Q[1235]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1236]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1237]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1238]={d="你可以在松土里看到一只紧紧握起来的兽人的手，手里抓着一根用骨头刻出来的管子，里面塞着一张粘着泥土的羊皮纸。\n\n羊皮纸上是一个在塞拉摩侦察了好几个星期的兽人写的报告。\n\n浏览过羊皮纸之后，你决定立刻把它送给蕨墙村的兽人情报官。",dEN="Sifting through the loose dirt, the severed hand of an orc is found. And clutched in the hand is a bone-carved tube. And in the tube is a dirt-stained parchment.\n\nThe parchment is a report made by an orc who spent weeks spying on the city of Theramore.\n\nAfter scanning the parchment, it is clear that it must be brought to the orc spymaster in Brackenwall Village.",o="把间谍的报告交给蕨墙村的纳泽尔·血矛。",oEN="Bring the Spy's Report to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You have something for me?",c="做得好，$n。我们的密探玛格·夜眼就在塞拉摩周边活动，他奉命监视塞拉摩城里的动静。\n\n这是他最近的一份报告，也可能是他最后一次报告——根据你所描述的情况，我担心玛格已经死在沼泽地了……",cEN="Good work, <name>. Our agent, Marg Nighteye, was stationed outside Theramore. He was charged to spy on the city.\n\nThis is his latest report, and it may be his last -- from your testimony, I fear that Marg met his end in the swamp..."}
Q[1239]={d="继续挖掘了一番之后，你找到了一颗男性兽人的头颅，脖子上有参差不齐的割痕。他的脸上还保持着发出怒吼的样子，黑色的眼睛不屈地怒视着前方。",dEN="Vigorous digging reveals the head of a male orc, raggedly severed at the neck. His lips are frozen in a snarl, and its dark eyes stare defiantly.",o="把兽人的头颅交给蕨墙村的纳泽尔·血矛。",oEN="Bring the Defiant Orc Head to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village.",p="你还有别的事要报告，$n？",pEN="You have another matter to report, <name>?",c="这是玛格·夜眼的头！和我担心的一样，他真的死了。\n\n看他脖子上的伤口！是某种武器留下这样不整齐的割痕，还是某种野兽杀了我们的密探？\n\n我们一定要解开这个谜，$n。我们必须查出玛格是不是死在联盟的手上！",cEN="This is the head of Marg Nighteye! As I feared, he is dead.\n\nLook at the wound on his neck! Could a weapon have made that ragged cut, or did some beast slay our agent?\n\nThis is a mystery we must solve, <name>. We must discover if Marg's death was at the hands of the Alliance!"}
Q[1240]={d="我们必须查明玛尔格之死的来龙去脉！而唯一的方法，$n，就是借助巨魔的巫术。\n\n把玛尔格的头颅带给金维雷，他就在荆棘谷的格罗姆高营地。\n\n金维雷是暗矛巨魔中最强大的巫医。若有人能与玛尔格·夜眼的灵魂交谈，那非他莫属。",dEN="We must know the events surrounding Marg's death! And the only way to do that, <name>, is through the witch-magic of trolls.\n\nBring Marg's head to Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale, at the Grom'gol Base Camp.\n\nKin'weelay is the most powerful witchdoctor of the Darkspear trolls. If anyone can speak to Marg Nighteye's spirit, it is he.",o="把兽人的头颅带到荆棘谷的格罗姆高营地里，交给肯维雷。",oEN="Take the Defiant Orc Head to Kin'weelay in the Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你身上跟着一个愤怒的灵魂，我的$g兄弟:姐妹。你来找肯维雷有什么事吗？",pEN="There is an angry spirit about you, <brother/sister>. What brings you to Kin'weelay?",c="啊，我看见了。这个兽人的灵魂还在我们的世界游荡，他因为一个未完成的任务而充满了怨念。\n\n好吧，让我们和这个愤怒的兽人说几句话吧……",cEN="Ah, I now see. The spirit of this orc is bound in our world, boiling with rage from a task yet undone.\n\nWell, let us have words with this angry orc..."}
Q[1241]={d="最近我们派出了一名外交使节前往塞拉摩与吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士会晤，但那位使节没能抵达目的地。\n\n我坚信是迪菲亚兄弟会密谋了这个事件，但我并不清楚具体的过程。使节失踪的消息对外严密封锁，但这件事情迟早要被曝光。\n\n国王的密探已经行动起来，在全城范围内寻找线索，但我打算私底下再找一些人来解决此事。\n\n我的一个老朋友乔贞现在就在英雄谷中。将这封便笺带给他，然后听他的命令行事。",dEN="Recently a diplomat was sent to Theramore to meet with Jaina Proudmoore. That diplomat never arrived.\n\nI believe the Defias are involved in this plot, but I'm not sure how. The diplomat's disappearance still eludes public attention, but it can't remain that way for long.\n\nAgents of the king are already scouring the city for clues, but I have my own contacts I would like involved.\n\nIn the Valley of Heroes is an old friend of mine named Jorgen. Find him, give him this note, and follow his instructions.",o="在暴风城的英雄谷找到乔贞。",oEN="Find Jorgen in Stormwind City.",p="嗯，你最好有个能打扰我钓鱼的好理由。否则，我就让你吃不完兜着走。",pEN="Hmph, you better have good reason to interrupt a man and his fishin'. I don't take kindly to peddlers, let alone beggars.",c="嗯……<乔贞斜着眼睛打量了你一番。>\n\n好吧。我会帮助你的，不过这可不是我自愿的，只是责任使然而已。\n\n有件事情我们得先说清楚：你知道太多你不应该知道的事情了。让这些事情当做我们之间的小秘密吧！别把你知道的事情在酒馆里大声嚷嚷，明白了吗？",cEN="Hmm... <Jorgen looks up at you through squinted eyes.>\n\nAll right. I'll help ya, but not because I want to, but because I'm obligated.\n\nAnd let's get one thing straight: you're knowin' far more than you should to begin with. Let's keep this our little secret, and don't go blabbin' at any taverns about anything you find out. Understand?"}
Q[1242]={d="把这张便笺带给埃林·提亚斯，除此以外不要和他说任何话。你只需要礼貌地等着他的回答就是了。不用担心，他一定会回答你的。\n\n我必须再跟你清清楚楚地说一遍，$n：把这件事看得认真点，在任何人面前都要管好你的嘴。\n\n你可以在他的奶酪店“提亚斯奶酪坊”里找到他，就在贸易区。祝你好运。",dEN="Take this here note to Elling Trias. Don't say nothin' else to him. Just be polite and wait for him to respond. And don't worry, he will.\n\nI'm gonna only impress this on ya once more, <name>: treat this matter seriously, and keep your yapper shut.\n\nYa can find Trias at his cheese shop, Trias' Cheese, in the Trade District. Good luck.",o="将乔贞的密信带给暴风城贸易区的埃林·提亚斯。",oEN="Delivery Jorgen's Sealed Note to Elling Trias in Stormwind City.",p="你好，$n。我能为你做些什么吗？想不想尝尝我们特制的提亚斯切达干酪？或者来块达纳苏斯乳酪？",pEN="Hello, <name>. Is there something I can do for you? Perhaps you'd like to try some of our special Trias cheddar? Or a block of Darnassian bleu?",c="什么，有我的信？好吧，我看看……成天到晚工作的人并不是经常能收到木箱或木桶之外的货物的，让我看看上面写了什么。\n\n<伊林一边打开信，一边打量着你。>\n\n你看起来有点紧张，你没事吧，$n？",cEN="I'm sorry, a letter for me? Well, I'll be... not often you get a delivery that's not a crate or barrel when all you do is work. Let's see what this is about.\n\n<Elling looks up at you while he opens the letter.>\n\nYou look a little tense, you okay, <name>?"}
Q[1243]={d="乔贞，你这老小子……那么，事情就是这样了，是吧？\n\n好吧，我会处理的。我倒是希望他早点死了呢！\n\n这么着，$n。我会开始派出我在这里的线人，不过你得帮我跑跑腿，好给我省点钱。\n\n到暮色森林的夜色镇去找守夜人巴库斯——他总是在镇子北边的路上巡逻。告诉他你正在为我调查迪菲亚兄弟会的活动，他会把他知道事情一股脑儿都告诉你的。",dEN="Jorgen, you ol' sonuva.... So, that's how it's going to be, huh?\n\nAll right, I can deal with that. I hope he finds the Twisting Nether that much sooner!\n\nHere's what's gonna happen, <name>. I'll start using my contacts here, but you're doing most of the footwork so I save some coin.\n\nHead to Darkshire in Duskwood and find Watcher Backus--he usually patrols the north road right outside of town. Just tell him you're looking into any Defias activity for me and he'll help you out with any information he can.",o="将密信带给暮色森林的守夜人巴库斯。",oEN="Give the Sealed Note to Watcher Backus in Duskwood.",p="在这片森林里旅行可不太安全，$n。小心为上，如果你看到任何可疑或者危险的东西，请立刻向守夜人报告。不要试图自己去解决问题，否则出了什么事情我们可无法负责。\n\n不过你我都知道你根本不会在意我的话，而且会不择手段与黑暗中的怪物搏斗，不是吗？哈哈，是呀，你们这些冒险者都是一样的。",pEN="Not too safe to be traveling about in the woods, <name>. Be careful, and if you see anything suspicious or dangerous, contact the Watchers immediately. Don't try and take anything on yourself. We're not responsible for anything terrible that might happen to you.\n\nBut we both know you're gonna ignore me and fight whatever comes out of the darkness anyway, don't we? Haha, yeah, you adventurer types... all the same.",c="哦，是提亚斯派你来的，对吗？那就有点不一样了。\n\n看来你根本不害怕潜伏在这一带的怪物。如果你跟他周遭那些人是同一类的话，我敢肯定你能轻松解决那些东西。\n\n那么，我的老朋友要我做些什么呢？",cEN="Oh, Trias sent you, huh? That's a little different.\n\nFeel free to fight whatever monstrosities come at you from the darkness. I'm sure you'll be able to handle it pretty easily if you're the type to be hanging around with the likes of him.\n\nSo, what does my friend need of me on such a gloomy day as this?"}
Q[1244]={d="迪菲亚兄弟会的活动？好吧，他们总是在活动。就算他们按兵不动，我们也仍然视之为威胁。\n\n但现在我认为，最近事情变得有点奇怪。大概是在两三周前吧，他们的许多密探都在腐草农场附近频繁出没。由此看来，那里一定是发生了什么重要的事情。\n\n你为什么不先去那里调查调查呢？记得把你调查到的结果拿给我看看。\n\n那座农场就在由西部荒野进入暮色森林的大路南边。",dEN="Defias activity? Well, there's always some activity; even if they keep to themselves we consider them a threat.\n\nBut now that I think about it, there was a recent sighting that seemed odd. It must have been a couple weeks ago, but some of their agents had gathered around Addle's Stead. From the report, I'd guessed something big went down.\n\nWhy don't you check there first and bring me back anything you find?\n\nThe farmstead is south of the road from Westfall just as you enter Duskwood.",o="找到迪菲亚记事本，把它带回给暮色森林的守夜人巴库斯。",oEN="Find the Defias Docket and return it to Watcher Backus in Duskwood.",p="小心点，$n。我知道提亚斯派来的人个个身手不凡，但这并不意味着这片森林里潜伏着的东西就不会给你造成任何麻烦……特别是在你调查迪菲亚兄弟会的时候。",pEN="Be careful out there, <name>. I know Trias was the one to send you here, but that doesn't mean there isn't anything lurking out in the woods that couldn't cause you some trouble... especially with you investigating the Defias.",c="你毫发无伤地回来啦！真是太棒了。\n\n现在，让我们来看看你找到了些什么吧。这份档案看起来相当正式，与我见过的任何迪亚菲兄弟会的档案都相去甚远，但这也极有可能只是个让你白费心思的把戏而已。",cEN="You're back safe and sound. Couldn't ask for much more than that, could you?\n\nNow, let's see what we have here. This looks pretty official as far as any Defias documents I've seen. But it could be a dupe just to throw you off track of whatever it is you're looking for."}
Q[1245]={d="哎呀，如果这只是个用来干扰你的视线的幌子，那他们也未免搞得太复杂了，我也不太清楚这东西到底是什么。把它交给提亚斯吧——他一定能弄明白其中的意义。千万小心，别让任何人把它抢走。我们都知道，这事可比我的命还重要，甚至比他的命还要重要。\n\n最后，拜托你一件事，$n，别对任何人说起我帮助过你。我的上司如果知道我对这件事有所了解而又没有向他们汇报的话，没准会绞死我的。",dEN="Whoa, this looks way too complex to be something to just lead you astray. I shouldn't even be looking at this stuff. Take it to Trias--he'll be able to make sense of it. And DON'T let anyone get in your way. This is bigger than me. It might even be bigger than him, but we'll see.\n\nAnd do me a favor, <name>, don't tell anyone I helped you. If my superiors found out I knew about any of this and didn't share it with them they'd probably hang me.",o="将迪菲亚记事本带给暴风城的埃林·提亚斯。",oEN="Bring the Defias Docket to Elling Trias in Stormwind.",p="啊，你回来了，而且看起来没有缺胳膊少腿。你我都知道我们不是来这里做乳酪买卖的，所以就别废话了吧。巴库斯帮上什么忙了吗？还是说，你根本就没去过暮色森林呢？",pEN="I see you're back, and in one piece. We both know you're not here for cheese, so let's cut out the pleasantries. Was Backus any help, or have you even left for Duskwood yet?",c="嗯……这份东西很有意思。乔根和德拉维叫我参与此事真是明智。\n\n看来迪菲亚兄弟会为了完成这个计划一直在拼命努力。等等，这是什么？\"拳头\"？这名字我听着耳熟。",cEN="Yeah... this is an interesting read. Jorgen and DeLavey were smart to bring me in on this.\n\nSeems the Defias have been trying pretty hard to complete this plan of theirs. Hmm... what's this? Fist? That's a familiar name."}
Q[1246]={d="对了，就是他，现在我想起来了…达舍尔…达舍尔…什么来着……他的名字是什么来着？拳！达舍尔·石拳。圈里人都叫他拳——或许是因为他喜欢制造事端的缘故吧。\n\n你通常可以在旧城区里见到他——在旧城区中心练拳。去和他谈一谈，如果有必要的话，你不妨威胁威胁他，用点暴力手段什么的，有时候只有那样才能让他说点真话出来。别犹豫！要是真像这份东西上所写的那样，他应该已经深陷其中，不会那么轻易就告诉你什么有用的信息。",dEN="Yeah, now that I think about it... Dashel... Dashel something... What was his name? FIST! Dashel Stonefist. They call him Fist in some circles--probably on account that he likes to get in brawls.\n\nYou can find him in Old Town usually--right smack dab in the center of it. Go talk to him. If you have to, use a sword or something heavy and blunt to persuade him to open up some. And don't hesitate. If he's in this as deep as these papers suggest, then he's not going to give you any information willingly.",o="与暴风城旧城区里的达舍尔·石拳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Dashel Stonefist in Stormwind.",c="什么？！\n\n你算老几，居然敢来过问我的私事？我的事情和你无关，闪开！",cEN="What?!\n\nYou come into me alley and ask questions about me personal business? Business which you obviously have nothing to do with."}
Q[1247]={d="原来如此……唔……我对腐草农场那边的会议略知一二，我记得是几周前组织的，但我没有去参加那个会议。我只参加了A计划的那部分，但A计划失败了……那些该死的冒险者。\n\n我们的线人说，那个执行B计划的小子来自米奈希尔，他的外号叫干柴。对于他们的后备计划我就知道这么多了。",dEN="So yeah... um... I might know something 'bout that meeting at Addle's Stead. Happened a few weeks back I think. I really didn't have any part in it. Me part was done when plan A failed... damn adventurers.\n\nThe guy we got on the inside for plan B came out of Menethil; guy called Slim. That's all I know regarding their backup plan.",o="与暴风城的埃林·提亚斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Elling Trias in Stormwind.",c="很高兴看见你还活着，$n。那么，达舍尔那边进行得还算顺利吧？\n\n我已经仔细读过他们的计划了，尽管没有在里面看到我们使节的名字，不过这计划书里曾写到，如果他们的第一次绑架计划失败的话，就会马上实行B计划。\n\n达舍尔提到的“干柴”似乎在这里面查不到别的资讯，但如果真如你所说，他来自米奈希尔的话，我们就有线索了。",cEN="Good to see you're still alive, <name>. So, it went well with Dashel then, huh?\n\nI've been reading up more on this plan of theirs, and although it doesn't state the name of the diplomat they were after, it does talk about this plan B they enacted after failing on their first attempt to capture him.\n\nThis Slim that Dashel mentioned doesn't have any other name written here, but if you say he's in Menethil, then that's a start."}
Q[1248]={d="我有一个隐居在米奈希尔港的线人。他已经退休了，不过如果你告诉他你是为我工作的话，他应该会很愿意帮助你的。他名叫米克哈尔，在几年前离开暴风城的时候，他提到过自己要去旅店工作。\n\n和他谈谈，想办法找到这个干柴，再打听一下有没有关于使节被绑架的消息。我们现在得弄清楚他被带到了什么地方去，或者至少弄清楚他是谁。这份摘要里没有提到绑架行动完成以后的事。",dEN="A contact of mine retired in the Wetlands at the harbor city of Menethil. He should be willing to help on your word alone if you tell him you're working for me. His name is Mikhail. He mentioned becoming a bartender before leaving Stormwind a few years ago.\n\nSpeak to him, find this Slim, and find out if there's anything else to know about this kidnapped diplomat. We need to find out where they've taken him, or at least who he is. The docket doesn't mention anything about their plans after he's captured.",o="与湿地的米克哈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",c="衷心欢迎你，$n。很高兴你能加入我们。今天想来杯麦酒吗？或者来点羊肉？\n\n想要什么尽管说，我会为你安排妥当。我叫米哈伊尔，只希望能好好为你效劳。\n\n嗯？你说什么？特里亚斯？小声点，朋友。这种事可不能整间酒馆都听见。",cEN="Welcome, welcome, welcome, <name>. Good of you to join us. Perhaps an ale today? Or some mutton?\n\nName your pleasure and I'll see to it that you're taken care of. My name is Mikhail, and I look forward to serving you.\n\nHmm? What's that? Trias? Keep your voice down, my friend. This isn't something for the whole tavern to hear about."}
Q[1249]={d="你说是埃林派你来的？好吧，现在我要拿出十倍的热情来招待你。想要什么尽管说，我会竭尽全力来帮助你的。\n\n嗯，你说的是干柴？似乎是没听说过的名字，但我一定会注意他的。\n\n别抬头，$n，壁炉旁边的那家伙正往我们这边看呢。这家伙似乎有点太专心地听我们的对话了，你明白我的意思吗？如果我是你，我就会趁他溜走之前好好教训教训他。",dEN="You say Elling sent you here? Well then, the hospitality I expressed is now tenfold. Anything you need, just ask. I will do my best to aid you.\n\nHmm, Slim, you say? Not sure the name sounds familiar, but I'll keep my eyes out for him.\n\nDon't look now, <name>, but the gentleman over by the exit is looking over here. He's listening to our conversation a little too intently if you catch my meaning? If I were you, I'd do what you can to subdue him before he makes a break for the door.",o="在塔伯克·贾恩逃跑前制服他，然后回米奈希尔港旅店去找米克哈尔。",oEN="Subdue Tapoke Jahn before he escapes, and then return to Mikhail in Menethil.",p="你没让他跑了吧？那小子注视我们时的样子有点诡异。",pEN="Did he slip away? He looked a little shady the way he was watching us.",c="抓住他了吗？做得好！我很意外他竟然就是“干柴”。\n\n说老实话，我从没有想到过我会这么喜欢这种秘密活动带来给我的刺激，我看我的老毛病是改不掉的了。不过千万别跟伊林说这个——他要是听到我怀念这样的工作，八成会想办法把我弄回暴风城去工作。\n\n我很高兴能在米奈希尔给你帮些小忙。如果你还需要别的东西，请尽管开口。",cEN="Caught him, huh? Good for you. I'm surprised that was Slim.\n\nI'll be honest, I never thought I'd miss the excitement of some of the more devious underground activities. I guess old habits die hard. Don't mention that to Elling--he'd probably try and get me to come back to Stormwind if he heard I missed the action.\n\nI'm glad I could at least be of a little service to you while you were in Menethil. If you need anything else, just ask."}
Q[1250]={d="好吧，迪菲亚兄弟会出价虽高，可还不值得把我的命也给赔上。他们抓走的是国王。对，没错，正是暴风城的国王，他可不是什么简单的外交使节。他当时正在去塞拉摩与吉安娜·普罗德摩尔会面的路上——这显然是件大事，当然也是个大秘密。但这可不是迪菲亚兄弟会的主意，实际上他们也是为别人效力的。我想只有他们自己知道谁是他们的雇主。\n\n我的份内事就是趁国王的船还在港里的时候，和他们在船上的内应碰头，那家伙叫亨德尔。我就知道这么多了，我发誓！",dEN="The Defias didn't pay me well enough to die for their cause. They took the king. Yeah, the king of Stormwind, not some lowly diplomat. He was on his way to Theramore to meet with Jaina Proudmore--it was a big deal apparently, and a big secret. But it's not just the Defias that are involved. They're working with someone. I think they knew this was bigger than them.\n\nMy part was just to get their man on board the king's ship while it was in the harbor. The guy's name was Hendel. That's all I know. I swear!",o="与湿地的米克哈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",c="国王陛下？！我是说……国王陛下？真正的国王陛下？你不会是在开玩笑吧？你可没说你在找的是绑架国王的绑匪啊，我甚至没听说他失踪了啊——这多少也能解释他儿子继位的理由。\n\n我马上和伊林联络，他一定会想知道你的进展的。\n\n我可从没想过贾恩会为了一点肮脏的钱就把暴风城给出卖了。须知盗亦有道啊！\n\n现在最重要的是要找到亨德尔。我想我应该能帮上忙。",cEN="THE KING?! I mean... the king? The real king? Are you joking? You didn't mention you were looking for the king's kidnappers. I didn't even hear he was missing--that would explain his son being crowned some.\n\nI'll send word to Elling right away. He'll want to know you're on the trail.\n\nI would never have guessed Jahn would sell out Stormwind for some lousy coin. Even a rogue's got to have honor when it comes to some things.\n\nThe key now is to find this Hendel. And I think I can help with that."}
Q[1251]={d="有一面被烧毁旅店的大火熏黑了的铁盾牌和倒塌的烟囱连在一起，这根烟囱是树荫旅店烧毁之后留下的几段残砖断瓦中的一部分。\n\n这面铁盾牌可以从烟囱的砖上拿下来。",dEN="An iron shield, blackened by the fire that raged through the inn, is affixed to the crumbling chimney, one of the few remaining parts of the structure that once made up the Shady Rest Inn.\n\nThe shield can be removed from the brick of the chimney.",o="把被熏黑的铁盾牌带给蕨墙村的克罗格。",oEN="Bring the Blackened Iron Shield to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",p="你手里拿着什么，$n？是从树荫旅店的废墟里找到的东西吗？",pEN="What's that you have there, <name>? Evidence from the remains of the Shady Rest Inn?",c="虽然人类的装饰品味很奇怪，不过我觉得他们不会把一面铁盾挂在壁炉上方做装饰。可能是放火烧旅馆的人放在那儿的。\n\n这是个警告？或者是个威胁？",cEN="I grant that humans have strange decorating tastes, but would they use a plain iron shield to adorn their fireplace? Perhaps this shield was placed there by the ones who burned the inn.\n\nA warning? A threat?"}
Q[1252]={d="瓦砾之下，你看到地面上闪过一道微光。你拨开碎石与灰烬，露出一枚白珐琅质地上嵌着金色船锚的徽记：那是塞拉摩的标志。\n\n船锚下方刻着一个名字：\"帕瓦尔·里瑟中尉\"。",dEN="A glint of light on the ground catches your eye from underneath the rubble. Brushing away debris and ash caked onto the object reveals the insignia of a gold anchor on white enameled on the surface: the sign of Theramore.\n\nUnderneath the anchor is embossed the name \"Lieutenant Paval Reethe\".",o="把雷瑟的徽章拿给塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长。",oEN="Bring Reethe's Badge to Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore.",p="你在树荫旅店找到什么有用的东西了吗？",pEN="Have you found anything of interest at the Shady Rest Inn?",c="找到这个守卫的徽章对我来说可不是什么好消息。\n\n有时候这就意味这有人死在战场上，而我还得把悲伤的消息带给他们的家人，有时我们永远不知道他们发生了什么，还有些时候，事情可能比你想象中的更糟糕。",cEN="It's never good news when a guard's badge is brought to me.\n\nSometimes it's a man or woman who's fallen in battle, and I'm left to bring the news to the grieving family. Other times we never find out what happened to them. And other times it's even worse than that."}
Q[1253]={d="有一面被烧毁旅店的大火熏黑了的铁盾牌和倒塌的烟囱连在一起，这根烟囱是树荫旅店烧毁之后留下的几段残砖断瓦中的一部分。\n\n这面铁盾牌可以从烟囱的砖上拿下来。",dEN="An iron shield, blackened by the fire that raged through the inn, is affixed to the crumbling chimney, one of the few remaining parts of the structure that once made up the Shady Rest Inn.\n\nThe shield can be removed from the brick of the chimney.",o="把被熏黑的铁盾牌交给塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长。",oEN="Bring the Blackened Iron Shield to Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore.",p="你在树荫旅店的废墟里找到什么证据了吗？",pEN="Have you found evidence from the site of the Shady Rest Inn?",c="嗯，我可不是制造武器和护甲的专家。我知道它们的用途，可是不懂如何制造。\n\n这个盾牌和一般盾牌没什么区别，只是旅馆的大火在上面留下了些痕迹。",cEN="Hm, I'm no expert with the construction of arms and armor. Their use, yes, but not their making.\n\nThis shield seems as ordinary as any, excepting the damage from the fire that engulfed the inn."}
Q[1254]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1255]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1256]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1257]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1258]={d="我的新菜谱还需要一样材料，就是带壳的巨型蟹腿。为此，尘泥沼泽里的那些螃蟹——他们管它们叫刺壳岩行者——再合适不过了！\n\n蟹腿的外壳是这道菜摆盘的关键，所以我需要完好无瑕、没有伤痕的蟹腿。一只成年螃蟹只有一两条这样的腿，而我要做很多次试验，需要大量的蟹腿。\n\n去塞拉摩周边的礁石区，给我弄来那些蟹腿！",dEN="Another component of my new recipe is the shelled leg of a giant crab. And the crabs they have in Dustwallow -- Muckshells they call them -- just won't do! I'm afraid the only suitable crabs live far away, in the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nThe shell of the crab leg is a key element of the dish's presentation so I need pristine, unscarred legs. An adult crab might only have one or two such legs, and I need a lot in order to research my dish.\n\nSo, <name>... are you willing to travel?",o="给塞拉摩的摩根·斯特恩收集12根新鲜的螃蟹腿。",oEN="Bring 12 Pristine Crawler Legs to Morgan Stern in Theramore.",p="我对泥石龟舌的研究进展很不错，我相信你找螃蟹腿也还顺利吧？",pEN="My research with the Mudrock tongues is progressing nicely. I trust your crab hunt goes well?",c="这些螃蟹腿真是好材料，$n！蟹壳完整无损，肉也非常鲜嫩。我敢说，你一定是个天生的厨子！",cEN="These are wonderful specimens, <name>! The shells are in perfect condition, and the meat is pink and tender. The blood of a chef is in your veins, I'm sure of it!"}
Q[1259]={d="我不认识这个帕瓦尔·雷瑟上尉，你最好还是去问问泰索兰副官。他负责管理塞拉摩所有守卫的档案，包括守卫的个人资料和他们的装备。\n\n他可以查查这些档案，然后告诉你这个雷瑟到底是谁。",dEN="I don't recognize the name of Lieutenant Paval Reethe. Your best bet would be to check with Adjutant Tesoran. He keeps track of all the records for the Theramore guard, from personnel to their equipment.\n\nHe should be able to tell you who this Reethe is with a quick check of his books.",o="从塞拉摩的泰索兰副官那儿找出更多关于雷瑟的消息。",oEN="Find out more about Reethe from Adjutant Tesoran in Theramore.",c="你好，$n。你要查一个塞拉摩守卫的资料？是叫雷瑟的吗？\n\n等一下，让我来找找。",cEN="Hello, <name>. You'd like information about a specific member of the Theramore guard? Reethe, was it?\n\nJust give me a moment to find the right book."}
Q[1260]={d="我正在为餐厅设计一份新菜单。里面全是同一主题的乡村菜肴：沼泽。我相信蓝隐士酒馆的客人们一定会喜欢的！\n\n我派我的侄子摩根去了塞拉摩，那是尘泥沼泽边缘的一座城市。他正在那里向当地人收集菜谱，我必须知道他目前收集到了什么。\n\n去塞拉摩的路途遥远，对我来说太远了。但像你这样的$g年轻人:年轻人; $c，肯定会抓住任何旅行的机会。",dEN="I'm developing a new menu for the restaurant. It will be filled with rural dishes with a \"bayou\" theme. I think my clientele at the Blue Recluse will love them!\n\nI sent my nephew Morgan to Theramore, a city on the edge of the Dustwallow Marsh. He's there gathering recipes from the locals, and I must know what he found so far.\n\nThe trip to Theramore is long. Too long for me. But I bet a young <class> like yourself would jump at the chance to travel, yes?",o="和塞拉摩的摩根·斯特恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Morgan Stern in Theramore.",c="哦，是我叔叔让你来的吗？\n\n我一直在寻找食谱，而且有了点眉目，不过我需要一些帮助。\n\n不过这个忙可能会让他的脚都湿透……",cEN="Oh, my uncle sent you, did he?\n\nWell I've been researching recipes and I have some leads, but I need help.\n\nHelp from someone willing to get his feet wet."}
Q[1261]={d="可恶的龙虾人！我是不会束手待毙的！啊…但是…我已经死了，看来它的确是把我杀掉了……\n\n但是我的使命，我的使命啊！$n，你必须替我完成它。\n\n我曾在塞拉摩附近监视一队在海滩上露营的联盟士兵，其中一个士兵身上配戴着一件饰品，是那种镶嵌着很多宝石，再有钱的士兵也买不起的饰品！\n\n那天晚上，我溜进他们的营地，偷走了那件饰品，但是在我返回基地的途中，一个污壳龙虾人杀死了我！\n\n$n，你必须找到那只该死的龙虾人，并夺回那件饰品。",dEN="Cursed muckshell! You can't kill Marg! Ah, but I am dead. So it must have slain me...\n\nBut my mission! My mission! You, <name>, must complete it.\n\nWhile near Theramore, I spied a group of Alliance soldiers camped on the beach. And one soldier wore a pendant... a pendant laden with more gems than any soldier could afford!\n\nThat night I snuck into their camp and stole the pendant, but on my return to base a muckshell crab-man killed me!\n\n<name>, you must find that muckshell and recover the pendant!",o="把宝石坠饰带给蕨墙村的纳泽尔·血矛。",oEN="Bring the Jeweled Pendant to Nazeer in Brackenwall Village.",p="$n，你发现玛格的下落了吗？",pEN="<name>, did you discover Marg's fate?",c="这个坠子是一名暴风城的士兵所配戴的？\n\n谢谢你，$n。你找出了玛格的死因。但是这个坠子是一个新的谜团，一个可能会对联盟和部落都产生可怕影响的谜团。",cEN="This pendant was worn by a soldier of Stormwind??\n\nThank you, <name>. You have revealed the secret of Marg's death. But this pendant is a new mystery to solve, one that may have dire effects on the Alliance, and the Horde."}
Q[1262]={d="很奇怪的是，玛尔格偷取的这件饰品居然是一个普通士兵的东西。它的主人也许掩饰了自己真正的身份，或者那个士兵本身就是个窃贼！\n\n不管事实是怎样的，总之这是一件贵族的饰品。如果我们想要揭开这个谜团，就必须找出它真正的主人。\n\n带着饰品去奥格瑞玛找佐尔·孤树吧。他对联盟那边的事情颇有了解，应该会知道这件饰品是否和暴风城的贵族们有关系。",dEN="It is strange that the pendant Marg stole was in the hands of common soldiers. Perhaps its owner was in disguise, or perhaps the soldiers themselves stole it!\n\nRegardless of which is true, this is a noble's pendant and we must discover its true owner if we are to unravel its mystery.\n\nTake the pendant to Zor Lonetree in Orgrimmar. He is well schooled in Alliance politics, and will know if this pendant has a history among the nobles of Stormwind.",o="把镶宝石饰品带给奥格瑞玛的佐尔·孤树。",oEN="Bring the Jeweled Pendant to Zor Lonetree in Orgrimmar.",p="你是从尘泥沼泽的蕨墙村过来的？纳泽尔过得如何？他在那里的生意又如何？",pEN="You traveled from Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow? How fares Nazeer, and how fare his efforts in the marsh?",c="这件饰品的工艺非常精湛，$n。兽人不会对这种东西感兴趣……\n\n但是许多人类都会的。\n\n让我们看看这件饰品，看看它是否隐藏着什么秘密……一些能够让它主人的身世之谜水落石出的东西。",cEN="This pendant was crafted with great skill and precision, <name>. No orc would covet such a jewel...\n\nBut many humans would.\n\nI will have this pendant studied. In time let us hope that its mysteries will be revealed to us."}
Q[1264]={d="每个月初，库尔提拉斯的水兵们都会领取薪水，然后离开塞拉摩到别的地方去游玩。大部分人会到这里来找女人，喝酒，寻欢作乐一番。他们当中有一些人整天都会泡在酒馆里，我敢肯定亨德尔也是其中之一。\n\n只要那家伙现在还留在塞拉摩的话，那么当地的指挥官萨穆尔就能帮你找到他。虽然他只对普罗德摩尔家族效忠，但如果你说出埃林的名字，他也会帮助你的……应该会的。",dEN="The beginning of every month the Kul Tiras Marines all get paid and usually leave Theramore for somewhere else. A lot of them come here to womanize, carouse, and just have a good time. One of those groups I'd consider regulars here at the tavern, and I believe this Hendel is among them.\n\nCommander Samaul in Theramore would be able to help you find him if Hendel's still stationed there. He's completely loyal to Proudmoore, but if you drop Elling's name, he should help you out... discreetly.",o="找到尘泥沼泽的指挥官萨穆尔。",oEN="Find Commander Samaul in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="很高兴见到你，$n。我是指挥官萨穆尔，普罗德摩尔女士麾下的塞拉摩驻军的最高负责人。\n\n尽管我很忙，不过如果你有什么问题的话，请尽管说出来。虽然我不能在这上面花费太多时间，但只要你需要帮助，我是绝对不会坐视不理的。\n\n如果你计划出城旅行的话，我建议你务必小心。除了巨魔、兽人和鱼人外，沼泽地的南部到处都是黑龙。",cEN="A pleasure to meet you, <name>. I am Commander Samaul. I'm in charge of Miss Proudmoore's forces here in Theramore.\n\nAlthough I'm quite busy, if you have any questions, please feel free to speak up. I might have to keep it short, but there's no reason for me to be rude if you need my help.\n\nIf you plan on traveling out of the city, I'd suggest you be careful. Besides ogres, orcs and murlocs, the southern part of the swamp is filled with black dragons."}
Q[1265]={d="亨德尔？是的，我知道这个人。不过你找我的士兵有什么事呢？\n\n埃林派你来找他？嗯，好吧，我感觉有些不妙了。你肯定遇到了麻烦，因此埃林才让你来先找我的。我理解你可能不愿告诉我详情，但请明白这一点：我有责任保护好这片土地。如果你是来制造麻烦的话，最好能先得到我的允许。\n\n据我所知，亨德尔就驻守在塞拉摩外的第一座哨塔上。请自己多加小心！",dEN="Hendel? Yes, I know the man. But why would you need one of my soldiers?\n\nElling sent you to find him? Hmm, I don't like the sound of that. Elling wouldn't have you come to me first if your business wasn't troubling. I understand if you can't tell me what this is about, but know this: I have a duty to protect these lands. If you're going to cause a disturbance, then I suggest you inform me of whatever you can.\n\nI believe Hendel was stationed at the first tower outside of Theramore. Be cautious.",o="在警戒哨岗中打探亨德尔下士的消息。",oEN="Search Sentry Point for any sign of Private Hendel.",p="嗯，$n？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你正在找的那个叫亨德尔的人已经不在这儿了，你所掌握的消息，也已经从别的渠道传到了普罗德摩尔女士那里。她派我来找你，并帮助你完成任务。如果你不反对的话，我来告诉你在哪里可以找到士兵亨德尔，这样我们就可以把他抓住并送上法庭。",cEN="The man you seek, the one known as Hendel, is not here. Other sources have brought to the Lady Proudmoore information I believe you already know. She has asked me to find you, and give you aid in your venture. If you would allow it, I will tell you where to find Private Hendel so we can bring him to justice."}
Q[1266]={d="亨德尔下士就在这里的西边，他现在正在执行保护那些轮休的塞拉摩密探们的任务。密探们正在那边监视着部落的前哨基地——蕨墙村，当然也时刻留心着其它任何有可能威胁到我们的东西。\n\n你应该很容易就能找到他，沿着道路搜索每一个帐篷就行。\n\n我现在还有另一件事要处理，但很快就可以追上你。",dEN="Private Hendel is to the west of here. He's currently on guard duty protecting some of Theramore's infiltrators while they rest. They've been keeping tabs on the Horde base, Brackenwall, and looking for anything else that might threaten our borders.\n\nYou should have no problem finding him; just look for the tents along the road.\n\nI have another matter to attend to, but I shall catch up to you soon enough. You can always find me in the Lady Proudmoore's tower if you have any problems.",o="找到尘泥沼泽中的亨德尔下士。",oEN="Find Private Hendel in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="你好，$g公民:公民;。这地方对访客来说很危险。要是你珍惜性命，就别在这儿久留。\n\n如果你的问题够简短，我会尽量帮你。睁大眼睛，小心那些肮脏的食人魔。据说沼泽附近有一处部落的据点。潜入者已经竭尽全力去找，但进展缓慢，我们没能取得多少成果。",cEN="Hello, citizen. This is a dangerous place to be wandering about. I wouldn't hang around too long if you value your life.\n\nIf you keep your questions short, I'll see if I can help you. Just keep your eyes open for any of those filthy ogres. Rumor has it there's a Horde base somewhere in the swamps. The infiltrators are doing what they can to find it, but the process has been slow going and we've had little progress."}
Q[1267]={o="与尘泥沼泽的吉安娜·普罗德摩尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Jaina Proudmore in Dustwallow Swamp.",c="首先我要对你所做的一切表示感谢，$n。我的人民与暴风城的人民都应该对你表示感谢。可惜，鉴于当前的情况，我不能将你的事迹公诸于众。\n\n你也得理解，我同样无法公开对你表示答谢，但我向你保证，你所做的事情一定会得到嘉奖。\n\n总有一天，当你再次来到塞拉摩的时候，我一定会让你获得你所有理应得到的荣誉。\n\n再一次感谢你，$n。",cEN="Let me be first to thank you for all you've done, <name>. You have been an incredible blessing to my people and the people of Stormwind. I am sorry I couldn't make your acquaintance under better circumstances.\n\nUnderstand also that I cannot overtly thank you for your efforts, but I assure you again, it is appreciated.\n\nWhen you visit Theramore in the future, seek me out and I shall try to keep you appraised of the situation.\n\nThank you again, <name>."}
Q[1268]={d="有几排蹄印从树荫旅店那仍然冒着烟的废墟中延伸出来。大部分蹄印都埋在沼泽地的松软泥土里没法辨认，不过至少还有一些是可以看清的。",dEN="Rows of hoofprints lead away from the still-smoking skeleton of the Shady Rest Inn. There are at least a few visible impressions, with more rows of prints almost imperceptible in the soft mud of the marsh.",o="把树荫旅店的可疑蹄印报告给蕨墙村的克罗格。",oEN="Report about the suspicious prints at the Shady Rest Inn to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",c="蹄印……我想，有可能是野猪人，或者是半人马。贫瘠之地有不少半人马，要说是他们做了这件事情，我一点也不觉得奇怪。\n\n我跟你说过吗？不仅仅是旅店被烧了……连店主的老婆和孩子都被杀了，这真是太残忍了。\n\n不管怎样，我会派卡古隆去查看那些足迹通向哪里。",cEN="Hoofprints... It could have been the quilboar, I suppose. Or maybe even the centaur. Their presence in the Barrens is not insignificant, and I would not think it a stretch to commit such an act.\n\nDid I tell you? It wasn't just that the inn was burned down... The owner's woman and pup were killed. Bad business, that.\n\nNonetheless, I will send Kagoro to find where the tracks lead."}
Q[1269]={d="瓦砾之下，你看到地面上闪过一道微光。你拨开碎石与灰烬，露出一枚白珐琅质地上嵌着金色船锚的徽记：那是塞拉摩的标志。\n\n船锚下方刻着一个名字：\"帕瓦尔·里瑟中尉\"。",dEN="A glint of light on the ground catches your eye from underneath the rubble. Brushing debris and ash caked onto the object reveals the insignia of a gold anchor on white, enameled on the surface: the sign of Theramore.\n\nUnderneath the anchor is embossed the name \"Lieutenant Paval Reethe\".",o="把雷瑟的徽章带给蕨墙村的克罗格。",oEN="Bring Reethe's Badge to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",p="你找到关于树荫旅店的线索了吗？",pEN="Have you found any leads on what happened at the Shady Rest Inn?",c="我认识这个叫帕瓦尔·雷瑟的人。他是个可怜的家伙……他抛弃了同伴，一个人躲在树林里。\n\n我派了奥格隆去追踪他，还有人怀疑雷瑟偷了我们的物资装备。我想奥格隆是向东南方向去了。",cEN="I know this human, Paval Reethe. Pathetic, even for his kind. He deserted his fellow soldiers and is now hiding out in the woods.\n\nI sent Ogron out to track him down. Some of the others suspect he's been stealing from our supplies. I think I saw Ogron heading off to the southeast."}
Q[1270]={d="太好了，总算碰到一个不是要来吃了我的人了！\n\n我正愁没人来帮我对付这儿的怪物哪，$g兄弟:小姐，你看来就挺合适。\n\n棘齿城一个叫麦伯克·米希瑞克斯的地精需要弄些睡菜叶……或是别的什么东西来做药剂，说实话我不在乎他做什么，反正他给的报酬不错，而我又正巧熟悉这个沼泽，所以我就来了。\n\n倒霉的是还没找到睡菜，我就被包围了！你能帮我从这儿逃出去吗？哦，对了，顺便在我找睡菜的时候替我断后。",dEN="Great, finally something that doesn't want to eat me!!\n\nI need help handling the critters around here, and you fit the mold, <buddy/lady>.\n\nA goblin from Ratchet named Mebok Mizzyrix needs some bogbean leaves for a potion, or something... I honestly don't care why -- his money was good and I know this swamp, so here I am.\n\nToo bad I got myself surrounded before I found the bogbean! Can you help me out of here, and watch my back as I look for Mebok's plant?",o="护送\"臭臭\"伊格纳兹，然后去棘齿城与梅博克·米兹里克斯交谈。",oEN="Escort \"Stinky\" Ignatz, then speak with Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",c="臭臭带着我要的草药来过，还说你帮他摆脱了困境。干得好！$gUn amigo:Una amiga; de Apestoso es $gamigo mío:amiga mía;！\n\n在他往南回沼泽之前，他托我如果见到你就把这个交给你。",cEN="Stinky was here with the herbs I ask of him, and he told me you helped him out of a bind. Good work! A friend of Stinky's is a friend of mine!\n\nHe asked me to give you this if I ever saw you, right before he walked back south toward the marsh."}
Q[1271]={c="我的侄子告诉我，你帮助他在尘泥沼泽进行研究工作，还帮助他的同事化险为夷。嗯，我们斯特恩系列向来团结一心，而且我们绝对不会漠视我们的朋友！\n\n去准备一下吧，$n，我们要为你举行一个宴会，以表达我们对你的敬意！",cEN="My nephew said you aided him with his research in Dustwallow, and that you helped his associate out of a tight spot. Well, we Sterns stick together and we don't ignore our friends!\n\nSo wash your hands, <name>, because we're about to throw a party in your honor!"}
Q[1273]={d="我花了很长时间终于找到雷瑟了。他躲藏得很好。\n\n奥格隆担心他在沼泽地里待了这么久可能已经疯了，你跟我来，咱们一起去从他那里套出一些我们需要的答案。",dEN="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human.\n\nOgron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him.",o="和奥格隆一起去和雷瑟谈一谈，然后回到蕨墙村见克罗格。",oEN="Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village.",p="你找到雷瑟了吗？",pEN="Did you find Reethe?",c="嗯！雷瑟不用再鬼鬼祟祟躲在沼泽地里了，这真是太好了。不过人类都这么虚弱，连这点小小的箭伤都恢复不了，真够丢脸的。\n\n这条线索似乎是没有进展了，我们得再找其他线索。",cEN="Hmph. It is good that Reethe will no longer be lurking around the swamp, but it is a shame that humans are built so frail that he could not recover from a little arrow wound.\n\nIt seems that this thread of the mystery has led nowhere, and we must look elsewhere."}
Q[1274]={d="很抱歉，$g先生:夫人。德拉维主教要我征召一些冒险者以帮助他解决一件棘手的事情。\n\n如果你能尽快而且悄悄地去一趟暴风要塞与他谈一谈的话，我想他将会非常感谢你的帮助。我得再申明一次，口风请紧一些，这件事情很重要。",dEN="Excuse me, <sir /madam>. Bishop DeLavey asked me to approach adventurers that might be able to help him with a delicate matter.\n\nIf you could quietly head to Stormwind Keep and speak to him at your earliest convenience, I'm sure he would appreciate your help. Again, please be discreet. It is a matter of some importance.",o="找到暴风要塞的德拉维主教。",oEN="Find Bishop DeLavey in Stormwind Keep.",c="你好，$n。我是维主教。\n\n如果你想说的是我正准备处理的那件事务的话，那么很明显年轻的汤玛斯已经成功地说服你来帮助我们暴风王国了。他总是对我的指示领会得很透彻。\n\n恐怕我没有时间把事情说得很详细了，所以请允许我简单扼要地跟你说明一下情况，并且，请把它牢记在心。",cEN="Hello, <name>. I am Bishop DeLavey.\n\nNo doubt if you're asking me about my business here in the keep then young Thomas has succeeded in requisitioning you to help our kingdom. He has always been adept at following my requests.\n\nI'm afraid I don't have time to elaborate much, so allow me to be blunt... and please, try to keep this from becoming common knowledge."}
Q[1275]={d="那些愚蠢的血精灵竟然在研究恶魔魔法。难道他们没见过卡利姆多的纳迦和萨特遭遇了什么吗？\n\n我担心血精灵最终也会遭受类似的扭曲。艾泽拉斯承受不起再诞生一个邪恶的怪物种族。\n\n我想研究萨特和纳迦的脑干。也许我能查明辛多雷等待着怎样的命运。你可以在西边的黑涩深渊找到萨特和纳迦。",dEN="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor?\n\nI fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation. Azeroth cannot afford to give birth to another vile race of monsters.\n\nI wish to study the brain stems of the satyr and naga so that I might deduce what fate the elves are headed toward. In Blackfathom Deeps, on the coast of Ashenvale, you will find both satyr and naga.\n\n'Tis a long journey, <name>.",o="奥伯丁的戈沙拉·夜语需要8块堕落者的脑干。",oEN="Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",p="只要我有了足够的样本，就可以开始真正的研究了。有了这些从黑暗深渊里找到的萨特和纳迦的脑干，我就能找出这两种被魔法扭曲了心智的生物之间的联系。\n\n或许……如果我们对这些东西能有足够的了解，我们就能阻止血精灵步他们的后尘，走向堕落的深渊。",pEN="Once I have enough samples to study, my true work can begin. With the corrupted brain stems of both the satyr and naga of Blackfathom Deeps I can try to draw a correlation between the mutations.\n\nPerhaps with that gained knowledge we can prevent the blood elves from delving deeper into deformity and evil.",c="你远道而来，无疑面对过巨大的危险。\n\n你的所作所为毫无私心；$n，你为了整个艾泽拉斯的福祉帮助我的研究。我感谢你所做的一切。\n\n现在，请恕我失陪，我还有很多事要做……",cEN="You have traveled far and undoubtedly faced great peril.\n\nYour actions have been selfless. 'Tis for the good of all Azeroth that you help me with my research. I thank you, <name>, for all that you have done.\n\nNow if you'll excuse me I have much work to do...."}
Q[1276]={d="啊，我想起来了！莫萨恩是个，嗯，他是雷霆崖的一个受人尊敬的铁匠。我就知道以前肯定在哪儿听过他的名字。\n\n大地之环为了感谢我，送了我一套莫萨恩打造的护甲，他的手艺很不错。\n\n关于莫萨恩打造的盾牌，他自己也许可以告诉你更多。\n\n这不是什么重要线索，不过既然帕瓦尔·雷瑟还什么都没有说，这就是我们所了解的全部了。",dEN="Ah, I remember now! Mosarn is a well-respected blacksmith in Thunder Bluff. I knew I had heard his name somewhere, before.\n\nIn thanks, the Earthen Ring awarded me with a set of armor crafted by Mosarn. Very good work.\n\nPerhaps he can tell you more about the shield he crafted.\n\nIt's not much of a lead, but since we didn't get anything useful out of Reethe, it's all we have.",o="把被熏黑的铁盾牌拿给雷霆崖的莫萨恩看一看。",oEN="Show the Blackened Iron Shield to Mosarn in Thunder Bluff.",p="你好啊，$c。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="Hello there, <class>. Something I can help you with?",c="是的，你的确是对的，这的确是我做的盾牌。\n\n不过我恐怕也没有太多有用的消息可以告诉你，$n。我打造了很多不同的盾牌和护甲，不可能知道每一个东西的去处。",cEN="Yes, you are certainly correct. This is a shield that I made.\n\nI'm afraid there's not much more I can tell you though, <name>. I craft so many different shields and sets of armor, I can't keep track of them all."}
Q[1282]={d="我对吉姆的事很遗憾……他以前不是那样的。他曾在沼泽地开了个旅店，那是个很不错的地方。\n\n我真不想谈这个。你想谈的话就去找维米斯队长吧。",dEN="I can't help it if I feel sorry for ol' Jim there. He wasn't always like that. Ran an inn out in the marsh for a while, wonderful place.\n\nLook, I don't really want to talk about it. Bring it up with Captain Vimes if you really have to. He's stationed on the top floor of Foothold Citadel, the large barracks to the east of Lady Jaina's tower.",o="与塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Garran Vimes on the top floor of Foothold Citadel.",c="詹姆斯·海厄尔是他的真名，他在贫瘠之地开了个旅店，想给路过的旅客提供个歇脚的地方……\n\n也许他的期望太高了，不过旅店有一阵的生意还是很不错的。但是后来，沼泽地一带的道路被那些巨魔控制了，我们也无力夺回来。\n\n詹姆斯太顽固，尽管那里非常危险，但他还是不愿放弃他的梦想，结果树荫旅店就被烧成了一片废墟。我们正在调查那起事件，但是还没有什么结果。如果你想帮忙的话，就看看在那堆废墟里能找到些什么吧。",cEN="James Hyal's his real name. He opened an inn at the edge of the Barrens. Wanted to make a nice place for travelers to stop over...\n\nMight be he was thinking too big, but the inn did do well for a while. Then we lost control of the roads in the marsh, and the ogres took over.\n\nJames was too stubborn to give up his dream for safety within our walls, and the Shady Rest Inn was burnt to the ground. We're investigating, but haven't had much luck. If you want to help out, see what you can find in the rubble."}
Q[1284]={d="有几排蹄印从树荫旅店那仍然冒着烟的废墟中延伸出来。大部分蹄印都埋在沼泽地的松软泥土里没法辨认，不过至少还有一些是可以看清的。",dEN="Rows of hoofprints lead away from the still-smoking skeleton of the Shady Rest Inn. There are at least a few visible impressions, with more rows of prints almost imperceptible in the soft mud of the marsh.",o="把树荫旅店的可疑蹄印报告给塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长。",oEN="Report about the suspicious prints at the Shady Rest Inn to Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore.",c="蹄印，是吗？尘泥沼泽附近的确有为数非比寻常的半人马在活动。我们在去贫瘠之地的路上看到过它们的营地和据点。\n\n我会派出我们的侦察兵法格兰·哈斯迪尔，看看他能不能找到这些蹄印通往哪儿。",cEN="Hoofprints, eh? It is true that there is an extraordinary amount of centaur activity in the lands near the Dustwallow Marsh. In brief excursions into the Barrens, we found their camps and holdings dotting the area.\n\nI'll send out Falgran Hastil, one of our trackers, to see if he can find where the tracks lead."}
Q[1285]={d="雷东……雷德帕斯……啊，找到了！帕瓦尔·雷瑟上尉。\n\n他和大部分跟随普罗德摩尔女士横渡大海的征募兵一起加入了塞拉摩守卫军。16岁时加入库尔提拉斯海军，战绩出色，屡获提升……\n\n已列入失踪名单。",dEN="Reddon... Redpath... Ah, here it is! Lieutenant Paval Reethe.\n\nJoined the Theramore guard along with most of the recruits that came across the sea with Lady Proudmoore. Enlisted with the marines of Kul Tiras at the age of sixteen. Distinguished service, promotions...\n\nListed as missing.",o="把雷瑟的资料报告给塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长。",oEN="Return the information about Reethe to Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore.",c="失踪？那是泰索兰对叛徒的仁慈说法。\n\n他就是那种对戴林上将愚忠的傻瓜，最后变成了一个叛徒。这不是很讽刺吗？背叛者反而说我们背叛了联盟。",cEN="Missing? That would be Tesoran's kind way of saying traitor.\n\nNo doubt he's one of those fools so blindly loyal to Admiral Daelin that he turned traitor. Isn't that a delicious irony? The deserters accuse us of betraying the Alliance."}
Q[1286]={d="在沼泽地里立足确实是非常艰难的，但是通过不懈的努力，最后我们终于在这一带守住了几座防守哨塔。\n\n我收到的最新消息和侦察报告说一群背叛者占据了我们在在旅店的西南方的一座废弃哨塔。\n\n这群背叛者的首领叫加科因，去看看能不能从他身上找到什么消息。\n\n小心点，$n。他可是个难对付的家伙。",dEN="It has been a struggle maintaining a presence in the marsh, but through strength of our resolve, we have been able to maintain several defensive watchtowers throughout the area.\n\nThe latest information and scouting reports I have received indicate that a group of deserters has squatted in our abandoned tower at Lost Point, southeast of the inn.\n\nThe local lieutenant seems to be Balos Jacken. See if you can get some information out of him.\n\nBe warned, <name>. He may be a tough nut to crack.",o="从巴鲁斯·加科因及尘泥沼泽的背叛者那里打探消息。",oEN="Get information about Reethe from Balos Jacken and the deserters in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="维米斯让你来的？他自己应付不了我，对吧……",cEN="Did Vimes send you? Couldn't do his dirty work himself, could he..."}
Q[1287]={d="雷瑟？那个懦夫？\n\n我们把他赶出营地，因为他坚持要袭击蕨墙村的食人魔，还要抢他们的物资。我们人数不够，没法跟那帮不长脑子的畜生斗。\n\n他不止一次做出过分的事，所以我们就把他赶了出去。\n\n现在我帮了你的忙……那么，别管你是不是偶然来这儿的，不如帮帮我的忙，别给我惹麻烦了吧？",dEN="Reethe? That coward?\n\nWe threw him out of camp because he insisted on raiding the supplies of the ogres up at Brackenwall Village. We're not so many in number that we could stand up to those mindless brutes.\n\nHe crossed the line one too many times, so we left him to fend for himself.\n\nNow, I helped you out... So, why don't you help us out and forget you bumped into us?",o="和塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长谈一谈关于雷瑟的事。",oEN="Speak with Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore about Reethe.",c="我会派卡德维尔上尉去对付废弃之塔的那群背叛者，另外，我还会指引他去找雷瑟。这片沼泽地并没有大到让他没办法找到雷瑟。",cEN="I will send Lieutenant Caldwell to deal with the deserters at Lost Point. In addition, I will instruct him to find Reethe. The marsh is not so big and trackless that he should be unable to find him."}
Q[1288]={d="你干得不错，$n，是我见过的最好的$g业余水平:业余水平;。\n\n普罗德摩尔女士曾要求我随时向她通报这桩微妙的局势，但我已经有段时间没向她汇报了。\n\n我本打算晚些时候把报告交给她，不过我觉得由你去跟她谈更合适。你大概比我更能回答她的问题。",dEN="You've done some good work, <name>, best I've seen from an amateur.\n\nLady Proudmoore asked that I keep her apprised of this delicate situation, and I haven't spoken to her for some time now.\n\nI was going to deliver my report to her later, but it seems more fitting that you should be the one to speak with her about it. You can probably answer her questions better than I could.",o="把维米斯的报告带给吉安娜?普罗德摩尔，她在塞拉摩.",oEN="Bring Vimes's Report to Lady Jaina Proudmoore in Theramore."}
Q[1301]={d="在蓝色隐士旅店干活之前，我曾在一个最棒的厨师兼旅店老板手下学艺，他的名字是詹姆斯·海厄尔。我今天能有这样的成就都得归功于他。\n\n不知道他现在在干什么，他和他的兄弟文森特到米奈希尔港的一家旅店去工作了，不过最近我一直没听到他的消息。\n\n你要是碰巧要往米奈希尔去的话，能不能帮我问候他一下？",dEN="Before working here at the Blue Recluse, I was trained by one of the best chefs and innkeepers I'd ever met. His name was James Hyal. Everything I have and everywhere I've gotten in life is thanks to him.\n\nI wonder how he's doing. His brother Vincent and he went to work in a tavern in Menethil Harbor, but I haven't heard from him recently.\n\nIf you ever happen to be headed in that direction, maybe you could say hello to him for me?",o="和米奈希尔港的文森特·海厄尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Vincent Hyal in Menethil Harbor.",c="詹姆斯？哦，他很久以前就走了。\n\n我看他被狂热的情绪冲昏了头。当时整个洛丹伦都疯了，很多人加入吉安娜·普罗德摩尔的军队横渡大海到卡利姆多去了。",cEN="James? Oh, he left quite some time ago.\n\nFelt the second wind of patriotism, I suppose. Not hard to see why he would. With all the insanity in Lordaeron, many people joined up with Jaina Proudmoore when she went across the sea."}
Q[1302]={d="我的兄弟詹姆斯跟随吉安娜女士到塞拉摩去了。我最后一次听到他的消息是说他们在那儿打完了仗，詹姆斯还在那里的某个地方开了个旅店。不管他现在在哪儿，我想他的生意肯定很红火，他是个很棒的厨师。\n\n啊，说起来我已经有一阵子没听到他的消息了——旅店的生意太忙了——不过塞拉摩的书记员应该可以帮你找到他。",dEN="My brother James went with Lady Proudmoore across the sea. Last I heard, the fighting had settled down over there, and James was setting up an inn somewhere on the continent. Wherever he is, I'm sure he's doing good business. Damn fine cook he was.\n\nI haven't heard from him for a while now--too busy with his inn, I'd wager--but the clerk in Theramore could probably point you to him. Look for him on the top floor of that keep near the middle of the city. What's it called... Foothold Citadel, that's it.",o="和塞拉摩的书记员伦德瑞谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Clerk Lendry at Foothold Citadel in Theramore.",c="詹姆斯·海厄尔，詹姆斯·海厄尔……这个名字怎么这么熟？\n\n对了！树荫旅店事件。如果你有什么关于那件事的消息，我建议你去和维米斯上尉说说。他负责调查这件事。",cEN="James Hyal, James Hyal... Why does that name sound so familiar?\n\nOf course! The Shady Rest Inn incident. If you have any information about what happened there, I would urge you to speak with Captain Vimes about it. He's handling the investigation."}
Q[1303]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1304]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1305]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1306]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",dEN="Calling every Hero!\n\nSlay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",o="在荣誉战斗中击杀与你拥有相同寻宝猎人增益的其他英雄！",oEN="Slay other heroes in Honorable Combat with the same Treasure Hunter buff as you!",p="你还没有在足够多的战斗中证明自己。回到战场上去战斗吧，英雄！",pEN="You have not yet proven yourself in enough battles. Get back out there and fight, Hero!",c="你的战斗技艺已经得到证明！今晚酒馆里将传颂你在荣誉战斗中的胜利事迹。去领取你的奖赏吧，勇士。",cEN="Your combat prowess is proven! Tales of your victories in Honorable Combat will echo through the taverns tonight. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[1307]={d="召唤所有恶魔！\n\n联盟的人数与日俱增，是时候给这群家伙\"减减员\"了……\n\n\n注意：击杀其他邪能铸造者不会计入击杀进度。",dEN="Calling all Demons!\n\nThe Alliance grow in numbers every day, and it is about time we \"thin\" the herd...\n\n\nNote: Killing other felforged will not count towards kill credit.",o="消灭联盟！",oEN="Slay the Alliance!",p="敌人依然屹立。继续猎杀，事成之后再回来。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Continue the hunt and return when the deed is done.",c="敌人已被大量削减。他们需要时间才能恢复元气。你为燃烧军团效劳得很好，恶魔。",cEN="The enemy has been culled. Their numbers will take time to recover. You have served the Legion well, demon."}
Q[1308]={d="召唤所有恶魔！\n\n部落的人数与日俱增，是时候给这群家伙\"减减员\"了……\n\n\n注意：击杀其他邪能铸造者不会计入击杀进度。",dEN="Calling all Demons!\n\nThe Horde grow in numbers every day, and it is about time we \"thin\" the herd...\n\n\nNote: Killing other felforged will not count towards kill credit.",o="歼灭部落！",oEN="Slay the Horde!",p="敌人依然屹立。继续猎杀，事成之后再回来。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Continue the hunt and return when the deed is done.",c="敌人已被大量削减。他们需要时间才能恢复元气。你为燃烧军团效劳得很好，恶魔。",cEN="The enemy has been culled. Their numbers will take time to recover. You have served the Legion well, demon."}
Q[1309]={p="你好，<race>。我是科拉克，来自雷霆崖的赏金猎人。我游历过世界的大部分地方，见识广博。\n\n我穿越南海的旅程让我发现了这些奇妙的瑟银箭头。可惜的是，我的箭矢供应源源不绝，箭杆却已用尽。呸，任何一个有自尊的牛头人都不会让人看见自己用一把劣质弓。这些箭根本没用！\n\n我提个交易：用瑟银箭杆换我的瑟银箭头，公平交换。成交吗？",pEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Kolark, Bounty Hunter from Thunderbluff. Much of the world I have traveled and much I have seen.\n\nMy journeys across the South Seas led to the discovery of these wonderous thorium headed arrows. Alas, I have an endless supply of the arrows but have exhausted my supply of shells. Bah, no self respecting Tauren would ever be caught dead using a flimsy bow. The arrows are useless!\n\nI will offer a trade: An even exchange of thorium shells for my thorium headed arrows. Deal?",c="太好了！我是言出必行的牛头人，<race>。这些箭归你了。",cEN="Excellent! I am a Tauren of my word, <race>. The arrows are yours."}
Q[1310]={p="你好，<race>。我是科拉克，来自雷霆崖的赏金猎人。我游历过世界的大部分地方，见识广博。\n\n我穿越南海的旅程让我发现了这些奇妙的瑟银箭头。可惜的是，我的箭矢供应源源不绝，箭杆却已用尽。呸，任何一个有自尊的牛头人都不会让人看见自己用一把劣质弓。这些箭根本没用！\n\n我提个交易：用瑟银箭杆换我的瑟银箭头，公平交换。成交吗？",pEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Kolark, Bounty Hunter from Thunderbluff. Much of the world I have traveled and much I have seen.\n\nMy journeys across the South Seas led to the discovery of these wonderous thorium headed arrows. Alas, I have an endless supply of the arrows but have exhausted my supply of shells. Bah, no self respecting Tauren would ever be caught dead using a flimsy bow. The arrows are useless!\n\nI will offer a trade: An even exchange of thorium shells for my thorium headed arrows. Deal?",c="太好了！我是言出必行的牛头人，<race>。这些箭归你了。",cEN="Excellent! I am a Tauren of my word, <race>. The arrows are yours."}
Q[1311]={p="你相信这种垃圾吗？！卡兰诺斯运来的最后一批弹药简直是场灾难！我们现在能用的弹药就只有这些毫无用处的劣质箭矢！我拿五十万支瑟银箭头能干什么？\n\n我跟你说，小子。如果你能给我弄来瑟银箭杆，我就跟你换瑟银箭头，直接换！成交吗？",pEN="Can you believe this rubbish?! The last shipment of ammunition from Kharanos was botched! All we have for ammo now are these flimsy, good for nothing arrows! What in the world am I going to do with 500,000 thorium headed arrows?\n\nI'll tell you what, kid. If you can bring me thorium shells, I'll trade you thorium headed arrows - straight up! Deal?",c="这可是实打实的买卖！这些箭归你了。",cEN="A done deal if I ever saw one! The arrows are yours."}
Q[1312]={p="你相信这种垃圾吗？！卡兰诺斯运来的最后一批弹药简直是场灾难！我们现在能用的弹药就只有这些毫无用处的劣质箭矢！我拿五十万支瑟银箭头能干什么？\n\n我跟你说，小子。如果你能给我弄来瑟银箭杆，我就跟你换瑟银箭头，直接换！成交吗？",pEN="Can you believe this rubbish?! The last shipment of ammunition from Kharanos was botched! All we have for ammo now are these flimsy, good for nothing arrows! What in the world am I going to do with 500,000 thorium headed arrows?\n\nI'll tell you what, kid. If you can bring me thorium shells, I'll trade you thorium headed arrows - straight up! Deal?",c="这可是实打实的买卖！这些箭归你了。",cEN="A done deal if I ever saw one! The arrows are yours."}
Q[1313]={d="我知道民兵队全靠我的药水，可那些该死的盗贼偷走了我半个库房，我怎么可能跟得上供应？\n\n这周早些时候，迪菲亚偷走了三箱准备发给人民军团的药水。我们的守卫需要那些药水！把它们找回来，我就分你一些，让你也保平安。",dEN="I know the militia relies on my potions, but when those damned thieves steal half of my store - how can I ever hope to keep up?\n\nEarlier this week, the Defias stole three crates ready to distribute to the People's Militia. Our defenders need those potions! Retrieve them, and I'll give you a few to keep you safe as well.",o="从西部荒野的迪菲亚营地中找回被偷走的药水。",oEN="Recover the stolen potions from the Defias camps in Westfall.",p="你全都找到了吗……？",pEN="Did you find them all...?",c="来得正是时候。这些东西回到我们手里，哨兵岭的伤员就有了一战之力。干得好。",cEN="Perfect timing. With these back in our hands, the wounded at Sentinel Hill stand a fighting chance. Well done."}
Q[1314]={d="你见过北边那队哨兵吗？\n\n很久以前，塞莱斯被派去找她的姐妹法德里斯，但两人都没有回来。我开始往最坏处想了；塞莱斯很能干，一定是有什么耽搁了她们……\n\n队长想再等一阵子才派出更大的搜索队，但我想尽可能多召集些眼线和耳目。如果你要沿北边的路走，请务必找到她！",dEN="Have you seen a group of Sentinels to the north?\n\nCylaeth was sent to go check on her sister, Fadrieth, ages ago but neither have returned. I'm beginning to fear the worst, Cylaeth is capable, for something to delay them both...\n\nThe Captain wishes to wait a little longer before sending a larger search party, but I want to enlist as many eyes and ears as I can. If you're venturing along the northern road - please find her!",o="在玛塞斯特拉废墟外找到哨兵塞莱斯·月刃。",oEN="Find Sentinel Cylaeth Moonblade outside the Ruins of Mathystra.",c="是梅琳娜派你来的……？\n\n<塞莱斯疼得蜷起身子。>\n\n好吧……赞美艾露恩，她总算派人来了。见识过这些纳迦的能耐之后，我可不敢把小法德里斯派进去。\n\n但你……也许你能帮上忙。",cEN="Melynna sent you...?\n\n<Cylaeth cringes in pain.>\n\nWell... praise Elune she did. I dare not send little Fadrieth in there, not after seeing what these naga can do.\n\nBut you... perhaps you can help."}
Q[1315]={d="我们失去了太多人……\n\n也许我比大多数人更留恋过去，但哀悼的并不只有我。曾居住于此的上层精灵灵魂仍在徘徊，被自己的悲痛所束缚。\n\n我知道哨兵们为了自己的目的在南边的废墟中搜寻，但我请求你做的是另一件事。终结那些很久以前在此丧生者的痛苦。\n\n他们无法自行解脱。如果你能帮他们放下执念、继续前行……那将是一种慈悲，对他们如此，对我亦然。",dEN="We have lost so many…\n\nI may cling to the past more than most, but I do not mourn alone. The spirits of the Highborne who once lived here still linger, bound to their grief.\n\nI know the Sentinels search the southern ruins for their own purposes, but I ask something different of you. End the suffering of those who perished here long ago.\n\nThey cannot release themselves. If you could help them let go and move on... it would be a mercy,\nfor them, and for me as well.",o="让阿梅斯阿兰的亡者得以安息。",oEN="Put the dead to rest in Ameth'Aran.",p="你完成那件事了吗……？",pEN="Have you done the deed...?",c="我又能听见寂静了。如今这里静得可怕。\n\n感谢你的所作所为，善良的灵魂。也许现在我们都能稍稍安息了。",cEN="I can hear silence again. How dreadfully quiet it is now.\n\nThank you for your actions, kind one. Perhaps we might all rest a little easier now."}
Q[1316]={d="大师之刃很早就一直是争夺之地，旧神的奴仆像食腐的鸟一样被这种地方吸引。\n\n我不知道这伙人具体在图谋什么，但我当然打算查清楚。无论他们是想复活陨落的主子、从废墟中研习，还是分食他的尸骸，我都必须弄清楚并阻止他们的行动。\n\n我们抓了一个，但我需要更多时间。杀掉现在守在那里的家伙，拖慢他们那些病态的仪式。",dEN="The Master’s Glaive has long since been a contested area, slaves of the old god drawn to such a place like carrion birds.\n\nI know not what this particular group is planning, but I certainly plan to find out. Whether they wish to resurrect their fallen lord, learn from his ruins, or cannibalize his corpse, - I must know, and halt their efforts.\n\nWe've captured one, but I need more time. Kill those who are there now to delay their sick rituals.",o="消灭大师之刃中的邪教徒。",oEN="Eliminate the cultists in the Master's Glaive.",p="你把邪教徒击退了吗？必须在更多援军到来之前摧毁他们的据点。",pEN="Have you driven back the cultists? Their foothold must be shattered before more arrive.",c="这应该能暂时阻止他们的活动了。\n\n你证明了自己非常有用，干得好。",cEN="That should halt their activities for now.\n\nYou've proven yourself most useful, well done."}
Q[1317]={d="我们在俘虏身上找到了一本用密文写成的日记。我们的图书管理员仍在试图解读它，需要更多信息来帮助他们理解其中的内容。\n\n把你从那些暮光走狗身上找到的任何文字带回来，交给博学者法尔奈。照做的话，我会确保你得到奖赏。",dEN="We found a journal of encoded text on our captive. Our librarians are still trying to make sense of it and need more information to help them understand what is written.\n\nBring back any writings you can find from those twilight dogs and give them to Lorekeeper Farnae. Do this, and I'll see you rewarded.",o="从暮光信徒和暮光暴徒身上收集 10 份《暮光杂记》。",oEN="Collect 10 Twilight Miscellany from Twilight Disciples and Twilight Thugs.",p="哦，你好！你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="Oh hello, did you have something for me?",c="这些记录证实了教派正在测绘我们的海岸线。现在我们可以挫败他们的计划了。干得好。",cEN="These records confirm the cult is mapping our shoreline. We can counter their plans now. Good work."}
Q[1319]={d="我很抱歉帮不了忙，$n，不过可以给你介绍个能帮忙的人。卡兹·双链是我们最好的铁匠，他就在铁匠铺给人打铁器。\n\n把盾牌拿给他，看看他能告诉你什么。",dEN="I'm sorry I can't be of much help, <name>, but I can refer you to someone who would be. Caz Twosprocket, one of our best blacksmiths, works the forge at the smithy.\n\nTake the shield to him, and see what he can tell you.",o="把被熏黑的铁盾牌拿给塞拉摩的卡兹·双链看一看。",oEN="Show the Blackened Iron Shield to Caz Twosprocket in Theramore.",p="有什么事吗？",pEN="Something for me to look at?",c="嗯……这东西有点意思。肯定不是塞拉摩这边的铁匠做的，当然更不可能是我做的。",cEN="Hm... interesting piece of iron you have here. Definitely not made by any of the blacksmiths I know over on this side of the sea, and it's certainly not my work."}
Q[1320]={d="啊，我差点没注意到这个……背面的皮带一定是被烧掉了，不过看上去这条皮带是给某个身材高大的家伙用的。我猜是个牛头人。\n\n我就只能告诉你这些了，告诉维米斯队长，很抱歉我帮不上别的什么忙了。",dEN="Ah, I almost missed this... The leather strap on the back must have burned off, but it seems like it was made to fit a large person. I'd guess a tauren, actually.\n\nThat's about all I can tell you. Tell Captain Vimes I'm sorry I couldn't be of more help.",o="与塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore.",c="这点资讯还不够，不过我们得把它记下来。也许将来我们还能找到关于这个秘密的其他线索，加在一起就应该能够看出事情的端倪了。",cEN="That's not much information to work on, but we'll have to keep it in mind. Hopefully some of the other pieces of this mystery will fall into place, and paint a more helpful picture of what happened."}
Q[1321]={d="嗯……我看不出这个盾牌有什么特别之处。我们应该把它拿给铁匠杜高尔，看看他有什么说法。不过我也不抱太大希望……",dEN="Hmm... I don't see anything out of the ordinary with this shield. We should have Do'gol, the blacksmith, take a look at it, and see if he can tell us more about it, but I wouldn't hold out hope...",o="把被熏黑的铁盾牌拿给蕨墙村的杜高尔看一看。",oEN="Show the Blackened Iron Shield to Do'gol in Brackenwall Village.",p="你找我，$c？",pEN="Something for me, <class>?",c="这个盾牌很不错，又重又坚硬。不过杜高尔不需要，我自己做盾牌，不买盾牌，$n。\n\n你应该知道。",cEN="This is good shield. Very strong, heavy, good. But Do'gol don't need it. I make shields, not buy them, <name>.\n\nYou should know that."}
Q[1322]={d="嗯，在盾牌的边上这儿刻着字，可惜烧过了读不出来。\n\n要用些酸液洗干净，用沼泽地里的暗牙蜘蛛的毒液就可以了。那些蜘蛛盘踞在一座旧矿洞里，现在那里被称为黑雾洞穴。给我找点它们的毒囊来，我可以把盾牌清洗一下以便辨认。",dEN="Hmmm, there's writing right here on the rim of the shield, but it's hard to read from all the burned stuff.\n\nI need acid to make it clear. Venom from the darkmist spiders would do good. The spiders have taken over an old mine, the Darkmist Cavern, northwest of the village. Get me some of their sacs and I can clean this up.",o="为蕨墙村的杜高尔收集5个酸性毒囊。",oEN="Acquire 5 Acidic Venom Sacs for Do'gol in Brackenwall Village.",p="你找到蜘蛛的毒囊了吗？",pEN="Did you get them sacs from the spiders?",c="我讨厌蜘蛛，因为它们太大我不能坐上去就把它直接压扁。\n\n多谢你帮我收集它们，$n。现在我就把它们撕开让毒汁倒在盾上……",cEN="I don't like spiders that are so big I can't sit on them and squish them.\n\nThanks for getting them, <name>. Now I rip them open and pour them onto the shield..."}
Q[1323]={d="呃，我想我大概倒了太多酸液在盾牌上，得擦掉点儿……\n\n嗯……有点难辨认，不过好象是一个叫“莫萨恩”的名字。从来没听过这个名字。克罗格认识不少人，他也许知道这个莫萨恩是谁。",dEN="Oh, I think I might have dropped too much acid onto the shield. Let me just rub a little...\n\nHm, kind of hard to read, but it looks like the name Mosarn. Never heard of him. Maybe Krog knows. Krog knows many people.",o="和蕨墙村的克罗格谈一谈。",oEN="Talk with Krog in Brackenwall Village.",c="莫萨恩？很耳熟……不过一时之间……也许过会儿我能想起来。\n\n可能不是什么重要的东西。这面盾牌没什么代表性，不一定有什么特殊的意义……",cEN="Mosarn? Sounds familiar... I can't put my finger on it. Maybe it'll come to me later.\n\nIt probably isn't important. A shield can come from anywhere and not mean anything..."}
Q[1324]={d="什么？！你到这里来就是为了指控我和迪菲亚兄弟会有染？！我无法容许你这么侮辱我！看来我非得好好教训教训你才行。",dEN="What?! You come here accusing me of allying with the Defias, and think I'll just stand here while you insult me?! Something tells me you've had this coming for a long time.",o="击败尘泥沼泽的亨德尔下士。",oEN="Defeat Private Hendel in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="又见面了，$n。我希望你不会介意我提供的这点小帮助，但我们绝不能让亨德尔给跑了，或者更糟的让他被灭口。",pEN="Hello again, <name>. I hope you don't mind the assistance, but we couldn't have Hendel escaping, or worse, wind up dead.",c="我向你保证，我们最近都被这一连串的突发事件搞得有点心烦意乱，但请允许我们先把他带回塞拉摩好好审问一番，我们保证一定会找到国王陛下的。\n\n我相信普罗德摩尔女士会乐于答谢你的帮助，如果你有空的话，就去找她谈谈吧。",cEN="I assure you, we're all quite upset about current events, but allow us to take him back to Theramore for some questioning, and we'll see about finding the King.\n\nI'm sure my lady Proudmore would like to thank you for your help. Speak to her when you have a moment."}
Q[1327]={d="我第一次爬上山丘时比你还年轻，手里握着弓，自信远多于理智。\n\n我的箭术实在没什么可夸耀的，所以我专挑能找到的最大的野兽下手，心想目标越大，命中的机会就越大。\n\n我吃了不少苦头才明白，熊对射偏的箭可没什么好脾气。\n\n现在去吧。尽可能多地猎杀野兽，证明你不只是个拿着武器的莽撞孩子。向我证明你有成为真正猎人的本事。",dEN="I was younger than you when I first climbed into the hills, bow in hand and far more confidence than sense.\n\nMy aim wasn’t much to boast about, so I chose the largest beasts I could find figuring a bigger target meant better odds of striking true.\n\nI learned the hard way that bears don’t take kindly to missed shots.\n\nNow go. Hunt down as many creatures as you can, and prove you’re more than just a reckless child with a weapon. Show me you have what it takes to be a true hunter.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只灰熊。",oEN="Kill 10 Gray Bears in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="你还在这儿？",pEN="You're still here?",c="干得好。你总算证明了自己至少跟个孩子一样能干。\n\n不过说句公道话，那些熊算不上什么考验。如果你以为这就能让你在真正的猎人中间占一席之地，那你还有得学呢。",cEN="Well done. You’ve managed to prove you’re at least as competent as a child.\n\nThough, to be fair, those bears were hardly a test. If you think this earns you a place among real huntsmen, you’ve got a lot left to learn."}
Q[1328]={d="你以前猎过蜘蛛吗？\n\n它们狡猾又安静，要么潜伏在蛛网上，要么在森林地面上爬行。哪怕是最小的一只也可能致命；一滴毒液就足以要你的命。\n\n如果你觉得自己有本事在这些山丘里狩猎，就去杀几只弱些的。事情没办完之前，别再想着来找我。",dEN="Have you ever hunted spiders before?\n\nThey’re tricky and quiet, lurking in their webs or scuttling across the forest floor. Even the smallest among them can be deadly; a single drop of their venom is enough to finish you.\n\nIf you believe you have what it takes to hunt in these hills, go and slay some of the weaker ones. And don't think about approaching me again until it's done.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只森林苔藓潜伏者。",oEN="Kill 10 Forest Moss Creepers in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="如果那些苔藓潜伏者还在灌木丛里出没，你的课就没上完。",pEN="If those moss creepers still haunt the brush, then your lesson is unfinished.",c="干得不错，你杀了一堆微不足道的蜘蛛。希望你没指望有人为这点事起立鼓掌。\n\n现在，如果你真想为这个镇子做点事……我手头有个更难对付的猎物。",cEN="Good job, you killed a bunch of lowly spiders. I hope you're not expecting a standing ovation for the deed.\n\nNow, if you'd like to actually do something to help this town... I've got a tougher quarry for you in mind."}
Q[1329]={d="冷静点。别那么得意，你不过证明了你能拍打幼崽而已。\n\n想让我刮目相看，就去对付那些在人类聚居地附近游荡的家伙。那些野兽在你失手时绝不会犹豫。它们既跟卫兵打，也跟强盗打……而且聪明得要命。\n\n帮我们大家一个忙，削减它们的数量。只是别把自己搭进去。",dEN="Settle down. Don’t look so proud of yourself, you’ve only proven you can swat at cubs.\n\nIf you want to impress me, go after the ones that linger near human settlements. Those beasts don’t hesitate when you miss. They’re used to fighting guards and bandits alike… and they’re smart as hell.\n\nDo us all a favor and cull their numbers. Just try not to get yourself killed in the process.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只凶恶灰熊。",oEN="Kill 10 Vicious Gray Bears in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我看你还活着。",pEN="Still alive I see.",c="这个我认了……你没死。而且你收拾得相当干净利落。\n\n那些熊可是解决过比你更强的斗士。\n\n继续保持，说不定你能赢得我的尊重。",cEN="I’ll give you this... you didn’t die. And you brought them down clean enough.\n\nThose bears have ended better fighters than you.\n\nKeep this up, and you might just earn my respect."}
Q[1330]={d="我在这些山丘里打了一辈子猎，但我老了。\n\n饥饿的山狮越来越大胆，总得有人在有人受伤之前削减它们的数量。\n\n替我杀死 10 只饥饿的山狮。做到了，也许我终于能去南海镇安度晚年了。",dEN="I’ve hunted these hills for many years, but I’m getting old.\n\nThe starving mountain lions are growing bold, and someone needs to thin their numbers before someone gets hurt.\n\nKill 10 Starving Mountain Lions for me. Do that, and maybe I can finally settle down in Southshore.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵为猎人维尔丹杀死 10 只饥饿的山狮。",oEN="Kill 10 Starving Mountain Lions for Hunstman Verdan in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="你处理掉那些山狮了吗？事情办完之前，这些山丘都不会安全。",pEN="Have you dealt with the mountain lions yet? These hills won’t be safe until the job is done.",c="干得好。你手很稳，这些山丘因此更安全了。\n\n也许一个老猎人还能指望安享晚年。",cEN="Good work. You’ve got a steady hand, and these hills are safer for it.\n\nMaybe there’s still hope for an old hunter to retire in peace."}
Q[1331]={d="你把那些饥饿的山狮处理得不错，但凶暴的更糟。\n\n它们更强壮、更凶残，也太嚣张了，不能放任不管。如果我真要放下弓，就得让最后这片山丘安全下来。\n\n替我杀死 10 只凶暴的山狮。",dEN="You handled the starving lions well, but the feral ones are worse.\n\nThey’re stronger, meaner, and too bold to leave alone. If I’m ever going to set down my bow, I need this last stretch of hills made safe.\n\nKill 10 Feral Mountain Lions for me.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵为猎人维尔丹杀死 10 只凶暴的山狮。",oEN="Kill 10 Feral Mountain Lions for Hunstman Verdan in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="那些凶暴的山狮还得处理。它们自由游荡一天，我就一天没法退休。",pEN="The feral lions still need dealing with. I can’t retire while they’re roaming free.",c="好。这应该能让这些山丘安静一阵子了。\n\n也许我这个老猎手离安宁又近了一步。",cEN="Good. That should quiet the hills for a while.\n\nMaybe this old huntsman is one step closer to peace."}
Q[1332]={d="小蜘蛛算不上什么威胁，但大蜘蛛就是另一回事了。它们会把你打得喘不过气，还没等你反应过来就把你裹进蛛丝里。\n\n我之前见过不少还算不错的猎人被它们干掉。\n\n去吧，拿出你的胆量，解决掉那些庞然大物。",dEN="The smaller ones are hardly a threat, but the larger spiders are another matter. They’ll knock the wind out of you and have you wrapped in silk before you can react.\n\nI've seen some half-decent huntsman get offed by them before.\n\nGo on now, prove your mettle and take down those enormous beasts.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只巨型苔藓潜伏者。",oEN="Kill 10 Giant Moss Creepers in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我想你的狩猎还没结束吧？",pEN="I don't suppose you've finished your hunt yet?",c="那么，也许我们还真能把你培养成一个热衷狩猎的猎人。\n\n话虽如此，这些山丘里还有比几只长过头的害虫更危险的东西。",cEN="Well then, perhaps we'll make an avid huntsman of you yet.\n\nThat being said, there are still more dangerous things in these hills than a few overgrown pests."}
Q[1333]={d="你已经证明了自己能对付普通的野兽。\n\n现在让我们看看你面对我的猎物时表现如何。我追踪的那些家伙既凶残，又会反过来猎杀我。这场游戏危险得多，等它们冲过来时你可没有从容应对的余裕。\n\n小心点，冒险者。对付这些生物要格外谨慎。一次失误就是最后一次。",dEN="You’ve proven you can handle yourself against common beasts.\n\nNow let’s see how you fare against my quarry. The ones I track are vicious and they hunt me in turn. The game gets a whole lot more dangerous, and you won’t have the luxury of time when they charge.\n\nBe warned, adventurer. Take utmost caution with these creatures. One mistake will be your last.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只年长灰熊。",oEN="Kill 10 Elder Gray Bears in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="稳住准头，一击致命。我可不希望下次出猎时绊到你的骨头。",pEN="Keep your aim steady and strike true. I'd hate to stumble upon your bones when I head out on my next hunt.",c="……所以你当真做到了。\n\n那些可不只是野兽，你猎杀的是会反猎的掠食者。大多数人活不到学会这一课。\n\n你不再只是靠运气了。哪天我都愿意带你深入山丘去狩猎。",cEN="…So you actually did it.\n\nThose weren’t just beasts, you hunted predators that hunt back. Most don’t live long enough to learn that lesson.\n\nYou’re not just getting lucky anymore. I’d take you on a hunt deep in the hills any day."}
Q[1334]={d="那些巨型家伙的危险在于体型，但我猎杀的是最古老的。幸存者。狡猾到能记住……还能认出自己的猎物。\n\n没有什么比闯进它们的领地更危险了。我清楚得很，那是我还年轻、缺乏经验的时候经历的事……我勉强活着出来。\n\n去吧。把它们猎杀殆尽。能杀多少杀多少，一只都别放过。",dEN="The giant ones are dangerous for their size, but the ones I hunt are the oldest. Survivors. Cunning enough to remember… and to recognize their prey.\n\nThere’s nothing more dangerous than wandering into their territory. I would know, it happened to me when I was a younger, inexperienced hunter... I barely made it out alive.\n\nGo on. Hunt them down. Exterminate as many as you can and let none survive.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵杀死 10 只年长苔藓潜伏者。",oEN="Kill 10 Elder Moss Creepers in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我看你还活着。很好。",pEN="Still alive I see. Good.",c="哎呀，真不敢相信……你居然真的回来了。\n\n追猎那些东西的人大多回不来。可你呢？你站稳了脚跟，在它们的领地上正面交锋，还活着讲出了这个故事。\n\n这可不是小成就。\n\n你赢得了我的尊重……还有我的感激。很少有人能得其一。",cEN="Well, I’ll be damned… you actually made it back.\n\nMost who go after those things don’t return. But you? You stood your ground, faced them in their own territory, and lived to tell the tale.\n\nThat’s no small feat.\n\nYou’ve earned my respect… and my gratitude. Few can claim either."}
Q[1335]={d="你已经处理了那些凶暴的山狮，但这些山丘仍不安全。\n\n这里的山狮安静而有耐心。别大意。放倒 10 只，我们就快完工了。",dEN="You’ve handled the feral lions, but the hills still aren’t safe.\n\nThe mountain lions here are quiet and patient. Don’t get careless. Bring down 10 of them, and we’ll be close to finished.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵为猎人维尔丹杀死 10 只山狮。",oEN="Kill 10 Mountain Lions for Hunstman Verdan in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="这些山丘还不安全。把这件事办完，我还有别的事要告诉你。",pEN="The hills aren’t safe yet. Finish this, and there’s something else I need to tell you.",c="好。这应该能解决其中最麻烦的部分。\n\n如果你愿意，还有三头野兽是我自己从未能放倒的。",cEN="Good. That should settle the worst of them.\n\nIf you're willing, there are three beasts I never managed to bring down myself."}
Q[1336]={d="一直有一头熊从我手中逃脱。我追踪了它多年，但每次终于与那野兽面对面时……我从未松开过弓弦。\n\n我早就知道真相……我的箭永远刺不穿它的皮，我的长矛会像柴火一样在它身上折断。\n\n老灰背不是普通的生物。它是一头眼神冰冷、嗜杀成性的野兽，我并不羞于承认自己不愿独自面对它。\n\n但如果你愿意接下这场狩猎，这份我承担不起的重担……你赢得的将远不止一个猎人同行的尊重。",dEN="There has always been one bear that has eluded me. I’ve spent years tracking it, yet whenever I finally came face to face with the beast… I never loosed the arrow.\n\nI’ve long known the truth... my arrows would never pierce its hide, and my spear would snap like kindling against it.\n\nOld Grayback is no ordinary creature. It is a murderous beast with cold eyes, and I do not shame myself in admitting I will not face it alone.\n\nBut if you are willing to take on this hunt, this burden, where I could not... you'll earn far more than mere respect from a fellow Huntsman.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵北部的群山中杀死老灰背。",oEN="Slay Old Grayback in the northern mountains of Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="很抱歉让你去做这件事。现在，你可别死在我前头。听见了吗？",pEN="I'm sorry I've asked this of you. Now don't you go dying on me. You hear?",c="言语不足以表达我有多骄傲，也不足以形容你走得有多远。\n\n也许，如果外面还有更多像你这样的年轻灵魂，那么也许……只是也许……我终于可以考虑放下长矛了。远离战斗，去过自己的生活，终于能享受我花了这么多年试图保护的这座小镇。\n\n唉……光是这个念头就足够令人欣慰了。",cEN="There are no words sufficient to express how proud I am, nor how far you have come.\n\nPerhaps, if there are more young souls like you out there, then maybe... just maybe... I could finally consider laying down my spear. To step away from the fighting, find a life of my own, and at last enjoy the town I’ve spent so many years trying to protect.\n\nAye… that thought alone is a comforting one indeed."}
Q[1337]={d="如果你准备好保卫南海镇，我请求你到阿祖雷矿坑来援助我们。我们的部队已在那里交战，许多最优秀的守卫正献出生命，保护那些既珍贵又迫切需要的物资。\n\n没有增援，我们守不住这条防线。我请求你在这场对抗部落的战斗中尽一份力，尽可能多地击杀那些被遗忘者。\n\n联盟绝不能退让。守住阵地，为所有依赖我们的人坚持下去。",dEN="If you stand ready to defend Southshore, then I call upon you to aid us at the Azurelode Mine. Our forces are already engaged there, and many of our finest defenders are laying down their lives to safeguard supplies that are both precious and desperately needed.\n\nWe cannot hold this line without reinforcement. I ask you to do your part in this battle against the Horde, and strike down as many of those Forsaken as you are able.\n\nThe Alliance must not yield. Hold your ground, and stand firm for all who depend on us.",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的阿祖雷矿坑杀死 15 名被遗忘者战斗员。",oEN="Slay 15 Forsaken Combatants at the Azurelode Mine in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我真想亲自去那里动手；作为联盟的一员，我们都必须坚强挺立。",pEN="I have half a mind to go there and do it myself, as a member of the Alliance we must all stand strong.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。\n\n今天你给被遗忘者重重一击。也许你的猛攻为我们的矿工争取到了几天的安全，之后那些可憎之物才会重新集结，再次试图攻陷我们的据点。\n\n至少，我们只能指望这样的喘息。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nYou've dealt the Forsaken a hearty blow today. Perhaps your onslaught has earned our miners a few days of safety before those abominations regroup and attempt to topple our hold once again.\n\nOr at least we can only hope for such a respite."}
Q[1338]={d="有一个名叫弗伦·长须的矮人铸甲匠，我很欣赏他做的东西，那手艺简直是无人能敌。我需要一面新盾牌，而且一定要他亲手做出来的盾牌！\n\n问题是……弗伦住在遥远的南方，在暴风城的矮人区里。他竟然住在人类的领地里！我没法想象他怎么会住在离铁炉堡这么远的地方，那帮人类一定出了足够收买国王的大价钱把他给留在那儿！\n\n如果你正好要去那里旅行一趟，又想顺便挣点钱的话，能不能去弗伦那儿让他给我做一面盾牌？",dEN="There is a dwarven armorsmith whose work I admire greatly. His name is Furen Longbeard, and his skill is unmatched. I need a new shield, and I must have one of his!\n\nThe problem is... Furen is far to the south, in the dwarven district within Stormwind. In human lands! I can't imagine why he would live there, so far from Ironforge. The humans must pay him a king's ransom to keep him there!\n\nSo, if you want to travel and don't mind making some money, then will you send Furen my request for a shield?",o="把卡尔·雷矛的订单交给暴风城的弗伦·长须。",oEN="Bring Stormpike's Request to Furen Longbeard in Stormwind.",p="从洛克莫丹那边带来的信？不知道会是谁找我……\n\n请让我看看是怎样的订单吧。",pEN="A letter from the dwarven lands? I wonder who would call from so far to the north...\n\nPlease, let me see the order.",c="哦，是雷矛氏族的成员下的订单啊，那可是一个令人骄傲的氏族，有许多精干的矮人都是那个氏族出来的，而且他们还都是有钱人。\n\n谢谢你，$n。天快黑的时候我就可以开始帮巡山人雷矛打造盾牌了。",cEN="Ah, a request from one of the Stormpikes. That's a proud clan, full of quality dwarves. Rich ones, too.\n\nThank you, <name>. I'll get to work on Mountaineer Stormpike's shield by the end of the day."}
Q[1339]={d="我听说巡山人卡尔·雷矛正在找一个为他跑腿的人。你看怎么样，要去试试看吗？\n\n如果愿意的话，你就去北边的哨塔找他吧。",dEN="I hear Mountaineer Stormpike is looking for a runner. Someone to do a little traveling for him. How about it? Are you the <race> for the job?\n\nIf so, then you'll find Stormpike at the top of the northern guard tower.",o="和巡山人卡尔·雷矛谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mountaineer Stormpike.",c="没错，我有个任务，会让你远离洛克莫丹。\n\n你的又一次冒险机会来了！",cEN="That's right. I have a task that I can't do while I'm guarding. In fact, it'll take you far from Loch Modan.\n\nYour perfect chance for adventure!"}
Q[1340]={d="瞧瞧他……在那儿坐了几个钟头，盯着水面，好像水欠他钱似的。一次咬钩都没有。\n\n我又累又饿，而他还倔得不肯承认鱼根本不上他的钩。\n\n你觉得你能教教他该怎么做吗？给我带几条新鲜的洛克疯狂鱼排回来，我保证不让你白跑一趟。",dEN="Would ye look at him… been sittin’ there for hours, starin’ at the water like it owes him coin. Not a single bite.\n\nI’m tired and famished, and he’s too stubborn to admit the fish aren’t bitin’ for him.\n\nThink ye can show him how it’s done? Bring me a few fresh Loch Frenzy Fillets, and I’ll see it’s worth yer trouble.",o="在洛克莫丹从洛克疯狂鱼身上收集 6 份疯狂鱼排，然后回到卡拉·深掘处。",oEN="Collect 6 Frenzy Fillets from Loch Frenzies in Loch Modan and return to Kara Deepdelve.",p="你拿到疯狂鱼排了吗？越新鲜越好，<name>。",pEN="Do you have the Frenzy Fillets? Fresh is best, <name>.",c="这就是我要的那种光泽！这些鱼排能让巡逻队撑住。这是你那份，你应得的。",cEN="That's the shine I was after! These fillets will keep the patrol on their feet. Here's your share, you earned it."}
Q[1342]={d="出大事了，一场彻底的、灾难性的、把车轴都压断的大灾难！\n\n最后一批炸药不幸掉进了湖里，那可是一大笔钱……\n\n你能潜下去帮我捞一些上来吗？",dEN="Disaster has struck utter, catastrophic, axle-snapping disaster!\n\nThe last shipment of dynamite took a most unfortunate dive into the loch, and they cost a pretty penny...\n\nThink you could swim down and dig some up for me?",o="克林克需要从湖底残骸中打捞上来的新鲜炸药外壳。找回 10 个外壳带回来。",oEN="Crink needs fresh dynamite casings pulled from the lake wreckage. Salvage 10 casings and bring them back.",p="你捞上来那些外壳了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to dig up any of those casings?",c="太棒了！\n\n这些看起来还没怎么泡透……你可真是救命恩人，我的朋友！",cEN="Wonderful!\n\nThese don't seem too waterlogged...you're a life savor my friend!"}
Q[1343]={d="呸！这该死的肉！\n\n我从来就不是干屠夫这行的料。内森德农场本该是我的，可它在战争中丢了，还被豺狼人占了。\n\n现在卫兵们都忙着对付部落，没空帮我夺回来。如果你愿意，借我一份力量，帮我拿回属于我的东西。",dEN="Bah! This blasted meat!\n\nI was never meant for a butcher’s work. Nethander Farm is mine by right, but it was lost in the war and overrun by gnolls.\n\nNow the guards are too busy with the Horde to help me reclaim it. If you’re willing, lend me your strength and help me take back what is mine.",o="在内森德农庄杀死 8 只泥鼻豺狼人和 5 名泥鼻萨满。",oEN="Kill 8 Mudsnout Gnolls and 5 Mudsnout Shamans at The Nethander Stead.",p="农场清干净了吗？",pEN="Is the farm clear yet?",c="干得好，朋友。\n\n也许现在我能回去干正事，把农场重新整顿好了。\n\n收下这个，聊表谢意。要是那些豺狼人再敢摸上我的地，我准知道该找谁。",cEN="Well done, friend.\n\nMaybe now I can get back to proper work and set my farm right again.\n\nTake this with my thanks. And if those gnolls come creeping back onto my land, I’ll know exactly who to send for."}
Q[1344]={d="通往腹地的路满是危险，但大多数危险我自己还应付得来。野兽、人类，都不难躲开，也不难杀掉。\n\n可荒野里还满是狮鹫，那怪物有狮子的力气和老鹰的速度。它们俯冲下来，还没等你反抗就把你撕成碎片！\n\n我想说的是，谁要是替我把它们从荒野里清干净，我愿意付钱。",dEN="De path to Hinterlands be full of dangers, but most be dangers I can face on my own. Beasts, humans, dey ain't hard to avoid, or slay.\n\nBut de wilds also be full of gryphons, monsters with de strength of lions and de swiftness of eagles. Dey swoop down and rip ya apart before ya can fight back!\n\nWhat I be tryin' to say is, I'm ready to pay anyone who clears the wilds of them.",o="杀死 5 只野生狮鹫，以及库德罗斯和格拉尼斯塔德，它们守卫着敦霍尔德城堡之后通往腹地的山口。",oEN="Kill 5 Wild Gryphons, Kurdros, and Granistad who guard the pass to the Hinterlands behind Durnholde Keep.",p="你最好别让自己丢了命，mon。我见过太多人低估狮鹫了。他们现在都死了。",pEN="Ya best not get yourself killed, mon. Seen too many underestimate gryphons. Dey all be dead now.",c="你可比我胆大，mon。狮鹫没了，我终于能出发去腹地了。\n\n我打算去跟那里的兄弟们会面，看看我们暗矛能不能跟枯木巨魔谈成个协议。\n\n我们巨魔早该开始合作了……尤其是对付那种野兽的时候。",cEN="You be a braver sort den I, mon. With the gryphons gone, I can finally set out for Hinterlands.\n\nI be plannin' on meeting with our brothas up dere, seein' if maybe us Darkspear can make an agreement with the Witherbark.\n\nIt's past time us trolls started workin' together... especially if it be against beasts like that."}
Q[1345]={d="我母亲让你带我回家，是吗？我真希望能让她宽心，可我不能丢下朱丽叶。她变了，但她并没有离开我。\n\n在天灾军团夺走她之前，她最爱春天的田野。我们会在西海岸走上几个钟头，采摘野生的塔伦贝尔花，直到太阳沉到山丘之后。\n\n如果她身上还残留着那个女人的一星半点，也许那些花能唤醒它。给我带一些来，<name>。求你了。",dEN="My mother asked you to bring me home, didn't she? I wish I could ease her heart, but I cannot leave Juliette behind. She is changed but she is not gone from me.\n\nBefore the Scourge took her, she loved the spring fields. We would walk the Western Strand for hours, gathering wild Tarrenbell flowers until the sun slipped behind the hills.\n\nIf any part of the woman she was remains, perhaps those flowers will stir it. Bring me some, <name>. Please.",o="在西海岸附近为罗梅诺·利文斯顿收集 8 朵塔伦贝尔花。",oEN="Collect 8 Tarrenbell flowers for Romeno Livingston near the Western Strand.",p="你找到朱丽叶深爱的塔伦贝尔花了吗？",pEN="Were you able to find the Tarrenbell flowers Juliette loved?",c="谢谢你，<name>。这些正是她当年最爱的花，尽管我担心即便是春天本身也无法唤醒天灾军团从她身上夺走的东西。\n\n但我还是得试一试。如果朱丽叶身上还有哪一部分记得西海岸、记得我们在落日下散步、记得她曾戴在发间的那些花，也许这些花能触及她。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. These are the very flowers she loved though I fear even spring itself may not stir what the Scourge has taken from her.\n\nStill, I must try. If there is any part of Juliette that remembers the Western Strand, our walks beneath the fading sun, or the flowers she once wore in her hair perhaps these will reach her"}
Q[1346]={d="求你了，旅行者，如果你的路通往内森德农庄，请去找我的儿子罗梅诺。自从战争把朱丽叶从他身边夺走，他就一心只想着去陪她。\n\n母亲的话再也传不到他心里了。告诉他我还在这里，告诉他悲伤不必成为他要爬进去的坟墓，<name>。",dEN="Please, traveler, if your road takes you toward Nethander Stead, look for my son, Romeno. Since the war took Juliette from him, he has become desperate to be with her.\n\nNo mother's words can reach him anymore. Tell him that I am still here, and that grief need not be a grave he climbs into, <name>.",o="与内森德农庄附近的罗梅诺·利文斯顿交谈。",oEN="Speak with Romeno Livingston near Nethander Stead.",p="是我母亲派你来的？过了这么久她还在担心……",pEN="My mother sent you? She still worries after all this time...",c="母亲操心太多了……不过也许她是对的。我知道她想让我离开，但我不能抛下朱丽叶。也许……有什么你能做的事。",cEN="Mother worries too much... but perhaps she has reason. I know she wants me to leave, but I cannot abandon Juliette. Perhaps... there is something you can do."}
Q[1347]={d="这实在让人受不了。\n\n我点吃的只是为了躲开这股味道，你知道那个可恶的店主给我端来了什么吗？一种叫\"神秘肉\"的东西。臭死了……！我发誓它准是从地底下爬出来的！\n\n我再也受不了了。求你了，我快饿死了。你能找点新鲜的东西给我们吃吗？什么都行，只要不是从特别恶心的地方来的。也许北边有；我听说奥特兰克还有真正的人类，一个亡灵都看不见。",dEN="This is unbearable.\n\nI tried ordering food just to escape the smell, and do you know what that wretched innkeeper brought me? Some kind of “mystery meat.” It reeked...! I swear it must have clawed its way up from the ground!\n\nI can’t take this anymore. Please, I’m starving. Could you find something fresh for us to eat? Anything from a place that isn’t utterly revolting. Maybe up there's something up north, I’ve heard there are actual humans in Alterac, and not an undead in sight.",o="从奥特兰克山脉丹德雷德农场周围的大桶中收集 8 条鲜鱼。",oEN="Collect 8 Fresh Fish from the barrels around Dandred's Fold in Alterac Mountains.",p="活人那里的食物，肯定比死人那里的强。",pEN="Food from an alive human is most certainly better than food from a dead one.",c="哦……\n\n<萨丽莎皱起鼻子。>\n\n还是……生的……还黏糊糊的。真恶心。",cEN="Oh...\n\n<Sarisa wrinkles her nose.>\n\nIt's still...raw... and slimy. Ew."}
Q[1349]={d="呃……你把这东西带进来的时候在想什么！？现在整间屋子都是一股尸体和恶心鱼腥混在一起的味道！\n\n这实在让人受不了……你必须解决。现在。\n\n把那臭鱼拿出去，让西蕾妮娅去煮。反正她除了站在塔里等大法师回来、听着那些怪叫之外也没别的事可做。\n\n至少……这屋里……安静。",dEN="Ew… what were you thinking, bringing that in here!? Now the whole room smells like a mix of dead body and disgusting fish!\n\nThis is unbearable... You have to fix it. NOW.\n\nTake that stinking fish outside and have Cirenia cook it. It’s not like she has anything better to do than stand around the tower, listening to those strange shrieks while she waits for the Magister to return.\n\nAt least… in here… it’s quiet.",o="把那一包鲜鱼交给塔伦米尔的西蕾妮娅·菲尼克斯菲尔。",oEN="Deliver the bundle of fresh fish to Cirenia Phoenixfell in Tarren Mill.",p="嗯，什么事？我正好需要点事分分心……",pEN="Yes, what is it? I could use a distraction...",c="他们说什么？\n\n哦，看在太阳之井的份上……我发誓，我离把那两个蠢货每一件贵得离谱的长袍都点着只差一口气了……！\n\n\"我没别的事可做\"？没别的事可做？他们是彻底疯了，还是就傲慢得如此登峰造极？\n\n真是好胆量。好一副十足惊人、令人瞠目的胆量。",cEN="They said what?\n\nOh, for the love of the Sunwell… I swear, I am one breath away from setting fire to every last overpriced robe those two imbeciles own...!\n\n“I have nothing better to do”? Nothing better to do? Are they completely out of their minds, or just that spectacularly arrogant?\n\nThe nerve. The sheer, staggering nerve of it."}
Q[1350]={d="我知道那两人待在这里，只是因为\"亲爱的老妈\"——大使祭司永恒哀伤——不忍心把两个无能的女儿留在家里，怕她们把她的宅邸烧成灰烬。\n\n可她们就只会惹麻烦！\n\n我们是这里的客人，虽然这算不上……理想的处境，但被遗忘者终究是人。他们已经尽力为我们提供方便。\n\n那么，我们来给他们上一课如何？\n\n如果我用魔法动什么手脚，恐怕他们立刻就会发现。看看你能不能在这儿附近找到某种更……自然的火。能直接把那些侮辱从他们嘴里烧掉的东西……然后，拜托，找个真正的厨师来把活干完。",dEN="I know those two are only here because “Mommy Dearest” the Ambassador Priestess Evermorne, couldn’t bear to leave her two incompetent daughters behind to burn her estate to the ground.\n\nBut they’ve been nothing but trouble!\n\nWe are guests here, and while it’s not… an ideal situation, the Forsaken are still people. They’ve gone out of their way to accommodate us.\n\nSo, what do you say we teach them a lesson?\n\nIf I tried anything funny with my magic I fear they'd realize it instantly. See if you can find some fire that's more... naturally occurring around here. Something that could burn the insults straight out of their mouths... and then please, find an ACTUAL cook to finish the job.",o="在阿拉希高地从燃烧的流放者身上收集 8 个炽热火花。",oEN="Gather 8 Fiery Sparks from Burning Exiles in Arathi Highlands.",p="我最近看见你在城里跑来跑去，不知道你对新鲜牛肉有没有兴趣？",pEN="I've seen you running around town a bit now, I don't suppose I could interest you in some fresh beef now could I?",c="<德拉克一眨不眨地听着。>\n\n我明白了……好吧，我非常乐意帮忙。我的学徒们总是需要额外的练习，他们多爱玩火啊。\n\n话虽如此，我相信我们能为你量身定做合适的东西。虽然我很想参与你这场小小的复仇，但我宁可避免引发一场……事端。\n\n我们就说这东西是你那位精灵朋友准备的，行吗？",cEN="<Derak listens, unblinking.>\n\nI see… well, I would be more than happy to assist. My apprentices could always use the extra practice, how they do love to play with fire.\n\nThat said, I’m sure we can devise something suited to your needs. As much as I might enjoy taking part in your little revenge, I would rather avoid causing an… incident.\n\nLet us simply say your elven friend had this prepared, yes?"}
Q[1353]={d="生者不会接纳我们，<name>。他们只记得我们曾经是什么，畏惧我们如今变成了什么。\n\n然而，朱丽叶·利文斯顿仍徘徊在塔伦米尔外的小河边，绕着一个她生前所爱之人的回忆打转。我并不因此责备她。记忆是我们仅剩的少数怜悯之一。\n\n但怜悯也会变成锁链。如果她抓得太紧，生者可能会用钢铁、火焰或更糟的东西来回应。她现在是弃誓者了，无论她的心是否接受。\n\n去找她。跟她谈谈。帮她明白，她曾经是什么，保护不了她如今是什么。",dEN="The living will not accept us, <name>. They remember only what we were, and fear what we have become.\n\nYet Juliette Livingston still lingers by the river outside Tarren Mill, circling the memory of a man she loved in life. I do not condemn her for it. Memory is one of the few mercies left to us.\n\nBut mercy can become a chain. If she clings too tightly to the living, they may answer with steel, fire, or worse. She is Forsaken now, whether her heart accepts it or not.\n\nGo to her. Speak with her. Help her understand that what she was cannot shelter her from what she is",o="与内森德农庄的朱丽叶·利文斯顿交谈。",oEN="Speak with Juliette Livingston at the Nethander Stead.",p="罗梅诺……你见过他了，是吗？他还在田野附近等着吗？",pEN="Romeno... you have seen him, haven't you? Does he still wait near the fields?",c="我清楚地记得他。河水安静时，他的声音就传到我耳边。每一道阴影里都有他的面容等着我。死亡带走了许多，却没把他从我身边带走。\n\n他们告诉我，渴望让我们变得软弱。可如果我们不是我们所拒绝放下的东西，又是什么呢？\n\n罗梅诺还在这里。我知道他还在。只要他能看着我，记起来，真正地记起来，那么也许这死后的生命仍能容下某种美好的东西。",cEN="I remember him clearly. His voice comes to me when the river is quiet. His face waits for me in every shadow. Death has taken much, but it has not taken him from me.\n\nThey tell me that longing makes us weak. But what are we, if not what we refuse to surrender?\n\nRomeno is still here. I know he is. If he could only look at me and remember, truly remember, then perhaps this life after death could still hold something beautiful."}
Q[1354]={d="<牧师一边施放另一个治疗法术，一边疼得皱眉。>\n\n圣光仍回应我们中的少数人，但这不是没有代价的……圣光会撕裂亡灵，而我们也在其中……我也在其中。\n\n我不知道自己还能这样撑多久。很多事本来用基础医疗物资就能解决，可我们早已用光了。\n\n我相信辛迪加手头还有一些，如果你愿意替我们夺回来的话。",dEN="<The cleric winces in pain as she casts another healing spell.>\n\nThe light still responds to a few of us, but it's not without it's costs...the light tears apart undead, and that includes us...includes me.\n\nI don't know how much longer I can keep going like this for. A lot of this could probably be done by basic medical supplies, but we've been out of those for a while.\n\nI'm sure the Syndicate has some, if you'd be willing to recover them for us.",o="从斯坦恩布莱德的辛迪加补给箱中收集 3 个急救包。",oEN="Collect 3 First Aid Kits from Syndicate Supply Crates in Strahnbrad.",p="这些人为了爬到地面，把身体损伤得太厉害了……我自己也一样。",pEN="These people have damaged too much of their bodies trying to get out to the surface... not to mention myself.",c="谢谢你。天灾军团的影响蔓延到塔伦米尔地下，把许多早已入土的人复活了。我们太久都没有察觉……\n\n我不介意借助圣光来安抚他们。他们受的苦远比我多，但如果我不必为每一次逃跑尝试造成的伤口和断骨费心，就能更容易真正帮助到所有人。",cEN="Thank you. The Scourge's influence swept beneath Tarren Mill and raised many who were already buried. We did not realize for too long...\n\nI do not mind drawing upon the light to soothe them. They have still suffered far more than I, but if I don't need to tend every cut and broken bone from their attempts to escape, it will be a lot easier to actually help all of them."}
Q[1355]={d="我以为塔伦贝尔花能唤醒我认识的那个女人，但它们只是让真相更难否认。朱丽叶还在那里，困在悲伤之后，而她在这些田野间游荡的每一天，都是她的记忆被亵渎的一天。\n\n我无法对她举起手。我太爱她了，做不到。但我也不能让她这样受苦。\n\n求你了，<name>……给朱丽叶一个我无法给出的告别。",dEN="I thought the Tarrenbell's might stir the woman I knew, but they only made the truth harder to deny. Juliette is still there, trapped behind grief, and every day she wanders these fields is another day her memory is profaned.\n\nI cannot raise my hand against her. I loved her too much for that. But I cannot let her suffer like this either.\n\nPlease, <name>... give Juliette the farewell I cannot.",o="杀死朱丽叶·利文斯顿，然后与罗梅诺·利文斯顿交谈。",oEN="Kill Juliette Livingston, then speak to Romeno Livingston.",p="结束了吗？她的痛苦结束了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Has her suffering ended?",c="那么，结束了。朱丽叶，我最亲爱的，原谅我。我告诉自己这是在让你解脱。告诉自己死亡会是一种慈悲。\n\n可我是个懦夫。我派了另一双手去做我的手做不到的事。我让你独自死去，而我自己躲在悲伤后面，还把它叫做爱。\n\n我回不了那间空屋子。如果这个破碎的世界还剩下慈悲，就让它是这样吧：无论你去了哪里，愿我能在那里找到你，乞求你的原谅。\n\n等着我，我的爱人。\n\n这一次我不害怕了。",cEN="So, it is done. Juliette, my dearest heart, forgive me. I told myself I was sparing you. That death would be mercy.\n\nBut I was a coward. I sent another hand to do what mine could not. I asked you to die alone while I hid behind grief and called it love.\n\nI cannot return to that empty house. If there is mercy left in this broken world, let it be this: wherever you have gone, may I find you there and beg for your forgiveness.\n\nWait for me, my love.\n\nI am not afraid this time."}
Q[1356]={d="那些花不只是好意，<name>。有那么一瞬间，我想起了朱丽叶本来的样子，也找回了以为早已失去的话语。\n\n我给她写了一封信。我不知道我所爱之人是否还能听见我，但我需要这些话传到她那里。\n\n把这封信带到此地向东北的洞穴，留在那里给朱丽叶。",dEN="The flowers were more than a kindness, <name>. For a moment, I remembered Juliette as she was, and I found words I thought were lost to me.\n\nI have written her a letter. I do not know if anything of the woman I loved can still hear me, but I need these words to reach her.\n\nTake this letter to the cave north east of here and leave it there for Juliette.",o="把罗梅诺的信送到隐蔽的洞穴。",oEN="Deliver Romeno's Letter to the hidden cave.",p="你把罗梅诺的信带来留给朱丽叶了吗？",pEN="Have you brought Romeno's letter to leave for Juliette?",c="你把罗梅诺的信放在祭坛上。无论朱丽叶还剩下什么，这些话如今都在她能找到的地方了。",cEN="You place Romeno's letter at the altar. Whatever remains of Juliette, the words are now where she may find them."}
Q[1357]={d="死人送不出什么像样的礼物，<name>。我们没有体温，也没有值得回去的家。\n\n即便如此，罗梅诺也该收到点什么。不为安慰他，也不为安慰我。只是作为过去并未被彻底吞噬的证据。\n\n阿祖雷矿坑曾出产过纯净异常的银。给我带足够打造一枚护符的银来。如果安宁已非我所能及，那就让纪念来顶替吧。",dEN="The dead make poor gift givers, <name>. We have no warmth, and no home worth returning to.\n\nEven so, Romeno should receive something. Not for his comfort. Not for mine. Merely as evidence that the past has not been entirely consumed.\n\nAzurelode Mine once produced silver of rare clarity. Bring me enough to make a charm. If peace is beyond my reach, remembrance will serve.",o="从阿祖雷矿坑收集 10 块阿祖雷银矿石，然后回到朱丽叶·利文斯顿那里。",oEN="Collect 10 pieces of Azurelode Silver from the Azurelode Mines, then return to Juliette Livingston.",p="你找到合适的银了吗？我可不会随便给他寄块破铜烂铁。",pEN="Have you found suitable silver? I would send him no common scrap.",c="在锈迹之下这是件好活计。够用了。\n\n他过去常为简单的小事微笑。我祈祷这一点没有改变。很奇怪，不是吗？在死亡夺走了那么多之后，我发现自己还是像傻姑娘一样抱着希望。",cEN="This is fine work beneath the tarnish. It will serve.\n\nHe used to smile at simple things. I pray that has not changed. Strange, is it not? After all that death has taken, I still find myself hoping like a foolish girl."}
Q[1358]={d="我有一位名叫赫布瑞姆的药剂师同事目前正在卡利姆多大陆工作。他正在研究洛丹伦大陆上的毒物在卡利姆多大陆生物身上所造成的影响。为了帮赫布瑞姆的忙，我收集了提瑞斯法和银松森林一带各种蜘蛛的蛛毒，现在需要找人帮我把这些毒液给他带去。\n\n他就在贫瘠之地的一处名为十字路口的镇子上。要找到他，你必须先搭飞艇到兽人的首都奥格瑞玛去，然后步行向南去杜隆塔尔，最后向西进入贫瘠之地，这样很快就可以到达十字路口了。",dEN="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me.\n\nHelbrim is stationed in the Barrens, in a village known as the Crossroads. To reach him, you must travel via zeppelin to the orc capital of Orgrimmar, then travel south, by foot, to Durotar. Head west into the Barrens, and you will soon reach the Crossroads.",o="把一箱蜘蛛毒带给贫瘠之地的药剂师赫布瑞姆。",oEN="Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",p="你有个包裹要给我？",pEN="You have a package for me?",c="啊，太好啦。如果起初的那些报告是正确的话，那么这些从心脏里提取的毒液，就能让我对于毒素的知识更进一步。\n\n你来得非常好，$n。这是给你的报酬。",cEN="Ah, very good. If initial reports are true, then the toxicity of these hearts could lead to further advances in our knowledge of poisons.\n\nThis is a welcome delivery, <name>. Your reward is well earned."}
Q[1359]={d="你拿来我的狼心具有与众不同的特质。从中提炼出的特殊毒素甚至可以毒死长着这种心脏的狼！\n\n这让我感到非常惊讶，所以我们必须对此进行深入的研究。把这几份心脏样本送到我的同事药剂师金格那里。你应该可以在幽暗城的炼金房里找到她。",dEN="The wolf hearts you acquired possess a quality unseen in similar specimens. There is a toxicity to them that should be deadly to the very wolves in which the hearts beat!\n\nIt's quite incredible, and we must study it further. I kept a few samples of the hearts acquired. Take them to my colleague, Apothecary Zinge. You will find her in our headquarters in the Undercity.",o="将狼心样本交给幽暗城的药剂师金格。",oEN="Bring the Wolf Heart Samples to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You have something for me?",c="啊，原来是伦弗利尔提到的心脏样品。我真是等不及用它们来进行实验了……皇家药剂师协会对于新型毒药永远都是充满兴趣的。",cEN="Ah yes, the heart samples of which Renferrel spoke. I am eager to experiment with these... it is always of interest to the Royal Apothecary Society when new forms of toxins are discovered."}
Q[1360]={d="我本来有个不错的工作，就是在荒芜之地的奥达曼挖掘场干活……直到那些该死的穴居人出现之后。我险些就没能活着跑出来，而且还什么也没来得及拿。在一片慌乱之中，我弄丢了我最重要的财产。我那箱子很难撬开是没错，不过你知道么，那里满地都是穴居人！\n\n你去帮我拿回箱子来，我就好好谢你！那个写着我名字的箱子就在北部大厅的尽头，你得一路杀进去才行。",dEN="I had myself a fine job as a digger at the Uldaman excavation site in the Badlands... that is until those blasted troggs showed up. I escaped with my hide barely intact, and nothing else. In the chaos, I left my most treasured possession. It's safe from the troggs in my chest, sure, but it's right in the thick of 'em.\n\nI'd be in your debt, both in honor and coin, if you could fetch it for me! A chest with my name on it is at the end of the North Common Hall. That's the one you need to get in.",o="到奥达曼的北部大厅去找到克罗姆·粗臂的箱子，从里面拿出他的宝贵财产，然后回到铁炉堡把东西交给他。",oEN="Get Krom Stoutarm's treasured possession from his chest in the North Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in Ironforge.",p="好吧，你有没有去和那帮穴居人杀个天昏地暗，有没有找到我的箱子，有没有拿到我的宝贝？",pEN="Well now, we're you able to get slap around those troggs long enough to get into my chest and nab my treasure?",c="哦，终于找回我的东西了……谢谢你。\n\n有些矮人可能喜欢亮闪闪的金属或是华丽的宝石……不过没有这只杯子，我就什么都没有啦！",cEN="Ah, I feel complete again - thank you kindly.\n\nSome dwarves may treasure the luster of metal, and some may treasure the glint of gems... but a Stoutarm without a treasured stein in hand is hardly a Stoutarm at all!"}
Q[1361]={d="有一个名叫雷戈萨·死门的部落战士正在招募愿意前往凄凉之地执行任务的人。如果你愿意的话，就去和他谈谈吧。雷戈萨·死门就在贫瘠之地的十字路口西边的工事中。\n\n准备好你的武器，凄凉之地是一片危机四伏的土地。",dEN="A warrior of the Horde, Regthar Deathgate, is recruiting agents for a mission into the land of Desolace. Speak with him if you wish to volunteer. He is stationed in the Barrens, in a series of bunkers west of the Crossroads.\n\nAnd sharpen your weapons. Desolace is a place torn by war.",o="和雷戈萨·死门谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Regthar Deathgate in the Barrens.",p="我发现你的活儿没干完啊，$n。难道要我告诉Sharlindra你很蠢吗？",pEN="I note that your task is unfinished, <name>. Shall I inform Sharlindra of your ineptitude?",c="对，我正在招募新兵。这次的任务是深入到凄凉之地，与那里的半人马部族作战。我会简单地交待任务内容，然后你就要尽快出发了。",cEN="Yes, I am recruiting. This mission leads into Desolace, against the centaur there. I will be brief so that you may quickly begin."}
Q[1362]={d="科卡尔半人马居住在凄凉之地，但他们的势力已经渗透到了贫瘠之地。这是事实，我们已经派了斥候去时刻监视着他们。\n\n只要凄凉之地的半人马依然足够强大，对我们而言，他们就是个威胁，我们应该主动出击清除这个威胁。\n\n去和凄凉之地幽灵岗哨的费古尔·双刃谈谈，他也是被派去收集有关半人马的情报的，他会知道该如何对付凄凉之地的科卡尔部族的。",dEN="The Kolkar centaur live in Desolace, and their forces have spread into the Barrens. This is a known fact and we have Horde agents dealing with them here.\n\nBut as long as the centaur are strong in Desolace, they will always pose a threat. It is time we rid ourselves of that threat.\n\nSpeak with Felgur Twocuts at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace. He was sent to gather intelligence on the centaur. He will know how to best deal with the Kolkar of Desolace.",o="和凄凉之地幽灵岗哨的费古尔·双刃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Felgur Twocuts at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace.",c="是雷格萨派你来的？那你是来猎杀半人马的了。很好。\n\n我希望你$g休息好了:休息好了;。我不知道我们对抗半人马的战役会如何收场，但我知道这场斗争会很漫长。\n\n坐下听我说。",cEN="You are here on orders from Regthar? Then you are here to deal with the centaur. Good.\n\nI hope you're rested. I don't know how our campaign against the centaur will end, but I know the struggle will be long.\n\nHave a seat, and listen."}
Q[1363]={d="我负责照管这里、奥法艺术与科学学院图书馆的藏书，确保所有魔法典籍和卷轴时刻都有登记在册是我的职责。谁知道这些附魔典籍落入坏人手中会引发什么祸事？\n\n说到这个……我的助手戴利斯上周犯了个可怕的错误。他在图书馆里相当能干，可一出暴风城的大门就笨手笨脚。做个$g英雄:英雄;，帮帮老戴利斯，好吗？",dEN="As caretaker of the works here in the library of the Academy of Arcane Arts and Sciences, it is my responsibility to ensure all the magical tomes and scrolls are accounted for at all times. Who knows what folly would unfold if some of these enchanted texts were to fall into the wrong hands?\n\nWhich reminds me... my assistant, Dellis, made a horrible mistake last week. He's quite able in the library but incompetent when he leaves the gates of Stormwind. Be a hero, and help old Dellis out, would you?",o="与暴风城里的助手迪利斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind.",c="这不是我的错，真的，不是我的错。",cEN="It wasn't my fault. Really it wasn't."}
Q[1364]={d="马森大人的指示再简单不过了：将这篇重要的文章递交给守望堡的看守者马哈尔巴。\n\n但我从来没有去过死亡之地！这段路程太可怕了！\n\n我在悲伤沼泽那边迷了路，被一大群像是植物一样的沼泽生物给包围了。它们在我身边徘徊着，似乎是想要攻击我，所以我就飞也似的逃了回来……结果我在慌乱中把文章给弄丢了。我敢肯定是有只怪物把它给捡跑了。\n\n你能帮我找回文章并把它送给马哈尔巴吗？",dEN="Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep.\n\nBut I had never been to the Blasted Lands before! The journey was frightening!\n\nWhen I got to the Swamp of Sorrows, I made a wrong turn and ended up surrounded by horrible plant-like swamp creatures. They lurched as if to attack me so I ran. But in my haste I dropped the essay. One of the beasts took it I am sure.\n\nCould you please try to retrieve it and deliver it to Mahar Ba?",o="夺回《卡德加的空间收敛研究笔记》，将它送给守望堡的看守者马哈尔巴。",oEN="Retrieve Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence and deliver them to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep.",p="来守望堡有什么事吗，$r？",pEN="What brings you to Nethergarde Keep, <race>?",c="啊，好极了！\n\n之前我还害怕学院的马森大人把我借阅《卡德加的空间收敛研究笔记》的请求给忘了。\n\n他一定是因为每天都要处理太多奇怪的事才没能马上回复我吧。\n\n现在，如果你没什么事了的话，我想马上开始阅读这本书。能读到伟大的卡德加的作品实在是让我兴奋极了！",cEN="Ah, most splendid!\n\nFor some time I had feared my request for Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence had been overlooked by Master Mazen of the Academy of Arcane Arts and Sciences.\n\nHe must be bogged down with requests considering the many strange happenings going on.\n\nNow, if you'll excuse me, I need to begin my research at once. To finally glimpse the insight of one as great as Khadgar excites me to no end."}
Q[1365]={d="科卡尔并不是凄凉之地唯一的半人马部族。许多半人马部族都游弋在这片干燥的平原上，他们相互残杀，纷争不断。他们的窝里斗对我们来说不是件坏事，因为半人马强壮而且残忍，如果这些半人马联合起来对付我们的话，那将是极其可怕的力量。\n\n在他们联合起来之前，我们必须将他们各个击破。\n\n你的第一个任务是让科卡尔部族出现内乱，只要干掉他们的首领戴兹帕可汗就可以了。\n\n科卡尔村就在东北方。去吧，祝你好运。",dEN="The Kolkar are not the only centaur of Desolace. Many clans wander these dry plains, fighting and dying against each other. And it is good that they fight among themselves, for they are strong and brutal. If the centaur united against us, they would be a fierce foe.\n\nWe must deal with them before they unite.\n\nYour first task is to disrupt the Kolkar clan. Do this by killing its leader, Khan Dez'hepah.\n\nThe Kolkar Village is northeast of here. Go, and may fortune go with you.",o="把戴兹帕可汗的头颅交给凄凉之地的费古尔·双刃。",oEN="Bring Khan Dez'hepah's Head to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace.",p="$n，你杀死戴兹帕可汗了吗？",pEN="<name>, have you defeated Khan Dez'hepah?",c="干得不错。你行动迅速地干掉了科卡尔氏族的首领，这充分地展示了我们的力量，而强大的力量则是半人马最畏惧的。\n\n科卡尔氏族首领的死不仅会让他们出现内乱，也会让其它的氏族暂时收敛一些。",cEN="Well done. This swift act against the Kolkar is an effective show of strength, and strength is what the centaur understand best.\n\nThe death of the Kolkar leader will not only disrupt that clan, but give pause to the others."}
Q[1366]={d="既然你已经震慑了半人马部族，那么现在该让他们出点血了。开始在凄凉之地猎杀半人马吧，我不关心你去猎杀哪一个部族，收集半人马耳朵就是了。\n\n减少他们的数量也就等于削弱他们的野心，打消他们不断扩张的念头。\n\n祝你狩猎愉快，$n。",dEN="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears. A hoard of ears.\n\nBy weakening their numbers you will weaken their resolve, and stamp out any thoughts of expansion.\n\nGood hunting, <name>.",o="收集15只半人马的耳朵，把它们交给凄凉之地的费古尔·双刃。",oEN="Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Felgur Twocuts in Desolace.",p="你收集了多少半人马的耳朵啦，$n？",pEN="How is your collection of ears, <name>? Large?",c="现在，半人马们一定都知道你的名字了，他们会知道这个名字，尊敬这个名字，同时对这个名字感到非常畏惧。当他们知道你，他们就会知道你所代表的力量。\n\n部落的力量。",cEN="By now, the centaur must know your name. I'm sure they know it, and respect it, and fear it. And just as they know you, they know the banner under which you ride.\n\nThe banner of the Horde."}
Q[1367]={d="要想打败半人马，我们就必须让他们自相残杀。首先我们要笼络一支半人马部族，利用它们打败所有的半人马。\n\n如果你准备和玛格拉姆部族结盟，那么就去杀掉他们的敌人——吉尔吉斯部族的半人马，这会使你在玛格拉姆部族中赢得尊重。当你得到足够的尊重之后，就可以去会见玛格拉姆部族的首领瓦鲁格，他就在凄凉之地东南部的玛格拉姆村外。",dEN="To beat the centaur, we must use their hatred against them. We will ally with one of the clans and through them, we will learn how to defeat all the clans.\n\nIf you choose to ally with the Magram then slay their foes, the Gelkis. This will earn you respect among the Magram. When you earn enough, then meet with the Magram spokesman Warug, on the outskirts of the Magram Village, in southeast Desolace.",o="和玛格拉姆部族建立良好的关系，然后和瓦鲁格谈一谈。",oEN="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Magram, then speak with Warug.",p="滚！玛格拉姆不和弱者交谈！我们只会杀了他们！\n\n如果你想和我谈话，就先让我看看你有多强大！去杀更多的吉尔吉斯人，然后再回来！",pEN="Leave! The Magram do not speak with the weak. We kill them!\n\nIf you want to speak with me, then show me you are strong. Return after you slay many Gelkis.",c="$n，吉尔吉斯族的半人马一听到你的名字就会大哭起来。他们害怕你，也讨厌你。他们讨厌你就像他们讨厌玛格拉姆人一样！\n\n也许你像玛格拉姆人一样强大，我们会知道的……",cEN="The Gelkis cry when they hear your name, <name>. They fear you and they hate you. They hate you like they hate the Magram!\n\nMaybe you are strong like the Magram. We will see..."}
Q[1368]={d="要想打败半人马，我们就必须以毒攻毒。我们要先笼络一支半人马部族，利用他们打败其他的半人马。\n\n如果你准备和吉尔吉斯结盟，那么就去攻击他们最憎恨的对手——玛格拉姆部族。在你赢得了吉尔吉斯部族足够的尊重以后，就可以去见他们的萨满祭司，智者乌泰克，他就住在凄凉之地西南的吉尔吉斯村外面。",dEN="To beat the centaur, we must use their hatred against them. We will ally with one of the clans and through them, we will learn how to defeat all the clans.\n\nIf you choose to ally with the Gelkis then slay their most hated rival, the Magram. After you earn the respect of the Gelkis, meet with the Gelkis shaman Uthek the Wise, on the outskirts of the Gelkis Village, in southwest Desolace.",o="和吉尔吉斯部族建立良好的关系，然后和智者乌泰克谈一谈。",oEN="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Gelkis, then speak with Uthek the Wise.",p="离吉尔吉斯人的土地远一点，这里不欢迎你！\n\n证明你对吉尔吉斯人的善意吧，去杀掉那些该死的玛格拉姆人。当你让玛格拉姆族血流成河的时候再回来吧！",pEN="Your two feet step on Gelkis earth. You are not welcome here!\n\nProve you seek friendship with the Gelkis. Kill Magram centaur. Return when the ground is wet with Magram blood.",c="大地向我低语。它告诉我你杀了许多玛格拉姆。这很好。\n\n如果你$g是格尔基斯的朋友:是格尔基斯的朋友;，那就听着。我还有两个任务交给你。",cEN="The earth speaks to me. And it says you have killed many Magram. This is good.\n\nIf you are a friend of the Gelkis, then listen. I have more tasks for you."}
Q[1369]={d="吉尔吉斯以为半人马之母瑟拉达丝在护佑着我们，他们都是蠢货！没有人在护佑半人马，玛格拉姆部族不需要护佑！我们是最强的！\n\n让吉尔吉斯半人马知道他们有多蠢——到他们村庄附近的洞穴里去一趟，他们把那种名叫瑟拉达丝之泪的水晶石藏在了洞里。毁掉那些水晶，把碎片交给我！",dEN="The Gelkis think our centaur mother, Theradras, protects us. They are stupid. No one protects the centaur. The Magram do not need protection! We are the strongest!\n\nShow the Gelkis they are stupid. Go to the cave in their village. They hoard crystals in that cave, the tears of Theradras. Destroy the tears and bring me the broken pieces!",o="继续和玛格拉姆部族保持良好的关系，把3块破碎之泪交给玛格拉姆村庄的瓦鲁格。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and bring 3 Broken Tears to Warug in the Magram Village.",p="如果你是我的朋友，就按照我的要求去做！",pEN="If you are not our enemy, then you will do what I ask!",c="你拿到了破碎之泪！现在吉尔吉斯半人马该知道瑟莱达丝不会帮助他们了。我们碾碎这些水晶的时候，她吭都不敢吭一声！玛格拉姆半人马注定要一统天下！\n\n你站在我们这边是个很明智的选择，$n，因为我们是最强大的！",cEN="You got the tears! Now the Gelkis will know that Theradras will not help them. She will not cry when we crush them! The Magram will rule!\n\nYou are smart to help us, <name>. We are the strongest."}
Q[1370]={d="在作战之余，我们为了食物而打猎。肉可以为我们补充力量，吃饱喝足之后作战会更加勇敢。\n\n玛格拉姆部族的半人马和我们一样，他们贮藏多余的肉食，这样他们就能进行更持久的战斗。如果你能去袭击他们在东部的村庄，并且偷走他们贮藏的肉，他们的力量就会衰竭。",dEN="When we are not at war, we hunt for meat. Meat gives us strength, and full bellies fight harder than empty ones.\n\nIt is the same with the Magram. They store extra meat so they may fight longer between hunts. If you raid their village to the east and take their stores of meat, then their strength will fail.",o="把6包粗制干肉交给吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",oEN="Bring 6 bags of Crudely Dried Meat to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",p="向吉尔吉斯半人马证明了你的价值以后再回来！",pEN="Return after you further prove your worth to the Gelkis!",c="很好。我在很远的地方就能听到玛格拉姆半人马的肚皮咕咕作响！\n\n我会把肉分给吉尔吉斯半人马，这样我们就可以连续作战很长时间了。\n\n你为吉尔吉斯半人马做了件好事，$n。",cEN="Good. I can hear the loud Magram bellies grumble from their village, far away!\n\nI will give this meat to the Gelkis. And we will fight for many days without rest.\n\nWhat you did is good for the Gelkis, <name>."}
Q[1371]={d="很久以前，有一个小侏儒来到凄凉之地。他是乘着马车来的，车上装着奇怪而有趣、燃烧后会放出五彩缤纷的焰火的东西，还有一些没有生命、但是居然可以自己移动的东西。我杀了这个小侏儒，不过在那之前……他让我乐坏了。\n\n我从他的马车上拿走了我最喜欢的东西，那是个木头做的人偶，在我把它砸得粉碎之前，它总是在那里向我招手。\n\n现在我想要一个新的，帮我弄一个来！",dEN="Long ago, a little gnome came to Desolace. He had horses and a cart, and the cart held strange things. Funny things. Things that burned different colors. Things that moved and weren't alive. I killed the little gnome, but before that... he made me laugh.\n\nI kept my favorite thing from his cart. It was a human made of wood and it waved at me until I hit it and broke it.\n\nI want a new one. Get me a new one!",o="继续和玛格拉姆部族保持良好的关系，给玛格拉姆村的瓦鲁格找到一个高级假人。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and bring an Advanced Target Dummy to Warug in the Magram Village in Desolace.",p="如果你是我的朋友，就按照我的要求去做！",pEN="If you are not our enemy, then you will do what I ask!",c="嗯！这就是我要的东西！我让它再动起来，它就能让我发笑！",cEN="Yes, this is what I had! I will make it move again. It makes me laugh!"}
Q[1372]={d="瓦里玛萨斯派遣我们这支远征军来对艾泽拉斯南部进行侦查。\n\n我偶然发现一个人类间谍在乞丐鬼屋附近探头探脑。我正准备暗中跟踪他，这个家伙就被一些…我们的兽人朋友抓去，押进了位于悲伤沼泽里的斯通纳德要塞。\n\n兽人们还不知道我们在这里安营扎寨，不过…我想去帮助他们，帮助我们的兽人盟友。\n\n去找法奥斯丁，让他给我们在斯通纳德的朋友制造一瓶真言药水……",dEN="Our expeditionary force was sent at Varimathras's behest to survey lower Azeroth.\n\nWhile out scouting I noticed a human Infiltrator spying on Beggar's Haunt. Before I could apprehend him, some of our orcish... brethren... captured him and took him to Stonard, their stronghold in Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nI want to... help... our orcish allies. They did not see our camp here but nonetheless I want to lend a hand.\n\nWork with Faustin here to develop a... truth serum for our friend in Stonard.",o="到乞丐鬼屋去和药剂师法奥斯丁谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Apothecary Faustin at Beggar's Haunt.",c="莱度斯刚刚还跟我提起过那个爱追根问底的人类探子。\n\n他确实是很麻烦，我们决不能让这么个爱管闲事的家伙在乞丐鬼屋周围到处探察。\n\n斯通纳德的兽人肯定很想知道我们这位探子朋友的脑袋瓜里藏着什么秘密。既然兽人是我们的同盟，咳咳，那么我们就得帮他们从这个人类间谍嘴里榨出些消息来。\n\n帮帮我吧，$n，让我们做出一瓶真言药水送到斯通纳德去。\n\n为了部落！\n\n……是这么说的吧？",cEN="Zraedus was just telling me about the nosey little Infiltrator before you arrived.\n\nQuite a problem, indeed. The last thing we need is a busybody sniffing around Beggar's Haunt.\n\nI am sure the orcs of Stonard would be quite anxious to hear what our friend has to say. Seeing that they are our allies, ahem, we must help them to get any information they can from the human.\n\nWork with me, <name>, and we will deliver a truth serum to Stonard.\n\nFor the Horde!\n\n...did I get that right?"}
Q[1373]={d="你还需要更多的行动来证明自己，我要你去很远的地方完成一个任务，所以从现在开始，吉尔吉斯部族就要独自和玛格拉姆部族作战了。\n\n大地把很多的秘密告诉了聆听它声音的人，我听到的秘密是关于一种红色水晶的。这种被称作德莱尼水晶的东西最近才出现在这片大陆上，它来自一个遥远的地方，那里的山脉在天空中悬浮，恶魔掌控着那里的一切。\n\n给我带一片德莱尼水晶碎片来，它能让我的魔法变得强大无比！这片德莱尼水晶碎片应该就在悲伤沼泽的失落者盎格库尔手里。",dEN="You have more to prove, and your next task will take you far, so for now the Gelkis will fight the Magram without you.\n\nThe earth whispers many secrets to those who listen. One secret I hear is of a red crystal. It is called draenethyst, and it is new to our earth. It comes from a place where mountains fly, and where demons rule.\n\nBring me a shard of draenethyst, and it will make my magic strong! The shard is in a place called the Swamp of Sorrows, held by the lost one Ongeku.",o="继续和吉尔吉斯部族保持良好的关系，并把德莱尼水晶碎片交给凄凉之地吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring a Draenethyst Shard to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village in Desolace.",p="向我证明你$g是格尔基斯的朋友:是格尔基斯的朋友;，$n。",pEN="Show me you are a friend of the Gelkis, <name>.",c="没错，这就是大地向我提及的水晶裂片，我可以感受它蕴含着强大的魔法！我会用这种魔法来对抗吉尔吉斯族的敌人。\n\n你又为我们完成了一项重要的任务，$n。也许不久以后，我们就可以称你为朋友了。",cEN="Yes, this is the shard of which the earth whispered. I can feel strong magic in it! I will use this magic against the enemies of the Gelkis.\n\nYou have done one more task for us, <name>. Maybe soon, we will call you friend."}
Q[1374]={d="大地告诉我说，玛格拉姆部族变得越来越衰弱了。现在是干掉他们的可汗的时候了！\n\n把玛格拉姆部族的杰恩可汗的头给我提来！",dEN="The earth speaks to me, and it says that the Magram grow weak. Now it is time to kill their Khan!\n\nBring me the head of the Magram Khan, Jehn!",o="把杰恩可汗的头颅交给凄凉之地吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",oEN="Bring the Khan Jehn's Head to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village in Desolace.",p="向我证明你$g是格尔基斯的朋友:是格尔基斯的朋友;，$n。",pEN="Show me you are a friend of the Gelkis, <name>.",c="杰恩可汗虽然强大，却很愚蠢。他自以为他的力量无人能及，但他并没有发现大地的魔法正在加强。失去首领的玛格拉姆半人马将会和他们的领袖落得一样的下场，吉尔吉斯半人马总有一天会一统天下！",cEN="Khan Jehn was strong, but stupid. He thought his own strength was great. He did not see that earth magic is stronger. The Magram centaur will now fall without their leader, and the Gelkis will one day rule!"}
Q[1375]={d="你帮助了玛格拉姆部族，我喜欢你。现在去杀了吉尔吉斯的可汗！他叫沙卡，我要他的脑袋！我要盯着他的脑袋取笑他！",dEN="You help the Magram, and I like you. Now, kill the Khan of the Gelkis! He is Khan Shaka, and I want his head! I want to stare at his head and laugh at him!",o="继续和玛格拉姆部族保持良好的关系，把沙卡可汗的头颅交给凄凉之地玛格拉姆村的瓦鲁格。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and bring the Head of Khan Shaka to Warug in the Magram Village in Desolace.",p="为玛格拉姆完成任务，那么我就会帮助你。",pEN="Do tasks for the Magram, and I will help you.",c="沙卡可汗死了！我要把他的头挂在长枪上，让沙卡看看我们玛格拉姆的力量！",cEN="Khan Shaka is dead! I will place his head on a pike, and keep it with me so Shaka can see the strength of the Magram!"}
Q[1376]={d="你应该知道你把自己绑在了什么上面。\n\n上塔去。在塔顶，你会见到剥魂者阿斯特里亚。她主持我们的……工作，你最好别让她失望。\n\n但要记住这个警告：一旦你爬上去……就没有回头路了。\n\n我们不能容许关于我们目的的任何风言风语传出去。我们有确保沉默的手段，比你如此心甘情愿喝下的毒药残忍得多的手段。\n\n记住这一点。",dEN="You deserve to know what you have bound yourself to.\n\nAscend the tower. At its summit, you will find Asteria the Soulcleaver. She leads our... work, and you would do well not to disappoint her.\n\nBut heed this warning, once you climb... there is no return.\n\nWe cannot allow word of our purpose to spread. We have methods of ensuring silence, methods far crueler than the poison you so willingly drank.\n\nRemember that.",o="进入塔内，在顶层与剥魂者阿斯特里亚交谈。",oEN="Enter the tower and speak with Asteria the Soulcleaver on the top floor.",p="什么事？",pEN="Yes?",c="啊……一位通过考验的新兵。\n\n告诉我，你犹豫过吗？你品尝过它的滋味吗？你的凡性从舌尖溜走的那种味道……\n\n我当然没有。我们谁都没有。\n\n凡性。死亡。不死……\n\n多么彻头彻尾愚蠢的设计。",cEN="Ah… a fresh recruit who has passed the test.\n\nTell me, did you hesitate? Did you savor its bite? The taste of your mortality slipping away on your tongue…\n\nI certainly did not. None of us did.\n\nMortality. Death. Undeath…\n\nWhat a profoundly idiotic design."}
Q[1377]={d="不死之身对我们并不仁慈。阳光的温暖再也照不到我。食物在我舌上化为灰烬。连世界的气息都已失去……被我自己腐坏的气味掩埋。\n\n然而，我还算幸运的。我的身体仍属于我自己，因为我尚不需要修补……或替换。其他人就说不上了。\n\n但我没多少时间去招呼每一个新来的人。\n\n去吧。跟你的新同伴们谈谈。问问他们为什么投奔我……然后仔细听。",dEN="Undeath has not been kind to us. The warmth of the sun no longer reaches me. Food turns to ash upon my tongue. Even the world’s scent is lost… buried beneath the stench of my own decay.\n\nAnd yet, I am among the fortunate. My body remains my own as I have not yet required repair... or replacement. Others cannot say the same.\n\nBut I have little time to indulge every new arrival.\n\nGo. Speak with your new peers. Ask them why they have joined me… and listen carefully.",o="与塔内的大法师晨光、暗影法师克蕾娜、暗影法师沃曼和贝加蒙特·莱斯特恩交谈。",oEN="Speak with Magister Morninglare, Shadowmage Krenna, Shadowmage Vorman, and Bergamont Lestern within the tower.",p="到处走动，是吧？",pEN="Making the rounds, are you?",c="现在，如果你真的接受了我等奋力追求的那个目标……我毫不怀疑你会伸出援手。\n\n尤其是现在，我们离揭开真相本身如此之近……\n\n我们的任务已不再是好奇心的问题，而是必然。",cEN="Now, if you have truly come to terms with what we are striving toward… I have no doubt you will lend us your aid.\n\nEspecially now, when we stand so close to unraveling the truth itself...\n\nOur task is no longer a question of curiosity, it is inevitability."}
Q[1378]={d="虽然我很想派你出去当我们的专属采买……但那不是我所能做的决定。\n\n回去找阿斯特里亚。再上一次塔，告诉她你为我做了什么。\n\n我确信她会为你找到一个更合适的位置……并让你的才能得到恰当的发挥。",dEN="As much as I would enjoy sending you out as our little supplier… that is not a decision I can make.\n\nReturn to Asteria. Ascend there once more, and tell her what you have done for me.\n\nI am certain she will find a far more fitting purpose for you… and put your abilities to proper use.",o="再上一次塔，向剥魂者阿斯特里亚禀报你在贝加蒙特·莱斯特恩一事上的成果。",oEN="Ascend the tower once more and inform Asteria the Soulcleaver of your success with Bergamont Lestern.",p="你已经回来了……",pEN="You've returned already...",c="<阿斯特里亚默默听着你的话。>\n\n我明白了。那么，也许还有别的事你可以为我们做。\n\n从宿主身上剥下灵魂这种精细活不容易教，而我目前没有多少躯体可供你练手。\n\n真遗憾。",cEN="<Asteria listens to you in silence.>\n\nI see. Well, perhaps there is something else you can do for us.\n\nThe delicate work of flaying a soul from its host is not easily taught, and I have few bodies to spare for your training at present.\n\nA pity."}
Q[1379]={d="我想你已经证明了自己有能力闯入外面的世界，而不被路上随便哪个蠢货拦住。\n\n鉴于我们工作的敏感性，你能理解这有……多罕见。尤其是在运送重要文件的时候。\n\n话虽如此，我们最新突破的消息必须送到幽暗城。把这个交给我在首都的联系人，确保它不会落入错误的手中。\n\n如果它丢了……那就意味着我们两个都得死。",dEN="I suppose you have proven yourself capable of venturing into the wider world without being waylaid by every cretin who crosses your path.\n\nGiven the sensitive mission of our work, you can understand how… uncommon that is. Especially when one is carrying documents of significance.\n\nThat being said, word of our latest breakthrough must reach the Undercity. Take this to my contact within the capital, and ensure it does not fall into the wrong hands.\n\nIf it is lost… it will mean the death of us both.",o="把阿斯特里亚的报告交给她在幽暗城的秘密联系人。",oEN="Deliver Asteria's report to her secret contact in the Undercity.",p="你想买点什么吗？",pEN="Do you wish to buy?",c="塔伦米尔来的货？真……意外。\n\n<萨拉查尔检视着包裹，眼睛越睁越大。>\n\n多么美妙的一批情报啊，我明白了。引人入胜。我相信我那个小小的……读书会……里的其他人会对这一进展非常满意。\n\n至于你，我不习惯重复接收送货。那太危险了。如果我或者我的同僚再次需要你……我会派人去找你。\n\n在那之前，滚吧。",cEN="A delivery from Tarren Mill? How… unexpected.\n\n<Salazar scans the package, his eyes widening.>\n\nWhat a lovely collection of information, I see. Fascinating. I am certain the others in my little… book club… will be most pleased by this development.\n\nAs for you, I do not make a habit of repeat deliveries. It is far too dangerous. If I, or my fellows, have need of you again... I will send for you.\n\nUntil then, begone."}
Q[1380]={d="$n，你帮助我们战胜了玛格拉姆部族。现在，请再帮助我们打败玛洛迪部族吧！干掉他们的首领赫鲁萨可汗！\n\n要挑战他，先要吹响玛洛迪号角，这把号角就在长矛谷中的一处高耸的峭壁上。\n\n而要吹响号角，你必须得到一只哨嘴。这种东西很少见，只有萨鲁赫可汗的心腹们才有资格携带。\n\n号角一响，玛洛迪半人马就会蜂拥而至。放手屠杀他们，直到赫兰萨出现。\n\n赫兰萨可汗手里有一把……一把钥匙。把这把钥匙交给我，我就会告诉你有关它的秘密。",dEN="<name>, you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha!\n\nTo face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn. It is atop a high bluff in the Valley of Spears.\n\nBut to blow the horn, you must gain a warhorn mouthpiece. These are rare, carried only by trusted Maraudine centaur.\n\nAfter the horn is blown, centaur will come. Kill them until Hratha appears.\n\nKhan Hratha holds the piece of... a key. Bring it to me...",o="继续和吉尔吉斯部族保持良好的关系，把玛洛迪钥匙碎片交给吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",p="赫兰萨可汗死了吗？你找到钥匙的碎片了吗？",pEN="Is Khan Hratha dead? Do you have the key fragment?",c="他死了！赫拉塔可汗死了！玛洛丁部族要垮了！等格尔基斯统治这片土地时，$n，我们会记住你。大地的灵魂将永远歌颂你的名字。",cEN="He is dead! Khan Hratha is dead! And now the Maraudine will fall! When the Gelkis rule this land, <name>, we will remember you. And the spirits of the earth will sing your name for all time."}
Q[1381]={d="格尔基斯可汗死了，现在玛洛丁部族要垮了！杀了玛洛丁可汗，赫拉塔！\n\n要面对他，就去长矛谷的高崖上吹响号角。但吹号角需要号嘴。要拿到号嘴，就得杀玛洛丁半人马。一直杀到找到号嘴为止。然后吹响号角。\n\n照做之后，玛洛丁半人马会涌向那座塔。杀到赫拉塔可汗出现为止。赫拉塔拿着一块钥匙碎片。把这碎片交给我……",dEN="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha!\n\nTo face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears. But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur. Keep killing until you find a mouthpiece. Then blow the horn.\n\nDo this and Maraudine centaur will come to the tower. Kill them until Khan Hratha appears. Hratha holds the piece of a key. Give this piece to me...",o="和玛格拉姆保持良好的关系，把玛洛迪钥匙碎片交给凄凉之地玛格拉姆村的瓦鲁格。",oEN="Maintain your Magram reputation, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Warug in the Magram Village in Desolace.",p="照我说的去做。让我确信你是玛格拉姆人的朋友！",pEN="Do what I ask. Prove to me that you are an ally of the Magram!",c="赫兰萨可汗死了！现在玛格拉姆人是最强大的半人马部族了！我们要消灭其它的半人马部族，一统凄凉之地！\n\n我们会记得你的，$n，当其它人被我们践踏在蹄下时，我们会宽恕你的。",cEN="Khan Hratha is dead! Now the Magram are the strongest of the centaur! We will crush the others, and rule Desolace!\n\nWe will remember, you, <name>, and you will be spared our hooves when all others are trampled."}
Q[1382]={d="我们的确很幸运，半人马氏族之间正在同室操戈。如果他们拧成一股绳，那将会是一股无法阻挡的力量。没错，我们很幸运，所以我们应该紧紧抓住现在的这种优势。\n\n众多半人马部族中的一支——吉尔吉斯，正在与玛格拉姆部族激烈地战斗。我希望在我们进攻玛格拉姆的同时，吉尔吉斯部族也能同时发动攻击。\n\n去和智者乌泰克谈谈吧，他就在凄凉之地西南的吉尔吉斯营地外面。也许我们可以通过他来和吉尔吉斯结成联盟，同时对玛格拉姆发起致命的攻击！",dEN="We are fortunate the centaur clans fight among themselves, for if they joined into a single force then they would be unstoppable. Yes, we are fortunate, and we should press our advantage.\n\nOne of the centaur clans, the Gelkis clan, is in brutal war with the Magram clan. If we attack the Magram, then perhaps an alliance may be struck with the Gelkis.\n\nSpeak with Uthek the Wise, in the outskirts of the Gelkis camps in southwestern Desolace. Through her we might strike an alliance with the Gelkis.",o="和吉尔吉斯部族建立良好的关系，然后和智者乌泰克谈一谈。",oEN="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Gelkis, then speak with Uthek the Wise.",p="走开！吉尔吉斯不想在这里看见你！\n\n干掉更多玛格拉姆部族的家伙以后再回来，那时候我才会和你好好谈谈。",pEN="Be gone! The Gelkis do not want you here. Leave now!!\n\nReturn after killing many Magram, and then I will speak with you.",c="你的名字在吉尔吉斯部族中广为传颂，因为你的手上沾满了玛格拉姆部族的鲜血。\n\n现在我们可以来谈一谈了。说说你能为吉尔吉斯做些什么，我们又能为你做些什么吧。",cEN="Your name is whispered among the Gelkis. You have much Magram blood on your hands. This is good.\n\nMaybe it is also good if we speak. Speak of what you can do for the Gelkis, and what we can do for you."}
Q[1383]={d="我脑中已经想到了合适的药剂配方，可以让口风最紧的人喝下之后也知无不言。\n\n要制成这种药水，我需要几颗沼泽地中的暗影黑豹的心脏，另外还需要住在那儿的泥沼之王的蘑菇。$n，像你这么能干的人一定可以说服他给你一个蘑菇的。\n\n最后一味药是绿龙的血液，比如伊萨里奥斯的洞穴外面的那些。\n\n事不宜迟，你赶快出发吧！",dEN="I have just the right serum in mind. It will deal with the truth in precisely the way the truth should be dealt with.\n\nFor this concoction I will need several Shadow Panther hearts from the Swamp. I also require the enchanted fungus off of the Mire Lord who resides there. I am sure one as able as you, <name>, can persuade him to part with some.\n\nThe last item I'll need for the serum is the blood of a dreaming whelp, like the ones that live outside Itharius' cave in the swamp.\n\nNow, off you go!",o="乞丐鬼屋的药剂师法奥斯丁需要5颗暗影黑豹的心脏、1颗泥沼之王的蘑菇和一些绿色雏龙之血。",oEN="Apothecary Faustin at Beggar's Haunt needs 5 Shadow Panther Hearts, Mire Lord Fungus and some Green Whelp Blood.",p="被关在斯通纳德的间谍肯定会开口的……只要他喝了我特制的药水，哈哈！\n\n不过要得到配制药水所必需的各种成分并不简单。暗影黑豹在沼泽地很常见，但是收集足够多的心脏还是颇困难的。另外，泥沼之王也是个难应付的家伙。",pEN="That Infiltrator in Stonard will surely.... open up... after he drinks my special serum. Haha!\n\nThe ingredients required are by no means easy to procure. Shadow Panthers are common in the Swamp but collecting enough hearts for our purpose can be daunting. And the Mire Lord can be such a fussy beast.",c="太棒了，$n！你来得还真巧。据莱度斯说，那个间谍的伤已经好了，现在就可以接受兽人的盘问。\n\n给我点时间来分配毒——我是说分配真言药水。",cEN="Splendid, <name>! And just in time too. From what Zraedus tells me, the Infiltrator has recovered from his wounds and is ready to be questioned by the orcs.\n\nGive me but a moment to prepare the pois - I mean prepare the truth serum."}
Q[1384]={d="科卡尔半人马认为他们的魔法很强大，其实他们根本就不知道魔法是什么东西！即使是把魔法扔在他们脸上，他们也不会知道的！\n\n你去让他们知道他们的魔法有多么脆弱吧。去杀了科卡尔部族的蠢货们，把他们的咒符带回来，我要把它们丢进火坑里，然后放声大笑！",dEN="The Kolkar centaurs think their magic is strong. They do not know magic! They would not know magic if it bit them!\n\nYou will show them their magic is weak. Go to the Kolkar to the northeast and kill them. Take their charms. Bring me the charms and I will throw them in the fire and laugh!",o="和吉尔吉斯部族保持良好的关系，把10个粗制咒符交给凄凉之地吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring 10 Crude Charms to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village in Desolace.",p="你拿到符咒了吗？你让科卡尔部族知道他们的魔法有多么脆弱了吗？",pEN="You have the charms? You showed the Kolkar they are weak?",c="你为吉尔吉斯做了件好事。科卡尔部族很弱小，他们很快就会灭亡。他们的魔法是那么地不值一提，完全无法拯救他们。你已经向他们展示了这一点，而他们对你的恐惧会使他们变得更加脆弱！\n\n在我们的领地上，弱者是无法生存的。",cEN="You do a good thing for the Gelkis. The Kolkar are weak and will die. Their magic is pathetic and will not save them. You showed them this, and their fear will make them even more feeble!\n\nAnd in our lands, the feeble soon die."}
Q[1385]={d="凄凉之地是一片杀戮场。半人马部族之间互相残杀，我们担心最后的胜利者会不断扩张领土，并最终威胁到我们的要塞。我们决不能允许这种情况出现。\n\n我们必须学会如何打败半人马部族，为了打败他们……我们就必须和诸多半人马部族中的一支结盟。玛格拉姆部族与吉尔吉斯部族正在互相征伐，如果你去攻打吉尔吉斯部族，那么玛格拉姆部族就会视你为盟友。\n\n想办法得到玛格拉姆部族的信任，然后去和瓦鲁格谈谈，他就在凄凉之地东南的玛格拉姆村里。",dEN="Desolace is a land at war. The centaurs wage war with each other, and we believe the victor among them will spill out and threaten our strongholds. That, we cannot allow\n\nWe must learn how to beat the centaurs, and to do that... we must ally with one of the clans. The Magram centaurs war with the Gelkis. If you fight the Gelkis then the Magram might consider an alliance.\n\nEarn the favor of the Magrams then speak with Warug, in the Magram village in southeastern Desolace.",o="和玛格拉姆部族建立良好的关系，然后和瓦鲁格谈一谈。",oEN="Gain a Friendly reputation with the Magram, then speak with Warug.",p="赶快滚，不然玛格拉姆部族就把你揍扁！要想成为我们的朋友，你就必须去杀更多的吉尔吉斯半人马。",pEN="You will go now, or the Magram will crush you! To be our friend, you must kill Gelkis.",c="许多吉尔吉斯半人马倒在你的脚下，我喜欢！也许你能做更多让我高兴的事情，也许你和玛格拉姆半人马能成为朋友。",cEN="Many Gelkis fall to you. I like that. Maybe you can do more things I like. Maybe you and the Magram can be friends."}
Q[1386]={d="科卡尔部族认为他们很强大，但我们对他们嗤之以鼻！我们杀这些杂碎根本不费吹灰之力！你也可以杀了他们。让我看看你也是否也能像我们一样杀死科卡尔半人马。",dEN="The Kolkar think they are strong, but we laugh at them! We laugh and we kill them! You kill them too. Show me you can kill Kolkar like we do. Head north and slay them all!",o="继续保持和玛格拉姆部族的良好关系，杀掉12个科卡尔半人马，12个科卡尔斥候和6个科卡尔虐待者，然后回到凄凉之地向玛格拉姆部族的瓦鲁格报告。",oEN="Maintain your reputation with the Magram. Kill 12 Kolkar Centaurs, 12 Kolkar Scouts and 6 Kolkar Maulers, then return to Warug in the Magram Village in Desolace.",p="你难道害怕科卡尔部族了吗？为什么不去杀了他们？也许你已经忘了该如何杀人了。赶快去给我杀了他们！",pEN="Are you afraid of the Kolkar? Why do you not kill them? Maybe you forgot how to kill. Hurry and kill Kolkar before they are dead!",c="科卡尔半人马现在很惧怕你！我希望你在杀他们的时候放声大笑。在你杀戮的时候最好大笑，这样敌人就会知道他是多么地弱小！",cEN="The Kolkar fear you now! I hope you laughed when you killed them. It is better to laugh when you kill, so the enemy can see he is weak."}
Q[1387]={d="半人马的社会是由多个部族组成的，每一个部族都有各自的领袖和纲领。所有的半人马部族只有一点是相同的：残忍。\n\n如果我们要寻求和平，就必须先消灭这些半人马。你的任务就是消灭他们。\n\n在凄凉之地猎杀半人马，割下他们的耳朵。给我尽可能多带些半人马的耳朵回来。\n\n为了联盟，请一定要这么做，$n，只有这样，和平才会降临这片土地。",dEN="Many clans make up the centaur race. Each has its own leader and agenda, but all the clans have one thing in common. Cruelty.\n\nIf we are to ever find peace, then the centaurs must be removed. And so I put you on the task to do just that.\n\nWhile wandering Desolace, hunt centaur and take their ears. Bring me many, many ears.\n\nDo this in service of the Alliance, <name>, and we will be one step closer to war's end.",o="收集15个半人马耳朵，把它们交给尼耶尔前哨站的麦尔金斯下士。",oEN="Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",p="有什么要报告的吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have a report, <name>?",c="啊，半人马的耳朵。做得不错。\n\n你对联盟的贡献是毫无疑问的，$n。你在凄凉之地的行动，无疑地可以挽救无数人的生命。",cEN="Ah, the ears. Well done.\n\nYour service to the Alliance is unquestioned, <name>. The blood you spilled in Desolace will, no doubt, save countless lives."}
Q[1388]={d="一切都在按照计划进行，$n。把真言药水交给莱度斯，他会告诉你怎样使用它……\n\n哈哈！",dEN="Everything is proceeding according to plan, <name>. I want you to give this truth serum to Deathstalker Zraedus and he'll show you how to administer it.... properly.\n\nHaha!",o="把法奥斯丁的真言药水交给乞丐鬼屋的亡灵哨兵莱度斯。",oEN="Give Faustin's Truth Serum to Deathstalker Zraedus at Beggar's Haunt.",p="药剂师法奥斯丁，我希望你的药水对我们亲爱的朋友有所帮助。",pEN="I hope you have proven yourself of use to our dear friend, Apothecary Faustin.",c="我就知道老法奥斯丁会搞出点名堂来！你真是帮了大忙了。\n\n现在我们继续做正事吧，好吗？",cEN="I knew old Faustin would come up with something good! You were a tremendous help, no doubt.\n\nNow let's get down to business, shall we?"}
Q[1389]={d="农田避难所里的那些失落者和我们是同族，但他们已经是疯狂的怪物了……在我们来到艾泽拉斯的那段残酷的征途把他们活活逼疯了！他们现在就住在东边的农田避难所里，任何在附近徘徊的人都有可能被他们抓住或杀掉……\n\n他们还偷走了我们的圣物——德莱尼水晶。\n\n我们没有足够的力量进入农田避难所去夺回那些被他们扔在小屋和营火附近的水晶，但是失去了那些水晶……我们就会迷失自己的方向。",dEN="The lost ones who live in the Fallow Sanctuary look as we look, but they are monsters... driven mad by the rigors of our journey to Azeroth. Once our brethren, they now live in the Fallow Sanctuary to the east, catching or killing any who wander near.\n\nAnd they have stolen something sacred to us--draenethyst crystals.\n\nWe lack the force to enter the Fallow Sanctuary and reclaim our stolen draenethyst from among their huts and campfires, but without those crystals... we too may lose our way.",o="给悲伤沼泽避难营地里的玛格图尔带去6块德莱尼水晶。",oEN="Bring 6 Draenethyst crystals to Magtoor at The Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你夺回德莱尼水晶了吗？",pEN="Do you have the crystals?",c="谢谢你，$n。我们会铭记你的恩德。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. We, are in your debt."}
Q[1391]={d="要办成这事，我们还得想点办法。毕竟你不可能大摇大摆地走进去，然后说服那个傻瓜喝下法奥斯丁配制的药水，对吧？\n\n不过有一样东西是这些人类肯定不会拒绝的，那就是酒。我会把法奥斯丁的药水和这瓶麦酒混合在一起，那个可怜的傻瓜肯定会毫不犹豫地一饮而尽。\n\n赶紧去悲伤沼泽的斯通纳德要塞，$n。什么都不要告诉别人……",dEN="We need to operate with a certain amount of discretion. After all, it's not like you're going to waltz in there and convince the fool to drink Faustin's concoction here, right?\n\nBut if there's one thing those humans cannot deny it's the booze. I'll take Faustin's serum and mix it into this ale. I guarantee the poor sap will show no reluctance when it comes to chug-a-lugging a brew.\n\nMake haste to Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows, <name>. And keep our little mission nice and quiet...",o="把莱度斯的酒带给斯通纳德的间谍玛克森。",oEN="Take Zraedus's Brew to Infiltrator Marksen in Stonard.",p="可怜可怜我吧！我有一些超出联盟范畴的机密消息。虽然我不是部落的支持者，但是有些正在进行中的政治阴谋一定要被揭露出来！",pEN="Please have mercy on me! I have information that goes beyond alliance boundaries. While I am no sympathizer of the Horde, there is political treachery going on that must be revealed!",c="请我喝酒？你真是太好了！他们很多天都没给我酒喝了。等我把这酒喝完就把我所知道的一切都告诉你……",cEN="A drink for me? How kind. It's been days since they've allowed me to drink. Let me drink this down and then I'll tell you what I've learned...."}
Q[1392]={d="避难营里的的德莱尼人已经被诺博鲁虐待了好几个月了，他的棒子对于这些失落者来说是一种残忍和暴力的象征。",dEN="Noboru has plagued the Draenei of the Harborage for months, and his cudgel is a symbol of the brutality they have suffered at the hands of the lost ones.",o="把诺博鲁的木棒交到悲伤沼泽中的避难营领导人手中。",oEN="Bring Noboru's Cudgel to the leader of The Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你好，欢迎来到避难营。",pEN="Greetings. And welcome to the Harborage.",c="你拿到了可怕的诺博鲁的武器？那也就是说他死了？\n\n对避风港来说这是喜庆的一天。诺博鲁和他那伙人曾是我们的噩梦，他们在沼泽里游荡，杀掉每一个路过的德莱尼。他直接威胁到我们的生存，而我们没有足够的力量去面对他。\n\n能有你这样的$g朋友:朋友;，我们很幸运，$n。",cEN="You have gained the weapon of the dreaded Noboru? Is he then dead?\n\nThis is a joyous day for the Harborage. Noboru and his gang were a terror to us, wandering the swamps and killing any Draenei who crossed his path. He was a direct threat to our survival, and we did not have the strength to face him.\n\nWe are fortunate to have a friend in you, <name>."}
Q[1393]={d="请救救我！这些东西想要吃掉我！\n\n帮我离开这儿，我就给你一笔巨大的财富！那笔财富就在斯通纳德北部沼泽的营地中，但是被锁在了一个保险箱里，只有我知道方法来打开箱子。\n\n如果你帮我逃走，我就告诉你怎么拿到那笔财富！",dEN="Please help! These creatures are going to eat me!\n\nHelp me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know.\n\nIf you help me escape, then I'll teach it to you.",o="护送加林逃出困境，然后打开他放在悲伤沼泽营地里的保险箱。",oEN="Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.",c="保险箱的钥匙孔里填满了黑色树脂，看来是不可能打开的。\n\n但是加林告诉过你在箱子的底部有个隐藏的锁……\n\n你迅速地找到了锁的位置，并轻轻地按了一下，保险箱应声打开了……",cEN="The keyhole of this strongbox is filled with black resin. It is impossible to open.\n\nBut Galen told you of a hidden latch on the box's bottom...\n\n...After a quick search the latch is found. The latch is flipped, and the strongbox opens..."}
Q[1394]={d="你做得很好，$n。你已经通过了所有的试炼，现在回到千针石林的多恩那里去吧。他会感觉到你的变化，他会看出你的思想、身体和精神都已经足够强大了，而你的努力理应受到嘉奖。\n\n将你在这些测试中所表现的优秀素质继续保持下去吧，$n。如果你能做到这些的话，多恩将在以后的日子里再次对你进行试炼。",dEN="You have done well, <name>. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles. He will sense the change within you, and see that your mind, body and spirit are strong enough that you should be rewarded for your efforts.\n\nStay true to the balance you've shown throughout these trials, <name>. Dorn will test you again in the future if you do.",o="和千针石林的多恩·平原行者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles.",c="啊，$n。你很久没来过我这里了。自从你迈出踏上旅途的第一跃，似乎已经过去了许多个月亮。\n\n如今你回到我面前，比当初更强……也更$g睿智:睿智;。这让我很欣慰，你通过了我所有的考验，理应得到奖赏。",cEN="Ah, <name>. It has been a long time since you have last stepped into my home. It seems like many moons have passed since you took your first leap that set you upon your path.\n\nAnd now you return to me stronger than you once were... more enlightened. This pleases me. And you should be justly rewarded for seeing my tests to the end."}
Q[1395]={d="这一箱能量石要送去位于死亡之地的守望堡。它们不能长久保持魔法的效力，因此我们恐怕不能等到下一支商队出发时让他们捎去了。\n\n你必须带上它们，迅速赶往守望堡，动作一定要快。\n\n把它们带给城堡里的军需官朗格尔斯。要想到达那里的话，你就必须向东穿越逆风小径，再向东穿越悲伤沼泽，然后向南穿越死亡之地。\n\n你要小心，$n。你要连续穿越好几个危险地带，但是你绝对不能失败。",dEN="This crate of powerstones needs to go to Nethergarde Keep, in the Blasted Lands. They won't hold their power for long, so we can't ship them with the next caravan.\n\nYou must take them, and you must take them quickly.\n\nBring them to Quartermaster Lungertz in Nethergarde Keep. To reach the keep, you must travel east through Deadwind Pass, then east through the Swamp of Sorrows, then south through the Blasted Lands.\n\nUse caution, <name>. You will travel through dangerous lands, yet you must not fail.",o="在能量石的魔法效果消失以前，把它们带给守望堡的军需官朗格尔斯。",oEN="Bring the Crate of Powerstones to Quartermaster Lungertz, before the powerstones expire.",p="嗨！别在意这些骚动，这在守望堡简直就是家常便饭。\n\n你有什么东西要给我的吗？",pEN="Hello! Don't mind all the commotion, it's just business as usual at Nethergarde Keep.\n\nYou have something for me?",c="啊，能量石！法师们看到这些一定会很高兴的。\n\n太谢谢你了，$n。我知道你从夜色镇赶到这里并不容易。",cEN="Ah, the powerstones! The mages will be happy to see these!\n\nMany thanks, <name>. I know your trip from Darkshire was not an easy one."}
Q[1396]={d="我的商队本要前往东海岸，但我们没能抵达目的地。失落者袭击了我们：他们杀了守卫，毁掉了物资。\n\n只有我从袭击中活了下来。我发誓要保护剩余的物资，可这附近有野兽出没。求你了，帮我保护营地免受野兽侵扰！",dEN="My caravan was destined for the eastern coast, but we did not reach our goal. Lost Ones attacked us, killing guards and dashing supplies.\n\nI alone survived their assault. I have sworn to protect what supplies remain, but wild creatures skulk near. Please, help me defend my camp from the beasts!",o="杀死8只小盐齿鳄鱼、10只沼泽纺丝蛛和10只沼泽虎，然后向悲伤沼泽的卫兵比格斯报告。",oEN="Kill 8 Young Sawtooth Crocolisks, 10 Sorrow Spinners and 10 Swamp Jaguars then return to Watcher Biggs in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="沼泽里的怪物正在逼近，$n。拜托，你一定要守住营地！",pEN="The swamp creatures press close, <name>. Please, you must defend the camp!",c="动物的咆哮声现在似乎减弱下去了，大概是远离了吧。谢谢你，$n。但愿它们不会再回来！",cEN="The sounds of animals are now faint, more distant. Thank you, <name>. Now let's hope they don't return!"}
Q[1398]={d="我对你实在是感激不尽，$n。你有一颗充满荣耀的心。现在，我想我仍需要谦卑地请您帮我完成另一个任务。\n\n如果我还想到守望堡去的话，就一定得修好这辆马车。因此……我需要一些木材，我要的是结实的干木，而不是从那些沼泽中的树上砍下的像海绵一样松软的木头。\n\n$n，请到东边的海滩上去找些已经被太阳晒干的流木，把它们给我拿来。",dEN="I owe you greatly, <name>. An honorable heart beats within you. And now I have another task for which I humbly ask your aid.\n\nIf I'm ever to reach Nethergarde, then I must fix this wagon. And for that... I will need wood. Strong, dry wood--not the spongy, tangled wood of the swamp's trees.\n\n<name>, go east to the coast and search for driftwood that has been dried by the sun. Bring it to me.",o="给悲伤沼泽的卫兵比格斯带回8块晒干的流木。",oEN="Bring 8 pieces of Sundried Driftwood to Watcher Biggs in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="找到流木了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you find any driftwood, <name>?",c="这木头很轻，但也很结实。感谢你，$n。",cEN="This wood is light, but tough. Thank you, <name>. It will work nicely."}
Q[1400]={d="这白银不只是一件小饰品，<name>。如果罗梅诺仍像我记得他那样记得我，那么也许这些话能到达我无法到达的地方。\n\n我给罗梅诺写了一封信。把它带到此地向东北的洞穴里留下。如果我们之间还有什么相连，他会知道的。",dEN="The silver will serve as more than a trinket, <name>. If Romeno still remembers me as I remember him, then perhaps these words will reach him where I cannot.\n\nI have written a letter for Romeno. Take it to the cave north east of here and leave it. If anything still binds us, he will know.",o="把朱丽叶的信送到隐蔽的洞穴。",oEN="Deliver Juliette's Letter to the hidden cave.",p="你把朱丽叶的信带来留给罗梅诺了吗？",pEN="Have you brought Juliette's letter to leave for Romeno?",c="你把朱丽叶的信放在祭坛上。这些话如今都在他能找到的地方了。",cEN="You place Juliette's letter at the altar. The words are now where he may find them."}
Q[1401]={d="那封信奏效了，<name>。罗梅诺回来了……但不再是原来的他。我能看到他身上的痛苦，看到他每一次呼吸都让他离自己更远。他在受苦，而我知道该怎么做。\n\n如果死亡带走他，也许就不会永远把他从我身边带走。被遗忘者能超越坟墓而存续。如果罗梅诺以我们同类的身份站起来，那么也许我们就能像本该的那样在一起，不因年岁而改变，不被时间触碰。\n\n但我不能做那送他过去的手。我太爱他了，也太害怕了。\n\n求你，替我杀了罗梅诺。给他解脱，也给我们唯一可能剩下的未来。",dEN="The letter worked, <name>. Romeno came back... but not as he was. I can see the pain in him, the way each breath drags him further from himself. He is suffering, and I know what must be done.\n\nIf death takes him, perhaps it will not take him from me forever. The Forsaken endure beyond the grave. If Romeno rises as one of us, then maybe we can be together as we were meant to be unchanged by age, untouched by time.\n\nBut I cannot be the hand that sends him there. I love him too much, and I am too afraid.\n\nPlease, kill Romeno for me. Give him release, and give us the only future we may have left.",o="杀死罗梅诺·利文斯顿，然后回到朱丽叶·利文斯顿那里。",oEN="Kill Romeno Livingston, then return to Juliette Livingston.",p="结束了吗？你终结他的痛苦了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Did you end his suffering?",c="他躺得那么静，而这份寂静比任何尖叫都更可怕。\n\n我告诉自己这样能救他。我告诉自己死亡会为罗梅诺打开与我相同的那扇门，他会站起来，我们就能永远在一起。\n\n可他一动不动。我求你去做我做不到的事，<name>，如今我看到了我的希望造成了什么。罗梅诺走了，而我是起因。\n\n如果这个世界不肯把他还给我，那我就去找他。无论此生之后等待着什么，我祈祷我抵达时他能认出我。",cEN="He lies so still and the silence is worse than any scream.\n\nI told myself this would save him. I told myself death would open the same door for Romeno that it opened for me that he would rise, and we would have forever together.\n\nBut he does not stir. I asked you to do what I could not, <name>, and now I see what my hope has caused. Romeno is gone, and I am the cause.\n\nIf this world will not give him back to me, then I will go to him. Whatever waits beyond this life I pray he will know me when I arrive."}
Q[1418]={d="可怕的荒芜之地就在联盟所控制的洛克莫丹地区南方，因此斯通纳德与荒芜之地中的卡加斯前哨站之间的交流经常中断。\n\n去证明你自己的实力吧，$n。旅行到荒芜之地去，与尼卡·血痕谈一谈，她是卡加斯前哨站的侦察队长。把她的报告给我拿回来。",dEN="The Badlands is harsh and lies close to the Alliance-held land of Loch Modan, so communication between Stonard and the Badlands outpost of Kargath is often cut.\n\nProve yourself, <name>. Travel to the Badlands and speak with Neeka Bloodscar, head scout of the Kargath outpost. Speak with her, and then send her report back to me.",o="和尼卡·血痕谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Neeka Bloodscar.",c="赫格拉姆想要一份报告，是吗？我不到三天前才派了个信差到斯通纳德去，难道他没能完成任务吗？如果斯通纳德没有收到我的报告的话，那他应该是失败了。\n\n希望我下次派去送信的人能有更强的本事，或者更好的运气。",cEN="Helgrum wants a report, eh? I sent an outrunner to Stonard not three days past. Did he fail his mission? If Stonard does not have my report, then it appears he did fail.\n\nLet's hope the next runner I send has more skill, or more luck."}
Q[1419]={d="你在荒芜之地待过很多天吗，$c？你感受过那里的炎热吗？你面对过在它尘土飞扬的平原上游荡的野兽吗？那么是时候了。\n\n峭壁土狼是一种强悍的品种。既强悍，又大胆到能悄悄溜进卡加斯偷窃我们的食物储备。帮哨站除掉这些盗贼！\n\n猎杀峭壁土狼，$n，把它们的下颚骨带给我。带够数量，也许我就会相信你说自己熟悉荒芜之地的话了。",dEN="Have you spent many days in the Badlands, <class>? Have you felt its heat? Have you faced the beasts that wander its dusty plains? It's time you did.\n\nCrag coyotes are a tough breed. Tough, and bold enough to creep into Kargath and steal from our food supplies. Help rid the outpost of these thieves!\n\nHunt crag coyotes, <name>. Hunt them and bring me their jawbones. Bring me enough, and maybe I'll believe it when you say you know the Badlands.",o="带30块山狗的颚骨去见卡加斯的尼卡·血痕。",oEN="Bring 30 Coyote Jawbones to Neeka Bloodscar in Kargath.",p="你拿到足够的腭骨了吗？",pEN="Do you have the jawbones?",c="干得不错，$n！现在那些山狗再也不会把我们的补给品给搞得一团糟了。\n\n荒芜之地的山狗是很难对付的野兽，你的行动向我展示了你有足够的能力在这里生存。",cEN="That's a nice collection of jawbones, <name>. Now those coyotes won't be tearing through our supplies for scraps.\n\nWell done. The coyotes of the Badlands aren't easy prey. Your deed shows me that you might just survive here."}
Q[1420]={d="我为斯通纳德的赫尔格鲁姆写了一份新报告，我要你送过去。\n\n如果你自认为$g是个好斥候:是个好斥候;，那就别在路上迷路，也别让敌人逮住。",dEN="I wrote a fresh report for Helgrum in Stonard. Bring it to him.\n\nAnd if you consider yourself an outrunner, then don't lose your way. Or fall to an enemy.",o="把尼卡的报告带给斯通纳德的赫格拉姆。",oEN="Bring Neeka's Report to Helgrum the Swift in Stonard.",p="你回来了，你带来了一份报告？",pEN="You returned. You have a report?",c="谢谢你，$n。看过尼卡的报告之后，我发现联盟还没有解决他们自己的问题。而且我们双方可能还拥有共同的敌人。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. From Neeka's report, I see the Alliance is not without its own problems. And we may find that some enemies are shared between us."}
Q[1421]={d="那些失落者们攻过来的时候，我一下子就被吓呆了。等我回过神来，就看见一只受惊的马拖着车一路狂奔出去，窜入了北边的失落者村庄里。\n\n那辆车上运的是非常贵重的施法材料，都是守望堡的巫师们急需的。找到我们的材料，$n，帮我把它们带回来。",dEN="I was stunned during the attack by the Lost Ones, but before my sight went black I spied one of our wagons being dragged to the Fallow Sanctuary, the lost one village to the north.\n\nA caravan chest with valuable reagents was in that wagon, reagents vital to the studies of the wizards of Nethergarde Keep. Find the chest and get those reagents, <name>. Get them and bring them to me.",o="在农田避难所中找到商队的货物，并拿到巫师的材料，把它交给卫兵比格斯。",oEN="Find the Caravan Chest in the Fallow Sanctuary, obtain the Wizards' Reagents and bring to Watcher Biggs.",p="你找到那些原料了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the wizard's reagents, <name>?",c="啊，你找到它们了！有了这些，守望堡的巫师们就可以继续他们的工作了。虽然我不知道他们在做些什么，但似乎这与诅咒之地里的黑暗之门有关，这对联盟的安全来说非常重要。",cEN="Ah, you found them! With these, the wizards in Nethergarde may continue their work. I do not know what it is that they do, but it is linked to the Dark Portal in the Blasted Lands, and is vital to the security of the Alliance."}
Q[1422]={d="在我给你打造武器的时侯，为什么你不去和卡塔尔谈谈呢？他曾说过需要有人帮忙在海滩上巡逻，我非常乐意看到像你这样睿智而警觉的$r去协助他，而不是我们这片营地中的某些只会骗酒喝的家伙。",dEN="While I begin work on your weapon, why don't you talk to Katar? He mentioned needing help with patrols along the beach, and I'd rather see you keep your wits and weapons prepared instead of getting drunk with some of the other louses I share this camp with.",o="与悲伤沼泽的卡塔尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",c="稍微安静一会儿，$c。就算海潮的声音再大，你都能听到那群恶心的鱼人所发出的叫声。",cEN="Be silent a moment, <class>. Even over the dull roar of the sea you can still hear those disgusting gurgles from the fish men."}
Q[1423]={d="这只木桶不大，但非常坚固。木板的接缝处和桶盖边上都用一种味道刺鼻的黄色封蜡封了起来。桶底的标签上写着两行大字：\n\n军需官朗格尔斯\n\n守望堡",dEN="This barrel is small yet sturdy. Its seams are sealed with a yellow, pungent wax. Stamped on the bottom of the barrel are the words:\n\nQUARTERMASTER LUNGERTZ\n\nNETHERGARDE KEEP",o="把遗失的货物交给军需官朗格尔斯。",oEN="Bring the Lost Supplies to Quartermaster Lungertz.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You have something for me?",c="啊，太感谢你了，$n！许多货物在从夜色镇运过来的路上都弄丢了，能找回一部分实在是太好了。",cEN="Ah, thank you <name>! So many supplies are lost from Darkshire to here. It's good to see that some are recovered."}
Q[1424]={d="酋长大人派我们去调查阿塔哈卡神庙中发生的奇怪现象。\n\n阿塔莱巨魔是由一群使用黑暗法术的施法者组成的部族，以惯于运用禁断的魔法而著称。你可以想象一下，当我们到达那里，却发现整座庙已经沉入了水中时，我们会有多么惊讶。\n\n现在那里被一群自称是艾泽拉斯保卫者的绿龙占据着。\n\n我们得弄清楚那里到底发生了些什么事。去探索一下泪水之池周围，收集一些阿塔莱神器。有了这些信息，我就可以开始把这个谜一点一点地给解开了。",dEN="The Warchief sent us to investigate strange happenings at The Temple of Atal'Hakkar.\n\nThe Atal'ai trolls are a tribe of dark casters, known for practicing forbidden magic. You can imagine how astonished we were when we arrived here to discover the temple had been sunk.\n\nThe green dragons now guard the site, claiming to be protectors of Azeroth.\n\nWe need to discover what happened. Explore around the Pool of Tears and gather Atal'ai artifacts. From those I can begin to piece together this puzzle.",o="斯通纳德的费泽鲁尔要求你收集5件阿塔莱神器。",oEN="Fel'zerul in Stonard wants you to gather 5 Atal'ai Artifacts.",p="没人知道阿塔哈卡神庙内现在潜伏着何种黑暗邪恶的力量，但我们都能感觉到那里聚集了强大的魔法能量。\n\n我们必须尽可能多地了解这种魔法，或许阿塔莱的法术对我们部落是有用处的。\n\n一旦你在泪水之池收集到了足够的阿塔莱神器，我就能了解到那群巨魔究竟施放了怎样的法术，以及那里到底发生了多么恐怖的事情。",pEN="No one knows what dark practices went on inside The Temple of Atal'Hakkar. But we do know that great and powerful forces of magic were used.\n\nWe must learn as much as we can about such magic. Perhaps the spells of the Atal'ai will prove of use to the Horde.\n\nOnce you have gathered enough Atal'ai artifacts from around the Pool of Tears, I can begin to understand what the trolls were hoping to accomplish and what went so horribly wrong.",c="你收集来了这么多的阿塔莱神器，值得嘉奖，$c。",cEN="Your diligence in collecting the Atal'ai artifacts is worthy of praise, <class>."}
Q[1425]={d="$n，在我修车的时候，我另外还有一件工作要交给你。\n\n我已经把从食人魔那里抢救回来的最重要的几件货物都放在了包裹里，你把它们都带到守望堡里去吧。这座城堡就在死亡之地北方的丘陵地带中，时刻监视着黑暗之门里的动静。\n\n你只要顺着这条路一直向东走，在第一个岔路口向南进入死亡之地，然后再在第二个岔路口向左转，就可以到达守望堡了。记住，要一直顺着路走，$n，多加小心。",dEN="While I fix this wagon, <name>, I have one last task for you.\n\nI have packed the most vital supplies saved from the ogre attacks. Take them to Nethergarde Keep. The keep is nestled in the northern hills of the Blasted Lands, keeping watch over the Dark Portal.\n\nTo reach Nethergard, follow the road east. When it branches head south into the Blasted Lands, then turn left at the next fork. Follow the road, <name>, and be wary.",o="把货物带给守望堡的军需官朗格尔斯。",oEN="Bring the Shipment to Nethergarde to Quartermaster Lungertz in Nethergarde Keep.",p="找我有什么事吗？",pEN="You have business with me?",c="什么？比格斯让你捎来的包裹？我们一直在等着它呢，我还以为比格斯出事了。\n\n谢谢你，$n。这些包裹里应该有我们最需要的法术材料——阿祖拉水晶。我们这里的库存已经不多了……",cEN="What? A package from Biggs' caravan? We thought it, and he, were lost.\n\nThank you, <name>. With luck, these supplies will carry the much needed reagent, Azoran Crystals. Our stock is running low..."}
Q[1426]={d="我一点都不喜欢大海，更不喜欢那些从深海里游上来的生物。他们都是些强大野蛮而又盲目的蠢货。要是我有足够的气力，我就会去成百上千地屠杀鱼人。不过现在我还没那么凶悍，所以就只好退而求其次，只要能看见这群鱼人死在任何遵从着部落意愿的勇士手里，我也就满足了。\n\n你怎么样呢，$c？你能杀死多少鱼人？你愿意和鱼人当中最强的一群较量较量吗？",dEN="I have no love for the sea, nor any creature I've seen come from its depths. It is a powerful but blind mistress; callous and brutal. It would bring me great pleasure to slay the fish men by the hundreds if it were within my power. But I garner some pleasure from watching their deaths at the hands of any who do the Horde's will.\n\nWhich brings us to you, <class>. How many can you slay? Would you test yourself against their most powerful kind?",o="杀掉10个沼泽鱼人、10个沼泽喷墨鱼人和10个沼泽食腐鱼人，然后向悲伤沼泽的卡塔尔回报。",oEN="Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我很有耐心，我的耐心就如同德拉诺的坎克石一般不可动摇。绝对不能让任何一个鱼人跨越过我们的边境——只要我还在，就不能。假如有一支完全听从我的命令的军队，我就要彻底把这种该死的动物从这个世界上清除掉。就算只是提到它们，我也感觉到我的仇恨随时都要爆发。",pEN="I am patient. Patient and everlasting like an old kank stone from Draenor. The fish men shall not make it past our borders--not while I still stand. If we had an army at our disposal I would cleanse this world and all others of their presence. I feel my hatred seethe just speaking about them.",c="大海看起来是辽阔而无情的，但你已经用她子民的血液浸染了她的身躯。鱼人知道什么是痛苦，但它们早晚会好了伤疤忘了痛，它们仍会从这次你给他们造成的灾难中恢复过来，然后继续肆无忌惮地扩张。\n\n让他们凄苦的惨叫在夜空中遮盖过大海的咆哮吧。每倒下一个鱼人，我都会微笑一次。\n\n如果你愿意再杀些鱼人的话，一定要来找我，我会再次奖励你的。",cEN="The sea seems vast and relentless, but you have stained her with the blood of her own spawn. The fish men know pain. Their stupidity will force them to refortify their ranks from the devastation you've caused, and that is good.\n\nLet their gurgling screams overshadow the sea's roar long into the night. I shall smile every time I hear one of them silenced.\n\nReturn to me if you wish to slay more of the fish men. I will gladly reward you again."}
Q[1427]={d="在你休息之前，再去跟托克卡尔谈谈。你不在的时候，我想他已经完成了几件武器，会送你其中一件。等你觉得自己$g准备好了:准备好了;，不妨拿它去试试对付那些鱼人……不过那只是为了让我更高兴而已。",dEN="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you. You would do well to test its strength against the fish men when you are ready... but only to please me further.",o="与悲伤沼泽的托克卡尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tok'Kar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",c="啊，$n，你已经回来了，太好了。我刚刚为我们那些整日和鱼人作战的勇士们制造了一些新武器。为了感谢你替我们带来了新鲜的盐齿鳄鱼肉，还有让卡塔尔的脸上露出了一丝笑容，我要送你一把，自己挑吧。",cEN="Ah, <name>, you've returned. Good. I've finished crafting more weapons for our fight against the murlocs. For bringing us the fresh sawtooth meat, and for bringing a small smile to Katar's face, I offer one of them to you."}
Q[1428]={d="看着你对鱼人的憎恶也如同我一般地与日俱增，我非常高兴。\n\n沿着海滩巡逻，你就可以找到更多的鱼人，去杀吧。当你觉得自己杀得够多了以后就回来找我，我会好好奖励你一下的。",dEN="It pleases me to see your hatred for the fish men grows with mine.\n\nFind more of their kind along the beach, and when you've had your fill of combat, return to me. We shall speak then of a reward for your diligence.",o="杀掉10名沼泽喷墨鱼人、10名沼泽食腐鱼人和10名沼泽鱼人智者，然后向悲伤沼泽的卡塔尔回报。",oEN="Kill 10 Marsh Inkspewers, 10 Marsh Flesheaters, and 10 Marsh Oracles, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="只有大海与她所有的孩子都回归寂静之后，我才会高兴……尤其是那些恶心的鱼人。",pEN="Not until the sea and all her children are silenced will I be pleased... especially those disgusting fish men.",c="干得好，$c。所有的鱼人都给我去死吧！",cEN="Well done, <class>. I call for more of their blood. Let all the fish men perish."}
Q[1429]={d="当你面对泪水之池的危险时，我的一名斥候带回了一卷用干肉制成、以血写就的卷轴。它似乎是对阿塔莱部族一名祭司的判决书。\n\n在阿塔莱部族中，这名祭司被判处一种被认为远比死亡更糟的命运。\n\n他被流放到腹地北部，与枯木巨魔同住。\n\n我会把这些器物打包好。你要找到那名流放者，查明它们的真正用途。旅程结束后回来见我。",dEN="While you were braving the dangers of the Pool of Tears, one of my scouts returned with a scroll written in blood on dried flesh. It seems to be a judicial sentence against a priest of the Atal'ai tribe.\n\nThis priest was sentenced to a fate worse than death amongst the Atal'ai.\n\nHe was exiled to live far north in the Hinterlands, with the Witherbark trolls.\n\nI will bundle these artifacts. You are to seek out the exile and discover their true use. Return to me once your journey is complete.",o="将一捆阿塔莱神器交给辛特兰的阿塔莱流放者。",oEN="Bring the Bundle of Atal'ai Artifacts to the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands.",p="你竟然能来到这里，真是太勇敢了。嗯，到底是勇敢还是愚蠢呢……",pEN="You are brave to come here. Brave or foolish...",c="你带来了阿塔莱的召唤法器？\n\n我倒要好好看看“预言者”迦玛兰是怎样领导着鲜血之厅的信徒与他们的宿命抗争的。我想知道，哈卡回到神庙里了吗？他们的命运之轮已经开始转动了吗？",cEN="You bring me the summoning artifacts of the Atail'ai?\n\nI see Jammal'an the Prophet is leading the disciples of the Chamber of Blood towards their chosen fate. Has Hakkar returned to the Temple I wonder? Has their fate been met?"}
Q[1430]={d="最近我的顾客总是会来买鲜嫩多汁的螃蟹肉，特别是那些巨型淤泥蟹的肉。\n\n如果你最近要去海边转转的话，最好能帮我带一些螃蟹腿到奥格瑞玛去，我会付你可观的报酬的。\n\n海岸就在这里的东边，那里遍地都是螃蟹，很容易就可以弄到螃蟹腿。",dEN="There's a high demand for the succulent taste of crawler meat among my customers; especially the meat from the monstrous crawlers.\n\nIf you plan on heading to the coast, then I could easily make it worth your while to bring me back some of their legs to have transported back to Orgrimmar.\n\nThe coast is to the east from here, and you should have no problem finding the creatures scurrying along the beaches and under the sea.",o="给悲伤沼泽的达尔带去10条巨大的螃蟹腿。",oEN="Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我为你准备了一桶酒，准备给你开个庆功会，$n。在我把这些肉送到顾客那边之前，我们一定要先尝个鲜。",pEN="I have a cask of wine waiting for your success, <name>. It's only right I taste the goods before I have it shipped back to my customers.",c="啊，太完美了。我等不及要把这些肉好好烤烤，然后大吃一顿了！你应该带一些在路上吃，它确实是美味至极。",cEN="Ah, this should be perfect. I can't wait to taste these after they are prepared perfectly over an open fire. You should take a sample of it with you on your travels. It truly is delicious."}
Q[1431]={d="请等一下，$c，让我告诉你一些对我们的族人来说非常重要却几乎不为人知的东西。\n\n我们兽人是个令人骄傲的种族，而与人类之间的战争是如此漫长，就连萨尔都有些不耐烦了。你知道的，我们的酋长睿智而谨慎，并总是以他的族人为重。总之，他是一个出色的外交家，在他与人类共同生活的那段日子里，他也学会了许多人类的行事之道。\n\n如果我刚才说的故事引起了你的兴趣，那么就去找城市西门附近的科尔丹吧。",dEN="Be still, <class>, and allow me to share with you something important to our people, but far from obvious.\n\nWe are a proud race, and the war with the humans tried even Thrall's great patience. You see, our Warchief is wise and prudent, and he continues to put his people first. Ultimately, he is a diplomat, and in his time with the humans he learned much of their ways.\n\nIf the tale I've started piques your interest, then find Keldran near the western exit of the city. His hovel is there.",o="与奥格瑞玛的科尔丹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar.",c="你好，尊贵的$c。我是科尔丹，魔法和某些“神秘艺术”的学徒。\n\n那帮懦弱的商人让你到这里来和我接触，想要与我进行更加微妙的接触，但这并不意味着你就不能再帮助我们了。\n\n请不要紧张，我会告诉你为什么大酋长那么需要我的帮助……还有你的。\n\n首先这是一个形象问题，$n。部落是怎样看自己的，我们的盟友是怎样看我们的，以及最重要的，我们的敌人是怎样看我们的。",cEN="Putanni, noble <class>. I am Keldran, student of magic... and other mystical arts.\n\nThe business Craven sent you here to speak to me about requires a touch more subtlety than you've previously needed, but that does not mean you can not still aid our cause.\n\nPlease, make yourself comfortable, and I shall tell you why the Warchief has need of my aid... and yours.\n\nIt starts with appearances, <name>. How the Horde sees itself. How our allies see us. And most importantly, how our enemies see us."}
Q[1432]={d="随着联盟在卡利姆多的推进越来越深入，部落与燃烧军团有染的错误结论一定会流传开来。酋长可不会允许这样的事情发生。受酋长所托，我正在负责这个问题的解决。\n\n我已经往凄凉之地派了密探，就在科多兽坟场北部的幽灵岗哨附近。你的任务是跨过石爪山脉，一直走到山脉的南侧，到那里去找塔卡塔·钢刃。",dEN="As the Alliance progresses deeper and deeper into Kalimdor, incorrect conclusions may be drawn about the Horde making pacts with the Burning Legion. The Warchief cannot allow that to happen. And with his blessing, I am taking control of overseeing them removed.\n\nI have agents in the area of Desolace at the Ghost Walker Post north of the great Kodo Graveyard. Head south of the Charred Vale in the Stonetalon Mountains and you shall come across it. When you arrive, seek out Takata Steelblade.",o="与凄凉之地的塔卡塔·钢刃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",c="你好，$c。你带来了奥格瑞玛的消息，这真好。\n\n这里恶魔的腐臭气息足以盖过半人马的粪味，那群马人宣称这片土地是他们的，但是仅仅以他们那一点可怜的影响力，这个地区并不完全在他们的控制范围之内，如果我们不对此有所行动的话，他们定会遭到灭顶之灾。\n\n虽然间接地帮助半人马对我来说不算是个乐事，但这对部落有好处，所以我会对大酋长尽责，即使这种责任意味着我正在给部落里的术士们帮忙。",cEN="Greetings, <class>. You bring news from Orgrimmar; that is good.\n\nThe demon infestation overwhelms this area even more than the smell of centaur dung. The horse-men claim this land as their own, but clearly there are influences out of their control that will crush them if not kept in check.\n\nIt does not please me that we aid the centaur indirectly, but it is for the good of the Horde, so I do my duty for the Warchief, even if it means helping the warlocks within the Horde."}
Q[1433]={d="和火刃氏族相关的说法是多如牛毛，但你要知道，这帮家伙实在是邪恶到家了，他们的精神已经腐朽，他们利用破坏与毁灭来维持并证明自己的存在。\n\n科尔丹派玛乌林·碎骨来与我同行，因为玛乌林对火刃氏族及他们的术士之道都有着充分的了解。\n\n他负责策划针对火刃氏族的行动，而我则负责对付在凄凉之地活动的恶魔。\n\n去和他谈一谈吧，他会告诉你如何按他的计划行事。",dEN="The Burning Blade have many agendas, but know that they are evil to their core, their spirits corrupted, and their destruction is the only way to thwart their objectives.\n\nKeldran sent Maurin with me because of his knowledge of the Blade and their warlock ways.\n\nHe has control of our plots against the Blade while I deal with the other demonic threats here in Desolace.\n\nSpeak to him, and he will guide you in his designs.",o="去找凄凉之地的玛乌林·碎骨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.",c="啊，好极了！感谢来自$r的帮助。\n\n我的名字是莫林。我是奉科尔丹以及年轻的大酋长萨尔之命来到这里的。能够帮助年轻的领袖抵抗威胁着部落的邪恶势力，那是我一生的夙愿。\n\n来，靠近点，$c。我将会向你说明一下我的计划，关于如何将火刃氏族这颗毒瘤除掉的计划。",cEN="Ah, yes. Aid from those loyal to the Warchief is always appreciated.\n\nMy name is Maurin. I am here at the behest of Keldran and the Warchief cub Thrall. It is my desire to aid the youngling leader against the evils that threaten his rule.\n\nCome, come closer, <class>. I shall explain to you my plan for removing the festering boil that is the Burning Blade."}
Q[1434]={d="恶魔是绝对不会凭空就出现的——他们需要一些空隙使邪恶得以立足。\n\n这空隙或许会产生自孱弱的精神，或许是对权力的无谓欲望，或许是对复仇的渴求，或许是要求最终审判的控诉。当我们被痛苦所困扰时，邪恶就会利用我们——例如萨特这样的邪恶力量。\n\n火刃氏族与它们之间显然有很紧密的联系，因此萨尔认为他们必须被清剿干净。到东北方向去寻找的它们的踪影，在将他们驱赶出这一带后回来向我报告。",dEN="A demon infestation does not occur without other influences--something else allows evil to gain a foothold.\n\nIt may start with a weakened spirit, a needless desire for power; perhaps it's a thirst for revenge, or the appeal for final justice. When we are beset by pain, evil takes advantage of us--evil such as the satyr.\n\nTies have been made between them and the Burning Blade, and Thrall would have them slain. Seek them out to the northeast of here, and return to me when you've driven them back.",o="杀死7只怨怒潜行者、7只怨怒魔仆、7只怨怒背叛者和7只怨怒唤魔者，然后向凄凉之地的塔卡塔·钢刃复命。",oEN="Slay 7 Hatefury Rogues, 7 Hatefury Felsworn, 7 Hatefury Betrayers, and 7 Hatefury Hellcallers, and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",p="有一个牛头人同伴警告我说，萨特的内心世界可能与它们的外表截然不同。他相信它们并不是表面上看起来的那么简单，也许是邪恶扭曲了它们的本性，但我是看不见这些事情的。\n\n我只是看见了它们无情地屠戮弱小，不惜一切地追寻黑暗的力量。\n\n我将继续履行歼灭它们的职责，直到大酋长给我新的指示。在那之前，我不会对它们有丝毫的同情。",pEN="I was warned by a tauren companion that the satyr are not all they appear to be. He believes there is something more to them, that their evil is a twisting of their true nature. But I have not seen such things.\n\nI see only the ruthless slaughter of the weak and the corruption of those who seek dark power.\n\nI will continue in my duty of annihilating them until the Warchief directs me otherwise. Until then, I take no pity on them.",c="干得好，$c。你向大家展示了你的荣耀和奉献精神。\n\n当我们在凄凉之地的任务告一段落时，大酋长将会知道是你在这里帮助我们完成了任务，是你帮助他实现了他的计划。\n\n感谢你。",cEN="You have done well, <class>. You have shown honor and dedication.\n\nWhen our campaign in Desolace is done, the Warchief will know that you aided us in our actions here, and that you helped make his will manifest.\n\nI thank you."}
Q[1435]={d="对那些为了某些自私的理由而背叛了自己首领的卑劣生物们而言，死亡是他们最合适的归宿。但对于那些将自己的全部身心奉献给黑暗的家伙们来说，死亡还远远不够。\n\n拿着这块宝石，当你附近有火刃氏族的爪牙死去时，就启动宝石上面的魔法。这个法术会拯救堕落的灵魂，将它们拉出黑暗的深渊，灌注到宝石里。\n\n在这些宝石中灌入了灵魂之后，把它们带回来交给我，我会妥善处置它们。\n\n现在就出发吧，多加小心。",dEN="Death is most desirable for those despicable creatures that turn their back on their liege for such selfish reasons. But death is not enough when dealing with those that have given themselves over to the darkness.\n\nTake this gem. When one of the Burning Blade's near death, activate its magic. The spell shall pull the corrupted spirit out of its victim, leaving an infused gem behind.\n\nBring me these infused gems so I may dispose of them properly.\n\nGo now, and may you elude death.",o="将15块燃烧宝石转变为灌入灵魂的燃烧宝石，然后把它们交给凄凉之地的玛乌林·碎骨。",oEN="Return the Burning Gem and 15 Infused Burning Gems to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.",p="我自己也尝试过尽可能将魔法弄得简单些。从受伤的躯体中抽取灵魂实在是易如反掌，但你不能完全依赖宝石的力量去杀敌。你必须在他们濒死的时候才能启动宝石，否则宝石就不能发挥它的功效。",pEN="I have tried to make the magics as simple as possible. Drawing the spirit of your victim out of its injured form should be child's play. Do not rely on the gem's power to slay your foe completely. You must only activate the gem when they are close to death, or it will be useless.",c="啊，你平安归来了，这很好。给我宝石，我要把它们放到安全的地方去。\n\n我给你的任务你已经全都完成了，$c。你休整好了以后记得和塔卡塔谈一下，他或许还有其它的任务给你，或者会安排你回奥格瑞玛去将我们在凄凉之地的工作进程通报给科尔丹。",cEN="Ah, you've returned successful. That is good. Give me the gems and I shall put them someplace safe....\n\nMy tasks for you are complete, <class>. Speak to Takata when you are rested. He may have other tasks for you, or perhaps needs you to return to Orgrimmar to inform Keldran of our progress here in Desolace."}
Q[1436]={d="形势很顺利，$n。如果我们能继续保持目前的推进势态的话，或许酋长会允许我们在换季之前回到久别的家园。\n\n回到科尔丹那里去，告诉他我们都干了些什么。我敢打赌他一定会为你在这儿的功绩而奖励你。他的事业对他来说很重要，并且如果酋长也会对他的成就表示敬意的话，他一定会非常自豪。",dEN="The fight goes well, <name>. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings.\n\nReturn to Keldran and let him know what we have done. I am sure he will reward you for your efforts here. His cause is important to him, and he will take pride in knowing that the Warchief respects his concerns.",o="与奥格瑞玛的科尔丹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar.",c="你在凄凉之地干得非常出色，$n。\n\n感谢你的努力、你的时间，以及你对我请求的理解。萨尔希望部落与联盟之间能有和平；既然我们的外貌已经可以被接受，我们就要避免引发更多暴力。\n\n我欠你一个人情。",cEN="You have returned from Desolace more than successful, <name>. Thank you.\n\nThank you for your efforts, your time, and your understanding to my plea. Thrall understands and desires peace between the Horde and Alliance, and by taking measures to insure our appearance is acceptable, we will not provoke any further threats of unnecessary violence."}
Q[1437]={d="你好，$n，我是瓦拉里尔。我到这里是来寻找达纳苏斯商业世家——玛雷姆家族的两个失踪的孩子。这个家族的族长已做好了最坏的打算，不过我还是要尽一切可能找到他的孩子。我已经开始了搜寻泰拉尼斯和黛琳达的工作，但愿一切顺利。\n\n我最近得知的线索是，几周前他们已经越过了石爪山。\n\n如果你发现了他们的踪迹，就请立刻通知我。",dEN="I am Vahlarriel, <name>. I've come here to discover the whereabouts of two missing nobles of a Darnassian merchant family--House Malem. The father of the house fears the worst, and I am to do everything I can to find his missing children. I have yet to start my search for Tyranis or Dalinda, but I am hopeful I shall not be here long.\n\nLast word tells of them passing through the Stonetalon Mountains a few weeks ago.\n\nIf you find their wagon, please, come find me immediately.",o="去凄凉之地寻找泰拉尼斯·玛雷姆和黛琳达·玛雷姆的马车。",oEN="Find and search Tyranis and Dalinda Malem's wagon in Desolace.",c="仔细地查看过马车的残骸之后，你发现它明显曾受到魔法和武器的双重攻击。似乎那场战斗的实力对比相当悬殊，因此很快就结束了，地上既没有血迹，也没有发现任何尸体。\n\n看来袭击者动作敏捷，而且颇有效率。",cEN="As you rummage around the remains of the wagon, it becomes obvious that it was attacked by both spells and weapons. The battle seemed one-sided and quick; there's no blood to be found, and no remains of any bodies.\n\nWhoever attacked the wagon was efficient and swift."}
Q[1438]={d="找到泰拉尼斯和黛琳达，然后带着你的发现回来见我。从这座城堡开始进行搜寻吧，我会立刻和达纳苏斯的上级联系，让他们知道这里的情况。\n\n对了，$n，还有一件事情一定会让你影响深刻。我的上级最关心的并不是泰拉尼斯以及他在这里的活动。对他们来说，更重要的是黛琳达能否安全地回来。泰拉尼斯……在他回来之前必须要接受评估。",dEN="Find both Dalinda and Tyranis if you can and come back to me with your findings. Start your search at this fortress. I will contact my superiors in Darnassus immediately and let them know the situation.\n\n<name>, there is something else I wish to impress upon you. My superiors have shown some concern over Tyranis' and his motives for coming here. It is more important to them that Dalinda is found and brought back safely. Tyranis is to be... gauged before he is taken home.",o="去凄凉之地找到黛琳达·玛雷姆。",oEN="Find Dalinda Malem in Desolace.",c="感谢艾露恩，总算有人来了。$c，我需要你的帮助。火刃氏族抓住了我和我的哥哥泰拉尼斯，然后把我们带到了这里。我想他们是要把我献祭给他们的恶魔主子！\n\n我早知道来凄凉之地是个错误，泰拉尼斯对所有神秘的事情都很好奇——甚至是那些有悖于大多数人的意愿的事情。即便明知道这片土地上恶魔横行，他也不惜冒险。\n\n我很担心他。",cEN="Thank Elune someone has finally come to help. Please, <class>, I need your help. My brother Tyranis and I were captured and brought here by the Burning Blade. I think they mean to sacrifice me to their demon masters!\n\nI knew coming to Desolace was a mistake, but Tyranis has recently begun craving knowledge of all things arcane--even against the wishes of our people. He decided to make this trek even after hearing tales of this land's demon infestation.\n\nI fear the worst for him."}
Q[1439]={d="兽人杀掉了我们所有的护卫和仆从，然后把我们带到了这里。天啊，那真是太可怕了！我以为他们肯定也会杀了我们，不过显然它们有别的计划。\n\n泰拉尼斯试图和他们交涉，我想他试图用对奥术的了解来博得他们的好感……我不知道他为什么要那么做。\n\n没有找到哥哥的下落，我就不离开这里。找到他，然后再回来救我吧。",dEN="We were brought here after the orcs slaughtered all our guards and servants. Oh, the terrible things they did to them! I thought surely they would kill us right there and then, but it became obvious they had other plans.\n\nTyranis attempted to speak to them. I think he wanted to impress them with his knowledge of the arcane... I'm not sure why.\n\nPlease, I can't leave here until I know what's happened to my brother. Find him, then come back for me when his fate is known.",o="去凄凉之地找到泰拉尼斯·玛雷姆。",oEN="Find Tyranis Malem in Desolace.",p="我担心泰拉尼斯是为了获取火刃氏族的秘密而不惜加入他们的阵营——他对魔法已经着迷了。\n\n我不知道自己是否忍心把泰拉尼斯沉迷魔法的事情告诉家乡的同胞，让我做这样的事情简直就是犯罪！但是为了保护我们自己不再遭受巨大的灾难，这样做也是可以理解的。",pEN="I fear Tyranis will attempt to learn the Burning Blade's secrets and count himself among their kind if they allow it - he has always adored the power magic brings to those who are seduced by it.\n\nI'm not sure I could endure returning home to my family with news of Tyranis' spirit flirting with such dangers. It's a terrible enough crime among my kind to pursue such things, but to become that which we attempt to protect ourselves from, well, that's apprehensible.",c="这太可怕了！不过我想这也是必要的。如果不是你动手，那肯定就是我族人的手。我想我该谢谢你——如果我显得不够真诚，请原谅我。我无意冒犯。\n\n既然已经知道我兄弟的命运，看来我逃跑的时候到了。如果你还愿意，我就接受你的帮助，逃离这个可怕的地方。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;，我们就可以动身前往安全之地了。",cEN="This is terrible! But I suppose it was necessary. If it wasn't by your hand, it would have surely been by that of my people's. I suppose I should thank you--please forgive me if it doesn't seem sincere. I mean no offense.\n\nWith the knowledge of my brother's fate in hand, it seems the time for my escape has come. If you are still willing, I will accept your aid in escaping this horrible place.\n\nWhen you are ready, we can make our way to safety."}
Q[1440]={d="那么，就是现在了？我很感激你的努力，如果以后没机会说，那就让我现在感谢你为我和我的家人所做的一切。如果你已$g准备好:准备好;……这里已经没有什么留给我了。你觉得什么时候合适，我们就什么时候动身。",dEN="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family. If you're ready, then there is nothing else for me here--we can leave when you feel the time is right.",o="护送黛琳达·玛雷姆离开雷斧堡垒，然后回到凄凉之地的瓦拉里尔·屠魔者那里。",oEN="Escort Dalinda Malem from Thunder Axe Fortress and then return to Vahlarriel Demonslayer in Desolace.",c="谢谢你，$n。黛琳达安全地返回了尼耶尔前哨站，情况比我想象的还要好一些。她能自己回到这里是件不错的事情，你一切都还好吧？\n\n可惜泰拉尼斯没有和黛琳达一起回来，这让我很痛心，不过我想黛琳达还是得承受泰拉尼斯的决定。她回到达纳苏斯以后还会有许多事情要做。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Dalinda made it safely back here to Nijel's Point, and in much better condition than I could have asked for. The fact that she arrived here under her own power was a good sign. I hope you're well?\n\nIt pains me to know that both Tyranis and Dalinda didn't return, but the embarrassment of Tyranis' decisions is hers to endure. It is something she will have to deal with when she returns to Darnassus."}
Q[1442]={d="你好，$n。我能为走在神圣道路上的人做些什么？\n\n啊，是的，斯蒂尔维尔，那个铁匠……好久不见了。我记得他很清楚，只是有段时间没听到他的名字了。\n\n我从不觉得他是个贪婪的人，所以他想要一颗考尔宝石，只可能出于高尚的动机。\n\n要找到这样的宝石，你得往灰谷西北方去。在那里你会找到一些古老的废墟和黑涩深渊。仍在使用那些宝石的纳迦就住在下面。别独自前往，$c。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. What can I do for one who follows a holy path?\n\nAh, yes, Stilwell, the blacksmith... from long ago. I remember him well, though, I have not heard his name in some time.\n\nHe never struck me as an impudent man, so I can only assume his desire for a Kor gem is noble.\n\nIf you truly wish for one of the gems, then you must head to the northwest of Ashenvale. You will find Blackfathom Deeps there within some ancient ruins. The naga who still use the gems are down below. Do not go alone, <class>.",o="给黑海岸的桑迪斯·织风带去一块科尔宝石。",oEN="Bring a Kor Gem to Thundris Windweaver in Darkshore.",p="对于一个向我要科尔宝石的人，我会怀疑他是不是真的追寻神圣的道路。不过我相信你胜于相信我的某些同类，更不会因为你们之中某人的堕落而怀疑你们所有的人。",pEN="I would be less trustful of one not on a holy path if they came asking about a Kor gem. But I trust your kind more than some of my kin. I do not judge your entire order based on the actions of just one of your fallen kind.",c="这正是史蒂威尔想要的宝石，不过在我让你拿给他之前，必须先去除其中的腐败成分——纳迦为科尔宝石灌输了强大的魔法，不过那是邪恶的魔法。\n\n告诉史蒂威尔，科尔宝石中的魔法能量都是纯正圣洁的，无论他想用它完成什么仪式都没有问题。\n\n我希望你知道自己在做什么，$c，你手里拿的可不是个简单的东西。",cEN="This is indeed the gem Stilwell desires, but before I can allow you to bring it to him, it must be purified of corruption--the naga wenches imbue the gems with power, that much is true, but of their own, evil kind.\n\nLet Stilwell know that its power is intact, and it should work well for whatever ritual he wishes it to be part of.\n\nI hope you know what you're doing, <class>, this is no simple item you possess."}
Q[1444]={d="预言者迦玛兰宣读了对我的放逐令，将我从阿塔哈卡神庙中赶了出来。我过去曾认为这位祭司是一位优秀的领导者。\n\n但他对自己的预言能力的过度依赖与盲目的服从一定会导致我们阿塔莱部族的毁灭，这是迟早的事情。\n\n当我说出了我所担忧的事情时，我被判为异端，从庙里被赶了出来。\n\n你拿来的这些东西都是无害的。但如果迦玛兰找到了能够启动召唤仪式的魔法神像，这个世界一定会落入巨大的灾难之中……",dEN="Jammal'an the Prophet sentenced me to exile from The Temple of Atal'Hakkar. I once felt the high priest was a worthy leader.\n\nHis unyielding faith in his prophecy will bring about the destruction of the Atal'ai. If it hasn't already.\n\nWhen I expressed my concerns, I was labeled an infidel and ousted from the temple.\n\nThose artifacts you brought to me are harmless. But if Jammal'an has found the proper fetish enchantment for the summoning ritual, the world lies in great peril....",o="向斯通纳德的费泽鲁尔回报。",oEN="Return to Fel'Zerul in Stonard.",c="距离上次我们交谈已经有很长一段时间了，$c。我希望你的旅程很顺利。\n\n你从辛特兰那个被流放的阿塔莱巨魔那里知道了些什么？",cEN="It has been quite some time since we spoke, <class>. I hope your journey was successful.\n\nWhat knowledge did you gain from the exiled Atal'ai in the Hinterlands?"}
Q[1445]={d="他提到了迦玛兰的预言？\n\n这位阿塔莱部族的精神领袖相信，只要哈卡从扭曲虚空回到艾泽拉斯，这位神祗就将赐予阿塔莱部族的每一个成员以永恒的生命。\n\n若你问我怎么看，我会说这实在是一个只会带来灾难的愚蠢行为。\n\n你说那个流亡者提到了魔法神像？这令我十分担心。如果这种东西确实是那个阿塔莱召唤仪式中的必需品，那我们就必须弄清楚这东西中蕴藏着怎样的力量。\n\n到那个神庙里去一趟，把这些神像都给我带回来！",dEN="So he spoke of Jammal'an's prophecy?\n\nThe Atal'ai spiritual leader believes once Hakkar returns to Azeroth from the Nether, the god will grant the Atal'ai tribe immortality.\n\nFoolish trickery to bring about a premature doomsday if you ask me.\n\nBut you say the exile spoke of enchanted fetishes? This concerns me greatly. If these are in fact the key to the Atal'ai ritual which caused this mess, we must understand their intrinsic powers.\n\nVenture into the Temple, and seize the fetishes!",o="收集20个哈卡神像，把它们带给斯通纳德的费泽鲁尔。",oEN="Collect 20 Fetishes of Hakkar and bring them to Fel'Zerul in Stonard.",p="如果阿塔莱的神像中蕴藏着能召唤出哈卡并实现迦玛兰预言的力量，那么我们就必须拿到它们。部落必须了解并掌握这种力量。",pEN="If the Atal'ai fetishes hold the power to summon Hakkar and fulfill Jammal'an's prophecy they must be seized. Such powers must be understood by the Horde!",c="勇敢的$c，你已证明自己是部落的$g伟大勇士:伟大勇士;。\n\n现在，这批哈卡巫毒雕像必须立刻处理掉。",cEN="Brave <class>, you have proven yourself to be a great champion of the Horde.\n\nNow this collection of fetishes of Hakkar must be dealt with at once!"}
Q[1446]={d="我的枯木同伴们对贸然闯入他们领地的陌生人不太和善。\n\n我吗？我连家都没有了。我原本属于悲伤沼泽的阿塔莱部族，不过现在却被我的同胞流放到这里来了。\n\n我们的精神领袖迦玛兰曾有过一个“预言”，他声称召唤哈卡会带给阿塔莱部族永恒的生命。\n\n但是我觉得有些不对劲的地方，如果这个预言仅仅是为了操纵我们，那我们该怎么办？\n\n我要为他们流放我的举动复仇，给我把迦玛兰的头带回来，也许这样我的同胞就可以重获自由。",dEN="My Witherbark companions don't take kindly to strangers around their home.\n\nMe? I don't have a home anymore. I was exiled from my people, the great Atal'ai tribe of the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nOur spiritual leader, Jammal'an, had what he called a prophecy. He believes the summoning of the god, Hakkar will bring the Atal'ai immortality.\n\nBut I urged caution. What if the prophecy was nothing more than manipulation?\n\nI want revenge for my exile. Bring me Jammal'an's head. Maybe then my people will be free.",o="辛特兰的阿塔莱流放者要你给他带回迦玛兰的头。",oEN="The Atal'ai Exile in The Hinterlands wants the Head of Jammal'an.",p="只要除掉迦玛兰，我就有机会回到我的同胞身边。\n\n如果迦玛兰继续蒙蔽他们的理智，那么阿塔莱必将遭受灭族之祸。",pEN="Once Jammal'an has been removed, I stand a chance of returning to my people.\n\nWith Jammal'an as their spiritual leader, the Atal'ai face certain destruction.",c="迦玛兰那可怕的错误信仰把我的同胞引上了绝路……\n\n谢谢你，$c，谢谢你为我被流放的事情复仇。我为我的同胞哀悼，我已经无家可归了。",cEN="Jammal'an's reckless trust of false visions led my people to their eternal doom.\n\nI thank you, <class>, for avenging my exile. I mourn for my people. I have no home to return to."}
Q[1447]={d="是啊，你显然不是来暴风城的$g最聪明的:最聪明的; $c，但你快成为$g离开这里的:离开这里的;最蠢的$g人:人;之一了。\n\n见过我的朋友吗？",dEN="Yeah, you're obviously not the smartest <class> to come into Stormwind, but you're about to be one of the dumbest to never leave.\n\nHave you met me friends?",o="击败暴风城的达舍尔·石拳。",oEN="Defeat Dashel Stonefist in Stormwind.",p="你是为什么事来的吗？你需要什么？",pEN="I didn't mean anything by the comment 'bout you being a stupid <class>. We're friends, right? No hard feelings?",c="我说你是个蠢$c，那话没别的意思。我们是朋友，对吧？别往心里去？",cEN="So, you came to me for a reason. What is it you need?"}
Q[1448]={d="曾经有段时间，我像你一样年轻，精力充沛，$c。\n\n但现在我老了，无法像从前那样探索世界。啊，我见过的那些东西！\n\n但有一个谜团始终躲着我。在我最后一次任务中，探险者协会派我去寻找阿塔哈卡神庙。据说它位于悲伤沼泽。\n\n由于身体虚弱，我骑着狮鹫从空中搜寻，但始终没能找到它。\n\n帮帮一个老矮人吧？也许你步行去运气会比我好。",dEN="There was a time when I was young and full of vigor like you, <class>.\n\nBut now I'm old and unable to explore the world like I once did. Ah, the things I saw!\n\nBut there was one mystery that eluded me. For my final quest, the Explorers' League sent me in search of The Temple of Atal'Hakkar. It was rumored to be located in the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nBecause of my frail state, I traveled the skies by gryphon in search of it but never found it.\n\nHelp an old dwarf out? Perhaps you will have better luck on foot.",o="暴风城的布罗哈恩·铁桶要求你去找到阿塔哈卡神庙。",oEN="Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind wants you to search for the Temple of Atal'Hakkar.",p="我曾到过艾泽拉斯的森林深处，也到过卡兹莫丹的雪峰峰顶。\n\n以前我从来没有在冒险的时候要求过别人的帮助，可现在我已经是一把老骨头啦。\n\n没什么事能比完成探险者协会赋予我的最后一个任务更能让我心满意足的了。\n\n如果你能帮我找到阿塔哈卡神庙的话，$c，我将对你感激不尽。\n\n希望你能仔细搜索悲伤沼泽，然后向我回报你的成果。",pEN="I have traveled the world from the jungles of Azeroth to the snowy peaks of Khaz Modan.\n\nNever before have I asked for help in my adventures. But my old bones are tired.\n\nNothing would leave me feeling more satisfied than knowing that I completed my final quest for the Explorers' League\n\nIf you'd be so kind as to help me search for the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, <class>, I'd greatly appreciate it.\n\nScour the Swamp of Sorrows and report back with your findings!",c="阿塔哈卡神庙已经沉没在泪水之池底了？而且被绿龙军团给围了起来？！\n\n真是个了不起的发现呀，$c，不过显然有什么地方不对劲……",cEN="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar has been sunk beneath the Pool of Tears? And surrounded by the green dragonflight?\n\nAn amazing discovery, <class>. But obviously something has gone terribly wrong."}
Q[1449]={d="正如我之前所说的，我曾经尝试过从空中寻找那座神殿。事实上，那次我并不是独自行动的。\n\n我先是去了位于辛特兰的鹰巢山上那座著名的狮鹫饲养场，在那里我请他们的一位最优秀的飞行员帮助我。在探险中，那位飞行员从他的座骑身上掉了下去，一直掉进了沼泽之中……\n\n我老了以后，这个可怜人的名字一直出现在我的脑海里，挥之不去。饲养场的管理员也应该还记得这件事。\n\n到那里去找弗斯塔德·蛮锤吧。\n\n我们得搞清楚那位飞行员后来到底怎么样了。",dEN="As I mentioned earlier, I attempted to scout the temple on my own from the air. Well, I wasn't exactly alone.\n\nI traveled to the renowned gryphon aviary at Aerie Peak in The Hinterlands. There I enlisted the aid of one of their finest pilots. The pilot fell off his mount, down into the swamp...\n\nIn my old age the poor fellow's name eludes me. The master of the aviary would remember, no doubt.\n\nJourney there and seek out Falstad Wildhammer.\n\nWe need to find out what happened to that pilot.",o="找到辛特兰的弗斯塔德·蛮锤。",oEN="Speak with High Thane Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands.",c="你想干什么，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？没看见我这儿一堆事要处理吗？谁有空站着跟$g某个:某个; $r $g唠叨鬼:唠叨鬼;闲扯？\n\n巨魔都快从木头缝里钻出来了！有话快说。",cEN="What do you want, laddy? Can't you see I've got problems to take care of here? Who has time to stand around yapping with some <race> chatterbox?\n\nThere are trolls coming out of the woodwork! Make it snappy."}
Q[1450]={d="那么说你这个$g毛头小子:小姑娘来这里就是给探险者协会里的某个老头子跑腿的吗？\n\n那你听好了，$c。我根本不知道他说的那个曾经在艾泽拉斯到处飞的老家伙是谁。你跑来问我这些，难道我脸上写着“狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧”这几个字吗？嗯？\n\n要是你想飞那么一次两次的，干嘛不去找个正儿八经的狮鹫饲养员呢？你要是还在这里继续闲晃的话，那我就真的要给你找点什么活去做做了。\n\n快走快走。",dEN="So you're a glorified errand <boy/girl> for some old Explorers' League geezer, eh?\n\nWell you listen to me, <class>. I don't know who your old buddy was flying around with down in Azeroth. Do I look like Gryphon Master Talonaxe to you? Do I?\n\nIf you're so interested in the flight assignments why don't you ask the gryphon master? If I catch you idling around here for much longer, I'm going to put you to some real work.\n\nNow get a move on.",o="与辛特兰的鹰巢山狮鹫饲养场里的狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gryphon Master Talonaxe inside the Aerie Peak Aviary.",c="啊，对。我还记得曾派出过一名狮鹫骑士去帮助布罗哈恩·铁桶。\n\n我对探险者协会一向是有着特别的感情的。我的父亲也曾经帮助他们的挖掘队伍找到了奥达曼古城。\n\n当时我派出了手下最优秀的狮鹫骑士去陪同布罗哈恩完成他的任务，嗯，我想想……他叫拉普索迪·铁铲。\n\n多么优秀的一个狮鹫骑手呀！可惜……",cEN="Ah, yes. Of course I remember sending one of my gryphon riders to lend a hand to Brohann Caskbelly.\n\nAlways had a soft spot in my heart for the Explorers' League. My father helped with the initial excavation team that discovered Uldaman as a matter of fact.\n\nI sent who I thought was my best gryphon rider at the time with Brohann. He was a chap by the name of Rhapsody Shindigger.\n\nAnd what a gryphon jockey he was! Well until..."}
Q[1451]={d="拉普索迪那家伙特别爱喝酒，不要误会我的意思——我们饲养场里所有的矮人没事的时候都爱喝上那么一小口麦酒。\n\n但拉普索迪不一样，那家伙一碰见烈酒就跟狮鹫见了天空一个模样。而且我不得不承认的是，没人能比拉普索迪这家伙飞得更好了。\n\n但是自从他勉强和你那位朋友飞回来以后，他就彻底变成了另一个人，因此我们只好让他走了。\n\n我听说拉普索迪东边的某个地方弄了个酒窖。",dEN="Rhapsody took quite a liking to the booze. Now don't get me wrong -- all of us dwarves up here at the aviary love a good ale when the time is right.\n\nBut ol' Shindigger took to the liquor like a gryphon takes to the skies. And a damned shame it was, too. No one could fly like Rhapsody.\n\nFirst sign of trouble was when he came stumbling back from that mission with your buddy, Brohann. All went down hill quickly after that. Had to let him go.\n\nLast I heard, he's set up a brew camp to the east of here...",o="去辛特兰找到拉普索迪·铁铲。",oEN="Seek out Rhapsody Shindigger in The Hinterlands.",c="嗝！\n\n我盯着你看，你却不停地晃。把我晃晕了。呵呵！\n\n嗝！\n\n哇！你感觉到了吗？地都在晃，$g朋友:朋友;。我需要来一杯。\n\n嗝！",cEN="Hiccup!\n\nI'm a-lookin' right at you but you keep bobbing up and down. Makin' me dizzy. Hoho!\n\nHiccup!\n\nWhoa! Did ya feel that? Ground is a-shakin', my friend. I need a drink.\n\nHiccup!"}
Q[1452]={d="嗝儿！\n\n你是那疯子加蠢蛋布罗哈恩派来的啊？我们倒是一起经历过一次大……大冒险……嗝儿！\n\n如果你想要知道我那时候掉进沼泽里的时候看到了什么，行，不过我得先喝上一杯好的。要知道那底下可不是什么美景……嗝儿！\n\n要不这么着吧……如果你给我弄些原料来配制卡利姆多鸡尾酒，我就告诉你。\n\n至于原材料，先去塔纳利斯搞点大鹏的砂囊……然后，然后……我看看……再去菲拉斯弄点格罗多克猩猩和铁鬃熊的肝脏来……\n\n这便是唯一能打开我的话匣子的东西，美味的卡利姆多鸡尾酒呀！",dEN="Hiccup!\n\nSo that crazy fool Brohann sent ya? My we had quite an adventure...Hiccup!\n\nIf ya want me to tell ya what happened down in the swamp, I'm gonna need me something stiff to drink. It wasn't a pretty scene, ya see. Hiccup!\n\nTell ya what... bring me what I need to whip up a Kalimdor Kocktail and I'll tell ya all about it.\n\nGonna need some Roc gizzards from Tanaris... and let's see... some Groddoc and Ironfur livers from Feralas...\n\nA nice stiff Kalimdor Kocktail... that'll get me talking!",o="辛特兰的拉普索迪·铁铲要求你带给他3块大鹏的砂囊、3块格罗多克猩猩的肝脏和3块铁鬃熊的肝脏。",oEN="Rhapsody Shindigger in The Hinterlands wants you to bring him 3 Roc Gizzards, 3 Groddoc Livers and 3 Ironfur Livers.",p="你喝过我酿的酒吗？要我说啊，这可是史上最好喝的酒！嗝儿！\n\n如果要我从那次差点要了我命的……嗝儿……沼泽飞行事故中缓过神来，你就得给我弄点东西来。嗝儿！\n\n你不想知道我把那些砂囊和肝加到卡利姆多鸡尾酒里是个什么味儿么？\n\n嗝儿！",pEN="Ya ever had a Rhapsody Malt? One of my finest brews, if I do say so myself. Hiccup!\n\nBut if I'm gonna relive the horrors of that fateful flight over... hiccup... the swamp, well I'm gonna need me something a wee bit stronger. Hiccup!\n\nDon't suppose you found me those gizzards and livers I need to add that extra kick to my Kalimdor Kocktail?\n\nHiccup!",c="我就知道你一定能搞定的！卡利姆多那地方可确实有些远。\n\n要是我亲自出马，一下子就能把这些杂七杂八的东西全都搞定。嗝儿！\n\n好吧，现在就让我来调制出一杯美酒，只要一口下肚，你想知道什么我就说什么。\n\n嗝儿！\n\n哎，一想到那沼泽的事我就要发抖。\n\n嗝儿！\n\n先让我喝上一杯壮壮胆。",cEN="I see ya had no trouble at all getting me what I need! Musta been quite a stint you had over there in far-off Kalimdor.\n\nIt won't take but a moment for me to extract what I need from these gizzards and livers. Hiccup!\n\nThen I can distill me a fierce ol' drink and finally tell ya what ya wanna know.\n\nHiccup!\n\nGetting shivers just thinking about that ol' swamp.\n\nHiccup!\n\nLemme whip up a drink real fast."}
Q[1453]={d="我有些活儿要你去凄凉之地跑一趟，$n。那里满地都是半人马和其它讨厌的东西，是个非常凶险的地方。不过如果你想找一份为期一星期的充实工作的话，就去那儿找克雷迪格·安戈尔，告诉他是我叫你去的。\n\n他就在尼耶尔前哨站，那是凄凉之地北部山区里的一个小营地。当你从石爪山进入凄凉之地的时候就向东转，尼耶尔前哨站有些难找，所以路上要多留心看看，免得错过了。",dEN="There's work to be done in Desolace, <name>. It's an atrocious place, befouled by centaur and other nasties. But if you're looking for a good week's honest work, then head there, meet with Kreldig Ungor, and tell him I sentcha.\n\nYou can find him holed up at Nijel's Point--it's a little cozy camp hidden in the mountains of northern Desolace. Just head east if you enter from the Stonetalon Mountains. It's easy to miss, so be on the lookout.",o="和凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Kreldig Ungor at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",c="很高兴看到还有愿意冒险的人。\n\n我叫克雷尔迪格。你加入回收者是个明智的选择，$n。人人都在找东西：一件宝物、一段逝去的爱情……而你能帮他们找到……当然，是有价钱的。",cEN="Glad to see the Reclaimers aren't in short supply of work, or adventurers willing to help out.\n\nI'm Kreldig, <name>. You've made a smart move helpin' out the Reclaimers. Everyone needs something these days: they've lost a family heirloom, a magic item, a loved one. You never can tell. But with the Reclaimers around, there's no reason, for the right price, everyone can't find what they've lost."}
Q[1454]={d="你好，$g朋友:朋友;。坐吧……\n\n我的第一单生意是给法师卡尼托尔的，他算是暴风城的某种贵族。看样子他的船在凄凉之地西北海面航行时遭到了海巨人的袭击。他和仆人试图把他的一只贵重箱子搬上岸，但海巨人成群袭来时，他选择丢下箱子，带着仆人传送走了。\n\n他希望我们找到那只箱子和里面的东西，送到暴风城给他。",dEN="My first order of business is for the mage Karnitol--a noble of some sort in Stormwind. Seems his ship was attacked by sea giants while off the coast in the northwest of Desolace. He and his servants tried to bring one of his more valuable chests ashore, but when the sea giants attacked in droves, he chose to abandon it and teleport himself and his servants to safety.\n\nHe wants us to find the chest and its contents, and return it to him in Stormwind.",o="在凄凉之地找到卡尼托的箱子。",oEN="Find Karnitol's Chest in Desolace.",c="你注意到这只箱子似乎没有进水。\n\n你注意的第二件事是这个箱子的顶部被撬开了，而且保护箱子的魔法机关早就已经被触发了——从箱子边缘的灼烧痕迹就可以看出这一点来。",cEN="You notice the chest does not seem to have any water damage.\n\nThe second thing you notice is that the top has been forced open, and whatever magical traps were set to safeguard it have long been triggered--this much is obvious from the burn marks around its edges."}
Q[1455]={d="你仔细考虑着到底是什么东西撬开了箱子，同时观察着箱子四周和顶部的又长又深的痕迹。显然，这并不像是某个人或是某个海巨人干的，而且这些撬痕似乎也不是匕首或者是利剑留下的。\n\n打开箱子检查了一番之后，你发现它是空的。\n\n找不到一点头绪，于是你关上箱子准备离开。克雷迪格一定会很失望。",dEN="You take a few moments to figure out what pried the chest open, and you notice along the sides and top of the chest, long, deep scratches that reveal that something other than a man or giant took interest in it. The marks don't appear as if they were caused by dagger or sword.\n\nAfter going through the chest you find it to be completely empty.\n\nNot having another course of action, you close the chest and prepare to leave. Kreldig will be disappointed.",o="回到凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔那里。",oEN="Return to Kreldig Ungor at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",c="欢迎回来，$n。你找到什么东西了吗？\n\n什么！？空的箱子？恐怕我们无法为一只空箱子付钱。\n\n请给我再讲讲你看到的箱子上的那些痕迹……",cEN="Welcome back to Nijel's Point, <name>. So, tell me what you found.\n\nWhat!? Nothing? An empty chest ain't gonna get us paid, I'm afraid.\n\nTell me more about these marks you saw... these slashes."}
Q[1456]={d="真有趣。\n\n其实，我们也不是一点希望都没有。\n\n在那个海岸更靠北的大海深处，有一片暗夜精灵的废墟。一个纳迦部落把那里当成了他们的家，他们管那地方叫什么来着……滑刺……不，是滑刃部族！我想我们可以去那里碰碰运气。\n\n如果有什么人能够深入到那么远的南部，那他们一定非常强大。如果你要去找卡尼托的东西，那么就准备对付更加强大的纳迦——滑刃潮行者或者滑刃海巫吧。",dEN="Intriguing.\n\nWell, we might not be without hope quite yet.\n\nAlong that same coast, but to the north near Ranazjar Isle, there're night elf ruins at the bottom of the ocean. A tribe of naga, the Slitherblade, make that their home. I think that'd be our best bet.\n\nIf a scouting party went that far south, then they must've been pretty powerful. If you're gonna find Karnitol's belongings, I'd start with the more powerful naga: the tidehunters or sea witches.",o="找到卡尼托的背包，把它交给凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔。",oEN="Find Karnitol's Satchel and return it to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",p="无论尼耶尔是谁，我都无意冒犯他，不过这个营地并不是我过夜的最佳场所，$n，希望你明白我的意思。",pEN="No offense to whoever Nijel is, but this camp ain't the most comfortable place I've spent a night, if you know what I mean, <name>.",c="太好了，$n！你找到了卡尼托尔的财物！\n\n那些该死的纳迦……总是惹麻烦。我想我宁可一辈子跟部落打仗，也不愿去对付那种货色。\n\n你为回收者立了大功。请收下这个，连同我们的谢意！",cEN="This is great, <name>! You found Karnitol's belongings!\n\nThose blasted naga, always causing trouble. I think I'd rather spend my life at war with the Horde than have to go against their kind. You've done a great service to the Reclaimers."}
Q[1457]={d="去把卡尼托的东西交给铁炉堡的罗顿吧，他会付你报酬的。\n\n哈哈，我敢跟你打赌，他一定会盛情邀请你加入我们的。\n\n再一次感谢你，$n，你干得很好。\n\n回去的时候要多加小心，别耽误太多的时间——卡尼托不是那种很有耐心的人，但是毫无疑问，他是非常慷慨的。",dEN="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done.\n\nHaha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time.\n\nAgain, great job, <name>.\n\nBe careful on your way back, and don't take too much time--Karnitol's not the most of patient of men, but he's very generous nonetheless.",o="把卡尼托的背包交给铁炉堡的罗顿·石锤。",oEN="Bring Karnitol's Satchel to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",p="$n，我的生意非常繁忙，所以没有很多时间来回答问题。如果你和寻物公司有生意往来的话，我洗耳恭听。否则，我只好请你去找我的手下谈谈，他们应该就可以处理你的问题了。",pEN="Business is booming, <name>, and I don't have a lot of time for questions. If you've got business with the Reclaimers, then let's hear it. If not, I'm gonna have to ask you to talk to one of me underlings - they're adept enough at taking care of things 'round here.",c="所以箱子毁了，但东西都在这儿，嗯？好吧，让他自己去评判吧。我这行当有个好处就是，要是客户不满意，我可以让他们滚蛋！他们是指望我们找到他们的东西……可没要求找回来的时候还得漂漂亮亮、完好无损。\n\n干得好，$n。现在我们来谈谈你的报酬。",cEN="Ah, the Karnitol business in Desolace. Excellent!\n\nSo, the chest was destroyed, but the items are all here, huh? Well, I'll let him be the judge of that. One good part about this business I got going on here is that if they're not satisfied, I can tell 'em to shove it! They're relyin' on us to find their stuff... not make sure it's all pretty and in good shape when they get it back.\n\nGood work, <name>. Let's see about gettin' you paid."}
Q[1458]={d="我到这里来的一个主要任务就是帮莱弗维奇收集材料，莱弗维奇是卡拉诺斯城中的一个侏儒法师。罗顿总觉得这件事对我们来说轻而易举，却对我们这里人手短缺的现状视而不见。\n\n他列出的清单上的前几件物品应该很容易找到，如果你帮我找到它们的话，就可以获得丰厚的报酬。\n\n首先你得从东边的怨怒萨特身上弄一些角和爪子回来，然后我们再来寻找清单上列出的其它物品。",dEN="One of my tasks out here involves picking up some reagents for Leftwitch, a gnome mage in Kharanos . Roetten seems to think it's easy coin in the bank since we're out here already. He doesn't really care that we're short-handed as is.\n\nThe first few items on his list should be easy enough to get, and it'd be a good chunk of coin for anyone helping me out.\n\nI need some horns and claws from the Hatefury satyr to the east of here. Bring 'em back to me and we'll get started on the rest of the list.",o="收集10只怨怒萨特的爪子和10根怨怒萨特的角，把它们交给凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔。",oEN="Bring 10 Hatefury Claws, and 10 Hatefury Horns to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",p="萨特是一种卑劣的畜牲，传说他们曾和暗夜精灵有一种说不清道不明的关系，不过我不是很相信那些说法。\n\n我想这样的说法大概源于很多年前，曾有个暗夜精灵让萨特卷入了战争中吧。这个世界真是越来越危险了……",pEN="Despicable creatures, the satyr. Story says they're somehow tied to the night elves, but I'm not so sure I believe it.\n\nI think they get that on account of that one elf that brought them into the war few years back. World's never been the same since. Lot more dangerous, and a lot scarier.",c="很好，很好，$n。不知道这些东西品质如何，但应该可以满足莱弗维奇的需要了，除非他要的是十分罕见的品种。嗯，当然，如果他想要特殊品种的话，应该会事先有所说明的。\n\n他的清单上的下一件物品是怎么说的？",cEN="Good good, <name>. Not sure if these are of any good quality, but if Leftwitch wanted a specific type, he should have specified before sending the Reclaimers out here to begin with.\n\nWhat say you to getting on with the next item on his list?"}
Q[1459]={d="莱弗维奇货单上的下一条……我看看……哦，在这里。\n\n非常简单，而且说明也写得非常清楚。他需要荒土蝎的毒液和科多兽的毛皮。清单上写得很清楚：这两件东西分别来自两个特定的物种：毒液来自于荒土鞭尾蝎，而毛皮则来自老迈的科多兽，注意，既不是濒死的科多兽也不是远古科多兽。\n\n法师……他们总是要一些稀奇古怪的东西……",dEN="Next on Leftwitch's list is... let's see... hmm. Oh, here it is.\n\nSimple enough, but pretty explicit in his directions. He needs venom from the scorpashi, and hide from some kodo. The fine print says both are from specific creatures: the venom's got to come from any of the scorpashi, and the hide's got to come from an aged kodo, not the dying or ancient ones.\n\nMages, I tell ya, some of the stuff they want... it's just weird.",o="收集7瓶鞭尾蝎的毒液和3块老迈科多兽的毛皮，把它们交给凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔。",oEN="Bring 7 vials of Scorpashi Venom and 3 Aged Kodo Hides to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",p="抱歉，我无法告诉你要到哪里去寻找科多兽或者荒土蝎。我不熟悉这片地区，而且也没有时间来进行调查。",pEN="Sorry I couldn't tell you where to find the kodo or the scorpashi. I'm not terribly familiar with the area, and I haven't had time to explore.",c="这是给你的酬劳，$n。你让我在凄凉之地节约了至少一半的时间。在你的帮助下，我应该可以早一些回到铁炉堡去，用热水好好泡泡脚了。\n\n我们收集完清单上的所有物品以后，我就可以回去了。到时候别忘了多来到我家来玩玩，我一定会买些上等的麦芽酒来招待你。\n\n不过，我们先得把这清单上剩下的材料都给收集到。",cEN="Your help here's a boon, <name>. You're cutting my time spent here in Desolace by half at least. I'll be back in Ironforge warming my feet in no time with your help.\n\nWhen we get this list taken care of, and I'm back home, look me up, I'll buy you an ale for sure.\n\nBut until then, let's get the rest of these reagents gathered."}
Q[1462]={o="向鸦羽先知要另一瓶大地灵契。",oEN="Speak to Seer Ravenfeather for another Earth Sapta."}
Q[1463]={o="向坎纳甘·地鸣要另一瓶大地灵契。",oEN="Speak to Canaga Earthcaller for another Earth Sapta.",p="我出于信任给你一个。你已经证明过自己一次了，不过我觉得你以后还是该多留点神。",pEN="I give you one in good faith. You already proved yourself once, but me tinkin' you should be more careful in the future."}
Q[1464]={o="向泰尔夫·祖拉姆再要一个 火焰灵契。",oEN="Speak to Telf Joolam for another Fire Sapta.",p="如果你在战斗中输给了火焰之魂，告诉我，我会再给你一个火焰灵契，让你能够看到山顶那座圣殿中的火焰之魂。",pEN="Speak to Telf Joolam for another Fire Sapta.",c="愿火焰在你的心中燃烧，$n。\n\n火焰元素在等着你。",cEN="May fire burn within your heart, <name>.\n\nThe elements await you."}
Q[1465]={d="你继续搜索货车时，不仅发现了一枚吊坠，还发现了向南延伸的脚印。远处你能看到一座大堡垒升起炊烟。那烟来自一堆有人看管的火，而不是建筑在燃烧，你的直觉告诉你，如果马勒姆一家还活着，他们被带往了那个方向。\n\n你认为尼耶尔前哨站的瓦拉里尔不但该看看你找到的吊坠，也该知道南边有生命迹象。",dEN="As you continue your search of the wagon you find not only a pendant, but also footprints leading off towards the south. In the distance you can see smoke rising from a large fort. The smoke is from a kept fire, not the burning of buildings, and your instincts tell you that the Malems, if still alive, were taken that direction.\n\nYou think Vahlarriel at Nijel's Point should not only see the pendant you've found, but also know about the signs of life to the south.",o="向凄凉之地的瓦拉里尔·屠魔者回复。",oEN="Return the Malem Pendant to Vahlarriel Demonslayer at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",c="这真让人恼火！一场彻彻底底的失败！\n\n我早就警告过他们两个，到这里来会非常危险。现在他们都失踪了……甚至可能会更糟。\n\n你说你看到了通向附近城堡的足迹？那也许是我们最后的赌注。\n\n根据当地人所说，那个城堡里有许多燃刃族的恶棍——燃刃族是一群异常残忍的兽人。他们也许不能代表部落的大部分信仰，但是他们非常邪恶，一旦你被他们发现，就会立刻招来杀身之祸。",cEN="Infuriating! This entire fiasco!\n\nThe two of them were warned about how dangerous coming here would be. Now they're both missing... or worse.\n\nYou said you saw tracks heading to a fort nearby? That may be our best bet.\n\nFrom what the locals have said, that fortress is infested with members of the Burning Blade--orcs who have dedicated themselves to demon causes. They may not represent the majority of the Horde's beliefs, but they are evil and will slay you on sight if you're caught spying."}
Q[1466]={d="这是物品列表上的最后一些东西了，我不会撒谎，撒谎可不是件光彩的事情。恐怕你得花更多的时间去寻找这些……\n\n我已经说了这么多了，言归正传。莱弗维奇的要求是：从噬法魔犬，法师猎手或者灵能猎犬那里收集大脑；从地狱魔女、地狱巫女或地狱修女那里收集魔女之翼；还有……从末日看守队长或者末日看守领主那里收集末日看守之血。\n\n是不是很简单啊？呵呵……如果你不想接这项任务的话，我也能理解。",dEN="This is the last of the items, and I won't lie, it ain't pretty. I'm also expecting this to take you a little bit longer than the other items.\n\nSo, enough with the warning, let's get this started. Leftwitch says he needs: ten brains from either mana eaters, mage hunters, or ley hunters. Ten nether wings from a nether maiden, sister or sorceress. And... ten vials of doomwarder blood from a doomwarder captain, or lord.\n\nSimple enough, huh? Sheesh... if you wanna pass on this one, I'd understand.",o="收集10个地狱犬的脑子、10对魔女之翼和10瓶末日看守之血，把它们交给凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔。",oEN="Bring 10 Felhound Brains, 10 Nether Wings, and 10 vials of Doomwarder Blood to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",p="我还没有意识到这些恶魔居然会出现在凄凉之地。我记得曾经从什么地方读到过……很多年前，暗夜精灵离开了这里，而半人马则接踵而至。\n\n我想知道恶魔们为什么会在这里出现，他们又是怎么来的。",pEN="I didn't even realize these demon things were in Desolace. Last I read, centaur pretty much owned the land after the night elves picked up and left years ago.\n\nI wonder why they took up here, and how.",c="你完成任务了？太让我吃惊了，$n，你真是太强悍了！你居然以一己之力对抗恶魔，而且还能全身而退！精彩至极！\n\n在我返回铁炉堡以后，我会亲自把你介绍给罗顿的。",cEN="Honestly? I wouldn't have thought it. You're amazing, <name>. Taking on demons for a mage's experiments, and coming back in one piece to boot. Great job!\n\nI'm personally gonna tell Roetten about you when I get back to Ironforge."}
Q[1467]={d="要想得到报酬，你就得去一趟铁炉堡，亲自和罗顿谈谈。他会非常乐意收到莱弗维奇的包裹的。把这个交给他，然后你应该就能收到报酬了。\n\n别担心，我回去以后会替你美言几句的，从理论上讲我应该不会在这个鬼地方呆太久的。",dEN="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway. Just give him this and it should be enough to get your booty.\n\nAnd don't worry, I'm still going to put in a good word for you when I get back. I shouldn't be in Desolace much longer.",o="把莱弗维奇的包裹交给铁炉堡的罗顿·石锤。",oEN="Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;，$n。生意红火得很。铁砧的敲击声在铁炉堡回荡，风箱把炉火吹得炽热，我老婆正在给我做晚饭后的甜点派。人生还能更美好吗？",pEN="Well met, <name>. Business is booming, the sounds of anvils being struck rings throughout Ironforge, the bellows blow the fires hot, and me wife's making me a pie for dessert after tonight's dinner. Could life be any grander?",c="啊，是从凄凉之地送来给莱弗维奇的包裹，太好了。我很感激你的认真工作及守时守信的态度，$c。很高兴能与你合作。\n\n这是你的报酬。让大家都知道寻物公司一直都坚持对辛勤的工作者们给予丰厚的报酬的！",cEN="Ah, the package for Leftwitch from Desolace. Excellent. I 'preciate the work, and your timeliness, <class>. Glad to have you aboard for at least this small bit of work.\n\nI got your payment right here. Let it be known that Reclaimers Inc. always pays well for a hard week's work."}
Q[1468]={d="你愿意来孤儿院帮我们？$G祝福你，$g朋友。你在儿童周期间的帮助将无比珍贵。\n\n拿着这只哨子。你只能用它一小段时间——通常不会超过儿童周本身。使用它，你就能和你同意照顾的孩子交谈。再次使用则会送走孩子。\n\n务必如此，$n——吹响哨子，去见你的被监护人吧！我相信那孩子一定非常想见到你。",dEN="You're willing to help us here at the orphanage? Bless you, friend; your aid during Children's Week will be invaluable.\n\nTake this whistle. You will only be able to use it for a short amount of time - typically not longer than Children's Week itself. When you use it, you will be able to talk with the child you've agreed to look after. Using it again will dismiss the child.\n\nBy all means <name> - use the whistle and meet your ward! I'm sure the child will be most eager to meet you.",o="使用人类孤儿哨来和你在儿童周期间要照顾的孩子进行对话。",oEN="Use the Human Orphan Whistle to talk with the child you will be looking after during Children's Week.",c="嗯……你好。我叫兰迪斯，我猜你是在照顾我吧？你是个冒险者，就像我爸爸妈妈以前那样。很高兴认识你。\n\n希望我们在一起能玩得很开心。我有些想做的事，院长说你这一周会像大哥哥一样待我。我很喜欢这样，是的先生。",cEN="Um... hi. My name is Randis and I guess you're looking after me? You're an adventurer, like my mom and dad were. I'm happy to meet you.\n\nI hope we'll have a lot of fun together. I have some things I'd like to do and the matron says you'll be like a big <brother/sister> to me during this week. I'd like that a whole bunch, yes <sir/lady>."}
Q[1469]={d="在出发前，我喝了整整一桶的烈酒。嗝儿！\n\n那是怎样的一次飞行呀！布罗哈恩跟着我飞了几圈，还是没看见庙。嗝儿！\n\n我喝得有点醉了，结果没抓稳就从坐骑上掉了下去。我一头栽进了水里，而且沉到了底儿，这个时候我竟然看见了那座庙。不过很快就从不知道哪里冒出了一大群巨魔把我给围了起来，废话，当然得快溜了！不过我还是从那些巨魔手中搞了点纪念品回来。给，把这个带给布罗哈恩，告诉他神庙确实就在那下面。嗝儿！",dEN="Before the flight, I drank me a whole keg of stout. Hiccup!\n\nAnd what a flight it was. Zipping around with Brohann following me. Didn't see no temple though. Hiccup!\n\nWell, didn't see no temple till I got a little too tipsy and fell off my mount. I plunged right into the water and was sucked down. Found myself surrounded by a bunch of creepy trolls. Sure swam out of there fast! Even made off with this troll souvenir. Here, take it to Brohann and let him know his temple is down there, indeed. Hiccup!",o="将阿塔莱石板碎片交给暴风城的布罗哈恩·铁桶。",oEN="Bring the Atal'ai Tablet Fragment to Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind.",p="你总算回来了，$n。好久没见了，我还以为你已经把我的事视l悀F呢。\n\n你找到那个狮鹫骑士了吗？他有没有告诉你些什么？",pEN="At long last you have returned, <name>. It has been quite some time since we last spoke. I thought perhaps you had forgotten about my quest.\n\nDid you locate that wily gryphon rider? Did he have anything to report?",c="拉普索迪·铁铲！对，就是他，就是他……我怎么能忘了这名字呢？\n\n这么说他一直就知道那神庙沉在水底啦？你一定跑了不少路。\n\n看看这阿塔莱神器！哈哈，这可真是个大发现呀！",cEN="Rhapsody Shindigger! That's right... how could I forget such a name?\n\nSo he knew about the sinking of the temple all along? Well, that certainly would have saved you some leg work.\n\nBut this Atal'ai artifact! Why, it's quite a find!"}
Q[1471]={d="你应该见过下边的那个召唤法阵了吧？只有站在那上面，你才能召唤出虚空行者来。\n\n用这些符文就可以进行召唤了，但在那之后，无论是用武器还是魔法，你必须击败它才能够对它进行操控。\n\n等虚空行者被你征服之后，它就会与你订下契约。契约签定完成之后就过来找我，我会向你说明召唤法术的使用方法，以便你以后随时召唤它。",dEN="Surely you have seen the circle of summoning below us? Only there will you be able to draw forth an unbound voidwalker.\n\nUsing these runes, you will be able to draw it forth, and then you must dominate it through strength of arms and magic.\n\nWhen it is subdued, it will be indentured to you. Come to me then, and I will elucidate the spell of summoning, so that it may serve you to whatever end you wish.",o="召唤并征服一只虚空行者，然后将召唤符文还给诅咒神庙中的凯伦丁·哈加尔。",oEN="Using the Runes of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Runes of Summoning to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",p="我期望着听到你的好消息，$n。至少别让我失望，不过，你应该不会失败的。",pEN="I expect to hear of your success, <name>. Not meeting my expectations will be the least of your worries, however, should you fail.",c="你干得非常好，$n。现在，我要开始教你如何召唤虚无行者了。\n\n它的力量以后将由你来控制，小心地使用它吧。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. Now, I will impart to you the spell used for summoning the voidwalker.\n\nThe power that it unleashed upon you is now yours to command. Use it wisely."}
Q[1472]={d="魅魔是灵魂的吞噬者，心灵的毁灭者，它们以诱惑人类为生，它们的心中只有纯粹的邪恶。\n\n在没有诱饵的情况下，我们是无法将它引入到我们的世界中来的。\n\n因此，我们要以它自身的力量来对抗它。只要有一个真正善良、纯洁而博爱的人的心脏，魅魔就将因为无法抵抗这种吸引力而被引入我们的世界。之后，你就要控制它，使它对你俯首贴耳。\n\n与我的助手高德瑞克·法杉谈谈吧，他就在神殿里。他会帮你找到你需要的诱饵。",dEN="A succubus is a devourer of souls, destroyer of hearts, tempter of men. A creature of profound evil and of singular mind.\n\nIt cannot be brought into our world without a stimulus.\n\nThus we use its own strength against it. With the hearts of good men, pure men, loving men, the succubus will be unable to resist, and will cross into our world. Then you can dominate it, and make it your own.\n\nSpeak with my assistant, Godrick Farsan, within the Temple. He will help you find your bait.",o="与诅咒神殿中的高德瑞克·法杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Godrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned.",c="你是凯伦丁大人派来的？$n，那么……\n\n别因为我瞎了就小看我。如今我已经有了某种我也弄不清楚的清晰灵觉，这让我即使丧失了视觉也能看清周围的东西。尽管我当初将它视为一种诅咒，但如今我觉得这是一种恩惠。",cEN="You were sent by Carendin? Sithel, then.\n\nDo not think light of me because my sight is gone. I see things that lie behind now, with clarity I had never known. What I once thought a curse, is now a boon."}
Q[1473]={d="看来大家都认为你$g已经准备好:已经准备好;学习召唤虚空行者了。\n\n那是由混沌创造出的生物，如果你召唤了它却无法控制它，它就会把你撕成碎片。\n\n埃加林是第一个召唤虚空行者的人，他在自己的魔典中解释了整个过程。\n\n不幸的是，血色十字军的一名特工把它从我们这里偷走了，现在藏在他们西边一座塔里的据点中。把它带给我，我就把这份知识传授给你。",dEN="It seems the consensus that you are ready to learn to summon a voidwalker.\n\nA being created of the chaos that lies beyond, if you summon one but cannot control it, you will be torn asunder.\n\nThe first voidwalker was summoned by Egalin, and in his grimoire is the process explained.\n\nUnfortunately, it was stolen from us by an agent of the Scarlet Crusade who has it secreted away in his base at a tower to the west. Bring it to me, and I will impart the knowledge to you.",o="夺回埃加林的魔典，把它交给诅咒神庙中的凯伦丁·哈加尔。",oEN="Recover Egalin's Grimoire and bring it to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.",p="埃加林是我的老师，他曾教我召唤虚无行者的方法。他很伟大，他只需要用一个眼神就可以操控他召唤出来的虚无行者。\n\n而当轮到我来进行召唤的时候，我过分的自信给我带来了不幸。不要轻视你还不能完全控制的这种力量，$n，即使你保持着警惕，它们还是随时有可能将你吞噬。",pEN="Egalin was the teacher that taught me. With hardly a look, he was able to command the voidwalker he had summoned.\n\nWhen it came my turn to try, I was overconfident. Do not trifle with the powers that you wield, <name>, they can consume even the vigilant.",c="啊，太棒了。看起来派瑞恩队长完全忽视了这本书中所蕴涵着的真正力量，亏他还专门把它从我们这里偷了过去。\n\n我们绝对不会再次把它给弄丢了。看着，$n，这就是施法的方式，你必须按这样的方法来引导魔法力量。",cEN="Ah, this is excellent. Like as not, Perrine was ignorant to the true power of the musty book he had stolen from us.\n\nIt will not fall out of our hands again. Observe, <name>, the structure of the spell, the manner in which your power must be channeled."}
Q[1474]={d="用这些心脏，对召唤法阵施法，打开一道让魅魔通过的门。你如今力量强大，但你需要用尽全力才能制服魅魔。\n\n小心她的魅惑，$n，许多高贵的心灵都屈从于她的意志。当你制服她之后，魅魔会回到虚空，那时我会教你今后随意召唤她的法术。",dEN="Using these hearts, cast a spell at the summoning circle to open a doorway for the succubus to come through. Your powers are greater now, and you will need all of them to defeat the succubus.",o="召唤并征服一只魅魔，然后将纯洁的心还给诅咒神庙里的凯伦丁·哈加尔。",oEN="Using the Pure Hearts, summon and subdue a succubus, then return the Pure Hearts to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",p="魅魔拥有能穿越虚无的强大力量，是最危险的生物之一，她经常将弱者们玩弄于股掌之间。\n\n从现在开始，你得永远记住这一点。",pEN="Of the powers from beyond the void, the succubus is one of the most dangerous, as the weak are most easily wrapped around its fingers.\n\nRemember that now and in the future.",c="又一次，你做得很好，$n。我已经很久没见过像你这样有潜力的$g年轻:年轻; $c了。请放心，我会继续关注你的进展，并为帮助你通过未来的考验做好准备。\n\n现在，让我为你展示刚刚被制服的魅魔的召唤法术。",cEN="Again, you have done well, <name>. It has been quite some time since I have seen a young <class> with as much potential as you. Be assured that I will continue to watch your progress, and prepare and assist you in your future trials.\n\nFor now, let me show you the summoning spell for your newly dominated succubus."}
Q[1475]={d="根据传说，阿塔哈卡神庙是供奉着古代神祗“夺魂者阿塔哈卡”的神圣祭坛，有一个名叫阿塔莱的巨魔部族世世代代守护着这座庙宇，据说从来也没人能进到庙中去一窥究竟。\n\n潜到泪水之池底部并从庙中取出古代的神器是件很困难的事，但这却正是我要你去做的，$n。\n\n帮我收集一些完整的阿塔莱石板，把它们带回来给我，这样一来我就能以英雄的身份回到探险者协会去了。我会和你一起分享这份荣耀。",dEN="According to legend, The Temple of Atal'Hakkar is a holy shrine dedicated to the ancient god, Hakkar the Soulflayer. Maintained by a vicious tribe of trolls named the Atal'ai, the temple is rumored to be impenetrable.\n\nNow sunk beneath the Pool of Tears, retrieving artifacts from the temple is even more difficult. But that's what I need you to do, <name>.\n\nAid me by gathering the intact Atal'ai Tablets. Bring them to me and I will return to the Explorers' Guild a hero. Together we will share the glory.",o="为暴风城的布罗哈恩·铁桶收集10块阿塔莱石板。",oEN="Gather 10 Atal'ai Tablets for Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind.",p="我已经不能再胜任一个冒险者的工作了，所以我希望你能帮忙，$n，帮我为探险者协会完成这最后的任务吧。如果我这身老骨头还有力气闯入悲伤沼泽、潜进神庙里的话，我肯定会和你并肩作战的。\n\n尽管我的自尊让我很难开口来要求你的帮助，但我的年纪让我不得不这么做。\n\n拜托你了，$n。我想在完成了探险者协会交给我的最后一个任务之后就光荣退休。",pEN="As dusk slowly descends upon my career I turn to you, <name>, to help me in my final quest for the Explorers' League. If my old bones could muster the strength to brave the Swamp of Sorrows and the sunken temple I would be fighting right alongside you.\n\nPride makes it hard for me to ask for your help in collecting the Atal'ai Tablets. But old age forces the necessity.\n\nPlease help me, <name>. I want to retire from the Explorers' League having completed their final bidding.",c="阿塔莱石板！太感谢你了，$n！\n\n我马上就将这个送去探险者协会，我们的名字将一起被载入史册。你帮助我这个老矮人完成了一生中的最后一件心愿。为此我将永远对你心存感激！",cEN="The Atal'ai Tablets! Thank you, <name>!\n\nOnce I deliver these to the Explorers' League our names shall go down in history together. You have helped an old dwarf fulfill his final obligation in life. For that I am eternally grateful."}
Q[1476]={d="有荣誉感与善良的人？这种人到底存在过吗？\n\n在进行了多年的研究并翻阅了无数的典籍与传说之后，我终于找到了两个符合我们标准的人。\n\n第一个叫达林·弗治维特，他将自己的全部身心都投入到了拯救那些被遗弃在格雷迈恩之墙外的洛丹伦难民的事业中。\n\n另一个叫科马·韦拉德。此人对他失踪了的爱人忠贞不渝，一直以来都在湿地中寻找着他的爱人的下落。\n\n把他们的心脏交给凯伦丁，不过首先，让我先告诉你到哪里去找。",dEN="Men of honor and goodness? Does such a man exist?\n\nIt took much research, but through bits of overheard stories, I managed to find two men that should do.\n\nThe first is Dalin Forgewright, who has dedicated himself to the care of the Lordaeron refugees, whom are refused by their kin at the Greymane Wall.\n\nThe other is Comar Villard, a man who remains faithful to his lost love, wandering the Wetlands for a sign of his wife.\n\nDeliver their hearts to Carendin. But first, let me show you your quarry.",o="将达林和科马的心脏交给诅咒神殿里的凯伦丁·哈加尔。",oEN="Bring the hearts of Dalin Forgewright and Comar Villard to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.",p="我对你当前的进展速度非常满意，$n。若能马上把心脏拿来，我对你将更满意。",pEN="I have been pleasantly surprised by the speed of your progress so far, <name>. Bring me the hearts and you will impress me once again.",c="从表面上看的话，所谓善良人的心脏似乎看起来也跟别的心脏没什么区别，你觉得呢？\n\n好吧，或许下次我们应该弄些能跟别的东西区分开的东西……啊，这些足够用了。魅魔无疑会被这些心脏所吸引的。",cEN="The heart of a goodly man seems much the same as any, when you see it like this, don't you think?\n\nPerhaps we possess something of a... different... view on the subject. These will do, though. I have no doubt that a succubus would be attracted by their purity."}
Q[1477]={d="法师们正在死亡之地的守望堡里进行研究，这项重要的研究关系到我们对黑暗之门的了解。他们需要持续的补给，然而我们到守望堡的补给线非常脆弱。\n\n你必须提供帮助以保证补给物资安全抵达守望堡。到夜色镇去找守卫队长索里加尔，按他的指示去做。这次任务要求你进入敌方区域，准备出发吧，$n。",dEN="Our mages are conducting research at Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands, research vital to our understanding of the Dark Portals. They require nearly constant supplies, but our supply line to Nethergarde is tenuous.\n\nYou must help ensure the supplies make it to Nethergard. Report to Watchmaster Sorigal in Darkshire, and do as he asks. This task will take you into hostile lands, <name>. Prepare yourself.",o="和守卫队长索里加尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Watchmaster Sorigal at Darkshire in Duskwood.",c="安多玛斯派你来的？很好。我有一项重要任务的吩咐给你。",cEN="Andromath sent you? Very good. I have an important task for you..."}
Q[1478]={d="啊，$n！我刚刚收到卡伦丁·哈尔加的消息，他想见你，继续你的训练。\n\n你该为自己感到$g骄傲:骄傲;，$n。哈尔加大师可不是每天都肯亲自指导$g一个:一个;年轻术士的。\n\n你可以在幽暗城的魔法区找到他，就在被诅咒者神殿附近。",dEN="Ah, <name>! I just received word from Carendin Halgar that he would like to see you for further training.\n\nYou should be proud of yourself, <name>. It's not every day that Master Halgar personally sees fit to instruct a young warlock.\n\nYou'll be able to find him in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, near the Temple of the Damned.",o="与幽暗城的凯伦丁·哈加尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Carendin Halgar in the Undercity.",c="很好，看来埃格隆找到你了，$n。我们就不要浪费时间说笑和寒暄了，直接来谈谈关于你的学习吧。你需要掌握的东西还有很多。",cEN="Good, I see Ageron managed to find you, <name>. Let us waste little time with small talk and pleasantries and focus on your training. There is still much you have to learn."}
Q[1479]={d="我听说过一个故事，故事里面说夜精灵的银行是建在一棵树里面的，那棵树看起来像一头熊!真是太酷了!夜精灵非常注重保护自然的和谐，但是熊熊听起来就很可怕!\n\n带我去看看那棵“熊树”吧?求求你了!有一条船会带我们去那里，一点都不远。求你了求你了求你了!",dEN="I've heard stories about how the night elves have their bank in a tree - one that looks like a bear! That's so cool! Night elves are neat how they like nature and stuff, but bears are just totally awesome!\n\nWould you take me to see the bear-tree in Darnassus, please? There's a boat that will take us close to there, and it shouldn't take very long. Please, please, please!",o="带着你看护的孤儿去达纳苏斯的银行。银行就坐落在一棵中空的树里，它被称为永恒之树。",oEN="Take the orphan to the bank of Darnassus. The bank itself is hollowed out of a tree known as the Bough of the Eternals.",p="我们到了吗？",pEN="Are we there yet?",c="哇，这比我想象中的还要酷——永恒之树！我没有想到它居然那么大，但是它真的有那么大！你看到树顶的小鸟了没有？！我不知道它们怎么能到那么高的地方去！\n\n谢谢你把我带到达纳苏斯来，$n。你真好！",cEN="Wow, it was cooler than I even imagined - the Bough of the Eternals! I didn't think it'd be so big, but it was! Did you see the bird on top of it too?! I wonder how they got the branches to look like that!\n\nThanks for taking me to Darnassus, <name>. You're awesome!"}
Q[1480]={d="这片被裁下来的皮子很臭，似乎已经有点腐烂了, 值得注意的是，这块看上去干燥而松脆的东西却异常柔软。\n\n在摊开它之后，你可以清楚地看见其中一面上有着用某种语言写成的红色标记文字。在皮子的底端有一个十分清晰的符号，你认为这是个签名。\n\n也许玛乌林能告诉你些什么？",dEN="The torn skin smells rotten, and is remarkably pliable for something that appears to be dry and fragile.\n\nAs you unroll it, you can clearly see the red markings of some kind of language on one side. At the bottom of the skin is a very clear symbol that you guess is a signature of some kind.\n\nPerhaps it is something Maurin could tell you more about?",o="把恶魔之皮拿给凄凉之地的玛乌林·碎骨看看。",oEN="Bring the Flayed Demon Skin to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.",p="火刃氏族开始意识到他们有多么的渺小了。他们的魔法是肤浅的，他们的力量是薄弱的。\n\n他们唯一可以依靠的力量来自他们所侍奉的主人，而不是来自于对于力量与知识的真正理解和掌握。",pEN="The Burning Blade begin to realize how weak they truly are. Their magics are pathetic, their strength feeble.\n\nTheir only power comes from those they serve, and not from any understanding of true power and knowledge.",c="嗯，这些符文确实是某种语言，$n，某种古老的语言。它们似乎与艾瑞达语有点类似，但仍然与其相去甚远。如果我没有看错的话，这是某种契约……你看这里，没错……这个符文正是一个恶魔的签名:阿兹雷索克领主。",cEN="Hmm, these runes are indeed a language, <name>, an old language. They seem remotely similar to the Eredun language, but the differences are drastic. If I am not mistaken, this is a contract of some kind.... Here, yes, this symbol is the demon's signature: Lord Azrethoc."}
Q[1481]={d="我可以在拥有适当材料的情况下找到这个恶魔领主。\n\n如果他确实如我推测的一般强大，那我就得先准备一些只有从非常危险的生物身上才能收集到的物品。既然你是为酋长做事的，那么我想你应该会接受我交付给你的任务吧。\n\n首先，我需要破坏他的反侦测结界。去给我找一块萨特的头皮来，不过并不是任何萨特的头皮都可以的，只有怨怒巡影者的头皮才能用。\n\n从凄凉之地东北部的古代遗迹附近开始找起吧。",dEN="I believe I can find this demon lord given the proper reagents.\n\nIf he is indeed as powerful as I suspect, I will need items gathered from deadly creatures. But you act in the Warchief's name, so I am sure you will accept my task.\n\nFirst, I will have to break any wards he has against scrying. For this, I will need the scalp from a satyr--but not any satyr. The scalp must come from a Hatefury shadowstalker.\n\nSearch for them among the ancient ruins in the northeast of Desolace.",o="给凄凉之地的玛乌林·碎骨带回一张巡影者的头皮。",oEN="Bring a Shadowstalker Scalp to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.",p="别带错的头皮给我，$c。如果用错材料的话，可是会要我们的命的。这个恶魔领主的身上可能有很多法术可以用来杀死那些想侦测他的人。\n\n命运已经让我品尝过那样的苦楚了。",pEN="Do not bring me an incorrect scalp, <class>. Using the incorrect reagents could cause our deaths. The demon lord may have contingency spells on his person to slay those who would scry upon him.\n\nFate has already dealt me enough pain.",c="很显然的巡影者没办法对付你，$c。真是令人印象深刻……非常深刻。\n\n这块头皮很适合我的法术。你不在的时候，我也已经准备好了其他的法术材料。\n\n我差不多都准备好了，我现在只需要集中精神施展这个法术——它就会把那个恶魔领主的影像和他的行踪展示给我们。",cEN="The shadowstalkers were unable to slay you, <class>. Impressive... most impressive.\n\nThis scalp will do nicely for my spell. While you were away, I was able to gather some of the other reagents needed for the spell.\n\nI am almost ready. I only need a focus for the spell--something to project an image of the demon lord and his whereabouts."}
Q[1482]={d="如果有一块神谕水晶就好了。这种东西一般都是由纳迦制造出来用于预言的。\n\n从这里向西北方向走，一直沿着海岸线前进，你会看到一个巨大的珊瑚礁，纳迦们通常在那一带活动。你可以在那里找到神谕水晶。滑刃纳迦并非善类，而且他们也不会对你的闯入表示欢迎，所以你要小心点，动作快点。\n\n等你回来以后，我们就可以开始寻找魔王阿兹雷索克了。",dEN="An oracle crystal would do nicely. They are crafted by the naga for their oracles to use.\n\nNorthwest of here, along the coast, is a vast coral reef that the naga have taken as their home when this close to the shore. You can find their oracles there. The Slitherblade are deadly and will not react kindly to your intrusions, so be careful and make haste.\n\nWhen you return, we shall see about finding this demon lord Azrethoc.",o="给凄凉之地的玛乌林·碎骨带回一块神谕水晶。",oEN="Bring an Oracle Crystal to Maurin Bonesplitter in Desolace.",p="我已经都准备好，就等神谕水晶了，$c。找到并除掉阿兹雷索克领主将为大酋长带来一个巨大的好处。我们得好好合作，尽快完成这件事，这样无论对我们还是酋长都有好处。",pEN="I am ready for the oracle crystal, <class>. Finding and destroying this Lord Azrethoc would garner a great deal of favor with the Warchief for both of us. We would do well to work together and to do so swiftly so we may further our own ends and curry favor with the Warchief.",c="就是这个，珍贵的神谕水晶……完美无暇……美丽动人。\n\n我们马上开始吧。找到恶魔领主将是我们的首要任务，而刺杀他则需要我们全心投入去行动。\n\n退后点，$c，让我们看这恶魔究竟是什么样子，还有他现在躲在哪儿。",cEN="A precious oracle crystal... flawless... beautiful. Indeed.\n\nWe shall begin immediately. Finding this demon lord should be our primary concern, and its slaying demands our utmost attention.\n\nTake a step back, <class>, and let us see what this demon is, and where he may be found."}
Q[1483]={d="风险投资公司偷走了许多最有天分的地精的创意，不过我们时不时地会偷一些回来。\n\n不久以前，风险投资公司在石爪山的分支机构居然雇佣了格雷苏——一个侏儒！他们的另一个工程师菲兹克斯只有靠边站了。他恳求我帮他在工匠协会找份工作，我交给他一些任务，不过他或许会需要帮助。\n\n也许你能帮他一把？菲兹克斯现在就住在狂风峭壁的西部。",dEN="The Venture Company stole many of the best goblin minds, but from time to time, we get the opportunity to steal some back.\n\nA while ago, the Venture Company outfit in the Stonetalon Mountains hired Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle--a gnome! Their other engineer, Ziz Fizziks, was so taken aback by this, he pleaded with me to find him new employment with the Tinkers' Union. I set him on a few tasks, but he might need help.\n\nMaybe you could look in on him for me? He's stationed at the western edge of Windshear Crag.",o="和狂风峭壁的菲兹克斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ziz Fizziks in Windshear Crag in Stonetalon Mountains.",c="我认为那些风险投资公司的高层简直就是些苛刻的监工，而我遇到的斯布特瓦夫是他们中最无情的！\n\n哈！不过比那更糟糕的是丢了工作……当然如果我和那个格雷苏一起工作，事情还会变得更糟。如果你过来是想提供些帮助的话，那么我这里正好有些事情让你做。",cEN="I thought those Venture Company higher-ups were slave drivers, but then I met Sputtervalve, the cruelest of them all!\n\nHa! Though it's better than being out of a job, I suppose... Or worse, working with that Gerenzo. If you're here to help, I've got something for you to do."}
Q[1484]={d="这家伙远比我预料的要危险得多。塔卡塔肯定会怀疑我是否能够成功地刺杀他，而且如果不把这件事情告诉他的话，实在是对他的侮辱。\n\n去告诉塔卡塔，如果他允许的话，你将去刺杀那个恶魔，不过你也不要太坚持，如果他有别的办法就最好了。",dEN="This creature is far more dangerous than I had anticipated. No doubt Takata questions my abilities to take on such a creature, and it would insult his honor if he were not informed about what just happened.\n\nSpeak to the swordsman, tell him you are willing to slay the demon if he would allow it, but do not press too hard. It is better if he thinks it his own idea.",o="与凄凉之地的塔卡塔·钢刃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",c="我看到了莫林以及他所侦测到的恶魔领主，即使只是他的亡魂，那力量也远比我的术士伙伴要强大得多。我怀疑莫林是否能打败这个怪物？如果我能亲自转至的话，或许会容易一些，但我的职责是保卫这里，如果我抛弃在这里的义务而为了个人的荣誉去挑战邪恶的话，我的氏族定然会因此蒙羞。",cEN="I witnessed what just occurred with Maurin and the demon lord. That creature, even as an apparition, seems to have more power than my warlock companion. I wonder if he's up to the task of defeating the monster? It would serve the Warchief better if I go myself, but with my responsibilities here, I would disgrace my clan if I turned my back on my duties here to battle this evil for my own honor."}
Q[1486]={d="当纳拉雷克斯沉入他的噩梦时，一种奇特的野兽从贫瘠之地下方涌出，进入了哀嚎洞穴。\n\n这些变异生物具有奇特而异界的性质。虽然它们本性邪恶，但我认为它们存在于卡利姆多也能带来一些好处。我相信它们的皮在制皮方面会特别有用。\n\n如果你觉得自己$g准备好:准备好;接下这项任务，就深入洞穴，弄些变异皮革回来。",dEN="As Naralex descended deeper into his nightmare, a strange breed of beasts arose from beneath the Barrens into the Wailing Caverns.\n\nThese deviate creatures have strange, otherworldly properties. While evil in nature, it is my opinion that some good can come from their existence here in Kalimdor. I believe their hides will be of particular use in the ways of leatherworking.\n\nIf you feel up to the task, venture into the caves below and retrieve some deviate hides.",o="哀嚎洞穴的纳尔帕克想要20张变异皮革。",oEN="Nalpak in the Wailing Caverns wants 20 Deviate Hides.",p="我对这些生活在洞穴中的变异生物身上的皮非常感兴趣。你弄到足够的皮了吗，$c？",pEN="I am very interested in examining the hides from the deviate creatures who have infested these caves. Have you had any luck in collecting some, <class>?",c="你收集了这么多的皮，我是不会忘记你的功绩的，$n。\n\n非常感谢你！",cEN="Your efforts shall not go unnoticed in gathering these hides, <name>.\n\nThank you for your dedication."}
Q[1487]={d="纳拉雷克斯有着一个崇高的目标。\n\n我们这位伟大的领袖一直想要进入翡翠梦境，将那片如今已经变得一片荒芜的土地变回过去那样茂密的森林，但似乎有一些可怕的事发生了。\n\n纳拉雷克斯的梦境不知为什么突然转化成了一场恶梦，同时，大量的堕落生物出现在了洞穴之中。\n\n一些纳拉雷克斯的信徒正在想办法来唤醒我们的领袖，而我此时的职责就是清除洞穴中的那些邪恶生物。\n\n去吧，$n，勇敢地把那些变异的生物都清除干净。",dEN="Naralex had a noble goal.\n\nOur great leader aspired to enter the Emerald Dream and help regrow these harsh lands back into the lush forest it once was. But something went terribly wrong.\n\nNaralex's dream turned into a nightmare and corrupt creatures began to inhabit the caverns.\n\nWhile some Disciples of Naralex seek to awake our master, my concern is with ridding these caves of the evil beasts.\n\nBrave the caverns, <name>, and eradicate the deviate spawn.",o="哀嚎洞穴的厄布鲁要求你杀掉7只变异破坏者、7只剧毒飞蛇、7只变异蹒跚者和7只变异尖牙风蛇。",oEN="Ebru in the Wailing Caverns wants you to kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs.",p="$n，我们纳拉雷克斯的门徒需要你的帮助。我们的主人在他扭曲的噩梦中受困，我们的人数正在减少。我们没有足够的力量应对如今盘踞在这些洞穴里的腐化生物。\n\n我求你了，进洞去，向那些变异生物开战！",pEN="<name>, we, the Disciples of Naralex, need your help. Our numbers are dwindling with our master trapped in his twisted nightmare. We have not the forces necessary to deal with the corrupt creatures which now haunt these caverns.\n\nI beg of you, enter the caves and wage war on the deviate creatures!",c="身为纳拉雷克斯的信徒，我对你的英勇与无畏表示赞赏，$n。\n\n清理干净这些洞穴将是我们重建贫瘠之地大计的第一步。\n\n感谢你，祝好运与你同在。",cEN="As a Disciple of Naralex, I commend your bravery, <name>.\n\nYour aid in ridding the caverns is the first step in our long plight to see the Barrens restored.\n\nThank you and may you prosper."}
Q[1488]={d="虽然我对这个魔王阿兹雷索克一无所知，但我同意玛乌林的观点：我们一定要尽快消灭掉这个恶魔，尤其是他正在逐渐控制火刃氏族为他的邪恶目的服务。\n\n到了你实现自己的诺言，为酋长和部落而战的时候了，我也相信你有能力召集一只小队去刺杀这个恶魔领主和他的爪牙。\n\n如果你准备好了，就直接向南方出发，消灭了这个威胁之后就回来向我复命。",dEN="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals.\n\nYou have already shown you wish to aid the Warchief, and I would trust you to gather a party to slay the demon lord and his warlock servant.\n\nWhen you are ready, head directly south, and return to me when the threat has been ended.",o="杀掉魔王阿兹雷索克和祖格卡，然后向凄凉之地的塔卡塔·钢刃复命。",oEN="Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",p="荣耀归于部落，而死亡归于吾敌，$n！\n\n凄凉之地的恶魔领主比以前更具威胁性了，我希望以后去觐见大酋长的时候，每次都能向他报告好消息，而不是像现在这样……\n\n有些时候，我真希望只有半人马需要对付。",pEN="Glory to the Horde, and death to our enemies, <name>!\n\nThe demons in Desolace pose a greater threat than ever before. My hope of returning to the Warchief dwindles as more and more of the foul creatures seem to appear.\n\nI sometimes wish it was only the centaur we had to deal with.",c="这对我们所有人来说都是一次重大的胜利，$n。让我们为你的成功而欣喜吧！我相信我们的未来不会再像我当初所想象的那样苍白了。\n\n恶魔们都将被消灭干净，火刃氏族也将不得不接受早已注定了的失败命运，而我们终究会再度得到一片我们可以称之为“家”的宁静土地。",cEN="A mighty victory for us all, <name>. Let us rejoice in your success. I trust now that our future here is not as bleak as I once thought.\n\nThe demons will be slain, the Burning Blade will fail in their efforts, and we may one day have a place we can safely call home again."}
Q[1489]={d="你带来的兽皮有一种奇怪的斑点，一种我从来没有见过的斑点。我确信绿洲里的水是造成这些斑点的原因，我甚至能够感受到它们给这片土地带来的混乱，这片土地现在死气沉沉的，就好像是长眠不醒了一样。\n\n哀嚎洞穴一定就是这一切问题的源头。但是，在你去那里调查以前，先去找德鲁伊长老哈缪尔·符文图腾谈谈吧。我托人给他捎了信，把关于在贫瘠之地所发生的一切都转告给他了。这位博学的长者应该能给你很多忠告。\n\n他就在雷霆崖的长者高地上。",dEN="The shells you brought me have a taint, one I have never before seen. I am certain the water of the Oases is the cause, and I can sense the confusion they cause this land. It is as if the land dreams and cannot awake.\n\nThe Wailing Caverns must be the source of the taint. But before you go there, speak with Hamuul Runetotem, the elder druid. I sent word to him of the happenings in the Barrens. He is wise, and can offer you counsel.\n\nYou will find him in Thunder Bluff, on the Elder Rise.",o="和哈缪尔·符文图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Hamuul Runetotem.",p="你师傅们把你派到这里实在太蠢，因为我再也不是天灾的奴隶了！",pEN="Your masters are fools to send you here, for I will never again be a Scourge slave!",c="我向你致以最诚挚的问候，$n。$g欢迎:欢迎;你来到我们中间。你最好积蓄你所有的力量……等待你的任务……极其艰巨。",cEN="I bid you greetings, <name>. You are welcome here, and I suggest you gather all your strength. For the task we now set before you ... is a dire one."}
Q[1490]={d="我进入了梦境之地，梦见一群德鲁伊住在哀嚎洞穴中。我看到他们的目标曾经高尚，但他们迷失了方向。如今他们侍奉着从贫瘠之地渗出的腐化。\n\n我老了，力量正在衰退。我无法在梦境之地久留，对腐化的德鲁伊所知甚少。但娜拉年轻，心志坚定。我被迫逃离时，她仍留在梦中。\n\n去跟娜拉谈谈。她就在那边的小屋里。",dEN="I entered the land of dreams, and dreamed of a cult of druids who dwell in the Wailing Caverns. I saw that their goals were once noble, but they have lost their way. They are now servants of the taint seeping through the Barrens.\n\nI am old and my strength fails. I could not long dwell in that dreaming place and know little more of the tainted druids. But Nara is young and her spirit is fierce. She remained in the dreaming when I fled.\n\nSpeak with Nara. She is in the tent, over yonder.",o="和纳拉·蛮鬃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nara Wildmane.",c="是的，这是真的。我认得哀嚎洞穴中的那些德鲁伊……我见过他们那扭曲而且长满缀鳞的面孔。我了解他们的罪行，我也了解他们的计划。\n\n你必须阻止他们，$n。",cEN="Yes, it is true. I know of the druids in the Wailing Caverns. I have seen their twisted, scaled faces. I know their crimes, and I know their plans.\n\nYou must stop them, <name>."}
Q[1491]={d="好吧，这些角似乎不太有用。不过没关系——万事开头难嘛！我想我已经找到另一种原料，可以让我制造出更好的智慧饮料！\n\n有一种叫做哀嚎香精的物质，我想这种东西就是造成贫瘠之地出现各种奇特动植物的原因。帮我找到这种物质，我要把它加入我的饮料里试试看！\n\n我听说这种物质可以在西边的哀嚎洞穴里的那些怪物身上找到，去猎捕这种生物，帮我收集哀嚎香精吧。",dEN="Ok, so the raptor horns didn't work so well. But that's all right -- no one got rich on their first try! And besides, I think I found something that'll work even better in my smart drinks!\n\nThere is a substance called Wailing Essence, and I think it is the cause of the strange plants and animals in the Barrens. Get me some and I'll try it in my drink!\n\nI heard the essence gathers in ectoplasmic creatures in the Wailing Caverns to the west. Hunt those creatures and gather the essence.",o="收集6份哀嚎香精，把它们交给棘齿城的麦伯克·米希瑞克斯。",oEN="Bring 6 portions of Wailing Essence to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet.",p="我要的哀嚎香精在哪里？",pEN="Where is my wailing essence?",c="好样的，你找到这东西了！我已经等不及要试试它了。我就知道我会赚一笔大钱的！\n\n谢谢你，$n。请接受这个作为报酬吧。我发誓，等我赚到了钱，就会给你更多报酬！",cEN="Great, you got it! I can't wait to try it out. This is going to make me a fortune, I just know it!\n\nThank you, <name>. Take this, and after I'm rich I'll send you more, I promise!"}
Q[1492]={d="我需要把一只装有药品、材料和其它物品的箱子送给我在卡利姆多的合伙人。我没时间把它送到棘齿城的码头上去，况且最后一支商队也早已经起航了。\n\n如果你方便的话，请把这只箱子交给码头管理员迪兹维格，他会把这只箱子放在下一班开往黑水湾的船上。",dEN="I have need to send a crate of potions, reagents and other items to my associates in the Old World. Little time I have to actually see them to the dock at Ratchet, and the last caravan has already left.\n\nIf you could, please take this to Wharfmaster Dizzywig. He will ensure that it is placed on the next boat to Blackwater Cove.",o="把保险箱交给棘齿城的码头管理员迪兹维格。",oEN="Bring the Secure Crate to Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet.",p="你是想搭下一班船呢，还是你有什么东西要送？",pEN="You seek passage on the next ship, or have some item you wish to send aboard it?",c="这么小的木箱。嗯，我应该能在船上找一个放木箱的地方。船会在下一次涨潮的时候出发，可以吗？好极了。让我把它记入货物帐目里去。\n\n好了，一切搞定！再见，$c。",cEN="A small enough crate. Yes, I should be able to find room for this aboard the ship. It sails with the next tide, I trust this is soon enough? Excellent. Let me just enter it into my ledger.\n\nAll taken care of! Good day to you, <class>."}
Q[1498]={d="作为一名战士，我们最重要的职责之一是……保护。我们是部落的盾牌，守护着较弱的同胞。若要加入我们的行列，你必须向我证明你的坚韧。\n\n去杜隆塔尔的雷霆山，那里住着雷皮族和雷加族。猎杀那些野兽！向我证明你比它们更强！顶住它们的攻击，并带回一捆烧焦的鳞片作为证明。\n\n做到了，我就指导你。",dEN="As a warrior, one of our most crucial tasks is... protection. We are the shield of the Horde, and we keep our weaker brethren safe. If you are to join in our ranks, then you must prove your mettle to me.",o="给贫瘠之地前沿哨所的犹塞克带回5块烧焦的鳞片。",oEN="Bring 5 Singed Scales to Uzzek at Far Watch Post in the Barrens.",p="你拿到鳞片了吗，$n？除非你可以承受那些雷霆蜥蜴的猛烈攻击，否则我不会给你任何好处的。",pEN="Do you have the scales, <name>? Unless you can withstand the attacks of the thunder lizards, you will not benefit from my instruction.",c="啊。看来你已经击败雷霆蜥蜴了，这证明你具有足够坚韧的意志。现在我将告诉你如何将坚实的肌肉和精良的技巧结合，以形成一堵坚不可摧的防御长城。\n\n好好学习这一课吧，$n。",cEN="Ah. I see you have defeated the thunder lizards, which proves you are tough. Now I will show you how tough skin and shrewd movements can combine to form an impenetrable wall of defense.\n\nLearn your lesson well, <name>. And be ready for future instruction."}
Q[1499]={d="祖雷萨正在找你这样的新手，让他们到当初你猎杀邪灵劣魔的那个地方旁边的洞穴里去，削减那里的生物数量。\n\n我想你可以在帮助她的过程中学到很多东西。记得跟她说，你是去帮忙解决小鬼问题的，她肯定会准备一份奖励给你。",dEN="Zureetha has been sending novices like yourself to help cull the numbers of the creatures in the cave near where you fought the vile familiars.\n\nI think it would be good for you to gain experience by assisting her. Be sure to tell her that you assisted with the imp problem, she'll probably have a reward for you.",o="与祖雷萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Zureetha Fargaze.",c="你做得很好，$n。\n\n虽然那些邪恶的仆从不过是灼刃氏族内部更黑暗势力的宠物，但你战胜它们预示着今后更大的功业。",cEN="You have done well, <name>.\n\nAlthough the vile familiars were merely pets of the darker powers within the Burning Blade, your success against them foretells greater deeds ahead."}
Q[1501]={d="很少有术士能活得够久的……我们冒着巨大的风险来研究恶魔，风险越大，回报越大。你必须尽快成熟起来，这样才会成为对酋长和部落有用的人。\n\n现在是该让你去学习新的召唤法术了。\n\n首先，你必须夺回维尔加石板，那个东西被火刃氏族的术士偷走了，现在石板被保存在他们的巢穴里，那个巢穴就在奥格瑞玛城东的骷髅石。有了石板之后，我会教你如何召唤虚空行者。",dEN="So few warlocks remain... We risk much, but the risks are warranted. You must quickly reach maturity in your ability if you are to be of use to the Horde and to the Warchief.\n\nIt is time that you learned a new summoning spell.\n\nFirst, you must recover the Tablet of Verga, which was stolen by warlocks of the Burning Blade and is now kept at their lair in Skull Rock to the east of the city. With the tablet, I will show you the runes necessary to summoning a voidwalker.",o="为奥格瑞玛的甘鲁尔·血眼找回维尔加石板。",oEN="Retrieve the Tablet of Verga for Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",p="你找到维尔加石板了吗，$n？没有它的话，我是不会和你说任何事的。",pEN="Do you have the Tablet of Verga, <name>? If not, I do not wish to speak with you until you do.",c="做得好。我想你在取回这东西的时候，还顺便让火刃氏族吃了些苦头吧？\n\n他们实在是大酋长的心头大患，也是我们术士中的败类。",cEN="Good. I hope you inflicted some other losses on the Burning Blade when you went to retrieve this.\n\nThey have been a source of great annoyance for the Warchief, and a great blight upon warlocks as a whole."}
Q[1502]={d="战士的武器品质至关重要。而要说有哪个兽人能打造出这样的武器，那就是图恩格里姆·火眼。他是个隐士，住在十字路口以东的山丘顶上。\n\n如果你想要一把武器，$g战士:战士;，就往西走到十字路口，到了之后再往东进入山丘。他的营地就在山顶上。",dEN="It is vital that a warrior's weapon is one of quality. And if there is an orc who can craft quality weapons, then that orc is Thun'grim Firegaze. He is a hermit who dwells atop the hills east of the Crossroads.\n\nIf you seek a weapon, warrior, then you should seek Thun'grim. To find him, first travel to the Crossroads to the west, then strike east into the hills. His camp is high on a hilltop.",o="与贫瘠之地的索恩格瑞姆·火眼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.",c="我盯着熔炉的火焰太久，眼睛早已干涸，但有些东西我仍能看见。我能看出你想要些什么。\n\n而如果你找到了这里，那我想我知道你渴望什么。",cEN="My eyes have long dried out from staring into the forge's flame, but some things I can still see. I can see you want something.\n\nAnd if you found your way here, then I can guess what you desire."}
Q[1503]={d="$n，我会给你一柄武器，但首先我需要你的帮助。几天前的一个晚上，西北边的那些钢鬃部落的家伙摸进了我的营地，他们不敢和我正面交战，但是他们知道我眼睛不好使，所以就想办法用响声把我引出来，然后派几个同伙溜进去偷了我的东西！\n\n他们偷走了一只铁箱子，里面是一些铸造好的钢锭。如果你能够找到它们的话，我就会给你一件你用得到的武器。\n\n你应该可以在钢鬃野猪人的营地里找到那只铁箱子，把那些钢锭给我拿回来。",dEN="I will give you a weapon, <name>, but first you must aid me. The Razormanes to the northwest came into my camp a few nights past. They would not meet me in combat, but they know my eyes are bad--a few distracted me with snorts while others stole from me! The cowards!\n\nThey took an iron chest, and within it were some forged steel bars. If you can recover them then I will give you the weapon you seek.\n\nSearch for the iron box within the quilboar camps, and return with the forged steel bars.",o="把锻造好的钢锭带给贫瘠之地的索恩格瑞姆·火眼。",oEN="Bring the Forged Steel Bars to Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.",p="你找到我的那些钢锭了吗？",pEN="Do you have my steel bars?",c="你找到它们了！所有的钢锭都在这里，我早就知道凭钢鬃野猪人的智商是不知道怎么使用这些钢锭的。\n\n谢谢你，$n。这是给你的奖励，希望它能在你将来的战斗中发挥应有的作用。",cEN="You found them! And all the bars are here, which doesn't surprise me. I didn't think the Razormanes would know what to do with fine steel like this.\n\nThank you, <name>. Here is your reward. May it serve you well."}
Q[1504]={d="你会看到石板上刻着召唤用的符文。把它带到洞穴另一侧尼鲁·火刃的帐篷里那个法阵；在那里你就能召唤虚空行者。\n\n用你掌握的任何物理或魔法手段击败它。然后把召唤符文还给我，我会教你如何将那个生物束缚在你的意志之下。",dEN="Now, observe the Tablet of Verga, for it contains the glyphs you will need for the summoning. Take them to the circle in Neeru Fireblade's tent on the other side of the cavern. There you will be able to call for the voidwalker.",o="召唤并征服一只虚空行者，然后带着召唤铭文向奥格瑞玛的甘鲁尔·血眼回报。",oEN="Using the Glyphs of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Glyphs of Summoning to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",p="虚空行者是强大的生物。我记得自己也曾经像你现在这样，$n。这些年下来，我自己的虚空行者越来越少跟我对抗了，不过我怀疑那只是因为它希望我放松警惕。\n\n记住这一点。",pEN="The voidwalker is a powerful creature. I remember when it was I that was in your shoes, <name>. Over the years, my own voidwalker has grown to fight me less, though I suspect that is only because it hopes I will let my guard down.\n\nRemember that, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。研究一下这份古卷，它将告诉你如何将你刚才击败了的虚无行者再次召唤出来。\n\n你应该知道我对你抱有很高的期望，而你也从没有辜负过我，至少到当前为止是这样的。\n\n不过，无论是什么事情都不要看得太重，你必须以平常心来看待这些事，就像每天早上起床洗漱一样简单而自然地做好它们。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. I will show you how to summon the voidwalker similar to the one you just defeated.\n\nYou should know that we have high expectations for you, and you have, so far, matched them.\n\nDo not let it go to your head, however, as the tasks that still lie before you will make this seem as simple as waking in the morning."}
Q[1505]={d="部落非常尊重战士，因为他们具有毋庸置疑的力量。但是真正伟大的战士同时也是一个优秀的学生。\n\n去找犹塞克吧，他经历了很多场战斗，并且向很多年轻的战士传授过精湛的战斗技艺。你可以在前沿哨所的南边找到他，那个地方位于贫瘠之地和杜隆塔尔的交界处，就在这里的东边。",dEN="The Horde honors its warriors because their strength is unquestioned. But the truly great warriors are great students as well.\n\nSeek out Uzzek. He is a veteran of many battles and now instructs young warriors in the ways of combat. You will find him south of Far Watch Post, the orc garrison on the border of the Barrens and Durotar.",o="和前沿哨所的犹塞克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Uzzek at Far Watch Post in the Barrens.",c="你好，年轻人。你是来这里寻求指引的吗？",cEN="Hello, young one. Here for some instruction, are you?"}
Q[1506]={d="嘿，你！你叫$n，没错吧？\n\n你现在不忙吧？甘鲁尔要马上见你。他在暗影裂口和几个高阶术士待在一起。\n\n根据我以前和他打交道的经验，他找你要么是有什么美差吩咐给你，要么就是你大难临头了。",dEN="You there. <name>, right?\n\nI hope your schedule isn't busy, because Gan'rul wants to see you right away. You'll find him with the senior warlocks in the Cleft of Shadow.\n\nBased on my past dealings with Gan'rul, your summons is either a very good thing or a very bad thing.",o="去奥格瑞玛和甘鲁尔·血眼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",c="很好，我还担心奥菲克找不到你呢。\n\n现在是时候让你的术士训练更进一步了。你手边的其它事都得暂时放一放。\n\n我相信你对此没什么意见吧？",cEN="Good. I was afraid Ophek wouldn't reach you.\n\nIt is time that I further your warlock training. Any business you have currently will have to wait.\n\nI trust there will not be a problem with this?"}
Q[1507]={d="是时候让你学些其它的召唤魔法了。你得学习如何召唤魅魔，那是一种具有非常强大的精神力量的恶魔。她会诱惑意志薄弱者，让他们心甘情愿地成为她的奴隶！我觉得你已经有足够的能力去面对这样的挑战了。\n\n魅魔只能在以一件象征着伟大的爱与奉献的物品作为媒质的情况下才能被召唤出来，你必须自己去寻找一件这样的东西。\n\n建议？去和卡祖尔谈谈吧……这世上没什么东西是那个老术士不知道的。",dEN="The time has come for you to learn more of the summoning magics. You will learn to summon a succubus, a creature of incredible mental powers. It can lull those of weak minds into its servitude--but have no fear! I feel certain that you will be equal to the challenge.\n\nA succubus can only be summoned when baited with an item that represents great devotion and love. I leave it to you to find such an object.\n\nA suggestion? Speak with Cazul... There seems to be little the ancient warlock does not know.",o="和暗影裂口的卡祖尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Cazul in the Cleft of Shadow.",c="嗯……$n。你在自己的道路上仍是个$g新手:新手;，但我感觉到你身上有成就伟大的可能。\n\n你生来就有天赋，$n。别让它们白白浪费。",cEN="Hm... Zarm. You are still new to your path, but I sense the possibility for greatness in you.\n\nYou were born with gifts, <name>. See that they do not go to waste."}
Q[1508]={d="嗯……根本不用问你是为什么来找我的。\n\n既然是甘鲁尔让你来，那你一定是想要召唤魅魔了，而你现在需要一件东西作为媒质，对吧？\n\n嗯……如果你确信我这个瞎子能够帮助你的话，那就听着吧，$n。在奥格瑞玛城内的通天塔以西的一处断崖上住着一个名叫赞卡沙的女性。\n\n去找她吧。",dEN="Hmm... But, of course, that is not why you have come to speak with me.\n\nIf Gan'rul has sent you to me, it must be that you are to summon a succubus, and need an object to use for enticement.\n\nHmm... If you trust a blind man to lead you, <name>, then listen. In the bluffs of Orgrimmar, west of the wind rider tower, lives Zankaja. She waits for the return of her mate.\n\nGo to her.",o="和奥格瑞玛的赞卡沙谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Zankaja in Orgrimmar.",c="你有没有听说过多格兰这个名字？按理说他应该几天前就回来了，但我却没有任何有关他的消息。",cEN="Have you come with news of Dogran? He was to have returned days ago, and I have heard nothing..."}
Q[1509]={d="我的伴侣多格兰最近被调往十字路口执勤。那是一次晋升，他非常自豪。\n\n我当然难过，但我没让他知道。我也很担心。贫瘠之地比奥格瑞玛危险得多，我总往坏处想。\n\n现在他本该回来已经一周了，我却一点消息都没有……\n\n你能去十字路口打听一下吗？跟加兹罗格谈谈，他们本来是一起驻防的。",dEN="My mate, Dogran, was recently sent to the Crossroads for duty. It was a promotion, and he was very proud.\n\nI was sad, of course, but I didn't let him know that. And worried, too. The Barrens is a more dangerous place than Orgrimmar, and I feared the worst.\n\nNow it's been a week after he should have returned, and I have received no word from him...\n\nPerhaps you could go to the Crossroads and see if they have any news? He worked with Gazrog, who should still be stationed there.",o="找到十字路口的加兹罗格并和他谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gazrog at the Crossroads.",c="赞卡扎？那是多格兰的伴侣，对吧？\n\n是的，我听说过他的消息，但这不是那种该让她知道的新闻……\n\n不，他没死。但他受了伤，成了野猪人的俘虏。",cEN="Zankaja? That's Dogran's mate, right?\n\nYeah, I've heard from him, but it's not the sort of news we should let get back to her...\n\nNo, he's not dead. But he is injured and a prisoner of the quilboar."}
Q[1510]={d="他是在陶拉祖营地被抓住的。我们当时正在和那里的野猪人交战，他带了一小队步兵去进攻野猪人的一处营地，但他在那场战斗里受了重伤。其他战士杀出重围，然后想要回去救他，但多格兰的情况很糟糕，他的伤口已经溃烂了，所以他们觉得要是不能先把他治好再带出来的话，他可能就会因为伤筋动骨而死掉。\n\n所以他们和这里联络了一下，希望能从石爪山的玛拉卡金那里的巨魔手里讨些伤药来。我们已经派人去找巨魔们了，但他们至今还没有回复我们。",dEN="He was stationed at Camp Taurajo, where we've been trying to weed out the quilboar. He led a few grunts to one of their camps, where he was hurt bad. The others made it back and tried to rescue him. He was in bad shape, his wounds festered, so they were afraid to move him without patching him up first.\n\nThey sent a message here, requesting a healing draught from the trolls at the Malaka'jin at the base of the Stonetalon Mountains. We sent someone to get it, but they haven't returned yet.",o="找到玛拉卡金的肯兹格拉并和他谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ken'zigla at the Malaka'jin.",c="$g又一个:又一个; $r，嗯？希望你不是为另一个来的。他没挺过来。那些地精把他收拾得够呛。\n\n他说他需要一瓶治疗药水，别的就没多说了。",cEN="Another <race>, eh? I hope you haven't come for the other. He didn't make it. Those goblins did him in good.\n\nHe said he needed a healing draught, but not much else."}
Q[1511]={d="我得告诉你们，可能还会有其他人来向我讨伤药，所以我得在这里随时做好准备。\n\n快回去吧，$n。你得注意，一开始只能给他一半伤药！这一半足以让他在活动的时候不再出血，免得失血过多而死。等过了一个晚上之后再给他另一半。\n\n总之，你得把它带给陶拉祖营地里的劳格玛。根据他派来的上一个信使所说的，他应该已经知道多格兰被关在哪儿了。",dEN="I figured there might be another coming to get the draught, so I prepared it anyways.\n\nHere you go, <name>. Mind you, you should only give half of it to him! That will give him enough strength to move without bleeding himself dry. Wait a night, then give him the other half.\n\nAnyways, you'll want to bring this to Logmar at Camp Taurajo. From what the first one told me, he should have an idea where this Dogran is.",o="将肯兹格拉的伤药交给陶拉祖营地的步兵劳格玛。",oEN="Bring Ken'zigla's Draught to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo.",p="怎么啦？",pEN="Yes, what is it?",c="太好了！多格兰恐怕已经奄奄一息，就等着这东西救命了！\n\n我们得赶紧把这个送到他那里，可是这儿几乎所有的蛮兵都出去寻找补给物资了……",cEN="Well, it's about time! Dogran has been dying out there, waiting for this.\n\nWe need to get this out to him right away, but most of the grunts stationed here are out on a foraging mission."}
Q[1512]={d="赞卡沙年轻而美丽，却得跟一个残废过上一辈子……我可不能让她受这种苦。\n\n别管我了，$n。谢谢你。我将会在战斗中光荣地结束我的生命，而不是拖着这破碎的躯壳白白度过后半辈子。\n\n拜托，别把这些告诉我的老婆……我可不想让她在良心上受谴责。",dEN="Zankaja is young and beautiful. To be chained to an invalid... I will not allow her to suffer that injustice.\n\nLeave me, <name>. And thank you. I may end my life in glorious battle, instead of a lifeless husk.\n\nAnd please, I would ask you not to tell my mate of this... I do not want guilt on her conscience.",o="把沾满泥土的坠饰带给奥格瑞玛的甘鲁尔·血眼。",oEN="Bring the Dirt-caked Pendant to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",p="你回来了。准备好挑战魅魔了吗？",pEN="You have returned. Are you ready to battle a succubus?",c="既然你告诉我这个东西确实达到了要求，那我就相信你，$n。容我把它弄弄干净……质朴而闪光，这对魅魔来说可的确是个好媒质。",cEN="If you tell me that this will suffice, then I trust you, <name>. Allow me to clean it though... Pristine and shining, it may be even more enticing to a succubus."}
Q[1513]={d="$n，把这个带到尼鲁帐篷里的召唤法阵去。召唤一个魅魔，向它展示你的本事。你够强了。但要谨慎；傲慢和过度自信曾毁掉过不止一个好术士。\n\n击败它之后，把吊坠还给我，这样我就能告诉赞卡扎发生了什么。",dEN="Take this to the summoning circle in Neeru's tent, <name>. Summon forth a foul succubus, then show it your mastery. I believe in the strength of your magic. As always, though, be wary, for pride and overconfidence has overcome many a promising warlock.",o="召唤并征服一只魅魔，然后将多格兰的坠饰还给奥格瑞玛的甘鲁尔·血眼。",oEN="Using Dogran's Pendant, summon and subdue a succubus, then return Dogran's Pendant to Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",p="一看到魅魔，我的心脏就开始咆哮……但与此同时，我能感觉到我的灵魂正在迅速消逝，如海潮退却一般地衰减。\n\n你要多加小心，我的朋友。",pEN="When I look upon a succubus, my heart begins to soar... But at the same time, I can almost sense my soul's ebb, drifting away like the tides.\n\nBe wary, my friend.",c="成功了！我就没指望我的$g明星学徒:明星学徒;会差到哪去。\n\n你证明了自己的价值，我很乐意教你召唤已被制服的魅魔的方法。现在去吧，你还有很多要学，下次我见到你时，希望你已经真正掌握了你的魅魔。\n\n把多格兰和赞卡扎的悲伤留给我们这些年长的人去承受，但要记住它，并把它当作护盾，抵挡你今天学会召唤的黑暗力量的诡计。",cEN="Success! Be sure I expected nothing less from my star pupil.\n\nYou have proven your worth, and gladly will I show you the method of summoning your subdued succubus. Go now, you have much to learn, and when next I see you, I will expect you to have found true mastery over your succubus.\n\nLeave the sorrow of Dogran and Zankaja to those of us who are longer in years, but remember it, and hold it as protection against the wiles of the dark power you have learned to summon today."}
Q[1514]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[1515]={d="你为这件事儿出了很多力，所以你如果愿意帮忙帮到底的话，我当然不会阻止你。但我没办法派给你更多的人了，所以你恐怕只能一个人去救多格兰……\n\n多格兰被关在北边的一处野猪人营地里。注意那里的两座小屋子，如果他还没被杀掉或者因为伤口恶化而死掉的话，那群野猪人应该会严密看守他的。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="You've made it this far, so if you want to see this through to the end, I won't stop you. I can't spare you any additional manpower though, you'll be on your own.\n\nDogran is being held in a quilboar camp to the north of here. Look for a group of two huts. He'll be heavily guarded--that is, if they haven't killed him yet, or he hasn't succumbed to his wounds.\n\nGood luck.",o="把肯兹格拉的伤药带给贫瘠之地的多格兰。",oEN="Bring Ken'zigla's Draught to Dogran in the Barrens.",p="啊啊啊……有人来救我了吗……",pEN="Urrrghhhh...",c="这药可真够难喝的……\n\n我感觉我现在又有劲了，能爬着走了……但我的腿，我怕以后得落下个终身残疾了。我的胳膊也不行了。",cEN="Foul tasting brew...\n\nI can feel the strength in me now, enough to hobble away... But my leg, I will have lost it for the rest of my life. My arm, too."}
Q[1516]={d="时候到了，年轻的$c。你正在变强，你的精神像大地一样坚韧。走上萨满之路，说明你在证明自己之前就已拥有智慧。\n\n大地元素将指引你的命运，如果你$g准备好:准备好;，它会成为你的一部分。但你必须始终对它表示感激。如果你$g准备好:准备好;，你将看到只有萨满才知晓的事物。\n\n去北方寻找邪能追猎者，从它们身上取两只蹄子。拿到之后回到这里，我们再谈谈你的未来。|n",dEN="The time is now, young <class>. You've grown strong and your spirit endures like the earth. Following the shaman's path shows you have wisdom before even proving yourself.\n\nThe element of earth will guide your destiny, becoming part of you if you are ready. But you must stand before the earth itself. If you are ready, then you will see things only shaman know of.\n\nSeek out the Felstalkers to the north, and take from them two of their hooves. Return to me then, and we shall speak more of your future.",o="给试炼谷的坎纳甘·地鸣带去2只地狱捕猎者的蹄子。",oEN="Bring 2 Felstalker Hooves to Canaga Earthcaller in the Valley of Trials.",p="坚韧是大地最伟大的美德。大地见证着万物归环的道理：巍峨的高山或许会变为平坦的沙漠，宽阔的河流或许会变为狭窄的溪谷。大地的元素是所有元素之中最亘古不变且最为睿智的，它不会容忍任何急躁的行为。\n\n时间就要到了，大地将会召唤你。当你在成功后再度回到我这里来的时候，你就会对它有更深的了解。\n\n无知者会因你的睿智而嫉妒你，因他们的渺小而憎恨你。",pEN="Patience is earth's greatest virtue. The earth witnesses the cycle of all things: the mountains becoming deserts; rivers becoming canyons. The earth is the most stubborn and wise of all the elements and it does not tolerate impatience.\n\nThe earth beckons you now because a time of conflict draws near. When you return to me successful, then you shall be that much closer to being made whole.\n\nOthers will be envious of your wisdom and hate you for their ignorance.",c="很好。你的成功代表着你已经准备好进入下一个步骤了。\n\n在所有的元素之中，大地元素代表着世间的所有事物得以存在的基石。它就是你的力量，你的韧性，以及你的耐心。大地会保护你，但首先你必须对它随时抱持着适当的尊敬。如同其它元素一样，大地也是变换无常的。它是生命的根本，通过观察它运行的规则，你将会学到许多东西。永远不要忘记它与你分享的秘密。\n\n我现在就要开始做你的灵契了，得到它之后，你将踏上新的萨满之道。",cEN="Excellent. Your success shows that you are prepared.\n\nOf all the elements, earth represents the foundation of all things. It is your strength, your stamina, and your patience. Earth will protect you, but only if shown the proper respect. Like the other elements, even earth can be fickle. Earth is the basis for life, and by observing its laws, you will gain greater wisdom. Never forget the secrets earth shares with you.\n\nI shall make a sapta for you now, and by accepting it, you will realize your path."}
Q[1517]={d="灵契是一种可以在我们的灵魂与元素之间建立起连接的特殊药水。这种融入了魔法的药水将使完全放开了心灵的你看到别人所不能看到的元素。你的灵魂将会永久地与灵契所对应的元素连接起来，只有我们中的少数被选中的人才知道灵契的制法。\n\n你必须知道一点……只有在神圣的地方喝下灵契才有效，其它任何地方都是不行的。\n\n到这里西南面的灵魂石地去吧——它就隐藏在一些茂密的藤蔓植物之间。到那里去把你的灵契喝掉，然后……嗯，到时候你就知道该怎么做了。",dEN="A sapta is a drink created to bind our spirits to the elements. Fused with magic, the potion will allow the strong willed to see the elements as no one else can. Your spirit will be connected to the element the sapta was created for, and only a select few shaman know the recipe.\n\nThe sapta is always drunk in a holy place, and never anywhere else--remember that.\n\nSeek out Spirit Rock southwest of here--it is found at the end of the Hidden Path. Drink your sapta there, and... well, you shall see.",o="找到灵魂石地，在那里喝下大地灵契。",oEN="Find Spirit Rock and drink the Earth Sapta.",c="啊……$n……大地很欣慰你来到这里。\n\n$g以:以;身心相系，你将前行，知道群山是你的力量，平原是你的耐心，而世界本身是你的本质。\n\n谦卑地站在大地面前，是你通过这次仪式所需的一切。但其他元素并不那么消极。它们可能混乱而暴烈……这就是元素的本质，两种本性在永恒的对抗中并存。你必须细致地了解这些。",cEN="Ah... <name>... pleased is the earth to have you here.\n\nBound together in body and spirit, you will go forward knowing that the mountains are your strength; the plains, your patience; and the world itself your essence.\n\nStanding before the earth humbly is all that is required of you for you to pass this rite. But the others are not as passive. They may be chaotic and often violent, but such is the nature of the elements. Dual natures opposing one another, you must come to learn these things intricately."}
Q[1518]={d="拿着这块粗石英，把它带给卡纳加·唤地者，作为我们见面的凭证。他会为你制作一根图腾，而这块小石头将成为它的核心。它看似很小，但你会发现大小并不重要，最微小的东西也能比许多其他事物更长久。\n\n耐心点，$n。保持坚强。追寻智慧。这就是大地对你的全部要求。最终你将$g与大地合而为一:与大地合而为一;……像大地尊重你一样尊重它。",dEN="Take this rough quartz from me and bring it to Canaga Earthcaller as proof of our meeting. He will craft a totem for you, and this pebble will be the heart of it. As small as it may seem, you will come to find that size does not matter, and that even the smallest of things can outlast many others.\n\nBe patient, <name>. Remain strong. And seek wisdom. This is what earth asks of you. In the end, you shall become one with the earth--respect it as it shall respect you.",o="把粗石英交给试炼谷的坎纳甘·地鸣。",oEN="Bring the Rough Quartz to Canaga Earthcaller in the Valley of Trials.",p="希望我是第一个欢迎你踏上萨满之道的人。\n\n如果你已经拥有了大地赐予你的石头，那么我就会按约定把图腾交给你。\n\n但如果你还没得到，那么就继续去追寻吧。",pEN="I wish to be the first to welcome you fully to the first of four paths that will forever lead you in your destiny.\n\nIf you have the stone the earth gave to you, I will give you the totem it promised.\n\nIf not, then be gone with you until you have found your way.",c="太棒了！\n\n我将要刻给你的图腾不仅仅是你萨满身份的标志——它的力量远远超乎你的想象。图腾的用途之一就是集中法术的能量，那些法术多是与大地联系在一起的，随着你的成长，你也就可以逐渐领会更多大地的精髓。\n\n遍及卡利姆多大陆各处的训练师将会在适当的时候教会你更多的知识，当你觉得该学习一些新知识的时候，就去寻找他们吧。\n\n现在，拿着你的图腾，还有这个能教会你第一项基本能力的卷轴。",cEN="Excellent!\n\nThe totem I will craft for you is more than a symbol of your status among <class>--it has abilities beyond that. One use of the totem is as a focus for spells. Those spells are tied to the earth, and as you earn greater and greater wisdom, more of the earth's abilities will be made accessible to you.\n\nThe trainers will know when you are ready for greater knowledge.\n\nBut for now, take this earth totem, and a scroll to teach you your first ability."}
Q[1519]={d="是时候了，年轻的$C。你的身体已经够强壮，你的精神如大地一般坚韧，这正是你已经成熟的标志。\n\n大地引领并教导着我们的族人，以后你也将得到它的指引。但在那之前，你必须先通过试炼。在你完成了试炼之后，就会看到那些只有我们才能看到的东西。\n\n往东边去，找到刺背野猪人的萨满祭司，把他们在仪式中使用的药膏拿回来一些。在你得到了足够的药膏之后再回来向我复命。",dEN="The time has come, young <class>. Your body ages and grows strong, and your spirit endures like the earth. I see it within you-you have wisdom already.\n\nThe earth guides our people, and it speaks to us, as it will to you in time. But you must be tested. If you are ready, then you shall see things only our kind know of.\n\nSeek out the Bristleback shamans in their ravine to the east, and take from them a salve they use in their rituals. Return to me only when you have enough for your own potion.",o="给纳拉其营地的鸦羽先知带回2份仪式药膏。",oEN="Bring 2 applications of Ritual Salve to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache.",p="大地是有耐心的，它会等到你$g准备好:准备好;，因为它知道时间终会让万物侵蚀并重生。这是事物的循环。高山变成沙漠。河流变成峡谷。大地是所有元素中最固执、也最智慧的一个。\n\n你必须学会把耐心和坚韧置于一切之上。大地现在召唤你，因为它感到你已准备好。如果成功，就把这当作你的重生。此后，你再也无法回到无知的状态。",pEN="The earth is patient, and will wait for you until you are ready because she knows in time all things erode and are reborn. It is the cycle of things. Mountains become deserts. Rivers become canyons. The earth is the most stubborn and wise of all the elements.\n\nYou must learn patience and stamina above all things. The earth calls for you now because she feels you are ready. Consider this your rebirth if you succeed. You will never be able to go back to ignorance afterwards.",c="很好，$n。你回到这里，说明你确实$g准备好:准备好;迈出下一步了。\n\n在所有元素中，大地代表万物的根基。它是你的力量、你的坚韧和你的耐心。大地母亲会保护你，但前提是你向她表示应有的尊重。她是生命的基础，遵守她的法则，你将获得更深的智慧。永远不要忘记她与你分享的秘密。\n\n我现在就为你制作你的萨帕，接受它，一条新的道路就会在你面前展开。",cEN="Good, <name>. Your return here signifies that you are indeed prepared for the next step.\n\nOf all the elements, earth represents the foundation of all things. It is your strength, your stamina, and your patience. The Earth Mother will protect you, but only if you show her proper respect. She is the basis for life, and by observing her laws, you will gain a greater wisdom. Never forget the secrets she shares with you.\n\nI shall make your sapta for you now, and by accepting it, a new path will open before you."}
Q[1520]={d="灵契是一种可以在我们的精神和自然的元素之间建立连接的药水。这种药水融入了魔法，它可以使打开了心灵之门的你看到别人所不能看到的元素。你的精神将会永久地与灵契相应的元素连接起来，只有我们中的少数被选中的人才知道灵契的制作方法。\n\n灵契只能在神圣的地方生效，其它的任何地方都不行。\n\n到东边的萨满祭坛去，在那里喝下灵契吧。",dEN="A sapta is a drink created to bind our spirits to the elements. Fused with magic, the potion will allow the open minded to see the elements as no one has seen them before. Your spirit will forever be tied to the element the sapta was created for, and only a select few of our kind know the secrets of its creation.\n\nThe sapta is always imbibed in a holy place, and never anywhere else.\n\nSeek out the shaman shrine to the east of here and drink of the sapta.",o="找到科多石并喝下大地灵契。",oEN="Find Kodo Rock and drink the Earth Sapta.",c="啊……$n……大地很欣慰你来到这里。\n\n$g以:以;身心相系，你将前行，知道群山是你的力量，平原是你的耐心，而世界本身是你的本质。\n\n谦卑地站在大地面前，是你通过这次仪式所需的一切。但其他元素并不那么消极。它们可能混乱而暴烈……这就是元素的本质，两种本性在永恒的对抗中并存。你必须细致地了解这些。",cEN="Ah... <name>... pleased is the earth to have you here.\n\nBound together in body and spirit, you will go forward knowing that the mountains are your strength; the plains, your patience; and the world itself your essence.\n\nStanding before the earth humbly is all that is required of you for you to pass this rite. But the others are not as passive. They may be chaotic and often violent, but such is the nature of the elements. Dual natures opposing one another, you must come to learn these things intricately."}
Q[1521]={d="拿着这块粗石英，把它带给先知渡鸦羽，作为我们见面的凭证。她会为你制作一根图腾，而这块小石头将成为它的核心。它看似很小，但你会发现大小并不重要，最微小的东西也能比群山更长久。\n\n耐心点，$n。保持坚强。追寻智慧。这就是大地对你的全部要求。最终你将$g与大地合而为一:与大地合而为一;……像大地尊重你一样尊重它。",dEN="Take this rough quartz from me and bring it to Seer Ravenfeather as proof of our meeting. She will craft a totem for you, and this pebble will be the heart of it. As small as it may seem, you will come to find that size does not matter, and that even the smallest of things can outlast mountains.\n\nBe patient, <name>. Remain strong. And seek wisdom. This is what earth asks of you. In the end, you shall become one with the earth--respect it as it shall respect you.",o="将粗石英带给纳拉其营地的鸦羽先知。",oEN="Bring the Rough Quartz to Seer Ravenfeather in Camp Narache.",p="你好，$n。如果你没有完成你的任务，你就不用再回来找我了。愿我能成为第一个欢迎你踏上你萨满道路的人。\n\n如果你已经拥有了土元素交给你的石头，我将会按照约定把图腾柱给你。如果你没得到，那么很可惜。只有当你将自身完全奉献给元素时，拥有它才会值得你自豪，也只有那样，拥有它才会有意义。",pEN="Greetings, <name>. You would not return to me if you had not accomplished your task. May I be the first to welcome you fully to the first path of four that will forever rule your travels.\n\nIf you have the stone the earth gave to you, I will give you the totem it promised. If not, then I pity you. There is much pride to be had when you've fully dedicated yourself to the elements.",c="太好了。\n\n我将为你制作的图腾不只是一个象征——它还有超越象征的能力。图腾的用途之一是作为法术的施法媒介。那些法术与大地相连，随着你获得越来越深的智慧，大地会向你开放更多能力。遍布卡利姆多的训练师会知道你何时$g准备好:准备好;接受更高深的知识，在你拜访时告知你。\n\n但现在，先拿上这根大地图腾，还有一卷教你第一个技能的卷轴。",cEN="Splendid.\n\nThe totem I will craft for you is more than a symbol--it has abilities beyond that. One use of the totem is a focus for spells. Those spells are tied to the earth, and as you earn greater and greater wisdom, more of the earth's abilities will be made accessible to you. Trainers found throughout Kalimdor will know when you are ready for greater knowledge and will let you know as much when you visit them.\n\nBut for now, take this earth totem, and a scroll to teach you your first ability."}
Q[1522]={d="愿火焰与你同在，伙计。我看你在大地之道上已经很有造诣。我觉得你已$g准备好:准备好;去跟克拉纳尔谈谈了。\n\n克拉纳尔住在贫瘠之地十字路口以北。他对元素了解很深，可以教你火焰之道……如果你觉得自己$g准备好:准备好;了。\n\n找到他很容易，但别走太远，不然你就到精灵的地盘了。",dEN="Fire be witcha, mon. I see you be strong in da ways of earth already, an' me tinkin' you be ready to talk to Kranal.\n\nKranal live north of da Crossroads in da Barrens. He be strong in da ways of da elements and can teach ya da ways of fire... if you tink you be ready.\n\nHe be easy ta find, just don' go too far--ya go too far an' ya find yerself in da elves' lands.",o="去贫瘠之地找到卡纳尔·菲斯。",oEN="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.",c="嗯，是塞尔恩派你来的吧？\n\n好吧，塞尔恩一向可靠，那也就是说你$g准备好:准备好;参加下一次萨帕了：火焰萨帕。\n\n我已在你的眼中看到了，那灼热，那渴望。你尝过力量的滋味，现在你已$g准备好:准备好;要更多了。耐心点，$n。记住大地教给你的。力量和毁灭来得容易，但你仍须知道何时收手。",cEN="Hmmm, Searn sent you to me, did he?\n\nWell then, Searn could always be trusted, so that must mean you're ready to take part of the next sapta--the sapta of fire.\n\nI see it in your eyes already, the burning, the desire. You've tasted power, and now you're ready for more of it. Patience, <name>. Remember what earth taught you. Power and destruction will come easily, but you must still know when to stay your hand."}
Q[1523]={d="距离你上次受考验已经很久了，$n。到目前为止你在学业中表现出了耐心，但时候到了，你该学更多东西了。时候到了，你该了解毁灭……与混乱。火元素属于你，如果你$g愿意:愿意;付出代价。\n\n去贫瘠之地找克拉纳尔·菲斯。他住在十字路口以北的一座小屋里。但要当心：如果你走到了暗夜精灵的土地，那就是走得太远了。",dEN="Long has it been since you were last tested, <name>. You have shown patience thus far in your studies, but the time has come for you to learn more. The time has come for you to learn about destruction... and chaos. The element of fire is yours for the understanding, if you're prepared to pay for it.\n\nSeek out Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. He lives in a small dwelling north of the Crossroads, but be mindful, if you've reached the night elf lands, you've gone too far.",o="去贫瘠之地找到卡纳尔·菲斯。",oEN="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.",c="嗯，是纳姆派你来的吧？\n\n好吧，纳姆一向可靠，那也就是说你$g准备好:准备好;参加下一次萨帕了：火焰萨帕。\n\n我已在你的眼中看到了，那灼热，那渴望。你尝过力量的滋味，现在你已$g准备好:准备好;要更多了。耐心点，$n。记住大地教给你的。力量和毁灭来得容易，但你仍须知道何时收手。",cEN="Hmmm, Narm sent you to me, did he?\n\nWell then, Narm could always be trusted, so that must mean you're ready to take part of the next sapta--the sapta of fire.\n\nI see it in your eyes already, the burning, the desire. You've tasted power, and now you're ready for more of it. Patience, <name>. Remember what earth taught you. Power and destruction will come easily, but you must still know when to stay your hand."}
Q[1524]={d="你已经有足够的力量挥舞火焰图腾，但这并不意味着你$g准备好:准备好;了。\n\n沿着杜隆塔尔的南怒河，在大海之前，有一条隐蔽的小径通往这片土地上最高的山峰之一。找到登上山顶的路，你就会找到我们的一座圣地，由泰尔夫·朱拉姆看守：休眠之焰神殿。\n\n把这支火炬带给他，以此表明你在尝试驯服火焰。在神殿的火盆上点燃它，再带回来给我。我会确保你得到火焰图腾。",dEN="You are powerful enough to wield the totem of fire, but that does not mean you are ready.\n\nAlong the Southfury River in Durotar, before the Great Sea, lies a hidden trail to one of the highest peaks in the land. Find your way to the top and you shall find one of our holy shrines watched over by Telf Joolam--the Shrine of the Dormant Flame.\n\nTake this torch to him--it marks that you attempt to tame fire. Return it to me aflame by the brazier at the shrine and I will see you are given the totem of fire.",o="把眠炎火炬带给杜隆塔尔的泰尔夫·祖拉姆。",oEN="Bring the Torch of the Dormant Flame to Telf Joolam in Durotar.",p="你好，$n。你来到了休眠之焰神殿。只有对萨满技艺有足够了解的人，才能发现此地的秘密和它所蕴含的力量。很抱歉$g你:你;走了这么远的路，如今却只能被打发回去——毕竟上山的路一点也不安全——但我是这座神殿的看守者，我不能让随便什么人在此闲逛。",pEN="Greetin's, <name>. You've found yerself at the Shrine of the Dormant Flame. Only those knowledgeable enough in the shamanistic arts will ever learn the secrets of this place and the power it holds. I'm sorry you made the trip all this way, only to be turned back now--the journey up here is far from safe after all--but I am the keeper of the shrine, and I cannot allow just anyone to wander around here.",c="啊，是我的错，我不知道你带着火炬，$n，请接受我最真诚的歉意，很高兴认识你。\n\n很多人冒着艰险找到这里，只为寻找失落的财宝或是捕杀神秘的生物，最后却看到这里似乎空无一物，便只能悻悻而归。只有我们知道这里的秘密，对吗，$n？\n\n这座圣殿中隐藏着一个巨大的秘密，对于绝大多数部落的成员来说，他们一生都不会对此有丝毫的了解。对我们而言，这里是极为神圣的。",cEN="Ah, my mistake, <name>. I apologize. I did not realize you possessed the Torch. I am pleased to make your acquaintance.\n\nMany adventurers find their way here while looking for lost treasure or the promise of mystical creatures to slay, only to be turned away from a seemingly empty shrine. But we know the truth, do we not, <name>?\n\nThis shrine holds a greater secret from the mundane members of the Horde. To us, it is sacred."}
Q[1525]={d="你该不是到这儿来上历史课的吧？你是要得到永恒之火和你的火焰图腾。\n\n首先，你要制造一个灵契，并将你和它连接起来。\n\n只要你给我找来两样东西，我就可以为你制造火焰灵契。第一件是火焰焦油，这个相对而言比较简单，钢鬃野猪人的施法者通常会带着这种东西。\n\n另一件则比较危险：从火刃氏族的祭司身上找一个试剂袋。你可以在奥格瑞玛东部找到他们。",dEN="But you did not come here for a history lesson, did you? You came for the Eternal Flame and fire totem.\n\nThe first step is to create a sapta and bind you to the flame.\n\nI can create the fire sapta for you if you bring me two items. The first is fire tar, a simple item usually carried by Razormane spellcasters in eastern Barrens.\n\nThe second item will be more dangerous: a reagent pouch from one of the cultists of the Burning Blade. You can find them in a cave above the ravines northeast of Razor Hill.",o="找到1个火焰焦油和1个试剂袋，把它们交给杜隆塔尔的泰尔夫·祖拉姆。",oEN="Bring 1 Fire Tar and 1 Reagent Pouch to Telf Joolam in Durotar.",p="只要你能找来试剂袋和火焰焦油，我就可以给你制作火焰灵契。燃刃祭司的试剂袋里通常都装着制作火焰灵契所需的所有材料，而且数量也很充足。\n\n只有用与某种元素属性相同的材料才能制成那种元素的灵契，这也让我们的工作轻松了不少，只要去找那些成天和火焰打交道的术士就行了。",pEN="I have enough ingredients for a sapta of fire if you can find the reagent pouch and some fire tar. The Burning Blade fanatics carry the proper components for most of their spells in those pouches, and usually have enough of the items I need that we will not have to search much farther for anything else.\n\nThe saptas are always made from ingredients that are closely tied to their respective elements. It makes our work easier because of the warlocks' ties to fire.",c="这些就可以了，$n。\n\n火焰并不只是混乱和毁灭的力量——你一定要牢牢记住这一点。它也是一种生命和创造的力量，因为世间万物都有着千丝万缕的联系。它们彼此之间互相排斥，但任何一种失去了对立面的力量都无法独存它们要消灭对立的力量，但只有在这种抗衡中才能体现出它们存在的意义，正如光与影，火与冰。永远不要忘了这一点。\n\n运用不同的、甚至是对立的魔法所需要的不仅仅是精湛的技艺，还有超群的智慧。",cEN="These will do nicely, <name>.\n\nFire is more than chaos and destruction--do well to remember that. It is also about life, and creation. All things are tied together in such a way. Forces oppose one another, but at the same time, one cannot exist without the other. Both extinguish one another, but also give one another meaning. Always remember this.\n\nUsing different types of magic in conjunction with one another will show not only true skill, but great wisdom."}
Q[1526]={d="火焰萨帕已经完成。时候到了，你该去面对火焰了。在神殿使用萨帕，然后登上山顶，面对那里的显灵。在你$g准备好:准备好;之前他不会攻击你，但他会察觉你能看见他。\n\n迅速击倒他，$n，因为你拖得越久，他的力量就越强。击败他之后，把他发光的余烬放进火盆，点燃火炬。",dEN="The fire sapta is finished. The time has come for you to face the flame. Use the sapta at the shrine and head to the top of the mountain to face the manifestation there. He will not attack until you are ready, but he will realize you are able to see him.\n\nStrike him down swiftly, <name>, for he shall only grow in power the longer you take to slay him. Once he is defeated, place his glowing embers within the brazier and light the torch.",o="击败火焰之魂，将余烬放在恒焰圣殿屋顶的火盆里。",oEN="Defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, and place the Glowing Ember in the brazier atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame.",p="火盆只有你的三分之一高，看起来没什么特别，只是在光滑的金属围栏上刻有文字。整座火盆都没有任何风化侵蚀的痕迹，摆在顶端的小碗摸上去十分冰凉。",pEN="The brazier stands about a third your height, and looks normal, save for the inscriptions along its smooth metal rails. The metal shows no signs of wear from the weather, and the bowl seated at the top of it feels cool to the touch.",c="当你将余烬投入碗里之后，一团白色火焰随即燃起。你能感受到灵契的神奇力量在你体中流过，也能看到火光在你面前舞动。\n\n你将火炬的前端伸进盆里，它立刻就被点燃了。",cEN="A white hot flame ignites within the bowl as you place the ember within. You can feel the magical effects of the sapta coursing through your body and the fire dances rhythmically before you.\n\nYou place the top of the torch within the basin, and it immediately catches on fire."}
Q[1527]={d="你手中紧握着火炬离开火盆，望向远处的杜隆塔尔，神圣的火焰随风狂舞，令你感到心中充满了激动和兴奋。\n\n你沿着小路回到贫瘠之地去找卡纳尔·菲斯。",dEN="Torch firmly in hand, you turn away from the brazier and look out over Durotar. You feel an excitement tugging at your spirit as the wind picks up and forces the flame to dance violently.\n\nYou start off down the path back to the Barrens in search of Kranal Fiss.",o="将恒焰火炬交给贫瘠之地的卡纳尔·菲斯。",oEN="Bring the Torch of Eternal Flame to Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.",p="嗯，这不是$n吗？",pEN="Yes, <name>? What do you have there?",c="你的意志燃烧得比我见过的任何火炬都要更加明亮，$n，你应该为此感到骄傲。\n\n继续沿着萨满之道走下去，你终将获得驾驭元素的力量，我们的同胞也将向你寻求指引和智慧。恭喜你得到这宝贵的图腾。",cEN="Your spirit burns brighter than any torch I've ever seen, <name>, and for that, you should be proud.\n\nIf you continue down this path, the elements will be yours to command, and our brethren will look to you for guidance and wisdom. Let me be the first to congratulate you and present to you your newest totem."}
Q[1528]={d="水在你前头，伙计。我看你已经熟悉了火，所以该$g准备好:准备好;去跟伊斯伦谈谈了。\n\n伊斯伦住在贫瘠之地的海岸边。你要是沿南怒河南下，准不会错过她——找那条大鲨鱼！她在水之道上很在行……如果你觉得自己$g准备好:准备好;了。\n\n找到她很容易，往南走就行，她就在棘齿城那边。",dEN="Water be in ya future, mon. I see you be strong in da ways of fire already, an' me tinkin' you be ready to talk to Islen.\n\nIslen live along the coast of da Barrens. If ya head south along the Southfury River, ya canna miss her--look fer da big shark! She be strong in da ways of da elements and can teach ya da ways of water... if you tink you be ready.\n\nShe be easy ta find, just don' go too far south--she be jus' beyond Ratchet.",o="找到贫瘠之地的水之先知伊斯伦。",oEN="Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.",c="地平线吹来的风轻拂着你，脚下的大地是如此坚实，火焰温暖了你的灵魂，而现在我想让你体味水的纯洁。\n\n你已经达到了一定的境界，你的精神将赐予你走得更远的力量。不过，你先得迈出至关重要的第一步。",cEN="The wind approaches you quickly from the horizon; the earth is steady beneath your feet; and your spirit is already warmed by fire--I would say it is time for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nYour path has led you this far, and your spirit will give you the strength to carry on even further. But the first step is yours to take."}
Q[1529]={d="从你上次接受测验到现在已经有很长的时间了，$n。迄今为止，你展示了足够的耐心，不过现在你应该学到更多的东西，应该去了解水的纯洁。\n\n去贫瘠之地找到水之先知伊斯伦，沿着怒水河的东岸向棘齿城的南方走，你可以在一间小渔屋里找到她。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="Long has it been since you were last tested, <name>. You have shown patience thus far in your studies, but the time has come for you to learn more. The time has come for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nSeek out Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. She is along the eastern coast, south of the Southfury River and Ratchet. You will find her there at her fishing hut. Good luck to you, <name>.",o="找到贫瘠之地的水之先知伊斯伦。",oEN="Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.",c="地平线吹来的风轻拂着你，脚下的大地是如此坚实，火焰温暖了你的灵魂，而现在我想让你体味水的纯洁。\n\n你已经达到了一定的境界，你的精神将赐予你走得更远的力量。不过，你先得迈出至关重要的第一步。",cEN="The wind approaches you quickly from the horizon; the earth is steady beneath your feet; and your spirit is already warmed by fire--I would say it is time for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nYour path has led you this far, and your spirit will give you the strength to carry on even further. But the first step is yours to take."}
Q[1530]={d="关于水，有一点是你必须要了解的：水意味着重生。\n\n水流动着，消蚀和清洗一切事物。水的治疗和恢复能力是无与伦比的，但这只有在水是完全纯洁的情况下。\n\n如果水受到了污染，那么它将毁灭一切它接触到的东西。理解了这一点，你就应该能明白保证水源的纯洁性是多么的重要。\n\n如果你想要得到水之灵契，就到南贫瘠之地去找布瑞恩吧，她的家园最近时常受到野猪人的骚扰。",dEN="If there is one lesson you must learn of water, it is this: water means rebirth.\n\nIts power flows, erodes, and makes clean all manner of things. You will find its ability to heal and replenish incomparable, but only when it is pure.\n\nWhen you understand that water, when polluted, can devastate all that it touches, you will appreciate how vital a resource it is.\n\nIf you wish the water sapta, find Brine deep in Southern Barrens. Her home is continually molested by the quilboar there.",o="到南贫瘠之地去找到布瑞恩。",oEN="Find Brine at Blackthorn Ridge in Southern Barrens.",c="什么事？\n\n嗯，我大概知道你要问什么：是什么让人愿意住在贫瘠之地最偏远的角落，四周都是野猪人的威胁，还没有任何保护？好吧，我们都有自己的理由来解释自己的行为方式。真正的问题是，是什么让$g一个:一个;卑微的$r跑到贫瘠之地最深的地方，来跟一个显然不在乎自己安危的女人说话？\n\n我敢打赌我们都清楚答案。",cEN="Yes?\n\nMmm. I have a feeling I know what you're going to ask me: what would possess someone to live out here in the deepest part of the Barrens, the threat of quilboar all around, and no protection? Well, we all have our reasons to justify why we act the way we do. The real question is, what brings a lowly <race> to the deepest reaches of the Barrens to speak to a woman who obviously has no concern for her own well-being?\n\nI'm willing to bet we both know the answer to that."}
Q[1531]={d="你有进步，伙计。你$g准备好:准备好;证明自己配得上空气图腾了，但首先你得去千针石林找普雷特·云先知。只要你对她足够尊重，她就愿意告诉你如何得到你的空气图腾。\n\n从贫瘠之地往南走，到了千针石林之后往东。你会发现她跟她男朋友一起躲在一个洞里……哈哈，别说是我说的——她可不爱听！",dEN="You be makin' headway now, mon. Your be ready to prove yerself worthy of the air totem, but first, ya must fin' Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles. She be willin' ta tell ya how to get yer air totem if ya treat her wit enough respect.\n\nHead south through the Barrens, and after ya reach Thousand Needles, head east. You'll find her hiddin' in a hole wit' her boyfriend--haha, don' tell her I be dissin' her none--she not take it too kindly.",o="到千针石林去找普拉特·白云。",oEN="Find Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles.",c="眼下，我会给你施法和召唤空气之灵所需的东西。拿上这根图腾，等你$g准备好:准备好;了，来找我继续训练。",cEN="For the time being. I shall give you what you need to focus your spells and to call upon the spirits of air. Take this totem, and when you are ready, train with me some more."}
Q[1532]={d="卡利姆多的风急切地要来见你。你将被列入我们最强大的$g兄弟:姐妹;之列，$g成为:成为;其中$g最$g强大的一员:最强大的一员;。看到你走到这一步、前途光明，我感到非常骄傲。\n\n空气是难以掌控的元素，但我相信你的本领能克服摆在面前的一切障碍。\n\n前往贫瘠之地最南端，进入千针石林。就在那里、最东边，你会找到普雷特·云先知。她会教你更多。",dEN="The winds of Kalimdor rush to meet you and you shall be counted among some of our most powerful <brothers/sisters>. I am proud to see you have come this far and have such a promising future.\n\nThe element of air is a difficult one to control, but I have faith that your skills will overcome any obstacles that are placed in front of you.\n\nHead to the very south of the Barrens, and enter Thousand Needles. It is there, far to the east, that you will find Prate Cloudseer. She will teach you more.",o="到千针石林去找普拉特·白云。",oEN="Find Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles.",c="眼下，我会给你施法和召唤空气之灵所需的东西。拿上这根图腾，等你$g准备好:准备好;了，来找我继续训练。",cEN="For the time being, I shall give you what you need to focus your spells and to call upon the spirits of air. Take this totem, and when you are ready, train with me some more."}
Q[1534]={d="现在，你必须带上这个水囊，深入到那片被暗夜精灵称为灰谷的茂密森林中，那地方就在贫瘠之地的北方。\n\n进入森林之后向西走，顺着隔断石爪山与灰谷的山脉前进，你会在密斯特拉湖的尽头发现一处圣地：星辰废墟。在那里的湖中央有一眼小喷泉。\n\n取回一些喷泉水，那是制作灵契所需的最后一种水样，然后我就可以把你送回伊斯伦那里了。",dEN="Take this waterskin and head deep into the lush forest the night elves call Ashenvale. It is to the far north of the Barrens.\n\nOnce you've entered the forest, travel west. Along the mountains that separate Stonetalon and Ashenvale, and beyond Lake Mystral, you will find a holy place: the Ruins of Stardust. At the center of the lake you will find a small fountain.\n\nBring me a sample of the fountain's water. It will be the final component you'll need before I send you back to Islen.",o="到灰谷的星辰废墟去，将空的蓝色水囊盛满泉水，然后把它交给贫瘠之地的布瑞恩。",oEN="Fill the Empty Blue Waterskin at the Ruins of Stardust in Ashenvale and return to Brine in the Barrens.",p="你找到泉水了吗，$n？传说有强大的生物保卫着那片废墟，它们不惧怕任何不速之客。不过，那可能只是暗夜精灵用来吓唬敌人的伎俩而已。\n\n不管怎么样，你要多加小心。",pEN="Do you have the water yet, <name>? Tales say the ruins were protected by large creatures of nature that do not care for visitors, but those could be myths to scare off the enemies of the night elves.\n\nRegardless, be careful.",c="太好了，$n。三份样本都收集齐了，我就能为你制作一瓶任何活物都未曾见过的最纯净的水。它将用于你成人礼接下来的步骤。\n\n我很高兴你能站在我们这一边，$n。你让所有$c都感到骄傲，我期待今后听到你的事迹。",cEN="Wonderful, <name>. With all three samples gathered, I can create for you a vial of the purest water any living creature will find. It will be used in the next steps of your rite of passage.\n\nI am pleased to count you among our kind, <name>. You do all <class>(s) proud, and I look forward to hearing about your exploits in the future."}
Q[1535]={d="要得到我的信任并从我这里取得灵契，你就必须找到最纯洁的水。在你寻找这种水样时，别忘了注意周围的动静。要小心那些依赖这种水生存并守护着它的生物，要注意这种水是如何影响森林和荒漠的。看看这种维持生命的特殊物质是如何强迫这些生物进行杀戮的。\n\n让我们先从一个简单的任务开始吧：在我的小屋下面有一小池这种珍贵的液体，装满这个水囊后再回来找我。",dEN="To find understanding and gain the sapta from me, you must seek out only the purest forms of water. As you fetch the samples for me, take note of your surroundings. Be aware of the creatures that rely on the water, that protect it. See how it affects forests and deserts. Witness how the very substance that sustains life will force creatures to take lives.\n\nWe shall start with a simple task: down below my hut there is a pond of the precious liquid. Fill this skin with it and return to me.",o="到野猪人的水池去，用井中的水装满空的棕色水囊，然后把水囊交给贫瘠之地的布瑞恩。",oEN="Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the watering hole below Brine's hut and return it to her in the Barrens.",p="我正在准备交给你下一项任务。你装满水囊了吗？\n\n我知道这些野猪人会拼命保护他们的水源，即便是一滴水对他们来说也是一笔巨大的财富。偶然降临贫瘠之地的毛毛细雨对他们而言也不啻为一场盛筵。他们将水视为神圣之物，因为它是如此稀少。你明白了吗？",pEN="I am just about prepared to send you on your other tasks. Have you filled the skin yet?\n\nI know how protective the quilboar can be. Even such a small water source is a vast hoard of wealth to them. They have great feasts when even the slightest rain comes to the Barrens. Water is sacred to their kind because it is so scarce. Do you understand?",c="如果你去那个池塘取水，那么流血冲突肯定是不可避免的。很遗憾，野猪人没有意识到所有的生物都是相互依存的，他们的贪婪只会无休止地延续他们自己的伤痛与苦难。如果他们能停止内乱，将所有的野猪人氏族都联合起来，那么现在的状况肯定会大不一样。\n\n这确实是一个遗憾，不过这对于贫瘠之地的其它种群来说，也不失为一种恩赐。",cEN="I thought some bloodshed might ensue if you tried to take water from the pool. It is a pity the quilboar do not realize that all living things are tied together; that their greed only perpetuates the pain and suffering of their people. How much could they accomplish if they were to put their differences aside and their clans came together.\n\nAgain, a pity, but more than likely a boon for the other races of the Barrens."}
Q[1536]={d="很久以前，我和一些同伴一起去过希尔斯布莱德丘陵。我们为了保护自己而和那里的人类作战，后来发现自己正置身于一个由被遗忘者控制的小镇：塔伦米尔。\n\n在那里，我有一个特别的发现：小镇中心有一口清泉小井。我不清楚镇中那些被感染的居民是否清楚它的价值——那口井是那片被亵渎的土地上唯一一块未受亵渎的神圣之地。\n\n用这只水囊帮我带回一些那口井里的水。",dEN="Long ago I followed some companions into the Hillsbrad Foothills. We defended ourselves from some tenacious humans who make their home there and we found ourselves in a small town the Forsaken had taken over: Tarren Mill.\n\nIt was there I found a most peculiar thing: in the center of town was a small well of fresh spring water. I'm not sure the plagued citizens of the town even realize its value--it's a small holy vestige in an unhallowed sea.\n\nBring me a sample of that water in this waterskin.",o="用塔伦米尔的井水装满空的红色水囊，然后把它交给贫瘠之地的布瑞恩。",oEN="Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the well in Tarren Mill and return to Brine in the Barrens.",p="$n，镇中那口井依然保持纯洁，这让我想起年轻时曾听到过的故事。即使是在最痛苦和最悲伤的时候，你也能找到一丝微弱的希望和重新振作的可能。兽人眼中的萨尔就是这样一种象征，他从绝境中站立起来，用他的力量和精神指引着他的人民。\n\n我想不会有哪个兽人和他一样经历过如此多的磨难，当然，也不会有谁像他那样强大。",pEN="The well remaining pure within the town reminds me of stories told to me when I was younger, <name>. Even in times of great pain and sorrow one can find a sliver of hope, a small symbol to rally around. The orc people see Thrall this way. He survived against great odds and rose up to lead our people through his strength and example.\n\nI'm not sure any orc has suffered as much as he has, but at the same time, I'm not sure any orc is as strong as he is either.",c="很好，$n。你的不懈努力终于使你完成了这个任务，同时也证明了你的能力。\n\n我还需要一份水样就能凑齐制作灵契所需的材料了，伊斯伦也会为你高兴的。",cEN="This is good, <name>. You're dedicated to the task at hand and have the ability to seek out that which is needed.\n\nOne more sample is all I need to create the reagent needed for your sapta. Islen will be pleased as well."}
Q[1558]={d="铁炉堡是矮人和侏儒的聚居地。在这附近有个地方叫做洛克莫丹，矮人在那里建造了一座巨大的水坝。他们说那是世界上最壮观的建筑！\n\n你能不能把我带到洛克莫丹去看看那座水坝呢？我想那座水坝叫巨砖……嗯……巨墙？巨石水坝？它很大——绝对大得让你吃惊。我想要去看看那里的巨大瀑布……我保证我绝对会紧紧跟着你的！",dEN="Ironforge is where all the dwarves and gnomes live. Near there is a place called Loch Modan, and the dwarves built a HUGE dam there. They say it's one of the biggest things anyone's ever made. Wow!\n\nCould you take me to Loch Modan and see the dam there, please? I think it is the Stone... um... Stonewrench Dam? Stonewrought? It's big - that's for sure. I'd like to look out over the big waterfall. I promise I won't lean over too far!",o="带着你看护的孤儿去洛克莫丹的巨石水坝。你应该带他去水坝的中间，然后让他俯瞰巨大的瀑布。",oEN="Take the orphan to the Stonewrought Dam in Loch Modan. You should take him to the middle of the dam so he can see out over the giant waterfall.",p="我们到了吗？",pEN="Are we there yet?",c="哇——这座水坝比我想象中的还要宏伟！轰鸣的瀑布声几乎让我无法听到自己说话的声音！嘿，你认为这里的水会不会流光？你说如果这座水坝破了会怎么样！啊，那真是太恐怖了！\n\n感谢你带我来看这座水坝，你真好。我说过我不会跑得太远的！",cEN="WOW - the dam was WAY bigger than I thought! I could barely hear myself talk from the sound of all the rushing water! Hey, do you think it would ever run out of water? Man, what would happen if that damn ever broke! WOW, that would be scary!\n\nThanks for taking me to see the dam. That was very kind of you. I told you I wouldn't lean over too far!"}
Q[1559]={c="这么说来你是个工程师咯？感谢你帮我取得了那些珍珠，这是闪光弹的制作方法。\n\n祝你好运，可别弄伤了自己的眼睛！",cEN="So you're an engineer, eh? Well, for your help in getting me those pearls, here's the recipe for flash bombs.\n\nGood luck, and try not to blind yourself!"}
Q[1560]={d="我走丢了！\n\n我的妻子托尔塔让我出来找晚餐，我一定是迷了路！\n\n你能行行好带我回到托尔塔身边吗？她正在热砂港南部等我。",dEN="I am so lost!\n\nMy wife, Torta, sent me out to fetch dinner and I must have taken a wrong turn somewhere.\n\nWould you be so kind as to lead me back to Torta? She's waiting for me just south of Steamwheedle Port.",o="把图加带回到他的妻子托尔塔身边。",oEN="Show Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta.",c="他找不到回自己家的路？真衰。\n\n好吧，我想你应该得到报酬……",cEN="So he couldn't find his way back on his own? Figures.\n\nWell, I guess you deserve something for your troubles...."}
Q[1578]={d="洛克莫丹的巡山人正在和穴居人战斗，可真是忙得不可开交呢！要对付那些穴居人，就必须给我们的部队不断提供盔甲和武器。\n\n这就是索瓦尔德待在那里的原因，他在为巡山人筹集足够的物资好让他们保持强大的战斗力。如果你能打造一些铜斧和铜质链甲腰带并把它们交给索瓦尔德的话，他一定会感激你的，没准他还会跟你分享他的知识和经验。\n\n索瓦尔德就在洛克莫丹的南部警戒塔。",dEN="The mountaineers of Loch Modan are fighting troggs, and having a busy time of it! They need constant supplies of new armor and weapons if we're ever to get a handle on those troggs.\n\nThat's why my colleague Thorvald is there, trying to keep the mountaineers in good gear. So if you were to make some copper axes and copper chain belts and bring them to Thorvald, he would be obliged. He might even share his knowledge with you.\n\nThorvald is in Loch Modan's southern guard tower.",o="给洛克莫丹南部警戒塔的索瓦尔德带去6把铜斧和6条铜质链甲腰带。",oEN="Bring 6 Copper Axes and 6 Copper Chain Belts to Thorvald in the southern guard tower of Loch Modan.",p="我没时间闲聊。你有事找我吗？",pEN="I have no time to chat. Do you have business with me?",c="哦，对不起！我没想到你是来给我提供装备的。这些东西会给我们很大帮助！\n\n这里是一些盔甲的设计图，希望能对你有用。",cEN="Ah, apologies! I didn't realize you were here to help resupply our troops. The stuff you made will be a big help!\n\nHere are plans for some armor. I hope you find them useful."}
Q[1579]={d="我到奥伯丁来仅仅是因为这里相当的安静。我喜欢在安静的地方进行发明创造，因为在一夜痛饮之后，铁炉堡的喧嚣足以让我发疯！\n\n因此我乘船来了奥伯丁，路上喝了不少酒，结果我一不小心就把一盒小齿轮掉在了船上！\n\n我不能确定把它们掉在什么地方了，但如果你愿意到大海里钓钓看的话，也许……",dEN="I came to Auberdine because of the quiet. I want to invent my inventions where it's quiet, because after a night of drinking I don't like all the noise of Ironforge!\n\nSo I took a ship to Auberdine and had a little too much to drink on the way. I dropped my box of gaffer jacks overboard! I need my gaffer jacks!\n\nI don't know exactly where I dropped them, but if you fish for them in the ocean you might get lucky...",o="收集8个小齿轮，把它们交给奥伯丁的维兹班恩·曲针。",oEN="Bring 8 Gaffer Jacks to Wizbang Cranktoggle in Auberdine.",p="$n，你找到我的小齿轮了吗？没有小齿轮，我这个伟大的发明家就什么都干不了！",pEN="Did you find my gaffer jacks, <name>? Without my gaffer jacks I can't tune my stintle pegs!",c="我简直不敢相信你找到了它们！你一定是卡利姆多$g最:最;$g幸运:幸运;的$r！",cEN="I can't believe you found them! You must be the luckiest <race> in Kalimdor!"}
Q[1580]={d="我们知道你是个幸运星，不过……你到底有多少幸运呢，$n？\n\n有一天晚上，我沿着黑海岸的小路散步，想要找一条河或一片湖来试验我新发明的自行驱动火爆式诱鸭器，但那时我可能有点醉了……所以我一不留神就睡了过去，几个小时后醒来的时候已经在奥伯丁了。我的头发烧焦了，导电器也都不见了！我一定是把它们丢在水里了！\n\n也许你能在黑海岸附近的湖泊或是溪流中钓到它们……",dEN="We know you're lucky, but... just how lucky are you, <name>?\n\nOne night I was wandering the roads of Darkshore. I was looking for a good river or lake to try my new self-propelled, exploding duck decoy and I think I was a little tipsy... because I passed out and awoke hours later in Auberdine. My hair was singed and my bag of electropellers was gone! I must have dropped them in the water!\n\nI need those electropellers! Maybe you can fish them out of some lake or stream in Darkshore...",o="收集12个导电器，把它们交给奥伯丁的维兹班恩·曲针。",oEN="Bring 12 Electropellers to Wizbang Cranktoggle in Auberdine.",p="你找到导电器了吗？我得有这些东西才能继续研制诱鸭器。",pEN="Did you find any electropellers? I'll need them if I'm to continue my research on duck decoys...",c="我简直不敢相信！你找到了它们！你是我这辈子见过的最棒的渔夫！\n\n谢谢你，$n。还有，收下这个。虽然你这么厉害，大概用不上，但它们会帮到你钓鱼。",cEN="I can't believe it! You found them! You are the best fisherman I've ever seen!\n\nThank you, <name>. And here, take these. Although you're so good and you probably don't need them, they will help you with your fishing."}
Q[1581]={d="我们的草药与炼金店生意不错，可我丈夫花太多时间调配药水，我们几乎没有时间相处。\n\n你能帮帮我们吗？\n\n如果你能给我弄来一批现成的药剂，我很乐意跟你做买卖。我有一些稀有的草药，也许你会觉得有用。",dEN="Our herb and alchemy shop is booming, but my husband spends so much time mixing potions that we never have time for each other.\n\nCan you help us?\n\nIf you can bring me a supply of pre-made elixirs, then I would be happy to trade with you. I have some rare herbs that you might find useful.",o="给在多兰纳尔的塞拉尔·刃叶带去6瓶狮王之力药剂和2瓶初级防御药剂。",oEN="Bring 6 Elixirs of Lion's Strength and 2 Elixirs of Minor Defense to Syral Bladeleaf in Dolanaar.",p="你好，$n。你弄到我要的药剂了吗？",pEN="Hello, <name>. Do you have the elixirs to trade?",c="这些药剂配制得很不错。$n，看得出你做生意很下工夫，这对一个炼金师来说是非常重要的。\n\n这些药草是刚刚收集来的，拿着吧。希望你好好利用它们。",cEN="These are nicely mixed. You take great care in your trade, <name>, and that is important for an alchemist.\n\nHere are your herbs, freshly gathered. May you use them well."}
Q[1582]={d="达纳苏斯的居民，尤其是像我这样的手工艺者，都是相当繁忙的。年轻的冒险家们很想在旷野里试试他们的身手，当然这就需要相应的装备来做保障。\n\n如果你能帮我搞到足够多的皮革制品的话，我也许会教你一些高级的制皮技术。",dEN="We in Darnassus, especially we craftsman, are quite busy. Young adventurers are eager to test themselves in the wilderness, and are in constant need of supplies.\n\nIf you can help me fill my orders of leather goods, then perhaps I can teach you an advanced leatherworking technique.",o="把1双雕花皮手套、5双雕花皮靴和5件雕花皮质披风交给达纳苏斯的洛瑟里亚斯。",oEN="Bring 1 Embossed Leather Gloves, 5 Embossed Leather Boots and 5 Embossed Leather Cloaks to Lotherias in Darnassus.",p="你好，$n。",pEN="Greetings, <name>.",c="这些都是好料子。你手艺熟练，眼光也细。你作为$g制皮师:制皮师;的前途很有希望。\n\n来，$n。让我教你制作月光外衣的图样。",cEN="Yes, these are good pieces. You have a skilled hand and an eye for detail. Your future as a leatherworker is promising.\n\nHere, <name>. Let me show you the pattern to make the Moonglow Vest."}
Q[1618]={d="并不是只有我们矮人在战斗，事实上，我们的人类盟友也忙得不可开交！\n\n赤脊山不断受到黑石兽人的袭击，装备和物资也一直跟不上。如果你能提供一些帮助的话，他们的铁匠弗纳·奥斯古应该会教你一两招独家绝活。",dEN="We dwarves aren't the only ones fighting. Our human allies have their hands full too!\n\nRedridge is under periodic attack from blackrock orcs, and their supply of equipment is always low. If you were to help them out, I'm sure their resident blacksmith, Verner Osgood, would teach you a trick or two.",o="托姆斯·深炉要你给赤脊山的弗纳·奥斯古带去4条铜质符文腰带和4把铜质大锤。",oEN="Tormus Deepforge wants you to bring 4 Runed Copper Belts and 4 Heavy Copper Mauls to Verner Osgood in Redridge.",p="我希望你从铁炉堡带来的是好消息，我这儿已经快要应付不过来了！",pEN="I hope you're here with good news from Ironforge. Because I'm at my wit's end!",c="谢谢你，$N。这可以给我们提供很大的帮助。除了不断从石堡高塔向这里发起攻击的黑石兽人之外，还有潜伏在北方丘陵地带的赤脊山豺狼人，我一直忙着为我们的军队修理盔甲及制造新武器。\n\n你带来的装备给了我片刻的安宁，让我利用时间教你点什么吧……",cEN="Thank you, <name>. This will help me out tremendously. With the Blackrock orcs attacking from Stonewatch Keep and the Redridge gnolls lurking in the foothills to the north, I'm always fixing armor and making new weapons for our troops.\n\nThe supplies you brought will give me a moment's peace. I will have enough time to teach you something..."}
Q[1638]={d="你已证明自己$g是:是;一名出色的战士，$n，但你还年轻，有很多要学。\n\n去跟哈里·伯尔加德谈谈，他常在暴风城旧城区的“猪与哨声”酒馆。哈里是位老练的老兵，也是个好老师。他能教你几招，让你多活一阵子。",dEN="You've shown yourself to be a competent warrior, <name>. But you're still young and have a lot to learn.\n\nSpeak with Harry Burlguard--he's usually in the Pig and Whistle tavern, in the Old Town of Stormwind. Harry is an old veteran and a good teacher. He can show you a few moves that'll keep you breathing longer.",o="和哈里·伯加德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Harry Burlguard in Stormwind.",c="哦嚯！陪我喝一杯，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。乍一看你挺$g硬气:硬气;，但让我们看看你的肚子能不能扛住几杯“猪与哨声”最烈的招牌酒！\n\n或者……你是来上课的？",cEN="Oh ho! Have a drink with me, <name>. You look tough on the outside, but let's see if your gut can handle a few mugs of the Pig and Whistle's strongest!!\n\nOr... were you here for a lesson?"}
Q[1639]={d="当然，我可以教你。不过，我先要看看你到底有多大的本事。\n\n看见酒吧最里面的那个醉汉了吗？就是那个巴特莱比，我要你去把他的酒杯拿来。\n\n哈哈，如果你了解巴特莱比，你就会明白他是不会轻易把酒杯给你的。",dEN="Yeah, I can teach you. But first I wanna see what moves you have already.\n\nSee that drunk over there at the end of the bar? Bartleby? I want you to get his mug.\n\nHah, and if you know Bartleby then you know he won't just give it to you.",o="和巴特莱比谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bartleby.",c="你好呀，$g小少爷:大小姐;！像你这样$g娇气:娇气;的人跑到“猪与哨声”来干什么？小心点，别把指甲弄断了……",cEN="Hello, fancy <boy/girl>! What's a prissy thing like you doing in the Pig and Whistle? Be careful, or you might break a nail..."}
Q[1640]={d="你想要什么？？你$g疯:疯;了！\n\n想从我手里拿走这杯酒，除非你从我冰冷死透的手指里掰出来……",dEN="You want what?? You're crazy!\n\nThe only way you'll get this mug is if you pry it from my cold, dead fingers...",o="打败巴特莱比，然后再和他谈一谈。",oEN="Beat Bartleby, then talk to him.",c="看不出你这么厉害！",cEN="You're a lot tougher than you look!"}
Q[1641]={c="在暴风城这里，我负责引领圣骑士走上更崇高的美德之路，让他们献身圣光，保护艾泽拉斯免受天灾军团和其他威胁的侵害。\n\n时候到了，你该迈出成为真正美德者的第一步。如果你接受，我会给你一本《圣光之书》。研读它，你会了解到一些关于圣光的事，以及人们对你的期望。如果你能理解它并有能力做到，就能成功获得更强大的技能。",cEN="Here in Stormwind, I am responsible for putting paladins on the path to greater virtue as they devote themselves to the Light and defend Azeroth from the Scourge and other threats.\n\nThe time has come for you to take your first step towards being truly virtuous. If you accept it, I will give you a Book of Divinity. In studying it, you shall learn some about the Light, and what is expected of you. If you understand it, and are capable, then you will succeed in attaining greater abilities."}
Q[1642]={d="无论在什么时候，圣骑士都必须严格地遵循圣光之道，因为它是我们力量的源泉。对于我们圣骑士来说，为了追求神圣而进行的几近苛刻的修行并不意味着我们是为了神格而努力——我们的目标是要在各方面都努力完善。\n\n虽然和邪恶斗争是眼前的当务之急，但是你必须牢记，只有无私地帮助他人才是圣骑士区别于普通人的根本要素。同情、耐心、勇敢——这些品德对圣骑士而言，和战斗中所表现出来的力量一样重要。\n\n记住这点，永远不要忘记。",dEN="In all things, a paladin must reflect the Light which supplements our strength. To strive to be divine for one of our kind does not mean we strive for godhood--we strive to be good in all actions.\n\nAlthough called upon to smite evil in these harsh times, you must always remember that it's aiding others that will truly set you apart from the citizens of Azeroth. Compassion, patience, bravery--these things mean as much to a paladin as strength in battle.\n\nKnow this well, and never forget it.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="又见面了，$N。你研读《圣光之书》进展如何？\n\n那么你应该准备好接受考验了。这座城市和我们的土地上总有任务要做：慈悲与理解之举；需要帮助的人；需要杀死的生物。\n\n通过证明你有耐心帮助他人，尤其是那些不幸之人，你就证明了自己是$g圣光的仆人:圣光的仆人;，且心智健全。",cEN="Hello again, <name>. How goes your studies of the Tome of Divinity?\n\nThen you should be prepared to have yourself tested. There are always tasks to be done throughout the city and our lands; acts of compassion and understanding; people who need help; creatures to slay.\n\nBy proving you have the patience to help others, especially those who are less fortunate, you prove that you are a servant of the Light and of sound mind."}
Q[1643]={d="$n，那么你的任务就是在暴风城找到一个需要帮助的人。一个心意纯正的人。也许是某个帮助他人的人。也许是某个需要指引的人。无论如何，那个人必须心怀高尚，并依赖你的善心。\n\n完成之后回来见我。那时我们再谈你的道路，以及做一名圣光圣骑士意味着什么。",dEN="Your task then, <name>, is to find someone here in Stormwind that is in need of aid. Someone who is pure of heart and motive. Perhaps someone helping others. Perhaps someone in need of a guide. Regardless, the person must have noble intent and be relying on your kindness.\n\nDo this, and return to me when you are finished. Then, we shall discuss more of your path and what it means to be a paladin of the Light.",o="在暴风城的贸易区找到斯蒂芬妮·特纳。",oEN="Search the Trade District of Stormwind for Stephanie Turner.",c="哦，你好，亲爱的。你的冒险进行得怎么样？很高兴听说你一切顺利。\n\n哦，我？谢谢你关心，总的来说我挺好。\n\n商人越来越多，如今人们愿意脱手的皮革和布料反而少了，所以给孤儿院的孩子们做衣服更困难了，不过我们能应付。我说的\"我们\"是指我和我丈夫。他正在铁炉堡，想从那里的市民手中寻求帮助。",cEN="Oh, hello, luv. How go your adventures? Oh, I'm so glad to hear you're doing well.\n\nOh, me? Thank you for asking--I'm doing well, all things considered.\n\nThe increase in tradesmen has kind of put a damper on the amount of leather and cloth people are willing to part with these days, so it's been tougher to make clothing for the children at the orphanage, but we'll manage. By \"we\" I mean my husband and I. He's up in Ironforge trying to seek help from the citizens there."}
Q[1644]={d="愿圣光护佑那些孩子，他们大多因为几年前那次亡灵天灾的袭击而失去了家庭。\n\n我丈夫约翰为我收集给孩子们做衣服裤子的布料，不过我没时间做，因为我得成天忙着照顾他们的饮食起居。\n\n什么？你愿意帮忙？赞美圣光，也感谢你，好心的$n。\n\n如果你能给我找点亚麻布来的话,我就能给孩子做衣服了，那可真是帮了我的大忙。",dEN="Bless their hearts, most of them have no families because of the Scourge attacks in the last decade.\n\nMy husband John collects the materials for me to make the shirts and pants for the children, but I haven't even had time to do that. I've been too focused on keeping food on their plates, and a roof over their heads.\n\nWhat's that? You'd be willing to help? Oh, thank the Light, and thank you, <name>.\n\nIf you could bring me some linen cloth so I can sew clothes for the kids, that would help me out so much.",o="给暴风城的斯蒂芬妮·特纳收集10块亚麻布。",oEN="Bring 10 Linen Cloth to Stephanie Turner in Stormwind.",p="但愿我丈夫约翰在铁炉堡能有更好的运气。他并不想把我和孩子们留下，自己一个人跑去那儿，不过他知道必须这么做，他真是太善良了。\n\n前些年的生活还不错，不过现在的日子越来越难过了。我们都能感觉到好像会有重大的变化发生，不过又有谁知道呢？",pEN="I hope my John is having better luck in Ironforge. He so dislikes his trips there because it leaves the kids and me alone, but he knows it must be done. He's so kind-hearted.\n\nSome years have been easier than others, but this one's been rougher by far. It's almost as though something in the air is signaling a huge change. Who knows though?",c="谢谢你，$n，太感谢了！\n\n孩子们会很高兴的，你为我节省了很多时间。现在我可以把精力集中在满足他们的其它需要上了，但愿我的约翰能早日回来。\n\n再次感谢你，$n。我知道会有你这样的好心人来帮我的。愿圣光与你同在。",cEN="Thank you, <name>, thank you so much!\n\nThe children will be so pleased, and you've saved me so much time. I'll now be able to focus on the children's other needs, and hopefully my John will be able to return home sooner than we thought.\n\nThank you again, <name>. I knew I could rely on the charity of others. The Light be with you."}
Q[1645]={c="在铁炉堡这里，我负责引领圣骑士走上更崇高的美德之路，让他们献身圣光，保护艾泽拉斯免受天灾军团和其他威胁的侵害。\n\n时候到了，$g你:你;该迈出成为真正美德者的第一步。如果你接受，我会给你一本《圣光之书》。研读它，你会了解到一些关于圣光的事，以及人们对你的期望。如果你能理解它并有能力做到，就能成功获得更强大的技能。",cEN="Here in Ironforge, I am responsible for putting paladins on the path to greater virtue as they devote themselves to the Light and defend Azeroth from the Scourge and other threats.\n\nThe time has come for you to take your first step towards being truly virtuous. If you accept it, I will give you a Book of Divinity. In studying it, you shall learn some about the Light, and what is expected of you. If you understand it, and are capable, then you will succeed in attaining greater abilities."}
Q[1646]={d="无论在什么时候，圣骑士都必须严格地遵循圣光之道，因为它是我们力量的源泉。对于我们圣骑士来说，为了追求神圣而进行的几近苛刻的修行并不意味着我们是为了神格而努力——我们的目标是要在各方面都努力完善。\n\n虽然和邪恶斗争是眼前的当务之急，但是你必须牢记，只有无私地帮助他人才是圣骑士区别于普通人的根本要素。同情、耐心、勇敢——这些品德对圣骑士而言，和战斗中所表现出来的力量一样重要。\n\n记住这点，永远不要忘记。",dEN="In all things, a paladin must reflect the Light which supplements our strength. To strive to be divine for one of our kind does not mean we strive for godhood--we strive to be good in all actions.\n\nAlthough called upon to smite evil in these harsh times, you must always remember that it's aiding others that will truly set you apart from the citizens of Azeroth. Compassion, patience, bravery--these things mean as much to a paladin as strength in battle.\n\nKnow this well, and never forget it.",o="与铁炉堡的蒂萨·热炉谈话。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。我希望你花了些时间读那本书。\n\n如果你读了，就应该$g准备好:准备好;接受考验了。这座城市和我们的土地上总有事情要做，慈悲与理解之举，需要帮助的人，需要杀死的生物。\n\n如果你证明自己有耐心帮助他人，尤其是那些不幸之人，你就证明了自己心智健全，是$g圣光的仆人:圣光的仆人;。",cEN="Welcome back, <name>. You've spent time reading the book, I hope?\n\nThen you should be prepared to have yourself tested. There are always tasks to be done throughout the city and our lands; acts of compassion and understanding; people who need help; creatures to slay.\n\nBy proving you have the patience to help others, especially those who are less fortunate, you prove that you are a servant of the Light and of sound mind."}
Q[1647]={d="$n，你的任务是在铁炉堡里找到一个需要帮助的人，一个心灵纯洁动机单纯的人。这也许是某个想要帮助别人的人，也许是某个需要指引的人。不管怎样，这个人必须心地纯朴，而且需要你的帮助。\n\n完成这件事之后再回到我这里来，那时我们再来谈关于你的修行之道，以及成为圣骑士的意义。",dEN="Your task then, <name>, is to find someone here in Ironforge that is in need of aid. Someone who is pure of heart and motive. Perhaps someone helping others. Perhaps someone in need of a guide. Regardless, the person must have noble intent and be relying on your kindness.\n\nDo this, and return to me when you are finished. Then, we shall discuss more of your path and what it means to be a paladin of the Light. I will remain here in the temple for your return. Other paladins will need my guidance also.",o="在铁炉堡的外环区域找到约翰·特纳。",oEN="Search the outer ring of Ironforge for John Turner.",c="暴风城孤……哦，抱歉，我不是有意冲你喊的。\n\n我叫约翰·特纳。你好吗？\n\n好，好，很高兴听说你一切顺利。我已经忙了一整天，特别想念我的妻子……但当你有一堆嘴要喂、一堆背要穿的时候，这就是必须付出的代价。",cEN="THE ORPHANAGE OF STOR... oh, sorry, didn't mean to shout at you, sir.\n\nMy name is John Turner. How are you?\n\nGood, good, glad to hear things go well for you. I've had a long day of work already, and I miss my wife terribly, but that's the price you have to pay when there are mouths to feed and backs to clothe."}
Q[1648]={d="我和我的妻子在暴风城管理着一家孤儿院，帮助在过去几年里因为亡灵天灾的袭击而失去双亲的孩子们。我差不多每个月都要来铁炉堡收集这里的居民捐赠的物资，而且我也会和不同的团体商谈，尽可能地寻求他们的帮助。\n\n这样的旅程往往让人苦恼，因为它很费时间而且收效甚微。\n\n如果能找到些亚麻布来让我妻子给那些孤儿做些衣服的话，我想我就可以寄些东西回家了。",dEN="My wife and I run an orphanage in Stormwind, mostly for children who have lost parents due to the attacks by the Scourge in the last decade. I come to Ironforge every month or so to see about collecting more supplies from the citizens here, and talk to the various groups to see if they can do anything to help.\n\nThis trip's been agonizingly slow, and not very productive.\n\nIf I could just get some more linen for my wife to make some clothes, I could finally send a shipment home.",o="收集10块亚麻布，把它们交给铁炉堡的约翰·特纳。",oEN="Bring 10 Linen Cloth to John Turner in Ironforge.",p="就算是这里和整个艾泽拉斯的商人都愿意帮忙，我们也无法得到足够的材料为孤儿院的所有孩子们制作衣裳。请帮我收集一些亚麻布，好让我的妻子力所能及地帮助孩子们。谢谢您，$n。\n\n如果走运的话，不久之后我就能回家见到我的妻子了。",pEN="What with the influx of tradesmen here and throughout Azeroth, there's a smaller supply of items we use to make clothes for the children of our orphanage. Helping me collect linen so my wife can make new clothes for them is very noble of you, <name>. Thank you.\n\nHopefully, I'll be able to return home to my wife soon.",c="你真是太好了，$n。再次感谢。\n\n你是个高尚的人。没多少人会为我做这种事。难怪你选择了追随圣光。我真希望能找到办法报答你所做的一切……什么？你说这是你最起码能做的？看吧？我说的就是这个，$n，你高尚到底了。\n\n愿你旅途平安，愿圣光保佑你。",cEN="This is so wonderful of you, <name>. Thank you again.\n\nYou're a noble man for doing this for me. It's no wonder you've chosen to follow the Light. I wish there was some way I could repay you for all you've done... what's that? It's the least you could do? See? That's what I'm talking about, <name>, noble to the end.\n\nBe safe, and may the Light protect you in your travels."}
Q[1649]={d="勇气，以及伴随着它而共同存在的一切美德，就如同那些珍贵的矿石一般：当你拥有它们的时候，要记得珍惜，因为它们非常宝贵。你也需要花费很大的精力去开采，去提炼。当你恰当地将这些矿石混合起来，一种新的坚不可摧的金属就会产生，即使是最强大的力量也无法将其破坏。\n\n这种来自你的信仰和勇气的力量必须经过考验。你必须学会绝不放弃信仰，并了解到在圣光之力的庇护下，你可以跨越过凡人根本无法跨越的障碍。",dEN="Valor, and all the virtues that go along with it, are like rare minerals: you must cherish them when you find them because of their value, but you must also take time to harvest them... refine them. When mixed together properly, a strong alloy is formed, sometimes unbreakable by even the most powerful blows.\n\nThis strength, your faith, your bravery, must be tested. You must learn to never lose faith and realize that with the power of the Light, you can overcome things that most others cannot.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="啊，你想向我申请一场勇气的考验。好极了。\n\n这座城市和周边土地上有许多任务，充满挑战，正适合有你这样本领的人。\n\n这场考验不能等闲视之，$n。这件事，就像你道路上会遇到的许多事一样，可能要了我们的命。教会总想扩充队伍，但也明白需要牺牲，才能确保为其效力的圣骑士配得上这份荣耀。\n\n你准备好了吗？",cEN="Ah, you wish to petition me for a test of valor. Splendid.\n\nThere are many tasks throughout the city and surrounding lands that hold much challenge, and they could use a man with your skills.\n\nThis test should not be taken lightly, <name>. This, like many things along our path, could take our lives. The Church always wishes to bolster its ranks, but it understands the sacrifices needed to ensure the paladins serving it are worthy.\n\nAre you prepared?"}
Q[1650]={d="很好！你毫不迟疑，这明确表明你已$g准备好:准备好;、也$g愿意:愿意;接受考验。那就这样吧。\n\n在西部荒野长滩的尽头，有一间俯瞰大海的小屋。那里住着一对夫妇，斯蒂尔维尔家。乔丹是位了不起的铁匠，他去铁炉堡跟矮人们待了一阵子。但这让他的妻子达芙妮独自一人，无人保护。\n\n报告显示迪菲亚几乎控制了整个地区，达芙妮可能需要保护。去那里吧。",dEN="Good! Your lack of hesitation is a sure sign that you are prepared and eager to test yourself. So be it.\n\nAt the very ends of Westfall's Longshore, a small house overlooks the ocean. There, a couple lives, the Stilwells. Jordan is an incredible smith, and he's gone to Ironforge to meet with the dwarves for a while. But this has left Daphne, his wife, alone and unprotected.\n\nReports suggest that the Defias have all but taken over the area, Daphne may need some protection from the villains. Go there.",o="在西部荒野找到达芙妮·斯迪威尔。",oEN="Find Daphne Stilwell in Westfall.",c="你好，$n。既然你带着盔甲和武器来到这儿，我想你如果不是来抢我的土地，就是在我丈夫离开以后由教会派来保护我的。\n\n那么，请先允许我自我介绍一下:我是达芙妮·斯迪威尔。很高兴见到你。\n\n你来得还不算太晚……从日出到现在，我只干掉了6个坏蛋。他们本来一直在这四周晃来晃去的，但后来他们可能是看见你来了，就很快跑掉了，不过，这或许意味着他们随时都会再来。",cEN="Hello, <name>. I'm assuming by all that armor and weapon of yours, you're either here to try and take my land, or the Church finally sent someone to help protect me while my Jordan's gone.\n\nWell, let me introduce myself: I'm Daphne Stilwell. It's a pleasure.\n\nNow, you're not too late... I've only killed a half dozen of the scum since last sun up. They've been a little slow getting 'round the bend up there, but they probably saw you coming, which means they'll probably be here any minute."}
Q[1651]={d="我敢打赌他们很快还会再来，所以做好准备。\n\n屋里有一把枪。我会拿上它并准备帮你，但大体上，你得$g独自:独自;应对。\n\n我不知道他们会派多少人，但我确信会比之前派来的多。\n\n向圣光祈求你能得到的祝福吧，因为……你听见了吗？我想他们已经来了。\n\n我们在屋子附近布防！",dEN="Now, they'll be coming again soon, I'd wager, so get yourself ready.\n\nI've got myself a gun in the house. I'll grab it and be ready to help you out, but for the most part, you're on your own.\n\nI've no idea how many they'll send, but I'm sure it'll be more than the few they sent earlier.\n\nAsk the Light for whatever blessings you can because... did you hear that? I think they're coming.\n\nWe make our stand near the house!",o="保护达芙妮·斯蒂尔维尔免受迪菲亚的袭击。\n\n如果你想成功，你们两人的灵魂都不能脱离凡躯。\n\n成功之后，再次与达芙妮·斯蒂尔维尔交谈。",oEN="Defend Daphne Stilwell from the Defias attack.\n\nNeither of your spirits must be released from their mortal coils if you wish to succeed.\n\nAfter you are successful, speak to Daphne Stilwell again.",c="我们做到了，$n！谢谢你的帮助。你在外面真是太厉害了。我从没想过一个$c能同时应付那么多敌人。\n\n在压倒性的劣势面前，你确实展现了勇气。",cEN="We've done it, <name>! Thank you for your help. You were truly amazing out there. I never thought a <class> could handle so many enemies at once.\n\nYou've truly shown bravery in the face of overwhelming odds."}
Q[1652]={d="请回去见杜索里安，告诉他我暂时安全了。这全都多亏了你和教会。\n\n他会把消息送到铁炉堡，让我亲爱的乔丹知道他没什么可担心的。\n\n哦，我多想念我的丈夫！我迫不及待想让他回来。",dEN="Please, return to Duthorian and let him know that I'm safe for now. I have you and the Church to thank for that.\n\nHe'll send word to Ironforge to let my Jordan know that he has nothing to fear.\n\nOh, how I miss my husband. I can't wait till he returns.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="那么，我们又见面了，$n，我看你心情很好。\n\n斯蒂尔维尔家又能安稳一天了，从你的讲述来看，危险可不少。干得好。\n\n达芙妮和乔丹帮了教会很多，让你保护他们的财产——乃至他们的性命——是我们能为他们做的最起码的事。\n\n为了你的英勇，你将得到奖赏。",cEN="So, we meet again, <name>, and you are in high spirits, I see.\n\nThe Stilwell home will be safe for another day, and from your story I see that there was no shortage of danger to be found. Well done.\n\nDaphne and Jordan have helped the Church greatly, and having you protect their property--and their very lives--was the least we could do for them.\n\nFor your valor, you will be rewarded."}
Q[1653]={d="事实上，我想乔丹本人会非常感谢你的。我正准备找人给他送个信，让他知道他的妻子目前很安全，我想你就是个合适的人选。\n\n乔丹原本可以成为一名为圣光而战的圣骑士，不过后来为了继承他父亲的手艺走上了另一条路——他对我们的生活方式非常熟悉，也是我们最忠实的朋友。\n\n他应该还在铁炉堡，白天的时候，乔丹喜欢在室外工作，比如在山里呼吸新鲜的空气。",dEN="Actually, I have no doubt that Jordan himself would like to thank you, and seeing as I need a messenger to send word that his wife is safe, I think you'd be a perfect choice.\n\nJordan was to be a paladin of the Light before his dedication to his father's craft took him on another path--he's intimately familiar with our way of life and is considered among our most faithful.\n\nHe should still be in Ironforge--he likes to work outside the gates during the day, something about the cool mountain air.",o="去和铁炉堡的乔丹·斯迪威尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Jordan Stilwell in Ironforge",c="你好，$n。我相信圣光与你同在？\n\n什么？是杜索里安派你来的！？我的妻子，她怎么样了？我就知道我一走会出事。请告诉我她……哦，谢天谢地。我真高兴她平安无事。迪菲亚早在这些袭击之前就是威胁，但现在国王的顾问们无法再否认了。\n\n杜索里安还说了什么？\n\n$g你就是:你就是;被派去保护我妻子的人？那么我再次感谢你，$n。我想不出比这更好的勇气考验了。",cEN="Good day, <name>. The Light is with you, I trust?\n\nWhat's that? You were sent by Duthorian!? My wife, how is she? I knew there was going to be trouble if I left. Please tell me she's... oh, thank goodness. I'm so glad that she's safe. The Defias were a threat long before these attacks, but now the King's advisors cannot deny it.\n\nWhat else did Duthorian have to say?\n\nYou're the one that was sent to protect my wife? Then I thank you again, <name>. I couldn't think of a better test of valor than that."}
Q[1654]={d="如果你愿意接受，我会奖赏你。请别误会，我的慷慨取决于你能帮上多少忙，但我认为这样的结盟对我们双方都大有好处。\n\n我会为你打造一件配得上你成就的武器，圣骑士与圣光的象征，但你必须为我收集打造它所需的材料。我这儿已经列好了清单；我只需要一个够勇敢的人去把材料找回来。你觉得怎么样，$c？",dEN="I'd like to reward you if you'd be willing to accept such a thing? Don't misunderstand me, my generosity is dependent on how much help you can be, but I see us both benefiting greatly from such an alliance.\n\nI will craft for you a weapon worthy of what you've accomplished, a symbol of paladinhood and the Light, but you must gather the items I need to craft it. I've already started taking notes on the items, it just requires someone brave and skilled enough to recover them. What do you say, <class>?",o="按照乔丹的武器材料单上的说明去寻找一些白石橡木、精炼矿石、乔丹的铁锤和一块科尔宝石，然后回到铁炉堡去见乔丹·斯迪威尔。",oEN="Using Jordan's Weapon Notes, find some Whitestone Oak Lumber, Bailor's Refined Ore Shipment, Jordan's Smithing Hammer, and a Kor Gem, and return them to Jordan Stilwell in Ironforge.",p="这些材料很难找到，不过我可以向你保证，我为你制造的武器绝对值得你这么做。\n\n这将是我当前为止最出色的作品，是送给你当作回报的。",pEN="The items you're seeking will be difficult to acquire, but I can assure you, the weapon I will craft for you will be worth the effort.\n\nIt will be my finest work to date, and only a small payment for the service you've done me.",c="太好了！你拿到这些东西了。\n\n有了这些我就可以铸造强大的武器了。其实我早有计划来做，不过一直都没有机会去收集这些材料。谢谢你，$n。\n\n再次握住我父亲的铁锤的感觉真好……还有这块科尔宝石，我可从来没想过自己能亲眼见到这个。",cEN="This is wonderful! You've gotten all the items.\n\nI should have no problem forging you a grand weapon with these. I've actually had the plans for doing this for some time. I just never had the opportunity to gather the goods. Thank you, <name>.\n\nIt feels good to have my father's hammer again...and a Kor gem. I never thought I'd see one of these myself."}
Q[1655]={d="啊！你吓了我一跳，$g先生:小姐！你没看到我在思考吗？\n\n那是什么？乔丹的矿石…送去铁炉堡的……啊，这样啊，我知道你说的是什么了。那群莫格罗什食人魔抢走了我朋友的矿石，商队从这里转至湿地的路上遭到了埋伏。唯一从袭击中逃出的守卫也在前几天死掉了——医师没能及时赶到。\n\n你想找到那些矿石，就往东北方向去，在洛克湖的另一边。矿石一定就在那里的某个地方。",dEN="Ach, ya startled me, <man/woman>! Can't ya see I was lost in thought?\n\nWhat's that? Jordan's shipment... fer Ironforge. Ahhh, yeah, I know whatcha speak of. Mo'grosh ogres... dat's who took me ol' friend's ore shipment. Caravan was headin' here from the Wetlands and was ambushed. The guard who survived their attack just passed away a few days ago--healer couldn't get to 'em fast enough.\n\nIf you want the shipment, you'll have to head northeast across the Loch. It's got to be there somewhere.",o="把乔丹的矿石带给洛克莫丹的白洛尔·石手。",oEN="Bring Jordan's Ore Shipment to Bailor Stonehand in Loch Modan.",p="运气怎么样？哈哈，那些巨魔打不过你，对不对？",pEN="So, any luck yet? Haha, those ogres didn't get the best of ya yet, did they?",c="是的是的，就是这些。哈哈！早知道你真的能去那儿和巨魔斗斗，我就该让你多让做点事情。不过，你来这儿不是帮我做事的，对吧？\n\n一桩归一桩，乔丹想要我把他的货拿回来，那他就一定能拿到。\n\n代我向他问好，路上多加小心，$c。",cEN="Yup yup, this is it. Ha! If I'd known you were really gonna head out there and fight some o' them ogres, I woulda given you a list of things to get instead of just this one thing. But, you're not here doin' business for me, are ya?.\n\nA deal's a deal; Jordan wanted a shipment of me alloy, that's what he's gonna get.\n\nTell 'em hello fer me, and be safe, <class>."}
Q[1656]={d="拜托，$n，求求你了，帮我一个忙吧！我正在完成我的力量仪祭，但父亲又要求我将这些皮毛送到血蹄村的旅店。\n\n我实在分不开身去同时完成仪祭和父亲交付给我的任务。你……能不能替我跑一趟？\n\n在长途旅行之后，旅店可是个休息的好地方。我敢说你到了那里之后也会同意的。",dEN="<name>, please, I beg of you, can you help me? I have not finished my tasks here on the Mesa--I'm in the middle of my Rite of Strength--and my father asked me to deliver these furs to the inn in Bloodhoof.\n\nI'm far from rested enough to complete both my rite and this task for my father. Would you mind going on for me?\n\nThe inn is pleasant and a perfect place to rest during your long travels. I'm sure you'll agree once you see it.",o="将一捆毛皮带给血蹄村的旅店老板考乌斯。",oEN="Bring the Bundle of Furs to Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof Village.",p="你好，年轻人，我能为你做点什么吗？\n\n从台地走到这里对某些人来说可实在是极大的负担，不过对另一些人则是开阔眼界的好机会。我想知道你是这两种人里的哪一种？",pEN="Yes, young one? What can Kauth do for you?\n\nThe journey here from the Mesa can be a tremendous burden for some, but a welcome sight for others. Which is it for you, I wonder?",c="啊，这正是我在等着送来的皮毛，谢谢你啦。\n\n比我预期的到货时间还要早一些。我会把它们编成毯子，给住在这里歇息的旅客使用。\n\n把这里当成自己的家吧，一切请随意。我的旅店从不关门，我们的同胞在这里总是受欢迎的。还有，千万别不注意休息，好好睡一晚会让你第二天的旅途大为不同。",cEN="Ah, the furs I was expecting. Thank you.\n\nThese came faster than I had expected. They will make good blankets for anyone who wishes to stay here.\n\nPlease feel free to stay as long as you like. My inn is always open and all of our people are welcome here. And don't underestimate a good night's rest, it can make a great difference while you're out traveling."}
Q[1657]={d="我们这次万圣节的庆祝要换个方式……我们要给南海镇的敌人带去痛苦！\n\n拿着这些特殊的臭气弹。其中包含了任何人类——或者较弱的野兽——都无法忍受的味道。你需要把这些臭气弹丢在南海镇的中心，然后使它生效，准备和联盟好好干一仗吧！\n\n当你完成任务之后……完成这个象征我们自由的标志之后，回到我这里来！",dEN="Celebrate Hallow's End in style... by bringing grief to our enemies in Southshore!\n\nTake one of these specially crafted stink bombs. It is filled with an odiferous funk that no human - or any weak-willed beast for that matter - can stand to smell. You'll need to throw it right in the heart of Southshore for it to do its job, so be prepared for a fight against the Alliance!\n\nWhen you've completed this task... this tribute to our liberation, return to me!",o="将三颗亡灵臭气弹放置在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇中心，完成任务之后回到提瑞斯法林地的黑暗召唤者雅恩卡那里。",oEN="Toss three Forsaken Stink Bombs into the heart of Southshore in Hillsbrad, and return to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade.",p="你把我们的\"礼物\"送给南海镇的人了么？\n\n<黑暗召唤者扬卡邪恶地大笑。>",pEN="Have you delivered our \"gift\" to the people of Southshore?\n\n<Darkcaller Yanka laughs wickedly.>",c="啊，做得好！希望联盟会被我们给的恶臭礼物给呛死，就像我们被迫遭天灾军团奴役而被枷锁窒息一样！\n\n你的万圣节消息是真的，$n，为此我向你致敬。作为额外的奖励，我要分你一些万圣节糖果。我想你一定会觉得它们是有趣的消遣！",cEN="Ah, well done! I hope the Alliance chokes on the foul gift we've given them, much like we were forced to choke on the yoke of enslavement to the Scourge!\n\nYou've kept the ideas of Hallow's End true, <name>, and for that I salute you. As an extra bonus, let me share some of these Hallow's End treats I have with you. I think you might find them to be quite the enjoyable diversion!"}
Q[1658]={d="我需要勇敢的人去提瑞斯法林地然后找到亡灵的稻草人节日举办地点。我不想撒谎——去那里会有危险。那里的守卫非常凶悍。但是，我们需要知道今年这个展会的规模有多大，另外就是被遗忘者打算在万圣节给我们造成多大的麻烦。\n\n如果你愿意接受这个任务的话，去提瑞斯法林地进行侦查吧。当你得到有价值的情报之后就回到我这里来，我会给予你优厚的补偿。",dEN="I need brave individuals to head up to Tirisfal Glades and check out the Wickerman Festival. I'm not going to lie - heading up there will be dangerous. The guards at the festival will be exceptionally vicious. Still, we need to know how big the festival is this year, and how much trouble the Forsaken are going to cause us during Hallow's End.\n\nIf you're up for it, head to Tirisfal and scout out the festival. Return to me with the information, and I'll make sure you're well compensated.",o="在提瑞斯法林地找到被遗忘者的稻草人节日举办地点。任务完成之后回到南海镇的哈特曼中士那里。",oEN="Locate the Forsaken's Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glades. Return to Sergeant Hartman in Southshore once you've done so.",c="你做的很好，$n。只要那些可恶的被遗忘者还继续骚扰洛丹伦的遗迹，稻草人节就会一直是个麻烦。这对一个曾经伟大的王国来说是个困扰，让我告诉你……。\n\n这里有一些钱让你做需要的修补工作，还有一些你会喜欢的季节小点心。万圣节尾声快乐——让南海镇这里尽可能的保持安全吧。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The Wickerman Festival will continue to be trouble so long as the abominable Forsaken are allowed to haunt the remnants of Lordaeron. It is NOT a fitting tribute to that once proud kingdom, let me tell you...\n\nHere's some coin for any repairs you might need, and in the spirit of the season I've also included some treats you might like. Happy Hallow's End - let's keep it as safe as possible here in Southshore."}
Q[1661]={d="再次向你致意，$n。比以往更让我骄傲的是能称你为$g兄弟:姐妹;。你的奉献是我们所有人的荣耀。\n\n时候到了，我该赐予你一份厚礼。但你要知道：眼下我无偿地把它给你，但日后时机成熟时，这对所有选择接受我任务的圣骑士来说都将是更大的挑战。\n\n再跟我谈一次，我就会赐予你一份厚礼。",dEN="I greet you once again, <name>. I am more proud to call you <brother/sister> than ever before--your dedication is a tribute to us all.\n\nThe time has come for me to bestow a great gift upon you. But know this, for now I give you this freely, but later, when time permits, this will be a much greater challenge to all paladins who choose to undertake my quest.\n\nSpeak to me again and I shall grant you a great boon.\n\nYou will still require Apprentice Riding to ride this mount.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="恭喜你，愿圣光保护你。",cEN="Congratulations, and may the Light protect you."}
Q[1665]={d="好吧，这是我的酒杯。等等！让我先把酒喝光……给你。",dEN="Ok, here's my mug. Wait! Let me finish what's in it first... there we go.",o="把巴特莱比的酒杯交给伯加德。",oEN="Bring Bartleby's Mug to Burlguard",p="看来你和巴特莱比打了一架。真是不错！你拿到酒杯了吗？",pEN="I saw your fight with Bartleby. Nicely done! Did you get his mug?",c="到手了！他肯定不愿割爱，但你很有$g说服力:说服力;。干得好。\n\n现在开始你的课程……",cEN="There it is! He sure didn't want to part with it, but you were persuasive. Well done.\n\nNow for your lesson..."}
Q[1666]={d="你学了几招，但还用得上一件像样的武器。我敢说，如果你去跟哈加德元帅谈谈，他能帮上忙。\n\n哈加德元帅住在艾尔文森林东谷伐木场的一座庄园里。他已经退休了，但职业生涯中收集了大量装备。\n\n告诉他是我让你去的，运气好的话，他会有一件多余的武器给你。",dEN="You've learned a few moves, but you could still use a decent weapon. I bet if you spoke with Marshal Haggard he could help you.\n\nMarshal Haggard lives in a manor in Elwynn Forest, at the Eastvale Lumber Camp. He's retired now but he collected a lot of gear during his career.\n\nLet him know I sent you, and with luck he'll have a spare weapon to offer.",o="和治安官哈迦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Marshal Haggard.",c="谁啊？\n\n是伯尔加德，你吗？\n\n你得再走近点。我的眼睛不如从前了。\n\n你那样走过来，我还以为是豺狼人呢！",cEN="Who's that?\n\nBurlguard, is that you?\n\nYou'll have to step a little closer. My eyes aren't what they used to be.\n\nWalking up like that, I thought you were a gnoll!"}
Q[1667]={d="是伯加德派你来的吗？是的，我这里的确有一些剩余的武器，不过首先有一项任务交给你……\n\n不久以前，一个被称作蛀牙杰克的迪菲亚混蛋捉弄了我。天很黑，他穿着一件暴风城卫兵的衣服，我还以为他是治安官杜汉呢。他说他要我那个旧的暴风城治安官徽章，我就把徽章给了他……然后他便大笑起来，在我反应过来之前就跑掉了！\n\n帮我取回我的勋章！蛀牙杰克应该是把徽章放在南边的迪菲亚盗贼营地里了。",dEN="Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you...\n\nA while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me. It was dark and he was wearing a Stormwind tabard and I thought he was Marshal Dughan. He said he needed my old Stormwind Marshal's badge and I gave it to him... and then he laughed and ran off before I could catch him!\n\nGet back my badge! Dead-tooth Jack probably has it stowed in his camp to the south.",o="从蛀牙杰克的营地里取回治安官哈迦德的徽章，把它交给治安官哈迦德。",oEN="Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard.",p="你找到我的勋章了吗？我可不希望蛀牙杰克用它去作恶。",pEN="Do you have my badge? I don't want to think of the mischief Dead-tooth Jack could cause with it.",c="太好了，你找到它了！我担心迪菲亚的人会用它来冒充暴风城的军官，还好这样的事情现在不会发生了，谢谢你。\n\n这是我当治安官时用过的武器，我把它们保养得很好——你随便挑一件吧。",cEN="Great, you found it! I feared it was gone forever, used by the Defias to impersonate a Stormwind official. Well that won't happen now, thanks to you.\n\nHere are some weapons I used when I was a Marshal. I kept them in great shape--take your pick!"}
Q[1678]={d="如果你想在战士的行列中往上爬，最好够强悍。我可以教你新招式，但在此之前，先向我证明你能应付真正的对手。\n\n维杰克是这一带你能找到的最硬的巨魔，你要打败的就是他。他在冰霜鬃村落以南的山坡上有一间小屋。\n\n把他的头带给我，我就知道你是否真有胆魄。",dEN="If you want to rise in the ranks of the warriors, then you better be tough. I can teach you new moves but before that, prove to me you can handle yourself against real foes.",o="将维吉雷克的头颅交给铁炉堡的穆伦·雷矛。",oEN="Bring Vejrek's Head to Muren Stormpike in Ironforge.",p="你去过维吉雷克的棚屋了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you been to Vejrek's hut, <name>? Is that troll stink I smell on you?",c="维杰克肯定丑得够呛，是吧？干得好，$n！你有那个本事，现在开始上课……\n\n也许你还不知道，强大的防御对$g一个:一个; $c来说非常重要。它能让他面对别的职业会被击倒的敌人仍屹立不倒，而你的盟友正需要这一点。",cEN="Vejrek sure was an ugly one, eh? Nicely done, <name>! You have what it takes, now let's start your lesson...\n\nYou may not know it, but a strong defense is very important to a <class>. It keeps him standing against foes that'd fell others, and that's what your allies need."}
Q[1679]={d="你好，$g战士:战士;！你看起来$g大有前途:大有前途;，但你还得学些诀窍，而穆伦·雷矛正是你需要的那位矮人。\n\n你可以在铁炉堡军事区的武器大厅找到他。等你$g准备好:准备好;去了解什么是真正的$g战士:战士;时，就去找他谈谈。",dEN="Hello, warrior! You show a lot of promise, but you still need to learn some tricks and Muren Stormpike is just the dwarf to teach you.\n\nYou can find Muren at the Hall of Arms in the Military Ward of Ironforge. Talk to him when you're ready to learn what it is to be a warrior.",o="和穆伦·雷矛谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Muren Stormpike.",p="可有什么收获吗？",pEN="Did you make the switch?",c="啊，$n。我听说丹莫罗的战士们到处赞颂你。希望你不要整天躺在功劳簿上睡大觉！",cEN="Ah, <name>. I heard the warriors of Dun Morogh bouncing your name around. I hope you haven't spent all your time in the breweries!"}
Q[1680]={d="既然你已经学了几招，该是为你配备一件像样的武器的时候了。去和托姆斯·深炉谈谈吧，他能铸造一件肯定让你喜欢的武器。\n\n托姆斯就在铁炉堡的大锻炉。",dEN="Now that you've learned some moves, it's time to get you a decent weapon. Speak with Tormus Deepforge. He can make you a weapon I'm sure you'll like.\n\nYou'll find Tormus here in Ironforge, at the Great Forge.",o="和托姆斯·深炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tormus Deepforge.",c="是穆伦让你来的吧？是的，我能给你打一件漂亮的武器……但在那之前，我得先请你帮个忙。\n\n别担心。这事相当危险，可能让你送命；正是一个$c想要的那种活儿。",cEN="Muren sent you, did he? Yes, I can make you a nice weapon... but before I do that, I have a favor to ask of you.\n\nDon't worry. It's plenty dangerous and could mean your death; it's exactly the sort of job a <class> wants."}
Q[1681]={d="我的导师，斯塔基·铁环，原本在丹莫罗东部的盔枕湖南边有一处独家小院。他在那里向别人传授铁匠的技能，他绝对是最棒的。\n\n不过，有一天，他的一个学生带给他一块奇特的矿石。铁环把它叫做暗影矿石，他很希望能用它做点什么，可是，之后不久……一伙黑铁矮人袭击了他的小院。他们杀死了所有的人！\n\n到铁环的小院去，$n，为我的导师复仇，然后把那块暗影矿石给我带回来。",dEN="My mentor, Sturgy Ironband, had a compound south of Helm's Bed Lake in eastern Dun Morogh. There he taught blacksmithing and he was the best.\n\nBut one day, one of his students brought him a load of strange ore. Master Ironband called it umbral ore and was eager to work with it, but soon after it arrived... a band of Dark Iron dwarves attacked his compound. They killed everyone!\n\nEnter Ironband's compound, <name>, and avenge my master's death. And bring me the load of umbral ore that caused it.",o="把暗影矿石交给铁炉堡的托姆斯·深炉。",oEN="Bring a load of Umbral Ore to Tormus Deepforge in Ironforge.",p="你去过铁环的小院了吗？你找到阴影矿石了吗？",pEN="Have you entered Ironband's Compound? Did you find the umbral ore?",c="你找到它了！干得不错！\n\n我希望你在搜索的时候把那伙黑铁矮人全都给干掉了。恐怕铁环的小院不会是我们唯一可以找得到他们的地方。\n\n不过，还是谢谢你带回了矿石，$n。我很希望马上能够使用它，看看它有什么样的特性。",cEN="You found it! Well done!\n\nI hope you killed a host of Dark Iron dwarves while searching. I fear that Ironband's compound won't be the last place we see them.\n\nBut thank you for the ore, <name>. I'm eager to work it and find its properties."}
Q[1682]={c="这里是一些刚从滚烫的铁砧上取下来的武器，是用你带给我的阴影矿石制成的！\n\n$n，你随便挑一件吧！",cEN="Here are some weapons, hot off the anvil and made with the new umbral ore you brought me!\n\nPlease, <name>, take your pick!"}
Q[1683]={d="在我能教你之前，你必须向我展示你的决心。\n\n萨特沃鲁斯·邪蹄找到了我们一处偏远的月亮井，就在班尼希尔土丘东南方。如今他整天在里面趟水，用他的污秽玷污纯净的井水。\n\n在月亮井找到沃鲁斯并解决他。把他的角带给我作为凭证，我就开始你作为$g战士:战士;的进阶训练。\n\n通往月亮井的路藏得很隐蔽，$n，但保持$g专注:专注;和警觉，你就能找到它。",dEN="Before I can teach you, you must show me your resolve.\n\nThe satyr Vorlus Vilehoof has found one of our remote moonwells, southeast of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den. He now splashes within it, defiling its pure waters with his filth.\n\nFind Vorlus at the moonwell and destroy him. Bring me his horn as proof and I will begin your advanced training as a warrior.\n\nThe path to the moonwell is hidden well, <name>, but stay focused and alert and you will find it.",o="将沃鲁斯的角交给达纳苏斯的艾兰娜瑞。",oEN="Bring the Horn of Vorlus to Elanaria in Darnassus.",p="你拿到角了吗，$n？玷污月亮井的恶魔沃鲁斯死了吗？",pEN="Do you have the horn, <name>? Is our moonwell free of the fiend Vorlus?",c="干得不错，$n。很高兴得知你打败了沃鲁斯的消息，你让我们的月亮井恢复了纯净，像你这样年轻的战士们为保护我们心爱的泰达希尔不受堕落的影响而战斗，这让我很欣慰。\n\n现在开始训练吧……",cEN="Well done, <name>. It is good to know Vorlus is defeated and our moonwell cleansed, and it is good to see young warriors eager to keep our beloved Teldrassil free of corruption.\n\nNow let us begin your training..."}
Q[1684]={d="你好，$g战士:战士;。你的技艺不断增长，但你的职业远比你想象的更博大。要继续进步，你很快得找个老师。\n\n女战士艾拉娜莉亚住在达纳苏斯，战士之台。她可以指导你。",dEN="Greetings, warrior. Your skill grows, but there is more to your profession than you may believe. To further progress, you must soon find a teacher.\n\nThe warrior Elanaria dwells in Darnassus, at the Warrior's Terrace. She can instruct you.",o="和艾兰娜瑞谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Elanaria.",c="向你致意，$n。你的名字在达纳苏斯很响亮，因为你$g大有前途:大有前途;。但我们很快就能看出，你是否拥有走$c之路所需的意志力。",cEN="I bid you greetings, <name>. Your name rings loudly in Darnassus, for you show promise. But we shall soon see if you possess the strength of will to follow the path of the <class>."}
Q[1685]={d="难道不是每次都这样吗？！我找了你一整天都不见你的踪影，等我已经不指望能找到你的时候你却来了。\n\n你已经浪费我太多时间了，所以现在咱们就少废话了。加科因大师要召见你进行更多训练，我觉得你最好还是尽快找到他。\n\n他在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖里。顺便说一句，他的藏身地点你可得保密，不要让别人知道了。",dEN="Isn't that how it always works? Was looking for you all day and couldn't find you, now when I'm not expecting it, you come and walk right up to me.\n\nI've wasted enough time trying to find you, so I won't delay you any longer. Master Gakin's summoned you for additional training. Seems to me you should seek him out as soon as possible.\n\nYou'll find him in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb tavern. By the way, you might want to keep that particular location quiet. Don't want word spreading about it.",o="去暴风城的法师区向黑暗缚灵者加科因报到。",oEN="Report to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",c="你总算露面了。不过，也许我该派个比雷门更能干的人去找你。\n\n无所谓。\n\n你太久没有训练了，而一个没受过训练的术士的脑袋在肩膀上待不了多久。",cEN="About time you showed up. Though, perhaps I should have sent someone more capable than Remen to find you.\n\nNo matter.\n\nYou've gone too long without training, and a warlock without training isn't like to keep his head on his shoulders for long."}
Q[1686]={d="你学到了很多，$n。现在我们可以为你打造一件武器了。一件$g真正的战士:真正的战士;的武器。\n\n为此你必须前往黑海岸。\n\n很久以前，一艘船在奥伯丁灯塔附近的礁石上撞毁，许多艾露恩矿矿石箱散落在海底。\n\n首先，你必须击败艾露恩矿的守护者，伊鲁拉的幽影。她曾是那艘船的船长，诅咒自己永远在深海中徘徊，守护那批货物。击败她，拿到她的徽章，并收集失落的艾露恩矿箱。",dEN="You have learned much, <name>. Now we will craft you a weapon. A warrior's weapon.\n\nTo do this, you must travel to Darkshore.\n\nLong ago a ship crashed upon the rocks near the Auberdine lighthouse, scattering many crates of elunite ore along the ocean floor.\n\nFirst, you must defeat the elunite's guardian, the Shade of Elura. Once the ship's captain, she cursed herself to roam the deeps and protect her shipment for all time. Defeat her, gain her medallion, and gather the crates of lost Elunite.",o="将艾鲁拉的徽章和8块月神矿石交给达纳苏斯的艾兰娜瑞。",oEN="Bring 8 loads of Elunite Ore and the Medallion of Elura to Elanaria in Darnassus.",p="你打败艾鲁拉的阴影了吗，$n？你找到丢失的月神矿石了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the Shade of Elura, <name>? And do you have the lost elunite ore?",c="你真是太勇敢了，$n。\n\n你让艾鲁拉的阴影得到了安息。我们会用这些矿石为你打造一件精巧的武器。",cEN="Bravely done, <name>.\n\nYou have given the Shade of Elura much deserved peace, and we will use the gathered elunite to make a fine weapon for you."}
Q[1687]={d="有时候，我们孤儿院的院长会在晚上给我们讲一些鬼故事。真是太恐怖了！其中有一个故事说在西部荒野的灯塔那里有一个游荡的幽灵。他们说那是一个海盗船长，他的船被别的海盗给抢了。这真是太刺激了！\n\n你能不能把我带到西部荒野的灯塔那里去？我想要看看那个幽灵船长是不是真的在那里！我保证会一直跟着你，而且绝对不会跑开或者惹些什么麻烦！",dEN="Sometimes late at night, our matrons at the orphanage will tell us spooky stories. Those RULE! There's one about a ghost that haunts a lighthouse in Westfall. They say he was a pirate captain who had his ship taken from him by other pirates. Wow!\n\nCould you please take me to the lighthouse in Westfall? I wanna see if the ghost of that captain is there! I promise to stay close to you; I won't run off or anything!",o="带孤儿去看西部荒野海岸外的灯塔。|n",oEN="Take the orphan to see the lighthouse off the coast of Westfall.",p="我们到了吗？",pEN="Are we there yet?",c="哇，一个真正的鬼魂！这真是太棒了——我要马上把这个告诉孤儿院里的其它人。葛瑞森船长……他打扮得十足像个海盗！当我长大之后，我也要做个鬼魂船长！\n\n感谢你把我带到西部荒野来，$n。我知道在西部荒野这里还有很多恐怖的事情，也希望我没有让你感到麻烦，你真是太棒了！",cEN="WOW, that was a real life ghost! That was so awesome - I can't wait to tell everyone back at the orphanage. Captain Grayson... he even looked like a pirate! When I grow up I wanna be a ghost pirate too!\n\nThanks for taking me to Westfall, <name>. I know there are scary things out there in the wilds of Westfall, and I hope I wasn't too much of a pain. You're awesome!"}
Q[1688]={d="我曾有一个名叫苏伦娜·凯尔东的学生。她过去和现在的你一样，一心渴求学习到强大的术士魔法，而且她也拥有着十分了得的天赋。更难能可贵的是，她很年轻，而且很漂亮。我最近又看见她了，那个背叛了我的女人！\n\n那时候她和迪菲亚兄弟会里的一个小贼埃尔兰·杜德摩尔私奔了。她走掉其实倒也没什么，但我曾送给她一条血石项圈，我必须把它拿回来。\n\n现在她的性命对我来说一点都不重要了。你应该可以在布莱克威尔南瓜田找到她，到那儿去把我的东西给夺回来！",dEN="I had a student named Surena Caledon. She stood where you stand now, eager to learn of warlock magic, and possessing no small bit of talent. More than that she was young and pleasing to the eye. Had I seen it then, the traitorous trollop!\n\nThe thieving wench ran off with one of the Defias, Erlan Drudgemoor. While her loss is of little importance, I gifted her a bloodstone choker that I must have.\n\nHer life means nothing to me now. You will find her at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Retrieve what is mine.",o="为暴风城的黑暗缚灵者加科因夺回苏伦娜的项圈。",oEN="Retrieve Surena's Choker for Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind.",p="即使是睿智的长者有时也会被年轻貌美的女人迷惑，$n。你得牢牢记住这个忠告。",pEN="Even the older and wiser can be unmanned by the wiles of youth and beauty, <name>. A piece of advice you would do well to remember throughout your life.",c="苏伦娜很有天赋，但仅靠这个就想掌握更多的术士魔法还远远不够。看着她的大好天赋被白白浪费掉确实很让人遗憾，但有时候这是必要的。\n\n我希望我在你身上倾注的心血会产生不同于此的结果。",cEN="Surena was talented, but not enough so to gain mastery of <class> magic on her own. It's a shame to see talent wasted, but sometimes it is necessary.\n\nI hope my investment in you will bear different results."}
Q[1689]={d="你找回了我的颈环并击败了苏伦娜，这证明你有着至少与她势均力敌的力量。\n\n虽然这么说，但我还是认为你需要进一步的训练。你现在已经能够控制魔法的流动了，这很好，但如果你要想要成为一位优秀的术士，这还远远不够。\n\n我会教你如何控制虚空行者，不过在我教你之前，你得先在召唤法阵上召唤它出来并制服它，无论你用什么武器都好——剑或者魔法——随你自己乐意吧。在下面的召唤法阵上使用这个颈环里的魔法，然后击败从虚空中出现的恶魔。",dEN="By retrieving my choker and besting Surena, you've proven that you're at least as capable as she was.\n\nWith that said, I can tell you're direly in need of training. You can manage the flows of magic, yes, but being a warlock is much more than that.\n\nI will show you how to command a voidwalker, but before I can, you must call one forth at a summoning circle and subdue it using whatever weapons--physical and magical--you have at your disposal. Use the magic of this choker at the summoning circle below.",o="召唤并制服一个虚空行者，然后将血石颈环还给暴风城的黑暗缚灵者加科因。",oEN="Using the Bloodstone Choker, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Bloodstone Choker to Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind.",p="在你制服虚无行者之前，我没办法教你怎么控制它。",pEN="I cannot show you how to control a voidwalker until you have overtaken one.",c="你做得比我想象中的要好，$n，不过也没怎么超出我的预期。现在，你可以学习如何操控这个只屈服于你的虚无行者了。你会发现在今后面临考验的时候，它将会坚定地站在你身前保护你。\n\n现在我已经没什么可以教你的了，但你的修行之路还远没有结束，$n。",cEN="You did better than I expected, <name>, but as well as I'd hoped. Now, you can learn to command your subjugated voidwalker, an ally you will find valuable in the trials that are sure to stand before you.\n\nI have nothing more to teach you at the present, but I am far from done with you, <name>."}
Q[1690]={d="你！是你出马帮助加基森水业公司的时候了！\n\n那些废土游牧民几乎占据了塔纳利斯沙漠上所有的水井！如果得不到这些水井的控制权，那我们的水源供应很快就会出现问题。如果你想帮助我们的话，就去解决那些该死的游牧民吧！\n\n从这里往东走，去干掉10个废土窃贼和10个废土强盗，然后立即向我报告。你一定要为我们这些人……呃……地精们伸张正义啊，不管怎么样，快点行动吧！",dEN="You there! It's time for you to be a big helper to the Gadgetzan Water Company.\n\nThe Wastewander nomads out in the Tanaris desert have seized almost all the water wells! Without access to them, our water supply will dry up in no time. If you want to get in our good graces, then you'll help us bring justice to those nomads!\n\nHead east of here and bring down ten Wastewander Bandits and Thieves, then report back to me on the double. Justice waits for no man... goblin... bah, just get on it!",o="去加基森的东面杀掉10个废土窃贼和10个废土强盗，然后向总工程师比格维兹复命。",oEN="Take down 10 Wastewander Bandits and Thieves east of Gadgetzan, then report back to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.",p="那么快就回来了？我希望你已经按照我的要求，以地精的方式为我们伸张了正义！",pEN="Back so soon? I hope you were able to bring some goblin-style justice to those Wastewander Bandits and Thieves like I asked you to!",c="你做事真是效率惊人啊！你帮我削弱了他们的势力，这样我们就可以开始考虑如何夺回属于我们的水井了。\n\n加基森水业公司感谢你的帮助，但是我们和那些愚蠢的游牧民之间的斗争还远没有结束。听好了——这是我交给你的下一个任务……",cEN="Now that's what I call efficiency! You've helped thin out the nomad's numbers enough now that we can start to think about how we can win back those water wells.\n\nThe Gadgetzan Water Company thanks you for your help, but we're far from done in dealing with those foul nomads. Listen close - here's what we need next..."}
Q[1691]={d="现在我们需要你去对付那些更强大的废土游牧民。到现在为止你都表现得相当出色，但是如果我们想要夺回水井的话，那么就必须要干掉更多的游牧民！\n\n这次，我要你去杀死他们的游荡者和刺客，还有暗法师。你可以在这里的东南面找到这些家伙。\n\n说实话，他们都很棘手。但是请你一定要帮忙，我们要取回属于自己的东西！",dEN="We need you to take on the stronger ranks of the Wastewander nomads now. You've done a good job thus far, but if we are to take back those water wells, then it only makes sense to do it against as few nomads as possible!\n\nThis time around we need you to take down their rogues, assassins, and shadow mages. You'll find them east and southeast of here.\n\nI'm not going to lie to you - they're a nasty lot. Do this for us though, and we'll be on our way to taking back what is rightfully ours!",o="为加基森的首席工程师比格维兹消灭 10 名废土暗影法师、8 名废土盗贼和 6 名废土刺客。|n",oEN="Take down 10 Wastewander Shadow Mages, 8 Wastewander Rogues, and 6 Wastewander Assassins for Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",p="怎么样，你杀死那些游牧民了吗？加基森水业公司需要你的成功来开展进一步的行动！不要让我们失望，现在就去……",pEN="Well, were you able to take out those nomads like I asked? The Gadgetzan Water Company is developing plans based on your success here! Don't let us down, now...",c="干得太棒了，$n……实在是太棒了！你成功地削弱了他们的势力，我们终于可以和他们进行一定程度上的对抗了！\n\n去和旁边的操作员鲁格伦克谈谈吧，他正在悬赏那些游牧民身上的水袋！我相信你一定可以帮我们夺回那些水井的。",cEN="Top notch work, <name>... top notch! You've thinned down the nomad population to a point where we can actually take the fight to them!\n\nIf you haven't already, talk to Spigot Operator Luglunket here; he gives a bounty on any of the Wastewander water pouches you may have run across while bringing those nomads to justice!"}
Q[1692]={d="我把你收集到的月神矿石装进了一只箱子。把它交给铁匠玛希尔，他会帮你打造一件月神武器。\n\n玛希尔住在靠南的地方，就在这座建筑物的另一侧。",dEN="I have placed the elunite you gathered into a case. Take it to the blacksmith Mathiel, and he will craft for you an elunite weapon.\n\nMathiel is to the south, on the other side of this building.",o="把这箱月神矿石交给铁匠玛希尔。",oEN="Bring the Case of Elunite to Smith Mathiel.",p="你好，年轻的$c。我的本领能为你做些什么？",pEN="Greetings, young <class>. How might my skills serve you?",c="啊，是月神矿石。这是一种很有用的金属材料，因为女神艾露恩赐予它祝福。用它来铸造武器是一种荣耀。\n\n请等一下，我现在就开始工作……",cEN="Ah, elunite ore. This is a fine metal to work with, for it is blessed by the goddess Elune herself. It would be an honor to craft weapons with it.\n\nPlease wait while I work..."}
Q[1693]={c="$n，我用你带来的月神矿石打造了这些武器，请选一样最适合你的。\n\n我必须谢谢你。能打造月神武器对我来说是一件荣幸而愉快的事情。",cEN="<name>, I have crafted these weapons with the elunite you brought to me. Please, take whichever most suits you.\n\nAnd I must thank you. Working with elunite is both an honor and a pleasure."}
Q[1698]={d="犹鲁斯·麦酒向联盟所有强大的战士发出了挑战。他在赤脊山的湖畔镇旅店等候着你们，并承诺会给所有通过试炼的战士提供丰厚的报酬。",dEN="Yorus Barleybrew has issued a challenge to all able warriors of the Alliance. He waits at the Lakeshire Inn, in Redridge, and pledges a grand reward to anyone able to pass his trial.",o="与犹鲁斯·麦酒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Yorus Barleybrew.",c="哈！你听说了我的挑战，对吗？\n\n请坐下来听我说。来一杯酒，慢慢享受……因为这也许是你这辈子最后一次喝酒了。",cEN="Hah! So you heard of my challenge, did you?\n\nWell sit down and listen. Have a drink, and savor it... because it might be your last."}
Q[1699]={d="我把我的挑战叫做“雷斯班铁手套”。要通过考验，你只需要进入雷斯班洞穴，走到第一个岔路口，然后回到这里。简单！不过有几个小麻烦……\n\n你必须在一小时内返回。\n\n路上你会遇到成群的赤脊山豺狼人。\n\n开始之前，你得喝一大口我家的招牌饮料：大麦酒灼烧！\n\n那么你说呢？雷斯班洞穴在湖畔镇以北的山麓。你$g准备好:准备好;挑战雷斯班铁手套了吗？",dEN="I call my challenge the Rethban Gauntlet. To pass the trial, all you must do is enter the Rethban Caverns, to the first fork, then return here. Easy! Except there are a few wrinkles...\n\nYou have to return within an hour.\n\nThere are whole heaps of Redridge Gnolls in the way.\n\nBefore you start, you have to take a swig of my family's signature drink: Barleybrew Scalder!\n\nSo what do you say? The Rethban Caverns are in the foothills north of Lakeshire. Are you ready to run the Rethban Gauntlet?",o="进入瑞斯班洞穴，然后在规定的时间内回到犹鲁斯·麦酒那里。\n\n在整个过程中你都不能死掉或者释放灵魂，否则任务就宣告失败。",oEN="Enter the Rethban Caverns, reach the first fork, and return to Yorus Barleybrew within the time allowed.\n\nYou must not die and release your spirit.",c="你成功了！干得不错！为$n欢呼喝彩！",cEN="You made it! Well done! Three cheers for <name>!"}
Q[1700]={d="我把打造你那件护甲时学到的技术笔记抄了一份，需要你送去给格里曼德·埃尔莫尔。他就在这儿的矮人区，武器店里。\n\n交给他的时候记得躲一下。他对自己的手艺极其自豪，可不喜欢从我这学东西……",dEN="I made a copy of my notes on the techniques I learned while making your armor, and I need them sent to Grimand Elmore. He's here in the Dwarven District, in the weapon shop.\n\nAnd duck when you give these to him. He's fiercely proud of his skills, and won't like the idea of learning something from me...",o="把弗伦的笔记交给格瑞曼德·艾尔默。",oEN="Bring Furen's Notes to Grimand Elmore.",p="你好，很高兴见到你。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="Hello, and well met. How might I be of service to you?",c="这是弗伦写的？真可笑？你知道吗，他的那点本事都是我教给他的！让他来指点我？这样的事情真是让人难以忍受！不可容忍！\n\n嗯……不过在他的笔记中的确有些有价值的东西，我来看看……",cEN="Furen wrote this? How dare he! Why, I taught him everything he knows! To think he could teach me something is outrageous! Outrageous!\n\nHm... but there is something in his notes that I'd like to try..."}
Q[1701]={d="我给了你一面好盾牌，但事情还没完。我知道制作极坚硬锁甲的秘密。这不容易，还需要一些相当稀有的材料，但如果你愿意去跑腿，我就为你做一件。\n\n你说呢，$n？如果你$g准备好:准备好;接受挑战，我就给你一张清单，写明需要什么、去哪里弄。",dEN="So I gave you a nice shield, but we don't have to stop there. I know the secrets to make extremely hard mail armor. It's not easy and it takes very rare materials, but if you're willing to do the legwork then I'll make a piece for you.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? If you're up for the challenge, then I'll give you a list of what to get and where to get them.",o="收集必需的材料，将它们交给暴风城的弗伦·长须。",oEN="Gather the materials Furen Longbeard requires, and bring them to him in Stormwind.",p="你的任务完成得怎么样了，$n？拿到材料了吗？",pEN="How goes the scavenger hunt, <name>? Do you have the materials?",c="你找到了全部的材料？难以置信！我还以为那些奇美拉把你吞进肚子里了！\n\n好吧，我们开始打造铠甲吧……",cEN="You got it all? Amazing! I was afraid those chimaeras would eat you up for sure!\n\nWell let's get started on that armor..."}
Q[1702]={d="跑完雷斯班铁手套，你确实证明了自己$g是:是;什么料，$n。而我也言出必行。我会给你我承诺的奖赏……\n\n唯一的问题是，它在暴风城。\n\n去跟我朋友弗伦·长须谈谈，他在暴风城的矮人区。他是你能见到的最好的制盾师，而且欠我一个大人情。\n\n来，把这桶大麦酒灼烧带给弗伦，向他要一面盾牌。他一定会给你一面很棒的。",dEN="You really showed what you were made of when you ran the Rethban Gauntlet, <name>. And I'm true to my word. I'll get you the reward I promised...\n\nExcept it's in Stormwind.\n\nTalk to my friend, Furen Longbeard, in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He's the best shieldsmith you'll ever meet, and he owes me a big favor.\n\nHere, take Furen this cask of Barleybrew Scalder and ask him for a shield. He'll give you a nice one.",o="将这桶热酒交给弗伦·长须。",oEN="Bring the Cask of Scalder to Furen Longbeard.",p="你好！今天真是个无聊的日子，你不觉得吗？",pEN="Hello! Dry times, don't you think?",c="啊，大麦酒灼烧。好东西！所以你去见过约鲁斯了，嗯？\n\n我能给你弄到一面盾牌，没错，先生！你找不到更好的了，我可不是在撒谎！",cEN="Ah, Barleybrew Scalder. Great stuff! So you've been to see Yorus, eh?\n\nI can get you a shield, yes sir! You won't find a better one, and that's no lying!"}
Q[1703]={d="在帮你铸造铠甲的同时，我记下了自己的心得体会。现在我得找个人帮我把笔记交给铁匠玛希尔，他住在遥远的达纳苏斯，但我相信他一定非常希望看看我记录的这些东西。",dEN="I made a copy of my notes on the techniques I learned while making your armor, and need them sent to the blacksmith Mathiel. He lives in Darnassus which is quite a long way off, but I'm sure he'll be very grateful to learn what I've learned.",o="把弗伦的笔记交给玛希尔。",oEN="Bring Furen's Notes to Mathiel.",p="向你致意，$c。",pEN="I bid you greetings, <class>.",c="这些笔记真有趣，真的非常有趣。看来我的这位矮人同事有了一个重大的发现！\n\n谢谢你，$n。能把他的新技术用于我的制造工艺，这对于我来说是一种荣耀。",cEN="These are interesting, very interesting indeed. My dwarven colleague Furen has made quite a grand discovery!\n\nThank you, <name>. It will be an honor to apply his new techniques to my own craftings."}
Q[1704]={d="在帮你铸造铠甲的时候，我顺手记下了我学到的技术。现在我得找个人帮我把笔记交给科罗莫特·钢尺。他是铁炉堡的侏儒铁匠，当他知道我学到的技术以后……我敢打赌，他一定会兴奋地拔掉胡子的！",dEN="I made a copy of my notes on the techniques I learned while making your armor, and need someone to take them to Klockmort Spannerspan. He's a gnomish blacksmith in Ironforge and when he learns what I've learned... I bet he'll pull off his own beard in excitement.",o="把弗伦的笔记交给科罗莫特·钢尺。",oEN="Bring Furen's Notes to Klockmort Spannerspan.",p="你好啊，我也不知道该说“早安”还是“晚安”。因为在这里我分不清是白天还是夜晚。你找我有什么事？",pEN="Good day, or morning or evening. I can't tell from way down here. So do you have business for me?",c="哦，天哪！这些笔记真是让人吃惊！还有……真是难以置信，太惊人了，我的腿都开始发抖了！\n\n弗伦在锻造技术领域有了一次突破！真正的突破！我已经等不及要试一下他的新技术了！",cEN="Oh my! These notes are amazing! And what's more... they're incredible and they're stupendous and they make my knees go all a-wobbly!\n\nFuren had a breakthrough! A real breakthrough! I can't wait to try out his new technique!"}
Q[1705]={d="真不想承认弗伦也许真找到了什么好东西。但为了确认，我得把他的手艺用在一件新护甲上试试。如果你帮我弄材料，$n，那这件护甲就归你。\n\n制作这件护甲，我需要燃烧之血和燃烧之石的样本。\n\n我只知道在暮色森林能弄到。盘踞在罗兰之墓矿洞的夜行狼人身上有燃烧之血，而它们的首领“开膛手”会有那块石头。\n\n愿幸运让你$g行动迅速:行动迅速;，$n。",dEN="I hate to admit that Furen might have really found something. But to be sure I'll need to try his techniques on a new piece of armor. If you help me with the materials, <name>, then you can have the armor.\n\nTo make this armor, I need samples of burning blood and a burning rock.\n\nThe only place I know to get them is Duskwood. The Nightbane worgen based in the Roland's Doom mine have burning blood, and their leader Gutspill will have the rock.\n\nMay fortune grant you speed, <name>.",o="把20瓶燃烧之血和1块燃烧之石交给暴风城的格瑞曼德·艾尔默。",oEN="Bring 20 vials of Burning Blood and 1 Burning Rock to Grimand Elmore in Stormwind.",p="$n，你拿到燃烧之血和燃烧之石了吗？我需要用它们来完成这件铠甲。",pEN="<name>, do you have the burning blood and rock? I'll need them to complete the armor.",c="干得漂亮！如果你不介意的话，我要开始工作了……",cEN="Nice work! Now if you'll excuse me, I have some work to do myself..."}
Q[1706]={c="我简直不敢相信！弗伦居然成功了，这副铠甲应该能承受超强的压力。\n\n$n，拿着它吧。谢谢你，如果你没有收集到这些材料，那我就必须自己进行测试，而那样也许我永远都无法相信弗伦的发现。",cEN="I can barely believe it! Furen's technique was a success, and this armor should withstand tremendous levels of stress.\n\nHere you are, <name>. And thank you. I wouldn't have believed Furen's discovery if you hadn't gathered the materials I needed to test it myself."}
Q[1707]={d="你好啊，$n！我叫鲁格伦克，如果你想要找些事情干，我们这里现在就有一件重要的工作给你！\n\n没有什么能比帮我带回一些废土水袋来更能令我这个老家伙开心的了。那可都是我们的水——就是那些混蛋把它们偷走了！你每给我带回五只废土水袋来，加基森水业公司就会奖励给你一个可以用来碰运气的小包裹。更重要的是，我们会永远记住你所提供的帮助！",dEN="Greetings <name> - the name's Luglunket, and we've got an important job for you if you're up for it! Huzzah!\n\nNothing would please me more as a seasoned spigot operator to take any Wastewander water pouches you might find out in the desert. That's our water anyway - the nomads have just stolen it is all! The Gadgetzan Water Company will offer you an official care package for every five you turn in. Most importantly though, you're helping Gadgetzan help itself!",o="收集5只废土水袋，把它们交给加基森的鲁格伦克。",oEN="Bring 5 Wastewander Water Pouches to Spigot Operator Luglunket in Gadgetzan.",p="拿到我要的五个废土水袋了吗？如果你能帮我们找到五个废土水袋的话，加基森水业公司的103——XB型护理袋就是你的了！",pEN="Got the five Wastewander water pouches we need? If you do, then the Gadgetzan Water Company Care Package, Model 103-XB, will be yours!",c="干得好！收集到越多水袋，我们就可以越早脱离这场灾难！继续干，你每给我带回五个水袋，我就会给你相应的奖励。",cEN="Excellent - the more water pouches we are able to reclaim, the further away from disaster we'll all be! Keep 'em coming, and I will be sure to reward you for every five water pouches you bring me."}
Q[1708]={d="我希望在我自己的铠甲上应用弗伦·长须的新技术。因为你帮了弗伦的忙，而他又帮了我的忙，所以当我做好铠甲以后，你可以第一个试用它！\n\n要打造铠甲的话，我就得弄到一种特别的珊瑚，灼热珊瑚。它只生长在一个地方——湿地的米奈希尔港南边的海岸地带。\n\n只要你给我带来我足够多的灼热珊瑚，我就可以马上开始铸造铠甲啦。快点，$n，我恨不得现在就开始工作！",dEN="I want to try Furen Longbeard's new techniques on my own piece of armor. And because you helped Furen and he helped me, you're welcome to the armor after I make it!\n\nTo finish the piece, I need a special coral, searing coral. It grows in only one place--along the coast south of Menethil Harbor in the Wetlands.\n\nBring me enough searing coral and I'll get right to work on the armor. And hurry, <name>. I'm so eager to get started it's making my toes twist!",o="收集20块灼热珊瑚，把它们交给铁炉堡的科罗莫特·钢尺。",oEN="Bring 20 loads of Searing Coral to Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge.",p="你好你好，$n！你搞到灼热珊瑚了吗？我恨不得马上就开始工作！",pEN="Hello hello, <name>! Do you have the searing coral? I can't wait to get to work!",c="这正是我要的东西！干得不错！我要把它煅烧并锤打成形，然后将弗伦的技术融入我的锻造技术里，让我们看看会发生什么！\n\n哦，天哪，天哪！我就知道这样打造出来的铠甲会非常非常非常坚固的！",cEN="That's the stuff! Well done! Now let me get this smelted and hammered so I can apply Furen's technique with my own and then we can see what happens!\n\nOh my, oh my! I just know the armor will be very very very tough!"}
Q[1709]={c="给你，这是你要的铠甲，$n。弗伦那一套果然很棒！简直是完美！不可思议，真的不可思议！\n\n我看它即使是被攻城机具辗过去也不会有什么问题！",cEN="Here's your armor, <name>. Furen's process worked brilliantly! Perfectly! Marvelously, truly!\n\nYou could run this armor over with a siege engine and it would spring right back into shape!"}
Q[1710]={d="我很想测试一下弗伦·长须的最新发现，希望能将它用于我正在研究的新式铠甲上，我认为弗伦的技术一定能产生最好的结果。\n\n你愿意帮助我吗？如果你愿意帮我收集制造铠甲所需的原料，我就会帮你也做一件。\n\n我需要晒焦的巨翼双足飞龙蛋壳，这种飞龙大都栖息在千针石林的风巢中。在它们的巢下可以找到我要的蛋壳，当你收集了足够数量的蛋壳之后就赶快回来找我。",dEN="My colleague, Furen Longbeard, made a discovery which I am eager to test. I wish to try it on a new armor that I am researching, for I believe Furen's techniques will produce superior results.\n\nWill you help me? If you gather what I need to make the armor, then I will make an extra piece for you.\n\nI need the sunscorched egg shells of the Highperch Wyverns who dwell at Highperch, in Thousand Needles. Search for the shells below their nests, and return to me when you have a sufficient amount.",o="把20个晒焦的蛋壳交给达纳苏斯的玛希尔。",oEN="Bring 20 Sunscorched Shells to Mathiel in Darnassus.",p="你找到蛋壳了吗，$n？我可以把它们碾碎并制成强力的护甲漆，然后就可以用它来加固我新制作的锁甲了。",pEN="Do you have the shells, <name>? They are quite strong, and can be rendered into a lacquer I will use to coat the links of my new mail armor.",c="啊，谢谢你。这些应该足够了！\n\n我要马上开始着手进行制作锁甲的最后一道工序……",cEN="Ah, thank you. These will work splendidly!\n\nI will begin fashioning the armor immediately..."}
Q[1711]={c="我已经完成了铠甲，而且我对它感到非常满意。现在我已经可以将弗伦的新技术运用得非常娴熟了，我想这副铠甲一定具有超强的韧性。\n\n谢谢你，$n。愿它能帮助你在以后的战斗中无往而不胜。",cEN="I have finished with your piece of armor, and I am quite pleased. Furen's new techniques meshed perfectly with my own and I am sure this armor will prove to be quite resilient.\n\nThank you, <name>. And may this serve you well in future battles."}
Q[1712]={d="我在这里观察了许多年。我守望着，只为有朝一日能亲眼看到伟大的塞克罗尼安陨落。但我还没找到能击败风之领主的勇士。\n\n也许你就是那位勇士。\n\n向我证明。收集召唤他所需的物品，我就会知道你$g是:是;一位伟大的战士。那时也许你就能击败他，夺得他的旋风之心。\n\n如果你做到了，我就把心脏的力量灌注进一件武器，并把它交给你。\n\n这是写着我所需要物品的羊皮纸。",dEN="I have spent ages watching this site. I watch, so that one day I might see the great Cyclonian fall. But I have not yet found a champion to defeat the wind lord.\n\nPerhaps you are that champion.\n\nProve it to me. Gather the items I need to summon Cyclonian, and I will know you are a great warrior. Perhaps then you can defeat him and gain his whirlwind heart.\n\nIf so, then I will infuse the heart's power in a weapon, and I will give that weapon to you.\n\nHere is a parchment with the items I need.",o="把巴斯拉的羊皮纸上列出的东西交给奥特兰克的捕风者巴斯拉。",oEN="Bring the items on Bath'rah's Parchment to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac.",p="你找到那些东西了吗，$n？找到这些东西，这样你才能证明自己有力量面对塞克隆尼亚。",pEN="Do you have the items, <name>? Gathering them is the proof I need that you have the strength to face Cyclonian.",c="你找到了我需要的东西，也证明了你的实力和智慧，但我们的下一个任务更加危险。\n\n希望你的力量不会就此终结。",cEN="You have gathered the items for my spell, and have shown me your strength and cunning. But the next stage of our quest is even more perilous.\n\nLet us hope your strength does not falter."}
Q[1713]={d="我已准备好进行召唤塞克罗尼安的仪式。他被召唤出来后，你必须击败他，夺取他的旋风之心。我要用它把塞克罗尼安的力量灌注进一件武器。\n\n$n，你$g准备好:准备好;面对风之领主了吗？",dEN="I am ready to perform the ritual to summon Cyclonian. When he is summoned, you must defeat him and take his whirlwind heart. This I will use to instill a weapon with Cyclonian's power.\n\n<name>, are you ready to face the wind lord?",o="将旋风之心带给捕风者巴斯拉。",oEN="Bring the Whirlwind Heart to Bath'rah Windwatcher.",p="$n，我必须得到旋风之心！",pEN="<name>, I must have the whirlwind heart!",c="你成功了！你打败了塞克隆尼亚，得到了旋风之心！",cEN="You did it! You defeated Cyclonian and gained the Whirlwind Heart!"}
Q[1714]={p="锅里翻腾着泡沫，弥漫的蒸汽在召唤着……",pEN="The cauldron bubbles. Its vapors beckon...",c="符咒缓缓渗入了这口大锅的深处……\n\n一个很大的泡沫漂到液体的表面上来，随即破裂了……\n\n……一块翻滚着的熔岩浮了上来。",cEN="The charms sink slowly into the cauldron's depths...\n\nA large bubble rises to the surface of the liquid and breaks...\n\n...And a churning lump of molten rock is revealed."}
Q[1715]={d="哎，以前术士们都在卡兹莫丹由诺莫瑞根的大师训练，现在我们不得不搬到铁炉堡这个老鼠洞里，而且麦格尼又在一直监视我们，所以我们只能把新手都送到暴风城去训练了。\n\n幸运的是，加科因还算是个有能力的人，你还是能在那里学到你需要的东西的，不过现在这种样子还是让我很冒火！\n\n加科因就在暴风城的“已宰的羔羊”旅店的地下室里。",dEN="Hmph. Times past, all warlocks in Khaz Modan were trained under the auspices of the masters of Gnomeregan, but now that we've all been forced to relocate into this rat's hole in Ironforge, and Magni's decided to keep a careful watch on us, we're forced to send our novices to Stormwind for training.\n\nLuckily, Gakin's no slouch, so you'll still learn what you need to know, but it burns my blood!\n\nAnyways, you'll find Gakin in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind.",o="去暴风城的法师区向黑暗缚灵者加科因报到。",oEN="Report to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",c="黑钳让你来的？铁炉堡的术士应该想办法自己解决问题，暴风城空间就这么大，导师也就这么多。活动越频繁，我们就越有可能引起别人的注意。",cEN="Sent by Blackwrench, were you? Damn warlocks in Ironforge need to get things sorted out. There's only so much room and so many teachers in Stormwind. With all the increased traffic, we're sure to attract attention sooner or later."}
Q[1716]={d="魅魔是灵魂的吞噬者，心灵的毁灭者，思想的控制者。她脑中永远只有邪恶的念头。\n\n这就是你现在要学会召唤并控制的生物，但在没有诱饵的情况下，你是无法将她引入到我们的世界中来的。\n\n以一件象征爱的事物作为诱饵，魅魔才会回应你的召唤。在这之后，你只有战胜她才能将她变为你的工具。\n\n但是找到象征着爱的东西可不容易，你最好和先知塔卡尔谈谈。他就住在卡利姆多大陆的贫瘠之地，靠近陶拉祖营地的地方。",dEN="A succubus is a devourer of souls, destroyer of hearts, and dominator of minds. It knows nothing but evil.\n\nThis will be the creature you will learn to summon and control, but it cannot be brought into our world without a stimulus.\n\nWith a symbol of love as bait, it will surely answer your call. Then you can defeat it, and make it your tool.\n\nIt will be hard to find something of this nature, though. You should speak with Takar the Seer. You will find him in the Barrens of Kalimdor near Camp Taurajo.",o="与贫瘠之地的先知塔卡尔交谈。",oEN="Speak with Takar the Seer in the Barrens.",c="你是历尽艰险才来到这儿的吧，$n？为了找我，你真可以说是不远万里了。不过，我知道加科因为什么派你来，他这么做很明智，因为我能帮助你寻找你所要的东西。",cEN="Was your crossing difficult, <name>? You have come a long way to speak with me. But fear not, I know why Gakin has sent you, and he was wise to, for I can help you in your search."}
Q[1717]={d="$n！没想到在这儿遇见你，不过我接到指示说要注意你的行踪。\n\n你应该接受更多训练了，下一次去暴风城的时候记得去见一下加科因，他正在等你。",dEN="<name>! Didn't expect to see you around these parts, but I was instructed to keep an eye out for you.\n\nIt's past time you got some more training, so you should stop in to see Gakin the next time you're in Stormwind. He'll be waiting for you.",o="去暴风城的法师区向黑暗缚灵者加科因报到。",oEN="Report to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",c="你总算露面了。不过，也许我该派个比雷门更能干的人去找你。\n\n无所谓。\n\n你太久没有训练了，而一个没受过训练的术士的脑袋在肩膀上待不了多久。",cEN="About time you showed up. Though, perhaps I should have sent someone more capable than Remen to find you.\n\nNo matter.\n\nYou've gone too long without training, and a warlock without training isn't like to keep his head on his shoulders for long."}
Q[1718]={d="你作为一名$g战士:战士;的名声不断增长，$n。现在是时候与你的同侪较量，看看你处在什么位置了。\n\n贫瘠之地的海岸外、棘齿城以南有一座岛。它叫乱斗岛，是战士们聚集的地方。\n\n他们相聚，然后战斗。\n\n去跟乱斗岛的首席战士克兰诺克·马克雷德谈谈。如果他认为你$g配得上:配得上;，他就会引领你在战士之路上走得更远。\n\n要前往乱斗岛，就去寻找商人海岸沿岸的浅沙洲。",dEN="Your renown as a warrior grows, <name>. Now it is time to pit yourself against your peers and see where you stand.\n\nThere is an island off the coast of the Barrens, south of Ratchet. It is called Fray Island and it is a place where warriors meet.\n\nMeet, and fight.\n\nSpeak with the chief warrior of Fray Island, Klannoc Macleod. If he finds you worthy, then Klannoc will lead you further down the warrior's path.\n\nTo reach Fray Island, search for the sand bar shallows along the Merchant Coast.",o="和克兰诺克·马克雷德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Klannoc Macleod.",c="你好，$n。很高兴看到你顺利抵达乱斗岛。希望你喜欢这里……",cEN="Hello, <name>. It's good to see you made it to Fray Island. I hope you find it to your liking..."}
Q[1719]={d="如果你想跟我学本事，就得先通过乱斗。这是我们乱斗岛向自以为强悍的战士提出的挑战，如果你能通过这场考验，我就知道你是真有本事。\n\n开始时，走到人群中央，站到格栅上。这样你就告诉特威基·扁脑袋你$g准备好了:准备好了;，他会派出你的对手。\n\n打败他们，他就会召来大个子威尔。杀死大个子威尔，然后在限定时间内回来见我。",dEN="If you want to learn from me, then you must first pass The Affray. It is a challenge we on Fray Island like to offer rising warriors who think they're tough, and if you can pass this test then I'll know you are.",o="杀掉比格维尔，然后向勇士岛的克兰诺克·马克雷德回复。",oEN="Kill Big Will, then speak to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island.",c="干得好，$n。你通过了乱斗！\n\n你是$g合格的:合格的; $c，能指导你是我的荣幸……",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have passed The Affray!\n\nYou are a worthy warrior, and I am honored to teach you..."}
Q[1738]={d="为了你的到来，我拨开时间的迷雾，搜寻了整个世界，终于找到了你在寻找的东西。\n\n在上古战争的一场战斗中，有一对恋人一起倒下了。在他们死去的地方，一棵同心树茁壮地生长了起来，那是他们至死不渝的爱情的象征。\n\n那棵树应该足以用来引诱魅魔，你可以在灰谷森林西北的奥迪拉兰废墟里找到它。",dEN="In preparation for your coming, I used my sight to look over the world and through the mists of time. I have found what it is you seek.\n\nIn the War of the Ancients, two lovers fell together in battle. Where they took their last breaths, a tree known as the heartswood grew, a symbol of their undying love.\n\nThat should be enough to tempt a succubus. You will find it in the ruins of Ordil'Aran in the northwestern part of the forest of Ashenvale.",o="从灰谷取回同心树，把它交给暴风城法师区里的黑暗缚灵者加科因。",oEN="Retrieve the Heartswood from Ashenvale and bring it to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind.",p="你找到同心树了吗，$n？",pEN="Was your search a success, <name>?",c="嗯，这个就可以了，你稍等一会儿……\n\n塔卡尔确实是一个足智多谋的家伙，难道不是吗？当然如果我能说服他回到文明社会就再好不过了。",cEN="Yes, I can tell this will do nicely, let me just work with it for a moment...\n\nTakar is a resourceful fellow to have around, isn't he? If only I could persuade him to move back to civilization."}
Q[1739]={d="你可以使用同心树之核在下面墓穴里的召唤法阵中施展一个法术，以此打开一个供魅魔通行的传送门。\n\n小心点，$n，即使是意志最坚定的人，也会被魅魔轻易控制。\n\n一旦你成功地击败了她并把她投回无尽虚空之后，就回来找我，我会告诉你如何召唤并控制她。",dEN="Using the heartswood core, you will be able to cast a spell at the summoning circle in the crypt below to open a portal for the succubus to pass through. Be careful, <name>, succubi have overrun even the strongest of minds. Once you have bested and returned it to the void, return to me and I will show you how to call and control it.",o="召唤并制服一个魅魔，然后将同心树之核还给已宰的羔羊旅店的黑暗缚灵者加科因。",oEN="Using the Heartswood Core, summon and subdue a succubus, then return the Heartswood Core to Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb.",p="有的时候我会想，苏伦娜是不是一个伪装之后跑来扭曲和破坏我的意志的魅魔……哈！我想我的确给她带来了太多的麻烦。",pEN="Sometimes I wonder if Surena was not a succubus in disguise, sent to warp and twist my mind... Ha! I give her too much credit, I think.",c="好极了，好极了，$n。你确实是个天生的术士，你的表现没有让我们失望。\n\n我会毫无保留地将控制魅魔的方法教给你。仔细看好了！",cEN="Well done, well done, <name>. I see we've done right in deciding to train you. Your performance certainly does not disappoint.\n\nI've no qualms in showing you the way to control your newly bound succubus. Observe carefully."}
Q[1740]={d="当燃烧军团中的某个恶魔失宠以后，他们的灵魂就会被囚禁在宝珠中，供他们的法师或者术士差遣。\n\n很多宝珠被赐给了艾泽拉斯的恶魔之仆。即使是一颗破碎的宝珠，仍然可以蕴含着强大的恶魔力量。\n\n索兰鲁克宝珠碎成了两块，其中的一块又被砸成碎片，分发给黑暗深渊中的暮光之锤侍僧使用。另一块比较大的碎片在影牙城堡的一个巫师的手中。把它们找来给我，我可以用这些碎片重塑宝珠。",dEN="When demons of the Legion fall out of favor, their spirits are imprisoned within orbs and distributed to their mages and warlocks.\n\nMany were carried by their servants in Azeroth. Even fragmented, they still possess the powers of the demons trapped inside.\n\nThe orb of Soran'ruk was broken into two pieces, one was further broken to be used by the acolytes of the Twilight's Hammer in Blackfathom Deeps. The other, larger piece, was possessed by a wizard in Shadowfang Keep. Find them and I can reform it.",o="找到3块索兰鲁克宝珠的碎片和1块索兰鲁克宝珠的大碎片，把它们交给贫瘠之地的杜安·卡汉。",oEN="Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens.",p="我用了很多年的时间来收集札盖恩宝珠的碎片，对我而言，它很好使，我想对你也一样。",pEN="It took me many years to collect the pieces of the orb of Zargain, but it has served me well, as I am sure the orb of Soran'ruk will serve you.",c="嗯……宝珠的破损不算太严重，几乎每一块碎片都在这儿。把它们粘合在一起，就可以重塑一个完整的索兰鲁克宝珠。\n\n我将毕生的精力投入对燃烧军团的宝珠的研究中。谢谢你帮我收集这些碎片让我研究，我会把拼凑好完整的一片都还给你，照你的意思重塑。",cEN="Yes... The orb was not greatly fragmented, and almost all of the pieces are here. It is a simple thing to recreate them, to make Soran'ruk whole again.\n\nI have dedicated my life to the study of the Burning Legion's orbs and their recreation. You have done me a favor collecting these pieces to study, and I will give you them back - fully reconstructed - in a form of your choosing."}
Q[1758]={d="仅仅靠一个简单的召唤法阵是无法为你召唤出地狱猎犬来的。\n\n我和我的三个助手会帮助你制造召唤法阵，但是你必须先弄到一本阴谋之书的副本，我们很久之前就把那本书给弄丢了。阴谋之书是当初一批术士为了召唤地狱猎犬而写的书。\n\n克罗姆·粗臂也许能给你提供一些帮助，他原本是一个四处巡游的术士，但是现在却整天躲在铁炉堡的图书馆里苦心研究古代文献。",dEN="It will take more than a simple summoning circle to bring forth a felhunter for you to challenge.\n\nMy three acolytes and I will assist in creating the magic circles. You require a copy of the Tome of the Cabal, which has been lost to us for some time. It was written by the first group of warlocks to summon a felhunter unaided.\n\nPerhaps Krom Stoutarm can help you with this. An itinerant warlock these days, he spends his days hoarding ancient texts and skulking about the library in Ironforge.",o="与铁炉堡的克罗姆·粗臂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge.",c="《密会之书》？嗯……听着耳熟。不过我从没在这里见过它，而且我向你保证，我读过的每一本书都记得。\n\n让我想想……\n\n啊，对了！我在图书馆的编目书籍中见过对它的引用。",cEN="Tome of Cabal? Hmm...sounds familiar. I have never seen it here before, though--and believe me, I remember every book I read.\n\nHmm... Ah, yes!\n\nI have seen reference to it in library cataloging books."}
Q[1778]={d="我计划不久后就回到家乡。幸运的是，斯蒂芬妮在暴风城把孤儿院照顾得不错，我简直等不及要见她了。再见，$c。",dEN="I'm going to see about making plans to return home soon. Hopefully, Stephanie is doing well back in Stormwind. I can't wait to see her again. Till next we meet, <class>.",o="与铁炉堡的蒂萨-热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="你回来得真快啊，在离开的这段时间中，你做了怎样的祷告？\n\n你有没有完成什么高尚的事业？也许你已经了解了慈善的真正价值，或者更多你对艾泽拉斯居民的责任。告诉我，你都帮了谁，怎么帮的……你的所做所为令人印象深刻，$n，你的行为毫无疑问证明你在坚定不移地追随圣光的指引。\n\n这样的牺牲一定会得到及时的奖赏。",cEN="So, you've returned so quickly, huh? And what pray tell have you accomplished in your time away from here?\n\nWere you able to help a noble cause? Perhaps you've learned the value of charity or some more about your obligations to the citizens of Azeroth. Tell me, who have you helped and how.... Impressive, <name>, those are surely the actions of one who follows the Light.\n\nSuch sacrifice will always be rewarded in time."}
Q[1779]={d="我希望你带上这个，$n。它的名字叫生命符记。\n\n你已经显示了自己的仁慈与耐心，现在我需要你证明在战斗和魔法两个方面的能力。\n\n最近，我的丈夫穆里顿在和黑铁矮人的战斗中负伤归来，他几乎丢了性命——一个牧师治好了他所受的伤。\n\n带上生命符记，和我丈夫谈谈。如果你能帮助他的话，我们可以再聊聊。愿圣光保佑你。",dEN="I want you to take this, <name>. It is called the Symbol of Life.\n\nYou've proven charitable and patient, and now I want you to prove just how adept you've become in both combat, and power.\n\nMy husband Muiredon returned recently from an encounter with some Dark Iron dwarves, and he barely escaped with his life--he's over there having his wounds healed by one of our priests.\n\nTake the Symbol and speak to him. If you can help him, then we will speak again soon. May the Light shine upon you.",o="带上生命符记，和铁炉堡的穆里顿·热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Take the Symbol of Life and speak to Muiredon Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="*咳嗽*\n\n你好，$c。别在意我的伤。这位好心的牧师会照顾老穆雷顿的。我还不需要你身上那枚生命符印的力量。\n\n说吧，是我老婆让你来的，对吧？我就知道。我会跟你聊聊。我会告诉你穆雷顿和他最好的朋友纳姆——一个像你一样勇敢的$c——究竟遭遇了什么。",cEN="*cough*\n\nGood day to ya, <class>. Don't mind me wounds, the good priest 'ere'll take care of ol' Muiredon in time. Not needin' the power of that Symbol of Life ya got there quite yet.\n\nSo, me wife sent ya o'er to speak to me, huh? Fair 'nough. I'll take the time to talk to ya-I'll tell ya exactly wut happened to Muiredon and his best friend Narm, a <class> jus' like yerself."}
Q[1780]={d="我今天就把这些给孩子们送去。请多保重，$g好:好; $c。城里不常出现你这样的人。你证明了暴风城的圣骑士绝不会背弃需要帮助的人。\n\n再会。",dEN="I'll take these to the children this very day. Please be safe, good <class>. It is not often <men/women> of your character show their faces in the city, but you've proven that the paladins here in Stormwind shall never turn their backs on those in need.\n\nFarewell.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="你回来得真快，$n。你离开大教堂这段时间有什么收获？\n\n你帮助了什么高尚的事业吗？也许你领悟了慈善的价值，或者更了解了自己对艾泽拉斯居民的义务。告诉我你帮助了谁、怎么帮的……哇，我很佩服，$n，这无疑是一个追随圣光、把他人的利益置于自身之上的人所为。\n\n这样的牺牲终将得到回报。",cEN="You've returned so quickly, <name>. And what have you accomplished in your time away from the Cathedral?\n\nHave you helped a noble cause? Perhaps you've learned the value of charity or some more about your obligations to the citizens of Azeroth. Tell me, who have you helped and how... Well, I'm impressed, <name>, those are surely the actions of one who follows the Light and values others above oneself.\n\nSuch sacrifice will always be rewarded in time."}
Q[1781]={d="拿着这个，$n。它叫生命符印。\n\n你已证明自己既caritativo:caritativa又$g有耐心:有耐心;，现在是时候看看你是否有足够的力量去引导圣光最伟大的恩赐之一了。\n\n我朋友加津最近在艾尔文森林的英雄岗附近遭遇了几个迪菲亚……他差点丧命。他就在祭坛附近，我们的一位牧师正在为他疗伤。\n\n把符印带给他并与他交谈。如果你能帮到他，我们很快会再谈。愿圣光的荣耀与你同在。",dEN="Take this, <name>. It is called the Symbol of Life.\n\nYou've proven charitable and patient, and now the time has come to see if you're powerful enough to focus one of the Light's greatest gifts.\n\nMy friend Gazin returned recently from an encounter with some Defias in Elwynn near Heroes' Vigil--he barely escaped with his life. He's near the altar having his wounds healed by our priests.\n\nTake the Symbol and speak to him. If you can help him, then we will speak again soon. May you bask in the Light's glory.",o="把生命符记带给暴风城的贾森·坦诺姆。",oEN="Take the Symbol of Life to Gazin Tenorm in Stormwind.",c="*咳嗽*\n\n很高兴认识你，$r。别在意我的伤，这位好心的牧师这次能照顾好老加津。我还不需要你带来的那枚生命符印的力量……至少现在还不需要。\n\n所以是杜索里安派你来的，嗯？好吧。我会告诉你我和我朋友亨泽究竟遭遇了什么。运气好的话，再加上你的本事，也许你还能帮上我们大家。",cEN="*cough*\n\nPleasure to meet you, <race>. Don't mind my wounds, the good priest here can take care of ol' Gazin this time. I won't be needing the power of that Symbol of Life you've got there... not yet anyway.\n\nSo, Duthorian sent you to speak to me, huh? Fair enough. I'll tell you exactly what befell me and my friend Henze. And with any luck, and some skill on your part, perhaps you can still help us all."}
Q[1782]={c="这是你要的铠甲，$n。如果它不能承受最猛烈的攻击的话，我就不叫弗伦·长须！\n\n我要谢谢你，在用你带回的材料进行锻造的同时，我也学会了很多的东西。我想也许哪一天我会在锻造技艺上再来一次惊人的突破！\n\n我要把我学到的东西告诉联盟的其它铁匠。\n\n我会告诉他们是你帮了我的大忙，没准他们也会报答你的。",cEN="Here's your armor, <name>. This will stand up to the strongest assaults or my name isn't Furen Longbeard!\n\nAnd I have to thank you. I learned a lot while working with the materials\nyou brought me. I think I'll have another breakthrough one day!\n\nI'm going to send what I learned to other\nblacksmiths of the Alliance.\n\nI'll tell them you were a big help, and maybe they'll want to return the favor."}
Q[1783]={d="我们一直在侦察一些潜伏在盔枕湖以南的黑铁矮人。我们知道他们出现在那里决不是什么好事，因此我和纳姆决定靠近些去看看——看看他们的头目到底下了些什么命令。\n\n我和纳姆发起了突袭，杀掉了一些黑铁矮人，但他们比我们想象的还要顽强，一大堆黑铁矮人朝我们扑了过来。纳姆让我来求援，我就跑回来了。\n\n纳姆需要帮助，我们一定要尽快，否则我不会安心的。\n\n你能帮助我吗，$n？",dEN="We was spyin' on some of the Dark Iron dwarves that've bunkered down south of Helm's Bed Lake. We knew they was up to no good, so Narm an' me thought we'd take a closer look--got ta see their leader given orders to some o' his men.\n\nNarm an' me took the chance to kill a few of 'em, but they proved tougher than we thought, an' more of 'em got the jump on us. Narm tol' me to run an' get support, so 'ere I am.\n\nNarm needs help, an' I'll not rest till he gets it.\n\nC'n ya help, <name>?",o="使用生命符记复活丹莫罗的纳姆·法奥克。",oEN="Take the Symbol of Life and resurrect Narm Faulk in Dun Morogh.",c="我该怎么才能感谢你，$g兄弟:姐妹。\n\n你带有生命符记，我猜想是提萨和穆里顿派你来帮我的。\n\n事实确实如此，我被黑铁矮人抓住了，但是总算还是尽量拖延了时间，让穆里顿有足够的时间逃跑，当你来了之后，我感到全身充满了圣光的力量。现在我已经可以看出你能够熟练使用生命符记了，这非常好。但是关于这个还是等我们到了安全的地方再继续讨论吧。",cEN="I can't thank you enough, <brother/sister>.\n\nI can only assume that Tiza and Muiredon sent you here to aid me if you carry the Symbol of Life.\n\nIt's true, I fell to the Dark Iron while trying to attain one of the scripts: I was able to hold on long enough to allow Muiredon to escape, but the Light had almost embraced me fully when you came along. The fact that you were powerful enough to use the Symbol means great things for you, but there's time to speak of that later."}
Q[1784]={d="在我陷入苦战以前，我和穆里顿在那座小房子附近几乎干掉了一个黑铁间谍。我们亲眼看见他们的头儿给他一条手令，于是我们就想把他干掉，然后抢到那条手令。\n\n铁炉堡议会里的一些家伙还不相信丹莫罗有黑铁矮人的存在。只要能得到那条手令，我们不仅能证实他们的确在这个地区活动，还能知道他们到底想要做什么。\n\n去拿到那份手令，然后把它交给穆里顿，$n。",dEN="Before I fell in battle, Muiredon and I had almost defeated one of the Dark Iron spies near that small house. We witnessed their captain passing orders to them, and sought to kill him and take the orders.\n\nSome of the council in Ironforge do not yet believe the presence of Dark Iron dwarves exists in Dun Morogh. By attaining one of those scripts, we'll not only have proof of their movements, but possibly an idea of what they're planning.\n\nGet one of those scripts and take it back to Muiredon, <name>.",o="从盔枕湖附近的黑铁矮人那里取回一份黑铁手稿，把它交给铁炉堡的穆里顿·热炉。",oEN="Retrieve a Dark Iron Script from the Dark Iron dwarves near Helm's Bed, and return to Muiredon Battleforge in Ironforge.",p="你回来了！我很高兴你能回来，$n。我的伤已经好了，只要我能够说服我的妻子不要再多担心我，就可以准备回到盔枕湖去了。",pEN="Yer back! I'm glad to see it, <name>. My wounds are healed and I'm about ready to return to Helm's Bed lake as soon as I c'n convince me wife that I'll be fine.",c="哈哈！你成功了！你救了纳姆，你找到了黑铁矮人在丹莫罗活动的证据，我的妻子可以把它交给议会。你是圣光的使者……当然我的妻子也是。\n\n谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Haha! You've done it! Ya saved Narm, and ya found the proof me wife needs to take to the council. Yer a blessin' o' the Light if I ever saw one... not includin' me wife o' course.\n\nThank ya again, <name>."}
Q[1785]={d="我的妻子正在那里骄傲地微笑，你最好快过去和她谈谈，我想她有些话要和你说。\n\n圣光会保佑你的，伟大的$c。相信有一天，我会邀请你一起来对抗亡灵天灾和那些该死的黑铁矮人。",dEN="I c'n see me wife's o'er there beamin' wit pride already. Ya better get yer tuchus o'er there pronto. I be thinkin' she'd have some words wit ya.\n\nLight be witcha, mighty <class>. I'll be lookin' fer ya on the battlefield against the Scourge and dem Dark Irons when the time comes.",o="与铁炉堡的蒂萨·热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="今天你为整个铁炉堡帮了大忙，$n。我很骄傲能把你算作我们中的一员，如果你觉得自己$g准备好:准备好;了，我想用这卷卷轴祝福你。生命符印只有在$g一位:一位;圣光最伟大祝福——让死者重生的力量——面前$g准备好的:准备好的; $c手中才能发挥作用。\n\n我会教你复活同伴的能力。善用这份恩赐，$n。我代表我自己、我丈夫和铁炉堡，感谢你。",cEN="You've done all of Ironforge a great favor today, <name>. I'm proud to count you among us, and if you feel you're ready, I would like to bless you with this scroll. The Symbol of Life would only have worked when used by a <class> who was ready for one of the Light's greatest blessings-the power to restore the dead back to life.\n\nI will teach you the ability to resurrect your companions. Use it wisely, <name>, and thank you, on behalf of myself, my husband, and Ironforge."}
Q[1786]={d="亨兹和我去了英烈碑，那地方就在艾尔文森林东北的石碑湖中央的一座小岛上。我们听说迪菲亚潜行者在边境一带搞间谍活动，就受命去找到证据交给国王的顾问。\n\n我们看见两个人在鬼鬼祟祟地阅读什么文件，就向他们发起了突袭。这时突然出现了很多法师将我们团团包围。\n\n亨兹为我拖住了他们，让我先逃脱了……这个傻瓜，他为什么要那么做……\n\n我的兄弟亨兹，他的尸体现在还躺在那里。你能帮助我们吗，$n？",dEN="Henze and I had made it to Heroes' Vigil, an island in the middle of Stone Cairn Lake in northeastern Elwynn. We'd heard the Defias had infiltrated our borders and we wanted proof to take to the king's advisors.\n\nWe caught sight of a couple of the scum going over some documents, and we attacked. Unfortunately, we were quickly overwhelmed by more of the mages.\n\nHenze held them off for me while I escaped... the daft fool, going and being brave.\n\nHe's out there now, Henze is. Can you help us, <name>?",o="把生命符记带到艾尔文森林的英烈碑去，复活亨兹·法奥克。",oEN="Take the Symbol of Life and resurrect Henze Faulk in Elwynn.",c="谢谢你，$g兄弟:姐妹;。\n\n看到你手持生命符印，我可以认为你是杜索里安或加津派来的吗？\n\n当加津和我试图从迪菲亚手中夺取他们的计划时，我倒在他们的施法者手下。我撑得够久，让加津逃了出去，但最终，他们的魔法压倒了我。\n\n而你把我带了回来：使用符印的能力并非人人都有，$n。你能以自己的信仰为其赋能，这对你是个好兆头。",cEN="Thank you, <brother/sister>.\n\nSeeing you wield the Symbol of Life, may I assume Duthorian or Gazin sent you?\n\nI fell to the Defias spell casters while Gazin and I tried to get their plans from them: I was able to hold on long enough to allow Gazin to escape, but in the end, their magics overwhelmed me.\n\nBut you were able to bring me back: the ability to use the Symbol doesn't come to just anyone, <name>. It bodes well for you that you were able to empower it with your own faith."}
Q[1787]={d="我们以后有的是时间谈符印的事。现在重要的是拿到我们看到迪菲亚翻阅的那些文件。如果我们能弄到手，就能证明迪菲亚已经渗透进艾尔文森林，运气好的话还能了解他们的计划。\n\n我现在没有战斗的能力，$n。你觉得你有足够的力量从岛上的迪菲亚手中夺走那些文件吗？\n\n如果你拿到了，把它们带给加津。也告诉他我没事。",dEN="We'll have time to talk more about the Symbol at a later time. What's important now is to get those papers we saw the Defias going over. If we can get our hands on them, we'll be able to prove the Defias have infiltrated Elwynn and hopefully gain some insight into what their plans are.\n\nI'm in no shape for battle as of now, <name>. Do you think you're strong enough to get those papers from the Defias here on the island?\n\nIf you're able to get them, bring them back to Gazin and let him know I'm all right.",o="从石碑湖小岛上的迪菲亚巫师手中拿到迪菲亚手稿，把它交给暴风城的贾森·坦诺姆。",oEN="Retrieve a Defias Script from the Defias Rogue Wizards in Elwynn, and return to Gazin Tenorm in Stormwind.",p="亨兹还好吗，$n？你成功了吗？\n\n以你的战斗技巧，再加上光明的力量，我想英雄岗哨不会再受到迪菲亚盗贼的威胁了，不过那是国王和他的顾问应该关心的事情。",pEN="Is Henze safe, <name>? Were you successful?\n\nBetween your skill with a weapon, and the power of the Light, I'd imagine Heroes' Vigil is safe from any Defias threat, but that's for the King and his advisors to say.",c="干得好！你救了亨兹的命。圣光与你同在，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! You made it, and saved Henze. The Light is with you for sure, <name>!"}
Q[1788]={d="等杜索里安看过这份文字，我就把它交给国王的顾问们。但在此期间，你现在就该去跟杜索里安谈谈。他肯定想拍着你的背好好夸你一顿！\n\n再次感谢你，$n。希望我们还能再见。你无疑是$g一位:一位;我引以为傲的$g盟友:盟友;，也是我乐于称之为朋友的人。",dEN="I'll take the script to the King's advisors after Duthorian's taken a look at them, but in the meantime, you should go speak to Duthorian now. He'll be wanting to pat you on the back for sure!\n\nThank you again, <name>. I hope we meet again. You're surely an ally I'm proud to call friend.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="你 today 做得不错，$n。你该为自己取得的成就感到$g自豪:自豪;。\n\n更该为你的能力感到$g骄傲:骄傲;。并非人人都能使用生命符印的力量。召唤圣光让死者复生，说明你已准备好迎接圣骑士最崇高的荣誉之一：复活的力量。\n\n你将有能力让倒下的同伴复生，就像你为亨泽所做的那样。\n\n保重，$n。圣光照耀着你。全然接纳它吧。",cEN="You've done well this day, <name>. You should take some pride in what you've accomplished.\n\nEven more so, you should be proud of your abilities. Not everyone can use the power of the Symbol of Life. Calling upon the Light to bring back the dead means you're prepared for one of the <class>'s greatest honors: the power of resurrection.\n\nYou shall have the power to bring back fallen companions much like you did for Henze.\n\nBe well, <name>. The Light shines upon you and you should welcome it wholly."}
Q[1789]={c="快去吧，$n，如果你失败，就不止一条性命悬于一线了。\n\n如果因为什么原因你没能帮助穆雷顿和纳姆，就回来见我，我会再给你一枚生命符印供你旅途使用。\n\n别把我的帮助当成单纯的施舍，你必须像任何其他$c一样证明自己配得上，屡次失败日后可能会对你不利。",cEN="Make haste, <name>, more than one life hangs in the balance if you fail.\n\nIf for some reason you fail to help Muiredon and Narm, then return to me and I will give you another Symbol of Life for your travels.\n\nDon't mistake my aid as simple charity, you must prove yourself worthy like any other <class> and continual failure may reflect upon you later."}
Q[1790]={c="快去吧，$n，如果你失败，就不止一条性命悬于一线了。\n\n如果因为什么原因你没能帮助加津和亨泽，就回来见我，我会再给你一枚生命符印供你旅途使用。\n\n别把我的帮助当成单纯的施舍，你必须像任何其他$c一样证明自己配得上，屡次失败日后可能会对你不利。",cEN="Make haste, <name>, more than one life hangs in the balance if you fail.\n\nIf for some reason you fail to help Gazin and Henze, then return to me and I will give you another Symbol of Life for your travels.\n\nDon't mistake my aid as simple charity, you must prove yourself worthy like any other <class> and continual failure may reflect upon you later."}
Q[1791]={d="现在既然你已经学会了狂暴姿态，就应该去弄一把称手的武器。\n\n去和捕风者巴斯拉谈谈吧，他是住在奥特兰克山脉和西瘟疫之地之间一个巨魔隐士。他是制造武器的行家，也是一个强大的萨满祭司。\n\n去找到巴斯拉，沿着塔伦米尔东侧的河流一直向北——巴斯拉的营地就在这条河东岸的废墟旁。",dEN="Now that you've learned your berserker's stance, you'll want a nice weapon to use it with.\n\nTalk to Bath'rah the Windwatcher, a troll hermit who lives between the Alterac Mountains and the Western Plaguelands. He is a skilled weapon maker and a powerful shaman.\n\nTo find Bath'rah, go to the river that flows along Tarren Mill's eastern flank. Follow it north--Bath'rah is camped near ruins that rest along the river's eastern bank.",o="和捕风者巴斯拉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",c="你走了很远的路，年轻的$c。我看到你眼中有火焰。你在寻找一件强大的武器，对吗？\n\n我可以助你完成你的追寻。而你也可以助我完成我的。",cEN="You have traveled far, young <class>. I see fire in your eyes. You seek a weapon of great power, yes?\n\nI can help you with your quest. And you can help me with mine."}
Q[1792]={d="我有旋风之心，随时可以把它放进你选择的容器里。",dEN="I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.",c="现在有了旋风之心，我就可以把蕴含在其中的力量注入到武器里。\n\n选择一件你中意的武器吧，$n，它将获得塞克隆尼亚的力量。",cEN="I have the whirlwind heart, and am ready to place it within your vessel of choice.\n\nChoose your weapon, <name>, and know that its power is the power of Cyclonian."}
Q[1793]={c="圣光与你同在，$n。不过在你将来面对更加危险的境况时，了解自身所具备的力量就显得非常重要了。当魔鬼、恶龙和其它邪恶在我们的土地上肆虐时，你的勇气将接受真正的考验。你有足够强大吗？\n\n不管在什么情况下，勇气对于圣骑士来说，都是和对圣光的信仰一样重要的精神，它是你铜墙铁壁的护盾，你无坚不摧的武器。在圣光大教堂中修行的时候，你还将学习圣骑士的另外两条标准，时刻铭记要保护弱者，保持信念。",cEN="It has been proven that the Light is with you, <name>, but as times grow more dangerous, it becomes important to know what strength lies beneath the flesh. When demons, dragons, or any other evil set foot in your lands, your mettle will be tested. Will you be strong enough?\n\nBravery, regardless of the situation, is as much a part of paladinhood as the Light, your armor, and your weapon. Protecting the weak, and not losing faith are two more lessons you must master while you study in the Cathedral of Light."}
Q[1795]={d="如果你已$g充分准备:充分准备;，我们就该开始了。让我为你解释这个过程。\n\n我会先创建基础的法术法阵。完成之后，我的侍僧会用引导法杖创建更大的法阵。\n\n做完这些，你就念出密会之书中的咒语，地狱犬便会被召唤出来。小心，$n。地狱犬是强大的敌人，我希望你能保住自己的脑袋。",dEN="If you are sufficiently prepared, then we should begin. Let me explain the process to you.",o="召唤地狱猎犬并打败它，然后把阴谋之书交给棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉。",oEN="Using the Tome of the Cabal, summon and subdue a felhunter, then return the Tome of the Cabal to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",p="每个:每个 $c都应该有一只听命于自己的地狱犬。虽然驯服它很困难，但它为主人带来的力量远超付出的代价。",pEN="Every <class> should have a felhunter at his command. Though it be difficult to tame, the powers it brings to its master far outweigh the cost.",c="我得说我很佩服，$n。当年我面对自己的地狱犬时，是侥幸捡回一条命。我感觉到你有潜力成为这个时代最强大的$g术士:术士;之一。",cEN="I must say I'm impressed, <name>. When I faced down my felhunter, I barely escaped with my life. I sense that you have the potential to become one of the most powerful warlocks of this era."}
Q[1796]={d="我帮你制作的第一件物品是一件长袍。你来为我收集材料，我负责把它们组合起来。之后，只要你成功，就会得到众多让你更加$g强大:强大;、并在斗争中助你一臂之力的物品中的第一件。\n\n首先，你得先制作出奥法长袍。裁缝可以为你制作，或者你也可以向别人购买——如果你能自己$g动手:动手;，我会印象非常深刻——但无论如何，把长袍带来给我，我们再往下走。",dEN="The first item I will aid you in creating is a robe. You will gather the items for me, and we will put them together. Afterwards, assuming you succeed, you will have the first of many items that will make you more powerful and aid you in your struggles.\n\nTo start, you must have crafted Robes of Arcana. A tailor can make this for you, or perhaps you can purchase one from someone else--I'd be most impressed if you could make it yourself--but regardless, bring me the robes, and we shall go from there.",o="将奥法之袍交给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德。",oEN="Bring Robes of the Arcana to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="你搜寻长袍的进展如何，$n？你是准备亲自制作长袍吗？如果你自己动手的话，就会有很大的成就感。不过如果你准备走捷径找人为你制作的话，我也可以理解你想要迅速强大起来的——怎么说呢……雄心壮志。",pEN="How goes your search for the robes, <name>? Have you created them yourself? Such personal touches I find make the imbuing of magic that much sweeter. It gives you a greater sense of accomplishment. But I understand if you choose the quicker path and have it made for you - there's something to be said for such... ambition.",c="干得不错，$n。\n\n所有的魔法装备都要在一件高品质的装备的基础上才能制造出来。你在这件装备上耗费的精力越多，它的魔法力量也就越强。稀有而昂贵的材料能更好地维系魔法的能量，当你得到我制作的袍子时，就会知道它有多么物超所值了。",cEN="This will do nicely, <name>.\n\nAll magical items must begin with an item of high quality. The more effort and skill put into an item, the greater the magics it can hold. Rare and more expensive components hold the magic better. You will not regret having the robes fashioned into the ones we will make for you later on."}
Q[1798]={d="是该教你召唤地狱猎犬的时候了，$n。但我现在手里没有教你这个法术所必需的材料，所以你得去找另外一个人来教你，也就是斯坦哈德·法尔杉，他是我们我们的另一个成员。\n\n他就住在在地精港口城市棘齿城附近。在你到达之前，我会通知他你要过去的。",dEN="It is time you learned the felhunter summoning, <name>. I do not have the reagents and items necessary to teach you here, so you will have to seek out another, Strahad Farsan, another of our inner circle.\n\nHe makes his residence in the goblin port of Ratchet. I will send word ahead of you to inform him of your coming.",o="与贫瘠之地的斯坦哈德·法尔杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Strahad Farsan in the Barrens.",c="$n？哦，就是你啊。你可是最近的风云人物，但我恐怕你是盛名之下难符其实啊。\n\n别介意，别介意，你来这儿是学习的嘛，别管我的自言自语的说笑了。",cEN="<name>? Ah, of course. Our latest prodigy. The real thing can not live up to the legend, I am afraid.\n\nNo matter, you have come here to learn, not to hear me make jokes to myself."}
Q[1799]={d="很好，那么我们开始吧。\n\n首先，你必须到里面去跟我的助手们谈谈，然后决定自己要走哪条路——他们会给你更详细的解释。\n\n然后，你必须到凄凉之地的玛诺洛克集会所去，从那里的某个术士身上找到一颗地狱火珠。你要净化这颗宝珠，隐居在尘泥沼泽南部的一个名叫塔贝萨的法师会帮你完成净化。她肯定会帮助你，因为我们曾有共同的过去。\n\n我再强调一次，这些任务没完成之前，你就别回来见我。",dEN="Good, then we shall begin.\n\nThe first thing you must do is speak to my acolytes inside. Choose one of their paths to follow--they will explain more.\n\nSecond, you must travel to Desolace and find an Infernal Orb from one of the warlocks of Mannoroc Coven. It is that orb that you will cleanse with the help of a mage named Tabetha deep in southern Dustwallow Marsh. She will aid you because of our history together.\n\nAgain, do not come back until you have done both things I've asked.",o="在棘齿城外的塔里与梅纳拉的侍僧们谈话，选择自己修行的方式。\n\n然后给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨带去一颗地狱火珠。",oEN="Speak to Menara's acolytes inside the tower above Ratchet and choose one of their paths to follow.\n\nAfterwards, bring an Infernal Orb to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="而且显然你不是法师，我怀疑自己到底能不能信任你。我能闻到你身上的奥术力量，但你似乎避开了你们这类人轻易就会沾染的腐化恶臭。\n\n没错，$c……$g一位:一位;$c来找我帮忙了。\n\n好吧，我能为你做什么，$n？",pEN="And obviously not being a mage, I wonder if I can trust you at all. I can smell the power of the arcane on you, but you seem to have eluded the stank of corruption that comes so willingly with your kind.\n\nYes, a <class>... a <class> has come to ask for my help.\n\nWell, what is it I can do for you, <name>?",c="哦，是梅娜拉派你来的。行吧……我想你暂时可以留下来$g做客:做客;。但你一定是在忙什么要紧事吧——也许是在寻找失落的力量？也许我错了。也许腐化终究离你并不远。",cEN="Oh, so Menara sent you. Fair enough... I suppose you may stay as my guest for the time being. But you must be on some pressing business - perhaps you're here seeking lost power? Maybe I'm mistaken. Maybe corruption isn't too far away from you after all."}
Q[1800]={d="在我们很听话的时候，孤儿院院长就会给我们讲述许多伟大的故事，其中的一个就是关于洛丹伦的陷落，以及邪恶的阿尔萨斯是如何杀死自己的父亲来夺取政权的。\n\n他这样做真是太无耻了，$n！等我成长为强大的部落战士之后，我将为荣誉而战——而不是为了邪恶的权力！\n\n你愿不愿意带我去洛丹伦的王座看看呢？王座就在你进入幽暗城之前的那个大厅里。",dEN="The orphan matrons at my home tell mighty stories of battle and lore at night if we are good and do our chores. One story was about how Lordaeron fell, and about how the evil Arthas took his own father's life to become ruler.\n\nHe had no honor, <name>! When I grow up and become a mighty Horde warrior, my blade will be guided by honor - never evil!\n\nWould you take me to see the throne room, please? It is just before where you would go down into the Undercity.",o="带着你看护的孤儿去幽暗城电梯外的王座大厅。",oEN="Take your ward to the old Lordaeron Throne Room that lies just before descending into the Undercity.",p="我们到了吗？",pEN="Are we there yet?",c="王座厅真的好雄伟啊，$n！虽然这里是空的，但是我感觉到似乎有很邪恶的事情曾在这里发生过。我感觉到了疯狂……但是我也感到很难过。我知道为什么院长要告诉我们这个故事了。我永远也不会像阿尔萨斯那样背叛我的同胞！\n\n感谢你带我到王座厅来，$n。我学到了很多东西。",cEN="That throne room was scary, <name>! Even though it was empty, it felt like a great evil had happened there. I felt mad... but I also felt sad too. I understand why the matrons tell us such stories; I will never betray my people like that!\n\nThank you for taking me to the throne room, <name>. I learned a lot."}
Q[1801]={d="要召唤地狱猎犬并迎接它的挑战，一个简单的召唤法阵是不够的。\n\n我和三个侍僧可以帮你制造法阵，但是你需要一本《阴谋之书》。很久以前我们就把这本书给弄丢了，它是由最早的那批不借助任何外力帮助就召唤出地狱猎犬的术士写下的。\n\n也许约拉·安尼森能帮你的忙。这段时间里，他作为一名制图师受雇于幽暗城，在古籍方面他知道的比我多。",dEN="It will take more than a simple summoning circle to bring forth a felhunter for you to challenge.\n\nMy three acolytes and I will assist in creating the magic circles. You require a copy of the Tome of the Cabal, which has been lost to us for some time. It was written by the first group of warlocks to summon a felhunter unaided.\n\nPerhaps Jorah Annison can help you with this. He's employed as a cartographer in the Undercity these days, but still knows more of ancient texts than any I know.",o="和幽暗城的约拉·安尼森谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jorah Annison in the Undercity.",c="地图绘制！图是对现实的模拟，不过这些东西对我来说没什么价值。\n\n书，书就是叙述和描写！真知就在其中。我宁愿用所有的地图去书店里换一本有通灵术起源的书，或者是一本关于黑暗女王百战百胜的传记故事。",cEN="Map making! Pictures, estimations of reality. I have no use for such things.\n\nIn books, narrative, description! That is where truth lies. I would trade all the maps in this store for one book on the rise of necromancy, or a tale of the Dark Lady's triumph."}
Q[1802]={d="它是丢了，不过我知道一些可以帮你找到它的线索。\n\n这本书的复制品只有一本，而且它也已经被损坏了，很大一部分的书页全都被撕了下来，现在听说它们落入了千针石林的半人马手里。\n\n其余的部分在南海镇的西岸丢失了，原本这些书页是要用船送往米奈希尔港的，不过却从来也没能送到。\n\n你看，我告诉了你这么多消息，好歹你也得在找回东西以后拿来给我看看吧？",dEN="It was lost, but there's some idea as to where it might be found.\n\nThere was only one copy ever made and it was vandalized at some point, a large portion of it ripped from the binding. Rumor has it that it somehow passed into the hands of the centaur of Thousand Needles.\n\nThe rest was lost off the coast west of Southshore, where it was to be transported to Menethil Harbor by boat. It never arrived.\n\nIn exchange for this knowledge, all I ask is that if you find it, bring it to me to see.",o="为铁炉堡的克罗姆·粗臂找回发霉的书籍和破损的手稿。",oEN="Retrieve the Moldy Tome and Tattered Manuscript for Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge.",p="事情进行得怎么样了，$n？",pEN="Did the rumors prove true, <name>?",c="太棒了！现在我终于有机会成为少数几个阅读过这本书的人之一了。\n\n我简直等不及要快点读读这本书了！今天真是个好日子，$n！你走之前再让我看它一眼吧，我敢说斯坦哈德肯定愿意给我抄写一本！",cEN="Fantastic! Now I may join the ranks of the few that have spied its contents.\n\nI can't wait to further peruse this text. This is a great day, <name>! If you will just allow me to glance at it before you leave. I'm sure that Strahad will be willing to send me a copy."}
Q[1803]={d="啊！我看出来了，你是$g一位:一位;口味与我相投的术士！的确，得到《密会之书》是一个值得追求的志向。你知道它曾被收藏在洛丹伦的城墙之内吗？但它被人损毁了，将近一半的书页被撕掉。谁会做出如此恶劣的行径？\n\n那一半已经失落，不过有传言说它落入了千针石林半人马的手中。\n\n其余的部分本应被送往铁炉堡，却在途中失落于南海镇以西的海岸。",dEN="Ah! I see that you are a warlock of similar tastes to mine. Indeed, acquiring the Tome of the Cabal is a worthy aspiration. Did you know that it was once held within the walls of Lordaeron? It was vandalized though, almost half its pages removed. Who would commit such a heinous act?\n\nThat half is lost, though rumor says that it fell into the hands of the centaur of the Thousand Needles.\n\nThe rest of the text was to be transferred to Ironforge, but was lost in transit on the coast west of Southshore.",o="给幽暗城的约拉·安尼森带回发霉的书籍和破损的手稿。",oEN="Retrieve the Moldy Tome and Tattered Manuscript for Jorah Annison in the Undercity.",p="也许你所追寻的东西只是一团空气，$n，但真相往往就隐藏在最夸张的谣言之中。",pEN="It may be that you are chasing after fairy tales, <name>, but truth can be found at the center of even the wildest rumors.",c="好，很好，非常好！看看我们找到了些什么？\n\n这实在是太令人吃惊了，$n。我几乎已经不奢望还能看见它了，没想到它现在就在我的手里，全本的阴谋之书！\n\n来，在你离开之前，让我先翻上几页吧。",cEN="Well well well! What do we have here?\n\nThis is impressive, <name>. I wouldn't have thought it possible, but here it is in my very hands, the complete Tome of the Cabal.\n\nAllow me to leaf through its pages for just a moment before you are off again."}
Q[1804]={d="唉……我真是恨不得一辈子都抱着这本书。不过既然这是你找到的，而且你还要用它做更重要的事，我还是把它还给你吧……不过，请你一定要告诉斯坦哈德帮我抄写一本。\n\n对了，你去找书的时候，他托人带了个消息过来，让我告诉你说他的助手要协助进行召唤，不过你必须帮他找到3根导能魔棒。\n\n斯坦哈德可能不知道要到哪里去找导能魔棒，不过我碰巧知道！龙喉氏族的兽人法师们手上应该还有一些这种魔棒。",dEN="Well, ah, it's hard to let it go. But you found it, and you have more important things to do with it, of course. Just, please, be sure to mention to Strahad that I wanted a copy.\n\nWhile you were out, he sent a message for you. He wanted me to tell you that for his acolytes to assist with the summoning, you'll have to acquire three rods of channeling.\n\nHe might not know where to find them, but I do! They were last used by the orcs of the Dragonmaw clan in the Wetlands. I'd check their spellcasters!",o="将翻修过的书籍和3根导能魔棒交给棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉。",oEN="Bring the Reconstructed Tome and 3 Rods of Channeling to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",p="有阵子没在这一带见到你了。你找到那本古籍和法杖了吗？",pEN="Haven't seen you around these parts for a while. Have you found the tome and the rods?",c="太好了！《密会之书》和三根引导法杖——好吧，也许稍微刮花了一点。\n\n这会很有意思：已经很久没有年轻$c挑战地狱犬并使其为己所用了。",cEN="Well done! The Tome of the Cabal and three pristine--slightly scratched, I suppose--rods of channeling.\n\nThis will be interesting. It's been some time since a young <class> took on a felhunter to make his own."}
Q[1805]={d="这书上写的东西是我这几年中看过的文章里最有趣的。这边的书很少，选择也很少——大多数的书都是地理方面的——而且，我都把它们翻来覆去地读了好些遍了。我真希望斯坦哈德能抽空给我也送一本这样的书来。\n\n去和他谈谈吧，他在你离开的时候托人给我带来了口信，说是要交给你一个任务，要求你找回三根召唤魔棒。\n\n当然，为了答谢你允许我继续看这本书，我告诉你一个小秘密：你可以在湿地的兽人龙喉氏族那里找到你要的东西。",dEN="This is one of the most interesting texts I have perused in the last few years. The selection here is sparse--mostly books on geography--and I have already read them all. I should hope that Strahad would send me a copy of this tome when he has the chance.\n\nSpeaking of him, he sent word to me while you were away. For your task, you must obtain three rods of channeling.\n\nFor allowing me to look at this text, I will share a secret: You can find the rods on orcs of the Dragonmaw Clan in the Wetlands.",o="将翻修过的书籍和3根导能魔棒交给棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉。",oEN="Bring the Reconstructed Tome and 3 Rods of Channeling to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",p="$n，还有什么事吗？我还能为你做些什么？",pEN="Yes, <name>? Of what service can I be to you?",c="干得好！《密会之书》和三根崭新的——我想是稍微刮花了一点——引导法杖。\n\n这会很有意思。已经有一阵子没有$g年轻的:年轻的; $c收服地狱犬为己所用了。",cEN="Well done! The Tome of the Cabal and three pristine--slightly scratched, I suppose--rods of channeling.\n\nThis will be interesting. It's been some time since a young <class> took on a felhunter to make his own."}
Q[1806]={d="我们现在就到熔炉边上去开始工作吧！我已经为你的到来准备很久了，现在不用再等了。\n\n在我们完成这把武器之后，你就可以更好地为圣光而战，这一点我绝对可以保证。\n\n说实话，$n，看到你所取得的这些成绩，我真有点羡慕。不过我知道我也可以用我自己的方式给你提供一些帮助，这样就已经让我很高兴了。",dEN="Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all.\n\nWhen we're done, you'll be far more prepared to defend the Light than you have been, this much I swear.\n\nI'll be somewhat honest, <name>, seeing the results of your exploits makes me somewhat envious. But knowing that I can contribute to your adventures in my own significant way does bring me some joy.",o="等待乔丹·斯迪威尔为你铸造武器。",oEN="Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you.",c="给你，$n。一件配得上你这样的$g圣光勇士:圣光勇士;的武器。我用一位我认识的伟大矮人圣骑士的名字为它命名。他叫维里根……博施·维里根。\n\n请代表我和我妻子收下它。我们欠你一份大人情，有你这样本领的人在这片土地上旅行，世界会变得更安全。",cEN="Here it is, <name>. A weapon worthy of a champion of the Light such as yourself. I've named it after a great dwarven paladin who was a friend of mine. His name was Verigan... Bosch Verigan.\n\nPlease take it on behalf of myself and my wife. We owe you a great debt, and the world will be a safer place with one of your skill traveling the land."}
Q[1818]={d="有人告诉我，死亡守卫迪林格有一件适合你这样的人的活儿。如果你想向黑暗女士的部队证明自己的价值，就立刻去向迪林格报到。\n\n死亡守卫迪林格的岗位在布瑞尔西端，墓园旁边。",dEN="I was told Deathguard Dillinger has a job for someone like you. If you're willing to show your value to the Dark Lady's forces, then report to Dillinger immediately.\n\nDeathguard Dillinger's post is on the west end of Brill, near the graveyard.",o="和布瑞尔的亡灵卫兵迪林格尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Deathguard Dillinger in Brill.",c="你来这里找事干？很好，我有一个很重要的任务要交给你，可以看看你到底有几把刷子……还可以检验你为我们被遗忘者效力的决心。",cEN="You're here for a mission? Good. I have an important one, and one that will test your skill in combat... and your resolve in the defense of the Forsaken."}
Q[1819]={d="当天灾军团席卷提瑞斯法林地时，我们抓了一个来做研究。他的心智是自由的，自称乌莱格·劈砍者。但尽管意志自由，他仍被巫妖王所奴役。\n\n我们本想找到办法打破巫妖王对乌莱格的控制，但失败了。如今，终于到了让他解脱的时候。\n\n放他出来，然后杀了他。\n\n启动北边陵墓旁的骷髅石触发器。这样你就能解除束缚他的封印。\n\n动手的时候……要$g做好准备:做好准备;，$n。",dEN="When the Scourge swept through Tirisfal Glades, we captured one to study. He had a free mind, and called himself Ulag the Cleaver. But, although his will was free, he was still enthralled by the Lich King.",o="杀死切割者奥拉格，然后和亡灵卫兵迪林格尔谈一谈。",oEN="Kill Ulag the Cleaver, then speak with Deathguard Dillinger.",p="你的任务还没完成，$n。$g一个:一个;$c表现出恐惧可不是明智之举……",pEN="Your task is yet undone, <name>. It is not wise for a <class> to show fear...",c="干得好，$n。乌莱格可不是天灾军团的小角色。你向死亡守卫们——乃至黑暗女士——证明了你是一名$g坚定:坚定;的$c，值得接受进一步的指导。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Ulag was no minor agent of the Scourge. You have shown the Deathguards, and hence the Dark Lady, that you are a <class> of skill and resolve, and are worthy of further instruction."}
Q[1820]={d="你已经向黑暗女王证明了自己的价值，现在你应该有资格继续完成她下达的其它任务了。\n\n库勒曼·法席恩正在征召可以帮助他对付敌人的勇士。\n\n你可以在布瑞尔东部的恐惧之末旅店找到他。",dEN="You have proven your value to the Dark Lady, now perhaps you can prove yourself to one of her subjects.\n\nColeman Farthing awaits a warrior who is willing to be his instrument of revenge against the Forsaken's enemies.\n\nYou will find him in the Gallow's End Tavern in eastern Brill.",o="和库勒曼·法席恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Coleman Farthing.",c="是的，没错，我需要你的战斗本领。我的财力有限，但我的任务也有助于被遗忘者的事业。照做吧，你的报酬将是双份的。",cEN="Yes, it is true. I have need for your skills in combat. My means are small, but my task aids both me and the Forsaken's cause. Do it, and your reward will be twofold."}
Q[1821]={d="在我活着的时候，阿加曼德家族是我的主人，但他们也是让我死去的罪魁祸首！现在他们得到了应有的报复，阿加曼德家族已经成为了巫妖王手下的行尸走肉。\n\n现在我要剥夺他们最后的荣耀。到他们家族的墓地里去，帮我抢来他们的传家之宝：一把剑，一柄斧，一柄匕首，还有一把钉锤。将这些东西全都给我拿来！\n\n阿加曼德家族墓穴就在阿加曼德磨坊的最北端，那里有许多亡灵天灾的部队和死去的阿加曼德族人守卫着。",dEN="The Agamand family were my employers in life, and they were the cause of my death! It is fitting that the Agamands are now mindless minions of the Lich King.\n\nNow I would have their last vestiges of honor. Go into their family crypt and rob them of their family heirlooms: a sword, an axe, a dagger and a mace. Bring them to me!\n\nThe Agamand family crypt is at the north end of the Agamand mills, protected by lurking Scourge and dead Agamands.",o="把阿加曼德家传长剑、阿加曼德家传战斧、阿加曼德家传钉锤和阿加曼德家传匕首交给库勒曼·法席恩。",oEN="Bring Coleman Farthing the Agamand Family Axe, the Agamand Family Sword, the Agamand Family Mace and the Agamand Family dagger.",p="你拿到那些传家宝了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the heirlooms, Sictor?",c="啊！你找到它们了！现在，阿加曼德系列最后的荣耀和记忆已经从这片被诅咒的土地上彻底消失了！现在，这个系列已经永远被人遗忘了！",cEN="Ah! You retrieved them! Now the last semblance of honor and memory is stripped from the cursed Agamand lands. The family truly is no more!"}
Q[1822]={c="我将从你找来的武器中留下三样作为我所遭受的痛苦和折磨的纪念。但是，$n，请你在这些武器中选择你最喜欢的一件作为奖赏吧。\n\n希望你选择的那件武器能够在战场上为你赢得荣誉，而不是像以前那样被它那该死的主人所玷污。",cEN="I will keep three of the weapons you returned to me, as mementos of my pain and loss. But please, <name>, choose your favorite of the heirlooms and keep it for yourself.\n\nMay it serve you greater than it served its cursed, former owners."}
Q[1823]={d="你是$g一位:一位;有名望、有天赋的战士。你$g准备好:准备好;接受鲁加·怒蹄的考验了吗？如果准备好了，就去贫瘠之地的陶拉祖营地找鲁加。\n\n他正在等待所有响应他召唤的战士。",dEN="You are a warrior of skill and growing renown. Perhaps you are ready for Ruga Ragetotem's trial? If so, then find Ruga in Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.\n\nHe awaits those warriors who answer his call.",o="和鲁迦·狂暴图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ruga Ragetotem.",c="$n，你是来这里接受我的试炼的？",cEN="You are here for my trial, <name>?"}
Q[1824]={d="要通过试炼，你必须一直向南到巨人旷野去，在那里有一大群叫做异种蝎的昆虫生物。我以前从未在贫瘠之地看到过这种生物，也不知道它们的到来究竟预兆着什么。\n\n把它们的触角交给我，$n，要刚刚割下来、还再抽搐的那种。不要浪费时间，因为一旦你把触角割下来，它们很快就会彻底失去活力。在规定的时间内把触角带给我，这样你就通过了考验。",dEN="To pass this trial, you must travel south to the Field of Giants. There you will find a host of crawling, insect creatures. They are new to the Barrens and I do not like what they herald.\n\nBring me their still-twitching antennae, and waste no time, <name>, for harvested antennae will not twitch for long. Bring me the antennae in the time allowed, and you will pass the trial.",o="收集5根颤抖的触角，把它们带给贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的鲁迦。",oEN="Bring 5 twitching antennae to Ruga Ragetotem at Camp Taurajo",p="你得到触角了吗？如果是的话，那就快把那些触角交给我，它们很快就会失去活力……",pEN="Do you have the antennae? If so then give them to me quickly, for twitching antennae do not twitch forever...",c="干得漂亮，$n！通过巨人旷野的考验，作为一名$g战士:战士;，你在$c的道路上又迈出了一大步。",cEN="Nicely done, <name>! In passing the trial at the Field of Giants, you take one more step down the <class>'s path."}
Q[1825]={d="著名的兽人铁匠索恩格瑞姆·火眼已经听说了你为部落作出的杰出贡献。他愿意为你制作一套护甲，马上去找他谈谈吧。\n\n索恩格瑞姆的营地就在贫瘠之地十字路口的东边。",dEN="Thun'grim Firegaze, an orc blacksmith of renown, has heard of your continued deeds of valor in service of the Horde. He would like to fashion for you a suit of armor, and bids you speak with him immediately.\n\nThun'grim is camped east of the Crossroads in the Barrens.",o="与贫瘠之地的索恩格瑞姆·火眼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.",c="你终于来了。很好，我有很多事情要跟你谈。",cEN="Yes, you have come. This is good, for we have much to discuss, you and I."}
Q[1838]={d="我听说了关于你的英勇事迹，所以希望能为你制作一套护甲，这能够帮助你去为部落作出更多更伟大的贡献。\n\n但是制作这样一件护甲需要你的帮助，$n，如果你能帮助我，那你也就帮助了部落里所有的铁匠。\n\n拿着这个卷轴，这是我经过无数不眠之夜，强睁着我半瞎的眼睛写下的，上面记载着制作护甲所需要的材料。把卷轴上所列出的材料帮我找来，我会为你制作一套护甲。",dEN="I have heard tales of your strength and valor, and wish to make for you a suit of armor, a companion to aid you as tales of your great deeds grow.\n\nBut the fashioning of this armor will be a quest unto itself, <name>. I will need your help, and the help of other smiths of the Horde.\n\nHere, take this scroll. I spent many nights, struggling with near-blind eyes, writing that which I need for the armor. Bring me the items on this scroll and I will create for you the first piece of the suit.",o="为索恩格瑞姆收集15根烟雾铁锭、10份蓝铜粉、10块铁锭和1瓶燃素。",oEN="Bring to Thun'grim Firegaze 15 Smoky Iron Ingots, 10 Powdered Azurite, 10 Iron Bars and a Vial of Phlogiston.",p="$n，你找到我列在卷轴上的材料了吗？",pEN="Do you have the items on my scroll, <name>?",c="你为我收集了所有需要的材料。现在，该我开工了……",cEN="You brought all that I asked. Now, I will do my part..."}
Q[1839]={d="巨魔铁匠尤拉莱克会为你铸造一副野蛮护手，他住在杜隆塔尔的森金村里，那儿是暗矛氏族的家园，他正在等着你。",dEN="The troll smith Ula'elek will craft for you the brutal gauntlets. He dwells in Durotar, in Sen'jin Village with his Darkspear brethren, and he awaits your coming.",o="与杜隆塔尔的尤拉莱克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ula'elek in Durotar.",c="你好，$n。老图恩格里姆传信告诉我你来了，但即便他闭口不言，你出现在这里也不会让我意外。\n\n灵魂们注视着你的进展，年轻的$c，它们告诉我许多敌人已倒在你的面前。",cEN="Greetings, <name>. Old Thun'grim sent word to me of your coming, but had he kept silent your presence here would not have surprised me.\n\nThe spirits follow your progress, young <class>, and they tell me that many foes have fallen before you."}
Q[1840]={d="奥姆·石蹄因为他杰出的铸造技术而被大家尊敬，他会为你铸造野蛮头盔。\n\n你可以在雷霆崖找到他，他就在城市中心最大的那根图腾旁的池塘附近。",dEN="Orm Stonehoof is respected greatly for his skill. He will make for you the brutal helm.\n\nSeek him out in Thunder Bluff, near the pool by the city's great, central totem.",o="和雷霆崖的奥姆·石蹄谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",c="你好，$c。我是奥姆，图恩格里姆告诉我你想让我给你打一顶头盔，对吗？",cEN="Greetings, <class>. I am Orm, and Thun'grim tells me you wish a helm made?"}
Q[1841]={d="在死亡之前，维罗拉·奈特雷曾是洛丹伦最好的铸甲师。看来死亡让她的技艺退步了许多。去和维罗拉谈谈——她会帮你铸造野蛮腿甲。\n\n维罗拉住在洛丹伦的幽暗城里，你可以在贸易区找到她。",dEN="It is said that, before her death, Velora Nitely was one of the finest armorsmiths in Lordaeron. Death, it seems, has not decreased her talents. Speak with Velora--she will make your brutal legguards.\n\nVelora plies her trade in the Undercity of Lordaeron, in the trade quarter.",o="与幽暗城的维罗拉·奈特雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Velora Nitely in the Undercity.",c="你来这里是为了野蛮腿甲？太好了！\n\n嗯……是我帮你铸造野蛮腿甲还是你帮我铸造野蛮腿甲？\n\n开玩笑啦，不好笑吗？我不知道……在我停止呼吸和嗅觉的时候，我已失去了幽默感。",cEN="You are here for leg armor? Great!\n\nUm... am I making the armor for you, or are you making it for me?\n\nThat was joke. Was it funny? I can't tell... I lost my sense of humor the same time I lost my sense of smell. Which was about the same time I stopped breathing."}
Q[1842]={d="我可以为你铸造一副具有很强魔法力量的野蛮手套。但是首先，你必须先替我去收集这样的魔法力量。\n\n为了获取这片森林的力量，许多萨特聚集在灰谷的东北面，它们在那里贪婪地吸取和破坏着森林的力量。你可以从它们肿胀的蹄子上判断出到底是哪些萨特在吸取灰谷的魔力。\n\n这些蹄子都有不小的魔法力量，把它们给我带来，这样我就可以给你铸造野蛮手套了。",dEN="I can make you a pair of brutal gauntlets, and great magic will they hold. But first, you must collect this magic and bring it to me.\n\nThe satyrs dwell in northeastern Ashenvale because of the forest's power. They feed off its purity, leeching and corrupting. You can tell which satyrs have drawn the most of Ashenvale's magic by their swollen, uncloven hooves.\n\nThese hooves hold great power. I will need them for your gauntlets' crafting.",o="收集7只完整的萨特之蹄，把它们交给杜隆塔尔森金村的尤拉莱克。",oEN="Bring 7 Uncloven Satyr Hooves to Ula'elek at Sen'jin Village in Durotar.",p="你得到它们的蹄子了吗，$n？那些蹄子里面蕴含着强大的力量。",pEN="Do you have the hooves, <name>? The magic within them is strong.",c="啊，你得到它们了！现在，就像它们当初吸取灰谷的力量一样，我将吸取这些蹄子中的力量，然后把它注入我要铸造的野蛮手套中……",cEN="Ah, you have them! Now, just as the Satyrs leeched the strength of Ashenvale, I will leech the power held within these hooves and harness it into my crafting..."}
Q[1843]={c="谢谢你，$n。这些护手是我的心血之作。拿着吧，如果你能一直带着它的话，对我和我的祖先来说都是一种荣耀。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. These gauntlets are my best work. Take them. In wearing them, you bring honor to me and my ancestors."}
Q[1844]={d="我会帮你铸造头盔，但是你必须向我证明你值得我这么做。\n\n石爪山的西北面是一个名叫焦炭谷的山谷，那里曾经是一片郁郁葱葱的森林，但是现在已经被完全被污染，那里剩下的生物也都被痛苦和绝望逼疯了。\n\n现在我就要派你去那里，$n。\n\n你必须去焦炭谷找到雌奇美拉，杀死她，让她从苦痛中得到解脱，把她那光滑的奇美拉角带给我作为你完成任务的证据，然后我就会为你铸造头盔。",dEN="I will make you the helm, but you must show me you are worthy of it.\n\nNestled in the southwestern reaches of the Stonetalon Mountains lies the Charred Vale. It was once a verdant place, but is now defiled and ashen, and what creatures remain there are mad with pain and despair.\n\nThat place is where I send you, <name>.\n\nYou must go to the Charred Vale and find a chimaera matriarch. Slay her, free her of her misery. Bring me her galvanized horn as proof, and I shall make for you the helm.",o="把光滑的奇美拉角交给雷霆崖的奥姆·石蹄。",oEN="Bring a Galvanized Horn to Orm Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="你得到角了吗？她最终得到解脱了吗？",pEN="Do you have the horn? Is the matriarch free of pain?",c="你完成了任务，$n。你向我证明了你的价值和决心。这个头盔是你的了……",cEN="You have completed your task, <name>, and shown me your worth and resolve. The helm will be yours..."}
Q[1845]={c="我把这顶头盔交给你了。\n\n是崇高的事业和大地之母的意愿将你带到我这里来的，$n……我相信还有着更加伟大而崇高的事业在等待着你。",cEN="I give this helm to you.\n\nGreat deeds brought you to me, <name>, and Earthmother willing... even greater deeds lie before you."}
Q[1846]={d="要铸造野蛮腿甲，我就需要一些结实的胫骨。湿地里的龙喉兽人就有非常合适的胫骨，我就需要那样的。\n\n但是你一定要确保胫骨是绝对牢固的，在你收集它们的时候记得要试一下它们是不是足够牢固：如果你能徒手把它们弄碎，那么它们肯定不符合我的要求。",dEN="To make the brutal leg guards, I need a brace of sturdy shinbones. The Dragonmaw orcs of the Wetlands have nice, thick shinbones. I'll need theirs.\n\nBut they must be sturdy. Be sure to test the shinbones as you collect them. If you can break them with your bare hands, then they won't be sturdy enough to work with.",o="给幽暗城的维罗拉·奈特雷带去8根结实的龙喉胫骨。",oEN="Bring 8 Sturdy Dragonmaw Shinbones to Velora Nitely in the Undercity.",p="我正等着你给我带来那些胫骨，$n。我要用它们来制作野蛮腿甲的框架，那些东西应该是最好的材料。",pEN="I'm waiting for those shinbones, <name>. They'll make a nice frame for your leg guards.",c="干得好！这些看起来很结实，肯定可以做一件很棒的野蛮腿甲。那些兽人不介意你把他们的胫骨拿走吧，$n？有没有很多抱怨？\n\n开玩笑啦，而且你没有笑。\n\n看来我这些天来都不太擅长搞笑……",cEN="Well done! These all look strong. I think they'll do quite nicely. How did those orcs mind you taking their shins, <name>? Complain much?\n\nThat was another joke. You're not laughing.\n\nI'm not very funny these days, am I..."}
Q[1847]={c="这是你的腿甲，$n。看看它是否合适，如果你需要对它进行一些改动的话，我很乐意为你效劳！\n\n这些天我并没有专心于打造装备，因为我总是为感到自己是天灾军团的手下而感到悲哀！\n\n我想应该是这样吧……",cEN="Here are your legguards, <name>. Let me know how they fit or if you need any modifications. I aim to please! At least I used to.\n\nThese days I don't care much for my craft. But it beats being a mindless minion of the Scourge!\n\nI guess."}
Q[1848]={c="我相信你为这个任务付出了很大的代价，$n。你的努力现在应该得到回报。\n\n希望它能够帮助你，愿你有一天能够回到这里来，向我讲述你穿着这件护甲所经历的冒险故事。",cEN="I am sure you endured much hardship and shed much blood on my task, <name>. Here is the product of your toil.\n\nMay you wear it well, and may you one day return here with stories of its service to you."}
Q[1858]={d="你得去想办法把塔赞的包给弄开，这样咱们才能把里面的东西拿出来。这锁的结构还真挺复杂的，所以你想要弄开它的话就只能靠钥匙了。\n\n如果你没有在塔赞的尸体上找到钥匙，那他就一定把钥匙放到某个安全的地方去了……啊，对了！他有一个助手叫加摩尔，是个彻头彻尾的大酒鬼，你八成能在酒馆里找到这家伙。我建议你“安静地”把钥匙从他手里搞来。",dEN="I'll leave it to you to get Tazan's satchel open, and return to me with its contents. The locking mechanism is complex, so it would probably be easiest if you obtained the key.\n\nAs you didn't find it on Tazan's body, I can only assume that he left the key in the care of another... Ah, yes, that's right. He had an assistant named Gamon. A drunkard, you'll most likely find him at the tavern. Perhaps you could quietly relieve him of the key.",o="偷来塔赞的钥匙，用它打开他的背包，然后将里面的物品交给奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的瑟祖克。",oEN="Steal Tazan's key, then use it to open his Satchel and deliver its contents to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="这世上没什么比看得到吃不到的东西更烦人的了。",pEN="Is it not vexing to have the subject of your desire within your grasp, but to have no way of getting to it?",c="嗯，有意思。你已充分证明了自己的价值，$n。我印象很深。就把自己当作$g碎手氏族的最新成员:碎手氏族的最新成员;吧。还有，拿着这个；我想它日后对你大有帮助。",cEN="Hmmm, now this is interesting. You've more than proved your worth with this, <name>. I am quite impressed. Consider yourself the newest member of the Shattered Hand. And take this, it will be a great help to you in the future, I think."}
Q[1859]={d="小声点，$n。没错，我知道你叫什么。有人让我注意一个兽人，你完全符合他的描述。\n\n我们听说你在战斗中颇有一套，有时也会使用一些非常的手段。\n\n我没说错吧？\n\n不管怎样，你得去见见奥格瑞玛的瑟祖克，他有事要吩咐你。",dEN="Lower your voice, <name>. Yeah, I know your name. Was told to keep an eye out for an orc by your description.\n\nFrom what we've heard about you, you can handle yourself in combat, and aren't opposed to a little sneakery from time to time.\n\nAm I right?\n\nAnyways, you should go see Therzok in Orgrimmar. He's got an offer for you to hear.",o="到奥格瑞玛的暗影裂口和瑟祖克谈谈。",oEN="Speak with Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",c="很好，我很高兴卡普拉克能找到你。\n\n我有点事情要跟你谈谈，这和你的前途息息相关。",cEN="Very good, I'm glad Kaplak was able to get a hold of you.\n\nWe have some things to speak of, not the least of which is your future with the Hand."}
Q[1860]={d="我们法师有一项任务要交给你去完成，一项对于暴风城和艾尔文森林的安全至关重要的任务。\n\n詹妮亚·坎农会告诉你任务的细节。她正在暴风城的法师区里的巫师圣地里学习，你最好尽快找到她。",dEN="We mages have a task that needs doing. One that is vital to the safety of Stormwind and Elwynn forest.\n\nJennea Cannon has the details. She studies in the wizard's sanctum, in the mage district of Stormwind. You should make your way to her with haste.",o="和暴风城的詹妮亚·坎农谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jennea Cannon in Stormwind.",c="你是被派来协助我完成任务的吗，$n？很好。看到$g年轻:年轻;的$g法师:法师;热心帮助我们的事业，令人振奋……\n\n你问是什么事业？到时候你就知道了，年轻人。你会知道的……到时候。",cEN="You have been sent to aid me in my task, <name>? Good. It is heartening to see young mages eager to help in our cause...\n\nWhat cause, you ask? In time, young one. You shall know... in time."}
Q[1861]={d="大规模的魔法战争已经使得原本稳定的魔法流开始出现异常的波动。我们正在努力调查这种波动究竟会造成怎样的影响，而有些人已经做好了最糟糕的打算！\n\n但是现在还不能轻易下结论，我们们要派你去收集更多的信息。\n\n拿着这个水袋，到艾尔文森林明镜湖瀑布的底部收集那里的水样，然后把水样给我带回来，这样我就可以用它来进行魔法污染情况的研究了。",dEN="This world has been victim to massive mystic struggles, which tore magic currents from once stable channels. We struggle to determine the effects these changes have caused, and some of us fear the worst!\n\nBut I will reveal more of this later. Right now, we need you to gather information.\n\nHere, take this flask. Go to the base of the waterfall at Mirror Lake, southwest of the Stormwind gates, and retrieve a sample of the water there. Return it to me so that I might test it for magical taints.",o="把一份明镜湖水的样本交给暴风城的詹妮亚·坎农。",oEN="Bring a Mirror Lake sample to Jennea Cannon in Stormwind.",p="你拿到样品了吗，$n？暴风城和艾尔文森林的魔法流被改变了，我必须知道这种改变是否已经影响到了水的本质。",pEN="Do you have the sample, <name>? The flow of magic in Stormwind and Elwynn has been altered, and I must know if it is seeping into the water.",c="谢谢你，$n。我会对这份水样进行魔法特性实验的。希望我不会从中检测出什么有害的东西，否则的话，那些饮用明镜湖水的人和野兽都会受到影响。\n\n过来，$n。从宝珠和法杖中选择一样东西吧，希望它对你有用。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I will test this water for magical properties. Let us hope that it contains none, or we may find that those who drink from Mirror Lake for too long will be adversely affected.\n\nHere, <name>. Take this orb or staff as a token of your service. May it serve you well."}
Q[1878]={p="又回来了，$n？如果你又找到5个废土水袋，那我就再给你一个医疗包裹！",pEN="Back again, <name>? If you have five more Wastewander water pouches, then I have a care package with your name on it!",c="干得好！收集到越多水袋，我们就可以越早脱离这场灾难！继续干，你每给我带回五个水袋，我就会给你相应的奖励。",cEN="Excellent - the more water pouches we are able to reclaim, the further away from disaster we'll all be! Keep 'em coming, and I will be sure to reward you for every five water pouches you bring me."}
Q[1879]={d="$n！我在铁炉堡的侏儒同事彬克送话过来说，她有一项必须交由某个法师来完成的任务！你不正好是个法师吗，$n？\n\n如果你愿意的话，去和彬克谈谈吧。她就在铁炉堡秘法区的秘法大厅里。",dEN="<name>! Bink, my gnome colleague in Ironforge, sends word. She has a task that needs doing and won't rely on anyone but a mage to do it! Are you that mage, <name>?\n\nIf so, then speak with Bink. She spends her time in the Hall of Mysteries in the Mystic Ward of Ironforge.",o="和铁炉堡的彬克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bink in Ironforge.",c="哦，我看得出你有前途，没错你有！但要成为$g好:好;$c，光有前途还不够。如果你不是$g好:好;$c，那你就是$g坏:坏;$c。而$g坏法师:坏法师;正是问题的一部分，没错！\n\n哎呀，我说得太远了。我们还是从头开始吧！",cEN="Oh, I can see you have promise, yes you do! But it takes more than promise to be a good <class>. And if you're not a good <class>, then you're a bad <class>. And bad mages are part of the problem, yes they are!\n\nOops, I'm getting ahead of things. Let's begin at the start!"}
Q[1880]={d="我们法师能做的事情可不仅仅是弹动一下手指变出美丽的火花那么简单！我们控制着魔法，控制着构建这个世界的源泉！当然，这需要极大的决心和极强的能力，还有知识……足够多的知识！\n\n我发明的一台设备——法师文档存储器——里面存储着无数的知识。不过问题是，我把它弄丢了！当我们逃离诺莫瑞根的时候，我把它留在城外一座小屋的箱子里，现在那地方麻疯侏儒横行！\n\n$n，请帮我取回我的法师文档存储器！",dEN="We mages do more than just waggle our fingers and make pretty sparks! We control magic, the base fabric of our world! And that takes great care, and resolve. And knowledge... so much knowledge!\n\nOne of my devices, the mage-tastic gizmonitor, collects and stores that knowledge in huge amounts! But it's lost! When we fled our home of Gnomeregan, I left it in a chest in one of our huts outside the city, and now the place is crawling with leper gnomes!\n\nPlease, <name>, retrieve my gizmonitor!",o="帮彬克找回她的法师文档存储器。",oEN="Bring Bink her Mage-tastic Gizmonitor.",p="你找到法师文档记忆体了吗？我必须在它的能量耗尽之前找到它！",pEN="Did you find the gizmonitor? I must have it before its energy supply runs out!",c="哦，多美好的一天！当初我做那台装置监视器时，从没想到自己会这么依赖它。现在我又能重新开始研究了！\n\n谢谢你，$n！还有，拿着——这是我当年做$c时的第一套工具。是有点磨损，但经过充分检验。随便挑一件吧——我相信哪件对你都有用。",cEN="Oh, splendid day! When I made the gizmonitor I never realized how dependent on it I would become. Now I can begin my studies anew!\n\nThank you, <name>! And here--these were my first tools as a <class>. They're a little scratched but they're well tested. Take your pick--I'm sure you'll find either of them useful."}
Q[1881]={d="$n，阿纳斯塔西娅·哈特维尔有一项适合你才能的任务。去幽暗城的魔法区找她谈谈，为你作为被遗忘者法师的第一项任务做好准备。",dEN="<name>, Anastasia Hartwell has a task for someone of your talents. Speak with her in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, and prepare yourself for your first task for the mages of the Forsaken.",o="和安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Anastasia Hartwell.",c="你好，$n。你响应我的召唤是$g明智:明智;的，如果你听从我接下来要说的话，那就更明智了……",cEN="Greetings, <name>. You were wise to answer my call, and wiser still if you heed what I next say..."}
Q[1882]={d="东边的瘟疫之地处于混乱的状态。巫妖王控制下的天灾军团将邪恶的魔法灌入土地之中，腐化并杀死那里的一切生灵。虽然瘟疫具有强大的破坏力量，但是我们——被遗忘者的法师——相信它必定可以被清除掉。\n\n首先，我们必须判断出它在提瑞斯法到底散播到了怎样的程度。到提瑞斯法东部的巴尼尔农场去，在那里的花园中收集一些金鱼草，然后再回来。",dEN="The Plaguelands to the east are an aberration. Devised by the Lich King, they spread their magic into the soil, corrupting and killing all that live. Although there is a certain charm to the destructive forces of the plague, we, the mages of the Forsaken, believe it is unruly and must be curtailed.\n\nBut first, we must measure how far it has spread into Tirisfal. Go to the Balnir Farmstead in eastern Tirisfal. In the garden are flowers--snapdragons. Gather these and return.",o="将巴尼尔金鱼草交给幽暗城法师区的安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔。",oEN="Bring Balnir Snapdragons to Anastasia Hartwell in the Mage Quarter of the Undercity.",p="你拿到金鱼草了吗？这种花非常能适应魔法能量，研究瘟疫之地附近的金鱼草就能够让我们了解瘟疫是否已进入了提瑞斯法林地。",pEN="Do you have the snapdragons? That breed of flower is highly receptive to magic energies, and studying the snapdragons so close to the Plaguelands can tell us if the plague has entered Tirisfal Glades.",c="啊，不错的样本。我会把它送给我们的药剂师去进行研究的。\n\n你干得很好，$n。对于你所做的贡献，我给你两种奖励让你挑选:一枚宝珠或者一根法杖。无论选择哪一个，你都会发现它对你很有用。",cEN="Ah, a fine specimen this is. I will send it to be studied by our apothecaries to determine the extent of the Plagueland's taint.\n\nWell done, <name>. For your services, I present to you this choice: an orb or staff. Whichever you choose, you will find it quite useful."}
Q[1883]={d="森金村的部落法师安苏瓦发现杜隆塔尔的魔法流出现了波动，为此他向我寻求帮助。去和安苏瓦谈谈，尽你所能去帮助他。\n\n快去吧，到时一定会有更多的秘密展示在你的面前。",dEN="Un'thuwa, tribal mage of Sen'jin Village, detects a disturbance in the magic currents of Durotar and asks for aid. Speak with Un'thuwa and do what you can to help him.\n\nDo this, and in time further secrets will be revealed to you.",o="和安苏瓦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Un'thuwa.",c="你好，$n。赞美你，我的求援得到了回应。但愿$g你能胜任:你能胜任;这项任务……",cEN="Hail, <name>. Praise to you, for my call for aid is now answered. Let us hope you are up to the task..."}
Q[1884]={d="回音群岛的术士扎拉赞恩扰乱了杜隆塔尔的魔法流。他那些邪恶的魂能骨堆就是造成这一切的罪魁祸首，他把那些骨堆放在回音群岛的主岛上。\n\n骨堆破坏了我们的生活，还让在黑暗角落里隐藏着的术士和恶魔获得源源不断的力量。\n\n你必须在魔法流被彻底改变之前摧毁那些魂能骨堆，$n。",dEN="The warlock Zalazane of the Echo Isles has disrupted the normal flow of magic in Durotar. He does this through tainted fetishes, ju-ju heaps, which he has placed among his huts on the main Echo Isle.\n\nThese heaps corrupt our wildlife and give power to the warlocks and infernal creatures that lurk in the land's dark corners.\n\nYou must destroy the ju-ju heaps, <name>, before the flow of magic is forever altered.",o="摧毁4个魂能骨堆，然后向森金村的安苏瓦汇报。",oEN="Destroy 4 Ju-Ju Heaps, then return to Un'thuwa in Sen'jin Village.",p="你必须快点，$n。摧毁那些魂能骨堆！",pEN="You must hurry, <name>. Destroy the ju-ju heaps!",c="我感觉札拉赞恩的魂能骨堆都已经被摧毁了。如果我们运气不错的话，杜隆塔尔的魔法流会慢慢恢复正常的。\n\n你为你的同胞做了一件很了不起的事，$n。你也向我们部落的法师们证明了你的价值。",cEN="I sense that Zalazane's ju-ju heaps were destroyed, and with time, and luck, the flow of magic in Durotar will return to normal.\n\nA great deed you have done for your people, <name>. And you have shown your worth to us, the mages of the Horde."}
Q[1885]={d="$n？虽然现在的情况并不像我所预计的一样，但卡加德确实对你非常感兴趣。听起来是不是有点难以置信？\n\n无论如何，你得尽快去找他谈谈。我想你并不想知道上一个对他的召唤置之不理的人的下场吧。",dEN="<name>? Not quite what I was expecting, considering Carkad himself has taken an interest to you. Looks can be deceiving though, right?\n\nEither way, you should go see him as soon as possible. You wouldn't want to know what happened to the last few that chose to ignore his summons.",o="与幽暗城盗贼区的米奈特·卡加德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity.",c="嗯。你一听说我召唤就立刻赶来了，对吧？当然。我也不会对$g一名:一名;未来的亡灵潜行者有别的期待。",cEN="Hm. No doubt you made your way here at first mention of my summons, yes? Of course. I would expect no less from a prospective Deathstalker."}
Q[1918]={d="被毁灭的水元素留下了一颗水球，它令你感到极端的厌恶，仿佛污染密斯特拉湖的所有物质都包含在这颗水球中一样。\n\n你不清楚谁会对这个感兴趣，不过碎木哨岗的马斯托克·维尔西斯——那个最初派你来这里的家伙——也许对此有所了解。",dEN="The slain elemental has produced an intensely glowing globe of water. The contents of the globe are, at best, disgusting. It would be safe to assume that whatever has befouled the water of Mystral Lake is most likely present in the water of the globe.\n\nIt's not exactly common knowledge who might be interested in such a find; perhaps the person who originally sent you out to the lake, Mastok Wrilehiss at Splintertree Post, might have an idea.",o="将被污染的水球交给灰谷碎木哨岗的马斯托克·维尔西斯。",oEN="Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Mastok Wrilehiss at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.",p="哦，你需要什么吗？",pEN="Yeah, what do you need?",c="你找到了一个令人厌恶的水球，并决定把它交给我？难道我是大地之环的成员吗？\n\n事实上，我突然有了一个想法……也许你确实需要大地之环的帮助。我的意思是，如果它有助于清除湖水中的污秽，我就帮你一次吧。\n\n你知道大地之环是什么吧，$n？",cEN="You find a nasty ball of water and decide to bring it to me? Who am I, the Earthen Ring or something?\n\nActually, that does give me an idea... perhaps you do need the Earthen Ring for this. I mean, if it helps clear up the situation at the lake for good, then I'm all for it.\n\nYou know who the Earthen Ring are, <name>?"}
Q[1919]={d="你对这门技艺的了解不断增长，年轻的$n。你$g准备好:准备好;开始真正的课程了吗？你$g准备好:准备好;在我们所进行的秘密战争中占有一席之地了吗？\n\n如果是，就去跟暴风城法师区的巫师圣殿里的詹妮娅·加农谈谈。她有一项任务交给你，那项任务将为你打开通往无形世界的第一扇窗。",dEN="Your knowledge of the craft grows, young <name>. Are you now ready to begin your true lessons? Are you ready to take your place in the secret war we wage?\n\nIf so, then speak with Jennea Cannon, in the wizard's sanctum in the mage district of Stormwind. She has a task for you which will open your first window into the invisible world.",o="和暴风城的詹妮亚·坎农谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jennea Cannon in Stormwind.",c="$n，我有一项任务交给你，就在这里的$c区。仔细听，因为没时间可浪费了。",cEN="<name>, I have a mission for you, here in the <class> district. Listen closely, for there is no time to waste."}
Q[1920]={d="有报告称，法师区的蓝色隐士旅店里出现了异常的魔法波动。一些隐形的奇怪生物徘徊在旅店里，我担心那里已经有了一道魔法裂隙。\n\n我希望你去调查一下旅店，捕获那些生物。用旅店中的显形卷轴让它们现出原形，然后用封灵箱抓住它们。当你抓到足够数量的隐形生物之后，就带上装满了的封灵箱和显形卷轴回到我这里来。",dEN="A disturbance has been reported at the Blue Recluse tavern in the Mage Quarter. Strange, invisible creatures now wander the tavern, and I fear a mana rift has formed there.\n\nI want you to investigate the tavern and capture those creatures. Use the cantation of manifestation in the tavern to make the creatures visible, subdue them then use a containment coffer to capture them. When you have enough, return to me with your filled coffers, your empty coffers and the cantation.",o="从詹妮亚·坎农身后拿取一根显形卷轴以及一盒封灵箱。将3个装满的封灵箱交给巫师圣殿里的詹妮亚·坎农。",oEN="Obtain a Cantation of Manifestation and a Chest of Containment coffers from behind Jennea Cannon. Bring 3 Filled Containment Coffers to Jennea at the Wizard's Sanctum.",p="你抓到那些生物了吗，$n？必须研究它们，才能确定它们到来的原因。",pEN="Have you captured the creatures, <name>? They must be studied in order to determine the reason behind their arrival.",c="干得好！我要对这些生物进行一番研究，如果走运的话，我就能搞清楚它们是如何进入我们的世界来的！\n\n你对法师界越来越有价值了，$n。",cEN="Very well done! I will study these creatures and, with diligence and luck, determine how they slipped into our world.\n\nYour value to the society of mages grows, <name>."}
Q[1921]={d="你帮了你的法师同行们很多忙，现在是为你制作巫师长袍的时候了。维恩·拉尔森可以帮你这个忙，不过你必须把必需的原料交给她。\n\n制袍用的亚麻布很容易找到，不过你还必须得到充能裂隙宝石，唯一出产这些宝石的地方是在洛克莫丹的银泉矿洞，它们大多被密封在矮人矿工协会的箱子里。\n\n收集好亚麻布和宝石之后，把它们交给法师区拉尔森服装店里的维恩·拉尔森。",dEN="You have served your fellow mages well, and now it is time to don your wizard's robe. Wynne Larson can make your robe, but you must bring her the needed materials\n\nThe robe will be made of linen which is easy to find, but you must also gain charged rift gems, and the only known location of the gems is in the Silver Stream Mine of Loch Modan, left in crates by the dwarven miners' league.\n\nGather the linen and the gems and bring them to Wynne Larson at the Larson Clothiers in the Mage District.",o="把10匹亚麻布和6颗充能裂隙宝石交给暴风城的维恩·拉尔森。",oEN="Bring 10 Linen Cloth and the 6 Charged Rift Gems to Wynne Larson in Stormwind.",p="你好，$n。詹妮亚告诉我你要来。你找到我要的东西了吗？",pEN="Hello, <name>. Jennea told me you would come. Do you have something for me?",c="是的，这些是上好的亚麻料子。我能用它做一件漂亮的长袍。等我把裂隙宝石织进去，我们就会有一件真$g配得上:配得上;$c的衣服了！",cEN="Yes, these are great pieces of linen. I can make a fine robe with them. And after I weave the rift gems into it, we'll have a garment fit for a <class>!"}
Q[1938]={d="很久以前，三个法师在暴风城里一起学习法术，直到其中的一个开始研究黑暗魔法。他原本并不想深入其中，但是却发现自己在不经意间越陷越深。最终，他被放逐出了暴风城。\n\n这个被放逐的法师就住在赤脊山的伊尔加拉之塔中，他手中有一本强大的魔法书——《乌尔的暗影魔法研究论文》。\n\n我们这些暴风城的法师希望能把那本书拿回来。你要做的就是溜进伊尔加拉之塔，帮我们取回那本书。",dEN="Long ago, three mages studied in this tower until one fell to the dark arts. He was urged to turn away from that evil magic, but he could not resist. And so he was banished.\n\nThe fallen mage's new domain is the tower of Ilgalar in Redridge, and he took with him a powerful book--Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic.\n\nWe, the mages of Stormwind, would have that book returned. Enter the tower of Ilgalar, find the tome in his library, and bring it to me.",o="将《乌尔的暗影魔法研究论文》交给暴风城的高阶巫师安多玛斯。",oEN="Bring Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic to High Sorcerer Andromath in Stormwind.",p="你找到那本书了吗，$n？书里的秘密不是为毫无经验的新手准备的，贸然研究它有可能将你引向厄运与毁灭……",pEN="Do you have the book, <name>? Its secrets are not meant for the untrained, and plumbing its depths can lead to doom and ruin.",c="我曾担心莫甘斯把书藏在了别的什么地方，或者他已经看过了那本书……\n\n幸运的是，他并没有蠢到迈出这一步。我们给《乌尔的暗影魔法研究论文》贴上的封条仍然完好无损。",cEN="I feared that Morganth had hidden the book elsewhere, or that he had found a way to open it and read its contents.\n\nIt is good to see that he did not, and that the seals we placed on Ur's Treatise on Shadow Magic still hold."}
Q[1939]={d="高阶巫师安多玛斯希望和你谈谈，$n。他就在暴风城法师区的高塔顶端。\n\n能去和他会面可是非常难得的机会，因为安多玛斯是少数几个没有被困在达拉然的超强的大法师之一，他找你也一定是有非常重大的事情。",dEN="High Sorcerer Andromath wishes to speak with you, <name>. He is at the top of the wizard's sanctum, in the mage's district of Stormwind.\n\nIt would be wise to speak with him, for Andromath is one of the most powerful mages not locked away in Dalaran. Council with him is high council indeed.",o="和高阶巫师安多玛斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Sorcerer Andromath.",c="你好，$n。我很高兴见到你，希望你有时间听听一个老人的话……",cEN="Greetings, <name>. I am pleased to see you, and hope you have time to listen to an old man's words..."}
Q[1940]={d="你一直在帮助我们，$n。我想，也许你应该换一件好点的长袍了，一件更适合资深法师地位的长袍。如果你能收集到必需的原料，我们就帮你做一件新的长袍。\n\n你必须进入暮色森林，猎捕那里的食腐独行蛛。抽出它们的丝，但只有最好的、最纯的丝才行。你得到足够的蛛丝后，就把它们交给维恩·拉尔森来帮你缝制长袍，她就在法师区的拉尔森服装店里。",dEN="Your service has been unwavering, <name>. I think, perhaps, it is time you had a finer garment, one more suiting your station as an adept mage. If you gather the needed materials, then we will arrange the robe made.\n\nYou must enter Duskwood and hunt carrion recluse spiders. Extract their silk, but only the finest, most pristine silk will do. When you have enough, take it to Wynne Larson, here in the mage district at the Larson Clothiers. She will craft your robe.",o="找到8束新鲜的蜘蛛丝，把它们交给暴风城的维恩·拉尔森。",oEN="Bring 8 Pristine Spider Silk to Wynne Larson in Stormwind.",p="啊，没错，大法师们已经告诉我你会来和我谈谈了。你拿到我要的蛛丝了吗？",pEN="Ah, yes. The mages of the Wizard's Sanctum said you'd speak with me. Do you have the required silk?",c="这真是上等的蛛丝，我马上就开始工作！",cEN="Nice specimens, these. I'll get right to work!"}
Q[1941]={c="这是你的长袍，也是我自己最满意的一件作品！请自豪地穿上它，当人们问起的时候……告诉他们这是拉尔森服装店为你制作的！",cEN="Here is your robe. It's one of my best made yet! Wear it with pride, and when people ask... tell them you got it at the Larson Clothiers!"}
Q[1942]={c="你的长袍做好了！你收集的蛛丝真是太好了……我在做长袍的时候稍微偷工减料了一些，剩下一些蛛丝给自己留着，你不介意吧？\n\n我只是开玩笑啦。这件长袍很适合你，无论是外出探险还是出席晚宴都非常棒。希望你能喜欢！",cEN="Your garment is ready! And that silk you gathered was so nice... you don't mind if I made it a little short so that I'd have some silk left over for me, do you?\n\nI'm only joking. It'll fit you great, and will be perfect for both adventure and formal dining. Enjoy!"}
Q[1943]={d="$n，巨魔法师迪诺需要你的帮助，她就住在奥格瑞玛的暗木小屋里。",dEN="The troll mage Deino has need of your assistance, <name>. She resides in Orgrimmar, in the Darkbriar Lodge.",o="和迪诺谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Deino.",c="太好了，你终于来了。我的任务可不是那么简单，但对于整个法师界来说是非常关键的。如果你能帮忙的话，我相信你一定不会后悔的。",cEN="Good, you have come. My task is not an easy one, but vital to the society of mages. If you aid me, I am sure you will find it worthwhile."}
Q[1944]={d="传说中的克萨维亚城位于灰谷的东部，据说在那里可以找到所有智者都渴望获得的古代知识，而克萨维亚之水也具有超强的魔法力量。\n\n我需要一些克萨维亚之水——要从水源直接取得的那种。\n\n拿着这只瓶子，去寻找传说中的克萨维亚城吧。从那里最高的瀑布底部收集水样，然后把它交给我。在那里你要步步小心，萨特占领了整个遗迹，它们一定不会喜欢让多事的法师侵入它们的领地。",dEN="The fabled city of Xavian lies nestled deep within eastern Ashenvale, and tales of its ancient knowledge are well known among the learned. It is said that the waters of Xavian hold vast magical powers.\n\nI would have a sample of those waters, from their source.\n\nTake this flask and go to Xavian. Gather water from the bottom of its highest waterfall, and return to me. And use care as you move through that ancient city--satyrs now hold the ruins and do not like mages prying into their affairs.",o="将克萨维亚水样交给奥格瑞玛的迪诺。",oEN="Bring the Xavian Water Sample to Deino in Orgrimmar.",p="$n，我很高兴看到你毫发无损地回来了。你得到水样了吗？我急切地需要用它来进行研究。",pEN="I am pleased you have returned with your skin intact, <name>. Do you have the water sample? I am eager to study its properties.",c="啊，非常好。看来克萨维亚城的萨特并没有给你带来什么麻烦。\n\n谢谢你，$n。我会马上投入对水样的研究工作中。",cEN="Ah, very good. I trust the satyrs of Xavian gave you little trouble?\n\nThank you, <name>. I will study this sample of Xavian water immediately."}
Q[1945]={d="我已经把为你制作新袍子的事情安排妥当了，就等你来提供一些材料……\n\n我需要一些头发来制作你的法袍，你应该可以在灰谷的树妖身上弄到符合条件的头发，那些树妖们都聚集在林中树居那里。\n\n当你找到足够的材料之后，就把它们交给贫瘠之地十字路口的基尔哈拉，他是一个巨魔裁缝。他正等着为你制作最新款的法袍。",dEN="For your services, I have arranged for the creation of your new robes, provided you can gather the needed materials...\n\nFor these robes, you must return to Ashenvale for the locks of hair from laughing sisters--dryads who gather near the Raynewood Retreat.\n\nWhen you have their hair, bring it to Kil'hala, a troll tailor at the Crossroads in the Barrens. He will be expecting you, and will fashion your robes.",o="给十字路口的基尔哈拉带去12缕欢笑姐妹的头发。",oEN="Bring 12 Laughing Sister's Hairs to Kil'hala at the Crossroads.",p="你好，$n。迪诺说过你会给我带来欢笑姐妹的头发。那么，头发呢？",pEN="Greetings, <name>. Deino said you would come, and would bring the laughing sisters' hair. Do you have it?",c="啊，$n，这些头发足以编制一件最好的法师袍。真遗憾那些树妖必须为此付出生命的代价，不过她们肯定是不会心甘情愿地把头发交出来的。\n\n有点惋惜，但只是一点点而已。",cEN="Ah, this hair will weave into a fine robe, <name>. It is a pity the laughing sisters had to die to part with it, though I do doubt they would ever give it willingly.\n\nA pity, but only a small one."}
Q[1946]={c="这是给你的虚灵长袍，$n。这件法袍穿在身上非常舒适，而且很耐磨，袍子里还蕴含着欢笑姐妹的头发的魔力。\n\n希望它对你有用，如果你喜欢这件法袍，别忘了告诉迪诺。我非常欣赏她……",cEN="Here is your nether-lace, <name>. It is both comfortable and durable, and holds the magic of the laughing sisters' hair.\n\nEnjoy, and if you find it amenable, please mention so to Deino. She is a <class> on whose good side I wish to stay..."}
Q[1947]={d="现在，是让你得到自己的法师魔杖的时候了。首先，你得去和住在尘泥沼泽的人类隐者塔贝萨谈一谈。你可以在沼泽深处找到她的小室，那地方就在塞拉摩的西边，石槌废墟的北边。\n\n去和她谈谈，她的知识非常渊博。",dEN="Now it is time for you to earn your mage's wand. To begin this quest, speak with the human hermit Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. You will find her shack deep in the marsh, west of Theramore.\n\nSpeak with her, for her knowledge is vast. You will find Tabetha's cottage west of Theramore, and just north of the Stonemaul Ruins.",o="和塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha.",c="请安静！我正在思考重要的问题，不要打扰我！\n\n请等一会儿……",cEN="Quiet! I'm in a delicate juncture and mustn't be disturbed!\n\nOne moment..."}
Q[1948]={d="铸造一根法师的魔杖并不容易。我们需要一些珍贵的材料，而且必须制作一个能储存大量魔法能量的容器——这些事情就交给你了。\n\n我已经把要你去找的东西写在这张羊皮纸上了，把上面列着的东西交给我，另外你一定要按照羊皮纸上的指示行事。如果你不听从我的指示擅自决断的话，我们铸造魔杖时就可能会有……大麻烦。",dEN="The building of a mage's wand is not easy. Rare substances are required, and a vessel must be made that can store great quantities of magical energy. You must gather these things and bring them to me.\n\nI have written onto this parchment that which you need, and instructions on how to get it. Bring me exactly what is on this list, and follow my written directions to the letter, for if you do not then when we make your wand things might go... badly.",o="将电能草莓和1颗翡翠交给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨。",oEN="Bring 1 Jade and the Bolt Charged Bramble to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你好，$n。你拿到我要的东西了吗？",pEN="Hello, <name>. Do you have the items I require?",c="啊，干得好！\n\n我看见的烟是从你耳朵里冒出来的吗？也许是闪电击中图腾时你靠得太近了，但也不用担心。能被闪电击中也是因为你人品好！",cEN="Aha! You got the jade and made the bramble! Well done!\n\nIs that smoke I see rising from your ears? You might have gotten too close when the lightning struck the totem sticks, but don't worry. Being hit by lightning is good luck!"}
Q[1949]={d="为了制作你的魔杖，我得查询一本书里的一些关键段落。这本书叫做《能量仪祭》，是大法师提尔斯写的。\n\n我没有这本书，世界上所有的大图书馆也没有收藏。你必须去和提尔斯谈谈，从他那里要一本来。\n\n祝你好运。提尔斯曾经是个伟大的法师和学者，不过他现在把时间都花在饮酒、赌博，还有去闪光平原观看侏儒与地精的车赛上了。",dEN="To make your wand, there are key passages in a certain book that I must read. The book is called Rituals of Power, written by the Magus Tirth.\n\nI do not have a copy of his book, and none of the world's great libraries possess it. So you must speak with Tirth and gain it from him.\n\nGood luck. Tirth used to be a great mage and scholar, but now he spends his time at the gnome and goblin races in the Shimmering Flats, drinking and gambling.",o="和闪光平原的大法师提尔斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Magus Tirth in the Shimmering Flats.",c="什么？大声点！我的耳朵不像以前那样灵光了。\n\n好吧，我希望你给我带来一杯新鲜的麦芽酒，或是准备给下一轮的车赛丢几注！否则，你最好离开这里……因为我的变形魔杖可不长眼睛！",cEN="What? Speak up! These old ears aren't as sharp as they used to be.\n\nWell, I hope you're here with a fresh mug of ale or some hot tips on the next race! If not, then you best keep walking... because I have a polymorph wand with your name on it!"}
Q[1950]={d="我可以给你书，但你得先帮助我！\n\n你要找的书被锁在我的魔法箱里了。必须念出一些咒语才能打开它，但是我忘记这些咒语了！通常都是我的助手帮我记这些事情，但现在他也不知道跑哪里去了。\n\n如果你想要我的书，那就得先找到我的学徒！到赛车道周围去问问——如果幸运的话，会有人知道他在哪里的。要么把他给我带回来，要么从他那儿问到咒语，不然就别想打开我的箱子！",dEN="I can help you with the book, but first you have to help me!\n\nThe tome you seek is in my magically locked strongbox. To open it a special phrase must be uttered, and I can't remember the phrase! Normally my assistant helps me remember these things but he's nowhere to be found.\n\nIf you want my book, then find my apprentice! Ask around the race track--if you're lucky then someone has seen him. Either drag him back here, or at least get my magic phrase from him so we can open my box!",o="找到提尔斯保险箱的解封咒语，然后向提尔斯复命。",oEN="Find the phrase to Tirth's strongbox, then return to Tirth.",p="你在等什么？赶紧去找回我的开箱咒语！",pEN="What are you waiting for? I need my magic phrase!",c="啊，我记起来了……\n\n我已经忘记了对约翰森所下的小小诅咒，也不记得我当时为什么要这么做了，但我确信我这么做是对的，这个忘恩负义的东西！",cEN="Ah, now I remember...\n\nI had forgotten about that little curse I put on Johnson. I can't remember why I did it but I'm sure it served him right, the little ingrate!"}
Q[1951]={d="嗯……我想起来了，我的书已经没有了！你要知道，我欠了一屁股的债，不得不把最后一册《能量仪祭》卖掉来还债，我把它卖给了一个牧师……\n\n他是血色十字军的成员。他一定把那本书带到了他们的根据地——提瑞斯法林地里的血色修道院图书馆去了！\n\n如果你想要那本书的话，就得去一趟修道院。很抱歉给你带来这么多麻烦，这些天我已经有些头昏脑涨了……",dEN="Hm... now that I think about it, I don't have my book! You see, I had some gambling debts and to pay them off I sold the last copy of Rituals of Power to a member of the clergy....\n\nA member of the Scarlet Brotherhood. He must have taken it to their library in the Scarlet Monastery in Tirisfal Glades!\n\nIf you want that book, then you'll have to go to the monastery to find it. And sorry about all the trouble. I'm not myself these days...",o="将《能量仪祭》交给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨。",oEN="Bring the book Rituals of Power to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你好，$n。你找到我要的书了吗？",pEN="Greetings, <name>. Did you find the book, Rituals of Power?",c="就是它了！它正是铸造魔杖的仪式必需的东西！我希望你寻找它的时候没有遇上太大的麻烦……",cEN="That's it! It's just what I need to prepare for the ritual to create your wand! I hope it wasn't too much trouble to find..."}
Q[1952]={d="我现在要去铸造魔杖了。",dEN="I'll go make the wands now.",o="等塔贝萨的仪式完成后，和她谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha after her ritual.",c="这些就是我铸造的魔杖。选一件吧！",cEN="Here are the wands I made. Take your pick!"}
Q[1953]={d="$n，是时候让你去和塔贝萨谈谈了……这位尘泥沼泽里的隐士将指导你如何铸造强大的法师物品。\n\n塔贝萨就隐居在尘泥沼泽的深处，塞拉摩的西边。",dEN="It is time, <name>, for you to speak with Tabetha... the hermit of Dustwallow Marsh. She will instruct you on the creation of a powerful mage's implement.\n\nTabetha's shack lies deep in Dustwallow Marsh, west of Theramore.",o="和塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha.",c="啊，是的。你是来要一颗法珠还是一根法杖的，$n？很好。我会协助你制作。\n\n但事先警告你——这个过程很危险，可能要了你的命。\n\n或者要了我的命。总之肯定有人要死……\n\n不过但愿死的是别人，对吧？",cEN="Ah, yes. You are here for an orb or a staff, <name>? Very well. I will aid you in its construction.\n\nBut be forewarned--the process is a perilous one and could mean your death.\n\nOr my death. Definitely someone's death...\n\nBut let's hope it's someone else's death, eh?"}
Q[1954]={d="首先，我们必须弄到一颗有魔力的宝珠。火刃氏族的术士有高质量的宝珠……糟糕的是，他们将恶魔收入了宝珠里！当然我们可以解决这个问题，对……我们可以。\n\n到凄凉之地去，从火刃召唤师那里夺取一颗地狱火宝珠。那帮家伙通常在玛诺洛克集会所活动。\n\n拿到宝珠之后就尽快返回我这儿来。",dEN="The first step is to acquire an orb with power. The warlocks of the Burning Blade have nice, high quality orbs... it's too bad they've bound demons into them! But we can fix that, yes we can.\n\nGo to Desolace and snatch an infernal orb from a Burning Blade summoner. You'll find summoners at the Mannoroc Coven.\n\nWhen you have the orb, return to me.",o="将一颗地狱火宝珠交给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨。",oEN="Bring an Infernal Orb to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你有地狱法珠吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have an infernal orb, <name>?",c="哦，这颗真不错！不，我不是说它像大热天里一杯冰果汁那样\"好喝\"。\n\n事实上，仔细一想，它非常不妙。不是果汁。是法珠！\n\n集中精神，$n！要想完成我们的任务，你就得集中精神！",cEN="Oh, that's a nice one! No, I don't mean it's \"nice\" like cool juice is nice on a hot day.\n\nIn fact, it's very NOT nice now that I think about it. Not the juice. The orb!\n\nFocus, <name>! We'll need you focused if we're ever to finish our task!"}
Q[1955]={d="既然我们有了一颗召唤师法珠，就得把里面的恶魔驱除出来。这我能做。这是最简单的部分。\n\n辛苦的活儿得你干。恶魔出来之后，得由你来杀死它。\n\n而且你得动作快。如果你拖太久，它就会跳回法珠里，我们只能从头再来！\n\n所以$g你做好准备:你做好准备;。准备好你最强大的法术，把药水放在手边，再带上一个朋友，如果你有的话。因为这场面可不会好看。",dEN="Now that we have a summoner's orb, we must exorcise the demon within it. I can do that. That's the easy part.\n\nYou're the one who has the hard job. You're the one who has to kill the demon once it's out.\n\nAnd you'll have to be quick. If you take too long then he'll jump back in the orb and we'll have to start over!\n\nSo get yourself ready. Prepare your strongest spells and keep your potions handy, and go get a friend if you have one. Because this isn't going to be pretty.",o="杀死宝珠之魔，然后与塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.",p="你必须杀了那个恶魔，将宝珠彻底净化，$n。",pEN="You'll have to kill that demon to remove its taint from the orb, <name>.",c="干得好，$n！你给了那个恶魔一个令它很难遗忘的教训。\n\n下次当它再想把那个丑陋的头探入这个世界的时候，它一定会再三考虑的。也许它会叫上它的朋友一起来，那些巨大而丑恶的家伙，那些只想把你撕成碎片的家伙……\n\n我没有吓着你吧……$n？",cEN="Nicely done, <name>! You gave that demon a lesson he won't soon forget.\n\nHe'll think twice before he sticks his ugly head back in this world, looking for the stupid mortal who beat him. Probably with friends this time. Big, scaly friends who'd want nothing more than to tear you into little <race> pieces.\n\nI didn't scare you, did I...<name>?"}
Q[1956]={d="既然恶魔已经被消灭了，接下来我们就得去找一个能量源。不幸的是，最合适的能量源往往非常古老而且极难获得。有的时候，命运就喜欢这样捉弄你，难道不是吗？\n\n所以，为了得到能量源，你必须到奥达曼去打败那里的黑曜石守卫。他体型巨大而且很难对付，但是你可以从他身上得到我们所需要的能量源！\n\n祝你好运，$n。如果你运气不好的话，那么……很高兴认识你。",dEN="Now that the demon has been removed, we must gain a power source. Unfortunately, the best power sources are usually the oldest and the hardest to get. It's neat how fate likes to take a bite out of you sometimes, isn't it?\n\nSo you're going to need to go to Uldaman and defeat the obsidian sentinel there. He's big, he's tough, and his power source packs a punch!\n\nI wish you the best of luck, <name>. And if you don't get lucky then, well... it was nice knowing you.",o="找到一个黑曜石能量源，将其交给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨。",oEN="Retrieve an Obsidian Power Source and bring it to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你去过奥达曼了吗，$n？把那个黑曜石守卫干掉了吗？",pEN="Have you been to Uldaman, <name>? Did you defeat the obsidian sentinel?",c="你做到了？干得好！\n\n我之前跟几个同行聊天，提到你的名字时他们说：\"你知道那个$n在压力下表现得可好了！\"\n\n可当我告诉他们我派你去奥达曼对付黑曜石哨兵时，他们说我疯了！他们说：\"塔贝莎，你疯了！$n不可能对付得了那个哨兵！\"\n\n我说：\"咱们走着瞧，\"然后他们说\"是啊，走着瞧……\"\n\n好吧，我们可真是让他们瞧见了，对吧！",cEN="You did it? Well done!\n\nI was chatting with some of my colleagues and when your name came up they said, \"You know that <name> sure works well under stress!\"\n\nBut when I told them I sent you to Uldaman against the obsidian sentinel, they said I was crazy! They said, \"Tabetha, you're crazy! There's no way <name> could take on that sentinel!\"\n\nAnd I said, \"We'll see,\" and then they said \"Yeah, we'll see...\"\n\nWell we sure showed them, didn't we!"}
Q[1957]={d="我们几乎已经要大功告成了，但是最后一步也是最危险的，$n。\n\n我有一颗空的召唤宝珠，准备给它注入力量。我们将通过一道魔法裂缝来完成这个步骤，首先，我会念一段咒语来打开裂缝，此时特殊的生物——法力怒灵将大量涌出来。你必须打败这些生物以释放它们的能量，我会及时用宝珠收集这些能量。\n\n在裂缝关闭之前杀死足够多的法力怒灵，我会把所有收集起来的能量注入你的宝珠。",dEN="We are almost finished, but this last step is the most perilous, <name>.\n\nI have the empty summoner's orb and am ready to empower it. We will do this by harnessing the energy of a mana rift. I'll cast a spell that will temporarily open a rift, from which creatures, mana surges, will pour out. You must defeat the mana surges and their power will be released, which I will then collect.\n\nKill enough mana surges before the rift closes and I will place all their collected energy in your orb.",o="在限定时间内杀死12只法力怒灵。",oEN="Kill 12 Mana Surges in the allowed time limit.",p="$n，你还没有杀死足够数量的法力怒灵。",pEN="You have not killed the required amount of mana surges, <name>.",c="你成功了！我丝毫没有怀疑过你的能力！好吧，也许曾经有一秒或两秒钟的怀疑……但基本上我并没有太多的怀疑。\n\n真的，我不骗你。",cEN="You did it! I never doubted you for a second! Ok, maybe for just a second, or two... but basically I didn't have much doubt.\n\nHonest."}
Q[1958]={c="你该为自己感到$g骄傲:骄傲;，$n。许多法师都倒在你面对的那些生物手下。\n\n天界法珠已经做好了。或者如果你愿意，我可以把它装在一根法杖上。由你决定。我本人更喜欢法珠，但我有什么资格评判呢？",cEN="You should be proud of yourself, <name>. Many mages have fallen to the creatures you faced.\n\nThe Celestial Orb is ready. Or if you'd like I can mount it atop a staff. It's up to you. I'd prefer the orb, but who am I to judge?"}
Q[1959]={d="幽暗城的法师们注意到城里出现了一股魔法波动，他们随即发出消息，请求部落的法师来协助他们进行调查。\n\n安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔会告诉你更多的详细内容，她就在幽暗城的魔法区，去和她谈谈吧。",dEN="The mages of the Undercity have noted a magical disturbance within the city, and have sent word for mages of the Horde to investigate.\n\nAnastasia Hartwell can tell you more. Speak with her in the Magic Quarter in the Undercity.",o="和安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Anastasia Hartwell.",c="确实如此。在我们的城市里出现了一股魔法波动，我们还不清楚它的起源，也无从得知它到底是好是坏。我们必须搜集更多的消息……\n\n$n，你来执行这个任务。",cEN="It is true. A magical disturbance has been detected in our city. We are not yet sure of its origin, or whether it is malign or benign. We must first gather more information...\n\nAnd that, <name>, brings us to your task."}
Q[1960]={d="在炼金房的奥格诺恩炼金店里有一股奇怪的魔法波动。由魔法能量构成的隐形生物在商店里四处游荡，这其中一定有什么原因，我们必须找到它！\n\n我希望你去调查一下，捕获那些生物。用我身后的显形卷轴让它们现出原形，然后用封灵箱抓住它们。当你抓到足够数量的隐形生物之后，就带上装满了的封灵箱和显形卷轴回到我这里来。",dEN="Algernon's alchemist shop in the Apothecarium is the locus of a strange disturbance. Invisible creatures, made solely of magic, wander the shop--there must be a reason, and we must find it!\n\nInvestigate the disturbance and capture those creatures. Take a chest of coffers and a scroll from behind me. Use the scroll at the shop to make the creatures visible, subdue them with your spells, then throw down a coffer to capture them. Return with the filled coffers, the empty coffers and the cantation.",o="从安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔身后拿取一根显形卷轴以及一盒封灵箱。将3个装满的封灵箱交给幽暗城的安娜斯塔西娅·哈特威尔。",oEN="Obtain a Cantation of Manifestation and a Chest of Containment Coffers from behind Anastasia Hartwell. Bring 3 Filled Containment Coffers, the Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation to Anastasia in the Undercity.",p="你调查过那场骚动了吗，$n？你抓到那些生物了吗？",pEN="Have you investigated the disturbance, <name>? Have you captured the creatures?",c="很好，$n。我会把这些生物拿去给在这方面有丰富经验的同事研究，搞清楚它们出现在这里的原因。\n\n如果它们是从自然形成的魔法裂隙中跑出来的，那我们就必须搞清楚那种裂隙是否随机出现的。如果不是的话……我们就得做好防范的准备了。",cEN="Very good, <name>. The creatures within these containment coffers will be studied by our finest minds, and the reason behind their presence in the Undercity will be determined.\n\nIf their appearance is caused by a rift in the natural flow of magic, then we must determine if the rift was random. If it was not random, but instead an attack by some magical force, then we must prepare for future, more serious disturbances."}
Q[1961]={d="$n，是时候为你制作你的第一件法师袍了。那会是你地位的标志，同时也是对你的一次考验。\n\n你必须从银松森林的达拉然法师身上获得制作法袍所必需的法力宝石。那些法师和我们拥有相似的信仰，所以杀掉他们会是一件让人感到不快的事情，但是既然他们不具备抵御我们的力量，那他们也就没有继续存活下去的价值了。\n\n把宝石和亚麻布交给法师区裁缝店里的乔瑟夫·格里高利，他会为你制作你的第一件法师袍。",dEN="It is time for you to don your first mage's robes, <name>. They are a sign of your station, and a testament to your worth.\n\nTo gain the robes, you must gather the mana gems from the Dalaran mages of Silverpine. Their beliefs are similar to ours and so killing them is somewhat distasteful, but if they lack the strength to resist us, then they do not deserve their lives.\n\nBring the gems and a supply of linen to Josef Gregorian at the Magic Quarter's tailor shop.",o="把10块亚麻布和6块达拉然法力宝石带给乔瑟夫·格里高利。",oEN="Bring 10 Linen Cloth and 6 Dalaran Mana Gems to Josef Gregorian.",p="安娜斯塔西娅已经告诉我你会来这里找我，而我也已经准备好要为你制作法师袍了。你弄到足够的宝石和亚麻布了吗？",pEN="Anastasia said you would come to me, and I am prepared to fashion your robes. Do you have the gems and the linen?",c="这些都是非常好的材料，虽然以我的资质还无法判断这些法力宝石的材质如何，但不久之后我们就能知道它们是否蕴含制作魔焰长袍所需的力量了……",cEN="This is very good material, and although I lack the talent to gauge the quality of these mana gems, we'll soon know if they possess the power needed to create spellfire robes..."}
Q[1962]={c="拿着这件长袍，$N。好好地利用它吧。",cEN="Here are your robes, <name>. Wear them well."}
Q[1963]={d="酋长行事的方法实在是有些太谨慎了。他总是很小心地不让部落显得过于锋芒毕露。一旦我们足够强大了，我们的力量将能征服一切。部落必须重现往日的荣耀和尊严，而现在看来能做到这一点的就只有我们碎手氏族了。\n\n我们必须在暗中积蓄力量，再突然向敌人发起致命的打击，神不知鬼不觉地将敌人除掉。如果你想加入我们，就必须先为我完成一个任务，以此来证明你自己的价值。\n\n有个名叫塔赞的巨魔在棘齿城附近和海盗们做交易，而他那里有我感兴趣的消息。杀了他，把他的背包拿来给我。",dEN="The Warchief is too subtle in his methods. He is cautious to unleash the might of the Horde. Once we were stronger, mighty conquerors all. That pride we must regain, and the Shattered Hand will do so.\n\nWe build strength from the shadows and strike at the exposed, secretly laying our enemies low. A task you must complete for me, to prove your worth.\n\nThe troll Tazan trades with the pirates near Ratchet. He has information I must have. Kill him and bring me his satchel.",o="杀死塔赞，把他的背包带给奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的瑟祖克。",oEN="Kill Tazan and bring his Satchel to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="只有笨蛋才会相信握着斧头从正面冲锋比用匕首偷袭更加有效。",pEN="It is a fool who believes a charge with axe drawn is more dangerous than a knife in the dark.",c="嗯，听说塔赞已经挂了，这事可真让我高兴，不过这锁着的背袋就有些麻烦了。我们想要的资讯都在这里面。\n\n对于想要加入我们碎手氏族的人来说，这就算是第二个考验吧。",cEN="Hm, while I am glad to hear that Tazan is no longer with us, a locked satchel does us no good. We need the information kept within.\n\nThis should prove a worthy second challenge for one who wishes to join the Shattered Hand."}
Q[1998]={d="瓦里玛萨斯大人刚刚给我下达了一道命令，要求我派人去把一个对我们构成巨大威胁的家伙立刻铲除掉。他的名字是芬维克·萨托斯，瓦里玛萨斯大人认为他是一群在银松森林中肆虐的亡灵的领袖。\n\n一接到这个任务，我马上就想到了你，$n。我坚信，以你的能力一定可以将这个任务轻松完成。\n\n我们派遣到银松森林的亡灵哨兵们发回的最新报告中指出，萨托斯就躲藏在洛丹米尔湖岸边的一处废弃码头上。",dEN="Lord Varimathras has just sent me a missive about a threat to the Forsaken that must be immediately removed. His name is Fenwick Thatros, one whom Lord Varimathras believes is a leader of the undead that have taken root in Silverpine Forest.\n\nYour name came to mind immediately, <name>. I have faith enough in your abilities that you will carry out this mission flawlessly.\n\nThe latest reports from the Deathstalkers in Silverpine indicate that Thatros can be found near the decrepit dock on Lordamere.",o="杀掉芬维克·萨托斯，把他的头颅交给幽暗城盗贼区的米奈特·卡加德。",oEN="Kill Fenwick Thatros and bring his head back to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity.",p="我对你抱有充分的信心，你一定能为瓦里玛萨斯大人完成这个任务。",pEN="I have placed the utmost faith in you to perform this service for Lord Varimathras.",c="你做得非常好，$n。我已经看到你为亡灵哨兵完成过许路复用了，这充分证明了你的价值，也许我们应该传授你一些更高深的技艺了……",cEN="You've done well, <name>. It occurs to me that you have performed many services for the Deathstalkers, proving your worth, and that perhaps it is time that we furthered your training in the shadow arts."}
Q[1999]={d="安伯米尔的肯瑞托法师那里保存着大量关于达拉然现状的文档，这些情报是我们从一个囚犯的口中拷问出来的。瓦里玛萨斯大人已经下令，要求我们必须把这些文件弄到手。\n\n于是这个任务就落到了你的肩上，$n。你需要一些装备，更重要的是得学会开锁的技术。去跟我们的工具商艾斯特蕾·根德瑞谈谈，在你出发前向她要一套开锁工具吧。",dEN="The wizards of the Kirin Tor at Ambermill have stored away important documents pertaining to the current state of Dalaran. This we know from the admissions of one of our prisoners. Lord Varimathras has placed the duty of recovering them in the hands of the Deathstalkers.\n\nThis task falls to you, <name>. You will need some equipment, however, and the knowledge of lockpicking. Speak with Estelle Gendry, our outfitter, and ask her for a set of tools before you set out.",o="找到达拉然形势报告，把它交给幽暗城盗贼区的米奈特·卡加德。",oEN="Find the Dalaran Status Report and return it to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity.",p="你找到那些文件了吗，$N？",pEN="Have you located the documents, <name>?",c="很好，$n！你把开锁这门精细手艺学得很好，比我预想的还要快。\n\n看来我信任你是对的。相信我，$g小伙子:小姑娘;，我预见到你在这行会大有前途。",cEN="Very good, <name>! You have learned the fine art of lockpicking well, and faster than I could have possibly expected.\n\nI see that I was right to place my trust in you. Believe me, boy, I foresee that you will go far in this line of work."}
Q[2019]={d="出发吧，$n。这些东西你用起来一定会很趁手。它们都是我亲手制作的，我发誓你找不到更好的了。\n\n别把你的工作告诉我，那只会让我心烦。毕竟，我对瑟祖克的计划是一点兴趣都没有了，我只希望自己能过上平静的退休生活。\n\n如果你需要一套新的工具的话，就随时回来找我，我会给你造一套新的。不过你要小心使用它们！",dEN="Here you go, <name>. These should serve you well. Crafted by my own hand, I swear you'll find none better.\n\nDo not bother to tell me your business, however. I have no interest in Therzok's schemes, I wish only to live out my retirement in peace.\n\nIf you should ever need another set of tools, come back to me, and I will furnish you with a new set. But have a care with them!",o="向奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的瑟祖克复命。",oEN="Return to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar."}
Q[2038]={d="好象在洛克湖坠机还不够倒霉似的，湖心小岛上来的穴居人还袭击了我，抢走了我的工具和气压炸弹。没有旋翼机没有炸药，我什么都干不了！\n\n去帮我找回工具和气压炸弹，$n。为了诺莫瑞根！",dEN="As if crashing into the Loch wasn't bad enough, troggs from the nearby island attacked me and stole my tools and special Blastenheimer Blastencapper explosives. With no gyrocopter and no explosives, the movement has no chance!\n\nGet my tools back and find my Blastencapper explosives, <name>. For Gnomeregan!",o="找到并交还宾格斯的工具：\n\n扳手、螺丝刀、锤子和爆破引爆器。",oEN="Find and return Bingles' supplies:\n\nBingles' Wrench, Bingles' Screwdriver, Bingles' Hammer, and Bingles' Blastencapper.",p="$n！我的东西在哪儿？！",pEN="<name>! Where are my things?!",c="你为这个行动作出了巨大贡献，$n。诺莫瑞根的穴居人和麻疯侏儒很快就会感受到侏儒空袭的可怕力量！",cEN="You've done the movement a great service, <name>. The troggs and leper gnomes infesting Gnomeregan will soon feel the brunt of a gnomish air assault!"}
Q[2039]={d="我们和宾格斯失去了联系！他被派去侦察诺莫瑞根，不过已经有足足一个星期没回来报告了。这家伙应该是失踪了。\n\n最后有人看到他时，他正在洛克湖上空飞行。你可以去那一带调查一下，$n。",dEN="We've lost contact with Bingles! He was sent on a reconnaissance mission over Gnomeregan and hasn't reported back in over a week. I just know he's gone and blown himself up.\n\nHe was last seen flying over the Loch. Perhaps you can investigate, <name>.",o="去洛克莫丹寻找宾格斯。",oEN="Find Bingles Blastenheimer in Loch Modan.",c="诺恩不相信我的侦察能力？为什么……\n\n不管了，我需要你帮忙！不！是这个行动需要你帮忙。",cEN="So Gnoarn doesn't trust my reconnaissance abilities? I wonder why...\n\nNevermind that, I need your assistance! Nay! The movement needs your assistance!"}
Q[2040]={d="诺莫瑞根已经被那群卑鄙懦弱的穴居人们完全占据了！情况很紧急，或许你能帮上我们的忙，$n。\n\n在死亡矿井深处有一台功能强大的地精伐木机，找到这台伐木机并带回它的能源供应机件。有了这台伐木机的能源供应机件，我们就能给高速钻孔挖掘机供应足够的能量，用它来钻透这里与诺莫瑞根之间的岩石。钻开一条路，给他们来一次侏儒式的突袭！",dEN="Gnomeregan has fallen under the control of those dastardly troggs! The situation is grave but perhaps you can help, <name>.\n\nDeep in the Deadmines is a functional goblin shredder. Find that shredder and bring back the intact power supply. With the shredder's power supply, we can give our gyrodrillmatic excavationators the power they need to break through the rocky underground borders of Gnomeregan, opening the way for a gnomish assault!",o="从死亡矿井中带回小型高能发动机，将其带给暴风城矮人区中的沉默的舒尼。",oEN="Retrieve the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from the Deadmines and return it to Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind.",p="你找到小型高能发动机了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you found the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。谢谢你，我们很快就能解放诺莫瑞根啦！",cEN="Well done, <name>. Thanks to you, Gnomeregan is one step closer to its day of liberation!"}
Q[2041]={d="也许……也许你能帮我们攻打诺莫瑞根。\n\n你可以到暴风城去找秘密攻击部队的指挥官，沉默的舒尼。舒尼需要有人帮他找一些东西。\n\n你可以在暴风城的矮人区中找到她。\n\n祝你好运，$n。",dEN="Perhaps... Perhaps you can help us in the battle for Gnomeregan.\n\nIn Stormwind you will find the commander of our underground assault crew, Shoni the Shilent. Shoni needs assistance with her gyrodrillmatic excavationators.\n\nYou will probably find her amongst the dwarves in Stormwind.\n\nGood luck, <name>.",o="去暴风城和舒尼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shoni the Shilent at the Dwarven District in Stormwind.",c="指挥官让你来的？",cEN="Do you bring word from central command?"}
Q[2078]={d="你得去找我的大副，你这个$g旱鸭子水手:旱鸭子水手;。\n\n拿着这把钥匙，插到他脑袋上，把他带回来给船长效力。\n\n那些鱼人可不算他的主人……等我的大副收拾了他们，他们就知道厉害了！",dEN="Landlubber, ye needs to find me first mate.\n\nTake this'n key, puts it in his gulliver an' bring him back here to serve the Cap'n.\n\nThem murlocs an' their chief ain't gonna be too happy once me first mate gets a hold of em!",o="找到基尔卡克的大副——机械打手4100型，把他带到基尔卡克那里。",oEN="Find Gelkak's First Mate, the Threshwackonator 4100, and lead it back to Gelkak.",p="我的大副呢，$n？如果你再不快点的话，我就把你和鲨鱼拴在一起！",pEN="Where be me first mate, <name>? Shackles n' sharks fer ye soon if ye don't hurry!",c="呀……你还真有两下子啊，旱鸭子。\n\n如果你能一直有这样的表现，船长大人我也许会开恩晋升你为甲板水手。",cEN="Yarrr... Ye be provin' yerself to be more than a yella sea dog, landlubber.\n\nThe Cap'n may promote ye to poop deck swabby if ye be keepin' this up..."}
Q[2098]={d="想要当一个出色的海盗可不简单呀，你这个旱鸭子是不会理解的。我们的生活并不仅仅只是掠夺和痛饮！唉，我的船在海岸附近被那些可恶的鱼龙给弄沉了。\n\n我希望我的大副能够重新回来工作！\n\n当我被冲到海岸的时候，大副的钥匙在岩石上折断了，接着又被黑海岸那一带的怪物给偷走了，我只记得隐约看见一些狂暴暗礁蟹、凶猛的森林陆行鸟和几个鱼人正在搜寻船的残骸……",dEN="A pirate's life ain't an easy one, landlubber. It ain't all about plunderin' and booze! Alas, me ship be sunk just off shore thanks to them pesky Threshadons.\n\nWhat I be needin' is me first mate back in workin' order!\n\nWhen I washed up'n shore, the key for me first mate broke on the rocks and was pilfered by the beasties of Darkshore. Out of the corner of me eyes I saw some of them Ragin' Crawlers, Ferocious Foreststrider, and murloc rummaging through the wreckage....",o="找到基尔卡可钥匙的3段碎片，把它们交给基尔卡克·旋杆。",oEN="Find and return the three pieces of Gelkak's Key to Gelkak Gyromast.",p="旱鸭子，你找到我的断钥匙了吗？",pEN="Have ye found me broke down key, landlubber?",c="等等，小子！你找到钥匙啦？我的大副很快就能回来工作，那些畜牲就会知道我的厉害啦！\n\n嗯，你看见我的大副了吗？",cEN="Avast ye scurvy sea dog! Ye did it! Soon me first mate be back in workin' order and them beasties won't know what hit em!\n\nHrm, have ye seen me first mate?"}
Q[2118]={d="一种疾病正在黑海岸蔓延，它能够控制一切与它接触的灵魂和肉体。\n\n这种瘟疫对蓟熊的影响最大，使得这种曾经高贵的动物现在几乎变成了毁灭和杀戮的机器——它们变得狂暴，完全失去了理智。我有一种方法应该可以治疗这种病。\n\n把这个陷阱放到森林的空地上。任何狂暴蓟熊经过时，都会在短时间内变得驯服。一旦蓟熊安静下来了，就上前安抚它，减轻它的痛苦（使用/soothe命令），然后它就会跟你走。把它带到这里来，$n。",dEN="A sickness spreads across the Darkshore, gripping the minds and bodies of all it touches.\n\nThe Thistle Bears have been hit the hardest by this plague. The once noble beasts are now an instrument of destruction - rabid and frenzied. I may have a cure for this ailment.\n\nTake this trap to the forest and lay it on the ground. Any Rabid Thistle Bear that crosses the light shall become docile for a short time. Once the bear is docile, it shall follow you. Lead it back here, <name>.",o="活捉一只狂躁蓟熊，带回来给萨纳里安。\n\n如果你没能捉到狂躁蓟熊还弄丢了陷阱，就回去找萨纳里安·树须再要一个。",oEN="Capture a living Rabid Thistle Bear and bring it back to Tharnariun.\n\nShould you fail to capture a Rabid Thistle Bear and lose your trap, return to Tharnariun Treetender and request another trap.",p="你把那只生病的动物带给我了吗，$n？\n\n如果陷阱没能弹起，别烦恼——萨纳里安的希望是永恒的。如果你需要另一个陷阱，就回来找我。",pEN="Have you brought me the sick animal, <name>?\n\nShould you fail to spring the trap, do not fret - Tharnariun's Hope is eternal. If you require another trap, abandon your task and report back to me.",c="$n，我们的工作才刚刚开始。你准备好迎接下一项任务了吗？",cEN="Our work has only just begun, <name>. Are you prepared for your next task?"}
Q[2138]={d="正如我所担心的，这种疗法没有起到效果。\n\n对我来说，任何野生动物的死都是一件令我难过的事情，但是我们必须杀掉这些感染了瘟疫的狂暴蓟熊。\n\n$n，回到森林里去，杀掉20只狂暴蓟熊。这虽然无法驱散瘟疫，但可以在短期内降低狂暴蓟熊对这片森林和森林里的居民们带来的破坏。",dEN="As I had feared, the cure does not work.\n\nIt saddens me greatly to order the death of any of nature's beasts, but the sick and tainted thistle bears must be put down.\n\nReturn to the forest and destroy 20 rabid thistle bears, <name>. It will most certainly not put a stop to the plague but it will slow down the damage the animals are doing to our forest and its inhabitants for a short time.",o="到森林里去杀掉20头狂暴蓟熊。",oEN="Cleanse the forest of 20 Rabid Thistle Bears and return to Tharnariun Treetender in Darkshore.",p="你完成任务了吗？",pEN="Is your task complete?",c="你为奥伯丁立了大功，$n，但你的任务还没完成。\n\n休息一下再回来。\n\n还有，$n，为更多的流血做好身心准备。",cEN="You have done Auberdine a great service, <name>, but your task is not yet complete.\n\nReturn to me once you have rested.\n\n...and <name>, prepare your mind and soul for more bloodshed."}
Q[2139]={d="$n，我们用惨痛的代价换取了黑海岸和奥伯丁的平安。\n\n你杀了很多早已病入膏肓的动物，减轻了森林的痛苦，也解脱了这些动物的灵魂。尽管这种状况只能持续一小会儿，但是奥伯丁的人民感谢你。\n\n我要交给你最后一项任务，请注意，这将是又一次的杀戮任务。我希望这是最后一次让你去做这样的事情，$n。\n\n有一只雌蓟熊住在东北方的一个靠近巴莎兰的洞穴里，杀了她。",dEN="The survival of our people and lands comes at unfortunate costs, <name>.\n\nYou have spilled the blood of nature's servants; many sick animals you have felled. The people of Auberdine are indebted to you, for the forest's pain is eased - even if only for a moment.\n\nI have one final task for you, but be warned, you will have to kill again. It is my hope that this will be the last time I call upon you, <name>.\n\nIn a cave to the northeast, near Bashal'Aran, resides the Den Mother. Slay her.",o="找到雌蓟熊，然后杀掉它。",oEN="Find and kill the Den Mother.",p="感染了瘟疫的雌蓟熊一死，这一带的狂暴蓟熊的数量将会大大减少。快点去吧，$n。",pEN="With the infected Den Mother slain, the population of Rabid Thistle Bears entering our land is lessened. Waste no time, <name>.",c="感谢你英勇地为奥伯丁而战，$n。在我们这片饱经战火的土地上，死亡与绝望随处可见。很多人不愿意面对生活的挑战，而是选择了躲避在他们的安乐小窝里，或者干脆逃向更安全的地方。\n\n谢谢你，$n。也许有一天，我们会再次并肩作战，一起对付又一个给森林和我们的同胞带来危险的敌人。",cEN="You have fought for Auberdine with bravery and honor, <name>. In our war torn lands, death and despair are common. Many will not rise to meet the challenge of life in our new home, choosing instead to hide in their homes or escape to the more fortified lands of the Alliance.\n\nThank you, <name>. Perhaps someday soon we shall fight along side as comrades versus another foe."}
Q[2158]={d="每个冒险家在疲惫的时候都需要休息——而休息和放松的最佳去处就是狮王之傲旅店！\n\n我的好朋友法雷是那里的旅店老板。告诉他是我介绍你去的，也许他还会给你些特别优惠呢。\n\n如果你要去狮王之傲旅店的，沿着大路往南走就没错了！",dEN="Every adventurer should rest when exhaustion sets in - and there is no finer place to get rest and relaxation than at the Lion's Pride Inn!\n\nMy best friend, Innkeeper Farley, runs the Lion's Pride. If you tell him I sent you, he may give you the special discounted rates on food and drink.\n\nTo find the Lion's Pride Inn, travel south along the road from here -- you can't miss it!",o="和狮王之傲旅店的旅店老板法雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Innkeeper Farley at the Lion's Pride Inn.",c="又累又冷的旅行者啊，狮王之傲就是您温暖的家——这是我们的格言！请坐在火边，让您疲惫的身体好好放松一下。\n\n您要不要尝一尝我们这儿最好的酒菜？",cEN="Rest and relaxation for the tired and cold -- that's our motto! Please, take a seat by the fire and rest your weary bones.\n\nWould you like to try a sampling of some of our fine food and drink?"}
Q[2159]={d="你好，年轻的$c。你能帮我一个忙吗？我有一包药草必须送到多兰纳尔去，但是现在我还要忙于处理幽影谷德鲁伊的事情，所以走不开。\n\n你能帮我把这包药带去吗？把它送到多兰纳尔旅店的老板凯达米尔那里，那座旅店就在南方的路边上。",dEN="Greetings, young <class>. Can you offer me aid? I have a package of herbs that I must deliver to the town of Dolanaar. But I still have business with the druids of Shadowglen and cannot yet leave.\n\nCan you deliver this package for me? It must be sent to Innkeeper Keldamyr, at the Dolanaar inn. It lies along the road, to the south.",o="把药草送到旅店老板凯达米尔手中。",oEN="Bring the Dolanaar Delivery to Innkeeper Keldamyr.",p="我能为你做点什么，年轻人？你是来客栈休息的吗？需要一块炉石吗？",pEN="How might I be of service to you, young one? Are you here to rest in the inn? Do you require a hearthstone?",c="啊，是的，来自影叶谷的草药。很遗憾波萨尼乌斯没能亲自送来，因为他和我有很多话要谈。不过我还是很高兴能拿到草药，也很高兴你来了。\n\n既然来了，就请好好休息。$g英雄们:英雄们;必须保持力量和士气，并在需要时寻求休憩与慰藉。若不给身心以安宁，失败便是必然。\n\n所以……休息吧。",cEN="Ah yes, the delivery of herbs from Shadowglen. It is a shame Porthannius could not bring it himself, for we have much to discuss, he and I. But I am glad to get the herbs nonetheless, and I am glad you came.\n\nWhile you are here, please, rest yourself. Heroes must keep their strength and spirits high, and must find rest and solace whenever they may. For to neglect one's peace of body and mind is a sure path to failure.\n\nSo... rest."}
Q[2160]={d="嘿！我一看就知道你是个精力充沛的冒险家。如果你要继续前进的话，能不能帮我带个包裹到卡拉诺斯的旅馆去？\n\n你应该已经计划在那个旅店里稍作休息了，对吧？我敢说只要你到了旅店，就肯定会想在那里歇一下脚。\n\n无论如何，请把这包裹带给旅馆主人的助手塔诺克·霜锤。我自己是没法活着穿越那危险的通道了，巡山人卫队还得过些天才会经过这儿，所以我只能靠你了。",dEN="Hey! You look like a hearty adventurer. If you're planning on braving the pass, do you suppose you could bring a package to the inn in Kharanos?\n\nYou were planning on stopping at the inn, right? If you make it through the pass, you'll definitely want to take a breather there.\n\nAnyways, bring this to Tannok Frosthammer, the innkeeper's assistant. I can't get through the pass myself, and it'll be days until a Mountaineer escort comes through!",o="给卡拉诺斯的塔诺克·霜锤带去一箱旅店补给品。",oEN="Deliver the Crate of Inn Supplies to Tannok Frosthammer in Kharanos.",p="嗨，$g欢迎:欢迎;！来，坐到火边，喝一大杯麦酒暖暖身子。",pEN="Hi there! Come in, take a seat by the fire and warm yourself with a flagon of ale.",c="啊，终于到了！补给品！我正要开始担心了。自从穴居人占领了山口，我们就很少收到铁砧村的音讯了。\n\n谢谢你把这些带来给我，$n。请你也$g自便:自便;。你旅途之后一定$g累了:累了;。",cEN="Ah, at last, the supplies from Hands! I was beginning to worry. We've had scarce word from Anvilmar ever since the troggs overran the pass.\n\nThanks for bringing this to me, <name>. And please, make yourself comfortable. You must be tired after your journey."}
Q[2161]={d="打扰一下……你能帮帮我吗？\n\n我这里有一大堆食物。我一路上还得对付蝎子、蜘蛛，还有更糟的东西！我把食物带到试炼谷，因为我以为他们需要，我想帮上忙。可他们根本不需要食物！现在我得把它带回剃刀岭，可我又怕路上那些野兽……\n\n你能替我带回去吗？我只是个卑微的苦工，可你是个英雄。你什么都不怕！\n\n把它带给剃刀岭客栈的店主格罗斯克。谢谢你！",dEN="Excuse me? Can you help me?\n\nI have a load of food here. I walked along the road and braved scorpids and spiders and worse! I brought the food to the Valley of Trials because I thought they needed it and I like to help out. But they don't need any food! Now I have to take it back to Razor Hill and I'm afraid of all the beasts along the way...\n\nCan you take it for me? I'm just a peon, but you're a hero. You fear nothing!\n\nTake it to Innkeeper Grosk at the Razor Hill inn. Thank you!",o="把乌克尔的货物交给剃刀岭的旅店老板格罗斯克。",oEN="Bring Ukor's Burden to Innkeeper Grosk in Razor Hill.",p="欢迎来到剃刀岭！",pEN="Welcome to Razor Hill!",c="啊，这就是乌科尔带到试炼谷去的食物。他们不需要？那大概是他们喜欢让受训的英雄们饿着肚子，说是能磨炼意志！\n\n谢谢你送还食物。我会把它放回架子上……不过先让我请你吃点东西！\n\n也别忘了在客栈里休息。你也许是个准备征服世界的勇敢冒险者，但如果精力耗尽，你对自己、对部落都做不了什么。",cEN="Ah, this is the food Ukor brought to the Valley of Trials. Did they not need it? Well, I guess they like to starve you heroes in training. Builds spirit, they say!\n\nThank you for returning the food. I'll stick it back on the shelves... but here, let me offer you some refreshment first!\n\nAnd don't forget to rest here in the inn. You may be a brave <class> ready to take on the world, but if your energy is sapped you won't be doing yourself, or the Horde, much good."}
Q[2178]={d="你闻到那股香味了吗？这是我的秘方，$n——新鲜的长腿蟹肉炖汤。美味极了！\n\n也许你有兴趣学这个菜谱？\n\n在教你之前，你得先证明你能对付那些野兽。\n\n我不指望你出去驯服一只然后骑回来，但如果你能杀掉几只，带些鲜美的肉回来，也许我就会被说服，教你长腿蟹肉炖汤的做法。",dEN="Do you smell that delicious aroma? It's my secret recipe, <name>--fresh strider stew. Delicious!\n\nPerhaps you would be interested in learning the recipe?\n\nBefore I teach you the recipe, you will need to prove that you can handle the beasts.\n\nNow, I don't expect you to go out and tame one and ride it back to me, but if you can kill a few and bring back some of their succulent meat, I may be persuaded to show you the ways of strider stew.",o="给急弯河的奥兰达利亚·夜歌带回5块陆行鸟肉。",oEN="Bring back 5 Strider Meat to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine.",p="锅里一直都空着，我都快饿死了。你怎么去了那么久？",pEN="The pot is empty and I'm hungry! What's taking you so long?",c="妙极了！尝尝看，你觉得味道如何，$n？",cEN="Fantastic! Try it and tell me what you think, <name>!"}
Q[2198]={d="你找到了一条失去光泽的项链，但锈色掩盖不了它精巧而带有魔力的工艺。项链已经破损，底座上似乎缺了三颗宝石。项链背面隐约印着铁炉堡的城徽。徽记下方刻着三个很小的字母：\"TdK\"。\n\n如果这条项链有什么来历，你就得去查清它的出处。也许那个徽记和那三个字母是个起点……",dEN="You have found a tarnished necklace, though the tarnish belies intricate and magical craftsmanship. The necklace has been shattered, as its setting appears to be missing three gems. On the underside of the necklace is the faint imprint of the city seal for Ironforge. Below the seal are three tiny, engraved letters: \"TdK\".\n\nIf there is anything to be gleaned from the necklace, you will need to learn about its origins. Perhaps the seal and the initials are a start...",o="找到破碎的项链的来源，从而了解其潜在的价值。",oEN="Search for the original creator of the shattered necklace to learn of its potential value.",p="你找错人了！我什么都没干过！你没有证据！\n\n等等……你是谁？这个……你在哪里找到这条项链的？",pEN="You've got the wrong gnome, pal! I was never there! You can't prove anything!\n\nWait a second... who are you? What the... where did you find this necklace at?",c="对……我就是制造这条项链的珠宝匠，不过我可没义务免费为你提供谘询服务，听着，伙计，世上没有免费的午餐。如果你想让我帮你的忙，你就得先帮我的忙。",cEN="Yes... I am the jeweler who made this necklace. I also am not in the business of handing out information as though it were free. Information is never free, friend. If I am going to help you out, you need to help ME out first."}
Q[2199]={d="我在铁炉堡可是鼎鼎有名的珠宝匠！好吧，我承认那是以前的我……因为一个竞争对手的污蔑让我变成现在这个样子！名声不好在这行里就根本混不下去。结果，你看，我现在就变得穷困潦倒。\n\n现在，我要你给我搞五块银锭来，这样我才能完成我手头上的这份订单——看来这是我唯一的一份订单了。\n\n你给我五块银锭之后，我就会回答你所有关于这条项链的问题。",dEN="I am a jeweler of great renown here in Ironforge! Well, former renown anyway... I have fallen onto hard times due to the chicanery of a competitor! A bad reputation in this business spells financial disaster. As a result, I find myself without a copper to my good-though-currently-sullied name.\n\nI want you to get me five silver bars to finish an order I received - the first in what seems like an eternity.\n\nYou get me those five silver bars, and I'll answer your questions on the necklace.",o="给铁炉堡的塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔带去五块银锭。",oEN="Bring five silver bars to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.",p="你搞到我要的五块银锭了吗？我会告诉你关于你手里拿着的那条项链的悲惨故事……但一定要等你搞到我要的五块银锭之后！请帮帮我这个可怜的地精吧！",pEN="Have you got the five silver bars I asked for? I will share my sad tale of woe with you concerning the necklace you now possess... but only after I get those bars! Please, help a gnome out, won't ya?",c="在我眼里你人不错；别人怎么说我不管……开玩笑的，开玩笑的！说真的，谢谢你，我的朋友。\n\n你手上这条项链是我最出色的作品之一，但它缺了三颗用来将魔法力量与之绑定的宝石。很久以前我为一个圣骑士打造了它。他自告奋勇要去清理荒芜之地一处叫奥达曼的挖掘场里的\"邪恶污染\"。\n\n结果那位圣骑士死在了奥达曼，而我的麻烦才刚刚开始。",cEN="You're all right in my book; I don't care what everyone else has been saying... I kid, I kid! Seriously, thank you my friend.\n\nNow, the necklace you have is one of my finest creations, but it is missing three gems that help bind magic power to it. I crafted it for a paladin some time ago. He was on a self-appointed quest to clear out the \"evil taint\" present at an excavation site in the Badlands called Uldaman.\n\nWell... that paladin died in Uldaman, and that was just the beginning of my woes."}
Q[2200]={d="一个竞争对手散布谣言，说我的项链给那位圣骑士带来了诅咒。不用说，没人愿意从珠宝商那里买受诅咒的东西。\n\n$n，我们做个交易——找到那些宝石，我就把项链重新装配好，前提是你得替我做宣传，说我做的绝不是受诅咒的东西！\n\n去奥达曼找找线索；也许那圣骑士的尸身就在下面，毕竟我们知道最后是他拿着它！等你找到宝石，就用这个；它能让你在铁炉堡这里联系上我。",dEN="A competitor of mine started a rumor that my necklace cursed the paladin. Needless to say, no one wants to buy cursed items from a jeweler.\n\n<name>, I'll make you a deal - find the gems and I'll reassemble the necklace, so long as you'll advertise that I do NOT make cursed items!\n\nTry looking for clues in Uldaman; maybe see if the paladin's body is down there, since he's the one who we know had it last! When you find the gems you should use this; it'll allow you to contact me here in Ironforge.",o="去奥达曼寻找塔瓦斯的魔法项链，被杀的圣骑士是最后一个拿着它的人。",oEN="Search for clues as to the current disposition of Talvash's necklace within Uldaman. The slain paladin he mentioned was the person who had it last.",c="通过阅读日记，你了解到圣骑士经过很大的努力最终找到了所有三块宝石的下落：\n\n暗炉矮人正在为奥达曼的控制权而与穴居人展开激烈的战斗，所以他们把红宝石藏在了重兵设防的区域。\n\n穴居人把黄宝石藏在了靠近联盟矮人区域的一个瓦罐中。\n\n最后的一块蓝宝石就在穴居人的首领手中。",cEN="Remains of a paladin: Reading the journal reveals that after much effort, the paladin had identified the location of all three missing gems:\n\nThe Shadowforge dwarves hid the ruby in their barricaded area as they battled the Troggs for control of Uldaman.\n\nThe troggs stashed the topaz in an urn located near some unusual inhabitants of Uldaman - Alliance dwarves!\n\nFinally, the trogg elder himself took the sapphire as his own."}
Q[2201]={d="从这个圣骑士的日记上看，只有奥达曼才有可能是项链上的那三块宝石的所在地。如果日记的描述还算准确的话，在奥达曼里有大量的暗炉矮人和石腭怪在活动。\n\n知道了这些信息之后，对宝石的搜索行动就可以开始了。当你收集到所有的宝石之后，通过塔瓦斯德的占卜之瓶和他联系来获取下一步的指示。",dEN="The paladin's journal has provided perhaps the only clues that Uldaman will yield as to the location of the necklace's gems. If the paladin's scribing remains accurate, then the Shadowforge dwarves and the troggs that vie for control of the dig site will need to be dealt with.\n\nArmed with this knowledge, the search for the gems begins in earnest. When all the gems have been acquired, Talvash in Ironforge should be notified via the Phial of Scrying as per his instructions.",o="找到散落在奥达曼各处的红宝石、蓝宝石和黄玉。拿到之后，用他之前给你的占卜水瓶远程联系塔尔瓦什·德尔·基塞尔。\n\n从日记中你得知……\n* 红宝石被藏在一处设了路障的暗炉区域。\n* 黄玉被藏在一只瓮中，位于某个穴居人区域，靠近一些联盟矮人。\n\n* 蓝宝石被穴居人首领格里姆洛克据为己有，这也是他自己承认的。",oEN="Find the ruby, sapphire, and topaz that are scattered throughout Uldaman. Once acquired, contact Talvash del Kissel remotely by using the Phial of Scrying he previously gave you.\n\nFrom the journal, you know...\n* The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area.\n* The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.\n\n* The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",p="塔尔瓦什的影像在占卜碗的水面上浮现。\n\n\"哇，你还活着！你找到我的宝石了吗？你真是$g我盼望的:我盼望的;那位挽救我名声的救星吗？求你别告诉我，你白白浪费了一次水瓶充能就为了闲聊……那玩意儿可不便宜，而且老实说我的经济状况实在不怎么样。\"",pEN="Talvash's image comes into focus from the waters of the scrying bowl.\n\n\"Wow, you're still alive! Did you manage to find the gems? Are you truly the savior of my reputation I have hoped for? Please tell me you didn't waste a charge on the phial just to chat; those things are NOT cheap, and I'm already in dire financial strai",c="没错，就是这三颗宝石。干得好！可惜，你的活儿还没完。\n\n不，我不是想耍你，傻法师。这是为了做出有品质的魔法珠宝——塔尔瓦什·德尔·基塞尔级别的珠宝！你需要一个强大的能量源来给它点劲头。嗯，那条项链本身已经没有劲头可给了。",cEN="Yep, those indeed are the three gems. Good job! Unfortunately, your work isn't quite over just yet.\n\nNo, I'm not trying to pull a fast one here, silly <class>. This is about making magic jewelry - Talvash del Kissel quality-level jewelry! You need a strong power source to give it some oomph. Well, that necklace has no more oomph to give."}
Q[2202]={d="我最近听说了一种新发现的植物，叫做品红真菌帽。它们成簇生长在奥达曼挖掘场，在早期的隧道和鲜有人探索的深处都能找到。我想研究它们在炼金术上的潜在用途，这就需要你帮忙了。\n\n找到品红菌帽丛，给我带一打菌帽回来。注意，这些菌丛受到惊扰时会喷出毒孢子。\n\n替我办成这件事，我就为你调制一批我著名的恢复药剂！",dEN="I've heard about a newly discovered plant called the magenta fungus caps. They grow in clusters at the Uldaman dig site and can be found in the early tunnels and deep within the less-explored areas. I want to study their potential use in alchemy, and that's where you come in.\n\nFind the magenta cap clusters and bring me a dozen caps. Be warned, the clusters may spew out poison spores if jostled.\n\nDo this for me, and I'll whip up a batch of one of my famous restorative elixirs for you!",o="收集12颗紫色蘑菇，把它们交给卡加斯的加卡尔。",oEN="Bring 12 Magenta Fungus Caps to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath.",p="你拿到我需要的紫色蘑菇了吗？找不到我要的东西，我可不会付给你报酬的！",pEN="Have you obtained the magenta fungus caps I need for my alchemical work? No caps - no reward!",c="干得好，$n，你再一次证明了自己的价值！这种蘑菇是研究炼金术的上好材料！\n\n现在……来尝尝我收藏多年的陈年好酒吧！\n\n如果你是个有经验的炼金师，那我们还可以继续进行合作。不管怎么样，我要再次感谢你对我的帮助。",cEN="Well done <name>, you've proven your worth once again! The caps will be an interesting study, you betcha.\n\nAnd now, as promised, enjoy a taste of one of my more potent restorative brews from my personal stock...\n\nIf you are a skilled alchemist, then perhaps we might have some additional business to conduct. Regardless, I thank you for your assistance!"}
Q[2203]={d="$c，你帮我了大忙了。我愿意与你分享你曾经品尝过的那种佳酿的配方……但我还要你去完成一项相当危险的任务。仔细听好我的要求。\n\n这只有锁的箱子里面装着三个空的魔瓶，它们被赋予了一种能够汲干烈焰守护者血液的魔法能量，用魔瓶收集烈焰守护者的血液是非常危险的，所以请多加小心。当你装满了三个瓶子之后，就把它们交给我。\n\n快去吧，你离那个配方只有一步之遥了。",dEN="You have been most helpful to me, <class>. I would reward you with the very recipe for the brew I gave you earlier... but I would ask of you a task that is quite dangerous. Hear my request.\n\nThis lockbox contains three empty thaumaturgy vessels; they are imbued with an attunement aura that will drain the blood of a scorched guardian dragon. Using one on the beast will anger it greatly, so be warned. Once you have all three filled, bring them to me.\n\nDo this, and the recipe will be yours.",o="用空的魔瓶吸收荒芜之地的烈焰守护者的血液。装满所有瓶子之后，把它们交给卡加斯的加卡尔。",oEN="Use the empty thaumaturgy vessels on scorched guardian dragons found in the Badlands. Once you have them filled, bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath.",p="你用那些容器帮我弄到所需要的焦灼守护巨龙之血了吗？是的，我知道这任务很危险……但我那恢复饮料的配方就等着你成功了。风险与回报，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;……风险与回报……",pEN="Have you used the vessels to get me the scorched guardian dragon blood I need? Yes, I know it is a dangerous task... but the recipe for my restorative brew awaits your success. Risk and reward, my friend... risk and reward...",c="我以一个炼金师的身份向你致敬。拿着这个配方吧，它会对你大有帮助的。愿它带给你的成功与回报像它这些年来带给我的一样多。",cEN="From one alchemist to another, I salute you. Here, take this recipe and commit it to your knowledge. May it bring you the success and rewards that it has brought me over the years."}
Q[2204]={d="你得给那条项链找点\"劲头\"，而奥达曼大概是最合适的地方。我猜那里面有很多构造体到处跑，对吧？那么，挑出那里最大、最凶的一个构造体，把它的能量源取出来！我相当确定我能把那个能量源熔进项链里。\n\n没有那个能量源，就不可能修复项链。拿到之后回铁炉堡找我，我们就能把它给你修好！",dEN="You are going to need to find some \"oomph\" for the necklace, and Uldaman is probably the best place for it, actually. I guess there are a lot of constructs running around in there, yeah? Well, take out the biggest, baddest construct in that place and grab its power source! I am pretty sure I can fuse that source into the necklace.\n\nWithout that power source, fixing the necklace will be impossible. Come back to me here to Ironforge when you have it, and we'll get it all fixed up for you!",o="从奥达曼最强大的石人身上获得能量源，然后将其交给铁炉堡的塔瓦斯德。",oEN="Obtain a power source from the most powerful construct you can find in Uldaman, and deliver it to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.",p="看得出你是马不停蹄地从奥达曼赶回来的。你回到这里应该不只是为了抱怨那个地城的气味有多让人讨厌吧？好了，希望你给我带回来的是好消息。\n\n你找到修复项链所需的能量源了吗？",pEN="You didn't even stop to tidy yourself up after leaving Uldaman, did you. You just came straight here, lingering dungeon odors be damned. Well, let's hope this visit is merely an odiferous one, and not a useless one to boot.\n\nDo you have the power source for the necklace?",c="哎呀——真高兴看到你和这个能量源都完好无损。既然宝石已经归位，我需要一点时间把能量源用魔法与项链融合。不过一旦完成，这条项链就归你了！\n\n你$g很激动:很激动;，对吧？ anticipation 得浑身发麻？我把那个法术媒介放哪儿了……",cEN="Well I'll be - I sure am glad to see you and this power source in one piece. It will take me a moment to magically fuse the power source with the necklace now that the gems have been reunited with it. Once it is done, however, the necklace will be yours!\n\nYou're excited, aren't you? All tingly with anticipation? Now where did I put that spell focus at..."}
Q[2205]={d="那枚徽章？哦，没什么，小鱼儿。至少不是你处理得了的事。看你这副样子，我敢说马蒂亚斯与其把你当成$g像样的潜行者:像样的潜行者;，还不如把你当成给奶酪店跑腿的$g小男孩:小女孩;。再说，这活儿是派给我的，也是我答应了要办成的。\n\n说到这个……把这个包裹送给马蒂亚斯，他也许会给你一两件小任务。\n\n快去吧。|n",dEN="The badge? Oh, it's nothing, fish - nothing you could handle anyhow. By the looks of you, I'd say Mathias is likely to mistake you for the cheese delivery <boy/girl> instead of a proper rogue. Regardless, I've been assigned a job and I've made a promise to deliver on that job.\n\nSpeaking of which, deliver this package to Mathias and he may give you a small task or two.\n\nGet cracking.",o="把科瑞恩·塞尔留斯的包裹带给暴风城兵营的马迪亚斯·肖尔。",oEN="Deliver Keryn Sylvius's package to Master Mathias Shaw at the Stormwind Barracks.",p="有事吗，$c？",pEN="Can I help you, <class>?",c="你找到我了——看你这个样子，我就知道接下来将要交给你的任务对你来说会很有压力，无论是精神上还是肉体上。\n\n那么，你是想让雷吉克指给你去旅店的路呢，还是准备要做些正事了？",cEN="You found me - and by looking at you, I'd say the run and subsequent search may have been a great strain on your system, both mentally and physically.\n\nWould you like Renzik to show you the way to an inn or are you ready for some work?"}
Q[2206]={d="我们在外勤的人报告说，金镇以南有大量迪菲亚活动。报告显示迪菲亚已经占据了杰罗德码头，如今利用它从赤脊山向西部荒野大量走私违禁品。\n\n我需要你潜入码头小屋，把那份货运时刻表给我弄来，$n。它很可能藏在码头管理员的深口袋里。\n\n……还有，$n，如果你被发现，军情七处将否认知道你的存在。",dEN="Our operatives in the field are reporting heavy Defias activity south of Goldshire. The reports indicate that the Defias have taken over Jerod's Landing and are now using it as a way to smuggle large quantities of contraband from Redridge to Westfall.\n\nI need you to infiltrate the dock house and get me that shipping schedule, <name>. You will probably find it buried deep in the pockets of the Dockmaster.\n\n...and <name>, should you be discovered, SI:7 will disavow all knowledge of your existence.",o="找到迪菲亚码头主管，从他那里为马迪亚斯·肖尔拿到迪菲亚船运时间表。",oEN="Find the Defias Dockmaster and recover the Shipping Schedule for Master Mathias Shaw.",p="你在营房里闲晃的每一刻，你的死期都在逼近，$c。",pEN="Your mortality wanes with every moment you waste loitering in the barracks, <class>.",c="我很惊讶……惊讶凯琳终于找到一个或许具备$g合格:合格;$c潜质的$g新人:新人;。拿上这把剑，$n。总有一天你会再次被召唤，为军情七处效力。磨炼你的技艺，睁大你的眼睛，保持刀刃锋利。\n\n你不会看到我们到来，但等我们到时你会感觉得到……",cEN="I am astonished... Astonished that Keryn finally found a recruit that could possibly have the makings of a proper <class>. Take this blade, <name>. A day will come when you will be called upon again to serve the SI:7. Hone your skills, keep your eyes open and that blade sharp.\n\nYou won't see us coming but you'll feel it when we get there..."}
Q[2218]={d="又一个寻求指引的迷途灵魂，嗯？我猜你想在这辈子找到个目标……你自己的目标。这我见过上千次了，英雄最后都得找活干。\n\n好吧，今天是你走运的日子。霍格拉尔有治你这毛病的方子。\n\n你该这么做：沿这条路去铁炉堡，找到被遗弃的洞穴。到了那里，找到盗贼公会，跟胡尔夫丹·黑须谈谈。他会给你指一条救赎之路。|n",dEN="Another lost soul looking for guidance, eh? I suppose you want to find a purpose - your purpose. I've seen it a thousand times, another hero looking for work.\n\nWell, today's your lucky day, friend. Hogral's got the cure for your ailment.\n\nHere's what you do: Take this road here up to Ironforge and make your way to the Forlorn Cavern. Once there, locate the thieves' guild and speak with Hulfdan Blackbeard. He'll put you on the road to salvation.",o="和铁炉堡的霍夫丹·黑须谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge.",c="所以你认为自己是个不折不扣的恶棍？注定要成为黑须选中的少数人之一——隐秘之环的干部？\n\n只有自以为是的废物才会这么高看自己。\n\n那正是我们要找的人！$g欢迎:欢迎;上船，$n！",cEN="So ye think yer a right scoundrel? Destined to be one o' Blackbeard's chosen few - an officer o' the Hidden Circle?\n\nOnly a good fer nothin' scallywag would think so highly o' hisself.\n\nThat's exactly what we be lookin' fer! Welcome aboard, <name>!"}
Q[2238]={d="你知道，国王抢走了采集矿石宝物的机会，那些财富……矮人活十辈子也挣不到。\n\n我们在铁炉堡那里有些关系，$n，很有价值的关系，你懂吧？\n\n国王应该把他的财宝拿出来和我们分享，不过我们不想让那老家伙知道他正在和我们分享——你懂我的意思吧。\n\n你到诺莫瑞根附近去和奥宁·雨锤谈一谈，然后回来跟我报告。那个狡猾的矮人混迹在一群麻疯侏儒当中，你要小心点。",dEN="Ye see, the King be strip mining the quarry fer ore and gems. More riches than any one dwarf should see in ten lifetimes.\n\nThe Hidden Circle has values, <name>. We value valuables. Can ye understand?\n\nNow we feels the King should be sharing some of that booty, but we don't want ol' 'Stinkbeard' to know he's sharin' - if ye catch me drift.\n\nWe needs ye to speak with Onin MacHammar over by Gnomeregan and bring back a report. The crafty dwarf has hidden hisself amongst the lepers. Be careful.",o="在诺莫瑞根附近找到奥宁·雨锤。",oEN="Find Onin MacHammar by Gnomeregan.",c="嘘！声音轻点，你这个笨蛋！他们会听见的。",cEN="Shhhh! Keep it down you daft fool. They'll hear us."}
Q[2239]={d="采石场？是啊，我几乎每天都看到那些 monstrous 的重型装甲蒸汽坦克经过这个岗哨。\n\n我在东边的线人说，坦克从铁炉堡出发，在戈尔博拉采石场装货，到卡兰诺斯加油，然后不知出于什么该死的原因，绕远路经过诺莫瑞根，最后才回铁炉堡卸货。\n\n全都写在报告里了，$r。把它带回给胡尔夫丹，好让他规划下一步。|n",dEN="The Quarry? Yap, I see those monstrous armored steam tanks come by this post near every day.\n\nMy contacts to the east tell me that the tank starts off at Ironforge, makes a pickup at the Gol'Bolar Quarry, stops over at Kharanos to refuel and then for some blasted reason, it takes the long way around past Gnomeregan, before reaching Ironforge to drop off the shipment.\n\nIt's all in the report, <race>. Take it back to Hulfdan so he can plan the next step.",o="把奥宁的报告交给铁炉堡的霍夫丹。",oEN="Take Onin's Report back to Hulfdan in Ironforge.",p="你有没有喜欢闻那些麻疯地精的恶臭？我随便问问而已，因为我看见你脸上露出了疯狂的笑容。\n\n你从奥宁那里带回了什么消息？",pEN="Did ye enjoy the stench of leper gnome? I only ask because ye got a crazy smile on yer face.\n\nWhat news do ye bring from Onin?",c="绕远路？以我自己这把胡子发誓！\n\n你干得不错，$n。拿上这把匕首走吧。等第三步准备启动时，隐秘之环会再召唤你。\n\n第三步是什么？它紧接在第二步之后——就是我把靴子踹到你屁股上。\n\n$g有兴趣:有兴趣;吗？",cEN="Long route? In the name o' me own beard!\n\nYe done good, <name>. Take this dagger and be gone with ye. The Circle will call upon ye again when step three be ready to be set into motion.\n\nWhat's step three? It comes right after step two - me putting me boot up yer backside.\n\nInterested?"}
Q[2240]={d="现在我手头有个任务。\n\n我们要找到一间被称作卡兹穆尔大厅的密室。问题是这个房间在一扇巨大的门后面，而那扇门被锁住了！幸运的是，我知道如何打开它。\n\n我把所有东西都写在我的日记里了，就在这个台子上。我的队伍现在被困在这里……所以呢，$n，你必须为我们找到卡兹穆尔大厅！\n\n阅读我的日记，探索那间密室，然后向铁炉堡探险者协会的勘察员塔伯斯·雷矛汇报。",dEN="Now for the task at hand.\n\nThere is a secret chamber, the Chamber of Khaz'mul, that must be explored. The problem is that the chamber's behind a huge, locked door! It's a lucky thing I know how to open it.\n\nI've described everything in my journal, here on the table. My band and I are stuck here for now... so you, <name>, must find the chamber of Khaz'mul for us!\n\nRead my journal, explore the chamber, then report to Prospector Stormpike at the Explorers' League in Ironforge.",o="阅读巴尔洛戈的日记，探索密室，然后向铁炉堡的勘察员塔伯斯·雷矛汇报。",oEN="Read Baelog's Journal, explore the hidden chamber, then report to Prospector Stormpike.",p="你有什么要报告的吗？",pEN="Do you have something to report?",c="你找到卡兹莫尔大厅了？真是太惊人了！巴尔洛戈认为它确实存在，但是我承认我当初并不是十分相信他。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你的发现将会促使我们的领袖重新考虑夺回奥达曼的计划。如果铁炉堡重新控制奥达曼的话，那卡兹莫尔大厅的秘密就是我们的了！",cEN="You have seen the Chamber of Khaz'mul? Amazing! Baelog was sure it existed, but I must admit that I had my doubts.\n\nThank you, <name>. With luck your finding will incite our leaders to renew their efforts to retake Uldaman. And if it is ever again under Ironforge control, then the secrets of the Chamber of Khaz'mul will be ours!"}
Q[2241]={d="他们说我\"为爱痴狂\"，随他们什么意思吧。\n\n没错，我醒着的每一刻都在想西尔娜。没错，我家里挂满了西尔娜的画像和图。没错，我常常好几天不吃不喝不睡，为我们本可以拥有的爱情哀叹。这有什么不对吗？\n\n可现在她不肯见我！见我！我试过给她送信，但她除了潜行者，谁都不肯搭理。\n\n你能替我把这朵花送给她吗？别忘了告诉她这是詹诺克送的。",dEN="They say I'm 'lovestruck,' whatever that means.\n\nSure, I spend my every waking moment thinking about Syurna. Sure, my home is full of paintings and drawings of Syurna. Sure, I often go days without eating, sleeping, or drinking, while I lament about the love we could have had. Is that so wrong?\n\nNow she won't see me! ME! I've tried sending her messages but she won't even talk to another person unless they are a rogue.\n\nCould you deliver this flower to her? Don't forget to tell her it's from Jannok.",o="把詹诺克的玫瑰带给达纳苏斯的塞尤娜。",oEN="Take Jannok's Rose to Syurna in Darnassus.",p="啊，这难道不是很美妙吗？你已经为你的葬礼买好了鲜花。",pEN="Oh, isn't this wonderful. You've brought flowers for your own funeral.",c="要是那个蠢货詹诺克送我的花我都留着，我早就有本钱开家店了。不过话说回来，詹诺克最新派的这个信使看来还能派上用场。$g想找点活干吗:想找点活干吗;，$c？",cEN="Had I saved every flower that dolt, Jannok, had sent me, I would have had the means to open a shop. Regardless, it seems as if Jannok's latest courier may prove to be useful.\n\nInterested in some work, <class>?"}
Q[2242]={d="我们相信有一个存在也许能帮我们弄清泰达希尔森林里正在发生什么。可惜，让那个生物合作的所有尝试都以灾难告终。\n\n他藏在神谕林地郊外的一根树枝上。迄今为止，所有接近那个萨特的人，无论用武力还是外交，都死于非命。也许潜行才是答案，$n。\n\n把上古者塞瑟尔随身包裹里的东西弄到手，然后回来向我报告。|n",dEN="We believe there is one being that may be able to help us understand what is happening to the forests of Teldrassil. Unfortunately, getting the creature to cooperate has proven disastrous.\n\nHe hides on a branch at the outskirts of the Oracle Glade. All who have so far approached the satyr, whether through force or diplomacy, have met with doom. Perhaps stealth is the answer, <name>.\n\nFind what Sethir the Ancient carries in his packs and report back to me.",o="找到上古者塞瑟尔，把你发现的任何线索带回来给西尔娜。|n",oEN="Find Sethir the Ancient and bring back any clues that you may discover to Syurna.",p="你有关于塞希尔的事情要报告吗，$n？",pEN="Have you anything to report from Sethir the Ancient, <name>?",c="这是个悲惨的消息，$n。蔓延于黑海岸一带的森林与河流的疾病似乎已经开始侵袭我们的家园了。\n\n你做得很好，但这儿已经没有什么你能做的事情了。拿着这把匕首吧，这是你为泰达希尔效力所得到的报酬。",cEN="This is grim news, <name>. It would seem that the sickness which has gripped the forests and rivers of Darkshore has begun to taint our home.\n\nYou have served us well, but there is nothing more you can do here. Take this blade as a reward for your service to Teldrassil."}
Q[2258]={d="$n，如果你愿意帮忙，我正好需要协助。我是个小有名气的炼金师，需要你帮我弄些荒芜之地产的材料。\n\n我需要以下物品来补充库存：5 个秃鹫砂囊、10 颗峭壁土狼獠牙和 5 块岩石元素碎片。当然，你可以直接从那些小动物身上弄到；如果你不是好斗的那类人，就找几个能打的朋友一起去。\n\n替我弄到这些东西，你口袋里就能多几枚金币。你觉得怎么样？干不干？",dEN="<name>, I could use your aid if you're up for it. I am an alchemist of some note, and I seek your aid in acquiring some reagents found out in the Badlands.\n\nI need the following items to replenish my stocks: five buzzard gizzards, ten crag coyote fangs, and five rock elemental shards. Obviously, you can get them off of the beasties themselves; if you're not the fighting type, then find friends who are.\n\nAcquire these items for me, you'll get some coin out of the deal. Watcha wanna do?",o="前往荒芜之地取回加卡尔需要的试剂，然后回到卡加斯把试剂交给他。",oEN="Bring 5 Buzzard Gizzards, 10 Crag Coyote Fangs, and 5 Rock Elemental Shards to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, Badlands.",p="你找到我需要的东西了吗？除非你帮我弄来那些东西，否则你得不到任何报酬。",pEN="Have you gotten the things I need yet? You won't get paid unless you bring me those reagents.",c="啊，干得好！这些至少够我用上一阵子了。这是说好的报酬。\n\n如果你有兴趣，我还需要些别的材料。不过这些只在奥达曼挖掘场深处才能找到。不容易弄到，但如果你愿意再帮我一次，我会让它值得你跑这一趟。\n\n也许不只是几枚闪亮的金币，如何？",cEN="Ah, well done! These should last me for a little while, at least. Here is your pay as promised.\n\nIf you're interested, I have some more reagents I could use. These, however, are only found in the depths of the Uldaman excavation. They will not be easy to get, but I will make it worth your while if you are interested in helping me again.\n\nPerhaps something more than some shiny coins, yes?"}
Q[2259]={d="别担心，$n，我不是要把你送去见塞尤娜。艾瑞安正在塞纳里奥区等你，快点吧！",dEN="Do not worry, <name>, I am not sending you to see Syurna. Erion requires your presence at the Cenarion Enclave. Make haste!",o="联系达纳苏斯的埃里昂·影语。|n",oEN="Contact Erion Shadewhisper in Darnassus.",c="是时候拓展一下了，$r——世界在等着你。",cEN="It is time to branch out, <race> - the world awaits."}
Q[2260]={d="\"你的事迹已传得很远，$n。远到暴风城情报处点名要找你。\n\n这趟旅程艰辛且不无危险，但在军情七处受训的机会不该被轻视。\n\n一个新世界在等着你，$n。前往暴风城旧城区，到军情七处总部与雷恩齐克·\"尖刀\"谈谈。",dEN="Word of your deeds has spread far and wide, <name>. So far, in fact, that Stormwind Intelligence has asked for you by name.\n\nThe journey is taxing and not without peril, but an opportunity to train under SI:7 should not be taken lightly.\n\nA new world awaits you, <name>. Make your way to Old Town in Stormwind and speak with Renzik \"The Shiv\" at SI:7 headquarters.",o="前往暴风城，找雷恩齐克·\"尖刀\"商议。",oEN="Travel to Stormwind City and seek council with Renzik \"The Shiv.\"",c="你响应了军情七处的召唤，$n，从遥远的海岸赶来加入我们的行列，不过你还有很多要学。",cEN="You have answered SI:7's calling, <name> and journeyed from distant shores to join our ranks, however, there is much for you to learn."}
Q[2278]={d="这间宝库的中央是四个巨大的白金圆盘，每个都饰有许多来历不明的印记。触碰它们时，你的手会一阵发麻。刚触碰完圆盘，一个巨大的石头守护者的影像便显现出来。\n\n\"致敬。我是知识的看守者。造物主对土灵的整合已被记录，并为本世界存储于诺甘农圆盘之中。\"\n\n你刚刚发现了一处前人从未发现的知识源泉！",dEN="The centerpieces of this treasure chamber are four huge platinum discs, each adorned with numerous sigils of an unknown origin. Touching them makes your hand tingle. Just after touching the discs, the visage of a large stone watcher springs forth.\n\n\"Salutations. I am a keeper of knowledge. The Creators' synthesis of the Earthen has been chronicled and stored here for this world in the Discs of Norgannon.\"\n\nYou have uncovered a wealth of previously undiscovered worldly lore!",o="和石头守护者交谈，从他那里了解更多古代的知识。一旦你了解到了所有的内容之后就激活诺甘农圆盘。",oEN="Speak with stone watcher and learn what ancient lore it keeps. Once you have learned what lore it has to offer, activate the Discs of Norgannon.",p="石头守护者的声音仿佛在你体内回响：\n\n\"你必须先满足诺甘农圆盘的数据同化前提；一旦满足这一要求，你便获准获取所存数据的便携版本。请务必先完整查阅此库中的信息。\"",pEN="The voice of the stone watcher seems to resonate within your very inner being:\n\n\"You must first satisfy the data assimilation prerequisite of Discs of Norgannon; once you fulfill this requirement, you will then be permitted to obtain a portable version of the stored data. Please be sure you have fully explored the information within this repository first.\"",c="按照石头守护者的指示，在你已经了解了土灵、穴居人和矮人的历史之后，你再次访问诺甘农圆盘。圆盘内部传来一声低微的嗡鸣。随后，石头守护者再次开口：\n\n\"圆盘已完成整合。再次访问诺甘农圆盘，即可获得你的个人副本。\"",cEN="Following the instructions of the stone watcher, you once again access the Discs of Norgannon now that you have learned about the history of the Earthen, the troggs, and the dwarves. A faint, brief hum is heard from within the discs. The stone watcher then speaks:\n\n\"The discs have now been synthesized. Access the Discs of Norgannon once more to receive your personal copy.\""}
Q[2279]={d="再次触及诺甘农圆盘让你的手感受到了又一次的震颤。这一次从圆盘传出了一种奇怪的研磨声。\n\n你的背包忽然沉了一下。打开背包之后，你发现了一张迷你版的圆盘！\n\n毫无疑问，在任何对艾泽拉斯大陆历史感兴趣的人手中，这张圆盘都绝对是无价之宝。铁炉堡的探险者协会是一个非常有名的探险团体，也许他们能好好利用这张圆盘。",dEN="Touching the Discs of Norgannon once again makes your hand tingle. This time, however, a strange grinding noise is heard from inside the discs.\n\nYour backpack suddenly becomes heavier than it was before. Inside, you discover a miniature version of the discs!\n\nNo doubt, an item of this sort would be invaluable for someone interested in the ancient history of Azeroth. The Explorers' League in Ironforge is such a group, known throughout the Alliance; perhaps they can make good use of it.",o="把迷你版的诺甘农圆盘带到铁炉堡的探险者协会去。",oEN="Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the Explorers' League in Ironforge.",p="你好，我能帮你什么忙坏吗？我现在真的很忙。但是如果你有什么重要的新闻，那我愿意洗耳恭听！",pEN="Yes, may I help you with something? I assure you I am a very busy right now. If it is grave importance to the Explorers' League, however, then I am all ears!",c="你手上那是什么……天哪。你在哪儿找到的？\n\n不，真的？\n\n你跟谁说了什么？\n\n不，真的吗？！\n\n我$g出色:出色;的$c，你也许刚刚做出了本年度最重大的考古发现！神明在上，我在说什么年度——是本世纪最重大的发现！如果这些圆盘是我想的那样，那这可能就是我们一直在找的那把关键钥匙！这或许能一劳永逸地证明矮人附魔造物的正统性！",cEN="What do you have there... oh my. You found this where?\n\nNo, really?\n\nYou spoke to whom about what?\n\nNO, REALLY?!\n\nMy fine <class>, you may have just made the archaeological find of the year! By the Gods who am I kidding, the find of the century! If these discs are what I think them to be, then this could be the very key we have been looking for! This may well prove outright once and for all the legitimacy of the Dwarves' enchanted creation!"}
Q[2280]={d="再次触及诺甘农圆盘让你的手感受到了又一次的震颤。这一次从圆盘传出了一种奇怪的研磨声。\n\n你的背包忽然沉了一下。打开背包之后，你发现了一张迷你版的圆盘！\n\n毫无疑问，在任何对艾泽拉斯大陆历史感兴趣的人手中，这张圆盘都绝对是无价之宝。雷霆崖的先知们对历史知识的了解程度享誉整个部落，也许他们能好好利用这张圆盘。",dEN="Touching the Discs of Norgannon once again makes your hand tingle. This time, however, a strange grinding noise is heard from inside the discs.\n\nYour backpack suddenly becomes heavier than it was before. Inside, you discover a miniature version of the discs!\n\nNo doubt, an item of this sort would be invaluable for someone interested in the ancient history of Azeroth. The sages of Thunder Bluff are such historians, known throughout the Horde; perhaps they can make good use of it.",o="把迷你版的诺甘农圆盘带到雷霆崖的贤者那里。",oEN="Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the one of the sages in Thunder Bluff.",p="没错，年轻的$r，我看得出你是带着坚定的决心经过长途跋涉才来到我这里的。你来找我应该是有什么对整个部落来说都很重要的事情吧？或者你是想要从我这里了解一个重大的秘密？",pEN="Yes young one, I see you marching into my tent with intensity in your stride... with determination in your purpose. You seek my counsel is some matter of grave importance to the Horde? Perhaps you wish a mystery of the universe revealed to you?",c="这些是什么东西？\n\n太让人惊奇了，年轻的$r！我从这些圆盘中感受到了被深藏许久的秘密。你做了一件明智的事情。",cEN="What are these here then?\n\nImpressive, young one! These discs, in them I sense secrets that the earth has held on to tightly for many years. You were very wise to bring them here to me."}
Q[2281]={d="现在就把你派出去等于让你去自杀，雷吉克可不想再让哪个初出茅庐的潜行者平白挂掉。不过你也别着急，$n。雷吉克要先培养你的能力。\n\n现在你就动身去赤脊山，和一个名叫卢修斯的军情七处联络员谈一谈吧。他就在湖畔镇的码头附近，和其他一些游手好闲的家伙整天搅在一起。",dEN="Sending you out in the field now would be suicide. Renzik doesn't need another dead rogue on his hands. Don't fret, though, <name> - Renzik is going to get you up to speed.\n\nMake your way to the Redridge Mountains and speak with an associate of SI:7 named Lucius. You will find him hanging around the docks of Lakeshire with the other shady good-for-nothings.",o="到赤脊山的湖畔镇去和卢修斯谈一谈。",oEN="Venture forth to Lakeshire in the Redridge Mountains and speak with Lucius.",c="啊，你的手指有点粗，是吧？别担心，$n，我把很多比你更没用的小偷都变成了成功的盗贼。",cEN="Ah, so your fingers are a little fat, eh? Don't worry, <name>, I've turned more useless thieves than you into accomplished rogues."}
Q[2282]={d="多年以来，我们都在这里对潜行者进行训练！毕竟不是每一个潜行者都能像老卢修斯那样机灵和优雅的。\n\n沿着这条路向前走，一直到奥瑟尔伐木场去。我在那里放了一只装着重要物品的箱子。去把箱子里的东西给我拿来，我就给你颁发偷窃技能认证书！",dEN="We've been training thieves here for years! After all, not every rapscallion is born with the grace and finesse of old Lucius.\n\nUp off the road here you'll find Alther's Mill. I got a chest up there with something important inside. Go get it for me! Bring back that token and you'll receive your Certificate of Thievery!",o="打开卢修斯的箱子，拿到偷窃技能证明物，然后把它归还给湖畔镇的卢修斯。",oEN="Open Lucius's Lockbox, recover the Token of Thievery and return it to Lucius in Lakeshire.",p="我没有和你提过那座磨坊附近有兽人吗？\n\n我听说那些兽人就在周围的山上活动。",pEN="Did I forget to mention the orcs?\n\nI hear they have been nosing around up by the mill.",c="你打开箱子了？干得好，$n。\n\n那么，从今往后，即使你死了，我也不会感到内疚，因为那是因为你自己太愚蠢而不是经验不足造成的。",cEN="Cracked it open, did you? Nice work, <name>.\n\nIf you die now, we can rest easy knowing it was due to your own stupidity and not inexperience."}
Q[2283]={d="我们有工作要交给你做，不过能否完成要看你有没有胆子！\n\n在荒芜之地的深处有一个名叫奥达曼的挖掘场，我们最近听说有个没脑子的圣骑士在里面挂了。我之所以如此关心这个问题是因为那蠢货身上带着一条非常珍贵的项链，项链上有三块大宝石：一块红宝石，一块蓝宝石和一块黄宝石。\n\n现在的问题是，我们需要它，而且我们会付给完成这个任务的人最丰厚的报酬。也许那条项链已经受到了损坏，但是不管怎么样，只要你把它带给我们，就总是会有办法修好它。",dEN="We've got work for you, that is if you've got the guts to do it!\n\nDeep in the Badlands is the Uldaman dig site. We've heard a tale about some idiot paladin who died there recently. Why we even care is that he had a very valuable necklace on him. It's supposedly got three large gems: a ruby, a sapphire, and a topaz.\n\nThe shot: we want it, and we're payin' TOP SILVER to get it. It may be damaged, but that's neither here nor there; we'll fix whatever scratches are on it.",o="在奥达曼挖掘场中寻找一条珍贵的项链，然后将其交给奥格瑞玛的德兰·杜佛斯。项链有可能已经损坏。",oEN="Look for a valuable necklace within the Uldaman dig site and bring it back to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar. The necklace may be damaged.",p="怎么样，拿到项链了吗？如果你拿不出项链，那就一个铜板都别想拿到！",pEN="Well, do you have the necklace? You won't see a copper from us if you don't have that necklace!",c="嗯，就是它了！在你还没到我这里的时候我就嗅到项链的味道啦！现在让我来欣赏一下这条举世无双的项链吧……\n\n嘿，你到底在搞什么鬼？项链上的宝石都不见了！你当我是瞎子吗？连玛尔顿也看得出宝石不见了。\n\n好吧，也许不是你偷了宝石……但是没有宝石，这条项链就一文不值！你的任务远没有完成！",cEN="Mmmm salvage! I can smell the necklace from here. Now let's look at that beauty...\n\nHey, what do you think you're trying to do here? This necklace is missing the gems! You think we wouldn't notice? Even Malton could see that the gems are gone.\n\nWell, maybe you didn't steal them... but this necklace is worthless without those gems! Your job isn't done here yet, not by a long shot!"}
Q[2284]={d="玛尔顿这个笨蛋，我确信宝石还在奥达曼的某个地方，你必须回去找到它们。\n\n就像我之前所说的那样，如果我们掌握的情报是正确的话，那么这条项链上原本应该有红宝石、黄宝石和蓝宝石各一块。找到它们，并且把它们放回到项链上。\n\n至于那些宝石的具体位置就没有人知道了。如果你运气不错的话，也许你能找到那个笨蛋圣骑士的尸体。如果他还没有被剥光的话，没准你还能在他身上找到那些宝石。",dEN="As sure as Malton is a dummy, those gems are still in Uldaman somewhere. You're going to have to go back there and look for them.\n\nLike I said before, if the information we have is correct then there's a ruby, a sapphire, and a topaz that go with the necklace. Find them and put them in the necklace.\n\nAs to where the gems are, who knows? Maybe you'll get lucky and find the corpse of the Paladin. If he's not been stripped clean already, then maybe he's got them on him still.",o="在奥达曼里找寻宝石的线索。",oEN="Find a clue as to the gems' whereabouts in the depths of Uldaman.",c="在搜查尸体的过程中，你找到了他的日记。这本书已经变得破破烂烂了，干涸的血迹使得整本日记变得难以辨识。能够看清的部分的文字也让你难以理解，显然这是用人类的语言撰写的一本日记。\n\n你得找个人来帮你翻译其中的内容才能决定下一步该干什么。",cEN="You seem to have found the remains of the paladin that Dran had mentioned from before. Searching the remains uncovers what would appear to be his journal. The book is in poor condition, as dried blood has stained most of the text in the book. What you can read, however, is gibberish; it is written in the native tongue of the humans, to the best of your knowledge.\n\nYou will need the book translated if you are to glean any knowledge from it."}
Q[2298]={d="我们正要在那儿开始筹划第三阶段，麦格尼的几个蠢货就冲进来，说什么抢劫之类的，还抓走了隐秘之环的几个人。\n\n可谁也别想给老黑须戴上手铐！争吵越来越激烈，不知怎么的，你的名字就被说出口了！\n\n我的建议？搭第一班出铁炉堡的狮鹫去暴风城。到旧城区去，找我一个老朋友，他叫雷恩齐克·\"尖刀\"。",dEN="So there we were, about to start plottin' out phase III when a couple o' Magni's blockheads come bargin' in here talkin' bout some kind o' heist and arresting some o' the Hidden Circle.\n\nWell nobody puts the iron on old Blackbeard! The argumentations got heavy and thick and somehow yer name weres blurted out!\n\nMe advice? Take the first Gryphon out o' Ironforge and get to Stormwind. Get yerself to Old Town and once there, talk to an old friend o' mine named Renzik \"The Shiv.\"",o="前往暴风城，找雷恩齐克·\"尖刀\"。",oEN="Travel to Stormwind and seek out Renzik \"The Shiv.\"",c="我们队伍里永远欢迎$g胡尔夫丹手下:胡尔夫丹手下;的潜行者！",cEN="It's always good to have one of Hulfdan's rogues among our ranks!"}
Q[2299]={d="你去哪儿啦，$n？霍夫丹到处找你。我们都以为国王把你抓起来了。\n\n快去铁炉堡找霍夫丹！",dEN="Where have you been, <name>? Hulfdan's been looking all over the place for you. We thought the king may have put you in irons.\n\nGet to Ironforge as soon as possible and speak with Hulfdan!",o="到铁炉堡去和霍夫丹·黑须谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Ironforge and speak with Hulfdan Blackbeard.",c="小点声，$n，守卫会听到的。",cEN="Keep yer voice down, <name>, the guards may hear ye."}
Q[2300]={d="雷恩齐克在找你，小鱼儿。\n\n换作是我，可不会让马蒂亚斯的副手等着。|n",dEN="Renzik was looking for you, fish.\n\nI wouldn't keep Mathias's second in command waiting if I were you.",o="前往暴风城，找雷恩齐克·\"尖刀\"。",oEN="Travel to Stormwind and seek out Renzik \"The Shiv.\"",c="你是准备好开始工作了呢，还是想在我们开始前先打个盹儿？",cEN="Are you ready to get to work or do you need to take a nap before we get started?"}
Q[2318]={d="到了这个地步，你知道自己需要有人把那本书翻译成你能理解的语言。世上能胜任的人当然不少；不过，最有可能找到合适人选的最近地点是荒芜之地的卡加斯哨站。也许那里是个不错的起点。|n",dEN="At an impasse of sorts, you know that you will need the book translated into a language you can understand. There certainly are a number of people in the world who could do it; the closest location that might have someone who could, however, is the Kargath outpost in the Badlands. Perhaps that is a good place to start.",o="在荒芜之地的卡加斯哨所里寻找一个可以帮你翻译圣骑士日记的人。",oEN="Find someone who can translate the paladin's journal. The closest location that might have someone is Kargath, in the Badlands.",c="$g强大的:强大的;$c，我知道你来荒芜之地做什么。你需要我通晓多种语言的本事。你在找你在奥达曼发现的那条项链的部件。\n\n惊讶吗？不必——打听这些事正是我的本行。那么，我们还是谈谈你能为翻译这本日记做些什么吧。相信我——能翻译它的人，你只找得到我一个。\n\n更好的是，让我给你一个比德兰·德罗弗斯更好的条件，而且你还能继续完成跟他们的交易。现在有兴趣了吧？",cEN="Mighty <class>, I know what you are doing out here in the Badlands. I know you seek my gift of tongues. You're after the parts to that necklace you found in Uldaman.\n\nSurprised? Don't be - it's my job to know such things. Instead, let's discuss what you're going to do for a translated journal. Trust me - I'm the only one you'll find that can translate it.\n\nBetter still, let me make you a better offer than Dran Droffers is, and it'll let you still complete your deal with them. Interested now, yes?"}
Q[2338]={d="杜佛斯那个蠢货是不可能恢复项链的力量的，不过我可以。现在我要做的就是好好研究一下项链，然后给你制作一条跟它完全一样的复制品。请把项链借给我作为我帮你翻译日记的交换吧，在你出发去找寻宝石的这段时间里，我应该可以完成对项链的研究和对日记的翻译工作。\n\n这个交易很简单明了，而且没有别人可以帮你翻译日记。你看怎么样？",dEN="Droffers and Son Salvage aren't smart enough to restore the magic in the necklace, but I am. All I want to do is study the necklace so I can learn to make them myself. To do that, I will need your necklace. Let me borrow it, and in exchange for the time I get to study it I will translate the journal for you. While you are searching for the gems, I should have enough time to learn what I need to.\n\nIt's a simple deal, and no one else will be the wiser. Whatcha wanna do?",o="将项链借给加卡尔。作为交换，他将帮你翻译日记。",oEN="Let Jarkal borrow the necklace. In exchange, he will translate the journal for you.",p="你应该已经好好琢磨过这桩交易的利弊吧？你是个聪明的$c，如果你接受这桩交易的话，那就皆大欢喜了——你我都可以如愿以偿，而德兰和玛尔顿也会以为他们得到了自己想要的东西。",pEN="You've thought about it, yes? You're a smart <class> if you take this deal - you and I will get what we both want, and Droffers and Son Salvage will think they're getting what they want.",c="你一眼就认得出好买卖——我就知道能指望你。\n\n稍等片刻，我施个法术，把人类语言快速翻译成你能理解的形式。我是言而有信的巨魔；部落里随便谁都可以替我作证，我贾卡尔·苔融。好，我们开始吧……",cEN="You know a good deal when you see one - I knew I could count on you.\n\nIt will be just a moment while I cast a spell to quickly translate the human tongue into a form you will understand. I am a troll of my word; ask anyone in the Horde about Jarkal Mossmeld. Now, let's get this started..."}
Q[2339]={d="这是翻译好的日记，你可以自己读。要点是说矮人藏起了红宝石，穴居人藏起了黄玉，而一个叫格里姆洛克的穴居人拿着蓝宝石。\n\n听着——你需要一个能量源才能让项链重新运作。德兰·德罗弗斯不知道这点。要找能量源，我会这么做：尽量深入奥达曼，杀掉那里最强的构造体。无论那是什么，它肯定有。\n\n等你把所有东西都收集齐了，就回到这儿来！",dEN="Here is the journal, translated for you to read on your own. The crux of it says dwarves hid the ruby, the troggs hid the topaz, and a trogg named Grimlok has the sapphire.\n\nLook - you're going to need a power source to make the necklace work again. Dran Droffers doesn't know this. To find one, here's what I'd do: go as deep as you can in Uldaman and kill whatever construct there is the strongest. No doubt whatever that is would have it.\n\nWhen you have everything collected, come back here!",o="从奥达曼找回三颗宝石和一条项链的能量源，然后把它们全部带给卡加斯的贾卡尔·苔融。贾卡尔相信最强的能量源也许就在奥达曼的某个构造体身上。\n\n从日记中你得知……\n* 红宝石被藏在一处设了路障的暗炉区域。\n* 黄玉被藏在一只瓮中，位于某个穴居人区域，靠近一些联盟矮人。\n* 蓝宝石被穴居人首领格里姆洛克据为己有。",oEN="Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.\n\nFrom the journal, you know...\n* The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area.\n* The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.\n* The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",p="如果你要寻找那些宝石和能让项链恢复力量的能量源的话，你就得再次回到奥达曼去。\n\n你找回宝石之后，就把它们送到奥格瑞玛的那些呆子手里，而我会把能量源保留下来，因为它是让项链恢复力量的最关键的东西。",pEN="You've got another trip into the depths of Uldaman in store for yourself if you don't have the gems and a power source capable of channeling magical power back into the necklace.\n\nYou'll be getting the gems back to deliver to the goons in Orgrimmar; I will be keeping the power source, since it will be the thing that will make the necklace work in the first place...",c="干得太漂亮了，$c。现在我们的付出将得到回报。我有足够的信心完全重铸项链，从而让其恢复力量。\n\n但是首先，在你将宝石和项链带回奥格瑞玛之前，让我用早已准备好的咒语来对它们进行一番快速分析。我相信这只会花费一点点时间。",cEN="Very well done, <class>. Now the fruits of our redirection will pay themselves out handsomely. I'm finished with the necklace itself, and I am confident I can duplicate the construction process consistently.\n\nBut first, I will use a specially prepared incantation to quickly analyze those gems before you take them and the necklace back to Orgrimmar. This will take just a brief moment to do."}
Q[2340]={d="只要采用相同的材料进行制作，任何的项链和宝石的组合都能发挥作用。而这个能量源才是真正给项链提供力量的关键……我希望如此。\n\n只要能量源能够一直保持正常运转，我随时都可以为你制作这么一条项链。\n\n去奥格瑞玛找德兰·杜佛斯完成你们的交易吧。记住不要透露任何关于项链的信息，当你回来的时候，我会给你一个特别的惊喜的。",dEN="Any necklace setting and gem will work, so long as they are the same material. This power source, however, is what will bring the magic back to the necklace... I hope.\n\nI'll gladly supply the gems needed for your version of the necklace, so long as the power source actually works.\n\nHead to Orgrimmar and keep your end of the bargain with Droffers and Son Salvage. Just keep your mouth shut about our deal, and when you get back I might have a wonderful surprise for you.",o="把项链和宝石送到奥格瑞玛的德兰·杜佛斯那里。",oEN="Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar.",p="看看谁来了！看来你过来的一路上还算顺利，我想你来这里不是要浪费我的时间吧！除非你带来我要的东西，否则我是不会给你报酬的。请注意:我们会反复地仔细确认每一件东西！",pEN="Well, look who it is! Took your sweet time getting here, I see. Let's hope this isn't a waste of my time! You'll not get paid unless you have everything I asked for. And trust me on this - we'll be double and triple checking everything!",c="是的，都在这儿了。喂，你不介意我们连袋子也留下吧？不介意？谢了，真心感谢！哈！\n\n这条项链会是我们最大的一笔收获！不过别太难过；我敢说这条项链也不适合你戴。哈！\n\n交易就是交易，这是你打捞的报酬。我们的生意暂时做完了；过些时候再来看看有没有新活儿。在那之前，滚吧！",cEN="Yep, it's all here. Say, mind if we keep the bag too? No? Thanks, appreciate it! Har!\n\nThis necklace will be our greatest haul yet! Don't feel too bad though; I'm sure the necklace wouldn't fit you anyway. Har again!\n\nA deal is a deal, so here's your fee for the salvage. Our business is done here for now; check back later to see if we have more work. Until then, beat it!"}
Q[2341]={d="在德兰和玛尔顿为了他们的战利品而争执不休的同时，你的任务也算完成一半了。现在你得去荒芜之地完结这个任务，卡加斯营地里的加卡尔应该已经为你准备好了特别的奖励。",dEN="As Dran and Malton Droffers begin to squabble over their new salvage, half of the deal is now complete. A trip to the Badlands is now in order to finish things up, as Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath might have a special reward waiting for you there.",o="去卡加斯看看加卡尔是否成功了。",oEN="Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful.",c="你给我的那个能量源超出了我所有的期待。我给你和我各做了一条项链，剩下的料还够再做至少三条。德兰·德罗弗斯父子回收行还蒙在鼓里，这些能卖个好价钱。\n\n给你，$g朋友:朋友;。感谢你干得漂亮……还有点特别的东西，酬谢你费的周折。",cEN="The power source you gave me exceeded every expectation I had for it. I was able to make both you and me a necklace, and I have enough left over to make at least three more. They will fetch quite the fee, with Droffers and Son Salvage none the wiser.\n\nHere you go, my friend. I give you my thanks on a splendid job... and something quite special for your trouble."}
Q[2342]={d="我简直烦透了用这把破扫帚在这里打扫蝙蝠窝了！我靠这个该死的工作中存了一些钱，而且我愿意用这些钱来雇你帮我做些事情。\n\n加瑞特家族的祖传武器自从我们家到那里去当挖掘工以来就一直被锁在奥达曼的南部大厅中的箱子里。没有它，我就要永远被困在这里——也就是说，我就得永远跟这些该死的蝙蝠在一起！\n\n找到我家族的宝藏，把它给我拿来！帮我找回原本就属于我的东西！",dEN="Sweeping the bat pens with this broom is not befitting a Garrett! I've earned a little coin from this accursed job, and I'm willing to spend it on you to better my station.\n\nThe Garrett family weapon of choice is locked away in our chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman from when we Garretts toiled there as diggers. Without it, I will be stuck here forever - literally - sweeping up after these infernal bats.\n\nReclaim my family's treasure and bring it to me! Help me restore my birthright!",o="从奥达曼南部大厅的箱子中找到加勒特的家族宝藏，然后把它交给幽暗城的帕特里克·加瑞特。",oEN="Get Patrick Garrett's family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in the Undercity.",p="这清扫工作真是没完没了……那些该死的蝙蝠一直以来都在嘲笑我和我的扫帚。快告诉我，你找到了我的系列宝藏没有！我会给你一大堆钱的——难道这还不够吗？！",pEN="The sweeping never ends... these bats are prolific in their mockery of me and my broom. Please tell me you've reclaimed my family's treasure! I've offered you my silver - is that not enough?!",c="这才是加勒特家该有的扫帚！我说，你绝对值我花在你身上的每一枚银币！\n\n听见了吗，肮脏的蝙蝠们？我现在握着加勒特家族的招牌武器！颤抖吧，蝙蝠，颤抖吧！！",cEN="At last - a broom worthy of a Garrett. You're bloody well worth every silver I spent on you, I say!\n\nDo you hear me, foul bats? I now wield the Garrett family weapon of choice! Tremble, bats, tremble!!"}
Q[2358]={d="许多年前，奈兹拉的号角被人从拉文霍德庄园偷走。我寻遍五湖四海，结果发现它一直在这群微不足道的生物手中。\n\n杀掉你遇到的每一个黑石兽人，直到夺回奈兹拉的号角。若你夺回了号角，就到湖畔镇找我。\n\n替我做这件事，你的名字就会被拉文霍德知晓，$n。",dEN="Many years ago, the Horns of Nez'ra were stolen from Ravenholdt manor. Across continents and oceans I have searched, only to discover that these insignificant beasts have had it in their possession all along.\n\nSlay every Blackrock orc you cross until the Horns of Nez'ra are recovered. Should you recover the horns, find me in Lakeshire.\n\nDo this for me and your name shall be known to Ravenholdt, <name>.",o="把奈兹拉之角还给在湖畔镇的阿兰提尔之影。",oEN="Return the Horns of Nez'ra to Arantir in Lakeshire.",p="你找到那个恶魔王子的角了吗？",pEN="Do you have the demon prince's horns?",c="拒绝把器物交给拉文霍德，就等于否认自己的存在。干得好，$c。你还能在拉文霍德的刺客中间行走。\n\n当年我还是个在黑海岸冒险的年轻潜行者时，发现了一种能在战斗中恢复能量的茶。这些年来它一直对我很有用，如今我把蓟草茶的滋味传给你。累了就喝一口，$n，然后再次奋力战斗！",cEN="To deny Ravenholdt the artifact, would be to deny one's own existence. Well done, <class>. You may yet walk among the assassins of Ravenholdt.\n\nAs a young rogue adventuring in Darkshore, I discovered a tea that replenishes energy in combat. It has served me well throughout the years and now I pass on a taste of the thistle tea to you. Drink of it when you tire, <name>, and fight with vigor once more!"}
Q[2359]={d="我为如何进入这座塔的问题头痛好久了，$n。最近从暮色森林来了一船货物，同时还来了不少守卫。\n\n他们是谁？我也有着和你一样的疑问。我所知道的是——他们不是人类。\n\n不管怎么样，这批货物中有一只特殊的箱子——我想这就是那些亡灵在守护的东西。带着狼牙棒的那个家伙手里有那座塔的钥匙。\n\n拿到钥匙，进入塔里，看看箱子中到底有什么，然后去向马迪亚斯报告。",dEN="I've been staking out this tower for weeks, <name>. Recently a major shipment came through from Duskwood, and along with it came those guards.\n\nWhat are they? Your guess is as good as mine. I can tell you one thing - they aren't human.\n\nAnyhow, the shipment had a chest - which is what I assume those abominations are guarding. The zombie with the spikes holds a key we'll need.\n\nGet that key, get in the tower, and uncover whatever is in that chest. Take your findings back to Mathias.",o="偷取迪菲亚塔楼钥匙，进入迪菲亚塔楼，看看暮色森林的箱子里到底有什么东西，然后向暴风城的马迪亚斯·肖尔汇报。",oEN="Steal the Defias Tower Key, break into the Defias Tower and uncover the contents of the Duskwood Chest. Take whatever information you find back to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Read Kearnen's Journal to gain insight about the tower.",p="吉尔妮那边有什么消息？",pEN="Any news from Agent Kearnen?",c="这可以解释为什么你和吉尔妮在塔外会看到迪菲亚闲工，$n。这也可以解释风险投资公司和迪菲亚兄弟会的关系，以及为什么会有货物从暮色森林运到那里。\n\n根据这本书上的内容，荆棘谷的赞吉尔已经研究出了利用某种药水——或者说是毒药——来制造亡灵的办法。\n\n如果你对毒药一无所知的话，你对军情七处来说就是毫无用处的，$n。这种药水可以让你在弹指之间创造一个听命于你的行尸走肉。",cEN="This would explain the Defias drones you and Kearnen saw outside of the tower, <name>. It would also explain the Venture Company's involvement with the Defias and the strange shipments out of Duskwood.\n\nAccording to this book, the Zanzil trolls in Stranglethorn have discovered a way to raise the dead through potions... or to be more specific: poison.\n\nYou'll be of no use to SI:7 without a firm understanding of poisons, <name> -- especially with the recipe to create undeath at our fingertips."}
Q[2360]={d="$n，不久之前，军情7处接到西部荒野出现大量迪菲亚兄弟会成员的报告。\n\n现在他们已经占据了位于哨兵岭东南部的一座荒废的哨塔，并将其作为从赤脊山走私补给物资的中转站。\n\n到西部荒野去和密探吉尔妮会面，你应该可以在哨塔的附近找到她。\n\n另外……$n，一旦你的行动被发现，军情7处将会否认与你有任何联系。",dEN="Not a moment too soon, <name>. SI:7 reconnaissance is reporting unusually heavy Defias activity in Westfall.\n\nIt would seem that the Defias have taken over an abandoned Alliance watch tower southeast of Sentinel Hill and are using it as a base of operations to smuggle in goods from the Redridge supply route.\n\nGet to Westfall and contact Agent Kearnen for your debriefing. You will find her hidden near the tower.\n\n...and <name>, should you be discovered, SI:7 will disavow all knowledge of your existence.",o="去西部荒野和密探吉尔妮谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Westfall and find Agent Kearnen for your debriefing.",c="马迪亚斯终于派人来帮我了？好吧，我这里的确是有些坏消息。",cEN="Mathias finally sent another agent to back me up, eh? Well I hope he's ready to hear some bad news."}
Q[2361]={c="我很高兴能给你这条项链，强大的$c。你对我的帮助是无价的，我为此对你表示万分的感谢。请把它戴上吧，这是属于你的荣耀，请在别人问及的时候告诉他们，是我制作了这条项链！\n\n另外，如果你证明这条项链根本没有受到诅咒，那就更棒了。",cEN="I gladly give you this necklace, mighty <class>. You have done me an invaluable service, and for that I thank you. Wear it with pride, and make sure you mention loudly and repeatedly who made it for you!\n\nAlso, if you could toss in the fact that it really isn't cursed, that would be great."}
Q[2378]={d="你为亡灵潜行者效力得尽职尽责，$n，但也许是时候向外拓展了。虽然你在潜行和欺骗之道上展现了天赋，你仍需要大量训练。\n\n亡灵潜行者在碎手氏族中有盟友。去找那些愿意协助我们的人——去奥格瑞玛找申苏尔。|n",dEN="You have served the Deathstalkers well, <name>, but perhaps it is time for you to venture outward. While you have shown aptitude in the ways of stealth and deception, you still require much training.\n\nThe Deathstalkers have allies within the Shattered Hand. Seek out those that would assist us - find Shenthul in Orgrimmar.",o="前往奥格瑞玛，在暗影裂口与申苏尔交谈。|n",oEN="Journey to Orgrimmar and speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow.",c="这么说来，我们那强大的盟友派到我这里来的就是你？太令人失望了……",cEN="So, you are what our mighty allies have sent Shenthul? How uninspiring...."}
Q[2379]={d="光靠意志力，你无法克服摆在我们面前的障碍。\n\n去跟赞多赞谈谈，开始你作为碎手氏族成员训练。\n\n只有当你掌握了潜行与盗窃的技艺，你才能向你的命运迈出下一步。|n",dEN="Your determination alone is not enough to overcome the obstacles that lay ahead of us.\n\nSpeak with Zando'zan to begin your training as an operative of the Shattered Hand.\n\nIt is only when you have mastered the practices of stealth and thievery that you may take the next step towards your destiny.",o="与暗影裂口的赞杜沙谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Zando'zan at the Cleft of Shadow.",c="也许是赞杜沙错了，赞杜沙道歉。",cEN="Perhaps Zando'zan was wrong. Zando'zan apologizes."}
Q[2380]={d="你还算不上潜行的$g大师:大师;，但这一切都可能改变，也会改变。显然，你那点可怜的本事让上头的人刮目相看，因为伟大的申苏尔点名要见你。\n\n沿这里的路往北走，就能到奥格瑞玛。在暗影裂口与申苏尔交谈。|n",dEN="A master of stealth and deception you are not, however, all of that can and will change. You've obviously impressed those in charge with your meager skills, as the great Shenthul has asked for you by name.\n\nTake the road north of here to Orgrimmar and speak with Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow.",o="在奥格瑞玛城中的暗影裂口和申苏尔谈谈。",oEN="Speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",c="萨尔想要改变部落的传统，我们碎手氏族必须对此保持警觉，这一点很重要。从人数上来说，我们很难和萨尔的势力相抗衡，所以我们必须精于隐秘行动和欺诈。",cEN="It is important that the Shattered Hand remains vigilant in the face of the changes Thrall wishes to bring about to the Horde. Our numbers alone will not be enough to overcome his rule - stealth and deception must be mastered."}
Q[2382]={d="赞多赞看到了，是的，死亡正向萨尔逼近。它会是一把背后的匕首，或是流遍他全身的毒药……赞多赞说得太多了。\n\n$n！赞多赞有一项任务交给$n。$n 必须去十字路口以东的棘齿城，跟倒霉的雷尼克斯谈谈。去吧。|n",dEN="Zando'zan has seen it! Yes, the day comes! Thrall's death... the dagger in his back, poison seeping through to his every vein... Zando'zan has said too much.\n\n<name>! Zando'zan has a task for <name>! <name> must travel to Ratchet, east of the Crossroads, and speak with Wrenix the Wretched. Go!",o="到棘齿城去，与卑鄙的维尼克斯谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Ratchet in the Barrens and speak with Wrenix the Wretched.",c="又来一个？那个疯狂的巨魔派来的前五个倒霉鬼都已经塞了鲨鱼的牙缝。我希望你的结局不会那么惨。",cEN="Another one? The last five that crazy troll sent me ended up as shark food. Let's hope you fare a little better, eh?"}
Q[2398]={d="奥达曼挖掘场从前并不是现在这样一团糟的。我们铁炉堡的矮人曾经控制了这个区域，但是……当穴居怪来了之后，一切都变了。它们的数量太多了，连我们矮人也挡不住它们！\n\n事实上，因为它们非常突然地发起了攻击，所以我担心我们有些人被困在了挖掘场里面。\n\n我的朋友巴尔洛戈带了一个矮人小队进入了挖掘场深处，就在穴居怪发起攻击之前。如果他和他的同伴们还活着的话，我希望你能找到他们。",dEN="The dig site at Uldaman wasn't always overrun. We Ironforge dwarves used to control the area, but... that was before the troggs came. They came so fast and in such numbers that not even dwarven might could stop them!\n\nIn fact, their attack was so sudden that I fear some of our people may be trapped behind enemy lines.\n\nMy friend Baelog led a small band of dwarves deep within the site just before the troggs showed up. If he and his company live, then I want you to find them.",o="在奥达曼找到巴尔洛戈。",oEN="Find Baelog in Uldaman.",c="你终于现身了！我差点输给了奥拉夫！\n\n他跟我打赌说，在他看到一个活的$r之前，他的胡子可以长到足以盖过他的膝盖那么长。现在你来了，而奥拉夫的胡子离他的膝盖还有几寸的距离哪。\n\n谢谢你，$n。我会把我赢来的钱分给你一些的。",cEN="It's about time you showed up! I was in danger of losing a bet with Olaf!\n\nHe wagered that his beard would grow to his knees before he saw another living <race>. Well here you are, and as you can see Olaf's beard has a few more inches to go.\n\nThanks, <name>. I'll split the winnings with you."}
Q[2399]={c="德纳兰植入土中的树叶开始迅速生根并成长，它们振颤着，仿佛急于被采摘一样……",cEN="The fronds Denalan planted within his garden have sprouted and grown. They tremble, eager to be picked...."}
Q[2418]={d="不久之前，我和暗炉矮人打过一段时间的交道。他们把我带到了苦痛堡垒，让我对两种来自于奥达曼的奇怪石头进行研究。我发现这两种石头如果经过正确的处理，就会变成相当理想的能量源。能在那个废旧的挖掘场里发现这样的东西让我感到十分惊奇！\n\n之后，在我告诉他们这个秘密之后，那帮该死的家伙就把我踢出了苦痛堡垒，然后自己在奥达曼挖掘更多的石头。\n\n我要为自己搞一些那种石头！帮我带那两种石头来，我会给你丰厚的报酬的。",dEN="A while ago, I had an incident with the Shadowforge Dwarves. They brought me to Angor Fortress to study two types of strange stones from Uldaman. I discovered that the stones were sustained, stable power sources if treated correctly. It's amazing the things one can find in that old dig site!\n\nAnyway, after I told them the secret of the stones they kicked me out of Angor Fortress and began digging for more in Uldaman.\n\nI want those stones for myself! Bring me both types and I'll pay you plenty!",o="给荒芜之地的里格弗兹带去8块德提亚姆能量石和8块安纳洛姆能量石。",oEN="Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands.",p="$n，你拿到能量石了吗？我有个机械动物需要这样一个能量源……",pEN="Do you have the power stones, <name>? I have a robotic rodent that needs a power supply...",c="太棒了，你找到了一些！多谢，$n。你是我见过最$g靠谱:靠谱;的$r！\n\n我迫不及待想在我做的一些装置上试试。我敢打赌，在合适的条件下，用这些石头驱动的装置会一直跑、一直跑、一直跑……",cEN="That's great, you found some! Thanks a lot, <name>. You're the most dependable <race> I've met!\n\nI can't wait to try these on some devices I've been tinkering with. I bet that, under the right circumstances, devices powered with these stones will keep going, and going, and going..."}
Q[2438]={d="班尼希尔土丘的看守者盖罗拉斯·塔尔维森曾送给我一个翡翠捕梦网。这枚强大的护符能汲取翡翠梦境的力量，为佩戴者带来好运。\n\n可惜，我把它落在了星风村……虽然星风村曾经是个宁静的地方，如今却已被那里的熊怪腐化所吞噬。\n\n你$g愿意:愿意;替我取回捕梦网吗，$c？",dEN="I was once given an emerald dreamcatcher from Gaerolas Talvethen, the warden of the druids in the Ban'ethil Barrow Den. This powerful amulet is able to siphon energy from the Emerald Dream, bestowing luck upon those who carry it.\n\nSadly, I have not been able to retrieve it from my dresser in Starbreeze Village... Although Starbreeze was once a tranquil place, it has now succumbed to the corruption of the furbolg that reside there.\n\nPerhaps you would be willing to recover my dreamcatcher, <class>?",o="将翡翠摄梦符交给多兰纳尔的塔隆凯·捷根。",oEN="Bring the Emerald Dreamcatcher to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.",p="请快点行动吧。我祈求我的翡翠摄梦符没有遭到熊怪的破坏。\n\n你拿到了它了没有，$n？",pEN="Please move swiftly. I can only hope that my emerald dreamcatcher has been unharmed by the furbolg.\n\nHave you recovered it yet, <name>?",c="翡翠摄梦符对我来说非常重要。这样的东西只有少数被选中的人才能得到。谢谢你把它还给我，$n。",cEN="My emerald dreamcatcher is of great importance to me. It is a gift only given to few. Thank you for returning it, <name>."}
Q[2439]={d="这东西真是个惊人的发现。如果这里储存的知识都是正确的话，那么这些圆盘所涉及的古代泰坦——或者说造物之神——肯定和我们的起源有所联系！我们要用尽可能多的时间来研究它。\n\n至于你，英勇的$c，把这个凭证交给大厅里的丁尼塔·石衣，你一定会为你的伟大发现得到应有的报酬！\n\n准备好了之后就回到我这里来，探险者协会还有很多事等着你去做！",dEN="This object is an incredible find. The ancient Titans, or the Creators as these discs refer to them as, are the link to our enchanted creation, if the lore stored in here is correct! We'll need to invest as much research time into this as possible.\n\nAs for you, heroic <class>, take this voucher to Dinita Stonemantle at the vault. It grants you what I think is a fitting for such a tremendous find!\n\nReturn to me directly when you are ready; there is much more to do for the Explorers' League!",o="把你的报酬凭证交给铁炉堡银行的丁尼塔·石衣。",oEN="Take your reward voucher to Dinita Stonemantle in the Vault of Ironforge.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到铁炉堡宝库，$n。今天我能为你做什么？",pEN="Welcome to the Vault of Ironforge, <name>. What may I do for you today?",c="啊，没错，这的确是探险者协会的凭证……我得说，这是个很有价值的凭证。\n\n根据探险者协会赋予我的权利，我允许你直接从他们的储藏室里选择报酬。你先拿着这个，然后请选择5瓶治疗药水或5瓶强效法力药水作为报酬。",cEN="As yes, a voucher from the Explorers' League... and quite the valuable one, might I add.\n\nThe Explorers' League lends me the authority to offer you a choice in your compensation directly from their vault. You are to receive this item, and you may choose between five superior healing potions or five greater mana potions as your reward."}
Q[2440]={d="我要把精力都集中在这些圆盘上，它们一定会向我展示其真正的作用。\n\n至于你，$n，你的努力也会得到我的回报。把这个证明交给雷霆崖的炼金师本娜·冰蹄，她会给你一样不错的东西作为回报，还会给你一些我私人收藏的药水。\n\n尽快回来见我，我感觉这个发现还会让我有很多事要忙。",dEN="I shall focus my energies on these discs; they will reveal their true workings to me in due time.\n\nAs for you <name>, I will now reward you for your diligence in bringing this to my attention. Take this voucher to Bena Winterhoof, the alchemy trainer for Thunder Bluff. She will give you a special item I believe you will find appealing, and she will supply you with a choice of potions from my personal stock.\n\nReturn to me soon, as I sense there is much more at hand for us to do regarding this find.",o="把报酬凭证交给雷霆崖的本娜·冰蹄。",oEN="Take the reward voucher to Bena Winterhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="你好，$c！你是来接受炼金术训练的，还是为其它什么事？",pEN="Greetings, <class>! Are you here for alchemy training, or perhaps something else?",c="好吧，$n，你一定是做了让贤者图希克非常高兴的事，他才会把这个给你。你还可以得到他收藏的药水，你可以选择5瓶超强治疗药水或5瓶强效法力药水作为你的报酬。",cEN="Well <name>, you must have pleased Sage Truthseeker greatly for him to give you this item. You are also to be granted a gift from his cache of potions; you may choose between 5 superior healing potions or 5 greater mana potions as your reward."}
Q[2458]={d="你听说过风险投资公司吗？\n\n我们花了一年苦心经营，终于成功安插了一名内线。\n\n我们发现他们正在策划一项大规模行动。往北去淤泥沼泽的风险投资公司塔楼，联系我们的卧底工头菲祖尔。\n\n找到塔楼后，用这把信号枪，然后去找菲祖尔，向他行碎手氏族的敬礼。|n",dEN="The Venture Company... Perhaps you have heard of them?\n\nFor one year we have worked on planting an agent deep within their ranks. Through much hard work and careful planning, we succeeded.\n\nRecently we received word that the Venture Co. are planning something on a grand scale. Go north of the Sludge Fen to the Venture Co. tower and contact our undercover agent, Taskmaster Fizzule.\n\nWhen you find the tower, use this flare gun, then approach Fizzule and show him the salute of the Shattered Hand.",o="到淤泥沼泽北边的风险投资公司塔楼去，联系碎手氏族的卧底费苏勒。\n\n看到塔楼之后，用信号枪发射信号，向工头费苏勒示意你已经到达。发出两个闪光信号，然后使用碎手军礼和工头费苏勒接头。\n\n注意，这些步骤必须依次进行，因为费苏勒会攻击并干掉任何他无法识别的人。",oEN="Travel to the Venture Co. Tower, north of the Sludge Fen and contact the Shattered Hand's covert operative, Taskmaster Fizzule.\n\nWhen the tower is in sight, use the Flare Gun to signal your arrival to Taskmaster Fizzule. Fire off TWO flares, then approach Taskmaster Fizzule and perform the Shattered /Salute.\n\nThese actions must be performed in the correct order, as Fizzule will attack and terminate any person he does not recognize.",c="在这儿看到碎手氏族同僚的感觉真不错，不过你发的信号似乎多了点！\n\n下次如果你还要找我的话，只要拿这只哨子吹两声就可以了。",cEN="It's good to see another agent of the Shattered Hand in these parts, however, the flare may have been a little too much!\n\nNext time you need to speak with me, blow into this whistle twice and I'll know you are an ally."}
Q[2459]={d="翡翠……不见了！我的摄梦符被毁了！\n\n星风村北部有一群瘤背秘法师。我接到报告说他们的领袖——噬梦者菲罗斯塔的脖子上戴着一根在夜间会发出绿光的项链。我觉得就是它偷走了我的翡翠……它决不会想到那颗翡翠对它毫无用处。\n\n去找到丢失的宝石，$n。另外，你在那儿活动的时候，别忘了顺便清除一些堕落的秘法师。",dEN="The emerald... It is missing! My dreamcatcher has been damaged!\n\nThere is a band of Gnarlpine mystics located to the north of Starbreeze. I have heard reports that their leader, Ferocitas the Dream Eater has been wearing a necklace that glows green in the night. Now seeing my dreamcatcher, I am sure that he has stolen my emerald... He would never realize that its power is useless to him.\n\nFind this missing jewel, <name>. And, while you're there, clear out some of the corrupted mystics as well.",o="多兰纳尔的塔隆凯·捷根要你杀掉7个瘤背秘法师，并找到遗失的珠宝。",oEN="Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar wants you to kill 7 Gnarlpine Mystics and find the Missing Jewel.",p="让菲罗希塔斯和旋枝秘法师把我的东西还回来。请取回那颗翡翠，好让我修复我的翡翠捕梦网。记得先把宝石从那条项链上取下来，我不需要其余部分。",pEN="Ferocitas and the Gnarlpine Mystics must return what is mine. Please retrieve the emerald so that I may repair my emerald dreamcatcher.\n\nMake sure to take the gem out of that necklace first, I don't need the rest of it.",c="现在我可以修复摄梦符了。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Now I can repair my dreamcatcher. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[2460]={d="作为碎手氏族的潜行者，你必须学会碎手军礼。这是识别氏族成员的唯一方法。\n\n看好了，然后重复做一遍。",dEN="As a rogue of the Shattered Hand, it is imperative that you learn the Shattered Salute. It is the only way to truly identify another member of the Hand.\n\nWatch, learn, repeat.",o="对着申苏尔练习碎手军礼。",oEN="Perform the Shattered Salute on Shenthul.",p="去练习！",pEN="Practice!",c="很好，$n。你现在可以进入下一步了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. You are now ready to proceed."}
Q[2478]={d="你必须从工头希里克斯身上偷出塔楼的钥匙，$n。拿到钥匙之后，就把它收好——你也许用得到它。\n\n记住，毒药已经让塔楼里的所有人都变得虚弱不堪。尽你所能给那些家伙制造混乱和破坏，把他们全都杀了——不要手下留情！\n\n等里面所有人都躺在血泊中之后，你就可以去打开加里维克斯的箱子，然后拿走赞吉尔的改良药剂。把加里维克斯的脑袋和药剂一起交给奥格瑞玛的申苏尔。",dEN="You will need to steal the tower key from Foreman Silixiz, <name>. Once you've got the key in your possession, hold on to it - I may need it later.\n\nRemember, the poison has weakened everything in this tower. Use your abilities to bring chaos and destruction to its inhabitants. Slay them all -- show no mercy!\n\nOnce everything inside lays in a bloodied heap, pick Gallywix's lockbox and steal the cache of Zanzil's mixture held inside. Take both the head of Gallywix and the mixture to Shenthul in Orgrimmar.",o="偷取工头西利克西斯身上的塔楼钥匙，杀死 2 只变异的风险投资公司雄蜂、2 名风险投资公司巡逻兵和 2 名风险投资公司瞭望员。\n\n刺杀大工头加里维克斯并取下他的头颅，然后撬开加里维克斯的锁箱，偷走藏在那里的改良赞吉尔合剂。把匣子和加里维克斯的头带回奥格瑞玛交给申苏尔，他会给你进一步的指示。|n",oEN="Steal Silixiz's Tower Key from Foreman Silixiz, then kill two Mutated Venture Co. Drones, two Venture Co. Patrollers, and two Venture Co. Lookouts.\n\nAssassinate Grand Foreman Gallywix and take his head, then pick the lock on Gallywix's lockbox and steal the Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture. Take the Cache and Gallywix's Head back to Shenthul in Orgrimmar for further instruction.",p="你有什么要报告的吗，$n？",pEN="What have you to report, <name>?",c="可怜的费苏勒，他是个出色的探子。唉，这就是我们要付出的代价，$n。做碎手氏族的密探是个危险的工作。\n\n你的任务完成得很出色，$c。如果你不能再为我们效力的话，那会是我们的一大损失。",cEN="Poor Fizzule, he was a good agent -- one of our best. Alas, it is the price we pay, <name>. Being a field agent of the Shattered Hand is dangerous work.\n\nYou have performed your duty well, <class>. It would be a shame if you did not live to serve us again."}
Q[2479]={d="把这个混合物的样本交给塔伦米尔的瑟尔格·希诺特。\n\n只有瑟尔格能治得了你所中的毒。如果你能活得久一点的话，他还能教你制造并使用这种毒药的方法。",dEN="Take a sample of the mixture to Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill.\n\nIf anyone can cure you, it's Serge. Live long enough and Serge will show you the ways of poison creation and use.",o="前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵的塔伦米尔，把赞吉尔合剂的样本交给塞尔吉·希诺特。\n\n要前往塔伦米尔，先乘飞艇到幽暗城，然后沿路向南穿过银松森林前往希尔斯布莱德。跟着路标走！|n|n",oEN="Travel to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and deliver the Sample of Zanzil's Mixture to Serge Hinott.\n\nTo get to Tarren Mill, take the Zeppelin to the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine and towards Hillsbrad. Follow the signs!",p="这是什么？",pEN="What's this???",c="你看起来脸色苍白，$c。你身上那股臭味是怎么回事？我必须得知道！",cEN="You look deliciously pale, <class>. And what is that foul aroma you are giving off? I must know!"}
Q[2480]={d="我从来没有见过哪种毒药能产生这么惊人的效果！你是说赞吉尔？从没听过这个家伙，不过既然他能制造出这种毒药来，那他还是值得我刮目相看的。\n\n那么你是要我帮你解毒，然后教你如何使用这种毒药？\n\n给我点时间研究一下毒药，$n。",dEN="I have never seen such wondrous results from a poison! Zanzil you say? Never heard of him, however, I must commend him on the creation of this concoction.\n\nSo, I am to cure you of this and then teach you how to make use of the poison?\n\nGive me a few moments to examine the toxin, <name>.",o="等待瑟尔格·希诺特完成解药。",oEN="Wait for Serge Hinott to complete the cure.",c="解药准备好了！喝下这个解药就能解除你的痛苦，不过对于你身上那股味道，我就无能为力了。",cEN="The cure is ready! Drink this anti-toxin and the creeping madness will stop, however, I will not be able to do anything about the smell."}
Q[2498]={d="我刚接到消息，奥拉密斯湖畔的德纳兰可能已经发现了让林精长出那些毒瘤的原因。你去和他谈谈吧，告诉他是我派你去的。\n\n动作快点，$n，他需要我们的帮助。",dEN="I have just received word that Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth has discovered what may be the cause of the tumors that plague the timberlings. Please speak with him, and tell him I sent you.\n\nMake haste, <name>; he needs our help.",o="雷利亚·绿树要你和奥拉密斯湖的德纳兰谈一谈。",oEN="Rellian Greenspyre wants you to speak with Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",c="哦，是雷利亚派你来的，我很高兴你这么快就来了。\n\n我这里有些令人不安的发现！",cEN="Ah, so Rellian sent you to aid me. I am glad you arrived here so soon.\n\nI have discovered something quite disturbing!"}
Q[2499]={d="在湖南岸的山洞里有一个名叫奥肯斯古尔的林精，它正在使居住在奥拉密斯湖周围的所有生物变得堕落。\n\n我不敢离那里太近，不过即使从远处看去，我也能看得很清楚：奥肯斯古尔已经被一颗我所见过的最大的肿瘤所毒害了……那个肿瘤简直可以被称作庞然大物。\n\n$n，你已经帮了我许多忙，不过我还要请你做一件事。杀掉奥肯斯古尔，拿到它身上的肿瘤，让这个堕落之源永远从我的家园消失。",dEN="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home.\n\nI dared not get too close, but even from a distance, it is obvious: Oakenscowl is being poisoned by the largest tumor I have ever seen... I would call it gargantuan, even.\n\n<name>, you have already done much to aid my efforts, but I ask of you one more task. Hunt down Oakenscowl and collect the tumor; remove this source of corruption from my home.",o="奥拉密斯湖的德纳兰要你去拿到奥肯斯古尔身上的巨大的瘤。",oEN="Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl.",p="你找到橡皮枭了吗，$r？",pEN="Have you located Oakenscowl yet, <race>?",c="我就知道你的能力不只是足以将那个可怕的野兽赶出湖区这么简单。\n\n这真是个棘手的局面，奥肯斯古尔曾经是一个伟大的树精领袖，但是堕落是不分平民和贵族的。\n\n这个肿瘤如此巨大，让我感到十分费解，不过我一定要对它做进一步的研究才能更多地了解这种疾病。\n\n谢谢你，$n。",cEN="I knew you were more than capable of ridding the lake of that horrible beast.\n\nIt is a distressing situation; Oakenscowl was once a grand leader amongst his kind... but corruption does not discriminate between the lowly and the noble.\n\nThe size of this tumor is quite disturbing, but I must study it to learn more about the disease that upsets the timberling population.\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[2500]={d="$C，我需要你的帮助。我是个小有名气的炼金师，我需要你去荒芜之地帮我找一些原材料。\n\n我需要这些东西补充我的库存：五个秃鹫的胃囊、十颗峭壁山狗的牙齿和五块岩石元素碎片。当然你可以从这些动物身上拿到这些东西，不过如果你不擅长打仗的话，可以找些擅长的朋友。\n\n找到这些东西给我，作为交换你可以得到一些钱币。\n\n好吧，你觉得怎么样？",dEN="<class>, I would make use of your services. I am an alchemist of some note, and I seek your aid in acquiring some reagents found out in the Badlands.\n\nI need the following items to replenish my stocks: five buzzard gizzards, ten crag coyote fangs, and five rock elemental shards. Obviously, you can get them off of the beasties themselves; if you're not the fighting type, then find friends who are.\n\nAcquire these items for me, you'll get some coin out of the deal.\n\nWell, what say ye?",o="从荒芜之地拿到加克所需的材料，然后回到塞尔萨玛去见他。",oEN="Acquire the reagents Ghak Healtouch needs from the Badlands, then return to him in Thelsamar.",p="你找到我需要的东西了吗？除非你帮我弄来那些东西，否则你得不到任何报酬。",pEN="Have you gotten the things I need yet? You won't get paid unless you bring me those reagents.",c="哦，干得好，$n！这些够我用一阵子的了。这是我许诺给你的报酬。\n\n如果你有兴趣的话，我还需要些别的材料，不过这些材料只能在奥达曼挖掘场的深处找到，而且比较困难。如果你有兴趣再帮助我的话，我会给你更多报酬的。\n\n也许我会给你一些比明晃晃的钱币更有价值的东西，你觉得怎么样？",cEN="Ah, well done <name>. These should last me for a little while at least. Here is your pay, as promised.\n\nIf you're interested, I have some more reagents I could use. These, however, are only found in the depths of the Uldaman excavation. They will not be easy to get, but I will make it worth your while if you are interested in helping me again.\n\nPerhaps something more than some shiny coins, yes?"}
Q[2501]={d="你对我的帮助很大，$n。我可以把以前我给你的那种酒的配方作为报酬送给你，不过还得让你先帮我个忙才行——这次的事比较危险。\n\n这只上锁的箱子里装着三个空的魔瓶，里面有一种可以吸取火龙血液的魔法能量。用这些容器去对付火龙会把它们激怒，所以你得小心点。把三个容器都盛满了，再把它们拿回来给我。\n\n完成这个任务之后，配方就是你的了。",dEN="You have been most helpful to me, <name>. I would like to reward you with the very recipe for the brew I gave you earlier, but I must ask of you a favor that is quite dangerous.\n\nThis lockbox contains three empty thaumaturgy vessels; they are imbued with an attunement aura that will drain the blood of a scorched guardian dragon. Using one on the beast will anger it greatly, so be careful. Once you have all three filled, bring them to me.\n\nDo this, and the recipe will be yours.",o="在荒芜之地的守护火龙身上使用空的魔瓶。将这些容器都盛满之后，把它们交给塞尔萨玛的加克。",oEN="Use the empty thaumaturgy vessels on scorched guardian dragons found in the Badlands. Once you have them filled, bring them to Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar.",p="你用那些容器帮我弄到所需要的焦灼守护巨龙之血了吗？是的，我知道这任务很危险……但我那恢复饮料的配方就等着你成功了。风险与回报，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;……风险与回报……",pEN="Have you used the vessels to get me the scorched guardian dragon blood I need? Yes, I know it is a dangerous task... but the recipe for my restorative brew awaits your success. Risk and reward, my friend... risk and reward...",c="我以一个炼金师的身份向你这个同行致敬。拿着这个配方，它是属于你的了。希望它能给你带来成功和回报，就像它这么多年给我带来的那样！",cEN="From one alchemist to another, I salute you. Here, take this recipe and commit it to your knowledge. May it bring you the success and rewards that it has brought me over the years!"}
Q[2518]={d="萨丝拉曾经受到月神的宠爱，这只优雅而纯洁的蜘蛛在月光下的迷雾中编织着银线，用以收集银色的露水，并将这种有治疗功效的露水存放在这个大殿里。\n\n不过最近萨丝拉却突然变得疯狂起来，她的后代也受到了威胁。\n\n找到萨丝拉，$n，结束她的痛苦。她住在泰达希尔的北部边界。找到她的银色丝囊，把它们交给我。",dEN="Lady Sathrah was once beloved of Elune. Graceful and pure, the spider spun her silver threads through the moonlight, catching the evening mist. The silvery dew had strong healing powers and was kept here in the temple.\n\nBut of late, Sathrah has descended into madness. Her future generations are now threatened as well.\n\nFind Lady Sathrah, <name>, and end her suffering. She dwells along the northern borders of Teldrassil, near Wellspring Lake. Gather her silvery spinnerets and bring them back to me.",o="达纳苏斯月神殿的女祭司艾茉拉让你把萨丝拉的银色丝囊交给她。",oEN="Priestess A'moora in the Temple of the Moon at Darnassus wants you to bring her Lady Sathrah's Silvery Spinnerets.",p="我很遗憾不得不交给你这个任务，不过萨丝拉已经没有挽救的希望了。\n\n我们希望能把这些丝囊作为祭品献给艾露恩。有了这个祭品，她就会保佑萨丝拉，让她有可能获得重生，并获得安宁。",pEN="I regret the task that I have asked you to carry out; but Lady Sathrah is beyond hope.\n\nIt is our hope to offer the sacrifice of the spinnerets to Elune. With this sacrifice, Elune will bless Sathrah so that she might be reborn, and at peace.",c="整个森林都在为萨丝拉女士哀悼，不过那是我们不得不做的事情。\n\n谢谢你，$n。",cEN="The forest mourns for Lady Sathrah, but it was something that had to be done.\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[2519]={d="一头曾经伟大的森林生物需要帮助，$r。\n\n有一项艰难的任务必须完成。\n\n请去找女祭司阿穆拉；她会向你解释一切。你可以在东南方、月神殿内找到她。",dEN="A once great creature of the forest is in need of help, <race>.\n\nThere is a difficult task that must be done.\n\nPlease seek out Priestess A'moora; she will explain things to you. Find her to the southeast of here, inside the Temple of the Moon.",o="艾奎恩妮让你和月神殿的女祭司艾茉拉谈一谈。",oEN="Sister Aquinne wants you to speak with Priestess A'moora in the Temple of the Moon.",c="是艾奎恩妮修女让你来的？",cEN="So, Sister Aquinne sent you?"}
Q[2520]={d="现在你必须完成交给你的任务。拿上银色丝囊，然后将它作为萨丝拉的祭品献给艾露恩，让这只蜘蛛得以安息。\n\n找到大殿中央的喷泉，在那儿放下祭品。神圣的泉水可以净化并清洗让萨丝拉发疯的堕落力量。\n\n完成任务之后再回来见我。",dEN="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest.\n\nInside this temple, find the central fountain. There is where you may leave the sacrifice. The holy waters will purify and cleanse the corruption that drove Sathrah mad.\n\nWhen you have completed this, return to me.",o="女祭司艾茉拉让你将萨丝拉的银色丝囊放在大殿的喷泉处，然后回去见她。",oEN="Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her.",p="你把祭品放到喷泉那儿了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you placed the sacrifice at the fountain, <name>?",c="失去萨丝拉女士是令人悲伤的，不过只有这样她才能以全新的灵魂获得重生。\n\n愿艾露恩能接受你献给她的祭品。",cEN="The loss of Lady Sathrah is distressing, but in this way only may she be reborn with a renewed spirit.\n\nMay Elune willingly accept the sacrifice that you have offered her."}
Q[2521]={d="$R，你的小脑袋能理解一颗无暇的德莱尼水晶球有多么珍稀吗？无数德莱尼人终其一生就想要寻找一块这样的水晶，可是却屡遭失败，一直没能达到愿望。\n\n你现在就站在库米沙面前，你知道库米沙想要什么，而且你还愿意帮助我？很好，$r……在你探索者个区域的过程中，只要找到一颗无暇的德莱尼水晶球，就把它带回来给我，我会以你永远都无法想象的财富回报你。",dEN="<race>, can your miniscule brain comprehend the rarity of a flawless sphere of draenethyst? Draenei have spent lifetimes in search of just one of these crystals, only to meet horrible fates, their purpose unfulfilled.\n\nSo you stand before Kum'isha, knowing what Kum'isha has requested and still wish to assist? Very well, <race>... At any time during your travels across these lands, should you find a flawless sphere of draenethyst, return it to me and I shall reward you with riches beyond your wildest dreams.",o="在你探索诅咒之地的旅程中，如果碰巧发现了无暇的德莱尼水晶球，就把它交给收藏家库米沙。\n\n你要知道，这种宝石是整个艾泽拉斯最珍稀的水晶。诅咒之地上的任何一种生物都有可能带着一颗无暇的德莱尼水晶球。\n\n每找到一颗，你都会得到相应的酬劳。",oEN="In your journeys throughout the Blasted Lands, should you ever come across a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere, take the item back to Kum'isha the Collector.\n\nBe warned, this gem is one of the most rare crystals in all of Azeroth. Any creature in these lands could be holding a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere.\n\nYou will be rewarded for each Flawless Draenethyst Sphere you have collected.",p="我一生都在寻找无暇的德莱尼水晶球。整整一生，你明白么，$r？",pEN="I have dedicated my life to the search of flawless draenethyst spheres. A lifetime, <race>!",c="我的眼睛在欺骗我吗？不可能！你从哪儿……怎么会……\n\n也许现在我可以找到一个裂隙，让我们返回家园。",cEN="Do my eyes deceive me? Impossible! Where did you... How...\n\nPerhaps now a rift can be opened, returning us to our homeland."}
Q[2522]={d="虽然召唤传送门的魔法失败了，不过我相信下一次一定能成功。\n\n德莱尼人的希望就象你们$R对财宝的渴望一样强烈，回到这块被诅咒的土地中去，再给我拿回一颗无暇的德莱尼水晶球来。\n\n当然，要不要接受这个任务完全取决于你*咧嘴笑*。",dEN="Even though the portal conjuration was a failure, I remain hopeful that my next attempt will be successful.\n\nThe hope of the Draenei is as fervent as your greed for trinkets, <race>. Go back out into these cursed lands and recover another flawless draenethyst sphere.\n\nOf course, the choice to take on this task is completely left to you *grin*.",o="找到一颗无暇的德莱尼水晶球，把它交给收藏家库米沙。",oEN="Find and return a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere to Kum'isha the Collector.",p="你找到新的德莱尼水晶球了吗？",pEN="Have you found another flawless draenethyst sphere?",c="真是太让我吃惊了！我曾经怀疑你是否能再找一块德莱尼水晶球回来，而它现在就在这儿，在我的手中跳动着。\n\n干得好，$n！\n\n如果你还能再找到一颗——我认为这是不太可能的——就把它交给我，我仍然会付给你相应的报酬。",cEN="Simply amazing. I had doubted that you could find another sphere, yet here it is, pulsating in my hands.\n\nWell done, <name>!\n\nShould you find anymore--and I believe this to be an impossibility--return them to me and I shall reward you again."}
Q[2523]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[2541]={d="这里的瘤背萨满祭司找到了一种可以在德鲁伊休眠时将他的灵魂和肉体分离的方法。熊怪就这样驱使着我的肉身，利用我去袭击那些对班奈希尔兽穴进行侦查的人。现在我沉睡在翡翠梦境里，无法阻止他们。\n\n你一定要帮帮我。瘤背萨满祭司用一种特殊的符咒来完成这种仪式，我希望能研究一下这种咒符。$n，全靠你了。",dEN="The Gnarlpine shaman that inhabit this place have discovered a way of separating a sleeping druid's spirit from the physical body. The furbolg have animated my physical form and are using it to attack anyone that attempts to explore the Ban'ethil Barrow Den. I am now trapped in the Emerald Dream, powerless to stop this.\n\nYou must help me. The Gnarlpine shaman carry a strange charm which is used to perform this ritual, and I'd like to examine it. Please, <name>, bring one to me.",o="将一个萨满巫毒符咒交给班奈希尔兽穴的奥本·怒爪。",oEN="Bring a Shaman Voodoo Charm to Oben Rageclaw in the Ban'ethil Barrow Den.",p="如果我能研究一下那种符咒，也许就能破解瘤背萨满的魔法。你找到符咒了吗？",pEN="If I can examine the charm, I may be able to figure out how to break the enchantment. Have you found one?",c="谢谢你，$n。\n\n这真是个奇怪的小符咒……我可以感受到它散发出的可怕能量，这里面包含了一种极为强大的魔法。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nWhat an odd trinket this is... I can sense the vile aura emanating from it; this is a very powerful enchantment."}
Q[2561]={d="在研究过这个咒符之后，$n，我知道该做什么了。请拿着它，然后照我说的去做。\n\n你必须到班奈希尔兽穴的深处去，在那里，你会发现我那失去灵魂的躯体……虽然我对将要让你这么做感到很遗憾，但是除此之外我找不到其它可以让我摆脱瘤背熊怪控制的办法了。\n\n你必须杀了我的肉身，然后对我的尸体使用巫毒咒符。完成这个任务之后就请回到我这里来。",dEN="After examining this charm, <name>, I see now what must be done. Please take it, and do as I ask.\n\nYou are to explore the deepest areas of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den. There, you will find my soulless body... Although I regret what I am about to tell you, I see no other way to free myself from the control of the Gnarlpine.\n\nIn order for me to escape them, you must kill my physical form. Once that is done, use the voodoo charm on my fallen body. After you have completed this task, please return to me.",o="奥本·怒爪要求你去杀掉他那失去灵魂的身体，然后对其尸体使用巫毒咒符。",oEN="Oben Rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the Voodoo Charm.",p="$n，靠近我的身体时要小心点，它已经被赋予了极强的力量。",pEN="<name>, be wary when approaching my physical form; the enchantment it is under is quite powerful.",c="我终于摆脱了瘤背熊怪的控制。谢谢你，$n。\n\n我的灵魂现在可以在翡翠梦境永远安息了。\n\n也许有一天我们还可以再见面，年轻的$c。不过现在，请你收下这个，它代表了我对你的感激之情。",cEN="I am finally free of the control of the Gnarlpine. Thank you, <name>.\n\nMy spirit may now rest peacefully forever in the Emerald Dream.\n\nPerhaps one day we may meet again, young <class>. But, for now, please accept this reward as a symbol of my gratitude."}
Q[2581]={d="众所周知，鬣狗的颚部拥有巨大的力量，但大到能咬穿三英寸厚的瑟银钢？不可能，难以置信，然而我亲眼见过这样的演示。\n\n深入诅咒之地，给我带回 3 块窃笑者鬣狗的颚骨。寻找窃笑者时，要$g时刻留意:时刻留意;野猪和蝎壳虫：初步化验还需要 2 个被诅咒的野猪肺和 1 只蝎壳虫钳。",dEN="It is a well known fact that hyenas possess tremendous strength in their jowls, but the strength to snap through three inches of thorium steel? Impossible, improbable, and yet I have seen this demonstrated with my own eyes.\n\nVenture forth, into the Blasted Lands, and bring me three snickerfang jowls. As you search for the snickerfang, be on the lookout for boars and scorpoks: The initial assay also requires two blasted boar lungs and one scorpok pincer to complete.",o="收集3个弯牙土狼的颚骨、2片诅咒之地的野猪肺和1个厚甲蝎螯，把它们交给血法师德拉吉亚。",oEN="Bring three Snickerfang Jowls, two Blasted Boar Lungs, and one Scorpok Pincer to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="你身上真臭，$n，是不是在硫磺地里走过了？我要的东西在哪儿？！",pEN="You smell foul, <name>. Have you been traipsing in sulfur fields? And where are my components?!",c="感觉怎么样，$n？你浑身都散发着土狼的气味——你的力量已非凡人可敌了！\n\n不过用你给我弄来的这点原料，我最多只能做这么多药剂了。如果你还想要更多的话，就给我多找些原料来。",cEN="How do you feel, <name>? You radiate with the aura of the snickerfang--your strength, unmatched by mortals!\n\nUnfortunately, with the components you brought to me, I could only make enough of the assay for one tablet. I will require more components, should you require another tablet."}
Q[2582]={d="啊，$n，$g欢迎:欢迎;回来。看来你很享受窃笑者带来的强健、实用的注能效果。但要当心，虽然即时效果是力量的爆发，但对你精神和智力的长期影响可能有害。\n\n话已说明，你还需要更多吗？如果是，就再给我带 3 块窃笑者鬣狗颚骨、2 个被诅咒的野猪肺和 1 只蝎壳虫钳。",dEN="Ah, <name>, welcome back. It seems you enjoyed the effect of the robust, operational imbue, derived from snickerfang. Be warned, while the immediate effect is a titanic burst of strength, the long term effects on your spirit and intelligence could be hazardous.\n\nWith that said, do you require more? If so, bring me another three snickerfang jowls, two blasted boar lungs, and one scorpok pincer.",o="收集3个弯牙土狼的颚骨、2片诅咒之地的野猪肺和1个厚甲蝎螯，把它们交给血法师德拉吉亚。",oEN="Bring three Snickerfang Jowls, two Blasted Boar Lungs, and one Scorpok Pincer to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="你找到我要的那些东西了吗？",pEN="Do you have the beast organs?",c="给你！记住省着点用啊。如果你用完这些还想要的话，就再来找我。",cEN="There you go! Remember, use it sparingly. If you require another, come see me after you finish the one you currently have in your possession."}
Q[2583]={d="诅咒之地有两种野猪：灰鬃野猪和地狱野猪。\n\n看来这些野兽的耐力让它们几乎对任何伤害免疫，因为其他动物觉得它们太难杀死，因此不值得费力。\n\n我们需要进一步分析，$n。如果你给我带 3 个被诅咒的野猪肺、2 只蝎壳虫钳和 1 个石化蜥蜴脑，我就能用化验的残渣调配出一种神圣药剂。你将成为我的$g第一个:第一个;试验品！",dEN="Within these blasted lands exists two species of boar: the ash-mane boar and the helboar.\n\nIt would appear that the stamina of these beasts renders them nearly immune to harm, as the other animals find them too difficult to kill and consequently, not worth the effort.\n\nWe need to perform further analysis, <name>. Should you bring me three blasted boar lungs, two scorpok pincers, and one basilisk brain, I shall create a divine elixir from the residue of the assay. You will be my first test subject!",o="把 3 个被诅咒的野猪肺、2 只蝎壳虫钳和 1 个石化蜥蜴脑带给血法师德拉齐尔。|n",oEN="Bring three Blasted Boar Lungs, two Scorpok Pincers, and one Basilisk Brain to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="我要的原料在哪儿，$n？！",pEN="Where are the organs, <name>!?",c="野猪的力量让你更加强大了，$n！你相信自己可以和那些野猪一样强韧吗？",cEN="The spirit of the boar illuminates your being, <name>! I wonder, do you believe yourself to be as invulnerable as these beasts?"}
Q[2584]={d="$n，当我第一次给你服用那药剂时，我就知道一两次用量满足不了你的胃口。即便现在，我也能从你眼中看到那种饥渴。这合剂有上瘾性，看来连意志最坚定的人也难以抗拒。\n\n那就这样吧！如果你需要更多的肺汁鸡尾酒，就回到荒原，替我找到 3 个被诅咒的野猪肺、2 只蝎壳虫钳和 1 个石化蜥蜴脑。",dEN="When I first administered the elixir, <name>, I could tell that one or two applications would not satiate your appetite. Even now, I can see the hunger in your eyes. The concoction has addictive properties of which, seemingly, the most strong of will cannot resist.\n\nSo be it! Should you require more of the lung juice cocktail, venture back into the wasteland and find for me three blasted boar lungs, two scorpok pincers, and one basilisk brain.",o="把 3 个被诅咒的野猪肺、2 只蝎壳虫钳和 1 个石化蜥蜴脑带给血法师德拉齐尔。|n",oEN="Bring three Blasted Boar Lungs, two Scorpok Pincers, and one Basilisk Brain to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="我要的原料在哪儿，$n？！",pEN="Where are the organs, <name>!?",c="我必须提醒你，$n，不要想把我的药剂混在一起。你最后使用的药剂的药性总是会替换在这之前所使用的药剂，所以别用了这个又用那个，白白浪费宝贵的药剂。",cEN="I must warn you, <name>, do not attempt to mix the formulas I have created. The chemical properties of the formula you most recently ingested will always take precedence over former enchantments; thus, rendering the other formulation null."}
Q[2585]={d="你见过它们战斗吗，$n？我是说那些蝎壳虫。你见过它们动作的优雅与敏捷吗？见过它们打击的果断吗？\n\n如果我们能设法分离那种敏捷并把它封装起来，我们就会富得……我是说……那将是科学界的巨大福音。\n\n帮帮我，$n，我就让你尝一份化验样品。\n\n要制成一份稳定的样本，我需要 3 只蝎壳虫钳、2 个秃鹫砂囊和 1 个被诅咒的野猪肺。",dEN="Have you ever watched them in battle, <name>? The scorpoks, I mean. Have you ever seen the grace and agility with which they move? The decisiveness of their strikes?\n\nIf only we could somehow isolate that agility and encapsulate it, we would be wealthy beyond our... I mean... it would be a boon for the scientific community.\n\nAssist me, <name>, and I shall allow you a sampling of the assay.\n\nIn order to create a stable sample, I will need three scorpok pincers, two vulture gizzards, and one blasted boar lung.",o="把 3 只蝎壳虫钳、2 个秃鹫砂囊和 1 个被诅咒的野猪肺带给血法师德拉齐尔。|n",oEN="Bring three Scorpok Pincers, two Vulture Gizzards, and one Blasted Boar Lung to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="我要的原料在哪儿，$n？！",pEN="Where are the organs, <name>!?",c="太棒了！这是我遇到的最难分析的东西。\n\n拿一撮残余的盐放在舌头下面，你会感到有点兴奋，之后就会发现自己具有惊人的敏捷和速度。",cEN="Fascinating. This has been the most difficult of all assays to analyze.\n\nTake a pinch of this residual salt and place it under your tongue. You should experience a slight feeling of euphoria followed by a state of unprecedented agility and quickness."}
Q[2586]={d="你还$g活着:活着;！这真是好消息。我猜你是回来要更多蝎壳虫化验粉末的，对吧？\n\n很好，$n，回到荒原去，凑齐 3 只蝎壳虫钳、2 个秃鹫砂囊和 1 个被诅咒的野猪肺再回来。",dEN="You live! This is good news, indeed. I assume you are back for more of the scorpok assay?\n\nVery well, <name>, back to the wasteland with you and do not return until you have collected three scorpok pincers, two vulture gizzards, and one blasted boar lung.",o="收集3个厚甲蝎螯、2个秃鹫的砂囊和1片诅咒之地的野猪肺，把它们血法师德拉吉亚。",oEN="Bring three Scorpok Pincers, two Vulture Gizzards, and one Blasted Boar Lung to Bloodmage Drazial.",p="我要的原料在哪儿，$n？！",pEN="Where are the organs, <name>!?",c="干得很好，$n。这份是给你试用的样品，剩下的九份我要留着做研究。\n\n如果你需要更多厚甲蝎药粉的话，就回到这儿来跟我交易。",cEN="Fine work, <name>. Here is one sample of the assay for you and the remaining nine will be used in my research.\n\nAnytime you require more of the ground scorpok assay, return to me and we shall work out a deal."}
Q[2601]={d="这块荒地上到处都是红石蜥蜴，$n。这些蜥蜴的族群比这里的其它任何生物都要兴旺。\n\n我曾经在远处观察过它们的捕猎和其它日常活动——这些野兽表现出了某种思考过程，它们的智商甚至比某些人型生物还要高。\n\n我得研究一下他们的脑子！\n\n给我找十颗蜥蜴的大脑来，$n。还有，你必须再找两个秃鹫的砂囊，否则我就无法完成药物的配制。",dEN="These wastelands are riddled with redstone basilisk, <name>. These basilisk have adapted and flourished, more so than any of the other wildlife within the region.\n\nI have watched from afar as they hunt and go about their daily activities - the beasts exhibit a thought process more complex than even some humanoids.\n\nI must study their brains!\n\nRetrieve ten of their brains for me, <name>. The compound cannot be complete, however, without two vulture gizzards to form the base of the solution.",o="把 10 个石化蜥蜴脑和 2 个秃鹫砂囊带给血法师琳诺尔。|n",oEN="Bring ten Basilisk Brains and two Vulture Gizzards to Bloodmage Lynnore.",p="你弄到我要的那些动物器官了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the requested organs?",c="这简直是奇迹，$n！我可以让你欣赏一下红石蜥蜴的内部构造。\n\n如果你对这种药物有兴趣的话，我也可以为你多做一点……当然，不是免费的。",cEN="This is wondrous, <name>! My offering to you is a taste of the inner workings of the redstone basilisk.\n\nShould the compound be to your liking, more can always be made... for a price."}
Q[2602]={d="你这么快就没了兴致？还得做更多研究！\n\n哦，是的，价钱照旧，$n。去诅咒之地，给我带回 10 个红石石化蜥蜴的脑子和 2 个秃鹫砂囊。|n",dEN="Your focused concentration has dwindled so soon? More research must be done!\n\nOh yes, the price remains the same, <name>. Venture forth into the blasted lands and return to me with ten brains from the redstone and two vulture gizzards.",o="收集10颗石化蜥蜴的大脑和2个秃鹫的砂囊，把它们交给血法师莱诺雷。",oEN="Bring ten Basilisk Brains and two Vulture Gizzards to Bloodmage Lynnore.",p="你弄到我要的那些动物器官了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the requested organs?",c="好，给我点时间，你就能得到更多的药物了，$n。\n\n拿着……还有，$n，不要在短时间内连续使用这些东西，那样可能会带来灾难性的结果。",cEN="Yes, yes, give me a moment and more of the compound will be ready for your consumption, <name>.\n\nTake it... and <name>, do not attempt to consume these experimental concoctions in rapid succession. The results could be disastrous."}
Q[2603]={d="在这片受诅咒的土地上，死亡确实长了翅膀，$r。我见过那些黑色杀手和食骨者大啖许多倒下探险者的尸体——甚至啃食最污秽、最病态的腐尸。它们的体内系统竟然能战胜笼罩这片土地的瘟疫，真是奇迹。\n\n协助我的研究吧，$n！我需要砂囊！调配基底还需要两块窃笑者鬣狗颚骨。\n\n你的努力将得到双倍回报。",dEN="Death does indeed have wings in these blasted lands, <race>. I have witnessed the black slayers and bonepickers feasting upon the corpse of many a fallen explorer - sometimes feeding upon the most vile and disease ridden of carcasses. It is a wonder, then, how their internal systems overcome the pestilence that claims these lands.\n\nAssist me in my studies, <name>! Gizzards I need! Two snickerfang jowls will also be required for the base of the concoction.\n\nYou shall be rewarded two-fold for your efforts.",o="把 10 个秃鹫砂囊和 2 块窃笑者鬣狗颚骨带给血法师琳诺尔。|n",oEN="Bring ten Vulture Gizzards and two Snickerfang Jowls to Bloodmage Lynnore.",p="不要浪费我的时间，$n。我们没什么可以讨论的——除非你已经找到了我要的东西。",pEN="Do not waste my time, <name>. We have nothing to discuss, unless you have recovered the items I have requested.",c="非常出色！我要立刻开始工作了。也许我能找到一种包治百病的方法！\n\n啊，对了，当然还有你的报酬——如果你想要更多砂囊口香糖的话，就回到我这儿来，继续帮我收集原料，然后我就可以帮你再做几份。",cEN="Most excellent! I shall get to work immediately. Perhaps a cure for many of the ailments of the world is to be found!\n\nAh yes, your reward - of course, should you require more of the gum, return to me and another task you shall be given."}
Q[2604]={d="我看到你体内的火已经消退。你说那种精神上的欣快持续了一个小时吗？\n\n如果你还想要更多砂囊口香糖，我就需要更多砂囊。回荒原去，$n。凑齐 10 个砂囊和 2 块颚骨再回来。",dEN="I see that the inner fire has dwindled. Would you say the spiritual euphoria lasted an hour?\n\nIf it's more of the gizzard gum you desire, then more of the gizzards I require. Back to the wastelands, <name>. Do not return until you have recovered ten gizzards and two jowls.",o="把 10 个秃鹫砂囊和 2 块窃笑者鬣狗颚骨带给血法师琳诺尔。|n",oEN="Bring ten Vulture Gizzards and two Snickerfang Jowls to Bloodmage Lynnore.",p="不要浪费我的时间，$n。我们没什么可以讨论的——除非你已经找到了我要的东西。",pEN="Do not waste my time, <name>. We have nothing to discuss, unless you have recovered the items I have requested.",c="也许有一天我可以分离出这种药物中的活性酵素，然后用它制成更有效的药物。不过，现在你只能用我现在做出来的这种东西。如果你需要更多口香糖的话，就回来找我吧。",cEN="Perhaps one day I shall be able to isolate the active enzymes of this assay and produce a much more efficient resultant. Unfortunately, you will have to settle for what I am currently able to produce. Return to me should you require more gizzard gum."}
Q[2605]={d="我有个主意。我听说西南方住着一种叫露水收集者的奇怪生物……它们能把水储存在特殊的腺体里。\n\n我想，如果我能弄到这样一个腺体，就能调配出一种解我可怕干渴的饮料！你觉得你能帮我吗，$n？\n\n去找那片仙人掌园，$n，露水收集者就在那里。",dEN="I've got an idea, see. I've heard of some strange creatures called dew collectors that live to the southwest... and that they are able to store water in special glands.\n\nI think that if I could get one of these glands, I could create a drink that would quench my terrible thirst! Do you think you could help me, <name>?\n\nLook for the cactus garden, <name>; that's where you'll find the dew collectors.",o="找到1个饱满的露水腺，把它交给加基森的马林·诺格弗格。",oEN="Collect a Laden Dew Gland and bring it to Marin Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan.",p="求求你，快给我把露水腺弄来吧！",pEN="Please, tell me you found the dew collectors?",c="哦，太棒了！快拿来——让我喝一口！",cEN="Oh, wonderful! Give it here -- let me drink it!"}
Q[2606]={d="呸！这个东西真难吃！这个主意也不过如此嘛……\n\n等等，你说什么？哦，我知道，我知道，你认为我不该就这么放弃它。那么，好吧。\n\n对了，我有个主意！一个妙极了的主意！去和我朋友斯普琳科谈谈吧——她是个出色的厨师。告诉她我们想做什么，还有我们想要知道加点什么才能把让人这东西咽下去。\n\n我的意思是，如果它这么难吃的话，总得让它有些让人兴奋的东西才行……可是我现在就是感觉不到。",dEN="Blech! This stuff tastes terrible! So much for that idea...\n\nWait, what's that? Oh, I know, I know, you think I shouldn't give up on this stuff. Well, okay then.\n\nUhhhh, I have an idea! Brilliant! Take this dew to my friend Sprinkle -- she's an excellent chef. Tell her what we're up to here and that we want to make it go down a little easier.\n\nI mean, if it's going to taste that bad, it at least should have some kick to it... And I'm just not feeling it...",o="马林·诺格弗格让你与加基森的斯普琳科谈一谈。",oEN="Marin Noggenfogger wants you to speak with Sprinkle in Gadgetzan.",p="老马林又需要我的帮助了吗？这玩意是用什么做的？",pEN="So old Marin's up to it again, eh? What's this concoction made from?",c="马林心眼不错，只是有一点点古怪。\n\n当然，他又一次需要我的帮助了。为什么我要说又呢……",cEN="Marin's a good guy, don't get me wrong -- just a little... eccentric, I'd say.\n\nAnd of course he needs my help, yet again."}
Q[2607]={d="看样子你带来的消息比我想象的还要多。这的确是一个奇怪的转折点，$n。\n\n解药？嗯……到地窖里去跟道克·米希匹克斯谈谈吧——他也许能提供点帮助。",dEN="It appears as if you've brought back more information than even I expected. This certainly is a strange turn of events, <name>.\n\nA cure? Hrm... Go down to the cellar and speak with Doc Mixilpixil - he may be able to help.",o="到兵营的地窖里去和道克·米希匹克斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Doc Mixilpixil in the cellar of the Barracks.",c="很好！把乳酪放在桌上就赶紧走吧。奥斯伯会在你出去时付钱给你的。",cEN="It's about time! Just put the cheese on the table and skedaddle. Osborne will pay you on the way out."}
Q[2608]={d="天哪！你看起来$g像:像;死了一样。更正——我见过死人，你比死人还难看。$g先生:女士;，你大概就是死神上次体检时咳出来的东西。\n\n哈！听见了吗，诺姆？记下来！\n\n*咳嗽* 嗯，是的。为了帮你，我得抽点血。别担心，只有前几次……大概五十次左右……会疼……等你$g准备好:准备好;接受治疗就躺下，$n。",dEN="Oh my, you look like death. Correction - I've seen death, you look worse than death. You, <sir/miss>, would be what death coughed up at his last physical.\n\nHah! You hear that Noarm? Write that one down!\n\n*Cough* Hrm yes, in order for me to help you, I'll need to draw some blood. Don't worry, it only hurts the first few... fifty times or so... /lay down when you're ready for the treatment, <name>.",o="躺下让米克西皮克西医生检查。他找不到病因，又怎能找到疗法？|n",oEN="/Lay down to be examined by Doc Mixilpixil. How can he find the cure if he can't find the cause?",p="等你$g准备好:准备好;接受检查，就躺到地上，我开始放血。",pEN="When you're ready for the examination, /lay down on the ground and I'll begin the phlebotomy.",c="等我和同事们交换一下意见，$n。蒙特高莫医生，诺拉姆先生，让我们来讨论一下吧！",cEN="Give me a moment to confer with my colleagues, <name>. Dr. Montgomery, Mr. Noarm, let us conference!"}
Q[2621]={d="悔恨。这就是我现在所剩的一切。一个糟糕的决定引出了好几桩可怕的后果。我当时为什么就不等等那些命令呢？！也许命令里写明了那片受诅咒的土地上等待着我们的恐怖！又或者它们会把我们调往别处？归根结底，是我的错。全都是我的错。\n\n所以我站在这儿，等待命令。我必须知道。我必须拿到那些命令。\n\n调度指挥官鲁格住在斯通纳德。找到他，查明那些命令后来怎么样了。|n",dEN="Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault.\n\nSo here I stand, awaiting orders. I must know. I must have those orders.\n\nDispatch Commander Ruag resides in Stonard. Find him and find out what became of the orders.",o="与斯通纳德的分队指挥官鲁尔格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Dispatch Commander Ruag at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",c="萨尔近卫军……我还清清楚楚地记得那可怕的一幕。\n\n<指挥官卢尔格摇了摇头。>\n\n这个军团经历了可怕的遭遇。部落也因此失去了最好的一批士兵。",cEN="Thrall's Grasp... The story is still fresh in my mind.\n\n<Commander Ruag shakes his head>\n\nTerrible thing that happened to that regiment. The horde lost some of its best soldiers when that battalion was destroyed."}
Q[2622]={d="命令？你要命令干什么？\n\n你在暗示什么，$n？我当然转达了那些命令！我派去送命令的士兵遭到伏击，被鱼人狠狠揍了一顿。只有一个人活了下来，如果那能叫活的话。他几乎说不出话，走不了路，还得靠管子喂食。如果你想知道那些命令怎么了，去问本戈尔。他肯定就在这附近……还有，$n，小心你把自己的鼻子伸到什么地方去——它可能会被一口咬掉。",dEN="The orders? What could you possibly want with the orders?\n\nWhat are you implying, <name>? Of course I relayed those orders! The soldiers I sent the orders with were ambushed and brutally beaten by murlocs. Only one survived, if you can call that surviving. He can hardly speak, cannot walk, and must be fed through a tube. If you want to know what happened to those orders, speak with Bengor. I'm sure he is around here somewhere... and, <name>, be mindful of what you stick your nose into - it may get bitten off.",o="与本戈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Bengor at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",c="沼……沼泽……空谈者……",cEN="Swamp tal... talk.. talker..."}
Q[2623]={d="命令是调度指挥官下的。我们接……接到了命令。在前往诅咒之地的路上，遭伏击。\n\n鱼人……很多鱼人……一个叫沼泽语者的。一根长矛刺进我的头颅时，他从我手里夺走了命令。东边……洞穴……\n\n<本戈尔昏了过去。>|n",dEN="Orders were given by the dispatch commander. We took... took orders. On way to Blasted Lands, ambushed.\n\nMurlocs... Many murlocs... One named Swamp Talker. Took orders from my hands as spear thrust into my skull. East... cave....\n\n<Bengor passes out.>",o="取回酋长的命令，把它们还给部落英雄的灵魂。",oEN="Retrieve the Warchief's Orders and return them to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",p="等待命令。",pEN="Awaiting orders.",c="比我想象中的更糟糕。如果我不是那么冲动的话，我手下的十九个兄弟本来可以免受那些痛苦。\n\n你一定要帮帮他们，$n！我已经无能为力了。",cEN="It is worse than I imagined. Nineteen of my men could have been spared from the agony which they faced. If only I had not acted so irrationally.\n\nYou must help them, <name>! I am powerless to act."}
Q[2641]={d="我小时候，做饭的一直是我姐姐。那真是太可怕了！她的一些汤汤水水简直难以下咽——直到我发现了自己称之为\"秘密\"的配料！往任何东西里一加……哇！味道好极了！\n\n你问是什么？是一种叫紫色特拉根的蘑菇。如果你想让我帮你把这难喝的玩意儿变得能吃，就去腹地，找那里的一处小湖。\n\n哦，记住，紫色特拉根只在水下生长。",dEN="When I was a kid, my sister used to do all the cooking. It was horrible! I could barely stomach some of her concoctions -- until I found what I like to call my \"secret\" ingredient! Add it to anything, and... WOW! It tastes great!\n\nWhat is it, you ask? It's a mushroom called the Violet Tragan. If you want me to help you turn this horrid-tasting brew into something edible, head to the Hinterlands, and look for a small lake there.\n\nOh, and remember, the Violet Tragan can only be found underwater.",o="加基森的斯普琳科要你去给她找到一颗紫色水生菇。",oEN="Sprinkle in Gadgetzan wants you to collect a Violet Tragan and return it to her.",p="那片湖的水下是唯一能找到紫色特拉根的地方。希望你很擅长憋气！",pEN="Under the waters of that lake -- it's the only place where the Violet Tragan can be found. Hope you're good at holding your breath!",c="就是这个，$n！\n\n它看起来很不错，哈哈！",cEN="That's the stuff, <name>!\n\nIt looks so good, I might just... Haha, gotcha!"}
Q[2661]={d="这是紫色粉末，$n，把它交给马林，告诉他，他欠我一个人情！",dEN="Here's the Violet Powder, <name>. Take it to Marin and tell him he owes me a favor!",o="斯普琳科让你把紫色粉末交给加基森的马林·诺格弗格。",oEN="Sprinkle wants to you take the Violet Powder to Marin Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan.",p="哦，$n，你终于回来了。你带什么东西回来了吗？",pEN="Oh, <name>, you're finally back. What have you brought?",c="紫色粉末？让我们试试它的效果吧——反正情况不会变得更糟了，这一点可以肯定！",cEN="Violet Powder, eh? Let's give it a try -- it sure couldn't make it any worse, that's for sure!"}
Q[2662]={d="现在，把这些粉末和露水混合在一起。\n\n等会儿再回来找我……那时我应该已经完成效力惊人的诺格弗格药剂了！",dEN="Now, to mix this powder in with the dew.\n\nCome back and talk to me in a minute... after I have perfected the fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir!",o="马林·诺格弗格让你在他制成药剂之后再去找他。",oEN="Marin Noggenfogger wants you to speak to him again after he creates his elixir.",c="喝一口！简直太棒了！！！\n\n我就知道我能行……哦，再次感谢你的帮助，$n，不过请你往旁边站一点，好吗？你挡住我做生意了！我要靠这款绝妙的诺格弗格药剂赚上几百万，几百万！\n\n什么？斯普林克尔说我还欠她一个人情？哦，那个斯普林克尔，真会开玩笑！",cEN="Drink this! It's absolutely wonderful!!!\n\nI knew I had it in me... Oh thanks again, <name> for your help, but please, stand a little to the side, will you? You're blocking my business! I'm going to make millions on the fabulous Noggenfogger Elixir, millions!\n\nWhat's that? Sprinkle says I owe her a favor? Oh, that Sprinkle, such a kidder!"}
Q[2681]={d="你$g一个人:一个人;是打不过拉泽利赫的部队和他的手下的。\n\n召集一队得力的冒险者，把我的人从永恒的折磨中解救出来！你们必须击碎 18 块石头。\n\n奋力战斗，光荣赴死，$n。",dEN="It will take more than you alone to overcome the forces of Razelikh and his subordinates.\n\nGather a suitable group of adventurers and free my men of their eternal torture! Eighteen stones you must shatter.\n\nFight hard and die with honor, <name>.",o="解救九个拉瑟莱克的仆从、三个瑟温妮的仆从、三个奥利斯塔的仆从和三个戈洛尔的仆从。完成任务后，回到部落英雄的灵魂这里。",oEN="Free nine Servants of Razelikh, three Servants of Sevine, three Servants of Allistarj, and three Servants of Grol. Return to the Fallen Hero when your task is complete. You must remain within close proximity of the stones or the process will fail.",p="这个任务可不简单，$n。不要轻易放弃！",pEN="It is no easy task, <name>. Do not give up!",c="你成功了，$n！那些饱受折磨的可怜灵魂终于可以安息了。\n\n不过我们的工作还没结束，$n。我们还有很多事要讨论，很多事要做。",cEN="You have done it, <name>! The poor, tortured souls can finally rest.\n\nOur work is not yet over, <name>. We have much to discuss and much more to accomplish."}
Q[2701]={d="请收下这件古老的遗物。我们已不再需要它了。\n\n愿它在你对抗燃烧军团的战斗中助你一臂之力。|n",dEN="Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item.\n\nMay it serve you well in your fight against the legion.",o="打开箱子，取走你的酬劳。",oEN="Open the chest and claim your reward.",c="突如其来的火花和光芒让你暂时失明。",cEN="You are temporarily blinded by the sparkle and gleam."}
Q[2702]={d="你用你高尚的行动和英勇的表现为我赢得了荣誉，$n。\n\n你也为他们赢得了荣誉……",dEN="You have honored me with your nobility and heroism, <name>.\n\nYou have also honored them...",o="和桑德·裂蹄谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Corporal Thund Splithoof.",c="你的确为我们大家赢得了荣誉。我真是不知道该如何谢你。",cEN="Indeed, you have honored us all. Our thanks alone are not sufficient."}
Q[2721]={d="你已完成了一次冒险，现在又有新的冒险在等着你，$n。\n\n我有个手下至今下落不明，他应该在诅咒之地的某个地方，我说的就是基利斯中尉。\n\n我告诉过你，我和他当时被奥利斯塔囚禁起来严刑拷打，可怜的基利斯……他的意志力变得越来越薄弱。在我的牢房里都能听到他受刑的声音，他的惨叫在山洞里回荡。那是我最后一次听见基利斯的声音。",dEN="As one chapter of your adventure closes, another one begins, <name>.\n\nOne of my men is still unaccounted for, lost somewhere in the Blasted Lands. I am talking about Lieutenant Kirith, of course.\n\nAs I had mentioned earlier, we were both imprisoned and tortured by Allistarj, but poor Kirith, his strength of will faltered. I could hear the experiments from my cage; the tortured screams rang through the halls of the cave. That was the last I saw or heard of Kirith.",o="找到基利斯的下落。",oEN="Find out what became of Lieutenant Kirith.",c="特雷博？特雷博让你来的？",cEN="Trebor? Trebor sent you?"}
Q[2741]={p="超级测蛋器是克格尔·曲藤的最新成果，看起来真是令人印象深刻。\n\n你刚刚接触到超级测蛋器的控制面板，它就劈啪作响了起来。",pEN="The Super Egg-O-Matic is the latest of Curgle Cranklehop's inventions. It is quite an impressive piece of machinery.\n\nThe Super Egg-O-Matic sputters wildly as you approach the control panel.",c="你将角鹰兽的蛋放入机器，随后里面传来了一些奇怪的机械声响和嘟嘟声。\n\n似乎测蛋器正在为这颗蛋称重、测量和包装。真是快捷又完善的服务！",cEN="You place the hippogryph egg into the machine. A series of beeps follows along with some strange mechanical sounds.\n\nIt appears that the Eggometer has weighed, measured, and packaged your egg. Now that's speedy service!"}
Q[2742]={d="嗨，$R！\n\n林吉丢了斧头，还被抓了！求求你，帮林吉逃出去。林吉知道像你这样的$r$g不喜欢林吉的族人:不喜欢林吉的族人;，但林吉求你了！一定要离开这里！\n\n如果好心的$r帮林吉逃出去，林吉有东西给$r……\n\n林吉在俯瞰崖藏了个秘密。",dEN="Hey <race>!\n\nRin'ji lost axe and was captured! Please, help Rin'ji escape. Me know that <race> like you don't like Rin'ji's kind, but Rin'ji begs! Must get out of here!\n\nGot something for nice <race> if <he helps Rin'ji out of here/she helps Rin'ji out of here>...\n\nRin'ji is hiding something secret at the Overlook Cliffs.",o="护送林吉逃出奎尔丹尼小屋，然后在望海崖找到他藏起来的东西。",oEN="Escort Rin'ji out of the Quel'Danil Lodge, then find his hidden secret at the Overlook Cliffs to the east.",p="林吉害怕！",pEN="Rin'ji is scared!",c="这块石板一定是林吉所说的那个秘密。\n\n上面刻着一些奇怪的符号，你无法解读。",cEN="This troll tablet must be the \"secret\" that Rin'ji was talking about.\n\nCovered with strange markings, you can not decipher what the tablet says."}
Q[2743]={d="我们别绕弯子了，$r；我在这里的时间有限。\n\n你必须摧毁保护恶魔领主拉泽利赫的三重力量。这可不是解救一个受诅咒的灵魂那么简单。\n\n<基里思咧嘴一笑。>\n\n你看，拉泽利赫的每个手下脖子上都挂着一块护符碎片，那是拉泽利赫的造物。而它正是你召唤那位大恶魔所需的护符。\n\n回去找特雷博，告诉他召唤拉泽利赫需要什么。他会给你其余的指示。",dEN="Let us not mince words, <race>; my time here is limited.\n\nYou must destroy the triad of power which protects the demon lord, Razelikh. Doing so will not be as simple a task as freeing a damned soul.\n\n<Kirith grins.>\n\nYou see, each of Razelikh's underlings wears a third of an amulet of Razelikh's creation around their neck. The very same amulet you will need in order to summon the arch demon.\n\nReturn to Trebor and tell him what is required to summon Razelikh. He will be able to instruct you further.",o="回去见部落英雄的灵魂，将你的发现告诉他。",oEN="Return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde with your findings.",c="$n，这个恶魔领主表现出的狡诈与他的残暴一样令我震惊。",cEN="The demon lord displays a cunning almost as calculated as his brutality, <name>."}
Q[2744]={d="那三个魔王受到拉瑟莱克的保护。\n\n为了让他们忠诚地为他效力，拉瑟莱克使他们在诅咒之地可以使用几乎无限的力量。他们佩带的护符和他们的命运联系在一起，并使他们变得不老不死。只要他们待在诅咒之地，你就没法杀了他们，他们的生命力可以维持到世界末日。\n\n我认识一个也许可以帮助你的朋友，$n。到艾萨拉地区的小岛上去找恶魔猎手洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯谈谈吧。",dEN="The triad is protected by Razelikh.\n\nIn exchange for their servitude, Razelikh granted each of them nearly unlimited power within the Blasted Lands. The amulet pieces are each attuned to the lifeforce of their owner, granting them immortality. As long as they remain within the Blasted Lands, they cannot be slain, their life spans extended until the end of days.\n\nThere is one who may be able to assist you further, <name>. Travel to Azshara and find the demon hunter, Loramus Thalipedes. Search the islands.",o="与艾萨拉的洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Loramus Thalipedes in Azshara.",p="你在这里做什么？",pEN="What are you doing here?",c="我可以帮你。不过，我觉得你还不清楚你将面对的是什么。",cEN="I will help you. Although, I do not think you fully understand what you are up against."}
Q[2745]={d="嗯，真是个有趣的故事，而且我们还要认真对待它。好吧，我可以帮你，但如果你想成功的话，就必须采用某种……正义而非法的手段。\n\n我们要赶快解决莱斯科瓦和马尔松，你认为你能胜任吗？\n\n你必须下定决心，到城堡里去找我的一个老朋友，一个名叫泰里恩的侏儒。几星期来他一直在监视着莱斯科瓦，他可以帮你解决这件事。",dEN="Hmm, an interesting tale, and not one to be taken lightly. Yeah, I can help you, but what you need to do is divvy out a form of justice that's not... legal, if you're to see this through to the end.\n\nLescovar and Marzon need to be dealt with, and swiftly. Do you think you're capable of such a thing?\n\nYou decide. If so, then make haste to the castle and find an old friend of mine, a gnome named Tyrion. He's been watching Lescovar now for a couple weeks. He should be able to help you end this.",o="与暴风城堡的泰里恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tyrion in Stormwind Castle.",c="你是谁？！别那样偷偷摸摸地走到我后面来！小声点！你到底在干啥？没看见我很忙吗，你这个蠢货？\n\n你说什么？我在干啥？我在等下一个黑暗之门被打开，你以为我在干啥？在卫兵发现我们两个一起藏在灌木丛中之前赶紧走开……我要维护我的声誉。",cEN="What the...?! Don't sneak up on me like that! And keep your voice down! What in the name of the Shadow are doing sneakin' up on me for? Can't you see I'm busy, you daft fool?\n\nWhat do you mean, what am I doing? I'm waiting for the next Dark Portal to open, what the heck do you think I'm doing? Speak your peace and be off with you... 'fore the guards notice the two of us hiding in the bushes together. I have a reputation to maintain."}
Q[2746]={d="提亚斯要加快实施计划了吗？好吧，我们可以做到，不过我还没准备好。你知道，我要做的是最困难的部分，而你是负责动手的人，明白吗？很好。\n\n我要让你先帮我准备些东西，这样我就可以对间谍机器人进行伪装，让它安全地骗过那些守卫。\n\n给我带回一些丝绸和几只苹果来。丝绸你自己去找，不过城外那个克拉拉的小农场上有非常合适的苹果。",dEN="Trias wants the timetable pushed up some, huh? Okay, we can do that, but I'm not ready. And know this, I'm doing the hard part, but you're the one that's going to get <his/her> hands dirty, understand? Good.\n\nOkay, I'll need you to get me a few things before I can put my plan into effect. I got the perfect disguise that'll get Spybot past those guards.\n\nBring me some silk and a couple apples. The silk's up to you, but Clara's little farm right outside the city has the perfect sized apples.",o="将3块丝绸和2只克拉拉的新鲜苹果交给暴风城的泰里恩。",oEN="Bring 3 Silk Cloth and 2 of Clara's Fresh Apples to Tyrion in Stormwind.",p="我已经监视莱斯科瓦好几个星期了。提亚斯一直不相信他，不过我们并不认为他和迪菲亚兄弟会有什么牵连，我们所追踪的线索表明他和暮光之锤有一定的联系。不管怎样，他已经变得越来越危险，越来越难对付，我们应该插手了。\n\n把那些东西找来，我们就可以执行计划了。",pEN="I've been watching Lescovar for a couple weeks now. Trias has never trusted him, but we didn't suspect he was involved in anything to do with the Defias Brotherhood. We were following leads that tied him to the Twilight's Hammer. Either way, he's become more dangerous than this city can deal with, and that's where we come in.\n\nGet me those items and we can put my plan into effect.",c="有这些东西就行了，$n。你干得很好。\n\n我的其余工具都在我的包里……感谢圣光，我还有个裁缝朋友可以帮我做一只丝绸包。我都快要装不下这一大堆东西了！\n\n在继续执行计划之前，我们得把一切细节都安排好，这样你就知道你具体需要做些什么了。",cEN="These will do nicely, <name>. Great job.\n\nI have the rest of the gear I'll need in my pack... thank the Light I just got a tailor friend of mine to make me a silk bag. I was running out of room carrying all my gear around.\n\nBefore Spybot heads in, let's get the details set so you know what you have to do."}
Q[2747]={p="我很少看见从菲拉斯送来的蛋有如此完好的。这些蛋真的十分罕见……",pEN="I have seen very few eggs retrieved from Feralas in extraordinary condition. These are eggs of the rarest sort...",c="好吧，我给你一个——大惊喜！\n\n希望你能永远记住今天！",cEN="Well now, you have one--amazing!\n\nI hope you always remember the good you have done today."}
Q[2748]={p="在理想的条件下，一只优良的蛋应该可以丝毫不受戈杜尼巨魔咒语的影响，完全正常地孵化出来。",pEN="A fine egg is one that will, in ideal conditions, hatch free of the evil effects of the Gordunni ogres' incantations.",c="很好，$n。我会把这只蛋送到达纳苏斯去，希望它可以在那里孵化！\n\n这是我对你的小小谢意，请收下它。",cEN="Very good, <name>. I will be sending this egg to Darnassus where I hope it will soon hatch!\n\nPlease accept this as a symbol of my gratitude."}
Q[2749]={p="普通的鹰角兽的蛋只有一半的孵化机会。我们尽力培育它们，只要再有点运气，就能成功孵化。",pEN="Ordinary hippogryph eggs hatch about half the time. We do our best to nurture them and with a little luck, they will hatch.",c="你找到了一只普通的蛋，$n？请把它交给我……我们只能往好的方面想了。\n\n我没有多少钱，不过请收下你的报酬。如果你再去菲拉斯的话，别忘了帮我带些蛋回来。",cEN="So, you have found an ordinary egg, <name>? Please give it to me... And we can only hope for the best.\n\nI don't have much, but please accept this reward. If you ever find yourself in Feralas again, know that I am always here to take the eggs you find there."}
Q[2750]={p="这些蛋没有任何价值——它们永远无法孵化。",pEN="These are the eggs that cannot be saved -- they will never hatch.",c="我有个坏消息要告诉你，$n。这颗蛋实在是无法满足要求，我可以帮你把它处理掉。\n\n不要灰心，我们总不可能把它们都孵出来。如果你要再去菲拉斯的话，就继续帮我找些蛋回来吧。",cEN="I am afraid I have bad news for you, <name>. This egg is too far gone. I can take it from you so that it may be disposed of properly.\n\nPlease don't be discouraged; we cannot save them all. If you find yourself in Feralas again, please try again. Bring another egg for the Super Egg-O-Matic!"}
Q[2751]={d="这只铁锤在沃姆什家族中传了二十代，$n。我们熔铸的铁有成千上万吨。不幸的是，这门技艺到了奥罗克手中却传不下去了，这是沃姆什家族的耻辱——我既没有亲属，又无法生育后代。\n\n决不能让沃姆什的祖传技艺和我一起死去！必须有人继承它，不管他是不是沃姆什家族的后裔！\n\n向奥罗克证明你的能力吧，$n。给奥罗克找来这些东西：两副青铜花纹护腕，两把青铜巨剑和两只锋利的爪子。把这些找来，我们再继续。",dEN="Twenty generations of Omosh have held this hammer, <name>. A hundred thousand tons of metal we have molded. Tragically, it all ends at Orokk, failure of the Omosh: Without kin and incapable of producing offspring.\n\nI cannot let the secret recipes of Omosh die with me! Someone must continue the legacy, Omosh or not!\n\nProve to Orokk you are capable, <name>. Bring for Orokk the following: Two patterned bronze bracers, two bronze greatswords, and two sharp claws. Bring them for Orokk and we shall continue.",o="把 2 副花纹青铜护腕、2 把青铜巨剑和 2 只锐利之爪带给奥格瑞玛的奥罗克·奥莫什。|n",oEN="Bring two Patterned Bronze Bracers, two Bronze Greatswords, and two Sharp Claws to Orokk Omosh in Orgrimmar.",p="青铜，$n！更多的青铜！",pEN="Bronze, <name>! More bronze!!",c="血脉会消逝，但也许奥莫什的传说会延续下去！\n\n你证明了自己是:是一名$g铁匠:铁匠;，$n。对铁匠而言，回报就是看着自己的武器和护甲沾满敌人鲜血时的那份满足！\n\n愿你为后世打造的胸甲浸透敌人的鲜血！",cEN="The bloodline will fade but perhaps the legend of Omosh will continue!\n\nYou have proven that you are a blacksmith, <name>. For the blacksmith the reward is the satisfaction of seeing their weapons and armors coated in the blood of their enemies!\n\nMay the breastplates you create for the generations ahead be drenched in the blood of your enemies!"}
Q[2752]={d="奥罗克可以看出你眼中的渴望，$n。你像海绵一样渴望吸收沃姆什的智慧。\n\n我会教你三样东西！\n\n到铁砧那边去，感受熔炉的热量，为奥罗克铸造四把青铜战斧和四把青铜战锤，然后你才能学习制造铁肩铠。",dEN="Orokk sees the eagerness in your eyes, <name>. Like a sponge you soak in the wisdom of the Omosh.\n\nThree lessons I shall teach!\n\nReturn to the anvil, soak in the heat of the forge, create for Orokk four bronze battleaxes and four bronze warhammers. Only then will you learn of the iron pauldron.",o="将4把青铜战斧和4把青铜战锤交给奥格瑞玛的奥罗克·沃姆什。",oEN="Bring four Bronze Battleaxes and four Bronze Warhammers to Orokk Omosh in Orgrimmar.",p="向我展示你的技艺吧，$r。",pEN="Show me your dedication, <race>.",c="你让奥罗克感到十分骄傲，$n。你可以开始学习铸造铁护肩了！",cEN="You do Orokk proud, <name>. Read, learn of iron shoulders!"}
Q[2753]={d="奥罗克还剩两课要教给你，$n。我知道你的肌肉很疼，不过为了沃姆什家族，你还要继续！\n\n把四顶绿铁头盔、四个绿铁护腕和四个绿铁护腿拿来给奥罗克——你可以学到知识，你的敌人也会更加痛苦！",dEN="Only two more lessons Orokk will teach, <name>. Your muscles ache, I know, but continue on for the Omosh!\n\nBring to Orokk four green iron helms, four green iron bracers, and two green iron leggings - for this you learn and your enemies suffer!",o="将4顶绿铁头盔、4副绿铁护腕和4副绿铁护腿交给奥格瑞玛的奥罗克·沃姆什。",oEN="Bring four Green Iron Helms, four Green Iron Bracers, and two Green Iron Leggings to Orokk Omosh in Orgrimmar.",p="敌人的头骨将碎裂在你的铁靴之下！",pEN="Their skulls will crack under the pressure of your boots!",c="你让奥罗克想起了爷爷，沃姆什的戈罗克酋长！现在你可以开始学习铸造铁靴了。",cEN="You remind Orokk of his grandfather, Chief Gorokk of Omosh! Read, learn of the iron boot."}
Q[2754]={d="这是奥罗克教你的最后一课，$n。回到神圣的熔炉去。给奥罗克带来两把实心铁锤、两双镀银青铜靴和两副镀银青铜护手。\n\n光看你走过来就能把他们吓个半死！|n",dEN="The final lesson Orokk teaches you, <name>. To the sacred anvil and forge you return! Bring for Orokk two solid iron mauls, two silvered bronze boots, and two silvered bronze gauntlets.\n\nSee the fear in their eyes as you approach!",o="将2只结实的铁锤、2双镀银青铜战靴和2副镀银青铜手套交给奥格瑞玛的奥罗克·沃姆什。",oEN="Bring two Solid Iron Mauls, two Silvered Bronze Boots, and two Silvered Bronze Gauntlets to Orokk Omosh in Orgrimmar.",p="让这些铁器知道谁是真正的主宰，$n！",pEN="Show the iron who is in charge, <name>!",c="太惊人了！你已经掌握了沃姆什系列所有的技术了，$n！",cEN="Astounding! You have learned the way of the Omosh, <name>!"}
Q[2755]={d="奥罗克没有哭，$n。\n\n<他擦去一滴眼泪。>\n\n奥罗克还有一个奥莫什家族的秘密要教你。多亏了$n，奥罗克死也瞑目了。\n\n学会奥莫什的欢乐之舞，我就教你我所知道的铁拳之道。|n",dEN="Orokk is not crying, <name>. Soot is in eye.\n\n<Orokk wipes a tear away.>\n\nThere is one last Omosh family secret Orokk will teach you. Orokk will die happy, thanks to <name>.\n\nLearn Omosh dance of joy and then you learn fist of iron!",o="观察并学习沃姆什的喜悦之舞。",oEN="Watch and learn the Omosh Dance of Joy.",c="<奥罗克喘着气。>\n\n奥罗克很久没跳过奥莫什的欢乐之舞了。现在就学吧，$n！",cEN="<Orokk pants.>\n\nIt has been a very long time since Orokk has done the Omosh dance of joy. Learn now, <name>!"}
Q[2756]={d="很久以前，阿图尔克可以碾碎敌人的头颅，将他们的骨头磨成粉做灯丝……很久以前，$r。现在酋长号召各部族和平相处。那些往日的敌人，现在我们只能用厌烦的眼光看着他们！\n\n我知道这很难以接受，不过这就是萨尔的意愿。\n\n实在是让我感到悲哀！你是来学习的，那你就学吧！给我拿四套钢质胸甲和四顶钢质头盔来，你可以在锻造它们的时候尝到战争的滋味！",dEN="In the time of legends, Aturk would crush the skulls of his enemies and grind the bone into a fine powder for use in filament. Long gone are those days, <race>. The Warchief calls for peace among the clans. Old enemies are now only watched with weary eyes!\n\nUnbelievable, I know, but such is the will of Thrall.\n\nEnough lamenting! You are here to learn, and learn you will! Bring me four steel breastplates and four steel helms and you will gain a taste of war!",o="把 4 件钢质胸甲和 4 顶钢质板甲头盔带给奥格瑞玛的铁砧阿图尔克。|n",oEN="Bring four Steel Breastplates and four Steel Plate Helms to Aturk the Anvil in Orgrimmar.",p="阿图尔克就像时间一样，不等任何人！快点，$g蠢货:蠢货;！",pEN="Aturk, like time, waits for no one! Hurry up fool!",c="看来你不过是又一个满足于现状、跟着大酋长走的旅鼠，$n。真令人失望。\n\n我多么渴望在战场上光荣赴死。可我却困在这里，奉萨尔之命，教婴儿们做手工！看着，学着点，$g孩子:孩子;！",cEN="It seems you are but another complacent lemming of the Warchief, <name>. How disappointing.\n\nHow I long for a glorious death upon the battlefield. Instead, I am stuck here, by order of Thrall, to teach infants how to craft! Watch and learn, child!"}
Q[2757]={d="听着，孩子，你在我这儿已经学不到什么东西了。\n\n我认识一个铁匠，他认识另一个优秀的铁匠……听起来有些混乱。你应该到藏宝海湾的铁匠铺去找他，只要你把这枚徽章交给他看看，他就会把有关秘银的知识都传授给你。\n\n怎么样？踏上真正的求知之旅吧，$n。\n\n如果你对此感兴趣的话，就去找马克迦文吧。别忘了给他看看这枚徽章。",dEN="Listen, kid, you're not gonna learn anything hanging around here.\n\nI know a guy who knows a guy. He hangs around the smithy in Booty Bay. If you show him this insignia, he'll tell you all about mithril.\n\nSo whadd'ya say? Leave this kid stuff to the babies in diapers, <name> -- it's time to move on.\n\nIf you're interested, his name's McGavan. Show him this trinket and he'll recognize your commitment.",o="与藏宝海湾的马克迦文谈一谈",oEN="Speak with McGavan in Booty Bay.",p="你们这族类倒是稀有，$g朋友:朋友;。让我看看那枚徽章。",pEN="A rare breed your kind be, matey. Let me see that insignia.",c="以黑蹄背上的毛起誓——终于有一个$g配得上秘银骑士团的人:配得上秘银骑士团的人;了！",cEN="By Blackhoof's back hair -- finally, one worthy of the Mithril Order!"}
Q[2758]={d="我像你这么大的时候，在一个名叫加尔文的矮人门下学习了铸造护甲的技术。在他离开这里前往藏宝海湾之前，曾让我向他许诺，要帮助训练所有决心在锻造这门技艺上学有所成的人——于是这么多年来，我一直在这么做。\n\n现在是时候让你学点新东西了。给我打造六套金鳞护腕，你就会知道锻造的本源是什么了，$n。",dEN="When I was about your age, a dwarf by the name of Galvan took me under his wing and trained me in the ways of the armorsmith. Before he left for Booty Bay, he made me promise to train all those with the desire and determination to advance in the craft of blacksmithing -- so here I am -- all these years later.\n\nSo, now it's time for you to learn a little something. Make me six golden scale bracers and you will learn where smithing comes from, <name>.",o="将6副金鳞护腕交给暴风城的巨锤汉克。",oEN="Bring six Golden Scale Bracers to Hank the Hammer in Stormwind.",p="你会成为加尔文的下$g一位:一位;门徒吗？",pEN="Could you be the next Galvan protege?",c="很好，$n！用心听着！\n\n锻造的手艺绝不是起源于这里！<巨锤汉克指向他的铁锤。>\n\n锻造的手艺绝不是起源于这里！<巨锤汉克指向他的铁砧。>\n\n锻造的手艺只能起源于这里！<巨锤汉克指向自己的心。>\n\n现在你知道锻造的起源了吧。",cEN="Very good, <name>! Listen and learn.\n\nBlacksmithing never comes from here! <Hank points to his hammer.>\n\nBlacksmithing never comes from here! <Hank points to the anvil.>\n\nBlacksmithing only comes from here! <Hank points to his heart.>\n\nAnd now you know the origin of blacksmithing."}
Q[2759]={d="虽然加尔文许多年前就离开了藏宝海湾，城里仍有骑士团的其他成员，盼着有朝一日能找到另一个配得上加尔文教导的人。\n\n带上这枚徽章，把它呈给藏宝海湾的麦加文。\n\n如果你真能走到那里，他就会知道你$g配得上:配得上;。我对你有信心，$n！",dEN="Although Galvan left Booty Bay many years ago, members of the order still remain in town, hoping to one day find another worthy of Galvan's tutelage.\n\nTake this insignia and present it to McGavan in Booty Bay.\n\nIf you actually make it that far, he'll know that you are worthy. I have faith, <name>!",o="与藏宝海湾的马克迦文谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with McGavan in Booty Bay.",p="你们这族类倒是稀有，$g朋友:朋友;。让我看看那枚徽章。",pEN="A rare breed your kind be, matey. Let me see that insignia.",c="以黑蹄背上的毛起誓——终于有一个$g配得上秘银骑士团的人:配得上秘银骑士团的人;了！",cEN="By Blackhoof's back hair -- finally, one worthy of the Mithril Order!"}
Q[2760]={d="我们大多数新人根本到不了藏宝海湾，$n。光是徽章的光泽就足以勾起连最虔诚的铁匠心中的掠夺欲。他们真是傻瓜，跟你在那里见到的财富相比，这徽章不过是沧海一粟！\n\n找到上古者加尔文，把这枚别针给他看。他住在很北的地方，在祖尔格拉布和莫什奥格食人魔丘之间。|n",dEN="Most of our recruits never make it to Booty Bay, <name>. The shine of the insignia is enough to trigger the loot lust in even the staunchest of blacksmiths. Fools they be, as the insignia is a drop in the bucket compared to the wealth of items you'll see!\n\nFind Galvan the Ancient and show him this pin. His residence is far to the north, between Zul Gurub and the Mosh'Ogg ogre mound.",o="与荆棘谷的上古者加尔文交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="嗨！走近点，让加尔文看看你拿的是什么。",pEN="Hail! Come closer; show Galvan what you have.",c="啊，很多年都没有看到一个值得秘银会启蒙的人了。我们现在就开始吧！",cEN="Ah, many years it has been since one has been worthy of the mithril order's initiation. We will start now!"}
Q[2761]={d="很多铁匠都以为采矿和锻造是两件完全独立的事情，不过锻造能离得开采矿吗？啊哈——那是不可能的！成功的铁匠还必须得是成功的矿工。\n\n让加尔文看看你的能力吧，$n。 给我找40块铁锭和40块秘银锭来，然后加尔文就会教你打造精制密银短裤的方法！",dEN="Many blacksmiths believe that mining and smithing are separate, independent jobs; but can there be blacksmithing without mining? Ah ha -- it is an impossibility! The accomplished blacksmith must also be an accomplished miner.\n\nShow Galvan that you are capable, <name>. Bring me forty bars of iron and forty bars of mithril. For this, Galvan will teach you the ways of the ornate mithril pants!",o="将40块秘银锭和40块铁锭交给荆棘谷的加尔文。",oEN="Bring forty Mithril Bars and forty Iron Bars to Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn.",p="采了这么一大堆矿之后，你感到肌肉肿胀，全身疼痛！",pEN="After such mining, your muscles bulge and your body aches!",c="你的敬业精神无可挑剔，$n！你开始领会加尔文矿物学的门道了！拿着这个，尽可能从中学到东西！",cEN="Your work ethic is impeccable, <name>! You are starting to understand the ways of Galvan mineralogy! Take this and learn from it all that you can."}
Q[2762]={d="据说真银比秘银更坚固耐用，加尔文对这个说法没有什么异议，但是严格说起来，真银并不是真的！秘银比真银更加高贵！哈！不管怎么说，这一次，你要去收集一大堆银子来，$n。\n\n给我弄四十块秘银锭和五块真银锭来，作为交换，我会向你传授打造精制秘银手套的技艺，以及更为重要的，让你知道真银并不是真的！",dEN="It is said that truesilver is stronger and more durable than mithril. Galvan does not disagree with this assessment of the minerals, but contrary to its name, truesilver is not true! Mithril is a far nobler mineral! HAH! Regardless, for this lesson you will need to find the great silver deceiver, <name>.\n\nBring me forty bars of mithril and five bars of truesilver. In exchange, you will be taught the secret of ornate mithril gloves and more importantly, learn that truesilver is a liar!",o="将40块秘银锭和5块真银锭交给荆棘谷的加尔文。",oEN="Bring forty Mithril Bars and five Truesilver Bars to Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn.",p="采了这么一大堆矿之后，你感到肌肉肿胀，全身疼痛！",pEN="After such mining, your muscles bulge and your body aches!",c="她是个倔强的姑娘，不是吗，$n？当然，我是说真银。没错，加尔文在奥特兰克的山区里待了十多年才学到了这一点。拿着这个，从中学习你所能学到的一切！",cEN="She's a cruel mistress, is she not, <name>? I'm speaking of truesilver, naturally. Aye, Galvan spent over a decade in the mountains of Alterac learning this lesson. Take this and learn from it all that you can!"}
Q[2763]={d="搜寻珍贵的宝石对我们来说是最重要的，$n。很少有比黄水晶更为珍贵的宝石。有了黄水晶，我们就能将注入各种装备中的魔法特性得到大幅度提升。\n\n这一课，我们要用四块黄水晶加强四十块秘银锭，这将使你更加了解神奇的宝石学，并学会如何制造精制秘银护肩。",dEN="The harvesting of precious gems is of utmost importance to our craft, <name>. Few gems are more precious than the citrine. The magical properties we imbue into our goods are amplified greatly by the presence of citrine.\n\nFor this lesson, we will fortify forty bars of mithril with four citrines. The result will be a better understanding of magical gemology and the knowledge to create ornate mithril shoulders.",o="将40块秘银锭和4块黄水晶交给荆棘谷的加尔文。",oEN="Bring forty Mithril Bars and four Citrines to Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn.",p="采了这么一大堆矿之后，你感到肌肉肿胀，全身疼痛！",pEN="After such mining, your muscles bulge and your body aches!",c="很少有人能不被那光芒四射的黄水晶所吸引，$n。没错，黄水晶是种非常华丽的宝石。\n\n好好留意这个发现能带给我们的益处！",cEN="One can barely keep their eyes from leaving its splendor, <name>. Aye, citrine is a glorious gem.\n\nPay attention and learn what such a discovery may teach us!"}
Q[2764]={d="如果你$g准备好:准备好;结束在加尔文这里的训练，就该前往加基森了。\n\n在那里你会找到我最出色的学生：特伦顿·轻锤。他能在华丽秘银之道上教你很多。否则，就留在这里继续学！\n\n哦，加基森当然是在塔纳利斯！",dEN="If you are ready to conclude your training with Galvan, you should journey to Gadgetzan.\n\nThere, you will find my finest pupil: Trenton Lighthammer. He has much to teach you in the ways of ornate mithril. Otherwise, remain here and learn!\n\nOh, Gadgetzan is in Tanaris, of course!",o="和加基森的特伦顿·轻锤谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Trenton Lighthammer at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",c="“长者”加尔文让你来的？\n\n<特伦顿向你鞠了一躬。>\n\n很荣幸见到大师的另一个学生！",cEN="Galvan the Ancient sent you??\n\n<Trenton bows.>\n\nIt is a great honor to meet another of the master's pupils!"}
Q[2765]={d="你刚来的时候，我就知道你会成为我最出色的学生之一！你毫不犹豫地把这个有魔力的饰品交给了马克迦文，因此你才有了来见我的资格。你的全心奉献和坚定信念应该得到回报。\n\n你已经在锻造技艺方面取得了长足的进步，$n。拿上你的回报吧！",dEN="When you first came to me, I knew that you would turn out to be one of my finest pupils! It was without hesitancy that you gave up a trinket of some power to McGavan. You did this only so that you could meet me. Such blind faith and devotion to the craft should be rewarded.\n\nYou have attained expertise over blacksmithing, <name>. Reap the rewards!",o="到加尔文那里拿取报酬！",oEN="Claim your reward from Galvan the Ancient!",c="你将得到一个比你放弃的饰品更棒的东西，好好利用它吧，$n。",cEN="It is only fitting that you receive a trinket of far greater power than the one you sacrificed to get here. Use it in good health, <name>."}
Q[2766]={d="你发现了一件奇怪的蛋形金属装置。你摆弄蛋上的一个旋钮，它就活了过来，展开成某种侏儒机器人装置！机器蛋内部传来一个声音。\n\n\"我叫奥格索普·奥布诺提斯，我的自导机器人坠毁了！找回它我会给你报酬；请把这个信标带到机器人那里。\"\n\n\"我已经为你计算出了机器人的坐标；它就在凶疤谷附近的一个洞穴里。\"",dEN="You have uncovered some sort of strange, egg-shaped device made from metal. Fiddling with one of its knobs springs the egg to life, as it opens up into some sort of gnomish robotic contraption! A voice from inside the robotic egg crackles to life.\n\n\"My name's Oglethorpe Obnoticus, and my homing robot has crashed! I will reward you for its recovery; please take this beacon to the robot!\"\n\n\"I now have computed the coordinates of the robot for you; it is in a cave near Feral Scar Vale!\"",o="把定位器带到深痕谷附近山洞中的奥格索普的导航机器人旁边。",oEN="Take the distress beacon to Oglethorpe's homing robot in a cave near Feral Scar Vale.",p="你似乎发现了……一只机械鸡的残骸？蛋里的声音再次响起：\n\n\"没错，干得漂亮！这确实是我的自导机器人，不过我的传感器显示，它需要一次助推才能飞回藏宝海湾维修。把信标放进机器人内部吧——其余的交给我！\"",pEN="You appear to have uncovered the wreckage of... a robotic chicken? The voice from within the egg crackles to life again:\n\n\"Yes, excellent work! This is indeed my homing robot, though my sensors indicate that it needs a jump start before it can fly back to Booty Bay for repairs. Go ahead and place the beacon inside the rover - the beacon will take care of the rest!\"",c="你把蛋……紧急信标……放进那只鸡……自导机器人里。\n\n机器人力图站起来时，内部传出嗡鸣和转动声。机器人恢复运作后，你再次听到奥格索普的声音，这次是从机器人内部传来的：\n\n\"OOX-22/FE 至少还能运作，但它需要大修！它太重了，你搬不动……不过我有个主意。你愿意再照看它一阵子吗？\"",cEN="You place the egg... distress beacon... inside the chicken... homing robot.\n\nHums and whirs are heard from inside the robot as it struggles to stand up. After the robot comes to life, Oglethorpe's voice is heard once more, but now from inside the robot:\n\n\"OOX-22/FE is working at least, but it needs major repairs! It is much too heavy for you to carry it... but I think I have an idea. Are you up for watching over it some more?\""}
Q[2767]={d="你再次听到从机器人里传出的侏儒声音：\n\n\"我得把 OOX-22/FE 移到一个开阔、安全的地方，好让它开始漫长的起飞程序。它有内置隐形装置，但我需要时间让它恢复运作。把机器人护送到，比如说，大路上！那里正合适，时间也够让它上线！\"\n\n\"安全护送它，然后到藏宝海湾来找我！奥格索普·奥布诺提斯——通话结束！\"",dEN="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot:\n\n\"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure. It has built-in cloaking, but I need time on my end to make it operational again. Escort the robot from its current location to, let's say, the main road! That should be a perfect place, and long enough, to get things online!\"\n\n\"Escort it safely and then come talk to me in Booty Bay! Oglethorpe Obnoticus - out!\"",o="将OOX-22/FE护送到被遗忘的海岸上的码头，然后向藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯报告。",oEN="Escort OOX-22/FE to safety, then report to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",p="是的，我就是奥格索普·奥布诺提斯，为您效劳的发明大师！那么，有什么我能$g帮到您:帮到您;的吗？",pEN="Yes, I'm Oglethorpe Obnoticus, master inventor at your service! Now, is there something I could assist you with?",c="哦，你就是 OOX-22/FE 的大救星！我简直不知该如何表达对你相助的感谢！我的自导机器人系列还需要更多开发，但你的回收为我省下了无数重建时间，也省下了大量制造成本！\n\n请从这些东西里挑一件吧。再次感谢你的慷慨相助，$n，我和我的机器人们都欠你一份情！",cEN="Oh, YOU'RE the great savior of OOX-22/FE! I cannot even begin to express my thanks for your assistance! My homing robot series needs more development, but your recovery has saved me countless hours of extra rebuilding time, as well as many gold pieces in manufacture costs!\n\nPlease, take your choice of any of these items I have. Thank you again for your generous assistance <name>, my robots and I are in your debt!"}
Q[2768]={d="布莱中士偷了我的东西！他说只是借一下，但那混蛋却偷了我宝贵的探水棒！没有这根棒子，我就不知道该在哪里打井找水！\n\n去找到布莱，把我的探水棒拿回来！我听说他带着一帮恶名远扬的冒险者去了西边的祖尔法拉克古城寻宝，你肯定可以在那里找到他。\n\n但愿那里的巨魔已经把他干掉了，因为如果你必须打败他才能拿回探水棒的话，那必将是一场恶仗。",dEN="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??\n\nFind Bly and bring me my rod! I heard he led his band of ill-reputed adventurers to go treasure hunting in Zul'Farrak to the west. I bet you'll find him there.\n\nLet's hope the trolls took care of him, because if you have to fight him for the rod then you're in for a serious fight.",o="把探水棒交给加基森的首席工程师沙克斯·比格维兹。",oEN="Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",p="你找到布莱中士了吗？找到我的探水棒了吗？",pEN="Did you find Sergeant Bly? Did you get my divino-matic rod?",c="你找到它了！太棒了，$n！你和他打了一架吗？我真希望你已经狠狠地教训了他和他的同伙一顿！",cEN="You found it! Well done, <name>! Did you have to fight Bly for it? I hope you knocked him and his band down good and hard!"}
Q[2769]={d="你有没有遇见铜栓兄弟？他们在卡利姆多的闪光平原上与地精赛车，而且他们通常都会获得胜利，这并不奇怪——地精的赛车轮胎总是爆掉，他们几乎从来都没有完成过比赛！\n\n但即使是这样，铜栓兄弟也还是在寻找新的方法使他们的车速更快，维兹尔跟我说过，他的下一个实验需要一种很稀有的原料。\n\n或许他需要别人的帮助来获取这种原料，你去和他谈谈就知道了。",dEN="Have you met the Brassbolts brothers? They're over in the Shimmering Flats, in Kalimdor, racing their rocket car against the goblins. They usually win which is no surprise--the goblin car blows up so much it barely ever crosses the finish line!\n\nBut even then, the Brassbolts brothers are always looking for new ways to make their car go faster, and Wizzle told me he needs a very rare component for his next experiment.\n\nHe probably needs help getting that part. Speak to him and find out.",o="和闪光平原的维兹尔·铜栓谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",c="啊，你想帮我？太好了！\n\n我正在做一个实验，需要一样零件，我需要$g一个:一个;像你这样勇敢的$c来帮我弄到它！",cEN="Ah, you want to help me? Great!\n\nThere's a part I want for an experiment I'm working on, and I need a brave <class> like you to help me get it!"}
Q[2770]={d="在塔纳利斯沙漠的巨魔古城祖尔法拉克深处，有一个神圣的池塘。巨魔可以从那个池塘里召唤一头巨大的野兽——加兹瑞拉！它凶猛异常，甚至连它的鳞片都会因为巨大的能量而发出声响。我要用它的能量来给我的赛车增加动力！\n\n把加兹瑞拉的鳞片给我弄来！\n\n不过，召唤加兹瑞拉的方法是巨魔的秘密。如果你想要面对加兹瑞拉的话，首先就要从巨魔那里弄到召唤它的方法。",dEN="Deep in Zul'Farrak, the sand troll city in Tanaris, there is a sacred pool. From that pool the trolls summon a huge beast! Gahz'rilla! He's so fierce that even his scales crackle with energy. It's that energy I want to harness for my car!\n\nBring me the electrified scale of Gahz'rilla!\n\nBut the summoning of Gahz'rilla is a well-kept secret of the trolls. To face him, you must first wrest the secret from them.",o="把加兹瑞拉的鳞片交给闪光平原的维兹尔·铜栓。",oEN="Bring Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale to Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",p="你拿到鳞片了吗？我简直等不及要试试不同的驱动方式了！",pEN="Do you have the scale? I can't wait to try different ways to harness its energy!",c="哇，你拿到鳞片了！谢谢你，$n。我现在就想用它试试！\n\n你看到加兹瑞拉了吗？它是不是像其它人说的那么大？",cEN="Wow, you got the scale! Thanks, <name>. I can't wait to get to work on this thing!\n\nSo you saw Gahz'rilla? Was he as big as they say??"}
Q[2771]={d="看来师傅一开始就计划好了。你学会制造的东西都是我不会的，而我学会的那些你也不会。\n\n师傅很聪明，$n。这样我们就可以互相学习了！\n\n你教我如何制造秘银罩帽和精制密银护肩，然后我再教你制造精制密银头盔，如何？",dEN="It seems as if master had this planned from the start. I was not taught to create the items which you learned to create and you were not taught the items which I learned to create.\n\nThe master is wise, <name>. We shall teach each other!\n\nShow me how to make a mithril coif and ornate mithril shoulders and I shall show you how to create an ornate mithril helm.",o="将2顶秘银罩帽和1副精制秘银护肩带秘银护肩交给特伦顿·轻锤。",oEN="Bring two Mithril Coifs and one Ornate Mithril Shoulder to Trenton Lighthammer.",p="你打造出我要的那些东西了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the crafting of the items, <name>?",c="非常出色！我可以这么说，做工很好。仔细看好了，$n！",cEN="Excellent! A fair tradeoff, if I do say so myself. Watch and learn, <name>!"}
Q[2772]={d="在去年的全谷铁匠冠军赛里，我在众目睽睽之下被一个来自风险投资公司的卑鄙家伙用扫堂腿放倒在地。但是他们却不知道我为什么还能继续站在那里完成比赛，并取得冠军。答案就是——没错，精制秘银战靴！\n\n如果今年我还想取胜的话，就得学会精制秘银短裤的制作方法，因为这次会有一个风险投资公司的伐木工参加比赛！教我制作短裤，我就教你制作靴子，怎么样？",dEN="At last year's All-Valley Blacksmithing Championship, all those who watched saw my leg get swept from under me by a cowardly dog from the Venture Co. Foundry. What they didn't know, however, was the reason I was able to continue and ultimately win the tournament: That's right, ornate mithril boots!\n\nI will need to learn how to craft ornate mithril pants for this year's tournament, however, as a Venture Co. shredder is an entrant! Teach me the way of the pants and learn the way of the boot!",o="把 2 双重型秘银靴和 1 条华丽秘银短裤带给特伦顿·轻锤。|n",oEN="Bring two Heavy Mithril Boots and one Ornate Mithril Pants to Trenton Lighthammer.",p="你打造出我要的那些东西了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the crafting of the items, <name>?",c="整个世界都将在被你踩在脚下，$n！你的靴子将让你傲然挺立，而且再也不会被扫堂腿暗算啦！",cEN="The world will be at your feet, <name>! Let them all come at your legs, for you are now unsweepable!"}
Q[2773]={d="这一带的人都叫我秘银小子。我为世界各地的冒险者供应华丽秘银。\n\n<特伦顿低声说。>\n\n很少有人知道，我其实不知道华丽秘银手套的做法。嘘！这是我们的小秘密。\n\n$n，教我做华丽秘银手套的技术，作为交换，我会给你看我在加尔文门下训练成果的结晶：华丽秘银胸甲。",dEN="Around these parts I am known as the Mithril Kid. I supply ornate mithril to adventurers from around the world.\n\n<Trenton whispers.>\n\nLittle do they know that I do not know the technique to fashion ornate mithril gloves. Shhhh! This will be our little secret.\n\nTeach me the technique to create ornate mithril gloves, <name>, and in exchange, I will show you the resultant of the culmination of my training under Galvan: the ornate mithril breastplate.",o="将2件重型秘银胸甲和1副精制秘银手套带给特秘银手套交给特伦顿·轻锤。",oEN="Bring two Heavy Mithril Breastplates and one Ornate Mithril Gloves to Trenton Lighthammer.",p="你打造出我要的那些东西了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the crafting of the items, <name>?",c="谢谢你所教我的一切，$n。你很快就能成为华丽秘银装备的大师了。\n\n仔细看着吧！",cEN="Thank you for all that you have taught me, <name>. The master and commander of the ornate mithril set will soon be in your possession.\n\nBehold!"}
Q[2781]={d="通缉：蝎刺哈里发。\n\n塔纳利斯加基森的加基森水务公司悬赏蝎刺哈里发——废土强盗的首领——的人头。他被控的罪行包括：\n\n1. 谋杀加基森水务公司员工！\n2. 盗窃加基森水务公司资源！\n3. 侵占加基森水务公司财产！\n\n把蝎刺哈里发死亡的证据交给首席工程师比格维兹，即可立即领取奖赏。",dEN="WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting!\n\nThe Gadgetzan Water Company of Gadgetzan, Tanaris will pay a high bounty for the head of Caliph Scorpidsting, leader of the Wastewander outlaws. His crimes include:\n\n1.Murdering Gadgetzan Water Co. employees!\n2.Stealing Gadgetzan Water Co. resources!\n3.Seizing Gadgetzan Water Co. property!\n\nBring proof of Caliph Scorpidsting's demise to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle for an immediate reward!",o="将卡利夫·斯科比斯汀的头颅交给加基森的首席工程师沙克斯·比格维兹。",oEN="Bring the head of Caliph Scorpidsting to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",p="没错，$c，我是加基森水力公司的官员。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="Yes <class>, I am an official of the Gadgetzan Water Company. What can I assist you with?",c="正义终于得到了伸张！你重拳打击了可恶的游牧民！斯科比斯汀死了，我们现在只需把那些游牧民赶离加基森的水井就大功告成了！\n\n以加基森水力公司的名义，我很高兴将这笔奖金颁给你。你为我们作出了很大的贡献。",cEN="Finally - justice is served! You have struck a mighty blow against those vile nomads! With Scorpidsting's demise, this might be just the thing to finally push those squatters off of Gadgetzan's water wells!\n\nBy the authority of the Gadgetzan Water Company, I gladly award you with this bounty. You've done a great service for us all."}
Q[2782]={d="这块石板上布满了枯木巨魔的印记。林吉的秘密真是难以猜测……\n\n或许你手头上的东西非常宝贵。当然，这东西也很有可能一文不值。悲伤中的枯木巨魔为了摆脱困境什么事情都干得出来……",dEN="The tablet is covered with Witherbark troll markings. Rin'ji's secret truly is a mystery...\n\nIt's possible that you might have something quite valuable on your hands here. On the other hand, quite the opposite is also possible. A Witherbark troll in distress would probably do anything to find his way out of trouble...",o="奥兰·斯内克威瑟是个学者，她对枯木巨魔很有研究，也许她可以帮你看看这块石板。奥兰就住在幽暗城的魔法区里。",oEN="Oran Snakewrithe, a well known scholar on matters concerning the Witherbark trolls, may be able to decipher the tablet. She is known to reside within the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.",p="好吧，这是什么？",pEN="Well, now, what is this?",c="这块石板……很不同寻常……你是在哪里找到它的，$n？",cEN="This tablet... Quite unusual... Where did you find this, <name>?"}
Q[2783]={d="我们在和错误的敌人进行战斗，$n。\n\n这片土地上真正强大的力量正在不断增强，而我们却还在和兽人为了这片焦土进行无谓的争斗。\n\n我们难道要继续这种争斗，直到有一天让燃烧军团把我们都踏扁吗？这实在是一种愚蠢的行为。\n\n$n，抛开你的偏见，和部落英雄的灵魂谈谈吧，他知道诅咒之地真正的秘密。",dEN="We fight the wrong enemy, <name>.\n\nThe true power in these lands continues to grow in strength and number while we squabble over scorched earth with orcs.\n\nDo we continue to fight a war in these lands against the Horde, only to be routed one day by the armies of the Burning Legion? It is futile.\n\nPut your differences aside, <name>, speak with the fallen hero of the Horde. He knows the truth behind the Blasted Lands.",o="与诅咒之地和悲伤沼泽交界处的部落英雄的灵魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the border of the Blasted Lands and the swamp.",c="联盟想要帮助我们？\n\n我以为这一天永远也不会再次到来了，我以为联盟永远也不会再次与部落并肩作战了。\n\n终于……我们要联合起来！",cEN="The Alliance wishes to assist?\n\nI thought to never see this day again. A day in which the Alliance fights side by side with the Horde against a common enemy.\n\nIt shall be... we will unite."}
Q[2784]={d="请听听我的故事，$r。",dEN="Hear my story, <race>.",o="聆听部落英雄的灵魂讲述他的故事。",oEN="Listen to the Fallen Hero of the Horde tell his story.",p="请听听我要说的故事。",pEN="Listen to what I have to say.",c="作为一个灵魂，我非常无力，$n，请帮帮我，让我重新获得我的荣耀。",cEN="As a spirit, I am powerless, <name>. Assist me. Allow me to regain my honor."}
Q[2801]={d="请你一定要先听听我的故事。",dEN="Before we may continue, you must hear my story.",o="聆听部落英雄的灵魂讲述他的故事。",oEN="Listen to the Fallen Hero of the Horde tell his story.",p="仔细听我讲述这段故事，$n。",pEN="Listen to what I have to say, <name>.",c="$n，是行动的时候了。",cEN="The time to act is now, <name>."}
Q[2821]={d="我对于皮革制作的哲学是要做就做最好——没有商量余地。任何说质量不要紧的人都是想要把丹莫罗的那些水货卖给你！\n\n在寻求高质量材料的过程中，我接触到了厚重的雪人皮。雪人是菲拉斯土生土长的一种生物，大多在深痕谷活动。我需要一些它们的皮，如果你给我十张的话，我可以让你在我的皮货中选一件。如果你觉得听起来还算公平，那我们就成交了吧。",dEN="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!\n\nIn my latest pursuit of high-quality materials, I have run across thick yeti hides. The Yeti are native to Feralas, with many found in Feral Scar Vale. I want some, and I'll give you a choice of one of my leather goods for a stack of ten. If that sounds fair to you, then we're in business.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比带去10张厚重的雪人皮。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="我说过，如果你给我十张厚重的雪人毛皮，我就让你在我的皮货中选一件。我一向以品质为重，我保证你得到的是好东西！\n\n如果你找不到雪人，那么我可以指点你一二，到被遗忘的海岸那边去，向内陆走，它们就在深痕谷附近。",pEN="A stack of ten thick yeti hides will net you a choice of one of my crafted items. Because I care about quality, I am able to ensure you'll get a good item!\n\nIf you can't seem to find yetis, I know where some might be. Try looking just inland of the Forgotten Coast, around Feral Scar Vale.",c="你有没有检查皮革的质地？处理得好的话，这些皮革会比铁还坚硬。没有几个人知道这种皮革的好处，我知道把它和大量处理液混合后就能制造出真正高品质的装备……当然，我要谢谢你！\n\n现在，请从这些皮货中任选一件吧！",cEN="Did you stop and examine the texture of these hides? Properly treated, these hides could very well be stronger than iron. Not many people know about these hides, and that in combination with the vast treating solutions I know will allow me to potentially make items with a true mark of quality... thanks to you, of course!\n\nAnd now, please choose from what I am able to offer you for your service!"}
Q[2822]={d="我为自己制作的皮革作品感到骄傲，它们也值得我骄傲，质量是永不可能妥协的东西。任何说质量不要紧的人都是在信口乱说！\n\n在寻求高质量材料的过程中，我接触到了厚重的雪人皮。雪人是菲拉斯土生土长的一种生物，大多在深痕谷活动。我需要一些它们的皮，如果你给我十张的话，我可以让你在我的皮货中选一件。如果你觉得听起来还算公平，那我们就成交了吧。",dEN="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!\n\nIn my latest pursuit of high-quality materials, I have discovered thick yeti hides. Yetis are native to Feralas, often found west of here in Feral Scar Vale. I'll give you a choice of one of my leather goods for a stack of ten. If that is agreeable to you, then we are set!",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去十张厚重的雪人皮。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="你能弄到十张厚重的雪人毛皮吗？我的皮货是无与伦比的，如果你有这种皮革的话，我就给你制作一件样品。\n\n如果你找不到那些雪人，我可以给你一些指点。从这里往西，它们就在被遗忘的海岸里，靠近深痕谷的地方。",pEN="Were you able to get a stack of ten thick yeti hides? My leather goods are second to none, and I'll share a sampling with you should you have the hides.\n\nIf you can't seem to find yetis, I know where some might be. Try looking west of here, just inland of the Forgotten Coast around the Feral Scar Vale.",c="啊，太好了！这些皮革如果经过特殊的处理就会像钢铁一样强韧！只有经过反复试验才能知道最佳的处理方法是什么，但我相信它们会使我的皮革制品的品质更上一层楼。\n\n至于你，$n……你对我的帮助绝对是无价的。请从我的手艺中随便选一件吧。",cEN="Ah, excellent! These hides, when given a special treatment, are as resilient as iron I tell you! It will take many tries in order to get the right mix down for the tanning, but I am confident they will bring my mark of quality to the next level.\n\nAs for you, <name>... your assistance has proven invaluable to me. Please take your choice from these items I have crafted."}
Q[2841]={d="两年前，侏儒科技最主要的用途还是逗人发笑。如今情况大不相同；他们造出了一台比我们所有型号加在一起还好的平台。我要那些图纸，$n！\n\n它们锁在机械师瑟玛普拉格附近的一个保险箱里。更糟的是，只有他知道保险箱的密码。\n\n不惜一切代价弄到它，$n。你必须打开保险箱，把图纸带给我！|n",dEN="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined. I need the blueprints, <name>!\n\nUnfortunately, the plans are locked away in a safe near Mekgineer Thermaplugg. To make matters worse, the combination to the safe is only known by Mekgineer Thermaplugg.\n\nDo whatever you have to do to get that combination, <name>. Then crack open that safe and bring back those blueprints!",o="从诺莫瑞根取回平台图纸和瑟玛普拉格的保险箱密码，并把它们带给奥格瑞玛的诺格。|n",oEN="Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",p="我没有看到任何蓝图，你是不是把它放在你身上的某个地方了，或者你根本就是想站在这里烦死我？",pEN="I don't see any blueprints. Did you hide them somewhere on your body or are you just standing around here to irritate me?",c="我就知道你能办到！索维克倒是不信……\n\n<诺格清了清嗓子。>\n\n既然图纸到手了，我们迟早能弄清那台平台里所有的侏儒创新，把它们变成我们新型粉碎机的goblin式创新。",cEN="I knew you could do it, <name>! Sovik on the other hand, he had his doubts.\n\n<Nogg clears his throat.>\n\nNow that we have the blueprints in our possession, it is only a matter of time before we figure out all of the gnomish innovations that went into the creation of the rig and make them goblin innovations for our new shredder models."}
Q[2842]={d="斯库提和我刚刚从克努比那里得到关于新型侏儒钻探设备的消息，就马上开始动手研制捷运器6000型了，它是去诺莫瑞根最快捷可靠的方法！\n\n现在它已经完成了，$n。如果你想试试的话，就到藏宝海湾去和空运处的斯库提谈谈吧。你可以从棘齿城乘船去藏宝海湾。\n\n当然，你也可以试试从满地都是矮人的丹莫罗山脉走到诺莫瑞根去！",dEN="As soon as we got word from Kernobee about the new gnomish rig, Scooty and I began work on the Transpolyporter 6000: The fastest and most reliable way to Gnomeregan.\n\nIt's finally ready for passengers to board, <name>. If you want to give it a try, go to Booty Bay and talk with Scooty at the wind rider roost. To get to Booty Bay, take the boat from Ratchet.\n\nOf course, you could always try and make the run to Gnomeregan through the dwarf infested mountains of Dun Morogh!",o="和藏宝海湾的斯库提谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Scooty in Booty Bay.",c="她很漂亮，不是吗？地精运输技术的巅峰——只爆炸过十几次而已。\n\n别担心，$n，我把一切都安排妥当了，她绝对不会爆炸的——即使真的爆炸了，也只是一瞬间的事情，而且我保证你根本不会有痛的感觉。",cEN="She's a beauty, isn't she? Pinnacle of goblin transport technology -- only exploded a dozen or so times.\n\nDon't worry, <name>, I've got her all fixed up. She won't blow up on you - and if she does, it'll be quick and painless."}
Q[2843]={d="只要你持有转发器，所需做的就只是站到传送台上，然后就会被$g传送到诺里斯根:传送到诺里斯根;。\n\n你也许会经历一些奇怪的副作用，但都不会是永久的……至少现在不会。\n\n差点忘了最重要的部分——怎么回来。等你想回来时，就站上诺莫瑞根的传送器平台。\n\n现在得按你的身高和体重校准转发器。|n",dEN="As long as you have the transponder in your possession, all you need to do is step on the pad and you'll be teleported to Gnomeregan.\n\nYou may experience some unusual side effects, but none of those should be permanent... anymore.\n\nI almost forgot the most important part - getting back. When you're ready to come back, just step on the transpolyporter pad in Gnomeregan!\n\nNow to calibrate the transponder to your size and weight.",o="等斯库提调整好地精传送器。",oEN="Wait for Scooty to calibrate the Goblin Transponder.",p="准备就绪！",pEN="It's ready!",c="好了！等你$g准备好:准备好;，就踩上传送台！",cEN="All done! When you're ready, just step on the pad."}
Q[2844]={d="都是我不好，$n。我本应细心照顾我的小朋友，沙恩。但是不知道为什么，她离开了我。我并不十分清楚发生了什么事，真的，但我最后一次看到她的时候，我们正在穿越这里北面的废墟。\n\n一切都很正常，但我转过身一看……她就不见了。\n\n现在我不知道该怎么办了。你有办法吗，$n？我很担心。\n\n嘿，你帮我去找沙恩怎么样？你看上去应该比我跑得快一些。",dEN="I am no good, <name>. I was 'spose to be watchin' over my little friend, Shay, and somehow, she got away from me. I'm not all that sure what happened, really, but last time I saw her, we was walkin' through the ruins just north of here.\n\nEverythin' was goin' fine, but then I turned around, and... she was gone.\n\nNow I jus can't quite figure out what I should do here. Got any ideas, <name>? I'm awful worried.\n\nHey, how 'bout you go look fer Shay? Yer legs can travel much faster 'n mine.",o="寻找走丢了的精灵小姑娘。",oEN="Locate the lost night elf girl.",c="哦，终于有人找到我了！嗯，我是有点迷路了……但是难道这里不是个非常美丽的地方吗？",cEN="Oh, I am so glad you found me! I must admit, I am a bit lost... But isn't this a beautiful place?"}
Q[2845]={d="你能带我回到我的朋友罗克比特身边吗？他本来是要照看我的……但我总是不知不觉之间就迷路了。这里有这么多好看的东西，我东看看西看看就不知道该怎么走了。\n\n但是有一样东西可以一直吸引我的注意力。\n\n在这个箱子里有一只对我来说最为珍贵的铃铛，我就喜欢听它的声音。我保证，如果我走失了，只要你摇响铃铛，我就会马上跑回来。",dEN="Do you think you could help me find my way back to my friend, Rockbiter? He was supposed to be watching me... But I do have a tendency to wander off now and then. There are just so many things to see, and I get so distracted.\n\nThere is one thing that will always work to get my attention, though.\n\nInside this chest, you'll find a bell that is very precious to me. I just love the sound of it. You have my word, if I wander off, all you have to do is ring it and I'll come running back.",o="从箱子里取出谢伊的铃铛。\n\n护送谢伊·叶行者到石颚的营地。",oEN="Pick up Shay's Bell from the chest.\n\nEscort Shay Leafrunner to Rockbiter's camp.",p="我正在担心你呢！谢谢你带沙恩回来，$n。",pEN="I was gettin' worried 'bout ya! Thank you so much for bringin' Shay home, <name>.",c="什么？这个铃铛有这种妙用？太好了！\n\n太感谢你了，$n。",cEN="What? You say dis bell will work when Shay runs off? Well, how 'bout that!\n\nSince you did so much fer me, here ya go, <name>."}
Q[2846]={d="很久以前我曾经拥有一件美丽的珍宝，深渊皇冠。它不仅美丽——而且它对于知道怎么使用它的人来说更是一件拥有巨大力量的宝贝。\n\n所以当水占师维蕾萨听说皇冠的事情之后，她就发誓要得到它。维蕾萨派人在我外出的时候到我家来偷走了皇冠，这些卑鄙的小偷！\n\n我要取回我的皇冠！到位于塔纳利斯沙漠中的巨魔城市祖尔法拉克去，把皇冠从她手上抢回来。把它还给我，你会得到报酬的。",dEN="Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it.\n\nSo when word of the tiara reached the Hydromancer Velratha, she had to have it. She sent agents to my home and they stole it while I was away. The thieves!\n\nI want my tiara back! Go to Zul'Farrak, the troll city in Tanaris, find Velratha and wrench the tiara from her. Return it to me and you'll earn my favor.",o="将深渊皇冠交给尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨。",oEN="Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你取得了那个皇冠吗，$n？维蕾萨有没有付出代价？",pEN="Do you have the tiara, <name>? Has Velratha learned the price of crossing me?",c="太好了！你找到它了！最为重要的是——维蕾萨不再拥有它！谢谢你，$n。我永远欠你的人情！\n\n如果我过去说话听起来有点……令人不舒服，别放在心上。你会发现我对没有从我这里偷东西的人其实是非常友善的。",cEN="Wonderful! You found it! And what's just as important--Velratha no longer has it! Thank you, <name>. I am forever in your debt!\n\nAnd if I sounded a little... mean before, pay it no mind. You'll find me a much nicer person to those who haven't stolen from me."}
Q[2847]={d="$n，你作为制皮师越来越$g出色:出色;了！我知道一些你也许感兴趣的图样……野性之皮护甲！野性之皮利用了生长在茂密植被区域以及当地某些生物身上的野性藤蔓那种强劲而混沌的特性。用它制作的护甲，对$g你这种手艺:你这种手艺;的人来说是最好的，我保证。\n\n我会教你，但你得为我干一阵子活。第一笔成本只是十张厚皮。之后我们再谈细节。",dEN="<name>, you're becoming quite skilled as a leatherworker! I know some patterns you might be interested in... Wild Leather armor! Wild Leather taps into the potent and chaotic properties of wildvines, found in areas of lush vegetation and on some of the creatures there. The armor made using it is second to none for people of your skill, guaranteed.\n\nI'll teach this to you, but you'll be working for me for a while. The first cost is simply ten pieces of thick leather. After this, we'll talk specifics.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比带去10块厚皮。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Leather to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="就像我说过的那样，你要想学会制作蛮皮护甲，就得先替我工作。野葡萄是强大而又混乱的，它可以在原本已经非常强大的护甲上加上随机的魔法属性，但是我发现这一点可是花了很长时间的。\n\n这一过程的最初阶段的花费是十块厚皮。\n\n当你得到十块厚皮之后，我们再继续进行下一步工作，给你护甲的图样。",pEN="Like I said, you'll be working for me while you learn about Wild Leather armor. Because wildvines are both potent and chaotic, it yields a random but strong benefit to the already strong armor you will be making. This knowledge, however, was not easy for me to come by.\n\nThe initial cost to begin this process is ten pieces of thick leather.\n\nOnce that is done, we'll get to the work you need to do in order to obtain the patterns.",c="好吧，$n，很高兴你能加入。作为$g制皮师:制皮师;，你做了个明智的决定；等你学会制作任何一件野性之皮护甲，穿皮甲的人都会争着来找你。\n\n我们开始吧——你想从哪儿入手？",cEN="Well <name>, I'm glad to have you on board. You've made a smart decision as a leatherworker; those who wear leather armor will be clamoring to you once you learn how to make any of the Wild Leather armor pieces.\n\nLet's get to work - where do you want to start?"}
Q[2848]={d="蛮皮护肩能够很好地支撑穿戴者的身形，为其上臂和肩部提供了极好的保护。和所有的蛮皮护甲一样，制作时所使用的野葡萄会使其附带一种强大的随机魔法效果。\n\n如果你想要这种护甲的图样，就给我弄六块厚重护甲片和一株野葡萄来，这对你来说应该不算什么过分的要求。",dEN="Wild Leather shoulders support the wearer's frame extremely well, offering top notch protection of the upper arms and the shoulders themselves. As with all Wild Leather armor, a potent but random benefit is applied to the item as the wildvine is stitched in.\n\nFor this pattern, I will require six thick armor kits and a wildvine. That shouldn't be too tall of an order for you to fill.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁带去6片厚重护甲片和1株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 6 Thick Armor Kits and a Wildvine to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="你弄到我要的六块厚重护甲片和一株野葡萄了吗？\n\n不要以为制作护甲片是一种简单的体力活儿，当你制作护甲片的时候，你也在不断提高自己在装饰方面的技能，这种训练对于提高制作精细装备的技巧也有很大的帮助。\n\n看到了吧——其实这才是我让你给我带六块护甲片来的真正原因……",pEN="Do you have the six thick armor kits and the wildvine I require?\n\nDon't think of making armor kits as monotonous work; the steady fashioning method you develop as you ply your trade on these kits helps develop your skills for the intricate work needed to make Wild Leather armor.\n\nSee - there's a real reason behind what you're making for me...",c="这些护甲片的品质很不错，$n。无论是对于我自己还是我的雇工，我对品质的要求都很高。\n\n你做得很好，理应获得这个图样，我希望它给你带来荣誉和财富，就像它曾经给我带来的那样。",cEN="These armor kits are of solid quality, <name>. If there is one thing I demand in not only my work, but the work of those in my employ, it is quality.\n\nYou've done well to earn this pattern; I hope it brings you the rewards it has brought me."}
Q[2849]={d="蛮皮外衣是蛮皮护甲中最主要的部分，它的结构以及编织于其中的野葡萄能使其在具有很强的保护作用的同时，还附带着强大的魔法力量。\n\nB如果你想要这种护甲的图样，就给我弄两件龟鳞胸甲、两副龟鳞手套和一株野葡萄来。这不是件容易的活儿，但你一定可以完成它。",dEN="Wild Leather vests are the staple of any Wild Leather armor set. The frame of the vest blends with the wildvine to produce a product that offers maximum protection of the torso while allowing for the potent magic to work its way through the garment.\n\nFor this pattern, I will require two Turtle Scale breastplates, two sets of Turtle Scale gloves, and a wildvine. It's a tall order, but one you should have little difficulty in filling for me.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁带去2件龟鳞胸甲、2副龟鳞手套和1株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Turtle Scale Breastplates, 2 Turtle Scale Gloves, and a Wildvine to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="你弄到两件龟鳞外衣和两副龟鳞手套了吗？还有别忘了野葡萄！\n\n即使是最基本的图样，其基础造型也可以被转化运用到更多更复杂的装备制作工艺中。通过制作龟鳞外衣，你应该已经掌握了制作蛮皮外衣的基本要领。\n\n还有手套……好了，你要为我带来这些东西。记住，你是在为我工作！",pEN="Do you have the two Turtle Scale breastplates and gloves I ordered? Also, don't forget the wildvine!\n\nEven with the earliest patterns, we learn that the fundamentals of shape translate well into more difficult garments. Though different items, the shape of the Turtle Scale breastplates prepares you for the detailing needed to make a Wild Leather vest.\n\nAnd the gloves... well, they're just for my own benefit. Remember, you're working for me!",c="这几件装备都很不错，$n。你在这些装备上所注入的工艺和耐心让我看到你已经决心选择全身心地投入这个任务之中了。\n\n你已经达到了我的要求，这是给你的奖赏。制作蛮皮外衣的秘诀现在就是你的了！",cEN="These are some very nice pieces here, <name>. The craftsmanship and care put in to making these alone would fetch several silver more than the average piece made.\n\nYou've filled my order, and with that comes your reward. The knowledge of making Wild Leather vests is now yours!"}
Q[2850]={d="蛮皮头盔可以为你的头部提供极好的保护，与此同时，它也具有相当的舒适性。和所有的蛮皮护甲一样，制作头盔时使用的野葡萄会使它产生一种强大的随机魔法效果。对于穿着皮甲的人来说，这东西可是非常不错的！\n\n想要得到这顶头盔的图样的话，就给我带两件夜色外套、两条夜色头巾和一株野葡萄来。完成这个任务之后，图样就是你的了！",dEN="A Wild Leather helmet offers the wearer superior protection to the vital areas of the head without a sacrifice in comfort. As with all Wild Leather armor, the integrated wildvine yields a powerful but random enhancement to the frame of the helm. Leather wearers will definitely want this piece!\n\nFor this pattern, I will need two Nightscape tunics, two Nightscape headbands, and a wildvine. Complete this order and the pattern will be yours!",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比带去2件夜色外套、2条夜色头巾和一株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Nightscape Tunics, 2 Nightscape Headbands, and a Wildvine to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="我需要那些外套和头罩，另外还需要一株野葡萄，然后我就会把蛮皮盔帽的制作方法告诉你。\n\n防护头部的装备是冒险者们垂涎已久的，无论是简单的头带还是一顶密闭的盔帽，无论其外观如何，制造有价值的头部装备的道理是恒久不变的。",pEN="I need those tunics and headbands made, and I also need that piece of wildvine before I will share with you the knowledge of Wild Leather helmets.\n\nHead gear is highly coveted amongst adventurers, whether it be a disarmingly simple headband or a full-covering helmet. The fundamentals of creating valued head gear remain constant, no matter what the cosmetic appearance of the gear is.",c="你提供的这套夜色装备完全符合要求，$n。我对你这种水准的$g制皮师:制皮师;没有别的期待。\n\n你绝对配得上这张图样。我免费给你，希望你能因此获益。",cEN="This Nightscape equipment you have supplied fills the order perfectly, <name>. I expect no less from a leatherworker of your caliber.\n\nYou have definitely earned this pattern. I give it to you freely, and hope you will profit from it accordingly."}
Q[2851]={d="你现在已经学到了很多东西，$n，但你仍有更多的东西要学习。现在我们来谈谈蛮皮战靴，它是这一套装备的基石。\n\n这种靴子舒适合脚，可以让你的双脚在长途跋涉之后仍然轻松自如。柔软的鞋底对于那些喜欢悄悄行动的人来说再合适不过了。\n\n如果你想要得到它的图样，就给我拿两条夜色短裤和两双夜色长靴来。另外我还需要两株野葡萄……只有一株的话可不够。拿到以上这些东西之后，就把它们交给我。",dEN="You've learned quite a bit now, <name>; still, there is more for you to learn. Next are Wild Leather boots, the cornerstone of any set.\n\nThese boots are crafted to cradle the foot in comfort while bracing it against the hazards of adventuring. The soft soles are a blessing to those seeking quiet movement in footwear.\n\nFor this pattern, I need an order of two Nightscape pants and two Nightscape boots filled. I also will require two wildvines... not just one. When you have all this, let me know.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁带去2条夜色裤、2双夜色靴和2株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Nightscape Pants, 2 Nightscape Boots, and 2 Wildvines to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="在你学习这个图样以前，你必须完成裤子、靴子和野葡萄的订单，$n。你找到这些东西了吗？\n\n从我们学会制作第一双靴子起，我们便开始懂得如何掌握靴子的舒适性与功能性之间的尺度。只有兼顾两样，我们才能够制造出令穿着者忘记疲劳的靴子，我们的靴子绝对会让那些劣质的同类产品无地自容。",pEN="The order on the pants, boots, and wildvines needs to be filled before you get the pattern, <name>. Are you finished?\n\nFrom the earliest pair of boots we learn how to make, we start to understand that a quality boot needs to ride a razor's edge between comfort and function. With both, we are able to create items that allow the wearer to ignore fatigue that would cripple those wearing lower quality goods.",c="你以专业的水准又一次完成了这个复杂的任务。你理应获得这个图样，还有我对你的感谢。",cEN="Once again, you've filled a complex order with the skill of a seasoned professional. You have earned this pattern, as well as my thanks."}
Q[2852]={d="基础教程已经完成，你应做好准备掌握更为复杂的制作了，$n。蛮皮护胫是最坚硬和强大的皮制系列装备中的一样。野兽系列皮装备让你的胸部，大腿，小腿和其他致命的部位都被保护起来。再加上野葡萄所起的辅助作用，拥有这种装备的冒险者一定会永远感谢你的。\n\n如果你想要得到这个图样的话，带给我两顶龟鳞头盔，两付龟鳞护腕和两株野葡萄。",dEN="With the basics down, you are ready to master more complex fare, <name>. Wild Leather leggings are some of the sturdiest and powerful leather gear around. The waist, thighs, calves, and the vitals - all are given tremendous protection. Coupled with the enhancement that the wildvine provides, adventurers who own it will thank you each time they see you.\n\nFor this pattern, I need an order of two Turtle Scale helms, two Turtle Scale bracers, and two wildvines filled.",o="给羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比带去2顶龟鳞头盔、2副龟鳞护腕和2株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Turtle Scale Helms, 2 Turtle Scale Bracers, and 2 Wildvines to Pratt McGrubben in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="你弄到龟鳞头盔和护腕了吗？另外不要忘记我还要两株野葡萄。\n\n现在，你已经开始意识到蛮皮护胫潜在的能量了。一件拥有无穷应用潜力的护甲对于一个皮革匠来说是无价的，唯一的瓶颈是制作这些护甲所需要的原料——而不是成品的品质！",pEN="Do you have the Turtle Scale bracers and helms ready? Don't forget the two wildvines I need!\n\nBy now, you're starting to realize the potential power that lies in Wild Leather armor. An armor that has no boundaries in application is nearly invaluable to a leatherworker. The limits are only in the quantities of resources to make the items - not the quality of the finished products!",c="你又一次完美地完成了我交给你的任务。也许有一天，我会要向你学些什么东西，不是吗，$n？\n\n这是给你的护腿图样，另外我还要对你表示感谢。学会这个图样，让你高超的技艺体现在你制作出的装备中吧！",cEN="Again, you've filled an order without flaw. Perhaps some day I will come to YOU seeking knowledge, eh <name>?\n\nHere is the pattern for the leggings, along with my thanks. Commit this lore to your knowledge, and let your finished products tap into your impressive skills!"}
Q[2853]={d="哎呀，$n，你简直是勤勉的化身。野性之皮护甲的图样你几乎全都掌握了，只差最后一张。我不会让你为此白白辛苦。因为你已经凭实力赢得了它，甚至还不止……但我没法亲自教你。我的老师，也就是带我入行的人，才该给你这份奖赏。\n\n把这封信带给泰罗尼斯；他在达纳苏斯教授制皮。把信给他看，他就会像我一样把你当作$g同行:同行;对待。",dEN="Well <name>, you are the definition of diligence. There is one pattern left for Wild Leather armor; you've mastered the others. I won't require you to toil needlessly for the pattern. You've earned it outright, and then some... but I cannot give it to you myself. My teacher, the one who brought me into the craft, is the one who must reward you.\n\nTake this letter to Telonis; he teaches leatherworking in Darnassus. Show him the letter, and let him acknowledge you as an equal, as I do.",o="将普拉特的信交给达纳苏斯的制皮大师泰龙尼斯。",oEN="Give Pratt's Letter to Telonis, the master leatherworker of Darnassus.",p="你好，$r……从你的面容我能看出你和我一样是$g制皮师:制皮师;。你是来学我的手艺的，还是另有别的事找我？",pEN="Greetings, <race>... from your countenance I can tell you are a leatherworker as am I. Have you come to draw from my skills, or perhaps you have other business with me?",c="啊，原来是普拉特让你来的。虽然他是人类，但他有时令我想起了暗夜精灵。他对于制皮业的贡献和才能给我留下了很深刻的印象。他在信中如此称赞你，在我看来这是一种尊重的体现。\n\n我知道他已经教会了你制作蛮皮护甲的方法，接下来就让我把最后一款蛮皮护甲的制作方法传授给你吧。你要好好珍惜你获得的知识，这个世界上没有几个人知道蛮皮披风的秘密。",cEN="Ah yes, Pratt sent you. Though he is a human, he reminds me of us night elves sometimes. His dedication and his talents with leather are impressive. For him to compliment you so in this letter, it is a sign of respect I acknowledge.\n\nI am aware that he has taught you the art of Wild Leather. Allow me to finish your training with this pattern. Make good use of it; few in the world know the secrets of Wild Leather cloaks."}
Q[2854]={d="$n，你作为$g制皮师:制皮师;的名声先于你而至。我掌握着一些你该学的制皮学问……比如野性之皮护甲！野性之皮利用了生长在茂密植被区域以及当地某些生物身上的野性藤蔓那种强劲而混沌的特性。用它制作的护甲，对$g你这种手艺的:你这种手艺的;工匠来说是最好的，我保证。\n\n我会教你，但你得为我干一阵子活。第一笔成本只是十张厚皮。之后我们再谈细节。",dEN="<name>, your skill as a leatherworker precedes you. I possess leatherworking lore you would be wise to acquire... Wild Leather armor! Wild Leather taps into the potent and chaotic properties of wildvines, found in areas of lush vegetation and on some of the creatures there. Armor made using it is second to none for a crafter of your skill, guaranteed.\n\nI'll teach you, but you'll be working for me for a while. The first cost is simply ten pieces of thick leather. After this, we'll talk specifics.",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去10块厚皮。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Leather to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="就像我说过的那样，你要想学会制作蛮皮护甲，就得做我的学徒。野葡萄是强大而又混乱的，它可以在原本已经非常强大的护甲上加上随机的魔法属性，但是我发现这一点可是花了很长时间的。\n\n这一过程的最初阶段的花费是十块厚皮。\n\n当你得到十块厚皮之后，我们再继续进行下一步工作，给你护甲的图样。",pEN="We must be clear; you shall be apprenticed to me while you learn the art of Wild Leather armor. Because wildvines are both potent and chaotic, it yields a random but strong benefit to the already strong armor you will be making. This knowledge, however, was not easy for me to acquire.\n\nThe initial cost to begin this process is ten pieces of thick leather.\n\nOnce that is done, we'll get to the work you need to do in order to obtain the patterns.",c="好吧，$n，很高兴收你为徒。作为$g制皮师:制皮师;，你做了个明智的决定；等你掌握野性之皮这门技艺，用皮甲的人都会争着来找你。\n\n我们开始干活吧——你想从哪儿入手？",cEN="Well <name>, I'm glad to have you on board as my apprentice. You've made a wise decision as a leatherworker; those who make use of leather armor will be clamoring to you once you learn how to master the art of Wild Leather.\n\nLet's get to work - where do you want to start?"}
Q[2855]={d="蛮皮护肩能够很好地支撑穿戴者的身形，为其上臂和肩部提供了极好的保护。和所有的蛮皮护甲一样，制作时所使用的野葡萄会使其附带一种强大的随机魔法效果。\n\n如果你想要这种护甲的图样，就给我弄六块厚重护甲片和一株野葡萄来，这对你来说应该不算什么过分的要求。",dEN="Wild Leather shoulders support a wearer's frame extremely well, offering superior protection of the upper arms as well as the shoulders. As with all Wild Leather armor, a random yet very potent enhancement is imbued within the item as the wildvine is stitched in.\n\nFor this pattern, I will require six thick armor kits and a wildvine. That shouldn't be too tall of an order for you to fill.",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去6块厚重护甲片和1株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 6 Thick Armor Kits and a Wildvine to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="你有我要的 6 个厚重护甲工具包和野性藤蔓吗？\n\n把制作护甲工具包看作一堂关于稳定可靠制作的课；你反复制作这些工具包所形成的固定手法，能帮你练就成为野性之皮护甲所需的精细工夫。\n\n每一课都有其用意，$n。重要的是相应地对待每一课。",pEN="Do you have the six thick armor kits and the wildvine I require?\n\nThink of making armor kits as a lesson in steady and reliable crafting; the consistent fashioning method you develop as you ply your trade on these kits helps develop your skills for the intricate work needed to make Wild Leather armors.\n\nEvery lesson has a purpose, <name>. It is important to embrace each one accordingly.",c="这些护甲片的品质很不错，$n。无论是对于我自己还是我的学徒，我对品质的要求都很高。\n\n你做得很好，理应获得这个图样，我希望它给你带来荣誉和财富，就像它曾经给我带来的那样。",cEN="These armor kits are of solid quality, <name>. If there is one thing I demand in not only my work, but in the work of those I give tutelage to, it is quality.\n\nYou've done well to earn this pattern; I hope it brings you the rewards it has brought me."}
Q[2856]={d="蛮皮外衣是蛮皮护甲中最主要的部分，它的结构以及编织于其中的野葡萄能使其在具有很强的保护作用的同时，还附带着强大的魔法力量。\n\nB如果你想要这种护甲的图样，就给我弄两件龟鳞胸甲、两副龟鳞手套和一株野葡萄来。这不是件容易的活儿，但你一定可以完成它。",dEN="Wild Leather vests are the staple of any Wild Leather armor set. The frame of the vest and the wildvine weave within it produces a product that offers maximum protection of the torso while allowing for potent magic to work its way through the garment.\n\nFor this pattern, I will require two Turtle Scale breastplates, two sets of Turtle Scale gloves, and a wildvine. This is not an easy lesson, but it is one you certainly have the skill to complete.",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去2件龟鳞胸甲、2副龟鳞手套和1株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Turtle Scale Breastplates, 2 Turtle Scale Gloves, and a Wildvine to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="你弄到两件龟鳞外衣和两副龟鳞手套了吗？还有别忘了野葡萄！\n\n即使是最基本的图样，其基础造型也可以被转化运用到更多更复杂的装备制作工艺中。通过制作龟鳞外衣，你应该已经掌握了制作蛮皮外衣的基本要领。\n\n当你逐渐熟练了之后，你的手艺就会如艺术一般完美。",pEN="Do you have the two Turtle Scale breastplates and gloves? Also, don't forget the wildvine!\n\nEven with the earliest patterns, we learn that the fundamentals of shape translate well into more difficult garments. Though different items, the shape of the Turtle Scale breastplates prepares you for the detailing needed to make a Wild Leather vest.\n\nAs you progress through your lessons, the skills I teach will become as art.",c="这几件装备都很不错，$n。你在这些装备上所注入的工艺和耐心让我看到你已经决心选择全身心地投入这个任务之中了。\n\n你已经达到了我的要求，这是给你的奖赏。制作蛮皮外衣的秘诀现在就是你的了！",cEN="These are some very nice pieces here, <name>. The craftsmanship and care put in to making these show you have chosen to dedicate yourself fully to these tasks.\n\nYou've met my requests, and with that comes your reward. The knowledge of making Wild Leather vests is now yours!"}
Q[2857]={d="蛮皮头盔可以为你的头部提供极好的保护，与此同时，它也具有相当的舒适性。和所有的蛮皮护甲一样，制作头盔时使用的野葡萄会使它产生一种强大的随机魔法效果。对于穿着皮甲的人来说，这东西可是非常不错的！\n\n想要得到这顶头盔的图样的话，就给我带两件夜色外套、两条夜色头巾和一株野葡萄来。完成这个任务之后，图样就是你的了！",dEN="A Wild Leather helmet offers the wearer superior protection to the vital areas of the head without a sacrifice in comfort. As with all Wild Leather armor, the integrated wildvine yields a powerful but random magic imbuement to the helm's frame. Leather wearers will definitely want this piece!\n\nFor this pattern, I will need two Nightscape tunics, 2 Nightscape headbands, and a wildvine. Complete this lesson and the pattern will be yours!",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去2件夜色外套、2条夜色头巾和1株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Nightscape Tunics, 2 Nightscape Headbands, and a Wildvine to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="我需要那些外套和头罩，另外还需要一株野葡萄，然后我就会把蛮皮盔帽的制作方法告诉你。\n\n防护头部的装备是冒险者们垂涎已久的，无论是简单的头带还是一顶密闭的盔帽，无论其外观如何，制造有价值的头部装备的道理是恒久不变的。",pEN="I need those tunics and headbands made, and I also need that piece of wildvine before I will share with you the knowledge of Wild Leather helmets.\n\nHead gear is highly coveted amongst adventurers, whether it be a disarmingly simple headband or a full-covering helmet. The fundamentals of creating valued head gear remain constant, no matter what the cosmetic appearance of the gear is.",c="你提供的这套夜色装备完全符合我给出的要求，$n。我对你这种水准的$g制皮师:制皮师;没有别的期待。\n\n你赢得了制作野性之皮头盔的荣誉。我免费把这张图样给你，希望你能因此获益。",cEN="This Nightscape equipment you have supplied perfectly meets the requirements I have given to you, <name>. I expect no less from a leatherworker of your caliber.\n\nYou have earned the honor of crafting Wild Leather helmets. I give this pattern to you freely, and hope you will profit from it accordingly."}
Q[2858]={d="你现在已经学到了很多东西，$n，但你仍有更多的东西要学习。现在我们来谈谈蛮皮战靴，它是这一套装备的基石。\n\n这种靴子舒适合脚，可以让你的双脚在长途跋涉之后仍然轻松自如。柔软的鞋底对于那些喜欢悄悄行动的人来说再合适不过了。\n\n如果你想要得到它的图样，就给我拿两条夜色短裤和两双夜色长靴来。另外我还需要两株野葡萄……只有一株的话可不够。拿到以上这些东西之后，就把它们交给我。",dEN="Your knowledge of Wild Leather armor grows, <name>; still, there is more for you to learn.\n\nWild Leather boots are the cornerstone of any set. Such boots are crafted to cradle the foot in comfort while bracing it against the hazards of adventuring. The soft soles are a blessing to those seeking quiet movement in footwear.\n\nFor this pattern, I need two Nightscape pants and two Nightscape boots crafted. I also will require two wildvines... not just one. When you have these items, we will proceed.",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去2条夜色短裤、2双夜色长靴和2株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Nightscape Pants, 2 Nightscape Boots, and 2 Wildvines to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="在你学习这个图样以前，你必须把裤子、靴子和野葡萄给我拿来，$n。你找到这些东西了吗？\n\n从我们学会制作第一双靴子起，我们便开始懂得如何掌握靴子的舒适性与功能性之间的尺度。只有兼顾两样，我们才能够制造出令穿着者忘记疲劳的靴子，我们的靴子绝对会让那些劣质的同类产品无地自容。",pEN="The pants, boots, and wildvines need to be delivered to me before you learn the pattern, <name>. Have you done as I asked?\n\nFrom the earliest pair of boots we learn how to make, we start to understand that a quality boot needs to ride a razor's edge between comfort and function. With both, we are able to create items that allow the wearer to ignore fatigue that would cripple those wearing lower quality goods.",c="你再一次以$g经验丰富的:经验丰富的;专业人士的手法完成了一份复杂的订单。你赢得了这张图样，也赢得了我的祝贺。",cEN="Once again, you have produced items with the skill of a seasoned professional. You have earned this pattern, as well as my congratulations."}
Q[2859]={d="你已$g准备好:准备好;学习更复杂的课程了，$n。野性之皮护腿是现存最结实、最强力的皮甲之一。腰部、大腿、小腿以及要害部位都能得到极好的保护。再加上野性藤蔓提供的强化，拥有它的冒险者每次见到你都会感谢你。\n\n要获得这张图样，你需要给我带来 2 顶龟壳头盔、2 副龟壳护腕和 2 株野性藤蔓。",dEN="You are ready to master more complex lessons, <name>. Wild Leather leggings are some of the sturdiest and powerful leather gear around. The waist, thighs, calves, and the vitals - all are given tremendous protection. Coupled with the enhancement that the wildvine provides, adventurers who own it will thank you each time they see you.\n\nFor you to gain this pattern, I need two Turtle Scale helms, two Turtle Scale bracers, and two wildvines.",o="给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去2顶龟鳞头盔、2副龟鳞护腕和2株野葡萄。",oEN="Bring 2 Turtle Scale Helms, 2 Turtle Scale Bracers, and 2 Wildvines to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="你弄到龟鳞头盔和护腕了吗？另外不要忘记我还要两株野葡萄。\n\n现在，你已经开始意识到蛮皮护胫潜在的能量了。一件拥有无穷应用潜力的护甲对于一个皮革匠来说是无价的，唯一的瓶颈是制作这些护甲所需要的原料——而不是成品的品质！",pEN="Do you have the Turtle Scale bracers and helms ready? Don't forget the two wildvines I require.\n\nBy now, you're starting to realize the potential power that lies in Wild Leather armor. An armor that has no boundaries in application is nearly invaluable to a leatherworker. The limits are only in the quantities of resources to make the items - not the quality of the finished products!",c="你又一次完美地完成了我交给你的任务。也许有一天，我会要向你学些什么东西，不是吗，$n？\n\n这是给你的护腿图样，另外我还要对你表示感谢。学会这个图样，让你高超的技艺体现在你制作出的装备中吧！",cEN="Again, you've completed my task without flaw. Perhaps some day I will come to YOU seeking knowledge, eh <name>?\n\nHere is the pattern for the leggings, along with my thanks. Commit this lore to your knowledge, and let your finished products tap into your impressive skills!"}
Q[2860]={d="$n，我所能教你的你都已经学会了。不过野性之皮护甲还剩最后一张图样。我不会要你再白白辛苦；你已经凭实力赢得了它，甚至还不止。但这张图样，我没法随意与你分享。\n\n我的老师，也就是带我入行的人，才该给你这份奖赏。把这封信带给乌娜；她在雷霆崖教授制皮。把信给她看，她就会像我一样把你当作$g同行:同行;对待。",dEN="<name>, you have learned all I am able to teach you. There is, however, one remaining pattern for Wild Leather armor. I will not require you to toil needlessly for this; you've earned it outright, and then some. This pattern, however, is one that I cannot freely share with you.\n\nMy teacher, the one who brought me into the craft, is the one who must reward you. Take this note to Una; she teaches leatherworking in Thunder Bluff. Show her the letter, and let her acknowledge you as an equal, as I do.",o="将杉多尔的信交给雷霆崖的制皮大师犹纳。",oEN="Give Jangdor's Letter to Una, the master leatherworker of Thunder Bluff.",p="你好，$r……从你的面容我能看出你和我一样是$g制皮师:制皮师;。你是来学我的手艺的，还是另有别的事找我？",pEN="Greetings, <race>... from your countenance I can tell you are a leatherworker as am I. Have you come to draw from my skills, or perhaps you have other business with me?",c="啊，好啊，杉多尔派你来的。我很高兴我最好的学徒之一也有自己的学徒了。\n\n他对于皮革的贡献和才能给我留下了很深刻的印象。他在信中如此称赞你，在我看来这是一种尊重的体现。\n\n我知道他已经教会了你制作蛮皮护甲的方法，接下来就让我把最后一款蛮皮护甲的制作方法传授给你吧。你要好好珍惜你获得的知识，这个世界上没有几个人知道蛮皮披风的秘密。",cEN="Ah yes, Jangdor sent you. I am pleased to see that one of my finest students now has a student of his own.\n\nHis dedication and his talents with leather are impressive. For him to compliment you so in this letter, it is a sign of respect I acknowledge.\n\nI am aware that he has taught you the art of Wild Leather. Allow me to finish your training with this pattern. Make good use of it; few in the world know the secrets of Wild Leather cloaks."}
Q[2861]={d="有传言说，住在尘泥沼泽深处的法师同行塔贝莎跟祖尔法拉克的某个沙巨魔有过节。如果你去跟塔贝莎谈谈，她能告诉你更多。\n\n再带上几个朋友，$n。如果塔贝莎让你去祖尔法拉克，你可不会想$g一个人:一个人;去。\n\n塔贝莎的小屋在塞拉摩以西，碎岩废墟正北。",dEN="Rumor is that Tabetha, a mage colleague who lives deep in Dustwallow Marsh, has a bone to pick with a certain sand troll in Zul'Farrak. If you speak with Tabetha she can tell you more.\n\nAnd bring some friends with you, <name>. If Tabetha has you go to Zul'Farrak then you're not going to want to go alone.\n\nYou will find Tabetha's cottage west of Theramore, and just north of the Stonemaul Ruin.",o="与尘泥沼泽的塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="没错，我确实想要一个巨魔去死。我要他身上的骨头，所有的骨头！\n\n你想要帮助我吗？",cEN="That's right. I do have a bone to pick with a troll. A few bones. All her bones!\n\nWant to help me?"}
Q[2862]={d="豺狼人……它们现在不再只是一个小麻烦了，它们已经对我们形成了巨大的威胁！这些豺狼人是不是菲拉斯的原住民已经不重要了；如果我们无法有效地对抗它们，那我们早晚都会被赶出这个地区的。\n\n豺狼人最近对营地的攻势愈演愈烈，因此我们需要你的帮助来削弱它们的数量。带给我十份豺狼人的鬃毛，我会为你付出的努力而给予优厚的报酬。\n\n赶快出发吧！",dEN="The gnolls... they are more than a nuisance. They are a constant threat to the existence of this very camp! It is irrelevant whether they are indigenous to Feralas or not; if we do not strengthen our resolve against them, we will find ourselves driven out of the entire region.\n\nThe gnoll attacks against the camp have become more fevered as of late. We need your aid in thinning their numbers; bring to me ten of their manes, and I will reward you handsomely for your effort.\n\nGo!",o="将10份木爪豺狼人的鬃毛交给莫沙彻营地的哈杜肯·迅蹄。",oEN="Bring 10 Woodpaw Gnoll Manes to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="我们把那些豺狼人都击退了，但是它们仍然在坚持进攻！一定是有什么人或什么东西让它们变得如此疯狂……哦，你回来了，任务完成了吗，$n？你拿到我要的鬃毛了吗？",pEN="We drive them back, and yet they still attack! Someone or something must be driving them into a frenzy... oh, you have returned, eh <name>? Do you have the manes I require for the bounty to be met?",c="这是个好的开始，$n。你作为士兵的本领值得称道。\n\n$g我不是:我不是;只把这任务交给你一个人。在你之前有很多人跟他们交战过，过去我们的努力一直把他们挡在外面。但最近，他们向北推进、侵入我们势力范围的企图急剧增加。他们的攻击也变得更加凶蛮……几乎像是走投无路。\n\n不过我有个计划，也许能一劳永逸地解决他们……",cEN="This is proof of a good start, <name>. Your skills as a soldier are to be commended.\n\nYou are not the only one I ask that task of. Many before you have fought them, and in times past our efforts have kept them at bay. Recently though, their attempts to push northward into our area of influence have increased dramatically. Their attacks have also become more savage... almost as if they were desperate.\n\nI have a plan though, <name>, that might settle things once and for all against them..."}
Q[2863]={d="计划是在极短时间内连续干掉豺狼人的几个首领，那些自称“头狼”的家伙。如果我们能足够迅速精准地实施，就能在他们内部制造混乱。也许还能把“我们能毁灭他们、而且一定会”这个信息钉进他们那些长满跳蚤的笨脑袋里！\n\n我要你成为我意志的$g使者:使者;，$n。在一小时内干掉他们的 5 个头狼，计划才能奏效；如果你拖得更久，我们就只能继续僵持下去！",dEN="The plan is for various leaders of the gnolls - Alphas as they call themselves - to be taken down within rapid succession. If we're able to execute this sort of swift and precise devastation against them, it would cause chaos in their ranks. Perhaps it would also drive a message through their thick flea-bitten heads that we can and will destroy them!\n\nI want you to be the messenger of my will; eliminate five of their Alphas within one hour for this to work <name>, or we'll remain at this impasse!",o="在1个小时内杀死5个木爪突击队员，并向哈杜肯·迅蹄汇报。",oEN="Kill 5 Woodpaw Alphas and return to Hadoken Swiftstrider within one hour.",p="时间宝贵，$n！如果你来这里不是要向我报捷的话，那么你就是在浪费时间！",pEN="Time is running out, <name>! If you're not here to report that you've taken out the Alphas, then you're wasting time!",c="你完成了我吩咐的任务，因此我向你表示敬意。拿着这个小奖励吧，$n。\n\n豺狼人的突击队员被杀死了，接下来他们会对突袭营地的计划考虑再三。但这并不意味着我们手头的事情已经结束了……\n\n豺狼人变得如此疯狂，这其中必有蹊跷。我想在他们有机会重新集结之前找到原因。",cEN="You've done as I have asked, and for that I salute you. Take this small reward as compensation for your efforts, <name>.\n\nWith their numbers thinned and their leaders slain, the gnolls will think twice about storming the camp. This doesn't conclude the issue at hand, however...\n\nThere must be some reason why the gnolls have been whipped into such a frenzied state. Before they have a chance to regroup though, I want to find out what is causing it."}
Q[2864]={d="我的兄弟特兰雷克现在显然处于困境中。几个星期之前他曾经向我承诺会给我一批圣甲虫的壳，但是至今为止我还没有收到。他是我的兄弟，所以我可不想派人去加基森砸他的场子。\n\n你能帮我去问问特兰雷克到底是怎么回事吗？在我真的发飙之前他最好快点把货给我送来。\n\n加基森就在卡利姆多大陆上的塔纳利斯沙漠北部。",dEN="My cousin Tran'rek is in a tight spot. He promised me a load of scarab shells weeks ago and he hasn't delivered. He's my cousin, so I'd hate to have to send someone to Gadgetzan to break something on him.\n\nCan you speak to Tran'rek for me? Let him know he needs to get that delivery together before I do something rash?\n\nGadgetzan is in northern Tanaris, in Kalimdor.",o="与加基森的特兰雷克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.",c="你好！\n\n哦，是我兄弟克拉兹克派你来的？他最近怎么样了？我希望他在藏宝海湾过得还好……\n\n你是说圣甲虫壳？好吧……让我告诉你一个故事……",cEN="Hello!\n\nOh, you spoke to my cousin Krazek? How is he? I hope Booty Bay is treating him well...\n\nScarab shells, you say? Well... let me tell you a story..."}
Q[2865]={d="塔纳利斯这里的圣甲虫的壳都很硬！硬得足可以给好多东西当建筑材料，好多东西！\n\n事实上，因为那些壳都太有用了……圣甲虫已经被猎杀得近乎灭绝了！\n\n我知道哪里有更多的圣甲虫，如果你保证会给我弄些壳来，我就告诉你它们在哪里。你保证吗？\n\n好吧，祖尔法拉克里面有许多圣甲虫，我想巨魔们并不因为想要那些壳而猎杀它们。\n\n但你可以！到祖尔法拉克去给我弄些完好无损的壳回来！",dEN="The scarabs of Tanaris have very hard shells! Hard enough to use as a building material for lots of things. So many things!\n\nIn fact, those shells are so useful... the scarabs were hunted all to near extinction!\n\nI know where there are more scarabs, and if you promise to bring me their shells then I'll tell you where they are. Promise?\n\nOk, the scarabs have a colony in Zul'Farrak. I guess the trolls don't hunt them for their shells.\n\nBut you can! Go to Zul'Farrak and get me uncracked shells!",o="给加基森的特兰雷克带去5个完整的圣甲虫壳。",oEN="Bring 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.",p="你弄到壳了吗？我那藏宝海湾的堂兄在等着我给他寄去一大批壳呐，他已经等得不耐烦了！",pEN="Do you have the shells? My cousin in Booty Bay is waiting for a load of them, and he's getting impatient!",c="哦，太好了！你拿到了！\n\n谢谢你，$n。你真$g是:是;个$g不折不扣的:不折不扣的;救命恩人！",cEN="Oh, great! You got them!\n\nThanks, <name>. You're a real lifesaver!"}
Q[2866]={d="在我们的南边就是索兰萨尔废墟，那个地区的历史相当悠久。我们探索过那个遗迹，没有发现什么特别值得注意的东西，所以我们就离开了。\n\n最近，憎世纳迦占据了那片遗迹，而且他们的数量已经多到了让我们不得不警惕的程度。一开始我们认为那些纳迦是准备对我们发起攻击，虽然这种可能性现在依然存在，但我们觉得他们可能是有什么别的目的。\n\n现在就到那片废墟去查看一番吧，祝你好运，$n。",dEN="To our south are the Ruins of Solarsal; this is an area that far pre-dates modern times. We explored the ruins initially and found nothing of note; as such, we left it in peace.\n\nVery recently, the Hatecrest naga have occupied these ruins in alarming numbers. At first, we considered it as the precursor for an attack. Though that threat is still possible, we believe there might be something else going on.\n\nGo there, explore the ruins, and look for anything that stands out to you. Good luck, <name>.",o="探索索兰萨尔废墟，并调查纳迦在那个地区的情况。",oEN="Explore the Ruins of Solarsal and investigate the presence of the naga there.",c="仔细检查这座凉亭，会发现一些与周围废墟相比颇为有趣、不同寻常之处。\n\n首先，这座凉亭显然比废墟中的其他结构更新。其次，凉亭侧面刻着一小串符文；符文以固定的模式重复，但除此之外，其来源和含义不明。第三，凉亭本身的石头摸上去是温热的。\n\n在搜寻废墟的过程中，这绝对算得上\"引人注目\"！",cEN="Examining the gazebo reveals some interesting and unusual things in contrast to the surrounding ruins.\n\nFirst, the gazebo is clearly a more recent construction than the other objects in the ruins. Second, the gazebo has a small series of glyphs engraved into the sides of it; the glyphs repeat in their pattern, but it otherwise is unknown in origin and meaning. Third, the stone of the gazebo itself is warm to the touch.\n\nThis certainly quantifies as \"standing out\" in the search of the ruins!"}
Q[2867]={d="在索兰萨尔废墟的心脏地带发现了奇怪的瞭望台之后，你觉得应该马上回到羽月要塞去向珊蒂斯·羽月汇报这个发现。",dEN="With the discovery of the strange gazebo in the heart of the Ruins of Solarsal, the time has come to return to Feathermoon Stronghold and report to General Shandris Feathermoon what has been discovered here.",o="向羽月要塞的珊蒂斯·羽月汇报你的发现。",oEN="Return to Shandris Feathermoon in the Feathermoon Stronghold and report your findings.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。你关于凉亭的报告很……令人不安。看来即便那里的纳迦没有策划进攻，他们的持续存在对我们向菲拉斯推进也不是好兆头。无论如何，这是你调查的报酬。\n\n看来羽月要塞急需人手应对憎恨者纳迦的问题。如果你愿意，我想把这项任务交给你。要做的事很多。",cEN="Welcome back, <name>. Your report on this gazebo is most... disturbing. It would seem that even if the naga there were not planning on an attack, their continued presence bodes ill for our push into Feralas. At any rate, here is compensation for your investigation.\n\nIt would seem that Feathermoon Stronghold is in dire need of additional assistance concerning the Hatecrest naga. I'd like to offer you the task, if you are so inclined. There is much to do."}
Q[2869]={d="我们认为，无论纳迦想要干什么，他们最终的目的无非是完全占据这座岛屿，由此我们制定了相应的行动计划。我们要尽早采取攻击行动来消除这种威胁，否则就可能全盘皆输。\n\n给我带来十块完整的憎世纳迦的鳞片——你应该知道如何获得这东西。这样一来，纳迦在萨尔多岛上的力量就被大大削弱了，这对我们是非常有利的。",dEN="The best course of action at this point is to assume that, regardless of what the naga are up to, they will eventually move to secure the island for their own. We need to take aggressive steps to counter that threat before it is too late.\n\nBring me ten Hatecrest Scales that are in good condition; it should be obvious to you how to acquire them. You'll cut your teeth on the naga for the first time, and we'll have a weakened naga presence on Sardor Isle - both are prospects that play to our advantage.",o="收集10块憎世纳迦的鳞片，把它们交给羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛。",oEN="Bring 10 Hatecrest Naga Scales to Latronicus Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="$n，如果你来这里是来核实我交给你的任务，那么，很好——我要的是十块憎世纳迦的鳞片。如果你来这里是为了闲聊，那么现在我没空和你多罗嗦。\n\n要知道，我们暗夜精灵不是好战分子，我们致力于维护和平与安宁，但这并不代表我们会放弃维护自己的利益。这是我对羽月将军和这座要塞应尽的职责。",pEN="<name>, if you're here to verify the task given to you, then excellent - it is ten Hatecrest scales I seek. If you are here for chit-chat, then I am currently unavailable for such trivialities.\n\nKnow this - we night elves are not warmongers. Our race is dedicated to the preservation of peace and harmony. This does not mean, however, that we will not proactively protect our own interests. This is my duty to General Feathermoon, and to the stronghold.",c="嗯，这些鳞片很令人满意。我会把它们直接送给普拉特，让他看看，或许他能用它们制造出一些有用的东西。\n\n至于你，我还想给你指派另一个任务。不过我要先奖励你，你为将军和整个羽月要塞提供的帮助对我们来说是非常有价值的。",cEN="Yes, yes, these scales are more than satisfactory. Actually, I think I will send these down to Pratt for him to take a look at. Maybe he can craft something useful out of them.\n\nAs for you, I have another mission I want to send you on. But first, here is your bounty for the scales. Your continued service to the General and Feathermoon Stronghold at large is a blessing in the face of adversity."}
Q[2870]={d="$n，新的侦查报告让我们对纳迦部队的组成有了一个更清晰的概念。纳迦的皇室成员在他们的部队中具有最高的权威性。\n\n皇室成员中的沙尔扎鲁是个极端残酷的纳迦，侦查报告表明最近他在南部的遗迹中发现了一块奇怪的古代遗物，那个地方就在恐怖之岛那里。\n\n你的任务就是结果他，然后把那块遗物给我带回来进行研究。",dEN="<name>, new scouting reports have given us a good idea on the naga chain of command. Royalty is present amongst their rank and file, and they're the ones calling all the shots.\n\nSpecifically, we've identified one of the crueler royals as Lord Shalzaru. Scouts report that he himself has uncovered an odd relic during a recent naga excavation in a cave south of the main ruins, across the water on the Isle of Dread.\n\nPut a stop to it by putting a stop to him, and bring me his relic so we can study it.",o="消灭沙尔扎鲁，然后把神秘遗物交给羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛。",oEN="Eliminate Lord Shalzaru, and then bring the Mysterious Relic he uncovered to Latronicus Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="除掉沙尔札鲁领主必定能让他们的计划拖延至少数个星期。除此之外，那块圣物也让我们非常感兴趣。\n\n$n，你完成任务了吗？",pEN="Bringing down Lord Shalzaru would certainly set their plans back weeks, if not months. On top of that, the relic he uncovered is of definite interest to us.\n\nHave you performed the mission given to you, <name>?",c="干得好，$n！沙尔扎鲁领主的死会让纳迦混乱一阵子，甚至可能是永久的。他们如今构成的威胁比以往任何时候都更受我们控制，这都得感谢你。\n\n这些是从要塞国库里拨出的更多赏金——每一枚铜币都是你应得的。你和你的朋友随时都$g欢迎:欢迎;来羽月要塞，我的朋友。\n\n在你离开之前还有一件事，$n……如果你能……",cEN="Well played, <name>! Lord Shalzaru's demise will throw the naga into disarray for some time, if not permanently. The threat they pose is now under more of our control than it has ever been, and we have you to thank for it.\n\nHere is more bounty money from the stronghold treasury - you've earned every copper. You and yours are welcome in Feathermoon Stronghold anytime, my friend.\n\nOne more thing before you depart, <name>... if you could..."}
Q[2871]={d="如果你能帮我将这个东西送给我的妻子维斯提亚，那我会非常感激的。她不仅是我们这里的女祭司，也会是你所见过的最博学的学者之一。我即使抓破头皮也搞不清楚这个东西到底是什么，可我的妻子不同，如果世界上有人能知道这东西是什么，那无疑就是她了……我们也迫切地需要知道真相！\n\n拜托了，$n。",dEN="If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere. I couldn't make heads or tails of this device even if there was a wager involved. My wife though, if anyone can figure out what this thing is, she could... and we need to know!\n\nShe's just around the bend, no doubt studying. Thanks, <name>.",o="将神秘遗物交给羽月要塞的维斯提亚·月矛。",oEN="Deliver the Mysterious Relic to Vestia Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="是的，我能帮你什么吗？\n\n等等，你就是那位一直在帮$g羽月将军:羽月将军;和拉特罗应对纳迦威胁的$c，对吧？我是维斯提亚，拉特罗的……呃，是拉特罗尼库斯的妻子。很高兴认识你！\n\n抱歉我说得太多。你当然是来办正事的。你有东西要给我吗——也许是他托你带来的？",pEN="Yes, may I assist you?\n\nHold on, you're the <class> that has been helping General Feathermoon and Latro out with the naga threat, yes? I'm Vestia, Latro's - erm, rather, Latronicus' wife. It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI'm sorry, you're here on business, of course. Do you have something for me - from him, perchance?",c="真有趣……你说这来自索兰萨尔废墟？好，拉托说得对，我得看一下。它不像是属于那个废墟的东西，好像也不是纳迦的设计……太奇怪了。\n\n我要花点时间研究这东西。当我结束对它的研究时，或许你也可以帮忙进行后续的工作。\n\n来，从这些东西里挑一件吧，我希望它们对你有用！",cEN="Interesting... this came from the Ruins of Solarsal, you say? Well, Latro's right that I need to look at this. At first glance, it seems non-indigenous to the ruins. Then again, this isn't of naga design... not something as alien as this.\n\nIt is going to take some time to research this item. Once my research on it is done, maybe I will make use of your talents, should you be around.\n\nHere, take one of these extra items we have; I hope you'll find some use for it!"}
Q[2872]={d="我的老朋友欠我一瓶特殊的朗姆酒。他在塔纳利斯沙漠的热砂港里经营着一家酒吧，他向我保证说，那里的朗姆酒绝对比藏宝海湾的任何酒都要香醇，还说如果我喝了他的酒不满意的话，那他就会双倍奉还他欠我的钱！\n\n好吧，我想他现在已经不像他上次说这话的时候那么自信了，他害怕给我尝他的朗姆酒了。但是我还是想继续这个赌注，那么你就替我去和他谈谈吧……",dEN="My old buddy Stoley owes me a very special bottle of rum. He tends the bar at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris, Kalimdor, and he promised me that the rum there is stronger than anything we can find in Booty Bay. He's so confident that he says if I try that rum and don't agree with him, then he'll double the money he owes me!\n\nWell, I think he's not as confident as he was when last we spoke, and now he's afraid to give me that rum. But I don't back down from wagers, so why don't you talk to him for me...",o="与热砂港的斯杜雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Stoley in Steamwheedle Port.",c="啊，你和麦克基雷谈过了？\n\n事实并不是他想象的那样！我当然不是不想给他尝尝热砂港朗姆酒……\n\n但是我现在一瓶朗姆酒都没有了！",cEN="Ah, so you've been speaking with MacKinley, have you?\n\nIt's not what he thinks! I'm not afraid to give him some Steamwheedle Bilge Rum...\n\nI just don't have any rum to give him!"}
Q[2873]={d="我欠藏宝海湾的\"海狼\"麦金利一些朗姆酒，是为了了结一场打赌，可我一点都没剩了！库尔戈船长偷走了我最后一批货，把它藏在了南边那座有城墙的海盗城里。\n\n如果你能找到我那批朗姆酒并还给我，也许我就能向麦金利证明，卡利姆多的酒能把藏宝海湾的踩进泥里。",dEN="I owe \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay some rum, to settle a bet, but I'm all out of rum! Captain Cuergo stole my last shipment, and he has it stowed in that walled pirate town to the south.\n\nIf you can find my shipment of rum and return it to me, then I can prove to MacKinley that Kalimdor's booze beats the dirt out of Booty Bay!",o="将斯杜雷的货物交给热砂港的斯杜雷。",oEN="Bring Stoley's Shipment to Stoley in Steamwheedle Port.",p="你有没有找到我的那批朗姆酒，$n？",pEN="Did you find my shipment of rum, <name>?",c="太好了，谢谢你替我找到了这批货。现在我终于可以偿还麦克基雷的赌注了。",cEN="Great, thanks for the shipment! Now MacKinley and I can finally settle our wager."}
Q[2874]={d="再次感谢你的帮助，$n。这里有一瓶热砂港朗姆酒。把它交给马克基雷，这样他就可以抛弃藏宝海湾烈酒，改喝热砂港朗姆酒了！",dEN="Thanks again for your help, <name>. Here's a bottle of Steamwheedle bilge rum. Take it to MacKinley and he can finally put to rest his crazy beliefs about Booty Bay booze.",o="把斯托利的瓶子带给藏宝海湾的\"海狼\"麦金利。",oEN="Bring Stoley's Bottle to \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay.",p="斯杜雷有没有交出我要的那瓶酒？",pEN="Did Stoley cough up my booze?",c="嗯，让我尝尝……\n\n真不敢相信！这东西……太妙了！棒极了！\n\n好吧，我想斯杜雷可以留着他欠我的钱了。他对于热砂港朗姆酒的描述一点也不夸张。这东西的口感和沙粒一样厚实，而性子却烈得像岩浆一样！",cEN="Hm, let's try this...\n\nI can't believe it! This stuff is... terrible! That's great!\n\nWell I guess Stoley can keep the money he owes me. He's true to his word about Steamwheedle bilge rum. That stuff is as thick as gravel and burns like lava!"}
Q[2875]={d="可恶的海盗安德雷·费尔比德因对热砂港和加基森所犯的罪行正被通缉。\n\n根据政府讨论所发布的决议，任何阅读这则通缉令的人有权在逮捕安德雷和他的同党过程中采取可能致其死亡的手段。\n\n进一步的决议表明，如在审讯期间，安德雷死了或病了，他的人头可以作为代替品，将它交给安全主管吉罗姆·比格维兹仍将使这份通缉令生效。",dEN="The vile pirate Andre Firebeard is wanted for crimes against Steamwheedle and Gadgetzan.\n\nBy decree of governing counsel, any who read this are hereby authorized to use lethal force during the apprehension of Andre and his abettors.\n\nBy further decree, should Andre be deceased, or otherwise indisposed, during the time of his hearing, his head may act as proxy, and deliverance of such head to Security Chief Bilgewhizzle constitutes a binding, and tenderable, contract.",o="将安德雷的头颅交给热砂港的安全主管吉罗姆·比格维兹。",oEN="Bring Andre's Head to Security Chief Bilgewhizzle in Steamwheedle Port.",p="你看起来有些神情恍惚，是不是刚刚看过我们的法律文件？",pEN="You look a little dazed. Have you been reading our legal documents?",c="啊，安德雷的脑袋。我早就知道他会被审判的！\n\n非常感谢你，$n。现在，如果你在这里签个字，我就可以为你支付报酬。\n\n别担心字体太小的问题。这里面没有对你不利的条款，而且……我不认为有什么放大镜可以帮助你阅读这些字。",cEN="Ah, Andre's head. So I guess he'll make his trial after all!\n\nMuch appreciated, <name>. Now if you'll just sign here, I can issue you payment for services rendered.\n\nDon't worry about the small print. It's harmless, and... I don't think there's a magnifying glass small enough to read it anyway."}
Q[2876]={d="这卷卷轴记录着热砂港与藏宝海湾之间的货运日程。既包括已完成的货运，也包括待运的，还有船名，其中一些船次旁边画着大大的\"X\"，另一些则写着\"大有收获”和\"苦战”之类的批注。\n\n热砂港肯定有人想看看这份文件。",dEN="This scroll contains the schedules of shipments between Steamwheedle Port and Booty Bay. Both past and future shipments are included, along with ship names, with large 'X's next to some ships' journeys, and annotations like \"GREAT LOOT\" and \"HARD FIGHT\" next to others.\n\nSomeone at Steamwheedle Port would want to see this document.",o="把船运时刻表交给热砂港的某个官员。",oEN="Report the Ship Schedules to an authority in Steamwheedle Port.",p="你看起来$g上气不接下气:上气不接下气;。有什么要告诉我的吗？",pEN="You look out of breath. You have something to tell me?",c="哦，我的天哪，这好像是所有货船到港和离港的记录，上面有精确的日期、时间和其它一切资讯！如果哪个海盗船长弄到了这个，那他可就发大财了！\n\n呃，你说你是从海盗那里得到这个的？这……\n\n谢谢你，$n。我很高兴你能把这个东西夺过来，也很高兴得知那个海盗现在已经被干掉了！",cEN="Oh my, this looks to be a list of ship departures and arrivals, with accurate dates and times and everything! If the captain of a pirate ship got his hands on this, he could have himself a field day!\n\nYou say you got this from a pirate? Well that's disturbing news...\n\nThank you, <name>. I'm glad you took it from him, and I'm glad that pirate's eating dirt right now!"}
Q[2877]={d="比起那些铁炉堡的兄弟们来，我们蛮锤部族对于过去曾发生过的事情有着更加深刻的记忆。如果你想在这里交朋友的话，那么你就要证明给我们看！\n\n部落的蛮子们从隐匿石一带撤了出去，现在那里满地都是淤泥怪。我们想要占领那个地区，不过首先我们要找些人来帮我们清理一下恼人的淤泥怪。\n\n这就是你要做的事情了！到那边去干掉十个绿色淤泥怪和十个玉石软泥怪，然后回到这里来向我报告。快出发吧！",dEN="We Wildhammers remember the past, more than our brothers in Ironforge. If you want to make friends here, then you get your hands dirty for us!\n\nThe Horde abandoned their positions in the Hinterlands around Skulk Rock; it's now overrun with nasty sludges and oozes. We've got plans on that area, but first we need a clean-up crew to make a hole for us.\n\nThat's where you come in, Sunshine! Head down there and take out ten green sludges and ten jade oozes, then report back to me here. Move out!",o="杀掉10个绿色淤泥怪和10个玉石软泥怪，然后回到鹰巢山向弗拉加尔报告。",oEN="Kill 10 Green Sludges and 10 Jade Oozes, and then report back to Fraggar Thundermantle in Aerie Peak.",p="别费劲跟你手上的任务讨价还价了，$r！如果众神想让那些软泥怪被杀死，他们早就显灵办成了，不是吗？！",pEN="Make no effort to negotiate the mission at hand, <race>! If the gods had wanted those oozes killed, they would have miracled it done by now, wouldn't they?!",c="非常好，你为蛮锤部族做出了巨大的贡献！你是一个大有前途的$c，我们尊重你这样的$r。\n\n你的清理任务远比你想象中的要重要，随着软泥怪数量的减少，我们马上就能进一步扩大影响力了。好了，接下来——除了在鹰巢山这里交朋友之外，你暂时没什么事可以做了！",cEN="Well look at you, helping out the Wildhammers! You're a <class> of action, and action is what we respect around here.\n\nYour little clean-up mission is a lot more important than you might think it is. With folks thinning out the oozes and sludges, we'll be able to extend our sphere of influence in no time. Here - have a little something in addition to just making new friends here in Aerie Peak!"}
Q[2878]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[2879]={d="看来这根法杖可能就是艾奎尼克斯法杖了。它事实上是把钥匙，你可以用它打开位于北方废墟中的艾奎尼克斯石碑。\n\n找到仍在那片废墟中燃烧的四团烈火：萨姆哈之焰、拜尔坦之焰、伊姆贝尔之焰和莱哈萨之焰。从这些火焰那里采集它们的精华。然后在艾奎尼克斯石碑旁使用这些精华，把它们的能量注入法杖。如果这真的是艾奎尼克斯法杖的话，你就可以打开石碑，并得到存放在里面的古物。",dEN="This stave might be the Stave of Equinex! The Stave of Equinex is actually a key, used to unlock the Equinex Monolith in the Ruins of Ravenwind, on the mainland west of the Dream Bough.\n\nFind the four flames that still burn in those ruins: Samha, Imbel, Byltan, and Lahassa. Retrieve their essence and then while standing by the Equinex Monolith, use the essences to energize the stave. If this is truly is the Stave of Equinex, you will be able to unlock the Monolith and gather a sacred artifact from it.",o="给特洛亚斯的法杖注入能量，并找到艾奎尼克斯石碑。",oEN="Energize Troyas' Stave and find the Equinex Monolith.",p="艾奎尼克斯石碑静静地立在废墟中。它到底蕴藏着什么秘密呢？",pEN="The Equinex Monolith stands silently among the ruins. What could it be holding?",c="这把充满能量的法杖几乎让人快握不住了。它的能量流窜于你的体内。\n\n你伸手去触碰艾奎尼克斯石碑的冰冷表面……\n\n一扇小门应声而开，使你得以把法杖带入其中。\n\n艾奎尼克斯石碑周围的区域发出了耀眼的光芒。",cEN="Holding the energized stave is almost impossible. Its power rumbles through your body.\n\nYou reach out to the cold surface of the Equinex Monolith...\n\nA small door opens, allowing you to reach in and take the artifact inside.\n\nBeams of light fill the area around the Equinex Monolith."}
Q[2880]={d="听清楚了，$r——我们不是联盟的一部分！蛮锤部族是独立的，我们相信价值要靠行动和事迹来证明，而不是靠那些用废话来掩饰无所作为的人空谈！\n\n如果你想在这里交朋友，就先向我们证明你的价值！那些堵塞腹地山丘的肮脏巨魔有时会带着部族项链。给我带五条来，我们就把它记作你朝正确方向迈出的一步。",dEN="Get this straight, <race> - we are NOT part of the Alliance! The Wildhammers are independent, relying on deeds and actions to prove one's worth, rather than the blather of those who use jibber-jabber to bolster their do-nothing attitudes!\n\nIf you're looking for friends here, then prove your worth to us first! The foul trolls that choke the hillsides of the Hinterlands sometimes carry tribal necklaces. Bring five of them to me, and we'll mark it down as a step in the right direction for you.",o="给鹰巢山的弗拉加尔带去5条巨魔部族项链。",oEN="Bring 5 Troll Tribal Necklaces to Fraggar Thundermantle in Aerie Peak.",p="我想要那些巨魔身上的部族项链。如果你想得到它的话，那就把你所看到的巨魔都干掉吧！\n\n向蛮锤部族证明你的价值！",pEN="I want five of those tribal necklaces the trolls carry on them. If you need it spelled out further, then killing one of them stands you a good chance of getting one!\n\nProve your worth to the Wildhammers!",c="这正是我提到的东西！看——这些项链证明了你的价值，我们蛮锤部族珍惜我们的朋友。\n\n继续好好干吧，你会受我们的青睐的。",cEN="Now that's what I am talking about! See - these necklaces prove that you're willing to get your hands dirty. We Wildhammers value that in those we associate with.\n\nYou keep this up, and you'll be in our good graces yet."}
Q[2881]={p="你已经完成了我交给你的任务，但我们会继续接受你拿来的任何巨魔部族项链。你把它们交给我，你在蛮锤部族中的地位就会继续提高如果你愿意为我们战斗，那么我们也愿意为你战斗！\n\n我需要五条巨魔部族项链，$n。",pEN="I want five of those tribal necklaces the trolls carry on them. If you need it spelled out further, then killing one of them stands you a good chance of getting one!\n\nProve your worth to the Wildhammers!",c="你又给我带来一套项链，这说明辛特兰的巨魔数量又少了一些！干得好，$n！",cEN="Now that's what I am talking about! See - these necklaces prove that you're willing to get your hands dirty. We Wildhammers value that in those we associate with.\n\nYou keep this up, and you'll be in our good graces yet."}
Q[2882]={d="这张地图上画着一条对着南方的海滩，图下面用优雅的字体写着……\n\n\n热砂港南边\n家的南边\n找到骨头，旗子和旗杆\n如果你够胆，就去挖挖看\n挖挖看啊，科尔戈的金子光灿灿！\n开箱需钥匙，钥匙你会看见\n你面对的要用血来做交换。",dEN="This map shows a stretch of beach with a southern face. Below the map are words, elegantly written...\n\n\nSouth of Wheedle\nSouth of home\nFind a mast and flag and bones\nDig you there, if you be bold\nDig and claim Cuergo's gold!\nA key you'll need and a key you'll see\nThe men you face take blood as fee.",o="找到科尔戈的黄金！",oEN="Find Cuergo's gold!",p="这个箱子被锁上了！",pEN="This chest is locked!",c="科尔戈船长的秘密宝藏正在等着你！",cEN="Captain Cuergo's hidden treasure awaits!"}
Q[2902]={d="豺狼人不是菲拉斯最具威胁的势力，但它们最近的活动毫无疑问是有些具体战略的。如果我们能找到它们的计划，那么我们就能知道究竟是什么让它们变得如此精明。\n\n我要你回到木爪岭去，寻找任何有可能是它们的战斗计划的东西。他们一定有些这样的东西，因为它们的攻击行动太协调了，没有一个像样的战斗计划是不可能进行的。找到那东西，然后再回到我这里来。",dEN="Gnolls aren't the sharpest tools in the shed, but they will no doubt have some sort of documented strategy on their recent activity. If we were to find those plans, then we'd have a clearer idea of what is making them so worked up.\n\nI want you to head back to the Woodpaw and find anything that might resemble their battle plans. They have to have something; their attacks have been too coordinated to be done without them. Find them, and return to me when you have them.",o="在莫沙彻营地以南的豺狼人营地中寻找豺狼人的战斗计划。",oEN="Find the gnoll battle plans somewhere in the gnoll camps to the south of Camp Mojache.",c="检查地图之后，你发现这正是哈杜肯·迅蹄想要的作战地图。地图上所画的无数箭头或许代表了军队行进的方向，不过几乎所有箭头都指向了南部，而不是莫沙彻营地所在的北部。\n\n地图的另一个部分是一幅图，上面的东西看起来像是某种大型昆虫，下面画了一些记号。这些记号也许是表示与那些未知生物作战所遭受的损失。",cEN="Examining the map reveals it to be the battle plans that Hadoken Swiftstrider wants. Numerous arrows that perhaps represent troop movements are drawn on the map, though most seem to be headed toward the south rather than to the north where Camp Mojache lies.\n\nAnother section of the map has a picture of what you think is a large insect of some kind, with various tick marks under it. From the looks of the gnolls, it perhaps represents their losses against the unknown bugs..."}
Q[2903]={d="既然我们已经发现了豺狼人的作战计划，接下来要做的就是把计划交给莫沙彻营地的哈杜肯·迅蹄。他或者那儿的其他什么人也许可以进一步弄清楚豺狼人到底想要做什么。",dEN="With the battle plans of the gnolls discovered, all that now remains is to bring the plans back to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache. Perhaps he or someone there can make further sense of what the gnolls are up to.",o="把木爪豺狼人的作战计划交给莫沙彻营地的哈杜肯·迅蹄。",oEN="Bring the Woodpaw Battle Plans to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n——你找到能证明豺狼人计划的确凿证据了吗？",pEN="Welcome back <name> - were you able to find some tangible evidence as to the plans of the gnolls?",c="啊，这正是我们需要的。虽然我还无法完全破译这张地图上涂写的东西，不过年轻的时候我研究过许多作战图，看来豺狼人现在的状况不妙。他们好像正在两线作战，除了作战之外……他们的主要精力似乎都用来对付南边的另一个敌人了。\n\n看来我们现在又多了一些问题，也许是时候去了解一下他们的另一个敌人究竟是谁了。",cEN="Ah, this is exactly what we needed. While I am not so skilled at ciphering what most of the scrawling on this map is, I've seen enough battle plans in my day to understand what is happening with the gnolls. It looks like they are currently fighting a two front war. One is with us... but it seems that their main energy has been against a foe to their south.\n\nThere's more at hand here than meets the eye. Perhaps it is time to figure out who this other foe they face really is."}
Q[2904]={d="<克努比呻吟着>发……发生什么事了？\n\n我只记得自己被一队黑铁矮人抓住了，他们暴打了我一顿，把我跟这些丑陋的穴居人扔在一块儿。\n\n快救我出去，$n！\n\n我有个计划：把我带到出口，如果我们能活着走出去的话，你就到藏宝海湾去，告诉斯库提我去了棘齿城，然后警告廷克维斯，黑铁矮人准备制造超强的钻探设备。\n\n让我们开始吧！",dEN="<Kernobee groans.> Wha.. What happened?\n\nThe last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs.\n\nGet me out of here, <name>!\n\nHere's the plan: Lead me to the exit; if we make it out alive, you go to Booty Bay and let Scooty know that I went to Ratchet to warn Tinkerwiz of the dark iron's involvement in the making of that super rig.\n\nLet's get going!",o="将克努比护送到出口，然后向藏宝海湾的斯库提汇报。",oEN="Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay.",p="嗯？克努比还活着？",pEN="Eh? Kernobee is alive??",c="$n，你把克努比救了出来，当然应该获得奖励。如果你回到诺莫瑞根去，这些东西或许可以帮助你打败那个一无是处的卑鄙家伙，机电师瑟玛普拉格。",cEN="I suppose you should be rewarded for bringing Kernobee back to us in one piece, <name>. If you go back to Gnomeregan, these might give you the edge you'll need in defeating that good-for-nothing backstabber, Mekgineer Thermaplugg."}
Q[2922]={d="我猜，当我们亲爱的诺莫瑞根陷落时，我那可怜的科技机器人挨了一道游离的电火花。它曾以无数的装置和无穷的信息储备帮助我们，但它的正电子脑发生了极性反转。现在它成了负电子脑……科技机器人的行为也反了过来。它在诺莫瑞根里失控游荡！\n\n不过也许我们还能把它救回来。如果你能把科技机器人的中央记忆处理器带给我，也许我就能查明极性反转的原因，修好我可怜的科技机器人。",dEN="When our beloved city Gnomeregan fell, a rogue spark must have jolted my poor creation, Techbot. It once aided me and my associates with its countless gizmos and limitless store of information, but its positronic brain has polarized. Now it's negatronic... and Techbot's behaviors are reversed. It roams Gnomeregan in a frenzy!\n\nBut perhaps it can be salvaged. Perhaps, if you can retrieve Techbot's memory core and bring it to me, I can discover the cause of the polarization and fix my poor Techbot.",o="将尖端机器人的存储器核心交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。",oEN="Bring Techbot's Memory Core to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",p="你有没有发现尖端机器人？你有没有找回它的记忆体核心？",pEN="Did you find Techbot? Did you retrieve its memory core??",c="哦，太棒了！谢谢你，$n！我马上就开始工作！\n\n可怜的尖端机器人……别难过了，我们会修好你的。\n\n嗯，我把水压动力旋转扳手的插头搁哪儿了……",cEN="Oh, this is wonderful! Thank you, <name>! I'll get to work immediately!!\n\nPoor, poor Techbot... Don't feel bad. We'll get you fixed.\n\nNow, where did I put that plug for my hydro-jack swivel spanner..."}
Q[2923]={d="工匠大师欧沃斯帕克对他那件机械造物——科技机器人——的遭遇非常难过。据我所知，科技机器人曾是侏儒们非常有用的工具，但欧沃斯帕克说它出了故障。\n\n真遗憾。不过运气好的话，也许还能修好！\n\n去铁炉堡的工匠区找欧沃斯帕克谈谈。他会很高兴你来帮忙。",dEN="Tinkmaster Overspark is very upset with the fate of his mechanical creation, Techbot. I remember Techbot as a kind and helpful tool for the gnomes, but Overspark tells me it's malfunctioned.\n\nVery sad. But with luck perhaps he can be fixed!\n\nSpeak with Tinkmaster Overspark, in Tinker Town in Ironforge. He would welcome your help.",o="与铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",c="对，确实如此。尖端机器人失灵了！你能帮帮我吗？",cEN="Yes it's true. Techbot has gone <class>! Please, can you help me?"}
Q[2924]={d="有一种通用型的机械部件——基础模组——对于诺莫瑞根的技师和铁匠来说都非常重要，不过在我们大举逃出诺莫瑞根的时候，谁也没想起要把这些东西带上！我手头上的工作需要大量这种部件。\n\n请去诺莫瑞根给我拿一些基础模组回来，它们就装在城市深处的机械储存柜里。\n\n谢谢你，$n，请尽快出发吧！",dEN="A nigh-universal mechanical component--the essential artificial--was of great use to the tinkers and smiths of Gnomeregan. But during the frantic exodus from our city, no one remembered to take any of these devices with them! And I need a large supply of them for work I will soon undertake.\n\nPlease, go into Gnomeregan and get me some essential artificials. You'll find them in the deeper areas of our city, held in containers called artificial extrapolators.\n\nThank you, <name>, and please hurry!",o="收集12个基础模组，把它们交给铁炉堡的科劳莫特·钢尺。",oEN="Bring 12 Essential Artificials to Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge.",p="你拿到基础模组了吗？",pEN="Do you have the essential artificials?",c="你成功了！现在我可以开始新的实验了！\n\n无论采用什么方式都不足以表达我的感激之情，$N！你的勇敢和无畏让我们的侏儒研究计划有了突飞猛进的发展！",cEN="You got them! Now I can begin my new experiments!\n\nI can't thank you enough, <name>! Your bravery has advanced gnomish research by a leap and a bound!"}
Q[2925]={d="我的侏儒朋友科劳莫特·钢尺从铁炉堡给我捎了个信过来，说是要我找人去完成一项很危险但也很重要的任务：潜入诺莫瑞根。现在这座壮观的侏儒城市里到处都是疯狂的侏儒和他们的机械装置。\n\n我必须呆在这里，但无法帮助我的朋友让我感到很心痛。如果你能替我去的话，我会很感谢你的。\n\n你可以在铁炉堡的侏儒区里找到科劳莫特。",dEN="A gnome friend, Klockmort Spannerspan, sent word to me from Ironforge. He tells me he needs help on a dangerous, but essential, mission into Gnomeregan, the once great gnome city now contaminated and filled with mad gnomes and their devices.\n\nI must stay here, but my heart aches to help my friend. If you can go in my stead, then I would be much indebted to you.\n\nYou may find Klockmort in Tinkertown, in Ironforge.",o="与铁炉堡的科劳莫特·钢尺谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge.",c="对！我是要找些冒险者帮我去诺莫瑞根完成任务，你这个$c简直是再合适不过了！",cEN="I do! I do need help with a mission into Gnomeregan. And you're just the <class> to do it!"}
Q[2926]={d="自从那场事故之后，格诺恩满脑子想的、满嘴说的都是把穴居人从诺莫瑞根清除出去，并找到治愈那场瘟疫的方法，$n。\n\n幸运的是，拉兹尔和我快要弄出某种解药了——要么就是酿出了一种劲头特别大的朗姆酒。不试一试就不知道！当然，要验证我们的理论，还需要一些东西，比如诺莫瑞根受辐射穴居人身上的残留物。把这个瓶子装满绿色的发光物质带回来！",dEN="Since the accident, all Gnoarn thinks about or talks about is cleansing Gnomeregan of the trogg infestation and finding a cure for the sickness that plagues it, <name>.\n\nLuckily, Razzle and I are close to some kind of cure - either that or the recipe for a really powerful rum. We won't know until we test! Naturally, in order to test our theory, we're going to need a few things; namely, fallout from the irradiated troggs in Gnomeregan. Fill up this phial with the green glow and bring it back!",o="用空铅瓶对着辐射入侵者或者辐射抢劫者，从它们身上收集放射尘。瓶子装满之后，把它交给卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环。",oEN="Use the Empty Leaden Collection Phial on Irradiated Invaders or Irradiated Pillagers to collect radioactive fallout. Once it is full, take it back to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos.",p="你没看见我们正在这里想办法治疗地精族群所面临的瘟疫吗？！我们需要更多的辐射尘！",pEN="Can't you see we're trying to cure an entire species of gnomes here??! We need more of the green glow!",c="干得好！是试试我的新配方的时候了。如果这个配方有效的话，不仅那些麻疯侏儒能被彻底治愈，我也会长出一头浓密的头发！站远点！",cEN="Excellent work! The time has come to test the new formula. If this works, not only should that captured leper gnome be cured, but I should have a full head of hair! Stand back!"}
Q[2927]={d="你不会认为我生来就是是秃子吧？事实并不是这样的，$g先生:女士！诺莫瑞根的放射性泄露导致了我悲剧性的脱发。在那之前，我有着整个艾泽拉斯世界独一无二的侏儒式飞机头！\n\n<诺恩一边说一边挥舞着拳头>\n\n那些该死的穴居怪——他们都该死！！\n\n或许现在还不晚，$n。我们也许仍然可以挽回局势——我说的是这座城市！去跟卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环谈谈吧，他和他伙伴拉兹正在想办法。",dEN="You don't think I was always bald, do you? No <sir/ma'am>! It was the radiation leak in Gnomeregan that caused this tragic hair loss. Before that day, I had the only gnomefro in all of Azeroth.\n\n<Gnoarn shakes his fist in the air.>\n\nDamn those damned dirty troggs - damn them all!!\n\nPerhaps it's not too late, <name>. We may still be able to save it - the city I mean! Speak to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos. He and his partner Razzle are working on a solution.",o="与丹莫罗中卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ozzie Togglevolt at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",c="我本以为失去那头漂亮的头发他就彻底完了，可你看，他活下来了！\n\n辐射束击中他时我就站在他旁边。那些可爱的棕色头发一撮撮、一把把地掉在地上！更可怕的是，格诺恩彻底失控了！哦是的，我说的是失控！格诺恩不敢置信地摸着自己的光头，他眼里的神情写满了复仇！然后他把怒火转向了穴居人！\n\n<奥兹缩了缩身子。>",cEN="I thought the loss of that outstanding head of hair would have been the end of him for sure, but he survived!\n\nI was standing right next to him when he was hit by the radiation bolt. Those delightful brown locks of hair hit the floor in clumps! Clusters! The horror of it all was only compounded when Gnoarn completely freaked out! Oh yes, freaked out I say! Gnoarn touched his bald head in disbelief, the look in his eyes screamed revenge, <name>! Then he turned his anger towards the troggs!\n\n<Ozzie cringes.>"}
Q[2928]={d="太糟了，$n。我们的陀螺钻探挖掘机队开往丹莫罗的零件不够了。\n\n我们需要的是备件，$n。要给我们这些载具找备件，还有比诺莫瑞根更好的地方吗？我听说机器人和机械蜘蛛在那地方像开阔牧场上的牛一样到处乱跑。\n\n我需要你去诺莫瑞根，把那些机器人拆了。把它们的机器人内脏带回来给我。两打应该就够了。|n",dEN="It's terrible, <name>. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh.\n\nWhat we need are spare parts, <name>. What better place to get the spare parts for our vehicles than Gnomeregan? I hear that bots and mechs roam around that place like cattle on an open range.\n\nWhat I need you to do is go to Gnomeregan and tear apart those robots. Bring me back their robot guts. Two dozen should be sufficient.",o="收集24副机械内胆，把它们交给暴风城的舒尼。",oEN="Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind.",p="如果这个任务是场比赛的话，你现在已经失败了。",pEN="If this were a race, you would have lost by now.",c="干得好，$n。一台陀螺式挖掘机完成了，还剩下三百九十八台。",cEN="This will do nicely, <name>. One gyrodrillmatic excavationator fixed; 398 left to go."}
Q[2929]={d="我以前曾经非常信任麦克尼尔，我从未想过他会背叛我和所有侏儒同胞。他为什么要背叛我们？为了权力？为了金钱？这些东西只要加以时日他都可以拥有。现在我们背井离乡，那个疯子掌握了政权，成了个什么都没有的国王……\n\n我们要夺回诺莫瑞根，$n。在夺回自己的城市之前，我们决不停止努力。如果你想加入我们，就先去完成一个简单的任务：杀了那个叛徒，麦克尼尔·瑟玛普拉格。",dEN="I trusted Thermaplugg, <race>. Never did I expect that he would betray me and the entire gnomish people. And for what? Power? Wealth? All things that he would have had in time. Now we have been displaced from our home and that madman is in charge. The king of nothing....\n\nWe will retake Gnomeregan, <name>. We will not stop until the city is back in our control. If you wish to join in our fight, a simple task I ask of you: Kill the betrayer. Destroy Mekgineer Thermaplugg.",o="到诺莫瑞根去杀掉麦克尼尔·瑟玛普拉格。完成任务之后向大工匠梅卡托克报告。",oEN="Venture to Gnomeregan and kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg. Return to High Tinker Mekkatorque when the task is complete.",p="任务完成了吗？他有没有请求你的宽恕？",pEN="Is the task complete? Did he beg for lenience? For mercy??",c="我想，他倒下前所看到的最后一样东西就是你的脚吧，勇敢的$r。麦克尼尔已经死了，我们距离夺回诺莫瑞根的目标又进了一步。",cEN="I like to think that the last thing that went through his head as he collapsed to the ground was your foot, <race>. With Thermaplugg dead, our plans to retake Gnomeregan are one step closer to becoming a reality."}
Q[2930]={d="在逃离诺莫瑞根的时候，我们留下了太多的数据！非常重要的数据！\n\n我需要一张彩色穿孔卡片，你可以从诺莫瑞根城里的矩阵式打孔计算机3005-D型里找到这种卡片。不过糟糕的是，要得到它的话，你就必须先接近低级安全终端，也就是A型，B型和C型计算机，然后用不同的穿孔卡片开启它们，从白色的卡片开始……而且我们把所有的穿孔卡片都留在城里了。\n\n这真是一场灾难！你能帮忙吗？",dEN="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data!\n\nI need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan. You must access the terminal, but to do that you first need clearance... and to get that you must access lower security terminals-- models -A, -B and -C. And to do THAT you need security punch cards, starting with white... and we left all the punch cards in the city.\n\nIt's a catastrophe! Can you help?",o="将彩色穿孔卡片交给铁炉堡的大机械师卡斯派普。",oEN="Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",p="你拿到棱彩穿孔卡片了吗？",pEN="Do you have the prismatic punch card??",c="你成功了！你找到了棱彩穿孔卡片和丢失的资料！这些都是生死攸关、无比重要的资料，没有它我一刻也不能活！\n\n你对我们的贡献，我们会铭记于心的，$n。",cEN="You did it! You found the prismatic punch card and recovered the lost data! Vitally, critically, immeasurably important data that we could not live another moment without!\n\nYour service to the gnomes will be long remembered, <name>."}
Q[2931]={d="铁炉堡的大机械师卡斯派普正在征集冒险者！他正在组织一个冒险小队，要到诺莫瑞根去执行一项极度机密和重要的数据收集任务。\n\n卡斯派普也许不是炼金术、魔法和工程学协会的一员，不过他也算是个很聪明的侏儒，如果是他认为这是件很重要的事情，那么根据我的计算，这件事有百分之八十四的可能性是确实很重要的！\n\n这个可能性可不小！",dEN="Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge has need of adventurers! He's organizing bands to reenter Gnomeregan on a data retrieval mission of top security and importance.\n\nCastpipe might not be a member of the Enlightened Assembly of Arcanology, Alchemy and Engineering Sciences like I am, but he's still a smart gnome so if he thinks it's important, then by my calculations there's an eighty-four percent probability that it really is important!\n\nThose are good odds!",o="与铁炉堡的大机械师卡斯派普谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",c="我正在组织去诺莫瑞根进行资料收集的团队。如果你是为此事而来这里的，那么就请听好了！",cEN="I'm organizing data extraction missions into Gnomeregan. If you're here for that, then listen up!"}
Q[2932]={d="枯木巨魔原来是部落的盟友，但他们现在背叛了萨尔……他们要为此受到惩罚！\n\n来，拿起我的长矛，到北面的辛特兰去，那个地方就在塔伦米尔的东北方向。\n\n追捕那里的枯木巨魔，收集他们的头皮，把我的长矛插在他们的某个村庄中，比如西利瓦萨或者祖瓦沙。\n\n让他们知道，背叛部落，迟早要还的！",dEN="The Witherbark trolls were once allies to the Horde, but they betrayed Thrall... and that must be punished!\n\nHere, take my pike and go to the Hinterlands, far to the north. You will find it northeast of Tarren Mill, a village held by our allies, the Forsaken.\n\nWhen you enter the Hinterlands, hunt Witherbark trolls. Gather their skulls and drive my pike into the ground at one of their smaller villages, Hiri'watha or Zun'watha.\n\nShow them their vile actions are of consequence!",o="在辛特兰收集枯木巨魔的头皮，把它们串在尼姆布亚之矛上。将尼姆布亚的长矛插在辛特兰的某个枯木巨魔村庄中，然后回到荆棘谷的尼姆布亚那里。",oEN="Gather Witherbark Skulls and place on Nimboya's Pike. Place Nimboya's Laden Pike at one of the Witherbark Villages in the Hinterlands, then return to Nimboya in Stranglethorn.",p="你还没有完成我交给你的任务，$n。",pEN="You have not completed my task, <name>.",c="我已经听说了你的所做所为。这听起来很可怕，但这是为了荣誉。让我们希望枯木部族明白你所要表达的意思。",cEN="Word reached me of your deed. A grim deed, but one of honor. Let us hope the Witherbarks heed your message."}
Q[2933]={d="这些瓶子里装有绿色的毒液。\n\n由村庄中这种瓶子的数量来看，枯木巨魔一定很重视这些东西。或许塔伦米尔的药剂师会对这些毒液的样本感兴趣。",dEN="These bottles hold a vile, green venom.\n\nConsidering the number of bottles in this village, the Witherbarks must deem it very important. Perhaps an apothecary in nearby Tarren Mill would like a sample.",o="将毒药瓶交给塔伦米尔的某个药剂师。",oEN="Bring a Venom Bottle to an apothecary in Tarren Mill.",p="你好啊，$c。整整一天了，没有一次实验是成功的……我希望你带给我的是好消息。",pEN="Hello, gentle <class>. The day has been long and not a single experiment successful...I hope you bring good news to me.",c="啊，这是什么？好像是毒液……我认为这是来自蜘蛛之类的动物，你从哪里弄来的？",cEN="Ah, and what is this? It appears to be venom... from some arachnoid creature I deem. And where did you get it?"}
Q[2934]={d="我需要更多像你带来的那种毒液。我想采集毒液的蜘蛛住在腹地；找到一只毒囊完好的，带回来给我。在巨魔城市沙德拉阿洛附近会有很多。\n\n别耽搁，$n。毒囊必须新鲜。",dEN="I must have a fresh sample of the venom you brought me. The spiders from which it was gathered must dwell in the Hinterlands -- hunt them until you find an undamaged venom sac and bring it to me. You will find many spiders near the troll city of Shadra'Alor.\n\nDo not tarry, <name>, for the venom sac must be fresh when you deliver it.",o="将完好无损的毒囊交给塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩。",oEN="Bring an Undamaged Venom Sac to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.",p="你拿到那些完好的毒囊了吗？我渴望用新鲜毒液做实验，而且我已经订购了一批非常可爱的小动物来试毒！",pEN="Do you have the undamaged venom sac, <name>? I yearn to run experiments with its fresh venom, and have ordered a collection of small, terribly cute animals on which to test it!",c="哦，太棒了！毒液很新鲜，我敢说它具有致命的毒性。谢谢你！",cEN="Oh, splendid! The venom is quite fresh and I'm sure very deadly. Thank you!"}
Q[2935]={d="巢穴守卫的毒液没有你先前带来的毒液那么有威力，它肯定来自不同类型的蜘蛛。\n\n我要那种毒液的新鲜样本。如果要找到它的出处，那么你必须与一个很了解枯木巨魔的巨魔谈一谈——我说的是森金村的加德林大师。到杜隆塔尔去找加德林吧。如果运气好的话，他会知道枯木巨魔是在哪里找到这种毒液的。",dEN="The venom from the broodguards wasn't as potent as the venom you brought originally. It must have come from a different spider.\n\nI want a fresh sample of that venom. To find out where it came from, you must consult with a troll who knows the Witherbark well--Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village. Travel to Durotar and speak with Gadrin. With luck, he'll know where the Witherbarks get their venom.",o="与森金村的加德林大师谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village.",c="啊，你想要枯木巨魔的新鲜蜘蛛毒液，对吗？好吧，坐下……接下来我将要告诉你的东西可能会让你不太舒服……",cEN="Ah, so you want fresh venom from the spider of the witherbarks, yes? Well, sit down... you're not going to like what I have to tell you."}
Q[2936]={d="枯木巨魔崇拜蜘蛛之神，他们从她那里收集极具威力的毒液。如果你想要毒液，就必须召唤他们的蜘蛛之神！\n\n要召唤她的话，你就必须知道她真正的名字，刻有这个名字的石板被埋藏在一座墓穴中，那墓穴就在塔纳利斯沙漠中的巨魔城市祖尔法拉克，由殉教者塞卡守卫着墓穴的入口。\n\n击败塞卡，阅读那块石板，找到蜘蛛之神的名字。知道了她的名字之后就回到我这里来。",dEN="The Witherbarks worship a spider god, and from her they collect their most potent venom. So if you want the venom, then you must summon their god!\n\nTo do that, you must know her true name, and that name is on a tablet buried in Tanaris, in the troll city of Zul'Farrak, in a tomb guarded by Theka the Martyr.\n\nDefeat Theka and find and read his tablet to discover the spider god's name. When you know it, return to me.",o="阅读塞卡石板，了解枯木巨魔的蜘蛛之神的名字，然后回到加德林大师那里。",oEN="Read from the Tablet of Theka to learn the name of the Witherbark spider god, then return to Master Gadrin.",p="你知道蜘蛛之神的名字了吗？",pEN="Do you know the spider god's name?",c="啊，艾罗萨——诺——莎……小声地念诵这个名字，因为它在灵魂的世界里充满了威力。\n\n我会把它写进羊皮纸，为你创造召唤的咒语……",cEN="Ah, Elortha no Shadra... speak this name only in whispers, for its utterance carries much weight in the realms of the spirit.\n\nI will put it to parchment and create for you a spell of summoning..."}
Q[2937]={d="拿着这张羊皮纸，在辛特兰的沙德拉洛祭坛上念诵羊皮纸上的咒文。这样就可以召唤蜘蛛之神沙德拉。",dEN="Take his parchment, and read it at the altar of Shadra'Alor, deep within the witherbark realm in the Hinterlands. This will summon Shadra the spider god.",o="在沙德拉洛祭坛上击败沙德拉，把它的毒液交给塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩。",oEN="Defeat Shadra at the altar of Shadra'Alor, then bring her venom to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.",p="你拿到毒液了没有？",pEN="Did you get the venom?",c="太棒了，你成功了！",cEN="Sweet, you got it!"}
Q[2938]={d="你在枯木巨魔的蜘蛛之神身上采集的毒液真是一个重大的发现！只消一小滴，我就可以杀死足足二十只兔子。当然，有些兔子很幼小，小得足以放在手掌上，它们对毒药的抵抗力非常低，但你也不能否认这种毒药极具威力！\n\n我想要给我的上级——幽暗城炼金房的大药剂师法拉尼尔——送去一些样本，我敢说他也会对此很感兴趣的。",dEN="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff. Granted, some of those rabbits were very young and small enough to fit in the palm of one's hand so I'm certain their resistance to toxins was low, but it can't be denied that this poison is powerful!\n\nI'd like a sample sent to my superior, Apothecary Faranell in the Apothecarium of the Undercity. I am positive he would want to test this himself.",o="将法拉尼尔的包裹交给幽暗城的大药剂师法拉尼尔。",oEN="Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",p="有消息说你要来，$n。你有包裹给我？",pEN="Word was sent of your coming, <name>. You have a parcel for me?",c="啊，太好了。林度恩说包裹里的毒药是他见过的最有威力的毒药，他正在忙着将它引入实用领域。\n\n幸运的话，我们会发现它的各种用处。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你对皇家药剂师协会的贡献是不可否认的。",cEN="Ah, very good. Lydon mentioned the poison in this parcel is the most potent he has come in contact with, and is busy working on new applications with it.\n\nWith luck, we will find many.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your service to the Royal Apothecary Society is undeniable."}
Q[2939]={d="虽然遍布菲拉斯的废墟和遗迹可能很危险，但是它们讲述了许多曾经发生的事情……\n\n几天前我在南边的碎石堆里搜索的时候，发现了一个看起来像是根普通法杖的东西。但是，我总觉得事情并不是那么简单，安吉拉斯和我在这里钻研书籍已经很久了，不过我们没发现什么和它相关的信息。\n\n我在达纳苏斯有一个同事，她能告诉我这是什么东西，$n。你为什么不去跟她谈谈呢？也许她能帮助我们。",dEN="While the ruins of Feralas can be quite dangerous, they have much to tell of what has happened here.\n\nSearching through the rubble to the south a few days ago, I discovered what appears to be a normal stave. However, I just can't shake the feeling that there is something more to it. Angelas and I have been poring over our books here, but we can't find a thing about it.\n\nI have a colleague in Darnassus that may be able to tell us what this is, <name>. Why don't you go talk to her and see if she can help us?",o="与鲁瑟兰村的达蕾恩·轻风谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Daryn Lightwind in Rut'theran Village.",c="哦，是特罗亚斯·月风派你来的？\n\n<murmurando>……他总拿那些“发现了重要东西”的夸大说法来烦我……\n\n听着，$n，我就直说了。特罗亚斯总以为他在那些废墟里发现了什么重要的东西。事实是，那里真正值钱的东西，大概早就被如今盘踞在那里的食人魔或鹰身女妖搜刮走了。\n\n你可以四处看看，但我不知道你能不能找到什么对你有用的书。",cEN="Oh, so Troyas Moonbreeze sent you?\n\n...always bothering me with his wild notions that he found something important...\n\nLook, <name>, I'll be blunt. Troyas always thinks he has found something important in those ruins. The truth is, anything that was truly valuable was probably hoarded away long ago by the ogres or the harpies that now reside there.\n\nYou're welcome to take a look around, but I don't know if you'll find any books here that will help you."}
Q[2940]={d="看起来这本书很久没有人打开过了。它的封面破旧而且书页发黄，但检查后你会发现这正是特洛亚斯要找的那本书。\n\n你把它捡了起来，但你却突然意识到，也许应该在借阅之前得到物主的允许。",dEN="This book looks as if no one has opened it for quite a long time. Its covers are quite worn, and its pages yellowed, but after examining it, you notice that it might be just what Troyas is looking for.\n\nYou pick it up, but realize you should probably ask before borrowing it.",o="如果你想借达蕾恩·轻风的书，要先得到她的允许。",oEN="Ask Daryn Lightwind if you may borrow her book.",c="那你想借《菲拉斯的历史》这本书？\n\n让我想想……\n\n我允许你借这本书，$n，但你先得为我做件事。",cEN="So, you'd like to borrow Feralas: A History?\n\nLet me think...\n\nI will allow you to borrow this book, <name>, but only if you do something for me first."}
Q[2941]={d="我这一生研究过许多课题，最近迷上的是占据腹地海滩的钳嘴龟。我特别想见其中一只，一只叫加梅丽塔的巨型钳嘴龟。我本想亲自去，但研究把我困在这里。我想一张它的画就是最好的替代。\n\n把这封信带给塔纳利斯的柯格尔·曲柄跳。她为我发明了一台能捕捉图像的装置。她好像管它叫\"快照\"……",dEN="I have studied many subjects in my time, and my latest fascination is with the snapjaw that occupy the beach in the Hinterlands. There's one in particular I'd like to see, a giant snapjaw named Gammerita. I'd like to go myself, but my research keeps me here. I think a picture of her would be the next best thing.\n\nTake this letter to Curgle Cranklehop in Tanaris. She has created an invention for me that can capture a picture. She called it a \"snapshot,\" I think...",o="把信交给塔纳利斯的克格尔·曲藤。",oEN="Take the letter to Curgle Cranklehop in Tanaris.",p="给我的信？",pEN="A letter -- for me?",c="你也是达蕾恩的学生？她是一位学识渊博的历史学家，$n。你能在她门下学习，应该心存感激！\n\n给，这是超级摄影器FX。你一定会喜欢它的！",cEN="Are you another one of Daryn's interns? She's quite a knowledgeable historian, <name>. You should be grateful to be studying under her leadership.\n\nNow, let me get the Super Snapper FX. You're gonna love it!"}
Q[2942]={d="石碑中的东西被你拿出来的一瞬间，你突然感到艾奎尼克斯法杖的力量开始衰竭。",dEN="The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade.",o="将闪光的石头和艾奎尼克斯法杖交给羽月要塞的特洛亚斯·月风。",oEN="Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="我很高兴你回来了，$n。你有什么新的发现吗？",pEN="I am glad you have returned, <name>. I am eager to hear of your findings.",c="你走之后我一直在研究相关资料，$n。你发现的石头叫做晨光石。虽然我不太清楚它是用来做什么的，但可以肯定的是，这件东西意义重大，所以它才会被藏进石碑中。\n\n我会继续对它进行研究，希望将来可以再次倚靠你，$n。谢谢你的帮助。",cEN="I have been reading since you left, <name>. This stone you have found is called the Morrow Stone. While I am not entirely sure what its purpose is yet, you can be sure that it is something of great significance to be hidden away inside the Equinex Monolith the way it was.\n\nI will continue my studies, and I hope I will be able to count on you in the future, <name>. Thank you for all your help."}
Q[2943]={d="给你，$n。请小心保管我的书。\n\n现在快点出发吧，特洛亚斯正在翘首企盼你的回归呢！",dEN="Here it is, <name>. Please, take care of my book.\n\nNow, hurry along. I'm sure Troyas is eager for your return.",o="把书交给羽月要塞的特洛亚斯·月风。",oEN="Deliver the book to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="你好，$n。你去过达纳苏斯了吗？",pEN="Hello, <name>. Have you been to Darnassus?",c="你把书带来了，太好了！",cEN="You have brought a book along. Excellent!"}
Q[2944]={d="先来看看我的发明吧，$n。你所要做的只是将它对准任何一个你想要拍摄的物品，然后按下这个按钮。\n\n你说的辛特兰的生物是什么？加莫里塔？好吧，祝你好运，希望你能找到它。我坚信达蕾恩会对你给她的照片很满意的。\n\n不说那么多了，这是给你的超级摄影器。玩得开心点！",dEN="Have the first look at my new invention, <name>. All you need to do is target whatever it is you'd like to take a picture of, and push the button.\n\nWhat was that creature from the Hinterlands that you mentioned? Gammerita? Well, good luck finding her. I'm sure Daryn will be quite pleased with the snapshot you return to her.\n\nIn any case, here's the Super Snapper. Have fun!",o="用超级摄影器FX给加莫里塔拍张照片，然后把它交给鲁瑟兰村的达蕾恩·轻风。",oEN="Use the Super Snapper FX to take a snapshot of Gammerita, then return to Daryn Lightwind in Rut'theran Village.",p="嗯，你终于回来了，$n。你还带来了克格尔为我制造的装置——真是太好了。",pEN="So, you have finally returned, <name>. And you've brought the contraption that Curgle built for me -- perfect.",c="太棒了！克格尔的发明没有辜负我的期望。\n\n不要得意忘形，但我对你的工作确实很满意，$n。\n\n现在，我把书放在哪里了……",cEN="Well! Curgle's invention lived up to its expectations.\n\nDon't get too excited, but do know that I am pleased with your work, <name>.\n\nNow, where did I leave that book..."}
Q[2945]={d="你在一个黑铁矮人的尸体上发现了一枚戒指。但要辨认戒指的细节却很困难，泥土和坚硬的污垢将它整个包裹了起来，你根本没法戴上它。你觉得它是用某种珍贵的金属制成的，似乎还镶着宝石。\n\n如果你想好好看看这枚戒指的话，就得找些东西把戒指表面的污垢清理掉。",dEN="You have uncovered what appears to be a ring from the corpse of one of the Dark Iron dwarves. It is difficult to tell what kind of ring it is, however; dirt and hardened residue cake the item completely, making wearing it impossible. You think you can make out the slight luster of precious metal and maybe even the glint of a gem under the residue.\n\nIf you are going to make use of this ring, you are going to need to find something to get the hardened residue off of it.",o="想方法把脏兮兮的戒指弄干净。",oEN="Figure out a way to remove the grime from the Grime-Encrusted Ring.",p="眼前这台侏儒装置上有一块铭牌，写着\"闪亮机 5200\"。从铭牌下方的说明看，这台机器的用途是洗去物品上的污垢。它有一个投币口，说明放入物品并投入三枚银币即可。\n\n这台机器正适合用来清洗你之前找到的那枚沾满污垢的戒指！",pEN="The gnomish contraption before you bears a plaque calling it \"The Sparklematic 5200\". The gist of the machine, from reading the instructions below the plaque, is to scrub away dirt that an item might have. The machine has a coin slot, accepting three silver coins to start the process once the item is placed inside it.\n\nIt would seem as though the grime-encrusted ring you found earlier is just the thing to try in this machine!",c="你把戒指放进闪亮机 5200，又往投币口投了一枚银币。\n\n机器发出刺耳的研磨声，剧烈地来回抖动。谁也不知道里面的戒指正经历着什么……\n\n机器突然停下，只以一声清脆的\"叮！\"宣告结束。物品槽打开，露出一只系着红丝带的小盒子。看来闪亮机 5200 还附带礼品包装！",cEN="You place the ring inside the Sparklematic 5200 and deposit a silver coin into the slot.\n\nPainful grinding noises emanate from the machine as it begins to jerk around violently. One can only guess what is happening with the ring inside the machine...\n\nThe machine suddenly stops, trumpeting its cessation with a simple \"Ding!\" The item receptacle opens up to reveal a small box that is neatly wrapped with a red bow. It would appear that the Sparklematic 5200 also gift wraps!"}
Q[2946]={d="我希望你把这张圆盘拿到奥丹姆的封印之门去。我们……我们不能肯定这样做会带来什么后果。\n\n当然，这听上去确实很危险，但也有可能什么都不会发生。也许你要将圆盘放在什么东西上，也许你只要带着圆盘，大门就会自己打开。总之，不试一试是不会知道真相的。\n\n等你完成这项任务之后就回到铁炉堡来，我们还有很多事需要讨论。",dEN="We want you to take the miniature discs you found to the sealed gates of Uldum. We... we aren't sure what will happen when you do this.\n\nThis sounds risky, sure, we acknowledge that. It might, however, do nothing. You might need to use the discs on something. Perhaps the doors unlock when you have the discs in your possession. Be open to try anything, and be ready for anything to happen.\n\nWhen you've found out what happens, return to Ironforge. We'll have a lot to analyze when you're done!",o="将迷你白金圆盘拿到塔纳利斯的奥丹姆大门去，找出两者之间的联系。",oEN="Bring the miniature platinum discs to the gates of Uldum in Tanaris and look for clues as to the connection between the two.",p="这个看起来很眼熟的底座从滚烫的沙子里突了出来。这其中一定有什么原因……",pEN="This familiar looking pedestal sticks out of the hot sand. Perhaps there is something to its presence here...",c="你一触碰基座，那些迷你圆盘就开始嗡鸣并闪烁。一阵熟悉的麻痒感涌过双手，另一个石头守护者的影像在奥丹姆大门前显现。\n\n\"致敬。我是入口的守护者。用于进入的圆盘缺少正确的准入圆盘，即奥丹姆石板。请将这些石板与圆盘结构整合，并重复你的准入序列。谢谢。\"",cEN="As you touch the pedestal, the miniature discs from Uldaman hum and glow in your backpack. A familiar feeling tingle washes over your hands, as the image of another Stone Watcher springs to life in front of the gates of Uldum.\n\n\"Salutations. I am a guardian of entry. The discs that have been used for access are missing the correct entry discs, the Plates of Uldum. Please incorporate these plates with the disc structure and repeat your access sequencing. Thank you.\""}
Q[2947]={d="打开闪亮机 5200 产出的盒子，你会看到你所期待的东西——一枚闪亮的戒指！戴上它，你会感到一股魔力涌遍全身。\n\n戒指内侧刻着铁炉堡的印记，很小但清晰可辨。旁边刻着三个字母缩写：\"TdK\"。这可能是前主人的姓名缩写，也可能是打造它的工匠的。留着戒指……或者把它还给这个人。你自己决定吧……",dEN="Opening the box produced by the Sparklematic 5200 reveals what you had suspected - a shiny ring! Wearing the ring, you feel magic power surge through you body.\n\nInside the band is a small but nonetheless discernable imprint of the seal of Ironforge. Next to that, three small initials are engraved: \"TdK\". This may signify either the initials of the previous owner, or perhaps the initials of the ring's crafter. Keep the ring... or return it to this person. Decisions, decisions...",o="你要么自己留着这枚戒指，要么就按照戒指内侧刻着的名字找到它的主人。",oEN="You may either keep the ring, or you may find the person responsible for the imprint and engravings on the inside of the band.",p="嘿，朋友，放轻松点——我是个有头有脸的商人！肯定是邮差忘了把帐单给我送来……等等……你不是我的房东。\n\n好吧，你当然不是来耍我的！你是来寻找铁炉堡最好的珠宝商的吧，我可绝对不会制作被诅咒的珠宝哦！绝对不会！\n\n嗯……你需要什么？",pEN="Hey, easy there partner - I'm a very important businessman! I am sure that the courier is just simply late with the delivery of the rent... wait... you're not my landlord.\n\nWell, of course you aren't - silly me! You've come to me seeking the finest jeweler in all of Ironforge, one who does NOT make CURSED items! Yes!\n\nUm... what do you need?",c="戒指？让我看看……没错，这是我制作的。\n\n早在诺莫瑞根出事之前，我在那里有家小店，或许这是我逃跑的时候留下的……这东西的设计很简单，我做了许多类似的戒指。或许它是某个没有逃出来的可怜虫的遗物。\n\n黑铁矮人拿着这枚戒指？好吧，事情变得复杂起来了。或许铁炉堡的高层对此更感兴趣，我这号珠宝商对此是没什么兴趣的。\n\n现在，让我们回到这枚戒指的话题上……",cEN="A ring, you say? Let's see... yep, I made that ring by golly.\n\nBefore Gnomeregan went up, I had a small shop there. Perhaps it's one I left behind when I ran for the hills; it's a simple design, and I made several like it. Maybe it's from someone who didn't make it out.\n\nDark Iron dwarves had this? Well, that puts a new layer of conspiracy on the nine different layers already floating about. Maybe the authorities would like to know; it's wasted on the likes of me.\n\nNow, back to the ring..."}
Q[2948]={d="听着，$n，这戒指当然是你的……但是我可以给你做一枚更好的！就像我说的一样，那种设计实在太简单了。现在我的技术更加娴熟了，只要你付我三十个银币的费用，我就可以帮你制作一枚新戒指！好吧，事实上还要再加一点点……\n\n我现在手头很紧，我的所有存货都用完了。如果你给我一块银锭和一块绿玛瑙，我就可以让戒指看起来更加闪亮华贵！\n\n相信我！",dEN="Listen <name>, that ring is yours, sure... but I can make you a better one! That design, like I said, is really simple. I am a lot more skilled now, and for the mere fee of thirty silver coins I'll spruce it up for you! Well, a little more than thirty, actually...\n\nI'm in a tight spot right now; all my material stock is all dried up. If you bring me a bar of silver and a moss agate, I'll add a silver and agate lattice to the ring that will give it a little more pizzazz!\n\nTrust me!",o="将闪亮的金戒指、1块银锭、1块绿玛瑙和30个银币交给铁炉堡的塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔。",oEN="Bring the Brilliant Gold Ring, a Silver Bar, a Moss Agate, and 30 silver coins to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.",p="你拿到我需要的材料了吗？要不是我运气实在不好，我也不会问你要……",pEN="Do you have the materials I need? I wouldn't ask you for them if I wasn't down on my luck...",c="啊，这正是我需要的！如果有一天我能摆脱现在的尴尬处境，我会为你，为所有人，制作出全艾泽拉斯最好的饰品来！谢谢你帮我找到这些材料，要制作这样的一枚戒指，我通常都会收取五倍的价格……\n\n说到戒指，这是你的新戒指！",cEN="Ah, exactly what I needed! Someday, when I find myself out of this hole that I am unjustly in, I will make for you, for EVERYONE the finest trinkets in all of Azeroth! Until then, thanks for being a sport about the reagents. I'd normally charge ten times what I have charged you for a ring of this quality...\n\nSpeaking of rings, here's your new one!"}
Q[2949]={d="打开闪亮机 5200 产出的盒子，你会看到一枚闪亮的戒指！戴上它，你会感到一股魔力涌遍全身。\n\n戒指内侧刻着奥格瑞玛的印记，很小但清晰可辨。印记旁边还有别的东西，但即便清洗过后，也只能读出：\"NOG……\"\n\n这可能是前主人的姓名缩写，也可能是打造戒指的工匠的。留着戒指，或者去找\"NOG\"。你自己决定吧……",dEN="Opening the box produced by the Sparklematic 5200 reveals a shiny ring! Donning the ring, you feel magic power surge through your body.\n\nInside the band is a small but nonetheless discernable imprint of the seal of Orgrimmar. Engraved letters are next to it, but only the first three stand out even after cleaning: \"NOG...\"\n\nThis may signify either the initials of the previous owner, or perhaps the initials of the ring's crafter. Keep the ring... or find \"NOG\" - decisions, decisions...",o="你要么自己留着这枚戒指，要么就按照戒指内侧刻着的名字找到它的主人。",oEN="You may either keep the ring, or you may find the person responsible for the imprint and engravings on the inside of the band.",p="我们一定要找到一种方法来击败那些丑陋的小地精，我甚至敢跟你打赌，他们从我们这里偷走钻探设备只是一个开始！呸，那些肮脏的小滑头……嗯，什么？你需要什么东西吗？",pEN="You'd think that we would find a way on our own to outdo those filthy little gnomes. I would even wager that they stole that rig from us to begin with! Bah, those greasy, grimy... erm, yes? You need something?",c="从诺莫瑞根拿来的戒指？让我看看……不，这不是我的。\n\n诺莫瑞根的东西——除了那帮蠢货还有谁会搞出这种事情来？这么多年了，他们存在的唯一价值就是被我们拿来开玩笑。难道一夜之间他们的钻探设备就比我们的更好了吗？\n\n你是从黑铁矮人那里弄到这枚戒指的？真有趣！你知道，也许那些侏儒偷了黑铁矮人疯狂的魔像制造计划，并对其进行了改造，因此那些黑铁矮人就要报复他们。这值得我们好好调查一番。\n\n当然，关于那枚戒指……",cEN="A ring from Gnomeregan? Let's see... not mine, but interesting.\n\nThe Gnomeregan thing - couldn't have happened to a nicer bunch of numbskulls. For years they're a joke, and now almost overnight they're making better rigs than us?\n\nDark Iron dwarves had the ring? That's even more interesting! You know, maybe the gnomes stole their crazy golem plans and modified them. Those Dark Irons, they'd definitely want some major payback. It's certainly worth investigating.\n\nYou know, about that ring..."}
Q[2950]={d="不，不，不——我当然不是突然就说这枚戒指是我的。嗯，我通常不这样做，但你提供的关于黑铁矮人的情报很有用，所以我会破例为你改造你的戒指，我的手艺绝对比制作这个小东西的家伙要高超得多。嗯，八成是个侏儒做的……\n\n如果你给我拿来一块银锭、一块绿玛瑙和三十枚银币作为加工费的话，我就可以在戒指中加入白银和玛瑙的精华来加强其魔力。怎么样，感兴趣吗？",dEN="No, no, no - I'm not all of the sudden saying that the ring is mine. I normally don't do this, but your information about the Dark Irons was very useful. I'll improve your ring for you, better than whomever made this simple little thing could have ever done. Probably some gnome...\n\nIf you bring me a bar of silver, a moss agate, and thirty silver coins for my trouble, I'll add a silver and agate lattice to the ring that will strengthen the magic inside of it. Interested?",o="将闪亮的金戒指、1块银锭、1块绿玛瑙和30个银币交给奥格瑞玛的诺格。",oEN="Bring the Brilliant Gold Ring, a Silver Bar, a Moss Agate, and 30 silver coins to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",p="你拿到我需要的材料吗？没有那些东西，我可没办法对戒指进行改造。",pEN="Do you have the materials I need? I can't improve on this design without everything I asked for.",c="这是你的戒指，它比以前更好了。再次感谢你提供的关于黑铁矮人的情报，这也解释了那些矮子为什么突然具有了地精般的灵感。",cEN="Here's your ring, better than before. Thanks again for the information about those Dark Iron dwarves. This seems like a reasonable lead as to how those gnomes suddenly were struck with goblin-like inspiration."}
Q[2951]={d="在那些坚守房间、抵御外面疯狂的侏儒中间，这台装置格外显眼。上面有一块铭牌写着\"闪亮机 5200\"，后面还有些文字：\n\n\"污垢和残渣毁了您宝贝的光泽？闪亮机 5200 让光泽重新闪耀！放入您想清洗的物品，并往投币口投入三枚银币。稍等片刻，瞧！您的贵重物品将焕然一新、光洁闪亮！\"",dEN="This contraption stands out amongst the gnomes holding out against the madness outside the room. A small plaque on the device reads \"The Sparklematic 5200\", followed by some text:\n\n\"Grime and residue ruining your sparklies? The Sparklematic 5200 puts the shine back in shine-tastic! Insert the item you wish to clean and deposit three silver coins in the coin slot. Give the Sparklematic 5200 a moment for operation, and voila! Your valuables will emerge clean and shiny!\"",o="将脏兮兮的东西放入超级清洁器5200型，记得要用三枚银币来启动机器。",oEN="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",p="似乎这个装置需要某种脏兮兮的东西和三枚银币才能运行。既然两样都有了，超级清洁器5200型应该开始运转了……",pEN="It would seem that the device needs some sort of grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to get the contraption working. So long as both are present, the Sparklematic 5200 should work...",c="将你找到的脏兮兮的东西和三枚银币放入超级清洁器5200型里面后，机器仿佛重获生命一般，疯狂地清理着那东西表面上的污垢，并发出响亮而剧烈的搅动声。它的金属外壳吱吱作响，发出吱吱呀呀的声音……",cEN="You insert the grime-encrusted item and three silver coins into the Sparklematic 5200. The machine surges to life in a frenzied attempt to purge the grime from the unknown item. Loud, violent churning sounds beat from the heart of the machine. The metal frame of the beast creaks and groans as it lurches from side to side..."}
Q[2952]={c="机器就像启动时一样骤然停下。只听一声\"叮\"，机器的开口螺旋上升。闪亮机 5200 里面是一只系着蝴蝶结的小盒子。看来这台机器在去除污垢之后还会把物品包装起来。就算机器不灵，至少东西现在装在一个漂亮的盒子里了。\n\n好吧，要弄清它到底洗干净了没有，只有一个办法……",cEN="As quickly as it started, the Sparklematic 5200 comes to an abrupt halt. A simple \"ding\" is heard from the machine, and the mouth of the machine spirals upward. Inside the Sparklematic 5200 is a small box wrapped in a little bow. The machine would appear to wrap an object up after eliminating its grime-encrusted status. Even if the machine didn't work, at least the item is now wrapped in a pretty box.\n\nWell, there is one way to find out if it cleaned the item or not..."}
Q[2953]={p="超级清洁器5200型等待着清理脏兮兮的东西，它需要三枚银币才能启动！",pEN="The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!",c="闪亮机 5200 一阵晃动地启动了。里面的侏儒清洁剂似乎在把机器内物品表面的污垢粉碎掉。\n\n机器以一声\"叮！\"停下，开口旋开，露出一只包得整整齐齐的小盒子。",cEN="The Sparklematic 5200 comes to life, lurching to and fro. Inside, the helpless grime that has encrusted the object placed within it is being pulverized by the machine's gnomish cleaning agent.\n\nThe Sparklematic 5200 comes to a halt, heralded by a familiar \"ding!\" The item receptacle of the machine spirals open, revealing a neatly wrapped box."}
Q[2954]={d="\"致敬——我是入口的守护者。除非你已经把奥丹姆石板与你的圆盘组整合在一起，否则我不会允许你进入奥丹姆。\"\n\n诺甘农石头守望者的出现，一定就是当初带着白金圆盘派你前往塔纳利斯沙漠时所期望的反应。按指示，你必须先弄清石头守望者背后的故事，才能继续前进。",dEN="\"Salutations - I am a guardian of entry. Unless you have the Plates of Uldum already integrated with your disc set, I will not allow for entry into the Uldum compound.\"\n\nThe appearance of the Stone Watcher of Norgannon must be the reaction that was hoped for in sending you out to the Tanaris desert with the platinum discs. As instructed, you will need to find out what the story behind the Stone Watcher is before continuing on.",o="询问诺甘农的石头卫士，搞清楚它要让你干什么，然后再次点击它脚下的奥丹姆石座。",oEN="Learn the purpose of the Stone Watcher of Norgannon, and then interact with the Uldum Pedestal in the Tanaris desert.",p="在进一步发展之前，你必须知道石之看守者要让你干什么……",pEN="The purpose of the stone watcher must be learned before continuing on...",c="石头守护者的声音带着力量与威严回响：\n\n\"你访问基座后，圆盘将归还给你。等你取得奥丹姆石板并将其整合进现有的圆盘组，你就可以进入该建筑群了。\"",cEN="The stone watcher's voice resonates with power and authority:\n\n\"Your discs will be returned to you once you access the pedestal. When you have obtained the Plates of Uldum and incorporated them into your existing disc set, you may then enter the complex.\""}
Q[2962]={d="你的样本不仅数量不够，而且纯度也不够。\n\n我们需要更多的辐射尘。很显然，穴居怪身上的辐射剂量根本无法满足我们的需要。你必须重返诺莫瑞根，直接从辐射源头取回一些辐射尘。我指的是那些受到辐射的泥浆怪、潜伏者和水元素。小心一点，收集这种辐射尘并不容易。也许你得试好几次才能找到一个合适的样本。",dEN="Not only was your sample insufficient in quantity, it was also impure.\n\nWhat we require is more green glow. The troggs are obviously not irradiated sufficiently to fulfill our needs. You will have to go into Gnomeregan and bring back some radioactive fallout, straight from the tap. I am speaking of the irradiated slimes, lurkers and horrors. Be warned, the containment of this type of fallout is difficult. You may need to make several attempts with the phial until a suitable sampling is recovered.",o="前往诺莫瑞根，取回高能辐射残留物。但要当心，这种残留物不稳定，很快就会衰变。\n\n奥兹还要求你在任务完成后交回那只重型铅制收集瓶。|n",oEN="Travel to Gnomeregan and bring back High Potency Radioactive Fallout. Be warned, the fallout is unstable and will collapse rather quickly.\n\nOzzie will also require your Heavy Leaden Collection Phial when the task is complete.",p="嗯，你没有发光，这是个好兆头。",pEN="Hrm, you're not glowing. That's a good sign.",c="<奥齐仔细打量着你。>真棒，你还能完整无缺地回来！现在让我们来看看这个东西到底能做些什么！",cEN="<Ozzie examines you.> Impressive, you still have all of your limbs. Now it's time to see what this stuff can do!"}
Q[2963]={d="你好，很高兴再一次见到你，$n！你在奥达曼的发现使探险者协会兴奋不已。协会一直都在努力揭开你所发现的那张白金圆盘的秘密。你来的正是时候，我可以和你分享一下我们的最新进展！\n\n史学家卡尼克发现了一些很重要的线索，可能有助于找到塔纳利斯沙漠中的守卫之谷的起源。他想和你谈谈，越快越好！",dEN="Greetings once again, <name>! Your discovery inside Uldaman has set the Explorers' League abuzz with excitement. The League has been working to unlock the secrets of the miniature platinum discs you found. Your fortuitous arrival here in the Hall allows me to share with you that we are quite possibly on to something!\n\nHistorian Karnik has uncovered some important clues as to the true origins of the Valley of the Watchers in the Tanaris desert. He would like to speak with you as soon as possible!",o="与铁炉堡探险者大厅中的史学家卡尼克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Historian Karnik in the Hall of Explorers within Ironforge.",c="我很高兴你对探索的兴趣$g依然不减:依然不减;，$n！凭你天生的才华和干劲，我们能揭开那些我们从未想过可能的秘密！\n\n奥达曼的诺甘农圆盘是一个庞大信息的储存库；你只被允许访问所存信息的表层，可以这么说。据传造物主在艾泽拉斯各处还有更多储存库。这就把我们带到了奥丹姆……",cEN="I am glad you're maintaining your interest in exploration, <name>! With your natural talent and moxie, we could crack open secrets that we never thought were possible!\n\nThe Discs of Norgannon in Uldaman were a repository of vast information; you were only permitted to access the top layers, as it were, of the information stored there. The Creators were rumored to have more repositories located throughout Azeroth. This now brings us to Uldum..."}
Q[2964]={d="好吧，$n…我们现在好象走进了一个死胡同。我们知道我们需要的是什么——奥丹姆圆盘——但我们不知道这些东西在哪里。我们得进行大量的研究才能制定出确实可行的计划。关于到哪里去寻找圆盘……我有一些想法，我坚信我们马上就会要求你尽快出发去找到它。\n\n这件事要通知资深探险家，$n，毫无疑问，他也会再次感谢你对探险者协会的帮助。",dEN="Well <name>... we seem to be at a temporary dead end here. We know what we need - the Plates of Uldum - but we have no idea where they might be. We'll need to do quite a bit of research on this to come up with a solid plan of attack. I have a couple ideas where to start looking; I have high hopes that soon, we'll be asking you to head out and recover them.\n\nThe High Explorer needs to be informed on this, <name>; no doubt, he also wants to thank you personally for once again aiding the League.",o="与铁炉堡的资深探险家麦格拉斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Explorer Magellas in Ironforge.",c="我们的意见是一致的——我们要把圆盘可能存在的范围缩小，然后再采取行动。是你让我们有了今天的成就，$n……我希望你能再次出手，替我们解开奥丹姆之谜！\n\n请拿着这个作为酬劳，请务必尽快回来和我们联系……奥丹姆在等待着我们！",cEN="We're all in agreement then - the best plan of attack is putting this on hold until we can narrow down the areas where these plates might lie hidden. You've brought us this far <name>, and I hope you will be the one to head back in to the field to unlock Uldum for us all!\n\nAllow me to give you this honorarium in the meantime; this should cover any expenses you've encountered in assisting us, and a little something extra. Be sure to check back with us soon... Uldum beckons!"}
Q[2965]={d="啊，$n，你来得正好。你在奥达曼挖掘场的发现让我们的贤者进行了激烈的讨论。我和纳拉·蛮鬃也交换了看法，因为当初我和她一起经历过一段冒险旅程，这段经历对于我们将要采取的下一步行动非常重要。\n\n我想让你和她去谈一谈，听听她当年在塔纳利斯的守卫之谷中遇到的事情。她在长者高地等你。",dEN="Ah, <name>, it is fortuitous that you have come to me again. Your revelations at the Uldaman dig site have certainly given us sages much discuss. I was doing just that with one of the druids, Nara Wildmane, when it dawned on me that her past adventuring experiences may have some great importance as to the next step we need to take.\n\nI would like for you to speak with her concerning her travels to the Valley of the Watchers in the Tanaris desert. She waits for you on the Elder Rise.",o="与雷霆崖长者高地的纳拉·蛮鬃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nara Wildmane on the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff.",c="在塔纳利斯沙漠中有一个守卫之谷。你找回的圆盘……其中雕文的翻译提到了一个叫奥丹姆的地方，许多人都认为这个地方只有在神话中才存在过。\n\n我知道这是不对的，奥丹姆的确存在，因为我去过那里。好吧……我只是到了它的外面。\n\n$n，我认为关键在于:圆盘和奥丹姆之间具有某种联系，我们希望你能去那里进行调查。",cEN="There is a place deep in the Tanaris desert called the Valley of the Watchers. The discs that you recovered... their translated glyphs make mention of a place called Uldum. Most think this place to be a myth.\n\nI know this to be false; Uldum exists. I've been there. Well... outside, at any rate.\n\nThe crux is this, <name>: we think there is a connection between the discs and Uldum, and we want you to go there."}
Q[2966]={d="圣者图希克和我希望你把这张圆盘拿到奥丹姆的封印之门去。我们……我们不能肯定这样做会带来什么后果。\n\n当然，这听上去确实很危险，但也有可能什么都不会发生。也许你要将圆盘放在什么东西上，也许你只要带着圆盘，大门就会自己打开。总之，不试一试是不会知道真相的。\n\n等你完成这项任务之后就回到我这里来，我们还有很多事需要讨论。",dEN="Sage Truthseeker and I would like you to take the miniature discs you found to the sealed gates of Uldum. We... we aren't sure what will happen when you do this.\n\nThis sounds risky, sure, we acknowledge that. It might, however, do nothing. You might need to use the discs on something. Perhaps the doors unlock when you have the discs in your possession. Be open to try anything, and be ready for anything to happen.\n\nLearn what you can, then return to me. We will have much to discuss.",o="将迷你白金圆盘拿到塔纳利斯的奥丹姆大门去，找出两者之间的联系。",oEN="Bring the miniature platinum discs to the gates of Uldum in Tanaris and look for clues as to the connection between the two.",p="这个看起来很眼熟的底座从滚烫的沙子里突了出来。这其中一定有什么原因……",pEN="This familiar looking pedestal sticks out of the hot sand. Perhaps there is something to its presence here...",c="你一触碰基座，奥达曼的迷你圆盘就在你的背包里嗡鸣闪烁。一阵熟悉的麻痒感涌过双手，另一个石头守护者的影像在奥丹姆大门前显现。\n\n\"致敬。我是入口的守护者。用于进入的圆盘缺少正确的准入圆盘：奥丹姆石板。请将这些石板与圆盘结构整合，并重复你的准入序列。谢谢。\"",cEN="As you touch the pedestal, the miniature discs from Uldaman hum and glow in your backpack. A familiar feeling tingle washes over your hands, as the image of another Stone Watcher springs to life in front of the gates of Uldum.\n\n\"Salutations. I am a guardian of entry. The discs that have been used for access are missing the correct entry discs, the Plates of Uldum. Please incorporate these plates with the disc structure and repeat your access sequencing. Thank you.\""}
Q[2967]={d="你打开了底座，白金圆盘又一次突然出现在你的背包里。\n\n你从石头守卫那里获取了许多信息，而且白金原盘又回到了你的手中，现在你应该回雷霆崖向纳拉·蛮鬃汇报这个大发现了。",dEN="You access the pedestal again; the platinum discs suddenly appear once more in your backpack.\n\nWith the knowledge of the stone watcher learned and the discs returned to your possession, the time has come to return to Thunder Bluff and inform the Nara Wildmane of your discovery.",o="与雷霆崖的纳拉·蛮鬃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。你是成功利用了那些圆盘，还是一无所获？",pEN="Welcome back <name>. Were you able to use the discs to your advantage, or was it for naught?",c="还缺一些圆盘？这真是太有趣了，似乎诺甘农圆盘只是整套圆盘中的一部分——就好像一串钥匙中的几只。\n\n如果我们能发现奥丹姆圆盘，那我们就可以进入奥丹姆地下城了。想想看吧，在创世之神工作过的地方探险，而且还不用带个大铲子挖来挖去！\n\n嗯，我不是说铲子有什么问题……也不是说挖来挖去有什么问题……",cEN="You were missing some discs? Interestingly enough, it seems that the discs of Norgannon are only parts of the complete set - like keys on a key ring, if you will.\n\nIf we can find the Plates of Uldum, then we could actually access the Uldum complex itself. I don't know whether to be excited by that prospect, or be terrified.\n\nWe may need to risk everything to ensure that those secrets the earth keeps which would destroy us all remain just that - secrets."}
Q[2968]={d="好吧，$n…我们现在好象走进了一个死胡同。我们知道我们需要的是什么——奥丹姆圆盘——但我们不知道这些东西在哪里。我们得进行大量的研究才能制定出确实可行的计划。关于到哪里去寻找圆盘……我有一些想法，我坚信我们马上就会要求你尽快出发去找到它。\n\n这件事必须要通知圣者图希克，$n，毫无疑问，他也会再次感谢你对我们的帮助。",dEN="Well <name>... we seem to be at an unfortunate impasse. We know what we need - the Plates of Uldum - but we have no idea where they might be. We will research this, and then devise a solid plan of attack. I have a couple ideas where to start looking; I have high hopes that soon, we'll be asking you to rejoin our efforts to discover the truth.\n\nSage Truthseeker needs to be informed on this, <name>; no doubt, he also wants to thank you personally for once again heeding the call.",o="与雷霆崖的圣者图希克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff.",c="我们的意见是一致的——我们要把圆盘可能存在的范围缩小，然后再采取行动。是你让我们有了今天的成就，$n……我希望你能再次出手，替我们解开奥丹姆之谜！\n\n请拿着这个作为酬劳，请务必尽快回来和我们联系……奥丹姆在等待着我们，年轻的$r。",cEN="We're all in agreement then - the best course of action is to wait until we can narrow down the areas where these plates might lie hidden. You've brought us this far <name>, and I hope you will be the one to head back in to the field to confront the secrets of Uldum.\n\nAllow me to give you this honorarium in the meantime; this should cover any expenses you've encountered in assisting us, and a little something extra. Be sure to check back with us soon... Uldum beckons us all, young one."}
Q[2969]={d="那些肮脏的恐怖图腾氏族正在抓捕精灵龙，$n。杰尔凯和我不知道他们打算拿它们做什么，但显然不怀好意。\n\n我们也没强到能一路打进营地、把被抓的龙救出来，不过也许有你的帮助……\n\n如果你愿意，而且有几个能打的朋友，就用这把钥匙把那些生物从笼子里放出来，确保它们活着逃走。我会一直陪在你身边。杰尔凯留在这里。",dEN="The filthy Grimtotem clan are capturing faerie dragons, <name>. Jer'kai and I have no idea what they plan on doing with them, but they're obviously up to no good.\n\nWe're not powerful enough to fight our way into the camp and free the captured dragons, but perhaps with your help...\n\nIf you're willing, and you have some strong friends, release the creatures from their cage with this key and make sure they escape with their lives. I'll be by your side the entire time. Jer'kai will remain here.",o="从恐怖图腾营地的围栏里释放被俘获的小精龙。至少6个小精龙和辛达尔·月纹必须活着。\n\n如果6分钟之内你还没能达成这个目标，辛达尔就会决定撤退，任务也会随即失败。",oEN="Using the Bamboo Cage Key, free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the Grimtotem camp. At least 6 Sprite Darters and Kindal Moonweaver must survive.\n\nYou have 6 minutes before Kindal decides it is time to retreat and you fail the quest.",c="感谢艾露恩，$n！你真是我们和精龙的福星。仅凭耶尔卡和我是绝不可能救出它们的——我们将永远记得你在恐怖图腾中的帮助。\n\n现在去和耶尔卡谈谈吧……我要开始准备我们的报复行动。精龙是被释放了，但这并不意味它们会一直保持自由。耶尔卡和我要以进攻夺取主动！",cEN="Thank Elune, <name>! You are a great blessing to us and to the darters you saved. Jer'kai and I would never have been able to help the dragons ourselves--your intervention in the Grimtotem's affairs will be remembered.\n\nSpeak to Jer'kai now... I have to prepare for our retribution. Just because the faerie dragons are free, it doesn't mean they will remain so. Jer'kai and I will now go on the offensive."}
Q[2970]={d="辛达尔已经跟你说过了，我们准备去和恐怖图腾部族作战。干掉几个牛头人对我们两个来说不是什么问题，但如果你愿意帮忙的话，我们还是很欢迎的。\n\n看到下面那个营地了吗？东边有更多这样的营地。运用你的战术，尽可能让那些牛头人多吃些苦头。当他们被你和辛达尔打得落花流水之后，我们再回到这里来碰头。",dEN="As she's already told you, Kindal and I will now take the fight to the Grimtotem. Together, we should still be able to pick off some of the tauren without much threat to ourselves, but we'd love some help if you're willing and able.\n\nYou've seen the camp below us, but there are more to the east. Using your own tactics, deal as much damage to the tauren as you can. We can all meet back here after they've felt the sting of Kindal's arrows and your own weapons.",o="杀掉12个恐怖图腾博学者、10个恐怖图腾袭击者和6个恐怖图腾萨满祭司，然后向菲拉斯的耶尔卡·月纹汇报。",oEN="Kill 12 Grimtotem Naturalists, 10 Grimtotem Raiders, and 6 Grimtotem Shamans before returning to Jer'kai Moonweaver in Feralas.",p="金达尔需要时间准备，但我们的人已经死了几十个了。恐怖图腾氏族非常清楚我们在这一带的活动，像毒蛇一样四处搜寻我们。\n\n他们会不惜一切代价把我们的脑袋从脖子上取下来。你该保持警惕……既然你插了手，他们现在也会来找你。",pEN="Kindal needs time to prepare, but our kills already number in the dozens. The Grimtotem clan is more than aware of our presence in the area, and they seek us out like vipers.\n\nThey'll do everything in their power to take our heads from our bodies. You should be alert... they'll be coming for you too now that you've interfered.",c="辛达尔说得对，$n——你确实很出色。作为一个冒险者，你比我们更有经验，谢谢你。\n\n恐怖图腾氏族比大多数牛头人更具有攻击性……我怀疑其它牛头人也会对这些家伙感到厌恶。你可能已经注意到了，艾泽拉斯的许多种族都有那么一部分害群之马。\n\n但这个问题我们还是以后再讨论吧。",cEN="Kindal was right about you, <name>--you do have a knack for this. You are a more seasoned adventurer than the both of us, and for that we thank you.\n\nThe Grimtotem clan is much more hostile than most tauren... I wonder if their own kind frowns upon their actions. I wouldn't be surprised. As you are probably aware, many races on Azeroth have ties to less kindly counterparts.\n\nBut that is a discussion for another day."}
Q[2972]={d="在这片蛮荒的土地上，辛达尔和我有无数的方法来报答你，但我们想让你有更多的成就感。把我的戒指拿去吧，如果你哪一天到了泰达希尔，就去一趟达纳苏斯城里的月神殿。你可以在那里找到高阶祭司泰兰德·语风。她看到这枚戒指就会知道我们在这里一切安好，并相信你所说的一切。\n\n$n，我们都很感谢你。",dEN="Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring. If you ever find yourself in the boughs of Teldrassil, go to the Temple of the Moon in the heart of Darnassus. There you will find my High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind. The ring will let her know that we are well and give credit to your story.\n\nWe both thank you, <name>.",o="将耶尔卡的徽记之戒交给达纳苏斯的高阶女祭司泰兰德·语风。",oEN="Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",p="欢迎:欢迎你，$g孩子:孩子;。圣殿里能有更强大的冒险者，我们很欣慰。如果你有时间，愿意跟年轻的冒险者们分享一两个故事吗？我知道他们中许多人会从你的智慧中受益。\n\n抱歉，瞧我多失礼。你是来圣殿寻求帮助的，我却在麻烦你。请原谅我。告诉我，圣光的仆人们能为你做什么。",pEN="Hello, child. It pleases us to have more powerful adventurers here in the temple. If you have the time, will you share a tale or two with the younger adventurers? I know many of them would benefit from your wisdom.\n\nI'm sorry, look how rude of me. You've come to the Temple seeking our aid, and I impose on you. Please, forgive me. Tell me what the servants of the Light can do for you.",c="这个故事令我感到非常惊讶，$n。你帮助了龙族和我们的女祭司，谢谢你。耶尔卡派你来找我是个正确的决定，我会派人把戒指送回她手中的——我的斥候将立刻向菲拉斯进发，详细调查这件事情。\n\n再次感谢你，请别拘束，把这里当成自己的家吧。",cEN="That's an amazing story, <name>. It pleases us that you've not only helped dragonkind, but also one of our own priestess. Jer'kai was right to send you to me. I will make sure she has her ring returned to her--I have scouts heading the direction of Feralas soon. This will be one more thing for them to investigate while on their mission.\n\nThank you again, and please, make yourself at home while you're here."}
Q[2973]={d="你好，$c。我和我的伙伴们正准备去菲拉斯执行任务。\n\n我的妻子科琳很喜欢新衣服，所以我想为她做一件用小精龙的翅膀装饰的新披风。你能帮帮我吗？长着美丽翅膀的小精龙在莫沙彻营地的西边。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've traveled with my companions down to the Feralas on a mission for our Orgrimmar masters.\n\nMy life-mate Korrin finds great pleasure in new clothing, so I aim to make her a new cloak adorned with the gossamer wings of faerie dragons. Would you be able to help me? Sprite darters with gorgeous wings I want are west of Camp Mojache.",o="给莫沙彻营地的克鲁伊格·碎颅带去10个闪光的小精灵翅膀。",oEN="Bring 10 Iridescent Sprite Darter Wings to Krueg Skullsplitter in Camp Mojache.",p="被激怒的小精龙是非常危险的，和它们打交道要多加小心，$c。这个地区的暗夜精灵比它们还危险，那些烦人的蠢货也会在森林里出没。\n\n当你拿到足够多的翅膀之后就告诉我，我一定会好好奖励你的！",pEN="The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, <class>. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.\n\nWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!",c="太好了，$c！这些再合适不过了，足够让科琳做一件披风，也许还要更多！谢谢你。\n\n你没碰到什么危险吧？菲拉斯地区可不是个安全的地方，不过你显然应付得过来。\n\n再次感谢你，$c。",cEN="Wonderful, <class>! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.\n\nI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.\n\nThank you again, <class>."}
Q[2974]={d="什么？！你在这一地区碰到牛头人了？你开玩笑吧！他们长什么样？！\n\n恐怖图腾氏族！你看到他们了？贝尔戈洛姆对他们这种生物很有兴趣……甚至出重金悬赏他们。\n\n你必须得回去，$c。回去给我带些他们的角回来……如果可以的话，尽可能多弄一些。你可别低估了恐怖图腾氏族，回去杀了他们，让菲拉斯的河流被他们的鲜血染红。",dEN="What!? You came across tauren in the area? You're joking! What did they look like!?\n\nThe Grimtotem clan! You found some of them? Belgrom, one of our masters, has an interest in their kind... he's even put a bounty on them.\n\nYou have to go back, <class>. Go back and bring me their horns... piles of them if you can. The Grimtotem are not to be trifled with or underestimated. Go back and slay them; let the rivers in Feralas run red with their dark blood.",o="收集20支恐怖图腾之角，把它们交给千针石林的克鲁伊格·碎颅。",oEN="Bring 20 Grimtotem Horns to Krueg Skullsplitter in Camp Mojache.",p="认真听我说，$c，恐怖图腾氏族都是恶魔。如果你在附近看到他们，那你就应该尽快决定是否要迎头痛击他们……否则他们就会闯入我们的领地，夷平我们的村庄，玷污我们的土地。",pEN="Take my words seriously, <class>, the Grimtotem clan is evil. If you've found their whereabouts, then it's up to you to return and strike the first blow against their clan... before they can come into our own lands and raze our own villages, or pilfer our lands.",c="这些都是品质很好的角，$c。干得不错。当我们回到奥格瑞玛时，我会把这件事情告诉贝尔戈洛姆的。你已经帮了我两次，为此，我会永远记住你的。也许在将来的某一天我也可以帮你的忙！祝你好运。",cEN="These are good horns, <class>. Well done. I'll take these from you and be sure to tell Belgrom as soon as we return to Orgrimmar. You've helped me twice now, and for that, you have my mark. Perhaps in the future I can help you! Good luck to you."}
Q[2975]={d="戈杜尼食人魔在这一地区的影响已经不容忽视了。$n，你可以清楚地看到这一点，他们的存在污染了这片土地。在他们进一步扩张之前，我们一定要把他们赶回去。\n\n沿着河向北走，你会找到他们的前哨营地。去杀掉他们，$n。我们必须告诉这些食人魔：他们在这里不受欢迎。",dEN="The effects of the Gordunni Ogre tribe can hardly go unnoticed in this area. Look around, <name>; their very presence scars this land. We must push them back before they expand even further into Feralas.\n\nFollow the river north, and you will find their outpost. Decrease their numbers, <name>. We must show them that their kind is not wanted here.",o="莫沙彻营地的洛卡·奥赫要你杀掉10个戈杜尼食人魔、10个戈杜尼食人魔法师和5个戈杜尼蛮兵。",oEN="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to kill 10 Gordunni Ogres, 10 Gordunni Ogre-Magi, and 5 Gordunni Brutes.",p="行动迅速点，$n。难道是这个任务对你来说太难了？",pEN="Move swiftly, <name>. Or is the task I requested too difficult?",c="太好了，$n。总有一天，这块土地会被治愈。我们不能放弃希望。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. In time, the land will heal. We must not give up."}
Q[2976]={d="什么？！\n\n啊，我确实提到过奖赏，对吗？好吧，我知道了\n\n你完成了任务，我觉得你应该得到最高的奖赏。把这些角拿去，我会帮你把它们放到箱子里。到荣誉谷去找贝尔戈洛姆·石槌，向他汇报你所见的一切，他会表彰你的。\n\n祝你一路平安，$c，再次感谢你。",dEN="What?!\n\nAh, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it?\n\nYou did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it. Take the horns, I'll have them put in a crate for you. Find Belgrom Rockmaul in the Valley of Honor, he'll want to know what you saw and he'll reward you for your hard work.\n\nBe well, <class>, and thank you again for everything you've done.",o="将一箱恐怖图腾之角交给奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆·石槌。",oEN="Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",p="快一点，$c，我今天有很多事要做。",pEN="Be quick, <class>, I have much to complete today.",c="恐怖图腾氏族？！真有趣。你说你是在菲拉斯打猎时发现他们的？真的吗？\n\n我的族人很想听你的故事，$c。告诉我更多细节，我会给你相应的报酬的。\n\n另外，在你走之前，我希望让你知道，我很感谢你今天给我带来的情报。",cEN="The Grimtotem!? This is interesting. You say you came across them while hunting in Feralas? Truly?\n\nMy peers will want to hear your news, <class>. Tell me more and I'll count out your coin while you do so.\n\nAnd before you go, know that I give you thanks for the information you've passed on to me this day."}
Q[2977]={d="你打开了底座，白金圆盘又一次突然出现在你的背包里。\n\n你从石头守卫那里获取了许多信息，而且白金原盘又回到了你的手中，现在你应该回铁炉堡向探险者协会汇报这个大发现了。",dEN="You access the pedestal again; the platinum discs suddenly appear once more in your backpack.\n\nWith the knowledge of the stone watcher learned and the discs returned to your possession, the time has come to return to Ironforge and inform the Explorers' League of your discovery.",o="与铁炉堡的史学家卡尼克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Historian Karnik in Ironforge.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。你是成功利用了那些圆盘，还是白忙一场？",pEN="Welcome back <name>. Were you able to use the discs to your advantage, or did it end up being a wild goose chase?",c="还缺一些圆盘？这真是太有趣了，似乎诺甘农圆盘只是整套圆盘中的一部分——就好像一串钥匙中的几只。\n\n如果我们能发现奥丹姆圆盘，那我们就可以进入奥丹姆地下城了。想想看吧，在创世之神工作过的地方探险，而且还不用带个大铲子挖来挖去！\n\n嗯，我不是说铲子有什么问题……也不是说挖来挖去有什么问题……",cEN="You were missing some discs? Interestingly enough, it seems that the discs of Norgannon are only parts of the complete set - like keys on a key ring, if you will.\n\nIf we can find the Plates of Uldum, then we could actually access the Uldum complex itself! Imagine actually exploring the place where the Creators worked without having to bring a huge shovel!\n\nNot that there's anything wrong with shovels... or digging..."}
Q[2978]={d="你捡起了这个沾满泥土的卷轴，发现上面写着某种集会或仪式的内容。洛卡·奥赫应该会对这个卷轴以及它对戈杜尼食人魔的意义感兴趣。",dEN="Picking up the soiled scroll, you notice that it seems to be depicting some sort of meeting or ceremony. Rok Orhan would be interested in this scroll, and what it might mean to the Gordunni.",o="将戈杜尼卷轴交给莫沙彻营地的洛克·奥汉。",oEN="Bring the Gordunni Scroll to Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What is this?",c="这个卷轴……你是在戈杜尼前哨站发现的？",cEN="This scroll... You found this in the Gordunni Outpost?"}
Q[2979]={d="这些好像是某种黑暗仪式的计划，$n。根据我所了解的情况，这种仪式是由戈杜尼食人魔中的大法师进行的。\n\n从某个戈杜尼大法师身上给我弄一颗宝珠来。\n\n法师的宝珠蕴含了巨大的力量，它可以帮我们搞清楚更多关于这种仪式的细节。",dEN="These seem to be plans for some sort of dark ceremony, <name>. From what I can make out, this ritual is conducted by the Gordunni mage-lords.\n\nFind one of these mage-lords, and from him, gather an orb.\n\nThe orb of a mage contains great power, and will help us discover more about this ceremony and the magic that the Gordunni wield.",o="莫沙彻营地的洛卡·奥赫希望你找到一颗戈杜尼之宝珠。",oEN="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to find a Gordunni Orb.",p="我们必须找到更多资讯，才能知道戈杜尼巨魔出现在这里的原因，$n。",pEN="We must discover more about why the Gordunni are here, <name>.",c="这颗宝珠可以为我们提供更多关于戈杜尼巨魔的资讯……我们会利用这些情报来击败他们，$n。",cEN="This orb will provide us with more information about the Gordunni... which we will then use in planning their downfall, <name>."}
Q[2980]={d="既然你已经证明自己是:是一名$g真正的战士:真正的战士;，我相信你有勇气继续手上的任务。\n\n前往此地向西南的蛮荒高地。那里有一些废弃残破的建筑，坐落于曾属于暗夜精灵的土地上。找到那些废墟，当你看到枯萎的树木和被亵渎的土地时，你就会找到戈杜尼。把他们击退。\n\n那些食人魔比你之前面对的强得多，$n，小心。",dEN="Now that you have proven that you are a true fighter, I trust that you possess the courage to continue with the task at hand.\n\nTravel to the High Wilderness, southwest of here. There lie some abandoned and destroyed structures, on land that once belonged to the night elves. Look for these ruins, and when you see the withered trees and desecrated terrain, you will find the Gordunni. Push them back.\n\nThese ogres are much stronger than the ones you faced previously, <name>. Be aware.",o="莫沙彻营地的洛卡·奥赫要你去杀掉十个戈杜尼萨满祭司、10个戈杜尼术士和5个戈杜尼虐待者。",oEN="Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache wants you to kill 10 Gordunni Shaman, 10 Gordunni Warlocks, and 5 Gordunni Maulers.",p="你找到那片废墟了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you found the ruins, <name>?",c="你已经证明自己的确是个可以信赖的朋友，$n。",cEN="You have proven yourself to be a trustworthy and dependable ally, <name>."}
Q[2981]={d="菲拉斯是一个有成就的$c证明自己能力的理想场所。有个名叫戈杜尼的食人魔部落是那里最主要的军事力量，而且他们的势力仍在不断增长。在这些食人魔威胁到我们在菲拉斯的地位以前，我们必须要阻止他们。\n\n我认识一个名叫洛卡·奥赫的战士，她住在菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地里，去找她谈谈吧，她会让你知道更多情况的。",dEN="Feralas is an ideal location for an accomplished <class> to prove <himself/herself>. A tribe of ogres called the Gordunni are the dominant military force there, and their numbers are growing. They must be stopped before they threaten our presence in Feralas.\n\nA warrior I know of named Rok Orhan resides at Camp Mojache in Feralas; go to her. She will tell you more of the situation when you arrive.",o="贝尔戈洛姆·石槌想让你去和莫沙彻营地的洛卡·奥赫谈一谈。",oEN="Belgrom Rockmaul wants you to speak with Rok Orhan in Camp Mojache.",c="所以是贝尔格罗姆派你来的。那你来得正是时候，$r。\n\n让我来说明情况，然后你再决定自己是否担得起这个挑战……不过既然是贝尔格罗姆派你来的，你的勇气想必毋庸置疑。",cEN="So, Belgrom sent you. You are just in time, <race>.\n\nLet me explain the situation, and then you can decide if you are up to the challenge... But if Belgrom sent you, I am sure your courage is unquestionable."}
Q[2982]={d="虽然菲拉斯森林的废墟中隐藏着巨大的危险，但特洛亚斯和我一直以来都在调查这个地区。\n\n最近特洛亚斯老是独自一人去高原荒野，这很让我担心。戈杜尼食人魔已经占领了那里，他们不会对任何进入他们领地的冒险者手下留情的。\n\n我希望你能到菲拉斯南部去一趟，消灭一些食人魔。让我的特洛亚斯安全一点，我会十分感激你的。",dEN="Although it is dangerous, Troyas and I have been investigating the ruins that cover the forests of Feralas.\n\nLately, though, Troyas has been going on his own to the High Wilderness, and I really worry about him. The Gordunni Ogres have taken over that area, and they don't take kindly to anyone that enters their territory.\n\nI was hoping you might be willing to travel to the ruins to the southeast and clear out some of the ogres. Make it a little safer for my Troyas, and I will be extremely grateful.",o="安吉拉斯·月风要求你杀死8个戈杜尼术士、8个戈杜尼萨满祭司和8个戈杜尼蛮兵。",oEN="Angelas Moonbreeze wants you to kill 8 Gordunni Warlocks, 8 Gordunni Shaman, and 8 Gordunni Brutes.",p="$n，你要小心那些戈杜尼巨魔。他们的魔法似乎已经在他们所占领的土地上造成了一场大灾难。",pEN="Be watchful around the Gordunni, <name>. Their magic seems to wreak havoc on the very land they stand on.",c="我很感激你为我所做的事。\n\n不过，请不要和特洛亚斯谈起此事……",cEN="I am very grateful you were able to do this for me.\n\nNow, please, don't mention a word to Troyas about this..."}
Q[2983]={d="距离你上次受考验已经有一阵子了，$n。到目前为止你在学业中表现得很有耐心，但时候到了，你该获得更强大的力量……时候到了，你该学习真正的力量。火元素将属于你，如果你$g愿意:愿意;付出代价。\n\n去贫瘠之地找克拉纳尔·菲斯。他住在十字路口以北的一座小屋里。但要当心：如果你走到了暗夜精灵那片被毁的土地，那就是走得太远了。",dEN="It's been some time since you were tested last, <name>. You've been patient thus far in your studies, but it's time for you to learn about greater powers... it's time you learn real power. The element of fire is yours if you're prepared to pay for it.\n\nSeek out Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. He lives in a small dwelling north of the Crossroads, but be mindful, if you've reached the blasted night elf lands, you've gone way too far.",o="去贫瘠之地找到卡纳尔·菲斯。",oEN="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.",c="所以……是斯瓦特派你来的，嗯？\n\n好吧。我一向信任斯瓦特。既然他把你派到我这儿，那就是说你已$g准备好:准备好;参加下一次萨帕了……火焰萨帕。\n\n我已经能在你眼中看到那火花，那焦躁的火焰。你尝过力量的滋味，现在你准备好要更多了。耐心点，$n。记住大地教给你的。力量和毁灭来得容易，但你始终要知道何时收手。",cEN="Hmmm, Swart sent you to me, did he?\n\nWell then, Swart could always be trusted, so that must mean you're ready to take part of the next sapta--the sapta of fire.\n\nI see it in your eyes already, the burning, the desire. You've tasted power, and now you're ready for more of it. Patience, <name>. Remember what earth taught you. Power and destruction will come easily, but you must still know when to stay your hand."}
Q[2984]={d="距离你上次受考验已经很久了，$n。到目前为止你在学业中表现出了耐心，但时候到了，你该学更多东西了。时候到了，你该了解毁灭……与混乱。火元素属于你，如果你$g愿意:愿意;付出代价。\n\n去贫瘠之地找克拉纳尔·菲斯。他住在十字路口以北的一座小屋里。但要当心：如果你走到了暗夜精灵的土地，那就是走得太远了。",dEN="Long has it been since you were last tested, <name>. You have shown patience thus far in your studies, but the time has come for you to learn more. The time has come for you to learn about destruction... and chaos. The element of fire is yours for the understanding, if you're prepared to pay for it.\n\nSeek out Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. He lives in a small dwelling north of the Crossroads, but be mindful, if you've reached the night elf lands, you've gone too far.",o="去贫瘠之地找到卡纳尔·菲斯。",oEN="Find Kranal Fiss in the Barrens.",c="所以……是纳姆派你来的，嗯？\n\n好吧。我一向信任斯瓦特。既然他把你派到我这儿，那就是说你已$g准备好:准备好;参加下一次萨帕了……火焰萨帕。\n\n我已经能在你眼中看到那火花，那焦躁的火焰。你尝过力量的滋味，现在你准备好要更多了。耐心点，$n。记住大地教给你的。力量和毁灭来得容易，但你始终要知道何时收手。",cEN="Hmmm, Narm sent you to me, did he?\n\nWell then, Narm could always be trusted, so that must mean you're ready to take part of the next sapta--the sapta of fire.\n\nI see it in your eyes already, the burning, the desire. You've tasted power, and now you're ready for more of it. Patience, <name>. Remember what earth taught you. Power and destruction will come easily, but you must still know when to stay your hand."}
Q[2985]={d="$g看来你:看来你;已为下一次考验做好了准备，$n。你在学业中表现出耐心，但时候到了，你该学得更多。时候到了，你该了解水的纯净。\n\n去贫瘠之地找伊斯伦·水先知。她在东海岸，位于南怒河和棘齿城以南。你会在她的钓鱼小屋里找到她。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="You look ready for your next test, <name>. You've been patient in your studies, but the time has come for you to learn more. The time has come for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nSeek out Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. She is along the eastern coast, south of the Southfury River and Ratchet. You will find her there at her fishing hut. Good luck to you, <name>.",o="找到贫瘠之地的水之先知伊斯伦。",oEN="Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.",c="地平线吹来的风轻拂着你，脚下的大地是如此坚实，火焰温暖了你的灵魂，而现在我想让你体味水的纯洁。\n\n你已经达到了一定的境界，你的精神将赐予你走得更远的力量。不过，你先得迈出至关重要的第一步。",cEN="The wind approaches you quickly from the horizon; the earth is steady beneath your feet; and your spirit is already warmed by fire--I would say it is time for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nYour path has led you this far, and your spirit will give you the strength to carry on even further. But the first step is yours to take."}
Q[2986]={d="从你上次接受测验到现在已经有很长的时间了，$n。迄今为止，你展示了足够的耐心，不过现在你应该学到更多的东西，应该去了解水的纯洁。\n\n去贫瘠之地找到水之先知伊斯伦，沿着怒水河的东岸向棘齿城的南方走，你可以在一间小渔屋里找到她。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="Long has it been since you were last tested, <name>. You have shown patience thus far in your studies, but the time has come for you to learn more. The time has come for you to learn about the purity of water.\n\nSeek out Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. She is along the eastern coast, south of the Southfury River and Ratchet. You will find her there at her fishing hut. Good luck to you, <name>.",o="找到贫瘠之地的水之先知伊斯伦。",oEN="Find Islen Waterseer in the Barrens."}
Q[2987]={d="我刚刚到达菲拉斯时，曾听说这里的戈杜尼食人魔有一些有趣的矿石。天知道食人魔用矿石来干什么，但他们确实在很小心地保护那种东西！他们有意隐藏这些矿石，以免我们接触到它。\n\n如果你愿意的话，我会把我的铲子给你。到北面的戈杜尼前哨站去，给我挖些戈杜尼钴矿回来。注意找那些泛着蓝光的矿石，然后就挖！",dEN="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff! They don't leave it just lying around; no, they bury it to protect folks like me from getting their hands on it.\n\nIf you'd be willing, I'll give you my shovel. Go to the Gordunni Outpost north of here and dig me up some Gordunni cobalt. Look for the blue glow, then start digging!",o="莫沙彻营地的奥尔文·吉兹米克需要12块戈杜尼钴矿石的样本。",oEN="Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",p="赶快去挖！\n\n我还要去很多地方，见很多人——时间就是金钱！",pEN="Get on up there and start digging!\n\nI've got places to go and people to see -- time is money!",c="太好了！我会在继续旅行的时候带着它们的，$n。我敢说会有人为这些矿石出个好价钱的。\n\n拿着这个，你应得的报酬。",cEN="Perfect! I will take these along as I continue my travels, <name>. I'm sure I can find someone that will pay a pretty penny for this cobalt.\n\nHere, take this for your trouble."}
Q[2988]={d="我们最强大的狮鹫的儿子失踪了！几天前，沙普比克和塔的父母外出打猎时失踪了，我们认为是巨魔抓走了它。\n\n你必须帮帮我们！到枯木巨魔的两个村子里去搜一搜那里的笼子，看看沙普比克是不是被关在里面。",dEN="The son of our mightiest gryphon is gone! Swiftwing's heir, Sharpbeak, was lost while hunting with his parents a few days ago, and we believe it was the trolls who took him.\n\nYou must aid us! Search the cages in the two Witherbark troll villages to see if Sharpbeak is there.",o="检查两个枯木巨魔村落里的笼子，然后向狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧回复。",oEN="Check the cages at the two Witherbark villages, then return to Gryphon Master Talonaxe.",p="你有没有搜查过笼子，$n？我们必须得找到沙普比克！",pEN="Have you searched the cages, <name>? We must find Sharpbeak!",c="沙普比克不在村子里？嗯……这是个可怕的消息。那头狮鹫命中注定是下一代狮鹫的领袖。如果它失踪了，我们的狮鹫军团也会因此遭受重创。",cEN="Sharpbeak wasn't at the villages? Hm... this is grim news. That gryphon is destined to lead the next generation of gryphons. If he is lost then the strength and spirit of our fleet will suffer immensely."}
Q[2989]={d="沙普比克没有和枯木巨魔在一起，那么或许是邪枝巨魔带走了他……到邪枝巨魔控制地区的西部边缘去，在那里的祖尔祭坛上找一找吧。",dEN="Sharpbeak was not with the Witherbark trolls. Perhaps the Vilebranch trolls took him. Go to the Altar of Zul on the western edge of Vilebranch territory and search for the gryphon child.",o="检查祖尔祭坛的顶部，然后向狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧报告。",oEN="Check the top of the Altar of Zul, then return to Gryphon Master Talonaxe.",p="赶快，$n！邪枝巨魔抓到了沙普比克，谁知道他们会对他干些什么！",pEN="Hurry, <name>! If the Vilebranch trolls have Sharpbeak, then who knows what they might be doing with him!",c="沙普比克不在那里？真是个坏消息，不过也是个好消息……\n\n幸好他不在祖尔祭坛上，那些邪枝巨魔是以供奉活祭出名的。\n\n感谢你的帮助，不过恐怕我还有更艰巨的任务要你去完成。",cEN="Sharpbeak wasn't there? That is bad news, but it is good news too...\n\nIt is good that he was not at the Altar of Zul for the Vilebranch trolls are known for performing sacrifices.\n\nI thank you for all of your aid, but I'm afraid I have an even greater task ahead."}
Q[2990]={d="把这根羽毛交给占卜师萨迪斯·格希德。几年前，他离开鹰巢山去寻求黑暗的知识，但他内心深处仍是一个不折不扣的蛮锤矮人！\n\n也许他的智慧能帮助我们找到沙普比克。\n\n这根羽毛是从它的巢穴里拿出来的，如果你把它交给萨迪斯，那么他也许就可以用占卜法术找到沙普比克。\n\n祝你好运，$n。你可以在诅咒之地找到萨迪斯，他就在守望堡的法师塔上。",dEN="Take this feather to Thadius Grimshade, the diviner. He left Aerie Peak years ago to pursue darker knowledge, but in his heart he is still a Wildhammer!\n\nAnd perhaps his talents can help us find Sharpbeak.\n\nThis feather was taken from the nest where the gryphon child sleeps. If you give it to Thadius then, with luck, he can use his divining magics to find Sharpbeak.\n\nGood luck, <name>. You will find Thadius in the Blasted Lands, in the mage tower of Nethergarde Keep.",o="将沙普比克的羽毛交给诅咒之地的萨迪斯·格希德。",oEN="Bring Sharpbeak's Feather to Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands.",p="$n，你给我带来了什么礼物？",pEN="<name>, you come bearing a gift?",c="啊，是这样。这根羽毛属于一头优秀的狮鹫。它命中注定要做大事……如果它可以安然无恙地活到成年的话。\n\n你想找到它？附耳过来，勇敢的$c……",cEN="Ah, yes. This feather belongs to a fine gryphon. One destined for great things... if he can survive into adulthood undamaged.\n\nYou wish to find him? Then listen close, brave <class>..."}
Q[2991]={d="我会帮你找出那头狮鹫的下落，但你得先为我做点事情。巨魔城市祖尔法拉克里面有一个名叫耐克鲁姆的巨魔，他拥有一枚徽章，我很想研究一下那东西。把徽章交给我，我就帮你找到沙普比克。\n\n祖尔法拉克在塔纳利斯的沙漠中。",dEN="I'll find out where your gryphon is, but first you have to do something for me. There's a troll in Zul'Farrak, Nekrum Gutchewer, who possesses a medallion I would very much like to study. Bring me that Medallion and I'll use my powers to find Sharpbeak.\n\nZul'Farrak is across the ocean to the west, in the desert of Tanaris.",o="将耐克鲁姆的徽章交给诅咒之地的萨迪斯·格希德。",oEN="Bring Nekrum's Medallion to Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands.",p="你把我需要的徽章带来了吗？我渴望研究其中隐藏的力量。",pEN="Do you have Nekrum's Medallion, <name>? There are powers hidden within it that I am eager to discover.",c="啊，耐克鲁姆的勋章。据说这枚勋章使那个巨魔变得长生不老，但这种奖励是有代价的。我希望找到一种获得勋章力量的方法，同时避免它的……讨厌的负面效应。\n\n你帮了我一个大忙，$n。我会遵守我的承诺。",cEN="Ah, the medallion of Nekrum. It is rumored to have given the troll an unnatural long life, but at a cost. I hope to discover a way to reap the medallion's power while avoiding its... unpleasant side effects.\n\nYou have done me a service, <name>. I shall now uphold my end of our bargain."}
Q[2992]={d="在我进行占卜仪式的过程中，不要打断我。我会找出你拿来的那根羽毛和它主人之间的关系，然后顺藤摸瓜找到沙普比克。\n\n理论上讲是这样……如果一切都按照计划进行的话。如果不是，那么……你最好闭上眼睛。",dEN="Give me room while I perform a ritual of divination. I will find the connection between the feather you brought me and its owner, and follow that connection to Sharpbeak himself.\n\nThat is... I will if all goes according to plan. If it does not, then... you better close your eyes.",o="等待萨迪斯完成占卜仪式。",oEN="Wait until Grimshade performs the ritual of divination.",c="仪式很成功。我看到了沙普比克，也可以告诉你如何找到它了。",cEN="The ritual was a success. I have seen Sharpbeak and can tell you how to find him."}
Q[2993]={d="沙普比克被关在巨魔城市辛萨罗的悬崖上的一只笼子里，笼子的钥匙由邪枝巨魔的邪恶祭司海克斯掌管着。\n\n我已经做了我该做的那部分事情，希望你执行任务的时候一切顺利，$n。",dEN="Sharpbeak is held in a cage, high on a cliff at the top of Jintha'Alor in the Hinterlands. The key to this cage is possessed by the high priestess of the Vilebranch trolls, Vile Priestess Hexx.\n\nThere. I have done my part. I bid you fortune on your quest, <name>.",o="与辛特兰的狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gryphon Master Talonaxe.",c="你已经同格希德谈过了？他说什么？\n\n……什么？邪枝巨魔抓了沙普比克？太过分了！我们必须组织力量把它给抢回来！",cEN="You've spoken with Grimshade? What did he say?\n\n...What? The Vilebranch trolls have Sharpbeak? That's unbearable! We must organize a force to get him back!"}
Q[2994]={d="你必须得救出沙普比克！\n\n杀进邪枝巨魔那座城市——辛萨罗的山顶，从邪恶祭司海克斯那里拿到沙普比克笼子的钥匙，找到沙普比克，把它救出来！",dEN="We must save Sharpbeak!\n\nFight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!",o="到辛萨罗山顶去，杀掉邪恶祭司海克斯，找到沙普比克笼子的钥匙，然后救出沙普比克。",oEN="Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",p="救出沙普比克！",pEN="Save Sharpbeak!",c="刚才沙普比克和它的父母一起回来了，它们对孩子唠唠叨叨的，就好像刚当上父母亲一样。看到它们重新团聚，这让我这个老矮人的眼睛也湿湿的……\n\n我们不知该如何感谢你，$n。鹰巢山的狮鹫和他们的骑手会一直传颂你的名字。",cEN="Swiftwind and Keenclaw returned with their child moments ago, and are fussing over him like new parents. Seeing them together again is enough to give even this old dwarf mist in the eyes...\n\nWe cannot repay you enough for what you have done, <name>. The gryphons of Aerie peak, and their riders, will sing your name for a long, long time."}
Q[2995]={d="奎尔丹尼小屋是高等精灵在辛特兰的联络中心。他们的使者正在试图与其他种族建立联系，他们会与这些种族分享与辛特兰南部的枯木巨魔的情报。所有联络其他种族所需的文件都被保存在了小屋中。\n\n我们不希望那些精灵与其他种族建立联盟关系，$n。\n\n去摧毁他们的文件，或者说，我们要毁掉他们的联络中心……",dEN="The Quel'Danil Lodge is a center of communication for the high elves of the Hinterlands. Their ambassadors are working to establish relationships with other races, with whom they share their knowledge of the Witherbark trolls that inhabit the area in the southern Hinterlands. All of the documents regarding the communications are kept at the lodge.\n\nWe don't need the Highvale building alliances with others, <name>.\n\nDestroy the Highvale documents. We need to burn their lines of communication... literally.",o="幽暗城的奥兰·斯内克威瑟让你到辛特兰去烧毁高原精灵记录、高原精灵报告和高原精灵信件。",oEN="Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity wants you to travel to the Hinterlands and burn the Highvale Records, Highvale Report, and Highvale Notes.",p="将高原精灵孤立起来是一切的关键……你找到小屋了没有？",pEN="Keeping the Highvale elves isolated is the key. Have you found the lodge?",c="太好了，$n。在高原精灵试图恢复他们丢失的联络资讯的同时，我们就可以将封锁线进一步推进……",cEN="Perfect, <name>. While the Highvale work to recover their lost information, we will be able to seal off the lines even further..."}
Q[2996]={d="我过去曾教过你一些知识和技艺，现在该让别人继续教你了。我说的是棘齿城的斯坦哈德，他是个人类，但不要以为他很弱小。虽然他看上去非常矮小，但是却有着超强的力量。他可以教你最强大的召唤法术——我觉得你已经准备好了，现在就到他那里去吧。他住在棘齿城……他的塔就在那座港口城市旁边的山上。",dEN="I have taught you skills in the past, but the time has come for another to teach you. He is in Ratchet, and his name is Strahad. He is human, but do not let that fool you into thinking he is weak. He is powerful even though he may be small. He can teach you about more powerful summonings--I feel you are ready. Go to him now. He is in Ratchet... above the port town next to his tower.",o="与棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",c="棘齿城的又一个忙碌的一天，不是吗？我多么喜欢看见港口城市的喧嚣啊，充满神秘，充满冒险……也充满着无知。\n\n我在你眼里看见的是仇恨吗，$n？很好，我们会好好利用这种仇恨的。",cEN="A busy day in Ratchet, isn't it? How I enjoy watching the toil of a port city. So much mystery, so much adventure... so much ignorance.\n\nIs that hatred I see in your eyes, <name>? Good, we will put that to good use."}
Q[2997]={d="你好，$n。我知道你正$g忙着:忙着;帮助丹莫罗的人民，但等你有空时，应该去铁炉堡跟这里最受尊敬的人之一谈谈：蒂萨·战炉。年轻的圣骑士该学习更多关于圣光的知识以及人们对他们的期望时，都会去找她。\n\n你可以在楼上的神秘大厅找到她。如果你从没去过，它就在神秘区。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="Hello, <name>. I know you're busy helping out the people of Dun Morogh, but when you have the time, you should make your way up to Ironforge to speak to one of our most respected ilk: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger paladins go to when it's time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of ya.\n\nYou can find her upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries. If you've never been there, it's in the Mystic Ward. Good luck to ya, <name>.",o="和铁炉堡的蒂萨·热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="幸会，$n。愿圣光为你指明真正的道路，护你免受邪恶侵扰。",cEN="Well met, <name>. I hope the Light shows you the true path and keeps you safe from evil."}
Q[2998]={d="你好，我的$G兄弟:姐妹。我们这里最有影响力的圣骑士——达索瑞恩·拉尔最近谈起过你。我听他说过你应该去找他接受试炼了……我也从他那里听说过你的出色表现。\n\n如果我是你，而且我有时间的话，我就会去暴风城和他聊聊的。我很肯定他会待在光明大教堂里——他一般都待在那里。",dEN="Greetings, <brother/sister>. Duthorian Rall, one of our most influential paladins, was speaking about you recently. I overheard him talking about how it was time you be put to the test some... along with some very complimentary things about how well you've performed thus far.\n\nIf I were you, I'd head to Stormwind and speak to him when you have time. I'm sure he's in the Cathedral of Light--that's where he spends most of his time.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="待在暴风城真好，不是吗？\n\n你的时机再好不过了，$n。",cEN="It is beautiful here in Stormwind, is it not?\n\nYour timing actually couldn't have been better, <name>."}
Q[2999]={d="你好，$n。我知道你正$g忙着:忙着;帮助丹莫罗的人民，但等你有空时，应该上楼去跟这里最受尊敬的人之一谈谈：蒂萨·战炉。年轻的圣骑士该学习更多关于圣光的知识以及人们对他们的期望时，都会去找她。",dEN="Hello, <name>. I know you're busy helping out the people of Dun Morogh, but when you have the time, you should go upstairs and speak to one of our most respected ilk: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger paladins go to when it's time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of ya.",o="与铁炉堡的蒂萨·热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge",c="你好，$n。希望圣光为你指引真理之路，让你免受邪恶的威胁。",cEN="Well met, <name>. I hope the Light shows you the true path and keeps you safe from evil."}
Q[3000]={d="你好，$n。我知道你正$g忙着:忙着;帮助艾泽拉斯的人民，但等你有空时，应该回铁炉堡去跟你家乡最受尊敬的圣骑士之一谈谈：蒂萨·战炉。年轻的矮人圣骑士该学习更多关于圣光的知识以及对我们所有人的期望时，都会去找她。\n\n你可以在楼上的神秘大厅找到她，它位于神秘区。",dEN="Hello, <name>. I know you're busy helping out the people of Azeroth, but when you have the time, you should return to Ironforge and speak to one of the most respected paladins of your home: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger dwarven paladins go to when it is time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of all of us.\n\nYou can find her upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries which is located in the Mystic Ward.",o="和铁炉堡的蒂萨·热炉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.",c="我向你致意，欢迎你，$n。",cEN="I greet you, and bid you welcome, <name>."}
Q[3001]={d="此前一直是我在指导你，但现在你该换个导师了。他叫斯特拉哈德，住在棘齿城。他是个人类，但别因此以为他软弱，也别以为他是你的敌人……至少目前不是……他非常强大，值得尊敬，能教你更高阶的召唤法术，我认为你已$g准备好:准备好;了解这些法术了。去找他吧。\n\n你会在棘齿城的港口找到他，就在他的塔附近。",dEN="I have taught you skills in the past, but the time has come for another to teach you. He is in Ratchet, and his name is Strahad. He is human, but do not let that fool you into thinking he is weak, nor is he your enemy... at least for now. He is powerful and should be respected. He can teach you about greater summonings, summonings I feel you are prepared for. Go to him now.\n\nYou can find him in Ratchet... above the port town next to the tower there.",o="在棘齿城找到斯坦哈德·法尔杉。",oEN="Find Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",c="棘齿城的又一个忙碌的一天，不是吗？我多么喜欢看见港口城市的喧嚣啊，充满神秘，充满冒险……也充满着无知。\n\n我在你眼里看见的是仇恨吗，$n？很好，我们会好好利用这种仇恨的。",cEN="A busy day in Ratchet, isn't it? How I enjoy watching the toil of a port city. So much mystery, so much adventure... so much ignorance.\n\nIs that hatred I see in your eyes, <name>? Good, we will put that to good use."}
Q[3002]={d="虽然我很熟悉我的敌人，但我只是一个战士，$n。我不知道这颗宝珠是用来干什么的。\n\n我认识一个住在奥格瑞玛的法师，他可以告诉你更多关于宝珠的信息。把它拿到他那里去吧。",dEN="Although I know my enemy well, I am a warrior, <name>. I cannot begin to tell you what this orb is capable of.\n\nI know of a mage in Orgrimmar that will be able to tell us more about the orb. Take it to him.",o="将戈杜尼宝珠交给奥格瑞玛暗木小屋里的尤塞尔奈。",oEN="Bring the Gordunni Orb to Uthel'nay in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar.",p="你给我带什么来了，$r？",pEN="What have you brought me, <race>?",c="这可真迷人，$n……\n\n这颗宝珠具有非常强大的力量，但也十分危险。",cEN="Fascinating, <name>...\n\nThis orb is very powerful, but also very dangerous."}
Q[3022]={d="$n，显然你很想帮我进行崇高的事业。嗯，当然，你可以为我做一些事情！\n\n请把这箱蛋送给艾瑞拉斯·琥珀。他是一个很重视这些蛋的德鲁伊，而且一直在帮助孵化这些蛋，以及训练幼小的角鹰兽。你可以在泰达希尔南边的一个名叫鲁瑟兰村的村庄里找到他。",dEN="<name>, I can see you yearn to be dedicated to my worthwhile cause. Yes, of course, you can do something for me!\n\nTake this crate of eggs to Erelas Ambersky. He is a druid that cares for these eggs, helping them to hatch and then training the young hippogryphs. You will find him in Teldrassil, in a small village to the south called Rut'theran.",o="把仔细包装过的箱子交给鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀。",oEN="Bring the Carefully-packed Crate to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.",p="我猜又是从克格尔那儿来的货吧？",pEN="Another shipment from Curgle, I assume?",c="谢谢你，$n。如果没有我们的帮助，角鹰兽的数量不会增长得如此之快。啊，我相信你也很了解这个问题，你只身转至菲拉斯，亲眼目睹了戈杜尼巨魔的残暴和破坏性。\n\n好吧，你也看到了，我在这里有许多事情要做，所以就这样吧。\n\n再次感谢你，$n。",cEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. The hippogryph population simply wouldn't flourish if it weren't for us. Ah, but I am sure you understand all too well, having traveled to Feralas yourself, and seen the devastation of the Gordunni there.\n\nWell, as you can see, I am hard at work here, so you'd best be on your way.\n\nThanks again, <name>."}
Q[3042]={d="祖尔法拉克的沙怒巨魔用砂石制造巨魔调和剂，我可以用它来加强我铸造的东西！有眼光的行家会出高价购买经过这样处理的装备，所以，如果你能给我提供足够的调和剂，那我一定会重重奖赏你的。\n\n祖尔法拉克在加基森的西北边。祝你好运。",dEN="The Sandfury trolls of Zul'Farrak make a tempering agent from sandstones, and I can use that to temper the goods I craft, yes I can! It is highly prized by connoisseurs, so if you bring me a good supply of the temper, then I'll reward you well.\n\nZul'Farrak is northwest of Gadgetzan. Good luck.",o="收集20瓶巨魔调和剂，把它们交给加基森的特伦顿·轻锤。",oEN="Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan.",p="你拿来我要的调和剂了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the temper, <name>?",c="啊，成色很好，数量也充足！看来我得好好工作几天才能把它们全都用光！\n\n谢谢你，$n。请收下这个作为报酬。",cEN="Ah, this is very nice temper indeed! And so much of it! I'll be at work for days before I use it all!\n\nThank you, <name>. Please, take this as payment."}
Q[3062]={d="艾丹娜·邪爪是居住在西面废墟里的北泉鹰身人的皇后。她是个彻头彻尾的恶魔，我听说她的心是水晶做的。除了对别人的仇恨之外，她没有一丝其它的情感。你必须干掉艾丹娜，把她的黑心交给我。\n\n我听说鹰身人有一种号角——在废墟北部的邪爪石那里吹响号角就可以召来她。\n\n当她发现召唤她的是死亡的命运而不是她的同族时，她会有多么惊讶啊！",dEN="Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal. She is void of any emotion aside from the hate she feels towards all others. You must face Edana and bring me back her dark heart.\n\nI have heard of a horn that harpies carry -- blowing it by the Hatetalon stones, in the northern part of the ruins, will summon the queen.\n\nImagine her surprise when it is not her kin calling her, but her death.",o="莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄要你给他拿去艾丹娜·邪爪的黑心。",oEN="Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.",p="不能让艾丹娜继续在这片土地上继续为非做歹了。",pEN="The hate that Edana spreads across the land must be stopped.",c="现在艾丹娜真的死了，而这颗心——我会把它收好，用它来时刻提醒自己，它曾经给我们带来了什么。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Now I know that Edana is truly dead. This heart; I will keep it in memory of what did here for me, <name>. Thank you."}
Q[3063]={d="年轻时，我曾是个经验丰富的猎手，没有什么野兽会让我感到害怕，直到……\n\n有一次在树林里，我在一场恶战之后正在打磨自己的武器，这时我遭到了伏击。鹰身人包围了我，好不容易我才脱了身。\n\n直到现在，我还能听见它们的嚎叫在耳边回荡……\n\n现在我已经不再年轻了，不过仇恨还在我的心中燃烧——这么多年了，我一定要报仇。\n\n北泉鹰身人就在西边，$n，去为我复仇。",dEN="In my day, I was a seasoned hunter. There wasn't any creature around that I feared. Until...\n\nI was out in the forest, sharpening my blade after a tough battle, when I was ambushed. Harpies surrounded me, and I barely managed to drag myself to safety.\n\nEven now, I can still hear their cries echoing...\n\nI was never the same after that. But the hate boils inside of me -- I must get even, after all these years.\n\nThe Northspring harpies can be found to the west of here. <name>, get my revenge.",o="塔罗·刺蹄让你杀掉4个北泉鹰身人、4个北泉游荡者、4个北泉唤风者和4个北泉杀戮者。",oEN="Talo Thornhoof wants you to kill 4 Northspring Harpies, 4 Northspring Roguefeathers, 4 Northspring Windcallers, and 4 Northspring Slayers.",p="北泉鹰身人的翅膀象夜一样黑不要让它们从你的视线中消失，否则黑夜会掩盖它们的行踪。",pEN="The wings of the Northspring harpies are black as the night; do not take your eyes off of them, lest they disappear into darkness.",c="谢谢，$n。你让一个年老的牛头人得到了心灵的慰籍。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You have put an old tauren's mind at peace."}
Q[3115]={d="你帮我的时候，有人托我把这份备忘录转交给你。有空的时候读一读。我想它是术士训练师萨里帕尔送来的。看一看，然后抽空去铁砧村找他。\n\n还有，小心点，$n：你这类人在这里不太受信任。",dEN="While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\n\nAnd watch yerself, <name>, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts.",o="阅读被污染的备忘录，然后寒脊山谷上的安威玛尔镇里的阿拉玛尔·格里姆谈一谈。",oEN="Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.",p="太好了！你显然拿到了我的备忘录。\n\n别理会你周围那些蠢人，$n。神圣的圣光？！剑与盾？！这些都不是给我们这种思想开放之人的道路。看看\"正统\"魔法对我们的家园做了什么。再加上那些该死的工匠，我们的种族差点灭绝。现在我们还得依靠矮人——他们宁愿花时间跟人类结盟，也不愿帮我们重建自己的家园。我们就像二等公民。你见过他们看我们的眼神吗？",pEN="Wonderful! You got my memorandum obviously.\n\nIgnore the fools around you, <name>. The Holy Light?! The sword and shield?! These aren't paths for ones as open minded as us. Look at what \"normal\" magic did to our home. Coupled with those damned tinkerers, our race almost became extinct. And now we have to rely on the dwarves-- they'd rather spend time allying with humans than help us rebuild our own home. We're like second-class citizens. Have you seen the way they look at us?",c="但那些都不重要，重要的是你要有自己的信仰！你要知道力量来自哪里，你要意识到结交盟友需要足够的……谨慎。我们需要特别的盟友，绝对忠诚的盟友，即使丢了性命也不会让我们失望的盟友。\n\n这就是我站在这里的原因，$n。我可以训练你，让你掌握这些特殊的力量。别忘了经常来找我，这样我就可以根据情况来向你传授更多的法术。",cEN="But none of that matters. What matters is that you've seen your own Holy Light! You know where power truly comes from. You realize that having our own allies is much more... prudent. Special allies. Allies that, no matter the task, will obey till their last breath.\n\nAnd that's where I come in, <name>. I can train you in the beginnings of those special powers. Seek me out often and I will do what I can to teach you more spells."}
Q[3121]={d="铁炉堡的泽拉什·火刃——就在莫沙彻营地以北的拉里斯亭——有我开始这里所需的东西！他调配了一种我需要的合剂，用来……嗯，你到时候就知道了。\n\n快去吧——去找泽拉什。把这个带上。这是我答应给泽拉什换草药的缩头。是某个在森林里撞见我的可怜矮人的脑袋。他肯定会喜欢。",dEN="Xerash Fireblade, located at the Lariss Pavilion, north of Camp Mojache, has what I need to get started here! He has mixed up a concoction that I need for my... well, you'll see.\n\nOff with you now -- to Xerash. Here, take this with you. It's a shrunken head that I promised Xerash in exchange for the herbs. It's the head of some poor dwarf I ventured across in the forest. I'm sure he will be pleased.",o="将皱缩的头颅交给菲拉斯的夏拉什·火刃。",oEN="Take the Shrunken Head to Xerash Fireblade at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas.",p="有事吗？",pEN="Yes?",c="我正在等尤克里送这个过来……\n\n等我给你拿草药，这是我为他的……嗯，实验……准备的……",cEN="I have been waiting for Uzer'i to deliver this...\n\nLet me give you the herb mixture I prepared for his... well, experiments..."}
Q[3122]={d="拿着这些草药，$n。把它们交给巫医尤克里。\n\n请告诉他，我对那些皱缩的头颅很满意。",dEN="Here are the herbs, <name>. Take them to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.\n\nPlease let him know that I am satisfied with the shrunken head.",o="将尼尔鲁的草药包送给菲拉斯的巫医尤克里。",oEN="Deliver Xerash's Herb Pouch to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas.",p="你跟尼鲁谈过了吗？",pEN="Have you spoken to Xerash?",c="这个就是我准备灵魂精华容器所必需的东西，$n。我们马上就可以看到我最新研究的咒语是否具有我所期望的威力了。\n\n请稍等一会儿，我必须举行仪式，然后使用这些草药。",cEN="This is just what I need to prepare the muisek vessel, <name>. Soon we will see if my latest incantations prove to be as powerful as I had hoped.\n\nPlease, a moment. I must perform the ritual and apply the herbs."}
Q[3123]={d="这是一个测试，对我将要进行的仪式和你的能力来说都是一个测试。拿着这个容器，$n。你可以用它将一个生物的灵魂禁锢起来。\n\n到辛特兰去寻找一种被称作枭兽的生物，它们曾经是暗夜精灵的女神艾露恩的宠物。那些堕落、头脑简单而又野蛮的枭兽就是你的目标，$n。杀死十头枭兽，在它们的灵魂逃跑之前用灵魂精华容器把它们收起来。",dEN="This will be a test; both of the ritual I performed, and of your abilities. Take this vessel, <name>. With it, you will have the power to shrink and capture a creature inside of it.\n\nTravel to the wilderness east of here and look for beasts. The vicious, ironfur bears and longtooth runners are your targets, <name>. Kill them, and use the muisek vessel to shrink and capture them before their spirits can escape.",o="到辛特兰去杀掉10头枭兽，然后使用灵魂精华容器捕获它们的灵魂。\n\n将灵魂精华容器和10个枭兽灵魂精华交给菲拉斯的巫医尤克里。",oEN="Kill 10 Ironfur Bears or Longtooth Runners, and use the Beast Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen beasts.\n\nBring 10 Beast Muiseks and the Beast Muisek Vessel to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas.",p="你抓到那些枭兽了吗？\n\n如果你成功了，我们就能缩小并捕获菲拉斯生物的穆塞克。",pEN="Were you able to capture the wildkin?\n\nIf you succeed, we will be ready to shrink and capture the muisek of creatures of Feralas.",c="如果生物死于暴力，它的穆塞克可能会逃脱并寻求复仇。像你那样把生物缩小，$n，就能防止穆塞克逃脱。现在我们就能随意使用它了！",cEN="Upon a violent death, the muisek of a creature may escape and seek revenge. Shrinking the creatures, as you did, <name>, prevents the muisek from escaping. Now we may use it as we please!"}
Q[3124]={d="你已证明自己既值得信赖，又有能力使用穆塞克容器，现在我希望你去捕获另一种生物。\n\n多年来，角鹰兽一直是暗夜精灵忠诚的伙伴；它们的灵魂忠诚而坚定。\n\n你的任务是杀死 10 只破羽角鹰兽，并迅速用容器将它们缩小并捕获，好保存它们的穆塞克。你可以在此地向南的蛮荒高地找到角鹰兽。",dEN="Since you have proven that you are both trustworthy and gifted with the ability to use the muisek vessel, I now wish you to capture another creature.\n\nHippogryphs have been loyal companions to the night elves for many years; their spirits are loyal and steadfast.\n\nYour task is to kill 10 frayfeather hippogryphs, and quickly, shrink and capture them with the vessel, so that their muisek may be preserved. You will find the hippogryphs in the High Wilderness, to the south of here.",o="杀掉10只任意种类的乱羽角鹰兽，然后用灵魂精华容器捕获它们的灵魂。",oEN="Kill 10 Frayfeather Hippogryphs of any type, then use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture them.",p="你捕获那些角鹰兽的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Were you able to capture the hippogryphs?",c="杀掉一只动物之后，如果我们让它的灵魂精华逃跑了，它就会变成一个更强大的生物，它的报复会使我们一直处于危险中。\n\n我交给你的工作非常危险，$n，但是你再一次成功地完成了任务。",cEN="After killing an animal, if we allowed the muisek to escape, it may take the form of an even greater creature. We would never be safe from its vengeance.\n\nThis is a dangerous job I have given you, <name>. Again, you have completed it well."}
Q[3125]={d="$n，下一步我必须让你捕获一种看上去可能很脆弱，但却有着我们真正需要的强大精神力量的生物。我所说的就是精灵龙，它们是暗夜精灵的伙伴。我们必须抓一只精灵龙来进行研究，这样部落也可以从这种精神力量中获益。\n\n我们需要它们的灵魂精华，$n。杀掉八只小精龙或精龙，并俘获它们的灵魂。从这里向西就可以找到它们。",dEN="<name>, next I must have you capture a creature that in appearance, may look quite fragile, yet its powerful spirit is what we are truly after. The faerie dragons that I speak of have served the night elves as their allies. We must capture one so that the horde may benefit from this strength of spirit as well.\n\nHere is the muisek, <name>. Kill 8 sprite darters or sprite dragons, and capture their muisek. They may be found to the west of here.",o="杀掉8只精龙或小精龙，然后用灵魂精华容器捕获它们的灵魂。",oEN="Kill 8 Sprite Darters or Sprite Dragons. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Faerie Dragons.",p="你捕获那些精灵龙的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Were you able to capture the muisek of the faerie dragons?",c="谢谢你，$n。现在精灵龙的灵魂力量可以为我们所用了。\n\n我希望你能再为我完成另一个任务。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Now the spiritual powers of the faerie dragon will be available to us.\n\nI hope you willing to perform another task for me."}
Q[3126]={d="在森林中到处游荡的森林漫游者是我们的下一个目标，$n。暗夜精灵已经和树人结成联盟，共同与部落为敌。它们的行动也许很缓慢，但它们却是强大的卫士。\n\n我们马上就能让这种力量为我们所用。\n\n去找到三个森林漫游者，然后用灵魂精华容器将它们的灵魂捕获。",dEN="The wandering forest walkers that can be found meandering through the forest are our next target, <name>. Night elves have enlisted treants as allies to fight against the horde. Their movement may be slow, but their role as protectors is undeniable.\n\nSoon we will be able to use this power for our own benefit.\n\nFind 3 wandering forest walkers; kill them, and use the muisek vessel to shrink and capture them.",o="杀掉3个森林漫游者，然后用灵魂精华容器捕获它们的灵魂。",oEN="Kill 3 Wandering Forest Walkers. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Treants.",p="你捕获那些森林漫游者的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Were you able to capture the wandering forest walkers?",c="谢谢你，$n。我们的灵魂精华几乎收集全了。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Our muisek collection is almost complete."}
Q[3127]={d="我给你的最后一项任务是到西北边去找到我们最后的敌人。\n\n在燃烧军团入侵的时候，山岭巨人帮助了暗夜精灵。在你穿过他们的领地时，你可以看到他们那庞大的身躯，感受到大地在随着他们的脚步声震动。\n\n我非常想得到如此庞大身躯下所蕴藏的力量，去杀掉十二个山岭巨人，然后用灵魂精华容器将他们强大的灵魂给我带回来。",dEN="The last task I will require of you is to travel to the northwest and find the final enemy.\n\nThe mountain giants left the mountains to aid the night elves when the burning legion appeared in the world. You will know them by their massive size and the way the ground begins to shake as you travel along their rocky terrain.\n\nI am eager to harness power of that size. Kill 7 mountain giants, then use the muisek vessel to capture their powerful muisek.",o="杀掉7个大地行者或者峭壁巨人，然后用灵魂精华容器捕获它们的灵魂。",oEN="Kill 7 Land Walkers or Cliff Giants. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Mountain Giants.",p="你捕获那些山岭巨人的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Were you able to capture the mountain giants?",c="$n，想象一下我们现在拥有了什么吧。有了你帮我收集到的材料，我就能将这些生物的灵魂精华永远囚禁起来。",cEN="Just imagine the possibilities of what we now possess, <name>. Along with the materials that you have collected, I will be able to forever trap the muisek of these creatures into whatever I wish."}
Q[3128]={d="我需要一些特定的材料来完成我的工作……你可以把这件事情与我要给你的其它几个任务一起完成了。\n\n我需要菲拉斯树人身上的一段断裂的原木，西边的那些山岭巨人和精灵龙身上的包壳矿石，还有从辛特兰的枭兽或者菲拉斯的角鹰兽身上找到的有弹性的肌腱。最后，我还需要大量的金属碎片，这些碎片可以从我刚才提到过的这些生物身上找到。",dEN="I will need certain materials to complete my endeavor... You may do this alongside the other tasks I will give you.\n\nI'll need a splintered log from a treant of Feralas. Encrusted minerals, these can be found on the mountain giants and faerie dragons to the west. Also, find me some resilient sinew from the owlbeasts of the Hinterlands or hippogryphs of Feralas. Finally, I'll need a large amount of metallic fragments from any of these creatures I mentioned.",o="为莫沙彻营地的巫医尤克里收集2根断裂的原木、6颗包壳矿石、20片有弹性的肌腱和40块金属碎片。",oEN="Bring 2 Splintered Logs, 6 Encrusted Minerals, 20 pieces of Resilient Sinew, and 40 Metallic Fragments to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Camp Mojache.",p="你收集到我需要的材料了吗？",pEN="Were you able to collect the materials I need?",c="太好了！这些材料和灵魂精华组合起来就应该能达到我们所期望的效果。",cEN="Excellent! These materials, combined with the muisek, should yield just the results we've been wanting."}
Q[3129]={d="将灵魂精华注入武器是个非常艰难的过程。既然我现在具备了所有必需的材料，还有这些你弄到的灵魂精华，那么我现在可以开始了。请等一会儿，我马上就回来。",dEN="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin. Please wait; I will return in a moment.",o="巫医尤克里希望你在他准备武器的时候稍等一会儿。",oEN="Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",c="就像我许诺过的一样，你有选择的权利，$n。这些生物的灵魂精华已经被永远地封存在这些武器中。\n\n你可以借它们的力量为自己所用了，好好利用它吧。",cEN="As promised, you have your choice, <name>. The muisek of the creatures has been forever sealed into the power of these weapons.\n\nYou may now wield their energy as your own. Use it well."}
Q[3130]={d="现在，我要让你到我的助手拉托尼库斯那里去，他一直都在密切注意纳迦的动向。我会对这里的综合形势作出评价，然后才能够采取行动将他们赶出这里，但是一旦我们发起攻击，我们的要塞就必然处于部落的直接威胁下——或者更糟，因此这并不是最佳的方案。\n\n不管怎么样，拉托尼库斯正在等着你。你的表现一直很不错，$n，希望你能继续保持。\n\n你可以出发了。",dEN="At this point, I am going to direct you to my second, Latronicus. He's been keeping a close eye on the naga forces to date. I'll assess the general situation here in regards to the naga; as much as I want to commit a full force to move against them, leaving the stronghold open to direct attack from the Horde - or worse - seems less than optimal.\n\nAnyway, Latronicus awaits. Good work thus far, <name>. Keep it up.\n\nYou're dismissed.",o="到羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛那里去报到。",oEN="Report to Latronicus Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="太好了，$n。我喜欢为我做事的人有那种\"我能行\"的态度。\n\n羽月将军委派我直接对付那些纳迦。我的计划有两个目标：其一，削弱他们的人数和指挥链；其二，查明他们在废墟里搞什么名堂。有你的帮助，我们就能在不牺牲要塞整体安全的前提下压制纳迦的存在。",cEN="Excellent, <name> - I value a \"can do\" attitude in those who I work with.\n\nI've been tasked by General Feathermoon to address the naga in a direct manner. My plans are two fold: one, we will weaken their forces both in number and in command, and two, we will uncover what they are up to in the ruins. With your help, we'll counter the naga presence without sacrificing the general security of the stronghold."}
Q[3141]={d="你想和恶魔战斗？听听我的故事会对你有好处。",dEN="So you wish to battle demons? You would do well to listen to my tale.",o="听洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯讲述他的故事。",oEN="Listen to Loramus Thalipedes tell his story.",p="不要打断我，$r。",pEN="Do not interrupt me, <race>.",c="事情就是这样……",cEN="So be it..."}
Q[3161]={d="$n，我是个科学家，但骨子里也是个寻宝者！\n\n很久以前，巨魔还占据这片土地时，他们制作了大量以加兹瑞拉为原型的饰物，那是一条被他们当作神明崇拜的九头蛇。这些饰物是用一种我称之为\"加兹瑞迪安\"的材料雕成的，名字来源于那位九头蛇神。\n\n我自己也找到过一些，但我想多要一些来深入研究——也许你能找到一些？\n\n我甚至发明了一台探测器，让寻找加兹瑞迪安变得轻而易举！戴上它，搜索就开始！",dEN="<name>, I'm a scientist, but also a treasure hunter at heart!\n\nLong ago, when trolls used to occupy this land, they created large amounts of ornaments modeled after Gahz'rilla, a hydra they worshipped as a deity. These ornaments are carved out of an element that I call \"Gahz'ridian,\" after the hydra god.\n\nI did find some myself, but I'd like to have some more to study -- maybe you can find some?\n\nI even invented a detector that makes finding the Gahz'ridian a snap! Just put it on, and the search begins!",o="塔纳利斯的马文·旋钉要你去收集 20 件加兹瑞迪安饰物。",oEN="Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 20 Gahz'ridian Ornaments.",p="你的搜寻工作进行得怎么样了？\n\n塔纳利斯到处都是加兹瑞迪安饰物，$n，所以请继续搜索吧！",pEN="Are you having any trouble?\n\nYou can find Gahz'ridian just about anywhere in Tanaris, <name>, so keep looking!",c="太好了，这些装饰物正好可以用在我的研究中。非常感谢你的帮助，$n。\n\n哦，能不能把盔帽也还给我？",cEN="Perfect; these ornaments are perfect for my studies. Thanks so much for the help, <name>.\n\nOh, can I get my helmet back?"}
Q[3181]={d="这根巨大的角上有许多擦痕和裂缝，还有一块金属物体嵌在粗糙的表面上。\n\n仔细检查了一番之后，你发现这块金属实际上是一把断掉的斧头。金属上刻着一行字：\n\n巡山人贝波蒂的财产。\n\n当你试着把斧头拔出来的时候，它一下子变成了无数的碎片。\n\n真糟糕！",dEN="The gigantic horn has numerous scratches and cracks. An unusual metal object is lodged into the rough surface.\n\nUpon further examination, you notice that the metal is actually a broken axe head. On the metal, the following words are etched:\n\nProperty of Mountaineer Pebblebitty.\n\nWhen you try and dislodge the broken axe head, it shatters into a million pieces.\n\nWoops!",o="把玛尔戈的巨大犄角带给巡山者卵石贝蒂。|n",oEN="Take Margol's Gigantic Horn to Mountaineer Pebblebitty.",p="不，我不会把门打开的。",pEN="No, I will not open the gate.",c="你手上那是什么？一看就是假的！\n\n我跟玛尔戈面对面过，我确信她的角至少比你手里那个大八倍，$n。你那大概是从贫瘠之地的风暴鼻兽身上弄来的。不行，女士，你骗不了卵石贝蒂！",cEN="What have you got there? A fake obviously!\n\nI've been face to face with Margol and I know for a fact that her horn is at least eight times larger than the one you've got in your hands, <name>. You probably got that off of a stormsnout in the Barrens. No ma'am, you can't fool Pebblebitty!"}
Q[3182]={d="你指望我会相信这样一个故事？真正的角怎么会是这个样子？\n\n听着，把这个明显是赝品的东西拿给铁炉堡的索里奥斯馆长看看。如果他能证明你的话是真的，那么你就能收到一份证明。把那份证明拿回来给我，我就给你一把灼热峡谷的钥匙。\n\n快动身去找索里奥斯馆长！",dEN="You expect me to believe a story like that? The real horn would have had my broken axe head still lodged into its surface.\n\nListen, take that obvious fake to Curator Thorius in Ironforge. If he can validate your claim, you will receive a proof of deed. Bring that proof back to me and I'll give you the key to the Searing Gorge.\n\nGet going!",o="把玛尔戈的巨角交给铁炉堡的索里奥斯馆长。",oEN="Take Margol's Gigantic Horn to Curator Thorius in Ironforge.",p="你好啊，年轻的女士。想参观一下博物馆吗？",pEN="Why hello there young lady. Would you like a tour of the museum?",c="这是什么？\n\n天哪，我简直不敢相信！你知道你手里拿的是什么吗，$r？这是暴怒者玛尔戈的角！玛尔戈，每一个踏足灼热峡谷的考古学家的噩梦。\n\n我可以留下它吗？",cEN="What's this?\n\nOh my, I don't believe it! Do you realize what you've got here, <race>? This is the horn of Margol the Rager! Margol, the bane of every archaeologist that ever set foot in the Searing Gorge.\n\nMay I keep it?"}
Q[3201]={d="我真不敢相信贝波蒂居然怀疑这支角的真实性。现在就你和我，我不妨直说，我认为她纯粹是嫉妒！我知道她很想亲手杀了那只野兽，你的“意外的成功”让她的美梦破灭了。\n\n那么，你需要证明是吗？你对博物馆的贡献很大，这不是问题。\n\n<索里奥斯馆长从一大堆文件中翻找东西。>\n\n好了！你可以把它拿去交给贝波蒂。",dEN="I can't believe Pebblebitty doubted the authenticity of the horn. Between you and me, I think she's just jealous. I know she really wanted to kill that beast herself, what with the 'incident' and all.\n\nSo you need a proof of deed? After the contribution you just made to the museum, it won't be a problem.\n\n<Curator Thorius begins to fill out a large document.>\n\nThere we go! You can take that back to Pebblebitty.",o="把索里奥斯的证明信交给巡山人贝波蒂。",oEN="Take the Proof of Deed back to Mountaineer Pebblebitty.",p="我不相信。",pEN="I don't believe it.",c="我不知道像你这么弱的$r是怎么征服玛尔戈的，但是我说话算话。这是钥匙。\n\n如果之后你出了什么事，那就是你自己的问题了。",cEN="I don't know how someone as weak as you overcame Margol, but a deal is a deal. Here is the key.\n\nIf anything happens to you after this, it will be your own fault."}
Q[3221]={d="你在这里帮助我们的亡灵哨兵的时候，药剂师伦弗利尔派人来找过你。他没有告诉我详情，但他想和你谈谈你交给他的那些狼的心脏。",dEN="While you were out helping our deathstalkers, Apothecary Renferrel sent you a summons. He did not give me details, but he wanted to speak with you about the wolf hearts you had given him.",o="与瑟伯切尔的药剂师伦弗利尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher.",c="啊，太好了。最近有一件与你给我的那些狼心有关的事情，我们最好注意一下。",cEN="Ah, very good. There is a matter regarding the wolf hearts you brought to me earlier that demands our attention."}
Q[3261]={d="你将结束跟随我进行修炼的日子，$n。为了进一步的深造，你必须到南边的陶拉祖营地去找乔恩·星眼，他会对你进行更深入的指导。",dEN="Your time with me is over, <name>. To learn more, you must go to Camp Taurajo to the south and speak with Jorn Skyseer. He will continue your guidance.",o="与陶拉祖营地的乔恩·星眼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.",c="你好，年轻人。你是来走$g这条:这条; $c之路的吗？\n\n很好。我们开始吧。",cEN="Greetings, young one. You are here to walk the hunter's path?\n\nVery good. Let us begin."}
Q[3281]={d="你杀了迅猛龙，很好，但是它们偷走的那些银币必须要找回来！我接到报告说有大量的迅猛龙聚集在棘齿城南面，那里现在被称为迅猛龙平原，它们八成是把银币藏在那里了。\n\n到那个迅猛龙平原去找到被偷走的银币，然后把银币送还到我这里来。",dEN="You may have killed the raptors, but the silver they stole must be recovered! I have reports that the raptors have a large grouping of nests south of Ratchet, known as the Raptor Grounds. It is likely that they brought our stolen silver there.\n\nGo to this raptor haven and search for the stolen silver. When you find it, return it to me.",o="把被偷走的银币交给十字路口的加兹罗格。",oEN="Bring the Stolen Silver to Gazrog in the Crossroads.",p="你拿到银币了吗？",pEN="Do you have the silver?",c="啊哈！这么说来迅猛龙的确是把银币藏在他们的巢穴里。真难相信这些野兽居然会对银币如此感到兴趣，也许它们真的有一些智商！\n\n谢谢你，$n。请收下这个，这是我们对你的奖励，另外我代表十字路口的守卫感谢你，因为你的辛苦，他们下个月的薪水有着落了。",cEN="Aha! So the raptors did hide the silver at their lair. It's hard to believe these beasts would have the desire for silver. Perhaps the stories of their intelligence are not as far from the mark as I thought!\n\nThank you, <name>. Take this as a reward for your service to us, and know that the guards of the crossroads owe their next month's pay to you."}
Q[3301]={d="我的族友茉拉·符文图腾去了银松森林，她去那里是为了帮助我们的亡灵盟友。银松森林状况不佳，那是一片濒死的森林，茉拉希望通过自己的努力给银松森林带来新的活力。也许在贫瘠之地找到的这种奇怪的生命形式能够对她在银松森林的工作有所帮助。\n\n把你收集到的龟壳样品交给她吧，茉拉一般都在瑟伯切尔待着。如果运气够好的话，这些贝壳可以帮她找到治愈那片濒死之地的方法。",dEN="My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life. Perhaps the strange life found here in the Barrens can help her work in Silverpine.\n\nTake a sample of the shells you gathered, and bring it to Mura in Silverpine. She is staying at the Sepulcher. With luck, studying the shell will give her the insight she needs to heal that dying place.",o="和瑟伯切尔的茉拉·符文图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mura Runetotem at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="我可以闻到你身上贫瘠之地的尘土味道，$c。你看来是远道而来的。",pEN="I can smell the dust of the Barrens on you, <class>. You have traveled far.",c="啊，这是什么？这个贝壳看起来闪闪发光，似乎还孕育着生命。太神奇了！我必须对它进行一番仔细的研究。\n\n谢谢你，$n。如果运气不错的话，我应该能从中发现治愈银松森林的方法。",cEN="Ah, what is this? This shell has an inner glow, as if it still pulses with life. Amazing! I must study it further.\n\nThank you, <name>. With luck, this shell will hold a secret I can use to aid the poor land of Silverpine."}
Q[3321]={d="你为骑士团做了很多，$n。走到这里所需的纯粹毅力早就把任何普通人挡在门外了。我毫不怀疑，加尔文也一样，你就是我们中的$g一员:一员;。\n\n所以我认为你该得到一点奖赏。真没什么，只是件小玩意儿。你也许熟悉它的特性，因为我确信正是它把你引到我们这里来的。",dEN="You have done much for the Order, <name>. The sheer dedication it takes to get this far would have turned away any ordinary person. There is no doubt in my mind, or in the mind of Galvan, that you are one of us.\n\nWhich is why I think you deserve a little reward. It is nothing really, just a trinket. You may be familiar with its properties, as I do believe it is what brought you to us in the first place.",o="等待特伦顿完成他的工作。",oEN="Wait for Trenton to finish his work.",p="今天，我们要庆祝你正式加入秘银会。",pEN="Today we finalize our celebration of your commitment to the Order.",c="起身吧，$g得到认可:得到认可;的$n，秘银骑士团的$g铁匠:铁匠;。",cEN="Rise and be recognized, <name>, blacksmith of the Mithril Order."}
Q[3341]={d="在贫瘠之地有一处藤蔓交错的地方，那里被称为剃刀高地。我们很久以前派去的斥候就已经发现那里的情况有些不对劲了，最近的发现表明那里的情况变得更加糟糕了……\n\n剃刀高地的野猪人和亡灵天灾结成了同盟。有个名叫寒冰之王亚门纳尔的巫妖指挥着它们的每一步行动。\n\n亚门纳尔与耐奥祖有着直接的心灵感应联系，我们必须切断这样的联系，$n。我们必须干掉寒冰之王。",dEN="In the Barrens lies a horrid mess of tangled vines called Razorfen Downs. While our first observations of this place revealed little threat, our recent findings are much more serious...\n\nThe quilboar of Razorfen Downs have aligned themselves with the Scourge. A Lich named Amnennar the Coldbringer rules them now, using the power of his massive consciousness to control their every move.\n\nAmnennar has a direct telepathic link to Ner'zhul; we must sever this bond, <name>. An end must come to the Coldbringer.",o="安德鲁·布隆奈尔要你杀了寒冰之王亚门纳尔并将其头骨带回来。",oEN="Andrew Brownell wants you to kill Amnennar the Coldbringer and return his skull.",p="这件事非常重要，$n。我们必须阻止天灾军团获得其它方面支持的行动。",pEN="This matter is of utmost importance, <name>. We must stop any attempt by the Scourge to bolster their ranks.",c="$n，一个巫妖的忠诚度是毋庸置疑的。让他们知道这样的忠诚只会给他们带来毁灭。",cEN="The loyalty of a Lich is unswerving, <name>. Let them know that such loyalty will only bring them destruction."}
Q[3361]={d="我正准备去诺莫瑞根跟我的侏儒同胞会合时，可怕的事情发生了！\n\n我提着行李箱离开铁砧村，打算穿过厚厚的积雪。结果一场该死的地震爆发了，我迷了路。最后我到了这里，更糟的是，巨魔把我的东西全抢走了！\n\n$n，过去一天半里我表现得相当无能。你介意潜入西南方的巨魔营地，替我取回东西吗？",dEN="We drove the troggs out of Gnomeregan, but then it all went so horribly wrong! Now our home is completely irradiated, and we gnomes have been scattered all over Dun Morogh.\n\nIn my haste to get away from the radiation, I lost all my personal belongings and tools. It was the trolls that got them. They stole my chest, my box, and my bucket of bolts! They took them back to their camps southwest of Anvilmar.\n\nI'm no adventurer - could you find my things and bring them here to me, please?",o="把菲利克斯的盒子、菲利克斯的箱子和菲利克斯的螺钉桶交给安威玛尔的菲利克斯。",oEN="Bring Felix's Box, Felix's Chest and Felix's Bucket of Bolts to Felix Whindlebolt in Anvilmar.",p="天啊，$n，这个城镇并不适合我这种人。这里讨厌的怪物简直和事故之前诺莫瑞根里的一样多！\n\n你拿到我的东西了吗？如果没有，天知道那些该死的巨魔把我的东西怎么了……",pEN="Oh goodness <name>, this town is not well suited for the likes of me. There are as many nasty creatures here as there were in Gnomeregan before the accident!\n\nDo you have my belongings? If you don't, then who knows what the trolls have done with them now...",c="太好了，你找到我的东西了！你真是我的救星！这给你，这些报酬虽然不多，但是它们表达了我对你的谢意！谢谢你！",cEN="Huzzah, you've found them! You're an absolute savior, my friend. Here, it's not much, but it's something for the trouble I've put you through! Thank you!"}
Q[3362]={d="你有没有去过灌木谷？那是个非常危险的地方，$n。\n\n那里到处都是奇怪的野兽，我根本不会冒险去靠近它们！那些野兽应该是被称作长瘤的灌木兽和灌木塑根者……\n\n不管怎么样，我想要亲自到那个山谷里去看一看，但是那么多的灌木兽在山谷里活动，我可不想去送死。但是现在你来了——如果你能帮我清除一些灌木兽的话，也许我就能去一趟了。$n，我想你应该能帮忙的吧？帮帮我，好不好？",dEN="Have you ever seen Thistleshrub Valley? It's a mighty dangerous place, <name>.\n\nThose strange beasts there, I don't trust them for a minute! Gnarled thistleshrubs and thistleshrub rootshapers, that's what I think they were called...\n\nAnyhow, I want to get into the valley, but with so many of those thistleshrubs around, there's no way I'm going back there. But here's where you come in -- if you clear some of them out, I just might think about going back. What do you think, <name>? Help me out?",o="加基森的特兰雷克要你杀掉8只长瘤的灌木兽和8只灌木塑根者。",oEN="Tran'rek in Gadgetzan wants you to kill 8 Gnarled Thistleshrubs and 8 Thistleshrub Rootshapers.",p="我想要仔细观察一下那个山谷里的仙人掌……所以打架的时候别把它们都给砸了，好吗？",pEN="I'd like to take a closer look at that cactus in the valley... So leave some of it in one piece, will ya?",c="它们有那么大吗？也许我得重新考虑一下我的计划……\n\n但是你确实完成了任务，这是我承诺要给你的。",cEN="They're that big? I might have to rethink my plan...\n\nBut you did hold up your end of the bargain, so here's what I promised."}
Q[3363]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[3364]={d="唉！我本该早些把这杯美味滚烫的晨酿送给铁砧村的杜南·割皮者，但我得先给这里的格雷林送一杯。等我赶到铁砧村，它肯定凉了！\n\n你看起来$g跑得快:跑得快;。也许你能送到。这杯只还能热几分钟，而杜南点的可不是“冰凉”晨酿，所以快去吧。铁砧村在东北方，是个凿在山里的聚居地。\n\n谢谢你，$n，别忘了把杯子还给我！",dEN="Gah! I was supposed to get this delicious scalding mornbrew to Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar a while ago now, but I had to deliver one to Grelin here first. I'll never make it to Anvilmar before the brew runs cold!\n\nYou look fast. Maybe you can make it. This cup will only stay hot for a few more minutes, and Durnan didn't order \"chilly\" mornbrew, so get going. Anvilmar is to the northeast, a settlement dug into the mountain.\n\nThanks, <name>, and don't forget to bring me back my mug!",o="在5分钟内把热酒交给安威玛尔的德南·弗卡特。",oEN="Take a Scalding Mornbrew to Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar before it gets cold!",p="是的，我是德南·弗卡特。你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="Aye, I'm Durnan Furcutter. You have something for me?",c="啊，太好了，这东西看起来很不错。请稍等片刻，让我享受这杯热腾腾的热酒吧！",cEN="Ah good, now this will hit the spot. Allow me to take a small break while I enjoy this scalding mornbrew!"}
Q[3365]={d="太正点了！没有什么别的东西能像这杯滚烫的热酒那样，在这个大冬天里温暖你的灵魂了！\n\n拿着这个，$n——帮个忙，把这个空杯子还给诺里斯，现在就去。",dEN="Now that hit the spot! Nothing like a piping hot - nay, SCALDING mornbrew on a cold winter's day to warm your cackles of yer soul.\n\nHere ya go <name> - be a pal and take this empty mug back to Nori for me, would ya now.",o="把诺里斯的杯子还给诺里斯·激流。",oEN="Return Nori's Mug to Nori Pridedrift in Coldridge Valley.",p="我相信你已经及时地把热腾腾的热酒交给德南了！杯子带回来了吗？",pEN="I trust the scalding mornbrew got to Durnan on time! Did you remember to bring me back my mug?",c="太好了，$n！你要是知道我见过多少信使连还杯子这种简单事都忘了，一定会吃惊。杯子又不会从树上长出来，反正他们是这么说的！\n\n这点东西算是酬谢你的辛劳。再次感谢你的帮助。",cEN="Excellent, <name>! You'd be surprised how many couriers I meet who forget to do something as simple as bring back the mug. Mugs don't grow on trees, or so they tell me!\n\nHere's a little something for the effort. Thanks again for your help."}
Q[3367]={d="<多里乌斯呻吟着。>\n\n我伤得很重，$r。一切都天旋地转……肯定有内出血。\n\n我必须回铁炉堡。帮帮我，$n。|n",dEN="<Dorius groans.>\n\nI'm badly injured, <race>. Feel... light headed... World spinning... Bleeding... internally.\n\nI must get back to Ironforge. Help me, <name>.",o="帮助多里乌斯回到铁炉堡。|n",oEN="Help Dorius get back to Ironforge.",p="我想我到不了铁炉堡了……",pEN="I'm not going to make it...",c="当杜里奥斯遭到枪击的时候，这封信掉了下来。",cEN="This letter was dropped by Dorius when he was shot."}
Q[3368]={d="兄弟：\n\n如果你在读这封信，我已经不在这个世界上了。请代我感谢把信送到你手上的人，并给予报酬。\n\n至于那些石头，我向你确认它们确实存在，而且掌握在黑铁矮人手中。他们的首领，黑铁拉索里克，用它们的力量奴役了我的挖掘队；他们被带到了大熔炉。他们一心执迷于某种叫“黑曜石”的东西。\n\n帮帮他们，兄弟。这是我最后的遗愿。\n\n多里乌斯|n",dEN="Brother,\n\nIf you are reading this letter, I am no more. How it got to you, I do not know, but thank and reward the ones responsible.\n\nAbout the stones: They exist and the Dark Irons have them in their possession. Their leader, Lathoric the Black, is using the power of the stones to enslave my excavation team. They were taken to the cauldron. Their minds are twisted, working night and day to complete something called Obsidion.\n\nHelp them, brother. It is the final wish of a dead man.\n\n-Dorius",o="把烧焦的信件交给铁炉堡的索里奥斯，他在探险者大厅里。",oEN="Take the Singed Letter to Thorius in Ironforge. He is in the Hall of Explorers.",p="<索里奥斯抽泣着。>",pEN="<Thorius sobs.>",c="<索里奥斯抹干了脸上的泪水。>\n\n以圣光的名义，他的遗愿一定会实现。我发誓。",cEN="<Thorius wipes his face dry.>\n\nIn the name of the Light, he will have his wish. This I vow."}
Q[3369]={d="这块碎片中蕴含有巨大的秘密，它是翡翠梦境的精华所在。然而，我从这片碎片中看到的却不是梦境，而是一种噩梦。\n\n我并不是想要警告你什么，$n，但是我希望你尽快把这个碎片送到一位睿智的德鲁伊手里。\n\n到雷霆崖的长者高地去找哈缪尔·符文图腾，我不能再多说了。",dEN="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare.\n\nI do not wish to alarm you, <name>, but I think it is best if you deliver this shard into the hands of a wise druid as soon as you can.\n\nHamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise is who you need to find. Head to Thunder Bluff. I cannot say more.",o="把噩梦碎片交给长者高地的哈缪尔·符文图腾。",oEN="Bring the Nightmare Shard to Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise.",p="我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="May I help you with something?",c="是法拉派你来的？好吧，让我们看看那块你说她如此不愿提起的碎片……\n\n<Hamuul intenta mirar dentro del fragmento>\n\n哦……我没有……好吧。\n\n$n，谢谢你把它送来给我。不过我要提醒你，谈论这种事并不明智。你不该插手这类事务。\n\n这么说吧，翡翠梦境里的事并不像我们以为的那样……\n\n也许将来我们的道路还会再次交汇。",cEN="Falla sent you to me? Well now, let's see that shard that you say she was so hesitant to talk about...\n\n<Hamuul peers into the shard>\n\nOh... I didn't... Well.\n\n<name>, thank you for delivering this to me. It isn't wise to speak of things such as this, though, I advise you. These are matters that you should not concern yourself with.\n\nLet's just say that things in the Emerald Dream are not as we thought...\n\nPerhaps in the future, our paths may cross again."}
Q[3370]={d="这块碎片中蕴含有巨大的秘密，它是翡翠梦境的精华所在。然而，我从这片碎片中看到的却不是梦境，而是一种噩梦。\n\n我并不是想要警告你什么，$n，但是我希望你尽快把这个碎片送到一位睿智的德鲁伊手里。\n\n到达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会去找玛斯雷·驭熊者，我不能再多说了。",dEN="This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare.\n\nI do not wish to alarm you, <name>, but I think it is best if you deliver this shard into the hands of a wise druid as soon as you can...\n\nMathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Circle is who you need to find. Head to Darnassus. I cannot say more.",o="把噩梦碎片交给达纳苏斯的玛斯雷·驭熊者。",oEN="Bring the Nightmare Shard to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus.",p="我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="May I help you with something?",c="是法拉派你来的？好吧，让我们看看那块你说她如此不愿提起的碎片……\n\n<Mathrengyl intenta mirar dentro del fragmento>\n\n哦……我没有……好吧。\n\n$n，谢谢你把它送来给我。不过我要提醒你，谈论这种事并不明智。你不该插手这类事务。\n\n这么说吧，翡翠梦境里的事并不像我们以为的那样……\n\n也许将来我们的道路还会再次交汇。",cEN="Falla sent you to me? Well now, let's see that shard that you say she was so hesitant to talk about...\n\n<Mathrengyl peers into the shard>\n\nOh... I didn't... Well.\n\n<name>, thank you for delivering this to me. It isn't wise to speak of things such as this, though, I advise you. These are matters that the Cenarion druids alone must attend to.\n\nLet's just say that things in the Emerald Dream are not as we thought...\n\nPerhaps in the future, our paths may cross again."}
Q[3371]={d="我的心已被悲痛腐蚀，变成了一个空虚的黑洞，$n。杜里奥斯的逝去让我一时之间无法恢复。我必须让他的心愿得以实现——那个冷血的凶手必须得到正义的惩罚。\n\n回到灼热峡谷去，达成他最后的心愿——解放他的同伴。",dEN="There is an empty, vacuous hole, where my heart used to be, <name>. The loss of Dorius is not one that I will soon recover from. I must see his final wish through - the perpetrators of this cold blooded murder must be brought to justice.\n\nReturn to the Searing Gorge and fulfill his last request: Free his men. The Dark Iron dwarves force their slaves to work in a sweltering mine called the Slag Pits. Search there for Dorius' men.",o="回到灼热峡谷，找到杜里奥斯的考古队员。",oEN="Return to the Searing Gorge and find Dorius's archaeology unit.",c="别管我，快去帮别人吧。",cEN="Forget about me, help the others."}
Q[3372]={d="释放他们，$r。即便他们的身体已经耗尽，桑塔拉的力量仍驱使着他们继续劳作。\n\n关键在桑塔拉祭坛。往西北去；暮光之锤在洞穴上方的山丘里守着一件遗物。取回它，放在桑塔拉祭坛上。\n\n<垂死的考古学家倒下了。>",dEN="Release them, <race>. Even after their bodies give out, the power of the Suntara forces them to complete their tasks.\n\nThe altar of Suntara is the key. Go northwest; in the hills above the cave... Twilight's Hammer guard a relic. Retrieve it and place it on the altar of Suntara.\n\n<The dying archaeologist collapses.>",o="找到灼热峡谷西北象限中暮光之锤膜拜者守护的神秘器物，并把它带到熔渣坑的桑塔拉祭坛。|n",oEN="Find the Mysterious Artifact being guarded by the Twilight's Hammer Idolaters in the northwest quadrant of the Searing Gorge and bring it to the Altar of Suntara in the Slag Pit.",p="祭坛是空的。",pEN="The altar is empty.",c="你把神秘的古器放在苏塔拉祭坛上。",cEN="You place the mysterious artifact on the altar of Suntara."}
Q[3373]={d="你一触碰宝石，一个低沉的声音便在脑海中回响。\n\n\"凡人，请听此恳求。我是绿龙军团的伊兰尼库斯，这座受诅咒神殿的看守者。我确保巨魔永不再唤起他们那憎恶之神的职责，如今已告失败。当我将部分精华注入这颗宝石时，我感到自己对梦境的掌控正扭曲成混沌。求你——把这颗宝石放入我巢穴中的精华之泉，让我们那里的魔法净化我心灵上的污秽，好让我得以安息。\"",dEN="As you touch the gem, a deep voice resonates in your mind.\n\n\"Mortal, heed this plea. I am Eranikus of the Green Dragonflight, keeper of this accursed temple. My charge to ensure that the trolls never again bring forth their abomination of a god has for now ended in failure. As I imbue this gem with part of my essence, I sense my grip on the Dream twisting into chaos. Please - place this gem into the essence font in my lair, and let our magic there purge the taint from my psyche so that I may rest.\"",o="把伊兰尼库斯精华放在精华之泉里，精华之泉就在沉没的神庙中，伊兰尼库斯的巢穴里。",oEN="Place the Essence of Eranikus in the Essence Font located in this lair in the Sunken Temple.",p="当你走近伊兰尼库斯所说的精华之泉时，他的声音再次触及你的心灵。\n\n\"是的，凡人，这座精华之泉将救赎我心灵中仍注入这颗宝石的未受污染的部分。把宝石放进泉中，让绿龙军团的魔法洗净我身上的腐化与污秽。只有这样我才能得到真正的解脱，也只有这样，龙军团才能重新确立对阿塔莱的统辖。\"",pEN="As you near the essence font that Eranikus told you of, his voice once again touches your mind.\n\n\"Yes mortal, this essence font will redeem what untainted element of my psyche remains imbued in this gem. Place the gem inside the font, and let the magic of the Green Dragonflight cleanse the corruption and taint from my being. Only then will I find true release, and only then will the Dragonflight be able to reassert their stewardship over the Atal'ai.\"",c="你把宝石放入精华之泉。\n\n\"谢谢你，凡人，你已经——不……这，这不可能！不！那受诅咒之神的腐化竟连绿龙军团精华之泉的神圣都能玷污！不，求你，我的精华……正在离我而去……痛苦……我感到永恒的噩梦攫住了我……\"\n\n\"凡人，我求你了！找到一位绿龙军团的成员来阻止这一切……帮帮我……我被锁在黑暗中……永远处于痛苦之中……求你别再折磨我……\"",cEN="You place the gem inside the essence font.\n\n\"Thank you mortal, you have - no... this, this cannot be! No! The corruption of this accursed god even taints the sanctity of a Green Dragonflight essence font! No please, I feel my essence ripping from me! THE PAIN! I feel the grip of an eternal nightmare taking hold on me...\"\n\n\"Mortal, I implore you! Find one of the Green Dragonflight to stop this... help me... I am chained in darkness... forever in agony... please do not torture...\""}
Q[3374]={d="你激活了誓言石，伊阿修斯的声音直接透过石头传入你的意识。\n\n\"接受这块誓言石所载的托付，即表示你同意协助我的事业，以及伊瑟拉龙军团的事业，去救赎伊兰尼库斯被腐化的灵魂。你我将无疑做出的诸多牺牲中的第一个，就是把你手中那颗仍束缚着伊兰尼库斯自由意志部分的宝石交给我。\"\n\n\"$n，照做吧，然后我们将共同救赎一个值得救赎的灵魂。\"",dEN="You engage the Oathstone, and Itharius speaks directly to your mind through the stone.\n\n\"By accepting the charge placed in this Oathstone, you agree to aid my cause and the cause of Ysera's Dragonflight in redeeming the corrupted soul of Eranikus. The first sacrifice, one of many you and I will no doubt make, will be to relinquish the gem to me that has chained what free-willed part of Eranikus' psyche remains.\"\n\n\"Do this <name>, and we will work together to redeem a soul worthy of redemption.\"",o="把伊瑟拉巨龙军团的誓言石和被禁锢的伊兰尼库斯精华交给悲伤沼泽的伊萨里奥斯。在那里你可以决定是否要帮助伊瑟拉的绿龙军团。",oEN="Bring the Oathstone of Ysera's Dragonflight and the Chained Essence of Eranikus to Itharius in the Swamp of Sorrows. It is there that you will make your choice to aid Ysera's Dragonflight or not.",p="我们已经到了，$n，到了另一个十字路口。是该作出个选择的时候了。凡人，你的选择是什么？",pEN="Here we are <name>, at yet another crossroads. The time has come to make another choice. What choice do you make, mortal?",c="你已经做出了选择，我们这就开始吧。你的选择现在在我看来是正确的你将要采取的行动和所得到的结果将会影响我们是否继续这件事情。",cEN="You have made your choice, and so it begins. Your choices have been, to date, what I would consider to be the correct ones; your actions and deeds henceforth will determine whether this is to continue."}
Q[3375]={d="呃……你还需要一瓶占卜之水？你开玩笑吧？第一瓶你拿去干什么了？！我们这儿有很多活要干，$r。那种瓶子又不会从树上长出来！说真的，我倒希望它们会，因为我手上一个都没有了！！\n\n要给你做一瓶，我需要以下东西：一瓶法力药水、一块煤和一些甘甜花蜜。别问为什么，把这些给我拿来就行，我会给你做一瓶新的。",dEN="Um... you need another phial of scrying? You're kidding, right? What did you do with the first one?! We have a lot of work ahead of us here, <race>. Those phials don't grow on trees! Actually, I wish they did, because I'd go there and pick one off since I don't have another one!!\n\nin order to make you one, I need the following: a mana potion, a piece of coal, and some sweet nectar. Don't ask why, just bring me what I ask and I'll make you a new one.",o="把一瓶法力药水、一块煤和一瓶蜂蜜酒送到铁炉堡的塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔那里，用以换取塔瓦斯德的占卜之瓶。",oEN="Bring a Mana Potion, Coal, and Sweet Nectar to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge to get a replacement for Talvash's Phial of Scrying.",p="要制作另外一个瓶子，我需要一瓶法力药水、一块煤和一些蜂蜜饮料。\n\n另外，还需要很多很多的耐心。",pEN="To make another phial I need a mana potion, a piece of coal, and some sweet nectar.\n\nThat, and a whole lotta patience apparently.",c="$g强大的冒险者:强大的女冒险者;完成了任务。为我欢呼吧！顺便说一句，我撒谎了——我还有一个药瓶。呃，拿去吧。\n\n怎么，你还指望什么？！\"哦，来，再拿一个！我不过是个没事可做、只能把魔法通讯装置分发给冒险者的傻瓜罢了！\"不过请放心，你交给我的东西足够在你再弄丢一个的时候给你做出另一个药瓶。\n\n拜托，证明我错了，别再把这个新的也弄丢了，好吗？",cEN="The mighty adventurer delivers. Hooray for me. By the way, I lied - I had another phial. Ungh, take it.\n\nWell, what did you expect?! \"Oh, here, have another one! I'm just some goofball who has nothing better to do than hand out magical communication devices to adventurers!\" Rest assured though, what you have given to me will be enough make you another phial when you lose that too.\n\nPlease prove me wrong and don't lose the new one, okay?"}
Q[3376]={d="$n，我听说过你的名字，也许你可以帮助我们一个忙。\n\n我们牛头人在这块土地上建立了自己的家园，但是我们也付出了巨大的代价。刺刃峡谷中有一座刺背野猪人的村庄，在他们的首领——刺鬃酋长的带领下，野猪人一直在与我们交战，这让我们的生活变得非常艰难。我要你去取回刺鬃酋长的头颅！\n\n你可以在东边的峡谷中找到他们那简陋的村庄，刺鬃酋长就在村子里面。",dEN="<name> - I have heard of you, newcomer. Perhaps it is you that will help us, where others have failed.\n\nWe tauren have carved a home out of this land, but not without a cost. The Bristleback quilboars of Brambleblade Ravine, led by Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle, have made our lives difficult with their continued war against us. I charge you to bring me the chief's head!\n\nHe will be found in the ravine to the east in their makeshift village.",o="把刺鬃酋长的头颅交给红云台地的卫兵维萨罗·风羽。",oEN="Bring the head of Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle to Brave Windfeather in Red Cloud Mesa.",p="只要尖牙刺鬃酋长死了，我们就再也不用忍受他的骚扰了。把他的头颅给我拿来作为你已经干掉他的证据，$n。\n\n我们牛头人生存的意义就在于打猎，而最大的乐趣莫过于猎杀那些有可能反咬我们一口的猎物了。如果你成功地完成这项任务，你就会理解我所说的话。",pEN="Sharptusk will trouble us no more once you have brought me proof of his death. It is his head that I seek, <name>.\n\nWe tauren live for the hunt, and there is no greater hunt than against one that is cunning enough to perhaps hunt us back. If you are successful in this task, young one, you will start to learn what I mean.",c="正义因你迅速的行动而得到了伸张，$n。让我们用这一件事来警告那些企图威胁我们家园的敌人吧。\n\n这是你应得的奖励，希望它能在你的旅途中派上用场，年轻的$c。",cEN="Justice has been served on this day by your swift actions, <name>. Let this deed serve as a warning to all who would threaten our home.\n\nYou have earned this reward to help you on your sojourn, young <class>."}
Q[3377]={d="你愿意帮我的忙吗？无论怎样，请先听听我的故事吧。",dEN="Will you assist me, mortal? Hear my tale.",o="听萨麦尔讲述他的故事。",oEN="Hear Zamael tell his tale.",p="请允许我讲完我的故事。",pEN="Allow me to finish my story.",c="我可以在这只笼子里听天由命，但祈祷文必须要被发现！",cEN="I have accepted my fate here in this cage, but the prayer must be found."}
Q[3378]={d="你愿意帮我的忙吗？你能找到艾露恩祷言吗？\n\n就如我所说的，祷言被刻在一块金色的石板上，那些崇拜它的恶棍把它占为己有。\n\n如果你能够找回我的祷言，就把它交给达纳苏斯的阿斯塔利·逐星。如此我才能在遭受如此多不幸之后重新恢复信心，而且更加重要的是，我的祈祷能够有人听见，至于我是否能被宽恕，我根本不关心。",dEN="Will you assist me, mortal? Will you find the prayer to Elune?\n\nAs I stated, the prayer was etched onto a golden tablet. One of these idol worshipping scoundrels must have it on their person.\n\nIf you do recover my prayer, take it to Astarii Starseeker in Darnassus. It matters little that my faith has been rekindled after the countless malevolent actions that I have taken against this world and its inhabitants, but my prayer must be heard. Absolution is the last thing I expect.",o="找到艾露恩祷言，把它交给达纳苏斯的阿斯塔利·逐星。|n",oEN="Find the Prayer to Elune and take it to Astarii Starseeker in Darnassus.",p="你来月神殿有什么事吗，$n？",pEN="What brings you to the Temple of the Moon, <name>?",c="今夜艾露恩会对你微笑，$n。你已经将一个迷失的灵魂还给了她。请收下这个作为我们对你的感谢吧。",cEN="Elune smiles upon you this eve, <name>. You have returned a lost soul to her. Please accept this as a token of our gratitude."}
Q[3379]={d="灼热峡谷的蜘蛛可以为我们提供暗影蛛丝，这使得它们的商业价值倍增。据我所知，暗影蛛丝在我们的交易中有着很大的需求量。\n\n最近有一批偷猎者来到了这里，他们随意地屠杀蜘蛛，根本不关心他们的行为可能造成的长期影响。我给你的第一个任务非常简单：找到他们……然后终结他们。\n\n到北边去开始你的搜索吧。\n\n如果你需要帮助的话，就去和拆毁者谈谈。",dEN="The spiders of the Searing Gorge are an invaluable source of shadow silk. As you know, shadow silk is highly sought after by the artisans of our trade.\n\nRecently, a group of poachers has encroached upon these lands, carelessly slaying spiders en masse without so much as a thought as to the long term effect of their actions. The first task I ask of you, then, is a simple one: Find them... and end them.\n\nBegin your search to the north.\n\nIf you require assistance, speak with Raze.",o="杀死灼热峡谷中游荡的暗影蛛丝偷猎者。尼丽丝认为一共有五个。任务完成后回到灼热峡谷向尼丽丝复命。|n",oEN="Kill the group of Shadow Silk Poachers that wander the Searing Gorge. Nilith has reason to believe that there are five of them that need to be exterminated. Return to Nilith in the Searing Gorge when this task is complete.",p="你带回什么消息了吗？",pEN="What information do you have?",c="干得好，$n。\n\n我相信这件影纹制品你从来都没有见过。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nI am sure that this is a piece of shadoweave that you have not yet seen."}
Q[3380]={d="世界上到处都是不肯安息的灵魂，$n。有些灵魂因为孤独而被腐化，继而和一个上古的邪恶力量联结了起来……\n\n我听说有一个地下的神庙，那里游荡着极其强大的力量。\n\n如果你想要对这个被称作失落的神庙的地方有更多了解的话，就去找一个名叫玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的地精吧。他曾经研究过许多古代遗迹，我最后一次听到他的消息时，他正从从棘齿城出发去塔纳利斯沙漠研究巨魔的遗迹。",dEN="There are restless spirits in this world, <name>. There are spirits that have been tainted by their isolation, bound to an ancient evil...\n\nI have heard of a place that lies deep below the surface of the earth -- banished there by powers greater than I have ever seen.\n\nIf you wish to learn more of this place; the Sunken Temple, seek out a goblin named Marvon Rivetseeker. He has studied many ancient areas of the world, and was last known to have left his home in Ratchet to study the troll ruins in Tanaris.",o="到塔纳利斯找到玛尔冯·瑞文斯克。",oEN="Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris.",c="嗯，沉没的神庙，我可是亲眼见过它的。也许你想要知道更多有关它的消息？\n\n你看起来就是那种爱冒险的类型——我想，你也许会对我所知道的东西感兴趣……",cEN="Yes, the Sunken Temple, I can say that I have seen it with my own eyes. Perhaps you'd like to hear more about it?\n\nYou look like the adventurous type -- I know things that may intrigue you..."}
Q[3381]={d="啊，一位年轻的$g男孩:女孩; $r前来与萨纳斯交谈。多么美好的一天！你赏光前来，我深感荣幸。谢谢你！\n\n拜托……别自以为是地觉得我的讽刺是在赞美你。咱们把话说清楚：我不喜欢你。但这次闲聊与我们无关，它和我的主人有关。\n\n给我带几根角鹰兽羽毛来做箭，我就准许你去见他。他吩咐过，如果有冒险者证明自己够胆量，就带他们去见他。",dEN="Ah, a young <race> come to speak to Sanath. What a wonderful day! I am so honored to have you grace me with your presence. Thank you!\n\nPlease... do not be so arrogant to assume my sarcasm was a compliment. Let us get one thing straight: I don't like you. But this little conversation doesn't have anything to do with us--it has to do with my master.\n\nBring me a couple hippogryph feathers for my arrows and I'll give you leave to see him. He's asked that I send adventurers to him if they proved worthy enough.",o="如果你想要见到萨纳斯的主人，就把2根完好无损的角鹰兽羽毛交给他。",oEN="Bring 2 Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers to Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara if you wish to speak to his master.",p="我仍然在这里执行主人吩咐的任务。我其实可以随便要求你提供什么东西来做为见到主人的代价，但是现在，我只要求每个旅人提供两根羽毛来完成我精美的箭。\n\n如果你不够小心的话，我可是会提价的。六枚金币听起来怎么样？\n\n就这样了，我现在就要求那么多。小心行事，我会暂时把价格保持在现在的水准。",pEN="I remain here at my master's bidding. I've been given leave to ask any price I wish for transportation up to his tower. For now, I ask for only the two feathers from each traveler so I can continue to make my signature arrows.\n\nIf you're not careful, I'll up the price. How does half a dozen gold sound?\n\nYeah, I thought as much. Just mind yourself and I'll keep the price where it is.",c="两根羽毛，正如我所要求的。而且质量还不差。\n\n那么，$g准备好了:准备好了;？只要你开口，你就能上路了。\n\n哦，再提醒你一次，注意言行……我的主人对蠢货可没什么好脸色，但对讨他欢心的人却非常慷慨。",cEN="Two feathers, just as I asked. And not bad ones at all.\n\nReady then? Just say the word and you're on your way.\n\nOh, and once again, mind yourself... my master doesn't take kindly to imbeciles, but he is very generous to those that please him."}
Q[3382]={d="当时我们刚离开海岸不远，正在寻找一处可以安全抛锚的港湾，$g真的:真的;。太阳落山还不到一个小时，它们就发动了袭击……那些该死的纳迦！\n\n我不确定它们在找什么，但显然它们没找到——它们已经又来过一次了。我派了几个斥候在山谷入口处放哨，一旦发现下次袭击就能及时警告我们。\n\n很抱歉你偏偏在这个时候赶来，$n，但这事由不得我。\n\n你准备好迎接这辈子最激烈的一战了吗？",dEN="We were just off the coast looking for a safe haven to make anchor. The sun hadn't been down for more than an hour when they attacked... those damned naga!\n\nI'm not sure what they were looking for, but it's clear they didn't find it--they've already come back once. A couple of my scouts are on watch at the entrance of the valley to give us fair warning when the next attack comes.\n\nI'm sorry you've come along now, <name>, but it's out of my hands.\n\nAre you ready for the fight of your life?",o="帮助瓦妮莎·贝蒂斯船长、她的船员和地平线轻帆号上的乘客抵御纳迦的攻击。瓦妮莎·贝蒂斯船长必须存活。",oEN="Defend Captain Vanessa Beltis, her crew and the Horizon Scout's passengers against the naga attack. Captain Vanessa Beltis must survive.",p="这将是一场艰苦的战斗……",pEN="Have you met with Andron yet? He rarely leaves Undercity, so I don't think it'd be too hard to find him.",c="你做到了！谢谢你！这无疑是我参与过的最惨烈的战斗之一。我对你感激不尽。\n\n我只希望我的船员能有更多人活过这次考验。\n\n我想请你去和地平线侦察号上$g幸存:幸存;的乘客谈谈。他们中有些人在这一带有事要办，如果你愿意，他们可能会有一两个请求交给你。再次感谢你的所有帮助。",cEN="You've done it! Thank you! Surely this was one of the most brutal battles I've ever taken part in. I can't thank you enough.\n\nI only wish more of my crew could have lived through this trial.\n\nI would ask you to speak to any surviving passengers from the Horizon Scout. Some of them had business in the area, and may have a request or two of you if you're willing. Again, thank you for all your help.\nRelated"}
Q[3385]={d="他们把自己称为黑市成员，他们都是些贪财如命的杂碎，只要有利可图，他们什么都会倒卖！\n\n现在情况变得更加糟糕了，$n。他们在灼热峡谷建立了一个基地，贸易首领考维克在那里策划着所有的行动，并且和该地区的黑铁矮人保持着密切的关系。\n\n我们必须对这种行为进行严厉打击，给他们一个严厉的警告。去杀掉贸易首领考维克和他的同伙科朗克，把他的商人的背包给我拿回来，你的任务就算完成了。\n\n向大熔炉进发！",dEN="They call themselves the Undermarket: Cutthroat traders that will sell, move, trade and do just about anything for the right price.\n\nIt gets worse, <name>. They have set up a base of operations here in the Searing Gorge. Trade Master Kovic is heading up the operation and has close ties with the Dark Iron dwarves of the region.\n\nWe must strike hard and send a message to their leadership. Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Bring back his trader's satchel when the job is done.\n\nTo the Cauldron!",o="杀死贸易首领考维克和他的爪牙科朗克，并从他身上取回商人的背包，交给尼丽丝。|n",oEN="Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith.",p="那家伙还活着吗？",pEN="The Trade Master still lives?",c="你对暗黑拍卖会进行了一次致命的打击。他们的领袖在派更多人进入灼热峡谷之前一定会考虑再三的。\n\n哦，我在这个商人的背袋里没找到什么有用的东西，你可以随便把它处理掉了。",cEN="You have struck a decisive blow against the Undermarket. Their leaders will think twice before sending more cronies into the gorge.\n\nOh, and I also found nothing of use in the trader's satchel. You may keep whatever you find inside."}
Q[3402]={d="我要你把考维克被干掉的消息亲自带给加基森的维兹格里克，他知道考维克死亡的消息一定会很高兴的，我敢说他肯定会为此给你丰厚的奖励。",dEN="I want you to personally deliver the news of Kovic's defeat to Vizzklick in Gadgetzan. He will be so happy to hear that Kovic is dead that I'm certain he'll give you some grand reward.",o="与加基森的维兹格里克交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Vizzklick in Gadgetzan.",c="考维克被干掉了？真是让人兴奋的一天啊，$n！这些年来，这个恶棍一直都在从事暗黑拍卖会交易，欺压全世界老实交易的辛苦商人。\n\n你理应为这个成就获得一份奖励！一份丰厚的奖励！",cEN="Kovic slain??! This is a glorious day, <name>! For years that scoundrel has been running shady undermarket trades, undercutting honest, hard working traders all over the world.\n\nYou deserve a fine reward for this accomplishment! And a fine reward you shall have!"}
Q[3421]={c="我现在会把你送回萨纳斯的营地里。\n\n不要理会他的坏脾气——除了主人之外，他对所有人都很粗鲁，迟早他要为此吃苦头的。",cEN="I will return you to Sanath's camp now.\n\nDo not mind his bad manners--he is rude to everyone save for the master. Perhaps he shall learn his lesson one day."}
Q[3441]={d="听听我的故事吧，旅行者。",dEN="Hear my tale, adventurer.",o="听卡拉然·温布雷讲述他的故事。",oEN="Listen as Kalaran Windblade tells his story.",p="请允许我把话说完……$r。",pEN="Allow me to finish mo... <race>.",c="你听完了吗？你准备行动了吗？",cEN="Have you heard enough? Are you prepared to act?"}
Q[3442]={d="你做出了正确的决定，$n。\n\n我们必须对敌人的要害下手，除掉那四座哨塔。\n\n一旦这四座塔都化为灰烬，我们就可以在他们反应之前发动攻击。\n\n你需要合适的工具来点燃防御塔，而制作这样的工具就需要合适的材料。\n\n给我弄四份烈焰之心和四份傀儡之油来，然后我就会给你制作出一把燃烧着无瑕之焰的火炬。\n\n在这片土地上的傀儡和元素生物身上找找吧。",dEN="You have made the right decision, <name>.\n\nWe must strike where we will do the most damage: the four sentry towers.\n\nWith the four towers in flames, we can initiate an offensive before they have time to react.\n\nYou will need the proper tool to set the towers ablaze. To make the tool requires some materials.\n\nBring me four hearts of flame and four golem oil and I shall craft the torch of flawless flame.\n\nThe golems and elementals in these lands should be your first target.",o="收集4份烈焰之心和4份傀儡之油，然后把这些东西交给卡拉然·温布雷。",oEN="Collect 4 Hearts of Flame and 4 globes of Golem Oil and return the items to Kalaran Windblade.",p="你收集到我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the materials?",c="干得好，$n。我们准备得差不多了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. We are almost ready."}
Q[3443]={d="要承载这无瑕的火焰，我们需要一根柄和一个外壳。你必须先找到合适的柄。\n\n大熔炉的黑铁监工和奴隶贩子使用附魔瑟银打造的武器，那是一种极其坚固的合金。如果你能给我带来八把镀瑟银匕首，我就能把合金熔解重铸成一根柄。|n",dEN="To hold the flawless flame, we will need a shaft and a casing. You must first find a suitable shaft.\n\nThe Dark Iron taskmasters and slavers of the cauldron use weapons of enchanted thorium, an extremely sturdy alloy. If you bring me eight thorium plated daggers, I can break the alloy down and reforge a shaft.",o="给卡拉然带去8把瑟银匕首。",oEN="Bring 8 Thorium Plated Daggers to Kalaran Windblade.",p="八把，$n。我需要八把匕首！",pEN="Eight, <name>. I need eight!",c="你是个很优秀的苦力，$n。你有没有考虑换个工作？比如当一个侦探？或是收垃圾的？哦，我知道了，有一大堆愚蠢的侏儒拿着金属探测器，徘徊在艾泽拉斯的海边寻找失落的宝物，嗯，那工作一定很适合你。",cEN="You're an exceptional laborer, <name>. Have you ever considered a change of vocation? Perhaps a detective? Junk collector? Oh, I know, one of those silly gnomes that crawl across the beaches of Azeroth with their metal detecting contraptions, looking for lost treasure. Yes, that would be an ideal position for you."}
Q[3444]={d="我曾经进入到沉没的神庙中的那个充满邪恶气息的房间，那里的恶魔会残忍地杀死每个进入房间的冒险者……我在那些满是泥泞的房间里艰难前进，差点就找不到出来的路了。我只记得自己蹒跚地穿过一个圆形的房间，房间里到处都是毒蛇塑像……\n\n最后，我发现了一块圆石，上面印着相同的毒蛇标记，我把它打包运到棘齿城的车间去了。去把它取回来，也许我能让你知道更多的信息。",dEN="I once entered the foreboding chambers of the Sunken Temple. The evil in that place penetrates all that enter; I barely managed to find my way out, wading through the ooze that now covers the floors. All I can remember is stumbling through a large circular room, filled with serpent statues...\n\nRecently, I discovered a round stone that appeared to have the same serpent symbol imprinted on it. I had it packed up and shipped to my workshop in Ratchet. Retrieve it, and I might be able to tell you more.",o="到棘齿城去，从玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的车间里取回石环。",oEN="Retrieve the Stone Circle from Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.",p="棘齿城离这儿不远，$n。花不了你多长时间的。",pEN="Ratchet is not far from here, <name>. The journey shouldn't take long.",c="对……就是这块石头。\n\n那些往事又回到我的脑中了，$n……",cEN="Yes... This is the stone.\n\nIt's all coming back to me now, <name>..."}
Q[3445]={d="我听说有一个地方被埋在地底深处，它是被一个我闻所未闻的强大力量沉入地下的。\n\n如果你想要对这个沉没的神庙有更多了解，就去找一个名叫玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的地精吧。就像特洛亚斯和我一样，他也探索过许多人迹罕至的地区。听说他离开了在棘齿城的家，前往塔纳利斯研究巨魔遗址去了。\n\n祝你好运，我好久都没有他的消息了。",dEN="I have heard of a place that lies deep below the surface of the earth -- banished there by powers greater than I have ever seen.\n\nIf you wish to learn more of this place; the Sunken Temple, seek out a goblin named Marvon Rivetseeker. Much like Troyas and I, he has studied many ancient areas of the world. He was last known to have left his home in Ratchet to study the troll ruins in Tanaris.\n\nGood luck finding him; he hasn't been heard from in some time.",o="到塔纳利斯找到玛尔冯·瑞文斯克。",oEN="Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris.",c="嗯，沉没的神庙，我可是亲眼见过它的。也许你想要知道更多有关它的消息？\n\n你看起来就是那种爱冒险的类型——我想，你也许会对我所知道的东西感兴趣……",cEN="Yes, the Sunken Temple, I can say that I have seen it with my own eyes. Perhaps you'd like to hear more about it?\n\nYou look like the adventurous type -- I know things that may intrigue you..."}
Q[3446]={d="在神庙里，我发现一间有着六个阳台的圆形房间，每个阳台的边缘都有一尊毒蛇塑像。我感到好奇，就推动了其中的一个，随即发现这是个陷阱！我差点在爆炸中丢了性命。我躺在台阶上往下看去，注意到在房间的底部还有一尊塑像，那好像是是什么神的祭坛……哈卡祭坛？似乎是这个名字。\n\n我认为这祭坛就是秘密所在——你必须把这个东西带到沉没的神庙中的那个祭坛上去……",dEN="Inside the temple, I found a circular room with six balconies, each one with a serpent statue on the edge. Curious, I pushed one of them to see what would happen, and it was a trap! I nearly fell to my death from the explosion. Laying there on the ledge, I looked down and noticed that there was another statue at the base of the room; an altar of sorts... Hakkar, I think it was called.\n\nI think that this altar is the secret -- you must bring this token to the altar in the Sunken Temple.",o="在悲伤沼泽沉没的神庙中找到哈卡祭坛。",oEN="Find the Altar of Hakkar in the Sunken Temple in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="在检查雕像时，你注意到边边有一处凹陷，与玛尔冯给你的石环尺寸相同……",pEN="Upon examining the statue, you notice a depression in its side, just the size of the token that Marvon gave you...",c="你把石环放入凹陷处，只听见“喀哒”一声，它完全密合。\n\n既然石头刚好吻合，那么你可以继续了……但是接下来要怎么做呢？\n\n也许你应该进一步检查这座祭坛……",cEN="You push the stone circle into the opening, and you hear it lock into place.\n\nNow that the stone is in place, you may continue... but what should you do next?\n\nPerhaps you should examine this altar further..."}
Q[3447]={d="我的记忆有些模糊了，但是我会尽量把我能回忆起来的细节都告诉你。虽然沉没的神庙中的雕像群充满危险，但我相信它们正是找到一笔巨大财富的钥匙。\n\n你可以在主祭坛上激活一系列光芒。我认为如果你能搞清楚出这些光代表着什么，或许你就能解开那座大厅中隐藏着的秘密。\n\n但是我要警告你，$n。神庙中潜伏着可怕的恶魔。它们会忠心地守护那些有价值的东西……",dEN="My memories are cloudy, but I will tell you what I can. The circle of statues in the Sunken Temple, while dangerous, I believe that they hold the secret to unlock an even greater treasure.\n\nFrom the main altar, I was able to activate a series of lights. I think that if you can uncover what these lights mean, you might be able to unlock whatever secrets are hiding in this room.\n\nI warn you though, <name>. Great evil lies in the temple. It's likely that anything valuable will be fervently guarded...",o="到沉没的神庙去，揭开雕像群中隐藏的秘密。",oEN="Travel into the Sunken Temple and discover the secret hidden in the circle of statues.",c="在半黑的神庙中，这尊雕像的眼睛仍然闪闪发光。通过清彻的眼睛你可以看到后面有某种发光的东西，你转动眼球，伸手进去抓住雕像中的东西。\n\n阿塔莱的宝藏是你的了。",cEN="The eye of the idol glitters brightly even in the half-darkness of the temple. Its transparency reveals something shiny behind it. Sliding it to the side, you reach in and grasp what lies inside the statue.\n\nThe Atal'ai treasure is now yours."}
Q[3448]={d="最近我一直在负责调查艾萨拉地区，那片美丽的土地曾经是精灵的故乡，他们曾在此研习魔法。现在这儿变得非常危险，但是这并不能阻止我们搜寻每一寸土地来寻找我们的历史。\n\n我的同伴泰摩尔对这样的事情特别感兴趣，因此他愿意帮助我调查艾萨拉。\n\n在城里的秘法大厅右边有一间小房子是他的。",dEN="I've recently been handed the responsibility of investigating Azshara--a once beautiful area the elves called home. This would be back when they practiced magic. It's now a more dangerous place than it is beautiful, but that doesn't stop us from turning over every stone for answers to our past.\n\nA companion of mine named Tymor offered to help me investigate the area since he takes a particular interest in such things.\n\nHe owns a small place to the right of the Hall of Mysteries here in the city.",o="跟铁炉堡的泰摩尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tymor in Ironforge.",c="啊，卡尼克派你来的，是吗？我可是整天盼着他的消息呢。我在艾萨拉发现了很多有趣的事情……我知道暗夜精灵的寿命很长，长得几乎令人难以置信，但是我们忘了他们生命中那些更为不幸的事情。这不是批判，而是观察。\n\n很久以前，精灵建造了许多城市，城市中保存着许多关于魔法的知识。我以学者的身份开始调查，而结果却令我毛骨悚然。",cEN="Ah, Karnik sent you, did he? I expected to hear from him soon. I've discovered such wonderful things about Azshara.. I know night elves have incredible life spans, but everyone forgets some of the more... unfortunate events in their lives sometimes. That's not meant as a criticism, just an observation.\n\nLong ago, there were cities created by the elves filled with knowledge about magic and other lost arts. Being a student of such things, I started my investigation. What I found was quite thrilling."}
Q[3449]={d="魔法曾经同艾露恩一样受到某些精灵的尊崇。他们中最厉害的法师发明了文字，并在石板上记录下了魔法的规律和他们对事物的认识，并将这些石板留在公开的场合供人研习。\n\n我非常想要获得这些来自埃达拉斯废墟的文字拓片。我将为你提供工具来帮助你取得拓片，但是你必须自己去寻找它们。多加小心，对埃达拉斯废墟感兴趣的可不仅仅是探险者协会。",dEN="Magic was once as revered as Elune herself to some elves. Some of their most powerful mages created runes and tablets citing rules of the arcane and insights into their findings. They would leave these for all to ponder in public places.\n\nI would very much like rubbings of these runes from the Ruins of Eldarath. I have a kit for you to make the rubbings with, but it will be up to you to find them. Be careful though, the Explorer's League isn't the only one interested in Eldarath.",o="使用绘图工具包获取贝萨玛拉符文、辛耶尔符文、玛科里符文和塞尔哈符文的拓片，然后前往艾萨拉南部半岛外的小岛，把它们交给驾驶员西格斯·熔光。",oEN="Using the Drawing Kit, make rubbings of the Rune of Beth'Amara, the Rune of Jin'yael, the Rune of Markri, and the Rune of Sael'hai before heading to the small island off of the southern peninsula of Azshara and signaling Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter to pick them up.",p="很好，很好，很好，很高兴见到你回来这里，$n。你帮泰摩尔拿到拓印了吗？\n\n尽管跟这里一样都是危机四伏，但是海岸附近却没什么动静。或许是因为水下有纳迦的关系，但是这与我无关……我是在天空巡逻的。",pEN="Well, well, well, glad to see you made it out here, <name>. Did you get the rubbings for Tymor?\n\nAs dangerous as this place is, there hasn't been too much action along the coast. That might be on account of the naga swimming underwater, but that's not my problem... I patrol the skies.",c="很高兴看到你$g安然无恙:安然无恙;，$n，$g真的:真的;。希望事情对你来说不算太难。\n\n我马上把这些东西送给泰莫。他会很激动能看看这些东西的。\n\n来吧，把信号枪扔了吧……反正它大概也对你没用了，我已经有一把新的了。",cEN="Good to see you safe and sound, <name>. I hope things weren't too tough for you.\n\nI'll get these to Tymor right away. He'll be thrilled to take a look at these things.\n\nGo ahead and toss the flare gun... probably won't be any good to you anymore anyway, and I already got a new one."}
Q[3450]={d="我想把这些拓片送到我的塔里去，但是你不必亲自跑一趟，我会把它们空运到艾萨拉。\n\n希格斯·熔火欠我的人情，而且他马上就会到那个地方去——因为他被派遣到海岸边去巡逻。在你离开之前，别忘了去跟他谈谈。他会给你一支闪光弹发射器用于发送信号。当你拿到拓片之后就到他指定的地点去给他发信号，这样他就能把拓片安全地送到我的塔里了。现在他应该在军事区的棚厂里。",dEN="I want the rubbings delivered to my tower, but there's no need to have you go all the way there. I'll just have them air-lifted out of Azshara.\n\nXiggs Fuselighter owes me a favor or two and will be in the area soon--he's signed on to patrol the coast. Speak to him before you leave. He can give you a flare gun to signal him with. When you have the rubbings, just head to wherever he tells you and then give them to him so he can get them to my tower safely. He should be in the hangar in the Military Ward.",o="与铁炉堡的希格斯·熔火谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Xiggs Fuselighter in Ironforge.",c="我能为你做什么吗，$n？我正忙着准备远行啊。我是来找我的那些坦克驾驶员的——我需要一些雪怪的鬃毛来装饰座舱，驾驶员们通常都有一些多余的存货。\n\n如果你不会太久，我可以给你一分钟的时间……有个驾驶员刚刚起飞转至钢架补给站去帮我找雪怪鬃毛了。",cEN="What can I do for you, <name>? Kinda busy at the moment preparing my ship for a long trip. I just came over to see some of the tank pilots--I need some wendigo manes to line my cockpit and they usually have extra.\n\nI can give you a minute if you're brief... one of the boys just took off to Steelgrill's Depot to see if the pilots down there have extra manes for me."}
Q[3451]={d="啊，泰摩尔派你来的，是吗？对，我可欠他的情呢。怎么？哦，那个小恶魔，我当然可以帮助他。你需要一枚闪光弹和一块合适的地方……就行了。\n\n在艾萨拉南部的半岛附近有一座小岛，我们可以在那儿着陆。你发射闪光弹，我就能看见信号，然后过去接收那个……他想要的随便什么东西了。",dEN="Ah, so Tymor sent you, huh? Yeah, I owe him a favor or two. What's that? Why, that little devil. Yeah, I can help him out with that. So you'll need a flare gun and a location... easy enough.\n\nThere's a small island off the southern peninsula of Azshara that we've made a landing pad on. You take this flare gun, and use it there. I'll see your signal and come by to pick up this... whatever it is he wants.",o="与铁炉堡的希格斯·熔火谈一谈，从他那儿获得一支标准型闪光信号枪。",oEN="Speak to Xiggs Fuselighter and get a Standard Issue Flare Gun from him in Ironforge.",c="这是我的标准型信号枪，你发射之后要耐心等待一会儿——这把枪用不了太多次，我可能要花点时间才能到你那里。发射信号之后，你只需要盯着海面就可以了。",cEN="Here's my standard issue flare gun, and be patient after you fire off the gun--there are only a couple charges in one of these, and it might take me a minute to get to you depending on how far out to sea I am. Just look out to sea after you fire off the flare."}
Q[3452]={d="我们还需要最后一部分来完成火炬。\n\n在西北方的山脚下，你可以找到暮光之锤的营地。据说他们携带着特殊的徽章和石像，用以表示对神明的崇敬。这些徽章和石像具有强大的魔法能力，足以制成一个魔法容器。将拉格纳罗斯符记交给我，我将试着从里面提取魔法，然后制造一个容器。",dEN="We need one final piece to form the torch.\n\nIn the mountains to the northwest you will find a large encampment of Twilight's Hammer. It is rumored that they carry symbols and idols that pay homage to their god. These symbols and idols could carry sufficient enchantment to form a magical casing. Bring me a single symbol of Ragnaros and I will try to extract the magic from the item to create the casing.",o="找到一个拉格纳罗斯符记，把它交给卡拉然·温布雷。",oEN="Find and return a Symbol of Ragnaros to Kalaran Windblade.",p="如果没有合适的魔法能量来源，惩戒火炬就无法完成。",pEN="Without a suitable source of arcane energy, the torch of retribution cannot be completed.",c="符记散发着邪恶的魔法能量，这正合我的心意。",cEN="The symbol radiates foul magic; perfectly suited for our task."}
Q[3453]={d="让我把部件组装起来，然后施加必要的附魔。|n",dEN="Give me a moment to combine the pieces and apply the necessary enchantments.",o="等待卡拉兰·风刃完成惩戒火炬。|n",oEN="Wait for Kalaran Windblade to complete the Torch of Retribution.",p="不要打断我。",pEN="Do not interrupt the channeling process.",c="还有一个最终的任务等着你去完成。",cEN="There is one final task that you must complete."}
Q[3454]={d="现在，火炬必须与它的拥有者建立联结。拿起火炬，$n。",dEN="The torch must now be bound to its owner. Pick up the torch, <name>.",o="拿起惩戒火炬。",oEN="Take the Torch of Retribution.",c="你用双手抓住火炬，一阵阵的憎恶和愤怒瞬间流过了你的身体。",cEN="You grab the torch with both hands; waves of hatred and anger pulse through your being."}
Q[3461]={d="泰摩尔并没有给我什么可以付你报酬的东西，我建议你回铁炉堡去的时候好好跟他交流一下。我想他还在秘法区，去找他吧，他会付你报酬的。\n\n再次感谢你帮助他摆脱困境，祝你好运。\n\n哦，我不需要绘图工具包啦，你为什么不顺便把它还给泰摩尔呢？",dEN="Tymor didn't give me anything to pay you with, so I suggest you take it up with him when you get back to Ironforge. I'm sure he'll still be in his place in the Mystic Ward. Just go knockin' and make sure he pays you good. This place ain't no picnic... that's for sure.\n\nThanks again for helping him out though, and good luck.\n\nOh, and I don't need the drawing kit. Why don't you just bring it back to Tymor when you go to see him?",o="到铁炉堡去，将法师泰摩尔的绘图工具包还给他。",oEN="Return Tymor's Drawing Kit to him in Ironforge.",p="你回来了！太棒了，你把我的绘图工具包拿回来了吗？",pEN="You're back! Excellent. Do you have my drawing kit also?",c="很好！我很高兴听到这个消息。\n\n到我的塔里去研究这些拓片一定会是件令人兴奋的事儿。我真羡慕你……能去艾萨拉那样的地方，那里是每个魔法研究者的梦想。\n\n嗯，自从你为探险者协会效力以来，我们还没谈过报酬问题呢，但是你应该得到回报。",cEN="Wonderful! I'm so glad to hear it.\n\nI'm really excited to get to my tower and go over those rubbings. I'm so envious of you... going to a place like Azshara. That's any student of the arcane's dream, I would guess.\n\nWell, we never spoke about any kind of reward since you were just working for the Explorer's League, but you deserve something."}
Q[3462]={d="跟我的特使——侍卫玛特拉克谈谈吧,他会进一步指导你使用惩戒火炬。",dEN="Speak with my envoy, Squire Maltrake. He will further instruct you as to the use of the Torch of Retribution.",o="与侍卫玛特拉克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Squire Maltrake.",c="你做好战斗的准备了吗？",cEN="Are you prepared to make your strike?"}
Q[3463]={d="听好了，$n。虽然我们无法摧毁那四座哨塔，但是你可以使用惩戒火炬点燃它们，这种火焰是任何元素或力量都没法熄灭的。\n\n在哨塔燃烧的过程中，没有什么部队可以驻扎在里面，这样他们的第一道防线就失效了。\n\n你必须进入每一个塔楼，用惩戒火炬把它们烧掉。要小心黑铁矮人的精英哨兵，$n。",dEN="Listen well, <name>. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue.\n\nWhile they are ablaze, no guard or sentry unit can inhabit the watch posts and thus, their first line of defense is nullified.\n\nYou must enter each tower and use the Torch of Retribution within their fortifications. Beware the lookouts posted by the Dark Irons, <name>.",o="进入四座哨塔，在每座建筑内使用惩戒火炬将其点燃。|n",oEN="Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.",p="你迷路了吗，$n？",pEN="Are you lost, <name>?",c="伟大的胜利！这难道不是一个伟大的胜利么？",cEN="It is glorious! Is it not glorious master?"}
Q[3481]={d="箱子似乎上锁了。",dEN="The chest appears locked.",o="打开箱子。",oEN="Open the chest.",c="你打开了箱子。里面究竟放着多少东西？只有一种办法可以知道。",cEN="The chest opens at your touch. How much cheese could possibly be in here? There is only one way to find out."}
Q[3483]={c="啊，还要一枚闪光弹？没问题。\n\n别忘了，是艾萨拉的南部地区。那里有一座小岛被改造成了停机坪。只要仔细观察一下，你是绝对不会错过的。",cEN="Ah, another flare gun, huh? That I can do.\n\nAnd don't forget, southern tip of Azshara. It's a small little island that's been turned into a landing pad. You can't miss it if you're in the right spot."}
Q[3501]={d="尽管你可能找不到纯净无暇德莱尼水晶，但是在你探索这片土地的过程中，一定可以找到若干有瑕疵的德莱尼水晶碎片。\n\n库米沙是否可以利用这些碎片返回家园，这还很难说，但是这些碎片可以为德莱尼人所用。\n\n把你发现的有瑕疵的德莱尼水晶碎片都交给我，我会给你报酬的。",dEN="Although you may never find a flawless sphere of draenethyst, you will undoubtedly uncover various imperfect fragments of the draenethyst in your exploration of these lands.\n\nWhile it is doubtful that Kum'isha will be able to use the flawed fragments to return home, the pieces may serve other, useful purposes for the draenei.\n\nReturn any piece of flawed draenethyst fragments that you may find and I shall reward you.",o="把有瑕疵的德莱尼水晶碎片带给库米沙，每交出一块碎片都会得到报酬。|n",oEN="Bring Kum'isha Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments and be rewarded for each one you turn in.",p="你在探险中找到什么好东西了吗？",pEN="Have you had any luck in your exploration?",c="你可真让我感到厌恶，$r。一个成年$g男子:女子对着一堆垃圾流口水？真可悲！带着你的报酬滚吧。",cEN="You truly disgust me, <race>. A grown <man /woman> drooling over a pile of junk? Pitiful! Take your reward and get out of my sight."}
Q[3502]={d="唉，在见识了那副贪得无厌的嘴脸之后，我直感到恶心。\n\n算了，我不会在你的物质欲上多费口舌。\n\n你每交来一块有瑕疵的德莱尼水晶碎片，我就用更多的破烂奖励你。我这堆垃圾变少了，你那堆却变多了。用德拉诺的话说，这叫稳赚不赔。|n",dEN="Well, after that display of voracious greed, I feel nauseous.\n\nRegardless, I shall not dwell too long on your material addiction.\n\nFor each imperfect draenethyst fragment you turn in, I shall reward you with more junk. My junk heap gets smaller while your junk heap gets larger. On Draenor we call this a 'win-win' situation.",o="把有瑕疵的德莱尼水晶碎片带给库米沙。诅咒之地的任何怪物身上都可能带着碎片。|n",oEN="Bring Kum'isha Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments. Any form of monster in the Blasted Lands could be carrying a fragment.",p="哦？德莱尼水晶？记得吗？\n\n<库米沙握紧拳头敲打你的脑袋。>\n\n有人在家吗？",pEN="Well? Draenethyst? Remember?\n\n<Kum'isha clenches his fist and knocks on your head.>\n\nIs anybody home?",c="你可真让我感到厌恶，$r。一个成年$g男子:女子对着一堆垃圾流口水？真可悲！带着你的报酬滚吧。\n\n听起来很耳熟是吧？我每天都要说一千次呢。\n\n啊，我真厌恶这个世界。",cEN="You truly disgust me, <race>. A grown <man /woman> drooling over a pile of junk? Pitiful! Take your reward and get out of my sight.\n\nSounds familiar? It should, because I say it a thousand times per day.\n\nOh how I loathe this world."}
Q[3503]={c="曾经，凡是来求见我主人的人，我都可以随意向他们索取任何东西。但现在，你只要开口，我就会把你送到他那里去。\n\n这让我很不痛快，但我不会质疑他的命令。我只能从嘲笑你那可笑的衣着或那张可悲的脸上找点乐子。连这也让我厌烦了……\n\n连这番唠叨都让我厌烦了！那么，你到底想不想见我的主人？",cEN="There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master. But now, you need only ask and I will send you to him.\n\nIt is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders. I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face. Even that bores me...\n\nEven this rambling bores me! Do you wish to see my master or not?"}
Q[3504]={d="这个毫无诚信可言的女人！她只能配得上这个称呼——罪有应得！\n\n我可能犯下了一个严重的错误，$n。我相信了一个血精灵。更糟糕的是，她还是个女的！\n\n她声称艾萨拉那里埋藏着数不尽的财富……我派了一些战士保护她去那里，满以为我可以有所斩获。但是，到头来我却被耍了——她把他们都杀掉了。\n\n我要报仇，$n，但是我手边已经没有可以派遣的人了。到哈达尔营地北边的瓦罗莫克去找阿格图，他会告诉你更详细的情况。",dEN="Betraying, thieving woman! That's what I call her--that's all she'll ever be!\n\nI may have made a grave mistake, <name>. I trusted a blood elf. What's worse, I trusted a woman!\n\nShe claimed Azshara would hold great riches... powerful items. I simply send some warriors with her to protect her and I would be rewarded. Well, look who's the fool--she's killed them all.\n\nI want vengeance, <name>, but I can't afford to send anyone else. Find Ag'tor at Valormok, north of the Haldarr Encampment. He'll tell you more.",o="把密封的信件交给艾萨拉的阿格图·血拳。",oEN="Deliver the Sealed Letter to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Azshara.",p="哦，这么说贝尔格罗姆终于想通了，派人来帮我们了，是吧？\n\n这座营地原本有十几个勇士，但如今他们全死了。那个法师琳姆托莉把他们全杀了。她把贝尔格罗姆玩弄于股掌之间……甚至还勾引了他。这不关我的事，但你我之间说句实话，她可真是个尤物。这大概也是我还在这儿帮贝尔格罗姆的原因——换了我，多半也会做同样的事。",pEN="Ah, Belgrom wizened up and finally sent someone not in his ranks to aid us, did he?\n\nThis camp used to be a dozen warriors strong, <name>, but now they're all dead. That mage, Rimtori, has slain them all. She played Belgrom like a lute... seduced him even. It's none of my business, but between you and I, she is quite the temptress. That's probably why I'm still out here helping Belgrom--I probably would have done the same thing.",c="我们已经竭尽全力来对付她和她的手下了，但是他们的确很能打。我们派去的人没一个回来的，我想他们多半都死了，剩下的八成是逃了……那帮懦夫。\n\n现在既然你这个援兵来了，我看我们还是能有所作为的。也许我们可以让她为欺骗和背叛贝尔戈洛姆付出代价。\n\n你愿意入伙吗？",cEN="We've sent everything we had at her and her workers, but they are strong in battle. None have bothered to return. I'm assuming some have died, but I'm sure others simply ran... cowards.\n\nBut now that reinforcements have arrived, perhaps there's still something we can do. Perhaps we can still punish her for lying and betraying Belgrom.\n\nWhat do you say, are you in?"}
Q[3505]={d="我的计划是这样的：\n\n我们从艾萨拉的北部半岛开始，沿着悬崖的南部开始进攻她的工人。把他们都干掉，让他们知道当叛徒的后果。\n\n先别管她——她大部分时间都跟她的护卫一起在艾萨拉进行搜寻工作。在杀死她的工人之后，我们在去考虑怎么收拾她比较好。我们应该先仔细侦察一番，也许有一些可以激怒她的东西。",dEN="I thought as much.\n\nWe start our crusade against her workers along the southern bluffs on the northern peninsula of Azshara. Kill them with bloody rage--let them know they've betrayed the wrong allies.\n\nDo not concern yourself with her yet--she spends most of her time with her bodyguards searching Azshara. It would be prudent after you've slain her workers to find her personal camp. Scouting out where we can attack her would be wise. Perhaps there is something there we can use to provoke her.",o="杀死10个血精灵搜寻者和10个血精灵勘测员，并找到大法师雷姆托里的营地。一旦你发现了营地，就去找到某个对她极为重要的东西，以用于激怒她，让她与你战斗。",oEN="Kill 10 Blood Elf Reclaimers, and 10 Blood Elf Surveyors before seeking out Magus Rimtori's camp. Once you've found it, look for something that might be important to her that can be used to draw her into a fight.",p="黑色的皮革封面上是用金叶镶嵌的书名——卡多雷召唤宝典。当你翻开书时，你发现这本书的年代十分久远，但是保存的十分完好。\n\n你猜测其中的文字是某种古代语言……或许是卡多雷语？\n\n你的直觉告诉自己，你应该在完成对血精灵的报复之后回到这里。",pEN="The title of the book is emblazoned on the black leather cover in gold leaf--Kaldorei Tome of Summoning. As you open the pages you can see that the book is very old but in superb condition.\n\nYou assume the text is of some ancient language... perhaps Kaldorei?\n\nYour instincts tell you that you should return here once you've finished doling out retribution on the blood elves for their betrayal.",c="你开始浏览这本书，并翻到了一页用黑色丝巾标出来的书页。\n\n在你试着解译书上文字的时候，你发现在其中一页的底部画着一张地图。你迅速地查看了一下眼前的景物，并很快意识到地上的水晶、石阵，甚至某些东西的位置都跟这张图上所画的东西十分相似。",cEN="You begin to skim some of the pages until you come to a page that's marked by a thin, black strip of silk cloth.\n\nAs you try to decipher the script, you see a diagram on the bottom of one of the pages. A quick look around at the scene before you and you realize that the crystals, the circle, and even some of the other components on the ground are set up in a similar pattern as the diagram."}
Q[3506]={d="经过思考，你对眼下的情形已经有了大致的了解，你的脸上浮现出一丝笑容：也许摧毁水晶将使那些杀死众多兽人并背叛贝尔戈洛姆的血精灵方寸大乱？\n\n你继续翻译着文字和图片，并了解到其中一块水晶就在这个石阵的制造者身上——其余的则在更为邪恶的生物手中。\n\n你合上书本，开始考虑要摧毁哪块水晶。",dEN="A few more moments of thought brings a few ideas to mind, one of which brings a smile to your face: perhaps destroying the crystals would upset the blood elf responsible for the slaughter of so many orcs and the betrayal of Belgrom?\n\nYou continue to decipher more of the script and pictures and realize that one of the crystals is tied to the creator of the circle--the others are tied to something far more sinister.\n\nYou close the book and begin to decide which crystal to destroy.",o="摧毁大法师雷姆托里携带的奥术聚焦水晶并杀死她。然后把她的脑袋交给艾萨拉的阿格图·血拳。",oEN="Destroy the arcane focusing crystal tied to Magus Rimtori and then slay her. Afterwards, take the Head of Magus Rimtori to Ag'tor Bloodfist in Azshara.",p="报复那些血精灵叛徒的事进行的如何了，$n？\n\n有任何的进展吗？我希望你够强壮，可以把那条狗狠扁一顿！她应该为她的所作所为死一百次！",pEN="How goes your slaughter of the blood elf traitors, <name>? Have you made any progress?\n\nI hope you are the one strong enough to bring that dog to her knees! She deserves nothing but a painful death for all that she has done!",c="啊！难以置信！\n\n你做到了！贝尔戈洛姆会很高兴的！无数战士的灵魂终于可以得到安息。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="RAR!! Incredible!\n\nYou've done it! Belgrom will be pleased! Finally the spirits of dozens of our warriors can be at peace. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[3507]={d="回到奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆那儿去，他肯定想要好好看看这个女人的脑袋！我们很快就回去。\n\n啊，这真是一个好日子。谢谢你的帮助，$n。",dEN="Return to Belgrom in Orgrimmar. He will want to see her head for himself! We'll return there shortly.\n\nAh, this is indeed a good day. Thank you for your help, <name>.",o="与奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆·石槌谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",p="我记得你，$c。我曾请求你去艾萨拉杀死那个叛徒！这好像是很久以前的事了。别告诉我阿格图和其他人也死了！",pEN="I remember you, <class>. I asked you to go to Azshara to destroy that wench that betrayed me! That seems like many moons ago. Don't tell me that Ag'tor and the others are dead also!",c="哈哈！看看你自己，可怜的女人！我要向你吐口水！\n\n谢谢你，$n。我衷心地感谢你！今天是个好日子！\n\n要是我有权力的话，我就送你一个王国！但是，也许你会对这件东西感到满意的。\n\n<贝尔戈洛姆低头看着那曾经背叛过他的法师。>\n\n哈哈！愚蠢的血精灵，看看你自己吧……躺在这麻布袋中，身首异处！这就是背叛贝尔戈洛姆的下场！",cEN="HAHA! Look at you now, pathetic woman! I spit on your remains!\n\nThank you, <name>. Thank you from the bottom of my heart! This is indeed a great day!\n\nI would give you a kingdom if it were in my power! But perhaps you will settle for this.\n\n<Belgrom looks down at the head of the mage who had betrayed him.>\n\nHaha! Stupid blood elf, look at you now... in a burlap sack and missing your body! You should never have betrayed Belgrom!"}
Q[3508]={d="你太鲁莽了，$n，$g莽撞:莽撞;得可以。明知几乎没有胜算，却仍盲目地投入战斗——这是你这类人身上令人钦佩的品质。我会帮你，哪怕只是为了看到拉瑟莱克的一个爪牙倒下。\n\n要打破拉瑟莱克属下身上的结界需要时间，还需要收集一些稀有的神器。\n\n别动，我必须先进行启蒙仪式。我收集到的信息将有助于我铸造威力强大的武器。",dEN="You are foolhardy, <name>. It is an admirable quality of your kind - to blindly enter battle when you have little to no chance of success. I will assist you, if only to see just one of Razelikh's minions fall.\n\nTo break the ward placed over Razelikh's subordinates will take time and require the acquisition of rare artifacts.\n\nBe still, I must first perform the enlightenment ritual. The information I gather will assist me in forging weapons of great power.",o="等待洛拉姆斯完成启迪法术。",oEN="Wait for Loramus to complete the enlightenment spell.",c="我们……要找到他的名字。",cEN="The name of the beast must be found."}
Q[3509]={d="要除掉恶魔之王和他的爪牙，只有一个方法：铸造一件刻有他真名的强大武器。\n\n这件武器铸造完成之时，就是恶魔之王的死期。\n\n有一个名叫亚考罗克的低阶神祗居住在艾萨拉，你必须找到他，但是如果他发现了你，那么他的爪牙就会不顾一切地想要杀死你。\n\n毫无疑问，你不费点力是没法成功的。",dEN="There is only one way to harm the demon lord and his minions. A weapon of power must be forged bearing his true name.\n\nWhen such a weapon is forged, the demon and all under his command are vulnerable.\n\nA lesser deity resides in Azshara: Lord Arkkoroc. You must seek him out but be warned, his minions will stop at nothing to destroy you if you are discovered.\n\nUndoubtedly, you will have to pay a price for such information.",o="与艾萨拉的亚考罗克谈一谈。你应该在海边搜索亚考兰神殿。",oEN="Speak with Lord Arkkoroc in Azshara. Begin your search at the waters edge to find the Temple of Arkkoran.",c="恶魔领主？\n\n<亚考罗克领主大笑了起来。>\n\n也许我可以告诉你，但是首先你得帮助我。",cEN="A demon lord?\n\n<Lord Arkkoroc laughs.>\n\nPerhaps the one can assist you with this information; but first, you must assist the one."}
Q[3510]={d="她杀害我的子嗣，凡人。就是那个自称统治这些海洋的家伙。一个假神，仅此而已。碾碎她，把她所有的头都带回来。\n\n作为交换，我会告诉你你要找的名字，还有另一件同等重要的东西。\n\n她在巢穴中游荡……人们叫她海泰拉。\n\n<亚考罗克领主指向西南方。>\n\n去吧！|n",dEN="She kills my children, mortal. She that calls herself the ruler of these oceans. A false god, nothing more. Crush her and bring back all of her heads.\n\nFor that, you will be given the name that you seek and something else of equal importance.\n\nShe roams the clutch... Hetaera she is called.\n\n<Lord Arkkoroc points to the southwest.>\n\nGo!",o="杀掉赫塔拉，将染血的赫塔拉头颅、破碎的赫塔拉头颅和淤血的赫塔拉头颅交给亚考罗克。",oEN="Slay Hetaera and bring back Hetaera's Bloodied Head, Hetaera's Beaten Head, and Hetaera's Bruised Head to Lord Arkkoroc.",p="<亚考罗克领主弯下腰来看你。>\n\n头颅在哪儿？",pEN="<Lord Arkkoroc bends down to inspect you.>\n\nWhere are they?",c="终于出现了一个$g配得上:配得上;亚考罗克智慧的人！",cEN="Finally, one worthy of the wisdom of Arkkoroc!"}
Q[3511]={d="我曾许诺将恶魔之王污染者拉瑟莱克的名字告诉你。不过，我得先为你的旅程准备一些至关重要的东西。\n\n你要铸造的武器必须有调剂才能制成。给我一点时间，让我从这些头颅中弄点血液出来。\n\n<亚考罗克用他那巨大的手掌挤压头颅，压出了血液。>\n\n将调剂交给洛拉姆斯，告诉他，那个恶魔的名字是拉瑟莱克。",dEN="As promised, I will reveal the name of the demon lord, Razelikh the Defiler. First, however, I must prepare something of utmost importance for your journey.\n\nThe weapon you seek to create requires a temper. Give me a moment to drain the blood from these heads.\n\n<Lord Arkkoroc squeezes the heads in between his gigantic fists, draining them of their blood.>\n\nTake the temper back to Loramus along with the name of the beast: Rakh'likh.",o="把调剂交还给洛拉姆斯·萨里比亚斯。|n",oEN="Take the temper back to Loramus Thalipedes.",p="你回来了！我真惊讶，$r。你知道那个恶魔真正的名字了吗？",pEN="You return! Astounding, <race>. Did you discover the true name?",c="调剂将为我们的武器提供必要的成分。接下来，我们还需进行最后一个步骤来完成武器的锻造。",cEN="The temper will add the necessary vitriol we require for the forging of the weapons. There is but one more step in their creation."}
Q[3512]={d="$n，第一步，我们将设法通过宝石与伊兰尼库斯交谈。现在他正处于半睡半死的不稳定状态，并受到噩梦的困扰。尽管你给我的精华已经被严重污染，但我们还是有机会跟他沟通的。\n\n到冬泉谷东部的冰川地带去寻找我们的盟友，灵语者阿姆布兰希。他可以与死者进行交谈——尽管伊兰尼库斯并没有真正死去，但阿姆布兰希依然会对我们有所帮助。",dEN="<name>, our first step will be to devise a method to speak with Eranikus through the gem. He lies in a precarious state between sleep and death now, twisted within a weave of nightmares. Though the essence you have given me is badly tainted, there is a chance we can reach him.\n\nTravel far to the icy lands of eastern Winterspring and seek one of our mortal allies, Umbranse the Spiritspeaker. He is a human medium who speaks for the dead. Though Eranikus is not truly dead, he may be of aid to us still.",o="到冬泉谷的东部地区去，与灵语者阿姆布兰希谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to the eastern part of Winterspring and speak with Umbranse the Spiritspeaker.",c="伊萨里奥斯派你来找我，这真是个明智的决定。伊兰尼库斯的状态并非你所理解的死亡，他将很快以他自己的语言给我们提供建议。但是，我不能直接帮助你……至少现在还不能。\n\n我可以教你与死者通话的方法，但是首先我需要一个人的帮助，这个人不会受到年老体衰的影响。我最有效的占卜装备早已被夺走，除非拿回它，否则我们就没法帮助伊兰尼库斯。",cEN="Itharius was wise to send you to me. While he is not dead as you understand death, Eranikus will soon give us advice in his own words. For now though, I cannot directly help you... at least not yet.\n\nI will lend my skill at death-speaking to you, but first I need the help of one who - unlike me - is not limited by the frailties of old age. My most potent augury device has been taken from me against my will, and unless I have it back we will be at a loss to help Eranikus."}
Q[3513]={d="这份看起来很正式的卷轴被一条银色丝带紧紧地裹着。你觉得会有什么人对此感兴趣，但是这人是谁呢？\n\n在灰谷边界以北有一处前哨站，如果卷轴上的信息与暗夜精灵有关，那么你就应该把它送到那儿去。",dEN="The official-looking scroll is wrapped tightly with a silvery ribbon. You're sure someone would be interested in seeing this, but who?\n\nThere is an outpost close to the Ashenvale border to the north, and if the information on this scroll involves the night elves, this would be the place to take it.",o="将符文卷轴带到贫瘠之地的北部警戒塔去。",oEN="Take the Runed Scroll to the northern guard tower in the Barrens.",p="你有什么事？",pEN="Whaddya got?",c="嗯……你在哪儿找到的？",cEN="Well now... Where did you find this?"}
Q[3514]={d="这张卷轴来自那个诡计多端的树妖琳萨瑞尔，石爪峰利爪巢穴的钥匙保管者。\n\n她再也无法联系上被你抢走卷轴的那个信使了，嘿，但我们必须守住这里。部落不会容忍她的信使在这里乱窜。\n\n$n，前往利爪巢穴。杀死琳萨瑞尔，然后立一个让所有人都看得见的标志。带上这面部落旗帜，$n。把它插在利爪巢穴里，好让他们在再派信使穿过我们领地前三思而行。",dEN="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak.\n\nShe'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here. The Horde will not tolerate her outrunners here.\n\n<name>, travel to the Talon Den. Kill Rynthariel, and then put up a symbol for all to see. Take this Horde flag, <name>. Put it up in the Talon Den so that they will not be so rash as to send another messenger through our territory again.",o="杀死猛禽洞穴的领袖琳萨瑞尔。",oEN="Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",p="不能让联盟踏入我们的领地，$n。让他们明白这一点。",pEN="We cannot allow the Alliance on our land, <name>. Make this known.",c="你可真够$g强硬:强硬;的！除掉琳萨瑞尔是重要的一步，$n。他们要重新集结得花不少时间，这样一来，贫瘠之地里的联盟信使就会少一些。他们在再派信使过来之前会好好想想的。\n\n谢谢你。",cEN="You're a tough one! Ridding the Den of Rynthariel is a major step, <name>. They will be slow to regroup, and so we can count on less Alliance runners in the Barrens. They will think again before sending another this way.\n\nThank you."}
Q[3517]={d="我承认，$n，我大部分时间都呆在艾萨拉。贝尔戈洛姆的惩罚对我也有好处。\n\n在离开这里之前，我进行了一些研究，你知道遍布这一地区废墟中的东西是多么的珍贵吗？\n\n我可以告诉你更多细节，如果你帮我收集一些东西，我甚至会分给你一些利润。\n\n在东边的埃达拉斯废墟里面有我需要的石板，它们都是以上层精灵的大法师命名的。去寻找石板，然后我们再来进一步详谈。",dEN="I admit, <name>, I've made the most of my situation in Azshara. Belgrom's punishment has had its share of benefits.\n\nBefore I left, I did some research and you would be surprised how many valuable items are lying around.\n\nI'll tell you more about my deals, and even give you a cut of the profits, if you help me gather some of them.\n\nThere are tablets throughout the Ruins of Eldarath to the east that I need. All four are named after Highborne wizards. Get them for me and we'll talk some more.",o="找到贝萨玛拉石板、辛耶尔石板、玛科里石板和塞尔哈石板，把它们交给艾萨拉的杰迪加。",oEN="Find the Tablet of Beth'Amara, the Tablet of Jin'yael, the Tablet of Markri, and the Tablet of Sael'hai before returning to Jediga in Azshara.",p="我要你收集的石板能让我们发一笔小财，当你找到它们之后，我会告诉你把它们送往何处的。但是，我可不是蠢货……我只有在确定它们都已送达的情况下才会把你应得的那一份给你。\n\n出发吧——我们的时间不多。我也许得多找些人来帮我。",pEN="The tablets I'm having you gather should bring in a pretty copper or two to the right parties. I'll tell you who we need to deliver them to after you've found them. But I'm no fool... you'll get your share after I have proof that they've been delivered.\n\nSo get to it--we don't have all day. I might have to find someone else to help me.",c="棒极了，$n，这些东西完好无损，我们一定能发财的。\n\n别在这儿浪费时间了，我们还得赚钱呢。",cEN="Perfect, <name>, and in good condition also. These should get us a good price from all the parties concerned.\n\nLet's not dawdle around here any longer than we have to. We have some money to make."}
Q[3518]={d="第一块石板要交给一位名叫玛加萨的牛头人。她是雷霆崖的长者之一，也是牛头人和被遗忘者结盟的支持者。她比其他长者中的任何一个都更希望帮助亡灵返回人类的状态。\n\n将贝萨玛拉石板交给她，这块石板或许能帮助被遗忘者……至少她是这么说的。",dEN="The first tablet goes to a tauren female... one called Magatha. She is among the elders in Thunder Bluff, and is one of the proponents of the alliance between the tauren and the Forsaken. She, more than anyone among the elders, feels the tauren and their ways can help the Forsaken find a path back to being human.\n\nBring her the Tablet of Beth'Amara. The tablet may be the link she needs in finding a way to help the Forsaken... or so she claims.",o="将贝萨玛拉石板交给雷霆崖的玛加萨·野性图腾。",oEN="Bring the Tablet of Beth'Amara to Magatha in Thunder Bluff.",p="你好，$n。我能为你做什么吗？我还要处理很多事情，请快一点。",pEN="Yes, <name>. What can I do for you? I have many matters I must attend to, so please, be quick.",c="啊，贝萨玛拉石板。我还在想我和杰迪加的合作关系是不是已经破裂了，要不然就是那可怜的兽人已经死在艾萨拉了呢。很高兴她成功了。\n\n贝萨玛拉是精灵贵族中最具影响力的炼金师之一，听说他已经掌握了随意把金属和其它物质互相转化的技能。",cEN="Ah, at long last, the Tablet of Beth'Amara. I was wondering if my partnership with Jediga had failed or if the poor orc had found her death in Azshara. I am glad she was successful.\n\nBeth'Amara was one of the Highborne's most influential alchemists. The wizard alone was said to have mastered transmuting metals among other things."}
Q[3519]={d="啊啊啊……我在探索旁边那个蜘蛛洞的时候被一只名叫基塞伊斯的蜘蛛咬成了重伤。我知道自己中了剧毒，你必须帮帮我。\n\n请把我中毒的消息告诉迪兰妮亚·月光，她知道该怎么办。\n\n快一点……我的头很晕……",dEN="Ughhh... I was bitten very badly by a spider named Githyiss the Vile while exploring the spider cave very close to here. I am sure I have been seriously poisoned; you must help me.\n\nPlease tell Dirania Silvershine. She will be able to help me.\n\nHurry... I'm so dizzy...",o="与幽影谷的迪兰妮亚·月光谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Dirania Silvershine in Shadowglen.",c="天啊，我正在想为什么今天还没看到埃沃隆呢。我一直警告他得当心那些蜘蛛……",cEN="Oh dear; I was wondering why I hadn't seen Iverron yet today. And I've always warned him about those spiders..."}
Q[3520]={d="我在寻找菲拉斯的山谷尖啸者的灵魂。它们是某位古老神灵的亲戚，它们的灵魂与那位神灵连在一起。\n\n带上这根魔杖去菲拉斯，在菲拉斯南部和中部区域寻找并杀死山谷尖啸者，对它们的尸体使用我的魔杖。这将使它们的灵魂现出原形，此时你就可以收集灵魂的精华了。\n\n将我的魔杖和尖啸者的灵魂精华交给我，我就会告诉你刚才我所说的那位神灵的详细情况。",dEN="I seek the spirits of the vale screechers of Feralas. They are the cousins of an old, old god, and their spirits are linked to him.\n\nTake this bramble wand and go to Feralas. Find and defeat vale screechers in southern and central Feralas, then wave my bramble over their fallen bodies. This will coax their spirit to reveal itself. Touch the spirit and collect its essence.\n\nReturn to me with my bramble and with the collected essence, and I will tell you more of the old god of which I spoke.",o="在菲拉斯捕获3个尖啸者的灵魂，然后回到热砂港的叶基亚那里去。",oEN="Capture the spirits of 3 screechers in Feralas, then return to Yeh'kinya in Steamwheedle Port.",p="你收集到尖啸者灵魂的灵魂了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you collected the essence of the screecher spirits, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。或许现在是揭开更多资讯的时候了……\n\n在巨魔中流传着一个古老的预言，死神哈卡，夺魂者，某一天会再回到这片土地上。有些人说哈卡的回归将为巨魔一族带来欢乐和荣耀，而另一些则认为他的复苏将摧毁一切。\n\n我不相信这个神话，但是我知道哈卡的灵魂精华拥有强大的能量，我们绝不能让这个力量落到那些居心叵测的人手里……",cEN="You have done well, <name>. Perhaps now it is time to reveal more...\n\nThere is an ancient prophecy among the trolls, where the dead god Hakkar, the Soulflayer, will one day return to this earth. Some say the coming of Hakkar will bring joy and glory to trollkind, while others believe his resurrection marks the end of all things.\n\nI do not believe this myth, but I do know the essence of Hakkar holds great power, and this power should be kept from those who would abuse it..."}
Q[3521]={d="我们也许能帮埃沃隆的忙，我知道有种方法能解蛛毒。但是我需要一些成分来制作解药。\n\n首先是紫蓝色蘑菇，它们一般生长在树下，你也可以从南边的劣魔身上找到它，劣魔们很喜欢这种蘑菇。我还需要月牙百合花，它们只生长在水池周围。\n\n最后一种成分也许是最难获得的，你必须从咬伤了埃沃隆的蜘蛛身上获取树林蜘蛛的脓液。",dEN="We may be able to help Iverron, as I know of an antidote that should help with the poison. It requires some ingredients, though, before I can make it.\n\nI'll need Hyacinth mushrooms. You can find these growing under trees, or you may collect them from the grell south of here; they seem to have taken a liking to them. I'll also need Moonpetal lilies, which only grow around watery pools.\n\nThe last ingredient may prove the most difficult. From the very spiders that poisoned Iverron, collect Webwood ichor.",o="在幽影谷中为迪兰妮亚·月光收集7朵紫蓝色蘑菇、4朵月牙百合花和一份树林蜘蛛的脓液。",oEN="Collect 7 Hyacinth Mushrooms, 4 Moonpetal Lilies, and 1 Webwood Ichor for Dirania Silveshine in Shadowglen.",p="请去收集我所说的那些原料，$n。埃沃隆需要我们的帮助。",pEN="Please, collect the ingredients, <name>. Iverron needs our help.",c="感谢艾露恩，你这么快就收集到了这些原料！\n\n稍等一下，我马上就配好解药。",cEN="Thank Elune that you have gathered these ingredients so quickly!\n\nIn just a moment, I will have the antidote prepared."}
Q[3522]={d="解药准备好了，$n。请确保埃沃隆把它喝下去。\n\n你要知道，解药的有效时间只有5分钟。你必须及时地把解药送到他嘴边。\n\n赶快去吧，$n。",dEN="The antidote is ready, <name>. Please see that Iverron drinks it.\n\nThere is something that you should know -- the antidote -- it will only remain viable for 5 minutes. You must get it to him in time.\n\nSpeed be with you, <name>.",o="在5分钟内将埃沃隆的解药交给他。你可以北边的洞穴入口外面找到埃沃隆。",oEN="Bring Iverron's Antidote to Iverron before the time limit is up. Iverron can be found by the cave to the north.",p="哦……$n，很高兴你回来了。",pEN="Oh... <name>, I'm so glad you have returned.",c="这是什么，$n？\n\n哦，我就知道迪兰妮亚能帮我的！\n\n<埃沃隆喝下解药。>\n\n我总是在惹麻烦，而迪兰妮亚总是会设法帮助我。\n\n我感觉好多了，但是我要在这里休息一会，直到我感觉完全恢复之后再离开。好吧，其实我是希望你帮我从这些可恶的树林蜘蛛中清出一条路来……",cEN="What is this, <name>?\n\nOh, I knew Dirania would be able to help me!\n\n<Iverron drinks the antidote>\n\nI'm always getting into trouble and Dirania, well, she always manages to help me out of it.\n\nI am feeling much better, but I think I will sit here for a while longer, until I feel completely better. Well, that, and I was hoping you'd clear a path for me through those vicious Webwood spiders..."}
Q[3523]={d="太好了！我叫奔尼斯特拉兹，感谢你前来营救我。我已经放弃了求生的欲望……甚至想到自己会被这些亡灵天灾滋生的渣滓给吃了。是的——我说的是亡灵天灾。他们与野猪人达成了协议，你所看到的这些噩梦般的景象就是这个协议的结果。\n\n听着……与其逃跑，我宁愿奋力一搏，为所有的生灵造福。你愿意帮助我吗？这也许很危险，但是你看起来应该可以胜任。",dEN="Outstanding! My name is Belnistrasz, and I thank you for rescuing me. I had given myself up for dead... or worse, as a meal for these Scourge-infested vermin. Yes - I said Scourge all right; they've brokered some sort of deal with the Quilboar here, and this nightmare is a result.\n\nListen... rather than just flee, I want to make a difference for all of our sakes. Would you be up to helping me out to that end? It's probably dangerous, but you seem to be the type not to worry about that too much.",o="如果你同意帮助奔尼斯特拉兹，就再跟他谈谈，并将誓言石还给他。",oEN="If you agree to aid Belnistrasz, speak with him again and hand the Oathstone he gave you back to him.",p="我并不是搞政治的，我不在意你是为部落还是为联盟效力。我对解决所有种族直接造成影响的重大威胁更感兴趣……现在我们就有一个很大的威胁。\n\n要是你愿意成为真正的人民英雄，就将我作为承诺的黑曜石还给我吧。对我的族人来说这代表着重要的同意契约。",pEN="I'm not one for politics; I care not if your affiliations are for either Horde or Alliance. I am more interested in squelching direct and dire threats to all the races... and we have quite a large one in here.\n\nIf you're willing to be a true hero for all people, then hand me the oathstone I have given you as a sign of commitment. I'm... not from around these parts; an oathstone is important to people of my kind as a bond of agreement.",c="太好了，我就知道你是那种有英雄气概的人！我们手头的活儿可不轻松，我不骗你。只要我们专注于眼前的任务，就应该能挺过去。\n\n现在，让我给你讲讲目前的进展……",cEN="Fantastic, I thought you looked to be the heroic type! We've got our work cut out for us <name>, I'm not going to lie to you. If we stay focused on the task at hand, we should be able to come out on top.\n\nNow, let me bring you up to speed on what's been going on..."}
Q[3524]={d="众所周知，巨大的海洋生物常年潜身于黑海岸边缘，它们在此游弋，直至死亡。近来，这些野兽的数量日益增加，并且开始侵袭海岸。我受月神殿的派遣到这里来调查，但是海水中的鱼人使调查变得非常困难。\n\n被邪恶的灰雾鱼人所控制的奥伯丁南部海岸上躺着一头搁浅的巨型生物，你能帮忙去从这头巨兽身上弄点骨头回来以供我研究吗？",dEN="Majestic sea creatures are known to launch themselves at the Darkshore coastline, beached there until they die. Lately, these beasts have been washing ashore in ever-increasing numbers. I've been sent here by the Temple of the Moon to investigate, but the presence of murlocs along the water has made my research difficult.\n\nThere is a giant creature washed ashore just south of Auberdine that is ringed by the foul Greymist murlocs. Could you go there and retrieve bones from the creature for our study?",o="从奥伯丁南面的海岸上收集海洋生物的骨头，然后带着骨头向奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛回复。",oEN="Recover Sea Creature Bones from the beached sea creature just south of Auberdine, and then return with it to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="这些生物是在最近才开始以如此令人震惊的数量在黑海岸登陆，我觉得这是某种不祥的征兆。到南边去弄些这种生物的骨头样本，这将有助于达纳苏斯对事态做出正确的评估！",pEN="It is only recently that these creatures started landing on the coast of Darkshore in such alarming numbers. I can't help but think that this is an ill omen of some sort. Recovering a sample of that creature's bones to the south would help us in Darnassus assess this situation!",c="我希望那些该死的鱼人没有在你收集的过程中带来太多的麻烦！我会让下一班飞往达纳苏斯的角鹰兽把这些骨头带过去。月神殿为我提供了一些用来寻求帮助的资金，请收下这些，以及我们的感激之情。\n\n你的成功让我印象深刻，如果你愿意的话，我将为你提供进一步为月神殿效力的机会。",cEN="I hope the murloc did not give you much trouble in collecting this for us! I will be sure to get this on the next hippogryph to Darnassus. The Temple of the Moon has given me some funds to hand out for assistance; please have some with our thanks.\n\nYour success here emboldens me to offer you a chance to aid the Temple of the Moon further, if you are interested..."}
Q[3525]={d="在入口附近有一尊令人毛骨悚然的石像，野猪人用它来烤熟食物。这些野兽……它们整日食用那些从贫瘠之地绑架来的生物。我可以封印这尊神像，使野猪人无法再次使用它，但是我需要你的帮助。我的计划是这样的，你保护我接近神像，之后我便开始进行仪式。在一段时间里，我几乎无法跟你沟通，更不用说保护自己了。当我在封印神像时，你必须保护我。如果野猪人击倒了我，那我们就都完了。\n\n你明白了吗？",dEN="Near the entrance is an idol that functions as a macabre oven for the Quilboar; the beasts... they literally consume their abductees from the Barrens. I can shut down the idol and bind them from using it again, but I need your aid in doing so. My plan: escort me to the idol. Once we arrive, I'll commence the ritual. I'll barely be able to communicate with you, let alone defend myself. Protect me while I shut down the idol. If they take me down, then it's all over for us.\n\nAre you with me?!",o="保护奔尼斯特拉兹来到剃刀高地的野猪人神像处。\n\n当他在进行仪式封印神像时保护他。",oEN="Escort Belnistrasz to the Quilboar's idol in Razorfen Downs.\n\nProtect Belnistrasz while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol.",c="贝尔尼斯特拉兹的突然离去留下了一盆燃烧的火盆。当你凝视火焰时，一只巨大的红龙影像充满了你的脑海。一个更加沙哑的贝尔尼斯特拉兹的声音直接对你说道：\n\n\"凡人们，你们确实是我所期望的英雄。多亏了你们，这些野兽犯下的屠杀已成为过去。我对你们这样的凡人的信心再次被唤醒了。收下这个吧，这是配得上英雄的奖赏。\"",cEN="Belnistrasz's sudden departure has left behind a burning brazier. As you stare in to the flame, the image of a great-winged red dragon fills your mind. A more graveled version of Belnistrasz's voice speaks directly to you.\n\n\"Indeed mortals, you are the heroes I had hoped you would be. Thanks to you the butchery these beasts were perpetrating is a thing of the past. My faith in mortals such as yourself has been once more renewed. Take this as a reward befitting of a hero.\""}
Q[3526]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，显然，地精工程学是所有明智的技师都会选择的一派，用华丽的高爆炸药和机械装置统治世界！\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习地精工程学，就把这个交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Expert engineering yields two distinct disciplines: gnome and goblin. Clearly, goblin engineering is the choice of all brilliant engineers. Learn to master the world through the judicious use of high explosives and fantastic gear!\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn about goblin engineering, then take it to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure this is what you want before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对地精工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",p="我可以在一里外闻到新技师的气味，就像我可以在一里外闻到炸药的气味一样。你是来揭开炸药的神秘面纱的吗？",pEN="I can smell fresh recruits much like I can an excellent blasting powder - from a mile away. Have you come seeking to learn about the mastery of the explosion?",c="很好，$n，你选择接受我的指导真是明智之举！随便什么蠢货都可以成为初级工程学的专家——那些地精跟他们那满是辐射的老窝就是最好的证据。要成为出色的地精工程学专家，你必须有坚强的意志和稳固的双手——（我得强调稳固二字）。\n\n竖起你的耳朵，$n，你会学到许多东西的。",cEN="Well <name>, you were wise to seek my tutelage! Any schlep can become an expert at the basics of engineering - the gnomes and their irradiated home of Gnomeregan are proof of that. It takes a strong mind and a steady hand (emphasis on STEADY) though to master the discipline of Goblin Engineering.\n\nKeep your ears perked <name>, and you might learn something."}
Q[3527]={d="摩沙鲁的古老预言中谈及获取神灵哈卡的灵魂精华的方法。这个方法被写在两块石板上，并被带到加基森西边的巨魔城市祖尔法拉克中。\n\n把摩沙鲁石板交给我！\n\n第一块石板在早已死去的巨魔殉教者塞卡那里。据说杀害他的凶手受到诅咒，都被变成了甲虫，正在他的神庙周围游荡。\n\n第二块石板在加兹瑞拉圣水池的水占师维蕾萨手中。\n\n得到石板之后，把它们交给我。",dEN="The ancient prophecy of Mosh'aru speaks of a way to contain the god Hakkar's essence. It was written on two tablets and taken to the troll city of Zul'Farrak, west of Gadgetzan.\n\nBring me the Mosh'aru tablets!\n\nThe first tablet is held by the long-dead troll Theka the Martyr. It is said his persecutors were cursed into scarabs and now scuttle about his shrine.\n\nThe second tablet is held by the hydromancer Velratha, near the sacred pool of Gahz'rilla.\n\nWhen you have the tablets, bring them to me.",o="将第一块和第二块摩沙鲁石板交给塔纳利斯的叶基亚。",oEN="Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",p="你拿到摩沙鲁的预言石板了吗，$n？\n\n等我获得石板后就可以进行研究，然后学习如何控制哈卡的精华！",pEN="Do you have the tablets of the Prophecy of Mosh'aru, <name>?\n\nWhen I gain the tablets, I will study them, and learn how to contain the essence of Hakkar!",c="啊，这太好了。我可以把这些远古石板组合在一起，研究它们隐藏的秘密了。\n\n我欠你的更多了，$n。未来还需要你的帮忙呢。",cEN="Ah, this is good. I can fuse these ancient tablets together, and then study their hidden secrets.\n\nMy debt to you grows, <name>. And it will grow further still."}
Q[3528]={d="现在是获取哈卡化身的精华的时候了。\n\n把哈卡之卵拿到悲伤沼泽的那座沉没的神庙中，在堕神圣地中使用卵的力量激怒死去的神灵。\n\n他将派出那些被称作“嗜血者”的奴仆对付你，杀掉它们，取出它们的哈卡莱血液，然后用这些血液熄灭包含哈卡灵魂能量的不灭火焰。当你熄灭所有的火焰时，哈卡的化身就可以进入我们的世界了。\n\n打败他，将他的精华封印在哈卡之卵中。",dEN="Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar.\n\nTake the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth. Invoke the egg's power to stir the dead god.\n\nHe will send his minions against you. Defeat his bloodrinkers and take their Hakkari blood, then use the blood to dowse the eternal flames that hold Hakkar's spirit. When all the flames go out, the avatar of Hakkar will enter our world.\n\nDefeat him, and place his essence within the egg of Hakkar.",o="将装满的哈卡之卵交给塔纳利斯的叶基亚。",oEN="Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",p="你打败了哈卡的化身了吗，$n？他的精华被封入我给你的卵中了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the avatar of Hakkar, <name>? Has his essence yet empowered the egg I gave you?",c="我收集到哈卡的精华了！现在这卵充满着生命！难道哈卡的神话是真的？\n\n这不能让它成真，要是哈卡获得重生，不知道他会做出什么事来呢。我将确保这颗卵的安全，不让它落入坏人之手。\n\n我给你的任务都完成了，$n。你经历了一场传奇，你的作为也许会改变我们的世界。",cEN="The essence of Hakkar has been collected! Even now the Egg stirs with life! Could the myths of Hakkar be true?\n\nThat must not be true, for it is then I fear what Hakkar may do if birthed again. I will keep this egg safe and be sure it does not fall into evil hands.\n\nYour labors with me are finished, <name>. You have touched a legend, and your actions may one day change the face of our world."}
Q[3541]={d="我在奥格瑞玛有个主顾，他住在暗巷区。如果你不熟悉那里，那么你是很难找到他的，不过如果你到那个区域中最高的那座建筑物里去，就应该能找到他。\n\n不过呢，你可别让全卡利姆多的人都知道他在哪里，他在干什么——这对咱们俩都没好处。\n\n为了这块辛耶尔石板，他会付给咱们一大笔钱的。我不知道他为什么如此在乎这块石板，不过你真该看看他听到这块石板的消息后有多激动。",dEN="I have a fence in Orgrimmar. He resides in The Drag. He's difficult to nail down if you don't know where to look, but if you go looking in one of the highest buildings there you should have no problem finding him.\n\nDo me a favor though, don't go shouting to all of Kalimdor that he's there and what his business is--it'd be bad for both of us.\n\nHe'll give us more than a fair price for the Tablet of Jin'yael. I'm not sure why, but you should have seen how excited he was to hear about its whereabouts.",o="将辛耶尔石板交给奥格瑞玛的杰斯雷蒙。",oEN="Bring the Tablet of Jin'yael to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar.",p="你有什么事？我今天有许多事情得处理，我没看到我的行程表里有你的名字。你要是想没事跑来烦我，我会特别为你“安排”的。",pEN="Yes, what you be needin', mon? I got many tings to be takin' care of today, and you not be on me agenda as one of them. Pester me, and I make sure that changes.",c="啊，杰迪加从艾萨拉送来了她的包裹。好极了，我正等着呢。\n\n杰迪加是个很好的女人……但也很危险。还有什么比这更好的？\n\n看看这个……石板保存的十分完好。你真是个好信差，$n。",cEN="Ahhh, Jediga be sendin' her package all the way from Azshara. Good. I be waitin' on this.\n\nJediga, now that be a fine woman... deadly too. What could be better?\n\nLook at this... the tablet be in perfect condition. You make a good messenger, <name>."}
Q[3542]={d="安德隆·甘特是我的下一个联系人。他通常待在幽暗城……就在药剂师区旁边。\n\n在谈到他要石板做什么时，他的嘴就没那么严了。看来幽暗城的一些法师正在研究高等精灵使用过的奥术法术。他们认为这块石板能帮上忙。玛克里擅长召唤生物，尤其是元素生物。\n\n把玛克里的石板带回去，然后回到我这里领取你那份报酬。",dEN="Andron Gant is my next contact. He usually holds himself up in the Undercity... right near the Apothecarium.\n\nHe was a little more loose-lipped when it came to speaking about what he wanted the Tablet for. Apparently some of the mages of Undercity are looking to study some of the arcane spells the highborne used. They think this tablet will help them. Markri was adept at summoning creatures; especially elementals.\n\nTake the Tablet of Markri and return to me for your part of the reward.",o="将玛科里石板交给幽暗城的安德隆·甘特。",oEN="Bring the Tablet of Markri to Andron Gant in Undercity.",p="哎呀……<hic>……真是个惊喜！一个冒冒冒冒险者……<hic>！\n\n我能为你做点啥……<hic>？",pEN="Well... ... isn't this a surprise? An adventurererere... !\n\nWhat c'n I do for you... ?",c="给，拿点钱去……给自己……<hic>……买件新护甲什么的……\n\n这能给合适的人……<hic>带来一两枚金币。",cEN="Here, take some coin... get yerself... ... some new armor or something....\n\nThis'll bring a shiny gold or two to the right... people."}
Q[3561]={d="最后这块石板要交给一个非常危险的家伙，$n。听着，比起我先前让你接触的那些人，我对他可以说是非常不信任的。\n\n大法师克希雷姆在艾萨拉的一处山顶上建了座高塔。他是个人类，但是他的行为跟我见过的……或是杀掉的那些人类大不相同。他充满了力量，我可不敢问他为什么想要这块石板。\n\n他来找过我，但是他跟我说，当我准备就绪时，他的侍卫萨纳斯会带我到塔里去。到北边去找萨纳斯吧。",dEN="This final tablet goes to someone very dangerous, <name>. Heed me when I tell you that I trust this person far less than anyone else I've asked you to meet with.\n\nArchmage Xylem has a tower up in the hills overlooking Azshara. He's human, but he acts like no human I've met... or killed. He exudes power, and I dare not ask him what he plans on doing with the tablet.\n\nHe came to me, but told me that his bodyguard Sanath would help me get to the tower when I was ready to meet him. Look north for Sanath.",o="将塞尔哈石板交给艾萨拉的大法师克希雷姆。",oEN="Bring the Tablet of Sael'hai to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.",p="我能帮上什么忙吗，$n？",pEN="What can help you with, <name>?",c="啊，塞尔哈石板……我是多么渴望能研究它呀。\n\n谢谢你，$n。告诉杰迪加，她做得很好。这东西的价值绝对符合她所要求的报酬啊！",cEN="Ah, the Tablet of Sael'hai... how long I've longed to study it.\n\nThank you, <name>. You may tell Jediga that she has done well. This will definitely be worth the payment she asked for."}
Q[3562]={d="把这张便笺交给杰迪加,告诉她当她回来的时候就到这儿来领取报酬。我对她的成绩很满意。\n\n快去吧，$n。告诉你的主人，我在这儿等她。",dEN="Take this note to Jediga. Tell her the payment will be here for her when she returns. And tell her I am pleased with her work.\n\nGo swiftly, <name>. Tell your master I will be awaiting her here.",o="将玛加萨的便笺交给艾萨拉的杰迪加。",oEN="Deliver Magatha's Note to Jediga in Azshara.",p="哦，玛加萨说什么了？那个老太婆……我敢打赌她根本不知道什么是礼貌。",pEN="Well, what did Magatha say? The old crone... I bet she was less than polite.",c="啊，好极了。她比我想象中的要通情达理多了……至少是对你来说。我本以为她会因为我的傲慢而惩罚你呢。她一定是非常想要那块石板，真有意思。\n\n下次再考虑这问题好了。",cEN="Ah, good. She was much more reasonable than I expected... at least towards you. I half expected her to have you punished for my insolence in sending someone in my place. She must really want that tablet. Interesting.\n\nSomething to ponder another time."}
Q[3563]={d="把这封信交给杰迪加，告诉她，我们的交易很成功，而且我对她很满意。\n\n让她马上返回奥格瑞玛，杰斯雷蒙会确保她的安全。\n\n也许将来我还需要你的帮助，$n。",dEN="Take this letter to Jediga. Let her know that our deal has been beneficial and I be pleased with her work.\n\nYou tell her she come back to Orgrimmar fast and Jes'rimon make sure he take good care of her.\n\nTell her that, and maybe in the future I have need of your services again, <name>.",o="将杰斯雷蒙的便笺交给艾萨拉的杰迪加。",oEN="Deliver Jes'rimon's Note to Jediga in Azshara.",p="你跟杰斯雷蒙谈过了吗？\n\n他跟其它巨魔比起来简直像头猪，但是他的资讯通常都很正确，而且他给的报酬也很丰厚。\n\n如果你能忍受他的态度，那么也许你能从他那赚一大笔钱。",pEN="Have you spoken to Jes'rimon yet?\n\nHe's a boar among trolls, but his information is usually accurate and his jobs well paying.\n\nIf you can stand his attitude then you stand to make some good coin from his business endeavors.",c="从他的字条看来他是欣喜若狂啊……高兴得有点过了头。\n\n也许有一天我要让他知道我是多么感谢他。哦，至少我们有理由在艾萨拉多停留一段时间了。\n\n这是你应得的那份酬劳。",cEN="I can see he was more than pleased by the looks of his note.... a little too pleased.\n\nPerhaps some day I'll take time to make sure he knows how much I appreciate his advances also. Well, at least there's one reason to look forward to spending more time in Azshara.\n\nHere's your share of our payment."}
Q[3564]={d="给……把这个……（打嗝）带给杰迪加。祝你好运！",dEN="Here... take... this to Jediga. Good luck to ya!",o="将安德隆的便笺交给艾萨拉的杰迪加。",oEN="Deliver Andron's Note to Jediga in Azshara.",p="你见到安德隆了吗？他很少离开幽暗城，我想你应该不难找到他。",pEN="Have you met with Andron yet? He rarely leaves Undercity, so I don't think it'd be too hard to find him.",c="太好了……等一下。\n\n哈哈！你把石板交给他的时候跟他说了什么，$n？他给了我们超额的报酬！我当然不是在抱怨，你告诉他这笔交易全额改变了吗？还是他又喝醉了？\n\n没关系……来，多的部分你也有份。",cEN="Perfect... wait a minute.\n\nHaha! What'd you tell him when you delivered the tablet, <name>? He overpaid us way too much! Not that I'm complaining. Did you tell him the deal changed? Or was he drunk again?\n\nDoesn't matter... here, take an extra share also."}
Q[3565]={d="什么？哦，你的报酬。当然。\n\n拿好了，赶快走吧。我想杰迪加正在耐心地等你回去呢。",dEN="What is it? Oh yes, your payment. Of course.\n\nTake this and be off with you. I'm sure Jediga is awaiting oh so patiently for your return.",o="将克希雷姆的便笺交给艾萨拉的杰迪加。",oEN="Deliver Xylem's Note to Jediga in Azshara.",p="嗯，克希雷姆说了些什么？他有没有对你做什么？他对你施法术了吗？或者强迫你为他做事了吗？",pEN="Well, what did Xylem have to say? He didn't do anything to you, did he? Cast a spell on you? Con you into doing work for him?",c="没问题？什么都没有做？好吧……我真希望他显露出几分不情愿来，或者至少是背弃我们的约定。嗯，也许我们可以信任他。\n\n好啦，没有必要细想了。这是你应得的那份，感谢你的帮助。",cEN="No problems? None at all? Well, that's something to be said... I expected him to show some sort of reluctance or to at least betray our deal. Hmm, maybe he can be trusted after all.\n\nWell, no need to dwell on it that much. Here's your share. Thank you for your help."}
Q[3566]={d="这……这……这是个陷阱。\n\n原谅……我。\n\n杀掉这个该死的混蛋……为我们杀掉他……为了索里奥斯。",dEN="It... It... It was all a trap.\n\nForgive... me.\n\nKill the traitor... Kill him for us... for Thorius.",o="杀死黑衣拉索里克和奥比斯顿，带着黑衣拉索里克的头颅和奥比斯顿的心脏回到铁炉堡的索里奥斯那儿。",oEN="Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion.",p="我不相信你！把证据拿出来！",pEN="I don't believe you! Show me proof!",c="<索里奥斯的脸变得惨白。>\n\n这……这不可能。我的兄弟？这一切都是他干的？\n\n<索里奥斯的脸孔因愤怒而扭曲了。>\n\n他背叛了我，背叛了铁炉堡！看来上古诸神在这些地方仍然有着巨大的影响力，令我害怕的是，如果我的兄弟——那个曾经高贵可敬的矮人，也会如此轻易地投靠拉格纳罗斯，那就没有人是安全可靠的了。",cEN="<Thorius' face turns white.>\n\nThis... this cannot be. My own brother? He set this all up?\n\n<Thorius' face contorts in anger.>\n\nHe betrayed me, he betrayed Ironforge! It seems as if the influence of the Old Gods is still strong in these lands. I fear that if my brother - a once noble and honorable man - was so easily turned to the will of Ragnaros, no one is safe."}
Q[3567]={c="你想从双子巨像中的一座顶上看看风景吗？因为我可以把你送上去，$r。\n\n不过你最好自己想想怎么下来。我提供的只是单程票。",cEN="Would you like to see the view atop one of the twin colossals? I can send you there, <race>.\n\nDo consider how you will get down, though. This is a one way trip only."}
Q[3568]={d="看见我后面的那个看上去随时都可能病倒的牛头人了吗？她前段时间去过艾萨拉。她说自己在经过埃达拉斯废墟时受到纳迦的攻击，而且负了伤。\n\n在击退一些纳迦之后，她在海滩休息了一下，并饮用了海潮之池中的水，现在她感觉有些恶心……\n\n我要找出她饮用的水。拿着这个盒子，我在里面放了一些空瓶子，用它们到各个海潮之池中收集一些水，然后回来。",dEN="See that tauren behind me--the one who looks like she's going to be ill at any moment? She was in Azshara recently. She claims she was wounded by some naga while making her way through the Ruins of Eldarath.\n\nAfter fighting off a few of them, she took a break on the beach and drank from one of the tide pools. Now she's feeling nauseous... among other things.\n\nI'd like to find out what she drank. Take this box, in it are some empty vials I labeled. Fill each at different pools and come back.",o="在艾萨拉的埃达拉斯废墟旁的海潮之池中收集4瓶水，然后回到药剂师科雷那儿。",oEN="Fill all 4 Empty Vials at the tide pools along the coast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara before returning to Chemist Cuely.",p="你知道她会怎么样吗，$n？她死定了……一看就知道。现在对她来说，最好的结果就是帮助我们找到治疗这种瘟疫的方法。她饮用的水也许能帮助我们。她早晚要死的——不如在死之前为我们做点贡献。你认为呢？",pEN="You know where this is leading, don't you, <name>? There's no way she can survive... look at her. The best thing for her now is to aid us in finding a cure for the plague. This water she drank might have a clue that helps us figure out how. She's going to die anyway--she might as well die doing something noble for our people before she does. Don't you agree?",c="棒极了。你在她死掉之前回来了，很好，很好。\n\n我们现在就开始吧。\n\n我一直在研究她的症状，情况相当不妙。不过令我惊讶的是她还活着。她呕吐过三四次，把这儿搞得一塌糊涂……味道真不好闻。\n\n给我一些时间，让我拿我们的……朋友……做个试验。",cEN="Wonderful. You're back before she died. Good, good.\n\nLet's get started on this then, shall we?\n\nI've been studying her symptoms for some time now, and it's quite ugly. I'm surprised she's still standing. She's vomited three or four times all over the place... quite a pleasant odor.\n\nGive me just a moment to put something together to test on our... friend."}
Q[3569]={d="把这个交给瑟尔萨。也许她可以痊愈……也许不能。反正要在她喝下后才能知道结果。",dEN="Give this to Thersa. Perhaps it will cure her... perhaps not. We really won't know until after she drinks it.",o="将科雷的药剂交给幽暗城的瑟尔萨·风歌。",oEN="Give Cuely's Elixir to Thersa Windsong in Undercity.",p="我听说幽暗城的炼金师长久以来一直在努力研究如何治愈自己的疾病，所以我来到了这里。据说他们也许能够帮助我。\n\n尽管我在这似乎不受欢迎，但是我别无选择——我受到疾病的煎熬，我急切需要他们的帮助。",pEN="I've come to Undercity because I heard their alchemists have been studying long and hard on how to find a cure for their own illness. It was suggested that perhaps they could help me too.\n\nAlthough this place makes me feel far from welcome, I had no choice--the sickness that found me is tearing me up inside and I needed their help immediately.",c="药剂师科雷对我非常友善……尽管这令我有些不安。如果他说这东西能帮我，那么我别无选择，我没有时间去寻找其它的解决方法了。我已经和牧师及萨满都谈过了，他们都无能为力。\n\n愿大地之母守护我的灵魂。",cEN="Chemist Cuely has been very accommodating... disturbingly so. But if he says this will help me, then I have no other choice. I don't have time to find any other solution. I've already spoken to priests and shamans, none of which could help me.\n\nLet us hope that the Earthmother watches over my spirit."}
Q[3570]={c="我从没有想过这瓶药剂可以如此快的发挥效果。谢谢你，$n。我会马上开始研究这些剩下的样品。我敢说它们不久之后就可供希尔瓦娜斯女士王和被遗忘者使用了。",cEN="I never dreamed the elixir would take hold that quickly. Thank you, <name>. I will get to work on the rest of these samples right away. I'm sure they'll be usable by the Lady Sylvanas and the Forsaken soon enough."}
Q[3601]={d="金贾尔，没错！！你知道金贾尔对血精灵来说是什么意思吗，$n？小老鼠……或者类似的东西。这群大恶霸！\n\n他们雇我帮忙在这一带侦察某种失落的宝藏。当然，一听到\"宝藏\"和他们愿意付的钱，我立刻就答应了，可结果他们却翻脸想杀我……杀我！\n\n这就说明，血精灵信不过。\n\n问题是我的装备还在他们手里，我拿不回来。能帮我一把吗？",dEN="Kim'jael indeed!! Do you know what Kim'jael means to the Blood elves, <name>? Little rat... or something like that. The big bullies!\n\nThey hired me to help them scout the area looking for some sort of lost treasures. Of course I jumped aboard the moment they said \"treasure\" and the amount they were willing to pay, but of course, they turned on me and tried to kill me... ME!\n\nGoes to show you, you can't trust a Blood elf.\n\nThe problem is, they still have my equipment and I can't get it back. Help me out?",o="搜索萨拉斯营地，找到基姆加尔的指南针、望远镜、烧鸡和花生，然后把它们交给艾萨拉的基姆加尔。",oEN="Search the Thalassian Base Camp for Kim'jael's Compass, Scope, Stuffed Chicken and Wizzlegoober, then return them to him in Azshara.",p="那些讨厌的血精灵。我告诉你，如果我和你一样强壮的话，我会去那里然后亲自好好教训一下他们！但我最好还是付钱给你请你帮我解决他们。",pEN="Those stinkin' Blood elves. I tell ya, if I was as strong as you are, I'd go down there and teach them a thing or two myself! But I'll have to settle with payin' you to take care of 'em for me.",c="哈哈！你给他们好看了，是不是？\n\n太好了！这给那些敢背叛伙伴的血精灵一个教训……特别是背叛像我这样忠诚的地精商人！去死吧，血精灵……\n\n好吧，我唯一能做的就是为你所花费的时间支付报酬……如同我所承诺的。\n\n拿去吧……这应该会对你有所帮助。",cEN="Haha! You got them good, didn't you?!\n\nThis is great! That'll teach those Blood elves to betray their partners... especially someone as loyal as a goblin merchant! Bah, Blood elves...!\n\nWell, the least I can do for you is pay you for your time... just like I said I would.\n\nHere you go... those should be useful."}
Q[3602]={d="艾萨拉南部地区的古代峭壁巨人以吞噬这个地区的岩石和建筑物为生。他们的排泄物具有高度的延展性和极其明显的水晶特性，所以被称作艾萨拉水晶。\n\n这种东西主要在南部地区出现，但是由于那些巨人的暴力倾向，通常你很难得到它们。\n\n你必需到艾萨拉南部去，收集足够多的艾萨拉水晶来制作武器的主体部分。我的地狱犬会帮助你收集水晶的。",dEN="The ancient cliff giants of the southern region of Azshara consume the rock and buildings of the land for sustenance. The excrement from their consumption is a highly malleable and extremely strong crystal known as Azsharite.\n\nThe formations litter the southern arc, but few are ever recovered due to the extremely violent nature of the giants.\n\nYou are to venture south and recover enough of the Azsharite for the creation of the weapon's body. My felhounds will aid in the recovery of the crystal.",o="从艾萨拉南部取回二十块结晶艾萨拉石。你可以让地狱犬帮你嗅出那些巧妙隐藏的矿藏的位置。任务完成后回到洛拉姆斯那里。|n\n\n",oEN="Recover twenty Crystallized Azsharite from southern Azshara. You may use the Felhound to assist you in 'sniffing' out the location of cleverly hidden deposits.\n\nReturn to Loramus when the task is complete.",p="邪恶从不休息，$g蠢货:蠢货;。等你最终$g死了:死了;，有的是时间休息。现在，把那些水晶给我拿来。",pEN="Evil does not sleep, fool. You will have time for rest when you are finally dead. Now, bring me those crystals.",c="你在艾萨拉的任务已经完成了，$r。现在我必须为你的下一步冒险铸造必需的东西。",cEN="Your tasks in Azshara are complete, mortal. I must now forge the necessary components for the next step in your adventure."}
Q[3621]={d="下一步就是铸造武器了。你必须把淬火过的艾萨拉水晶交给一个有能力操纵恶魔能量的铁匠。\n\n在荆棘谷就有这样的一个铁匠——他就是加尔文，秘银会的领袖。他会按照你的要求打造武器，到祖尔格拉布和莫什奥格食人魔山之间的区域去寻找他的营地吧。\n\n愿你的决心和信念引领你度过这场考验。如果你失败了，你的神会对你微笑。去吧，$r。",dEN="The weapons are ready to be forged. You must take the tempered azsharite to one with the ability to harness fel energy.\n\nIn Stranglethorn Vale such a blacksmith exists. Galvan the Ancient, leader of the Mithril Order, will craft the weapons to your specifications. You will find his encampment between Zul'Gurub and the Mosh'Ogg ogre mound.\n\nMay your determination and faith carry you through this ordeal. Should you fail, know that your God smiles down upon you, mortal.",o="把货物交给荆棘谷的加尔文。",oEN="Take the Shipment to Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="洛拉姆斯？我上次听到这个名字已经是许多年前的事了。",pEN="Loramus, eh? It has been many years since I have heard that name.",c="我的老天，我简直不敢想象你为了这些原料都经历了什么样的磨难。几乎没有人能进入艾萨拉然后活着回来，更不用说那些挑战半神和巨人的家伙了！",cEN="My goodness, I can only imagine what you went through to get these materials. Few venture into Azshara and return alive, let alone those that face demi-gods and giants!"}
Q[3625]={d="$n，铸造每一件武器都需要一些时间。\n\n此外，你每三分钟只能使用一次魔咒之力。它削弱污染者拉瑟莱克及其爪牙的效果，持续时间并不固定。这就是为什么你必须在恰当的时机释放魔咒！\n\n现在给我一点时间为你打造武器，$n。|n",dEN="<name>, the creation of each weapon will take some time.\n\nAdditionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration. This is why you must release the Felcurse only when the moment is right!\n\nNow give me a moment to craft your weapon, <name>.",o="等待加尔文为你锻造武器。",oEN="Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",p="如果打断锻造的过程，那么我打造出来的武器就是不完美的。请耐心一些，$n。",pEN="To interrupt the forging process could result in an imperfect weapon. Be patient, <name>.",c="<加尔文擦了擦他额头上的汗。>\n\n没有比这更能对付恶魔的武器了，$n。",cEN="<Galvan wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nA finer demon slayer has never existed, <name>."}
Q[3626]={d="救赎的时刻临近了，$n。你必须带着新铸的武器回到诅咒之地，与部落的堕落英雄交谈，他会告诉你最终的目标。|n",dEN="The hour of redemption is near, <name>. You must return to the Blasted Lands with your new-found weaponry and speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde to receive your final objective.",o="回到部落英雄的灵魂那里。",oEN="Return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde at Splinterspear Junction in Swamp of Sorrows.",c="你看起来历经了战火的洗礼，$n。你$g准备好:准备好;面对拉瑟莱克和他的爪牙了吗？",cEN="You look battle hardened, <name>. Are you prepared to face Razelikh and his minions?"}
Q[3627]={d="要接近污染者，你必须先摧毁三巨头并取回护符的碎片。当你集齐三块碎片后，回到我这里，我会给你进一步的指示。\n\n去吧，$n！去诅咒之地！塞维因、阿利斯塔兹和格罗尔都必须倒下！|n",dEN="To reach the Defiler, you must first destroy the triad of power and recover the amulet pieces. When you recover all three pieces, return to me and I shall give you further instruction.\n\nGo <name>! To the Blasted Lands! Sevine, Allistarj, and Grol must fall!",o="杀死毁灭者格罗尔、塞维因女士和大法师阿利斯塔兹。从他们的尸体上取下格罗尔护符、塞维因护符和阿利斯塔兹护符。\n\n记住要使用你那些附魔艾萨拉石魔化武器来削弱三巨头。否则他们根本无法被杀死——但要谨慎使用……|n",oEN="Slay Grol the Destroyer, Lady Sevine, and Archmage Allistarj. From their corpses take the Amulet of Grol, the Amulet of Sevine, and the Amulet of Allistarj.\n\nRemember to USE your Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry to weaken the triad. They cannot be killed otherwise - but use them wisely...",p="三位一体，前方的通路已经敞开。",pEN="The three shall form the one, the one shall light the way.",c="“污染者”拉瑟莱克的护符再次合并了，但是拉瑟莱克已经意识到他手下的爪牙出了问题。他知道你即将去挑战他……",cEN="The amulet of Razelikh the Defiler is once again complete but he senses the disruption in his chain of command. He knows you come for him..."}
Q[3628]={d="拉瑟莱克的巢穴位于诅咒之地最高山的山顶。唯一上去的办法是使用山附近的传送符文。只要你持有护符，就能自由地传送到巢穴。到达巢穴后，你必须召唤那头野兽。护符就是你的钥匙，$n。在污染者祭坛上使用它。\n\n如果你能击败污染者，就把他的角带回来。它将成为所有目睹它的人的希望象征——证明在这个饱经战火摧残的世界里，英雄确实存在。|n",dEN="Razelikh's lair is atop the highest mountain in the Blasted Lands. The only way to the lair is through the use of the teleport runes near the mountain. As long as you hold the amulet, you can freely transport up to the lair. Once you reach the lair, you must conjure the beast. The amulet is your key, <name>. Use it on the Altar of the Defiler.\n\nShould you defeat the Defiler, bring back his horn. It will become a symbol of hope for all that view it - proof that heroes do exist in this war torn world.",o="摧毁污染者拉瑟莱克，把割下的污染者之角交给部落的堕落英雄。你还必须归还污染者结界，好让堕落英雄将其摧毁，以免它落入不该持有它的人手中。|n",oEN="Destroy Razelikh the Defiler and return the Severed Horn of the Defiler to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. You will also need to return the Ward of the Defiler so that the Fallen Hero can destroy it, preventing it from ever falling into the wrong hands.",p="没有什么可害怕的了。",pEN="There is nothing left to fear.",c="今天是一个值得我们铭记的日子，诅咒之地的恶魔领主终于被击败了！",cEN="Today is a day that will be remembered for all eternity. The demonic overlord of the Blasted Lands has finally fallen!"}
Q[3629]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，请注意我提到地精工程学的唯一原因是因为我是个公正的训练师。他们喜欢制造一些会爆炸的东西，而且丝毫不关心有什么东西会被炸到——即使是他们自己。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习把自己炸上天的方法，就把这个交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Expert engineering yields two distinct disciplines: gnome and goblin. I only bother to mention goblin engineering because I'm a fair trainer. They like to make things that blow up, and they rarely care what is in the way - even themselves.\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn how to blow yourself up, then take it to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure this is what you want before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对地精工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",p="我可以在一里外闻到新技师的气味，就像我可以在一里外闻到炸药的气味一样。你是来揭开炸药的神秘面纱的吗？",pEN="I can smell fresh recruits much like I can an excellent blasting powder - from a mile away. Have you come seeking to learn about the mastery of the explosion?",c="好吧，$n，你选择这条道路真是明智之极！随便什么蠢货都可以成为初级工程学的专家——那些侏儒跟他们那满是辐射的老窝就是铁一样的证据。要成为出色的地精工程学专家，你必须有坚强的意志和稳固的双手——在这里我不得不强调稳固二字。\n\n竖起你的耳朵来好好听着，$n，你会学到许多东西的。",cEN="Well <name>, you were wise to seek my tutelage! Any schlep can become an expert at the basics of engineering - the gnomes and their irradiated home of Gnomeregan are proof of that. It takes a strong mind and a steady hand (emphasis on STEADY) though to master the discipline of Goblin Engineering.\n\nKeep your ears perked <name>, and you might learn something."}
Q[3630]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，虽然我认为提到侏儒简直是浪费时间，但是你还是要对他们的技术保持警惕。他们制造了一大堆号称可以改变世界的小玩意，但是那些东西很少有能用的。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习永远都派不上用场的垃圾，就把这个交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Engineering at the expert level breaks into two disciplines: gnome and goblin. Gnome engineering represents by far the superior of the two! It's about the construction of wonderful gadgets and devices that make life better!\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn more on gnome engineering, then take that manual to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure you are sure before finishing his task!",o="如果你想要对侏儒工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",p="嗯嗯，你有什么事要我帮忙吗？很显然，我有的是时间，因为我的家乡现在正笼罩在一片辐射云里，而我却站在这里无所事事。",pEN="Yes, yes, what needs of yours might I address today? Clearly, I have the time to do such since all I do is stand here while our beloved city lies in a cloud of irradiated death.",c="啊，一个追寻工程学真谛的年轻工程师，一个探求侏儒工程学奥秘的求知者！好吧，我的朋友，请原谅我的敏感和激动。我们现在的情况仍然十分糟糕，但是有你这样对工程学的真知孜孜以求的技师加入我们的行列，这仍然是让我很高兴的！",cEN="Ah, a young engineer interested in pursuing the one, true discipline of engineering! Well forgive my melodrama, friend. While our situation remains dire, it still is always a good day to see another engineer respond to the clarion call of true engineering!"}
Q[3632]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，虽然我认为提到侏儒简直是浪费时间，但是你还是要对他们的技术保持警惕。他们制造了一大堆号称可以改变世界的小玩意，但是那些东西很少有能用的。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习永远都派不上用场的垃圾，就把这个交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Engineering at the expert level breaks into two disciplines: gnome and goblin. Gnome engineering represents by far the superior of the two! It's about the construction of wonderful gadgets and devices that make life better!\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn more on gnome engineering, then take that manual to Tinkmaster Overspark here in Ironforge. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure you are sure before finishing his task!",o="如果你想要对侏儒工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",p="嗯嗯，你有什么事要我帮忙吗？很显然，我有的是时间，因为我的家乡现在正笼罩在一片辐射云里，而我却站在这里无所事事。",pEN="Yes, yes, what needs of yours might I address today? Clearly, I have the time to do such since all I do is stand here while our beloved city lies in a cloud of irradiated death.",c="啊，一个追寻工程学真谛的年轻工程师，一个探求侏儒工程学奥秘的求知者！好吧，我的朋友，请原谅我的敏感和激动。我们现在的情况仍然十分糟糕，但是有你这样对工程学的真知孜孜以求的技师加入我们的行列，这仍然是让我很高兴的！",cEN="Ah, a young engineer interested in pursuing the one, true discipline of engineering! Well forgive my melodrama, friend. While our situation remains dire, it still is always a good day to see another engineer respond to the clarion call of true engineering!"}
Q[3633]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，显然，地精工程学是所有明智的技师都会选择的一派，用华丽的高爆炸药和机械装置统治世界！\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习地精工程学，就把这个交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Expert engineering yields two distinct disciplines: gnome and goblin. Clearly, goblin engineering is the choice of all brilliant engineers. Learn to master the world through the judicious use of high explosives and fantastic gear!\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn about goblin engineering, then take it to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure this is what you want before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对地精工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",p="我可以在一里外闻到新技师的气味，就像我可以在一里外闻到炸药的气味一样。你是来揭开炸药的神秘面纱的吗？",pEN="I can smell fresh recruits much like I can an excellent blasting powder - from a mile away. Have you come seeking to learn about the mastery of the explosion?",c="好吧，$n，你选择这条道路真是明智之极！随便什么蠢货都可以成为初级工程学的专家——那些侏儒跟他们那满是辐射的老窝就是铁一样的证据。要成为出色的侏儒工程学专家，你必须有坚强的意志和稳固的双手——在这里我不得不强调稳固二字。\n\n竖起你的耳朵来好好听着，$n，你会学到许多东西的。",cEN="Well <name>, you were wise to seek my tutelage! Any schlep can become an expert at the basics of engineering - the gnomes and their irradiated home of Gnomeregan are proof of that. It takes a strong mind and a steady hand (emphasis on STEADY) though to master the discipline of Goblin Engineering.\n\nKeep your ears perked <name>, and you might learn something."}
Q[3634]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，虽然我认为提到侏儒简直是浪费时间，但是你还是要对他们的技术保持警惕。他们制造了一大堆号称可以改变世界的小玩意，但是那些东西很少有能用的。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习永远都派不上用场的垃圾，就把这个交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Engineering at the expert level breaks into two disciplines: gnome and goblin. While I think it is a waste, you should be aware of gnome specialization. They make items and gadgets that claim to change the world, but rarely often work.\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you wish to learn how to make metal paper weights, then take that manual to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure you are sure before finishing his task!",o="如果你想要对侏儒工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",p="嗯嗯，你有什么事要我帮忙吗？很显然，我有的是时间，因为我的家乡现在正笼罩在一片辐射云里，而我却站在这里无所事事。",pEN="Yes, yes, what needs of yours might I address today? Clearly, I have the time to do such since all I do is stand here while our beloved city lies in a cloud of irradiated death.",c="啊，一个追寻工程学真谛的年轻工程师，一个探求侏儒工程学奥秘的求知者！好吧，我的朋友，请原谅我的敏感和激动。我们现在的情况仍然十分糟糕，但是有你这样对工程学的真知孜孜以求的技师加入我们的行列，这仍然是让我很高兴的！",cEN="Ah, a young engineer interested in pursuing the one, true discipline of engineering! Well forgive my melodrama, friend. While our situation remains dire, it still is always a good day to see another engineer respond to the clarion call of true engineering!"}
Q[3635]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，虽然我认为提到侏儒简直是浪费时间，但是你还是要对他们的技术保持警惕。他们制造了一大堆号称可以改变世界的小玩意，但是那些东西很少有能用的。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习永远都派不上用场的垃圾，就把这个交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Engineering at the expert level breaks into two disciplines: gnome and goblin. While I think it is a waste, you should be aware of gnome specialization. They make items and gadgets that claim to change the world, but rarely work.\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you wish to learn how to make metal paper weights, then take the manual to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure you are sure before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对侏儒工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",p="你好啊！如果你是来跟我说导航机器人坠毁在你家房顶上之类的事情，那么请去找我的律师。如果不是，请问找我有什么事？",pEN="Hello there! If you've come about a homing robot that may have smashed through a wall of your domicile, then I will refer you to my barrister in advance. Otherwise, what can I do for you today?",c="你是来学习侏儒工程学的？好吧，你算是找对侏儒了。虽然诺莫瑞根当局可以用政治的手段来放逐那些智商比他们高的天才，但是他们也知道，知识是他们无法控制的！\n\n他们和我都很清楚，自从我离开诺莫瑞根之后，他们就失去了一个有史以来最伟大的工程师！如果你是个合格的学生，那么我会将我的知识倾囊相传。",cEN="You've come to learn about gnome engineering, eh? Well, you've come to the right gnome. While the ruling faction of Gnomeregan may use politics to ostracize those they view as an intellectual threat, they know that knowledge is something they cannot control.\n\nThey and I both know that when I left Gnomeregan, they lost one of their greatest gnome engineers alive today. If you're a capable student, I'll teach you what I know."}
Q[3636]={d="亡灵天灾对联盟是一个长期的威胁，我想你应该明白这一点。最近，我们偶然发现了一些罕见的东西，$n。\n\n在贫瘠之地有一片令人恐怖的灌木林，它被称作剃刀高地。虽然那儿曾经是野猪人的家，但是很明显，它已经变成亡灵天灾的地盘，并衍生出了更加可怕的生物……这些生物都被巫妖寒冰之王亚门纳尔统治着。\n\n愿圣光与你同在，$n。终结那里的邪恶吧。",dEN="The Scourge is a persistent threat to the Alliance, a fact I am sure you know quite well. Recently, we have come across some very peculiar findings, <name>.\n\nIn the Barrens lies a horrid tangle of briars called Razorfen Downs. While once it was the home of simple quilboar, now it has become apparent that a pact was made with the Scourge, creating creatures far worse... They are now ruled by the lich, Amnennar the Coldbringer.\n\nAlign yourself with the Light, <name>; put an end to this evil union.",o="大主教本尼迪塔斯要你去杀死剃刀高地的寒冰之王亚门纳尔。",oEN="Archbishop Bendictus wants you to slay Amnennar the Coldbringer in Razorfen Downs.",p="你必须杀死亚门纳尔。快点去吧。",pEN="Amnennar must be eradicated. Go, swiftly.",c="谢谢你，$n。天灾军团在疯狂扩张之前得再三考虑了。\n\n愿圣光保佑你。",cEN="Thank you , <name>. The Scourge will now think twice before attempting to bolster its ranks again.\n\nMay you be blessed by the Light."}
Q[3637]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，虽然我认为提到侏儒简直是浪费时间，但是你还是要对他们的技术保持警惕。他们制造了一大堆号称可以改变世界的小玩意，但是那些东西很少有能用的。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习永远都派不上用场的垃圾，就把这个交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Engineering at the expert level breaks into two disciplines: gnome and goblin. While I think it is a waste, you should be aware of gnome specialization. They make items and gadgets that claim to change the world, but rarely work.\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you wish to learn how to make metal paper weights, then take the manual to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure you are sure before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对侏儒工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Gnome Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",p="你好啊！如果你是来跟我说导航机器人坠毁在你家房顶上之类的事情，那么请去找我的律师。如果不是，请问找我有什么事？",pEN="Hello there! If you've come about a homing robot that may have smashed through a wall of your domicile, then I will refer you to my barrister in advance. Otherwise, what can I do for you today?",c="你是来学习侏儒工程学的？好吧，你算是找对侏儒了。虽然诺莫瑞根当局可以用政治的手段来放逐那些智商比他们高的天才，但是他们也知道，知识是他们无法控制的！\n\n他们和我都很清楚，自从我离开诺莫瑞根之后，他们就失去了一个有史以来最伟大的工程师！如果你是个合格的学生，那么我会将我的知识倾囊相传。",cEN="You've come to learn about gnome engineering, eh? Well, you've come to the right gnome. While the ruling faction of Gnomeregan may use politics to ostracize those they view as an intellectual threat, they know that knowledge is something they cannot control.\n\nThey and I both know that when I left Gnomeregan, they lost one of their greatest gnome engineers alive today. If you're a capable student, I'll teach you what I know."}
Q[3639]={d="你眼中的光芒说明了一切；你想炸点东西。你有初露头角的才华，$n，但我想看看你的作品样品，好研究一下如何引导你掌握更偏向地精风格的技术。我需要以下东西：二十个大型铁炸弹、二十根实心炸药和五只爆炸羊——而且要保持保险装置开启！\n\n把这些东西交给我，你就能成为$g正式的:正式的;地精工程师！",dEN="The gleam in your eye tells me everything; you want to blow things up. You have budding talent, <name>, but I'd like to get some samples of your work so I might examine it for ways to emphasize goblin-oriented techniques. I'll need the following: twenty big iron bombs, twenty sticks of solid dynamite, and five explosive sheep - and keep the safeties armed!\n\nSubmit these items to me and you'll be an official goblin engineer!",o="将20颗重磅铁制炸弹、20颗实心炸弹和5只自爆绵羊交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。",oEN="Bring 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 Solid Dynamite, and 5 Explosive Sheep to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",p="一旦我收到你制作的物品并检查完毕之后，我就会教最后一些知识，好让你要加入我们地精工程师这个严格小团体！",pEN="Once I receive your crafted engineering items for my review, I will hand you a genuine Goblin Engineer Membership Card! So long as the card is valid, you will have unlimited access to any goblin engineer trainer anywhere in the world.",c="这是你的第一张地精工程师协会会员卡！\n\n这张卡的会费已预付了十四天；所有会员卡在有效期两周后都会过期。到期后，向任何地精工程学训练师缴纳会费即可换领新卡；没有会员卡，你的会员资格将暂时失效，也就无法学习新的图纸。\n\n这绝不会影响你已掌握的知识。一旦成为地精工程师，就永远是地精工程师。",cEN="Here is your first Goblin Engineer Membership Card!\n\nThis card has its dues paid for in advance for fourteen days; all cards expire after two weeks of activity. When it does, pay your next set of dues to any goblin engineer trainer in order to get another card; without the card, your membership will temporarily lapse and you cannot access new schemata.\n\nThis never affects what you already know; once a goblin engineer, always a goblin engineer."}
Q[3641]={d="如果你准备好制造一些真正奇妙的装置，那你就来对地方了。我看得出你是个熟练的工程师，但我想看看你的作品样品。我希望做的是分析你的手艺，以便在你未来的工作中突出侏儒风格的技术。我需要以下样品：六根秘银管、一个精确瞄准镜和两个高级活动假人。\n\n把这些东西交给我，你就能成为$g正式的:正式的;侏儒工程师，并获得所有图纸的使用权！",dEN="If you're ready to make some truly fantastic devices, then you've come to the right place. And I can see you're a skilled engineer, but I want some samples of your work. What I hope to do though is to analyze your craftmanship for ways to emphasize gnome-oriented techniques in your future efforts. I need the following samples: six mithril tubes, an accurate scope, and two advanced target dummies.\n\nSubmit these items to me and you'll be an official gnomish engineer with access to all the schematics!",o="将6根秘银管、1只精确瞄准镜和2个高级假人交给铁炉堡的工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。",oEN="Bring 6 Mithril Tubes, an Accurate Scope, and 2 Advanced Target Dummies to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.",p="一旦我收到你制作的物品并检查完毕之后，你就可以成为受认可的侏儒工程师，你可以不受限制地拜访世界上任何地方的任何侏儒工程学训练师。",pEN="Once I receive your crafted engineering items for my review, I will hand you a genuine Gnome Engineer Membership Card! So long as the card is valid, you will have unlimited access to any gnome engineer trainer anywhere in the world.",c="这是你的第一张侏儒工程师协会会员卡。\n\n它在两周后过期；续期请缴纳会费。如果你没有会员卡，就无法继续学习，直到重新办理为止。\n\n但你学过的东西不会忘记；侏儒工程学就像骑自行车一样。",cEN="Here is your first Gnome Engineer Membership Card!\n\nThis card has its dues paid for in advance for fourteen days; all cards expire after two weeks of activity. When it does, pay your next set of dues to any gnome engineer trainer in order to get another card; without the card, your membership will temporarily lapse and you cannot access new schemata.\n\nThis never affects what you already know; once a gnome engineer, always a gnome engineer."}
Q[3643]={d="如果你准备好制造一些真正奇妙的装置，那你就来对地方了。我看得出你是个熟练的工程师，但我想看看你的作品样品。我希望做的是分析你的手艺，以便在你未来的工作中突出侏儒风格的技术。我需要以下样品：六根秘银管、一个精确瞄准镜和两个高级活动假人。\n\n把这些东西交给我，你就能成为$g正式的:正式的;侏儒工程师，并获得所有图纸的使用权！",dEN="If you're ready to make some truly fantastic devices, then you've come to the right place. And I can see you're a skilled engineer, but I want some samples of your work. What I hope to do though is to analyze your craftmanship for ways to emphasize gnome-oriented techniques in your future efforts. I need the following samples: six mithril tubes, an accurate scope, and two advanced target dummies.\n\nSubmit these items to me and you'll be an official gnomish engineer with access to all the schematics!",o="将6根秘银管、1只精确瞄准镜和2个高级假人交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。",oEN="Bring 6 Mithril Tubes, an Accurate Scope, and a 2 Advanced Target Dummies to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",p="在我收到你制作的物品并检查完毕之后，我就会给你发放一张真正的侏儒工程师协会会员卡！在这张卡片的有效期内，你可以不受限制地拜访世界上任何地方的任何侏儒工程学训练师。",pEN="Once I receive your crafted engineering items for my review, I will hand you a genuine Gnome Engineer Membership Card! So long as the card is valid, you will have unlimited access to any gnome engineer trainer anywhere in the world.",c="这是你的第一张侏儒工程师协会会员卡！\n\n这张卡片中包含14天的费用，两周过后，这张卡就会到期。届时你可以到任何侏儒工程学训练师那儿缴付一定的费用，换得另一张卡片。如果没有卡片，你的会员身份就会暂时失效，同时你也无法从我们这里学习新的结构图。\n\n这对你已经学会的东西毫无影响，一旦成为侏儒工程师，你就终身都是侏儒工程师啦。",cEN="Here is your first Gnome Engineer Membership Card!\n\nThis card has its dues paid for in advance for fourteen days; all cards expire after two weeks of activity. When it does, pay your next set of dues to any gnome engineer trainer in order to get another card; without the card, your membership will temporarily lapse and you cannot access new schemata.\n\nThis never affects what you already know; once a gnome engineer, always a gnome engineer."}
Q[3661]={d="枭兽是难以预测的生物，$n。它们有着极端温顺的一面，如果它们重视的东西受到威胁，这些生物就会变得非常凶猛。\n\n传说这些野兽是由艾露恩创造的，我对这种说法的真伪很感兴趣。\n\n近来，我听说辛特兰的枭兽数量越来越多——这些凶残、原始、野蛮的家伙在辛特兰的野外四处横行。你能帮我收集一些枭兽的羽毛吗？",dEN="Wildkin are quite unpredictable creatures, <name>. Capable of incredible gentleness, these creatures will show extreme ferocity if something they deem important is threatened.\n\nThese beasts are rumored to have been created by Elune, and I am interested in finding if this is really the truth.\n\nRecently, I heard about a population of wildkin living in the Hinterlands -- Vicious, Primitive, and Savage Owlbeasts. They can be found amongst the wildlife there. Will you gather some wildkin feathers for me?",o="为鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀收集15支枭兽羽毛。",oEN="Collect 15 Wildkin Feathers from the Hinterlands for Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.",p="如果可以的话，尽量避开它们，。枭兽可能会把你的好奇误认为有伤害它们的意图……",pEN="Try to avoid them if you can, <name>. The Wildkin may misread your interest as an intent to do them harm...",c="谢谢你为我带来了这些，$n。\n\n你对枭兽有进一步的了解了吗？\n\n也许这些羽毛包含着我们想要知道的资讯。它们是凶残的怪物，还是被误导的宠物？我想知道真相……\n\n我将继续进行研究——请过一段时间再回来跟我谈谈。",cEN="Thank you for bringing these to me, <name>.\n\nWhat did you learn of the Wildkin?\n\nPerhaps these feathers will tell us more. Ferocious monsters, or simply misguided pets? One day I'd like to know the truth...\n\nI am going to continue my research -- please come back and talk to me again after some time has passed."}
Q[3681]={d="很抱歉打断你的旅程，$r，但我想你应该知道，暴风城最近传来消息，要求圣骑士们回去接受训练。\n\n如果我不是知道这不可能，我会说你快要迎来该研读圣典的特殊时刻了。\n\n去暴风城找杜索瑞安·雷尔。他通常在光明大教堂训练圣骑士。",dEN="Sorry to interrupt your travels, <race>, but I thought you should know that word was sent from Stormwind recently asking that paladins report there for training.\n\nIf I didn't know any better, I'd say your close to reaching a special time and it's time you started studying the Tomes.\n\nLook for Duthorian Rall in Stormwind. He usually trains paladins in the Cathedral of Light.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩-拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到光明大教堂，$c。",cEN="Welcome to the Cathedral of Light, <class>."}
Q[3701]={d="到燃烧平原的索瑞森废墟中去尽可能多地收集情报。\n\n据说那里散布着许多神秘的上古遗物，也许你可以在那里搜寻一番，$n。小心在那里保护着废墟的索瑞森的刺客们。",dEN="Venture to the smoldering ruins of Thaurissan in the Burning Steppes and gather as much information as possible.\n\nIt is said that mysterious relics litter the ruins. Perhaps you should start your search there, <name>. Beware the Thaurissan guardians: Assassins that guard the ruins, keeping whatever secrets may still be buried there protected.",o="到燃烧平原的索瑞森废墟中去，从索瑞森遗物上搜集信息。当你收集到足够的信息之后，就回到皇家历史学家阿克瑟努斯那里。",oEN="Venture to the Ruins of Thaurissan in the Burning Steppes and recover information from the Thaurissan Relics. Return to Royal Historian Archesonus when you have recovered the information.",p="你带来什么新的消息没有？",pEN="Do you bring new information?",c="哦，我的天啊！这些资讯解释了很多关于索瑞森的事情。\n\n我们还有很多需要了解的东西！",cEN="Oh my! This information explains quite a lot about Thaurissan.\n\nThere is much more to learn!"}
Q[3702]={d="你愿意听听黑铁矮人的简要历史吗？",dEN="Would you like to hear a brief history of the Dark Iron dwarves?",o="听皇家历史学家阿克瑟努斯讲述索瑞森的历史。",oEN="Listen to Royal Historian Archesonus recant the history of Thaurissan.",p="请听我讲完索瑞森的历史。",pEN="Allow me to finish telling you the story of Thaurissan.",c="我们可以继续进行下一步了吗？",cEN="Shall we proceed?"}
Q[3721]={c="你帮我找回了三个OOX导航机器人！这简直帮了我的大忙，所以我要送你一件特殊的礼物以表谢意。这是一个迷你版的OOX导航机器人，你一定已经很熟悉而且很喜欢它们了！\n\n我一般不会把这种高精度的装置送给别人，但是你确实帮了我不少忙。另外，这个机器人的战斗模组和导航逻辑模组都已经被掩码掉了。\n\n除此之外，这是一个绝不缩水的OOX机器人！",cEN="You've recovered three of my OOX homing robots! You've gone above and beyond what you needed to, so I will give you something special for all your help. It is a miniature version of the very same robot that you have come to know and love, the OOX!\n\nI normally wouldn't let anyone have such a potentially lethal device, but you've been a real help. Besides - the combat mechanisms and the homing logic on this one have been disabled.\n\nOther than that, it's an OOX by golly!"}
Q[3741]={d="我朋友希拉里的项链丢了，我们怎么都找不到。我们一整天都在这儿钓鱼，已经把周围都找遍了。我认为它只可能是落到湖里去了。我们的父母不让我们在湖里游泳……我妈妈说水下有一些可怕的生物，但是你好像不怕那些东西。\n\n你去帮她找到项链，好吗？",dEN="My friend Hilary lost her necklace, and we can't find it. We've been fishing all day right here, and we looked around here already. The only thing I can think of is that it fell into the lake. Our parents don't want us to swim in the lake... my mom says there's some mean things underwater, but you look like you aren't scared of mean things.\n\nCould you find it for her, please?",o="找到希拉里的项链，将其还给湖畔镇的希拉里。",oEN="Find Hilary's Necklace, and return it to Hilary in Lakeshire.",p="你好。我很想我的项链！是我爸爸送我的。爸爸说湖水中有怪兽，你打败它们了吗？",pEN="Hi. I miss my necklace. My daddy got it for me. Daddy says that there are monsters in the lake. Did you beat up any monsters?",c="谢谢你帮我找到项链，$c$g先生:小姐……你可真好！我的小猫也感谢你——对吗，喵喵？",cEN="Thank you for finding my necklace mister <class>... you are very kind! My kitty thanks you too - isn't that right Effsee?"}
Q[3761]={d="据说安戈洛环形山的土壤富含强大的魔法特质，因此塞纳里奥议会想大量研究它；去安戈洛的荒野中采集足够的样本，好让我们继续研究。\n\n肥沃的土壤会时不时成堆地冒出来，那里的野兽身上也可能带有可用的样本。你只需寻找那些土堆，并$g留心:留心;那些牛头人，然后把所有东西都带给盖德。他是一片好心，但你最好别惹他发火！",dEN="The soil of Un'Goro Crater is reportedly enriched with potent magical qualities. The Cenarion Circle wants to study this soil in large quantities; go into the wilds of Un'Goro and acquire enough of it for our continued research.\n\nThe rich soil will stick out in piles from time to time, and some of the beasts might have usable samples on their being. Take them all outside to Ghede; just look for the piles of dirt and the tauren barking orders. He means well, just don't get him riled up though!",o="收集20份安戈洛的泥土，把它们交给雷霆崖的格德。",oEN="Bring 20 Un'Goro Soil samples to Ghede on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",p="放轻松点，如果你拿来了安戈洛的泥土，就赶紧拿出来，不然就该干什么干什么去！",pEN="At ease, Private. If you're here to unload soil from Un'Goro - outstanding then! Otherwise, disappear.",c="噢，这就对了，$n，不用帮忙了，我自己会把这些土堆上去的！如果伟大的先祖之灵们想要让这里有一大堆土，那他们会凭空变出一堆来，根本用不着你来动手，现在你看他们像是有这个意思吗？！\n\n大德鲁伊想再跟你谈谈，但是就他的下一个任务而言，你将发现熟练掌握草药学方面的知识是很有必要的。如果你对草药学一窍不通，他也不会让你无事可做。",cEN="Oh that's right Private <name>, don't make any effort to help me unload this soil up on to the piles! If the Great Spirits had wanted it done they would have miracled it up there, now wouldn't they?!\n\nArch Druid Runetotem wants to speak with you again, but for his next task you find that a journeyman's understanding of Herbalism would be helpful. If you don't know it though, he'll still find a use for you."}
Q[3762]={d="打扰一下，$c，如果可能的话，我想占用你一点时间。\n\n雷霆崖的塞纳里奥议会希望能找到像你这样经验丰富的冒险家来帮助他们进行一项重要的研究项目。虽然我不知道详细的情况，但是我可以告诉你，正是哈缪尔·符文图腾亲自负责这项研究。\n\n要是你感兴趣的话，请直接去雷霆崖的长者高地找他谈谈。",dEN="Excuse me <class>, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is most interested in seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Hamuul Runetotem is spearheading this research.\n\nPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly on the Elder Rise within Thunder Bluff proper.",o="与雷霆崖的大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",c="你好，$c；我很高兴看到你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;协助我们的研究。要做的事还有很多，如果我不告诉你这项工作伴随着危险，那就是对你不负责任。希望这不会把你吓跑……不过看你的样子，我想危险对你来说早已是家常便饭了。",cEN="Greetings, <class>; I am glad you are interested in assisting our research. There is much to do, and I would be doing you a disservice if I informed you that the work this entails is not dangerous. Hopefully this will not scare you off... but from the looks of you, I take it that danger is something that you have dealt with before."}
Q[3763]={d="打扰一下，$c，如果可能的话，我想占用你一点时间。\n\n达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会希望能找到像你这样经验丰富的冒险家来帮助他们进行一项重要的研究项目。虽然我不知道详细的情况，但是我可以告诉你，正是伊范达尔·鹿盔亲自负责这项研究。\n\n要是你感兴趣的话，请直接去达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区找他谈谈。",dEN="Excuse me <class>, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is looking for seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is spearheading this research.\n\nPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly in the Cenarion Enclave within Darnassus proper.",o="与达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",c="好吧，$c……既然你已得知是我亲自领导这项研究，那你显然是能多快赶来就多快赶来了。\n\n既然你来了，就$g好好:好好;听仔细，因为我只讲一遍细节；我可不想重复自己说过的话。",cEN="Well now, <class>... since you were informed that I was leading this research myself, you obviously came as quickly as you could.\n\nNow that you are here, be sure to pay attention the first time I tell you the details; I have no desire to repeat myself."}
Q[3764]={d="据说安戈洛环形山一带的土壤非常肥沃，而且具有不可思议的魔法能量。我想要知道这事的真假，到安戈洛去帮我们收集足够的土壤吧。\n\n你可能会认为派你去做收集任务是委屈你了，我和塞纳里奥议会可不喜欢这种态度。将样本交给耶纳尔，他总躲在树后浪费时间，你只要去找那一堆堆的泥土就是了。剩下的事情都交给他办，别来找我。",dEN="The soil of Un'Goro Crater is reportedly enriched with potent magical qualities. I want to know facts from falsehoods; go into the wilds of Un'Goro and acquire enough quality samples of soil for our continued study.\n\nYou may think that collection tasks are beneath you; that sort of attitude does not endear yourself to me or the Cenarion Circle. Bring the samples to Jenal, who is no doubt wasting time outside behind this tree; just look for the piles of dirt. He will handle the logistics - not I.",o="收集20份安戈洛的泥土，把它们交给达纳苏斯的耶纳尔。",oEN="Bring 20 Un'Goro Soil samples to Jenal at the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus.",p="哦，当然，泥土。大德鲁伊想要20份，所以你就得拿来20份。没有就别废话了！",pEN="Ah yes, the dirt. The Arch Druid wants twenty loads per adventurer, and twenty loads he shall get. Let those who conspire against us fall to the wayside!",c="首领，请在这里卸下你那珍贵的货物吧。这一路一定让你不堪重负——就像我这个有远见的人所背负的重担一样。这是大德鲁伊亲自规定的，给你的一份酬劳。\n\n大德鲁伊鹿盔想再和你谈谈，$n。不过他下一次交给你的任务，需要你具备一名熟练草药师的知识。就算你没有，也仍然可以帮助议会，$c！",cEN="Unload your precious cargo here, noble <class>. It must have been quite the burden... not unlike the burden I carry being a visionary. Here is an honorarium for your work, as dictated by the Arch Druid himself.\n\nArch Druid Staghelm wants to speak with you again <name>, but for his next task you will be aided if you have a journeyman's understanding of Herbalism. If you don't know it though, you will still be able to aid the Circle!"}
Q[3765]={d="暴风城……真是个人来人往的繁华之地。\n\n我远道而来寻求帮助。常听说勇敢的冒险者会在这座城市的街头游荡。\n\n我的兄弟格沙拉在黑海岸需要帮助。他住在海边的奥伯丁。\n\n这段旅程漫长而壮阔。正因如此，我才需要像你这样经验丰富的$g:; $c的帮助。",dEN="Stormwind -- such a bustling hub of activity.\n\nI have traveled from afar to seek help. Often it is heard that brave adventurers roam these city streets.\n\nMy brother, Gershala, requires assistance in Darkshore. He resides in the seaside town of Auberdine.\n\nThe journey is a long and epic one. It is for this reason that I ask the help of a seasoned <class> such as yourself.",o="到奥伯丁的戈沙拉·夜语那儿去。",oEN="Travel to Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine.",c="这么说，是我兄弟阿尔戈斯派你来的？我想你一路奔波一定$g累坏了:累坏了;。不过我们有很多话要谈。",cEN="Ah, so my brother, Argos, sent you? I realize you must be weary from your travels. But we have much to talk about."}
Q[3781]={d="有了这件名为常青袋的东西，我们已在来自安戈洛环形山的土壤上种植了萨伦迪斯种子。这些种子繁殖出了大片的草药。其中一种是晨光麦，我们对这种神秘的草药知之甚少，不过我打算揭开其中的奥秘。\n\n把这个交给楼下的玛斯雷，他会给你一些种子，然后你就可以开始了。要是种子用完了的话，你就得从他那儿购买新的种子。",dEN="With what we call an Evergreen Pouch, we have cultivated Tharlendris seeds in the soil from Un'Goro Crater. These seeds blossom into an array of random, potent herbs. One result is morrowgrain, a mysterious herb we know little about; I intend to unravel this mystery.\n\nTake this to Mathrengyl downstairs, and he will give you some seeds so you can get started. If you run out, you will need to purchase more from him.",o="将大德鲁伊的草种购买券交给达纳苏斯城塞纳里奥区的玛斯雷·驭熊者。",oEN="Take the Arch Druid's Seed Voucher to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.",p="朋友，和平与宁静与你同在。是大德鲁伊派你来的，对吗？",pEN="Peace and serenity be yours, friend. You are here on business from the Arch Druid himself, yes?",c="嗯，这张优惠券值二十份种子。要是你把种子用完了，我们仍可以为你提供更多的种子。不幸的是，大量生产萨伦迪斯种子所需的费用可不小，这正是我们要收取成本费以解决资金问题的原因。\n\n那些带着晨光麦回来的冒险者们会发现大德鲁伊给予的回报要远远大于他们所付出的代价。",cEN="Yes, this voucher is good for twenty packets of seeds. If you run out, we have more that can be provided. Unfortunately though, Tharlendris seeds are quite costly to produce in significant numbers. This is why the Cenarion Circle asks that those who are assisting us help out by offsetting some of the cost.\n\nThose who return with morrowgrain find that the reward the Arch Druid offers far makes up for the cost."}
Q[3782]={d="有了这件名为常青袋的东西，我们已在来自安戈洛环形山的土壤上种植了萨伦迪斯种子。这些种子繁殖出了大片的草药。其中一种是晨光麦，我们对这种神秘的草药知之甚少，不过我打算揭开其中的奥秘。\n\n把这个交给我的女儿巴珊娜，她会给你一些种子，然后你就可以开始了。要是种子用完了的话，你就得从她那儿购买新的种子。",dEN="With what we call an Evergreen Pouch, we have cultivated Tharlendris seeds in the soil from Un'Goro Crater. These seeds have blossomed into an array of random, potent herbs. One result is morrowgrain, a mysterious herb we know little about; I very much hope to unravel this mystery for the Circle.\n\nTake this voucher over to my daughter Bashana, and she will give you some seeds so you may assist us. If you run out, you will need to purchase more from her.",o="将草种购买券交给雷霆崖的巴珊娜·符文图腾。",oEN="Take the Seed Voucher to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",p="愿和平与你同在，$g朋友:朋友;。你是奉大德鲁伊本人之命来的，对吧？",pEN="Peace and serenity be yours, friend. You are here on business from the Arch Druid himself, yes?",c="是的，这张凭证可以换二十包种子。如果你用完了，我们还能提供更多。可惜的是，大量培育萨伦迪斯种子的成本相当高昂。正因如此，塞纳里奥议会才请那些协助我们的人分担一部分费用。\n\n凡是带回晨光麦的人，$n，都会发现，大德鲁伊给出的报酬远远超过这些花费。",cEN="Yes, this voucher is good for twenty packets of seeds. If you run out, we have more that can be provided. Unfortunately though, Tharlendris seeds are quite costly to produce in significant numbers. This is why the Cenarion Circle asks that those who are assisting us help out by offsetting some of the cost.\n\nThose who return with morrowgrain find that the reward the Arch Druid offers far makes up for the cost."}
Q[3783]={d="我的朋友总是不断想出天才般的点子来，我感觉我总是比不上他们……直到今天！我想到了一个好主意！如果你答应不告诉别人的话，我就和你分享这个秘密……\n\n我要制作一个机械雪人！我的朋友看到它的时候肯定会被吓一跳，然后就会被我的技术和创意所震撼！\n\n首先，我需要那些冰蓟雪人身上的厚雪人毛皮。你能帮帮我吗？雪人一般都在这里的东南边活动。",dEN="My friends are always coming up with great ideas. I've never felt like I could match them... until today! I just drew up the plans for something great! If you promise not to tell, I'll let you in on the secret...\n\nI'm going to make a mechanical yeti! Not only are my friends sure to be freaked out when they see it, but when they get over that, I know they'll be impressed!\n\nI need thick yeti fur from the ice thistle yeti to start with. Will you help? You'll find them to the southeast.",o="为永望镇的乌米收集10张厚雪人毛皮。",oEN="Collect 10 Thick Yeti Furs for Umi Rumplesnicker in Everlook.",p="我有很多准备工作要做，请你尽快把毛皮交给我！",pEN="I've got lots to get started on here. Please get me those furs as soon as you can!",c="这些皮毛非常完美，$n。好的开始是成功的一半！",cEN="These furs are perfect, <name>. We're off to a great start here!"}
Q[3784]={d="打扰一下，$c，如果可能的话，我想占用你一点时间。\n\n雷霆崖的塞纳里奥议会希望能找到像你这样经验丰富的冒险家来帮助他们进行一项重要的研究项目。虽然我不知道详细的情况，但是我可以告诉你，正是哈缪尔·符文图腾亲自负责这项研究。\n\n要是你感兴趣的话，请直接去雷霆崖的长者高地找他谈谈。",dEN="Excuse me <class>, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is most interested in seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Hamuul Runetotem is spearheading this research.\n\nPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly on the Elder Rise within Thunder Bluff proper.",o="与雷霆崖的大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",c="你好，$C。很高兴你愿意帮助我们进行研究。你要做的事情很多，如果是我告诉你这工作并不危险，也许会伤害到你的感情。希望你不会因此受惊……但是，从你的表情看来，你已经经历过不少危险了。",cEN="Greetings, <class>; I am glad you are interested in assisting our research. There is much to do, and I would be doing you a disservice if I informed you that the work this entails is not dangerous. Hopefully this will not scare you off... but from the looks of you, I take it that danger is something that you have dealt with before."}
Q[3785]={d="这是你所需的与萨伦迪斯种子一同使用的常青袋，当然，你手中还必须有安戈洛的泥土样本给种子做肥料。这些东西都准备好了之后就使用常青袋，剩下的就交给它了。\n\n当你种出足够的晨光麦之后，将它们交给我就行了。请不要打扰大德鲁伊，他事务繁忙，而且他也没必要为收集晨光麦的事情操心！",dEN="Here's your Evergreen Pouch that you'll need to use the Tharlendis seeds with. You also need to have Un'Goro soil samples on hand to use as fertilizer for the seeds. Just use the pouch when you have everything; the pouch will take care of the rest.\n\nWhen you have enough morrowgrain, bring them here to me in the enclave. Please don't bother the Arch Druid; he's a very busy man, and he doesn't need to be disturbed every time someone returns with another batch of morrowgrain!",o="用一个常青袋、一包萨伦迪斯种子以及两份安戈洛的泥土来尝试种植晨光麦。\n\n将10株晨光麦交给达纳苏斯的玛斯雷·驭熊者。",oEN="Use an Evergreen Pouch with a Packet of Tharlendis Seeds and two Un'Goro Soil samples to try and cultivate samples of Morrowgrain.\n\nBring 10 Morrowgrain to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus.",p="嗯，$n，你种植出用于大德鲁伊的研究工作的晨光麦了吗？他为塞纳里奥议会进行的研究事关重大，你的帮助必定给你带来丰厚的回报！",pEN="Yes <name>, have you grown some morrowgrain for the Arch Druid's important research? The mysterious properties of Un'Goro Crater become clearer with each passing day, thanks to the help you are giving us.",c="干得好，$n。当大德鲁伊需要晨光麦时，我会把这些交给他的。同时，请收下这个作为塞纳里奥议会对你的酬谢。\n\n我们对晨光麦的需求量非常大，如果你想要继续帮助我们的话，那么当你种植出更多的晨光麦之后就把它们交给我。",cEN="Well done <name>, I will be sure to give these to the Arch Druid himself when he has need of them. Meanwhile, please accept this as a token of the Cenarion Circle's appreciation.\n\nOur need for morrowgrain, for now, is constant; if you wish to continue aiding us, then please return when you have cultivated more of it."}
Q[3786]={d="这是你所需的与萨伦迪斯种子一同使用的常青袋，当然，你手中还必须有安戈洛的泥土样本给种子做肥料。这些东西都准备好了之后就使用常青袋，剩下的就交给它了。\n\n当你种出足够的晨光麦之后，将它们交给我就行了。请不要打扰大德鲁伊，他事务繁忙，而且他也没必要为收集晨光麦的事情操心！",dEN="Here's your Evergreen Pouch that you'll need to use the Tharlendis seeds with. You also need to have Un'Goro soil samples on hand to use as fertilizer for the seeds. Just use the pouch when you have everything; the pouch will take care of the rest.\n\nWhen you have enough morrowgrain, bring them to me here on Elder Rise. Please don't bother the Arch Druid; he'll be very busy with the research, as well as the multitude of concerns he has!",o="用一个常青袋、一包萨伦迪斯种子以及两份安戈洛的泥土来尝试种植晨光麦。\n\n将10株晨光麦交给雷霆崖的巴珊娜·符文图腾。",oEN="Use an Evergreen Pouch with a Packet of Tharlendis Seeds and two Un'Goro Soil samples to try and cultivate samples of Morrowgrain.\n\nBring 10 Morrowgrain to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",p="嗯，$n，你种植出用于大德鲁伊的研究工作的晨光麦了吗？我们对安戈洛环形山神秘构造的了解已经越来越多了，谢谢你为我们提供的帮助。",pEN="Yes <name>, have you grown some morrowgrain for the Arch Druid's important research? The mysterious properties of Un'Goro Crater become clearer with each passing day, thanks to the help you are giving us.",c="干得好，$n。当大德鲁伊需要晨光麦时，我会把这些交给他的。同时，请收下这个作为塞纳里奥议会对你的酬谢。\n\n我们对晨光麦的需求量非常大，如果你想要继续帮助我们的话，那么当你种植出更多的晨光麦之后就把它们交给我。",cEN="Well done <name>, I will be sure to give these to the Arch Druid himself when he has need of them. Meanwhile, please accept this as a token of the Cenarion Circle's appreciation.\n\nOur need for morrowgrain, for now, is constant; if you wish to continue aiding us, then please return when you have cultivated more of it."}
Q[3787]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我的同伴想与你谈谈有关你同塞纳里奥议会联合进行的研究。他是一名德鲁伊，名叫奎恩提斯，居住在菲拉斯的羽月要塞。他想就晨光麦与你交换一些意见……而且他希望我们的谈话不为大德鲁伊所知。\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，就去跟他谈谈，当然，一旦你这么做了，所有的一切便不是秘密了。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nA colleague of mine would like to speak with you about the research you are doing in conjunction with the Cenarion Circle. He is a druid by the name of Quintis Jonespyre, and he resides in Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas. He would like to confer with you about morrowgrain... and he very much would like for you to keep our discussion from the ears of the Arch Druid.\n\nIf you're interested, speak with him; no doubt, all will be revealed once you do.",o="与羽月要塞的奎恩提斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="谢谢你前来，$g旅行者:旅行者;！请容我自我介绍——我是奎恩提斯·琼斯派尔，一名德鲁伊，也是玛法里奥和塞纳里奥议会谦卑的仆人。我和我的同僚（珊蒂斯·羽月将军和守护者议会——或许你听说过我们）想和你谈谈你在达纳苏斯为范达尔·鹿盔所做的工作。\n\n在我们继续之前，我希望这次谈话只限于你我之间。如果你不介意，我们就可以开始了。",cEN="I thank you for coming, weary traveler! Allow me to introduce myself - I am Quintis Jonespyre, druid and humble servant of Malfurion and the Cenarion Circle. My colleagues (General Shandris Feathermoon and the Protectorate - mayhap you've heard of us) and I wanted to talk with you about the work you are doing for Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\n\nBefore we get much further, I'd like to ask that our discussion stay between just us. If you have no problem with this, then we may proceed."}
Q[3788]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我的同伴想与你谈谈有关你同塞纳里奥议会联合进行的研究。他是一名德鲁伊，名叫奎恩提斯，居住在菲拉斯的羽月要塞。他想就晨光麦与你交换一些意见……而且他希望我们的谈话不为大德鲁伊所知。\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，就去跟他谈谈，当然，一旦你这么做了，所有的一切便不是秘密了。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nA colleague of mine would like to speak with you about the research you are doing in conjunction with the Cenarion Circle. He is a druid by the name of Quintis Jonespyre, and he resides here in Feathermoon Stronghold. He would like to confer with you about morrowgrain... and he very much would like for you to keep our discussion from the ears of the Arch Druid.\n\nIf you're interested, speak with him; no doubt, all will be revealed once you do.",o="与羽月要塞的奎恩提斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="谢谢你前来，$g旅行者:旅行者;！请容我自我介绍——我是奎恩提斯·琼斯派尔，一名德鲁伊，也是玛法里奥和塞纳里奥议会谦卑的仆人。我和我的同僚（珊蒂斯·羽月将军和守护者议会——或许你听说过我们）想和你谈谈你在达纳苏斯为范达尔·鹿盔所做的工作。\n\n在我们继续之前，我希望这次谈话只限于你我之间。如果你不介意，我们就可以开始了。",cEN="I thank you for coming, weary traveler! Allow me to introduce myself - I am Quintis Jonespyre, druid and humble servant of Malfurion and the Cenarion Circle. My colleagues (General Shandris Feathermoon and the Protectorate - mayhap you've heard of us) and I wanted to talk with you about the work you are doing for Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\n\nBefore we get much further, I'd like to ask that our discussion stay between just us. If you have no problem with this, then we may proceed."}
Q[3789]={d="打扰一下，$c，如果可能的话，我想占用你一点时间。\n\n达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会希望能找到像你这样经验丰富的冒险家来帮助他们进行一项重要的研究项目。虽然我不知道详细的情况，但是我可以告诉你，正是伊范达尔·鹿盔亲自负责这项研究。\n\n要是你感兴趣的话，请直接去达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区找他谈谈。",dEN="Excuse me <class>, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is looking for seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is spearheading this research.\n\nPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly in the Cenarion Enclave within Darnassus proper.",o="与达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",c="好吧，$c……既然你已得知是我亲自领导这项研究，那你显然是能多快赶来就多快赶来了。\n\n既然你来了，就$g好好:好好;听仔细，因为我只讲一遍细节；我可不想重复自己说过的话。",cEN="Well now, <class>... since you were informed that I was leading this research myself, you obviously came as quickly as you could.\n\nNow that you are here, be sure to pay attention the first time I tell you the details; I have no desire to repeat myself."}
Q[3790]={d="打扰一下，$c，如果可能的话，我想占用你一点时间。\n\n达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会希望能找到像你这样经验丰富的冒险家来帮助他们进行一项重要的研究项目。虽然我不知道详细的情况，但是我可以告诉你，正是伊范达尔·鹿盔亲自负责这项研究。\n\n要是你感兴趣的话，请直接去达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区找他谈谈。",dEN="Excuse me <class>, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is looking for seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project. While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm is spearheading this research.\n\nPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly in the Cenarion Enclave within Darnassus proper.",o="与达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",c="好吧，$c……既然你已得知是我亲自领导这项研究，那你显然是能多快赶来就多快赶来了。\n\n既然你来了，就$g好好:好好;听仔细，因为我只讲一遍细节；我可不想重复自己说过的话。",cEN="Well now, <class>... since you were informed that I was leading this research myself, you obviously came as quickly as you could.\n\nNow that you are here, be sure to pay attention the first time I tell you the details; I have no desire to repeat myself."}
Q[3791]={d="坦白说吧，$n。我对达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊以塞纳里奥议会的名义、使用 议会的资源来大量生产晨光麦的原因很感兴趣——不，应该说是极度关注。我是一名研究员——研究诅咒是我的专长。我听说晨光麦在一定的条件下可以像其它草药那样用于进行诅咒。\n\n我想了解更多的情况，因此我请求你的帮助。给我带十株晨光麦回来，我会好好报答你的。",dEN="Let me to be frank with you, <name>. I'm interested - nay, concerned with why the Arch Druid in Darnassus is using the name of the Cenarion Circle as well as the Circle's resources to procure vast amounts of morrowgrain. I'm a researcher - curses are my specialty. I've heard that morrowgrain, under the right conditions, exude qualities like other herbs used in primitive curses.\n\nI want to know more, and I ask for your help. Bring me ten morrowgrain, and I will be sure to take care of you.",o="将10株晨光麦交给羽月要塞的奎恩提斯。",oEN="Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="我要十株晨光麦——要启动我的研究，至少需要这么多。毫无疑问，整个研究过程肯定要消耗不少晨光麦，但这也正是研究的本质。",pEN="I'm looking for ten morrowgrain - that should be enough to at least get my research started. I'll no doubt burn through a lot of those going down wrong paths, but such is the nature of research.",c="呃，这些晨光麦让我感觉有些……不可思议。大德鲁伊鹿盔会以月神的名义用这些东西做什么？\n\n无论如何，再次感谢你的帮助。拿着这件小东西……你知道的，给你的回报。我对晨光麦的研究还要进行一段时间，因此我需要更多的晨光麦。虽然我精通于此，但我认为我仍需要足够的时间来观察晨光麦是否具有炼金术方面的价值。话说回来，跟这种东西待在一起还真让我感觉不大舒服……",cEN="Gah, these morrowgrain make me feel... weird. What in the name of Elune is Staghelm up to with these things?\n\nAnyway, thank you again for your help. Here's a little something... you know, for the effort. My research on morrowgrain is going to take a while, and I no doubt am going to need more. While I'm at it, I suppose I could take the time to see if morrowgrain have some pertinent alchemical uses. Still, I feel uncomfortable even being around them."}
Q[3792]={p="你好，我们又见面了，$n。我的研究进展得相当顺利，不果如果你还有5株晨光麦的话，我会很乐意地从你这儿购买的。呃……“乐意”在这里只是一个修饰语罢了，和这些东西相处的时间越长，我就越发感到不太舒服。尽管如此，我的研究任务仍要求我必须认真对待工作，并尽力克服我这奇怪的心理作用。",pEN="Hello again, <name>. My research is progressing fairly well, but if you have five more Morrowgrain I'd be happy to take them off your hands. Well... happy is a figurative term in this case; the more I am around them, the more uncomfortable I feel. Still, my research demands I buckle down and get through this.",c="谢谢你，$n。我会将这些东西存储起来，虽然我无法像大德鲁伊那样对资源具有掌控权，但是我可以尽力为你提供一点东西聊表谢意。总之，如果大德鲁伊持续不断地收集晨光麦，天知道会发生什么事情。记着我说的，这里面必有古怪。\n\n另外，晨光麦对我来说是多多益善，我会以5株为单位购买这些东西。",cEN="Thanks <name>; I'll just store these out of the way for the time being. While I don't command the resources that Staghelm does, I am able to give you a little something for your trouble. Anyway, who knows what will happen if Staghelm keeps getting Morrowgrain after Morrowgrain. There's something fishy going on, mark my words.\n\nRemember that I'm always looking for more Morrowgrain. I'll take them in quantities of five at a time."}
Q[3801]={d="你好，$n。我是弗兰克罗恩·铸铁。没错，正是我创造了以石头为基础的建筑方法。在探索这个饱受战争创伤的世界的旅途中，你一定见过了不少由我设计建造的建筑物。\n\n你也许想要知道我为什么在这里，以及我想要你帮我做些什么——这些问题都很合理。\n\n我当然需要你的帮助。作为请求你帮助我的交换条件，我会给你一把钥匙，让你得以进入这座由我建造的……被诅咒的城市。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. I am Franclorn Forgewright. Yes, the Franclorn Forgewright responsible for the stonewrought method of architecture. You have undoubtedly passed through or stood upon one of my creations in your adventures across our war torn world.\n\nYou are probably wondering why I am here and what it is that I want from you - both valid questions.\n\nI need your assistance, of course. In exchange for your assistance, I shall grant you the key to the depths of my accursed city.",o="如果你想要得到进入这座城市主城区的钥匙，就去和弗兰克罗恩·铸铁谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Franclorn Forgewright at Forgewright's Tomb in Blackrock Mountain if you are interested in obtaining a key to the city major.",c="不管是因为贪婪还是无私，你所要做的事情对我们双方都很有好处。",cEN="Whether it is greed which brought you here or an act of selfless devotion, what you are about to undertake is for the good of us all."}
Q[3802]={d="你可以在律法之环外的工匠大厅里找到弗诺斯·达克维尔。杀掉那个卑鄙的家伙，拿回我的铁胆之锤。\n\n把铁胆之锤拿到索瑞森神殿去，然后把它放在正确的地方——就是我的雕像的手里。\n\n当你把铁胆之锤放上去之后，我存放主宰钥匙的那个小机关将会打开。更重要的是，铁胆之锤将会永远掌握在我的手中。如果有人想要拿走战锤的话，那整座雕像和战锤都会碎裂，永远无法修复。",dEN="You will find Fineous Darkvire beyond the Ring of Law, in the Hall of Crafting. Kill the miserable cur and recover Ironfel.\n\nTake Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place the hammer in its rightful place: In the hands of the statue erected in my honor.\n\nWhen this is done, the compartment in which I stored the master key will open. More importantly, Ironfel will remain forever in my grasp. Should they make an attempt to remove the hammer; both the statue and hammer will shatter, lost forever.",o="杀死弗诺斯·达克维尔，取回那把巨锤——铁胆之锤。把铁胆之锤带到索瑞森神殿，放在弗兰克罗恩·铸铁的雕像上。|n",oEN="Slay Fineous Darkvire and recover the great hammer, Ironfel. Take Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place it on the statue of Franclorn Forgewright.",p="雕像隐隐约约地矗立在你的面前。",pEN="The statue looms ominously above you.",c="战锤慢慢地滑入巨大的黑铁雕像的手中。此时，雕像基座处的一个小隔间被打开，你在里面找到了……",cEN="The hammer slides firmly into place, within the grasp of the massive Dark Iron monument. A tiny compartment opens at the base of the statue. Inside you find..."}
Q[3803]={p="大德鲁伊始终在寻找更多的晨光麦以供塞纳里奥议会研究之用。我们以10株为单位进行收购，而且会奖励给你一包很有用的东西。如果你弄到了10株晨光麦，就来找我，我将奖赏你的。",pEN="The Arch Druid is always looking for additional morrowgrain for the Cenarion Circle's continued research. We take them in increments of ten, and award you with a cache of goods you should find useful. When you have ten, let me know and I will reward you accordingly.",c="棒极了——毫无疑问，这些晨光麦定能取悦大德鲁伊，不过我必须承认……仅仅是靠近它们就让我感到有些不舒服。可以想象大德鲁伊要忍受这么多的晨光麦是一件多困难的事！\n\n这是给你的，$n。我们感谢你提供的帮助。",cEN="Excellent - this morrowgrain will no doubt please the Arch Druid. I must admit though... just being near them makes me feel a little uncomfortable. I can only imagine how difficult it is for the Arch Druid to tolerate them in such large numbers!\n\nThis is for you, <name>. The Cenarion Circle thanks you for your continued support."}
Q[3804]={p="大德鲁伊始终在寻找更多的晨光麦以供塞纳里奥议会研究安戈洛环形山之用。我们以10株为单位进行收购，而且会奖励给你一包很有用的东西。如果你弄到了10株晨光麦，就来找我，我将奖赏你的。",pEN="The Arch Druid is always looking for more morrowgrain for the Cenarion Circle's research project on Un'Goro Crater. We take them in increments of ten, and award you with a cache of goods you should find useful. When you have ten, let me know and I will award you accordingly.",c="棒极了——毫无疑问，这些晨光麦会在适当时候派上用场。我们知道暗夜精灵也在进行关于这些草药的研究，但是我们还不清楚如果他们有所发现的话，这些草药将用于何种目的。大德鲁伊认为我们应该继续收购晨光麦，直到我们找出其中的奥秘。\n\n这是给你的，$n。我们感谢你提供的帮助。",cEN="Excellent - this morrowgrain will no doubt help when the time comes. We know that the night elves are conducting similar research into these herbs, though it isn't clear to what end they will use them for if they discover anything. The Arch Druid thinks that the need for morrowgrain will remain until we've figured out the mysteries behind this herb.\n\nThis is for you, <name>. The Cenarion Circle thanks you for your continued support."}
Q[3821]={d="沙妮被派去调查过去三个星期以来燃烧平原上的那些火腹食人魔所进行的一些奇怪仪式。\n\n高图斯告诉我说没有听到过任何关于那支部队的消息，所以他建议我最好不要再管这件事情，继续自己手头上的工作。你相信他居然这么说了吗？要知道沙妮是我的妻子啊！\n\n我不能离开我的哨所，$n，但是我必须要知道沙妮现在怎么样了。到燃烧平原去，找到她。",dEN="Sha'ni was sent to investigate reports of strange ritualistic activity coming from the Firegut ogres of the Burning Steppes over three weeks ago.\n\nGoretooth tells me that he hasn't heard from anyone in that platoon and that it's best that I move on and focus on the task at hand. Can you believe it? That's my wife!\n\nI can't leave my post, <name>, but I must know what became of Sha'ni. Travel to the Burning Steppes and search for her.",o="到燃烧平原去找到沙妮·长齿。",oEN="Venture forth to the Burning Steppes and find out what became of Sha'ni Proudtusk.",c="我可怜的萨特拉克。\n\n我们原本计划在这段旅程结束之后和我们的父母搬到辛特兰居住的，但是这一计划现在显然已经不可能实现了！",cEN="My poor Thal'trak.\n\nWe were planning on moving in with my mother and father in the Hinterlands after our tours were over. Now those plans are ruined!"}
Q[3822]={d="$n，我们整支小分队都被抓住了，除了我之外的所有同伴都被杀了。\n\n他们的头领克罗格鲁尔想要把我留下来举行某种仪式。\n\n我被绑在这个祭坛上，被那些野兽用酷刑折磨。不到一个小时，我就被活活折磨致死。那个野兽摘下了我的结婚鼻环，把它戴在了自己的手上。我从来没有见过如此无耻残暴的行为！\n\n找到克罗格鲁尔，杀了他！把我的戒指交给萨特拉克。\n\n另外，$n，告诉他，我们会再次见面的……来世再见……",dEN="My whole platoon was captured, <name>. All were slain - except me.\n\nTheir leader, Krom'Grul, wanted to save me for some sort of ritual.\n\nI was chained to this altar and brutalized by the beast. My physical being ceased functioning after an hour of this torture. The beast then ripped my wedding nose-ring off of my face and stuck it on his finger. I had never seen such savagery!\n\nFind Krom'Grul and kill him! Take my ring back to Thal'trak.\n\nAnd <name>, tell him that we will meet again... in another life.",o="从克罗格鲁尔手中取回沙妮的鼻环，带回卡加斯交给萨特拉克。到恐惧之石的各处洞穴和矿坑中搜寻。|n",oEN="Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock.",p="你找到沙妮了吗？她还好吗？",pEN="Did you find Sha'ni? Is she ok?",c="<萨特拉克一下子崩溃了。>\n\n我们原本准备去辛特兰……她没有告诉过你吗？这原本是她最后的一个任务。\n\n<萨特拉克开始抽泣。>\n\n我不要这个东西，$n。拿走它，丢掉它，随你怎样！它对我来说没有丝毫意义。没有了她……",cEN="<Thal'trak collapses.>\n\nWe were going to move to the Hinterlands. Did she tell you? This was going to be her last mission.\n\n<Thal'trak sobs.>\n\nI don't want it, <name>. Keep it, throw it away, I don't care! The ring means nothing to me now. Not without her..."}
Q[3823]={d="我们必须先发制人！\n\n我先简单地向你介绍一下现在的状况，士兵。\n\n燃烧平原上的火腹食人魔是黑石兽人的盟友。它们和那些邪恶的兽人一起工作，帮助守卫蕴藏着丰富矿藏的巨槌石，并保证那条补给线一直正常运作。\n\n现在出发吧，$n。削弱他们的力量然后回来向我报告。\n\n<奥拉留斯向空中伸出手，然后作出被掐住脖子的表情。>\n\n我要杀了你，温奇！",dEN="We must strike at our enemies before they strike at us!\n\nI'll make this brief, soldier.\n\nThe Firegut ogres of the Burning Steppes are allies of the Blackrock orcs. They work closely with those vile orcs, keeping the mineral rich Dreadmaul Rock guarded and the supply lines open at all times.\n\nLeave your mark, <name>. Cripple their forces and return to me when the job is done.\n\n<Oralius grabs at the air and makes a choking motion.>\n\nI WILL KILL YOU, WINKY!",o="杀掉15个火腹食人魔法师、7个火腹食人魔和7个火腹蛮兵，完成任务之后向奥拉留斯报告。",oEN="Slay 15 Firegut Ogre-Mages, 7 Firegut Ogres, and 7 Firegut Ogre Brutes.",p="你的军服还没有沾上足够的血，士兵！",pEN="There is not nearly enough blood on your uniform, soldier!",c="干得好，士兵！兽人和巨魔会因为这次打击而混乱几分钟，也许几个小时！",cEN="Outstanding, soldier! The orcs and ogres will be reeling from this blow for minutes, maybe even hours!"}
Q[3824]={d="我告诉你，他们现在已经被搞得晕头转向了！我们的下一步行动将是决定性的。\n\n干掉那个野蛮的食人魔之王戈泰什。更重要的是，你必须把他的头带回来，这样我就可以准备对火腹食人魔发动第三次攻击了。\n\n你要留神，士兵，戈泰什并不在巨槌石上，而是在巨槌石西面的某座黑石兽人的建筑物中。\n\n你的任务很简单。找到戈泰什，然后砍掉他那肥大的脑袋。完成任务之后回到我这里来。\n\n闭嘴，温奇！",dEN="They're reeling I tell you! Our next strike must be decisive.\n\nThe brute lord, Gor'tesh, must be slain. More importantly, his head must be returned to me so that I may prepare the third phase of our attack on the Firegut ogres.\n\nBe warned, soldier, Gor'tesh rules not from Dreadmaul Rock but from a Blackrock orc structure to the west of Dreadmaul Rock.\n\nYour orders, then, are simple. Find Gor'tesh and chop off his fat head. Return to me when the job is done.\n\nSHUT UP, WINKY!",o="找到戈泰什，他应该在巨槌石西面的某处。杀掉戈泰什并把他的头颅交给燃烧平原的奥拉留斯。",oEN="Collect Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head.",p="哦，光荣的一天！你带回那个家伙的头了吗？",pEN="Oh glorious day! Have you returned with the head?",c="看看这颗脑袋，士兵。真是让人讨厌！当火腹巨魔看到这颗肥大的头挂在长矛上并竖在他们的山头上时，他们一定会变得歇斯底里！\n\n<奥拉留斯肆无忌惮地咯咯笑着。>",cEN="Just look at it, soldier. Disgusting! When the remaining Firegut ogres see this fat mug stuck on a pike sitting at the top of their mountain, mass hysteria will ensue!\n\n<Oralius cackles wildly.>"}
Q[3825]={d="士兵，你还有最后一件事要做。\n\n我已经把戈泰什的头颅挂在了一支长矛上。现在你要做的就是把这支长矛带到巨槌石的山顶去，把它插在地上。这样，你就能看到那些怯懦的食人魔四散逃窜了！当你完成这个任务之后，回到我这里来，我会为你的辛勤工作而奖励你的。\n\n<奥拉留斯看上去有些出神。>",dEN="Just one last thing you must do, soldier.\n\nI've taken the liberty of putting Gor'tesh's head on a pike. Now all you have to do is take this head to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and stick it into the ground. Once you do that, watch as those cowardly ogres run for their lives! After you've had your fun, come back to me and I'll reward you for all of your hard work.\n\n<Oralius seems to be losing touch with reality.>",o="把戈泰什的头颅放在巨槌石的山顶上。找一块软土堆把串着头颅的长矛插上去就可以了。",oEN="Take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head and place it at the top of Dreadmaul Rock. Look for a soft dirt mound to plant the pike.",p="完成任务了？你有没有把当时的场景画下来？",pEN="So? Did you paint any pictures of the event?",c="干得漂亮，士兵！简直了不起！哦，我会因此获得英勇勋章的，呃，我是说，你会因此得到$g丰厚:丰厚;的报酬！",cEN="Outstanding work, soldier! Simply amazing! Oh I'll get the medal of bravery for this, er, I mean you'll be rewarded handsomely for this!"}
Q[3841]={d="噢，你好，$n。很高兴再次见到你。去达纳苏斯的旅途怎么样？\n\n你不在的这段时间里，我们取得了相当大的进展，你会为此感到高兴的。我们甚至保存了一整巢的蛋。不幸的是，我们找到这些蛋的母亲的时候，它已经死掉了。\n\n呃，你要取一只作为宠物吗？它们很快就要孵化了，所以它们会需要一个好$G父亲:母亲的。你认为呢？\n\n如果你真的感兴趣的话，请带上一颗蛋，到闪光平原的赛车场去找奎恩丁。他会告诉你更多细节的。",dEN="Oh, hello, <name>. I'm so glad to see you again. How was your trip to Darnassus?\n\nWell, you'll be happy to know that we've made quite a bit of progress while you've been gone. We even saved a nest full of eggs. Unfortunately, the mother died before we got to her.\n\nSay, would you want one for a pet? They look to hatch soon, so they'll need a good <father/mother>. What do you say?\n\nIf you're really interested, take one of the eggs to Quentin at the race tracks in Shimmering Flats. He'll tell you more.",o="与千针石林的奎恩丁谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Quentin in Thousand Needles.",p="你好啊，$c。\n\n可别被我所待的地方给糊弄了，我到这儿来可不是为了赛车……不是为了娱乐而来。\n\n我到千针石林是为了调查这片土地到底有多么贫瘠。现在我要让这里的盐硷地变成新鲜肥沃的土壤，使它获得新生！也许我很快就要在这附近发现水源了。\n\n你有没有觉得菲拉斯和千针石林之间的差异之大简直令人感到匪夷所思？一定有什么奇怪的魔法从中作祟……",pEN="Why hello, <class>.\n\nDon't let my location fool you, I'm really not here for the races... as entertaining as they may be.\n\nI'm actually here in Thousand Needles investigating all I can to find out how salvageable the land is. It has become my crusade of sorts to revitalize and replenish the area with new, fertile soil. Perhaps I'll find there's a water source nearby.\n\nTell me you haven't noticed how odd the transition between Feralas and Thousand Needles is. Strange magic was afoot when that happened.",c="啊，一枚精灵龙的蛋！要是我没看错的话，它就快要破壳而出了。能找到这东西已属不易，更不用说是一枚完好无损的蛋了。在菲拉斯那一带，这些日子已经很少见到精灵龙的蛋了。我知道在这片区域有很多偷猎者，他们以种种理由捕杀精灵龙。情况真的相当糟糕……这些小精灵龙成年后将变得极为美丽。\n\n你是怎么找到的呢？",cEN="Ah, a sprite darter egg, and one near maturation, if I'm not mistaken. Remarkable you've found one, let alone in this good a condition. They're rarely seen in Feralas these days. I understand there were various poachers in the area trying to capture and kill them for many reasons. Too bad really... such beautiful creatures when they reach adulthood.\n\nHow did you come across such a find?"}
Q[3842]={d="辛达尔和耶尔卡？这可太有意思了。我希望那些小精龙能意识到她们的一片好心。她们俩都相当能干。\n\n这样看来，她们把这颗蛋作为礼物送给你了。呃，好吧，现在你应该对这颗蛋负责了。看起来它马上就要孵化了，但是我们应该确定它是健康的。\n\n我需要两份坚韧药剂，然后用它们来施放一个小小的法术保护这颗蛋。至于其它的材料，我这里就有。",dEN="The Moonweavers, huh? Most intriguing. I wish the sprite darters could truly appreciate what it means to have those two look after them. They are both quite capable.\n\nSo, they gave you the egg as a gift. Well, then you should be responsible for it for as long as you desire. It appears it's almost ready to hatch, but we should ensure it's healthy and no damage has been done to it.\n\nI only need two elixirs of fortitude for a small spell to protect the egg. I have the rest of the components here with me.",o="将2份坚韧药剂交给千针林的奎恩丁。",oEN="Bring 2 Elixir of Fortitudes to Quentin in Thousand Needles.",p="我在这儿待的时间越长，就越想参与到赛车中去，$n。我可真有些犹豫……\n\n你找到药剂了吗？在我辨别出这颗蛋是否健康之后，我就会把它还给你，你要好好地保护它，直到小精龙孵化为止。\n\n准备好了就告诉我。",pEN="The longer I stay here, the more tempted I am to partake in these races, <name>. Truly boggling...\n\nHave you found the elixirs yet? Once I can tell if the egg is going to be healthy or not, I'll return it to you to hold onto until it's prepared to hatch.\n\nLet me know.",c="好极了。给我一些时间，让我来混合这些成分，然后看看这颗蛋能不能顺利孵化。",cEN="Wonderful. These will do nicely. Give me a moment to mix together my components and we shall see how well this egg is going to do."}
Q[3843]={d="很不错，$n。如果它的妈妈活着生下它的话，那它将是一只健康的宠物！\n\n要是你正巧要去辛特兰的鹰巢山，那我建议你去找一个名叫阿格纳的矮人谈谈，他精于训练动物，可以就孵化的最终步骤对你进行指导。\n\n但是你一定要快，$n，这颗蛋很脆弱，要是没有悉心的照料，它可活不了多久。",dEN="A magnificent specimen, <name>. If this creature survives gestation, then it'll be a healthy pet indeed!\n\nThere is one last thing I would suggest doing if you plan on following through with this--head to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands. Speak to a dwarf there named Agnar Beastamer, he's a master animal handler and should be able to guide you in the final steps of incubation.\n\nBut hurry, <name>, this egg is fragile and will not last long without proper care.",o="带着这枚脆弱的小精龙卵去辛特兰，与阿格纳谈一谈，但是你一定要在它还有生命力的时候赶到，在蛋里的小生命夭折之前，你只有1小时的时间。",oEN="Take your Fragile Sprite Darter Egg to the Hinterlands and speak to Agnar Beastamer, but hurry, you only have 1 hour to find him before the hatchling within the egg dies.",p="你好，$n。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="Greetin's, <name>. How can I be of service to ya?",c="呃……我以前可没见过这种蛋。要是我没判断错的话，这是精灵龙……看起来像是小精龙一类的。很好，这真是棒极了。\n\n要是这个小家伙能破壳而出，而且强壮健康的话，我们该给它找些食物。你最好赶紧帮我找些食物来吧。",cEN="Well, well, well... I haven't seen one of these in a dragon's age. Faerie dragon, if I'm not mistaken... looks to be of the sprite darter variety. Excellent, excellent indeed.\n\nWell, if this little fella's gonna hatch and live to be strong and healthy, then we should get some food for it. Good ya got it to me in time."}
Q[3844]={d="一艘被毁坏的小艇搁浅在岸边。这里是个小池塘，为什么会有一艘小艇搁浅在这里就不得而知了，不过从树上的痕迹来看，这里的水位并不是一直不变的。\n\n也许在附近继续搜查一下的话有可能发现更多的线索……",dEN="A destroyed raft rests along the shoreline. Considering this is only a small pond, it is not clear as to how it ended up here, although looking at the trees tells you that the water level may not be constant.\n\nPerhaps a little exploration in the area might uncover more clues...",o="在池塘附近查找与搁浅的小艇有关的线索。",oEN="Look around in the pond for a clue about who this wrecked raft may belong to.",c="在池底有一只被池水浸湿的袋子。",cEN="A water-logged pack rests at the bottom of the pond."}
Q[3845]={d="你把那只袋子从水中拉上了岸。如果你检查一下袋子中的东西，那么你应该可以知道它是谁的袋子。\n\n在马绍尔营地那里有一些迷路的旅行者，也许你可以在那里发现更多的线索。",dEN="Grabbing onto it, you pull the pack back to the shore. Perhaps if you examine the items inside the pack, you might find out more about who it belongs to.\n\nThere are a few stray travelers at Marshal's Refuge. Perhaps you might find out more there.",o="查看袋子里的东西，然后将它们交给物主。",oEN="Examine the items inside the pack and bring them to their owner.",p="你好，我以前见过你……是不是啊？",pEN="Hi there. I've seen you before... Haven't I?",c="哦……当然，这些东西看起来很熟悉……事实上，是有些熟悉……",cEN="Oh... Yes, these things do look familiar... well, kind of..."}
Q[3861]={d="\"咯—咯—咯—咯—咯……咯！\n\n咯—咯—咯。\"\n\n那只鸡抬头看着你，然后开始用爪子刨地。你觉得它是在拼写什么词，但看不清楚。会不会是……萨—尔—迪—恩？还没等你开口问，那只鸡就转身走开了。",dEN="\"Cluck... cluck... cluck... BACAW!\n\nCluck... cluck... cluck.\"\n\nThe chicken looks up at you and then starts to scratch its claws into the ground. You think it is spelling out a word, but you are not sure what it is. Could it be... S-A-L-D-E-A-N? Before you can ask, the chicken turns away and goes about its business.",o="找一些特殊的鸡饲料，把它交给友好的小鸡。当你找到小鸡的时候，在喂食它之前对它做出高兴的表情。（使用/cheer命令）",oEN="Find some Special Chicken Feed and return to your befriended chicken. When you find it, /cheer at it before trying to give it the Special Chicken Feed.",p="那只鸡用冷漠的眼睛盯着你，一副饿相。\n\n\"咯—咯—咯！\n\n咯—咯—咯。\"",pEN="The chicken stares at you with dark, cold eyes. It waits for you hungrily.\n\n\"BACAAAW!\n\nCluck...cluck...cluck.\"",c="\"咯—咯！\"\n\n那只鸡开始大口吞食你放下的饲料。\n\n过了一会儿，它像是被惊到一样四下张望，不安地来回挪动。哎呀，这只鸡不是公鸡，是只母鸡……你最好看看它下面。",cEN="\"BACAW!!!\"\n\nThe chicken starts to gobble up the feed you put down.\n\nAfter a moment, the chicken looks around, startled. It uncomfortably shuffles back and forth. Is this chicken pregnant? You think you better check underneath it."}
Q[3881]={d="我不知道你是怎么到这儿来的，但你真是让我眼前一亮！我是威利登·马绍尔，带领一支中立的探险队。我们最近这次最重大的行动碰上了一连串的灾难，其中最严重的就是我们低估了安戈洛环形山的凶险！\n\n当我们从环形山西南部和东北部的基地营地仓皇撤离时，留下了至关重要的补给。你看起来够$g能干:能干;——能帮我们取回来吗？",dEN="I don't know how you made it here, but you're a sight for sore eyes! I'm Williden Marshal, and I lead a non-aligned expedition troupe. Our latest and greatest endeavor has met with what seems like countless disasters, the most serious of which being that we underestimated the savagery of Un'Goro Crater!\n\nAs we fled our base camps in the southwestern and northeastern parts of the crater, we left behind vital supplies. You look like you're capable enough - can you help us by getting them back?",o="将食物箱和研究设备交给安戈洛环形山的威利德·马绍尔。",oEN="Bring a Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment to Williden Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.",p="要是我们还想有活着离开这鬼地方的机会，首先就需要大箱大箱的食物来充饥。此外，尽可能取回研究设备对身陷困境的我们而言也是个福音。",pEN="If we're going to have any chance of getting out of here alive, we'll need our big crate of foodstuffs. Also, getting at least some of our research equipment back would be a blessing in a sea of misery.",c="你取回了我们的食物和研究设备！你不仅拯救了探险队，还拯救了我们的生命。我和我的队员们对你感激万分，我们要好好感谢你。\n\n尽管我们现在的处境有些窘迫，但是你给予了我们无私的帮助，我绝对不会亏待你。谢谢你，$n——你在马绍尔探险队里赢得了一个朋友！",cEN="You got both our foodstuff AND our research equipment back! You've not only saved the expedition, you've also saved our lives. I and the rest of my team can't thank you enough; we just might make it here for a while now thanks to you.\n\nWhile we don't have much, I'm certainly not going to leave you high and dry for the invaluable help you've given us. Thank you, <name> - you've got a friend in Marshal Expeditions!"}
Q[3882]={d="你也许认为我在马绍尔探险队里当挖掘工是因为我喜欢这活儿，好吧，世上可能的确有比这更糟糕的差事……但是我还真没见过。\n\n我们本应是在恐惧小道那个鬼地方进行剑龙和双帆龙化石的挖掘工作——顺便提一句，那地名可真古怪。呃，那儿也有许多活着的恐龙！威利和霍莱坚持要研究这些东西，所以我们还是得弄些恐龙骨头来。咱们私下里说说，其实你只要从活着的恐龙身上给我取些骨头回来就行了。",dEN="You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind.\n\nWe were supposed to be digging in Terror Run - FANTASTIC name by the way - for dead stegodons and diemetradons. Well, there are plenty of live ones there too! Wil and Hol are still all about studying this death trap, so we need those dinosaur bones. Between you and me though, bringing some from live ones will work out just as well.",o="将8根恐龙骨头交给安戈洛环形山的斯巴克·尼米尔。",oEN="Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你可以对我有看法，但是，他们拿去研究的骨头究竟是来自古代的剑龙和双帆龙还是那些在我们扎营时差点把我们生吞了的恐龙，对他们而言没有什么区别。只要我们能活着离开这儿，我就高兴了……",pEN="Think whatever you want of me, but they're not going to care if the bones they get to research are from ones from ancient stegodons and diemetradons or the ones that almost devoured us wholesale when we were trying to set up our camps. I'll just be happy if we get out of here alive...",c="太好了，这些应该管用。那么，如果你允许的话……\n\n感谢你为我们把所有这些骨头从地里挖出来，而且完全没有伤害当地的野兽。\n\n你到底有没有伤到它们，我不想知道。咱们就让这件事这么过去，行吗？拿着——也许这个能让你把嘴闭紧点。只要能活着离开这儿，我什么都愿意，我早说过了！",cEN="Excellent, these should do the trick. And now, if you'll permit me...\n\nTHANKS FOR DIGGING ALL OF THESE BONES OUT OF THE GROUND FOR US AND NOT HURTING THE NATIVE BEASTS IN ANY WAY.\n\nWhether you really did or didn't, I don't want to know. Let's keep it that way, shall we? Here - maybe this will keep your lips shut on the whole thing. Anything to get out of here alive, I say!"}
Q[3883]={d="我们遭遇了一次挫折，但这并不意味着研究必须停下来！在落到这步田地之前，我们正在研究环形山南部的格里什虫。它们出现在安戈洛的生态系统中既陌生又反常，我们想弄清楚它们为什么在这里。\n\n它们的蜂巢网络中一定有幼虫孵育室。你可以通过那些到处悬挂的幼虫卵来辨认这些地方。用这个小瓶在任何一个孵育室附近采集蜂巢壁的样本，带回来给我们研究。但要非常小心！",dEN="Just because we've suffered a setback doesn't mean that research must stop! We were investigating the Gorishi insects in the southern part of the crater before winding up here. Their presence is alien to the ecology of Un'Goro, and we want to find out why.\n\nIn their hive network must be larval hatcheries. You can identify these places by their hanging larval spawns. Use this vial to take a sample of the hive wall near any of the hatcheries. Bring it back to me for study, but be careful!",o="使用采集瓶从安戈洛环形山的某个格里什虫巢的孵化室中收集一份巢穴侧壁的样本，在有悬挂着的虫卵的房间里收集样本。\n\n将虫穴内壁样本交给安戈洛环形山的霍莱伊·马绍尔。",oEN="Use the Scraping Vial to collect a Hive Wall Sample from one of the Gorishi hive hatcheries in Un'Goro Crater. Look for the chambers with the hanging larval spawns.\n\nBring the Hive Wall Sample to Hol'anyee Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你弄到格里什虫巢的样本了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the sample of the Gorishi hive for me to study, <name>?",c="嗯，不错。你帮了我的大忙……我希望能给你更多的回报，但是我现在被困在这片原始的土地上，很难再给你别的什么。不管怎么说，没有你的帮助，我是不可能在这里进行研究的！",cEN="Yes, this will do nicely. You've been a great help... I wish I could give you more than this, but being virtually stranded in the middle of a savage land does limit what I can and cannot give. Rest assured though - the research done here would not have been possible without your assistance!"}
Q[3884]={d="你找到了一本被撕破的日记，其中的某些部分仍然清晰可辨，目录中有威利德·马绍尔的署名。如果日记上面的记载没错的话，那么你可以在环形山的北部地区找到威利德。根据日记中所说的，他和他的同伴们的营地被袭击了，所以他们不得不寻找更高处的空地扎营，以避开横行在环形山里的凶残野兽。",dEN="You have uncovered a mangled journal. Parts of it remain legible, with a Williden Marshal claiming ownership over the contents therein. If the journal is accurate, then Williden may be found somewhere in the northern part of the Crater; according to the journal, he and his companions sought higher ground from the savage beasts of the Crater once their base camps were overrun.",o="将日记还给安戈洛环形山中的威利德·马绍尔。",oEN="Return the journal to Williden Marshal somewhere in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你好！我和我的同伴很高兴能在这里见到一个活生生的$r，而不是那些巨大野蛮的野兽！你来安戈洛环形山干什么？",pEN="Hello there! I and my companions are happy to see some living beings here other than overgrown savage beasts! What brings you into the Un'Goro Crater?",c="我的日记！我以为它和我们带到安戈洛的其它物品一样被弄丢了，谢谢你把它还给我！",cEN="Well look at this - my journal! I thought it was lost, much like almost everything else we brought into Un'Goro. I thank you kindly for returning this to me!"}
Q[3901]={d="你已经向我们展示了你在正常情况下的潜力，$n——现在让我们来看看你在压力下的表现吧。\n\n断骨骷髅是巫妖王手下的走狗，与你先前干掉的那些僵尸相比，它们更为强韧而凶残。去杀掉它们，再次向被遗忘者证明你的能力吧。别耽搁时间——当你完成任务后，就来找我谈谈。",dEN="You've shown your potential to the Forsaken under normal circumstances <name> - now let's see you under pressure.\n\nThe Rattlecage skeletons, more mindless minions of the Lich King, are a tougher foe than the zombies you have faced thus far. Again, thin their numbers and prove yourself to the Forsaken. Do not tarry - when you are done, speak to me again.",o="杀掉8个断骨骷髅，然后回到丧钟镇的暗影牧师萨维斯那里。",oEN="Kill 8 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done.",p="那些在执行任务时浪费时间的新兵也许会像我们那些不幸的兄弟姐妹一样，漫无目的地在镇子里徘徊。我不希望你再度成为一个毫无思想的僵尸，你说呢？",pEN="Those who dally in this task might as well end up wandering about aimlessly like our fallen brothers and sisters in the village. Let's hope you will fare better than them, yes?",c="我和你的关系到此为止了，$n——你已经证明自己配得上被赐予的自由。很多人会因为你的身份而$g与你为敌:与你为敌;，但你要知道，无论他们想对我们做什么，我们都是自由的，不会再被套上锁链。\n\n拿着这些，上路吧。你还有很多事要完成，$c。",cEN="I am finished with you, <name> - you have shown yourself to be worthy of the freedom that you have been given. Many will stand against you for what you have become, but know that no matter what they may try to do against us, we are free and will not be shackled again.\n\nTake these and be on your way. You have much to accomplish, <class>."}
Q[3902]={d="嘿，说你呢！要是你想实现自己的价值，那就听好了！\n\n我们要求那些刚刚爬出坟墓的新兵前往丧钟镇，搜寻任何可以为我们所用的装备，这些装备极有可能装在成堆的箱子里。我们希望能立即招募到更多的新兵，因此，除非我们想让他们赤手空拳地上阵，否则我们就得搜寻一切可用之物！\n\n开始工作吧，你这堆可悲的骨头！对那些不努力工作的家伙，我可是不会给予回报的。",dEN="You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up!\n\nWe need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment. Most likely, they'll be in stacks of boxes. We expect more recruits to be rising soon, and unless we want them to stumble about naked we had better get to scavenging!\n\nWell get to work, you miserable bag of bones! I'm not going to reward those without some hustle.",o="在丧钟镇及临近地区搜寻6件破烂装备，把它们交给亡灵卫兵萨尔坦。",oEN="Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain.",p="你有没有为我们搜寻到一些有用的装备？重新利用那些被弃置不用的装备并不是件可耻的事情。没人会给我们施舍的——我们被遗忘者必须要自给自足！",pEN="Have you managed to scavenge up some useful items for us? There is no shame in reusing that which has been tossed aside. No one is going to give us any handouts - we Forsaken will fend for ourselves!",c="干得好，$n，我就知道你不是$g个:个;废物。拿着，从我们目前收集到的货物里挑一件最好的东西吧。",cEN="Great work <name>, I knew you weren't useless. Here - have one of the better items I've found out of the lots that have been collected so far."}
Q[3903]={d="$n，你已经证明自己是一位$G可靠的:可靠的; $c，而且不怕吃苦。\n\n我的朋友米莉·奥丝沃斯遇到了麻烦。她的货车在修道院另一头，靠近马厩那边。我相信她会很高兴你能伸把手。",dEN="You've shown yourself a dependable <class>, <name>. Dependable, and not afraid to get your hands dirty, eh?\n\nI have a friend, Milly Osworth, who's in some trouble. She's over with her wagon on the other side of the abbey, near the stable. I'm sure she could use a pair of hands like yours.",o="与米莉·奥斯沃斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Milly Osworth.",c="啊，维里副队长让你来找我？他是个勇敢而热心的人，但是职责所在，他不能离开北郡修道院，所以也没法帮我的忙……\n\n你能帮帮我吗？",cEN="Oh, Deputy Willem told you to speak with me? He's a brave man and always willing to help, but his duties keep him stuck at Northshire Abbey and I'm afraid the problem I have today is beyond him.\n\nPerhaps you can help me?"}
Q[3904]={d="一伙迪菲亚盗贼趁我收割的时候闯进了北郡农场！我将这件事情报告给了北郡的卫兵，他们向我保证会尽快解决，但是……我担心我的那些葡萄！即使迪菲亚盗贼不去偷盗葡萄，恐怕那些卫兵在剿灭盗贼的过程中也会踩坏它们。\n\n你一定得帮助我！我把大部分的葡萄都装在箱子里了，但是我把它们留在了东南边的农场。\n\n把那些箱子给我拿回来吧！救救我的收成！",dEN="A gang of brigands, the Defias, moved into the Northshire Vineyards while I was harvesting! I reported it to the Northshire guards and they assured me they'd take care of things, but... I'm afraid for my crop of grapes! If the Defias don't steal them then I fear our guards will trample them when they chase away the thugs.\n\nPlease, you must help me! I gathered most of my grapes into buckets, but I left them in the vineyards to the southeast.\n\nBring me those buckets! Save my harvest!",o="收集8箱米莉的葡萄，把它们交给北郡修道院的米莉·奥斯沃斯。",oEN="Bring 8 crates of Milly's Harvest to Milly Osworth at Northshire Abbey.",p="你拿回我的葡萄了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have my harvest, <name>?",c="哦，谢谢你，$n！你保全了我的劳动成果！我希望你让那些迪菲亚盗贼吃了苦头，让他们明白在这儿闹事的下场。\n\n这些日子以来，我们的卫兵可能有些人手短缺，但是有你这样的英雄保护着我们可真是幸运！",cEN="Oh thank you, <name>! You saved my harvest! And I hope you showed a few of those Defias that they can't cause trouble around here.\n\nWe might be short on guards these days, but we're lucky to have heroes like you to protect us!"}
Q[3905]={d="我的作物完好无损，请将这张葡萄出货单交给尼尔斯修士。他在北郡经营一家销售食品和饮料的商店，我敢说当他知道他可以得到一批新鲜葡萄时一定会很高兴的。\n\n你可以在修道院的钟塔上找到尼尔斯修士，他喜欢在那儿饮酒。",dEN="Now that my crop is saved, take this Grape Manifest to Brother Neals. He manages the store of food and drink in Northshire, and I'm sure he'll be delighted to hear that he has fresh grapes.\n\nYou'll find Brother Neals in the abbey, in the bell tower... where he likes to taste his wine.",o="将葡萄出货单交给北郡修道院的尼尔斯修士。",oEN="Bring the Grape Manifest to Brother Neals in Northshire Abbey.",p="你看起来精神很好嘛！来！坐下来喝杯酒吧！",pEN="You look to be in fine spirits! Come! Have a seat, and have a drink!",c="让我看看……\n\n啊呀！米莉的葡萄保住了！当她告诉我盗匪洗劫了她的农场时，我差不多已经绝望了，但是我对圣光的信仰并未改变！\n\n有了你的帮助，我们就可以用葡萄酿造更多的酒了！愿圣光保佑你，$n，注意安全！",cEN="Let's see here...\n\nOh my! Milly's grapes have been saved! When she told me that brigands overran her vineyards I nearly despaired, but my faith in the Light did not waver!\n\nAnd through your bravery, we now have grapes for more wine! May the Light bless you, <name>, and keep you safe!"}
Q[3906]={d="部落的长老感觉到元素中的一种扰动。黑铁矮人召唤出了一个肮脏的灵魂，这个灵魂将用冲天的大火完全毁灭这个世界。我们必须调查这种不和谐的火焰的来源。\n\n到黑石山脉去，穿过火焰裂口，进入采石场。你应该可以在那里找到火焰之王——征服者派隆。\n\n解决这个造成扰动的源泉，然后向我回报。",dEN="The elders have felt a disturbance amongst the elements. The Dark Iron dwarves have summoned a foul spirit into our world that threatens to plague our lands with an eternal draught. This disharmony of flame must be investigated.\n\nTravel to Blackrock Mountain, through the Chasm of Flame, into the quarry. It is there that you shall find this lord of fire: Overmaster Pyron.\n\nEnd the disruption and return to me.",o="前往黑石山的采石场，杀死征服者派隆。完成这项任务后回到雷心那里。|n",oEN="Travel to the quarry in Blackrock Mountain and slay Overmaster Pyron. Return to Thunderheart when you have completed this assignment.",p="元素仍然处于混乱之中，$n。",pEN="The elements are still in disarray, <name>.",c="这不可能……绝对不可能……派隆的毁灭只是个开始，在黑石山脉的深处隐藏着更加邪恶阴险的堕落源泉。",cEN="This cannot be... it must not be. The destruction of Pyron has merely lifted a veil. Within the depths of Blackrock is a much more insidious source of corruption."}
Q[3907]={d="我能嗅到你周围空气中的污浊，$n。还有另一个存在，潜伏在黑石的深处，操控着这股污浊。\n\n风与大地呼喊着它的名字：伊森迪奥斯领主……但有某个存在……某样东西……在支配着它。它不过是个使者罢了。\n\n找到它，查明它的主人藏在何处！拿到这些信息后回来见我。|n",dEN="I can taste the foulness in the air that surrounds you, <name>. There is another, hidden in the depths of Blackrock, who does control this foulness.\n\nThe wind and earth cry his name: Lord Incendius... but someone... something... commands this being. He is merely an emissary.\n\nFind him and discover where his master hides. Return to me when you have collected this information.",o="进入黑石深渊，找到伊森迪奥斯领主。杀死他，把找到的所有情报都带给雷心。|n",oEN="Enter Blackrock Depths and track down Lord Incendius. Slay him and return any source of information you may find to Thunderheart.",p="整个大陆很快就会被烈焰吞噬，快一点行动，$n！",pEN="The flames will soon overtake these lands. Make haste, <name>!",c="<桑德哈特抓起库尔尼亚石板。>\n\n拉格纳罗斯……在这里……\n\n部落的长老对黑石山脉散发的堕落气息感到恐惧是有道理的。一个上古诸神的统帅！它在我们的世界中出现了！我们必须重新评估自己在卡加斯的地位了。现在，我们必须决定是要留在这里继续作战，还是因为这个新的发现而怯懦地逃走。\n\n不要再贸然探索黑石山脉了，$n。一个比世界上任何事物都要邪恶的力量就居住在那个火焰燃烧的深渊中。",cEN="<Thunderheart clutches the Tablet of Kurniya.>\n\nRagnaros... here...\n\nThe elders were right to fear the corruption emanating from Blackrock Mountain. A general of the Old Gods! IN OUR WORLD! We must reassess our position here in Kargath. We must decide on whether we stay and fight or run for fear of a new sundering.\n\nBe weary of any further exploration in Blackrock Mountain, <name>. A far greater evil than anything that exists in this world resides in those fiery depths."}
Q[3908]={d="你看，我已经对自己为什么会在这里完全没有概念了。没有人知道——这对所有的人来说都是个秘密！我什么都记不起来了……\n\n不过……你带给我的东西却让我想起了什么……\n\n我的剑！我想起来了，原本我是要去将其加强的，但是我不知道我为什么要那么做。很抱歉我不能告诉你更多的信息，因为我确实什么都记不起来了！\n\n不管怎么样，我知道你应该把剑带到什么地方去——把它交给冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山。你可以在温泉旁边找到她，她会用温泉的泉水来给剑中注入力量。",dEN="You see, I have no idea how I ended up here. No one really knows -- it's a secret to everybody! I just can't seem to remember anything...\n\nThese items you brought to me, though... I am remembering something.\n\nMy sword. I am supposed to strengthen it somehow, but I'm really not sure why. Sorry I can't tell you more, but I just don't remember!\n\nAnyhoo, I do know where you can take it -- Donova Snowden in Winterspring. You'll find her by the hot springs. She can temper the sword by the pools there.",o="把林克的剑交给冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山。",oEN="Take Linken's Sword to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",p="我的天啊，林克终于找人把剑送到我这里了。",pEN="My, my... So Linken did finally get around to sending me his sword.",c="嗯，我确实可以加强这把剑。在我工作的同时，你可以告诉我为什么林克花了那么长的时间才把剑送到我这里来。他并不健忘啊……",cEN="Well, of course I can temper this sword. While I'm working, you can explain what took Linken so long to get this to me. He's not usually one to forget things..."}
Q[3909]={d="什么，你说什么？林克……失忆了？\n\n哦，我明白了……他失去了自己的记忆……\n\n好吧，这是他的剑。但是它并不完整。我知道有人可以把它变得完整，但是……和他说话也许会很困难。\n\n听着，我知道有人可以帮助你，现在我没法把一切都给你解释清楚，总之你一定要得到视灵药剂。我所知道的唯一一个可以帮你的人就是格雷甘·山酒了。他行踪不定，但是我知道他眼下正在菲拉斯一带活动。",dEN="Now, what's this? Linken... FORGOT?\n\nOh, I see... Lost his memory...\n\nWell, here is his sword. It's not complete, though. I know of the one that can finish it, but... speaking with him may prove difficult.\n\nListen, I know of someone that will be able to help you. It's too much to explain right now, but you must somehow acquire a Videre Elixir. The only one I know that can help you with that is Gregan Brewspewer. He's hard to track down, but last I knew he was camping in the wilds of Feralas.",o="去菲拉斯找格雷甘·山酒。从他那里问到获取视灵药剂的方法，然后向冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山复命。",oEN="Seek out Gregan Brewspewer in northern Feralas. From him, learn how you may acquire the Videre Elixir, then return to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back already?",c="我需要一个小瓶子来确认这是我们所需的药剂……太棒了……就是它！",cEN="I'll need one vial to make sure that this is truly the elixir... Yes... This is the stuff."}
Q[3912]={d="有了这瓶药剂，你就能与一个你平时根本见不到的存在交谈……\n\n带上维德雷药剂和林肯的剑，前往塔纳利斯加基森城门外的墓地。到了那里就喝下药水。结果可能会让你大吃一惊，但不要惊慌。\n\n以你\"另一种\"形态向正北前进，直到抵达山脉。你会在某处岩石裂隙中见到那个你必须与之交谈的人。他叫盖瑞扬。\n\n但记住，只有在那副形态下他才会和你说话……\\",dEN="This elixir will allow you to speak with one that you would not normally even see...\n\nTake the Videre elixir, along with Linken's sword, to the graveyard just outside Gadgetzan in Tanaris. Once there, drink the potion. You may be quite surprised at the results, but do not be alarmed.\n\nIn your \"other\" form, head due north until you reach the mountains. You'll find the one you need to speak with in one of the rocky crevices. His name is Gaeriyan.\n\nRemember, he will only speak to you in that form...",o="在加基森镇外的墓地中使用视灵药剂，然后按照多诺瓦的指示找到加里杨。",oEN="Go to the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, and use the Videre Elixir. Follow the rest of Donova's instructions to find Gaeriyan.",c="已经很久没有人来找我说话了……",cEN="It has been long since any have come to talk with me..."}
Q[3913]={d="如果你回到墓地，$n，你会在那里找到一块墓碑……那不是一块普通的墓碑，它非常显眼。秘密就隐藏在其中。\n\n推动墓碑，然后你就可以发现那些秘密……",dEN="If you return to the graveyard, <name>, you will find a gravestone there... Not just any gravestone; this one will stand out from the others. Secrets lie within it.\n\nPush on the stone, and you will learn of these secrets...",o="复活，然后寻找加里杨让你去找的那块墓碑。",oEN="Resurrect, then look for the gravestone that Gaeriyan told you to find.",p="这一定是加里杨提到的那块墓碑。",pEN="This must be the gravestone that Gaeriyan mentioned...",c="你用力推动墓碑，它往旁边挪动了一点，露出了一个小凹槽。\n\n把林克的剑放入这个凹槽之后，你发现凹槽的形状和剑的形状正好吻合……",cEN="You push on the stone firmly, and it slides away, revealing a small depression underneath it.\n\nPlacing Linken's Sword into the depression, you realize that it fits perfectly..."}
Q[3914]={d="一阵强光闪过之后，你再次捡起了那把剑。它已经完全变成另一种样子了！",dEN="After a strong flash of light, you are able to pick up the sword again. It has been transformed!",o="把林克的强化之剑交给安戈洛尔环形山的林克。",oEN="Deliver Linken's Superior Sword to Linken in Un'Goro Crater.",p="哦！我记得你！你是……不，别说！让我想想！",pEN="Oh! I remember you! You are... No, don't tell me!",c="我的剑……它终于完成了！\n\n现在，如果我能记得我为什么需要它的话……\n\n给你，至少我记得要付报酬给你。",cEN="My sword... It's finished!\n\nNow, if only I could remember why I needed this...\n\nHere, let me at least pay you for your work."}
Q[3921]={d="我想我可能已经把主动式负载平衡器给弄坏了。这可不太妙，因为我已经对安德麦的一些同伴谈及它了，而且他们对此非常感兴趣。我们必须想办法修好它！\n\n把这个坏掉的主动式负载平衡器交给维妮·布特巴克，她就在贫瘠之地和灰谷之间的部落前哨站里。她非常聪明而且好奇，如果你将主动式负载平衡器给她看的话，我敢打赌她会欣然帮你修理它。",dEN="I think I might have broken that Samophlange. That's not good, because I already told some colleagues in Undermine about it and they were very intrigued. We must find a way to fix it!\n\nTake the broken samophlange to Wenikee Boltbucket, just south of Mor'shan Rampart, the horde outpost between the Barrens and Ashenvale. She is very clever and inquisitive. If you show her the samophlange I bet she'd jump at the chance to fix it.",o="将损坏的主动式负载平衡器交给维妮·布特巴克。",oEN="Bring the Broken Samophlange to Wenikee Boltbucket.",p="我正忙着干活哪，$c。除非你有事找我，不然你最好该干什么干什么去……",pEN="I'm very busy with my work, <class>. Unless you have something for me, it'd be best if you moved along...",c="哦，这是什么？主动式负载平衡器？啥叫主动式负载平衡器？\n\n呃……这里面有复杂的齿轮传动结构运转时发出的声音。啊，天哪！我要修好它，看看它到底是干什么用的，好吗？",cEN="Oh, what's this? A samophlange, you say? What's a samophlange??\n\nAh... but look at the way it moves when you handle it. And there's the sound of intricate gears inside. Oh my! I want to fix it and see what it does, don't you??"}
Q[3922]={d="我想修好这个主动式负载平衡器，但是，我需要一些材料。我用光了17.5规格的高强度齿轮，而我需要很多这样的东西才能继续工作。\n\n要弄到这种齿轮的话，最近的地方是东面的淤泥沼泽。风险投资公司的家伙们通常会把齿轮放在他们的工具桶里。到淤泥沼泽去，检查一下你在那里找到的工具桶，当你搜集了足够的高强度齿轮后再回到我这里来。",dEN="I want to fix this samophlange, but to do that I'm going to need some supplies. I ran out of seventeen-point-five gauge nugget slugs and I'm going to need a bunch of those for the work ahead.\n\nThe closest place to get them is the Sludge Fen to the east. The Venture Company usually keeps them in their tool buckets. Go to the Sludge Fen and look in the tool buckets you find there, then return to me when you've gathered enough nugget slugs.",o="把15个高强度齿轮交给贫瘠之地的维妮·布特巴克。",oEN="Bring 15 Nugget Slugs to Wenikee Boltbucket in the Barrens.",p="你拿到高强度齿轮了吗，$n？我一直在盯着这个主动式负载平衡器，而且在急切地盼望着能开始动手修补它。",pEN="Do you have the nugget slugs, <name>? I've been eyeing this Samophlange and I can't wait to tinker with it.",c="太好了，你搞到齿轮了！我马上就开始工作……",cEN="Great, you got them! Now I can get to work..."}
Q[3923]={d="好吧，我失败了。我在主动式负载平衡器上安装了更多的仪表来测量它的结构完整度，读出来的数据表明现在的完整度很低。我也许需要加些转盘或者一两根杠杆来继续尝试，但是……没准我把它会搞得更糟。\n\n你应该把主动式负载平衡器交给雷里·格里斯高布。他过去是为风险投资公司干活的——如果有人知道该怎么修理这玩意的话，那一定就是雷里了。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛荣誉谷中的诺格机械店找到他。",dEN="Well, that didn't work. I put some extra gauges on the samophlange to measure its structural integrity, and they read the integrity at an all-time low. I could add some more dials and maybe a lever or two to try and fix it, but... I think that might make things even worse.\n\nYou should take the samophlange to Rilli Greasygob. He used to work for the Venture Company -- if anyone knows how to fix it, it's Rilli.\n\nYou can find him at Nogg's Machine Shop in Orgrimmar, in the Valley of Honor.",o="把破碎的主动式负载平衡器交给奥格瑞玛的雷里·格里斯高布。",oEN="Bring the Broken and Battered Samophlange to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",p="小心你的头！最好不要影响我的工作！",pEN="Mind your head! I don't want it to get in the way of my work!",c="这是什么？咦？！这是个沙姆弗兰格！你从哪儿弄来的？你是不是去贫瘠之地的风险投资公司驻地乱翻过了？\n\n你要么非常勇敢，要么非常$g愚蠢:愚蠢;。",cEN="What's this? Why, it's a samophlange! Where did you get this thing? Have you been poking around the Venture Company holdings in the Barrens?\n\nYou must be very brave, or very stupid."}
Q[3924]={d="我想我可以修复主动式负载平衡器，但首先我需要一本用户手册。当我在风险投资公司干活的时候，我有个名叫考博普拉格的对手……他会把主动式负载平衡器的秘密告诉那些他信任的同党。不过我不是他的亲信……\n\n考博普拉格应该在贫瘠之地东北部的石矿洞里。从他那里把手册拿过来，如果他把其中的一部分给了其他人的话，你也要把它们一起拿来。",dEN="I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first. When I was in the Venture Company I had a rival, Boss Copperplug, who hoarded the secrets of the samophlange, giving out small bits of knowledge on the device to those he trusted. I wasn't one of the trusted few...\n\nBoss Copperplug used to stay at the Boulder Lode Mine in northeastern Barrens. Get the manual from him, and if he's given pages from it to anyone, you'll have to collect them too.",o="把主动式负载平衡器说明书交给奥格瑞玛的雷里·格里斯高布。",oEN="Bring the Samophlange Manual to Rilli Greasygob in Orgrimmar.",p="你拿到说明书了吗？",pEN="Do you have the manual?",c="你成功了！我马上就研习这本说明书的内容，然后找出修复主动式负载平衡器的方法！我和棘齿城的斯布特瓦夫谈过了——他感谢你的帮助，并想要对你进行奖励。\n\n我也想感谢你，如果我能修好它的话，我会通知你的……",cEN="You got the manual! I can't wait to read it and find out how to fix the Samophlange! I spoke with Sputtervalve in Ratchet--he wanted to thank you for your help, and wanted to reward your efforts.\n\nI want to thank you too, and if I ever get this thing fixed I'll let you know..."}
Q[3941]={d="让我想想……让我想想……我来这里肯定是为了某个很重要的事情……\n\n我有个办法，$n。那边的那个洞穴里有个叫科琳的侏儒，我记得我刚到这里的时候她给我留下了很好的印象。也许在我思维混乱的时候曾向她提过一些关于我的东西。\n\n为什么你不去问问她呢？哦，不过你要小心——她对这个地区的那些水晶表现得特别疯狂，我不知道她究竟想干什么！",dEN="Thinking... Thinking... I know I came here for something important...\n\nI have an idea, <name>. In the cave over there is a gnome named J.D. that was very kind to me when I first arrived here. Perhaps in my disoriented state, I might have mentioned something to her.\n\nWhy don't you go ask her if she knows anything? Oh, but be careful -- she's always messing with those crazy glowing crystals I've seen in the crater. I'm not quite sure what she's up to in there!",o="到马绍尔营地那里的山洞中去找科琳。",oEN="Find J.D. Collie in the cave at Marshal's Refuge.",c="就站在那里别动……我正在实验一种新的水晶组合……",cEN="Stay where you are for just a moment... I am testing out a new combination of crystals..."}
Q[3942]={d="哦……林肯？是啊，他是个有趣的家伙。他刚到这里时，一直在嘟囔各种奇怪的东西。估计是脑袋被狠狠撞过。\n\n不过他说过一句话让我记住了——他正在制作某种图腾，还说必须和一个叫艾瑞丹·蓝风的人谈谈……好像是在一个叫费伍德森林的地方？\n\n不过我觉得他现在也$g说不了:说不了;什么了。如果你想知道更多，也许该自己去找艾瑞丹？",dEN="Oh... Linken? Yeah, he's a funny one. When he first got here, he was mumbling about all kinds of strange things. Probably got bumped on the head pretty hard, I imagine.\n\nSomething he said kinda stuck with me though -- that he was making some sort of totem; said he had to talk to someone named Eridan Bluewind... in a place called Felwood, I think?\n\nI doubt he could tell you much now, though. If you want to know more, maybe you should look for Eridan yourself?",o="到费伍德森林去找艾瑞丹·蓝风。",oEN="Find Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood.",c="你好，$c。我能帮你什么忙吗？",cEN="Hello, <class>. Is there something I can help you with?"}
Q[3961]={d="真难想象林克来这里居然是为了帮助我们除掉火焰使者……他看上去是那么普通的一个侏儒，但是我确实感觉到他和别的侏儒有些不同，他居然对我的实验或者小装置一点都不感兴趣！他一定拥有一颗真正的战士之心。\n\n把图腾交给他，看看这是否能够帮助唤起他的记忆。",dEN="To think all this time that the reason Linken came here was to rid us of Blazerunner... He seems like such an ordinary guy, but I did notice that he's not at all interested in any of my experiments or gadgets like most gnomes would be. He must be a true warrior at heart.\n\nBring the totem to him. See if that helps him remember why he came here.",o="把亚奎门塔斯的银图腾交给马绍尔营地里的林克。",oEN="Take the Silver Totem of Aquementas to Linken in Marshal's Refuge.",p="你好，我们又见面了，$n！",pEN="Hi, again, <name>!",c="科琳帮你什么忙了吗？",cEN="Did J.D. help you at all?"}
Q[3962]={d="$n，我终于想起来了……我来这里是要和火焰使者作战的。我经历了一段漫长的旅途，原本最重要的目标就是它。\n\n但是我不再是英雄了……你才是。迄今为止你已经做了那么多——应该由你来完成这个任务，而不是我。\n\n去找到火焰使者并打败它吧。它守护着一个被称作金色火焰的神器，这个神器的力量比我所见过的任何东西都要强大，如果它落在邪恶势力的手中，那会是一件非常危险的事情。\n\n你应该找些同伴一起去完成这个任务——独自行动是很危险的。",dEN="<name>, I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step.\n\nBut I am no longer the hero... You are. All that you have done -- you must finish this now, not me.\n\nBlazerunner guards an artifact called the Golden Flame. It provides power more vast than anything else I have ever known, and it is dangerous in the hands of one with an evil heart.\n\nYou will want to bring others with you -- it's dangerous to go alone. Take this as my advice.",o="到马绍尔营地南边的火羽山去。\n\n找到火焰使者，并使用图腾除掉它的防护光环。在击败它之后从洞中取得金色火焰。",oEN="Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.\n\nFind Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",p="火焰使者用金色火焰创造了一个保护光环，使它无法被击败。只要使用亚奎门塔斯的银图腾，你就可以消除这个光环。",pEN="Blazerunner is almost invincible behind the aura he has created by using the Golden Flame. Only you have the power to remove it with the Silver Totem of Aquementas.",c="谢谢你，$n。\n\n金色火焰终于要回到我的家乡了，在那里它会受到保护，再也不会被用于邪恶的目的。\n\n要不是你，我到现在还不知道自己是谁！你为我做了这么多，我想送你一件非常特别的东西……\n\n挑你喜欢的吧！",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nThe Golden Flame will now be returned back to my homeland, where it may be protected, never again to be used for evil.\n\nSince you did so much for me, I'd like you to have this. Without you, I'd still have no idea who I am!"}
Q[3981]={d="可怜的加尔加尔……他连反应的工夫都没有。砰！那支箭正中他的头顶。他以前也不怎么聪明，现在就更……\n\n<加拉玛夫做了个鬼脸。>\n\n我们把箭拔出来时，发现箭杆上卷着一张纸条。纸条上画着一个粗劣的图案——一个被关在栅栏后面的兽人，署名是哥沙克指挥官。\n\n如果他还活着，就在深渊里，你得找到他。\n\n你说是陷阱？那当然了，笨蹄子！所以才派你去！|n",dEN="Poor Gargal... didn't even see it coming. WHAM! The arrow landed dead center on the top of his head. He was no genius before but now...\n\n<Galamav grimaces.>\n\nWhen we dislodged the arrow, we noticed a rolled up note attached to the shaft. On the note was a crudely drawn picture of an orc behind bars with the signature of Commander Gor'shak attached.\n\nIf he's still alive in the Depths, you'll have to find him.\n\nA trap you say? Well no kidding, numb hooves! That's why you're going!",o="在黑石深渊里找到指挥官哥沙克。\n\n在那幅草图上画着的是一个铁栏后面的兽人，也许你应该到某个类似监狱的地方去找找看。",oEN="Find Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths.\n\nYou recall that the crudely drawn picture of the orc included bars drawn over the portrait. Perhaps you should search for a prison of some sort.",c="我们没有多少时间。仔细听好了，$R。我要告诉你的事情可是高度机密，千万不要告诉别人！",cEN="We haven't got much time. Listen carefully, <race>. What I have to tell you is classified and for your ears only."}
Q[3982]={d="我受萨尔的差遣来到这里，你真的认为这些小丑可以抓住我吗？我是主动送上门的，这样我才能从他们这里收集情报。\n\n<哥沙克压低了声音。>\n\n黑铁皇帝索瑞森绑架了铁炉堡的公主，她就被关押在这座城市里！我敢打赌，当老麦格尼听到这个消息时，他的心脏大概会停止跳动的。\n\n<哥沙克大笑了起来。>\n\n嘘～～！你听到了吗？卫队来了！准备战斗！",dEN="I was sent here under the auspices of Thrall. Do you actually think these buffoons could capture me? I allowed myself to be captured so that I could gather intelligence.\n\n<Gor'shak whispers.>\n\nThe Princess of Ironforge has been kidnapped by Emperor Thaurissan. Princess Bronzebeard is in this very city! I bet old Magni's heart almost stopped when he heard that news.\n\n<Gor'shak laughs.>\n\nShhh! Do you hear that? Guards coming! DEFEND YOURSELF!",o="保护哥沙克。",oEN="Defend Gor'shak.",p="保护你自己吧，$g蠢货:蠢货;！",pEN="Defend yourself, fool!",c="真是千钧一发呀。他们已经察觉到你了……会有更多的家伙过来的。",cEN="That was a close call. They have been alerted to your presence... more will surely come."}
Q[4001]={d="到目前为止，我和卡兰——就是大厅对面那间牢房里的矮人——的交流还很有限。不过我已经让他相信，我，呃，我们，对他没有恶意。\n\n去和他谈谈，尽可能多地打听关于公主和绑架者的情报。然后把这些情报带回给大酋长。\n\n萨尔不想伤害公主，所以他制定了一个周密的计划，其中包括让她安全返回铁炉堡。卡兰已经知道这一切了……去吧！|n",dEN="So far, my communication with the dwarf, Kharan, in the cell across the hall, has been limited. I have, however, managed to convince him that I, rather -we- mean him no harm.\n\nGo speak with him and gather as much information about the Princess and her captors as possible. Take that information back to the Warchief.\n\nThrall does not want the Princess harmed, but instead, has some grand plan laid out, which includes her being safely returned to Ironforge. Kharan already knows all of this... Go!",o="与卡兰·巨锤交谈，收集关于茉艾拉·铜须公主被绑架的情报。把这些情报带给奥格瑞玛的萨尔。\n\n你记得哥沙克提到过卡兰被关在附近的一间牢房里。|n",oEN="Speak with Kharan Mighthammer and gather information about Princess Moira Bronzebeard's kidnapping. Take that information to Thrall in Orgrimmar.\n\nYou recall Gor'shak mentioning that Kharan is being held in a cell nearby.",p="你到这里来干什么？",pEN="What brings you to these hallowed grounds?",c="对部落而言，这是一个永远改变这个世界的外交格局的机会。仔细听着，$n。\n\n这次任务绝对不能失败。",cEN="This is a chance for the Horde to change the political climate of our war torn world forever. Listen carefully, <name>.\n\nFailure of this mission is not an option."}
Q[4002]={d="你带来了非常有价值的情报，$n。\n\n作为酋长，我的职责就是做一切对部落有益的事情，以确保我们的后代有一个光明的未来。\n\n一个结交新盟友的机会已经落在了我们的肩上。帮助矮人的举动可以极大地改善我们与东部王国的关系。这就是你绝对不能失败的原因！\n\n你准备好了吗？",dEN="You bring excellent information, <name>.\n\nAs Warchief, it is my duty to do what is best for the Horde. To ensure that the generations that come after us are not forced into a hopeless existence.\n\nThe opportunity to shape our future alliances has fallen into our collective laps. A move to help the dwarves could greatly strengthen our relationships in the Eastern Kingdoms. This, then, is why you must not fail!\n\nAre you prepared?",o="如果你准备好要接受萨尔所安排的任务，就去找他谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Thrall if you are prepared to take on the mission he has planned.",c="踏出这一步，你就再也无法回头了，$n。",cEN="There is no going back beyond this point, <name>."}
Q[4003]={d="这次行动是针对黑铁矮人的，如果我们成功了，那么他们的整个王国都将遭到一次巨大的冲击。\n\n茉艾拉公主正处于索瑞森大帝的控制之下。要想救她的话，你就必须杀了索瑞森。千万小心，你的任务非常危险，因为公主可能会在索瑞森的控制下向你发起攻击。\n\n不要伤害她！",dEN="This strike against the Dark Iron dwarves, if successful, will send a shockwave throughout their entire kingdom.\n\nPrincess Bronzebeard is under the control of Emperor Thaurissan. To free her, you must kill the Emperor. Be warned, your task is doubly dangerous, as Bronzebeard will attack you without question while under the control of the Emperor.\n\nDO NOT HARM HER!",o="杀死达格兰·索瑞森大帝，把茉艾拉·铜须公主从他的邪恶法术中解救出来。|n",oEN="Slay Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and free Princess Moira Bronzebeard from his evil spell.",p="<茉艾拉公主惊恐地蜷缩成一团。>",pEN="<Princess Moira cowers in fear.>",c="看看你都干了些什么！",cEN="What have you done!"}
Q[4004]={d="你杀了我的丈夫，$r！我的孩子将来到这个世界而没有父亲。\n\n<茉艾拉公主直直地指着你。>\n\n我向你保证，这个孩子将成为铁炉堡王国的下一任统治者。你和你所有的同族都将因为这一恶行而被追杀到世界末日。\n\n<你觉得茉艾拉公主可能仍受索瑞森法术的残余影响。>\n\n现在别来烦我，$r。我相信你的大酋长一定急于知道他这趟插手的成果。|n",dEN="You have slain my husband, <race>! My child will be born into this world without a father.\n\n<Princess Moira points directly at you.>\n\nI assure you, this child will be the next ruler of the kingdom of Ironforge. You and your kind shall be hunted down until the end of days for this wrongful act.\n\n<You think that Princess Moira may be suffering from the residual effect of Thaurissan's spell.>\n\nLeave me be, <race>. I am certain your warchief will be eager to hear the results of his meddling.",o="回到奥格瑞玛格罗玛什要塞的萨尔那里。|n",oEN="Return to Thrall at Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar.",c="<萨尔对你带来的消息感到震惊。>\n\n新的威胁正在地平线上逼近。随着麦格尼的岁月流逝，这个尚未出世的黑铁矮人将有机会入主铁炉堡。\n\n你已经完成了我交代的事，为此你会得到$g奖赏:奖赏;。\n\n现在离开我吧，$n！我必须和希尔瓦娜斯和凯恩商议。",cEN="<Thrall is taken aback by the information you have presented to him.>\n\nA new threat now looms on the horizon. As Magni's years dwindle down, the way shall be opened for this unborn Dark Iron to become ruler of Ironforge.\n\nYou have accomplished what I asked of you and for that, you shall be rewarded.\n\nNow leave me, <name>! I must confer with Sylvanas and Cairne."}
Q[4005]={d="把这包补给带到塔纳利斯去。前往失落的海盗湾，寻找一圈石头。\n\n秘密就在最东边的半岛上……\n\n只有站在那个石圈里，才能诵读阿库尔之书，召唤出唯一能把你的物品转化为图腾的生物——那个图腾将助你对抗火焰使者。\n\n唤醒阿奎门塔斯它会很不高兴，但记住，你必须留在石圈内，它才能转化那些物品。",dEN="Take this bag of supplies with you to Tanaris. Travel to Lost Rigger Cove, and look for a circle of stones.\n\nThe eastmost peninsula is the secret...\n\nFrom this circle only, read from the book of Aquor; summon the only creature that can transform the items you collected into a totem to fight Blazerunner.\n\nAquementas will not be pleased to be awakened, but remember, you must remain in the circle for him to transform the items.",o="把阿奎尔之书、银爪和铁树之心带到塔纳利斯去。\n\n使用这本书召唤亚奎门塔斯。\n\n在图腾完成之后，把它交给马绍尔营地的科琳。",oEN="Take the Book of Aquor, the Silvery Claws, and the Irontree Heart to Tanaris.\n\nUse the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas.\n\nAfter you have the completed totem, take it to J.D. Collie in Marshal's Refuge.",p="你回来了？嗯……让我看看那个东西，$n。",pEN="So you're back, eh? Hmm... Let me take a look at that, <name>.",c="你是说火焰使者……？\n\n是的，我知道在这个环形山中部烧焦的那片土地上有一个强大的元素生物。我们都尽量和它保持距离，从来都没人能击破环绕在它周围的光环。许多想要挑战它的人，都从那条岩石路上被推了下来。",cEN="Blazerunner, you say...\n\nYes, I am aware that a strong elemental resides in the charred center of the crater. We all just keep our distance; none have been able to penetrate the powerful aura that surrounds him. Many have been pushed from the rocky paths onto the ground below when trying to face him."}
Q[4021]={d="部落对你战胜科卡尔部族的功绩感到非常高兴，但是科卡尔部族却为此发了狂。有报告称科卡尔部族的一支从凄凉之地来到了贫瘠之地，准备进行报复。到目前为止，我得到的最新消息是：他们已经在从西面往这里进发了！\n\n去迎战科卡尔部族的入侵者吧，彻底结束他们对贫瘠之地的威胁！杀死那些该死的半人马，直到他们的首领——督军克罗姆扎出现在你面前，干掉他，把他的旗帜撕下一片作为证据。\n\n我们都指望你了，$n。",dEN="The Horde commends your successes against the Kolkar, but the Kolkar themselves are maddened. I have reports that a contingent of Kolkar has traveled to the Barrens from their home in Desolace, to seek vengeance. My latest report was that, even now, they move against these bunkers, from the west!\n\nFace the Kolkar invaders, and end their threat in the Barrens. Kill them until their leader, Warlord Krom'zar, appears. Defeat him and bring me a piece of his banner as proof.\n\nWe're counting on you, <name>.",o="将克罗姆扎军旗的碎片交给十字路口西边的雷戈萨·死门。",oEN="Bring a Piece of Krom'zar's Banner to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.",p="你拿到旌旗了吗？",pEN="Do you have the banner?",c="你成功了！你打败了科卡尔部族！\n\n我会把这个消息告诉萨尔的，$n。\n\n你证明了自己的价值，部落为你而骄傲。",cEN="You have done it! You have defeated the Kolkar!\n\nI will be sure Thrall receives word of your actions here, <name>.\n\nStand tall. You do yourself, and the Horde, proud."}
Q[4022]={d="龙族已经知晓你在灼热峡谷的作为。\n\n让我看看，$r。那片蜕皮，蠢货。",dEN="The flight is aware of your work in the Searing Gorge.\n\nShow it to me, <race>. The molt, imbecile.",o="把卡拉兰·风刃交给你的黑龙蜕皮拿给塞勒斯·暗须看。|n",oEN="Show Cyrus Therepentous the Black Dragonflight Molt you received from Kalaran Windblade.",p="<塞勒斯的双眼变成了两颗燃烧的火球。>",pEN="<Cyrus's eyes form two blazing spheres.>",c="<塞勒斯查看了一下那块龙皮。>\n\n看来你还不是一文不值的。",cEN="<Cyrus examines the molt.>\n\nYou have proven that you are not entirely useless, mortal."}
Q[4023]={d="你在寻访龙族？向我展示你价值的证明吧，凡人。",dEN="You seek out the Flight? Present to me proof of your worth, mortal.",o="向塞勒斯·萨雷芬图斯证明你的价值。\n\n你感觉到塞勒斯似乎对你不屑一顾。",oEN="Show Cyrus Therepentous proof of your worth.\n\nYou have a feeling that Cyrus already knows that you are unworthy.",p="<塞勒斯的双眼变成了两颗燃烧的火球。>",pEN="<Cyrus's eyes form two blazing spheres.>",c="<塞勒斯查看了一下那块龙皮。>\n\n看来你还不是一文不值的。",cEN="<Cyrus examines the molt.>\n\nYou have proven that you are not entirely useless, mortal."}
Q[4024]={d="我要为火焰之山中的炙热烈焰歌唱，我要让黑石山的熔岩瀑布贯穿我的身体。我所渴求的就是那种精华，那种炙焰的感觉。\n\n在黑石深渊住着一个纯火焰铸成的怪物：贝尔加，他是从拉格纳罗斯的火焰中诞生的。杀掉贝尔加，然后从他燃烧的身体中取出他心中的烈焰。\n\n使用黑龙皮就可以安全地萃取这种烈焰。\n\n大功告成后，你会获得奖励的。",dEN="I wish to taste the searing flames of the mountain of fire. To let the molten fires of Blackrock cascade across my being. That essence, that searing heat, it is what I crave.\n\nBael'Gar resides in the Depths of Blackrock: A being of pure flame, born of the fires of Ragnaros. Slay Bael'Gar and from his smoldering remains bring for me a piece of his inner fire.\n\nUse the molt on his remains to safely extract the inner flame.\n\nSucceed and be rewarded.",o="前往黑石深渊，杀死贝尔加。\n\n你只知道那个巨人住在黑石深渊里。记得对贝尔加的遗骸使用变质的黑龙蜕皮，以捕获火焰精华。\n\n把封装好的火焰精华带给塞勒斯·暗须。|n",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay Bael'Gar.\n\nYou only know that the giant resides inside Blackrock Depths. Remember to use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on Bael'Gar's remains to capture the Fiery Essence.\n\nReturn the Encased Fiery Essence to Cyrus Therepentous.",p="你干掉那个怪物了吗？",pEN="Has the giant been felled?",c="<塞勒斯从你的手中一把拿过烈焰精华。>\n\n就是它！\n\n拿着你的奖励，然后走开。马上从我眼前消失！",cEN="<Cyrus snatches the fiery essence from your hands.>\n\nYES!\n\nTake your prize and be gone. Leave my sight at once!"}
Q[4041]={p="替我弄一支灵根草来，我就可以帮你制作视灵药剂。\n\n我知道所有关于草药和炼金术的事情……为什么？让我告诉你，那次我把准备拿来当午餐的乳酪变成了金子的故事……喂……你要去哪儿？",pEN="Bring me an Evoroot, and sure, I can make ya that Videre Elixir.\n\nI know all kinds of things about herbs and alchemy... Why, let me tell you the story about the time I transmuted gold from the cheese I was going to eat for lunch... hey... Where are you going?",c="这么说来，你轻松搞定了那个米布隆，是吗？",cEN="So, you pulled a fast one on ol' Miblon, eh?"}
Q[4061]={d="我们最初几次进入灼热峡谷时，就注意到了那些机器。经过进一步调查，我们发现它们是从燃烧平原运来的，很可能来自黑石深渊。这就是我们需要你的原因，$n。\n\n你的任务是前往燃烧平原，从该地区的岩石自动机和较小的岩石造物身上取回元素碎片。等你收集到足够的数量，就回来见我，我会查明它们的来源。|n",dEN="The machines made themselves known to us during our initial forays into the Searing Gorge. Upon further investigation we discovered that they were being imported from Burning Steppes, possibly Blackrock Depths. That is what we need you for, <name>.\n\nYour first task is to venture to the Burning Steppes and recover elemental shards from the rock automatons and lesser rock creations of the region. Once you have collected a sufficient amount, return to me and I shall determine their source of origin.",o="到燃烧平原去为塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼收集10块断裂的元素碎片。\n\n塞朵拉曾经说过，那里的机械傀儡和元素生物是这种碎片的主要来源。",oEN="Venture to the Burning Steppes and recover 10 Fractured Elemental Shards for Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania.\n\nYou recall Theodora mentioning the golems and elementals of that region as being a source for these shards.",p="不要轻视这个任务，$n！",pEN="Do not take this task lightly, <name>!",c="<塞朵拉把碎片放在她的面前。>\n\n<塞朵拉用一只巨型放大镜检查着那些碎片。>\n\n很有趣。每块碎片上面都刻着……一串字母。",cEN="<Theodora lays the fragments out before her.>\n\n<Theodora carefully examines the fragments with an enormous monocle.>\n\nInteresting. Etched into the structural foundation of each of these fragments are... initials."}
Q[4062]={d="G.L.A.\n\n这就是印在元素碎片上的\"首字母缩写\"。首字母下面还有某种等级标记。你在燃烧平原摧毁的那些机器是IV级的。我猜这是个相当低的等级。把这份碎片样本带给东边营地的洛特威尔·维里亚图斯。他是元素科学领域颇有声望的学者。也许他能帮上我们这项调查。\n\n",dEN="G.L.A.\n\nThose are the 'initials' imprinted on the elemental shards. Below the initials are a rank marking of some sort. The machinations you destroyed in the Burning Steppes were of 'Rank IV.' I assume that this is a lowly rank.\n\nTake this shard sample to Lotwil Veriatus in the camp to the east. He is a scholar of some renown in the field of elemental sciences. He may be able to assist us in our search.",o="把元素碎片样本带给洛特威尔·维里亚图斯。\n\n你记得西奥多拉说过，洛特威尔驻扎在东边的一个营地里。|n",oEN="Take the Elemental Shard Sample to Lotwil Veriatus.\n\nYou recall Theodora saying that Lotwil was stationed in a camp to the east.",p="你那儿拿着什么，$r？",pEN="What have you got there, <race>?",c="<鲁特维尔的脸变得煞白。>\n\n我……我知道这些东西代表着什么……",cEN="<Lotwil's face turns white.>\n\nI... I know these markings."}
Q[4063]={d="不可能是阿格曼奇！因为阿格曼奇在十年前就被杀掉了。什么？我为什么那么肯定？因为我就是杀死他的人之一。\n\n他是个卑鄙的矮人，为了自己的邪恶计划而逼我为他工作。看来坏蛋总有办法逃脱正义的惩罚。\n\n如果这一切都是阿格曼奇干的，那他就必须死！你去帮我弄些他最近制造的傀儡人的样品来吧，如果有合适的样品，我们也许就可以阻止他了。那些东西在黑石深渊里守护着阿格曼奇。",dEN="This can't be Argelmach! Argelmach was killed ten years ago. How can I be sure? I was the one who killed him.\n\nHe was a despicable dwarf, hell-bent on twisting my life's work to meet his diabolical needs. It seems that the wicked always find a way to escape justice.\n\nIf this is Argelmach's handiwork then he must be destroyed. I will need samplings of his latest creations. With the proper samples, I may be able to stop this uprising. The creations guard Argelmach in Blackrock Depths.",o="找到并杀死魔像领主阿格曼奇。把他的头带给洛特威尔。你还需要从保护阿格曼奇的狂怒魔像和战争使者构造体身上收集十个完好的元素之核。你知道这些，因为你是$g个先知:个先知;。",oEN="Find and slay Golem Lord Argelmach. Return his head to Lotwil. You will also need to collect 10 Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs protecting Argelmach. You know this because you are psychic.",p="是他吗？他还活着吗？",pEN="Was it him? Was he really alive?",c="这是什么？！这颗头颅不是由血肉构成的。这是黑铁矮人制造的另一种机器人，与阿格曼奇一模一样的机器人！看来即使你杀掉了阿格曼奇也无济于事，不久之后就会有另外一个同样的东西替换它的位置。",cEN="What is this?!? This head is not flesh. This is some sort of dark iron creation: A shadow of Argelmach - ANOTHER machine! I suspect that your destruction of Argelmach will be short lived as another shall rise to take 'its' place soon."}
Q[4081]={d="根据卡加斯探险队的指挥官高图斯大人的命令：\n\n黑石深渊中所有安格弗将军麾下的部队必须全部消灭。\n\n安格弗的下属都是杀人不眨眼的暴徒，正是他们杀害了卡加斯探险队109分队的成员。遇到这群穷凶极恶的歹徒的时候要特别小心。\n\n任何能消灭黑石深渊安格弗将军麾下部队的勇士都将得到奖励。",dEN="By order of Warlord Goretooth, commander of the Kargath Expeditionary Force:\n\nAny and all of General Angerforge's forces within Blackrock Depths must be annihilated.\n\nAngerforge's men are ruthless killers, responsible for the mass murder of the 109th division of the Kargath Expeditionary Force. Heroes are warned to exercise extreme caution when confronting these brutes.\n\nAny person who destroys the first line of General Angerforge's forces in Blackrock Depths shall receive a tribute.",o="前往黑石深渊，消灭那些卑劣的侵略者！\n\n战争使者戈雷图斯要你杀死十五名铁怒卫兵、十名铁怒监军和五名铁怒步兵。完成任务后回到他那里。|n",oEN="Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!\n\nWarlord Goretooth wants you to kill 15 Anvilrage Guardsmen, 10 Anvilrage Wardens and 5 Anvilrage Footmen. Return to him once your task is complete.",p="你有什么事吗，$r？你难道看不出我有一大堆事要忙吗？",pEN="What is it, <race>? Can't you see I have a platoon to command?",c="这次首轮打击应该够安格弗将军头疼一阵了。现在，继续前进吧，士兵。我还有工作要完成，有战斗要筹划，有敌人要碾碎！\n\n想找更多活儿就留意那些\"通缉\"告示。",cEN="This first strike should put a crease in Angerforge's pants. Now, move along soldier. I have work to complete, battles to plan, enemies to crush!\n\nCheck the wanted signs for more work."}
Q[4082]={d="奉卡加斯远征军指挥官、战争使者戈雷图斯之命：\n\n卡加斯远征军侦察分队队长、大法师莱克斯洛特带回了高阶黑铁军官下落的消息。在城门紧锁之处、靠近城市心脏的地方，他们正在训练部队，企图消灭我们的人。前往黑石深渊，消灭他们！\n\n完成此任务将获得一份贡品。|n",dEN="By order of Warlord Goretooth, commander of the Kargath Expeditionary Force:\n\nHead of the K.E.F. reconnaissance division, Grandmaster Lexlort, has returned with news of the whereabouts of high ranking Dark Iron officials. Through locked gate, near the heart of the city, they train their forces to snuff out our men. Travel to Blackrock Depths and destroy them!\n\nCompletion of this mission will result in a tribute.",o="到黑石深渊去消灭那些邪恶的侵略者！\n\n高图斯军阀要你杀死10个铁怒医师,、10个铁怒士兵和10个铁怒军官。完成任务之后回去向他复命。",oEN="Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!\n\nWarlord Goretooth wants you to kill 10 Anvilrage Medics, 10 Anvilrage Soldiers and 10 Anvilrage Officers. Return to him once your task is complete.",p="你回来了？你很有毅力，所以我当然要把任务交给你来完成，$n。",pEN="You again? I have to hand it to you, <name>, you are tenacious.",c="铁怒矮人无疑已经被激怒了。当你让我第三次刮目相看之后再回来和我谈谈，接下来我们要商讨下一步的行动:刺杀安格弗将军。这个任务可非同小可，在我告诉你行动的具体步骤前，你一定要保证自己已经休息充分了。",cEN="Angerforge is undoubtedly... angry. Return to me when you receive a third tribute and we shall proceed with Operation: Death to Angerforge. I cannot go into any detail of what this entails, but rest assured, it involves somebody dying."}
Q[4083]={p="宝石无声地坠入圣杯深处……",pEN="The gems make no sound as they fall into depths of the chalice...",c="那只幽魂圣杯漂浮在空中，缓缓升沉……仿佛一颗垂死心脏的搏动。",cEN="The spectral chalice floats in the air, slowing rising and falling... as if to the beat of a dying heart."}
Q[4084]={d="我不知道你说的那个人是谁，$n。\n\n但是请不要担心，如果你的朋友原本打算大老远地来找我的话，我应该可以想象到他需要什么。\n\n在安戈洛尔环形山的中心地带有一个极端邪恶的恶魔，它以一个名叫火焰使者的元素生物的形象出现……它被一层任何人都无法驱散的光环保护着……\n\n没有人可以驱散……除非有足够的力量。我可以教你如何获得这样的力量，$n。\n\n首先按我说的去做，从费伍德森林的生物身上收集11个银爪和1个铁树之心，然后回来找我。",dEN="I do not know the one you speak of, <name>.\n\nBut worry not; if your friend was on a journey to find me, I do know what it was he desired.\n\nIn the heart of Un'Goro Crater dwells evil of the purest form. This evil takes the shape of an elemental called Blazerunner... protected by an aura that none can dispel...\n\nNone... except those with enough power to do so. I can teach you of this power, <name>.\n\nFirst, do as I ask. Collect 11 Silvery Claws and 1 Irontree Heart from the creatures in Felwood, then return.",o="为费伍德森林的艾瑞丹·蓝风收集11只银爪和1颗铁树之心。",oEN="Collect 11 Silvery Claws and 1 Irontree Heart for Eridan Bluewind in Felwood.",p="我可以告诉你更多关于击败火焰使者的资讯，但是首先，你必须收集到我要的那些东西。",pEN="I can tell you more of the power of which you required to defeat Blazerunner, but first, you need to gather the things I require.",c="非常好，$n。我可以看出你是真心想要帮助你的朋友。",cEN="Very well, <name>. I can see you are serious about helping your friend."}
Q[4101]={d="植物给与费伍德森林以生命，然而即使是它们也遭受了腐化和堕落的痛苦。我知道净化它们的方法，但是我不会把这种方法告诉一个我不熟识或者不能信任的$r。向我证明你真的能帮助塞纳里奥议会！\n\n这里的北面有一个铁木山洞，那里的曲木元素已经无法挽救了。我要你帮我从它们身上取得树汁，这些树汁被称作血琥珀。有了它们，我就可以研究拯救其它生命的办法了。",dEN="Plants give life to Felwood, yet even they suffer the taint of corruption. I know ways to cleanse them, but I cannot give out such knowledge to those I don't know or trust. Prove to me that you will truly aid the cause of the Cenarion Circle!\n\nTo the north lie the Irontree Caverns. The Warpwood elementals present there are now beyond hope of cleansing. I ask you to bring me their sap - blood amber it is called - so I may study it in the hopes of saving other forms of life here.",o="收集15颗血琥珀，把它们交给费伍德森林的阿拉珊蒂丝·银空。",oEN="Bring 15 Blood Amber to Arathandris Silversky in Felwood.",p="我知道费伍德森林正在被痛苦折磨，$n，因为我自己也在体尝这样的痛苦！但我必须保持自己坚定的意志……如果我所掌握的知识落入了错误的人的手里，那费伍德森林就将遭受一场空前的灾难。\n\n帮我从扭木元素身上抽取血琥珀，然后我就能相信你会帮助我和堕落进行斗争了。",pEN="I know Felwood suffers, <name> - I suffer along with it! I must remain steadfast in my conviction; were the knowledge I possess to fall into the wrong hands, it would spell disaster for all of Felwood.\n\nBring to me the blood amber drawn from the slain Warpwood elementals, and I will trust you enough to help me enact a means to fight the corruption.",c="血琥珀将被用来研究一种可以对付费伍德森林中的堕落力量的方法，你已经证明了自己愿意为塞纳里奥议会做任何事情。\n\n也许通过杀掉那些元素生物来证明这一点显得有些奇怪，但我们最终的目标是拯救所有的生灵，到那时一切都会证明我们现在所走的道路是正确的。现在我们可以开始专注于如何救更多的生命了。\n\n$n，是时候开始净化费伍德森林了。",cEN="This blood amber will be used to find a means of defeating the corruption present in Felwood. You've proven to me that you're willing to do whatever it takes for the Cenarion Circle. I trust you now, friend.\n\nIt might seem odd that killing the elementals proved yourself to me, but the end of saving countless sentient beings must justify the means we take. You and I can now focus on the preservation of life through the salves I can make.\n\n<name>, the time has come to cleanse Felwood."}
Q[4102]={d="植物给与费伍德森林以生命，然而即使是它们也遭受了腐化和堕落的痛苦。我知道净化它们的方法，但是我不会把这种方法告诉一个我不熟识或者不能信任的$r。向我证明你真的能帮助塞纳里奥议会！\n\n这里的北面有一个铁木山洞，那里的曲木元素已经无法挽救了。我要你帮我从它们身上取得树汁，这些树汁被称作血琥珀。有了它们，我就可以研究拯救其它生命的办法了。",dEN="Plants give life to Felwood, yet even they suffer the taint of corruption. I know ways to cleanse them, but I cannot give out such knowledge to those I don't know or trust. Prove to me that you will truly aid the cause of the Cenarion Circle!\n\nTo the north lie the Irontree Caverns. The Warpwood elementals present there are now beyond hope of cleansing. I ask you to bring me their sap - blood amber it is called - so I may study it in the hopes of saving other forms of life here.",o="收集15颗血琥珀，把它们交给费伍德森林的梅贝丝·河风。",oEN="Bring 15 Blood Amber to Maybess Riverbreeze in Felwood.",p="我知道费伍德森林正在被痛苦折磨，$n，因为我自己也在体尝这样的痛苦！但我必须保持自己坚定的意志……如果我所掌握的知识落入了错误的人的手里，那费伍德森林就将遭受一场空前的灾难。\n\n帮我从扭木元素身上抽取血琥珀，然后我就能相信你会帮助我和堕落进行斗争了。",pEN="I know Felwood suffers, <name> - I suffer along with it! I must remain steadfast in my conviction; were the knowledge I possess to fall into the wrong hands, it would spell disaster for all of Felwood.\n\nBring to me the blood amber drawn from the slain Warpwood elementals, and I will trust you enough to help me enact a means to fight the corruption.",c="血琥珀将被用来研究一种可以对付费伍德森林中的堕落力量的方法，你已经证明了自己愿意为塞纳里奥议会做任何事情。\n\n也许通过杀掉那些元素生物来证明这一点显得有些奇怪，但我们最终的目标是拯救所有的生灵，到那时一切都会证明我们现在所走的道路是正确的。现在我们可以开始专注于如何救更多的生命了。\n\n$n，是时候开始净化费伍德森林了。",cEN="This blood amber will be used to find a means of defeating the corruption present in Felwood. You've proven to me that you're willing to do whatever it takes for the Cenarion Circle. I trust you now, friend.\n\nIt might seem odd that killing the elementals proved yourself to me, but the end of saving countless sentient beings must justify the means we take. You and I can now focus on the preservation of life through the salves I can make.\n\n<name>, the time has come to cleanse Felwood."}
Q[4103]={p="持有塞纳里奥信标，就能在那些为大局而被处死的污染野兽身上看到腐化的灵魂碎片。我把碎片碾磨成可用的材料，用来制作塞纳里奥植物药膏。我们将用药膏把被污染的植物重新治愈。\n\n作为这些碎片的交换，我会给你一些我已经配制好的塞纳里奥植物药膏。",pEN="Possessing a Cenarion Beacon allows one to sea a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again.\n\nIn exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",c="很好。这是你的塞纳里奥植物药膏。去费伍德森林搜寻被污染的植物吧，$n！无论它们在哪里，都用我给你的药膏净化它们。",cEN="Very well then, here are your Cenarion plant salves. Scour Felwood for corrupted plants, <name>! Wherever they are, use the salve I have given you to purify them."}
Q[4104]={p="如果你随身带着塞纳里奥信标，那么你在采矿的时候就会看到那些污染了矿脉的硫酸盐。我可以对那些硫酸盐进行净化，然后把它们制成塞纳里奥植物药膏。你可以用这种药膏来拯救堕落的大自然。\n\n给我弄些受污染的硫酸盐来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving.\n\nIf you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",c="干得好，这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。如果你能在费伍德森林采矿过程中找到更多的硝酸盐的话，记得一定要把它们交给我！这东西越多，我就能造成越多的药膏来。",cEN="Very well then, here's some Cenarion plant salve. If you find more vitriol when you mine in Felwood, remember to hold on to it for me! The more of it you find, the more salve I will be able to make."}
Q[4105]={p="训练有素的草药师可以用塞纳里奥信标探测到那些被污染的魔藤——这是费伍德森林被污染后所诞生的产物。我在这里进行了一些研究工作，现在我可以把魔藤转化为一种净化原料……然后就可以用它来制作我们所说的塞纳里奥植物药膏了。\n\n当你在费伍德森林里收集草药的时候，别忘了带着这个信标来寻找魔藤。给我弄些魔藤来，我就给你几份药膏作为交换。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve.\n\nWhen you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",c="干得漂亮，$n——每一株被净化的植物，都会帮助我们夺回费伍德森林。来，带上一些塞纳里奥植物药膏，深入森林吧。从腐化中夺回这片土地的事可等不了任何$r！",cEN="Excellent work <name> - every bit of this, once we purify it, will help us take back Felwood. Here, take some doses of Cenarion plant salve and head into the forest. The reclaiming of the land from the corruption waits for no <race>!"}
Q[4106]={p="训练有素的剥皮匠可以用塞纳里奥信标从费伍德森林里的生物身上找到受污染的毛皮，我可以把这些皮制作成塞纳里奥植物药膏。\n\n当你在这里采集兽皮的时候，记得带上信标。给我弄些受污染的毛皮来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you!\n\nWhen you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",c="这正是我所需要的。拿着这些药膏，把它们用于拯救费伍德森林吧。你一定要坚持到底，$n！",cEN="This is exactly what I need. Here - take these plant salves and use them to reclaim Felwood from the corruption. We must persevere, <name>!"}
Q[4107]={p="分解物品所得到的魔法精华中蕴藏着相当大的能量。我已经研究出一种方法，可以把炼金术所使用的原始精华材料转化为制作塞纳里奥植物药膏所需的材料。你不需要拿着塞纳里奥信标，只要是能够分解出次级虚空精华的物品都适用。\n\n我只需要一个次级虚空精华，作为交换，我可以给你一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。那些精华的能量很强大，所以即使很少的精华就能制作出不少的药膏了。",pEN="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work.\n\nI just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",c="这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏——我只需要一份次级虚空精华就够了，$n。这种精华是我迄今为止碰到过的最具魔法潜能的东西，我可以用它们来拯救这片森林。如果你需要更多的药膏，那就到这里来找我吧！",cEN="Here are some Cenarion plant salves - I only need one lesser nether essence for this, <name>. Essence is by far the most potent item I can make use of to turn swords into plowshares, as it were. If you need more salve, then find me here!"}
Q[4108]={p="持有塞纳里奥信标，就能在那些为大局而被处死的污染野兽身上看到腐化的灵魂碎片。我把碎片碾磨成可用的材料，用来制作塞纳里奥植物药膏。我们将用药膏把被污染的植物重新治愈。\n\n作为这些碎片的交换，我会给你一些我已经配制好的塞纳里奥植物药膏。",pEN="Possessing a Cenarion Beacon allows one to sea a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again.\n\nIn exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",c="很好。这是你的塞纳里奥植物药膏。去费伍德森林搜寻被污染的植物吧，$n！无论它们在哪里，都用我给你的药膏净化它们。",cEN="Very well then, here are your Cenarion plant salves. Scour Felwood for corrupted plants, <name>! Wherever they are, use the salve I have given you to purify them."}
Q[4109]={p="如果你随身带着塞纳里奥信标，那么你在采矿的时候就会看到那些污染了矿脉的硫酸盐。我可以对那些硫酸盐进行净化，然后把它们制成塞纳里奥植物药膏。你可以用这种药膏来拯救堕落的大自然。\n\n给我弄些受污染的硫酸盐来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving.\n\nIf you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",c="干得好，这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。如果你能在费伍德森林采矿过程中找到更多的硝酸盐的话，记得一定要把它们交给我！这东西越多，我就能造成越多的药膏来。",cEN="Very well then, here's some Cenarion plant salve. If you find more vitriol when you mine in Felwood, remember to hold on to it for me! The more of it you find, the more salve I will be able to make."}
Q[4110]={p="训练有素的草药师可以用塞纳里奥信标探测到那些被污染的魔藤——这是费伍德森林被污染后所诞生的产物。我在这里进行了一些研究工作，现在我可以把魔藤转化为一种净化原料……然后就可以用它来制作我们所说的塞纳里奥植物药膏了。\n\n当你在费伍德森林里收集草药的时候，别忘了带着这个信标来寻找魔藤。给我弄些魔藤来，我就给你几份药膏作为交换。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve.\n\nWhen you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",c="干得漂亮，$n——每一株被净化的植物，都会帮助我们夺回费伍德森林。来，带上一些塞纳里奥植物药膏，深入森林吧。从腐化中夺回这片土地的事可等不了任何$r！",cEN="Excellent work <name> - every bit of this, once we purify it, will help us take back Felwood. Here, take some doses of Cenarion plant salve and head into the forest. The reclaiming of the land from the corruption waits for no <race>!"}
Q[4111]={p="训练有素的剥皮匠可以用塞纳里奥信标从费伍德森林里的生物身上找到受污染的毛皮，我可以把这些皮制作成塞纳里奥植物药膏。\n\n当你在这里采集兽皮的时候，记得带上信标。给我弄些受污染的毛皮来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you!\n\nWhen you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",c="这正是我所需要的。拿着这些药膏，把它们用于拯救费伍德森林吧。你一定要坚持到底，$n！",cEN="This is exactly what I need. Here - take these plant salves and use them to reclaim Felwood from the corruption. We must persevere, <name>!"}
Q[4112]={p="分解物品所得到的魔法精华中蕴藏着相当大的能量。我已经研究出一种方法，可以把炼金术所使用的原始精华材料转化为制作塞纳里奥植物药膏所需的材料。你不需要拿着塞纳里奥信标，只要是能够分解出次级虚空精华的物品都适用。\n\n我只需要一个次级虚空精华，作为交换，我可以给你一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。那些精华的能量很强大，所以即使很少的精华就能制作出不少的药膏了。",pEN="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work.\n\nI just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",c="这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏——我只需要一份次级虚空精华就够了，$n。这种精华是我迄今为止碰到过的最具魔法潜能的东西，我可以用它们来拯救这片森林。如果你需要更多的药膏，那就到这里来找我吧！",cEN="Here are some Cenarion plant salves - I only need one lesser nether essence for this, <name>. Essence is by far the most potent item I can make use of to turn swords into plowshares, as it were. If you need more salve, then find me here!"}
Q[4113]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4114]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4115]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4116]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4117]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的鞭根草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a whipper root plant. The visible roots of the plant appear tough and leathery, and a slimy film hangs from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将三份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株鞭根草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 3 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Whipper Root. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4118]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4119]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的夜龙草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a night dragon plant. The fruits that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将四份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株夜龙草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 4 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Night Dragon. It immediately begins to shed it's corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4120]={d="作为猎人，我总是努力来模仿我对手的长处。知己知彼，百战不殆，$n\n\n在灰谷北部的费伍德森林中生活的野兽们都被恶魔的能量所感染，熊和狼都已经变得疯狂，而且我相信它们的力量也变得更加强大了。\n\n出发吧，$n。去费伍德森林面对那些野兽。如果你和我想象中的一样强大，就去那里锻炼自己吧。",dEN="Being a hunter, I strive to emulate the strengths I see in my opponents. It is possible to turn the battle in your favor by simply knowing your enemy well, <name>.\n\nIn a place called Felwood, north of Ashenvale, the creatures have been tainted by a substance called fel. The bears and wolves have been driven mad by it, but I believe that they have also grown even stronger as well.\n\nGo, <name>. Travel to Felwood and face these beasts. Learn for yourself if they are truly as strong as I believe.",o="菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄要你去费伍德森林杀掉12头怒爪灰熊和12头魔爪掠夺者。",oEN="Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas wants you to kill 12 Angerclaw Grizzlies and 12 Felpaw Ravagers in Felwood.",p="每个感染恶魔能量的动物都会泛出绿光……我感到了极端邪恶而强大的力量。",pEN="Everything touched by the fel emanates a strange green glow... I sense it is evil, but at the same time, very powerful.",c="从你的描述来看，那些生物都表现出一种歇斯底里的疯狂……\n\n保持警惕，$n。你最好注意更多关于堕落的事情。对你的敌人要多一些了解。",cEN="It sounds from your descriptions as if the creatures show a mindless ferocity...\n\nStay alert, <name>. It would be in your best interest to learn more of the corruption. Always know your enemy."}
Q[4121]={d="你真以为押着我还能到达会合点？你真以为能闯进一座戒备森严的黑石要塞，抓走他们一件珍贵的资产，而不会惊动任何人或任何东西？\n\n你会被碾成齑粉！|n",dEN="Do you truly believe that you will make it to your rendezvous point with me in custody? You actually expected to break into a heavily fortified Blackrock fortress to capture a prized asset of theirs without alerting anyone or anything to your presence?\n\nYou will be destroyed!",o="押送你的囚犯格拉克·洛克鲁布。穿过燃烧平原和黑石山脉，一直走到灼热峡谷。\n\n雷克斯洛特曾经告诉过你，他会让他的人等在黑石山脉的另外一边准备接收格拉克。\n\n另外，你还要把瑟银镣铐一并还给雷克斯洛特。",oEN="Escort your prisoner, Grark Lorkrub, through Burning Steppes and through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge.\n\nYou recall Lexlort mentioning that he would have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.\n\nYou will also be required to hand over your Thorium Shackles to Lexlort.",p="我会照顾这个叛徒的，$n。",pEN="I will take this traitorous filth, <name>.",c="你的英雄事迹决不会被忽视，$n。你理应得到这些奖励。另外，上面还有最后一个任务要交给你。",cEN="Your heroics will not go unrecognized, <name>. You have earned this tribute. The Warlord will speak with you now in regards to the final mission."}
Q[4122]={d="我一路追踪他穿过灼热峡谷，翻过山脉，进入燃烧平原。那个叛徒被抓了个正着，正在向黑石兽人泄露我们日常行动的重要情报。我说的是格拉尔克·洛尔克鲁布。\n\n他现在坐在燃烧平原里，安全地受着保护——至少他自己是这么想的。\n\n带上这些镣铐，$n。找到格拉尔克，给他铐上镣铐，押着他穿过黑石山。办成了，贡品就是你的。|n",dEN="I tracked him across the Searing Gorge, through the mountain, and into the Burning Steppes. That traitor was caught red-handed giving the Blackrock orcs vital information about our day to day operations. I'm speaking of Grark Lorkrub.\n\nHe now sits in the Burning Steppes, safely under their protection - or so he thinks.\n\nTake these shackles, <name>. Find Grark, place the shackles on him and lead him through Blackrock Mountain. Do this and a tribute is yours.",o="前往燃烧平原，找到格拉尔克·洛尔克鲁布。你记得莱克斯洛特提到过，他最后一次露面是在一座巨大的黑石要塞里。\n\n找到格拉尔克·洛尔克鲁布后，用瑟银镣铐把他捆住，然后押着他穿过黑石山回到灼热峡谷。莱克斯洛特的人会在另一头等着，把他收押带走。|n",oEN="Travel to the Burning Steppes and find Grark Lorkrub. You recall Lexlort mentioning that he was last seen in a massive Blackrock fortress.\n\nWhen you find Grark Lorkrub, use the Thorium Shackles to bind him and then lead him back through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge. Lexlort will have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.",c="你难道看不出我们在加入黑石军团之后获得了多么强大的力量吗？",cEN="Can you not see the power we gain by joining the legion of Blackrock?"}
Q[4123]={d="多年以来，我都在追寻一块特殊的宝石。它的名字是山脉之心，个头大概和你的拳头差不多！黑铁矮人把它锁在他们的一个房间里，虽然我想尽了办法，但他们就是不卖给我。\n\n所以我只好诉诸暴力了。\n\n到黑石深渊底部的宝库里去，击败那里的守卫，把山脉之心给我抢出来。你所要做的就是击败卫兵杜格瑞普，不过只有在你打开房间里所有的保险箱之后他才会出现！\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="For years I have sought a certain gem. It is called the Heart of the Mountain and it's the size of your fist! The Dark Iron dwarves have it locked in their vault and, try as I may, they won't let me purchase it.\n\nSo I must resort to force.\n\nFight your way to the Lower Vault of Blackrock Depths, breach its secret safe and gain the Heart. To do that, you must defeat Watchman Doomgrip, and he won't appear until you've opened every relic coffer in the vault!\n\nGood luck.",o="把山脉之心交给燃烧平原的麦克斯沃特·尤博格林。",oEN="Bring the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes.",p="你拿到山脉之心了吗？对我来说，它是无价之宝。",pEN="Do you have the Heart of the Mountain? To me, its value is without limit.",c="你拿到那颗心了！太棒了！它比我梦见的还要美丽！\n\n请收下吧，$n，这是你的报酬。",cEN="You have the heart! Amazing! It is even more beautiful than I imagined!\n\nPlease, <name>, take this as payment!"}
Q[4124]={d="我的同事基恩诺·火花正在寻找信使的下落，以及他身上携带的包裹。那个信使已经失踪一个星期了，我们所有的搜寻行动都徒劳而返，因此现在我不得不宣布：信使已经失踪了。\n\n如果你有时间的话，请去跟基恩诺谈谈。他应该在要塞里——也许在他自己的房间里。",dEN="An associate of mine, Ginro Hearthkindle, is looking for assistance concerning the location of a courier and the parcels he was carrying. It has been a week or so since the courier went missing; our own searches have proved fruitless, and we're at an impasse. Unfortunately, I have had to declare the courier as missing in action.\n\nIf you have the time and resources to spare, please speak with Ginro. He should be here in the Stronghold - perhaps in his quarters.",o="和羽月要塞的基恩诺·火花谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="我想应该是拉托尼库斯派你来的。当我们的搜寻行动毫无进展的时候，我愿意接受任何人提供的帮助。我必须承认……如果我能平息这件事情的话，我会很高兴的。每天我都会到菲拉斯的丛林里去寻找拉斯卡尔，但每次我都会带着遗憾和豺狼人的齿痕无功而返。",cEN="Latro sent you to me, I presume. While I think it is a lost cause at this point, I'll take whatever assistance you can offer. I must admit... I'll be glad once I can put my mind to rest on this matter. Every day I set out into the wilds of Feralas looking for signs of Raschal, and every night I have come back with nothing to show for my work save gnoll teeth and disappointment."}
Q[4125]={d="拉斯卡尔这个信使出发去萨兰纳尔已经快一个星期了。他对菲拉斯了如指掌，自从羽月将军率领远征军踏上这片土地的时候，他就和我们在一起了。我知道他这次是想要划船沿着海岸前进，然后横穿菲拉斯的南部区域以避开部落的营地。\n\n我找不到他的船，但是也许你可以。也许那艘船被藏起来了，也许它已经沉没了。不管怎么样，只要找到船，就有可能找到他的线索。如果你找到什么东西的话，请赶快告诉我。",dEN="It's been about a week since Raschal, the courier, set out for Thalanaar. He knows Feralas well; he's been with us since General Feathermoon led the expeditionary forces here. I know his plan was to take a row boat down the coast and try and traverse across southern Feralas to avoid the Horde camp.\n\nI couldn't find his boat, but maybe you can. Maybe it is hidden, or maybe it was sunk. Regardless, it might hold a clue as to where he is. If you uncover something, please let me know.",o="找到信使的小船，你应该在菲拉斯的南部海岸线上展开搜索。",oEN="Locate the courier's boat somewhere along the coast of Feralas.",c="你找到了一只搁浅的小船。通过有些浑浊的水，你看到左船舷有很多洞，整只船被破坏得几乎只剩下龙骨了，似乎是有什么力量想要把这只船撕为两半。在右舷上有一个小小的羽月要塞标志。\n\n在船底下的泥土里，似乎有什么金属物品在闪光……",cEN="You have found what appears to be a wrecked row boat. Through the slightly muddy water you see gaping holes riddling the port side; the boat is nearly shredded down to its simple wooden frame. Whatever broke this boat most likely tried to snap it in two. A small crest of the Feathermoon Stronghold is painted on the starboard side.\n\nIn the mud at the base of the boat, a glint of something metallic catches your eye..."}
Q[4126]={d="在万恶的霍尔雷·黑须的带领下，那些黑铁矮人偷了我们的雷霆啤酒的配方，那些混蛋！他们不配得到如此美味的佳酿！\n\n$n，我有个艰巨的任务要交给你。去燃烧平原的黑石深渊，摧毁找到的所有装有雷霆啤酒的桶，然后把雷霆啤酒的配方带回来！\n\n求求你了，你一定要把配方带回来，即使要把黑石深渊翻个底朝天你也一定要找到它。",dEN="The Dark Iron dwarves, led by the villain Hurley Blackbreath, stole one of the Thunderbrew's best recipes, Thunderbrew Lager. The villains! They don't deserve such a fine brew!\n\n<name>, I have a tough task for you. Go to the Blackrock Depths in the Burning Steppes, destroy any kegs of Thunderbrew Lager you find, and bring back our recipe for Thunderbrew Lager!\n\nPlease, get that recipe back, even if you have to turn Blackrock Depths upside down to do it!",o="把遗失的雷酒秘方带给卡拉诺斯的拉格纳·雷酒。",oEN="Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",p="你找到配方了吗，$n？我绝不能忍受那些黑铁矮人居然能够饮用我系列的酒！",pEN="Do you have the recipe, <name>? I can't stand the idea of those Dark Iron dwarves drinking my family's drink!",c="你找到了它！干得好！我希望你狠狠揍了那些黑铁矮人和霍尔雷·黑须一顿！\n\n雷酒家族任凭你差遣，$n。你是$g英雄:女英雄;中的$g英雄:女英雄;！",cEN="You found it! Well done! And I hope you gave those Dark Irons, and Hurley Blackbreath, a good thumping!\n\nThe Thunderbrews are at your service, <name>. You are a hero of heroes!"}
Q[4127]={d="你伸手拨开淤泥，指尖掠过一把刀的刀柄。它保养得很好。可以推断，无论当时船上的是谁，都可能把它弄丢了。也许船上缺失的那一大块与它的遗失有关。\n\n你想起羽月要塞的金罗·炉火曾吩咐过，一旦找到任何线索就回去向他报告，于是你收起了那把刀。可你忽然有一种感觉——水里的你并不$g孤单:孤单;……",dEN="Running your hand along the mud, your fingers graze the handle of a knife. It looks well cared for, and it might be safe to assume that whoever was on the boat might have lost it. Perhaps the large chunk of the missing boat might have something to do with the loss.\n\nYou grab the knife, remembering that Ginro Hearthkindle in the Feathermoon Stronghold instructed you to return to him with any found clues. You get the feeling, however, that you are not quite alone in the water...",o="回到羽月要塞，给基恩诺·火花看看你找到的这把被丢弃的小刀。",oEN="Return to Feathermoon Stronghold and show Ginro Hearthkindle the Discarded Knife you have found.",p="啊，欢迎回来，$n。我希望你能发现一些关于拉斯卡尔的线索，尽管这可能是个悲剧。",pEN="Ah, welcome back <name>. I hope that you were able to uncover some clue as to Raschal's ultimate fate, as tragic as that may be.",c="很有趣……我相信这是拉斯卡尔的刀子。你说你是在水底找到的，他的船也沉了？好吧，仅凭这把刀并不足以把它与拉斯卡尔的失踪联系起来，然而，我们确实还有一个非传统的办法，也许可以让我们得到更多的资讯。\n\n你听说过心灵占卜术吗？",cEN="Interesting... I believe that this is Raschal's knife. You say you found it at the bottom of the water, along with his boat? Well, just the knife's discovery might not be enough to connect this to Raschal's disappearance; we do, however, have an unconventional option available to us to try and learn more.\n\nHave you ever heard of psychometry?"}
Q[4128]={d="你好，$n。我听说拉格纳·雷酒正因为有人偷了他的酒而大发雷霆呢。他在找合适的冒险者来帮忙，而且报酬丰富。\n\n如果你感兴趣的话就去找拉格纳谈谈吧，他在丹莫罗，卡拉诺斯的雷酒酿制厂里。",dEN="Ho, <name>. I heard that Ragnar Thunderbrew is steaming mad about someone stealing his ale. He's looking for stalwart adventurers, and willing to pay plenty.\n\nTalk to Ragnar if you're interested. He's at the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, in Dun Morogh.",o="和拉格纳·雷酒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ragnar Thunderbrew.",c="你说的很多，我确实疯了！我被人抢劫了！那些强盗抢了我祖传的配方！他们怎么敢这样做！在此之前我还不怎么恨那些黑铁矮人了！现在，哦……他们就是罪魁祸首！",cEN="You're right I'm mad! I've been robbed! Robbed of one of our family recipes! How dare they! As if I didn't have enough cause to hate the Dark Iron dwarves! Now, oh... now they're in for it!"}
Q[4129]={d="要塞里有一个名叫奎恩提斯的德鲁伊，他有一些……非同寻常的技艺，比如心灵占卜术——通过触摸某件物品揭示与其关联的历史。不要问我他是怎么做到的，我认为那是一种我不懂也不愿去弄懂的魔法。然而我确实知道两件事：首先，那把戏的效果确实不错；其次，他还欠着我的债。\n\n把小刀交给小树屋里的奎恩提斯，替我告诉他……如果他把他的本事用在那把刀子上的话，他跟我打牌时欠下的债务就一笔勾销。",dEN="The Stronghold's resident druid, Quintis Jonespyre, has some... unusual skills. One of them involves psychometry - the ability to reveal an item's history by touch. Don't ask me how he does it; I chalk it up to magic I do not and choose not to understand. I do know, however, two things: one, I've seen it work and two, the bum owes me.\n\nTake the knife up to Quint in his little tree-house here, and tell him for me that his Kalimdor Hold 'Em debt will be paid if he works his mojo on that knife.",o="把被丢弃的小刀交给羽月要塞的奎恩提斯。",oEN="Take the Discarded Knife to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold.",p="是金罗派你来的吧，嗯？\n\n通灵占卜对我来说相当耗费心神……耗尽我的精力……不过话说回来，我在卡利姆多扑克上的输局也一样耗尽我的精力。这里的人都叫我\"点不亮的灯笼之王\"。不过……牌运不佳，掌控自然奥秘的运气倒是不错……\n\n总之，没错，我会帮你的。这也许正是揭开拉斯卡尔下落的关键。把刀交给我，我们就可以开始了。",pEN="Ginro sent you, eh?\n\nMy psychometric readings are fairly draining on the psyche... but so are my losses at Kalimdor Hold 'Em. They call me \"King of the Bad Beats\" here in the Stronghold. Unlucky at cards... lucky at mastering the secrets of nature, I guess.\n\nAnyway, of course I'll do it. This may be just the breakthrough we need to uncover Raschal's fate. If you would hand me the knife, we can get started.",c="谢谢你，$n。\n\n虽说心灵占卜术并不是多么精深的技艺，但我在过去的岁月中一直使用它来发现别人忽略的细节。我想，把它用到这把刀子上会让我们对拉斯卡尔的下落有更多的头绪。\n\n请稍等一会儿，虽然心灵占卜花不了多久，但是这种事情颇为费神。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nWhile psychometry isn't an exact art by any stretch of the imagination, I've used it in times past to give insight into situations that others have chalked up to lost causes. I think using it on the knife you've uncovered will give us a glimpse into what happened to Raschal.\n\nIt will only take a moment to do, but it isn't what I'd call a caster-friendly task. Bear with me on this."}
Q[4130]={d="我仍然有些晕，不好意思。嗯，我看到了一些有用的图像。\n\n拉斯卡尔从小船里拿了两只皮袋子，然后上了岸；然而，他又回到了小船那里。我看到了豺狼人……他遇到了豺狼人——那些被称作木爪豺狼人的家伙。他看起来很着急——看上去有些恐惧——似乎是在躲避什么。他甚至没有注意到身后的水元素……就是这些了。\n\n我得休息一下，对不起，$n。把我看到的东西告诉基恩诺，他需要知道这些。",dEN="I'm a little wobbly still, sorry. Anyway, I received some useful visions.\n\nRaschal takes two large leather backpacks from his boat and goes inland; he returns to the boat, however. I see gnoll scalps... he ran into some gnolls - Woodpaw I think they're called. He's very worried - almost terrified - about something. So much so, that he is not paying attention to water elementals forming behind him. The images... stop there.\n\nI need to rest, sorry <name>. Tell Gin what I've seen. He needs to know.",o="和羽月要塞的基恩诺·火花谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="感谢你把奎恩提斯看到的东西告诉我，$n。我下一次和他打牌的时候看来要小心一些了。\n\n拉斯卡尔应该可以应付那些豺狼人，他的实力还不至于弱到被豺狼人打得落花流水。也许在获得这些新的情报之后，你可以帮我们再去找找新的线索。",cEN="Thanks for passing along Quint's visions to me, <name>. I'll try to remember to be a little easier on him the next time we play cards.\n\nRaschal can hold his own in a fight, and gnolls aren't anything that would get him worried - nay, terrified. Still, maybe you and yours can act on this new information and make the breakthrough we desperately need."}
Q[4131]={d="也许我们那些\"朋友\"木爪豺狼人最终害了拉斯卡尔，但直觉告诉我事情并非如此。可是，从它们那里查起总归是最好的。我希望我们能有更清晰的思路，眼下我只能说：去搜查木爪营地。我知道豺狼人会保存捡来的东西，还会为此大打出手；也许它们翻到过奎因特提到的背包。以前的搜查我从不敢正面硬拼，可既然奎因特看到了那样的景象，我只能说：\"冲进去！\"\n\n",dEN="Our \"friends\" the Woodpaw might have gotten Raschal in the end, but something tells me that's not what occurred. Still, they're the best place to start looking.\n\nI wish I had clearer insight as to what to do, but all I have right now is 'Search the Woodpaw camps - go.' I do know that gnolls will keep items they scavenge and fight over them; maybe they ran across the backpacks Quint mentioned. I hadn't risked a head-on fight in past searches, but with Quint's vision on this I say rip into them.",o="在菲拉斯南部地区的木爪豺狼人营地里寻找信使的下落或者信使的物品。",oEN="Search the Woodpaw Gnoll camps of southern Feralas for evidence of the courier's belongings or the courier himself.",c="两个皮制的大背包靠在附近的树旁，每个包上都有羽月要塞的标志……",cEN="Tacked up on a nearby tree are two large leather backpacks. Each bears a small insignia of the Feathermoon Stronghold on the front of the pack..."}
Q[4132]={d="你干得很出色，$n。现在是派你去执行最后一项任务的时候了。\n\n安格弗将军——那个策划黑铁矮人对卡加斯远征军第109师团发动攻击、并大肆屠杀我方部队的家伙，必须被绳之以法。\n\n这无疑将是你最艰难的一次任务，但如果你成功了，等待你的将是丰厚的报酬。|n",dEN="You have done an exemplary job, <name>. It is now time to send you on your last mission.\n\nGeneral Angerforge, the Dark Iron responsible for coordinating the attacks on the 109th division of the K.E.F. and the mass slaughter of our forces must be brought to justice.\n\nThis will undoubtedly be your most grueling mission, but should you succeed, you will be richly rewarded.",o="到黑石深渊去杀掉安格弗将军！当任务完成之后向军官高图斯复命。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay General Angerforge! Return to Warlord Goretooth when the task is complete.",p="那个屠夫有没有被正法？",pEN="Has the Butcher of Blackrock been disposed of?",c="正义终于得到了伸张！你是个不平凡的$r，$n。戴上这枚勋章，这是你为部落和K·E·F·所做出的卓越贡献的象征。",cEN="Finally! The villain been brought to justice! You are a remarkable individual, <name>. Wear this medallion as a symbol of your stalwart dedication to the Horde and the K.E.F."}
Q[4133]={d="暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷需要你的帮助。她在荒芜之地，就在兽人的卡加斯前哨基地里，她在那里对有关黑铁矮人的事情进行调查。\n\n去和薇薇安谈谈吧，她正在等着你。",dEN="Shadowmaster Vivian Lagrave is in need of your services. She is in the Badlands, in the orcish outpost of Kargath, pursuing rumors of a certain brew made by the Dark Iron dwarves of Blackrock Depths.\n\nSpeak with Vivian. She awaits you.",o="与卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shadowmaster Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",c="谢谢你到这里来，$n。这里不缺少荒漠地区的独特魅力，但是似乎医疗条件差了点。\n\n不开玩笑了。你是来这里谈生意的，对不对？",cEN="Thank you for coming, <name>. This place is not without a stark charm, but is lacks the amenities of the Apothecarium.\n\nEnough with the pleasantries. To business, yes?"}
Q[4134]={d="有传言说黑铁矮人霍尔雷·黑须偷到了一种酒的配方。这种被称作雷霆啤酒的饮料会使饮用者获得无穷的力量和勇气。我们希望能研究一下这种饮料。也许我们可以开发它的其它功能……能够帮助我们被遗忘者达成目标的功能。\n\n我说了被遗忘者的目标？我的意思是……整个部落的目标，我当然是这个意思！\n\n到黑石深渊去找到雷霆啤酒的配方，把它给我带回来。",dEN="It is rumored that the Dark Iron Hurley Blackbreath has stolen a recipe for ale. This ale, Thunderbrew Lager, is said to infuse its imbiber with great strength and courage. We wish to study the drink. Perhaps, we will find other applications for its virtues... applications more in line with Forsaken objectives.\n\nDelve into Blackrock Depths, find Hurley, take from him the recipe for Thunderbrew lager and bring it to me.\n\nAnd to find him, you may have to entice him by threatening his precious ale.",o="把遗失的雷酒秘方交给卡加斯的薇薇安·拉格雷。",oEN="Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",p="你找到雷酒配方了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the recipe for the Thunderbrew Lager, <name>?",c="非常好。我会把这个配方送到皇家药剂师协会进行研究，只要假以时日，我们必定可以找到其中的秘密。终有一天，那些联盟的矮人会发现我们用他们创造的饮料中的秘密来对付他们！\n\n那真的是太有趣了。这再次证明，死亡不会影响一个人的幽默感……你说呢？",cEN="Very good. I will send this recipe to the Apothecarium to be studied, and in time we will unlock its secrets. One day, the dwarves of the Alliance may find the virtues of this drink used against them!\n\nI find that terribly amusing. Perhaps death has an affect on one's sense of humor... do you think?"}
Q[4135]={d="在背包中有两样东西：第一件是要送到萨兰纳尔去的包裹，第二件是匆忙书写的便笺。\n\n便笺上面写着在豺狼人营地南边有一处被称作痛苦深渊的地方，那里有许多邪恶的虫类生物。作者认为他应该亲自去调查一番，因为他觉得那是对整个菲拉斯的威胁。便笺的末尾署了名，“羽月要塞的拉斯卡尔”。\n\n看来你最终找到了拉斯卡尔的下落。",dEN="Inside the backpacks are two items: the first is a parcel of goods that was bound for Thalanaar, and the second is a note hastily penned to an unknown reader.\n\nThe note tells of discovering insidious bug-like creatures south of the gnoll camps in a place called the Writhing Deep. The author felt the need to investigate it personally, as though it was a serious threat to all of Feralas. The note is signed, \"Raschal of Feathermoon\".\n\nIt would seem that you have located where Raschal ultimately went.",o="现在你已经知道了拉斯卡尔的去向，那么你最好到痛苦深渊去寻找他，或者至少是他的尸体。根据便笺上的信息，那个地方应该在木爪豺狼人营地的南边。",oEN="Now that Raschal's last known whereabouts have been discovered, continue your search for him or his remains in the Writhing Deep. According to the note, it is located to the south of the Woodpaw gnoll camps.",c="你找到了一个很大的脓包状物体。看起来这东西粘糊糊的，有些地方还有硬质的瘤。这个脓包的高度和宽度足够装下一个人型生物……通过里面隐约可见的人形轮廓，你大概猜出了里面裹着的究竟是什么。",cEN="You have discovered a large pod of an alien nature. The texture of the pod appears mucous, though hardened protrusions stick out from random parts of it. The pod itself has the height and width to easily encompass a humanoid inside of it... and from the faint humanoid shape visible through the skin of the pod, you surmise that this is what it indeed encapsulates."}
Q[4136]={d="我的兄弟雷布里就是我们家族的耻辱，他拿走了我们所有的钱，然后挥霍一空。\n\n藏宝海湾的大财主里维加兹刚刚开始悬赏雷布里的脑袋，这对他来说可能有些糟糕，但我简直无法形容斯库比格特家族在得知这个消息之后有多高兴了！我们的小雷布里终于有点价值了！\n\n但是现在他躲在黑石深渊的深处。请你帮忙找到他，然后把他带到我这里来！\n\n如果他不愿意来的话，那么也好……至少把他的头给我提来。",dEN="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another.\n\nWell, his last scheme must have been his worst, because Baron Revilgaz of Booty Bay just put a price on poor Ribbly's head. I can't tell you how happy this makes the Screwspigots! Our little Ribbly's finally worth something!\n\nBut now he's hiding out, deep in Blackrock Depths. Please, find him and bring him to me!\n\nOr, if he won't come, then that's ok... just bring me his head.",o="把雷布里的头颅交给燃烧平原的尤卡·斯库比格特。",oEN="Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",p="你抓到雷布里了吗？或者……至少把他身上的一部分交给我。",pEN="Do you have Ribbly? Or, at least a part of him?",c="啊！你找到他了！看来……我的小兄弟不愿来见我。太可惜了。我真希望能当面告诉他我们准备把他交给里维加兹，然后看看他脸上的表情。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你让我们感到很高兴。雷布里从来没有像现在这样平静过。",cEN="Aha! You found him! And... it appears that my little brother didn't want to come quiety. It's a pity. I would have liked to see the look on his face when I told him our plans to turn him in to Revilgaz.\n\nThank you, <name>. You've made my family very happy. And Ribbly's never looked as peaceful as he does now."}
Q[4141]={d="看见那里的拉瑞安了吗？就是他的错导致我们不得不待在这里！\n\n我告诉过他我们走错路了，但是他会听我的吗？你能相信他居然不和我说话吗？好吧，除非他改变主意，否则我们就准备看场好戏吧。\n\n你注意到周围那些像植物一样的生物了吗？它们确实很麻烦，但是我认为只要经过正确的训练，我就可以让它们听命于我。\n\n首先，我需要一些样品来进行研究。你可不可以帮我收集一些呢？",dEN="See Larion over there? It's HIS fault we're here!\n\nI told him we were going the wrong way, but would he listen? And would you believe that he's the one that won't speak to me? Well, until he changes his mind, let's have a bit of fun with him.\n\nHave you noticed the strange plant-like creatures around here? They're nothing but trouble, really, but I think if trained properly, I could get them to obey commands.\n\nFirst thing though, I'll need some samples to study. Do you think you could collect some?",o="从安戈洛尔环形山的血瓣花猛击者和血瓣花掠夺者身上收集20个血瓣花，然后向穆尔金回复。",oEN="Collect 15 Bloodpetals and return to Muigin.",p="拉瑞安在谋划一些东西，肯定是这样的！",pEN="Larion's got something coming, that's for sure!",c="我希望它们没有给你带来太多的麻烦，$n。我试图绕过它们——它们真是太疯狂了！\n\n我想要从它们身上跳过去……然后我就遭到了攻击！被植物攻击！",cEN="I hope they didn't give you too much trouble, <name>. I try to steer clear of them -- they're wild!\n\nI tried jumping over one... I was attacked! Plants just shouldn't be acting that way!"}
Q[4142]={d="我不能完全确定这是由什么构成的，$n。这些植物……好像具有一些最简单的智能。\n\n虽然我并不是这方面的专家。但是我知道有人一定知道答案！\n\n到菲拉斯去找我的一个名叫格雷甘·山酒的朋友，他是这方面的专家。\n\n我敢肯定格雷甘能帮我们，你应该可以在菲拉斯的野外找到他，他可不是那种喜欢生活在大城市里的家伙。",dEN="I'm not quite sure what to make of this, <name>. The plants... they seem to have some minimal intelligence.\n\nI'm no expert, though. But, I do know someone that is!\n\nHead to northern Feralas, and look for a buddy of mine named Gregan Brewspewer. He's an expert on this sort of thing.\n\nI'm sure Gregan can help us out here. You'll find him out in the wilderness; he's not the type to live in a big city.",o="把血瓣花交给菲拉斯的格雷甘·山酒。",oEN="Take a Bloodpetal to Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas.",p="我在这片森林中与世无争地生活……\n\n好吧，至少我原认为是这样的。我在这里碰到的来访者比我在铁炉堡的时候还要多！",pEN="I live out here in the forest... Peaceful.\n\nWell, at least I thought it would be. I get more visitors out here than I ever did when I lived in Ironforge!",c="血瓣花？嗯……好吧，你最好向我解释整个计划，然后我才能够告诉你我是否能够帮助你。",cEN="Bloodpetal, eh? Hmmm... Well, you better explain the plan, and then I'll tell you whether or not I can help you."}
Q[4143]={d="我跟你说实话吧，$n，在我的旅途生涯中，我从来没有看见过这样的植物。也许我应该去一下环形山……\n\n不管怎么样，我想我知道穆尔金正在找什么东西——阿塔莱之雾。那是种恐怖的东西，而且非常难找，但是穆尔金需要这种材料来控制那些小怪兽。\n\n你应该去悲伤沼泽里的那座沉没的神庙，那里的潜伏者、黑暗虫和泥浆怪身上都有阿塔莱之雾。祝你好运，$n！",dEN="To tell you the truth, <name>, I've never seen any plants like this in my travels. Perhaps I should take a trip to this crater...\n\nAt any rate, I think I know just the thing Muigin's looking for -- Atal'ai haze. It's horrid stuff, hard to collect, but it's just what he needs to control the little monsters.\n\nYou'll need to visit the temple of Atal'Hakkar in the Swamp of Sorrows. The Atal'ai Haze can be collected from the deep lurkers, murk worms, or oozes found there. Good luck, <name>!",o="收集5份阿塔莱之雾的样本，然后向安戈洛环形山的穆尔金复命。",oEN="Collect 5 samples of Atal'ai Haze, then return to Muigin in Un'Goro Crater.",p="拉瑞安还是不和我说话！看来他要对我沉默到底了。",pEN="Larion's still not speaking to me! He sure knows how to hold a grudge.",c="我承认，对于接触这些材料我有些犹豫，$n！但是如果格雷甘说它们会有效果的话，那我愿意试一下！",cEN="I admit, I'm a bit hesitant to touch that stuff, <name>! But if Gregan says it'll work, then I'm willing to give it a try!"}
Q[4144]={p="计划是这样的，$n：去收集一些血瓣花苗——你要知道，现在这种植物还没有开始广泛传播其种子，所以尽快把它们给我弄来，然后我就能看看阿塔莱之雾可以干些什么……\n\n你也许会认为我复仇心很重……事实上，所有人都应该有这样的权利！\n\n事实是这样的，我知道离开这里的路，但是除非拉瑞安承认我是对的，否则的话我就得永远待在这里！\n\n快点出发吧，找到那些血瓣花苗，然后就准备看好戏吧！",pEN="Here's the plan, <name>: Go out and collect some bloodpetal sprouts -- you know, the plants that haven't fully sprouted yet, and bring them here. Then I'll see what the Atal'ai haze can do.\n\nYou may think I'm vengeful... Actually, you'd be right about that!\n\nTruth is, I know the way out of here, but until Larion will admit that I'm right, I'm staying right here!\n\nSo off with you, find those bloodpetal sprouts and let's have some fun!",c="就是这东西，$n！这些一定会引起拉瑞安的注意的！",cEN="Here goes nothing, <name>! This will get Larion's attention!"}
Q[4145]={d="看到那边的穆尔金了吗？就是他的错使我们迷路了！\n\n我知道正确的路，但是他坚持说他知道一条捷径，然后我们就到了这里！\n\n更糟的是，现在他还不断用他那些疯狂的植物来烦我。我很生气，所以我原本打算不和他说话了，但是这些该死的植物实在是太多，我没有足够的能力来清除它们。\n\n那么，首先让我们来减少这些东西的数量吧，去帮我干掉一些血瓣花鞭笞者和血瓣花捕兽者。",dEN="See Muigin over there? It's HIS fault we're lost!\n\nI'm the one that knew the way, but he insisted he knew a shortcut, and we ended up here!\n\nTo make matters worse, now he keeps sending his crazy plant pests to annoy me. I'm so angry that I'm not planning on talking to him any time soon, but these pests are too much to handle.\n\nWhy don't we try to limit his supply, first thing. Go out and hunt some Bloodpetals, then return to me.",o="为马绍尔营地里的拉瑞安杀掉5个血瓣花鞭笞者、5个血瓣花捕兽者、5个血瓣花掠夺者和5个血瓣花猛击者。",oEN="Hunt 5 Bloodpetal Lashers, 5 Bloodpetal Threshers, 5 Bloodpetal Flayers and 5 Bloodpetal Trappers for Larion at Marshal's Refuge.",p="除非莫尔金向我道歉，否则我绝对不会再和他说话。",pEN="Muigin needs to apologize first before I'll talk to him again!",c="感谢你的帮助，$n，但是恐怕我这里有些坏消息……",cEN="Thanks for your help, <name>, but I'm afraid I have some bad news..."}
Q[4146]={d="你运气真不错，$n！在玛尔冯离开之后，我一直都在进行一些实验，其中的一项就是研究一种专杀除草器。只要进行一些调整，它就可以帮助你轻松地除掉那些血瓣花。\n\n我可以给你一部这种除草器的样品，但是你仍然得自行收集所需的燃料。你可以在沉没的神庙找到你要的阿塔莱之雾，那里的潜伏者、黑暗虫和泥浆怪身上都有这种东西。",dEN="You're in luck, <name>! I've been working on some of my own experiments while Marvon's been gone, and one of them is a short range bug zapper. With just a few adjustments, it should be great for ridding yourself of those Bloodpetal pests.\n\nI can let you have one of my zapper prototypes, but you'll still need to collect the fuel. You can get the necessary Atal'ai haze that the zapper needs in the temple of Atal'Hakkar. The deep lurkers, murk worms, or oozes are the ones you'll need to get it from.",o="收集5份阿塔莱之雾的样本，然后将它们送到马绍尔营地的拉瑞安那里。",oEN="Deliver the Unloaded Zapper and 5 samples of Atal'ai Haze to Larion in Marshal's Refuge.",p="累死人了，$n。那些东西搞得我永不得安宁！",pEN="This is exhausting, <name>. Those things just won't leave me alone!",c="那么说来，你没找到玛尔冯？好吧，不管怎么样，让我看看你拿来什么了。",cEN="So, Marvon wasn't around? Well, show me what you got, anyway."}
Q[4147]={d="我查了查穆尔金到底在干什么，结果发现他居然在种植那些该死的东西！\n\n我想现在唯一的解决方法是……不，不是去和他谈判……你在想什么？唯一的解决方法就是以牙还牙！\n\n我需要我的朋友玛尔冯的帮助，他在棘齿城有个车间。我敢说他一定能造点对我们有用的东西出来。",dEN="I managed to spy on what Muigin was doing, and he's actually growing the darn things over there!\n\nI think the only solution here is to... no, not go talk to him... What are you thinking? The solution is to fight back!\n\nWe'll need the help of my friend, Marvon, who has a workshop in Ratchet. I'm sure he'll be able to create some sort of gadget that will help us.",o="到棘齿城去，在玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的车间里找到他。",oEN="Travel to Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet.",c="玛尔冯很久之前就离开这里了，$n。他去塔纳利斯研究那里的古代巨魔遗迹去了。\n\n那么你刚才说你需要什么来着？",cEN="Marvon's been gone quite a long time now, <name>. He went off to Tanaris to study some of the ancient troll ruins.\n\nNow, what was it that you said you needed?"}
Q[4148]={p="要让除草器开工的话，我们就得有一份目标生物的样品。去环形山里找一个血瓣花苗来，然后我就设法用它启动莫尔金的小朋友……\n\n如果他不是那么固执的话，我们应该已经在回家的路上了……但是在我们能动身回家之前，我要向他证明他的那个小恶作剧并不能妨碍我！",pEN="For the zapper to work, it needs a sample of the target creature. Head out into the crater and collect a Bloodpetal sprout. Then I can calibrate it to work on Muigin's little friends...\n\nIf he weren't so stubborn, we could be on our way home, already... But until then, I'll just have to show him that his little prank doesn't bother me at all!",c="看起来这个血瓣花苗会很有作用，$n。现在记住，如果你在看到任何这种有害物出现的话，马上使用除草器！如果除草器不够用的话，你可以随时回到我这里来进行补充！",cEN="Looks like this is going to work perfectly, <name>. Now remember, if you see any of those pests around, don't hesitate to use that zapper!"}
Q[4161]={d="很久以前，暗夜精灵被称为卡多雷，这个名字的意思是\"众星之子\"。了解过去是你作为一名$c成长道路上的重要一步，$n，所以请仔细听我说。\n\n卡多雷一向以与自然和谐相处为傲。这意味着我们只向自然索取所需，并以同等的回报回馈自然。这种平衡给予我们许多，$n。\n\n去收集七条小蜘蛛腿——不多不少，然后带回来给我。",dEN="Long ago, the night elves were called the kaldorei, a name that means \"children of the stars.\" Learning of the past is an important step in your path as a <class>, <name>, so listen well to what I have to tell you.\n\nThe kaldorei have always taken much pride in their harmonious relationship with nature. This means that we only take from nature what is necessary, and that we return in kind. This balance has afforded us much, <name>.\n\nGo out and collect seven small spider legs -- no more than that, and return to me.",o="为多兰纳尔的扎瑞恩收集7条小蜘蛛腿。",oEN="Collect 7 Small Spider Legs for Zarrin in Dolanaar.",p="记住这种平衡，$n。我希望你能拥有一颗对这片森林充满理解和宽容的心。",pEN="Remember the balance, <name>. I wish you to develop an understanding and a strong empathy for the living forests.",c="永远记住我今天说的话，$n。我们暗夜精灵努力维护自然的平衡，而你就是这种平衡中的一部分。",cEN="Always remember what I have shown you today, <name>. You are part of the balance that the night elves strive to keep intact, even during troublesome times."}
Q[4181]={d="高级的工程学有两个分支：侏儒派和地精派，请注意我提到地精工程学的唯一原因是因为我是个公正的训练师。他们喜欢制造一些会爆炸的东西，而且丝毫不关心有什么东西会被炸到——即使是他们自己。\n\n好吧，$n，读一下这本手册。如果你想要学习把自己炸上天的方法，就把这个交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。请记住，一旦你加入某一派，就永远也不能再加入另一派了，所以在你完成他交给你的任务之前要三思。",dEN="Expert engineering yields two distinct disciplines: gnome and goblin. I only bother to mention goblin engineering because I'm a fair trainer. They like to make things that blow up, and they rarely care what is in the way - even themselves.\n\n<name>, read this manual. If you want to learn how to blow yourself up, then take it to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan. Remember - membership is permanent and prevents joining the other discipline, so make sure this is what you want before finishing his task.",o="如果你想要对地精工程学有更多了解，就把工程学教材交给加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。",oEN="If you wish to learn more about Goblin Engineering, take the Manual of Engineering Disciplines to Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan.",p="我可以在一里外闻到新技师的气味，就像我可以在一里外闻到炸药的气味一样。你是来揭开炸药的神秘面纱的吗？",pEN="I can smell fresh recruits much like I can an excellent blasting powder - from a mile away. Have you come seeking to learn about the mastery of the explosion?",c="好吧，$n，你选择这条道路真是明智之极！随便什么蠢货都可以成为初级工程学的专家——那些侏儒跟他们那满是辐射的老窝就是铁一样的证据。要成为出色的地精工程学专家，你必须有坚强的意志和稳固的双手——在这里我不得不强调稳固二字。\n\n竖起你的耳朵来好好听着，$n，你会学到许多东西的。",cEN="Well <name>, you were wise to seek my tutelage! Any schlep can become an expert at the basics of engineering - the gnomes and their irradiated home of Gnomeregan are proof of that. It takes a strong mind and a steady hand (emphasis on STEADY) though to master the discipline of Goblin Engineering.\n\nKeep your ears perked <name>, and you might learn something."}
Q[4182]={d="燃烧平原上的生活充满了冲突。\n\n看看这个地方！我们对这些建筑的遭遇知之甚少，但我们知道，在很久以前那场大爆炸之前，这里原本是赤脊山脉的一部分。\n\n别再哀叹了！我们有个麻烦，$n。你也许已经注意到山脊下面的龙人。我们需要有人帮忙把它们逼退。尽可能多地杀死它们，然后回来见我。做到了，也许我们还能谈谈别的事。|n",dEN="Life in the Burning Steppes is rife with conflict.\n\nJust look at this place! We know very little of what happened to these buildings, but we do know that at one time, before the great explosion, this was all part of the Redridge mountain range.\n\nEnough lamenting! We have a problem, <name>. You may have noticed the dragonkin below this ridge. We need assistance in pushing them back. Kill as many as you can and return to me. Succeed and perhaps we can talk of other things.",o="杀掉15条黑色小龙、10条黑色龙人、4条火鳞龙人和1条黑色幼龙。当你完成任务之后就向赫林迪斯·河角回报。",oEN="Slay 15 Black Broodlings, 10 Black Dragonspawn, 4 Black Wyrmkin and 1 Black Drake.",p="猎龙行动进行得怎么样了？",pEN="How goes the dragon hunt?",c="干得好，$n。现在我们知道你能轻松搞定那些龙，那么……来谈谈更棘手的事情吧。",cEN="Superb slaying, <name>. Now that we know you can handle yourself around dragonkin, we can talk of more pressing matters."}
Q[4183]={d="我们以前总是认为黑石兽人的残忍是与生俱来的。不过我们在这里找到的东西却告诉我们另一个故事。\n\n没错，嗜血和对战斗的饥渴使他们变成了如今的样子，但是这一切的幕后主使却是那些黑龙。我们认为，正是黑龙把愤怒和敌意灌输给了他们。\n\n把这封信交给所罗门镇长，他会知道该做什么的。\n\n<赫林迪斯把一封信交给了你。>",dEN="We had always assumed that the Blackrock orcs were a product of their savage upbringing. What we have found here, in their homeland, tells us another story.\n\nIndeed, it is bloodlust and thirst for conflict that empowers them, but the black dragonflight are the beings whom control the orcs of Blackrock. We suspect that it is the black dragonflight that fuels them with rage and hostility.\n\nTake this letter to Magistrate Solomon. He will know what must be done.\n\n<Helendis hands you a sealed letter.>",o="把赫林迪斯·河角的信交给湖畔镇的所罗门镇长。",oEN="Travel to Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains and deliver Helendis Riverhorn's Letter to Magistrate Solomon.",p="幸会，$n。我们之前见过吗？你看起来好眼熟啊。",pEN="Greetings, <name>. Have we met before? You look vaguely familiar.",c="<所罗门镇长打开赫林迪斯给他的信，然后读了起来。>",cEN="<Magistrate Solomon opens the sealed letter from Helendis and begins reading.>"}
Q[4184]={d="这消息可不妙，$n。发现自己不共戴天的敌人不过是更强大威胁的棋子，实在令人沮丧。湖畔镇绝不可能同时抵挡黑石兽人和黑龙军团的进攻。如果湖畔镇陷落，夜色镇就是下一个，然后呢？闪金镇？还是暴风城本身？\n\n你必须立刻把这个消息带给暴风城的国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩！如果这都不能让暴风城伸出援手，那就没有什么能了，一切都将失去。|n",dEN="This is grim news, <name>. To discover that our mortal enemies are merely pawns of a much greater threat is disheartening. There is no possible way that Lakeshire could survive an attack from both the Blackrock orcs and the black dragonflight. Should Lakeshire fall to this menace, Darkshire would fall next, and then what? Goldshire? Stormwind itself?\n\nYou must take this information to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind at once! If this does not merit the aid of Stormwind, nothing will and all is lost.",o="前往暴风城，把所罗门的求援信交给国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩。\n\n他住在暴风要塞里。",oEN="Travel to Stormwind and deliver Solomon's Plea to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.\n\nBolvar resides in Stormwind Keep.",p="是什么风把你吹到暴风要塞里来了？",pEN="What brings you to Stormwind Keep?",c="龙？不可能！",cEN="Dragons? Impossible!"}
Q[4185]={d="所罗门描绘的图景十分可怕。但仅凭猜测，我们还不能把本就捉襟见肘的部队派去支援湖畔镇。我需要这些说法的证据才能行动。\n\n去和普瑞斯托女士谈谈，$n。她博学多识，对龙类和龙人知之甚详。也许她能为这件事提供一些线索。|n",dEN="Solomon paints a dreary picture. Still, we cannot afford to send our thinly spread troops to the aid of Lakeshire on speculation. I will need proof of these claims before I can act.\n\nSpeak with Lady Prestor, <name>. She is a learned woman and knows much of dragons and dragonkin. She may be able to shed some light on this situation.",o="与女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托谈话，然后再与伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵谈话。",oEN="Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon after speaking with Lady Katrana Prestor.",p="<伯瓦尔专注地看着你。>",pEN="<Bolvar watches you intently.>",c="<伯瓦尔用手摸着下巴，好像陷入了沉思。>\n\n我尊重普瑞斯托女士的立场，我相信一定有办法可以解决我们面临的难题。",cEN="<Bolvar cups his chin as if in deep thought.>\n\nWhile I respect Lady Prestor's stance, I believe that there is a solution to this dilemma that may put all of our concerns to rest."}
Q[4186]={d="我现在任命你为暴风城执行代表，$n。\n\n回到湖畔镇的所罗门镇长那里，向他传达这份命令。",dEN="I am going to empower you as an acting deputy of Stormwind, <name>.\n\nReturn to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire and deliver this decree.",o="把乌瑞恩的法令带给湖畔镇的所罗门镇长。|n",oEN="Take Wrynn's Decree to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire.",p="有没有乌瑞恩国王传来的消息？",pEN="Any news from Bolvar?",c="我觉得情况会更加糟糕……\n\n<所罗门镇长看着你。>\n\n看来湖畔镇的命运落在你的肩头上了。\n\n<你注意到所罗门镇长的眼睛湿润了。他开始哭泣。>",cEN="It could have been worse, I suppose...\n\n<Magistrate Solomon looks you over.>\n\nIt appears as if the fate of Lakeshire rests squarely on your shoulders.\n\n<You notice Magistrate Solomon blinking rapidly. He appears to be crying.>"}
Q[4201]={d="啊，爱情的痛苦！我亲爱的罗克诺特下士对我的魅力不来电，他将我无情地拒绝了！这真是令我发狂！\n\n你必须帮帮我！我们魅魔对于爱情了如指掌，所以我可以配制一种药水，用它来融化包围着罗克诺特心脏的铁墙。不过我需要一些材料才能配置这种药水——一种被称作格罗姆之血的药草，一块从艾萨拉的悬崖巨人那里得到的巨大银矿，还有从安戈洛的温泉中取得的水。你可以把水放在这个小瓶里。\n\n$n，请帮助一个可怜的灵魂追求她的快乐吧！",dEN="Oh, the pains of love! My dear Private Rocknot is immune to my charms. I am spurned! It's maddening!\n\nYou must help me! We succubi know much of love, and I can make a potion to beat down the iron walls around Rocknot's heart. To make it, I need these items: the herb gromsblood, giant silver veins from the cliff giants of Azshara, and water from the Golakka Springs Crater in Un'Goro. You can place the water in this vial.\n\nPlease, <name>, help a poor soul in her quest for happiness!",o="将4份格罗姆之血、10块巨型银矿和装满水的娜玛拉之瓶交给黑石深渊的娜玛拉小姐。",oEN="Bring 4 Gromsblood, 10 Giant Silver Veins and Nagmara's Filled Vial to Mistress Nagmara in Blackrock Depths.",p="你拿到材料了吗？我心中的空虚正在吞噬我！",pEN="Do you have the ingredients? The hole in my heart threatens to consume me!",c="哦，你做到了！现在我可以配制我的药水，用在洛克诺特身上了。他终于要拜倒在我的魅力之下了！\n\n谢谢你，$n。你是$g爱情:爱情;的冠军:冠军;！",cEN="Oh, you've done it! I can now make my potion and use it on Rocknot. Finally, he will fall victim to my charms!\n\nThank you, <name>. You are a champion of love!"}
Q[4221]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4222]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4223]={d="<所罗门镇长叹着气。>\n\n你必须回到燃烧平原去，$n。作为暴风城的代表，你现在应该去向麦克斯韦尔元帅报告。祝你好运。",dEN="<Magistrate Solomon sighs.>\n\nYou must return to the Burning Steppes, <name>. As a deputy of Stormwind, you will be required to report to Marshal Maxwell. Good luck.",o="和燃烧平原的麦克斯韦尔元帅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes.",c="<麦斯威尔元帅大笑着。>",cEN="<Marshal Maxwell laughs.>"}
Q[4224]={d="什么？你以为你是第一个被派来这里的？我们到底要损失多少士兵，暴风城才会下决心采取行动？\n\n对于黑石兽人可能造成的威胁，我们已经有了充足的证据，但是在指挥官温德索尔元帅被俘虏之后，我们损失了许多宝贵的情报。\n\n我们需要的是那份文件。去跟约翰谈谈吧，$n。他当时和温德索尔一起遇到了黑石氏族的袭击，现在他正在北边的一个洞穴里休息。",dEN="What? You thought you were the first? How many soldiers must we lose before Stormwind acts?\n\nWe had accumulated enormous amounts of intelligence pertaining to the Blackrock menace before we lost our commanding officer, Marshal Windsor. With Marshal Windsor went all of our precious information.\n\nWhat we need is that documentation. Speak with Ragged John, <name>. He was with Windsor when they were attacked by a Blackrock raiding party. He was last seen in a cave to the north.",o="与衣衫褴褛的约翰交谈。",oEN="Speak with Ragged John.",p="你和约翰谈过了吗？",pEN="Have you spoken with John yet?",c="嗯？有什么好笑的？",cEN="I could have warned you, but what fun is that?"}
Q[4241]={d="这么说来，那个没用的废物说温德索尔还活着，是吗？\n\n做好准备，士兵，你必须去找到他。如果温德索尔还活着的话，你就把他带回来。如果他死了，那我就要你拿出他已经死亡的证据。\n\n<麦克斯韦尔大笑着。>\n\n我打赌你已经厌倦听到这样的命令了，是不是？",dEN="So that good for nothing coward says that Windsor is alive, eh?\n\nSuit up, deputy, you are going in to find him. If Windsor is alive, you are to bring him back. If he's dead, I want proof.\n\n<Maxwell laughs.>\n\nI bet you are getting tired of hearing that, aren't you?",o="到西北部的黑石山脉去，在黑石深渊中找到温德索尔元帅的下落。\n\n狼狈不堪的约翰曾告诉你说温德索尔被关进了一个监狱。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor.\n\nYou recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison.",c="他在哪里？我要杀了他！",cEN="Where is he! I'll murder him!"}
Q[4242]={d="博瓦尔是个蠢货。我当时正在收集他那些宝贝证据，好把它们塞进他嘴里。\n\n可那小丑的眼睛比石膏猫还瞎。证据就摆在他面前两英尺远，他却看不见。\n\n至于我的资料，已经丢失了。没了。找不回来了。\n\n要是有朝一日我能找到铁炉堡之锤，并且走出这座迷宫，我第一站就去暴风城，把我的锤子狠狠敲在那条爬虫的两眼之间。\n\n别来烦我，$n。",dEN="Bolvar is a fool. I was gathering his precious 'proof' so that I could shove it down his throat.\n\nHe is a blind buffoon. Proof stands two feet away from him and he does not see.\n\nAs for my data, it's lost. Gone. Unrecoverable.\n\nShould I ever find Ironfoe and make it out of this labyrinth, my first stop will be Stormwind, to place my hammer in between that reptile's eyes.\n\nLeave me, <name>.",o="把这个坏消息传达给麦克斯韦尔元帅。",oEN="Give Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes the bad news.",c="显然，他疯了。\n\n<麦斯威尔难过地垂下了头。>\n\n一个曾经是那么光荣和高贵的战士现在却成了唠唠叨叨的家伙。我猜想我们进了一个死胡同……\n\n不管怎么样，我必须为你所做的努力而奖励你，$n。",cEN="He's gone mad, apparently.\n\n<Maxwell lowers his head in mourning.>\n\nIt is unfortunate that a once proud and noble warrior would be turned into a blithering head case. I GUESS we've reached a dead end...\n\nI must reward you for your efforts thus far, <name>."}
Q[4243]={d="非常不幸，我的一项最伟大的发明出了点问题。你以前见过机械松鼠，对吗？嗯，为了接近安戈洛环形山的猿猴，我制造了一只机械猿猴混入它们的群落——我把她称为A-Me 01。\n\n她的水晶眼珠上附有特殊的魔法，因此我能看见她所看见的一切。不过，在她到了北边的蘑菇石——也就是那群猿猴的巢穴里面之后，我便与她失去了联系。我最后看到她的时候，猿群中有一只雄猿正在冲上前去想和她套近乎！\n\n你能帮我找到她吗？",dEN="Unfortunately, something's happened to one of my greatest inventions. You've seen mechanical squirrels, yes? Well, to get closer to the apes of Un'Goro Crater, I created a mechanical ape to blend in with their kind--I call her A-Me 01.\n\nShe has scrying gems for eyes so I could see everything she saw. She made it to Fungal Rock--the apes' lair--just east of here, and that's when I lost contact. The last thing I saw was one of their alpha males rushing up to say hello to her!\n\nCan you help me find her?",o="在安戈洛环形山找到A-Me 01。",oEN="Find A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.",c="在你检查 艾米 01时，你发现她身上有两处非常明显的咬痕，一处在肩膀上，另一处在头上。\n\n你对她做了进一步的检查，发现似乎没有任何动力驱动这台复杂的机械。",cEN="As you look A-Me 01 over, you see two huge dents tarnishing what Karna obviously feels is a well-crafted piece of engineering. One dent decorates A-Me 01's shoulder, the other is on her head.\n\nNo power seems to be running through her components as you investigate further."}
Q[4244]={d="再仔细检查一下，你会发现一块滑开的盖板。线路上方清楚地写着：\"更换秘银外壳，然后\"关掉电源再重新打开\"。\n\n你花点时间换好盖板，心里琢磨着修好A-Me 01并把她带回马绍尔营地附近的卡纳·雷姆特雷夫身边，会不会就这么简单。只有试过才知道。\n\n",dEN="A little further investigation shows a panel that slides open. Clearly written above some wiring is the statement, \"Replace Mithril Casing And Turn Power Off Then On.\"\n\nTaking a moment to replace the panel, you wonder if it'll be that simple to fix A-Me 01 and get her back to Karna Remtravel near Marshall's Refuge.\n\nOnly trying it will tell.",o="找到一个秘银外壳，然后回到安戈洛环形山的A-Me 01身边。",oEN="Find a Mithril Casing and return to A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.",p="用来放置秘银外壳的面板仍处于关闭状态。艾米 01的其它部分没有任何动静。",pEN="The panel in which the mithril casing goes is still closed shut. The rest of A-Me 01 remains inert.",c="你再次打开A-Me 01背上的盖板，小心地取出那个似乎已经烧毁的旧秘银外壳。新的外壳轻松地滑入到位。如果秘银外壳就是问题所在，那么接下来唯一要做的就是把开关拨到\"关的位置，然后再拨回开的位置。",cEN="You remove the panel from A-Me 01's back yet again and carefully remove the old mithril casing that seems to have burnt out. The new one slides into place easily. The only thing left to do, assuming the mithril casing was the problem, is to flip the switch to the \"Off\" position, and then back to the \"On\" position."}
Q[4245]={d="你一边检查自己是否$g准备好:准备好;把A-Me 01带回卡纳·雷姆特雷夫身边，一边把开关拨到\"关\"的位置。你再次四下张望，确定没有大猩猩靠近，然后准备看看把开关拨回\"开\"的位置会发生什么。\n\n这是你最后的机会了……你$g确定:确定;这就是你想做的吗？",dEN="Checking to see if you're prepared to lead A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel, you flip the switch to the \"Off\" position. Glancing around once again to make sure none of the gorillas are coming, you prepare to see what happens when you flip the switch back to the \"On\" position.\n\nThis is your last chance... are you sure this is what you want to do?",o="将A-Me 01交给安戈洛环形山的卡尔纳·雷塔维。",oEN="Escort A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你能帮助艾米吗？看来很可能是她的秘银外壳被损坏了，我相信如果你给她换一个秘银外壳，她就能恢复如初，而且可以自己回家。",pEN="Have you been able to help A-Me? That mithril casing you mentioned being destroyed was a good guess at what was wrong. I'm sure if you replace that, she'll reactivate and be able to come home.",c="哦，你成功了！太棒了！谢谢你，$n。\n\n啊，我可怜的艾米，看看这些牙印！我们只需稍作修理就能让她重新正常运转起来。\n\n再次感谢你，$n。",cEN="Oh, you've done it! Wonderful! Thank you, <name>.\n\nOh, my poor, A-Me. Look at all those dents. We'll get her up and running perfectly with just a little work.\n\nThank you again, <name>. I really appreciate it."}
Q[4261]={d="费伍德森林曾经是个和平安详的地方……直到燃烧军团占据了这里。恶魔、毁灭和混乱接踵而来……\n\n古尔丹之颅让这里的所有生物无一幸免地全都堕落了。\n\n直到现在，我还是身陷其中，不得不忍受这片土地所遭受的痛苦。请帮我找到回家的路吧，$n，告诉我你愿意带领一个古树之灵离开这里，让我得到最终的安息。\n\n在我获得自由之后，就请去找住在林歌神殿的德鲁伊凯尼斯·静风。",dEN="Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos...\n\nThe skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here. All fell to the corruption.\n\nEven now, as a spirit, I still find myself trapped, bearing the suffering of this land. Help me find my way home. Please, <name>, tell me you will lead an ancient spirit away from here, where I may finally rest.\n\nOnce I am free, seek out Kayneth Stillwind, a druid that resides in Forest Song, to the east.",o="护送艾雷脱离危险，然后和灰谷东部的林歌神殿中的凯尼斯·静风谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",c="没错，$n，费伍德森林经历了如此之多的苦痛。感谢你所做的一切。\n\n总有那么一天，我们会将费伍德森林从堕落中解救出来，所有像你这样的善举对我们都很有帮助。",cEN="Yes, <name>. Felwood has been through much hardship. Thank you for what you have done.\n\nOne day, we may be able to reclaim Felwood from the corruption; every kind deed helps."}
Q[4262]={d="前五个试图进入黑石深渊的法师几乎个个都灰头土脸地回来了，有的情况还要更糟糕。\n\n<加琳达从地上抓了一把灰尘洒向天空。>\n\n造成这种情况的主要原因是有一个可恶的臭虫——征服者派隆给我们带来了很多麻烦。我们必须干掉这个元素生物，然后才能顺利地进入黑石深渊！\n\n他就守在黑石采矿场的黑石深渊入口处。",dEN="The last five of my mages that went snooping around in Blackrock Mountain came back extra crispy with a permanent orange gnomefro - or worse.\n\n<Jalinda picks up some ashes from the ground and releases them into the air.>\n\nOne nasty bugger in particular, Overmaster Pyron, seems to be causing quite a bit of trouble. We need that elemental terminated so that our expedition crew can make its way into Blackrock Depths!\n\nHe guards the entrance at the Blackrock Quarry.",o="杀掉征服者派隆，然后向加琳达复命。\n\n加琳达告诉过你，派隆守在采矿场中，也许你应该去那里找找。",oEN="Slay Overmaster Pyron.\n\nYou recall Jalinda talking about Pyron guarding the quarry. Perhaps you should search there?",p="<加琳达目不转睛地盯着你。>",pEN="<Jalinda appears to be staring at your head.>",c="伊森迪奥斯？我的天啊……",cEN="Incendius? Oh dear..."}
Q[4263]={d="你$g确定:确定;派隆临死前说的是\"伊森迪奥斯\"吗？\n\n<贾琳达艰难地咽了口唾沫。>\n\n据说伊森迪奥斯领主是拉格纳罗斯的爪牙！天哪，天哪……我们该怎么办？\n\n你觉得你还能再接受一个任务吗？我没有别人可以派了，$n！\n\n只要伊森迪奥斯还在不断把派隆从灰烬中复活，我们的队伍就永远渗透不进去。\n\n你必须找到并摧毁伊森迪奥斯领主！|n",dEN="Are you sure Pyron said 'Incendius' when he died?\n\n<Jalinda swallows hard.>\n\nLord Incendius is purported to be a minion of Ragnaros! Oh dear, oh dear... whatever will we do?\n\nDo you think you can handle another mission? I don't have anybody else to send, <name>!\n\nWe will never get a team in if Incendius continues to raise Pyron from the ashes.\n\nYou'll have to find and destroy Lord Incendius!",o="在黑石深渊里找到伊森迪奥斯，然后把他干掉！",oEN="Find Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths and destroy him!",p="那个恶魔死了吗？",pEN="Is the fiend dead??",c="天哪！你$g确定:确定;伊森迪奥斯说的是\"拉格纳罗斯\"吗？\n\n<贾琳达递给你一样东西，拍了拍你的手腕，随即陷入沉思。>",cEN="Oh dear! Are you sure Incendius said 'Ragnaros?'\n\n<Jalinda hands you something and pats you on the wrist as she fades deep into thought.>"}
Q[4264]={d="这张纸条上布满了污渍。字迹勉强可以辨认，但你大致看清了以下内容：\n\n……多么绝妙的讽刺……\n\n……破碎的联盟的覆灭……\n\n……若不是安格弗将军的勤勉，我们也许永远发现不了这套加密的规律……\n\n……阿格曼奇几乎已经破译完温莎的笔记了。\n\n我们的主人将从深渊中崛起，碾碎所有残存者……\n\n——达格兰·索瑞森大帝。|n",dEN="The note has stains covering its surface. The text is barely legible, but you make out the following:\n\n...sweet irony...\n\n...the fall of the broken Alliance...\n\n...if it were not for General Angerforge's diligence, we may have never discovered the pattern to the encryption...\n\n...Argelmach is almost done with the decryption of Windsor's notes.\n\nOur lord will rise from the depths and crush any that remain...\n\n-Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.",o="温德索尔元帅也许会对你手中的东西感兴趣。毕竟，希望还没有被完全扼杀。",oEN="You may have just stumbled on to something that Marshal Windsor would be interested in seeing. There may be hope, after all.",p="<温德索尔元帅盯着你手中的信。>\n\n你手里拿着什么，$n？",pEN="<Marshal Windsor eyes the note in your hand.>\n\nWhat do you have there, <name>?",c="<温德索尔元帅拿过信开始读起来。>",cEN="<Marshal Windsor takes the note and begins reading.>"}
Q[4265]={d="你一碰，荚壳便裂了开来，里面竟是一位还活着的暗夜精灵男性。他看上去状态还不错，只是极度恍惚。当你扶他下来时，他渐渐恢复了意识。\n\n\"感谢艾露恩——你救了我，朋友！我……我叫拉斯卡尔。我被虫子袭击，醒来时就瘫痪在这个荚壳里了。是要塞派你来的吗？\"\n\n看来你找到了那位失踪的信使！",dEN="The pod splits opens some when you touch it, revealing a night elven male who is surprisingly still alive. He seems to be in good health, though deeply stunned. As you help him down from the pod, he stirs to life.\n\n\"Thank Elune - you've saved me, friend! I... I'm Raschal, and I awoke paralyzed inside this pod after these bugs overwhelmed me. Were you sent by the Stronghold?\"\n\nIt would seem that you've found the missing courier!",o="将拉斯卡尔安全护送到祖卡什虫巢外。\n\n回到羽月要塞的基恩诺·火花那儿，告诉他拉斯卡尔还活着，且状况良好。",oEN="Free Raschal from the Zukk'ash hive.\n\nReturn to Ginro Hearthkindle in Feathermoon Stronghold and let him know that Raschal is alive and well.",p="你有事要报告吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to report, <name>?",c="欢迎回家，$n。拉斯卡尔不久前刚回来报到，把事情经过告诉了我。\n\n我……不，整个要塞都无以回报你的壮举；要不是你及时相助，拉斯卡尔早就死了，而你的援手甚至没有提过一分佣金的影子。你身上有着真正英雄的印记。要知道，你永远是金罗·炉火的$g朋友:朋友;。",cEN="Welcome home, <name>. Raschal checked in just a little while ago and told me what happened.\n\nI... no, the entire Stronghold can't even begin to thank you for your great deed; Raschal would have been dead without your timely aid, and your assistance came to us without even so much as the whisper of a mercenary's fee. You bear the mark of a true hero. Know that you will always have a friend in Ginro Hearthkindle."}
Q[4266]={d="$n，珊蒂斯·羽月将军想与你私下谈一谈。毫无疑问，她是想要感谢你对要塞做出的贡献，但我知道她还想和你讨论一下你和拉斯卡尔在菲拉斯南部遇到的那种昆虫。毫不夸张地说，那些祖卡什的昆虫……非常可怕。\n\n羽月将军正在主厅里等你。",dEN="<name>, General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally. No doubt she wants to thank you for your service to the Stronghold, but I do know that she also wants to talk to you about the insect creatures that you and Raschal faced in southern Feralas. The reports of those Zukk'ash insects are... frightening, to say the least.\n\nGeneral Feathermoon is waiting for you in the main compound.",o="与羽月要塞的珊蒂斯·羽月谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",c="$n，对你给予我们的帮助，我向你致以最衷心的感谢。你在面对巨大的困难表现出了过人的勇气，因此我希望你接受这一奖励。\n\n现在，如果可以的话……我想再次请求你的帮助。这个任务涉及到了在菲拉斯这里发现的祖卡什虫穴，我想你是最佳的人选。",cEN="<name>, I give you my warmest thanks for the aid you've given us. Your bravery in the face of overwhelming odds has warranted a reward worth a thousand times greater. Nevertheless, I hope you accept this on behalf of the entire Stronghold.\n\nNow, if I may... I'd like to ask for your aid one more time. In light of the discovery of the Zukk'ash hive here in Feralas, I think you're the best choice for this mission."}
Q[4267]={d="我信任你，所以把这份由拉斯卡尔撰写的关于菲拉斯东南部现状的报告交给你。现在这份报告的原本正在达纳苏斯归档，我要你做的是把这份副件交给最高女祭司的助手，她的名字叫格拉希娜·灵风，是一个住在达纳苏斯月神殿中的女祭司。她对于这些生物有着很深入的了解，把这份报告提交给她对我们大家都有好处。\n\n现在解散，祝你好运，$n。愿艾露恩保佑我们。",dEN="I am entrusting you with a copy of the report Raschal made on the infestation of southeastern Feralas. While the main report is being filed in Darnassus, I want you to give this copy to an associate of the Protectorate. Her name is Gracina Spiritmight; she is a priestess who dwells in the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus. She has broad knowledge on these kinds of creatures, and her receiving this report would benefit us all.\n\nYou're dismissed - good luck, <name>; may Elune watch over us all.",o="把拉斯卡尔的报告交给达纳苏斯的格拉希娜·灵风。",oEN="Bring Raschal's Report to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus.",p="欢迎来到这座神圣的殿堂，$g朋友:朋友;。你从羽月要塞到来的消息早已传到我这里。珊蒂斯·羽月要你带来的报告，你带来了吗？",pEN="Welcome to this blessed temple, friend. Your arrival here from Feathermoon Stronghold has been foretold to me. Do you have the report Shandris Feathermoon asked you to bring?",c="我们暗夜精灵很了解这份报告中所描绘的恐怖的场景。珊蒂斯派你把这份报告送到我这里来，这是个明智的决定。\n\n这些生物很快就吞噬菲拉斯，我们一定要消灭它们。你和其它信差看到的那些昆虫被称作异种蝎，它们是联盟和部落将要面对的共同威胁。\n\n我发誓要在异种蝎毁灭我们之前解决它们。",cEN="We night elves know of the terror outlined in this report. Shandris was wise to send this, and you, to me.\n\nThese creatures will consume Feralas rapidly; they are nothing short of one of the greatest menaces we all will ever face. The insects you and the courier encountered are known as the silithid. They are mere tools of one of the greatest threats that both the Horde and Alliance will ever face.\n\nI pray we will have the resolve to defeat them before they destroy us."}
Q[4281]={d="你在木爪豺狼人营地里发现的这包货物应该是送往菲拉斯东南部的萨兰纳尔驿站的。不管那个失踪的信使命运如何，递送包裹的任务显然是没有完成。\n\n你仔细地检查包裹，发现在外包装上有手写的“法芬德尔”字样，也许这就是包裹接收人的名字。",dEN="This parcel of goods you found in the Woodpaw gnoll camps was supposed to be delivered to the small way-station of Thalanaar in southeastern Feralas. Regardless of the missing courier's fate, the task of delivering the parcel remains unfinished.\n\nExamining the parcel in detail reveals a hand written name of \"Falfindel Waywarder\" on the outside of the packaging. Perhaps this is the parcel's ultimate recipient.",o="将未递送的包裹交给萨兰纳尔驿站的法芬德尔。",oEN="Bring the Undelivered Parcel to Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar.",p="欢迎来到萨兰纳尔，$c。你需要什么帮助吗？",pEN="Welcome to Thalanaar, <class>. Do you need assistance of some sort?",c="赞美艾露恩，来自羽月要塞的包裹终于到了！\n\n是你送来了包裹，这么说我们的信差拉斯卡尔也许遇到麻烦了。我希望他能安然无恙……我知道，最近木爪豺狼人对它们南边的某种生物产生了强烈的敌对情绪，或许他是落到那些野兽手中了。我会小心的，朋友。\n\n无论如何，再次感谢你。这是递送包裹的报酬。",cEN="Elune be praised, the delivery from Feathermoon Stronghold has finally arrived!\n\nYour presence here indicates to me that perhaps some ill fate may have befallen Raschal, our usual courier. I hope that everything works out. I know that recently, the Woodpaw have become highly agitated from some source to their south. Maybe he fell to the wilds there; I would be careful, friend.\n\nRegardless, thank you again. Here is payment for this parcel's delivery."}
Q[4282]={d="<温莎元帅兴奋地晃着那张纸条。>\n\n你明白这意味着什么吗，$n？\n\n也许一切都还没有失去！据我判断，这些情报掌握在两个黑铁矮人手里：安格弗将军和魔像领主阿格曼奇。我有种感觉，如果我们客客气气地开口，他们是不会把情报交出来的。\n\n我希望你已经$g准备好:准备好;战斗了。\n\n出发吧，找到那两个恶棍！消灭他们，把我丢失的情报带回来。",dEN="<Marshal Windsor shakes the note excitedly.>\n\nDo you realize what this means, <name>?\n\nPerhaps all is not lost! From what I can ascertain, the information is being held by two Dark Iron dwarves: General Angerforge and the golem lord, Argelmach. I have a feeling that they won't just hand over the information if we ask nicely.\n\nI hope you are ready to battle.\n\nVenture forth and find these two villains! Destroy them and return my lost information.",o="找回温德索尔元帅遗失的情报。\n\n温德索尔元帅确信那些情报在安格弗将军和傀儡统帅阿格曼奇的手里。",oEN="Return Marshal Windsor's Lost Information.\n\nMarshal Windsor believes that the information is being held by Golem Lord Argelmach and General Angerforge.",p="不久之后，这个大阴谋就要彻底破灭了。",pEN="Soon this grand subterfuge will be over.",c="<温德索尔元帅从你的手中一把抓过那两块石板。>\n\n我们要离开这里！",cEN="<Marshal Windsor snatches the two tablets from your hands.>\n\nWe need to get out of here!"}
Q[4283]={d="我要告诉你个小秘密，士兵。走近一些。\n\n我是这里唯一正常的人！\n\n看看我周围的那些家伙！你相信他们都不正常吗？事实上他们都不正常！他们都疯了！疯了！\n\n<奥拉留斯放低了声音。>\n\n这是个秘密，不要告诉别人，只有你，我，还有我的那个军官伙计知道。\n\n<奥拉留斯紧握拳头。>\n\n不管怎么样……我在收集食人魔耳朵的同时也收集徽章，就是那些兽人身上的徽章。给我弄五十枚徽章来，现在就出发！\n\n<奥拉留斯双手拢在嘴边作喇叭状。>\n\n快去拿到那些徽章！",dEN="I'm going to let you in on a little secret, soldier. Come a little closer.\n\nI'M THE ONLY SANE ONE HERE!\n\nLook at these people! Would you believe that they're all insane!? Well they are! NUTS! CRAZY!\n\n<Oralius lowers his voice.>\n\nLet's just keep that between me, you, and my pal Captain Winky.\n\n<Oralius grabs at the air and squeezes.>\n\nAnyhooooo... I'm collecting badges to go along with my ogre ear collection. Orc is the flavor of the day. Fifty. GO!\n\n<Oralius blows into a horn.>\n\nSHIP IT!",o="奥拉留斯想要50枚黑石徽章。在燃烧平原的兽人身上应该可以找到那些徽章。",oEN="Collect 50 Blackrock Medallions.",p="<奥拉留斯对着一只又大又脏的巨魔耳朵喃喃自语。>\n\n我们要掌控燃烧平原，掌控它……",pEN="<Oralius is talking into a rather large, severed ogre ear.>\n\nBurning Steppes to control, come in control.",c="你做到了！你所得到的奖励是:摸摸我的肚子！来啊！快摸摸它！",cEN="You've done it! Your reward is: RUB MY BELLY! GO ON! RUB IT!"}
Q[4284]={d="我确定你一定已经注意过它们了，$n。它们到处都是！\n\n我在说什么？这都不知道，我当然在说水晶！\n\n那些水晶……它们遍布在整个环形山里。大多数人都会忽视它们，但我感觉到那些水晶里一定蕴含着特殊的力量。我一直以来都在用它们进行实验，但似乎总是没有什么成果。好吧，我承认至今为止我一无所获。\n\n这么说吧，我这里的水晶已经不多了——我想你也许能够帮我收集一些水晶回来？",dEN="I'm sure you've noticed 'em, <name>. They're everywhere!\n\nWhat am I talking about? Why, the crystals, of course!\n\nThe crystals... They're all over the crater. Most people ignore them, but I have a strange feeling that they hold power within them. I've been doing experiments here with them for a while, but I can't seem to find anything. Well, I haven't yet, anyway.\n\nSay, I'm running a little low on the crystals I have here -- think you might be able to collect some more for me?",o="收集红色能量水晶、蓝色能量水晶、黄色能量水晶和绿色能量水晶各7块，把它们交给马绍尔营地里的科琳。",oEN="Collect 7 Power Crystals of each color: red, blue, yellow, and green. Bring them to J.D. Collie at Marshal's Refuge.",p="$n，我在等着你拿水晶回来呢！",pEN="I just know I'm onto something here, <name>!",c="现在我可以继续我的实验了！谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Now I will continue my experiments! Thank you, <name>."}
Q[4285]={d="那些到底是什么东西？我脑子里现在只有这个问题！\n\n它都快要把我逼疯了——我相信那些关于水晶塔的传言都是真的。随便你怎么说，但是我一般总是会相信别人告诉我的任何东西。\n\n不管怎么样，我听说有一座水晶塔就在北部很近的地方……请去找到它，$n。我敢肯定它们确实存在。",dEN="What could they be for? I can't get the thought out of my head!\n\nIt's driving me crazy -- that the rumors I have heard about the crystal pylons are all true. Call me gullible, but I'll usually believe anything people tell me.\n\nAnyway, I have heard that there is one of the crystal pylons fairly close. Somewhere in the north... Please locate it, <name>. I just know they exist.",o="在安戈洛尔环形山找到北部水晶塔。",oEN="Discover the location of the Northern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你去过水晶塔了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you visited the pylon, <name>?",c="我就知道那些故事是真的，$n。",cEN="I know the stories are true, <name>."}
Q[4286]={d="温基船长告诉我，深渊里的黑铁矮人手里全是好东西。对吧，温基？\n\n<奥拉留斯尽力模仿着海盗的腔调。>\n\n啊啊，伙计！没错！\n\n明白我的意思了吗？你得进去一趟，给我带点那种好货的样品回来。\n\n进去吧，让钱袋子抖起来！|n",dEN="Captain Winky tells me that the Dark Irons in the Depths got all the good stuff. Ain't that right, Winky?\n\n<Oralius does his best impersonation of a pirate.>\n\nARRR MATEY! IT BE RIGHT!\n\nSee what I'm saying? You need to get in there and bring me back some samples of the good stuff.\n\nGet in there and shake your moneymaker!",o="到黑石深渊去找到20个黑铁挎包。当你完成任务之后，回到奥拉留斯那里复命。你认为黑石深渊里的黑铁矮人应该会有这些黑铁挎包。",oEN="Collect 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs.",p="我现在很忙，$n。我和温奇正在开会。",pEN="I can't be bothered right now, <name>. Me and Winky got a meeting to attend.",c="<奥拉留斯开始在一大堆黑铁挎包里翻东西。>\n\n啊，太棒了！\n\n<奥拉留斯把他的鼻子伸进这堆东西里，深吸了一口气。>\n\n神清气爽！看看这些好东西！\n\n你也拿一个吧，$n。随便拿。",cEN="<Oralius starts rummaging through the mountainous pile of fanny packs.>\n\nOH WONDERFUL!\n\n<Oralius sticks his large nose into the pile and takes a whiff.>\n\nDELICIOUS! Look at all these goodies!\n\nTake one for yourself, <name>. There's plenty to go around."}
Q[4287]={d="这段时间我听说了一些关于神秘的水晶塔的奇怪传言，据说它们就在环形山中，$n。我猜它们的体积非常巨大，而且里面蕴含有珍贵的水晶。\n\n虽然我从来没有见过它们，但我却情不自禁地愿意去相信这些传言是真的——而且那些水晶塔有可能和我们找到的水晶有某种联系。\n\n请帮帮我，满足一下我的好奇心吧。也许在环形山的东部地区有一个水晶塔，你认为你可以找到它吗？",dEN="During my stay here, I have heard strange rumors about mysterious pylons existing out in the wilderness of the crater, <name>. I guess that they are quite large, with crystals lining their interiors.\n\nAlthough I've never seen one, I can't help but think that the rumors are true -- and that the pylons have something to do with all the crystals we found\n\nSo why don't you help me put my curiosity to rest? Supposedly, there is one in the eastern area of the crater. Do you think you can find it?",o="在安戈洛尔环形山找到东部水晶塔。",oEN="Discover the location of the Eastern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你去过水晶塔了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you visited the pylon, <name>?",c="安戈洛是个奇怪的地方，$n。当你进入环形山的时候，你会发现自己好像进入了一个完全不同的世界……",cEN="Un'Goro is such a strange place, <name>. When you enter the crater, it's as if you are in a completely different world..."}
Q[4288]={d="我的实验迄今为至没有取得任何实质性的进展，$n。我真希望你能帮我去查看一下传说中的一座水晶塔。\n\n也许我们在那里组合特定颜色的水晶的话……嗯，这我会自己去做的。首先我们得找到那些水晶塔！\n\n$n，去搜索一下环形山的西部区域；据说那里有个水晶塔。",dEN="My experiments so far have not yielded any positive results, <name>. I can't help but hope that you can find a solution by searching for one of the pylons that I have heard exist.\n\nPerhaps if we combine certain colors at them... but I get ahead of myself. Let's find them first!\n\n<name>, search the western area of the crater; a pylon is said to be somewhere in that area.",o="在安戈洛尔环形山找到西部水晶塔。",oEN="Discover the location of the Western Crystal Pylon.",p="你去过水晶塔了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you visited the pylon, <name>?",c="环形山的边缘地带隐藏着很多秘密。如果你不知道该去哪里找的话，就到那些曲折的小道上查看一下，$n。",cEN="There are many hidden areas of the crater along the sides. Try exploring the winding paths if you can't think of anywhere else to look, <name>."}
Q[4289]={d="这个环形山中居住着许多奇怪的生物——它们似乎比我家乡那边的生物更加高贵。我无法解释这一点，但是这块地方在呼唤大地之母。每次我看到大地之母创造的某种美丽的生物时，我都会对她肃然起敬。\n\n如果你也希望感觉到见证这伟大功绩的幸福感，就向北方出发吧。你将在那儿遇到巨大的猩猩，这对$r的力量来说是一个挑战。把它们的皮毛交给我……证明你的力量。",dEN="This crater has many strange creatures--they seem to be nobler versions of the creatures found throughout my homeland and beyond. I cannot explain it, but this place cries of the Earth Mother. I pay homage to her every time I track one of her beautiful creatures across its basin.\n\nIf you too wish to feel the enlightenment that accompanies such a great feat, then head to the north. There you'll find great apes who are a test for any mortal's strength. Bring me their pelts... prove your strength.",o="将2块安戈洛猩猩的皮、2块安戈洛大猩猩的皮和2块安戈洛巨猩猩的皮交给安戈洛环形山入口处的托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Bring 2 Un'Goro Gorilla Pelts, 2 Un'Goro Stomper Pelts, and 2 Un'Goro Thunderer Pelts to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",p="你已经被这里的生物打败了吗，$n？\n\n别这么$g轻易:轻易;就放弃。追踪并击败安戈洛的猩猩可不是件轻松的事，哪怕对一位伟大的$c来说也是如此。",pEN="Have the creatures here bested you already, <name>?\n\nDo not be dissuaded so easily. Tracking and defeating the apes of Un'Goro is no simple task, even for a great hunter.",c="你证明了自己的力量足以对抗安戈洛的猩猩——这真是好极了。跟拉克维相比，这次挑战算是微不足道，但是我不会否定你所取得的胜利。\n\n这些皮毛可以为我的部族提供优质的衣料。你帮助了我，并证明了自己。\n\n在你接受下一个任务之前，让我们感谢大地之母以及那些死去的猩猩的灵魂吧——它们的死没有白费。",cEN="So, you have proven strong, strong enough to best the great apes of Un'Goro--that is good. The challenge was small compared to Lar'korwi, but I will not take such a great victory away from you.\n\nThese pelts will make wonderful clothing for my tribe. You have helped me and proven worthy.\n\nBefore you set off on another task, let us give praise to the Earth Mother and thank the spirits of those apes you killed--they must know their deaths will not be wasted."}
Q[4290]={d="很久以前，我的一个兄弟从拉克维的猎物身上拿了一些肉。他那时并不知道拉克维就潜伏在丛林中看着他。拉克维跟踪了我的兄弟好几天，毁灭了他碰过的一切。我的兄弟吓坏了，最终他决定从安戈洛逃走，彻底甩开拉克维。\n\n拉克维就在这附近杀死了他。\n\n如果你想激怒拉克维，就去寻找它刚刚杀死的猎物，并从尸体上取一些肉。\n\n做完这些之后，就回到我这儿来。",dEN="Once, a long time ago, a brother of mine took some meat from one of Lar'korwi's kills. He didn't know it at the time, but Lar'korwi saw him from the forest. Lar'korwi followed my brother for days, destroying everything he touched. My brother, scared, finally decided to run from the Crater and leave Lar'korwi behind.\n\nLar'korwi killed him not far from this spot.\n\nIf you want to provoke Lar'korwi, find a fresh kill of his and take some of the meat from it.\n\nReturn to me afterwards.",o="找到拉克维刚刚猎杀的动物的尸体，从尸体上偷取一块蛇颈龙肉块，然后回到安戈洛环形山的托尔瓦·寻路者那里。",oEN="Find the carcass of Lar'korwi's freshest kill and steal a Piece of Threshadon Carcass before returning to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",p="不要对我说的话心不在焉，$n。如果你真想面对这头野兽，那你就必须非常小心……而且非常聪明。要想引出拉克维并打败它，你必须拥有超群的力量和观察力。",pEN="Do not take my words lightly, <name>. If you truly wish to face this creature, then you must be careful... and smart. It will take a great deal of strength and insight to draw out Lar'korwi and defeat him.",c="这肉正合适，$n。看来拉尔科维这些天吃得不错，是吧？我在纳闷它是在哪儿找到一头蓟皮龙的……真奇怪。\n\n不管怎样，我会保管好这些，直到你$g准备好:准备好;与它正面交锋。别担心我的安危——我敢说你已经把拉尔科维激怒到，在尝过你的血肉之前它是不会杀我的。",cEN="This will do nicely, <name>. It seems Lar'korwi eats well these days. Although, I wonder where he found a threshadon in this area. Odd.\n\nRegardless, I will hold onto this until you are ready for your confrontation with the beast. Do not worry for my safety--I am sure you've angered Lar'korwi enough that he will not kill me until after he's tasted your flesh."}
Q[4291]={d="老实说，我挺意外它还没来找你，$n。不过没关系，我还有最后一个计划能把那怪物引出来。\n\n作为占据统治地位的雄性，拉尔科维有权与任何它选中的雌性交配——而它选中的可不少。你在这西边能找到许多掠龙蛋。靠近它们，就会引来雌性的攻击。雌性头部有一颗腺体，会散发出恶臭，向雄性表明它们已经准备好繁殖。给我带两颗那样的腺体回来。",dEN="I'm actually surprised he has not come for you yet, <name>. But all is well, for I have a final plan that will bring the monster to us.\n\nBeing the dominant male gives Lar'korwi rights to breed with any female he chooses--and he chooses many of them. You'll find many ravasaur eggs to the west of here. Get close to them and you should provoke an attack by his mates. The females produce an awful smell from a gland in their heads that allow males to know they are ready to breed. Bring me two of those glands.",o="将2份暴掠龙信息素交给安戈洛尔环形山入口附近的托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Bring 2 Ravasaur Pheromone Glands to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",p="小心，$n。靠近任何恐龙蛋的行动都必定会引来它们的母亲……即使你做好了准备也要万分小心。那些雌性暴掠龙和拉克维一样致命，它们会拼死保护自己的蛋。但是，如果你成功了，我们就一定有办法把拉克维从它的藏身之处引出来。",pEN="Be careful, <name>. Getting close to any of nest of eggs surely will provoke the mothers... even if you've already secured a gland from one. The mothers can be just as deadly as Lar'korwi himself when they fight to protect their young. But, if you are successful, then we shall have a definitive way of bringing Lar'korwi out from hiding.",c="啊，很不错，$n。你找到的这两个腺体中的资讯素可以轻松地把拉克维引出来。你很快就要与它正面较量了，拉克维拥有像刀刃一样锋利的爪子，当你看到它的眼睛时，你就会知道什么是死亡。",cEN="Ah, fine specimens, <name>. The two pieces you've found should be perfect for baiting Lar'korwi into the open. I cannot wait to see the outcome of your fight with the monster. He is a massive thing with claws as sharp as the finest blades. You will look into his eyes and you will know death."}
Q[4292]={d="计划有些复杂，因此这是最困难的部分。沿着山脚向北面走，你可以发现一条很不起眼的小道直通山中。那是我最后一次看到拉克维的地方。那里应该散落着大型野兽的残骸，所以你很容易判断自己的位置是否正确。带上这块肉，把它放在那儿。然后在肉上涂抹我配制的这种液体。如果这还不能使拉克维现身的话，我想也没什么东西能把它引诱出来了。",dEN="This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains. It was here I saw Lar'korwi last. You will know you are in the right area because of all the bones from massive creatures that once wandered nearby. Take the meat you recovered and place it there. Then, rub this mixture I created on the meat. If both lures mingled together do not bring Lar'korwi to you, then I know nothing else that will.",o="使用托尔瓦的麻袋中的东西召唤拉克维并打败它。将拉克维的头颅交给安戈洛环形山入口处的托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",p="不要让恐惧战胜你，$n。恐惧是最大的叛徒……你必须保持意志！\n\n带上这块肉，把它放在小山谷中，然后给肉上涂满资讯素。那时你就要面对死亡的挑战了。",pEN="Do not let fear overpower you, <name>. Fear is the great betrayer... you must remain strong!\n\nTake the meat, place it in the small valley, and then use the gland on it. Only then will death come for you.",c="赞美大地之母！你做到了！你$g真了不起:真了不起;。你已经证明自己本身就是一位伟大的猎人。你的意志坚强，你的勇气无可匹敌，你的力量也得到了增强。我向你的技艺致敬。\n\n只有我最伟大的先祖才能完成如此不可思议的壮举。恭喜你。$g真的:真的;",cEN="The Earth Mother be praised! You've done it! Fair play to you, <name>. You have proven to be a great hunter in your own right. Your spirit is strong. Your bravery unmatched. And your strength has been fortified. I bow down to your skills.\n\nOnly the greatest of my ancestors could have accomplished something so incredible. Congratulations."}
Q[4293]={d="费伍德是在贫瘠之地北边很远的地方的一片森林，比灰谷还要远。在那里的被恶魔污染的池水中到处都可以看到软泥怪，天灾军团的地狱火和其它恶魔法术曾经在这个地区肆虐过——软泥怪应该是在这段时间里从地底下冒出来的。\n\n从费伍德森林的软泥怪身上收集一些样本，然后我们就可以用我的测试仪器拿它们和其他样本作一下比较了。",dEN="Felwood is a forest far north of the Barrens, even farther than Ashenvale. There, slimes are found all around pools of water blessed by the touch of Fel. The Scourge decimated the area with attacks of Infernals and other demonic magics--the slimes supposedly crept up through the earth during these attacks.\n\nGather samples of Felwood slimes and we will use the testing equipment next to me to create a control group for our tests against other samples you gather.",o="从费伍德的软泥怪身上收集费伍德软泥怪样本，然后使用幽暗城的化学家弗雷身旁的测试设备来检测你所收集的样本中哪一份被腐化的程度最深。给化学家弗雷带去5个被腐化的费伍德样本。",oEN="Gather Felwood Slime Samples from any of the slimes in Felwood. Then, using the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely in Undercity, see which of your samples are the most corrupt. Bring 5 of the Corrupted Felwood Samples you find to Chemist Fuely.",p="我需要至少5份腐化的样本来进行试验，$n。继续去收集样品，希尔瓦娜斯女王已经下令要得到它了……",pEN="I will need at least five corrupted samples for our control group, <name>. Continue to gather Felwood slime samples until you're able to give me that which we'll need. The Lady Sylvanas decrees it...",c="啊，太好了，这些样本很合适。感谢你对我的帮助。\n\n当我收集到所有的泥浆怪样品之后，我们就可以搞清楚更多的东西。我觉得希尔瓦娜斯殿下的决定不仅正确，而且相当具有前瞻性。这些样品很有趣，看看它和我的这些材料之间发生的反应……嗯，没错，我们显然需要进行进一步的调查。",cEN="Ah, excellent. These samples will do nicely. I thank you for your help.\n\nOnce we've gathered all the samples of slimes, we'll be able to determine more. I am beginning to suspect that Lady Sylvanas' hunch was not only correct, but more insightful than even she could have predicted. These samples are very interesting. Just seeing how they've reacted with my compounds... hmm, yes, we'll definitely need to investigate further."}
Q[4294]={d="$n，你听说过安戈洛环形山吗？它就在塔纳利斯沙漠附近，那里是个神奇的地方，到处都是郁郁葱葱的大树，还有大量的野生动物。 \n\n你必须到那里去一趟，我听说那块地方至今未至从未受到过外界的污染，探险者们正在逐渐揭开它的秘密。\n\n我想要对那里的软泥怪或者泥浆怪做一下测试，如果它们真的没有受到污染的话，那我真的想要看看这些生物是怎么进化的。",dEN="Have you heard of the Un'Goro Crater, <name>? It is near the Tanaris desert, and it is a magnificent place: lush, vibrant, full of creatures and plant life.\n\nIt is there you must go. Word has reached me that the place seems completely untainted by outside hands. Explorers are just now discovering its secrets.\n\nI would like to test the slimes or oozes there. If it is true--that they are uncorrupt--then I would like to see how such creatures have evolved.",o="从安戈洛尔环形山那里任何泥浆怪身上收集安戈洛泥浆怪样本。使用幽暗城的化学家弗雷身旁的测试仪器来检验你所采集到的样本的纯度。把5份纯净的安戈洛样本送到化学家弗雷那里去。",oEN="Gather Un'Goro Slime Samples from any of the slimes in Un'Goro Crater. Then, using the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely in Undercity, see which of your samples are the most pure. Bring 5 of the Pure Un'Goro Samples you find to Chemist Fuely.",p="怎么样，$n？你的研究进展如何了？",pEN="Yes, <name>? How goes your search?",c="太不可思议了，$n。安戈洛环形山中蕴藏的秘密比我预想得要多得多。我真想知道随着实验的不断进行，我们还会发现什么新的东西。\n\n太不可思议了……看看这些样品的纯度，嗯……我真想知道这意味着什么。它们看起来好像自然的元素，但是……还有别的东西。它们让我想起……上古诸神。我们在整个艾泽拉斯大陆上都能找到他们的踪迹，现在我想要知道这些生物是否和他们有关联。\n\n我们还要做进一步的研究才行。",cEN="Truly amazing, <name>. This Un'Goro Crater is holding many more secrets than I expected. I wonder what else we will discover as we test further.\n\nSimply amazing... look at the purity of these samples. Hmm, I wonder what it could mean. They seem to be elemental in nature, but... something more. They remind me of... of the Old Gods. We've found traces of them throughout Azeroth, and now I wonder if these creatures aren't related to them somehow.\n\nWe shall have to test further."}
Q[4295]={p="哦，麦酒！为了黑铁麦酒我什么都肯干！！快，我快清醒过来了！我之所以知道，是因为清醒会让我的视线变模糊……而这一模糊，你看起来就$g像:像;我上周杀的那个$r了！",pEN="Oh, ale! I would kill for some Dark Iron ale!! Quick, I'm getting sober! I know this because sobriety blurs my vision... and it's making you look like the <race> I slew last week!",c="这是什么？啊！闻起来像黑铁麦酒！酒让我视线模糊，但我可以告诉你一件事，$g先生:女士;，你才是$g真正的朋友:真正的朋友;！",cEN="What's this? Ah! It smells like Dark Iron Ale! Drink has blurred my sight, but I can tell that you, <sir/my lady>, are a real friend!\nRelated"}
Q[4296]={d="我追随着七贤的传说来到燃烧平原。他们是拥有渊博知识和强大力量的矮人，而只要你同时拥有这两样，财富自然随之而来。\n\n那就是我想要的。财富！\n\n如果我们能弄清更多关于七贤的事，也许就能一起发财。有传言说，索瑞森废墟里藏着七贤石板，上面记载着古代矮人的知识。找到这块石板，抄下上面的文字带给我。让我们一起解开它的秘密！",dEN="I came to the Burning Steppes, following the legends of the Seven. They were dwarves of great knowledge and power, and if you have knowledge and power, then wealth is sure to follow.\n\nThat's what I want. Wealth!\n\nIf we can learn more of the Seven, then maybe we can get rich together. The ruins of Thaurissan is rumored to keep the Tablet of the Seven, which holds knowledge of the ancient dwarves. Find this tablet, copy its text and bring it to me. Let's discover its secrets together!",o="把石板拓文交给燃烧平原的麦克斯沃特·尤博格林。",oEN="Collect the Tablet Transcript.",p="你找到七贤石板了吗，$n？你找到石板中隐藏的秘密了吗？",pEN="Do you have the writings of the Seven, <name>? Have you learned the secrets from their tablet?",c="啊，你找到石板了！而且你的抄录好极了！你$g确定:确定;自己是个$c，而不是个抄写员吗？\n\n给你，$n，$g真的:真的;。这是我答应给你的报酬。",cEN="Ah, you found the tablet! And your transcription is superb! Are you sure you're a <class> and not a scribe?\n\nHere you are, <name>. Here is the payment I promised."}
Q[4297]={d="小精龙是杂食动物——它们既吃肉也吃植物。要是这颗蛋即将孵化的话，我们最好有所准备。信不信由你，这些小家伙最喜欢吃生的新鲜腰肉。我始终不明白为什么，但是这也许和艾露恩的旨意有关……或许它们将成为守护者或是别的什么，谁知道呢。\n\n我会照顾好这颗蛋，而你要负责找到一些银鬃捕猎者的肉，以便在小精龙孵化后喂食。",dEN="Sprite darters are omnivores--that means they eat both meat and vegetation. If your egg here's gonna hatch, we best be prepared. Some good eats for these little guys are flanks of meat, raw and juicy, believe it or not. I was never able to find out why, but it has somethin' to do with Elune's plan for the elves... maybe they were to be protectors or somethin', I don't know.\n\nI'll take care of the egg for now, why don't you get me some good Silvermane stalker flanks for 'em to eat when he's hatched.",o="将5块银鬃捕猎者的肉交给辛特兰的阿格纳。",oEN="Bring 5 Silvermane Stalker Flanks to Agnar Beastamer in Hinterlands.",p="找到肉了吗，$n？这颗蛋就快孵化了。要是第一餐不喂饱，没准它连一周都活不了，我可不愿意发生这样的事。\n\n我没骗你，$n。我很是羡慕你能得到这颗蛋呢。别让我后悔这样帮助你。",pEN="Find that meat yet, <name>? Your little egg here's just about ready to hatch. If he don't have a good enough first meal, then he might not make it past his first week, and I'd hate for that to happen.\n\nCan't much lie to ya, <name>. I'm jealous of you gettin' this egg to begin with. Don't make me regret helpin' ya out like this.",c="这些正合适，如果我没弄错的话，你那颗小蛋快要孵化了。感觉怎么样？你知道吗，你快当$g爸爸:妈妈;了？哈哈，没想到还得担起这种责任吧，嗯？",cEN="These'll do nicely, and if I'm not mistaken, your little egg's just about ready to hatch. How does it feel? You know, you about to be a father? Haha, didn't think ya'd have to deal with such responsibility, now did ya?"}
Q[4298]={d="哇，他们比我想象中的要成熟得多……",dEN="Whoa, it was a lot more ready than I thought...",o="与辛特兰的阿格纳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Agnar Beastamer in the Hinterlands.",c="来，把蛋拿去……还是你拿着好，这样它就会认你，把你当成它的$g爸爸:妈妈;。\n\n恭喜你，$n。你当$g爸爸:妈妈;了……勉强算吧。",cEN="Here, take the egg... better you have it so it bonds to you and looks to you to be its dadda.\n\nCongrats, <name>. You're a parent... kinda."}
Q[4300]={d="嗯，既然你这么一说，也许你确实能为兄弟会做点什么。没错，杰斯里蒙肯定用得上你的帮忙。\n\n安戈洛环形山里有长着致命利爪的迅猛龙。有些迅猛龙的爪子是白色的，而不是死亡般的黑色。兄弟会有一些……\"客户\"……喜欢用这种爪子打造的武器。给我带很多白爪子来，我会付你不少钱。动作够快的话，也许我还能在别的方面帮帮你。",dEN="Hmm, maybe there be somethin' you can do for the Hand now that me think 'bout it. Yes, Jes'rimon could use your help for sure.\n\nIn Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death. The Hand have... clients... that like weapons crafted from these claws. Bring me many of those white claws, and me pay you good coin. Do it fast enough, and maybe me help you in other ways.",o="将8只白色暴掠龙爪交给奥格瑞玛的杰斯雷蒙。",oEN="Bring 8 White Ravasaur Claws to Jes'rimon in Orgrimmar.",p="我的顾客可没那么多的耐心，$n。你拿到爪子了吗？",pEN="Me clients are not so patient, <name>. Have you gotten any of the claws yet?",c="啊，很好。谢谢你，$n。你带来的爪子超过了他们所需的数量……很好。\n\n或许我们能为你制作这样一件武器。你觉得如何呢？",cEN="Ah, these do nicely. Thank you, <name>. An' you be here long before they needed... that be good.\n\nMaybe we have a weapon fashioned for you from the claws. What do you say?"}
Q[4301]={d="在你探索安戈洛期间，我看到了另一些像你这样强大的猎人一定会感兴趣的东西，$g真的:真的;。其中一样是北方那些大猩猩当中最大的一只。你去过那个洞穴，但这次，如果你接下我的任务，我怀疑你能否活着回来。\n\n我叫它乌查，它是大地之母最杰出的儿子之一，这一点你可以$g确信:确信;。击败乌查，把它的毛皮带给我。做到了，我就承认你有资格自称伟大的猎人。$g真的:真的;$g真的:真的;",dEN="While you have been exploring Un'Goro, I have seen other things that a mighty hunter such as yourself would relish in. One such sight was a huge ape among the other gorillas to the north. You have been to that cave before, but this time, I wonder if you'll survive the encounter if you accept my task.\n\nI call him U'cha, and he is one of the Earth Mother's greatest sons, of that you can be sure. Defeat U'cha and bring me his pelt. Do this, and I will defend your right to call yourself a great hunter.",o="把尤尔查的毛皮交给安戈洛环形山入口处的托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",p="尤尔查……这头野兽非常健壮。巨大的身躯，赤红的外皮，像匕首一样巨大的牙齿。它的胳膊像树干一样粗，动作比我见过的任何猎豹都要快。你能找到这样一个测试你勇气的机会，应该觉得很幸运——我的同胞可能一辈子都看不到这样的生物。",pEN="U'cha... the beast was magnificent. Huge and red, with teeth the size of daggers. His arms as thick as tree trunks, and as fast as any mountain lion I have ever laid eyes upon. You should consider yourself lucky to find such a test of bravery--my people would go generations without seeing such a creature.",c="干得好，$n。我很高兴。你今天做了一件伟大的事。\n\n尤尔查是我所见过的最强大的猩猩之一。你战胜它的这一事实本身就证明了你的力量和勇气。\n\n请接受这件礼物以表示我对你的敬意。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I am pleased. You have done a great thing here today.\n\nU'cha was one of the greatest apes I had ever seen. The fact that you have bested his strength speaks well of your own strength... and courage.\n\nIt is only fitting that I give you this as a sign of respect. You have earned it."}
Q[4321]={d="你带给我的有关这些水晶塔的信息很有趣……\n\n给我点时间，我要计算一下，$n。过会再和我说话，我应该可以给你一些答复。",dEN="The information you have given me about the pylons is very interesting...\n\nGive me a moment to do some calculations, <name>. Speak to me again in a moment and I should be able to give you the answer we have been looking for.",o="过一会再和科琳说话。",oEN="Speak with J.D. Collie in a moment.",c="好吧，$n。这太令人着迷了……我希望我的这些图表是正确的！\n\n我相信自己已经可以回答你所有的关于水晶的问题了，$n。",cEN="Alright, <name>. This is fascinating... I can only hope that my diagrams are correct! I compiled everything into this manual, which you can have.\n\nI believe I can answer any questions you have about the crystals now, <name>."}
Q[4322]={d="我们得离开这里，$n。帮我从补给区取回我的装备，并救出我的朋友们。如果我们能逃出去，你就前往摩根的岗哨，与麦克斯韦尔元帅谈谈。他会给你进一步的指示。",dEN="We need to get out of here, <name>. Help me get my gear back from the supply area and free my friends. If we make it out of here, you are to proceed to Morgan's Vigil and speak with Marshal Maxwell. He will give you further instruction.",o="帮助温德索尔元帅拿回他的装备并救出他的朋友。当你成功之后就回去向麦克斯韦尔元帅复命。",oEN="Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed.",p="你看起来$g累坏了:累坏了;，$n。也许你该在火边坐下来歇一歇。",pEN="You look exhausted, <name>. Perhaps you should have a seat by the fire and relax.",c="不可思议，$n。简直不可思议。温莎不到五分钟前才像一阵风似的从这里经过。他带来了一些惊人的说法，但声称有证据支持。他现在正前往暴风城，要与博瓦尔以及……普瑞斯托女士对质。",cEN="Amazing, <name>. Simply amazing. Windsor stormed through here not five minutes ago. He makes some grand claims but purports that they are supported by his evidence. He is on his way to Stormwind now to confront Bolvar and ... Lady Prestor."}
Q[4324]={d="尽管我的弟弟雷布里一生都无所作为，但是我认为，最终他的生命还是有些价值的！然而……我们可能需要你的帮助来让雷布里发挥他最后的价值。\n\n我姐姐尤卡这段日子以来都在寻找他，而且跟踪他到了燃烧平原。她曾带话给我，要我雇些人给她帮忙。\n\n那么，你有兴趣吗？如果你想要试试的话，就去跟我姐姐说吧。她就住在巨槌石西北的称作烈焰洞里。",dEN="Although my little brother Ribbly has been worthless his whole life, I think, finally, he has some value! But... we might need your help to capitalize on Ribbly's newfound worth.\n\nMy sister Yuka has been looking for him for weeks, and tracked him to the Burning Steppes. She sent word to me, asking for some hired hands.\n\nSo, what do you say? Want to help? If so, then speak with my sister. You'll find her holed up in Flame Crest, a cave northwest of Dreadmaul Rock.",o="与燃烧平原的尤卡·斯库比格特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",c="对，我正在寻找我的弟弟。我们必须找到他，愿神保佑他。\n\n但是如果我们无法将他活着带走……至少也要带走他的首级。",cEN="Yes, I'm looking for my brother. We must find him and retrieve him, bless his heart.\n\nBut if we can't bring all of him... then his head will suffice."}
Q[4341]={d="你去过索瑞森那冒着烟的废墟？你有没有碰见一个叫卡兰·巨锤的可怜笨蛋？那个本该照看我宝贝女儿的矮人！\n\n<国王抽泣起来。>\n\n现在她不见了，$n！\n\n我的人已经把整个平原翻了个底朝天。关于我女儿下落的唯一线索就是她可能在深渊里面。就我所知，她可能已经死了！\n\n据说卡兰被关在那里……去找他！我要答案！",dEN="You have been to the smoldering ruins of Thaurissan? Did you happen to run into a pitiful lout named Kharan Mighthammer? The dwarf that was supposedly watching over my baby girl!\n\n<The King sobs.>\n\nAnd now she's gone, <name>!\n\nI have had my men turn the Steppes upside down. The only clue they have as to the whereabouts of my daughter is that she may be inside the Depths. For all I know, she could be dead!\n\nKharan is supposedly being held prisoner there... find him! I want answers!",o="去黑石深渊找到卡兰·巨锤。\n\n国王提到卡兰在那里负责看守囚犯——也许你应该在监狱附近寻找他。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Depths and find Kharan Mighthammer.\n\nThe King mentioned that Kharan was being held prisoner there - perhaps you should try looking for a prison.",c="求求你，请听我解释。",cEN="Please, let me explain."}
Q[4342]={d="求求你，在你评判我之前，先听我把话说完！|n",dEN="Please, hear me out before passing judgement!",o="听卡兰·巨锤说他的故事。",oEN="Listen as Kharan Mighthammer tells his story.",p="请允许我说完我的故事。",pEN="Allow me to finish telling my story.",c="就如你所见的那样，我什么都没有做。",cEN="As you can see, there was nothing I could have done."}
Q[4343]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4361]={d="你必须把这个消息带回去给麦格尼国王，$n。他会知道该怎么办的！|n",dEN="You must take this information back to King Magni, <name>. He will know what to do!",o="回到铁炉堡，把这个坏消息带给国王麦格尼·铜须。",oEN="Return to Ironforge and deliver the bad news to King Magni Bronzebeard.",c="<麦格尼愤怒地用他的拳头砸向王座的扶手。>",cEN="<King Magni slams his fist down in anger.>"}
Q[4362]={d="看起来我的老对手——达格兰·索瑞森——已经把我和铁炉堡都置于他的控制之下了。\n\n你可能是我的最后希望了，$n。你必须拯救我亲爱的女儿，茉艾拉！\n\n只有一种方法可以破除索瑞森施放在茉艾拉身上的咒语，那就是杀死他。\n\n还有，$n，不要伤害茉艾拉！记住，她正在被索瑞森控制着！她所做所说的一切都只是索瑞森邪恶咒语的结果！",dEN="It would seem as if my old adversary, Dagran Thaurissan, has me and the kingdom of Ironforge at his mercy.\n\nYou may be my last hope, <name>. You must rescue my dear daughter, Moira!\n\nThere is only one way to make sure that the spell Thaurissan has cast on Moira is broken: Kill him.\n\nAnd <name>, do not harm her! Remember, she is being controlled by Thaurissan! The things she may do or say are a result of Thaurissan's evil spell!",o="回到黑石深渊，把茉艾拉·铜须公主从达格兰·索瑞森大帝的魔爪中解救出来。|n",oEN="Return to Blackrock Depths and rescue Princess Moira Bronzebeard from the evil clutches of Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.",c="铜须公主为达格兰·索瑞森大帝的死而放声痛哭。>\n\n为什么？",cEN="<Princess Bronzebeard weeps over the loss of Emperor Dagran Thaurissan.>\n\nWhy???"}
Q[4363]={d="索瑞森是个伟大的、值得尊重的矮人。你毁了我的一生，还有我肚子里的孩子的一生！\n\n<你认为茉艾拉公主也许是受到了索瑞森的法术影响才变成这样的。>\n\n回铁炉堡去告诉我父亲，铁炉堡的下一任统治者将会是个黑铁矮人。\n\n不管他同不同意，事情都会是这样。",dEN="Thaurissan was a great and honorable dwarf. You ruined my life and the life of my unborn child!\n\n<You think that Princess Bronzebeard may still be suffering from the residual effect of the Emperor's spell.>\n\nReturn to Ironforge and tell my father that the heir to the Kingdom of Ironforge will be a Dark Iron dwarf.\n\nWhether he approves or not, it shall be.",o="回到铁炉堡去，与国王麦格尼·铜须谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Ironforge and speak with King Magni Bronzebeard.",c="<国王麦格尼·铜须显然非常失望。>\n\n看来即使索瑞森死了，他也获得了胜利。\n\n你可以走了，$n。在你离开之前，别忘了从皇家宝库里选择你应得的奖励。\n\n<麦格尼·铜须瘫倒在王座上，陷入了沉思。>",cEN="<King Magni Bronzebeard is visibly upset.>\n\nIt seems that even in death, Thaurissan has won.\n\nYou are dismissed, <name>. Before you leave, you may choose your reward from the royal vault.\n\n<King Bronzebeard slumps into his throne to mull over this bizarre change of events.>"}
Q[4381]={p="你可以把绿色能量水晶和黄色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以治疗你和你的同伴。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with yellow power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to heal yourself or your allies.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4382]={p="你可以把绿色能量水晶和蓝色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以提高你的精神属性。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with blue power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to increase your spirit.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4383]={p="你可以把绿色能量水晶和红色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以提高你抵抗物理攻击的能力。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with red power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to strengthen the protection you have against physical damage.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4384]={p="你可以把红色能量水晶和蓝色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以削弱敌人的防御能力。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine red power crystals with blue power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to weaken an enemy's defenses.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4385]={p="你可以把红色能量水晶和黄色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以猛烈地爆炸，对你的敌人造成伤害。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine red power crystals with yellow power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to create a large explosion that can inflict damage on your enemies.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4386]={p="你可以把蓝色能量水晶和黄色能量水晶组合在一起。\n\n根据科琳给你的说明书上的记载，这种组合所制造的水晶可以产生一道能对敌人造成伤害的屏障。",pEN="The Pylon table allows you to combine blue power crystals with yellow power crystals.\n\nAccording to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to create a shield that does damage to enemies.",c="你仔细地排列着水晶阵列，调整着不同颜色水晶的位置。当你把最后一块水晶放上去之后，一阵强光将这些水晶熔为一体。\n\n你得到了一块新的水晶。",cEN="Arranging the crystals on the table, you carefully align the colors. As you push the last one into place, a burst of light fuses the crystals together.\n\nThe resulting combination is now yours."}
Q[4401]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4402]={d="试炼谷这地方真是热得厉害。\n\n<加尔加擦了擦额头。>\n\n要是我有几颗仙人掌果，就能做我那道著名的仙人掌果惊喜了！没有什么比吃上一口那美味更能让人凉快下来的了。\n\n这样吧，$n。你给我带六颗仙人掌果来，我就给你做几份仙人掌果惊喜，让你带着去冒险。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，在附近生长的仙人掌旁边就能找到仙人掌果。",dEN="It sure gets hot out here in the Valley of Trials.\n\n<Galgar wipes his brow.>\n\nIf only I had some cactus apples, I could make my famous cactus apple surprise! Nothing cools you off faster than a piece of that delicious treat.\n\nI'll tell you what, <name>. If you bring me 6 cactus apples, I'll make you a few portions of cactus apple surprise to take with you on your adventures. If you're interested, you can find cactus apples growing near the cactus plants around here.",o="收集6个仙人掌果，把它们交给戈加尔。你记得他说可以在仙人掌上收集到这种果子。",oEN="Bring Galgar 6 Cactus Apples. You remember him saying that they could be found near cactuses.",p="你收集到我要的仙人掌果了吗？",pEN="Have you finished collecting cactus apples?",c="太好了，$n！这是给你的清凉果，还有一些其它的东西。",cEN="Wonderful, <name>! As promised, here is your cactus apple surprise plus a little something extra."}
Q[4403]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4421]={d="在这里寻求冒险的人并不多……费伍德森林的腐化\"遍布各处，不分对象\"。\n\n作为翡翠议会的成员，我努力治愈这片土地，但有些人却希望它彻底腐坏下去。\n\n我说的那些家伙是居住在西北方康斯坦茨废墟的碧火萨特。他们由一个格外残忍的萨特——萨瓦瑟拉斯——率领，还在不断把这种疾病传播给遇到的每一种生物。\n\n我们必须保卫这片曾经属于我们的土地。击败萨瓦瑟拉斯，消灭他的爪牙。",dEN="Not many seek adventure here... Felwood's corruption is widespread and indiscriminate.\n\nAs part of the Emerald Circle, I seek to heal this land, but there are some that wish it to fester.\n\nThe ones I speak of are the Jadefire satyrs that dwell to the northwest of here, at the Ruins of Constellas. Led by a particularly cruel satyr named Xavathras, they continue to spread the disease to any creatures they encounter.\n\nWe must defend this land that was once ours. Defeat Xavathras and destroy his minions.",o="杀掉11个碧火魔仆、9个碧火巡影者、9个碧火潜行者和萨瓦瑟拉斯。任务完成之后回到费伍德森林的艾瑞丹·蓝风处复命。",oEN="Kill 11 Jadefire Felsworns, 9 Jadefire Shadowstalkers, 9 Jadefire Rogues, and Xavathras. Return to Eridan Bluewind in Felwood when the task has been completed.",p="这里的堕落气息已经让森林中的生灵都发疯了……",pEN="The corruption here drives the creatures into madness...",c="除掉萨瓦瑟拉斯只是一个长期的斗争过程的第一步。修复这里遭受的破坏将会耗费大量的时间和精力。\n\n我感觉到这里有某种东西比目前的萨特更加强大，但我们只有等时间来揭示真相……",cEN="Ridding Felwood of Xavathras is only the first step in a long process. It will take much work to repair the damage that has been done here.\n\nI sense that there is something much larger than just the satyrs at work here, but we will only know the truth with time..."}
Q[4441]={d="你所发现的长笛是由某个守护古树——忠心守护着暗夜精灵的树人——雕刻而成的。\n\n萨特能使他们接触到的任何东西受到腐蚀，其中也包括那些在费伍德森林安家的古树。他们的灵魂在恶魔能量的作用下受到束缚和折磨，永远无法解脱。你找到的碧火魔符就是禁锢古树的东西。\n\n我们必须净化长笛，$n。为我从达纳苏斯的月神殿取回一瓶祝福之水吧。",dEN="The flute you found was carved from an ancient protector, the treant allies that have faithfully protected the night elves.\n\nThe satyrs have been able to corrupt anything they come in contact with, which includes the ancients that made Felwood their home. By the use of the fel, the spirit of the ancient has been bound and tortured, never completely released. The felbind you found is no doubt related.\n\nWe must try to purify the flute, <name>. Bring me blessed water from the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus.",o="到达纳苏斯去，用艾瑞丹的瓶子收集月神殿中的祝福之水，然后回到艾瑞丹那儿。",oEN="Travel to Darnassus and use Eridan's Vial to collect a Vial of Blessed Water from the Temple of the Moon. Return to Eridan with the filled vial.",p="这水可以释放古树的灵魂，并使其安息。",pEN="The water will hopefully release the spirit of the ancient, and allow it to be at peace.",c="谢谢你，$n。现在，让我们祈祷能抚平那些已经造成的创伤吧。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Now, we must pray that we can undo the damage that has been done..."}
Q[4442]={d="我要用月神之水来净化这根笛子。我们必须结束这场劫难……\n\n愿艾露恩指引我的双手和我的心。\n\n过一会再和我说话。",dEN="Using the water of Elune, I will attempt to purify the flute. We must end this suffering...\n\nMay Elune guide my hands and heart.\n\nSpeak with me again in a moment.",o="过一会儿再与艾瑞丹对话。",oEN="Speak to Eridan again in a moment.",c="有了这些被祝福的水，我就能切断长笛和古树之魂的联系——只要你在一个神圣的地方使用这支长笛。\n\n也许你可以在铁木林地南边的遗迹里试试看。那个地区曾经有许多堕落的树人群聚，也许它们仍然以灵魂的形式在那里出现……",cEN="With the blessed water, I was able to break the link between the flute and the ancient spirit. I do believe though, that if you were to use this flute in a sacred spot, you may be able to summon the ancient spirits.\n\nPerhaps you might try the ruins in the southern part of Irontree Woods. Many corrupted treants inhabited this area at one time, and it is possible that they may still reside there, even in spirit form."}
Q[4443]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的鞭根草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a whipper root plant. The visible roots of the plant appear tough and leathery, and a slimy film hangs from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将三份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株鞭根草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 3 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Whipper Root. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
