Q[4447]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的夜龙草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a night dragon plant. The fruits that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将四份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株夜龙草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 4 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Night Dragon. It immediately begins to shed it's corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4448]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的夜龙草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a Night Dragon plant. The fruits that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将四份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株夜龙草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 4 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Night Dragon. It immediately begins to shed it's corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4449]={d="嘿！嘿，你！过来！\n\n你要帮帮我。我正在逃避黑铁矮人的追击，我藏在这里，满以为他们就找不到我了。但那些可恶的混蛋还有魔法！他们肯定看到我藏了起来，他们很快就把门锁上，说了些什么过一阵子再回来之类的话，然后就离开了。\n\n你要给它们的颜色瞧瞧！给那些黑铁地质学家一个教训！哦……对了，你能不能给我弄几块丝绸来做……做……呃，没什么。",dEN="Hey! Hey, you! Get over here!\n\nYa gotta help me out. I was runnin' from them Dark Iron dwarves, and I hid in here to get out of sight. Damn geologists and their magic ways! They musta seen me hide, cause next thing I knew, they locked the door and stuck me in here.\n\nTeach them geologists a lesson! Oh... an' can ya get me some pieces of silk cloth for... for... nothin'.",o="杀掉8个黑铁地质学家，并将15块丝绸交给灼热峡谷里那个被锁在厕所中的矮人。",oEN="Kill 8 Dark Iron Geologists and bring 15 pieces of Silk Cloth to the person locked in the outhouse in Searing Gorge.",p="我可没有闲工夫在这里待着！给我弄些丝绸来！我是说那些黑铁地质学家，抓住那些地质学家！他们应该尝尝我的，嗯……你的愤怒。",pEN="I ain't got all day! Get me those pieces of silk cloth! I mean geologists. Get those geologists! They deserve to feel my, well... your wrath.",c="哦，太好了！感觉很不错！\n\n什么？啊，当然……我是说那些地质学家。你给他们颜色了，对吗？我不知道该怎么谢你，$n。我可以有充足的时间在这里面……我的意思是，这让我不必担心他们会很快回来找我了。再次谢谢你。",cEN="Oh, this is great! Nice feel to it too!\n\nWhat? Oh, yeah... geologists. Got 'em good, did ya? I can't thank ya enough, <name>. That'll give me some time to finish up in here... Thanks again, <name>."}
Q[4450]={d="哦，你猜怎么着？我想起了一件事情。\n\n我现在仍然被困在这里，那么你可以帮我完成一项我在塔纳利斯接受的任务吗？很简单……嗯，对于你来说是这样的。\n\n加基森的克林科·古德斯迪尔需要一些从灼热峡谷和其它地方收集的东西。也许你可以看一下清单，然后把东西交给他……\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，我会把他的账本从门下递给你。把账本和他需要的那些东西交给他就行了。",dEN="Oh, you know what? That reminds me.\n\nYou wanna finish up a little job I took up while I was in Tanaris? It's easy...\n\nKrinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan was lookin' for some stuff found here in Searing Gorge and a few other places. Maybe you could take a look at the list and then bring it all to him?\n\nI'll just slide his ledger under the door if you're interested. Take that, and the stuff he wants back to him after ya collected it all.",o="把古德斯迪尔的账本和上面所列的物品交给塔纳利斯的克林科·古德斯迪尔。",oEN="Take the copy of Goodsteel's Ledger and then find the items listed in it before seeking Krinkle Goodsteel in Tanaris.",p="你有什么事吗，$r？抱歉，我手头工作太多，别见怪，有话直说吧。",pEN="Yes, yes? What can I do for you, <race>? I'm awfully busy and have many patrons requesting my services. Perhaps you can speed things up. I don't mean to be rude, but I just don't have the time if I'm to catch up on all my work.",c="哦，你看来很适合来帮我做事。很好。我还以为你是要我帮你锻造什么东西哪！\n\n这些东西太完美了……而且一应俱全。谢谢你，$c。\n\n我会奖励你一些东西的……嗯，你看看你想要什么吧。",cEN="Oh, you've seen fit to do some of the work I requested. Excellent. And here I thought you were going to ask me to craft you something.\n\nThese are all perfect... and everything's here. Thank you, <class>.\n\nMaybe it wouldn't hurt to reward you some... hmm, what would you find useful."}
Q[4451]={d="这把小小的黄铜钥匙看上去很普通。唯一特别的地方是匙柄上刻着几个字：\n\n\"黑铁茅厕——禁止配钥匙。\"\n\n你完全不知道它是什么意思，也不知道它能打开什么。",dEN="The small brass key looks simple enough.. The only thing that seems to make it stand out are some words scratched into the head of it:\n\n\"Dark Iron Outhouse - Do Not Duplicate.\"\n\nYou have no idea what it means or what it will lead to.",o="搜寻灼热峡谷并找到一个可以插入这把格里塞特厕所钥匙的锁眼。",oEN="Search Searing Gorge and find a use for the Grimesilt Outhouse Key you have found.",p="<Tose>\n\n谁啊？没看见我正忙着吗？",pEN="*cough*\n\nWho is it? Can't ya see I'm busy?",c="啊，好吧！真丢人！不过你找到钥匙了！我就知道那些该死的黑铁矮人把我锁在这里以后就把钥匙藏起来了！多谢你，$n。你太伟大了$r！现在，转动钥匙，把我放出来吧！",cEN="Well, I'll be! How in tarnation!? You found the key! I knew them blasted Dark Irons were hiding it after they locked me in here! Thank ya so much, <name>. You're the greatest! Now, just turn the key and let ol' Locheed outta here!"}
Q[4461]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的鞭根草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a whipper root plant. The visible roots of the plant appear tough and leathery, and a slimy film hangs from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将三份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株鞭根草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 3 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Whipper Root. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4462]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的夜龙草。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a Night Dragon plant. The fruits that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将四份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株夜龙草上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply 4 Cenarion Plant Salves to the Night Dragon. It immediately begins to shed it's corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4463]={p="拿出原料来，渺小的$r。\n\n另外我还需要三十枚金币，这是我帮你制作东西的报酬。",pEN="Present the components, mortal.\n\nI will also require payment in the form of thirty gold pieces for this creation.",c="拿着你的东西，愚蠢的$r。赶快从我面前消失！",cEN="Take your trinket, fool. Leave me to my studies!"}
Q[4464]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4465]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的轻歌花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a songflower plant. A pungent, unhealthy odor emanates from the plant. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将一些塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株轻歌花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply some Cenarion plant salve to the songflower. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant."}
Q[4466]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4467]={p="你找到了一株病怏怏的、被腐化了的迎风花。这株植物上面挂着的果实看起来已经腐烂，而且含有剧毒。你得想办法让它恢复到正常状态。",pEN="You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.",c="你将两份塞纳里奥植物药膏涂在了这株迎风花上。它立即摆脱了刚才奄奄一息的状态，重新变成了一棵活力十足的健康植物。",cEN="You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\nRelated"}
Q[4481]={p="这世上所有的东西都有价格，你所寻找的东西的价格是三十枚金币。\n\n当然，我会留下你收集的大部分材料。但是不用担心，你会得到你想要的东西。",pEN="There is a price to pay for all things in this world. The price for the specific item that you seek is thirty gold pieces.\n\nNaturally, I shall retain the majority of the components which you collected. But worry not, you shall have your trinket.",c="这对他简直就是侮辱……一个渺小的$r，比如说你，正在完成他一生都没能完成的工作。\n\n拿着你的东西，离开这里！",cEN="It is disgrace to his memory... a mortal, such as yourself, finishing his life's work.\n\nTake your amalgamation and be gone!"}
Q[4482]={p="三十枚金币，$r，三十枚金币外加必需的材料。",pEN="Thirty gold, <race>. Thirty gold and the required components.",c="为了完成你现在所持的圣契，卡里尔花费的时间足够让你活上好几辈子，$r。这都是为了什么？为了让他的信徒可以站在燃烧平原上，贬低他的研究，以满足对魔法永无止境的追求和欲望……诅咒这该死的欲望\n\n我对你的无情和贪得无厌感到恶心，滚开！",cEN="It took Kariel what would amount to several of your lifetimes to complete the libram that you now hold, <race>. All for what? So that his disciple could stand in the Burning Steppes and bastardize his research in order to satiate a never ending arcane craving... Curse this foul addiction.\n\nI am disgusted with your lack of compassion and insatiable greed. Be gone!"}
Q[4483]={p="如果你想要的是韧性圣契，那得给我三十枚金币。",pEN="If it is resilience you desire, thirty gold I require.",c="其余的圣契都遗失在这个世界上了，掉在你一辈子都不敢进入的地方，掉在你想都不敢想的地方。\n\n我要吸收这些材料的能量，剩下的残渣就是你的了……",cEN="Other librams are lost in this world. Lost in places you would not dare enter. Places you would pray did not exist.\n\nI will drink in the energies of these components. You shall be given the residual waste..."}
Q[4484]={p="不要浪费我的时间，渺小的$r。我要的是三十枚金币，外加必需的材料。",pEN="Do not waste my time, <race>. Give me what I require. Thirty gold and the components.",c="我的头在轰鸣……构成我们宇宙的无尽能量……啊！\n\n<玛瑟迪斯显得非常痛苦。>\n\n拿着你的东西，走开！",cEN="My head throbs... The energies of the vast expanses that makes up our universe... ARGGH!\n\nTake what you desire and leave!"}
Q[4485]={d="你好，$n。我看得出来，你的虔诚一如既往，信仰也一样坚定。\n\n我想，是时候让你去暴风城找杜索瑞安·雷尔谈谈了。你还有一些功课要学，而我觉得你已经$g准备好:准备好;了。\n\n去光明大教堂找他吧。还有，$n，认真对待这些功课。你是靠着谦逊和努力才走到今天的，别因为变得傲慢而让我们失望。\n\n保重。",dEN="Hello, <name>. I see your dedication remains strong, as does your faith.\n\nI think it is time you spoke with Duthorian Rall in Stormwind. There are some more lessons for you to learn, and I feel you are prepared.\n\nSeek him out in the Cathedral of Light, and <name>, take these lessons seriously. You've attained your status through humility and hard work, do not disappoint us by becoming arrogant.\n\nBe well.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind."}
Q[4486]={d="好啊，好啊，好啊，看看这位威风凛凛的大英雄。\n\n抱歉，$n，我不是有意冒犯……只是看到你取得的那些成就时，我有时会有点嫉妒。蒂莎说这是我的弱点，我向她发誓会努力改正。可有时候真的很难，你懂吗？\n\n我想跟你说话，是因为暴风城的杜索瑞安·雷尔传话给你，让你在$g准备好:准备好;时去光明大教堂见他。听起来很重要。像是出什么事了。",dEN="Well, well, well, look at the mighty hero in all <his/her> regality.\n\nSorry, <name>, I meant no offense... I just get a little jealous sometimes when I see some of the feats you've accomplished. Tiza tells me it's my weakness, and I swore to her I'd work on it. It's just hard sometimes, you know?\n\nBut the reason I wanted to talk to you was because Duthorian Rall in Stormwind sent word for you to meet him in the Cathedral of Light when you're ready. Sounded important. Sounded like something's going on.",o="与暴风城的达索瑞恩·拉尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.",c="啊，你回到大教堂了，<name>。很好。最近发生了很多事，如果你证明自己够格，我会寻求你的帮助。\n\n周围有许多阴险的敌人。我需要你帮忙阻止他们。",cEN="Ah, you've returned to the Cathedral, <name>. Good. A lot has happened recently, and I would seek your aid if you prove worthy.\n\nMany treacherous enemies are about. I will need your help to stop them."}
Q[4487]={d="啊，好，你来了。我派了个$g魅魔:地狱火;去通知你，不过看来它在找到你之前你就先到了。没关系。\n\n最近有些关于你力量增长的传闻，这对你是好事，对别人想必就是坏事。不过这无关紧要。重要的是你已经证明了自己的价值，理应得到某种……祝福。\n\n在棘齿城之外的贫瘠之地，住着一个叫斯坦哈德的人；我想你们已经认识了。",dEN="Ah, good, you're here. I sent a after you to get your attention, but it seems you were able to get here before it found you. No matter.\nRelated",o="与棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."}
Q[4488]={d="啊，$n，你肯赏光来看我们，真是太好了。\n\n我想你并不指望有音乐或是盛大的礼遇。你学得很快，但距离真正的智慧还有很长的路要走。若不小心，腐化就会攫取你，以及你那薄弱的意志。\n\n不过话说回来：斯坦哈德想和你谈谈。他仍住在贫瘠之地棘齿城的那座塔里。我建议你别拖太久。",dEN="Ah, <name>, you've seen fit to grace us with your presence. How wonderful!\nRelated",o="与棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."}
Q[4489]={d="你，说你哪！过来！\n\n你就是他们所说的那个叫做$n，对吗？\n\n我也这么想。我长话短说：你的力量在不断增长，这点众所周知。现在，你的努力终于可以为你带来回报了。\n\n到贫瘠之地去，在那里的棘齿城中找到斯坦哈德·法尔杉——你还记得他吧？他会跟你详谈的，赶快去吧。",dEN="You, <race>! Come here!\n\nYou're the one they call <name>, yes?\n\nI thought as much. I will keep this short: you're growing in power, and it has been acknowledged. And now, the time has come that you are rewarded for your efforts.\n\nGo to the Barrens. There, above Ratchet, you'll find Strahad Farsan--perhaps you remember him? He would have words with you. I wouldn't take long.",o="与棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.",c="那么说来，你又决定要回应我的召唤，很好。\n\nB我的侍僧还在怀疑你会不会出现呢。我告诉他们这一点是毫无疑问的：当你想要获得更强大的力量时，你就会急切地来我这里。",cEN="So, you've decided to grace my presence again. How kind of you.\n\nMy acolytes wondered if you'd ever show up. I told them there was no doubt. When power is concerned, you are drawn in like a moth to the flame.\nRelated"}
Q[4490]={d="我想为你的耐心和努力给你一份奖赏。但你要知道，日后召唤地狱战马的能力会困难得多。你必须真正去争取它，而那并不容易。\n\n至少现在，你有能力随心所欲地召唤这个生物了。",dEN="I would give you a reward for your patience and hard work. But know this, the ability to summon a Felsteed will be much more difficult in the future. You will have to truely earn it... and it will not be easy.",o="去棘齿城找斯坦哈德·法尔桑，学习召唤地狱战马的能力。",oEN="Bring 25 gold to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet to learn the ability to summon a Felsteed",c="祝你好运，$n。我期盼着能与你再次见面。",cEN="Good luck, <name>. I look forward to seeing you in the future."}
Q[4491]={d="啊……太热了……\n\n我正在探索这片地域，突然之间，我就热得昏了过去，我一定是中暑了。\n\n求求你，带我回到马绍尔营地的朋友斯普拉格那里去，我想我还可以坚持到走回去……\n\n我感觉有些不对劲，如果我又晕倒了，就用斯普拉格的水壶里给我洒点水。我希望这能有点用……",dEN="Ugh... It's so hot...\n\nI was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion.\n\nPlease, help me get back to my friend Spraggle at Marshal's Refuge. I think I'm well enough to follow you there.\n\nI am feeling a little out of it, so if I do happen to faint again, just splash some water on me from Spraggle's canteen. That should work, I hope...",o="把林格带回马绍尔营地的斯普拉格·弗劳克身边。\n\n如果林格晕倒了，就用斯普拉格的水壶让他恢复。",oEN="Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.\n\nIf Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him.",p="我好担心林格……",pEN="I've been so worried about Ringo...",c="林格的情况并不好，$n，但我很高兴他能活着回来！\n\n谢谢你找到他。",cEN="Ringo's not in the best shape, <name>, but I am glad to have him back in one piece!\n\nThank you for finding him."}
Q[4492]={d="你必须帮帮我，$n！我的朋友林格前不久离开这里去探索南边的火山了，但他一直没回来。我很为他担心。\n\n你能帮我找找他吗？带着我的水壶，如果你找到了林格，没准他正需要它呢！",dEN="You've got to help me, <name>! My friend, Ringo left earlier to explore the volcano to the south of here, and he has been gone way too long. I am really worried about him.\n\nDo you think you could find him? Why don't you take my canteen with you -- if you do find Ringo, I'm sure he'll need it!",o="在火羽山找到林格。",oEN="Find Ringo at Fire Plume Ridge.",p="什……什么？",pEN="Wha... What?",c="哦……终于有人找到我了……",cEN="Oh... I'm so glad someone found me..."}
Q[4493]={d="看起来异种蝎的意图，不——它们存在的原因，就是毁灭它们遇到的所有其它生物。它们的目标非常明确，也正是由于这个原因，它们成了对艾泽拉斯所有生物的巨大威胁。\n\n我们现在见到的仅仅是个开始，我怀疑它们的力量来自卡利姆多的腹地：安戈洛环形山。到塔纳利斯沙漠里的加基森镇去，跟炼金师匹斯特苏格谈一谈。把我的想法告诉他，他肯定会帮我们对抗异种蝎的。",dEN="It would seem that the silithid's intent, nay - reason for being, is to devour everything in their path that is not of their ecology. Their focus is singular, and it is for this reason they are a grave threat to all life on Azeroth.\n\nWhat we've seen to date is but the first stages. I suspect that their strength comes from deeper in Kalimdor: Un'Goro Crater. Go to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg. Tell him of my theory; he will surely aid us in fighting the silithid.",o="与加基森的炼金师匹斯特苏格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",c="嗯，我知道是格拉希娜派你来的。你与这些小动物的作战经验是非常宝贵的，据我所知没几个人曾经对付过这类生物。至于格拉希娜所持的安戈洛环形山是异种蝎发源地的观点……可能确实如此。安戈洛环形山是西边的一个神秘而危险的丛林。也许我们可以在那里搞清楚异种蝎的来龙去脉。",cEN="Yes, I gathered that Gracina sent you to me. Your experience in fighting these beasties is priceless; no one to my knowledge has ever dealt with their kind before. As for Gracina's idea that Un'Goro Crater is their heart... perhaps it is. Un'Goro is a mysterious and dangerous jungle to the west of here. Perhaps it is also one step closer to figuring out what the silithid are all about."}
Q[4494]={d="看起来异种蝎的意图，不——它们存在的原因，就是毁灭它们遇到的所有其它生物。它们的目标非常明确，也正是由于这个原因，它们成了对艾泽拉斯所有生物的巨大威胁。\n\n我们现在见到的仅仅是个开始，我怀疑它们的力量来自卡利姆多的腹地：安戈洛环形山。到塔纳利斯沙漠里的加基森镇去，跟炼金师匹斯特苏格谈一谈。把我的想法告诉他，他肯定会帮我们对抗异种蝎的。",dEN="It would seem that the silithid's intent, nay - reason for being, is to devour everything in their path that is not of their ecology. Their focus is singular, and it is for this reason they are a grave threat to all life on Azeroth.\n\nWhat we've seen to date is but the first stages. I suspect that their strength comes from deeper in Kalimdor: Un'Goro Crater. Go to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg. Tell him of my theory; he will surely aid us in fighting the silithid.",o="与加基森的炼金师匹斯特苏格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",c="嗯，我知道是格拉希娜派你来的。你与这些小动物的作战经验是非常宝贵的，据我所知没几个人曾经对付过这类生物。至于格拉希娜所持的安戈洛环形山是异种蝎发源地的观点……可能确实如此。安戈洛环形山是西边的一个神秘而危险的丛林。也许我们可以在那里搞清楚异种蝎的来龙去脉。",cEN="Yes, I gathered that Zilzibin sent you to me. Your experience in fighting these beasties is priceless; no one to my knowledge has ever dealt with their kind before. As for Zil's idea that Un'Goro Crater is their heart... perhaps it is. Un'Goro is a mysterious and dangerous jungle to the west of here. Perhaps it is also one step closer to figuring out what the silithid are all about."}
Q[4495]={d="我有一位名叫埃沃隆的朋友，他通常都会在每天的固定时间段里来拜访我。奇怪的是，今天他根本没来，实际上现在他已经晚了好几个小时了。\n\n我承认我有些担心，$n。埃沃隆常常在北面的一个洞穴里待很长时间，你知道那里有多危险——那里到处都是蜘蛛！\n\n如果你恰巧要过去那边的话，能帮我找一下他吗？",dEN="A friend of mine named Iverron usually visits me at the same time every day. The strange thing is that he hasn't been by today at all -- he's several hours late, in fact.\n\nI admit, I am a little worried, <name>. Iverron spends a lot of time over by the cave to the north, and I'm sure you know how dangerous it is there -- spiders, everywhere!\n\nIf you happen to be going that way, though, will you keep an eye out for him?",o="在北边的洞穴附近找到埃沃隆。",oEN="Find Iverron by the cave to the north.",c="真高兴你能找到我，$n。你是怎么知道我在这里的？",cEN="I'm so glad you found me, <name>. How did you know I was here?"}
Q[4496]={d="我的研究表明，异种虫就像蜜蜂：只要杀死蜂巢中的女王，其余的就会陷入混乱。我会调配一种诱饵把女王引出来；一旦它现身，你就解决掉它。\n\n不过首先，我们需要一些材料；我们可不想让你$g毫无准备:毫无准备;地闯进丛林里出洋相。往西去，在安戈洛环形山找到异种虫巢穴，从其中一只虫子身上取得一颗气味腺。我还需要一些安戈洛原生土壤的样本。",dEN="My research revealed to me that the silithid are like bees; destroy the queen of the hive, and the rest of should be thrown into disarray. I'll brew a lure that we'll use to bring out the queen; once summoned, you'll take her down.\n\nFirst though, we need some reagents; we don't want you bungling into the jungle unprepared. Go west to find the silithid hive in Un'Goro Crater and obtain a scent gland from one of the bugs. I'll also need some samples of the native Un'Goro soil.",o="把一份格里什信息素和5份安戈洛的泥土样本交给加基森的炼金师匹斯特苏格。",oEN="Bring a Gorishi Scent Gland and 5 Un'Goro Soil samples to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",p="找到一个合适的臭腺可能会有一点难度——腺体不能损坏，但是取得腺体的过程似乎不容易得出这种结果。至于土壤，我认为很容易就能找到。\n\n不管怎样，你拿到我制造诱饵所需要的东西了吗？",pEN="Finding a suitable scent gland might take a bit - the gland can't be damaged, but the process of getting one certainly doesn't lend itself to it. As for the soil, I'd assume it should be easy enough to find.\n\nAnyway, do you have the items I need to make the lure?",c="啊，是臭腺。外膜看起来还完整无缺——太好了。还有土壤，是的，这应该可以发挥很好的效果。加上我特殊的添加剂，我应该能把这个研磨成完美的诱饵。\n\n给我一点时间来完成诱饵的制作，$n。一旦做好，我们就可以进行下一步的计划，希望可以在异种蝎蹂躏加基森……以及卡利姆多的其余地区之前阻止他们。",cEN="The scent gland, ah yes. The membrane appears intact - excellent. The soil, yes, this should work out perfectly. With my special additions, I should be able to grind all this up into the perfect lure.\n\nGive me a moment to make the lure, <name>. Once it's ready, we'll be able to enact the next step that may hopefully stop the silithid before they overrun Gadgetzan... and the rest of Kalimdor."}
Q[4501]={d="悬赏：寻找技艺精湛的冒险者来对付安戈洛尔环形山中的翼手龙。它们的数量正在不断增加，已经威胁到了这个地区的旅行者。\n\n请杀掉10只翼手龙和15只狂怒的翼手龙来削减它们的数量。\n\n在完成任务之后，请向斯普拉格·弗劳克报告并换取奖励。",dEN="Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area.\n\nDecrease the population by slaying 10 frenzied pterrordax.\n\nSpeak with Spraggle Frock after completing the task for a reward.",o="杀掉10只翼手龙和15只狂怒的翼手龙，然后向马绍尔营地的斯普拉格·弗劳克报告。",oEN="Kill 10 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.",p="实话跟你说吧，我以前不是很担心那些奇怪生物的数量……直到有一天我看到写在一块大石头上的话：\n\n小心翼手龙\n\n这是谁写的呢？我不知道，但是忽视这句话显然是愚蠢的。",pEN="To tell you the truth, I really wasn't that worried about the strange creatures... Until the day that I saw it written on the side of a large stone.\n\nBEWARE OF PTERRORDAX\n\nWho could have written it? I don't know, but it's too creepy to just ignore!",c="我对这里的翼手龙感到恐惧！感谢你减少了它们的数量，$n。我现在终于敢走出马绍尔营地进行冒险了。",cEN="I am absolutely terrified of the pterrordax here! Thank you for decreasing their numbers, <name>. Now I might feel safe enough to venture out of Marshal's Refuge."}
Q[4502]={d="作为玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的学徒，我从他那里学到了很多知识。但是他已离开很长时间了，因此我想自己去学习新的知识。\n\n近来我一直在阅读关于安戈洛环形山里面那些持续而奇怪的火山活动的资料。我想如果能从那儿的火元素身上弄到一些灰烬，就可以了解到很多东西了。\n\n如果你要往那儿去的话，能顺便帮我收集一些吗？",dEN="Being an apprentice to Marvon Rivetseeker, I've learned so much. But he's been gone for such a long time now, so I think I'm going to work on some experiments of my own.\n\nI've been reading about Un'Goro Crater most recently, and about the strange volcanic activity going on in the middle of the crater. I think a lot could be learned if I could just get some of the ash from the elementals there.\n\nDo you think you'd mind collecting some for me, if you are going that way?",o="到安戈洛环形山的火山中去，从那里的元素身上收集9份安戈洛灰烬，把它们交给棘齿城的莉芙·雷兹菲克斯。",oEN="Collect 9 samples of Un'Goro Ash from the fire elementals around the volcano in Un'Goro Crater, and return them to Liv Rizzlefix in Ratchet.",p="安戈洛环形山里的火山真的是活火山吗？我相信我可以从火山灰中了解到很多东西，$n。",pEN="Is it true that the volcano in Un'Goro is active? I'm sure I could learn a lot with some ash from the volcano, <name>.",c="这些样本对我的研究而言简直堪称完美！谢谢你，$n！我承诺，我会把我的研究结果优先告诉你的。",cEN="These samples will be perfect for my studies! Thank you, <name>! I promise, you'll be the first one I will tell about my findings."}
Q[4503]={d="我正在做一架飞行器！\n\n我被困在了这里，而且不敢轻易出去。如果我走出这里的话，肯定会迷路的，但是如果使用飞行器，我就可以轻松地回到加基森去。\n\n那么，你愿意帮助我吗？我现在只剩下机翼没有完成了，我想翼手龙和双帆龙的鳞片会是非常合适的材料。我自己是不可能去搞到这些鳞片的，但是你看上去好像有两把刷子。为什么你不帮我找找呢？",dEN="I'm making a flying machine!\n\nI got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death.\n\nSo, will you help me? All I have left to build is the wings, and I was thinking that the webby scales from the pterrordax and diemetradon would be perfect. There's no way I'm going to go up against one of those, but you look pretty tough. Why don't you give it a try?",o="为马绍尔营地的希兹尔收集8块精细的双帆龙鳞片和8块精细的翼手龙鳞片。",oEN="Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",p="每个伟大的交通工具都需要有个名字……我想我会叫它……双翼飞行器！",pEN="Every great vehicle needs a name... I was thinking I'd call it... Pwned!",c="太好了，这些鳞片非常合适。我想我一定可以用这些鳞片让我的机器飞起来！\n\n谢谢你！",cEN="Yes, these scales are perfect. I should be able to get this flyer off the ground with these scales for sure!\n\nThanks!"}
Q[4504]={d="我总在琢磨怎么快速赚到一个金币，$n。如果你帮我实现我这个新点子，我就分你一点利润。你觉得怎么样？\n\n我就知道！\n\n去安戈洛环形山北部的沥青坑，给我收集一些沥青。不过不是随便什么沥青——你得从沥青坑周围那些野兽身上取。普通的沥青黏性根本不够。\n\n那些长得像植物的生物皮肤里含有叶绿素，和沥青混合后，就会变成一种超级黏稠的物质。",dEN="I'm always looking for a quick way to earn a gold, <name>. If you help me with my newest idea, I'll let you in on a little of the profit. How does that sound to you?\n\nI thought so!\n\nHead to the tar pits in northern Un'Goro Crater, and collect me some tar. Not just any tar, now, you'll need to get it from the beasts that live around the tar pits. Regular tar just simply isn't sticky enough.\n\nThe plant-like creatures contain chlorophyll in their skin, and mixed with the tar, it's super sticky!",o="帮加基森的特兰雷克收集12块极度粘稠的沥青。",oEN="Collect 12 samples of Super Sticky Tar for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan.",p="特兰雷克又要大获成功了——超级粘合剂即将风靡市场！",pEN="Tran'rek's done it again -- this super sticky glue will be all the rage!",c="没错，我要的就是这些……\n\n嘿，等等，我的手……看来我没办法把我的双手分开了……\n\n也许这不是个好主意。哦，等等！我真是天才，超级粘合液清除剂！我可以用它来赚钱！",cEN="Yes, this tar is just the stuff...\n\nHey, wait a minute, my hands... I can't seem to get them apart...\n\nMaybe this wasn't such a good idea. Oh, but wait! Super sticky tar remover! That's where the real money is!"}
Q[4505]={d="有人可能会说我非常残忍……但事实上，我只不过是迫切地希望以任何可能的方法使部落能够压倒联盟。\n\n我最近对南边的克斯特拉斯废墟中的月亮井很感兴趣，这座月亮井是由碧火萨特守护的，它曾经是那些暗夜精灵新生的象征，但如今它已遭到腐化，被用于制造更多的萨特。\n\n我有个主意，$n，我需要一份井水的样品……给我们的那些“朋友”。",dEN="Some may say that I am exceptionally cruel... But truly, it is only a strong desire to see the Horde gain an advantage against the Alliance, in any way possible.\n\nMy newest interest is a moonwell at the Ruins of Constellas, south of here, tended by the Jadefire satyrs. The moonwell, once a symbol of renewal for the insufferable night elves, is now corrupted, and used to bring forth more satyrs.\n\nI have an idea, <name>, and I'd like a sample of the water... for my little feline friend here.",o="从碧火萨特的月亮井中收集一份被腐化的水的样本，把它交给血毒哨所的温娜·哈萨德。",oEN="Collect a sample of corrupted water from the Jadefire Satyrs' moonwell and bring it to Winna Hazzard at Bloodvenom Post.",p="这是至关重要的，赶快出发吧。",pEN="This is of utmost importance. Be on your way, now.",c="很好。我们必须设法用这种腐化的力量来对付我们的敌人……",cEN="Very well. We must find a way to use this corruption against our enemies..."}
Q[4506]={d="这股腐化的水可以为我们所用，$n。只喝了一小口，我的小猫就长大了一倍，看起来还强壮了许多。这些猫也许能派上用场……\n\n拿着，$n。把这个猫笼带到康斯坦茨废墟，在月井旁边把小猫放出来。嘿嘿……我相信你会对结果感到满意的！\n\n然后把它带回来给我；我会好好报答你的。",dEN="This corrupted water can be used to our advantage, <name>. With just a small amount of the water, my kitten doubled in size, and seems to be stronger... somehow. These cats may prove useful...\n\nHere, <name>. Take this cat carrier, and release the kitten inside next to the moonwell in the Ruins of Constellas. Heh, heh... I'm sure you'll be pleased with the results!\n\nReturn towards Bloodvenom Post, and I'm sure I can make it worth your time.",o="把温娜的小猫带到被腐化的月井，在那里放出来，然后再把它带回血毒岗哨。\n\n回到温娜身边后，点击那只猫把它交给她。",oEN="Use Winna's Kitten Carrier at the corrupted moonwell, release it, then bring it back towards Bloodvenom Post.",p="不要告诉我你搞不定这种小事！快去！",pEN="Don't tell me that you can't go back there! Get going!",c="太好了！\n\n被遗忘者会寻找一切可以击败联盟的方法！这些腐败的水会在我们将来的行动中很有用处……",cEN="Excellent!\n\nThe forsaken will resort to any means necessary to crush the alliance! The use of the corrupted water will surely prove useful in our future efforts..."}
Q[4507]={d="拿着这份诱饵。在四通八达的虫巢中一定有一块水晶之类的东西，我想异种蝎就是使用它作为协调设备的。至于水晶在哪里……我建议你到虫巢中的孵化室找找看。\n\n在那里对水晶使用诱饵，这样就可以引出异种蝎的皇后了，但是你要小心——也许会有几个守卫保护着她。干掉皇后，然后拿出她的脑子。虽然这听上去有些恶心，但是我们必须对它进行研究。祝你好运，$n！",dEN="Here's the lure. Inside the hive network should be a crystal of some sort. We think the silithid use the crystal as some sort of hive-wide attunement device. As for where this crystal might be, I'd say try the hatcheries inside the hive.\n\nUsing the lure on the crystal should roust out the queen, but be warned - she will probably be protected by several guards. Take out the queen and remove her brain. As icky as that sounds, we desperately need to study it. Good luck, <name>!",o="召唤格里什皇后，然后击败她。\n\n把格里什皇后的大脑交给加基森的炼金师匹斯特苏格。",oEN="Defeat the Gorishi Hive Queen once she is summoned.\n\nBring the Gorishi Queen's Brain to Alchemist Pestlezugg in Gadgetzan.",p="我们当务之急是要得到皇后的脑袋作为研究。根据我们所了解的情况，我们相信这些异种蝎可能被一种邪恶的智慧力量所控制。每当我想起能够控制像异种蝎这么邪恶的东西的力量，我都感到浑身发抖，$n。",pEN="Acquiring the queen's brain for our research is absolutely imperative. From what we have learned, we believe that these silithid are quite possibly being controlled by a malign intelligence. I shudder to think what could control something as insidious as the silithid, <name>.",c="太好了，$n！我们今天获得了重大的胜利。我们需要花些时间来研究这东西但是我们一定会好好利用它的，你不用担心。\n\n至于那些异种蝎，我不知道它们是不是就只存在于现有的范围。看来要找到真相还有很多事要做，我不得不那么说。",cEN="Fantastic, <name>! We've won quite the victory here today. It will take some time for us to fully understand what we have here; we'll put it to good use though, don't you worry about that.\n\nAs for the silithid, I genuinely doubt that this was the full extent of their presence. This is much too clean of a resolution, I'm sorry to say."}
Q[4508]={d="我最近的研究结果表明情况相当糟糕，我们必须得通知某个能采取一些实质行动的人，因为我们不可能单独解决这件事情。\n\n把我的最新报告交给达纳苏斯的格拉希娜·灵风吧，她还在月神殿，不是吗？她的许多朋友都是联盟的要人，$n，如果我们能让他们涉及这件事情，那解决问题的希望就大增了。",dEN="My recent findings and the knowledge we have gained here today needs to reach hands that can quite possibly do something with it. As resourceful as we are here in Gadgetzan, we can't do this alone.\n\nTake my latest report back to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus; she's still at the Temple of the Moon, is she not? She's got friends who are Alliance bigwigs; if we can get them involved in this <name>, then we just might make it out of this alive.",o="把匹斯特苏格的安戈洛报告交给达纳苏斯的格拉希娜·灵风。",oEN="Bring Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus.",p="他们都是笨蛋，$n！他们甚至没有想到在自己的周围潜藏着多么可怕的威胁，他们对部落的仇恨最终会导致我们的毁灭！我不知道除了把他们直接丢到其中一个蝎巢以外，还有什么关于异种蝎威胁的证据可以给他们？\n\n对不起，你有什么消息要给我吗？",pEN="They are fools, <name>! They cannot even think to look around them for a greater threat; their irrational hatred of the Horde will be the end of us all. I do not know how much more proof I can give them of the silithid threat short of dropping them in one of the hives so they can see for themselves!\n\nI'm sorry, you bring news for my attention?",c="虽然我真心感谢你这么做，但我不确定这能有什么用。联盟只会忽视来自部落以外任何一方的威胁，就连我们达纳苏斯自己的领袖们也无法就这究竟是什么威胁达成一致。像范达尔·鹿盔那样的蠢货还振振有词地说，异种虫根本不像我所说的那样是远古时代的威胁。他的无知只有他的傲慢能与之相比。你自己也见识过这威胁了，我们必须坚持消灭异种虫！",cEN="While I genuinely appreciate this, I am not sure what good it will do us. The Alliance ignores threats from any source other than the Horde, and even our own leaders here in Darnassus cannot agree on what exactly this threat is. Fools like Fandral Staghelm theorize that the silithid are nothing like the threat from the ancient past I claim them to be. His ignorance is only surpassed by his arrogance.\n\nYou have seen the threat yourself, <name>. We must remain committed to defeating the silithid!"}
Q[4509]={d="我最近的研究结果表明情况相当糟糕，我们必须得通知某个能采取一些实质行动的人，因为我们不可能单独解决这件事情。\n\n把我的最新报告交给奥格瑞玛的基尔兹宾·鼓眼，他还在暗巷区里待着，不是吗？他的许多朋友都是部落的要人，$n，如果我们能让他们涉及这件事情，那解决问题的希望就大增了。",dEN="My recent findings and the knowledge we have gained here today needs to reach hands that can quite possibly do something with it. As resourceful as we are here in Gadgetzan, we can't do this alone.\n\nTake my latest report back to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar; he's still in his place on the upper part of the Drag, is he not? He's got friends who are high within the Horde; if we can get them involved in this <name>, then we just might make it out of this alive.",o="把匹斯特苏格的安戈洛报告交给奥格瑞玛斯的基尔兹宾·鼓眼。",oEN="Bring Pestlezugg's Un'Goro Report to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar.",p="他们都是笨蛋，$n！他们甚至没有想到在自己的周围潜藏着多么可怕的威胁，他们对联盟的仇恨最终会导致我们的毁灭！我不知道除了把他们直接丢到其中一个蝎巢以外，还有什么关于异种蝎威胁的证据可以给他们？\n\n对不起，你有什么消息要给我吗？",pEN="They are fools, <name>! They cannot even think to look around them for a greater threat; their irrational hatred of the Alliance will be our undoing. I do not know how much more proof I can give them of the silithid threat short of dropping them in one of the hives so they can see for themselves!\n\nI'm sorry, you bring news for my attention?",c="我很高兴你把这个消息带给我，但是我不确定这到底会为我们带来什么好处。部落忽视了一切联盟之外的威胁，如果萨尔看到现在这种严重的事实的话，也许他会采取一些行动，但是他被各种杂务困扰着，根本看不到这些。那些笨蛋认为我们在担心着想象中的威胁，而他们所关心的才是我们真正面临的危机！\n\n你已经亲眼目睹这个威胁，$n。我们必须继续投入击败异种蝎的行动！",cEN="While I genuinely appreciate this, I am not sure what good it will do us. The Horde ignores threats from any source other than the Alliance. While Thrall himself might take action were the facts presented to him, he is beset on all sides by conflicting advice. These fools would have us chase our own imaginary tails were they to think it might catch the Alliance unawares!\n\nYou have seen the threat yourself, <name>. We must remain committed to defeating the silithid!"}
Q[4510]={d="$n，你对我们的帮助是无价的。等到时机成熟时，我肯定会再次请求你帮助我们去对付异种蝎。我们必须清晰地解读我们在安戈洛得到的信息，恐怕我原本假设安戈洛是异种蝎发源地的想法是错误的……看来它们还有更大规模的聚居地。\n\n把这封信交给银行的伊迪瑞娜。她会让你从我的仓库中挑选一件东西。感谢你为我们提供的帮助，勇敢的$c。",dEN="<name>, your help has been immeasurable. The time will come, no doubt, when I'll ask for your assistance against the silithid once more. We must absorb what we have learned in Un'Goro; I fear that my assumptions that the silithid originated from Un'Goro are now wrong... that indeed there is a far stronger presence somewhere.\n\nTake this note to Idriana at the bank. She'll give you something from my vault that should be viewed as a token of my gratitude. Thank you for your assistance, brave <class>.",o="把银行赠券交给达纳苏斯银行的伊迪瑞娜。",oEN="Bring the Bank Voucher to Idriana in the bank of Darnassus.",p="艾露恩保佑你，$c。我能为你做些什么？",pEN="Elune'adore, <class>. What may I do for you today?",c="这张赠券授权我从格拉希娜·灵风的帐户中取出一件东西送给你。看来我要恭喜你了！",cEN="This bank voucher authorizes me to withdraw an item from Gracina Spiritmight's account with us and present it to you. Congratulations would seem to be in order!"}
Q[4511]={d="$n，你对我们的帮助是无价的。等到时机成熟时，我肯定会再次请求你帮助我们去对付异种蝎。我们必须清晰地解读我们在安戈洛得到的信息，恐怕我原本假设安戈洛是异种蝎发源地的想法是错误的……看来它们还有更大规模的聚居地。\n\n把这封信交给银行的卡鲁斯。他会让你从我的仓库中挑选一件东西。感谢你为我们提供的帮助，勇敢的$c。",dEN="<name>, we could not have gotten this far without you. The time will come soon, no doubt, when I'll ask for your help against the silithid once more. We must absorb what we have learned in Un'Goro; I fear that my assumptions that the silithid originated from Un'Goro are now wrong... that indeed there is a far stronger presence somewhere.\n\nTake this note to Karus at the bank. He'll give you something from my vault that should be viewed as a token of my gratitude. Thank you for your assistance, mighty <class>.",o="把银行赠券交给奥格瑞玛银行的卡鲁斯。",oEN="Bring the Bank Voucher to Karus in the bank of Orgrimmar.",p="啧啧！我能为你做些什么吗，$c？",pEN="Zug zug! What may I help you with today, <class>?",c="这张赠券授权我从基尔兹宾·鼓眼的帐户中取出一件东西送给你。看来我要恭喜你了！",cEN="This bank voucher authorizes me to withdraw an item from Zilzibin Drumlore's account with us and present it to you. Congratulations would seem to be in order!"}
Q[4512]={d="我研究最多的生物是软泥怪。我知道这听上去很奇怪，但是那种东西已经到处都是了！\n\n不久之前，我帮助米纳希尔港的一位女士找到了她的包——那个包被软泥怪吞掉了。我也看见幽暗城皇家药剂师学会派出了他们的成员去收集软泥怪的样品。我要知道这是为什么！软泥怪究竟是从哪里来的？\n\n我听说在费伍德森林有许多软泥怪，我需要那些软泥怪的样品来进行研究。我会给你一些容器，这样你就可以帮我收集软泥怪了。",dEN="But the thing I've studied most is ooze. I know it sounds odd, but they're all over!\n\nI helped a lady in Menethil find her bag not too long ago--it was eaten by oozes. I've seen members of the Royal Apothecary Society from Undercity collecting samples of the stuff. I want to know why! Where does it come from?\n\nI've heard of more in Felwood. What I need are samples of the oozes there so I can further my research. I'll give you containers, you use them to collect a sample from the deceased creatures.",o="将6瓶被诅咒的软泥怪样本和6瓶被污染的软泥怪样本交给铁炉堡的拉里斯·空轮。",oEN="Bring 6 Filled Cursed Ooze Jars and 6 Filled Tainted Ooze Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.",p="我已经完成的一些实验效果很不错。我相信只要再多加把劲，就能找出这些生物的特性，以及它们在艾泽拉斯的生物演化史中扮演了什么样的角色……如果它真的和艾泽拉斯的物种起源有关的话。\n\n我最重要的理论之一似乎并不是很受欢迎——我认为软泥怪和泥浆怪及这个星球上的生物是密切相关的……彷佛它们本身就是这个星球的分泌物。\n\n但是如果没有更多样品的话，我是无法证实或者推翻这一理论的。",pEN="Some of the experiments I've done are fascinating. I think with a little more work, I'll be able to figure out the nature of these creatures and how they play into how life developed on Azeroth... if they even have anything to do with it to begin with.\n\nOne of my biggest theories that isn't well liked is the idea that oozes and slimes are tied to the creation of this planet... almost like they're a secretion of it.\n\nBut I can't prove or disprove it until I get more samples.",c="真是惊人的结果啊，$n！你取得了堕落软泥怪的样品，而且它们看起来毫发无伤！谢谢你。嗯，这些样品会非常合适。我等不及要对它们进行试验了。\n\n如果我成功的话，那我就能成为探险者协会中最伟大的科学家之一了！\n\n这足以向所有的矮人证明，在诺莫瑞根事件之后让我们侏儒迁入铁炉堡不是个错误。",cEN="Amazing results, <name>! You got close enough to take a sample of the corrupted things, and managed to look no worse for wear! Thank you. Oh, these samples will be perfect. I can't wait to start testing on them.\n\nIf I'm right, I could be one of the Explorers' Leagues greatest scientists!\n\nThat'll prove to all the dwarves that it wasn't a mistake to allow us gnomes into Ironforge after the Gnomeregan incident."}
Q[4513]={d="$n，我还需要更多样本。但我需要的是纯净的样本。我知道，我知道。\"纯净\"是什么意思，这种话对你没什么帮助。我也不知道该怎么说，我只知道这些样本是被污染的，就像费伍德森林一样。而这正是我的发现如此重要的原因。看来软泥会适应它们所处的环境。我需要未被污染的软泥样本。你问去哪儿找？我不知道。\n\n唉，$n，带上这些容器吧，万一你自己找到了呢。",dEN="I'm going to need more samples, <name>. But--and I don't know how to put this--they have to be pure samples. I know, I know. \"What does 'pure' mean, Laris?\" I'm not sure. I do know that these are corrupt... just like Felwood. Which is what makes my realization so important. The oozes seem to adapt... to take on the aspects of the area they're in. I'll need to find samples that haven't been polluted. But where? Where?!\n\nBah! <name>, take these containers just in case you find any on your own.",o="将10个纯净样本瓶交给铁炉堡的拉里斯·空轮。\n\n如果你无法找到它们的话，不妨到拉里斯那里去再打听一些线索。",oEN="Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.\n\nIf you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris.",p="我要考虑许多问题。它意味着什么？它是如何影响艾泽拉斯的种种生物的？",pEN="So many things to consider. But what does it mean? And how does it affect the lives of the people of Azeroth?",c="你找到它了？$n，你真是块瑰宝。你的勤奋和乐于助人的精神让我感到非常钦佩。\n\n请你拿着这个当作报酬吧。现在我有些工作要做，但是我敢肯定，如果你以后再来的话，我还会再次需要你的帮助。\n\n谢谢你，非常的感谢你。",cEN="You've found it? <name>, you are a treasure unto yourself. Your dedication and aid has been magnificent and I could not possibly thank you enough.\n\nPlease, take this for your troubles. I have some work to do, but I'm sure, if you come back at a later time, I'll have need of your services again.\n\nThank you. Thank you so much."}
Q[4521]={d="冬泉谷就在费伍德森林的东北面，木候要塞的另一边。你去过那儿吗？\n\n我听说那片区域里到处都是一种被称作枭兽的生物，这些野兽以守护着暗夜精灵的秘密而知名。\n\n我们必须找出可能隐藏在冬泉谷里的东西。\n\n我听说你可在道路的南边找到蓬毛枭兽，而狂怒的枭兽则可在冬泉谷的中心地区找到。清除它们，控制那片土地。",dEN="Winterspring lies just beyond Timbermaw, northeast of Felwood. Have you been there?\n\nI have heard that the area is laden with creatures called wildkin. These beasts have been known to guard secrets; secrets of the Night elves.\n\nWe must figure out what may be hidden in Winterspring.\n\nI have heard the ragged owlbeasts can be found just south of the road, and that there are others called raging owlbeasts that may be found in the center of Winterspring. Clear them out, and gain access to the land.",o="费伍德森林的特鲁尔·法贝恩要你去冬泉谷猎杀15头狂怒的枭兽和15头蓬毛枭兽。",oEN="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to kill 15 Raging Owlbeasts and 15 Ragged Owlbeasts.",p="完成我给你的任务之后再回来向我报告。",pEN="Report back to me after you have completed the task I gave you.",c="这真是个好消息，$n。把这些野兽清开之后，我们就可以进一步深入冬泉谷了。你$g准备好:准备好;接受更多挑战了吗？",cEN="This is excellent news, <name>. With these beasts out of the way, we can begin to adventure further into Winterspring. Are you ready for more?"}
Q[4542]={d="勇敢的$g旅行者:旅行者;，半人马在这一带的袭击越来越频繁了。自由之风村落必须立刻知道这件事！去东南方自由之风村落找峭壁守望者长角，把这封急件交给他。\n\n小心别撞上邪枝氏族……他们最近对我们的态度很古怪。|n|c|n",dEN="Brave traveler, the centaurs have increased their attacks in this area. Freewind Post must know about this renewed harassment immediately! Seek Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post to the southeast and give him this urgent message.\n\nBe warned, avoid the Grimtotem Clan nearby... they have been acting strange toward us lately.",o="把紧急信件交给乱风岗的峭壁卫兵图林·长角。",oEN="Bring the Urgent Message to Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post.",p="你有什么事，$c？紧急通知？这是给我的？",pEN="What do you want, <class>? An urgent message - for me?",c="还有更多的坏消息！这些半人马太过分了！他们袭击了我的一个补给车队，一个活口都没留下。这是赤裸裸的暴行，他们一定会受到惩罚的！",cEN="More bad news! These centaurs have gone too far! They raided one of my supply caravans and slaughtered the whole party. This is an outrage, and it will not go unpunished!"}
Q[4561]={p="你拿出一份从安戈洛环形山取来的淤泥样本，把它分开放进了桌上的试管和烧杯里。溶液开始沸腾并猛烈地喷溅，淤泥的颜色渐渐发生了改变。当反应渐缓，溶液不再喷溅时，你看见培养皿中有净化过的安戈洛淤泥样本和其它的一些残留物。",pEN="You take a sample of slime from Un'Goro Crater and place some of it into the various tubes and beakers on the table. As things begin to boil and spurt, the slime changes colors. When the process slows down and the liquids calm, you see a small petri dish with your purified Un'Goro slime samples in it along with some other remnants.",c="你端起盛有淤泥样本的培养皿。要查看样本是否纯净的唯一方法就是打开培养皿，检查里面的物质成分。在理想状态下，你应该可以找到符合化学家弗雷要求的样本。",cEN="You pick up the petri dish with the slime sample in it. The only way to discern if the samples is pure enough is to open it and examine the contents yourself. Ideally you'll find a sample that fits Chemist Fuely's criteria."}
Q[4581]={d="德鲁伊凯尼斯·静风让人捎话过来说，他需要一份关于我们这边海岸和阿斯特兰纳附近森林的报告。他担心有一股堕落的力量正在靠近灰谷……也许他是正确的。\n\n给你，拿着我的报告。你可以在林歌神殿里找到他，就在东边的夜歌森林一带。",dEN="The druid Kayneth Stillwind sent word to me. He would like a report of the happenings along our coast and in the forests surrounding Astranaar. He fears there is a corruption moving through Ashenvale... and he may be right.\n\nHere, take my report to him. You will find him in the shrine of Forest Song, in the Nightsong Woods to the east.",o="把辛德瑞尔的便笺交给林歌神殿里的凯尼斯·静风。",oEN="Take Shindrell's Note to Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song.",p="你有什么要给我的吗？",pEN="Do you have something for me?",c="啊，辛德瑞尔的报告！非常感谢你，$n。辛德瑞尔是个不错的哨兵，她很勇敢，而且也很机敏。我必须要仔细阅读这封信，了解一下那股可能正在靠近灰谷的邪恶力量。",cEN="Ah, Shindrell's report! Many thanks, <name>. Shindrell is a fine sentinel, brave and keen. I must read this for clues of a wickedness I fear is moving through Ashenvale."}
Q[4601]={d="在那些坚守房间、抵御外面疯狂的侏儒中间，这台装置格外显眼。上面有一块铭牌写着\"闪亮机 5200\"，后面还有些文字：\n\n\"污垢和残渣毁了您宝贝的光泽？闪亮机 5200 让光泽重新闪耀！放入您想清洗的物品，并往投币口投入三枚银币。稍等片刻，瞧！您的贵重物品将焕然一新、光洁闪亮！\"",dEN="This contraption stands out amongst the gnomes holding out against the madness outside the room. A small plaque on the device reads \"The Sparklematic 5200\", followed by some text:\n\n\"Grime and residue ruining your sparklies? The Sparklematic 5200 puts the shine back in shine-tastic! Insert the item you wish to clean and deposit three silver coins in the coin slot. Give the Sparklematic 5200 a moment for operation, and voila! Your valuables will emerge clean and shiny!\"",o="将脏兮兮的东西放入超级清洁器5200型，记得要用三枚银币来启动机器。",oEN="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",p="似乎这个装置需要某种脏兮兮的东西和三枚银币才能运行。既然两样都有了，超级清洁器5200型应该开始运转了……",pEN="It would seem that the device needs some sort of grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to get the contraption working. So long as both are present, the Sparklematic 5200 should work...",c="将你找到的脏兮兮的东西和三枚银币放入超级清洁器5200型里面后，机器仿佛重获生命一般，疯狂地清理着那东西表面上的污垢，并发出响亮而剧烈的搅动声。它的金属外壳吱吱作响，发出吱吱呀呀的声音……",cEN="You insert the grime-encrusted item and three silver coins into the Sparklematic 5200. The machine surges to live in an almost frenzied attempt to purge the grime from the unknown item. Loud, violent churning sounds beat from the heart of the machine. The metal frame of the beast creaks and groans as it lurches from side to side..."}
Q[4602]={d="在一群抵挡着房外疯狂的侏儒当中，这台装置格外显眼。装置上有一块小铭牌，写着\"闪亮机5200\"，后面还有一些文字：\n\n\"污垢和残渣毁了你的宝贝？闪亮机5200让它们闪耀如新！放入你想清洁的物品，再往投币口投入三枚银币。让闪亮机5200运转片刻，瞧！你的贵重物品就会变得干净闪亮！\"",dEN="This contraption stands out amongst the gnomes holding out against the madness outside the room. A small plaque on the device reads \"The Sparklematic 5200\", followed by some text:\n\n\"Grime and residue ruining your sparklies? The Sparklematic 5200 puts the shine back in shine-tastic! Insert the item you wish to clean and deposit three silver coins in the coin slot. Give the Sparklematic 5200 a moment for operation, and voila! Your valuables will emerge clean and shiny!\"",o="将脏兮兮的东西放入超级清洁器5200型，记得要用三枚银币来启动机器。",oEN="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",p="似乎这个装置需要某种脏兮兮的东西和三枚银币才能运行。既然两样都有了，超级清洁器5200型应该开始运转了……",pEN="Insert a Grime-Encrusted Item into the Sparklematic 5200, and be sure to have three silver coins to start the machine.",c="装置上的一块小铭牌写着\"闪亮机5200\"，后面还有一些文字：\n\n\"污垢和残渣毁了你的宝贝？闪亮机5200让它们闪耀出奇妙的光彩！放入你想清洁的物品，再往投币口投入三枚银币。让闪亮机5200运转片刻，瞧！你的贵重物品就会变得干净闪亮。\"",cEN="This contraption stands out amongst the gnomes holding out against the madness outside the room. A small plaque on the device reads \"The Sparklematic 5200\", followed by some text:\n\n\"Grime and residue ruining your sparklies? The Sparklematic 5200 puts the shine back in shine-tastic! Insert the item you wish to clean and deposit three silver coins in the coin slot. Give the Sparklematic 5200 a moment for operation, and voila! Your valuables will emerge clean and shiny!\""}
Q[4603]={p="超级清洁器5200型等待着清理脏兮兮的东西，它需要三枚银币才能启动！",pEN="The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!",c="闪亮机 5200 一阵晃动地启动了。里面的侏儒清洁剂似乎在把机器内物品表面的污垢粉碎掉。\n\n机器以一声\"叮！\"停下，开口旋开，露出一只包得整整齐齐的小盒子。",cEN="The Sparklematic 5200 comes to life, lurching to and fro. Inside, the helpless grime that has encrusted the object placed within it is being pulverized by the machine's gnomish cleaning agent.\n\nThe Sparklematic 5200 comes to a halt, heralded by a familiar \"ding!\" The item receptacle of the machine spirals open, revealing a neatly wrapped box."}
Q[4604]={p="超级清洁器5200型等待着清理脏兮兮的东西，它需要三枚银币才能启动！",pEN="The Sparklematic 5200 is empty, awaiting a grime-encrusted object to clean and three silver coins to start!",c="闪亮机 5200 一阵晃动地启动了。里面的侏儒清洁剂似乎在把机器内物品表面的污垢粉碎掉。\n\n机器以一声\"叮！\"停下，开口旋开，露出一只包得整整齐齐的小盒子。",cEN="The Sparklematic 5200 comes to life, lurching to and fro. Inside, the helpless grime that has encrusted the object placed within it is being pulverized by the machine's gnomish cleaning agent.\n\nThe Sparklematic 5200 comes to a halt, heralded by a familiar \"ding!\" The item receptacle of the machine spirals open, revealing a neatly wrapped box."}
Q[4605]={c="机器就像启动时一样骤然停下。只听一声\"叮\"，机器的开口螺旋上升。闪亮机 5200 里面是一只系着蝴蝶结的小盒子。看来这台机器在去除污垢之后还会把物品包装起来。就算机器不灵，至少东西现在装在一个漂亮的盒子里了。\n\n好吧，要弄清它到底洗干净了没有，只有一个办法……",cEN="As quickly as it started, the Sparklematic 5200 comes to an abrupt halt. A simple \"ding\" is heard from the machine, and the mouth of the machine spirals upward. Inside the Sparklematic 5200 is a small box wrapped in a little bow. The machine would appear to wrap an object up after eliminating its grime-encrusted status. Even if the machine didn't work, at least the item is now wrapped in a pretty box.\n\nWell, there is one way to find out if it cleaned the item or not..."}
Q[4606]={c="机器就像启动时一样骤然停下。只听一声\"叮\"，机器的开口螺旋上升。闪亮机 5200 里面是一只系着蝴蝶结的小盒子。看来这台机器在去除污垢之后还会把物品包装起来。就算机器不灵，至少东西现在装在一个漂亮的盒子里了。\n\n好吧，要弄清它到底洗干净了没有，只有一个办法……",cEN="As quickly as it started, the Sparklematic 5200 comes to an abrupt halt. A simple \"ding\" is heard from the machine, and the mouth of the machine spirals upward. Inside the Sparklematic 5200 is a small box wrapped in a little bow. The machine would appear to wrap an object up after eliminating its grime-encrusted status. Even if the machine didn't work, at least the item is now wrapped in a pretty box.\n\nWell, there is one way to find out if it cleaned the item or not..."}
Q[4621]={d="听仔细了，海狗……正是藏宝海湾的势力让我们血帆海盗不能想去哪就去哪，不能想抢什么就抢什么。你要是能给舰队指挥官海角来上一刀，我们就再也不会撞上藏宝海湾的船。你要是能给雷维尔加兹男爵来上一刀，我们就再也不用面对法律——他们的法律。\n\n你要是想在我们中间当上$g:;海军上将，没错，海军上将，就照我说的给那两个家伙各来一刀。去吧，$g小子:丫头;，办完事回来见我。",dEN="Listen close, sea dawg... the powers of Booty Bay is what keeps us Bloodsail from sailing wheres we like and taking whats we want as rights o' plunder. Were ye to put a knife to Fleet Master Seahorn, we'd ne'er run afoul of a Booty Bay's vessel. Were ye to put a knife to Baron Revilgaz, we'd ne'er face the law on their terms.\n\nIf ye are to be an honorary admiral amongst us - yes, ADMIRAL, you'll puts a knife to both of 'em as I've says. Go now <lad /lass>, and return to me once ye does the deeds.",o="杀死藏宝海湾的舰队指挥官卡拉·海角和大财主里维加兹，然后回到荆棘谷海边的红雾号上去，向舰队指挥官菲尔拉伦复命。",oEN="Slay Fleet Master Seahorn and Baron Revilgaz of Booty Bay, and then return to Fleet Master Firallon aboard the Crimson Veil off the coast of Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你这么快就回来了，该死的旱鸭子！我吩咐的事办妥了吗？要是让我们失望，你就得走跳板了。\n\n啊啊啊……",pEN="Yer back already, ya blasted tar! Haves ye done as I've ordered? Fail us, and ye will be walkin' the plank.\n\nArrrrr...",c="向你致敬，舰队司令$n！你是海盗中的海盗，$g小伙子:姑娘！\n\n戴着这顶帽子吧。你在别的地方都不可能找到同样的帽子，所有看到你的人都会知道你就是血帆海军的舰队司令！",cEN="Avast ye... Admiral <name>! Yer a pirate of pirates, lass!\n\nIt warms the cackles of me heart to give ye this hat. Ye will ne'er find one like it anywheres, and all that gazes upon ye will see that yer an Admiral of the Bloodsail Navy!"}
Q[4641]={d="这一刻终于到来了，$n……为你以部落之名而战的时刻。为我们的酋长的荣耀而征服。\n\n是的……\n\n<卡尔图克打量着你。>\n\n你会干得很出色。\n\n我猜你正巴不得找条巨龙或者大恶魔，徒手把它掐死，不过也许从没那么……危险的东西开始会更明智。\n\n<卡尔图克笑了。>\n\n去找格内克吧。他能给你派个适合年轻$c的任务。你可以在西边的巢穴里找到他。|n",dEN="Finally, you are of age, <name>... of age to battle in the name of the Horde. To conquer for the glory of the Warchief.\n\nYes...\n\n<Kaltunk looks you over.>\n\nYou will do nicely.\n\nNo doubt you wish to find a great dragon or demon and strangle it with your bare hands, but perhaps it would be wise to start on something less... dangerous.\n\n<Kaltunk laughs.>\n\nReport to Gornek, he should be able to assign a task better suited to a young <class>. You will find Gornek in the Den, to the west.",o="与格内克交谈。你记得卡尔图克在地图上标出了他的位置，并提到格内克住在西边的一座建筑——巢穴里。|n|n",oEN="Speak with Gornek. You recall Kaltunk marking your map with his location and mentioning that Gornek resided in the Den, a building to the west.",p="蝎子的甲壳还没厚到能挡住一位坚定战士的力量。只要打击得坚决果断，蝎子应该不难对付。$c$g真的:真的;",pEN="The carapace of a scorpid isn't so thick that the strength of a determined warrior will be deterred. Strike strongly and without doubt, and the scorpids should prove easy prey.",c="又是卡尔图克招来的新兵，嗯？\n\n如果这已经是部落能拿出的最好货色，那情况可真是糟糕。不过没关系。等我们认为你可以离开试炼谷时，你会成为部落$g引以为傲:引以为傲;的$c。$g真的:真的;",cEN="Another one of Kaltunk's recruits, hm?\n\nA sorry state of affairs we find ourselves in if this is the best the Horde can produce. No matter. By the time we think you're ready to leave the Valley, you'll be a proud <class> of the Horde."}
Q[4642]={d="这里有一些你从费伍德森林收集的软泥怪样本。把它拿到安戈洛环形山去，在那里找到一个纯净的软泥怪……最原始的品种就可以了。当你离它够近的时候，倒出容器里的软泥怪，让我们看看这两种软泥怪之间会发生什么事情。\n\n当这个试验完成之后，把剩下来的东西交给我。我会在炼金房这里等你。",dEN="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely. When you get close enough, release the ooze in the case, and let us see what the two think of one another.\n\nAfter the experiment concludes, bring me a sample of whatever is left over. I will await you here in the Apothecarium.",o="把一块融合的软泥怪样本交给幽暗城的化学家弗雷。",oEN="Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",p="试验怎么样了，$n？我会继续研究你给我带回来的样本——我开始明白为什么希尔瓦娜斯会对这些生物如此感兴趣了。如果它们真是上古诸神的一部分，那么也许我们可以好好利用这些东西。",pEN="How goes the experiment, <name>? I will continue to study the samples you've recovered for me--I am starting to see why Lady Sylvanas is so interested in these creatures. If they are truly part of the Old Gods, then who knows how it can be used to our benefit.",c="哦，太好了，$n。这真是太好了。\n\n谁能想到这两样东西会进行这样的相互作用呢……我必须花更多的时间来研究这些生物产生变异的原因。\n\n我马上就开始继续我的研究。我们可能会很快再见面的，保重。",cEN="Oh, most excellent, <name>. This is most excellent.\n\nSuch a tale. Who would have thought the two would interact with one another in such a way... I will have to spend more time looking at the environmental issues that cause changes in these creatures.\n\nI will continue my research for now. Perhaps we will speak again soon. Until then, I wish you well."}
Q[4661]={p="你拿出一份从费伍德森林取来的淤泥样本，把它分开放进了桌上的试管和烧杯里。溶液开始沸腾并猛烈地喷溅，淤泥的颜色渐渐发生了改变。当反应渐缓，溶液不再喷溅时，你看见培养皿中有净化过的安戈洛淤泥样本和其它的一些残留物。",pEN="You take a sample of slime from Felwood and place some of it into the various tubes and beakers on the table. As things begin to boil and spurt, the slime changes colors. When the process slows down and the liquids calm, you see a small petri dish with your altered Felwood slime samples in it along with some other remnants.",c="你端起盛有淤泥样本的培养皿。要查看样本是否纯净的唯一方法就是打开培养皿，检查里面的物质成分。在理想状态下，你应该可以找到符合化学家弗雷要求的样本。",cEN="You pick up the petri dish with the slime sample in it. The only way to discern if the samples is pure enough is to open it and examine the contents yourself. Ideally you'll find a sample that fits Chemist Fuely's criteria."}
Q[4681]={d="黑海岸地区到处都是这种搁浅在海滩上的生物。它们大多出现在海岸线上，有一些甚至出现在海水中。我想让你调查另一只最近被发现的生物，据说它的尸体躺在奥伯丁西边的海水中，在一艘沉船附近。把你发现的任何有助于研究的信息都反馈给我。\n\n此外，在旅途中，你可能会发现其它搁浅的生物，你一定要把这些新发现也告诉我们！",dEN="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water. I would like for you to investigate another one that we know of; this one was reported to be in the water due west of Auberdine, close to a sunken vessel. Return to me with anything that you may recover that would aid our research.\n\nAlso, in your travels you may find other creatures. By all means, if you should discover anything then please bring it to our attention!",o="在奥伯丁西面海水中的海龟骸骨那里取回海龟残骸，然后与奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛谈一谈。",oEN="Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",p="在你调查了西边那片水域中的生物残骸之后，我就应该能向达纳苏斯的月神殿提交一份较为准确的报告了。然后我们再来研究一下，为什么这些不幸的生物会选择在黑海岸结束它们的生命。",pEN="Once you have investigated the creature's remains in the water to the west of here, I should be able to file a proper report with the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus. Perhaps then we will be closer to discovering the reason why these unfortunate creatures choose to end their lives beached on the coast of Darkshore.",c="今天你为我们提供了很大的帮助，这些生物选择在黑海岸结束生命，现在我们终于有机会解开这一谜团了。他们可能是从泰达希尔附近逃来这里的，这可是件麻烦事。如果你在旅途中见到了其他此类的生物，就请告知我，我们在这里的研究才刚刚开始。\n\n我谨代表月神殿，请你收下它作为回报。谢谢你，$n！",cEN="You've been a tremendous help here today; we now have a solid chance at unlocking the mystery of why these creatures choose to beach themselves on the cost of Darkshore. The idea that they might be fleeing the area around Teldrassil is disturbing. Should you come across others in your travels, please let me know. Our research here is but in its infancy.\n\nOn behalf of the Temple of the Moon, please accept this as thanks for the effort you have given. Thank you, <name>!"}
Q[4701]={d="你一定见过黑石兽人驱使的座狼。\n\n很奇怪——无论我们杀死多少，它们的数量似乎从不减少。据我的斥候报告，座狼是在黑石塔——黑石兽人的首都——繁育、训练并最终外销的。你必须前往黑石塔，查明这一威胁的源头。查明……然后摧毁。\n\n祝你好运，$n。愿塞纳留斯保佑你……|n",dEN="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command.\n\nIt is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle. My scouts have reported that the worgs are bred, trained, and ultimately exported from Blackrock Spire: capital city of the Blackrock orcs. You must travel to Blackrock Spire and discover the source of this menace. Discover... and destroy.\n\nGood luck, <name>. May Cenarius protect you...",o="到黑石塔去摧毁那里的座狼源头。当你离开的时候，赫林迪斯喊出了一个名字：哈雷肯。这个词就是兽人语中“座狼”的意思。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",p="你解决座狼的问题了吗？",pEN="Have you discovered and dealt with the source of the worg menace?",c="不要一直为她的死感到难过，$n。那头野兽已经堕落了——她是黑暗魔法的产物。你为联盟做出了杰出的贡献，你应该得到奖励。",cEN="Do not dwell upon her suffering, <name>. The beast was corrupt - a product of dark magic. You have done the Alliance a great service and you shall be rewarded."}
Q[4721]={d="从冬泉谷回来的信使报告说，冬泉谷南部区域有许多洞穴，而且这些洞穴周围似乎都有枭兽出没。如果说它们是在守护某种重要的东西，那么我相信这就是我们要搜查的地区。\n\n这次的任务比上一个任务更富有挑战性，$n。如果这些生物拼尽全力守护的东西被发现的话，它们会变得非常疯狂而暴躁。",dEN="Runners have returned from Winterspring with reports that there is a series of small caves in the southern area of Winterspring. It seems that there are wildkin situated in the area around these caves. If there is something valuable that they are guarding, I believe that this is the place we will find it.\n\nYou will find these to be more of a challenge than the previous types, <name>. The creatures seem to have gone mad from exposure to the very thing that they strive to protect.",o="费伍德森林的特鲁尔·法贝恩要你去冬泉谷猎杀10头狂暴枭兽。",oEN="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to hunt 10 Berserk Owlbeasts in Winterspring.",p="你知道自己该做什么，$n。",pEN="You know your orders, <name>.",c="努力工作是我最敬佩的品质，$n。现在我们可以继续进行在冬泉谷的计划了。",cEN="Hard work is something I have great respect for, <name>. Now we can move forward with our plans for Winterspring."}
Q[4722]={d="你找到一具海龟的尸体，它显然是不久之前搁浅在黑海岸的，而且早已被住在周围的灰雾鱼人吃得一干二净了。不过，剩下的残骸也足够让你取样并送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里去了。",dEN="You find a corpse of a sea turtle that had beached itself on the coast of Darkshore some time ago. It has been scavenged by the murlocs who have encamped themselves around the creature's remains. Still, there appear to be some suitable samples left on the creature's remains that Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine might be able to make use of.",o="把海龟的残骸交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Turtle Remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="你好，$n，你有没有发现什么被冲到海岸上的尸体？",pEN="Hello <name> - do you have any discoveries of creatures that have washed ashore to report on?",c="又一个可供我们研究的新发现——干得好，$n！达纳苏斯那边会对这些残骸进行仔细的研究。请收下这个作为你的回报。",cEN="Another discovery for us to research - well done <name>! These remains will be properly studied once they get to Darnassus. Please accept this small honorarium in exchange for the remains you have provided for our study."}
Q[4723]={d="一头巨型蛇颈龙的尸体——它比你预想的还要大很多——躺在薄雾海的海岸上。这个生物是怎么到这里的，你无从得知。成群的鱼人正在分食它的尸体，那些鱼人看上去是如此渺小，它们完全是依靠数量才将这头巨兽搞定的。\n\n虽然尸体已经被吃掉了大半，但是剩下的也足够让你取样并送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里去了。",dEN="The remains of a giant thresher - much larger than one you'd expect to find in Darkshore - lie beached on the coast of the Mist's Edge. How this creature came to be here is unknown; the group of murlocs that now feast off the carcass of it seem to be much too weak, even in large numbers, to have brought down the beast.\n\nWhile some of it has been picked clean, enough of it remains to take a sample for Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine to study.",o="把海洋生物的骸骨交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="也许有一天我们能找到办法，阻止这些可怜的生物在黑海岸以如此悲惨而无谓的方式结束生命。在那之前，我们必须继续研究！\n\n你好，$n——有什么消息吗？",pEN="Perhaps one day we'll find a means to prevent these poor creatures from ending their lives needlessly on the coast of Darkshore. Until then, we must continue our research!\n\nGreetings <name> - what news do you bring?",c="又一项发现——干得好，$n！这些遗骸送到达纳苏斯后会得到妥善研究。请收下这份微薄的酬劳，作为你为我们研究提供遗骸的回报。",cEN="Another discovery - well done <name>! These remains will be properly studied once they get to Darnassus. Please accept this small honorarium in exchange for the remains you have provided for our study."}
Q[4724]={d="有些人说黑石兽人控制的座狼是由超自然的力量创造的。另一些人说其实它们并不是座狼，而是一种恶魔犬，是由一个堕落的深渊领主赐予兽人的。\n\n事实上，真相并没有这样夸张，但是同样很吓人。哈雷肯是一头巨型母座狼。她的配偶？没有人能活着回来描述他的样子。\n\n打击座狼的关键就在于杀掉哈雷肯……另外，$n，时刻小心你的背后。",dEN="Some say the worg controlled by the Blackrock orcs are the creation of a supernatural force. Others say they are not true worg but instead a breed of demon dog, granted to the orcs by a fallen pit lord.\n\nThe truth is far less contrived but every bit as frightening. The worg of Blackrock come from Halycon and her mate. Halycon is the gigantic den mother of the worg. Her mate? Nobody has ever lived to tell the tale of that one.\n\nStrike at the heart of the worg. Destroy Halycon... and <name>, watch your back.",o="杀死血斧座狼的领袖，哈雷肯。",oEN="Slay Halycon, pack mistress of the Bloodaxe worg.",p="只要那头母狼被干掉，我们就可以削弱黑石塔中的座狼，然后设法进入那座要塞。",pEN="With the pack mistress slain, we can begin to thin out the worg sentries of the Spire and eventually make some headway into the city.",c="疯狂的座狼？“奴役者”基兹卢尔？你居然能活着回来告诉我这个故事？！太难以置信了！你将赢得丰厚的奖赏！",cEN="Rabid pups? Gizrul the Slavener? And you live to tell the tale?! Incredible! A tribute well earned!"}
Q[4725]={d="还有更多的海龟尸体躺在海岸线上。这一具尸体的龟壳上还有个废弃的车架。也许这个生物是被某种未知的力量赶到了海岸上，而不是像别的尸体那样自己爬上海岸。强大的灰雾鱼人正聚集在尸体附近并蚕食着它。\n\n你在车架中找到了一只有着奇怪标志的箱子，也许奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛会对它有所了解。",dEN="More sea turtle remains lie beached along the coastline. This particular set has an abandoned carriage attached to the turtle's shell. Perhaps this creature was driven to the shoreline by unknown beings rather than beaching itself as some of the other remains suggested. Greymist murlocs now make the remains of this creature their home, feasting off the carrion.\n\nIn the carriage, you find a box with strange markings on it; perhaps Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine can make sense of it.",o="把有奇怪标记的箱子交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Strangely Marked Box to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="很高兴再见到你，$n。我们正在努力找寻巨型海洋动物纷纷在黑海岸搁浅的原因，但是似乎只要我们有一点进展，就会陷入更大的谜团中。\n\n你有什么可以对我们的研究有所帮助的新消息吗？",pEN="It is a pleasure to see you again, <name>. We are making great strives in uncovering the mystery of why majestic sea creatures beach themselves on the Darkshore coastline, but with every question answered, two more are raised it seems.\n\nAre you here to offer us more aid in our research?",c="我听说过在海龟背上有车架这种事情。我相信这些都是纳迦的车架，他们用它来为作战服务，以及向陆地上运送物品。你找到的箱子上的标志也是纳迦的，这也许可以解释为什么最近在黑海岸北边会出现大量的纳迦。\n\n我准备把这只箱子和你发现的其它东西都送到达纳苏斯去。这个是给你的——再次感谢你的帮助。",cEN="I have heard of the kinds of carriages found on the back of the turtle you found. Those I do believe are naga carriages, used both in battle and in transportation of their supplies on to land. The markings on the box you found are of the naga; this would explain their invasive presence in far-northern Darkshore.\n\nI will send this box to Darnassus along with the rest of your discoveries. This is for you - thank you again for your assistance."}
Q[4726]={d="我几个星期来都在研究燃烧平原的龙类，而且我终于有所突破了！我制作了一个装置——我把它叫做“龙灵采集器900型”，它可以采集雏龙的精华！\n\n好吧，至少我认为它可以实现这个功能。\n\n给你，拿着这个装置，然后到燃烧平原上去采集雏龙精华。首先使用它标记雏龙，然后再杀死被标记的雏龙，这样你就可以采集雏龙精华了。\n\n如果一切正常的话，那就太棒了！把你采集的东西带回来供我进行研究！",dEN="I have been studying the dragonkin of the Burning Steppes for weeks, and I think I've finally had a breakthrough! I created a device--I call it the Draco Incarcinatrix 900. It can capture the essence of dragon whelp broodlings!\n\nOr, at least I think it can.\n\nHere, take the device and zap a broodling in the Burning Steppes with it. While it's under the device's effects, defeat the broodling and its essence should be released.\n\nIf it is, then splendid! Bring me back samples so I can study them!",o="将龙灵采集器900型和8份雏龙精华交给燃烧平原烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波尔。",oEN="Bring 8 Broodling Essence and the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 to Tinkee Steamboil at the Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.",p="你拿到小龙精华了吗，$n？我想要尽快开始研究它。\n\n除此之外……别让我的赞助人失望。",pEN="Do you have the broodling essence, <name>? I can't wait to study it.\n\nAnd besides that... my patron is not the type of person you want to disappoint.",c="它起作用了！你拿到精华了！干得好，$n！干得好！\n\n这些精华在我的研究中将起到至关重要的作用。我希望有一天能研究出捕捉活的幼龙或者拿到龙蛋的方法。如果我成功了，我就会成为全世界的龙类学术泰斗！\n\n我的雇主也会很高兴的，就如我以前所说的那样，你最好一直保持他处于高兴状态……",cEN="It worked! You got the essence! Well done, <name>! Well done!\n\nThis essence will be invaluable in my research. I hope to one day learn how to capture living dragon whelps, or perhaps capture their eggs. If I could find a way to do that, then I would be the envy of dragon scholars around the world!\n\nMy employer would also be happy, and as I said before, he's someone you want to keep happy..."}
Q[4727]={d="一只海龟的骸骨躺在黑海岸北部的沙滩上。也许灰雾鱼人没有发现它的尸体，或者由于某些特殊的原因而没有去碰它。不管怎么样，这具尸体上有足够的海龟肉，你可以采集一些作为样本，并把它送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里，供月神殿进行研究。",dEN="The skeletal remains of a sea turtle lie in the sand of the northern Darkshore beaches. The Greymist murlocs have either not found this carcass, or perhaps they have and are shying away from it for some unknown reason. Regardless, there is enough of the turtle left to take a sample back to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine for the Temple of the Moon to study.",o="把海龟的残骸交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Turtle Remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="又见面了，$n——你有没有再发现其他搁浅的生物，是月神殿应该知道的？",pEN="Hello once again <name> - have you found any more beached creatures that the Temple of the Moon should know about?",c="鱼人竟然不在现场，这很有意思……我们在研究这具生物遗骸时会记住这一点！谢谢你的努力，$n；月神殿希望我把这个交给你，作为占用你时间的补偿。",cEN="It is interesting that the murlocs were not present at this site; we will keep this in mind as we study this creature's remains! Thank you for your effort, <name>; the Temple of the Moon would like for me to give you this, as compensation for your time."}
Q[4728]={d="某种海中巨兽的尸体搁浅在了海滩上，一只带着轮子的木桶和其它一些杂七杂八的工具散布在这头巨兽旁边，看来曾经有什么人想要研究它。虽然这具尸体被鱼人吃得差不多只剩骨头了，但是剩下的残骸也足够让你取样并送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里去。",dEN="The corpse of what appears to be some sort of giant sea mammal lies partially gutted on the beach. A wheelbarrow and various tools lie abandoned by this enormous beached sea creature, as though an attempt to study it had been made previously. Though murlocs have scavenged this beast, enough of it remains to gather a suitable sample for Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",o="把海洋生物的骸骨交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="很高兴再次见到你，$n！是什么风把你吹回奥伯丁的？你来这里是不是有什么新的发现要报告给我们？",pEN="Greetings once again, <name>! What brings you back to Auberdine? Are you here to report on another discovery, perhaps?",c="啊，我相信你发现的是以前被探险者协会检查过的那具尸体。他们来过这里，还提到了在研究一具尸体的时候被一群鱼人追击的事情。看来你成功地完成了我们都没能完成的事情。请你收下这个，月神殿感谢你。",cEN="Ah, I believe you discovered one that was originally being examined by the Explorer's League. They have a presence here in Darkshore, and they had mentioned that they were studying one of the beached creatures until they were chased out by the murlocs. You appear to have succeeded where we both have not. Please - accept this honorarium on behalf of the Temple of the Moon."}
Q[4729]={d="你大概在想我在这儿干什么。看看这些笼子！还不明显吗？\n\n首先，我是个动物爱好者，但职业上是个商人。我为富贵名流寻找珍奇动物，并把它们驯化得像正常的宠物一样乖巧。\n\n现在你大概又会想，\"我能为你做什么呢，基布勒？\"答案很简单：带上这个兽笼，给我找几只座狼幼崽来。办到了，我就给你驯化一头座狼！",dEN="You're probably wondering what I'm doing out here. Look at the cages! Ain't it obvious?\n\nI'm an animal lover, first and foremost, but a salesman by trade. I track down exotic animals for the rich and famous and domesticate the beasts so they behave as proper pets.\n\nNow you're probably wondering, \"What can I do for you, Kibler.\" The answer is simple: Take this here beast cage and find me some worg pups. For that, I'll domesticate a worg for you!",o="到黑石塔去找到血斧座狼幼崽。使用笼子来捕捉这些凶猛的小野兽，然后把笼中的座狼幼崽交给基布雷尔。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Bloodaxe Worg Pups. Use the cage to carry the ferocious little beasts. Bring back a Caged Worg Pup to Kibler.",p="基布雷尔正在和奥普斯激烈地争执着。>",pEN="<Kibler is busy arguing with Toucan Stan.>",c="你抓到它们的时机真是恰如其分，$n。如果再晚几天的话，它们就不可能被驯服了！给我一分钟，我就可以帮你把这只小座狼驯化好。",cEN="You got 'em at the perfect time, <name>. Any later and they'd be untrainable! Gimmie a minute and I'll have the little fella ready for you to take home."}
Q[4730]={d="这具已经被吃掉一半的尸体看来是一头海洋巨兽。尸体躺在海岸上，一群比奥伯丁那里的同类更加强大的鱼人聚在周围大嚼大咽，不过残留的尸体应该足够让你取样并送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里去了。",dEN="The half-devoured corpse of what might have been a giant sea mammal lies on the beach. A band of murlocs, stronger than those found closer to Auberdine, have taken up residence around the fallen creature. Enough of the creature remains that a suitable sample of its bones could be delivered to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",o="把海洋生物的骸骨交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="很高兴再次见到你，$n！是什么风把你吹回奥伯丁的？你来这里是不是有什么新的发现要报告给我们？",pEN="Hello again, <name>! Are you here to report on another discovery?",c="你带来的骨头属于栖息在泰达希尔底部周边海域的温和海洋哺乳动物。以前从未有记录显示它们会像蓟鱼一样猛烈地冲上沙滩。它们为什么要这样做呢？也许研究它们的遗骸能带给我们所寻求的知识。\n\n再次感谢你的帮助。请收下月神殿给你的这份酬劳。",cEN="The bones you have are from gentle sea mammals that are known to inhabit the waters surrounding the base of Teldrassil. They had never been known to violently beach themselves like the threshers had been known to. Why would these creatures do this, I wonder? Well, perhaps the study of their remains will bear the fruits of knowledge that we seek.\n\nAgain, thank you for your aid. Please accept this honorarium from the Temple of the Moon."}
Q[4731]={d="又一具海龟的尸体躺在海岸线上，龟壳上还有个废弃的车架。也许这个生物是被某种未知的力量赶到了海岸上，而不是像别的尸体那样自己爬上海岸。强大的灰雾鱼人正聚集在尸体附近并蚕食着它。\n\n你在车架中找到了一只有着奇怪标志的箱子，也许奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛会对它有所了解。",dEN="Another set of sea turtle remains lie beached on the coastline. This set of remains has an abandoned carriage half buckled to the turtle's shell. Perhaps this creature was driven to the shoreline by unknown beings rather than beaching itself as some of the other remains suggested. Powerful Greymist murlocs have made the carcass of this creature their current home.\n\nIn the carriage, you find a box with strange markings on it; perhaps Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine can make sense of it.",o="把有奇怪标记的箱子交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Strangely Marked Box to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="又见面了，$n。你为月神殿做的工作非常出色。我们还能有幸得到你更多的帮助吗？",pEN="Hello again, <name>. The work you have done on behalf of the Temple of the Moon has been outstanding. Are we to be blessed with more of your effort on our behalf?",c="我听说过在海龟背上有车架这种事情。我相信这些都是纳迦的车架，他们用它来为作战服务，以及向陆地上运送物品。你找到的箱子上的标志也是纳迦的，这也许可以解释为什么最近在黑海岸北边会出现大量的纳迦。\n\n我准备把这只箱子和你发现的其它东西都送到达纳苏斯去。这个是给你的——再次感谢你的帮助。",cEN="I have heard of the kinds of carriages found on the back of that turtle. Those I do believe are naga carriages, used both in battle and in transportation of their supplies on to land. The markings on the box you found are of the naga; perhaps the creature you discovered was killed as it was heading further south... to Ashenvale maybe?\n\nI will be sure to send this box to Darnassus with the rest of your discoveries. This is for you - thank you again for your assistance."}
Q[4732]={d="你找到一具海龟的尸体，它显然是不久之前搁浅在黑海岸的，而且早已被住在周围的灰雾鱼人吃得一干二净了。不过，剩下的残骸也足够让你取样并送到奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛那里去了。",dEN="You find a corpse of a sea turtle that had beached itself on the coast of Darkshore some time ago. It has been picked nearly clean by Greymist murlocs, the very ones who now have encamped themselves around the creature's remains. Still, there appear to be some suitable samples left on the creature's remains that Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine might be able to make use of.",o="把海龟的残骸交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Turtle Remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="你好，$n，你有没有发现什么被冲到海岸上的尸体？",pEN="Greetings once again <name> - do you have any more discoveries to report to the Temple of the Moon?",c="你又发现了更多搁浅的生物吗，$n？海龟在诺达希尔被摧毁之前，常在它的底部嬉戏。可随着泰达希尔的诞生，这些生物已越来越少见了。我们发现，其中一些因某种未知的原因在此结束了生命。\n\n有你的帮助，或许我们就能揭开眼前的谜团。请收下这个，作为你为我们研究提供遗骸的回报。",cEN="You've found even more beached creatures, <name>? Sea turtles were commonly found frolicking along the base of Nordrassil before it was destroyed. With the birth of Teldrassil, however, these creatures have been seen in ever decreasing numbers. Some, as we have discovered, end their lives here for some unknown reason.\n\nYour aid will perhaps unlock the mystery before us. Please accept this in exchange for the remains you have provided for our study."}
Q[4733]={d="一只像是巨型蓟鱼的生物遗骸被冲上了暮色海岸多岩的小海湾。这只蓟鱼比这一带常见的蓟鱼大出好几倍。无论它来自何处，这只生物似乎都不是黑海岸的原生物种。虽然它已被啃食得残缺不全，剩下的部分也足够收集一份合适的样本，交给奥伯丁的格温妮丝·布莱雷冈德。",dEN="The remains of what appear to be a giant thresher have washed ashore on the rocky inlet of the Twilight Shore. The thresher is several times larger than any of the other threshers spotted in these parts. Wherever it came from, this creature would not seem to have been native to Darkshore.\n\nThough the creature has been picked apart in places, enough of it remains to gather a suitable sample for Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",o="把海洋生物的骸骨交给奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛。",oEN="Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.",p="很高兴再次见到你，$n！是什么风把你吹回奥伯丁的？你来这里是不是有什么新的发现要报告给我们？",pEN="Thanks be to Elune - I am glad to see you again, dear <name>. The Temple of the Moon's work on the strange beaching phenomena continues here in Darkshore. Might you have anything additional to offer us?",c="你提到的这只蓟鱼的尺寸简直令人难以置信。这一带最年长的蓟鱼也只能长到它的一小部分大小。泰达希尔附近曾有一些更大的，但它们的数量一直在减少。我不禁在想，这些冲上沙滩的生物是否与此有关。\n\n我们会分析你带来的骨头。在此期间，请代表月神殿收下这份心意。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="The dimensions of the thresher you mention are mind-boggling. Even the eldest of the threshers in this region grow to only a fraction of that size. While some larger ones were known to be close to Teldrassil, their numbers have declined steadily. I cannot help but wonder if these creatures beaching themselves here are somehow related to this.\n\nWhile we analyze the bones you have brought us, please accept this on behalf of the Temple of the Moon. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[4734]={d="$n，我一直都在忙着准备我的新装置，龙蛋冷冻器！这个装置可以对黑龙蛋喷出极冷的气流……然后就把蛋冻住了！你能不能帮我测试一下？\n\n我听说在黑石塔的高处，黑龙有个专门的地方来孵化它们的蛋。你可以在那里对它进行测试，然后告诉我效果如何！\n\n不要担心。被冻住的蛋是不会对你造成危害的。你所要担心的只是那些没有被冻住的而已！",dEN="<name>, I've been working hard on a new device, the eggscilloscope! It's designed to project a burst of cold energy at the egg of a black dragon... and freeze it solid! Can you test it for me?\n\nI heard that high up in Blackrock Spire, the dragons have a rookery where they hatch their eggs. That's where you'll have to go to test the eggscilloscope, and then let me know how it worked!\n\nAnd don't worry. Frozen dragon eggs should be harmless. It's the unfrozen ones you have to worry about!",o="在孵化间对着某颗龙蛋使用龙蛋冷冻器初号机。",oEN="Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery of Blackrock Spire.",p="$n，你测试过龙蛋冷冻器了吗？",pEN="<name>, did you test the eggscilloscope?",c="成功了？太好了！我就知道它行的！\n\n在你离开的这段时间里，我制造了一个新的龙蛋冷冻器，它比以前那个版本的射程更远。\n\n拿着吧，如果你再去黑石塔的话会用得到它。",cEN="It worked? Splendid! I knew it would!\n\nWhile you were gone I was working on a new version of the eggscilloscope. This one has a much longer range.\n\nHere, you can have one in case you go back to Blackrock Spire."}
Q[4735]={d="$n，我终于做好采集真正龙蛋的准备了！给你，拿着这个电动采集模块，它可以萃取龙蛋精华并使你可以很方便地运输龙蛋。回到孵化间去，用这个东西来收集龙蛋。\n\n不要忘了把它们先冰冻起来，不然的话，在你开始收集之前龙蛋就会孵化！\n\n当你收集到足够的龙蛋之后，就把它们交给我！",dEN="<name>, I'm finally ready for real samples of dragon eggs! Here, take this collectronic module. It's designed to extract a dragon egg and prepare it for transport. Go back to the Rookery and use the module to collect eggs.\n\nAnd don't forget to freeze them first, or they might hatch before you can collect them!\n\nWhen you have enough eggs, bring them to me!",o="将电动采集模块和8颗收集到的龙蛋交给燃烧平原烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波尔。",oEN="Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.",p="你拿到蛋了吗，$n？我的赞助人听说你在帮我收集龙蛋，他很想亲手摸到那些蛋！",pEN="Do you have the eggs, <name>? My patron heard you were collecting them for me, and is very eager to get his hands on them!",c="哇，你成功了！电动采集模组成功了！我真是个天才！\n\n谢谢你，$n。我的赞助人会很高兴能拿到这些蛋的……",cEN="Wow, you got them! The collectronic module worked! I'm a genius!\n\nThank you, <name>. My patron will be very pleased to get these eggs..."}
Q[4736]={d="啊，你好，$n。你的训练进行得很顺利，所以我想你应该因自己的辛勤努力——以及你至今仍未被魔法的力量腐蚀——而获得奖励。\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，就到棘齿城去找梅纳拉·沃伦德。她在斯坦哈德的塔里俯瞰着整个小镇。\n\n她并不是很友好，$n，所以你可别想从她那里得到什么赞许。但是如果你努力的话，那她一定会好好照顾你的。",dEN="Ah, hello, <name>. You're progressing well in your training. So well in fact that I think you should be rewarded for your hard work--and for not becoming corrupted by the arcane yet.\n\nIf you're interested, seek out Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. She is currently staying at Strahad Farsan's tower overlooking the town.\n\nShe's not very friendly, <name>, so don't expect any praise. But if you work hard, she'll make sure you're taken care of.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，是荆棘草派你来的。很好。看来消息传得够远，能找到未来的学生了。这让我很高兴。\n\n我们这一族向来如此，$n，不论种族都会聚在一起。这尤其重要，因为与我们打交道最多的那些家伙，若我们不能适当地安抚或控制他们，他们的恶意可不会区分对象。\n\n我觉得你已经学到了很多东西，如果你$g愿意:愿意;，我可以帮你制作一些工具，来补足你的能力。",cEN="Ah, Briarthorn sent you. Good. Then word does reach far enough to find future students. This pleases me.\n\nIt is typical of our kind, <name>, to band together, regardless of race. It is especially important since those we deal with most do not discriminate in their malice if we fail to appease them or control them properly.\n\nI feel you've learned a great many things, and if you are willing, I would help you create tools to compliment your skills."}
Q[4737]={d="哼……你还在努力让自己变得更强，$g真的:真的;，$g真的:真的;。我说过，腐化和瘾癖迟早会攫住你，让你沦为你想支配之物的奴隶。\n\n呸！真是个$g蠢货:蠢货;！时间会证明我是对的，仅此而已……就让时间来说话吧。\n\n不过看样子，并不是所有人都同意泽弗罗斯特。看来梅纳拉制作了一些工具，能让你获得更强的力量，更好地驾驭你的实力。如果你有兴趣，就去贫瘠之地的棘齿城。她就在那座俯瞰全镇的塔上。",dEN="Hmph, still you strive to become more powerful. I say it's only time before the corruption and addiction takes hold of you and you become a slave to that which you seek to gain power over.\n\nPfah! A fool you are! Time will prove me right--nothing else... just time.\n\nBut it seems that not all agree with Zevrost. It seems Menara would create tools for you to become more powerful and to harness your strength. If you're interested, then go to Ratchet in the Barrens. She is there overlooking the town.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，是泽弗罗斯特派你来的。很好。看来消息传得够远，能找到未来的学生了。这让我很高兴。\n\n我们这一族向来如此，$n，不论种族都会聚在一起。这尤其重要，因为与我们打交道最多的那些家伙，若我们不能适当地安抚或控制他们，他们的恶意可不会区分对象。\n\n我觉得你已经学到了很多东西，如果你$g愿意:愿意;，我可以帮你制作一些工具，来补足你的能力。",cEN="Ah, Zevrost sent you. Good. Then word does reach far enough to find future students. This pleases me.\n\nIt is typical of our kind, <name>, to band together, regardless of race. It is especially important since those we deal with most do not discriminate in their malice if we fail to appease them or control them properly.\n\nI feel you've learned a great many things, and if you are willing, I would help you create tools to compliment your skills."}
Q[4738]={d="让我们把话说清楚，$n：我认为你还没$g准备好:准备好;承担这样的责任。我不认为帮助制作任何一件强大物品是新手该参与的事，尤其是像你这样未经考验的新手。\n\n但这不是我能决定的。那些掌权者，或者说至少那些愿意把这样的礼物传给你的人，才能做这个决定。\n\n如果你有兴趣了解更多，我建议你去棘齿城找梅纳拉·虚空行者。她通常待在那座俯瞰港口小镇的塔上。",dEN="Let us be clear about one thing, <name>: I don't feel you are ready for such responsibilities. I don't think aiding in the creation of any item of power is something a novice should ever be involved in; especially one so untested.\n\nBut that's not my decision. The powers that be, or at least the ones that do wish to impart such gifts upon you get to decide that.\n\nIf you're interested in learning more, I suggest you seek out Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. She usually resides in the tower above the port town.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，是德米赛特派你来的。很好。看来消息传得够远，能找到未来的学生了。这让我很高兴。\n\n我们这一族向来如此，$n，不论种族都会聚在一起。这尤其重要，因为与我们打交道最多的那些家伙，若我们不能适当地安抚或控制他们，他们的恶意可不会区分对象。\n\n我觉得你已经学到了很多东西，如果你$g愿意:愿意;，我可以帮你制作一些工具，来补足你的能力。",cEN="Ah, Demisette sent you. Good. Then word does reach far enough to find future students. This pleases me.\n\nIt is typical of our kind, <name>, to band together, regardless of race. It is especially important since those we deal with most do not discriminate in their malice if we fail to appease them or control them properly.\n\nI feel you've learned a great many things, and if you are willing, I would help you create tools to compliment your skills."}
Q[4739]={d="$C！对，就是你！\n\n你还没有配齐全套行头，但一眼就能看出你已经准备好了——你周围的气场透着更强的自信，$g真的:真的;。没错，我现在看出来了。\n\n如果你觉得自己准备好了，梅纳拉·虚空行者会教你几手。她把时间都花在教导年轻的奥术学生上。她甚至会给通过她考验的人送礼物。\n\n有兴趣的话就去贫瘠之地的棘齿城吧。她就在城里，斯坦哈德那座俯瞰全城的塔上。$g真的:真的;$g真的:真的;",dEN="<class>! Yes, you!\n\nYou don't have all the accoutrements, but it's plain to see you're ready--the air around you exudes greater confidence. Yes, I see it now.\n\nMenara Voidrender would teach you a few things if you feel you're ready. She spends her time tutoring younger students in the arcane. She even gives gifts to those who pass her tests.\n\nGo to Ratchet in the Barrens if you're interested. She's above the city in Strahad's tower.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，是卡尔派你来的。很好。看来消息传得够远，能找到未来的学生了。这让我很高兴。\n\n我们这一族向来如此，$n，不论种族都会聚在一起。这尤其重要，因为与我们打交道最多的那些家伙，若我们不能适当地安抚或控制他们，他们的恶意可不会区分对象。\n\n我觉得你已经学到了很多东西，如果你$g愿意:愿意;，我可以帮你制作一些工具，来补足你的能力。",cEN="Ah, Kaal sent you. Good. Then word does reach far enough to find future students. This pleases me.\n\nIt is typical of our kind, <name>, to band together, regardless of race. It is especially important since those we deal with most do not discriminate in their malice if we fail to appease them or control them properly.\n\nI feel you've learned a great many things, and if you are willing, I would help you create tools to compliment your skills."}
Q[4740]={d="注意！\n\n现悬赏通缉鱼人\"泥沼深\"的项上人头。这头肮脏的野兽至少要为一名哨兵的死亡负责，并涉嫌在黑海岸水域弄沉了至少两艘货船！\n\n泥沼深最后一次出现在奥伯丁以南的一处鱼人窝棚营地，据信它正守护着那里的窝棚。欲领取赏金者，请前往奥伯丁与哨兵格琳达·纳尔希亚联系。\n\n奥伯丁村议会",dEN="Attention!\n\nA reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep.\" This foul beast is known to be responsible for the death of at least one Sentinel, and is suspected of causing the sinking of at least two cargo vessels in the waters off Darkshore!\n\nMurkdeep was last spotted at a hutted murloc camp south of Auberdine, and is thought to be protecting the huts there. Reward claims for this bounty should be claimed with Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.\n\nThe Auberdine Village Council",o="找到并杀死名为莫克迪普的鱼人。它守护着位于奥伯丁南部海岸的鱼人营地。\n\n向奥伯丁的哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩报告莫克迪普的死讯。",oEN="Find and slay the murloc known as Murkdeep. The creature is thought to be defending the murloc huts south of Auberdine along the water.\n\nReport the death of Murkdeep to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",p="你好，$c——今天哨兵部队能为你提供什么帮助吗？你是来询问 有关莫克迪普的赏金事宜的吗？",pEN="Greetings <class> - what may the Sentinels assist you with today? Perhaps you are here to inquire about the bounty on Murkdeep?",c="哎呀，看来你来这里可不只是打听消息的！市民们知道今晚能睡得更安稳些，一定会非常高兴。\n\n你今天为奥伯丁的人民执行了正义，$n。为此，我想把这份东西作为合适的奖赏送给你……你是奥伯丁人民$g真正的英雄:真正的英雄;。",cEN="Well, looks like you're here to more than just inquire! The citizens will be delighted to know that tonight they will sleep a little bit more soundly and safer.\n\nYou've acted as the executioner of justice for the people of Auberdine today, <name>. For that, I would like to offer you this as a suitable reward... for a true hero of the Auberdine people."}
Q[4741]={d="冬泉谷北部区域的枭兽更加凶残，我们必须在那儿继续采取主动。\n\n猎杀冬泉谷中的月光枭兽，并探察他们居住的区域。\n\n那里是非常危险的地区，但是我知道你可以面对这样的挑战。当你杀死十三头枭兽之后就回到我这里来。",dEN="In the northern areas of Winterspring, the Wildkin grow even more ferocious. We must continue our measures there.\n\nHunt the moontouched owlbeasts in Winterspring, and explore the area they inhabit.\n\nThis is dangerous ground, but I know that you will be able to handle the challenge. Return to me after you have slain 13 of the wildkin.",o="费伍德森林的特鲁尔·法贝恩要你去冬泉谷猎杀13头月光枭兽。",oEN="Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to hunt 13 Moontouched Owlbeasts.",p="别告诉我你太$g害怕:害怕;了！快动手！",pEN="Don't tell me that you're too scared! Get going!",c="我感觉你是在享受任务。并且，我相信我们对此处的事物心中有数。",cEN="I sense that you are enjoying your work. And I believe that we are onto something here."}
Q[4742]={d="正如你所见的一样，这个简单的印章有三个洞。每个洞都必须用代表领导力的宝石来填满。最终，下层要塞的领主维姆萨拉克会使用黑龙的火焰来铸造这个印章。\n\n你一定要明白，下层要塞的三个将军并不总是随身带着命令宝石，你必须在执行任务的时候务必保持谨慎。一定要完成这个任务！",dEN="As you can see, the unadorned seal has three empty sockets. Each of those sockets must be filled with a gemstone representing the leadership's command. Finally, Overlord Wyrmthalak, master of the lower citadel, must forge the seal in the flames of the Black Dragonflight.\n\nUnderstand this, mortal: the chance that one of the three generals of the lower citadel would carry a gemstone at any given time is rare. You must be vigilant in your quest. Remain determined!",o="找到三颗统御宝石：燃棘宝石、尖石宝石和血斧宝石。把它们连同未装饰的要塞印章一起交给维兰。\n\n正如维兰告诉你的，那三位将军分别是：燃棘氏族的战争大师沃恩、尖石氏族的高阶领主奥莫克，以及血斧氏族的霸主维姆萨拉克。",oEN="Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of the Spire, to Vaelan.\n\nThe Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak of the Bloodaxe.",p="勇气与耐心高于一切，$n！",pEN="Courage and patience above all else, <name>!",c="<维埃兰的影像模糊了一下。>\n\n<你所收集的东西都消失了。>\n\n未铸造的晋升徽印已经准备就绪，该进行最后一步了。",cEN="<Vaelan's image blurs for a moment.>\n\n<The pieces that you had collected have disappeared.>\n\nThe Unforged Seal of Ascension is now ready. It is time for the final step."}
Q[4743]={d="上层要塞之外的黑龙很少有能力用它们的烈焰铸造印章。维姆萨拉克是其中的一员，但是他的意志是不可动摇的。\n\n到尘泥沼泽中的巨龙沼泽去，在那里，你可以找到一条名叫埃博斯塔夫的上古老龙。你必须击溃他的意志，$n。把他击垮，然后在他虚弱的躯体上使用这颗宝珠。你有很短的一段时间来控制他的意志，然后用他所喷出的烈焰铸造印章。",dEN="Few of the black dragonkin, outside of those in the upper citadel, have the ability to forge the seal with their own flaming breath. Wyrmthalak is one such dragonkin, but his will is unbreakable.\n\nYou must travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. It is there that you will find an ancient drake known as Emberstrife. You must break his will, <name>. Break it and use this orb on his weakened form. You will have scant seconds to control his mind and fan the flames that will forge the seal.",o="到尘泥沼泽中的巨龙沼泽去。找到上古老龙埃博斯塔夫，对他发起无情的攻击，直到他的意志被摧毁。\n\n此时，你必须尽快将未铸造的晋升印章放在这条龙面前，并使用龙力宝珠控制他的躯体，强迫他将黑龙的烈焰喷向未铸造的晋升印章！",oEN="Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.\n\nIt is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!",p="不要浪费时间，凡人。奈法利安正在努力将他的邪恶散播到整个世界。",pEN="Waste no time, <name>. Nefarian works feverishly to unleash his evil upon our world.",c="当心，我要施展最后的保护咒语了。\n\n<维埃兰的眼睛变成了两团火球。>\n\n晋升徽印铸造完成了……\n\n你要明白，我给这件神器中加入了一些强大的保护结界。在情况最危急的时候，当一切看来都已经无法挽回的时候，红龙军团的力量将会帮助你。",cEN="Stand steady while I cast the final invocation of protection.\n\n<Vaelan's eyes turn to twin orbs of flame.>\n\nThe Seal of Ascension is complete...\n\nKnow this, I have imbued the artifact with some powerful protective wards. In your darkest hour, when all appears to be lost, the might of the red flight will be at your disposal."}
Q[4761]={d="桑迪斯·织风应该已经对你在熊怪的营地那里所进行的侦察行动有所了结了。他是奥伯丁的长者，在那里负责处理村中的日常事务。请把你对熊怪的侦察结果汇报给他。\n\n我相信，他对熊怪堕落的原因有自己的解释。或许你能与他一起制定出恢复自然平衡的计划！",dEN="Your scouting of the furbolg camp is information that Thundris Windweaver should be made aware of. He graciously serves as the elder of Auberdine, offering sage and just stewardship of the day to day affairs of the village. Please - share with him your findings to date on the furbolg situation.\n\nI believe he has some ideas of his own on the reasons behind their corruption. Perhaps you can work with him to enact a plan to restore the balance of nature here!",o="与奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",c="很高兴见到你，$c。你对熊怪进行的侦察活动对奥伯丁而言是件大好事。这段时间以来，我们不仅要对付那些公开与我们为敌的生物，还要面对整个森林不断堕落的现状。希望你能在这样艰难的时期对奥伯丁有所帮助。",cEN="Well met, <class>. Your scouting of the furbolg situation comes at a fortuitous time for us in Auberdine. For some time we have dealt with not only forest dwellers who are now openly hostile to our presence, but also the outright corruption of the forest itself. Hopefully you might be able to lend Auberdine aid during these troubling times."}
Q[4762]={d="壁泉河的河水正在逐渐变得污浊，这污浊的河水流入薄雾海，我担心奥伯丁也会很快受到影响。我怀疑居住在上游区域的黑木熊怪是造成污染的原因，但是我觉得它们并不是一切问题的真正源头。\n\n带上这支试管，到北面的河口去，在第一个内陆瀑布的水潭中取出一份河水的样本来——在你抬头就可以看到一座桥的那个地方取水就可以了。拿到样本后就回奥伯丁来找我。",dEN="The Cliffspring River has begun turning foul and corrupted. It empties into the Mist's Edge, and I fear the wash will affect Auberdine soon. I suspect the Blackwood furbolgs up-river are the cause of the taint, but I also suspect that they aren't the true root of it.\n\nTake this sampling tube and go to the mouth of the river to our north. Proceed inland to the first waterfall and draw a sample from the pool there. You'll see a bridge overhead. Once you have a sample, return to me in Auberdine.",o="到奥伯丁的北面去，沿着壁泉河到达第一个瀑布处，从瀑布下的水潭中取出一份水样。\n\n将壁泉河水样交给奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风。",oEN="Travel north of Auberdine to the first waterfall along the Cliffspring River and draw a sample from the pool there.\n\nReturn to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine with the Cliffspring River Sample.",p="壁泉河的污染为黑海岸拉响了警报。你提供的样本有助于我们制定计划……我猜想我们需要的是一项攻击计划。",pEN="The pollution of the Cliffspring River is but the start of an alarming trend here in Darkshore. The sample you provide will help us formalize a plan... a plan of attack, I am starting to suspect.",c="对于河水受污染的程度，我一点都不感到惊讶。看看吧，河水已经腐化，充满了恶臭！看起来我们要尽快采取措施了，对吧，$n？\n\n我们东面的费伍德森林是这种污染的真正来源，我敢说这份样本可以证明这一点。我们也许能制定一项净化河水的方案，但是我们必须寻求帮助才能执行这个方案。当时机成熟时，$n，我希望你能给我们提供帮助。",cEN="It's no surprise how tainted this water is, but just look at how putrid it is becoming! It would seem that action is needed sooner than later, eh <name>?\n\nTo our east is Felwood; it is the real source of this corruption, one that I have seen in times past. I predict this sample will confirm this. We might be able to enact a cure for it here, but in order to even try we will need assistance. When that time comes <name>, I hope you will be able to give the aid we need."}
Q[4763]={d="我们已经知道熊怪的堕落与萨特有很大的关系，他们使用魔法护符控制熊怪。如果我们要尝试拯救熊怪的话，就必须击败引诱熊怪的萨特，取回他的护符！\n\n到我们的月亮井里去，在碗里盛满水，然后从北面的熊怪营帐中取回一些食物。把水和食物混合并放在河水边的营火旁，只要熊怪吃下食物，它就会得到净化，稍等片刻，那个引诱熊怪的萨特就会出现……这时你就要出手杀掉它！",dEN="We've learned that a source of furbolg corruption is from the satyr. They hold sway via talismans that they channel magic through. If the furbolg have a chance at salvation, we must lure out the satyr corruptor and take that talisman!\n\nFill this bowl at our moonwell and take samples of the furbolgs' food from their northern camp. Mix them and place it near the bonfire by the river; any furbolgs who eat will be cleansed just long enough to lure out the satyr corruptor... who then you must slay!",o="在空的净化碗里盛满奥伯丁月亮井的井水。\n\n在黑木熊怪的北部营地里收集水果、坚果和谷物各一份。\n\n将水和三种食物混合起来，放置在壁泉河附近的营火边，这样就会召来唤引诱熊怪堕落的萨特。\n\n取回堕落护符，将它交给奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风。",oEN="Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.\n\nGather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.\n\nMix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.\n\nTake the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",p="堕落护符是一件邪恶的物品，它唯一的作用就是破坏自然的平衡。当你从萨特手中夺取这件让熊怪堕落的物品时，就把它交给我来处置，这样我们今天就可以说是有所斩获了！",pEN="The Talisman of Corruption is a sinister device that only serves to pervert the balance of nature. When you obtain this item from whatever satyr is tormenting the furbolgs and bring it to me for disposal, we will have won a great victory this day!",c="从堕落力量的魔掌中夺回森林的战争刚刚开始，但是今天我们已经取得了胜利！$n，奥伯丁的人民对你感激万分，你所提供的帮助是我们永远也报答不完的。请收下这个吧。今天我们所掌握的知识也许能在将来的某一天使我们的熊怪朋友们从痛苦中永久地解脱出来。",cEN="We have just begun this war to reclaim our forest from the forces of corruption, but a battle this day has been won! <name>, the people of Auberdine owe you a debt of gratitude that will never be easily repaid. Please accept this along with our thanks. What we have learned here today may one day free our furbolg friends from the shackles of torment permanently."}
Q[4764]={d="黑石塔高处有一座大厅，它曾被称为财富大厅。黑铁矮人将他们的遗物、战利品以及艺术品存放在那里。\n\n那是很久以前的事儿了。据说大厅已经塌陷，现在用于……较为普通的用途。但是我相信里面可能仍藏有一些古代矮人的遗物。\n\n其中一件是末日扣环，那上面镶有罕见的宝石，据说任何矮人看到它都会感动得潸然泪下。\n\n那个扣环，$n，就是你的目标。",dEN="There is a chamber, high in Blackrock Spire, that was once called the Hall of Fortune. It was where the Dark Iron dwarves kept their relics, trophies and objects of art.\n\nThat was long ago. It is said the hall has collapsed and is now used for... less savory tasks. But I believe some old dwarven relics may still be found there.\n\nOne such relic is Doomrigger's clasp, with a surface so encrusted with rare gems that it was said to make weep any dwarf who gazes upon it.\n\nThat clasp, <name>, is your goal.",o="将末日扣环交给燃烧平原的玛亚拉·布莱特文。",oEN="Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.",p="你找到扣环了吗，$n？我的主顾愿意出大价钱买它。",pEN="Do you have the clasp, <name>? My patron will pay very handsomely for it.",c="你成功了！看来传言是真的！\n\n谢谢你，$n。我的主顾雷明顿·瑞治维尔伯爵看到这件东西将非常高兴。",cEN="You found it! So the rumors were true!\n\nThank you, <name>. My patron, Count Remington Ridgewell, will be quite pleased to see this addition to this collection."}
Q[4765]={d="我已经把末日扣环放入一只箱子，便于运送到暴风城。$n，你帮了我的大忙，不过我能请你再帮我最后一个忙吗？\n\n把这只箱子交给雷明顿·瑞治维尔伯爵，你可以在暴风城里找到他。我敢说他看到这东西之后会非常高兴的。",dEN="I have packaged Doomriggers Clasp into a crate, suitable for shipment to Stormwind. <name>, you have been extremely helpful -- can I ask you for one last favor?\n\nDeliver the crate to Count Remington Ridgewell. You will find him in the Keep of Stormwind. I am sure he'll be very pleased to see what you have for him.",o="将瑞治维尔的箱子交给暴风城的雷明顿·瑞治维尔。",oEN="Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Count Remington Ridgewell at Stormwind Keep in Stormwind.",p="有人告诉我，一个来自黑石塔的信差给我带来了一件礼物。\n\n你就是那个信差吗？",pEN="I was told a messenger would come. One with a gift from Blackrock Spire.\n\nAre you he?",c="啊，果然是你！谢谢你，$n。呃……如果你还不知道的话……瑞治维尔系列中的一个贵族所能给予你的酬谢，足可以抵得上一个国王所能给予的。",cEN="Ah, so you are he! You have my thanks, <name>. And... if you didn't already know... the gratitude of a noble in the house of Ridgewell is nigh worth a king's ransom."}
Q[4766]={d="我派了一名密探——玛雅拉·亮翼——前往燃烧平原侦察索瑞森的废墟之城。那座黑铁矮人被摧毁的城市里也许藏着价值连城的宝物……那些东西正好能放进我们家族的博物馆。\n\n玛雅拉说她发现了些东西，需要人手帮忙取回，但那东西不在索瑞森。要取它，得闯一趟黑石塔。\n\n细节我不清楚，如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，就去燃烧平原找玛雅拉谈谈。",dEN="An agent of mine, Mayara Brightwing, was sent to the Burning Steppes to scout the ruined city of Thaurissan. That destroyed city of the Dark Iron dwarves may hide objects of great value... objects that would fit nicely into our family museum.\n\nMayara says she found something and will need aid in retrieving it, but it is not in Thaurissan. Instead, a foray into Blackrock Spire will be required.\n\nI do not know the details, but if interested then speak with Mayara in the Burning Steppes.",o="与燃烧平原的玛亚拉·布莱特文谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mayara Brightwing at Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes.",c="你是从暴风城来的？很好——我知道这里有一件雷明顿非常想要弄到手的艺术品，但是想要获得它并不是那么简单的。\n\n这就是让你来这里的原因。",cEN="You came from Stormwind? Wonderful -- I know of an object of art that Remington would kill to have in his museum, but extracting it won't be easy.\n\nThat's where you come in."}
Q[4767]={d="我的任务是为主风骑士招募更多的双足飞龙。它们的数量在增长，我自己也希望有朝一日能成为一名风骑士。然而，对双足飞龙的需求太大了，我们根本训练不出足够多的数量。也许你能帮我，$n。\n\n我需要你去高巢收集一些双足飞龙蛋。从这里出发，沿峡谷岩壁向西北走，会找到一条通往高巢的坡道。小心点，双足飞龙对它们的蛋非常护崽，绝不会欢迎$g入侵者:入侵者;。",dEN="I've been tasked to recruit more wyverns for the master wind riders. Their numbers are growing and I myself hope to become a wind rider one day. However, we cannot train enough wyverns to keep up with the demand. Perhaps you can help me, <name>.\n\nI need you to travel to Highperch to gather some wyvern eggs. From here, head northwest along the canyon walls to a ramp that will lead you into Highperch. Be careful, wyverns are very protective over their eggs and they will not be kind to intruders.",o="将10颗双足飞龙的蛋交给乱风岗的艾鲁。",oEN="Bring 10 Highperch Wyvern Eggs to Elu in Freewind Post.",p="$n，你弄到那些双足飞龙的蛋了吗？我简直等不及要进行飞龙骑士的训练了！",pEN="<name>, have you retrieved the wyvern eggs that I seek? I'm really anxious to start my wind rider training!",c="很好！有了这些蛋，我离成为飞龙骑士的目标就更近一步啦。这是我对你的一点谢意，愿你永享狩猎的乐趣，$c。",cEN="Perfect! With these eggs I hope to take the next step to become a wind rider. Here is a token of my appreciation; may good hunting always shine upon you, <class>."}
Q[4768]={d="黑石石板记载着早已逝去的矮人乌尔赫尔德·黑石的著述。他是一位技艺高超的炼金师，却被同代人视为疯子，因此没有公开他的研究成果。\n\n但他把研究刻在了石板上，我相信其中一块就在黑石塔里，一个曾被称为幸运大厅的密室中。我不知道它现在叫什么，因为进入黑石塔还能回来的人寥寥无几。\n\n但如果你愿意直面其中的危险，把石板带回来给我，$g冒险者:冒险者;，我一定会重重酬谢你。",dEN="The Darkstone Tablet holds the writings of the long-dead dwarf Urheld Darkstone. An alchemist of great skill, he was thought insane by his contemporaries and, hence, did not share his research.\n\nBut he did etch it onto tablets, and I believe one such tablet lies in Blackrock Spire, in a chamber once named the Hall of Fortune. I know not what it is now called, for few enter Blackrock and return.\n\nBut if you are willing to brave its dangers and return to me with the tablet, your reward will be great.",o="将黑暗石板交给卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷。",oEN="Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.",p="你找到石板了吗，$n？我想尽快对它进行研究。",pEN="Have you found the Tablet, <name>? I yearn to delve into its secrets.",c="太棒了。刻在石板上的配方需要花费数天才能研究出来，但我相信这一次我们肯定会收获颇丰。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你对我们的价值真是无法估量。",cEN="Excellent. The formulae etched into this tablet will consume days of research, but I am confident such research will bear sweet fruit.\n\nThank you, <name>. You have been invaluable to us."}
Q[4769]={d="薇薇安·拉格雷从荒芜之地的卡加斯给我捎来消息。根据她的研究，她相信黑石塔内有一份古代文献，会对我们的研究有帮助。为了证实这一点，她需要有人把那份文献从塔里取出来。这绝非易事。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，就去卡加斯找薇薇安谈谈。",dEN="Vivian Lagrave sent me word from Kargath, in the Badlands. Through her studies, she believes there is an ancient text within Blackrock Spire that would benefit our research. To confirm this, she will need someone to extract the text from the spire. No easy task.\n\nIf interested, then speak with Vivian in Kargath.",o="与卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.",c="确实如此。我相信黑石塔内藏着一块石板，一块记载着古老炼金配方的石板。很高兴你来了，因为我正需要人帮忙取回那块石板。\n\n请$g自便:自便;，我再详细解释。",cEN="It is true. I believe there is a tablet held within Blackrock Spire, a tablet that contains old alchemical recipes. I am glad you are here, for I need help in retrieving the tablet.\n\nMake yourself comfortable, and I will explain further."}
Q[4770]={d="请帮帮我，$c！我藏在这里已经很久了，好多天都没有看到过一张友好的面孔。我来这里是准备研究双足飞龙的，但是也许我靠得太近了。我在研究一只双足飞龙的时候遭到了攻击，一直被追到这里，而且迷了路。\n\n我要回白沙岗哨去！莫特加不知道我失踪了，如果他知道我独自进入风巢的话，一定会暴跳如雷的。\n\n白沙岗哨就在这里的东面……请把我带到那里去！",dEN="Please help me, <class>! I've been hiding here in Highperch for some time now and it's been days since I've seen a friendly face. I came here to study the wyvern and I think I got a little too close. After being chased away from one of the nests I got lost.\n\nI need to get back to Whitereach Post! Motega does not know that I am missing and will be furious to know that I ventured into Highperch by myself.\n\nWhitereach Post is just east of here... please take me there!",o="护送波卡·雨山走出风巢，然后和白沙岗哨的莫特加·火鬃谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Pao'ka Swiftmountain from Highperch, and then talk to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post.",c="什么！？如果我知道波卡·捷山要独自进入风巢的话，我会把他拴在图腾上面！他的父亲勉强才允许他和我一起来千针石林，我们来这里是为了研究这片美丽的土地上的各种生物。\n\n非常感谢你给予波卡的帮助，希望这个能够替你阻挡各种的不幸之事。",cEN="What!? If I knew that Pao'ka Swiftmountain was going to snoop around Highperch, I would have chained him to a totem! His father was reluctant allowing him to come with me to Thousand Needles. We came here to study the different creatures that inhabit these beautiful lands.\n\nI appreciate the help you have shown Pao'ka. I hope this covers any misfortunes this deed has cost you."}
Q[4771]={d="我已经把黎明先锋放进了你送来的那个容器里——原先装龙蛋的那个。你的任务就是把它带进通灵学院的深处。\n\n亡灵法师维克图斯率领着一群天灾学者。把黎明先锋放进他们的房间，也就是\"观景室\"。它会与那里的亡灵发生反应，运气好的话就能把他们全部消灭！\n\n这之后，击败维克图斯就不成问题了，你觉得呢？",dEN="I've placed Dawn's Gambit in the container you brought to us, the one that held the dragon eggs. Your job is to bring it deep within the Scholomance.\n\nThe undead mage Vectus leads a team of Scourge scholars... place Dawn's Gambit in their chamber, called the \"viewing room.\" It will then react with the undead found there and, with a little luck, destroy them!\n\nAfter that, defeating Vectus shouldn't be a problem. Right?",o="将黎明先锋放在通灵学院的观察室里。打败维克图斯，然后回到贝蒂娜·比格辛克那里去。",oEN="Place Dawn's Gambit in the Viewing Room of the Scholomance. Defeat Vectus, then return to Betina Bigglezink.",p="记住，$n——我们必须宽容待人，但在信念上必须坚定不移！",pEN="Remember, <name> - we must be tolerant yet rigid in our beliefs!",c="你成功了！维克图斯被打败了！黎明先锋……它有效吗？\n\n嗯……或许我的设备不是我期望的那样有效，但是很高兴你把一切都摆平了。干得好，$n！\n\n银色黎明和艾泽拉斯的人民都会感谢你的。",cEN="You did it! Vectus is defeated! And Dawn's Gambit... did it work?\n\nHm... maybe my device wasn't the success I had hoped, but I'm glad you were able to handle things anyway. Well done, <name>!\n\nThe Argent Dawn, and the good people of Azeroth, are in your debt."}
Q[4781]={d="你下一个任务和第一个一样简单，不过你需要找人帮忙。\n\n我需要金线来给斗篷绣花，但金线不好弄到，而且没几个人知道怎么做。幸好，有一位忠于我们事业的人掌握着其中的诀窍，而且乐意帮助我们在队伍中崭露头角的人。\n\n带一根金锭给藏宝海湾的克希兹克·好针脚。他是裁缝大师，会很乐意为你纺一轴线。金锭由技艺娴熟的矿工熔炼而成。去找个矿工帮忙吧。",dEN="Your next task is as simple as your first, but will require you to seek out aid.\n\nI require gold thread for the embroidery of the cloak, but gold thread is not easy to come by, and very few know how to make it. Fortunately, one who is loyal to our cause knows its secrets and is willing to help those rising in our ranks.\n\nBring a gold bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay. He is a master tailor and will be happy to spin the thread for you. Gold bars are smelted by skilled miners. Ask a miner for help.",o="将一块金锭交给荆棘谷的希兹克·古斯提。",oEN="Bring a Gold Bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="金锭，是的……是的。给我带一根来，我们再看能为你纺出什么样的线。在那之前，我建议你把精力放在提升实力上。最艰难的考验还在后面。相信我……无论你自认为多$g强大:强大;，到时候你都会希望自己$g准备:准备;得更充分。",pEN="Gold bars, yes... yes. Bring me one and we'll see what we can do about spinning some thread for you. Until then, I would suggest you focus your efforts on becoming more powerful. Your toughest trials are still ahead. And trust me... you'll wish you were more prepared, regardless of how powerful you think you might be.",c="棒极了，$n。很高兴你能如此迅速地找到愿意帮忙的矿工，要不然就是你自己动手熔炼金锭？不管怎么说，你做得很好。这块金锭用于纺织金线是再好不过了。\n\n我要花一些时间来干这活儿，所以你得过一阵子再回到我这儿来——事实上，我要让那些被囚禁在高塔中的公主们加班加点地干活了，她们唯一的工作就是纺织金线……不，我是认真的。我说真的……好吧，我开玩笑的。",cEN="Perfect, <name>. I'm glad you could find a miner to help you out so quickly. Or did you do this work yourself? Either way, you've done well. This will be perfect for the thread.\n\nIt will take some time to create the stuff, so you'll have to come back--I actually send it off to some princess who we have locked in a tower who's only job is to spin gold thread... no, seriously. I mean it... okay, not really."}
Q[4782]={d="回到梅纳拉那儿去吧，告诉她我需要一些时间来完成这活儿，但是我向她……和你保证，我肯定会完成它。等你弄到你所需的其它物品之后，我应该已经纺好金线了。到那时你就可以到我这儿来取走金线。\n\n祝你好运，$n。哦，对了，请帮我向斯坦哈德问好。那个老疯子……他居然在棘齿城旁边盖了座塔……真是疯了。",dEN="Return to Menara, tell her it'll take some time, but I'll make sure to come through for her... and you. Tell her to have you finish gathering the rest of your components--I should have the thread done by then. You can return and pick it up then.\n\nGood luck, <name>. Oh, and say hello to Strahad for me while you're there. That old coot... putting a tower right there next to Ratchet... crazy.",o="回到贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德那里。",oEN="Return to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="很好，你回来了，$n。线呢？\n\n啊，我明白了。可以接受。那个地精和他的兄弟还没让我们失望过——我想他当时没准备好也是可以理解的。那就这样吧……这段时间我们还有别的事要办。\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;进行下一步了吗？",cEN="Good, you've returned, <name>. And where is the thread?\n\nAh, I understand. That is acceptable. The goblin and his brother have not failed us yet--I suppose it is understandable that he did not have it prepared right then. So be it... we have other things we can attend to in the meantime.\n\nAre you prepared for the next step?"}
Q[4783]={d="下一件必需的材料只有在石爪山西面的凄凉之地才能找到。\n\n在大灾变之后，这片区域仍处于混乱之中。你的力量和智慧都将在此得到考验——你将面对满怀仇恨的生物，以及可怕的燃烧军团。\n\n到凄凉之地的东北部去寻找怨怒萨特，取回它们的血。然后从玛诺洛克集会所的次级地狱火身上弄到一块次级地狱火石。\n\n我们将在制作披风的过程中用到这两种东西。",dEN="The next components are found in Desolace, far to the west of the Barrens and even the Stonetalon Mountains.\n\nThere, chaos still reigns after the Sundering. Both your strength and cunning will be tested there--you will face creatures of hatred and also of the Burning Legion.\n\nFrom the Hatefury satyr in the northeast, bring me their blood. From the lesser infernals in Mannoroc Coven, bring me a lesser infernal stone.\n\nWe will use both in the construction of your robe.",o="将10瓶怨怒萨特之血和1块次级地狱火石交给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德。",oEN="Bring 10 Vials of Hatefury Blood and 1 Lesser Infernal Stone to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="凄凉之地可不是个友善的地方。纳迦、巨人、萨特、燃烧军团、好战的半人马部落……所有这些都使得这片区域危机四伏，所以你得加倍小心。\n\n就像我先前所说的一样，这次任务不仅会考验你的力量和智慧，还会考验你的耐性。随时保持警惕，$n。",pEN="Desolace is not a kind area: naga, giants, satyr, the Burning Legion... all of those and warring centaur clans all make the land dangerous if you're not careful.\n\nLike I said before, it will not only test your strength and cunning, but also your patience. Be wary in those lands, <name>.",c="太好了，$n。这些正合适。我现在就来处理它们，你继续去找最后两样材料。你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？",cEN="Excellent, <name>. These will do nicely. I will prepare them now while you move on to your last two components. Are you ready?"}
Q[4784]={d="$n，现在我只差三样东西就能完成你的长袍了。\n\n首先，是克希兹克正在为你准备的金线。回藏宝海湾去把它取来。\n\n其次，从阿拉希高地的火元素身上给我带两块阴燃的煤块来。如果我没记错，它们在西边，靠近索拉丁之墙。\n\n最后，一块由你自己制作的灵魂碎片。\n\n等你凑齐所有材料，回到这座塔来，我就为你完成这件长袍。",dEN="I need only two things now, <name>, then we can finish your robe.\n\nFirst, the fine gold thread Xizk is making for you. Return to him in Booty Bay and get it.\n\nSecond, bring me two smoldering coals from the fire elementals in the Arathi Highlands. If I recall correctly, they are to the west, near Thoradin's Wall.\n\nAfter you have all the components, return here to the tower and I will complete the robe for you.",o="把一些优质金线、两块阴燃的煤块和一块灵魂碎片带给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·虚空行者。",oEN="Bring some Fine Gold Thread and 2 Smoldering Coals to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="很快就好了，$n。我向你保证。我制作的披风绝对符合你的要求，它能使你在战斗中占尽上风。",pEN="Soon, <name>. I promise you. The robe will be more than adequate for your needs and certainly give you an edge over your opponents.",c="太好了，$n！材料都齐了，我们$g准备好:准备好了;。\n\n我相信你会对结果满意的。",cEN="Excellent, <name>! The components are gathered and we are ready.\n\nI trust you will be pleased."}
Q[4785]={c="拿着吧，$N。请代我们向梅纳拉问好。\n\n我们希望你将来能有所作为。也许有一天，当燃烧军团被击败时，人们将呼喊着你的名字，赞颂着你的力量。我已经等不及要看到那场面了！",cEN="Here you go, <name>. And please tell Menara we say hello.\n\nWe expect great things of you. Perhaps when the Legion falls to its knees, your name will be spoken aloud and in praise of your power. I can't wait!"}
Q[4786]={d="稍等一下，我现在就为你织好披风。这需要一些时间，可别走得太远了。",dEN="I will put the robe together for you now. It will take but a few moments. Do not go far.",o="等待梅纳拉·沃伦德织好披风，然后跟她谈一谈。",oEN="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again.",p="再等一等，$n……",pEN="A moment, <name>...",c="好了，$n。自豪地穿上它吧。\n\n你干得不错，我看得出你会有远大的前途。记住，要对抗与我们的修行之道共存的堕落力量需要强大的意志和恒心。只要你坚持自己的信念，就能取得成功。",cEN="It is done, <name>. Here you are. Wear it with pride.\n\nYou've worked hard and I see great things in your future. Remember, to defy the corruption that comes with our path takes great will and fortitude. As long as your will is your own, then you shall have great success."}
Q[4787]={d="摩沙鲁的预言提到了一枚远古之卵。当巨魔建造的强大帝国还无人能敌时，那枚卵就已经存在了，它具有控制哈卡的灵魂精华的力量。也许它就是能使我们的世界免受邪恶侵扰的唯一希望。\n\n把这枚远古之卵交给我，$n。据说它被深藏在辛特兰地区的巨魔城市辛萨罗，就在城市最顶端的大广场后面的洞穴中。",dEN="The Prophecy of Mosh'aru speaks of an ancient egg. It is a relic of a time when trolls ruled vast empires, and it has the power to hold the essence of Hakkar. It may be the only way to keep our world safe from his evil.\n\nBring me the ancient egg, <name>. It is said to lay hidden deep within Jintha'Alor in the Hinterlands, in a cave behind the amphitheater at the top of the city.",o="将远古之卵交给塔纳利斯的叶基亚。",oEN="Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.",p="你拿到远古之卵了吗？我感到一股强大的力量在蠢蠢欲动，我担心时间已经不多了。",pEN="Do you have the ancient egg? I sense great forces stirring, and I fear that time grows short.",c="啊，你找到它了！我向你的勇敢和力量致以最崇高的敬意，$n。",cEN="Ah, you have the egg! I bow to you, <name>. Your strength and bravery will be long remembered."}
Q[4788]={d="在我研究摩沙鲁的第三块和第四块石板的同时，你必须找到第五块和第六块！这并不容易，因为它们在黑石塔的燃棘巨魔手中。黑石塔位于燃烧平原和灼热峡谷之间，那是一座到处都是岩浆和火焰的黑色山脉。\n\n祝你好运，$n。黑石塔可不是个观光的去处……",dEN="While I look over the third and fourth tablets of Mosh'aru, you must find the fifth and sixth! It will not be easy, for they are held by the Smolderthorn trolls within Blackrock Spire. The spire is a dark mountain of fire between the Burning Steppes and the Searing Gorge.\n\nGood luck, <name>. Blackrock Spire is no place for decent folk...",o="将第五块和第六块摩沙鲁石板交给塔纳利斯的勘查员詹斯·铁靴。",oEN="Bring the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.",p="你去过黑石塔了吗，$n？你找到第五块和第六块石板了吗？",pEN="Have you been to the spire, <name>? Do you have the fifth and sixth tables?",c="难以置信！你找到它们了！你真是个$g英雄:英雄;，$n！\n\n这是好事，因为我一直在研读你之前带来的那些石板，根据我拼凑出的内容……我们需要一位$g英雄:英雄;来阻止即将到来的东西……",cEN="Unbelievable! You found them! You truly are a hero, <name>!\n\nThat's a good thing, because I've been reading the tablets you brought me before, and from what I gathered... we're going to need a hero to stop what's coming..."}
Q[4801]={p="在冬泉谷，你要跟一种叫霜刃豹的大猫搏斗。这些野兽速度惊人，狡猾无比。你要是想得到霜刃豹的速度，就把从它们身上找到的伊可带给我。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will fight great cats called frostsabers. These beasts possess incredible speed an' cunning. If you wish ta gain the speed a' da frostsaber, bring me da E'ko you find from dem.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4802]={p="在冬泉谷，你将与被称为冬泉熊怪的堕落生物搏斗，这些怪物拥有令人难以置信的力量。如果你想要获得冬泉熊怪的力量，就把你从它们身上找到的魂精交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will fight misguided creatures known as da Winterfall furbolg. Through the wishes of their leader, dey have gained incredible strength. If you wish ta gain the power a' da Winterfall, bring me da E'ko you find from dem.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4803]={p="在冬泉谷，你会找到强壮无比的巨熊，这些裂齿熊有着很强的忍耐力。如果你想要获得抵抗火焰的能力，就把你从裂齿熊身上找到的魂精交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will find large bears wit extremely thick hides. These Shardtooth bears gain much protection from what dey can withstand. If you wish ta gain the resistance against fire, bring me da E'ko you find from da Shardtooth.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4804]={p="在冬泉谷，你会与巨大的冰风奇美拉进行战斗。这些动物有控制冰冻魔法的力量。如果你希望得到抵抗冰冷的能力，就把你从它们身上找到的魂精交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will fight great flying creatures called da Chillwind. These beasts possess da power ta wield frost magics. If you wish ta gain resistance ta frost, bring me da E'ko you find from da Chillwind.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4805]={p="在冬泉谷，你会与巨大的冰蓟雪人战斗。他们的行动非常缓慢，但是厚厚的皮毛可以让他们获得超强的防御力。如果你希望拥有躲避攻击的能力，就把你从他们身上找到的魂精交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will fight great creatures called da ice thistle yeti. These beasts move slowly, but dey are able to evade many blows from da protection their thick fur provides dem. If you wish ta gain da ability to dodge attacks, bring me da E'ko you find from dem.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4806]={p="在冬泉谷，你已经跟那些霜槌部族的冰巨人战斗过了，他们拥有巨大的力量。如果你希望拥有霜槌的力量，就从他们身上收集魂精，把它们交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you have fought da large ice giants called frostmaul. Sheer power and force is at their disposal. If you wish ta gain da force of da frostmaul, bring me da E'ko you find from dem.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4807]={p="在冬泉谷，你将与拥有强大的魔法天赋的生物进行搏斗，那些枭兽可以使用强大的魔法。如果你想要提高自己的智力，就把你从枭兽那里得到的魂精交给我。\n\n记住，如果你想搜寻魂精的话，就必须随身带着玛艾里的容器。",pEN="In Winterspring, you will fight creatures of might dat seem to possess an innate magic ability. These wildkin can use strong magics. If you wish ta gain an increase in your intellect bring me da E'ko you find from any a' da owlbeasts you find der.\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",c="玛艾里可以把魂能提取出来，转移给$n……利用玛艾里的容器就可以把这中能量赋予你自己，或者你的盟友。",cEN="Mau'ari can derive da juju for <name>... Use da Cache of Mau'ari to cast dis upon yourself or your allies."}
Q[4808]={d="我还有一件事要请你帮忙。\n\n我对你收集的那些精华进行了研究，结果表明冷冻并运输龙蛋是有可能实现的。我想测试一下这个理论，但是首先我需要一些特别设计的零件。我的同事菲诺克可以制作我需要的东西。\n\n现在，请你把这封信交给菲诺克，上面写着我所需要的东西的技术细节。你可以在冬泉谷的永望镇里找到菲诺克。",dEN="I have another favor to ask of you.\n\nMy initial study of the essence you collected shows that it might be possible to freeze dragon whelp eggs and preserve them! I want to test this theory, but first I need specially made engineering components. My colleague, Felnok Steelspring, can make them.\n\nHere, take this letter to Felnok. It tells him what I need. You'll find Felnok in Winterspring, in the town of Everlook.",o="把丁奇的信交给菲诺克。",oEN="Give Tinkee's Letter to Felnok Steelspring at Everlook in Winterspring.",p="这里真冷！你有毯子吗？",pEN="It's cold up here! I hope you brought me a blanket!",c="那不是毯子！但那是什么呢？丁奇写给我的信？我想知道她要说什么……\n\n啊，她正在燃烧平原学习。我明白了——那里有一大票的龙。哦，你看！她说她需要一些零件来建造她的仪器。这就是她派你来找我的原因，对吗？",cEN="That's no blanket! But what have we here? I letter from Tinkee? I wonder what she has to say...\n\nAh, she's studying in the Burning Steppes. That makes sense--that's a good source for dragonkin. Oh, but look! It says here that she needs some parts for a device she wants to build. I guess that's where I come in, eh?"}
Q[4809]={d="我有丁奇所需的大部分材料，但是唯独缺少一种很重要的零件，那就是冰风奇美拉的角。冰风奇美拉的角是寒冷的源泉，但是只有非常纯粹而完整的角才能用！我需要很多角才能完成丁奇的订单。\n\n给我弄些完整的冰风奇美拉角来，我会为丁奇准备一个包裹。",dEN="I have most of what Tinkee needs, but I'm missing one important component, and that's chillwind horns. The horns of the chillwind chimaera in Winterspring are a concentrated source of cold, but only pristine, uncracked horns will do! I'll need a supply of those to complete Tinkee's order.\n\nBring me the uncracked chillwind horns, and I'll prepare a package for Tinkee.",o="将8支完整的冰风奇美拉角交给菲诺克。",oEN="Collect 8 Uncracked Chillwind Horns.",p="你拿到冰风奇美拉的角了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the chillwind horns, <name>?",c="嗯，品质很不错。你瞧，简直比冰还要冷！等我戴上手套，然后把它们与丁奇需要的其它东西一起包好……",cEN="These are good specimens. They're packed with cold! Let me get some gloves on, then pack them along with the other things Tinkee needs..."}
Q[4810]={d="好了，一切都打包妥当，随时可以运走了！祝你旅途顺利，还有，别忘了告诉廷基，她欠我一个人情！",dEN="Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!",o="把菲诺克的包裹交给燃烧平原的丁奇·斯迪波尔。",oEN="Bring Felnok's Package to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.",p="$n！你找菲诺克谈过话了吗？我要的东西呢？",pEN="<name>! Did you talk to Felnok? Did you bring the components I need?",c="太棒了！我马上就开始工作！真是太感谢你了，$n！\n\n你帮了我的大忙，我以后可能会需要你去完成更加重要的任务……",cEN="You brought them! Great! I'll get to work right away! Thanks a ton, <name>!\n\nYou've been so helpful to me, I might need you for even more important tasks later..."}
Q[4811]={d="我们东边的区域出现了越来越多的有攻击性的枭兽。过去它们都是很温和的——甚至可以说是神秘的动物。尽管仍然有人对它们非常尊敬，但出于对奥伯丁安全的考虑，我不得不保持更现实一些的观点。\n\n据说这段时间以来，月光枭兽被黑海岸东部山脉上的一块巨大的红色水晶吸引，聚集在它的周围。没有人知道那块水晶是什么，也没有人知道它是否真的存在。我想让你去找到它的位置，并把你所发现的任何东西都报告给我。",dEN="Hostile moonkin roam in ever increasing numbers to our east. They once were thought to be gentle, almost mystical creatures. While some continue to hold reverence for them, the safety of Auberdine forces me to keep a more realistic view.\n\nI've received reports that moonkin are being drawn to a large red crystal along Darkshore's eastern mountain range. No one has any idea what that crystal is, or even if it really exists. I want you to locate it over there and report back to me what you find.",o="到奥伯丁的东边去，沿着黑海岸东部边界的山脉寻找一颗巨大的红色水晶，然后向奥伯丁的哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩汇报你的发现。",oEN="Travel east of Auberdine and look for a large, red crystal along Darkshore's eastern mountain range. Report back what you find to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",p="关于那块红色水晶，你有什么要汇报的吗？它真的存在吗？",pEN="What do you have to report on that red crystal? Does it even really exist?",c="那么水晶确实存在了，$n？嗯……不管怎么说，你出色地完成了任务，干得漂亮！\n\n这块水晶到底是什么东西？这只是许多问题中的一个。另一个浮现在我脑中的问题是，为什么枭兽会被它吸引？这水晶是自然形成的呢，还是邪恶的产物？\n\n我还有很多问题，但我们还需要仔细研究那块水晶才能得到更多答案。",cEN="So the crystal exists, <name>? Fascinating... anyway, your task has been well executed; good work!\n\nWhat exactly is this crystal? This is but a single question in a sea of questions. Another question that comes to mind is why the moonkin would be drawn to this object? Is the crystal benign in nature, or does it hold a more sinister purpose?\n\nI have many more questions, but we're going to need to examine that crystal closely to get some answers."}
Q[4812]={d="用这支小瓶装一些奥伯丁月亮井的水。它潜在的魔法能量可以帮我们弄清这块水晶的成分，你必须把水倒在那块水晶上，剩下的就不用你操心了。\n\n虽然我不觉得你会有什么不测，但我仍然希望你多加小心。我们东边就是费伍德森林，如果这块水晶真的与那个地方有关联，它就可能非常危险。",dEN="Use this empty vial and fill up on some moonwell water here in Auberdine. Such potent magic should provide a clue as to the composition of the crystal. To do that, you'll pour the liquid over the crystal; it should take care of the rest.\n\nWhile I don't anticipate anything bad happening to you, I still want you to be careful. Above us to the east is Felwood; if that crystal is tied to that place as I suspect it is, then it could prove to be very dangerous.",o="在奥伯丁月亮井中把空水瓶装满，然后调查黑海岸东部山脉的红水晶。",oEN="Fill the Empty Water Tube at the Auberdine moonwell, and then investigate the red crystal along Darkshore's eastern mountain wall.",p="这块水晶伫立在黑海岸繁茂的森林中，与周围的景色格格不入。你似乎听到有非常轻微的嗡嗡声从水晶里面传出来。",pEN="The crystal looks very alien against the wooded scenery of Darkshore. You think you hear a very slight humming coming from deep within it.",c="你又来到了这块神秘的水晶旁，并小心翼翼地将月亮井水倒在了水晶的顶部。随着水流刷洗着水晶，你看到原本混浊的表面开始变得透明了……",cEN="You have made it once more to the mysterious crystal. Removing the stopper on the tube of moonwell water, you gingerly pour the contents out over the top of the crystal. As the water cascades down its lattices, you see the opaque surface turn transparent..."}
Q[4813]={d="月亮井的水让嵌在水晶里的东西显现了出来，那是一些细小的骨头碎片，还有半块下颌骨。这块下颌骨似乎是人类的，但是你没办法打开水晶，所以还不能确定这一点——即使是最强大的魔法也几乎不可能打碎这块水晶。\n\n现在看来，你只能去向奥伯丁的哨兵哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩汇报这个发现了。",dEN="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone. The jawbone appears to be from a humanoid, but it is unclear without breaking open the crystal - a feat that even the strongest of magic would find near impossible.\n\nWith the task at hand complete, all that remains is to report back to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",o="向奥伯丁的哨兵哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩报告你的发现。",oEN="Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",c="那么，看起来即使我们对这块水晶有了进一步的了解，其结果也不过是发现了更多有待回答的问题！\n\n我要把你汇报的这些情报交给奥伯丁的议会，他们可能会制定后续的计划，嗯，我是说假设他们能制定出计划来的话……现在，东边的威胁一时半会还不会对我们造成什么伤害。\n\n至于你，请拿着这个。这是给你的奖赏，$n。",cEN="Well, it would seem that even though we know more about this crystal, more unanswered questions are the result!\n\nI'll take the information you've uncovered to the council here in Auberdine. Perhaps they'll know a course of action to follow on this crystal. Well, that is if there is one to be taken; for now, the threat remains far enough to our east to be out of harm's way.\n\nAs for you, please have this. Consider it a reward for a job well done, <name>."}
Q[4821]={d="在千针石林流传着一个有关异型卵的传言。那些声称见到它的旅行者都没能靠近它进行详细的观察。毒蛇守卫着那枚卵，就仿佛是在守卫它们自己的卵一样。\n\n我想让你去把那枚异型卵找出来交给我，以便让我进行观察。据说它在某条毒蛇的窝里，但是沿着乱风岗南面与东北面的悬崖基部有好几处蛇窝。",dEN="A rumor has surfaced about an alien egg here in Thousand Needles. Those that report seeing this egg have failed to even get close enough to examine it in detail. Serpents guard the egg as if it's one of their own.\n\nI want you to seek out this alien egg and bring it to me so that I may examine it. Reports say the egg is located within a serpent den, but there are several serpent dens along the base of the cliff walls south and northeast of Freewind Post.",o="把异型卵交给乱风岗的哈加尔·雷蹄。",oEN="Return the Alien Egg to Hagar Lightninghoof in Freewind Post.",p="我必须要对这枚神秘的卵有更多了解，天知道它会孵出什么东西来。",pEN="I must know more about this mysterious egg, who knows what will hatch from it.",c="嗯，终于……这枚神秘的卵终于还是被我拿到了。现在，让我仔细看看这东西……什么……！这是什么……？",cEN="Yes, finally... the mysterious egg has finally been delivered to me. Now, let me take a closer look at this... What..! What is this..?"}
Q[4822]={d="冰激凌！啊天哪，求求你可不可以给我弄点冰激凌？我最喜欢草莓味了，而世界上最美味的草莓冰激凌就是提古勒和弗罗尔的草莓冰激凌了！这是世界上我最爱吃的冰激凌了。\n\n很久以前我在闪光平原的时候吃过，但是我听说他们可能会在城里出售了！求你了，可不可以给我弄点提古勒和弗罗尔的草莓冰激凌？！",dEN="ICE CREAM! Oh please please please could you get me some ice cream?! Strawberry is my favorite flavor, and there's no better strawberry ice cream in the world than Tigule and Foror's Strawberry Ice Cream! It's my favorite ice cream in the whole wide world!\n\nI had it once a long time ago when I was at the Shimmering Flats race track, but I heard that they might be selling them in town now! Please? Pretty please? With Tigule and Foror's Strawberry Ice Cream on top??!?!",o="给守卫找一些草莓冰激凌。这位老兄好像比较喜欢提古勒和弗罗尔的草莓冰激凌。",oEN="Get some Strawberry Ice Cream for your ward. The lad seems to prefer Tigule and Foror's brand ice cream.",p="我希望他们除了草莓冰淇淋之外还能做出更多口味的冰淇淋，但是还好我最喜欢的就是草莓口味！",pEN="I wish they'd make more flavors of ice cream other than strawberry, but I guess I'm lucky that strawberry is my favorite!",c="嗯！我喜欢草莓冰淇淋！提古勒和弗洛尔的草莓冰淇淋是最棒的！\n\n非常感谢你，$n——这是我所得到的最好的礼物！",cEN="Mmmmmmmmm! I love their strawberry ice cream! If there's one thing Tigule and Foror know to do, it's make ice cream!\n\nThank you very much <name> - this is the best treat ever!"}
Q[4841]={d="$n，我恳求你去猎杀这些半人马。让他们尝尝我们复仇的怒火！袭击自由之风村落北边的半人马营地！让怒火指引你的手！|n",dEN="<name>, I entreat you to hunt these centaur down. They shall feel the wrath of our revenge. Attack the centaur camp to the north of Freewind Post! Let wrath guide your hand!",o="杀掉12个加拉克斥候、10个加拉克争斗者和6个加拉克逐风者，然后向乱风岗的峭壁卫兵图林·长角复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Galak Scouts, 10 Galak Wranglers, and 6 Galak Windchasers, and then return to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",p="快一点，$n，我知道你还没有完成我交给你的任务。猎杀那些半人马，然后我就会给你一份奖励以表示感谢。",pEN="Come now <name>, I know you haven't killed your share yet. Hunt them down, and I shall give you a reward for my gratitude.",c="为了表示我的感谢，请拿着这个，$n。",cEN="For my gratitude, this is for you, <name>."}
Q[4842]={d="跟你说实话吧，虽然冬泉谷并没有火山，但我认为这些温泉的成因要可怕得多……\n\n嗯，我想你会想$g亲自:亲自;去看看。你得走遍整个冬泉谷，一直往南。当空气变得又闷又黏稠、天空暗下来的时候，你就找到了我认为的温泉源头……\n\n去看看吧。我相信你回来时会有更多疑问。",dEN="To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs...\n\nWell, I think you'll want to see it for yourself. You'll need to travel the length of Winterspring, and head to the very south. When the air becomes thick and muggy, and the sky turns dark, you'll have found what I believe to be the source of the hot springs.\n\nHave a look. I'm sure you'll have many questions when you return.",o="根据多诺瓦·雪山的指示行动，然后回到她那里报告。",oEN="Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.",p="泉水似乎有些古怪……我还不能确定这意味着什么……",pEN="The water in the springs seems to have some very odd properties... I am still unsure of what it means...",c="没错，暗语峡谷的恶魔……我相信是他们污染了这片土地。我将继续观察温泉，看看是否能通过研究得出更进一步的结论。\n\n如果你准备深入暗语峡谷的话，我建议你在变得更加强大之后再去。",cEN="Yes, the demons there in Darkwhisper Gorge; I believe it is their presence that is affecting the land in this way. I am going to continue observing the hot springs here and see if I learn anything more.\n\nI'd wait until you are a bit stronger if you have plans of heading farther into Darkwhisper Gorge."}
Q[4861]={d="小$G伙子:姑娘，过来一下！我被一群嗜血如命的枭兽追赶，从我那个在冬泉谷南部的营帐里逃到了这儿！我觉得这可能是我离枭兽要保护的某种东西太近的缘故。\n\n我刚刚设法安全脱身，但是跟我一起的那个同伴可就没这么幸运了……你愿意到我的营地里去一趟吗？我真的需要那些补给物资，另外我还想取回昨天在挖掘场发现的护符。",dEN="Hey there, <lad/lass>! I was chased from my camp in southern Winterspring by some bloodthirsty wildkin! Well, I suppose I got too close to something the wildkin were guarding.\n\nI barely managed to get away safely; I fear a buddy of mine wasn't as lucky. Would you mind braving the wildkin and heading to the camp? I really need my supplies, and I'd also like to get back the amulet I unearthed yesterday at the dig site.",o="在冬泉谷的南部寻找加隆·石矛的被破坏的营帐，以及他的补给物资。",oEN="Locate Jaron Stoneshaper's wrecked camp and supplies in southern Winterspring.",c="在这个一片狼藉的营帐中有一只严重毁损的木箱……",cEN="A severely damaged crate stands out among the rest of the destroyed belongings at the camp..."}
Q[4862]={d="信不信由你，真有人愿意为最凶恶的驯化野兽掏钱！\n\n我派比修去黑石塔收集一些蜘蛛卵，可我已经好几周没有她的消息了。也许你能帮我？\n\n这样吧，$n，去黑石塔替我收集一些蜘蛛卵。把它们带回来，我不仅会给你钱，还会给你驯化一只！",dEN="Believe it or not, there are people out there willing to pay for the most vile of domesticated beast!\n\nI'd sent Bijou into the Spire to try and collect some of those spire spider eggs but I haven't heard from her in weeks. Maybe you can help me out?\n\nI'll tell you what, <name>. Go to Blackrock Spire and collect some spire spider eggs for me. Bring them back here and not only will I give you a little cash, but I'll even domesticate one for you!",o="前往黑石塔，为基布勒收集十五颗塔中蜘蛛卵。\n\n听上去，这些蛋应该能在蜘蛛附近找到。|n",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.\n\nBy the sound of it, these eggs could be found near spiders.",p="你是弄到蜘蛛卵了，还是仅仅跑来跟我打个招呼？",pEN="Are those spider eggs in your pack or are you just happy to see me?",c="好重！我的意思是，看这些卵！这些应该能值一大笔钱。\n\n就像我承诺过的一样，你也可以带着一个这样的小东西。别被它咬了！",cEN="What a load! I mean, look at all those eggs! These should bring in a right few gold.\n\nAs promised, here's your own little critter. Don't get bitten!"}
Q[4863]={d="你朝四周看了看，没找到加隆想要的东西。但是，你注意到先前找到的箱子已被打碎，似乎是被枭兽洗劫过……\n\n你向东看去，勉强辨认出那里有一辆支离破碎的马车。或许你能在那里找到加隆的东西，最好去看一看。",dEN="Looking around, you don't see much that Jaron could want here. However, you do notice that the crate you found has been smashed open, almost as if this was what the wildkin were after...\n\nLooking to the east, you can barely make out an abandoned wagon. Perhaps you might find Jaron's things there. It's worth a look.",o="找到加隆·石矛的马车。",oEN="Find Jaron Stoneshaper's wrecked wagon.",c="在马车附近似乎没有加隆想要的东西。但是，你在地面上发现了一些半埋在雪地里的未被损坏的木箱。",cEN="Approaching the wagon, it doesn't appear that there is much more here for Jaron. But, looking on the ground, you notice some crates that look undamaged, despite being half-buried in the snow."}
Q[4864]={d="翻了翻箱子里的东西之后，你认为里面的工具和其它一些物品可能对加隆仍然有用，但是你没有发现他所说的护符。\n\n枭兽似乎居住在此地北面和东面的地区，因此你认为接下来最好到它们的聚居地去找一找。",dEN="After inspecting the contents of the box, you decide that Jaron could make use of the tools and other items inside. However, there is no sign of the amulet.\n\nIt appears that the wildkin inhabit the lands to the north and east of here, so you decide that the next step is to face the creatures and reclaim the amulet from them.",o="从雪地中拾起加隆的补给物资，然后寻找盗取加隆所说的护符的枭兽。\n\n将加隆的补给物资和蓝色羽毛护符交给冬泉谷的加隆·石矛。",oEN="Pick up Jaron's Supplies from the snow, then find the wildkin that stole the amulet Jaron spoke of.\n\nBring Jaron's Supplies and the Blue-feathered Amulet to Jaron Stoneshaper at the lodge in Winterspring.",p="啊……你有什么新消息么？",pEN="Aye... Tell me the news.",c="啊，小$g伙子:姑娘，这真是太好了。我以为那些疯狂的野兽毁掉了我所有的财产……\n\n但是你找到了我的工具，更重要的是，你找到了护符！我在想，为什么枭兽会如此认真地守护这件东西……无论如何，下次我可不会随便就到它们那里去了！",cEN="Well, I expected to hear as much, lad. I figured that the crazed beasts destroyed all of my belongings...\n\nBut you did find my tools, and most importantly, the amulet! I wonder why the wildkin so fiercely defended this item... In any case, I'll think twice before heading their way again!"}
Q[4865]={d="若不是亲眼所见，我绝不会相信这是真的。复仇之灵已经来到了千针石林！\n\n<哈加尔擦了擦额头上的汗。>\n\n$n，你必须尽快采取行动！现在就去找到莫特加·火鬃，他住在乱风岗西北部的白沙岗哨，他知道该怎么做！",dEN="If I did not see that with my own eyes I would never have believed it to be true. Vengeance has come to Thousand Needles!\n\n<Hagar wipes his brow.>\n\n<name>, you must act quickly! Go now and seek out Motega Firemane; he is located at Whitereach Post just northwest of Freewind Post along the road. He will know what to do!",o="向莫特加·火鬃汇报你的发现。",oEN="Report your findings to Motega Firemane at Whitereach Post in Thousand Needles.",c="复仇？！那么，阿利卡拉的传说是真的了。这确实是一个必须尽快解决的问题。",cEN="Vengeance! So, the legend of Arikara is true. Indeed, this is a problem that must be resolved immediately."}
Q[4866]={d="这大概是世界上最厉害的毒药之一，$r！\n\n我几次潜入黑石塔时，听到那些黑铁矮人在谈论它有多致命。他们管它叫\"母亲的乳汁\"，因蛛网洞穴里那只又大又恶心的蜘蛛——烟网蛛后而得名。\n\n那么，我需要你做的是：一份活的乳汁样本，要流淌在你自己血管里的。光把腺体带给我可不够！让她毒到你，然后再回来找我！\n\n到时候……我就来挤你！\n\n<他搓着手，满心期待。>",dEN="It's probably one of the most potent poisons in the world, <race>!\n\nI've overheard the Blackrock speaking about its lethality in my jaunts into the Spire. They call it 'Mother's Milk', named after Mother Smolderweb, the big nasty spider in the Skitterweb cave.\n\nNow here's what I need from you: A live sample of the Milk, flowing through YOUR veins. Just bringing me the gland won't be enough! Get her to poison you and come back to me!\n\nThen... I get to milk ya!\n\n<Rubs his hands together in anticipation.>",o="你可以在黑石塔的中心地带找到烟网蛛后。与她战斗，让她在你体内注入毒汁。如果你有能力的话，就杀死她吧。当你中毒之后，回到狼狈不堪的约翰那儿，他会从你的身体里抽取这些“蛛后的乳汁”。",oEN="In the heart of Blackrock Spire you will find Mother Smolderweb. Engage her and get her to poison you. Chances are good that you will have to kill her as well. Return to Ragged John when you are poisoned so that he can 'milk' you.",p="<狼狈不堪的约翰使劲拧了拧你。>",pEN="<Ragged John pinches you.>",c="这肯定可以酿成最好的麦芽酒！\n\n呃，你以为它是干什么用的？毒药？\n\n孩子，你疯了……",cEN="This is gonna make the best ale yet!\n\nEh, what did you think I was gonna use this for? Poison or something??\n\nCrazy kids..."}
Q[4867]={d="啊！说起来就麻烦了！\n\n拿上这张便笺！把我的蟑螂牵过来！",dEN="Argh! So hard to speak!\n\nTake this note! Get me my mojo!",o="阅读瓦罗什的卷轴。将瓦罗什的蟑螂交给他。",oEN="Read Warosh's Scroll. Bring Warosh's Mojo to Warosh.",p="啊！你把我的魔精带来了吗？",pEN="Ah! Do you have my mojo?",c="啊哈！我已经能感觉到力量回来了。我的神志也不再受乌洛克诅咒的折磨。\n\n谢谢你，$n！谦逊不适合我，但我必须承认你的帮助。\n\n祝你在黑石塔的旅途中好运。你要是以为自己能爬到塔顶，那你就是个$g蠢货:蠢货;，但你的勇气毋庸置疑。",cEN="Aha! I can already feel my powers returning to me. And my mind is no longer wracked by Urok's curse.\n\nThank you, <name>! Humility is below me, but I must acknowledge your aid.\n\nAnd I bid you fortune in your journeys through Blackrock Spire. You are a fool to think you could make your way to the top, but your bravery is without question."}
Q[4881]={d="那个牛头人卡纳提·灰云竟敢在千针石林设立狩猎营地。我们必须杀掉他，以及所有追随他的人，彻底铲平这个狩猎营地。我们在大升降梯西南的小据点集结。|n",dEN="The Tauren, Kanati Greycloud is bold to set up a hunting camp in Thousand Needles. We must kill him to rid this hunting camp and all who may follow him. We will converge at the small post Southwest of the Great Lift.",o="将暗杀计划通知给白沙岗哨的卡纳提·灰云。",oEN="Warn Kanati Greycloud at Whitereach Post of the plot to kill him.",c="他们要来杀我？我会让他们看到牛头人是怎样战斗的！",cEN="They come to kill me? I will show them how a Tauren fights!"}
Q[4882]={d="你不确定那只刚被杀的野生枭兽脖子上掉落的项链有什么意义。它闪着明亮的光，忽明忽暗地缓缓变幻。\n\n也许特鲁尔·灾祸能告诉你更多，他对枭兽的了解似乎相当渊博。你$g或许:或许;该去问问他。",dEN="You are unsure of the significance of the necklace that fell from the neck of the recently-slain wildkin. It glows brightly, slowly fading in and out.\n\nTrull Failbane might be able to tell you more, since his knowledge of the wildkin seems extensive. Perhaps you should ask him about it.",o="把蓝羽项链交给血毒岗哨的特鲁尔·法贝恩。",oEN="Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Trull Failbane at Bloodvenom Post.",p="$g准备好:准备好;接受另一个任务了吗？",pEN="Reporting for another assignment?",c="一项重要的发现？",cEN="An important discovery?"}
Q[4883]={d="我确实比你更了解冬泉谷的枭兽，但是我不太了解它们所使用的魔法。我知道谁可以告诉你有关这条项链的更多信息。\n\n雷霆崖的纳拉·蛮鬃是这方面的专家，去问问她吧。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="While I do possess much knowledge about the owlbeasts you defeated in Winterspring, I am not very learned on the subject of the magics they wield. But I do believe I know of one that would be able to examine the necklace and most likely tell you what it is.\n\nNara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff is an expert in this field; see her. Good luck, <name>.",o="把蓝羽项链交给纳拉·蛮鬃。",oEN="Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Nara Wildmane.",p="我能帮你什么忙吗，$n？",pEN="How may I help you, <name>?",c="这条项链中所蕴含的能量，$n……我相信它只有一个来源。\n\n<纳拉闭上眼睛，然后沉默了一会儿。>\n\n枭兽以前并不是这样的，它们被误导了，堕落了。它们曾经肩负着神圣的使命——暗夜精灵的女神艾露恩创造了这种生物，让它们守护她的圣地。\n\n虽然这听起来与现在的局面并没有什么关系，但我希望你看得更深一些。\n\n总有一天，你会理解的。谢谢你把这个交给我，$n。",cEN="The energy of this necklace, <name>. I believe that it has only one source.\n\n<Nara closes her eyes and is quiet for a moment.>\n\nThe wildkin, now misguided and confused, were once not so. They once had a purpose, and were guided to serve. The night elf goddess Elune created these creatures to guard her most sacred areas.\n\nWhile this fact may seem like it holds little value; I urge you to look deeper.\n\nYou will learn, in time. Thank you for bringing this to me, <name>."}
Q[4901]={d="在山脊的顶部有一座艾露恩的祭坛。根据我所了解到的情况，我们必须点燃那一带每座洞穴里的火炬，然后我们就可以直接到祭坛那边去了。\n\n我在凯斯利尔废墟的石头上发现了一些用符文书写的咒语，我想这可以打开通往祭坛的路。我需要你来帮忙点燃那些火炬，与此同时，我将诵读咒语。\n\n如果我们成功了，你就可以把我们的发现汇报给艾瑞拉斯了！",dEN="At the very top of the ridge lies what I believe to be an altar of the goddess Elune. From what I can tell, we need to light the five torches in each cave, and then we will be able to access the altar directly.\n\nI transcribed some incantations carved into the stone in the ancient ruins of Kel'Theril, which I believe are the secret to unlocking the altar. I'll need your help to light each torch, while I recite the spell.\n\nIf we are successful, you'll be able to report our findings to Erelas!",o="在兰莎尔拉尝试激活艾露恩祭坛的过程中保护她。然后将你的发现报告给鲁瑟兰村的艾瑞拉斯·琥珀。",oEN="Protect Ranshalla while she attempts to reactivate the Altar of Elune. Report your findings to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.",c="你找到兰莎尔拉了没有？",cEN="Did you meet up with Ranshalla?"}
Q[4902]={d="这可真叫人着迷！\n\n我一直在思考事情的真相……呃，你也应该跟我们分享这些知识！立即到大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔那儿去，你可以在达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区里找到他。把这里所发生的一切都告诉他，就像你刚才跟我说的那样。我敢说他肯定会对此很感兴趣！\n\n这可是个重要的情报，$n！",dEN="That's fascinating!\n\nI have always wondered about the truth... Well, you must share this knowledge, definitely! Go to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm right away -- you'll find him in Darnassus, in the Cenarion Circle. Explain to him what happened, just the same as you told me. I'm sure he will be just as interested!\n\nThis is important information, <name>!",o="与达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",c="别犹豫，告诉我你为什么来这儿。\n\n哦，是吗？嗯，好吧。\n\n谢谢你直接了当地告诉我这个，开门见山总是最好的……但是……没错。塞纳里奥议会的德鲁伊对枭兽已有所了解。它们是艾露恩的宠物，被指派去守护那些最神圣的地方。\n\n虽然这不是什么新闻，但我还是对你的努力表示敬意。拿着这个——这是给你的奖赏。",cEN="Do not hesitate; tell me why you have come.\n\nOh, yes? Hmm. Well.\n\nThank you for bringing this straight to me; it is always best to go right to the top... But... Yes. The druids of the Cenarion Circle have known of the Wildkin for some time. That they are pets of Elune, and were chosen to guard the most sacred of places.\n\nSo while this isn't news, I definitely compliment you on your effort. Here, take this -- it is something that seems suitable for such a deed."}
Q[4903]={d="根据军官高图斯的命令，黑石塔的下列主要首领必须被消灭：\n\n对我们造成巨大威胁的欧莫克大王。\n\n残忍无情的巨魔指挥官沃恩。\n\n监督者维姆萨拉克。\n\n如果你找到何重要的文件，也必须一并上缴。\n\n成功则受人敬仰。\n\n失败则被人遗忘。",dEN="By order of Warlord Goretooth, the following inhabitants of Blackrock Spire must be destroyed:\n\nThe rotund menace, Highlord Omokk.\n\nThe cruel and ruthless troll, War Master Voone.\n\nOverlord Wyrmthalak, taskmaster of the lesser city.\n\nYou will also be required to return any important documents that you may find.\n\nSucceed and be honored.\n\nFail and be forgotten.",o="杀死欧莫克大王、指挥官沃恩和维姆萨拉克。找到重要的黑石文件，然后向卡加斯的军官高图斯汇报。",oEN="Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.",p="<督军高图斯向你敬礼。>",pEN="<Warlord Goretooth salutes.>",c="<督军高图斯暗绿色的皮肤在一瞬间变得苍白。>",cEN="<Warlord Goretooth's dull green skin turns a pasty white for a brief moment.>"}
Q[4904]={d="阿纳克要和我结婚……但是在我拒绝了他的提议之后，他当晚就回来绑架了我。我的兄弟试图阻止他，但是阿纳克太强大了，他……他杀了我的兄弟，然后把我带到了这里。我可怜的兄弟……\n\n$n，你能护送我离开恐怖图腾营地吗？求你了……我要回到萨利亚身边去！她一定非常思念我。",dEN="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong. He... he slew my brother and then brought me here. My poor brother...\n\n<name>, could you escort me out of the Darkcloud Pinnacle? Please... I need to get back to Thalia! She must be worried sick about me.",o="护送拉克塔·风歌离开恐怖图腾营地，然后与乱风岗的萨利亚谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",p="萨利亚我好想你……",pEN="Thalia Amberhide:",c="谢谢你，$n。我知道她会回到我身边的。她把你的英勇事迹以及你帮她逃走的事情都告诉了我。这些东西原本属于她的兄弟，现在她想让你收下它们。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Deep in my bones I knew that she would find her way back to me. She told me of your bravery and how you helped her escape. These items belonged to her brother. I know she would want you to have them."}
Q[4906]={d="第二个萨特营地在费伍德森林的北部，他们的头领是萨瓦里克。这个诡计多端的恶魔在不断吸收费伍德森林中的那些堕落生物的力量。\n\n萨瓦瑟拉斯和他的手下只不过是一个宏大计划的一部分，他们要培养出一座堕落的月亮井，然后用它为萨瓦里克提供力量。\n\n现在萨瓦瑟拉斯已经成为历史了，那么，$n，你的任务就是到北部去，打败萨瓦里克。",dEN="A second encampment of satyrs threatens the land of Felwood towards the north, led by the cruel Xavaric. The vile betrayers and tricksters feed upon the corruption of the native creatures of Felwood.\n\nXavathras and his minions were only part of a larger plan -- to cultivate a corrupted moonwell, and then provide the spoils to Xavaric.\n\nNow that Xavathras is out of the way, finish this task, <name>. Head to the north and defeat Xavaric.",o="费伍德森林的艾瑞丹·蓝风要你去杀掉8个碧火唤魔者、8个碧火背叛者、8个碧火欺诈者和萨瓦里克。任务完成之后回到艾瑞丹那里复命。",oEN="Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed.",p="请你快点去结束费伍德森林的生物所遭受的痛苦。",pEN="Please, put and end to the suffering of Felwood's creatures.",c="感谢你所做的一切，$n。愿艾露恩保佑你。",cEN="Thank you for all you have done, <name>. May Elune protect you and guide you on the path ahead."}
Q[4907]={d="嗨，$n。你还记得丁奇·斯迪波尔吗？嗯，她还记得你！她让我留意你的行踪，因为……她需要你的帮助。我认为这可能跟她对龙类的研究工作有关。\n\n你应该到燃烧平原的烈焰峰去找她谈谈。",dEN="Hi, <name>. Remember Tinkee Steamboil? Well, she remembers you! She sent me a message to keep an eye out for you, because... she needs your help again. I think it has something to do with her studies on dragons.\n\nYou should speak to her in the Burning Steppes, at the Flame Crest.",o="与丁奇·斯迪波尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.",c="费尔诺克说得没错！我又需要你的帮助了，而这一次……会非常危险。\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？？",cEN="Felnok was right! I do need your help again, and this time... it's going to be really dangerous.\n\nAre you ready??"}
Q[4921]={d="我们在一个小小的牛头人营地里作战，然后就被冲散了——她独自与三个刺背野猪人交战。形势越来越不妙，我引开了一些敌人，结果她又很快被新赶到的敌人包围了。在狂怒之下，我冲向敌人，但是他们人多势众，很轻松地就把我打倒了。\n\n我醒来的时候，一位牛头人德鲁伊正在照料我的伤口，他是在黄金之路上找到我的。\n\n$c，请你帮我寻找我妻子的音讯。",dEN="We battled in a small tauren camp when we were separated--she held three of the Bristlebacks off by herself. But the odds began to overwhelm us. I led some away only to see her overwhelmed by newcomers. In my rage, I turned to face my enemies, but they brought me down easily with their vast numbers.\n\nI awoke to a tauren druid tending my wounds--he had come across me on the Gold Road as I fell.\n\nPlease, <class>, find some sign of my wife.",o="找到曼科里克的妻子，然后回到十字路口找他。",oEN="Find Mankrik's wife and then return to him in the Crossroads.",p="你找到她的线索了吗？我胸中的疼痛告诉我，也许最糟糕的事情已经发生了，但我还心存一点点希望……",pEN="Have you found any sign of her at all? The pain in my chest tells me that the worst has happened, but I have hope you will find her safe and sound.",c="我明白。谢谢你，$c。",cEN="I understand. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[4941]={d="雷德还活着？\n\n不可能！\n\n据说雷德在数十年前就被杀掉了。\n\n去寻求伊崔格的建议吧，$n。没有谁能比他更了解黑石氏族的情况了，如果这上面所写的都是真的，那么你应该通知伊崔格。谁都有复仇的权利。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛找到他。\n\n在你跟伊崔格谈过话之后，便去与酋长交流一下，搞清楚他想要如何处理这个问题。",dEN="Rend lives?\n\nImpossible!\n\nIt had been thought that Rend was slain decades ago.\n\nSeek out the wisdom of Eitrigg, <name>. None know the workings of the Blackrock better than he and if what is written here bares truth, Eitrigg should be informed. No person should be denied the right of vengeance.\n\nYou will find him in Orgrimmar.\n\nOnce you have spoken with Eitrigg, confer with the Warchief to find out what he wishes to do about this problem.",o="和奥格瑞玛的伊崔格谈一谈。讨论完毕后，咨询萨尔的意见。\n\n你回忆起曾在萨尔的大厅中见过伊崔格。",oEN="Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall.\n\nYou recall having seen Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber.",p="你没看见我很忙吗？",pEN="Can you not see that I must not be interrupted?",c="<萨尔听到你带来的消息之后显得有些沮丧。>",cEN="<Thrall appears dismayed by the news you bring.>"}
Q[4961]={d="啊，一颗召唤师宝珠——污染一定就是从它里面来的。如果你想使用它，我们就必须把里面的恶魔驱除出去。这对我来说很容易。\n\n难的部分归你。我把它放出来之后，你必须杀死它。\n\n而且动作要快。如果你拖太久，它就会回到宝珠里，我们就得重来一遍！\n\n所以做好准备，$n。备好你最强的法术和药水，有条件的话再带上个朋友。因为这可不会好看。",dEN="Ah, a summoner's orb--this is where the taint must be coming from. We must exorcise the demon within it if you're to use it. That I can do easily.\n\nYou're the one who has the hard job. You must kill the demon once I release it.\n\nAnd you'll have to be quick. If you take too long then he'll return to the orb and we'll have to start over!\n\nSo get yourself ready, <name>. Prepare your strongest spells and keep your potions handy, and go get a friend if you have one. Because this isn't going to be pretty.",o="杀死宝珠之魔，然后与塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.",p="你必须杀死那个恶魔，将它永远地从宝珠中驱逐出去，$n。",pEN="You'll have to kill that demon to remove its presence permanently from the orb, <name>.",c="干得好，$n！你让那个恶魔吃了苦头，看来短时间内它是不会忘了你所展现出的强大力量和技巧的，现在你可以带着净化过的宝珠回去找梅纳拉，然后好好地利用这颗宝珠。\n\n祝你好运，$c。也许以后我们还能再见面的。",cEN="Nicely done, <name>! You gave that demon a lesson he won't soon forget. You've shown great power and skill. Now I suppose it's time you return to Menara with your cleansed orb so you can put it to good use.\n\nGood luck, <class>. Perhaps our paths will cross again."}
Q[4962]={d="这么说，你决定去捕获地狱犬的灵魂，这很好。\n\n带着这颗红宝石——你必须带着它才能捕获那种恶魔的灵魂。你应该很熟悉它的使用方法：当地狱犬快要死亡的时候，就使用这颗宝石，它会替你完成剩下的工作。\n\n我建议你到凄凉之地去，在那里收服一头地狱犬。\n\n你成功之后就把捕获到的灵魂和红宝石都交给梅纳拉。",dEN="So, you have chosen to capture the soul of a felhound, good.\n\nTake this ruby--with it, you will be able to capture the creature's soul. It works very similar to spells you already know: when the creature is close to dying, use the gem and it should do the rest of the work for you.\n\nI would suggest going to Desolace and trying your hand at any of the felhounds there. Those should do nicely.\n\nAfter you're successful, take both the captured spirit and your ruby to Menara.",o="带上地狱犬红宝石到凄凉之地去，用它捕获一只地狱犬的灵魂。成功之后，将地狱犬红宝石和被禁锢的地狱犬灵魂交给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德。",oEN="Take the Felhas Ruby and use it on one of the Felhounds found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Felhas Ruby and the Imprisoned Felhound Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="怎么了，$n？你选好了吗？地狱火还是地狱犬？\n\n每种选择都是个人的事，应该反映出你的长处和短处。$g一位:一位; $c不去弥补自己的短板，反而一味强化已有的优势，这也不是头一回了。有时候，压制敌人和成为一个更均衡的施法者一样有效。",pEN="Yes, <name>? Have you chosen? Infernal or felhound?\n\nEach choice is personal and should reflect your strengths and weaknesses. It is not unheard of for a <class> to enhance themselves further instead of making up in areas they lack. Sometimes overpowering an enemy is just as strong a tactic than becoming a more balanced spell caster.",c="啊，恶魔犬的灵魂。干得好，$n。\n\n现在只要你把到灵魂和净化过的宝珠都给我，我就可以将这两者融合起来了。",cEN="Ah, the spirit of a felhound. Well done, <name>.\n\nWhen I have both the spirit and the cleansed orb, I will merge the two for you, but not until then."}
Q[4963]={d="这么说，你决定去捕获地狱火的灵魂，这很好。\n\n带着这颗绿宝石——你必须带着它才能捕获那种恶魔的灵魂。你应该很熟悉它的使用方法：当地狱火快要死亡的时候，就使用这颗宝石，它会替你完成剩下的工作。\n\n我建议你到凄凉之地去，在那里收服一个地狱火。\n\n你成功之后就把捕获到的灵魂和绿宝石都交给梅纳拉。",dEN="So, you have chosen to capture the soul of an infernal, good.\n\nTake this emerald--with it, you will be able to capture the creature's soul. It works very similar to spells you already know: when the creature is close to dying, use the gem and it should do the rest of the work for you.\n\nI would suggest going to Desolace and trying your hand at any of the infernals there. Those should do nicely.\n\nAfter you're successful, take both the captured spirit and your emerald to Menara.",o="带上地狱火绿宝石到凄凉之地去，用它捕获一个地狱火的灵魂。成功之后，将地狱火绿宝石和被禁锢的地狱火灵魂交给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德。",oEN="Take the Infus Emerald and use it on one of the Infernals found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Infus Emerald and the Imprisoned Infernal Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="怎么了，$n？你选好了吗？地狱火还是地狱犬？\n\n每种选择都是个人的事，应该反映出你的长处和短处。$g一位:一位; $c不去弥补自己的短板，反而一味强化已有的优势，这也不是头一回了。有时候，压制敌人和成为一个更均衡的施法者一样有效。",pEN="Yes, <name>? Have you chosen? Infernal or felhound?\n\nEach choice is personal and should reflect your strengths and weaknesses. It is not unheard of for a <class> to enhance themselves further instead of making up in areas they lack. Sometimes overpowering an enemy is just as strong a tactic than becoming a more balanced spell caster.",c="啊，地狱火的灵魂。干得好，$n。\n\n现在只要你把到灵魂和净化过的宝珠都给我，我就可以将这两者融合起来了。",cEN="Ah, the spirit of an infernal. Well done, <name>.\n\nWhen I have both the spirit and the cleansed orb, I will merge the two for you, but not until then."}
Q[4964]={d="我马上就开始为你制作宝珠，并将新的恶魔禁锢在里面。等宝珠完成之后，你可以选择是把它制成法杖还是保留这颗宝珠。我始终认为术士应该选择自己最喜欢的武器……所以这次我也没理由不按老规矩办。",dEN="I will get started immediately on crafting your orb and infusing your new demon into it. When done, you will have the choice of having it in the form of a staff or orb. I always felt it was important to cater to a warlock's chosen weapon... I see no reason not to continue that practice.",o="等待梅纳拉·沃伦德完成达奥拉赫宝珠，然后再与她谈一谈。",oEN="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again.",c="完成了，$n。告诉我你喜欢哪一种就行了:法杖是要用两只手拿的，而宝珠只需一只手拿着，因此你就可以腾出手来使用匕首或是长剑。\n\n战胜恶魔犬是件很了不起的事情，这件东西作为给你的回报是再合适不过了。希望你以后能掌握更强大的力量，$n。",cEN="It is done, <name>. Simply tell me which you'd prefer: a staff that would require you to use both hands, or an orb so you may use a dagger or sword as your weapon.\n\nTackling a felhound was a great feat on your part. I am sure your item will serve you well in the future. Continue to work hard in the arts, <name>. I will be awaiting details of your exploits."}
Q[4965]={d="哎呀，哎呀，哎呀……看到你的力量不断增长，我真是高兴，$n。我敢打赌，你已经可以去和贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·虚空行者谈谈了。如果你从没和她打过交道，那么我告诉你，我还没见过有哪位物品制作专家——尤其是<sobre todo los orbes>——能如此轻易地囚禁一个恶魔为我们所用。\n\n如果你有兴趣，她就在贫瘠之地棘齿城上方斯坦哈德的塔里。",dEN="Well, well, well... a pleasure to see you're growing in power, <name>. I'd wager you'd be about ready to speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens. If you haven't spoken to her before, then let me tell you, I don't think I've ever met another expert in the creation of items--orbs specifically--that can inprison even a demon to serve our will so easily.\n\nIf you're interested, she's in Strahad's tower above Ratchet in the Barrens.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，你确实在寻求一些更……实在的东西，$g真的:真的;。如果你真的准备好了，我可以帮你。\n\n看到我们这一族的人以知识之外的形式追求更强的力量，真是令人欣慰的改变。\n\n那么，你觉得自己准备好了吗，$n？$g真的:真的;$g真的:真的;",cEN="Ah, you do seek something more... substantial. That I can help you if you truly are prepared.\n\nIt's a welcome change to see one of our kind seeking more power in forms other than just knowledge.\n\nSo, do you feel you're ready, <name>?"}
Q[4966]={d="但是，半人马的数量可能比我想象中的要多，我请求你，$n，与我一起反击这些可耻的暗杀者吧。",dEN="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, <name>, to fight with me against these vile assassins.",o="保护卡纳提·灰云免受半人马的袭击。",oEN="Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",c="谢谢你的帮助，$n。没有你，我可对付不了他们。",cEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. I couldn't have held them off without you."}
Q[4967]={d="你还是个$g蠢货:蠢货;，还在追逐凡人的那些虚饰。没错，我就是带着傲慢对你说话。我看着你站在我面前，只想发笑。你真可悲！\n\n不过我怎么想并不重要。重要的是那些愿意与你打交道的人怎么想！而这一次，尽管以我最专业的判断并不赞成，掌权者仍认为你需要更多。\n\n如果这是你争取的东西，那你就该去和棘齿城上方那座塔里的梅纳拉·虚空行者谈谈。我想你不久前见过她。",dEN="Still a fool, and still seeking the trappings of mortals. Yes, I speak to you with arrogance. I see you before me and I laugh. You're pathetic!\n\nBut it matters not what I think. It only matters what those willing to deal with you thinks! And in this case, against my better judgment, those with some portion of power feel you deserve more.\n\nIf this is something you strive for then you should speak with Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet. I believe you have met her before some time ago.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，你确实在寻求一些更……实在的东西，$g真的:真的;。如果你真的准备好了，我可以帮你。\n\n看到我们这一族的人$g追求:追求;知识之外的力量，真是令人欣慰的改变。\n\n那么，$g你觉得自己准备好了吗:你觉得自己准备好了吗;，$n？",cEN="Ah, you do seek something more... substantial. That I can help you if you truly are prepared.\n\nIt's a welcome change to see one of our kind seeking more power in forms other than just knowledge.\n\nSo, do you feel you're ready, <name>?"}
Q[4968]={d="嗯，你居然大有长进……这真令人吃惊。我曾认为你肯定已经魔法的力量拉入了堕落的深渊，那么，让我们来继续增强你的力量，如何？\n\n如果你想要看看自己到底有多大的本事，就到棘齿城外的那座塔里去找梅纳拉·沃伦德，她会给你指引的。",dEN="Hmm, you've made it this far... truly astonishing. I would have thought the corruption of channeling the arcane would have seeped into your very soul and driven you mad by now. How about we try and push you further then?\n\nIf you want to test your skill, seek out Menara Voidrender above Ratchet in Strahad's tower. She will guide you.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，你确实在寻求一些更……实在的东西，$g真的:真的;。如果你真的准备好了，我可以帮你。\n\n看到我们这一族的人$g追求:追求;知识之外的力量，真是令人欣慰的改变。\n\n那么，$g你觉得自己准备好了吗:你觉得自己准备好了吗;，$n？",cEN="Ah, you do seek something more... substantial. That I can help you if you truly are prepared.\n\nIt's a welcome change to see one of our kind seeking more power in forms other than just knowledge.\n\nSo, do you feel you're ready, <name>?"}
Q[4969]={d="哈哈！你干得相当不错，年轻的$c，$g真的:真的;，$g真的:真的;。\n\n假以时日，地狱火和恐惧魔王都会向你俯首！\n\n但在那一天到来之前，你还得依靠凡俗种族亲手打造的武器。\n\n你似乎已经为下一件这样的作品做好了准备，如果你愿意，梅纳拉·虚空行者想和你谈谈！她就在俯瞰棘齿城港口小镇的斯坦哈德之塔附近。准备好了就去吧。",dEN="Haha! You're doing very well for yourself, young <class>.\n\nGiven time, infernals and dreadlords will bow before you!\n\nBut until that time comes, you must still rely on weapons forged by the hands of the mortal races.\n\nYou seem prepared for another such creation, and if you are willing, Menara Voidrender would speak with you! She is near Strahad's tower overlooking the port town of Ratchet. Go there when you are ready.",o="与贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",c="啊，你确实在寻求一些更……实在的东西，$g真的:真的;。如果你真的准备好了，我可以帮你。\n\n看到我们这一族的人$g追求:追求;知识之外的力量，真是令人欣慰的改变。\n\n那么，$g你觉得自己准备好了吗:你觉得自己准备好了吗;，$n？",cEN="Ah, you do seek something more... substantial. I can help you if you truly are prepared.\n\nIt's a welcome change to see one of our kind seeking more power in forms other than just knowledge.\n\nSo, do you feel you're ready, <name>?"}
Q[4970]={d="如果你想要证明自己，可以先从一项简单但很重要的任务开始。\n\n从遍布冬泉谷的奇美拉和碎齿熊身上收集它们的肉。把肉交给我，这样我就可以用它来喂养那些正在接受训练的霜刃豹了。",dEN="If you wish to prove yourself, you may begin by doing a very simple, but very important task.\n\nGather meat from the chimaera and from the shardtooth bears in the area. Bring it to me so that I may use it to feed the frostsabers that are being trained.",o="收集5块碎齿熊肉和5块冰风奇美拉肉，把它们交给冬泉谷的雷沃·霜翼。",oEN="Collect 5 Shardtooth Meats and 5 Chillwind Meats for Rivern Frostwind in Winterspring.",p="纪律和决心是你的目标。我会让你完成若干个简单的任务，每次你都必须尽全力。",pEN="Discipline and determination are your goals. I may ask you to do a simple task many times; you must perform to the best of your ability each time.",c="谢谢你的帮助，$n。我对你的评价随着时间与日俱增啊。",cEN="Thank you for assisting me, <name>. My opinion of you grows as time passes."}
Q[4971]={d="一股邪恶的力量——很可能是天灾军团——出现在安多哈尔，扰乱了时间的流动！我可以尝试维持现有的时间进程，并修正它所遭到的破坏，但是我必须在一个安静的环境中才能做这些事情，这就需要你的帮助。\n\n时光寄生虫——以改变的时间流为能源的食腐虫——在安多哈尔的仓库中大量繁殖，扭曲的蓝色脉搏是它们身体唯一可见的部分。它们阻挠了我的施法过程，所以，$n，请你使用时光置换器帮我除掉这些寄生虫。",dEN="Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted.\n\nTemporal parasites - carrion that feed on the strands of time's altered flow - now infest the silos of Andorhal. A blue pulse of distortion is their only visual marker. They slow my auguries; please <name>, help me by using this temporal displacer to root out these parasites.",o="在安多哈尔的一处仓库附近使用时光置换器，使时光寄生虫现身。\n\n杀掉10只时光寄生虫，然后将时光置换器还给西瘟疫之地安多哈尔旅店的克罗米。",oEN="Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.\n\nSlay 10 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",p="当时间的进程被打乱时，时光寄生虫就会出现。现在就是这种状况，这可真是件令人烦恼的事儿。\n\n除掉那些时光寄生虫将有助于我控制不断恶化的情况。如果你完成了任务，我应该可以很快感知到。",pEN="Temporal parasites are a common malady present wherever the flow of time has been tampered with. I sense that many are present, and this is disturbing.\n\nRooting out whatever ones you can find will help me be able to take a better hold on the deteriorating temporal situation here. I will be able to sense when this has been achieved.",c="现在修补时间似乎容易些了，谢谢你，$n。虽然你也许永远无法完全理解时间线断裂的后果，但我很感激你明白必须尽快应对这一状况——我越来越怀疑这是天灾军团一手造成的恶行。\n\n给你报酬对我来说并无坏处，凡人。你最伟大的功绩尚未到来，一件小饰物绝不会改变你未来的命运。不过，你持续的帮助，正是我和龙族或许都用得上的……",cEN="Time feels easier to mend now, thank you <name>. While you might not understand fully the consequences of a fractured timeline, I appreciate that you understand the urgency of countering what I suspect more and more to be a Scourge-driven malfeasance.\n\nI see no harm in rewarding you for your assistance, mortal. Your greatest feats are to come, and the awarding of a bauble will certainly not alter your future destiny. Your continued aid, however, is something that I and the dragonflight could use..."}
Q[4972]={d="我需要借助你的能力进入这间房间以外的世界，$n。请允许我稍后向你解释。\n\n你发现这间房间与安多哈尔其他地方的不同了吧。我的飞龙以不同的方式在不同的时间线上工作着。要修复安多哈尔的损伤，我要从一个不同的时间线着手，避免过分污染它。要继续进行这项工作的话，我需要一些时间饰品，其中一个是在瘟疫袭击安多哈尔时产生的。在建筑物残骸中寻找时间饰品，这些建筑都是这个曾经繁华的城市的一部分。",dEN="I need you to reach into the world beyond this room, <name>. Allow me to explain.\n\nYou see the difference in this room compared to the rest of Andorhal. My dragonflight works in many different ways and in many different timelines. To mend Andorhal's damage, I now act from a different timeline as not to overly contaminate it. To continue this though I need time trinkets, ones trapped from when the plague hit. Find them in lockboxes found in the ruined buildings that make up this once proud city.",o="在安多哈尔城中四处散落的保险箱里找到5只安多哈尔怀表，然后把它们交给西瘟疫之地安多哈尔旅店里的克罗米。",oEN="Locate 5 Andorhal Watches, found in lockboxes amongst the rubble of the city. Return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",p="我寻找的那些计时器都是简单的小装置，当瘟疫侵袭安多哈尔的时候，它们就停止走动了。\n\n时间永远不会停止，而你找到的怀表会自动调整回正确时间……就是说，只要这儿仍在混乱之中。",pEN="The time trinkets I seek are simple devices. They are watches mainly, and their hands are trapped forever when the plague first ravaged Andorhal.\n\nTime is never ending, and the watches you bring to me will invariably find themselves counted out back to their homes... that is, so long as the disturbances continue here.",c="这正是我需要的，$n。谢谢你。\n\n请允许我以此给你一份合适的报酬。你也许不明白自己为何会需要这样一件装置，甚至可能不太清楚它究竟是什么。唉……我无法告诉你它何时会派上用场，你只需知道，将来某个时刻，你会发现它极其有用。至于你要不要$g留到:留到;那个时候……这，我的朋友，由你决定。",cEN="These are exactly what I need, <name>. Thank you.\n\nAllow me to suitably reward you with this. You may not understand what you would need with such a device. You might not even know quite what it really is. Alas, I cannot tell you when you will find it most useful; just know that at some point in the future, you may find this item to have extreme utility and function when consumed. Whether or not you choose to hold on to it until then... this, my friend, is up to you."}
Q[4973]={d="要是你愿意再帮我一次，我就不客气啦。我想要更多的怀表，你也许能在安多哈尔的废墟中找到它们。它们能帮助我们在与扰乱时间线的任何邪恶力量抗衡时保持平衡。\n\n对于交换，我将给你另外一件装备，将来你会发现它的大用处的。",dEN="If you are willing to help once more, I can certainly use your assistance. I'll gladly take more watches you might uncover from the ruins of Andorhal. They certainly help me in maintaining a balance against whatever malign force is meddling with the timeline here.\n\nIn exchange for those watches, I'll give you another item that, in the future, I suspect you'll find quite the use for.",o="在安多哈尔城的废墟里找到5只安多哈尔怀表，然后把它们交给西瘟疫之地安多哈尔旅店里的克罗米。",oEN="Locate 5 Andorhal Watches amongst the rubble of the city, and return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",p="安多哈尔的怀表，就像城镇大厅废墟上的大钟，所有的指针都停留在三点的位置。这便是瘟疫首次席卷城市时带来的效应，指针停止转动了。\n\n几乎所有人都为那天发生的事情惋惜不已，就如人类感知的那样，时间流形成了。青铜龙军团必须坚持守护时间线！",pEN="The watches of Andorhal, much like the large clock on the ruins of the town hall, all are frozen in time at three o'clock. This was when the full effects of the plague first spread out over the city, choking the life out of it.\n\nAs much as we all may regret what happened that day, it has shaped the flow of time as you mortals perceive it. The bronze dragonflight must persevere in protecting the timeline!",c="再次感谢你的帮助。请收下这份礼物。虽然你可能还不知道何时可使用这样的装备，或许将来，时间会揭示出它真正的用意。可以这么说，我已感知到那些即将发生的事情了，$n。",cEN="Again, I thank you for your assistance. Please accept this gift. While you still may not know when to use such an item, perhaps in the future the path of time will reveal its true intentions to you. You could say that I've seen as such happening to you, <name>."}
Q[4974]={d="雷德之所以敢如此放肆，是因为有黑龙军团为他撑腰。\n\n你，$n，要找到穿过升腾大厅的办法。然后找到大酋长雷德·黑手，消灭他——为了部落！\n\n<萨尔一拳砸在王座上。>\n\n下次你回来时，要高高举起他的头颅，然后把它呈给我。做到这一点，你就会作为部落的英雄受到应有的尊敬。",dEN="Rend dares make such grand claims because of the protection he is afforded by the black flight.\n\nYou, <name>, will find a way to pass through the Halls of Ascension. You will then find 'Warchief' Rend Blackhand and you will destroy him - FOR THE HORDE!\n\nThe next time you return, you will hold his head high in triumph and then you shall present it to me. Do this and be honored as a hero of the Horde.",o="前往黑石塔，杀死大酋长雷德·黑手。把他的头带到奥格瑞玛。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand.",p="<他咕哝了一声。>",pEN="<He grunts.>",c="你给了黑石氏族致命的一击，$n。他们的大酋长已死，黑石军团将再度陷入混乱之中。\n\n为了表示对你的敬意，卡利姆多的部落成员都将得到奖赏！",cEN="You have dealt a crippling blow to the forces of Blackrock, <name>. With their Warchief slain, the Blackrock legion is once again thrown into the maw of chaos.\n\nIn honor of your heroics, the people of Kalimdor shall be rewarded!"}
Q[4975]={d="我马上就开始为你制作宝珠，并将新的恶魔禁锢在里面。等宝珠完成之后，你可以选择是把它制成法杖还是保留这颗宝珠。我始终认为术士应该选择自己最喜欢的武器……所以这次我也没理由不按老规矩办。",dEN="I will get started immediately on crafting your orb and infusing your new demon into it. When done, you will have the choice of having it in the form of a staff or orb. I always felt it was important to cater to a warlock's chosen weapon... I see no reason not to continue that practice.",o="等待梅纳拉·沃伦德完成诺奥拉赫宝珠，然后再与她谈一谈。",oEN="Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again.",c="完成了，$n。告诉我你喜欢哪一种就行了:法杖是要用两只手拿的，而宝珠只需一只手拿着，因此你就可以腾出手来使用匕首或是长剑。\n\n战胜地狱火是件很了不起的事情，这件东西作为给你的回报是再合适不过了。希望你以后能掌握更强大的力量，$n。",cEN="It is done, <name>. Simply tell me which you'd prefer: a staff that would require you to use both hands, or an orb so you may use a dagger or sword as your weapon.\n\nTackling the infernal was a great feat on your part and this reward will fit you nicely. I wish you further success in the arts, <name>."}
Q[4976]={d="把净化过的宝珠交给棘齿城的梅纳拉，$n。代我向她问好，一路小心。我真的希望你能应付得了越来越强大的诱惑和腐蚀的力量。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="Take the cleansed orb back to Menara in Ratchet, <name>. Give her my regards and be safe. I truly hope you are able to withstand the temptation and corruption that is sure to come as you follow your path.\n\nGood luck.",o="将净化过的地狱火宝珠交给贫瘠之地的梅纳拉·沃伦德。",oEN="Return the Cleansed Infernal Orb to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.",p="你搜寻塔贝萨和宝珠的事情有没有新的进展，$n？\n\n塔贝萨对魔法的力量可以说是应付自如。我相信如果你能找到她的话，她肯定会帮助你的。",pEN="How goes your search for Tabetha and the orb, <name>?\n\nTabetha has been more than useful when it comes to matters of the arcane. I'm sure she would have no problem aiding you if you're able to find her.",c="干得好，$n。这可是个好东西。\n\n你要做的最后一件事情就是决定要在宝珠中禁锢哪个恶魔。有了它，你便获得了新的力量。",cEN="Well done, <name>. This will do nicely.\n\nThe only thing left for you to do is to decide on which demon you want me to imprison within the cleansed orb. Do that, and you will have a magnificent new item to wield."}
Q[4981]={d="决不要相信地精。这是我多年来总结的经验，$n。\n\n她的名字是比修——我们最机敏的侦察员之一。我发现她在为燃烧平原外面的一个名叫基布雷尔的可疑的宠物商工作，而且非常卖力。更糟糕的是，她在使用部落的资金来做这些事情。\n\n把她给我带回来，要活的。\n\n她已经钻到黑石塔里面去了。去找到她，并把她带回来。\n\n还有，$n，不要让她的甜言蜜语欺骗了你。",dEN="Never trust a goblin. That's what it comes down to, <name>.\n\nBijou is her name - one of our slipperiest operatives. I found out she was working for some shady exotic pet dealer out of the Burning Steppes named Kibler, in essence, two timing us. Worse yet, she was using Horde funds to finance her operations.\n\nI want her brought back here alive.\n\nShe was last seen entering Blackrock Spire. Find her and bring her back.\n\nAnd <name>, do not let her sweet talk you.",o="到黑石塔去查明比修的下落。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.",c="我不骗你，$r。我需要钱！基布勒出手非常、非常大方——比卡加斯远征军能给的多得多。\n\n但别怀疑我的忠诚！你以为我为什么会在这下面？就为了给哪个疯地精弄点奇异动物的蛋或者同样无聊的东西？不，只有真正的傻子才会跑到黑石塔来收集宠物。没错，我不觉得这世上会有多少那种人。\n\n<比修大笑起来。>\n\n我们最不需要的就是那种人繁衍后代。",cEN="I won't lie to you, <race>. I needed the money! Kibler pays very, very well - much better than the K.E.F. ever could.\n\nBut don't doubt my loyalties! Why do you think I'm down here? To get that crazy goblin some exotic animal eggs or something equally inane? No, only someone truly daft would come to Blackrock Spire to collect pets. Yep, I don't reckon too many people like that exist in this world.\n\n<Bijou laughs.>\n\nThe last thing we need are those kinds of people breeding."}
Q[4982]={d="在夜里，当这个地方守备松懈的时候，我就会在城里偷偷地四处走动，记下我所看到的可能会对K.E.F.有战略价值的任何东西。\n\n然而昨晚事情变得非常糟糕，我被一张网绊到并触动了一个机关，我马上把我的侦察装置藏起来去找藏身之所了！不幸的是，我没法取回那套装置。他们已经把巡逻兵的数量增加了两三倍！所有的情报都丢失了。\n\n把我的东西拿回来，我就可以返回K.E.F.去了。",dEN="At night when this place is lightly guarded, I sneak around the city, taking notes and writing down anything I see that could be of some strategic value to the K.E.F.\n\nLast night, however, things went dreadfully wrong. I stumbled across a tripwire and set off an alarm. I stashed my recon gear and ran for cover! Unfortunately, I can't get back to that gear. They've doubled and tripled up the patrols! All that information is lost.\n\nGet my belongings back and I'll return to the K.E.F. peacefully.",o="找到比修的物品并归还给她。你记得她提到过，她把东西藏在城市的最底层。|n",oEN="Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city.",p="找到了吗？",pEN="Any luck?",c="你做到了！等莱克斯洛特拿到这些图纸，他就会忘掉那些他想对我做的恶心事。\n\n$n，你是$g我的英雄:我的英雄;！",cEN="You've done it! Once Lexlort has these plans, he'll forget all about the nasty things he wanted to do to me.\n\n<name>, you're my hero!"}
Q[4983]={d="把这份报告带回去给莱克斯洛特。它能洗刷我蒙污的名声，也必定能让卡加斯远征军在对付这些兽人时占得战略优势。\n\n问我要不要陪你一起去？我手头的活儿太多了。快去吧，他们急需这些报告！|n",dEN="Take this report back to Lexlort. It will redeem my good name and will surely give the K.E.F. a strategic advantage in dealing with these orcs.\n\nCome with you? I've got way too much work to do. Get going, they need these reports as soon as possible!",o="把比修的侦察报告带回去给卡加斯的大法师莱克斯洛特。|n",oEN="Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.",p="那个地精在哪儿？",pEN="Where's the goblin???",c="她又想办法摆脱了另一个困境！这些报告在我们对付黑石兽人时将提供足够的情报。\n\n当然，你也会因你的辛勤工作得到奖赏的。",cEN="I've got to hand it to her; she's managed to weasel her way out of another sticky situation! These reports will prove to be invaluable in our dealings with the Blackrock orcs.\n\nOf course, you will be rewarded for your hard work."}
Q[4984]={d="尽管我不可能以一己之力反抗亡灵天灾，但我仍然来到了这里，尽力治愈他们对大自然造成的伤害。这片土地上的生灵遭受着瘟疫所带来的灾难，这瘟疫使大地窒息。我想请你把我在这里未完成的工作继续下去。\n\n对那些正在忍受折磨的动物们来说，除了仁慈地解放它们，没有什么其它的解决办法了。把附近生病的狼找出来，杀死它们。我请求你，$n，结束它们的痛苦吧……这样做也会令我得到安宁。",dEN="While there was little I could do alone to thwart the Scourge, I nevertheless came to these lands to try and heal the damage done to nature. Animals suffer from the plague that continues to choke these lands, unable to find mercy and peace. I ask for you to continue what I could not finish here.\n\nThere is no salvation for the suffering animals but a sweet and merciful release. Seek out diseased wolves nearby and put them down. Please <name>, end their misery - doing so will surely soothe mine.",o="消灭八只染病的狼，然后回到西瘟疫之地挣扎之痕的穆格里斯·深河那里。|n|n",oEN="Destroy 8 Diseased Wolves, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.",p="感染了瘟疫的狼必须被除掉，$n。他们所患的疾病无法治愈。我曾经尝试过……我一直在试图拯救他们，直到我自己也死于瘟疫。",pEN="The wolves that are infected with the plague must be put down, <name>. The disease they carry cannot be cured. I tried... I tried until I succumbed to the plague myself.",c="我……我感觉到那些被你杀死的狼的灵魂现在已经安息了。它们……和我一样，都感谢你仁慈地解放了它们的灵魂。\n\n那些狼已经不在这个被诅咒的地方继续忍受痛苦了，$n。但是，我还需要你再次帮助我……",cEN="I... I sense that the souls of those wolves you have put down now have rest. They - and I - thank you for a merciful release.\n\nThe wolves are not alone in their suffering within this damnable place, <name>. Please, I have need of you once more."}
Q[4985]={d="在我们所在地的东方，东瘟疫之地边界的附近，从前骄傲而威严的灰熊在乡村游走。亡灵天灾所释放的瘟疫也已将这些动物趋散。它们在乡村游荡，饱受了肌肉僵硬和皮肉腐烂之苦。\n\n我请求你也去结束它们的痛苦。治疗它们苦难的唯一方法就是让其痛快的死去，这必须由你亲手来完成。",dEN="To the east of where we are, near where the Eastern Plaguelands begin, once proud and majestic grizzlies roamed the countryside. The plague released by the Scourge has sundered these beasts too. They wander the countryside, agonized by the stiffening of their muscles and the rotting of their fur and flesh.\n\nI ask of you to end their misery as well. The only cure for their suffering is a swift death, one that must be ministered by your hand.",o="消灭8只生病的灰熊，然后去找西瘟疫之地嚎哭鬼屋的穆格雷斯·深水。",oEN="Destroy 8 Diseased Grizzlies, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.",p="我听到你的脚步声了，$n。我的视力已经消退，但我仍然能感觉到周围的事物。你让那些受尽疾病折磨的灰熊安息了吗？",pEN="I hear your footsteps, <name>. My vision has faded from me, but I still am able to sense things around me. Have you ended the misery of the disease-ridden grizzlies?",c="\"我知道那些灰熊已经安息了，它们的折磨结束了。我……我还有一样东西要给你。我把它写在……在这根树枝上，因为我感到自己在这个位面的时日已尽。\n\n没错……我已到了尽头。再次谢谢你，$g朋友:朋友;……这片受诅咒土地上的生灵可以安息了……现在，也该轮到我了。\"\n\n说完这最后几句话，德鲁伊长长地吐出一口气，再没了声息。他的身体一动不动地躺在小屋的地板上。",cEN="\"I know that the grizzlies have been put down, their torment at an end. I... I have one more thing for you. I wrote it down on... on this branch, sensing that my time in this realm had come to an end.\n\nIndeed... I am at that end. Thank you again friend... the creatures of this accursed land may rest... and now shall I.\"\n\nWith that, a heavy sigh is uttered by the druid, followed by what sounds like a death rattle. His body lies motionless on the cottage floor."}
Q[4986]={d="牛头人德鲁伊毫无生气的手握着一根看起来充满生机的橡木树枝。细看树枝，你会发现树皮上刻着德鲁伊自然系的符文。\n\n你握住树枝，发现它摸起来温热，比应有的温度更热。泰达希尔之树的影像浮现在你脑海中——具体来说是达纳苏斯——而\"塞纳里奥议会\"这几个字就在你舌尖。仿佛该把树枝送到何处的提示，已经铭刻在它里面。",dEN="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark.\n\nAs you grasp the branch, you notice it is warm to the touch, more than it should be. The image of the Teldrassil tree enters your mind - Darnassus specifically - and the words \"Cenarion Circle\" are on the tip of your tongue. It would appear that the suggestion of where to take the branch has been placed within it.",o="根据雕文橡木枝上面所附加的魔法，这个牛头人德鲁伊本来准备把它交给达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会。看来你应该到那里去找一个德鲁伊，并寻求他的帮助。",oEN="Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",p="我代表塞纳里奥议会欢迎你的到来，$c。你找我们有什么事吗？",pEN="On behalf of the Cenarion Circle, I bid you welcome to this enclave, <class>. What business do you have with us?",c="这……这真是奇怪。这位德鲁伊——还是一位牛头人德鲁伊——竟然托付给你这么多关于天灾瘟疫蔓延范围的重要情报。我很惊讶一个牛头人会$g向一位:向一位; $r 提供这样的情报，如果照你说的都是真的，那就更令人惊讶了。我向你保证，我们会好好利用这些情报。也许牛头人离塞纳留斯的道路并没有范达尔以为的那么远……\n\n呃，总之，请收下这个，作为塞纳里奥议会的谢意。",cEN="This... this is quite strange. This druid - this tauren druid no less - entrusted you with a great deal of valuable information on the extent of the Scourge's plague. I am surprised a tauren would give a <race> such information, and freely at that if what you say is true. We will make good use of this, I promise you. Perhaps the tauren have not fallen as far from Cenarius as Fandral would believe...\n\nErm, anyway, please - accept this as a token of thanks from the Cenarion Circle."}
Q[4987]={d="牛头人德鲁伊毫无生气的手握着一根看起来充满生机的橡木树枝。细看树枝，你会发现树皮上刻着德鲁伊自然系的符文。\n\n你握住树枝，发现它摸起来温热，比应有的温度更热。雷霆崖的影像浮现在你脑海中——具体来说是长者高地——而\"塞纳里奥议会\"这几个字就在你舌尖。仿佛该把树枝送到何处的提示，已经铭刻在它里面。",dEN="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark.\n\nAs you grasp the branch, you notice it is warm to the touch, more than it should be. The image of Thunder Bluff in Mulgore enters your mind - Elder Rise specifically - and the words \"Cenarion Circle\" are on the tip of your tongue. It would appear that the suggestion of where to take the branch has been placed within it.",o="根据雕文橡木枝上面所附加的魔法，这个牛头人德鲁伊本来准备把它交给雷霆崖的塞纳里奥议会。看来你应该到那里去找一个德鲁伊，并寻求他的帮助。",oEN="Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",p="我代表塞纳里奥议会欢迎你的到来，$c。你找我们有什么事吗？",pEN="On behalf of the Cenarion Circle, I bid you welcome to this enclave, <class>. What business do you have with us?",c="你说这是从穆格雷斯那里拿来的？我们听说过他想要去帮助那些在瘟疫之地受苦的生物，但我们却没有想到……这太令我伤心了。穆格雷斯是……曾是我的好朋友，我会为他的去世深深哀悼的。\n\n但他的努力没有白费，这都要感谢你的帮助。在这段树枝里保存着更多有关于天灾军团所传播的瘟疫情报，我们会仔细研究它的。至于你，请收下这个吧，这是我们对你的高尚行为所能给予的唯一回报了。",cEN="This is from Mulgris, you say? We had heard he sought to minister to the creatures suffering in the Plaguelands, but this is most unexpected... and most saddening. Mulgris is... was a good friend. I will mourn his passing deeply.\n\nHis efforts have not gone in vain, thanks to your diligence. In this branch, much lore is stored about the plague the Scourge propagates upon the land. We will study it diligently. As for you, please accept this. It is the least we can do for your noble efforts."}
Q[5001]={d="我平时不和$g任何:任何; $r打交道，但看来我这次是卡在巨魔和险境之间了。你看，我在这里的任务对部落至关重要。不过我查到的情报，同样关系到联盟的安危。相信我，我绝不是联盟的同情者，但黑石兽人的威胁远不止一小撮兽人那么简单。\n\n你帮我找回我的东西，我就给你一些对你族人或许有用的情报。\n\n成交吗？",dEN="Ordinarily I don't deal with <race>s but it seems that I'm stuck between a troll and a hard place. You see, my mission here is one of utmost importance to the Horde. The information I've discovered, however, applies to the well being of the Alliance as well. Now believe me, I'm no Alliance sympathizer, but the Blackrock threat is bigger than just a bunch of orcs.\n\nYou help me out by finding my belongings and I'll help you out with some information that could prove useful to your kind.\n\nDeal?",o="找到比修的物品并归还给她。祝你好运！|n",oEN="Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck!",p="运气如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="我说话算话！东西在哪里？",cEN="Well I'll be! Where were they??"}
Q[5002]={d="我是个说话算话的小地精。现在仔细听着：\n\n这些兽人的主要用途是黑龙的苦工和炮灰！\n\n他们真正的头领不是别人，正是奈法利安，死亡之翼的儿子。我还在这一带侦察到了一些奈法利安的下属所在的位置。\n\n把这张地图交给燃烧平原的麦克斯韦尔元帅，地图上面标记着这些魔王的位置，很容易就可以辨认出来。",dEN="I'm a goblin of my word, <race>. Now listen closely:\n\nThese orcs are used primarily as beasts of burden and cannon fodder for the black dragonflight!\n\nTheir true leader is none other than Nefarian, brood of Deathwing. I've also discovered the location of Nefarian's subordinates in this part of the citadel.\n\nTake this map to Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes. It has the location of these fiends marked for easy identification.",o="到燃烧平原去，把比修的情报交给麦克斯韦尔元帅。",oEN="Travel to the Burning Steppes and give Bijou's Information to Marshal Maxwell.",p="啊，$n。好久不见了。",pEN="Ah, <name>. It has been a long time.",c="这与我们所知的大部分都吻合。不管怎样，这是个既有趣却又非常不幸的消息。\n\n这张地图上的记号在削弱黑石氏族威胁的过程中将会被证明是非常有价值的。",cEN="This coincides with much of what we already knew. Regardless, it is interesting and rather unfortunate information.\n\nThe markings on this map will prove valuable in thinning the Blackrock menace."}
Q[5021]={d="包裹必须送到……在我被困在这里之前送到！\n\n一个惊恐女子的呼喊在这座房子里飘荡，几乎像是一声耳语。在楼上角落里蜷缩着一个女子的幽灵。她似乎并不完全清楚自己身在何处，也只是隐约察觉到你的存在。\n\n\"你是来送我的包裹的吗？求求你了，趁事情还没变得更糟！我本来要骑马离开这里的。它应该还在我的马旁边……还是说我已经太迟了？\"",dEN="\"The package must be delivered... delivered before I'm trapped here!\"\n\nThe cries of a panicked woman feel almost like a whisper floating through the house. Cowered in the upstairs corner is the apparition of a woman. She does not seem to be fully cognizant of her surroundings, and she is only vaguely aware of you.\n\n\"Are you here to deliver my package? Please, before it gets much worse! I was going to ride out of here. It should still be by my horse... or am I too late?\"",o="这个女人的幽灵告诉你她要送出一只包裹。她说那只包裹就在她的马旁边。至于马在哪里或者包裹要送到哪里去，她却根本没有说。",oEN="The ramblings of the ghostly woman indicated that she needed a package delivered. She claimed that it was where her horse was. As to where the horse is or where the package was to be delivered - the ghost remains incomprehensible.",c="一个你原本没有注意到的包裹从破败的废墟中显现出来。可能这就是詹妮丝·费尔斯通的鬼魂在不断念叨的那个包裹……",cEN="A package in the barn that you might have otherwise overlooked now stands out amongst the decay and ruin. Perhaps this is the one that the ghost of Janice Felstone was clamoring about..."}
Q[5022]={d="你捡起那只包裹，然后擦掉了积落在上面的一层薄薄的尘土和泥垢。这只包裹上面草草地写着要投寄给暴风城里的一个名叫艾玛·费尔斯通的人，而包裹的递送日期已经是四年之前了。\n\n尽管你并不清楚艾玛·费尔斯通是否还活着，但暴风城的市政厅里应该还保留有城市居民的记录，你应该去找暴风城人口普查处的皇家代理人帮忙。",dEN="You pick up the package, wiping off a small layer of dust and grime that had settled on it. It is addressed in a hurried hand to an Emma Felstone of Stormwind; the delivery of the package is dated for well over four years ago.\n\nThough it is unclear if Emma Felstone is even alive, it is widely known that the Stormwind City Hall keep records on the populace of the city. This is handled through the Royal Factors of the Stormwind Census.",o="与暴风城的皇家代理人巴瑟罗尔协商，查找到艾玛·费尔斯通的下落。通常在市政厅里都有一个人口普查官。",oEN="Check with the Royal Factors of Stormwind to learn the whereabouts of an Emma Felstone. There is usually a census officer located in City Hall.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到暴风城人口普查办公室。如果你需要关于本城居民的信息，我可以$g帮到你:帮到你;。",pEN="Welcome to the office of the Stormwind census. If you are in need of information on our populace, then I can assist you.",c="你说这是给一个名叫艾玛·费尔斯通的人的包裹？收件人的地址是暴风城，四年以前？让我看看……\n\n据我们所知，四年前城里是有一个名叫艾玛·费尔斯通的人。嗯，我应该说可能有这个人——这份人口普查记录是五年前的，但我这里没有关于她离开暴风城的报告，当然这并不意味着她还在这里。\n\n等一下……这只包裹该不是寄给老艾玛的吧？",cEN="A package for an Emma Felstone, you say? Last known address was Stormwind, four years ago? Well let me see here...\n\nAccording to what we know, there was an Emma Felstone in the city about four years ago. Well, I should say possibly - this census I refer to is from five years ago, and I don't have a report of her vacating the city. This doesn't mean that she is still here though.\n\nWait a second... this package couldn't be for Ol' Emma, could it?"}
Q[5023]={d="你捡起那只包裹，然后擦掉了积落在上面的一层薄薄的尘土和泥垢。这只包裹上面草草地写着要投寄给洛丹伦的一个名叫杰雷米亚·费尔斯通的人，而包裹的递送日期已经是四年之前了。\n\n尽管你并不清楚杰雷米亚·费尔斯通是否还活着，但幽暗城——也就是以前的洛丹伦——应该还保留有城市居民的记录，你应该去找幽暗城人口普查处的皇家管理人帮忙。",dEN="You pick up the package, wiping off a small layer of dust and grime that had settled on it. It is addressed in a hurried hand to a Jeremiah Felstone of Lordaeron; the delivery of the package is dated for well over four years ago.\n\nThough it is unclear if Jeremiah Felstone is even alive, it is widely known that the Undercity, formerly known as Lordaeron, keeps records on the populace of the city. This is handled through the Royal Overseers of the Undercity Census.",o="与幽暗城的皇家管理人巴哈乌斯协商，查找杰雷米亚·费尔斯通的下落。通常在公会注册处附近会有一个人口普查官。",oEN="Check with the Royal Overseers of the Undercity to learn the whereabouts of a Jeremiah Felstone. There is usually a census officer located near guild and tabard registration.",p="你到这里来是寻求幽暗城人口普查局的帮助，还是问我某个你认识的人是不是已经死了？每天都有无数人来问我这个问题……",pEN="Are you here to seek the assistance of the Undercity census, or just to ask me if someone you knew is dead? I get asked that a lot.",c="给一个叫做杰雷米亚·费尔斯通的人的包裹，收件地址是洛丹伦……让我找找看。\n\n杰雷米亚·费尔斯通在瘟疫来袭之前就在城里。哦，我应该说从前的杰雷米亚·费尔斯通——有些被遗忘者改了他们的姓好跟之前的一切都断绝关系。这个人也不例外，从前的杰雷米亚·费尔斯通现在的名字是杰雷米亚·派森。\n\n等一下……他不就是那个卖蟑螂的吗？",cEN="A package for a Jeremiah Felstone, with his last known address as Lordaeron... I should be able to assist you.\n\nJeremiah Felstone was in the city before the plague. Well, I should say the former Jeremiah Felstone - some of the Forsaken have changed their last names to rid themselves of their former countenance. This case is no exception; the former Jeremiah Felstone is now known as Jeremiah Payson.\n\nWait a minute... isn't he the cockroach vendor?"}
Q[5041]={d="南贫瘠之地发生的变故，正迫使一些野猪人部族朝我们这边逃窜。尤其是那些流离失所的钢鬃野猪人，他们开始变得绝望，袭击也越来越猖狂。光这一周我就损失了两支商队！\n\n我们在十字路口的战士急需那些补给，我绝不允许野猪人继续为非作歹。找到那些丢失的补给箱，带回来给我。我会去南边沿河的野猪人窝棚里找找。",dEN="That attack on the caravan contained supplies we desperately needed.\n\nYou've been brave enough to take on the Razormane tribe so far, and I will ask you to do so again, but this time, I wonder if I could ask you to keep your eyes open for some of our lost supplies. You can probably find them throughout their camps, the quilboar getting fat off their dishonorable acts.\n\nThe people of the Crossroads would be in your debt.",o="找到十字路口的补给箱，把它还给贫瘠之地的索克。",oEN="Find and return Crossroads' Supply Crates to Thork in the Barrens.",p="你找到我们的补给物资了吗？$n？我相信你很容易就把野猪人打败了。",pEN="How goes your search for the supplies, <name>? I trust the quilboar fall under your strength easily.",c="哈哈！谢谢你，$n！这会对我们有非常大的帮助。你对十字路口和部落来说真是一大福音。如果我能为你做什么的话，请一定要让我知道。",cEN="Haha! Thank you, <name>! This will help us greatly. You're a boon to the Crossroads and to the Horde. If there is anything I can do for you, please, let me know."}
Q[5042]={p="如果你想要阿迦玛甘的力量，我需要四块血色碎片，$r。\n\n如果你被赐予这份祝福，你的敌人将在你的力量面前瑟瑟发抖。\n\n钢鬃最荣耀的战士都充满了这样的力量！",pEN="I will need 4 blood shards if you wish Agamaggan's strength, <race>.\n\nYour foes will cower before your strength were you to be given this blessing.\n\nThe Razormane's greatest warriors are infused with such power!",c="要是裂牙能亲眼看到你屠戮那些背叛他的人就好了！<咕哝>\n\n谢谢你收集这些碎片，消灭了更多刺背野猪人。求你继续这样做，我也会继续帮你。<咕哝>",cEN="If only Mangletooth were free to see you decimate those who betrayed him!\n\nI thank you for destroying more of the Bristleback by gathering these shards. Please, continue to do so, and I will continue to aid you."}
Q[5043]={p="据说我部族最优秀的斥候箭法无人能及，任何盗贼<咕哝>都比不上他们在战斗中的敏捷。\n\n给我带来四块血色碎片，我就让你比任何野猪人都更敏捷。",pEN="My tribes greatest scouts are said to be unrivaled in their accuracy, and no rogue could measure up to their quickness in battle.\n\nBring me 4 blood shards and I will make you even more agile than any quilboar born.",c="愿你的箭无虚发，愿你的武器留下真实的印记，$r。\n\n阿迦玛甘之灵与你同在。想的话就回来吧。只要伟大的野猪之神认为你$g配得上:配得上;，裂牙就会再次祝福你。",cEN="May your aim be unerring, and the mark of your weapon be true, <race>.\n\nAgamaggan's spirit is with you. Return to me if you wish. Mangletooth will bless you again if the great boar god deems me worthy."}
Q[5044]={p="野猪人部族的萨满和地卜师<咕哝>会借助阿迦玛甘的力量，在战斗和仪式中获得帮助，$r。\n\n如果你也希望自己的法术得到阿迦玛甘祝福的额外力量，就给我带来四块血色碎片，裂牙会帮你。",pEN="The shaman and geomancers of the quilboar tribes call upon the strength of Agamaggan to help them in battle and in their rituals, <race>.\n\nIf you too wish the added power of Agamaggan's blessing with your spells, then bring me 4 blood shards and Mangletooth will aid you.",c="你的敌人应该更加畏惧你，$r。\n\n下次我们相见时，无论今生还是来世，都跟裂牙讲讲你在战斗中的机智吧。",cEN="Your enemies should fear you even more, <race>.\n\nTell Mangletooth tales of your cunning in battle when next we meet--be it in this life, or the next."}
Q[5045]={p="各类$c都需要坚强的意志。当一切希望都失去时，它会推动你成就更伟大的功业。这一点钢鬃深有体会。我们是个崇尚精神的部族——我们为与阿迦玛甘的联系而自豪，胜过为战斗中的勇武而自豪。\n\n给我带来四块血色碎片，我就为你的战斗祝福你的意志。",pEN="Warriors of all types have need of a strong spirit. It drives you to greater feats when all hope has been lost. This is not unknown to the Razormane. We are a spiritual tribe--we are more proud of our connection to Agamaggan than our prowess in battle.\n\nBring me 4 blood shards and I will bless your spirit for battle.",c="我们最荣耀的战士和最强大的<咕哝>萨满都会羡慕你的意志，$r。\n\n去消灭更多刺背野猪人吧，让他们知道挡不住你！",cEN="Our greatest warriors, and our greatest shamans would envy your will, <race>.\n\nDefeat more of the Bristlebacks knowing that they cannot stop you!"}
Q[5046]={p="所有<咕哝>投入战斗的人都需要保护。他们的骨头必须坚硬，皮必须坚韧。<咕哝>我的部族深知这一点，为了增强我们尖刺和皮毛天生的防护，<咕哝>我们常在开战前向阿迦玛甘祈求庇佑。\n\n给我带来四块血色碎片<咕哝>，我就赐予你同样的保护。",pEN="All those who enter battle have need of protection. Their bones must be strong. Their skin tough. My tribe knows this as well, and to add to the natural protection our quills and hide give us, we often call upon Agamaggan to protect us from harm before we go to war.\n\nBring me 4 blood shards and I will grant you the same protection.",c="去战斗吧，$r。",cEN="Go to war, <race>."}
Q[5047]={d="你会在永望镇找到马利弗斯·暗锤，$c。告诉他\"芬克尔一切安好\"，还有那套衣服好使得很。\n\n然后把这个交给他：\n\n<芬克尔递给你一块发光的肉。>\n\n这是我从那头野兽的内脏里掏出来的，就在我\"度假\"的时候。\n\n我敢打赌，马利弗斯能相当准确地告诉你，用这种怪物身上的一部分能做出什么来！\n\n哦，我猜你还不知道永望镇在哪儿吧？往冬泉谷去，$g伙计:姑娘;！",dEN="You'll find Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook, <class>. Tell him that 'Finkle is A-OK' and that the suit works perfectly.\n\nThen hand him this:\n\n<Finkle hands you a glowing piece of flesh.>\n\nI snatched it from the beast's innards during my 'vacation.'\n\nI bet Malyfous could give you a fairly accurate assessment of what he can do with parts from a monster like this!\n\nOh, I suppose you don't know where Everlook is, do you? To Winterspring, <fella/lady>!",o="与永望镇的玛雷弗斯·暗锤谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.",p="什么事？",pEN="Yea?",c="活着？衣服起作用了？哦！",cEN="Alive? Suit worked? And what do we have here?"}
Q[5048]={d="她是个奇怪的人，很可能精神不正常……但是记录显示这个艾玛可能确实就是艾玛·费尔斯通。\n\n你也许见过艾玛在城市里到处游逛——她不停地自言自语，通常都是些荒诞而含糊不清的话。但是她没有伤害任何东西或是任何人，因此人们大都不刁难她。\n\n因此，我认为艾玛事实上就是你要找的艾玛·费尔斯通。你可以问问她是不是姓费尔斯通。",dEN="She's a tad ornery, and quite possibly out of her gourd... but the records indicate that Ol' Emma does fit the framework of who Emma Felstone might be.\n\nPerhaps you've seen Ol' Emma wander the city - she talks to herself, most often in nonsensical jibber-jabber. Still, she doesn't hurt anything or anyone, so folks pretty much leave her be.\n\nAll things considered, I would say that Ol' Emma is in fact Emma Felstone. You might try asking if her last name is indeed Felstone.",o="找到暴风城的艾玛并弄清她是否就是艾玛·费尔斯通。如果是的话，那么她可能想要拿到詹妮丝·费尔斯通给她的包裹。",oEN="Find Ol' Emma in Stormwind and see if she is in fact Emma Felstone. If she is, then perhaps she'd like the package Janice Felstone made for her.",p="我本想叫你离开我的草坪，但是如你所见的，我没有草坪。",pEN="I would tell you to get off my lawn, but as you can see I don't have one.",c="我的名字确实叫艾玛·费尔斯通——你是这么多年来第一个这么叫我的人。你……你是谁？\n\n你说你认识……我妹妹？！她还活着吗？我骗谁呢，她当然不在了。洛丹伦瘟疫爆发时，我就已经做好了最坏的打算。我家里那么多人死了……或者更糟。现在我坐在这里，疯疯癫癫的老艾玛，孤身一人。你是什么人，$g盗墓贼:盗墓贼;之类的吗？在找你的下一个目标？\n\n什么……你有一个我妹妹给我的包裹？",cEN="My name is indeed Emma Felstone - you're the first person in years to call me that. Who... who are you?\n\nYou say you knew... my sister?! Is she still alive? Who am I kidding, of course she isn't. When the plague broke out in Lordaeron, I had come to expect the worst. So many of my family died... or worse. Here I am now, crazy Ol' Emma, all alone. What are you, a grave-robber or something? Looking for your next target?\n\nWhat... you have a package for me from my sister?"}
Q[5049]={d="根据我能收集到的证据，你要找的人，也是这个包裹的收件人，是幽暗城的蟑螂商人杰雷米亚·派森。\n\n我一直认为，卖……蟑螂需要一种特别的天赋。毫无疑问，你正身处一次史诗般的旅程中，$g强大的:强大的; $c。改变世界的伟业就交给你了。不过，请允许我也参与你的杰作——他就在银行附近，舒舒服服地趴在其中一条通道下面。",dEN="From the evidence I am able to muster, the person you seek - and the intended recipient of the parcel - is Jeremiah Payson, the Undercity cockroach vendor.\n\nI've always been of the opinion that it takes a special gift to sell... cockroaches. No doubt you are on quite the epic sojourn now, mighty <class>. I will leave you to your world-shaping endeavors. Allow me, however, to be a part of your magnum opus and reveal that he is located near the bank, suitably groveling under one of the walkways.",o="在幽暗城找到杰雷米亚·派森并查明他是否就是你要找的杰雷米亚·费尔斯通。如果他是的话，那么他可能会想要拿到詹妮丝·费尔斯通寄给他的包裹。",oEN="Find Jeremiah Payson in the Undercity and see if he is in fact Jeremiah Felstone. If he is, then perhaps he'd like the package Janice Felstone made for him.",p="每次有人踩到蟑螂，我都会哭。请不要让我哭泣。",pEN="Every time someone steps on a cockroach, I cry. Please don't make me cry.",c="我已经很多年没用过那个名字了……不过没错，在我以前的生命里——在这光荣的亡灵生涯之前——那是我的姓。\n\n你声称认识我妹妹……或者说，最近和我妹妹说过话。\n\n她已经死了。死了四年了。\n\n你知道吗，要不是我的骨头已经够脆了，我真想踢你屁股一脚。你可真是只秃鹫，对吧？\n\n什么……你有一个我妹妹给我的包裹？",cEN="I haven't used that name in years... but yes, at one point in my life - before this glorious unlife - that was my last name.\n\nYou claim to have known my sister... or rather, have recently spoken to my sister.\n\nWho's been dead.\n\nFor four years.\n\nYou know, if my bones weren't already brittle enough, I'd be tempted to break my foot off on your posterior. You're quite the vulture, aren't you?\n\nWhat... you have a package for me from my sister?"}
Q[5050]={d="看起来我错怪你了，$n，为此我应向你道歉。我姐姐送给我许多东西，包括看起来很滑稽的费尔斯通农场地契，我想我一时半会是没法收回它了。\n\n如果我姐姐的灵魂还被束缚在农场不能安息，请你帮帮忙……你能把这个还给她吗？这是她的半个护身符，她的丈夫拿着另外一半。\n\n或许当她知道我拿到这些东西之后就可以安息了。",dEN="It would seem that I was wrong about you <name>, and for that I owe you an apology. My sister sent me a number of personal effects, including humorously enough the deed to the Felstone farm. I think I'll pass on reclaiming it right now.\n\nIf my sister's spirit remains tethered to the farm and cannot rest, please... could you return this to her? It is half of a good luck charm she had, with her husband having the other half.\n\nMaybe her knowing I have these things will now put her soul to rest.",o="把好运半护符交还给西瘟疫之地的珍妮·费尔斯通。",oEN="Return the Good Luck Half-Charm to Jaine Felstone in Western Plaguelands.",p="约翰，亲爱的……是你吗？我突然觉得好冷……",pEN="John, sweetheart... is that you? I'm so cold all the sudden...",c="你把那半块护符还给那个幽灵。她看了看护符，又满怀期待地看着你。\n\n\"亲爱的，你把你那一半放哪儿了？我们得凑齐两半才能在一起啊。亲爱的……你能看见我吗？\"",cEN="You give the half-charm back to the apparition. She looks at it, then at you expectantly.\n\n\"Honey, where did you put your half of the charm? We can't be together unless we have both halves. Honey... can you see me?\""}
Q[5051]={d="那可怜的灵魂仍在喃喃自语，语无伦次：\n\n\"我好冷，约翰。把你的护符给我，我们就能在一起了！快点，约翰，趁瘟疫还没把我们变成可怕的怪物！我看不见你，约翰……但我知道你就在附近。我感觉你就在我身边。\"\n\n也许只要找到护符的另一半，把两半合在一起，就能满足珍妮·费尔斯通的灵魂所求。",dEN="The ramblings of the poor ghost continue:\n\n\"I'm so cold, John. Bring me your charm, and we'll be together! Quickly John, before the plague comes to change us into hideous beasts! I can't see you John... but I know you're near. I feel you near me.\"\n\nPerhaps if the second half of the charm was found and reassembled, this would constitute what the spirit of Janice Felstone is seeking.",o="在西瘟疫之地的费尔斯通农场某地找到另外一半好运护符，并把两半护符合并。\n\n把好运护符交给西瘟疫之地费尔斯通农场的詹妮丝·费尔斯通。",oEN="Locate the other half of the Good Luck Charm somewhere on the Felstone Farm in Western Plaguelands and reassemble it.\n\nGive the Good Luck Charm to Janice Felstone on the Felstone Farm, Western Plaguelands.",p="约翰，不要让那些食尸鬼抓到你……不要让这些食尸鬼抓到我……肮脏的食尸鬼……我们的幸运符会让我们安全的。",pEN="John, don't let the ghouls get you... don't let the ghouls get me... nasty ghouls... our charm will keep us safe.",c="你把重新合好的好运护符交给珍妮·费尔斯通的幽灵。她一握住它，你就看到几乎立刻发生了的变化。她飘渺的形体微微闪烁，用清澈却哀伤的眼睛望着你。\n\n\"你解放了我……我不再需要这枚护符了。请拿着它吧，也许它能给你带来它曾给过我的慰藉。\"",cEN="You hand the reassembled good luck charm to Janice Felstone's ghost. As soon as she grasps it, you observe an almost immediate change in her. Her ethereal form shimmers, and she looks upon you with clear yet sad eyes.\n\n\"You've freed me... I no longer will need this charm. Please, take it and perhaps it will give you the solace it has given me.\""}
Q[5052]={d="除了尖刺，那血液还影响了<咕哝>大地的其他方面：染成血红、与其他矿物混杂在一起的石块。刺背野猪人把这些碎片挖出来，当作图腾携带<咕哝>，以求战斗中的力量和法术的威力<咕哝>。\n\n我知晓那魔法的秘密。\n\n给裂牙带一块这样的血色碎片来，证明你明白这是怎么回事。给裂牙带许多碎片来，他就会用野猪人的魔法——也就是阿迦玛甘的魔法——祝福你！<咕哝>",dEN="Along with the thorns, the blood affected other aspects of the earth: blood red stones mixed in with other minerals. The Bristleback dig up these shards and carry them as totems for strength in battle and as totems for their magics.\n\nI know the secrets of that magic.\n\nBring Mangletooth one of these blood shards to show you understand. Bring Mangletooth many of the shards, and he will bless you with quilboar magic--the magic of Agamaggan!",o="给陶拉祖营地的碎牙带去一块血岩碎片。\n\n如果你想要他赐予你阿迦玛甘的力量，就搜集更多的血岩碎片。",oEN="Bring a Blood Shard to Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.\n\nCollect more Blood Shards if you want him to bless you with Agamaggan's power.",p="我们的部族聚集在贫瘠之地长满荆棘的区域<咕哝>，因为那里是圣地，但没有哪里比剃刀沼泽更神圣。阿迦玛甘的躯体构成了整个剃刀沼泽，<咕哝>而剃刀高地尤其受到庇护，因为它的入口就是由他巨大的咽喉构成的！<咕哝>凡是不忠于他的人都会被整个吞下，嚼碎之后再把尸体吐出来！<咕哝>\n\n阿迦玛甘留下他的躯体来保护我们，也献出他的灵魂，好让我们保护他。<咕哝>",pEN="Our tribes flock to the thorny areas throughout the Barrens because they are holy places, but none as holy as Razorfen. Agamaggan's body makes up the entirety of the Razorfen, but the Downs are especially protected because the entrance is made from his great maw! It will swallow whole those not loyal to him, and spit out their bodies after he's chewed them up!\n\nAgamaggan has left his body behind to protect us, and he gives of his spirit so we may protect him.",c="啊，你明白了。<咕哝>我的话没有白说，$r。裂牙也许被关在笼子里，但没有任何笼子能挡住阿迦玛甘的力量！\n\n摸到碎片的感觉，就只是触碰一下……已经太久了，$r。\n\n你知道那是什么滋味吗？被剥夺自己的力量？\n\n不过，这故事改日再讲。我答应过给你情报。我答应过给你阿迦玛甘的力量。我自己的族人背弃了我，背弃了裂牙。现在，我派你去，让我的怒火降临在他们身上。",cEN="Ah, you do understand. My words were not lost on your ears, <race>. Mangletooth may be caged, but no cage can stop Agamaggan's power!\n\nThe touch of the shard, the feel of it... it has been a long time, <race>.\n\nDo you know what it is like? To have your power severed from you?\n\nBut, that is a tale for another time. I promised you information. I promised you Agamaggan's power. My people turned their backs on Mangletooth. Now, I lose you upon them."}
Q[5054]={d="在冬泉谷那白雪茫茫的山脉里，有一头狩猎技术纯熟精湛的碎齿熊，尤西乌斯。\n\n现在我让你去对付他，尤西乌斯就在永望镇西边的山坡上徘徊。在它发现你的意图之前找到他，击败他。\n\n所有前去猎杀尤西乌斯的猎人都很快发现自己变成了猎物，而尤西乌斯才是猎人。你要多加小心。",dEN="In the snowy mountains of Winterspring, to the northwest, a skilled hunter stalks his prey... I speak of Ursius of the shardtooth bears, an agile and clever beast.\n\nI send you now against him. He roams the sloping hills to the northwest of Everlook. Find and hunt him, before he discovers your intent.\n\nAll that have gone up against Ursius have quickly found themselves to be the prey, and he, the hunter. Stay on your guard.",o="永望镇的斯托姆·影蹄想要你去杀死尤西乌斯。",oEN="Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Ursius.",p="动身吧，$c。去找出尤西乌斯。",pEN="Go now, <class>. Seek out Ursius.",c="这可不是简单的工作，但你却出色地完成了它。不过，不要以为你已经令我折服了，$n。",cEN="This was no easy task, yet you have excelled. But do not be too quick to think you have impressed me, <name>."}
Q[5055]={d="布鲁米兰迅捷而又聪明，她悄无声息地在冬泉谷南边的雪地中滑翔。但是不要让她那优雅的外表迷惑了你，所有从她身旁经过的旅行者都受到了猛烈的攻击，而且多半会赔上他们的性命。\n\n从那些冰风奇美拉中找出布鲁米兰，打败它，然后再回来见我。",dEN="Swift, and clever, Brumeran glides silently across the snowy landscape of southern Winterspring. But do not let her graceful appearance convince you that she is harmless. All that cross her pay considerably, and often with their own lives.\n\nSeek out Brumeran of the chillwind among the chimera. Defeat her, then return again to me.",o="永望镇的斯托姆·影蹄想要你去杀死布鲁米兰。",oEN="Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Brumeran.",p="布鲁米兰在呼唤你，$n。",pEN="Brumeran calls out to you, <name>.",c="是的。你回来了。我现在相信，你天生就是一位真正的$c。你面对过最凶猛的生物并活着回来了，超出了我的所有期望。\n\n现在，你已准备好接受我最后的请求了。",cEN="Yes. You have returned. I believe now that you are a true <class> by nature. You have faced the most ferocious of creatures and have returned, surpassing my expectations.\n\nYou are now ready for my final request."}
Q[5056]={d="在冬泉谷北部，大型猫科动物聚集在一个叫霜刃石的地标周围。这群猫的首领名叫希洛塔姆。若能击败霜刃豹的女族长，你将在任何$r眼中赢得极大的敬意。\n\n再次前往那片严酷的荒野，到了那里就采集神圣的霜刃豹肉。找到希洛塔姆之石，把它放在那里。当你把同类的肉放在石上，就会激怒希洛塔姆并将它召唤出来。\n\n$g准备好:准备好;迎接它的怒火，击败它。",dEN="In northern Winterspring, great cats assemble around a large landmark called Frostsaber Rock. The leader of these cats is known by the name Shy-Rotam. Defeating the matriarch of the frostsabers would grant you much respect in the eyes of your fellow <race>.\n\nGo again to the harsh wilds, and once there, gather sacred meat from the frostsabers. Find the stone of Shy-Rotam, and place it there. Placing the meat of her kin before her will summon Shy-Rotam, in anger.\n\nBe ready for her fury, and defeat her.",o="永望镇的斯托姆·影蹄想要你去杀死希洛塔姆。",oEN="Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam.",p="希洛塔姆勇猛而无情，她会以热情和生命保卫她的同类。",pEN="Shy-Rotam is bold and unforgiving; she will defend her kind with fervent enthusiasm.",c="你已经证明了你的力量和决心。还有更多挑战在等着你，但我已经把自己所能展示的都展示给你了。祝你好运。",cEN="You have proven both your strength and your determination. Many more challenges await you, but I have already shown you as much as I am able.\n\nGood luck, <name>."}
Q[5057]={d="$n，我已经听说过许多有关你的传言了……据说你有着坚强不屈的信念，作为一个$c，你具备杰出的能力。现在看到你，我终于相信这些都是事实了。\n\n像你这样优秀的$r值得嘉奖。把这个交给我在雷霆崖的一个名叫梅洛·石蹄的朋友。我肯定他会记得你，还有你以往做出的努力。将你近期所取得的胜利告诉他，还有永远不要忘记你今天所取得的成就。",dEN="Before you spoke to me, <name>, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a <class>, and I now know these things to be the truth.\n\nThose that excel as you do are worthy of recognition. Take this marker to a friend of mine in Thunder Bluff named Melor Stonehoof. I'm sure he will remember you, and what you accomplished so long ago. Speak to him of you recent victories, and do not ever forget what you have accomplished today.",o="把斯托姆·影蹄的徽记交给雷霆崖的梅洛·石蹄。",oEN="Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",c="我们从人生经历中学习，$n。我相信你的经历只会让你变得更强、更$g睿智:睿智;。从我们第一次交谈到现在，你成长了许多。\n\n收下这个，作为你身为$r $c所完成的一项项艰巨任务的纪念吧，也请记住，你永远拥有我的尊敬与钦佩。",cEN="We learn from our life experiences, <name>. I am sure that you have only become stronger and wiser as a result of yours. You have grown much since we first spoke.\n\nTake this in remembrance of the difficult tasks you have accomplished as a <race> <class>, and know that you will always have my respect and admiration."}
Q[5058]={c="一本纸页泛黄的日记翻开着，停在最后一则记录上：\n\n\"我不知道哈罗德变成这样之后会发生什么。我费尽力气把他拖进我能找到的唯一一个能把他牢牢关住的地方。我把钥匙藏在自己身上，祈祷它能管用……\n\n我希望能离开这里，可我需要钱才能走。我想我们的东西都在柜子里……现在想想，哈罗德不是一直把钥匙带在身上吗？\n\n我先歇一歇，我现在累得要死。\"",cEN="A diary with yellowing pages lies open to the last entry:\n\n\"I don't know what's going to happen now that Harold's turned. It took everything out of me to drag him into the only place I could find that'd lock him up tight and hold him. I hid the key on me, and I pray it works...\n\nI hope I can get out of here, but I need money to do that. Our stuff's all in the cabinet I think... and now that I think about it, doesn't Harold keep the key on him?\n\nI'll rest on it, I'm dead tired now.\""}
Q[5059]={p="一个极其结实的柜子立在你面前，柜子的门被一个内建的锁牢牢地锁着。柜子的前面有深深的划痕与刻痕，看起来好像是在无数次想要解开其中秘密的粗暴失败尝试所导致的结果。\n\n如果你想要打开这个柜子，就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="The door to the outhouse has begun to splinter at the edges of the frame as though it has been repeatedly and incessantly tried to be forced open. It is currently locked up tight from the outside of the outhouse.\n\nAs you rattle the door, you hear a guttural moaning come from inside! Whatever is inside there, it certainly does not sound friendly.",c="你用从前达尔森夫人骸骨上找到的钥匙打开了厕所的门。一只嗜血的食尸鬼从里面跳了出来——天知道它被困在里面多久了。\n\n食尸鬼发现你时发出的那声刺耳尖叫清楚地说明，昔日的农夫达尔森已经无可挽救了。",cEN="Using the key found on the skeleton of the former Mrs. Dalson, you unlock the door to the outhouse. A bloodthirsty ghoul leaps from the outhouse, having been trapped inside for who knows how long.\n\nIt is clear by the bloodcurdling scream of the ghoul at your presence that the former Farmer Dalson is now beyond saving.\nRelated"}
Q[5060]={p="一个极其结实的柜子立在你面前，柜子的门被一个内建的锁牢牢地锁着。柜子的前面有深深的划痕与刻痕，看起来好像是在无数次想要解开其中秘密的粗暴失败尝试所导致的结果。\n\n如果你想要打开这个柜子，就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An extremely sturdy cabinet stands before you, securely fastened shut by a built-in lock. The front of the cabinet is deeply scratched and marked. This could be surmised as being from numerous and violent failed attempts to reveal whatever secrets the cabinet currently obfuscates from view.\n\nIf you are going to open this cabinet, you will need to find the key.",c="从农夫达尔松那已经成为食尸鬼的遗体中拿到的钥匙完全与锁孔吻合。柜子的门转开了，展现在你面前的是数样完整无缺的物品，而且它们看起来都非常珍贵。",cEN="The key taken from Farmer Dalson's ghoulish remains fits the lock perfectly. The doors of the cabinet swing open, revealing several items that remain intact and appear quite valuable."}
Q[5061]={d="你已经完成了所有年轻德鲁伊在学习水栖形态之前必须完成的课程。现在回到达纳苏斯去找你的训练师玛斯雷尼·熊行者。把你的坠饰给他看，向他证明你已经准备好学习他要教你的东西。他会完成你的训练，让你能与水融为一体。\n\n祝你好运，年轻的德鲁伊。我们还会再见面的。",dEN="You have completed the necessary lessons all young druids are taught before they can adopt an aquatic aspect. Go now back to your trainer, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, in Darnassus. Show him your pendant and prove to him you are ready to learn what he has to teach you. He will complete your training, allowing you to become one with the water.",o="回到达纳苏斯，让玛斯雷·驭熊者看看你的海狮坠饰。",oEN="Return to Darnassus and show Mathrengyl Bearwalker the Pendant of the Sea Lion.",p="你回到达纳苏斯并不是没有预兆的，尽管在教你学习水中形态之前，我需要你在月光林地所学课程的证据。\n\n你得到海狮的坠饰了吗？",pEN="Your return to Darnassus is not without heralding, though I will need proof of your lessons learned in Moonglade before I will teach you your aquatic form.\n\nDo you have the Pendant of the Sea Lion?",c="非常出色，$n。你已经$g准备好:准备好;学习水栖形态了，我很荣幸能教你。\n\n此外，为表彰你在两项试炼中取得的成就，我把这件物品送给你。希望你会觉得它是你作为自然的$g保护者:保护者;与平衡的$g守护者:守护者;装备中一件受欢迎的物品。",cEN="Very impressive, <name>. You are ready to learn your aquatic form, and it is my pleasure to teach it to you.\n\nAlso, in recognition of your achievement during the two trials, I give you this item. I hope you'll find it to be a welcome addition to your gear as a protector of nature and a keeper of the balance."}
Q[5062]={d="阿利卡拉是个致命的威胁，我们必须马上将其解决。你必须点燃生命圣火，这样就可以召唤出阿利卡拉了。\n\n现在就去采集稀有的火岩龙舌兰植株。在你采集到了足够的植株后，到雷霆崖的长者高地上去找玛加萨·野性图腾。她是个具有强大力量的萨满祭司，她可以点化火岩龙舌兰来创造一种引燃圣火所需的材料。\n\n到西北面的沸腾之池去收集火岩龙舌兰吧。",dEN="Arikara is a deadly creature that must be dealt with swiftly. In order to hunt her down you will need to light the sacred fire of life - this will summon Arikara.\n\nGo now and harvest the rare Incendia agave plant. Once you have harvested enough agave, seek council with Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff. She is a powerful shaman that can enchant the agave plant to create a powder that will light the fire.\n\nTravel northeast to the Boiling Pool and gather Incendia Agave.",o="收集10支火岩龙舌兰，然后去找雷霆崖长者高地的玛加萨·野性图腾。",oEN="Gather 10 bushels of Incendia Agave, and then consult Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise in Thunderbluff.",p="那么说来玛加萨·图腾要对付了阿利卡拉……好吧，这真是个重大的消息。\n\n<玛加萨看了看四周。>\n\n阿利卡拉是一个危险的生物，它的诞生只是为了对那些犯了极度可恶罪行的人寻求报复。\n\n<玛加萨微笑着。>",pEN="So, Motega Firemane sends word of Arikara... well now that is grave news.\n\n<Magatha looks around.>\n\nArikara is a deadly creature born only to seek vengeance against those who have committed heinous acts.\n\n<Magatha smiles.>",c="好的，你收集了足够的火岩龙舌兰。这种能够点燃生命之火的草药只有在千针石林才能找到。\n\n<玛加萨开始炼化火岩龙舌兰。>",cEN="Good, you have gathered the essential amount of Incendia agave. This rare herb found only in Thousand Needles will help light the dormant sacred fire of life.\n\n<Magatha begins to enchant the Incendia agave.>"}
Q[5063]={d="你再也不会见到比这更精致的帽子了。用那头野兽原始无瑕的皮，我们的能工巧匠将打造出一顶魔术师梦寐以求的最了不起的帽子！\n\n五十枚金币，再加上清单上的物品，你的头上就将戴上猩红学者的帽子：\n\n*那头野兽原始无瑕的皮。\n\n*破烂的憎恶缝合线。\n\n*奥术水晶。\n\n*附魔的猩红丝线。\n\n好好看着吧！",dEN="A finer cap you may never see. From the pristine hide of the beast, our expert crafters will create the most phenomenal hat a prestidigitator could ever hope to don!\n\nFifty gold pieces along with the listed items and your head shall be graced with the Cap of the Scarlet Savant:\n\n*The pristine hide of the Beast.\n\n*Frayed abomination stitchings.\n\n*Arcane crystals.\n\n*Enchanted scarlet thread.\n\nBEHOLD!",o="为了制造血色学者之帽，你必须将下列物品交给玛雷弗斯·暗锤：1块比斯巨兽的皮，5根磨损的憎恶缝合线，8块奥术水晶，5根魔化红线。\n\n另外你还必须支付50金币的制作费用。",oEN="In order to create the Cap of the Scarlet Savant, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 8 Arcane Crystals; 5 Enchanted Scarlet Thread.\n\nYou will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",p="除非你收集到了我要的东西，否则你就是在浪费我的时间。",pEN="Unless you've got everything I need, you're wasting my time.",c="这真令人惊讶！你一定花了好几周时间才收集到这些东西……你是怎么找到比斯巨兽的皮的？\n\n戴上帽子吧，$n！",cEN="Astounding! It must have taken weeks to gather those components... and how did you find a pristine hide?!?\n\nEnjoy the cap, <name>!"}
Q[5064]={d="$n，你过去一直忠心地为我们效力，所以现在我把一项重要任务托付给你。邪枝氏族正在密谋着什么。我们知道，最近几周有三名来历不明的特工一直在与邪枝氏族会面。我们查明，暗云峰有几只箱子存放着这些机密信件。\n\n$n，如果你能成功完成这项危险的任务，我会给你相应的奖赏。|n",dEN="<name>, you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks. We discovered that separate chests in Darkcloud Pinnacle hold these guarded messages.\n\n<name>, if you succeed in this dangerous mission, I will reward you in kind.",o="在黑云峰拿到三封密信。",oEN="Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",p="你找到恐怖图腾族到底在做什么了吗？",pEN="Have you discovered what the Grimtotem are up to?",c="伟大的灵魂图腾啊！这确实是个可怕的消息。我必须开始为可能发生的事情做好准备了。\n\n$n，如同我答应过的，这是给你英勇行为的回报。",cEN="Great Spirit Totem! This is dire news indeed. I must begin to plan for whatever may come.\n\n<name>, as promised, here is your reward for your brave service."}
Q[5065]={d="那个巨魔没有对你说出真相。你为他弄来的那两块石板提到了哈卡精华，但是那个传说的内容应该还有更多才对。我已经研究很久了，而且我发现摩沙鲁石板应该总共有六块，并非两块！是六块！\n\n我恐怕其他人所掌握的那些秘密会对我们不利……\n\n找到第三块和第四块摩沙鲁石板。它们在东瘟疫之地，被居住在那里的烂苔巨魔控制着。找到它们并把它们交给我。",dEN="The troll with whom you spoke did not tell the truth. The two tablets you gained for him spoke of containing the essence of Hakkar, but there is more to that legend. I have studied long, and found that there are six Tablets of Mosh'aru, not two! Six!\n\nAnd I fear that we will not like what secrets the others hold..\n\nFind the third and fourth tablets of Mosh'aru. They're in the Eastern Plaguelands, held by the mossflayer trolls. Find them, and bring them to me.",o="把第三块和第四块摩沙鲁石板交给塔纳利斯的勘查员詹斯·铁靴。",oEN="Bring the Third and Fourth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.",p="你拿到石板了吗？我怕那些石板上所刻的文字会揭示一个对我们世界造成巨大威胁的力量。",pEN="Do you have the tablets? I fear their texts will reveal a great threat to our world.",c="你找到它们了！太好了！\n\n谢谢你，$n。我会详细地研读这些文字，并搞清楚它们的意思。\n\n然而，我还有另一项任务要交给你……",cEN="You found them! Great!\n\nThank you, <name>. I will pour over these texts and decipher their meaning.\n\nYou, however, have another task..."}
Q[5066]={d="大家都听着！大家都听着！所有的英雄都应该聆听这号召的声音！\n\n暴风城已经发出了备战的号召！所有勇士都应该拿起武器，一同面对来自东部王国北部地区亡灵天灾的威胁！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，联盟的安全岌岌可危！\n\n联盟的英雄们——去向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到吧，他的大本营就在奥特兰克山脉北边的冰风岗！",dEN="Hear ye, hear ye! All heroes are called upon to heed these words!\n\nA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind! All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!",o="找到指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。他的大本营位于奥特兰克山脉以北的冰风岗。",oEN="Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，$g英雄:英雄;。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是我们北方和东北方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁。我很高兴听到，责任与为大局服务的号角声没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;弄脏双手，那么在这瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着$g愿意并有能力的英雄:愿意并有能力的英雄;去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, especially with the looming threat of the Scourge to our north and northeast. I am glad to hear that the clarion call of duty and service to the greater good did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[5067]={d="这样的物品从未被成功制作出来，但人们认为在合适的条件下它是可能的。\n\n如果奥术的追寻者想要为护腿注入巨大的力量，就必须找到以下物品：\n\n*那头野兽原始无瑕的皮。\n\n*破烂的憎恶缝合线。\n\n*奥金锭。\n\n*穆尔海尔的防腐液。\n\n好好看着吧！",dEN="While the crafting of such an item has never successfully been accomplished, it is thought to be possible - under the right circumstance.\n\nShould the seeker of arcanum desire to imbue leggings with immense power, the following they must find:\n\n* The pristine hide of the Beast.\n\n* Frayed abomination stitchings.\n\n*Arcanite Bars.\n\n*Frostwhisper's embalming fluid.\n\nBEHOLD!",o="为了制造阿卡纳护腿，你必须将下列物品交给玛雷弗斯·暗锤：1块比斯巨兽的皮，5根磨损的憎恶缝合线，5块奥金锭，5份莱斯·霜语的防腐液。\n\n另外你还必须支付50金币的制作费用。",oEN="In order to create the Leggings of Arcana, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid.\n\nYou will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",p="除非你收集到了我要的东西，否则你就是在浪费我的时间。",pEN="Unless you've got everything I need, you're wasting my time.",c="很少有凡人能完成这样艰巨的任务。感受一下我的手艺吧！拿好你的奖励！",cEN="Few more improbable tasks I have seen completed by mortals. Bask in the glory of my handiwork! Reap its rewards!"}
Q[5068]={d="据说嗜血胸甲只造出过一件，是为传奇刺客迦罗娜打造的。我怀疑这个世界是否还能再见到第二件。\n\n不过没关系！只要有必要的材料，我们的能工巧匠就能复制出这件物品：\n\n*那头野兽原始无瑕的皮。\n\n*破烂的憎恶缝合线。\n\n*奥金锭。\n\n*暗影之皮。\n\n好好看着吧！",dEN="It is said that only one Breastplate of Bloodthirst has ever been created and that it was made for the legendary assassin, Garona. Whether this world will ever see another is doubtful.\n\nRegardless! Our master crafters can reproduce the item given the necessary components:\n\n*The pristine hide of the Beast.\n\n*Frayed abomination stitchings.\n\n*Arcanite bars.\n\n*The skin of shadow.\n\nBEHOLD!",o="为了制造嗜血胸甲，你必须将下列物品交给玛雷弗斯·暗锤：1块比斯巨兽的皮，10根磨损的憎恶缝合线，5块奥金锭，5块暗影之皮。\n\n另外你还必须支付50金币的制作费用。",oEN="In order to create the Breastplate of Bloodthirst, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Skin of Shadow.\n\nYou will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.",p="除非你收集到了我要的东西，否则你就是在浪费我的时间。",pEN="Unless you've got everything I need, you're wasting my time.",c="我曾以为我一辈子都看不到这一天。\n\n只有这样的报酬才能嘉奖你的壮举。",cEN="I thought I would be dead and buried before I ever saw this day.\n\nAn accomplishment of this magnitude can only be overshadowed by the reward."}
Q[5081]={d="这条消息正好弥补了我们对黑石塔情报的不足。\n\n本次进攻具有决定性的战略意义，$n。\n\n首先，我们要消灭他们的主帅，巨魔沃恩。没有他的战斗计划，黑石兽人将陷入一片混乱之中。\n\n接下来，你必须除掉食人魔之王欧莫克。黑石塔里那些胆小如鼠的食人魔如果没有了他的指挥，就会变成一盘散沙。\n\n最后是黑石塔的核心将领维姆萨拉克。只要维姆萨拉克一死，他们的指挥中枢就会彻底瘫痪。",dEN="This information fills in the gaps to our otherwise impeccable intelligence of Blackrock Spire.\n\nThe attack must be decisive, <name>.\n\nFirst their war master, the troll Voone, must be destroyed. Without his battle plans, the Blackrock orcs will be thrown into chaos.\n\nYou must then take out the ogre Highlord, Omokk. The cowardly ogres of Blackrock are powerless without his leadership.\n\nLastly, the overlord of the citadel: Wyrmthalak. With Wyrmthalak dead, their central command unit is without a conduit.",o="到黑石塔去消灭指挥官沃恩、欧莫克大王和维姆萨拉克。完成任务之后回到麦克斯韦尔元帅处复命。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy War Master Voone, Highlord Omokk, and Overlord Wyrmthalak.",p="情况如何？",pEN="Status?",c="干得漂亮，$n。至少你为我们争取了更多时间——珍贵的时间。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. At the very least, you have bought us more time - precious, precious time."}
Q[5082]={d="我是来冬泉谷调查冰火温泉的。我注意到这里的泉水似乎有些……古怪。我暂时还没有找出问题的根源，老实说，我最近遇到一些麻烦，都是那些冬泉熊怪在作祟。\n\n它们跟我一样被吸引到了泉水附近。这些熊怪对水源的保护意识极强，不让我接近北边那两处较大的温泉。\n\n我想继续进行研究，你能帮帮我吗？",dEN="I came to Winterspring to investigate the Frostfire Hot Springs. I've noticed that the water seems to have ...strange qualities. I haven't yet been able to discover the source, and to tell you the truth, I've had some difficulty lately, due to the Winterfall furbolg.\n\nThey seem to be drawn to the springs, just as I am. They have become extremely protective of the water, and won't let me come near the two larger springs to the north of here.\n\nI'd like to continue my studies, so won't you help me?",o="冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山要你去杀死8个冬泉探路者、8个冬泉巢穴守卫和8个冬泉图腾师。",oEN="Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Pathfinders, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Totemics.",p="感谢你的帮助！",pEN="I appreciate your help!",c="非常感谢你，$n！现在我可以继续研究了。\n\n你在冬泉熊怪的营地里发现什么有趣的东西没有？",cEN="Thanks so much, <name>! Now I can get back to work here.\n\nDid you find anything of interest at the Winterfall camp?"}
Q[5083]={d="你从冬泉熊怪那儿拣来的这只小瓶子是空的，但是里面有一些奇怪的绿色液体，它甚至发出了微微的光芒。\n\n这会是什么重要的东西吗？\n\n多诺瓦·雪山可能会告诉你更多的信息，她在冬泉谷的温泉附近有个营地。",dEN="This vial that you picked up from the Winterfall furbolg is empty, but you can detect a few drops of a strange green liquid inside; it almost glows.\n\nIs it something important?\n\nDonova Snowden would probably be able to tell you more, since she has been camped by the hot springs in Winterspring for some time now.",o="将空的火酒瓶交给冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山。",oEN="Bring the Empty Firewater Flask to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",p="那是什么东西？",pEN="What is that you have found?",c="你是从冬泉熊怪那里得到这东西的吗？",cEN="You got this from the Winterfall?"}
Q[5084]={d="这种绿色液体……它让我想起了费伍德森林中的那些淤泥。我还看见一些冬泉谷的信使进入了木喉要塞……也许这与你正在寻找的瓶子有关，$n。\n\n有一大群熊怪刚刚经过费伍德森林的木喉要塞，它们被称为死木部族，恶魔的气息让它们堕落了。你为什么不去周围看看，找到冬泉谷熊怪和死木熊怪之间的关系？",dEN="This greenish liquid... it reminds me a bit of the sludge I saw when traveling through Felwood. And I have seen some Winterfall Runners passing into Timbermaw... Perhaps these things have something to do with the flask you found, <name>.\n\nThere is a large group of furbolg just past Timbermaw Hold, in Felwood. Called the Deadwood tribe, they have been corrupted and driven mad by the fel. Why don't you look around there and see if you can find any evidence of dealings between the Winterfall and the Deadwood?",o="搜寻费伍德森林北部的死木熊怪的营帐，继续寻找线索。",oEN="Search the Deadwood furbolg camp in northern Felwood for a clue.",c="锅中翻腾着一种令人作呕的腐烂物质……",cEN="Inside the cauldron bubbles a rotting, repulsive-smelling substance..."}
Q[5085]={d="锅里沸腾的绿色物质看起来与你在小瓶子中找到的东西一样。这种奇怪的粘液状的物体可能与制造它的熊怪一样，感染了严重的堕落力量……\n\n如果冬泉熊怪在使用它，那么这是否意味着它们很快就会像死木部族一样堕落？\n\n你最好赶快向多诺瓦汇报你的发现，顺便从锅里采集一点液体样本给她。",dEN="The greenish substance inside the cauldron appears to be similar to what you found in the flask. This strange gooey stuff could be as corrupted as the furbolg that created it...\n\nIf the Winterfall furbolg are using it, does this mean that they will soon be as corrupted as the Deadwood tribe?\n\nIt would be best to report back to Donova with your findings, along with a sample of the liquid in the cauldron.",o="将你的发现报告给多诺瓦·雪山。",oEN="Report back to Donova Snowden with your findings.",p="我希望你有些发现，$n。熊怪变得越来越咄咄逼人了！",pEN="I hope you found something, <name>. The Winterfall are becoming increasingly aggressive!",c="你非常的机警，$n。你认为冬泉熊怪到过死木营地吗？",cEN="You are very resourceful, <name>. Do you think that the Winterfall furbolgs have been to the Deadwood camp?"}
Q[5086]={d="我研究了你取回来的样本，虽然我还无法确定，但是我相信其中包含着有毒的成分。判断这一点的唯一方法是收集其它类似的物质进行比较。\n\n我想死木熊怪也许会从费伍德森林的其它堕落生物那儿收集这些东西，尤其是生活在铁木森林中的那种被称作剧毒之水的元素生物。\n\n为我收集一些样本以进行比较，但是要小心——那里是个非常危险的地方！",dEN="I've studied the sample you returned with, and while I can't say for sure, I believe it contains traces of toxic elements. However, the only way to know for sure is to gather some as a comparison.\n\nI believe that the Deadwood furbolg may be gathering these elements from other corrupted creatures in Felwood; in particular, the elementals living in the Irontree Woods, called toxic horrors.\n\nCollect a few samples for me to compare, but be careful -- it's very dangerous there!",o="为冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山收集3份剧毒水滴。",oEN="Collect 3 Toxic Horror Droplets for Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",p="我想我们就快揭开谜底了，$n。",pEN="I think we are beginning to uncover what is happening here, <name>.",c="我要把这个和你在锅中发现的东西进行比较，然后我们就能获得更多资讯了。",cEN="I have to compare this to the substance you found in the cauldron, and then I'm sure we'll know more."}
Q[5087]={d="真有趣，$n……\n\n当这种有毒物质与温泉里的水混合的时候，它的毒性就消失了，对饮用者来说，它只会产生暂时的影响。这必定是冬泉熊怪如此热衷于守护温泉的原因——它们需要这些泉水来净化火酒。\n\n我们必须阻止它们——截断冬泉熊怪与死木熊怪之间的联系。有一队冬泉熊怪的信使往返于它们的村子和费伍德森林之间。找到它们，把它们的货物劫下来。",dEN="Very interesting, <name>...\n\nWhen this toxic substance is mixed with the water from the hot springs, it loses its toxicity, only retaining the ability to temporarily affect those that ingest it. This must be why the Winterfall protect the hot springs so fervently -- they need them to purify their firewater.\n\nWe need to stop this -- cut off contact between the Winterfall and the Deadwood. A group of runners walks the distance between their village and Felwood. Find and defeat them, and steal their shipment.",o="找到冬泉信使，阻止他们向冬泉村运送物品。",oEN="Find the Winterfall Runners and stop them from delivering their shipment to Winterfall Village.",p="让我们来看没有火酒的冬泉熊怪变成什么样子吧！",pEN="We'll see what happens when the Winterfall don't get their firewater!",c="<多诺瓦检查木箱内的物品>\n\n我在想，熊怪是不是在喝下了这种东西之后就会变得更具攻击性。它们看起来真的比以前更巨大……",cEN="<Donova examines the contents of the crate>\n\nI wonder if consuming this substance makes the furbolg more aggressive. They do seem much larger..."}
Q[5088]={d="把这些提纯净化的火岩粉拿到千针石林去，并洒在生命圣火之上。那团火焰位于黑云峰的一根用于埋葬死者的石针上。\n\n我注入火岩粉中的魔法会将阿利卡拉召唤到你身旁，$n。\n\n我担心她可能在追踪凯恩·血蹄……牛头人的观念改变得太多了，而我担心这一点激怒了阿利卡拉。在事情变得无法收拾之前赶快行动吧，$c！",dEN="Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead.\n\nThe enchantment that I have weaved into the Incendia powder will summon Arikara to you, <name>.\n\nI fear she may be stalking Cairne Bloodhoof; too much Tauren lore has changed, and I fear this has angered Arikara. Move quickly before all is lost, <class>!",o="杀死阿利卡拉。把她的遗体和火岩粉交给白沙岗哨的莫特加·火鬃作为证明。",oEN="Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed.",p="你杀死邪恶的毒蛇阿利卡拉了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you slain the vicious serpent Arikara, <name>?",c="为什么会这样？为什么阿利卡拉要跟踪凯恩·血蹄？玛加萨不可能犯错，她是我们最强大的萨满。\n\n<莫特加摇了摇头。>\n\n无论如何，你对部落所做出的贡献不应被忽视——请从这些物品中挑选一件作为对你的帮助所给予的回报。",cEN="This does not make sense. Why would Arikara be after Cairne Bloodhoof? Magatha could not be wrong, she is our most powerful shaman.\n\n<Motega shakes his head.>\n\nRegardless, your great deed to the Horde shall not go unnoticed - please, choose one of these as a reward for your aid."}
Q[5089]={d="你从尸体上发现了一封看上去很重要的信：一封来自于他的上级达基萨斯将军的信，信的内容似乎跟某种协议有关。\n\n你的直觉告诉你，应该把它交给麦克斯韦尔元帅。",dEN="From the corpse of the defeated serpent you uncover what appears to be a note of some importance: A letter from his superior, General Drakkisath, concerning protocol.\n\nYour instinct tells you that you should take it to Marshal Maxwell.",o="把达基萨斯将军的命令交给燃烧平原的麦克斯韦尔元帅。",oEN="Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="What have you got there, <name>?",c="这份东西意义重大……",cEN="The plot thickens..."}
Q[5090]={d="大家都听着！大家都听着！所有的英雄都应该聆听这号召的声音！\n\n暴风城已经发出了备战的号召！所有勇士都应该拿起武器，一同面对来自东部王国北部地区亡灵天灾的威胁！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，联盟的安全岌岌可危！\n\n联盟的英雄们——去向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到吧，他的大本营就在奥特兰克山脉北边的冰风岗！",dEN="Hear ye, hear ye! All heroes are called upon to heed these words!\n\nA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind! All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!",o="找到指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。他的大本营位于奥特兰克山脉以北的冰风岗。",oEN="Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，$g英雄:英雄;。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是我们北方和东北方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁。我很高兴听到，责任与为大局服务的号角声没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;弄脏双手，那么在这瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着$g愿意并有能力的英雄:愿意并有能力的英雄;去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, especially with the looming threat of the Scourge to our north and northeast. I am glad to hear that the clarion call of duty and service to the greater good did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[5091]={d="大家都听着！大家都听着！所有的英雄都应该聆听这号召的声音！\n\n暴风城已经发出了备战的号召！所有勇士都应该拿起武器，一同面对来自东部王国北部地区亡灵天灾的威胁！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，联盟的安全岌岌可危！\n\n联盟的英雄们——去向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到吧，他的大本营就在奥特兰克山脉北边的冰风岗！",dEN="Hear ye, hear ye! All heroes are called upon to heed these words!\n\nA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind! All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!",o="找到指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。他的大本营位于奥特兰克山脉以北的冰风岗。",oEN="Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，$g英雄:英雄;。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是我们北方和东北方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁。我很高兴听到，责任与为大局服务的号角声没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;弄脏双手，那么在这瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着$g愿意并有能力的英雄:愿意并有能力的英雄;去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, especially with the looming threat of the Scourge to our north and northeast. I am glad to hear that the clarion call of duty and service to the greater good did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[5092]={d="安多哈尔城西和城北的入口防守非常严密，我正在努力从防御力较弱的东面入口寻找突破点。天灾军团以占据悔恨岭的亡灵部队所组成的第一道防线作为缓冲区，如果我们想要进攻安多哈尔的话，就必须穿过悔恨岭。\n\n你的第一个任务是清除悔恨岭一带的障碍，扫除在这一地区出没的骷髅和食尸鬼，任务完成之后就回来向我汇报！",dEN="With Andorhal's western and northern roads into the city well fortified, I'm looking to strike at it from the less defended eastern road. The Scourge relies on the buffer of undead that infests Sorrow Hill as a first line of defense. If we are to advance on Andorhal, we will need to do it through Sorrow Hill.\n\nYour first assignment will be to clear the way through Sorrow Hill. Thin out the skeletons and ghouls that haunt the area; report back to me when this is done!",o="杀掉悔恨岭中的10个骷髅剥皮者和10个被奴役的食尸鬼。\n\n然后向西瘟疫之地冰风岗的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill.\n\nReturn to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="我希望你做好最坏的打算，$n——要深入敌军腹地。我们要完成的可不是简单的任务。在我们集结军队与天灾军团决战之前，你将作为先遣部队的一员对他们发起攻击！你在悔恨岭的任务将是我们通往胜利之路的起点！",pEN="I want you to prepare for the worst, <name> - dig deep. The task in front of us will not be easy. As we rally our forces here to eventually strike out against the Scourge, you will be part of our advance effort that takes the fight to them! Your assigned mission in Sorrow Hill will begin our path to victory!",c="任务完成，$n！干得漂亮，干得漂亮。\n\n请允许我用暴风城金库里的一些钱币，来酬谢你至今为止的工作。我建议你把钱花在能帮助你完成下一个任务的物资上……那个任务会把你带进安多哈尔的废墟。\n\n做好准备！$g保持警觉:保持警觉;！",cEN="Mission accomplished, <name>! Well played, well played.\n\nAllow me to reward your work thus far with some coin from the Stormwind coffers. I'd recommend spending it on materiel that will aid you in your next mission... one that will take you into the ruins of Andorhal itself.\n\nBe ready! Be vigilant!"}
Q[5093]={d="部落的英雄们，请聆听这召唤的声音——部落召唤你们迅速行动起来！\n\n战斗的号角已经吹响，所有勇士都应拿起武器，准备与天灾军团殊死作战！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，部落的安全岌岌可危！\n\n部落的英雄们——去向高级执行官德灵顿报到吧，他的大本营就在提瑞斯法林地东部的亡灵壁垒！",dEN="Heroes of the realm, hear me - the Horde calls upon you for swift action!\n\nA call to arms has been issued for all able bodied individuals to take up arms against the Scourge! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Eastern Kingdoms. They loom to the east of the Undercity, in the northern reaches of the lands now known as the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out High Executor Derrington, who has set up his base camp at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade!",o="找到高级执行官德灵顿。他将自己的大本营建在提瑞斯法林地和幽暗城以东的亡灵壁垒。",oEN="Seek out High Executor Derrington. His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，英雄。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是东方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁，而再往东更远的地方也是如此。我很高兴听到，责任与为部落服务的号召没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;动手干活，那么在瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着愿意并有能力的英雄去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, with the looming threat of the Scourge to our east, and then even further still eastward from there. I am glad to hear that the call of duty and service to the Horde did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
