Q[5095]={d="部落的英雄们，请聆听这召唤的声音——部落召唤你们迅速行动起来！\n\n战斗的号角已经吹响，所有勇士都应拿起武器，准备与天灾军团殊死作战！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，部落的安全岌岌可危！\n\n部落的英雄们——去向高级执行官德灵顿报到吧，他的大本营就在提瑞斯法林地东部的亡灵壁垒！",dEN="Heroes of the realm, hear me - the Horde calls upon you for swift action!\n\nA call to arms has been issued for all able bodied individuals to take up arms against the Scourge! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Eastern Kingdoms. They loom to the east of the Undercity, in the northern reaches of the lands now known as the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out High Executor Derrington, who has set up his base camp at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glades!",o="找到高级执行官德灵顿。他将自己的大本营建在提瑞斯法林地和幽暗城以东的亡灵壁垒。",oEN="Seek out High Executor Derrington. His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glades and the Undercity.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，英雄。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是东方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁，而再往东更远的地方也是如此。我很高兴听到，责任与为部落服务的号召没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;动手干活，那么在瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着愿意并有能力的英雄去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, with the looming threat of the Scourge to our east, and then even further still eastward from there. I am glad to hear that the call of duty and service to the Horde did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[5096]={d="在进军安多哈尔之前，我们必须解决来自壁炉谷的血色十字军的威胁。他们已经在费尔斯通农场和达尔松之泪中间建立了营地，这使得我们在对亡灵天灾和十字军的作战中处于劣势，风险激增。\n\n我的计划是挑起他们之间的战争，你要做的就是去摧毁十字军的指挥帐篷，使用这只箱子里的燃烧瓶就行了。在点燃了帐篷之后，把亡灵天灾的战旗插在他们的营地中。如果我们运气够好的话，十字军就会对亡灵天灾进行报复。",dEN="Before Andorhal, we must tackle the advancing Scarlet Crusade menace from Hearthglen. They've made camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears, making us risk conflict against both the Scourge and the Crusade at once.\n\nMy plan is to play them off of each other by sending you to destroy the command tent they've set up; use some Flame in a Bottle from this box of incendiaries. Once razed, plant this Scourge banner by the tent. With some luck, they'll ignore us and focus on the Scourge for vengeance.",o="到血色十字军建在费尔斯通农场和达尔松之泪之间的营地去，摧毁他们的指挥帐篷。\n\n将亡灵天灾的战旗插在营地中，然后回到西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的高级执行官德灵顿那儿。",oEN="Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent.\n\nPlace the Scourge banner at the camp, and then return to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",c="干得很好，$n。你对血色十字军的攻击为我们赢得了时间。我已经派出了最好的斥候去监视营地，确保那些十字军钻进圈套。\n\n随着我们承受的压力开始减弱，我们就能发起对安多哈尔的攻击，虽然有些风险，但这场战役非常重要。由于你已经顺利地完成了多次任务，我非常希望你也能参与这次行动。",cEN="Finely executed, <name>. Your attack on the Scarlet Crusade will buy us time. I have sent one of my best scouts out to watch over the camp and make sure that the Crusade forces that come to reinforce the position will take the bait.\n\nWith the pressure on us lessened, we should now finally be able to risk a mission into Andorhal itself, and an important one at that. I'd very much like it if you'd perform this one as well, based on your success to date."}
Q[5097]={d="通过使用一种被称作信号火炬的魔法物品，我们可以为军队即将展开的行动标识出目标。我们认为亡灵天灾正在将安多哈尔的哨塔作为控制军队的手段。\n\n你的任务就是突破安多哈尔的防线，将信标放置在四座哨塔中。你必须将信标放在每座哨塔的门口才行。信号火炬仅可使用五次，可别浪费了！",dEN="Through the use of a magical device known as a beacon torch, we can mark targets of our choosing for future actions by our troops. To that end, we think the Scourge are using Andorhal's watchtowers as a means to control their troop movements.\n\nYour mission: breach Andorhal's defenses to plant beacons at all four watchtowers. You'll need to be in the doorway of each tower to plant the beacon; it will then proceed to mark the tower. There are only five charges on the beacon torch, so use them wisely!",o="使用信号火炬为安多哈尔城中的四座哨塔做上标记，你必须站在哨塔门口才能成功地进行标记。\n\n在做完了标记之后，将信号火炬还给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。",oEN="Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.\n\nOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="一旦那几座哨塔被做上了标记，它们就将成为我们在安多哈尔的首要攻击目标。我预计在攻占那些哨塔塔之后就要和安多哈尔城中的主力部队交锋了。那时，我们要进行一场痛快淋漓的战斗，一举夺取城市的控制权！\n\n我希望你凯旋而归，另外别忘了把信号火炬也带回来，我们可不能浪费资源。",pEN="Once the towers are marked, they'll become top priority targets for our attack on Andorhal. I suspect that once we neutralize the towers, the main threat of Andorhal will emerge. From that point on, we'll have a straight-up fight for control of the city!\n\nyou're back to report success, yes? Don't forget the beacon torch as well; we must maintain control of our materiel.",c="我的牧师报告说信号追踪器接收到了来自四座哨塔的强烈信号！那么你肯定是已经成功完成了这项任务！干得好，$n！\n\n哨塔已被做上了标记，进攻的准备工作也一切就绪。与天灾军团的战争就要开始了！",cEN="My priests are reporting that our beacon trackers are picking up extremely strong signals on all four towers! Dare I say it, but I believe you've executed another mission with complete and total success! Well played once again, <name>!\n\nWith the towers marked, our preparations for the attack are now in place. The time has come to take the fight to the Scourge!"}
Q[5098]={d="通过使用一种被称作信号火炬的魔法物品，我们可以为军队即将展开的行动标识出目标。我们认为亡灵天灾正在将安多哈尔的哨塔作为控制军队的手段。\n\n你的任务就是突破安多哈尔的防线，将信标放置在四座哨塔中。你必须将信标放在每座哨塔的门口才行。信号火炬仅可使用五次，可别浪费了！",dEN="Through the use of a magical device known as a beacon torch, we can mark targets of our choosing for future actions by our troops. To that end, we think the Scourge are using Andorhal's watchtowers as a means to control their troop movements.\n\nYour mission: breach Andorhal's defenses to plant beacons at all four watchtowers. You'll need to be in the doorway of each tower to plant the beacon; it will then proceed to mark the tower. There are only five charges on the beacon torch, so use them wisely!",o="使用信号火炬为安多哈尔城中的四座哨塔做上标记，你必须站在哨塔门口才能成功地进行标记。\n\n在做完了标记之后，将信号火炬还给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的高级执行官德灵顿。",oEN="Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.\n\nOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="一旦那几座哨塔被做上了标记，它们就将成为我们在安多哈尔的首要攻击目标。我预计在攻占那些哨塔塔之后就要和安多哈尔城中的主力部队交锋了。那时，我们要进行一场痛快淋漓的战斗，一举夺取城市的控制权！\n\n我希望你凯旋而归，另外别忘了把信号火炬也带回来，我们可不能浪费资源。",pEN="Once the towers are marked, they'll become top priority targets for our attack on Andorhal. I suspect that once we neutralize the towers, the main threat of Andorhal will emerge. From that point on, we'll have a straight-up fight for control of the city!\n\nYou're back to report success, yes? Don't forget the beacon torch as well; we must maintain control of our materiel.",c="我的术士报告说信号追踪器接收到了来自四座哨塔的强烈信号！那么你肯定是已经成功完成了这项任务，并再一次对部落做出了巨大的贡献！干得好，$n！\n\n哨塔已被做上了标记，进攻的准备工作也一切就绪。与天灾军团的战争就要开始了！",cEN="My warlocks are reporting that our beacon trackers are picking up extremely strong signals on all four towers! You've executed my orders with the skill and precision of a seasoned veteran. Your service to the Horde is duly noted once more, <name>!\n\nWith the towers marked, our preparations for the attack are now in place. The time has come to take the fight to the Scourge!"}
Q[5102]={d="我们和这些怪物正在进行双线作战：在暴风城，我们努力不让它们的魔爪深入城市；在燃烧平原，我们把战火烧到它们门前。我们必须时刻保持着警惕，$n。当它们侵占我们的领地，残害我们家人的时候，我们要把怒火全部倾泻出来。\n\n找到达基萨斯将军，然后干掉它！\n\n这个任务显然不简单，但是完成它所能得到的奖励也是相当丰厚的。",dEN="We battle against these beasts on two fronts: From our capital of Stormwind we fight them from the inside out and here, in the Burning Steppes, we take the battle to their doorstep. We must be vigilant, <name>. None should be spared our wrath as none of our own were spared when they struck at our homes and families.\n\nFind this General Drakkisath and destroy him!\n\nThe task certainly will not be a simple one, but the rewards shall be extravagant.",o="到黑石塔去杀掉达基萨斯将军，完成任务之后就回到麦克斯韦尔元帅那里复命。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath.",p="任务完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="当然，我们接下来就要干掉它们的龙领主。做得好，勇敢的联盟战士！做得非常好。",cEN="Surely, we will strike against their dragon lords next. Well done, brave soldier of the Alliance! Well done, indeed."}
Q[5103]={d="这个人留下的只有一把烧焦了的骨头。他似乎是死于他找到的东西——一副未淬火的板甲护手。\n\n也许你应该拿起那副手套，然后离开这里？",dEN="The only thing that remains of this human are some charred bones. He seems to have died within arms reach of what he was after - unfired plate gauntlets.\n\nPerhaps you should grab the gauntlets and get out of the fire?",o="世界上一定有人知道关于这副手套的事情，祝你好运！",oEN="Someone in this world must know what to do with these gauntlets. Good luck!",c="你要干什……",cEN="What the..."}
Q[5121]={d="虽然我们还不太清楚为什么熊怪会吃下这种奇怪的物质，但我们最好尽快阻止它们。\n\n冬泉熊怪并不是一个好战的部族，它们的巨大变化让我认为它们一定是在执行领袖的命令。我们无法挽回它们已经造成的损失，但是我想，如果它们的领袖被除掉的话，事态至少不会进一步恶化。\n\n快去冬泉村吧。",dEN="While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand.\n\nThe Winterfall furbolg are not a normally aggressive tribe, and this change in their behavior leads me to think that they must be under orders from their chief. We most likely can't undo the damage that has already been done, but I think that if their leader is slain, they will not get any worse.\n\nHead east to Winterfall Village.",o="冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山要你去击败冬泉酋长。",oEN="Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",p="也许你可以在冬泉谷里找到更多的线索，$n。",pEN="Maybe you will find out more in Winterfall Village, <name>.",c="非常感谢你，$n。我希望能不受干扰地继续进行我的研究。请收下这个作为报酬。",cEN="Thank you so much, <name>. I hope to get back to my studies without worry that I will be ambushed. Please accept this as a reward."}
Q[5122]={p="这个小教堂给了我抵抗内心中的腐化力量。如果离开这里，我就会变成一个死亡骑士。但是有一枚勋章，信仰勋章，它可以给予我离开这里所需的力量。\n\n$n，请帮我拿回这枚勋章。它被狂热的玛洛尔看守着，他是血色十字军的一员，居住在西斯坦索姆的血色十字军堡垒深处。",pEN="The power of this chapel gives me the strength to resist the corruption in my heart. If I leave it, I will become a death knight. But there is a medallion, the medallion of faith, that will give me the strength I need to leave.\n\nPlease, <name>, retrieve the medallion. It is guarded by Malor the Zealous, a crazed member of the Scarlet Crusade who resides deep in the Scarlet Bastion in western Stratholme.",c="你找回勋章了！现在我可以离开这个教堂去继续履行我的职责了。\n\n我的职责就是去杀死那个帮助腐蚀了我和许多兄弟姐妹的野兽，瑞文戴尔男爵！",cEN="You retrieved the medallion! Now I will be able to leave the chapel and perform my duty.\n\nThat duty is to kill the beast who helped corrupt me and so many of my brothers and sisters, Baron Rivendare!"}
Q[5123]={d="你在大酋长身上找到的那本日志看起来内容很多，但翻了几页之后，你发现自己读不懂上面的文字。那些符号粗糙、写得歪歪扭扭，你甚至不确定有没有人能读懂。\n\n不过$g也许:也许;多诺瓦能告诉你上面写了什么……",dEN="The log you found on the high chief looks extensive, but after looking through a couple of the pages, you find that you cannot read the text. The markings are so crude and poorly-formed that you are not sure if anyone would be able to read them.\n\nBut perhaps Donova will be able to tell you what it says...",o="把潦草的日志交给冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山。",oEN="Bring the Crudely-written Log to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.",p="嗯，这是什么，$n？",pEN="Now, what's this, <name>?",c="我在想这些东西代表了什么……我什么都看不出来……",cEN="I wonder what all of this means... I can't make anything out..."}
Q[5124]={d="以索瑞森的胡子起誓！\n\n你是在哪儿找到它们的？\n\n更重要的是，$g你愿意:你愿意;把它们分给我吗？当然，面对如此高尚的举动，我会非常慷慨。\n\n这样吧，$n。如果你把那副未锻烧的板甲手套给我，我就教你自己做一副。你只需要替我收集材料，好让我弄清确切的配方。\n\n成交吗？？\n\n这是我所需要的全部东西的清单。既然手套由你提供，未附魔的瑟银就由我来出。|n",dEN="By Thaurissan's beard!\n\nWhere did you find them?\n\nMore importantly, are you willing to part with them? Naturally, I would pay you for such a noble gesture.\n\nI'll tell you what, <name>. If you give me those unfired gauntlets, I will teach you how to make a set all your own. All you need to do is collect the parts for me so that I may narrow down the exact recipe.\n\nDo we have a deal??\n\nHere's the list of what I need, I'll front the non-enchanted thorium myself since you're supplying the gauntlets.",o="将6块魔化瑟银锭、2份火焰精华和4颗红宝石交给玛雷弗斯·暗锤。另外你还得把未淬火的板甲护手也交给他。",oEN="Bring Malyfous Darkhammer 6 Enchanted Thorium Bars, 2 Essence of Fire, and 4 Star Rubies. You will also need to turn in your Unfired Plate Gauntlets.",p="时间就是金钱，$n和我都浪费不起。",pEN="Time is money, <name> and I don't have much of either.",c="作为承诺，$N，这是你要的配方！为了表示感谢，我还会送你一件小东西，我要这些也没啥用。",cEN="As promised, <name>, here's your recipe! I'm also going to throw in a little something extra for all of your hard work and dedication. What am I going to do with these anyway???"}
Q[5125]={c="$n，我快死了……但我的灵魂得到了拯救。我欠你的情是无法用言语来表达的。请拿着这个……继续战斗下去吧，勇敢的$c！",cEN="<name>, I am dying... but my soul is saved. For that, I owe you more than words can say. Please, take this... and fight on, brave <class>!"}
Q[5126]={d="那个萨特正在四处踱步并且自言自语。你想跟他搭话吗？",dEN="The Satyr paces about and talks to himself. Do you wish to question him?",o="与洛拉克斯交谈。听听他要对你说什么。|n",oEN="Speak with Lorax. Listen to what he has to say.",c="<罗拉克斯大笑了起来。>",cEN="<Lorax laughs.>"}
Q[5127]={d="罗拉克斯做生意，但他不与那些无足轻重的凡人打交道。\n\n不过，我要跟你做一笔生意……带上这支矛，它充满着恶魔的强大能量，当你找到古拉鲁克时，杀了他，然后用这支矛刺穿他的心脏。他的灵魂将被吸取，而这灵魂将为我所有。把长矛和他偷走的胸甲给我带回来，然后我就会交给你他想要学习的东西。",dEN="Lorax makes deals, he does not accept them from insignificant mortals.\n\nA deal I shall make with you, however... take this pike, it is imbued with powerful Fel energies. When you find Goraluk Anvilcrack, slay him and drive this pike through his dying heart. His soul he bartered, his soul I shall have. Return the pike and return the breastplate that the thief stole and I shall teach you what it is that he was to learn.",o="到黑石塔去找到古拉鲁克。杀死他，然后用血污长矛刺入他的尸体。当他的灵魂被吸干后，这支矛就会成为穿魂长矛。\n\n你还必须找到未铸造的符文覆饰胸甲。\n\n将穿魂长矛和未铸造的符文覆饰胸甲都交给冬泉谷的罗拉克斯。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.\n\nYou must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.\n\nReturn both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.",p="别让我等得不耐烦……",pEN="Tempt not...",c="你没有破坏我们的协定。我带走了灵魂。我会给你酬劳。",cEN="Our pact you did not break. The soul I did take. The reward I shall make."}
Q[5128]={d="冬泉熊怪对我而言已不是个威胁了，但是如果你仍然想要查出是什么驱使熊怪制造并饮用这种奇怪的火酒，那么你应该去寻求科雷克·望天的帮助。\n\n他是翡翠议会的成员，那个组织中的德鲁伊都在致力于净化和治愈费伍德森林的创伤。\n\n科雷克对费伍德森林中的熊怪非常了解，他可以告诉你更多关于这本日志的信息。\n\n再次感谢你，$n。",dEN="The Winterfall are no longer a threat to me, but if you still want to find out what was driving the furbolg to create and consume this strange firewater, I think you should seek out Kelek Skykeeper.\n\nHe is part of a group known as the Emerald Circle, druids that are committed to their work in Felwood, healing the land from the corruption.\n\nKelek has much experience with the furbolgs in Felwood, and may be able to tell you more about the log.\n\nThank you, again, <name>.",o="将潦草的日志交给费伍德森林南部的科雷克·望天。",oEN="Take the Crudely-written Log to Kelek Skykeeper in southern Felwood.",p="翡翠议会对所有的种族都非常友善，$r。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="The Emerald Circle is friendly to all, <race>. What can I do for you?",c="嗯，如果你让我好好研究一下这个，我可能会帮你翻译出来。\n\n<科雷克翻动着书页。>\n\n等我看完它之后，我会通知你的。\n\n谢谢你把它交给我，$n。说实话，我对冬泉熊怪知之甚少。",cEN="Yes, if you let me examine this for a while, I might be able to translate it for you.\n\n<Kelek flips through the pages.>\n\nWhen I am able to look over this fully, I will send word to you.\n\nThank you for sharing this with me, <name>. Very little is known about the Winterfall furbolg."}
Q[5141]={d="龙鳞制皮可不是件简单的工作，但是收益也非常丰厚。我可以教你如何制造这件精良的锁甲，但你得先同意我的一些条件。\n\n你选择了这条路，就必须承诺永远不会学习元素制皮技术或部族制皮技术，只能沿着这条路走下去。此外，你还必须制造一件蝎壳护甲。最后，我还要看看你是否有能力获得制造护甲所必需的材料：龙类的鳞片。",dEN="Dragonscale leatherworking isn't easy, but it's extremely rewarding. I'll teach you how to make this fine mail armor, but only if you agree to certain conditions.\n\nBy choosing this path, you agree never to learn elemental or tribal leatherworking; there is only room for one of the three at the apex of the craft. Furthermore, I'll need some samples of your best work involving scorpid armor. Finally, I'll need proof of your ability to acquire the staple of the trade: scales of the dragonkin.",o="将2套硬化蝎壳胸甲、2套硬化蝎壳手套和10片龙鳞交给艾萨拉的彼得·加林。\n\n完成这项任务之后，你就可以学到龙鳞制皮技术了。\n\n同时，你也将永远无法学习元素制皮技术和部族制皮技术，在决定之前先考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves, and 10 Worn Dragonscales to Peter Galen in Azshara.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Dragonscale Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Elemental Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="如果你已经$g准备好:准备好;做出永久性的决定，成为一名龙鳞制皮师，那么我也准备好收你为徒了。只要把我要求的东西带来，我们就会开始你的学业，$g真的:真的;。",pEN="If you're ready to commit to a permanent decision by becoming a dragonscale leatherworker, then I'm ready to take you on as a student. Just bring to me the things I asked for, and we'll begin your education.",c="我将向你传授龙鳞制皮技能，你做这样的决定一定是下了极大的勇气吧。我向你保证，掌握这种技能会给你带来丰厚的回报。\n\n要学会龙鳞制皮，你只要跟我交谈，我就会把我所掌握的知识都传授给你。",cEN="I'll hand it to you - it takes a strong will to make a permanent decision like you've just done. I assure you, dragonscale leatherworking will prove to be a profitable and rewarding path for you to follow.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5142]={d="在达隆郡之战中，有多少生命逝去啊！许多人死了……或者更糟。\n\n战斗打响时，我把我的侄女帕米拉藏了起来……可我不知道她后来怎么样了。我不过是个游荡的幽灵，但我的心仍然渴望知道帕米拉的命运。\n\n求你了，善良的$C，你能去达隆郡找找她吗？它在东边，就在盖罗恩农场的枯萎之地那边，$g真的:真的;。",dEN="So many of us died at the battle of Darrowshire. So many died... and worse.\n\nWhen the battle began I hid my niece Pamela, and I do not know what happened to her. I am but a wandering spirit, but my heart still longs to know Pamela's fate.\n\nPlease, good <class>. Will you go to Darrowshire and search for her? It is to the east, beyond Gahrron's Withering.",o="找到帕米拉·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Find Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire.",c="你好。我叫帕米拉，你叫什么名字？",cEN="Hello. I'm Pamela, what's your name?"}
Q[5143]={d="要学习部族制皮技术，你就必须了解大自然最初的状态。我知道你已经掌握了制造蛮皮护甲的技术，我很乐意帮助你完成训练。\n\n要知道，$c，一旦你选择了这条路，就得承诺永远不会学习龙鳞制皮技术和元素制皮技术，你只能沿着自己选定的路走下去。此外，将你所能制造出来的最好的蛮皮护甲给我看看，然后我就可以向你传授技艺了。",dEN="To learn tribal leatherworking demands an understanding of how primal nature truly is; I know that you have already mastered the art of making wild leather armor, and I am willing to complete your training.\n\nKnow this, <class>: by choosing this path you agree never to learn dragonscale or elemental leatherworking; there is only room for practice of one of the three arts. Furthermore, bring to me the finest samples of your wild leather armor. From there, we will begin your mastery.",o="将1件蛮皮外衣和1件蛮皮头盔交给菲拉斯的凯雷希亚·猎月。\n\n完成这项任务之后，你就可以学到部族制皮技术了。\n\n同时，你也将永远无法学习元素制皮技术和龙鳞制皮技术，在决定之前先考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Caryssia Moonhunter in Feralas.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="在你期望学习如何利用大自然提供的材料制作皮甲之前，你必须对它有所贡献。让我看看你为大自然奉献了什么吧，它会回报你的。",pEN="Nature is a force that must be appeased before you hope to learn how to bend its will into your leather garments. Bring me your offering to this force, and I will make sure you are heard.",c="你带来了最好的贡献，大自然会顺应你的要求。在我向你传授了部族制皮的技艺之后，你的作品将成为自然本身力量的体现。\n\n要学会部族制皮，你只要跟我交谈，我就会把我所掌握的知识都传授给你。",cEN="You've given your finest offerings, and nature will soon permit you to bend her to your will. Once I have finished my tutelage, your work will be a force of nature unto itself.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5144]={d="我熟知元素制皮的技艺，如果你愿意敞开心扉学习更多的知识，那么我愿意与你分享我所知的一切。\n\n你要明白，$c：一旦你选择了这条道路，就必须承诺永远不学习龙鳞制皮或是部落制皮；你只能学习这三种手艺中的一种。此外，我需要你证明自己与大自然的元素有着融洽的关系，所以，你要将火、水、土和风元素最纯净的精华交给我。",dEN="Elemental leatherworking is what I know, and if you're willing to open your mind to the greater powers of substance, I will share with you all there is to learn.\n\nKnow this, <class>: by choosing this path you agree never to learn dragonscale or tribal leatherworking; there is only room for practice of one of the three arts. Furthermore, I'll need adequate proof that you are in tune with the elements of nature; to that end, bring me the purest essences of fire, water, earth, and wind.",o="将2个火焰之心、2个纯水之球、2个大地之核和2个风之气息交给灼热峡谷的萨拉·坦尼。\n\n一旦你完成这项任务，就可以开始学习元素制皮技艺了。\n\n同时，你也就无法再学习龙鳞制皮和部落制皮了，在你决定之前要考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring 2 Heart of Fire, 2 Globe of Water, 2 Core of Earth, and 2 Breath of Wind to Sarah Tanner in Searing Gorge.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Elemental Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="制造皮甲需要耐心和热情。一旦你投身元素制皮工作，就不能退出了。让我看看你是否能胜任这项工作，然后我们就可以开始了。",pEN="Making this kind of leather-based armor requires patience and dedication. Once you have cast your lot with the elements, there is no turning your back on them. Bring me proof of your worthiness, and we'll get started.",c="你已经决定投身这项工作，并得到了元素的认可。在我给你传授元素制皮的技艺之后，你就可以随心所欲地制造出最好的皮甲了。\n\n在你准备好了之后来跟我谈话，然后我就将你想学的知识统统传授给你。",cEN="You've cast your lot, and the elements accept you. Once I have finished my tutelage, you shall command the will to craft the finest of leather garbs.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5145]={d="龙鳞制皮可不是件简单的工作，但是收益也非常丰厚。我可以教你如何制造这件精良的锁甲，但你得先同意我的一些条件。\n\n你选择了这条路，就必须承诺永远不会学习元素制皮技术或部族制皮技术，只能沿着这条路走下去。此外，你还必须制造一件蝎壳护甲。最后，我还要看看你是否有能力获得制造护甲所必需的材料：龙类的鳞片。",dEN="Dragonscale leatherworking isn't easy, but it's extremely rewarding. I'll teach you how to make this fine mail armor, but only if you agree to certain conditions.\n\nBy choosing this path, you agree never to learn elemental or tribal leatherworking; there is only room for one of the three at the apex of the craft. Furthermore, I'll need some samples of your best work involving scorpid armor. Finally, I'll need proof of your ability to acquire the staple of the trade: scales of the dragonkin.",o="将2套硬化蝎壳胸甲、2套硬化蝎壳手套和10片龙鳞交给荒芜之地的索卡夫·龙眼。\n\n完成这项任务之后，你就可以学到龙鳞制皮技术了。\n\n同时，你也将永远无法学习元素制皮技术和部族制皮技术，在决定之前先考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves, and 10 Worn Dragonscales to Thorkaf Dragoneye in the Badlands.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Dragonscale Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Elemental Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="如果你已经$g准备好:准备好;做出永久性的决定，成为一名龙鳞制皮师，那么我也准备好收你为徒了。只要把我要求的东西带来，我们就会开始你的学业，$g真的:真的;。",pEN="If you're ready to commit to a permanent decision by becoming a dragonscale leatherworker, then I'm ready to take you on as a student. Just bring to me the things I asked for, and we'll begin your education.",c="我将向你传授龙鳞制皮技能，你做这样的决定一定是下了极大的勇气吧。我向你保证，掌握这种技能会给你带来丰厚的回报。\n\n要学会龙鳞制皮，你只要跟我交谈，我就会把我所掌握的知识都传授给你。",cEN="I'll hand it to you - it takes a strong will to make a permanent decision like you've just done. I assure you, dragonscale leatherworking will prove to be a profitable and rewarding path for you to follow.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5146]={d="我熟知元素制皮的技艺，如果你愿意敞开心扉学习更多的知识，那么我愿意与你分享我所知的一切。\n\n你要明白，$c：一旦你选择了这条道路，就必须承诺永远不学习龙鳞制皮或是部落制皮；你只能学习这三种手艺中的一种。此外，我需要你证明自己与大自然的元素有着融洽的关系，所以，你要将火、水、土和风元素最纯净的精华交给我。",dEN="Elemental leatherworking is what I know, and if you're willing to open your mind to the greater powers of substance, I will share with you all there is to learn.\n\nKnow this, <class>: by choosing this path you agree never to learn dragonscale or tribal leatherworking; there is only room for practice of one of the three arts. Furthermore, I'll need adequate proof that you are in tune with the elements of nature; to that end, bring me the purest essences of fire, water, earth, and wind.",o="将2个火焰之心、2个纯水之球、2个大地之核和2个风之气息交给阿拉希山脉的布鲁姆·白蹄。\n\n一旦你完成这项任务，就可以开始学习元素制皮技艺了。\n\n同时，你也就无法再学习龙鳞制皮和部落制皮了，在你决定之前要考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring 2 Heart of Fire, 2 Globe of Water, 2 Core of Earth, and 2 Breath of Wind to Brumn Winterhoof in the Arathi Mountains.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Elemental Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="制造皮甲需要耐心和热情。一旦你投身元素制皮工作，就不能退出了。让我看看你是否能胜任这项工作，然后我们就可以开始了。",pEN="Making this kind of leather-based armor requires patience and dedication. Once you have cast your lot with the elements, there is no turning your back on them. Bring me proof of your worthiness, and we'll get started.",c="你已经决定投身这项工作，并得到了元素的认可。在我给你传授元素制皮的技艺之后，你就可以随心所欲地制造出最好的皮甲了。\n\n在你准备好了之后来跟我谈一谈，然后我就将你想学的知识统统传授给你。",cEN="You've cast your lot, and the elements accept you. Once I have finished my tutelage, you shall command the will to craft the finest of leather garbs.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5147]={d="通缉：阿纳克·恐怖图腾\n\n流放者阿纳克因罪大恶极的谋杀和绑架行为而被通缉。那些敢于将这名罪犯绳之以法的勇士将获得丰厚的报酬。\n\n阿纳克最后一次被发现是在黑云峰附近的悬崖上。请向乱风岗的峭壁卫兵图林·长角出示你杀死阿纳克的证明。",dEN="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem\n\nArnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice.\n\nArnak was last seen on the cliffs near the Darkcloud Pinnacle. Show the proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post in order to claim the reward.",o="杀死阿纳克·恐怖图腾，并向乱风岗的峭壁卫兵图林·长角出示证据。",oEN="Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",p="你有什么关于阿纳克·恐怖图腾的消息吗？",pEN="Have you any news of that murderous Arnak Grimtotem?",c="哈哈！这可真是个好消息！我起初还以为他会永远消遥法外呢！\n\n给你，$n……谢谢你。听到阿纳克邪恶的行径得到了惩处，我就不由得热血沸腾！",cEN="Hah! Well, this is excellent news! I was starting to think that he would never be brought to justice!\n\nHere you are, <name>... and thanks. News of Anrak's foul deeds boiled my blood!"}
Q[5148]={d="要学习部族制皮技术，你就必须了解大自然最初的状态。我知道你已经掌握了制造蛮皮护甲的技术，我很乐意帮助你完成训练。\n\n要知道，$c：一旦你选择了这条路，就得承诺永远不会学习龙鳞制皮技术和元素制皮技术，你只能沿着自己选定的路走下去。此外，将你所能制造出来的最好的蛮皮护甲给我看看，然后我就可以向你传授技艺了。",dEN="To learn tribal leatherworking demands an understanding of how primal nature truly is; I know that you have already mastered the art of making wild leather armor, and I am willing to complete your training.\n\nKnow this, <class>: by choosing this path you agree never to learn dragonscale or elemental leatherworking; there is only room for practice of one of the three arts. Furthermore, bring to me the finest samples of your wild leather armor. From there, we will begin your mastery.",o="将1件蛮皮外衣和1件蛮皮头盔交给荆棘谷的瑟伊布。\n\n完成这项任务之后，你就可以学到部族制皮技术了。\n\n同时，你也将永远无法学习元素制皮技术和龙鳞制皮技术，在决定之前先考虑清楚。",oEN="Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Se'Jib in Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts.\n\nThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.",p="在你期望学习如何利用大自然提供的材料制作皮甲之前，你必须对它有所贡献。让我看看你为大自然奉献了什么吧，它会回报你的。",pEN="Nature is a force that must be appeased before you hope to learn how to bend its will into your leather garments. Bring me your offering to this force, and I will make sure you are heard.",c="你带来了最好的贡献，大自然会顺应你的要求。在我向你传授了部族制皮的技艺之后，你的作品将成为自然本身力量的体现。\n\n要学会部族制皮，你只要跟我交谈，我就会把我所掌握的知识都传授给你。",cEN="You've given your finest offerings, and nature will soon permit you to bend her to your will. Once I have finished my tutelage, your work will be a force of nature unto itself.\n\nTo train in the art for the future, simply speak to me and I will make available any knowledge that you have yet to commit as yours."}
Q[5149]={d="玛莱恩姑妈让我留在家里，因为我的爸爸出去作战了。爸爸是世界上最勇敢的人！\n\n但是我在这里等了很长时间，他一直都没有回来。有时候会有坏人来和我说话，我想让爸爸把他们赶走，但是他不在这里！\n\n有时候，天黑了以后，我会和我的洋娃娃玩，但是我把它丢在镇子里了。\n\n你能不能去帮我找到洋娃娃呢？",dEN="My auntie Marlene told me to stay here in our house because my father had to go and fight. My father's the bravest man in the whole world!\n\nBut I've been here for a long time, and he hasn't come for me. Sometimes bad people come and whisper to me and I want my dad to make them go away, but he's not here!\n\nAnd sometimes when it gets dark I want to play with my doll but I can't because I left it in town.\n\nWill you find my doll for me?",o="找到帕米拉的洋娃娃。",oEN="Find Pamela's doll.",p="你找到我的洋娃娃了吗？",pEN="Did you find my doll?",c="你找到它了！你找到我的洋娃娃了！哦，谢谢你！",cEN="You found it! You found my doll! Oh, thank you!"}
Q[5150]={p="当你走向达丹加的时候，她目不转睛地看着你。她似乎在希望你拿给她什么东西……\n\n她也许是饿了！\n\n也许在环形山里长着一些可以喂给这头大型食草动物的花花草草。达丹加的个头不小，不管你准备给她喂什么，数量肯定少不了！",pEN="Dadanga looks up at you as you approach her. She seems to be hoping for something...\n\nShe's probably hungry!\n\nThere's got to be something growing in the crater that would be just the perfect snack for a large herbivore. Dadanga's a big girl; whatever you bring her, there would need to be a lot of it!",c="你把血瓣花苗放在达丹加前面，她看起来很满意。\n\n她推出了一个小型棕色包裹，用它来交换你给她的食品！",cEN="Placing the sprouts in front of her, Dadanga seems pleased.\n\nShe nudges a small brown-wrapped package towards you, in exchange for the treat!"}
Q[5151]={d="我是我们商队遭半人马袭击后唯一的幸存者。一只罕见而强大的黑豹守着我最好的发明，就挂在它脖子上。哈！连半人马见了它都发抖。\n\n这是豹笼的钥匙。那里已经什么都没有了，只剩下那只黑豹。干掉那头野兽，把我的超级电容器带回来，我就会奖赏你。\n\n商队的残骸就在北边。|n",dEN="I am the only survivor from our caravan attack by the centaur! A rare yet mighty panther is guarding my best gizmo, which is around his neck. Hah! Even the centaur tremble in the presence of this ferocious beast!\n\nHere is the key to the cage. They took everything there, but left him alone. Slay this beast and bring back my hypercapacitor, and I shall reward you.\n\nThe wrecked caravan is just north of here.",o="杀了那头野兽，把超适应齿轮和钥匙交给维兹罗。",oEN="Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.",p="你拿到我的超适应齿轮了吗？",pEN="Do you have my hypercapacitor?",c="我的超适应齿轮！在我研究出它的功能前这可要让我忙上好一阵子……",cEN="My hypercapacitor! This will keep me busy for a while until I can figure out what it does..."}
Q[5152]={d="我好孤单啊！我的家人在哪里？玛琳阿姨让我待在这里，可她后来就走了，到现在还没回来！还有我爸爸……你见过他吗？\n\n也许玛琳阿姨知道他在哪儿。她住在安多哈尔附近，南边的一栋房子里。我记得是在一座小山上……对，她说是在一座小山上。\n\n求你了，$n。你是我的$g新朋友:新朋友;！你能替我去和阿姨谈谈吗？",dEN="Oh, I'm so lonely! Where is my family? Auntie Marlene told me to stay here, but then she left and never came back! And my dad... have you seen him?\n\nMaybe Auntie Marlene knows where he is. She lives near Andorhal, in a house to the south. I think it was on a hill... she said it was on a hill.\n\nPlease, <name>. You're my new friend! Will you talk to my Auntie for me?",o="与安多哈尔废墟南边的玛莱恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Marlene, south of the Ruins of Andorhal.",c="你看到帕米拉了？她怎么样了？她还活着吗？不！可怜的帕米拉！她那么小，她是个多么快乐的小孩子啊……\n\n她不知道她爸爸发生了什么事情，是不是？我的兄弟约瑟夫？\n\n不……她无法理解约瑟夫究竟是怎么了。即使她可以理解，我想我也不能把这件事情告诉她……",cEN="You saw Pamela? How is she? Is she alive?? Oh, no! Poor Pamela! She was so young, and such a happy child...\n\nShe doesn't know what happened to her father, does she? My brother, Joseph?\n\nNo... she couldn't understand what happened to Joseph. And even if she could, I don't have the heart to tell her..."}
Q[5153]={d="我希望约瑟夫重新回到她女儿身边，但是这已经不可能了。他的灵魂已经属于亡灵天灾，他已经变成了一个怪物。唉，他命中注定如此！\n\n但是，也许我们能改变他的命运。\n\n在墓地外围寻找约瑟夫的墓碑。他的躯体不在那里，因为他已经在几年前灰飞烟灭了，但是在墓碑下埋着他的戒指。把戒指交给克罗米……那是个具有强大魔法力量的侏儒。\n\n克罗米在安多哈尔南墙附近的旅馆废墟中。",dEN="I wish Joseph could again be with his daughter, but it cannot be so. His soul was twisted by the Scourge, and he became a monster. Oh, he is doomed!\n\nBut perhaps we can change his fate.\n\nSearch the graves outside for Joseph's monument. His body's not there, for it was trampled and destroyed years ago, but under the monument is his wedding ring. Take that ring to Chromie... a strange gnome with very strange powers.\n\nChromie is staying in the ruined inn at the northwest corner of Andorhal.",o="把约瑟夫的结婚戒指交给安多哈尔的克罗米。",oEN="Bring Joseph's Wedding Ring to Chromie.",p="你来访的时间很有意思……你不是来自未来的吧？",pEN="There is something timely about your visit. You're not from the future, are you?",c="这是什么？一枚结婚戒指？让我看看……\n\n啊！这枚戒指曾经戴在一位伟人的手上，但那个人的过去充满了悲剧。\n\n你是来帮他的吗？对他来说已经太迟了……但也许我们可以在过去帮帮他！",cEN="What is this? A wedding ring? Let me see...\n\nAh! This ring was once on the hand of a great man, but there is much tragedy in that man's past.\n\nAre you here to help him? It's far too late for him now... but perhaps we can help him in the past!"}
Q[5154]={d="要拯救约瑟夫·雷德帕斯，我们首先得找到他的过去。安多哈尔城镇中心有一本书，名叫《达隆郡的历史》，它可以告诉我们一些重要的事情。\n\n把书拿来给我，然后我们就可以了解约瑟夫的命运，如果运气好的话……我们还能改变它！",dEN="To save Joseph Redpath, we must first discover his past. We can learn this in the Annals of Darrowshire, a book held in the city hall of Andorhal.\n\nBring me that book. We can then learn Joseph's fate, and with luck... change it!",o="把《达隆郡的历史》交给安多哈尔的克罗米。",oEN="Bring the Annals of Darrowshire to Chromie in Andorhal.",p="你找到书了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you find the book, <name>?",c="干得好，你找到它了！\n\n你读过这本书了吗？里面提到约瑟夫·雷德帕斯了吗？如果是的话，那我们就可以拯救他！\n\n啊。《达隆郡的历史》讲述了一段令人扼腕叹息的故事。书中说约瑟夫·雷德帕斯在战斗中陷入了堕落，并且变成了天灾军团的一员！他因此而背叛了达隆郡的防卫者们。\n\n这真是个悲惨的命运。如果可能的话，我们一定要改变它，你说对吗？",cEN="Well done, you found it!\n\nDid you read it? Is Joseph Redpath mentioned? If he is, then perhaps we can save him!\n\nAh. The Annals of Darrowshire tell a very unsettling tale. It says that during the battle, Joseph Redpath was corrupted and joined the ranks of the Scourge! He then betrayed the defenders of Darrowshire.\n\nThat is an ill fate. If we can, we should try to change that fate, don't you think?"}
Q[5155]={d="如果我要在这件事上信任你，你首先得证明自己值得我信任。\n\n我必须知道你是暮光之锤议会的敌人——正是他们在这里和我们的边境之外制造了无数邪恶。\n\n深入费伍德森林。向西你会看到一条通往加德纳尔的小路。议会就是在那里与燃烧军团策划阴谋的。\n\n进入他们盘踞的某座腐化鬃怪巢穴深处，把他们全部杀掉。做完之后回来见我。那时我才会知道你确实想帮助我们，$g真的:真的;。",dEN="If I am to trust you in this matter, you will first have to prove yourself.\n\nI must know that you are an enemy of the Shadow Council--the ones responsible for many evils here and abroad.\n\nTravel deeper into Felwood. To the west you will see a path leading to Jaedenar. It is there that the Council plots with the Burning Legion.\n\nEnter the depths of one of the corrupted Barrow Dens they inhabit and slay their kind. Return to me after you've done this. Then I will know you truly seek to help us.",o="到加德纳尔去杀掉4个加德纳尔恶犬、4个加德纳尔守护者、6个加德纳尔精兵和6个加德纳尔祭司，然后向费伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄复命。",oEN="Enter Jaedenar and slay 4 Jaedenar Hounds, 4 Jaedenar Guardsmen, 6 Jaedenar Adepts, and 6 Jaedenar Cultists before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",p="你的战斗进行得怎么样了，$n？我知道把挥洒的鲜血作为荣誉的证明让有些人感到疑惑，但是你必须懂得这么做的原因:它可以让我的任务变得简单一些。另一方面，我们可以因此而互相尊重。\n\n我希望你能懂得这些。",pEN="How goes your fight, <name>? I know the shedding of blood as proof of honor can be disgusting to some, but you must understand that it serves two goals: you make my task easier by hurting their numbers, and we gain a respect for each other that will only make us stronger in times to come.\n\nI hope you understand.",c="很好，$n！随着他们数量的减少，我们就可以进一步地压制他们。\n\n你觉得他们实力如何？他们是否如你所想象的那么强大？还是更强？或许他们对你来说不堪一击。你知道这意味着什么吗？\n\n我们可以晚些再讨论你的潜力，现在，我们必须解决其他的一些问题。",cEN="Good, <name>! With their numbers weakening, we can further press them.\n\nHow was your first taste of their power? Were they as strong as you thought they would be? Stronger? Or perhaps they were no challenge for you at all. Wouldn't that be something?\n\nWe can discuss the details of your exploits later. There are other things we must focus on now."}
Q[5156]={d="在这里的北面，沿着大路向东看，你可以找到一处被称作碎痕谷的地方，那里是上次战争中燃烧军团的地狱火恶魔们的着陆点——迄今仍有许多地狱火在那里游荡。\n\n我感兴趣的有两件事情。首先，那里是否还有被污染的元素生物？其次，那些凹坑中是否还充满了堕落的恶臭之水？你能帮我去看看吗，$n？小心一些，地狱火可是会攻击它们看到的一切东西的。",dEN="To the north, along the east of the road in what's called Shatter Scar Vale, is an area where infernals were called down during the last great war--the craters still scar the land, as do the infernals themselves.\n\nI am curious about two things. First, are there still entropic elementals roaming the area? And second, are the craters still filled with the corrupt, fetid water that gathered there years ago? Will you help me and check, <name>? Be careful though, the infernals destroy anything in their path.",o="杀掉2个热能野兽和2个热能恐兽，并探索碎痕谷。然后查看凹坑中是否仍然充满了堕落的恶臭之水，完成这些任务之后，向费伍德森林中的塔诺恩·红羽复命。",oEN="Seek out and destroy 2 Entropic Beasts and 2 Entropic Horrors while exploring Shatter Scar Vale. After checking to see if the craters there are still filled with corrupt fel water, return to Taronn Redfeather in Felwood.",p="我希望你的搜索进行得很顺利，$n。我还没有准备启程去森林北部，但是我必须承认，穿越一片到处都是地狱火的区域让我感到有些害怕。那些生物没有思想，但仍然非常具有威胁性。",pEN="I hope your search goes well, <name>. I haven't started heading that far north, but I will admit, the thought of crossing the path of an infernal at any point scares me just a little. The creatures are brainless, but still quite intimidating.",c="很好，你还活着，$n。糟糕的是那些堕落之水还在那里。我原本希望能在费伍德森林找到一片干净的水源，看来我的计划落空了。如果有那样的水源，治愈这片土地的工作就会简单许多。\n\n我现在不得不一边拯救那些可以被拯救的生物，一边消灭那些已经无可救药的生物，它们对于进入这片森林的旅人是一种威胁。",cEN="Good that you're alive, <name>. Bad that the water still exists. I was hoping to find at least one pure source of water here in Felwood. It looks like my search has failed. The process of healing the land could have been made much easier with its existence.\n\nI will have to concern myself with saving what forest creatures I can while destroying those that have become so corrupt that they endanger themselves as much as travelers through this once-mighty forest."}
Q[5157]={d="在加德纳尔的最深处坐落着暗影堡——他们邪恶与腐化的大本营。\n\n暮光之锤议会用火盆围绕着自己的巢穴，那些火盆不过是他们防护法术的外在形式。如果我想通过占卜进一步了解我们的敌人，就必须熄灭那些火盆。一旦熄灭，我应该就能窥探议会，查明是谁在领导他们。\n\n如果可以的话，拿上这个水壶，去加德纳尔中央的月井把它装满。之后回来见我。",dEN="Deep within Jaedenar lies Shadow Hold--the main fortress of their corruption and evil.\n\nThe Shadow Council has protective spells surrounding their lair in the form of braziers. If I am to find out any more information about our enemy through scrying, then those braziers must be extinguished. By doing so, I should be able to spy on the Council and find out who leads them.\n\nIf you can, take this canteen and fill it at the Moon Well in the center of Jaedenar. Return to me afterwards.",o="把空壶拿到加德纳尔中心的月亮井去，装满井水之后再回到费伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄那里。",oEN="Take the Empty Canteen to the Moon Well in the center of Jaedenar and fill it before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",p="一旦我们有了月亮井的水，就可以对其进行净化，然后用它来熄灭保护暗影堡的火盆。这样我就有充足的时间来侦测他们的老巢，并搞清楚是谁在领导着他们……\n\n我希望大地之母能与我们同在。",pEN="Once we have the waters from the Moon Well, we will purify it and use it to extinguish the braziers of protection within Shadow Hold. That should allow me ample time to see into the chambers even deeper and discern who actually leads this... cult.\n\nI pray the Earthmother is with us.",c="干得很好，$n。\n\n现在我们要做的就是净化这些水，然后用它熄灭火盆。这并不困难——只需要跑跑路就可以了。\n\n我希望我们可以尽快完成这件事。",cEN="This will do nicely, <name>.\n\nNow all we have to do besides apply the waters to the braziers is to have it purified. That should not be difficult--it should only require a little travel.\n\nHopefully we can do this quickly."}
Q[5158]={d="把腐化的月亮井水拿到贫瘠之地去，$n。棘齿城南面的海岸边上住着我的一个老朋友，水之先知伊斯伦。她是个强大的萨满祭司，并且愿意帮助我们。她和水之魂的关系不错，我们高尚的目标一定可以让她和水之魂出手帮助我们。\n\n你可以在水边的一个小帐篷中找到她。另外，$n，不要管那些海盗……他们对你完全不构成威胁。",dEN="Take the corrupt water to the Barrens, <name>. South of Ratchet, hidden along the shore, is an old friend of mine, a shaman named Islen Waterseer. She is a powerful shaman who will help us. Her relationship with the spirits of water has always been strong. Our task being a noble one should be enough to persuade her and the spirits of water to aid us in this task.\n\nYou should find her at a small camp right along the water's edge. And, <name>, ignore the pirates... they are but a nuisance and no threat to you.",o="把腐化的月亮井水交给贫瘠之地的水之先知伊斯伦。",oEN="Take the Corrupt Moon Well Water to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.",p="我感觉你不是个找路去棘齿城的旅人。过来，在我们的帐篷里休息一下，当你准备好了就和我说说吧。",pEN="I sense you are not just a simple traveler looking for the path to Ratchet. Come, sit and rest at our camp. Speak to me when you're ready.",c="啊，你需要净化这瓶月亮井里的水。阻止费伍德森林的堕落力量，这听起来很高尚，但是我无法决定是否要净化这瓶水。我会询问水灵——它们将决定是否对其进行净化。\n\n给我点时间，我会把你的理由告诉它们。我希望它们也像我一样具有同情心。",cEN="Ah, you need the water from this Moon Well cleansed. Stopping this force of malice in Felwood seems noble enough, but it is not for me to decide if the water will be purified. I will ask the spirits of water--it will be up to them to decide if the cause is just.\n\nGive me a moment and I will tell them of your plea. I hope they are as sympathetic as I am to your cause."}
Q[5159]={d="感谢水之魂，$n。它们答应帮助你了。\n\n现在我就把这瓶净化好的水交给你。代我向格雷塔问好，她正在做的事情比我们大多数人所做的事情都要伟大……我确信不久之后她也会发现这一点的。\n\n不要小看暗影议会的力量，$n。记住这一点。\n\n现在就出发吧，把水交给格雷塔。",dEN="Thank the spirits, <name>. They are the ones that have come to your aid, not me.\n\nI give this purified water to you now. Please give my regards to Greta and my best wishes. She is tackling something greater than many of us... as I'm sure she will soon find out.\n\nThe Shadow Council is not a force to be trifled with, <name>. Remember that.\n\nGo now. Take the water and return to Greta.",o="把净化过的月亮井水交给费伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄。",oEN="Take the Purified Moon Well Water to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",p="啊，你回来了，$n。很好。你在贫瘠之地找到水之先知伊斯伦了吗？如果没有的话，那我们就得另想办法来达成目标了。",pEN="Ah, I see you've returned, <name>. Good. Did you find Islen in the Barrens? Or do we have to find another way to accomplish our goals?",c="这些水足够了。\n\n我很高兴听说伊斯伦愿意帮助我们。她和水灵的力量非常强大，而且她总是如此睿智，所以水灵很少否决她的意见。他们都同意我的看法，这让我觉得我们确实做对了。",cEN="This should be more than enough water for our purposes.\n\nI'm glad to hear that Islen was able to help us. Her strength with the water spirits has always been a strong one. She is also wise, and rare is it that the spirits do not agree with her purpose. The fact that both of them have blessed our task gives me hope that we are on the right path."}
Q[5160]={d="到卡利姆多去，$r。我们蓝龙军团在寒冷的冬泉谷定居。在你到达冬泉谷之后，就去寻找麦索瑞尔洞穴。\n\n在麦索瑞尔的冰冷的地板上，你将会找到钴蓝色的符文。拿着我的鳞片站在某个符文上，你就会被传送到哈尔琳身边, 她是我们的监护者。\n\n把鳞片交给她，让她用水晶球占卜一下我在这个可怕的地方所看到和感觉到的是什么。",dEN="Travel to Kalimdor, <race>. Our flight makes its home in the frigid landscape of Winterspring. Once you reach Winterspring, find the caves of Mazthoril.\n\nUpon the icy floors of Mazthoril you will find cobalt runes. Hold one of my scales and stand upon a rune and you shall be transported to Haleh, our matron protectorate.\n\nGive her the scale so that she may scry what it is I have seen and felt, here in this doomed place.",o="到冬泉谷去找到哈尔琳，把奥比的鳞片交给她。",oEN="Travel to Winterspring and find Haleh. Give her Awbee's scale.",p="见到你很高兴，$n。",pEN="It is good to see you, <name>.",c="守护巨龙坚持认为我们应该远离凡人的俗事。然而，在这个世界上，这是不太可能的——尤其当我们中的一些成员对这种律令熟视无睹的时候。",cEN="The Aspects insist that we stay out of the affairs of mortals. In this world, however, such a thing is not always possible - especially when one of our own contemptuously disregards such edicts."}
Q[5161]={d="我们了解那些被诅咒的死亡之翼的后代想要做什么，我们不能让它们得逞。\n\n由于黑石山脉对奈法利安有着天然的保护作用，我们根本无法与它们进行沟通。\n\n但是，我们可以授权给你，$r——你必须这么做。\n\n你眼前的道路充满了危险，你必须决定是否接受我们的帮助。考虑一下，决定之后再找我谈谈吧。",dEN="We understand what the cursed brood of Deathwing attempts to do and we know that it cannot be allowed.\n\nBecause of the protection Blackrock mountain affords Nefarian, it has become increasingly difficult for us to intercede.\n\nWe can, however, empower you, mortal - should you so choose.\n\nThe path before you is one full of peril. You must decide whether to accept our help. Ponder this and speak with me again when a decision has been made.",o="要是你想继续的话，就与哈尔琳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Haleh if you wish to continue.",c="那么，好吧……",cEN="So it shall be..."}
Q[5162]={d="我所掌控的是奥术魔法，而将你送往下一个目的地的也是奥术魔法。\n\n当你$g准备好:准备好;时，旅程就会开始。你将前往瘟疫之地，并与杰兹巴交谈。\n\n他是一位像先祖一样睿智、像不动的大地一样耐心的凡人。去安多哈尔找他。|n",dEN="It is the arcane that I control and the arcane which will send you to your next destination.\n\nWhen you are ready, the journey will begin. To the Plaguelands you will go and to Jeziba you will speak.\n\nHe is a mortal as wise as the ancients and as patient as the immovable earth. Find him in Andorhal.",o="与瘟疫之地的耶兹巴交谈。他居住在安多哈尔。",oEN="Speak with Jeziba in the Plaguelands. He resides in Andorhal.",c="我是耶兹巴，许多人称我为雕刻家。我所雕刻和塑造的却不是雕像，而是英雄。",cEN="I am Jeziba, known to many as the Sculptor. What I sculpt, however, are not statues, but heroes."}
Q[5163]={d="全都准备好了，$n！\n\n我已经写信给我的朋友们，告诉他们我给他们准备了一个惊喜。接下来就轮到你上场了！\n\n我要把我的机械雪人交给你。为了吓唬我的朋友们，你得去挨个拜访他们，启动雪人，把它朝他们放过去。\n\n等你依次在永望镇的莱加奇、加基森的斯普林克尔和马绍尔营地的奎克希尔面前展示过之后，就回来告诉我发生了什么！\n\n拜托了，回来的时候也把我的雪人还给我。",dEN="It's all ready, <name>!\n\nNow, I sent some mail to my friends already, telling them that I have a surprise for them. This is where you come in!\n\nI'm going to give you my mechanical yeti, and you need to surprise them by paying each of my friends a visit, turning the yeti on and sending it towards them.\n\nOnce you have shown Legacki in Everlook, Sprinkle in Gadgetzan, and Quixxil in Marshal's Refuge, come back and tell me what happened!\n\nPlease bring my yeti back to me then, too.",o="拿上乌米的机械雪人，用它去吓唬她的朋友们：\n\n冬泉谷永望镇的莱加奇\n\n塔纳利斯加基森的斯普林克尔\n\n安戈洛环形山马绍尔营地的奎克希尔完成后，把机械雪人还给乌米。",oEN="Take Umi's Mechanical Yeti and scare her friends with it:\n\nLegacki in Everlook (Winterspring)\nSprinkle in Gadgetzan (Tanaris)\nQuixxil in Marshal's Refuge (Un'Goro Crater)\n\nWhen you are done, bring the Mechanical Yeti back to Umi.",p="真想知道我的朋友会有什么反应！\n\n他们绝对会被吓一大跳的！",pEN="I can't wait to hear how my friends react!\n\nThey'll never expect it!",c="哈哈！以后他们再想取笑我的主意时，就得先考虑一下了！\n\n感谢你的帮助，$n。如果没有你的帮助，我可找不到那么多乐子！",cEN="Hah! They'll think twice before making fun of my ideas again!\n\nThanks for your help, <name>. I couldn't have had so much fun without you!"}
Q[5164]={d="哈雷再也找不到比这更好的正义工具了。阅读《迷途者名录》，你就会得到启迪。\n\n如果你坚持下去……如果你去做我要求你做的事……如果你能活下来……你就会成为一名英雄，$g真的:真的;。",dEN="A finer instrument of justice, Haleh could not have chosen. Read from the catalogue of the wayward and be enlightened.\n\nShould you persist... should you do what is asked of you... should you survive... a hero you will make.",o="阅读《迷途者名录》。|n",oEN="Read from the Catalogue of the Wayward.",c="数百页充斥着混乱的文字和符号的书页组成了这本书。",cEN="Hundreds upon hundreds of pages filled with garbled text and symbols make up the brunt of this book."}
Q[5165]={d="现在，你必须回到加德纳尔去。那些火盆分布在暗影堡中，熄灭它们的火焰，这样保护暗影议会的屏障就会消失一段时间——我正在等待着那个时刻的到来。如果你成功了，我就会仔细查看暗影堡，然后找出他们的头目。然后，我们将决定是否发起正面攻击。",dEN="Now, you must return to Jaedenar. The braziers are more than likely spread throughout Shadow Hold. Douse each of their flames and the protections the Council has set up will fall for at least a short period of time. I will be waiting for that to happen. When it does, I will look deep within the Hold and try to find out who the head of this beast is. Then, and only then, will we see about attacking them directly.",o="使用净化过的月亮井水熄灭暗影堡内部的四座火盆的火焰，从而破除其保护效果，然后向翡翠圣地的格雷塔·苔蹄复命。",oEN="Using the Purified Moon Well Water, douse the flames of the four braziers of protection within Shadow Hold in Felwood, then return to Greta Mosshoof in the Emerald Sanctuary.",p="如果我们想要发动一场大战的话，那些火盆就必须被熄灭。毫无准备地闯入暗影堡无异于找死。现在我们所面对的敌人甚至比一条龙还要危险——暗影议会犯下了无数滔天的罪行。如果我们要阻止他们的话，就必须快点行动了。",pEN="The braziers must be extinguished if we are to have any hope of being prepared for a much greater battle. Going in to the dragon's lair without any knowledge is a fool's errand. And this is much worse than a dragon. The Shadow Council are solely responsible for a great number of crimes and atrocities. We'll have to work quickly if we're to stop them.",c="在最后一个火盆熄灭的同时，我就看到了你。干得好，$n。\n\n在暗影议会的术士重新施展他们的保护法术之前，我了解到了不少东西，这些情报应该够用了。\n\n至于现在，好好休息一下吧。我很快就会告诉你我看到了什么东西。",cEN="I was able to see you with my spells as soon as the last brazier's flames died. Well done, <name>.\n\nI learned a few things before the Shadow Council's warlocks were able to recast their spells. Hopefully it will be enough.\n\nFor now, rest. I will tell you what I've learned in a moment."}
Q[5166]={d="铸造一件足以抵御彩色巨龙冷酷攻击的胸甲，就必须使用最坚硬的材料。\n\n我们需要把成年彩色巨龙的多彩龙鳞和那些被我们击败的凶残的野兽的外皮缝合在一起。这些东西的存在并不为人所知，愿它们永不存在于这个世界。\n\n另外，最难以得到的东西就是英雄之血。\n\n雕刻者将会为你完成铸造。",dEN="The forging of a powerful breastplate to protect against the unrelenting attacks of the chromatic flight is one built upon irony.\n\nThe scales of the very beasts we battle must be sewn to the pristine carapace of an elder chromatic drake or dragon. None are known to exist at this time and we should hope that none will ever exist.\n\nLastly, perhaps the most difficult of all components: the blood of heroes.\n\nThe Sculptor must ultimately forge this creation.",o="要锻造彩色巨龙胸甲，你必须把以下物品带给“雕刻者”杰兹巴：\n\n1 个彩色龙鳞外壳。\n\n10 片闪光的彩色龙鳞。\n\n10 份英雄之血。\n\n10 份破损的憎恶缝合线。\"",oEN="To forge the Breastplate of the Chromatic Flight, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor':\n\n1 Chromatic Carapace.\n\n10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales.\n\n10 Blood of Heroes.\n\n10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings.",p="你做出了明智的选择，$r。",pEN="You have chosen wisely, <race>.",c="你还没有理解吗？这次旅程本身就是你的终点。你感觉不到战争留下的伤痕吗？你所经受的痛苦呢？\n\n你幸存了下来，并且变得更加强大，这件胸甲只是你能力的微不足道的体现。",cEN="Do you not yet understand? The journey was the destination. Can you not feel the battle scars? The pain you underwent?\n\nHaving survived the ordeal, you are a more powerful being. Much more powerful. This breastplate is merely a reflection of your own innate abilities."}
Q[5167]={d="成年彩色巨龙的外壳是制造护腿的基础。彩色龙鳞将被用于制作镶边，最后在英雄之血中进行洗礼。最后，暗影之皮的力量将被注入护腿中。",dEN="The carapace of a mature chromatic drake is needed to form the foundation of the leggings. Brilliant chromatic scales are then layered upon the wire frame and enchanted in the blood of heroes. Finally, the supple skin of shadow must be applied to the inner greaves.",o="要锻造彩色挑战者护腿，你必须把以下物品带给“雕刻者”杰兹巴：\n\n1 个彩色龙鳞外壳。\n\n10 片闪光的彩色龙鳞。\n\n10 份英雄之血。\n\n5 张暗影之皮。\"",oEN="To forge the Legplates of the Chromatic Defier, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor':\n\n1 Chromatic Carapace.\n\n10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales.\n\n10 Blood of Heroes.\n\n5 Skin of Shadow.",p="这样一件东西以前从未被铸造出来过！",pEN="Such an item has never been crafted!",c="他们会在你出现的时候闻到同类的味道，$n。以他们自己的恐惧为武器击溃他们吧！",cEN="They will smell their kin as you enter their halls, <name>. Crush them with their own fear!"}
Q[5168]={d="我永远铭记着达隆郡的英雄，你带给我的这本《达隆镇的历史》中就讲述了他们的故事。\n\n书中提到了圣骑士达维·莱法尔，还提到了血色十字军把他的圣契放在壁炉谷的城镇大厅中。\n\n书中还提到了我的兄弟，雷德帕斯队长。在他叛变之后，他的盾牌被击碎并抛弃了，它就被扔在一个看起来最不可思议的地方——靠近盖罗恩农场的谷仓那里。\n\n收集那些被命运和悲剧笼罩的遗物，$n。",dEN="The heroes of Darrowshire hold a place in my heart, and the book you brought me, the Annals of Darrowshire, tells their tales.\n\nIt tells of the paladin Davil Lightfire and how the Crusade took his libram to the town hall of Hearthglen.\n\nIts passages also speak of my brother, Captain Redpath. After his betrayal, his shield was cracked and discarded and now lies in the most unlikely of places -- near the barn of Gahrron's Withering.\n\nGather these relics, <name>. For fate and tragedy surrounds them.",o="把达维的圣契和雷德帕斯之盾交给卡林·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Bring Davil's Libram and Redpath's Shield to Carlin Redpath.",p="你找到那些圣物了吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the relics, <name>?",c="你找到盾牌和圣契了！\n\n它们的历史和达隆郡的历史交织在一起，我知道命运会让它们重聚的。",cEN="You have the libram and the shield!\n\nTheir history is entwined with the history of Darrowshire, and somehow, I know that fate will bring them together again."}
Q[5181]={d="《达隆郡的历史》讲述了那场战役中的几个天灾军团头目。联盟在这场战役中杀死了食尸鬼之王，掠夺者霍古斯。他的尸体被扔到考林路口西北面的湖泊中，现在他的头颅还在那儿呢。\n\n黑衣玛杜克从未吃过败仗，但是他的剑却被击落，留在了考林路口西面的山谷底部。\n\n去找回颅骨和宝剑吧，$n。我不清楚原因，但是我知道它们的命运是跟你有关联的。",dEN="The Annals of Darrowshire tells of the villains of that battle. It tells how the ghoul lord Horgus the Ravager was destroyed by Alliance forces during the battle. His body was cast into a lake, northwest of Corin's Crossing, and his skull remains there.\n\nMarduk the Black was never defeated, but his fabled sword was shattered and lost. It lies at the bottom of the gorge west of Corin's Crossing.\n\nRetrieve these items, <name>. I know not why, but I am certain their fate lies with you.",o="将霍古斯的颅骨和马杜克的破碎之剑交给圣光之愿礼拜堂的卡林·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Bring the Skull of Horgus and the Shattered Sword of Marduk to Carlin Redpath at Light's Hope Chapel.",p="你找到头颅和宝剑了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you find the skull and the sword, <name>?",c="你找到了！干得好，$n！这些圣物拥有我所不熟悉的力量，终有一天你会用到这种力量。\n\n它们也给我带来了黑色的回忆……死亡和背叛，还有达隆郡的最后一夜。",cEN="You found them! Well done, <name>! These relics hold a power I do not fully understand, a power you will one day harness.\n\nThey also bring dark memories to my mind, memories of death and treachery, and of the last night of Darrowshire..."}
Q[5201]={d="大多数人都不知道我在这里，$n。但是，在冬泉谷有个许久以来挥之不去的大麻烦：冬泉熊怪。\n\n我可从来没有直接跟熊怪发生过冲突，它们极度癫狂，对面前的一切事物都毫不畏惧。我曾看到熊怪残杀无数生物，而这些不幸的生物惨遭杀戮的原因无非是挡了熊怪的路。\n\n我对它们的胡作非为感到厌烦——请帮帮我，代替月神惩罚它们吧。杀死熊怪，让它们永远也不敢侵入霜刀石！",dEN="My presence goes unnoticed by most, <name>. However, there is an annoyance that seems firmly rooted here in Winterspring: the Winterfall furbolg.\n\nAlthough I have never directly attacked the furbolg, they seem crazed, fearful of anything in their path. I have watched them slay countless creatures that had the misfortune to simply be in the wrong place at the wrong time.\n\nI am weary of their meddling -- please, help me by fighting back. Slay the furbolg and keep them away from Frostsaber Rock.",o="雷沃·霜翼要你去杀死5个冬泉萨满祭司和5个冬泉巨熊怪。",oEN="Rivern Frostwind wants you to slay 5 Winterfall Shaman and 5 Winterfall Ursa.",p="熊怪们似乎患上了妄想症……",pEN="The furbolgs seem to suffer from such paranoia...",c="很快，我们就无须再为冬泉熊怪的侵扰而烦恼了。\n\n你有着百折不挠的精神，$n。",cEN="I am relieved to hear that for a short moment, we will not have to worry about the Winterfall intrusion.\n\nYou are beginning to show your perseverance, <name>."}
Q[5202]={d="这把红色的小钥匙似乎是由某种骨头制成的。它非常沉重，但是看上去却非常脆弱。为什么暗影议会的成员会拿着这样的东西呢？或许在加德纳尔内部有什么东西可以用这把奇怪的钥匙打开。",dEN="The small red key seems to be made of some kind of bone material. It is heavy in your hand, but appears very fragile. Why would a member of the Shadow Council have such a thing? Perhaps there is something within Jaedenar that this strange key unlocks.",o="搜寻加德纳尔，找出血红钥匙的用途。",oEN="Search through Jaedenar to discover what the Blood Red Key is used for.",p="我不禁开始怀疑我是否能逃离这只牢笼。\n\n他们迟早会把我献祭给他们所崇拜的恶魔。",pEN="I begin to wonder if I'll ever escape this cage.\n\nIt's only a matter of time before they sacrifice me to whatever demons they worship. The monsters!",c="钥匙，你找到它了！请把它给我，这样我就可以脱身了！",cEN="The key, you've found it! Please, give it to me and I can finally escape!"}
Q[5203]={d="虽然我承受了很大的痛苦，但是有件事情我们必须先做好：我要找到特雷·莱弗治，然后从暗影堡逃出去，把这里所发生的一切都报告给我们的上司。你能帮我吗，$n？\n\n我的装备就在离这里不远的地方，而且你已经证明了你的实力。\n\n在我们逃脱之后，我会去达纳苏斯，请你到灰谷的边界地带去找到杰希尔。她应该在那里的翡翠议会营地中。\n\n你认为怎么样，$n？你能再帮我一次吗？",dEN="But, as much as it pains me, there is one thing that must be done first: I have to find Trey's sword Lightforge and escape Shadow Hold to tell my superiors what's happening here. Can you help me, <name>?\n\nOur equipment isn't far from here, and you've already proven you can survive the path to the top.\n\nAfter we escape, I'll head to Darnassus if you can find my friend Jessir near the Ashenvale border. She was to meet us at the Emerald Circle's camp near there.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? Can you help me again?",o="护送亚科纳琳到莱弗治和她的装备所在的地方，然后保护她逃离暗影堡。之后，在费伍德森林找杰希尔·月弓，并告诉她刚才发生的事情。",oEN="Escort Arko'narin to where Lightforge and her equipment are being held, and then protect her as you escape Shadow Hold. Afterwards, seek out Jessir Moonbow in Felwood to let her know what's happened to her friends.",p="你看起来气喘吁吁的，$n。你还好吗？",pEN="You look winded, <name>. Are you all right, or is something wrong?",c="你帮助亚科逃了出来？很高兴你找到我了。她不久之前来过我这里，然后就去达纳苏斯了。她之前是和莱弗治在一起，当时都来不及让德鲁伊进行治疗。她说当时情况太紧急了。\n\n但是她确实告诉我你遇到了特雷的灵魂。白银之手的骑士遇到了多么恐怖的命运。她没有具体说那件事情，但是我知道这让她承受了很大的痛苦，因为她失去了她最好的朋友之一。",cEN="You were the one who helped Arko escape? I'm so glad you found me. She passed by here not too long ago on her way to Darnassus. She had Lightforge in tow and wouldn't even take time to speak to the druids to be healed. She said it was far too urgent.\n\nBut she did tell me about your encounter with Trey's spirit. What a terrible fate for a Knight of the Silver Hand. She didn't show it, but I know it's tearing her up inside, the thought of losing one of her closest friends."}
Q[5204]={d="她假装自己没事。她希望我认为她有足够坚强，可以独自承担所有的悲伤，这一点我很清楚。特雷的死和他被折磨时发出的惨叫会让她在很长一段时间里都被痛苦煎熬，我们对此无能为力。但是我们至少可以给她一些安慰！\n\n$n，回到暗影堡去，杀了折磨特雷的混蛋，并找回他的遗体。在亚科纳琳默默承受痛苦的时候，我们可不能留在这里什么事情都不做。",dEN="She would like to pretend that she's fine. She'd love for me to think that she's strong enough to deal with all of this on her own, but I know better than that. Trey's death and hearing the torture he was put through is going to haunt her for a long time, and there's nothing we can do to stop that. But we can give her some peace!\n\n<name>, return to Shadow Hold, kill Trey's torturer and find his remains. There is no reason we can't tie off all these loose ends while Arko'narin mourns in her own private way.",o="回到加德纳尔杀了魅魔拉凯雅，然后找到特雷·莱弗治的残骸。",oEN="Return to Jaedenar and kill the succubus Rakaiah before finding the Remains of Trey Lightforge.",p="你检查了那具尸体，毫无疑问，这就是白银之手骑士团的特雷·莱弗治的遗体了。你想起了亚科纳琳，并想起了这位圣骑士的死对她所造成的打击。\n\n过了一会儿，你重新收回了思绪。你很清楚，在没有杀死折磨这个圣骑士的恶徒之前，你是无法把他的遗体带回杰希尔那里的。",pEN="You inspect the body, and there is no doubt that these are the remains of the Knight of the Silver Hand, Trey Lightforge. For a moment you think of Arko'narin and question if anyone in your life meant as much to you as this man meant to the Night elf captive you recently helped escape Shadow Hold.\n\nAfter taking another moment to gather your thoughts, you know that you cannot take the paladin's remains back to Jessir without killing his torturer first.",c="你小心翼翼地敛起圣骑士的遗体，至少他的灵魂已经得到解脱，不再会感受到他生前所遭受的痛苦和折磨了。",cEN="You gather the paladin's remains as carefully as you can, recalling that at least his spirit has been released from any pain or suffering that might have been forced upon him."}
Q[5206]={d="克罗米说你所收集的那些遗物是施放一个强大的法术所必需的材料，此外还需要一样东西：参加达隆郡战役的天灾军团士兵的颅骨。\n\n带着这块水晶去猎杀天灾军团的士兵，并拿到他们的颅骨。这块水晶已经被施了魔法，如果某个士兵曾参加过那场战斗，那么当你把水晶球放在他的颅骨上时，它就会发出共鸣。把那些可以与水晶共鸣的颅骨交给我。\n\n快去，$n。你可以在北方的剧毒林地和西方的蘑菇林中找到亡灵天灾的士兵。",dEN="Chromie said the relics you gathered are reagents to a powerful spell, and one more is required: skulls from the scourge who took part in the battle of Darrowshire.\n\nTake this crystal and hunt scourge champions for their skulls. The crystal is enchanted; if a champion took part in the battle, then when you pass the crystal over its skull it will resonate. Bring me those resonating skulls.\n\nGo, <name>. You'll find scourge champions in the Noxious Glade to the north and the Fungal Vale to the west.",o="把5个共鸣颅骨和神秘水晶交给东瘟疫之地的卡林·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Bring 5 Resonating Skulls and the Mystic Crystal to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你拿到头骨了吗？克罗米说那些东西对她的法术至关重要，而那个法术会给我们带来拯救达隆郡的机会。",pEN="Do you have the skulls? Chromie said they will be critical for her spell, and that spell will give us the chance to save Darrowshire.",c="你成功了！太好了！\n\n尽管我不太明白这些东西如何能帮助我们，但我仍可以感觉到它们的力量，而且我能感觉到……它们和我的故乡达隆郡息息相关。",cEN="You found them! Wonderful!\n\nAlthough I don't fully understand how they can help us, I feel their power and I know in my bones that they are linked to my home village of Darrowshire."}
Q[5210]={d="借助我的魔法，《达隆郡的历史》被增补了，现在它所记述的历史已近包括战争之后的事情了。新增的章节里有一部分讲述了另一个雷德帕斯家族成员的下落，他在约瑟夫叛变后侥幸活了下来。卡林·雷德帕斯在东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂里。\n\n拿着这本书去找他吧。",dEN="The Annals of Darrowshire, through my magic, has gained pages at its end, and now it extends its history beyond the battle. One of the extra passages tells of another Redpath, Carlin, who survived Joseph's betrayal. Carlin's now in the Plaguelands to the east, at the Light's Hope Chapel.\n\nTake the book and speak with him.",o="将《达隆镇全史》交给东瘟疫之地的卡林·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Bring the Extended Annals of Darrowshire to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你从西边来的？洛丹伦的其它人怎么样了？我知道安多哈尔已经陷落了，但是天灾军团到达美丽的提瑞斯法了吗？",pEN="You've come from the west? How fare the rest of Lordaeron? I know that Andorhal is lost, but has the Scourge yet reached fair Tirisfal?",c="这是本什么书？达隆郡的历史？那是我的家……直到那场战斗彻底毁灭了它！你为什么把这本书拿来给我？\n\n什么？书中竟然有一部分讲述的是战后的故事！有一章是讲我的！还有一章是讲我兄弟约瑟夫的！这本书所说的事情都是真的吗？\n\n我们必须查明真相！",cEN="What is this book? The Annals of Darrowshire? That was my home before the war... my home before the battle that destroyed it! Why did you bring me this book?\n\nBut look here! At the end there are pages that tell tales of the days beyond the battle! Here is a passage about me! And one about my brother Joseph! Is this book true?\n\nWe must discover the truth!"}
Q[5211]={d="许多保卫者在达隆郡的战役中倒下了，而他们中的许多人又变成了天灾军团的爪牙！找到这些可怜的灵魂，结束他们的痛苦！\n\n去猎杀吃人的食尸鬼、喋喋不休的食尸鬼和生病的剥皮者。他们以前都是达隆郡的善良居民，毁灭他们的肉体将会使他们的灵魂得到自由。\n\n你可以在病木林、考林的十字路口，还有东瘟疫之地的其它天灾军团的据点里找到他们。",dEN="Many of the defenders fell at the battle of Darrowshire. And many roam again as the ghastly servants of the Scourge! Find these poor souls and end their misery!\n\nHunt cannibal ghouls, gibbering ghouls and diseased flayers. Many of these fiends were once the good folk of Darrowshire and destroying their forms now will set their souls free.\n\nYou will find them in Plaguewood and Corin's Crossing, and in other Scourge strongholds of Eastern Plaguelands.",o="释放15个达隆郡居民的灵魂，然后返回卡林·雷德帕斯身边。",oEN="Free 15 Darrowshire Spirits and return to Carlin Redpath.",p="达隆郡的防卫者们在我的梦中向我哭喊，$n。你必须释放他们！",pEN="The poor defenders of Darrowshire cry out to me in my dreams, <name>. You must free them!",c="听到你找到那些备受折磨的灵魂并释放了他们，这真是个好消息。我的心可以得到些许安慰，至少我知道一部分达隆郡的防卫者不会再可耻地为天灾军团效力了。",cEN="It is good to hear you found the tortured souls of my brethren and freed them. My heart will weep less, knowing at least some of the defenders of Darrowshire no longer wallow in the vile subservience of the Scourge."}
Q[5212]={d="被遗忘者的药剂师并不是这个世界上唯一精通科学的人。\n\n我研究瘟疫已经很多年了，$r。我们原本以为瘟疫的效力正在衰退，但我在这片瘟疫之地的发现令人震惊。瘟疫的力量正在增强！\n\n我需要做更多的试验！瘟疫最强烈的来源就是最新感染者被污染的肉体。前往斯坦索姆，给我带一些样本回来，$n。|n",dEN="The Forsaken apothecaries are not the only beings in this world schooled in the sciences.\n\nI have been studying the plague for years, <race>. We had previously thought that the potency of the plague was dwindling, but what I have discovered here in the Plaguelands is startling. The plague seems to be growing in strength!\n\nI need to run more tests! The most potent source of the plague is from the tainted flesh of the most recently infected. Travel to Stratholme and bring me samples, <name>.",o="从斯坦索姆找回10个瘟疫肉块，并把它们交给贝蒂娜·比格辛克。你觉得斯坦索姆中的生灵都不大可能长着肉……",oEN="Recover 10 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample.",p="有些人说我担心太多了，我对他们说，“是你们太掉以轻心了！”",pEN="Some say I worry too much - to them I say, 'You don't worry enough!'",c="瘟疫中的活性成分发生了某些变化。我们还需要更多的资料。",cEN="There is something that has changed in the chemical structure of the plague's active agents. More data is required."}
Q[5213]={d="你必须更深入地进入斯坦索姆，$n。\n\n穿过第一道大门后，你会看到通灵塔。我们知道天灾军团从这些建筑中汲取着强大的力量。搜查那些通灵塔，带着你找到的任何情报回来。|n",dEN="You will have to delve deeper into Stratholme, <name>.\n\nBeyond the first gates you will find the ziggurats. We know that the Scourge draws great power from these structures. Search the Ziggurats and return with any information that you may discover.",o="前往斯坦索姆，搜查那些通灵塔。找到关于天灾军团的情报，并把它带给贝蒂娜·比格辛克。|n",oEN="Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink.",p="我们就快要揭开这种新的活性瘟疫的秘密了！",pEN="We are on the verge of discovering what this new active plague agent may be!",c="真令人惊讶！我必须花费好几个月的时间来对它进行解剖和分析。银色黎明感谢你所做的努力，$n。\n\n带着我们的祝福，在黎明圣印与黎明符文中做出选择。不管选择哪一个，他们都拥有银色黎明委任徽章搜集天灾石的效果。若你的遗失了，与我交谈就能得到一个新的。",cEN="Astonishing! This will take months to dissect and analyze. The Argent Dawn thanks you for your efforts, <name>.\n\nWith our blessing, take your pick between either this Seal of the Dawn or this Rune of the Dawn. You can use either of them instead of a standard Argent Dawn Commission to collect scourgestones on our behalf. Should you lose yours, speak with me and I'll get you a replacement."}
Q[5214]={d="可怕的事情……弗拉斯。你知道，城镇被毁灭了，而弗拉斯不想离开他那珍贵的货物。我还记得他说的最后一句话：“我要在他们该死的脏手碰到我的烟叶之前把所有东西都烧光！”\n\n我可能比较贪财，但我不是傻瓜，于是我离开了弗拉斯和他的商店。我觉得他应该是已经被烧死了，但是如果……万一他的名牌烟草还有一部分没有被烧毁……\n\n你怎么说，$n？去帮烟鬼找包烟吧？",dEN="Terrible thing... what happened to Fras. You see, the town was sacked and Fras didn't want to leave his precious goods behind. The last thing I remember him saying was, 'I'll burn every last leaf before they get their damned, dirty hands on them!'\n\nI may love a good stogie but I'm no fool. I left Fras and his delightful store that day. I assume he went down in flames but if there's a chance that even one box of his famous tobacco is still intact...\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? Find a box for ol' Smokey?",o="在斯坦索姆找到弗拉斯·希亚比的烟草店，取回一箱希亚比的上等烟草。完成任务后回到烟鬼拉鲁恩那里。|n",oEN="Find Fras Siabi's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Siabi's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done.",p="我受不了了，$n！你必须帮帮我！我要死了！",pEN="I can't take it, <name>! You gotta help me! I'm dying!",c="哦，亲爱的香烟，我多么想念你啊……",cEN="Oh sweet, sweet stogie, how I have missed you..."}
Q[5215]={d="在洛丹伦的土地上有八口瘟疫之锅，其中四口在西瘟疫之地，另外四口在东瘟疫之地。这些瘟疫之锅不断向空中喷出毒气，将天灾军团的瘟疫传播到整个大地。\n\n克尔苏加德的力量太强大了，我们无法关掉这些瘟疫之锅，但是我想我们可能有办法利用它们。我的助手，高阶牧师玛多妮尔负责此项任务的执行，你去找她谈谈吧。",dEN="Within the lands of former Lordaeron are eight cauldrons - four here in the west, and four more ensconced in the east. These cauldrons spew poisons into the air, propagating the plague throughout the land for the Scourge.\n\nThe necromantic might of Kel'Thuzad is too strong to outright shut down these cauldrons, but we think we might have a way to subvert them to our advantage. My second, High Priestess MacDonnell, will be your point on this assignment; she'll continue the briefing from here.",o="与西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",c="愿圣光的力量在这些黑暗的岁月里照亮你，$c。我很荣幸能在破坏天灾瘟疫之锅的计划中担任你的协调员。\n\n我们的目标是改变大锅中产生的瘟疫成分，把它变成对天灾军团有害的东西。要实现这一改变，你必须取得西瘟疫之地四口大锅的通行权。\n\n做好准备吧，英雄，一场对抗邪恶天灾的荣耀之战正等着你，$g真的:真的;！",cEN="May the power of the Light shine upon you in these dark times, <class>. I am pleased to serve as your coordinator for our plan to sabotage the Scourge's cauldrons.\n\nOur goal will be to change the composition of the plague that the cauldrons create into something that negatively affects the Scourge. In order to affect this change, you will need to secure access to each of the four cauldrons present in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nStand ready hero, for a glorious battle against the vile Scourge awaits you!"}
Q[5216]={d="在西瘟疫之地的四口瘟疫之锅中，费尔斯通农场里的那一口可能是最容易进入的了。亡灵天灾在那边驻扎的都是新兵，尽管他们也不是轻易可以击败的对手，但相对来说毕竟容易一些。\n\n到费尔斯通农场去，它就在这里的正东方，安多哈尔的西北方，并与那里的护锅者交战。它身上有一把可以打开瘟疫之锅的钥匙。当你开启那口锅之后，用这个瓶子装满锅里的毒药样品，我们要对它进行研究以制造出一种解药。",dEN="Of the four cauldrons here in the west, the one located at Felstone Field may be the easiest one in obtaining access to. The Scourge have greener troops positioned here, though they should not be underestimated.\n\nGo to Felstone Field, northwest of Andorhal, and engage the cauldron lord there. We think it has a key that will unlock access to the cauldron. When unlocked, use this bottle to obtain a sample of the poisons inside the cauldron; we'll need it for study in developing a counter agent.",o="到西瘟疫之地的费尔斯通农场去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带费尔斯通农场的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Felstone Field in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there. It may have a key that will allow access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Felstone Field Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="你轻松地将从护锅者拜尔摩那里拿来的钥匙插进控制板里，但是随即它就消失了。尽管如此，你却已经可以不用钥匙就打开控制板了。随着一种未知的浓缩混合剂在天灾之锅中翻腾，腐烂的恶臭气息从打开的控制板里散发了出来。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔带回一份样品。",cEN="The key taken from Cauldron Lord Bilemaw is a perfect fit in unlocking the access panel. A foul stench emanates from the opened panel as an unknown mix of concentrated substances swirl inside the cauldron.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for High Priestess MacDonnell back at Chillwind Point."}
Q[5217]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔那里去了。",dEN="You fill the bottle with enough of the cauldron's poisonous concoction for a suitable sample to be studied.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp to complete the mission.",o="把费尔斯通农场的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔。",oEN="Bring the Filled Felstone Field Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="欢迎回到相对来说还算安全的冰风营地，$n。你在天灾之锅那边有什么进展要汇报吗？",pEN="Welcome back to the relative safety of Chillwind Camp, <name>. What progress on the cauldrons do you have to report?",c="干得好，$n。炼金师阿尔比顿不用费什么工夫就可以对这东西进行分析，然后制造出可以中和瘟疫的药剂。如果能把足够的解药散播到空气中，我们就有可能削弱这个地区的天灾军团。\n\n毫无疑问，这是一场持久而严酷的考验，我们需要不断的攻击这些天灾之锅，把我们的药剂倒入锅中。只要我们能坚持下去，在全面的战争开始的那一天，我们就会对天灾军团占有压倒性的优势！",cEN="Well done <name> - it should take Alchemist Arbington no time at all to analyze this and devise a counter agent to introduce into the cauldron. If we are able to pump out enough of it into the air, we might be able to weaken all the Scourge present here.\n\nThis will no doubt be an ongoing ordeal; we will need to continually hit these cauldrons and introduce our reagents into their mix. Still, if we can keep it up, we will have a huge advantage over Scourge when the time comes for battle!"}
Q[5218]={p="天灾军团的天灾之锅就伫立在你面前，它将大量的毒素喷洒到空气中。在锅炉的巨大平台下，有一条细长的管道。\n\n你已经击败了护锅者并获得了这口锅的钥匙，可以随心所欲地向锅内添加适当的药剂来抵消瘟疫的效果了。",pEN="The Scourge's plague cauldron stands before you, spewing vast amounts of toxins into the air. A small, non-descript access panel lies in the base of the cauldron's vast platform.\n\nHaving already defeated the cauldron lord and acquired its key, you are free to add the appropriate reagents to the cauldron to make a counter agent to the plague.",c="你把药剂倒入了锅中的混合物中，不断喷涌的水汽的颜色和成分很快就发生了变化。面对大量散入空气中的新物质，即使是那些离锅炉较远的天灾军团爪牙也显出了畏惧之色。",cEN="Adding the reagents to the cauldron's mix begins to change the color and texture of the cloud it spews forth. Scourge that are even remotely near the cauldron appear to recoil at the introduction of the new components into the environment."}
Q[5219]={d="其中一口瘟疫之锅位于一座旧农舍的田地里，如今那里被称作达尔森的眼泪。好吧，今天我们不该流一滴眼泪，因为就在今天，我们要挫败天灾军团的阴谋，让他们被自己的毒气呛死！\n\n去安多哈尔几乎正北方的达尔森的眼泪，干掉你在那里找到的大锅领主。和上一个一样，它身上应该有一把进入大锅的钥匙。用这个瓶子从大锅内部取一份样本。每一口大锅都有自己独特的毒素配方。",dEN="One of the plague cauldrons is located in the field of a former farmhouse now referred to as Dalson's Tears. Well, we shall shed no tears this day as we thwart the Scourge and have them choke on their own fumes!\n\nGo to Dalson's Tears, almost due north of Andorhal, and eliminate the cauldron lord there. It should have a key like the last one did, allowing you into the cauldron. Use this bottle to obtain a sample from inside the cauldron; each cauldron has its own distinct brew of toxins it uses.",o="到西瘟疫之地的达尔松之泪去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带达尔松之泪的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Dalson's Tears in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Dalson's Tears Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="从护锅者身上找到的钥匙很容易地滑入锁孔并随即消失，而天灾之锅的控制板也一下子打开了，粘稠的腐液在天灾之锅里涌动沸腾。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔带回一份样品。",cEN="The macabre key found on the cauldron lord easily slides into a keyhole and then disappears, allowing you permanent access to it. Crude, viscous ichors pulsate through twisted tubes within the cauldrons underpinnings.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for High Priestess MacDonnell back at Chillwind Point."}
Q[5220]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔那里去了。",dEN="You carefully fill the bottle with enough of the cauldron's ichors for what you consider to be suitably sized sample.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp to complete the mission.",o="把达尔松之泪的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔。",oEN="Bring the Filled Dalson's Tears Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="我们知道每一口天灾之锅都使用不同的药剂来产生毒素，同样，我们也知道我们必须针对各个天灾之锅中的毒素研制出相应的解药。你从达尔松之泪取得的样品是我们解决那里的天灾之锅的关键。",pEN="We know that each cauldron employs a different mix of reagents to generate its plague-inducing toxin; likewise, we know that we will need to develop a counter agent that is unique for each cauldron. Your sample from Dalson's Tears will be the key to figure out that cauldron's distinct reagent requirement.",c="啊，这些对研究来说已经足够了。干得好，$n！\n\n现在，事态已经在我们的掌握中了。我们需要制造一系列试剂，当这些试剂与天灾之锅中已有的物质结合之后，那些原有的毒素就会被中和。\n\n我们只有把解药直接倒进天灾之锅里才能达到这种效果。炼金师阿尔比顿对这类事情有更深的了解，所以你最好尽快找他谈话。",cEN="Ah, there is plenty in here for study. Well done, <name>!\n\nFor now, the next step is in our hands. We'll need to produce a list of reagents that, when combined with what is already in the cauldron, will act as its counter.\n\nThe only way we will be able to introduce this is by placing the reagents into the cauldron directly. Alchemist Arbington will have more information on that, so be sure to speak with him at your earliest convenience."}
Q[5221]={p="天灾军团的天灾之锅就伫立在你面前，它将大量的毒素喷洒到空气中。在锅炉的巨大平台下，有一条细长的管道。\n\n你已经击败了护锅者并获得了这口锅的钥匙，可以随心所欲地向锅内添加适当的药剂来抵消瘟疫的效果了。",pEN="The Scourge's plague cauldron stands before you, spewing vast amounts of toxins into the air. A small, non-descript access panel lies in the base of the cauldron's vast platform.\n\nHaving already defeated the cauldron lord and acquired its key, you are free to add the appropriate reagents to the cauldron to make a counter agent to the plague.",c="你把药剂倒入了锅中的混合物中，不断喷涌的水汽的颜色和成分很快就发生了变化。面对大量散入空气中的新物质，即使是那些离锅炉较远的天灾军团爪牙也显出了畏惧之色。",cEN="Adding the reagents to the cauldron's mix begins to change the color and texture of the cloud it spews forth. Scourge that are even remotely near the cauldron appear to recoil at the introduction of the new components into the environment."}
Q[5222]={d="已经有两口瘟疫之锅被成功打开了，虽然并不确定你能否继续前进，但我们仍然想要打开剩下的两口瘟疫之锅。这可以让我们的解药发挥更大的效果！\n\n这次你的目标是嚎哭鬼屋的瘟疫之锅。那个地方在安多哈尔正东边，相对来说比较靠近被毁坏的城墙。和以前一样，消灭那里的护锅者，拿到它的钥匙。用这只瓶子从锅里取得样品。\n\n祝一切顺利，$n！",dEN="Two cauldrons have been successfully opened; while you will be able to access them indefinitely, we still want to open up the other two that remain. This will provide all of us with more options to introduce the counter agent!\n\nThis time, you'll be hitting the Writhing Haunt's cauldron. It is almost due east of Andorhal, relatively close to the ruined city walls; again, eliminate the cauldron lord present there for its key. Use this bottle to obtain the sample from the cauldron.\n\nGood hunting, <name>!",o="到西瘟疫之地的嚎哭鬼屋去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带嚎哭鬼屋的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to the Writhing Haunt in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Writhing Haunt Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="护锅者的钥匙打开了这口锅的控制板，然后就消失了——与前两口天灾之锅的钥匙一样。一种带着腐烂气息的物质在锅里剧烈地翻滚着。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝带回一份样品。",cEN="The cauldron lord's key unlocks the access panel to this cauldron and then disappears, much like the other keys have for the previous two cauldrons you've dealt of. A putrid smelling substance churns violently beneath the platform of the cauldron.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for High Priestess MacDonnell back at Chillwind Point."}
Q[5223]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔那里去了。",dEN="You delicately top off the empty bottle; a sample of the foul substance that churns under the platform of the cauldron now oozes back and forth inside the fragile glass container.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp to complete the mission.",o="把嚎哭鬼屋的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔。",oEN="Bring the Filled Writhing Haunt Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="一旦我们成功地分析了从嚎哭鬼屋的天灾之锅里取得的样品，就可以再研制出一种能有效对抗天灾军团的药剂了！",pEN="Once we successfully analyze the sample drawn from the Writhing Haunt's cauldron, it will provide us with a third avenue to deliver a devastating counter agent onto the Scourge!",c="干得漂亮，$n！我们现在可以用这三口天灾之锅来对付天灾军团了。如果克尔苏加德对这些地方的控制力不像现在这样强大的话，我敢说你已经把它们全都关掉了！\n\n炼金师阿尔比顿将对中和这口锅中的毒素的问题进行研究。现在，控制西瘟疫之地的最后一口天灾之锅的时机终于到来了！",cEN="Another finely executed mission, <name>! This makes three cauldrons available to us to turn against the Scourge. If Kel'Thuzad's necromantic dominance over these lands wasn't as strong as it currently is, I'd dare say you'd shut them down completely!\n\nAlchemist Arbington will have a report on what this cauldron - as well as the other cauldrons subverted - will require to deliver our counter agent to the plague. With that, the time has come to bring the last cauldron of the west under our influence!"}
Q[5224]={p="天灾军团的天灾之锅就伫立在你面前，它将大量的毒素喷洒到空气中。在锅炉的巨大平台下，有一条细长的管道。\n\n你已经击败了护锅者并获得了这口锅的钥匙，可以随心所欲地向锅内添加适当的药剂来抵消瘟疫的效果了。",pEN="The Scourge's plague cauldron stands before you, spewing vast amounts of toxins into the air. A small, non-descript access panel lies in the base of the cauldron's vast platform.\n\nHaving already defeated the cauldron lord and acquired its key, you are free to add the appropriate reagents to the cauldron to make a counter agent to the plague.",c="你把药剂倒入了锅中的混合物中，不断喷涌的水汽的颜色和成分很快就发生了变化。面对大量散入空气中的新物质，即使是那些离锅炉较远的天灾军团爪牙也显出了畏惧之色。",cEN="Adding the reagents to the cauldron's mix begins to change the color and texture of the cloud it spews forth. Scourge that are even remotely near the cauldron appear to recoil at the introduction of the new components into the environment."}
Q[5225]={d="最后的一口瘟疫之锅在一个被称作盖罗恩农场的地方，由亡灵天灾中较为强大的爪牙守卫着——那里的鬼魂和幽灵尤其危险。你可不能掉以轻心，$n。\n\n盖罗恩农场在这里的东北方向，靠近东瘟疫之地的边界。和以前一样，消灭那里的护锅者以获取他的钥匙。拿着这个空样品瓶，把它装满给我拿回来。愿圣光护佑你平安完成这次危险的任务，$c。",dEN="The last cauldron that remains is located on a farm now called Gahrron's Withering. It is guarded by some of the Scourge's tougher minions - specifically, wraiths and ghosts. They are not to be trifled with, <name>.\n\nGahrron's Withering is due northeast of our position here, close to where the Eastern Plaguelands begin; again, eliminate the cauldron lord present there for its key. Here is your empty sample bottle; bring it to me filled. May the Light protect you in this dangerous mission, <class>.",o="到西瘟疫之地的盖罗恩农场去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带盖罗恩农场的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Gahrron's Withering in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Gahrron's Withering Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="护锅者索瓦斯的钥匙碰到天灾之锅平台底部控制板上的锁之后就消散了。一声轻轻的叮当声过后，控制板打开了，展现在你面前的是天灾之锅里沸腾着的毒素。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝带回一份样品。",cEN="Cauldron Lord Soulwrath's key disintegrates as it touches the lock on the access panel at the base of the cauldron's platform. A slight clanking noise is heard within, and the access panel swings open to reveal more viscous toxins within the cauldron's framework.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for High Priestess MacDonnell back at Chillwind Point."}
Q[5226]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔那里去了。",dEN="You carefully close the spigot in the control panel, watching the cauldron's putrid ichors drip into the empty bottle.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp to complete the mission.",o="把盖罗恩农场的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔。",oEN="Bring the Filled Gahrron's Withering Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="盖罗恩农场的天灾之锅是我们在东部的最后一个目标。只要我们得到锅中的瘟疫样本，我们就可以通过这四口锅把我们的解药散播到空气中！即使有克尔苏加德的支持，天灾军团也很难兼顾四口天灾之锅。",pEN="Gahrron's Withering houses the last cauldron here in the east that we need access to. Once we have a sample of the plague it spews forth, we will be able to introduce our reagents into the environment through four separate vessels! The Scourge will be hard pressed to keep us out of all four, even with the power of Kel'Thuzad behind them.",c="恭喜你，$n，你为我们解锁了最后一口大锅！炼金师阿尔比顿很快就会知道这口大锅需要哪些材料来配制。\n\n至于你，我相信指挥官瓦罗菲斯特会想亲自感谢你给予我们的帮助。没有你，我们对抗天灾军团的斗争几乎是无法取胜的。谢谢你，$g英雄:英雄;！",cEN="Congratulations <name>, you've unlocked the last cauldron for us! Alchemist Arbington will soon know what this cauldron requires as far as reagents needed for the mix.\n\nAs for you, I am sure that Commander Valorfist will want to thank you personally for the assistance you've given us. Without you, our struggle against the Scourge would have been nearly insurmountable. Thank you, hero!"}
Q[5227]={p="天灾军团的天灾之锅就伫立在你面前，它将大量的毒素喷洒到空气中。在锅炉的巨大平台下，有一条细长的管道。\n\n你已经击败了护锅者并获得了这口锅的钥匙，可以随心所欲地向锅内添加适当的药剂来抵消瘟疫的效果了。",pEN="The Scourge's plague cauldron stands before you, spewing vast amounts of toxins into the air. A small, non-descript access panel lies in the base of the cauldron's vast platform.\n\nHaving already defeated the cauldron lord and acquired its key, you are free to add the appropriate reagents to the cauldron to make a counter agent to the plague.",c="你把药剂倒入了锅中的混合物中，不断喷涌的水汽的颜色和成分很快就发生了变化。面对大量散入空气中的新物质，即使是那些离锅炉较远的天灾军团爪牙也显出了畏惧之色。",cEN="Adding the reagents to the cauldron's mix begins to change the color and texture of the cloud it spews forth. Scourge that are even remotely near the cauldron appear to recoil at the introduction of the new components into the environment."}
Q[5228]={d="在洛丹伦的土地上有八口瘟疫之锅，其中四口在西瘟疫之地，另外四口在东瘟疫之地。这些瘟疫之锅不断向空中喷出毒气，将天灾军团的瘟疫传播到整个大地。\n\n克尔苏加德的力量太强大了，我们无法关掉这些瘟疫之锅，但是我想我们可能有办法利用它们。我的助手，暗影牧师范蒂丝负责此项任务的执行，你去找她谈谈吧。",dEN="Within the lands of former Lordaeron are eight cauldrons - four in the west, and four more entrenched in the east. These cauldrons spew poisons into the air, propagating the plague throughout the land for the Scourge.\n\nThe necromantic might of Kel'Thuzad is too strong to outright shut down these cauldrons, but we think we might have a way to subvert them to our advantage. My second, Shadow Priestess Vandis, will be your point on this assignment; she'll continue the briefing from here.",o="与西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",c="来自暗影之中，$g兄弟:姐妹; $r，我向你致意。我将在破坏天灾瘟疫之锅的计划中担任你的协调员。\n\n我们的目标是改变大锅中产生的瘟疫成分，把它变成对天灾军团有害的东西。要实现这一改变，你必须取得西瘟疫之地四口大锅的通行权。\n\n你率领大军向天灾军团发起进攻的时刻到了，$g英雄:英雄;。",cEN="From the shadows, brother <race>, I bid you greetings. I am to serve as your coordinator for our plan to sabotage the Scourge's cauldrons.\n\nOur goal will be to change the composition of the plague that the cauldrons create into something that negatively affects the Scourge. In order to affect this change, you will need to secure access to each of the four cauldrons here in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nThe time has come for you to lead the charge against the Scourge, hero."}
Q[5229]={d="在西瘟疫之地的四口瘟疫之锅中，费尔斯通农场里的那一口可能是最容易进入的了。亡灵天灾在那边驻扎的都是新兵，尽管他们也不是轻易可以击败的对手，但相对来说毕竟容易一些。\n\n到费尔斯通农场去，它就在这里的正东方，安多哈尔的西北方，并与那里的护锅者交战。它身上有一把可以打开瘟疫之锅的钥匙。当你开启那口锅之后，用这个瓶子装满锅里的毒药样品，我们要对它进行研究以制造出一种解药。",dEN="Of the four cauldrons in the Western Plaguelands, the one at Felstone Field may be the easiest one to gain access to. The Scourge have greener troops positioned here, though they should not be underestimated.\n\nGo to Felstone Field, due east of here and northwest of Andorhal, and engage the cauldron lord there. On it is a key that will unlock access to the cauldron. When unlocked, use this bottle to get a sample of the cauldron's toxins; we'll need it for study in developing a counter agent.",o="到西瘟疫之地的费尔斯通农场去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带费尔斯通农场的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Felstone Field in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there. It may have a key that will allow access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Felstone Field Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="你轻松地将从护锅者拜尔摩那里拿来的钥匙插进控制板里，但是随即它就消失了。尽管如此，你却已经可以不用钥匙就打开控制板了。随着一种未知的浓缩混合剂在天灾之锅中翻腾，腐烂的恶臭气息从打开的控制板里散发了出来。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔带回一份样品。",cEN="The key taken from Cauldron Lord Bilemaw is a perfect fit in unlocking the access panel, though it disappears after you use it. Still, you think you can open the panel now without a key. A foul stench emanates from the opened panel as an unknown mix of concentrated substances swirl inside the cauldron.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for Shadow Priestess Vandis back at the Bulwark."}
Q[5230]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝那里去了。",dEN="You fill the bottle with enough of the cauldron's poisonous concoction for a suitable sample to be studied.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark to complete the mission.",o="把费尔斯通农场的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝。",oEN="Bring the Filled Felstone Field Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="欢迎回到相对来说还算安全的亡灵壁垒，$n。你在天灾之锅那边有什么进展要汇报吗？",pEN="Welcome back to the relative safety of the Bulwark, <name>. What progress on the cauldrons do you have to report?",c="干得好，$n。迪瑟斯不用费什么工夫就可以对这东西进行分析，然后制造出可以中和瘟疫的药剂。如果能把足够的解药散播到空气中，我们就有可能削弱这个地区的天灾军团。\n\n毫无疑问，这是一场持久而严酷的考验，我们需要不断的攻击这些天灾之锅，把我们的药剂倒入锅中。只要我们能坚持下去，在全面的战争开始的那一天，我们就会对天灾军团占有压倒性的优势！",cEN="Well done <name> - it should take Apothecary Dithers no time at all to analyze this and devise a counter agent to introduce into the cauldron. If we are able to pump out enough of it into the air, we might be able to weaken all the Scourge present here.\n\nThis will no doubt be an ongoing ordeal; we will need to continually hit these cauldrons and introduce our reagents into their mix. Still, if we can keep it up, we will have a huge advantage over Scourge when the time comes for battle!"}
Q[5231]={d="有一口瘟疫之锅被放置在一座早已废弃的农场上，现在这里被称为达尔松之泪。不过现在我们没时间掉眼泪，$c。我们必须打开这口瘟疫之锅！\n\n到安多哈尔正北方的达尔松之泪去，消灭那里的护锅者。像上次一样，护锅者身上应该有一把可以打开瘟疫之锅的钥匙。用这个瓶子从锅里装一份样品拿回来，每口锅所使用的毒素配方都是截然不同的。",dEN="One of the plague cauldrons is located in the field of a former farmhouse now referred to as Dalson's Tears. No tears will be shed this day, <class>; we must strike at this cauldron and gain access to it!\n\nGo to Dalson's Tears, almost due north of Andorhal, and eliminate the cauldron lord there. It should have a key like the last one did, allowing you inside the cauldron's innards. Use this bottle to obtain a sample from inside the cauldron; each cauldron has its own distinct brew of toxins it uses.",o="到西瘟疫之地的达尔松之泪去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带达尔松之泪的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Dalson's Tears in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Dalson's Tears Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="从护锅者身上找到的钥匙很容易地滑入锁孔并随即消失，而天灾之锅的控制板也一下子打开了，粘稠的腐液在天灾之锅里涌动沸腾。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔带回一份样品。",cEN="The skeletal key found on the cauldron lord easily slides into a keyhole and then disappears, allowing you permanent access to it. Crude, viscous ichors pulsate through twisted tubes within the cauldrons underpinnings.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for Shadow Priestess Vandis back at the Bulwark."}
Q[5232]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝那里去了。",dEN="You carefully fill the bottle with enough of the cauldron's ichors for what you consider to be suitably sized sample.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark to complete the mission.",o="把装满的达尔松眼泪之瓶交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝。",oEN="Bring the Filled Dalson's Tears Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="我们知道每一口天灾之锅都使用不同的药剂来产生毒素，同样，我们也知道我们必须针对各个天灾之锅中的毒素研制出相应的解药。你从达尔松之泪取得的样品是我们解决那里的天灾之锅的关键。",pEN="We know that each cauldron employs a different mix of reagents to generate its plague-inducing toxin; likewise, we know that we will need to develop a counter agent that is unique for each cauldron. Your sample from Dalson's Tears will be the key to figure out that cauldron's distinct reagent requirement.",c="啊，这些对研究来说已经足够了。干得好，$n！\n\n现在，事态已经在我们的掌握中了。我们需要制造一系列试剂，当这些试剂与天灾之锅中已有的物质结合之后，那些原有的毒素就会被中和。\n\n我们只有把解药直接倒进天灾之锅里才能达到这种效果。迪瑟斯对这类事情有更深的了解，所以你最好尽快找他谈一谈。",cEN="Ah, there is plenty in here for study. Well done, <name>!\n\nFor now, the next step is in our hands. We'll need to produce a list of reagents that, when combined with what is already in the cauldron, will act as its counter.\n\nThe only way we will be able to introduce this is by placing the reagents into the cauldron directly. Apothecary Dithers will have more information on that, so be sure to speak with him as soon as possible."}
Q[5233]={d="已经有两口瘟疫之锅被成功打开了，虽然并不确定你能否继续前进，但我们仍然想要打开剩下的两口瘟疫之锅。这可以让我们的解药发挥更大的效果！\n\n这次你的目标是嚎哭鬼屋的瘟疫之锅。那个地方在安多哈尔正东边，相对来说比较靠近被毁坏的城墙。和以前一样，消灭那里的护锅者，拿到它的钥匙。用这只瓶子从锅里取得样品。\n\n祝一切顺利，$n！",dEN="Two cauldrons have been successfully opened; while you'll be able to access them indefinitely, we still want to open up the other two that remain. This will provide all of us with more options to introduce the counter agent!\n\nThis time, you'll be hitting the Writhing Haunt's cauldron. It is almost due east of Andorhal, relatively close to the ruined city walls; again, eliminate the cauldron lord present there for its key. Use this bottle to obtain the sample from the cauldron.\n\nGood hunting, <name>!",o="到西瘟疫之地的嚎哭鬼屋去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带嚎哭鬼屋的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to the Writhing Haunt in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Writhing Haunt Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="护锅者的钥匙打开了这口锅的控制板，然后就消失了——与前两口天灾之锅的钥匙一样。一种带着腐烂气息的物质在锅里剧烈地翻滚着。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝带回一份样品。",cEN="The cauldron lord's key unlocks the access panel to this cauldron and then disappears, much like the other keys have for the previous ones you've dealt of. A putrid smelling substance churns violently beneath the platform of the cauldron.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for Shadow Priestess Vandis back at the Bulwark."}
Q[5234]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝那里去了。",dEN="You delicately top off the empty bottle; a sample of the foul substance that churns under the platform of the cauldron now oozes back and forth inside the fragile glass container.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark to complete the mission.",o="把嚎哭鬼屋的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝。",oEN="Bring the Filled Writhing Haunt Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at The Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="只要我们成功的分析从嚎哭鬼屋的天灾之锅里取得的样品，就可以研制出另一种能够有效对抗瘟疫的解药了！",pEN="Once we successfully analysis the sample drawn from the Writhing Haunt's cauldron, it will provide us with a third avenue to deliver a devastating counter agent against the Scourge!",c="又一个完美的任务，$n！我们现在可以用这三口天灾之锅来对付天灾军团了。如果克尔苏加德对这些地方的控制力不是像现在这么强大的话，我敢说你已经可以把它们全都结束掉了！\n\n药剂师迪瑟斯将会对如何利用这几个锅子的东西研发瘟疫疫苗的方式提出报告。等到疫苗出来，控制西瘟疫之地的最后一口天灾之锅的时机就会到来了！",cEN="Another finely executed mission, <name>! This makes three cauldrons available to us to turn against the Scourge. If Kel'Thuzad's necromantic dominance over these lands wasn't as strong as it currently is, I'd dare say you'd shut them down completely!\n\nApothecary Dithers will have a report on what this cauldron - as well as the other cauldrons subverted - will require to deliver our counter agent to the plague. With that, the time has come to bring the last cauldron of the west under our influence!"}
Q[5235]={d="最后的一口瘟疫之锅在一个被称作盖罗恩农场的地方，由亡灵天灾中较为强大的爪牙守卫着——那里的鬼魂和幽灵尤其危险。你可不能掉以轻心，$n。\n\n盖罗恩农场在这里的东北方向，靠近东瘟疫之地的边界。和以前一样，消灭那里的护锅者以获取他的钥匙。拿着这个空样品瓶，把它装满给我拿回来。愿圣光护佑你平安完成这次危险的任务，$c。",dEN="The last cauldron that remains is located on a farm now called Gahrron's Withering. It is guarded by some of the Scourge's tougher minions - specifically, wraiths and ghosts. They are not to be trifled with, <name>.\n\nGahrron's Withering is far to the east of the Bulwark, close to where the Eastern Plaguelands begin; again, eliminate the cauldron lord present there for its key. Here is your empty sample bottle; bring it to me filled. May the shadows cloak you in safety for this dangerous mission, <class>.",o="到西瘟疫之地的盖罗恩农场去，找到并击败那里的护锅者，用它的钥匙打开瘟疫之锅。你必须随身携带盖罗恩农场的空瓶来采集瘟疫之锅中的毒药样本。",oEN="Go to Gahrron's Withering in Western Plaguelands to locate and defeat the Cauldron Lord present there, and use its key to gain access to the cauldron. You must have the Empty Gahrron's Withering Bottle with you to secure a sample of the poisons used inside the cauldron.",p="天灾之锅的控制面板仍然被牢牢地锁着。要想打开它，你就得先找到钥匙。",pEN="An access panel to the cauldron remains securely fastened. In order to open it, you will need to find the key.",c="护锅者索瓦斯的钥匙碰到天灾之锅平台底部控制板上的锁之后就消散了。一声轻轻的叮当声过后，控制板打开了，展现在你面前的是天灾之锅里沸腾着的毒素。\n\n锅的底部有一个小水龙头，可以让你用手中的瓶子为亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝带回一份样品。",cEN="Cauldron Lord Soulwrath's key disintegrates as it touches the lock on the access panel at the base of the cauldron's platform. A slight clanking noise is heard within, and the access panel swings open to reveal more viscous toxins within the cauldron's framework.\n\nThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for Shadow Priestess Vandis back at the Bulwark."}
Q[5236]={d="你往瓶子里装满了瘟疫之锅中的毒液，制成了一份合适的样品。\n\n现在你应该带着毒药回到亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝那里去了。",dEN="You carefully close the spigot in the control panel, watching the cauldron's putrid ichors drip into the empty bottle.\n\nWith the poison in hand, it is time to return to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark to complete the mission.",o="把盖罗恩农场的样本瓶交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的暗影牧师范蒂丝。",oEN="Bring the Filled Gahrron's Withering Bottle to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="盖罗恩农场的天灾之锅是我们在西瘟疫之地的最后一个目标。只要我们得到锅中的瘟疫样本，我们就可以通过这四口锅把我们的解药散播到空气中！即使有克尔苏加德的支持，天灾军团也很难兼顾四口天灾之锅。",pEN="Gahrron's Withering houses the last cauldron that we need to acquire access to here in the west. Once we have a sample of the plague from that cauldron, we will be able to introduce our reagents into the environment through four separate vessels! The Scourge will be hard pressed to keep us out of all four, even with the power of Kel'Thuzad behind them.",c="恭喜你，$n，你为我们打开了最后一口大锅！药剂师迪瑟斯很快就会知道配制需要哪些成分。\n\n至于你，我敢肯定高阶执行官德灵顿会想亲自感谢你给予我们的帮助。没有你，我们对抗天灾军团的斗争几乎是无法取胜的。非常感谢你，$g强大的:强大的; $c。",cEN="Congratulations <name>, you've unlocked the last cauldron for us! Apothecary Dithers will soon know what this cauldron requires as far as reagents needed for the mix.\n\nAs for you, I am sure that High Executor Derrington will want to thank you personally for the assistance you've given us. Without you, our struggle against the Scourge would have been nearly insurmountable. I thank you, mighty <class>."}
Q[5237]={c="$n，你成功改造了大锅的结构，这对我们来说是一场巨大的胜利！\n\n<指挥官清了清嗓子，开始大声宣告。>\n\n在场所有人都听着：鉴于你为暴风城王国和整个联盟做出的贡献远远超出了职责的要求，而且我还要补充一点，面对压倒性的劣势和难以言喻的危险，我将此授予$n，并向$g你:你;致以我们永恒的感激之情，你是一位真正的:你是一位真正的;联盟英雄。让我们欢呼吧！",cEN="<name>, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!\n\n<The commander clears his throat and begins to bellow loudly.>\n\nLet all within my presence hear: for service to the Kingdom of Stormwind and to the Alliance above and beyond the call of duty - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give <name> this, and I extend upon <him/her> our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Alliance. Cheers, I say!"}
Q[5238]={c="$n，你成功改造了大锅的结构，这对我们来说是一场巨大的胜利！\n\n<高阶执行官清了清嗓子，开始大声宣告。>\n\n在场所有人都听着：鉴于你为被遗忘者和整个部落做出的贡献远远超出了预期，而且我还要补充一点，面对压倒性的劣势和难以言喻的危险，我将此授予$n，并向$g你:你;致以我们永恒的感激之情，你是一位真正的:你是一位真正的;部落英雄。呼啦！",cEN="<name>, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!\n\n<The high executor clears his throat and begins to bellow loudly.>\n\nLet all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give <name> this, and I extend upon <him/her> our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. Huzzah!"}
Q[5241]={d="有时，在夜里，我能听到我的叔叔卡林在哭，但那哭声听起来好像是从很遥远的东边传过来的。\n\n我希望他不是在为我哭泣！$n，你能找到我的叔叔并告诉他我过得很好吗？\n\n如果你找到他，跟他说我在等他，还有我想听他过去常讲的故事……那个关于兔子和果酱的故事！那个故事可真有趣！",dEN="Sometimes, when it's nighttime, I can hear my Uncle Carlin crying. It sounds like he's far away, to the east.\n\nI hope he's not crying for me! <name>, will you find my uncle and tell him I'm alright?\n\nIf you find him say I'm waiting for him, and I want to hear the story he used to tell... the one about the rabbits and the berry jam! That story's so funny!",o="找到卡林·瑞德巴思。",oEN="Find Carlin Redpath.",c="你见过帕米拉了？她还活着吗？\n\n她死了？不！哦，帕米拉！为什么你的灵魂还留在这世上受苦。为什么你死了，而命运却让我活着？我宁愿与你交换命运，在达隆郡这片死寂的土地上当一个孤魂野鬼！\n\n啊，但这个消息并不能改变命运。谢谢你，$n。现在，我的责任，我复仇的责任，像从前一样猛烈地燃烧起来了。",cEN="You've seen Pamela? She's alive?\n\nShe's dead? No! Oh, Pamela! Why does your spirit still suffer in this world. Why are you perished, while fortune keeps me alive? In an instant I would switch places with you and wander dead Darrowshire, a ghost and alone!\n\nAh, but this news cannot change fate. Thank you, <name>. Now my duty, my duty to revenge, burns hot as ever."}
Q[5242]={d="不幸的是，我认为唯一可以解决暗影议会的方法就是从正面进攻。没有别的方法进入暗影堡，我也没有办法把你传送进去。通往底部的笔直小径是唯一的通路……而且我也知道你的目标是谁。他的名字是费尔丹……暗影领主费尔丹。他就是暗影堡的头目。杀了他和他的两个魅魔仆从，然后回到我这儿来。费尔丹与燃烧军团定下了盟约，你必须除掉他！",dEN="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside. The straight path down to the bottom is the only way... and I also know who you should seek out. His name is Fel'dan... Shadow Lord Fel'dan. He is the mortal in power down below... he is the head of the serpent. Kill him and his two succubus servants and return to me. Fel'dan is the one making pacts with the Legion. He must be stopped.",o="杀掉米莱恩和萨莉亚，并把暗影领主费尔丹的头颅交给费伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄。",oEN="Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",p="如果没有了费尔丹，暗影议会就很有可能失去重心并开始内讧。他们会各怀鬼胎地相互争夺权力和财宝。那将是毁灭他们的绝佳时机。",pEN="Without Fel'dan, the Shadow Council will hopefully lose focus and start infighting. They will struggle with one another for control and hoard assets for future plans. That will be an opportune time to devastate them and their demon slaves.",c="赞美大地之母，$n！谢谢你！这确实是荣耀的一天！\n\n在受到如此沉重的打击之后，暗影议会再要想恢复以前的实力将会困难重重。你今天完成了一件伟大的壮举！",cEN="Earthmother be praised, <name>! Thank you! This is a great day, indeed!\n\nThe Shadow Council will be hard pressed to scale to the same levels of power they once held with this blow to their hierarchy. You have done a great thing this day!"}
Q[5243]={d="我把自己的不死之身看作一种疾病，$r。一种只需要治疗就能解决的病；然而，它对银色黎明来说也是一大幸事。要打击天灾军团那些异教徒，还有什么比亡灵更好的容器呢？\n\n我的同僚因为我所做的牺牲而敬重我，但那些赞誉对我毫无意义。\n\n如果你有兴趣帮助银色黎明，我可以给你一份工作。\n\n前往斯坦索姆，取回我们多余的圣水。去翻找那些补给箱。|n",dEN="I look at my undeath as a malady, <race>. An illness that merely requires treatment; however, it is also a great blessing for the Argent Dawn. What better vessel to smite the heathens of the Scourge than through the undead?\n\nI am revered by my colleagues because of the sacrifices I have made, but the accolades mean nothing to me.\n\nIf you are interested in assisting the Argent Dawn, then a job I can offer.\n\nVenture to Stratholme and recover our surplus of holy water. Search the supply crates.",o="到北方的斯坦索姆去，寻找散落在城市中的补给箱，并收集5瓶斯坦索姆圣水。当你找到足够的圣水之后就回去向莱尼德·巴萨罗梅复命。",oEN="Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid.",p="你要注意，并不是所有的补给木箱都在城市被毁灭后保存了下来。天灾军团不敢碰触圣水，但圣水并不能阻止害虫的侵袭。",pEN="Be wary, not all supply crates will have survived the destruction of the city. The Scourge dare not touch the water but surely the holy water will not prevent vermin infestations.",c="干得好，$r。你已经证明，虽然你$g宽容:宽容;待人，但为了消灭克尔苏加德的爪牙，你会不惜一切代价。",cEN="Well done, <race>. You have proven that while you are tolerant of others, you will stop at nothing to destroy the minions of Kel'Thuzad."}
Q[5244]={d="凯斯利尔背后的故事是关于一个被诅咒的种族的,这个种族被困在在他们试图进行一场典礼的地方……\n\n你会在那里找到的上层精灵从前偷了一个圣物，它们相信可以把它的力量吸出供自己使用，以使自己变得更加强大。在他们试图吸取其力量时，这个遗物在一场大爆炸中粉碎了，碎片被埋在了湖面的冰下……\n\n如果你想知道更多的话去找加隆·石矛谈话；他最近刚去过这一地区可以告诉你更多事情。",dEN="The story behind Kel'Theril is one of a cursed race, bound to the place where they attempted an unfortunate ritual...\n\nThe highborne that you will find there once stole a sacred artifact, believing that they could siphon its power for themselves, becoming even more powerful. In their efforts, the relic shattered in a huge explosion, driving the pieces below the ice of the lake...\n\nSpeak with Jaron Stoneshaper if you'd like to learn more; he has recently visited the area and can tell you more.",o="与坠星村的加隆·石矛谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jaron Stoneshaper in Starfall Village.",c="啊，当然，我可以告诉你关于凯斯利尔的更多事情。尽管如此，我并不是一个历史学家，但我可以告诉你我在那里所看到的……",cEN="Well, sure, I can tell you more about Kel'Theril. Mind you now, I'm no historian, but I can tell ya about what I saw there..."}
Q[5245]={d="上层精灵的灵魂是些可悲的生物，这一点毫无疑问。他们仍在寻找那件诅咒他们永远困在凯尔瑟林的东西的碎片——那件被盗的圣物。\n\n如果你真有兴趣，就拿上我的镐子去南边的湖那里，看看能不能从冰层里收集到它的碎片。不过，我没法告诉你你找到的是什么，但我认识一个可能知道的人……奥萝拉·唤天者；她住在东瘟疫之地北部北关哨塔附近。",dEN="The highborne spirits are miserable creatures, that's for sure. They are still searching for pieces of the very thing that has cursed them to Kel'Theril forever -- the stolen relic.\n\nIf you are that interested, take my pick and go south to the lake, see if you can gather the pieces of it from within the ice.\n\nNow, I can't tell you a thing about what you find, but I do know of someone who might... Aurora Skycaller; she dwells near the Northpass Tower in the northern part of Eastern Plaguelands.",o="使用加隆的镐来寻找四块上层精灵遗物的碎片，把它们交给东瘟疫之地的奥萝拉。",oEN="Use Jaron's Pick to find the four Highborne Relic Fragments. Bring them to Aurora Skycaller in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你为何而来？",pEN="Why have you come here?",c="精灵的过去是我所不愿提及的，$n。原谅我，一想到曾经发生的那些事情，我就非常痛苦……而且没有任何办法可以让一切重回正轨。",cEN="The past of the high elves is something that I do not wish to discuss, <name>. Please, it pains me to think of all that has happened... And that there is no way to make things right."}
Q[5246]={d="我没有意识到……请原谅我无情的话语，$c。\n\n我并不想回顾祖先犯下的错误，但是如果你的请求是真心的，那么我会帮助你。\n\n<奥萝拉查看了一下这些碎片>\n\n我相信这就是辛玛洛水晶，一种具有强大的魔法力量并可以控制更强大力量的神器。它原本是用来做善事的，但那些偷走它的窃贼的邪恶力量使它破碎了。\n\n到艾萨拉的辛玛洛神殿去吧，希望那本书还放在那里……",dEN="I did not realize... Forgive my callous words, <class>.\n\nThe mistakes of my ancestors are not what I wish to dwell on, but if your request is truly genuine, then I will help you.\n\n<Aurora examines the fragments.>\n\nI believe this is the Crystal of Zin-Malor, an artifact that can contain and control strong arcane forces. It could have been used for good, but the evil intentions of those that stole it caused it to shatter.\n\nGo to the Temple of Zin-Malor in Azshara - I can only hope the book is still there.",o="在艾萨拉的辛玛洛神殿里找到神圣的上层精灵笔迹，并将它带给位于东瘟疫之地的北地哨塔附近的奥萝拉。",oEN="Find the Sacred Highborne Writings in the Temple of Zin-Malor in Azshara, and bring them to Aurora Skycaller near the Northpass Tower in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="只有看过圣书，我才能知道是否可以帮助你……",pEN="It is only in the pages of the sacred writings that I will be able to discern whether or not I can help you...",c="这本书已经很久都没有人碰过了……",cEN="The pages have gone untouched for many many years..."}
Q[5247]={d="如果你真的希望重塑神器，那我就可以帮助你。\n\n为了修复碎片，我需要一些具有强大魔法能量的物品。一块魔化瑟银锭和五块恢复水晶……你还得从一个非常危险的地方搜集一些水……在菲拉斯地区的厄运之槌中，艾德雷斯区有一个厄运之池，用池中的水装满这只小瓶。\n\n在你去收集这些东西的时候，我会尝试从书中找到复原神器所需的知识。",dEN="I will be able to help you, if recreating the artifact is truly what you wish to do.\n\nTo seal the pieces back together, I will need items with strong magical qualities. An enchanted thorium bar and five crystal restore... You'll also need to collect some water from what might seem an unlikely place... Find the dire pool along Eldreth Row at Dire Maul in Feralas, and fill this vial.\n\nWhile you are gone, I will attempt to glean from these pages the knowledge I need to repair the damage done to the relic.",o="给东瘟疫之地的奥萝拉带去一块魔化瑟银锭、5块恢复水晶，以及一小瓶恐怖之水。",oEN="Bring an Enchanted Thorium Bar, 5 Crystal Restore, and a Vial of Dire Water to Aurora Skycaller near the Northpass Tower in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="神器必须放在最值得信任的人手中。它不能再次被盗了……",pEN="The relic must be placed in the hands of only the most trustworthy. It can not be stolen again...",c="凭着这些材料，我就可以把碎片熔合在一起……希望能使它们恢复到从前的样子。",cEN="Using these elements, I can fuse the fragments together... to hopefully what they once were."}
Q[5248]={d="$n，我为过去所发生的事情哭泣。就像这块水晶一样，精灵这个种族已经破碎了。我不知道这些碎片是否还能被拼成一块，但是能够帮你完成这项小小的任务，这令我的悲痛减轻了许多。\n\n我们决不能忘记过去，$n……\n\n请把辛玛洛水晶带回凯斯利尔湖去，你必须寻找一个意识到这个错误的上层精灵，让他看到我们已经纠正了他们犯下的弥天大错。",dEN="<name>, I weep for what has happened in the past. Like this crystal, the elves, as a race, have been shattered. I do not know if the pieces will ever again be reunited into one, but my sorrow has been eased by being able to help you with this one small task.\n\nWe must not forget the past, <name>...\n\nPlease take the Crystal of Zin-Malor back to Lake Kel'Theril. You must find a highborne spirit that realizes the error of what was done so long ago. Show the spirit that we have made things right again.",o="把辛玛洛水晶带回冬泉谷的凯斯利尔湖，在那里寻找一个会与你讲话的上层精灵。",oEN="Take the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Lake Kel'Theril in Winterspring and find a highborne spirit that will speak to you.",p="诅咒……永远……",pEN="Currrrrsed... Forevvvverrrr...",c="请……离开我……",cEN="Pleeease, leeeave meeeeee..."}
Q[5249]={d="在冬泉谷，也就是这里北面的极寒之地，有许多远古的精灵遗迹。那是一块荒凉的土地，但它藏着许多秘密和有待探索的地方。\n\n因为我在费伍德森林这里还有事情要做，因此我没有机会到冬泉谷去。但你如果不去可就没有理由了！\n\n你到了冬泉谷之后，就去坠星村找到维恩德·夜风，他非常了解那片土地。",dEN="In Winterspring, to the north of here, there are many ancient elven ruins. It's a harsh land, but it holds many secrets and places to explore.\n\nWith all my work to do here in Felwood, I have not had the opportunity to travel to Winterspring. But there's no reason why you shouldn't!\n\nWhile you're there, look for Wynd Nightchaser. He spends most of his time in Starfall Village and he knows a lot about the area.",o="找到冬泉谷的坠星村，在那里与维恩德·夜风谈一谈。",oEN="Find Starfall Village in Winterspring and speak with Wynd Nightchaser.",c="伊维·飘叶的朋友？很高兴见到你，$n。",cEN="A friend of Ivy Leafrunner? Nice to meet you, <name>."}
Q[5250]={d="在费伍德森林以北的冬泉谷，散布着许多古老的精灵废墟。那是一片严酷的土地，却藏着许多秘密和值得探索的地方。\n\n我这里的研究让我忙得脱不开身，已经很久没有机会去冬泉谷了。但你没有理由不去那里研究那些废墟。\n\n到了那里就去找温德·夜行者。他大部分时间都在星光镇，对那一带非常了解。\n\n告诉他你是我的$g学生:学生;。",dEN="In Winterspring, to the north of Felwood, there are many ancient elven ruins. It's a harsh land, but it holds many secrets and places to explore.\n\nMy studies here keep me so busy that I have not had the opportunity to travel to Winterspring for some time. But there's no reason why you shouldn't travel there and study the ruins.\n\nWhile you're there, look for Wynd Nightchaser. He spends most of his time in Starfall and he knows a lot about the area.\n\nTell him that you are a student of mine...",o="找到冬泉谷的坠星村，在那里与维恩德·夜风谈一谈。",oEN="Find Starfall in Winterspring and speak with Wynd Nightchaser.",c="你是达林·轻风的学生？很高兴认识你，$n，$g真的:真的;。",cEN="A student of Daryn Lightwind? Nice to meet you, <name>."}
Q[5251]={d="任何事物走向极端都会危害我们的世界，$n。就拿血色十字军来说吧。你认为他们盲目的狂热真的服务于更高的善吗？他们以圣光之名杀害了多少无辜者？\n\n他们全都是亵渎者，一个不剩！\n\n不过其中有一个人让我特别感兴趣：斯坦索姆的档案管理员加尔福特，血色十字军最珍贵的文件都要经过他的手。干掉他，烧掉他的档案馆！如果你成功了，回来见我，就会得到$g奖赏:奖赏;。",dEN="Anything taken to an extreme is hazardous to our world, <name>. Take for example, the Scarlet Crusade. Do you believe that their blind zealotry serves a greater good? How many innocents have they destroyed in the name of the Light?\n\nBlasphemers, one and all!\n\nOne in particular interests me, though; the Archivist Galford of Stratholme: A man that watches over the Crusade's most valued documents. Destroy him and burn down his archives! Should you succeed, return to me and be rewarded.",o="在斯坦索姆城中找到血色十字军的档案管理员加尔福特，杀掉他，然后烧毁血色十字军档案。",oEN="Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive.",p="记住，$n——我们需要宽容，但是我们也必须坚持自己的信仰！",pEN="Remember, <name> - we must be tolerant yet rigid in our beliefs!",c="太好了，$n！他们数年积累下来的资料化为灰烬！血色十字军在接下来的几星期里一定会知道这次打击对他们有多么严重。",cEN="Outstanding, <name>! Years of intelligence, lost! The Scarlet Crusade will surely feel this blow in the coming weeks."}
Q[5252]={d="那块……水晶……\n\n这里的上层精灵被他们的过错折磨着……\n\n我感到很悲伤，但是我意识到了很久之前我们犯下的错误。虽然我们没有办法纠正这个过错，但是你拿回了辛玛洛水晶，现在我终于可以安息了……\n\n你必须归还它……\n\n必须……",dEN="The... the crystal...\n\nThe highborne here are clouded by their own misssery...\n\nI am sorrrrrowful, but I realize the errorrrr of what happened so long ago. Even though there is no waaaay to change the past, I am now at peacccce knowing that you have recovered the crystal of Zin-Malor...\n\nYouuu must return it...\n\nIt muuuussst be returrrned.",o="和坠星村的维恩德·夜风谈一谈，了解到辛玛洛水晶所在的位置。",oEN="Speak with Wynd Nightchaser in Starfall Village, and ask about the proper place for the Crystal of Zin-Malor.",p="你离开已经很长时间了，$n。这段时间以来，你都遇见了些什么事情？",pEN="It has been some time since you left, <name>. How have you fared?",c="难道……难道这就是……",cEN="Is that... what I think it is?"}
Q[5253]={d="你给我留下了深刻的印象，$n。\n\n辛玛洛水晶永远都无法重回神殿，你应该知道的，它已经变成了废墟。但是我相信你对抗邪恶力量的努力会得到回报的。\n\n到达纳苏斯去找大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔，然后把水晶交给他，$n。这样水晶就不会再次落到居心叵测的人手中了。根据我的观察，只有极其强大的魔法使用者才能控制水晶的力量。",dEN="Quite impressive, <name>.\n\nThe crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded.\n\nSeek out Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus, and bring the crystal to him, <name>. It should be in the hands of those that will not abuse its power. From the looks of it, only a handful of the strongest magic users would be able to control such a power.",o="将辛玛洛水晶送到达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔那里。",oEN="Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",p="怎么了，$r？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="我听说过辛玛洛水晶；使用者能获得惊人的奥术力量，但前提是他真正配得上。让我印象深刻的是，你不仅找回了水晶，还认清了自己的极限，没有亲自去使用它。\n\n谢谢你把它带给我，$n。我们会妥善保管它，愿那些曾守护破碎水晶的受诅咒的灵魂终于得到安息，$g真的:真的;。",cEN="I have heard of the Crystal of Zin-Malor; the user of the crystal becomes capable of incredible arcane power, but only if truly worthy. I am impressed that you not only recovered the crystal, but you also realize your own limits, and did not attempt to use the crystal yourself.\n\nThank you for bringing it to me, <name>. We will keep it safe, and may the cursed sprits that once guarded the shattered crystal finally be at peace."}
Q[5261]={d="伊根·剥皮者正在找人帮他猎杀恶狼。这消息不错，因为最近北郡山谷里出现了很多恶狼。\n\n如果你有兴趣，就去找伊根谈谈；他就在修道院左边。",dEN="Eagan Peltskinner is looking for someone to hunt wolves for him. That's good news, because we're seeing a lot more wolves in Northshire Valley lately.",o="与伊根·派特斯金纳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Eagan Peltskinner.",c="确实如此。我正在找人帮我捕猎那些狼！你要帮我吗？",cEN="That's true. I'm looking for someone to hunt me some wolves! Are you that person?"}
Q[5262]={d="当房间中的尘埃逐渐落定的时候，你努力整理着自己的思路。在回忆了一遍刚刚发生的事情之后，你似乎还是无法相信这一切。\n\n血色十字军的头号人物是个恶魔？不仅仅是恶魔，他还是幽暗城中的瓦里玛萨斯的兄弟？\n\n你小心地将恐惧之王的头颅砍下，然后装入包中。显然，如果没有证据的话,没有人会相信你所说的。\n\n你必须马上让尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵得知这个消息！",dEN="You try and gather your thoughts as the dust settles across the chamber. You go over the events that just transpired and still cannot comprehend the gravity of the situation.\n\nThe Grand Crusader of the Scarlet Crusade a demon? And not just any demon but brother to Varimathras, arch lord of the Undercity?\n\nYou carefully stow the severed head of the dreadlord into your pack. Surely, none would believe the tale you would tell without proof.\n\nDuke Nicholas Zverenhoff must be told at once!",o="将巴纳扎尔的头颅交给东瘟疫之地的尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵。",oEN="Take the Head of Balnazzar to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="What have you got there, <name>?",c="这对十字军意味着什么？他们是否已经在恶魔的控制之下了？他们是否已经不知不觉地被一个更加邪恶的力量所利用了？",cEN="What will this mean to the Crusade? Could it be possible that they have been under the control of this demon? Unwittingly serving as the pawns to a greater evil?"}
Q[5263]={d="你展现出破坏的天赋，而且服从命令。这两样东西很少能共存于同一个灵魂之中。我开始觉得，你也许会成为一具绝佳的圣裁工具。\n\n<兹维伦霍夫双手在面前合十。>\n\n克尔苏加德的跑腿小厮统治着斯坦索姆。向我证明你$g是:是;一位冠军——$g我的:我的;冠军。摧毁瑞文戴尔男爵，把他的头带回来给我。 |n",dEN="You display a natural aptitude for destruction and you follow orders. It is rare to see the two coexist. I am beginning to think that you may make an excellent vehicle of divine justice.\n\n<Zverenhoff clasps his hands together in front of his face.>\n\nKel'Thuzad's errand boy rules over Stratholme. Prove to me that you are a champion - my champion. Destroy Baron Rivendare and return to me with his head.",o="前往斯坦索姆，干掉瑞文戴尔男爵。取下他的头颅，回到尼古拉斯·兹维伦霍夫公爵那里。|n",oEN="Venture to Stratholme and destroy Baron Rivendare. Take his head and return to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff.",p="男爵杀的人也许比你一生所看到的都要多。",pEN="The Baron has slain more people than you have most likely seen in your lifetime.",c="已经很多年没有一位冠军加入我们的行列了。你是多年来第一个得到麦克斯韦尔领主接见的人，$g真的:真的;，$g真的:真的;。",cEN="It has been many years since I have ushered a champion into our ranks. You are the first to be granted audience with Lord Maxwell in years."}
Q[5264]={d="你即将获得一项巨大的荣誉，$n。\n\n麦克斯韦尔领主想要奖赏你为银色黎明所做的贡献！\n\n麦克斯韦尔已经很多年没有接见过外人了。|n",dEN="I am about to bestow a great honor upon you, <name>.\n\nLord Maxwell wishes to reward you for your service to the Argent Dawn!\n\nIt has been years since Maxwell has granted audience to outsiders.",o="和玛克斯韦尔·泰罗索斯男爵谈一谈。他就在教堂里面。",oEN="Speak with Lord Maxwell Tyrosus. He is inside the church.",c="你是一位$g有价值的盟友:有价值的盟友;，$n。你将收获你坚定奉献的回报。",cEN="You are a worthy ally, <name>. You shall reap the rewards of your stalwart dedication."}
Q[5265]={d="许多年来，银色黎明宝箱都一直锁着，没有人能得到打开它的殊荣——直到今天。\n\n银色黎明宝箱现在为你敞开，$n。",dEN="Through the years the Argent Hold has remained locked. None have been worthy to reach inside and take from it the power of the Argent Dawn - until today.\n\nThe Argent Hold is now open to you, <name>.",o="打开银色黎明宝箱，拿取你应得的奖励。",oEN="Open the Argent Hold and claim your reward.",c="哇……",cEN="Whoa..."}
Q[5281]={d="在斯坦索姆沦陷的时候，许多人都悲惨地死去了。其中许多人是自杀的，他们宁愿选择葬身火海，也不愿成为亡灵天灾的一员。\n\n现在他们成了永远也不得安息的幽灵，在斯坦索姆的街道上到处游荡。\n\n我们必须拯救他们，$n！\n\n我有一个名叫埃根的同伴，他多年来对鬼魂和幽灵进行了大量的研究，你可以去找他帮忙。埃根正在斯坦索姆附近的东瘟疫之地对他的新发明进行测试。",dEN="There are those that died tragically in the fall of Stratholme. Many took their own lives, opting to hurl themselves into the myriad flames of the smoldering city rather than become one of the Scourge.\n\nThey now walk the streets of Stratholme as restless spirits.\n\nWe must aid them, <name>!\n\nI have an associate named Egan who has been doing miraculous work with ghosts and souls. Seek him out. He walks the eastern Plaguelands, near Stratholme, testing his innovations.",o="找到埃根。你只知道他在斯坦索姆附近。",oEN="Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme.",c="奥林总算是找到了一个足够勇敢的$r！",cEN="Alen has finally found someone brave enough, eh?"}
Q[5282]={d="对亡灵的愤怒是我力量的源泉，也是我继续生存下去的动力。但是，我不是个没大脑的狂热分子。总有些人——比如血色十字军，他们只知道疯狂地摧毁一切亡灵，但从来也没想过要对他们有哪怕一丁点的同情。\n\n所以我发明了这样一件东西：冲击器。它可以解放斯坦索姆城中的那些痛苦的灵魂。\n\n对那些在街道上游荡的鬼魂使用它，让他们的灵魂获得自由吧。",dEN="I draw my power - my will to continue living and breathing - from the unmitigated hatred I have for the Scourge and all that they have done. I am, however, no zealot. There are those, like the Scarlet Crusade, who would sooner destroy the innocent undead than lend them even an ounce of compassion.\n\nWhich brings me to this: My blaster. It will unchain the tortured souls from Stratholme.\n\nUse it on the ghosts that haunt the ransacked streets. Free their souls.",o="对斯坦索姆城中的鬼魂使用埃根的冲击器。当那些永不安息的灵魂挣脱他们的外壳时，再次使用埃根的冲击器——他们就可以获得自由了！\n\n解放15个永不安息的灵魂，然后回到埃根那里去。",oEN="Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs!\n\nFree 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan.",p="怜悯是我们与动物的区别所在，$n。记住这一点……",pEN="Compassion is what separates us from the animals, <name>. Remember that...",c="<伊根拭去眼眶中的泪水。>\n\n你看见我妈妈了吗，$n？你让她获得安宁了吗？\n\n你是尊严的象征。为了补偿这件事情给你带来的麻烦……",cEN="<Egan wipes a tear from his eye.>\n\nDid you see my mother, <name>? Did you free her?\n\nYou are a shining example of decency. For your troubles..."}
Q[5283]={d="这么说，你做出了明智的决定。\n\n对我来说，铸造护甲就是我的爱好。那些整天打造玩具刀枪的根本不知道什么是锻造。\n\n有了绝佳的防护，才能取得战争的胜利。当战争的优势不在你这边时，任何武器都没法帮你摆脱困境。\n\n好吧，我们开始工作吧。首先你必须证明自己已经学会了一些粗略的手艺。然后，我将把你塑造成一名真正的护甲铸造师。你应该知道如何制造精制秘银护甲，对吧？",dEN="So ye made the smart decision.\n\nThere ain't no love lost betwixt me an old Ironus here. That good for nothing toy maker knows who the true craftsmen round here be.\n\nThe truly great wars are won with a good defense. When it be go time, no offense is gonna be helping ye out.\n\nRight, so let's get to work. All ye need to do is show me that ye've got some raw talent. After that, I'll yank whatever impurities be left in ye and mold ye into an armorsmith. Ye do know how to make ornate mithril, don't ye?",o="要成为一名$g护甲铸造师:护甲铸造师;，你必须制造以下物品并把它们交给格鲁努斯：4 顶精制秘银头盔、2 双精制秘银战靴、1 件精制秘银胸甲。",oEN="To become an Armorsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Grumnus: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots, 1 Ornate Mithril Breastplate.",p="啊，没什么比一双巧手更有价值的了，你只需看看护甲的线脚，就可以知道它是个什么级别的货色。",pEN="Ah, ain't nothing like a good forge tan. Ye can tell who's got the really good tans by their apron lines.",c="很好，$n。你还有最后一次重新选择的机会。如果你想要当个造玩具的，呃，我是说武器锻造师，现在还不算太晚。\n\n我相信你会做出正确的抉择。",cEN="This be it, <name>. After this, there ain't no way to turn back. It's not too late to become a toy maker, er, weaponsmith.\n\nI trust ye'll make the right decision."}
Q[5284]={d="作为一名武器铸造师，你将发现英雄和冒险者们会经常来向你购买装备。虽然你应该可以承受这繁重的工作量，但是你所得的钱财会有一大部分耗费在治疗肌肉拉伤和肺尘病上。\n\n哦，没错，$n，武器铸造师拥有惊人的财富！\n\n要是你想成为我们当中的一员，就必须证明自己能帮我赚——我的意思是，你必须要证明，当人们需要高质量的武器时，他们会来找你而不是别人。去工作吧！",dEN="As a weaponsmith you'll find that more often than not, heroes and adventurers will be coming to you for gear. While the workload can be unbearable at times, the riches more than make up for the back strain and ash lung.\n\nOh yes, <name>, weaponsmiths are the ones with all the gold!\n\nIf you wish to join our ranks, you'll need to show me that you can make me a silver or two - I mean, show me that you've got what it takes to be the go to <guy/girl> when people need superior quality weapons. Get to work!",o="要成为一名$g武器铸造师:武器铸造师;，你必须制造以下物品并把它们交给艾隆努斯：4 把月钢宽剑、4 把巨型铁斧、2 把重型秘银斧、2 把大黑锤。|n",oEN="To become a Weaponsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Ironus: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes, and 2 Big Black Maces.",p="<埃隆努斯正忙于将金币整理成堆。>",pEN="<Ironus is busy stacking gold coins into neat little piles.>",c="总算来了！我还有客户等着呢。\n\n把这些交给这里的人，然后听好了。你将迈出成为$g武器铸造师:武器铸造师;的第一步。",cEN="About time! I've got customers waiting.\n\nGive those here and pay attention. You're going to take the first step in your career as a weaponsmith."}
Q[5301]={d="我很满意。我对自己使用铁锤和铁砧制造出的东西感到满意。每当看到骄傲的部落士兵身穿着由我打造的钢铁铠甲，我就能体会到活着的意义。永不放弃是我不变的信念，$n。\n\n我无法将自己的满足感分给你，我只能引导你前进。尽你的全力，成为护甲铸造师的道路就像一次漫长的旅程。\n\n如果你想要成为技艺精湛的护甲铸造师，就告诉我吧，我将对你进行训练，但在此之前你必须完成一项任务。",dEN="Satisfaction. It is what I draw from the hammer and the anvil. To see a proud Horde warrior protected under my steel reminds me of what it is to be alive. It is an addiction that I dare never give up, <name>.\n\nI can not grant you this satisfaction, merely set you upon the path. As with all of life's endeavors, the path of the armorsmith is a journey.\n\nIf you wish to be one of the select few, you need only to ask and I shall train, but, a task you must first complete.",o="要成为一名$g护甲铸造师:护甲铸造师;，你必须制造以下物品并把它们交给奥克索斯：4 顶精制秘银头盔、2 双精制秘银战靴、1 件精制秘银胸甲。",oEN="To become an armorsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Okothos: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots, 1 Ornate Mithril Breastplate.",p="我要用尽全力，把这块铁敲打得坚固无比。",pEN="I will pound the steel until the breath itself has been taken from me.",c="这是你开始$g护甲铸造师:护甲铸造师;新职业前的最后一步，$n。如果你决定退出，现在是最后的机会。否则，就准备好迎接一生的荣耀吧。",cEN="This is the final step before you begin your new career as an armorsmith, <name>. Should you choose to back out, now would be your last chance. Otherwise, prepare yourself for a lifetime of glory."}
Q[5302]={d="总有一天，我要制造出一把无以伦比的铁锤，配得上酋长的铁锤！\n\n这是我毕生的工作，$n，也是我的激情所在。我认为你有潜力成为我们中的一份子，成为一名武器铸造师。我可以帮助你发挥自己的潜能。\n\n你只需完成一项简单的任务，让我来看看你够不够资格。",dEN="One day, I will create a legendary hammer. A hammer fit for a Warchief!\n\nIt is my life's work, <name>. My passion. I recognize that you have the potential to be among us, one of us - a weaponsmith. I am the one that can help you harness that potential.\n\nA simple task is all that you must complete. Simple for one of your exceptional skill.",o="要成为一名$g武器铸造师:武器铸造师;，你必须制造以下物品并把它们交给博尔戈什：4 把月钢宽剑、4 把巨型铁斧、2 把重型秘银斧、2 把大黑锤。|n",oEN="To become a Weaponsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Borgosh: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes, and 2 Big Black Maces.",p="为部落的荣耀而努力吧！",pEN="For the glory of the Horde!",c="这是你开始$g武器铸造师:武器铸造师;新职业前的最后一步，$n。如果你决定退出，现在就是最后的机会。否则，就准备被知识$g吞没:吞没;吧！",cEN="This is the final step before you begin your new career as a weaponsmith, <name>. Should you choose to back out, now would be your last chance. Otherwise, prepare to be consumed by knowledge!"}
Q[5305]={d="在血色堡垒的深处坐落着甜美的宁静。血色铸锤师用自己的生命守护着那份图纸。击败他，把他的围裙带给我。作为回报，我会传授你成为$g铸锤师:铸锤师;所需的知识。",dEN="Within the confines of the Scarlet Bastion lies sweet Serenity. The Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe with his life. Defeat him and bring me his apron. For that, I shall reward you with the knowledge required to create an enchanted battlehammer!",o="前往斯坦索姆，杀死血色铸锤师。取得血色铸锤师的围裙，回到莉莉丝那里。|n",oEN="Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith.",p="他的围裙！在哪儿？",pEN="His apron! Where is it?",c="希望你的战锤可以打爆许多脑浆，$n！",cEN="May you bash in many a brain, <name>!"}
Q[5306]={d="别被她的美貌骗了，$c。暗影猎手沃什加斯既致命又疯狂。\n\n<基尔拉姆指了指自己脸上的伤疤。>\n\n没错，那就是她留下的——她称之为“爱的一击”。\n\n复仇的时刻终于到了。\n\n你可以在黑石塔找到沃什加斯。杀了她，把她的蛇石带回来给我。做到这一点，我就教你铸造黎明之刃的技艺。\"\"",dEN="Don't let her beauty fool you, <class>. The shadow huntress, Vosh'gajin is deadly and deranged.\n\n<Kilram points to the scar on his face.>\n\nAye, she gave me that - a love tap, she called it.\n\nThe time for vengeance has finally come.\n\nYou can find Vosh'gajin in Blackrock Spire. Slay her and return to me with her snakestone. Do this and I will teach you the secret to crafting Dawn's Edge!",o="到黑石塔去杀死暗影猎手沃什加斯，将沃什加斯的菊石交给基尔拉姆。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Recover Vosh'gajin's Snakestone and return to Kilram.",p="据说用沃许加斯的菊石打磨过的斧头可以保持锋利达千年之久！",pEN="Legend states that one use of Vosh'gajin's snakestone will keep an axe razor sharp for a 1000 years!",c="知识就是力量！",cEN="Knowledge is power!"}
Q[5307]={d="如果我看起来对你有些无礼，那是有原因的。腐蚀之剑的设计图被黑衣守卫——瑞文戴尔男爵的精英骷髅部队给盗走了。\n\n没错，斯坦索姆的瑞文戴尔男爵。\n\n现在黑衣守卫铸剑师正在以他的生命——呃，姑且这么说吧——守护着设计图。\n\n杀死他，把他的物品拿回来作为凭证，我就会教你如何锻造闪耀轻剑！",dEN="If I am short with you, it is for a reason. The plans for the creation of the great blade, Corruption, have been stolen by the Black Guard: Elite skeletal units of Baron Rivendare.\n\nYes, Baron Rivendare of Stratholme.\n\nThe Black Guard swordsmith now guards those plans with his... undeath.\n\nSlay him and return proof of this deed and I shall grant you the knowledge required to create a blazing rapier!",o="在斯坦索姆找到黑衣守卫铸剑师，然后杀死他。将黑色卫士徽记交给亡灵杀手瑟里尔。",oEN="Find the Black Guard Swordsmith in Stratholme and destroy him. Recover the Insignia of the Black Guard and return to Seril Scourgebane.",p="你忘记自己的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you forgotten what it is that you were tasked with, <name>?",c="刀剑永远是你铸造的最好选择。",cEN="It should be obvious that a sword is always the best choice."}
Q[5321]={d="我本要去玛斯特拉哨所与莉拉迪丝·月河会面，但我决定在这里停下来打个盹。自从我从翡翠梦境中醒来，就一直困得不行……\n\n<打了个哈欠>\n\n你介意给我指条路吗？据我所知，玛斯特拉哨所在南边，沿着灰谷的道路。那里很危险，希望你有些朋友能加入我们的队伍。\n\n还有一件事：我可能会睡着，所以如果你需要叫醒我，就用我的号角。你在这个箱子里能找到它。<bostezo>",dEN="I was on my way to Maestra's Post to meet Liladris Moonriver, but I decided to stop here and take a short nap. Ever since I awoke from the emerald dream, I have been so sleepy...\n\n\n\nWould you mind showing me the way? I understand that Maestra's Post is south of here, along the road in Ashenvale. It can be dangerous, so I hope you have some friends that will join us.\n\nLastly, I may fall asleep so if you ever need to wake me, please use my horn. You'll find it in the chest here.",o="护送科洛尼安·永影前往灰谷的玛斯特拉哨所，与莉拉迪丝·月河会合。",oEN="Escort Kerlonian Evershade towards Ashenvale.",p="克罗尼亚来了没有？",pEN="Has Kerlonian arrived?",c="科洛尼安没事，我太高兴了！我肯定能在附近某个角落找到他，又在打瞌睡，对吧？\n\n谢谢你给他指路，$n。",cEN="Oh, I am so happy Kerlonian made it! And I'm sure I'll find him sleeping somewhere around here, won't I?\n\nThank you for showing him the way, <name>."}
Q[5341]={d="在通灵学院的深处藏着巴罗夫家族的财富。我，阿莱克斯·巴罗夫，是巴罗夫家族最后两位继承人之一。我的兄弟维尔顿是另一位。\n\n维尔顿那个可悲的懦夫，在战争中逃跑了，因此得以保住他毫无价值的人类性命。\n\n如今他正在寻找地契，好把那笔财富据为己有。在我兄弟之前找回地契，我就会让你$g富有:富有;得超乎你最疯狂的梦想！",dEN="Within the Scholomance lays the Barov family fortune. I, Alexi Barov, am one of the last two remaining heirs of the house Barov. My brother, Weldon, is the other.\n\nWeldon, the miserable coward, fled during the war and thus retained his worthless existence as a human.\n\nHe now searches for the deeds so that he may claim the fortune for his own. Recover the deeds before my brother does and I shall make you wealthy beyond your wildest dreams!",o="到通灵学院中去取得巴罗夫家族的宝藏。这份宝藏包括四份地契：凯尔达隆地契、布瑞尔地契、塔伦米尔地契，还有南海镇地契。完成任务之后就回到阿莱克斯·巴罗夫那儿去。",oEN="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",p="在我面前低下头，$r。毕竟我是贵族，而你不过是个$g身无分文的农民:身无分文的农民;。",pEN="Bow your head in my presence, <race>. I am a noble, after all, and you are a copperless peasant.",c="干得好，$r。现在，该收回我的遗产了……",cEN="Excellent work, <race>. Now to secure my inheritance..."}
Q[5342]={d="既然我的兄弟仍然活着，那么自然就是家族财产的理所应当的继承人。我绝不能让他得到这笔财产。\n\n你这样卑贱的流浪者除了当个冷血杀手之外还能干什么？\n\n这任务很简单，我希望你能胜任。如果你想要得到报酬，就按我说的去做吧。\n\n维尔顿在东边的冰风岗，他在那里受到了联盟的保护。杀死他，把他的脑袋给我带回来。\n\n<阿莱克斯打了个哈欠。>\n\n赶快出发吧。",dEN="Naturally, with my brother still alive, there may be some contention as to the primary beneficiary of the family's fortune. This cannot be.\n\nA low down guttersnipe like you isn't above a little cold-blooded murder, I hope.\n\nIt's a simple task and one that I expect you will complete; that is, if you wish to claim your reward.\n\nWeldon sits under Alliance protection at Chillwind Camp, to the east. Slay him, return his head.\n\n<Alexi yawns.>\n\nHurry along now.",o="到冰风岗——联盟的领地——去暗杀维尔顿·巴罗夫。把他的脑袋交给阿莱克斯·巴罗夫。\n\n要多加小心，联盟也许对维尔顿实施了严密的保护。",oEN="Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov.\n\nBe warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum.",p="确保我得到这笔财产，你也不会吃亏的。",pEN="Secure my fortune and share in the spoils.",c="好极了！现在，我掌握了巴罗夫系列的权力和财富！\n\n<阿莱克斯扔给你一只大口袋。>\n\n你这肮脏的$r，这是你应得的。",cEN="Wonderful! Now only I hold the power and fortune of house Barov!\n\n<Alexi throws a large bag at you.>\n\nAnd keep the change, you filthy animal."}
Q[5343]={d="我亲爱的兄弟阿莱克斯……我真不该饶了他的命。我与已经成为亡灵的他四目相视，最终却免了他一死。\n\n<维尔顿啐了一口唾沫。>\n\n现在他正到处寻找属于我的财产！我绝不能让他得逞。\n\n在他肮脏的爪子碰到财宝之前，你必须找到我们巴罗夫家族的地契，我会用无数的珍宝和财富回报你。它们就在通灵学院的废墟中，要快！",dEN="My dear brother Alexi. What a fool I was to spare his life. I looked into the face of the enemy, one of the undead, and let him live.\n\n<Weldon spits.>\n\nHe now searches for MY inheritance. This simply cannot happen.\n\nFind my family's deeds before that vile retch gets his boney hands upon them and I shall reward you with vast riches. They lay in the ruins of the Scholomance. Make haste!",o="到通灵学院中去取得巴罗夫家族的宝藏。这份宝藏包括四份地契：凯尔达隆地契、布瑞尔地契、塔伦米尔地契，还有南海镇地契。完成任务之后就回到维尔顿·巴罗夫那儿去。",oEN="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",p="在我面前低下头，$r。毕竟我是贵族，而你不过是个$g身无分文的农民:身无分文的农民;。",pEN="Bow your head in my presence, <race>. I am a noble, after all, and you are a copperless peasant.",c="干得漂亮，$r。现在，来确保我的遗产……",cEN="Excellent work, <race>. Now to secure my inheritance..."}
Q[5344]={d="地契已经找到了，我们还剩下一件事要做——杀死阿莱克斯。只要他一死，我就用不着再担心那些惟利是图、肆无忌惮的强盗来取我的脑袋了。\n\n这任务很简单。阿莱克斯在亡灵壁垒，他在那里受到了部落的保护。\n\n不，只是杀死他还不行，我要你把他的脑袋拿回来！至于你怎么做到这一点……呃，那是你的事情。这种行为可不是我这样的贵族会做的。",dEN="With the deeds recovered, there is but one thing left to do. Alexi must be killed. With him dead, I need not ever worry about an unscrupulous gang of mercenaries seeking my head.\n\nIt's a simple task. Alexi hides under the protection of the Horde - at the Bulwark.\n\nNo, I do not expect you to just walk up and kill him, I want his head! How you get it... well, that part is up to you. That type of behavior is below one of my noble upbringing.",o="去亡灵壁垒——部落的领地——去暗杀阿莱克斯·巴罗夫。把他的脑袋交给维尔顿·巴罗夫。\n\n要小心，部落也许对阿莱克斯实施了严密的保护。",oEN="Travel to the Bulwark - Horde territory - and assassinate Alexi Barov. Take his head and return to Weldon Barov.\n\nBe warned, Alexi will probably be well protected by Horde filth.",p="你难道不想要报酬吗？",pEN="You do want payment, do you not?",c="这真是光荣的一天！巴罗夫家族的祸害终于被清除了，我的财富也安全了！\n\n拿着这个，从我的视线里消失，$g农民:农民;。",cEN="A glorious day it is! Finally, the pockmark of house Barov eliminated and my fortune secure!\n\nTake this and leave my sight, peasant."}
Q[5361]={d="我的兄弟纳塔卡驻扎在凄凉之地的幽灵岗哨。我想问你……你能帮我把这份报告交给他吗？距离我上次写报告给他已经过去一年了，最近半人马有些不寻常的举动，我想我应该把这些告诉他。\n\n到十字路口北边的石爪山脉去，然后向西进入焦炭谷，再往南进入凄凉之地，在那儿有一条路通往南边的幽灵岗哨。",dEN="My brother Nataka is stationed at Ghost Walker Post over in Desolace. I'd like to ask you... could you give this report to him for me? A year has passed since the last time I wrote, there has been unusual centaur activity since then and he should be informed.\n\nJourney to Stonetalon Mountain north of the Crossroads, and then head west into Charred Vale. From there, head south into Desolace; there you will find a road going south to Ghost Walker Post.",o="将峭壁卫兵图林·长角的报告交给凄凉之地幽灵岗哨的纳塔卡·长角。",oEN="Deliver Cliffwatcher Longhorn Report to Nataka Longhorn at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace.",p="你带来了什么消息，$c？啊——你是说我兄弟托送的消息？好吧，把报告给我吧！",pEN="What news have you, <class>! Ah - a message from my brother you say? Well then, hand over the report!",c="我不知道你和我兄弟是怎么认识的，但他似乎很信任你，$c。\n\n我是纳塔卡·长角，欢迎你来到鬼行哨所。我们永远需要$g一位:一位; $c！和其他人谈谈吧，这里肯定有你能做的事。",cEN="I know not what connection you have with my brother but it would seem he has trust with you, <class>.\n\nI am Nataka Longhorn and would like to welcome you to Ghost Walker Post, we have many needs of a <class>! Talk with others, perhaps there is need of you here."}
Q[5381]={d="燃烧之刃掌握着恶魔之盒。盒中封存着强大的伊鲁克斯之手。燃烧之刃用它来在玛诺洛克集会所开启恶魔传送门。我们必须阻止恶魔的洪流涌入我们的世界，$n！\n\n用这把恶魔镐去凿开雷斧堡垒的红水晶，就能进入恶魔之盒。|n",dEN="The Burning Blade possesses the Demon Box. Within it lies the powerful Hand of Iruxos. The Burning Blade uses it to open demonic portals at Mannoroc Coven. We must stop the tide of demons entering our world, <name>!\n\nUse this demon pick on the red crystal in Thunder Axe Fortress to gain access to the Demon Box.",o="从雷斧堡垒取出恶魔之盒，连同恶魔镐一起交给影袭村的泰加·睿智之鬃。|n",oEN="Retrieve the Demon Box from Thunder Axe Fortress, and return it, along with the Demon Pick to Taiga Wisemane in Shadowprey Village.",p="$n，你拿到恶魔之盒了吗？",pEN="<name>, do you have the Demon Box?",c="啊，恶魔之盒。把它给我，$c，我将打开它……并向你展示埃卢梭斯之手。",cEN="Ah, the Demon Box. Give it to me, <class>, and I shall open... and thus reveal to you the Hand of Iruxos."}
Q[5382]={d="卡斯迪诺夫杀死了数千条生命。他必须得到惩罚，正义必须得到伸张。\n\n找到他，让他也尝尝他给那些无辜者带来的痛苦。在他死掉之后烧毁我们的遗体，让它们都化为灰烬，$n。",dEN="Krastinov is responsible for the deaths of thousands. He must be punished, justice must be meted out.\n\nFind him and exact upon him the agony he has inflicted upon countless innocents. Once he is destroyed, burn our remains. Turn them to ashes, <name>.",o="在通灵学院内找到希欧林·卡斯迪诺夫医生。摧毁他，然后烧掉伊瓦·萨克霍夫的遗骸和卢西恩·萨克霍夫的遗骸。任务完成后回到伊瓦·萨克霍夫那里。|n",oEN="Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete.",p="我们必须除掉这个屠夫！",pEN="The Butcher must be stopped!",c="我能感觉到自己的灵魂正在康复，$n。你帮了我和我丈夫的大忙，但是事情还没有完。",cEN="I can feel my spirit healing, <name>. You have done my husband and I a great service, but I am certain there is more to be done."}
Q[5384]={d="就是这个了，$n。\n\n<艾瓦指着口袋中的小瓶。>\n\n这无辜者之血。最纯净的血，用于取悦卡斯迪诺夫的主人。\n\n也许它可以召唤基尔图诺斯，这样我们就能杀死他了。\n\n把血液带到门廊去，放在火盆下。基尔图诺斯会出现的——他无法抵抗这血液的诱惑。当他出现时，释放出那些愤怒的无辜者的灵魂。\n\n如果你成功的话，你所能得到的不仅仅是我们的感激之情。",dEN="This is it, <name>.\n\n<Eva points to the vial inside the bag.>\n\nThe blood of innocents. The purest blood, used to appease Krastinov's master.\n\nIt is with this blood that Kirtonos may be summoned. It is with this blood, then, that Kirtonos must be destroyed.\n\nTake the blood to the porch. Place it upon the brazier. Kirtonos will come - he cannot resist. When he appears, unleash the fury and wrath of a thousand innocent deaths upon him.\n\nShould you succeed, you will earn more than just our gratitude.",o="带着无辜者之血回到通灵学院。找到门廊，把无辜者之血放进火盆。基尔图诺斯会前来吞噬你的灵魂。\n\n勇敢作战，寸步不让！摧毁基尔图诺斯，然后回到伊瓦·萨克霍夫那里。|n",oEN="Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.\n\nFight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.",p="小心，基尔图诺斯是个经验丰富的战士。",pEN="Be wary, Kirtonos is a seasoned fighter.",c="随着基尔图诺斯的死亡，通灵学院恐怖故事的一个篇章就此结束。然而，还有很多事要做。这里其他人都已经知道了你的英勇事迹。拿着这个，。它是我们自己精华的一部分。它将让你能与凯尔达隆其他迷失的灵魂交流。",cEN="With the death of Kirtonos, a chapter in the horrible tale of Scholomance comes to a close. There is, however, more to be done. Others here are now aware of your brave acts. Take this, <name>. It is a piece of our own essence. It will allow you to communicate with the other lost souls of Caer Darrow."}
Q[5385]={d="你小心地拾起袋子，准备返回费伍德森林和灰谷边界处的杰希尔·月弓那儿去。希望在你将圣骑士的遗体交给他的朋友之后，他会被隆重地安葬。",dEN="You pick up the sack carefully and prepare to make your way back to Jessir Moonbow on the border of Felwood and Ashenvale. Hopefully the paladin will be given the proper respects once you've passed his remains on to his friends.",o="将特雷·莱弗治的残骸交给费伍德森林的杰希尔·月弓。",oEN="Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood.",p="加德纳尔的情况怎么样了，$n？",pEN="How did things go in Jaedenar, <name>?",c="你做到了！愿艾露恩和你所信奉的任何力量受到赞美，$n。今天你做了一件光荣而高尚的事。我相信阿尔科娜琳会很高兴，因为你不仅抽出时间救了她，还杀死了那个折磨她最好朋友之一的生物。\n\n我希望能为你做得更多，但至少请收下这个。",cEN="You've done it! Praise be to Elune and whichever powers you worship, <name>. You have done an honorable and noble thing this day. I am certain Arko'narin will be pleased that you not only took the time to save her, but to also slay the creature who tortured one of her best friends.\n\nI wish I could do more for you, but please, take this."}
Q[5386]={d="我在幽灵岗哨这儿好久都没有闻到过鱼肉的香味了。葬影村的巨魔最擅长捕鱼……但是，我要在此负责半人马的事情，因此没有时间去拜访巨魔。嗯……\n\n帮我个忙吧，替我去一趟葬影村。在那里找当地的渔夫吉纳泽林谈谈，给我带点美味可口的血肚鱼回来。沿着南边的道路走，你就可以到达西边的巨魔村庄。",dEN="The smell of cooked fish has long been missing here at Ghost Walker Post. The trolls at Shadowprey Village are the best at catching fish... but alas, with all the centaur activities I have little time to make a journey to the trolls. Hrm...\n\nDo me a favor and journey to Shadowprey Village. Talk to the local fisherman Jinar'Zillen and bring me back my favorite, Bloodbelly fish. The road south of here will take you west to the troll village.",o="与葬影村的吉纳泽林谈话，然后将2条血肚鱼交给纳塔卡·长角。",oEN="Talk to Jinar'Zillen at Shadowprey Village, and then bring Nataka Longhorn 2 Bloodbelly fish.",p="当我想到油炸的血肚鱼时，我的蹄子便开始发痒，口水都快流下来了……你搞到鱼了吗？",pEN="My hoof tingles and my mouth starts to water when I think of fried Bloodbelly fish... You have any on you?",c="你可真是个救世主，$n！这些血肚鱼看起来就是生嚼也够味儿。\n\n<纳塔卡开始流口水了。>\n\n作为报酬，你随便选一样东西吧。",cEN="You are a savior, <name>! These Bloodbelly fish look almost good enough to eat raw.\n\n<Nataka starts salivating.>\n\nHere you go - choose one of these items as a payment for these fish."}
Q[5401]={c="所有以银色黎明之名与邪恶战斗的勇士都必须佩戴我们的委任徽记，这样你们就可以向我们的军需官领取奖赏。\n\n在受到委任之后，你就可以从天灾军团士兵的尸体上收集天灾石，那是他们身份和职位的证明。将你收集到的天灾石交给我，每套天灾石都可用来换取一枚勇气和荣耀的象征——银色黎明勇气徽记。\n\n实现你的价值，$c，今天就加入与天灾军团作战的行列！",cEN="All who fight evil on behalf of the Argent Dawn must don our commission. Wearing such will earn your right to claim rewards our quartermasters have to offer.\n\nWhile under commission, you'll be able to acquire Scourgestones from slain Scourge; these are marks of insignia that they sometimes possess. Procure these insignia and bring them to me. For each set you turn in, you will receive our marker of heroism - the Argent Dawn Valor Token.\n\nAchieve your destiny, <class> - join the fight today!"}
Q[5402]={p="爪牙的天灾石是天灾军团基层的徽记。有时可以在瘟疫之地驻扎的较弱部队身上找到它们，不过“较弱”这个词当然要视情况而定。无论在哪里，天灾军团都绝不该被低估。\n\n目前银色黎明正在用一枚勇气徽记换取二十枚这样的徽记——只要你有足够的天灾石，我非常乐意做这笔交易！\"\"",pEN="A Minion's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge rank and file. These are sometimes found on the weaker of their troops positioned in the Plaguelands, though the term \"weaker\" is certainly to be considered in context. The Scourge, no matter where they are, should never be underestimated.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for twenty of these insignia - an exchange I'm happy to do, provided you have earned enough scourgestones!",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n勇气勋章有两个用途:它可以让你与银色黎明的关系更加亲密，这是对你奋力作战的表彰你也可以凭这枚勋章再加上一点钱，到我们的军需官那里换取一些宝贵的物品。\n\n无论你决定怎样使用这枚勇气勋章，它都是你用血汗赢得的，干得不错！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nThe tokens serve two purposes. One - they can be used to further your standing within the Argent Dawn; to do so may avail you options and rewards that are reserved for our honored and revered allies. Two - they can be given to our quartermasters, along with coin, as payment for some of the Dawn's more prized items.\n\nWhatever you decide, know that you are earning your commission. Well done!"}
Q[5403]={p="侵略者的天灾石是天灾军团精英部队的象征，通常是由那些部署在瘟疫之地的主力部队中的士兵携带的。斩杀这样的敌人对你来说是一个挑战，但是你也会因此得到丰厚的奖赏。\n\n如果你能拿来十块这样的天灾石，银色黎明就将给你颁发一枚勇气徽记。",pEN="An Invader's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's elite troops. These are sometimes found on the stronger of the troops positioned in the Plaguelands. Slaying such a creature is indeed a challenge, but one that should be relished with a commission to vanquish evil.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for ten of these insignia. Bring them to me here, and I will make sure you receive your just reward.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n我们每向你这样的勇士颁发一枚勇气勋章，就说明我们在这场对抗天灾军团的战争中又取得了一点进展。只要有更多的英雄加入我们的行列，银色黎明终将剿灭这支无比邪恶的势力。我希望你在今天表现出来的过人勇气也能一直持续到胜利时刻的到来！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nEach valor token handed out to worthy recipients is a sign of the tide turning against the Scourge. With more and more heroes fighting the Scourge in their own lands, the Argent Dawn will assuredly be at the forefront when the time comes to wage war on the ultimate evil of the Scourge. I hope that the valor you've shown what it took to acquiring your token will carry the day then as well!"}
Q[5404]={p="堕落者的天灾石是天灾军团将领的标志。那些统御天灾军团的将领总是会随身携带一块这样的徽记。如果能杀掉如此强大可怕的敌人对银色黎明和我们的正义事业来说都是非常有利的！\n\n如果你能拿来一块这样的天灾石，我会代表银色黎明颁发一枚勇气徽记给你。不过你要小心，$n——你要面对的绝非一般的敌人。",pEN="A Corruptor's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's overlords. A powerful being that holds a position of authority over the Scourge will always possess one. To slay such a malevolent creature would surely advance the cause of the Argent Dawn, and all good causes!\n\nOn behalf of the Argent Dawn, I will give you a valor token in exchange for just a single one these insignia. Use caution in acquiring one, <name> - such powerful beings are not to be trifled with.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n这足以证明你是个甘愿为正义事业献身的英雄。我们会表彰一切与天灾军团抗争的勇士，但是击败他们的领袖才是真正给了他们一个迎头痛击！\n\n为了黎明而战，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nTo acquire a valor token in such a manner indicates that you are a true hero in the cause of good. We value all effort brought to bear against the Scourge, but to take down one of their leaders is to truly deliver onto them a crushing defeat!\n\nFor the Dawn, my <brother/sister>!"}
Q[5405]={c="所有以银色黎明之名与邪恶战斗的勇士都必须佩戴我们的委任徽记，这样你们就可以向我们的军需官领取奖赏。\n\n在受到委任之后，你就可以从天灾军团士兵的尸体上收集天灾石，那是他们身份和职位的证明。将你收集到的天灾石交给我，每套天灾石都可用来换取一枚勇气和荣耀的象征——银色黎明勇气徽记。\n\n实现你的价值，$c，今天就加入与天灾军团作战的行列！",cEN="All who fight evil on behalf of the Argent Dawn must don our commission. Wearing such will earn your right to claim rewards our quartermasters have to offer.\n\nWhile under commission, you'll be able to acquire Scourgestones from slain Scourge; these are marks of insignia that they sometimes possess. Procure these insignia and bring them to me. For each set you turn in, you will receive our marker of heroism - the Argent Dawn Valor Token.\n\nAchieve your destiny, <class> join the fight today!"}
Q[5406]={p="堕落者的天灾石是天灾军团将领的标志。那些统御天灾军团的将领总是会随身携带一块这样的徽记。如果能杀掉如此强大可怕的敌人对银色黎明和我们的正义事业来说都是非常有利的！\n\n如果你能拿来一块这样的天灾石，我会代表银色黎明颁发一枚勇气徽记给你。不过你要小心，$n——你要面对的绝非一般的敌人。",pEN="A Corruptor's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's overlords. A powerful being that holds a position of authority over the Scourge will always possess one. To slay such a malevolent creature would surely advance the cause of the Argent Dawn, and all good causes!\n\nOn behalf of the Argent Dawn, I will give you a valor token in exchange for just a single one these insignia. Use caution in acquiring one, <name> - such powerful beings are not to be trifled with.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n这足以证明你是个甘愿为正义事业献身的英雄。我们会表彰一切与天灾军团抗争的勇士，但是击败他们的领袖才是真正给了他们一个迎头痛击！\n\n为了黎明而战，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nTo acquire a valor token in such a manner indicates that you are a true hero in the cause of good. We value all effort brought to bear against the Scourge, but to take down one of their leaders is to truly deliver onto them a crushing defeat!\n\nFor the Dawn, my <brother/sister>!"}
Q[5407]={p="侵略者的天灾石是天灾军团精英部队的象征，通常是由那些部署在瘟疫之地的主力部队中的士兵携带的。斩杀这样的敌人对你来说是一个挑战，但是你也会因此得到丰厚的奖赏。\n\n如果你能拿来十块这样的天灾石，银色黎明就将给你颁发一枚勇气徽记。",pEN="An Invader's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's elite troops. These are sometimes found on the stronger of the troops positioned in the Plaguelands. Slaying such a creature is indeed a challenge, but one that should be relished with a commission to vanquish evil.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for ten of these insignia. Bring them to me here, and I will make sure you receive your just reward.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n我们每向你这样的勇士颁发一枚勇气勋章，就说明我们在这场对抗天灾军团的战争中又取得了一点进展。只要有更多的英雄加入我们的行列，银色黎明终将剿灭这支无比邪恶的势力。我希望你在今天表现出来的过人勇气也能一直持续到胜利时刻的到来！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nEach valor token handed out to worthy recipients is a sign of the tide turning against the Scourge. With more and more heroes fighting the Scourge in their own lands, the Argent Dawn will assuredly be at the forefront when the time comes to wage war on the ultimate evil of the Scourge. I hope that the valor you've shown what it took to acquiring your token will carry the day then as well!"}
Q[5408]={p="爪牙的天灾石是天灾军团基层的徽记。有时可以在瘟疫之地驻扎的较弱部队身上找到它们，不过“较弱”这个词当然要视情况而定。无论在哪里，天灾军团都绝不该被低估。\n\n目前银色黎明正在用一枚勇气徽记换取二十枚这样的徽记——只要你有足够的天灾石，我非常乐意做这笔交易！\"\"",pEN="A Minion's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge rank and file. These are sometimes found on the weaker of their troops positioned in the Plaguelands, though the term \"weaker\" is certainly to be considered in context. The Scourge, no matter where they are, should never be underestimated.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for twenty of these insignia - an exchange I'm happy to do, provided you have earned enough scourgestones!",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n勇气勋章有两个用途:它可以让你与银色黎明的关系更加亲密，这是对你奋力作战的表彰你也可以凭这枚勋章再加上一点钱，到我们的军需官那里换取一些宝贵的物品。\n\n无论你决定怎样使用这枚勇气勋章，它都是你用血汗赢得的，干得不错！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nThe tokens serve two purposes. One - they can be used to further your standing within the Argent Dawn; to do so may avail you options and rewards that are reserved for our honored and revered allies. Two - they can be given to our quartermasters, along with coin, as payment for some of the Dawn's more prized items.\n\nWhatever you decide, know that you are earning your commission. Well done!"}
Q[5421]={p="谁能使我的生活更惬意些，我就报答谁……我喜欢尽可能地少做事，多睡觉！\n\n我在葬影村的码头放了许多捕贝装置，如果你愿意帮我收集贝壳，我也会给你一些好东西……明白我的意思了吗？你每交给我五块贝壳，我就送你一条血肚鱼。",pEN="I'll reward anyone who makes my life a bit easier... I enjoy doing as little as possible, mon!\n\nBelow the docks here in Shadowprey Village, I've many shellfish traps. If you're kind enough to do my work and collect me my shellfish, then I'll reward you with something you want... get my drift mon? For every five shellfish you bring me I will give you a fine Bloodbelly fish!",c="嗯，没什么比完成工作更美妙的了，特别是其它人帮你完成工作……对吧？",cEN="Sweet mon, nothing beats work being done, especially if it's someone else doing the work... eh?"}
Q[5441]={d="该死的苦工！他们辛苦地从山谷的树上砍伐木材，可总是在打瞌睡！我需要有人帮我管住这些苦工。\n\n你看起来正是适合这项任务的$g人选:人选;。来，拿上这根棍棒，用它去敲那些干活时偷懒睡觉的苦工。狠狠一下就能让他们回去干活！完事后把棍棒还给我。\n\n这些苦工真是又懒又没用……$g真的:真的;",dEN="Cursed peons! They work hard gathering lumber from the trees of the valley, but they're always taking naps! I need someone to help keep the peons in line.\n\nYou look like the right <race> for my task. Here, you take this blackjack and use it on any lazy peons you find sleeping on the job. A good smack will get them right back to work! Return the blackjack when you're done.\n\nLousy slacking peons...",o="在懒惰的苦工睡觉时，用工头的木棒敲他们。敲醒5个苦工，然后把工头的木棒还给试炼谷的工头塔兹利尔。",oEN="Use the Foreman's Blackjack on Lazy Peons when they're sleeping. Wake up 5 peons, then return the Foreman's Blackjack to Foreman Thazz'ril in the Valley of Trials.",p="偷懒可不好……\n\n嗯？你手里拿的是我的木棒？你抓到偷懒睡觉的苦工没有？",pEN="No good lazy...\n\nEh? Do you have my blackjack? Did you catch any peons sleeping on the job?!",c="很好，很好，也许他们下次偷懒之前会记起这次的教训！感谢你的帮助！",cEN="Good. good. Maybe they'll think twice before slacking next time! Thanks for the help!"}
Q[5461]={d="亡灵对于生命的恐惧就像我们对于死亡的恐惧一样，所以一个亡灵将其生前用过的东西全都毁掉是很正常的事情。\n\n不幸的是，要想创建一件能破除莱斯·霜语不死之身的神器，我们就必须找到他生前拥有的一样东西。\n\n你必须到早已被废弃的激流堡去，那里是莱斯·霜语的家，到那里去寻找这样一件东西。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="The undead fear life just as the living fear death. It is not unusual for a sentient undead being to completely destroy all remnants of his or her previous life after having turned.\n\nUnfortunately, in order to create an artifact capable of reverting Ras Frostwhisper to a mortal, we must have a keepsake from his years among the living.\n\nYou must venture to the ruined city of Stromgarde, Frostwhisper's home, and search for such an item. May luck be with you, <name>.",o="到阿拉希高地的激流堡遗迹里面寻找巫妖生前的遗物。如果你能找到这样的东西，就把它交给马杜克镇长。",oEN="Travel to the Arathi Highlands, to the ruins of Stromgarde. Search Stromgarde for a Keepsake of Remembrance. If you find such an item, return with it to Magistrate Marduke.",p="$n，巫妖生前的遗物是很难找到的。",pEN="A keepsake of remembrance is a rare find, <name>.",c="我对这样的东西是否存在曾经心存疑问。你找到了它，这给了我们一个非常珍贵的机会——我们决不能浪费这个机会。\n\n准备好，$n，接下来我要你做的事情就是深入通灵学院之中。",cEN="I had doubted the possibility of such an item existing. This certainly opens up an incredible opportunity - one we must not squander.\n\nPrepare yourself, <name>, for what I am about to ask of you will take you into the depths of hell."}
Q[5462]={d="你必须把这件遗物放在被玷污的土地上。\n\n传说弗斯特·维斯帕尔是在斯坦索姆城里屈服于巫妖王的。在那片血迹斑斑的土地上，他心甘情愿地献出了自己的生命和灵魂，变成了亡灵的一员。\n\n你必须找到那片土地。\n\n我知道有一个亡灵天灾的背叛者，他被希尔瓦娜斯解救了出来，但是他现在效力于银色黎明。去找到他，他的名字是莱尼德·巴萨罗梅。他应该对这件事情更了解一些，到圣光之愿礼拜堂去找他吧，$n。",dEN="Upon tainted soil, the keepsake must be attuned.\n\nIt is rumored that Stratholme is where Frostwhisper succumbed to the Lich King. Upon those bloodied grounds he gave his life - freely and with motive - to become one of the undying.\n\nIt is those grounds that must be found.\n\nThere is one, an undead dissenter of the Scourge, freed by the Banshee Queen but loyal to the cause of the Argent Dawn. Find him: Leonid Barthalomew the Revered. He may know more. Seek out Light's Hope, <name>.",o="到东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂去找到莱尼德·巴萨罗梅，给他看看巫妖生前的遗物，并告诉他你收集到的情报。",oEN="Travel to Light's Hope in Eastern Plaguelands and seek out Leonid Barthalomew the Revered. Show him the Keepsake of Remembrance and tell him all that you have discovered.",p="不要问你不需要答案的问题。",pEN="Do not ask questions of which you do not want answers.",c="<莱尼德看着巫妖生前的遗物。>\n\n你的发现唤醒了我想要永远埋藏的记忆。",cEN="<Leonid looks over the keepsake.>\n\nYour quandary stirs up memories that I had hoped would never resurface."}
Q[5463]={d="我亲眼看着人类莱斯·霜语把自己的不朽灵魂献给巫妖王。他把匕首抵住自己的喉咙，微笑着从耳根割到耳根。他的身体倒在五芒星的界线之内。巫妖王俯视着倒下的法师……只一个动作，巫妖莱斯·霜语就诞生了。\n\n<列奥尼德看着地面，然后抬头看向你。>\n\n是的，$r，我记得很清楚。你所寻找的东西有个名字：米奈希尔的礼物。那是被巫妖王祝福过的土地，对天灾军团来说是一片圣地。|n",dEN="I watched as the human, Ras Frostwhisper, pledged his undying soul to the Lich King. He drew the dagger to his own throat and with a smile, cut from ear to ear. His body collapsed inside the borders of the pentagram. The Lich King stood over the fallen mage and with a single motion, Ras Frostwhisper the lich, was born.\n\n<Leonid gazes at the ground and then looks up at you.>\n\nYes, <race>, I remember. What you seek has a name - Menethil's Gift: The ground blessed by the Lich King - holy ground to Scourge.",o="到斯坦索姆城里去找到米奈希尔的礼物，把巫妖生前的遗物放在那块邪恶的土地上。",oEN="Travel to Stratholme and find Menethil's Gift. Place the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the unholy ground.",p="米奈希尔的礼物周围的区域显得特别寒冷。",pEN="The area around Menethil's Gift is exceptionally cold.",c="你把遗物放在了那块被玷污的土地上。",cEN="You place the keepsake on the tainted soil."}
Q[5464]={d="巫妖的灵魂钻入了代表它前身的物品之中，这件物品很快变成了一本禁锢着巫妖灵魂的遗物。你把它拿了起来，放入包中。",dEN="The soul of the fallen clings to that which represents its former life and transforms the item into a soulbound keepsake. You pick the item up and place it in your pack.",o="把禁锢灵魂的遗物交给东瘟疫之地的莱尼德·巴萨罗梅。",oEN="Take the Soulbound Keepsake to Leonid Barthalomew in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="<莱尼德战栗着。>",pEN="<Leonid shudders.>",c="既然灵魂已经附在了这件遗物上面，那么这件遗物也已经与莱斯·霜语的肉身联结了起来。",cEN="As the soul clung to the keepsake, so shall it cling to the physical form of Ras Frostwhisper."}
Q[5465]={d="把这件遗物交给马杜克吧，$n。他会告你该怎么使用它的。",dEN="Return to Marduke with the keepsake, <name>. He will instruct you in its use.",o="回到凯尔达隆的马杜克镇长那里，把禁锢灵魂的遗物交给他。",oEN="Return to Magistrate Marduke in Caer Darrow. Show him the Soulbound Keepsake.",p="你完成了我交给你的任务了吗？",pEN="Have you done the impossible?",c="我刚才还在担心你无法活着从那里出来……",cEN="I was certain that you would be joining me as another hapless spirit."}
Q[5466]={d="你还有最后一个任务必须去完成，$n——到巫妖莱斯·霜语的巢穴中去击败他。\n\n使用禁锢灵魂的遗物的力量来对付他——千万不要心存任何怜悯，否则倒下的就会是你！不要因为痛苦而屈服！\n\n当仪式完成之后，他就不再是一个不死之身了。那时你必须尽快杀死他，把他的头颅给我拿回来。",dEN="There is but one task remaining, <name>. Confront the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, in his lair.\n\nUse the power of the keepsake against the beast - be unrelenting in your actions! Weather the blows that the flailing beast will surely bring down upon you. Do not give in to the pain!\n\nWhen the ritual is complete, Ras will be mortal once more. It is at that point that he must be slain. Strike him down and take his human head.",o="在通灵学院里找到莱斯·霜语。当你找到他之后，使用禁锢灵魂的遗物破除其亡灵的外壳。如果你成功地破除了他的不死之身，就杀掉他并拿到莱斯·霜语的头颅。把那个头颅交给马杜克镇长。",oEN="Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.",p="你肩负着为上万个永不安息的灵魂复仇的责任，$n。",pEN="You carry the burden of ten thousand restless souls, <name>.",c="一万个灵魂齐声呼喊，$n！你给天灾军团和他们的主人造成了致命一击。",cEN="Ten thousand souls cry out in unison, <name>! You have struck a mortal blow to the Scourge and their masters."}
Q[5481]={d="主人要草。我们手太大，不会摘。你帮忙，我们不打你。我们需要幽暗草。这里很多，路边也有。\n\n你有幽暗草，就带给布瑞尔墓地的霍兰德主人。|n",dEN="Master want weeds. Us gots big hands and not good at picking. You help us and we not hurt you. Us need gloom weed. Many weeds around here and near road.\n\nWhen you have gloom weed you take to Master Holland in Brill graveyard.",o="收集3根阴暗草，把它们交给布瑞尔墓地的初级药剂师霍兰德。",oEN="Collect 3 Gloom Weed and deliver them to Junior Apothecary Holland in the Brill graveyard.",p="那个没用的憎恶在哪里？要是你还没拿到我要的东西，就赶快给我去找。",pEN="Where's that useless abomination? Either you have what I need or you'd best get out there and find it.",c="这是什么？阴暗草？！我不需要阴暗草！那堆没脑子的臭肉一边在外面乱转，一边让天知道多少个像你这样的废物也跟着他犯傻。我并不想冒犯你。\n\n好吧，既然你已经来了，那也就这样了……我想我不会浪费时间来跟那堆烂肉说清楚我到底要什么，你去办就行了——我要的是末日草！",cEN="What's this? Gloom weed?! I've no need for gloom weed! That mindless mass of flesh is out there picking daisies and convincing the Lady knows how many dupes like you into doing the same. No offense.\n\nVery well, you're here now and that's all that matters. Since I'm not going to bother to try to explain things to that abomination how about you collect what I really need... doom weed!"}
Q[5482]={d="你看到我所处的困境的吧，$n？那个蠢货弄来的野草根本不是我要的！如果你能给我弄些末日草来，我会回报你的。\n\n据我所知，那些野草一般生长在布瑞尔墓地北面。快去吧，小心那儿的豺狼人。",dEN="So you can see the predicament that I'm in, <name>. That thing is out there collecting the wrong weeds! I'll make it worth your while to gather what I need. Bring back to me enough doom weed and I'll give you a suitable reward.\n\nIt is my understanding that they like to plague the flora near the mass gravesite, to the north of the Brill graveyard. Hurry and be mindful of the gnolls in the area.",o="收集 10 株末日草，交给初级药剂师霍兰德。|n",oEN="Collect 10 Doom Weed and deliver them back to Junior Apothecary Holland.",p="嗯，你收集到我要的末日草了吗？",pEN="This had better be good. I trust you have all of the doom weed that I require?",c="啊，我的末日草，很好！\n\n<初级药剂师霍兰德贪婪地揉搓着双手。>\n\n这会非常有用。你为我，呃，我是说黑暗女王，做了一件大事。这是先前承诺的回报。",cEN="Ah, my doom weed. Excellent!\n\n<Junior Apothecary Holland rubs his hands together greedily>\n\nThese will come in quite handy. You've done me, uh, the Lady, a fine service today <name>. As promised here is the reward that you deserve."}
Q[5501]={d="我们正坐在一座金矿上，你知道吗，一座金矿！科多兽骨将永远改变这个世界……我的顾客可以用它们来制作家具、乐器，甚至是火药。\n\n有一个车队经常到这儿来，收集一大堆科多兽骨，然后在葬影村把它们卖掉。如果你能去到南边的那座科多墓地去给我弄十根科多兽骨回来，我就付你报酬。怎么样？",dEN="We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them.\n\nThere's a caravan that comes by and picks up my kodo bones and then sells them at Shadowprey Village. If you can travel to the kodo graveyard south of here and bring me ten kodo bones, I'll give you something in return. Is it a deal?",o="从科多墓地收集10根科多兽骨，把它们交给兽人小屋的比布里·弗斯巴克。",oEN="Bring 10 Kodo Bones from the Kodo Graveyard to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut.",p="你弄到科多兽骨吗？车队随时都会来的。我只需要十根科多兽骨就可以达到我事业的巅峰。事业的巅峰，你明白吗？！",pEN="Do you have the bones? The caravan will be here any moment. I need just ten more kodo bones to reach a career high. A career high, I tell you!",c="啊，好极了！科多兽骨！\n\n我仿佛已经看到自己的肖像被印在 《地精周刊》的封面上了。我会成为世界上最富有的地精……我的体育老师当年还曾说我会一事无成哪。",cEN="Ah, goodie! My bones!\n\nI can't wait till the chaps at home see my face on the front cover of Goblin'preneur. I'll be the richest goblin in the world... and my physical education teacher said I would never amount to anything."}
Q[5502]={d="你对我真好，$n。我从没想过儿童周能玩得这么开心。谢谢你。\n\n我真希望所有孤儿都有运气看到我们看到的这些东西。我们再去把布拉斯·波提米尔找来，给他买一个泡沫剑展示架好不好？我想他还在大街上推着那辆小车呢。这样孤儿院里的每个人都能玩点有趣的了！\n\n之后，我就该回家了，$g真的:真的;。",dEN="You have been so very kind to me, <name>. I never dreamed that I'd have so much fun during Children's Week. Thank you. I won't be sad about what's happened to me - my parents always told me to rise above anything bad that happens. I'll be a hero... just like you.\n\nI'm sad to say this, but it's time for me to go home. Let's go back and I'll tell the matron what an awesome person you are!",o="回到奥格瑞玛，把兽人孤儿哨交还给荣誉谷的孤儿监护员巴特维尔。",oEN="Return your ward to the Orgrimmar orphanage by handing in the Orcish Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Battlewail in the Valley of Honor.",p="很高兴再次见到你，$n。你在儿童周报名做$g志愿者:志愿者;时承诺的那些职责，都履行了吗？",pEN="It is a pleasure to see you again, <name>. Have you attended to the duties you've volunteered for during Children's Week?",c="愿灵魂保佑你，$n。你为格伦斯做的事，比大多数人能想到的都要多。谢谢你——你完美地诠释了成为一名部落$g英雄:英雄;的意义。\n\n拜托，如果你有空，就回来看看我们。我知道格伦斯会喜欢的，我也是。\n\n格伦斯和你玩得很开心，$n，他想把自己最喜欢的宠物之一送给你，好让你别忘了他。",cEN="May the spirits bless you, <name>. You've done more for Grunth than most would ever think of doing for him. Thank you - you're the epitome of what it means to be a hero of the Horde.\n\nPlease - if you can spare the time, come back and visit us. I know that Grunth would like that, as would I."}
Q[5503]={c="所有以银色黎明之名与邪恶战斗的勇士都必须佩戴我们的委任徽记，这样你们就可以向我们的军需官领取奖赏。\n\n在受到委任之后，你就可以从天灾军团士兵的尸体上收集天灾石，那是他们身份和职位的证明。将你收集到的天灾石交给我，每套天灾石都可用来换取一枚勇气和荣耀的象征——银色黎明勇气徽记。\n\n实现你的价值，$c，今天就加入与天灾军团作战的行列！",cEN="All who fight evil on behalf of the Argent Dawn must don our commission. Wearing such will earn your right to claim rewards our quartermasters have to offer.\n\nWhile under commission, you'll be able to acquire Scourgestones from slain Scourge; these are marks of insignia that they sometimes possess. Procure these insignia and bring them to me. For each set you turn in, you will receive our marker of heroism - the Argent Dawn Valor Token.\n\nAchieve your destiny, <class> join the fight today!"}
Q[5504]={d="你为银色黎明所做的贡献值得赞扬，$n。你已经成了我们当中$g受尊敬的一员:受尊敬的一员;。我已被授权向你开放银色黎明最珍贵的物品之一——我们的魔法抗性披风。\n\n把一件披风附到你的护肩上，就能以五种可能形式中的一种提升你对魔法力量的抗性。作为你对我们事业忠诚奉献的象征，我要求你至少交出十枚勇气徽记，才能获得这些披风。",dEN="Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, <name>. You are truly revered amongst us. I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.\n\nApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways. As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.",o="把10个银色黎明勇气勋章交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的银色黎明军需官哈萨娜。",oEN="Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Hasana at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="啊，高尚的$C！你带来我所要求的银色黎明勇气勋章了吗？只要你把它们交给我，我就可以向你提供各种各样的披肩了。",pEN="Ah, noble <class>! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.",c="太好了！你对银色黎明做出的贡献必将永载史册，$n。你完成了我的要求，现在我很高兴能为你提供我们的披肩。只要你一直保持在银色黎明中的声望，你就可以从任何银色黎明军需官那里购买到这些披肩。\n\n我的$g兄弟:姐妹，为了银色黎明而战！",cEN="Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, <name>. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.\n\nFor the Dawn, my brother!"}
Q[5505]={p="好了，给你，$n——这就是骷髅钥匙。我很确定它能打开通灵学院的大门。不过只有一个办法能检验它，我说，你就别在我这浪费时间了。",pEN="Well, here you are, <name> - the completed Skeleton Key. I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance. There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though. Waste no time in trying it out, I say.",c="好了，给你，$n——这就是完整的骷髅钥匙。我尽可能确信这把钥匙能让你进入通灵学院。不过只有一种办法能完全确定它管用。听我一句劝，别在我这儿浪费时间，快去试试吧。\n\n祝你好运，$g强大的英雄:强大的英雄;。愿你继续把圣光带进黑暗之中！",cEN="Well, here you are, <name> - the completed Skeleton Key. I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance. There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though. Waste no time in trying it out, I say.\n\nGood luck, mighty hero. May your victories continue to bring you fame and power as you lay waste to Scholomance!"}
Q[5507]={d="你为银色黎明所做的贡献值得赞扬，$n。你已经成了我们当中$g受尊敬的一员:受尊敬的一员;。我已被授权向你开放银色黎明最珍贵的物品之一——我们的魔法抗性披风。\n\n把一件披风附到你的护肩上，就能以五种可能形式中的一种提升你对魔法力量的抗性。作为你对我们事业忠诚奉献的象征，我要求你至少交出十枚勇气徽记，才能获得这些披风。",dEN="Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, <name>. You are truly revered amongst us. I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.\n\nApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways. As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.",o="把10个银色黎明勇气勋章交给西瘟疫之地冰风营地的银色黎明军需官莱斯巴克。",oEN="Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Lightspark at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="啊，高尚的$C！你带来我所要求的银色黎明勇气勋章了吗？只要你把它们交给我，我就可以向你提供各种各样的披肩了。",pEN="Ah, noble <class>! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.",c="太好了！你对银色黎明做出的贡献必将永载史册，$n。你完成了我的要求，现在我很高兴能为你提供我们的披肩。只要你一直保持在银色黎明中的声望，你就可以从任何银色黎明军需官那里购买到这些披肩。\n\n我的$g兄弟:姐妹，为了银色黎明而战！",cEN="Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, <name>. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.\n\nFor the Dawn, my brother!"}
Q[5508]={p="堕落者的天灾石是天灾军团将领的标志。那些统御天灾军团的将领总是会随身携带一块这样的徽记。如果能杀掉如此强大可怕的敌人对银色黎明和我们的正义事业来说都是非常有利的！\n\n如果你能拿来一块这样的天灾石，我会代表银色黎明颁发一枚勇气徽记给你。不过你要小心，$n——你要面对的绝非一般的敌人。",pEN="A Corruptor's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's overlords. A powerful being that holds a position of authority over the Scourge will always possess one. To slay such a malevolent creature would surely advance the cause of the Argent Dawn, and all good causes!\n\nOn behalf of the Argent Dawn, I will give you a valor token in exchange for just a single one of these insignia. Use caution in acquiring one, <name> - such powerful beings are not to be trifled with.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n这足以证明你是个甘愿为正义事业献身的英雄。我们会表彰一切与天灾军团抗争的勇士，但是击败他们的领袖才是真正给了他们一个迎头痛击！\n\n为了黎明而战，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nTo acquire a valor token in such a manner indicates that you are a true hero in the cause of good. We value all effort brought to bear against the Scourge, but to take down one of their leaders is to truly deliver onto them a crushing defeat!\n\nFor the Dawn, my <brother/sister>!"}
Q[5509]={p="侵略者的天灾石是天灾军团精英部队的象征，通常是由那些部署在瘟疫之地的主力部队中的士兵携带的。斩杀这样的敌人对你来说是一个挑战，但是你也会因此得到丰厚的奖赏。\n\n如果你能拿来十块这样的天灾石，银色黎明就将给你颁发一枚勇气徽记。",pEN="An Invader's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's elite troops. These are sometimes found on the stronger of the troops positioned in the Plaguelands. Slaying such a creature is indeed a challenge, but one that should be relished with a commission to vanquish evil.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for ten of these insignia. Bring them to me here, and I will make sure you receive your just reward.",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n我们每向你这样的勇士颁发一枚勇气勋章，就说明我们在这场对抗天灾军团的战争中又取得了一点进展。只要有更多的英雄加入我们的行列，银色黎明终将剿灭这支无比邪恶的势力。我希望你在今天表现出来的过人勇气也能一直持续到胜利时刻的到来！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nEach valor token handed out to worthy recipients is a sign of the tide turning against the Scourge. With more and more heroes fighting the Scourge in their own lands, the Argent Dawn will assuredly be at the forefront when the time comes to wage war on the ultimate evil of the Scourge. I hope that the valor you've shown what it took to acquiring your token will carry the day then as well!"}
Q[5510]={p="爪牙的天灾石是天灾军团基层的徽记。有时可以在瘟疫之地驻扎的较弱部队身上找到它们，不过“较弱”这个词当然要视情况而定。无论在哪里，天灾军团都绝不该被低估。\n\n目前银色黎明正在用一枚勇气徽记换取二十枚这样的徽记——只要你有足够的天灾石，我非常乐意做这笔交易！\"\"",pEN="A Minion's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge rank and file. These are sometimes found on the weaker of their troops positioned in the Plaguelands, though the term \"weaker\" is certainly to be considered in context. The Scourge, no matter where they are, should never be underestimated.\n\nThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for twenty of these insignia - an exchange I'm happy to do, provided you have earned enough scourgestones!",c="恭喜你，$n——我很高兴为你颁发这枚勇气勋章！\n\n勇气勋章有两个用途:它可以让你与银色黎明的关系更加亲密，这是对你奋力作战的表彰你也可以凭这枚勋章再加上一点钱，到我们的军需官那里换取一些宝贵的物品。\n\n无论你决定怎样使用这枚勇气勋章，它都是你用血汗赢得的，干得不错！",cEN="Congratulations, <name> - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!\n\nThe tokens serve two purposes. One - they can be used to further your standing within the Argent Dawn; to do so may avail you options and rewards that are reserved for our honored and revered allies. Two - they can be given to our quartermasters, along with coin, as payment for some of the Dawn's more prized items.\n\nWhatever you decide, know that you are earning your commission. Well done!"}
Q[5511]={p="好了，给你，$n——这就是骷髅钥匙。我很确定它能打开通灵学院的大门。不过只有一个办法能检验它，我说，你就别在我这浪费时间了。",pEN="Well, here you are, <name> - the completed Skeleton Key. I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance. There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though. Waste no time in trying it out, I say.",c="好了，给你，$n——这就是完整的骷髅钥匙。我尽可能确信这把钥匙能让你进入通灵学院。不过只有一种办法能完全确定它管用。听我一句劝，别在我这儿浪费时间，快去试试吧。\n\n祝你好运，$g强大的英雄:强大的英雄;。愿你继续把圣光带进黑暗之中！",cEN="Well, here you are, <name> - the completed Skeleton Key. I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance. There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though. Waste no time in trying it out, I say.\n\nGood luck, mighty hero. May your victories continue to bring you fame and power as you lay waste to Scholomance!"}
Q[5513]={d="你为银色黎明所做的贡献值得赞扬，$n。你已经成了我们当中$g受尊敬的一员:受尊敬的一员;。我已被授权向你开放银色黎明最珍贵的物品之一——我们的魔法抗性披风。\n\n把一件披风附到你的护肩上，就能以五种可能形式中的一种提升你对魔法力量的抗性。作为你对我们事业忠诚奉献的象征，我要求你至少交出十枚勇气徽记，才能获得这些披风。",dEN="Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, <name>. You are truly revered amongst us. I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.\n\nApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways. As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.",o="把10个银色黎明勇气勋章交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需官米兰达·布利洛克。",oEN="Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Breechlock at Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.",p="啊，高尚的$C！你带来我所要求的银色黎明勇气勋章了吗？只要你把它们交给我，我就可以向你提供各种各样的披肩了。",pEN="Ah, noble <class>! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.",c="太好了！你对银色黎明做出的贡献必将永载史册，$n。你完成了我的要求，现在我很高兴能为你提供我们的披肩。只要你一直保持在银色黎明中的声望，你就可以从任何银色黎明军需官那里购买到这些披肩。\n\n我的$g兄弟:姐妹，为了银色黎明而战！",cEN="Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, <name>. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.\n\nFor the Dawn, my brother!"}
Q[5514]={d="你要找的地精的名字叫做克林科·古德斯迪尔。他在塔纳利斯的加基森镇里生活，为出价最高的顾客效力。看来他是唯一个可以帮我们完成融合工序的铁匠，不过他的标价会非常高，所以你来解决他的工钱。\n\n我是个炼金师，不是个银行家。如果我有一堆金子的话，还待在这里干什么？\n\n我相信我已经把事情说得很直白了，咳咳。\n\n加基森在等待你！祝你好运！",dEN="The goblin you will need to speak with is Krinkle Goodsteel. He peddles his skills to the highest bidder in Gadgetzan, within the Tanaris desert. He'll likely be the only one who can produce the mold we need, and his services won't come cheap. We now ask for you to dig deep by footing whatever fee he will charge.\n\nI'm an apothecary, not a banker. If I had gold lying around, I certainly wouldn't be here.\n\nI guess I said the quiet part out loud again. Oops.\n\nGadgetzan awaits you! Good luck!",o="把灌魔的骸骨碎片和15枚金币交给加基森的克林科·古德斯迪尔。",oEN="Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan.",p="嗯，我知道你是谁，我也知道你来这里干什么。阿尔比顿在你来之前就跟我说过了。让我们长话短说吧，怎么样？\n\n我确实有可以用来制作骷髅钥匙的模具，但是它非常贵——15个金币，现货，不二价。我会把骸骨碎片放进模具里交给你，我也会教你如何铸造钥匙，即使你连一点锻造的相关知识都没有……这些都是免费的。\n\n谁说商人都是唯利是图的！",pEN="Yeah, I know who you are, and I know why you're here. Dithers sent word to me before you arrived. Let's cut to deal at hand, now shall we?\n\nI've got a mold you can use for the skeleton key, but it will cost you - fifteen gold, up front, no negotiation. I'll pack the skeletal fragments into the mold for you, and I'll also teach you on how to forge the stem of the key without any knowledge of blacksmithing... all free of charge no less.\n\nWho says mercenaries don't offer competitive deals!",c="阿尔比顿说你会把东西送过来，那就拿出来吧！让我把碎片和模具放在一起。\n\n阿尔比顿已经给它们附过魔法了？很好……否则的话，你就得再跑一趟冰风岗了。",cEN="Dithers said you'd deliver the goods, and deliver you have! A deal is a deal; let me pack the fragments into the mold for you.\n\nDid Dithers imbue them already? Excellent... otherwise, it would have been a long trip back to the Bulwark for you."}
Q[5515]={d="$n，你帮我去掉了压在心上的一块大石头，但是你的任务还没有完成。卡斯迪诺夫的主人基尔图诺斯还活着。\n\n在你面对基尔图诺斯之前，必须先找到召唤他的方法。\n\n据说詹迪斯·巴罗夫负责将卡斯迪诺夫收集的无辜者之血交给基尔图诺斯。\n\n到通灵学院中那个沉没的墓穴里去找到她，打败她。把你找到的线索拿回来交给我。",dEN="A great weight has been lifted from our hearts, <name>, but your task is not yet complete. Krastinov's master, Kirtonos, still lives.\n\nBefore you may face Kirtonos, however, you must first secure a method in which to summon him.\n\nIt is said that Jandice Barov stewards the blood of innocents from Krastinov to Kirtonos.\n\nFind her in the sunken catacombs of Scholomance and strike her down. Bring back any clues that you may find.",o="在通灵学院找到詹迪斯·巴罗夫并打败她。从她的尸体上找到卡斯迪诺夫的恐惧之袋，然后将其交给艾瓦·萨克霍夫。",oEN="Locate Jandice Barov in the Scholomance and destroy her. From her corpse recover Krastinov's Bag of Horrors. Return the bag to Eva Sarkhoff.",p="<艾瓦若隐若现。>",pEN="<Eva fades in and out of focus.>",c="是恐惧之袋！",cEN="The bag of horrors!"}
Q[5518]={d="如果你想要和那个笨蛋食人魔国王作战，那么首先你必须通过克罗卡斯那一关。好吧，你当然可以杀了他，但实际上你也可以留他一条命。\n\n你问我该怎么做？嗯，你真好运，，我想我知道如何制作一件可以把你伪装成食人魔的服装，用来迷惑那些四肢发达的笨蛋。唯一的问题可能就是稳定性——这种衣服的持续时间最多为10分钟。把我需要的东西给我拿来，然后我就可以帮你做一件。我就等在这里……",dEN="If you're going to fight the king of this dump - and I think that's what you're bound to do - then you're going to need to get by Captain Kromcrush. Now, you can get by him by killing him, sure. You might actually want to leave him alive.\n\nHow, you ask? Since I've been here, I think I know how to make an ogre suit that will last just long enough to fool these bozos. The only problem is stability - ten minutes tops. Bring me what I need, and I'll make you one. I'm not going anywhere...",o="把4份符文布卷、8块硬甲皮、2卷符文线和一份食人魔鞣酸交给诺特·希姆加克。他现在被拴在厄运之槌的戈多克食人魔那边。",oEN="Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack. He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.",p="我制作巨魔装所需要的材料中，巨魔鞣酸也许是最难找到的——我想也许你可以在这里的楼上找到一些？不过很难说，因为我被拴在这里寸步难行……\n\n不管怎样，把我需要的东西给我拿来，我就会帮你制作一件巨魔装，然后你就可以用它来欺骗克罗卡斯，因为他会以为你是自己人。",pEN="The Ogre Tannin is probably the toughest thing to find for what I need to make the suit - I think they have some upstairs? It's hard to tell, since this ball and chain doesn't make movement that easy to do...\n\nAnyway, bring me the things I need, and I'll whip you up an ogre suit that will fool Captain Kromcrush into thinking you're one of his men.",c="嗯，这样就行了。这里塞一塞，那里掖一掖……嘿嘿，肯定管用得很！<被锁链拴着的哥布林脸上绽开灿烂的笑容。>\n\n好了，你准备好了。但记住，这可不是世上做工最牢靠的东西。它只能用十分钟，然后就会散架，到那时你可骗不了任何人！在靠近他之前不久再穿上它，还有记住，它只会让他以为你是$g他的盟友:他的盟友;，可不是他的$g好朋友:好朋友;，$g真的:真的;！",cEN="Yeah, this will do the trick. Just a slip here, and tuck here... heh - this is going to work out just fine! <A broad smile beams from the chained goblin's face.>\n\nHere you go, you're all set. Remember- this isn't the most securely fashioned item in the world. You'll have ten minutes of use before it falls apart, and then you're not going to fool anybody! Try using it just before you approach him, and remember... it only will make him think that YOU are an ally - not your group mates!"}
Q[5519]={p="还要一件？好吧，看起来我一时半会也没法出去，那么你就像上次那样把材料给我拿来，我帮你把衣服做好。",pEN="Need another suit, do ya? Well, I'm not going anywhere soon it seems - bring me the same things I asked for from before, and I'll make you another ogre suit.",c="好了，$n——穿上这个，你就变成一个巨魔啦！祝你好运！\n\n哦，对了，如果你碰巧找到可以打开这个镣铐的钥匙，无论如何都要告诉我！",cEN="Here ya go <name> - put this thing on, and you'll have ten minutes to do whatever. Good luck!\n\nOh, and if you happen to find a key to get me out of here, BY ALL MEANS LET ME KNOW!!!"}
Q[5522]={d="我从我的主人维克图斯那里收到了一个消息。好吧，其实不是从维克图斯那里来的……是来自于一个名叫莱尼德·巴萨罗梅的人。我不认识他，但是他认识我的主人。你要知道，除非我的主人允许，否则你是根本无从结识他的。\n\n他说维克图斯需要龙蛋，因此它要你把它们送到东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂去。\n\n这真让我恼火！为什么？难道维克图斯不相信我吗？哦，不要介意这些……把蛋交给莱尼德，告诉他我已经完成了主人的命令。",dEN="I received a message from my master, Vectus. Well, the message wasn't really from Vectus...it was from someone named Leonid Barthalomew. I don't know Leonid, but he knew my master, and no one knows my master unless he allows it.\n\nLeonid says Vectus wants the dragon eggs. He wants you to deliver them to him at the Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nThat hurts! Why you? Doesn't Vectus trust me? Oh, never mind... just take the eggs and tell Leonid that I did what our master commanded.",o="把冰冻的龙蛋交给东瘟疫之地的莱尼德·巴萨罗梅。",oEN="Bring the Frozen Eggs to Leonid Barthalomew in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你就是在黑石塔里捣鬼的那个，对吧？我要的东西你带来了吗，$g真的:真的;？",pEN="You are the one up to mischief in Blackrock Spire, yes? Do you have what I asked for?",c="啊，很好。你不知道自己一直在为多么邪恶的力量效力，但现在你会知道真相了。别害怕，我不是那位主人的仆人。我是莱尼德·巴萨罗梅，银色黎明的同胞们称我为“受尊敬的”。\n\n我骗丁奇把你和那些龙蛋送到我这里来。我的计谋成功了，这很好，因为如果这些蛋送到了预定的目的地，一股强大的力量就会落入敌人手中。\"\"",cEN="Ah, very good. You do not know the evil power for whom you have labored, but now you will know the truth. And fear not--I am no servant of that master. I am Leonid Barthalomew, known as \"the Revered\" to my brethren in the Argent Dawn.\n\nI tricked Tinkee into sending you and the dragon eggs to me. And it is good that my trick was successful, for had these eggs reached their intended destination, a great power would have fallen into the hands of the enemy."}
Q[5525]={p="我说的是戈多克镣铐钥匙——好吧，那些胖家伙是这么叫它的。任何巨魔都有可能拿着这把钥匙，不过我不清楚到底谁拿着它。没准那些卫兵是负责看管钥匙的……\n\n啊呀，我到底在想什么？你已经拿到钥匙了，对吧？",pEN="It's called the Gordok Shackle Key - well, that's what these \"tons o' fun\" keep calling it. I think any of the ogres might have it, but I'm not sure if any specific ones do. Maybe the guards have a better chance of having one...\n\nWhat am I talking about - you have it already, don't you?! Is that it there??!",c="你——是第一名。其他所有人——都排在第二或更低。哦，谢谢你救我出来！\n\n我就知道我的命不该只是成为某个食人魔的开胃菜，$g真的:真的;！",cEN="You - ranked number one. Everyone else - ranked number two or lower. Oh, thank you for freeing me!\n\nI knew my life was destined for more than just being an appetizer to some ogre!"}
Q[5526]={d="你对于埃雷萨拉斯——厄运之槌——的知识现在要派上用场了，$n。在那座城市的遗迹的东部区域，奥兹恩正在散播着自己的堕落力量。去那里击败所有胆敢挑战你的敌人。\n\n奥兹恩身边应该有一些丰饶之果，它们已经被堕落的力量腐蚀，变成了魔藤。在你干掉他之后，采集一块魔藤的精华，把它装在净化之匣里，然后带回来交给我。\n\n祝你好运，塞纳留斯保佑你快去快回。",dEN="Your knowledge of Eldre'Thalas - Dire Maul - in Feralas will now come into play, <name>. In the eastern part of the ruined city is where Alzzin the Wildshaper has exerted his corrupt dominion. Go there with all due haste and brave whatever challenges await you.\n\nThe Fruit of Fertility, now corrupted as the Felvine, should be close to Alzzin. When he falls, capture whatever essence of the Felvine you can. Seal it in the Reliquary, and bring it to me.\n\nGood luck, and Cenarion's speed.",o="在厄运之槌中找到魔藤，然后从它上面采集一块碎片。只有干掉了奥兹恩之后，你才能进行采集工作。使用净化之匣安全地封印碎片，然后将其交给月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·萨图纳。",oEN="Find the Felvine in Dire Maul and acquire a shard from it. Chances are you'll only be able to procure one with the demise of Alzzin the Wildshaper. Use the Reliquary of Purity to securely seal the shard inside, and return it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade.",p="拿到净化之匣后，我们不仅可以从世界上消除一股堕落的力量，而且可以谨慎理智地对其进行研究。也许我们可以找到与威胁艾泽拉斯的堕落力量抗衡的新方法。\n\n我知道米利会得到它的……",pEN="With the Sealed Reliquary of Purity in our possession, it will be possible not only to remove a corrupting threat from the world but also to study it under our judicious watch. Perhaps we can even devise new means to combat the taint of corruption that ever threatens Azeroth.\n\nI know Milli would have had it no other way...",c="塞纳里奥议会欠你一份情，$c，因为你帮助我们赢得了这场对抗敌人的战斗。\n\n请收下这个，作为议会的感激与敬意的象征，$n。",cEN="It is done, brave <class>, and with that the Cenarion Circle is in your debt. Though the war is far from over, a great battle has been won against those who would bring about our doom.\n\nPlease - accept this as a token of our enduring gratitude. Know that you are welcomed here as a hero of the Cenarion Circle for your great deed, <name>. Thank you."}
Q[5527]={d="第一步是要找到一个可以容纳堕落物质而不受其影响的容器。我所能想到的只有一件可以容纳魔藤的东西：净化之匣。\n\n在希利苏斯有一处暗夜精灵的南风村，我知道很久很久以前那里曾有一个净化之匣。如果我们想要成功的话，我希望你先去那边的废墟中找到它。",dEN="The first step is to find a container capable of holding an extremely corruptible substance without the handler suffering ill effects. There is only one sort device I am aware of that could possibly contain something as vile as the Felvine: a Reliquary of Purity.\n\nDeep in the wasteland of Silithus is the remnants of the night elf village known as Southwind. I know one was there many, many years ago. If we are to succeed, I need you to scour those ruins in the hopes of reclaiming it.",o="到希利苏斯的南风村去寻找净化之匣。然后将其交给月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·萨图纳。",oEN="Travel to Silithus and search for a Reliquary of Purity within the ruins of Southwind Village. If you are able to find it, return with it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade.",p="净化之匣本身就是一件神器。最初制造出来的净化之匣数量不多，随着时间的推移，其数量越来越少。\n\n我承认，很早之前我就知道南风村中的那个净化之匣的存在了。老实说，随着希利苏斯不断出现新的混乱状况，我希望你能把这个秘密一直保持下去。过多地泄露这个秘密将会引起敌人更多的怀疑。\n\n啊，看来和平时期又要结束了，尤其是当埃德萨拉斯处于当前这种情况下的时候。",pEN="A Reliquary of Purity is an artifact unto itself. Few were ever made, and almost all of them were thought to have been lost over time.\n\nI admit I have known about the one in Southwind for a little while now. Honestly, with the rising turmoil in Silithus, I thought to keep our secrets just that - a secret. To poke and prod would only cause suspicions of our enemies to rise.\n\nAlas, the time for complacency is at an end, especially with the situation in Eldre'Thalas.",c="关于你的传闻果然不假；塞纳里奥议会有你在为我们效力，真是幸运。\n\n圣物匣重新回到我们手中，我的心也安定了下来。我对你所做的一切怀着永恒的感激……",cEN="Indeed, you are as resourceful as many claim. The Cenarion Circle is blessed to have you working in our stead.\n\nWith the Reliquary once more in our hands, my mind is at ease. I feel more comfortable asking you to not only face down a malfeasant demon, but also to bring back a dangerous item in the process..."}
Q[5528]={c="现在你是$g大老板了:大老板了;，所以你能免费尝到我的好酒！这些酒能让你精神振奋，还让你痛快上头！这可都是好货，$g老板:老板;。尝尝吧，然后自己告诉克里格！",cEN="You da big boss now, so you get free sample of my better brews! These drinks boost you up AND give you good buzz! These are da good ones, chief... you try and tell Kreeg yourself!"}
Q[5529]={d="银色黎明得到消息，据说亡灵天灾正在制造它们自己的瘟疫之龙！我们必须阻止他们——如果亡灵天灾得到了龙的力量，那么他们必将横扫艾泽拉斯！\n\n他们的亡灵巫师正在达隆米尔湖中间的通灵学院里繁殖瘟疫之龙。\n\n到通灵学院去，尽可能多地摧毁龙崽……别让它们长大！",dEN="The Argent Dawn recently learned that the Scourge are creating their own plagued dragonflight! We must stop them -- if the Scourge gain a force of dragons they'll sweep across Azeroth unchecked!\n\nTheir necromancers are breeding plagued dragons at the Scholomance, in the middle of Darrowmere Lake.\n\nGo to the Scholomance and kill as many hatchlings as you can... before they get any bigger!",o="杀掉20只瘟疫龙崽，然后向圣光之愿礼拜堂的贝蒂娜·比格辛克复命。",oEN="Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel.",p="到通灵学院去，$n。一定要在那些龙崽长大之前干掉它们！",pEN="Get to the Scholomance, <name>. Take out those plagued hatchlings before they grow!",c="干得好，$n！他们再培养下一批龙还需要花费很长时间。\n\n……好吧，至少我希望如此！",cEN="Well done, <name>! It'll be a long time before they can grow another clutch of dragons.\n\n...At least, I hope it will!"}
Q[5531]={d="你带来的那些蛋本要被用于亡灵天灾制造瘟疫飞龙的试验中。这些冰冻的黑龙卵在他们的研究中有巨大的价值，也会毫无疑问地加快他们的时间表。\n\n现在，是我们结束他们研究的时候了。\n\n把这些冰冻的卵带给外面的贝蒂娜·比格辛克。她在科学和炼金术方面造诣很深，而且她还制造了一种我们可以用来对付亡灵天灾的武器。有了你的帮助，我们将会给他们一个沉重的打击。",dEN="The eggs you brought were to be used in Scourge experiments to create a plagued dragonflight. These frozen black dragon eggs would have been invaluable in their studies, and would have assuredly quickened their timetable.\n\nNow, it is time we ended their research.\n\nTake the frozen eggs to Betina Bigglezink outside. She is well-learned in science and alchemy, and has produced a weapon we can use against the Scourge. With your help, we will deal them a heavy blow.",o="将冰冻的龙蛋交给贝蒂娜·比格辛克。",oEN="Bring the Frozen Eggs to Betina Bigglezink.",p="你好，$n！我听说你带来一些龙蛋？嗯，快让我看看！",pEN="Hello, <name>! I heard you were here with some dragon eggs? Well, let's see them!",c="啊，真是龙蛋！而且还装在这么漂亮的容器里！完美无缺！\n\n我们要把这些蛋放在安全的地方，便于日后研究，但当前我们得让它们保持原样。\n\n我制造了一个具有特殊功能的装置，可以用来消灭通灵学院里的不死生物学者。他们正在对龙类进行研究，想要制造出一支瘟疫之龙军团来，我们必须阻止他们！\n\n我把这一装置叫做黎明先锋，不过……我不敢肯定它是否真的有用！\n\n你能去帮我们试验一下吗？",cEN="There they are! And in such a nice container. The perfect size!\n\nWe'll keep these eggs in a safe place so we can study them later, but right now we need that thing you brought them in.\n\nI have created a device with a very specific use: to destroy the undead scholars of the Scholomance. They are studying dragons in their efforts to create a plagued dragonflight, and we must halt their progress.\n\nI call the device Dawn's Gambit, because... I'm not sure if it works!\n\nWill you find out for us?"}
Q[5533]={d="通灵学院坐落在凯尔达隆岛上，这所学校是亡灵天灾的一座堡垒。我们的敌人就聚居在那里，安全地进行研究并不断增强他们的力量。有一扇坚固的大门封住了唯一的入口，如果没有一把合适的钥匙，我们无论如何都无法通过它。\n\n化学家阿尔比顿一直以来都负责与通灵学院有关的事务，他应该知道如何才能获得那把钥匙。你应该向我证明你确实有存在的价值，现在我把这个任务交给你，去跟阿尔比顿谈谈关于这件事的详细情况吧。",dEN="On the island of Caer Darrow lies Scholomance - a wretched center of Scourge necromancy and evil. Our enemy dwells within, conducting unspeakable acts of depravity on unwitting victims... at least, we surmise as much. A door bars the way, and try as we might no entry is to be had without a proper key.\n\nAlchemist Arbington is well versed on Scholomance, and has an idea how to obtain a key. You have proved your worth to me, and now I entrust this task to you. Speak with him on this matter.",o="和西瘟疫之地冰风岗的化学家阿尔比顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",c="幸会，$c。我最近的研究有很大一部分都投入到了通灵学院上，我想我知道取得一把钥匙的办法……一把能让你穿过前门的钥匙。\n\n我只能想象里面会看到多么可怕的景象，$n。我不知道你们这些$g英雄:英雄;是怎么做到的……",cEN="Well met, <class>. I've dedicated a fair portion of my recent studies to the Scholomance, and I believe I know a means by which you can acquire a key... one that will let you past the front door.\n\nI can only imagine what horrid sights are to be seen inside, <name>. I don't know how you heroic types do it sometimes..."}
Q[5534]={d="什么？！我真不敢相信！\n\n那还不够？你知道那些炸药有多贵吗？它们卖……唉，算了。好吧，你想赚点真正的钱吗？因为生意就是这么做的：你先证明自己是个有价值的雇员，熬过一段时间之后，自然会得到相应的回报。\n\n如果你是个“$g有价值的:有价值的;”$g雇员:雇员;，那就去埃达拉斯废墟，给我找一块那些血精灵在找的符文。据说它落到了纳迦手里。\"\"",dEN="What?! What?!\n\nThat wasn't good enough for you? You know how expensive those explosives are? They sell for... oh, nevermind. Fine, you want to make some real money? Cause that's how business is done: you prove you're a valuable employee and then you're rewarded adequately after you stick it out some.\n\nIf you're a \"valuable\" employee, then hit the Ruins of Eldarath and find me some rune that them Blood elves were lookin' for. The naga apparently have it in their possession.",o="寻找埃达拉斯废墟中的纳迦携带的那些符石，然后把它们交给艾萨拉的基姆加尔。",oEN="Find Some Rune that the naga have in their possession in the Ruins of Eldarath and return it to Kim'jael in Azshara.",p="怎么样，$n？符文在哪儿？你是个$g好雇员:好雇员;，对吧？你是来帮忙的吗？\n\n别让我重新考虑答应给你的报酬。什么？哦，我们什么都没谈定？哦，好吧……那你就慢慢来——只是要知道，拖得越久，报酬就会少得多。",pEN="Well, <name>? Where is the rune? You are a good employee, right? You're here to help?\n\nDon't make me think twice about paying you what we agreed upon. What? Oh, we didn't agree on anything? Oh, great... then take your time--just know that it'll be a lot less if you take a long time.",c="哈哈，太好了！\n\n我一定会发现这里面的秘密，还有魔导师雷姆托里——那头母牛雇佣了我——想要得到这东西的原因。哈哈！我终于比你们抢先一步了，讨厌的血精灵！基姆加尔！哈！我会让他们知道谁才是废物！\n\n干得好，$n。非常感谢。给你，拿着这些钱，然后就走吧——我很忙。",cEN="Haha! Wonderful!\n\nI'll be sure to find out what this is for and why Magus Rimtori--she's the cow that hired me--wanted it. Hah! I got you now, stinkin' Blood elves! Kim'jael! Ha! I'll teach them who the rats are!\n\nYa did good, <name>. Thanks a bundle. Here, take this coin and be off with ya--I've got some things to figure out."}
Q[5535]={d="很久之前，暗夜精灵中的上层精灵们是最优秀的魔法学徒。他们最终对暗夜精灵社会造成了很大的伤害，并且影响了艾泽拉斯世界的历史……我相信这些你都很清楚。\n\n我向那些哨兵保证要超度那些我遇见的上层精灵之魂。如果你也可以帮忙的话，我保证我会奖励你的。\n\n那些灵魂在这里东北边的影歌神殿附近游荡。",dEN="Long ago, the Highborne were some of the most powerful students of the arcane the night elves ever produced. The corruption that comes along with such studies caused much harm to night elf society and greatly affected all of Azeroth... as I'm sure you well know.\n\nI promised the Sentinels that I would release the spirits from their mortal bonds as I find them. If you would do the same, then I am sure I can reward you some.\n\nThe spirits haunt the Shadowsong Shrine to the northeast of here.",o="杀掉6个上层精灵的幻影和6个上层精灵鬼巫，然后向艾萨拉的罗哈图复命。",oEN="Destroy 6 Highborne Apparitions and 6 Highborne Lichlings before returning to Loh'atu in Azshara.",p="你搜寻精灵贵族之魂的工作进行得怎么样了，$c？\n\n有很多事情使得整个艾泽拉斯都遭受了巨大的痛苦，但是因为某些原因，这些游魂对所有人来说好像一场瘟疫。也许它们仍然还是渴望着获得魔法的力量——这种渴望最终会引来燃烧军团，我们知道这意味着什么。",pEN="How goes your search for the Highborne spirits, <class>?\n\nMany events have caused all the races of Azeroth great suffering, but for some reason, these spirits seem to be a plague for all people. Perhaps it is there continued desire for any arcane magic--such desire is a harbinger of the Burning Legion, and we know what that can lead to.",c="干得好，$c。感谢你的帮助，那些灵魂已经平静了，它们对于魔法的渴望被削弱了。\n\n艾泽拉斯大陆上的所有生灵都会感谢你的。",cEN="Well done, <class>. Thank you for your help. The spirits are at peace, and the threats that their desire for the arcane draw have been lessened.\n\nI am sure that both sides of the conflict that ravishes Azeroth will see you are above such things."}
Q[5536]={d="萨特是暗夜精灵畸形和邪恶的一面，现在他们正在玷污这片塞纳留斯曾经眷顾过的神圣之地。当提及这些恶魔的罪行时，我是不会给暗夜精灵留面子的，但是我已经向大地母亲发誓要帮助暗夜精灵除掉这些祸害。\n\n我相信你可以在净化他们的过程中证明自己的价值。\n\n在这里的东北面就是萨特的哈达尔氏族。与他们作战，然后再回到我这里来。",dEN="The satyr, a disfigured, evil aspect of the night elves, now infect the sacred lands once traveled by Cenarius. I cannot speak for the night elves when it comes to all the atrocities those demonic creatures have committed, but I have sworn an oath to the Earthmother to aid the elves in ridding the land of such a nuisance.\n\nI am sure you would prove yourself if you aided me in purging them.\n\nNortheast of here, you can find the Haldarr clan. Return to me after you've tested yourself against their power.",o="杀掉6个哈达尔萨特、2个哈达尔欺诈者和2个哈达尔魔仆，然后向灰谷与艾萨拉交界处的罗哈图复命。",oEN="Kill 6 Haldarr Satyr, 2 Haldarr Tricksters, 2 Haldarr Felsworn and then return to Loh'atu on the border of Ashenvale.",p="你和萨特的战斗进行得怎么样了，$c？\n\n他们是不是如你想象中的一般强大呢？或者更强？",pEN="How goes your battle against the satyr, <class>?\n\nAre they as strong as you thought? Stronger? Or perhaps they were nothing to your own might.",c="干得好，$c。我看你不仅$g技艺高超:技艺高超;，而且$g十分精明:十分精明;。击败这样的生物，证明了你对大地母亲信条的忠诚，即使你不承认她是你的神祇。她存在于这个星球和更远处的一切事物之中。她的双眼一暗一明，划过天空，始终俯视着我们。\n\n请收下这袋钱币，作为对你所做之事的感谢。",cEN="Well done, <class>. I see you're not only skilled but cunning. To defeat such creatures is a testament to your loyalty to the tenants of the Earthmother, even if you do not recognize her as your own deity. She is in all things on this planet and beyond. Her eyes, one dark and one light, travel across the skies always gazing down upon us.\n\nPlease, take this small amount of coin in appreciation for what you have done."}
Q[5537]={d="通灵学院大门的钥匙名叫骷髅钥匙，它一定是由某具骸骨制造而成——事实上是若干具骸骨——并在适当的模具中使用最坚硬的金属进行加固。天生就能打开通灵学院大门的人拥有一种特殊的力量，这种力量能让钥匙发挥作用。\n\n重要的事情要优先处理掉，$n。我们需要一些骸骨碎片来制造钥匙。安多哈尔内的骸骨应该符合我们的要求，但是安多哈尔城外的那些骸骨也许同样有效。",dEN="The key to Scholomance is called a Skeleton Key. It must be forged from the remains of a skeleton - several actually - and hardened by only the strongest of metals within a suitable mold. A signet of power from a being who naturally can open the portal to Scholomance will make the key ultimately function.\n\nFirst thing's first though, <name>. We'll need skeletal fragments for the key's forging. Skeletons inside Andorhal should yield what we need, but the ones outside the walls might work too.",o="将15块骷髅碎片交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的化学家阿尔比顿。",oEN="Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",p="虽然这听起来很恶心，但是我们确实需要许多合适的骸骨碎片来制作钥匙的外层部分。你要知道，如果没有这些东西，那它也不叫骷髅钥匙了。",pEN="As morbid as it sounds, we'll need a decent supply of suitable skeletal fragments to make up the outer layer of the key. They don't call it a Skeleton Key for nothing, you know.",c="很好，$n！现在轮到我了——我将对这些白骨进行适当的回火，使它们不至于在锻造过程中断裂。\n\n下一步就是获得钥匙的模具了，在塔纳利斯有个地精铁匠，他曾经制作过类似的模具。跟其它的地精一样，他也会为那些出价最高的人效劳的。",cEN="This'll work, <name>! My turn now - I will imbue these with a suitable temper that will allow them to survive the intense forging process they will eventually go through.\n\nThe next step will be to get an appropriate mold for the key. I know a goblin blacksmith in Tanaris that has in the past made molds for similarly macabre items. He works for whom goblins usually work for - the highest bidder."}
Q[5538]={d="你要找的地精的名字叫做克林科·古德斯迪尔。他在塔纳利斯的加基森镇里生活，为出价最高的顾客效力。看来他是唯一个可以帮我们完成融合工序的铁匠，不过他的标价会非常高，所以你来解决他的工钱。\n\n我是个炼金师，不是个银行家。如果我有一堆金子的话，还待在这里干什么？\n\n我相信我已经把事情说得很直白了，咳咳。\n\n加基森在等待你！祝你好运！",dEN="The goblin you will need to speak with is Krinkle Goodsteel. He peddles his skills to the highest bidder in Gadgetzan, within the Tanaris desert. He'll likely be the only one who can produce the mold we need, and his services won't come cheap. We now ask for you to dig deep by footing whatever fee he will charge.\n\nI'm an alchemist, not a banker. If I had gold lying around, I certainly wouldn't be here.\n\nI guess I said the quiet part out loud again. Oops.\n\nGadgetzan awaits you! Good luck!",o="把灌魔的骸骨碎片和15枚金币交给加基森的克林科·古德斯迪尔。",oEN="Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan.",p="是的，我知道你是谁，也知道你为什么来。迪瑟斯在你到之前就捎信给我了。咱们直接谈正事，好吗？\n\n我有个模具可以用在骷髅钥匙上，但要收你十五枚金币，先付，不还价。我会帮你把骸骨碎片装进模具，还会教你如何在完全不懂锻造的情况下打造钥匙的柄……当然，全部免费。\n\n谁说佣兵不提供划算的交易！",pEN="Yeah, I know who you are, and I know why you're here. Dithers sent word to me before you arrived. Let's cut to deal at hand, now shall we?\n\nI've got a mold you can use for the skeleton key, but it will cost you - fifteen gold, up front, no negotiation. I'll pack the skeletal fragments into the mold for you, and I'll also teach you on how to forge the stem of the key without any knowledge of blacksmithing... all free of charge no less.\n\nWho says mercenaries don't offer competitive deals!",c="阿尔比顿说你会把东西送过来，那就拿出来吧！让我把碎片和模具放在一起。\n\n阿尔比顿已经给它们附过魔法了？很好……否则的话，你就得再跑一趟冰风岗了。",cEN="Arbington said you'd deliver the goods, and deliver you have! A deal is a deal; let me pack the fragments into the mold for you.\n\nDid Arbington imbue them already? Excellent... otherwise, it would have been a long trip back to the Chillwind Camp for you."}
Q[5541]={d="海格纳·重枪在安威玛尔出售枪支。火枪队和迫击炮小队都会花大量的时间在他的店铺里挑挑拣拣，所以他总是需要充足的新货物。\n\n但是……我送给他的最后一箱弹药在半路上不见了。送货的家伙说他当时在灰色洞穴附近扎营，然后来了几个雪怪把他给赶跑了……那个傻瓜就把海格纳的弹药留在那里了！\n\n$n，你能不能拿到那些弹药然后送到海格纳那里去呢？我敢说他的库存已经不多了。",dEN="Hegnar Rumbleshot sells guns off the road to Anvilmar. Riflemen and mortar teams spend a lot of time practicing out near his shop, and he's always needing fresh ammunition.\n\nBut... the last crate of ammo I sent him got lost along the way. My courier said he was camped near the Grizzled Den when wendigo chased him away... and the fool left Rumbleshot's ammo behind!\n\n<name>, can you get that ammo and take it to Rumbleshot? He's been waiting on it and I'm sure he's running low.",o="把海格纳的弹药交给丹莫罗的海格纳·重枪。",oEN="Bring Rumbleshot's Ammo to Hegnar Rumbleshot in Dun Morogh.",p="我希望你不是来买弹药的，因为我已经没有库存了！",pEN="I hope you're not here for ammo, because I'm almost out!",c="很好，更多的弹药！罗斯洛的货终于来了！虽然有些晚，但是我爷爷说得好:来得晚总比不来的好！\n\n非常感谢你，$n。准备买弹药的顾客已经要踏平我的小店了！",cEN="Great, more ammo! Old Loslor's shipment finally came through! The ammo might be late, but just like my grand daddy used to tell me: late's better than never!\n\nThank you much, <name>. I already have buyers eager for this stuff!"}
Q[5542]={d="如果你要留在这里，我只要求你自食其力。我们有很多麻烦需要一点“管教”。\n\n你可以从瘟疫犬和它们的幼崽开始。\n\n我给不了你多少回报，但如果你成功了，保证有一顿热饭和一些闲聊。\"\"",dEN="If you are going to remain here, I ask only that you earn your keep. We have many nuisances that could use some 'discipline.'\n\nYou can start with the Plaguehounds and their runts.\n\nI cannot offer much in return, but you are guaranteed a warm meal and some conversation should you succeed.",o="杀掉20条瘟疫幼犬、5条瘟疫犬和5条狂怒的瘟疫犬。任务完成之后向提里奥·弗丁复命。",oEN="Slay 20 Plaguehound Runts, 5 Plaguehounds and 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds. Return to Tirion Fordring when the task is complete.",p="别怜悯那些恶魔犬，$r。它们是些可憎之物！",pEN="Do not pity the demon dogs, <race>. They are abominations!",c="干得好，$n。来，休息一下。让我们吃点东西，然后谈谈以前的事情吧！",cEN="Well done, <name>. Come. Rest. Let us eat and talk of days long past!"}
Q[5543]={d="踏入瘟疫之地的人真是愚蠢而又悲哀。各种各样邪恶的生物在这里徘徊——狂热的血色十字军会杀死一切不愿与他们同流合污的人，凶恶的天灾军团会不断地扩充亡灵的数量。\n\n即使是普通的野生动物也已经变为了凶残的食人猛兽。我请求你去杀掉那些从空中袭击无辜者的生物，瘟疫蝙蝠。",dEN="Woe to those that foolishly wander into the Plaguelands. All manner of foulness inhabit these woods - from the fanatical Scarlet Crusade, who will kill any that do not bear the mark of the Crusade, to the murderous Scourge, who only look to bolster their numbers by adding more undead to their ranks.\n\nEven the wildlife have been transformed into rapacious, man eating beasts. I ask that you destroy those that would strike from the skies: The Plaguebats.",o="杀死30只瘟疫蝙蝠，然后向提里奥·弗丁复命。",oEN="Slay 30 Plaguebats and return to Tirion Fordring.",p="别小看那些带翅膀的害虫，$r。瘟疫赋予了它们超自然的能力。",pEN="Do not underestimate the winged vermin, <race>. The Plague has given them supernatural abilities.",c="你是正直品行的光辉典范，$r！我已经很久没有感到英雄之血在我的血管里奔涌了。你的英勇事迹振奋人心！",cEN="You are a shining example of decency, <race>! It has been long since I have felt the blood of heroes pump through my veins. Your acts of bravery are uplifting!"}
Q[5544]={d="我的食品储备已经很少了，$r。我不得不承认，现在我已经没有可以和你分享的食物了。\n\n你能不能帮我这个老人一个小忙？这附近唯一没有被瘟疫感染的生物是食腐虫。虽然它们味道并不好，但是它们的肉可以储存好几个月。我要为即将来临的冬天存储数百磅的肉！",dEN="My food supplies are running low, <race>. I am ashamed to admit that I might not have enough food to share with you.\n\nCould you assist an old man with a simple task? Around here, the only manner of beast unaffected by the ravages of the Plague are the Carrion worms. While rather bland in taste, the meat of the worms can easily be preserved to last for months. I will need several hundred pounds to restock for the coming winter!",o="寻找这一带的食腐幼虫和吞噬者。杀死它们并采集它们的肉。当你凑齐 15 块食腐虫肉后，回到提里奥·弗丁那里。|n",oEN="Seek out the Carrion Grubs and Devourers of the region. Slay them and harvest their meat. Return to Tirion Fordring when you have gathered 15 Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat.",p="你会慢慢习惯这个味道的，$r。",pEN="You will grow to tolerate the taste, <race>.",c="愿圣光守护你！$g祝福:祝福;你，年轻人。",cEN="May the Light watch over you! Bless you, young one."}
Q[5545]={d="我现在真的是碰到棘手问题了。我有一批木材的订单马上就要到期了，但我抽不出时间来解决这事情。北边的狼和熊把我的工人追得满地跑，否则的话他们早就把木材的问题解决了。\n\n我和瑞尼尔副队长谈过，要他帮忙清理那些动物，但是眼下我得找人帮我去收集足够的木材。如果你可以帮我收集八捆木材的话，我就可以按时完成订单了。",dEN="I've got a real problem on my hands. I have a deadline looming for an order of lumber, and I'm running out of time. The wolves and bears north of here have chased my workers away from the bundles of wood that they've already chopped.\n\nI've already talked to Deputy Rainer about clearing the animals, but I need someone to go collect the wood for me. If you could collect eight bundles of wood for me I might just make my deadline.",o="收集8捆木材，把它们交给东谷伐木场的管理员莱琳。",oEN="Bring 8 Bundles of Wood to Raelen at the Eastvale Logging Camp.",p="期限马上就要到了，$c。请马上帮我收集一些木材。",pEN="That deadline isn't getting any further away, <class>. Please hurry and collect those bundles of wood.",c="太好了！这样我就应该可以按时完成订单了。为了表示感谢，请收下这些银币。\n\n谢谢你，再见。",cEN="Excellent! Thanks to you, I should be able to complete the order in time. To show my gratitude, I would like to offer some coin as compensation for your troubles.\n\nThank you and farewell."}
Q[5561]={d="比布里认为他是凄凉之地唯一一个懂得赚钱的地精。好吧，唯一一个有胆量闯过这块地方的商队就是我了。因为我懂得利用我的科多兽诱引器控制年老的和濒死的科多兽，所以我和商队的老板——考克和里格尔——进行了合作。\n\n把诱引器拿去，对任何一头年老的或者濒死的科多兽使用，然后那头野兽就会变成驯服的科多兽并跟着你。你每驯服一头科多兽，就把它给我带来。",dEN="Bibbly thinks he is the only goblin in Desolace who knows how to make money. Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership.\n\nTake the kombobulator and use it on any ancient, aged, or dying kodos; it will jolt the beast into a tamed kodo and force it to follow you. Once you have a kodo tamed, bring it back to me.",o="将科多兽诱引器和5头被驯服的科多兽交给瑟卡布斯库的营地中的斯米德·瑟卡布斯库。",oEN="Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",p="商队就要来了，我要的5头科多兽呢？",pEN="The caravan will be here shortly; do you have the five new tamed kodos I was asking for?",c="<斯米德·瑟卡布斯库开始计算科多兽的数量。>\n\n三，四，五……很好，我要五头科多兽，现在你给我带来了五头……我要发财了……嗯，发大财！我真想知道，如果比布里听说我成功了，他的脸色会难看到什么程度。",cEN="<Smeed Scrabblescrew begins counting.>\n\nThree, four, and five... excellent, I ask for five tamed kodos and I get five tamed kodos... I am going to be rich... yes, very rich! I hope to see the look on Bibbly's green face when he hears about my success!"}
Q[5581]={d="看吧——这就是伊鲁克斯之手。确实是令人毛骨悚然的东西。\n\n如果要把玛诺洛克集会所的恶魔传送门清除掉，你就必须持有它……而这正是我现在要求你去做的事。恶魔的威胁正在加剧，我们必须关闭这些传送门，阻止恶魔涌入这个世界。祝你好运，……还要小心传送门的守卫。|n\n\n\n\n",dEN="Behold - the Hand of Iruxos. A gruesome sight indeed.\n\nYou must possess it if the demon portals at Mannoroc Coven are to be banished... which is what I now ask you to do. The Demon threat is increasing and we must close these portals to stem the tide of demons to this world. Good luck, <name>... and be wary of the portal guardians.",o="在玛诺洛克集会所摧毁 6 座传送门，然后回到鬼行哨所向费尔古尔·双刃复命。|n",oEN="Banish 6 Portals at Mannoroc Coven and return to Taiga Wisemane at Shadowprey Village.",p="你有没有放逐玛诺洛克集会所里的恶魔传送门？",pEN="Have you banished the demon portals at Mannoroc Coven?",c="你值得赞扬，$n。你的努力极大帮助了我们对抗恶魔的威胁，整个艾泽拉斯也因此更加安全了，$g真的:真的;。",cEN="You are to be commended, <name>. Your effort has helped greatly in fighting the demon threat, and all of Azeroth is safer because of it."}
Q[5582]={d="这是一块被瘟疫感染的龙鳞，但是它不像别的幼龙鳞片那样遍布麻点、柔软无力，这块鳞片的质量很好，而且没有任何损坏。\n\n贝蒂娜·比格辛克需要这样的东西来进行研究。",dEN="This is a scale shed from a plagued dragon hatchling. But unlike the other pocked, oozing scales on the infant beast, this rare scale is healthy and unmarred.\n\nBetina Bigglezink will want a sample of this to study.",o="把健康的龙鳞交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂中的贝蒂娜·比格辛克。",oEN="Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="，你有什么要给我看的吗？",pEN="<name>, do you have something to show me?",c="太好了！这可以极大地帮助我对天灾军团的阴谋进行研究。谢谢你，$n，如果你找到更多这样的鳞片的话，请把它们都交给我！",cEN="Excellent! This will be invaluable in my continued studies of the machinations of the Scourge. Thank you, <name>, and if you find more of these scales please bring them to me!"}
Q[5601]={d="我在大战中逃离了洛丹伦，在亡灵天灾席卷我的家园，将那儿变成一片可怕的废墟之前，我幸运地逃脱了！我太幸运了，但是我的家族却非常悲惨。我担心他们都已经在达隆郡战役中死去了。\n\n达隆郡就在东瘟疫之地南部山区里，你能帮我去那儿找找我的家族成员吗？我非常想念他们，特别是我的妹妹帕米拉。\n\n请帮我找到她！",dEN="I fled Lordaeron during the great war, and was lucky to escape before the Scourge swept through my homeland and turned it into a plagued nightmare! I was lucky, but my family was not. I fear they were all killed during the battle of Darrowshire.\n\nDarrowshire is a village in the Eastern Kingdoms, nestled in the southern hills of what is now the Eastern Plaguelands. Will you go there and search for my family? I miss them so much, especially my little sister Pamela.\n\nPlease, find her for me!",o="在达隆郡里找到帕米拉·雷德帕斯。",oEN="Find Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire.",c="我的姐姐杰希卡在哪儿？在我还是很小很小的小女孩的时候，她就离开了。她走的时候哭得很伤心，我不知道她为什么要哭！也许是她跌伤了脚趾吧。\n\n杰希卡还在这儿的时候，我们经常一起玩游戏，一起跳舞，一起在屋子周围采花。有时看到爸爸回来的时候我们就藏起来，然后突然跳出来吓他！\n\n回来吧，杰希卡！要是你回来了，爸爸也会回来，我们就能像以前一样在一起玩了……",cEN="Where is my sister Jessica? She left so long ago, when I was just a little girl. She cried so much when she went away. I don't know why she cried! Maybe she fell and hit her toe.\n\nWhen Jessica was here we used to play games and dance and pick pretty flowers around the house. And sometimes we'd hide when we saw daddy coming home, then jump out and surprise him!\n\nCome back, Jessica! If you come back then maybe daddy will too and we can all play together again..."}
Q[5623]={d="又见面了，年轻的$g牧师:女祭司;。是时候让你更多地了解我们的信仰了。办完你在北郡的事情后，去闪金镇找女祭司乔塞塔。她会教你更多东西，也已经听说你在圣光之道上进步神速。她正等着指导你呢。",dEN="Hello again, young Hero. The time has come for you to learn more about our religion. After you've completed whatever tasks you have here in Northshire, please seek out Priestess Josetta in Goldshire. She has more to teach you and has heard that you are growing strong in the ways of the Light. She looks forward to tutoring you more.",o="与艾尔文森林的女牧师洁塞塔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Priestess Josetta in Elwynn Forest.",c="我很高兴你来了，$n。关于你的未来和你在圣光之道上的修行，我们有很多要谈的。",cEN="I'm glad you've arrived, <name>. We have much to discuss about your future and your path within the Light."}
Q[5624]={d="一般来说，我会给那些圣光的追随者布置一个小小的挑战来测试他们的能力。我要看看他们是否值得穿着他们的第一件圣光之袍——那是$g他:她他在教会中的地位和身份的标志。\n\n但是这次情况有所不同。闪金镇的一个居民报告说，这里东面的湖边上有一位受伤的守卫，他的名字叫罗伯兹。找到他，治疗他，强化他的身体，然后回到我这里来。如果你能为我做这些的话，我会认为你已经通过了试炼。",dEN="Normally I put forth a small challenge to followers of the Light to test their skill. I want to see if they are worthy of wearing their first robes--a sign that the church outwardly approves of the <priest/priestess> and supports <him/her>.\n\nBut this situation is a bit different. One of Goldshire's citizens saw an injured guard near the lake to the east of here. His name is Roberts. Find him, heal him, fortify his body and return here. If you can do that for me, then I will consider your test complete.",o="找到守卫罗伯兹，用闪电治疗治愈他的伤口，然后回到闪金镇向女祭司乔塞塔复命。",oEN="Find Guard Roberts and heal his wounds then return to Priestess Josetta in Goldshire.",p="就如同你所了解的，在日前这种艰苦的时期中，我们的治疗法术对我们的生存是非常重要的——特别是对于那些使用武器和魔法对抗许多不同威胁的冒险者和英雄们。\n\n牢记这些技能的重要性。使用真言术：韧，你的战友就可以在战斗中活得更久，可以承受更多次的攻击，也能让你表现得很好。\n\n不要让任何人忽视你所掌控的魔法力量。",pEN="As you may have already learned, our healing magics are vital to the survival of our people in these harsh times--especially to adventurers and heroes who take up arms and magic to fight back so many different threats.\n\nYou would do well to always remember how important that skill is. That, coupled with Fortitude, make your companions far more capable in battle since they will be able to stand up to a greater number of blows.\n\nDo not let anyone dismiss how powerful your magics are.",c="太好了，$n。多了一个健康的守卫，我们就会更加的安全。我很高兴看见你已经能聪明地使用你的技能，如果你在任何时间觉得自己已经准备好要接受更多训练的话，请回来找我。但是现在，请收下这件长袍，它会让别人知道你是我们的其中一员。如果你不想穿它的话也无所谓。未来还有很多试炼要让你去完成，这件袍子并不是必要的。",cEN="Excellent, <name> With one more healthy guard out there to help the town, we'll be that much safer. I'm glad to see you're already learning to use your abilities wisely. If you feel you are ready for more training at any time, please come back to me. But for now, take this robe. It will let others know that you are one of our order. If you don't want to wear it, that's fine. Later there will be more tests and this robe isn't necessary for those."}
Q[5625]={d="现在是时候看看你的力量是否值得穿着象征教会的长袍了。但是老实说，我现在有更重要的事情要做。卡拉诺斯的居民向我报告说，这里的南边有一位受伤的巡山人——他的名字叫多尔夫。\n\n治疗他，然后给他加上真言术：韧，如果你完成了这些，你就证明了自己的价值。这听上去怎么样？",dEN="It's usually about this time that one of your power is tested to see if they're worthy of wearing robes denoting their place in the church. But to be honest, I got more pressing matters to look into. Citizen of Kharanos' just came in here and told me 'bout a hurt mountaineer just outside town to the south--name's Dolf.\n\nYou heal Dolf and give him Fortitude, and I'll consider you done with proving yourself. How's that sound?",o="找到巡山人多尔夫，用次级治疗术（等级 2）治愈他的伤口。之后给他施加真言术：韧，然后回到卡拉诺斯与马克桑·安沃尔交谈。",oEN="Find Mountaineer Dolf and heal his wounds then return to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos.",p="你找到多尔夫了吗，$n？\n\n也许你已经知道了这些，但是，我们的治疗技能确实非常有用。我们不仅仅能治疗受伤的人，而且对于那些未来的英雄或者想要打向自己名字的人的生命也非常重要。使用真言术：韧，我们就可以让自己和伙伴们变得更加耐打，而我们的治疗法术能让他们活得更久，没有什么是我们不能克服的！",pEN="Have you found Dolf yet, <name>?\n\nYou've probably already learned this, but our ability to heal is very useful. Not only are we able to take care of the wounded, but we're vital to the survival of all those would-be heroes out there trying to make a name for themselves. With Fortitude to increase the amount of blows we can take, and our healing magic to keep them alive, there's nothing we can't overcome!",c="干得好，$n。你心中有圣光，这一点毋庸置疑。\n\n来，收下这件长袍。它将标示你在教会中的角色，帮助人们认出你是一名$c。想穿就穿上吧。\n\n往后你还要经历更多的考验。尽力去学习你的能力，了解你究竟能做到什么。先试着独自打上一两场，然后再和其他旅人一起作战。\n\n不过别担心……你比你想象的要强大得多。",cEN="Well done, <name>. You got the Light inside you, that's for sure.\n\nHere, take this robe. It'll denote your role in the church and help people recognize you as a <class>--wear it if you want.\n\nLater, there will be more tests that you'll have to go through. Do what you can to learn about your abilities and what you're capable of. Try your hand at a fight or two alone, and then again with other travelers.\n\nBut don't fret none... you're as powerful as they come."}
Q[5626]={d="嘿，$n！你有空吗？！\n\n你追随圣光已经够久了，该去卡拉诺斯找马克桑·安沃尔了。他会教你更多关于你正走的这条道路的知识，如果你证明自己配得上，他就会把你第一套长袍交给你。那将标示你作为一名$g牧师:女祭司;的身份。\n\n现在出发吧！这里的事一办完，就穿过隧道。他在等着你呢。",dEN="Hey! <name>! Got a minute?!\n\nYa been following the Light now for long enough that you find your way to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos. He'll teach ya more about the path yer following, and if you prove worthy, give ya yer first set of robes to denote your station as a <priest/priestess>.\n\nNow get goin'! As soon as yer done here, head through the tunnel--he'll be waitin' for ya.",o="与丹莫罗的马克萨恩·安沃尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Maxan Anvol in Dun Morogh.",c="哦，布兰斯托克派你来的，是吗？很好，很好！他说得没错，你应该在圣光之道上更进一步了。我要好好地培养你，让你变得更加强大……这也是你所需要的，更强大的身体，以及更强大的意志。",cEN="Oh, so Branstock sent ya, did he? Good, good! He's right, it is 'bout time you started taking a much larger step into the Light. It'll build character and make ya stronger... an' that's what you'll need more than anything: strength of body... strength of will."}
Q[5648]={d="你已经$g准备好:准备好;接受第一次考验了，$n。我们的一位步兵在剃刀岭以南、刚出城的地方被普罗德摩尔的一些旧部打伤了。她伤得不轻，如果我们族人能去帮她一把，她会好过很多。找到她——她叫科尔娅——治愈她的伤口，并赐予她我们祖先的祝福。\n\n你做到了，我就认为这足以证明你已经$g准备好:准备好;在我们的文化中继续前行了。",dEN="You be ready for your first test, <name>. South of Razor Hill, just outta town, one of our grunts be hurt fightin' off some o' Proudmoore's old troops. She not doin' too well, an' she benefit much if one of our kind could help her. Find her--her name be Kor'ja--heal her wounds, an' give her the blessin' of our ancestors.\n\nYou do this, an' me thinks that be sufficient proof that you ready to move on in our ways.",o="找到步兵科尔娅，用次级治疗术（等级 2）治愈她的伤口。之后给她施加真言术：韧，然后回到剃刀岭与泰金交谈。",oEN="Find Grunt Kor'ja and heal her wounds then return to Tai'jin at Razor Hill.",p="许多人都知道治疗法术非常强大，但是他们并不知道它有多么强大。你可以拯救无数即将消逝的生命，让他们不致过早地在另一个世界见到他们的祖先。治疗法术与真言术：韧的结合是非常强大的，你要牢记这一点。无论是战士、法师，还是其它的职业，都会很需要你的这种能力。",pEN="Most think it logical that healin' magics be powerful, but not many understand how powerful. You can keep many alive when instead they should be meetin' their own ancestors. This healin' magic mixed with the ability of Fortitude are a very powerful combination of spells. You remember this. It helpful to all manner of people: warriors, mages and everything in between.",c="很好，那么科尔娅活下来了，会去保卫我们的城镇，抵御那些恶毒的人类。我常常想回忆那些战斗的岁月；那时力量在战斗中彰显，而往往是智者击败了那些只倚仗蛮力的人。\n\n你为我做得很好，$n。现在收下这件长袍。也许它会有用，也许你并不在意，但这是你应得的，我很自豪能称你为$g兄弟:姐妹;。",cEN="Good, then Kor'ja lives and goes off to defend our town from those malicious humans. I often wish to remember days of battle; where power was shown in combat and it was the wise who often destroyed those who relied on just their strength.\n\nYou done good by me, <name>. You take this robe now. Maybe it help, maybe you not care, but you earned it and I'm proud to call you brother."}
Q[5649]={d="哎，伙计。我们族人加入部落，是因为这对我们有好处。他们忠诚，也教了我们很多关于荣誉之类的事情。但我们的古老习俗不会就这么轻易消亡。兽人也许不赞同我们所有的传统，但那并不意味着我们不能私下里继续奉行其中一些。\n\n你明白这一点，所以我才派你去剃刀岭找泰金。她会教你更多我们的历史，教你我们部族的习俗。等你$g准备好:准备好;就去找她。",dEN="Aye, mon. Our kind have joined the Horde because they be good for us. They loyal, and they teach us much 'bout tings like honor. But our old ways die hard. The orcs may not approve of all our traditions, but that not mean we can't continue to practice some them in secret.\n\nYou know this, an' that's why I send you to Tai'jin in Razor Hill. She teach you more 'bout our history. She teach you the ways of our tribe. Go to her when you be ready.",o="与杜隆塔尔的泰金谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tai'jin in Durotar.",c="啊……你终于来找泰金了。很好。\n\n你应该已经知道我们已经不同于加入部落的那个时候了，我们变得更加强大。我们之所以强大，是因为我们能够适应变化——部落教会了我们许多东西。我们不再先击败我们的敌人再获取他们的力量，现在我们先获得力量，然后击败我们的敌人。\n\n虽然这其中的差别很小，但是你会明白的。我们的部族需要你去了解这些。",cEN="Ahh... so you finally come to Tai'jin. This be good.\n\nYou already know that we are not da same tribe that once joined with the Horde. We be much stronger now. We stronger 'cause we adapt--the Horde teach us that much. We no longer defeat our enemies and gain strength from them; now we gain strength, and then defeat our enemies.\n\nThe difference be subtle, but you will learn. You will see. The tribe count on you to learn such things."}
Q[5650]={d="我们的力量来自黑暗和阴影，$n，但是那不是你唯一的角色。你已承认了治疗术的价值，这是很明智的。但是如果你要了解黑暗，那么你还必须了解光明。对于这一点，我为你准备了一个试炼。\n\n墓地以北有一个受伤的亡灵卫兵，他名叫科尔。他曾保护我们免受豺狼人的伤害，现在他需要治疗。但是，你还必须在他能重回岗位之前增强他的体力。使用你的法术完成任务，然后回到我这儿来。",dEN="Our power comes from darkness and shadow, <name>, but that is not your only role. You have acknowledged that there is merit in knowing the healing arts. This is wise. But before you can know the dark, you must also know the light. And for this, I have a test for you.\n\nNorth of the cemetery is a wounded Deathguard--Deathguard Kel. He has protected us from gnolls for some time, and needs healing. But, you must also fortify his body before he can return to duty. Do both with your spells, and then return to me.",o="找到亡灵卫兵科尔，使用次级治疗术（等级 2）治愈他的伤口。接下来给他施加真言术：韧，然后回到布瑞尔再次拜访黑暗牧师贝里尔。",oEN="Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill.",p="我们的力量让我们在各种场合都无比合适，$n。不过你会发现，无论如何，我们治愈伤口、提升同伴所能承受伤害的能力，永远是我们所能掌握的最令人渴求的天赋。别因此就放弃走上其他道路，作为一名$c，你可以在很多方面$g卓有成效:卓有成效;。但是……如果你真的想用魔法能量摧毁敌人，也许奥术更合你的口味。",pEN="Our powers make us ideal for so many situations, <name>. You'll find that no matter what though, our ability to mend wounds and increase the amount of damage our companions can take will always be the most desired talents we have access to. Do not let that dissuade you from pursuing other paths as a <class>--you can be effective in many ways. But... if you truly wish to destroy your enemies with magical energy, perhaps the arcane is more to your liking.",c="你轻松通过了我的考验。很好。\n\n很快你就能承担更多责任，而那条路将引向更黑暗的力量——其他种族的任何$c都不曾拥有的力量。\n\n收下这件长袍，作为你身份的象征。这是你应得的。如果你不想穿，那也随你，你可以随意处置它。我和像我一样的人，将永远因你在我们行列中取得的成就而认可你。",cEN="You have passed my test with ease. Good.\n\nSoon, you will be ready to take on more responsibility and that road will lead to darker powers--powers that no <class> of another race has.\n\nTake this robe as a symbol of your station. You have earned it. If you do not wish to wear it, then so be it, you may do with it as you will. I and others like us will always acknowledge you for what you've achieved in our ranks."}
Q[5651]={d="被遗忘者从经验中学到了许多教训——有些种族连开始理解都做不到。虽然我们的道路位于黑暗之中，但你会发现，很多事情同时依赖于光明与黑暗。你将受到的教诲会教你运用这两者……并且懂得分寸。但记住我的话：永远不要忘记，我们诞生于腐化之中，被抛弃在世上自生自灭，像一堆腐肉一样烂掉。黑暗就是我们的家。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;继续学习时，去布瑞尔找黑暗牧师贝里尔。",dEN="There are many lessons that the Forsaken have learned through experience--things that some races can only begin to fathom. And although our path lies in darkness, you will find that a great many things rely on both the light and the dark. Your lessons shall teach you to use both... and with discretion. But heed my words: never forget we were forged in corruption and left to rot like so much carrion. The Darkness is our home.\n\nSeek out Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill when you're ready to learn more.",o="与提瑞斯法林地的黑暗牧师贝里尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Dark Cleric Beryl in Tirisfal Glades.",c="你终于来了。仅凭你的信仰，是无法通过摆在你面前的考验的，年轻人。你还需要$g一份迫切:一份迫切;之心，以及一些雄心。",cEN="Finally, you've arrived. Your faith alone will not allow you to pass the trials before you, young one. A sense of urgency and some ambition will help too."}
Q[5713]={d="我本来是带着一封重要的信件往奥伯丁去，但是熊怪玛洛什带着它的爪牙袭击了我。在这次攻击事件中，我不慎中毒了，现在我几乎无法站起来。当然，我可以制作解毒药，但是这需要花些时间。\n\n你能在我制作解毒药的时候保护我吗？我会尽力协助你的。\n\n如果我们活下来的话，我就动身把那封信送到奥伯丁去，而你负责向迈斯特拉岗哨的奥奈雅报告这件事情。",dEN="I was traveling to Auberdine with an important message when I was attacked by the furbolg Marosh and his trackers. During the attack I was poisoned, leaving me barely able to stand. I can make an antidote, but it will take time before it is ready.\n\nI would ask that you defend me until I can apply the antidote. I will aid you with my bow as best I can.\n\nShould we survive, I will be able to deliver my message to Auberdine, while you speak with Onaeya at Maestra's Post to inform her of this incident.",o="保护哨兵阿娜莎，然后向灰谷迈斯特拉岗哨的奥奈雅报告。",oEN="Protect Sentinel Aynasha, then speak with Onaeya at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",p="你在路上看到哨兵阿娜莎了吗？她正在执行重要的任务，不过直到现在她还没有回来。",pEN="Have you seen of Sentinel Aynasha on the road? She left on an important mission but she has not yet returned.",c="这真是个好消息，$c。我很高兴得知阿娜莎还活着，谢谢你。请收下这个作为我对你英勇事迹的奖励。愿艾露恩照耀你的道路。",cEN="You bring most welcome news <class>. It is good to hear that Aynasha is alive and well thanks to you. I would hope that you might accept a reward for your valor. May Elune watch over you and light your path."}
Q[5721]={d="现在，$n，你将参加达隆郡的战斗，并且拯救约瑟夫·雷德帕斯。\n\n把这个遗物包裹放到达隆郡的广场中，达隆郡居民的灵魂将因此而被唤醒。参加他们的战斗，并确保你完成两件事：在霍古斯死后，达维必须存活；雷德帕斯必须存活，直到他被腐化而堕落，此时再将其击败。\n\n在打败了堕落的雷德帕斯之后，他的灵魂就将得到救赎。同他交谈，然后再去找他的女儿帕米拉。",dEN="Now, <name>, you will take part in battle of Darrowshire, and you will save Joseph Redpath.\n\nPlace this relic bundle in the Darrowshire town square, and the spirits of Darrowshire will rise. Join their battle and assure that these two things come to pass: Davil must survive beyond the death of Horgus, and Redpath must survive to be corrupted, then defeated.\n\nAfter defeating the corrupted Redpath, his spirit will be saved. Speak with him, then return to his daughter Pamela.",o="将遗物包裹放在达隆郡的广场中。\n\n在霍古斯死亡之前，达维必须存活。\n\n在雷德帕斯队长堕落之前保证他存活。\n\n击败堕落的雷德帕斯。\n\n当约瑟夫·雷德帕斯出现在广场中时，与他的灵魂进行交谈，然后回到帕米拉的家中去找帕米拉。",oEN="Place the Relic Bundle at the Darrowshire town square.\n\nPrevent Davil Lightfire's death until the death of Horgus.\n\nPrevent Captain Redpath's death until Redpath the Corrupted appears.\n\nDefeat Redpath the Corrupted.\n\nSpeak with the spirit of Joseph Redpath when he appears at the town square, then speak with Pamela at her home.",p="我想我听到了外面那些鬼魂的声音。他们在低声告诉我一些可怕的事情……",pEN="I think I heard ghosts outside. They whisper scary things to me...",c="战斗结束了！我听见爸爸在跟我说话。他吓跑了所有鬼魂，而且他说他正在回家的途中！我太高兴了！\n\n他还说要是你来到我们家，我就得好好欢迎你，所以我已经沏好了茶！\n\n希望你喜欢喝加了好多好多糖的茶水！",cEN="The fighting is over! I heard my daddy whisper to me. He scared away all the ghosts and he says he's coming home! I'm so happy!\n\nHe also said I should welcome you if came to our house, so I made some tea!\n\nI hope you like lots of sugar!"}
Q[5722]={d="穴居人并不是玛加萨在怒焰裂谷唯一感兴趣的东西。她听说自己的一个仆人——玛尔·邪图腾——在裂谷中发现了某种奇特的东西，却始终没能活着出来给她看。她希望找到玛尔的尸体——如果还剩下什么的话——以及他在试图与穴居人交谈时发现的东西的任何线索。\n\n把任何可能引起她兴趣的物品交给玛加萨，我相信她一定会慷慨地奖赏你。\n\n再提醒一次，去奥格瑞玛最黑暗的区域寻找那座裂谷。",dEN="The troggs are not the only thing that interested Magatha in Ragefire Chasm. She has heard word that one of her servants, a Maur Grimtotem, found something peculiar while in the Chasm, but he never made it out to show her what. She'd like Maur's body found--if it still exists--and any signs of what he found while attempting to speak to the troggs.\n\nReturn to Magatha any items of interest, and I'm sure she would be very generous in her reward.\n\nAgain, seek the Chasm in the darkest areas of Orgrimmar.",o="在怒焰裂谷搜寻玛尔·恐怖图腾的尸体以及他留下的东西。",oEN="Search Ragefire Chasm for Maur Grimtotem's corpse and search it for any items of interest.",c="尸体似乎曾被棍棒或拳头猛烈地击打过，伤痕累累，但是大部分衣物和装备看起来还是很新的，似乎穴居人并没有过分注重这些东西。\n\n你开始搜查尸体，寻找一切有可能帮助玛加萨的东西。",cEN="The body looks seriously beaten by clubs or fists, but most of the corpse's clothing and equipment still looks present. It seems the troggs do not overly care much for material wealth.\n\nYou begin to search the body for anything of interest that might help Magatha."}
Q[5723]={d="在奥格瑞玛城的地下，那些被称为穴居人的生物正在从充满岩浆的管道深处源源不断地涌出来。玛加萨心怀仁爱，试图与这些生物和平相处，但是他们却对她派出的外交官大开杀戒。她绝不允许牛头人受到这样的待遇，现在她将穴居人看作是整个部落的威胁。\n\n她希望你在穴居人毁灭部落之前消灭他们——找到怒焰裂谷，把他们全都杀掉。",dEN="Beneath the city of Orgrimmar, stout creatures known as troggs started coming to the surface from deep below the lava filled tunnels. In her ever-benevolence, Magatha sought to make peace with the creatures, but they turned on her diplomats, killing them. She will not allow such treatment of the tauren people and now consider the creatures a threat to all of the Horde.\n\nShe asks that you put an end to this trogg threat before it overwhelms the Horde from below. Find Ragefire Chasm and destroy them all.",o="在奥格瑞玛找到怒焰裂谷，杀掉8个怒焰穴居人和8个怒焰萨满祭司，然后向雷霆崖的拉哈罗复命。",oEN="Search Orgrimmar for Ragefire Chasm, then kill 8 Ragefire Troggs and 8 Ragefire Shaman before returning to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",p="搜寻怒焰裂谷的工作进行得怎么样了？穴居人呢？\n\n我们绝不允许它们的威胁继续存在——这只会伤害到我们的兽人同胞。",pEN="How goes your search for the Chasm? And the troggs?\n\nThe threat cannot be allowed to persist--it will only injure our orc brethren if it continues.",c="很高兴看到你能如此认真地执行玛加萨的任务。谢谢你，$n。我想随着穴居人数量的锐减，他们将更难于在地表上站住脚。\n\n或许将来我们可以搞清楚这种生物来自何方，他们想要干什么。",cEN="I am glad to see you took Magatha's task seriously. Thank you, <name>. I'm sure the troggs will have a harder time coming to the surface with their numbers so greatly reduced.\n\nPerhaps in the future we can take time to figure out where such creatures came from, and what they really want."}
Q[5724]={d="你在牛头人的尸体上发现了一个小包。他的手臂紧紧地夹着它，似乎在被穴居人攻击时还试图保护这个小包。\n\n你从他那钳子般紧握的手臂中取出小包，装入你自己的行囊，准备离开隧道返回雷霆崖的拉哈罗那里去。",dEN="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs.\n\nRemoving the satchel from his vice-like grip, you stow it with your own equipment and prepare to make your way out of the tunnels and back to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",o="将恐怖图腾背包交给雷霆崖的拉哈罗。",oEN="Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",p="你找到什么东西了吗，$n？我想知道为什么她的族人要做出无谓的牺牲，任何有关的线索都会对我们很有帮助的。",pEN="Were you able to find anything, <name>? Any clues as to why one of her clansman had to die needlessly would be helpful.",c="棒极了，$n。谢谢你。\n\n玛加萨告诉我说，如果你成功地找到了她的族人，就把这个交给你。请收下它吧，这代表着我们的谢意。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. Thank you.\n\nMagatha told me that if you were successful in finding her clansman that you be given this. Please, take it in thanks."}
Q[5725]={d="正如你可能已经知道的，军团的许多成员都会向自己的追随者赐予礼物。黑暗女士认为，其中许多礼物握在她手里，比落在那些……眼光不那么长远的人手中要好。\n\n隐藏在奥格瑞玛地下洞穴中的暮光之锤议会分支——灼刃氏族——就是个绝佳的例子。女士告诉我，灼刃氏族成员已经得到了两本强大的法术书——她想从他们那里“借”来看看。你去替她弄到手。\"\"",dEN="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with... lesser vision.\n\nA sect of the Shadow Council hidden in caverns below Orgrimmar known as the Searing Blade are a prime example. The Lady tells me that members of the Searing Blade have come into the possession of two powerful spell books--she would like to \"borrow\" these books from them. You will get them for her.",p="我还有好几百个任务要执行，$c。你取到书了吗？",pEN="There are a hundred other tasks awaiting my attention, <class>. Do you have the books?",c="好极了，$c。你在为黑暗女王效力的过程中表现得很出色。你的坚定不移和雄心壮志将极大地帮助黑暗女王实现她的目标。下次再来我这儿吧，也许我会布置其它的任务给你，帮助黑暗女王取代巫妖王，并彻底瓦解天灾军团。",cEN="Good, <class>. You have done well in serving the Dark Lady. Your continued perseverance and ambition will be of great use to the Lady's subjects. Return to me again in the future. Perhaps I will have other tasks for you that will aid the Dark Lady in her attempts at overtaking the Lich King and completely freeing the Scourge."}
Q[5726]={d="我绝不容忍的就是我们当中的叛徒，$n。但如果过早亮出底牌，那就是愚蠢——那样无法彻底铲除我们土地上的腐化，只会让感染愈演愈烈。\n\n但你，一个年轻的冒险者，可以去我的密探去不了的地方……查明真相……找到那头野兽真正的头颅。\n\n如果你够胆量，就进入奥格瑞玛东边的骷髅岩，从那里的燃烧之刃成员身上弄到一枚中尉徽记，带回来给我。",dEN="One thing I will not tolerate are traitors in our midst, <name>. But I would be a fool to play my hand so early--it would not sufficiently cut the corruption out of our lands and only cause the infection to grow worse.\n\nBut you, a young adventurer, could go places my agents could not... could learn the truth... could find the true head of the beast.\n\nIf you are brave enough, then enter Skull Rock to the east of Orgrimmar, find a lieutenant's insignia off one of the Burning Blade there, and return to me.",o="将军官的徽章交给奥格瑞玛的萨尔。",oEN="Bring a Lieutenant's Insignia to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="你拿到了徽章了吗，$n？\n\n它将是你渗透到火刃氏族中去的重要工具，我认为他们是部落的最大威胁，也是我们刚刚得到的和平的最大威胁。\n\n你会发现，当人类或是兽人受到贪欲和权力驱使时，他们会干出多么可怕的事情来。那些阴暗的勾当和隐藏的敌人终将露出真面目来。你将发现自己置身于一场你从未想象过的战争中。",pEN="Do you have the insignia yet, <name>?\n\nIt will be a vital tool in you infiltrating what I believe is the greatest threat to the Horde and us finally finding peace in our new home.\n\nYou will learn how intricate a web men and orcs alike can weave when they are motivated by greed and power. The hidden agendas, the corruption, all of it will become clear. You will find yourself in the midst of a war you never knew existed.",c="好极了，$n！我们的士气得到了鼓舞，也许你正是那个可以帮我除掉心头大患的勇士！你迅速成长并支持着我们的事业，有谁会怀疑像你这样勇敢而年轻的$r？你让我想起了自己年轻的时候。如果我们在即将来临的风暴之后仍然屹立不倒，那么我保证你会得到应有的回报。\n\n但是，赞扬的话留到以后再说吧。与你即将面临的威胁相比，你还没有做成什么大事呢……不过这是一个好的开端。",cEN="Good, <name>! The spirits be praised, perhaps you are the one who will finally put my greatest fears to rest! Who would suspect someone so young and so brave would rise up and champion our cause? You remind me of myself when I was younger. I will ensure that you are justly rewarded for your efforts if we both survive the coming storm.\n\nBut there is time for more praise later. You've not accomplished anything in comparison to what you will face... but this is a good start."}
Q[5727]={d="让我们看看你找到的徽章是否有价值。\n\n城中有一个术士，他认为自己已经得到了我的信任，但是他并不知道我很了解他真正效忠的主人是谁。他实际上是火刃氏族的领袖。先别急着跟他开战，因为他还有用处，我们可以利用他来对付我们的敌人。\n\n去奥格瑞玛的暗影裂口找他，把这枚徽章交给他，跟他谈谈，看他是否相信你是他的同伙，然后回到我这儿来。",dEN="Now let us see if this insignia you found is worth the effort.\n\nThere is a warlock within the city who believes he has my trust. He does not know that I realize where his true loyalties lie. He is in fact the leader of the Burning Blade. But do not rush off to do battle with him; he has a purpose, and we shall use him against our enemies.\n\nTake this insignia to him in the Cleft of Shadow here in Orgrimmar, speak to him and see if he believes you are one of his own, then return to me here.",o="将军官的徽章交给尼尔鲁·火刃并与他谈一谈，看看他是否相信你是火刃氏族中的一员，然后回到奥格瑞玛的萨尔那里。",oEN="Take the Lieutenant's Insignia to Neeru Fireblade and speak to him. Gauge if he believes you are a member of the Burning Blade and then return to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="嗯，$c？他相信我们了没有？要不然就是事情比预计的更加糟糕？\n\n向尼尔鲁证明你的价值，这样我们就更容易进入暗影议会。我们可以利用他提供的大量情报找到真正的幕后主使。",pEN="Well, <class>? Does he believe our ploy, or are things worse than I had first estimated?\n\nProving valuable to Neeru will make our infiltration of the Shadow Council much easier. He will have plenty of information that we can use to route out those who would destroy all we have built in Durotar.",c="很好！太棒了，$c！\n\n今天你所做的事情仅仅是更为宏大的事业的第一步，这项事业就是彻底摧毁暗影议会。\n\n把他的话原原本本地告诉我……不要漏掉哪怕一个字，这比你所能想象的更加重要。",cEN="Excellent! Most excellent, <class>!\n\nWhat you have done this day is only the first step in a much broader foundation--a foundation that we will build the destruction of the Shadow Council on, once and for all.\n\nTell me all he said... and leave not one word out--it may be more important than you realize."}
Q[5728]={d="这么说，灼刃氏族的头目，是吗？有意思……如果他们是尼尔鲁最看重的人，那他们就是我们首先要对付的目标。那个萨特巴扎兰，还有尼尔鲁提到的另一个——我想是个术士——都必须除掉。\n\n$n，回到暗影裂口，进入怒焰裂谷。找到灼刃氏族的这两名首领并杀掉他们。但注意别让尼尔鲁知道是你干的。你必须继续保持作为他$g兄弟:姐妹;中一员的身份。",dEN="Hmm, leaders of the Searing Blade... this concerns me most. If they are the ones of value to Neeru, then those are who we must target first. This satyr... Bazzalan, and the other Neeru mentioned--what was he, a warlock?--must be slain.\n\nReturn to the Cleft of Shadow and enter Ragefire Chasm, <name>. Find these two leaders of the Searing Blade, and kill them. But be careful not to let Neeru know it was you who did this. You must retain your identity as one of his <brothers/sisters> in arms.",o="杀死巴扎兰和祈求者耶戈什，然后回到奥格瑞玛的萨尔那里。",oEN="Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="你找到他们了吗，$n？我是说灼刃氏族的领袖。\n\n我知道暗影议会想要从我手中夺走奥格瑞玛以及整个部落，但是我还不清楚他们能以多快的速度渗透到这座城市里来。这群叛徒拥有如此大的势力……我们可以全力以赴，奋勇杀敌，直至筋疲力尽，但是情况并不会好转多少。我必须让我的探子更活跃一些。",pEN="Have you found them yet, <name>? The leaders of the Searing Blade.\n\nI knew the Shadow Council sought to take Orgrimmar and all of the Horde from me, but I hadn't realized how quickly they were able to infiltrate the city. So many arms this beast has... we can cut them off until exhaustion sets in, but we will be no further than when we started. I will have to have my spies double their efforts.",c="很高兴你回来了，$n。我的眼线已经告诉我了，由于首领被杀，奥格瑞玛地下的洞穴之中乱成一团。甚至有报告称尼尔鲁陷入了极度的惊恐和不安。我们这一步走得非常成功，即使是这样的小胜利，也让我感到了喜悦。",cEN="I am glad you've returned, <name>. Some of those loyal to me brought word immediately that the caverns below Orgrimmar were in disarray now that their leaders have been slain. I even heard reports that Neeru was more than agitated. It seems we've put a dent in his armor. I can't say I'm displeased... even with such a minor victory."}
Q[5729]={d="我想下一步应该让你接近尼尔鲁。如果他像报告中所说的那样焦虑不安，那么我们也许能做成两件事。第一，你可以获得关于议会或者至少是 火刃氏族的更多情报；第二，你也许能取得他的信任，他会让你协助他。鉴于当前领导层的混乱状况，他可能会将你当作填补空缺的人选。\n\n回到他那里去，再跟他谈谈，但是别露出马脚来。",dEN="I think our next step should be to have you placed close to Neeru. If he is as agitated as reports suggest, then we may accomplish two things. One, you may be able to gain some greater knowledge about the Council or at least the Burning Blade, and two, he may just begin to trust you enough that he asks you to start to aid him. He may very well look at you as someone who can fill the void now that some of the leadership is in turmoil.\n\nReturn to the Cleft and speak to him again, but do not be too overt.",o="与奥格瑞玛的尼尔鲁·火刃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.",c="什么？！哦，$c……我向你道歉。我的愤怒快可以与一头狂暴的科多兽相提并论了……但这也许是我的错。在派遣他们转至怒焰裂谷之前，我就应该了解他们惹祸上身的可能性。似乎巴札兰和耶戈什都是在毫无防备的情况下被萨尔的手下杀死的。他们死得真不是时候，但是如今已经于事无补了。",cEN="What is it?! Oh, you, <class>... my apologies. My anger rivals that of a rabid kodo bull... but perhaps it is my own fault. In sending travelers into Ragefire Chasm, I should have seen the possibility that some harm would come from it. It seems both Bazzalan and Jergosh were taken unaware and slain by some of Thrall's do-gooders. A most inopportune time, but there is nothing that can be done about it now."}
Q[5730]={d="你是我的$g将军:将军;之一！做好准备，$c。我很快就会召见你。\n\n我在灼刃氏族上花的时间现在看来也许全白费了，但这并不意味着暮光之锤议会在别处的阴谋就该受挫。我会尽力减轻怒焰裂谷这里的损失。与此同时，我会让我的密探在贫瘠之地和灰谷开始着手我们最新的计划。尽快回来见我。",dEN="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself, <class>. I will call upon you soon.\n\nMy time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer. I will do what I can to minimize the damage here in Ragefire Chasm. In the meantime, I will have my agents in the Barrens and Ashenvale begin work on our newest agenda. Return to me soon.",o="与奥格瑞玛的萨尔谈一谈，告诉他你了解到的东西。",oEN="Speak to Thrall in Orgrimmar and tell him what you've learned.",c="灰谷？嗯，我没有听说过灰谷有议会或者火刃氏族的势力存在。我的探子会去调查的，$n。你干得很出色。\n\n至于现在，去好好休息吧，然后继续执行其它的任务。不久之后我会再次召唤你。\n\n为了部落的荣耀！",cEN="Ashenvale? Hmm, I had not heard of any presence of the Council or the Burning Blade in Ashenvale. My spies will investigate, <name>. You have done well.\n\nFor now, rest, and keep yourself occupied with other tasks. I will call upon you again soon.\n\nLok-Tar Ogar!"}
Q[5741]={d="据说东边雷斧堡垒的燃烧之刃从纳迦手中得到了光明权杖。传说这把权杖能让整座城市沉入大海。绝不能让燃烧之刃拥有这样的力量。\n\n为此，你必须亲手夺回权杖！它被一名燃烧之刃先知持有，他正在雷斧堡垒某一座哨塔的顶部研究这把权杖。|n",dEN="The Burning Blade in Thunder Axe Fortress to the east is rumored to have acquired the Sceptre of Light from the Naga. Legend tells that the sceptre is able to sink entire cities under the great seas. The Burning Blade must not be allowed to possess such power.\n\nTo that end, you must retrieve the sceptre yourself! It is held by a Burning Blade seer, who studies the sceptre from atop one of the Thunder Axe watchtowers.",o="取得光明权杖，把它交给埃塞尔·雷瑟尔塔的亚祖尔·奥达莫特。|n",oEN="Get the Sceptre of Light and then return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor.",p="你拿到圣光权杖了吗？",pEN="Do you have the Sceptre of Light?",c="强大的圣光权杖！你终于拿到它了，这个世界上又少了一个巨大的威胁。干得好，$c，干得非常好。",cEN="The elusive Sceptre of Light! Your acquisition of it has removed a grave threat to the world. Well done, <class>, well done."}
Q[5742]={d="你辛苦了，$g朋友:朋友;。让你疲惫的骨头歇一歇，也让我正式介绍一下自己。|n",dEN="You have worked hard, friend. Rest your weary bones and allow me to properly introduce myself.",o="听听提里奥·弗丁要说什么。",oEN="Listen to what Tirion Fordring has to say.",p="请坐，$g朋友:朋友;，听听我的故事。",pEN="Please, friend; sit and hear my tale.",c="弗丁的救赎将是一项艰巨的任务。你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？",cEN="The Fordring redemption will be a difficult task. Are you prepared?"}
Q[5761]={d="我们伟大的酋长交给我的首要任务就是搜寻那些利用恶魔的力量破坏城市的敌人。火刃氏族是个威胁，但是这里还存在着其它的威胁，比如在怒焰裂谷安家的燃刃氏族，他们暗地里计划着袭击部落的无辜民众。\n\n要想阻止他们，就必须杀死他们的领袖——那个被称作饥饿者塔拉加曼的恶魔守卫。\n\n杀死他，萨尔看到他的心脏之后一定会安心很多，这点我可以确信。",dEN="The primary task set upon me by our great Warchief is to root out the creatures responsible for infesting our lord's great city with demonic influence. The Burning Blade is one threat, but there are others; the Searing Blade for instance, who make their home in Ragefire Chasm, secretly attempting to subvert innocent members of the Horde.\n\nIf they are to be stopped, then their leader must be slain--a Felguard named Taragaman the Hungerer.\n\nKill him, and his heart will appease Thrall, of this I'm sure.",o="进入怒焰裂谷，杀死饥饿者塔拉加曼，然后把他的心脏交给奥格瑞玛的尼尔鲁·火刃。",oEN="Enter Ragefire Chasm and slay Taragaman the Hungerer, then bring his heart back to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.",p="你杀死那头野兽了吗？他一定是怒焰裂谷中那些灼刃氏族成员的首领。",pEN="Have you killed the beast? He surely must be the leader of the Searing Blade in Ragefire Chasm.",c="啊！你成功了！萨尔会很满意的。\n\n我会好好看管这颗心脏。\n\n庆祝你的胜利吧，我将把你的名字告知萨尔。\n\n感谢你的帮助，$c。",cEN="Ha! You've done it! Thrall will be so pleased.\n\nI will ensure this heart is taken care of properly.\n\nFor now though, you must celebrate your victory. I will inform Thrall of your success.\n\nThank you for your aid, <class>."}
Q[5762]={d="我有个包裹要给我的老顾客，一个名叫赫米特·奈辛瓦里的矮人。这个包裹花了几个星期才到我这里，那时候赫米特早就走了。他说他要去荆棘谷打猎，但是他给我留了一些钱，让我在有必要的时候把他的包裹寄给他。\n\n赫米特是个富有的矮人，所以我们最好和这号人物保持良好的关系，是不是？那么……你愿意帮我递送包裹吗？\n\n我听说赫米特在荆棘谷里扎了营，就在格罗姆高的北边。",dEN="I have a package for a new customer of mine, a dwarf named Hemet Nesingwary Jr.. The package took weeks to arrive, and Hemet's long gone by now. He said he was going to Stranglethorn to take his father's place and hunt the beasts there, but he left me some money to send his delivery when I could.\n\nJunior's a rich dwarf and it's a good idea to keep up relations with the rich ones, yeah? So... you want to deliver the package for me?\n\nI heard he has a camp in Stranglethorn, north of Grom'gol.",o="将克拉维尔的箱子送到荆棘谷的赫米特·奈辛瓦里那里。",oEN="Take Kravel's Crate to Hemet Nesingwary Jr. in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你的领子上是沙漠的尘土吗？\n\n嗯……如果我的鼻子没有毛病的话，那不是沙漠上的尘土，是沙漠盐！你去过闪光平原了，是不是？",pEN="Is that desert dust on your collar?\n\nHm... if my nose tells true, I'd say it's not desert dust, it's desert salt! Been to the Shimmering Flats, have you?",c="太好了，浓须给我的包裹！谢谢你，$n。这个木箱里装着特别尺寸的弹药——我父亲发誓——这对我们在丛林中很有帮助！\n\n这是你应得的报酬，告诉我，那个易怒的老克拉维尔最近过得怎么样？我打赌他还是不太好……",cEN="Great, my package from Koalbeard! Thank you <name>. This crate holds special-gauge ammunition, and it'll serve us well out in the jungle!\n\nHere's your pay, and tell me, how is crusty old Kravel these days? Still up to no good I'd wager..."}
Q[5763]={d="很久以前，有一个矮人来到这片土地上。他的名字叫做赫米特，他的目标是狩猎强大的野兽。他用起火枪来简直是出神入化，我们在一起狩猎了很多天，甚至遗忘了不同种族之间的隔阂与憎恨。\n\n现在他离开凄凉之地去了荆棘谷，我期待有一天他可以回来，这样我们就可以再次一起狩猎了。不过，他现在到一个未知的世界去狩猎了，所以他的儿子接替了他的位置。\n\n把这支科多兽角交给赫米特二世……我听说他在荆棘谷里扎了营，就在格罗姆高的北边。",dEN="Long ago, a dwarf came to this land. His name was Hemet and he wished to hunt great beasts. His skills with the rifle were uncanny, and we spent many days hunting together. Even the enmity between our peoples was forgotten.\n\nWhen he left for Stranglethorn, I vowed to one day welcome him back. Now he has gone on to hunt in lands unknown, but his son has taken his place.\n\nTake this kodo horn as a gift to Hemet Jr.. You will find him in Stranglethorn, north of the Grom'gol Base camp.",o="将鲁恩的科多兽角送到荆棘谷的赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世那里。",oEN="Bring Roon's Kodo Horn to Hemet Nesingwary Jr. in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="坐下，$c。不久之后，你就要重新杀入丛林之中了。",pEN="Sit, <class>. Soon enough you'll strike back into the jungle.",c="啊，这只角属于一位牛头人，罗恩·野鬃。我们一起猎杀凄凉之地的野兽，度过了愉快的时光。这么说罗恩是在邀请我回去，是吗？\n\n眼下我们在这片丛林里忙得脱不开身，不过还是谢谢你，$n。也许我下一次远征会带我回到凄凉之地，那片半人马的土地。",cEN="Ah, this horn belongs to a Tauren, Roon Wildmane. He and I had a good time hunting the beasts of Desolace. So Roon is inviting me back, is he?\n\nWe're neck deep in the jungle right now, but thank you, <name>. Perhaps my next expedition will take me back to Desolace, the land of the centaurs."}
Q[5781]={d="为了帮泰兰找回他失去的东西，你必须收集他过去曾经使用过的物品。\n\n第一件是一个玩具，那是他7岁的时候我送给他的。这个玩具是他最珍爱的礼物：一只小小的战锤，那是我的战锤的复制品。\n\n在我因叛国罪而被驱逐出去的时候，他妈妈告诉他我已经死了。他被带到了我的“坟墓”前，就在南边的墓室旁边，把那只小战锤和对我的记忆永远地埋在了那里。\n\n你必须去一趟墓室，拿回泰兰之锤。",dEN="To help Taelan regain what he has lost, you must gather items from his past.\n\nThe first such item is a toy that I gave to him on his 7th birthday. It was his most cherished possession: A miniature war hammer; an exact replica of my very own.\n\nAfter I was banished for treason, his mother told him that I had died. He was taken to my false grave at the Undercroft, where he buried the hammer along with my memory - forever.\n\nYou must venture to the Undercroft and recover Taelan's hammer.",o="到东瘟疫之地最南端的墓室去找回泰兰之锤。完成目标之后，返回提里奥·弗丁那里。",oEN="Travel to the Undercroft - at the southernmost section of the Eastern Plaguelands - and recover Taelan's Hammer. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",p="他必须得到救赎。",pEN="He must be redeemed.",c="<提里奥眨了眨眼睛，忍住将要流出来的泪水。>\n\n命运安排了我们的相遇，$n。你已经用你的仁慈善良赐福给我了。",cEN="<Tirion blinks to hold back tears.>\n\nIt was destiny that we meet, <name>. You have blessed me with your kindness."}
Q[5801]={d="你需要两块瑟银锭和一个强大的热源来锻造钥匙的主体部分。你得自己去找瑟银，但是我可以帮你找到热源。\n\n我们西面的安戈洛尔环形山里有一座温度极高的火山，它被称作火羽山。山顶的岩浆足以把瑟银和骨头熔在一起。你只需把买来的模具浸入熔岩湖中，然后就不用管其它的了。\n\n我的任务这就算是完成了。要完成你的钥匙的话，你还得去跟阿尔比顿再谈谈。",dEN="You need two bars of thorium and a powerfully hot heat source to forge the key stem. You're on your own for the thorium, but I can help with the heat.\n\nTo our west in Un'Goro Crater is Fire Plume Ridge - a simmering volcano. The lava lake up top is hot enough to fuse thorium and bone together. Your gold has bought you a mold that simply requires you to dip it in the lake up top; the lava will take care of the rest.\n\nThat's it on my end. To finish your key, you'll need to talk to Arbington again.",o="把骷髅钥匙模具和2块瑟银锭带到安戈洛尔环形山地区的火羽山顶部。在熔岩湖旁使用骷髅钥匙模具，铸造出一把未完工的骷髅钥匙。\n\n把未完工的骷髅钥匙交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的化学家阿尔比顿。",oEN="Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.\n\nBring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",p="你铸造出骷髅钥匙的主体部分了吗？很抱歉你得自己掏钱来买这个模具，但是我们必须各尽所能地共同对抗天灾军团。一旦你把未完成的钥匙交给我，你就可以开始准备铸造钥匙所需的最后一件物品了。\n\n虽然这并不简单，但是你为了进攻安多哈尔所做的准备将会初见成效。你会看到的。",pEN="Do you have the stem of the skeletal key finished? I'm truly sorry you had to bear the brunt of the fee to purchase the mold, but we must all do our part to counter the Scourge. Once you hand me the unfinished key, you'll be ready for the final item needed to complete its construction.\n\nIt won't be easy at all, but the work you've done to date in preparing for an assault on Andorhal will now start to pay for itself. You'll see.",c="我们终于拿到这支花费巨大的骷髅钥匙啦，$n！但是它还差一点才能完成，我们还得继续努力。最终，你将要面对安多哈尔城中的强敌……那个在废弃的城墙中徘徊的邪恶生物。\n\n我说的是“召唤者”阿拉基，一个巫妖，天灾军团中最强大的爪牙之一。",cEN="We've got quite the costly skeleton key there, don't we <name>? Still, it remains unfinished; the time has now come to put some focus behind our creation. To that end, you're going to have to face the ultimate foe we've been working towards facing in Andorhal... the being that runs the show within the ruined city walls.\n\nI'm speaking of Araj the Summoner - a lich, and one of the most powerful beings the Scourge calls as its own."}
Q[5802]={d="你需要两块瑟银锭和一个强大的热源来锻造钥匙的主体部分。你得自己去找瑟银，但是我可以帮你找到热源。\n\n我们西面的安戈洛尔环形山里有一座温度极高的火山，它被称作火羽山。山顶的岩浆足以把瑟银和骨头熔在一起。你只需把买来的模具浸入熔岩湖中，然后就不用管其它的了。\n\n我的任务这就算是完成了。要完成你的钥匙的话，你还得去跟迪瑟斯再谈谈。",dEN="You need two bars of thorium and a powerfully hot heat source to forge the key stem. You're on your own for the thorium, but I can help with the heat.\n\nTo our west in Un'Goro Crater is Fire Plume Ridge - a simmering volcano. The lava lake up top is hot enough to fuse thorium and bone together. Your gold has bought you a mold that simply requires you to dip it in the lake up top; the lava will take care of the rest.\n\nThat's it on my end. To finish your key, you'll need to talk to Dithers again.",o="把骷髅钥匙模具和2块瑟银锭带到安戈洛尔环形山地区的火羽山顶部。在熔岩湖旁使用骷髅钥匙模具，铸造出一把未完工的骷髅钥匙。\n\n把未完工的骷髅钥匙交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的药剂师迪瑟斯。",oEN="Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.\n\nBring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="你铸造出骷髅钥匙的主体部分了吗？很抱歉你得自己掏钱来买这个模具，但是我们必须各尽所能地共同对抗天灾军团。一旦你把未完成的钥匙交给我，你就可以开始准备铸造钥匙所需的最后一件物品了。\n\n虽然这并不简单，但是你为了进攻安多哈尔所做的准备将会初见成效。你会看到的。",pEN="Do you have the stem of the skeletal key finished? I'm truly sorry you had to bear the brunt of the fee to purchase the mold, but we must all do our part to counter the Scourge. Once you hand me the unfinished key, you'll be ready for the final item needed to complete its construction.\n\nIt won't be easy at all, but the work you've done to date in preparing for an assault on Andorhal will now start to pay for itself. You'll see.",c="我们终于拿到这支花费巨大的骷髅钥匙啦，$n！但是它还差一点才能完成，我们还得继续努力。最终，你将要面对安多哈尔城中的强敌……那个在废弃的城墙中徘徊的邪恶生物。\n\n我说的是“召唤者”阿拉基，一个巫妖，天灾军团中最强大的爪牙之一。",cEN="We've got quite the costly skeleton key there, don't we <name>? Still, it remains unfinished; the time has now come to put some focus behind our creation. To that end, you're going to have to face the ultimate foe we've been working towards facing in Andorhal... the being that runs the show within the ruined city walls.\n\nI'm speaking of Araj the Summoner - a lich, and one of the most powerful beings the Scourge calls as its own."}
Q[5803]={d="召唤者阿拉基从废墟之城的中心统治着安多哈尔。我们知道，在占据这座城市之前，他曾是通灵学院的领袖。要完成这把钥匙，我们需要他的印信——所谓圣甲虫——把它嵌在钥匙的头部。\n\n前往安多哈尔的中心，趁他现在被引了出来，打破他对这座城市的控制。一旦摧毁他，就从他的命匣中夺走那枚圣甲虫！\n\n通灵学院的钥匙正等着你，$n！",dEN="Araj the Summoner lords over Andorhal from the ruined city's heart. We know that he was the former leader of Scholomance before claiming the city as his own. To finish the key, we will need his signet - called a scarab - mounted as the head of the key.\n\nMake your way into the heart of Andorhal, and break his hold on the city now that he is drawn into the open. Once destroyed, seize his scarab from his fallen phylactery!\n\nThe Key to Scholomance awaits, <name>!",o="杀掉召唤者阿拉基，并将阿拉基的圣甲虫交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的化学家阿尔比顿。",oEN="Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands.",p="你必须明白，$n——只有摧毁“召唤者”阿拉基的肉身才能拿到完成钥匙所必需的材料。把阿拉基的圣甲虫交给我，我会将它制成钥匙的头部。",pEN="You've come this far <name> - only the destruction of the physical form of Araj the Summoner will provide us with the means to finish the key. Get Araj's scarab, by hook or by crook, and bring it to me - I will fuse it on as the head of the key.",c="是的，就是这样！我……又一次，我对你那深不可测的狡黠与勇气感到惊叹。你为了取得胜利愿意走到何种地步，简直令人难以置信。\n\n现在请允许我在这件事上尽一点绵薄之力。我配制了一种特殊的溶剂，能让我把那枚圣甲虫固定为钥匙的头部，并赋予它冲破通灵学院紧锁大门的力量。\n\n只需要一下子……$g真的:真的;",cEN="Yes, this is it! I... again, I'm absolutely amazed at the depths of your cunning and bravery. It simply boggles the mind the lengths you are willing to go in order achieve victory.\n\nAllow me now to play my small part in this. I've prepared a special solvent that should allow me to secure the scarab on as the head of the key, infusing it with the power to breech the locked door of Scholomance.\n\nThis should take just a moment..."}
Q[5804]={d="召唤者阿拉基从废墟之城的中心统治着安多哈尔。我们知道，在占据这座城市之前，他曾是通灵学院的领袖。要完成这把钥匙，我们需要他的印信——所谓圣甲虫——把它嵌在钥匙的头部。\n\n前往安多哈尔的中心，趁他现在被引了出来，打破他对这座城市的控制。一旦摧毁他，就从他的命匣中夺走那枚圣甲虫！\n\n通灵学院的钥匙正等着你，$n！",dEN="Araj the Summoner lords over Andorhal from the ruined city's heart. We know that he was the former leader of Scholomance before claiming the city as his own. To finish the key, we will need his signet - called a scarab - mounted as the head of the key.\n\nMake your way into the heart of Andorhal, and break his hold on the city now that he is drawn into the open. Once destroyed, seize his scarab from his fallen phylactery!\n\nThe Key to Scholomance awaits, <name>!",o="杀掉召唤者阿拉基，并将阿拉基的圣甲虫交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的药剂师迪瑟斯。",oEN="Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="你必须明白，$n——只有摧毁“召唤者”阿拉基的肉身才能拿到完成钥匙所必需的材料。把阿拉基的圣甲虫交给我，我会将它制成钥匙的头部。",pEN="You've come this far <name> - only the destruction of the physical form of Araj the Summoner will provide us with the means to finish the key. Get Araj's scarab, by hook or by crook, and bring it to me - I will fuse it on as the head of the key.",c="是的，就是这样！我……又一次，我对你那深不可测的狡黠与勇气感到惊叹。你为了取得胜利愿意走到何种地步，简直令人难以置信。\n\n现在请允许我在这件事上尽一点绵薄之力。我配制了一种特殊的溶剂，能让我把那枚圣甲虫固定为钥匙的头部，并赋予它冲破通灵学院紧锁大门的力量。\n\n只需要一下子……$g真的:真的;",cEN="Yes, this is it! I... again, I'm absolutely amazed at the depths of your cunning and bravery. It simply boggles the mind the lengths you are willing to go in order achieve victory.\n\nAllow me now to play my small part in this. I've prepared a special solvent that should allow me to secure the scarab on as the head of the key, infusing it with the power to breech the locked door of Scholomance.\n\nThis should take just a moment..."}
Q[5805]={d="欢迎来到魔兽世界！\n\n为了感谢您购买魔兽世界典藏版，请将这张礼券交给北郡山谷的梅里萨·斯蒂维尔。您将得到一份特别的礼物：陪伴您踏上冒险旅途的小宠物！\n\n再次感谢您的支持，请尽情享受魔兽世界的乐趣吧！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Merissa Stilwell in Goldshire. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将北郡礼品券交给梅里萨·斯蒂维尔。",oEN="Bring the Goldshire Gift Voucher to Merissa Stilwell in Goldshire.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5821]={d="一般来说，里格和我会率领我们的科多兽商队经过科卡尔半人马的领地。我们不时地听到半人马的战鼓声，而每当听到那种可怕的声音，我们就会停下。为了挣几个钱把命送掉可不值得！\n\n你猜怎么着，$c，如果你保护我们通过科尔卡半人马的村庄，我们会给你相应的报酬。\n\n这段路程很短，你需要做的就是让商队免受损失，然后你就可以从斯米德·瑟卡布斯库那里领取你的奖赏了——他在就在路的那一边。我们有些生意上的往来。",dEN="Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop. It's not good for business to be dead!\n\nI'll tell you what <class>, if you protect us past the Kolkar village we'll make it worth your while.\n\nIt's just a short distance, all you need to do is keep the caravan intact and you can pick up your reward from Smeed Scrabblescrew - he is down the road a bit. We do a little business together.",o="护送基泽尔顿商队通过科卡尔半人马村，然后与瑟卡布斯库的营地中的斯米德谈话以领取你的奖赏。",oEN="Escort the Gizelton Caravan past the Kolkar Centaur village. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",p="为什么我要等那可恶的商队？\n\n<斯米德看起来若有所悟。>\n\n哦，对了，他们付钱。你看到他们了吗？",pEN="Why do I find myself waiting for that blasted caravan?\n\n<Smeed looks enlightened.>\n\nOh yeah, they pay the bills. Have you seen them?",c="你知道，雇你这样的人来保护吉泽尔顿商队似乎并不划算。$c，如果我再高一点，我就能再接一份工作，坐在科多兽鞍边，扛着我双手能举起的最大的枪……然后让那些该死的半人马知道谁才是他们的老爹。",cEN="You know, it doesn't seem prosperous to be paying the likes of you to guard Gizelton Caravan. <class>, if I were a bit taller I could take on a second job and sit kodo-side-saddle with the biggest gun my hands could carry... and I'd show them blasted centaur who's their papa."}
Q[5841]={d="欢迎来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为特别感谢你购买了《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼券交给卡拉诺斯的约里·裂盔。你会得到一份礼物：一个小伙伴，陪伴你在追寻冒险与荣耀的旅途中同行。\n\n再次感谢！祝你在《魔兽世界》中玩得愉快，$g真的:真的;！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Yori Crackhelm in Kharanos. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将寒脊山谷礼品券交给尤里·碎盔。",oEN="Bring the Kharanos Gift Voucher to Yori Crackhelm in Kharanos.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Hello! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5842]={d="欢迎来到魔兽世界！\n\n为了感谢您购买魔兽世界典藏版，请将这张礼券交给幽影谷的奥雷希尔·语风。您将得到一份特别的礼物：陪伴您踏上冒险旅途的小宠物！\n\n再次感谢您的支持，请尽情享受魔兽世界的乐趣吧！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Orenthil Whisperwind in Dolanaar. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将幽影谷礼品券交给奥雷希尔·语风。",oEN="Bring the Dolanaar Gift Voucher to Orenthil Whisperwind in Dolanaar.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5843]={d="欢迎来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为感谢你购买《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼券交给剃刀岭的玛加。你会得到一份礼物：一个小伙伴，陪伴你在追寻冒险与荣耀的旅途中同行。\n\n再次感谢，祝你在《魔兽世界》中玩得愉快！$G",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Magga in Razor Hill. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将试炼谷礼品券交给玛卡尔。",oEN="Bring the Razor Hill Gift Voucher to Magga in Razor Hill.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Hello! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5844]={d="欢迎来到魔兽世界！\n\n为了感谢您购买魔兽世界典藏版，请将这张礼券交给纳拉其营地的沃恩·星眼。您将得到一份特别的礼物：陪伴您踏上冒险旅途的小宠物！\n\n再次感谢您的支持，请尽情享受魔兽世界的乐趣吧！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Vorn Skyseer in Bloodhoof Village. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将纳拉其营地礼品券交给沃恩·星眼。",oEN="Bring the Bloodhoof Village Gift Voucher to Vorn Skyseer in Bloodhoof Village.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5845]={d="当乌瑟尔被杀之后，白银之手骑士团完全瓦解了。\n\n这孩子竭尽所能地坚持着。当他被逼入饱经战乱的北谷中时，他做了最后的抵抗。\n\n骑士团是否还有别人活着，这还有什么意义吗？\n\n正是带着这样的想法，泰兰抛弃了骑士团的战旗，并否认了他所熟知的一切。他的荣誉被遗弃在了北谷那浸满鲜血的土地上。\n\n你必须到北谷去，找回那面代表失落的荣耀的战旗。",dEN="The Order of the Silver Hand was utterly decimated when Uther was slain.\n\nThe boy held out for as long as he could. Pushed to the war torn hamlet of Northdale, he made his final stand.\n\nWere any of the Order left alive, he thought - and did it matter?\n\nIt was with that thought that Taelan threw down the standard of the Order and renounced all that he had known. His honor left upon the blood soaked ground of Northdale.\n\nYou must travel to Northdale and recover that symbol of lost honor.",o="到东瘟疫之地东北部的北谷去，找到失落荣耀的象征。完成目标之后向提里奥·弗丁复命。",oEN="Travel to Northdale, in the northeastern region of the Eastern Plaguelands, and recover the Symbol of Lost Honor. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective.",p="我的信仰会指引你，$n。光明无界。",pEN="My faith will guide you, <name>. The Light knows no bounds.",c="即使在如此破败的情形下，它也仍然像我当初注视着它并宣誓效忠骑士团的那个时候一样充满了荣耀和骄傲。\n\n他即将得到救赎，也许还有我……",cEN="It is as glorious now - even in its tattered state - as the day I looked upon it and took my oath of allegiance.\n\nHis redemption comes and perhaps mine with it..."}
Q[5846]={d="当泰兰还是孩子的时候，我们全家经常去凯尔达隆度假。我们最后一次去那里时，一位名叫瑞弗蕾的艺术家为我们画了一张在湖边漫步的画。这是最能让我回想起与泰兰和卡兰德拉在一起时的美好时光的东西。那个时候我牵着我的妻子和儿子，心中充满了无限的爱意。\n\n如果那幅画还存在的话，你必须找到它。\n\n去凯尔达隆那座废弃的岛上看看那副画或者那个画家是不是还在吧。",dEN="When Taelan was a child, we would oft visit Caer Darrow on family excursions. On our last visit, an artist by the name of Renfray painted a portrait of us poised along the beachside. It is my fondest memory of both Taelan and Karandra. For it was at that moment, with my wife and son in my arms, that I felt a bond of love and family that I would never know again.\n\nIf this painting still exists, you must find it.\n\nTravel to the ruined island of Caer Darrow and see if the painting or the artist remain.",o="到凯尔达隆岛去，寻找关于那副画的线索。凯尔达隆岛在瘟疫之地南部的湖中央。",oEN="Travel to island of Caer Darrow, in the south-central region of the Plaguelands, and look for any clues as to the whereabouts of the painting.",c="我怎么能忘记？这座岛上的许多生灵在遭遇劫难之前都中了诅咒，从而丧失了他们最美好的记忆。\n\n我也中了诅咒，但是和他们不一样——我记得所有的东西……\n\n也许你询问我的东西就是我在这些遗迹中游荡的原因。也许我所告诉你的东西能让我得到彻底的解脱。",cEN="How could I forget? Many of the spirits on this island are cursed to relive their last happy memory before they met their tragic end.\n\nI too am cursed, but not as they - I am one of the few that remembers all...\n\nPerhaps this thing that you ask me is why I haunt these ruins. Perhaps this thing I tell you shall set me free."}
Q[5847]={d="欢迎来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为特别感谢你购买了《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼券交给布瑞尔的克莱尔·威洛尔。你会得到一份礼物：一个小伙伴，陪伴你在追寻冒险与荣耀的旅途中同行。\n\n再次感谢！祝你在《魔兽世界》中玩得愉快，$g真的:真的;！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Claire Willower in Brill. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将丧钟镇礼品券交给克莱尔·韦洛。",oEN="Bring the Brill Gift Voucher to Claire Willower in Brill.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位特别的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送你一件独一无二的礼物！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[5848]={d="那幅画……曾在我的工作室（白银之手兵营内）的墙上挂了许多年。\n\n提里奥的审判结束后，我知道自己不能再让那幅画留在明处。我把它藏在一个他们绝不会想到去找的地方。\n\n前往斯坦索姆，深入如今被称作血色堡垒的地方，寻找一幅绘着我们双子月亮的画。把那幅画的颜料刮掉，你就会发现我的杰作——《爱与家庭》。\n\n愿圣光指引你的行动。\"\"",dEN="The painting... It hung on the wall of my workshop - inside the Order's barracks - for years.\n\nAfter Tirion's trial was over, I knew that I could no longer keep the painting visible. I hid it in a place that they would never think to look.\n\nTravel to Stratholme and make your way deep inside what is now the Scarlet Bastion, search for a painting of our twin moons. Chip away at the paint until you uncover my master work, 'Of Love and Family.'\n\nMay the Light guide your actions.",o="到瘟疫之地北部的斯坦索姆去。你可以在血色十字军堡垒中找到“爱与家庭”这幅画，它被隐藏在另一幅描绘两个月亮的画之后。\n\n把这幅画还给提里奥·弗丁。",oEN="Travel to Stratholme, in the northern part of the Plaguelands. It is in the Scarlet Bastion that you will find the painting 'Of Love and Family,' hidden behind another painting depicting the twin moons of our world.\n\nReturn the painting to Tirion Fordring.",p="画，$n。你找到画了吗？",pEN="The painting, <name>. Do you have the painting?",c="<提里奥看到画以后几乎崩溃了。>\n\n<他开始像疯了一样掩面哭泣。>",cEN="<Tirion nearly collapses when he sees the painting.>\n\n<He begins to sob in an almost frenetic manner.>"}
Q[5861]={d="$n，你完成了我交给你的所有任务，你的救赎任务只剩最后一步了。\n\n你必须把你收集到的东西交给泰兰。不幸的是，泰兰和他的血色十字军一看见你就会立刻攻击你。\n\n要传递我的信件只有一个办法，那就是进行伪装。\n\n往南走，你可以在那边找到乌瑟尔之墓。我有个值得信赖的老朋友麦兰达住在那儿，找到她，把这些东西给她看看，她会帮助你的。",dEN="<name>, you have done all that I have asked thus far. Only one step remains in your quest of redemption.\n\nYou must deliver the items you have collected to Taelan. Unfortunately, Taelan and his Scarlet Crusaders will attack you on sight.\n\nThere is only one way in which to deliver my message and that is through a guise of deception.\n\nTo the south you will find Uther's tomb. An old and trusted confidant of mine, Myranda, now resides there - seek her out. Show her the items and she will assist you.",o="到瘟疫之地南部的乌瑟尔之墓去，将提里奥的礼物交给巫女麦兰达。",oEN="Travel to Uther's Tomb, located in the southern Plaguelands. Show Myranda the Hag Tirion's Gift.",p="我就知道会有这么一天的。",pEN="I knew this day would come.",c="提里奥还是玛登霍尔德领主时，我是他最信任的顾问。我公开反对白银之手骑士团下达的判决，因此因冒犯之罪被流放。\n\n他一生经历了太多心痛与失望，$r。你准备好纠正施加在弗丁家族身上的冤屈了吗，$g真的:真的;？",cEN="I was Tirion's most trusted advisor when he held rank as Lord of Mardenholde. I openly dissented the verdict passed by the Order of the Silver Hand and was banished for my insolence.\n\nHe has been through much heart ache and disappointment in his life, <race>. Are you prepared to right the wrongs set upon the Fordrings?"}
Q[5862]={d="我就是你会称之为幻术师的那种人。虽然我能创造出一个让你进入壁炉谷的幻象，但我要警告你：我的力量是有限度的。\n\n如果你走离这片土地太远，幻象的效果就会中断。这个法术需要我投入大量的专注与力量，因此我只能维持很短一段时间。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;时再来和我谈谈。",dEN="I am what you would call, an illusionist. Though I may be able to create an illusion to allow you entry into Hearthglen, be warned; my powers have their limitations.\n\nShould you travel too far from these lands, the effects of the illusion will cease. The spell itself takes a great amount of concentration and power from me, and thus, I can only sustain the effect for a short time.\n\nSpeak to me again when you are ready.",o="和巫女麦兰达交谈以获得血色幻象的效果。在血色幻象的掩护下深入壁炉谷，将提里奥的礼物交给大领主泰兰·弗丁。\n\n壁炉谷在北方，泰兰应该在玛登霍尔德城堡里面。",oEN="Speak to Myranda to gain the Scarlet Illusion. Travel to Hearthglen while under the Scarlet Illusion and deliver Tirion's Gift to Highlord Taelan Fordring.\n\nHearthglen is to the north, Taelan should be inside of Mardenholde Keep.",p="你是从提尔之手来的援军吗？",pEN="Are you the reinforcements from Tyr's Hand?",c="这是什么，士兵？\n\n<泰兰打开盒子查看里面的东西。>\n\n这……这不可能。但是你所带给我的东西……\n\n<泰兰单膝跪下，他的心跳加速。多年来沉积的愤怒即将爆发。>",cEN="What is this, soldier?\n\n<Taelan opens the box and begins to examine its contents.>\n\nThis... this cannot be true. But all that you have shown me...\n\n<Taelan falls to one knee, his heartbeat quickens. The fury of ages is about to be loosed upon this town.>"}
Q[5863]={d="最近一段时间，一大群食人魔来到了塔纳利斯。他们已经在南面占领了大片沙漠，并建立了一个营地。目前，食人魔的几个小团伙正在沙漠里四处游荡，其中有些已经侵占了古老的巨魔废墟。\n\n你必须去消灭砂槌食人魔！我们不能让这些家伙的势力壮大起来。\n\n他们的头目名叫掠夺者格玛洛克，我认为如果能杀掉他，食人魔的势力就会土崩瓦解。",dEN="Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound. Several smaller bands are currently wandering the desert, some of which have invaded the old troll ruins.\n\nThe Dunemaul Compound must be destroyed! We cannot allow these ogres to build up a force.\n\nThe leader of this band is named Gor'marok the Ravager; I believe that putting an end to his leadership will be the beginning of the end for the ogres.",o="加基森的安迪·利恩想要你攻入砂槌营地，杀死10个砂槌蛮兵、10个砂槌执行者，以及掠夺者格玛洛克。",oEN="Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager.",p="我很担心！请保重！",pEN="I'm so worried! Please be careful!",c="我很高兴你能成功，$n！谢谢你的帮助！",cEN="I'm so glad you were able to do this for me, <name>! Thanks for your help!"}
Q[5881]={d="部落让我们的部队保持充沛的精力，做得很好……自大战以来，我们在卡利姆多一直繁荣兴旺。\n\n我需要你帮我个忙。有个家伙叫格里什·长路，在南部贫瘠之地守护着大升降梯。把这封信交给他。信里会通知他，一名预备役战士正在前去接替他的岗位，这样他就能回家探亲了。他很久以前就提出了这个请求，听到这个好消息一定会很高兴。",dEN="The Horde does well keeping our troops fresh... since the Great War we have been prosperous here in Kalimdor.\n\nI need you to do me a favor, I have a lad by the name of Grish Longrunner protecting the Great Lift in the southern barrens. Give him this letter; the letter will let him know that I have a reserve warrior coming to relieve him of duty so that he can visit his family. He requested this sometime ago and he would be happy to hear the news.",o="马格兰希望你将信送到贫瘠之地升降梯的瑞什·远行者手中。",oEN="Maggran wishes you to deliver a letter to Grish Longrunner at the Great Lift in the Barrens.",p="你有来自马格兰的消息吗？",pEN="You have news from Maggran Earthbinder?",c="这真是个好消息，我在这儿守着这堆木头已经有很长时间了。现在我终于能跟家人团聚了……太好了！",cEN="This is great news; I have been sitting here guarding this hunk of wood for too long. Now I can spend some time with my family... Yippee!"}
Q[5882]={p="持有塞纳里奥信标，就能在那些为大局而被处死的污染野兽身上看到腐化的灵魂碎片。我把碎片碾磨成可用的材料，用来制作塞纳里奥植物药膏。我们将用药膏把被污染的植物重新治愈。\n\n作为这些碎片的交换，我会给你一些我已经配制好的塞纳里奥植物药膏。",pEN="Possessing a Cenarion Beacon allows one to sea a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again.\n\nIn exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",c="很好。这是你的塞纳里奥植物药膏。去费伍德森林搜寻被污染的植物吧，$n！无论它们在哪里，都用我给你的药膏净化它们。",cEN="Very well then, here are your Cenarion plant salves. Scour Felwood for corrupted plants, <name>! Wherever they are, use the salve I have given you to purify them."}
Q[5883]={p="如果你随身带着塞纳里奥信标，那么你在采矿的时候就会看到那些污染了矿脉的硫酸盐。我可以对那些硫酸盐进行净化，然后把它们制成塞纳里奥植物药膏。你可以用这种药膏来拯救堕落的大自然。\n\n给我弄些受污染的硫酸盐来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving.\n\nIf you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",c="干得好，这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。如果你能在费伍德森林采矿过程中找到更多的硝酸盐的话，记得一定要把它们交给我！这东西越多，我就能造成越多的药膏来。",cEN="Very well then, here's some Cenarion plant salve. If you find more vitriol when you mine in Felwood, remember to hold on to it for me! The more of it you find, the more salve I will be able to make."}
Q[5884]={p="训练有素的草药师可以用塞纳里奥信标探测到那些被污染的魔藤——这是费伍德森林被污染后所诞生的产物。我在这里进行了一些研究工作，现在我可以把魔藤转化为一种净化原料……然后就可以用它来制作我们所说的塞纳里奥植物药膏了。\n\n当你在费伍德森林里收集草药的时候，别忘了带着这个信标来寻找魔藤。给我弄些魔藤来，我就给你几份药膏作为交换。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve.\n\nWhen you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",c="干得漂亮，$n——每一株被净化的植物，都会帮助我们夺回费伍德森林。来，带上一些塞纳里奥植物药膏，深入森林吧。从腐化中夺回这片土地的事可等不了任何$r！",cEN="Excellent work <name> - every bit of this, once we purify it, will help us take back Felwood. Here, take some doses of Cenarion plant salve and head into the forest. The reclaiming of the land from the corruption waits for no <race>!"}
Q[5885]={p="训练有素的剥皮匠可以用塞纳里奥信标从费伍德森林里的生物身上找到受污染的毛皮，我可以把这些皮制作成塞纳里奥植物药膏。\n\n当你在这里采集兽皮的时候，记得带上信标。给我弄些受污染的毛皮来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you!\n\nWhen you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",c="这正是我所需要的。拿着这些药膏，把它们用于拯救费伍德森林吧。你一定要坚持到底，$n！",cEN="This is exactly what I need. Here - take these plant salves and use them to reclaim Felwood from the corruption. We must persevere, <name>!"}
Q[5886]={p="分解物品所得到的魔法精华中蕴藏着相当大的能量。我已经研究出一种方法，可以把炼金术所使用的原始精华材料转化为制作塞纳里奥植物药膏所需的材料。你不需要拿着塞纳里奥信标，只要是能够分解出次级虚空精华的物品都适用。\n\n我只需要一个次级虚空精华，作为交换，我可以给你一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。那些精华的能量很强大，所以即使很少的精华就能制作出不少的药膏了。",pEN="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work.\n\nI just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",c="这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏——我只需要一份次级虚空精华就够了，$n。这种精华是我迄今为止碰到过的最具魔法潜能的东西，我可以用它们来拯救这片森林。如果你需要更多的药膏，那就到这里来找我吧！",cEN="Here are some Cenarion plant salves - I only need one lesser nether essence for this, <name>. Essence is by far the most potent item I can make use of to turn swords into plowshares, as it were. If you need more salve, then find me here!"}
Q[5887]={p="只要你拿着塞纳里奥信标，你就能从那些堕落的野兽身上找到受污染的灵魂裂片，为了费伍德森林的未来，你一定要拿到那些裂片。我会对裂片进行研磨加工，将其制成塞纳里奥植物药膏。我们可以用这种药膏拯救那些奄奄一息的堕落植物。\n\n如果你能给我弄些裂片来，我就可以给你几份植物药膏。",pEN="Possessing a Cenarion beacon allows one to see a corrupted soul shard on those tainted beasts that are put down for the greater good. I grind shards into a usable reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. We will use that salve to turn corrupted plants into healthy ones again.\n\nIn exchange for these shards, I will give you some Cenarion plant salves I have already prepared.",c="很好。这是给你的塞纳里奥植物药膏。去费伍德森林搜寻被腐化的植物吧，$n！无论它们在哪里，都用我给你的药膏去净化它们。",cEN="Very well then, here are your Cenarion plant salves. Scour Felwood for corrupted plants, <name>! Wherever they are, use the salve I have given you to purify them."}
Q[5888]={p="如果你随身带着塞纳里奥信标，那么你在采矿的时候就会看到那些污染了矿脉的硫酸盐。我可以对那些硫酸盐进行净化，然后把它们制成塞纳里奥植物药膏。你可以用这种药膏来拯救堕落的大自然。\n\n给我弄些受污染的硫酸盐来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="If you possess a Cenarion beacon while mining in Felwood, you will be able to see tainted vitriol that corrupts a vein of raw metal. I know how to purify that vitriol and turn it into a reagent that goes into making Cenarion plant salve. You will then use that salve on plants you find in the wild that need saving.\n\nIf you have collected any tainted vitriol, I'll give you some Cenarion plant salve I have already prepared.",c="干得好，这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。如果你能在费伍德森林采矿过程中找到更多的硝酸盐的话，记得一定要把它们交给我！这东西越多，我就能造成越多的药膏来。",cEN="Very well then, here's some Cenarion plant salve. If you find more vitriol when you mine in Felwood, remember to hold on to it for me! The more of it you find, the more salve I will be able to make."}
Q[5889]={p="训练有素的草药师可以用塞纳里奥信标探测到那些被污染的魔藤——这是费伍德森林被污染后所诞生的产物。我在这里进行了一些研究工作，现在我可以把魔藤转化为一种净化原料……然后就可以用它来制作我们所说的塞纳里奥植物药膏了。\n\n当你在费伍德森林里收集草药的时候，别忘了带着这个信标来寻找魔藤。给我弄些魔藤来，我就给你几份药膏作为交换。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon allows a seasoned herbalist to spot insidious fel creep - a malfeasant product of Felwood's corruption. My work here has taught me the knowledge of purifying fel creep into a cleansing reagent... used in what we now refer to as Cenarion plant salve.\n\nWhen you gather herbs in Felwood, you should encounter the fel creep so long as you have the beacon. In exchange for what you bring to me, I will give you pre-made Cenarion plant salve.",c="干得漂亮，$n——每一株被净化的植物，都会帮助我们夺回费伍德森林。来，带上一些塞纳里奥植物药膏，深入森林吧。从腐化中夺回这片土地的事可等不了任何$r！",cEN="Excellent work <name> - every bit of this, once we purify it, will help us take back Felwood. Here, take some doses of Cenarion plant salve and head into the forest. The reclaiming of the land from the corruption waits for no <race>!"}
Q[5890]={p="训练有素的剥皮匠可以用塞纳里奥信标从费伍德森林里的生物身上找到受污染的毛皮，我可以把这些皮制作成塞纳里奥植物药膏。\n\n当你在这里采集兽皮的时候，记得带上信标。给我弄些受污染的毛皮来，我就可以给你几份药膏。",pEN="A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood. I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve. When you skin your kills here in Felwood, be sure to have a beacon on you!\n\nWhen you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made.",c="这正是我所需要的。拿着这些药膏，把它们用于拯救费伍德森林吧。你一定要坚持到底，$n！",cEN="This is exactly what I need. Here - take these plant salves and use them to reclaim Felwood from the corruption. We must persevere, <name>!"}
Q[5891]={p="分解物品所得到的魔法精华中蕴藏着相当大的能量。我已经研究出一种方法，可以把炼金术所使用的原始精华材料转化为制作塞纳里奥植物药膏所需的材料。你不需要拿着塞纳里奥信标，只要是能够分解出次级虚空精华的物品都适用。\n\n我只需要一个次级虚空精华，作为交换，我可以给你一些塞纳里奥植物药膏。那些精华的能量很强大，所以即使很少的精华就能制作出不少的药膏了。",pEN="The power of a disenchanted magical item is felt by the essence it creates. I've devised a way to turn raw essence used by enchanters into a suitable reagent for creating Cenarion plant salve. You don't need a Cenarion beacon for this; any suitably disenchanted item that yields lesser nether essences will work.\n\nI just need a single lesser nether essence; in exchange, I will give you Cenarion plant salves. The essence is extremely potent - a little definitely goes a long way!",c="这里是一些塞纳里奥植物药膏——我只需要一份次级虚空精华就够了，$n。这种精华是我迄今为止碰到过的最具魔法潜能的东西，我可以用它们来拯救这片森林。如果你需要更多的药膏，那就到这里来找我吧！",cEN="Here are some Cenarion plant salves - I only need one lesser nether essence for this, <name>. Essence is by far the most potent item I can make use of to turn swords into plowshares, as it were. If you need more salve, then find me here!"}
Q[5892]={d="在战斗开始前，我们曾在丹巴达尔的深铁矿洞储存了很多补给品。那个时候石腭怪对于那里的骚扰在我们强大的军力面前简直是不堪一击，但是现在我们必须和部落作战，所以没有足够的人手来控制深铁矿洞。\n\n我们需要深铁矿洞中的补给品，$n。进入矿洞，把它们取回来。",dEN="Before the fighting started, we stored supplies for Dun Baldar in the Irondeep mine. The troggs that surfaced there weren't much of a problem when we had spare troops to guard the mine, but now that we're fighting with the Horde we can't maintain control of Irondeep.\n\nWe need the supplies in Irondeep, <name>. Enter the mine and bring me a load of them.",o="把10份深铁矿洞补给品交给丹巴达尔的联盟军需官。",oEN="Bring 10 Irondeep Supplies to the Alliance Quartermaster in Dun Baldar.",p="你拿到补给品了吗，$n？我们的补给品一直都很缺乏！",pEN="Do you have the supplies, <name>? We can never have enough!",c="干得好！我一定会把这些补给品用在最需要它们的地方！谢谢你，$n！",cEN="Well done! I'll put these supplies to good use! Thanks, <name>!"}
Q[5893]={d="北边的冷齿矿洞是一个储存多余补给品的好东西，但是为了抵御雷矛部族的疯狂攻击，我们没有足够的士兵驻守在那座矿洞中。因此，现在那里经常落入联盟的控制，或被地下冒出来的渣滓们控制……\n\n但是我们仍然需要补给品，$n！去冷齿矿洞，帮我拿回一些补给品来。小心那里的敌人，战局瞬息万变……",dEN="The Coldtooth mine to the north was once an ideal place to store extra supplies, but now that the fighting with the Stormpikes grows fierce, we do not always have the spare warriors to station at the mine and protect it. And so, control of the mine often falls to the Alliance, or to underground denizens...\n\nBut we still need our supplies, <name>! Go to the Coldtooth mine and bring me a load of them. And be wary of enemies as you go; the tides of battle shift quickly in that place...",o="把10份冷齿矿洞补给品交给霜狼要塞的部落军需官。",oEN="Bring 10 Coldtooth Supplies to the Horde Quatermaster in Frostwolf Keep.",p="你去过冷齿矿洞了吗，$n？你拿到我要的补给品没有？",pEN="Have you been to the Coldtooth mine, <name>? Do you have the supplies I asked for?",c="啊，你拿到它们了。干得好，$n！这些补给品在那个黑暗的矿洞中放了太久，沾了不少灰尘，但是我们一定会好好利用它们的。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你为维持我们的战斗力做出了杰出的贡献。",cEN="Ah, you got them. Good work, <name>! These supplies are a little musty from sitting in that dark mine for so long, but we'll make use of them nonetheless.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your deeds are vital to the maintenance of our fighting forces."}
Q[5901]={d="为了削弱血色十字军，我要拿下那座对他们来说至关重要的伐木场。我相信，如果他们损失了这么重要的一个资源，定然会在构建防御和重建城镇的过程中捉襟见肘。你愿意帮我的忙吗，$n？\n\n把这个瓶子拿到东瘟疫之地的病木林去，在那里的蚁丘上抓些白蚁，放进这个瓶子里。当你收集到了足够多的白蚁之后就回到我这里来。",dEN="So, to bring pain and strife to the Scarlet Crusade, I want to take their precious lumber mill from them. I'm sure the loss of such a resource will cause them a great deal of harm in defending and rebuilding the town for their own reasons. Will you help me, <name>?\n\nStart by taking this jar to Plaguewood in the Eastern Plaguelands. Fill it with the termites you find in their mounds throughout the woods. Come back when you have enough.",o="在东瘟疫之地的蚁丘上使用空的白蚁瓶。当你收集了100只瘟疫白蚁之后，就回到提瑞斯法林地的亡灵壁垒去找米克·莱文。",oEN="Use the Empty Termite Jar on the Termite Mounds in Eastern Plaguelands. After you've gathered 100 Plagueland Termites, return to Mickey Levine at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你拿到白蚁了吗，$n？我想像你这样聪明的$c一定早就想到了。\n\n等我们有了足够多的白蚁，就能确保再也没人能使用那座伐木场了，$g真的:真的;！",pEN="Do you have the termites yet, <name>? I am sure it is obvious to a smart <class> like yourself.\n\nOnce we have enough of them, we'll make sure no one can use the lumber mill ever again!",c="谢谢你，$n。这些够用了。\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;，我们就可以进入下一步了。",cEN="These will do nicely, <name>. Thank you.\n\nIf you're ready, we can get on with the next step."}
Q[5902]={d="既然我们有足够的白蚁了，就把这个加固钢桶带到壁炉谷以南的北岭伐木场去。你会在通往镇子的道路西侧找到它。\n\n到了那里，把桶放在伐木场的中央。找个合适的位置，比如木箱上，然后打开桶。\n\n你的任务到此为止，剩下的会自行发生。你只需回来领取我因你相助而给你的报酬。",dEN="Now that we have plenty of termites, take this steel reinforced barrel to the Northridge Lumber Mill south of Hearthglen--you'll find it to the west of the road that leads you up to the town.\n\nOnce there, place the barrel in the center of the lumber mill; someplace high, like on a crate or something.\n\nAfter you open it, the rest should take care of itself. Just come back here and I'll reward you for helping me.",o="到西瘟疫之地的北山伐木场去找个合适的地方，在那里放下一桶瘟疫白蚁。",oEN="Find someplace suitable in the center of the Northridge Lumber Mill in Western Plaguelands to place the Barrel of Plagueland Termites.",c="当你把木桶放在木箱上之后，白蚁就开始不停地忙碌了。",cEN="The termites are obviously getting restless as you place the barrel on top of the crate."}
Q[5903]={d="我试过很多方法来清除血色十字军，但是从来都没有成功过。好吧，我决定更换一下行事方法，我要让他们吃吃苦头。\n\n如果你愿意帮我的话，我准备用最恐怖的白蚁来毁灭他们的伐木场。\n\n在靠近斯坦索姆的病木林里有一种被瘟疫扭曲的白蚁。找到它们的巢穴，在瓶子里装满白蚁，然后我们就把它们放到血色十字军的伐木场里！",dEN="I've tried many times to rout out the Scarlet Crusade through force alone, but to no avail. So, as an alternative, I've decided to make their lives more difficult.\n\nIf you are willing to help, I want to infest that lumber mill with the most terrible species of termites ever found.\n\nIn Plaguewood, near the once-great Stratholme, there is a breed that survived the plague and the Scourge combined. Find their mounds and fill this jar with them, so we can prepare them to be unleashed on the Crusade.",o="在东瘟疫之地的蚁丘上使用空的白蚁瓶。当你收集了100只瘟疫白蚁之后，就回到西瘟疫之地的冰风岗去找纳萨尼尔·杜马。",oEN="Use the Empty Termite Jar on the Termite Mounds in Eastern Plaguelands. After you've gathered 100 Plagueland Termites, return to Nathaniel Dumah at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="你找到蚁丘了吗，$n？我听说病木林里到处都是这种巢穴。",pEN="Did you find the termite mounds, <name>? I've heard they are all over Plaguewood.",c="这些就足够了，$n。谢谢你。看看它们……密密麻麻地抱成一团。我都有点为十字军感到难过了，但是为了让他们得不到那座伐木场，我们必须这样做，对吗？",cEN="These will do nicely, <name>. Thank you. Just look at them... so many of them all huddled up. I almost feel bad for the Crusade, but then again, it was never their mill to take, now, was it?"}
Q[5904]={d="现在我们有足够的白蚁了，把这只铁桶拿到壁炉谷南边的北山伐木场去——就在那条通往镇子的小路的西边。\n\n当你到了那里之后，就在伐木场的中间找个高一点的地方，比如一只箱子或者别的什么东西，把桶放在上面，然后打开桶盖。这样，白蚁就会开始它们的工作，然后让那个伐木场彻底完蛋。",dEN="Now that we have the termites, take this steel reinforced barrel to the Northridge Lumber Mill south of Hearthglen--you'll find it to the west of the road that leads you up to the town.\n\nOnce there, place the barrel in the center of the lumber mill; find someplace suitable, like on a crate and then open it. The termites should do their work from there and make the mill useless to the Crusade.",o="到西瘟疫之地的北山伐木场去找个合适的地方，在那里放下一桶瘟疫白蚁。",oEN="Find someplace suitable in the center of the Northridge Lumber Mill in Western Plaguelands to place the Barrel of Plagueland Termites.",c="当你把木桶放在木箱上之后，白蚁就开始不停地忙碌了。",cEN="The termites are obviously getting restless as you place the barrel on top of the crate."}
Q[5924]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我注意到玛斯雷·驭熊者已经放出话来，说想要和你谈谈。看样子你即将开始崭新的生活——去接受德鲁伊的训练，他将亲自训练你。玛斯雷是大德鲁伊的助手，也是泰达希尔中最为睿智、最为威严的德鲁伊之一。\n\n他居住在达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区，就在范达尔·鹿盔所在的那棵树的第二层。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nIt has come to my attention that Mathrengyl Bearwalker has put out word that he wishes to speak with you. It seems that your training as a druid is about to take on a new life, and he will be training you personally. Mathrengyl is the direct assistant to the Arch Druid himself, and is one of the most sage and august druids you'll find in Teldrassil.\n\nHe is located in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus, on the second floor of Fandral Staghelm's tree.",o="与达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的玛斯雷·驭熊者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",c="我很高兴你找到了来这里的路，年轻的$c。是时候迈出一大步，进入一个更广阔的世界了。\n\n塞纳留斯的每一个子民内心都回荡着为自然服务的召唤。动物和植物既是我们的朋友，也是我们的责任。我们选择献出一生去维护平衡，既为了它们，也为了我们自己。你在这个世界上的第一步，将是学习熊之道，学习身体与心灵的力量。\n\n做好准备！",cEN="I am glad you found your way here today, young <class>. The time has come for you to take a large step into a much larger world.\n\nInside each of Cenarius' children is the call to serve nature. Animals and plants are our friends as well as our charges. We choose to devote our lives as preservers of balance for their sakes as well as our own. Your first step into this world will be to learn of the ways of the bear, and to learn strength of body and heart.\n\nReady yourself!"}
Q[5925]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我注意到玛斯雷·驭熊者已经放出话来，说想要和你谈谈。看样子你即将开始崭新的生活——去接受德鲁伊的训练，他将亲自训练你。玛斯雷是大德鲁伊的助手，也是泰达希尔中最为睿智、最为威严的德鲁伊之一。\n\n他居住在达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区，就在范达尔·鹿盔所在的那棵树的第二层。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nIt has come to my attention that Mathrengyl Bearwalker has put out word that he wishes to speak with you. It seems that your training as a druid is about to take on a new life, and he will be training you personally. Mathrengyl is the direct assistant to the Arch Druid himself, and is one of the most sage and august druids you'll find in Teldrassil.\n\nHe is located in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus, on the second floor of Fandral Staghelm's tree.",o="与达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的玛斯雷·驭熊者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",c="我很高兴你找到了来这里的路，年轻的$c。是时候迈出一大步，进入一个更广阔的世界了。\n\n塞纳留斯的每一个子民内心都回荡着为自然服务的召唤。动物和植物既是我们的朋友，也是我们的责任。我们选择献出一生去维护平衡，既为了它们，也为了我们自己。你在这个世界上的第一步，将是学习熊之道，学习身体与心灵的力量。\n\n做好准备！",cEN="I am glad you found your way here today, young <class>. The time has come for you to take a large step into a much larger world.\n\nInside each of Cenarius' children is the call to serve nature. Animals and plants are our friends as well as our charges. We choose to devote our lives as preservers of balance for their sakes as well as our own. Your first step into this world will be to learn of the ways of the bear, and to learn strength of body and heart.\n\nReady yourself!"}
Q[5927]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我注意到图拉克·符文图腾已经放出话来，说想要和你谈谈。看样子你即将开始崭新的生活——去接受德鲁伊的训练，他将亲自训练你。图拉克是大德鲁伊的助手，也是最为睿智、最为威严的德鲁伊之一。\n\n他居住在雷霆崖，就在长者高地上的塞纳里奥议会大帐里。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nIt has come to my attention that Turak Runetotem has put out word that he wishes to speak with you. It seems that your training as a druid is about to take on a new life, and he will be training you personally. Turak is one of the Arch Druid's assistants; he is known as a wise and patient druid, and he should teach you well.\n\nHe is located in Thunder Bluff, inside the Cenarion Circle's main tent on the Elder Rise.",o="与雷霆崖长者高地上的图拉克·符文图腾谈话。",oEN="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",c="我很高兴你找到了来这里的路，年轻的$c。是时候迈出一大步，进入一个更广阔的世界了。\n\n塞纳留斯的每一个子民内心都回荡着为自然服务的召唤。动物和植物既是我们的朋友，也是我们的责任。我们选择献出一生去维护平衡，既为了它们，也为了我们自己。你在这个世界上的第一步，将是学习熊之道，学习身体与心灵的力量。\n\n做好准备！",cEN="I am glad you found your way here today. young <class>. The time has come for you to take a large step into a much larger world.\n\nInside each of Cenarius' children is the call to serve nature. Animals and plants are our friends as well as our charges. We choose to devote our lives as preservers of balance for their sakes as well as our own. Your first step into this world will be to learn of the ways of the bear, and to learn strength of body and heart.\n\nReady yourself!"}
Q[5928]={d="朋友，打扰一下……\n\n我注意到图拉克·符文图腾已经放出话来，说想要和你谈谈。看样子你即将开始崭新的生活——去接受德鲁伊的训练，他将亲自训练你。图拉克是大德鲁伊的助手，也是最为睿智、最为威严的德鲁伊之一。\n\n他居住在雷霆崖，就在长者高地上的塞纳里奥议会大帐里。",dEN="Excuse me, friend...\n\nIt has come to my attention that Turak Runetotem has put out word that he wishes to speak with you. It seems that your training as a druid is about to take on a new life, and he will be training you personally. Turak is one of the Arch Druid's assistants; he is known as a wise and patient druid, and he should teach you well.\n\nHe is located in Thunder Bluff, inside the Cenarion Circle's main tent on the Elder Rise.",o="与雷霆崖长者高地上的图拉克·符文图腾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.",c="我很高兴你找到了来这里的路，年轻的$c。是时候迈出一大步，进入一个更广阔的世界了。\n\n塞纳留斯的每一个子民内心都回荡着为自然服务的召唤。动物和植物既是我们的朋友，也是我们的责任。我们选择献出一生去维护平衡，既为了它们，也为了我们自己。你在这个世界上的第一步，将是学习熊之道，学习身体与心灵的力量。\n\n做好准备！",cEN="I am glad you found your way here today. young <class>. The time has come for you to take a large step into a much larger world.\n\nInside each of Cenarius' children is the call to serve nature. Animals and plants are our friends as well as our charges. We choose to devote our lives as preservers of balance for their sakes as well as our own. Your first step into this world will be to learn of the ways of the bear, and to learn strength of body and heart.\n\nReady yourself!"}
Q[5941]={d="你已经收集了达隆郡之战中留下来的许多遗物。每次你给我带回更多的遗物，我的心就更加向往我的家园……更加急切地想要改变它的命运。\n\n我觉得这不可能，但是克罗米——那个安多哈尔奇怪的侏儒告诉我说，这是有可能的。她说你可以拯救达隆郡！\n\n她要我收集所有的遗物，然后由你去把那些东西交给她。她说她仍然在安多哈尔的废弃旅店里等你。",dEN="You have gathered many relics of the battle of Darrowshire. Each time you returned with more, my heart yearned for my village... yearned to protect it from its fate.\n\nI know that cannot be, but Chromie, that strange gnome in Andorhal, tells me it is possible. She says you can save Darrowshire!\n\nShe asked me to gather together the relics, and to have you bring them to her. She said that she awaits you in the ruined inn of Andorhal.",o="将一包遗物交给安多哈尔的克罗米。",oEN="Take the Bundle of Relics to Chromie in Andorhal.",p="我一直和你的朋友卡林保持联系。他对自己的村庄遭受的厄运感到极度痛苦，但是他对你评价很高并知道你可以把事情搞定。\n\n哦，但是好像我有点离题了……$n，你拿到我需要的圣物了吗？",pEN="I have been in contact with your friend Carlin. He feels great pain for the doom of his village, but he speaks very highly of you and knows that you can set things right.\n\nOh, but I'm drifting from the subject at hand... <name>, do you have the relics I asked for?",c="啊，没错。这些东西放在一起就可以施放强大的法术，足以唤醒达隆郡的灵魂。\n\n有了这个法术，再加上一些运气，我们就可以拯救约瑟夫·雷德帕斯！",cEN="Ah yes, there they are. Together they weave a powerful spell, one that will raise the spirits of Darrowshire.\n\nWith that spell, and with a little luck, we can save Joseph Redpath!"}
Q[5942]={d="爸爸让我给你这把钥匙，他说你可以用它打开房子后面的一只箱子。\n\n他还要让我谢谢你。你是不是帮过他？你有没有告诉他你帮我找到了我的洋娃娃？\n\n好吧，这里是钥匙。谢谢你，$n。谢谢你！你是个好心的$g先生:小姐！",dEN="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house.\n\nHe also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him? Did you tell him you found my doll?\n\nWell here's the key. And thank you <name>. Thank you! You're a very nice <man/lady>!",o="用约瑟夫的钥匙打开约瑟夫的箱子。",oEN="Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",p="这只箱子非常破旧，表面满是污迹。",pEN="This chest is old and covered in grime.",c="箱子打开了……",cEN="The key fits the lock, and the chest opens..."}
Q[5943]={d="你看上去是个能干的$r，想不想赚点外快？考克和我为了赚钱而开始了这趟旅程，但是我们不知道此行的凶险！\n\n前面就是玛诺洛克集会所……通常那里的恶魔会忽视我们，但是这一次，有些东西把科多兽赶得四散惊逃。我愿意付钱让你保护我们通过玛诺洛克集会所，在我们安全通过之后，你就可以到瑟卡布斯库的营地去，从我们商业伙伴斯米德那里获得你的奖励。",dEN="You look like a capable <race>. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!\n\nUp ahead is Mannoroc Coven... normally the demons ignore us but something has the kodos spooked this time. I'll pay you to protect the caravan past Mannoroc Coven. Once we are safely past you can receive your reward from our business associate Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",o="护送基泽尔顿车队通过玛诺洛克集会所，然后与瑟卡布斯库的营地的斯米德谈一谈，领取你的奖励。",oEN="Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",p="你要知道，如果那个车队没有到达目的地的话，那我就完了！你不是带来厄运的使者，是不是？\n\n<斯米德擦了一下额头。>\n\n感谢贪婪女神！",pEN="You know, if that caravan were to ever disappear I would be ruined! You're not the bearer of bad news about the caravan, are you?\n\n<Smeed wipes his brow.>\n\nThank the goddess of greed!",c="不知道用那么多钱来请人保护基泽尔顿车队是否值得。考克和里格每周只赚一个金币，但是只要他们一直为我的科多兽付钱，我就不会去管他们生意的事情。",cEN="Not sure it's a prosperous proposition to be paying so much money to protect the Gizelton Caravan. Cork and Rigger only make one gold piece a week, but as long as they keep paying for my kodos I can care less how they run their business."}
Q[5944]={d="很久以来，我一直是大十字军的傀儡。与血色十字军后来变成的样子作战，又有什么意义呢？几十年过去了，可仍然是关于我父亲的记忆——那些珍贵的记忆——让我活了下来。\n\n我有一些梦，$g陌生人:陌生人;。在梦里，父亲就在我身边。他骄傲地站在我身旁，看着我宣誓加入骑士团。我们并肩与天灾军团的大军作战。我们为联盟、为洛丹伦带来荣耀。\n\n我不想再做这些梦了。\n\n带我去见他。",dEN="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become? It has been decades, yet the memories of my father; those precious memories, they are what have kept me alive.\n\nI have dreams, stranger. In these dreams my father is with me. He stands proudly at my side as I am inducted into the Order. We battle legion of Scourge, side by side. We bring honor to the Alliance, to Lordaeron.\n\nI want not to dream anymore.\n\nTake me to him.",o="护送泰兰·弗丁走出壁炉谷。",oEN="Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen.",p="<提里奥恢复了镇静。>",pEN="<Tirion regains his composure.>",c="我的儿子死在这些怪物手中，这段记忆绝不会随着岁月的流逝而消失在我的脑海中。虽然我非常悲伤，但是我知道骑士团已经重生了。\n\n现在我是新的白银之手骑士团大领主。\n\n这些是我过去所拥有的东西，也是我可以给你的所有东西。请你收下它们当作我对你的感谢，它们这些年来一直跟随着我。\n\n希望我们可以再次相见，在更美好的时代，或者在以往的记忆之中……经过了激烈的战斗……我的梦想得到了救赎。",cEN="The death of my son at the hands of these monsters will not pass without incident. Take solace in knowing that the Order is reborn.\n\nI now take my place as Highlord of the new Order of the Silver Hand.\n\nThese possessions of my past - they are all that I have to offer for all that you have done. Please, take these as a symbol of my gratitude; all have served me well over the years.\n\nMay we meet again, in better times, and reminisce of days long past... battles hard fought... dreams redeemed."}
Q[5961]={d="看到$g久经沙场的老手:久经沙场的老手;加入我们的事业，我非常高兴。每过一天，我们的队伍就更壮大、更强大。也许你已$g准备好:准备好;检验自己的胆识了，$c？\n\n我麾下最出色的人中就有纳萨诺斯，如今被称为凋零者。我们行列中很少有人比他更忠诚、更有活力。\n\n去东瘟疫之地找他。他住在玛瑞斯农场，偶尔也会在荒芜的废土上游荡，杀死所有挡路的联盟或天灾军团成员。",dEN="It pleases me greatly to see the battle hardened join our cause. Our numbers grow in size and strength as each day passes. Perhaps you are prepared to test your mettle, <class>?\n\nAmong the first of my champions was Nathanos, now known as the Blightcaller. Few exist with more dedication or vigor amidst our ranks.\n\nSeek him out in the Eastern Plaguelands. He resides at the Marris Stead; occasionally roaming the decimated wastes, slaying all Scourge and Alliance filth that cross his path.",o="与东瘟疫之地的纳萨诺斯·凋零者交谈。据说他如今住在玛瑞斯农场。|n",oEN="Speak with Nathanos Blightcaller in the Eastern Plaguelands. He is said to have taken up residence at the Marris Stead.",c="黑暗女士想必并不认为你$g配得上:配得上;觐见她的勇士。你是来喂我的猎犬的，对吧？除此之外，我想不出你还有什么理由来打扰我。",cEN="Surely the Dark Lady does not believe you worthy to meet her champion. You are here to feed my hounds, yes? There could be no other reason for this interruption."}
Q[5981]={d="大约四千年前，泰兰德·语风从狂暴的巨人手中救了霜刃豹女王的命。从那个时候开始，霜刃豹就是暗夜精灵的盟友。\n\n那些对霜刃豹造成极大威胁的巨人依然在这附近徘徊——霜槌巨人占据了这里南边的一处山谷。\n\n向霜刃豹证明你的忠诚吧；以霜刃豹女王希洛塔姆的名义杀死那些巨人！",dEN="Around 4,000 years ago, Tyrande Whisperwind saved the life of the frostsaber queen, at the hands of rampaging giants. Since then, the frostsabers have been allies of the night elves.\n\nThese same giants that once were a danger to the frostsabers, still exist not too far from here. They are called the frostmaul, and they have taken over the large valley to the south.\n\nProve your loyalty to the frostsabers; kill these giants in the name of the frostsaber queen, Shy-Rotam!",o="雷沃·霜翼要你去杀死4个霜槌巨人和4个霜槌保卫者。",oEN="Rivern Frostwind wants you to kill 4 Frostmaul Giants and 4 Frostmaul Preservers.",p="你必须持续的证明你的忠诚，$n。",pEN="You must continue to prove yourself, <name>.",c="非常好，$n。你已经适时地表现出你的决心了。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. Your determination has been duly noted."}
Q[6004]={d="我以间谍的身份来此暗中搞破坏，并负责侦查壁炉谷的防御力量。联盟中的一些人认为这座小镇的重要性并不局限于其历史意义，不过这与我的工作无关。但无论如何，我要好好休息一下才有精力继续做事。\n\n如果你愿意的话，我愿意出大价钱换取你的帮助。沿着堡垒附近的营帐往南查看。如果你能证明自己的实力，或许你就能帮上我的大忙呢。",dEN="I was sent as a scout to do some damage and gauge the strength of Hearthglen's defenses. Some people in the Alliance feel the little town has more than historical importance. It's not my job to question what that importance is, but regardless, I'm in no shape to continue until I rest up.\n\nIf you're willing, I'd pay handsomely for some help. Start south of here at their camp near the small bulwark they've set up. If you prove strong enough, maybe I could get your help with my main goal.",o="杀死2个血色医护员、2个血色猎人、2个血色魔法师和2个血色骑士，然后回到西瘟疫之地的科尔斯塔·迪普沙东那儿。",oEN="Kill 2 Scarlet Medics, 2 Scarlet Hunters, 2 Scarlet Magi and 2 Scarlet Knights before returning to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",p="进展如何，$n？它们比你想象得更加强大吗？我希望不是。如果换成是我的话，还不知要费多大的劲呢。",pEN="How is it going, <name>? Are they stronger than you thought? I hope not. If I'm going to follow through here, then it's going to require a heck of a lot more strength than what I've already asked you to do.",c="干得好，$n。你这么快就搞定了，这真让人吃惊。谢谢你。\n\n血色十字军的教义是扭曲的。和暴风城中的所有人一样，我也信仰光明，但是十字军的行为却表明他们只想杀死那些不忠于他们的人……连无辜者也不能幸免。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I'm amazed you dealt with them so quickly. Thank you.\n\nI have yet to meet anyone that approves of the Scarlet Crusade and their methods. I believe in the Light as much as anyone else in Stormwind, but they've demonstrated that they only want to kill anyone not loyal to their movement... even innocents."}
Q[6021]={d="在经历了瘟疫之地的一次次祸事之后……我们还得防着潜行者。你能相信吗？他们不是普通的潜行者，而是巨魔潜行者。\n\n不是普通的巨魔潜行者。而是亡灵巨魔潜行者！\n\n统帅这伙潜行者的是一个身体魁梧的亡灵巨魔，流亡者塞达尔，他们趁着夜色来到这里，从下面的坑里盗取尸体，然后把尸体运到他们那邪恶的藏身之所——西边的墓室中。\n\n到那儿去，干掉塞达尔，$n。我对他深恶痛绝！",dEN="Can you believe that, after all the trouble we have in the plaguelands... we have to worry about thieves too? And not just normal thieves, troll thieves.\n\nAnd not just normal troll thieves. Dead troll thieves!\n\nThey're led by this big, dead troll named Zaeldarr the Outcast, and they come here at night and steal bodies from the pit below, then take them back to their evil, dead troll hideout--the Undercroft to the west.\n\nGo there and take out Zaeldarr, <name>. I'm sick to death of his mischief!",o="将塞达尔的头颅交给圣光之愿礼拜堂的护理者奥林。",oEN="Bring Zaeldarr's Head to Caretaker Alen at Light's Hope Chapel.",p="你找到他的藏身之处了吗，$n？你有没有干掉塞达尔？",pEN="Did you find the hideout, <name>? Did you take care of Zaeldarr?",c="好极了，你杀掉他了！我希望你也让他的同伙吃足了苦头！",cEN="Great, you got him! And I hope you taught his gang a lesson too!"}
Q[6022]={d="你留在我农场的这段时间里，杀人要有目的。\n\n你的第一个任务是喂我的猎犬。\n\n拿上这个研钵和研杵，前往科林十字路口。到了那里，你会发现有大量天灾军团成员可供宰杀。我需要它们新鲜尸体上的活体腐液。把那些活体腐液取来，在研钵里研磨，然后让它静置凝固。再把凝固的腐液带回来给我。\n\n还有，蠢货，你要明白，亡灵身上的活体腐液不会“活”太久。你必须杀得够快！\"\"",dEN="You kill with purpose while you remain on my stead.\n\nYour first task is to feed my hounds.\n\nTake this mortar and pestle and travel to Corin's Crossing. Once there, you will find a robust selection of Scourge to slaughter. From their fresh carcasses I need living rot. Take that living rot and grind it up in the mortar, then let it sit to coagulate. Bring the coagulated rot back here.\n\nAnd imbecile, realize that living rot from the undead doesn't remain 'living' for very long. You must kill quickly!",o="到东边的考林路口去屠杀镇里的亡灵天灾。在10分钟内收集7块生命腐质，使用研钵和捣杵将其研磨成凝固腐质。",oEN="Travel to Corin's Crossing to the east and slaughter the Scourge that inhabit the town. Collect 7 pieces of Living Rot in under 10 minutes. Use the Mortar and Pestle to grind the Living Rot into Coagulated Rot.",p="你在哭吗？如果这对你来说太“乏味”了，“$g英雄:英雄;”，我建议你去找黑暗女士，向她哭诉我在农场里对你的种种虐待。\n\n现在，滚出我的视线！\"\"",pEN="Are you crying? If this is too 'tedious' for you, 'hero,' I recommend that you head back to the Dark Lady and inform her of the horrible mistreatment you received at my farmstead.\n\nNow get out of my sight!",c="真遗憾。我原本希望用你来喂我的狗。\n\n<纳萨诺斯叹了一口气。>\n\n好吧，至少现在它们有东西可以吃了。",cEN="Disappointing. I was hoping that I'd be feeding you to my hounds, instead.\n\n<Nathanos sighs.>\n\nWell, at least you they'll have something to eat."}
Q[6023]={d="我的真正任务是要削弱血色十字军的外围力量，然后潜入壁炉谷，探查他们的军队规模。现在我对这个行动还没有什么设想，因此我也许要再次请你帮助我，可以吗，$n？根据我所收集的资料，血色十字军在镇外部署了两个主要成员：猎人莱德雷和骑士杜尔根。杀了他们，这样我们就离成功更近了一步。他们应该驻扎在壁炉谷小径那里，就在哨塔的附近。",dEN="My real mission was to weaken the Scarlet Crusade's outlying forces and then infiltrate Hearthglen to gauge their numbers. I'm still in no shape to do it on my own, so perhaps I could ask you to aid me again, <name>? From what information I gathered before being discovered, the Crusade has two important members that are the backbone of their forces outside the town: Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen. Kill them, and we're making progress. They should be along Hearthglen Pass outside the town proper.",o="杀掉猎人莱德雷和骑士杜尔根，然后向西瘟疫之地的科尔斯塔·迪普沙东复命。",oEN="Kill Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen before returning to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",p="你找到他们了吗，$n？如果你能干掉他们两个，我就可以进入壁炉谷好好侦察一番了。没有你的帮助，我是根本做不到这些的。请你一定要帮我找到莱德雷和杜尔根。",pEN="Have you found them yet, <name>? With the two of them taken care of, I can proceed to enter Hearthglen to take a closer look at their setup. I can't do it without your help. Please, find Radley and Durgen for me.",c="谢谢你，$n。你给予我的帮助比我预想的还要多。这里的空气正在消磨我的意志，我感到很累，在这里待得越久，我就越虚弱。\n\n我不能确定如何才能够潜入壁炉谷侦察，然后对血色十字军的实力作出正确评估。\n\n但是那是以后的事情了，在你离开这里之前，请拿着这个……这是你应得的报酬。再次感谢你。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You've been more help than I could have hoped for. The air here just seems to suck my will. I feel tired, and I can tell I'm not getting any better the longer I'm here.\n\nI'm not really sure how I'm going to infiltrate Hearthglen itself and report on how strong the Scarlet Crusade's presence is.\n\nBut that's another matter, before you leave, here, take this... as payment for your help. Thank you again."}
Q[6024]={d="杀了我。否则就太迟了。\n\n我是哈米亚。在穿越祖玛沙尔的时候，我和我的兄弟吃了点坏掉的肉……我们已经变了。我们已经被感染了。\n\n现在我可以感觉到巫妖的话语，他要求我去祖玛沙尔，并感染更多我的同胞。我无法抵抗他的命令，所以在我失去一切之前，我写下了这张卷轴。\n\n我在这座地穴的后方埋了一只箱子，就在货车旁的土堆中。但是只有我的钥匙可以打开它，钥匙在我的手里。如果你想要得到我的财宝，就来找到我。\n\n杀了我。否则就太迟了。",dEN="Kill me. Before it's too late.\n\nI am Hameya. While traveling to Zul'Mashar, my brethren and I ate some bad meat... and we changed. We are infected.\n\nI can feel the lich's words now, urging me to reach Zul'Mashar and infect more of my people. I cannot resist, and so I wrote this scroll before my will left me.\n\nI buried a chest in dirt next to a wagon behind this crypt, but only my key will open it. I have the key. If you want my treasure, then find me.\n\nKill me. Before it's too late.",o="杀了渗透者哈米亚，用他的钥匙开启墓室后的一堆泥土。",oEN="Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft.",p="这只箱子被牢牢地锁着。",pEN="This chest buried here is securely locked.",c="哈米亚的箱子被打开了！",cEN="Hameya's chest is opened!!"}
Q[6025]={d="什么？真的吗？你还想知道更多？可你已经为我做了这么多，$n，我不可能再要求你替我去进入壁炉谷。\n\n你$g确定:确定;吗，$n？壁炉谷比山口危险得多——我无法给你任何保护，甚至连你会遇到什么的信息都提供不了。\n\n好吧，如果你真的愿意帮忙，就进入镇子，找个高处，以便清楚地观察整座城镇。从那里你可以估算他们的人数，做完之后回来告诉我。但要小心……",dEN="What? Really? You want to know more? But you've already done so much for me, <name>. I couldn't possibly ask you to enter Hearthglen itself on my behalf.\n\nAre you sure, <name>? Hearthglen is much more dangerous than the Pass--I cannot provide you any protection or even information about what you might face.\n\nWell, if you really are willing to help, then enter the town and find a high place to gain a good view of the town. From there you can gauge their numbers and report them back to me. But be careful....",o="进入壁炉谷并找一处高地，你可以在那里观察整个城镇并估算血色十字军的兵力，然后向西瘟疫之地的科尔斯塔·迪普沙东回报。",oEN="Enter Hearthglen and find a high vantage point from which you can see the town and gauge the Scarlet Crusade's forces, then return to Kirsta Deepshadow in Western Plaguelands.",p="这是个危险的任务，$n。我羡慕你的勇气。",pEN="It's a dangerous task, <name>. I envy your courage.",c="你做到了，$n！谢谢你！\n\n我会尽快回到艾林……我是说，回到暴风城。来，收下这些钱，这是我至少能为你做的。你为你的族人争了光，$n。谢谢，祝你好运。",cEN="You've done it, <name>! Thank you!\n\nI'll return to Elling... I mean Stormwind as soon as I can. Here, take this coin, it's the least I can do for you. You're a credit to your people, <name>. Thank you and good luck."}
Q[6026]={d="银色黎明的成员让烟鬼给他们干一些“爆炸性的”工作，烟鬼可不是小角色！只要你愿意掏钱，我随时为你效劳。这就是我的座右铭！\n\n如果你能为我做点跑腿之类的小事，那么我也愿意和你一起分享荣誉。具体说来是这样的：我要去一趟病木林，然后给我们将要摧毁的建筑物做上标记，而你就负责收集制造炸弹所需的材料。当你拿到所有东西之后就把它们交给我。你觉得怎么样？",dEN="These here Argent Dawn people commissioned ol' Smokey to do a little demolition work for 'em. Smokey's mammy ain't raised no dummy. When gold coin is slapped on the table, Smokey's services are available. That's my motto!\n\nNow I'd be willing to split the commission with you if you're willing to do a little legwork. Here's the deal: I'm going to head over to Plaguewood and mark the buildings we need destroyed. You gather the components for the bombs. Meet back here when you've got everything. Deal?",o="烟鬼拉鲁恩要你拿来2块瑟银锭、1根金棒、8颗高爆炸弹和8个不牢固的扳机。\n\n你需要找铁匠和工程学技师帮忙制作这些东西。",oEN="Smokey LaRue wants you to get 2 Thorium Bars, 1 Golden Rod, 8 Hi-Explosive Bombs, and 8 Unstable Triggers.\n\nYou will have to find a blacksmith and an engineer for these items.",p="相信老烟鬼吧，$r。报酬一定值得。那些银色黎明的人在付钱这件事上可不含糊。",pEN="Trust ol' Smokey, <race>. The reward will be worth it. These Argent Dawn folk don't mess around when it comes to payment.",c="我可以在工作完成之前给你一半的报酬，事成之后再给你一半。",cEN="I can pay you half up front and half when the job is done."}
Q[6027]={d="$n，拿着这颗毒蛇宝石。在这里的西北面有一座小岛，到那里去把这颗宝石放在毒蛇雕像的手里。它会召唤保护上古之书的守护者。那本书中包含了纳迦的秘密，被埋藏了数百年的秘密。把这本书交给我，然后我们就会对那些长着鳞片的混蛋有更多的了解！",dEN="<name>, I entrust you with the Gem of the Serpent. Place this gem on the Serpent Statue's hand on Ranazjar Isle, a small island northwest of here. Placing it will summon the one who protects the Book of the Ancients. This book contains the secrets of the naga, secrets that have been kept for centuries. Bring this book to me, and we will learn much about our scaled foes!",o="取得《上古之书》，把它交给埃塞尔·雷瑟尔塔的亚祖尔·奥达莫特。|n",oEN="Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor.",p="啊，$n！很高兴再见到你。你拿到上古之书了吗？",pEN="Ah, <name>! It's good to see you again. Do you have the Book of the Ancients?",c="《上古之书》！失传已久的那本书！我会确保这本书交到高阶议会手中。你今天做得非常出色，为此我们应当感谢你……就像对待一位$g英雄:英雄;那样感谢你，$g真的:真的;！",cEN="The long lost Book of the Ancients! I will ensure this book is passed on to the high council. You've done well today, and for that you are to be thanked... as a hero should be thanked!"}
Q[6028]={d="我正在找一个愿意帮忙的$r，这事情虽然小，但是非常重要。我是作为银色黎明的代表来考察永望镇这里的管理情况的，现在我要给冰风岗的银色黎明军官普尔哈特提交一份进度报告，冰风岗就在西瘟疫地的南部。\n\n如果你接下我的任务，就可以得到一个接触我上司的好机会，也许你还可以从她那里获得一些工作！",dEN="I am looking for a responsible individual to aid me in a small but nonetheless important matter. I'm here as a representative of the Argent Dawn's interests to the local governance of Everlook. I need to get a progress report to Argent Officer Pureheart at Chillwind Camp; it's a ways from here, located along the southern fringe of the Western Plaguelands.\n\nIf I may be so bold - this would be a perfect means to introduce yourself to my superior and perhaps earn some work from her!",o="把永望镇报告送给西瘟疫地冰风岗的银色黎明军官普尔哈特。",oEN="Deliver the Everlook Report to Argent Officer Pureheart at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.",p="你好，$n。我代表银色黎明，为你在冰风岗期间提供安全与庇护。我也许还有些工作可以交给你……",pEN="Greetings, <name>. On behalf of the Argent Dawn, I offer you safety and shelter while you are here at Chillwind Camp. I might also have some work for you...",c="格雷戈很有办法。他和热砂港财团打交道已经有一段时间了，如今已经是哥布林谈判“艺术”的专家。虽说哥布林的忠诚首先属于钱袋最鼓的人，但他们也懂得并尊重外交的价值。真要说的话，这还能给他们带来回头客……\n\n总之，银色黎明感谢你的付出。请收下这个，连同我们的谢意。\"\"",cEN="Very resourceful, Gregor is. He's been dealing with the Steamwheedle Cartel for some time now, and has become an expert on the \"art\" of goblin negotiations. Though it's true that the goblins' primary loyalties lie with those who have the largest coin purses, they also know and respect the value of diplomacy. If anything, it provides them with repeat customers...\n\nAt any rate, the Argent Dawn acknowledges you for your effort. Please have this, with our thanks."}
Q[6029]={d="我正在找一个愿意帮忙的$r，这事情虽然小，但是非常重要。我是作为银色黎明的代表来考察永望镇这里的管理情况的，现在我要给亡灵壁垒的银色黎明军官加鲁什提交一份进度报告。亡灵壁垒就在西瘟疫之地的西部，提瑞斯法林地的东边。\n\n如果你接下我的任务，就可以得到一个接触我上司的好机会，也许你还可以从他那里获得一些工作！",dEN="I'm looking for a responsible individual to aid me in a small but nonetheless important matter. I'm here as a representative of the Argent Dawn's interests to the local governance of Everlook. I need to get a progress report to Argent Officer Garush at the Bulwark; it's a ways from here, located along the western fringe of the Western Plaguelands, east of Tirisfal Glades.\n\nIf I may be so bold - this would be a perfect means to introduce yourself to my superior and perhaps earn some work from him!",o="把永望镇报告送给西瘟疫地亡灵壁垒的银色黎明军官加鲁什。",oEN="Deliver the Everlook Report to Argent Officer Garush at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.",p="你好，$c。以银色黎明的名义，我在亡灵壁垒这里保护你的安全。我还会为你提供一个机会，让你为了值得争取的东西而战斗！",pEN="Greetings, <class>. On behalf of the Argent Dawn, I offer you safety and shelter while you are here at Bulwark. I might also offer you the chance to fight for a cause that's worth fighting for!",c="作为一个人类，格雷戈算是很有办法了。他和热砂港财团打交道已经有一段时间了，如今已经是哥布林谈判“艺术”的真正专家。虽说哥布林的忠诚首先属于手头最宽裕的人，但他们也懂得并尊重外交的价值。这尤其能让他们拥有固定的客户……\n\n无论如何，银色黎明感谢你的一切付出。请收下这个，以及我们的感激。\"\"",cEN="Resourceful for a human, Gregor is. He's been dealing with the Steamwheedle Cartel for some time now, and has become an expert on the \"art\" of goblin negotiations. Though it's true that the goblins' primary loyalties lie with those who have the largest coin purses, they also know and respect the value of diplomacy. If anything, it provides them with repeat customers...\n\nAt any rate, the Argent Dawn acknowledges you for your effort. Please have this, with our thanks."}
Q[6030]={d="阿姆布兰希发现的这本书为银色黎明提供了丰富的文学财富……它也是迄今为止我读过的最让人摸不着头脑的古书之一。\n\n我们令人尊敬的领袖尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵是个睿智的语言学家。你能帮我把这个交给他吗？当然会有奖励。他现在就在圣光之愿礼拜堂，东瘟疫之地的最东部。",dEN="A recluse medium found in these parts by the name of Umbranse has provided the Argent Dawn with quite a literary masterpiece... one that amounts to quite possibly the largest collection of jibber-jabber I've ever seen written.\n\nOne of the Dawn's most respected leaders, Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff, is a brilliant linguist. Could you take this to him for me - for a reward, of course? Light's Hope Chapel - that's where he's currently at, far in the eastern part of the Eastern Plaguelands.",o="把《灵语研究》这本书交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的尼古拉斯·兹维伦霍夫公爵。\"\"",oEN="Deliver the book, \"Studies in Spirit Speaking\", to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.",p="愿圣光照亮你前行的道路，$c。是什么在这黑暗而动荡的时代中将你带到这个希望之地来的？",pEN="May the Light guide you in these troubling times, <class>. What brings you here to this beacon of hope in the middle of darkness and despair?",c="这……你给我带来的是一本非常特别的书。我倒想说这里的“特别”意味着“独一无二、很可能极具启发性”，不过这还有待验证。\n\n“噢噢噢噢？”哪个脑子正常的人会想出这种东西？\n\n好吧，我听说过格雷戈提到的那个安布兰希，所以这倒也不是全无价值。我会尽力破译它。至于你……请收下这个，银色黎明的一点心意。你在这里期间，也许还有其他事情可以帮我们。\"\"\"\"\"\"\"",cEN="This... this is a very special book you have brought me. I'd like to tell you that \"special\" in this case means \"unique and quite possibly illuminating\", but that remains to be seen.\n\n\"Ooooooo?\" Who in their right mind thinks this up?\n\nWell now, I've heard of this Umbranse that Gregor spoke of, so this isn't without merit. I'll do my best to decipher it. As for you... please, have this - courtesy of the Argent Dawn. While you are here, perhaps there are some other things you can aid us with."}
Q[6031]={d="我们木喉熊怪过着自给自足的生活，我们不喜欢陌生人。这对我们来说很好，但是这对交易不好。\n\n不久之前，一个暗夜精灵朋友来到了这里，她披了一件符文布做成的披风。符文布在我们这里很少见，但是那件袍子真的很不错，所以伙伴们要我去找到更多的符文布。\n\n你愿意给我弄些符文布来吗？如果你能给我足够的符文布，那我可以给你一些东西作为交换。",dEN="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade.\n\nNot long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak. Runecloth is rare among us, but the cloak was so fine my people want me to make more runecloth clothing.\n\nWill you bring me runecloth? If you bring me enough, then I will give you something in trade.",o="把30块符文布交给木喉要塞的梅罗什。",oEN="Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",p="你有符文布吗？我们需要符文布来制作很多东西！",pEN="Do you have the runecloth? My people are eager for more items of runecloth!",c="啊，你把布料带来了。多好的料子啊！\n\n谢谢你，$n。你是$g真正的朋友:真正的朋友;。请收下这个作为交换。",cEN="Ah, you brought the cloth. Such fine material it is!\n\nThank you, <name>. You are a true friend. Please accept this in exchange."}
Q[6032]={d="虽然木喉熊怪很喜欢符文布，但是它对我们来说并不是神圣的。月布才是神圣的。\n\n给我带一些这种神圣的布来，然后我就教你一种神秘的编织技巧。",dEN="Although the people of Timbermaw delight in the feel of runecloth, it is not sacred to us. But mooncloth is sacred.\n\nBring me a small supply of this holy cloth, and I will teach you a secret fashioning technique.",o="把2块月布交给木喉要塞的梅罗什。",oEN="Bring 2 Mooncloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",p="你带来月布了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought the mooncloth, <name>?",c="啊，很好。这些月布将用来为我们族人制作神圣的衣物。谢谢你，。现在我来训练你。",cEN="Ah, very good. This mooncloth will be used for garments sacred to our people. Thank you, <name>. Now I will train you."}
Q[6041]={d="在你收集材料的同时，我让一些手下给那些亡灵天灾的建筑物做上了标记。\n\n计划是这样的：我将给你十根由我特制的炸药。你要拿着它们去病木林，把它们放在那些已经被做上标记的天灾建筑物中。\n\n<烟鬼打了个响指。>\n\n嘭！然后世界就清静了。",dEN="While you were gathering the supplies, I had some of my people handle marking the Scourge buildings we need demolished.\n\nHere's the plan: I'm going to give you ten sticks of my special compound. You're going to take them over to Plaguewood and plant them inside the Scourge structures that I've had marked for detonation.\n\n<Smokey snaps his fingers.>\n\nBing! It's just that easy.",o="到圣光之愿礼拜堂西北方的病木林去。在那些有爆炸标记的建筑物中对爆炸标记使用烟鬼的特殊混合物，以此来摧毁8座亡灵天灾建筑。烟鬼已经给通灵塔和屠宰房做上了标记。\n\n一旦你放置好炸弹，就离那些建筑物远一些，然后尽情欣赏你的杰作吧。\n\n顺便说一句，烟鬼的特殊混合物相当不稳定……",oEN="Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked.\n\nOnce you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork.\n\nBy the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable.",p="我这里还库存了一些材料，可以制造更多含有特殊混合物的炸药。如果你需要的话，告诉烟鬼就行了。",pEN="I got supplies left over to make a few more sticks of the special compound. Just let ol' Smokey know if you need more.",c="你比我记忆中$g黑:黑;多了。你那副模样——那神情简直在说：“我被一枚高爆炸弹烧过。”\n\n<烟鬼笑了起来。>\n\n总之！这是你那份战利品。我额外添了点东西，帮你缓解烧伤。\"\"",cEN="You're much darker than I remember. You got that look going for you; the look that says, 'I've been charred by a high explosive bomb.'\n\n<Smokey laughs.>\n\nAnyhow! Here's your cut of the loot. I've thrown in a little something extra to help soothe the burns."}
Q[6042]={d="只要你离开农场两步，就肯定可以撞见那些讨厌的蝙蝠。我想带着这些猎犬出去，在不惊动这些该死的家伙的情况下剿灭亡灵天灾。很明显，与其让我去没日没夜地砍杀蝙蝠，还不如做点更有意思的事情。但是你跟我不同。\n\n什么？你的培训？这就是培训！出发吧，如果你不杀死一定数量的蝙蝠就别回来。不要让我失望。",dEN="You cannot take two steps off of this farm without running into one of those obnoxious bats. I want to be able to take the hounds out and slaughter Scourge without being accosted by any damned, dirty bats. Obviously, I have better things to do with my time than mindlessly kill bats day in and day out. You, however, do not.\n\nWhat? Your training? This is your training! Now get out of my sight and don't come back until you've killed a fair number of those winged demons. Don't disappoint me.",o="杀掉20只毒性瘟疫蝙蝠和10只巨型瘟疫蝙蝠，然后回到纳萨诺斯·凋零者那里。",oEN="Slay 20 Noxious Plaguebats and 10 Monstrous Plaguebats. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when you are finished.",p="情况也许会更糟，我应该让你去收集蝙蝠粪便的。\n\n<纳萨诺斯注视着你。>\n\n嗯……嘿！等等，你要去哪儿？",pEN="It could have been worse. I could have had you collecting bat guano.\n\n<Nathanos stares at you in contemplation.>\n\nHrm... Hey! Wait a minute. Where are you going?",c="一点点愤怒就能帮助你完成任务，这真令我诧异。",cEN="It's incredible what a little anger and rage can get accomplished."}
Q[6121]={d="你应该好学习有关德鲁伊的解毒能力的知识了，$n。塞纳留斯赐予了我们特殊的能力，让我们只需施展一个简单的法术就能净化世间最邪恶的剧毒。但是这份礼物可不是随便就可以送给你的……为了保证你能深刻地理解这门新的课程，你要像个刚刚入行的新手那样，逐一了解各种毒药的特点。\n\n到月光林地去跟德迪利特·星焰谈谈吧，他会在那里向你传授这些知识的。",dEN="You're now ready to learn about poison and the power we as druids have over it, <name>. Cenarius has blessed us with the ability to purge even the most foul of poisons with but a mere incantation. This gift is not to be taken lightly... and to ensure you learn this lesson, you'll work to address the effects of poisonings as a layman would.\n\nTravel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze; he awaits your arrival to begin your lesson.",o="到月光林地去，与永夜港的德迪利特·星焰谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",c="你好，年轻的$c。很高兴看到你$g渴望:渴望;学习解毒之术。\n\n过去，大多数德鲁伊都要经历各种预先安排好的试炼，但你的工作不涉及这些。贫瘠之地的奥伯丁爆发了一场动物中毒的疫情，可那里的人不知道如何控制它。奥伯丁的一位代表已向月光林地求援，我们就派你前去。这不是演练——你要做的工作是真实发生的。请牢记这一点。",cEN="Greetings young <class>, I'm glad to see you ready and eager to learn about the curing of poisons.\n\nWhile most druids in the past were put through pre-planned trials, your work will involve no such thing. There has been a rash of animal poisonings in Auberdine, and the village there has been unable to cure it. To that end, a representative there has asked Moonglade for aid and we are sending you there to aid them. This is no exercise - the work you'll do is quite real. Bear this in mind."}
Q[6122]={d="黑海岸的峭壁之泉是这个地区的主要水源，我认为那里就是造成当地的动物大量中毒的罪魁祸首。用这个取样器在洞口取一些水样，你要小心一些，瀑布旁边的一个洞穴中居住着危险的纳迦。\n\n一旦你拿到了水样，就把它送到奥伯丁的奥兰达利亚·夜歌那里去。她是向我们寻求帮助的人之一，往后你将和她一起工作。",dEN="The Cliffspring Falls in Darkshore serves as the principal source of drinking water for the region, and now I suspect it is the principal source of the poison that is harming the local fauna - deer specifically. Use this sampler to draw some water from the mouth of the cave; be careful, as dangerous naga now reside in a cave by the falls.\n\nOnce filled, deliver it to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine. She is the one that requested our aid, and you will work with her to address this malady.",o="使用空的峭壁之泉取样器在瀑布洞口获得水样。\n\n将盛满的峭壁之泉取样器送到黑海岸奥伯丁的奥兰达利亚·夜歌那里。",oEN="Use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler to draw a sample of water from the mouth of the cave by the falls.\n\nDeliver the Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine, Darkshore.",p="你就是月光林地的塞纳里奥议会派来的那位？太好了！我们这儿正为那些可怜的小鹿焦头烂额，能得到任何帮助都很高兴。\n\n你带了吗——丹德利特·星焰说你会有的那份水样？他通知我说你会取一份来，这样我们就能一起研制解药……，$g真的:真的;$g真的:真的;",pEN="You're the one that the Cenarion Circle in Moonglade sent? That's wonderful! We've quite the crisis our hands here regarding the poor deer, and we're happy for all the help we can get.\n\nDo you have the sample of water that Dendrite Starblaze said you'd have? He notified me that you'd draw one so we could work on a cure together...",c="以艾露恩的名义，这种水实在是太恶心了！怪不得鹿都生病了。\n\n有某种东西正在污染水源，最终它会污染到整个黑海岸的水域——这里已经到处都是病鹿了。不过除了这个主要的污染源之外，似乎还有别的什么东西也在污染水质……\n\n这个水样将帮助我们找到治疗的方法。在研究这些水样的同时，我需要一些东西来制作治疗药剂……",cEN="By Elune, this water is disgusting! No wonder the deer are sick.\n\nSomething is polluting the water, and in turn corrupting Darkshore's entire water table. Sick deer have been seen all over area, and not just by the river. While this water is most likely a primary source of the sickness spreading, there's something else at work here.\n\nThis water, believe it or not, will help us formulate a cure. While I research this water, I have need of some items to formulate a cure..."}
Q[6123]={d="这些水将作为解毒药膏的基础材料。为了使它产生治疗效果，我需要一些地根草。采药人知道怎样找到它，如果你不懂草药学的话，那你就得找一个懂行的来帮你。\n\n另外，为了增强药力，我们还需要一些月亮菇。寻找月亮菇很简单——这里东面的洞穴里到处都是。不过这些洞穴里住着一些月光枭兽，它们很容易发怒，所以你要多加小心。",dEN="The water will serve as the base of the curative salve I'll make for the deer. For curative properties, I need some earthroot. Herbalists know how to find it, so if we're unlucky and you aren't one then you'll need to find one to help us out.\n\nFinally for potency, I need some lunar fungus. Finding lunar fungal blooms is easy enough; they're all over the place in caves just to the east of here. Moonkin reside in the caves and they're irritable as of late, so be careful.",o="收集5个地根草和12个月亮菇，把它们交给奥伯丁的奥兰达利亚·夜歌，这样她就可以制作解药了。",oEN="Bring 5 Earthroot and 12 Lunar Funguses to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine so she may make a curative salve.",p="你拿到我制作解药所需的材料了吗？鹿群无法自己恢复健康，所以我们一定要帮助它们！",pEN="Have you got the reagents I need to make the salve? The deer aren't getting any better on their own, so we better hurry to help them out!",c="很好，$n，这些可以制成不少解药——至少可以让现在的局面有所改观。\n\n制作解药有时是很困难的，因为每种毒药都需要特定的解药。如果我们可以不考虑这种对应性，随意地制作解药，那就好了！\n\n现在，让我开始工作吧！",cEN="This is good, <name>, so much so that it should be enough to make some ample doses of the salve - at least enough to start to make a difference.\n\nMaking a cure for poisons can be quite difficult at times because each one often requires a very specific antidote to counteract it. Imagine being able to cure a poison at will without having to worry about the exact ingredients of what the antidote must be!\n\nNow, let me get to work on this!"}
Q[6124]={d="你所带来的材料足够制作十份解药，$n。在我继续想办法准备更多解药的时候，希望你可以给我们开个好头。黑海岸到处都是生病的鹿，对它们使用药膏就可以治疗它们的疾病。\n\n在你完成任务之后，就去找月光林地的德迪利特·星焰谈一谈。请向那里的塞纳里奥议会转达奥伯丁的谢意……另外，我要对你所提供的帮助表示感谢！",dEN="The amount of salve made out of the reagents you brought me is good enough for ten doses, <name>. While I work with the village to try and make some more salve, I'd like for you to help us get a head start. All around Darkshore are sickly deer; use the salve on them and cure their malaise.\n\nDendrite Starblaze in Moonglade will want to talk to you when you're done, I'm sure. Please extend Auberdine's thanks to the Cenarion Circle there... and let me say thanks to you directly for the help you've given!",o="对黑海岸的10头生病的鹿使用动物医疗药膏，以此来治疗它们。从壁泉河到奥伯丁，直到最南端靠近灰谷的地区都有生病的鹿出没。",oEN="Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them. Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins.",p="你完成了奥伯丁的奥兰达利亚·夜歌给你的任务了吗？不要倦怠！",pEN="Have you completed what was asked of you by Alanndarian Nightsong of Auberdine? Your work is not complete unless it is.",c="你在治愈黑海岸的那些鹿的过程中表现得非常出色。这些可怕的污染和堕落在整个大陆上造成了无数生灵的痛苦，达纳苏斯的一些人愿意承认这个危险的存在……而另一些则对其视而不见。我希望你可以认清现在的形势，$n。\n\n不管怎么样，你是大自然和塞纳里奥议会的朋友——请拿着这个作为我们友谊的象征。",cEN="You have done well in tending to the sickly deer of Darkshore; they are unwitting victims of a greater taint and corruption that is spreading all throughout the land. There are those in Darnassus who choose to recognize this threat... and there are those who ignore the growing signs. I hope you will not be one to put blinders on about what facts stare you in the face, <name>.\n\nRegardless, you've proven your worth as a friend of nature and the Circle - take this as a symbol of such."}
Q[6125]={d="你已经知道在没有精神支柱的情况下清除毒素有多么困难了。你很快就会拥有可以轻松解除毒性的能力了，所以请牢记其他的生灵在抵抗毒素侵袭时所承受的痛苦。\n\n现在，你应该返回达纳苏斯去找玛斯雷·驭熊者了，$n。既然你已经领悟了这一课的内容，那么他就应该会把这个非常重要的法术教给你。\n\n再见，年轻的德鲁伊。",dEN="You've learned what it means to cure poison without the benefit of spiritual aid. Remember what others must endure in fighting poisonous afflictions as you soon embrace your newfound power over poison.\n\nYou should now return to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus, <name>. He, no doubt, has a very important spell to teach you now that the student understands the lesson given unto <him /her>.\n\nFarewell, young druid. We shall speak again.",o="回到达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的玛斯雷·驭熊者那里。",oEN="Return to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.",c="欢迎回来，自从你离开之后，我就一直在关注你的进展。我必须承认，奥伯丁的状况让我感到很惊讶。这确实需要进一步的调查，这类毒物一旦扩散开来，对自然平衡所造成的影响就会非常可怕。\n\n你可以从容地面对压力，为此，我将奖励给你清除毒素的力量。好好使用它，$n……好好使用它。",cEN="Welcome back - I've been following your progress on this lesson since you left, and I must admit I was surprised to learn about the situation in Auberdine. This does bear some further investigation, as the introduction of such poisons into the environment is most upsetting to the balance.\n\nYou handled yourself with grace under pressure. For that, I can find no better way to reward you than with permanent power over poison. Use it well, <name>... use it well."}
Q[6126]={d="你应该好学习有关德鲁伊的解毒能力的知识了，$n。塞纳留斯赐予了我们特殊的能力，让我们只需施展一个简单的法术就能净化世间最邪恶的剧毒。但是这份礼物可不是随便就可以送给你的……为了保证你能深刻地理解这门新的课程，你要像个刚刚入行的新手那样，逐一了解各种毒药的特点。\n\n到月光林地去跟德迪利特·星焰谈谈吧，他会在那里向你传授这些知识的。",dEN="You're now ready to learn about poison and the power we as druids have over it, <name>. Cenarius has blessed us with the ability to purge even the most foul of poisons with but a mere incantation. This gift is not to be taken lightly... and to ensure you learn this lesson, you'll work to address the effects of poisonings as a layman would.\n\nTravel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze; he awaits your arrival to begin your lesson.",o="到月光林地去，与永夜港的德迪利特·星焰谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.",c="你好，年轻的$c。很高兴看到你$g渴望:渴望;学习解毒之术。\n\n过去，大多数德鲁伊都要经历各种预先安排好的试炼，但你的工作不涉及这些。贫瘠之地的奥伯丁爆发了一场动物中毒的疫情，可那里的人不知道如何控制它。奥伯丁的一位代表已向月光林地求援，我们就派你前去。这不是演练——你要做的工作是真实发生的。请牢记这一点。",cEN="Greetings young <class>, I'm glad to see you ready and eager to learn about the curing of poisons.\n\nWhile most druids in the past were put through pre-planned trials, your work will involve no such thing. There has been a rash of animal poisonings at the Crossroads in the Barrens, and they're unable to bring it under control. Someone there has requested Moonglade for aid, so we are sending you there to aid them. This is no exercise - the work you'll do is quite real. Bear this in mind."}
Q[6127]={d="看来，十字路口的西北面的鬼雾峰是最有可能散播毒药的地点。那里的水池可能已经被崇拜恶魔的火刃氏族污染了。\n\n用取样器在山顶的水池中收集一些水样，灌满之后就把它送到十字路口的图加·符文图腾那里去。他是向我们寻求帮助的人之一，往后你将和他一起工作。",dEN="Dreadmist Peak to the northwest of the Crossroads is most likely a primary candidate as to the source of the spread of the poison. Its airy peaks have pools of water that influence the weather patterns. I suspect the water is now tainted by the demon-worshipping Burning Blade.\n\nUse this sampler to draw water from the pool at the very top of the peak. Once filled, deliver it to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads. He is the one that requested our aid, and you will work with him to address this malady.",o="使用空的鬼雾峰取样器在山顶取水样。\n\n将盛满的鬼雾峰取样器送到贫瘠之地十字路口的图加·符文图腾那里。",oEN="Use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler to draw a sample of water from a pool at the top of the peak.\n\nDeliver the Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads, Barrens.",p="你是月光林地的塞纳里奥议会派来的？太好了！我们正在致力于救治那些中毒的蹬羚，很高兴能够获得你的帮助。\n\n你拿到德迪利特·星焰所说的水样了吗？他告诉过我说你会拿来一份水样，让我们一起找出应对的方法。",pEN="You are the one that the Cenarion Circle in Moonglade sent, yes? This is most fortuitous for us! We are stymied in our effort to bring balance to the sickly gazelles that wander the northern Barrens; we're happy for all the help we can get.\n\nDo you have the sample of water that Dendrite Starblaze said you'd have? He notified me that you'd draw one so we could work on a cure together...",c="以我祖先的名义，这种水实在是太恶心了！怪不得瞪羚都生病了。\n\n有某种东西正在污染水源，最终它会污染到整个北贫瘠之地的水域——这里已经到处都是生病的瞪羚了。不过除了这个主要的污染源之外，似乎还有别的什么东西也在污染水质……\n\n这个水样将帮助我们找到治疗的方法。在研究这些水样的同时，我需要一些东西来制作治疗药剂……",cEN="By my ancestors, this water is disgusting! No wonder the gazelles are sick.\n\nSomething is polluting the water, and in turn beginning to wreck the northern Barrens ecosystem. Sick gazelles have been sighted all north of the east-west road here. While this water is most likely a primary source of the sickness spreading, there's something else at work here.\n\nThis water, believe it or not, will help us formulate a cure. While I research this water, I have need of some items to formulate a cure..."}
Q[6128]={d="水将作为我要为瞪羚配制的治疗药膏的基底。但为了增强它的疗效，我还需要一些地根草。草药师知道怎么找到它，所以如果你对这行不太熟悉，就得找个草药师来帮我们。\n\n最后，为了提升效力，我还需要科多兽的角——零星的碎片或小块可不行。你能对付的那些科多兽在贫瘠之地北部游荡；为了平衡的大义，去放倒几头吧，$n，然后把它们的角带给我。",dEN="The water will serve as the base of the curative salve I shall make for the gazelles. For curative properties, I need some earthroot. Herbalists know how to find it, so if you are not familiar with this skill you'll need to find one to help us out.\n\nFinally for potency, I need kodo horns - mere chips and fragments will not suffice. Kodos you can handle wander the northern part of the Barrens; bring some down for the greater good of the balance <name>, and fetch the horns for me.",o="收集5个地根草和5个科多兽角，把它们交给十字路口的图加·符文图腾，这样他就可以制作解药了。",oEN="Bring 5 Earthroot and 5 Kodo Horns to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads so he may make a curative salve.",p="你拿到我制作解药所需的材料了吗？瞪羚无法自己恢复健康，所以我们一定要帮助它们！",pEN="Have you got the reagents I need to make the salve? The gazelle aren't getting any better on their own, so we better not tarry in our effort to save them!",c="很好，$n，这些可以制成不少解药——至少可以让现在的局面有所改观。\n\n制作解药有时是很困难的，因为每种毒药都需要特定的解药。如果我们可以不考虑这种对应性，随意地制作解药，那就好了！\n\n现在，让我开始工作吧！",cEN="This is good, <name>, so much so that it should be enough to make some ample doses of the salve - at least enough to start to make a difference.\n\nMaking a cure for poisons can be quite difficult at times because each one often requires a very specific antidote to counteract it. Imagine being able to cure a poison at will without having to worry about the exact ingredients of what the antidote must be!\n\nNow, let me get to work on this!"}
Q[6129]={d="你所带来的材料足够制作十份解药，$n。在我继续想办法准备更多解药的时候，希望你可以给我们开个好头。贫瘠之地北部到处都是生病的瞪羚，对它们使用药膏就可以治疗它们的疾病。\n\n在你完成任务之后，就去找月光林地的德迪利特·星焰谈一谈。请向那里的塞纳里奥议会转达奥伯丁的谢意……另外，我要对你所提供的帮助表示感谢！",dEN="I was able to make enough salve for ten doses of curing, <name>. While I work with local authorities to try and make some more salve, I'd like for you to help us get a head start. All around the northern Barrens are sickly gazelles; use the salve on them and cure their malaise.\n\nDendrite Starblaze in Moonglade will want to talk to you when you're done, I'm sure. Please extend our thanks to the Cenarion Circle there... and let me say thanks to you directly for the help you've given!",o="对贫瘠之地北部的10只生病的瞪羚使用动物医疗药膏，以此来治疗它们。在穿过十字路口的那条东西走向的大路北面到处都是生病的蹬羚。",oEN="Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Gazelles that are located throughout the northern part of the Barrens; doing so should cure them. Sickly Gazelles have been reported north of the east-west road that runs through the Crossroads.",p="你完成了十字路口的图加·符文图腾给你的任务了吗？不要倦怠！",pEN="Have you completed what was asked of you by Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads? Your work is not complete unless it is.",c="你在治愈贫瘠之地的那些蹬羚的过程中表现得非常出色。这些可怕的污染和堕落在整个大陆上造成了无数生灵的痛苦，而你们牛头人对于塞纳留斯的精神和信仰求之若渴你和你们那些在雷霆崖的长老都已经知道，维护自然平衡的职责要求我们超越种族的隔阂。\n\n$n，你是大自然和塞纳里奥议会的朋友——请拿着这个作为我们友谊的象征。",cEN="You have done well in tending to the sickly gazelles of the Barrens; they are unwitting victims of a greater taint and corruption that is spreading all throughout the land. You <race> are most eager to understand the ways of Cenarius; you, like your elders in Thunder Bluff, are proving that the need for balance transcends artificial racial barriers.\n\n<name>, you've proven your worth as an friend of nature and the Circle - take this as a symbol of such."}
Q[6130]={d="你已经知道在没有精神支柱的情况下清除毒素有多么困难了。你很快就会拥有可以轻松解除毒性的能力了，所以请牢记其他的生灵在抵抗毒素侵袭时所承受的痛苦。\n\n现在，你应该返回雷霆崖去找图拉克·符文图腾了，$n。既然你已经领悟了这一课的内容，那么他就应该会把这个非常重要的法术教给你。\n\n再见，年轻的德鲁伊。",dEN="You've learned what it means to cure poison without the benefit of spiritual aid. Remember what others must endure in fighting poisonous afflictions as you soon embrace your newfound power over poison.\n\nYou should now return to Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff, <name>. He, no doubt, has a very important spell to teach you now that the student understands the lesson given unto <him /her>.\n\nFarewell, young druid. We shall speak again.",o="回到雷霆崖长者高地的图拉克·符文图腾那里。",oEN="Return to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff.",c="欢迎回来，自从你离开之后，我就一直在关注你的进展。我必须承认，十字路口的状况让我感到很惊讶。这确实需要进一步的调查，这类毒物一旦扩散开来，对自然平衡所造成的影响就会非常可怕。\n\n你可以从容地面对压力，为此，我将奖励给你清除毒素的力量。好好使用它，$n……好好使用它。",cEN="Welcome back - I've been following your progress on this lesson since you left, and I must admit I was surprised to learn about the situation at the Crossroads. This does bear some further investigation, as the introduction of such poisons into the environment is most upsetting to the balance.\n\nYou handled yourself with grace under pressure. For that, I can find no better way to reward you with permanent power over poison. Use it well, <name>... use it well."}
Q[6131]={d="木喉是唯一逃脱了腐化的熊怪部族。然而，许多其他种族如今见到熊怪就盲目地杀害，根本懒得分辨他们是敌是友。正因如此，木喉熊怪极少信任外人。\n\n你有兴趣证明自己吗？把费伍德森林那些腐化的死木部族赶回去，也许有一天我们会把你视作$g我们的盟友:我们的盟友;。你会在我的西边找到第一个死木部族——战士、探路者和园丁。",dEN="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe. For this reason, the Timbermaw furbolg trust very few.\n\nAre you interested in proving yourself? Drive back the corrupted Deadwood tribe of Felwood and we may one day consider you an ally. You'll find the first Deadwood tribe - warriors, pathfinders and gardeners - to my west.",o="格拉兹要你去杀死5个死木战士、5个死木探路者以及5个死木园丁。",oEN="Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",c="我们在过去的事件中遭受了很多痛苦。谢谢你为帮助保护木喉部族所做的一切。",cEN="We suffer much from the events of the past. Thank you for what you have done to help protect the Timbermaw."}
Q[6132]={d="救我出去！\n\n我本来是到长矛谷这里找玛洛迪半人马谈判的……我本以为可以跟他们做点生意……但他们根本不想做生意！我想他们要吃了我！\n\n救我出去吧，我哥哥霍恩尼兹会给你很多钱的！他在东边靠近科多兽坟场的营地里。\n\n我们赶紧出发吧，$n。大概两分钟前，我听到几只半人马说要找些木头烧火……",dEN="Get me out of here!\n\nI came up to the Valley of Spears to talk to the Maraudines. I thought I could do a little business with them... but they don't want to talk! I think they want to eat me!\n\nGet me out of here and my brother Hornizz will pay you big! He's at our camp next to the kodo graveyard, to the east.\n\nLet's hurry, <name>. Not two minutes ago I heard some centaurs talking about getting wood for their cookpot...",o="护送梅丽萨，然后与科多兽坟场的霍恩尼兹谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Melizza Brimbuzzle, then speak with Hornizz Brimbuzzle at the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace.",p="你有没有看到我妹妹梅丽萨？她总是到处乱跑，到处给我惹麻烦。",pEN="Have you seen my sister Melizza? She's always on the go, which gets her into trouble all the time.",c="我妹妹梅丽萨说过你会来的。多谢你把她从困境中解救出来，但她现在很可能又已经陷入新的困境了，这可真糟糕！",cEN="My sister Melizza said you'd be coming. Thanks a lot for getting her out of the jam she was in; it's too bad that she's already probably found herself in a new one!"}
Q[6133]={d="奎尔林斯小屋的高等精灵占有着一件属于我的东西，$c：一份详述我凡人生活的名册。\n\n别问了；不，你当然无权知晓这些信息。照我说的做就是了，虫子：把名册取回来。\n\n还有，蠢货，务必在你身后留下尽可能多的纷争与悲恸。让他们痛苦……",dEN="The high elves of the Quel'Lithien lodge possesses something that belongs to me, <class>: A document detailing my life as a mortal.\n\nBefore you ask; no, you most certainly are not privy to such information. Just do as I tell you, worm: Recover the registry.\n\nAnd imbecile, be sure to leave as much strife and grief as possible in your wake. Leave them suffering...",o="到东瘟疫之地的北方边界去找回奎尔萨拉斯名册，这件物品在奎尔林斯小屋的某处。\n\n另外你还必须杀掉8个游侠、8个巡路者和8个护林者。",oEN="Travel to the northern borders of the Eastern Plaguelands and recover the Quel'Thalas Registry. The item is somewhere in the Quel'Lithien lodge.\n\nYou must also slay 8 Rangers, 8 Pathstriders, and 8 Woodsmen.",p="不要让我空等，$c。",pEN="Do not leave me waiting, <class>.",c="我相信你没有读过这份文件。即使是你这样的蠢货也不会蠢到那个地步……",cEN="I trust you did not read the registry. Not even you would do something that idiotic..."}
Q[6134]={d="东南方有一处山谷——白骨之谷，那里是玛格拉姆半人马的鬼魂出没的地方。听起来很可怕，不是吗？好吧，想想那里对玛格拉姆半人马有多么可怕吧！如果我们从那个地方收集鬼魂的能量，我敢打赌它对那些半人马来说是很值钱的。\n\n给，拿着这箱幽灵磁铁。如果你把它放在山谷中的两具大骷髅之间，那么鬼魂就会实体化，并聚集到它旁边。干掉那些鬼魂并收集他们的幽灵电浆——那就是我们要卖给玛格拉姆部族的东西。",dEN="There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram! If we captured ghost energy from that place, I bet it'd be worth plenty to those centaurs.\n\nHere, take this crate of ghost magnets. If you place one between the two big skeletons in the valley, the Dead Goliaths, then ghosts will wander to it. Distance yourself, take out the ghosts and get their ghost-o-plasm--that's what we'll sell to the Magram.",o="把幽灵磁铁箱和8份幽灵电浆交给凄凉之地的霍恩尼兹。",oEN="Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.",p="我的幽灵电浆在哪里，$n？",pEN="Where's my ghost-o-plasm, <name>?",c="它在那儿！看起来你身上还沾了一点。有点黏，是吗？\n\n哦，给你添了那么多麻烦，真的很谢谢你，$n。这东西值一大笔钱……如果我能让半人马们相信这是什么！",cEN="There it is! Looks like you got some of it on you too. Kinda slimey, eh?\n\nWell, thanks a lot for all the trouble, <name>. This stuff will be worth a fortune... if I can convince the centaurs what it is!"}
Q[6135]={d="到目前为止，你已经完成了我交办的各项任务，尽管并不总是那么及时。\n\n我想你现在也许觉得自己准备好迎接挑战了。是的……是的，蠢货，也许你已经$g准备好:准备好;接受一系列更复杂的任务了。\n\n那只白化恶魔蝙蝠暗翼就在此地向北的乡野间游荡。找到它并摧毁它。带一片它白色的毛皮回来给我，你就会得到奖赏。|n",dEN="Up until now, you have completed the missions I have assigned; even if not in the most timely manner.\n\nI suppose you think that you are ready for a challenge. Yes... Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions.\n\nThe albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here. Track him down and destroy him. Return to me with a patch of his white fur and you shall be rewarded.",o="找到暗翼蝠并杀掉它。从尸体上取下一块暗翼蝠的皮，并把它交给纳萨诺斯·凋零者。\n\n据说暗翼蝠游荡在玛瑞斯农场北面的荒原上。",oEN="Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.\n\nIt is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.",p="我不建议你独自迎接这次挑战，$c。",pEN="I would not recommend that you take on this challenge alone, <class>.",c="干得漂亮，白痴。我要把这块毛皮做成你可以使用的东西。",cEN="Excellent work, imbecile. I shall fashion this fur into something you can use."}
Q[6136]={d="过了银色黎明的圣光之愿营地，在北谷以西，你会找到波雷尔戈尔，一头臃肿的蛆虫巨兽。\n\n我已经在那头怪物手上损失了整整几个军团。它的体型没有极限！它吃得越多，身躯就越庞大……\n\n虽说那头畜生把你吃掉我也不会受到什么情感上的创伤，但我还是更希望你$g得胜:得胜;归来。波雷尔戈尔已经吞下了不少蠢到去猎杀它的人。",dEN="Past the Argent Dawn encampment of Light's Hope and west of Northdale, you will find the corpulent maggot beast, Borelgore.\n\nI've lost entire regiments to that monster. His size knows no bounds! The more he eats the greater his girth becomes...\n\nWhile I would not suffer any emotional harm should the beast devour you, I would prefer that you were the victor. Borelgore has been known to devour others who tried to hunt him.",o="找到东瘟疫之地北方荒原中的淤血虫并消灭它。任务完成之后，向纳萨诺斯·凋零者复命。",oEN="Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete.",p="最近我有没有告诉你，我恨你？",pEN="Have I told you lately that I hate you?",c="继续保持下去，我可能就得把你从低能儿提升到心智障碍一级了。",cEN="Keep this up and I may have to promote you from imbecile to mental deficient, first class."}
Q[6141]={d="我的好兄弟安东修士听说在卡利姆多大陆的某处有亡灵出没的传闻——那个地方叫做凄凉之地。安东立即就决定要到那里去消灭亡灵！\n\n他正在寻找有勇气和决心帮助他的冒险者。如果你愿意的话，就去找安东谈谈吧。他在凄凉之地的尼耶尔前哨站里。",dEN="My brother in arms, Brother Anton, heard rumors of an undead infestation in distant Kalimdor, in a land known as Desolace. Anton immediately booked passage to that place, to seek and destroy the undead menace!\n\nHe is looking for those with the bravery and resolve to aid him. If your heart is true, then speak with Anton. He is in Desolace, in the Alliance town of Nijel's Point.",o="与凄凉之地的安东修士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Brother Anton at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",c="我听说了有援军要来的消息，你就是来帮助我们的那个$r吗？你是来帮助血色十字军征讨亡灵的吗？\n\n如果是这样，那么请靠近些听我说……",cEN="I received word of aid arriving from the east. Are you the source of these rumors? Have you come here to help the Scarlet Brother in its crusade?\n\nIf so, then listen close..."}
Q[6142]={d="你看起来就像个$g渔夫:渔夫;，$c！我特别喜欢鱼——我这辈子都在钓鱼。最好的鱼饵是软壳蛤肉。鱼根本抗拒不了，你懂我的意思吧？\n\n往北走，离海岸不远的地方，你会找到一艘沉船。那一片区域到处都是软壳蛤。如果你给我带回 10 块软壳蛤肉，我就会给你点东西作为回报。",dEN="You have the look of a fisherman, <class>! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?\n\nUp north you will find a wrecked ship off the coast. Soft-shelled clams are littered throughout the area. If you bring me back 10 pieces of soft-shelled clam meat, I will give you something in return.",o="找到10块软壳蚌肉，把它们交给葬影村的麦拉斯。",oEN="Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.",p="我等不及要带些新鲜的软壳蚌肉去钓鱼了，你弄到我要的十块肉了吗？",pEN="I can't wait to go fishing with some fresh soft-shelled clam meat; did you bring me the 10 pieces of it I need?",c="太好了，伙计，这正是巫医给我治头疼开的方子。他说：“麦拉希——去钓鱼吧。你会感觉好些的。”\n\n嘿，我已经感觉好多了！谢谢你，伙计！\"\"",cEN="Perfect mon, this is just what the witch doctor told me to do for my headache. He says, \"\"Mai'Lahii - go fish. It'll make you feel better\"\"\n\nWell, I feel better already, thanks mon!"}
Q[6143]={d="你可能听说过，也可能没有……我的同伴和我一起在靠近纳迦岛的地方钓鱼，就在北面海岸边的那艘失事船舶的更北面。我们过去常常在那里钓鱼，但是现在我满脑子想的都是为我死去的同伴报仇。\n\n有一天早上，纳迦攻击了我们，杀了除我以外的所有人。\n\n我的心每天都被内疚和仇恨煎熬着，$c。我想让你去把纳迦全都给干掉，而且我保证你的努力会得到回报的。那么，你愿意帮我吗？",dEN="Maybe you heard or maybe you haven't... my crew and I was out fishing near Ranazjar Isle, north of the wrecked ship off the coast up north. We used to fish there all the time; now all I do is think of a way to seek revenge for my fallen comrades.\n\nThe naga attacked us one morning, killing everyone except me.\n\nMe conscience can't handle the guilt, <class>; I need you to go and fry them naga for me. I'll make the effort worth your while; you think you can help me with that?",o="杀死7个滑刃侍从、7个滑刃纳迦，以及5个滑刃巫师，然后与葬影村的杜泽加尔谈谈。",oEN="Slay 7 Slitherblade Myrmidon, 7 Slitherblade Naga, and 5 Slitherblade Sorceresses, and then talk to Drulzegar at Shadowprey in Desolace.",p="我还能听到我的手下在被纳迦屠杀时哭喊求救的声音。如果不是因为我的膝盖坏掉了，我肯定会跟你一起去，帮你杀死那些混蛋纳迦！\n\n你通常都可以在水下的珊瑚礁深处找到他们……潜伏着……策划着阴谋……",pEN="I still hear their voices crying for help when the naga unleashed their chaos over us. If I didn't have this bad knee, I'd go and help you kill those blasted naga!\n\nYou can usually guarantee to find them deep in the coral reefs below the surface... lurking... scheming...",c="听到纳迦被击败的消息固然很好，但我的心仍然觉得空荡荡的。在我的余生中，我发誓要把他们全都杀掉。\n\n给你老兄，这是我许诺的奖赏。比起惩罚罪恶累累的纳迦而带来的满足感，这点东西是微不足道的。",cEN="As sweet as it is hearing the news that the naga have been vanquished, my heart still feels empty. For the rest of my life I will be dedicated to having them all killed.\n\nHere mon, your reward as I promised. It's small in comparison to the gratification of knowing the naga fried for their hated act upon my crew."}
Q[6146]={d="我已经对这份命令做了一些调整。如果我们的小计谋成功了，他们就会暴露血色十字军圣贤，然后我们就可以出击了！\n\n现在听好了，$c。你要把这份命令交给十字军领主瓦德玛尔。\n\n怎么交给他？亲手交给他，你这白痴。\n\n把命令和这只烂苹果拿到提尔之手去。当你快到那里的时候，吃掉这个苹果，你会变成某种更加……能被人类接受的东西。把这份命令交给十字军领主瓦德玛尔。",dEN="I have made some adjustments to this command. Should our little ruse work, they will expose the Scarlet Oracle and we shall strike!\n\nNow pay attention, <class>. You are to deliver this command to the Crusader Lord, Valdelmar.\n\nHow? You are going to hand it to him, imbecile.\n\nTake the command and this rotten apple to Tyr's Hand. When you cross into the city, eat the apple. You will transform into something more... palatable to the humans. Take the command and hand it to the Crusader Lord, Valdelmar.",o="到玛瑞斯农场东南方的提尔之手去，抵达那里之后就咬一口烂苹果。在血色十字军伪装的掩护下，把大十字军的命令交给十字军领主瓦德玛尔。",oEN="Travel to Tyr's Hand, southeast of the Marris Stead. Once there, take a bite of the Rotten Apple. While under the guise of the Scarlet Crusade, deliver the Grand Crusader's Command to Crusader Lord Valdelmar.",p="这是不可接受的，士兵！",pEN="This is unacceptable, soldier!",c="你去哪儿了？我们还以为天灾军团把你给捉住了。",cEN="Where have you been? We had thought the Scourge had captured you."}
Q[6147]={d="大十字军有一个不寻常的要求。嗯，不管怎么说……他的命令必须执行。返回血色堡垒去，告诉他圣贤很快就要上路了。\n\n我们将尽全力防范，确保她毫发无伤地抵达斯坦索姆。",dEN="The Grand Crusader makes an unusual request. Hrm, regardless... what he asks will be done. Return to the Scarlet Bastion and notify him that the Oracle will be en route shortly.\n\nWe will take every precaution to ensure that she makes it to Stratholme unharmed.",o="带着新情报回去见纳萨诺斯·凋零者。|n",oEN="Return to Nathanos Blightcaller with the new information.",c="这些蠢货！我的骗局竟然没被识破！做好准备，$n。我们必须以冷静的狡诈发起攻击！",cEN="The fools! My deception went unnoticed! Prepare yourself, <class>. We must strike with cold cunning!"}
Q[6148]={d="德米提雅是大十字军的首席顾问。由于她那些超凡的感知力，人们也称她为先知。她曾协助血色十字军多次成功击败天灾军团。\n\n虽然我们的计策成功地让她暴露了，但如果她真的拥有心灵异能，她无疑会预料到某种麻烦。而你，就是那个“麻烦”。\n\n找到先知并杀了她。就在我们说话的这会儿，他们应该正从提尔之手出发。让我为你感到骄傲吧，虫子。|n",dEN="Demetria is chief advisor to the Grand Crusader. She is called the Oracle due to her 'otherworldly' senses. She has successfully assisted the Crusade in several of their victories against the Scourge.\n\nWhile this ruse was successful in exposing her, if she truly does possess psychic powers, she will undoubtedly be expecting some sort of trouble. You are going to provide that 'trouble.'\n\nTrack down the Oracle and terminate her. They should be moving out of Tyr's Hand as we speak. Make me proud, worm.",o="血色十字军正在从提尔之手到斯坦索姆的路上巡逻，你可以在巡逻队中找到圣者德米提雅和她的随从，找到并杀死她。如果你成功了，就回到纳萨诺斯·凋零者那里去复命。",oEN="The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed.",p="怎么样了，$n？",pEN="What is your status, <name>?",c="十字军遭受的这次损失将会使他们从此一蹶不振！干得漂亮，$n！你不仅赢得了我的尊敬，而且还赢得了这份奖赏。",cEN="They will be reeling from this blow for years! Well done, <name>! You have earned not only my respect but also this reward."}
Q[6161]={d="拉克摩尔的日志上面说，他的船是在驶向羽月要塞的途中受到海洋生物攻击的。为了避免自己的财宝落入敌人之手，他将宝物箱藏在了一座岛上。\n\n你需要两把钥匙才能打开箱子，一把金钥匙和一把银钥匙。这两把钥匙都丢失了，但是如果你能找到钥匙和宝箱，就能得到财宝了！",dEN="Rackmore's log tells of how his ship was sailing for Feathermoon Stronghold when it was attacked by seafaring creatures. To prevent his treasure from falling into enemy hands, he hid his chest on Ranazjar Isle.\n\nTo open the chest requires two keys, a silver and a gold. These keys were lost, but if the keys and the chest are found, a treasure awaits!",o="找到拉克摩尔的银钥匙和金钥匙。找到并打开拉克摩尔的箱子。",oEN="Find Rackmore's Silver Key. Find Rackmore's Golden Key. Find and open Rackmore's Chest.",p="这个箱子被牢牢地锁着。",pEN="This chest is securely locked.",c="箱子打开了，拉克摩尔的财宝展现在你面前！",cEN="Chest opens to reveal Rackmore's treasure!"}
Q[6162]={d="我的丈夫为了氏族的荣耀去了费伍德森林，与暗影议会和其它堕落的势力作战！\n\n他多次从死亡边缘逃了回来，直到我收到了他的一封信，说是有一名德鲁伊请他帮忙干掉一只被称作主宰洛尔的熊怪——但他们两个再也没有了音信。\n\n我想要洛尔的爪子，$n。我要它偿还令我成为寡妇的代价！我相信这头野兽就在南边……靠近灰谷的边境。",dEN="My husband traveled Felwood for the honor of our clan, doing battle against the Shadow Council and other corrupt atrocities!\n\nAfter he escaped death numerous times, I received a letter from him saying that a druid asked him for help against a great befouled furbolg named Overlord Ror--the two were never heard from again.\n\nI want this Ror's clawed hand, <name>. I want it to pay for leaving me a widow! I believe the creature is to the south... near the Ashenvale border.",o="杀死主宰洛尔，把他的爪子交给费伍德森林血毒岗哨的德雷卡苏。",oEN="Kill Overlord Ror and return his claw to Dreka'Sur at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.",p="你拿到那野兽的爪子了吗，$n？它会为它的罪行付出代价的。我不管它是堕落了还是仅仅因为生活在这片阴暗的森林中而感到愤怒。任何熊怪都不能在对我的家庭犯下这种恶行之后逍遥法外！",pEN="Do you have the beast's claw yet, <name>? It will pay for its crimes. I don't care if it's corrupt or just angry for living in such a dismal forest. No furbolg will live for long committing such crimes against my family!",c="你遵守了你的诺言。我的丈夫在战斗中牺牲——他以此为傲，但是我不能安心，除非我知道那个让我孤独一生的那头野兽已经对它的所作所为付出了代价。\n\n再次谢谢你，$n。",cEN="You bring honor to me for following through with your word. My husband died in battle--he would have been proud of that. But I could not rest until I knew that the creature that has forced me to live my life alone paid for what it had done.\n\nThank you again, <name>."}
Q[6163]={d="我被完全击败了。为了守卫我们的家园，为了守卫洛丹伦，我在这里绝望地战斗着……一切抵抗者都在潮水般的天灾士兵面前被夷为废墟。\n\n那个邪恶而肮脏的怪物把我踏在脚下，我能看到它的内脏挂在破碎的胸腔中。\n\n我被亡灵天灾唤醒了，一直以来，我是如此的无助。我的意志被巫妖王牢牢地控制着。\n\n她赶来解救了我……不管用什么方式，在什么地方，我知道她早晚会这么做的。自由。\n\n现在，我必须进行复仇——对那些夺取我生命的敌人进行复仇。毁灭它。",dEN="I was overwhelmed. On this very stead, I stood... held my ground in defense of Lordaeron. The farm and all on it were waylaid by a gigantic wave of Scourge.\n\nThe wretch. The filth. It hovered above me, entrails hanging from its gaping chest cavity.\n\nI woke as Scourge. For so long I was helpless. My mind had coalesced with the Lich King's.\n\nShe came for me... somewhere, somehow, I knew she would. Free.\n\nAnd now, I must have my vengeance - my vengeance on that which took from me my life. Destroy it.",o="到斯坦索姆去，杀掉吞咽者拉姆斯登。把他的头颅交给纳萨诺斯。",oEN="Travel to Stratholme and slay Ramstein the Gorger. Take his head as a souvenir for Nathanos.",p="在希尔瓦娜斯让我获得自由之后的这几个月来，我一直都在这片废土上狩猎那个混蛋，它居然躲进了斯坦索姆……",pEN="After Sylvanas freed me, I hunted the beast across these wastes for months. It fled to the safety of Stratholme. The bastard...",c="我想要知道……它求饶了没有？它知道什么是怜悯吗？\n\n<纳萨诺斯吐了一口唾沫。>\n\n我会把那个野兽的头颅挂在我的墙上。\n\n你将成为我麾下诸多勇士的一员，$n。\n\n<纳萨诺斯向你敬礼。>",cEN="I wonder... did it beg for mercy? Could it know what mercy is?\n\n<Nathanos spits.>\n\nI will hang this beast's head upon my wall.\n\nYou have earned a spot amongst one of my champions, <name>.\n\n<Nathanos salutes.>"}
Q[6164]={d="准备开张！你想要点什么？\n\n啊，等等……没有收据册，我就不能开张。没有收据册的话，我怎么能搞清楚帐目呢？\n\n我一定是把它丢在镇子里了。我在旅店里住过，一定是在那里。\n\n把我的收据册拿回来吧。请把它交给我！我要尽快开张营业，而你会看到我的价格完全出乎你的意料！",dEN="I'm ready for business! What you do want?\n\nOh wait... I can't open up shop without my receipt book. How am I to keep track of things without my receipt book?\n\nI must have left it in town somewhere. I had a room in the inn... the book must be there.\n\nBring me my book. Please, bring it to me! Bring me my book and you'll see! I'll set up shop and you'll see that my prices are INSANE!",o="把奥古斯图斯的收据册交给恶蛛隧道中的被感动的奥古斯图斯。",oEN="Get Augustus' Receipt Book from the inn in Terrordale.",p="你找到我的收据册了吗？我还等着重新开业哪！",pEN="Do you have my receipt book? I can't wait to get back to business!",c="你成功了！天哪！我简直都忘记这里面记载了多少东西！\n\n真是荣耀的一天，$n！太惊人了！简直太棒了！",cEN="There it is! And oh my! I forgot how full it was!\n\nThis is a glorious day, <name>! Stupendous! Insanely good, I say!"}
Q[6181]={d="尽管我没有直接从暴风城得到很多帮助，但是城里有个好心人一直在为我提供护具。他的名字叫做奥斯瑞克·斯图恩，他在暴风城的旧城区里开了一家名叫“有限防护”的店。\n\n现在我们的护甲供应短缺，所以我必须联系到奥斯瑞克以得到更多的装备。你能把这张便笺交给他吗？\n\n到暴风城去的最快捷的办法就是通过索尔，我们的狮鹫管理员。他就在山脚下，把我的便笺拿给他看看，然后从他那里租一头狮鹫飞到暴风城去吧。",dEN="Although we don't get much aid from Stormwind directly, I do have a contact in the city who helps supply us with armor. His name is Osric Strang. His shop, Limited Immunity, is in the Old Town of Stormwind.\n\nOur supply of armor dwindles, and I must contact Osric for more. Can you take him this note?\n\nThe fastest way to Stormwind is through Thor, our gryphon master. He's just down the hill; bring him my note, and then take a gryphon to Stormwind.",o="将刘易斯的便笺交给狮鹫管理员索尔。",oEN="Bring Lewis' Note to Thor the gryphon master.",p="你看起来是要急着赶路。嗯，你来对地方了！",pEN="You look like you're in a hurry. Well, then you came to the right place!",c="你要把这封信送到暴风城去？没问题，骑我的狮鹫去吧！",cEN="You have to get this note to Stormwind? That's not a problem, you can take one of my gryphons!"}
Q[6182]={d="纳萨诺斯·玛瑞斯是历史上第一个也是最后一个人类游侠领主，他是希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的学生。\n\n我们一直以为纳萨诺斯在五年前的洛丹伦保卫战中牺牲了。尽管他的尸体从未被发现，但人们都认为他不大可能从东瘟疫之地逃出来。\n\n马迪亚斯·肖尔一直在调查这起失踪案，而且可能有了一些新的消息。立即去向他汇报。马迪亚斯就住在旧城区的兵营里。",dEN="Nathanos Marris was the first and last of the human ranger lords. A disciple of Sylvanas Windrunner, now the Banshee Queen of the Forsaken.\n\nWe had thought that Nathanos had been killed in action in the defense of Lordaeron five years ago. Although his corpse was never recovered, it was assumed that he did not make it out of the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nMathias Shaw has been investigating the disappearance and may have some new information. Report to him at once. He resides in Old Town, at the Barracks.",o="与暴风城的马迪亚斯·肖尔谈一谈，他住在旧城区的兵营里。",oEN="Speak with Mathias Shaw in Old Town Stormwind. He resides in the Barracks.",c="在收到几起关于东瘟疫之地有被遗忘者异常活动的报告后，军情七处派出了一些密探前去调查。调查的结果令人感到不安。",cEN="After some reports of unusual Forsaken activity in the Eastern Plaguelands, SI:7 agents were dispatched to investigate. The results of that investigation are unsettling."}
Q[6183]={d="玛瑞斯案被分配给了我手下五名最优秀的特工。只有一人回来了，却也在三天后于睡梦中死去。\n\n我们从他那得到的少量信息完全是语无伦次的胡话。我们辨认出了两个词：“纳萨诺斯”和“凋零者”。\n\n我没有多余的人手继续这项调查，拉文霍特也不会协助我们。我们必须查明真相；哪怕只是为了给死者的家属一个交代。你愿意帮我们吗？\"\"\"\"",dEN="Five of my best field agents were assigned the Marris case. One returned, only to end up dead in his sleep three days later.\n\nWhat little information we did manage to get out of him was incoherent gibberish. We made out two words: \"Nathanos,\" and \"Blightcaller.\"\n\nI do not have the available manpower to continue this investigation and Ravenholdt will not assist us. We must get to the bottom of this; if only to provide closure to the families of the deceased. Will you help?",o="如果你愿意接这个任务，就再和马迪亚斯·肖尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mathias Shaw again if you wish to accept his task.",c="<马迪亚斯点了点头。>\n\n我就知道乌瑞恩会派出值得尊敬的人——联盟可靠的勇士。",cEN="<Mathias nods.>\n\nI had faith that Wrynn would send me men and women of honor - the most dedicated soldiers of the Alliance."}
Q[6184]={d="到目前为止，我们掌握的唯一信息就是纳萨诺斯·玛瑞斯也许已经被这个凋零者给杀死了。而且我们认为凋零者就是杀死那些军情七处密探的恶魔。\n\n另一个军情七处的间谍弗林特·沙多摩尔正驻守在西瘟疫之地冰风岗的联盟营地中。去找到他，他会告诉你瘟疫之地的现状，并派给你下一步的任务。\n\n祝你好运，$n。",dEN="The only information we have thus far, then, is that Nathanos Marris may have been slain by this Blightcaller. We assume the Blightcaller is the same fiend that disposed of my agents.\n\nFlint Shadowmore, another SI:7 operative, is stationed at the Alliance encampment of Chillwind Point in the Western Plaguelands. Seek him out; he will debrief you on the current situation in the Plagues and give you an assignment.\n\nGood luck, <name>.",o="前往西瘟疫之地的冰风岗，与你的联络人弗林特·暗影会合。|n",oEN="Travel to Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands and meet up with your contact, Flint Shadowmore.",c="第一个任务很简单，$n。进去，然后出来。侦察……",cEN="The first mission will be straight up, <name>. You go in, you come out. Recon..."}
Q[6185]={d="正如我所说的，你的第一项任务就是侦察工作。没什么难度，$n。你必须到东瘟疫之地去寻找任何有关这个凋零者的线索。\n\n留意我们的几个失踪的密探。我们只能是认为他们已经死了，不过如果他们确实死了，那就一定可以在某个地方找到……他们的尸体。\n\n<弗林特艰难地咽了一下唾沫。>\n\n所有的军情七处成员都有这样的一枚徽章。\n\n<弗林特给你看了他的军情七处徽章。>\n\n把你发现的所有东西都带回来给我。",dEN="As I said, your first mission is one of reconnaissance. Nothing fancy, <name>. You must travel to the Eastern Plaguelands and look for any clues as to this Blightcaller.\n\nBe on the lookout for information about our missing operatives. We have to assume that they are dead and if they are dead, they must have a corpse... somewhere.\n\n<Flint swallows hard.>\n\nAll SI:7 agents carry this insignia.\n\n<Flint shows you his SI:7 insignia.>\n\nBring any of those that you may find back to me.",o="在东瘟疫之地搜寻有关“凋零者”和失踪的军情七处特工的线索。如果你找到任何军情七处徽章，就把它们交给冰风岗的弗林特·暗影。\"\"",oEN="Scour the Eastern Plaguelands for clues as to the \"Blightcaller\" and the missing SI:7 agents. If you find any SI:7 Insignias, return them to Flint Shadowmore at Chillwind Camp.",p="你发现……发现什么了吗？",pEN="An... Any luck??",c="拉戈尔。弗雷多。特伊恩。都……死了……\n\n<弗林特紧紧抓住徽记。>\n\n他们在哪里？你有没有发现关于这个混蛋的更多消息，就是凋零者？",cEN="Rutger. Fredo. Turyen. All... dead...\n\n<Flint clutches the insignias tightly.>\n\nWhere were they? Did you discover any more information about this monster, the Blightcaller?"}
Q[6186]={d="<弗林特脸上的血色似乎已经完全褪去。>\n\n纳……纳萨诺斯干的？纳萨诺斯就是凋零者？\n\n为什么？他……他曾那么高尚——一位受所有人尊敬的游侠领主。唯一被允许在高等精灵门下受训的人类。如今却成了被遗忘者冷酷无情的密探？\n\n我……很抱歉要拜托你这件事，$n，但摄政王弗塔根必须立刻得知这一变故。请你回暴风城一趟，把这个消息带过去。",dEN="<The blood appears to have completely drained from Flint's face.>\n\nNa... Nathanos did this? Nathanos is the Blightcaller?\n\nWhy? He was... was so noble - a ranger lord respected by all. The only human ever allowed to train under the high elves. Now a ruthless agent of the Forsaken?\n\nI... I am sorry to ask this of you, <name>, but Highlord Fordragon must be informed of this turn of events at once. Please, return to Stormwind and deliver the news.",o="返回暴风城，向摄政王伯瓦尔·弗塔根禀报纳萨诺斯·玛瑞斯的命运。",oEN="Return to Stormwind and inform Highlord Bolvar Fordragon of the fate of Nathanos Marris.",c="不。这……不！怎么会？被遗忘者的密探？女妖之王的勇士？？？\n\n<国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩颓然瘫倒。>",cEN="No. It... NO! How? An agent of the Forsaken? The CHAMPION of the Banshee Queen???\n\n<King Varian Wrynn slumps in defeat.>"}
Q[6187]={d="你知道这个世界上总共才出现过多少游侠领主吗？你知道这其中的人类游侠领主有几个吗？\n\n纳萨诺斯的贡献是空前的。他是个战术天才，他让联盟获得了无数次战斗的胜利。\n\n现在……他却成了被遗忘者的勇士。\n\n不，事情不可能是这样的。我们必须恢复那里的秩序。\n\n召集一支部队，$n。回到瘟疫之地，杀掉凋零者。\n\n祝你好运，$n。事实上，这次你确实需要一些好运。",dEN="Do you know how many ranger lords exist in this world? How many human ranger lords have ever existed?\n\nNathanos' accomplishments were unprecedented. He was a tactical genius, responsible for Alliance victories spanning a decade of conflict.\n\nAnd now... the champion of the Forsaken.\n\nNo. This cannot be. Order must be restored.\n\nGather an army, <name>. Return to the Plagues with your army and destroy the Blightcaller.\n\nI wish you luck, <name>. Truly, you will need it for this battle.",o="组织一支部队，然后到东瘟疫之地去。向纳萨诺斯·凋零者和任何敢于保护他的部落成员发起攻击。\n\n你要倾尽全力，$n。部落会不惜一切代价保护他们的游侠领主。",oEN="Assemble an army and travel to the Eastern Plaguelands. Launch a full assault on Nathanos Blightcaller and any Horde filth that may attempt to protect him.\n\nKeep your wits about you, <name>. The Horde will defend the ranger lord with their very lives.",p="<瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王陷入了沉思。>",pEN="<King Varian Wrynn is lost in thought.>",c="这是个悲剧。我想……我认为我们的种族是被诅咒的，$n。我们损失了最伟大的战士，我们最高贵的英雄，我们最富智慧的智者。\n\n我们很荣幸能够拥有你，并且我向你保证，$n，不管纳萨诺斯·玛瑞斯如今在哪里，他一定正在对着你微笑。",cEN="It is a tragedy. I think... I believe that our kind is cursed, <name>. We are cursed to lose our greatest warriors; our most noble heroes; our most gifted scholars.\n\nWe are indebted to you and I assure you, <name>, wherever Nathanos Marris is now, he smiles down upon you."}
Q[6261]={d="$n，我收集了奥斯瑞克需要的所有东西，把它们都放在这个箱子里了。你能帮我把它运过去吗？\n\n如果你以前和西部荒野的索尔说过话，那么你就可以搭乘狮鹫直接飞回他那里。杜加尔·朗德瑞克是我们的狮鹫管理员，就在贸易区那边。\n\n和杜加尔谈一谈，然后尽快把这个东西交给刘易斯。我们不希望西部荒野的战士们赤手空拳地进行战斗！",dEN="<name>, I gathered into this crate everything Lewis asked for. Can you take it to him?\n\nIf you've already spoken to Thor in Westfall, then you can take a gryphon back to him. Dungar Longdrink is our gryphon master, over in the trade district.\n\nSpeak with Dungar, then get this crate to Lewis as fast as you can. We don't want our fighting men and women in Westfall to go without fresh equipment!",o="将奥斯瑞克的箱子交给狮鹫管理员杜加尔·朗德瑞克。",oEN="Bring Osric's Crate to Dungar Longdrink the gryphon master.",p="看你满头大汗的，$g小伙子:小姑娘，跑来跑去的真是太辛苦了。下一次，你应该搭乘狮鹫！",pEN="Is that sweat on your brow, lad? You've been running too much. Next time, take a gryphon!",c="这是要送到西部荒野去的木箱，对吗？你以前去过西部荒野？如果你去过那里的话，那就没有问题了，我的朋友。我的这些训练有素的狮鹫可以载着你直飞那里！",cEN="A crate for Westfall, eh? Have you been to Westall before? If so, then it's no problem, my friend. I have plenty of gryphons trained to fly that route!"}
Q[6281]={d="只要付一小笔费用，你就可以乘狮鹫前往暴风城，把刘易斯的字条交给奥斯瑞克。没有比这更快的办法了。\n\n如果你觉得可以，就在$g准备好:准备好;出发时再来和我谈谈。我会收你一点钱，但相信我，绝对物有所值！",dEN="For a small fee, you can take a gryphon to Stormwind, so you can deliver Lewis' note to Osric. You won't get there faster any other way.\n\nIf that sounds acceptable, then just speak to me again when you're ready for the ride. I'll charge you a little, but trust me; it'll be worth it!",o="从狮鹫管理员索尔那里租用一头狮鹫，然后把刘易斯的便笺交给暴风城的奥斯瑞克·斯图恩。",oEN="Buy a gryphon ride from the gryphon master Thor, then bring Lewis' Note to Osric Strang, in the shop Limited Immunity, in the Old Town of Stormwind.",p="你是在到处旅行吗？有没有去过什么有趣的地方？",pEN="You've been traveling, eh? Have you been anywhere interesting?",c="啊，军需官路易斯的信？他需要更多的装备，这一点我并不感到奇怪。哨兵岭是如此的遥远，它几乎都要被暴风城遗忘了。\n\n好吧，谢谢你，$n。这是给你的旅费。",cEN="Ah, a note from Quartermaster Lewis? I'm not surprised he needs more gear. Sentinel Hill is far away, in a land Stormwind has all but forgotten.\n\nWell thank you, <name>. Here's some money to cover your travel costs."}
Q[6282]={d="牛头人以保护这片土地而感到骄傲。毫无疑问，你知道我为什么对石爪山的鹰身人的数量感到担心。\n\n血怒鹰身人是卡利姆多大陆上膨胀速度最快的鹰身人族群，它们会阻止任何人离开它们的领地。\n\n你必须去减少它们的数量，$n！",dEN="Tauren take pride as the protector of these lands. Undoubtedly you can guess why I am alarmed with the number of harpies that dwell here in Stonetalon.\n\nThe Bloodfuries are the source of the increasing number of harpies in Kalimdor; they encroach upon all likes of life preventing the innocent from leaving their boundaries.\n\nI need you to cull the harpies, <name>!",o="烈日石居的马格兰要你去杀掉7个血怒鹰身人、7个血怒伏击者、7个血怒杀戮者和7个血怒游荡者。",oEN="Maggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat wants you to slay 7 Bloodfury Harpies, 7 Bloodfury Ambushers, 7 Bloodfury Slayers and 7 Bloodfury Roguefeathers.",p="不要对焦炭谷掉以轻心，许多邪恶的生物都盘踞在那里。保持斗志，$n，你将帮助我们消除这些威胁。现在出发去痛击敌人吧——让我们的后代永远都不知道这些邪恶曾经存在过。",pEN="Do not be weary of Charred Vale; many evil creatures reside in those hills. Stay strong <name>, and you shall prevail over this threat to our people. Go now and strike hard - our children shall never know of the evil of what was.",c="太好了！再跟我说说你是如何让那些邪恶的鹰身人四散逃窜的。血怒鹰身人已经遭受了重创！",cEN="This is most excellent news! Tell me again how you cast fear into the cold hearts of those vile harpies. The Bloodfuries have been dealt a serious blow!"}
Q[6283]={d="限制血怒鹰身人的数量还不够，要解决它们的问题，唯一的方法就是杀了它们的领袖，血怒撕裂者！\n\n她是那些邪恶生物的女王。只要杀了她，鹰身人的数量就一定会减少。\n\n回到焦炭谷去，你可以在西部的山岭中找到她。她可不好对付，但是如果你完成这个任务的话，我也会给你可观的奖励。",dEN="Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!\n\nShe is all but a queen to those filthy creatures. Slay her and their numbers will surely diminish.\n\nGo back into the Charred Vale and you will find her along the western hills. She will not be easy to vanquish, but the reward will be great.",o="烈日石居的马格兰要你去杀掉血怒撕裂者，然后把她的遗体带回来作为证据。",oEN="Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",p="血怒撕裂者是个肮脏的生物！你可以在焦炭谷西部的山岭中找到她。\n\n只要干掉了她，血怒鹰身人就会乱作一团……然后我们就可以把它们完全消灭掉！",pEN="Bloodfury Ripper is a nasty creature! You will have success finding her along the western hill line in the Charred Vale.\n\nThe bloodfuries will be helpless with out... surely we can vanquish them forever!",c="我的愤怒正在逐渐消退。我该怎么办呢？当我知道邪恶的力量靠近我的家园时，我的思绪就无法稳定下来，虽然它们现在很沉寂。也许这是件好事……也许我现在可以专注于一些好的事情，就像所有牛头人都应该做的那样。\n\n请收下这个作为你的奖励。",cEN="Already I feel the anger leave me. What will I do with my time? Knowing evil moves near my land kept my thoughts moving, though now they are silent. Perhaps this is a good thing... maybe now I can focus on the good, as all Tauren should.\n\nPlease accept this as a reward for your troubles."}
Q[6284]={d="警告：从这里往西进入希塞尔山谷的旅行者请多加小心。\n\n贝瑟莱斯和她的蜘蛛后代们占领了这座峡谷，将其作为它们的巢穴。\n\n烈日石居的马格兰正在悬赏贝瑟莱斯。杀了她并将证据交给马格兰以换取奖励。",dEN="Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk.\n\nBesseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair.\n\nMaggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat has placed a bounty on Besseleth. Slay her and bring proof of your killing to Maggran; there you will receive your reward for disposing this eight-legged menace.",o="杀掉贝瑟莱斯，然后把贝瑟莱斯的牙齿交给烈日石居的马格兰。",oEN="Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.",p="贝瑟莱斯是个残忍的猎食者……我晚上都不敢独自在蛛网小径行走。每当那个时候，她和她的孩子们就会潜伏在黑暗中，准备猎捕无辜的旅人。我也曾经落入她的魔爪，幸运的是我活着逃了出来。我会为干掉这头怪兽而付出一切的。",pEN="Besseleth is a ruthless predator... I fear for those that travel Webwinder Path at night. It's then that she and her children prey upon innocent travelers. I myself fell prey to her two-foot fang of death, but luckily I was able to fend her off and get to safety. I would give anything to see that monster destroyed.",c="狩猎愉快，$n！贝瑟莱斯是这一带的老猎手了……我不会想念她的。收下这份奖赏吧，作为你$g身为:身为;森林冠军:冠军;的证明。\n\n<马格兰摸了摸被贝瑟莱斯造成的伤口。>\n\n也许从现在起，会有更多人前往烈日石居，不必再担心黑暗中潜伏着什么了。",cEN="Good hunting, <name>! Besseleth is an old predator in these parts... I will miss her not. Take this reward as a token for being the forest champion.\n\n<Maggran rubs the wound caused by Besseleth.>\n\nPerhaps now many more will travel to Sun Rock Retreat without fearing what lurks in the dark."}
Q[6285]={d="西部荒野的狮鹫管理员是索尔。如果你以前和他说过话，就可以乘我的狮鹫去他那里。\n\n有件事你最好知道：狮鹫总是受过训练，能飞往自己的主城，但只有在你去过某位偏远狮鹫管理员那里之后，它们才会载你飞过去。\n\n你已经见过索尔了，所以等$g准备好:准备好;乘狮鹫去西部荒野时，再来和我谈谈。到了那里，你就可以把奥斯瑞克的箱子交给军需官刘易斯。",dEN="The gryphon master in Westfall is Thor. If you've spoken to him before, then you can take one of my gryphons to him.\n\nThat's a good lesson to know: gryphons are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they'll only take you to a remote gryphon master after you've already been there.\n\nYou've already been to Thor, so just speak with me again when you're ready to take a gryphon to Westfall. Once there, you can deliver Osric's Crate to Quartermaster Lewis.",o="从狮鹫管理员杜加尔·朗德瑞克那里租用一头狮鹫飞到哨兵岭，然后将奥斯瑞克的箱子交给哨兵岭的刘易斯。",oEN="Buy a gryphon ride to Sentinel Hill from the gryphon master Dungar Longdrink, then take Osric's Crate to Lewis at Sentinel Hill.",p="你从暴风城回来了？奥斯瑞克的护甲拿到了没有？",pEN="You're back from Stormwind? Did Osric send the armor?",c="很好！我会把这些护甲分发给需要它们的人。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你的努力对我们的帮助很大。现在你对狮鹫已经不陌生了，我希望你多为哨兵岭出一些力！",cEN="Great, you brought the armor! We'll get this divvied to those who need it immediately.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your efforts have been a great help to us. And now that you're no stranger to gryphons, I hope you'll come and lend your aid to Sentinel Hill often!"}
Q[6301]={d="工业集团的贪婪和持续不断的战事已经让了石爪山脉的土地饱经创伤，在我的血管中流淌着的萨满能量可以帮助这里的森林。\n\n$n，我需要派你去寻找一种特殊的种子。盖亚之种仅生长石爪山地区，你可以在北边的暗色湖一带找到盖亚之种，就在湖岸边。\n\n当你把种子交给我之后，我就会为它们灌入萨满的能量，使它们快速成长。",dEN="Industrial greed and continuous war have wrecked the lands of Stonetalon. Only the blessings of the Earthmother can cure such injury.\n\n<name>, I will require you to seek a special seed, the Gaea seed. They are only found here in Stonetalon Mountain, north of Sun Rock Retreat at Mirkfallon Lake, near the water's edge.\n\nOnce you bring me the seeds I will imbue them with shamanistic power to speed their growth.",o="烈日石居的塔姆拉·荒原想让你去收集10枚盖亚之种。",oEN="Tammra Windfield at Sun Rock Retreat wants you to gather 10 Gaea Seeds.",p="战争带来的持续破坏，还有那些想要从木材贸易中牟利的商人都深深地刺痛了我。我们所能做的就是尽量治愈大自然，种植盖亚之种，用新生的森林来抚平大地的创伤。你弄到我要的盖亚之种了吗，$c？",pEN="The continuous destruction caused by war and those that seek a profit from lumber pains me deeply. To aid the cycle of rebirth and replenish the lands, I need Gaea seeds. Do you have them, <class>?",c="啊，$n，你拿到盖亚之种了。看看这些种子将如何给土地带来新的活力吧，只有这些纯净的植物可以治愈大地的创伤。\n\n<塔姆拉开始吟唱魔法。>",cEN="Ah, <name>, you have the Gaea seeds. Watch and see how the blessing of the Earthmother can cause even these small kernels of life to bloom and flourish.\n\n<Tammra begins to chant.>"}
Q[6321]={d="执行官哈德瑞克让我清查我们在瑟伯切尔的装备。由于森林中潜伏着的天灾军团士兵的威胁，他不希望我们在装备方面有所短缺。\n\n我发现，我们的武器装备基本上库存丰富，但是我们仍然需要更多的武器来替换那些在战场上丢失的武器。\n\n这是一份武器订单，把它交给幽暗城里的武器供应商高顿·温德哈姆。带着订单去找我们的蝙蝠管理员卡洛斯·拉佐克，跟他谈谈关于前往幽暗城的事儿吧。",dEN="Executor Hadrec asked me to take stock of our equipment at the Sepulcher. With the Scourge, and worse, lurking in the woods, he doesn't want the Deathguards to lack gear they might need.\n\nI found that we are, in general, well stocked, but we do need more weapons to replace those lost in the field.\n\nHere is a requisition order of what is needed, for the weapon dealer Gordon Wendham in the Undercity. Take the order to our bat master, Karos Razok, and speak with him about transport to the Undercity.",o="将博迪瑞格的订单交给卡洛斯·拉佐克。",oEN="Bring Podrig's Order to Karos Razok.",p="你似乎是有公务在身……",pEN="You appear to be on official business...",c="啊，一份供给订单。毫无疑问，你想要带着这份订单去幽暗城。那么就快点动身吧，瑟伯切尔急需物资补给。",cEN="Ah, an order for supplies. You will want to take this to the Undercity, no doubt. And quickly, for the Sepulcher must not be left under stocked."}
Q[6322]={d="我已经将瑟伯切尔那边要求的物资装箱了。如果你已经拜访过瑟伯切尔，并与他们那里的蝙蝠管理员打过招呼，那么你就可以乘坐蝙蝠回到那儿去。\n\n与幽暗城的蝙蝠饲养员迈克尔·加勒特谈谈吧，他可以为你提供一只飞往瑟伯切尔的蝙蝠。",dEN="I have placed the Sepulcher's supplies into this crate. If you have already visited the Sepulcher and spoken with their bat master, then you may ride a bat back to him.\n\nSpeak with the Undercity's bat master, Michael Garrett. He can provide you with a bat to the Sepulcher.",o="将高顿的箱子交给迈克尔·加勒特。",oEN="Bring Gordon's Crate to Michael Garrett.",p="如果你非得进行长途跋涉的话，最好选择乘坐蝙蝠的方式。",pEN="If you must travel a long distance, then a bat is your best option.",c="这只木箱是要送往银松森林的瑟伯切尔？这很容易，我们的蝙蝠每天都往那儿飞。",cEN="This crate must reach the Sepulcher in Silverpine? That is easily done; our bats fly there daily."}
Q[6323]={d="我的一只蝙蝠可以带你去幽暗城。通常要付一小笔费用，但像你这样$g英俊:迷人;的$r，飞往幽暗城是免费的。等你$g准备好:准备好;再来和我谈谈，我们来安排行程。\n\n你会在幽暗城的贸易区找到戈登·温德姆。我的蝙蝠就降落在同一个区域。",dEN="One of my bats can take you to the Undercity, for a small fee. Speak with me again when you are ready so that we may arrange your transport.\n\nYou will find Gordon Wendham in the Trade Quarter of the Undercity. That is the same quarter where my bat will land.",o="从蝙蝠管理员卡洛斯·拉佐克那里租一只蝙蝠飞往幽暗城，然后将博迪瑞格的订单交给幽暗城里的高顿·温德哈姆。",oEN="Buy a bat ride to the Undercity from the bat master Karos Razok, then take Podrig's Order to Gordon Wendham in the Undercity.",p="我的武器保养得无懈可击。它们毫无瑕疵，随时都可使用。",pEN="I keep my weapons in top condition. They are cleaned and ready for use.",c="一份来自瑟伯切尔的订单？好极了。能为黑暗女王的侍从提供服务是我的荣幸。",cEN="An order from the Sepulcher? Very well. It is an honor to serve those who serve our Dark Lady."}
Q[6324]={d="墓室的蝙蝠管理员是卡洛斯·拉佐克。如果你已经和他说过话，我就可以给你一只蝙蝠，让你飞到他那里。\n\n我们的蝙蝠总是飞往幽暗城，但要前往更偏远的地区，骑手必须先去过那里，并与当地的蝙蝠管理员交谈。\n\n你已经在墓室见过卡洛斯了，所以现在你可以乘蝙蝠飞过去。等你$g准备好:准备好;再来和我谈谈。",dEN="The bat master in the Sepulcher is Karos Razok. If you have already met him, then I can give you a bat to fly back to him.\n\nOur bats will always fly to the Undercity, but to travel to more remote locales their rider must first visit the area and speak with its bat master.\n\nYou have met Karos in the Sepulcher, so you may now fly bats there. Speak with me again when you are ready.",o="从蝙蝠管理员迈克尔·加勒特那儿租一只蝙蝠飞往瑟伯切尔，然后将高顿的箱子交给瑟伯切尔的亡灵卫兵博迪瑞格。",oEN="Buy a bat ride to the Sepulcher from the bat master Michael Garrett, then bring Gordon's Crate to Deathguard Podrig in the Sepulcher.",p="$n，你回来了。你从幽暗城带来我们所需的物资了吗？",pEN="<name>, you return. Do you have our supplies from the Undercity?",c="干得不错，$n。这些武器能确保我们的士兵有充足的准备。\n\n你为黑暗女王做出了颇具价值的贡献。",cEN="Good work, <name>. These weapons will ensure our Deathguards don't get caught unprepared.\n\nYou have done a valuable service for our Dark Lady."}
Q[6341]={d="多兰纳尔的所有人都为阿奎恩姐妹感到骄傲。她收到尼奥玛这份好意的礼物一定会很高兴。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;前往达纳苏斯时，再来和我谈谈，花几枚硬币就能买到一段角鹰兽旅程。我听说阿奎恩姐妹喜欢达纳苏斯角鹰兽管理员正南方那个小广场的清静。到了那里就去找她。",dEN="The fishermen of Rut'theran village do very well, for the fish here are extremely large and abundant. I would like to compare the bounty here with that of the mainland.\n\nI have a collection of fish bones and scales that I would like taken to a colleague of mine in Darkshore. His name is Laird, he is a fish vendor in the village of Auberdine.\n\nBring my collection to our hippogryph master, Vesprystus, and speak to him about traveling to Auberdine.",o="将尼莎的货物交给维斯派塔斯。",oEN="Bring Nessa's Collection to Vesprystus.",p="我能帮你什么忙吗？你是来搭乘角鹰兽的吗？",pEN="How may I help you? Are you in need of transport?",c="啊，你要把这个送到奥伯丁？很好……",cEN="Ah, you wish to get this to Auberdine? Very well..."}
Q[6342]={d="从鲁瑟兰村到奥伯丁去的方法有两种：乘船或者骑角鹰兽。这两种方式都很迅捷可靠，但是如果你没有搭乘过角鹰兽的话，我建议你试一下。\n\n另外，你最好和各个城镇中的角鹰兽管理员谈谈。一旦你和某地的角鹰兽饲养员打过了招呼，那么以后你就可以从其它城镇飞到那里去了。\n\n这里是尼莎的货物。如果你准备好了的话，就再次和我对话，然后把这包东西送到莱尔德那里。",dEN="From Rut'theran, there are two methods of travel to Auberdine: by ferry and by hippogryph. Both are quick and reliable, but if you have not yet flown to Auberdine by hippogryph, then I suggest you do.\n\nIt is sound advice to speak with the hippogryph master in every town that has one. Once you speak to the master, you can then fly there from other towns.\n\nHere is Nessa's collection. Speak with me again when you are ready to fly to Auberdine and deliver Nessa's collection to Laird.",o="从角鹰兽管理员维斯派塔斯那里租用一只角鹰兽飞到奥伯丁，然后将尼莎的货物交给莱尔德。",oEN="Ride a hippogryph to Auberdine from the hippogryph master Vesprystus, then bring Nessa's Collection to Laird.",p="你是从泰达希尔来的？告诉我，那里的渔业近况如何？",pEN="Have you come from Teldrassil? Tell me, how is the fishing there?",c="奈莎送来的包裹？谢谢你，$N！她说过如果她在鲁瑟兰村钓到鱼的话，就会托人把样品送到我这里来。她认为那里的鱼可能和这边的不太一样……\n\n我的天啊！这条鱼的个头几乎比这里的同类大了两倍！这些鳞片都有拳头那么大！太令人惊奇了！",cEN="A package from Nessa? Thank you, <name>! She told me she would send me samples of the fish caught near Rut'theran village. She thinks they may be very different from the fish caught here...\n\nMy! This jawbone is nearly twice the size of the same fish found here. And these scales are as big as a closed fist! Amazing!"}
Q[6343]={d="给你安排一趟飞回多兰纳尔的行程很容易。既然你在那里认识菲德利奥，回去不成问题。\n\n每当你到达一座新城市，记得去和飞行管理员谈谈，这样你才能从新区域起飞、飞抵新区域。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;购买一段角鹰兽旅程返回多兰纳尔时，来找我谈谈。",dEN="I must send a response to Nessa. She'll be very interested to know how different the fish here are from those along Teldrassil's coastline. We can only guess the cause, but it is my suspicion that the world tree itself is affecting the wildlife around it!\n\nPlease, take this response to Nessa. If you wish to take a hippogryph back to Rut'theran then speak with the hippogryph master Caylais Moonfeather. If you wish to take the ferry, then one regularly departs from the dock to the northwest.",o="将莱尔德的回信交给尼莎·影歌。",oEN="Bring Laird's Response to Nessa Shadowsong.",p="$n，你从奥伯丁必来了？你和赖尔德谈过了吗？",pEN="<name>, you're back from Auberdine? Did you speak with Laird?",c="真有趣。这里的鱼很大，但是我不认为它们和卡利姆多大陆的鱼有很大的差异。这一定是有原因的……\n\n很好，谢谢你，$n。我会和其他村民讨论一下的。也许有一天，我们能搞清楚这种情况出现的原因。但是在此之前，我们要尽情享受它给我们带来的好处！",cEN="This is very interesting. The fish here are large, but I didn't think the difference in bounties between here and the mainland was so great. There must be a reason for this...\n\nWell thank you, <name>. I will discuss with the villagers the news you brought. Perhaps, one day, we will find the root of this oddity. But until then, we shall reap its benefits!"}
Q[6344]={d="我的朋友尼莎·影歌是鲁瑟兰村的一个渔业商人，她要把一只包裹送到黑海岸去，所以她正在找人帮忙。\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，那就去找尼莎吧。从达纳苏斯到鲁瑟兰村去的传送门就在神殿花园的西边。",dEN="A friend of mine, Nessa Shadowsong, is a fishing merchant in Rut'theran Village. She needs a parcel taken to Darkshore, and is looking for someone to help her.\n\nIf you're interested, then to reach Nessa you must take the portal in Darnassus to Rut'theran Village. You will find the portal west of the Temple Gardens.",o="与尼莎·影歌谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nessa Shadowsong.",c="对，我是要找一个跑腿的帮我把包裹送到黑海岸去，你愿意帮我吗？",cEN="Yes, I have need of a courier who will take a package to Darkshore. Will you help me?"}
Q[6361]={d="我有一捆从贫瘠之地采集的兽皮，必须要把它们送到雷霆崖去。我在那儿的同伴安哈努需要用这些兽皮来制作皮件。\n\n你能帮我把这些兽皮交给他吗？\n\n前往雷霆崖最为快捷的方法就是乘坐双足飞龙。带着这捆兽皮去十字路口找双足飞龙管理员迪弗拉克，跟他谈谈到雷霆崖去的事儿。",dEN="I have a bundle of hides from the animals of the Barrens, and must get them to Thunder Bluff. A colleague there, Ahanu, will use the hides to create leather goods.\n\nWill you take the hides to him for me?\n\nThe quickest way to Thunder Bluff is on the back of a wind rider. Bring the bundle of hides to Devrak, our wind rider master in the Crossroads, and speak to him about transport to Thunder Bluff.",o="带着兽皮去找十字路口的迪弗拉克。",oEN="Bring the Bundle of Hides to the wind rider master Devrak in the Crossroads.",p="你是来租用双足飞龙的吗？你需要运送什么货物吗？",pEN="Are you here for a wind rider? You have something to transport?",c="你要把这些兽皮送到雷霆崖去？找我就对了！",cEN="If you must take these hides to Thunder Bluff, then you are speaking to the right orc!"}
Q[6362]={d="只要一小笔费用，我就给你安排一头双足飞龙前往雷霆崖。没有比这更快的进城方式了！\n\n如果你觉得可以，就在$g准备好:准备好;出发时回来和我谈谈。\n\n如果你要把那些皮子送给阿哈努，我记得他在雷霆崖双足飞龙塔底部的赫瓦军械库。而你正好就降落在那里！",dEN="For a small fee, I will give you a wind rider to Thunder Bluff. There's no faster way to the city!\n\nIf that is acceptable, speak to me again when you are ready to go.\n\nIf you're taking those hides to Ahanu, then I think he's at Hewa's Armory, at the base of the wind rider tower in Thunder Bluff. And that's right where you'll land!",o="从双足飞龙管理员迪弗拉克那里租一只驭风者飞往雷霆崖，然后将这捆兽皮交给雷霆崖的安哈努。",oEN="Buy a wind rider to Thunder Bluff from the wind rider master Devrak, then bring the Bundle of Hides to Ahanu in Thunder Bluff.",p="你肩膀上有来自贫瘠之地的灰尘。你同我的朋友加翰见过面吗？",pEN="There is dust on your shoulders that must be from the Barrens. You have spoken with my friend Jahan?",c="啊，一捆新的兽皮。我要马上就开始动手制作皮件！\n\n谢谢你，$g兄弟:姐妹。你帮了我的大忙。这些是你的报酬。",cEN="Ah, a new bundle of hides. I will get to work on these immediately!\n\nThank you, <brother/sister>. You have done me a great service. Here are some coins to pay for your time and travel costs."}
Q[6363]={d="我已经为加翰准备好了供他在十字路口出售的皮件。请你把这些交给他好吗？\n\n如果你已经拜访过了十字路口的双足飞龙管理员，那么你就可以乘坐雷霆崖的双足飞龙返回他那儿了。\n\n将皮件交给雷霆崖的双足飞龙管理员塔尔，然后和他谈谈前往十字路口的行程安排。",dEN="I have prepared leather goods for Jahan to sell at the Crossroads. Will you bring them to him?\n\nIf you have already been to the Crossroads and spoken to their wind rider master, then you can fly one of our Thunder Bluff wind riders back to him.\n\nTake the leather goods to Tal, our wind rider master in Thunder Bluff, and speak with him to arrange transport to the Crossroads.",o="将安哈努的皮货交给雷霆崖的塔尔。",oEN="Bring Ahanu's Leather Goods to Tal in Thunder Bluff.",p="你好，$c。我能为你做什么吗？",pEN="Greetings, <class>. What can I do for you?",c="你要把这个送到十字路口去，对吗？没问题。要是你已经去过那儿，并且和迪弗拉克打过招呼，你就可以乘坐我的双足飞龙直接回到他那儿了。",cEN="You need to take this to the Crossroads, eh? That's not a problem. If you've already been there and spoken to Devrak, then you can take one of my wind riders back to him."}
Q[6364]={d="要飞往一座城镇，你必须先去那里，并与该城镇的双足飞龙管理员谈过话。你去过十字路口，也和他们的双足飞龙管理员德弗拉克谈过，所以只要一小笔费用，你就可以从这里乘双足飞龙去他那里。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;再来和我谈谈。到了十字路口，你就可以把那些皮货交给贾汉·鹰翼。",dEN="In order to fly to a town, you must have already been there and spoken with the wind rider master of that town. You have been to the Crossroads and spoken to their wind rider master Devrak, so for a small fee you can take a wind rider to him from here.\n\nSpeak with me again when you are ready. Once at the Crossroads, you can then deliver the leather goods to Jahan Hawkwing.",o="从双足飞龙管理员塔尔那里租用一头飞往十字路口的双足飞龙，并把安哈努的皮货交给加翰·鹰翼。",oEN="Buy a wind rider to the Crossroads from the wind rider master Tal, then bring Ahanu's Leather Goods to Jahan Hawkwing.",p="$n，你是从雷霆崖回来的吗？你把皮革送到安哈努那里了吗？",pEN="<name>, you are back from Thunder Bluff? Did you deliver the hides to Ahanu?",c="安哈努送来了皮货？很好！十字路口这里有很多猎人和冒险者来来往往，生意也非常火爆。我肯定我会很快把这些货物都卖光的。\n\n谢谢你的努力，$n。我欠你的人情。",cEN="Ahanu sent me finished products? Very good. There are many hunters and adventurers in the Crossroads now and business is lively. I am sure I'll sell these goods very soon.\n\nThank you for all your efforts, <name>. I am in your debt."}
Q[6365]={d="我有一些上等的肉片想送给我的朋友。她的名字叫雷什卡，是奥格瑞玛旅店的老板。你可以替我把这些肉交给她吗？\n\n到奥格瑞玛去的最快捷方法就是乘坐双足飞龙。带着这些肉去找十字路口的双足飞龙管理员迪弗拉克，跟他谈谈关于到奥格瑞玛去的事情。",dEN="I have some choice cuts of meat that I want to send to a friend. Her name is Gryshka, the innkeeper in Orgrimmar. Will you deliver the meat for me?\n\nThe fastest way to Orgrimmar is on a wind rider. Take the meats to the Crossroads wind rider master, Devrak, and speak with him about transport to Orgrimmar.",o="把扎尔夫的肉品交给十字路口的迪弗拉克。",oEN="Bring Zargh's Meats to Devrak in the Crossroads.",p="你需要快速赶到某个地方去？找我就对了！",pEN="You need to get somewhere fast? Then you're talking to the right orc!",c="你要把这块肉送到奥格瑞玛去？没问题。只需支付一点点费用，我的双足飞龙就可以把你带去。",cEN="You have to get this meat to Orgrimmar? That is no problem. For a small fee, my wind rider can take you there."}
Q[6381]={d="如你所见，$c，我纯净的心灵可以为这片不毛之地带来新的生机。你必须将这些种子种植在破坏之源中，在西边的焦炭谷里就是破坏大自然的源泉——这片被污染的土地上到处都是鹰身人和凶恶的火元素。\n\n$n，拿着这些附有魔法的盖亚之种，把它们种植在盖亚土堆里。",dEN="As you have seen, <class>, though the land is in pain, the cycle of life is a powerful thing. Now we must do our part help it along. You must plant these seeds at the center of the destruction, to the west, in the Charred Vale. Beware, for harpies and angry fire elementals still plague the scarred land.\n\n<name>, take these enchanted Gaea seeds and plant them in fertile mounds of soil. The cycle of life must go on!",o="将10枚盖亚之种种植在盖亚土堆中，然后与烈日石居的塔姆拉谈一谈。",oEN="Plant 10 Gaea Seeds in Gaea Dirt Mounds, and then return the remaining Enchanted Gaea Seeds to Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat.",p="你所种下的种子将使得森林更加强大，使它可以抵御那些足够杀死所有新生命的堕落能量。它们将不断生长，防止死亡和破坏继续在这块土地上蔓延。\n\n你种下所有的盖亚之种了吗？",pEN="These seeds you plant are strong, resisting corruption, and making a foothold for other life. They will grow and grow, first preventing corruption and healing the scarred land, and then one day, restoring Stonetalon to a lush forest, once again.\n\nHave you planted all of the Gaea seeds?",c="这是这片土地的一大胜利。假以时日，其他事情也会随之发生：风险投资公司会收起他们的圆锯和斧头，愤怒的火焰之灵会平息下来，鹰身女妖也会被这片土地驱逐出去。\n\n只有到那时，$n，石爪山才会真正迎来和平。\n\n你做得很好，$c；收下其中一件物品吧，作为对你今天在此创造新生的感谢。",cEN="This is great victory for the land. In time, other things will come to pass: the Venture Co. will pack up their buzz saws and axes, the angry fire spirits will calm, and the harpies will be pushed out by the land.\n\nOnly then <name>, will Stonetalon be truly at peace.\n\nYou have done well <class>; take one of these items as thanks for the new life you have created here today."}
Q[6382]={d="你的力量给我留下了深刻的印象，$c。你对狩猎兴趣昂然，这让我相信你有能力参与更大规模的狩猎行动……面临更大的挑战。\n\n灰谷森林是一大片未开化的土地，部落正在为控制这片土地而努力。如果你想要在那里证明自己的能力，就到碎木哨岗去寻求塞娜尼·雷心的指点吧。那个前哨站就在贫瘠之地的正北方。",dEN="Your strength impresses me, <class>. Your willingness to embrace the hunt gives me confidence that you could move on to bigger game... and bigger challenges.\n\nThe forests of Ashenvale represent a vast untamed wild that the Horde seeks to impose its own will upon, both politically and spiritually. If you seek to prove yourself in an unproven land, seek the guidance of Senani Thunderheart in Splintertree Post. The outpost is due north of the path leading from the Barrens.",o="与灰谷碎木哨岗的塞娜尼·雷心谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.",c="欢迎来到这块新的疆土，$n。灰谷是一片充满机遇的土地，像你这样年轻的$c肯定可以在这里找到无数证明自己实力的机会。在这里的前哨站到处转转，然后到佐拉姆海岸去，部落在那儿设有另一个岗哨。\n\n我看得出你是到这儿来学习狩猎的。用心学习吧，我将很乐意与你分享我所掌握的知识。",cEN="Welcome to the new frontier, <name>. Ashenvale is a land of opportunity, one where a young <class> like yourself is able to find boundless chances to prove their mettle. Look around the outpost here, and be sure to travel out to the Zoram Strand, as the Horde has another outpost there as well.\n\nYour presence here tells me that you've come to learn more about the hunt. Listen close, and I will gladly share with you what you need to know."}
Q[6383]={c="有三只传说生物组成了灰谷狩猎；你可以去寻找它们，用它们的狡诈与力量来考验自己。在这个过程中，希望你也能对自己有所了解。这三只生物是：熊乌萨苟斯、夜刃豹沙德姆布拉和角鹰兽利爪。\n\n灰谷狩猎中的生物都很强大，你可能会发现自己需要帮助才能击败它们。如果你做到了，就带着狩猎的凭证来见我，$g真的:真的;。",cEN="There are three legendary creatures that make up the Ashenvale Hunt; you may seek them and test yourself against their cunning and might. In the process, you will hopefully learn something about yourself. The creatures are: the bear Ursangous, the nightsaber cat Shadumbra, and the hippogryph Sharptalon.\n\nThe creatures of the Ashenvale Hunt are powerful, and you may find that you'll need aid in bringing them down. If you should best them, bring me proof of your deed."}
Q[6384]={d="只要几枚硬币，我就为你安排一头双足飞龙送你去奥格瑞玛。到了那里，你就可以把扎尔格的肉交给格里什卡。她的旅店就在力量谷。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;启程时，回到这里和我谈谈。",dEN="For just a few coins I will have a wind rider bring you to Orgrimmar. When you get there, you can take Zargh's Meats to Gryshka. Her inn is in the Valley of Strength, not far from the Skytower, where my wind rider will drop you off.\n\nSpeak with me again when you are ready for the journey.",o="从双足飞龙管理员迪弗拉克那里租一只驭风者飞往奥格瑞玛，然后将扎尔夫的肉品交给奥格瑞玛的格雷什卡。",oEN="Buy a wind rider to Orgrimmar from the wind rider master Devrak, then bring Zargh's Meats to Gryshka in Orgrimmar.",p="这味儿真好闻！你身上带着新鲜的肉，对吗？",pEN="Something smells good! You don't have raw meat on you, do you?",c="啊，棒极了！这些肉真不错！这些是札尔夫给我的肉，是吗？那个家伙倒是很清楚如何赢得女士的芳心啊……\n\n我马上就要把这些肉煮了吃，但是不能煮得太多！物以稀为贵，你说对吧？",cEN="Oh, wonderful! Those are fine cuts! These are from Zargh, are they? That orc sure knows his way into a lady's heart...\n\nOh, I can't wait to cook it. But not too much! Meat is best served rare, don't you think?"}
Q[6385]={d="我已经为扎尔夫写了一封感谢信。你能帮我交给他吗？如果你已经去过十字路口，并且和那里的双足飞龙管理员谈过话，那么你就可以乘坐一头双足飞龙直飞到那里去。\n\n把我的信交给奥格瑞玛的双足飞龙管理员多拉斯，并同他谈谈去十字路口的事儿。",dEN="I've written a letter of thanks to Zargh. Will you deliver it for me? If you've already been to the Crossroads and spoken with their wind rider master, then you can fly a wind rider back there.\n\nTake my letter to Doras, the wind rider master of Orgrimmar, and speak with him about transport to the Crossroads.",o="将格雷什卡的信交给奥格瑞玛的多拉斯。",oEN="Bring Gryshka's Letter to Doras in Orgrimmar.",p="你需要租用双足飞龙吗？",pEN="Do you need one of my wind riders?",c="你要把这个带到贫瘠之地的十字路口去吗？嗯，没问题……",cEN="You have to get this to the Crossroads in the Barrens? Yes, I can get you there..."}
Q[6386]={d="我的双足飞龙受过训练，可以飞往许多不同的地方，前提是你已经去过那里，并与当地的双足飞龙管理员谈过话。\n\n你去过十字路口，也和他们的双足飞龙管理员德弗拉克谈过，所以现在你可以从这里直接飞到他那里。等你到了十字路口，就可以把格里什卡的感谢信交给扎尔格。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;出发时回来和我谈谈。",dEN="My wind riders are trained to fly to many different places, as long as you have already been to that place and spoken with the wind rider master there.\n\nYou have been to the Crossroads and spoken to their wind rider master Devrak, so now you can fly directly to him from here. Once you're at the Crossroads, you can deliver Gryshka's letter to Zargh.\n\nSpeak with me when you are ready to go.",o="从驭风者管理员多拉斯那里雇一只驭风者前往十字路口，然后将格雷什卡的信交给十字路口的扎尔夫。",oEN="Buy a wind rider to the Crossroads from the wind rider master Doras, then bring Gryshka's Letter to Zargh at the Crossroads.",p="你是从奥格瑞玛回来的吗？格雷什卡喜欢我送给她的肉吗？",pEN="Have you returned from Orgrimmar? Did Gryshka like the meat I sent her?",c="哈！我就知道她会喜欢的！除了一大块鲜美多汁的烤肉，没有什么能让这样一位小姐的脸颊泛起红光了！\n\n谢谢你，$n。你帮了我的大忙。这是我给你的一点报酬，要是我邀请你参加我的婚礼，可别感到惊讶啊！",cEN="Hah! I guess she liked it! Nothing brings red to a lady's cheeks like a big, juicy steak!\n\nThank you, <name>. You've done me a great service. Here is some money for your trouble, and don't be surprised if I invite you to my wedding!"}
Q[6387]={d="我看见门前聚集了一大群年轻的矮人，他们都迫切地想要学习采矿技巧。如果说有一件东西是矿工最为需要的工具的话，那当然是铁锄无疑了！\n\n我有一张学习采矿的学生的名单，他们表现得都很出色，因此都将获得一把荣誉锄。把这张名单交给铁炉堡的高尼尔·石趾，他会为你准备好荣誉锄。\n\n去铁炉堡最快的途径是乘坐狮鹫，带着这张名单去找狮鹫管理员索格拉姆·伯雷森吧，跟他谈谈去铁炉堡的事儿。",dEN="I see a lot of young dwarves at my door, eager to learn the trade of mining. And if there's one thing a miner needs more than anything, it's a pick!\n\nI have a list of mining students who scored high in their lessons and earned an honorary pick. Take my list to Golnir Bouldertoe in Ironforge. He'll get the picks ready.\n\nThe fastest way to Ironforge is on a gryphon, so bring the list to our gryphon master, Thorgrum Borrelson, and speak with him about transport to Ironforge.",o="将布洛克的名单交给塞尔萨玛的索格拉姆·伯雷森。",oEN="Bring Brock's List to Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar.",p="你这么快就办完了在塞尔萨玛的事儿吗？现在你是要转至其它座城市吗？",pEN="Have you had your fill of Thelsamar so soon? Are you ready to leave for another city?",c="你要带着这个去铁炉堡，对吗？你只需支付一小笔费用，我就可以为你提供一匹狮鹫，它将把你带到那儿去。怎么样？",cEN="You have to get this to Ironforge, eh? For a small fee I can put you on the back of one of my gryphons, and it'll take you there. How does that sound?"}
Q[6388]={d="这是给布洛克的学生的荣誉锄。如果你已经去过塞尔萨玛了，那么就乘坐狮鹫返回那里吧！\n\n把这些荣誉锄交给狮鹫管理员格莱斯·瑟登，跟他谈谈关于返回塞尔萨玛的事儿。",dEN="Here are the honorary picks for Brock's students. If you've already been to Thelsamar, then you should fly a gryphon back there!\n\nTake the picks to our gryphon master, Gryth Thurden, and speak with him about a ride back to Thelsamar.",o="将荣誉锄交给铁炉堡的格莱斯·瑟登。",oEN="Bring the Honorary Picks to Gryth Thurden in Ironforge.",p="似乎你是要外出旅行，需要乘坐狮鹫吗？",pEN="You look like you have somewhere to go. Need one of my gryphons?",c="你要把这些东西带到塞尔萨玛去，对吗？没问题。只要你已经去过塞尔萨玛，而且跟索格拉姆·伯雷森谈过话，你就能乘坐我的狮鹫回到他那儿。",cEN="You have to get these to Thelsamar, eh? That won't be a problem. As long as you've already been to Thelsamar and spoken to Thorgrum Borrelson, then you can take one of my gryphons back to him."}
Q[6389]={d="你在伐木场附近寻找能打开桶的工具，很快就找到了一根铁棍，似乎可以用它撬开桶。\n\n你开始撬桶，并暗自祈祷能在白蚁发现你之前离开伐木场。",dEN="You look around the lumber mill for something suitable to open the barrel with. You find a crowbar that looks like it will do the trick.\n\nYou set your feet and pray that you'll be able to get out of the mill before the termites get to you.",o="使用北山伐木场里的铁棍放出那里的瘟疫白蚁，然后向西瘟疫之地冰风岗的纳萨尼尔·杜马报告。",oEN="Release the Plagueland Termites in the Northridge Lumber Mill, then return with the Barrel of Plagueland Termites to Nathaniel Dumah at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="你完成任务了吗，$n？你把白蚁放出来了吗？愿圣光保佑我们，将血色十字军逐出伐木场和壁炉谷，我们不能让他们控制任何一处地方。血色十字军只不过是利用上一次战争的牺牲者来达到自己疯狂的目标而已，因此你应该像杀死那些发疯的动物一样杀死他们！",pEN="Have you done it, <name>? Have you released the termites? The Light help us if the Scarlet Crusade were able to hold onto both the mill and Hearthglen. They should have neither. They're just capitalizing on the victims of the last war and should be put down like rabid animals!",c="哈哈！谢谢你，$n！你做到了！我父亲的灵魂可以安息了，我也能安安宁宁地过日子了。\n\n再次感谢你。要是有什么我可以帮忙的地方，请尽管开口。",cEN="Haha! Thank you, <name>! You've done it! My father's spirit can now rest and I can live in peace.\n\nThank you again. If there is anything I can do for you, please, just ask."}
Q[6390]={d="你在伐木场附近寻找能打开桶的工具，很快就找到了一根铁棍，似乎可以用它撬开桶。\n\n你开始撬桶，并暗自祈祷能在白蚁发现你之前离开伐木场。",dEN="You look around the lumber mill for something suitable to open the barrel with. You find a crowbar that looks like it will do the trick.\n\nYou set your feet and pray that you'll be able to get out of the mill before the termites get to you.",o="使用北山伐木场里的铁棍放出那里的瘟疫白蚁，然后向提瑞斯法林地亡灵壁垒的米克·莱文报告。",oEN="Release the Plagueland Termites in the Northridge Lumber Mill, then return with the Barrel of Plagueland Termites to Mickey Levine at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你做到了吗，$n？你在伐木场把白蚁放出来了吗？\n\n我的家人失去了工作和性命，这已经够让人痛心了，可我还得眼看着那些恶心透顶的所谓“圣职者”占据我度过童年的地方！呸！！\"\"",pEN="Have you done it, <name>? Have you released the termites in the lumber mill?\n\nIt was bad enough that my family lost their jobs and lives, but then to see the place where my childhood was spent taken over by those disgusting so-called holy men... pfah!!",c="谢谢你，$n。请拿着这枚硬币吧。很抱歉我没有更多的硬币，但是你可以从摧毁血色十字军的成就中获得一些乐趣！",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Here, take this coin. I'm sorry it's not more, but try to take some joy in helping destroy the Scarlet Crusade's efforts!"}
Q[6391]={d="只需一小笔费用，我就能为你提供一只飞往铁炉堡的狮鹫，让你把布洛克的名单交给高尼尔·石趾。你可以在铁炉堡大锻炉区的深山矿工协会里找到他，狮鹫也会在那个区域降落！\n\n当你准备出发时就来找我。",dEN="For just a few coins, one of my gryphons will take you to Ironforge. From there, deliver Brock's list to Golnir Bouldertoe. You'll find him in the Deep Mountain Mining Guild. That's in the Great Forge District of Ironforge, which is right where my gryphon will drop you off!\n\nSpeak to me again when you're ready for the journey.",o="从狮鹫管理员索格拉姆·伯雷森那里租一只狮鹫飞往铁炉堡，然后将布洛克的名单交给铁炉堡的高尼尔·石趾。",oEN="Buy a gryphon to Ironforge from the gryphon master Thorgrum Borrelson, then bring Brock's List to Golnir Bouldertoe in Ironforge.",p="我能为你做什么，先生？",pEN="What can I do for you, sir?",c="啊，最新的布洛克优秀学生名单。我已经准备好了一批荣誉锄，现在只需要学生的名字刻上去就行了……",cEN="Ah, the lastest list of Brock's best pupils. I have a batch of honorary picks ready to go. I just need to chisel in the names of the students..."}
Q[6392]={d="只需一小笔费用，我就能为你提供一只飞往塞尔萨玛的狮鹫，当然，在这之前你必须已经去过塞尔萨玛了。狮鹫只能载着你飞往你以前曾经去过的地方，因此你必须跟你所见到的每个狮鹫管理员交谈，以确保稍后你能乘坐狮鹫飞到管理员那里。\n\n你已经见过了塞尔萨玛的狮鹫管理员索格拉姆，因此现在你可以返回他那儿了。到了塞尔萨玛之后，把这些镐交给布洛克·寻石者。\n\n当你准备出发时就来找我吧。",dEN="For a small fee you can buy a gryphon ride to Thelsamar... as long as you've already been there. Gryphons will only fly you to places you've already been, so be sure to speak with every gryphon master you see so you can fly to him later.\n\nYou've already been to Thorgrum, the gryphon master of Thelsamar, so now you can return to him. And once in Thelsamar, you can deliver the picks to Brock Stoneseeker.\n\nSpeak with me when you're ready to go.",o="从狮鹫管理员格莱斯·瑟登那里租用一头飞往塞尔萨玛的狮鹫，然后将荣誉锄交给塞尔萨玛的布洛克·寻石者。",oEN="Buy a gryphon to Thelsamar from the gryphon master Gryth Thurden, then bring the Honorary Picks to Brock Stoneseeker in Thelsamar.",p="啊，$n。你已经从铁炉堡回来了吗？",pEN="Ah, <name>. Have you returned from Ironforge?",c="你带来了镐。棒极了！我将把它们分给我的优秀学员们。我敢肯定他们会很乐意在洛克莫丹的矿产开采中使用这些镐的。\n\n谢谢你的帮助，$n。我欠你的人情，但是希望这些钱能补偿你在旅途中的开销。",cEN="You brought the picks. Great! I'll get these to my mining students. I'm sure they're eager to use them on the ore deposits of Loch Modan.\n\nThank you for your help, <name>. I am in your debt, but I hope this money will at least cover your travel costs."}
Q[6393]={d="海潮议会派我来与石爪山的火元素作战。水元素的统帅，猎潮者耐普图隆对于消灭火元素很感兴趣。\n\n$n，你可以通过消灭焦炭谷的火元素来赢得我们的青睐。当火元素被摧毁之后，它们会留下焚火余烬。把那些东西给我带回来，然后你就能获得奖励。",dEN="The Tribunal of the Tides has sent me to wage war on the fire elementals here in Stonetalon Mountain. Neptulon the Tidehunter, Lord of all water elementals, has taken a personal interest in seeing our fiery cousins extinguished.\n\n<name>, you can help me gain favor with the Tribunal by destroying the fire elementals in Charred Vale. When destroyed, the fire elementals leave Incendrites. Return these to me and be rewarded.",o="将10块焚火余烬交给烈日石居的苏纳曼。",oEN="Bring 10 Incendrites to Tsunaman at Sun Rock Retreat.",p="海潮议会开始变得有些不耐烦了。他们试图结束这场持续数年、波及各个位面的战争。我的同胞们迫切地希望听到战胜那些讨厌的火元素的消息。你拿到我要的东西了吗？",pEN="The Tribunal of the Tides grows impatient. They seek to end this war that has raged across all dimensions for eons. My brethren are anxious to hear news of the glorious victory over the hated fire elementals. Have you the Incendrites that I require?",c="我体内的水灵变得异常兴奋。$n，我可以将你辉煌的胜利报告给海潮议会。",cEN="The water spirits within me bubble with the excitement. <name>, you have given me a glorious victory to report to the Tribunal of the Tides."}
Q[6394]={d="$n，你是个可靠的$r。我能指望你再办一件事吗？\n\n不久前我在北边的洞穴里勘察矿产，把最心爱的镐子落在了那里。可当我回去取的时候，发现洞里已经满是凶恶的野兽！你愿意进入那个洞穴——燃烧之刃集会所——帮我把镐子取回来吗？\n\n我把它留在一个有瀑布的洞室里。我的镐子上有法术，能让你在黑暗中看到它，所以你不必太担心找不到它……只需当心看守它的东西，$g真的:真的;！",dEN="<name>, you are a dependable <race>. Can I count on you for another task?\n\nSome time ago I was surveying the cave to the north for minerals, and I left my favorite pick behind. When I later returned to retrieve it I found the cave was filled with vicious beasts! Will you go into the cave, the Burning Blade Coven, and get my pick?\n\nI left it in a chamber with waterfalls. My pick has a spell on it so you can see it in the dark, so you won't have to worry about finding it... just what's guarding it!",o="将塔兹利尔的镐还给塔兹利尔。",oEN="Bring Thazz'ril's Pick to Foreman Thazz'ril.",p="你进入燃刃集会所了吗，$n？你找到我的镐了吗？",pEN="Have you entered the Burning Blade Coven, <name>? Did you find my pick?",c="好极了！非常感谢你，$n。这是我最喜欢的镐！要是我的苦工能砍完这些树，我们或许就能找到一个挖矿的好去处了！",cEN="Great, you got it! Thanks a lot, <name>. This is my favorite pick! Now if my peons ever finish chopping down these trees, maybe we can find a nice cave to mine!"}
Q[6395]={d="瘟疫发生之前，我的朋友玛拉·菲普斯和她的丈夫塞缪尔生活在一起。但是瘟疫扫过这片土地之后，塞缪尔加入了亡灵天灾的队伍。\n\n玛拉逃过了瘟疫，却惨死在她那愚蠢的丈夫手里。唉，这个傻女人深爱着自己的丈夫，她的遗愿竟然是同塞缪尔葬在一起。\n\n塞缪尔·菲普斯就住在丧钟镇东北边，在路旁的一座废弃的营帐里。去打败他，实现玛拉的遗愿——将他葬在玛拉的坟墓里，就在墓地的第一排。",dEN="My friend Marla Fipps lived with her husband Samuel before the plague, but when the plague came Samuel succumbed and joined the Scourge's ranks.\n\nMarla was spared an undeath only to die at the hands of her now mindless husband. So strong was her love, however, that her last dying wish was to be buried with her beloved Samuel.\n\nSamuel Fipps roams at a ruined camp along the road northeast of Deathknell. Defeat him and grant Marla's wish: bury him at her grave, in the first row of our graveyard.",o="将塞缪尔·菲普斯的遗骸带到玛拉的坟墓去，然后回到新兵艾尔雷斯那里。",oEN="Bring Samuel Fipps' Remains to Marla's Grave, then return to Novice Elreth.",p="我们尊重死者，$n。这是我们与天灾军团的不同之处……",pEN="We must respect our dead, <name>. It is one of the ways in which we differ from the Scourge...",c="你今天可做了一件好事，$n。虽然我们与天灾军团的斗争还在继续，但是我希望玛拉和塞缪尔都能安息。",cEN="You have done a good deed today, <name>. Although our struggle against the Scourge continues, let us hope that Marla and Samuel will find peace together in their final resting place."}
Q[6401]={d="去把好消息告诉卡娅的姑妈坦姆拉·风田，她就在烈日石居。卡娅还活着！我们本以为在村子遭到那场残暴袭击后就失去她了。沿着西边的路走就能到烈日石居。|n|n",dEN="Tell Tammra Windfield, Kaya's aunt who's at Sun Rock Retreat, about the good news! Kaya is alive! We had thought she was lost after the brutal attack on our village. Follow the path to the west to get to Sun Rock Retreat.",o="把好消息告诉烈日石居的坦姆拉·风田。|n",oEN="Tell Tammra Windfield in Sun Rock Retreat the good news.",c="天啊，我的侄女卡雅还活着！这真是个好消息。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="My goodness, my niece Kaya is alive! That is good news indeed. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[6402]={d="你要在暴风城城门口与温德索尔会合。\n\n温德索尔即将揭露的真相，将动摇这个王国的根基！\n\n不要试图独自前往，$n。你必须集结一支军队！召集你的同胞。拿起武器！|n|n",dEN="You are to meet with Windsor at the gates of Stormwind.\n\nWhat Windsor is about to unveil will shake the very foundation of the kingdom!\n\nDo not attempt to venture there alone, <name>. You must amass an army! Gather your compatriots. To arms!",o="前往暴风城的城门。与侍卫洛文交谈，他会通知温德索尔元帅你已经到达了。",oEN="Travel to Stormwind City and venture to the city gates. Speak with Squire Rowe so that he may let Marshal Windsor know that you have arrived.",c="在开始之前，我要你首先集合一支军队。毕竟我们要面对的是一条龙！",cEN="Before we begin, I ask that you first gather an army. We face a dragon, after all!"}
Q[6403]={d="真是一场冒险，$g朋友:朋友;！我欠你一份沉甸甸的人情。也许，等一切都结束之后……\n\n到现在你无疑已经查明，普瑞斯托女士就是奥妮克希亚：死亡之翼的子嗣，黑石塔暴君奈法利安的孪生姐妹。\n\n她掌控我们的王国太久了。甚至连摄政王都被她像傀儡一样操纵着。但这一切今天就会结束……法术将被破除。\n\n别担心，我们携手，必将取得胜利！\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？",dEN="It has been quite the adventure, friend. I owe you a great debt of gratitude. Perhaps, when all is said and done...\n\nAs you have no doubt ascertained by now, Lady Prestor is Onyxia: Brood of Deathwing, twin to the tyrant of the Spire, Nefarian.\n\nFor too long she has held our kingdom in her captivating gaze. Even the Highlord is controlled by her trickery - a puppet. It all ends today... The spell will be broken.\n\nWorry not, for together, we shall be victorious!\n\nAre you ready?",o="跟随雷吉纳德·温德索尔元帅在暴风城中前进。保护他，别让他受到伤害！",oEN="Follow Reginald Windsor through Stormwind. Protect him from harm!",p="我……我……我没有力量了。",pEN="I... I... I was powerless.",c="<伯瓦尔握着破碎的勋章。>\n\n这上面肯定附着了魔法，让我们不知不觉就被控制的魔法。\n\n温德索尔元帅的牺牲拯救了我们的王国，但是奥妮克希亚和她的系列仍然在威胁着我们。\n\n这勋章迷惑了我的头脑和身体，但它也让我洞察了奥妮克希亚的思维——她的秘密。虽然记忆有些混乱，但是我仍记得一些事情。",cEN="<Bolvar holds the shattered medallion.>\n\nThe magic held within must be reignited. The dragon's eye must be attuned.\n\nWindsor's sacrifice has freed our Kingdom, but the threat of Onyxia and her kin is ever looming.\n\nThis medallion is what held my mind and body captive. It is also what gave me access to Onyxia's own mind - to her secrets. Albeit the visions are muddled now, some things I do remember."}
Q[6421]={d="石爪山这里有些不对劲。你能感觉到空气中的紧张吗，$n？\n\n在此地东南方，巨石滑落峡谷中有一个深洞。那里的狗头人正在疯狂开采一种叫做共鸣石的稀有水晶。我需要你带回一些矿石样本，好让我弄清那洞穴里发生了什么。我还需要你去探查洞穴的深处。\n\n去吧，年轻的$c。我必须知道这些山下面潜伏着什么邪恶。",dEN="Something is amiss here in Stonetalon. Can you feel the tension in the air, <name>?\n\nSoutheast of here lies a deep cave in Boulderslide Ravine. The kobolds there are frantically mining a rare crystal called Resonite. I need you to bring back some ore samples so that I can understand what's happening in that cave. I also need you to investigate the depth of that cave.\n\nGo young <class>, it's imperative I know what evil lurks under these mountains.",o="深入滚岩峡谷的洞穴中，为烈日石居的摩罗加尔取回10块共鸣水晶以供研究。",oEN="Explore deep into the cave at Boulderslide Ravine and bring back 10 Resonite Crystals for Mor'rogal at Sun Rock Retreat to investigate.",p="你在滚岩峡谷有什么发现吗？我记得一些与共鸣水晶有关的传说……但是我没法亲自去那儿。或许当我知道洞穴底部都有些什么东西的时候就能洞察他们的意图了。",pEN="What news have you discovered from Boulderslide Ravine? I recall some legend that deals with Resonite... I just cannot place my hoof on it. Perhaps knowing what lies at the bottom of the cave will illuminate their devious intentions.",c="啊……没错！就是这个。共鸣水晶附有土灵的魔法。狗头人一定挖得很深，结果把土灵给挖出来了。\n\n传说土灵是泰坦创造的生物，他们曾协助泰坦创造了我们脚下的土地。这是个不能忽视的威胁。\n\n<摩罗加尔晃动着他的脑袋。>\n\n或许我能为这些矿石样本附上一些魔法，以此来破坏狗头人的阴谋。",cEN="Ah... Yes! That's it; the Resonite crystals have a trace of Earthen magic. The Kobolds must have dug deep uncovering an Earthen.\n\nLegend states that the Earthen are creatures created by the Titans. They were used to create the land our feet walk on. This most definitely is a threat that cannot be ignored.\n\n<Mor'rogal shakes his head.>\n\nPerhaps I can enchant these ore samples to use against this Kobold plot."}
Q[6441]={d="你好啊！我要穿越灰谷往棘齿城去，途中在碎木哨岗这里稍作休息。我一直在寻找发财的机会，眼下似乎就有一个——这些日子以来棘齿城的萨特角行情看涨。\n\n在附近询问了一番之后，我认为夜道谷、萨提纳尔和萨维亚的萨特头上的角都符合我的要求。不过我可不是萨特的对手……你也许能行！\n\n帮我收集一些角吧，我会给你报酬的。",dEN="Heya! I've been traveling through Ashenvale, heading towards Ratchet, and decided to make a stop here at Splintertree. I'm always looking for an opportunity, and it seems that satyr horns are in high demand in Ratchet these days.\n\nAfter asking around here, it seems that the satyrs in Night Run, Satyrnaar, and Xavian all have the type of horns I am looking for. I'm no match for those satyrs... but you look like you might be!\n\nTell you what, you collect the horns for me and I'll make it worth your time.",o="为碎木哨岗的皮克希尔收集16只萨特的角。",oEN="Collect 16 Satyr Horns for Pixel in Splintertree Post.",p="我希望你能快点找到这些角，$n。我马上就要回棘齿城了！",pEN="I hope you can be quick about getting those horns, <name>. I'm heading back to Ratchet soon!",c="完美的角，$n！谢谢你！\n\n哦，这是你应得的酬劳……",cEN="These are perfect, <name>! Thanks for helping me out!\n\nOh, and this is for your time..."}
Q[6442]={d="邪恶就在海岸边潜伏着，$r。\n\n那里是注定毁灭的城市佐拉姆的安息之地，它早已被摧毁，从此沉没于大海之下。失落了，也几乎被遗忘。\n\n如今，纳迦回来了，至于他们的目的……我们无从得知。但原因并不重要；我们必须保卫这片我们辛苦开垦、据为己有的土地。\n\n带 20 颗他们的头颅回来见我！把纳迦打回深渊去！",dEN="There is evil lurking here along the coast, <race>.\n\nIt is the resting place of the doomed city of Zoram, long destroyed and submerged beneath the seas. Lost, and nearly forgotten.\n\nNow, the naga have returned, and for what reason we do not know. But reason matters little; we must defend the land we have worked so hard to claim as our own.\n\nReturn to me with 20 of their heads! Throw the naga back to the depths!",o="将20颗怒尾纳迦的头颅交给佐拉姆海岸的玛鲁凯。",oEN="Bring 20 Wrathtail Heads to Marukai along the Zoram Strand.",p="纳迦的数量正在激增，$n。请赶快完成我交给你的任务。",pEN="The naga increase in numbers, <name>. Please complete this task for me.",c="我们这里正需要更多像你这样的人，$n。谢谢你的帮助。",cEN="We could use more of your kind around here, <name>. Thank you for your help."}
Q[6461]={d="玛拉卡金的巨魔在这片土地上繁衍生息，石爪山脉是我们赖以生存的狩猎场。\n\n但是近来却有些不请自来的客人……山中的蜘蛛常常在夜间洗劫我们的营帐，窃取我们的猎物。\n\n如果你能帮我们杀死这些可怕的怪物，玛拉卡金的巨魔会对你感激不尽的。石爪山脉到处都是蜘蛛——往北走，你就会看到的。",dEN="We Trolls here at Malaka'Jin have prospered from the land; Stonetalon Mountain offers great hunting for us to live on.\n\nLately, we have attracted the wrong dinner guests... the spiders in these mountains have been raiding our camps at night looking to steal our hunt.\n\nIf you were to help us kill off these ghastly beasts we at Malaka'Jin would be in your debt. Spiders are everywhere in Stonetalon - just head north from here and you will see what I am talking about.",o="玛拉卡金的辛吉拉要求你杀死10只深苔爬行者和7只深苔毒蜘蛛。",oEN="Xen'zilla at Malaka'Jin needs you to kill 10 Deepmoss Creepers and 7 Deepmoss Venomspitters.",p="嘿，你杀死那些浑身长毛、性格暴躁的畜生了吗？我在石爪山什么都不怕，但是晚上我可不敢在附近闲逛……你该明白我的意思吧！\n\n只有我确信自己不会成为它们的盘中餐，我才会感到安全。\n\n祝你好运，$c！",pEN="Hey mon, have you slain the hairy blood feeders? I fear none here in Stonetalon but I don't go walking around here at night... if you know what I mean mon!\n\nAs long as I stay off their dinner plate then all is well.\n\nGood luck to you, <class>!",c="太好了，伙计！好消息，也许今晚我们的晚餐就不会有那么多不速之客了。\n\n非常感谢，$n。我们永远欠你一份人情。",cEN="Sweet, mon! Good news, perhaps we will have fewer unwanted dinner guests tonight.\n\nMany thanks, <name>. We are forever in your debt."}
Q[6462]={d="我的族人携带着大量神圣的巨魔符咒到这里来，但是在他们抵达佐拉姆加之前，蓟皮熊怪袭击了他们，把他们全都给杀了！这些可憎的熊怪！\n\n我思念那些死去的兄弟姐妹，但愿我们能在另一个世界重逢。不过，他们的巨魔符咒蕴含着强大的魔力。这些符咒落在熊怪手里对我们来说简直是一种耻辱！\n\n$n，你必须取回符咒！蓟皮熊怪的村落在阿斯特兰纳背面，穿过村落进入那个被称作蓟皮要塞的洞穴，从它们的箱子里拿回我们的符咒。",dEN="My kinfolk were traveling here with many sacred troll charms, but the Thistlefur furbolgs attacked and killed them before they reached Zoram'gar! Those vile Furbolgs!\n\nI miss my brothers and sisters who were killed, but we will meet again in the afterlife. However, their troll charms hold great value in this world. It is an outrage that the furbolgs have them!\n\n<name>, you must retrieve the charms! They are in chests in Thistlefur Hold, a cave at the end of Thistlefur Village, north of Astranaar.",o="将8个巨魔符咒交给佐拉姆加前哨站的米苏瓦。",oEN="Bring 8 Troll Charms to Mitsuwa at the Zoram'gar Outpost.",p="你找到符咒了吗，$n？一想到那些神圣的符咒落在熊怪手中，我就气不打一处来！",pEN="Did you find the charms, <name>? Every moment the furbolgs possess those sacred items, my blood boils with rage!",c="你找到它们了！谢谢你！谢谢你，$n！你可帮了我的大忙了。\n\n没有符咒的巨魔就好像没有因作战而留下伤疤的兽人一样……\n\n毫无价值。",cEN="You found them! Thank you! Thank you, <name>! You do not know how great a thing you have done for me.\n\nA troll without his charm is like an orc without his battle scars...\n\nWorthless."}
Q[6481]={d="你已经找到了一个隐藏在这片土地中的威胁，$c。你在洞穴中发现的共鸣桶中藏有一个沉睡的土灵，他的名字叫做高戈罗克。\n\n我已经用萨满力量改变了你收集的共鸣水晶的成分。用这块魔化共鸣水晶打开那只藏有土灵的共鸣桶。\n\n当高戈罗克清醒过来时，他的能力也将减弱……杀死他，$n！",dEN="You have uncovered a dark threat to the land, <class>. The Resonite cask you have found in that cave houses a slumbering Earthen by the name of Goggeroc.\n\nI have changed the mixture of the Resonite crystals that you gathered with my shamanistic powers. Take the enchanted Resonite crystal and smash open the Resonite cask, which houses the Earthen.\n\nWhen awakened, Goggeroc will be weakened... Slay him, <name>!",o="使用魔化共鸣水晶打开共鸣桶，然后杀死高戈罗克。将这个消息告诉摩罗加尔，并把魔化共鸣水晶还给他。",oEN="Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal.",p="如果我们不能尽快解决威胁的话，也许我们会丧失整个石爪山地区。任何魔法都无法与土灵的力量抗衡。当高戈罗克清醒时，他的力量将因长期沉睡而减弱，你必须利用这个机会……去吧，$n！",pEN="I fear if we do not dispose of this threat immediately, all of Stonetalon will be lost. The might of an Earthen can not be matched by any means. When awakened, Goggeroc will be weak from his long slumber, this will be the opportunity that you must take advantage of... go now <name>!",c="你带来了好消息，$c！我正担心土灵可能会给卡利姆多大陆造成灾难呢。\n\n只有英雄才能完成这个危险的任务。你做得很好，整个石爪山和卡利姆多都感谢你，高贵的$c。\n\n请收下这个，这是我们所能提供的最好的回报了。",cEN="You bear good news, <class>! I fear the possibilities of what an Earthen would mean to Kalimdor.\n\nSlaying Goggeroc was a task for no one less then a hero. You have done well; all of Stonetalon and Kalimdor are indebted to you, noble <class>.\n\nAccept this as your reward most honored one."}
Q[6482]={d="呃？你是谁？\n\n$n？你不是熊怪。他们被诅咒了！他们以为我是一头熊，就把我抓了起来，现在还想饿死我！我的力气快撑不住了……\n\n帮我逃出去，然后去东边的碎木哨岗找我妹妹亚玛。\n\n$n！我必须逃出去，$g真的:真的;！",dEN="Eh? Who are you?\n\n<name>? You're no furbolg. They are cursed! They thought I was a bear and captured me, and now they starve me! My strength is failing...\n\nHelp me escape, then speak with my sister Yama at the Splintertree Post to the east.\n\n<name>! I must escape!",o="护送鲁尔，然后与碎木岗哨的雅玛·雪蹄谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Ruul, then speak with Yama Snowhoof in Splintertree Post.",p="你看见我的兄弟卢尔了吗？他几天前进入了森林，一直都没有回来……",pEN="Have you seen my brother Ruul? He walked into the forest days ago and has not returned...",c="你找到了我的兄弟！他被蓟皮熊怪捉住了吗？这真是个可怕的消息，尽管许多熊怪都是高贵的生物，但蓟皮熊怪却是堕落的家伙。\n\n谢谢你营救了我的兄弟，$n。我简直不敢想象它们是怎样对待可怜的卢尔的。历经磨难之后，他终于可以安心睡一觉了……",cEN="You found my brother! He was captured by the Thistlefurs? That is terrible news to hear, for although many Furbolgs are noble creatures, the Thistlefurs are corrupt.\n\nThank you for rescuing my brother, <name>. I do not want to think of how they treated poor Ruul. He will likely sleep long after this ordeal..."}
Q[6501]={d="我唯一能给你的，就是破碎徽章的一块碎片。\n\n你必须找到另一位拥有龙族血脉、愿意帮你锻造新钥匙的人。一旦你拿到这把钥匙，就必须前往尘泥沼泽的巨龙沼泽。你会在那里找到她的巢穴，$n。\n\n去哪里找其他愿意帮忙的巨龙军团？可惜，我不知道……据说他们是存在的。有些甚至可能伪装成某种类人种族，在我们中间工作和生活。祝你好运。|n",dEN="A fragment of the shattered medallion is all that I can offer.\n\nYou must find another of dragon blood willing to assist you in forging a new key. Once you secure this key, you must travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. It is there that you will find her lair, <name>.\n\nWhere to find other flights willing to help? Sadly, I do not know... They are said to exist. Some may even work and live among us, disguised as one of the humanoid races. I wish you luck.",o="你必须寻遍世界以找到一种能恢复龙眼碎片的能量的生物。你对这种生物的唯一了解就是：他们确实存在。",oEN="You must search the world for a being capable of restoring the power to the Fragment of the Dragon's Eye. The only information you possess about such a being is that they exist.",p="我感到了你身上散发出的邪恶气息，$r。是什么让你被这种气息笼罩？",pEN="I sense an aura of evil radiating from you, <race>. What could you hold that emits such an aura?",c="我早该猜到的……黑龙公主奥妮克希亚。真令我恶心……",cEN="I should have known - a piece of the black dragon brood mother, Onyxia. How revolting..."}
Q[6502]={d="这是那条龙的一部分；一片龙鳞——被施了魔法并加以转化。如果完整，它本可以让你进入那头野兽的巢穴。可它碎了，对你毫无用处。\n\n这件物品是可以修复的，但要做到这一点，需要一头黑龙勇士的血。有这么一个……他叫达基萨斯将军，是奈法利安麾下龙人军队的统帅。也许你听说过他？\n\n带着他的血回来，$r，我就会为这块碎片附魔，让你能够进入奥妮克希亚的巢穴。",dEN="It is a piece of the dragon; a scale - enchanted and transformed. Whole, it could have granted access to the beast's lair. Shattered, it is useless.\n\nIt is possible to repair the item, but to do so would require the blood of a black dragon champion. There is one... He is known as General Drakkisath, ruler of the dragonspawn armies of Nefarian. Perhaps you have heard of him?\n\nReturn with his blood, <race>, and I shall enchant the fragment into something that will grant you access to Onyxia's lair.",o="你必须从达基萨斯将军身上取回黑龙勇士之血，你可以在黑石塔的晋升大厅后面的房间里找到他。",oEN="You must retrieve the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath. Drakkisath can be found in his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension in Blackrock Spire.",p="时间的流动不会停止或滞后，$r。我的生命是永恒的，但是你的却不是。不要浪费时间了……",pEN="The flow of time does not stop or slow, <race>. While my life is eternal, yours is not. Waste not the time that you have...",c="这个护符可以让你进入你想去的地方。奥妮克希亚的巢穴在尘泥沼泽中。一旦你拥有了护符，她的结界就无法阻止你进入了。\n\n蓝龙军团祝福你，$n。",cEN="This amulet will grant you the access that you seek. The lair of Onyxia can be found in Dustwallow Marsh. As long as you hold the amulet, her wards cannot prevent you from entering.\n\nThe Blue Flight wishes you luck, <name>."}
Q[6503]={d="该死的女精灵！她们完全清楚该在哪里伏击我们！\n\n是那些斥候……我曾试图警告大家她们在监视我们，却没人理会。现在看看我们，像鸡一样被挤在这里！\n\n复仇永远不嫌晚，$g伙计:伙计;！去猎杀她们，让她们为自己的所作所为付出代价！",dEN="We received reports that Ashenvale outrunners left Silverwing Outpost not long ago, and now sneak near our territories in the forest. We don't want them gathering intelligence on our defenses!\n\nSneak through the forests south of our post here and east of the Alliance outpost of Silverwing. Find and slay the outrunners, then return to me.",o="杀掉9个灰谷先驱者，然后回到碎木哨岗的库莱比那里。",oEN="Kill 9 Ashenvale Outrunners, then return to Kuray'bin at Splintertree Outpost.",p="我等待着你杀死先驱者的消息，$n。",pEN="I await reports of your outrunner kills, <name>.",c="很好，$n。你的猎杀技术真不错……\n\n失去那些信使会让联盟无法得到情报，而当他们缺乏情报的时候，他们就不太可能发动攻击了。",cEN="Very good, <name>. Your hunting skills are impressive...\n\nThe loss of those outrunners help blind the Alliance, and when they lack intelligence they are less likely to launch attacks."}
Q[6504]={d="我刚刚从棘齿城得到了这台伐木机，准备回到战歌伐木场去上班。伐木机中放着一本操作说明书，但在回来的路上，一阵强风把它从我手中吹走了，纸张散落得到处都是，剩下的就只有封面了。\n\n现在那些纸都飞到不知哪里去了……没有它们，我就压根不知道该如何操作这台伐木机！你能帮我找到它们吗？",dEN="I just picked up this shredder from Ratchet and I was on my way back to the Warsong Lumber Camp, where I am supposed to be on duty. I was given a manual on how to operate the shredder, but on the trip back, a huge gust of wind blew it from my hands. The pages went everywhere, and all I was left with was the cover.\n\nThe pages could be just about anywhere by now, I suppose... but I don't know how to use the shredder without them! Will you find them for me?",o="找到伐木机操作手册缺失的 12 页，把它们重新拼成前 3 章。把这些书页交给碎木哨岗附近的古尔达·怒痕。|n",oEN="Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post.",p="我希望你尽快把纸张找回来，$n！我必须马上回去工作！",pEN="I hope you find the pages soon, <name>! I really need to get back to work!",c="阅读不是我的强项……但我现在至少可以回去工作了！谢谢你，$n！",cEN="Reading isn't my strong point... but now I'll be able to get back to work! Thanks, <name>!"}
Q[6521]={d="玛克林声称他在剃刀高地外面。这位大使必须被干掉——他的任务在巫妖王的眼中是彻头彻尾的失败。\n\n他在那里的出现确实解释了我们的一些发现，比如某些野猪人已经变得非常强大，并且还显示出了被感染亡灵瘟疫的迹象。那一定是他们达成某种交易的征兆。\n\n找到玛克林并杀了他，$n。任务完成后回来找我。",dEN="Malcin claims he is outside Razorfen Downs. This ambassador must be slain--his mission a failure in the eyes of the Lich King.\n\nHis presence there does explain much of what we've discovered about the area--some of the quilboar have grown frightfully powerful while showing signs of the Plague in their own way. Truly that must be a sign of some sort of deal they've struck.\n\nFind Malcin and slay him, <name>. Return to me after the deed is done.",o="把玛克林大使的头颅带给幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯。",oEN="Bring Ambassador Malcin's Head to Varimathras in the Undercity.",p="大使死了吗？\n\n我们不能容许天灾军团在卡利姆多站稳脚跟；他们本身就是够大的威胁了。\n\n你告诉我的这一切中，唯一让人乐观的迹象是，那个老巫婆似乎并未被腐化。她一定深知天灾军团能带来强大的力量，但如果她接受这笔交易，贫瘠之地就并不真正属于她了。",pEN="Have you found the Ambassador, <name>? Is he dead?\n\nWe cannot afford to allow the Scourge to take a foothold on Kalimdor. They are enough of a threat to our own borders to have to deal with them on two fronts.\n\nThe only optimistic sign from the events you've told me about is that the crone seemed uncorrupted. She must know deep in her spirit that the Scourge may bring great power, but that the Barrens would not truly be hers if she were to agree to their deal.",c="很好。干得漂亮，$c。\n\n现在玛克林死了，我们至少知道天灾军团的行动被延缓了。黑暗女王对你的行动表示感谢，并希望给你一份礼物作为奖励。\n\n尽管我们不清楚天灾军团在剃刀高地的影响范围，但我敢肯定，我们很快就会揭穿他们的阴谋。",cEN="Good. Well done, <class>.\n\nNow that Malcin is dead, we can at least know that the Scourges advances will be halted. The Dark Lady thanks you for your efforts and wishes to reward you with a gift.\n\nAlthough we do not know the extent of the Scourges influence within the Downs, I am sure we will discover their plots soon enough."}
Q[6522]={d="大人：\n\n您很清楚我们可以提供什么。您占领贫瘠之地及其它土地的机会非常大，我们也只想要您的帮助作为回报。所谓的帮助不过是让您授予我们在这一带行动的自由。\n\n请允许我们说得更远些。我们拥有强大的力量，并愿意与那些希望加入我们的聪明人分享。我目前仍待在剃刀高地外面。\n\n向您致以最高的敬意，\n玛克林大使",dEN="My Lady,\n\nYou know very well what it is we are offering. The opportunity for you to take the Barrens and the lands beyond is a great one. We simply want your aid in return. By aid we mean nothing more than your giving us the freedom to take action in the area.\n\nPlease, allow us to discuss this further. We have great power and are willing to share with those wise enough to join us. I will remain outside Razorfen Downs for the time being.\n\nBest Regards,\nAmbassador Malcin",o="把这卷小卷轴带给幽暗城皇家区的瓦里玛萨斯。",oEN="Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras at the Royal Quarter in the Undercity.",p="你有什么事，$n？如果你不断来烦我，那你一定是有什么你以为很重要的事情。",pEN="What business is it you wish to speak of, <name>? You must feel it is important if you continue to pester me.",c="我认得这个卷轴上的徽记，$n。你在那个统治剃刀沼泽的野猪人身上找到的？真有趣。\n\n天灾军团看起来并不满足于统治一块大陆。这个玛克林大使——这个写便条的家伙——是天灾军团的一个仆从，在瘟疫来临之前曾是洛丹伦王国的大使。\n\n如果天灾军团想在卡利姆多占据一个立足点，那么我们就该立刻出手干预。",cEN="I recognize the insignia on this scroll, <name>. You found this on that crone who reigns over Razorfen Kraul? Interesting.\n\nThe Scourge aren't content with one continent it seems. This Ambassador Malcin--the one who wrote the note--is one of the Scourge's plagued servants, a human diplomat to the kingdom of Lordaeron before things... changed.\n\nIf the Scourge are trying to gain a foothold in Kalimdor, then it is up to us to act."}
Q[6523]={d="谢谢你救了我！我们必须赶快离开，不然很快就会被发现的。请护送我回到阿帕拉耶营地去。到了那里，我就知道回去的路了。\n\n我的父亲玛卡巴·扁蹄得知我安全回家之后一定会很高兴的。",dEN="Thank you for rescuing me! We must leave quickly before they discover that I am free. Please escort me to Camp Aparaje. From there, I know my way.\n\nMy father, Makaba Flathoof, will be desperate to know that I am safe.",o="护送卡娅·平蹄前往阿帕拉耶营地，然后去见石爪山东南边缘附近的玛卡巴·平蹄。|n",oEN="Escort Kaya Flathoof to Camp Aparaje, and then return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.",c="卡雅还活着！$n，我要感谢你救了她的命。",cEN="Kaya is alive! <name>, I have you to thank for rescuing her."}
Q[6541]={d="你去过北面的灰谷没有？部落最近在那里的佐拉姆海岸旁设立了哨所，我们经常派一些刚刚招募的新兵来协助防守前线。\n\n如果你愿意的话，就到贫瘠之地北部的哨塔里找卡德拉克。他正要去灰谷进行战斗，应该可以给你进一步的指示。",dEN="Have you ever been to Ashenvale, to the north? The horde has recently set up an outpost on the Zoram Strand there, and we can always use some new recruits to help defend our new fronts.\n\nIf you think you are up to it, see Kadrak in the northern Barrens, at the watch tower. He is heading up the Ashenvale campaign and can give you further orders.",o="到贫瘠之地北部的卡德拉克那里报到。",oEN="Report to Kadrak at the watch tower in northern Barrens.",c="灰谷是一块战事频频的土地，但是我们最近采取的一系列行动都非常成功。我们不仅在佐拉姆海岸建立了哨所，还在更北边的碎木林建立了另一座。",cEN="Ashenvale is a divided land, but our most recent efforts have been very successful. We not only have an outpost at the Zoram Strand, but another just north of here called Splintertree."}
Q[6542]={d="你去过北边的灰谷吗？部落最近在那里佐拉姆海岸设立了一处前哨，我们总是需要新兵来帮助防守新的战线。\n\n如果你觉得自己能胜任，就去北贫瘠之地的瞭望塔找卡德拉克。他正负责灰谷战役，会给你进一步的命令。|n",dEN="Have you ever been to Ashenvale, to the north? The horde has recently set up an outpost on the Zoram Strand there, and we can always use some new recruits to help defend our new fronts.\n\nIf you think you are up to it, see Kadrak in the northern Barrens, at the watch tower. He is heading up the Ashenvale campaign and can give you further orders.",o="到贫瘠之地北部的卡德拉克那里报到。",oEN="Report to Kadrak at the watch tower in northern Barrens.",c="灰谷是一块战事频频的土地，但是我们最近采取的一系列行动都非常成功。我们不仅在佐拉姆海岸创建了哨所，还在更北边的碎木林创建了另一座。",cEN="Ashenvale is a divided land, but our most recent efforts have been very successful. We not only have an outpost at the Zoram Strand, but another just north of here called Splintertree."}
Q[6543]={d="我最近派了一些斥候进入灰谷，所以我得找个跑腿的去把他们的报告带回来。\n\n你的第一站应该是西面的佐拉姆海岸边的佐拉姆加前哨站，在那里可以找到第一个斥候。另外你还要到北边的碎木哨岗去，它就在东边的路上，靠近艾萨拉地区。你可以在那里找到一个斥候和一个侦查骑兵。\n\n给他们每人一份报告，然后把他们的最新报告拿回来。",dEN="I recently deployed a few scouts into Ashenvale and I need a runner to take them their orders, and bring me back a report of what they have observed.\n\nYour first stop should be the Zoram'gar Outpost, along the coast to the west, at the Zoram Strand, to locate the first runner. You also need to stop at Splintertree Post, to the north, and along the road to the east, near Azshara. You will find a scout and an outrider there.\n\nGive them each a report, and from them, get an update on their findings.",o="打开报告集，把战歌报告交给战歌斥候、战歌信使和战歌侦查骑兵。把他们的最新报告交给贫瘠之地北部哨塔上的卡德拉克。",oEN="Open the Bundle of Reports. Take the Warsong Reports to the Warsong Scout, Warsong Runner, and Warsong Outrider. Bring back the updates they give you to Kadrak at the northern watch tower in the barrens.",p="快点，$n。我们必须拿到他们的报告，事关紧急。",pEN="Hurry, <name>. They must receive their reports; it is urgent.",c="我看得出你是个可以依靠的人。这些报告对我们扩大灰谷存在的计划至关重要。现在我们可以规划下一步行动了。",cEN="I can see that you are one that can be counted on. These updates are crucial to our plans to further our presence in Ashenvale. We can now plan our next move."}
Q[6544]={d="嘿！$C！到这儿来！\n\n我将和我的部队准备袭击西边的银翼哨站，这次行动的目标是他们的首领杜瑞尔·月火。据侦察，那座哨站中有重兵把守。这将是一场激烈而光荣的战役！\n\n你愿意加入我们的队伍吗，$n？如果你愿意的话，那么当战役结束时，你就可以去将我们胜利的消息汇报给慰藉之林的埃尔托格·怒齿了。\n\n你认为怎么样，要跟我们一起来吗？",dEN="Hey! <class>! Come here!\n\nMy raiders and I are about to attack the Silverwing Outpost to the west. Our target is its leader, Duriel Moonfire. Scouts report the outpost is defended heavily with sentinels and warriors. The battle will be glorious!\n\nDo you want to share in the glory, <name>, and aid us? If so, then when it's over you can report our success to my superior, Ertog Ragetusk in Splintertree.\n\nWhat do you say. Are you with us?",o="保护在银翼哨站与杜瑞尔·月火作战的托雷克，然后向慰籍之林的埃尔托格·怒齿汇报胜利的消息。",oEN="Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.",p="托雷克被派去执行突袭银翼哨站的任务了，他取得胜利了吗？",pEN="Torek was sent on a mission against Silverwing Outpost. Was the attack successful?",c="托雷克获胜了！干得好，$n。暗夜精灵是相当顽强的对手，虽然他们身材瘦小，但是力量强大，勇猛无比！我想这场战役肯定很激烈……\n\n希望你在战争中留下了荣耀的伤痕！",cEN="So Torek's attack was successful! Well done, <name>. Night elves are decent foes. A little skinny, but strong and fierce! I'm sure the battle was something to see...\n\nAnd I hope you gained a scar or two!"}
Q[6545]={p="那么，你是来给我传达上面的命令的？看见你这样体格健壮、意志坚定的新兵，我总是会感到很高兴。\n\n要是你希望继续在这里待下去的话，最好尽快成长起来。纳迦的威胁正在日益增长，$n。自从我到这儿之后，就开始着手研究对策，并在这个前哨站里抵挡了他们的多次进攻。\n\n但是如果你也想要投入到对敌作战中，就去跟这里的其它人也谈谈吧。",pEN="So you're here with my orders? Always good to see a new recruit with an exuberant nature and a strong will.\n\nYou'd best learn fast if you expect to keep up here. The threat of the naga grows, <name>. I have observed and have taken up defenses against several attacks on this outpost since I arrived here.\n\nBut if you'd like to pitch in with that effort, speak with one of the others here at the outpost.",c="哦，我的报告会向卡德拉克解释这一大堆事情，你必须尽快把这个交给他。",cEN="Well, my update will explain all of this to Kadrak. You must return this to him as quickly as possible."}
Q[6546]={p="这条路上危机四伏，$n。你最好在整个旅途中都牢记这一点。联盟的威胁近在咫尺。\n\n我们已经陷入了四面受敌的困境，灰谷东部的萨特是一种可怕的生物，而纳迦也已经占据了艾萨拉的大片区域。\n\n我们的军队数量始终维持在较高的水准，这很好，随时准备应付我们的敌人吧，$n。",pEN="Much danger lies along this path, <name>. You'd do best to remember this while traveling in these lands. The threat of the alliance is quite near.\n\nWe are faced by enemies on all fronts. The satyr are a formidable and prevalent force in eastern Ashenvale. I have also discovered that the naga have taken over a large area of the land of Azshara.\n\nIt's good to see that we are still bolstering our numbers -- be ready for what lies ahead, <name>.",c="把我的报告交给卡德拉克，要快，$n。",cEN="Take my update to Kadrak. Swiftly, <name>."}
Q[6547]={p="保持警惕，$r。精灵总是潜伏在黑暗中……\n\n我们必须继续监视敌人。我们在努力地控制这片土地，而精灵也在寻找机会从我们手中夺走它。\n\n我想你是来传达卡德拉克下达给我的新命令的吧？",pEN="Keep an eye out, <race>. The elves are often hiding in the shadows...\n\nWe must always be watching. We have worked very hard to claim this land, and the elves are looking for a chance to take it from us.\n\nI assume you have my next orders from Kadrak?",c="告诉卡德拉克，我们已经成功地阻止了暗夜精灵的进攻。一切进展顺利。",cEN="Let Kadrak know of the success we have had here holding off the night elves. Our plans are going well."}
Q[6548]={d="邪图腾氏族袭击了我的村庄，几乎杀光了所有人。我杀了我能杀的所有人，但勉强才保住性命逃出来。\n\n$n，我现在唯一的愿望就是他们死得更多。你就在此地向西一点就能找到他们。|n|n",dEN="The Grimtotem Clan raided my village and killed most everyone. I killed all I could, but barely escaped with my life.\n\n<name>, all I wish now is that more of them are dead. You will find them just to the west of here.",o="杀死 8 名邪图腾恶棍和 6 名邪图腾佣兵。然后去见石爪山东南边缘附近的玛卡巴·平蹄。|n",oEN="Kill 8 Grimtotem Ruffians and 6 Grimtotem Mercenaries, and then return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.",p="你杀死他们了吗？",pEN="Have you killed them yet?",c="$n，谢谢你……但我永远都不会忘记恐怖图腾氏族对我的村庄做过什么。",cEN="<name>, I thank you... but I will never forget what the Grimtotem have done to my village."}
Q[6561]={d="力量已经离开了我。我需要你的帮助！\n\n很久以前，这里是艾露恩的一座伟大神殿。但当一位上古之神的腐化从地底渗出，污染了神圣的月井，不幸便将它引向了毁灭。\n\n上古之神的仆从阿库麦尔从水中升起。\n\n暮光之锤的教徒已与纳迦联手占据了这片土地。这些教徒由凯尔里斯率领，用无辜者的性命向阿库麦尔献祭以换取力量。\n\n杀了凯尔里斯，把他的头带给雷霆崖的巴珊娜，$n，求你。",dEN="Strength has left me. Your help is needed!\n\nLong ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well.\n\nAku'Mai, servant of the Old God, rose from the waters.\n\nThe Twilight's Hammer cultists have allied with the naga to occupy these grounds. The cultists, led by Kelris, sacrifice innocents to Aku'Mai for power.\n\nSlay Kelris and bring his head to Bashana in Thunder Bluff, <name>, please.",o="把梦游者克尔里斯的头颅交给雷霆崖的巴珊娜·符文图腾。",oEN="Bring the head of Twilight Lord Kelris to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",p="愿大地之母与你同在，$n。\n\n世界和平是我们的目标。大地之母对整个世界有一个宏伟的计划，我们都在其中扮演了某种角色。",pEN="May the Earthmother be with you, <name>.\n\nPeace between the earth and all her people should be our goal. She has a grand plan for nature, and we all have a role to play in that plan.",c="克尔里斯一直以来都在躲避着银色黎明的追杀。\n\n一段时间以来，他们认为他已经死了，或者是失踪了。\n\n你的行为使很多无辜的生命幸免于难，$n。\n\n大地之母会因此而赞扬你！为了个人利益而牺牲他人是一种可耻的行为！\n\n今天你做了一件伟大的事情。克尔里斯是一个恶魔，他想要通过膜拜如上古诸神这样的生物而把世界重新带回一片混乱之中。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Kelris has eluded the Argent Dawn for some time.\n\nFor some time they considered him dead or missing.\n\nBy ending his reign you have spared the lives of many innocent people, <name>.\n\nEarthmother be praised! To sacrifice another to a servant of an Old God for personal gain is beyond disgusting!\n\nYou have done a great thing this day. Kelris was a creature of evil and sought to bring the world back to a time of chaos by worshipping such creatures as the Old Gods. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[6562]={d="耶努萨克雷需要帮助。他在灰谷的佐拉姆加前哨站那里，就在石爪山的北面。穿过风剪峭壁，或者从贫瘠之地直接往北走，都可以到达那里。佐拉姆海岸在森林的最西面，小心一些，$n。那里是非常危险的。",dEN="Je'neu Sancrea is in need of aid. He is at the Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale. The Night elf forest is to the north of the Stonetalon mountains. You can reach it by traveling through Windshear Crag or by heading north through Barrens. Zoram Strand is far to the west of the forest. Be careful, <name>. There are forces there that will not take to your presence kindly.",o="与灰谷的耶努萨克雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",c="苏纳曼派你来的？太好了。我们有很多事情要办。",cEN="Tsunaman sent you? Excellent. Then we have matters to discuss."}
Q[6563]={d="在通往黑暗深渊入口的通道中有许多生长在洞穴墙壁上的蓝宝石，最近有消息说纳迦正在挖掘这些宝石。在搞清楚他们的动机之前，我们应该先阻止它们。这些水晶中蕴含着强大的元素力量，只要经过一定的处理，它们就可以被制作成强大的魔法材料。\n\n你能帮帮我吗，$n？从我们的哨所往北走，然后就可以在佐拉姆海岸附近找到黑暗深渊了。",dEN="Within the beginning tunnels of Blackfathom Deeps, large sapphire clusters can be found along the cave walls. Recently it was noted that the naga were harvesting the crystals. Until it can be discerned why, I sense we should stop the naga from succeeding. The crystals have great elemental power and if used inappropriately, could make for a powerful arcane component.\n\nWill you help me, <name>? Blackfathom Deeps can be found along Zoram Strand to the north of our outpost.",o="收集20颗阿库麦尔蓝宝石，把它们交给灰谷的耶努萨克雷。",oEN="Bring 20 Sapphires of Aku'Mai to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",p="搜寻水晶的工作进行得如何，$n？你有见到纳迦在采集它们吗？祖先保佑，希望我们能找到纳迦收集这些东西的原因。",pEN="How goes your search for the crystals, <name>? Have you witnessed the naga harvesting them? I pray to my ancestors we find the reason they are collecting such things.",c="干得好，$n。这就是我说的那些水晶。真有意思……\n\n我能感觉到其中的力量。水之灵魂依附在它们上面。不管纳迦原本要用它们做什么……好吧，我们该庆幸它们已不在纳迦手中。",cEN="Well done, <name>. These are the crystals I spoke of. Intriguings...\n\nI can feel the power within them. The spirits of water cling to them. Whatever the naga were going to use these for... well, let us be glad they are no longer in their hands."}
Q[6564]={d="皱巴巴的字条上潦草地写着几行歪歪扭扭的字：\n\n“对，告诉所有女祭司把水晶带来给我。水元素灵魂在它们内部十分强大，能极大地协助我们的水术师施展召唤。\n\n通过控制水晶中的力量，我们就能安抚阿库麦尔。总有一天我们会拥有足够的力量把阿库麦尔带回来，世界将重回它最辉煌的时代！一个由上古之神统治的时代！”\"\"",dEN="Some poor handwriting is scrawled on the crumpled up note:\n\n\"Yes, tell all the priestesses to bring the crystals to me. The water elemental spirits are strong within them and they will aid our aquamancers greatly in their own summonings.\n\nBy controlling the power within the crystals, we will appease Aku'Mai. One day we will have enough power to bring Aku'Mai back to us and the world will return to its greatest era! An era of rule by the Old Gods!\"",o="把潮湿的便笺交给灰谷的耶努萨克雷。",oEN="Bring the Damp Note to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",p="什么事，$n？你需要什么吗？对于纳迦正在收集的那些水晶，我还知之甚少。",pEN="Yes, <name>? What is it you need? There is still much I must learn about the crystals the naga are gathering.",c="这确实非常有趣。很高兴你能把它交给我。\n\n现在我们可以找到这一连串麻烦的幕后真凶了……洛古斯·杰特。",cEN="This is interesting indeed. I am glad you have brought it to my attention.\n\nNow we have a name for our troubles... Lorgus Jett."}
Q[6565]={d="我们绝对不能让这个暮光之锤的信徒完成他的计划。暮光之锤根本不了解自然的真义。他们信仰上古之神——很久之前就被击败了的、代表着混乱和毁灭的生物。你必须阻止洛古斯，$n。我无法自己来完成这个任务——因为我太脆弱了。\n\n到黑暗深渊去，找到他，杀了他。完成任务之后就回到我这里来。",dEN="This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan. The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature. They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated. This Lorgus cannot be allowed to succeed. You must stop him, <name>. I cannot do it myself--I am too weak.\n\nGo into Blackfathom Deeps, find him, and kill him. Return to me here at Zoram'gar when it's done.",o="杀掉黑暗深渊里的洛古斯·杰特，然后向灰谷的耶努萨克雷复命。",oEN="Kill Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps and then return to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",p="你找到他了没有，$n？我们必须阻止洛古斯！",pEN="Have you found him yet, <name>? Lorgus must be stopped!",c="太好了！谢谢你，$n。我们也许无法完全阻止暮光之锤，但是你至少阻止了他们将上古诸神带回这个世界的计划。\n\n不知道他们是不是还有别的计划在酝酿中，但是现在我们至少可以休息一下了。",cEN="Very good!! Thank you, <name>. We may not have stopped the Twilight's Hammer completely, but at least you have staved off another of their plans to return the Old Gods to power.\n\nWho knows what other plans they have manifesting, but we can rest easy for now."}
Q[6566]={d="很高兴再次见到你，$n。风从东部王国带来了消息。\n\n坐下，听着。|n",dEN="It is good to see you again, <name>. The wind carries with it news from the Eastern Kingdom.\n\nSit, listen.",o="听萨尔讲话。",oEN="Listen to Thrall.",p="耐心点，$n。注意听！",pEN="Patience, <name>. Pay attention!",c="你准备好接受这个任务了吗？",cEN="Are you prepared to take on this task?"}
Q[6567]={d="我的勇士之一雷克萨发现，也许存在进入那条龙巢穴的办法。他已动身前往艾泽拉斯，加入一支前往外域的远征队。\n\n不过，他的伙伴、影袭村的洛卡洛知道这个消息。去找他。",dEN="I have received word from one of my champions that a way into the lair of the dragon may exist. You are to seek him out.Rexxar wanders the desert wasteland of Desolace, traveling between Stonetalon and Feralas. He awaits your arrival.",o="在凄凉之地的影袭村寻找洛卡洛。",oEN="Seek out Rexxar. The Warchief has instructed you as to his whereabouts. Search the paths of Desolace, between the Stonetalon Mountains and Feralas.",c="进入那条母龙巢穴只有一个办法，$r。\n\n你看，只有黑翼军团中最强者才被允许进入族母的巢穴。必须通过重重考验，并由达基萨斯将军亲自主持仪式为钥匙附魔！\n\n既然你不属于黑龙龙裔，取得通行许可对你来说可能会有些困难。\n\n<雷克萨咧嘴一笑。>",cEN="There is but one way into the dragon's lair, <race>.\n\nYou see, only the strongest of the Black Dragonflight are allowed entry into the lair of the brood mother. Many trials must be passed and the key to enter ceremoniously enchanted by General Drakkisath himself!\n\nSince you are not of black dragonkin, you may have some difficulty in obtaining passage.\n\n<Rexxar grins.>"}
Q[6568]={d="幻象与伪装。这就是你欺骗黑翼军团、得到你所求之物的办法。\n\n虽然我可以教你一些欺骗的技巧，但你需要一位大师的帮助。\n\n我知道有个人能做到。在西瘟疫之地，你会找到米兰达·鬼婆，她曾是洛丹伦的幻术大师。她过去帮过我们，如果她相信你，就会帮你。\n\n把这个口信交给她。",dEN="Illusion and disguise. That is how you will fool the Black Dragonflight, and gain what you seek.\n\nThough I could teach you something of the skills of deception, you need the help of a master.\n\nI know of one who could do this. In the Western Plaguelands, you will find Myranda the Hag, once a master illusionist of Lordaeron. She has helped us in the past, and if she believes the cause worthy, she may help you.\n\nTake this message to her.",o="把洛卡洛的信交给西瘟疫之地的米兰达·鬼婆。",oEN="Deliver Rexxar's Letter to Myranda the Hag in the Western Plaguelands.",p="我很少在这里见到部落来的$r。你给米兰达带什么来了？",pEN="It is not often I see one of the Horde in these parts of Lordaeron. What is it that you have for Myranda?",c="<米兰达拿着字条，停顿了一下，然后笑了。>\n\n他怎么样了？我是说雷克萨。哦，别装糊涂了。这封信是故意留白的。它承载着写信人的意念与思绪。从内容来看，难怪雷克萨会让它保持空白。想象一下，如果你被俘或被杀，这些信息被人发现会怎样！\n\n哦，算了！米兰达会帮你的，$r。我欠大酋长一两个人情。\n\n<米兰达微笑着。>",cEN="<Myranda holds the note, pauses, then smiles.>\n\nHow is he? Rexxar, I mean. Oh, come now, do not look so confused. The letter was left intentionally blank. It carried with it the intentions and thoughts of its creator. Judging from its contents, it is no wonder Rexxar left it as such. Imagine if you were captured or slain and this information discovered!\n\nOh, nevermind! Myranda will help you, <race>. I owe the Warchief a favor or two.\n\n<Myranda smiles.>"}
Q[6569]={d="这么说，这位$r想成为黑翼军团的一员，是吗？\n\n创造你所需的幻象并不难，但占卜所需的材料相当难以取得。大酋长把这项任务托付给你，说明他信任你，所以米兰达也只能认为你$g有这个能力:有这个能力;。\n\n前往黑石塔上层的城堡，杀死足够多的黑龙龙裔，用它们的眼睛装满你的一个背包。\n\n等你收集够材料后，回来见米兰达。",dEN="So the <race> wishes to become one of the Black Flight, eh?\n\nThe creation of the illusion you require is trivial, but the components required for the divination are quite difficult to obtain. The Warchief has entrusted you with this mission, so Myranda must assume you as capable.\n\nTravel to the upper citadel of Blackrock Spire and slay enough of the black dragonspawn to fill up one of your packs with their eyes.\n\nReturn to Myranda when you have gathered enough of the reagent.",o="到黑石塔去收集20颗黑色龙人的眼球，完成任务之后回到巫女麦兰达那里。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.",p="任何幻象最重要的材料，$n，就是我们要模仿之物的眼睛。\n\n<米兰达指着一个几乎装满眼球、贴着“血色十字军”标签的袋子。>\n\n<米兰达大笑起来。>",pEN="The eyes of that which we wish to mimic are the most important ingredient of any illusion, <name>.\n\n<Myranda points to a bag almost overflowing with eyeballs labeled 'Scarlet Crusade.'>\n\n<Myranda laughs.>",c="让米兰达看看，$r。\n\n哦，是的，这些非常合适。\n\n有了这些材料，米兰达就能为你制作一枚徽章，它能制造出骗过黑翼军团守门人的幻象。",cEN="Let Myranda have a look, <race>.\n\nOh yes, these will do nicely.\n\nWith these reagents, Myranda will create for you a medallion that will grant an illusion capable of fooling the black dragonflight's gatekeeper."}
Q[6570]={d="我已经为这枚徽章调谐了必要的魔法，使它能在燃鬃的巢穴范围内制造并维持一个幻象。\n\n燃鬃是一头古老的龙；奈法利安的老守门人，肩负着考验那些即将晋升为奥妮克希亚精锐守卫的龙人的职责。\n\n前往尘泥沼泽的巨龙沼泽，进入燃鬃的巢穴。到了那里就戴上这枚护符，然后跟随你的命运，任凭它把你引向何处！|n",dEN="I have attuned this medallion with the magic necessary to create and maintain an illusion within the bounds of the den of Emberstrife.\n\nEmberstrife is an ancient drake; an old gatekeeper of Nefarian, burdened with the duty to test those dragonspawn that would ascend to the rank of elite guard to Onyxia.\n\nTravel to the Wyrmbog of Dustwallow Marsh and enter the lair of Emberstrife. Once there, put on the amulet and follow where your destiny may lead!",o="前往尘泥沼泽的巨龙沼泽，寻找燃鬃的巢穴。进入之后戴上龙鳞征服护符，与燃鬃交谈。|n",oEN="Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh and seek out Emberstrife's Den. Once inside, wear the Amulet of Draconic Subversion and speak with Emberstrife.",c="我们合格的士兵已经少到要让奈法利安给我送雏龙来了吗？你永远通不过我的考验，$g小崽子:小崽子;。",cEN="Have we run so low on able soldiers that Nefarian is sending me whelps? You will never pass my tests, broodling."}
Q[6571]={d="我们在战歌伐木场中的某些物资出现了短缺！\n\n碎木哨岗的皮克希尔有我们所需的战歌锯条，另外，你必须前往藏宝海湾，从码头管理员罗兹基尔那儿取回一箱斧头。\n\n不过要取回油和绳索就比较困难了。熊怪盗走了绳索，萨特截走了油，在它们的仪式中使用！\n\n如果我不能尽快把这批物资送过去，我可就麻烦大了——你能帮帮我吗？",dEN="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!\n\nPixel at Splintertree Post has our shipment of saw blades. It'll take a trip to Booty Bay to pick up a crate of axes from Wharfmaster Lozgil.\n\nOur shipment of oil and rope will be more difficult. The rope was pilfered by the Thistlefur and Foulweald furbolgs, and the satyrs intercepted the delivery of the oil and are now using it for detestable rituals in Night Run, Satyrnaar, and Xavian!\n\nCan you help me?",o="收集战歌氏族的补给品：战歌锯条、伐木绳、战歌之油，还有一箱战歌之斧。",oEN="Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post.",p="希望你能成功运送这批物资！如果我不快点运送这些货物我就会有大麻烦了！",pEN="I hope you can come through with the supplies!",c="太棒了，$n。你帮我省了不少事儿！\n\n我对你非常感激！",cEN="Excellent, <name>. You've saved me a lot of work!\n\nBut don't think that I'm not grateful!"}
Q[6581]={d="直接从棘齿城运来的战歌锯刃！没错，就在我这儿。\n\n……不过，你打算拿什么来付账？你知道的，可不能白拿！我的时间可不便宜！\n\n我真正需要的是一把能随身携带的好枪。女孩子总得保护自己，你懂吧？有一把枪我特别喜欢，我相信工程师做起来毫无问题。\n\n所以，如果你给我带来一把致命短枪，我就把这批锯刃给你。成交吗？",dEN="Direct from Ratchet, the Warsong saw blades! Yep, I have them right here.\n\n..But what sort of payment do you have for me? You can't just take them, you know! My time isn't cheap!\n\nWhat I really need is a good gun to carry with me on my travels. A girl's gotta protect herself, you know? There's a gun I really like that I'm sure an engineer would have no problem making.\n\nSo, if you bring me a deadly blunderbuss, I'll give you the saw blade shipment. Do we have a deal?",o="取得一把致命短枪，带到碎木哨岗交给皮克塞尔。",oEN="Acquire and bring a Deadly Blunderbuss to Pixel in Splintertree Post.",p="战歌锯刃！当然，我这儿就有。\n\n……但是你要如何回报我呢？要知道，你可不能白拿！我的时间可不能白费！\n\n我真正想要的是一把好枪，我要在旅途中随身携带它。女孩子要学会自我保护，你明白吗？我想，精通工程学的人可以毫不费力地制作出一把我喜欢的枪来。\n\n如果你能给我一把威力强大的火枪，我就给你这些锯刃。这笔交易如何？",pEN="Direct from Ratchet, the Warsong saw blades! Yep, I have them right here.\n\n..But what sort of payment do you have for me? You can't just take them, you know! My time isn't cheap!\n\nWhat I really need is a good gun to carry with me on my travels. A girl's gotta protect herself, you know? There's a gun I really like that I'm sure an engineer would have no problem making.\n\nSo, if you bring me a deadly blunderbuss, I'll give you the saw blade shipment. Do we have a deal?",c="这真是太完美了——就是它！好吧，这是你要的货物。",cEN="This is perfect -- just the thing! Well, here's the shipment."}
Q[6582]={d="我们是死亡之翼的子嗣，$g雏龙:雏龙;。我们必须确立对低等守护巨龙军团的统治。\n\n如果你真的配得上晋升，那些低等巨龙军团将在你面前畏缩。\n\n找到他们的勇士，以我们父亲之名将他们彻底摧毁！\n\n前往冬泉谷，找到强大的蓝龙占卜者。碾碎他和所有挡路的蓝翼军团成员。撕下他的头骨，带回来给我。",dEN="We are Deathwing's children, whelp. Our dominance over the lesser Aspects must be enforced.\n\nIf you are truly worthy of ascension, the lesser dragonflight will wilt in your presence.\n\nFind their champions and lay waste to them in the name of our Father!\n\nTravel to Winterspring and track down the mighty blue drake, Scryer. Crush him and any of the Blue Flight that stand in your path. Tear out his skull and return it to me.",o="找到蓝龙斯克利尔并杀掉他。从他的身上取下他的颅骨，然后将其交给埃博斯塔夫。\n\n你可以在冬泉谷找到斯克利尔。",oEN="You must find the blue dragonflight drake champion, Scryer, and slay him. Pry his skull from his corpse and return it to Emberstrife.\n\nYou know that Scryer can be found in Winterspring.",p="<艾博斯塔夫发出嘶嘶声。>",pEN="<Emberstrife hisses.>",c="第一个试炼结束了，接下来是第二个……",cEN="One of ssseveral complete..."}
Q[6583]={d="我们的父亲击溃了其它守护巨龙，我们也必须给他们的孩子带来混乱和毁灭。\n\n你必须在那些绿龙的孩子身上检验你的力量。\n\n到悲伤沼泽去找到索姆努斯，它是绿龙的勇士。让它感受你的愤怒，杀掉那只可怜的小虫……把他的颅骨给我拿回来……",dEN="Just as our Father crushes the Aspects themselves, so too must we strive to bring chaos and destruction to their children.\n\nYou must test your battle prowess against the sleepless dreamers: The children of the Green Flight.\n\nTravel to the Swamp of Sorrows and track down Somnus, drake champion of the Green Flight. Let flow your hatred; dominate the insect... Return to me with his skull...",o="杀掉绿龙索姆努斯，把他的颅骨交给埃博斯塔夫。",oEN="Destroy the drake champion of the Green Flight, Somnus. Take his skull and return it to Emberstrife.",p="在你浸浴敌人的鲜血前不要回来，让它们感受死亡和痛苦吧。",pEN="Do not return here until you have bathed in the blood of our enemies and drank in their suffering.",c="两个任务完成了，还有两个……",cEN="Another complete..."}
Q[6584]={d="诺兹多姆，时间之王……他的孩子们……\n\n有三条龙看守着时光之穴，但我们黑龙只对其中一条感兴趣：时光的转换者，克鲁纳里斯，他是诺兹多姆最喜欢的孩子……\n\n把他杀掉，让整个沙漠都因你的力量而震动，把他的颅骨给我拿回来……",dEN="The time watchers, children of Nozdormu - Lord of the Centuriesss...\n\nIt is three that guard the Caverns of Time, but only one that holds the interests of the Black Flight: The Time Shifter, Chronalis, favored drakeling of Nozdormu.\n\nSsstrike at this champion, a blow to make even the stoic sands of time weep. Return to me with his skull.",o="诺兹多姆的孩子克鲁纳里斯在塔纳利斯沙漠守卫着时光之穴。杀了他，把他的颅骨交给埃博斯塔夫。",oEN="Guarding the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris Desert is Chronalis, child of Nozdormu. Destroy him and return his skull to Emberstrife.",p="小家伙，你必须知道，时间紧迫……",pEN="Ironically, whelp, time is of the essencccce.",c="最让人憎恨的那个还活着……",cEN="The most hated remainsss..."}
Q[6585]={d="我们的父亲在格瑞姆巴托的群山中大发神威，对抗守护之龙的力量。阿莱克斯塔萨，那个懦弱的背叛者，她畏怯地逃跑了。\n\n多么可耻的行为……\n\n现在红龙守卫着格瑞姆巴托，他们的领导者埃克托兹必须被干掉，把他的颅骨给我带回来。为了我们的父亲而战，小黑龙！",dEN="It was over the mountains of Grim Batol that our Father raged against the combined might of the Aspects. The cowardly act of the betrayer, Alexstrasza, bought the other Aspects enough time to escape from Father's wrath.\n\nSssuch a shameful act...\n\nThe Red Flight now guards Grim Batol, their lieutenant, Axtroz, must be destroyed. Return the skull of Axtroz to me. For Father, whelp!",o="到格瑞姆巴托去杀掉红龙埃克托兹，把他的颅骨交给埃博斯塔夫。",oEN="Travel to Grim Batol and track down Axtroz, drake champion of the Red Flight. Destroy him and take his skull. Return the skull to Emberstrife.",p="改变……我感觉到了你的改变，小家伙。通过这个试炼，等着你的就是庆典了。",pEN="Changesss... I sense them taking place in you, whelp. Pass this test and only ceremony remains.",c="我曾怀疑过你的忠诚，$g雏龙:雏龙;。你坚持下来了，击败了我们的敌人，为我们的军团带来了荣耀。\n\n现在，我必须为你的晋升准备那些头骨。",cEN="I had doubted your dedication, whelp. You persisted, dominating our enemies, bringing honor to our flight.\n\nI must now prepare the skulls for your ascension."}
Q[6601]={d="用我们敌人的头骨铸成的一枚徽章。你认识这枚徽章，是吧？你一定见过，因为你的长辈们都佩戴着它。\n\n拿着它，$g雏龙:雏龙;。回到黑石塔，把它呈给达基萨斯将军。将军会为徽章施加最后的附魔，把这件饰品与你的灵魂调谐。\n\n你将佩戴这枚完成的徽章作为荣誉的标记。它将象征你晋升到我们最核心的行列之一：族母的守护者。\n\n去吧！",dEN="From the skulls of our enemies is shaped a medallion. You know this medallion, yesss? You have no doubt seen it worn by your elders.\n\nTake it, whelp. Return to the Spire and present it to General Drakkisath. The General will place the final enchantment upon the medallion, attuning the trinket to your spirit.\n\nYou will wear the finished medallion as a badge of honor, symbolizing your ascension to one of our most guarded ranks: Guardian to the brood mother.\n\nGo!",o="看来这场戏该收场了。你知道米兰达·鬼婆为你制作的龙鳞征服护符在黑石塔内部不会起作用。也许你该去找雷克萨，向他说明你的困境。给他看看那枚黯淡的龙火护符。运气好的话，他会知道下一步该怎么做。",oEN="It would appear as if the charade is over. You know that the Amulet of Draconic Subversion that Myranda the Hag created for you will not function inside Blackrock Spire. Perhaps you should find Rexxar and explain your predicament. Show him the Dull Drakefire Amulet. Hopefully he will know what to do next.",p="别慌，$n！",pEN="Do not panic, <name>!",c="那只是单纯龙与龙之间的对话，$n，热空气多过于实际有用的资讯。它们那些龙就只会采取豹而不实或者激进的行动。",cEN="It is merely dragon-talk, <name> - more hot air than actual substantive information. Pompous, aggressive behavior is to be expected from their kind."}
Q[6602]={d="你要去拜访一下将军，没错，但并不是以黑龙的样子去拜访。\n\n你看，这个仪式所需的不过是更多的流血而已。\n\n这个未完成的饰物只需要将军的血就可激活，这是它们那野蛮而原始的备用机制。\n\n回到黑石塔去干掉达基萨斯，把他的血拿来给我，然后我就可以帮你激活开启奥妮克希亚巢穴的钥匙。",dEN="How would you feel about paying a visit to the General? No illusions, this time.\n\nCeremony? A pretty word to describe the bloodletting that amuses the Black Dragonflight.\n\nAll this amulet requires is the blood of General Drakkisath. Primitive security. There are other ways to receive the General's blood.\n\nGo to Blackrock Spire and kill Drakkisath. Return with his blood and I will activate the key to Onyxia's lair.",o="前往黑石塔，杀死达基萨斯将军。收集他的血，带回来交给雷克萨。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.",p="达基萨斯并不是那么好对付的，$n。死在他手上的人不计其数。",pEN="I don't think I need to tell you that Drakkisath is not to be taken lightly.\n\nI let the thousands dead by his hand do the talking.",c="你的英勇事迹将会永远流传，$n。龙火护符是通往奥妮克希亚巢穴的钥匙，聚集你的同伴，以部落的名义征服那里吧。",cEN="A victory that will be remembered for many years, <name>. The Drakefire Amulet will open Onyxia's lair. Gather your allies and bring victory to the Horde."}
Q[6603]={d="冬泉谷出事了！\n\n呃，这个嘛，我在野外待的时间不少……所以知道这些事……我总是很自豪这么说。我觉得在山里度过的那些时光是宝贵的。能帮你练出敏捷的反应、冷静的头脑和敏锐的眼力……\n\n要像我这样欣赏荒野，需要判断力、头脑和成熟。\n\n对了……我们刚才在说什么来着？\n\n啊，对，出事了。去温泉找多诺瓦·雪山，她能告诉你更多。|n",dEN="There's trouble in Winterspring!\n\nWhy, sure, I spend some time out in the wilds and know about these things... I'm always mighty proud to say it. I consider the hours I spend out there in the hills to be golden. Help you cultivate quick reflexes, a cool head and a keen eye...\n\nIt takes judgement, brains and maturity to appreciate the wilderness in the way that I do.\n\nNow, what was I talking about?\n\nAh yes, trouble. See Donova Snowden at the hot springs and she can tell you more.",o="到冬泉谷的温泉附近去找到多诺瓦·雪山。",oEN="Find Donova Snowden near the hot springs in Winterspring.",c="你好！麦吉已经把我在这儿碰到的麻烦事情跟你说了？",cEN="Well, hi there! So Meggi told you of the trouble I have found here?"}
Q[6604]={d="你有没有注意到南边那个废弃的营地？看来那里是被疯狂的枭兽洗劫过了！\n\n我听说从那次攻击中侥幸逃脱的一个幸存者正在坠星村里休养，就在这里的西边。我对这事情很感兴趣……你呢？",dEN="Have you noticed the abandoned camp to the south of here? It looks like the wildkin went crazy and destroyed just about everything they could find!\n\nI heard a rumor that one of the survivors of the attack is resting at Starfall Village, west of here. I'm sure curious about what happened... aren't you?",o="与坠星村的加隆·石矛谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jaron Stoneshaper at Starfall Village.",c="啊，我能为你做些什么吗？",cEN="Aye, what can I do for you?"}
Q[6605]={d="我刚从费伍德森林回来，$n。路上我在血毒岗哨停留了一下，遇到了一个非常古怪的角色……她似乎一门心思扑在某件事上。我本可以告诉你那是什么，但我想她更愿意亲自向你解释。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，就去费伍德森林西部的血毒岗哨找温娜·里兹加。\n\n谁知道呢，也许她需要你的帮助……",dEN="I just got back from Felwood, <name>. On my way through, I stopped at Bloodvenom Post and I met a very odd character... She seemed intent on one thing, and I suppose I could tell you what that is, but I think she'd like to explain it to you herself.\n\nIf you're interested, head to Bloodvenom Post in western Felwood and look for Winna Hazzard.\n\nWho knows, she might need your help...",o="与费伍德森林的温娜·哈萨德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Winna Hazzard in Felwood.",c="啊，一个$c。看来现在有希望了，你是来帮助我的吗？",cEN="Ah, <class>. I see that there is hope yet. Are you here to assist me?"}
Q[6607]={d="我不能说我非常喜欢钓鱼，但是算起来我也已经钓了有二三十年了吧。\n\n我想很多人都是因为各种各样的原因而去做他们正在做的那些事情吧。\n\n当然，我的意思并不是你也得耐着性子钓三十年才能成为一个钓鱼高手。我想你只需有足够的耐心和定力，可以一坐就是几个小时，而且要在这期间什么都不干。\n\n我跟你说啊，给我抓来一些非常稀有的鱼，然后我就会教你几招。以下是列表：",dEN="Can't say I really enjoy fishin' much. Figure I been at it for a good 20 or 30 years now.\n\nI reckon people are driven to do what they do for different reasons.\n\nNow, I'm not saying you need to fish for 30 years or catch every fish in the sea to become a master fisherman. I reckon you just need to be determined - determined enough to sit on your duff for hours at a time, doin' nothin'.\n\nI'll tell you what, catch me a few rare fish and I'll teach you a thing or two. Here's a list:",o="纳特·帕格要你钓到以下几种鱼：\n\n悲伤沼泽芦苇海岸的芦苇海岸大马哈鱼。\n\n凄凉之地萨瑟里斯海岸的萨瑟里斯虎鱼。\n\n菲拉斯沃丹提斯河的菲拉斯草鱼。\n\n荆棘谷野人海岸的野人海岸蓝色叉牙鱼。\n\n当你钓到这些鱼之后，就可以回到纳特·帕格那里去了！",oEN="Nat Pagle wants you to catch the following fish:\n\nMisty Reed Mahi Mahi from the Misty Reed Strand in the Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nA Sar'theris Striker from the Sar'theris Strand in Desolace.\n\nFeralas Ahi from the Verdantis River of Feralas.\n\nSavage Coast Blue Sailfin from the Savage Coast of Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nReturn to Nat Pagle when you have reeled them all in!",p="有东西上钩了吗？",pEN="Anything bitin' today?",c="干得漂亮！\n\n来吧，让我教你几招钓鱼的方法吧。",cEN="Now that's a fine catch!\n\nCome over here, lemme show you how to set a few lines."}
Q[6608]={d="鲁玛克已经没有什么可教给$n的了。你太棒了！去找鲁玛克的朋友纳特·帕格吧，他是一个人类，但我不吃他！他是鲁玛克的朋友！纳特教你钓鱼。\n\n你也许可以在塞拉摩岛的那个人类镇子南面，嗯，尘泥沼泽里，在那里找到他，纳特·帕格可能正在那里钓鱼。现在就出发吧！",dEN="Lumak no can teach <name> no more. You too good! Find Lumak friend, Nat Pagle. Is human but no eat! Is Lumak friend! Nat teach you fish gooder.\n\nYou find Nat in Dustwallow Marsh, south of Humie town, Thermorosomethinglikedat. Nat probably fishing. Go now!",o="你认为鲁玛克想要告诉你，他已经不能帮你提高钓鱼的技能了。也许你应该去找到他的朋友纳特·帕格，他居住在塞拉摩以南的某个岛屿上，他是一名人类渔夫（至少你认为鲁玛克是这么说的）。",oEN="You think Lumak is trying to tell you that he can no longer help you improve your fishing skill. You may want to try to find his friend, Nat Pagle, a human fishing off one of the islands south of Theramore (at least that's what you think Lumak said).",c="你一定是鲁玛克的朋友吧。\n\n钓鱼？我可以告诉你所有跟钓鱼有关的事情。",cEN="'Course, you must be a friend of Lumak's.\n\nFishin'? I can tell you all 'bout fishin'."}
Q[6609]={d="我是个大嗓门的矮人，我亲爱的$g小伙子:小姑娘！我可不是为了钓鱼而生出来的！我的意思是，看看我！我是用石头刻出来的。\n\n我没有什么可保留的了——你已经把我知道的全都学会啦！\n\n你还不明白吗？啊，好吧。我在卡利姆多大陆有一个朋友，他也许可以帮你。他的名字叫纳特·帕格，是一个很友善的人。你可以在塞拉摩南边的岛上找到他。快出发吧！",dEN="I'm a dwarf fer cryin' out loud, <lad/missy>! I ain't been designed to fish! I mean look at me! I'm practically made outta stone.\n\nI got nothin' left - ye tapped me out. I've taught ye all I know, flipflop!\n\nDon't ye get it? Ah, fine. I got an ol' friend over on Kalimdor who can help ye out. 'Is name be Nat Pagle, a fine lad. Find him on the islands south o' Theramore. Git goin'!",o="到卡利姆多大陆的塞拉摩去。从那里向南方出发，找到一座岛屿。纳特·帕格就在岛上等待着你的到来！",oEN="Travel to Kalimdor, to the coastal city of Theramore. From there you must search for an island, south of the main town. Nat Pagle awaits your arrival!",c="我欢迎所有的来访者……我猜……",cEN="I've always got room on my island for visitors... I reckon..."}
Q[6610]={d="你听说过蚌肉大餐没有？显然没有！这是我最最终极、最最伟大的烹饪杰作！哦，$n，只是想一想蚌肉大餐就足以让我垂涎三尺了。\n\n不幸的是，我没有足够的原料来烹饪它！我们来做笔交易怎么样？你为我收集必需的原料，我将这种无上美味的烹饪方法告诉你，此外我还请你吃一顿蚌肉大餐！如何？\n\n很好！我需要下列材料：",dEN="Ever heard of a clamlette? Of course you haven't! It's my latest and greatest culinary masterpiece. Oh, <name>, just thinking about a clamlette makes my mouth water.\n\nUnfortunately, I'm all out of supplies to make any! How about I make you a deal? You gather the supplies I need to make a clamlette and I'll teach you the finer points of exotic cuisine and I'll even throw in a couple of clamlettes to boot! Deal??\n\nHere's what I need:",o="迪尔格·奎克里弗想要你收集这些原料：\n\n10只巨蛋。你可以在塔纳利斯的大鹏或是其它大型鸟类那里获得这种蛋。\n\n10块美味的蚌肉。你可以从任何蚌类身上获得这种原料！\n\n20块奥特兰克冷酪。去买就是了！\n\n收集好所有原料，然后把它们交给迪尔格。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Giant Eggs. You will find those on the Rocs wandering Tanaris or any other species of large bird.\n\n10 pieces of Zesty Clam Meat. You can find those in clams, naturally!\n\n20 pieces of Alterac Swiss. Get thee to a cheesery!\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",p="我快受不了了！快点，$n，别让我动用自己的存货。",pEN="My cravings are going to be the end of me! Hurry, <name> - before I dip into my own supply.",c="你会被这种美味折服的，$n。看好了！\n\n<迪尔格开始准备蚌肉大餐。>",cEN="You are in for a special treat, <name>. Watch and learn!\n\n<Dirge begins to prepare clamlette surprise.>"}
Q[6611]={d="你怎么能指望扎姆佳教你什么？扎姆佳的烹饪魔力你全学会了，还想再要！\n\n扎姆佳帮不了。胖$r得去加基森。那儿有个小地精，叫迪尔格。他会帮你，胖子。\n\n等你成了大厨，就回来教扎姆佳，行吗？现在，走。",dEN="How you expect Zamja teach you anything? You got all of Zamja's cooking mojo and still you crave more!\n\nZamja can't help. Fat <race> needs to go to Gadgetzan. You find a little goblin named Dirge there - he help you, fatty.\n\nWhen you become big cook on the block, you come back and teach Zamja, ok? Now go!",o="到塔纳利斯沙漠的加基森去，与迪尔格·奎克里弗谈谈你的厨师生涯。",oEN="Travel to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak with Dirge Quikcleave about advancing your cooking career.",c="<迪尔格吐出一些皮鞋的碎皮。>\n\n呸呸……\n\n<迪尔格剧烈地咳了起来。>\n\n什么？难道你不知道吗，皮革的蛋白质含量极高，而糖份含量极低！",cEN="<Dirge spits out some leather sandal bits.>\n\nPfftooey...\n\n<Dirge hacks loudly.>\n\nWhat? I'll have you know that leather is surprisingly high in protein and low in carbohydrates."}
Q[6612]={d="我看得出来，你心里有数。可惜我啥也教不了你。\n\n不过算你走运，我认识一个家伙，是个地精，卡利姆多最好的厨子。\n\n所以啊，$g小子:丫头;，你就得跑一趟卡利姆多。去加基森找迪尔格·奎克利夫，他会给你指点迷津。|n",dEN="I can tell by yer cooking spoon that ye know what yer doin'. Unfortunately, I can't teach ya nothin'.\n\nLuckily fer ye, I know a guy. He's a goblin and probably the best cook on Kalimdor.\n\nAyep, that's the bad news, <lad/missy> - ye got to travel to Kalimdor. Git to Gadgetzan and find Dirge Quikcleave. He'll set ya straight.",o="前往塔纳利斯沙漠的加基森，与迪尔格·奎克利夫谈谈提升你的烹饪技艺。|n",oEN="Travel to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak with Dirge Quikcleave about advancing your cooking career.",c="<迪尔格吐出一些皮鞋的碎皮。>\n\n呸呸……\n\n<迪尔格剧烈地咳了起来。>\n\n什么？难道你不知道吗，皮革的蛋白质含量极高，而糖份含量极低！",cEN="<Dirge spits out leather.>\n\nPfftey...\n\n<Dirge hacks loudly.>\n\nWhat? I'll have you know that leather is surprisingly high in protein and low in carbohydrates, <race>."}
Q[6621]={d="$n，另一个熊怪部族——腐木部族——住在阿斯特兰纳东南方。他们人数不如蓟皮部族，但他们的凶残构成了未来的威胁。通过一次武力展示，我们可以消除这个威胁。\n\n带上这面旗帜，去腐木村把它插在他们的图腾土堆上。他们会试图摧毁旗帜，但你要守住阵地，直到他们的首领穆尔古特出现，为部族挽回颜面。把他携带的图腾带给我。\n\n召集你的同伴，。这可不是$g一个:一个;$c能独自完成的任务。\n\n",dEN="<name>, another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat. With a show of force, we can remove that threat.\n\nTake this banner, go to the Foulweald village and place it on their totem mound. They will try to destroy the banner, but hold your ground until their chief, Murgut, appears to save face for the tribe. Bring me the totem he carries.\n\nGather your allies, <name>. This is no task for a single <class>.",o="把卡拉恩的旗子插到污林图腾堆中。不要让熊怪摧毁这面旗子。击败穆戈特酋长，将穆戈特的图腾交给佐拉姆加的卡拉恩·阿玛卡。",oEN="Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar.",p="你击败了穆戈特酋长了吗，$n？你拿回他的图腾了吗？",pEN="Did you defeat Chief Murgut, <name>? Did you retrieve his Foulweald Totem?",c="干得好，$n。你向腐木部族发出了挑战，并击败了他们的首领，向他们传递了一个强烈的信号：\n\n部落不是好惹的。\n\n我相信那个部族很长时间内都不会再给我们添麻烦了。",cEN="Good work, <name>. Issuing that challenge to the Foulwealds and defeating their leader sends them a strong message:\n\nThe Horde is not to be trifled with.\n\nI don't believe that tribe will giving us much trouble for a long time."}
Q[6622]={d="你好，$g医生:医生;。今天下午将对你分诊病人的能力进行考核。如果你通过考试，就能加入部落外科医疗队的光荣行列。\n\n现在注意听！必须先处理危重伤员。危重伤员之后是重伤员。轻伤员要放在最后处理。你必须救活 15 名病患才能通过这次考核。如果有 6 名病患在分诊中死亡，你就不及格。\n\n我们会提供分诊绷带。\n\n祝你好运，$g医生:医生;。",dEN="Good day, doctor. You will be tested on your ability to triage patients accordingly this afternoon. Should you pass your examination, you will join the prestigious ranks of Horde Trauma.\n\nNow pay attention! The critically injured must be tended to first. After the criticals come the badly injured. The injured should be tended to last. You must save 15 patients to pass this exam. You will fail should 6 of your patients die in triage.\n\nTriage bandages will be supplied.\n\nGood luck, doctor.",o="使用急救绷带来治疗病人。你必须在6个病人死亡之前拯救15个病人。\n\n一定要牢记治疗的顺序！受致命伤的病人会很快死亡，其次是重伤病人，受普通伤的病人死亡得最慢。所以你最好在治疗那些受致命伤和重伤的病人之后再去治疗受普通伤的病人。",oEN="Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.\n\nRemember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged.",p="干得太出色了，医生。实在是太出色了。",pEN="Miraculous work, doctor. Simply miraculous.",c="$n医生，欢迎加入联盟外科医疗队。",cEN="Doctor <name>, welcome to Horde Trauma."}
Q[6623]={d="$n医生，我想我应该这么称呼你。很高兴再见到你。\n\n我有些好消息要告诉你！格里高利·维克托医生，也就是部落外科医疗队的首席医师，要求你到落锤镇去加入他的队伍。这可是毕生难求的机会啊！我真希望能付出一切来换取跟随格里高利·维克托医生学习的机会！你可不要浪费了这个机会！",dEN="Doctor <name>, I presume. It is a pleasure to see you again.\n\nI have some wonderful news for you! Doctor Gregory Victor, chief physician of Horde Trauma has made a personal request for you to join him at Hammerfall. This could be the opportunity of a lifetime! I would give anything to be given a chance to study under the great Doctor Gregory Victor! Do not squander this opportunity!",o="前往阿拉希高地的落锤镇，与格里高利·维克托医生谈谈加入部落外科医疗队的事宜。|n",oEN="Travel to Hammerfall in the Arathi Highlands and speak with Doctor Gregory Victor about joining the ranks of Horde Trauma.",c="很好。拿上你的医疗器械，我们现在就开始！",cEN="Wonderful. Put on your scrubs, we are to start at once!"}
Q[6624]={d="你好，$g医生:医生;。今天下午将对你分诊病人的能力进行考核。如果你通过考试，就能加入联盟外科医疗队的光荣行列。\n\n现在注意听！必须先处理伤势严重的士兵。之后是伤势中等的。轻伤员要放在最后处理。你必须救活 15 名病患才能通过这次考核。如果有 6 名病患在分诊中死亡，你就不及格。\n\n祝你好运，$g医生:医生;。",dEN="Good day, doctor. You will be tested on your ability to triage patients accordingly this afternoon. Should you pass your examination, you will join the prestigious ranks of Alliance Trauma.\n\nNow pay attention! The critically injured must be tended to first. After the criticals come the badly injured. The injured should be tended to last. You must save 15 patients to pass this exam. You will fail should 6 of your patients die in triage.\n\nGood luck, doctor.",o="使用急救绷带来治疗病人。你必须在6个病人死亡之前拯救15个病人。\n\n一定要牢记治疗的顺序！受致命伤的病人会很快死亡，其次是重伤病人，受普通伤的病人死亡得最慢。所以你最好在治疗那些受致命伤和重伤的病人之后再去治疗受普通伤的病人。",oEN="Save patients by using Triage Bandages to tend to their wounds. You must save 15 patients before 6 of them die from their injuries.\n\nRemember the order of triage! Critically Injured Soldiers die the fastest followed by Badly Injured Soldiers. Injured Soldiers take the longest to die and should be saved AFTER your Critically Injured and Badly Injured Soldiers have been triaged.",p="干得太出色了，医生。实在是太出色了。",pEN="Miraculous work, doctor. Simply miraculous.",c="$n医生，欢迎加入联盟外科医疗队。",cEN="Doctor <name>, welcome to Alliance Trauma."}
Q[6625]={d="$n医生，我想我应该这么称呼你。很高兴再见到你。\n\n我有些好消息要告诉你！古斯塔夫·范沃森医生，也就是联盟外科医疗队的首席医师，要求你到塞拉摩去加入他的队伍。这可是毕生难求的机会啊！我真希望能付出一切来换取跟随古斯塔夫·范沃森医生医生学习的机会！你可不要浪费了这个机会！",dEN="Doctor <name>, I presume. It is a pleasure to see you.\n\nI have some wonderful news for you! Gustaf VanHowzen, chief physician of Alliance Trauma has made a personal request for you to join him at Theramore. This could be the opportunity of a lifetime! I would give anything to be given a chance to study under the great doctor, Gustaf VanHowzen! Do not squander this opportunity, doctor!",o="到尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩去，与古斯塔夫·范沃森医生谈一谈关于加入联盟外科医疗队的事宜。",oEN="Travel to Theramore in the Dustwallow Marsh and speak with Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen about joining the ranks of Alliance Trauma.",c="很好。拿上你的医疗器械，我们现在就开始！",cEN="Wonderful. Put on your scrubs, we are to start at once!"}
Q[6626]={d="被遗忘者不会因为他们的疾病而逝去……至少我所看到的是这样。这使得他们的追随者在某种意义上可以获得永恒的生命。我在想，他也许是亡灵天灾的一员。\n\n至于现在，我关注的不是他，而是他身边不断膨胀的部队。他们总是躲藏在阴影之中，总是向他祈求更多的力量。\n\n现在我无法自己去和他们作战，$n。你看怎么样？你做好大战一场的准备了吗？",dEN="The Forsaken do not pass on their... illness... from what I have seen. This diplomat seems to be granting undeath to would-be followers. I am beginning to think he is one of the Scourge.\n\nFor now, my concern is not with him though, it's with the growing ranks around him. They creep from the shadows daily, almost begging him for more power.\n\nI'm not powerful enough to fight them on my own, <name>. What do you say? Are you up for some hunting?",o="杀掉8个剃刀沼泽护卫者、8个剃刀沼泽织棘者和8个亡首教徒，然后向剃刀高地入口处的麦雷姆·月歌复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs.",p="狩猎行动进行得怎么样了，$n？看到这么一小批家伙，我就已经不再怀疑天灾军团是这个世界上最大的威胁了。",pEN="How goes the hunt, <name>? Seeing just this small sample of this diplomat's power here removes any doubt I had that the Scourge are one of the greatest threats this world has ever seen.",c="谢谢你，$n！你所完成的任务无疑会给我们提供巨大的帮助，这一点我可以肯定。\n\n我会对这一地区的情况以及这里剩余的野猪人继续进行研究。如果你想要迎接更大的挑战，那就召集一些同伴，进入那座仿佛巨大的野猪嘴的洞穴吧。我相信你会在洞中遇到更危险的敌人。",cEN="Thank you, <name>! The work you've done will be a great help, I'm sure.\n\nI will continue my study of this diplomat and the rest of the quilboar here. If you seek greater adventure, I'd find a few friends and head into the cave that looks like a great boar maw just over there. I'm sure once you're inside you'll find greater challenges to face."}
Q[6627]={d="你把书给我带来了，现在是时候向你提问了。你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？\n\n别觉得$g有压力:有压力;，$c。慢慢来，想好了再回答。",dEN="You have brought me the book, and now it is time for your question. Are you ready?\n\nTime is not an issue, <class>, so do not feel pressured. You may take as long as you like to answer.",o="正确回答布劳格·幽魂的问题，然后再和他交谈一次。当你$g准备好:准备好;时，他仍会留在石爪山脉。",oEN="Answer Braug Dimspirit's question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in Stonetalon Mountains when you are ready.",p="生活充满了问题，$n。你永远无法回答所有问题，但只要花些时间钻研学习，也许你会变得更有见识一些。",pEN="Life is full of questions, <class>. You will never be able to answer all of them, but with some time and study, perhaps you will become a little more knowledgeable.",c="干得好，$c。你已经认真读过了我要求你学习的东西，你通过了我们的又一个测试。",cEN="Well done, <class>. You have studied the text I asked you to, and now you have passed another of our tests."}
Q[6628]={d="我们又见面了。你以极大的毅力完成了我交给你的任务。\n\n那么现在，该向你提问了。如果你$g准备好:准备好;了，就再来和我谈谈，需要多少时间都可以，$n——不必急着立刻作答。",dEN="So the time is once again upon us. As a student of lore, you have shown great tenacity by undertaking my task.\n\nAnd so now I offer you your question. If you are ready, speak to me again, and take all the time you need, <name>--there is no pressure to answer quickly.",o="正确回答帕库尔·芬塔拉斯的问题，然后再和他交谈一次。当你$g准备好:准备好;时，他仍会留在幽暗城。",oEN="Answer Parqual Fintallas' question successfully and then speak to him again. He will remain in the Undercity until you are ready.",p="如果你想在这个世界上生存下去，我认为只有一条规则你必须知道：你知道得越多，看到的就越多。\n\n如果你去钻研，如果你去观察，你就会开始看到这个世界上其他$r都看不到的东西，$g真的:真的;。",pEN="There is only one rule I feel you must know if you wish to survive in this world: the more you know, the more you'll see.\n\nIf you study, if you observe, then you will begin to see things in the world that no other <race> will see.",c="干得好，$n。我曾经怀疑你是否认真读过了我要求你学习的那些文字，但是你做出了正确的回答。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I had my doubts if you studied the text I asked you to get, but you've answered correctly."}
Q[6629]={d="$n，你杀掉那些邪图腾成员干得很出色。如果你敢的话，格伦迪格·暗云和他那帮贴身打手是所有家伙里最恶劣的。就是他带头发动对我村庄的残暴袭击。\n\n你可以在邪图腾哨站找到他，沿这条路再往西走一段就是。杀了他，我将永远感激你。|n",dEN="<name>, you've done a fine job killing Grimtotem. If you dare, Grundig Darkcloud and his personal band of brutes is by far the worst of the lot. He was the one who led the brutal attack on my village.\n\nYou will find him in Grimtotem Post a bit further up the path to the west. Kill him, and I will be forever grateful.",o="杀死格伦迪格·暗云和 6 名邪图腾打手。然后去见石爪山东南边缘附近的玛卡巴·平蹄。|n",oEN="Kill Grundig Darkcloud and 6 Grimtotem Brutes, and return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.",p="你把格鲁迪格·暗云和他的手下都干掉了吗？",pEN="Have you killed Grundig Darkcloud and his personal band of Brutes?",c="格鲁迪格·暗云死了！$n，我会永远感谢你的。",cEN="Grundig Darkcloud is dead! <name>, I will always be grateful for what you've done here today."}
Q[6641]={d="鞭笞者沃尔沙……在海中出没的残忍的多头蛇怪……\n\n她频繁地、无缘无故地袭击我们的岗哨，到处制造混乱。\n\n但是我已经准备就绪了，$n。我要去击败那个怪物，让她不再对佐拉姆构成威胁。\n\n纳迦在海岸边的小岛上放置着一个长明的火盆，以此来表示他们对这野兽的尊崇。我想，如果我们熄灭火盆，沃尔沙一定会非常愤怒的。\n\n我们需要帮助，因此你最好邀上一些强大的朋友同去。",dEN="Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas...\n\nShe has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path.\n\nBut I am ready, <name>. I have prepared to best the hydra and end these attacks on Zoram'gar.\n\nThe naga honor the wicked nature of this beast with a brazier that remains lit on an island just off the coast. I believe that if we put it out, Vorsha will appear in anger.\n\nWe will need help, so be sure to bring some strong allies.",o="保护穆格拉什安全抵达火盆处。帮他熄灭火焰，然后在他与纳迦战斗时保护他。\n\n如果你$g成功:成功;了，就回到佐拉姆加前哨站，向战歌信使报告鞭笞者沃尔沙的死讯。",oEN="Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.\n\nIf you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",c="自从我到了这儿后，纳迦进攻我们的事情就时常发生。听到沃尔沙再也不能猖狂的消息，让我如释重负！\n\n我们欠你一份人情，$n。",cEN="I have witnessed many naga attacks since I arrived here. It puts my mind at ease that Vorsha will no longer roam freely.\n\nWe are in your debt, <name>."}
Q[6642]={p="黑铁矿蕴藏在黑石山脉的深处，对于兄弟会来说，它是很有价值的商品。拉格纳罗斯神圣的护甲和装备都需要黑铁。\n\n你每给我十块黑铁矿石，兄弟会对你的好感就会增加。",pEN="Dark Iron, while plentiful in the Depths, is still a valued commodity amongst the Brotherhood. The sacred arms and armaments of Ragnaros favor Dark Iron.\n\nFor every 10 pieces of Dark Iron Ore you offer, favor amongst the Brotherhood you will gain.",c="你的贡献被接受了。你获得了我们的好感。继续做下去，你就可以接触到那些历史悠久的生意了。",cEN="Your offering has been accepted. Favor you have gained. Continue and you shall be allowed access to the ancient trades."}
Q[6643]={p="在熔火之心中人人命运难测，死亡说到就到，惩罚来得毫不留情。\n\n兄弟会里面有很多人为了搜寻炽热之核而丧失生命。\n\n给我一个炽热之核，兄弟会对你的好感就会增加。",pEN="Woe unto those that tempt fate inside the Molten Core. Death comes swiftly - the punishment dealt without mercy.\n\nMany of the Brotherhood have been lost in their search for Fiery Cores.\n\nOffer 1 Fiery Core and you shall be granted favor amongst the Brotherhood.",c="你的贡献被接受了。你获得了我们的好感，继续做下去，你就可以接触到那些历史悠久的生意了。",cEN="Your offering has been accepted. Favor you have gained. Continue and you shall be allowed access to the ancient trades."}
Q[6644]={p="你和瑟银兄弟会同心同德，$r。因此洛克索斯才会被授权与你进行交易。\n\n拿一块熔岩之核来，你就会得到兄弟会的好感。",pEN="The Thorium Brotherhood sympathizes with your plight, <race>. This is why Lokthos has been empowered to bargain.\n\nOffer 1 Lava Core and you shall be granted favor amongst the Brotherhood.",c="你的贡献被接受了。你获得了我们的好感，继续做下去，你就可以接触到那些历史悠久的生意了。",cEN="Your offering has been accepted. Favor you have gained. Continue and you shall be allowed access to the ancient trades."}
Q[6645]={p="许多神圣的配方需要拉格纳罗斯心爱的宠物皮毛。\n\n拿二块来，将可以获得兄弟会对你的好感。从熔火之心的熔核犬身上割下的熔核犬皮。",pEN="Many of the sacred recipes require the skin from Ragnaros' chosen pets.\n\nOffer 2 Core Leather, skinned from the smoldering corpses of the Core Hounds of the Molten Core and you shall be granted favor amongst the Brotherhood.",c="你的贡献被接受了。你获得了我们的好感，继续做下去，你就可以接触到那些历史悠久的生意了。",cEN="Your offering has been accepted. Favor you have gained. Continue and you shall be allowed access to the ancient trades."}
Q[6646]={p="火焰之王的眼泪是一种非常稀有的珍宝。\n\n给我一个山脉之血，你就可以获得兄弟会的好感。",pEN="The tears of the Fire Lord are a rare find indeed.\n\nOffer 1 Blood of the Mountain and you shall be granted favor amongst the Brotherhood.",c="你的贡献被接受了。你获得了我们的好感，继续做下去，你就可以接触到那些历史悠久的生意了。",cEN="Your offering has been accepted. Favor you have gained. Continue and you shall be allowed access to the ancient trades."}
Q[6661]={d="慢着，你这饭桶。你……你在找活干吗？我们这儿鼠灾泛滥，甲板上人手不够。\n\n你说什么？你只需要吹奏这只捕鼠者之笛就行了，它们会跟着你走向生命的尽头！\n\n给我抓五只小坏蛋来，把它们交给我，我要活的。\n\n啊……",dEN="Avast ye scallywag. Arrrr... Arrrr ye looking fer work? We gots a serious rat problem down here an' not enough hands on the poop deck.\n\nWhat do ye say? All ye needs to do is take this here rat catchin' flute and play the melody around the vermin. They'll follow ye to the ends of the world!\n\nJust capture five of the little buggers and bring em back here. We needs em alive.\n\nArrrrr...",o="使用捕鼠者之笛捕获5只矿道老鼠，把它们引到蒙提那儿去。别忘了退还笛子。",oEN="Capture 5 Deeprun Rats by using the Rat Catcher's Flute. Lead the rats back to Monty. Don't forget to turn in the flute when you're finished.",p="呃……臭小子，你怎么去了这么久？",pEN="Yarrr... Swabby, what be takin' ye so long?",c="这些正好，$g伙计:伙计;。我兄弟要的是活蹦乱跳的，不然就变味了……你总不想尝尝酸掉的鼠肉串吧。",cEN="These'll werk nicely, matey. Me brother needs em still tickin' and kickin,' else they go sour... Ye don't want to taste no sour rat kabob."}
Q[6662]={d="我的兄弟尼普希在矿道的另一边经营一家烤老鼠肉的摊点。你必须在这箱老鼠坏掉之前把它们交给他。赶快！\n\n你以前坐过地铁的，对吧？很简单，只要等车停下，走上去，然后就享受你的旅程吧。在车行进时可别伸胳膊伸腿的，免得你下半辈子靠假肢过日子。",dEN="Me brother, Nipsy, runs a rat kabob operation on the other side of Deeprun. Ye needs to take this here crate o' rats to him before they go bad. Get a move on!\n\nYe have ridden a tram before, aye? It's easy. Just step aboard when she arrives and enjoy the ride. An' keep yer arms and legs inside durin' the ride, lest ye be peglegged fer life.",o="把装着神秘肉品的纸箱交给暴风城矿道地铁仓库的尼普希。",oEN="Take the Carton of Mystery Meat to Nipsy at the Stormwind Deeprun Tram Depot.",p="<尼普希把他的食指伸进纸箱的换气孔。>\n\n生气勃勃，活力十足……而且时间刚刚好！",pEN="<Nipsy puts his index finger through one of the air holes in the carton.>\n\nAlive and kicking... and just in time!",c="可怜的蒙提。自从诺莫瑞根事件后，他就变了。那个孩子从来都从没看过海，更不用说什么海盗了。\n\n<尼普希叹了口气。>\n\n至少他还一直为我供货。",cEN="Poor Monty. Ever since the Gnomeregan incident, he hasn't been the same. That boy has never seen an ocean in his life, let alone being some kind of pirate.\n\n<Nipsy sighs.>\n\nAt least he keeps the flow of twitching critters coming."}
Q[6681]={d="$n：\n\n拉文霍德已经对你感兴趣了，小贼。我们一直在观察你。你的状况有些尴尬，但没有什么是我们不能改变的。\n\n如果你想要在拉文霍德大人手下谋求一份工作，以及成为刺客联盟的一员，只需把拉文霍德徽记（已附在信中）拿到拉文霍德庄园来。\n\n你的第一项任务就是要找到庄园，它就隐藏在希尔斯布莱德的群山之中，你要充分发挥你的聪明才智。\n\n向你致敬，\n\n- 法拉德。",dEN="<name>,\n\nRavenholdt has taken an interest in you, young thief. We have been watching. Your style is a bit awkward but nothing we couldn't fix.\n\nShould you be prepared to embark on a career as a disciple of Master Ravenholdt and member of the Assassin's League, you have only to bring the Seal of Ravenholdt (attached to this letter) to Ravenholdt Manor.\n\nYour first task is to find the manor, hidden away in the hills of Hillsbrad and demonstrate your cunning.\n\nRegards,\n\nFahrad",o="把拉文霍德徽记交给拉文霍德庄园的法拉德，庄园就坐落在希尔斯布莱德的群山之中。\n\n你的智慧将在这次旅途中得到考验。做好准备吧。",oEN="Take the Seal of Ravenholdt to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden away in the hills of Hillsbrad.\n\nYour cunning will be tested along the way. Be prepared.",p="你遇到密尔顿了吗？\n\n<法拉德笑了起来。>",pEN="Did you meet Milton?<Fahrad laughs.>",c="真精彩，小贼。\n\n你看起来似乎比较寒酸，但穿得还算得体。\n\n前面还有很长的旅程在等待着你去探索呢。你准备好迎接你在拉文霍德庄园的命运了吗？\n\n与外面的警卫谈谈，他们会告诉你如何开始的。",cEN="Most excellent, young thief.\n\nYou look a bit beaten down, but no worse for the wear.\n\nA long journey awaits you - long and rewarding. Are you prepared to finally embrace your destiny among the masters of Ravenholdt?\n\nSpeak with the guards outside. They will get you started."}
Q[6701]={p="我们与辛迪加交战数年，他们战斗技艺极差，却屡屡以数量取胜。单凭砍杀是不可能对他们的数量造成明显影响的！\n\n不过我们发现，要削减辛迪加的人数，最好的办法是窃取他们的纹章。谁丢失了纹章，他们的组织就会“处理”谁。\n\n去翻他们的口袋，把纹章交给我或是其它的守卫。\n\n你就从南边的敦霍尔德城堡开始吧。",pEN="We have been entrenched in a battle with the Syndicate for years. What they lack in skill they make up for in numbers. It's impossible to kill them off fast enough to have any noticeable impact on their population!\n\nWe've found that the best way to deal with their size is to pilfer their emblems. Once an emblem is stolen the shamed member is 'dealt' with internally.\n\nPick their pockets clean and turn the emblems in to me or one of the other guards.\n\nStart at Durnholde, south of here.",c="哈哈，干得好！继续吧，其它的盗贼会对你刮目相看的。",cEN="Hey, nice work! Keep this up and the other rogues might stop spitting on you."}
Q[6741]={p="我需要更多的护甲碎片，$n！你有吗？",pEN="I need more armor scraps, <name>! Do you have any?",c="再次感谢你，$n。你让部落感到骄傲……",cEN="Thanks again, <name>. You do the Horde proud..."}
Q[6761]={d="我已经让我的助手玛斯雷·驭熊者来处理月光林地求援的事宜了。去跟他谈谈吧——不要找我。\n\n不过我要给你一些……友好的建议。是我领导着大家走出了黑暗，不是月光林地的塞纳里奥议会。我们曾经陷入了一无所有的困境，但是泰达希尔给了我们新的生命！他们会努力让你相信他们那套鬼扯，如果你真的相信了他们，那你无疑是个蠢货。\n\n你自己来决定是不是要当一个傻瓜吧。",dEN="I have relegated my second, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, to deal with Moonglade's call for aid. Speak to him on this matter - NOT me.\n\nLet me give you some... friendly... advice. It is I who led us out of the darkness - NOT the Cenarion Circle in Moonglade - when all was lost for our race. Teldrassil gives us all new life! They would have you believe otherwise, and to believe their propaganda would be a fool's task.\n\nI'll leave it to you to decide whether or not you're a fool.",o="与达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区的玛斯雷·驭熊者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker at the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.",c="嗯，$c，感谢你来到这里……大德鲁伊和月光林地的守护者雷姆洛斯之间似乎有着太多的隔阂。双方都在强调自己是正确的，而泰达希尔那边奇怪的堕落气息还是在不断扩散。即使这样，双方的误解也丝毫没有化解的迹象……\n\n不管怎么样，我们对于塞纳里奥议会的职责还在……尽管那些领导着它的长者们可能各执己见。",cEN="Yes <class>, thank you for coming. I apologize about the misunderstanding... the air is thick with mistrust between the Arch Druid here and Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Each suspect the other of chicanery, and the fact that strange corruptions of Teldrassil continue unabated are still an issue here. It does little to quell mistrust.\n\nRegardless, our duty to the Cenarion Circle remains... even if those who lead it may disagree with one another."}
Q[6762]={d="这个任务的内容是这样的，守护者雷姆洛斯在月光林地的总管——拉比恩·萨图纳——正在征集愿意去探索塔纳利斯沙漠以及安戈洛尔环形山地区的冒险者，他就住在月光林地的永夜港里。\n\n虽然你的工作会对我们都有好处，但是我建议你仍然要小心行事，达纳苏斯和月光林地之间的关系最近有些紧张……而且可能会越来越紧张。",dEN="For this task, Keeper Remulos' majordomo in Moonglade - Rabine Saturna - seeks aid in exploring the vast wastelands far to the west of Tanaris... and even further west of Un'Goro. You should find him in Nighthaven, the main village of Moonglade.\n\nWhile your work will no doubt be of tremendous benefit to us all, I advise you to tread gingerly. There are tensions between Darnassus and Moonglade... ones that may grow over the course of time.",o="与月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·萨图纳谈一谈。月光林地在费伍德森林和冬泉谷之间，可以从木喉要塞中的一条通道抵达那里。",oEN="Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade. Moonglade lies between Felwood and Winterspring, accessible through a path out of Timbermaw Hold.",c="我是拉比恩·萨图纳，我代表守护者雷姆洛斯以及这块圣地的所有居民欢迎你。\n\n我感谢你有兴趣并且急切地想要帮助塞纳里奥议会，我也知道达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊对你向我们提供帮助表示了不满。你必须了解，你所做的事情是为了实现崇高的目标，而不是某个心怀叵测的阴暗目的。\n\n欢迎你来到这里，$n。",cEN="I am Rabine Saturna, and on behalf of Keeper Remulos and all of the denizens of this sacred glade I bid you welcome.\n\nI appreciate your interest and eagerness to assist the Cenarion Circle. I also know that Arch Druid of Darnassus expressed his displeasure to you in your lending us aid. Rest assured that it is for the greater good, and that you will be safe from any ill-conceived repercussions you may be the target of.\n\nYou are among friends here, <name>."}
Q[6781]={p="$n，我们需要更多护甲碎片来供给我们的部队！",pEN="<name>, we need more armor scraps to supply our troops!",c="这里有不少上好的材料呢，$n。我可以用这些东西来给我们的军队提供新的装备。\n\n如果我可以得到更多补给的话，也许我们的主力部队就就可以开进战场了！",cEN="These are some good pieces, <name>. I can use them to fashion new equipment for our troops.\n\nIf my supply level gets high enough, then maybe our seasoned fighting units will enter the field!"}
Q[6801]={p="我从雷霆崖来，$r。凯恩亲自决定让我在这些艰难的岁月里协助霜狼氏族。\n\n但别再浪费时间了。你必须击倒我们的敌人，把他们的血带给我。一旦收集到足够的血，召唤仪式就可以开始了。\n\n当元素领主被释放到雷矛大军头上时，胜利就已成定局。",pEN="I come from Thunder Bluff, <race>. Cairne himself has seen to it that I assist the Frostwolf Clan in these dire times.\n\nBut let us not waste any more time. You must strike down our enemies and bring to me their blood. Once enough blood has been gathered, the ritual of summoning may begin.\n\nVictory will be assured when the elemental lord is loosed upon the Stormpike army.",c="我们敌人的鲜血洒满了战场。我会将这些血液和先前收集到的血液混合，在献祭结束之后，冰雪之王就会让这些雷矛矮人看看霜狼氏族的威力！",cEN="The blood of our enemies has been shed. I shall mix this blood with the rest that has been gathered. Once the offering is complete, the Ice Lord shall show these Stormpike dogs the full wrath of the Frostwolf Clan!"}
Q[6804]={d="一支水元素侦查部队被派往洛丹伦的东瘟疫之地，但是那里的瘟疫把它们感染并扭曲了。我们水元素不允许这样的事情破坏我们的纯洁性！\n\n拿上这个瓶子，它里面装着的是海神之水。如果将它用在被感染的水元素身上，海神之水就会和它们身体中的毒素抗争，并治愈它们！但是水元素体内发生的争斗也会使它们变得非常疯狂。\n\n打败这些疯狂的水元素，然后把它们的缚灵护腕交给我。",dEN="A force of elemental scouts was sent to the eastern plaguelands of Lordaeron, and the disease of that place twisted and infected them. The Waterlords cannot allow this affront to our purity!\n\nTake this vial. In it is a quantity of one aspect of Neptulon. If used on the plagued elementals it will fight the poison within their bodies and cure them! But their inner conflict will drive them into a surging madness.\n\nDefeat the discordant surges and bring me their bracers of binding.",o="对东瘟疫之地的被感染的水元素使用海神之水。把12副不谐护腕和海神之水交给艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵。",oEN="Use the Aspect of Neptulon on poisoned elementals of Eastern Plaguelands. Bring 12 Discordant Bracers and the Aspect of Neptulon to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",p="你拿到那些护腕了吗？",pEN="Do you have the bracers?",c="你干得很好，$c。那些堕落的水元素对于所有的水体都是一种玷污。我们的力量来自于我们的纯洁性，如果我们要赢得这场战争，我们就必须保持强盛。",cEN="You have done well, <class>. The corrupted elementals you cured were an outrage to all bodies of water. Our strength lies in our purity and if we are to win our war with the others, we must remain strong."}
Q[6805]={d="我们水元素一直在与其它下等的元素生物交战。如果你在这场纷争中站在我们这一边，就拿出点证明来！\n\n在最南端的希利苏斯沙漠，空气元素和地元素的仆从聚集在一处被称作水晶谷的地方。它们保卫着某些强大的物品，不让你们这些凡人接触它们。尽管我不知道那些元素生物为什么要这样做，但我希望挫败他们。\n\n到希利苏斯的水晶谷去，击败我们的敌人，然后回到我这儿来。",dEN="We, the elementals of water, wage war with those beings of the lesser elements. If you are truly our ally in this conflict, then show me your conviction!\n\nFar to the south, in the desert land of Silithus, the servants of air and earth scurry in a corner of rock named the Crystal Vale. They protect items of power from smaller beings, mortals, and although I do not know why they do this, I wish to foil their efforts.\n\nGo to the Crystal Vale in Silithus and defeat our enemies, then return to me.",o="杀死15个灰尘风暴和15个沙漠奔行者，然后回到艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵那儿。",oEN="Kill 15 Dust Stormers and 15 Desert Rumblers and then return to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",p="胆怯不是我们所尊崇的品德，$c。去希利苏斯证明自己的勇敢吧。",pEN="Cowardice is not a thing we hold in regard, <class>. Go to Silithus and prove your bravery.",c="你证明了自己的勇敢，也证明了你对我们的价值。或许将来我还会交给你新的任务，更适合水元素的忠诚盟友的任务。",cEN="Your bravery is proven, as is your worth to us. Perhaps I may have future tasks for you, tasks more befitting a valued ally of the Waterlords."}
Q[6821]={d="你已经证明了自己可以击败我们的敌人，并能为水元素执行更为艰巨的任务。但是到目前为止，你所面对的敌人并不算强大……如果面对强敌，你还能获胜吗？\n\n这就是你的新任务。\n\n兽人在黑石塔的高处捕获了一个火焰元素的仆从——烈焰卫士艾博希尔。找到关押他的地方，杀死看守着他的兽人，然后杀死艾博希尔。把他的眼珠交给我，以此来证明你的价值。",dEN="You have shown me that you can defeat our enemies and perform missions to further the cause of the Waterlords. But until now you have only faced lesser foes... if pitted against a powerful enemy, can you prevail?\n\nThat is your new task.\n\nHigh up in Blackrock Spire the orcs have captured a servant of fire, the Pyroguard Emberseer. Find his place of imprisonment, slay his captors, and then slay the emberseer. Bring me his eye and it will show me your worth.",o="将艾博希尔之眼交给艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵。",oEN="Bring the Eye of the Emberseer to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",p="你把眼睛带来了吗，？你有胆量进入黑石塔吗？",pEN="Do you have the Eye, <class>? Do you have the strength to enter Blackrock Spire?",c="啊，看来你确实有实力。而且你也有头脑，因为单靠蛮力可对付不了黑石塔。\n\n确实，，你也许还能证明自己是我们的得力盟友……",cEN="Ah, so you do have the strength. And you have the cunning as well, for Blackrock Spire is more than a match for brute strength alone.\n\nIndeed <name>, you may yet prove a valued ally to us..."}
Q[6822]={d="$n，也许现在已经到了派给你一项真正的考验的时候了。你准备好了吗？\n\n在黑石深渊的底部有一条通往熔火之心的小径。那里是我们死敌的要塞，由这个世上最强大的火焰奴仆把守着。\n\n到熔火之心去，$n。让我看到你拥有足以打败他们的力量和意志。\n\n如果你有朋友和盟军，就召集他们。没有一支强大的军队，就别想进入熔火之心并活着出来。",dEN="<name>, perhaps it is time to give you a real test. Are you ready?\n\nAt the bottom of Blackrock Depths is a passage to the Molten Core. This is a stronghold of our enemy, held by the most powerful servants of fire on this world.\n\nGo to the Molten Core, <name>. Show me you have the strength and the will to defeat what you find there.\n\nAnd if you have allies among your people, then rally them. Nothing short of an army can hope to enter the Molten Core and live.",o="杀死一个火焰之王、一个熔岩巨人、一个上古熔火恶犬和一个熔岩奔腾者，然后回到艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵那里。",oEN="Kill 1 Fire Lord, 1 Molten Giant, 1 Ancient Core Hound and 1 Lava Surger, then return to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",p="胜利在熔火之心向你招手，$n。",pEN="Your success in the Molten Core awaits, <name>.",c="你已经做到了大多数$r都认为是绝无可能的事。你挑战了熔火之心中的敌人，并且获得了胜利！\n\n对于如此渺小的生物来说，你所拥有的力量非常惊人。\n\n也许有一天，我们水元素和你们$r将结成真正同生共死的盟约。",cEN="You have done what most of your kind would think impossible. You have faced the beings of the Molten Core, and triumphed!\n\nFor so small a creature, you have displayed great resource.\n\nSome day, perhaps we might strike a true allegiance between your kind and the Waterlords."}
Q[6823]={d="如果你真的想要与我们结盟，那我邀请你对我们的敌人——空气元素、土元素和火元素——发动战争。每杀死他们的一个成员，都会削弱他们在这个世界上的势力，并进一步证明你对我们事业的忠诚。\n\n这场战役肯定会持续很长时间，但是如果你坚持下去，那么你就将得到至高的荣誉。",dEN="If you truly wish an allegiance with us, then I invite you to wage war on our foes, the servants of air and earth and fire. Each defeat you heap upon them will weaken their foothold here, and further prove your adherence to our cause.\n\nThe campaign will be long, but if you persevere then your glory and honor will be great.",o="在海达希亚水元素中达到被尊敬的声望，然后与艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Earn an Honored faction with the Hydraxian Waterlords, then talk to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",c="你抗击敌人的功绩响彻水元素的世界，$n。有些水元素认为你不可能赢得这样的战斗，但你却取得了伟大的成就。你也赢得了我们的尊敬，以及无比丰厚的奖励。",cEN="Your exploits against our enemies ring through the chambers of the Waterlords, <name>. It was thought by some that your form is too small and fragile to fight in our war, but you have made great gains. You have earned respect among us, an unbelievable feat."}
Q[6824]={d="$n，你的贡献对我们来说是无价的，我们不愿意损失你这样一个有用的人才，但是为了最后一个任务，也只能勉强为之了。\n\n如果你成功了，战争的天平将朝着对我们有利的方向发展……它值得你为之冒险。\n\n我们要将盘踞在熔火之心的几个火元素的头目干掉：鲁西弗隆，萨弗隆，基赫纳斯和沙斯拉尔。杀了他们，把他们的手给我拿来！\n\n这项任务需要你尽全力而为之，$n，如果你能够成功的话，火元素将遭受重大的打击。",dEN="<name>, your service is of great value to us, so we are reluctant to send you on this last mission for we do not want to lose such a useful agent.\n\nBut its success would further our war efforts tremendously and... it was deemed worth risking you.\n\nWe want these captains in the Molten Core destroyed: Lucifron, Sulfuron, Gehennas and Shazzrah. Kill them and bring me their hands!\n\nThis task will take every resource you possess, <name>, but if can do it then the Firelords will be dealt a terrible blow.",o="将鲁西弗隆之手、萨弗隆之手、基赫纳斯之手和沙斯拉尔之手交给艾萨拉的海达克西斯公爵。",oEN="Bring the Hands of Lucifron, Sulfuron, Gehennas and Shazzrah to Duke Hydraxis in Azshara.",p="你打败鲁西弗隆和其它的家伙了吗，$n？你拿到他们的手了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated Lucifron and the others, <name>? Do you have the hands of the enemy?",c="你把那些火焰首领都干掉了！要不是了解你的本事，我简直不敢相信。\n\n$n，你以往的战绩数不胜数，但这最后一桩壮举将在水元素领主的大厅中被传颂。你的名字有一天也许会成为我们的传说。\n\n再来和我谈谈，。我也许还有别的任务……",cEN="You have the hands! You defeated the fire captains! I would not have thought it possible, had I not known you and what you are capable of.\n\n<name>, your exploits are without number, but word of this last feat will send waves among the Waterlords. Your name may one day be legend to us.\n\nSpeak with me again, <name>. I may have yet another task..."}
Q[6825]={p="我们必须装备起新的战争坐骑编队，$r！我的骑兵已准备就绪，要对中央战场发起一次打击；但首先，我得吊起它们的胃口——为这次突袭做好准备。\n\n我需要足以喂饱一支编队的雷矛士兵血肉！好几百磅！你肯定能办到，对吧？快去吧！",pEN="We must prepare the new fleet of War Riders, <race>! My riders are set to make a strike on the central battlefield; but first, I must wet their appetites - preparing them for the assault.\n\nI need enough Stormpike Soldier Flesh to feed a fleet! Hundreds of pounds! Surely you can handle that, yes? Get going!",c="我们需要更多的肉来喂养部队，这将不断消耗敌人的实力。\n\n空军已经准备完毕了！",cEN="The fleet feeds on their flesh. It consumes the enemy.\n\nFlight is imminent!"}
Q[6826]={p="你工作得很努力，$n，但是我们只是刚刚开始而已！\n\n我的驭风者部队要在吃饱之后才能对敌人发起突袭！\n\n我的部队在我们的空军中实力排名第二，它们将对敌人最强的部队发起进攻。因此它们也需要优质的食物，从雷矛士官那里抢夺他们随身携带的生肉吧。\n\n快点出发，勇士！",pEN="You've worked hard, <name>, but we have only just begun!\n\nMy War Riders must taste in the flesh of their targets. This will ensure a surgical strike against our enemies!\n\nMy fleet is the second most powerful in our air command. Thusly, they will strike at the more powerful of our adversaries. For this, then, they need the flesh of the Stormpike Lieutenants.\n\nMake haste, soldier!",c="更多的肉！更多的肉！多带点肉回来，那我的部队马上就能出发了！",cEN="More! More! Bring more for they are soon to be ready!"}
Q[6827]={p="我曾经被终日锁在一个矮小的洞穴里，我要报仇！\n\n我们必须仔细计划一下。\n\n首先，我的驭风者必须吃到最优质的食物，才能储备精力以待发起攻击。从雷矛指挥官那里抢一些生肉来喂养它们。不幸的是，那些可恶的家伙都躲在最后方！显然，你面临的是一个艰巨的任务。",pEN="I was locked up in a dwarven hellhole for days. You better believe I want revenge!\n\nWe must plan carefully.\n\nFirst, my war riders need targets to gun for - high priority targets. I'm going to need to feed them the flesh of Stormpike Commanders. Unfortunately, those little buggers are entrenched deep behind enemy lines! You've definitely got your work cut out for you.",c="还不够！这些肉对于一个新手来说还差不多，但是你，$n？再努力一些，士兵！快点行动！我们需要更多的肉！",cEN="Not enough! I would expect this level of work from an initiate, but you, <name>? Come on, soldier! HUSTLE! More flesh is needed!"}
Q[6844]={d="我们有很多事情要做，但是我认为把这个带回议会进行分析是最关键的。相信我，如果这团黏呼呼的东西里面是一本日记的话，议会将最终打开通往过去的窗口！\n\n把这个交给永夜港议会的档案管理员阿姆伯尔，他是个才华横溢的人，虽然有些疯疯癫癫，但是真的非常能干！阿姆伯尔曾补救许多远比这本书更破旧的典籍，他肯定可以胜任这个工作。。",dEN="There's plenty to do here still, but I think taking this back to the Circle for analysis is key. Trust me - the work will still be here once this is all said and done. If it's a journal inside this sticky chitin, then the Circle would finally have a window into the past!\n\nTake this to the Circle's archivist in Nighthaven. His name is Umber, and the man's brilliant. Touched, sure, but brilliant nonetheless! Umber's salvaged tomes in far worse shape than this. If it can be saved, he can do it.",o="将异种蝎粘液包裹的物体交给月光林地永夜港的阿姆伯尔，他是塞纳里奥议会的档案管理员。",oEN="Take the Encrusted Silithid Object to Umber - the Cenarion Circle's archivist - in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",p="哎呀，你好啊！嗯……\n\n我跟你说实话吧，$g朋友:朋友;……你身上味儿有点重。可以说，有点冲。我不是在人身攻击你。我只是说……以后从战场回来，也许你该稍微梳洗一下。这样你给人的第一印象会好得多！\n\n总之……我能为你做点什么？",pEN="Why, hello there! Hrmm...\n\nLet me be a little honest with you, friend... you smell a bit ripe. Whiffy, one might say. Now I'm not making a personal assailment of your being. I'm just saying... in the future, you may want to freshen up a little after coming in from the field. It will make those first impressions a little more positively impressionable!\n\nAnyhoo... what can I do for you?",c="哦，瞧瞧，这是什么？我猜是书吧……我可以尝试补好剥落的部分。\n\n是莱耶要你从希利苏斯跑到我这儿来的？我听到一些零零碎碎的谣言，说是有很恐怖的东西在那里出没。结合我不喜欢跟虫子打交道的个性，你就能明白我为什么要待在这里整天对付这些书了！",cEN="Well great monkey toads! What have you got here? It's sort of book shaped, I guess... I'll try crack this shell on it.\n\nLayo sent you to me from Silithus? I've only heard very hushed rumblings - which I guess aren't all that hushed when you think about it - about the horrors that are going on out there. Couple that with my lack of pleasure for anything bug-like, and you've got the recipe for me needing to stay here with the books!"}
Q[6845]={d="无论如何，如果你想要了解这儿的情况的话……就应该尽快找我核实。一旦我查明了真相，而且这确实是一本书的话，那么我会很高兴与你分享这里面的知识。\n\n同时，我也会通知月光林地的拉比恩，他肯定想要知道你做出了多么疯狂的事情。别让他等太久，$n……除非你想被扔到蜂蜜中。\n\n相信我，这样的事儿不是没发生过。",dEN="Anyway, you should check back with me relatively soon... that is if you want to know what was in here. As soon as I find out what it is, and if it's indeed a book, I'd be happy to share that information with you.\n\nIn the meantime, I'd check in with the den mother of this little bear camp, Rabine. No doubt he'll want to know what crazy antics you've been up to. Never leave the den mother waiting, <name>... that is, unless you want to be doused in honey.\n\nIt's happened, trust me.",o="与月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·萨图纳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",c="啊，$n——我正在等你来呢，很高兴看到你一切安好。\n\n我接到消息说你要回来了，我想亲自表达塞纳里奥议会对你的感激之情。毫无疑问，希利苏斯还有许多秘密有待揭示，你交给阿姆伯尔的东西一定有着非常重要的价值。请收下这个作为我们给你的回报。\n\n谢谢你，慷慨的$c。",cEN="Ah, <name> - I had hoped you would stop by. I am glad to see you well.\n\nI received notice you would be coming in from the field, and I wanted to personally express the Cenarion Circle's gratitude for the assistance you've given us thus far. No doubt there are more secrets to uncover from Silithus; your delivery to Umber should prove most interesting once uncovered. Please, accept this as a token of our continued appreciation for your aid.\n\nThank you, generous <class>."}
Q[6846]={p="我的军队已经整装待发，准备攻击。只要诺雷格·雷矛中尉一声令下，我们就会发起冲锋！",pEN="My troops are supplied and ready to assault. We just need orders from Noreg Stormpike and I'll send them into the fray!",c="啊，命令下来了！他们说我可以随时发动攻击，那么……就现在吧！",cEN="Ah, the orders! They say I'm to assault at will, and my will says... now!"}
Q[6847]={d="你在奥特兰克中心的这场战争对辛迪加来说毫无意义，$c。我们会一如既往：等到一个明确的胜利者从这疯狂的灰烬中站起，然后发动致命一击。\n\n不过，我们来这里并不是为了这个。全视之眼已经失落——被这一带的冬斧巨魔夺走了。\n\n把那只眼睛夺回来，我们的效力就归你所有——在你这一方还能支撑多久就算多久。\n\n拿到眼睛之后回来见我，好让我检视你。\n\n<el maestro Ryson esboza una sonrisa>",dEN="Your war in the heart of Alterac means nothing to the Syndicate, <class>. We will do as we have always done: Wait until a clear victor rises from the ashes and rubble of this madness and then strike.\n\nThat, however, is not why we are here now. The All Seeing Eye has been lost - taken by the Winterax trolls of the region.\n\nRecover the Eye and our services shall be yours - for whatever time remains for your side.\n\nReturn to me once you acquire the eye so that I may examine you.\n\n<Master Ryson grins.>",o="从冬斧洞穴中夺回莱森主人的全视之眼，把它还给莱森主人。\n\n但你要小心，据说莱森主人的全视之眼带着可怕的诅咒！",oEN="Recover Master Ryson's All Seeing Eye from the Winterax caves and return it to Master Ryson.\n\nBe warned, it is said that Master Ryson's All Seeing Eye carries with it a terrible curse!"}
Q[6848]={d="你在奥特兰克中心的这场战争对辛迪加来说毫无意义，$c。我们会一如既往：等到一个明确的胜利者从这疯狂的灰烬中站起，然后发动致命一击。\n\n不过，我们来这里并不是为了这个。全视之眼已经失落——被这一带的冬斧巨魔夺走了。\n\n把那只眼睛夺回来，我们的效力就归你所有——在你这一方还能支撑多久就算多久。\n\n拿到眼睛之后回来见我，好让我检视你。\n\n<el maestro Ryson esboza una sonrisa>",dEN="Your war in the heart of Alterac means nothing to the Syndicate, <class>. We will do as we have always done: Wait until a clear victor rises from the ashes and rubble of this madness and then strike.\n\nThat, however, is not why we are here now. The All Seeing Eye has been lost - taken by the Winterax trolls of the region.\n\nRecover the Eye and our services shall be yours - for whatever time remains for your side.\n\nReturn to me once you acquire the eye so that I may examine you.\n\n<Master Ryson grins.>",o="从冬斧洞穴中夺回莱森主人的全视之眼，把它还给莱森主人。\n\n但你要小心，据说莱森主人的全视之眼带着可怕的诅咒！",oEN="Recover Master Ryson's All Seeing Eye from the Winterax caves and return it to Master Ryson.\n\nBe warned, it is said that Master Ryson's All Seeing Eye carries with it a terrible curse!"}
Q[6861]={d="我和你一样急着试用我的便携伐木机，$r，但在制造它之前，我需要材料——大量的材料！\n\n确切地说，我需要堆积如山的瑟银、秘银和铁。每台还需要一把蒸汽锯。你得去伐木场弄到它们。\n\n我在这里四处打听的时候（被抓之前），注意到雷矛伐木场里堆着一堆蒸汽锯。",dEN="I'm as anxious as you are to try out my portable shredder unit, <race>, but before I can make the kit, I'm going to need materials - lots of materials!\n\nTo be exact, I'm going to need a mountain of thorium, mithril, and iron. I will also need one steamsaw per unit. You'll have to get those at the lumber mill.\n\nWhen I was nosing around in here (before my capture) I noticed a pile of steamsaws at the Stormpike lumber camp.",o="总工程师辛菲兹莱克斯要你把以下物品带给他：\n\n*30 块瑟银锭。\n\n*50 块秘银锭。\n\n*75 块铁锭。\n\n*1 把蒸汽锯。|n",oEN="Master Engineer Zinfizzlex wants you to bring him the following:\n\n*30 Thorium Bars.\n\n*50 Mithril Bars.\n\n*75 Iron bars.\n\n*1 Steamsaw."}
Q[6862]={d="我和你一样急着试用我的便携伐木机，$r，但在制造它之前，我需要材料——大量的材料！\n\n确切地说，我需要堆积如山的瑟银、秘银和铁。每台还需要一把蒸汽锯。你得去伐木场弄到它们。\n\n我在这里四处打听的时候（被抓之前），注意到霜狼伐木场里堆着一堆蒸汽锯。",dEN="I'm as anxious as you are to try out my portable shredder unit, <race>, but before I can make the kit, I'm going to need materials - lots of materials!\n\nTo be exact, I'm going to need a mountain of thorium, mithril, and iron. I will also need one steamsaw per unit. You'll have to get those at the lumber mill.\n\nWhen I was nosing around in here (before my capture) I noticed a pile of steamsaws at the Frostwolf lumber camp.",o="总工程师辛菲兹莱克斯要你把以下物品带给他：\n\n*30 块瑟银锭。\n\n*50 块秘银锭。\n\n*75 块铁锭。\n\n*1 把蒸汽锯。|n",oEN="Master Engineer Zinfizzlex wants you to bring him the following:\n\n*30 Thorium Bars.\n\n*50 Mithril Bars.\n\n*75 Iron bars.\n\n*1 Steamsaw."}
Q[6881]={p="霜狼氏族被一种堕落的元素能量保护着。如果我们不加以注意的话，他们的萨满必然会利用这种力量来毁掉我们。\n\n这种能量已经不是议会可以控制的了！我们必须找到伊弗斯，寻求他的帮助。\n\n霜狼氏族的战士身上带着一种名叫暴风水晶的符咒，我们可以用这些符咒来召唤伊弗斯。快去拿来那些水晶吧，$n！",pEN="The Frostwolf Clan is protected by a taint of elemental energy. Their shaman meddle in powers that will surely destroy us all if left unchecked.\n\nThe damage has grown too great for the Circle to control! Ivus must be called to our aid.\n\nThe Frostwolf soldiers carry elemental charms called storm crystals. We can use the charms to conjure Ivus. Venture forth and claim the crystals, <name>!",c="干得好，$n，但是我们还需要更多的水晶。森林之王是我们对抗堕落力量的关键！",cEN="Well done, <name>. I will use the power of this charm to augment the magic that has already been gathered. When enough power has been amassed, I shall focus the collected energies and call upon the Forest Lord to aid our cause."}
Q[6901]={p="我的部队已经补给完毕，随时准备发起进攻。只等亚兹拉·血嚎中士下达命令，我就会把他们投入战斗！",pEN="My troops are supplied and ready to assault. We just need orders from Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl and I'll send them into the fray!",c="一切准备就绪！现在我会让那些联盟的蠢货知道闯入奥特兰克山谷是个多么严重的错误！",cEN="It's about time! Now we can show the Alliance their folly in coming to Alterac Valley!"}
Q[6921]={d="暮光之锤已经进驻黑深渊的月神殿废墟。他们的存在只会迫使元素与我们为敌。如果放任不管，这片地区就会永远落入他们手中。\n\n$n，进入黑深渊，找到废墟中的深渊之石；它应该就在不远的水中。里面有一枚深渊核心——一个装置，若正确解读，就能叙述所有元素活动的历史。如果我拿到它，我和大地之环也许能做点什么来阻止他们！",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer has moved into the Moonshrine Ruins of Blackfathom Deeps. Their presence can only serve to coerce the elements into working against us. If left unchecked, this region will be theirs for good.\n\n<name>, go into Blackfathom and find the ruin's fathom stone; it should be somewhere close in the water. In it is a fathom core - a device that when properly read it will relate a history of all elemental activity. If I have it, I and the Earthen Ring can maybe do something to stop them!",o="把深渊之核交给灰谷佐拉姆加前哨站里的耶努萨克雷。",oEN="Bring the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",p="你找到深渊之核了吗？没有它的话，我们就无法得知暮光之锤究竟在那里做什么。",pEN="Have you been successful in locating the fathom core? Without it we'll have no idea what the Twilight's Hammer is exactly up to down there.",c="这正是我需要的东西！深渊之核是个非常完美的资讯源，我可以从中获取许多资讯。不管暮光之锤在干什么——反正肯定不会是什么好事情——我和我的同事都会努力找出真相。\n\n你干得很好，大地之环非常感谢你对我们的帮助。同时，你也帮助了整个部落，因此你应该感到光荣。",cEN="This is exactly what I need! A fathom core is an incredible well of information that we will be able to draw much good from. Whatever the Twilight's Hammer is up to in there - and believe me when I say it is no good - my comrades and I will now uncover.\n\nYou've done well here today; the Earthen Ring looks upon you warmly for assisting us. You've also helped the Horde as a whole, and for that you should be proud."}
Q[6922]={d="被击败的水元素留下了一个奇怪的水球，你猜想这东西可能是为水元素提供能量的。一股看起来就很恶心的水流在球体内翻腾喷溅，而球体本身似乎不受任何自然力的影响。\n\n如果说有人能对这个东西有所了解，那就只能是陶土议会的耶努萨克雷了。他就在灰谷的佐拉姆加前哨站里。",dEN="The defeated water elemental has left behind a strange water globe. You surmise that the object somehow fed the beast energy. Inside the globe, a putrid-looking form of water sloshes about. The globe itself seems impervious to any sort of physical force.\n\nIf anyone can make any sense of this item, it would be Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring. He is located at the Horde's Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",o="把奇怪的水球交给灰谷佐拉姆加前哨站的耶努萨克雷。",oEN="Bring the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",p="啊，又见面了，$n。我正在像往常一样观察海洋的波涛。什么风把你吹到这里来了？",pEN="Ah, hello again <name>. I was just reading the waves the sea, much like I always do. What brings you to the outpost?",c="这……这真是一个大发现，$n。\n\n你说你是从黑暗深渊的阿奎尼斯男爵那里得到这东西的？阿奎尼斯男爵一直以来都被认为是腐败的元素生物，这个球体将证明到底是什么腐蚀了它。如果最终证明是暮光之锤搞的鬼，那么我一点也不会感到吃惊，但是我们的研究还是可以搞清楚他们是怎么做的。\n\n感谢你把这个球体交给我，请接受大地之环最诚挚的敬意。",cEN="This... this is quite the find, <name>.\n\nYou acquired this from Baron Aquanis in Blackfathom, you say? Baron Aquanis has long been thought of as a corrupted elemental power; this globe will prove what exactly had corrupted him. While it would be no surprise if it turned out to be the Twilight's Hammer, our studies will also show how they did it as well.\n\nYou did well in bringing this to me. Please - take this, along with the Earthen Ring's warmest regards."}
Q[6941]={p="你必须去对付守卫前线的部落精英士兵！我现在命令你去削弱那些绿皮蛮子的力量，把他们的中尉和军团士兵的勋章给我拿来。当我拿到足够的勋章时，我会命令开始对他们进行空中打击的。",pEN="The elite Frostwolf units that guard the lines must be dealt with, soldier! I'm tasking you with thinning out that herd of savages. Return to me with medals from their lieutenants and legionnaires. When I feel that enough of the riff-raff has been dealt with, I'll deploy the air strike.",c="空袭马上准备就绪。继续努力吧！",cEN="The flight will be ready soon. Continue your efforts!"}
Q[6942]={p="我的狮鹫应该在前线作战，但是在那里的敌人被削弱之前，它们是无法发动攻击的。\n\n部落的战士胸前挂着代表荣誉的勋章勇猛冲锋，而你要做的就是从他们腐烂的尸体上把勋章拿下来，并把它们交给我。\n\n只要敌人在前线的力量受到足够的打击，我就会发出命令进行空袭！我们将从空中给敌人造成致命的创伤！",pEN="My gryphons are poised to strike at the front lines but cannot make the attack until the lines are thinned out.\n\nThe Frostwolf warriors charged with holding the front lines wear medals of service proudly upon their chests. Rip those medals off their rotten corpses and bring them back here.\n\nOnce the front line is sufficiently thinned out, I will make the call to air! Death from above!",c="继续带勋章回来，士兵！狮鹫空袭马上就要准备好了！",cEN="Keep em coming, soldier! The Aerie gryphons will be ready to strike in no time at all!"}
Q[6943]={p="它们的士气很低，战士。自从我们上次对部落的空中打击失败之后，它们就拒绝再次飞行！你必须鼓舞它们的士气。\n\n回到战场并攻击部落的核心力量，杀死他们的指挥官和卫兵。尽可能带回更多的勋章！我向你保证，当我的狮鹫看到这些战利品并嗅到敌人的鲜血时，它们就会再次起飞！现在就出发吧！",pEN="Their spirits are low, soldier. After our last failed air strike against the Horde, they refuse to fly! It is up to you to bolster their morale.\n\nReturn to the battlefield and strike at the heart of the Frostwolf's command. Take down their commanders and guardians. Return to me with as many of their medals as you can stuff in your pack! I promise you, when my gryphons see the bounty and smell the blood of our enemies, they will fly again! Go now!",c="你看到了吗？看看它们，士兵！它们正在绕回来……很快，伊奇曼的飞行编队将再次打击山谷的心脏！雷矛将统治天空！",cEN="Can you see it? Look at them, soldier! They're coming around... Soon, Ichman's flight will once again strike at the heart of the valley! Stormpike will rule the skies!"}
Q[6961]={d="冬幕节快乐，我的朋友！你一定要去冬天爷爷打个招呼！如果你今年表现的不错的话，你会在冬幕节那天收到一份很棒的礼物。你一定要告诉冬天爷爷你今年想要什么！\n\n另外，记得多买些好东西来给那些今年表现得好的人。我们这里货物齐全。各种货物一应俱全——这是Smokywood Pastures精心为您准备的货物！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!\n\nAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",o="和冬天爷爷谈谈；他在奥格瑞玛Smokywood Pastures商人区旁边。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.",c="呵呵，你好。我是冬天爷爷，我谨代表烟林牧场的友善人们……“从我们的农场新鲜直达您的餐盘，这就是烟林牧场的健康美味”……祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n如果你今年表现良好，也许就会收到烟林牧场送给你的冬幕节礼物。呼啦。\"\"",cEN="Ho ho hello. I am Greatfather Winter, and I - courtesy of the fine folks of Smokywood Pastures... \"Fresh from our farm to your plate, it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness\" - would like to wish you a fantastic Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nIf you've been good this year, maybe you will receive treats from Smokywood Pastures as your treat for the Feast of Winter Veil. Huzzah."}
Q[6962]={d="嘿，你能帮冬天爷爷一个忙吗，嗯，小$g男孩:女孩;？\n\n我不是想没完没了地用第三人称谈论自己，但冬天爷爷忙了一整天，也该犒劳一下自己了。几块姜饼，再配上一杯冰镇牛奶，那真是再好不过了。想想你能不能做冬天爷爷的$g好朋友:好朋友;，去给我拿点吃的来？",dEN="Hey, can you do Greatfather Winter a favor, um, little <boy /girl>?\n\nNot to needlessly talk about myself in the third person, but Greatfather Winter has been at this all day and he could use a treat himself. Some gingerbread cookies and ice cold milk to wash them down with would really hit the spot. Think you could be a friend to the Greatfather and fetch some for me?",o="将5个小姜饼和一杯冰镇牛奶交给奥格瑞玛的冬天爷爷。",oEN="Bring 5 Gingerbread Cookies and an Ice Cold Milk to Greatfather Winter in Orgrimmar.",p="一天到晚给别人礼物让我自己也想要礼物了。嗯……我要姜饼和牛奶……",pEN="All this talk of treats has given me a hankering for some myself. Mmmm... gingerbread cookies and milk...",c="你对冬天爷爷真是太好了，$n。祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n这些小东西……就当作给你的奖励吧。",cEN="You're quite the helper to ol' Greatfather Winter there, <name>. Have a great Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nHere's a little something... you know, for the effort."}
Q[6963]={d="听着……我不想破坏了节日的美好气氛，但是烟林牧场需要帮助——需要你这样的冒险家。\n\n我们弄丢了节日所需的重要礼品，现在连我们派去寻找礼品的烟林牧场密探也不见了！请帮帮忙——礼品是在奥特兰克山脉附近丢失的，我们派出的密探也在那儿。\n\n看看礼品和密探是否都安然无恙吧！",dEN="Listen... not to shatter the magic of the season here, but Smokywood Pastures could use some assistance - the kind you adventuring types are known to give.\n\nWe're missing an important shipment of treats that was restocking us for the season, and now we're missing the agent of Smokywood Pastures that we sent out to the field to find it! Please - the shipment was last reported in the Alterac Mountains, and that's where our man went to look for it.\n\nSee if both are out there, safe and sound!",o="前往奥特兰克山脉雪域寻找失踪的烟林牧场密探。",oEN="Locate the Smokywood Pastures investigator that has gone missing in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",c="你——你——你可以听到我说话！感——感——感谢老天！\n\n我不是真的雪——雪——雪人，我的名字叫萨克斯，我为奥格瑞玛的烟熏牧场工——工——工作……我被派——派——派到这里来找寻遗失的包裹时被不明生——生——生物攻击了！\n\n好——好——好冷啊……",cEN="Y-y-you can h-h-hear me! Thank the b-b-bottom line!\n\nI'm not really a s-s-snowman - my n-n-name is Sacks, and I w-w-work for the Orgrimmar b-b-branch of Smokywood Pastures... I g-g-got sent out here to look for a m-m-missing package, when I was attacked by a c-c-creature I have never seen b-b-before!\n\nSo v-v-very cold..."}
Q[6964]={d="礼物，礼物，礼物……啊，呸！\n\n这些地精玷污了冬幕节的真正含义。这是个新旧更替的时节；大地在冬天爷爷降下的皑皑白雪下沉睡，冬天爷爷可不是那个身着红衣装模作样的傻子！\n\n如果你想亲自了解冬幕节，就去询问探险者协会的史学家卡尼克吧。有人关心历史胜过关心礼物，我想他一定会很惊讶的。",dEN="Gifts, treats, presents... bah, I say!\n\nThose goblins pollute the true meaning of this season - the Feast of Winter Veil. This is a time of renewal; the land slumbers under a blanket of snow brought forth by Greatfather Winter, who is NOT the bumbling fool over there in the red suit!\n\nIf you're interested in learning what the Feast is all about for yourself, ask Sagorne Creststrider. I'm sure he'll be surprised that someone cares about history rather than getting presents.",o="与奥格瑞玛智慧谷中的萨格尼谈谈关于冬幕节的情况。",oEN="Speak with Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom of Orgrimmar about the Feast of Winter Veil.",c="你说冬幕节？啊，在过去的岁月中，这个节日对我们牛头人代表着重大的意义。然而，现在这个在万物复苏的季节中具有深远历史意义的节日却变成了帮忙促销糖果和礼物的节日。\n\n难怪法穆德对此耿耿于怀。他和别的牛头人把我们的过去视为战争的标志。虽然我认为适当的庆祝也是需要的，但是记住这个节日的源起应该也是很重要的。",cEN="The Feast of Winter Veil, you say? Alas, in times past it held a more substantial meaning to us tauren. Nowadays, it seems as though others have turned the legend of this season of renewal into something that helps to sell candies and presents.\n\nIt's no surprise that Furmund is bitter about that sort of change. He and other tauren like him cling to our past like a banner of war. While I think a little celebration is always good, it is important to remember the origins of the Feast."}
Q[6981]={d="这块碎片透出异样的绿色光芒，虽然它完全是一块固体，但是却让人感觉好像有一股烟从碎片中冒出来。你情不自禁地注视着这块水晶的深处，这时你突然觉得这其中必定包含着许多曲折的故事。\n\n也许你应该去棘齿城看看那里有没有人知道这块碎片的来历。",dEN="The shard is a brilliant green, and although solid, what looks like smoke swirls just below the surface. You can't help staring into the depths of the crystal; at the same time, you know there is something very disturbing about it.\n\nMaybe you should see if anyone in Ratchet can tell you more about this strange shard.",o="前往棘齿城，找一个能告诉你更多关于那块闪光碎片的事情的人。\n\n然后按指示把碎片交出去。",oEN="Travel to Ratchet to find someone(Sputtervalve) that can tell you more about the glowing shard.\n\nThen, deliver the shard as you are directed.",p="你好啊，风尘仆仆的$r。我可以为你做些什么吗？",pEN="Hello, <race>. What can I do for you?",c="哦……我从来没有见过这种东西……",cEN="Oh... I have never seen anything like this..."}
Q[6982]={d="冷齿矿洞是部落的物资储存点。他们的军粮实在不是我们能吃下去的东西，但是他们的武器和护甲却很棒！在眼下这种物资十分短缺的时候，我们要利用一切可以利用的东西！\n\n进入冷齿矿洞，帮我把他们的补给品拿回来。那些补给品可以帮助联盟保持战斗力，同时也削弱了部落。\n\n祝你好运，$n。那座矿洞在南边很远的地方，就在部落领地的深处。",dEN="The Coldtooth mine is a storage depot for the Horde. I can't stomach the food they give their troops, and the state of their arms and armor is atrocious! But... in times like these when supplies are so important, we can use what they have.\n\nEnter the Coldtooth mine and bring me back their supplies. That will help keep the Alliance in fighting shape, and remove much needed equipment from the Horde's warriors.\n\nGood luck, <name>. The mine is to the distant south, deep in Horde territory.",o="把10份冷齿矿洞补给品交给丹巴达尔的联盟军需官。",oEN="Bring 10 Coldtooth Supplies to the Alliance Quartermaster in Dun Baldar.",p="你去过部落领地中的冷齿矿洞了吗，$n？你有没有抢到他们的补给品？",pEN="Have you been to the Coldtooth mine, <name>? Do you have the supplies I asked for?",c="啊，你拿到了。干得好，$n！这些补给在那座黑漆漆的矿洞里放得太久，有点发霉了，不过我们照样能用上。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你的所作所为对我们维持战斗力至关重要。",cEN="Ah, you got them. Good work, <name>! These supplies are a little musty from sitting in that dark mine for so long, but we'll make use of them nonetheless.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your deeds are vital to the maintenance of our fighting forces."}
Q[6983]={d="一个叫“可憎的格林奇”的家伙偷走了我们那批礼物，$n。小心点！他很恶毒，还手下有一帮绿色侏儒！\n\n对付他你需要帮手。据说他把我们的礼物和我们心爱的驯鹿梅森都关在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的狭长洞穴里！找到那些礼物，$n，在节日被毁、奥格瑞玛的孩子们失望之前把它们带回来！\"\"",dEN="A c-c-creature called \"The Abominable Greench\" is the one w-w-who stole our shipment of t-t-treats, <name>. Be c-c-careful though! He is t-t-the one who turned me into this s-s-snowy mess!\n\nYou're g-g-gonna need some help in f-f-facing him. I've seen him w-w-wander all around where the y-y-yeti are; he's s-s-surely here s-s-somewhere! F-f-find the treats <name>, take them b-b-back to Smokywood Pastures in Orgrimmar, and t-t-tell them I n-n-need to be unfrozen!",o="寻找被偷走的礼品，把它交还给铁炉堡的凯玛德·考伯宾奇。看起来是格林奇偷走了礼品，他就在奥特兰克山脉雪域附近。",oEN="Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Kaymard Copperpinch in Orgrimmar. It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",p="$n——我们冬幕节的礼物如果没有那些货物的话就准备不好了！格拉库就没有机会和这些好孩子们一起分享他的美味肉派了……",pEN="<name> - our Feast of Winter Veil will be ruined without those treats to restock! Graccu himself will miss out on sharing his delicious meat pies with all the good boys and girls this season...",c="你找到它了！你拯救了烟熏牧场冬幕节的礼物！\n\n可怜的萨克斯……我们会派一支队伍去找他并想办法帮他解冻的。希望他能够及时回来和我们一起欢度这个节日虽然他要补上这段时间没有干的活。这些都是因为你的功劳才能够实现的啊！",cEN="You found it! You've saved Smokywood Pasture's Feast of Winter Veil!\n\nPoor Sacks... we'll be sure to send a team out there and figure out a way to unfreeze him. Hopefully, he'll be back in time for the day of the Feast; he'll need to make up missed time working though. Still, this wouldn't even be possible if it weren't for you!"}
Q[6984]={d="我们这些烟林牧场的人感谢你找回了被偷窃的物品，$n。为此，我们要给你一件特殊的礼物……冬天爷爷将会亲自把它给你！\n\n请你去找冬天爷爷，他会给你冬幕节的礼物，来自于我们烟林牧场的礼物！我们这里应有尽有，烟林牧场能满足你一切需求……当然，我们还要谢谢你！",dEN="We at Smokywood Pastures appreciate the recovery of the stolen treats, <name>. For that, we'd like to offer you a special gift... presented by none other than Great-father Winter himself!\n\nPlease, speak with Great-father Winter, and he will give you your Feast of Winter Veil gift from us here at Smokywood Pastures. From our farm to your plate, it's always Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness... thanks to you, of course!",o="和奥格瑞玛的冬天爷爷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Great-father Winter in Orgrimmar.",c="呵呵……你好啊，$g冒险者:冒险者;！\n\n地精们告诉我，你在这个节日季赢得了一份特别的礼物。给你。祝你冬幕节快乐！",cEN="Ho ho hello, adventurer!\n\nThe goblins told me that you have earned a special gift this holiday season, and I am pleased to give it to you. Here you go - have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil this and every season in the future."}
Q[6985]={d="雷矛部族的矮人把深铁矿洞作为储藏物资的地方。我要派你去那个矿洞里，把里面的补给品给我拿回来。这样不但可以削弱雷矛部族在奥特兰克山谷的势力，还可以给我们提供必需的物资！\n\n小心一点，$n。深铁矿洞在联盟的控制下，如果我们能控制那座矿洞，那么整个奥特兰克山谷就会被我们牢牢掌握。",dEN="The Stormpike dwarves are using the Irondeep mine as a storage depot. I want you to raid that mine and bring me its supplies. This will curtail the Stormpikes' efforts in Alterac Valley, and will provide us with needed equipment!\n\nBe wary, <name>. The Irondeep mine is deep in Alliance territory, and control of the mine is as shifting as the snows of Alterac.",o="把10份深铁矿洞补给品交给霜狼要塞的部落军需官。",oEN="Bring 10 Irondeep Supplies to the Horde Quartermaster in Frostwolf Keep.",p="你去过深铁矿洞了吗，$n？你有没有拿到那里的补给品？",pEN="Did you enter the Irondeep mine, <name>? Did you raid its supplies?",c="你拿到它们了！干得好，$n！你有没有顺便干掉几个矮人？",cEN="You got them! Nicely done, <name>! And I hope you saw a few dwarves during your raid, and shed their blood for the Frostwolves!"}
Q[7001]={d="奥特兰克山谷中的战争在不断消耗我们的军力，因此我们必须不断补充新的力量！\n\n如果我们可以找到更多的坐骑，狼骑兵部队就能再一次投入战斗之中。\n\n拿上这根缰绳，去追踪附近森林中的霜狼。一旦你找到了霜狼，就对它使用缰绳以驯服它。把驯服的霜狼带回我这里来，这样我就可以把它编入骑兵部队了。\n\n当我们拥有足够的坐骑之后，狼骑兵就会再一次冲锋陷阵！",dEN="The war in the valley has taken its toll on our soldiers. We must revitalize our forces!\n\nIf we can fill up the stables, the Wolf Riders will once more be able to ride out into the field of battle.\n\nTake this muzzle and track down the frostwolves that inhabit the nearby forest. Once you find a wolf, use the muzzle to tame the beast. Bring the tamed beast back to me so that I may place it in the stable.\n\nWhen we have enough wolves stabled, the Wolf Riders will rejoin their patrol on our front lines.",o="找到奥特兰克山谷中的霜狼。使用霜狼口套来驯服它们。被驯服的霜狼会跟随你回到兽栏管理员那里，然后与兽栏管理员谈话以获得你的奖励。",oEN="Locate a Frostwolf in Alterac Valley. Use the Frostwolf Muzzle when you are near the Frostwolf to 'tame' the beast. Once tamed, the Frostwolf will follow you back to the Frostwolf Stable Master. Speak with the Frostwolf Stable Master to earn credit for the capture.",p="没有你的帮助，霜狼氏族的狼骑兵就无法获得足够的坐骑来进行作战。你干得很好！",pEN="Without your help, the Frostwolf Wolf Riders would not have mounts to ride into battle. You do us a great service!",c="我希望那些收集山羊皮的家伙具有与你一样坚定的决心，$n。\n\n按照这种速度，我们的兽栏很快就将爆满！",cEN="I can only hope that those charged with collecting ram hides are as determined as you, <name>.\n\nAt this rate, we will have the stables full in a matter of hours!"}
Q[7002]={p="在我们的一些战士帮助兽栏管理员捕捉巨狼的同时，其它人还需要去找一些将它们变成坐骑所必需的东西，比如缰绳和坐鞍。\n\n你必须去猎捕这个地区的山羊，也就是那些与雷矛骑兵的坐骑很相似的山羊！\n\n杀了它们，把它们的皮交给我。只要收集到足够多的羊皮，我们就可以开始为骑手们制作坐具了。霜狼氏族的狼骑兵很快就将再次驰骋在战场上！",pEN="While some of our soldiers are busy capturing wolves for the stable master, others must provide for the simple necessities that riding requires. I am speaking of riding harnesses, of course.\n\nYou must strike at the indigenous rams of the region. The very same rams that the Stormpike cavalry uses as mounts!\n\nSlay them and return to me with their hides. Once we have gathered enough hides, we will fashion harnesses for the riders. The Frostwolf Wolf Riders will ride once more!",c="干得好，士兵。当我收集到足够的皮毛时，我会通知你的。\n\n继续好好干吧！",cEN="Well done, soldier. I will notify you when I have stockpiled enough of the hides.\n\nCarry on!"}
Q[7003]={d="如果我还想继续在这里混的话，就必须对那些巨人采取一些措施了！他们把我的生意搞得一团糟，难道不是吗？\n\n眼下我正在实验各种各样的侏儒缩小射线，但是重点在于，我用尖端的地精科技强化了这种装置！为了防止它可能对我自身造成的各种不良影响，比如死亡之类的，我希望你用它在菲拉斯的任何一种巨人身上试验一下。在你把他们缩小之后，就可以从他们身上找到微缩残渣——把那种东西拿来给我！",dEN="I'm going to have to do something about the giants if I stay out here! They're certainly not good for business, now are they?\n\nI've been working on a variant of a gnomish shrinking ray, but I'm using superior GOBLIN technological advances in its construction! In an effort to avoid inconveniences for myself such as death, I'd like for you to try it out on any of the giants in Feralas. You should find miniaturization residue on them after you shrink them - bring me back some!",o="使用索尔宾的超级压缩器来缩小菲拉斯的任意种类的巨人，将他们缩小到更容易控制的体积。从缩小过的巨人身上收集15份微缩残渣，把它们交给菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸码头的索尔宾·范达瑟。",oEN="Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",p="微缩残渣，我可以确信地告诉你，它是工程学中非常重要的一种材料！好吧，它可以确保压缩器不会发生诸如爆炸之类的让人感到不爽的故障。\n\n哦，我说的当然不是给你的那一台。当然不是！",pEN="Miniaturization residue, I assure you, is a valuable commodity when it comes to engineering! Well, it is valuable in that it helps me make sure the zapper won't do something as disappointing as explode on the user.\n\nOh, I mean for the zappers other than the one I gave you. Absolutely!",c="精彩绝伦！很高兴看到你带着残余物回来了，而且所有主要器官都完好无损，脑袋也在！这很好……倒不是说超微缩器有什么危险，不过，嘿……\n\n啊，我非常感谢你的帮助，$n。说真的，你是全世界地精的$g好朋友:好朋友;。请收下这个，作为我感激之情的表示。",cEN="Splendifimous! Not only am I glad to see that you've returned with the residue, but also with all your major appendages intact! That is, well, there was never any danger in using the Ultra-Shrinker, now was there!\n\nI do appreciate your effort on my behalf, <name>. Truly, you are a friend to goblins everywhere. Accept this as a token of my appreciation!"}
Q[7021]={d="朋友，祝你在冬幕节玩得开心！记得跟奥格瑞玛的冬天爷爷问好！如果你今年表现得好的话，就能在冬幕节那天收到很多礼物。记得告诉他你希望收到礼物！\n\n另外，别忘了准备一些礼品，送给那些今年表现良好的朋友！我们有很多东西可供选择，都是从农场精心挑选的新鲜食物——来自烟林牧场的馈赠！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter, who's currently in Orgrimmar! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!\n\nAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",o="跟冬天爷爷谈一谈，他就在奥格瑞玛的烟林牧场零售店附近。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.",c="呵呵，你好。我是冬天爷爷，我谨代表烟林牧场的友善人们……“从我们的农场新鲜直达您的餐盘，这就是烟林牧场的健康美味”……祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n如果你今年表现良好，也许就会收到烟林牧场送给你的冬幕节礼物。呼啦。\"\"",cEN="Ho ho hello. I am Greatfather Winter, and I - courtesy of the fine folks of Smokywood Pastures... \"Fresh from our farm to your plate, it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness\" - would like to wish you a fantastic Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nIf you've been good this year, maybe you will receive treats from Smokywood Pastures as your treat for the Feast of Winter Veil. Huzzah."}
Q[7022]={d="朋友，祝你在冬幕节玩得开心！记得跟冬天爷爷问好！如果你今年表现得好的话，就能在冬幕节那天收到很多礼物。记得告诉他你希望收到礼物！\n\n另外，别忘了准备一些礼品，送给那些今年表现良好的朋友！我们有很多东西可供选择，都是从农场精心挑选的新鲜食物——来自烟林牧场的馈赠！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!\n\nAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",o="跟冬天爷爷谈一谈，他就在铁炉堡的烟林牧场零售店附近。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge.",c="呵呵，你好。我是冬天爷爷，我谨代表烟林牧场的友善人们……“从我们的农场新鲜直达您的餐盘，这就是烟林牧场的健康美味”……祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n如果你今年表现良好，也许就会收到烟林牧场送给你的冬幕节礼物。呼啦。\"\"",cEN="Ho ho hello. I am Greatfather Winter, and I - courtesy of the fine folks of Smokywood Pastures... \"Fresh from our farm to your plate, it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness\" - would like to wish you a fantastic Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nIf you've been good this year, maybe you will receive treats from Smokywood Pastures as your treat for the Feast of Winter Veil. Huzzah."}
Q[7023]={d="朋友，祝你在冬幕节玩得开心！记得跟铁炉堡的冬天爷爷问好！如果你今年表现得好的话，就能在冬幕节那天收到很多礼物。记得告诉他你希望收到礼物！\n\n另外，别忘了准备一些礼品，送给那些今年表现良好的朋友！我们有很多东西可供选择，都是从农场精心挑选的新鲜食物——来自烟林牧场的馈赠！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter, who's currently in Ironforge! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!\n\nAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",o="跟冬天爷爷谈一谈，他就在铁炉堡的烟林牧场零售店附近。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge.",c="呵呵，你好。我是冬天爷爷，我谨代表烟林牧场的友善人们……“从我们的农场新鲜直达您的餐盘，这就是烟林牧场的健康美味”……祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n如果你今年表现良好，也许就会收到烟林牧场送给你的冬幕节礼物。呼啦。\"\"",cEN="Ho ho hello. I am Greatfather Winter, and I - courtesy of the fine folks of Smokywood Pastures... \"Fresh from our farm to your plate, it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness\" - would like to wish you a fantastic Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nIf you've been good this year, maybe you will receive treats from Smokywood Pastures as your treat for the Feast of Winter Veil. Huzzah."}
Q[7024]={d="朋友，祝你在冬幕节玩得开心！记得跟奥格瑞玛的冬天爷爷问好！如果你今年表现得好的话，就能在冬幕节那天收到很多礼物。记得告诉他你希望收到礼物！\n\n另外，别忘了准备一些礼品，送给那些今年表现良好的朋友！我们有很多东西可供选择，都是从农场精心挑选的新鲜食物——来自烟林牧场的馈赠！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, friend! Be sure to say hello to Greatfather Winter, who's currently in Orgrimmar! If you've been nice this year, you'll receive wondrous treats on the day of the Feast of Winter Veil. Be sure to tell him what you hope to get this year!\n\nAlso, be sure to stock up on treats to give those who've been nice this year. We have a great selection to choose from. Fresh from our farm to your plate - it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness!",o="跟冬天爷爷谈一谈，他就在奥格瑞玛的烟林牧场零售店附近。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter; he is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.",c="呵呵，你好。我是冬天爷爷，我谨代表烟林牧场的友善人们……“从我们的农场新鲜直达您的餐盘，这就是烟林牧场的健康美味”……祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n如果你今年表现良好，也许就会收到烟林牧场送给你的冬幕节礼物。呼啦。\"\"",cEN="Ho ho hello. I am Greatfather Winter, and I - courtesy of the fine folks of Smokywood Pastures... \"Fresh from our farm to your plate, it's Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness\" - would like to wish you a fantastic Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nIf you've been good this year, maybe you will receive treats from Smokywood Pastures as your treat for the Feast of Winter Veil. Huzzah."}
Q[7025]={d="嘿，你能帮冬天爷爷一个忙吗，嗯，小$g男孩:女孩;？\n\n我不是想没完没了地用第三人称谈论自己，但冬天爷爷忙了一整天，也该犒劳一下自己了。几块姜饼，再配上一杯冰镇牛奶，那真是再好不过了。想想你能不能做冬天爷爷的$g好朋友:好朋友;，去给我拿点吃的来？",dEN="Hey, can you do Greatfather Winter a favor, um, little <boy /girl>?\n\nNot to needlessly talk about myself in the third person, but Greatfather Winter has been at this all day and he could use a treat himself. Some gingerbread cookies and ice cold milk to wash them down with would really hit the spot. Think you could be a friend to the Greatfather and fetch some for me?",o="将5个小姜饼和一杯冰镇牛奶交给铁炉堡的冬天爷爷。",oEN="Bring 5 Gingerbread Cookies and an Ice Cold Milk to Greatfather Winter in Ironforge.",p="所有这些关于礼物的谈话都让我十分向往。嗯~~~~~姜饼与牛奶……",pEN="All this talk of treats has given me a hankering for some myself. Mmmm... gingerbread cookies and milk...",c="你对冬天爷爷真是太好了，$n。祝你冬幕节快乐。\n\n这些小东西……就当作给你的奖励吧。",cEN="You're quite the helper to ol' Greatfather Winter there, <name>. Have a great Feast of Winter Veil.\n\nHere's a little something... you know, for the effort."}
Q[7026]={p="没有鞍具，雷矛卫队就无法重新投入到战斗中！我们必须为坐骑配上鞍具，这样我们才不会像野蛮人一样骑着一头光溜溜的山羊。\n\n我们可以简单地干掉基地周围的山羊来获得皮革，但是那样做是非常愚蠢的。因为我们还要把那些山羊驯化成坐骑哪！\n\n你必须去攻击敌人的基地，杀死他们的霜狼坐骑，然后拿回他们的皮。把它们的皮交给我，这样我就可以帮我们的骑兵制作鞍具了。出发吧！",pEN="The Stormpike Brigade cannot charge into battle bareback! We require harnesses for our mounts, after all, we are not savages.\n\nWhile we could easily slay the rams that roam near our base for the leather required to fashion a harness, doing so would be idiotic. We need those rams for mounts.\n\nYou must strike at our enemy's base, slaying the frostwolves they use as mounts and taking their hides. Return their hides to me so that harnesses may be made for the cavalry. Go!",c="干得好，士兵。等我囤够了兽皮就会通知你。继续努力！",cEN="Well done, soldier. I will notify you when I have stockpiled enough of the hides.\n\nCarry on!"}
Q[7027]={d="看看这里的兽栏，$n！空空如也！雷矛部族的骑兵部队没有坐骑——它已经名存实亡了。\n\n你必须帮助我们，士兵。拿着这根颈圈，到山谷中去寻找四处徘徊的奥特兰克山羊，并使用训练颈圈来抓住它们。当你抓住山羊之后，就把它给我带回来，然后我就可以将它配备给骑兵部队了。\n\n当我们有足够的山羊之后，山羊骑兵将再次准备就绪。有了你的帮助，骑兵部队将会获得重生！",dEN="Just look at the stables, <name>! Empty! The Stormpike Brigade has no rams to ride - the cavalry is defunct.\n\nYou must help us, soldier. Take this training collar and enter the wilds of this valley. Locate the Alterac rams that roam throughout the area and use the collar to snare one. When you have captured a ram, return it to me and I shall place it in our stable.\n\nWhen we have enough rams, the ram rider commander will be notifed. With your help, the cavalry will be reborn!",o="在奥特兰克山谷中找到一只奥特兰克山羊。当你靠近奥特兰克山羊时，使用雷矛训练颈圈来“驯服”它。驯服之后，奥特兰克山羊会跟着你回到兽栏管理员那里。与兽栏管理员交谈，即可获得捕获的功劳。|n",oEN="Locate an Alterac Ram in Alterac Valley. Use the Stormpike Training Collar when you are near the Alterac Ram to 'tame' the beast. Once tamed, the Alterac Ram will follow you back to the Stable Master. Speak with the Stable Master to earn credit for the capture.",p="没有你的帮助，雷矛卫队的山羊骑兵就无法获得足够的坐骑来进行作战。你干得很好！",pEN="Without your help, the Stormpike Ram Riders would not have mounts to ride into battle. You do us a great service!",c="兽栏马上就会被山羊挤满了。继续好好干！",cEN="The stables will be full in no time at all. Keep up the good work!"}
Q[7028]={d="泰拉莫克水晶洞穴坐落在这里的西边，在玛拉顿的深处……那里是一处拥有悠久历史的古迹。我希望从那里得到一些东西，$c。上古之神的遗物就在那些巨门的后面。\n\n如果你愿意挑战潜伏在玛拉顿里的那些扭曲的邪恶力量，我一定会让你为做出这个决定而感到满意的。收集你所找到的瑟莱德丝水晶雕像，把它们交给我。\n\n一旦我拿到雕像，我就能……研究它们。雕像中蕴含的力量已经沉睡太久了……",dEN="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it, <class>. Relics of the old gods lie hidden behind the giant doors.\n\nIf you are willing to brave the twisted evils found in Maraudon, I believe I can make it worth your time. Collect the theradric crystal carvings you find, and return them to me.\n\nOnce I get the carvings, I will be able to... study them. These powers have been too long at rest...",o="为凄凉之地的维洛收集15个瑟莱德丝水晶雕像。",oEN="Collect 15 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",p="不要问问题！\n\n我给你的指示是非常明确的。",pEN="Don't ask questions!\n\nYou have my request.",c="哈哈哈！我知道你会回来的。\n\n<维洛自言自语着。>\n\n……太容易说服了。\n\n……看来只要有钱，什么事都好办。呵呵呵呵……",cEN="Ha ha ha! I knew you'd be back.\n\n<Willow mutters>\n\n...So easy to convince.\n\n...Will do anything for the right price. Heh heh heh..."}
Q[7029]={d="一个名叫维利塔恩的萨特正在玷污玛拉顿的洞穴，使那里的许多植物无法生长。\n\n拿着这个瓶子，$n。用洞穴里面橙色水晶池中的水装满这个瓶子；瓶中所包含的物质可以中和毒药，将它变成一种治疗药剂。\n\n你可以在橙色的洞穴中找到维利斯塔姆藤蔓，然后对它们使用净化过的液体。这样，附着在植物上的堕落物质就会被净化，但是你要知道维利塔恩仍然控制着这些植物。他会利用它来对付你……",dEN="A satyr known as Vyletongue has corrupted the caverns of Maraudon, stunting the growth of many of the plants inside.\n\nTake this vial, <name>. Fill it at the orange crystal pool found inside the caverns; the coating inside the vial will counter the toxins, turning it into a healing agent.\n\nFind the Vylestem vines inside the orange caverns, and use the purified liquid on them. The corruption will be purged from the plant, but do know that Vyletongue will still control it. He may use it against you...",o="在玛拉顿里用天蓝水瓶在橙色水晶池中装满水。\n\n在维利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用装满水的天蓝水瓶，使堕落的诺克赛恩幼体出现。\n\n治疗8株植物并杀死那些诺克赛恩幼体，然后向葬影村的瓦克·战痕复命。",oEN="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.\n\nUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.\n\nHeal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village.",p="如果你可以治疗那些植物，它们就可以再次生长了。我们必须尽力而为，$n……",pEN="If you are able to heal the plant, it will again begin to grow. We must do what we can, <name>...",c="感谢你把这个拿回来交给我，$n。有了这些剩下的液体，我就可以继续进行研究了。\n\n虽然现在我们还有很多事情要做，但是你至少帮我阻止了维利塔恩的堕落力量继续在玛拉顿中蔓延。请接受这个作为我的感谢。",cEN="Thank you for returning this, <name>. With the remaining liquid you brought me, I can continue my studies.\n\nWhile there is still much to do, you have helped to heal some of the corruption that Vyletongue spread through Maraudon. Please take this with my gratitude."}
Q[7041]={d="一个名叫维利塔恩的萨特正在玷污玛拉顿的洞穴，使那里的许多植物无法生长。\n\n拿着这个瓶子，$n。用洞穴里面橙色水晶池中的水装满这个瓶子；瓶中所包含的物质可以中和毒药，将它变成一种治疗药剂。\n\n你可以在橙色的洞穴中找到维利斯塔姆藤蔓，然后对它们使用净化过的液体。这样，附着在植物上的堕落物质就会被净化，但是你要知道维利塔恩仍然控制着这些植物。他会利用它来对付你……",dEN="A satyr known as Vyletongue has corrupted the caverns of Maraudon, stunting the growth of many of the plants inside.\n\nTake this vial, <name>. Fill it at the corrupted orange pool found inside the caverns; the coating inside the vial will counter the toxins, turning it into a healing agent.\n\nFind the Vylestem vines inside the orange caverns, and use the purified liquid on them. The corruption will be purged from the plant, but do know that Vyletongue will still control it. He may use it against you...",o="在玛拉顿里用天蓝水瓶在橙色水晶池中装满水。\n\n在维利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用装满水的天蓝水瓶，使堕落的诺克赛恩幼体出现。\n\n治疗8株植物并杀死那些诺克赛恩幼体，然后向尼耶尔前哨站的塔琳德莉亚复命。",oEN="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.\n\nUse the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.\n\nHeal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point.",p="如果你可以治疗那些植物，它们就可以再次生长了。我们必须尽力而为，$n……",pEN="If you are able to heal the plant, it will again begin to grow. We must do what we can, <name>...",c="感谢你把这个拿回来交给我，$n。有了这些剩下的液体，我就可以继续进行研究了。\n\n虽然现在我们还有很多事情要做，但是你至少帮我阻止了维利塔恩的堕落力量继续在玛拉顿中蔓延。请接受这个作为我的感谢。",cEN="Thank you for returning this, <name>. With the remaining liquid you brought me, I can continue my studies.\n\nWhile there is still much to do, you have helped to heal some of the corruption that Vyletongue spread through Maraudon. Please take this with my gratitude."}
Q[7042]={d="听着……我不想破坏了节日的美好气氛，但是烟林牧场需要帮助——需要你这样的冒险家。\n\n我们弄丢了节日所需的重要礼品，现在连我们派去寻找礼品的烟林牧场密探也不见了！请帮帮忙——礼品是在奥特兰克山脉附近丢失的，我们派出的密探也在那儿。\n\n看看礼品和密探是否都安然无恙吧！",dEN="Listen... not to shatter the magic of the season here, but Smokywood Pastures could use some assistance - the kind you adventuring types are known to give.\n\nWe're missing an important shipment of treats that was restocking us for the season, and now we're missing the agent of Smokywood Pastures that we sent out to the field to find it! Please - the shipment was last reported in the Alterac Mountains, and that's where our man went to look for it.\n\nSee if both are out there, safe and sound!",o="前往奥特兰克山脉雪域寻找失踪的烟林牧场密探。",oEN="Locate the Smokywood Pastures investigator that has gone missing in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",c="你——你——你可以听到我说话！感——感——感谢老天！\n\n我不是真的雪——雪——雪人，我的名字叫萨克斯，我为铁炉堡的烟熏牧场工——工——工作……我被派——派——派到这里来找寻遗失的包裹时被不明生——生——生物攻击了！\n\n好——好——好冷啊……",cEN="Y-y-you can h-h-hear me! Thank the b-b-bottom line!\n\nI'm not really a s-s-snowman - my n-n-name is Sacks, and I w-w-work for the Ironforge b-b-branch of Smokywood Pastures... I g-g-got sent out here to look for a m-m-missing package, when I was attacked by a c-c-creature I have never seen b-b-before!\n\nSo v-v-very cold..."}
Q[7043]={d="一个叫“可憎的格林奇”的家:家;伙偷走了我们那批礼:礼;物，$n。小心点！他很恶:恶;毒，还手下有一帮绿色:色;侏儒！\n\n对付他你需要帮手:手;。据说他把我们的礼:礼;物和我们心:心;爱的驯鹿梅森都关在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的狭长洞穴里！找到那些礼:礼;物，$n，在节:节;日被毁、暴风城的孩子:子;们失望之前把它们带回来！\"\"",dEN="A c-c-creature called \"The Abominable Greench\" is the one w-w-who stole our shipment of t-t-treats, <name>. Be c-c-careful though! He is t-t-the one who turned me into this s-s-snowy mess!\n\nYou're g-g-gonna need some help in f-f-facing him. I've seen him w-w-wander all around where the y-y-yeti are; he's s-s-surely here s-s-somewhere! F-f-find the treats <name>, take them b-b-back to Smokywood Pastures in Ironforge, and t-t-tell them I n-n-need to be unfrozen!",o="寻找被偷走的礼品，把它交还给铁炉堡的乌莫尔特。看起来是格林奇偷走了礼品，他就在奥特兰克山脉雪域附近。",oEN="Locate and return the Stolen Treats to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge. It was last thought to be in the possession of the Abominable Greench, found somewhere in the snowy regions of the Alterac Mountains.",p="$n——我们冬幕节的礼物如果没有那些货物的话就准备不好了！格拉库就没有机会和这些好孩子们一起分享他的美味肉派了……",pEN="<name> - our Feast of Winter Veil will be ruined without those treats to restock! Graccu himself will miss out on sharing his delicious meat pies with all the good boys and girls this season...",c="你找到它了！你拯救了烟熏牧场冬幕节的礼物！\n\n可怜的萨克斯……我们会派一支队伍去找他并想办法帮他解冻的。希望他能够及时回来和我们一起欢度这个节日虽然他要补上这段时间没有干的活。这些都是因为你的功劳才能够实现的啊！",cEN="You found it! You've saved Smokywood Pasture's Feast of Winter Veil!\n\nPoor Sacks... we'll be sure to send a team out there and figure out a way to unfreeze him. Hopefully, he'll be back in time for the day of the Feast; he'll need to make up missed time working though. Still, this wouldn't even be possible if it weren't for you!"}
Q[7044]={d="一个名叫维利塔恩的黑暗萨特在这些蜿蜒曲折的洞穴中散播着他的邪恶力量。他住在有着紫色水晶的入口那边。\n\n维利塔恩还创造了一个名叫诺克赛恩的堕落生物，让它把守在有着橙色水晶的入口那边。他们偷取了我兄弟的节杖。塞雷布拉斯，我的兄弟……他在洞中毫无目的地游荡，被堕落的力量所诅咒。\n\n你必须帮助他！找到节杖的两个部分，然后……想办法和我兄弟谈谈。",dEN="A dark satyr called Lord Vyletongue spread his evil through these twisting caves, poisoning the minds of all inside. He still resides beyond the purple crystals.\n\nVyletongue also created a living symbol of his corruption called Noxxion that dwells beyond the orange crystals. Together, they have stolen the two parts of my brother's scepter. Celebras, my brother... he wanders blindly inside, cursed by corruption.\n\nYou must help him! Find the pieces, and speak to my brother... somehow.",o="找回塞雷布拉斯节杖的两个部分：塞雷布拉斯魔棒和塞雷布拉斯钻石。\n\n然后设法和塞雷布拉斯对话。",oEN="Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond.\n\nFind a way to speak with Celebras.",p="我从看似永无止境的梦魇中醒来……",pEN="I have awoken from a nightmare that seemed it would never end...",c="现在你找到了权杖的两个部分，玛拉顿终于有了摆脱维利塔恩堕落力量的希望。",cEN="Now that you have recovered the two parts of my scepter, I have hope that Maraudon may one day be rid of the Vyle corruption."}
Q[7045]={d="我们这些烟林牧场的人感谢你找回了被偷窃的物品，$n。为此，我们要给你一件特殊的礼物……冬天爷爷将会亲自把它给你！\n\n请你去找冬天爷爷，他会给你冬幕节的礼物，来自于我们烟林牧场的礼物！我们这里应有尽有，烟林牧场能满足你一切需求……当然，我们还要谢谢你！",dEN="We at Smokywood Pastures appreciate the recovery of the stolen treats, <name>. For that, we'd like to offer you a special gift... presented by none other than Greatfather Winter himself!\n\nPlease, speak with Greatfather Winter, and he will give you your Feast of Winter Veil gift from us here at Smokywood Pastures. From our farm to your plate, it's always Smokywood Pastures wholesome goodness... thanks to you, of course!",o="和铁炉堡的冬天爷爷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter in Ironforge.",c="呵呵……你好啊，$g冒险者:冒险者;！\n\n地精们告诉我，你在这个节日季赢得了一份特别的礼物。给你。祝你冬幕节快乐！",cEN="Ho ho hello, adventurer!\n\nThe goblins told me that you have earned a special gift this holiday season, and I am pleased to give it to you. Here you go - have a wondrous Feast of Winter Veil this and every season in the future."}
Q[7046]={d="我的权杖是我希望的源泉。它的力量可以让我自由穿梭于这些洞穴中。我希望能够让我叔叔的灵魂得到安宁……这是我要交给你的任务。\n\n为了让这两个部分再次结合起来，我需要你的协助来完成仪式。请跟着我，听从我的指示行动，然后我就会重新把钻石镶到节杖上。\n\n让我们一起把塞雷布拉斯节杖重新组合起来！",dEN="My scepter was once a source of hope for me. It once granted me power over these caverns. I had hoped to bring peace to the spirit of my uncle...\n\nFor the two parts to once again become one, I will need your assistance in performing the ritual. Please follow me, and listen to my instructions while I channel the energy required to reunite the rod with the diamond.\n\nTogether, we shall create the Scepter of Celebras once again!",o="帮助赎罪的塞雷布拉斯制作塞雷布拉斯节杖。\n\n当仪式完成之后再和他谈谈。",oEN="Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras.\n\nSpeak with him when the ritual is complete.",p="如果你希望重新启动仪式，请放弃我们的这一次尝试，然后再和我谈谈。",pEN="If you wish to restart the ritual, please abandon our first attempt and then speak to me again.",c="请拿着这个，你一定要好好利用它。继续你的旅程，带着希望穿越洞穴，你可以找到我的叔叔的遗体。前方还有很多危险在等着你，$n。\n\n如果你需要的话，就再次找我对话。",cEN="Please take this, and know that the power allotted to you now must be used for good. Continue your journey through the caverns, and with hope, you will find the remains of my uncle. Much danger awaits you, <name>.\n\nSpeak with me again should the need arise."}
Q[7061]={d="嗯——如果你对冬幕节的历史知识感兴趣的话，就读读这本书吧。虽然我认为我们对传说的认知是正确的，但是我是个真正的学者，我希望能收集到全面的信息。\n\n阅读完这边书后，将它交给雷霆崖的凯恩·血蹄。要是听说有人对我们的传说感兴趣，他会很开心的。",dEN="Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book. While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a student of legends to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.\n\nWhen you're done, take the book to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff. I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the lore of our people.",o="想了解更多关于这个节日的内容，就去读读《冬幕节》这本书。读完之后，把它交给雷霆崖的凯恩·血蹄。\"\"",oEN="Feel free to read the book, \"The Feast of Winter Veil\", to learn more about the holiday. When you are finished with the book, deliver it to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="我欢迎你来到莫高雷，欢迎来到我们雷霆崖这个简朴的社区，$g朋友:朋友;。我总是对那些愿意了解这个王国、它的人民和它传说的人感兴趣。这就是你站在我面前的原因吗？",pEN="I bid you welcome to Mulgore and our humble community of Thunder Bluff, friend. I always take an interest in those who choose to take an interest in the kingdom, its people, and its lore. Is this why you are standing before me?",c="笼罩着冬幕的传奇与故事在这几年中已经慢慢地由广为人知变得较为隐密了。我知道地精们为了他们自己而正在帮忙提倡这个节庆，而我们族人的反应至少在某种形式上对于保住这些传说是有帮助的。\n\n你想要越过物质并且学习我们的过去是值得敬佩的特质，年轻的$c。我向你的智慧致敬。",cEN="The legends and lore surrounding the Winter Veil are ones that have faded from the forefront of public though over the years. Yes, I know that the goblins are helping to revive the season for their own ends, the fact that our people reflect upon it at least in some form does good to keep such lore alive.\n\nYour desire to go beyond the material and learn about our past is an admirable trait, young <class>. I salute your wisdom."}
Q[7062]={d="礼物，礼物，礼物……啊，呸！\n\n这些地精玷污了冬幕节的真正含义。这是个新旧更替的时节；大地在冬天爷爷降下的皑皑白雪下沉睡，冬天爷爷可不是那个身着红衣装模作样的傻子！\n\n如果你想亲自了解冬幕节，就去询问探险者协会的史学家卡尼克吧。有人关心历史胜过关心礼物，我想他一定会很惊讶的。",dEN="Gifts, treats, presents... bah, I say!\n\nThose goblins pollute the true meaning of this season - the Feast of Winter Veil. This is a time of renewal; the land slumbers under a blanket of snow brought forth by Greatfather Winter, who is NOT the bumbling fool over there in the red suit!\n\nIf you're interested in learning what the Feast is all about for yourself, ask Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League. I'm sure he'll be surprised that someone cares about history rather than getting presents.",o="与铁炉堡探险者协会的史学家卡尼克谈谈关于冬幕节的情况。",oEN="Speak with Historian Karnik at the Explorer's League in Ironforge about the Feast of Winter Veil.",c="冬幕节？唉，过去的岁月里，它对我们矮人有着更深厚的意义。如今看来，其他人已经把冬天爷爷的传说变成了推销糖果和礼物的工具。\n\n难怪戈利对这种变化如此愤愤不平。他和其他像他一样的矮人把过去当作一面战旗紧紧攥着。我认为有一点庆祝总是好的，但重要的是记住这个节日的本源。",cEN="The Feast of Winter Veil, you say? Alas, in times past it held a more substantial meaning to us dwarves. Nowadays, it seems as though others have turned the legend of Greatfather Winter into something that helps to sell candies and presents.\n\nIt's no surprise that Goli is bitter about that sort of change. He and other dwarves like him cling to our past like a banner of war. While I think a little celebration is always good, it is important to remember the origins of the Feast."}
Q[7063]={d="嗯——如果你对冬幕节的历史知识感兴趣的话，就读读这本书吧。虽然我认为我们对传说的认知是正确的，但是我是个真正的学者，我希望能收集到全面的信息。\n\n阅读完这边书后，将它交给国王麦格尼·铜须。要是听说有人对古老的传说感兴趣，他会很开心的。",dEN="Here - if you are interested in learning more about the Feast of Winter Veil, read this book. While I think our recognition of the legend is the appropriate one, I'm enough of a scholar to appreciate the collection of all information into a single source.\n\nWhen you're done, take the book to King Magni Bronzebeard. I know for a fact he'd be interested in hearing that others have taken an interest in the older legends.",o="想了解更多关于这个节日的内容，就去读读《冬幕节》这本书。读完之后，把它交给铁炉堡的穆拉丁·铜须。\"\"",oEN="Feel free to read the book, \"The Feast of Winter Veil\", to learn more about the holiday. When you are finished with the book, deliver it to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",p="我欢迎你来到铁炉堡王国，$g朋友:朋友;。我总是对那些愿意了解这个王国、它的人民和它传说的人感兴趣。这就是你站在我面前的原因吗？",pEN="I bid you welcome to the Kingdom of Ironforge, friend. I always take an interest in those who choose to take an interest in the kingdom, its people, and its lore. Is this why you are standing before me?",c="笼罩着冬幕的传奇与故事在这几年中已经慢慢地由广为人知变得较为隐密了。当我察觉到侏儒们为了他们自己而正在帮忙提倡这个节庆时，我们族人的反应至少在某种形式上对于保住这些传说是有帮助的。\n\n你想要越过物质并且学习我们的过去是值得敬佩的特质，年轻的$c。我向你博学的天性致敬。",cEN="The legends and lore surrounding the Winter Veil are ones that have faded from the forefront of public thought over the years. While I recognize that the goblins are helping to revive the season for their own ends, the fact that the citizenry thinks about it at least in some form does good to keep such lore alive.\n\nYour desire to go beyond the material and learn about our past is an admirable trait, young <class>. I salute your erudite nature."}
Q[7064]={d="在玛拉顿的深处居住着一个邪恶的混乱生物——瑟莱德丝公主，她是一个和上古之神相关的地元素。很早以前，她和塞纳留斯的长子扎尔塔结合，他们的后代……被称为半人马。那些半人马杀掉了扎尔塔，并保留了他的遗体。我的任务是征召足够强大的冒险者去杀死瑟莱德丝，这样我们就可以在回到石爪山之前找到扎尔塔的遗体了。",dEN="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship. The offspring of their time together became known to the people of Kalimdor as centaur. Ever-thankful creatures, the centaur killed Zaetar, and now hold Zaetar's remains. My quest here is to find those powerful enough to slay Theradras so we may recover Zaetar's remains before returning to Stonetalon.",o="杀死瑟莱德丝公主，然后回到凄凉之地葬影村附近的瑟琳德拉那里复命。",oEN="Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="我原本想要自己去进行这场战斗，但是我们没有选择——我们需要更加强大的帮手，而艾泽拉斯的各个种族早已证明，只要他们团结起来就可以击败非常可怕的敌人。所以我寻求你的帮助。\n\n我希望这已经足够了。\n\n作为雷姆洛斯的兄弟，札尔塔给这个世界带来了无尽的痛苦，并最终导致了他自己的死亡。我只希望我们不会再造成更多的死亡。",pEN="I would prefer to fight this battle on our own, but we are left with no other options--we need those more powerful, and the races of Azeroth have proven without a doubt they can overcome such things when they work together. So it is to you we turn for help.\n\nI only hope it is enough.\n\nZaetar, brother to Remulos, brought many pains to this world, and ultimately it caused his own death. I just hope I have not caused more death by asking you to aid us.",c="这个消息真是再好不过了，$n！谢谢你！\n\n我原本想要和玛兰迪斯谈谈，并就札尔塔遗体的问题寻求他的指引，但是你已经克服了这个任务中最困难的部分。\n\n我这里有些东西，是为那些帮助我们的冒险者准备的。你帮了我们的大忙，因此，你可以从中选择一件来作为报酬。",cEN="This is most wonderful news, <name>! Thank you!\n\nI will speak with Marandis and ask his wisdom on the topic of Zaetar's remains, but at least you have overcome the hardest of the tasks.\n\nI was told that if we were successful in our mission, I had permission to reward those who aided us. I was given these items as tokens from our people--you may choose one."}
Q[7065]={d="在玛拉顿的深处住着一个极度邪恶的生物，$n。瑟莱德丝公主是一股与上古之神有所关联的大地元素力量。很久以前，塞纳留斯的第一个儿子扎尔塔找到了她。他们结合的产物就是被称为半人马的生物。这些生物杀死了扎尔塔，如今瑟莱德丝保存着他的遗骸。我此行的任务就是找到足够强大的人去杀死瑟莱德丝，好让我们能在返回石爪山之前找回扎尔塔的遗骸。",dEN="In the depths of Maraudon lives a creature of chaos and evil, <name>. Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related somehow to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she was sought out by Zaetar, first son of Cenarius. The offspring of their... relationship are the creatures known as centaur. Ever-thankful creatures, the centaur killed Zaetar, and now Theradras keeps his remains. My quest here is to find those powerful enough to slay Theradras so we may recover Zaetar's remains before returning to Stonetalon.",o="杀死瑟莱德丝公主，然后回到凄凉之地尼耶尔前哨站的守护者玛兰迪斯那里复命。",oEN="Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",p="我原本想要自己去进行这场战斗，但是我们没有选择——我们需要更加强大的帮手，而艾泽拉斯的各个种族早已证明，只要他们团结起来就可以击败非常可怕的敌人。所以我寻求你的帮助。\n\n我希望这已经足够了。\n\n作为雷姆洛斯的兄弟，札尔塔给这个世界带来了无尽的痛苦，并最终导致了他自己的死亡。这对我们来说是很有报警意义的。",pEN="I feel the weight of imposing my plea on the mortal races, but we are left with no other options. The races of Azeroth have proven without a doubt they can overcome such things when they work together, so it is to them I ask for help.\n\nI only hope it is enough.\n\nZaetar, brother to Remulos, brought many pains to this world, and ultimately it caused his own death. There is a lesson there to all of us if we are wise enough to see it.",c="这个消息真是再好不过了，$n！谢谢你！\n\n虽然你无法带回札尔塔的遗体来让我当面质问这个塞纳留斯的长子，但是半人马的意志会慢慢被消磨，他们对于鲜血的渴望会慢慢衰减——我们希望如此。\n\n我这里有些东西，是为那些帮助我们的冒险者准备的。你帮了我们的大忙，因此，你可以从中选择一件来作为报酬。",cEN="This is most wonderful news, <name>! Thank you!\n\nAlthough it concerns me that you were not able to bring back Zaetar's remains, who am I to question the will of Cenarius' first born. Perhaps now the will of the centaur will break and their thirst for blood will lesson--we can only hope.\n\nIf successful in our mission, I was given these items to reward any who aided us. You may choose one as a token of thanks."}
Q[7066]={d="这些私生的半人马——我的儿子和女儿——需要他们的父亲。\n\n看看你的周围——这个地方遍布着希望，遍布着我父亲塞纳留斯梦想中的宁静。它们在从我的体内源源不断地涌出来！我不能剥夺他们享受这一切的权利……即便他们对我犯下了深重的罪恶。\n\n但是我有一件事情需要请你帮助，以便让我兄弟的心灵得到抚慰。拿着这个……这是我的遗体孕育出来的第一颗种子。告诉他，我的灵魂还在这里，我还在继续活着。我相信他可以理解我。",dEN="The misbegotten centaur--my sons and daughters--have need of their father.\n\nLook around you--this place rings of hope and all that my father Cenarius preaches. It sprung from me! And I cannot take that away from them... not even for their crimes against me.\n\nBut there is one thing I would ask of you to ease my brother's mind. Take this... it is the first seed that fell from the life my remains nourished. Tell him my spirit remains here, and that I live on. I am sure he will understand.",o="到月光林地去找到雷姆洛斯，将生命之种交给他。",oEN="Seek out Remulos in Moonglade and give him the Seed of Life.",p="你身上有堕落的气味，$n……最近一段时间到这里来的许多旅行者都是这样。但是你身上的有所不同。你来这里是有什么事情要告诉我的吗？你身上有一种让我感觉非常熟悉的气息，但是我不知道那是什么。\n\n请你告诉我，你为什么要来找我？",pEN="You have the scent of corruption on you, <name>... much like many adventurers these days. But something about you is different. Is there something you've come to speak to me about? You have an aura about you that seems familiar, but I cannot place it.\n\nPlease, I implore you, tell me why you've sought an audience with me.",c="那么说来我的兄弟终于安息了？我很荣幸能够在有生之年得知这件事。他的傲慢自大和愤怒让我以为他已经远离了我们，但是他……他的牺牲证明我错了——他已经重生了。他尽到了自己对大自然的职责。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你让我看到了一丝我原以为早已丧失的希望。这颗种子对于这个饱受战火创伤的世界来说非常重要……我已经感觉到了这一点。",cEN="So my brother has finally found peace? I am proud to have lived to see this day. In all his arrogance and anger, I truly thought he was lost to us, but this... this symbol of his sacrifice only proves that he is not lost--he has only been reborn. He takes his place in nature as was his duty.\n\nThank you, <name>. By bringing this to me, you have secured a small amount of hope that I thought I had once lost. This seed will be important to the people of this war-torn land some day... I can sense it."}
Q[7067]={d="虽然我被当作异教徒流放了，但我的信仰还是一如既往——它将永远激励我前进。为了完成我的使命，我不得不借助外来者的力量……而不是我的半人马同胞们。这真可悲。\n\n这个任务需要深入神圣的玛拉顿——那座坟墓被我的同胞保护着，只有最为虔诚的半人马才能进入。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我，只需点点头就行了。我会给你一块羊皮纸，上面写着具体的指示。阅读那块羊皮纸然后考虑一下我的话。",dEN="Though exiled as a heretic, my beliefs still ring true--that alone drives me onward. But for my destiny to be complete, I need the aid of an outsider... one not of any centaur tribe.\n\nThe task requires someone to enter the holy halls of Maraudon--a tomb my people protect, and only the most devout are ever allowed to enter.\n\nIf you agree to aid me, then you need only nod. I will pass you a parchment with my instructions on it. Read it over and consider my words.",o="阅读贱民的指引，然后从玛拉顿得到联合坠饰，将其交给凄凉之地南部的半人马贱民。",oEN="Read the Pariah's Instructions. Afterwards, obtain the Amulet of Union from Maraudon and return it to the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace.",p="你考虑得怎么样了，$n？你能帮助我吗？你愿意进入那块圣地并帮我重建一个伟大的半人马部族吗？",pEN="What did you decide, <name>? Can you help me? Will you set foot on holy ground to help me forge one great centaur tribe!?",c="就是这个，$r！就是这个！现在我就可以开始伟大的部族复兴计划了。谢谢你。\n\n请你拿着这个。希望我们下次见面的时候，一切都与现在不同。",cEN="This is it, <race>! This is it! Now I can begin the great task of uniting the tribes. Thank you.\n\nTake this for your efforts, please. I hope when next we meet, it will be on much different terms."}
Q[7068]={d="在半人马的圣地玛拉顿中有着强大的魔法，凄凉之地的半人马用他们的生命来保卫那个地方，但他们无法阻止我们拿走我们想要的东西。\n\n你现在要去一趟玛拉顿，寻找那些由暗影残片组成的石头生物。如果你把那种紫色的水晶交给我，那么尤塞尔奈就会为你付出的时间而奖励你。\n\n那个地方很危险，也许你应该找一些朋友与你一同探险。",dEN="Strong magics be found in the centaur holy place... the holy place of Maraudon. The Desolace tribes of centaur protect that place wit' their lives, but they canna stop us from takin' what we need.\n\nYou, you head to this Maraudon place and find the rock creatures made of shadowshard. You bring me the purple crystals, and Uthel'nay make you somethin' for your time.\n\nThe place be dangerous, so maybe you be bringing some friends.",o="从玛拉顿收集10块暗影残片，然后把它们交给奥格瑞玛的尤塞尔奈。",oEN="Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar.",p="你找到水晶了吗？强大的仪式，惊人的法术——那些裂影碎片可能对于各种魔法都有极大的帮助。",pEN="You find the crystals yet? Rituals of power, spells of great strength - those shadowshards maybe very helpful in all kind of arcane magics.",c="啊，这些对我的魔法来说简直是太完美了。给你，你可以拿走这些饰物中的一样，然后就赶快离开吧……我要开始进行研究工作了。",cEN="Ah, these be perfect for me magics. Here, you take one of these trinkets and be on your way... me got much studyin' to do."}
Q[7070]={d="我最近开始测试不同的水晶和它们所具有的魔法特性。普罗德摩尔女士让我征集一些旅行者去凄凉之地寻找一处被称作玛拉顿的地方。在那座废弃的庙宇中，巨大的元素生物带有紫色的石头，我把那种石头称为暗影残片。\n\n如果你决定去那里的话，请帮我找些暗影残片回来，我会非常感谢你的。如果你需要的话，我甚至可以用它们制作一件饰物给你。",dEN="I've recently begun testing various crystals and their arcane properties. Lady Proudmoore has given me leave to ask travelers heading into Desolace to seek out a place called Maraudon. Within the ruined temple are great elementals composed of purplish stones I've named shadowshards.\n\nIf you decide to head that direction and find some of the crystals, I would be very thankful. I could even fashion you a trinket from them if you so desired.",o="从玛拉顿收集10块暗影残片，然后把它们交给尘泥沼泽塞拉摩岛上的大法师特沃什。",oEN="Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Archmage Tervosh in Theramore on the coast of Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你去过玛拉顿了吗？我知道那是很危险的，但是如果你成功了，那一切努力都是值得的。",pEN="Have you made the trip yet? I realize it'd be quite dangerous, but if you were successful, it would very much be worth it.",c="这些真是太完美了，$n。我还征集了一些其它的冒险中从那里帮我收集水晶，所以我有充足的材料做出这些东西……嗯，从中拿一件作为你辛勤工作的奖励吧。感谢你把这些样品交给我来进行研究。",cEN="These are perfect, <name>. I actually had other adventurers return from there also and from them I was able to fashion these... please, feel free to take one for your hard work. And thank you again for more samples to study."}
Q[7081]={d="奥特兰克山谷的墓地是人人觊觎的领地。部落和联盟为了这些圣地拼死厮杀。$n，你$g愿意:愿意;加入这场战斗吗？\n\n我要你去袭击一处敌方墓地。找到一处插着部落旗帜的墓地，把旗帜从地里拔出来！做到这一点，你的任务就完成了……\n\n但如果你还能守住墓地几分钟，我们的部队很快就会赶来接替你。",dEN="The graveyards in Alterac Valley are prized territories. Both the Horde and the Alliance fight savagely for these sacred grounds. Are you, <name>, ready to join that fight?\n\nI want you to assault an enemy graveyard. Find a graveyard with a Horde banner in its midst, and pull it from the ground! Do that, and your task will be complete....\n\nBut if you can also hold the graveyard for a few minutes, then our troops will soon come to relieve you.",o="占领一座墓地，然后向丹巴达尔的诺雷格·雷矛中尉复命。",oEN="Assault a graveyard, then return to Sergeant Durgen Stormpike in the Alterac Mountains.",p="$n，你还没有占领一座墓地。当你完成任务之后再回到我这里来！",pEN="<name>, you have not yet assaulted a graveyard. Return to me when this task is complete!",c="干得好！墓地对于我们控制奥特兰克山谷具有十分重要的价值。当你占领一座墓地之后，联盟在这里的优势就得到了进一步的巩固。\n\n现在回到战场上去，$n。如果你再看到被部落占领的墓地……你就知道该怎么做了！",cEN="Well done! Graveyards are vital to our control of Alterac Valley. When you capture one, you help ensure the Alliance's sovereignty here.\n\nGo now, <name>. Reenter the battle, and if you see a graveyard under the Horde's control... you know what to do!"}
Q[7082]={d="奥特兰克山谷的前线时刻都在变化。当我们与敌人展开殊死搏斗时，领土的边界也随之进退。而$n，最惨烈的战斗正是在墓地里打响的。\n\n我要你去袭击一处被联盟占据的墓地！找到插着联盟旗帜的墓地，把它的旗帜从地上拔出来。\n\n做到这一点，你为我办的事就算完成了……但如果你还能在墓地里坚守几分钟，那它就是我们的了，我们的士兵很快就会赶来接替你。",dEN="The battle lines of Alterac Valley are ever shifting. Territories swing back and forth as we meet our opponents in deadly combat. And graveyards, <name>, are where battles rage most fierce.\n\nI want you to attack an Alliance held graveyard! Find a graveyard with an Alliance banner in its midst and pull it from the ground.\n\nDo that and your task for me will be complete, but... if you hold the graveyard for a few minutes, then it will be ours and troops will come and relieve you.",o="占领一座墓地，然后向霜狼村的亚斯拉复命。",oEN="Assault a graveyard, then return to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl in the Alterac Mountains.",p="为联盟占领一座墓地！",pEN="Attack a graveyard held by the Alliance!",c="干得好，$n！当我们控制了墓地之后，敌人的鲜血就将染红奥特兰克山谷的雪地！",cEN="Well done, <name>! With each graveyard under our control, the spirits of our enemies will wander more lost and aimless."}
Q[7101]={d="哨塔和碉堡是非常重要的战略设施，我们必须完全占领它们！因此，我要求你去进攻被敌人占领的哨塔和碉堡。\n\n想要占领一座哨塔和碉堡，你就必须杀进去，将联盟的旗帜拔掉，这样部落的旗帜就会在那里出现，然后大功告成！\n\n此时你就完成了我下达给你的任务，如果我们能够占据那些设施足够长的时间，并且不被联盟夺回去，那么我们就可以控制那一带了！",dEN="Towers and bunkers are important positions, and we must capture and hold them all! So to that end, I want you to attack a bunker that is controlled by the enemy.\n\nTo do that, enter one with an Alliance banner. You will see another banner inside. Pull out that banner, and a white Horde banner will appear in its place. Well done!\n\nAt that point your task for me will be complete, but if you hold the place long enough, and if the Alliance doesn't take it back, then it will be destroyed!",o="占领敌方的某座哨塔，然后向霜狼村的提卡·血牙复命。",oEN="Capture an enemy tower, then return to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl in the Alterac Mountains.",p="你还没有攻陷任何一座哨塔，$n！你是不是在等着别人来夺取属于你的荣耀？",pEN="You haven't yet assaulted a bunker, <name>! Are you waiting for others to claim your glory?",c="我听说你成功地完成了任务！这让我很高兴……\n\n我们的部队现在可以全面出击，让那些联盟的家伙尝尝苦头了。让他们知道奥特兰克山谷中没有他们的容身之地！",cEN="I heard of your mission's success! That pleases me...\n\nOur troops can now charge forward with impunity, and show the Alliance that Alterac Valley is no place for them!"}
Q[7102]={d="哨塔和碉堡是非常重要的战略设施，我们必须完全占领它们！因此，我要求你去进攻被敌人占领的哨塔和碉堡。\n\n想要占领一座哨塔和碉堡，你就必须杀进去，将部落的旗帜拔掉，这样联盟的旗帜就会在那里出现，然后大功告成！\n\n此时你就完成了我下达给你的任务，如果我们能够占据那些设施足够长的时间，并且不被部落夺回去，那么我们就可以控制那一带了！",dEN="Towers and bunkers are key defensive positions, and so we must hold as many as possible! I want you to attack a tower or a bunker in Alterac Valley.\n\nTo do that, enter a tower with a Horde banner atop it. You will see another enemy banner inside. Pull out that banner, and a white Alliance banner will appear in its place. Well done!\n\nAt that point your mission for me will be complete, but hold the area long enough, and if the Horde doesn't take it back, then it will be destroyed!",o="摧毁敌方的某座哨塔或者碉堡中的旗帜，然后向丹巴达尔的杜尔根·雷矛复命。",oEN="Destroy the banner at an enemy tower or bunker, then return to Sergeant Durgen Stormpike in the Alterac Mountains.",p="你还没有攻陷任何一座哨塔，$n！你在等什么？",pEN="You haven't yet assaulted a tower, <name>! What are you waiting for?",c="我接到报告说你成功地拔掉敌人的旌旗。干得好，$n！有了我们的步枪兵助阵，我们就可以抵御部落的反攻，并牢牢握住这块地区的控制权！",cEN="I received a field report stating you helped secure an enemy banner. Well done, <name>! With their ranged troops out of position we can move the line of battle forward!"}
Q[7121]={d="$n，我们的军需官让我派新兵去他那里报到。他需要奥特兰克矿洞中的矿藏作为军需之用，也许他会派你去采集它们。\n\n沿着这条路走，你可以在西边找到军需官。",dEN="<name>, our quartermaster charged me to direct new recruits to him. He needs supplies from caches stored in the mines of Alterac, and he'll probably send you to get them.\n\nFollow the road. You'll find our quartermaster to the west.",o="与雷矛军需管谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Stormpike Quartermaster.",c="在这里见到新兵真好，$n，不过运气好的话你很快就会投入战斗，不会当太久的$g新兵:新兵;！\n\n再来跟我说话吧。我有任务要和你商量……",cEN="It's good to see fresh troops here, <name>, but with a little luck you'll get into some action and won't be fresh for long!\n\nSpeak with me again. I have tasks I must discuss with you...."}
Q[7122]={d="奥特兰克的这座矿洞蕴藏不仅仅是矿藏。部落和联盟都在深铁矿洞和冷齿矿洞中储藏了大量的补给……如果我们能控制它们的话，那就太好不过了！\n\n占领一座矿洞，然后回到我这里来。想要占领一个矿洞的话，你必须进入一个还未被我们控制的矿洞并杀死那里的领袖。这样矿洞就是我们的了，而我们也将派遣部队来保护它！",dEN="The mines in Alterac Valley hold more than just minerals. Both the Frostwolf and Stormpike have cached excess supplies in the Irondeep and Coldtooth mines... that's not a bad idea, if we could only maintain control of them!\n\nCapture a mine, then return to me. To capture a mine, enter one that we do not control and kill its leader. When you do that, the mine will be ours, and we'll send troops to protect it!",o="占领一座还没有被雷矛部族控制的矿洞，然后向丹巴达尔的雷矛军需官复命。",oEN="Capture a mine that the Stormpike does not control, then return to Sergeant Durgen Stormpike in the Alterac Mountains.",p="你还没有占领一座矿洞，$n！\n\n只有控制了矿洞，我们才能方便地采集矿石和获取补给。",pEN="You haven't captured the mine yet, <name>!\n\nAfter we control a mine, it will be much easier to gather minerals and supplies from it.",c="你成功了！干得好，$n！\n\n只要我们控制了矿洞，并派遣部队驻扎在那里，我们就可以源源不断地获得物资补给了。",cEN="You did it! Well done, <name>!\n\nWhen we control a mine and have troops stationed there, it's much easier to gather minerals and supplies from it."}
Q[7123]={d="$n，霜狼军需官正在招募新兵，他需要派一些士兵深入奥特兰克山谷的矿洞。去和他谈谈吧，他会告诉你更多的信息。\n\n沿着西边的路进入碉堡，然后从西边的出口出去，你就可以找到军需官了。",dEN="<name>, the Frostwolf Quartermaster is looking for recruits, for tasks that lead into the mines of Alterac Valley. Speak with him; he will tell you more.\n\nFollow the road west into the bunker, then take the west exit and you'll find our quartermaster.",o="与霜狼军需官谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Frostwolf Quartermaster.",c="你好，$n！很高兴看到一位$g新来的:新来的;$c愿意为部落尽一份力。再来跟我说话吧，我有重要的任务要交给你……",cEN="Hail, <name>! It is good to see a <class> like yourself, eager to do his part for the Horde. Speak with me again, for I have vital tasks for you..."}
Q[7124]={d="奥特兰克山谷中战事不断升级，对冷齿矿洞和深铁矿洞的争夺也越来越激烈。丰富的矿藏和物资储备吸引了双方的势力，它们的价值实在是太高了！\n\n请帮助我们的部队，$n！为部落占领一座矿洞！你必须进入一个仍未被我们控制的矿洞，然后干掉其中的首领。当你完成这个目标之后，这座矿洞就是我们的了，而且我们会派遣部队驻守其中！",dEN="As battle rages over the landscape of Alterac Valley, so too does it rage through the Coldtooth and Irondeep mines. Both are rich sources of minerals and both are used to store supplies; it's no wonder they are so highly valued!\n\nHelp our war effort, <name>! Capture one of the mines for the Horde! To capture a mine, enter one that we do not control and kill its leader. When that is done, the mine will be ours and we'll send troops to protect it!",o="占领一座矿洞，然后向霜狼村的霜狼军需官报告。",oEN="Capture a mine, then return to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl in the Alterac Mountains.",p="你还没有占领一座矿洞，$n！找到一个还未被我们控制的矿洞，然后击败里面的首领！",pEN="You haven't yet captured a mine, <name>! Find one that we do not control and defeat it's leader!",c="你夺取了一座矿洞！由我们自己的战士把守，从深处开采矿石、收集藏在那里的物资都会容易得多。\n\n干得好，$n。你的这一行动为我们的战斗大业作出了巨大的贡献。",cEN="You captured a mine! With our own warriors protecting it, it will be much simpler to extract minerals from its depths, or gather supplies that have been cached there.\n\nWell done, <name>>. The deed you have done is a great boon to our battle efforts."}
Q[7141]={d="侦查人员报告说，在奥特兰克山谷中隐藏着许多神器，但是霜狼氏族的兽人不会让我们接近它们。我们不能让部落阻止我们对于学术的追求！去干掉他们的统帅，德雷克塔尔。只要他死了，那些兽人就会乱成一团。\n\n德雷克塔尔在奥特兰克山谷南端的霜狼要塞中，把他除掉，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="The Explorers' League believes there are artifacts in Alterac Valley, but the Frostwolf orcs won't let us explore. We can't allow the Horde to stop our scholarly pursuits! Defeat the Frostwolf general, Drek'Thar. With him dead, the orcs will lose their edge.\n\nDrek'Thar is in Frostwolf Keep, in the south of Alterac Valley. Vanquish him, and then return to me.",o="进入奥特兰克山谷，击败部落将军德雷克塔尔。然后回到勘查员塔雷·石镐那里。",oEN="Enter Alterac Valley, defeat the Horde general Drek'thar, and then return to Prospector Stonehewer in the Alterac Mountains.",p="你拿到地图了吗，$n？那些地图上可能标明了更多神器的位置！",pEN="Go, <name>. Go to Alterac Valley and defeat the orc general!",c="啊，你找到它们了！干得好，$n！我会让我们的勘察员对地图进行研究，以便决定未来的挖掘点。部落得知他们的将军被干掉的话一定会气急败坏，那时我们就能抽出工夫来进行更多的探索了！",cEN="Well done, <name>! With the Horde's nose bloodied after the death of their general, we'll have the breathing room we need to explore!"}
Q[7142]={d="雷矛矮人和他们的盟友侵入了奥特兰克山谷，我们必须把他们赶出去！要赢得奥特兰克之战，我们必须击败他们的将军范达尔·雷矛！\n\n你会在奥特兰克山谷北部的丹巴达尔找到范达尔。\n\n摧毁他，$n，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="The Stormpike dwarves and their allies have invaded Alterac Valley, and we must drive them out! To win the battle for Alterac, we must defeat their general, Vanndar Stormpike!\n\nYou will find Vanndar in Dun Baldar, in the north of Alterac Valley.\n\nDestroy him, <name>, and then return to me.",o="进入奥特兰克山谷，击败矮人将军范达尔·雷矛。然后回到沃加·死爪那里。",oEN="Enter Alterac Valley and defeat the dwarven general, Vanndar Stormpike. Then, return to Voggah Deathgrip in the Alterac Mountains.",c="你找到它们了！干得好，$n！这些计划可以告诉我们，那些雷矛卫队的家伙究竟想要从这次愚蠢的入侵中获得什么好处。\n\n哈哈！迄今为止，他们所得到的只是他们将军的葬礼！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Stormpikes have no hope in this foolish invasion.\n\nHah! So far, all they've done is get their general killed!"}
Q[7161]={d="你好，$c。经过如此长时间的等待，我们终于有机会响应战斗的召唤了。旧日的感觉正在慢慢恢复，我们又将热血沸腾！\n\n所有新兵都必须完成氏族的试炼。\n\n在附近的蛮爪豺狼人山洞里面有一面霜狼氏族的旗帜。去那里拿回旗帜，然后把它还给我，我就将授予你霜狼新兵的勋章。",dEN="Hail, <class>. It has been a long time since we have had the chance to answer the call of battle. The old feelings are slow to rise but once awakened, the blood does rush. The battle rage returns...\n\nAll newcomers to the Valley must first complete the rite of battle.\n\nDeep within the Wildpaw gnoll cave is a banner of the Frostwolf. Venture forth and recover the banner. Return it to me and I shall grant you the Frostwolf initiate's insignia.",o="到主基地东南边的蛮爪洞穴中去找到霜狼军旗，然后把它交给拉格隆德。",oEN="Travel to the Wildpaw cavern located southeast of the main base in Alterac Valley and find the Frostwolf Banner. Return the Frostwolf Banner to Warmaster Laggrond.",p="醒醒！醒醒，$n！这不是梦。你真的$g正:正;身处一场激烈的战斗之中！",pEN="Wake up! Wake up, <name>! This is not a dream. You really are entrenched in the midst of a raging battle!",c="你所感觉到的激情是你的灵魂正在被唤醒的证明——它已经响应了战争的召唤。\n\n现在你是霜狼氏族的一员了，$n。恭喜你。\n\n一直戴着这枚徽记吧。当你在霜狼中的军阶再次提升后就回来找我，我会给你颁发更高级、更强大的徽记。\n\n也许有一天你在霜狼氏族中获得最尊贵的荣誉。当那一天到来的时候，你将获得整个氏族军队的控制权。",cEN="That burning sensation you feel is your soul being awakened. Your spirit has accepted the call to arms.\n\nYou are now one of the Frostwolf, <name>. Congratulations.\n\nCarry this insignia with you at all times. As you advance among the ranks of Frostwolf, I will replace the insignia with other, more powerful insignias.\n\nPerhaps someday you will be exalted among the Frostwolf Clan. Should that day ever come, you will be granted the Eye of Command."}
Q[7162]={d="你来得真及时，$c。那些霜狼氏族的蛮子就是不愿意放弃！我们要让他们看看联盟真正的力量，让他们一溃千里。\n\n在你踏入战场之前，你最好先通过雷矛部族的试炼。\n\n在这里东南边的冰翼洞穴深处有一面雷矛部族的旗帜。到那里去，把旗帜带回来，然后把它交给我。这样你就可以得到一枚雷矛部族新兵的勋章。",dEN="You've arrived just in time, <class>. These Frostwolf savages just won't give up! We must show them the might of the Stormpike. They must bow to our superiority.\n\nBefore you make your way to the field of battle, you will want to join the rank of Stormpike.\n\nSouthwest of Dun Baldar, you will find the Icewing Caverns. Planted deep within the caverns is a Stormpike Banner. Venture forth and recover that banner. Return it to me, and you will have earned a Stormpike initiate's insignia.",o="到主基地东南边的冰翼洞穴中去找到雷矛军旗，然后把它交给哈格丁中尉。",oEN="Travel to the Icewing Caverns located southwest of Dun Baldar in Alterac Valley and recover the Stormpike Banner. Return the Stormpike Banner to Lieutenant Haggerdin in the Alterac Mountains.",p="小心那个地区的鹰身人，$c。它们会毫不留情地割破你的喉咙！",pEN="Beware the harpies of the region, <class>. They'll not think twice to rip out your throat!",c="拿着这枚徽记，$n。当你在雷矛卫队中的军阶再次提升后就回来找我，我会给你颁发更高级、更强大的徽记。\n\n也许有一天你会成为新的英雄，到那个时候，你就可以获得对整个卫队部队的控制权了。",cEN="Take and wear this insignia with pride, <name>. As your rank among the Stormpike grows, so too will the insignia. Return to me as you gain honor with Stormpike, and I shall replace your insignia with other, more powerful insignias.\n\nPerhaps someday you will grow to be a legend on this field of battle. Should that day ever come, you will be granted the Eye of Command."}
Q[7163]={p="<指挥官拉格隆德向你敬礼。>\n\n你的时刻到了，$n。你为霜狼氏族做了很多，也因此赢得了一席之地——不仅是霜狼的$g士兵:士兵;，更是$g朋友:朋友;。\n\n干得好！出示你的新兵徽章吧。",pEN="<Warmaster Laggrond salutes you.>\n\nIt is your time, <name>. You have done much for the Frostwolf Clan and in doing so, earned a place as not only a soldier of Frostwolf but also as a friend.\n\nWell done! Present your initiate's insignia.",c="这枚新徽章代表着你在霜狼中的军衔。随时随地都要带着它。\n\n还有，$c……要死得光荣。",cEN="This new insignia reflects your rank amongst the Frostwolf. Keep it on you at all times.\n\nAnd <class>... Die with honor!"}
Q[7164]={p="很高兴又见到你，$c！我没想到你还能活着回来。不过，你已经$g证明:证明;了自己是一位勇敢而荣耀的霜狼士兵。\n\n你的时刻又到了，$n。你赢得了新的军衔，也因此获得了一枚彰显你地位提升的新徽章。\n\n出示你的徽章吧。",pEN="It is good to see you again, <class>. I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf.\n\nYour time has come again, <name>. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.\n\nPresent your insignia.",c="<拉格隆德向你致敬。>\n\n出发吧，$n！继续为霜狼氏族作战。我们一定要赢得这场战争！为了德雷克塔尔！为了大酋长！",cEN="<Warmaster Laggrond salutes.>\n\nGo, <name>! Continue your defense of the Frostwolf. This war must be won! For Drek'Thar! For the Warchief!"}
Q[7165]={p="死者众多。鲜血浸透了大地。然而……你还$g活着:活着;……你坚持了下来。你率领我们的军队取得了无数胜利。因此，士兵，你赢得了新的军衔。\n\n出示你的徽章吧。",pEN="So many slain. Blood drenches the fields. Yet... You live... You have persevered. You have led our armies to many victories. For this, then, soldier, you have earned a new rank.\n\nPresent your insignia.",c="<指挥官拉格隆德发出咆哮。>\n\n士兵，关于你事迹的传言已经开始流传。雷矛只要听到你的名字就会吓得发抖。继续这样干下去！",cEN="<Warmaster Laggrond roars.>\n\nThey have already begun telling tales of your deeds, soldier. The Stormpike shakes in fear when your name is uttered. Carry on!"}
Q[7166]={p="你身上散发着统御与力量，$c。在霜狼眼中地位$g崇高:崇高;的你，敌人光是听到你的名字就会畏缩。\n\n站起来，霜狼的$g英雄:英雄;。站起来接受荣耀吧！\n\n出示你的徽章。",pEN="Your radiate command and power, <class>. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name.\n\nRise, Hero of Frostwolf. Rise and be honored!\n\nPresent your insignia.",c="我们的部队将听从你的调遣！",cEN="Soon, all on the field of battle will be under your watchful eye. Command of the Valley and its troops will be yours!"}
Q[7167]={p="德雷克塔尔对你赞不绝口。卡利姆多到处都是你英雄事迹的传闻。酋长容光焕发，你对我们氏族的坚定守护令他极为满意。\n\n你赢得了统御之眼。\n\n出示你的徽章吧，指挥官$n。",pEN="Drek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.\n\nYou have earned the Eye of Command.\n\nPresent your insignia, Commander <name>.",c="倾泻出徽记的力量吧，让敌人听到你的声音，让他们被你震慑。部落的力量不容蔑视！",cEN="Channel the power of the insignia. Let the enemy hear your words. The might of the Horde is unquestionable!"}
Q[7168]={c="让我们的敌人看看，$g一名:a名;有军衔的士兵已经把他们打倒了！为雷矛的荣耀而战！",cEN="Let our enemies see that a soldier of rank has struck them down! Fight for the glory of Stormpike!"}
Q[7169]={c="国王也已经听闻了你的英雄事迹，$c。继续为雷矛卫队作战吧！",cEN="The king has been made aware of your battlefront heroics, <class>. Continue in your stalwart defense of the Stormpike Guard!"}
Q[7170]={c="当初我们相识时，我绝不会想到$g一位英雄:一位英雄;正在成长。继续前进吧，士兵！",cEN="When we first met, I would have never guessed that a hero was in the making. Carry on, soldier!"}
Q[7171]={c="将来背负统御之眼的人一定是你！",cEN="Surely it will be you who carries the Eye of Command!"}
Q[7172]={p="让他们听见你的声音，指挥官$n！让他们知道恐惧。让他们看看雷矛的军衔蕴藏着怎样的力量！",pEN="Let them hear your voice, Commander <name>! Let them know fear. Show them what power the Stormpike holds in their rank!",c="率领我们部队走向胜利的人必须是你，指挥官！士兵们都听从你的号令。他们会服从你的直接命令。带领他们……碾碎霜狼。",cEN="<Warmaster Laggrond salutes.>\n\nGo, SN! Continue your defense of the Frostwolf. This war must be won! For Drek'Thar! For the Warchief!"}
Q[7201]={d="只有那些进入深渊的冒险者才能迎接这个挑战，$n。\n\n黑铁矮人已经掌握了制造强大的作战傀儡的方法。\n\n来自间谍的报告显示，那些矮人使用某种独特的能量源为他们所创造的傀儡提供无与伦比的杀戮能力。\n\n如果我们能得到这种元素精华的话，我们的憎恶怪就可以得到极大的加强！把那座城市翻个底朝天也在所不惜，找不到精华你就别回来！我们给予的报酬值得你去冒这个险。",dEN="There is work to be had for those venturing into the depths, <name>.\n\nThe Dark Irons have mastered creation of extremely powerful golems.\n\nInitial reports from our spies indicate that the dwarves use a unique power source to give their creations incomparable killing power.\n\nJust imagine what we could do with our abominations if we could get our hands on this essence of the elements! Turn that city upside down if you must, but do not return until you have found the essence! Payment will be worth the risk.",o="前往黑石深渊，取回10份元素精华。你的第一反应是去找那些石像鬼和制造石像鬼的人。你记起薇薇安·拉格雷也曾低声嘟囔过关于元素生物的事。|n",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.",p="<搓揉着她的双手。>\n\n给我看看！",pEN="Show them to me!",c="棒极了！我立刻就派信差把它们送到幽暗城去！\n\n这是我承诺会给你的报酬。拿着吧！",cEN="Wonderful! I will have these sent by courier to the Undercity at once!\n\nAs for you - here is payment, as promised. Keep the change, you filthy beast!"}
Q[7223]={d="战争在奥特兰克山谷激烈地进行着，从铁炉堡运来的物资不足以让我们为部队提供充足的补给。\n\n如果你能在战场上找到护甲碎片，那么就帮我带一些回来吧！",dEN="Battles rage constantly in Alterac Valley, and the supplies we get from Ironforge are not enough to outfit our experienced troops.\n\nIf you find armor scraps from the battlefield, aid the war effort and bring those scraps to me!",o="给丹巴达尔的莫高特·深炉带去20块护甲碎片。",oEN="Bring 20 Armor Scraps to Murgot Deepforge in Dun Baldar.",p="你带回护甲碎块了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring any armor scraps, <name>?",c="这里有不少上好的材料呢，$n。我可以用这些东西来给我们的军队提供新的装备。\n\n如果我可以得到更多补给的话，也许我们的主力部队就就可以开进战场了！",cEN="These are some good pieces, <name>. I can use them to fashion new equipment for our troops.\n\nIf my supply level gets high enough, then maybe our seasoned fighting units will enter the field!"}
Q[7224]={d="当你和敌人作战的时候，收集他们护甲的碎片并把它们带给我。我会用这些碎片来制作我们自己军队的护甲的！",dEN="When you fight the enemy, gather the scraps of their armor and bring them to me. I'll use those scraps to make armor for our own troops!",o="给霜狼村的铁匠雷格萨带去20块护甲碎片。",oEN="Bring 20 Armor Scraps to Smith Regzar in Frostwolf Village.",p="收集工作进行得怎么样，$n。你有没有可以给我的护甲碎块？",pEN="How goes the hunting, <name>. Do you have any armor scraps for me?",c="这些材料正好可以用。我会将它们溶解然后再把它们重新铸造起来，然后看起来绝对不会看出来是从雷矛那些懦夫那里来的！\n\n谢谢你，$n。让我为你清洁一下你的护甲……",cEN="These will do nicely. I'll melt them down and patch them up and you'll never know they came from those Stormpike cowards!\n\nThanks, <name>. And let me polish up that armor of yours..."}
Q[7241]={d="远方的大地上战鼓轰隆，$c。你的酋长所庇护的氏族正遭到铁炉堡阴险的雷矛卫队的攻击。\n\n光看你的样子，我就知道你身经百战，也已经$g准备好:准备好;为霜狼的事业而战。\n\n现在必须由你迈出成长路上的下一步。\n\n在奥特兰克的塔伦米尔以北，你会找到奥特兰克山谷的入口。指挥官拉格隆德就在那里。快去吧，$c，战斗就要打响了！",dEN="The drums of war sound off in a distant land, <class>. The favored clan of your Warchief is under attack from the nefarious Stormpike Guard of Ironforge.\n\nBy the looks of you, I can discern that you are indeed battle hardy and prepared to take on the cause of the Frostwolf.\n\nIt is you who must now take the next step in your evolution.\n\nNorth of Tarren Mill, in Alterac, you will find the entrance to Alterac Valley. It is there that you will find Warmaster Laggrond. Hurry <class>, for the battle is upon us!",o="到希尔斯布莱德丘陵地区的奥特兰克山谷去。找到拉格隆德并和他谈谈，然后成为霜狼氏族的士兵。",oEN="Venture to Alterac Valley, located in the Alterac Mountains. Find and speak with Warmaster Laggrond - who stands outside the tunnel entrance - to begin your career as a soldier of Frostwolf. You will find Alterac Valley north of Tarren Mill at the base of the Alterac Mountains.",c="要成为一名霜狼$g士兵:士兵;，必须先接受考验……",cEN="To become a soldier of Frostwolf, one must first be tested..."}
Q[7261]={d="我们正在奥特兰克山谷进行一场血腥的战斗，蒙昧的冰斧巨魔和野蛮的霜狼氏族从两边夹击我们。以麦格尼·铜须陛下的名义，我们一定要把他们全都消灭掉！占领那片土地，将敌人赶出去，这对于王国的稳定是非常重要的。\n\n啊，士兵可不是从树上长出来的！向奥特兰克的哈格丁中尉报告，在那里加入雷矛部族的军队，开始履行你光荣的职责吧。",dEN="We are fighting a brutal battle in the valleys of Alterac. The savage Frostwolf Clan challenges the might of the Stormpike! They must be exterminated in the name of King Magni Bronzebeard! The taking, culling, and turning of that land is a sovereign and territorial imperative to the kingdom of Ironforge.\n\nAlas, soldiers do not grow on trees! Report to Lieutenant Haggerdin outside Alterac Valley to begin your tour of duty and honor amongst the Stormpike.",o="到希尔斯布莱德丘陵地区的奥特兰克山谷去。到那里之后，和哈格丁中尉谈谈。\n\n为了铜须的荣耀！",oEN="Travel to Alterac Valley in the Hillsbrad Foothills. Outside of the entrance tunnel, find and speak with Lieutenant Haggerdin.\n\nFor the glory of Bronzebeard!",c="开工吧！",cEN="Let's get to work!"}
Q[7321]={d="谁说亡灵就不懂烹饪？就拿我这份海龟汤的秘方来说吧。我认识一些人，他们宁愿从坟墓里爬出来，就为了喝上一碗！嘿嘿……\n\n说起来，我很久没做过这道汤了。以前我常亲自去洛丹米尔湖猎捕那些讨厌的钳嘴龟，可现在我离不开这里的工作。\n\n如果你能给我带些钳嘴龟的龟肉来，我就教你怎么做！",dEN="Who says that the undead don't know anything about cooking? Take my secret recipe for Turtle Bisque, for example. I've known folks that would come back from the dead just to enjoy a bowl! Heh, heh...\n\nSpeaking of which, I haven't been able to make any lately. I used to head over to Lake Lordamere myself to hunt snapjaws, the nasty things, but I can't pull myself away from my work here.\n\nIf you bring me some Turtle Meat from the snapjaws, I'll show you how it's done!",o="给塔伦米尔的克里斯托弗·杰弗寇特带去10块海龟肉和一些舒心草。",oEN="Bring 10 pieces of Turtle Meat to Christoph Jeffcoat in Tarren Mill.",p="幸运光环笼罩着你找到原因了吗？我告诉你，联盟狗在这一片真是太多了……在我看来，他们离得够近了。",pEN="Any luck finding the ingredients? I'll tell you, the alliance maggots are far too numerous in this area now... In my opinion, they have come far too close already...",c="我的海龟汤可以让你在寒冷的夜晚也能感到温暖……如果你还能感觉到温暖的话。",cEN="My soothing turtle bisque will keep you warm on a cold night... if you care about that kind of thing."}
Q[7341]={p="你好，$r。我是考拉克，来自雷霆崖的赏金猎人。我游历了整个世界，见识过很多奇异的事情。\n\n我穿越了整个南海，并偶然找到了这些奇妙的瑟银之箭。啊，我有无数的箭，但是我的子弹都用光了。呸，没有好的装备，一个牛头人怎么可能横行战场。这些箭现在毫无用处！\n\n我们来进行一个交易:你可以用瑟银弹来交换我的瑟银之箭。怎么样？",pEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Kolark, Bounty Hunter from Thunderbluff. Much of the world I have traveled and much I have seen.\n\nMy journeys across the South Seas led to the discovery of these wonderous thorium headed arrows. Alas, I have an endless supply of the arrows but have exhausted my supply of shells. Bah, no self respecting Tauren would ever be caught dead using a flimsy bow. The arrows are useless!\n\nI will offer a trade: An even exchange of thorium shells for my thorium headed arrows. Deal?",c="太好了！我说到做到，$r；这些箭归你了。",cEN="Excellent! I am a Tauren of my word, <race>. The arrows are yours."}
Q[7342]={p="你信这种破烂吗？！从卡拉诺斯运来的最后一批弹药全毁了！现在我们手上只有这些一折就断、毫无用处的破箭！我拿五十万支瑟银箭头的箭该怎么办？\n\n这样吧，$g小子:姑娘;。如果你能给我弄来瑟银弹，我就用瑟银箭头的箭和你换——直接换！成交吗？",pEN="Can you believe this rubbish?! The last shipment of ammunition from Kharanos was botched! All we have for ammo now are these flimsy, good for nothing arrows! What in the world am I going to do with 500,000 thorium headed arrows?\n\nI'll tell you what, kid. If you can bring me thorium shells, I'll trade you thorium headed arrows - straight up! Deal?",c="你带来我要的东西了，交易成功！这些箭是你的了。",cEN="A done deal if I ever saw one! The arrows are yours."}
Q[7361]={d="<纳亚克咆哮着。>\n\n暗夜精灵的祖先是巨魔，有巨魔才有暗夜精灵。\n\n他们对于我们的攻击是无法忍受的。鹿盔想要把我们全部干掉——那么就让我们干掉所有听从他命令的蠢货！他们决无可能达到他们的目的！\n\n你每杀掉一个暗夜精灵，纳亚克都会代表暗矛部族对你表示感谢。你的事迹将会在整个卡利姆多和东部王国传播开来。现在就出发，为了暗矛部族而战！",dEN="<Najak snarls.>\n\nBefore the night elves existed there was troll. It was from troll that the night elves came.\n\nTheir mutinous attacks against my people will not be tolerated. Staghelm seeks to wipe us out - to leave no trace of those that bore him and his ilk. It will not happen!\n\nFor every night elf that you slay and decapitate, Najak will grant you favor amongst the Darkspear. Word of your deeds will be spread across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms. Go now and serve the Darkspear!",o="你被指派去杀死奥特兰克山谷中的暗夜精灵玩家。\n\n杀死一个暗夜精灵，然后把暗夜精灵的头颅交给霜狼要塞的纳亚克·海克森。",oEN="You have been tasked with slaying opposing night elf players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a night elf and return to Najak Hexxen at Frostwolf Keep with a Severed Night Elf Head.",p="他们想要灭绝我们？他们自己才应该被灭绝。",pEN="They seek to exterminate us? It is they who shall be exterminated.",c="$n，这只是成千上万中的一个。不过，干得不错。",cEN="<name>, it is but one of thousands. A job well done nonetheless."}
Q[7362]={d="长者派我到这个战场上来研究其他的种族。我在这里最主要的任务就是对侏儒进行分析，玛加萨对于他们的生存能力很感兴趣。啊，那些侏儒——虽然他们看上去如此可怜而娇小——但他们却能迸发出今人惊讶的韧性。\n\n祝你好运，我一直以来都在找人帮我完成玛加萨的任务。当你收集到侏儒的头发之后就把它交给我，这样你就会被认为是牛头人的盟友。",dEN="The Elder Crone has sent me to this warzone to research the other races. More specifically, I am to collect gnome samples. Magatha is primarily interested in their survivability. Aye, the gnomes - while pitifully weak and miniscule - exude great resilience both in and out of combat.\n\nFortunately for you, I am looking for ruffians to do Magatha's bidding. Return to me with tufts of gnome hair and you shall be known to the tauren as an ally.",o="你被指派去杀死奥特兰克山谷中的侏儒玩家。\n\n杀死一个侏儒，然后把一束侏儒的头发交给霜狼要塞的拉瓦克·恐怖图腾。",oEN="You have been tasked with slaying opposing gnome players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a gnome and return to Ravak Grimtotem at Frostwolf Keep with a Tuft of Gnome Hair.",p="我可不管头发是什么地方来的，$r。",pEN="I don't care where the hair comes from, <race>.",c="没错，这绝对是侏儒。干得好，$r，不过还有更多活儿要干。",cEN="Aye, this is definitely gnome. Well done, <race>, but there is more work to be done."}
Q[7367]={d="霜狼部族在他们的前线和基地中都布置了陷阱，$c。所以当你进入敌人领地的时候，必须多加小心。\n\n如果你想要放心大胆地攻击他们的话，就得先摧毁这种针对单兵的防御武器——我要你做的就是干掉他们的爆破专家。如果你杀了他，就可以安全地拆除那些地雷。因为只要他被干掉了，那些地雷也就变成了一堆废物。\n\n你可以在冰血要塞附近的哨塔里找到他。祝你好运！",dEN="The Frostwolf have their front lines and bases booby trapped, <class>. You have to watch your step when invading enemy territory.\n\nIf you want to make a solid strike against them, you must destroy their source of anti personnel munitions - I'm talking about their explosives expert. If you kill him, you are safe to disarm the mines. As long as he is kept down, the mines will also stay down.\n\nYou will probably find him in a tower near the Iceblood Garrison. Good luck!",o="找到霜狼爆破专家并干掉他。完成任务之后向雷矛爆破专家复命。",oEN="Find the Frostwolf Explosives Expert and kill him. Return to the Stormpike Explosives Expert when the task is complete.",c="哈！你干掉那个霜狼破坏者了？干得好，<name>！没有了他们的爆破专家，那些地雷短时间内不会再被引爆了。\n\n我们部队前方的路安全多了！",cEN="Ha! You got that Frostwolf saboteur? Good work, <name>! Without their explosives expert, those mines won't be coming back anytime soon.\n\nThe road ahead just got a lot safer for our troops!"}
Q[7368]={d="我对关于地雷的技术细节了如指掌，我负责将所有的地雷埋设在前线。\n\n如果你想要解除雷矛部族的地雷阵，你要做的就是干掉对方的爆破专家。那个矮人懦夫无疑藏在征战平原的第一座哨塔中。把他干掉，联盟就没法再埋设地雷了。\n\n在你干掉他之后，别忘了回到我这里来通报一声，你会得到奖励的。",dEN="I know all about landmines. I'm the one that lays all the mines on the front lines here, after all.\n\nIf you want to defuse the Stormpike mine fields, all you have to do is kill their explosives expert. That dwarven coward is no doubt hiding in the first tower on the Field of Strife. Take him out and those landmines won't come back after they've been disarmed.\n\nIf you do happen to kill him, come back here and let me know. No good deed should go unrewarded.",o="找到雷矛爆破专家并干掉他。完成任务之后向霜狼爆破专家复命。",oEN="Find the Stormpike Explosives Expert and kill him. Return to the Frostwolf Explosives Expert when the task is complete.",c="那只雷矛的老鼠不会再埋设地雷了，是吧？干得漂亮，<name>。他们的爆破专家出局之后，我们就能放心推进，不用再担心隐藏的陷阱了。\n\n霜狼氏族欠你一份人情。",cEN="That Stormpike rat won't be laying any more mines, eh? Excellent work, <name>. With their explosives expert out of the picture, we can advance without worrying about hidden traps.\n\nThe Frostwolf Clan is in your debt."}
Q[7383]={d="然而泰达希尔并不是一切都尽如人意。范达尔·鹿盔对于世界之树的计划正如他自己所希望的那样一步步展开了，但是还有一个小问题，这个问题或许会给泰达希尔带来一些麻烦。\n\n不过我不打算介入此事。你得去一趟最后一口月亮井，就在这里西北面的神谕林地里，就在神谕之树的树干下面，那是我们的第一口也是最强大的一口月亮井。在那里灌一瓶水，然后回来向我报告。",dEN="All was not well with Teldrassil, however. Staghelm's carefully made plans for the new World Tree had borne out as he had hoped, but there was one small problem, a problem to which many of the troubles on Teldrassil may be attributed.\n\nHowever, I will not get into that yet. You must visit the last moonwell, to the northwest in the Oracle Glade. Under the boughs of the Oracle Tree lies the first and most powerful of our wells. Retrieve a phial of its water and return to me.",o="用月亮井的水装满紫水晶瓶，然后把它交给多兰纳尔的科瑞萨斯·月怒。",oEN="Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.",p="神谕之树、大德鲁伊和德鲁伊们一起密切关注着泰达希尔的成长。但是虽然我们有了一个新家，但我们还没有重新得到不朽的生命。",pEN="Along with the druids, the Oracle Tree and the Arch Druid have been carefully monitoring the growth of Teldrassil. But though we have a new home, our immortal lives have not been restored.",c="在神谕之树面前……你会感觉到自己几乎能把智慧抓在手里。让我继续说下去……\n\n随着泰达希尔的成长，大德鲁伊去祈求巨龙的祝福，因为在古代，那些巨龙的地位远在诺达希尔之上。但是时间之王诺兹多姆拒绝祝福泰达希尔，反而斥责德鲁伊的傲慢。和诺兹多姆一样，阿莱克斯塔萨也拒绝了德鲁伊们的要求，但是没有她的祝福，泰达希尔的成长就会受到不良的影响，后果难以预料……",cEN="To be in the presence of the Oracle Tree... it is almost to feel wisdom take form. Let me continue the telling...\n\nWith Teldrassil grown, the Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed upon Nordrassil in ancient times. But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance. In agreement with Nozdormu, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable..."}
Q[7385]={p="你可以为我提供更多敌人的鲜血。我很乐意接受更多，$n。",pEN="You have the option of offering larger quantities of the blood taken from our enemies. I will be glad to accept gallon sized offerings, <name>.",c="我会将这些血液和先前收集到的血液混合，在献祭结束之后，冰雪之王就会让雷矛氏族的那些蠢货尝尝霜狼氏族的厉害！",cEN="The blood of our enemies has been shed. I shall mix this blood with the rest that has been gathered. Once the offering is complete, the Ice Lord shall show these Stormpike dogs the full wrath of the Frostwolf Clan!"}
Q[7386]={p="有时候你会在战斗中$g一连坚守:一连坚守;数日甚至数周。在那段较长的作战期间，你最终可能会收集到大量霜狼的风暴水晶。\n\n环环议会接受这样的供奉，$n。",pEN="There are times which you may be entrenched in battle for days or weeks on end.\n\nDuring those longer periods of activity you may end up collecting large clusters of the Frostwolf's storm crystals.\n\nThe Circle accepts such offerings, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。我可以使用这些水晶中的力量来增强现有的魔法。当我积累了足够的力量之后，就可以释放这些力量，召唤森林之王来帮助我们。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I will use the power of these charms to augment the magic that has already been gathered. When enough power has been amassed, I shall focus the collected energies and call upon the Forest Lord to aid our cause."}
Q[7401]={d="根据亚斯拉·血矛的命令，在战场上遇到矮人的时候要格杀勿论。\n\n如果你在战场上干掉了矮人，就把他们的脊椎骨挖出来，留下那具血迹斑斑的尸体，警告所有胆敢冒犯霜狼氏族的蠢货。\n\n把脊椎骨交给亚斯拉·血矛，以此来证明你的功勋。",dEN="By order of Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl, all dwarves on the field of battle are to be killed on sight.\n\nShould you slay a dwarf in combat, rip out their spine, leaving a spineless heap of stink and rot to serve as a warning to any and all that dare oppose the might of the Frostwolf.\n\nReturn to Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl with proof of your heroics.",o="你被指派去杀死奥特兰克山谷中的矮人玩家。\n\n杀掉一个矮人，然后把矮人的脊椎交给霜狼要塞的亚斯拉·血矛。",oEN="You have been tasked with slaying opposing Dwarf players in Alterac Valley.\n\nKill a Dwarf and rip out their spine. Take the Dwarf Spine to Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl at Frostwolf Keep.",p="我做的可是批发的讽刺生意，士兵。",pEN="I deal in wholesale irony, soldier.",c="你现在有了成打屠戮矮人的许可，$n！\n\n<亚兹拉朝远处望了一会儿。>\n\n你永远不会忘记自己第一次抽脊椎……",cEN="You now have license to decimate dwarves by the dozen, <class>!\n\n<Yazra stares off into the distance for a moment.>\n\nYou never forget your first de-spining..."}
Q[7424]={c="*德克把蹄子扔进身后的那一堆里。*",cEN="*Dirk throws the hoof in a pile behind him.*"}
Q[7429]={p="我说的是戈多克镣铐钥匙——好吧，那些胖家伙是这么叫它的。任何巨魔都有可能拿着这把钥匙，不过我不清楚到底谁拿着它。没准那些卫兵是负责看管钥匙的……\n\n啊呀，我到底在想什么？你已经拿到钥匙了，对吧？",pEN="It's called the Gordok Shackle Key - well, that's what these \"tons o' fun\" keep calling it. I think any of the ogres might have it, but I'm not sure if any specific ones do. Maybe the guards have a better chance of having one...\n\nWhat am I talking about - you have it already, don't you?! Is that it there??!",c="哦，谢谢你放了我！你……是$g最棒的:最棒的;。其他所有人跟你比都差得远了。\n\n我就知道我的命运不该是成为某个食人魔的开胃菜！",cEN="Oh, thank you for freeing me! You - ranked number one. Everyone else - ranked number two or lower.\n\nI knew my life was destined for more than just being an appetizer to some ogre!"}
Q[7441]={d="我只是让自己稍微松懈了一下，就酿成了大错。在我匆匆逃离堕落王子的魔爪时，我被洗劫一空。一个名叫普希林的小鬼拿走了我的法术书，还有艾德雷萨拉斯大厅的钥匙。\n\n我对钥匙已经不再有兴趣了，因为我已经以永生换来了自由，但是我一定要找回我的法术书。\n\n找到普希林，然后找回我的法术书。\n\n到厄运之槌的扭木广场去找普希林吧。",dEN="I had let my guard down for only one moment, stranger. In my haste to escape the grip of the fallen Prince, I was robbed. A most foul demon, the imp Pusillin, pilfered my book of incantations and the key to the once great halls of Eldre'Thalas.\n\nI no longer hold interest in the key, as I have exchanged my immortality for freedom, but I desperately need my book of incantations.\n\nFind the imp, Pusillin, and recover my book.\n\nSearch the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul for Pusillin.",o="到厄运之槌去找到小鬼普希林。你可以使用任何手段从小鬼那里得到埃斯托尔迪的咒术之书。\n\n找到咒术之书后，回到拉瑞斯小亭的埃斯托尔迪那里。",oEN="Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.\n\nReturn to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",p="我无怨无悔，陌生的$r。女王很久之前就已经逝去，辛德拉的工作成果已经被那个托塞德林王子的疯狂毁灭了。我要的只是自由……我只有选择逃跑……",pEN="I regret nothing, stranger. The Queen has long since passed. The works of the Shen'Dralar have been marred by the madness of Prince Tortheldrin. I seek only freedom... Escape...",c="你终于找到它了！那个小鬼真可怜。啊，我这里还有一些很不错的东西，你可以从中选择一件。",cEN="You have found it! A curse upon that miserable imp. Alas, my material possessions are meager at best. You may choose from what I have to offer."}
Q[7461]={d="你听够了吗？你是那种$g行动派:行动派;吗？\n\n这种疯狂必须结束。不朽者的时代早已过去。摧毁环绕着能量塔的守卫，削弱那道力场。做完这些之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。当王子的力量大幅削弱时，进攻并终结他。让这座城市的灵魂安息吧。",dEN="Have you heard enough? Are you a <man/woman> of action?\n\nThis madness must come to an end. The age of the immortals has long since passed. Destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, attack and end him. Lay the spirits of this city to rest, adventurer.",o="你必须干掉5座水晶塔周围的守卫，那5座水晶塔维持着关押伊莫塔尔的监狱。一旦水晶塔的能量被削弱，伊莫塔尔周围的能量力场就会消散。\n\n进入伊莫塔尔的监狱，干掉站在中间的那个恶魔。最后，在图书馆挑战托塞德林王子。\n\n当任务完成之后，到庭院中去找辛德拉古灵。",oEN="You must destroy the guardians surrounding the 5 Pylons that power the Prison of Immol'thar. Once the Pylons have powered down, the force field surrounding Immol'thar will have dissipated.\n\nEnter the Prison of Immol'thar and eradicate the foul demon that stands at its heart. Finally, confront Prince Tortheldrin in Athenaeum.\n\nReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.",p="小心，$g冒险者:冒险者;。王子很……有说服力。",pEN="Be wary, adventurer. The Prince is... persuasive.",c="我们感谢你，$g英雄:英雄;。",cEN="We thank you, hero."}
Q[7462]={d="你可以在图书馆的楼梯下方找到一只古老的箱子，从中拿取你所需的东西吧。",dEN="In the library, Athenaeum, you will find an ancient chest hidden beneath the stairway. Take from it that which you desire.",o="返回图书馆去找到辛德拉的宝藏。拿取你的奖励吧！",oEN="Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",c="你打开了箱子，发现了……",cEN="You open the chest to find..."}
Q[7463]={d="一位$g$r法师:$r法师;！多么奇妙。我已经……哦，算算有多久了？五百年没见过你这样的族人了！\n\n我有样东西能解你的渴，不过你得先替我办件事。\n\n<莱德罗斯窃笑。>\n\n埃雷萨拉斯出了异常。一只水元素在东翼住了下来。必须把它的存在记录下来！\n\n去扭木区，从海多斯pawn身上提取一份元素精华。把它带回来给我，我就教你一个有用的小法术。",dEN="A <race> mage! How wonderous. I have not seen one of your kind for... oh what is it going on now? 500 years!\n\nI have something that will quench your thirst, but first you must do a task for me.\n\n<Lydros snickers.>\n\nThere is an anomaly in Eldre'Thalas. A water elemental has taken residence in the east wing. His presence must be catalogued!\n\nVenture to the Warpwood Quarter and extract a portion of the elemental essence of the Hydrospawn. Return it to me and I shall teach you a useful cantrip.",o="到厄运之槌的扭木广场去杀掉水元素海多斯博恩。把海多斯博恩精华交给图书馆的博学者莱德罗斯。",oEN="Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.",p="什么？我认识你吗？",pEN="Yes? Do I know you?",c="太棒了！你刚才说你是谁？哦，不重要。我该给你什么来着？嗯……好吧，你是$c，也许这个对你会有点用。",cEN="Wonderful! Who are you again? Oh it matters not. What was I supposed to give you? Hrm... well you are a <class>, perhaps you will find this useful."}
Q[7481]={d="几年前，一个名叫卡里尔·温萨鲁斯的精灵领主独自带着几件上古精灵的神器逃离了他那饱经战乱的家乡。\n\n为了寻找这位失踪的领主，我们离开了奎尔萨拉斯的废墟，穿过燃烧平原以及广阔的海洋，最终来到了菲拉斯。\n\n我们认为他就躲在埃雷萨拉斯（现在被称为厄运之槌）的大厅里。\n\n你必须找到他，冒险者。无论他是死是活，我们必须拿回那些他所带走的东西！",dEN="Several years ago, a lone elven master named Kariel Winthalus fled the devastation of his homeland with several ancient elven artifacts in tow.\n\nOur search for this lost master lead us from the ruins of Quel'Thalas, through the Burning Steppes, across the great expanses of the sea, to Feralas.\n\nWe suspect that the elf sought sanctuary in the halls of Eldre'Thalas (what is now known as Dire Maul).\n\nYou must find him, adventurer. Whether alive or dead, the knowledge he carried must be recovered!",o="到厄运之槌去寻找卡里尔·温萨鲁斯。向莫沙彻营地的先知科鲁拉克报告你所找到的信息。",oEN="Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.",p="我的同事，暗夜精灵的学者卢索恩·纹角正在找人帮助他来完成这项任务。",pEN="My associate, the night elf scholar, Runethorn, is recruiting her allies for this task.",c="真是遗憾……真是一场悲剧。你说那些东西不见了？没有任何线索，是不是？",cEN="A shame... a tragedy. The items are lost you say? No trace of him, eh?"}
Q[7482]={d="几年前，一个名叫卡里尔·温萨鲁斯的精灵领主独自带着几件上古精灵的神器逃离了他那饱经战乱的家乡。\n\n为了寻找这位失踪的领主，我们离开了奎尔萨拉斯的废墟，穿过燃烧平原以及广阔的海洋，最终来到了菲拉斯。\n\n我们认为他就躲在埃雷萨拉斯（现在被称为厄运之槌）的大厅里。\n\n你必须找到他，冒险者。无论他是死是活，我们必须拿回那些他所带走的东西！",dEN="Several years ago, a lone elven master named Kariel Winthalus fled the devastation of his homeland with several ancient elven artifacts in tow.\n\nOur search for this lost master lead us from the ruins of Quel'Thalas, through the Burning Steppes, across the great expanses of the sea, to Feralas.\n\nWe suspect that the elf sought sanctuary in the halls of Eldre'Thalas (what is now known as Dire Maul).\n\nYou must find him, adventurer. Whether alive or dead, the knowledge he carried must be recovered!",o="到厄运之槌去寻找卡里尔·温萨鲁斯。向羽月要塞的学者卢索恩·纹角报告你所找到的信息。",oEN="Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon with whatever information that you may find.",p="我的同事，牛头人的先知科鲁拉克正在找人帮助他来完成这项任务。",pEN="My associate, the night elf scholar, Runethorn, is recruiting her allies for this task.",c="真是遗憾……真是一个悲剧。你说那些东西不见了？没有任何线索，是不是？",cEN="A shame... a tragedy. The items are lost you say? No trace of him, eh?"}
Q[7483]={d="温萨鲁斯在这里的东侧遗失了急速圣典，那本圣典可以给你的装备附加上少许的加速效果。那只是一个微不足道的小魔法，真的……\n\n不管怎么样，如果你感兴趣的话，就去把圣典和一些基本材料给我带来。\n\n嗯……你还需要准备一些英雄之血，一块原始黑钻石，外加一些大块魔光碎片。当然我也有可能说得不完全正确！\n\n<莱德罗斯耸了耸肩膀。>",dEN="Master Winthalus lost the Libram of Rapidity in the east wing. The Libram will allow for a minor haste cantrip to be placed upon your equipment. Parlor tricks, really...\n\nRegardless, if you are interested, you will need to present the Libram along with some basic reagents.\n\nHrm... I believe it also requires blood of heroes, a pristine black diamond, and large brilliant shards. I could be wrong!\n\n<Lydros shrugs.>",o="将急速圣典、1块原始黑钻石、2份大块魔光碎片和2份英雄之血交给厄运之槌的博学者莱德罗斯，以换取一份急速秘药。",oEN="Bring a Libram of Rapidity, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Blood of Heroes to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Rapidity.",p="你有什么事？我还有很多事得做！",pEN="What is it? I have much cataloguing to do!",c="<莱德罗斯打了个哈欠。>\n\n答应我，这份疾速秘纹，千万别一次用光它。\n\n<莱德罗斯窃笑>",cEN="<Lydros yawns.>\n\nAs promised, the Arcanum of Rapidity. Don't spend it all in once place.\n\n<Lydros snickers.>"}
Q[7484]={d="这本圣典几乎令一个年轻的学者废寝忘食。但是，几个星期之后他就不再热衷于此了。\n\n你们当中那些对魔法更有洞察力的$r会发现，这些东西是非常有趣的。\n\n专注圣典已经不见了，我相信是那些上层精灵的灵魂拿走了它。\n\n把圣典给我拿来，再准备一些大块魔光碎片和暗影之皮，外加一块原始黑钻石，然后我就可以合成秘药了。",dEN="This libram almost aroused interest in one of the younger Lorekeeper's familiars. Poor thing, it was only a few weeks old.\n\nThose among you who are more magically inclined might find this item interesting.\n\nThe Libram of Focus was lost in this wing. I can only assume one of the Highborne spirits holds it in their possession.\n\nBring the Libram along with some large brilliant shards, skin of shadow, and a pristine black diamond and I shall conjure the Arcanum.",o="将专注圣典、1块原始黑钻石、4份大块魔光碎片和2张暗影之皮交给厄运之槌的博学者莱德罗斯，以换取一份专注秘药。",oEN="Bring a Libram of Focus, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 4 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Skin of Shadow to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Focus.",p="你又来了？这一次你有什么事？",pEN="You again? What could you possibly want now?",c="施放附魔的时候别伤着自己，$r。",cEN="Don't hurt yourself when applying the enchantment, <race>."}
Q[7485]={d="他因为遗失了圣典而像婴孩一样哭泣。告诉你吧，我自己也曾因为一些文字而哭泣——世界上没有比知识和历史化为乌有更大的损失了——但是为了这些几乎无用的咒语而哭泣，这值得吗？太荒谬了！这让我相信王子把他杀掉对他来说反而是一种恩惠。\n\n把圣典交给我，还有一块原始黑钻石和一些大块魔光碎片，外加一份磨损的憎恶缝合线，这样我就可以帮你合成秘药了。\n\n哦，你应该到北侧去找那本圣典。",dEN="He wept like an infant at the loss of this libram. Mind you, I myself have wept over texts - there is no greater loss than that of knowledge and history - but to cry over this nearly useless jumbling of incantations? Preposterous! It left me to believe that the Prince was doing him a favor in flaying the flesh from his bones.\n\nBring the Libram along with a pristine black diamond, large brilliant shards, and a frayed abomination stitching and I shall recreate the Arcanum.\n\nOh, and check the north wing.",o="将防护圣典、1块原始黑钻石、2份大块魔光碎片和1份磨损的憎恶缝合线交给厄运之槌的博学者莱德罗斯，以换取一份防护秘药。",oEN="Bring a Libram of Protection, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 1 Frayed Abomination Stitching to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Protection.",p="我的耐心让你免受痛苦。",pEN="My patience prevents your suffering.",c="嗯……冷静一下。正如我所承诺的那样，这里是给你的秘纹。",cEN="Yes, yes... Calm yourself. As promised, here is your Arcanum."}
Q[7486]={d="$n，你对于水元素的贡献已经超出我们对于这个世界中的凡人所抱有的期望。\n\n我们不知道你们这些凡人如何对待这样的贡献，或者如何奖励杰出的成就，但是这一次……也许我们应该给予你一些奖励。\n\n在这座岛南部的水下有一只箱子。你可以在里面找到你的……奖励。\n\n去吧，$n。去拿取你的奖励吧。",dEN="<name>, your services to the Warlords surpassed all we could expect from the denizens of this world.\n\nWe do not understand your people's notions of gratitude, or rewarding good works, but in this case... perhaps a reward is warranted.\n\nUnder the surf at the southern base of this island, you will find a coffer. In it you will find your... reward.\n\nGo, <name>. Claim your reward.",o="从海达克西斯的箱子拿取你的奖励。",oEN="Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer.",c="海达克西斯的声音从水面上传来……\n\n\"$n，选你最中意的那件吧。愿它保护你对抗水领主的敌人。\"",cEN="Hydraxis' voice descends from the waters' surface...\n\n\"Choose that which best suits you, <name>. May it protect you against the foes of the Waterlords.\""}
Q[7487]={d="裂隙在我们四周不断裂开、撕扯、闭合，$r。离我站立之处不到两步就有一道裂隙，它穿过黑石山脉的深处，直通火焰领主的咽喉。\n\n惊讶吗？真遗憾……凡人种族无法理解他们看不见、摸不着、感觉不到的东西。\n\n但我向你保证，传送门就在那里，进入是可能的。\n\n我勾起了你的兴趣？调谐很简单。闯入黑石深渊，取回一块核心碎片。把它带给我，我就把你的精华与传送门调和起来。",dEN="Rifts stir, tear, and collapse all around us, <race>. Not two paces from where I stand is a tear leading through the depths of Blackrock Mountain, into the maw of the Firelord.\n\nSurprised? Pity... The mortal races cannot comprehend that which they cannot see, touch, or feel.\n\nI assure you, the portal is there and access is possible.\n\nI've piqued your interest? Attunement is simple. Venture into Blackrock Depths and retrieve a core fragment. Return it to me and I shall attune your essence with the portal.",o="进入黑石深渊，在通往熔火之心的传送门附近找到一块熔火碎片，然后回到黑石山脉的洛索斯·天痕那里",oEN="Venture to the Molten Core entry portal in Blackrock Depths and recover a Core Fragment. Return to Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain when you have recovered the Core Fragment.",p="现在跳入裂缝之中将会给你带来无穷的灾难……",pEN="You must attune your soul with the Molten Core before access is granted.",c="步入我右方的裂隙，你就将进入熔火之心。",cEN="I am now able to transport you to the Molten Core. Ask and it shall be done."}
Q[7488]={d="蕾瑟塔蒂丝是一个邪恶的血精灵法师，她对魔法有着近乎变态的痴迷，而且残忍无比，现在她逃进了厄运之棰中。蕾瑟塔蒂丝制造了一张可以收集魔法能量的网。我担心如果不加以控制的话，她的力量将会足以摧毁整个世界！\n\n去阻止她，$n。找到她并拿回她的网。她应该在厄运之槌的扭木广场中，就在那些萨特附近。把她的网交给我，让我来把它的能量安全地释放出来。",dEN="The mage Lethtendris, a vicious blood elf whose brutality is matched only by her twisted addiction to magic, has fled into Dire Maul. She has created a device, a web to ensnare the magical energies of that place and we fear that, if left unchecked, she will cause irreparable damage to our world!\n\nStop her, <name>. Find her and retrieve her web. She is likely near the satyrs in Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul. Bring the web to me so that its power may be released safely back into the wilds...",o="把蕾瑟塔蒂丝的网交给菲拉斯羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛。",oEN="Bring Lethtendris' Web to Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="你拿到了网了没有，$n？我们必须驱散它所汇集的魔法能量！",pEN="Do you have the web, <name>? Its concentrated magical energy must be dissipated!",c="你取回那张网了！干得好，$n！蕾瑟塔蒂丝和她那一类精灵一样，对滥用魔法可能给我们世界带来的危险视而不见。他们以为自己是魔法的主人；却没意识到自己其实是瘾症的奴隶。她的死让我难过，但那是必要的。\n\n谢谢你，$n。我会让网中蕴藏的能量在一片广阔区域内安全地释放掉，然后摧毁这张网，防止它将来再被用于魔法上的图谋。",cEN="You retrieved the web! Well done, <name>! Lethtendris, like many elves of her ilk, are blind to the dangers the abuse of magic can cause to our world. They believe they are masters of magic; they do not realize that they are slaves to their own addiction. Her death saddens me, but it was necessary.\n\nThank you, <name>. I will have the energies within the web released safely over a wide area, and then I'll destroy it to prevent future magical exploits."}
Q[7489]={d="血精灵蕾瑟塔蒂丝已经疯了，她极端饥渴着收集魔法的力量，这使她敢于挑战她的同胞，并创造了一种危险的装置，一张可以收集厄运之棰中的那些被污染的魔法能量的网。现在她正在收集那些能量，并计划将其用于对付她的敌人。\n\n我们必须阻止蕾瑟塔蒂丝。在厄运之槌的扭木广场找到她，击败她，把她的网交给我，这样我们也许可以把它交给那些头脑比较冷静的血精灵进行研究。",dEN="The blood elf Lethtendris has overstepped her bounds. So eager was she to gather magical power that she defied her brethren and created a device of insidious design, a web meant to siphon the tainted magical energies of Dire Maul. Even now she gathers those energies and plans to release them against her enemies.\n\nLethtendris must be stopped. Find her within the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul, defeat her and bring her web to me so that it might be returned to more clear-headed blood elves for study.",o="把蕾瑟塔蒂丝的网交给非拉斯莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄。",oEN="Bring Lethtendris's Web to Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="$n，你拿到蕾瑟塔蒂丝的网了吗？",pEN="<name>, do you have Lethtendris's Web?",c="你干得很好，$n。这张网包含了大量厄运之槌中的能量，我认为如果它继续留在像蕾瑟塔蒂丝这样的家伙手里，会对我们造成很大的威胁。我对于她的死感到悲伤，但是谁让她多此一举地制造了这张网呢？\n\n谢谢你，$n。我会把网送到那些比蕾瑟塔蒂丝更有负责感的魔法学员那里，他们将负责保管它。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. This web holds within it vast stores of the magic of Dire Maul, and I fear what damage may be unleashed if those energies were harnessed by one so irresponsible as Lethtendris. I am saddened by her death, but I know that she could never part with her web while alive.\n\nThank you, <name>. I will send the web to students of magic more responsible than Lethtendris. They will be the new wardens of its power."}
Q[7491]={d="伦萨克在力量谷等你。\n\n<萨尔向你致敬。>\n\n不要让你的民众等得太久，英雄。",dEN="Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength.\n\n<Thrall salutes you.>\n\nDo not keep your public waiting, hero.",o="在力量谷找到伦萨克。",oEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",p="让我看看这个。",pEN="Let me see this.",c="请选择你的奖励，然后我们就将开始庆祝你光辉的胜利。",cEN="Choose your reward and let the celebration of your glorious victory begin."}
Q[7492]={d="菲拉斯的牛头人长者塔罗·刺蹄派人送信请求帮助。他并没有详细述说详情，但是他说他需要一个有着足够的勇气而且做事细致的冒险者来帮助他。\n\n为了部落而战，$n。到菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地去找塔罗谈谈吧。",dEN="Talo Thornhoof, a Tauren elder in Feralas, sends a request for aid. He offered few details, but he did say that he needs agents for a matter both delicate... and dire.\n\nServe the Horde, <name>. Go to Camp Mojache in Feralas and speak with Talo.",o="和菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",c="啊，很高兴看到$g一位:一位;$c响应我的召唤。我需要你的效力，$n，恐怕我托付你的事会带你踏上一条危险的道路……\n\n一条通往厄运之槌的路。",cEN="Ah, it is good to see a <class> heed my summons. I have need of your services, <name>, and fear they will take you down a dangerous path...\n\nA path into Dire Maul."}
Q[7493]={c="一个屠龙者，同时还是一个老练的制皮师？你让我感到十分吃惊，英雄。\n\n请接受我将要教给你的东西。这种知识对于准备去摧毁所有黑龙军团的你来说是十分有用的。\n\n我要教你如何使用黑龙公主奥妮克希亚的皮来制作一件披风，当你和你的队友与黑石之王奈法利安作战的时候，这件披风可以让你们不至于被他那炽热的火焰气息烧成灰烬。",cEN="A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.\n\nPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.\n\nCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian."}
Q[7494]={d="$n！菲拉斯需要你的帮助！\n\n一个名叫蕾瑟塔蒂丝的流亡法师逃进了古代暗夜精灵的遗迹——埃雷萨拉斯，现在那里被称为厄运之槌。她手中有一件非常危险的魔法物品，我们一定要拿回它。\n\n拉托尼库斯·月矛要求派遣强大的冒险者进入厄运之槌，从蕾瑟塔蒂丝手里拿回那件东西。\n\n为了联盟而战！你可以在菲拉斯的羽月要塞中找到拉托尼库斯。",dEN="<name>! Your aid is needed in Feralas!\n\nAn outlaw mage, Lethtendris, has fled to the ancient elven ruins Eldre'thalas, now called Dire Maul. It is believed she has an item of dangerous magical energy which must be recovered.\n\nLatronicus Moonspear requests agents to enter Dire Maul and retrieve the item from Lethtendris.\n\nServe the Alliance! Seek out Latronicus at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",o="和菲拉斯羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",c="你好，$n。很高兴见到你，只是如果我们的会面发生在更让人愉悦的环境之下就好了。\n\n听好了，我有个重要的任务要交给你……",cEN="Hail, <name>. I am pleased to see you, but regret that our meeting is not under more pleasant conditions.\n\nListen close, for I have a vital task for you..."}
Q[7496]={d="到英雄谷去找到玛丁雷少校，$n。他会在那里等着你……",dEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, <name>. He will be expecting you...",o="在英雄谷找到玛丁雷少校。",oEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes.",p="让我看看这个。",pEN="Let me see this.",c="除了庆典之外，你还可以选择一些东西作为奖励，$n。请选择你想要的奖励，然后我们就可以开始隆重的庆典了。",cEN="Few are graced with such ceremony, <name>. Please, choose your reward so that we may begin the celebration."}
Q[7497]={c="一位屠龙者，还是一位经验丰富的制皮师？你总是让我惊叹，英雄。我深感荣幸。\n\n请接受我即将教给你的东西。如果你想摧毁黑龍军团残留的一切，这些知识将无比珍贵。\n\n用母龙的鳞片制作这件披风。它会保护你和你的盟友，抵御黑石之王……奈法利安的烈焰吐息。",cEN="A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.\n\nPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.\n\nCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian."}
Q[7498]={d="这本典籍印有图书馆的标记。",dEN="The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.",o="将这本典籍交给它的主人。",oEN="Return the book to its rightful owners.",p="你找到了一本书！",pEN="You have recovered a tome!",c="干得漂亮，$r。如果你再找到更多的典籍，尽管还给我们。\n\n随着时间推移，我们往往会调整、甚至增加归还失散典籍的奖励。",cEN="Excellent work, <race>. Should you find any more tomes, do not hesitate to return them to us.\n\nAs time passes, we tend to change around and even add new rewards for the return of missing tomes."}
