Q[7868]={c="你向我们证明了你的实力，$n。作为奖励，请收下这个护理包！你可以在里面发现一些补给品和绷带，这些东西只有在战歌峡谷中才能使用。\n\n当你在战歌峡谷的战场上不断证明自己的价值之后，就能找到更多可以购买的东西。当你在我们这里的声望到达友善后，你就能购买这些补给品，而当你的声望达到尊敬后，就可以购买绷带。",cEN="You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, <name>. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch.\n\nAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored."}
Q[7877]={d="你可以在图书馆的楼梯下方找到一只古老的箱子，从中拿取你所需的东西吧。",dEN="In the library, Athenaeum, you will find an ancient chest hidden beneath the stairway. Take from it that which you desire.",o="返回图书馆去找到辛德拉的宝藏。拿取你的奖励吧！",oEN="Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!",c="你打开了箱子，发现了……",cEN="You open the chest to find..."}
Q[7881]={p="我们暗月马戏团的人要走很多路。我们从一个集市地点走到另一个……事实上，你永远看不到我们在工作时坐下来！所以我们磨坏很多靴子也就不奇怪了！我们需要既耐穿又时髦的靴子，而浮雕皮靴正好符合要求。\n\n你！你是$g制皮师:制皮师;；给我做几双浮雕皮靴，我就用一张暗月马戏团奖券作为报酬。",pEN="We at the Darkmoon Faire do much walking. We walk from one faire site to another... in fact, you'll never see us sitting down on the job! So it is no surprise that we wear out quite a lot of boots! We need boots that are both durable and stylish, and embossed leather boots fit that bill rather well.\n\nYou! You're a leatherworker; make me embossed leather boots and I'll give you a Darkmoon Faire ticket for the work.",c="感谢你，$n。你干得真不错。你的手艺绝对是顶级的！这里是给你的暗月马戏团奖券……希望你喜欢，$g先生:女士。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. These are quite well made. The craftsmanship is top notch! Here is a Darkmoon Faire ticket... enjoy, sir."}
Q[7882]={p="我们的工作人员不仅仅是负责清扫垃圾的！他们还在大篷车在巡游的时候负责警戒，因此他们需要优质的护甲。\n\n如果你可以制作结实的皮甲，那我可以保证它一定会物尽所用。我会给你一些暗月马戏团奖券作为报酬。",pEN="Our Faire workers do more than sweep trash and hammer spikes! They also help guard the carnival as it travels, and to that end they are always needing good sturdy armor jerkins.\n\nIf you make some tough leather armor and bring it to me, then I'll make sure it gets to the right people. I'll also get you some Darkmoon Faire tickets as trade.",c="啊，你把皮甲上衣带来了。太好了。请问你用了什么动物的皮来做这些？缝线做工很好，皮革的质感也带着一种粗犷的风格。看得出你是$g有手艺的工匠:有手艺的工匠;！\n\n谢谢你，$n，这是你的奖券。",cEN="Ah, you brought the jerkins. Splendid. What animal's skin did you use to make these, may I ask? The stitch-work is very well done, and the texture of the leather has a rugged style to it. I can tell you are a craftsman of skill!\n\nThank you, <name>, and here are your tickets."}
Q[7883]={p="亚布·尼比盖尔正在找寻更多的天才来加入他的演出，他正在找世界上个头最大的地精。你知道有身材尺寸合适的地精吗？\n\n在我们找到那个地精之前，他希望可以把他的演出服装给准备好。我想野人背心就可以胜任，你可以制作一些背心吗？如果可以的话，我会给你一叠暗月马戏团奖券的……",pEN="Yebb Nebblegear is looking to add more talent to his show, and he's searching far and wide for the world's largest gnome. Do you know any gnomes of considerable size?\n\nWell before he finds the gnome, he wants to have its costume ready. I think a barbaric harness would be a good foundation for the costume; can you make some harnesses and bring them to me? Do that, and I'll have a stack of Darkmoon Faire tickets for you...",c="哦，天啊，这些戏服还真大！我无法想象有侏儒可以合身的穿上它们，但是不要担心——如果我们找到的侏儒身材不够大的话，那么我可以调整他的戏服。\n\n非常感谢，$n。这是我允诺给你的奖券。",cEN="Oh dear, these are quite large!! I can't imagine finding a gnome that would fit snuggly into them, but not to worry - if the gnome we find is not big enough, I can make adjustments to his costume.\n\nMany thanks, <name>. Here are the tickets I promised you."}
Q[7884]={p="亚布正在为他的动物园增加新的观光景点，包括一间沼泽小屋，用来安顿一个被鳄鱼喂养长大的小男孩，或者也许是给一个鱼人住的。我们需要高档的防水护腿，避免在水底行动的时候弄得浑身湿透。我想我们需要龟壳护腿。\n\n$n，你可以制作这种护腿吗？如果可以的话，那么一大堆暗月马戏团奖券就是你的了……",pEN="Yebb is working on other attractions for his zoo, including wet, swampy abodes for a boy raised by crocolisks, and perhaps for a murloc. We will need nice, water-tight leggings so we won't get waterlogged during prop-ups and tear-downs. For that job, I think turtlescale leggings will do the trick.\n\n<name>, can you make those leggings? If you do, then a fat stack of Darkmoon Faire tickets will be your reward...",c="太好了！这些东西很不错……我希望我不是那个将要去清扫鳄鱼笼子的家伙。那些野兽的兽性十足，嗯嗯……\n\n这是你的奖券，$n。尽情享受你在暗月马戏团的时光吧！",cEN="Great, you made them! These will do nicely... I just hope I won't be the one to clean the crocolisk cage when the time comes. Those beasts can be rather beastly, don't you think?\n\nHere are your tickets, <name>. Enjoy them, and enjoy your stay at the Darkmoon Faire!"}
Q[7885]={p="你可能不会相信，但是经营一个流动的嘉年华会是很花钱的！每样东西都耗损的那么快，我们还可以赚钱实在是个奇迹。\n\n为了节省开支，我们一直在寻找方法来尽可能便宜的维护我们的设备。举例来说，我们的帐棚常常会裂开，但是我发现皮制护甲片可以拿来做很好的修复。你可以帮我带一些护甲片来吗？这会让我们在买新帐篷的花费上节省许多！如果你可以做到的话，我有一大堆的暗月马戏团奖券可以给你……",pEN="You might not realize this, but running a traveling carnival is costly! Everything wears down so fast it's a wonder we can turn a profit.\n\nBecause of all those hidden costs, we're always looking for ways to maintain our equipment as cheaply as possible. Our tents, for instance, tear regularly but I've found that leather armor kits make great patches. Can you find and bring me some armor kits? That'll save us a bundle! Do that, and I have a fistful of Darkmoon Faire tickets for you...",c="太棒了！我刚刚发现了帐篷上的一条裂缝，正需要用这些护甲片中的一块来修补它！\n\n非常感谢你，$n。它们可以帮我们节省大量的修补费用。这里是你的奖券——祝你玩得愉快！",cEN="Great! This will work great! I just noticed a rip in a tent over yonder, and one of these armor kits is just what I need to patch it up!\n\nThank you very much, <name>. These armor kits will save us a ton in repair costs. Here are your tickets - you deserve them!"}
Q[7889]={p="要当世界上最强壮的女人可不是一件容易的事情！我的体重已经开始变得太轻了，要维持适当的身材就需要增加更多体重！\n\n你认为你可以给我弄一些镇石来吗？如果可以的话，那么我会给你一张暗月马戏团奖券。",pEN="It takes a lot of work to be the strongest woman alive! My weight set is getting too light and if I'm to stay fit then I'll need more weights!\n\nDo you think you could bring me some weight stones? If you do, then I'll give you a Darkmoon Faire ticket.",c="太棒了！这些东西非常合适！它们不太重，但是也不太轻，正好用来帮我来强化肌肉！\n\n非常感谢你，$n。这是你的暗月马戏团奖券！",cEN="Great! These will work great! They're not too heavy, but not too light either. They're perfect for building muscle mass!\n\nThanks much, <name>. Here's your Darkmoon Faire ticket!"}
Q[7890]={p="如果你想要帮我健身的话，我需要一根两头穿着重砂轮的杖子，然后我把这根杖子举过头顶来锻炼。听起来并不简单，但是作为世界上最强的女人，我不能有丝毫的松懈！\n\n你能不能帮我？我需要更多的重砂轮——给我弄一些来，我可以用暗月马戏团奖券和你进行交易。",pEN="To help with my workout, I like to fit a staff between heavy grinding stones, then lift the staff over my head. It isn't easy, but being the strongest woman in the world, like I am, can't be earned sitting down!\n\nCan you help me? I need more grinding stones - bring me some and I'll trade Darkmoon Faire tickets for them.",c="你把石头带来了，$n！而且好重！$n，我已经能感觉到肌肉在变大了。谢谢你！\n\n拿着，收下这些奖券，在集市里可别吃太多甜食。像你这样又高大又强壮的$g家伙:家伙;，必须保持战斗状态！",cEN="You brought the stones! And they're heavy! I can already feel my muscles getting bigger. Thanks <name>!\n\nHere, take these tickets, and be sure not to eat too many sweets while your at the faire. A big strong <class> like you needs to keep himself in fighting shape!"}
Q[7891]={p="我正在忙着制作一件新的戏服，当我有自己的展台来展示我是世界上最强的女人时，就可以穿着它上台了！现在我正在寻找合适的护腕。它们不能遮盖太多，否则大家就看不到我的肌肉了，另外我希望它能有些闪光，你明白了吗？\n\n你看绿铁护腕是不是适合我呢，$n？你可以帮我做一双绿铁护腕吗？如果可以的话，我有许多的暗月马戏团奖券可以送给你。",pEN="I'm working on a new costume, for when I have my own booth as the strongest woman alive! Right now I'm looking for some bracers I can wear. They can't cover much because people want to see my muscles, but I still want to flash a little color, you know?\n\nHow about green iron bracers, <name>? Can you make me green iron bracers? If you can, then I have a whole bunch of Darkmoon Faire tickets for you.",c="多谢了，$n。这是你的暗月马戏团奖券！",cEN="Thanks much, <name>. Here's your Darkmoon Faire tickets!"}
Q[7892]={p="作为世界上最强的女人，我计划从观众那里收集各种东西，然后用大锤把它们全都敲碎！\n\n你可以帮我制作一柄巨型黑锤吗，$n？",pEN="For my act as the strongest woman alive, I plan to accept items from the audience and smash them with a big, black mace!\n\nCan you make me a big black mace, <name>?",c="多谢了，$n。这是你的暗月马戏团奖券！",cEN="Thanks much, <name>. Here's your Darkmoon Faire tickets!"}
Q[7893]={p="$n，在我寻求成为世上最强的女人过程中，我曾周游世界，从各种高手那里和古书中学到了强化肌肉的秘密。我掌握着可以让你将弱者轻松击溃的锻炼方法！\n\n要进行这种训练的话，我需要很多砂轮。$n，你有砂轮吗？",pEN="<name>, in my quest to become the strongest woman alive, I have traveled the world and learned muscle building secrets from distant weight masters, strength gurus, and ancient manuals. I now know forbidden exercises that would kill the weak and cripple the uninitiated!\n\nThese feats of strength and conditioning require training with the densest of grinding stones. <name>, can you find or make some grinding stones and bring them to me? I'll give you tickets if you do...",c="多谢了，$n。这是你的暗月马戏团奖券！",cEN="Thanks much, <name>. Here's your Darkmoon Faire tickets!"}
Q[7894]={p="亚布正在为动物园研制一种新玩意儿，它能使人们沉浸在疯狂的愉悦中！但是这东西需要耗费大量精力和原料……\n\n其中包括铜质调节器。我们需要大量的铜质调节器作为机械部件，我会用暗月马戏团奖券来与你交换。",pEN="Yebb is developing a new attraction for the Zoo Bizarre, one that will drive people crazy with wonder, and delight! But it will take a lot of work, and a lot of materials...\n\nThat includes copper modulators. We need lots of modulators for the mechanical parts of the attraction. Bring me copper modulators and I'll trade for them with a Darkmoon Faire ticket.",c="啊哈！调节器！太棒了！\n\n我不能告诉你我们到底在造什么，但它们对建造至关重要。我欠你一份人情，$n，不过请收下这张暗月马戏团奖券，作为我谢意的表示。",cEN="Aha! The modulators! Superb!\n\nI can't tell you exactly what we're building, but these will be invaluable for its construction. I am in your debt, Grimling, but please, take this Darkmoon Faire ticket as a token of my appreciation."}
Q[7895]={p="我的崭新的售货亭将是一道风景线，没错！一道风景线，而且……只有少数的幸运儿才可以接近！\n\n当顾客走近我的售货亭时，那些高速青铜齿轮便会欢快地吟唱起来！\n\n啊……现在我需要一些高速青铜齿轮来实现这一梦想。$n，请给我弄点高速青铜齿轮来吧……我会用暗月马戏团奖券来和你交换的！",pEN="My new booth will be a sight to see, yes sir! A sight to see, and... for a lucky few, to touch!\n\nI can already hear the whirring bronze gizmos singing their song of mechanical rapture as patrons step to my booth and test their skill!\n\nAh... now I need the gizmos themselves to bring my dream closer to fruition. Please, <name>, bring me whirring bronze gizmos... and Darkmoon Faire tickets will be yours!",c="你带来了高速青铜齿轮！太棒了！我现在就能听到这些高速青铜齿轮欢快的吟唱声！啊，当我的售货亭一切就绪时，它将成为世界上最伟大的奇观，等着瞧吧！\n\n这是你的奖券，$n。尽情享受吧！",cEN="You brought the gizmos! Wonderful! Even now I can hear their buzzing, whirring chorus in my mind! Oh, when this booth is ready it will be the wonder of the world, mark me!\n\nHere are your tickets, <name>. And please enjoy your stay at the Faire!"}
Q[7896]={p="当我的售货亭一切准备就绪，开始营业时，我会做一些广告！还有什么宣传方式比烟火更加有效呢？\n\n嗯，或许有人认为在沸腾的大熔炉中翻煮敌人的头颅更能吸引人群，但是……我们这里什么种族的成员都有。烟火一定能达到华丽的效果！\n\n给我绿色烟火，$N，我会用一叠暗月马戏团奖券来交换的。",pEN="When I finally get this booth up and running, I'll want to advertise! And what better way is there to advertise than with fireworks?\n\nWell, some might think that the smell of a cauldron, churning with the boiling heads of your foes is better for drawing crowds, but... we're in mixed company. So fireworks it will have to be!\n\nBring me green fireworks, <name>, and I have a big fistful of Darkmoon Faire tickets for you.",c="你带来了烟火，好极了，$N！我真想赶快点燃烟火，告诉全世界我的售货亭开张啦！但是还得等等，恐怕还得相当一段日子……等我准备就绪，自然会开张的。\n\n这儿是你的奖券，$N。尽情享受吧！",cEN="You brought the fireworks. Wonderful work, <name>! I can't wait to light these and tell the world that my booth is ready to go! I must still wait, quite a long time I'm afraid, but... I'll be ready when I'm ready, yes?\n\nHere are the tickets, <name>. Enjoy yourself!"}
Q[7897]={p="我的售货亭不能开张的最大原因是……所有的东西都坏啦！我需要机械修理包进行修理！\n\n你能给我机械修理包吗，$n？我会用暗月马戏团奖券来交换的，你觉得怎么样？",pEN="The biggest reason I can't open up my booth is that... everything's broken! I need mechanical repair kits to fix all this stuff!\n\nCan you bring me those kits, <name>? I'll trade you... kits for Darkmoon Faire tickets. What do you say?",c="谢谢你！现在我可以修理这些东西啦。\n\n我需要大量的机械修理包，不眠不休好多天才能把所有东西都修理完毕。有时，我觉得自己最好回到故乡，重操旧业，做一名猎头者，但是……暗月马戏团对我来说相当重要。\n\n带上这些奖券，$n，尽情享受吧！",cEN="Thank you! Now I can get to fixing things.\n\nIt's going to take a lot of repair kits and a lot of late nights to get everything in working order. Sometimes I think it'd be better to get back to my roots and restart my career as a headhunter, but... the Faire has been good to me.\n\nTake these tickets, <name>, and have fun!"}
Q[7898]={p="亚布·尼比盖尔跟我一样，正在进行一项新发明。叶博说，这个这东西是那么的惊人华丽，足以把整个世界的人都吸引过来……这将会让我们每个人都变的非常非常的富有！\n\n他说他需要瑟银零件来进行这项工程，所以要我去收集给他。你觉得如何，$n？你想要用瑟银零件来交换暗月马戏团奖券吗？",pEN="Yebb Nebblegear, like me, is working on a future attraction. So amazing is this attraction, says Nebb, that it will draw folks from across the world... and it will make us all very, very rich!\n\nHe says he needs thorium widgets for its construction, and wants me to collect them for him. So what do you say, <name>? Do you know where to get Thorium widgets? If you're an engineer, can you make them? Do you want to trade them for Darkmoon Faire tickets?",c="啊，谢谢你，$n！亚布会用得到它们的。我不知道他准备用这些东西来干什么，但亚布是个聪明的小侏儒……他聪明得几乎有些狡猾了……\n\n如果他喜欢吃人，那他简直就是个彻头彻尾的巨魔了！\n\n拿着这个，$n。这些奖券是你的了。",cEN="Ah, thank you, <name>! Yebb will enjoy these widgets. I don't know what he has planned for them, but Yebb's a clever little gnome. He's clever, and maybe a little devious....\n\nIf only he liked the taste of humanoid flesh... he'd make a great troll!\n\nHere, <name>. A deal's a deal, and these tickets are yours."}
Q[7899]={p="要吸引人潮的第一课就是:用小东西跟小玩意儿引诱他们！你可以帮我吗？\n\n我需要毛茸茸的小爪子做为奖品。你可以在贫瘠之地或是黑海岸的猫身上取得它们……\n\n帮我带一些爪子来，我可以用暗月马戏团奖券来交换它们。",pEN="The first lesson in drawing a crowd is: lure them with gadgets and trinkets! Can you help me?\n\nI need small furry paws to use for prizes. You can find those on the cats of the Barrens or Darkshore....\n\nBring me some paws and I'll trade you a Darkmoon Faire ticket for them.",c="哈哈，毛茸茸的小爪子，棒极了！我们可以使用这些爪子来制作玩具和别的小玩意儿，这些能吸引更多的观众来到暗月马戏团！\n\n这是你的奖券，$n。是你应得的报酬！",cEN="Great, you got them! We can use these to make toys and baubles, and those will attract more people to the Faire!\n\nHere's your ticket, <name>. You earned it!"}
Q[7900]={p="小孩子喜欢玩具！我发现所有的小孩都喜欢用破损的熊皮制成的绒毛玩具！\n\n你可以在灰谷或希尔斯布莱德的熊身上弄到熊皮。我会用暗月马戏团奖券来和你交换的！",pEN="Children love toys! And no matter what race, I've found that all children love furry, plushy toys made from torn bear pelts!\n\nYou can get those pelts from the bears of Ashenvale or Hillsbrad. Bring me a heap of them and earn yourself a heap of Darkmoon Faire tickets!",c="好皮子，$n！我会找人把它们缝成一大堆毛绒玩具。加上点填充物，再上点颜色，我想它们会成为全艾泽拉斯孩子们羡慕的东西！\n\n奖券？啊对，你的报酬！\n\n在这儿！",cEN="Nice pelts, <name>! I'll get someone to sew these into a bunch of plush toys. With a little stuffing and some paint, I think they'll be the envy of children across Azeroth!\n\nTickets? Ah yes, your payment!\n\nHere they are!"}
Q[7901]={p="人们看重的东西真是奇妙！就拿一根木棍来说吧，上面挂着一条毛茸茸的尾巴。你我大概都会觉得这种东西不怎么值钱……可你要是给那件破烂起个像\"野蛮绒毛尾\"这样整齐的名字，再装进漂亮的盒子里，人们就会觉得它很值钱。垃圾就变成了宝贝！\n\n给我弄来凄凉之地和荒芜之地那些狼身上的柔软蓬松尾巴，我就给你暗月马戏团奖券。",pEN="It's amazing what people value! Take, for instance, a wooden stick with a soft bushy tail attached to it. Now, you and I might think something like that isn't all that valuable... but if you give that piece of junk a neat name like \"Savage Fuzz Tail\" and put it in a pretty box, then people will think it's valuable. Trash becomes treasure!\n\nGet me soft bushy tails from the wolves of Desolace and the Badlands, and I'll give you Darkmoon Faire tickets.",c="做得好，$n！这些狼尾将为我们的观众带来惊喜，然后他们会跟他们的朋友谈及此事，从而为我们招揽更多的观众！\n\n这是你的奖券！尽情享受暗月马戏团的好时光吧……别忘记跟你的朋友谈起我们！",cEN="Well done, <name>! These tails will make great prizes for our visitors, and that means happy visitors... who talk to their friends and bring more visitors!\n\nHere are your tickets! Have a good time at the Darkmoon Faire... and don't forget to tell your friends about us!"}
Q[7902]={p="人的想象力是件了不起的东西。它能让最小的土丘看起来像最高的大山。它能让最无害的影子看起来像是可怕噩梦投下的！\n\n我们暗月马戏团让游客的想象力尽情绽放！但为了帮他们拉伸想象力……有时候我们得耍点花样。\n\n我的一个游乐项目需要鲜艳的羽毛。你可以从艾泽拉斯较危险地区的鸟类身上弄到。把羽毛带给我，许多奖券就归你了！",pEN="A person's imagination is an incredible thing. It can make the smallest hill seem like the largest mountain. It can make the most innocuous shadow appear cast by a horrible nightmare!\n\nWe at the Darkmoon Faire let our visitor's imaginations blossom! But to help stretch their imaginations... sometimes we have to get tricky.\n\nI need vibrant plumes for one of my attractions. You can get them from the birds of the more dangerous areas of Azeroth. Bring me the plumes and many tickets will be yours!",c="啊，羽毛！这真令人惊异，不是吗？在这样美丽的东西面前，人的想象力是很容易爆发的！\n\n你做得棒极了，$n。当游客们面露微笑时，我们就得到了最好的回报，请收下这些奖券吧。",cEN="Ah, the plumes! They are amazing, don't you think! It would be easy to spark one's imaginations with such beauties!\n\nYou do such charitable work, <name>. The smiles on our visitors' faces when they see the show is a grand payment indeed, but please take these tickets as well."}
Q[7903]={p="你有没有曾经在一个伸手不见五指的洞穴里游荡，追寻冒险跟刺激？你有？真的吗？很好，那你一定看过蝙蝠那令人毛骨悚然的眼睛从高高的地方凝视着你，等待着你放松戒备的时候好来吸你的血！\n\n很可怕的想法，你不觉得吗？当然！蝙蝠眼毫无疑问是很可怕的！\n\n你可以帮我拿些蝙蝠眼来吗，$n？我需要它们来……给我正在设计的某件东西。某件很可怕的东西。\n\n你可以从东瘟疫之地的蝙蝠身上找到它们。",pEN="Do you ever find yourself wandering in a cave, late at night, looking for adventure? You do? Really? Well, then you've seen the creepy eyes of bats staring at you from high up, waiting for you to let down your guard so they can suck your blood!\n\nScary thought, don't you think? Of course! It's no doubt that bat eyes are scary!\n\nWill you bring me some evil bat eyes, <name>? I want them for... something I'm designing. Something scary.\n\nYou can get them from the bats of the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="太棒了！$n，你拿到那些眼睛了！希望猎杀那些蝙蝠的过程吓到了你，因为如果它吓到了像你这样勇敢的$g家伙:家伙;，$n，那么这些眼睛一定也能吓到我们马戏团的游客。\n\n收下这些奖券，谢谢你的效力。",cEN="Great! You got the eyes! I hope hunting those bats was frightening for you, because if it scared a brave <class> like yourself, then those eyes will certainly scare our Faire visitors.\n\nTake these tickets, <name>, and thank you for your service."}
Q[7905]={d="暗月马戏团就要来了！它进城时，一定要来体验它所有的奇观与刺激！\n\n如果你现在就行动，还能用这张兑换券换取免费的奖券！只要把兑换券交给马戏团里的盖尔瓦斯·暗门就行。\n\n现在，马戏团就在艾尔文森林的闪金镇外。别错过！今天就出发！\n\n",dEN="The Darkmoon Faire is coming! Be sure to experience all the wonders and excitement of it when it comes to town!\n\nIf you act right now, you can redeem this voucher for free prize tickets! Just hand your voucher to Gelvas Grimgate located inside the carnival.\n\nRight now, the Faire is outside Goldshire, in the Elwynn Forest. Don't miss out! Go today!",o="到暗月马戏团的场地里去，将免费券交给吉瓦斯·格里加特。",oEN="Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival.",p="我的朋友，我能帮你什么忙吗？你有需要兑换的礼券吗？",pEN="Yes friend, may I help you? Do you have a voucher that needs redeeming?",c="欢迎来到暗月马戏团！这张礼券可以兑换5张奖品券呢！\n\n你可以用奖品券兑换一些价值不菲的奖品券越多，能换取的奖品也就越多。哈哈！",cEN="Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! This voucher is good for FIVE, yes, FIVE prize tickets!\n\nWhen you accumulate prize tickets, you'll want to speak to me about redeeming them for valuable prizes. The more tickets you get, the more prizes you can win. Huzzah!"}
Q[7907]={d="既然你已经把野兽套牌的所有卡片集齐成一副，第九张牌便神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张牌上刻着：\"把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，便可获得奖励。\"你听说这个集市每隔几个月就会轮流在莫高雷和闪金镇停留，所以你只能等下次他们到来。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Beast cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把野兽套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Beast Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你集满一整套野兽套牌了！恭喜你！",pEN="Oh dear.",c="现在你已经集满了整套野兽套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="Well this explains a lot. If you ever find a way into Ahn'Qiraj, keep an eye out for ol' Brann. I'm afraid that he'll be powerless without his monkey."}
Q[7926]={d="暗月马戏团就要来了！它进城时，一定要来体验它所有的奇观与刺激！\n\n如果你现在就行动，还能用这张兑换券换取免费的奖券！只要把兑换券交给马戏团里的盖尔瓦斯·暗门就行。\n\n现在，马戏团就在莫高雷的雷霆崖外。别错过！今天就出发！\n\n",dEN="The Darkmoon Faire is coming! Be sure to experience all the wonders and excitement of it when it comes to town!\n\nIf you act right now, you can redeem this voucher for free prize tickets! Just hand your voucher to Gelvas Grimgate located inside the carnival.\n\nRight now, the Faire is just outside Thunder Bluff, in Mulgore. Don't miss out! Go today!",o="到暗月马戏团的场地里去，将免费券交给吉瓦斯·格里加特。",oEN="Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival.",p="我的朋友，我能帮你什么忙吗？你有需要兑换的礼券吗？",pEN="Yes friend, may I help you? Do you have a voucher that needs redeeming?",c="欢迎来到暗月马戏团！这张礼券可以兑换5张奖品券呢！\n\n你可以用奖品券兑换一些价值不菲的奖品券越多，能换取的奖品也就越多。哈哈！",cEN="Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire! This voucher is good for FIVE, yes, FIVE prize tickets!\n\nWhen you accumulate prize tickets, you'll want to speak to me about redeeming them for valuable prizes. The more tickets you get, the more prizes you can win. Huzzah!"}
Q[7927]={d="既然你已经把传送门套牌的所有卡片集齐成一副，第九张牌便神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张牌上刻着：\"把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，便可获得奖励。\"你听说这个集市每隔几个月就会轮流在莫高雷和闪金镇停留，所以你只能等下次他们到来。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Portal cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把入口套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Portals Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你集满一整套入门套牌了！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of portals! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套入门套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Portals. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[7928]={d="既然你已经把督军套牌的所有卡片集齐成一副，第九张牌便神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张牌上刻着：\"把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，便可获得奖励。\"你听说这个集市每隔几个月就会轮流在莫高雷和闪金镇停留，所以你只能等下次他们到来。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Warlord cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把督军套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Warlords Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你集满一整套督军套牌了！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of warlords! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套督军套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Warlords. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[7929]={d="既然你已经把元素套牌的所有卡片集齐成一副，第九张牌便神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张牌上刻着：\"把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，便可获得奖励。\"你听说这个集市每隔几个月就会轮流在莫高雷和闪金镇停留，所以你只能等下次他们到来。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Elemental cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把元素套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Elementals Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你集满一整套元素套牌了！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of elementals! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套元素套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Elementals. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[7930]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7931]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7932]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7933]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7934]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7935]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7936]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7937]={d="\"你的命运在东风谷等着你。\"\n\n萨吉交给你的命运纸条摸起来微微发烫。你紧紧握住它，眼前浮现出艾尔文森林东风谷伐木场的景象。再凑近细看，你看见一个紧挨着马厩的干草堆。",dEN="\"Your fortune awaits you in Eastvale.\"\n\nThe fortune Sayge handed you feels slightly warm to the touch. Grasping it firmly, you see an image of the Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest. Focusing closer in on the image, you see a haystack that sits next to a stable.",o="到艾尔文森林的东谷伐木场去寻找你的财宝吧。",oEN="Travel to the Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest and seek out your fortune.",p="这堆干草看起来跟幻象中的很像……",pEN="This haystack looks like the one from your vision.",c="你快速搜查了干草堆，找到一只带锁的小带锁箱！似乎你已经找到财宝了！",cEN="A quick search of the haystack reveals a lockbox from within it! It would seem that you have found your fortune!"}
Q[7938]={d="\"你的命运在死亡矿井里等着你。\"\n\n萨吉交给你的命运纸条摸起来微微发烫。你紧紧握住它，眼前浮现出西部荒野月溪镇废墟之中死亡矿井的景象。再凑近细看，你在蜿蜒曲折的通道中飞速穿行，直到来到一道闪烁的传送门前……它直通矿井的心脏。当你穿过它时，一只奇怪的箱子凭空出现。",dEN="\"Your fortune awaits you inside the Deadmines.\"\n\nThe fortune Sayge handed you feels slightly warm to the touch. Grasping it firmly, you see an image of the Deadmines inside Westfall's ruined hamlet of Moonbrook. Focusing closer in on the image, you wind about twisty passages until you reach a shimmering portal... one that leads into the heart of the mines itself. Stepping through it, a strange chest appears out from nowhere.",o="到西部荒野的死亡矿井中去寻找你的财宝吧。",oEN="Travel to the Deadmines in Westfall and seek out your fortune.",p="这箱子看起来跟幻象中的很像……",pEN="This chest looks like the one from your vision...",c="你快速搜查了带锁箱，找到一只带锁的小带锁箱！似乎你已经找到财宝了！",cEN="A quick search of the chest reveals a lockbox from within it! It would seem that you have found your fortune!"}
Q[7939]={p="$n，感谢你所给予我的一切帮助。我实在无法足够的表达我的谢意！\n\n虽然我没那么需要了……但是如果你带给我更多的致密砂轮，我可以给你更多暗月马戏团奖券。",pEN="<name>, thank you for all the help you've given me. I really can't thank you enough!\n\nAlthough my need is no longer great... if you bring me more dense grinding stones, I still have more Darkmoon Faire tickets for you.",c="啊，感谢你$n。请收下这些奖券，然后把关于暗月马戏团的事情告诉你所有的朋友！",cEN="Thanks much, <name>. Here's your Darkmoon Faire tickets!"}
Q[7940]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[7941]={p="$n，我必须要感谢你的帮助。我有很多的补给了，当然这里面你帮了很大的忙，如果你可以带更多的护甲片给我的话，我会很乐意用暗月马戏团奖券来交换它们。",pEN="<name>, I must thank you for all your help. I have plenty of supplies, through no small efforts on your part, but if you wish to bring me more armor kits, then I will gladly trade them for Darkmoon Faire tickets.",c="给你，$n。很公平的交易。希望你喜欢。",cEN="There you are, <name>. A fair trade. Enjoy."}
Q[7942]={p="$n，你$g对我们:对我们;真是太好了，一直不知疲倦地给我送东西。我永远感激你！\n\n虽然我们对瑟银零件需求已不如从前，你仍然可以把它们带来，我很乐意用暗月马戏团奖券和你交换。",pEN="<name>, you have been so good to us, bringing me goods without tiring. You have my eternal thanks!\n\nAlthough our need for Thorium widgets is not as great as it was, you may still bring them to me and I will gladly trade them for Darkmoon Faire tickets.",c="给你，$n。这些是暗月马戏团奖券，去尽情狂欢吧。可别在同一个地方把它们都花光啦！",cEN="Here you are, <name>. Here are Darkmoon Faire tickets for your enjoyment. Do not, as they say, spend them all in one place!"}
Q[7943]={p="$n，我正在设计的东西将是继诺莫瑞根被入侵后最可怕的事件！这要大力的感谢你以及你带给我的小玩意儿。真是太太太感谢你了！\n\n虽然我已经不太需要了，但是……如果你可以从东瘟疫之地的蝙蝠身上取得更多的邪恶蝙蝠眼给我的话……我也许会给你更多暗月马戏团奖券。",pEN="<name>, the attraction I'm designing will be the scariest event since Gnomeregan was overrun! And it's largely thanks to you and all the baubles you've brought me. Many, many thanks!\n\nI don't need much else, but... if you bring me more evil bat eyes from the bats of the Eastern Plaguelands... I might have more Darkmoon Faire tickets for you.",c="再次感谢你，$n。这是给你的奖券！",cEN="Thanks again, <name>. Here are your tickets!"}
Q[7944]={d="\"你的命运在哀嚎洞穴里等着你。\"\n\n萨吉交给你的命运纸条摸起来微微发烫。你紧紧握住它，眼前浮现出贫瘠之地十字路口西南方一处洞穴的景象。再凑近细看，你在蜿蜒曲折的通道中飞速穿行，直到来到一道闪烁的传送门前……它直通洞穴的心脏。当你穿过它时，一只奇怪的箱子凭空出现。",dEN="\"Your fortune awaits you inside Wailing Caverns.\"\n\nThe fortune Sayge handed you feels slightly warm to the touch. Grasping it firmly, you see an image of a cave to the southwest of the Crossroads in the Barrens. Focusing closer in on the image, you wind about twisty passages until you reach a shimmering portal... one that leads into the heart of the caverns itself. Stepping through it, a strange chest appears out from nowhere.",o="到贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴中去寻找你的财宝吧。",oEN="Travel to the Wailing Caverns in the Barrens and seek out your fortune.",p="这箱子看起来跟幻象中的很像……",pEN="This chest looks like the one from your vision...",c="你快速搜查了带锁箱，找到一只带锁的小带锁箱！似乎你已经找到财宝了！",cEN="A quick search of the chest reveals a lockbox from within it! It would seem that you have found your fortune!"}
Q[7945]={d="\"你的命运在苍白鬃岩外等着你。\"\n\n萨吉交给你的命运纸条摸起来微微发烫。你紧紧握住它，眼前浮现出莫高雷苍白鬃岩的景象。再凑近细看，你看见一个紧挨着洞穴入口的树桩。",dEN="\"Your fortune awaits you outside Palemane Rock.\"\n\nThe fortune Sayge handed you feels slightly warm to the touch. Grasping it firmly, you see an image of the Palemane Rock of Mulgore. Focusing closer in on the image, you see a tree stump that sits close to the cave entrance.",o="到莫高雷的灰月洞穴去寻找你的财宝吧。",oEN="Travel to Palemane Rock in Mulgore and seek out your fortune.",p="这树桩看起来跟幻象中的很像……",pEN="This tree stump looks like the one from your vision.",c="你快速搜查了树桩，找到一只带锁的小带锁箱！似乎你已经找到财宝了！",cEN="A quick search of the tree stump reveals a lockbox from within it! It would seem that you have found your fortune!"}
Q[7946]={p="我真高兴加布加布终于回来了。她是那么喜欢黑铁啤酒，所以当我没有了以后，她就跑去找更多的酒了！\n\n现在加布加布回来了，我要所有我可以取得的啤酒！我不希望她再跑掉了！\n\n你有黑铁啤酒吗？如果你有的话，我愿意用一颗加布加布的蛋跟你换……",pEN="I'm so happy Jubjub is no longer lost. She loves Dark Iron ale so much that when I ran out... she ran away to find more!\n\nNow that Jubjub's back, I want as much ale as I can get! I won't want her to run away again!\n\nDo you have any Dark Iron Ale? If you do, then I'll trade you one of Jubjub's frog eggs for a mug...",c="感谢你，$n。拿着这颗蛋吧！虽然它不会马上孵化，但是当它孵化的时候，你将拥有一个非常棒的宠物！",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Here is your egg! It won't be ready to hatch for a little while, but when it does you'll have a great pet!"}
Q[7981]={p="往前走一步，往前走一步！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，\"只要开口\"就行！你可以用不同数量的奖券兑换奇妙非凡的奖品。别$g害羞:害羞;，试试看吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a <king/queen>! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[8041]={c="你好，$c。我是破击者金罗克，穆甘巴的巨魔。我们赞达拉部族认可你的功绩。我们向你的坚韧与意志致敬。\n\n把这条护符戴在脖子上，$c。让穆甘巴山的力量流遍你的全身。当你击倒我们的敌人时，愿你的力量增长！",cEN="Hail, <class>. I am Jin'rokh the Breaker, troll of Mugamba. We of the Zandalar tribe recognize your accomplishments. We salute your tenacity and strength of will.\n\nWear this talisman around your neck, <class>. Let the strength of Mount Mugamba flow through your being. Be empowered as you strike down our enemies!"}
Q[8042]={p="见到你身体健康真好，$n。这场显赫的战斗影响着这个星球上的所有生物。绝不能让哈卡离开祖尔格拉布，否则世界将会毁在他无尽的欲望中。\n\n把坠饰给我吧，我会强化它的力量。运用穆贾巴之力惩罚我们的敌人吧！",pEN="It is good to see you in good health, <name>. The glorious battles you have undertaken affect all life on this planet. Hakkar must never leave the confines of Zul'Gurub as the world will surely collapse beneath his immense hunger.\n\nGive me your talisman and I shall amplify its strength. Use the Strength of Mugamba to punish our enemies!",c="我们会再见面的，$c。",cEN="Our paths will cross again, <class>."}
Q[8043]={p="$g大师:大师;$n，你回来了！莫托尔已经把您的事迹禀报给国王。您的名字甚至远播南海。也许有一天您会成为$g传奇的:传奇的;$c——一个流传千古的故事。\n\n把您的护符交给我，好让我再次强化它的力量。",pEN="Master <name>, you return! Molthor has sent word of your deeds to the King. Your name is known even in the South Seas. Perhaps one day you will be a legendary <class> - a story for the ages.\n\nGive me your talisman so that I may once more amplify its power.",c="用你新得的力量去摧毁古拉巴什！",cEN="Use your newfound strength to destroy the Gurubashi!"}
Q[8044]={p="拉斯塔哈国王向你致意，$g大师:大师;$n。这样的荣誉从未授予过赞达拉部族之外的人。\n\n<金罗克鞠躬。>\n\n把你的护符交给我，好让我再次强化它。要知道，穆甘巴之怒现在已经与你的灵魂紧密相连。",pEN="King Rastakhan sends his regards, Master <name>. Such an honor has never been given to one outside the Zandalar tribe.\n\n<Jin'rokh bows.>\n\nGive me your talisman so that I may enhance it once more. Know that the Rage of Mugamba is now intrinsically connected to your very soul.",c="祖尔金会嫉妒你的，$c。去征服吧！",cEN="Zul'jin would be envious, <class>. Go forth and conquer!"}
Q[8045]={c="异教徒，你要明白：一场灾变把我们绑在了一起。赞达拉既不理解也不欣赏你的异教习俗，但我们是公正的民族。把这枚烙印戴在脖子上。它既是对我们敌人的警告，也是你与赞达拉友谊的象征。\n\n继续为我们的人民效力，我就会强化这枚烙印的力量。",cEN="Know this, heathen: A catastrophe has brought us together. Your pagan ways are neither understood nor appreciated by Zandalar but we are a fair people. Wear this brand around your neck. It shall serve as both a warning to our enemies and a symbol of your friendship to Zandalar.\n\nContinue to serve our people and I will amplify the power of the brand."}
Q[8046]={p="我的判断看来有些草率，$c。似乎你对圣光的盲目信仰还有些用处。\n\n把烙印给我吧，我会强化它的力量。",pEN="I may have been too hasty in my judgement, <class>. It seems as if your blind faith in this Light has some value after all.\n\nGive me your brand and I shall amplify its power.",c="去吧，你必须打败我们的敌人，$c。即使这意味着要借助圣光的力量。\n\n<金罗克浑身战栗。>",cEN="Do what you must to defeat our enemies, <class>. Even if it means channeling the Light.\n\n<Jin'rokh shudders.>"}
Q[8047]={p="我的判断看来有些草率，$c。似乎你对圣光的盲目信仰还有些用处。\n\n把烙印给我吧，我会强化它的力量。",pEN="I must confess, I did not think you had the resolution to see this cause through, <class>. Zandalar now considers you an invaluable ally. Well done, indeed.\n\nGive me your brand and I shall once more amplify its power.",c="我们的信仰不同，但我们的事业是正义的。击倒我们的敌人吧，高尚的$c。",cEN="Our beliefs differ but our cause is righteous. Strike down our foes, noble <class>."}
Q[8048]={p="国王已经认可了你的存在，$c。你是你族群中$g第一个:第一个;被拉斯塔哈接纳为$g赞达拉真正盟友:赞达拉真正盟友;的人。\n\n为你的努力，你将$g得到丰厚的回报:得到丰厚的回报;。出示你的烙印，我会施加$g最终的强化:最终的强化;。",pEN="The King has acknowledged your existence, <class>. You are the first of your kind to be accepted by Rastakhan as a true ally of Zandalar.\n\nYou will be rewarded greatly for your efforts. Present your brand and I shall apply the final amplification.",c="警觉、荣誉、忠诚、勇敢……你拥有所有的优点，你的烙印也应如此。",cEN="Vigilance, honor, loyalty, bravery... You embody all of these traits and so shall your brand."}
Q[8049]={c="请接受这条护符，作为我们谢意的表示，$c。\n\n随着你与赞达拉巨魔的羁绊增强，祖尔达扎之眼的力量也会增长。定期回到我这里来，我会为这颗宝石注入力量。",cEN="Accept this talisman as a token of our appreciation, <class>.\n\nThe Eye of Zuldazar will grow in power as your bond with the trolls of Zandalar strengthens. Return to me periodically and I shall imbue the jewel."}
Q[8050]={p="你与古拉巴什战斗的故事在风中低语流传，$g牧师:女祭司;。就连王室也开始谈论你的事迹。有传言说拉斯塔哈国王甚至提到过你的名字。\n\n为这只眼睛注入力量的时刻到了。把护符交给我，我来完成此事。",pEN="Tales of your battles against the Gurubashi are whispered in the winds, priestess. Even royalty is beginning to talk of your deeds. It is rumored that King Rastakhan even mentioned you by name.\n\nThe time has come to imbue the Eye. Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the service.",c="$n，你要坚持不懈地奋力战斗。夺魂者会试图汲取你求生的意志。",cEN="Be resolute in your endeavors, <name>. The Soulflayer will attempt to siphon your will to live."}
Q[8051]={p="欢迎$c。祖尔达扎之眼充满能量地跳动着。你已经准备好迈出下一步。把护符交给我，我来注入力量。",pEN="Welcome <class>. The Eye of Zuldazar pulses with energy. You are ready to take the next step. Hand me the talisman and I shall perform the imbue.",c="$n，你要坚持不懈地奋力战斗。夺魂者会试图汲取你求生的意志。",cEN="Continue in your battle against the Soulflayer and his minions, <name>. He must never be permitted to leave the confines of Zul'Gurub."}
Q[8052]={p="$n，如果我们有上万名像你这样的人物，哈卡的军队将在瞬间灰飞烟灭。\n\n<阿塔比姆发出了一声叹息。>\n\n唉，祖达萨之眼就要发挥它所有的潜能了。把它给我。",pEN="If only we had ten-thousand more like you, <name>. The armies of Hakkar would be scattered to the wind in the blink of an eye.\n\n<Al'tabim sighs.>\n\nAlas, the Eye is ready to realize its full potential. Give it to me.",c="给他们迎头痛击，让哈卡尝尝失败的滋味……",cEN="Smite them all and let Hakkar sort them out..."}
Q[8053]={d="你是个$g异教徒:异教徒;。异教徒在我们部族中自有其位置。异教徒是赞达拉的自由思想者。自由思想者不惧压迫。自由思想者会为自己所信之物而死。我们知道你也会为自己所信之物而死。这为你赢得了我们的认可。也为你赢得了一次进一步证明自己的机会。\n\n我们必须得到权力珍宝。去祖尔格拉布。杀掉哈卡的爪牙。拿到我所求之物后再回来。去领取$g赞达拉自由思想者的第一件战甲:赞达拉自由思想者的第一件战甲;。\n\n去吧。",dEN="You are a heathen. Heathens have a place in the tribe. Heathens are freethinkers of Zandalar. Freethinkers do not fear oppression. Freethinkers die for what they believe in. We know you would die for what you believe in. This earns our acknowledgement. This earns you a chance to prove yourself further.\n\nWe must have the Paragons of Power. Go to Zul'Gurub. Kill the minions of Hakkar. Return when you have what I seek. Claim the first battle gear of a Zandalar freethinker.\n\nGo.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给破击者金罗克：一件原始哈卡莱护腕。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n破击者金罗克位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker Primal Hakkari Bindings. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你回来了？你拿到权力珍宝了吗？你是在浪费我的时间吗？\n\n我希望不是，$g异教徒:异教徒;。",pEN="You have returned? Do you have the Paragons of Power? Are you wasting my time?\n\nI hope not, heathen.",c="你为我们增光不少。你的双手滴着哈卡爪牙的鲜血。你是$g部族的朋友:部族的朋友;。\n\n戴上这些护腕。它们是自由思想者的护臂。这就是我所说的真正力量。",cEN="You do much to honor us. Your hands drip with the blood of Hakkar's minions. You are a friend to the tribe.\n\nWear these bracers. They are the freethinker's armguards. This is what I mean about real power."}
Q[8054]={d="你的信仰对我们来说很陌生，$g异教徒:异教徒;。古时的赞达拉人曾被指为异端。那是在古拉巴什帝国强盛的时候。异教徒敢于挑战哈卡的祭司。于是异教徒像害虫一样被猎杀。那些异教徒在与血神的斗争中从未动摇。我们敬重他们付出的代价。他们就是自由思想者。\n\n消灭祖尔格拉布中哈卡的爪牙。把我要的权力珍宝带给我。成功将得到丰厚的回报。\n\n去吧。",dEN="Your beliefs are alien to us, heathen. Ancient Zandalar were once branded as heretics. This was when the Gurubashi Empire was strong. Heathens dared to challenge the priest of Hakkar. Heathens then were hunted and killed as vermin. Those heathens never wavered in their fight against the Blood God. We honor the price they paid. They are the freethinkers.\n\nDestroy the minions of Hakkar in Zul'Gurub. Bring me the Paragons of Power I seek. Success will be greatly rewarded.\n\nGo.",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给击碎者金罗克：1条原始哈卡莱披肩。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n击碎者金罗克在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Shawl. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你获胜了？你取回权力珍宝了吗？你杀死敌人了吗？",pEN="Your presence means victory? Do you have the Paragons? Are you dripping in the remains of your enemies?",c="你将获得部族的尊敬。你血洗了祖尔格拉布。敌人在你的信念前倒下。敌人因你的力量而死。\n\n这是思考者腰带。它是荣誉的象征。它是强大的魔精。现在它属于你了。",cEN="Your honor is assured in the tribe. You claim many deaths in Zul'Gurub. Enemies fall before your convictions. Enemies fall before your power.\n\nThis is the freethinker's belt. It is a symbol of honor. It is powerful mojo. It is now yours."}
Q[8055]={d="战甲赋予你在部族中的力量。自由思想者就是以这种方式受到敬重。他们是狂信徒。他们用强大的魔精灌注自己的胸甲。即使面对敌人时他们的信仰有所动摇，他们的胸甲也不会。\n\n你必须在我们之中受到崇敬，才能拥有这样的胸甲。去祖尔格拉布。取走我需要的权力珍宝。从里面那些蠢货身上最痛苦地夺走权力珍宝。把它们带给我。彻底证明你作为$g自由思想者:自由思想者;的价值。",dEN="Battle gear gives you power in the tribe. The freethinkers are honored in this way. They are zealots. They imbue their breastplates with powerful mojo. If their beliefs falter in the face of the enemy, their breastplate will not.\n\nYou must be revered amongst us to possess such a breastplate. Go to Zul'Gurub. Take the Paragons of Power I need. Take the Paragons most painfully from the fools inside. Bring them to me. Prove your worth as a freethinker once and for all.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给破击者金罗克：一件原始哈卡莱战袍。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n破击者金罗克位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Tabard. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你拿到权力珍宝了吗？那里面有魔精，我们必须得到它。你必须帮助我们。",pEN="Do you have the Paragons? They have mojo inside them. We must have them. You will aid us.",c="你做到了很多人永远也无法做到的事情。你打败了哈卡的爪牙，让他们见识到思考者的能力。异教徒在赞达拉部族中也能赢得崇拜。你拥有不可思议的力量，你就是力量的化身。\n\n思考者，拿走属于你的胸甲吧。粉碎那些反对你的家伙。",cEN="You have done what few ever could. You have brought the minions of Hakkar to their knees. You have shown them what a freethinker can do. You have shown us how a heretic could be revered in the tribe. You have more than real power. You ARE real power.\n\nTake the breastplate, freethinker. Crush those who oppose you."}
Q[8056]={d="预言者以他们超凡的眼界在部族中倍受尊敬。他们不是巫医，他们是通过抛掷骨头或是辨识树叶来进行预言的。作为一名萨满祭司，你已经掌握了预言者的一些能力；赞达拉部族非常重视他们的预言。\n\n去祖尔格拉布，取回我需要的权力珍宝，证明自己的价值。如果你成功的话，我就会送你一副预言者护腕的！",dEN="The augurs of our tribe are revered for their gifts of the divine sight, ya mon. They ain't a witch doctor; they spend their time castin' bones or readin' the leaves for insight - not hexin' people. As a shaman, you already know somethin' about the power of augury; we Zandalar prize the insight they give to the tribe.\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do this for us, and I'll give ya some bracers that our augurs prize above all others!",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给祖尔达扎的梅维基：一件原始哈卡莱护臂。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n祖尔达扎的梅维基位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Armsplint. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nMaywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你有没有从祖尔格拉布取回我需要的权力珍宝？这些护腕值得你为之付出努力！",pEN="Got the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub that I need? These bracers are well worth any effort ya be needin' to make!",c="看起来你有点赞达拉占兆师的模样了。我们知道你在祖尔格拉布为我们所做的一切。这些权力珍宝将帮助赞达拉部族——或许我应该说，你的朋友。收下这些护腕吧，$n，这是你应得的！",cEN="It seems ya got a bit of the Zandalar augur in ya. We know about the deeds you've been doin' in Zul'Gurub on our behalf mon. These Paragons of Power will go a long way to helpin' out the Zandalar tribe - a tribe, I might add, ya can call upon as friends. Take these bracers, <name>; ya earned them and then some!"}
Q[8057]={d="占卜师是我们部族的重要成员，聆听他们的教诲是你明智的选择。通过和动物交流以及在必要的时候把它们献给魂灵，他们将会给我们提供神圣的指引。在过去的岁月中，占卜师的洞察力和智慧帮助我们在和古拉巴什的战争中渡过了难关。\n\n从祖尔格拉布帮我带回权力珍宝来，证明你的价值。只要你带回那些东西，我就会给你赞达拉占卜师梦寐以求的护腕。",dEN="A haruspex is a key member of our tribe; you'll be wise to listen to their portents. By communion with animals and givin' them up to the spirits when needed, they give us divine guidance. In times past, the haruspex's insight and wisdom gave us an edge in the wars against the splintered tribes of the Gurubashi.\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do this, and I'll give ya bracers that any haruspex of the Zandalar would want.",o="把一件原始哈卡莱支柱带给祖尔达扎的梅维基。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n祖尔达扎的梅维基位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Stanchion. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nMaywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你有没有从祖尔格拉布找到权力珍宝？这些护腕价值不菲呢，$n。相信我！",pEN="Have ya got the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub? These bracers are worth the effort, <name>. Trust me mon!",c="啊，我能感觉到这些权力珍宝散发出的力量，$n。你证明了自己是部族可以称之为\"$g朋友:朋友;\"的人。交易就是交易，$n……见识一下占卜师护腕的力量吧！",cEN="Ah, I can sense the power comin' from these Paragons of Power, <name>. Ya proved to be someone we in the tribe can call \"friend.\" A deal is a deal, <name>... behold the power of the haruspex's bracers!"}
Q[8058]={d="复仇就是力量。赞达拉的复仇者就拥有这样的力量。部族敌人众多。复仇者替他们讨回公道。任何针对我们的罪行都不会不受惩罚。复仇者施予这种惩罚。我们的敌人畏惧我们的复仇。他们理应畏惧。他们永远都会畏惧。\n\n成为我们复仇者中的一员吧。在祖尔格拉布中寻找权力珍宝。杀掉哈卡的爪牙，以部族之名讨回血债。你会得到$g奖赏:奖赏;。",dEN="Vengeance is power. The Zandalar vindicator is such power. The tribe has many enemies. The vindicator exacts retribution on them. No crime against us is unpunished. The vindicator delivers this punishment. Our enemies fear our vengeance. They should. They forever will.\n\nBecome one of our vindicators. Seek the Paragons of Power inside Zul'Gurub. Slay the minions of Hakkar and claim vengeance in the tribe's name. You will be rewarded.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给破击者金罗克：一件原始哈卡莱护臂。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n破击者金罗克位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Armsplint. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你取回权力珍宝了吗？你以赞达拉的名义复仇了吗？",pEN="Have you brought the Paragons of Power? Has vengeance been claimed in the name of the Zandalar?",c="你今天播下了大量的复仇。你已经披上了复仇者的面容。你已经让血神的爪牙跪倒在地。\n\n拿着这个。它会在未来助长你的复仇。现在你是$g赞达拉的朋友:赞达拉的朋友;了。",cEN="You have wrought much vengeance today. You have taken on the visage of the vindicator. You have brought the Blood God's minions to their knees.\n\nTake this. It will fuel your vengeance for the future. You are a friend to the Zandalar now."}
Q[8059]={d="术士在和恶魔打交道的过程中冒着极大的危险，但是我们的恶魔师的研究更近一步。通过一个古老的魔法仪式，他们让恶魔进入他们的躯壳。他们从身体内部奴役了恶魔，而不是让恶魔占据他们，这些野兽的力量将永远被他们控制。这种技能只有少数人可以掌握。\n\n为了让你了解恶魔的力量，我必须获得祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝。去那里带回我们所需的东西。",dEN="Warlocks tread dangerous ground in dealing with demons, but our demoniacs take this one step further. Through an ancient and arcane ritual, they allow a demon to enter their being. Rather than let it possess them though, they enslave the demon from the inside, absorbing the power of the beast for their own command. It is a feat few are ever able to master.\n\nFor you to learn of the power of the demoniac, I must have Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub. Go there and retrieve that which we seek.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给全视者阿尔塔比姆：一件原始哈卡莱支柱。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Stanchion. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你有没有带回权力珍宝？如果你可以击败哈卡的恶魔仆从，那么你不仅向我们证明了自己的实力，而且还证明了你想要学习恶魔之道的意愿。",pEN="Have you returned with the Paragons of Power? By defeating the diabolic minions of the Hakkar, you will not only prove yourself to us, but also your willingness to learn the ways of the demoniac.",c="干得好……显然他们在交出权力珍宝之前痛苦地挣扎了一番。拿着这个——恶魔师裹带。这是用恶魔祈祷中使用的强大魔精制作而成的，它将在你追求力量的过程中成为有用的工具。",cEN="Well done... no doubt they were made to pay in excruciating ways before they gave up the Paragons of Power. Take this - the demoniac's wraps. Made from powerful mojo used in summoning the demoniac's prey, it is a powerful tool in your acquisition of power."}
Q[8060]={d="法师在我们的部族中被称为幻术师。他们在咒术中使用了强大的魔精，能迷惑部族的敌人！\n\n<阿塔比姆顽皮地笑起来。>\n\n看到这样一名强大的幻术师全力以赴，击败敌人，真令人兴奋！\n\n如果你要了解幻术师的话，就去祖尔格拉布找回我需要的权力珍宝吧。如果你成功了，我就会送你一件织入幻术师法术的装备。",dEN="Mages in our tribe are known as illusionists. They employ powerful mojo in their incantations, often befuddling and confusing the tribe's enemies!\n\n<Al'tabim laughs wickedly.>\n\nIt is quite the sight to see a powerful illusionist at work, bringing our enemies to their knees from their own madness!\n\nFor you to know the way of our illusionists, go to Zul'Gurub and bring back to me selected Paragons of Power. For this, I will give you arm wraps our illusionists use to weave their spells.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给全视者阿尔塔比姆：一件原始哈卡莱护腕。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing Primal Hakkari Bindings. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="$n——你已经回来啦？你带回我需要的权力珍宝了吗？",pEN="<name> - you've returned already? Were you able to get the Paragons of Power I need?",c="太令人惊讶了……你能感觉到魔精的力量在这些珍宝中涌动吗？在古拉巴什帝国统治一切的时代，权力珍宝被作为流通货币。现在，赞达拉将利用珍宝中隐藏的魔精对抗哈卡的第二次崛起！\n\n你做得很好——你是赞达拉部族的朋友。依照我们的承诺，幻术师裹布是你的了！",cEN="Impressive... could you feel the mojo flowing through them? The Paragons of Power were used as currency of sorts back when the Gurubashi Empire ruled these lands. Now we Zandalar will use the latent mojo inside of them to fight the second rise of the Blood God Hakkar!\n\nYou've done well today - consider yourself to have a friend in the Zandalar. For that, here are the illusionist's wraps I promised!"}
Q[8061]={d="我们赞达拉部族将权力授予那些能和神灵直接沟通的成员。我们的祭司不仅仅是治疗者，也是忏悔者。邪恶不但来自外部的威胁——比如哈卡，也来自部族内部。我们的忏悔者在此担起了法官的职责，避免我们被那股吞噬了古拉巴什帝国的邪恶力量所毁灭。\n\n我需要的权力珍宝就在祖尔格拉布中，去找到那些珍宝，了解忏悔者的职责和精神，保护我们免受邪恶的侵蚀。",dEN="We Zandalar invest power in those who speak with the authority of divinity. Our priests are more than just healers - they are our confessors. Evil comes both from outside threats - such as Hakkar - and from within the tribe. Our confessors act as the judges amongst us, preserving us from the same evil that devoured the Gurubashi from inside itself.\n\nGo to Zul'Gurub and bring back the Paragons of Power from the Gurubashi. Learn what it means to be the confessor, and preserve us from evil.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给全视者阿尔塔比姆：一件原始哈卡莱支柱。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Stanchion. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你从祖尔格拉布回来了？你有没有成功地从哈卡的手下那里获得权力珍宝？",pEN="Back from Zul'Gurub, are you? Have you succeeded in retrieving the Paragons of Power from the minions of Hakkar?",c="太出色了，$n！把这些带给我可不是什么小功绩。毫无疑问，你今天担当了部族的忏悔者，守护我们免遭哈卡的威胁。这些护腕正适合像你这样部族的$g朋友:朋友;！",cEN="Outstanding, <name>! This was no small feat bringing these to me. No doubt you've acted as our tribe's confessor today in preserving ourselves against the threat of Hakkar. These wraps are befitting a friend of the tribe such as you!"}
Q[8062]={d="在古拉巴什帝国毁灭后的黑暗岁月里，赞达拉捕猎者凭借自己的能力维系着部族的生存。猎人跟我们部族的捕猎者很像——狩猎便是捕猎者的基本工作。你在祖尔格拉布的狩猎之旅将证明你有没有资格成为捕猎者中的一员。\n\n从祖尔格拉布取回权力珍宝吧，如果你成功了，那么你就会在成为捕猎者的生涯中迈出第一步。",dEN="In the dark times after the fall of the Gurubashi Empire, Zandalar predators used their prowess to provide sustenance for the tribe. Hunters claim to be much like our tribe's predators - to seek the hunt is to embody the essence of the predator, yes. Your hunt in Zul'Gurub, however, will show us how you truly rate amongst our finest predators.\n\nBring to me a sampling of the Paragons of Power from within Zul'Gurub. Do so, and you'll take first steps in becoming the penultimate predator.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给盲眼者法尔希尔：一件原始哈卡莱护腕。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n盲眼者法尔希尔位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Bindings. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="去祖尔格拉布，打败那些拥有权力珍宝的家伙，$n。他们是你的猎物，他们拥有我们需要的东西。",pEN="Hunt those in Zul'Gurub that would possess the Paragons of Power, <name>. They are your prey; they possess that which we both must have.",c="是的……我不需要视力就能感应到权力珍宝的存在。你在祖尔格拉布的功绩让部族中许多人印象深刻。我们不仅把你视为赞达拉的$g朋友:朋友;，还认为你足够$g配得上:配得上;持有掠食者护腕——那是强大的物品，也是掠食者身份的象征。干得好，$n。",cEN="Yes... I need no vision to sense the presence of the Paragons of Power. Your success in Zul'Gurub has impressed many among the tribe. We not only consider you to be a friend of the Zandalar, but also consider you worthy enough to possess the predator's bracers - powerful items, and a symbol of what it means to be a predator. Well done, <name>."}
Q[8063]={d="赞达拉狂妄者和潜行者很像，但是他们信奉疯狂……混乱……无可预见的存在。狂妄者在战场上是个巨大的威胁，他们在敌人中散播混乱和伤害的种子。\n\n从祖尔格拉布带回我需要的权力珍宝，我就会送你一件狂妄者护甲。拥抱疯狂吧！",dEN="The madcaps of Zandalar are similar to rogues, but above all else they embrace madness... chaos... the unpredictability of existence. A terror to behold on the battlefield, they sowed the seeds of confusion and mayhem amongst our enemies in the savage times after the tribes splintered. We would not be here today without them.\n\nBring to me the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub that I seek, and I will grant you the first of the madcap's prized armors. Embrace the madness!",o="把一件原始哈卡莱护臂带给盲眼者法尔希尔。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g友善:友善;。\n\n盲眼者法尔希尔位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Falthir the Sightless a Primal Hakkari Armsplint. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="去祖尔格拉布寻找那些发狂的家伙，用你自己的力量征服他们，$n！丰厚的奖励在等待着你，不要让哈卡占了上风！",pEN="Seek the madness from within Zul'Gurub and overshadow it with your own, <name>! To do so means success, and success means reward! Let not the Blood God reign supreme again!",c="干得好，$n……你在祖尔格拉布取得了成功，赞达拉部族会从此将你视为朋友。现在我要实现对你的承诺，请收下这份奖励！",cEN="Well done, <name>... your accomplishments in Zul'Gurub have earned you the right to call the Zandalar tribe as a friend. I will see to the disposition of the Paragons; for your effort please accept this reward!"}
Q[8064]={d="赞达拉部族不了解德鲁伊的行事之道。我们按照自己的需求塑造自然，而不是通过别的方式达到目标。当然，占卜师是我们当中与自然的关系最为和谐的。放弃一头小动物的灵魂是成为占卜师的重要步骤之一，那就是自然的真正力量。\n\n从祖尔格拉布帮我带回权力珍宝，向我们证明你的价值。只要你带回那些东西，我就会给你赞达拉占卜师使用的强大物品，一条腰带。\n\n非常强大！",dEN="We Zandalar know not of druidic ways; nature is to be shaped by our need, not the other way around. Still, a haruspex is the one of us most in tune with nature, and rightly so. To give up the ghost of a beastie is to know what it is to be one of them. That is the real power of nature.\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub, proving yourself to us. Do this, and I'll give ya a powerful item - a belt used by many of the Zandalar's haruspices.\n\nStrong mojo, ya mon!",o="把一件原始哈卡莱腰带带给祖尔达扎的梅维基。祖尔达扎的梅维基位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。你还必须与赞达拉的声望达到尊敬。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Sash. Maywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale. You must also be Honored with Zandalar.",p="从祖尔格拉布带回我需要的权力珍宝了吗？只要你带来那些东西占卜师腰带就是你的了。",pEN="Got the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub I need? The haruspex's belt will be yours if ya have them.",c="谢谢你——这些物品中潜藏的力量本身就是宝物，真的。你不仅照我说的做了，还证明了自己对我们部族是光荣的。如我所承诺的，这是你的奖励！",cEN="I thank you - the latent power in these items will be treasures unto themselves, you betcha. Not only have ya done as I've asked of ya, but you've also proven to be honorable to us here in the tribe. As promised, here is your reward!"}
Q[8065]={d="衣着是占卜师力量的标志，$n。占卜师的外套象征了他们自己和他们所寻找的神圣智慧之间的联系。通常，外套中织入了用作祭品的小动物的部分肢体，这可以让他们时刻记着自己是如何获得强大的力量的。\n\n从祖尔格拉布帮我带回权力珍宝来，向我们证明你的价值。只要你带回那些东西，我就会给你一件包含占卜师真正力量的外套。",dEN="The ultimate symbol of a haruspex's power is what they wear, <name>. Of these, the tunic symbolizes the connection between themselves and the divine wisdom they seek. It often weaves parts of the beasties they sacrifice into the tunic; this reminds them of the connection they have to their gifts.\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do this, and a tunic seeping with the true power of a haruspex is yours.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给祖尔达扎的梅维基：一件原始哈卡莱战袍。祖尔达扎的梅维基位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。你还必须与赞达拉的声望达到$g崇敬:崇敬;。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Tabard. Maywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale. You must also be Revered with Zandalar.",p="从祖尔格拉布带回我需要的权力珍宝了吗？占卜师外套绝对值得你付出那些努力。",pEN="Got the necessary Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub? The haruspex's tunic is well worth any effort ya be needin' to make.",c="令人印象深刻……你成功收集到了所需的权力珍宝，$n。你在祖尔格拉布为赞达拉立下的功绩堪称传奇；因此，你将在部族中受到$g崇敬:崇敬;。这是你的长袍，强大的$c！",cEN="Impressive... you've successfully collected the required Paragons of Power, <name>. Your accomplishments in Zul'Gurub for the Zandalar are legendary; hence forth, you'll be revered amongst the tribe. Here is your tunic, mighty <class>!"}
Q[8066]={d="捕猎者知道如何追踪猎物，而成功的捕猎者知道如何一击解决他的猎物。你必须掌握这两种技能才能在祖尔格拉布生存下来，才有可能具备赞达拉捕猎者的风采……\n\n从祖尔格拉布带回我需要的权力珍宝。我将抽取那些东西的力量，而你会得到赞达拉捕猎者腰带——这是笔好买卖，相信我。",dEN="A predator knows how to stalk their prey, but a successful one knows how to strike at it once they have closed ranks. You must master both to have any chance of success in Zul'Gurub... and any chance of being like the Zandalar predators.\n\nBring me choice parts of the Paragons of Power from within Zul'Gurub. My reward will be the power that the trinkets yield, while yours will be the Zandalar predator's belt - equipment well worth the trade.",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给盲眼法希尔：1条原始哈卡莱披肩。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n盲眼法希尔在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Shawl. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="攻击祖尔格拉布那些愚蠢的哈卡爪牙——他们身上有权力珍宝，$n。宣告自己的胜利，向部族证明你的实力。",pEN="Strike at the insane minions of Hakkar in Zul'Gurub - they are the ones that hold the Paragons of Power, <name>. Prove your success to them - and to the tribe - as an aspirant to the predator.",c="我在片刻之前就感应到了你的到来，$n，但并不轻松。向我显露的是你带来的那些权力珍宝。我不必看见这些饰物就能感受到它们的力量；它们潜藏的魔精——如果你愿意，也可以说是纯粹的魔法——将继续为我们的努力添柴，去粉碎血神哈卡的邪恶阴谋。\n\n你的成功应当受到$g嘉奖:嘉奖;——也应当得到$g回报:回报;。你在部族中备受尊敬，你$g配得上:配得上;佩戴掠食者的腰带。",cEN="I sensed your arrival moments before, <name>, but none too easily. What revealed yourself to me were the Paragons of Power you brought. I can feel the power without needing to see the trinkets; their latent mojo - raw magic, if you will - will continue to fuel our efforts of vanquishing the diabolic schemes of the Blood God Hakkar.\n\nYou are to be commended - and rewarded - for your success. You are honored amongst the tribe, and you are worthy to wear the predator's belt."}
Q[8067]={d="赞达拉部族将衣着视为成就的象征。你无需观察别人的衣着，只需感觉它所散发的力量——力量超越视觉。赞达拉捕猎者的衣服正是如此，他们最珍视的莫过于衬肩了。衬肩能使他们的身形变得模糊……并可以随心所欲地显形。\n\n去祖尔格拉布取回我需要的权力珍宝，捕猎者衬肩就属于你了。",dEN="We Zandalar prize what we wear as a symbol of accomplishment. You don't need to be able to see what one wears to be able to sense what emanates from it - power transcends sight. The garments of the Zandalar predator are like this, and most cherished by them is the mantle they wear. It helps to obfuscate them from view... and to make their presence known when they wish it.\n\nThe Paragons of Power await your retrieval in Zul'Gurub. Bring me what I seek, and the predator's mantle shall be yours.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给盲眼者法尔希尔：一件原始哈卡莱神盾。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n盲眼者法尔希尔位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Aegis. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你在祖尔格拉布取得胜利了吗，$n？你只有带回我需要的权力珍宝，证明你对部族的价值，才能赢得赞达拉捕猎者披肩。",pEN="Have your strikes into Zul'Gurub yielded success, <name>? Only when you've brought me what I seek - and proven yourself fully to the tribe - will you earn a mantle second to none amongst the Zandalar.",c="干得好……你将在部族中受到$g崇敬:崇敬;，$n。凑齐披风所需的权力珍宝绝非小功绩，但你行事的方式正如我们最致命的掠食者。你已经赢得了在它们之中的位置，当然也赢得了披挂它们斗篷的权利。",cEN="Success... you are to be revered amongst the tribe, <name>. It was no small feat acquiring the Paragons of Power needed for the mantle, but you handled it in the fashion of the deadliest of our predators. You've earned your place amongst them, and you've certainly earned the right to wear their mantle."}
Q[8068]={d="魔法是供强者随心所欲运用的原始力量。魔精便是这种力量的外延，我们以幻术的形式来操纵这种魔法。谁希望自己打败的敌人并非真实的存在呢？赞达拉部族了解这种魔法，幻术师在部族中倍受尊敬。\n\n从祖尔格拉布带回我需要的权力珍宝吧——如果你成功的话，你就将受到部族的尊敬，并获得幻术师所使用的衬肩！",dEN="Magic is a raw, primal force to be shaped by those strong enough to do it. Mojo is our extension of this power; one such potent manipulation of it is in the form of illusion. How can one truly hope to win against a foe that is not even really there? We Zandalar know the power of this, and as such illusionists hold a honored place within the tribe.\n\nTake the needed Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub - for this, honor from the tribe and a powerful mantle used by our best illusionists will be yours!",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝交给全知者阿塔比姆：1条原始哈卡莱披肩。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n全知者阿塔比姆克在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Shawl. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="祖尔格拉布的情况如何？你利用幻术的力量打败敌人了吗？无论如何，他们都得死——从他们那儿取回的权力珍宝将会帮助我们打败哈卡。",pEN="How was your foray into Zul'Gurub? Did you drive your enemies mad through the power of illusion? Illusion or not, their deaths - and the Paragons of Power taken from them - will help thwart the rise of Hakkar.",c="成功！从今往后你将在部族中受到$g尊敬:尊敬;！多亏了你，$n，祖尔格拉布今天算是尝到了赞达拉的威力。\n\n带着部族的祝福，收下赞达拉幻术师的斗篷吧。愿它对你大有裨益。",cEN="Success! You shall be honored in the tribe from here on! Zul'Gurub has certainly tasted the might of the Zandalar today, thanks to you <name>.\n\nWith the tribe's blessing, take the Zandalar illusionist's mantle. May it serve you well."}
Q[8069]={d="部族成员通过所穿之物来确认地位与力量。我们的法衣由上等材料制成，并用我们赖以强大的魔精编织而成。幻术师也不例外；据说他们的长袍外观本身就体现着幻象的精髓。传说称，他们古老的长袍从来不会两次看起来一样。\n\n我会给你一件幻术师长袍，$n……但你得先在部族中赢得$g崇敬:崇敬;的地位！把祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给我！",dEN="The tribe acknowledges station and power through what we wear. Our vestments are made from the finest of materials, and interwoven with the mojo we use to make us powerful. Illusionists are no exception; their robes are said to embody the essence of illusion in their look. Legend states that their ancient robes never looked the same twice.\n\nI will give you an illusionist's robe, <name>... but earn your place of reverence among the tribe first! Bring me the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub!",o="把一件原始哈卡莱长袍带给全视者阿尔塔比姆。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Kossack. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你带着我们需要的权力珍宝回来了吗？我知道这不会容易……但我早就预言会有$g一个外来者:一个外来者;来帮助我们对抗哈卡。我说，就让你来吧！",pEN="Have you returned with the Paragons of Power we need? I know it will not be easy... but I have long predicted an outsider would come to aid us in our fight against Hakkar. Let it be you, I say!",c="终于有人$g配得上:配得上;穿这件幻术师长袍了！你在祖尔格拉布的成功确保了你今后数个世纪在部族中受到的崇敬。自豪地穿上它吧，$n！",cEN="At last, someone worthy to wear the illusionist's robe! Your success in Zul'Gurub has assured your reverences amongst the tribe for ages to come. Wear it with pride, <name>!"}
Q[8070]={d="古拉巴什覆灭后不久，我们赞达拉几乎在我们自己部族内部的邪恶手中走向最终的败亡。正是在那时，我们之中的忏悔者站了出来，通过放逐那些会毁灭自己同胞的人来保全部族。他们不仅让我们与灵魂保持共鸣，也守护着我们的血肉。\n\n进入祖尔格拉布，亲眼见证哈卡与古拉巴什的堕落。从他们手中夺走我们追寻的权力珍宝，你就会得到$g奖赏:奖赏;。",dEN="Shortly after the fall of the Gurubashi, we Zandalar almost succumbed to a final defeat from evil within our own tribe. It was then that the confessors amongst us arose, preserving the tribe by banishing out those who would destroy their own kind. They not only keep us in tune with the spirits, but they also preserve the flesh.\n\nGo forth into Zul'Gurub and witness first hand the depravity of Hakkar and the Gurubashi. Wrest the Paragons of Power that we seek from them; success will be rewarded!",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝交给全知者阿塔比姆：1条原始哈卡莱腰带。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n全知者阿塔比姆在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Sash. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="权力珍宝……你拿到它们了吗？只有当我们拥有了它们之后，才能使用那些储存在里面的强大能量。如果我们能对血神的仆从发起反攻，就再好不过了……",pEN="The Paragons of Power... do you have them? Only when we have them will we be able to make use of the latent power stored inside them. It will be good to turn the tables on the minions of the Blood God...",c="成功了！要对抗哈卡的复苏，我们还有很多事情要做。有了你的帮助，血神就无法将我们完全毁灭了。\n\n你今天赢得了部族的尊敬，$n。拿着这个——忏悔者束腕——这是我们对你的感谢。",cEN="Success! These will go a long way to building up our power against the rise of Hakkar. With your help, we've taken a significant step in ensuring that the Blood God will not destroy us all.\n\nYou've earned honor with the tribe today, <name>. Take this - the confessor's bindings - as a symbol of our thanks."}
Q[8071]={d="赞达拉的忏悔者都披着一件独特的斗篷，以此表明他们是部族的守护者。这些斗篷用强大的魔精织成，帮助他们在审判那些威胁我们部族的人时作出判断。作为$g牧师:女祭司;，你也要花时间去判断谁配得上、谁配不上；这样一件斗篷对你来说无疑是一份祝福。\n\n作为在祖尔格拉布与哈卡的爪牙作战、并把我追寻的权力珍宝带回来的交换，我会给你一件配得上我们最优秀忏悔者的斗篷。",dEN="The confessors of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive mantle, marking them as the preservers of the tribe. These mantles are woven with powerful mojo that aids them in judging those who would threaten our tribe. As a priest, you too must spend your time judging those worthy and not; such a mantle would definitely be a blessing to you.\n\nIn exchange for fighting Hakkar's minions in Zul'Gurub and bringing me the Paragons of Power I seek, I will give you a mantle worthy of our finest confessors.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给全视者阿尔塔比姆：一件原始哈卡莱神盾。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Aegis. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你拿到祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝了吗？",pEN="Do you have the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub?",c="干得好，$n——多亏了你，哈卡的爪牙今天肯定尝到了赞达拉的报应。你的行为为你赢得了部族中永久的$g崇敬:崇敬;地位。带着我们的祝福，请把这件忏悔者斗篷当作你自己的收下吧！",cEN="Well done, <name> - the minions of Hakkar have surely felt the retribution of the Zandalar today, thanks to you. Your actions have given you a permanent place of reverence within the tribe. With our blessing, please take this confessor's mantle as your own!"}
Q[8072]={d="\"赞达拉传奇的狂徒之一，是“裂开者”卡'瓦克萨尔。传说他第一次面对部族的敌人时，用的是一件专门以\"疯狂之织\"编成的斗篷。他的身影不仅被斗篷笼罩，还被他那对双匕的炫目速度所包裹。如今的狂徒珍视自己的斗篷，视之为自身在部族中位置的标志。\n\n把我要的权力珍宝交给我，这样一件斗篷就归你所有，好让你把疯狂编织到自己的敌人身上。",dEN="One of Zandalar's legendary madcaps was Khar'vaxal the Cracked. Legend states that when facing the enemies of the tribe for the first time, Kar'xavan used his mantle specifically woven with \"the weave of madness\". His form was shrouded not only by the mantle, but also with the blinding speed of his twin daggers. Madcaps today cherish their mantle as a sign of their place in the tribe.\n\nBring to me the Paragons of Power I seek, and such a mantle will be yours to weave madness unto your own enemies.",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给盲眼法希尔：1条原始哈卡莱束带。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n盲眼法希尔在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Falthir the Sightless a Primal Hakkari Girdle. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你回来了——你带来了我需要的权力珍宝了吗？\n\n卡瓦萨尔的传说告诉我们，无论敌人有多强大，他们都不是不可战胜的。混乱会使所有人屈服，这点是毫无疑问的……而混乱中那些最有序的因素也可能使所有人屈服。",pEN="You've returned - do you have the Paragons of Power I need?\n\nThe legend of Khar'vaxal the Cracked serves us today as a reminder that no foe - no matter how great a threat they may be - is impossible to overcome. Chaos will bring everyone to their knees, that much is certain... and perhaps the most non-chaotic elements of chaos.",c="多亏你播撒在我们共同敌人身上的疯狂，今天的胜利属于我们！你理应在赞达拉中受到$g尊敬:尊敬;，而表达对你功绩的感激，最好的方式莫过于把这件狂徒斗篷送给你！",cEN="Victory is ours this day, thanks to the madness you have sowed upon our mutual enemies! You are to be honored amongst the Zandalar, and there is no better way of showing gratitude for your deeds than by offering you the madcap's mantle!"}
Q[8073]={d="我的眼睛很早以前就瞎了，但是我一点也不怀念它们。在我们这样的部族中，衣饰代表了着装者的地位和意图，而最强大的衣服所蕴涵的力量不是用肉眼就能看出来的。赞达拉狂妄者外套也不例外，它蕴藏着可任你操控的混乱和疯狂之力。\n\n我需要的权力珍宝就在祖尔格拉布中，去找到那些珍宝，我会奖励你一件传说中的外套……适合狂妄者的外套。",dEN="My eyes failed me long ago, but I do not miss them. Even in a tribe such as ours - where one's vestments convey station and purpose - the most potent of garb exudes power that simple eyes cannot see. The prized tunic of the Zandalar madcap is no exception, exuding the raw power of chaos and madness that they are able to channel.\n\nThe Paragons of Power I need lie in Zul'Gurub; bring me what I seek, and I will reward you with your own legendary tunic... one befitting a weaver of madness.",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给盲眼者法尔希尔：一件原始哈卡莱神盾。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n盲眼者法尔希尔位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Falthir the Sightless a Primal Hakkari Aegis. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nFalthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="欢迎回到尤亚姆巴岛，$n……你成功地取回权力珍宝了吗？",pEN="Welcome back to the Isle, <name>... have you returned triumphantly with the Paragons of Power in tow?",c="很出色……你做到了很多人无法做到的事情。你获得了部族永远的崇敬，$n。你获得了穿上狂妄者外套的权力——带着我们的祝福穿上它吧。",cEN="Impressive... you have accomplished today what few thought was possible. Your reverence in the tribe is assured for a lifetime, <name>. You have earned the right to don the madcap's tunic - do so with our blessing."}
Q[8074]={d="预言者了解元素中蕴含的魔精，他们将其作为指引部族繁荣发展的工具。在古拉巴什帝国毁灭后的黑暗岁月里，他们将我们领回祖尔格拉布的山谷中。\n\n从祖尔格拉布把权力珍宝给我带回来，证明你的实力。如果你能做到的话，我会送你一条预言者使用的腰带——里面有强大的魔精！",dEN="Augurs know the mojo of the elements, mon. They use it as a means to guide the tribe to glory. In the dark days after the Gurubashi Empire ripped itself up, our augurs led us to our safe haven in the South Seas. They've also led us back here to the Vale, right back to the heart of evil brewin' in Zul'Gurub.\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do it and I'll give ya a belt that our augurs use - one with powerful mojo inside it!",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给祖达萨的梅维克：1条原始哈卡莱束带。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n祖达萨的梅维克在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Girdle. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nMaywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="我需要的正是权力珍宝——在对祖尔格拉布的恶魔作战时，我们可以利用它的力量。你带来权力珍宝了吗？",pEN="The Paragons of Power are what I need mon - we'll tap the power right out of them in our fight against the evil from Zul'Gurub. Do ya have them for me?",c="我能闻到你身上那被击败的邪恶的气味，$n。那是股甜美的味道，兄弟……我想你对它相当熟悉。\n\n我知道为我带来制作腰带所需的权力珍宝绝非小事。你的行为不仅为部族增了光，也为你$g自己:自己;在部族中增了光。拿着——收下预言者腰带，就当它是你自己的吧！",cEN="I can smell the scent of vanquished evil on ya, <name>. It's a sweet smell mon... one I think you know quite well.\n\nI know it's no small feat to have brought me the Paragons of Power required for the belt. Your deeds have not only honored the tribe, but also honored yourself amongst my tribe. Here ya are - take the augur's belt and don it as your own!"}
Q[8075]={d="赞达拉预言者都身着一件与众不同的外套。它是由最好的丝绸和布料织成的，其中还编入了坚韧的锁链。这不仅是神力的象征，也是权力的标志。跟那些用尽毕生精力与灵魂交谈的预言者唱反调绝不是明智之举……\n\n从祖尔格拉布找回我需要的权力珍宝，证明你的价值。如果你成功的话，我就送你一件预言者梦寐以求的外套！",dEN="The augurs of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive chest piece called a hauberk. It's fitted with the finest of silks and cloths, interwoven with strong chain. It's a symbol of not only their divinity, but also of their authority, mon. It's never wise to cross one whose life is devoted to speakin' with the spirits...\n\nBring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do it and I'll give ya one of the finest hauberks our augurs would ever hope to wear!",o="把下列祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝带给祖尔达扎的梅维基：一件原始哈卡莱战袍。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n祖尔达扎的梅维基位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Maywiki of Zuldazar a Primal Hakkari Tabard. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nMaywiki of Zuldazar is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="权力珍宝是魔法的关键来源——占兆师炼衫中也蕴藏了这样的魔法。把我需要的东西交给我，我就送你一件赞达拉占兆师梦寐以求的炼衫。",pEN="The Paragons of Power are a key source of magic power - the same kind of power that goes into makin' the augur's hauberk. Bring me what I need, and I'll be able to share the finest of vestments any Zandalar augur would be wantin' as their own.",c="我知道你为了给我带来权力珍宝经历了什么，$n。兄弟，击败那像恶臭软泥一样从祖尔格拉布渗出的邪恶可不容易——但现在尘埃落定，我可以干脆地说，你将在今后数个世纪里受到$g崇敬:崇敬;！\n\n拿着——把这件预言者锁甲穿在身上，自豪地穿着它！",cEN="I know what ya had to go through to bring me the Paragons of Power, <name>. It wasn't easy, mon - defeatin' the evil that seeps out of Zul'Gurub like a foul ooze - but now that it is all said and done, I can easily say that you'll be revered amongst the Zandalar for ages to come!\n\nHere - take the augur's hauberk and wear it with pride!"}
Q[8076]={d="恶魔师的目标是直接吸收所有的能量，而不是简单地占据它。我们的许多恶魔师都在和恶魔战斗的过程中失败了；我们的敌人——尤其是古拉巴什的敌人——在威胁着我们，因此在真正需要牺牲的时候，恶魔师的力量将会倾泻在敌人的头上。我们能否生存取决于能否摧毁那些想要毁灭我们的人；古拉巴什帝国的沦陷让我们学会了这些东西。\n\n去祖尔格拉布，拿回我们所需的权力珍宝。完成了这一任务之后，我们将会奖励你一件珍贵的东西。",dEN="The demoniac seeks to embody power outright, not just possess it. More than one of our demoniacs has lost a fight with a demon; with our enemies threatening us - especially in Zul'Gurub - the power that a demoniac is able to unleash on our foes is worth the sacrifice. Our survival depends on crushing those who would destroy us; the fall of the Gurubashi Empire taught us this.\n\nTravel to Zul'Gurub and gain the Paragons of Power we need. Do this, and a valuable demoniac item shall be yours.",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝交给全知者阿塔比姆：1条原始哈卡莱腰带。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n全知者阿塔比姆在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Sash. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你找到了祖尔格拉布中的权力珍宝？我们将从这些物品中抽取力量并为我们所用，如果你成功了，我们会给你应得的奖励……",pEN="Retrieved the Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub? While we will take the latent power from these items and make them our own, we will give you your own reward of power should you be successful...",c="干得好，$n。来自祖尔格拉布的权力珍宝应当成为浪费力量的一记提醒。古拉巴什在鼎盛时很强大，但他们让自己被这份力量吞噬了。恶魔师明白，他们玩的游戏与此非常相似，但释放出来的力量往往正是生存所需之物。\n\n把这件斗篷当作赞达拉荣誉盟友的象征来使用……它会让你受益的。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub should act as a reminder of wasted power. The Gurubashi were strong at their height, but they allowed themselves to be consumed by it. A demoniac knows that the game they play is much similar, but the power unleashed is often the very thing needed for survival.\n\nUse this mantle as an honored ally of the Zandalar... it will serve you well."}
Q[8077]={d="力量的终极象征就是我们在战斗中穿着的服饰。恶魔师的长袍都是用优良的符文布和强大的魔精制作而成的。长袍的外表会让所有看到他的人感到恐惧……特别是那些恶魔师想要控制的恶魔。\n\n去祖尔格拉布找回我所需要的权力珍宝。这会非常困难……但是你的成功将会为你换来一件无以匹敌的长袍。",dEN="The ultimate symbol of power amongst the tribe is the garb we wear in battle. A demoniac's robes have fused fine runecloth and devastatingly powerful mojo into a single fabric. The visage of the robe is said to instill fear into the minds of all who see it... especially the demons that the demoniac will eventually dominate.\n\nFrom Zul'Gurub, you must bring me a very specific set of the Paragons of Power. It will be difficult... but your success will assure you of acquiring a robe for yourself.",o="把一件原始哈卡莱长袍带给全视者阿尔塔比姆。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n全视者阿尔塔比姆位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Al'tabim the All-Seeing a Primal Hakkari Kossack. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nAl'tabim the All-Seeing is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="权力珍宝……你有没有找到它们？只有我们得到这些东西，你才能获得恶魔力量的终极象征，$n。",pEN="The Paragons of Power... you have returned with them? Only once we have them will we share the ultimate symbol of demoniac power with you, <name>.",c="太好了——你在祖尔格拉布的胜利向我们，不，是向整个世界作出了保证，哈卡绝对无法为所欲为。你最终将要直接面对血神……你在赞达拉部族中也将获得极高的声望。\n\n哦，这件简单的长袍也能帮你一些忙。\n\n<阿塔比姆意味深长地对你眨了眨眼睛。>",cEN="Impressive - your victory in Zul'Gurub has assured us - nay, the world - that Hakkar will not prevail. The time may come when you face the Blood God directly... and should this come to pass know that your reverence is assured amongst the Zandalar tribe.\n\nOh, and this simple robe should help out too I think.\n\n<Al'tabim winks knowingly at you.>"}
Q[8078]={d="祖尔格拉布将再次沐浴在仇恨的洗礼中。哈卡，这个摧毁了古拉巴什帝国的恶魔必须被消灭，无论我们付出多大代价也都在所不惜。现在的巨魔只不过是光芒消退后残存的阴影而已，这都是哈卡造成的！\n\n成为一名辩护者吧，去消灭恶魔的爪牙。祖尔格拉布将要尝到来自赞达拉的复仇。把权力珍宝交给我，我会给你一条辩护者腰带，让你拥有真实的力量。\n\n去吧。",dEN="The ultimate vengeance waits within Zul'Gurub. Hakkar must not rise again. Hakkar destroyed the Gurubashi Empire from within. No sacrifice was enough. The trolls are a shadow of former glories. I know this is because of Hakkar.\n\nBecome the vindicator you were meant to be. Wreak havoc on the minions of evil. Zul'Gurub must taste Zandalar vengeance. Bring me proof in the Paragons of Power. You will receive the vindicator's belt. You will receive real power.\n\nGo.",o="从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给击碎者金罗克：1条原始哈卡莱束带。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。\n\n击碎者金罗克在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Girdle. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你带回权力珍宝了吗？你打败部族的敌人了吗？必须让哈卡尝到辩护者的愤怒！",pEN="Have you brought the Paragons of Power? Have you struck down the enemies of the tribe? Hakkar must know the wrath of the vindicator!",c="复仇者之道你现在已经知晓。你为部族带来了荣耀。你为自己带来了荣耀。你为我们的敌人带来了痛苦。\n\n复仇者腰带归你了。你$g无疑:无疑;正在$g与复仇者之道融为一体:与复仇者之道融为一体;。",cEN="The way of the vindicator is now known to you. You have brought honor to the tribe. You have brought honor to yourself. You have brought pain to our enemies.\n\nThe vindicator's belt is yours. You are surely becoming one with the way of the vindicator."}
Q[8079]={d="胸甲是辩护者力量的象征。它是由魔精制成的。只有那些受到部族崇敬的勇士才能拥有它，这是赞达拉复仇的象征。\n\n要成为辩护者，就必须复仇。从祖尔格拉布取回我们需要的权力珍宝，夺回被盗的魔精。哈卡的爪牙将为此付出代价，而你将因此获得辩护者胸甲。\n\n去吧。成为我们的复仇之神，$n。",dEN="The vindicator's symbol of power is the breastplate. It is forged with powerful mojo. It is trusted only to those we revere. It is the Zandalar symbol of vengeance.\n\nTo become a vindicator is to become vengeance. Take the Paragons of Power we need from Zul'Gurub. Bring them to us. We will take the mojo stolen from us. We will make the minions of Hakkar pay. We will reward you with the vindicator's breastplate.\n\nGo. Be our vengeance, <name>.",o="把一件原始哈卡莱长袍带给破击者金罗克。你还必须与赞达拉部族的声望达到至少$g崇敬:崇敬;。\n\n破击者金罗克位于荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛。",oEN="Bring Jin'rokh the Breaker a Primal Hakkari Kossack. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.\n\nJin'rokh the Breaker is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你获胜了吗？你取回权力珍宝了吗？告诉我你的复仇经历！",pEN="Your presence means victory? Do you have the Paragons of Power? Tell me of the vengeance you have wrought today!",c="你应当因你的功绩而受到$g崇敬:崇敬;。部族会奖赏它的$g英雄:英雄;。祖尔格拉布从未像今天这样尝到赞达拉的复仇。\n\n你的事迹将昭示后来者的行动。他们会把你看作真正力量的标志。他们会把你看作复仇的化身！",cEN="You are to be revered for your deeds. The tribe rewards its heroes. Zul'Gurub has tasted Zandalar vengeance like never before.\n\nYour deeds will herald the deeds of others to come. They will look upon you as a sign of real power. They will look upon you as vengeance personified!"}
Q[8081]={p="$n，阿拉索联军有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the League of Arathor has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by footman and field marshal alike."}
Q[8101]={p="NULL",pEN="NULL",c="$r，这枚护符框架中的小石子来自南海的卡哈罗山。卡哈罗山是一片饱受不稳定之苦的区域——以猛烈而常常带有魔法性质的火山喷发为标志。\n\n随着你与赞达拉巨魔的羁绊增长，这颗小石子的力量也会增长。驾驭这颗小石子的力量去击倒我们的敌人吧。像那座山一样：$g迅捷、猛烈:迅捷、猛烈;、致命……",cEN="<race>, the pebble held within the frame of this talisman comes from Mount Kajaro in the South Seas. Mount Kajaro is an area plagued by volatility - marked by violent and oftentimes magical volcanic eruptions.\n\nAs your bond with the trolls of Zandalar grows, so too shall the power of this pebble. Harness the power of the pebble to strike down our enemies. Be like the mountain: Quick, explosive, deadly..."}
Q[8102]={p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$c。我能看出这颗小石子已经经受了许多使用。我们的许多敌人都倒在了你超凡的能力之下。他们受的苦可不少。是时候强化这颗小石子的力量了。把它给我。",pEN="Welcome back, <class>. I can see that the pebble has seen much use. Many of our foes have fallen to your otherworldly abilities. Their suffering has been great. It is time that I enhance the power of the pebble. Give it to me.",c="像卡哈罗的熔岩前线一样，势不可挡。",cEN="Be unstoppable, like the molten fronts of Kajaro."}
Q[8103]={p="哈卡莱畏惧你，$n。他们谈起那些他们曾以为只有自己那无面之神才能犯下的恐怖行径。你用卡哈罗之力烧灼了他们。如今他们在两个地方都知道了恐惧。\n\n是时候进一步强化这颗小石子了。把护符交给我。",pEN="Hakkari fear you, <name>. They speak of horrors they believed that only their faceless God could perpetrate. You have burned them with the force of Kajaro. They now know fear in two places.\n\nIt is time to further strengthen the pebble. Hand me the talisman.",c="继续屠戮祖尔格拉布的巨魔吧。我们必须确保世界不会在哈卡那不可征服的意志之下屈服。",cEN="Continue in your decimation of the trolls of Zul'Gurub. Hakkar must see that the world will not buckle beneath his indomitable will."}
Q[8104]={p="把坠饰给我吧，$n。我要给你看点东西。",pEN="Give me the talisman, <name>. I must show you something.",c="<阿塔比姆以你前所未见的强大力量击碎了石头。>\n\n看见了吗？卡亚罗之石便是我们所说的异质晶簇。石头中蕴藏中汲取了潜在能量的水晶，破开石头便能发挥最大潜能。用它来消灭我们的敌人吧。",cEN="<Al'tabim shatters the pebble with a powerful unseen force.>\n\nDo you see? The pebble is what we call a geode. Inside the pebble are powerful crystals that have been soaking in the latent energies from our world. By cutting the pebble in half, I have finally allowed its full potential to be realized. Use it to lay waste to our enemies."}
Q[8106]={c="请收下这块坠饰，$c。运用它的力量消灭我们共同的敌人。\n\n戴在你脖子上的坠饰蕴涵着一段历史。科赞原本是赞达拉帝国的领土。但是地精的贸易大亨玷污了此地，将我的兄弟姐妹赶了出来。\n\n科赞现在是地精主城安德麦的领地——但是在科赞被玷污之前，它曾是一片伟大的土地。即使在今天，我们仍将科赞看作神圣的地方。",cEN="Accept this talisman, <class>. Accept it and use its power to strike down our mutual enemies.\n\nKnow that around your neck you carry a piece of history. Kezan was once a grand territory of the Zandalar Empire. Alas, the taint of goblin trade princes would force out my proud brothers and sisters.\n\nKezan is now home to the goblin capital of the Undermine; but know that before the taint, it held greatness. Still to this day Kezan is considered sacred land to my people."}
Q[8107]={p="荣耀是在赞达拉巨魔之中赢得的，$n。伴随荣耀而来的是回报——友谊、同盟……\n\n把护符给我，好让我强化它的力量。",pEN="Honor is earned amongst the Zandalar trolls, <name>. With honor comes reward - friendship, alliance...\n\nHand me the talisman so that I may enhance its power.",c="从黑暗中汲取力量，$c。拥抱暗影。让科赞之污助长你在黑暗中的勾当。",cEN="Draw from the darkness, <class>. Embrace the shadows. Let Kezan's Taint supplement your dark meddling."}
Q[8108]={p="我为你准备好了，$c。我会再一次强化你的护符。我只要求你继续摧毁哈卡和他的爪牙。\n\n把护符给我。",pEN="I am ready for you, <class>. Once more I will enhance your talisman. I only ask that you continue in your destruction of Hakkar and his minions.\n\nGive me the talisman.",c="只有通过我们共同的努力，才能阻止噬魂者。",cEN="It is only through our combined efforts that we will stop the Soulflayer."}
Q[8109]={p="召唤恶魔，$c。让它们汲取玷污科赞的黑暗能量。指挥它们大开杀戒！\n\n是的……是时候对科赞的玷污进行最后一次强化了。把它给我吧。",pEN="Call forth your demons, <class>. Let them bask in the energy of Kezan's Taint. Command them on the field of battle! Decimate the enemy!\n\nYes... The time has come to apply the final enhancement to Kezan's Taint. Give me the talisman.",c="剥去他们尸体上的鲜肉。看着黑暗的力量吞噬哈卡，从他们的恐惧中汲取力量，$c。让科赞的玷污再次强化……",cEN="Flay the flesh from their corpses. Watch as the shadows consume the Hakkari. Draw power from their fear, <class>. Let Kezan's Taint augment this power..."}
Q[8110]={p="NULL",pEN="NULL",c="看见这儿的海藻了吗，兄弟？它来自南海。我们只要加一点魔精、一点魔法，它就会$g具备:具备;最适合其主人的特性。\n\n你是$c，所以这很容易，兄弟。把它缠在脖子上，想着自然，或者松鼠，或者你们这种人喜欢的随便什么东西。",cEN="See this here seaweed, mon? It be from the South Seas. We just add a little mojo and a little magic and it takes on the properties most suited to its owner.\n\nYou a <class> so it be easy, mon. Just wrap it around your neck and think of nature or squirrels or whatever it be that you people like."}
Q[8111]={p="嘿，兄弟！又见到你真好。部族都在谈论你屠杀哈卡莱之类的壮举。莫托尔已经吩咐我给您的护符加更多魔精。把它放这儿，梅维基会把它变得更好。",pEN="Hey mon! It be good to see you again. The tribe be talking about your killin' of the Hakkari and all that. Molthor gave me the word to be adding more mojo to your talisman. Just give it here and Maywiki make it better.",c="脖子上那玩意儿不是拿来抽的，兄弟！你得用它去对抗邪恶。",cEN="The neck piece not be for smokin', mon! You got to use it to fight evil."}
Q[8112]={p="那护符怎么样，兄弟？看起来是时候给它的叶子加点魔法和魔精了。它需要重新绽放一点……它正在枯萎。把它给我，梅维基会把它修好的。",pEN="How be that talisman, mon? It look like it be time to add a little more magic and mojo to its leaves. It need a little bloom in its wilt. Give it here and Maywiki fix it right up.",c="现在你去祖尔格拉布找那些邪恶的巨魔，让他们见识见识你的自然之力能做什么，兄弟！",cEN="Now you take the evil trolls in Zul'Gurub and show them what your nature powers can do, mon!"}
Q[8113]={p="$n！好久不见。拉斯塔哈命令我为你的坠饰加入更多的魔精和魔法，这可是最后一次呢，你知道吗？真的！要不是亲眼所见，我怎么都无法相信呢。把坠饰放在这儿吧。",pEN="<name>! It been a long time since I seen you. Did you know that King Rastakhan himself be givin' me the order to add the final bit of mojo and magic to your talisman? It be true, mon! I wouldn't have believed it had I not seen it with me own eyes. Give it here.",c="$n，旅途愉快。继续取哈卡和他的爪牙的性命吧。",cEN="<name> mon, it been a good journey. Keep on with the killing and suppressing of Hakkar and he minions."}
Q[8114]={d="$n，你赢得了在阿拉希盆地的战争，并在战场上证明了自己有资格得到荣耀和尊重。你是一个有价值的$c，你让我们的敌人知道我们绝对不会向他们的暴行屈服！\n\n现在我有一项艰巨的任务要交给你。我需要你进入阿拉希盆地，占领至少四座基地。如果你可以完成这个任务的话，那么我们不仅保证了重要资源的供给，而且还向部落展示了我们的力量！\n\n出发吧，$n，祝你好运。",dEN="<name>, you have taken the battle of Arathi Basin to our enemies and earned great honors in that field of battle. You have shown us your worth as a <class>, and you have shown our enemies that we will not submit to their villainy!\n\nBecause of your proven value to us, I have a difficult task for you. I want you to take and hold at least four of the bases in Arathi Basin. If you can do that, then we will not only secure critical resources, we will show the Horde our dominance!\n\nGo, <name>, and good fortune.",o="进入阿拉希盆地，同时占据并控制四座基地，当任务完成之后向避难谷地的奥斯莱特元帅报告。",oEN="Enter Arathi Basin, capture and control four bases at the same time, and then return to Field Marshal Oslight at Refuge Pointe.",c="干得非常好，$n！一名兴奋的斥候跑来向我报告了你的功绩。我们阿拉索联军非常高兴！\n\n你正迅速成为联军士兵中的本地$g英雄:英雄;，而今天的壮举再次证明了你的卓越声望。",cEN="Very good work, <name>! An excited scout came to me with a report of your exploits. We in the League of Arathor are very pleased!\n\nYou are swiftly becoming a local hero among the soldiers in the League, and today's deed once again proves your sterling reputation."}
Q[8115]={d="$n，阿拉希盆地的资源之战是一场血腥的战斗。阿拉索联军需要你的帮助。\n\n我们还有一个任务需要交给你。\n\n联军想要对污染者进行一次大规模攻击。我们要把他们从这个战场中的每个重要战略点里赶出去！\n\n这个任务不简单，但是如果说有人可以完成它的话，那个人就是你。",dEN="<name>, battling for the resources of Arathi Basin is a bloody undertaking. Your services to the League of Arathor are as needed as they are appreciated.\n\nAnd we have one more task for you.\n\nThe League wishes to make one strong push against the Defilers' occupation of Arathi Basin. We want them driven out of every strategic point on the battlefield!\n\nIt will not be easy, but if anyone can get it done, it is you.",o="同时控制阿拉希盆地中的五座基地，然后向避难谷地的奥斯莱特元帅复命。",oEN="Control 5 bases in Arathi Basin at the same time, then return to Field Marshal Oslight at Refuge Pointe.",c="你成功了！你占据了所有基地！做得好，$n！\n\n以前有人曾怀疑你能否顺利完成，但是我就知道你会成功。感谢你，整个阿拉索联军向你表示致敬，而被遗忘者的污染者每次提到你的名字，必定感到胆战心惊！",cEN="You did it! You took all of the bases! Well done, <name>!\n\nThere were those who doubted your chances, but I knew you could do it. Thank you, and know that the League of Arathor holds you in high regard, just as the Defilers of the Forsaken must fear the very mention of your name!"}
Q[8116]={p="NULL",pEN="NULL",c="你和梅维基有共同之处，兄弟。我们都是$c！不过，梅维基更像个神秘主义者，你更像个灌木丛。即便如此，我们都知道伟大的灵魂会带来什么。\n\n作为礼物，我把这颗宝珠送给你，戴在脖子上。往里面深处看，看看南海的巫德雷斯村！让它振作你的精神！",cEN="You and Maywiki have something in common, mon. We both be <class>! Although, Maywiki is more of a mystic and you be more of a scrub. Still, we both know what the great spirits bring.\n\nAs a gift I give to you this orb to wear around your neck. Look deep inside and see the village of Voodress in the South Seas! Let it lift your spirits!"}
Q[8117]={p="好消息，$n。莫托尔最近一直在夸你。他说你会成为赞达拉真正的$g英雄:英雄;。\n\n他还说让梅维基再把你的宝珠打磨一下！把它放这儿，好让梅维基点亮那景象。",pEN="Good news, <name>. Molthor be singin' your praises lately. He say how you be turnin' into a real hero of Zandalar.\n\nHe also say for Maywiki to polish your orb some more! Give it here so Maywiki can brighten the vision.",c="当心哈卡莱的邪恶灵魂，兄弟。老实说，它们挺吓人的。",cEN="Beware the evil Hakkari spirits, mon. Honestly, they be spooky."}
Q[8118]={p="啊哈！梅维基闹了一个笑话！\n\n<梅维基大笑了起来。>\n\n这么说，你一直利用灵魂和元素的力量对抗那些藏在祖尔格拉布的敌人，是吗？这值得奖励！\n\n梅维基会磨亮你的宝珠的。把宝珠放在这儿，$n。",pEN="Sha-mon! Maywiki make a joke!\n\n<Maywiki laughs.>\n\nSo, you been using the spirits and elements against our enemies in Zul'Gurub, eh? Spirits be praised!\n\nMaywiki gonna brighten your orb. Give it here, <name>.",c="看看吧，$n。巫毒的力量更加强大了，不是吗？让原始的力量流遍你吧。",cEN="Take a look at it now, <name>. Voodress come in even clearer now, yea? Let the primal power flow through you, mon."}
Q[8119]={p="<梅维基指着你的坠饰。>\n\n看看它，$n！看起来象真的一样。灵魂在围绕着宝珠跳舞。\n\n把它交给梅维基吧，她会进行最后一次调整的。",pEN="<Maywiki points to your talisman.>\n\nLook at it, <name>! It's come alive. The spirits dance around the orb.\n\nGive it to Maywiki so she can make one last adjustment.",c="$n，终有一天你可以使用宝珠直接与我交流。一旦你结束了与哈卡的战争，梅维基就能重返家园。让我们呼唤那些强大的灵魂，让那一天早日到来吧。",cEN="One day, <name>, you will be able to use this orb to communicate directly with me. Whenever this battle with Hakkar be over and Maywiki go home. Let us call to the spirits and ask them for that day to come soon."}
Q[8121]={d="$n，随着阿拉希盆地的战事进展，你的事迹已经传遍了战场。你的所做所为让我确信你一定可以完成现在我要给你的任务。\n\n现在是给阿拉索联军一个信号的时候了。我们将会向他们展示，他们在阿拉希盆地的防守是多么脆弱。我们要通过同时占领阿拉希盆地的四个战略点来让他们明白这一点。\n\n如果你可以完成这个任务，$n，你将赢得污染者的尊敬。",dEN="<name>, as the battles over Arathi Basin rage, news of your actions have reached many ears. You are highly regarded among us, which gives me confidence that you will accomplish the mission I now have for you.\n\nIt is time to send a message to the League of Arathor. We must show them that their holdings in Arathi Basin are tenuous and quickly lost. We will show them this by holding, all at once, four strategic points in Arathi Basin.\n\nSucceed in this, <name>, and earn great respect among the Defilers.",o="同时占据阿拉希盆地中的四座基地，然后向落锤镇的屠杀者杜维尔复命。",oEN="Hold four bases at the same time in Arathi Basin, and then return to Deathmaster Dwire in Hammerfall.",c="做得好，$n！你最近在阿拉希盆地所完成的任务都十分困难，它们的成功值得表扬。阿拉索联军在最近的遭遇战中必定被打得抱头鼠窜，希望他们可以重新考虑一下继续在这里战斗的必要性。",cEN="Good work, <name>! Your latest actions in Arathi Basin were quite difficult, and so their successes are quite praiseworthy. The League of Arathor must be reeling from the last skirmishes in the basin, licking their wounds and, let us hope, rethinking their choice to fight here."}
Q[8122]={d="我们其实已经深深陷入战争之中，只是我们还没有意识到。幸好，我们的探子回报说发现了阿拉索联军的弱点。我们必须利用这一机会对他们造成致命一击！回到阿拉希盆地，和我们的敌人交战吧。诅咒他们，干掉他们，控制所有的五个战略点！让他们的士兵尖叫，流血，从前线仓皇撤退，让他们用抽泣的嘴唇述说你的事迹。\n\n完成这一目标，为污染者带来光辉的胜利。",dEN="It is difficult to see, so deep we are in the conflict, but our spies report a weakening in the League of Arathor's resolve. We must use this window and strike a brutal blow against them! Return to Arathi Basin and throw yourself against our foes. Curse them and kill them and control all five strategic bases! Send their soldiers screaming and bleeding from the front lines, with stories of your cruelty on their mewling lips.\n\nDo this, and score a great victory for the Defilers.",o="同时占据阿拉希盆地中的五座基地，然后向落锤镇的屠杀者杜维尔复命。",oEN="Hold five bases in Arathi Basin at the same time, then return to Deathmaster Dwire in Hammerfall.",c="联盟的哭喊声和你的冲锋号角响彻战场，即使在这里也可以清晰听到，$n。对于他们所遭受的苦痛和你带去的恐惧，我感到遗憾。不过只是一点点而已。\n\n你对于污染者的贡献是毋庸置疑的。你在阿拉希盆地的事迹让人感到震撼，它已经传到了瓦里玛萨斯大人……甚至是黑暗女王的耳中。",cEN="The cries of the Alliance as you and your compatriots attacked them could be heard even from here, <name>. I can almost pity them for the pain and fear you delivered to their ranks. Almost, but not quite.\n\nYour value to the Defilers is without question. Your deeds in Arathi Basin have been most impressive, and have echoed among the chambers of Varimathras... and the Dark Lady herself."}
Q[8123]={d="阿拉索联军正在不惜一切代价进攻阿拉希，并妄图夺回这个区域。联盟的各个种族正在全力进军这块遥远的土地，想要将他们的势力从避难谷地扩张到这里。我们必须阻止他们，而最好的方式就是夺取他们的资源。\n\n你可以帮助我们，$n。进入阿拉希盆地，那里遍地都是丰富的矿藏、肥沃的土地和技艺精湛的能工巧匠。占据并控制你找到的所有基地，赢得战斗，然后把你获得的资源给我拿回来。",dEN="The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi. They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe. We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.\n\nYou can help us, <name>. Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman. Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.",o="进入阿拉希盆地，获得一箱阿拉希资源箱，然后将它交给落锤镇的亡灵哨兵莫提斯。",oEN="Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Deathstalker Mortis at Hammerfall."}
Q[8124]={p="$n，污染者有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the Defilers has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by grunt and high warlord alike."}
Q[8141]={c="年轻人$c，你进步神速。或许是该让你加入塞拉利卡——赞达拉的精英组织了。数千年来，我们一直充当着赞达拉帝国的刺客，但是长期以来我们都很懒散松懈，这使得哈卡的力量不断扩张。当我们再次面对哈卡大军的时候，却没了巨魔同盟的支持。你和你的盟友必须帮助我们消灭血神和他的爪牙！\n\n带上这个坠饰，它会助你一臂之力的。",cEN="You progress swiftly, young <class>. Perhaps it is time to initiate you into the Shera Ali'kh - Zandalari for Death's Hand. For thousands of years we have played the role of assassin for the Zandalar Empire. For too long we have sat idly, allowing the Hakkari to grow in strength. Once more we face Hakkar, but this time without the support of a united <race> front. It is you and your allies who must assist in vanquishing the Blood God and his minions!\n\nWear this talisman and let it assist you in your journeys."}
Q[8142]={p="令人印象深刻，$n。你有一种杀伐的天赋，我多年未在别人身上感应到了。就连莫托尔也知道你为赞达拉做的事。是时候进一步强化你的护符了。把它给我。",pEN="Impressive, <name>. You have a gift for killing that I have not sensed in another in many years. Even Molthor is aware of the work that you have done for Zandalar. It is time to enhance your talisman further. Give it to me.",c="这枚护符上只剩最后一项强化可以施加了，$c。时机合适时，我会施加那项强化。",cEN="There is only one enhancement left that can be placed on the talisman, <class>. When the time is right, I shall apply that enhancement."}
Q[8143]={p="我感应到你让哈卡莱遭受了无数死亡，$n。你身上带着他们魔精的臭气。\n\n我猜暗影护符在屠杀中帮上了忙？把它给我，让我强化它的力量。",pEN="I sense that you have dealt countless fatalities to the Hakkari, <name>. You carry the stink of their mojo.\n\nI assume the Shadow talisman has assisted in the culling? Give it to me and allow me to enhance its power.",c="像你这样水准的$g刺客:刺客;应当让人远远避开。你的敌人必须学会敬畏！当敌人看见死亡之手的寒光时就会明白这一点——只是为时已晚……",cEN="An assassin of your caliber should be given a wide berth. Your foes must learn respect! You will get just that when the enemy sees the glint of Death's Hand - all too late..."}
Q[8144]={p="$n，它渴望成长。坠饰已经吸取了祖尔格拉布上千具巨魔尸体的能量。把它给我吧，我会对它做最后一次强化。",pEN="It yearns to grow, <name>. The talisman has soaked in all that you have done. The thousands of troll corpses littering Zul'Gurub have fueled its power. Hand it to me and I shall make the final enhancement.",c="这是我们最后一次在塞拉利卡的庇护下进行交谈。你已经知道自己该做什么了。带上坠饰继续杀戮吧，绝不能让哈卡离开祖尔格拉布。",cEN="This is the last time we will speak under the auspices of Shera Ali'kh. You know all that you must. Take the talisman and continue in your slaying. Hakkar must never be allowed to leave Zul'Gurub."}
Q[8145]={c="在赞达拉人之中，$c这一职业备受尊崇。我们最伟大的猎人会前往大漩涡边缘证明自己的决心。\n\n他们从海洋深处扯出被称为大漩涡触须的海藻条。随后，这些海藻被编织成一枚护符，并施以附魔以提升他们的精准与力量。\n\n现在我赐予你这枚大漩涡触须的单次编织。随着你与赞达拉的羁绊增长，我会把更多力量织入这枚护符。",cEN="Amongst the Zandalarians, the profession of <class> is revered. Our greatest hunters travel to the edge of the Maelstrom to prove their resolution.\n\nFrom the heart of the sea they pull strands of kelp known as Maelstrom Tendrils. The kelp is then woven into a talisman that is enchanted to improve their accuracy and power.\n\nI now grant you a single weaving of the Maelstrom's Tendril. As your bond with Zandalar grows, I shall weave more power into the talisman."}
Q[8146]={p="即使从这里我也能听见你的齐射横扫我们敌人的声响。他们的惨叫在痛苦中回荡。\n\n你已经在赞达拉巨魔中闯出了名号，$n。我们感激你所做的一切。\n\n把你的护符给我，好让我再加上一层编织。",pEN="Even from here I can hear the sound of your volleys laying waste to our enemies. Their cries echo in agony.\n\nYou have made quite a name for yourself among the trolls of Zandalar, <name>. We are grateful for all that you have done.\n\nHand me your talisman so that I may add another weave.",c="我还能为你的护符再加上最后一层编织，$c。",cEN="There is only one more weave that I will be able to add to your talisman, <class>"}
Q[8147]={p="啊，$n，又能闻到你的味道真好。\n\n<法尔希尔咧嘴一笑。>\n\n你得原谅我的幽默感。它有时候实在恶臭得很。\n\n我感应到你给我们的敌人造成了巨大的痛苦。哈卡的力量正愤怒地喊出你的名字。这真是好极了。\n\n你在护符上又赢得了一层编织。把它交给我。",pEN="Ah, <name>, it is good to smell you again.\n\n<Falthir grins.>\n\nYou'll have to excuse my sense of humor. It can be most foul at times.\n\nI sense that you have caused great anguish to our enemies. The forces of Hakkar cry out your name in anger. This is most excellent.\n\nYou have earned another weave on your talisman. Hand it to me.",c="让他们在你的弹药耗尽之处寻求赎罪吧。",cEN="Let them seek atonement at the end of your munitions."}
Q[8148]={p="莫托尔替拉斯塔哈传话给你，$n。皇室对你全力剿灭哈卡军队的行为倍加赞赏。我会在坠饰中编入最后一根漩涡之藤的。把它给我吧。",pEN="Molthor delivers word from King Rastakhan, <name>. The royal court is most impressed with your decimation of the Hakkari forces. I am to award you with the final weave in your talisman. Hand it to me.",c="年轻的$c，旅途才刚刚开始。或许有一天你会去大漩涡看看世界的中心。\n\n愿力量和坚韧与你同在！",cEN="Your journey has only just begun, young <class>. Perhaps one day you will visit the Maelstrom and glance into the heart of the world.\n\nI wish you power and fortitude!"}
Q[8149]={d="在艾泽拉斯收获节上，我们对那些无私奉献英雄们表示感谢，他们中的一些甚至献出了自己的性命。联盟曾涌现出很多的英雄，但是没有谁的光芒能超越光明使者乌瑟尔。\n\n将这些祭品带到西瘟疫之地光明使者乌瑟尔的墓碑那儿，去表达我们的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然后回到我们这儿来。收获节结束之前我会一直在这儿，别浪费时间了，出发吧。",dEN="During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf. The Alliance acknowledges many heroes, but none weave a more tragic tale than that of Uther Lightbringer.\n\nHelp us honor Uther by taking this offering to his tomb in the Western Plaguelands. Place it at his statue, and then return to me. I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Uther his tribute.",o="前往西瘟疫之地的光明使者乌瑟尔的墓碑，在墓碑前放下他的祭品。在收获节结束之前返回铁炉堡的瓦格纳·巨锤那儿。",oEN="Travel to Uther's Tomb in Western Plaguelands and use Uther's Tribute at his statue, and then return to Wagner Hammerstrike outside Ironforge before the Harvest Festival is over.",p="你到达光明使者乌瑟尔的墓碑，放下他的祭品了吗？\n\n对经验并不丰富的冒险家来说，这是一次危险的旅程。沿着穿越希尔斯布莱德的河流向北进入瘟疫之地是一条相对安全的道路。河流从悔恨岭附近的湖泊发源，往西奔流进入群山，穿过寂静的坟墓……那儿到处都是天灾军团的爪牙。",pEN="Have you made the journey to Uther's Tomb and placed the tribute there?\n\nIt can be a dangerous trip for less experienced adventurers; a safer way of traveling there, relatively speaking, may be to travel north from the river that runs through Hillsbrad into the Plaguelands. It flows from a lake that is adjacent to Sorrow Hill; travel west up through the hills, steering clear of the adjacent tomb... one that is infested with the Scourge.",c="乌瑟尔是英雄中的英雄。我简直难以想象阿尔萨斯变节时他所承受的痛苦，阿尔萨斯是他最优秀的学生，他就像疼爱自己的儿子一样疼爱他。他尽了全力去阻止阿尔萨斯，他永远都是一个真正的圣骑士。乌瑟尔的战斗已经结束了，想想那些他曾经拯救过的人吧。\n\n谢谢你，$n。你向这位伟大的英雄献上了祭品，以此来纪念了他的精神和收获节的精神。",cEN="He was a hero among heroes, Uther was. I can't even begin to imagine the anguish of what he felt when Arthas - his greatest student and someone whom Uther loved like his own son - betrayed all of humanity. Still, he rose to try and stop Arthas, and for that he will be forever remembered as a true paladin. His fight was to the end, thinking only of those he might save.\n\nThank you, <name>. You've paid tribute to a great hero today, honoring his spirit and the spirit of the Harvest Festival."}
Q[8150]={d="在艾泽拉斯收获节上，我们对那些无私奉献英雄们表示感谢，他们中的一些甚至献出了自己的性命。部落曾涌现出许多英雄，但是没有谁的光芒能超越格罗姆·地狱咆哮。\n\n将这些祭品带到灰谷屠魔峡谷中的格罗姆·地狱咆哮的墓碑那儿，去表达我们的敬意吧。把祭品放在墓碑下，然后回到我们这儿来。收获节结束之前我会一直在这儿，别浪费时间了，出发吧。",dEN="During the Harvest Festival of Azeroth, we give thanks to heroes for the sacrifices - in some cases ultimate sacrifices - they have given on our behalf. The Horde acknowledges many heroes, but none exemplify strength and sacrifice more than Grom Hellscream.\n\nHelp us honor Grom by taking this offering to his monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale. Place it at the base, and then return to me. I'll only be here through the end of the festival, so waste no time in giving Grom his tribute.",o="前往灰谷屠魔峡谷的格罗姆·地狱咆哮的墓碑，在墓碑前放下他的祭品。在收获节结束之前返回奥格瑞玛的亚尼·纳沙克那儿。",oEN="Travel to Grom's Monument in the Demon Fall Canyon of Ashenvale and use Grom's Tribute at the base of the monument. Return to Javnir Nashak outside Orgrimmar before the Harvest Festival is over.",p="你造访了格罗姆·地狱咆哮的纪念碑，放下他的祭品了吗？\n\n纪念碑的所在地仍然受到燃烧军团的污染。当你接近纪念碑时，一定要多加小心，不要太过冒险了。",pEN="Have you made the journey to Grom's Monument and placed his tribute there?\n\nThe site where the monument is still touched by the taint of the Burning Legion. Should you be less experienced in the ways of adventuring, be on your toes when approaching the monument.",c="格罗姆的全名——格罗玛什——意为\"巨人之心\"；正是凭着这份心以及更多的东西，他才能独自面对玛诺洛斯。我想酋长说得最贴切：兽人的诅咒始于格罗姆，也终于格罗姆。格罗姆的牺牲——也许还有他的救赎——成为部落今日奔流不息的源泉，这是再合适不过的。\n\n谢谢你，$n。今天你向一位伟大的英雄献上了敬意，也向他的灵魂和收获节的灵魂致敬。",cEN="Grom's full name - Grommash - means \"The Giant's Heart\"; it took that and more to stand alone against Mannoroth. I think the Warchief said it best when the curse of the orcs began and ended with Grom. Fitting that Grom's sacrifice - and perhaps redemption - would be the wellspring from which the Horde flows today.\n\nThank you, <name>. You've paid tribute to a great hero today, honoring his spirit and the spirit of the Harvest Festival."}
Q[8151]={d="艾萨拉的奥汀克正在召集象你这样经验丰富的猎人。他是一名熊怪猎人，他离开了自己的部族，前来帮助塞纳里奥议会。奥汀克与他人分享自己的智慧，也告诉他们要如何维护平衡。你最好去跟他谈谈。\n\n奥汀克居住在艾萨拉埃达拉斯废墟东北部的悬崖顶部。",dEN="Ogtinc of Azshara has sent out a call for seasoned hunters such as yourself. He is a furbolg hunter who has left his tribe to aid the Cenarion Circle. His teachings are meant to enrich the wisdom of others who share his craft, and guide them toward maintaining a balance. You would do well to speak with him.\n\nOgtinc resides atop the cliffs of Azshara, northeast from the Ruins of Eldarath.",o="跟艾萨拉的奥汀克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ogtinc in Azshara.",c="我的使命不再是狩猎，而是教导$g这位:这位;$n。这就是命运交给我的事。\n\n和我一起制作一枚$n的护符吧——收集倒下猎物的战利品，它们会让你想起自己过去的试炼与胜利。到最后我会留下这枚护符，但会用别的东西来回报你。",cEN="It is no longer my purpose to hunt, but to teach the <class>. That is what fate has handed to me.\n\nCraft with me a <class>'s charm -- a collection of trophies from fallen prey that will remind you of your past trials and triumphs. In the end I will keep the charm, but reward you with something else."}
Q[8153]={d="艾萨拉的苔蹄快步者那强劲有力的鹿角是它们发动进攻时的有效武器，可以造成不小的伤害。完好的、自然的鹿角是这种动物的精神和信心的标志。\n\n如果你持有这样的鹿角，你也将拥有同样的自信。\n\n猎杀苔蹄快步者，把完好的鹿角交给我。",dEN="The courser wears the mightiest antlers in the known lands. Such antlers are used to defend the courser, goring an attacker and often damaging the points. Perfect, natural antlers are the sign of an animal spirit with supreme confidence.\n\nTo hold such antlers will bestow the same confidence in you.\n\nHunt the mosshoof courser, find the perfect antlers and bring them to me.",o="将一副完好的苔蹄快步者鹿角交给艾萨拉的奥汀克。奥汀克居住在埃达拉斯废墟东北部的悬崖顶。",oEN="Bring a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath.",p="你找到鹿角了吗？",pEN="Have you found the antlers?",c="只有拥有敏锐视力和无比耐心的人才能得到它们。做得好。",cEN="You must possess keen sight and great patience to have obtained these. Well done."}
Q[8157]={p="$n，阿拉索联军有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the League of Arathor has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by footman and field marshal alike."}
Q[8158]={p="$n，阿拉索联军有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the League of Arathor has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by footman and field marshal alike."}
Q[8159]={p="$n，阿拉索联军有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the League of Arathor has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by footman and field marshal alike."}
Q[8160]={d="阿拉索联军正在不惜一切代价进攻阿拉希，并妄图夺回这个区域。联盟的各个种族正在全力进军这块遥远的土地，想要将他们的势力从避难谷地扩张到这里。我们必须阻止他们，而最好的方式就是夺取他们的资源。\n\n你可以帮助我们，$n。进入阿拉希盆地，那里遍地都是丰富的矿藏、肥沃的土地和技艺精湛的能工巧匠。占据并控制你找到的所有基地，赢得战斗，然后把你获得的资源给我拿回来。",dEN="The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi. They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe. We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.\n\nYou can help us, <name>. Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman. Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.",o="进入阿拉希盆地，获得一箱阿拉希资源箱，然后将它交给落锤镇的亡灵哨兵莫提斯。",oEN="Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Deathstalker Mortis at Hammerfall."}
Q[8161]={d="阿拉索联军正在不惜一切代价进攻阿拉希，并妄图夺回这个区域。联盟的各个种族正在全力进军这块遥远的土地，想要将他们的势力从避难谷地扩张到这里。我们必须阻止他们，而最好的方式就是夺取他们的资源。\n\n你可以帮助我们，$n。进入阿拉希盆地，那里遍地都是丰富的矿藏、肥沃的土地和技艺精湛的能工巧匠。占据并控制你找到的所有基地，赢得战斗，然后把你获得的资源给我拿回来。",dEN="The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi. They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe. We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.\n\nYou can help us, <name>. Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman. Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.",o="进入阿拉希盆地，获得一箱阿拉希资源箱，然后将它交给落锤镇的亡灵哨兵莫提斯。",oEN="Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Deathstalker Mortis at Hammerfall."}
Q[8162]={d="阿拉索联军正在不惜一切代价进攻阿拉希，并妄图夺回这个区域。联盟的各个种族正在全力进军这块遥远的土地，想要将他们的势力从避难谷地扩张到这里。我们必须阻止他们，而最好的方式就是夺取他们的资源。\n\n你可以帮助我们，$n。进入阿拉希盆地，那里遍地都是丰富的矿藏、肥沃的土地和技艺精湛的能工巧匠。占据并控制你找到的所有基地，赢得战斗，然后把你获得的资源给我拿回来。",dEN="The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi. They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe. We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.\n\nYou can help us, <name>. Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman. Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.",o="进入阿拉希盆地，获得一箱阿拉希资源箱，然后将它交给落锤镇的亡灵哨兵莫提斯。",oEN="Win the battle for Arathi Basin, get an Arathi Resource Crate, and return it to Deathstalker Mortis at Hammerfall."}
Q[8163]={p="$n，污染者有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the Defilers has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by grunt and high warlord alike."}
Q[8164]={p="$n，污染者有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the Defilers has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by grunt and high warlord alike."}
Q[8165]={p="$n，污染者有一项长期任务交给你：再次进入阿拉希盆地，获取更多资源箱并带给我。",pEN="<name>, the Defilers has a standing mission for you to reenter Arathi Basin, procure more resource crates and bring them to me.",c="啊，你抢到了更多的资源木箱！没有资源补给的联盟肯定会一败涂地的！\n\n感谢你，$n。你的努力已经为我们所知，并且也为瓦里玛萨斯所知。",cEN="Very good. I will get these to our quartermasters immediately, and a commendation for your actions will be sent to my superiors.\n\nOnce again, thank you <name>. Your contributions to our struggles are noticed by grunt and high warlord alike."}
Q[8181]={d="通过对摩沙鲁石板的研究，我得出了一个可怕的消息，$n。你用一枚蛋收复了哈卡，然而血神哈卡的真身可以通过那枚蛋获得新生！叶基亚告诉你说那枚蛋是用来禁锢哈卡的邪恶力量的，但实际上，它的作用是让哈卡重生！那个巨魔将你引入了歧途！\n\n去找到叶基亚，摧毁那枚蛋。希望我们还有足够的时间阻止哈卡死灰复燃！",dEN="My delvings into the Mosh'aru Tablets bear grim news, <name>. Hakkar's true form, the god himself, can be born again through the very egg into which you captured him. Yeh'kinya told you it was to contain his evil, but it is to recreate it! The troll has led you astray!\n\nGo to Yeh'kinya and demand the egg from him. Pray that it is not too late to stop Hakkar's return!",o="跟叶基亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Yeh'kinya.",c="这么说，你已经跟那个老矮人詹斯·铁靴谈过话，知道丢失的摩沙鲁石板的秘密了？那个爱管闲事的勘察员……\n\n没关系。要挽救世界，现在已经太晚了。哈卡已经重获新生，他的力量还在继续增长中……他就在古老的巨魔王国祖尔格拉布！他来了！他将再次使世界笼罩在血腥和恐怖之中！\n\n谢谢你，$n。在你的帮助下，夺魂者又回来了！",cEN="So, you have been speaking with that old dwarf Ironboot and uncovered the lost Mosh'aru Tablets, have you? That meddling prospector...\n\nNo matter. It is too late to save this world. Hakkar has been reborn, and even now grows in power... deep in the ancient troll kingdom of Zul'Gurub! He has come! And he will rule in blood and terror!\n\nThank you, <name>. Your help has sped the return of the Soulflayer!"}
Q[8182]={d="$n，我们最担心的事情终于发生了。相传拥有无上力量的夺灵者哈卡正在统治着巨魔的古代帝国，那里充斥着邪恶和恐怖。如果我们不做点什么的话，他的统治范围很可能会蔓延到整个艾泽拉斯！\n\n也许赞达拉巨魔能帮助我们阻止悲剧的发生。他们驻扎在荆棘谷的祖昆达废墟以西，也就是那个名叫尤亚姆巴的小岛上。跟他们的首领莫托尔谈谈，但愿他知道如何打败哈卡。",dEN="<name>, our worst fears have come. Legend speaks of the Soulflayer ruling the ancient troll world through evil and terror, and his power was absolute. If he cannot be stopped now, then his new reign may spread across all of Azeroth!\n\nThere is a contingent of Zandalarian trolls who may help us stem this tide of darkness. They have camped on Yojamba Isle, off the coast of Stranglethorn, west of the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Speak with their leader, Molthor, and pray he knows how to defeat Hakkar.",o="跟荆棘谷的莫托尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Molthor in Stranglethorn.",c="你是$g勘探员铁靴:勘探员铁靴;派来的？他这类人很明智，而把你带到我面前就更明智了，因为我与赞达拉巨魔或许知道击败噬魂者的办法。\n\n去和这座岛上的巨魔谈谈，留心他们的话，并做好准备，$n，因为摆在你面前的是一项浸透鲜血的任务。",cEN="You were sent by the prospector, Ironboot? His kind are wise, and wiser still to bring you to me, for I and the Zandalarian trolls may know a way to defeat the Soulflayer.\n\nSpeak with the trolls of this isle, heed their words, and prepare yourself, <name>, for the task before you is soaked in blood."}
Q[8183]={d="哈卡之心熊熊燃烧着。虽然夺魂者已经被击败，但是他邪恶的力量依然在被诅咒的躯体之中涌动。",dEN="The Heart of Hakkar burns from within. Although the Soulflayer is defeated, the kernel of his power yet remains in this cursed organ.",o="把哈卡之心交给尤亚姆巴岛上的莫托尔。",oEN="Bring the Heart of Hakkar to Molthor on Yojamba Isle.",p="$n，一种邪灵的臭味环绕着你。你是否已经被夺魂者诅咒了？",pEN="<name>, the reek of an evil soul surrounds you. Have you been cursed by the Soulflayer?",c="啊，哈卡之心。这么说噬魂者已经被杀了！我们的世界得救了！\n\n$n，你对我们的贡献怎么夸赞都不为过。你真的是这个王国的$g英雄:英雄;！",cEN="Ah, the Heart of Hakkar. So the Soulflayer has been slain! Our world is saved!\n\n<name>, your service to us cannot be overstated. You truly are a hero of this realm!"}
Q[8184]={p="把这些东西带给我，我就为你制作一个强大的附魔！",pEN="Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",c="好好使用它，$n。别对哈卡莱心慈手软！",cEN="Use it well, <class>. Show the Hakkari no mercy!"}
Q[8185]={p="把这些东西带给我，我就为你制作一个强大的附魔！",pEN="Bring me these things and I will create a powerful enchantment for you!",c="好好使用它，$n。别对哈卡莱心慈手软！",cEN="Use it well, <class>. Show the Hakkari no mercy!"}
