Q[8388]={p="许多勇敢的士兵都非常尊敬你，$n。你一直是那些和联盟艰苦作战的勇士的榜样。你从旅途中带回了什么消息？",pEN="Arathi is still wet with the blood of great warriors and the clash of steel still rings throughout Alterac. Do not waste my time unless you bring news from the front!",c="你继续为部落带来荣耀，$n。我很高兴看到你还是一样的坚强。",cEN="You continue to honor the Horde, <name>. I'm glad to see you haven't turned soft.\nRelated"}
Q[8409]={d="腐烂的蛋已经被放进了桶里。以后南海镇旅馆出产的酒肯定都是次品了！\n\n你现在应该回提瑞斯法林地向黑暗召唤者雅恩卡报告你的成功。",dEN="The rotten eggs have been successfully placed inside the keg. Future batches of ale from the Southshore Inn are sure to be ruined!\n\nYou should now report back to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade and report your success.",o="向提瑞斯法林地的黑暗召唤者雅恩卡复命。",oEN="Return to Darkcaller Yanka at the Wickerman Festival in Tirisfal Glade.",c="啊，你成功了！我要说的是，你展现了万圣节的精神——被遗忘者的精神！\n\n<黑暗召唤者雅恩卡搓着手大笑着。>\n\n现在南海镇没有美味的麦芽酒喝了，我为此要庆祝一番！至于你，收下这些礼物，你会发现其中必定有有用的东西！",cEN="Ah, success! You've shown true Hallow's End spirit - FORSAKEN spirit, I should say!\n\n<Darkcaller Yanka laughs and rubs her hands together.>\n\nI revel in the fact that Southshore must now feast on bad ale or go without! As for you, take these treats. I believe you will find good use for them!"}
Q[8410]={d="风之守望者巴斯拉召唤了一位像你这样有智慧的萨满。他要求你带上一份每一种元素的样本，以表明你已经$g准备好:准备好;了。\n\n要找到巴斯拉，就去塔伦米尔以东的河边。沿着河向北走，直到你找到巴斯拉居住的废墟。",dEN="Bath'rah the Windwatcher has sent out a summons for a shaman of your wisdom. He requests you bring a sample of each of the elements to show you are ready.\n\nTo find Bath'rah, go to the river east of Tarren Mill. Follow the river north until you come across the ruins where Bath'rah resides.",o="为捕风者巴斯拉收集一份空气样本、一份火元素样本、一份土元素样本和一份水元素样本。",oEN="Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",p="你给我带什么来了，$n？",pEN="What you got for me, <class>?",c="太棒了。我们谈谈吧。",cEN="Excellent, mon. Now we be talkin'."}
Q[8412]={d="这地方的元素之灵已经不再喜欢我了。\n\n你比谁都懂图腾，我需要一个能保护我的灵魂图腾。我们已经有了元素，现在还需要点更偏向自然的东西。更原始的东西。\n\n在西瘟疫之地，你可以杀熊取爪，杀蜘蛛取眼。食腐鸟什么都吃，所以它们肚子里多半也有这两样东西。",dEN="The elemental spirits of this place don't be likin' me any more.\n\nYou know about the totems more than any, and I be needin' a spirit totem to protect me. We already got the elements, now we need somethin' more with more nature. More primal.\n\nIn the Western Plaguelands you can kill bears for claws and spiders for their eyes. The carrion birds eat everything, so they might have either one.",o="将灵魂图腾所需的材料交给捕风者巴斯拉。",oEN="Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",p="灵魂们很清楚我们在干嘛，他们想要杀了我！我希望你能取得材料。",pEN="The spirits know what we're up to, and they been tryin' to kill me! I hope you got the parts.",c="太棒了，老兄！我们试试吧……",cEN="Great, mon! Let's try it out..."}
Q[8413]={d="灵魂图腾还不够。我们还需要一些巫毒魔法来让它发挥效力。\n\n沉没的神庙中的巨魔身上有巫毒羽毛。去杀掉加什尔、米杉、祖罗、胡库、祖罗尔和洛若尔。这样我们就能拥有一个真正的、具有魔法力量的灵魂图腾了。",dEN="The spirit totem just isn't enough. We be needin' some voodoo magic to make it work jus' right.\n\nThe trolls in the sunken temple have feathers strong with voodoo magics. Go there and kill Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Then we have magic enough for a real spirit totem.",o="将巫毒羽毛交给捕风者巴斯拉。",oEN="Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.",p="羽毛在那？",pEN="Where's the feathers, mon?",c="该让这位巨魔好好睡上一整晚了！灵魂图腾会守护我的。\n\n我收集东西已经收集很久了，也许你想拿点什么作为你辛苦的报酬？",cEN="It's about time this <race> got a full night's rest! The spirit totem will watch over me.\n\nI been a long time collectin' things, maybe you want somethin' for all your trouble?"}
Q[8414]={d="你好，$c。在这片荒无人烟的土地上，像你这样的十字军是受到欢迎的。\n\n我们需要借助你神圣的力量来消灭这里无穷无尽的亡灵。更重要的是，我们想让你收集大量的天灾石，将它们交给高阶牧师赛尔丹尼斯。赛尔丹尼斯就在距离此地不远的悔恨岭守护乌瑟尔之墓。\n\n只有佩戴银色黎明委任徽章的人可以找到天灾石，如果你没有徽章的话，就去跟军官普尔哈特谈谈吧。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. Crusaders like you are a welcome sight in these desolate reaches.\n\nYour holy strength is needed to help fight the endless undead here. We need you to collect a large number of scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis. The high priest can be found guarding Uther's Tomb in Sorrow Hill, not far from here.\n\nOnly one with an Argent Dawn Commission can hope to find scourgestones, so speak to Officer Pureheart if you haven't already.",o="收集20个爪牙的天灾石，并将它们交给西瘟疫之地的高阶牧师赛尔丹尼斯。",oEN="Collect 20 Minion's Scourgestones and bring them to High Priest Thel'danis in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你带给我什么邪恶的东西？",pEN="What evil have you brought me?",c="驱散天灾石的邪恶力量是有风险的，就算在万里之遥，它也能跟不死族有所感应。但是你拥有如此强大的力量，$n，我并不你担心……",cEN="There is risk in dispelling the evil from a scourgestone, for it attracts the attention of undead for countless miles. But you are strong in the Light, <name>, and I do not fear for you..."}
Q[8415]={d="指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特需要你这样纯洁和勇敢的圣骑士，$n。你可以在西瘟疫之地南部的冰风岗找到他。以圣光的名义，去帮助他吧！",dEN="Commander Ashlam Valorfist has sent out a call for a paladin of your purity and valor, <name>. You can find him at Chillwind Camp in the southern part of the Western Plaguelands. Seek him and aid in his cause for the Light!",o="与冰风岗的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp.",c="很好，$n！让我们看看你是$g什么材料做的:什么材料做的;。",cEN="Very well, <class>! Let's see what you're made of."}
Q[8416]={d="天灾石上的邪恶力量已经被清除了，$n。\n\n我了解指挥官阿什拉姆的计划，他还需要一块惰性天灾石。把惰性天灾石带给他，或许我们就能以正义之火消灭亡灵天灾。",dEN="The evil has been purged from the stones, <name>.\n\nI am aware of Commander Ashlam's plans, and he will require only a single inert stone. Bring it to him so we may bathe the Scourge in righteous fire.",o="将惰性天灾石交给冰风岗的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。",oEN="Bring the Inert Scourgestone to Commander Ashlan Valorfist in Chillwind Point.",p="赛尔丹尼斯净化了天灾石吗？",pEN="Was Thal'danis able to cleanse the scourgestones?",c="你成功地完成了我交给你的任务，$n。\n\n你赢得了我的信任。或许现在我可以告诉你更多计划的详细信息了。",cEN="You have done as I asked without question, <name>.\n\nTrust is achieved, it seems. Perhaps I can reveal our plan in more detail to you now."}
Q[8417]={d="在诅咒之地中有个受到困扰的灵魂，他生前曾是部落的一位伟大的英雄。战士的荣耀绝不会随着肉体的毁灭而消逝，如果可能的话，我希望你能帮帮他。",dEN="In the Blasted Lands, there is a troubled spirit who was once a great hero of the horde. A warrior's honor does not die with the body, and it would serve you well to speak with him.",o="到诅咒之地的入口去，与部落英雄的灵魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the entrance to the Blasted Lands.",p="斯托利把我的酒咳出来了吗？",pEN="Did Stoley cough up my booze?",c="这么说，你是来解除我的痛苦的。希望这和打败我一样简单，但显然它不是……",cEN="So, you have come to alleviate my pain. I wish you could simply strike me down, but it is not that simple..."}
Q[8418]={d="现在我们必须把惰性天灾石组合起来，制造一件可以击溃亡灵的武器。这不是一件轻松的任务，$n。只有沉没的神庙中的那些巨魔身上携带着的魔法才拥有这种力量，正所谓以毒攻毒。。\n\n我需要沉没的神庙里那些巨魔的巫毒羽毛。加什尔、米杉、祖罗、胡库、祖罗尔和洛若尔会掉落巫毒羽毛。不要为他们感到难过……他们是极端邪恶的存在。",dEN="Now we must combine the inert scourgestones and create a weapon to shatter the ranks of undead. This is no trivial task, <name>. Only the trolls of the sunken temple carry the kind of rare magic able to turn the evil of something against itself.\n\nIn the temple, the trolls are known as Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Do not feel remorse for their corrupt souls... they are not without evil.",o="前往沉没的神庙，从巨魔守护者们身上取得巫毒羽毛，然后把它们交给阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。",oEN="Collect Amber, Blue, and Green Voodoo Feathers from the trolls of Sunken Temple.",p="你把那些邪恶的巨魔杀死了吗？",pEN="Have you slain the wretched trolls?",c="太好了，$n。我有些吃惊，不过我知道你不会让我失望的。\n\n我很荣幸地将这块神圣力量之石交给你，好好使用它吧。",cEN="This is excellent, <name>. I would say I am surprised, but I knew without question that you wouldn't let us down.\n\nIt is my honor to bestow one of the Holy Mightstones to you. Use it well."}
Q[8419]={d="$n，费伍德森林有个名叫伊普斯的小鬼让你去见他。这听上去有些奇怪，因为他让你带上一块恶魔布作为忠实的象征。既然你已经是个强大的术士了，那我想不用说你也知道费伍德的萨特身上有时会带着恶魔布吧？\n\n你可以在血毒瀑布以北找到伊普斯，我听说这个季节血毒瀑布非常漂亮。",dEN="<name>, an imp in Felwood by the name of Impsy has requested your presence. It is somewhat strange, as he has asked that you bring a piece of felcloth as a sign of good faith. Considering the power you already wield as a warlock, I can only assume you know the satyrs of Felwood carry this felcloth.\n\nYou can find Impsy just north of the Bloodvenom Falls, which I've heard is quite lovely this time of year.",o="将一块恶魔布交给费伍德森林的伊普斯。",oEN="Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",p="你带来恶魔布了吗？",pEN="Do you have my felcloth?",c="你真是$g位:位;了不起的$n！\n\n<伊普斯把恶魔布贴在脸上。>\n\n哦，我多爱这种感觉，它灼烧你的皮肤，把邪恶的念头织进你的脑海……",cEN="What a splendid <class> you are!\n\n<Impsy holds the felcloth to his face.>\n\nOh how I love the feel of it, the way it burns your skin and weaves evil thoughts through the mind..."}
Q[8420]={d="或许一个小鬼说这话有些奇怪，但是我希望拥有自己的宠物。尼比把我当作宠物，我却没有宠物，这不公平!\n\n事实上，我并不需要什么活的宠物。如果你能给我一块恶魔布的话，我就能制造一个宠物。这周围的萨特身上经常带着恶魔布，所以你可以去跟他们打打交道，你觉得如何?",dEN="Maybe this sounds strange coming from an imp, but I'd like a pet of my own. I really would. It's just not fair that Niby gets me and I get nothing!\n\nIn fact, it doesn't even need to be a living pet. I'd need something to start making it with, like some felcloth. The satyrs here in Felwood sometimes have felcloth, so you'd just have to kill enough of them until you find some. That doesn't sound so bad, does it?",o="将1块恶魔布交给费伍德森林的伊普斯。",oEN="Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.",p="你带恶魔布来了吗？",pEN="Do you have my felcloth?",c="哇！你太$g善良:善良;了。尤其对$g一位:一位;$n来说！\n\n<伊普斯把恶魔布贴在脸上。>\n\n哦，我多爱这种感觉，它灼烧你的皮肤，把邪恶的念头织进你的脑海……",cEN="Wow! You are too kind. Especially for a <class>!\n\n<Impsy holds the felcloth to his face.>\n\nOh how I love the feel of it, the way it burns your skin and weaves evil thoughts through the mind..."}
Q[8421]={d="既然我有了恶魔布，就可以真正开始制作*我的*宠物了。\n\n不过它还需要一些眼睛。也许你可以从铁木部族那里弄点腐烂的木头来，我好给它雕出漂亮的眼睛。他们在北边的铁木林里。\n\n我还需要一些血毒精华，好让它有股新恶魔的味道。被污染的软泥怪身上就带着这种精华，它们就在这附近，离尼比和我很近。",dEN="Now that I have my felcloth, I can really begin making *my* pet.\n\nIt's going to need some eyes though. Perhaps you could rip some rotting wood from the irontree folk for me, so I can carve out some lovely eyes. They're up north in the Irontree Woods.\n\nI'll also need some bloodvenom essence to give it that new demon smell. The tainted oozes carry the essence, and they hang out right here near Niby and me.",o="将10块腐烂的木头和4个血毒精华交给费伍德森林的伊普斯。",oEN="Bring 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence to Impsy in Felwood.",p="我要的东西你带来了吗？",pEN="Do you have the goods?",c="这真是个好东西。",cEN="This will work so very well."}
Q[8422]={d="我的宠物差不多要制作完成了。现在我需要一些填充物。\n\n我需要沉没的神庙里那些巨魔的巫毒羽毛。加什尔、米杉、祖罗、胡库、祖罗尔和洛若尔会掉落巫毒羽毛。干掉他们。全部。\n\n这项任务可不简单，$n，我会送你一些尼比的东西——反正他似乎也用不着。",dEN="My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with.\n\nOnly the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. Kill them. Kill them all.\n\nThis is no trivial task <name>, so I'll make it worth your while by giving you something of Niby's -- he probably doesn't need it anyhow.",o="到沉没的神庙去，从巨魔们身上获得6支巫毒羽毛。",oEN="Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple.",p="你把羽毛带来了吗？这个玩偶需要填充物！",pEN="Did you bring the feathers? This doll needs stuffed!",c="太好了，我的宠物制作完成了！\n\n<伊普斯很快将玩偶填充好，紧紧抱住它。>\n\n啊，这些巫毒羽毛拥有多么神奇的力量啊……",cEN="Wonderful, now my pet is complete!\n\n<Impsy quickly stuffs the doll and gives it a demonic hug.>\n\nOh, what an odd side effect these voodoo feathers have..."}
Q[8423]={d="<英雄上下打量着你。>\n\n你是$g一位:一位;$c，毫无疑问。我本想托付你一件光荣的任务，但首先我必须考验你的力量。\n\n据说雷克萨是靠一击斩杀一头地狱野猪来衡量自己刀刃的锋利。现在我要靠你如何杀死它们来衡量你的力量。",dEN="<The Hero looks you over.>\n\nYou are a <class>, no doubt. I would ask an honorable task of you, but I must test your strength.\n\nIt is said that Rexxar would measure the sharpness of his blades by killing a helboar with a single, swift strike. Now I will measure your strength by killing them.",o="杀死7头地狱野猪，然后回到部落英雄的灵魂那儿。",oEN="Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",p="地狱野猪灼热的尖刺会留下可怕的伤疤。别害怕痛苦和毁容，$g战士:战士;，与我被束缚的牢笼相比，这些根本不算什么。",pEN="The burning spines of the helboar leave horrific scars. Do not fear the pain and disfigurement, warrior, they are nothing compared to the prison to which I am bound.",c="我不需要证据就知道你做了什么，$n。我能看见刻在你表情上的决心。",cEN="I need no proof to know what you have done, <class>. I can see the determination etched in your expression."}
Q[8424]={d="我的存在本身就是个苦难，魔誓者更是为我带来了无穷无尽的痛苦，他们的黑暗仪式让我感到了比死亡还要可怕的苦楚。\n\n现在你可以帮我把痛苦带给他们。去吧，成为我的愤怒的象征。",dEN="The continued presence of the shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands bring great pain to me. Their dark rituals and spells cause agony unlike any I felt while alive.\n\nThrough you I can deliver my own message of pain. Go forth and deliver my wrath.",o="杀死诅咒之地的魔誓者，然后回到部落英雄的灵魂那儿。",oEN="Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",p="魔誓者并不容易被击败，对吧？但你是$g一位战士:一位战士;，你要么凯旋，要么在尝试中殒命。",pEN="The shadowsworn are not easily defeated, are they? But you are a warrior, and you will triumph or perish trying.",c="你已经减轻了我的痛苦，也给了我荣耀。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Already you have subdued my pain and honored me. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[8425]={d="你为我带来一丝平静。我得给你点什么作为回报。\n\n我的武器和护甲陪我度过了光辉的岁月，现在它们对我来说都没什么用处了。还是送给你吧。\n\n去沉没的神庙，杀死巨魔守卫加什尔、米杉、祖罗、胡库、祖罗尔和洛若尔。他们的巫毒羽毛能使我的肉身重现一段时间，足够给你奖励了。将巫毒羽毛带给我吧。",dEN="Your honor has brought some peace to me. It is only right that I offer you something in return.\n\nMy weapons and armor were splendid in life, and yet they are of no use to me now. They would be better served in your possession.\n\nTravel to the sunken temple and destroy the troll guardians Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro. They carry magic feathers that can reform my physical body long enough to grant you a reward.",o="将你从沉没的神庙的巨魔身上得到的巫毒羽毛交给部落英雄的灵魂。",oEN="Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.",p="你这么快就回来了？时间对我的意义不太一样，或许对你而言，这是一次相当长的旅途……",pEN="Are you back so soon? Time is not the same to me any more, perhaps it has indeed been a long journey for you...",c="我终于又能感受到冰冷的钢铁了，尽管只有一下下而已。",cEN="At last I can feel the cold touch of steel again, even if only for a moment."}
Q[8446]={d="这东西了渗出堕落的力量。\n\n它和来自翡翠梦境的龙类或许有些关系。你必须找到能解读这东西的人。或许月光林地或是塞纳里奥要塞的德鲁伊能帮助你。",dEN="Corruption seeps from this object.\n\nThere may be a link between this object and the dragons coming forth from the Dream. You must find someone that can decipher the meaning of this item. Perhaps the druids of the Moonglade or Cenarion Hold could assist you further.",o="寻找能解读梦魇包裹的物品中所隐藏的信息的人。\n\n或许拥有强大力量的德鲁伊可以帮助你。",oEN="Find someone capable of deciphering the meaning behind the Nightmare Engulfed Object.\n\nPerhaps a druid of great power could assist you.",p="怎么了，$r？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="我必须将污染从这东西上清除。这或许对翡翠梦境的研究工作有所帮助。把它给我。",cEN="I must remove the taint from this object. This may shed some light on my recent failures to delve into the Dream. Give it to me."}
Q[8447]={d="月神湖的湖水可以融解这东西里面的梦魇。给我点时间来净化它吧，$n。",dEN="The waters of Lake Elune'ara should dissolve the nightmares engulfing this object. Give me a moment to perform the cleansing, <name>.",o="等待月光林地的守护者雷姆洛斯净化梦魇包裹的物品。",oEN="Wait for Keeper Remulos at the Moonglade to cleanse the Nightmare Engulfed Object.",c="戴上他的戒指，$n。它为玛法里奥效劳的日子结束了。现在它该为你效劳了……",cEN="Take his ring, <name>. It has served its purpose for Malfurion. It shall now serve a new purpose for you..."}
Q[8460]={d="木喉是唯一逃脱了腐化的熊怪部族。然而，许多其他种族如今见到熊怪就盲目地杀害，根本懒得分辨他们是敌是友。正因如此，木喉熊怪极少信任外人。\n\n你有兴趣证明自己吗？把费伍德森林那些腐化的死木部族赶回去，也许有一天我们会把你视作$g我们的盟友:我们的盟友;。你会在我的西边找到第一个死木部族——战士、探路者和园丁。",dEN="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe. For this reason, the Timbermaw furbolg trust very few.\n\nAre you interested in proving yourself? Drive back the corrupted Deadwood tribe of Felwood and we may one day consider you an ally. You'll find the first Deadwood tribe - warriors, pathfinders and gardeners - to my west.",o="格拉兹要你去杀死6个死木战士、6个死木探路者以及6个死木园丁。",oEN="Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 6 Deadwood Warriors, 6 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 6 Deadwood Gardeners. Return to him in southern Felwood near the Emerald Sanctuary when you are done.",p="加油，$n。如果你想赢得我们的信任，你就需要向我们证明你的能力。",pEN="Keep at it, <name>. If you are to earn our trust, you will need to prove yourself to us.",c="我们在过去的事件中遭受了很多痛苦。谢谢你为帮助保护木喉部族所做的一切。",cEN="We suffer much from the events of the past. Thank you for what you have done to help protect the Timbermaw. As a sign of our growing friendship, please accept this humble offering."}
Q[8461]={d="此地西南方向有一处死木熊怪的营地。我不清楚他们想要干什么，但是我希望能在他们开始捣乱之前就结果他们。\n\n死木部族非常邪恶，是恶魔的力量侵蚀了他们的心智。他们的天性并不坏，但是现在一切都无法挽回了。因此，我对被迫与自己的同胞作战感到非常悲哀。\n\n$n，去结果他们吧，别对我说起战斗的具体过程，我不忍心听到那些。",dEN="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem.\n\nThe Deadwood tribe is evil, but it is the effects of the fel that pollutes their minds. Their hostility is not truly an innate quality, yet they cannot be helped. It saddens me that we must fight our own brethren.\n\nPlease, <name> - I ask you to do what must be done. Simply spare me the details; such troublesome images upset me far too much.",o="格拉兹要你去杀死6个死木守卫、6个死木复仇者和6个死木萨满祭司。",oEN="Nafien would like you to kill 6 Deadwood Den Watchers, 6 Deadwood Avengers, and 6 Deadwood Shamans. Return to him in northern Felwood near the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.",p="一旦你获得了木喉部族的信任，作为对你的忠诚的回报，也许我们可以帮你做点什么。",pEN="Once you gain the trust of the Timbermaw, I am confident there will be something we will be able to do for you. The Timbermaw do not forget their allies, especially in dark times such as these.",c="我感应到你取得了胜利。胜利……考虑要做的事，这词何其空洞。不管怎样，你已经证明自己配得上我们的信任。\n\n要塞里的木喉部族可能还需要一段时间才能不带敌意地接纳你。不过，你的坚持会逐渐消磨我的同胞对你的疑虑。只要你不背叛我们、不向我们举刀，我们就能和睦相处。",cEN="I sense that you have achieved victory. Victory... such a hollow word considering what had to be done. Regardless, you've proven yourself to be worthy of our trust.\n\nIt may take some time before the Timbermaw welcome you without hostility within the Hold. Still, your perseverance will erode any suspicion my brethren may have about you. So long as you never betray us and raise weapons against us, we will find common ground."}
Q[8462]={d="也许你可以帮助我们木喉部族应付我们正在遭受着的更大的威胁。你一定可以在这里展示自己的能力……\n\n在木喉要塞另一头站着一个我的同类，就沿着这条路去背面。他的名字叫纳菲恩；虽然他看上去是很凶猛和令人讨厌的野兽，但是你不要害怕。他只是在寻求帮助来对抗那些威胁我们家园的力量。",dEN="Perhaps you are capable of handling a larger threat that we Timbermaw face. You certainly have shown yourself capable here...\n\nAnother of my kind stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold, along this road far to the north. His name is Nafien; while he may appear to be a feral and unsavory beast, fear him not. He only seeks aid against the malign forces that threaten our home.",o="沿着费伍德森林的路向北走，与一个名叫纳菲恩的熊怪谈谈。他站在木喉要塞的入口处。",oEN="Travel north along the main road in Felwood and speak with the furbolg named Nafien. He stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.",c="啊……我从风中的话听到有非我部族的人想找木喉熊怪与他们结盟。我欢迎你，但你必须知道我的部族对陌生人是很冷淡的。\n\n这些是试炼时期，而我们只能信任选择与我们一起抵抗土地腐败的人……并向我们证明他们自己。不这么做的人就会在进入要塞时感受到明显的敌意。",cEN="Ah... I have heard the word on the wind about those not of our tribe who seek to ally themselves with the Timbermaw furbolgs. I welcome you, but you must be warned that my tribe reacts poorly to strangers.\n\nThese are trying times, and we can only trust those who choose to fight the corruption of the land alongside of us... and have proven themselves to us accordingly. Those who have not done so will be met with open hostility should they enter the Hold."}
Q[8463]={d="不久前，一伙失心者从我们的一处奥术圣所抢走了一批不稳定的法力水晶。如果不小心处理，这些水晶爆炸的威力足以在城墙上炸出一个大洞。\n\n$n，我倒不太在乎他们摆弄不稳定的奥术源时把自己炸上天，但整件事会让我的部下脸上无光。\n\n把你找到的所有被偷的水晶都带给我；它们可能还在原来的箱子里。",dEN="A group of Wretched recently raided a supply of unstable mana crystals from one of our arcane sanctums. If not handled properly, the crystals could explode with enough force to blow a hole into the city walls.\n\nNow, <name>, I don't quite care if they blow themselves up while tapping unstable arcane sources, but the whole incident would make my men look bad.\n\nBring me back any remaining stolen crystals you find; they might still be inside their original crates.",o="给鹰翼广场的艾尔杜·炙痕带回6块不稳定的法力水晶。",oEN="Bring back 6 Unstable Mana Crystals to Aeldon Sunbrand at Falconwing Square.",p="你拿回被劫走的物品了没？",pEN="Did you retrieve the stolen goods yet?",c="做得好，$n。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>."}
Q[8464]={d="木喉部族喜欢独处，$n。虽然我们允许信任的人安全通过隘口，但只要能避免，我们都会避开其他熊怪部族。\n\n最近一段时间，冬泉部族对我们越来越充满敌意。他们似乎陷入了狂怒状态，完全被自己的恐惧和对一切未知之物的憎恨吞噬。\n\n我必须请你削减他们的数量，以减轻对我们的威胁。去东边很远的冬泉村找他们。",dEN="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves, <name>. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible.\n\nThe Winterfall tribe as of late has become increasingly hostile towards us. They seem to be in a state of rage, completely engulfed by their own fear and hatred of anything they do not understand.\n\nI must ask you to thin their numbers as to lessen the threat against us. Seek them out in Winterfall Village, far to the east of here.",o="萨尔法要你杀死8名冬泉萨满祭司、8名冬泉巢穴守卫和8名冬泉巨熊怪。萨尔法就在冬泉谷木喉要塞入口外。|n",oEN="Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",p="我们很感激你为木喉部族所做的一切，$n。",pEN="We very much appreciate what you have done for the Timbermaw, <name>. Your continued efforts will surely earn my tribe's trust and respect.",c="感谢你所做的一切。请收下这枚感谢的硬币。\n\n请继续帮助我们，$n。我们的盟友很少，若你不再帮助我们，威胁我们部族的危险会增强到我们无法抵抗的地步。",cEN="Thank you for what you have done, as saddening as it is. Accept this as a token of thanks.\n\nI would ask of you to please continue helping us, <name>. We have very few allies on which to call upon, and without your aid, the threats against my tribe would surely be too much for us to handle alone."}
Q[8465]={d="除了来自南面的死木熊怪的堕落威胁之外，东面的冬泉熊怪同样也同样是我们的心头大患。如果你愿意继续帮助我们的话，就去和要塞另外一头的萨尔法谈谈吧。沿着左边的这条路一直走下去。\n\n你要小心，如果我里面的兄弟对你表示敌意，他们也许会攻击你。尽快通过那里，避免纠纷。你每杀死一个木喉熊怪——即便是出于自卫——都会极大地降低你在木喉熊怪中的声望。",dEN="The threat of corruption comes not only from the Deadwood furbolgs to the south, but also from the east and the Winterfall furbolgs of Winterspring. If you wish to further aid us, speak with Salfa on the other side of the Hold, by the Winterspring entrance. Follow the path to the left to reach it.\n\nBe warned - if my kind inside considers you hostile or hated, they will attack. Travel as quick as you can, avoiding conflict. To kill a Timbermaw - even in self defense - will only alienate you further.",o="穿过木喉要塞去冬泉谷。和萨尔法谈谈，他就在木喉要塞另一头的出口处。",oEN="Travel through Timbermaw Hold and exit into Winterspring. Speak with Salfa, who stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold.",c="你好，$c。我是木喉在冬泉谷这里的发言人也是部族的防卫者。\n\n我们在这寒冷土地的冬泉兄弟们都受到和费伍德森林的熊怪一样的腐败侵略。如果你是来为木喉熊怪提供支援的话，我们很乐意欢迎你。",cEN="Greetings, <class> - I stand guard here as both a speaker for the Timbermaw here in Winterspring and as a defender of the tribe.\n\nOur Winterfall brethren here in this frigid land have fallen under the same corruptive sway as the furbolg of Felwood. If you've come here offering the Timbermaw furbolgs aid, then we are ready to accept such an offer."}
Q[8466]={p="虽然你已向我证明自己的来意，你还需要继续努力向我部族怀疑的兄弟们证明你自己。只有这样我才能继续帮助你。\n\n有些死木熊怪戴着特殊的头饰，可以作为削减他们势力的证据。带给我你从任何头饰上取得的羽毛；你每给我一套5个，就会赢得木喉的信赖。",pEN="While you have proven yourself to me, you may need to continue to work toward proving yourself to the suspicious brethren of my tribe. To that end, I may be able to continue assisting you.\n\nSome of the Deadwood furbolgs wear a distinctive headdress that may be used as a means of proof in thinning their numbers. Bring me a feather from any headdresses you acquire; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",c="做得好，$n！我会让我的族人都知道你的行为。\n\n记得把你找到的羽毛带给我。只要还有需要，我会继续收下它们。",cEN="Well done, <name>! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.\n\nRemember to bring any of the feathers you find to me. I will continue to accept them as long as necessary."}
Q[8467]={p="虽然你已向我证明自己的来意，你还需要继续努力向我部族怀疑的兄弟们证明你自己。只有这样我才能继续帮助你。\n\n有些死木熊怪戴着特殊的头饰，可以作为削减他们势力的证据。带给我你从任何头饰上取得的羽毛；你每给我一套5个，就会赢得木喉的信赖。",pEN="While you have proven yourself to me, you may need to continue to work toward proving yourself to the suspicious brethren of my tribe. To that end, I may be able to continue assisting you.\n\nSome of the Deadwood furbolgs wear a distinctive headdress that may be used as a means of proof in thinning their numbers. Bring me a feather from any headdresses you acquire; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",c="做得好，$n！我会让我的族人都知道你的行为。\n\n记得把你找到的羽毛带给我。只要还有需要，我会继续收下它们。",cEN="Well done, <name>! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.\n\nRemember to bring any of the feathers you find to me. I will continue to accept them as long as necessary."}
Q[8468]={d="银月城政府在此发布公告，悬赏声名狼籍的失心者团伙头目，饥饿者泰里斯。他因涉嫌参与包括谋杀两名城市卫队士兵在内的多起危害广大银月城人民群众的恶性案件而被通缉。\n\n请向坎雷中士报告以领取赏金。",dEN="The city of Silvermoon hereby issues a reward for the head of Thaelis the Hungerer, notorious Wretched ringleader. He is wanted for repeated crimes against the general populace of Silvermoon City, including the murder of two city guards.\n\nReport to Sergeant Kan'ren to collect the reward.",o="将泰里斯的徽记交给永歌森林鹰翼广场的坎雷中士。",oEN="Bring Thaelis's Head to Sergeant Kan'ren at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods.",p="你有东西要给我瞧瞧吗？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="那个恶棍泰里斯终于走到生命的尽头了。做得好，$n。这下失心者总算能安静一会儿了。",cEN="That scoundrel, Thaelis, finally met his fate. Good job, <name>. Things should be quiet with the Wretched for a while."}
Q[8469]={p="你无疑地得到了我的信任，$n，但你仍要努力得到我整个部族的信任。拜托……让我继续帮助你。\n\n冬泉谷的人都会配戴灵魂珠子来避开邪恶的灵魂。但这些珠子显然失去了它们的意义，因为冬泉谷的人就是腐败的媒介。帮我从冬泉谷熊怪那里带来这些灵魂珠子；你每给我一套5个，就会赢得木喉的信赖。",pEN="You've certainly earned my trust, <name>, but you may need to continue to earn the trust of my untrusting tribe. There is something you can do to earn that trust.\n\nThe Winterfall are known to carry spirit beads to ward against foul spirits. These beads have clearly failed in their purpose, as the Winterfall themselves are the agents of corruption. Bring to me these spirit beads from fallen Winterfall furbolgs; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.",c="你再一次的向我们证明了你的信誉！我会让我的族人都知道你的行为。\n\n记得把你找到的冬泉谷珠子带来给我。只要你把一套珠子给我，我就会继续为你向部族说些好话。",cEN="Once again, you prove your honor to us! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.\n\nRemember to bring any of the Winterfall's beads you find to me. For each set you continue to bring to me, I will speak on your behalf to the tribe."}
Q[8470]={d="你找到了死木熊怪的一根仪祭图腾。图腾本身难以描述，却散发着一股触手可及的绝望。如果有什么东西能体现死木熊怪所遭受的腐化，那就是它了。\n\n木喉要塞里的某个熊怪也许用得上这东西……前提是你已经赢得了他们的信任，能和他们说得上话。|n",dEN="You have found one of the Deadwood furbolg's ritual totems. The totem itself is of non-descript construction, but a palpable sense of despair emanates from it. If there were any object that might best exemplify the corruption that the Deadwood furbolg suffer under, this item would clearly be it.\n\nOne of the furbolgs inside Timbermaw Hold may have a use for such an item... that is, if you've earned their trust enough for them to speak with you.",o="把死木仪祭图腾拿到木喉要塞去，看看是否有熊怪想要研究一下它。只有当你在木喉要塞的声望达到中立或者更高级别的时候，木喉要塞的熊怪才会和你说话。",oEN="Take the Deadwood Ritual Totem inside Timbermaw Hold and see if one of the furbolgs there will find a use for the item. The Timbermaw will not speak with you unless you are of Neutral reputation or greater with them.",p="$c，我可以帮你什么忙吗？你平静地走在我们之中，虽然一定有什么事情出错了。我感觉到什么东西……麻烦的东西……",pEN="Yes <class>, what can I assist you with? You walk among us peacefully, though there is assuredly something amiss. I sense something... something troubling...",c="这个图腾……我知道它是死木部族的东西，但是它发出浓烈的腐败恶臭。让我们的手足与我们反目成仇的邪恶东西一定就在这个物体里。\n\n你把这个拿来给我们是很明智的行为，$n。或许通过研究和仪式，我们可以了解是什么污染了我们手足的心智。谢谢你，朋友……",cEN="This totem... I recognize it as one of the Deadwood's, but it is thick with the stench of decay. Whatever foulness has turned our brethren against us is surely present in this object.\n\nYou were wise to bring this to us, <name>. Perhaps through study and ritual, we can uncover what it is that pollutes the minds of our brethren. Thank you, friend please accept these offerings in exchange for your find."}
Q[8471]={d="你找到了一根冬泉仪祭图腾。图腾本身没有什么雕刻的痕迹，但是它却散发出一种让人绝望的气息。如果有什么东西导致了冬泉熊怪的堕落的话，那么这件东西应该就是罪魁祸首了。\n\n木喉要塞中的某个熊怪一定对它有兴趣……当然，你首先需要在他们当中赢得一定的声望。",dEN="You have found one of the Winterfall furbolg's ritual totems. The totem itself is of non-descript construction, but it seems to emanate an almost tangible sense of dread and despair. If many of the Winterfall furbolgs do indeed carry these, it certainly would go a long way in explaining their current condition.\n\nOne of the furbolgs inside Timbermaw Hold may have a use for such an item... that is, if you've earned their trust enough for them to speak with you.",o="把冬泉仪祭图腾拿到木喉要塞去，看看是否有熊怪想要研究一下它。只有当你在木喉要塞的声望达到中立或者更高级别的时候，木喉要塞的熊怪才会和你说话。",oEN="Take the Winterfall Ritual Totem inside Timbermaw Hold and see if one of the furbolgs there will find a use for the item. The Timbermaw will not speak with you unless you are of Neutral reputation or greater with them.",p="$c，你以和平的方式来到我们面前，但我感觉你是为着对熊怪和$g$r:$r;都同样严重而重大的事情而来。你想告诉我们什么？",pEN="<class> - you approach us in a peaceful manner, but I sense that you are here on matters that are grave and severe... for both furbolg and <race> alike. What have you come to tell us?",c="这东西……形状像根冬泉仪祭图腾，却已被我根本无法理解的力量扭曲。无论是何种邪恶与腐化让冬泉部族与我们为敌，它都存在于这件物品之中，毫无疑问。\n\n神圣的智慧把你和这件东西一起带到了我们面前，$n。我们会仔细研究它，也许有一天冬泉部族不再对我们发泄怒火。\n\n谢谢你，$g朋友:朋友;，请收下这些礼物，作为你善行的回报。",cEN="This thing... it is in the shape of a Winterfall Ritual Totem, but it has been twisted by forces I cannot begin to comprehend. Whatever taint that has set the Winterfall against us is surely present in this object.\n\nDivine wisdom has brought both this and you to us, <name>. We will study this object intently; perhaps one day, the Winterfall will rage against us no longer.\n\nThank you, friend - please accept these offerings in exchange for your benevolence."}
Q[8472]={d="在旧城区的废墟里，有一些原本负责保卫城市的奥术傀儡最近因为年久失修而失去了控制。它们已经无法辨认出自己的主人，只要见到我们就会立即对我们发起攻击！\n\n尽管它们是很多年前制造出来的，但它们体内用于驱动机关运行的奥术核心仍然对我们很有价值。我希望你能为我回收这些奥术核心，我想它们还可以在某些地方派上用场。这些傀儡在西北方的银月城废墟中到处都是，很容易找到。",dEN="The arcane patrollers crafted by our forefathers to protect the city have fallen into a dangerous state of disrepair. They fail to recognize us as their masters and will attack us on sight!\n\nEven though they were created many years ago, the arcane cores that power them are still quite useful and valuable to us. I want you to gather these cores and bring them to me so I can put them to good use again. You will find the patrollers in the ruined section of Silvermoon, to the northwest.",o="从游荡在银月城遗迹中的奥术巡逻者身上获取6枚奥术核心，把它们交给永歌森林鹰翼广场的魔导师亚隆尼斯。",oEN="Collect 6 Arcane Cores from the Arcane Patrollers that roam the ruins of Silvermoon City and bring them to Magister Jaronis at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods.",p="你有顺利收集完奥术核心吗，$n？",pEN="Have you succeeded in gathering the arcane cores yet, <name>?",c="你做的很好，$n。我们尽全力去运作奥术圣殿，这些能量核心将能在接下来一段时间内满足我们的需求。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. With our arcane sanctums not operating at full capacity, these power cores will go a long way in supplementing our needs."}
Q[8473]={d="这些日子对我们来说，真是一段艰难的时刻，$n。为了防止天灾军团的扩张，我们必须烧毁永歌森林与幽魂之地边境处的森林，这无疑是个艰难的抉择。\n\n而最近，那些过去几年中还曾是我们朋友的树人，正在尝试着重新培育焦痕谷周围的树木。\n\n这是个令人痛苦的抉择，$c，但我们已经无法说服这些曾经的盟友放弃他们的做法了。我要求你立刻阻止他们，而你唯一可用的手段，就是武力。",dEN="These are difficult times for us, <name>. It was a very hard decision to burn the woods bordering the Ghostlands to prevent the Scourge's expansion.\n\nThe treants, who have been our friends for years, are now trying to foster the regrowth of the forest along the Scorched Grove.\n\nThis is a painful thing to ask of you, <class>, but we've failed to convince our former allies to cease their endeavors. I need you to stop them by the only means that remain to us: force.",o="在焦痕谷一带杀死10名枯萎的护卫者，然后向永歌森林焦痕谷西北方的高塔内的拉莉亚娜·河风复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Withered Green Keepers at the Scorched Grove. Then report back to Larianna Riverwind inside the tower just to the northwest of the Scorched Grove in Eversong Woods.",p="我不太敢问，$n……任务完成了吗？",pEN="I dread to ask, <name>... is the task done?",c="所以，都结束了。诅咒这时代使我们逼近绝望的手段……并诅咒我们的敌人，天灾军团！\n\n你要知道，$n。我们一定要保护国土，不论花多少代价。我们要战胜一切！",cEN="So, it is done. Curse these times that have driven us to desperate measures... and curse our enemy, the Scourge!\n\nLearn this, <name>. Our lands must be protected, no matter what the cost. We shall prevail!"}
Q[8474]={d="这枚吊坠上刻着缩写L.R.。也许是制作它的工匠姓名的缩写。",dEN="The pendant has the initials L.R. etched on to it. Perhaps these letters will lead to the pendant's maker.",o="寻找制造怀特巴克的坠饰的人。他们或许会提供一些关于这件物品的线索。",oEN="Find the person who might have made Old Whitebark's Pendant. They might provide some insight on the item.",p="你有东西要给我瞧瞧吗？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="这个……这个坠饰。之前因为老白树帮我们重建村庄，所以把这个送给他当礼物。\n\n我想你会将它还给我，想必他是……\n\n<血精灵清了清她的喉咙镇定自己。>\n\n谢谢你带回来，$n。我想一个人静一静。",cEN="This... this pendant. I gave it to Old Whitebark after his people helped us rebuild our village.\n\nI guess this means he's...\n\n<The blood elf clears her throat as she regains her composure.>\n\nI appreciate you bringing this to me, <name>. There is something I'd like to ask of you."}
Q[8475]={d="满目葱绿的永歌森林中，那道丑陋的黑色伤痕无时无刻不在提醒着我们：要铭记阿尔萨斯入侵我们心爱的城市的那段屈辱的日子。\n\n这些污瑕不仅仅是我们的眼中钉，最近这几天也总是吸引着幽魂之地的天灾军团向银月城这边移动。\n\n去吧，$n，帮助我的手下把那些在死亡之痕游荡的亡灵全部消灭掉，这样我或许会感觉好过些。",dEN="The black swath of soil that cuts through Eversong Woods is a permanent reminder of the day Arthas led the Scourge into our beloved city.\n\nThis blemish is more than an eyesore as even today it brings Scourge from the Ghostlands to Silvermoon.\n\nGo, <name>, and give my men a hand in killing the mindless undead that walk down the Dead Scar.",o="杀死8个瘟疫骨骸，然后向永歌森林死亡之痕的游侠杰拉复命。",oEN="Slay 8 Plaguebone Pillagers and report back to Ranger Jaela on the Dead Scar in Eversong Woods.",p="你回来了，$n。你击退了死亡之痕的不死族吗？",pEN="You're back, <name>. Did you fight off the undead along the Dead Scar yet?",c="我们不期望能对天灾军团先发制人，但我们仍感谢任何保卫断崖的援助。",cEN="We don't anticipate the Scourge letting up on their attacks any time soon, but we still appreciate any help we get guarding the Scar."}
Q[8476]={d="我们的王国所占有的领土并不像人类与兽人的那样广袤。我们在艾泽拉斯大陆上仅剩的土地基本上都已经在你眼前了，$n。\n\n在我们能够抵达外域，并在那里找到新的家园之前，我们必须不惜一切代价守护住这片小小的土地。\n\n东南方那些未开化的阿曼尼巨魔正对我们的土地虎视眈眈，我们已经彻底无法再容忍他们的骚扰了！到他们的居住地塞布瓦萨和托尔瓦萨去，给他们点颜色看看。",dEN="Ours are not the vast kingdoms of the humans and orcs. All we have left of our lands in Azeroth lies mostly before your eyes, <name>.\n\nUntil we can reach Outland, we must defend what little land we have at any cost.\n\nOur uncivilized neighbors to the southeast, the Amani trolls, certainly have a different opinion regarding the ownership of these lands. Their daily raids are something we can't tolerate anymore. Go to their settlements, Zeb'Watha and Tor'Watha, and teach them a lesson.",o="永歌森林远行者居所的达恩·晨行者中尉要求你杀死5名阿曼尼狂战士和5名阿曼尼掷斧者。",oEN="Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods wants you to kill 5 Amani Berserkers and 5 Amani Axe Throwers.",p="你在东南方可以找到拉伯瓦萨，杀掉巨魔再回来。",pEN="You'll find Tor'Watha and Zeb'Watha southeast of here. Come back when you've killed the trolls.",c="做得好，$n。有越多像你这样的人我们就能越快让我们的土地重返荣耀。",cEN="Good work, <name>. With more people like you we'll soon restore our lands to their former glory."}
Q[8477]={d="阿曼尼巨魔和辛多雷在历史上素来敌对，早有许多大规模的战争。但这并不妨碍我对他们的一些工艺作品的欣赏之情，$n。\n\n我曾使用过几件阿曼尼武器，它们在金属工艺上的造诣给我留下了深刻的印象。据说制矛师奥特姆比有一把魔法锻造锤，非常轻盈，平衡性也非常好，这使得他在工作时可以充分发挥自己的灵巧与技艺。\n\n如果你能把这件工具带回来给我的话，我可以用它为你打造一件武器。",dEN="The Amani and the sin'dorei have a long history of mutual dislike and open hostility. That doesn't prevent me from appreciating a fellow craftsman's work, <name>.\n\nI've come across pieces of Amani weaponry and I must admit I'm impressed by the quality of their work. It is rumored that Spearcrafter Otembe wields a magical hammer that is so light and well-balanced it allows him to work with great dexterity and efficiency.\n\nIf you bring me this tool I'll use it to craft you a weapon.",o="到远行者居所东南方的托尔瓦萨去，找到制矛师奥特姆比，将奥特姆比之锤带回远行者居所去交给阿拉瑟尔。",oEN="Search Tor'Watha to the southeast of the Farstrider Retreat for Spearcrafter Otembe and bring Otembe's Hammer to Arathel Sunforge at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods.",p="你有带回欧坦毕之锤给我吗，$n？",pEN="You've brought me Otembe's hammer?",c="有些谣言是真的，$n。这铁锤同时具有轻巧却强大的力量而我还有几个工作没完成。当然，我会让你第一个挑武器。",cEN="There's truth to the rumors! This hammer is light and strong at once; I shall manage to complete several of my unfinished projects. And of course, I'll let you have first pick."}
Q[8479]={d="靠近点，别害怕，文贾希不会伤害你的。\n\n我们暗矛和你们一样，都是阿曼尼的死敌。他们的头目祖尔玛罗什是个邪恶的巨魔。他给我下了这种毒药，把我关在这个笼子里等死。\n\n我不怕死；我当面嘲笑过死神。\n\n但在祖尔玛罗什死掉之前，我无法安息。你会在湖对岸的祖布瓦萨找到他。等你把他的大脑袋带来，我就喝下这毒药；那时我才能平静地死去。",dEN="Come closer, mon. Don't be 'fraid, Ven'jashi not gonna hurt you.\n\nUs Darkspears be mortal enemies of the Amani just like you. Their boss Zul'Marosh is evil troll. He give me the bad poison and leave me in this cage to die.\n\nI not scared of dyin', mon. I seen death in the eye an' I laugh at her.\n\nI cannot die in peace yet, mon. Not 'til Zul'Marosh be dead too. You find him 'cross the lake in Zeb'Watha. I hold this poison off 'til you bring me his big ugly head, mon. Only then I die peacefully.",o="被囚禁在托尔瓦萨的巨魔俘虏文亚什要求你把祖玛洛什酋长的徽记交给他。祖玛洛什酋长居住在艾伦达尔湖对岸的塞布瓦萨。",oEN="Ven'jashi, the troll prisoner at Tor'Watha, wants you to bring him Chieftain Zul'Marosh's Head. Chieftain Zul'Marosh can be found in Zeb'Watha, across Lake Elrendar.",p="你带回祖玛罗什头颅了没？",pEN="You bring me Zul'Marosh's head?",c="对了，兄弟。祖玛罗什来过。他烧毁了凡加许的村子，而我在他们抓我进牢笼前也杀了很多阿曼尼人。我在沙子里藏了一个东西，是我要给你的礼物。\n\n啊……啊，毒性……已扩散全身了。该安息了……",cEN="Ya, <dad/mon>. Zul'Marosh had this comin'. He burn down Ven'jashi's village. I kill many Amani before they put me in this cage. I hide something in the sand, my gift for you now.\n\nAh... ah, the poison... it spread now, mon. Time to rest..."}
Q[8480]={d="看起来，失心者的数量每日都在增长，$n。他们甚至已经相互联合起来，在统一的指挥下对阳帆港发起了一次攻击。\n\n更令我们游侠部队感到窘迫的是，我们的大部分武器都在他们攻占港口时遗落在了那里。把我们的武器带回来，这样我们就可以让那些该死的无赖知道谁才是老大了！",dEN="The Wretched grow bolder every day, <name>. They've achieved enough coordination to launch an attack on Sunsail Anchorage.\n\nAs if that weren't embarrassing enough, most of our weapons were left behind when they attacked. Bring me back our armaments so that we may show those ruffians who's boss.",o="将8个辛多雷军备物品交给永歌森林的维雷迪斯·雪晨。",oEN="Bring 8 Sin'dorei Armaments to Velendris Whitemorn in Eversong Woods.",p="你收集好丢失的武器了吗？",pEN="Did you gather the lost weapons yet?",c="做的太棒了，$n。让失心者看看我们的厉害！",cEN="Great job, <name>. Let's show the Wretched what we're made of!"}
Q[8481]={d="$n，感谢你的帮助，我们已经找到了致使冬泉部族堕落的根源——有一个堕落的恶魔正在控制着他们！\n\n把这支火炬拿到冬泉酋长所在的山洞去，然后放在那里。这样就可以让那个恶魔现身。此时你和你的盟友就要把它击倒！只有使用恶魔身上的精华才能帮助我们进行治愈冬泉部族的工作……最终解除他们对木喉要塞的威胁。",dEN="<name>, thanks to you we have devised a way to summon forth the root of all evil for the Winterfall tribe - the corrupting demon that dominates them!\n\nTake this torch to the mouth of High Chief Winterfall's personal cave and plant it there. Doing so will force the demon to reveal itself and investigate. This is when you and your allies must strike it down! Only the essence of the fallen demon will begin the lengthy healing process of the Winterfall tribe... and the salvation of Timbermaw Hold.",o="把恶魔召唤火炬放在寒水村的冬泉酋长的洞穴入口处。击败召唤出来的恶魔，然后把沙迪维尔斯精华交给木喉要塞的独眼高恩。",oEN="Plant the Demon Summoning Torch in the mouth of High Chief Winterfall's cave in the Winterfall furbolg village. Defeat the demon and retrieve the Essence of Xandivious for Gorn One Eye in Timbermaw Hold.",p="你回到我们这里了，$n……这代表恶魔已经被杀死了吗？",pEN="You have returned to us, <name>... does this mean that the demon has been slain?",c="你……你救了我们！你击败了恶魔赞迪维斯，确保了木喉要塞今后数年的安全。你是我们族类中$g真正的英雄:真正的英雄;。\n\n请带着我们的祝福收下这个。虽然熊怪的治愈过程会很缓慢——冲突也仍将持续——但你给了冬泉部族在此之前从未有过的东西。\n\n他们有了活下去的机会。",cEN="You've... you've saved us! Your defeat of the demon Xandivious has ensured the safety of Timbermaw Hold for years to come. You are truly a hero amongst our kind.\n\nPlease, accept this with our blessing. Though the healing process will be slow amongst the furbolgs - and the conflict will still go on - you have given the Winterfall something they never had before this day.\n\nThey have a chance at survival."}
Q[8482]={d="这份文件中包含着永歌森林中数座极富战略意义的建筑物的详细地图，更有一份关于奥术圣殿的详细建筑结构图表。图的下方还有数行用某种你不认识的语言写成的注释，看起来十分缜密。\n\n既然这份文件是你从一个达纳苏斯方面的间谍那里找到的，或许把它交给卫兵队长艾尔杜·炙痕是最正确的选择。",dEN="The documents contain detailed maps of different strategic buildings in Eversong Woods. A diagram of an arcane sanctum is also sketched in good detail. There seem to be numerous notes in a language you don't recognize.\n\nAs these were carried by a Darnassian spy, it might be a good idea to bring them to the Captain of the Guard - Aeldon Sunbrand.",o="将秘密文件交给永歌森林鹰翼广场的艾尔杜·炙痕。",oEN="Bring the Incriminating Documents to Aeldon Sunbrand at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods.",p="你有带东西给我吗？让我瞧瞧。",pEN="You've got something for me? Let me take a look.",c="你确定你在暗夜精灵身上发现这些吗？他们以矮人文字清楚的记载着……\n\n就我所了解这封信的内容，无论写信的人是谁，都不是他行为不当，他只是个被派来这里观察结果的间谍。他们说我们的行为鲁莽又危险……但会是谁？\n\n没错！就是那个铁炉堡的使者！我们实在是太愚蠢了，竟然会完全相信联盟的人！",cEN="Are you sure you found these on a night elf? They're clearly written in Dwarven...\n\nFrom what I can understand of this letter, whoever wrote this did not cause the malfunction, but rather was sent here as a spy to observe the results of it. They call our endeavors reckless and dangerous... but who?\n\nOf course! That envoy from Ironforge! We were fools to trust anyone belonging to the Alliance!"}
Q[8483]={d="听着，$n。当前的事态很敏感，就算我们已经知道他的间谍身份，但我们仍然不能公开地处死他。我们也不能尝试逮捕他，如果被他逃走，那么风险就太大了。\n\n我希望你立刻转至北部圣殿，找到勘测员安威瓦尔德，并秘密刺杀他。做这件事的时候要注意保密，我们也不想让“城市内有个间谍”这样的消息流传出去。\n\n带回他的徽记作为证明。铁炉堡应该学会不要和辛多雷作对！",dEN="Listen, <name>. This is a very delicate situation; even though we've identified the spy, we cannot kill him out in the open. We cannot try to capture him either as the risk of him escaping is too great.\n\nI want you to go find Prospector Anvilward at the North Sanctum and kill him. Do this in a quiet manner, we don't want word to spread that we allowed a spy into our city.\n\nBring me his head as proof. Ironforge will learn not to meddle with the sin'dorei.",o="将安威瓦尔德的徽记交给永歌森林鹰翼广场的艾尔杜·炙痕。",oEN="Bring Prospector Anvilward's Head to Aeldon Sunbrand at Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods.",p="你有处理好间谍吗？",pEN="Did you take care of the intruder?",c="好，任务已完成。你真是优秀。\n\n话已传到游侠将军耳边，相信我，矮人要为他们的背叛付出极高的代价。\n\n你已为你的人民立下很大的功劳和贡献，$n。",cEN="So, the deed is done. Excellent job.\n\nWord has been passed to the ranger general and believe me, the dwarves will pay dearly for their treason.\n\nYou've been of great service to your people today, <name>."}
Q[8484]={d="你的功绩已远超$g一位:一位;普通英雄的传说，$n。如果你族人的代表都是你这样的人，那我们一定会努力与他们和解。\n\n请把这件供品带给住在铁山之中的矮人国王，我想你们称那座城市为铁炉堡。过去他曾代表他的联盟试图与我们接触。而现在，我们认可你才是代表你的联盟洽谈和平的关键人物。",dEN="Your deeds go beyond the tale of a simple hero, <name>. If you are a representative of your people, then your people are ones we would work to make peace with.\n\nPlease - take this offering to the dwarven king that resides in a mountain of iron; I believe you call this city Ironforge. In times past, he had tried to make contact with us on behalf of his Alliance. It is now only fitting to acknowledge you as the key in your Alliance's efforts in brokering peace.",o="将木喉和平契约交给铁炉堡的国王麦格尼·铜须。",oEN="Bring the Timbermaw Offering of Peace to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",p="$n，你在我的领地$g受到欢迎:受到欢迎;。铁炉堡永远该是像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;的家。那么，你找我有什么事？",pEN="<class>, you are welcomed in my domain. Ironforge should always be considered a home to a hero such as yourself. Now, what business do you have with me?",c="这的确是最幸运的事了。如果这些生物能维持永远的和平，对我们在卡利姆多的事务很有助益……这项事务是暗夜精灵们无法自行解决的。我会立即通知其它联盟的领导者，并会发送进一步的公文！\n\n至于你，$n……你在外交手腕和行为上都表现了你的勇气。谢谢你，整个联盟也感谢你。",cEN="Indeed, this is a most fortuitous turn of events. Were a lasting peace to be made with these creatures, this would certainly give us an advantage in the affairs of Kalimdor... one that the Night Elves cannot support on their own. I will notify the other leaders of the Alliance of this immediately, and further diplomats will be dispatched!\n\nAs for you, <name>... you have shown courage in both diplomacy and in action. I thank you, as does the whole of the Alliance."}
Q[8485]={d="你的功绩已远超$g一位:一位;普通英雄的传说，$n。如果你族人的代表都是你这样的人，那我们一定会努力与他们和解。\n\n请把这件供品带给住在杜隆塔尔土地上的兽人酋长，我想你们称那座城市为奥格瑞玛。过去他曾代表他的部落试图与我们接触。而现在，我们认可你才是代表你的部落洽谈和平的关键人物。",dEN="Your deeds go beyond the tale of a simple hero, <name>. If you are a representative of your people, then your people are ones we would work to make peace with.\n\nPlease - take this offering to the orcish warchief that resides in the lands of Durotar; I believe you call this city Orgrimmar. In times past, he had tried to make contact with us on behalf of his Horde. It is now only fitting to acknowledge you as the key in your Horde's efforts in brokering peace.",o="带回木喉和平契约给奥格玛的索尔。",oEN="Bring the Timbermaw Offering of Peace to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="酋长的问候已授予你，$n。在这艰难的时刻，你的行动让部落愈发强大。那么，你找我有什么事？",pEN="The warchief's greetings are bestowed upon you, <class>. Your deeds make the Horde grow stronger in these troubling times. Now, what business do you have with me?",c="这的确是个偶然又幸运的转机。愿和平永随这些生物，这一定会让我们在保卫卡利姆多上占优势，以免于外在威胁。我会立刻通知部落其他首领，并派遣外交使节！\n\n至于你，$n……你已在外交及行动上展现了勇气。我和全部落都感谢你。",cEN="Indeed, this is a most fortuitous turn of events. Were a lasting peace to be made with these creatures, this would certainly give us an advantage in securing Kalimdor from external threats. I will notify the other leaders of the Horde of this immediately, and further diplomats will be dispatched!\n\nAs for you, <name>... you have shown courage in both diplomacy and in action. I thank you, as does the entirety of the Horde."}
Q[8486]={d="真是时候啊！居然凯丹尼斯在这个关口派了人过来。\n\n我早就警告过他们西部圣殿负荷加剧的危险性了！现在，我们为数不多的几个能量转换装置里又有一个彻底毁坏了，而且法力怨灵也跑了出来，满地都是！\n\n在我们派人修理这里之前，我需要你帮我处理这些该死的生物。快点！",dEN="It's about time that dimwit, Caidanis, sent someone this way.\n\nI warned of the dangers of increasing the load on the West Sanctum! Now one of our energy converters is destroyed and arcane wraiths are pouring out of the sanctum!\n\nI'm going to need you to take care of these creatures before we send anyone in for repairs. Make haste!",o="魔网监护者薇兰妮亚要求你杀死5只法力怨灵和5只法力漫步者。",oEN="Ley-Keeper Velania wants you to kill 5 Manawraiths and 5 Mana Stalkers.",p="你杀死那些法力怨灵了吗？",pEN="Did you take care of the arcane wraiths?",c="谢谢你，$n。因为法力怨灵受制，我们才能重建西部圣殿。希望这里水流不再遭受持续的伤害。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Now that we have the wraiths under control we can send someone in to assess the damage. Hopefully this wasn't anything permanent."}
Q[8487]={d="在阿尔萨斯和天灾军团在森林里犁出一条通向银月城的路之前，这里曾是一座功能完备的奥术圣殿。\n\n可是现在，它已经和死亡之痕里的其它东西一样对我们毫无用处了。土地被腐蚀，亡灵被这腐蚀的土壤源源不断地吸引而来，而魔网管道中的能量也被污染了。\n\n现在我最想知道的事，$n，就是这种腐蚀是否可逆。我要你从这个区域中收集一些土壤样本来供我研究。或许不久之后，我们就能让这片土地恢复健康。",dEN="This was a fully functional arcane sanctum before Arthas and his army of Scourge decided to plow through it on their way to Silvermoon.\n\nNow it's as useful to us as any part of the Dead Scar. The soil is tainted, undead are drawn to it and the energy in the ley lines is completely disrupted.\n\nWhat I want to know, <name>, is whether this taint is reversible or not. I want you to collect soil samples from this area so I can study them. Perhaps with time we can set things back to normal.",o="永歌森林东部圣殿的学徒米尔维达要求你收集8堆被污染的土壤样本。",oEN="Apprentice Mirveda at the East Sanctum in Eversong Woods wants you to collect 8 Tainted Soil Samples.",p="你收集好我要求的样品了吗，$n？",pEN="Are you done collecting the samples I asked for, <name>?",c="太棒了。我要对这些土壤样本施法，这样才能好好解析土壤腐败的原因。",cEN="Excellent. I will cast an augmentation enchantment on the samples so I can more clearly analyze the taint on the soil."}
Q[8488]={d="情况有些不对，$n。我感觉到了天灾军团的存在。做好战斗准备！",dEN="Something's wrong, <name>. I sense the presence of Scourge. Be ready to fight them!",o="保护学徒米尔维达免遭天灾军团的伤害。",oEN="Protect Apprentice Mirveda from the Scourge ambush.",c="我没帮上什么忙，$n。土壤的自然本质已被改变……污染和腐败已成定局。不过还是谢谢你的协助，我再给你最后一项任务。",cEN="My endeavors are hopeless, <name>. The very nature of the soil has been altered... the taint is irreversible. Thank you for your assistance. I'll need to ask one last task of you."}
Q[8490]={d="在永歌森林的边界曾经有数十块古老的符石组成结界，封闭国土以免外敌入侵。这些符石在阿尔萨斯入侵时大多被损坏了，还有一些被偷走了。\n\n当前，还有三块符石遗留在那里，这三块中，也只有一块仍然维持着能量。这块符石就在东边，或许它还有挽救的馀地。\n\n把这块水晶带过去，将里面的能量小心地注入东部符石中。这个过程或许会需要一些时间，所以你要有耐心。此外，你还得小心，附近的天灾军团士兵或许会被它吸引过去。千万不要让它们摧毁符石。",dEN="Ancient runestones once powered a protective barrier across the Eversong border. Many were destroyed during Arthas' attack; others were stolen.\n\nOf the three that remain, only this one has retained its powers. The runestone to the east might be salvageable, though.\n\nTake this crystal and instill its energy on the Eastern Runestone. The process should take but a minute. Beware though, nearby Scourge will be drawn to it and will seek to destroy it. Do not let them!",o="将魔能水晶放置在东部符石上，并确保它在1分钟之内免遭天灾军团的攻击。之后将魔能水晶交给永歌森林的符文看守者德尔雅，以换取你的奖励。",oEN="Place the Infused Crystal at the Eastern Runestone and protect it from the Scourge for 1 minute. Return the Infused Crystal to Runewarden Deryan in Eversong Woods for a reward.",p="你成功的增强符文石了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you succeeded in powering the runestone yet, <name>?",c="很好。这样就能防守天灾军团更久些。谢谢你助我们一臂之力，$n。",cEN="Excellent. The defenses should hold off the Scourge a bit longer. Thank you for lending us a hand, <name>."}
Q[8491]={d="这一带的春爪豹以皮毛品质上乘而闻名；甚至有暗夜精灵专程跑到这片土地来偷猎它们。\n\n我们与阿曼尼的冲突消耗了装备储备，游侠们也没时间去打猎了。如果你愿意帮忙收集春爪豹皮，我很乐意用一件手工制作的护甲奖励你。你在这条路以北的森林里到处都能找到春爪潜伏者。",dEN="The springpaw that inhabit this region are known for their high quality pelts. We've even seen night elf scum travel to these lands just to poach them.\n\nOur skirmishes with the Amani have put a bit of a strain on our supply of gear and our rangers don't have much time to hunt for pelts anymore. If you'd be willing to lend a hand by collecting springpaw pelts, I'd be happy to reward you with a hand-crafted piece of armor. You'll find springpaw stalkers all around the woods north of here.",o="永歌森林晴风村的维兰·布雷托克要求你帮他收集6张魔泉豹皮。",oEN="Velan Brightoak at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods wants you to bring him 6 Springpaw Pelts.",p="你回来了，你有带那些毛皮吗？",pEN="You're back. Did you bring the pelts?",c="这些会非常有用，$n。请收下这个护甲做为奖励。我会用你带来给我的毛皮做更多护甲。",cEN="These will do perfectly, <name>. Take this piece of armor as a reward. I'll be able to make more with the pelts you brought me."}
Q[8492]={d="你好，$c，看来你很合适为我们的备战计划做出点贡献！我们欢迎一切帮助来准备安其拉之战。\n\n为了这样一件有意义的事情，我正在收集20块一组的铜锭。你觉得怎么样？",dEN="Hey there, <class>, you look fit enough to contribute to the war effort! We need all of the help that we can get here to put together the materiel needed for the Ahn'Qiraj War and it's your lucky day.\n\nI'm collecting copper bars in stacks of twenty. It's for a worthy cause, what do you say? Do you think you could help out the Alliance?",o="把20块铜锭带给铁炉堡军事区的派特罗斯·毕勾斯中士。",oEN="Bring 20 Copper Bars to the bar collector.",p="你收集好那20个铜锭了吗？",pEN="Have you collected those twenty bars of copper yet, trooper?",c="你办到了，$g小子:姑娘;！我们马上把这些铜锭堆起来，用来制作战争物资。正是像你这样的人出力，才让我为效力联盟而自豪。干得好，士兵！\n\n如果你碰巧还能找到更多铜锭，一定要让它们送到我这儿来。",cEN="You did it, lad! We'll get those copper bars onto the pile and put them to good use making the war materiel right away. It's the efforts of people like you that make me proud to serve the Alliance. Good work, soldier!\n\nAnd if you should happen to come across more copper bars, make sure that they find their way to me."}
Q[8493]={d="又回来了$c？太好了！我们需要更多你从安其拉之战取得的铜锭。你会帮我们吗？",dEN="Back again <class>? Outstanding! We still need more stacks of copper bars if you can procure them for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Will you help us out?",o="把20块铜锭带给丹莫罗机场的铜锭收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Copper Bars to the bar collector.",p="又回来了$c？太好了！我们还需要大量的铜锭，为了准备安其拉之战，请尽你所能地帮我收集铜锭，这些铜锭是要用来建造蒸汽坦克跟旋翼机，\n\n我们为了安其拉战役，真的还需要更多铜锭，你愿意帮帮我们吗？",pEN="Back again, <class>? Outstanding! The bars you've provided thus far are really going to help out in making all sorts of things for the war. I know, for example, that the copper is going to be used for parts of the steam tanks that are being built, as well as in a small fleet of gyrocopters that we're planning to deploy if time allows.\n\nDon't let the stacks here fool you though, we still need more copper bars if you can procure them for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Will you help us out?",c="做得好！到处挖铜一定是个很大的冒险吧。除非你是在拍卖场买到它们的。反正，我都需要它们。你对战事的贡献会受到表扬的$c。",cEN="Excellent work! Digging around for that copper and smelting it must have been quite an adventure. Unless you bought them at the auction house. Either way, it works for me. You are to be commended for your contribution to the war effort, <class>. And please don't hesitate to bring me more copper bars if you have them."}
Q[8494]={d="哎呀呀，你好啊，$g先-生:小-姐;，见到你真是太好了。免得你还没听说——当你在外头过着\"社交繁忙的生活\"时，联盟一直在为安其拉之战做准备，正需要铁锭……而且是一大堆。以二十块一组带给我。我们可以指望你吧，$c？",dEN="Well hello there, <Mr. /Ms.> Fancypants, aren't you a sight for sore eyes. In case you hadn't heard while you were out there \"adventuring\", the Alliance has been gearing up for a war in Ahn'Qiraj and is in need of iron bars... a whole mess of 'em. Bring them to me in stacks of twenty. We can count on you, right, <class>?",o="把20块铁锭带给铁炉堡军事区的卡恩斯下士。",oEN="Bring 20 Iron Bars to the bar collector.",p="如果你收集到那20个铁锭，我可不想发现你把它们都藏起来了！",pEN="If you have those twenty bars of iron, I don't want to know where you have them hidden!",c="嗯，嗯，多亏了你$n。你渡过难关了。我想现在我要多注意你。我不想这么说，但是谢谢你的帮忙。联盟不会忘记，我也不会。现在快离开这里去看看还有什么需要收集。",cEN="Well, well, if it isn't <name>. And you pulled through. I guess now I'll have to keep my eye on you. It hurts me to say this, but thanks for your efforts. The Alliance won't forget, and neither will I. Now get out there and bust your hump on whatever else needs collecting."}
Q[8495]={d="这么快就回来了？不要让我再重新评估对你不好的看法$c，你让我觉得很感伤。那么，你知道我们仍然没有足够的铁锭供应武器、护甲、蒸气坦克和搜寻故障所有需要的东西。你觉得你可以在去祖尔格拉布的路上，或是你们这些孩子现在鬼混的地方带回另一批20个铁锭吗？",dEN="Back so soon? Stop making me re-evaluate my low opinion of you <class>, you're making me feel all gooey inside. So, as you can tell we still don't have enough iron bars for all of the weapons, armor, steam tanks and whatnot that need building for the bug hunt. Think you have it in you to bring back another stack of twenty iron bars in between all of those trips to Zul'Gurub, or wherever it is that you kids hang out these days?",o="把20块铁锭带给丹莫罗机场的卡恩斯下士。",oEN="Bring 20 Iron Bars to the bar collector.",p="这么快就回来了？不要让我再重新评估对你不好的看法$c，你让我觉得很感伤。那么，你知道我们仍然没有足够的铁锭供应武器、护甲、蒸汽坦克和搜寻故障所有需要的东西。你觉得你可以在去祖尔格拉布的路上，或是你们这些孩子现在鬼混的地方带回另一批20个铁锭吗？",pEN="Back so soon? Stop making me re-evaluate my low opinion of you, <class>, you're making me feel all gooey inside. So, as you can tell we still don't have enough iron bars for all of the weapons, armor, steam tanks and whatnot that need building for the bug hunt. Think you have it in you to bring back another stack of twenty iron bars in between all of those trips to Zul'Gurub, or wherever it is that you kids hang out these days?",c="燃烧平原今天一定很冷。瞧，是$n，还给我带了份礼物。二十块铁锭！正是我一直想要的。\n\n不过说正经的，谢谢你，$n。你为自己和整个联盟都增了光。现在快回去，为战争事业多带点东西来！",cEN="Must be a cold day in the Burning Steppes. Look here, it's <name>, and she's brought me a gift. Twenty iron bars! Just what I always wanted.\n\nIn all seriousness though, thank you, <name>. You're a credit to yourself and the Alliance. Now get back out there and bring in more stuff for the war effort!"}
Q[8496]={d="我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="Our supply of bandages in the battlefield is running dangerously low after the recent casualties we have incurred. Obtain a batch of first-aid supplies and deliver them to Windcaller Proudhorn in Cenarion Hold.",o="把30根厚符文布绷带、30根厚魔纹绷带和30根厚丝质绷带交给唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 X才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="来的正好。这些补给能救回性命，$n。我们感谢你的努力。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Just in time. These supplies will save lives, <name>. Your work is appreciated. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8497]={d="随着新兵增援塞纳里奥城堡，如何让他们在沙漠中生存成了一个问题。缺水是基本的问题，沙漠中无数具毒的生物对没有经验的志愿兵而言是很大的威胁。收集沙漠生存工具包需要的物资并带给塞纳里奥城堡的卡兰德拉斯。",dEN="With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert. Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers. Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.",o="带4个纯水之球，4个强效抗毒药剂和4个沙漠肉丸子带到希利苏斯给塞纳里奥城堡旅店的卡兰德拉斯。你还必须将后勤任务简报 I带去才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="很好。我们正需要这些，$n。做得好。",cEN="Excellent! We were in need of these, <name>. Thanks."}
Q[8498]={d="我们的侦察兵报告说，暮光之锤的领袖收到了新的作战命令。现在这道命令正在被发送到各处的暮光预言者那里，并且有重兵护送。拦截这道命令，把它们交给指挥官玛尔利斯。",dEN="Our scouts have reported new battle orders being issued by the Twilight's Hammer leaders. The orders are being distributed by Twilight Prophets under heavy escort. Intercept the orders and bring them to Commander Mar'alith.",o="拿到暮光作战命令，把它交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯。",oEN="Obtain the Twilight Battle Orders and bring them Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",p="你带了什么东西要给我吗？",pEN="You've brought something for me?",c="很好。比敌人抢先一步是很重要的。这项消息可以让我们预测暮光之锤的攻击。",cEN="Excellent. It's important to stay ahead of the enemy's next move. This information will allow us to anticipate the Twilight's Hammer's attacks."}
Q[8499]={d="你能主动关心联盟需要什么东西，这真是太好了。除了现在正在收集的各种物资之外，我们还需要大量的瑟银锭，我将负责这方面的收集。所有的瑟银都将用于制作各种战争必需的物资，特别是用来制造一个军团的蒸汽坦克，准备进攻希利苏斯。你能帮帮我吗，$c？",dEN="It is very kind of you to inquire about the needs that the Alliance has. In addition to all of the other collection efforts underway, we are in need of a great quantity of thorium bars, which is the task that I am in charge of. The thorium will be used in the creation of many different things for the war, foremost of which is the construction of a battalion of steam tanks to be airlifted into Silithus as soon as they are completed. Can you aid us in this endeavor, <class>?",o="把20块瑟银锭带给铁炉堡军事区的达玛·织辫。",oEN="Bring 20 Thorium Bars to the bar collector.",p="我希望你已经成功收集好我们之前讲的瑟银锭了。",pEN="Oh, a shipment from my brother? Splendid! Fortune truly shines on me today!",c="这么说格诺恩不相信我的侦察能力？我真想知道为什么……",cEN="So Gnoarn doesn't trust my reconnaissance abilities? I wonder why..."}
Q[8500]={d="又见到你真高兴，$n！希望一切顺利。没错，我们仍然需要瑟银锭。如果你有多余的，我正在为安其拉之战的准备收集它们。",dEN="It is so good to see you again <name>. I hope that you've been doing well. It's true that we are still in need of thorium bars. If you have them to spare I am collecting them for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort.",o="把20块瑟银锭带给丹莫罗机场的达玛·织辫。",oEN="Bring 20 Thorium Bars to the bar collector.",p="能再见到你真好，$n。希望你一切都好。我们现在还需要瑟银锭。如果你有的话请分给我，我正在为安其拉之战收集。",pEN="It is so good to see you again, <name>. I hope that you've been doing well. It's true that we are still in need of thorium bars. If you have them to spare I am collecting them for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort.",c="太好了，$n！干得漂亮。我会确保这些锭子堆上货盘，送到正在为军队赶制补给品的铁匠和工程师手中。再次感谢你，如果你再找到瑟银锭，一定要再来。",cEN="Excellent, <class>! A job well done. I'll see to it that those bars get onto the pallet and into the hands of the blacksmiths and engineers that are hard at work building up the supplies for our army. Thank you again, and if you come across more thorium bars be sure to drop by."}
Q[8501]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对亚什虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是亚什毒蝎。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of the airborne Hive'Ashi stingers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="杀死30只亚什毒蝎，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报XII》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Kill 30 Hive'Ashi Stingers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing XII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么事要跟我说吗，$n？",pEN="You wish to tell me something, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。你在亚什虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Ashi has been noted."}
Q[8502]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对亚什虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是亚什工蝎。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi workers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="击杀30只亚什工蝎，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带着作战任务简报 III才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Workers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="做得好，$n。少了他们的工蝎，异种蝎就很难修补他们虫巢结构所受的伤害。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Without their workers, the silithid will have a hard time repairing any damage inflicted to their hive's structure."}
Q[8503]={d="那么$c，我是否告诉过你荆棘藻的所有用处？有没有说过？哦，好吧……不管怎么样，我们需要很多荆棘藻，我说很多的意思就是非常非常多！你可以帮帮我吗？我知道这意味着你无法用它来制作许多你需要的东西，但是我们是在为了正义的事业而努力！",dEN="So, <class>, did I already tell you about all of the fabulous uses stranglekelp has? I did? Oh well... in any case we need a lot of it, and when I say a lot, I mean A LOT! Do you think that you could help us out? I know that it means going without all of those wonderful things that you can make with it, but it's for a good cause!",o="把20株荆棘藻带给铁炉堡军事区的士兵德拉克斯勒格。",oEN="Bring 20 Stranglekelp to the herb collector.",p="这不是真的！我从来没有将这些堆积物上面的荆棘藻去除过。有人可能会认为它几乎就是经济利义下有效的万灵丹。*咳咳*你不会正好有我们先前谈的荆棘藻吧？",pEN="It's not true! I'd never skim any stranglekelp off the top of the stacks here. One might be tempted to though considering that it's practically a panacea of utilitarian usefulness. *cough* You don't happen to have that stranglekelp we discussed earlier?",c="呼啦！又少二十株。你是$g最棒的:最棒的;。我想我该在它们枯萎之前把这些都打包起来。这么多荆棘藻，时间却这么少！\n\n再次感谢你，$n！",cEN="Hooray! That's another twenty down. You're the best. I suppose that I should get these all packed away before they wither. So much stranglekelp, so little time!\n\nThanks again, <class>!"}
Q[8504]={d="呃，又见面了……叫什么来着？啊对，$n！你是来看看我还需不需要更多荆棘藻吗？那今天是你的幸运日，因为这个重要问题的答案是一个响亮的——需要！你觉得你能再弄二十株来吗？",dEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Stranglekelp. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",o="把20株荆棘藻带给丹莫罗机场的士兵德拉克斯勒格。",oEN="Bring 20 Stranglekelp to the herb collector.",p="哎呀，又见面了……什么来着？啊对，<name>！你是来看看我还需不需要更多荆棘藻吗？那今天是你的幸运日，因为这个重要问题的答案是一个非常肯定的“是”！你觉得你能再采二十株来吗？",pEN="Well hello again there... what was it? Ah yes, <name>! Come to see if I still need more stranglekelp have you? Well, it's your lucky day, because the answer to that very important question is a very affirmative YES! Think you could gather up twenty more?",c="天哪，你那儿带了多少荆棘藻啊。快，我们把它装进箱子里保鲜。你送来这一批，可帮了……帮了联盟一个大忙。我会让所有人都知道，是你，伟大的<name>，用你的荆棘藻为安其拉战争事业助了一臂之力！",cEN="Oh goodness that's a quite a load of stranglekelp you have there. Quick, let's get that into a box to keep it fresh. You've done me... us, the Alliance a great favor by bringing that batch in. I'll make sure that everyone knows that it was you, the great <name>, that helped to tip the scales in the Ahn'Qiraj war effort with your contribution of stranglekelp!"}
Q[8505]={d="$C，紫莲花是一种非常有用的植物。我在这里作为联盟的官员收集紫莲花，我要负责监督整个收集过程，并保证在战时有足够的紫莲花储量可供使用。\n\n我希望你可以到世界各地帮我带回一些紫莲花。你可以做到吗？",dEN="<class>, the purple lotus is a flower with a plentitude of uses. I am here at the request of the Alliance as an authority on those applications, to preserve the herbs collected and to ensure that their war effort acquires enough purple lotus to sustain whatever function they plan for it.\n\nI would like for you to travel out into the world and return to me with some of these flowers. Is that something that you can do?",o="把20株紫莲花带给铁炉堡军事区的奥罗兰大师。",oEN="Bring 20 Purple Lotus to the herb collector at the Military Ward in Ironforge.",p="你有我要的紫莲花草药了吗？",pEN="Do you have the purple lotus herbs that I requested?",c="我们非常感谢你的贡献，$c。只有大家同心协力才能将无情的异种发展和所有驱使他们的力量击退。就连部落也都在收集他们自己的紫莲花。如果你收集得够多，请带到这里给我。",cEN="Your contribution is greatly appreciated, <class>. It is only through the combined efforts of all that we shall be able to repel the ruthless advance of the silithid and whatever force is driving them forth. Even the Horde is amassing their own collection of purple lotus. Should you come across more, please return to me here."}
Q[8506]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$c。我们的收集在增长，但仍然需要更多紫莲花。如果你还有能力采集更多，我恳请你去采来带给我。",dEN="Welcome back <class>. Our collection grows, but even now we have a need for additional purple lotus. If it is still within your power to gather more of the herb, I entreat you to do so and return them to me here.",o="把20株紫莲花带给丹莫罗机场的奥罗兰大师。",oEN="Bring 20 purple lotus to the herb collector at the airfield in Dun Morogh.",p="欢迎回来，<class>。我们的收集在增长，但即便现在我们也还需要更多紫莲花。如果你还能采集更多，我恳请你去采来带给我。",pEN="Welcome back <class>. Our collection grows, but even now we have a need for additional purple lotus. If it is still within your power to gather more of the herb, I entreat you to do so and return them to me here.",c="我代表联盟欣然接受你的贡献，<name>。你的努力将直接促成若干药剂和油脂的制作，用以支援我们前线的将士。谢谢你，如果你再找到更多，请考虑带给我。",cEN="I gladly accept your contribution on behalf of the Alliance, <name>. Your efforts will directly lead to the creation of several potions and oils in support of our men and women in the field. Thank you, and should come across more, please consider returning to me."}
Q[8507]={d="你好，$n。在我为你布置更重要的任务之前，你需要首先完成一些常规的战地任务。\n\n你可以在佐拉虫穴外找到布莱卡维尔上尉的部队。\n\n向他或者他的副官珍妮拉·钢锤报到，然后回到我这里来。那时我将会给你下达进一步的指令。\n\n哦，别忘了离奥格瑞玛军团远一些。由于这两股势力之间的互相仇视，我们被迫把他们分开来。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Before I assign you to more involved tasks in the war, you'll need to do your share of field duty.\n\nYou will find Captain Blackanvil's Ironforge Brigade outside Hive'Zora.\n\nReport to him or his lieutenant, Janela Stouthammer and come back to me. I shall have a more advanced assignment for you ready.\n\nOh and please do us a favor and stay away from the Orgrimmar Legion. We've been forced to keep the two forces well apart from one another due to mutual animosity.",o="向佐拉虫巢外的铁炉堡军团报到，从布莱卡维尔上尉那里拿到签过字的战地任务文件，把它交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者卡尔东。\n\n注意：给铁炉堡军团的士兵治疗或者施放增益法术会打开你的PvP标志。",oEN="Report for duty at the Ironforge Brigade post near Hive'Zora. Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers and obtain Signed Field Duty Papers from Captain Blackanvil and return to Windcaller Kaldon at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.\n\nNote: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Ironforge Brigade will flag you for PvP.",p="你可以在佐拉虫巢外找到布莱卡维尔上尉的军队。和他的中尉，珍妮拉·顽锤谈谈，如果你能找到他的话。",pEN="You'll find Captain Blackanvil's force stationed outside Hive'Zora. Talk to his lieutenant, Janela Stouthammer, if you can't find him.",c="很好，$n。我已准备了一系列最适合你的技能的任务。\n\n有你和像你这样的人继续努力，我们的敌人很快就会被击败了！\n\n要取得新的任务简报，回去找布莱卡维尔上尉。",cEN="Very well, <name> I've prepared a set of tasks that should make optimal use of your skills.\n\nWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be vanquished once and for all!\n\nShould you require a new mission briefing, return to Captain Blackanvil."}
Q[8508]={p="我猜你想要那些文件签字，小伙子。",pEN="I take it you want those papers signed, <lad/lass>?",c="啊，我想刚才经历了那场小遭遇战也可以被称为完成了一项“战地任务”吧。把这些带回塞纳里奥要塞去，我相信他们一定会有重要任务给你的。\n\n快出发！",cEN="Aye, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I'm sure they'll have a cushy job ready for you.\n\nOff you go!"}
Q[8509]={d="我长话短说，直入正题，$c。联盟需要收集大量阿尔萨斯之泪，为安其拉之战做准备。别问我用来干什么，我只是奉命行事。但我希望你能尽可能多地采集这种草药，带到我这儿来。你愿意为我做这件事吗？",dEN="I'll keep it simple and to the point, <class>. We Need to collect a large quantity of Arthas' Tears for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Don't ask me what for; I'm just following orders. But I'd like you to gather up as many of the herbs as you can and bring them back to me here. Are you willing to do that?",o="把20株阿尔萨斯之泪带给铁炉堡军事区的陆军少校热尔曼。",oEN="Bring 20 Arthas' Tears to the herb collector.",p="那是什么？说清楚点，$n！我让你办的那批阿尔萨斯之泪，你带来了吗？",pEN="What's that? Speak up, <class>! Have you got that shipment of Arthas' Tears I asked for?",c="干得好，$n。我得说我很惊喜。你不会相信有多少人来过，主动说要帮忙，却再也没回来。让我把它们装进箱子、记上你的名字，然后我们再谈谈我是否还需要更多这种草药。",cEN="Good work, <class>. I must say that I'm pleasantly surprised. You would not believe the number of people that have come by, offering to help, but never returning. Let me just get those into a crate and tallied with your name on it, and then we can talk again about whether I need anymore of those plants."}
Q[8510]={d="好吧，看来我还需要更多阿尔萨斯之泪。我想你上次帮我采集的地方应该还能找到。我们越早拿到，就能越早对安其拉的势力发起进攻。\n\n你会再来帮我们吗，$c？",dEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Arthas' Tears. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",o="把20株阿尔萨斯之泪带给丹莫罗机场的陆军少校热尔曼。",oEN="Bring 20 Arthas' Tears to the herb collector.",p="好吧，看来我还需要更多阿尔萨斯之泪。我想你上次帮我采集的地方应该还能找到。我们越早拿到，就能越早对安其拉的势力发起进攻。\n\n你会再来帮我们吗，<class>？",pEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Arthas' Tears. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",c="简直出色，<name>！你真是联盟的骄傲。我会确保把这些草药收好，等有人来把它们制成战争可用的东西。随时欢迎你回来，尤其是如果你还有更多阿尔萨斯之泪给我。",cEN="Simply outstanding, <name>! You're a real credit to the Alliance. I'll make sure to get these herbs packed away until someone comes to make them into something useful for the war. Feel free to come back around anytime, especially if you have more Arthas' Tears for me."}
Q[8511]={d="我们系列历代都是着名的剥皮匠，$c。这就是联盟要求我们为了安其拉之战而收集轻皮的原因。我在这里的工作是确保皮革经过正确的处理，准备投入使用。但是我们需要你的帮助。\n\n因为我不得不留在这里，所以我需要你去帮忙收集皮革，然后把它们交给我。你觉得怎么样，$g小伙子:小姑娘，你会帮我吗？",dEN="We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, <class>. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of light leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.\n\nSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, <lad /lass>, will you give it a go?",o="把10张轻皮带给铁炉堡军事区的邦妮·石剥。",oEN="Bring 10 Light Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="$n，我希望那就是你答应过的轻皮。",pEN="<class>, I do so hope that's the light leather you promised.",c="我敢说联盟会对你带来的这些皮革非常满意，$n。我会确保一点都不浪费。谢谢你，等我清点完之后一定回来问问我是否还需要更多。",cEN="I dare say the Alliance is going to be very happy with your skins here, <class>. I'll make sure that not a one goes to waste. Thank you, and make sure that you check back in with me once I've counted them up to see if we need more."}
Q[8512]={d="很高兴再见到你，$n。显然我们需要更多轻皮来制作各种战争要用的东西。如果你能再帮我带来10张轻皮就太完美了。",dEN="Good to see you again <name>. It does appear that we need more light leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.",o="把10张轻皮带给丹莫罗机场的邦妮·石剥。",oEN="Bring 10 Light Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="很高兴再见到你，$n。显然我们需要更多轻皮来制作各种战争要用的东西。如果你能再帮我带来10张轻皮就太完美了。",pEN="Good to see you again, <name>. It does appear that we need more light leather for the creation of the various war materiels. If you would bring me a stack of ten, that would be just perfect.",c="谢谢你慷慨的捐献，$n。我会让相关人士知道你的名字，这样高权者就会知道你为战争做的努力。看来我们好像永远都需要更多的轻皮。快点回来找我。",cEN="Thank you for your generous donation, <name>. I'm going to get those onto the pile right now, and in no time I'm sure that they'll get changed into a nice set of armor, some leather patches, or used for something else in our preparations. Seems like we're always in need of more light leather. Come back and visit me soon."}
Q[8513]={d="是的，$g先生:女士;，他们委托我收集并登记所有为备战而采集的中皮。如果你有办法凑集中皮，不管来自哪里，都带给我。如果你肯花点时间，我当然感激这份帮助。",dEN="We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, <class>. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of medium leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.\n\nSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, <lad /lass>, will you give it a go?",o="把10张中皮带给铁炉堡军事区的士兵波特。",oEN="Bring 10 Medium Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="是的，先生，我记得你。你身上带的就是中皮吗？",pEN="Yes sir, I remember you. Is that the medium leather you have with you there?",c="哇！看起来你刚才还只是来这儿自荐当$g志愿者:志愿者;帮忙的。非常感谢你的捐赠。我会把它们打包清点。你可真懂得怎么让小伙子高兴。",cEN="Wow! Seems like you were just here volunteering to help. Thank you very much for the donation. I'll just get those all packed up and counted. You sure do know how to brighten a fella's day."}
Q[8514]={d="确实，$g先生:女士;，到目前为止我们已经收集了$2063w张中皮。我知道这要求有点高，但如果你还$g愿意:愿意;，你的帮助能帮我大大减少配额，我会非常感激。",dEN="Good to see you again <name>. It does appear that we need more medium leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.",o="把10张中皮带给丹莫罗机场的士兵波特。",oEN="Bring 10 Medium Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="是的$g先生:女士;，看来我们已经收集了很多张中皮，但我们还需要更多。我可以向你保证，这些都会被好好利用；一张都不会浪费。我知道这要求有点高，但如果你还$g愿意:愿意;，我可以用你的帮助来削减我剩余配额的一部分。",pEN="Yes sir, looks like we've collected many pieces of medium leather, but we need more. I can assure you that it will all be put to good use; not one piece will get wasted. I know it's a lot to ask, but if you're still willing, I could use your help in attempting to put a dent in the rest of my quota.",c="天啊，你真的带了很多中皮来$g先生:女士！我会将你的名字和功绩列在清单上。有你的帮忙我们很快就能将中皮收集好了！\n\n谢谢，$n！",cEN="Golly, that sure is a lot of medium leather that you've brought round, sir! I'm gonna make sure that all of that gets put to proper use, yes indeed. With your help we'll have filled our estimation for medium leather in no time!\n\nThanks, <name>!"}
Q[8515]={d="哎呀，这可太棒了！$C，安其拉之战的准备工作正全速推进，他们委托我登记所有送来的厚皮。我们要用它做出成吨的东西，但首先得弄到成吨的厚皮。我是说真的！现在该你上场了。\n\n那么，你觉得你能出去给我弄一大堆厚皮回来吗？来吧，$g老兄:老妹;！",dEN="We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, <class>. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of thick leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.\n\nSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, <lad /lass>, will you give it a go?",o="把10张厚皮带给铁炉堡军事区的玛尔塔·布恩耶。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="$n，你背包里带的就是厚皮吗？是吗？我迫不及待想让你交给我了！大家都会对我们很满意的，你不觉得吗？",pEN="Is that the thick leather you have there in your pack, <class>? Is it? I can't wait for you to hand it over! Everyone is going to be so pleased with us don't you think?",c="哦，我就知道你能做到，$n，我就是知道！我会尽快把这些交到合适的人手里。现在让我看看。嗯，看来我们的账目进展得相当不错。等我清点完，你应该马上回来问问我是否还需要更多。因为如果$g需要:需要;，我要派出去替我收集的人就是你！",cEN="Oh, I knew you could do it, <class>, I just knew it! I'll get these into the right hands as soon as I can. Now, let's see here. Hmm, looks like our tally is coming along rather nicely. You should check back with me in just a moment once I'm done counting to see if we need more. Cuz if we do, you're the one I want out there gathering it up for me!"}
Q[8516]={d="啊哈，这堆还不够高。$n，我们离$2071w张厚皮的目标还有差距。想想看，用这么多皮革我们能做多少东西！各种各样的护甲和武器。蒸汽坦克内部的零件、步枪瞄准镜！给工程师做的护目镜，我敢打赌，如果我们收集得太多，说不定还能把剩下的给部落做飞艇！\n\n你愿意再给我带些厚皮来吗？",dEN="Good to see you again <name>. It does appear that we need more thick leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.",o="把10张厚皮带给丹莫罗机场的玛尔塔·布恩耶。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="没错，存货仍然不够。$n，我们仍未达到理想的目标。想想我们能用重皮做的所有东西！各种护甲和武器。蒸汽坦克的零件和步枪瞄准器！工程学护目镜，而且如果到最后我们还有剩下，可以把它们交给部落的齐柏林飞艇！\n\n你会为我带更多的重皮回来吗？",pEN="Yep, the stack's still not high enough. <name>, we still haven't reached our thick leather goal. Just think of all the things that we can make with all of that leather! All kinds of armor and weapons. Stuff for inside the steam tanks and rifle scopes! And engineering goggles, those are always fun!\n\nYou gonna bring me back some more thick leather?",c="你又办到了！你能踏出这里收集所有的东西真是太神奇了，然后再把它们带回来交给我。我告诉你，如果他们知道你帮了多大的忙，你走到街上就一定会有人跟你要签名。\n\n再次谢谢你慷慨的捐献重皮，$n。",cEN="You did it again! That is simply amazing how you go out there, collect all of this stuff, and then bring it back here and hand it over. I tell ya, when they find out how much you've been helping out around here you're not going to be able to walk down the street without people asking you for your autograph!\n\nThanks again for your very generous donation of thick leather, <name>."}
Q[8517]={d="安其拉之战将会漫长而血腥。联盟把你和像你这样的人征召入伍，在一头扎进冲突之前备好必需的物资，这是非常明智的举措。\n\n他们让我负责为战争收集亚麻绷带，我希望你能帮我凑齐我们需要的数量。这可不是小事。你愿意和我们一起干吗，$c？",dEN="The war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to be long and bloody. It is a very wise thing that the Alliance is doing by enlisting the aid of you, and those like you, to build up the materiel necessary before plunging headlong into conflict.\n\nI have been asked to head up the collection of linen bandages for the war, and I am hoping that you are going to assist me in amassing as many as we need. It is no light matter. Are you with us, <class>?",o="把20卷亚麻绷带带给铁炉堡军事区的哨兵希拉格银。",oEN="Bring 20 linen bandages to the bandage collector.",p="$n，我需要的那二十卷亚麻绷带你有了吗？",pEN="Do you have the twenty linen bandages that I require, <class>?",c="$n，今天你在这里的贡献会让许多士兵受益。我会亲自确保联盟知晓你的努力。请容我片刻，把这些绷带妥善存放并更新我的统计，然后你再来问问我是否需要更多。\n\n愿艾露恩之光在你身上闪耀，$r！",cEN="Many are the soldiers that will benefit from your contribution here today, <class>. I shall see to it personally that the Alliance is made aware of your efforts. Allow me a moment to store these bandages properly and update my count, and then you should check back with me to see if I am in need of more.\n\nMay the Light of Elune shine upon you, <race>!"}
Q[8518]={d="我非常惊奇有那么多无私的人将私欲抛于一旁。$C，我还需要收集更多的亚麻绷带，直到完成我的指标。你是否可以再帮我收集一些亚麻绷带呢？",dEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of linen bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",o="把20卷亚麻绷带带给丹莫罗机场的哨兵希拉格银。",oEN="Bring 20 linen bandages to the bandage collector.",p="我对于你在私下还有如此无私的行为感到很惊讶。$c，在我的任务完成之前我仍需要一些亚麻布绷带。你能再次帮我收集那些绷带吗？",pEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of linen bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",c="你会受到表扬，$n。当其它人会在我们的战争立足点上占经济的便宜来填满他们的荷包时，你却对联盟牺牲奉献，而且对整个艾泽拉斯而言你是第一个这么做的人。\n\n愿艾露恩的祝福永远跟随你！",cEN="You are to be commended, <name>. While there are those that would take advantage of the economics of our war footing to line their pockets in a fervor of greed, you have proven time and again that your devotion to the Alliance, and indeed to all of Azeroth, comes first.\n\nBlessings of Elune be with you always!"}
Q[8519]={d="当你恢复镇静并重新汇集目光的时候，你发现有些东西从水晶之内往外瞪着。通过进一步的观察，你所看到的是过去……一段记忆……很久之前就遗忘的记忆。",dEN="As you regain your composure and focus your gaze, you notice that something stirs within the crystal. Upon closer inspection, you realize that you are looking into the past... a memory... long forgotten.",o="尽可能多地了解过去，然后去塔纳利斯的时光之穴与阿纳克罗斯交谈。|n",oEN="Learn all that you can of the past, then speak with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.",c="在鹿盔的背叛之后，我收集了流沙之地权杖碎片并回到这里。我尽了所有力气来保护权杖，不让想用它来伤害世界的人使用它——因此才有巨龙军团的攻击。\n\n在四只巨龙之间分裂的权杖实在不太可能重整那些蓄意制造的混乱……至少我是这样想的。我真是个笨蛋。到现在我还是被那受诅咒的思想困扰着。",cEN="After Staghelm's betrayal, I gathered the shattered pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and returned here. I had every intention of protecting the scepter from those that would seek to use it to cause harm to our world - thus was born the charge of the Dragonflights.\n\nA scepter divided amongst the four mighty Aspects would prove to be nearly impossible to restore for those willfully seeking chaos... or so I thought. What a fool I was. Even now I am hunted by that cursed flight."}
Q[8520]={d="随着安其拉之战迫近，我们必须竭尽全力让士兵们什么都不缺。这正是我们在这里做的事。就我而言，他们让我负责监督收集足够的丝绸绷带。\n\n你觉得你能帮我吗，$c？",dEN="The war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to be long and bloody. It is a very wise thing that the Alliance is doing by enlisting the aid of you, and those like you, to build up the materiel necessary before plunging headlong into conflict.\n\nI have been asked to head up the collection of silk bandages for the war, and I am hoping that you are going to assist me in amassing as many as we need. It is no light matter. Are you with us, <class>?",o="把20卷丝绸绷带带给铁炉堡军事区的护士斯通菲尔德。",oEN="Bring 20 silk bandages to the bandage collector.",p="你好，$c，你拿到那20个丝质绷带了吗？",pEN="I need those tunics and headbands made, and I also need that piece of wildvine before I will share with you the knowledge of Wild Leather helmets.\n\nHead gear is highly coveted amongst adventurers, whether it be a disarmingly simple headband or a full-covering helmet. The fundamentals of creating valued head gear remain constant, no matter what the cosmetic appearance of the gear is.",c="$c，你成功了！多亏了你，我们又离收集丝质绷带的目标更近一步了。我先把那些绷带储存好再来和你谈谈。",cEN="<class>, you did it! Thanks to you we are another step closer to achieving our goal with silk bandages. I'll get them stored away, and then we can talk more if you like."}
Q[8521]={d="你愿意再次帮我，真是太好了，$c。我们已经收集了$2082w卷丝绸绷带，所以还需要更多。",dEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of silk bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",o="把20卷丝绸绷带带给丹莫罗机场的护士斯通菲尔德。",oEN="Bring 20 silk bandages to the bandage collector.",p="你能再次提供我协助真是太好了，$c。看来我们已经收集了一堆丝质绷带，不过我们还需要更多。$n，你可以再想办法弄另一捆绷带拿来给我吗？联盟和我都会非常感激的。",pEN="It is very kind of you to offer to help me again, <class>. It looks like we've collected a goodly number of the silk bandages we've been tasked with, but we still need more. <name>, is there any way that you could see fit to put together another bundle and return them to me here? The Alliance and I will be most grateful.",c="你真是个无私的人。非常谢谢你对战争的贡献。只有像你这样的人才能让安其拉的成功和失败有所区别。我只希望这些东西已经足够。\n\n再次感谢，$n。",cEN="You are such a selfless person. Thank you very much for your contribution to the war effort. It's people like you that are going to make the difference between success and failure at Ahn'Qiraj. I just hope that all of this will be enough.\n\nThanks again, <name>."}
Q[8523]={d="我们又见面了，来谈些紧急事务，$c。再一次感谢你此前的努力；不是每个人都会如此无私地伸出援手。但还有工作没做完。\n\n$n，你能再弄些符文布绷带带给我吗？",dEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of runecloth bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",o="把20卷符文布绷带带给丹莫罗机场的守夜人月影。",oEN="Bring 20 runecloth bandages to the bandage collector.",p="所以，我们又来谈紧急事务了，$n。再一次感谢你的努力；不是每个人都如此无私。但还有更多工作要做。\n\n$n，你愿意再收集符文布绷带并带回这里给我吗？",pEN="So it is that we come to discuss pressing matters yet again, <class>. Once more I thank you for your previous efforts; it is not everyone who would give so selflessly. But there is still more work to do.\n\n<name>, will you once more collect runecloth bandages and return them to me here?",c="我们走的是一条好路，$n。你是个$g出色的:出色的;工作伙伴。我再次代表整个联盟感谢你的努力。快再来找我谈谈。",cEN="This is a fine road we are traveling together, <name>. You make an excellent working companion. Once more do I give thanks to you for your efforts on behalf of the entire Alliance. Come and talk again with me soon."}
Q[8524]={d="嘿，你好，$g朋友:朋友;！如果我对你说，\"你不觉得士兵们也应该像其他人一样有东西吃吗？\"你肯定会回答\"觉得\"。我百分之一百一十同意！很高兴我们意见一致。你只需要出去钓上一大堆生彩虹鳍鲔，把它们都烤熟，然后带回来给我就行。嗯，好香，好香，我已经在回味了。",dEN="Hey there, friend! If I were to say to you, 'Don't you think that soldiers should have food to eat like anyone else?', you would of course reply, 'yes'. I agree with you 110%! I'm glad we're in accord. All I need for you to do is to head out there, fish up a whole bunch of raw rainbow fin albacore, and then cook it all up and bring it back to me right here. Mmm, mmm, I can taste it already.",o="把20条彩虹鳍鲔带给铁炉堡军事区的滑溜美食家。",oEN="Bring 20 Rainbow Fin Albacore to the food collector.",p="我敢打赌你带着我们之前说的那些彩虹鳍鲔回来了，对吧，$n？",pEN="I'm willing to lay odds that you've returned with all of that rainbow fin albacore we were talking about before, right, <class>?",c="两条给联盟，一条给我；两条给联盟，一条给我。你好啊，$g渔夫:渔妇;，干得漂亮。我看你会成为俱乐部的骄傲。不过看样子我们可能还需要更多彩虹鳍鲔。你何不再出去弄一点回来呢？我已经能听见我的肚子在咕咕叫了。",cEN="Two for the Alliance, one for me, two for the Alliance, one for me. Hey there, fishmonger, excellent work. I can see that you're going to be a real credit to the club. Looks to me like we probably need more of that albacore though. Why don't you head on out and rustle up a mite more. I can hear my stomach rumbling already."}
Q[8525]={d="什么！又是你？我真要惊呆了……只可惜我是个侏儒。准确地说，是滑溜美食家！所以你又回来帮忙了，是吧？好吧，我不能怪你。你不就是喜欢所有那些食物的香味吗？<流口水。\n\n别再闲逛了！出去给我带更多彩虹鳍鲔回来！",dEN="What! You again? Well I'll be a monkey's uncle... except that I'm a gnome. Slicky Gastronome to be precise! So you're back to help out again eh? Well, I can't say as I blame you. Don't you just love the smell of all of that food?\n\nEnough loitering! Get out there and bring me back more rainbow fin albacore!",o="把20条彩虹鳍鲔带给丹莫罗机场的滑溜美食家。",oEN="Bring 20 Rainbow Fin Albacore to the food collector.",p="什么！又是你？好吧，我真要变成猴子的叔叔了……只可惜我是个$r。准确地说，是滑溜美食家！所以你又回来帮忙了，是吧？好吧，我不能怪你。你不就是喜欢所有那些食物的香味吗？<babeando>\n\n别再闲逛了！出去给我带更多彩虹鳍鲔回来！",pEN="What! You again? Well I'll be a monkey's uncle... except that I'm a <race>. Slicky Gastronome to be precise! So you're back to help out again, eh? Well, I can't say as I blame you. Don't you just love the smell of all of that food?\n\nEnough loitering! Get out there and bring me back more rainbow fin albacore!",c="我知道你把它放在你的包包里。你看起来就像是知道$g他:她喜欢什么的样子。尤其是你喜欢讨好我和那些权势。而且你成功了，我保证。\n\n哈哈，好了，我先把这些鱼收好，然后你和我就能谈谈关于收集另外20条鱼的事了。",cEN="I knew that you had it in you, kid. You've got the look of someone who knows what she likes. Specifically that you like pleasing me and the powers that be. And that you have, I guarantee.\n\nHaha, ok, I'll just get these fish properly stashed away, and then you and I can have a little talk concerning you collecting another twenty albacore."}
Q[8526]={d="嘿，最近过得怎么样啊，$c？我看你好像有兴趣帮即将开始的安其拉战争收集食品物资。我爸爸觉得我来这里帮忙是一个学习的好方法。这可是个大错误，我根本不喜欢吃肉。\n\n不管怎么样，如果你愿意的话，请带给我大量的烤迅猛龙肉。显然这是所有士兵都想要的美食。",dEN="Oh, how's it going, <class>? I see that you're interested in maybe gathering up food for the coming war at Ahn'Qiraj? Somehow my dad thought that it would be a good learning experience for me if I were to volunteer to help out here. Big mistake. I don't even like to eat meat.\n\nAnyway, if you feel like it, you could bring me back a lot of roast raptor. Apparently that's what all of the soldiers are going to want.",o="把20份烤迅猛龙肉带给铁炉堡军事区的莎拉·悲伤少女。",oEN="Bring 20 Roast Raptor to the food collector.",p="你拿到所有的烤迅猛龙肉了吗？",pEN="So do you have all of that roast raptor yet?",c="哎呀，这太棒了。谢谢你给我带来这些烤焦的兽肉，$n。我会把它放到那边的堆里。肯定会有人处理的。我想如果你有点时间，也许愿意再给我带些来？",cEN="Gee, that's swell. Thanks for bringing me all of this burnt animal flesh, <class>. I'll just put it onto the pile over there. I'm sure that someone will take care of it. I suppose if you have some time on your hands that you might want to bring me more?"}
Q[8527]={d="嘿，最近过得怎么样啊，$c？我看你好像有兴趣帮即将开始的安其拉战争收集食品物资。我爸爸觉得我来这里帮忙是一个学习的好方法。这可是个大错误，我根本不喜欢吃肉。不管怎么样，如果你愿意的话，请带给我大量的烤迅猛龙肉。显然这是所有士兵都想要的美食。",dEN="Hi again <class>. I can tell you're very excited about all of this. So I suppose you want to bring me another twenty roast raptor. Great. Well you do that. I guess I'll see you when you get back.",o="把20份烤迅猛龙肉带给丹莫罗机场的莎拉·悲伤少女。",oEN="Bring 20 Roast Raptor to the food collector.",p="又见面了，<class>。我看得出你对这一切热情高涨。所以我猜你想再给我带二十份烤迅猛龙肉来。太好了。那你就去吧。我想你回来时我们再见。",pEN="Hi again <class>. I can tell you're very excited about all of this. So I suppose you want to bring me another twenty roast raptor. Great. Well you do that. I guess I'll see you when you get back.",c="哇，你真是个干劲十足的人。光是看着你我都累了。总而言之，联盟感谢你做的一切。我会把你的名字和所做的贡献写在单子上让大家喜欢你。我想你可以等会儿再回来看我们是否需要更多肉，虽然这边的肉已经多的发臭了。",cEN="Wow, you're a real go-getter. You make me tired just looking at you. Anyway, thanks from the Alliance and all that. I'll make sure that all of that dead meat gets packed away. I guess you could check back with me later to see if we still need more of it, though it's starting to stink up the place if you ask me."}
Q[8528]={d="收集烤鱼也许看起来不像什么英雄事迹，但别低估准备工作的价值，年轻的$c。士兵们需要像其他人一样吃饭，而我们的职责就是确保安其拉之战打响时他们什么都不缺。\n\n因此，我正在囤积斑点黄尾鱼，这是一种用途广泛的食粮，耐储存，还能用在许多不同的菜肴里。它也没有其他海水鱼那种腥味。你$g愿意:愿意;在这件事上帮我吗？",dEN="It may not seem heroic to gather up cooked fish, but do not underestimate the value of preparation, young <class>. Soldiers need to eat like anyone else, and we're here to do our part to make sure they have what they need once the war in Ahn'Qiraj commences.\n\nAccordingly, I am stockpiling spotted yellowtail, a versatile source of sustenance that stores well and can be used in many different dishes. It also doesn't have the odor of some other saltwater fish. Are you willing to aid me in this endeavor?",o="把20条斑点黄尾鱼带给铁炉堡军事区的女猎手迅河。",oEN="Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to the food collector.",p="我有信心你很快就会带着我们讨论的斑点黄尾鱼回来。",pEN="I am confident that you are returning so soon with the spotted yellowtail we discussed.",c="谢谢你这份礼物，$n，而且送得如此及时。我们的士兵肯定不会缺吃的了。让我先把这些鱼妥善存放起来，然后如果你$g愿意:愿意;，你我还可以商量第二批。",cEN="Thank you for this gift, <class>, and in such a timely manner as well. Our soldiers will surely not lack for something to eat. Just let me get these fish stored away properly and then you and I can discuss a second haul if you're willing."}
Q[8529]={d="如果你愿意我想派你再去捕一批斑点黄尾鱼，$n。我想你有了第一次的经验，这次捕鱼一定会更快更容易。你愿意吗？",dEN="If you're still willing I'd like to send you back out to bring in another haul of spotted yellowtail, <name>. I'd imagine with the expertise you gained the first time out that this catch should be much faster and easier. Are you game?",o="把20条斑点黄尾鱼带给丹莫罗机场的女猎手迅河。",oEN="Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to the food collector.",p="如果你还$g愿意:愿意;，我想再派你出去带一批斑点黄尾鱼回来，$n。我想有了第一次的经验，这次捕捞应该会快得多、容易得多。你愿意干吗？",pEN="If you're still willing I'd like to send you back out to bring in another haul of spotted yellowtail, <name>. I'd imagine with the expertise you gained the first time out that this catch should be much faster and easier. Are you game?",c="你是联盟$g真正的一员:真正的一员;，$n。你的努力不会被忽视，也不会被辜负。还要谢谢你把这些鱼也烤好了。我会确保它们被妥善存放，然后我得更新我的统计。每一条都让我们离目标更近一步。",cEN="You are a true member of the Alliance, <name>. Your efforts shall not go unnoticed, or unappreciated. And thank you for cooking up the fish as well. I will see to it that they are stored away properly, and then I'll need to update my count. Every one brings us that much closer to catching our goal."}
Q[8532]={d="很高兴你来帮助我们。并不是所有人都能搞清楚我所需要的东西是什么，所以我要确保你不犯错误。我需要的是铜锭，不是铜矿石。我们没有时间自己进行熔炼，希望你可以帮助我们。你可以办到吧，$c？",dEN="So glad that you've decided to help out here. Not everyone would, so I need to make sure you understand what it is that I need. Copper bars, not copper ore. We don't have the time or people to do all of the smelting ourselves, so if you would be so kind as to take care of that, your efforts will be duly noted. Is that something that you can handle, <class>?",o="把20块铜锭带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的矿工克伦威尔。",oEN="Bring 20 Copper Bars to the bar collector at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",p="我希望你带来的是20个铜锭，$c。",pEN="I hope that's the twenty copper bars you have there with you, <class>.",c="这些铜锭很好，谢谢你没有打亮它们。要将它们熔解做成战争要用的东西时，不需要把它们弄得那么漂亮。我会把它们堆放好，也会确定你的名字有被记下。如果你有兴趣帮我另外带20个的话再来和我谈谈。",cEN="These bars will do, and thanks for not shining them. No sense in making them pretty when they're going to be mangled for whatever materiel needs to be built for the war. I'll take care of putting them on the stacks, and I'll make sure that they are put to proper use. Speak to me again if you're interested in bringing in another twenty."}
Q[8533]={d="这么快就回来了？你很快就会成为一名真正的矿工，$c。所以你已经知道该怎么做了；我需要你出去挖一大堆铜矿石，熔炼成锭，然后带回来给我。我知道你有这个能力，问题是你$g愿意:愿意;去做吗？",dEN="Back so soon? You'll be a real miner in no time <class>. So, you already know the drill; I need you to go out, mine up a mess of copper ore, smelt it into bars and bring it back to me here. I know that's something you're capable of, the question is, are you willing?",o="把20块铜锭带给杜隆塔尔的矿工克伦威尔。",oEN="Bring 20 copper bars to the bar collector in Durotar.",p="这么快就回来了？你很快就会成为$g一名:一名;真正的矿工，$c。所以你已经知道该怎么做了；我需要你出去挖一大堆铜矿石，熔炼成锭，然后带回来给我。我知道你有这个能力，问题是你$g愿意:愿意;去做吗？",pEN="Back so soon? You'll be a real miner in no time, <class>. So, you already know the drill; I need you to go out, mine up a mess of copper ore, smelt it into bars and bring it back to me here. I know that's something you're capable of, the question is, are you willing?",c="你又一次向我证明了自己，$n。我会确保这些铜在适当的时候派上用场。不过现在，我得先把这些铜锭码上货盘并清点清楚。如果你还$g有兴致:有兴致;，我大概还需要你帮忙再收集更多铜锭。",cEN="You've proven yourself to me yet again, <class>. I will see to it that this copper is used in due time. For now though, I need to get these copper bars onto the pallet and tallied. If you still feel inclined, I could probably use your help in gathering even more copper bars."}
Q[8534]={d="我们派出了最好的斥候深入异种虫类的巢穴收集情报。艾泽奈尔这几天来一直在监视佐拉虫巢，去找到她，拿回她的书面报告。我们需要这些情报来制定战术，要尽快，$n。",dEN="We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence. Scout Azenel has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Zora for several days now. Find her and obtain a written report. We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, <name>.",o="在佐拉虫巢内找到塞纳里奥斥候艾泽奈尔，然后把佐拉虫巢侦查报告交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着战术任务简报 VI才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Contact Cenarion Scout Azenel inside Hive'Zora and return the Hive'Zora Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",p="你会在佐拉虫巢里找到塞纳里奥斥候艾泽奈尔。快，$n！时间就是金钱。",pEN="You'll find Scout Azenel inside Hive'Zora. Hurry, <name>! Time is of the essence.",c="你的努力获得很大的赞赏，$n。我要立刻显示这些侦察报告，去接你的下一个任务吧。",cEN="Your efforts are greatly appreciated, <name>. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment."}
Q[8535]={d="暮光之锤以及他们所崇拜的元素贵族，对我们希利苏斯的行动构成了可怕的威胁。面对安其拉内部的新敌人，我们绝不能对外部的敌人放松警惕。\n\n找到召唤并消灭一名白霜圣殿骑士的办法，然后去向波尔·野鬃复命。|n",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus. With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.\n\nFind a way to summon and destroy a Hoary Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.",o="设法召唤并击杀深渊公爵，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角复命。",oEN="Summon and slay a Hoary Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Good job, <name>. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8536]={d="暮光之锤和他们所膜拜的元素生物对我们在希利苏斯地区的行动是个不小的威胁。安其拉虫墙内的敌人还在虎视眈眈，所以我们绝对不能对暮光之锤的势力掉以轻心。\n\n想办法召唤并摧毁一名土色圣殿骑士，然后向鲍尔·蛮鬃汇报。",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus. With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.\n\nFind a way to summon and destroy an Earthen Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.",o="召唤并杀死一名土色圣殿骑士，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的鲍尔·蛮鬃复命。你还必须随身带着战术任务简报 III才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Summon and slay an Earthen Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Good job, <name>. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8537]={d="暮光之锤和深渊议会之间的联系看来比我们想象的还要意义重大。\n\n根据可靠情报，那个被称作微风公爵的元素领主将要策动暮光之锤对塞纳里奥要塞实施一次大规模的攻击。设法把他引诱出来，然后击杀他。",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus. With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.\n\nFind a way to summon and destroy a Crimson Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.",o="设法召唤并击杀微风公爵，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角复命。",oEN="Summon and slay a Crimson Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Good job, <name>. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8538]={d="暮光之锤与深渊议会之间的联系，其重要性远超我们此前的预想。\n\n我们相信，被称为深渊公爵的元素贵族是组织暮光之锤信徒的主要力量之一。找到把四位深渊公爵引诱到我们位面的办法，并消灭他们！\n\n你在以往任务中展现的忠诚与才干，让我们选中你来执行这项特别任务。我们确信你会成功。",dEN="The links between the Twilight's Hammer and the Abyssal Council are proving to be more important than we had expected.\n\nWe believe the elemental nobles known as the Abyssal Dukes are one of the primary force organizing the Twilight's Hammer cultists. Find a way to lure the four Abyssal Dukes into our plane of existence and destroy them!\n\nYour dedication and prowess in past assignments have led us to choose you for this particular assignment. We are certain you will succeed in this endeavor.",o="设法召唤并击杀四个深渊圣殿骑士，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角复命。",oEN="Find a way to summon and slay the Duke of Cynders, the Duke of Fathoms, the Duke of Zephyrs and the Duke of Shards and report back to Commander Mar'alith in Cenarion Hold. You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",p="你的任务完成了吗，$n？",pEN="Is your task done yet, <name>?",c="你为我们完成了一项伟大的任务，$n。你消除了对我们而言相当严重的威胁。在些表达我深深的谢意。",cEN="You have achieved a great accomplishment for our cause today, <name>. You've vanquished some of our most powerful enemies. For that I greatly commend you."}
Q[8539]={d="我们需要援军进攻佐拉虫巢。你的主要目标是那些佐拉雌蝎，当你的任务完成之后就去向指挥官玛尔利斯报告。",dEN="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora. You have been selected to target Hive'Zora hive sisters. Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="击杀30只佐拉雌蝎，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带着作战任务简报 V才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Hive Sisters and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="干得漂亮，$n。你是$g一位:一位;当之无愧的盟友。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. You're a worthy ally."}
Q[8540]={d="塞纳里奥城堡守卫的坐骑军师缺少精制秘银战靴。取得一批战靴并立即送给塞纳里奥城堡的维斯·库鲁兹队长。",dEN="The mounted division of the Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of ornate mithril boots. Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="将3双精制秘银战靴带到希利苏斯给塞纳里奥城堡的守卫队长维斯·库鲁兹。你还必须将后勤任务简报 II带去才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="很好。我们正需要这些，$n。做得好。",cEN="Excellent. We were in need of these, <name>. Good work."}
Q[8541]={d="塞纳里奥要塞的卫兵急需磨刀石。去收集足够的磨刀石，然后立即把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹队长。",dEN="The Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of grinding stones. Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="把磨刀石交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹。",oEN="Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="很好。我们正需要这些，$n。做得好。",cEN="Excellent. We were in need of these, <name>. Good work."}
Q[8542]={d="Lok'tar，$r，你肯定已经知道我们要在安其拉和那些虫子开战了。但首先酋长决定我们得做一件叫做\"准备\"的事。虽然我更愿意磨利武器、锻造护甲，但我很自豪被选中负责这里的锡锭收集。可没有你的帮助我办不到。\n\n所以我需要你出去制作锡锭，然后带回来给我。我想我需要多到数不清的量。|n",dEN="Lok'tar, <race>, I'm sure you already know that we're going to war at Ahn'Qiraj with the insects. But first the Warchief has decided that we're going to do something called 'prepare'. Though I'd rather be sharpening weapons and hammering armor into shape, I'm proud to have been chosen to be in charge of tin bar collection here. But I cannot do that without your help.\n\nSo I need you to go out and make tin bars and bring them back to me here. I think I'm going to need more than I can count.",o="把20块锡锭带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的蛮兵莫格。",oEN="Bring 20 Tin Bars to the bar collector.",p="为了你好，我希望你有那些锡锭，$c！",pEN="The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!",c="嗯，我想这应该是正确的锡锭数字。别想蒙骗我，$c！清点数量让我感到头疼。现在去收集一样的数量来，但要快一点！",cEN="You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage."}
Q[8543]={d="很好，我看的出来你对战争很认真。不过我对战争要开始有点急躁，所以如果你不快点把东西带来我就会生气。或许我可以直接拿你开刀。\n\n哈！还是不要好了，因为这样谁会帮我带锡锭来呢？",dEN="Very good, I see that you are serious about the war. I'm a little edgy waiting for it to start though, which means I'm going to get angry if you don't start bringing in the goods faster. Maybe I can just practice on you instead.\n\nHar! Maybe not, 'cuz then who would bring me back the tin bars?",o="把20块锡锭带给杜隆塔尔的蛮兵莫格。",oEN="Bring 20 Tin Bars to the bar collector.",p="很好，我看得出你对这场战争是认真的。不过我有点焦急地等着它开始，我相信你也是，$n。它开始的时候将会无比荣耀。部落驰骋在希利苏斯的沙漠上，手执武器，一头冲向虫群。那一天所有人都将获得无上荣耀！\n\n哈！但首先我们需要更多锡锭。奇怪的是，这么小的东西竟能带来这么大的不同，你不觉得吗？",pEN="Very good, I see that you are serious about the war. I'm a little edgy waiting for it to start though, as I'm sure you are as well, <class>. It will be glorious when it begins. The Horde running over the sands of the Silithus desert, weapons in hand, charging headlong into the insect masses. Great honor will be had that day by all!\n\nHar! But first we need more tin bars. Funny how such a small thing may make such a huge difference, don't you think?",c="（兽人语）你好，$n。你带来的锡锭让我和部落都感到荣耀。我会把它们堆放好并用它们制作东西。然后一切都准备好的时候我们就会上战场，教教渺小的联盟如何打仗。\n\n现在帮我带更多的锡锭回来！",cEN="Throm'ka, <name>. You honor me and the Horde with your tin bars. I will put them on the stack and then they will come and make things from them. And then when that is all done we will go to war and show the puny Alliance how to fight the bugs.\n\nNow bring me back more tin bars!"}
Q[8544]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个夜晚塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，凡人。希望它们能给你需要的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8545]={d="$C，战争即将到来，我们所能做的就是准备作战。在这方面我们可以互相帮助。你看，他们派我来负责收集秘银锭，以供制作我们所需的东西。现在我需要更多秘银锭！\n\n那么，我希望你可以帮我去找来一些秘银矿石，然后熔化成锭。你可以做到这些吧？",dEN="<class>, the war it is comin' and the only thing we can do is prepare for it. That be where you and I can help each other, mon. Ya see, they put me in charge of collectin' all the mithril bars we be needin' ta build for all the things we gonna need. An I still be needin' more!\n\nSo, I be hopin' that you can get out there an mine us up some mithril, then smelt it into bars. Sound like something you can do for us?",o="把20块秘银锭带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的军士长特'凯拉。",oEN="Bring 20 Mithril Bars to the bar collector.",p="如果能拥有所有安其拉之战需要的秘银锭就好了。这就是你回来的原因吗？你把我的秘银锭带来了？",pEN="It sure would be nice to be havin' all of the mithril bars that we be needin' for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Is that why you be back, mon? You got my bars?",c="这对你我都是个好开端，$n。又是二十块秘银锭，我可以把它们码上堆、从清单上划掉。这些都会被好好用来制作战争物资。\n\n一定要再来看我，因为你知道吗，看样子我们还会需要更多秘银锭。",cEN="This be a good start for you an me, <class>. That be another twenty mithril bars that I can be puttin' on the stacks an checkin' off of the list. It all gonna be put to good use makin' the war materiel.\n\nBe makin' sure that you check back in with me 'cuz you know it be lookin' like we gonna need even more of those mithril bars."}
Q[8546]={d="<class>，战争就要来了，我们唯一能做的就是为它做准备。这正是你我互相帮忙的地方，兄弟。你看，他们让我负责收集我们建造各种所需之物时要用到的全部秘银锭。而我还需要更多！\n\n所以，我希望你能出去替我们挖些秘银，然后熔炼成锭。听起来是你能为我们做的事吗？",dEN="<class>, the war it is comin' and the only thing we can do is prepare for it. That be where you and I can help each other, mon. Ya see, they put me in charge of collectin' all the mithril bars we be needin' ta build for all the things we gonna need. An I still be needin' more!\n\nSo, I be hopin' that you can get out there an mine us up some mithril, then smelt it into bars. Sound like something you can do for us?",o="把20块秘银锭带给锭子收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Mithril Bars to the bar collector.",c="做得好，$n！另外20个秘银锭，让我们离目标又更近一步了，也让我们获得更多战场材料。我会提起你的名字让部落知道你正尽你的职责帮忙。如果你有其它的秘银锭，记得要拿来这里给我。",cEN="That be good work <name>! Another twenty bars get us that much closer to the goal, and get us more war materiel. I see to it they get put away. And if you get another stack of mithril bars mon, you make sure to be bringin' them here to me."}
Q[8547]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为特别感谢你购买《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼品券交给猎鹰wing广场的玛希拉·晨星。你会得到一份礼物：一个小伙伴，陪你一同踏上追寻冒险与荣耀的旅程。\n\n再次感谢，祝你在《魔兽世界》中玩得愉快！",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Marsilla Dawnstar in Falconwing Square. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将鹰翼广场礼品券交给鹰翼广场的玛希尔拉·晨星。",oEN="Bring the Falconwing Square Gift Voucher to Marsilla Dawnstar in Falconwing Square.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是$g位:位;特别的英雄，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送给你这些独特礼物中的一件！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[8548]={d="$n，你在与敌人作战、提供后勤补给和执行战略任务之后获得的徽章并不只是用来炫耀的。\n\n希望你还保留着它们。作为对你的鼓励，我想要奖励你一些只有塞纳里奥议会最亲近的盟友才能获得的东西。",dEN="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, <name>.\n\nYou'd be wise to hold on to them. As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.",o="把5枚作战徽章、3枚后勤徽章和7枚战术徽章交给塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到友善声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",p="你完成必要的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。请代表塞纳里奥议会收下这个。你绝对配得上它，$g朋友:朋友;！",cEN="Great work, <name>. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!"}
Q[8549]={d="据说每一代人都需要面对一次决定性的试炼。恐怕安其拉之战将是我们这一辈人所要经历的残酷考验。我们要做好准备，了解自己的实力究竟如何。\n\n我在这里志愿帮忙收集宁神花，我们会用它们制作战争所需的药水。我希望你来这里是为了帮助我们，如果是这样的话，那么我需要你帮我带回大量的这种草药。你会帮助我吗，$c？",dEN="It is said that every generation must face a defining trial. I fear the Ahn'Qiraj War will be the crucible in which our mettle is tested. So we prepare, and in so doing find what we are made of.\n\nI have volunteered to help the Horde by gathering as much peacebloom as possible, so that it can be made into potions for the war. I hope that you are here to lend me your aid. If so, then I need you to bring back to me a good quantity of the herb. Will you assist me, <class>?",o="把20株宁神花带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的草药师普露玛·丁娜。",oEN="Bring 20 Peacebloom to the herb collector.",p="现在去吧，$n。去寻找，$n。",pEN="Go now, <class>. Seek out <name>.",c="我们的努力让我们离战争越来越近。谢谢你努力帮忙收集这些宁神花。我保证它们会有很好的用途，而且你的贡献会被大家所认同的，$n。如果你还有意愿的话，请带更多的花回来给我。在那之前，愿大地之母指引你。",cEN="This was no easy task, yet you have excelled. But do not be too quick to think you have impressed me, <name>."}
Q[8550]={d="好吧，看来我还需要更多宁神花。我想你上次帮我采集的地方应该还能找到。我们越早拿到，就能越早对安其拉的势力发起进攻。\n\n你会再来帮我们吗，<class>？",dEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Peacebloom. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",o="把20株宁神花带给草药收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Peacebloom to the herb collector.",p="又见面了，<name>。很高兴你愿意再一次和我谈起我们对宁神花永无止境的需求。战争事业仍在继续，随之而来的还有我们为即将到来的战斗制作药剂和合剂。你会再帮我们吗，<class>？我需要和之前一样多的宁神花，所以如果你能采集并带回这里，我会非常感激。当然，如果你已经带在身上，我现在就很乐意收下。",pEN="Hello again, <name>. I am glad that you wish to speak to me once more concerning our neverending need for peacebloom. The war effort continues, and with it our production of potions and elixirs to aid in the battles to come. Will you help us again, <class>? I am in need of the same amount of peacebloom as before, so if you can gather it up and return it to me here I would be most grateful. Of course, if you already have it on your person, I will be more than happy to accept it from you now.",c="谢谢你持续不断的努力，$n。你用无私的奉献为自己和祖先带来了$g巨大的荣耀:巨大的荣耀;，而且所有人都会知道！我会把这些草药收好，让它们在需要之前保持新鲜。你再一次展现了部落最真实的精神——战胜一切的奋斗，以及我们能够携手做到这一点的承诺。",cEN="Thank you for your continued efforts, <name>. You bring great honor to yourself and your ancestors with your selfless giving, and it will be known to all! I will store these herbs away so that they stay fresh until they are needed. Once again you reveal the truest spirit of the Horde, the struggle to overcome and the promise that we can work together to do so."}
Q[8551]={d="我过去在一条专跑从这里到卡利姆多的棘齿城的航线上干过。我是个很优秀也很有名望的船长。\n\n直到……\n\n那些该死的海巨人毁了我的生活！他们打沉了我的船，杀光了我的水手，把我丢在一条救生艇上，让我漂回了藏宝海湾。还有，其中一个名叫高拉什的巨人还把我的箱子给偷走了，他说要拿这东西当鼻烟盒，简直是神经病！\n\n我听说有人看见高拉什最近在东边的海岸一带闲逛。找到他，把我的箱子给抢回来！快去，你会得到一位船长的敬意的。",dEN="I used to sail a ship from here all the way to Ratchet, in Kalimdor. I was a successful captain with a sterling reputation.\n\nUntil...\n\nThose cursed sea giants ruined me! They smashed my ship, killed my crew, and set me on a lifeboat to Booty Bay. And one of the giants, Gorlash, stole my Captain's Chest. He said he wanted it for a snuffbox. The nerve!\n\nI hear Gorlash wanders the coast east of here. Find him and get back my chest! Do that, and you'll have earned a captain's gratitude.",o="将斯莫特的箱子交给藏宝海湾的海克拜瑞·斯莫特。",oEN="Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.",p="你好啊，$n！你找到高拉什了吗？那箱子是我最喜欢的，里面有个小夹层，我最值钱的宝贝都藏在里面！",pEN="Ahoy, <name>! Did you find Gorlash? That chest was my favorite, and it has a hidden compartment that held my greatest treasures!",c="你找到它啦！啊，今天我太高兴啦！谢谢你，$n。得到这个箱子之后，我内心里的愤懑也就平息了。\n\n但我还是要复仇……",cEN="You found it! Oh happy day, this is! Thank you, <name>. Getting back my chest cools some of the fire in me.\n\nBut my revenge isn't complete..."}
Q[8552]={d="这条精美的腰带下摆绣着字母\"HS\"。",dEN="This fine sash has the letters \"HS\" embroidered along its hem.",o="将刺着字母的腰带还给他的主人。",oEN="Return the Monogrammed Sash to its owner.",p="你好。你有什么事吗？",pEN="Hello. Do you have business with me?",c="你找回我的腰带了吗？那么……你一定杀死了那个海巨人莫克拉什。万岁！\n\n我很高兴那个卑鄙的恶棍死了。莫克拉什是砸毁我的船、杀害我船员的三个海巨人之一。\n\n三次。\n\n你是$g一位:一位;极有价值的$c，$n。",cEN="You recovered my sash? Then... you must have killed Mok'rash the sea giant! Hooray!\n\nI'm glad the scurvy villain's dead - Mok'rash was one of three sea giants who smashed my ships and killed my crew.\n\nThree times.\n\nYou are a <class> of worth, <name>."}
Q[8553]={d="我的第一条船被那些海巨人们搞沉了之后，我只好买了第二艘，而且给它起名为“斯莫特的复仇”。我为它配备了新的装备和船员，并出发去寻找那些该死的巨人。我找到了他们，但……他们又一次击败了我们。他们把“斯莫特的复仇”号给打成了碎片，船员也几乎被他们杀光了，但那帮混蛋却把我丢在了一条救生艇上，让我一个人漂了回来。\n\n这次，那些海巨人中的另外一个偷了我的弯刀。\n\n到奈古拉什那里去把我的佩刀给抢回来！\n\n去和斯普罗格谈谈吧。他本来是“斯莫特的复仇”号上的厨子，沉船的时候他也幸存了下来，我想他能帮你们找到那些巨人。",dEN="After I lost my first ship to those giants, I bought another. Named Smotts' Revenge, I filled it with supplies and crew, and set out to find the villains. I found them, but...they beat me. They smashed Smotts' Revenge, killed my second crew and set me on another lifeboat.\n\nThis time another of the giants, Negolash, stole my cutlass.\n\nFace Negolash and bring me my cutlass!\n\nSpeak with Sprogger. He was my cook on the Smotts' Revenge, and survived the last attack. He can help you find the giant.",o="与斯普罗格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sprogger.",c="你好你好，$n。船长大人跟我说你要去找奈古拉什的晦气，呵呵，是真的吗？",cEN="Hello hello, <name>. Captain told me you're going after Negolash, eh?"}
Q[8554]={d="奈古拉什总是一副随时准备把一切都吞下去充饥的样子。\n\n那些巨人袭击我们的船的时候，奈古拉什直接冲向了我的厨房，不过他可不像其他巨人那样喜欢吃人。奈古拉什要的是酒……还有我秘制的烧烤秃鹰翅膀。嘿，这可都是我的拿手菜，我当年可是跑到荒芜之地才弄到这食谱的！\n\n如果你想把奈古拉什给引出来，只要用点酒再加上一碟烤翅就行啦。把这些东西放进我们当初丢在东南边海岸上的救生艇里，然后你就等着奈古拉什闻到食物的味儿乖乖上钩吧！",dEN="Negolash is a hungry giant.\n\nWhen the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants. Negolash wanted wine...and my Barbecued Buzzard Wings. They're my specialty, and I had to go all the way to the Badlands for the recipe!\n\nIf you want to lure the giant, then get some wine and a heap of buzzard wings. Put them in our old lifeboat, southeast of here along the coast. When Negolash smells all that food, he'll come for sure!",o="将10块烧烤秃鹰翅膀和5瓶密林葡萄酒带到斯莫特船长的救生艇上去。\n\n然后杀死奈古拉什，将斯莫特的弯刀交给荆棘谷的斯莫特船长。",oEN="Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.\n\nKill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.",p="把我的弯剑抢回来没有，$n？",pEN="Did you get my cutlass, <name>?",c="你从尼格拉什那里拿回了我的弯刀！$n，我简直不敢相信我有这么好的运气！遇见你让我的运气变好了，绝对变好了！\n\n谢谢你！如果哪天我再弄到一条船，而你想出海航行，你就是我的$g贵宾:贵宾;！",cEN="You got my cutlass from Negolash! I can't believe my fortune, <name>! Meeting you has turned my luck to the better, make no mistake there!\n\nThank you! And if I ever get a new ship and you're looking to sail the seas, you would be my honored guest."}
Q[8555]={d="伊兰尼库斯、瓦拉斯塔兹和艾索雷葛斯……毫无疑问，凡人，你听说过这些龙。那么，他们曾作为我们世界的守望者扮演过如此有影响力的角色，绝非巧合。",dEN="Eranikus, Vaelastrasz, and Azuregos... No doubt you know of these dragons, mortal. It is no coincidence, then, that they have played such influential roles as watchers of our world.",c="伊兰尼库斯、瓦拉斯塔兹、和艾索雷葛斯……你的确知道这些龙，凡人。这不是巧合，他们看守我们的世界，扮演着如此有影响力的角色。\n\n不幸的是（有部分也要怪我涉世未深）不论是上古诸神的密探或者称他们为朋友的背叛者，每个守卫都沦陷了。其程度只加深了我对你的种族的不信任。\n\n找到他们……$r，做好最坏的准备吧。",cEN="Eranikus, Vaelastrasz, and Azuregos... No doubt you know of these dragons, mortal. It is no coincidence, then, that they have played such influential roles as watchers of our world.\n\nUnfortunately (and my own naivety is partially to blame) whether by agents of the Old Gods or betrayal by those that would call them friend, each guardian has fallen to tragedy. The extent of which has fueled my own distrust towards your kind.\n\nSeek them out... And <race>, prepare yourself for the worst."}
Q[8556]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <class>.",o="将1枚其拉将领戒指、2个柔光雕像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Lambent Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable."}
Q[8557]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉军用披风、2个玛瑙雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8558]={d="其拉虫人和他们的奴仆所使用的装备是由最珍稀宝贵的物品制作而成的，包括古代巨兽的骨头，大地最深处的宝石，以及最坚硬纯净的金属。\n\n这些其拉神器让我有一种冲动，想要用一些这样的材料来锻炼我的技艺。向塞纳里奥议会证明你的忠诚吧，$n，我会用最好的其拉虫人材料帮你制作一把强大的武器。",dEN="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.\n\nJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces. Prove your allegiance to the Circle, <name>, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.",o="将1件其拉尖刺刀柄、2个雪白雕像、5个水晶甲虫和5个岩石甲虫交给希利苏斯的守望者哈尔洛。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇拜声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Alabaster Idols, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Stone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你把我要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the components I require, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。这是一把大师级的剑柄……平衡感完美无缺。\n\n拿走你的武器，$n。满怀信心地挥舞它，击败我们的敌人！",cEN="You've done well, <class>. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.\n\nTake your weapon, <name>. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!"}
Q[8559]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个战争塑像、5个象牙甲虫和5个黄金甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of War, 5 Ivory Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。你已经证明自己不是$g一位:一位;普通的$g凡人:凡人;。\n\n我把这些交给你，相信它们会助你碾碎邪恶的其拉虫人。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.\n\nI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji."}
Q[8560]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把奥罗的外皮、2个死亡塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the components I require, <name>?",c="太好了……这块虫的皮肤会是很棒的保护层。和我们在路上摧毁的其拉材料结合，这会是个令人畏惧的护甲。愿它协助你面对里面难以言喻的恐怖。",cEN="Yes... the worm's hide will make for an excellent protective layer. Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we've destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor. May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!"}
Q[8561]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克尼拉斯的头饰、2个太阳塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你有带我要的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="你成功了！双子皇帝的窃语已经停止。\n\n收下这个作为奖励。光是看到它，就会让其拉虫人的心中充满恐惧……它会让他们想起自己陨落的首领，以及$g那位:那位;杀死他们的凡人。",cEN="You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.\n\nTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them."}
Q[8562]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个战争塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of War, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.",c="我没指望你能从这次尝试中活着回来，$n。\n\n你完成的命运，比大多数不朽存在的都更伟大。\n\n杀死克苏恩，你不仅拯救了整个艾泽拉斯，还改变了远超你理解范围的宇宙事件的走向。\n\n收下这件胸甲，作为荣耀的象征，也是你行为将带来之重负的象征。\n\n愿它的力量在你面临的挑战中助你一臂之力，$g弑神者:弑神者;！",cEN="I did not expect you to return from your attempt, <name>.\n\nYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.\n\nBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.\n\nAccept this breastplate as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.\n\nMay its power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!"}
Q[8572]={d="$n，你在与敌人作战、提供后勤补给和执行战略任务之后获得的徽章并不只是用来炫耀的。\n\n希望你还保留着它们。作为对你的鼓励，我想要奖励你一些只有塞纳里奥议会最亲近的盟友才能获得的东西。",dEN="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, <name>.\n\nYou'd be wise to hold on to them. As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.",o="把7枚塞纳里奥作战徽章、4枚塞纳里奥后勤徽章和4枚塞纳里奥战术徽章带给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你还必须与塞纳里奥议会的声望达到尊敬，才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",p="你完成必要的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。请代表塞纳里奥议会收下这个。你绝对配得上它，$g朋友:朋友;！",cEN="Great work, <name>. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!"}
Q[8573]={d="$n，你在与敌人作战、提供后勤补给和执行战略任务之后获得的徽章并不只是用来炫耀的。\n\n希望你还保留着它们。作为对你的鼓励，我想要奖励你一些只有塞纳里奥议会最亲近的盟友才能获得的东西。",dEN="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, <name>.\n\nYou'd be wise to hold on to them. As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.",o="把15枚塞纳里奥作战徽章、20枚塞纳里奥后勤徽章、20枚塞纳里奥战术徽章和1枚塞纳留斯印记带给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你还必须与塞纳里奥议会的声望达到崇拜，才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",p="你完成必要的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。请代表塞纳里奥议会收下这个。你绝对配得上它，$g朋友:朋友;！",cEN="Great work, <name>. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!"}
Q[8574]={d="$n，你在与敌人作战、提供后勤补给和执行战略任务之后获得的徽章并不只是用来炫耀的。\n\n希望你还保留着它们。作为对你的鼓励，我想要奖励你一些只有塞纳里奥议会最亲近的盟友才能获得的东西。",dEN="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show, <name>.\n\nYou'd be wise to hold on to them. As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.",o="把15枚作战徽章、20枚后勤徽章、17枚战术徽章和1枚雷姆洛斯印记交给塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",p="你完成必要的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, <name>.",c="干得好，$n。请代表塞纳里奥议会收下这个。你绝对配得上它，$g朋友:朋友;！",cEN="Great work, <name>. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!"}
Q[8575]={d="<你无法理解这上面的字。你甚至不知道这些文字是什么语言！>",dEN="You cannot understand a single word on this ledger. You don't even know what language it is written in!",o="把魔法账本交给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安。",oEN="Deliver Azuregos's Magical Ledger to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="喔！魔法跳动的东西！是给我的吗？",pEN="Ooooh! Magical pulsing thingy! For me?",c="<纳里安积极地检视字母。>\n\n太特别了，$r！这是什么？我完全看不懂龙语。",cEN="<Narain eagerly examines the letter.>\n\nOutstanding, <race>! What is it? I can't read a lick of Draconic."}
Q[8576]={d="先做最要紧的事！我们得弄清楚艾索雷葛斯在这本账簿里写了什么。",dEN="First things first! We need to figure out what Azuregos wrote in this ledger.",c="先做最要紧的事，$n！我们需要弄清楚艾索雷葛斯在这本账簿里写了什么。\n\n你说他让你做一个奥金鱼漂，而这个就是图纸？奇怪，他居然用龙语写。那头老山羊明知道我看不懂这种鬼画符。\n\n如果这玩意儿要管用，我需要我的占卜护目镜、一只五百磅重的鸡，还有\"龙语入门\"第二卷。不一定要按这个顺序。",cEN="First things first, <name>! We need to figure out what Azuregos wrote in this ledger.\n\nYou say that he's told you to make an arcanite buoy and that this is the schematic? Strange that he would write this in Draconic. That old goat knows I can't read this nonsense.\n\nIf this is going to work, I'm going to need my scrying goggles, a five hundred pound chicken and volume II of \"Draconic for Dummies.\" Not necessarily in that order."}
Q[8577]={d="如果我要翻译东西的话，就得戴上我的占卜眼镜。不幸的，很久以前，我的眼镜就被我的前任死党给偷走了，他就是斯图沃尔。他把我打翻在地，然后拿走了眼镜，把我留在了这里。\n\n在我忠实的水晶球的帮助下，我现在找到他了！他要么就在银松森林的格雷迈恩之墙，要么就在遍地传送门的外域，那里现在到处都是燃烧军团的家伙。你要追踪到他，然后把我的眼镜拿回来，$n！",dEN="If I am to translate anything, I will need my scrying goggles. Unfortunately, those were stolen quite some time ago by my ex-best friend forever, Stewvul. He broke my heart in five places and then left me here to rot.\n\nWith the help of my trusty crystal ball, I've isolated his whereabouts to either the Greymane Wall in Silverpine or what appears to be a portal world in the Outland that is currently being overrun by the Burning Legion. You're going to have to track him down and get my goggles back, <name>!",o="纳瑞安要你找到他的前任死党斯图沃尔，从他那里拿回从纳瑞安那里偷走的占卜眼镜。",oEN="Narain Soothfancy wants you to find his ex-best friend forever (BFF), Stewvul, and take back the scrying goggles that Stewvul stole from him.",c="真不敢相信他竟找到了我。我还以为我在外域时就与他走失了。我不会回去那里的，$r！不会，绝对不会！我受够了当他兼职的好朋友和全职的佣人。",cEN="I can't believe he found me. I thought for sure that I'd lost him when I was in the Outland. I'm not going back there, <race>! No way, no how! I'm through being his part time best friend forever and full time slave."}
Q[8578]={d="<你听到箱子里面传来一个声音。>\n\n你只需要他的占卜眼镜？很好！这不是问题……给我一分钟……嘿！该死……在哪里！\n\n好吧，我这里有一些坏消息，还有一些更坏的消息。坏消息是我把眼镜给弄丢了。更坏的消息是，我是上个星期在熔火之心里晃悠的时候把它给弄丢的。是的，熔火之心……我想这不是我能搞定的了！再见！",dEN="<You hear a sigh of relief escape the crate.>\n\nYou just want his scrying goggles? Great! That will be no problem... Just give me a minute to... Hey! Where the... Dagnabbit!\n\nWell, there's some bad news and some worse news. The bad news is that I lost the goggles. The worse news is that I lost them when I was nosing around in the Molten Core last month. Yep, the Molten Core... I guess that concludes our business! Bye!",o="找到纳瑞安的占卜眼镜。",oEN="Find Narain's Scrying Goggles and return them to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="熔火之心啊？我希望我的护目镜还完好如初！",pEN="The Molten Core, eh? I hope my goggles are still in one piece!",c="太出色了！现在，我把那只五百磅重的鸡和\"龙语入门\"第二卷放哪儿了？？？啊，还有这个，是你辛苦工作的报酬！",cEN="Outstanding! Now where did I put that 500 pound chicken and Volume II of \"Draconic For Dummies???\" Oh, and here's a little something for all your hard work!"}
Q[8580]={d="呃，$c。叫你来！部落认为安其拉之战的准备需要很多火焰花。那些小花能派上什么好用的场吗？能给联盟的蒸汽坦克当燃料吗？谁知道呢？佩勒奇奇不知道！\n\n不过佩勒奇奇知道这个……他知道你会帮他弄来很多火焰花，是吧，兄弟？",dEN="The Fireboom, <class>, is a reagent in a great many potions, elixirs and oils, some of which will be of use to us at Ahn'Qiraj. We're going to need to create an immense number of those potions for the war effort. And I'm going to experiment to find more uses for the Firebloom as well. But to do all of that I'm going to need a great quantity of the flower.\n\nThat's where you come in. Go out into the field and collect up as many Fireblooms as you can. Is this something that you are willing to do for us?",o="把20株火焰花带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的蝙蝠骑士佩勒奇奇。",oEN="Bring 20 Firebloom to the herb collector.",p="你不想让比雷凯基生气吧。要让比雷凯基高兴，你就得快速地带给他很多的火焰花。",pEN="Are you done collecting those samples? We could lose Noggle any minute now!",c="祈祷吧，朋友！希望我们能救回诺格！",cEN="Cross your fingers, friend! Here's to hoping we can save Noggle!"}
Q[8581]={d="呃，<class>。叫你来！部落认为安其拉之战的准备需要很多火焰花。那些小花能派上什么好用的场吗？能给联盟的蒸汽坦克当燃料吗？谁知道呢？佩勒奇奇不知道！\n\n不过佩勒奇奇知道这个……他知道你会帮他弄来很多火焰花，是吧，兄弟？",dEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Firebloom. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",o="把20株火焰花带给草药收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Firebloom to the herb collector.",p="佩勒奇奇知道你是来帮忙的。带来很多火焰花，让他非常高兴。佩勒奇奇也许能用火焰花做大炸弹。等战争来的时候，骑着他的蝙蝠飞到安其拉上空，把它们扔到虫子头上。但佩勒奇奇需要更多火焰花，<class>！\n\n你要给佩勒奇奇弄来那些火焰花，现在就要快。至少带回来和上次一样多，佩勒奇奇就满意了。",pEN="Pele'keiki know you come to help. Bring many firebloom and make him very happy. Pele'keiki might make big bombs with firebloom. Drop them on insects from his bat over Ahn'Qiraj when war come. But Pele'keiki need more firebloom, <class>!\n\nYou gonna bring Pele'keiki that firebloom, real quick now. Come back with at least as much as last time, and Pele'keiki be pleased.",c="这不是开玩笑吧，$n？你这么快就带来火焰花了？佩勒奇奇现在就数，兄弟！你让佩勒奇奇太高兴了，他要告诉所有人，$n是最好的火焰花收集者！佩勒奇奇等不及战争开始了。现在我们要把希利苏斯的天空彻底点亮，是吧，兄弟？！",cEN="This no joke, <class>? You bring Pele'keiki firebloom that fast? Pele'keiki count them up right now, mon! You makin' Pele'keiki so happy, he be tellin' everyone, <name> best firebloom collector ever! Pele'keiki can't wait for war to start. Now we really light up the sky over Silithus, right, bruddah?!"}
Q[8582]={d="紫莲花，$c，是许多上好药剂、合剂和油脂的成分，其中一些会在安其拉对我们有用。为战争准备，我们得制作数量庞大的这类药剂。而且我还要试验紫莲花的更多用途。但要做这些，我需要大量的这种花。\n\n这就该你上场了。出去到野外，尽可能多地采集紫莲花。你$g愿意:愿意;为我们做这件事吗？",dEN="The purple lotus, <class>, is a reagent in a great many potions, elixirs and oils, some of which will be of use to us at Ahn'Qiraj. We're going to need to create an immense number of those potions for the war effort. And I'm going to experiment to find more uses for the lotus as well. But to do all of that I'm going to need a great quantity of the flower.\n\nThat's where you come in. Go out into the field and collect up as many purple lotuses as you can. Is this something that you are willing to do for us?",o="把20株紫莲花带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的药剂师杰泽尔。",oEN="Bring 20 Purple Lotus to the herb collector.",p="你已经带着我要的紫莲花回来了吗，$c？你一定得尽快做好这件事，否则我这里要做的事全是空谈。",pEN="Have you found the Ambassador, <name>? Is he dead?\n\nWe cannot afford to allow the Scourge to take a foothold on Kalimdor. They are enough of a threat to our own borders to have to deal with them on two fronts.\n\nThe only optimistic sign from the events you've told me about is that the crone seemed uncorrupted. She must know deep in her spirit that the Scourge may bring great power, but that the Barrens would not truly be hers if she were to agree to their deal.",c="值得表扬的努力，$c。我会测试这些样本找出它们适合的用途并记下你的贡献。这些紫莲花在我使用之前要先好好储藏起来。至于你，如果你还有空的话我还需要更多的紫莲花。等一会儿再回来找我。",cEN="Good. Well done, <class>.\n\nNow that Malcin is dead, we can at least know that the Scourges advances will be halted. The Dark Lady thanks you for your efforts and wishes to reward you with a gift.\n\nAlthough we do not know the extent of the Scourges influence within the Downs, I am sure we will discover their plots soon enough."}
Q[8583]={d="好吧，看来我还需要更多紫莲花。我想你上次帮我采集的地方应该还能找到。我们越早拿到，就能越早对安其拉的势力发起进攻。\n\n你会再来帮我们吗，<class>？",dEN="Ok, so it looks like I still need more Purple Lotus. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nYou gonna help us out again <class>?",o="把20株紫莲花带给草药收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Purple Lotus to the herb collector.",c="一流而精准的工作，$n。你的勤勉$g值得称赞:值得称赞;，你的迅速也一样。我会亲自确保这些紫莲花一点都不浪费。\n\n再次感谢你，如果你再找到紫莲花，一定要尽快带给我。",cEN="Excellent and precise work, <name>. Your diligence is to be commended, as is your celerity. I will personally see to it that none of these purple lotus go to waste.\n\nThank you again, and should you come by more purple lotus do not hesitate to bring them to me with utmost haste."}
Q[8584]={d="听着，有件事你必须知道：永远、永远不要问我在做什么生意！我打交道的东西你根本不可能理解。比如说：你知道什么是精神控制型矮人嘴套吗？你当然不知道！所以规划的事交给我，跑腿的事交给你。\n\n就像我刚才说的，如果这玩意儿要管用，我们需要一只五百磅重的鸡。\n\n去加基森找德尔格·快切谈谈。他会给你线索，帮你找到合适的样本。|n",dEN="If there is one thing that you should know about me, it is this: NEVER ask me about my business! I work with things you simply cannot understand. Like for example: Do you know what a psychotronic muzzledorf is? Of course you don't! And that's why we leave the planning to me and the fetching to you.\n\nAs I said earlier, if this is going to work, we're going to need a 500 pound chicken.\n\nHead to Gadgetzan and speak with Dirge Quikcleave - he'll get you started on finding a suitable specimen.",o="塔纳利斯的纳瑞安让你和加基森的迪尔格·奎克里弗谈一谈。",oEN="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to speak with Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan.",c="<德尔格挠了挠头。>\n\n一只五百磅重的鸡？根本没这种东西！至少现在没有了。我倒是听说过这样一只鸡……死亡黑鸡……\n\n<德尔格的声音低了下去。>\n\n可是没错，没人见过那只鸡还能活着讲出来。我有个主意，对你我都有好处，$g小子:姑娘;。",cEN="<Dirge scratches his head.>\n\nA 500 pound chicken? There's no such thing! Not anymore, at least. I knew of such a chicken... The Black Chicken of Death...\n\n<Dirge's voice trails off.>\n\nBut yes, nobody ever saw that chicken and lived to tell the tale. I've got an idea that could benefit the both of us, kid."}
Q[8585]={d="传说菲拉斯恐惧岛上的奇美拉拥有世上最鲜嫩多汁的肉！而这些奇美拉还有个老爸，只要稍加处理，看起来也许——也许不——像一只五百磅重的鸡。\n\n去恐惧岛，杀掉拉克麦兰领主，把他新鲜的尸体带给我。这应该能让那个侏儒满意。但要让我满意，你得给我弄些奇美拉里脊肉来。\n\n做到这些，你就能得到你的五百磅重的鸡，外加一点小惊喜。|n",dEN="Legend has it that the chimaerok of the Isle of Dread in Feralas have the most succulent and tender vittles in existence! Now these chimaerok also have a daddy who, with proper preparation, may or may not look like a 500 pound chicken.\n\nHead to the Isle of Dread and kill Lord Lakmaeran and bring me his fresh carcass. That should satisfy the gnome. To satisfy me, you'll need to get your hands on some chimaerok tenderloin.\n\nDo this and you'll have your 500 pound chicken and a little something extra.",o="加基森的迪尔格·奎克里弗要你去菲拉斯的恐怖之岛击杀拉克麦拉，获得拉克麦拉的肉，并从岛上收集20份奇美洛克的腰肋肉。",oEN="Recover Lakmaeran's Carcass and 20 Chimaerok Tenderloins for Dirge Quikcleave in Tanaris.",p="嗯……奇美洛克……",pEN="Mmmmm... Chimaerok...",c="看看那些嫩腰肉！太棒了！\n\n关于那只鸡……嗯，让我看看。我需要几分钟策划食谱。",cEN="Look at the marbleization on those tenderloins! Fantastic!\n\nNow about that chicken... Hrm, let me see. I'm going to need a few minutes to devise the recipe."}
Q[8586]={d="我的食谱完成了！我还需要一些火箭燃料和石中盐，只要把这些调料和你带给我的肉混合起来就可以了。\n\n如果你带来了我要的东西，纳瑞安想要的那只鸡就可以完成了。",dEN="My recipe is complete! What I need from you now is some rocket fuel and deeprock salt. I'll handle the spices and the meat you brought me will cover the rest.\n\nAfter you bring me what I asked for, the chicken will be ready to take back to Narain.",o="加基森的迪尔格·奎克里弗要你给他带去20份地精火箭燃油和20份石中盐。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan wants you to bring him 20 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 20 Deeprock Salt.",p="快点，$g小子:姑娘;。我们可不想让这些肉坏掉。",pEN="Hurry it up, kid. We don't want this meat to go bad.",c="准备好了！我要呈现给你我最棒的创作:迪尔格的超美味奇美拉肉片！",cEN="It's ready! I present to you my greatest creation: Dirge's Kickin' Chimaerok Chops!"}
Q[8587]={d="我说到做到，$g小子:姑娘;。这是你的五百磅重的鸡。\n\n我真不知道一个侏儒要一只五百磅重的鸡干什么……\n\n<德尔格含糊地嘟囔着什么。>\n\n大概是想睡在里面吧……肮脏的侏儒……",dEN="I'm a goblin of my word, kid. Here's your 500 pound chicken.\n\nWhat a gnome wants with a 500 pound chicken, I'll never know...\n\n<Dirge grumbles something unintelligible.>\n\nProbably to sleep in it... Dirty gnomes...",o="把500磅的小鸡交给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安。",oEN="Deliver the 500 Pound Chicken to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="是什么味道这么香？",pEN="What is that scrumptious smell?",c="<纳里安将两只拳头伸进那只巨大的鸡里，整张脸塞在迪尔格美味的佳肴里。>\n\n嗯……这真是不可思议！我吃过最好吃的鸡！",cEN="<Narain mashes two fists into the huge chicken, stuffing his face full of Dirge's delicious delicacy.>\n\nMMmmm... This is unbelievable! Best chicken I've ever had!"}
Q[8588]={d="既然我们在为战争做准备，最好先把需要的东西都弄齐，你不觉得吗，兄弟？我们生产的战争物资里有一种是重皮。从护甲加固到普通的篷布，我们几乎什么都用它。\n\n但首先我们得弄到更多。那就是你的活儿，$c。磨快你的剥皮刀，给我带一包回来。然后我们再接着谈。",dEN="We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, <class>. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of heavy leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.\n\nSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, <lad /lass>, will you give it a go?",o="把10张重皮带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的剥皮师贾曼尼。",oEN="Bring 10 Heavy Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="如果你只是要来这里碎碎念的话我可没有时间，$c。有太多堆重皮需要保存。等你至少有10张后再回来找我。",pEN="I've got no time for games if you're just here to jibber-jabber, <class>. There are too many stacks of heavy leather that need curing. Come back when you have at least ten for me.",c="喔，你真的有我要的重皮。你的刀真的很锐利，$c这些真是好皮！现在既然我们已经有了该有的东西，我一定会将你对事业的贡献让大家都知道。如果你刚好又有更多的重皮，请带来这里给我。",cEN="Simply amazing... look at the purity of these samples. Hmm, I wonder what it could mean. They seem to be elemental in nature, but... something more. They remind me of... of the Old Gods. We've found traces of them throughout Azeroth, and now I wonder if these creatures aren't related to them somehow.\n\nWe shall have to test further."}
Q[8589]={d="又见到你真好，<name>。看来我们还需要更多重皮来制作各种战争物资。如果你能给我带一叠十张来，那就再好不过了。",dEN="Good to see you again <name>. It does appear that we need more heavy leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.",o="把10张重皮带给塞纳里奥要塞的皮革收集者。",oEN="Bring 10 Heavy Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",c="谢谢你的重皮。每一点都让我们离目标更接近。我会好好保存并确定你的名字被写在清单上，这样首领们就会知道你的努力。\n\n再次谢谢你，$n，如果你又有更多的重皮，你知道在哪里可以找的到我。",cEN="You da mon, mon! Thank you so much for the heavy leather. Every little bit gets us that much closer. I'll just get these onto a pile so that the other leatherworkers can get to work on them.\n\nThanks again, <name>, and if you come across more stacks of heavy leather, you know where you can find me."}
Q[8590]={d="我很高兴你决定和我谈谈这个，$c。部落方面已经着手为即将开始的安其拉之战做准备了，你我都要做好自己该做的事情。\n\n我被指派来收集大量的厚皮，我需要你帮忙去收集这些东西。这项工作是你的荣耀，也是表示你对部落的忠诚的好机会。你愿意帮忙吗？",dEN="I'm glad that you decided to speak to me about this, <class>. It looks like the Horde's preparations for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War are in full swing. But you and I still need to do our part.\n\nI've been asked to collect a great number of thick leather skins for use in all manner of war materiel, and I need you to help me by going out there and gathering them up. There's honor and the gratitude of the Horde in it for you should you decide to help. Will you?",o="把10块厚皮交给奥格瑞玛精神谷的乌玛拉中士。",oEN="Bring 10 Thick Leather to Sergeant Umala at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",p="$c，你这么快就带着我们说的10张厚皮回来了吗？",pEN="<class>, have you returned so soon with the ten thick leather that we discussed?",c="做得好，$c。我相信这些厚皮会被拿来做齐柏林飞艇的增援和所有护甲及武器。谢谢你，部落也很感激你。如果你旅途中有更多的厚皮请回来找我。",cEN="Good work, <class>. I'm sure that these thick leather skins will be put to use reinforcing zeppelins and making all manner of armor and weaponry. You have my thanks, and that of the Horde. Come back again if you come across more thick leather in your travels, and luck be with you."}
Q[8591]={c="你办到了，$n，我就知道你能行！再一次代表整个部落感谢你。你的付出已被记录，也备受感激。如果你再找到想捐的厚皮，就带到我这儿来。\n\nLok'tar Ogar，$c！",cEN="You did it, <name>, I knew that you would! Once again, thank you on behalf of the entire Horde. Your efforts have been noted and are greatly appreciated. And if you find yourself with more thick leather that you'd like to donate, bring them to me here.\n\nLok'tar Ogar, <class>!"}
Q[8592]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克尼拉斯的头饰、2个先知塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你带回我要求的材料了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="你成功了！双子皇帝的窃语已经停止。\n\n收下这个作为奖励。光是看到它，就会让其拉虫人的心中充满恐惧……它会让他们想起自己陨落的首领，以及$g那位:那位;杀死他们的凡人。",cEN="You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.\n\nTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them."}
Q[8593]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把巨型沙虫的皮、2个重生塑像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我需要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the components I require, <name>?",c="太好了……这块虫的皮肤会是很棒的保护层。和我们在路上摧毁的其拉材料结合，这会是个令人畏惧的护甲。愿它协助你面对里面难以言喻的恐怖。",cEN="Yes... the worm's skin will make for an excellent protective layer. Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we've destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor. May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!"}
Q[8594]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个重生塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，凡人。希望它们能给你需要的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8595]={p="杀死一位其拉领主对$g一位:一位;凡人来说是了不起的成就，$n。然而他们数量众多、力量强大。继续击败他们，证明你作为$g我们冠军:我们冠军;的价值。",pEN="Killing one Qiraji lord is a notable accomplishment for a mortal, <name>. They are however, numerous and powerful. Continue to defeat them to prove your worth as our champion.",c="你继续好好的效忠我们吧，$n。我们的协定依然存在。",cEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>. Our pact remains in place."}
Q[8596]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个死亡塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个黄金甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。你已经证明自己不是$g一位:一位;普通的凡人。\n\n我把这些交给你，相信它们会助你碾碎邪恶的其拉虫人。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.\n\nI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji."}
Q[8597]={d="我就知道总有一天这本书会有用的！幸运的是，我已经学聪明了！我把它藏了起来。\n\n不要担心，它被放在谁都找不到的地方！嗯，我需要搭乘一架直升飞机才可以到那里去。不幸的是，在我回来的路上，飞机坠毁了。就是因为这次事故，我才获得了超级侏儒精神力量！\n\n到天涯海滩那边去寻找坠毁的直升飞机，然后往南边游！你到了那里就会看到的！",dEN="I knew that book would come in handy some day! Thankfully, I had the wit and foresight to stow it somewhere safe.\n\nDon't worry, it's in a place that nobody could ever hope to find it! I needed a gyrocopter just to get there the first time. Unfortunately I crashed it on the beach on my way back. It was through that accident that I gained these super-gnomish psychic powers!\n\nLook for my crashed gyrocopter somewhere on Land's End Beach and swim south from there! You'll know the spot when you see it!",o="寻找纳瑞安埋在南海的某座小岛上的书。",oEN="Find Narain Soothfancy's book, buried on an island in the South Seas.",c="书不见了！在土石堆上的是一张纸条。",cEN="The book is gone! On top of the dirt mound is a note."}
Q[8598]={d="<便笺上用不同的字体拼凑出一段话。>\n\n我们已经拿到了你宝贵的书，侏儒。如果你想再见到它的话，那么你就必须按照我们说的来做。\n\n<以下是长达3页的具体指示说明。>\n\n把钱带来，只需你一个人来！",dEN="<The text on this note is made up of various typefaces glued onto the parchment's surface.>\n\nWe've got your precious book, gnome. If you ever want to see it again, you'll do exactly as we ask.\n\n<A detailed set of instructions is listed, spanning 3 pages.>\n\nBring the money and come alone!",o="把勒索信带回给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安·巧舌。|n",oEN="Return the Ransom Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="嘿，有什么事吗？",pEN="Say, what's the matter?",c="<纳里安的脸愤怒而发红。>\n\n他们绑架我的……书，是吗？我会让他们知道玩弄超自然侏儒的下场！",cEN="<Narain's face glows a bright red.>\n\nBooknap my... book, will they!? I'll teach them what it means to mess with a psychic gnome!"}
Q[8599]={d="并不是总是有人来拜访我。上一次有人来拜访，还是那次我把那个可爱的侏儒从坠毁的机器中救出来的时候。\n\n<米莉蒂丝若有所思。>\n\n你认识他吗？他叫纳瑞安……哦，如果有人可以替我给他传个话，那就太好了。我一定要告诉他我的感觉！我知道这就是爱！就是这样的！\n\n你可以帮我传话给纳瑞安吗？我永远都不会忘记你的！",dEN="It isn't often that I get visitors. As a matter of fact, the last time I had a visitor was when I rescued that dear, sweet gnome from the wreckage of the crashed flying machine.\n\n<Meridith gazes into nothingness, lost in a memory.>\n\nDo you know him? Narain? Narain Soothfancy? Oh it would mean so much to me if somebody would deliver a message to him for me. I must tell him how I feel! I know it's love! I just know it!\n\nCould you possibly deliver a message to Narain? I would be forever indebted to you!",o="把米莉蒂丝的情书交给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安。",oEN="Take Meridith's Love Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="你身上都是鱼腥味！",pEN="You smell like fish!",c="什么！？\n\n<纳里安开始坐立不安。>\n\n嗯……你要我怎么做？她是一条鱼！我告诉你是一条鱼！而且我是个侏儒。我们是不可能在一起的。",cEN="What!?\n\n<Narain starts to fidget.>\n\nWell, um... What do you want me to do??? She's a fish! A FISH I tell you! And I'm a gnome. It could never work out."}
Q[8600]={d="我认为剥皮刀是否合手，比刀刃的状态更重要。只要用对了力气，即便最钝的刀也能割开，你不觉得吗，$c？不过你我都没这个问题，因为我们总是把刀磨得最锋利，对吧？\n\n算了，不管这些，我有个任务给你。作为对部落的效劳，也为安其拉之战的准备出一份力，我希望你回来时给我带些硬甲皮。你会为我们做这件事的，对吧？",dEN="We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, <class>. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of rugged leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.\n\nSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, <lad /lass>, will you give it a go?",o="把10张硬甲皮带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的锯骨医生。",oEN="Bring 10 Rugged Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="帮我切割10张硬甲皮不需要这么久的时间吧！你是不是应该磨锐你的剥皮小刀了呢？",pEN="It couldn't possibly be taking you this long to slice off ten rugged leather for me! Perhaps you should sharpen your skinning knife? Or, perhaps I am mistaken and you have them there in your pack?",c="很好，这算是及格的工作了，虽然有些皮看起来切割的参差不齐。没关系，任务完成了，你获得了你的奖励。我会把你的名字写在皮革旁边，我肯定部落会很感谢你的努力。如果你又有了另一批硬甲皮，请尽快将它们带来给我。",cEN="Very well, it appears you've done a fairly decent job of it, though some of those skins look a bit ragged about the edges. No matter, the task is completed, and you have earned your reward. Should you come across another stack of rugged leather, be sure to bring them to me posthaste."}
Q[8601]={d="又见到你真好，<name>。看来我们还需要更多硬甲皮来制作各种战争物资。如果你能给我带一叠十张来，那就再好不过了。",dEN="Good to see you again <name>. It does appear that we need more rugged leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.",o="把10张硬甲皮带给塞纳里奥要塞的皮革收集者。",oEN="Bring 10 Rugged Leather to the leather collector at Cenarion Hold.",p="安其拉迫在眉睫的战争准备工作正在推进，<class>。不过，为了确保我们不会落后，或者至少确保落后的不是我，我要你再带一叠硬甲皮回来。你对此事的迅速响应将备受感激，<name>。",pEN="Preparations for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj are proceeding, <class>. However, to ensure that we do not fall behind, or at least that I am not the one that causes us to fall behind, I want for you to bring back another stack of rugged leather. Your prompt attention to this matter will be greatly appreciated, <name>.",c="练习，练习，练习。一把磨锐的好刀和使用它的技能会让你所向披靡，$n。看来这次的皮革边缘比上次切割的好。你买了新的小刀吗？\n\n我们感谢你的努力。你的捐献会被记录下来，而你的名声会远播至关心这类事情的人那里。如果你又获得了更多硬甲皮，请务必回来与我交谈，因为我可能会需要它。",cEN="Practice, practice, practice. A well honed knife and the skill to use it will get you far in this world, <name>. Looks like the edges on these skins are better than the last. Did you buy a new knife?\n\nIn any case, we thank you for your efforts. Your donation has been noted, and will be put to good use I can assure you. Should you find yourself in the possession of more rugged leather, be sure to come back and speak with me, as I will probably need it."}
Q[8602]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉统御腕轮、2个生命塑像、5个黄金甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，人类。希望它们能给你需要的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8603]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个死亡塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.",c="我没指望你能从这次尝试中活着回来，$n。\n\n你完成的命运，比大多数不朽存在的都更伟大。\n\n杀死克苏恩，你不仅拯救了整个艾泽拉斯，还改变了远超你理解范围的宇宙事件的走向。\n\n收下这些法衣，作为荣耀的象征，也是你行为将带来之后果的重负的象征。\n\n愿它们的力量在你面临的挑战中助你一臂之力，$g弑神者:弑神者;！",cEN="I did not expect you to return from your attempt, <name>.\n\nYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.\n\nBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.\n\nAccept these vestments as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.\n\nMay their power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!"}
Q[8604]={d="你好，$c。为安其拉之战的准备，我正在协调部落收集羊毛绷带的任务。遗憾的是，在前线，我们的士兵不能指望随时有治疗者在旁保命。相信我，我经历过。因此，我们正在为他们缝制所有这些急救包。\n\n如果你有时间，我需要很多羊毛绷带。把它们带到这儿来，我会亲自确保你得到应得的报酬。",dEN="The war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to be long and bloody. It is a very wise thing that the Alliance is doing by enlisting the aid of you, and those like you, to build up the materiel necessary before plunging headlong into conflict.\n\nI have been asked to head up the collection of linen bandages for the war, and I am hoping that you are going to assist me in amassing as many as we need. It is no light matter. Are you with us, <class>?",o="把20卷羊毛绷带带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的医者长路。",oEN="Bring 20 wool bandages to the bandage collector.",p="啊，$c，你这么快就带着绒线绷带回来了吗？",pEN="The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!",c="谢谢你，$c，部落也很感激你。如果你有更多的绒线绷带，又希望对战事做更多贡献的话，请带到这边给我。在那之前，愿你的祖先守护着你！",cEN="You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage."}
Q[8605]={d="当那么多人都选择自私时，你展现出的无私总让我惊叹。<class>，在我的任务完成之前，我仍然需要一批羊毛绷带。你愿意再一次帮我收集这些绷带吗？",dEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of wool bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",o="把20卷羊毛绷带带给绷带收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 wool bandages to the bandage collector.",p="又见到你真好，<class>。我们还在为战争事业做准备工作，我仍然需要你帮忙收集羊毛绷带，任何帮助都行。任何援助都将备受感激。我只希望我们的努力足够了。我在昨日的战场上失去了太多高尚的灵魂，所以我必须尽我所能确保那样的事不再发生。",pEN="Good to see you again, <class>. We are still working on preparations here for the war effort, and I can still use all of the help that you can give in gathering up wool bandaging. Any assistance at all will be greatly appreciated. I only hope that our efforts will be good enough. I've lost too many noble souls on the battlefields of yesterday to not do everything in my power to see to it that doesn't happen again.",c="作为$c，你理应得到我全部的敬意，$n！我会确保这些绷带送到合适的人手中。你有我诚挚的谢意，也有部落的谢意。\n\n平安去吧，如果你发现自己有多余的羊毛绷带，就再回来。任何贡献对我们都有用。",cEN="You are an honorable <class>, <name>! I will see to it that these bandages get into the right hands. You have my thanks, and that of the Horde.\n\nGo in peace, and return to me again should you find yourself with excess wool bandaging. We can use all of the help that we can get here."}
Q[8606]={d="我有办法了！我们这么做：我把一个袋子装满石头，你去交货。我知道信上说我必须亲自交货，我会的——算是吧。\n\n<纳瑞安上下打量着你。>\n\n对，你能糊弄过去。拿上这个头巾、长袍和装满石头的袋子，去冬泉谷的交货地点。\n\n我把你需要的一切都装在这个特制工具包里了。等他们来取货的时候……干掉他们！这就能让他们知道别惹纳瑞安！|n",dEN="I've got it! Here's what we're going to do. I'm going to fill a sack up with rocks and you're going to make the drop. I know it said that I should make the delivery and I'm going to - sort of.\n\n<Narain looks you up and down.>\n\nYes, you will do just fine. Take this turban, robe, and sack of rocks and head to the drop off point in Winterspring.\n\nI've included everything you need in this special kit. When they show up to pick up the goods, snuff them out! That will teach them to mess with Narain!",o="塔纳利斯的纳瑞安要你去冬泉谷，把一袋金子放在绑匪的勒索信上所写的位置。他还要求你教训一下那些家伙！",oEN="Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to travel to Winterspring and place the Bag of Gold at the drop off point documented by the booknappers.",c="我想我低估了这些绑架书的人。",cEN="I think we may have underestimated these booknappers."}
Q[8607]={d="我希望你来找我说话，是因为你打算帮我完成他们交给我的收集任务。很好！无论用什么手段，我说的是任何手段，我都要你弄到一大批魔纹布绷带。新的当然好，但并非绝对必要。把它们带到这儿来，$c，我会亲自确保你得到应得的报酬。",dEN="The war at Ahn'Qiraj is going to be long and bloody. It is a very wise thing that the Alliance is doing by enlisting the aid of you, and those like you, to build up the materiel necessary before plunging headlong into conflict.\n\nI have been asked to head up the collection of mageweave bandages for the war, and I am hoping that you are going to assist me in amassing as many as we need. It is no light matter. Are you with us, <class>?",o="把20卷魔纹布绷带带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的卡萝女士。",oEN="Bring 20 mageweave bandages to the bandage collector.",p="不许失败让我颜面扫地，$c！尽快带着我们讨论的魔纹布绷带回到这里。",pEN="Do not fail and make me look bad, <class>! Return here as quickly as possible with the mageweave bandages we discussed.",c="很惊讶，但是差强人意。或许我低估了你的“能力”，$c。你或许完成了一个非常简单的任务，因此你会获得不成比例的奖励，但是不要让它影响到你。如果你真的想证明自己就再去帮我带回另一堆魔纹布绷带吧。",cEN="Surprising, yet acceptable. Perhaps I underestimated your 'abilities', <class>. Perhaps. You completed a very simple task, and for doing so you are to be rewarded out of proportion. But don't let it go to your head. If you really want to prove yourself you should get out there and bring me another bundle of mageweave bandages."}
Q[8608]={d="当那么多人都选择自私时，所展现出的无私总让我惊叹。<class>，在我的任务完成之前，我仍然需要一批魔纹布绷带。你愿意再一次帮我收集这些绷带吗？",dEN="Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. <class>, I am still in need of a number of mageweave bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?",o="把20卷魔纹布绷带带给绷带收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 mageweave bandages to the bandage collector.",p="你回来了？有意思。如你所见，我还在为安其拉的\"战争事业\"募捐。也就是说，我需要你再出去一次，替我收集一叠魔纹布绷带。我期待你回来，<class>。",pEN="You returned? Interesting. As you can see I am still collecting for the Ahn'Qiraj 'war effort'. Which means that I need you to once again go out and collect a stack of mageweave bandages for me. I look forward to your return, <class>.",c="真是太惊讶了，$c，你真的又完成了。嗯，他们都说我很会选人做事。很好，我会将你的名字记录在你的贡献旁边，这样你就能获得这项努力应得的社会利益。如果你真的想证明自己的价值，我建议你再出去收集另一堆魔纹布绷带。",cEN="Astounding, <class>, you actually did it again! Well, they do say that I have good taste in those that I choose to place in my service. Very well, your contribution is noted and you will receive the social benefits that your efforts have afforded. I suggest though that you go back out and gather yet another bundle of mageweave bandages if you truly wish to prove your worth."}
Q[8609]={d="看来部落和联盟在安其拉之战中注定要走向对抗。令人意外的是，这并不是他们彼此之间的战争，而是针对异种虫以及控制它们的某种力量的战争。同样令人意外的是，双方都在尽其所能收集打赢这场战争所需的资源。\n\n我正在收集符文布绷带分发给士兵，但没有帮助我做不到，希望帮助来自你。你能在这件事上帮我吗，$c？|n",dEN="It appears inevitable that the Horde and Alliance are on a collision course for war at Ahn'Qiraj. Surprisingly, it is not a war with each other, but rather with the silithid, and whatever force controls them. Also surprisingly, both sides are doing their part to gather the resources necessary to wage a successful war.\n\nI am collecting runecloth bandages to distribute to the soldiers, but I won't be successful without assistance, hopefully yours. Is this something that you can aid me with, <class>?",o="把20卷符文布绷带交给奥格瑞玛精神谷的尼根·陶蹄。",oEN="Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Stoneguard Clayhoof at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",p="战争很快就来了，$c。你取得了我们之前说的符文布绷带吗？",pEN="Did you get the venom?",c="你对部落而言是个荣耀，$c。谢谢你的努力我们很感谢！我要把这些新鲜的绷带打包好并算算我们离目标还差多少。如果你愿意，可以帮我收集更多符文布绷带再回来这里。",cEN="Sweet, you got it!"}
Q[8610]={p="我们一头扎进安其拉战火的日子似乎总是越来越近，牧师。但首先我们必须集结力量、做好准备，才能在虫群及其主人的猛攻下存活下来。\n\n如果你又来了，那你肯定是想再为战争事业捐一批符文布绷带吧？请尽快去做，然后再回到我这里来。",pEN="Ever does the time grow nearer when we shall launch ourselves headlong into the conflagration at Ahn'Qiraj, priest. But first we must gather our strength and prepare so that we can survive the onslaught of the insects and their masters.\n\nIf you are here again, then surely you wish to make another contribution of runecloth bandages to the war effort? Please do so as soon as you can and return to me once more.",c="你的付出相当地无私，$n。你解救了安其拉战士。非常感谢你对部落的慷慨解囊。如果你能制作、或是遇到更多的符文布绷带，请考虑带回来这里给我。",cEN="It is a very selfless act of giving that you perform, <name>. One that is likely to save the lives of many combatants at Ahn'Qiraj. Thank you and know that you have the appreciation of the Horde for your donation. Should you create, or come across, more runecloth bandages, please consider bringing them to me here."}
Q[8611]={d="我站在这里可不是为了把自己皮肤晒成健康色的，$c。我们必须为战争做好准备。如果我们想要把那些安其拉的虫子都碾碎的话，那么我们现在就得好好准备一下了，这当然包括食物的储备工作！\n\n我们需要收集足够的狼肉来为战争做好准备。我要待在这里进行整理工作，所以我要委托你去杀几条狼，然后把它们的肉烧成瘦狼排给我。你知道该怎么做了吗？",dEN="I'm not standing here just to get a nice tan, <class>. There are war preparations to be made. If we're going to crush those bugs at Ahn'Qiraj then we need to be ready, and that includes food too!\n\nThey have me gathering and salting lean wolf steaks here for the upcoming war. But since I need to stay here to take care of all of this, I need you to go out, kill some wolves and then cook up the meat into lean wolf steaks and bring them back to me here. You got all that?",o="把20份瘦狼排带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的血卫士阿尔基库多。",oEN="Bring 20 Lean Wolf Steaks to the food collector.",p="这么快就带着瘦狼排回来了吗，$c？我不在乎它们烤太熟或沾了塔塔酱，只要它们是美味的就快点带来给我！",pEN="The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, <class>. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.\n\nWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!",c="好极了！这些正合适。我会把它们腌好、打包，运气好的话，到用的时候还能保持足够新鲜、可以入口。\n\n谢谢你的贡献，$c。你觉得你能再给我带一批来吗？",cEN="Wonderful, <class>! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.\n\nI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.\n\nThank you again, <class>."}
Q[8612]={d="我站在这儿可不是为了晒出一身漂亮的古铜色，<class>。还有战争准备工作要做。如果我们要在安其拉碾碎那些虫子，就得做好准备，这也包括食物！\n\n他们让我在这里收集并腌制瘦狼排，为即将到来的战争做准备。但因为我要留在这儿处理这些事，我需要你出去杀些狼，把肉烤成瘦狼排，然后带回来给我。都听明白了吗？",dEN="I'm not standing here just to get a nice tan, <class>. There are war preparations to be made. If we're going to crush those bugs at Ahn'Qiraj then we need to be ready, and that includes food too!\n\nThey have me gathering and salting lean wolf steaks here for the upcoming war. But since I need to stay here to take care of all of this, I need you to go out, kill some wolves and then cook up the meat into lean wolf steaks and bring them back to me here. You got all that?",o="把20份瘦狼排带给食物收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Lean Wolf Steaks to the food collector.",p="如你所见，<class>，我们还得为士兵们储备更多食物。我不知道你有没有上过战场，但一旦你熬过战场最初的那阵冲击，就会饿得厉害。你上次干得不错，所以我期待你这次也一样好，甚至再快一点，给我带另一叠瘦狼排回来。",pEN="As you can see, <class>, we still need to pack away more food for the soldiers. I don't know if you've ever been in a war before, but once you get past the initial shock of the battlefield, you can get pretty hungry. You did a good job last time, so I expect that you'll do as well, if not a little quicker, in getting me another stack of those lean wolf steaks.",c="闻起来像是你，或者你认识的某个人，是个了不起的厨子，<name>。那些瘦狼排让我口水直流；我想少掉几份应该也没人会发现。总之，干得好。我会确保有人把它们妥善收好，免得坏得太厉害。\n\n如果你再找到更多，你知道上哪儿找我。",cEN="Smells like you, or someone you know, are quite the cook, <name>. Those lean wolf steaks are making my mouth water; I suppose a few going missing won't be noticed. Anyway, good work. I'll make sure someone packs them away right so that they don't spoil too much.\n\nIf you come across more, you know where to find me."}
Q[8613]={d="今天是个钓鱼的好日子，你不觉得吗，兄弟？太好了，因为看样子我需要很多鱼。部落让我负责替他们收集成吨的斑点黄尾鱼。他们说准备安其拉之战要用。我跟他们说我会尽力而为。所以我需要帮手。$C，你愿意帮我吗？",dEN="It be a nice day for fishin', don't'cha think mon? Good thing, cuz I be needin' a lot of fish it lookin' like. The Horde, they askin' me to be in charge of collectin' a ton of the spotted yellowtail for them. They say they needin' it for the war they getting' ready for at Ahn'Qiraj. I say to them I do the best I can. So I be needin' to get some help. You gonna be helpin' me, <class>?",o="把20条斑点黄尾鱼交给奥格瑞玛精神谷的渔夫林度。",oEN="Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Fisherman Lin'do at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.",p="这么快就带着斑点黄尾鱼回来了吗，$c？你有把它们煮好吧？我们可不想在炎热的沙漠艳阳下给士兵们生鱼吃。",pEN="The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, <class>. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.\n\nWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!",c="喔耶，这真是好东西。我会把它们收好，不会浪费。谢谢你帮我们这样的忙。我想你是个一流的渔夫$g先生:小姐能钓到这些斑点黄尾鱼。如果你刚好钓到并煮好更多鱼，拿到这里给我我要让大家都知道你的表现！",cEN="Wonderful, <class>! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.\n\nI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.\n\nThank you again, <class>."}
Q[8614]={p="如你所见，我们仍然需要很多的鱼。安其拉的战士们需要很多食物，所以我要尽所能的弄到所有斑点黄尾鱼。你抓到、煮好它们并带来给我，我会表达我的谢意，还有部落的谢意。",pEN="So as you can see, we still be needin' a lot of the fishies. The combatants in the upcomin' Ahn'Qiraj War gonna be needin' a lot to eat, so I needin' to get all the spotted yellowtail that I can. You catch 'em, cook 'em, and bringin' 'em back to me here, and I be givin' you thanks, and the thanks of the Horde.",c="这是最好的捕获量，$n！很好，很认真的工作。而且也没有骨头。谢谢你为这些斑点黄尾鱼到外面去。如果你又煮了更多的黄尾鱼请快点回到我这里！",cEN="That be the best catch yet, <name>! Good, honest work right there. And no bones too! Thanks goin' out to you for this spotted yellowtail here mon. Come back soon if you cookin' up some more!"}
Q[8615]={d="安其拉之战的准备工作是一项浩大的工程，$c。所有的物资都将在这里进行收集，无论是铸造武器所需的金属，还是士兵日常生活所需的食物都非常重要。比如说，如果你几天没有吃东西，那么你一定没有力气挥舞战斧。\n\n因此我们需要收集尽可能多的食物。我在这里负责收集烤鲑鱼，它的口味和营养都非常适合我们的士兵。你能帮帮我吗，$c？",dEN="The Ahn'Qiraj war effort is an immense undertaking, <class>. All of the materials being gathered here, whether it is metal for weapons, or food to eat, are all as important as the other. For, if you haven't eaten in days you will not have the strength to lift your axe when it matters.\n\nThus, we gather what food we can. I am collecting baked salmon, a dish that was chosen both for its sustenance and its ability to keep well. Can you aid me with this task, <class>?",o="把20份烤鲑鱼带给奥格瑞玛灵魂谷的利爪首领。",oEN="Bring 20 Baked Salmon to the food collector.",p="你带着烤鲑鱼回来了吗，$c？记住，一定要煮熟的我们不能用生的鱼。",pEN="The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, <class>. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.\n\nWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!",c="谢谢你为战事提供帮忙，$c。很多人都会忽略我们的需要，选择赚取利润。但是他们无法获得部落的感谢，无法像你现在所做的一样。他们的心不是丰盈的，不像你现在的心一样，因为无私的奉献充满骄傲。\n\n我再一次的感谢你。如果你能在我们的准备完成前再次帮助我们，我会在这里等你。",cEN="Wonderful, <class>! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.\n\nI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.\n\nThank you again, <class>."}
Q[8616]={d="安其拉战争事业是一项浩大的工程，<class>。这里收集的所有物资，无论是造武器的金属还是吃的食物，都一样重要。因为，如果你好几天没吃东西，关键时刻就没力气举起斧头。\n\n因此，我们尽可能多地收集食物。我正在收集烤鲑鱼，这道菜之所以被选中，既因为它的营养，也因为它耐存放。你能在这件事上帮我吗，<class>？",dEN="The Ahn'Qiraj war effort is an immense undertaking, <class>. All of the materials being gathered here, whether it is metal for weapons, or food to eat, are all as important as the other. For, if you haven't eaten in days you will not have the strength to lift your axe when it matters.\n\nThus, we gather what food we can. I am collecting baked salmon, a dish that was chosen both for its sustenance and its ability to keep well. Can you aid me with this task, <class>?",o="把20份烤鲑鱼带给食物收集者。",oEN="Bring 20 Baked Salmon to the food collector.",p="你上次为战争事业捐的那批烤鲑鱼看起来非常美味，<class>。我得承认，我很想给自己留几条。如你所见，我们这里的配额还没凑够。我希望你回来是因为你又带了另一叠烤鲑鱼。",pEN="The last batch of baked salmon that you donated to the war effort looked very delicious, <class>. I must admit that I was tempted to take a few for myself. As you can tell, we have not yet reached our quota here. I am hoping you have returned because you have another stack of baked salmon with you.",c="你为战争事业投入的时间和精力远超常人，<name>。我向你保证，你的辛劳没有被忽视。你有我的谢意，也有部落的感激。如果你再烤出一批，请再来找我。",cEN="Your donation of time and energy to the war effort goes above and beyond, <name>. I assure you that your labors have not gone unnoticed. You have my thanks, and the gratitude of the Horde. Please return to me again should you bake up another batch."}
Q[8619]={c="很庆幸这片大地的居民仍然会对古老的种族表达敬意。我祝你平安，$n，并且送你这个硬币……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[8620]={d="我就知道，我最大的敌人，维维尔博士又开始玩他那老一套了！现在，由于你在冬泉谷的失败，维维尔把我的书给毁掉了！你现在还怎么拯救世界，大英雄？\n\n我收集到的仅存的《龙语傻瓜教程：第二卷》被撕成8份，散落在世界各地！如果你可以收集到这些遗失的章节，那么就用这个魔法书封面把它们合在一起，然后给我带回来。",dEN="I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book! How are you going to save the world now, hero?\n\nThe note I received stated that the only known copy of \"Draconic for Dummies: Volume II\" was ripped into 8 parts and scattered to the wind! If you somehow manage to find those missing chapters, use this magical binding to put them back together and return to me.",o="把8章《龙语傻瓜教程》的章节用魔法书封面合起来，然后把完整的《龙语傻瓜教程：第二卷》交给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安。",oEN="Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",p="我和你一样把裤子穿上——一次穿一条腿进去。只不过等你穿好了，我已经在制作奥金浮标了。奥金浮标啊，宝贝！",pEN="I put my pants on just like you - one leg at a time. Except when my pants are on, I make arcanite buoys. Arcanite buoys, baby!",c="太棒了！真不敢相信你真的突破了那个难题！你是机器吗？换作是我，我可能会让整个世界爆炸。\n\n告诉你，$g先生:女士。英勇的行为一定会得到奖励的。",cEN="Fantastic! I can't believe you went through the hassle! Are you some kind of machine? If it were me, I would have probably just let the world implode.\n\nI tip my turban to you, sir. And no good deed should go unrewarded."}
Q[8621]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉统御腕轮、2个先知塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你拿到我所需要的东西了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8622]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个先知塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8623]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克洛尔的王冠、2个重生塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我所要求的材料都带回来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8624]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把巨型沙虫的皮、2个征战塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我需要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8625]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个重生塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Bronze Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，凡人。希望它们能给你适时的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8626]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个生命塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你拿到我所需要的东西了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。你已经证明自己不是$g一位:一位;普通的$g凡人:凡人;。\n\n我把这些交给你，相信它们会助你碾碎邪恶的其拉虫人。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.\n\nI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji."}
Q[8627]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个先知塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。",oEN="Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.",c="我没指望你能从这次尝试中活着回来，$n。\n\n你完成的命运，比大多数不朽存在的都更伟大。\n\n杀死克苏恩，你不仅拯救了整个艾泽拉斯，还改变了远超你理解范围的宇宙事件的走向。\n\n收下这些法衣，作为荣耀的象征，也是你行为将带来之后果的重负的象征。\n\n愿它们的力量在你面临的挑战中助你一臂之力，$g弑神者:弑神者;！",cEN="I did not expect you to return from your attempt, <name>.\n\nYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.\n\nBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.\n\nAccept this breastplate as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.\n\nMay its power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!"}
Q[8628]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克洛尔的王冠、2个重生塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="我要求的那些部件你收集到了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="用你带来的材料，以及我们陨落的其拉敌人的鳞片，我为你打造了这副肩甲，凡人。愿它给予你所需的防护，也愿敌人看到它就心生恐惧。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8629]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把巨型沙虫的皮、2个征战塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我需要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the components I require, <name>?",c="太好了……虫的皮肤会是很棒的保护层。和我们在路上摧毁的其拉材料结合，这会是个令人畏惧的护甲。愿它协助你面对里面难以言喻的恐怖。",cEN="Yes... the worm's skin will make for an excellent protective layer. Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we've destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor. May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!"}
Q[8630]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉统御腕轮、2个生命塑像、5个水晶甲虫和5个黄金甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，凡人。希望它们能给你适时的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8631]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把奥罗的外皮、2个先知塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我需要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8632]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克尼拉斯的头饰、2个夜晚塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我所要求的材料都带回来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="你成功了！双子皇帝的窃语已经停止。\n\n收下这个作为奖励。光是看到它，就会让其拉虫人的心中充满恐惧……它会让他们想起自己陨落的首领，以及$g那位:那位;杀死他们的凡人。",cEN="You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.\n\nTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them."}
Q[8633]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个太阳塑像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.",c="我没指望你能从这次尝试中活着回来，$n。\n\n你完成的命运，比大多数不朽存在的都更伟大。\n\n杀死克苏恩，你不仅拯救了整个艾泽拉斯，还改变了远超你理解范围的宇宙事件的走向。\n\n收下这些法衣，作为荣耀的象征，也是你行为将带来之后果的重负的象征。\n\n愿它们的力量在你面临的挑战中助你一臂之力，$g弑神者:弑神者;！",cEN="I did not expect you to return from your attempt, <name>.\n\nYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.\n\nBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.\n\nAccept these robes as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.\n\nMay their power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!"}
Q[8634]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉统御腕轮、2个太阳塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个青铜甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你拿到我所需要的东西了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。你已经证明自己不是$g一位:一位;普通的$g凡人:凡人;。\n\n我把这些交给你，相信它们会助你碾碎邪恶的其拉虫人。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.\n\nI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji."}
Q[8635]={c="战争的历史是传奇壮大的种子。你正处于英雄的时代，年轻人。愿你的英勇传奇深植人心、源远流长。\n\n祝你平安，$n，这是你应有的奖赏……",cEN="The battles of ages past are seeds from which legends grow. Yours is a time of heroes, young one. May your legend take root, thrive.\n\nI bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[8636]={c="万物皆难逃一死，但精神却永垂不朽。祝你平安，$n，这是给你的奖赏……",cEN="The stuff of life is doomed to die and return to the earth, but the stuff of spirit lives eternal. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[8637]={d="其拉虫人的魔法古老而又强大，它们最强大的武器甚至可以与龙抗衡。\n\n把其拉统御腕轮和其它辅助材料交给我，我将为你制作一双威力无比的靴子。\n\n你会在与敌人作战的时候发现它所蕴含的力量。",dEN="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.\n\nBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.\n\nYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.",o="把其拉统御腕轮、2个先知塑像、5个水晶甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",p="你拿到我所需要的东西了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。你已经证明自己不是$g一位:一位;普通的$g凡人:凡人;。\n\n我把这些交给你，相信它们会助你碾碎邪恶的其拉虫人。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.\n\nI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji."}
Q[8638]={d="最令人恐怖的上古之神正在从安其拉的休眠之中慢慢醒来。艾泽拉斯世界不久之后即将面对这股恐怖的力量，时间对于如此强大的存在来说毫无意义。\n\n当星辰的位置合适的时候，他将让恐怖的力量席卷所有的一切。你必须在此之前找到他，消灭他。\n\n完成这个任务，把他的外壳交给我。我会奖励你一件凡人从未见到过的护甲……一件只有弑神者才有资格获得的护甲！",dEN="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.\n\nWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath. You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.\n\nDo this and bring me a piece of his husk. I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!",o="把上古之神的外鞘、2个征战塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。",oEN="Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="在安其拉的住所里，可怕的克苏恩在睡眠中等待着。",pEN="At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.",c="我没指望你能从这次尝试中活着回来，$n。\n\n你完成的命运，比大多数不朽存在的都更伟大。\n\n杀死克苏恩，你不仅拯救了整个艾泽拉斯，还改变了远超你理解范围的宇宙事件的走向。\n\n收下这些法衣，作为荣耀的象征，也是你行为将带来之后果的重负的象征。\n\n愿它们的力量在你面临的挑战中助你一臂之力，$g弑神者:弑神者;！",cEN="I did not expect you to return from your attempt, <name>.\n\nYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.\n\nBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.\n\nAccept this breastplate as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.\n\nMay its power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!"}
Q[8639]={d="双子皇帝……他们正向我轻声密语，这折磨着我的神志。他们嘲笑我，他们知道我无法进入神殿的深处去拯救我的兄弟亚雷戈斯。\n\n我可以看见他们狰狞的脸庞，他们头上戴着具有无穷力量的皇冠。但是我必须要报仇……我会把这种代表其拉虫人力量的饰品转化成对我们有利的东西。\n\n把我需要的材料交给我，$n。我会为你制作一顶具有超凡力量的头盔。",dEN="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.\n\nIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns. But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.\n\nBring me the components I require, <name>. I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.",o="把维克洛尔的王冠、2个战争塑像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of the War, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我所要求的材料都带回来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="你成功了！双子皇帝的窃语已经停止。\n\n收下这个作为奖励。光是看到它，就会让其拉虫人的心中充满恐惧……它会让他们想起自己陨落的首领，以及$g那位:那位;杀死他们的凡人。",cEN="You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.\n\nTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them."}
Q[8640]={d="你想要向我们证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n在传说中，古老的沙虫奥罗是一个非常强大的存在。据说是上古把它创造出来的原因是为了嘲笑生命的软弱。\n\n它的皮肤非常特殊……异常结实，甚至是无法击破的，而它本身的移动速度却不会因此而受到任何妨碍，它和那些小型生物一样动作灵敏。\n\n把它的皮肤样品和其它一些原材料都交给我，我会给你制作一条具有强大力量的护腿。",dEN="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.\n\nThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power. He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.\n\nHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.\n\nBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.",o="把奥罗的外皮、2个夜晚塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的坎多斯特拉兹。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到友善声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你把我需要的材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="You've acquired the items I requested, <name>?"}
Q[8641]={d="据说凡人所穿着的绚丽护肩是他们用来模仿龙翼的。\n\n把其拉虫人的最高领袖所佩戴的腕轮交给我，我会用它来制作一副比奈法利安的双翼还要可怕的护肩！",dEN="It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.\n\nBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!",o="把其拉命令腕轮、2个太阳塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的安多葛斯。你必须首先在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到中立声望才可以完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",p="你收集好我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the components I require?",c="我用你带来的材料和其拉虫人的鳞片制成了这套肩铠，凡人。希望它们能给你适时的保护也能让我们的敌人尝到恐惧的滋味。",cEN="From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies."}
Q[8642]={c="很庆幸这片大地的居民仍然会对古老的种族表达敬意。我祝你平安，$n，并且送你这个硬币……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
