Q[8687]={d="我们需要援军进攻佐拉虫巢。你的主要目标是那些佐拉坑道蝎，当你的任务完成之后就去向指挥官玛尔利斯报告。",dEN="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora. You have been selected to target Hive'Zora tunnelers. Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="杀死30只佐拉掘洞者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报VII》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Tunnelers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有事要告诉我吗，$c？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="做得好，$n。少了他们的坑道蝎，异种蝎就很难修补他们虫巢结构所受的伤害。我猜你想要一个新任务。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Without their tunnelers, the silithid will have a hard time repairing any damage inflicted to their hive's structure. I assume you'll want a new task."}
Q[8688]={c="天堂，在他们数不尽的星星中有着世间神秘事物的答案，$n。强大，有智慧，幸运的人，能够抬头盯着天空找到答案？",cEN="The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, <name>. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?"}
Q[8689]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉军用披风、2个翠玉雕像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Jasper Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8690]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉帝王披风、2个黑曜石雕像、5个陶土甲虫和5个黄金甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Clay Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8691]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉军用披风、2个雪白雕像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Alabaster Idols, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8692]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉帝王披风、2个朱红雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Vermillion Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8693]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉军用披风、2个碧蓝雕像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
