Q[8695]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉帝王披风、2个黑曜石雕像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了斗蓬的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cape, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8696]={d="我很高兴听说你愿意帮助我们进攻安其拉，$n。我可以制作一件装备，让你在作战时获得一些保护，$c。\n\n我需要一件其拉斗篷，然后把它按照你的体型进行修改。我还需要其拉塑像和圣甲虫，这样我才能制作合适的扣子。\n\n我保证你一定不会失望的。",dEN="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, <name>. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, <class>.\n\nI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.\n\nI promise you won't be disappointed.",o="将1件其拉帝王披风、2个柔光雕像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Lambent Idols, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我带来了披风的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring the materials for the cloak, <name>?",c="啊，太好了……这件披氅非常完美。\n\n拿着这个披氅，$n。愿它保护你对抗其拉虫人的邪恶魔法。",cEN="Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.\n\nTake this cloak, <name>. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
Q[8697]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <class>.",o="将1枚其拉典礼戒指、2个黑曜石雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Ceremonial Ring, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable."}
Q[8698]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <class>.",o="将1枚其拉将领戒指、2个朱红雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Vermillion Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable."}
Q[8699]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <class>.",o="将1枚其拉将领戒指、2个碧蓝雕像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable."}
Q[8700]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <fellow /sister> druid.",o="将1枚其拉将领戒指、2个雪白雕像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Alabaster Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gems on the ring for you. You'll find the finished piece is much more... agreeable."}
Q[8701]={d="据说其拉虫人的军官所佩戴的戒指可以给他们带来无穷的能量。那些戒指上镶嵌着腐化的宝石，也许我们可以用纯净的材料替换它们，以此来制作净化版本的戒指。\n\n那些装饰在其拉雕像上的宝石就非常合适，它们的质量非常好。\n\n把戒指和雕像交给我，我会为你制作一枚强大的戒指，$c。",dEN="The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.\n\nThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.\n\nBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, <class>.",o="将1枚其拉典礼戒指、2个玛瑙雕像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给唤风者耶萨德拉。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Qiraji Ceremonial Ring, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",p="你帮我把戒指和材料带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring me the ring and materials, <name>?",c="我会帮你把戒指上的宝石换下来。你会发现效果会变得比较……协调。",cEN="I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable."}
