Q[8756]={p="我从没看过这样不屈不挠的凡人！青铜龙军团将给你最后的附魔强化。这是永恒之王本人的希望！\n\n请将你的徽记之戒交给我，这样我才能开始施法。",pEN="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",c="起来吧，其拉$g征服者:征服者;！站起来，接受$g认可:认可;！",cEN="Rise, Qiraji Conqueror! Rise and be recognized!"}
Q[8757]={p="令人印象深刻，$g小家伙:小家伙;。你历经千辛万苦才赢得青铜龙军团的青睐。你的付出已被记下。\n\n守御者的徽记之戒将提供对抗邪恶势力的卓越防护。\n\n请注意，一旦你选定了道路，若你改变主意，你将无路可退。",pEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.",c="令人印象深刻，$g小家伙:小家伙;。你历经千辛万苦才赢得青铜龙军团的青睐。你的付出已被记下。\n\n守御者的徽记之戒将提供对抗邪恶势力的卓越防护。\n\n请注意，一旦你选定了道路，若你改变主意，你将无路可退。",cEN="Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.\n\nThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.\n\nBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."}
Q[8758]={p="你一直保护卡利姆多生灵的行为已经被我们认可。把徽记之戒拿来，让我增强它的能量。",pEN="Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.",c="你在龙族中军衔的晋升令人印象深刻，$n。愿你永不偏离守护者之路！",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!"}
Q[8759]={p="向你致敬，$n。粉碎卡利姆多的敌人！告诉他们污染这片不灭星光照耀下的大陆要付出什么代价！\n\n你又赢得了一个强效施法。请把徽记之戒给我，我来灌注能量。",pEN="You honor my kind, <name>. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.\n\nYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",c="你在龙族中军衔的晋升令人印象深刻，$n。愿你永不偏离守护者之路！",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!"}
Q[8760]={p="如此程度的奉献实属罕见。你已经证明自己的意志坚定不移，$n。你对我们世界的坚定守望将得到$g丰厚的回报:丰厚的回报;。\n\n把你的徽记之戒交给我，好让我强化它的附魔。",pEN="Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, <name>. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.",c="你在龙族中军衔的晋升令人印象深刻，$n。愿你永不偏离守护者之路！",cEN="Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, <name>. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!"}
Q[8761]={p="我从没看过这样不屈不挠的凡人！青铜龙军团将给你最后的附魔强化。这是永恒之王本人的希望！\n\n请将你的徽记之戒交给我，这样我才能开始施法。",pEN="Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!\n\nHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",c="起来吧，伟大的$g祈求者:祈求者;！挺身而立，接受你的认可！",cEN="Rise, Grand Invoker! Rise and be recognized!"}
Q[8762]={d="灾难降临了！驯鹿梅森被绑架了！\n\n梅森是冬天爷爷的八头驯鹿之一，也是烟林牧场的财产。我们相信是那卑鄙的可恶雪人格林奇把他带走了，那家伙藏在希尔斯布莱德丘陵。偏偏现在节日期间，我们手头正紧！求你——把梅森带回来，击败他的绑架者，把他带回来给我们！",dEN="DISASTER has struck! Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!\n\nMetzen is one of Greatfather Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures. We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen. With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here! Please - find Metzen and return him to us!\n\nCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!\n\nPlease, hurry!",o="在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的窄穴附近，从绑匪手中救出驯鹿梅森。",oEN="Find Metzen the Reindeer. Use the notes provided to you for clues as to where he is being held.\n\nWhen you find Metzen, have the Pouch of Reindeer Dust in your possession so you can sprinkle some of the dust on him; this should free Metzen from his bonds of captivity.\n\nReturn the Pouch of Reindeer Dust to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge once Metzen is freed.",p="你找到他了吗？我给你的那些笔记足以让你找到梅森吗？我不愿去想那些残忍的暴徒会对他做什么……可我们根本付不起那么高额的赎金！",pEN="<name>! Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen? I hate to think of that those cruel thugs might do to him... but there's no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!",c="你办到了！万岁！\n\n梅特森已经飞回去冬天爷爷的兽栏里了——是的，梅特森是会飞的——就在不久之前！这个尘土有点像是个符咒；我知道它可以的。你拯救了冬幕节还有烟熏牧场免于疾病的侵袭。谢谢你，$n。\n\n听着……因为你对这里的贡献，我希望你可以拿着这个。这是一个非常特别的东西如果你有坐骑的话，我想你可以好好的试试它。冬幕节快乐！",cEN="You did it! Huzzah!\n\nMetzen flew back into Greatfather Winter's stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago! The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would. You've saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster. Thank you, <name>.\n\nListen... because of what you've done here, I want you to have this. It's something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you'll get a kick out of it. Happy Winter Veil!"}
Q[8763]={d="听着……我本不该告诉你这些，不过既然你是个大英雄……\n\n今年到处都有新鲜的冬青树茁壮成长，不过它们很快就会枯萎。我们弄了一台机器，可以储藏冬青树，然后在夏天拿出来热卖！\n\n我可以让你使用我们储藏的冬青树，不过你必须得是个够资格的大厨！给我带来一些石中盐，还有两个，不，三个，我是说五个金币。你觉得怎么样？够划算吧？",dEN="Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...\n\nThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts. We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad! We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!\n\nI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook. You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold. It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.",o="将1份石中盐和5个金币交给冬青树储藏器，以换取5棵冬青树。",oEN="Bring 1 Deeprock Salt and 5 gold coins to any Holly Preserver machine, upon which you will receive 5 Preserved Holly.",p="\"冬青保鲜机\"乍看之下像某种蒸馏器，但仔细检查会发现它带有一些地精式的改动。不过，你的烹饪技艺似乎足以让你明白这台机器如何运作。\n\n机器里已经有新鲜的冬青了——你只需提供一些深石盐和五枚金币，就能让机器运转起来。",pEN="The \"Holly Preserver\" machine looks like some sort of still at first, but a careful examination of it reveals some goblin-esque changes to it. Still, your skill at cooking seems to allow you to understand how the machine works.\n\nThere is already fresh holly in the machine - you simply need to provide some deeprock salt and five gold coins to get the machine working.",c="机器开始运转时发出一阵轻响和少量蒸汽。\n\n没过多久它就停了下来，伴随着又一股从机器中喷出的小小蒸汽。\n\n一扇舱门打开了，露出一批保鲜好的冬青！",cEN="The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working.\n\nIt is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it.\n\nA door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!"}
Q[8764]={p="$g勇士:勇士;，如果你决定走上另一条路，就把你的徽记之戒和一大堆我们在安其拉的敌人身上取得的甲虫交给我。",pEN="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",c="很好，$n。如果你改变心意，我会在这里帮助你。",cEN="Be well, <name>. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you."}
Q[8765]={p="$g勇士:勇士;，如果你决定走上另一条路，就把你的徽记之戒和一大堆我们在安其拉的敌人身上取得的甲虫交给我。",pEN="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",c="很好，$n。如果你改变心意，我会在这里帮助你。",cEN="Be well, <name>. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you."}
Q[8766]={p="$g勇士:勇士;，如果你决定走上另一条路，就把你的徽记之戒和一大堆我们在安其拉的敌人身上取得的甲虫交给我。",pEN="Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.",c="很好，$n。如果你改变心意，我会在这里帮助你。",cEN="Be well, <name>. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you."}
Q[8768]={c="这件礼物上面写着你的名字。\n\n等等，它刚才好像动了一下？",cEN="This festively-wrapped present has your name on it.\n\nWait, did it just move?"}
Q[8769]={c="烟熏牧场祝你冬幕节快乐！",cEN="Have a joyous Feast of Great-Winter from your friends at Smokeywood Pastures."}
Q[8770]={d="随着战争推进，该地区的异种虫存在对我们的行动构成了持续增长的威胁。你已被选中参与对亚什虫巢的一次突袭，主要目标是亚什虫巢的守卫者。\n\n完成任务后向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi defenders.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="击杀25只亚什工蝎和40只亚什雄蝎。",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Defenders and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="干得好，$n。你的表现一如以往地出色。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your diligence is as noteworthy as always."}
Q[8771]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对亚什虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是亚什沙行者。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi sandstalkers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="击杀30只亚什沙行者，然后向塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带着作战任务简报 II才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Sandstalkers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="干得好，$n。你在亚什虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Ashi has been noted."}
Q[8772]={d="我们需要援军进攻佐拉虫巢。你的主要目标是那些佐拉守卫，当你的任务完成之后就去向指挥官玛尔利斯报告。",dEN="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora. You have been selected to target Hive'Zora waywatchers. Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="杀死30只佐拉望风者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报VI》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Waywatchers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="干得好，$n。你在佐拉虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Zora has been noted."}
Q[8773]={d="我们需要援军进攻佐拉虫巢。你的主要目标是那些佐拉掠夺者，当你的任务完成之后就去向指挥官玛尔利斯报告。",dEN="Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora. You have been selected to target Hive'Zora reavers. Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.",o="击杀40只佐拉掠夺者。",oEN="Slay 30 Hive'Zora Reavers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要告诉我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to tell me, <class>?",c="我听说了你在佐拉虫巢的事迹。继续努力，胜利必将属于我们。",cEN="I've heard good things about your part in the Hive'Zora attack. Keep up the good work and victory will soon be ours."}
Q[8774]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对雷戈虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是雷戈伏击者。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the Hive'Regal ambushers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="杀死30只雷戈伏击者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报VIII》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Ambushers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么事吗，$n？",pEN="You wish to tell me something, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。你在佐拉虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Regal has been noted."}
Q[8775]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对雷戈虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是雷戈喷火者。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the airborne Hive'Regal spitfires.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="杀死30只雷戈喷火者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报IX》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Spitfires and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么事吗，$n？",pEN="You wish to tell me something, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。你在佐拉虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Regal has been noted."}
Q[8776]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对雷戈虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是雷戈制奴者。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of the Hive'Regal slavemakers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="杀死30只雷戈制奴者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报X》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Slavemakers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么事吗，$n？",pEN="You wish to tell me something, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。你在佐拉虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Regal has been noted."}
Q[8777]={d="这一地区猖獗的异种虫类对我们来说是个巨大的威胁。你被指派负责对雷戈虫巢发动攻击，主要目标是雷戈掘洞者。\n\n在你的任务完成之后，向指挥官玛尔利斯汇报。",dEN="As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations. You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Regal where your primary target will consist of Hive'Regal burrowers.\n\nReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.",o="杀死30只雷戈掘洞者，然后向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯复命。你还必须带上《作战任务简报XI》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Kill 30 Hive'Regal Burrowers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Combat Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么事吗，$n？",pEN="You wish to tell me something, <name>?",c="干得好，$n。你在雷戈虫巢攻击行动中的卓越表现已经引起了关注。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Your part in the attack on Hive'Regal has been noted."}
Q[8778]={d="战场的绷带储存量在最近战争伤亡之后急剧降低。把大量的急救物资带给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The Ironforge Brigade has put in an unusual request for highly... volatile... components. Gather them and bring them to Mr. Nozzlespring from the Ironforge Brigade.",o="把20个重符文绷带，20个厚丝质绷带和20个厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 6 Oils of Immolation, 5 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 10 Dense Blasting Powder to Arcanist Nozzlespring near Hive'Zora in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，太好了！这些东西会很有用！非常感激，$n！",cEN="Ah, yes! These will come in handy! Much obliged, <name>!"}
Q[8779]={d="地质学家拉克斯班的研究已被证明对我们在希利苏斯的行动有巨大价值。她最近申请了一些用于研究的占卜材料。\n\n请收集这些材料，并直接交给她，好让她继续研究。",dEN="Geologist Larksbane's studies have proven to be of tremendous value to our operations in Silithus. She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.\n\nPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research.",o="把20个重符文绷带，20个厚丝质绷带和20个厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="很好……这些东西有很大的帮助！这些材料在沙漠中很难取得，$n。谢谢你。",cEN="Why, yes... these will be of tremendous aid! These materials are awfully hard to come by in the desert, <name>. Thank you."}
Q[8780]={d="我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The Ironforge Brigade's supply of armor kits in the battlefield is running dangerously low. Obtain a batch and deliver them to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade's outpost outside Hive'Zora.",o="把20根重符文绷带、20根厚丝质绷带和20根厚绒线绷带交给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade Outpost near Hive'Zora in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="谢谢你，我会把它们分发出去的。",cEN="Thanks, I'll hand these out to the lads."}
Q[8781]={d="我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The Ironforge Brigade has been a worthy ally in our fight in Silithus. Unfortunately, many of their supplies were lost on their way here. Procure a batch of weapons and deliver them to Janela Stouthammer near Hive'Zora.",o="把20根重符文绷带、20根厚丝质绷带和20根厚绒线绷带交给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 2 Moonsteel Broadswords to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade Outpost outside of Hive'Zora. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="喔，太好了！我不用再听他们抱怨那些没用的武器了。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Oh, excellent! I won't have to hear complaints about dull blades anymore. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[8782]={d="最近不断涌来的志愿者导致我们制服紧缺。去搜集一些制服的材料，然后把它们交给唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The latest influx of volunteers has caused a shortage of uniforms. Procure a batch of uniform materials and bring them to Windcaller Proudhorn.",o="把1块月布、2卷符文布卷和1份铁网蛛丝交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 VIII才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 1 Mooncloth, 2 Bolts of Runecloth and 1 Ironweb Spider Silk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，我们正需要这些。非常感谢你，$n。",cEN="Ah, we were in need of these. Your work is appreciated, <name>."}
Q[8783]={d="瓦古斯是塞纳里奥要塞的铁匠，他需要一些附魔材料来为我们的部队制作强力的武器。去找到这些材料，把它们直接交给瓦古斯，这样塞纳里奥议会的军队就有了作战装备的保障。",dEN="Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces. Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped.",o="把2块魔化瑟银锭和2块魔化皮交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 IX才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，很好。这些材料的品质都很棒。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Ah, yes. These materials are of excellent quality. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[8784]={d="你找到了一件上古其拉神器！也许神殿入口附近的龙用得到这件东西。",dEN="You have discovered an ancient Qiraji artifact! Perhaps one of the dragons near the entrance of the temple would have a use for this relic.",o="把上古其拉神器带给神殿入口附近藏身的巨龙。|n",oEN="Take the Ancient Qiraji Artifact to the dragons hiding near the entrance of the temple.",p="你看起来容光焕发！我知道这代表什么……",pEN="You're glowing! I know what that means...",c="真是重大的发现，$n。简直是太惊人了！这绝对会让我们对敌人古怪的心理多点了解。",cEN="An exceptional find, <name>. Simply marvelous! This will definitely give us some insight into our enemy's twisted minds."}
Q[8785]={d="奥格瑞玛军团要求我们提供一些不寻常的物资。他们在希利苏斯的表现很不错，因此我们最好尽快满足他们的需求。收集必需的材料，把它们交给那个名叫沙艾的巨魔。",dEN="The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for several unusual ingredients. Given their current performance in Silithus, we'd like to comply with their request as soon as possible. Gather the materials and bring them to the troll called Shai.",o="把6份强力魔精、6份大瓶魔精和8份献祭之油交给希利苏斯地区的雷戈虫巢附近的暗影祭司沙艾。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 IV才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 6 Powerful Mojo, 6 Flasks of Big Mojo and 8 Oils of Immolation to Shadow Priestess Shai near Hive'Regal in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.",p="你带来了我要的材料吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have my materials, <name>?",c="啊，很好。正是我需要的东西！我会用这些东西做一个特别的混合物。一个异种绝不会喜欢的东西！",cEN="Ah, yes. Just what I needed! I'll make a special concoction with this. The silithid won't like it one bit!"}
Q[8786]={d="我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for additional weapons that we haven't been able to provide at the moment. Obtain the weapons they've requested and bring them to Merok Longstride outside of Hive'Regal.",o="把20根重符文绷带、20根厚丝质绷带和20根厚绒线绷带交给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 3 Massive Iron Axes to Merok Longstride at the Orgrimmar Legion camp outside of Hive'Regal. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="来的正好。这些补给能救回性命，$n。",cEN="Excellent work. We were in short supply of these, <name>."}
Q[8787]={d="战场的绷带储存量在最近战争伤亡之后急剧降低。把大量的急救物资带给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The brave volunteers of the Orgrimmar Legion have arrived to Silithus to aid us in our cause. Their supplies of armor kits were somehow lost in the trip. Obtain a batch of armor kits and deliver them to Merok Longstride at the location of the Orgrimmar Legion camp.",o="把20个重符文绷带，20个厚丝质绷带和20个厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Merok Longstride near Hive'Regal. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，很好……我会把这些东西配置给军队，$n。奥格瑞玛军团感谢你！",cEN="Ah, yes... I will distribute these to the troops, <name>. The Orgrimmar Legion thanks you!"}
Q[8788]={c="这份礼物看起来被摇晃过好几次。上面的标签写着：\n\n致$g一位:一位;非常特别的$r$c。",cEN="This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:\n\nTo a very special <race> <class>."}
Q[8789]={d="一千年以来，我们并没有无所事事地留在这里，$n。\n\n我们在这里看着这些野兽耗尽资源时自相残杀，我们倾听了它们密谋毁灭我们世界的谈话，我们还知道了它们内部的争权夺利。\n\n它们确实有弱点，而且我们知道如何利用这些弱点。\n\n找到它们在葬礼仪祭上陪葬用的武器，把它和他们自己的神所创造的最强的元素融合在一起，我们就可以创造出终结一切的武器。",dEN="We have not sat idly by for a millennium, <name>.\n\nWe have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world. And we have learned of their own internal treachery.\n\nWeaknesses exist and we know how to use those weaknesses to our advantage.\n\nFind and bring me their ceremonial armaments: Combined with the element created from the volatility of their own God, they will become a force of reckoning.",o="把其拉帝王武器和3块源质矿石交给安其拉神殿的亚雷戈斯，他会帮你制作使用源质强化过的武器。",oEN="Arygos in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring him Imperial Qiraji Armaments and 3 Elementium Ore.",p="去寻找我所要求的东西。你将成为超越自身各部分之和的存在，$g勇士:勇士;。",pEN="Seek out what I requested. You will become greater than the sum of your parts, champion.",c="有了源质的灌注，这些武器就能轻易的击败其拉和他们的神。",cEN="Infused with Elementium, these weapons will cut through the Qiraji and their God with incredible ease."}
Q[8790]={d="根据阿雷戈斯的一种理论，诞生于上古之神与其爪牙冲突之中的那种元素，在合适条件下对它们也极为致命。凡人，我说的是源质。\n\n找到一件其拉帝王徽记，连同那种剧毒元素一起带给我，我将用它们灌注出威力强大的武器。|n",dEN="Arygos theorizes that the element which is born of conflicts between the Old Gods and their minions is also extremely deadly to them under the right conditions. I speak of Elementium, mortal.\n\nFind and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power.",o="如果你把一件其拉帝王徽记和3块源质矿石带给安其拉神殿中的梦境之梅丽丝拉，她就会为你制作灌注源质的武器。|n",oEN="Merithra of the Dream in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring her Imperial Qiraji Regalia and 3 Elementium Ore.",p="你会将他们击败并让我们脱离这些束缚。",pEN="You will strike them down and free us of these bonds.",c="好好使用这个物品，$n。让他们尝尝自己附加在别人身上的痛苦。",cEN="Use the item well, <name>. Let them feel the pain that they so dearly wish to inflict upon others."}
Q[8791]={d="来自其拉虫人的威胁已经被平息。可怕的奥斯里安被消灭了。\n\n卡利姆多的人民听到这个消息应该可以松口气了。将奥斯里安的头颅交给塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯。",dEN="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.\n\nThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.",o="把无疤者奥斯里安的头颅交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯。|n",oEN="Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",p="啊，$n，你回来了！而且$g完好无损:完好无损;，容我补充一句。你从安其拉带来了什么消息？",pEN="Ah, <name>, you have returned! And in one piece, I might add. What news do you bring from Ahn'Qiraj?",c="我要给你最高的奖励，你还能选择一样强大的物品，$n。你为卡利姆多的人民做了伟大的贡献。",cEN="I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, <name>. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service."}
Q[8792]={d="你好，很高兴你决定听我把话说完。部落需要一切能得到的帮助来准备安其拉之战，也就是说，我们也需要你！就在此刻，官方收集员正在为即将到来的战争收集必需的材料，但没有你的协助我们无法达成目标，$n！\n\n你该去和负责此事的人谈谈，督军戈尔库克。你说呢，$c？你愿意协助这些至关重要的准备工作吗？",dEN="Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Horde needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, <name>!\n\nYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Warlord Gorchuk. What do you say, <class>? Will you help out with the vital preparations?",o="和奥格瑞玛精神谷的督军格尔库克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",c="（兽人语）你好，$c！很高兴看到这么多像你$n一样的部落成员，伸出援手为安其拉之战打好基础。这样的努力一定会让我们胜过异种和他们藏在安其拉里面的邪恶主人。\n\n既然你在这里，记得去和不同的收集者谈谈并提供你的协助，收集你能取得的材料。",cEN="Throm'ka, <class>! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, <name>, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to."}
Q[8793]={d="你好，很高兴你决定听我把话说完。部落需要一切能得到的帮助来准备安其拉之战，也就是说，我们也需要你！就在此刻，官方收集员正在为即将到来的战争收集必需的材料，但没有你的协助我们无法达成目标，$n！\n\n你该去和负责此事的人谈谈，督军戈尔库克。你说呢，$c？你愿意协助这些至关重要的准备工作吗？",dEN="Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Horde needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, <name>!\n\nYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Warlord Gorchuk. What do you say, <class>? Will you help out with the vital preparations?",o="和奥格瑞玛精神谷的督军格尔库克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",c="（兽人语）你好，$c！很高兴看到这么多像你$n一样的部落成员，伸出援手为安其拉之战打好基础。这样的努力一定会让我们胜过异种和他们藏在安其拉里面的邪恶主人。\n\n既然你在这里，记得去和不同的收集者谈谈并提供你的协助，收集你能取得的材料。",cEN="Throm'ka, <class>! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, <name>, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to."}
Q[8794]={d="你好，很高兴你决定听我把话说完。部落需要一切能得到的帮助来准备安其拉之战，也就是说，我们也需要你！就在此刻，官方收集员正在为即将到来的战争收集必需的材料，但没有你的协助我们无法达成目标，$n！\n\n你该去和负责此事的人谈谈，督军戈尔库克。你说呢，$c？你愿意协助这些至关重要的准备工作吗？",dEN="Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Horde needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, <name>!\n\nYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Warlord Gorchuk. What do you say, <class>? Will you help out with the vital preparations?",o="和奥格瑞玛精神谷的督军格尔库克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",c="（兽人语）你好，$c！很高兴看到这么多像你$n一样的部落成员，伸出援手为安其拉之战打好基础。这样的努力一定会让我们胜过异种和他们藏在安其拉里面的邪恶主人。\n\n既然你在这里，记得去和不同的收集者谈谈并提供你的协助，收集你能取得的材料。",cEN="Throm'ka, <class>! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, <name>, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to."}
Q[8795]={d="你好，很高兴你决定听我把话说完。联盟需要一切能得到的帮助来准备安其拉之战，也就是说，我们也需要你！就在此刻，官方收集员正在为即将到来的战争收集必需的材料，但没有你的协助我们无法达成目标，$n！\n\n你该去和负责此事的人谈谈，陆军元帅尼瓦努尔。你说呢，$c？你愿意协助这些至关重要的准备工作吗？",dEN="Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Alliance needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, <name>!\n\nYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Field Marshal Snowfall. What do you say, <class>? Will you help out with the vital preparations?",o="和铁炉堡军事区的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."}
Q[8797]={d="你好，很高兴你决定听我把话说完。联盟需要一切能得到的帮助来准备安其拉之战，也就是说，我们也需要你！就在此刻，官方收集员正在为即将到来的战争收集必需的材料，但没有你的协助我们无法达成目标，$n！\n\n你该去和负责此事的人谈谈，陆军元帅尼瓦努尔。你说呢，$c？你愿意协助这些至关重要的准备工作吗？",dEN="Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Alliance needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, <name>!\n\nYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Field Marshal Snowfall. What do you say, <class>? Will you help out with the vital preparations?",o="和铁炉堡军事区的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."}
Q[8798]={c="嘿！你知道吗？！你也是$g工程师:工程师;！既然你帮我教训了我的朋友，那我就教你怎么做你自己的机械雪人！这下乐趣就永远停不下来了，你想吓谁就吓谁！当然，前提是你能凑齐制作它的部件。\n\n你说呢，$n？你想学做机械雪人的秘密吗？",cEN="Say! You know what?! You're an engineer too! So, since you helped me teach my friends a lesson, I'm going to teach you how to make your very own mechanical yeti! Now the fun can go on forever and ever, and you can scare whoever you want! Provided that you can scare up the components to make it that is.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? Do you want to learn the secret to making a mechanical yeti?"}
Q[8799]={d="听着……我本不该告诉你这些，不过既然你是个大英雄……\n\n今年到处都有新鲜的冬青树茁壮成长，不过它们很快就会枯萎。我们弄了一台机器，可以储藏冬青树，然后在夏天拿出来热卖！\n\n我可以让你使用我们储藏的冬青树，不过你必须得是个够资格的大厨！给我带来一些石中盐，还有两个，不，三个，我是说五个金币。你觉得怎么样？够划算吧？",dEN="Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...\n\nThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts. We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad! We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!\n\nI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook. You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold. It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.",o="将1份石中盐和5个金币交给冬青树储藏器，以换取5棵冬青树。",oEN="Bring 1 Deeprock Salt and 5 gold coins to the Holly Preserver machine, upon which you will receive 5 Preserved Holly.",p="\"冬青保鲜机\"乍看之下像某种蒸馏器，但仔细检查会发现它带有一些地精式的改动。不过，你的烹饪技艺似乎足以让你明白这台机器如何运作。\n\n机器里已经有新鲜的冬青了——你只需提供一些深石盐和五枚金币，就能让机器运转起来。",pEN="The \"Holly Preserver\" machine looks like some sort of still at first, but a careful examination of it reveals some goblin-esque changes to it. Still, your skill at cooking seems to allow you to understand how the machine works.\n\nThere is already fresh holly in the machine - you simply need to provide some deeprock salt and five gold coins to get the machine working.",c="机器开始运转时发出一阵轻响和少量蒸汽。\n\n没过多久它就停了下来，伴随着又一股从机器中喷出的小小蒸汽。\n\n一扇舱门打开了，露出一批保鲜好的冬青！",cEN="The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working.\n\nIt is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it.\n\nA door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!"}
Q[8800]={d="一旦你完成了分配给你的任务，就去找铁匠瓦古斯谈谈。让他看看你在战斗中得到的徽章。他会为你提供一些合适的装备。",dEN="As you complete the tasks you're assigned in the war you'll want to talk to Vargus, the blacksmith. Show him any badges you've earned along the way. He'll provide you with gear to match your level of commitment to our cause.",o="与希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",c="卡尔东派你来的？很好，我们能为你做什么呢。",cEN="Kaldon sent you? Very well, let's see what we can do for you."}
Q[8801]={d="安其拉的城墙在颤抖。一股比世界本身还要古老的邪恶力量已被摧毁。\n\n当你看着那具庞大可憎之物的残骸时，你的心几乎冻结。即使在$g它死后:它死后;，你依然能感觉到克苏恩邪恶的遗毒环绕四周。\n\n你做到了看似不可能的事。\n\n你从那只恶魔身上扯下一根眼柄，妥善收进背包。\n\n把克苏恩之眼带给下一个房间里的巨龙。",dEN="The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.\n\nAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.\n\nYou have done what was thought to be impossible.\n\nYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.\n\nTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber.",o="将克苏恩之眼带给安其拉神庙的卡拉史塔斯。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",p="<凯拉斯塔兹跪在你面前。>\n\n$g大人:女士;$n，你把我们从它的魔爪中解放了出来。",pEN="Lady <name>, you have freed us of its grasp.",c="等我们确信这里的邪恶已被彻底摧毁，我们会自行离开此地，$g大人:女士;$n。你的传奇之旅已接近尾声。",cEN="We will leave this place on our own, Lady <name> - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end."}
Q[8802]={d="前往时光之穴，$G大人:女士;$n。阿纳克罗斯在等你回去。把克苏恩之眼交给他，因为他无疑会想把它加入他主人的收藏。|n",dEN="The lifeless eye of the ancient god still penetrates your mind with its malicious stare. Anachronos at the Caverns of Time should take care of this. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="把克苏恩之眼交给时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",p="$n$g大人:女士！结束了……",pEN="Lord <name>! It is over...",c="主人把这些留给了你，$g勇士:勇士;。来自永恒宝库：跨越数千年的神器收藏——由你挑选。",cEN="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours."}
Q[8803]={c="这个礼物上的便条纸写着：\n\n给$n，\n\n希望这个礼物可以帮助你将温暖及节日的喜悦散播到整个艾泽拉斯大陆。\n\n冬天爷爷敬赠",cEN="The note on this present reads:\n\nTo <name>,\n\nIn hoping this will help you spread warm tidings and holiday cheer to all of Azeroth.\n\nFrom Greatfather Winter"}
Q[8804]={d="目前塞纳里奥要塞涌入了大量的新兵，我们的首要问题就成了如何保证他们在沙漠中生存下来。缺水的环境和遍布希利苏斯的剧毒生物都威胁着这些缺乏经验的志愿者。去收集一些必需的物资，把他们交给要塞里的卡兰德拉斯吧。",dEN="With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert. Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers. Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.",o="把4份纯水之球、4份特效抗毒药剂和4份烤鲑鱼交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的卡兰德拉斯。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 I才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?"}
Q[8805]={d="目前塞纳里奥要塞的骑兵团缺乏足够的毛皮护甲片，去收集大量护甲片，然后立即把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹队长。",dEN="The mounted division of the Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of ornate mithril boots. Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="把毛皮护甲片交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹。",oEN="Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?"}
Q[8806]={d="塞纳里奥要塞的卫兵急需磨刀石。去收集足够的磨刀石，然后立即把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹队长。",dEN="The Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of grinding stones. Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.",o="把磨刀石交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹。",oEN="Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?"}
Q[8807]={d="地质学家拉克斯班的研究已被证明对我们在希利苏斯的行动有巨大价值。她最近申请了一些用于研究的占卜材料。\n\n请收集这些材料，并直接交给她，好让她继续研究。",dEN="Geologist Larksbane's studies have proven to be of tremendous value to our operations in Silithus. She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.\n\nPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research.",o="把20个重符文绷带，20个厚丝质绷带和20个厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="很好……这些东西有很大的帮助！这些材料在沙漠中很难取得，$n。谢谢你。",cEN="Why, yes... these will be of tremendous aid! These materials are awfully hard to come by in the desert, <name>. Thank you."}
Q[8808]={d="战场的绷带储存量在最近战争伤亡之后急剧降低。把大量的急救物资带给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="The latest influx of volunteers has caused a shortage of uniforms. Procure a batch of uniform materials and bring them to Windcaller Proudhorn.",o="把20个重符文绷带，20个厚丝质绷带和20个厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。",oEN="Bring 1 Mooncloth, 2 Bolts of Runecloth and 1 Ironweb Spider Silk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，我们正需要这些东西。你的努力很受肯定，$n。",cEN="Ah, we were in need of these. Your work is appreciated, <name>."}
Q[8809]={d="瓦古斯是塞纳里奥要塞的铁匠，他需要一些附魔材料来为我们的部队制作强力的武器。去找到这些材料，把它们直接交给瓦古斯，这样塞纳里奥议会的军队就有了作战装备的保障。",dEN="Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces. Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped.",o="把2块魔化瑟银锭和2块魔化皮交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 IX才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="啊，很好。这些材料的品质都很棒。谢谢你，$n。",cEN="Ah, yes. These materials are of excellent quality. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[8810]={d="我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。",dEN="Our supply of bandages in the battlefield is running dangerously low after the recent casualties we have incurred. Obtain a batch of first-aid supplies and deliver them to Windcaller Proudhorn in Cenarion Hold.",o="把30根重符文绷带，30根厚丝质绷带和30根厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 X才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="来的正好。这些补给能救回性命，$n。我们感谢你的努力。这是你的下一个任务。",cEN="Just in time. These supplies will save lives, <name>. Your work is appreciated. Here's your next assignment."}
Q[8812]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量铁炉堡的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Ironforge.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8813]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量达纳苏斯的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Darnassus.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8814]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量诺莫瑞根流亡者的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Gnomeregan exiles.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8815]={p="如果如果你有荣誉徽章，我可以用它来帮助你提高在暴风城的知名度。\n\n请注意，你最好一次交给我十枚荣誉徽章，这样你的知名度会获得更大的提高。我们提供针对一枚荣誉徽章的交换服务是为了方便那些没有足够荣誉徽章的冒险者。\n\n总之，如果你想要用荣誉徽章来换取声望的话，我随时在这里等着你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Orgrimmar.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8816]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量幽暗城的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Undercity.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8817]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量雷霆崖的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Thunder Bluff.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8818]={p="对于那些只拥有一枚嘉奖徽记的冒险者，我会为它兑换少量暗矛部族的认可。\n\n请记住，一次交给我十枚会更好，那样你的努力会得到更高的认可。我们提供单枚徽记兑换，是为那些凑不齐十枚一整叠的人提供的服务。\n\n话虽如此，如果你仍然想交一枚，我随时可以帮你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Darkspear tribe.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8820]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在铁炉堡的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Ironforge. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8821]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在达纳苏斯的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Darnassus. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8822]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在诺莫瑞根流亡者中的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with the Gnomeregan exiles. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8823]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在奥格瑞玛的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Orgrimmar. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8824]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在幽暗城的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Undercity. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8825]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在雷霆崖的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Thunder Bluff. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8826]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在暗矛部族的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with the Darkspear tribe. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的$g冒险者:冒险者;，$n，$g才真正:才真正;带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8827]={d="我听说冬天爷爷已经把许多礼物放在了铁炉堡的圣诞树下，今年烟林牧场又慷慨地赞助了不少钱！我很想去看看，但是我更想一睹PX-238型欢乐制造器。\n\n如果你没事的话，最好去看一看，我相信冬天爷爷的礼物中也有你的一份。",dEN="I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.\n\nBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them.",o="与冬天爷爷谈一谈。他就在铁炉堡的烟林牧场商人附近。",oEN="Speak with Greatfather Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge.",c="哦，你好啊！你来这儿只可能有一个原因：打开你的冬幕节礼物。\n\n别担心，冬天爷爷没有忘记他最喜爱的$r$c$g:;。看看树下，你会找到你的礼物。\n\n在这慷慨馈赠的时节，也许你的朋友们也会喜欢收到一些烟林牧场的上等产品？",cEN="Oh, ho hello there! You can only be here for one reason: to open your Winter Veil presents.\n\nNow, don't you worry, Greatfather Winter hasn't forgotten about his favorite <race> <class>. Look under the tree and you'll find your gifts.\n\nDuring this season of giving, perhaps your friends would also enjoy receiving some of Smokeywood Pasture's excellent products?"}
Q[8828]={d="我听说冬天爷爷已经把许多礼物放在了铁炉堡的圣诞树下，今年烟林牧场又慷慨地赞助了不少钱！我很想去看看，但是我更想一睹PX-238型欢乐制造器。\n\n如果你没事的话，最好去看一看，我相信冬天爷爷的礼物中也有你的一份。",dEN="I hear Great-father Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.\n\nBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Great-father Winter has some presents with your name on them.",o="与冬天爷爷谈一谈。他就在奥格瑞玛的烟林牧场商人附近。",oEN="Speak with Great-father Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.",c="哦，你好啊！你来这儿只可能有一个原因：打开你的冬幕节礼物。\n\n别担心，冬天爷爷没有忘记他最喜爱的$r$c$g:;。看看树下，你会找到你的礼物。\n\n在这慷慨馈赠的时节，也许你的朋友们也会喜欢收到一些烟林牧场的上等产品？",cEN="Oh, ho hello there! You can only be here for one reason: to open your Winter Veil presents.\n\nNow, don't you worry, Greatfather Winter hasn't forgotten about his favorite <race> <class>. Look under the tree and you'll find your gifts.\n\nDuring this season of giving, perhaps your friends would also enjoy receiving some of Smokeywood Pasture's excellent products?"}
Q[8829]={d="暮光之锤的运作机制有着数不清的保密措施。虽然他们的身影在世界各地出现，但他们策划阴谋的大本营却是在一个我们不知道的地方。\n\n我们相信暮光之锤用以召唤头目的石头可以用来进行双向传送，因此我们要尝试使用它。当然，我们必须仿造一件暮光大使的长袍。\n\n把必需的材料交给奥蕾尔·金叶，$n。",dEN="The Twilight's Hammer operates through innumerable layers of secrecy and deceit. While their actions are carried out in our world, they are planned in a place we have not yet been able to reach.\n\nWe've come to believe that the stones the Twilight's Hammer uses to summon their superiors allow for two-way transportation. To attempt to use them in this manner, we must replicate - to every last detail - a twilight emissary's robe.\n\nGather the necessary materials and bring them to Aurel Goldleaf, <name>.",o="把1张暗影之皮、3份破碎的憎恶缝合线和1件暮光教徒长袍带给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的奥蕾尔·金叶。你还必须带上《后勤任务简报XI》才能完成此任务。|n",oEN="Bring a Skin of Shadow, 3 Frayed Abomination Stitchings and 1 Twilight Cultist Robe to Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，$n？",pEN="You have something for me, <name>?",c="是的，我想这些应该够了。我会把它们染成暮光之锤使者所用的颜色。我向艾露恩祈祷，愿我的手艺能再一次骗过我们的敌人。\n\n但别为此担心，你已经尽了自己的本分，为此你会得到恰当的$g回报:回报;。你是$g一位:一位;忠诚而$g有价值的:有价值的;盟友，$n。",cEN="Yes, I believe these shall suffice. I shall craft these into the colors worn by the Twilight Hammer's emissaries. I pray to Elune that my skills will be able to fool our enemies once more.\n\nBut do not be concerned with that, you've done your part and for that you will be appropriately rewarded. You are a loyal and worthy ally, <name>."}
Q[8832]={p="如果如果你有荣誉徽章，我可以用它来帮助你提高在暴风城的知名度。\n\n请注意，你最好一次交给我十枚荣誉徽章，这样你的知名度会获得更大的提高。我们提供针对一枚荣誉徽章的交换服务是为了方便那些没有足够荣誉徽章的冒险者。\n\n总之，如果你想要用荣誉徽章来换取声望的话，我随时在这里等着你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Undercity.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
