Q[8839]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在诺莫瑞根流亡者中的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with the Gnomeregan exiles. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的冒险者，$n，才带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8840]={p="如果如果你有荣誉徽章，我可以用它来帮助你提高在暴风城的知名度。\n\n请注意，你最好一次交给我十枚荣誉徽章，这样你的知名度会获得更大的提高。我们提供针对一枚荣誉徽章的交换服务是为了方便那些没有足够荣誉徽章的冒险者。\n\n总之，如果你想要用荣誉徽章来换取声望的话，我随时在这里等着你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Orgrimmar.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8841]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在奥格瑞玛的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Orgrimmar. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的冒险者，$n，才带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8842]={p="如果如果你有荣誉徽章，我可以用它来帮助你提高在暴风城的知名度。\n\n请注意，你最好一次交给我十枚荣誉徽章，这样你的知名度会获得更大的提高。我们提供针对一枚荣誉徽章的交换服务是为了方便那些没有足够荣誉徽章的冒险者。\n\n总之，如果你想要用荣誉徽章来换取声望的话，我随时在这里等着你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with Thunder Bluff.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8843]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在雷霆崖的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Thunder Bluff. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的冒险者，$n，才带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8844]={p="如果如果你有荣誉徽章，我可以用它来帮助你提高在暴风城的知名度。\n\n请注意，你最好一次交给我十枚荣誉徽章，这样你的知名度会获得更大的提高。我们提供针对一枚荣誉徽章的交换服务是为了方便那些没有足够荣誉徽章的冒险者。\n\n总之，如果你想要用荣誉徽章来换取声望的话，我随时在这里等着你。",pEN="For those adventurers who have but a single commendation signet, I'll exchange it for a small amount of recognition with the Darkspear tribe.\n\nPlease bear in mind that it is better to hand over a stack of ten signets at once; your efforts will receive greater recognition in doing so. We offer a single signet exchange as a service for those who don't have enough for a full stack of ten.\n\nWith that being said, I stand ready to assist you if you still wish to hand in a single signet.",c="很好，你的贡献已经记录在册，而你也得到了不错的评价。继续好好干，$c。\n\n如果你有更多徽章的话，我随时可以帮你进一步提高声望。",cEN="Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, <class>.\n\nIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard."}
Q[8845]={p="我接受那些在执行任务中获得嘉奖徽记的冒险者上交的徽记。你每交给我十枚，我就会确保你在暗矛部族的功绩得到认可与赞赏。我也接受单枚徽记，但认可的等级要低得多。我们对与长期奉献相关的伟大功绩更感兴趣……不过任何功绩都不会被忽视。\n\n话虽如此，如果你$g准备好:准备好;交一整套，我很乐意收下你的徽记。",pEN="I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with the Darkspear tribe. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.\n\nWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.",c="太棒了！你为赢得这些徽记所作出的牺牲可不小，你的功绩将得到恰当的认可。正是像你这样的冒险者，$n，才带来了改变。\n\n如果你还有徽记要交，请告诉我。只要你需要兑换，我随时乐意帮忙。",cEN="Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, <name>, that truly make a difference.\n\nLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
Q[8857]={d="我正在寻找那些经过战争洗礼的冒险者，看他们是否愿意从亚什巨像的尸体上取到新鲜的獠牙样本，并把它交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普。不，不，我可不希望你在那家伙的尸体附近游荡。你只需迅速取回样本，这东西腐烂了就不好办了！",dEN="I'm looking for battle hardened adventurers willing and able to get a fresh husk sample from the fallen Colossus of Ashi to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. No, no, I wouldn't want you to go anywhere near that thing's corpse. Just take one of my samples and make it snappy. These things are no good to him rotten!",o="将亚什巨像的甲壳交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。|n",oEN="Take the Colossus of Ashi's Husk to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.",p="嗯？你发现了什么？",pEN="Yes? What have you got there?",c="噢，我要用这奇妙的甲壳做出多少只小鸡啊！干得好！",cEN="Oh the chickens I will craft from this wondrous husk! Well done, my <boy/girl> !"}
Q[8858]={d="我只想把这个甲虫壳套在奥菲斯特的大肥脸上…可惜，我现在要在这里收集畸形的蟑螂样本。我会一直在这里直到清晨。\n\n快点帮我把这个样本带给奥菲斯特，$c。他会重重答谢你!\n\n没错，瑟银哨塔 – 就在灼热峡谷。",dEN="There ain't nothin' I'd like more than to stuff this bug husk down Oilfist's fat face... Cept, I'm stuck here collectin' samples from that overgrown cockroach. I'll be here 'till the wee mornin' hours given the size o' that thing.\n\nTake this here sample to Oilfist fer me and do it fast, <class>. He's payin' BIG!\n\nYar, Thorium Point - it be in the Searin' Gorge.",o="将雷加巨像的甲壳交给灼热峡谷的监工奥利弗。|n",oEN="Take the Colossus of Regal's Husk to Overseer Oilfist in Searing Gorge.",p="嗯……",pEN="Hmmm...",c="太棒了。我们一定会利用这东西制造出拥有强大力量的护甲的。这是先前许诺的奖励。",cEN="Excellent. We could surely devise some incredibly powerful armor from this chitin. Here's the riches you were promised."}
Q[8859]={d="我的仆人们为了取回这份样本险些丧命。你必须抓紧时间！麦克斯韦尔·泰罗索斯领主正迫切地等待着一份新鲜的甲壳样本。他相信这头巨像的秘密能帮助我们在对抗天灾的战争中取得优势！\n\n你还留在这里做什么！？去圣光之愿礼拜堂！没错，你的努力将会得到丰厚的回报……|n",dEN="My servants were nearly killed in their efforts to recover this sample. You absolutely must hurry! Lord Maxwell Tyrosus eagerly awaits a fresh husk sample. He believes that the secrets of this Colossus could help us in the war against the Scourge!\n\nWhy are you still here!? To Light's Hope! Yes, you will be rewarded handsomely for your efforts...",o="将佐拉巨像的甲壳交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的麦克斯韦尔·泰罗索斯领主。|n",oEN="Take the Colossus of Zora's Husk to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="朋友，你穿那双靴子看起来有些笨拙。",pEN="You look a bit heavy in the boots, friend.",c="出色又及时！干得好！",cEN="Excellent and timely! Well done, <lad/lass>."}
Q[8860]={d="暴风城正在举行新年庆典！所有人都可以全天畅饮美酒佳肴，晚上还会有焰火表演！听起来是不错……不过藏宝海湾也有这样的庆典，我敢说这个肯定更棒！\n\n总之，暴风城的旅店老板奥里森需要一些烟林牧场的补给品才能应付需求量巨大的庆典，你能帮我送一趟货吗？\n\n谢谢你，$n！旅店老板奥里森在镶金玫瑰旅店，就在暴风城的贸易区里。",dEN="Stormwind is holding a celebration for the new year! All day long today you can get free booze, and at night they'll put on a firework show! It should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!\n\nWell anyway, Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers. Can you do me a favor and deliver it!\n\nThanks, <name>! Innkeeper Allison is in the Gilded Rose, in the Trade District of Stormwind.",o="将烟林补给品交给暴风城的旅店老板奥里森。",oEN="Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind.",p="你好啊！你是来参加新年庆典的吗？",pEN="Greetings! Are you here for the party! Or perhaps you just need to rest those weary feet of yours...",c="喔，我的熏木补给品！太好了！我很需要这些东西来喂饱来参加城里参加庆典的人们！\n\n谢谢你，$n。请收下这个当作报酬，还有，别忘了畅饮几杯，并和外面的狂欢者一起跳个舞吧！",cEN="Oh, my Smokywood supplies! Splendid! I'll need these to feed all the people in town for the celebration!\n\nThank you, <name>. Please take this as payment, and don't forget to drink and dance with the revelers outside!"}
Q[8861]={d="雷霆崖要庆祝新年啦！一整天都有免费的酒水，晚上还会放烟花！\n\n听起来很不错……不过藏宝海湾今天也有派对，我敢说那边更棒！\n\n总之，雷霆崖的旅店老板帕拉需要一批烟林牧场的补给，好招待所有参加派对的人。你能帮我送一趟吗！\n\n谢谢你，$n！旅店老板帕拉就在通往猎人高地的那座桥旁的旅店里。",dEN="Thunder Bluff is holding a celebration for the new year! All day you'll find free booze there, and at night they'll put on a firework show!\n\nIt should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!\n\nWell anyway, Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers. Can you do me a favor and deliver it!\n\nThanks, <name>! Innkeeper Pala is in the inn near the bridge to Hunter's Rise.",o="将烟林补给品交给雷霆崖的旅店老板帕拉。",oEN="Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff.",p="你好啊，$n！你是来雷霆崖参加我们的庆典的吗？还是说，你只是想在狩猎之余让疲惫的蹄子歇一歇？",pEN="Good day, <class>! Did you come to Thunder Bluff for our celebrations? Or are you here to rest a weary hoof between hunts?",c="喔，非常好！这些补给品可以用来喂饱来这里庆祝新年的民众！\n\n感谢你，$n。我欠你一个人情。请收下这一点钱吧吧……别忘了——尽情地饮用外面的酒，和大家一起好好庆祝一番！",cEN="Oh, very good! These supplies will help feed all our people, here to celebrate the new year!\n\nI thank you, <name>. You are in my debt. Please, take these coins... and heed my advice - drink heartily from the kegs outside, and join our revelers in a dance of celebration!"}
Q[8866]={c="很庆幸这片大地的居民仍然会对古老的种族表达敬意。我祝你平安，$n，并且送你这个硬币……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[8867]={d="每年，月光林地的德鲁伊们都会举行庆典，纪念我们的城市战胜远古邪恶的伟大胜利。\n\n我们颂扬先贤的智慧，共享丰盛的宴席，当然还有……放烟花！\n\n只要捐一点小钱，你就能从我们的商人那里买到彩色火箭。试着用用这附近的发射器吧，$n。",dEN="Every year the druids of Moonglade hold a celebration of our city's great triumph over an ancient evil.\n\nWe celebrate the wisdom of our elders, share in magnificent feasts and of course... shoot fireworks!\n\nFor a small donation you can purchase colorful rockets from our vendor. Try using some of the launchers around here, <name>.",o="点燃8枚春节烟花和2组春节烟花束，然后回到任何一座主城的春节预告者身边。",oEN="Launch 8 Lunar Fireworks and 2 Cluster Fireworks and return to a Lunar Festival Harbinger at any capital city.",p="你找到那些发射器了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you find the launchers, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。\n\n既然你对此感兴趣，何不接受月光林地庆典的邀请呢？\n\n如果你有空参加的话，那是个愉快的盛典。我们有美食、好酒、趣事，当然……还有烟火表演！\n\n站在月光之环中打开邀请函，你就会被传送至月光林地去了。",cEN="Well done, <name>.\n\nNow that you're in the spirit of things, why don't you take this invitation to the festival in Moonglade.\n\nIt's quite an enjoyable celebration, if you have the time to spare. We share food, drink, stories and of course... more fireworks!\n\nOpen the invitation while standing inside the circle of greater moonlight and you'll be transported to Moonglade."}
Q[8868]={d="年兽曾经是这个世界的英雄，一头充满着力量、能给人带来幸运的巨狼。在上古之战时，它和其他的英雄一起对抗燃烧军团，但最终却被恶魔腐蚀，成为了邪恶的野兽，在艾泽拉斯传播恐惧与死亡。\n\n最终，它在月光林地这里被打败了，并长眠在月神湖底。但是每年的这个时候，在春节期间，它都会苏醒……\n\n集结你的军团吧，$n，召唤并打败年兽，艾露恩将赐予你祝福！",dEN="The beast Omen was once a hero of this world. A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics. Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.\n\nFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara. But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...\n\nGather cohorts, <name>, and summon and defeat the beast Omen. Earn the blessing of Elune!",o="召唤年兽，击败它，并获得艾露恩的祝福。完成任务之后回到永夜港的瓦拉达尔·星歌那里。",oEN="Summon Omen, defeat him and gain Elune's Blessing. Return to Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven",c="干得漂亮，$n。击败年兽把他的灵魂送回了艾露恩之眼的水中。虽然这头野兽本身受艾露恩的祝福而不会真正死去，但他的怒火会再平息一年。\n\n你的胜利就是一场庆典，$n——庆祝年兽的力量，庆祝你和你的盟友，也庆祝你为我们过去这位悲惨英雄带来的安宁。",cEN="Very well done, <name>. Defeating Omen sent his spirit back to the waters of Elune'ara. Although the beast himself is blessed by Elune and so cannot die, his anger will subside for another year.\n\nYour victory is a celebration, <name>--a celebration of the might of Omen, of you and your allies, and of the peace you have given this tragic hero of our past."}
Q[8870]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与铁炉堡秘法区的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the Mystic Ward of Ironforge. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的庆祝吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8871]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与暴风城花园区的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the Park District in Stormwind. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的节庆吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8872]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger at the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的节庆吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8873]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与奥格瑞玛智慧谷的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the Valley of Wisdom in Orgrimmar. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的节庆吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8874]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与幽暗城入口处的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the entrance to the Undercity. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的节庆吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8875]={d="春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。",dEN="It's that time of the year, <name>! The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival. You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight. She can tell you more about the holiday.",o="与雷霆崖长者高地的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。",oEN="Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger at the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff. You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities.",c="欢迎，$n。你是来这儿参加我们的节庆吗？",cEN="Welcome, <name>. Are you here to join in the festivities?"}
Q[8883]={d="现在你已经拿到了春节邀请函，就赶快到月光林地去吧！你可以在那里看到狂欢的人群，瓦拉达尔·星歌和他的妹妹法蕾尔·星歌在永夜港负责接待前来参加庆典的人。\n\n走上这道月光就可以被传送到月光林地去，到那里之后就找瓦拉达尔·星歌谈谈吧，看看你能在节日期间拿到什么奖品！",dEN="Now that you have your Lunar Festival invitation, you may travel to Moonglade! There you will find many revelers, and in the village of Nighthaven Valadar Starsong and his sister Fariel await those eager to participate in the celebration.\n\nTravel to Moonglade through the greater moonlight and speak with Valadar Starsong; see what prizes you might gain during the festival!",o="在月光中使用你的春节邀请函前往月光林地，抵达之后与永夜港的瓦拉达尔·星歌谈一谈。",oEN="Use your Lunar Festival Invitation in the moonlight to travel to Moonglade. Speak with Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven when you arrive.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;，$n，欢迎来到永夜港，月光节的举办地！虽然我们的村庄一向偏远，与艾泽拉斯的各族少有往来，但在这庆典的日子里，我们向所有人敞开怀抱与心扉。\n\n好好享受你的到访吧，$n；等你$g准备好:准备好;了，再来找我和我的姐妹谈谈。",cEN="<name>, welcome to Nighthaven, host of the Lunar Festival! Although our village is normally remote and sequestered from the peoples of Azeroth, during this time of celebration we open our arms and hearts to all.\n\nEnjoy your visit, <name>, and speak with me or my sister again when ready."}
Q[8884]={d="你好，$c。看看海岸那边，你发现有什么不对劲吗？对，对，我们的海滩……我们的静谧海岸，竟然成了一群卑贱鱼人的乐土。\n\n这是对我们的侮辱，是对我们尊严的践踏，我们绝对不能接受！\n\n如果你觉得自己能够胜任的话，我有个任务要给你。我要它们的徽记！看看这样的威吓能不能让它们彻底消失，如果它们长了脑子的话，就应该会立即退回到属于它们的肮脏深海里去！",dEN="Greetings, <class>. Take a look toward the shore; what do you see? That's right, our beach... our Tranquil Shore, has been infested with the malignancy known as the murloc.\n\nThis blight will not stand!\n\nI have a task for you. If you feel that you're up to it, I would have their heads! Let us see if we can put a dent in their numbers so large that, if they have any sense at all, they will return to the murky depths from which they sprang!",o="收集8枚暗鳞鱼人的徽记，并把它们带回永歌森林中的一处可遥望静谧海岸的悬崖旁，交给那里的哈斯温里奥。",oEN="Collect 8 Grimscale Murloc Heads. Return them to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore.",p="我们远行者居所的骑兵巡逻队奉命导正我们这块美好土地上遭到的破坏。为达此目的我们会无所不用其极。\n\n我相信你已带着我要你去收集的鱼人头颅回来？",pEN="We rangers of the Farstrider Retreat are dedicated to setting right the damage that has been wreaked upon our fair lands. We will go to any length to do so.\n\nI trust that you have returned with the murloc heads I tasked you to gather?",c="做得好，$c。凭这味道，我敢说你一定带着我要的东西回来了，说不定还超出我要的数量。我相信这些东西一定有其用途，做个炖肉之类的。\n\n唉，不过你的努力似乎没有给他们足够的教训这些鱼人并没有撤退。这表示我们需要一些更直接的行动！",cEN="A job well done. by the smell of it, I'd say you returned all that I asked for, and possibly more. I'm sure we can find some use for these, in a stew, or somesuch.\n\nAlas, it does not appear that your efforts have done the trick; the murlocs are not in retreat. This calls for more direct action!"}
Q[8885]={d="该死，你的恐吓行为看来失败了，暗鳞鱼人完全没有被吓跑。但是，不用怕，我想我还是很清楚怎样才能把它们送上路的。我个人的小小复仇也可以趁此机会得到实现了。\n\n那里有个自称呜啦哇啦的鱼人酋长，它总是喜欢在河口南边的金色沙滩上散步，还戴着一枚象征挑衅与嘲弄的戒指。\n\n杀掉呜啦哇啦，把它的戒指给我拿来。然后我们就可以坐观这群妖孽惊惶失措的样子了！",dEN="The Grimscale murlocs have not been scared off by your efforts. But, I think I know what will send them packing, as well as get me some personal retribution.\n\nThey have a murloc chieftain that calls itself Mmmrrrggglll. It wanders the Golden Strand south of the river inlet. The beast once slew a compatriot of mine, and now wears his ring in open defiance and mockery.\n\nSlay Mmmrrrggglll, and bring back my friend's ring. Then we shall see these monsters cowed!",o="从暗鳞酋长的尸体上夺回呜啦哇啦的戒指，并把它带回永歌森林中的一处可遥望静谧海岸的悬崖旁，交给那里的哈斯温里奥。",oEN="Retrieve the Ring of Mmmrrrggglll from the Grimscale chieftain's dead clutches. Return it to Hathvelion Sungaze in the Eversong Woods on the bluff overlooking the Tranquil Shore.",p="你是我成功与复仇的希望，$c。你拿到戒指了吗？",pEN="You are the instrument of my success and revenge!\n\nHave you the ring?",c="终于！虽然厉鳞没有如期望地按原本的计划行事，但是当你将他们所谓的首领给宰了，看着他们惊慌失措实在有够过瘾。谢谢你，银月城的辛多雷也感激你！\n\n请从这些东西里选择一个以慰劳你付出的努力。",cEN="At last! Though the Grimscale did not route. as hoped, it was entertaining to watch them panic in confusion when you laid low their so-called chieftain. You have my thanks, and the gratitude of the sin'dorei of Silvermoon City!\n\nPlease, take one of these in thanks for the service that you have rendered."}
Q[8886]={d="多亏有你，$c！那些黏糊糊的暗鳞鱼人把我的货物都抢走了！那些失心者偷走了我仅有的一点魔法货物就已经够糟的了，剩下的又被鱼人拿走了！这地方到底怎么了？\n\n你能帮我找回货物吗？我不指望你能全部找回来，但此刻你能带回多少，我都会感激不尽。肯定是金滩锚地西面和南面那些棚屋里的暗鳞鱼人干的，我敢肯定！|n",dEN="Thank goodness for you, <class>! Those slimy Grimscale murlocs have pirated away my cargo! It's bad enough that the Wretched have stolen what little magical goods I had, but the murlocs took the rest! What has this land come to?\n\nCould you retrieve my cargo? I can't expect that you'd be able to get all of it back, but I'll be grateful for any of it at this point. It was the Grimscale murlocs in the huts, just to the west and south of the anchorage on the Golden Strand, I'm sure of it!",o="夺回6箱凯莉森德拉船长的货物，把它们交给永歌森林阳帆港东侧营地中的凯莉森德拉船长。",oEN="Retrieve 6 of Captain Kelisendra's Cargo and return them to Captain Kelisendra at the defended camp just to the east of the Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods.",p="我对像你这样的人来帮忙感到十分感激，$n。你的帮助几乎让我可以绽放笑容。但后来我就知道这些怪物对我的船做了还有奎尔萨拉斯发生了什么事。\n\n你有货物的消息了吗？",pEN="I am grateful for the assistance of someone like you, <name>. It almost puts a smile on my face. But then I realize what these monsters have done to my ship and what's happening to Quel'Thalas.\n\nHave you managed to retrieve any of my cargo?",c="你办到了！你让我免于毁灭还让那些恶心的生物尝到了我的复仇！\n\n现在我只希望请那两名漂亮的游侠帮我把这个货物装载到运货车上，不要再引诱失心者，我终于能够离开这里了！我们会等微兰德丝和他的游侠重新取回船厂再回来。\n\n来，收下这笔钱。这是我的一点心意，也是我为了奖励你的努力仅能做的。",cEN="You did it! You've saved me from ruin and delivered my revenge upon those disgusting creatures!\n\nNow if I can just get these pretty rangers here to help me with this cargo, I'll finally get out of here! I'll have to come back when Velendris has retaken the shipyard.\n\nHere, take this coin. It's what little I can afford, and the least that I can do to reward your efforts."}
Q[8887]={d="有趣……你找到的这个东西是一只防水的小皮筒，里面装着几张整齐折叠好、并经过防水涂蜡处理的羊皮纸。展开纸张之后，你发现纸上清晰地标明了一些航海线路，角上都印着某位“凯莉森德拉船长”的私人印章。\n\n你似乎听说过，有一处小规模的营地就在阳帆港东侧不远的地方。或许这位船长也在那里？",dEN="Interesting... what you have found here is a water-proofed, leather tube containing a number of sheets of parchment. By the markings upon them, the pages are clearly navigation rutters, and each bears the signature of one Captain Kelisendra.\n\nYou've heard of a small, defended camp just east of the nearby Sunsail Anchorage. Maybe the captain is there?",o="将凯莉森德拉船长的航海图交还给永歌森林阳帆港东侧营地中的凯莉森德拉船长。",oEN="Return Captain Kelisendra's Lost Rutters to Captain Kelisendra at the defended camp just to the east of the Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods.",p="嗨，$c，见到你真高兴。我知道，我出现在这里是很疯狂的事，泊地都被失心者给占据了。微兰德丝和他的游侠发誓要保护我直到我取回我的货物。\n\n你手里拿得是什么……看起来有那么点眼熟？",pEN="Hello, <class>, you're a sight for sore eyes. I know, it's crazy for me to be here, what with the anchorage overrun by the Wretched. Velendris and his rangers have sworn to protect me on the condition that I get out of here as soon as I've recovered my cargo.\n\nWhat's that you have there... it looks vaguely familiar?",c="喔你这个可爱的、可爱的$c！我完全不知道那些恶心的厉鳞鱼人还偷走了我的航海方针！没了它们，我们到泊地修船后就再也没机会航海了。\n\n非常谢谢你！来，收下这些钱以聊表我一点心意。",cEN="Oh you sweet, sweet <class>! I had no idea that those disgusting Grimscale murlocs had also pirated away with my navigation rudders! Without them, I would have no chance of navigating the seas again once we retake the anchorage and repair the ship.\n\nThank you very much! Here, take this coin as a sign of my appreciation."}
Q[8888]={d="$C，请听听我的请求吧。出于某些当前无法查明的原因，我不得不被迫暂时关闭我的法师塔。几天前，我派我的学徒罗拉塔莉丝到那里去执行这个重要而艰巨的任务，可直到现在，她也没有给我任何消息。\n\n拜托，请你转至达斯维瑟之塔去确认一下她的状况，看看她是否还安然无恙。你只需从远行者居所出去后一路向北，在那个三叉路口向右转就可以找到我的法师塔了。",dEN="<class>, hear my request. For reasons that I cannot go into now, I decided to shut down my nearby school. A few days ago, I sent one of my pupils, Apprentice Loralthalis, there with this very task. I have not heard back from her since.\n\nWill you go to Duskwither Spire and check in on her, to make sure that she is well? You'll find it by heading north on the path out of Farstrider Retreat, then go to the right when the road branches.",o="找到达斯维瑟之塔的学徒罗拉塔莉丝，并与之交谈。",oEN="Speak with Apprentice Loralthalis near Duskwither Spire in Eversong Woods.",c="博学者担心我的安危？真令人感动当我们都在塔里的时候，他怎么没早点表现出这样的关心。\n\n不过那已经不重要了。请听仔细了，$c，我想请你帮个忙。",cEN="The magister was concerned for my wellbeing? How sweet; I wish that he had shown such an interest before, when we were at the Spire.\n\nThat doesn't matter now. Please listen carefully, <class>, as I have a favor to ask of you."}
Q[8889]={d="你或许知道，魔导师达斯维瑟派我回来关闭为法师塔供能的能量源。一共有三处，各自位于塔内的不同位置。\n\n不幸的是，我似乎来晚了：达斯维瑟法师塔已被奇怪的魔法生物占据。我没有完成这项任务的本事，但像你这样$g一位:一位;的$c想必能轻松办到吧？",dEN="As you may know, Magister Duskwither sent me back here to shut down the power sources that feed the Spire. There are three of them, each located in a different place inside.\n\nUnfortunately, I appear to be too late, and Duskwither Spire has been overrun with strange, magical creatures. While I haven't the expertise to accomplish this task, surely a <class>, such as yourself, could do so easily?",o="关闭达斯维瑟之塔内的3处达斯维瑟之塔能量源，然后将断能宝石还给永歌森林的学徒罗拉塔莉丝。",oEN="Deactivate the 3 Duskwither Spire Power Sources inside Duskwither Spire. Then return the Deactivating Jewel to Apprentice Loralthalis in Eversong Woods.",p="我从这里看不清楚……你已经关闭了达斯维瑟之塔的能源开关吗？",pEN="I can't be certain from this distance... have you already shut down the power to Duskwither Spire?",c="我非常感激你的帮忙，但听到有些学徒堕落于他们的魔法瘾真让我痛心。\n\n现在尖塔的能源被关闭，我想我可以在这里待一阵子，看看情况是否够稳定，我再潜入塔中取回他们的遗物。",cEN="I am grateful to you for your assistance, but saddened to hear that some of my fellow apprentices have fallen to their addiction.\n\nWith the power to the Spire cut off, I think I'll stay here a while and see if things calm down long enough for me to sneak in and retrieve their remains."}
Q[8890]={d="$n，我还有最后一个请求。你能把这里所发生的一切告诉魔导师达斯维瑟吗？他就在远行者居所。替我向他报个平安，但你也一定要让他知道，也有一部分学徒沉溺在魔瘾中，成为了失心者。\n\n谢谢你。",dEN="<name>, I have one last favor to ask of you. Would you please relay what's transpired here to Magister Duskwither, back at the Farstrider Retreat? Let him know that I am well, but make certain that he is aware that some of the apprentices have become Wretched.\n\nThank you for your help!",o="回去向永歌森林远行者居所的魔导师达斯维瑟报告。",oEN="Return to Magister Duskwither at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods.",c="不！太迟了。都是我的错。\n\n我的净化替换魔法源调查在我来得及阻止之前就失了控。要是我亲自过去……·或是他们听了我的劝，注意我的警告，一切就不会这样了！\n\n我的手里沾满鲜血，$c。不过还是谢谢你，让我死去的学徒们得以安息。让他们离开有血精灵存在的地方对他们而言会是个小小的安慰。",cEN="No! I was too late. It is all my fault.\n\nMy investigation into purifying alternative magical sources got out of hand before I could put a stop to it. If only I had gone myself... or that they had listened to me, and heeded my warnings!\n\nI have blood on my hands, <class>. I thank you, though, for putting to rest the tortured souls of my former apprentices. It is some small consolation that they will not linger in that state where a Blood Elf is better off dead."}
Q[8891]={d="你发现了一本似乎是魔导师达斯维瑟的研究日记之类的东西。粗略的浏览之后，你发现这本日记中记载了一些十分具有震撼性的研究尝试，他曾试图过滤已被腐蚀的魔法能量流！这或许也是造成达斯维瑟之塔事故的重要原因之一。魔导师肯定希望能找回这本日记。",dEN="You have discovered what appears to be an investigative journal left behind by Magister Duskwither. A brief scan of its contents reveal some shocking attempts at filtering corrupted magical flows, which might explain what has happened here at Duskwither Spire. The magister is sure to want this brought back to him.",o="将魔导师达斯维瑟的日记交还给永歌森林远行者居所的魔导师达斯维瑟。",oEN="Return Magister Duskwither's Journal to Magister Duskwither at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods.",p="这是什么？好眼熟。喔不，这本日志……我的调查……这就是造成现在一切的根源。",pEN="What's this? It looks familiar. Oh no, this journal... my investigations... this is what caused all of this in the first place.",c="拿去，$n，我犯罪的证据。这本日志包含我所有计划不周的研究。\n\n我不听劝告，执意我的研究，直到一切为时已晚。然后，等到我知道自己犯了错，我已尽力挽回。但是几个学生早已逃之夭夭。我撤空了塔以避免他们受到腐败，但是我慌乱之中忘了关闭能源。\n\n我会烧了这本册子，不让其它人再身受其害。我只想帮助辛多雷。",cEN="Here it is, <name>, the proof of my crime. This journal contains all of my ill-conceived studies.\n\nHeedless of the warnings, I continued my research, until it was almost too late. Then, when I grasped my error, I did what I could. But by then, some of my pupils had already gone too far. I evacuated the Spire to get them away from the corruption, but in my haste, forgot to shutdown the power sources.\n\nI will burn this tome so that no one else falls prey to its contents. I only wanted to help the sin'dorei."}
Q[8892]={d="阳帆港现在已经彻底沦落为失心者的巢穴了。一旦我们得到了增援，就可以彻底将他们连人带尸全部从那里扫出去，$n。\n\n但在那之前，我希望你能先过去给他们一些教训。去吧，让他们见识见识我们的手段。从晴风村一直沿路向西走，就可以找到阳帆港了。",dEN="Sunsail Anchorage has been overrun by Wretched scum. As soon as we manage to get reinforcements to the area we'll show those thugs who's boss, <name>.\n\nIn the meantime you can help by showing them a bit of discipline. Go in there and show them we are not to be trifled with. You will find Sunsail Anchorage just to the west of Fairbreeze Village.",o="杀死5名失心者暴徒和5名失心者无赖，然后向永歌森林的游侠戴戈利恩复命。",oEN="Kill 5 Wretched Thugs and 5 Wretched Hooligans and report to Ranger Degolien in Eversong Woods.",p="你给失心者那些败类一点颜色瞧瞧了吗？",pEN="Did you teach those Wretched a lesson?",c="这应该足以让那些家伙汲取教训了。做得好，$n。",cEN="That'll teach them not to mess with us. Good work, <name>."}
Q[8893]={p="超级测蛋器是克格尔·曲藤的最新成果，看起来真是令人印象深刻。\n\n你刚刚接触到超级测蛋器的控制面板，它就劈啪作响了起来。",pEN="The Super Egg-O-Matic is the latest of Curgle Cranklehop's inventions. It is quite an impressive piece of machinery.\n\nThe Super Egg-O-Matic sputters wildly as you approach the control panel.",c="你将角鹰兽的蛋放入机器，随后里面传来了一些奇怪的机械声响和嘟嘟声。\n\n似乎测蛋器正在为这颗蛋称重、测量和包装。真是快捷又完善的服务！",cEN="You place the hippogryph egg into the machine. A series of beeps follows along with some strange mechanical sounds.\n\nIt appears that the Eggometer has weighed, measured, and packaged your egg. Now that's speedy service!"}
Q[8894]={d="这太可怕了！真的太可怕了！法师塔里发生了一些奇怪的事情，魔导师和他的学徒都已经跑光了，现在整座塔内都充斥着这些魔法能量构成的野兽！谁告诉我的？没有人告诉我！别问我没有人是谁……\n\n$c，你一定得帮我把些东西全部清理掉……我可没法在这个畸形怪兽满地乱跑的庭院里打扫卫生！",dEN="It's horrible, I tell you! Strange things happening in the spire, the magister and his apprentices run off, and then the next thing that you know, the whole grounds are overrun with these magical beasties! And who told Wyllithen? No one, that's who!\n\n<class>, you've got to help me clear some of these things out... I cannot maintain the grounds while these 'anomalies' are running amok!",o="杀死6只法力蛇和6只以太魔，然后向永歌森林达斯维瑟广场的看守者维林森复命。",oEN="Kill 6 Mana Serpents and 6 Ether Fiends and return to Groundskeeper Wyllithen at Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods.",p="你把他们处理掉了吗？消灭了一堆怪物吗？要是博学者暮萎又带着这些东西出现我该怎么办？",pEN="Have you taken care of it then? Did you deal with a good number of those magical anomalies? What would I do if Magister Duskwither were to reappear with all of these things lurking about?",c="好吧，我想这样也只好凑合了，不是吗？谢谢你的帮忙，$c。我只盼着能在魔导师回到达斯维瑟法师塔之前把这一团乱麻彻底收拾干净。\n\n拿着这点零钱吧，不多，但我眼下就这么多。走的时候要是愿意再顺手收拾几只小畜生，请自便。",cEN="Well, I suppose that will have to do, now won't it? Thanks for the help, <class>. I can only hope to get this mess completely cleaned up before the Magister returns to Duskwither Spire.\n\nTake this pocket change; it's not much but it's all that I have at the moment. Feel free to dispatch a few more of the beasties on your way out, if you'd be so kind."}
Q[8895]={d="看来你确实有一定的能力，$n，这让我很欣慰。既然你这么渴望能有所建树，那么我再给你一个任务。\n\n这是一封写给魔网监护者凯丹尼斯的信。他是一名奥术师，负责管理北部圣殿。从鹰翼广场出去后向西南方向前进就可以找到他。他是一位非常重要的人物，所以我希望你不要用无关紧要的琐事打扰他。",dEN="I'm pleased to discover that you're at least somewhat competent, <name>. I'll give you another task since you seem so eager to prove yourself.\n\nThis is a letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis, the arcanist in charge of the upkeep of the North Sanctum. Go southwest of Falconwing Square and you will find him. He is a very important person, so I hope you don't bother him too much with trivial chatter.",o="将无记号的信件送给永歌森林北部圣殿的魔网监护者凯丹尼斯。",oEN="Deliver the Unmarked Letter to Ley-Keeper Caidanis at the North Sanctum in Eversong Woods.",p="找我有事吗，$c？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="谢谢你，$n。我一直都在等这封信。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I've been expecting this letter."}
Q[8897]={d="我得在城门驻守巡逻，但是我心里一直想着我的恋人科兰拉。如果幸运的话，我还能注视她一会儿；但是，你瞧瞧我，我不过是个薪水微薄的小军官，随时都可能奉命赶赴前线。\n\n她会忘记我吗？城里有那么多男人，其中不乏有钱的家伙。\n\n不管怎样，我写了一些东西给她……如果你能帮我交给她的话，我会很感谢你的。",dEN="I've got to keep watch here at the gate, but I'm always worrying about my sweetheart, Colara. I only get to see her for a few hours, if I'm lucky, and well, just look at me. I've got a minor officer's pay and I could be called to the front any day now.\n\nWould she just forget about me? There are a lot of men in the city. A lot of rich ones.\n\nAnyways, I've scribbled some things down... nothing much, but if you could take it to her for me, that'd be great.",o="将亨德瑞克中尉精心书写的信件交给暴风城银行外面的科兰拉·迪恩。",oEN="Deliver Lieutenant Heldric's Carefully Penned Note to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.",p="你好啊，$g帅哥:美女;。有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?",c="喔，太贴心了！这是他第一次寄东西给我。你觉得他是认真的吗？\n\n克莱拉·迪恩？我猜这里面有戒指吧，喔，我好像讲话讲太快了。谢谢你。",cEN="Oh, isn't that sweet! This is the first time he's ever sent me something. Do you suppose he's getting serious?\n\nColara Heldric? I suppose it has a ring to it. Oh, but I'm getting ahead of myself. Thank you.\nRelated"}
Q[8898]={d="我上次去暴风城银行办事时遇到一位少女。她偷走了我的心。现在，我想她想得快发疯了！我想把这封信给她——我反反复复写了12次呢！\n\n这封信装满了我的心意，我一定要让她看看。\n\n如果你顺路的话，能帮我这个忙吗？",dEN="I met a lass in Stormwind when I was last there on the bank's business. She stole my heart away. Now, I can't stop thinking about her! I'd like to send her this message - I've rewritten it twelve times!\n\nThe mail is so full now, and I want to make sure it gets there.\n\nIf you're heading that way, could you help me?",o="将皱褶的信件交给暴风城银行外面的科兰拉·迪恩。",oEN="Deliver the Creased Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.",p="你好啊，$g帅哥:美女;，有什么事吗？",pEN="Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?",c="托眉克？喔，对。我当然记得他。他留着很性格的胡子，胡子下还有着亲切的笑容。\n\n啊，不敢相信他还记得我！",cEN="Tormek? Oh yes, I do remember him. He had quite a nice beard and smile underneath.\n\nAh, I can't believe he remembered me!\nRelated"}
Q[8899]={d="要怎么描述她的美丽呢？我脑海里涌现了数千个形容词，却不知道该挑哪些。\n\n这些词语扰乱了我的思绪，令我的舌头打结。\n\n我久久地思考着，却发现任何一个词语都不足以描述她清新脱俗的容貌。啊，不行，她一定得尽快看到我的情书，不然其他的追求者肯定会夺走她的芳心。",dEN="How to describe her beauty? Thousands of years of words and I am at a loss.\n\nThese mortals confound the mind and leave us babbling fools.\n\nI've stared at these words too long. No more eloquent meaning can I squeeze from them. No, she must have it now, or some other suitor will surely steal her eye.",o="将精美的信件交给暴风城银行外面的科兰拉·迪恩。",oEN="Deliver the Immaculate Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.",p="你好啊，$g帅哥:美女;。有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?",c="我之前从来都没收过这种耶。好可爱！",cEN="I've never received something like this before. How lovely!\nRelated"}
Q[8900]={d="她是如此悲伤，上次我路经幽暗城的时候就注意到了。我是说，她看起来很忧郁——你不这样认为吗？\n\n但是在一番交谈之后，我们的关系有了微妙的变化。除了她，谁都不能理解我心里所想的事儿。\n\n当我把这种感觉告诉别人时，他们总是嘲笑我，因此我再也没有跟她讲过话了。但是我好想她……你能帮我把这封信带给她吗？你得亲自把信送到她手上。",dEN="She was so sad. I could see that, once I saw past her state. I mean, she seemed sad - wouldn't you?\n\nBut after talking to her, there was a connection. I didn't think anyone could understand what I was thinking, but she could.\n\nWhen I told the others, they laughed at me, so I never spoke with her again. But I miss her. Can you take this letter to her for me? I want to be sure it finds her hands.",o="将轻折的信件交给幽暗城银行附近的艾琳娜·海东。",oEN="Deliver the Slightly Creased Note to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.",p="喔，我要怎么报答这个忙呢？",pEN="Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?",c="你知道兽人一向不善表达。当然我们也没机会去一探究竟。谢谢你带这个给我。",cEN="You wouldn't expect an orc to be so eloquent. Of course, we never really had a chance to know them before now. Thank you for bringing this to me.\nRelated"}
Q[8901]={d="你懂得爱吗，年轻人？直到前不久我遇见幽暗城来的姑娘埃莱妮娅之前，爱对我来说一直很陌生。我的族人本就很少与外族交往，更别提和一个被遗忘者了。\n\n可如今，我日日夜夜都在想着她。\n\n你愿意把这封信带给她吗？我想让她来莫高雷。但愿她会答应。",dEN="Have you ever known love, young one? It was a thing foreign to me until lately, when I met a girl from the Undercity, Elenia. It is rare enough for one of my kind to look outside our own, let alone one of the Forsaken.\n\nBut now thoughts of her occupy my mind both days and nights.\n\nIf you can, could you take this letter to her? I want her to come here to Mulgore. I hope that she will say yes.",o="将精心书写的信件交给幽暗城银行附近的艾琳娜·海东。",oEN="Deliver the Carefully Written Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.",p="喔，我要怎么报答这个忙呢？",pEN="Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?",c="泰玛写给我的信真是窝心。但是，虽然他的文字让我很感动，我还是不能考虑一个牛头人的爱。你想想，外型和思想我们都太不相同了。\n\n还好他不是一个人当面拿给我。我不忍心伤他的心啊。",cEN="What kind words Temma writes for me. But, as much as his words move me, I cannot consider the love of a tauren. In thoughts, body and mind we are too different.\n\nIt is good I do not have to receive these thoughts of his in person. I could not bear to break his heart.\nRelated"}
Q[8902]={d="很久很久以前，我就跟青梅竹马的艾琳娜订婚了。虽然我对她的爱恋在多年之前就消退了，但她依然时常闯入我的内心。\n\n也许，即使在经历了那么多事情之后，我们的心中还是为爱情留下了空间。\n\n我相信她也变了许多。你能帮我把这封信交给她吗？我自己去的话肯定会很紧张的。",dEN="A lifetime ago, I was betrothed to marry Elenia, my childhood sweetheart. It's been years since I thought about her last, but of late, she frequently occupies my thoughts.\n\nPerhaps, even with everything that has passed, there can be some room in each other's lives for our love.\n\nI'm sure she has changed, also. Can you deliver this letter to her for me? I am too nervous to give it in person.",o="将充满感情的信件交给幽暗城银行附近的艾琳娜·海东。",oEN="Deliver the Lovingly Composed Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.",p="喔，我要怎么报答这个忙呢？",pEN="Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?",c="这勾起了好久前的回忆，$n。艾妮亚·托尔。这本来应该是我的名字，你知道吗。我们本来会在湖岸边有一场美丽的婚礼。当他退休后，我们就会找个农场隐退。\n\n不过，那都是梦。\n\n如果他现在看到我，我怀疑他还会不会在我身上看到艾妮亚。只有冰冷的躯体和已死的心……",cEN="This brings back memories from a lifetime ago, <name>. Elenia Tor. That was going to be my name, you know. We would have a beautiful ceremony out on the shores of the lake. When he retired, we'd find a farm to retire to.\n\nSimple dreams, then.\n\nBut if he saw me now, I doubt he'd even see Elenia in me. Only cold flesh and a dead heart...\nRelated"}
Q[8905]={d="你好，$c。我这里有一些你可能会很感兴趣的东西。\n\n它跟你们这个职业的人平常穿着的那些护甲有点类似，但质量上远远好于你们现在所拥有的。要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通的套装组件。\n\n栖息在冬泉谷的霜刃豹和熊身上的血液有着某种我目前很需要的特性。给我带来一批样本，再把普通套装的手腕部分拿来，当然了，你还得支付一些金币。你会发现这其实是笔很划算的交易。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment. Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold. You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="将15份冬泉谷血样、20枚金币以及一副野性之心护腕交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="太好了！那我们就来交换吧。要和这套精良的护甲告别还真有些舍不得，但我想我暂时也用不上它了。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;再为我做些事，我也许愿意把剩下的部件也让给你。",cEN="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces."}
Q[8906]={d="你好，$c。我这里有一些你可能会很感兴趣的东西。\n\n它跟你们这个职业的人平常穿着的那些护甲有点类似，但质量上远远好于你们现在所拥有的。要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通的套装组件。\n\n栖息在冬泉谷的霜刃豹和熊身上的血液有着某种我目前很需要的特性。给我带来一批样本，再把普通套装的手腕部分拿来，当然了，你还得支付一些金币。你会发现这其实是笔很划算的交易。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment. Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold. You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="将15份冬泉谷血样、20枚金币，以及一副野兽追猎者护腕交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Beaststalker's Bindings to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="太好了！那我们就来交换吧。要和这套精良的护甲告别还真有些舍不得，但我想我暂时也用不上它了。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;再为我做些事，我也许愿意把剩下的部件也让给你。",cEN="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces."}
