Q[8910]={d="你好，$c。我这里有一些你可能会很感兴趣的东西。\n\n它跟你们这个职业的人平常穿着的那些护甲有点类似，但质量上远远好于你们现在所拥有的。要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通的套装组件。\n\n栖息在冬泉谷的霜刃豹和熊身上的血液有着某种我目前很需要的特性。给我带来一批样本，再把普通套装的手腕部分拿来，当然了，你还得支付一些金币。你会发现这其实是笔很划算的交易。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment. Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold. You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="将15份冬泉谷血液样本、20枚金币和一副暗影之皮护腕交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Shadowcraft Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="太好了！那我们就来交换吧。要和这套精良的护甲告别还真有些舍不得，但我想我暂时也用不上它了。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;再为我做些事，我也许愿意把剩下的部件也让给你。",cEN="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces."}
Q[8911]={d="你好，$c。我有一些你可能会感兴趣的东西。\n\n它很像你们那个职业的人会穿戴的典型护甲，但是等级高很多。只要你帮我一个小忙，我愿意和你交换一件普通装备。\n\n冬泉谷的霜刃豹和熊的鲜血里有我目前需要的成分。帮我带来足够的样本还有护腕装备，以及一点金子。你会发现你的付出是值得的。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment. Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold. You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="将15份冬泉谷血液样本、20枚金币和一副恐惧之雾护腕交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Dreadmist Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="太好了！那我们就来交换吧。要和这套精良的护甲告别还真有些舍不得，但我想我暂时也用不上它了。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;再为我做些事，我也许愿意把剩下的部件也让给你。",cEN="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces."}
Q[8912]={d="幸会，$c。我有样东西或许会让你感兴趣。\n\n我手上有一套和你这个职业所穿的十分相似的护甲，但品质要高得多。只要你帮我一个小忙，我愿意用它来换一副普通的护腕。\n\n生活在冬泉谷的霜刃豹和熊的血液里含有我眼下需要的成分。给我带一份足量的样本，连同那副护腕和一小笔金币。你会发现这番辛苦是值得的。|n",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've something that might interest you.\n\nI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.\n\nThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment. Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold. You shall find the effort worth your while.",o="将15份冬泉谷血样、20枚金币，以及一副勇气护腕交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bracers of Valor to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you brought me what I requested of you, <name>?",c="太好了！那我们就来交换吧。要和这套精良的护甲告别还真有些舍不得，但我想我暂时也用不上它了。\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;再为我做些事，我也许愿意把剩下的部件也让给你。",cEN="Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.\n\nIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces."}
Q[8913]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样品、20枚金币以及一副野性之心护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8914]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样品、20枚金币以及一副野兽追猎者护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Beaststalker's Bindings to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bindings were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8915]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样本、20枚金币和一套魔导师的护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Magister's Bindings to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bindings were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8916]={d="你好，$c！从你的举止我就能看出，你在这世上见识过、经历过许多。不过我敢打赌，你从没见过这样一件护甲。\n\n帮我一个小忙，我就愿意用它跟你换一副普通的护腕。\n\n我需要一份足量的、采自希利苏斯蜘蛛和蝎子的毒液。把它连同几枚金币一起带来，我就跟你交换。|n",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样本、20枚金币和一副虔诚护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Devout Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8917]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样本、20枚金币和一副暗影之皮护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Shadowcraft Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8918]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样本、20枚金币和一副元素束缚护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bindings of Elements to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. That old goblin shall be quite happy with this blood.\n\nThose bindings were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8919]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样品、20枚金币以及一副鬼雾护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Dreadmist Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8920]={d="嗨，$c！从你的言行举止就能看出你是个历经沧桑、见多识广的家伙。但是我打赌你没有见过这么一件护甲。\n\n要是你能帮我一个小忙的话，我愿意拿它来从你手里换一件普通套装的手腕部分。\n\n我需要大量生活在希利苏斯地区的蝎子和蜘蛛的毒液。把毒液样本带给我，再支付一些金币，我就跟你交换。",dEN="Hail, <class>! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.\n\nPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.\n\nI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.",o="将15份希利苏斯毒液样本、20枚金币和一副英勇护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bracers of Valor to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你把我要的东西都带来了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the items I require, <name>?",c="啊，没错。穆克斯会对此非常满意的。\n\n那副护腕原本属于一整套护甲。如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;继续帮我，我愿意考虑把剩下的部分也让给你。",cEN="Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.\n\nThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it."}
Q[8921]={d="啊，你需要我最新的研究产品……超维度幽灵显形器！不过遗憾的是，我已经消耗光了所有的人力和资金，没法继续研究了。\n\n你说你愿意帮忙？太好了！我们首先需要建立起一个能够收集亡灵物质的设备，制造一台灵质提纯器！这可不是一项简单的工作，$n。\n\n我需要你给我找来一个奥金转换器，一些强效不灭精华和一些石鳞鱼油。我还需要一些来自燃烧平原的岩浆流里的火山灰，用来制造过滤网。",dEN="Ah, you're in need of my latest project... the extra-dimensional ghost revealer! Unfortunately I've run out of funds and manpower.\n\nYou're willing to help? Excellent! Our first task is to build a device to harvest the very fabric of death! Building an ectoplasmic distiller won't be an easy task, <name>.\n\nI'll need you to bring me an arcanite converter, some greater eternal essences and stonescale oil. I'll also need some volcanic ash from the lava pools in the Burning Steppes to build a filter.",o="将1个精密奥金转换器、4份强效不灭精华、10瓶石鳞鱼油、25份火山灰和40枚金币交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan with 1 Delicate Arcanite Converter, 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil, 25 Volcanic Ash and 40 gold.",p="我知道材料有点贵……但是我保证每一项物品都是必需的！",pEN="I understand the materials are a bit pricey... but I promise you every last one of them shall be necessary!",c="这正是我要的材料。你也及时赶上了，$n！\n\n再过一下子你的提纯器马上就要派上用场了！同时，收下这个作为你协助我完成计划的奖励！",cEN="These are precisely the materials I needed. Quite timely too, <name>!\n\nIn mere moments I will have your distiller ready to go! In the meantime, take this as a reward for aiding me in my project."}
Q[8922]={d="我必须想个办法与安泰恩·哈尔蒙谈谈……更确切地说，和他的鬼魂好好谈谈！\n\n我知道有个技师对这种超自然的东西有着一种奇怪的兴趣。他宣称他可以造出一台能让与死者对话的机器！\n\n你收集来的血其实是为他所准备的，到加基森去，把这些带给他，就算是支付给他的酬劳吧！",dEN="I must find a way to speak with Anthion Harmon... or more specifically, his ghost!\n\nI know of an engineer with a queer interest in the supernatural. He claims he can build a machine that allows him to speak with the dead!\n\nThe blood you collected was intended for him; travel to Gadgetzan and bring it to him as payment for his services!",o="将封起来的血液容器交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Bring the Sealed Blood Container to Mux Manascrambler inside Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You've something for me?",c="太好了！我正好需要它！\n\n你说是德莉娜派你来的？",cEN="Excellent! Just as I was running low!\n\nYou say Deliana sent you?"}
Q[8923]={d="经历了那一切之后你还留下来，胆子可真不小。要么就是你对我给你的那件护甲兴味盎然。如果你还想继续帮我，我这儿还有的是。\n\n你要的那些毒液样本是给我的一位熟人穆克斯·曼纳拼凑者准备的，他是个对超自然现象感兴趣的工程师。他最新的项目是一台能与死者交流的装置！我最后的希望就是联系上安西恩，弄清我这处境的更多线索。",dEN="You must be quite brave to have stuck around after that. That or I've piqued your interest with the piece of armor I gave you. There is more from where that came from, if you're still interested in aiding me.\n\nThe venom samples you collected are for an acquaintance of mine, Mux Manascrambler, an engineer with an interest in the supernatural. His latest project consists of a device that allows you to communicate with the dead! My last hope is to contact Anthion and find out more about my situation.",o="将封起来的毒液容器交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Take the Sealed Venom Container to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",p="你想跟我谈谈吗？",pEN="You wish to speak to me?",c="太好了！我正好需要它！\n\n你说是莫克瓦尔派你来的？",cEN="Excellent! Just as I was running low!\n\nYou say Mokvar sent you?"}
Q[8924]={d="这真是一件完美的器物，若能应用在工程学里就太好了，我不得不这么说！恐怕，你现在需要跑点远路了，得去一些我们所必需的虚体亡灵生物里的灵质来。\n\n你看，不同的气候将会导致幽灵体的亡灵生物的灵质不同。希利苏斯的被折磨的暗夜精灵，冬泉谷的上层精灵幽灵，以及东瘟疫之地的幽灵和女妖或许能分别给我们提供不同的灵质样本。在收集之前，一定要把萃取器放在它们附近！",dEN="A fine piece of engineering, if I do say so myself! You will need to travel a bit, I'm afraid, in order to find the incorporeal undead we require.\n\nYou see, different climates lend different consistencies to the spectral fabric of the dead. The tortured night elves of Silithus, the spirits of the highborne from Winterspring and the ghosts and banshees of the Eastern Plaguelands should give us the different types of ectoplasm we need. Be sure to place the distiller nearby before you harvest them!",o="使用灵质提纯器在希利苏斯收集12份烧焦的灵质，在冬泉谷收集12份冰冻的灵质，以及在东瘟疫之地收集12份稳定的灵质。然后将这些东西与灵质提纯器一起交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Use the Ectoplasmic Distiller near incorporeal undead to collect 12 Scorched Ectoplasms in Silithus, 12 Frozen Ectoplasms in Winterspring and 12 Stable Ectoplasms in the Eastern Plaguelands. Bring them along with the Ectoplasmic Distiller back to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",p="你收集好魂能了吗，$r？",pEN="Have you gathered the ectoplasm yet, <race>?",c="太好了，这些一定很棒！\n\n汲取这些物质里超自然的能量，我们就能与那些灵魂尚未离开这世界的人接触了！",cEN="Yes, these will do great!\n\nBy tapping into the otherworldly energies contained within these substances we'll be able to reach out to those whose souls haven't quite left this world yet!"}
Q[8925]={d="接下来我们需要找到一种稳定且便于携带的能量，以便维持灵质的活性。我听说有个名叫熔岩领主博奥克的强大土元素，它的心脏是个富含能量的岩浆核，永远地在不停地散发着热能！\n\n据说它就居住在燃烧平原的大熔炉。把它的心脏取来，这样我们就可以获得足够的富含热能的液体来维持超维度幽灵显形器的运转了！",dEN="Next we shall need to find a stable and portable source of energy to keep the ectoplasm active. I've heard rumors of a mighty elemental called Magma Lord Bokk, whose heart is a powerful magma core - an endless supply of heat!\n\nIt's said he can be found in the Burning Steppes, south of Blackrock Mountain. Bring the magma core to me and we shall have enough juice to power the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!",o="前往燃烧平原，找到熔岩领主博奥克，把它的岩浆核心交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Find Magma Lord Bokk in the Burning Steppes, obtain his Magma Core and bring it to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",p="你见到麦格玛了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you found the Magma Lord, <name>?",c="你成功了！这将有足够的能量启动超空间鬼魂显像机！",cEN="You've done it! This will certainly provide enough energy to power up the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!"}
Q[8926]={d="你信守承诺将莫克斯建构的仪器带来了。我相信如果我给你奖赏，你会感兴趣的。若你想升级的话，就把腰带和一整套手套拿来给我。我承诺我交还给你的一定是更为精良的物品。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将野性之心腰带，一套野性之心手套带给铁炉堡的德莉娜。",oEN="Bring a Wildheart Belt and a set of Wildheart Gloves Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8927]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将野性之心腰带和1套野性之心手套带给奥格玛的莫克瓦。",oEN="Bring a Wildheart Belt and a set of Wildheart Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8928]={d="那个核心可以提供足够的岩浆来驱动我们的装置，现在我们只需要制造一根耐性足够，不会被熔掉的导流棒来引导能量就可以了！\n\n我曾在冬泉谷见过一个贩卖各类奇特货物的小鬼。他似乎有一根由某种元素制成的棒子，应该就是最完美的了。现在我真想抽自己的耳光，为什么当初没有买下它。\n\n他就住在暗语峡谷入口附近的一处洞穴里。看看你能不能找到他吧！\n\n记住，超过40金币就别要了，这是他过去给我开的价！",dEN="The core will provide us with enough juice to power our device; now we just have to build a rod that can channel that energy without melting.\n\nI met an imp in Winterspring that sold all manner of exotic goods. He had an elemental rod that would do perfectly. I'm kicking myself in the head right now for not having bought it.\n\nHe lives inside a cave in the entrance to Darkwhisper Gorge. Sneak in there and try to find him.\n\nMake sure he only charges you forty gold; that's the price he quoted me!",o="到冬泉谷南部的暗语峡谷入口附近去，在那里的一处洞穴内的某个小鬼那里购买一根恶魔元素之杖，并把它交给加基森的穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波。",oEN="Search for an imp inside a cave at the entrance of Darkwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, purchase a Fel Elemental Rod and return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.",p="你找到暗语峡谷里的小鬼了吗？",pEN="Have you had any luck finding the imp in Darkwhisper Gorge?",c="你办到了！这支棍棒非常完美。现在把所有东西放在一起……",cEN="You did it! This rod will do perfectly. Now to put it all together..."}
Q[8929]={d="好吧，看来我们除了试试地精的发明外别无他法。据说安泰恩在试图进入斯坦索姆时被天灾军团砍翻了。\n\n试试使用这个设备，看看你能从安泰恩的灵魂那里得到什么消息。",dEN="Well, nothing left for us to do but try out the goblin's invention. Word has it that Anthion was mowed down by the undead legions of Stratholme as he tried to enter its gates.\n\nTry using the device there and find out whatever Anthion knew.",o="在斯坦索姆的入口处使用超维度幽灵显形器，然后与安泰恩·哈尔蒙的灵魂交谈。",oEN="Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon.",c="是德莉娜叫你来找我的？我会尽力帮你，但首先我必须请你帮我一个大忙。",cEN="Deliana had you contact me? I'll do my best to help you, but first I must ask a great favor of you."}
end)(AscensionCN.QuestData)
;(function(Q)
Q[8930]={d="非常好，$n。后面唯一要做的事就是把这个地精的发明拿去测试一下了。据说安泰恩在尝试进入斯坦索姆的时候被亡灵军团干掉了。\n\n到那里去用一下这个装置吧，看看你是否真的能跟死人说话！",dEN="Very well, <name>. All that remains is to put the goblin's invention to the test. Word has it that Anthion was slain by the undead legions of Stratholme as he tried to enter its gates.\n\nTry using the device there and see if, indeed, you can speak with the dead!",o="在斯坦索姆的入口处使用超维度幽灵显形器，然后与安泰恩·哈尔蒙的灵魂交谈。",oEN="Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon.",c="是德莉娜叫你来找我的？我会尽力帮你，但首先我必须请你帮我一个大忙。",cEN="Mokvar had you contact me? I'll do my best to help you, but first I must ask a great favor of you."}
Q[8931]={d="你做到了你所承诺的事，把穆克斯制造的装备给我带了回来，那么我也按承诺给予你一件不错的奖励。把你原先使用的腰带和手套拿来吧，我会帮你升级它们。我敢保证，新的装备会比原来的好得多。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.",o="将一条野兽追猎者腰带和一副野兽追猎者手套交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Bring a Beaststalker's Belt and a set of Beaststalker's Gloves to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8932]={d="你信守承诺将莫克斯建构的仪器带来了。我相信如果我给你奖赏，你会感兴趣的。若你想升级的话，就把普通腰带和整套手套拿来给我。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.",o="将一条魔导师的腰带和一整套魔导师的手套交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。|n",oEN="Bring a Magister's Belt and a set of Magister's Gloves to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8933]={d="你做到了你所承诺的事，把穆克斯制造的装备给我带了回来，那么我也按承诺给予你一件不错的奖励。把你原先使用的腰带和手套拿来吧，我会帮你升级它们。我敢保证，新的装备会比原来的好得多。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将一条光铸腰带和一整套光铸护手交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。|n",oEN="Bring a Lightforge Belt and a set of Lightforge Gauntlets to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8934]={d="你信守承诺将莫克斯建构的仪器带来了。我相信如果我给你奖赏，你会感兴趣的。若你想升级的话，就把腰带和一整套手套拿来给我。我承诺我给你的一定是超过精良的物品。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将虔诚腰带和1套虔诚手套带给铁炉堡的德莉娜。",oEN="Bring a Devout Belt and a set of Devout Gloves to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8935]={d="你做到了你所承诺的事，把穆克斯制造的装备给我带了回来，那么我也按承诺给予你一件不错的奖励。把你原先使用的腰带和手套拿来吧，我会帮你升级它们。我敢保证，新的装备会比原来的好得多。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将一条迅影腰带和一副迅影手套交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8936]={d="你做到了你所承诺的事，把穆克斯制造的装备给我带了回来，那么我也按承诺给予你一件不错的奖励。把你原先使用的腰带和手套拿来吧，我会帮你升级它们。我敢保证，新的装备会比原来的好得多。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将一条鬼雾腰带和一副鬼雾手套交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Bring a Dreadmist Belt and a set of Dreadmist Wraps to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8937]={d="你信守承诺将莫克斯建构的仪器带来了。我相信如果我给你奖赏，你会感兴趣的。若你想升级的话，就把腰带和一整套手套拿来给我。我承诺我交还给你的将会是更精良的物品。",dEN="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",o="将勇气腰带和1套勇气护手带给铁炉堡的德莉娜。",oEN="Bring a Belt of Valor and a set of Gauntlets of Valor to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交易了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the trade?",c="你已达成交易，我也会保留我的。\n\n记住，我会保留最好的部分，就等你完成任务了。",cEN="You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.\n\nJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished."}
Q[8938]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将驭兽者腰带和1套驭兽者手套带给奥格玛的莫克瓦。",oEN="Bring a Beaststalker's Belt and a set of Beaststalker's Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8939]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将博学者腰带和1套博学者手套带给奥格玛的莫克瓦。",oEN="Bring a Magister's Belt and a set of Magister's Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8940]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将虔诚腰带和1套虔诚手套带给奥格玛的莫克瓦。",oEN="Bring a Devout Belt and a set of Devout Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8941]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将迅影腰带和1套迅影手套带给奥格玛的莫克瓦。",oEN="Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8942]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在就交换你的腰带和护手。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将一条元素束带和一整套元素护手交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Bring a Cord of Elements and a set of Gauntlets of Elements to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8943]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在我要把你的腰带和手套换掉。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将一条恐惧之雾腰带和一整套恐惧之雾护腕交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Bring a Dreadmist Belt and a set of Dreadmist Wraps to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8944]={d="你证明了自己是个非常可靠的人，$n。我相信你会帮我度过这次的困境，我会依照你的表现来给予奖励。\n\n现在就交换你的腰带和护手。如果我们一起度过了这个难关，我就会把剩下的装备都做给你。",dEN="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, <name>. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\n\nFor now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",o="将一条英勇腰带和一整套英勇护手交给奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔。|n",oEN="Bring a Belt of Valor and a set of Gauntlets of Valor to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;交换了吗？",pEN="You're ready to perform the exchange?",c="我们的协议仍在。记住，这还只是个前菜而已。帮我从受诅咒的命运解除开来，我会奖励你超强大的物品。",cEN="Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power."}
Q[8945]={d="我会把我所知道的一切都告诉你的，$n。但现在还有些更紧迫的事情要做。\n\n我挚爱的妻子被该死的瑞文戴尔男爵和他手下的亡灵渣滓们给监禁了。\n\n我过去就非常反对她加入那个什么银色黎明的愚蠢组织，不过现在这并不重要了。你一定得帮我这个忙，完成我的遗愿——从男爵的魔爪中救出我的伊思达！",dEN="I'll provide you the information you ask for, <name>. But more pressing matters are at hand.\n\nMy beloved wife has been taken prisoner by Rivendare's undead scum.\n\nI strongly objected to her joining the Argent Dawn's foolish crusade, yet that's not of importance anymore. You must finish what I attempted to do, you must rescue Ysida from the clutches of the Baron!",o="进入斯坦索姆，从瑞文戴尔男爵手中救出伊思达。",oEN="Go into Stratholme and rescue Ysida Harmon from Baron Rivendare.",p="告诉我，亚希达还活着吗？",pEN="Tell me, is Ysida alive?",c="谢谢你救了我……我很担心活不了了。请收下这个作为我小小的心意。\n\n安希恩他……不是……他不能是……",cEN="Thank you for rescuing me... I feared for my life. Please accept this as a small token of my gratitude.\n\nAnthion is... no... he can't be..."}
Q[8946]={d="我的爱人在赶来营救我的途中不幸丧命，这是多么悲惨的命运。不过既然你说自己有跟灵魂交谈的能力……\n\n把这个小盒子交给他，告诉他我过得很好。让他的灵魂不要继续在世间游荡了，我已经无法承受内心的伤痛。\n\n再见，$n。你心肠真好，我会永远记得你的。",dEN="It is the cruelest of fates that my beloved has perished while trying to rescue me. Yet, you claim to possess the ability to converse with him.\n\nBring him this locket as proof that I am well. He must not linger in this world; my heart would not be able to bear it.\n\nFarewell, <name>. I shall be in your debt always.",o="将伊思达的盒子交给东瘟疫之地的安泰恩·哈尔蒙。",oEN="Bring Ysida's Locket to Anthion Harmon in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="亚希达……她还活着吗？",pEN="Ysida... is she alive?",c="那个小盒子……你找到她了！我终于可以瞑目了。\n\n我现在会回答你任何的问题，$n。但是要快一点，我在这个世界的时间不多了。",cEN="That locket... you found her! I can rest in peace at long last.\n\nI shall now answer any questions you might have, <name>. But make haste, my time in this world is not long."}
Q[8947]={d="我们竟没有意识到瓦塔拉克勋章的重要性，它被分割成了几部分，分别由不同的人保存着。第一部分被一个名叫塞尔德林的矮人拿走了。我曾尝试着把它要回来，可那个矮人几乎把我活活打死。要想拿回它，你恐怕得用点暴力手段。\n\n有关这个塞尔德林的近况……他好像在黑铁矮人那边，成了一名角斗士。想让他跟你打，你恐怕得先通过一些挑战。\n\n把这些材料都收集来，你会用到它们的。",dEN="We didn't realize the importance of Valthalak's medallion, so it was divided along with the rest of the spoils. The first piece was taken by a dwarf named Theldren. I tried to retrieve it from him and he beat me within an inch of my life. You shall have to take the fragment by force.\n\nLast I heard of him, he'd become a gladiator for the Dark Iron dwarves. Getting him to fight you is going to present a bit of a challenge, though.\n\nGather the following materials for me. You're going to need them.",o="将3块黑铁锭、20张魔化皮、3块月布和4块熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地的安泰恩·哈尔蒙。",oEN="Bring 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth and 4 Cured Rugged Hides to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你弄到我要的那些材料了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you obtain the materials I asked for, <name>?",c="很好。我要把这些东西转化的更符合我们的需求。",cEN="Excellent. I shall transmute these into something more suitable to our needs."}
Q[8948]={d="塞尔德林可不是一个愿意参加一场公平决斗的家伙。我做了这面旗子，上面绘有他家族的纹章。\n\n只需要再附加上一点小小的巫术，这面旗子就可以让他无法抗拒地迎接他人的挑战。\n\n我有个老熟人叫法尔林，他知道如何附加上这个小巫术。对于……对于激怒他人，他有一种非常特别的方式。你可以在厄运之槌的图书馆里找到他。",dEN="Theldren is not one to willingly participate in a fair fight. I've shaped this banner to display his family colors.\n\nWith some additional sorcery, this banner shall provoke him in a way he won't be able to resist.\n\nAn old acquaintance of mine named Falrin knows the exact procedure required. He has a particular way of... aggravating people. You shall find him at the library in Dire Maul.",o="将未完成的挑战之旗交给厄运之槌图书馆内的法尔林·树影。",oEN="Take the incomplete Banner of Provocation to Falrin Treeshaper at the library in Dire Maul.",p="有话快说，$g陌生人:陌生人;，你没看见我正忙着吗？",pEN="Speak up stranger, can't you see I'm busy?",c="你说，安希恩叫你来的？我还以为他已经死了呢。我想我一生中听过更奇怪的事。\n\n那么，很好。你希望我如何处置这面旌旗？",cEN="Anthion sent you, you say? I thought he was dead. I guess I've heard stranger things in my life.\n\nVery well, then. What is it you want me to do with this banner?"}
Q[8949]={d="是的，没错，我确实对你所想要的这种强化魔法十分熟悉，$c。可我并不是那种随随便便就免费施恩的人，哪怕你是我的老朋友介绍来的。\n\n对于那些粗鄙野蛮的食人魔邻居，我除了讨厌与憎恨以外就没有其他情感了。不光是那些戈多克大王的手下，我还特别讨厌那些追随欧莫克大王的食人魔。\n\n我要你杀了他们。杀了他们！全杀光！把他们脖子上常挂的珠串给我拿回来，做为证明。去干吧，让我满意的话，我就考虑一下你的要求。",dEN="Yes, it is true that I am familiar with this enchantment you require, <class>. Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend.\n\nI hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors. And not only them, I hate the followers of Omokk just as much as I hate those that follow King Gordok.\n\nI want you to kill them. Kill lots of them! Bring me the beads they carry around their neck as proof of your work. Do this and we shall talk about your request.",o="在厄运之槌和黑石塔的食人魔身上收集25串食人魔珠串，然后回去向厄运之槌图书馆内的法尔林·树影复命。",oEN="Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.",p="你完成了我要你帮的忙吗，$n？",pEN="Have you performed the favor I asked of you, <name>?",c="嗯……很奇怪，我对我哥哥死于那些野蛮人手上仍然无法释怀。\n\n嗯，现在是讨论你的协议的时候了。看看我能帮你做什么。",cEN="Hmmm... strangely enough I don't feel any better about my brother's death at the hands of those brutes.\n\nWell, you held your end of the bargain. Let's see what I can do for you."}
Q[8950]={d="我能按照你的要求在挑战之旗上附魔，$n。不幸的是，我恰好没有那种附魔材料。那可是个稀罕物，有些人甚至把它当作护身符来用。\n\n我需要这一带的建筑里面的艾德雷斯亡灵生物的精华，一些黑暗符文，以及一些大块魔光碎片。将附魔材料交给我，我就能帮你完成任务。",dEN="I can place the enchantment you require on the banner quite easily, <name>. Unfortunately I don't have the materials I need as it is very rarely that someone asks for this sort of charm.\n\nI will require the essence of one of the Eldreth ghosts that haunt these halls, a handful of Scholomance dark runes and some large brilliant shards. Bring me these reagents and I shall perform this task for you.",o="将1份游荡鬼灵的精华、4个黑暗符文和8个大块魔光碎片交给厄运之槌图书馆内的法尔林·树影。",oEN="Bring the following to Falrin Treeshaper inside Dire Maul: 1 Jeering Spectre's Essence, 4 Dark Runes and 8 Large Brilliant Shards.",p="你收集到我需要的材料了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you gathered the materials I require, <name>?",c="很好，这些东西会很有用。待我完成后，世界上没有任何力量能阻止牺牲者接受你的挑战。",cEN="Yes, these will do just fine. After I'm done, no force in the world will be able to stop your victim from accepting your challenge."}
Q[8951]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到德莉娜那里，告诉她布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和她谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着野性之心长靴，野性之心褶裙和野性之心肩甲回到铁炉堡的德莉娜那里。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Wildheart Boots, a Wildheart Kilt and Wildheart Spaulders.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8952]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到德莉娜那里，告诉她布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和她谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着驭兽者长靴，驭兽者短裤和驭兽者衬肩回到铁炉堡的德莉娜那里。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Beaststalker's Boots, Beaststalker's Pants and Beaststalker's Mantle.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8953]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到德莉娜那里，告诉她布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和她谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着博学者长靴，博学者护腿和博学者衬肩回到铁炉堡的德莉娜那里。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Magister's Boots, Magister's Leggings and Magister's Mantle.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8954]={d="瓦塔拉克的灵魂就封印在这枚护符里。因为贪婪，我们愚蠢地将它分成了好几部分，丝毫不了解这会为我们带来怎样残酷的诅咒。\n\n唯一解除瓦塔拉克的法术的办法，就是将这枚勋章重新组合在一起。回到德莉亚娜那里去，告诉她说，伯德雷已经是她找齐剩余部分的最后希望了。顺便跟她提一下你应得的报酬。\n\n我只希望能从此安息。祝你好运……你会非常需要运气的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带上一双光铸战靴、一条光铸腿铠和一副光铸肩铠，回去向铁炉堡的德莉亚娜复命。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Lightforge Boots, Lightforge Legplates and Lightforge Spaulders.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8955]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到德莉娜那里，告诉她布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和她谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着虔诚软鞋，虔诚长裙和虔诚衬肩回到铁炉堡的德莉娜那里。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Devout Sandals, Devout Skirt and Devout Mantle.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8956]={d="瓦塔拉克的灵魂就封印在这枚护符里。因为贪婪，我们愚蠢地将它分成了好几部分，丝毫不了解这会为我们带来怎样残酷的诅咒。\n\n唯一解除瓦塔拉克的法术的办法，就是将这枚勋章重新组合在一起。回到德莉亚娜那里去，告诉她说，伯德雷已经是她找齐剩余部分的最后希望了。顺便跟她提一下你应得的报酬。\n\n我只希望能从此安息。祝你好运……你会非常需要运气的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带上一双迅影长靴、一条迅影短裤和一副迅影肩甲，回去向铁炉堡的德莉亚娜复命。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Shadowcraft Boots, Shadowcraft Pants and Shadowcraft Spaulders.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8957]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着元素长靴，元素护腿和元素护肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Boots of Elements, Kilt of Elements and Pauldrons of Elements.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼中看出你有很多话想跟我说，$n。让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[8958]={d="瓦塔拉克的灵魂就封印在这枚护符里。因为贪婪，我们愚蠢地将它分成了好几部分，丝毫不了解这会为我们带来怎样残酷的诅咒。\n\n唯一解除瓦塔拉克的法术的办法，就是将这枚勋章重新组合在一起。回到德莉亚娜那里去，告诉她说，伯德雷已经是她找齐剩余部分的最后希望了。顺便跟她提一下你应得的报酬。\n\n我只希望能从此安息。祝你好运……你会非常需要运气的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带上一双鬼雾便鞋、一条鬼雾护腿和一副鬼雾衬肩，回去向铁炉堡的德莉亚娜复命。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8959]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存封在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到德莉娜那里，告诉她布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和她谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together. Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着勇气战靴，勇气腿铠和勇气肩甲回到铁炉堡的德莉娜那里。",oEN="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Boots of Valor, Legplates of Valor and Spaulders of Valor.",p="你回来了，$n。你一定要告诉我你发现的所有事情。但是首先让我们先来看看你的奖励。",pEN="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="我真不敢相信，我们竟然差点因为一枚愚蠢的护符送命！你$g确定:确定;安西恩提到的是博德利？\n\n好吧，你的活儿干完了，那我们赶紧把你的报酬了结了吧。",cEN="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way."}
Q[8960]={d="那么也就是说我们需要找回勋章的其他部分？要找伯德雷可有点麻烦。他去了黑石山，想尝试重新进入黑石塔，结果就再也没有回来了。\n\n我建议你带上地精的那台设备吧，万一最坏的结果发生了，你也有办法应对。",dEN="So we need to recover the rest of the medallion? Finding Bodley's going to be a bit of a headache. He went back to Blackrock Mountain to attempt to re-enter Blackrock Spire and never came back.\n\nI'd suggest taking the goblin's ghost revealing device with you, as I fear the worst might have happened.",o="到黑石山去，使用超维度幽灵显形器找到伯德雷。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Mountain and use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",c="我好高兴你能看到我，终于有人能跟我说说话！\n\n你能帮帮我们吗，$n？帮帮我们将以前所犯的错导入正轨？如果你真的有瓦萨拉克领主护符上半块，我就能指引你拿到另外那2块，然后拼凑好就行了。\n\n喔，对了，你好，我叫布德利。很高兴认识你！",cEN="I am so glad that you can see me. Finally someone to talk to!\n\nWill you help us, <name>? Help to undo the wrong that we perpetrated and put things to right? If it's true that you already have the Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, then I think I can point you in the right direction to acquire the other two parts, reunite them and put an end to all of this.\n\nOh, by the way, hello, my name is Bodley. Nice to meet you!"}
Q[8961]={d="要召唤瓦萨拉克领主，我们首先得集齐护符另外的三分之二。为此我们需要一个火盆，以及一些在其中燃烧的特殊炭火。\n\n有三位火焰贵族掌握着我们所需的东西：黑石深渊的伊森迪奥斯领主、黑石塔的烈焰护卫埃伯希尔，以及安戈洛尔环山的布雷泽朗纳。从他们每人身上收集一块残骸，然后带着一个神圣火盆回来见我——如果你在银色黎明中享有崇敬声望，就能从他们那里买到。",dEN="In order to summon Lord Valthalak we're first going to need to gather the other two-thirds of the amulet. To do that we need to get a brazier and some special coals to burn in it.\n\nThere are three nobles of fire, Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths, Pyroguard Emberseer in Blackrock Spire and Blazerunner in Un'goro Crater, with what we need. Collect from each a piece of their remains, and then return to me with a Hallowed Brazier, which can be purchased from the Argent Dawn if you are honored by them.",o="收集伊森迪奥斯的焚化石、埃伯希尔的余烬和布雷泽朗纳的炽热残骸，连同神圣火盆一起，交给黑石山内的博德利。",oEN="Gather the Incendicite of Incendius, the Ember of Emberseer and the Blazing Remains of Blazerunner, along with a Hallowed Brazier, and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="都是因为我们的愚蠢……接下上一个工作是我们的宿命。如果我们没有偷走瓦萨拉克领主在护符里部分的灵魂如果我们佣兵公司的人没有那么贪婪瓜分护符。我今天就不会死了，或许正喝着啤酒，或是逗弄我的孩子。\n\n$n，别让我们佣兵公司不光彩的贪婪也成为你的宿命。",pEN="It was our folly... our doom that we took that last job. If only we hadn't inadvertently stolen Lord Valthalak's spirit, which was contained in the amulet; if only there weren't those in our mercenary group that had been so greedy and divided it up amongst themselves. I'd be alive today, maybe tossing back a beer, or tossing one of my kids into the air.\n\n<name>, don't let the avarice of the ignoble in our old mercenary company be your doom as well.",c="我很欣赏你，$n，但没时间可浪费了。我这就把下一个任务交给你，因为在我们继续之前，你还需要弄到几样重要的材料。\n\n等你觉得自己已经$g准备好:准备好;迎接前方的挑战时，再来跟我谈谈。",cEN="I'm impressed, <class>, but there's no time to lose. I will give you your next task, because you will still need to acquire a few more important components before we can proceed.\n\nSpeak to me again when you feel that you are ready for the challenge that lies ahead."}
Q[8962]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们有了火盆和点燃它的方法，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n莫尔·灰蹄，我们最重要的德鲁伊，在塞纳里奥议会有很多亲密的朋友，其中有些人已被异种消灭。我要你去希利苏斯从雷戈虫巢的异种身上取得德鲁伊遗骨。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",o="取得德鲁伊的遗体，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将遗体的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至黑石塔低层，进入指挥官沃恩在塔萨洛尔住的房间，并使用火盆召唤我老友莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂。护符一天不从他那里被取走，他就一天不能安息。",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the remains into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the lower portion of Blackrock Spire, to the chamber where War Master Voone resides in Tazz'Alaor, and use the brazier to summon forth the corrupted spirit of my former cohort, Mor Grayhoof. He cannot rest until the amulet piece is taken from him."}
Q[8963]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们有了火盆和点燃它的方法，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n伊萨利恩，我们的女祭司，在星风村的冬泉谷长大。我要你去冬泉谷南边的霜语峡谷，从那里的霜槌巨人身上取得星风村圣物，他们有时候会袭击北方。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",o="取得星风村圣物，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将圣物的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至厄运之槌东翼，进入艾德雷斯神殿，并使用火盆召唤我老友依萨利恩的灵魂。她的灵魂因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符而被腐坏。",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the relic into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the Shrine of Eldretharr in the east wing of Dire Maul, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Isalien. Her spirit has been corrupted by her possession of the piece of Valthalak's amulet, and the portion of his soul within it."}
Q[8964]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们有了火盆和点燃它的方法，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n贾林和索索斯这对兄弟是血色十字军的信徒。他们渴望在那个邪恶的组织里成为骑士。前往东瘟疫之地的提尔之手，从血色禁卫队那里取得光亮的狂热之剑。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.\n\nThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",o="取得光亮的狂热之剑，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将剑的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至斯坦索姆，进入血色十字军堡垒的赤色王座，并使用火盆召唤我老友贾林和索索斯的灵魂。他们的灵魂已经因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符太久变得扭曲不堪。",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the sword into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into The Crimson Throne inside The Scarlet Bastion at Stratholme, and use the brazier to summon forth the remains of my former cohorts, Jarien and Sothos. Their souls have been twisted further by their possession of Valthalak's amulet piece and his spirit within."}
Q[8965]={d="$C，仔细听我说。我们已经拿到火盆了，但是要点燃火盆，我们还需要借助某些特殊材料的力量。那些稀有的材料可以释放出足够的能量，以引出那些已死的灵魂，我昔日的同伴。\n\n有个叫库尔莫克的食人魔通灵师曾与我们一起旅行，他曾在希尔斯布莱德海岸南方的赎罪岛那边召唤出被流放的死者的灵魂。到那里去，从他们的遗体身上帮我找些放逐者的灵魂灰烬回来。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",o="拿到放逐者的灵魂灰烬，把它交给黑石山的伯德雷。",oEN="Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将灰烬的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至通灵学院，进入莱斯·霜语的房间，并使用火盆召唤我老友科尔莫克的灵魂。有着瓦萨拉克灵魂的护符块已经让他腐败的更厉害了，如果你不强硬地从他那里拿走护符，他是不会停下来的。",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the ashes into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into Scholomance, to Ras Frostwhisper's chamber, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Kormok. The amulet piece, and Valthalak's spirit within, has corrupted him even further, and he will not rest until you forcibly take it from him."}
Q[8966]={d="我的朋友，莫尔·灰蹄，是第一个因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符碎片和其中包含的腐败灵魂碎片而受害的人。在偷了瓦萨拉克的法术书和护符之后，我们就立刻从黑石塔上层逃走。途中，莫尔跌进了塔底。\n\n之后，我们发现他并没有摔死，只是被指挥官沃恩俘虏起来且受尽折磨。几个鬼魂刺客溜进去在沃恩面前把他给杀了。",dEN="My friend, Mor Grayhoof, was the first to fall victim to possession of a piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, and the corrupting spirit fragment that it contains. After stealing Valthalak's spellbook and amulet, we fled for our lives from the upper portion of Blackrock Spire. Along the way, Mor fell into the lower portion of the spire.\n\nLater, we discovered that he survived the fall, only to be captured and tortured by War Master Voone. A few spectral assassins snuck in and slew him right in front of Voone.",o="使用召唤火盆来召唤莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂并杀了他。带着瓦萨拉克护符的左半块和召唤火盆回到黑石山的布德利那里。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Mor Grayhoof and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="事情已经完成了吗？你拿回瓦萨拉克领主护符的左半块，然后让我老同伴莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂得到安息了吗？",pEN="Then it is done? You have retrieved the left piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet and finally put to rest the spirit of my old companion, Mor Grayhoof?",c="你做了一件很棒的事，$n。一个灵魂得到了安息，但是如果我们想把这一切做个了断，就还有很多事要做。\n\n不幸地是，我不知道有着右半块护符的人死去的地点。不过不要害怕我生前是个玩票性质的占卜师，所以我有另一个任务要给你，就是让我们查出最后一块护符的位置。",cEN="You have done a great thing, <name>. One spirit rests in peace, but there is still much work to be done before we can put all of this behind us.\n\nUnfortunately, I do not know the location of the one who died with the right piece of the amulet in their possession. But do not fear; in life I was a dabbler in the art of divination, so I have another task for you, which is going to enable us to ferret out the final piece."}
Q[8967]={d="就在几天前，我们挣扎着寻求生存时得到了这样的消息，我们队伍中的暗夜精灵牧师伊萨莉恩私自去了那座暗夜精灵的古城遗迹，也就是现在被称为厄运之槌的地方。根据我们搜集到的信息，她去那里不仅是为了个人原因，也是想解开她所拥有的那部分饰品中蕴涵的秘密。\n\n但她似乎没能成功。我们所搜集到的消息是，她在艾德雷斯神殿被奥兹恩及其手下干掉了。",dEN="It became known to us in later days, as we were doing what we could ourselves to survive, that Isalien, a night elf priestess of our company, had gone to the night elvic ancestral city, now known as Dire Maul. From what we gathered, she went there both for personal reasons and also to unlock the secrets of the piece of the amulet that she had in her possession.\n\nShe didn't quite make it, though. Word got back to us that she was ambushed at the Shrine of Eldretharr by Alzzin the Wildshaper and his forces.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤出伊萨利恩的灵魂，然后杀掉她。完成之后，将召唤火盆与瓦塔拉克饰品的左瓣还给伯德雷。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Isalien and slay her. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="你还没拯救依萨利恩的灵魂和追回瓦萨拉克领主护符的左半块吧，$n？",pEN="Surely you haven't already dealt with the salvation of Isalien's spirit and the retrieval of the left piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, <name>?",c="谢谢你让依萨利恩的灵魂得到安息，$n。现在，或许她会从她的女神那里得到平静。但是，如果我们要解决这个困境，前方还有多任务等着我们。\n\n不幸地是，我不知道有着右半块护符的人死去的地点。不过不要害怕我生前是个玩票性质的占卜师，所以我有另一个任务要给你，就是让我们查出最后一块护符的位置。",cEN="Thank you, <name>, for putting Isalien's spirit to rest. Now, perhaps, she will find peace with her goddess. But, there is still a great deal of work ahead of us if we are to get out of this fine pickle we find ourselves in.\n\nUnfortunately, I do not know the location of the one who died with the right piece of the amulet in their possession. But do not fear; in life I was a dabbler in the art of divination, so I have another task for you, which is going to enable us to ferret out the final piece."}
Q[8968]={d="贾林和索索斯这对兄弟，决定要加入血色十字军因为我们的佣兵公司要解散了。他们带着瓦萨拉克的左半块护符。我说这真是一个很好的解脱，但我们需要拿回那个东西。\n\n据消息指出，他们是因为在血色十字军堡垒的创始仪式失败，被大十字军战士达索汉在他的房间里杀死。\n\n无论如何，我们……也就是你，还是要把那块护符讨回来。",dEN="The siblings, Jarien and Sothos, decided to join the Scarlet Crusade upon the disbanding of our mercenary company. They took the left piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet with them. Good riddance, I say, but we need that piece back.\n\nFrom what we could gather, they were actually slain by Grand Crusader Dathrohan himself for failing the initiation rites inside his chamber in the Scarlet Bastion.\n\nIn any case, we... meaning you, are still going to need to retrieve that piece of the amulet.",o="使用召唤火盆来召唤贾林和索索斯并杀了他们。带着瓦萨拉克护符的左半块和召唤火盆回到黑石山的布德利那里。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Jarien and Sothos and slay them. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="这是否意味着，$n，你已经让那两个蠢货的灵魂安息，并取回了瓦萨拉克领主护符的左半块？",pEN="Does this mean then, <class>, that you've already put the souls of those two fools to rest and retrieved the left piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet?",c="我想，让这两个人的灵魂安息是最好的吧，虽然我并不喜欢他们。无论如何，我们有了该有的东西，这绝对是值得高兴的事！\n\n不幸地是，我不知道有着右半块护符的人死去地点。不过不要害怕我生前是个玩票性质的占卜师，所以我有另一个任务要给你，就是让我们查出最后一块护符的位置。",cEN="I suppose it's for the best that the souls of those two have finally been put to rest, even if I didn't like them while they were alive. In any case, we have what we were after, and that is definitely a good thing!\n\nUnfortunately, I do not know the location of the one who died with the right piece of the amulet in their possession. But do not fear; in life I was a dabbler in the art of divination, so I have another task for you, which is going to enable us to ferret out the final piece."}
Q[8969]={d="现在我们终于有了我们需要的一切，是时候讨论一下你该召唤谁了。\n\n库尔莫克过于曾是还不错的食人魔，可开始学习通灵术之后他就彻底变了。自那以后，每个人都开始远离他，厌恶他。于是，毫无悬念地，他带着他的那部分饰品去了他的新家，通灵学院。\n\n然而，就算在那里，他仍然不免遭了幽灵刺客的毒手。它们干脆当着他的主人莱斯·霜语的面，杀死了他。",dEN="Now we have what we need, so it's time to discuss who it is that you'll be summoning.\n\nKormok was ok for an ogre, right up until he turned to necromancy. After that, things got creepy for just about everyone in the outfit. It was no surprise then when he took his piece of the amulet and returned to his new home, Scholomance.\n\nBut even there, or perhaps especially there, he was not safe from the spectral assassins. They slew him right in front of his master, Ras Frostwhisper.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤出库尔莫克的灵魂，然后杀掉他。完成之后，将召唤火盆与瓦塔拉克饰品的左瓣还给黑石山的伯德雷。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="我欣赏你，$n，如果你带着左半块的护符回来的话。如果没有，那么，请快点完成别浪费时间，我向你保证！",pEN="I commend you, <name>, if you have returned with the left piece of the amulet. If not, however, please take care of that as there is no time to waste, I assure you!",c="做得好，$n！科尔莫克不是那么坏的巨魔，至少他活着的时候不是，所以我希望他能得到应有的安息。但是前方还有最艰难的考验等着我们。\n\n不幸地是，我不知道有着右半块护符的人死去的地点。不过不要害怕我生前是个玩票性质的占卜师，所以我有另一个任务要给你，就是让我们查出最后一块护符的位置。",cEN="Good work, <name>! Kormok wasn't all that bad for an ogre, at least not while he was still alive, so I hope he gets the rest that he deserves. But, there is more work ahead of us.\n\nUnfortunately, I do not know the location of the one who died with the right piece of the amulet in their possession. But do not fear; in life I was a dabbler in the art of divination, so I have another task for you, which is going to enable us to ferret out the final piece."}
Q[8970]={d="正如我说的那样，$c，我很草率地做了决定，成为一名预言师。预言师并非想象中那样来钱……这份工作充满危险，施法材料价格昂贵而且很不好找。但是我知道最后一块饰品碎片在哪儿，那上面还附着我的老朋友的灵魂。\n\n$n，恐怕你得去尘泥沼泽的奥卡兹岛一趟，从斯塔莎兹纳迦身上收集血藻。",dEN="As I was saying, <class>, in my living years I flirted with becoming a diviner. But, there really wasn't as much profit in it as you might imagine, mostly because it's dangerous and the reagents are rare and expensive. However, I do know enough to be able to pinpoint the final piece of the amulet, and the spirit of my former comrade along with it.\n\nThis is where you come in, <name>. I need you to go to Alcaz Island off the coast of Dustwallow Marsh and collect Bloodkelp from the Strashaz naga that live there.",o="前往尘泥沼泽的奥卡兹岛，从斯塔莎兹纳迦身上收集20份血藻，然后返回黑石山的伯德雷那儿。",oEN="Gather 20 Bloodkelp from the Strashaz naga and then return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="血巨藻，$n，需要一大叠才是增进我占卜法术的方法。你需要带一些朋友和你一起转至奥卡兹岛……那些斯塔沙兹是一群难对付的家伙。",pEN="Bloodkelp, <name>, a big stack of it, that's what I need to power my divinatory spells. You're likely to need to take at least a couple of friends along with you to Alcaz Island to gather it up... those Strashaz are a nasty lot!",c="老实说，$n，我很惊讶你竟然把它完整的带了回来。我猜奥卡兹岛是最不令你烦恼的。\n\n好了，等我一下……占卜不是你一挥手就能立刻有答案的。",cEN="To be honest, <name>, I'm surprised you made it back in one piece. Then again, I guess Alcaz Island is the least of your worries right now.\n\nOk, give me a moment here... divination isn't something that you can just snap your fingers and expect accurate answers from."}
Q[8977]={d="跟你合作真是愉快，$n。这是你要的成品。\n\n希望它能助你一臂之力。呃，如果你不介意的话，请帮我宣传宣传。我希望有更多的顾客！",dEN="It's been great working with you, <name>. Here is the finished product.\n\nI hope it helps you in your current endeavors. And hey, if you don't mind, help spread the word. I wouldn't mind having more customers!",o="将超维度幽灵显形器交给铁炉堡的德莉亚娜。",oEN="Bring the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to Deliana in Ironforge.",p="你回来了？",pEN="You've returned?",c="太好了！你做的很好，$n。我不太信任地精的手工艺，不过我没有别的选择了。",cEN="Excellent! You've done well, <name>. I'm not sure I trust the goblin's craftsmanship, but I'm left with no other choice."}
Q[8978]={d="和你一起工作很愉快，$n。这是完成的产品。\n\n希望它能对你目前的努力有所帮助。还有，如果你不介意，帮我宣传一下。我不介意有更多的顾客！",dEN="It's been great working with you, <name>. Here is the finished product.\n\nI hope it helps you in your current endeavors. And hey, if you don't mind, help spread the word. I wouldn't mind having more customers!",o="带着超空间灵体显像机回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgrimmar with the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer.",p="你带着那个仪器回来了吗？",pEN="You've returned with the device?",c="你带着那个仪器回来了！你的努力让我印象深刻，$n。做得好。",cEN="You've returned with the device! I'm impressed by your dedication, <name>. Excellent work."}
Q[8979]={d="我想我知道造成目前这种状况的原因了。你闻到风中所飘扬着的这种芳香的气味了没有？它几乎都把运河的臭味都给盖过去了！莫非这就是新上市的香水吗？\n\n我们的理智基本已经被这些该死的炼金术产品抹掉了。\n\n要想搞清楚问题，只有一个办法：把香水的样本交给我的朋友，药剂师金格。皇家药剂师协会一定能找出真相。\n\n别担心，你回来的时候我会把买香水的钱付给你的。",dEN="I believe I know the cause of this recent behavior. Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind, over the stink of the canals? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion?\n\nOur thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.\n\nThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to my friend, Apothecary Zinge. The Royal Apothecary Society will find the truth.\n\nI will reimburse you for their purchase when you return.",o="将1瓶古龙水和1瓶香水交给幽暗城炼金房的药剂师金格。",oEN="Bring 1 Cologne Bottle and 1 Perfume Bottle to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity's Apothecarium.",p="有什么能帮你的吗？",pEN="How may I serve you?",c="我懂了，又一个被芬斯塔德迷惑的例子。难道他以为皇家药剂师协会只有进行小小调查这件事可以忙吗？\n\n很好，我会再一次的迁就他。",cEN="Another one of Fenstad's obsessions, I see. Does he think that the Royal Apothecary Society has nothing better to do than to perform his little investigations?\n\nVery well, I will humor him once again."}
Q[8980]={d="这真让人感到意外。看来芬斯塔还真是个很警觉的家伙。我在香水中发现了某些可以用来控制精神的物质。\n\n在香水中应用这些物质虽然并非是前所未有的事情，但我从其中提炼出的一些原料……这是严肃的炼金术问题，以皇家药剂师协会成员的能力一定可以查出结果。",dEN="This is unexpected. It looks like Fenstad might be on to something after all. I found traces of substances used in mind control potions.\n\nIt isn't unheard of for perfumes to have some of this, but a few of the ingredients I detected... This is serious alchemy, along the abilities of a member of the Royal Apothecary Society.",o="回到幽暗城银行附近的芬斯塔·艾吉勒那里。",oEN="Return to Fenstad Argyle outside the bank in the Undercity.",c="所以，我是对的。我们千万别浪费时间。一定要找出这些受污染的香水来源。\n\n来，这是酬谢你购买古龙水和香水的。",cEN="So, I was right. We must waste no time. We must determine the source of these tainted fragrances.\n\nHere, to repay you for the purchase of the cologne and perfume."}
Q[8982]={d="我们一定得找出香水的供货商！我注意药剂师卡崔娜那里似乎有一瓶香水的样子。她告诉我说是从旅店老板诺曼那里买来的。",dEN="We must find who the supplier is. I noticed Apothecary Katrina with a bottle of the perfume tucked in her pack. She told me that she purchased it from Norman, the innkeeper.",o="与幽暗城中的旅店老板诺曼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Innkeeper Norman in the Undercity.",c="啊是的。我最近刚收到一批香水和古龙水。我不知道它们还能在柜子上放多久——看来还没有人闻腻了。\n\n如果你问我，其实我觉得它也没什么大不了的。",cEN="Ah yes, I just recently received stock of the perfume and cologne. I don't know how long I can keep it on the shelves - seems like no one can get enough of it.\n\nIf you ask me, I don't see what the big deal is."}
Q[8983]={d="我的货有问题？好吧好吧，我从来没见过别人对我的货物这么热衷痴迷。\n\n我是从一个叫玛拉·雷尼克的商人那里进到这批货的。她是新来的。\n\n她提到过说要有些货物得送到法师区的裁缝店那边去。",dEN="Something's wrong with my product? Well, I've never seen so many people wanting something so badly.\n\nI bought my supply from a merchant named Mara Rennick. She's new in town.\n\nShe mentioned she had some goods she had to deliver to the tailor in the Magic Quarter.",o="与幽暗城法师区裁缝店里的玛拉·雷尼克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mara Rennick at the tailor's shop in the Undercity's Magic Quarter.",c="抱歉，我把所有的香水和古龙水都卖给旅店老板诺曼了。如果你想要，得去找他——前提是他还有剩。\n\n不过你可别浪费时间。我想你会发现那古龙水让人难以抗拒。",cEN="I'm afraid I sold my entire supply of perfume and cologne to Norman, the innkeeper. If you'd like some, you should speak with him - assuming he has any left.\n\nYou shouldn't waste any time, though. I think you'll find the cologne irresistible."}
Q[8984]={d="你看，一个游手好闲外加无所事事的药剂师要干什么我根本不关心。要是他想给我找麻烦的话，那我就必须告诉你什么是正确的事。\n\n如果他是无辜的，那他根本没什么好担心的，对吗？\n\n我这批货是从药剂师斯塔弗隆·雷伦特那里进的。他就在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的拉文霍德庄园那边工作。坦承地讲，我认为他确实有点古怪。",dEN="Look, the actions of a rogue apothecary are not my concern. If he's undermining our efforts, then let me be the first to point you in the right direction.\n\nIf he's innocent, then he's got nothing to hide, right?\n\nI purchased the goods from Apothecary Staffron Lerent. He's working in a secluded area past Ravenholdt Manor in the hills over Hillsbrad. To be honest with you, I thought he was a little odd.",o="到希尔斯布莱德丘陵去，在拉文霍德庄园后面找到药剂师斯塔弗隆·雷伦特。",oEN="Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills past Ravenholdt Manor.",c="是的，是我做了那些香水。很香啊，不是吗？另人无法抗拒。\n\n当联盟和部落的战士们都为这些爱的感觉所倾倒，他们就无法抵抗暗影议会的崛起了。\n\n他们会变的衰弱，手足无措。当他们担心着内心所挚爱的人，就会失去他们的优势。\n\n解决的方法很简单。为什么我要花那么久的时间去想呢？弱点就是心啊。会发生的事就是会发生，你无法避免的。",cEN="Yes, I made those fragrances. Wonderful smell, isn't it? Irresistible.\n\nOnce the warriors of Alliance and Horde alike are smitten with these feelings of love, they will be powerless to stop the rise of the Shadow Council.\n\nThey will be weakened, unprepared. As they worry for their loved ones, they will lose their edge.\n\nThe solution was so simple. Why did it take me so long to come upon it? The weakness of all is through the heart. And there is nothing you can do to stop the inevitable."}
Q[8985]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们知道了最后一块护符的位置，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n伊萨利恩，我们的女祭司，在星风村的冬泉谷长大。我要你去冬泉谷南边的霜语峡谷，从那里的霜槌巨人身上取得星风村圣物，他们有时候会袭击北方。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",o="取得星风村圣物，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将圣物的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至厄运之槌东翼，进入艾德雷斯神殿，并使用火盆召唤我老友依萨利恩的灵魂。她的灵魂因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符而被腐坏。\n\n喔，对了，我这里有一些你上次去奥卡兹岛剩下的血巨藻，我把它做成了一些药剂给你。拿着吧！",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the relic into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the Shrine of Eldretharr in the east wing of Dire Maul, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Isalien. Her spirit has been corrupted by her possession of the piece of Valthalak's amulet, and the portion of his soul within it.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!"}
Q[8986]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们知道了最后一块护符的位置，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n莫尔·灰蹄，我们最重要的德鲁伊，在塞纳里奥议会有很多亲密的朋友，其中有些人已被异种消灭。我要你去希利苏斯从雷戈虫巢的异种身上取得德鲁伊遗骨。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",o="取得德鲁伊的遗体，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将遗体的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至黑石塔低层，进入指挥官沃恩在塔萨洛尔住的房间，并使用火盆召唤我老友莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂。护符一天不从他那里被取走，他就一天不能安息。\n\n喔，对了，我这里有一些你上次去奥卡兹岛剩下的血巨藻，我把它做成了一些药剂给你。拿着吧！",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the remains into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the lower portion of Blackrock Spire, to the chamber where War Master Voone resides in Tazz'Alaor, and use the brazier to summon forth the corrupted spirit of my former cohort, Mor Grayhoof. He cannot rest until the amulet piece is taken from him.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!"}
Q[8987]={d="$C，仔细听好。既然我们已经知道了最后一块护符的下落，就还需要另一样东西来浸润火盆；那东西必须能提供足够强的聚焦，好召唤出我已故旧日战友的遗骸。\n\n这对兄妹，贾林和索索斯，曾是血色十字军的信徒。他们一心盼望在那个邪恶组织里晋身为骑士。去东瘟疫之地的提尔之手，从那里的禁卫军手中取回一柄炽热的狂热之剑。|n",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.\n\nThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",o="取得光亮的狂热之剑，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将剑的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至斯坦索姆，进入血色十字军堡垒的赤色王座，并使用火盆召唤我老友贾林和索索斯的灵魂。他们的灵魂已经因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符太久变得扭曲不堪。\n\n喔，对了，我这里有一些你上次去奥卡兹岛剩下的血巨藻，我把它做成了一些药剂给你。拿着吧！",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the sword into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into The Crimson Throne inside The Scarlet Bastion at Stratholme, and use the brazier to summon forth the remains of my former cohorts, Jarien and Sothos. Their souls have been twisted further by their possession of Valthalak's amulet piece and his spirit within.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!"}
Q[8988]={d="$C，仔细听好了。既然我们知道了最后一块护符的位置，我们还需要另一个材料来注入火盆；一种强大的集中力来诱使我已故亡友的灵魂出现。\n\n有个跟我们同行的巨魔巫师，科尔莫克，喜爱召唤赎罪岛上被流放的亡者灵魂，那个地方就在希尔斯布莱德丘陵南边海岸。去那里的遗迹取得一些被流放的灵魂灰烬。",dEN="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",o="取得流放者的灵魂灰烬，再回到黑石山找布德利。",oEN="Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="你带着我要你收集的东西回来了吗，$c？",pEN="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="做得好，$n。我会将灰烬的精华注入火盆。\n\n现在要做的就是转至通灵学院，进入莱斯·霜语的房间，并使用火盆召唤我老友科尔莫克的灵魂。有着瓦萨拉克灵魂的护符块已经让他腐败的更厉害了，如果你不强硬地从他那里拿走护符，他是不会停下来的。\n\n喔，对了，我这里有一些你上次去奥卡兹岛剩下的血巨藻，我把它做成了一些药剂给你。拿着吧！",cEN="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the ashes into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into Scholomance, to Ras Frostwhisper's chamber, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Kormok. The amulet piece, and Valthalak's spirit within, has corrupted him even further, and he will not rest until you forcibly take it from him.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!"}
Q[8989]={d="我的朋友，莫尔·灰蹄，是第一个因为拥有瓦萨拉克的护符碎片和其中包含的腐败灵魂碎片而受害的人。在偷了瓦萨拉克的法术书和护符之后，我们就立刻从黑石塔上层逃走。途中，莫尔跌进了塔底。\n\n之后，我们发现他并没有摔死，只是被指挥官沃恩俘虏起来且受尽折磨。几个鬼魂刺客溜进去在沃恩面前把他给杀了。",dEN="My friend, Mor Grayhoof, was the first to fall victim to possession of a piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, and the corrupting spirit fragment that it contains. After stealing Valthalak's spellbook and amulet, we fled for our lives from the upper portion of Blackrock Spire. Along the way, Mor fell into the lower portion of the spire.\n\nLater, we discovered that he survived the fall, only to be captured and tortured by War Master Voone. A few spectral assassins snuck in and slew him right in front of Voone.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂并杀了他。带着重新组合的瓦萨拉克护符和召唤火盆回到黑石山的布德利那里。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Mor Grayhoof and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="事情已经完成了吗？你拿回瓦萨拉克领主护符的右半块，重新组合了完整的护符，然后让我老同伴莫尔·灰蹄的灵魂得到安息了吗？",pEN="Then it is done? You have retrieved the right piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, recombined the amulet into one whole, and finally put to rest the spirit of my old companion, Mor Grayhoof?",c="谢谢你帮助莫尔·灰蹄，$n。又让一个灵魂得到安息了，而我们现在有了重新组合好的护符！但是前方还有最艰难的考验等着我们。\n\n为了让火盆调合好以召唤瓦萨拉克领主，还有几样物品需要收集，请带到这里给我。",cEN="Thank you for helping Mor Grayhoof, <name>. Another spirit rests in peace, and we now have the reassembled amulet! But we still have the hardest test ahead of us.\n\nIn order for the brazier to be attuned to calling forth Lord Valthalak, there are a few more items that need to be gathered and brought back to me here."}
Q[8990]={d="就在几天前，我们挣扎着寻求生存时得到了这样的消息，我们队伍中的暗夜精灵牧师伊萨莉恩私自去了那座暗夜精灵的古城遗迹，也就是现在被称为厄运之槌的地方。根据我们搜集到的信息，她去那里不仅是为了个人原因，也是想解开她所拥有的那部分饰品中蕴涵的秘密。\n\n但她似乎没能成功。我们所搜集到的消息是，她在艾德雷斯神殿被奥兹恩及其手下干掉了。",dEN="It became known to us in later days, as we were doing what we could ourselves to survive, that Isalien, a night elf priestess of our company, had gone to the night elvic ancestral city, now known as Dire Maul. From what we gathered, she went there both for personal reasons and also to unlock the secrets of the piece of the amulet that she had in her possession.\n\nShe didn't quite make it, though. Word got back to us that she was ambushed at the Shrine of Eldretharr by Alzzin the Wildshaper and his forces.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤出伊萨莉恩的灵魂，然后杀掉他。完成之后，将召唤火盆与瓦塔拉克公爵的饰品还给伯德雷。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Isalien and slay her. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="你还没拯救依萨利恩的灵魂和追回瓦萨拉克领主护符的右半块吧，$n？务必要在交到我手中前重新组合护符碎片。",pEN="Surely you haven't already dealt with the salvation of Isalien's spirit and the retrieval of the right piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet, <name>? Be sure to recombine the pieces of the amulet before handing it to me.",c="谢谢你让依萨利恩的灵魂得到安息，$n。现在，或许她会从她的女神那里得到平静。而现在我们也有了重新组合的护符！但是前方还有最艰难的考验等着我们。\n\n为了让火盆调合好以召唤瓦萨拉克领主，还有几样物品需要收集，请带到这里给我。",cEN="Thank you, <name>, for putting Isalien's spirit to rest. Now, perhaps, she will find peace with her goddess. And, we have the reassembled amulet, as well! But we still have the hardest test ahead of us.\n\nIn order for the brazier to be attuned to calling forth Lord Valthalak, there are a few more items that need to be gathered and brought back to me here."}
Q[8991]={d="在我们这个雇佣兵团解散之后，亚雷恩和索托斯决定去加入血色十字军。他们姐弟两人带走了瓦塔拉克饰品的右瓣。本来他们把那个代表着灾难与不幸的东西拿走是件好事，可现在我们又非需要它不可了。\n\n根据我们目前掌握的消息，他们似乎因为在宣誓仪式上触怒了大十字军达索汉而被杀了，死在了血色十字军要塞中达索汉的房间内。\n\n无论如何，我们……我是说你……仍然有必要前去那里夺回那部分饰品。",dEN="The siblings, Jarien and Sothos, decided to join the Scarlet Crusade upon the disbanding of our mercenary company. They took the right piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet with them. Good riddance, I say, but we need that piece back.\n\nFrom what we could gather, they were actually slain by Grand Crusader Dathrohan himself for failing the initiation rites inside his chamber in the Scarlet Bastion.\n\nIn any case, we... meaning you, are still going to need to retrieve that piece of the amulet.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤出亚雷恩和索托斯的灵魂，然后杀掉他。完成之后，将召唤火盆与瓦塔拉克公爵的饰品还给黑石山的伯德雷。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Jarien and Sothos and slay them. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="那么，$c，这代表你已经让那两个笨蛋的灵魂得到安息并重新组合了瓦萨拉克领主的护符吗？",pEN="Does this mean then, <class>, that you've already put the souls of those two fools to rest and recombined the pieces of Lord Valthalak's amulet?",c="我想，让这两个人的灵魂安息是最好的吧，虽然我并不喜欢他们。无论如何，我们有了该有的东西，而且护符也重新组合了！但是前方还有最艰难的考验等着我们。\n\n为了让火盆调合好以召唤瓦萨拉克领主，还有几样物品需要收集，请带到这里给我。",cEN="I suppose it's for the best that the souls of those two have finally been put to rest, even if I didn't like them while they were alive. In any case, we have what we were after, and now the amulet is reassembled! But we still have the hardest test ahead of us.\n\nIn order for the brazier to be attuned to calling forth Lord Valthalak, there are a few more items that need to be gathered and brought back to me here."}
Q[8992]={d="现在我们有了需要的东西，该是讨论你下一个要召唤的人的时候了。\n\n科尔莫克在巨魔中算是好的，让他恢复正常直到他求助于巫术为止。在那之后，事情因每个人的装备而变的棘手。当他拿着他的护符回到新家，通灵学院时，一点也不令人惊讶。\n\n但是就连在那里，或是尤其在那里，他仍无法幸免于鬼魂刺客的威胁。他们就在他的主人莱斯·霜语面前杀了他。",dEN="Now we have what we need, so it's time to discuss who it is that you'll be summoning next.\n\nKormok was ok for an ogre, right up until he turned to necromancy. After that, things got creepy for just about everyone in the outfit. It was no surprise then when he took his piece of the amulet and returned to his new home, Scholomance.\n\nBut even there, or perhaps especially there, he was not safe from the spectral assassins. They slew him right in front of his master, Ras Frostwhisper.",o="使用召唤火盆召唤科尔莫克的灵魂并杀了他。带着重新组合的瓦萨拉克护符和召唤火盆回到黑石山的布德利那里。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth the spirit of Kormok and slay him. Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain with the recombined Lord Valthalak's Amulet and the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="我欣赏你，$n，如果你能带着完整的护符回来的话。如果没有，那么，请快点完成别浪费时间，我向你保证！",pEN="I commend you, <name>, if you have returned with the completed amulet. If not, however, please take care of that as there is no time to waste, I assure you!",c="做得好，$n！科尔莫克不是那么坏的巨魔，至少他活着的时候不是，所以我希望他能得到应有的安息。现在我们有了完整的护符！但是前方还有最艰难的考验等着我们。\n\n为了让火盆调合好以召唤瓦萨拉克领主，还有几样物品需要收集，请带到这里给我。",cEN="Good work, <name>! Kormok wasn't all that bad for an ogre, at least not while he was still alive, so I hope he gets the rest that he deserves. And now we have the completed amulet! But we still have the hardest test ahead of us.\n\nIn order for the brazier to be attuned to calling forth Lord Valthalak, there are a few more items that need to be gathered and brought back to me here."}
Q[8994]={d="就快好了，$c。只差最后一步了，我还需要往火盆中加一些东西，这样才能召唤瓦塔拉克公爵。\n\n你必须进入黑石塔，杀死那儿的兽人。他们的护腕中含有某种可以追踪灵魂的金属，我需要一定数量的护腕来提取足够多的这种金属。要完成浸魔，你还得给我一瓶超级能量合剂。\n\n祝你好运，$n！",dEN="We're nearly there, <class>. All that is left is to retrieve a few more components so that I can attune the brazier and enable it to beckon forth Lord Valthalak.\n\nTo begin I must ask you to journey forth into Blackrock Spire and slay the orcs therein. They wear bracers that contain trace metals that I will need, so I'll need more than a few to extract the right amount out of them. Then, to complete the imbuing process, you'll need to bring me a Flask of Supreme Power.\n\nGood luck, <name>!",o="从黑石塔的兽人那儿收集40副黑石护腕，把它们和一瓶超级能量合剂一起交给黑石山的伯德雷。",oEN="Gather 40 Blackrock Bracers and acquire a Flask of Supreme Power. Return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",p="这是一条很艰辛的路，$n，我只想告诉你不管发生什么事，谢谢你！你为了帮助我们佣兵公司的生存让自己陷入致命的危险之中，隐刃，我想，你和我们是同一阵线的了。",pEN="We've come a long way, <name>, and I just wanted to say that no matter what happens, thank you! You've put yourself in mortal danger to try to help the surviving members of our mercenary company, The Veiled Blade, and as far as I'm concerned, you're one of us now.",c="那么，就这样了。我会将这些最后的材料注入火盆，你就能准备召唤瓦萨拉克领主了，最后再将他的灵魂护符交还给他。\n\n你一路走来不简单，$n，别在最后功亏一篑啊！",cEN="That's it then. I'll extract the metal from the bracers and imbue the brazier with these final components. Then it will be ready for you to summon Lord Valthalak, and finally return his spirit amulet to him.\n\nYou've come quite a distance, <name>, don't falter now that the end is in sight!"}
Q[8995]={d="$n，一切都已准备就绪了。\n\n瓦塔拉克公爵生前居住在比斯巨兽的房间。到那里去，使用召唤火盆召唤出瓦塔拉克公爵，火盆会使他重新成为实体生物，所以我们就可以再度杀死他。当然，最好先把比斯巨兽干掉，所以请多叫上几个朋友一同前往黑石塔上层，确保安全。\n\n杀死瓦塔拉克之后对着他的尸体使用饰品就行了。灵魂重新融合之后，他也可能会要回他的饰品。\n\n祝你好运！",dEN="All is now ready, <name>.\n\nWhen alive, Lord Valthalak used to inhabit what is now The Beast's chamber. Go there and use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon forth Lord Valthalak. It will reincorporate him, so he'll have to be killed again. I'd take care of The Beast first, and be sure take enough friends along to survive the upper portion of Blackrock Spire.\n\nOnce you've dispatched Valthalak, use the amulet on his corpse. With his spirit reunified, he'll likely want his amulet back, as well.\n\nGood luck!",o="在比斯巨兽的房间里使用召唤火盆，召唤瓦塔拉克公爵。杀死他，对尸体使用瓦塔拉克的饰品。然后将瓦塔拉克的饰品还给瓦塔拉克公爵之魂。",oEN="Use the Brazier of Beckoning to summon Lord Valthalak. Dispatch him, and use Lord Valthalak's Amulet on the corpse. Then, return Lord Valthalak's Amulet to the Spirit of Lord Valthalak.",p="$n，你竟敢打扰我的安息！",pEN="<class>, you dare disturb my rest!",c="你真幸运，我知道你不是那群偷走我东西的人。\n\n现在我要拿回属于我的东西，凡人！把护符给我！",cEN="How fortunate for you that I know you're not part of the original group that stole this from me.\n\nI'll take back what is mine now, mortal! Give the amulet to me!"}
Q[8996]={d="我会原让你这次的无礼，因为你今天做了一件高尚的事，$c，那就是带回我被偷走的灵魂。尽管你的本性明显地处于弱势，$r，你仍然展现了比别人更多的勇气，就连从我这里偷走东西的人也没有你强，或许永远也不会有人比得上你。\n\n趁我还没改变心意杀了你之前，回到他们那里去。回去告诉他们，他们很安全…至少现在是。",dEN="I will ignore your impertinence this time, <class>, because you have done a noble thing today; returning the rest of my stolen spirit to me. Despite your obviously weak nature, <race>, you have shown courage where those that stole from me did not, and probably never could!\n\nReturn to them, before I change my mind and slay you where you stand. Go back and tell them that they are safe... for now.",o="回到黑石山的布德利那里并将召唤火盆交给他。",oEN="Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain and give him the Brazier of Beckoning.",p="$n，你活着回来了！嗯，至少还有你一人。\n\n你要告诉我所有发生的事！",pEN="<name>, you're back and still alive! Well, at least that makes one of us.\n\nYou're going to have to tell me all about it!",c="他真的说了这些话？天啊，我不敢相信他要赶走鬼灵刺客和潜猎者，即使他暗示过将来可能对我的佣兵同伴们造成伤害。\n\n今天是很棒的一天，$n！你完成了极少数人能办到的事，赦免了我们，至少就某部分而言，一些我们过去的罪。\n\n谢谢你！我想给你这个以表达感谢之意。你可以在已经召唤过灵魂的闹鬼之地和其它几个地方使用以召唤灵魂。",cEN="He really said all of that? Wow, I can't believe he's going to call off the spectral assassins and stalkers, even if he did hint at causing my living companions further harm in the future.\n\nThis is a great day, <name>! You've accomplished what few ever could, and absolved us, at least in part, of some of our past sins.\n\nThank you! As a sign of appreciation, I'd like to give you this. You can use it to summon forth spirits at the same haunted locations that you already have, and a few others, too."}
Q[8997]={d="我想，这就是道别的时候了，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;。不过，如果你想时不时回来跟我说说话，我一直都在。多半是在你四处闲逛、等着伙伴们一起突袭黑石塔的时候吧。\n\n走吧，趁我还没哭出来。回铁炉堡找德莉亚娜，把发生的一切告诉她。",dEN="I suppose that this is goodbye then, my friend. But, I'll always be here if you want to come back and talk with me from time to time. Probably while you're loitering around waiting for your buddies to join you for a raid on Blackrock Spire.\n\nGo, before I start to cry. Go back to Deliana in Ironforge and tell her what's happened.",o="回到铁炉堡的王座厅和德莉娜谈谈。",oEN="Speak with Deliana at The High Seat in Ironforge.",c="很高兴看到你$g安然无恙:安然无恙;地回到我身边，$n。你气色不错，只是略显疲惫罢了。\n\n来吧，把发生的一切都告诉我。",cEN="I am very happy to see you return to me safely, <name>. You look well, if not a bit worse for the wear.\n\nCome, tell me of all that has transpired."}
Q[8998]={d="我想，这就是道别的时候了，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;。不过，如果你想时不时回来跟我说说话，我一直都在。多半是在你四处闲逛、等着伙伴们一起突袭黑石塔的时候吧。\n\n走吧，趁我还没哭出来。回奥格瑞玛找莫克瓦尔，把发生的一切告诉他。",dEN="I suppose that this is goodbye then, my friend. But, I'll always be here if you want to come back and talk with me from time to time. Probably while you're loitering around waiting for your buddies to join you for a raid on Blackrock Spire.\n\nGo, before I start to cry. Go back to Mokvar in Orgrimmar and tell him what's happened.",o="回到奥格玛智慧谷在索尔的堡垒中找莫克瓦谈谈。",oEN="Speak with Mokvar at Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom.",c="很高兴看到你活了下来，$n。你气色不错，只是多了几分$g沧桑:沧桑;。\n\n来吧，把发生的一切都告诉我。",cEN="I am pleased to see that you have survived, <name>. You look well, if not a bit more seasoned.\n\nCome, tell me of all that has transpired."}
Q[8999]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的野性之心兜帽和野性之心外衣交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的狂野之心部件，换取全新的野性之心兜帽和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Wildheart pieces in exchange for your new Feralheart Cowl and Vest?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9000]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的驭兽者之帽和驭兽者外套交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Beaststalker's Cap and Beaststalker's Tunic.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的驭兽者部件，换取全新的兽王软帽和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Beaststalker pieces in exchange for your new Beastmaster's Cap and Tunic?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
