Q[9005]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的鬼雾面具和鬼雾长袍交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Dreadmist Mask and Dreadmist Robe.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的恐惧之雾部件，换取全新的死亡之雾面罩和长袍了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Dreadmist pieces in exchange for your new Deathmist Mask and Robe?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9006]={d="这真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。现在我或许可以安心的入眠了。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",o="将你的勇气头盔和勇气胸甲交给德莉娜。",oEN="Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的英勇部件，换取全新的英雄之盔和胸甲了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Valor pieces in exchange for your new Helm and Breastplate of Heroism?",c="我会想念你的，$n。我欠你很大一份人情；我想我永远也无法报答你。\n\n希望你喜欢你的新头饰和胸甲，也希望它能保护你很长一段时间。",cEN="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come."}
Q[9007]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的野性之心兜帽和野性之心外衣交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的狂野之心部件，换取全新的野性之心兜帽和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Wildheart pieces in exchange for your new Feralheart Cowl and Vest?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9008]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！我向你表示感谢，也可以向你保证，所有牵涉其中的人都由衷地感激你。因为你的努力，我们才从过去的错误中解脱出来。\n\n至于你的报酬，我想我手头有几样东西，是你确实应得、也一定会喜欢的。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的野兽追猎者之帽与野兽追猎者外套交给莫克瓦尔。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Beaststalker's Cap and Beaststalker's Tunic.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的驭兽者部件，换取全新的兽王软帽和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Beaststalker pieces in exchange for your new Beastmaster's Cap and Tunic?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9009]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的虔诚头冠和虔诚长袍交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Devout Crown and Devout Robe.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的虔诚部件，换取全新的圣洁之冠和长袍了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Devout pieces in exchange for your new Virtuous Crown and Robe?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9010]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的迅影罩帽和迅影外套交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Shadowcraft Cap and Shadowcraft Tunic.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的暗影之皮部件，换取全新的黑暗之皮软帽和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Shadowcraft pieces in exchange for your new Darkmantle Cap and Tunic?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9011]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的元素罩帽和元素外衣交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Coif of Elements and Vest of Elements.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的元素部件，换取全新的五雷头巾和外衣了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Elements pieces in exchange for your new Coif and Vest of The Five Thunders",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9012]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的鬼雾面具和鬼雾长袍交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Dreadmist Mask and Dreadmist Robe.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的恐惧之雾部件，换取全新的死亡之雾面罩和长袍了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Dreadmist pieces in exchange for your new Deathmist Mask and Robe?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9013]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n!谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的勇气头盔和勇气胸甲交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的英勇部件，换取全新的英雄之盔和胸甲了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Valor pieces in exchange for your new Helm and Breastplate of Heroism?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9014]={d="真是个不可思议的故事，$n！谢谢你，我保证，所有相关的人都衷心的感激你。因为你的努力，我们走出了从前犯的错误。\n\n至于你的奖励，我确信这几样东西你会很喜欢。",dEN="A truly amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you have definitely earned and will truly enjoy.",o="将你的博学者头冠和博学者长袍交给莫克瓦。",oEN="Give Mokvar your Magister's Crown and Magister's Robes.",p="按照我们的约定，你$g准备好:准备好;交出你的魔导师部件，换取全新的巫士之冠和长袍了吗？",pEN="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Magister's pieces in exchange for your new Sorcerer's Crown and Robes?",c="我真的会很想你，$n。我欠你一份人情，这是我永远也无法回报的。\n\n好好使用你的新头饰和胸甲。愿它能保护你很长一段时间，为你带来更多的荣耀！",cEN="I will truly miss you, <name>. There is a debt that I owe you, which I may never be able to repay.\n\nEnjoy your new head and chest armor. May it protect you for a long time to come, and help you to achieve even greater honor!"}
Q[9015]={d="听好了，$n。为了让这面旗帜运转起来，你必须要进入黑石深渊的竞技场，然后听任裁决者格里斯通宣判你，然后将这面旗子牢牢地插在地面上有处挑战标记的地方。\n\n这时你想挑战的人就会被不可抗拒的力量推入战场，浑身上下只有将你杀死的欲望。当你从他身上找到了你要的东西以后，就回去找安泰恩吧。",dEN="Heed me well, <name>. For the banner to work in the desired way, you will need to step into the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths. Allow yourself to be sentenced by High Justice Grimstone and place the banner firmly on the ground in a sign of defiance.\n\nYour victim will not be able to restrain himself and shall enter the fray filled with a desire to fight you. Once you obtain that which you seek, go back to Anthion.",o="到黑石深渊的竞技场去，在你被裁决者格里斯通宣判之后将挑战之旗插在场地中央。杀死塞尔德林和他的角斗士，然后将瓦塔拉克饰品第一部分交给东瘟疫之地的安泰恩·哈尔蒙。",oEN="Travel to the Ring of the Law in Blackrock Depths and place the Banner of Provocation in its center as you are sentenced by High Justice Grimstone. Slay Theldren and his gladiators and return to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands with the first piece of Lord Valthalak's amulet.",p="你回来了，$n！",pEN="You're back, <name>!",c="你取回了部分的勋章了吗，$n？",cEN="You've recovered part of the medallion, <name>?"}
Q[9016]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着一整套狂野之心长靴、狂野之心短裙和狂野之心护肩，回到奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔那里。|n",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Wildheart Boots, a Wildheart Kilt and Wildheart Spaulders.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9017]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着驭兽者长靴，驭兽者短裤和驭兽者衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Beaststalker's Boots, Beaststalker's Pants and Beaststalker's Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9018]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着博学者长靴，博学者护腿和博学者衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Magister's Boots, Magister's Leggings and Magister's Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9019]={d="瓦塔拉克的灵魂就封印在这枚护符里。因为贪婪，我们愚蠢地将它分成了好几部分，丝毫不了解这会为我们带来怎样残酷的诅咒。\n\n唯一解除瓦塔拉克的法术的办法，就是将这枚勋章重新组合在一起。回到莫克瓦尔那里去，告诉他说，伯德雷已经是他找齐剩余部分的最后希望了。顺便跟他提一下你应得的报酬。\n\n我只希望能从此安息。祝你好运……你会非常需要运气的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带上一双虔诚软鞋、一条虔诚长裙和一副虔诚衬肩，回去向奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔复命。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Devout Sandals, Devout Skirt and Devout Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9020]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着迅影长靴，迅影短裤和迅影肩甲回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Shadowcraft Boots, Shadowcraft Pants and Shadowcraft Spaulders.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9021]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的！",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着鬼雾便鞋，鬼雾护腿和鬼雾衬肩回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9022]={d="瓦萨拉克的灵魂被存在这个护符里。因为我们的贪婪，愚蠢地把护符分成三块，不知道有可怕的诅咒在等着我们。\n\n阻止瓦萨拉克的魔法的唯一方法就是将护符重新组合回去。回到莫克瓦那里，告诉他布德利是找到剩下护符的唯一希望。和他谈谈为你安排的奖励。\n\n我，这一次，终于可以安息了。祝你好运；你需要这份好运的!",dEN="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together. Return to Mokvar and tell him that Bodley is his only hope for finding the remaining pieces. Speak to him about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",o="带着勇气战靴，勇气腿铠和勇气肩甲回到奥格玛的莫克瓦那里。",oEN="Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Boots of Valor, Legplates of Valor and Spaulders of Valor.",p="你回来了，我从你的眼睛里看出来你有很多话想跟我讲，$n。让我们先处理好你的奖励。",pEN="You've returned and I see in your eyes that you've much to tell me, <name>. Let us take care of your reward first.",c="就因为这个勋章，这个诅咒才会降临到我们身上。瓦萨拉克领主显然知道如何掌握仇恨。\n\n我们会尽力找到剩下的碎块——希望是在我面临最终的死期之前。不过在那之前，让我们先来看看你的奖励。",cEN="This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.\n\nWe'll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward."}
Q[9023]={d="我和我的兄弟在拉文霍德庄园外进行毒药研究。\n\n拉文霍德公爵命令我们研制一种极效混合毒药，祖尔格拉布和安其拉废墟出产这种毒药的原料，也就是毒囊。\n\n有两只剧毒的野兽居住在那些可怕的废墟中，它们很可能有我们需要的毒囊。$c，去取回库林纳克斯和温诺希斯的毒囊，我们会永远记得你的恩情的。",dEN="My brother and I run the poison operations out of the manor Ravenholdt.\n\nLord Ravenholdt tasked me to track down a new and extremely effective poison compound that can be crafted from the venom sacs of the inhabitants of Zul'Gurub and the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nThere are two particularly venomous beasts residing in those blasted ruins that possess what it is that we might be looking for, <class>. Bring me a venom sac from the beasts Kurinnaxx and Venoxis and we would be eternally grateful.",o="塞纳里奥要塞的德尔克·雷木让你把温诺希斯的毒囊和库林纳克斯的毒囊交给他。",oEN="Dirk Thunderwood at Cenarion Hold wants you to bring him Venoxis's Venom Sac and Kurinnaxx's Venom Sac.",p="这不是个简单的任务，$n。你需要带些朋友去。",pEN="This ain't no smash and grab job, <name>. You're gonna need to bring friends.",c="拉文霍德感谢你，英雄！带着你的奖励走吧！",cEN="Ravenholdt thanks you, hero! Take your pick!"}
Q[9024]={d="我找到了！你闻到过风中的新香气没有？新的香水现在有那么流行么？我们的卫兵不该这么简单就这样抛弃他们的职责！\n\n嗯，一定是因为他们的理智完全被这些该死的炼金术产品所盖过去了。\n\n要想搞清楚问题，只有一个办法：弄一些香水的样本，把它们交给摩根·匹斯特，并把我的推断告诉他。别担心，你回来的时候我会把买香水的钱付给你的。",dEN="I've got it! Have you smelled the new fragrance on the wind? The new colognes and perfumes that have come into fashion? Our guards wouldn't neglect their duties so easily.\n\nThat is, unless their thinking has been clouded by some foul alchemy.\n\nThere is only one way to be sure - bring a bottle of cologne and perfume to Morgan Pestle, and tell him my suspicions. I will reimburse you for their purchase when you return.",o="将1瓶古龙水和1瓶香水交给暴风城贸易区的摩根·匹斯特。",oEN="Bring 1 Cologne Bottle and 1 Perfume Bottle to Morgan Pestle in the Trade District of Stormwind.",p="有什么能帮你的吗？",pEN="Something I can help you with?",c="我了解艾里斯坦的疑虑，但我真的觉得他反应过度了。让年轻男女做他们想做的事吧。我想艾里斯坦已经忘了年轻和恋爱的感觉。\n\n不过还是不要告诉他比较好。我们就迁就他吧。",cEN="I understand Aristan's concerns, but I really think he's overreacting. Let young men and women do what they will. I think Aristan has forgotten what it means to be young and in love.\n\nBut it would be better not to tell him that. We'll humor him."}
Q[9025]={d="好吧，有问题。看来阿瑞斯坦还真是个很警觉的人。我在香水中发现了一些应用在爱情药水中的物质，以及一些可以影响情绪的危险成分。\n\n在香水中应用这些物质虽然并非是前所未有的，但我从中分析出的一些原料……闻起来很有趣。",dEN="Well, I'll be. It looks like Aristan might be on to something after all. I found traces of substances used in love potions and insidious mind-altering draughts.\n\nIt isn't unheard of for perfumes to have some of them, but a few of the ingredients I detected... Smells funny.",o="回到暴风城银行附近的阿瑞斯坦·莫塔那里。",oEN="Return to Aristan Mottar outside the bank in Stormwind's Trade District.",c="虽然我认为这应该就是事实，但仍未证实我的怀疑是对的。我们要三思而后行。\n\n拿着，酬谢你购买古龙水跟香水。",cEN="While I thought this would be the case, finding out that my suspicions were correct is still unsettling. We must carefully consider our next move.\n\nHere, to repay you for the purchase of the cologne and perfume."}
Q[9026]={d="我们一定得找到源头才行。我看到许多人，包括卫兵，都在镶金玫瑰那里进进出出。跟奥里森谈谈，要是她在卖这些东西，就问问她是从哪里弄来的货。",dEN="We've got to find the source. I've seen a lot more people than usual - guards included - going in and out of The Gilded Rose. Talk to Allison. If she's selling them, she can tell you where they came from.",o="与暴风城贸易区中的镶金玫瑰旅店的老板奥里森谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Innkeeper Allison at The Gilded Rose in Stormwind's Trade District.",c="是的，我最近刚进了香水和古龙水。相当地热卖，我不知道它们还能放在柜子上多久。\n\n如果你问我，其实我觉得有点无聊。每个人身上的味道都一样？不过是真的很好闻啦。",cEN="Oh yes, I just got the perfume and cologne in stock recently. It's been selling so well, I don't know how long I can keep it on the shelves.\n\nIf you ask me, it's kind of boring. Everyone smelling the same? It smells great, but still."}
Q[9027]={d="我的香水有点古怪？有可能。我从来没见过人们对某种产品这样痴迷。\n\n你看，要是有什么古怪的话，我也很想知道。我是从一个叫埃文特·索里萨姆的商人那里进到这批货的。他是新来的。\n\n他提到过说有些货物得送到“最好的线团”那边去。",dEN="Something funny about the cologne? It's possible. I've never seen so many people after one product like this.\n\nLook, if there's something wrong with it, I want to know, too. I bought my supply from a merchant named Evert Sorisam. He's new in town.\n\nHe mentioned he had some goods he was going to deliver to The Finest Thread.",o="与暴风城运河旁的裁缝店“最好的线团”里面的埃文特·索里萨姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Evert Sorisam at The Finest Thread along Stormwind's Canals.",c="是的，当然。那些香氛是这一季最抢手的货。这一个小时里，你已经是第五六个来打听它们的人了。\n\n可惜我的存货都卖光了。如果你想要一些，该去找金蔷薇旅店的老板艾莉森。\n\n不过你可别浪费时间。我想你会发现那香水让人难以抗拒。",cEN="Yes, of course. Those fragrances are the hottest items this season. You must be the fifth or sixth person this hour to inquire about them.\n\nI'm afraid my supplies are all sold out. If you'd like some, you should speak with Allison, the innkeeper of The Gilded Rose.\n\nYou shouldn't waste any time, though. I think you'll find the perfume will be irresistible."}
Q[9028]={d="什么？叛国罪？不，不，我向你保证，我绝对没有任何的恶意。\n\n难道说帮助那些想轻松度过痛苦的求爱期的年轻人也有错吗？拜托，这绝对不是犯罪。\n\n为了证明我确实没有恶意，我可以告诉你货源。\n\n据说这些香水都是一个叫斯塔弗隆·雷伦特的药剂师制作的，不过我从未与他见过面，也没有说过话。\n\n我们的地精中间人说，他就在希尔斯布莱德地区工作，似乎就是那个神秘的拉文霍德庄园一带。祝你好运！",dEN="What? Treason? No, no. I assure you, my intentions are completely harmless.\n\nIs it so wrong to help those who wish to ease the painful ritual of courtship? Come, that is no crime.\n\nAnd to prove that I mean no harm, I will even tell you my source.\n\nThey were shipped to me by a Staffron Lerent, an apothecary of some sort. I never spoke with him.\n\nOur goblin middle man said that he worked in the foothills over Hillsbrad past that mysterious Ravenholdt Manor. I wish you luck in finding him.",o="到希尔斯布莱德丘陵去，在拉文霍德庄园后面找到药剂师斯塔弗隆·雷伦特。",oEN="Find Apothecary Staffron Lerent in the Hillsbrad Foothills behind Ravenholdt Manor.",c="是的，是我做了那些香水。很香啊，不是吗？另人无法抗拒。\n\n当联盟和部落的战士们都为这些爱的感觉所倾倒，他们就无法抵抗暗影议会的崛起了。\n\n他们会变的衰弱，手足无措。当他们担心着内心所挚爱的人，就会失去他们的优势。\n\n解决的方法很简单。为什么我要花那么久的时间去想呢？弱点就是心啊。会发生的事就是会发生，你无法避免的。",cEN="Yes, I made those fragrances. Wonderful smell, isn't it? Irresistible.\n\nOnce the warriors of Alliance and Horde alike are smitten with these feelings of love, they will be powerless to stop the rise of the Shadow Council.\n\nThey will be weakened, unprepared. As they worry for their loved ones, they will lose their edge.\n\nThe solution was so simple. Why did it take me so long to come upon it? The weakness of all is through the heart. And there is nothing you can do to stop the inevitable."}
Q[9032]={d="护符里藏着瓦萨拉克的灵魂？！难怪它被如此强大的诅咒守护着。\n\n要找到博德利有点麻烦。我最后一次听说他的消息时，他正准备再次深入黑石塔。之后就再没他的音讯了。\n\n到黑石山去找他吧，不过我恐怕他如今多半已经死了。我建议你带上那个地精的装置，$g朋友:朋友;。",dEN="The medallion contained Valthalak's soul? It's no surprise it was guarded by such a powerful curse.\n\nLocating Bodley presents a bit of a problem. Last time I heard of him, he was preparing to venture back into Blackrock Spire. He was never heard of again.\n\nSeek him out in Blackrock Mountain, though I'm afraid to say he's probably dead by now. I suggest taking the goblin's device with you, friend.",o="到黑石山并使用超空间鬼魂显像机，去黑石塔附近寻找布德利。",oEN="Travel to Blackrock Mountain and use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",c="我好高兴你能看到我，终于有人能跟我说说话！\n\n你能帮帮我们吗，$n？帮帮我们将以前所犯的错导入正轨？如果你真的有瓦萨拉克领主护符上半块，我就能指引你拿到另外那2块，然后拼凑好就行了。\n\n喔，对了，你好，我叫布德利。很高兴认识你！",cEN="I am so glad that you can see me. Finally someone to talk to!\n\nWill you help us, <name>? Help to undo the wrong that we perpetrated and put things to right? If it's true that you already have the Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, then I think I can point you in the right direction to acquire the other two parts, reunite them and put an end to all of this.\n\nOh, by the way, hello, my name is Bodley. Nice to meet you!"}
Q[9033]={d="上一次战争距今已有5年了……\n\n数万名士兵战死沙场，他们的牺牲换来了什么？危机远远没有消失。\n\n巫妖王再次蠢蠢欲动……他的走狗克尔苏加德正在集聚军队，准备对我们的家园发动新一轮的袭击。\n\n我们绝不会让他得逞！拿出你的奉献精神吧。勇敢地投入战斗，以此证明你的无畏！银色黎明和血色十字军组成的联军将是你坚强的后盾和战友。\n\n前往纳克萨玛斯的宫殿，打败天灾军团……",dEN="Five years since the last war...\n\nTens of thousands of lives were lost and for what? The threat was never fully extinguished.\n\nAnd so the Lich King stirs once more... His yes-man, Kel'Thuzad, amassing for another attack upon our lands.\n\nWe will not allow it! Prove your dedication. Prove that you are willing to risk life and limb to stop this madness and the combined might of the Dawn and the Crusade will be at your beck and call.\n\nEnter Naxxramas and destroy the Scourge within...",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃利戈尔·黎明使者要你杀死3只活体畸形怪、5只石肤石像鬼、6名死亡骑士队长和3只毒刺潜伏者。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to slay 3 Living Monstrosities, 5 Stoneskin Gargoyles, 6 Deathknight Captains and 3 Venom Stalkers.",p="职责，荣誉，奉献……这些字眼对你而言有什么意义？",pEN="Duty, honor, dedication... What do these words mean to you?",c="做得好！你会因为替圣光之愿的男男女女牺牲奉献而获得奖励。",cEN="A job well done! You will be rewarded via the services of the men and women at Light's Hope."}
Q[9034]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯就会为你打造一件无畏胸甲：1件被亵渎的胸甲、25块破损的板甲碎片、4根奥金锭和2颗连结水晶。|n",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Breastplate if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一件无畏胸甲了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Breastplate."}
Q[9035]={d="嘿，叫你呢！你可得帮帮我。\n\n我和我的学徒被那些肮脏的怪物袭击了！他们渴望拥有魔法力量，疯狂地收集法力水晶、魔杖、法术书……所有与魔法相关的东西！\n\n梅雷多尔追他们去了，我只得留在这儿保护好幸存的东西。沿着这条路往前走，看看你能不能帮他一把。",dEN="You, there! You must help me, please!\n\nA fellow apprentice and I were attacked by the Wretched! In their mad hunger for magic, they took everything they could get their hands on: mana crystals, wands, spellbooks... everything!\n\nMeledor gave chase after them; I had to stay behind and look after what they didn't take. Continue down the road and see if you can lend him a hand.",o="出了银月城向南走便是永歌森林，去那儿找学徒梅雷多尔谈谈。",oEN="Speak to Apprentice Meledor in Eversong Woods along the road heading south from Silvermoon City.",c="他们全都逃了。用一枚火球把他们全都吓的屁滚尿流！不幸的是，他们把大部分偷走的东西都丢到河里了。",cEN="They're gone now. Scared the breeches out of them with a well-placed fireball! Unfortunately for me, they threw our precious cargo into the river."}
Q[9036]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿铠、20块板甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏腿铠。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Legplates if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一副无畏腿甲了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Legplates."}
Q[9037]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1顶被玷污的头盔、15块板甲碎片、5块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一顶无畏头盔。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Helmet if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="头部是全身最敏感的位置。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一顶无畏头盔了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Helmet."}
Q[9038]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠、12块板甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏肩铠。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Pauldrons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="秘诀就在于团结一致。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一副无畏护肩了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Pauldrons."}
Q[9039]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯就会为你打造一双无畏战靴：1双被亵渎的战靴、12块破损的板甲碎片、2根奥金锭和3张鞣制过的厚重兽皮。|n",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Sabatons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="永远不要低估一双好鞋的价值。尤其是柯菲斯做的鞋子！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一双无畏战靴了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Sabatons."}
Q[9040]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护手。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Gauntlets if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这些护手就是要配上精良的武器。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一副无畏护手了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Gauntlets."}
Q[9041]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一条无畏护腰。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Waistguard if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="腰带不仅是个时髦的象征也是强大的保护装备。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一条无畏腰甲了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Waistguard."}
Q[9042]={d="在你与纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的天灾军团作战过程中，如果看到被玷污的护甲和板甲碎片，将它们带给我，我会为你打造一套适合英雄穿着的护甲。",dEN="During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护腕。",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Bracers if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="手腕是全身第二脆弱的部位……还是第四个？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以打造一副无畏护腕了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Dreadnaught Bracers."}
Q[9043]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套，25块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎外套。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一件救赎外衣了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Tunic."}
Q[9044]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿甲，20块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎腿甲。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你不会再找到比这更适合神圣战士的腿甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副救赎腿甲了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Legguards."}
Q[9045]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰，15块板甲碎片，5块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎头饰。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="<艾利格抬头看着你又继续说。>",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="<埃利戈尔指着自己的头。>\n\n把它戴好，$n。",cEN="<Eligor points to his head.>\n\nKeep it covered, <class>."}
Q[9046]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎肩铠。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你没看到我们在忙吗，$n？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="任何一位$c都会告诉你，他大部分的力量都来自肩头。越大越好……",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Spaulders."}
Q[9047]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一双救赎长靴。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="这双靴子会保护你的双脚不受矮小的天灾军团攻击。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Boots."}
Q[9048]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护手。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="让圣光引导这些手甲击倒你的敌人！",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Handguards."}
Q[9049]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的束带，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一条救赎束带。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="这条腰带会有两大用处：1）它会保护你、引导你对抗天灾；2）它会让你看起来$g轻了:轻了;10公斤。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Girdle."}
Q[9050]={d="杀死纳克萨玛斯城中的敌军首领之后，你会在他们的尸体上发现阵亡英雄的遗骸。将那些被亵渎的遗物、板甲碎片和其它材料交给我，也许我能试着移除护甲上的诅咒，重新为你打造一件精良的护甲。",dEN="You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕，6块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护腕。",oEN="Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="如果你要我帮你制作护甲就一定要将我说的东西带来。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="这些东西制作的非常划算，但是请小心，如果你太常让它们溅水的话是会生锈的。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Wristguards."}
Q[9051]={d="这些你帮我制造的毒素有着特殊的用途。环形山里的魔暴龙使得那里的狩猎和生存环境对我来说都变得十分恶劣。即使我足够强壮，杀死一只魔暴龙也只会让另一只游荡入那块带领地而已。\n\n带上这根毒针并将其刺入一只活着的魔暴龙体内。毒素会使它很快就安静下来，不过……我不知道很快有多快……",dEN="The toxin you helped me create is for a special purpose. The great devilsaurs of the crater make it dangerous to hunt and difficult for me to survive. Even if I possessed the necessary strength, killing a devilsaur simply allows another to move into its territory.\n\nTake this poisoned barb and stab it deep into a living devilsaur. The toxin should pacify the creature, though I do not know how quickly...",o="将魔暴龙之刺扎入一只魔暴龙的体内。",oEN="Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb. Return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater when you have completed this task.",p="你驯服那头野兽了吗？",pEN="Were you able to pacify the great beast?",c="感谢你，$n。你很勇敢也很有智慧。\n\n跟我说说看那个恶龙的毒性反应如何？",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You are brave and wise.\n\nTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?"}
Q[9052]={d="我想请你帮我配制一种毒素之类的东西，好安抚住生活在这个火山口里的那头巨兽。它并不致命，而且只有像你这样$g一位:一位;目光敏锐的$c才有望采齐这些材料。\n\n你可以在遍布火山口的血瓣花丛里找到生长其中的血帽蘑菇。戈里什毒刺则取自蜷缩伤痕内部及周边的昆虫——就在火山口南部的蜿蜒伤痕一带。",dEN="I would ask you to help me create a toxin of sorts, to pacify a great creature living here in the crater. It is not deadly, and only the keen eyes of a <class> can hope to collect the ingredients.\n\nYou can find the bloodcap mushrooms growing within the bloodpetal sprouts all across the crater. Gorishi stings are from the insects inside and around the Slithering Scar, located in the southern part of the crater.",o="收集一些血帽和格里什钉刺，然后向托尔瓦·寻路者复命。",oEN="Collect 8 Bloodcap and 8 Gorishi Stings, and return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",p="成功了吗？",pEN="Have you met with success?",c="终于拿到了材料！\n\n有了安戈洛的这些材料，调制毒素就变的轻而易举……",cEN="The ingredients at last!\n\nWith the Un'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted..."}
Q[9053]={d="这正是我所担心的，看来毒素的力量还是太弱了，无法对这样强大的生物产生影响。\n\n我们必须造出一种更强力的毒素，你需要前往阿塔哈卡神庙的底部，揭开那个祭坛的秘密，并从那里的守卫身上取一些腐烂的藤蔓来。神庙很危险，我建议你带些朋友一起去。\n\n完成之后回到我这里来吧。",dEN="It is as I feared -- the toxin is simply too weak for such a powerful creature.\n\nIf we are to create a toxin of high enough potency, you must venture to the bottom of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, unlock the secrets of the altar and recover a putrid vine from the guardian there. The temple is dangerous, and it would behoove you to bring friends.\n\nReturn to me when this is done.",o="从沉没的神庙底部的守卫身上得到一些腐烂藤蔓，把它们交给托尔瓦·寻路者。",oEN="Retrieve a Putrid Vine from the guardian at the bottom of the Sunken Temple and return to Torwa Pathfinder.",p="你拿回藤蔓了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the vine?",c="终于，这毒素可以完整地配制出来了。我不敢再要求你把它用在那个生物身上了，我已经麻烦你太多了。\n\n我向你致谢，也向你致敬。愿你的旅途一切顺利，$n。",cEN="At last, the toxin can be created in full. I dare not require you to inflict it upon the creature again, as I have asked too much already.\n\nYou have my thanks and respect. May you be well in your travels, <name>."}
Q[9054]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者外套。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="他们会畏惧你，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Tunic."}
Q[9055]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1条被玷污的腿甲、20块锁甲碎片、3块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一条地穴追猎者腿甲。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="当你穿上这件护甲，你就会发现你的人开始改变。你会有不可思议的杀人能力。或许，甚至有一点嗜血。\n\n先说好我不会对你卷入的任何混乱负责……",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Legguards."}
Q[9056]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者头饰。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你有我要的物品了吗，$c？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="你变成了一个可怕的生物，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Headpiece."}
Q[9057]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块锁甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者肩饰。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副地穴追猎者护肩了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Spaulders."}
Q[9058]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一双地穴追猎者长靴。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="靴子准备好了，$n！好好地穿。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Boots."}
Q[9059]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的手甲、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者护手。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="让地穴恶魔带领你的手吧，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Handguards."}
Q[9060]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎人利奥波德就会为你打造一条地穴追猎者腰带：1条被亵渎的腰带、8块破损的锁甲碎片、1根奥金锭和3颗连结水晶。|n",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="一个忠诚的束腰！为你准备好了，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Girdle."}
Q[9061]={d="我发现地穴恶魔的甲壳大有用处。我可以利用这种甲壳以及丢失在纳克萨玛斯宫殿中的被玷污的护甲，打造出一套轻便时尚的、具有毁灭性力量的套装。\n\n帮我寻找必需的材料，我就能制作出这套前所未有的装备！",dEN="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者腕甲。",oEN="Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副地穴追猎者护腕了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Wristguards."}
Q[9062]={d="那些该死的失心者一见到敢跟他们叫板的人，跑得倒是飞快。不过现在先别管这些了。我得找回我导师的元素魔典。\n\n我敢肯定我看见其中一个胆小鬼把它扔进了河里，可我怎么也找不到。多一双眼睛总是好的。你要是能找到，我另外再加点钱。",dEN="Those blasted Wretched sure can run fast at the sight of someone who'll stand up to them. But let's not worry about that now. I need to find my instructor's elemental grimoire.\n\nI'm certain I saw one of those cowards throw it into the river but I cannot seem to be able to locate it. I could use another set of eyes. I'll throw in a bit of coin if you spot it.",o="永歌森林的学徒梅雷多尔让你搜寻附近桥梁下的水域，帮他找到安瑟隆的元素魔典。",oEN="Apprentice Meledor in Eversong Woods wants you to search the water beneath the bridge nearby and bring him Antheol's Elemental Grimoire.",p="运气不好？嗯，继续找。那本书极为重要，$c。",pEN="No luck? Well, keep looking. The book is of utmost importance, <class>.",c="这本书已经完全浸湿了。指导者安瑟隆会不高兴的。\n\n来，拿着这些钱。我有个主意。",cEN="The book is completely soaked. Instructor Antheol's not going to like this at all.\n\nHere, take this money. I have an idea."}
Q[9063]={d="有位名叫托尔瓦·寻路者的猎人最近请求德鲁伊的帮助。他说只有我们才具备必要的技巧与对大自然的尊重。\n\n托尔瓦并不难找，他就在由塔纳利斯通往安戈洛环形山的路上，准确的说，是环形山的入口位置。",dEN="A hunter by the name of Torwa Pathfinder has requested the help of a druid. He said only we would possess the necessary skills and respect for nature to help him.\n\nThere is a road that connects the Un'Goro Crater and the desert of Tanaris. As that road enters the crater, you will find Torwa close by.",o="与安戈洛环形山的托尔瓦·寻路者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.",c="你千里迢迢来找我，$c，而且还真花了很多时间。",cEN="You have traveled far to meet with me, <class>, and not a moment too soon."}
Q[9064]={d="安瑟奥尔要是知道他的书成了这副样子，准会暴跳如雷。我给你出个主意，别担心，不会让你白帮忙的。\n\n把这本书给他送去，这事一个字也别提。他要是问起，就说你把书掉进水坑里了。他对你没有直接的管束权，所以也拿你没办法。\n\n安瑟奥尔在银月城东南的静语池塘讲课。你会帮我们这个忙的，对吧？事成之后我定有重谢！",dEN="Antheol is going to fly off his rocker when he finds out his book is ruined. I've got a little proposal for you; don't worry, I'll make it worth your while.\n\nTake this book to him and tell him nothing of this incident. If he asks, just tell him you dropped the book into a puddle. He has no direct authority over you, so there's not much he can do.\n\nAntheol delivers his lectures at Stillwhisper Pond, southeast of Silvermoon. You'll do this for us, right? I'll reward you handsomely for this favor!",o="将安瑟隆的元素魔典交给永歌森林的萦语水池旁的指导者安瑟隆。",oEN="Bring Antheol's Elemental Grimoire to Instructor Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods.",p="有什么事需要打断我的演讲，$c？",pEN="What calls for this interruption to my lecture, <class>?",c="你说那两个无能的蠢蛋收买你来骗我？你来找我做的非常好，$n。",cEN="You say those two incompetent fools bribed you to lie to me? You've done very well in coming to me, <name>."}
Q[9066]={d="希望你能学到一点处事之道，$n。不要相信满嘴谎言的家伙。\n\n现在，我想让你回去找那两个愚蠢的学生，使用这根魔杖召回他们的学徒徽章。这根杖子不仅能取下两人身上的徽章，还会给予他们适当的惩罚。\n\n做完这事儿就来找我吧。我会酬谢你的。",dEN="I hope you learn a valuable lesson today, <name>. Never trust someone else to lie for you.\n\nNow I want you to go back to my two dimwitted students and discipline them using this wand. My magic tells me that you'll find them along the road to the west on the other side of the Dead Scar.\n\nCome back to me after you've done this. I'll give you a small reward for your troubles.",o="对指导者安瑟隆的两名学生：学徒拉尔雷和学徒梅雷多尔使用他交给你的魔杖。然后将安瑟隆的训诫棒还给永歌森林萦语水池旁的安瑟隆。",oEN="Use Antheol's Disciplinary Rod on his two students: Apprentice Ralen and Apprentice Meledor. Return to Antheol at Stillwhisper Pond in Eversong Woods with the rod after this.",p="你做了我要你做的事吗，$n？",pEN="Did you do what I asked of you, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。别担心，他们不会永远变成那个样子。不过，他们的学徒资格在他们自己把它挣回来之前是不会再出现的。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. Don't worry, they're not stuck in that form permanently. Their apprenticeship, however, won't be restored until they earn it back."}
Q[9067]={d="我最喜欢举办舞会和酒会了……这都是为伟大而辉煌的奎尔萨拉斯庆贺与祝福！\n\n但……但是，我手头上还有别的事，所以我希望你能帮我带过来一些货物。\n\n请你帮我从银月城旅店的调酒师桑塔基德那里买一瓶日光陈酿，从远行者居所的萨蕾妮·晨光那里买一些魔泉美味回来，然后再从晴风村的哈里斯·晨行者那里买点烟花。\n\n快点，别让我等急了！",dEN="I like to throw parties... just a little something to celebrate the magnificence that is Quel'Thalas!\n\nBut, I'm in a bit of a bind. I need you to gather up more party supplies.\n\nFrom Vinemaster Suntouched at the Silvermoon City inn, bring me a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve. From Zalene Firstlight at Farstrider Retreat acquire more of those delicious Springpaw Appetizers. And you can pick up my delivery of fireworks from Halis Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village.\n\nBe quick about it!",o="购买一瓶日光陈酿、一些魔泉美味和一捆烟花，然后向永歌森林萨瑟利尔庄园的萨瑟利尔男爵复命。",oEN="Acquire a bottle of Suntouched Special Reserve, Springpaw Appetizers and a Bundle of Fireworks, and return them to Lord Saltheril at Saltheril's Haven in Eversong Woods.",p="我不是派你去为派对收集更多食物吗？是你吗？喔，我不可能永远记住每个人的长相，对吧？我见过太多……有趣的人。\n\n你想要什么？",pEN="Didn't I just send you out to gather up more party supplies? Was that you? Oh, I can't be expected to remember everyone's face, now can I? I meet so many... interesting people.\n\nWhat is it that you want?",c="你是$g个:个;精力充沛的$g年轻人:年轻人;，不是吗？\n\n这些看起来都挺不错。你替我收集齐了这些东西，理应得到报酬，我想还该额外再添点什么。\n\n哦，差点忘了，这是宴会的请柬。还有，$c，下次来的时候，记得穿得稍微……喜庆一点。",cEN="You're quite the energetic young <man/woman>, aren't you?\n\nThis all looks very adequate. You certainly deserve compensation for gathering up all of this for me, and something a little extra I think.\n\nOh, I almost forgot, here's an invitation to the party. And, <class>, next time that you drop in make sure to dress up in something a little more... festive."}
Q[9068]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者外套，只要你将下列物品带给他：1件被亵渎的外衣，25个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，4个奥金锭和3块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="<林布拉特对你嗤之以鼻。>",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="碎地者是最强大且引人敬畏的护甲。我的祖先会为你的成就而微笑的，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Tunic."}
Q[9069]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者护腿，只要你将下列物品带给他：1对被亵渎的腿甲，20个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，3个奥金锭和5块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="不论如何，我们一定要拯救这块土地。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="我希望你不会和之前来这里的人有一样的命运，$n。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Legguards."}
Q[9070]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者头盔，只要你将下列物品带给他：1个被亵渎的头甲，15个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，4个奥金锭和2个联结水晶。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一顶碎地者头盔了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Headpiece."}
Q[9071]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者肩甲，只要你将下列物品带给他：1套被亵渎的护肩，12个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，2个奥金锭和2块月布。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Mooncloth.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副碎地者护肩了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Spaulders."}
Q[9072]={d="你能将那些战死沙场的英雄的护甲给我带回来吗？\n\n那些护甲被邪恶的敌人夺去，早已被玷污了，但是护甲碎片能彻底清洁它们，让我们重新穿着它们杀入战场。\n\n将阵亡英雄的遗物以及那些净化所需的材料交给我，我会为你打造碎地者的套装。\n\n到纳克萨玛斯去寻找吧！",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一双碎地者长靴。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一双碎地者长靴了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Boots."}
Q[9073]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者护手，只要你将下列物品带给他：1套被亵渎的护手，8个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，1个奥金锭和5块熟化毛皮。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me that which I require?",c="这些手甲引导元素的能量！",cEN="These handguards channel the power of the elements!"}
Q[9074]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者将为你制作碎地者束腰，只要你将下列物品带给他：1个被亵渎的束腰，8个受战争破坏的链甲碎片，1个奥金锭和3个联结水晶。",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一条碎地者腰带了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Earthshatter Girdle."}
Q[9075]={d="你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗？\n\n护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。\n\n将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。\n\n寻找纳克萨玛斯。",dEN="Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?\n\nThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.\n\nBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.\n\nSearch Naxxramas.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的里姆布拉特·碎地者就会为你打造一副碎地者护腕：1副被亵渎的护腕、6块破损的锁甲碎片、1根奥金锭和2张鞣制过的厚重兽皮。|n",oEN="Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me that which I require?",c="腕甲准备好了，$n。\n\n<林布拉特鞠躬。>",cEN="The wristguards are ready, <name>.\n\n<Rimblat bows.>"}
Q[9076]={d="那些失心者囫囵吞枣似的研究着低劣的魔法，尚未察觉我们已经取回了大部分武器。但是，我们不能指望他们一直这么愚钝。现在是时候策划一场决定性的突袭了，目标就锁定他们的首领奥尔达隆吧。他就在船坞旁边那幢建筑物的顶层。把他的徽记交给我，我会酬谢你的。",dEN="The Wretched are so oblivious, gorging on foul magic, that they haven't realized we've recovered most of our weapons. We can't expect them to remain in their stupor, though. Now is the time for a decisive attack. Let us make an example of their leader, Aldaron. He was spotted on the top floor of the building by the anchorage. Bring me his head; I'll reward you suitably.",o="将奥尔达隆的徽记交给永歌森林阳帆港附近的维雷迪斯·雪晨。",oEN="Bring Aldaron's Head to Velendris Whitemorn near Sunsail Anchorage in Eversong Woods.",p="嗯，你拿到他的头了吗？我没时间浪费，$n。",pEN="Well, do you have his head or not? I've no time to waste, <name>.",c="你终究还是击败了他！不用说，是我的人先替你把他磨软了。\n\n开个玩笑，$c。你干得很好。只要你洁身自好，早晚会闯出名堂来。",cEN="You defeated him after all! Undoubtedly my men softened him up for you.\n\nI jest, <class>. You've done well. You'll make a name for yourself if you keep your nose clean."}
Q[9077]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的胸甲、25块皮甲碎片、2块奥金锭和6个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一件骨镰胸甲。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Breastplate if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 6 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一件骨镰胸甲了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n,you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Bonescythe Breastplate."}
Q[9078]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腿铠、20块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭、8个熟化毛皮和100金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰腿铠。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Legplates if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 100 gold pieces.",p="<罗汉笑着。>\n\n我了解了这整个事情的讽刺之处。",pEN="<Rohan laughs.>\n\nI just realized the irony in all of this.",c="戴着这东西要小心一点。你可能会伤了自己。",cEN="Be careful walking around in those things. You might cut yourself."}
Q[9079]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的刺客罗翰就会为你打造一顶骨镰头盔：1顶被亵渎的头盔、15块破损的皮甲碎片、8张鞣制过的厚重兽皮、1颗连结水晶和75枚金币。|n",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Helmet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 75 gold pieces.",p="这个任务你还缺几样东西，请去把它们都找齐！",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="我的骨镰盔帽和胡力欧的不同之处在于格调，$n。格调……",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n,you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Bonescythe Helmet."}
Q[9080]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠、12块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮、1块连结水晶和50金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰肩铠。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Pauldrons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 50 gold pieces.",p="<罗汉很怀疑地看着你。>\n\n你最近去过提尔之手？",pEN="<Rohan eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nBeen to Tyr's Hand lately?",c="<Rohan se seca el sudor de la frente>\n\n这副护肩可费了不少功夫！别出去像个小菜鸟一样白白送命，$n。",cEN="<Rohan wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nThese shoulders took some work! Don't go out and get yourself killed like a scrub, <name>."}
Q[9081]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的马靴、12块皮甲碎片、3个熟化毛皮、2块连结水晶和25金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一双骨镰马靴。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Sabatons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Cured Rugged Hides, 2 Nexus Crystals and 25 gold pieces.",p="把材料拿来就行，别再浪费我的时间了，$n。",pEN="Just bring me the materials and stop wasting my time, <class>.",c="他们穿在你脚上很适合。对了，你最近没有再去提尔之手了吧？",cEN="They go on your feet. Say, you haven't been nosing around in Tyr's Hand again, have you?"}
Q[9082]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的护手、8块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一双骨镰护手。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Gauntlets if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="这些护手必要时可能可以替换武器。骄傲的穿戴上它们吧！",cEN="These gauntlets could probably substitute as weapons if absolutely necessary. Wear them with pride!"}
Q[9083]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮、1块连结水晶和15金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一条骨镰护腰。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Waistguard if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 15 gold pieces.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="腰带准备好了，$n。你有看过这样高品质的物品以如此低价出售吗？",cEN="The belt is ready, <name>. Have you ever seen such a high-quality item sold for so little?"}
Q[9084]={d="如果你想要骨镰护甲，就得帮我找来一些必需的材料。\n\n进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿——就是那座漂浮在空中的巨大城市，去收集被玷污的护甲和皮甲碎片。集齐所有材料，我就能为你打造骨镰护甲。噢，对了，你还得付点金币给我……制作护甲所需的骨头由我来提供。",dEN="If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials.\n\nEnter Naxxramas, the big floating city of death in the sky up there, and find desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps. Bring those back along with the materials to put everything together and you'll have your Bonescythe. Oh, and you'll need to pay me for my troubles... I'll supply the bones.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块皮甲碎片、1块奥金锭、2个熟化毛皮和10金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一副骨镰护腕。",oEN="Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Bracers if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar, 2 Cured Rugged Hides and 10 gold pieces.",p="没有我需要的物品，你要我怎么做出什么东西来？",pEN="How do you expect me to get anything done without the items I requested?",c="护腕准备好了，$n。\n\n<罗汉鞠躬。>",cEN="The bracers are ready, <name>.\n\n<Rohan bows.>"}
Q[9085]={d="天灾的军队由无数恐怖之物组成——但很少有比护巢者阿肯纳特更令人胆寒的。\n\n护巢者阿肯纳特只是眼下在艾泽拉斯各处发动入侵的天灾指挥官之一。若银色黎明要取得胜利，这头怪物必须被消灭。说真的，我并不羡慕你的任务。你将面对阿努布雷坎最忠诚、最受信赖的仆从之一。",dEN="The forces of the Scourge are comprised of many horrors -- but few are more harrowing than Broodwatcher Akhenat.\n\nBroodwatcher Akhenat is but one of the Scourge commanders overseeing the invasions we're currently experiencing across Azeroth.\n\nIf the Argent Dawn is to prevail, this monstrosity MUST be destroyed.\n\nIn truth, I do not envy your task. You will be facing one of Anub'Rekhan's most loyal and trusted servants.\n\nMay the Light give you strength, <name>. You'll need it.",o="前往一处召唤法阵，杀死一只毁灭之影，然后向东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官托马斯·海勒兰汇报。",oEN="Find an active level 60 Scourge Invasion and defeat Broodwatcher Akhenat, then return to Commander Thomas Helleran at Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="运气如何，$n？",pEN="Have you had any luck, <name>?",c="干得漂亮，$n。那头蛛怪怪物被消灭了，我们战胜克尔苏加德的希望得以延续。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. With that Nerubian monstrosity destroyed, our hope of victory against Kel'Thuzad survives."}
Q[9086]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者外套。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Tunic if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者外套准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Tunic is ready, <name>."}
Q[9087]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的腿甲、20块皮甲碎片、8个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者腿甲。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Legguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="如我所允诺的，梦行者腿甲。\n\n<瑞恩将护甲交给你。>",cEN="As promised, Dreamwalker Legguards.\n\n<Rayne hands you the armor.>"}
Q[9088]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者头饰。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Headpiece if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者首盔准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Headpiece is ready, <name>."}
Q[9089]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者肩饰。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Spaulders if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者肩甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Spaulders are ready, <name>."}
Q[9090]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一双梦游者长靴。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Boots if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者长靴准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Boots are ready, <name>."}
Q[9091]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者护手。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Handguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者手甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Handguards are ready, <name>."}
Q[9092]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的束带、8块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一条梦游者束带。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Girdle if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者束腰准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Girdle is ready, <name>."}
Q[9093]={d="许多英雄在那场战争中丧生，直到今天还有无数勇士前赴后继，与天灾军团进行殊死的搏斗。天灾士兵们从阵亡的英雄身上脱下护甲，带回纳克萨玛斯进行秘密研究。\n\n取回那些被玷污的护甲碎片和我需要的其它材料，我就能为你打造梦游者护甲。",dEN="Many heroes fell in the last war and many continue to perish at the hands of the Scourge to this day. From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes.\n\nRecover the desecrated armor and wartorn armor scraps and supply to me the other material components I require and I will craft Dreamwalker armor.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块皮甲碎片、1块奥术水晶和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者腕甲。",oEN="Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Wristguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="材料虽然昂贵，但你很快就不会放在心上了。",pEN="The material cost is high, but soon forgotten.",c="你的梦行者腕甲准备好了，$n。",cEN="Your Dreamwalker Wristguards are ready, <name>."}
Q[9095]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一件霜火长袍。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Robe if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="ou got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一件霜火长袍了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Robe."}
Q[9096]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一副霜火护腿。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Leggings if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副霜火护腿了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Leggings."}
Q[9097]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1个被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一个霜火头饰。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Circlet if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一个霜火头环了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Circlet."}
Q[9098]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯就会为你制作一副霜火护肩：1副被亵渎的护肩、12块破损的布甲碎片、2块月布和3张鞣制过的厚重兽皮。|n",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Shoulderpads if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副霜火护肩了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Shoulderpads."}
Q[9099]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的便鞋、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一双霜火便鞋。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Sandals if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一双霜火便鞋了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Sandals."}
Q[9100]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1双被玷污的手套、8块布衣碎片和4张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一双霜火手套。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Gloves if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副霜火手套了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Gloves."}
Q[9101]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的腰带、8块布衣碎片、2块奥术水晶和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一条霜火腰带。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Frostfire Belt if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一条霜火腰带。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n,you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Belt."}
Q[9102]={d="作为一名守卫，我有权使用麦迪文的私人物品。我发现在所有的物品中，书籍最能予人启迪。坦白地说，虽然大部分书籍内容都相当垃圾，但其中也不乏精品。其中一本记载了大法师的霜火套装的制作方法。\n\n<安吉拉指着她的脑袋。>\n\n它们现在都在我的脑子里，如果你能给我适当的材料，我会很乐意与你分享这些宝贵的知识。",dEN="As a Watcher, I was allowed access to many of Medivh's personal effects. Among those items, I found the tomes most enlightening. While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire.\n\n<Angela points to her head.>\n\nIt's all in here and I am willing to share the fruits of that knowledge with you as long as you are able to provide me with the necessary materials.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕轮、6块布衣碎片、1块奥术水晶和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的大法师安吉拉·杜萨图斯，她会为你制作一副霜火腕轮。",oEN="Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Frostfire Bindings if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="有了适宜的材料和试剂，我就能制作神话般的霜火护甲了。",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副霜火护腕了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !,\nyou got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Frostfire Bindings."}
Q[9103]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一件瘟疫之心长袍。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一件瘟疫之心长袍了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Robe."}
Q[9104]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1副被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心护腿。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副瘟疫之心护腿了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Leggings."}
Q[9105]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1个被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一个瘟疫之心头饰。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一个瘟疫之心头环了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Circlet."}
Q[9106]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩垫、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心肩垫。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Shoulderpads if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副瘟疫之心护肩了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Shoulderpads."}
Q[9107]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1双被玷污的便鞋、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一双瘟疫之心便鞋。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Sandals if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一双瘟疫之心便鞋了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Sandals."}
Q[9108]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1双被玷污的手套、8块布衣碎片和4张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一双瘟疫之心手套。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Gloves if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副瘟疫之心手套了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Gloves."}
Q[9109]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1条被玷污的腰带、8块布衣碎片、2块奥术水晶和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一条瘟疫之心腰带。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Belt if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一条瘟疫之心腰带。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Belt."}
Q[9110]={d="我可不是吹牛，你这卑微的家伙。瘟疫之心套装拥有的黑暗力量很可能会要了我们俩的性命。这也是我要价很高的原因。要死的话，我也得做个富鬼不是？\n\n我可不关心你的死活，除非你照我说的去做。去寻找我需要的材料吧，这对我们都有好处——当然，或者我们都会丢掉性命，但是我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕轮、6块布衣碎片、1块奥术水晶和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心腕轮。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Bindings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="丰富的材料回来了！你把我要的东西都带来了吗？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="太棒了，$n！你把我要求的材料都带来了，现在我可以制作一副瘟疫之心护腕了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Bindings."}
Q[9111]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰长袍。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Robe of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你帮我把试剂带来了吗，孩子？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Robe of Faith."}
Q[9112]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰护腿。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Leggings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",p="你帮我把试剂带来了吗，孩子？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Leggings of Faith."}
Q[9113]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1件被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰头环。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Circlet of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",p="你帮我把试剂带来了吗，孩子？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Circlet of Faith."}
Q[9114]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的肩垫、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3块熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一对信仰肩垫。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Shoulderpads of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="$g孩子:孩子;，你把我要的材料带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me the reagents, child?",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="The vestments are ready, <name>. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire."}
Q[9115]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的伊尼戈·蒙托亚神父就会为你制作一双信仰之靴：1双被亵渎的便鞋、12块破损的布甲碎片、2块月布和3张鞣制过的厚重兽皮。|n",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Sandals of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",p="$g孩子:孩子;，你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me the reagents, child?",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="The vestments are ready, <name>. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire."}
Q[9116]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="只要你能带来以下物品，东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的伊尼戈·蒙托亚神父就会为你制作一副信仰手套：1副被亵渎的手套、8块破损的布甲碎片和4块月布。|n",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Gloves of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.",p="$g孩子:孩子;，你把我要的东西带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought me the reagents, child?",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="The vestments are ready, <name>. Smite those that would harm our world in your righteous fire."}
Q[9117]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1条被玷污的腰带、8块布衣碎片、2块奥术水晶和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一条信仰腰带。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Belt of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth.",p="你帮我把试剂带来了吗，孩子？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Belt of Faith."}
Q[9118]={d="<蒙托尔神父在你面前做了一个奇怪的手势。>\n\n幸运的$g小伙子:姑娘，你找到那些阵亡士兵的护甲了吗？这些可怜的英雄在那场战争中咽下了最后一口气，还被天灾士兵脱去了所有护甲，连死亡的尊严都没能保住。\n\n把被玷污的护甲部件和净化所需的材料给我带来，你就会了解信仰的含义。",dEN="<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed <boy/girl>, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",o="如果你将1副被玷污的腕轮、6块布衣碎片、1块奥术水晶和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一副信仰腕轮。",oEN="Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bindings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal.",p="你帮我把试剂带来了吗，孩子？",pEN="You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!",c="装备准备好了，$n。用你的公正之火将那些伤害我们世界的人击溃。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Bindings of Faith."}
Q[9119]={d="$n，既然你正好在这儿，我想请你帮个忙。魔网监护者薇兰妮亚的学徒之前曾到我这儿来寻求帮助。西部圣殿那边显然是出了什么麻烦。可是我得忙着招待这些……最最可爱的……矮人朋友。去那儿看看有什么可做的吧。",dEN="Since you're here, <name>, I've a favor to ask you. Ley-Keeper Velania's apprentice dropped by earlier to ask for assistance. Apparently there's some malfunction happening at the West Sanctum. I've been a bit busy entertaining our... most pleasant... dwarven guest. See if you can give her a hand. You'll find the West Sanctum southwest of here.",o="与永歌森林的魔网监护者薇兰妮亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ley-Keeper Velania at the West Sanctum in Eversong Woods.",c="看看你的四周。情况可不太对劲。\n\n西部圣殿显然出了严重的故障。我们尽力别让事态进一步恶化吧。",cEN="Look around you. Things aren't exactly in order.\n\nWe have a severe malfunction at the West Sanctum. Let us do our best to prevent matters from getting worse."}
Q[9120]={d="护符匣是纳克萨玛斯惟一的遗物。理性告诉你应该摧毁护符匣，令巫妖王再也无法复活。好在你从来不会听从理智的心声。\n\n圣光之愿礼拜堂的某人会出大价钱换取护符匣的。就算克尔苏加德恢复力量又如何？管他的呢！",dEN="The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.\n\nSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?",o="将克尔苏加德的护符匣带往东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂。",oEN="Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="我活了这么久，从没想到会见到这个……\n\n<蒙托亚神父似乎在流口水。>\n\n哦，是的，你会$g得到报酬:得到报酬;的，亲爱的。你会$g得到:得到;丰厚的报酬。现在，把它交给我！",cEN="In all my days of living I would have never expected to see this...\n\n<Father Montoy appears to be salivating.>\n\nOh yes, you will be rewarded dear $g. You will be greatly rewarded. Give it here. Now!"}
Q[9125]={p="你的第一批货是个示范性的成就，$n。如果你有更多，我现在就会收下它们。你每交给我一束，我就会用一枚徽记奖励你。",pEN="You did an exemplary job on the first bundle, <name>. If you have more, I will take them now. For every bundle that you turn in, I will reward you with another insignia.",c="非常好，$n！这些绝对会很有助益。",cEN="Most excellent, <name>! These will definitely come to good use."}
Q[9127]={p="我的人手里从没有人能拥有许多骨头碎片，$n。不论何时，只要你有多余的碎片，把它们带来给我，我就会用另一枚徽记奖励你。",pEN="A man in my line of work can never have too many bone fragments, <name>. Whenever you have a surplus of fragments, bring them to me and I'll reward you with another insignia.",c="我在加基森的舞厅当全职舞者的梦想终于要实现了！继续努力，$n。",cEN="My dream of becoming a full-time dancer at the Gadgetzan disco is soon to become a reality! Keep up the good work, <name>."}
Q[9129]={p="说实话，我用熔核来制作霜火护甲。这是法师用来对抗纳克萨玛斯的护甲。如果没有你和其它像你一样的人，我们大概绝对会输掉这场战役。\n\n说到这，如果你给我更多熔核，我就会给你更多徽记。",pEN="Truth be told, I use the cores to create Frostfire armor. It is the armor used by the mages battling in Naxxramas. Without you and others like you, we would most definitely be losing this war.\n\nWith that said, bring me more cores and I shall grant you more insignias.",c="你为我们奉献许多，$n。做得好！",cEN="You perform a great service for us, <name>. Well done!"}
Q[9130]={d="$g欢迎你:欢迎你;，志愿者！我们这里的补给快见底了，但银月城答应给我们物资援助。这正是需要你出力的地方。\n\n把这份提货单交给飞行管理员晨翼。他会进一步指示你，如何才能最好地抵达银月城。",dEN="Welcome volunteer! We're running low on supplies here, but the blood elves have promised us materiel assistance. That's where you come in.\n\nTake this bill of lading over to Skymaster Sunwing. He'll have further instructions for you on how best to get up to Silvermoon City.",o="将军需官雷米尔的货运清单交给塔奎林的飞行管理员加尼斯·日翼。",oEN="Deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien.",p="嗯，这是什么？",pEN="Yes. what's this?",c="里莫要你转至银月城把她的货物带回来，是吗？没问题，我可以让你快速地到达那里……当然，要收一点费用。",cEN="Lymel wants you to head up to Silvermoon City and bring back her goods. huh? Sure. I can get you there quickly... for a small fee, of course."}
Q[9132]={p="你每给我一堆碎块，我就会给你一枚徽记——越多越好。在我把你碎成两半之前快离开我的视线！",pEN="For every armful of the scraps, I'll give you an insignia - the more the better. Now get out of my sight before I split you in two!",c="你只带了这些来给我？你可能没听清楚我说的话。我要更多！",cEN="That's all you brought me? Maybe you didn't hear me the first time. I need MORE!"}
Q[9133]={d="$C，只要一笔不多的钱币，我就能让你乘着这些雄伟的猛兽在空中飞驰。而且我可以向你保证，这比在这一带走过去安全得多！\n\n等你抵达银月城，到集市去找萨瑟伦·蔚蓝晨曦。\n\n等你拿定主意、$g准备好:准备好;拥抱天空时，再来跟我谈谈。",dEN="<class>, for a very modest amount of coin, I can send you swiftly flying through the air on one of these magnificent beasts. And, it's safer than walking there, I can assure you!\n\nWhen you arrive in Silvermoon City, seek out Sathren Azuredawn in the Bazaar.\n\nSpeak with me once more when you've decided you're ready to brave the skies.",o="租用飞行服务转至银月城，并将军需官雷米尔的货运清单交给银月城的萨斯雷·蓝空。",oEN="Purchase a flight to Silvermoon City and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Bill of Lading to Sathren Azuredawn in Silvermoon City.",p="你手上拿着的清单还真不简单，朋友。让我看看它。",pEN="That's quite a list you have there, friend. Let me take a look at it.",c="这是什么？里莫的脑袋从头里掉出来了吗？他要这些的全部！？\n\n你有带人来帮你运回去吗？",cEN="What's this? Has Lymel's rotting brain finally slid out of her head? She wants all of this!?\n\nDid you bring anyone with you to help take it back?"}
Q[9134]={d="嗯，看来你既没有推车，也没有驮载用的牲畜，还是量力而行吧。我会给你适当数量的货物，如果你已经跟塔奎林的飞行管理员加尼斯·日翼谈过，就尽快飞回塔奎林，把这些东西交给军需官雷米尔。\n\n将货物交给银月城的飞行管理员葛拉米做最后的检查工作，然后跟她谈谈飞回塔奎林的事。葛拉米就在银月城的牧羊人之门外。",dEN="It doesn't look as if you have a cart or a beast of burden with you, so I'd better send you back only with what you can carry. If you've spoken with Skymaster Sunwing at Tranquillien, then you should get this to Quartermaster Lymel as soon as possible by flying back.\n\nTake these goods for final inspection to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate.",o="将军需官雷米尔的货物交给银月城的葛拉米。",oEN="Bring Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Skymistress Gloaming just outside Silvermoon City's Shepherd's Gate.",p="哇，你手上的盒子看起来很重！你想不想把它放在我的飞行驮兽身上？",pEN="Wow, that box of goods you have there looks heavy! You want to load that up on one of my flying beauties?",c="那么，回到幽魂之地的塔奎林？没问题，我可以让你很快就回到那里！",cEN="Back down to Tranquillien in the Ghostlands, then? Sure, I can get you there fast!"}
Q[9135]={d="据我所能判断，一切都没问题。依我看，被遗忘者这回是替我们拼了命，我们欠他们一份人情，哪怕他们又丑又烂。\n\n所以问题是：你跟塔奎林的飞行管理员晨翼谈过了吗？如果谈过了，那就简单了——付一笔不多的路费，我们很快就能飞回去。\n\n$g准备好:准备好;了就告诉我。",dEN="It all checks out as far as I can tell. Seems to me that the Forsaken have put their backs to the wall for us and we owe them, even if they are all ugly and rotting.\n\nSo, the question is, have you already spoken to Skymaster Sunwing in Tranquillien? If so, then this can be as simple as you paying the small fare and quickly flying back.\n\nLet me know when you're ready.",o="租用飞行服务返回幽魂之地的塔奎林，将军需官雷米尔的货物交给塔奎林的军需官雷米尔。",oEN="Purchase a flight back to Tranquillien in the Ghostlands and deliver Quartermaster Lymel's Goods to Quartermaster Lymel at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="$c，这么快就回来了？那是我要你去找的物品吗？看起来不像是我要的全部东西！",pEN="<class>, back so soon? Are those the goods that I sent you for? Doesn't look like it could possibly be everything that I asked for!",c="嗯，我想如果他说剩下的东西很快就会送来的话，我就会相信他的话。我们成为盟友以来他一直都在短时间内提供物品。\n\n谢谢你，$n，你是辛多雷的荣耀！拿着这些钱……它们一整天都在我口袋里叮当响。",cEN="Well, I guess if he said that the rest of it will be coming quickly overland, then I'll take him at his word. He's certainly never failed to provide the goods in the short time that we've been working together.\n\nThank you, <name>, you're a credit to the sin'dorei! Here take this coin... it's done nothing but jingle around in my pocket all day."}
Q[9137]={p="你每给我一组蛮荒之叶我就会给你一枚黎明徽记或十字军徽记。\n\n徽记可以交给军需官换取不同的奖励。",pEN="For every bundle of fronds that you deliver to me, I will pay you with your choice of an insignia of the Dawn or the Crusade.\n\nInsignias may be turned in to the Quartermaster for various rewards.",c="谢谢你，$n。你的贡献对我们成功战胜天灾军团极为重要。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Your work is vital to the success of our campaign against the Scourge."}
Q[9138]={d="$c，我们被包围了。亡灵天灾侵占了所有的外围村落！\n\n你最好立即转至东北方的日冕村，解除蛛怪的威胁。那是一种蜘蛛类的生物，很容易辨认。\n\n时间紧迫……我们必须收复奎尔萨拉斯！",dEN="We're surrounded here, <class>. The outlying villages have all been overrun by the Scourge!\n\nYou must head northeast to Suncrown Village immediately and deal with the Nerubian Scourge menace. You can't miss them - they're spider-like creatures.\n\nThere's no time to waste.... Quel'Thalas must be reclaimed!",o="杀死10个蛛怪卫兵，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Nerubis Guards and then return to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="有你的协助我们一定可以遏制天灾军团，$c。达克汗会被制服的！\n\n你有处理过日冠村蛛魔蛛怪的问题吗？",pEN="With your aid we'll get the Scourge problem contained, <class>. Dar'Khan will be dealt with!\n\nHave you handled the nerubian problem at Suncrown Village yet?",c="太棒了！但是，在天灾军团的威胁被永远赶出奎尔萨拉斯之前还有很多事要做。\n\n来，拿着这个钱币……虽然不多，但这是你应得的。",cEN="Outstanding! But, there's much to be done before the Scourge menace is completely driven from mighty Quel'Thalas!\n\nHere, take this coin... it's not much, but you've earned it."}
Q[9139]={d="我们终于获得了一次胜利，但仍有两个村庄需要收复。\n\n金雾村将是我们的下一个目标。它位于西北方向，当前被一些高等精灵的怨灵与鬼魂所占据。听起来确实很可怕，我也知道，但这的确是天灾军团的惯用战术。\n\n去消灭那里的鬼魂和怨灵，$c。出了塔奎林后，沿道路一直向西走就可以到达那里。",dEN="We've had one success, but there are two more villages that must be reclaimed!\n\nGoldenmist Village is our next target. It lies to the northwest, and has been taken by the ghosts of the high elves that used to live there. Gruesome, I know, but these are apparently the sorts of tactics that the Scourge like to employ.\n\nGo and defeat these ghosts and wraiths, <class>. Take the west road out of Tranquillien to get there.",o="在金雾村消灭6个奎尔多雷鬼魂和4个奎尔多雷怨灵，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔复命。",oEN="Defeat 6 Quel'dorei Ghosts and 4 Quel'dorei Wraiths at Goldenmist Village, and then return to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="我在这里已经经历过很多对抗天灾军团的事了。他们会被击退的，但是一定要一小步一小步慢慢地来。他们有一种卑鄙的手段，就是将你们死去的人抢走，加入他们自己的力量成为新的势力，因此你们一路上千万不能有一点疏失。\n\n那么，金雾村的战绩如何？",pEN="I've learned much about fighting the Scourge in the time that I've been here. They can be beaten back, but it must be done in small steps. The obscene manner in which they can take your fallen and add them to their own ranks as the newly risen makes it imperative that you make no mistakes along the way.\n\nNow, how goes the fight against Goldenmist Village?",c="你在金雾村的成功带领着我们往收复领土更加迈近了一步。不过别因而欺骗自己，$c这场战役还没结束。\n\n拿着，这是你应得的。当你转至对付风行者村时会需要这个的。",cEN="Your success at Goldenmist Village takes us another step closer to taking our land back. Don't fool yourself though, <class>; this fight is far from over.\n\nHere, you've more than earned this. You may need it when you go up against Windrunner Village."}
Q[9140]={d="$n，现在，收复幽魂之地最后一座村庄的任务也将落在你的肩上。风行村位于这里的西南方，当前被一群非常强大的天灾军团飞行部队占据了。这些飞行部队由石像鬼和阴影组成。你将是我们进攻力量的核心，将是羽箭之锋芒，将是担负起削弱对方军力的重任的先锋。\n\n附近的太阳圣殿里的魔导师们最近还递交了一份特殊申请，他们希望能获得一些天灾军团生物的残骸碎片用于研究，看看能否找到它们的弱点。\n\n祝你狩猎愉快！",dEN="<name>, the final battle against the Ghostlands villages is upon you. Windrunner Village to the southwest has been overrun by a large force of the more powerful Scourge shocktroopers; shades and gargoyles. You will be the spearpoint of our offensive by thinning out their numbers.\n\nThe magisters at the nearby Sanctum of the Sun have made a special request this time; they want the remains from these Scourge to study in hopes of finding creative ways of fighting them.\n\nGood hunting!",o="收集6份幻影灵质和4块石像鬼碎片，把它们交给幽魂之地塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔。",oEN="Gather 6 Phantasmal Substance and 4 Gargoyle Fragments. Return them to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="$c，风行者村被释放了吗？那些可恶的太阳圣所博学者严厉地要我把那些我要你去收集的天灾遗物交到他们手中。\n\n不过别担心。你慢慢来把工作做好。让我来烦恼那些博学者的事。",pEN="<class>, has Windrunner Village been liberated? Those damned magisters at the Sanctum of the Sun have been berating me to get their hands on those Scourge remnants I asked you to gather.\n\nDon't worry about that, though. You take your time and get the job done right. I'll deal with the magisters.",c="你办到了，$n。你击破了天灾军团三个村子的要塞！现在我们可以集中我们的火力，更能轻易对抗死亡之痕和死亡之域南方的天灾军团了。\n\n来，从里面选择一个。我相信你哪都不会去吧？我们还需要你持续协助我们！",cEN="You've done it, <name>. You've broken the Scourge hold on the three villages! Now we can focus our forces with greater ease against the Scourge on the Dead Scar and south at Deatholme.\n\nHere, take your choice of any one of these. I trust that you're not going anywhere? We can really use your continued assistance!"}
Q[9141]={d="你想要一份文书？什么？你以为光露个面，我就会把人人抢破头的工单塞到你手里？想都别想，菜鸟。世界各地的工匠都在前线竞标这些活儿。\n\n想要工单，你就得让我看到你$g愿意:愿意;为这事业流血。给我带一枚勇气徽记来，我们再说。\n\n而想让你那双脏兮兮的小菜鸟手拿到徽记，只有一个办法——去杀。",dEN="You want a writ? What? Do you expect me to hand you a highly sought after work order just for showing up? I think not, scrub. Crafters from around the world bid for jobs here at the front lines.\n\nIf you want a work order, you'll have to show me that you're willing to bleed for the cause. Bring me a valor token and we'll talk.\n\nAnd there's only one way to get your grubby little scrub mitts on those - get to killin'.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的调度指挥官梅兹想要一枚银色黎明的勇气徽记。|n",oEN="Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants an Argent Dawn Valor Token.",p="<指挥官梅兹抽着他的雪茄。>\n\n有什么事吗？我是个大忙人。",pEN="<Commander Metz chews on his cigar.>\n\nWhat is it? I'm a busy man.",c="好，这是它使用的方式：你每交出一枚勇气勋章，我就会给你一个文书。你要完成文书上的任务并将它交给马队管理者布鲁斯。懂了吗？很好。现在快滚吧。",cEN="Alright, here's how it works: For every valor token that you turn in, I'll give you another writ. You complete the order on that writ and deliver the order to Packmaster Stonebruiser. Got it? Good. Now get out of here."}
Q[9142]={c="这是你的奖励，蠢蛋。现在，不要跟我抱怨你的任务。完成它们——或者——摧毁它们。",cEN="You earned this, scrub. Now, don't cry about your orders. Fill 'em or destroy 'em."}
Q[9143]={d="中尉事先并未侦察敌情，就贸然命令我们向湖对面的巨魔开战。我们就因为他的愚蠢而全军复没！你听到了我说话了吗，托曼森？你这个废物！白痴！\n\n你能帮帮我们吗，$c？我们仍然需要削减巨魔的数量，可我又得留在这儿照顾他——我想这家伙八成是傻了。\n\n朝东走，湖对面便是塞布索雷，我要复仇……把表明他们身份的标记给我带来！",dEN="The lieutenant here rushed us into battle with the trolls across the lake instead of scouting the situation first. We were decimated by his stupidity! You hear me Tomathren? You're an idiot!\n\nWill you help us, <class>? Those trolls still need to be dealt with. I need to stay here and nursemaid him -- I think he's lost his mind.\n\nJust head east to the other side of the lake into Zeb'Sora. I want revenge... bring me their ears so that I can fashion a nice necklace!",o="收集6个塞布索雷巨魔标记，把它们交给幽魂之地的游侠瓦兰娜。",oEN="Collect 6 Zeb'Sora Troll Ears and return them to Ranger Valanna in the Ghostlands.",p="巨魔的耳朵拿到了吗？\n\n你知道，要是塔奎林能时不时给我们派点援手，这也不会是个大麻烦。我很高兴你能来。",pEN="You get those troll ears yet?\n\nYou know, if we could get some help from Tranquillien every once in a while this wouldn't be such a problem. I'm just glad that you're here.",c="感谢你为我们做的一切，$c！谢谢你。现在，我能够确定那些在这次征战中消失的生命不会白费了。",cEN="I appreciate your efforts, <class>! Thank you. Now, we can say that this expedition and all the lives lost on it haven't been in vain."}
Q[9144]={d="几天前我的侄子被派往幽魂之地。他对此行的任务只字未提，只说是件相当机密的事儿。\n\n到现在他都没回来，我担心情况不妙，$c。对那些冷漠无情的银月城魔导师来说，一名小小的信使失踪根本算不得什么，但是他对我来说就像是亲生的孩子一样。求你了，$n，你能帮我找到他吗？",dEN="My nephew was sent into the Ghostlands a few days ago. He never mentioned anything about his task, except that it was of an extremely secret nature.\n\nHe never returned and I fear for the worst, <class>. A missing messenger might not mean much to the callous magisters of Silvermoon, but he's like a son to me. Please, <name>, will you look for him?",o="沿着道路离开晴风村，到幽魂之地去寻找信使迪卡·晨行者。",oEN="Follow the road out of Fairbreeze Village towards the south and look for Courier Dawnstrider as you approach the Ghostlands.",c="帮帮我……陌生人……我必须去塔奎林……我不能失败……\n\n<这位血精灵说完话就失去意识昏厥过去了。>",cEN="Help me, stranger. I must... reach Tranquillien... I cannot fail.\n\n<The blood elf falls back into unconsciousness as his eyes go blank.>"}
Q[9145]={d="$C，我不能就这么坐在这儿，等着高等执行官或奥丽菲拉夫人召见！这事等不了！\n\n我们本来在对付湖对面东北方泽布索拉的暗松巨魔。可中尉把这次进攻搞砸了，我们损失了许多游侠。之后他就彻底崩溃了。游侠瓦兰娜派我到这里来，派游侠萨莉莎去远行者营地求援。\n\n请找到他们，$c。瓦兰娜伤得很重，而中尉又是个废物。",dEN="<class>, I can't just sit here waiting for an audience with the high executor or Dame Auriferous! This cannot wait!\n\nWe were dealing with the Shadowpine trolls of Zeb'Sora to the northeast across Lake Elrendar. But the lieutenant mishandled the attack and we lost a lot of Farstriders. Then he just fell to pieces afterward. Ranger Valanna sent me here, and Ranger Salissa to the Farstrider Enclave for help.\n\nPlease find them, <class>. Valanna was badly injured and the lieutenant's useless.",o="在幽魂之地日冕村附近的艾伦达尔湖畔寻找游侠瓦兰娜和托曼森中尉。",oEN="Find Ranger Valanna and Lieutenant Tomathren on the shore of Lake Elrendar in the Ghostlands near Suncrown Village.",c="听说莱斯瓦林平安脱险，而且他够机灵，知道向你求助而不是继续在那里干等，真是太好了。\n\n但愿游侠萨莉莎也顺利避入了远行者营地。",cEN="Good to hear that Lethvalin made it to safety. and that he was smart enough to ask you for help instead of just waiting there.\n\nI hope that Ranger Salissa made it safely to Farstrider Enclave."}
Q[9147]={d="你还站在那边做什么？你没看见这个小伙子需要照顾吗？看起来瘟疫正在逐渐侵袭他的躯体。再耽搁一会儿，就连我这样的药剂大师也无能为力了。\n\n河流南岸的动物的血液中都携带着瘟疫，去给我猎杀一些动物，带足够的瘟疫血样回来，这样我才能提炼出足以挽救这个小伙子的血清。快一点！",dEN="What are you standing around for? Can't you see this boy needs immediate attention? By the looks of it, the plague is beginning to take over his body. Within minutes not even a master apothecary like me will be able to save him.\n\nThe animals south of the river all carry the plague in their blood. Go across the bridge and hunt the plagued beasts there. Bring me enough plagued blood samples and I'll distill a serum capable of saving this blood elf. Hurry!",o="药剂师瑟德拉要求你从幽魂之地的野兽身上收集4份染疫血样。",oEN="Apothecary Thedra in Eversong Woods wants you to bring her 4 Plagued Blood Samples from beasts in the Ghostlands.",p="嗯？你把我需要的东西带来了吗？快点，否则那个可爱的血精灵男孩就要死了！",pEN="Well? Did you bring me what I need? Hurry, or the pretty Blood Elf boy is a goner!",c="来的正好，$n！我刚好要开始帮我们的朋友在这里挖一个洞。\n\n我的药剂似乎开始产生作用了，他正苏醒过来。\n\n嘿，我想他想要跟你聊聊。你何不跟他说说话呢？",cEN="Just in time, <name>! I was about ready to start digging a hole for our friend here.\n\nMy potion seems to be working; he's coming to.\n\nHey, I think he's trying to get your attention. Why don't you talk to him?"}
Q[9148]={d="我……我太虚弱了，没法前行。这封信是摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆大人的亲笔信，只能靠你……帮我送信了。\n\n把它交给塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔。沿着这条路继续朝南走就可以到那里了。去那里……找到范迪瑞尔……",dEN="I... I'm too weak to continue. I carry a dire warning from Regent Lord Theron, in the form of a letter. You'll have to deliver it for me.\n\nTake it to Arcanist Vandril in Tranquillien. You'll find the town further to the south along this road. Go there and... find Vandril...",o="将银月城的信件交给幽魂之地塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔。",oEN="Bring the Letter from Silvermoon to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="你有东西要给我？",pEN="You have the letter?",c="啊，终于！我们等着地区统治者的回复等了好几个礼拜！让我看看……\n\n<范德隆开始展读这封信。>\n\n什么？一股黑暗的力量？他感觉到幽魂之地有一股黑暗的力量？！别开玩笑了，这我也会说！\n\n这就是我们一直在等的回复？",cEN="Finally! We've waited for a response from the regent lord for weeks! Let me see here...\n\n<Vandril begins to read the letter.>\n\nWhat's this? A dark presence? He senses a dark presence in the Ghostlands?! No kidding; I could have told him that!\n\nThis is what we've been waiting for?"}
Q[9149]={d="要找出治愈瘟疫的办法，首先要分析它对各种生物带来的影响，从最复杂的生命体到最低等的亚种都要搞清楚。\n\n幽魂之地的鱼人在这场瘟疫中奇迹般地活了下来，我一直在研究其中的奥秘。这种低等的动物为何能抵御瘟疫的侵袭？$n，我必须找出答案！\n\n转至西北方的鱼人村落，将鱼人的脊骨带回来，我要研究骨髓的成分。谁知道它们小小的脊骨中隐藏着什么秘密？",dEN="To find a cure for the plague we need to understand how it affects different creatures, from the most complex life forms to the lowliest subspecies.\n\nI've come here to study the murlocs since, like us, they've retained free will in undeath. What makes these lowly mongrels so special? I need to find out, <name>!\n\nTravel northwest and bring me their spines so that I may study the accumulation of plague in their marrow. Who knows what secrets their little bones hold?",o="将6根染疫鱼人脊骨交给塔奎林的药剂师雷兹特恩。",oEN="Bring 6 Plagued Murloc Spines to Apothecary Renzithen in Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="你弄到我要你取得的样本了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the specimens I asked of you, <name>?",c="太好了！我会好好利用这些脊椎。\n\n收下这些做为奖励。如果你想回到海岸就会需要它们。",cEN="Excellent! These spines will be invaluable to my research! When I find a cure for the plague and word of my name spreads I'll make sure to make mention of you!\n\nIn the meantime, take these as a reward. You might need them if you decide to go back to the coast."}
Q[9150]={d="你相信吗？我们在东南方设立了一座能够正常运转的奥术圣殿——太阳圣殿。声名显赫的魔导师全都去了太阳圣殿负责管理工作。\n\n他们显然忽视了月亮圣殿的存在。在被废弃的月亮圣殿中，残馀的能量滋生出某些奇异的生物体。\n\n我可不愿意让这么好的资源白白浪费。转至月亮圣殿，从那里的生物身上取回一些晶化法力精华。",dEN="Can you believe it? We have an actual functioning arcane sanctum up and running southeast of here: the Sanctum of the Sun. All manner of important magisters have come to take part in running it.\n\nOf course they've all forgotten about the Sanctum of the Moon. Not much remains of it and its energies have given rise to bizarre creatures.\n\nI'm not one to let good resources go to waste, however. Go to the Sanctum of the Moon and see if you can recover the crystallized essences from the creatures there.",o="魔导师戴伦尼斯要你转至塔奎林以西的月亮圣殿，从那里的奥术吞噬者和法力流窜者身上取回8份晶化法力精华。",oEN="Magister Darenis wants you to travel to the Sanctum of the Moon to the west of Tranquillien and recover 8 Crystallized Mana Essences from the Arcane Devourers and Mana Shifters that inhabit the structure.",p="你拿到那些精华了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you obtain the essences, <name>?",c="这些东西会非常有用，$n。我对你所做的努力很高兴。",cEN="These are remarkably powerful, <name>. I'm very pleased with your work."}
Q[9151]={d="你已经证明了你对塔奎林的忠诚，也帮我们抵御了天灾的威胁。我们从银月城来了一些最强大的魔导师，帮我们把战火烧到敌人的家门口。\n\n他们重建了南边的奥术圣殿，并把天灾逐出了周边地区。他们计划向戴索姆——达尔坎的要塞——发起进攻。你最好加入他们，$n。我毫不怀疑，像你这样$g一位:一位;经验丰富的$c会对他们大有帮助。",dEN="You've proven your loyalty to Tranquillien and have helped us defend it against the threat of the Scourge. Some of our most powerful magisters have come from Silvermoon to help us take the fight to the enemy's doorstep.\n\nThey've rebuilt the arcane sanctum to the south and have driven the Scourge away from the surrounding area. They plan to launch an offensive into Deatholme, Dar'Khan's stronghold. You would do well to join them, <name>. I'm sure they can make use of a seasoned <class> like yourself.",o="与幽魂之地太阳圣殿的魔导师伊东尼斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Magister Idonis in the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",c="戴伦尼斯派你来的？非常好，我想我们可以借助你的帮忙对抗达克汗的威胁。",cEN="Darenis sent you? Very well, I suppose we can use your aid in fighting Dar'Khan's forces."}
Q[9152]={d="如果我连补给品都拿不到，还怎么开店？我所倚仗的护送队伍压根就没有出现过，所以我只好一个人出发，结果在经过西边的时候遭到一帮食尸鬼的攻击，有辆推车落在了那儿。\n\n你能帮帮我吗？沿着西边的道路走出城镇，穿过墓地。在死亡之痕对面有个岔路口，我的推车就停在路那边的小山坡上。",dEN="How am I supposed to supply the war effort when I cannot even safely get my supplies here? I was promised an escort that never came. And then, I had to leave one of my carts behind to the west when I was attacked by a band of ghouls!\n\nWant to help out, and get me open for business in the process? Go down the western road out of town and past the graveyard. On the other side of the Dead Scar is a fork in the road. The hill that my cart had to be left on lies just beyond.",o="找到拉提斯·托博尔的补给品，把它交给幽魂之地塔奎林的拉提斯·托博尔。",oEN="Retrieve Rathis Tomber's Supplies and return it to him at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="等我把剩下的补给都弄到手，就能开张了。这里的部队要是买不到干活儿用的东西，可走不了多远。\n\n战区可是能赚大钱的地方，你不这么觉得吗，$c？那么，你是一路杀穿那些食尸鬼，摸到我的货车那儿了吗？",pEN="Just as soon as I get the rest of my supplies. I'll be open for business. The forces here aren't going to get very far if they can't purchase what they need to ply their trades.\n\nWar zones can be such profitable places, wouldn't you agree, <class>? Now, did you manage to fight your way to my cart through all of those ghouls?",c="剩下的商品都在这里，我总算能够开店了。我相信指挥官会很高兴听到达克汗和天灾军团的战争开始了。\n\n还有，当然，这里是你的一点报酬。很好，$c，这就是我提过的钱。记得一定要来看看有没有你需要的商品。",cEN="With the rest of my supplies here. I can finally open shop. I'm sure that the high executor will be most pleased to hear that the war on Dar'Khan and the Scourge can commence.\n\nAnd, of course, there's the small matter of your recompense. Very well, <class>, here is the coin that I alluded to. Do be sure to drop by should you find yourself in need of any trade goods."}
Q[9153]={d="天灾的浮空亡灵城肆虐着部落与联盟的土地。整个艾泽拉斯都被这些飞行要塞的阴影笼罩。\n\n只有我们齐心协力，才能将它们击退。\n\n每座亡灵城都由一颗死灵石所支撑，其周围盘踞着成群的不死生物。我们已查明，消灭这些无脑的群兽就能摧毁死灵石的防御。",dEN="The floating necropolises of the Scourge plague the lands of Horde and Alliance alike. The whole of Azeroth is blanketed in the shadows of the flying fortresses.\n\nOnly through our combined efforts will they be repelled.\n\nEach necropolis is supported by a Necrotic Crystal, surrounded by host of undead creatures. We have determined that destroying these mindless hordes will destroy the Crystal's defenses.",o="找一位银色使者，查明一处正遭受天灾进攻的区域。前往那里，击败亡灵城周围的天灾成员以对其造成破坏。将10枚死灵符文带回东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官托马斯·海勒兰那里。",oEN="Speak to an Argent Emissary to find an area under Scourge attack. Go there and damage a necropolis by defeating the Scourge around them. Return 10 of their Necrotic Runes to Commander Thomas Helleran at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="要战胜这个威胁需要时间。你$g准备好:准备好;了吗，$n？",pEN="It will take time to prevail against this threat. How have you fared, <name>?",c="你做的很好，$n。通过持续增加的获胜记录，我们将可以战胜巫妖王和他的手下。\n\n休息一下养精蓄锐，但你之后务必要再次回到前线，以免我们损失了今天才夺回的土地。\n\n为了在日后的战役中帮助你，我们会用特别的物品和你交易更多的亡域符文。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. Through these incremental defeats, we shall prevail against this renewed Scourge threat.\n\nRest and recover, but then you must head out to the front again, lest we lose the ground we have gained today.\n\nTo aid you in your further battles, we will make some of our special items available to you in trade for more necrotic runes."}
Q[9155]={d="你应该已经见过死亡之痕了吧，阿尔萨斯当年沿着这条路线杀入银月城，而现在无数没脑子的天灾士兵正虎视眈眈地盘踞在那里。\n\n去做点有用的事情吧，削减死亡之痕一带的天灾士兵的数量。如果你能证明自己的价值，我会替你美言几句的。",dEN="If you've made it this far then you probably know about the Dead Scar and how to this day mindless Scourge follow the path of destruction that Arthas created on his way to Silvermoon City.\n\nMake yourself useful and thin down the Scourge's numbers in the Scar. If you prove to be worth your salt I'll put in a good word for you.",o="在死亡之痕除掉10个复生的饥饿者和10个笨拙的食尸者，然后向塔奎林的亡灵哨兵拉提尔复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Risen Hungerers and 10 Gangled Cannibals on the Dead Scar. Return to Deathstalker Rathiel in Tranquillien for a reward.",p="你完成你的任务了吗？",pEN="Are you done with your task yet?",c="不错，$n。继续保持，我们可以多用些像你一样的人。",cEN="Not bad, <name>. Keep it up, we could use a few more people like you around here."}
Q[9156]={d="塔奎林对两名憎恶：纳克雷洛特和卢兹兰发出通缉令。这些可怕的生物是达尔坎的创造物，有目击者称它们在鬼嚎通灵塔和鲜血通灵塔附近巡逻。拿回纳克雷洛特和卢兹兰的徽记作为凭证，在亡灵哨兵拉提尔处领取赏金。",dEN="A bounty is hereby declared for the abominations known as Knucklerot and Luzran. These dreadful creations of Dar'Khan are extremely dangerous and have been sighted patrolling near the Howling and Bleeding Ziggurats. Individuals seeking to claim the reward must present the abominations' heads to Deathstalker Rathiel as proof of the deed.",o="在幽魂之地搜寻并杀死纳克雷洛特和卢兹兰，将他们的徽记交给塔奎林的亡灵哨兵拉提尔换取奖励。",oEN="Search the Ghostlands for Knucklerot and Luzran. Bring their heads to Deathstalker Rathiel in Tranquillien for a reward.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="啊……纳克罗和路斯莱恩！你看起来不那么强壮了，是吗？我看的出来你还是和以前一样丑陋。\n\n拿着这个奖励，$n。你获得了它。",cEN="Ah... Luzran and Knucklerot! Not looking so tough anymore, are you? I can see you're still looking ugly as ever.\n\nTake one of these rewards, <name>. You've earned it."}
Q[9157]={d="每年我们日冕村的村民都会举行仪式控制各种不同的自然生物。我们需要召唤并奴役阿奎艾森来控制水元素，但是由于一个法术的失误，阿奎艾森挣脱了束缚，反过来奴役了我们！\n\n那场仪式的参与者们都佩戴着波浪状的勋章。我们需要取回那些勋章，重新控制阿奎艾森，解放我们的灵魂！",dEN="Every year we, the denizens of Suncrown Village, would take part in a ritual to keep the different aspects of nature under our control. Dominion over the element of water was symbolized by the summoning and enslavement of an elemental named Aquantion. Through a wicked perversion of our magic, the scoundrel broke his bonds and enslaved us instead!\n\nWe wore medallions shaped like waves during the ritual. Seek them at the bottom of the lake; we'll need them to free my compatriots' spirits!",o="将8枚波浪勋章交给幽魂之地的格兰尼斯·月晨。",oEN="Bring 8 Wavefront Medallions to Geranis Whitemorn in the Ghostlands.",p="你拿到勋章了吗，$n？溺死的鬼魂仍然在这湖边徘徊！",pEN="Have you obtained the medallions? The drowned still haunt this lake!",c="有了这些勋章我们就能再次召唤海之平衡。叛变的元素将会付出代价而我们的死也得以报复。",cEN="With these necklaces we shall once again summon Aquantion. The rebellious elemental will pay and our deaths will be avenged!"}
Q[9158]={d="你能来幽魂之地就证明你相当勇敢，$n。要做的事儿还很多，懦弱的家伙是无法胜任的。\n\n如果你愿意伸出援手的话，我有一项艰巨的任务要交给你。瘟疫已经污染了此地的野生动植物，我们必须阻止瘟疫的继续扩散。去清理东边和南边的鬼爪山猫，然后回来向我复命。",dEN="You show courage coming to the Ghostlands, <name>. There is much work to be done here and not enough brave souls to do it.\n\nI've a thankless task to offer you, should you have the inclination to aid our cause. The very wildlife in this land has been tainted by the plague and we must stop it from spreading. Hunt the ghostclaw lynxes to the east and south of here and return when you've slain enough of them.",o="远行者营地的远行者塞蒂娜要求你杀死10只鬼爪山猫。",oEN="Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 10 Ghostclaw Lynxes.",p="你完成了我要你去做的任务吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the task I asked of you, <name>?",c="你做的很好，$n。瘟疫绝不能散播到永歌森林健康的野生生物身上。如果你想找事做的话我这里还有一些工作。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. It's important that the plague doesn't spread to the healthy wildlife in Eversong. I have more work for you if you're looking for something to do."}
Q[9159]={d="你已经证明了自己是个$g可靠的盟友:可靠的盟友;，$n。我需要你继续这项任务，追踪更多感染瘟疫的野生动物。这次去找些更危险的野兽。猎杀死亡之痕以西的纺丝潜伏者，以及这里正南方的吸血雾蝠。办完就回来找我。",dEN="You've proven your worth as an ally, <name>. I need you to continue your task and track down more plagued wildlife. This time seek out some of the more dangerous beasts. Hunt the spindleweb lurkers west of the Dead Scar and the vampiric mistbats just south of here. Return to me when you're done.",o="远行者营地的远行者塞蒂娜要求你杀死8只纺丝潜伏者和10只吸血迷雾蝠。",oEN="Farstrider Sedina at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 8 Spindleweb Lurkers and 10 Vampiric Mistbats.",p="你完成了我要你去做的任务吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the task I asked of you, <name>?",c="你很认真的看待任务因此我要给你一个适当的奖励。我们需要更多和你一样有勇气和决心的盟友，$n。",cEN="You've taken your task seriously and thus I'd like to present you with suitable rewards. We need more allies with your courage and determination, <name>."}
Q[9160]={d="很高兴你能伸出援手，$C。我们和最近出现的一群暗夜精灵斥候之间出了点问题。我们不清楚他们有什么目的，只知道这些家伙在此地西北方一处名为安达洛斯的古代高等精灵魔网节点设立了营地。你需要穿越死亡之痕才能到达那儿。\n\n希望你能转至调查他们的动向，多杀几个自以为是的暗夜精灵。",dEN="<class>, we are having difficulty with a group of night elves that have recently taken over a nearby island. They've set up a small camp at the old high elf ley-line nexus, An'daroth, to the northwest. There is a dirt path that leads up to it just past the Dead Scar.\n\nI suggest that you lend us your aid by going there, investigating what they are up to, and slaying as many of the conceited night elves as you can.",o="调查安达洛斯一带，杀死12个哨兵部队间谍，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的奥莉菲洛丝夫人复命。",oEN="Investigate the area at An'daroth, kill 12 Sentinel Spies and then return to Dame Auriferous at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="$c，你从安都拉斯带回来什么消息还有暗夜精灵都在那边做什么？",pEN="<class>. what word do you bring concerning An'daroth and what the night elves were up to there?",c="暗夜精灵在安达洛斯没什么明显的计划，真令人失望。不过，你提到的那些像小魔法树、顶上还顶着能量宝珠的东西，听起来很有意思。看来我们得采取更直接的方式去搜集情报了。\n\n给你，拿着这些钱币和药水。等我们收拾完这些暗夜精灵之前，你会用得上的。",cEN="Disappointing that the night elves' plans were not readily apparent at An'daroth. However, those objects that looked like small magically-grown trees with powered orbs atop them sound interesting. It would appear that we'll need to be more direct in our information gathering efforts.\n\nHere, take this coin and these potions. I believe that you'll have use for them before we're done dealing with these night elves."}
Q[9161]={d="据说达尔坎·德拉希尔已经复活，统治着幽魂之地的天灾军队。达尔坎早就跟天灾军团勾结到一起了……只是他那时还是个活着的精灵罢了。大部分时间他都躲在东北边的晨星之塔内策划着他的阴谋。\n\n去塔里找找吧，$n。或许他会留下一本日记或是笔记，你永远都猜不到有价值的线索会在何处。",dEN="Dar'Khan Drathir is believed to have returned from the dead to rule over the armies of the Scourge in the Ghostlands. Dar'Khan aligned himself with the Scourge long ago... yet he was once a living, breathing elf. Much of his time was spent inside Dawnstar Spire, northeast of here. He hid there for many nights, scheming against his own.\n\nSearch the tower for more information, <name>. Perhaps he had a journal or kept notes. One never knows where useful information might present itself.",o="转至幽魂之地的晨星之塔搜寻任何关于达尔坎的过去的线索。",oEN="Travel to Dawnstar Spire in the Ghostlands and search for any clues involving Dar'Khan's past.",c="看完了这本旧书的前几页之后，你发现这本书曾经属于达克汗·崔希尔。",cEN="After browsing through the first few pages of this old book, you come to the conclusion that it once belonged to the one known as Dar'Khan Drathir."}
Q[9162]={d="当你翻阅这本日记时，突然觉得背后有诡异的目光注视着自己。\n\n日记上记录的内容相当混乱。达尔坎的心中充满了对自己族人的仇恨和蔑视。日记中详细描述了他的诡计和阴谋。\n\n或许维恩娜会用得上这本日记。",dEN="As you skim through the pages in the journal you're overcome by an unnerving sense of being watched.\n\nThe contents are unsettling. Dar'Khan's soul was one filled with hatred and contempt for his own people. The extent of his machinations and plots are all documented in great detail.\n\nPerhaps there is something here that Vynna will find useful.",o="将达尔坎的日记交给远行者营地的游侠维恩娜。",oEN="Return to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave with Dar'Khan's Journal.",p="告诉我，$n，你发现了什么？",pEN="Tell me, <name>, what did you find out?",c="这项资讯非常有价值，$n。我们都知道达克汗计划偷取太阳之井的能量给天灾军团，但这里发现的资讯对我们而言是全新的线索。太阳圣所的博学者坎德立斯会想看看这个的。",cEN="This information is very valuable, <name>. We all knew about Dar'Khan's plans to steal the power of the Sunwell for the Scourge, but much of the information found here is completely new to us. Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun will want to look at this."}
Q[9163]={d="现在，我们将展开一系列行动以探明这些暗夜精灵来此的真正目的。你将负责执行这个计划，首先，你要转至他们所占据的小岛，收集任何你所能得到的情报。\n\n我要求你出镇后直接沿路向西前进，去海岸对面的沙兰蒂斯岛。到那里之后，在船上和岛屿上寻找任何行动计划书之类的东西。",dEN="Now, the more direct course of action that we are going to take, to figure out what these night elves are really up to, is to have you go to their island and steal any information that you can come by.\n\nI want you to head west down the road out of town to Shalandis Isle, just off the coast. Go there and recover any plans they might have on the island or on their ship.",o="窃取暗夜精灵计划表：安达洛斯、暗夜精灵计划表：安欧维恩和暗夜精灵计划表：监视辛多雷，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的奥莉菲洛丝夫人复命。",oEN="Steal the Night Elf Plans: An'daroth, Night Elf Plans: An'owyn and Night Elf Plans: Scrying on the Sin'dorei, and return them to Dame Auriferous at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="你去萨蓝迪斯岛搜寻暗夜精灵秘密计划一事进行得如何了，$c？",pEN="How fare our efforts to uncover the night elf plot on Shalandis Isle, <class>?",c="事情有点棘手！这些计划说明了除了我们原本就知道的安都拉斯，暗夜精灵也在安欧恩，一个东南方更遥远的能量界线连结点也有他们的地盘。\n\n在东边有我们没提过的第三个连结点。它叫做安泰拉斯。对此，我有着不详的预感，$c。",cEN="Troubling! These plans show the night elf forces at An'daroth, which we already knew, but also at An'owyn, a more remote ley-line nexus to the southeast.\n\nThere is a third nexus to the east, which is not mentioned, named An'telas. I have a very bad feeling about all of this, <class>."}
Q[9164]={d="啊，当然。我最得意的发明。这种药膏可以解除多种形式的药物控制效果。\n\n副作用可能包括昏迷、呕吐或者暂时性的失明。这些显然都比天灾军团对俘虏所采用的手段要舒服得多……\n\n祝你好运，勇敢的$c。",dEN="Ah, yes. One of my finest creations. This draught will break most forms of alchemically induced stupor.\n\nSide effects include confusion, nausea and - in rare cases - temporary blindness. All much preferable to whatever the Scourge plans to do to those prisoners in Deatholme, if you ask me.\n\nBest of luck, brave <class>. You are going to need it.",o="转至塔奎林，从药剂师雷兹特恩那儿拿到雷兹特恩的疗伤药膏，然后转至戴索姆，救治学徒瓦尼斯、药剂师恩尼斯和游侠维多兰。完成任务之后返回太阳圣殿找奥术师亚尼达领取奖励。",oEN="Take Renzithen's Restorative Draught to Deatholme and rescue Apprentice Varnis, Apothecary Enith and Ranger Vedoran. Return to Arcanist Janeda at the Sanctum of the Sun for a reward.",p="死亡之域的囚犯都变成什么样子了？你去过那里了吗？",pEN="What became of the prisoners in Deatholme? Have you ventured there yet?",c="做的很好，$n。如果没有你的帮忙那些俘虏的思想与灵魂就会毁在天灾军团手里。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. Without your help those prisoners would've lost their minds and souls to the Scourge."}
Q[9165]={d="如果没有冒险者的帮忙，我的商队绝不可能成功！天谴军团已经停下他们的木工活，想阻止我们进入那里。\n\n&lt;守卫迪笛儿擦了擦他的额头。&gt;\n\n现在我们要在这里等待大元帅钱柏到达。他会签署你的安全之路令状让你带回圣光之愿礼拜堂的发送指挥官梅兹那里。\n\n还有$n，在钱柏面前讲话可要小心。他是那种会咬断你的头刺穿你气管的人 - 只是他不一定会这么做...",dEN="Without the help of adventurers, my caravan would have never made it! Scourge were coming out of the woodwork to try and stop us from getting here.\n\n<Guard Didier wipes his brow.>\n\nNow we need to wait here for Field Marshal Chambers to arrive. He'll sign your writ of safe passage to take back to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel.\n\nAnd <name>, watch what you say around Chambers. He's the 'bite off your head and spit down your wind pipe' type of guy - except that he'll actually do it...",o="将签署的安全之路令状送到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的发送指挥官梅兹。",oEN="Deliver the signed Writ of Safe Passage to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="报上名字，军阶还有编号！",pEN="Name, rank and serial number!",c="<发送指挥官梅兹接过令状并签署。>\n\n做得好，$n。可以说是相当杰出！收下这个以表我们的感谢。别说客套话了，小鬼。",cEN="<Dispatch Commander Metz takes the writ and signs it.>\n\nExcellent work, <name>. Outstanding even! Take this as a token of our appreciation. No pun intended, scrub."}
Q[9166]={d="你必须把缴获的暗夜精灵计划送到安泰拉斯去。它在东边，阳痕峰的南坡上，就在太阳圣殿的东北方。\n\n魔导师希拉斯托尔正在那里研究魔网节点的能量，看能否用它来对抗天灾。让他看看这些计划，好弄清这些暗夜精灵到底在搞什么名堂。",dEN="You must deliver the recovered night elf plans to An'telas for me. It is to the east, on the southern slopes of Sungraze Peak, just to the northeast of the Sanctum of the Sun.\n\nMagister Sylastor is there conducting ongoing studies into the ley-line nexus energy for potential use in our fight against the Scourge. Have him look at these plans to shed some light on what it is that these night elves are up to.",o="将暗夜精灵计划表交给幽魂之地安泰拉斯的魔导师塞拉斯托。",oEN="Deliver the Night Elf Plans to Magister Sylastor at An'telas in the Ghostlands.",p="喔，真是太感谢你了！",pEN="Oh, thank goodness for you!",c="真是太糟糕了！暗夜精灵！他们在这里召唤月水晶以进行他们的恶毒计划，但是我悄悄地转至太阳圣所，招集更多的斥候和施法者并组成一支小队。我们杀死了大部分的暗夜精灵，小队的其它成员当前正在追杀他们残存的党羽！\n\n很高兴你来帮忙我的身边只剩下几名保护我的斥候而已！这里并不是个安全的地方！\n\n给我一点时间，让我从这份计划中看出那些暗夜精灵打的是什么主意。",cEN="It was just horrible! Night elves! They conjured their moon crystal here for some nefarious plot, but I snuck away and gathered a larger group of our scouts and casters from the nearby Sanctum of the Sun. We killed most of them and the rest of the group is hunting down the remnants!\n\nI'm glad that you're here now; I was only left a couple of scouts for protection! It's not safe out here!\n\nGive me a moment and I'll read through these plans to see what the night elves are up to."}
Q[9167]={d="我们在幽魂之地所做的一切，都是为了夺回本就属于我们的东西。天灾对这一地区的钳制已经太久了。\n\n复仇的时刻到了，$n。多亏你和我们的新盟友——被遗忘者——的相助，复仇很快就会属于我们。\n\n那个妄图窃取太阳井之力的人必须死。去死亡之痕以南的天灾据点戴索姆，把达尔坎的首级带给我，你的功绩将载入史册！",dEN="Everything we've done in the Ghostlands has been done with the goal of taking back what is rightfully ours. The Scourge have maintained their chokehold on the region for far too long.\n\nThe time has come for payback, <name>. Thanks to your help and the help of our new allies, the Forsaken, vengeance will soon be ours.\n\nHe who sought to steal the power of the Sunwell must die. Go to Deatholme, the Scourge stronghold south of the Dead Scar. Bring me Dar'Khan's head and your deeds will go down in history!",o="进入戴索姆杀死达尔坎，将他的徽记交给幽魂之地太阳圣殿的魔导师坎迪瑞斯。",oEN="Slay Dar'Khan Drathir inside Deatholme and bring his head to Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",p="那么，完成了吗？杀死达克汗了吗？",pEN="Is it done, then? Has Dar'Khan been destroyed?",c="今天你在天灾军团的势力范围内给了他们致命的一击。\n\n没有了可恶的叛国者，我们很快就能夺回自己的土地，重振声威。",cEN="Today you've dealt a deadly blow to the Scourge's grasp in the region.\n\nWith the vile traitor gone, it shall not be long before we've reclaimed our lands and our greatness is restored once again."}
Q[9169]={d="他们的月亮水晶是一种侦测工具，他们显然要利用这东西来侦察我们的行动。据我所知，安达洛斯那里的能量不够强大，无法支持起这种工具，但正南方的安欧维恩则毫无疑问具备足够的能量强度！\n\n我研究了一下这些计划书，基本上搞清楚了月亮水晶是如何运作的，并且也知道如何关闭它们。你必须立刻赶往安欧维恩，从某个暗夜精灵手中抢到控制宝珠，然后在月亮水晶上使用它，这样就可以关闭月亮水晶，阻止他们的计划了！\n\n行动快一点，$c！",dEN="Their moon crystals are scrying devices -- they're going to spy on us! I know that An'daroth can't provide enough power for that, but An'owyn, directly to the south, most definitely can!\n\nFrom the plans I now have a basic knowledge of how these moon crystals work; enough to shut them down. They're keyed so that they can be turned off. You must go to An'owyn, retrieve the controlling orb from one of the night elves and then use it on the moon crystal to stop them from enacting their plan!\n\nHurry, <class>!",o="获取水晶控制宝珠，用它关闭安欧维恩的暗夜精灵月亮水晶，然后向幽魂之地安泰拉斯的魔导师塞拉斯托复命。",oEN="Retrieve the Crystal Controlling Orb and then use it to deactivate the Night Elf Moon Crystal at An'owyn. Then return to Magister Sylastor at An'telas in the Ghostlands.",p="结束了吗，$c？你成功地关闭安欧恩的暗夜精灵月水晶了吗？",pEN="Is it over then, <class>? Did you deactivate the night elf moon crystal at An'owyn?",c="真是令人感到欣慰，$c！我向你保证，如果你没有关闭安欧恩的占卜宝珠，我们的情势会比现在还要凄惨！想想看，被敌人层层包围而且他们其中一人甚至还能占卜出我们每一个行动的念头！\n\n但是现在我们不用担心了，多亏了你！来，拿着这个，我要奖励你的努力而且我手边刚好有这些不用的东西。\n\n再次谢谢你，$n！",cEN="That's a relief, <class>! I can assure you that if you hadn't deactivated those scrying orbs we would be in a more tenuous position than the one we're already in! To think, surrounded by enemies, and one of them able to spy upon our every move!\n\nBut now we don't need to worry about that thanks to you! Here, take this, I want you to be rewarded for your efforts and I just happen to have a few things here that I no longer have any use for.\n\nThank you again, <name>!"}
Q[9170]={d="可憎的叛徒达尔坎在天灾军团中掌握了实权。他麾下的军官统领着亡灵大军，而我方的军队数量却在不断减少。\n\n黑衣玛索菲特、欺诈者尤瑞恩、放血者鲍尔古斯和堕落者米尔杜兰是幽魂之地天灾军团的首领人物。杀死这些军官，天灾军团自然会陷入混乱。",dEN="The odious traitor, Dar'Khan, has risen to great power among the ranks of the Scourge. His lieutenants command vast armies of undead against our dwindling numbers.\n\nMasophet the Black, Jurion the Deceiver, Borgoth the Bloodletter, Mirdoran the Fallen. Learn these names well for in the Ghostlands these Scourge leaders are second only to Dar'Khan himself. Slay them and their mindless armies will be thrown into disarray.",o="魔导师伊东尼斯要你转至戴索姆杀死黑衣玛索菲特、欺诈者尤瑞恩、放血者鲍尔古斯和堕落者米尔杜兰，完成任务后回到幽魂之地的太阳圣殿向他复命。",oEN="Magister Idonis wants you to venture into Deatholme to slay Masophet the Black, Jurion the Deceiver, Borgoth the Bloodletter and Mirdoran the Fallen. Report back to him in the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands after you've completed this task.",p="你成功的切断了天灾军团的指挥炼吗，$n？达克汗的副官们都死了吗？",pEN="Have you succeeded in severing the Scourge's chain of command, <name>? Are Dar'Khan's lieutenants dead?",c="达克汗的军队很快就会瓦解。天灾军团不会有机会对抗被遗忘者与辛多雷结合的力量了。",cEN="Dar'Khan's armies will soon fall. The Scourge shall not stand a chance against the combined might of the sin'dorei and the Forsaken."}
Q[9171]={d="这实在让人无法忍受！我这儿根本没法干活！夫人把我从银月城请来，她要的是与身份相称的佳肴，对吧？可我到了这儿，连吃的都没有。出去打猎，$c；我需要点东西下锅。\n\n奥丽菲拉夫人偏爱酥脆的口感；死亡之痕对面西南方有很多纺丝潜伏者。我知道那很恶心，可眼下只有这个。",dEN="This is intolerable! I have nothing to work with here! Milady asks me to come from Silvermoon City; she deserves cuisine as befits her station. No? But I get here and there is no food. You must go out, <class>, and bring back fresh kills so that I have something to prepare.\n\nDame Auriferous prefers a crunchy texture to her food. There are plenty of spindleweb lurkers to the southwest on the other side of the Dead Scar. Disgusting, I know, but that's what we have to work with.",o="将5条松脆蜘蛛腿交给幽魂之地塔奎林的大厨师莫迪尔。",oEN="Collect 5 Crunchy Spider Legs and return them to Master Chef Mouldier at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="我想我在这里就能听到夫人的肚子在咕噜咕噜叫了！我想你会在这里跟我说话是因为你已经弄到我要你去找的东西了吧？",pEN="I believe I can hear the dame's belly rumbling even from here! I take it that you are here talking to me because you have what I asked you to obtain?",c="非常好，这些材料很有用。不，别描述它们在地上爬来爬去的样子，我不想知道！我会用这些腿肉施展我的厨艺，它们会变的相当美味。一点点香料，一小撮草药，当然还有一点秘法原料，瞧，这不是一顿给女王的大餐吗……应该是说，夫人。\n\n你的努力非常足够，$c。来，拿着这个食谱和一些试吃样品。",cEN="Very well, these will have to do. No, don't describe them crawling around, I don't want to know! I'll work my magic upon these legs and they'll turn out quite tasty. A little spice here, a pinch of herb there, and then of course some arcane ingredients, and voila, a meal fit for a queen... or in this case, a dame.\n\nYour service has been adequate, <class>. Here, take this recipe and some samples."}
Q[9172]={d="在被遗忘者的帮助下，太阳圣殿的魔导师在研究天灾军团的弱点方面取得了很大的进展。坎迪瑞斯会知道该如何处理这本日记的。\n\n你得赶快，$n。达尔坎是个狡猾的敌人，每时每刻都在监视我们的动向！",dEN="The magisters at the Sanctum of the Sun have made great progress in analyzing the Scourge's weaknesses with the aid of the Forsaken. Magister Kaendris will know what to do with this information.\n\nYou'll find the Sanctum of the Sun southwest of here. You must hurry, <name>. Dar'Khan is a cunning enemy and watches our every move!",o="将达尔坎的日记交给幽魂之地太阳圣殿的魔导师坎迪瑞斯。",oEN="Bring Dar'Khan's Journal to Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",p="你想和我谈谈？",pEN="You wish to speak to me?",c="这本书……不可能！这真的是达克汗亲笔写下的。这其中一定透露了我们敌人的弱点。\n\n你来找我们是对的，$n。远行者将这件事交给我们是相当睿智的行为。这件护甲应该是你帮助促成我们的原因。",cEN="This book... it can't be! It's Dar'Khan's very own handwriting. There must be information here that will reveal a weakness in our opponent.\n\nYou've done well in coming to us, <name>. The Farstriders have shown great wisdom in leaving this matter in our hands. This armor should help you further our cause."}
Q[9173]={d="$C，我要你去夺回风行者之塔！\n\n这其实是种荣耀。风行者之塔是被遗忘者的女王、精灵的前任游侠将军希尔瓦娜斯·风行者最初的家园。可如今它已被无脑的天灾占据。\n\n沿路向南走，到岔路口向右拐；穿过死亡之痕后继续往西南走。你不会错过的。",dEN="<class>, I want you to reclaim Windrunner Spire!\n\nIt's an honor, really. Windrunner Spire is the original home of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, queen of the Forsaken and former ranger-general of the elves. But now it's been overrun by the mindless Scourge.\n\nTo get there take the road south until it branches. Take the right fork and after crossing the Dead Scar continue southwest. You can't miss it.",o="杀死8个戴索姆侍僧和8个堕落游侠，然后向塔奎林的高级执行官玛尔伦复命。",oEN="Slay 8 Deatholme Acolytes and 10 Fallen Rangers, and return to High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="我相信你是清除了风行者塔的天灾军团才回来的吧？",pEN="I trust that you return to me with news that Windrunner Spire has been cleansed of its Scourge infection?",c="我相信希尔瓦娜斯会很高兴听到我们在这件事上大有进展。\n\n收下这些钱做为你努力的奖励。",cEN="I'm certain that Lady Sylvanas will be pleased to hear that we've made progress in the matter.\n\nHere, take this coin as payment for your efforts."}
Q[9174]={d="那个固执的元素生物在背叛我们那天夺走了许多生命。他召来卑微的鱼人破坏我们的仪式，扭曲了我们的魔法，反过来对付我们。\n\n让他看看我们的复仇之渴从未消退！把这些徽章带到湖底的潮汐掌握祭坛去。阿库安提恩会立刻回应你的召唤！\n\n当心，$r！没有我们的魔法控制他，他的怒火将毫无约束。摧毁阿库安提恩，好让我们得以安息！",dEN="That willful elemental ended many lives that fateful day when he revolted against us. By calling to the lowly murloc to sabotage our rites he subverted our magic and turned it against us.\n\nShow him our thirst for vengeance has not waned! Take these medallions and lay them at the Altar of Tidal Mastery at the bottom of the lake. Aquantion shall immediately answer your summons!\n\nBeware, <race>! Without our magic controlling him, his wrath will be unrestrained. Destroy Aquantion so we may rest!",o="格兰尼斯·月晨要你潜入日冕村东面的湖底，对海潮掌控祭坛使用你手中的一堆勋章。杀死你召唤出的元素生物阿奎艾森，然后向格兰尼斯复命。",oEN="Geranis Whitemorn wants you to swim to the bottom of the lake east of Suncrown Village and use the Bundle of Medallions on the Altar of Tidal Mastery. Summon and slay the elemental known as Aquantion and return to Geranis.",p="海之平衡被消灭了吗？",pEN="Has Aquantion been destroyed yet?",c="你为我们的死报了仇并解放了我们在海之平衡手上的灵魂。我们终于可以安息了。",cEN="You've avenged our deaths and broken Aquantion's grasp on our souls. We may finally rest."}
Q[9175]={d="这串项链闪闪发光，弥漫在幽魂之地的阴暗空气也无法掩盖那块宝石的光辉。从项链上所刻的字来看，这是希尔瓦娜斯·风行者的东西！\n\n或许应该把它先交给塔奎林的高级执行官玛尔伦？他似乎是这儿最有地位的被遗忘者，他一定知道要怎么处理这根项链。",dEN="The necklace shimmers, a remarkable piece of jewelry that doesn't seem to succumb to the gloom that permeates the Ghostlands. Given the inscription, and where you found it, it must be the lost property of Lady Sylvanas Windrunner herself!\n\nPerhaps it would be best to first take it to High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien? He seems to be the highest ranking Forsaken in the area and is sure to know what to do with it.",o="将女王的项链交给幽魂之地塔奎林的高级执行官玛尔伦。",oEN="Take The Lady's Necklace to High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="你手里拿的是什么，$n？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="你是说，你是在风行者之塔的一个天灾成员身上找到的，上面还刻着字？！让我看看！\n\n拿去，这是你干得好的报酬。",cEN="You say that you found it on one of the Scourge at Windrunner Spire and that there's an inscription on it? Let me see!Here, take this coin for a job well done."}
Q[9176]={d="从日记来看，达尔坎答应将光芒之石和烈焰之石交给天灾军团。这两件精灵神器拥有太阳之井的魔法力量，可以用来对抗天灾军团。\n\n它们似乎被送到了鲜血通灵塔和鬼嚎通灵塔，就在死亡之痕的中部。如果它们仍在那里，我们就必须尽快找到它们。这两块晶体拥有的力量对我们有很大帮助。",dEN="According to this journal, Dar'Khan promised the Scourge two powerful elven artifacts: the stone of light and the stone of flame. These were imbued with the magical energies of the Sunwell and attuned to have warding powers against the Scourge.\n\nThe crystals were to be transported to where the Howling Ziggurat and the Bleeding Ziggurat now stand, in the middle of the Dead Scar. If they're still held there, we need to recover them. Their power will be greatly useful in our struggle against the enemy.",o="转至鲜血通灵塔和鬼嚎通灵塔寻找光芒之石和烈焰之石，然后向太阳圣殿的魔导师坎迪瑞斯复命。",oEN="Travel to the Bleeding Ziggurat and the Howling Ziggurat and recover the Stone of Light and the Stone of Flame. Return to Magister Kaendris at the Sanctum of the Sun after recovering the items.",p="你取回那些水晶了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the crystals yet?",c="谣言果然是真的！圣光之石和火焰之石真的存在！有了它们的能量我们就能制造对付达克汗的武器了。\n\n在对的时机使用它们，抑制在里面的太阳之井能量就会消灭他，以最初他想从我们这里偷走的力量！",cEN="The rumors were true! The stone of light and the stone of flame do exist! We shall use their power to create weapons against Dar'Khan.\n\nUse them when the time is right and the energies of the Sunwell, trapped within these objects, will vanquish him with the very power he sought to steal from us!"}
Q[9178]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单BS-091：\n\n120个致密平衡石。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order BS-091:\n\n120 Dense Weightstones.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将120个致密平衡石和工匠文书 - 致密平衡石交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 120 Dense Weightstones and the Craftsman's Writ - Dense Weightstone - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="来交工单吗，$n？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="是的，这些东西会成为步兵易于操作的攻击武器。",cEN="Yep, these will come in handy for the infantry's bashin' weapons."}
Q[9179]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单BS-428：\n\n3个君王板甲护胸。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order BS-428:\n\n3 Imperial Plate Chests.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将3个君王板甲护胸和工匠文书 - 君王板甲护胸交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 3 Imperial Plate Chests and the Craftsman's Writ - Imperial Plate Chest - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="来交工单吗，$n？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="有更多的护甲给我们的军队！太棒了，$n！",cEN="More armor for the troops! Fantastic, <name>!"}
Q[9180]={d="这可了不得！这根项链似乎是女王的姐姐奥蕾莉亚·风行者送给她的礼物！\n\n你最好立即将这东西送往幽暗城，亲自交给女王。希尔瓦娜斯·风行者就在幽暗城的皇家区。\n\n你可以穿过银月城的传送门，然后乘坐电梯到达幽暗城。如果你找不着皇家区，最好看看地图。",dEN="This is quite extraordinary! It appears to be a gift to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner from her sister, Alleria!\n\nYou must take it to her in the Undercity at once! The lady holds court in the Royal Quarter.\n\nTo get there, use the orb of translocation in the Inner Sanctum of Sunfury Spire in Silvermoon City to cross over to the Undercity. Once there, take the elevator ride down into the city proper. Use your maps if you need help finding the Royal Quarter.",o="将女王的项链交给幽暗城皇家区的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Take The Lady's Necklace to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner at the Royal Quarter in Undercity.",p="你是……？\n\n你手里拿的是什么？那串项链看着有点眼熟。交给我！",pEN="And you are?\n\nWhat's that you have there? That necklace looks somehow familiar. Give it here!",c="<希尔瓦娜斯从你手中拿走项链。>\n\n这怎么可能！这么久以来，我以为我永远失去它了。\n\n<一阵静默后，女王开始重新注意到周围的情况，镇定了下来。>\n\n你以为这样就能取悦我吗？你以为我还会怀念那段成为被遗忘者女王之前的时光吗？就跟你这个人一样，这东西对我来说完全没有意义，而艾兰里亚·风行者也只是一段逝去的回忆罢了！\n\n<她把护符丢到地上去。>\n\n你现在可以立刻消失在我眼前，$c。",cEN="<Sylvanas takes the necklace from your grasp.>\n\nIt can't be! After all this time, I thought it was lost forever.\n\n<After a lingering moment the Lady seems to become aware once again of her surroundings, composing herself.>\n\nYou thought this would amuse me? Do you think I long for a time before I was the queen of the Forsaken? Like you, it means nothing to me, and Alleria Windrunner is a long dead memory!\n\n<She drops the amulet to the ground.>\n\nYou may now remove yourself from my presence, <class>."}
Q[9181]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单BS-697：\n\n3个火山战锤。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order BS-697:\n\n3 Volcanic Hammers.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将3把火山战锤和工匠文书 - 火山战锤交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 3 Volcanic Hammers and the Craftsman's Writ - Volcanic Hammer - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="来交工单吗，$n？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些东西和我们储备的致密平衡石会配合的很好。",cEN="These should go well with the dense weightstones we're stockpiling."}
Q[9182]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单BS-6020：\n\n3个巨型瑟银战斧。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order BS-6020:\n\n3 Huge Thorium Battleaxes.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将3把巨型瑟银战斧和工匠文书 - 巨型瑟银战斧交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 3 Huge Thorium Battleaxes and the Craftsman's Writ - Huge Thorium Battleaxe - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="来交工单吗，$n？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些东西没有我想象中巨大。不过，我信守承诺。",cEN="These aren't as huge as I expected. Regardless, a deal is a deal."}
Q[9183]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单BS-80：\n\n3个辐光头饰。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order BS-80:\n\n3 Radiant Circlets.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将3个辐光头饰和工匠文书 - 辐光头饰交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 3 Radiant Circlets and the Craftsman's Writ - Radiant Circlet - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="来交工单吗，$n？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="我还是不敢相信梅兹竟期望我们的军队穿戴这种劣质的垃圾来抵抗天灾军团的攻击。",cEN="I still can't believe Metz expects our troops to wear this low-quality garbage to protect against the freezing attacks of the Scourge."}
Q[9184]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单LW-971：\n\n10个邪恶皮甲头环。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order LW-971:\n\n10 Wicked Leather Headbands.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将10条邪恶皮甲头环和工匠文书——邪恶皮甲头环交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。|n",oEN="Deliver 10 Wicked Leather Headbands and the Craftsman's Writ - Wicked Leather Headband - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些东西真是……很棒。",cEN="These are... wicked."}
Q[9185]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单LW-448：\n\n25个毛皮护甲片。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order LW-448:\n\n25 Rugged Armor Kits.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将25张厚重护甲片和工匠文书——厚重护甲片交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。|n",oEN="Deliver 25 Rugged Armor Kits and the Craftsman's Writ - Rugged Armor Kit - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="毛皮护甲片的用处比你想象中还多，$n。他不只可以给予防具更多的护甲，他也可以拿来当做茶壶垫！",cEN="The rugged armor kits have many uses, <name>. They aren't JUST for slapping on certain armor pieces for added protection. Like this one here, I'm going to use it as teapot cozy."}
Q[9186]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单LW-736：\n\n9条邪恶皮甲腰带。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order LW-736:\n\n9 Wicked Leather Belts.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将9条邪恶皮甲腰带和工匠文书 - 邪恶皮甲腰带交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 9 Wicked Leather Belts and the Craftsman's Writ - Wicked Leather Belt - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些邪恶皮甲腰带看起来比邪恶皮甲头带还要更加的棒——如果你相信他说的话。",cEN="These belts are actually more wicked than the headbands - if you can believe such a thing to be possible."}
Q[9187]={d="这张令状的持有人在完成订定的工作后会以徽记的形式得到奖赏。\n\n工作令LW-8485：\n\n4件符文皮甲短裤。\n\n所有完成的工作令都要送到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。\n\n一旦契约遭到损坏或篡改一律视为无效。\n\n-发送指挥官梅兹，银色黎明",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order LW-8485:\n\n4 Runic Leather Pants.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将4件符文皮甲短裤和工匠令状 - 符文皮甲短裤 - 带到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。",oEN="Deliver 4 Runic Leather Pants and the Craftsman's Writ - Runic Leather Pants - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="德鲁伊们一定会喜欢制作这条裤子所用的手艺。多谢了，$n。",cEN="The druids will definitely appreciate the craftsmanship that went into the making of these pants. Many thanks, <class>."}
Q[9188]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单TR-95：\n\n6条亮布短裤。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order TR-95:\n\n6 Brightcloth Pants.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将6条亮布短裤和工匠文书 - 亮布短裤交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 6 Brightcloth Pants and the Craftsman's Writ - Brightcloth Pants - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="哇，这些东西几乎可以将我的样子反射出来！",cEN="I can almost see my reflection in these things! That's crazy."}
Q[9189]={d="你唤起了那位夫人的心，尽管它早已不再跳动。\n\n不过，我有一份指令必须送到银松森林的墓室去。顾问索雷隆在那里代表我们与被遗忘者交涉。\n\n如果不搭他们的飞行蝙蝠，最短的路线就是出幽暗城，走南边的大路。跟着路标走。找到那地方应该不难。不过你得有心理准备，墓室本身就是一座破败的地窖。\n\n这些被遗忘者真是些古怪的家伙。",dEN="You have stirred the lady's heart, though it no longer beats.\n\nHowever, I have instructions that must be delivered to the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest. Advisor Sorrelon represents us to the Forsaken there.\n\nThe shortest route, barring the use of their flying bats, is to leave Undercity and take the road south. Follow the signposts. Finding the place shouldn't be difficult. Brace yourself, though; the Sepulcher itself is a dilapidated crypt.\n\nThese Forsaken are certainly odd creatures.",o="将密封的辛多雷命令交给银松森林瑟伯切尔的顾问索雷伦。",oEN="Deliver the Sealed Sin'dorei Orders to Advisor Sorrelon at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="你好，$g兄弟:姐妹，你带来了什么消息？",pEN="Greetings, <brother/sister>. What news do you bring?",c="啊，很好。我看的出来银月大使对你水涨船高的辛多雷声望抱着很大的希望。不过很遗憾那是希尔瓦娜斯的差事。别担心，$n，你归还她的项链是正确的。\n\n当你在这里的时候，你应该选择协助被遗忘者的不同任务，尽你最大所能。你不会想破坏和部落创建的新关系吧？",cEN="I see here that Ambassador Sunsorrow has high hopes for your continued rise as a credit to the sin'dorei. Unfortunate that business with Lady Sylvanas, though. Pay it no heed, <name>, you did the right thing in returning her necklace. She should have been grateful, but such is the way of royalty.\n\nWhile you are here, should you choose to assist with the tasks of the Forsaken, be on your best behavior. You wouldn't want to damage our new bond with the Horde now would you?"}
Q[9190]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单TR-635：\n\n8双符文布靴。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order TR-635:\n\n8 Runecloth Boots.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将8双符文布靴和工匠文书 - 符文布靴交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 8 Runecloth Boots and the Craftsman's Writ - Runecloth Boots - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你真的带来了这些符文布靴，看来是我的胡子赌赢了！",cEN="By Bronzebeard's beard! You actually brought me runecloth boots... I guess I lost that bet."}
Q[9192]={d="西南方的暗光矿洞被一群自称黑爪的豺狼人占据了。我不用提醒你，这些矿洞对我们在幽魂之地当前的战事来说是多么重要的战略资产！\n\n出了城走南边的大路，在岔路口向右拐。刚过右边的通灵塔，你就会看到一条向西的短土路。沿着它走。\n\n矿石必须流通起来！",dEN="The Underlight Mines to the southwest have been overrun by a clan of gnolls calling themselves the Blackpaw. I don't need to remind you how important those mines are to us as a strategic asset in our ongoing campaign here in the Ghostlands!\n\nTake the south road out of town and follow the fork to the right. Just past the ziggurat on the right there will be a short dirt path to the west. Follow it.\n\nThe ore must flow!",o="杀死8个黑爪豺狼人、6个黑爪食腐者和4个黑爪萨满祭司，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的亡灵哨兵玛尔特迪斯复命。",oEN="Slay 8 Blackpaw Gnolls, 6 Blackpaw Scavengers and 4 Blackpaw Shaman, and return to Deathstalker Maltendis at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="$g亲爱的:亲爱的;，是好消息还是坏消息？",pEN="Is it good news, or bad, darling?",c="你这一手宰杀干得挺利索，$c。我们这就让矿工们复工。我敢说他们会为假期结束而失望，但总得打造护甲和武器，而这就要靠挖出来的矿石。\n\n拿着，这算是你尽职的酬劳。去把护甲和武器修一修，再喝上一杯，我请客。",cEN="That's a fair job of butchery you managed there, <class>. We'll get the miners back to work now. I'm sure they'll be disappointed that their break is over, but there's armor and weaponry to be made, and that requires ore to be mined.\n\nHere, take this as payment for doing your duty. Go get your armor and weapons repaired, and have a drink on me."}
Q[9193]={d="$C，我们的线人报告说，被埋葬在阳痕峰阿曼尼墓穴内的巨魔尸体竟然重新站立了起来。奥莉菲洛丝夫人希望你去调查这些墓穴，并烧掉那些还没有活化的尸体，这样就可以避免它们为亡灵生物所利用。\n\n以你最快的速度向北出镇吧，在第一个路口向右转，到达山的北侧，然后再折向南就可以看到那里的入口了。",dEN="<class>, our sources tell us that the trolls buried in the Amani Catacombs inside Sungraze Peak have been rising from the dead. Dame Auriferous would have you investigate these catacombs and put to the torch any of the unanimated remains you come across so as to prevent any more of these creatures from rising.\n\nThe fastest way there is to head north out of town and then take the first fork to the right. This will put you on the north side of the peak, so look to the south for the entrance.",o="调查阿曼尼墓穴并烧毁10具巨魔木乃伊残骸，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的顾问瓦尔文复命。",oEN="Investigate the Amani Catacombs and burn 10 Mummified Troll Remains, then return to Advisor Valwyn at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="这是件最无情又有失威严的差事，$c。我相信你会完成这项任务让女士满意。",pEN="This is a most grim and undignified business, I trust that you will complete this task to milady's complete satisfaction?",c="很恶心，但我向你保证这是必须的。你调查这件事是帮了我们一个大忙，$c。拜托，收下这个做为我们慷慨的奖赏及感激。",cEN="Disgusting, but necessary I can assure you. You have done us good service by investigating this matter, Please, take this as a token of our generosity and appreciation."}
Q[9194]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单TR-7229：\n\n8件符文布袍。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order TR-7229:\n\n8 Runecloth Robes.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将8件符文布袍和工匠文书 - 符文布袍交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 8 Runecloth Robes and the Craftsman's Writ - Runecloth Robe - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你不该这么做的！不，说真的，你不该这么做。我不知道梅兹在想什么，可没人会穿着这些长袍进纳克萨玛斯。\n\n<兽栏管理员石碾叹了口气。>\n\n唉，又得把一堆垃圾运到前线去，还得再挨钱伯斯一顿骂。",cEN="You shouldn't have! No really, you shouldn't have. I don't know what Metz is thinking, but nobody is going to be wearing these robes into Naxxramas.\n\n<Packmaster Stonebruiser sighs.>\n\nBah, another pile of junk I'll have to get transferred to the front lines and another berating I'll have to take from Chambers."}
Q[9195]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单EN-11：\n\n20个地精工兵炸药。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order EN-11:\n\n20 Goblin Sapper Charges.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将20个地精工兵炸药和工匠文书 - 地精工兵炸药交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 20 Goblin Sapper Charges and the Craftsman's Writ - Goblin Sapper Charge - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这才说到我心坎上了，$n。会轰的一声炸开的东西！",cEN="Now you're talking my language, <class>. Things that go BOOM!"}
Q[9196]={d="持此文书者，在完成受托工单后，可领取一枚自选徽记作为报酬。\n\n工单 EN-7：\n\n20枚瑟银手榴弹。\n\n所有完成的工单都应交付给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。\n\n本契约若被篡改或损毁即告作废。\n\n——调度指挥官梅兹，银色黎明|n",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order EN-7:\n\n20 Thorium Grenades.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将20枚瑟银手榴弹和工匠文书 - 瑟银手榴弹交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 20 Thorium Grenades and the Craftsman's Writ - Thorium Grenade - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些手榴弹一定花不少钱来制作。我说的对吗，$n？",cEN="These must have cost a pretty copper piece to make. Am I right or am I right, <name>?"}
Q[9197]={d="这张令状的持有人在完成订定的工作后会以徽记的形式得到奖赏。\n\n工作令EN-0：\n\n4只地精作战小鸡。\n\n所有完成的工作令都要送到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。\n\n一旦契约遭到损坏或篡改一律视为无效。\n\n-发送指挥官梅兹，银色黎明",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order EN-0:\n\n4 Gnomish Battle Chickens.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将4只地精作战小鸡和工匠令状 - 地精作战小鸡 - 带到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。",oEN="Deliver 4 Gnomish Battle Chickens and the Craftsman's Writ - Gnomish Battle Chicken - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你在笑什么？有什么那么好笑？听着，$g小子:女孩，千万不要小看侏儒作战小鸡，他们在战役中是多么的重要啊，因为侏儒作战小鸡是唯一能够在有瘟疫的环境中生存并消灭那些被传染的昆虫和瘟疫带原者，大家都知道机器人都是对疾病免疫的。\n\n我想你现在应该觉得自己没有想象中的聪明了吧，大笨蛋……",cEN="Why are you smiling? What's so funny? Listen, <mister/missy>, a gnomish battle chicken is a very important unit and not to be taken lightly - EVER. We send these in to areas that might be heavily plagued or infested and they clean up any plagued insects or carrion maggots that might still be fluttering about. Everybody knows that robots are immune to the plague.\n\nI bet you don't feel so smart now, do you? Big dummy..."}
Q[9198]={d="这张令状的持有人在完成订定的工作后会以徽记的形式得到奖赏。\n\n工作令EN-558：\n\n14个瑟银管。\n\n所有完成的工作令都要送到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。\n\n一旦契约遭到损坏或篡改一律视为无效。\n\n-发送指挥官梅兹，银色黎明",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order EN-558:\n\n14 Thorium Tubes.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将14个瑟银管和工匠令状 - 瑟银管 - 带到东瘟疫之地给圣光之愿礼拜堂的军需筹备官·石汉 。",oEN="Deliver 14 Thorium Tubes and the Craftsman's Writ - Thorium Tube - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="瑟银管？喔，谢谢。\n\n<马队管理者布鲁斯把那些瑟银管顺手丢到旁边的垃圾堆。>",cEN="Thorium tubes? Gee, thanks.\n\n<Packmaster Stonebruiser throws the stack of thorium tubes into a large pile of assorted junk.>"}
Q[9199]={d="埋在阿曼尼地下墓穴里的巨魔尸体竟然复活了！我要你去那里，带一份他们被彻底消灭的证明回来。有些巨魔木乃伊，以及他们活着的同类，身上带着巫毒；那些发光的物件里蕴藏着某种未知的能量源。多半就是它在驱使它们！\n\n墓穴就在正东方的阳痕峰内。我听说最容易的入口在山体北面。去查个明白，$c！",dEN="The corpses of trolls buried inside the Amani Catacombs have been rising from the dead! I want you to go there and bring back proof of their final demise. Some of these mummy trolls, and their living counterparts, carry juju; glowing objects that house an unknown power source. It's probably what is animating them!\n\nThe catacombs lie within Sungraze Peak, directly to the east. I am told that the easiest way in lies on the north face of the mountain. See to it, <class>!",o="收集8个巨魔的邪符，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的亡灵哨兵玛尔特迪斯复命。",oEN="Collect 8 Troll Juju and return them to Deathstalker Maltendis at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="不用我提醒你，我们实在经不起自家后院闹巨魔亡者复活这种乱子！光南边的戴索姆就够我们受的了！",pEN="I don't have to remind you that we can ill afford this trouble with the troll dead rising in our very backyard! We have enough trouble with Deatholme to the south!",c="巨魔祭司在复活木乃伊……真聪明！暗松巨魔一定是在用这些死灵法术扩充兵力。我敢打赌，这些神谕者在复活仪式中用的就是巫毒。\n\n你又一次尽到了职责，无愧于你这样$g一位:一位;名声渐起的$c。收下这个，连同我们的谢意。",cEN="Mummies being raised by troll priests... clever! The Shadowpine trolls must be trying to bolster their numbers through necromantic means. I'd wager that these oracles were using the juju in their reanimation ritual.\n\nOnce again you perform your duty as befits a <class> of your growing reputation. Take this with our gratitude."}
Q[9200]={d="持此文书者，在完成受托工单后，可领取一枚自选徽记作为报酬。\n\n工单 AL-473：\n\n10瓶特效法力药水。\n\n所有完成的工单都应交付给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。\n\n本契约若被篡改或损毁即告作废。\n\n——调度指挥官梅兹，银色黎明|n",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order AL-473:\n\n10 Major Mana Potions.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将10份特效法力药水和工匠文书 - 特效法力药水交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 10 Major Mana Potions and the Craftsman's Writ - Major Mana Potion - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="这些药水的功能真的是好到无可挑剔。",cEN="The utility of these should go without saying."}
Q[9201]={d="持此文书者，在完成受托工单后，可领取一枚自选徽记作为报酬。\n\n工单 AL-1420：\n\n15瓶强效奥术防护药水。\n\n所有完成的工单都应交付给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。\n\n本契约若被篡改或损毁即告作废。\n\n——调度指挥官梅兹，银色黎明|n",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order AL-1420:\n\n15 Greater Arcane Protection Potions.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将15瓶强效奥术防护药水和工匠文书——强效奥术防护药水交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的兽栏管理员石碾。|n",oEN="Deliver 15 Greater Arcane Protection Potions and the Craftsman's Writ - Greater Arcane Protection Potion - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="<马队管理者布鲁斯拿了一瓶强效秘法防护药水起来，然后一口喝下。>\n\n哇！这个还真好喝！好喝！",cEN="<Packmaster Stonebruiser pops open one of the greater arcane protection potions and take a swig.>\n\nWOOT! These pack a kick, baby! A kick I say!"}
Q[9202]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单AL-169110：\n\n20份特效治疗药水。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order AL-169110:\n\n20 Major Healing Potions.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将20份特效治疗药水和工匠文书 - 特效治疗药水交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 20 Major Healing Potions and the Craftsman's Writ - Major Healing Potion - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你知道前线的部队管这些叫什么吗？瓶装牧师……\n\n<兽栏管理员石碾唱了起来。>\n\n\"我是你的瓶装牧师，宝贝……你得用对的方式把我喝下去……\"\n\n$g小伙子:姑娘;，怎么了？这一带很流行这首歌。",cEN="Do you know what the troops on the front lines call these? Priests in a bottle...\n\n<Packmaster Stonebruiser sings.>\n\n\"I'm your priest in a bott-le baby... you gotta drink me the right way...\"\n\nWhat's the matter sonny? It's a very popular song around these parts."}
Q[9203]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单AL-90：\n\n1份化石合剂。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order AL-90:\n\n1 Potion of Petrification.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将1份化石合剂和工匠文书 - 化石合剂交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 1 Potion of Petrification and the Craftsman's Writ - Potion of Petrification - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="无可奉告。\n\n<马队管理者布鲁斯看看了你>\n\n我都说了无可奉告了！滚出我的视线！",cEN="No comment.\n\n<Packmaster Stonebruiser glares at you.>\n\nI said no comment! Now get out of my sight!"}
Q[9204]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单FS-5：\n\n40条石鳞鳗。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order FS-5:\n\n40 Stonescale Eel.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将40条石鳞鳗和工匠文书 - 石鳞鳗交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 40 Stonescale Eel and the Craftsman's Writ - Stonescale Eel - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你原本可以用这些材料去做其它物品的，可是你没有，对吧？现在你想反悔也来不及了，$n。",cEN="You could have used this for something else, but you didn't, did you? No use crying about it now, <name>."}
Q[9205]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单FS-12：\n\n30条板鳞鱼。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order FS-12:\n\n30 Plated Armorfish.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将30条板鳞鱼和工匠文书 - 板鳞鱼交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 30 Plated Armorfish and the Craftsman's Writ - Plated Armorfish - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="你真的不知道这个是做什么用的？\n\n<马队管理者布鲁斯大笑。>\n\n别想指望我会告诉你！",cEN="You really don't know what these are for?\n\n<Packmaster Stonebruiser laughs.>\n\nLike I'm going to tell you!"}
Q[9206]={d="工匠文书的持有者在完成订单后可以挑选一枚徽记作为奖励。\n\n订单FS-9：\n\n30条电鳗。\n\n所有的成品应送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤处。\n\n物品若有任何损坏，订单无效。\n\n银色黎明物资官员梅兹",dEN="The bearer of this writ is entitled to payment in the form of an insignia of their choice upon completion of the contracted work order.\n\nWork Order FS-9:\n\n30 Lightning Eel.\n\nAll filled orders should be delivered to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nContract is null and void if tampered with or damaged.\n\n-Dispatch Commander Metz, The Argent Dawn",o="将30条电鳗和工匠文书 - 电鳗交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的马队管理者布鲁斯·石锤。",oEN="Deliver 30 Lightning Eel and the Craftsman's Writ - Lightning Eel - to Packmaster Stonebruiser at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="完成工作订单了吗，$c？",pEN="Filling a work order, <class>?",c="用这些电鳗做的电鳗卷真的是全世界最好吃的食物！没错——全世界！",cEN="These make the best eel rolls in the world. That's right - IN THE WORLD."}
Q[9207]={d="我是被太阳圣殿派过来收集矿石样本的，但这里已经完全被豺狼人占据了！如果我不能马上给魔导师带去矿石，那他可就想要我的脑袋了。或许你能帮帮我，$c？\n\n你可以在这里的锡矿和铜矿上找到矿石的样本，豺狼人身上也有携带着。有了足够的矿石以后，请直接把它交给太阳圣殿的魔导师奎尔林提斯。向东走，穿过死亡之痕，你可以在阳痕峰的正南方发现太阳圣殿。",dEN="I was sent here from the Sanctum of the Sun to collect some ore samples, but the gnolls have overrun the place! It's going to be my head on a platter if I don't get those samples to the magister soon. Maybe you could help, <class>?\n\nYou can find the ore in the tin and copper veins here, and the gnolls are carrying it around, too. When you have enough, take it to Magister Quallestis at the Sanctum of the Sun directly to the east. Go across the Dead Scar and you'll find the sanctum just south of Sungraze Peak.",o="收集6块幽光矿石，把它们交给幽魂之地太阳圣殿的魔导师奎尔林提斯。",oEN="Collect 6 Underlight Ore and deliver them to Magister Quallestis at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",p="需要帮忙吗，$c？",pEN="How may I help you?",c="我的学徒连这点事都办不好？等她回来我得跟她好好谈谈，管他有没有豺狼人。说到这个，她怎么没跟你一起回来？\n\n<魔导师叹了口气。>\n\n那丫头是个麻烦精，要好好调教她可不是件容易的事。谢谢你把这些样本带给我，$c。我们希望能从中发现某些特殊性质，有助于对抗天灾。\n\n请收下这枚钱币，聊表谢意。",cEN="My apprentice was unable to take care of this herself? I shall have a word with her when she returns then, gnolls or not. Speaking of which, why didn't she return with you?\n\n<The magister sighs.>\n\nThat one is a handful, and is going to be quite a challenge to properly train. Thank you, for bringing these samples to me. We are hoping that we can uncover some special property from them that will help in the fight against the Scourge.\n\nPlease take this coin as a token of my appreciation."}
Q[9208]={d="只要有合适的材料，赞扎就能制作许多古老的巨魔附魔！你听说过野性守护吗？没有，你当然没听过。你的脑子被那些低劣的精灵魔法搅糊涂了。\n\n给我带一件精灵制作的秘法宝典来，好让我毁掉那个异端。做到这一点，野性守护就归你了。|n",dEN="Zanza can create many ancient troll enchantments with proper components! Have you heard of the Savage Guard? No, of course you haven't. Your mind is addled with the inferior elven magic.\n\nBring me an arcanum of elven creation so that I may destroy the aberration. Do this and the Savage Guard will be yours.",o="祖尔格拉布的无眠者赞扎需要一份防护秘药。",oEN="Zanza the Restless in Zul'Gurub wants an Arcanum of Protection.",p="拿到秘纹了吗？",pEN="Do you have the arcanum?",c="看到这些无用的精灵魔法让我更加的愤怒而这些愤怒也能让我获得更多的力量。\n\n再去多拿一些秘药来给我，你就能获得另一个野蛮护卫。",cEN="The worthless magic in these enchantments fuels my anger. My anger gives me strength.\n\nBring me more and you shall receive another Savage Guard."}
Q[9209]={d="只要有合适的材料，赞扎就能制作许多古老的巨魔附魔！你听说过野性守护吗？没有，你当然没听过。你的脑子被那些低劣的精灵魔法搅糊涂了。\n\n给我带一件精灵制作的秘法宝典来，好让我毁掉那个异端。做到这一点，野性守护就归你了。|n",dEN="Zanza can create many ancient troll enchantments with proper components! Have you heard of the Savage Guard? No, of course you haven't. Your mind is addled with the inferior elven magic.\n\nBring me an arcanum of elven creation so that I may destroy the aberration. Do this and the Savage Guard will be yours.",o="祖尔格拉布的无眠者赞扎需要一份急速秘药。",oEN="Zanza the Restless in Zul'Gurub wants an Arcanum of Rapidity.",p="拿到秘纹了吗？",pEN="Do you have the arcanum?",c="看到这些无用的精灵魔法让我更加的愤怒而这些愤怒也能让我获得更多的力量。\n\n再去多拿一些秘药来给我，你就能获得另一个野蛮护卫。",cEN="The worthless magic in these enchantments fuels my anger. My anger gives me strength.\n\nBring me more and you shall receive another Savage Guard."}
Q[9210]={d="只要有合适的材料，赞扎就能制作许多古老的巨魔附魔！你听说过野性守护吗？没有，你当然没听过。你的脑子被那些低劣的精灵魔法搅糊涂了。\n\n给我带一件精灵制作的秘法宝典来，好让我毁掉那个异端。做到这一点，野性守护就归你了。|n",dEN="Zanza can create many ancient troll enchantments with proper components! Have you heard of the Savage Guard? No, of course you haven't. Your mind is addled with the inferior elven magic.\n\nBring me an arcanum of elven creation so that I may destroy the aberration. Do this and the Savage Guard will be yours.",o="祖尔格拉布的无眠者赞扎需要一份专注秘药。",oEN="Zanza the Restless in Zul'Gurub wants an Arcanum of Focus.",p="拿到秘纹了吗？",pEN="Do you have the arcanum?",c="看到这些无用的精灵魔法让我更加的愤怒而这些愤怒也能让我获得更多的力量。\n\n再去多拿一些秘药来给我，你就能获得另一个野蛮护卫。",cEN="The worthless magic in these enchantments fuels my anger. My anger gives me strength.\n\nBring me more and you shall receive another Savage Guard."}
Q[9212]={d="这些巨魔伏击了我，并把我关在了这座笼子里。我想他们一定是计划要把我献祭给他们的神！帮我逃出这里！\n\n笼子的锁不是很复杂，但我在里面没办法打开它，不然我就可以自己逃走了。请你一定要保护我回到远行者营地。我想赫里奥斯中尉一定会奖励你的，而我也会铭记你的大恩大德，永世不忘！",dEN="These trolls ambushed me and have been keeping me in this cage. I think they're planning to sacrifice me! Help me get out of here!\n\nThe lock on the cage isn't that complex... I just can't get to it from this side. Please escort me back to the Farstrider Enclave. I'm sure Captain Helios will reward you, and you'll have my undying gratitude!",o="护送游侠莉拉恩萨回到远行者营地的赫里奥斯中尉身边。",oEN="Escort Ranger Lilatha to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="就是你救了我的游侠？",pEN="You're the one that rescued my ranger?",c="你真是个英雄，$c，竟能把她活着救出来。我想我们也得发动一次进攻，把那些墓穴一并清理干净。好像活着的巨魔还不够让我们头疼似的！\n\n你今天立了大功，我该奖赏你。从这些里面随便挑吧。",cEN="You're quite the hero, <class>, to get her out of there alive. I suppose we'll have to mount an offensive to clear out those catacombs too. As if we didn't have enough trouble with the living trolls!\n\nYou've done a great thing today, I should reward you. Take your pick from any of these."}
Q[9214]={d="$C，我需要你尽可能杀死更多的暗松巨魔。我们必须大大削减他们的人数，才能把主力部队调往戴索姆。另外，别忘了在清理巨魔的时候顺便把他们的武器给我拿回来，与其让巨魔浪费掉这些武器，还不如让我们的士兵拿着它们作战，这是一石二鸟之计。\n\n他们的营地就在东边和南边的塞布提拉和塞布努瓦。",dEN="<class>, I want you to kill as many Shadowpine trolls as you can. We need their numbers greatly reduced before we can shift our attention toward Deatholme. And while you're at it, we might as well kill two birds with one stone, so bring me back a load of their weapons. Better that they not go to waste, and we can use them in the fight against the Scourge.\n\nHit their camps hard to the east and the south at Zeb'Tela and Zeb'Nowa.",o="收集3把猎头者战斧、3把暗影施法者钉锤、3只驭豹者之爪和3根妖术师法杖，然后向远行者营地的赫里奥斯中尉复命。",oEN="Collect 3 Headhunter Axes, 3 Shadowcaster Maces, 3 Catlord Claws and 3 Hexxer Staves. Return them to Captain Helios at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="你拿到他们的武器了吗？等影松巨魔的实力被削弱了以后，我们终于可以转移目标对付天灾军团。",pEN="Have those weapons yet? With the Shadowpine numbers decimated we'll finally be able to turn our attention to the fight against the Scourge.",c="我会立刻派一些巡逻兵去调查你对影松巨魔造成的伤害。我相信不用多久，我们就可以在你的攻击之后向天灾军团进攻，拿着你成功取回的武器而大获全胜。\n\n拿着，我要你收下这枚硬币当作谢礼，反正我的钱包也满到快装不下了。",cEN="I'll immediately send a few rangers out to survey the damage that you wreaked upon the Shadowpine trolls. I've no doubt that we'll be able to mop up after your offensive and launch an attack on the Scourge soon if these weapons are any indication of your success.\n\nHere, I want you to take this coin in payment. It's burning a hole in my pouch anyway."}
Q[9215]={d="悬赏：将暗松巨魔酋长克尔加什的徽记交给赫里奥斯中尉。不要问任何其它问题。根据当前的情报，克尔加什居住在塞布努瓦南部某处。\n\n\n\n奖励：有奖励，但无预付！",dEN="WANTED: Bring the head of Kel'gash the Wicked, chieftain of the Shadowpine trolls, to Captain Helios. No questions asked. Kel'gash is known to dwell somewhere to the south in Zeb'Nowa.\n\n\n\nREWARD: Yes, but no advances!",o="将克尔加什的徽记交给远行者营地的赫里奥斯中尉。",oEN="Return the Head of Kel'gash the Wicked to Captain Helios at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="这可怕的味道是什么啊？",pEN="What is that awful smell?",c="啊，原来那颗头颅就是恶臭冲天的东西。做得好，$c！\n\n一旦他们的头目死了，影松巨魔就会陷入一片混乱。加上我们最近致力于削弱他们的势力，这应该是个完美的反击时机。\n\n谢谢你，$n。我可以给你一点奖励吗？",cEN="Ah. Kel'gash's head is what smelled so bad. That's a nice piece of work there, <class>!\n\nWith their chieftain dead, the Shadowpine trolls should be in total disarray. Combined with your recent efforts to decimate their numbers, this should be the perfect opportunity to launch our counter-offensive against them and wipe them out for good.\n\nYou have my thanks, Might I interest you in one of these?"}
Q[9216]={d="我听说阿曼尼巨魔认为吃下敌人的精华可以获得他们的力量。$n，这种巨魔的习俗也许并非只是迷信。经过适当的处理，亡者的精华可以被制成各种强效的药剂。\n\n杀掉死亡之痕的食尸鬼，把他们的精华带回来。我会为你配制一份药剂，提高你对亡灵的物理攻击力。",dEN="I hear the Amani trolls eat their enemies' hearts to steal their strength. They might just be on to something, <name>. With the proper treatment, the hearts of the unliving can produce potent elixirs.\n\nHunt down the zombies that roam the Dead Scar and bring me their hearts. I'll show you the kind of enhancement we can perform to your physical prowess against the undead.",o="将10颗腐烂的精华交给塔奎林的魔导师艾米妮尔。",oEN="Bring back 10 Rotting Hearts to Magistrix Aminel in Tranquillien.",p="你有带回我要的腐烂之心吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the zombie hearts I requested, <name>?",c="拿着这个药水，$n。喝下之后，它将给你强大的力量去对付天灾军团。如果你又有大量的腐烂之心，要记得通知我。",cEN="Take this draught, <name>. After you drink it, your physical strength against the Scourge will receive a boost. If you need more than this sample bring me more hearts."}
Q[9217]={p="你有更多的腐烂之心吗？你有多少，我就用多少，$n。",pEN="You've brought more ghoul hearts? I can use as many as you can collect, <name>.",c="这将能替你增强魔法能量来对付天灾军团。多带一些腐烂之心回来吧，$n。",cEN="This will provide you with greater power against the Scourge. Bring more hearts if you find them, <name>."}
Q[9218]={d="黑暗的能量在复苏的骷髅体内涌动着，并聚集在它们的脊骨中。我发现，若是在药水中注入这种能量，饮用后可以提高我们对亡灵的魔法攻击力。\n\n将脊骨之尘带回来，我就给你配制一份药水。去西边的死亡之痕吧，那儿聚集着大量的骷髅。",dEN="The dark energy that flows through the bodies of reanimated skeletons tends to accumulate primarily in their spine. I've discovered a method of instilling this energy into a potion that boosts our magical abilities against the undead.\n\nBring me some spinal dust and I'll be glad to provide you with a sample. You'll find an ample number of skeletons wandering the Dead Scar, west of here.",o="将10份脊骨之尘交给塔奎林的魔导师艾米妮尔。",oEN="Bring back 10 Spinal Dusts to Magistrix Aminel in Tranquillien.",p="你有带回我要的样本吗，$n？",pEN="Do you have the samples I requested, <name>?",c="收下这个，$n。你会立刻感觉到不同！\n\n多带一些脊骨之尘回来你有多少我就能用多少。副作用？你可能会觉得你的关节开始出点毛病。没有永久的影响，我保证！",cEN="Take this, <name>. You'll feel the difference immediately!\n\nFeel free to bring more spinal dust; I can use as much of it as you can provide. Side effects? You might start feeling your joints acting up a bit. Nothing permanent, I assure you!"}
Q[9219]={p="你有更多的脊骨之尘吗？你有多少，我就用多少。",pEN="You've procured more spinal dust? I can use as much of it as you bring me.",c="这些粉末有着强大的能量，$n。如果你想增加你的魔法力量来对抗天灾军团的话，那就持续把它带来给我。",cEN="This dust is as potent as ever, <name>. Keep bringing it to me if you're in need to boost your magical powers against the Scourge."}
Q[9220]={d="如果你想要伸出援手，现在正是时候。\n\n我们最近重建了太阳圣殿，并正式向戴索姆的敌军宣战。\n\n转至那座天灾军团的要塞，英勇作战吧。",dEN="If you seek to aid our cause there is no better place to start than here and no better time to do it than now.\n\nBy rebuilding the Sanctum of the Sun we've raised a banner of defiance in front of our enemy's seat of power: Deatholme.\n\nGo forth and fight the hordes of undead that inhabit the vile Scourge fortress.",o="转至戴索姆杀死5个达尔坎之眼、6个蛛怪百夫长和6个恸哭者，然后向幽魂之地太阳圣殿的魔导师伊东尼斯复命。",oEN="Slay 5 Eyes of Dar'khan, 6 Nerubis Centurions and 6 Wailers in Deatholme and return to Magister Idonis at the Sanctum of the Sun in the Ghostlands.",p="你是$g凯旋:凯旋;而归吗，$n，从戴索姆？",pEN="Have you returned from Deatholme victorious, <name>?",c="天灾军团深切感受到我们的狂怒，$n。他们被诅咒的要塞很快就要失陷了。\n\n随着他们数量的减少，该是时候发动一场战斗攻击更多重要的目标。",cEN="The Scourge has felt our wrath, <name>. It won't be long before their cursed citadel lies in ruins.\n\nWith their numbers weakened, it is time to launch an attack on more strategic targets."}
Q[9229]={d="拉玛兰迪是兄弟会的一名战士，早在银色黎明成立之前他便是莫格莱尼阁下的学生了！当莫格莱尼的死讯传来时，仇恨和愤怒充斥着他的心灵。\n\n试想一下吧，$n，一个被复仇的怒火占据了心灵的人还能算个人吗，无非是个被情绪操控的傀儡。拉玛兰迪在盛怒之下冲进了纳克萨玛斯的宫殿，想为恩师报仇……可惜是肉包子打狗。\n\n前往纳克萨玛斯的宫殿打探拉玛兰迪的下落吧。",dEN="Ramaladni was a warrior of the Brotherhood - a pupil of Highlord Mograine before the Dawn even existed! When news of Mograine's death reached him, hatred and anger took over.\n\nUnderstand this, <name>, when rage and retribution take the reins, a man ceases to be a man. The man personifies the emotions that control him instead. And so it would be that Ramaladni, the spirit of retribution, would enter Naxxramas to exact vengeance... and never return.\n\nEnter Naxxramas and find what became of Ramaladni.",o="进入纳克萨玛斯的宫殿，找到拉玛兰迪的下落。",oEN="Enter Naxxramas and uncover the Fate of Ramaladni.",p="有罗马拉丁尼的消息吗？",pEN="Any news of Ramaladni?",c="这就是他的戒指没错！不过光芒却已不在。你还有找到其它罗马拉丁尼的物品吗？\n\n<柯菲斯露出痛苦的表情。>\n\n这样看来罗马拉丁尼应该是凶多吉少了。不过这戒指……应该还能恢复他原有的光芒。",cEN="It is his ring! But it is destroyed. No other evidence of Ramaladni was found?\n\n<Korfax grimaces.>\n\nThis does not bode well for Ramaladni. The ring, however... it might be salvageable."}
Q[9230]={d="要修复这枚戒指可不是件容易的事儿，$n。瞧，它的原材料是取自天灾建筑物中形成的冰冻符文，例如纳克萨玛斯的宫殿。当然我还需要其它材料，但是你的主要任务就是找到冰冻符文。把我所需的材料拿来，我会让这枚戒指重新恢复光泽的。",dEN="Fixing this band may prove to be quite challenging, <name>. You see, it was made from the very runes that form inside Scourge structures - like Naxxramas. Additional materials are also required but your main concern should be getting those frozen runes. Bring me what I need and I will restore the ring to its former glory.",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯要你给他带去1枚冰冻符文、1颗蓝宝石和1根奥金锭。|n",oEN="Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 1 Frozen Rune, 1 Blue Sapphire and 1 Arcanite Bar.",p="在纳克萨玛斯里应该可以找到冰冻符文。",pEN="Frozen runes could probably be found inside Naxxramas.",c="就连罗马拉丁尼他自己也不可能做的比这个更完美！就像我所承诺的，我已经把这颗戒指恢复了他原有的光芒甚至更好，希望他能给你更多的帮助。",cEN="Ramaladni himself couldn't have done better! Here is the ring, as promised."}
Q[9232]={d="你自以为是个$g黎明的英雄:黎明的英雄;，是吧？我可是亲眼见过我们最出色的士兵被克尔苏加德的小喽啰碾得粉碎！一个像你这样一无所知的人，在纳克萨玛斯能有什么作为？\n\n<威廉叹了口气。>\n\n唉，我还有什么选择？你是我手头最好的了，那我还不如帮帮你。\n\n奥玛里恩给我留了一份配方。这是我会的唯一一首曲子……我可以把这条裤子做出几种变体；材料你得自己提供。",dEN="You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?\n\n<Wilhelm sighs.>\n\nBah, what choice do I got? You're the best I can do; I may as well help you.\n\nOmarion left me with one recipe. It's the only song I know... I can make a few variations of these pants; you just gotta supply the materials.",o="将2个冰冻符文、2个水之精华、2块蓝宝石和30金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",oEN="Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold pieces.",p="你还没见过工匠大师欧玛利安，对吧？",pEN="You haven't run into Omarion, have you?",c="<Wilhelm se seca el sudor de la frente>\n\n这可真是件苦差事！好好享用这条裤子吧，$n。至少你现在能穿着条干净的裤子去死了。",cEN="<Wilhelm wipes the sweat from his brow.>\n\nThat's some hard work! Enjoy the pants, <class>. At least you'll die in a clean pair now."}
Q[9233]={d="威尔海姆：\n\n当你翻阅这本手册时，我已经咽气了——这对我来说是个解脱。我想告诉你，我临死前还想着你和你那糟糕的商业头脑。不幸的是，就工匠技能来说，送手册给你的家伙连你都不如。\n\n这本手册记载了我生前研制的配方，可以让手册的持有者制造出任何他们想要的东西。我想你一定会向别人收取高额费用的，因为你就是这么个混帐。\n\n我鄙视你，\n\n奥玛里恩",dEN="Wilhelm,\n\nIf you are reading this, I have perished - finally. I want you to know that my dying thoughts revolved around you and your ineptitude when it comes to tradeskills. Unfortunately, the bearer of this handbook is in even worse shape than you in regards to crafting.\n\nAbout the book: These are the rest of my recipes. Make the bearer of this book whatever they request. I'm sure you will charge a hefty fee for your services because you are, after all, a crook.\n\nIn Disdain,\n\nOmarion",o="将奥玛里恩的手册交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威廉。|n",oEN="Take Omarion's Handbook to Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="这跟我想的是一样的吗？\n\n<威尔海姆流口水。>",pEN="Is that what I think it is?\n\n<Wilhelm appears to be drooling.>",c="他在撰写这本手册的时候一定是发疯了吧！我和奥玛里恩——我们可是贼世至尊呢！\n\n总而言之，这也为我们开创了新的契机，$n。我现在可以制造更多新样式的物品了——当然，要付一点工资和材料费。",cEN="He musta really been off his rocker when he wrote this! Omarion and I - we were thick as thieves!\n\nAnyhow, this certainly opens up some new possibilities, <name>. I am now able to craft more items - for a small fee and material charges, of course."}
Q[9247]={d="$n，\n\n在过去的日子里，你尽心尽力地为银色黎明做出了杰出的贡献。现在，在这紧要关头，我们再次发出号召。\n\n$n，如果你愿意伸出援手，就去东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂向名单登记员报道吧。",dEN="<name>,\n\nIn times past you have served the interests of the Argent Dawn, always to the best of your abilities. Now, once again, we sound the clarion call in our time of greatest need.\n\n<name>, please report to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands if you are willing to aid us once more.",o="将名单登记员的信交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的名单登记员。",oEN="Take the Letter from the Keeper of the Rolls to him at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="为了只是向你回复征召，我们这可惨了，$n。你们无疑是银色黎明光明的典范，其它人则是更明白、洞察该如何有效抵御天灾军团的入侵！",cEN="Simply by answering the call, we are in your debt, <name>. The Argent Dawn is certain that through your shining example, others that are here to aid us will gain great insight into how best to throw back this Scourge Invasion!"}
Q[9248]={d="Ishnu-alah，$R。让我看看能证明你杀死深渊议会领主的证据，我就奖励你一件好东西，它能在你与其拉虫人作战时帮你一臂之力。",dEN="Ishnu-alah, <race>. Show me proof of the demise of a Lord of the Abyssal Council and I shall reward you with an item that should aid you in your battles against the Qiraji.",o="将一根深渊节杖交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的奥蕾尔·金叶。你在塞纳里奥议会的声望必须达到尊敬。",oEN="Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to bring her 1 Abyssal Scepter. You must also be Honored with the Cenarion Circle.",p="报上名来？喔，请原谅我，$n。我没有认出你来。你拿到节杖了吗？",pEN="Fandu-dath-belore? Oh, pardon me, <name>. I did not recognize you. Have you the scepter?",c="愿你的烦恼减至最低。\n\n骄傲地戴上戒指，希望它保佑你健健康康，平平安安，$n。",cEN="Ande'thoras-ethil. It means; 'May your troubles be diminished,' in my native tongue.\n\nWear the band proudly and in good health, <name>."}
Q[9249]={p="快来，快来！如果你有暗月马戏团的奖券想要兑换，直说就行！不同数量的奖券可以换到各种奇妙精美的奖品。别害羞，$g小伙子:小姑娘;，来试试吧！",pEN="Step right up, step right up! If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!",c="拿去吧，拿去吧！一个最适合$g国王:皇后的奖品！恭喜你，我的朋友！\n\n如果你有更多奖券想要兑换，请告诉我！只要暗月马戏团还在这里，我就会兑换你的奖券。",cEN="Here you go, here you go! A prize fit for a king! Congratulations to you, my friend!\n\nIf you have more tickets you'd like to turn in, then please let me know! For as long as the Darkmoon Faire is here, I'll redeem your tickets."}
Q[9250]={d="合成杖柄之后，从形状上来看，守护者的传说之杖埃提耶什只差法杖顶部和杖柄末端两个部分了。还有个小问题就是：这根杖子蕴涵着萨格拉斯的邪恶力量。\n\n看看有谁能帮你找到残余的法杖碎片并且净化那些邪恶的力量。",dEN="With the frame formed, Atiesh is nearly whole. Only the head and base of the staff are now missing. There is also a minor issue regarding the staff being a conduit for Sargeras's evil.\n\nFind someone that can assist you in locating the remaining pieces and exorcising the evil from the staff.",o="看看有谁能帮你找到法杖的最后两个部分，并且净化邪恶的力量。",oEN="Find someone that will help you in recovering the last two pieces of the staff and ridding it of evil.",p="她的时辰到了，凡人。",pEN="It was her time, mortal.",c="大法师已经死了。\n\n别为他们的死而哀伤，$n。这一切都是命。就好像你手握守护者之杖也是命中注定……",cEN="The archmages have died.\n\nDo not mourn their passing, <name>. All such things are fated. Just as you holding the staff of the Guardian was fated..."}
Q[9251]={d="你很困惑为何自己还活在世上吧。毕竟，你拥有这么一件邪恶的物品。没有确切的答案，$n。我只是做我应该做的事儿罢了。\n\n克尔苏加德就在纳克萨玛斯宫殿的王座上策划着某个阴谋……他要找的东西在你手中，而你要找的东西在他手中。\n\n一位名叫布莱恩·铜须的矮人曾携带杖柄的末端进入安其拉，却不小心将它遗失在了安其拉里面。\n\n一旦你成功拿到杖柄末端，就立即来找我吧。",dEN="You question why you are still alive. After all, you have in your possession an item of great evil. The answer is not clear, <name>. I only do as I must.\n\nKel'Thuzad sits atop his throne in Naxxramas, plotting... He seeks that which you hold and holds that which you seek.\n\nAs for the base of the staff; the dwarf, Brann Bronzebeard, held it when he entered Ahn'Qiraj. He has left Ahn'Qiraj but the base of Atiesh remains.\n\nShould you succeed in recovering the pieces, return them to me.",o="塔纳利斯时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯要你找到埃提耶什的法杖顶部和埃提耶什的杖柄末端。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants the Staff Head of Atiesh and the Base of Atiesh.",p="以现状来看，法杖落在人类手上实在是太危险了。",pEN="In its current form, the staff is far too dangerous to be in the hands of a mortal.",c="里面有一个东西……一个不存在于世界上的东西。",cEN="There is a being within... a being not of this world."}
Q[9252]={d="$n，亡灵天灾的攻击愈发频繁，晴风村薄弱的防御力量已经有些捉襟见肘了，而银月城的援军又迟迟没有消息。死亡之痕里到处都是天灾军团的士兵，去帮我们削减它们的数量吧。",dEN="We've experienced a marked increase in Scourge attacks, <name>. Our defenses are barely holding and there's no sign of reinforcements from Silvermoon City. Lend us a hand in defending the village by thinning the numbers of the undead roaming the Dead Scar nearby.",o="杀死4个腐肢劫掠者和4个黑暗怨灵，然后向永歌森林晴风村的游侠萨蕾恩复命。",oEN="Slay 4 Rotlimb Marauders and 4 Darkwraiths and return to Ranger Sareyn at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods.",p="我们会战胜一切的，$n。",pEN="We will prevail, <name>.",c="非常感谢，$n。这是个吃力不讨好的工作，但今天有你帮忙，实在是让这工作轻松不少。",cEN="Many thanks, <name>. Our job is a thankless one, but today you helped make it a bit easier."}
Q[9253]={d="亡灵天灾的攻击愈发频繁，我怀疑是幽魂之地边界的某块符石出了问题。\n\n这些远古的符石可以抵御天灾士兵的入侵，保护我们的村落。太阳之井遭到攻击时，大多数符石都被摧毁或是遗失了。\n\n沿着南面的道路往幽魂之地的方向前进，拐入道路西边的小径。符文看守者德尔雅就站在符石附近，他会告诉你到底出了什么状况。",dEN="This increase in Scourge attacks leads me to believe there might be a malfunction at one of the protective runestones at the border with the Ghostlands.\n\nWe used these ancient stones to protect us against the undead. Most of them were destroyed or lost after the attack on the Sunwell.\n\nFollow the road south, towards the Ghostlands, and look to the west for a small path. You will find Runewarden Deryan by the runestone nearby; he will know whether anything's wrong.",o="与永歌森林和幽魂之地交界处的符文看守者德尔雅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Runewarden Deryan in Eversong Woods, near the border with the Ghostlands.",c="一定是晴风村的人派你过来。我就知道迟早会有人赶来帮忙。",cEN="You must've been sent by someone at Fairbreeze Village. I knew it would just be a matter of time until help arrived."}
Q[9254]={d="谢谢你的帮忙，$n。在我整顿这里的同时，我想请你帮我一个忙。我以前的一个学徒正在死亡之痕中部的东部圣殿进行一项危险的研究。\n\n我担心她的安危，如果你能找到她，就看她是否还活着，然后回来向我报告她的情况。",dEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. While I get things back in order here, I'd like to ask you for a favor. One of my former apprentices embarked in a very dangerous line of research. She journeyed to the East Sanctum, in the middle of the Dead Scar.\n\nI worry for her well-being. See if you can find her and convince her to return to her senses.",o="与永歌森林东部圣殿的学徒米尔维达谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Apprentice Mirveda at the East Sanctum in Eversong Woods.",c="很高兴听到我的恩师在打听我的消息。不过遗憾的是，她很久以前就对我的研究失去信心。\n\n不要浪费你的时间说服我回到她身边了，你要不就帮我做研究，不然就离开。",cEN="It's so nice of my old mentor to check on me. It's too bad she lost faith in my research long ago.\n\nDon't waste your time trying to get me to return to her; you can either help me with my research or leave."}
Q[9255]={d="虽然研究结果令人气馁，但是我在研究笔记中记录的数据还是很有价值的。我想听听导师对这些数据的意见。到西边的晴风村去，把笔记交给魔导师兰德拉·晨行者。",dEN="As discouraging as my research results are, they still contain valuable data. I must have a magister review my work before it is taken seriously. Please, take these notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village, west of here.",o="将研究笔记交给永歌森林晴风村的魔导师兰德拉·晨行者。",oEN="Deliver the Research Notes to Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You've something for me?",c="这份资料……令人震惊。如果它们是正确的，那么就表示死亡之痕的伤害是无法补救了。\n\n我会立刻通知大魔导师，这样就有更多的理由要让我们的种族逃离这个世界并了解在外域中的真正命运。",cEN="These notes... are shocking. If they're correct it means the damage to the land on the Dead Scar is irreversible.\n\nI'll notify the grand magister right away. More reason for our race to escape this world and find our true fate in Outland."}
Q[9256]={d="我想请你帮我完成另一个任务，$n。游侠戴戈利恩被派往晴风村去调查一起失心者袭击附近船坞的事。他要求增派援手，但当前我们人手不够。去找到他，尽你所能地帮助他。\n\n沿着鹰翼广场外的路一直往南走就可以到达晴风村了，祝你好运，$n。",dEN="I have another task for you, <name>. Ranger Degolien was sent to Fairbreeze Village to find out more about a Wretched attack on a nearby shipyard. He has requested reinforcements which we cannot yet provide. Seek him out and grant him whatever aid you can.\n\nFairbreeze Village can be reached by following the road out of Falconwing Square all the way towards the south. Good luck, <name>.",o="与永歌森林晴风村的游侠戴戈利恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ranger Degolien at Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods.",c="谢谢你特地前来，$n。事情进展比我们预期的糟。失心者已夺下整个阳帆湾。",cEN="Thanks for coming, <name>. Things are worse than we had anticipated. The Wretched have taken over Sunsail Anchorage in its entirety."}
Q[9257]={d="艰巨的任务总在最后，$n。你已经击败了一位上古之神和一位巫妖王的大将，现在是面对萨格拉斯的时候了。\n\n带上这根杖子转至斯坦索姆。你会在那儿发现一处神圣之地：洛丹伦最伟大的骑士们的埋骨之处。将这柄被玷污的传说之杖放在神圣之地中，准备好挑战被驱赶出法杖的可怕生物……击败控制着法杖的恶魔，然后再回来找我。",dEN="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",o="塔纳利斯时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯要你转至斯坦索姆，在神圣之地上使用埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。击败被驱赶出法杖的生物，然后回到阿纳克洛斯那里去。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him."}
Q[9258]={d="随着土壤中污染源的不断扩散，亡灵天灾将魔爪伸向了新的区域。过去，我们靠幽魂之地边界处的远古符石抵御侵略者，保护村落。\n\n天灾士兵在一次攻势中摧毁了最西边的符石，于是我们不得不焚毁符石四周的土地，阻止污染源扩散。\n\n我的姐妹拉莉亚娜·河风驻守在焦痕谷。去找她吧，或许她需要你的帮助。",dEN="A foul taint in the soil precedes the expansion of the Scourge into a new area. The protective runestones along the border with the Ghostlands have warded the land against this taint in the past.\n\nThe westernmost runestone was destroyed during a Scourge attack, which forced us to burn the ground around it to prevent the taint from spreading.\n\nMy sister, Larianna Riverwind, watches over the Scorched Grove. Go find her; she might have some work for you.",o="转至永歌森林西南方的焦痕谷寻找拉莉亚娜·河风。",oEN="Find Larianna Riverwind near the Scorched Grove in the southwest of Eversong Woods.",c="啊，是我哥把你派来了。我这里当然有需要你协助的任务。",cEN="Ah, my brother sent you. I do have a task I could use assistance with."}
Q[9259]={d="那条癞皮狗雷维尔加兹放出话来，只要以前的血帆海盗肯背叛船长，就赦免他们的罪！那混蛋让我去干掉我那些老伙计，还要把他们的头巾带回来当凭证。",dEN="That mangy dog, Revilgaz, has offered to pardon any former Bloodsails willing to turn on their cap'n! That bilge sucker asked me to go an' off me ole' mates and to bring back their bandannas as proof.",p="那条癞皮狗雷维尔加兹放出话来，只要以前的血帆海盗肯背叛船长，就赦免他们的罪！那混蛋让我去干掉我那些老伙计，还要把他们的头巾带回来当凭证。\n\n我实在狠不下这个心，也不会让你去做。给我带些丝绸布料和红色染料来，我来做几条像样的仿制品。我会告诉男爵你$g成了叛徒:成了叛徒;，但你得小心……血帆海盗可不会喜欢！",pEN="That mangy dog, Revilgaz, has offered to pardon any former Bloodsails willing to turn on their cap'n! That bilge sucker asked me to go an' off me ole' mates and to bring back their bandannas as proof.\n\nI don't have it in me heart to do that, nor will I ask ye to. Bring me some silk cloth and red dye and I'll make suitable replicas. I'll tell the Baron you went turncoat, but be warned... the Bloodsails are not gonna like it!",c="让我们为这些阵亡的朋友哀悼，$n。\n\n<血帆背叛者对你咧嘴笑了笑，使了个眼色。>\n\n当一个背叛者是一回事，杀死你自己的兄弟……那才是真正可鄙的事！",cEN="Let us observe a minute of silence for our fallen mates, <name>.\n\n<The Bloodsail Traitor grins at you and winks.>\n\nBeing a traitor is one thing, murdering yer own buckos... that'd be just downright despicable, aye!"}
Q[9260]={d="巫妖王的部队已经在我们鼻子底下扎了营，我们可不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫暴风城的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend Stormwind from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从暴风城外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查天灾营地附近的发光符文法阵。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside Stormwind and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment.",c="嗯。照你所说，法阵里的那些声音……一定是用于某种交流。一想到通过这种魔法联系上的是何等违背自然的头脑，我就不寒而栗。不管怎样，你似乎$g完好:完好;而$g清醒:清醒;地走了出来。银色黎明感谢你的效力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[9265]={d="天灾士兵们在主城外扎了营，我们不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫幽暗城的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend the Undercity from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从幽暗城外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查营地附近的发光的符文法阵。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside the Undercity and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment.",c="嗯。照你所说，法阵里的那些声音……一定是用于某种交流。一想到通过这种魔法联系上的是何等违背自然的头脑，我就不寒而栗。不管怎样，你似乎$g清醒:清醒;地走了出来。银色黎明感谢你的效力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[9266]={p="你一定是对我们或我们的朋友做了什么可怕的事，$n。无论如何，我是来提供你一个方法赢回我们的好感。\n\n你知道，冬泉谷还满冷的。我们有这么多的地精从别的城市过来，需要一些帮忙来保持温暖。帮我带一些符文布和煤炭来我就会帮你说点好话。不过要小心，我们的敌人不会对你的帮忙产生好感的。",pEN="You must've done something really bad to us or our friends, <name>. At any rate, I'm here to offer you a way to get our good graces back.\n\nAs you know, Winterspring is quite cold. With so many of us goblins coming from other cities, we could use a hand keeping warm. Bring me some runecloth and coal and I'll put in the good word for ya. Be warned though, our enemies are not going to take kindly to your helping us.",c="谢谢你，$n。你很快就重拾我们城镇对你的好感了。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You're on a quick path to redeeming yourself with our fair town."}
Q[9267]={p="你最好三思之后再踏进棘齿城，$n！你那些肮脏勾当的传言已经传开了。\n\n不过你运气不错，刚有一艘船靠岸，船上全是从血帆海盗手里逃出来的伤员。这是你证明自己还不算$g彻头彻尾的恶棍:彻头彻尾的恶棍;的机会。帮我们一把，带些亚麻布来做绷带，再带些空瓶来装药水。",pEN="You'd better think twice before setting foot in Ratchet, <name>! Word's been getting around of your dirty deeds.\n\nYou're in luck though, a ship just arrived with many wounded from an encounter with the Bloodsail Buccaneers. This is your chance to prove you're not a complete scoundrel. Lend us a hand by bringing linen cloth for bandages and empty vials for potions.",c="很高兴看到你认识到自己的错误，$n。补给继续送来吧；我们可不会那么容易就把你忘了，$g先生:女士;！",cEN="I'm happy you're seeing the error of your ways, <name>. Keep the supplies coming; we're not going to forget about you so easily, <mister/miss>!"}
Q[9268]={p="你是想再次$g和:和;塔纳利斯的地精交朋友吗，$n？我们需要制作船帆和火炮的材料，好对抗我们的老对头血帆海盗。给我带些魔纹布和强效助熔剂来，我们就能着手赦免你的过错了。",pEN="You seek to befriend the goblins of Tanaris once again, <name>? We're in need of materials for sails and guns to fight off our old enemies, the Bloodsail Buccaneers. Bring me mageweave and strong flux and we'll be on our way to pardoning your trespasses.",c="继续保持，$n。我们地精没那么健忘！",cEN="Keep it coming, <name>. Us goblins don't forget that easily!"}
Q[9269]={d="艰巨的任务总在最后，$n。你已经击败了一位上古之神和一位巫妖王的大将，现在是面对萨格拉斯的时候了。\n\n带上这根杖子转至斯坦索姆。你会在那儿发现一处神圣之地：洛丹伦最伟大的骑士们的埋骨之处。将这柄被玷污的传说之杖放在神圣之地中，准备好挑战被驱赶出法杖的可怕生物……击败控制着法杖的恶魔，然后再回来找我。",dEN="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",o="塔纳利斯时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯要你转至斯坦索姆，在神圣之地上使用埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。击败被驱赶出法杖的生物，然后回到阿纳克洛斯那里去。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him."}
Q[9270]={d="艰巨的任务总在最后，$n。你已经击败了一位上古之神和一位巫妖王的大将，现在是面对萨格拉斯的时候了。\n\n带上这根杖子前往斯坦索姆。你会在那儿发现一处神圣之地：洛丹伦最伟大的骑士们的埋骨之处。将这柄被玷污的传说之杖放在神圣之地中，准备好挑战被驱赶出法杖的可怕生物……击败控制着法杖的恶魔，然后再回来找我。",dEN="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",o="塔纳利斯时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯要你前往斯坦索姆，在神圣之地上使用埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。击败被驱赶出法杖的生物，然后回到阿纳克洛斯那里去。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him."}
Q[9271]={d="艰巨的任务总在最后，$n。你已经击败了一位上古之神和一位巫妖王的大将，现在是面对萨格拉斯的时候了。\n\n带上这根杖子转至斯坦索姆。你会在那儿发现一处神圣之地：洛丹伦最伟大的骑士们的埋骨之处。将这柄被玷污的传说之杖放在神圣之地中，准备好挑战被驱赶出法杖的可怕生物……击败控制着法杖的恶魔，然后再回来找我。",dEN="This final task will be the most difficult of all, <name>. You have faced and defeated both an Old God and the Lich King's General, but now you must face the hand of Sargeras.\n\nTake the staff to Stratholme. It is there that you will find a piece of consecrated earth: ground where the greatest knights of Lordaeron were murdered. Place the befouled staff upon the holy ground and prepare for an entity of immense power to break from within... Defeat the demonic being that controls the staff and return to me.",o="塔纳利斯时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯要你转至斯坦索姆，在神圣之地上使用埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖。击败被驱赶出法杖的生物，然后回到阿纳克洛斯那里去。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants you to take Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian to Stratholme and use it on Consecrated Earth. Defeat the entity that is exorcised from the staff and return to him."}
Q[9272]={c="呀……如果你真的那么想加入我们老练水手的行列，你最好穿的像个水手一点！来，在我严责你之前快穿上适当的服饰。\n\n它们穿在你身上比穿在红眼阿班那个老家伙身上适合多了。他死在海上的一场暴风雨里。\n\n骄傲的穿着它吧，朋友！",cEN="Yarrr... if ye be keen on enjoying the company of us experienced sea dogs, you'd best belay dressing like a blaggard! Here, put on something proper 'fore I keelhaul yer hide.\n\nThese'll fit ye better than they ever fit that old dog, Red-Eyed Ben. Lost him in a devil of a storm at sea.\n\nWear 'em with pride, mate!"}
Q[9274]={d="$n，从我记事起，北边的湖泊就一直有先祖的鬼魂出没。那是一场悲惨的灾难，很多人被活活溺死，他们的灵魂仍在世间飘荡。\n\n虽然族人们对那场灾变的记忆已经模糊，但是湖边凄凉的哭泣声似乎在述说着他们被诅咒的命运。\n\n$n，如果你愿意接受这项任务，就去湖边结束他们的痛苦吧。我想……他们和我都会感激你的。",dEN="The lake to the north has been haunted by the ghosts of my ancestors for as long as I can remember, <name>. The poor souls were victims of a tragic incident in which scores of them drowned at the bottom of the lake.\n\nThe details of the event are mostly forgotten, but their haunting cries serve as a constant reminder of their curse.\n\nIf you're up to the task, I want you to go to the lake and put an end to their suffering, <name>. You will have my gratitude as well as theirs... I'm sure.",o="在附近的湖泊周围杀死8个复仇的幽灵和8个贪婪的幽灵，然后向远行者营地的游侠克雷安复命。",oEN="Ranger Krenn'an, at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands, wants you to kill 8 Vengeful Apparitions and 8 Ravening Apparitions in the nearby lake.",p="你完成了我要你做的事吗，$n？",pEN="You've done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="我感谢你的帮助，$n。看到祖先们的灵魂处于那样可怜的状态我就很痛苦。愿他们终于获得应得的安息。",cEN="I appreciate your help, <name>. It pains me to see the spirits of my ancestors in their pitiful state. May they finally get the rest they deserve."}
Q[9275]={d="我奉命从塔奎林来到远行者营地对付巨魔，而且我很快就想到了一个好法子。\n\n炼制一批强效毒药对我来说容易得很。你知道，巨魔这种生物总归要进食的吧，如果在他们的食物中投毒……唔，那一定非常有趣！\n\n你愿意帮我们消灭南面塞布努瓦的暗松巨魔吗？他们的营地分布在通往祖阿曼的道路的南北两侧。",dEN="I'm on loan to the Farstriders in an attempt to help with their troll difficulties. I believe that I have a solution to their problem.\n\nAt my disposal are a number of potent poisons. The trolls, as you know, are living creatures and therefore must eat. If we combine my poison with their food... well, I'm sure that the results will be entertaining!\n\nCare to help rid us of the Shadowpine trolls at Zeb'Nowa to the south? The camp straddles both the north and south sides of the road to Zul'Aman.",o="转至塞布努瓦的巨魔营地，给他们的食物中投毒，然后向远行者营地的药剂师温努图斯复命。",oEN="Poison the Troll foodstuff at the camps in Zeb'Nowa and then return to Apothecary Venustus at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="这难道不令人兴奋吗？我确实为自己的工作深感自豪；希望你能欣赏，$c。\n\n那么，我相信你已经给泽布诺瓦那些巨魔营地的食物“加了料”？",pEN="Isn't this exciting? I really do take great pride in my work; I hope you appreciate it, <class>.\n\nSo, I trust that you have 'seasoned' the food at the troll camps in Zeb'Nowa?",c="啊，太好了！我就知道把任务交给$g一位:一位;$r来执行，效率必定最高。运气好的话，暗松巨魔会先吃得膘肥体壮再倒毙。这样他们就不会再缠着游侠们，我也能回塔奎林了。\n\n跟你合作很愉快，$c！",cEN="Ah, excellent! I knew that a <race>-delivery system would make for the most efficient application of the poison. With any luck the Shadowpine trolls will get fat on it before keeling over. That should get them off of the backs of the Farstriders, and me back to Tranquillien.\n\nIt has been a pleasure working with you, <class>!"}
Q[9276]={d="$c，远行者营地的兵力相当分布，我们迫切需要你的帮助。我奉命骚扰附近的暗松巨魔营地。根据作战计划，不能让暗松巨魔有任何喘息的机会，要闹得他们不得安宁，然后再伺机发动反攻，将这帮家伙统统消灭。\n\n因此，我们需要所有冒险者伸出援手，帮我们削减巨魔的数量。\n\n你愿意转至东边的塞布提拉，给巨魔们一点苦头吃吗？",dEN="Our resources are spread pretty thin here, <class>, so your help is going to be invaluable. The captain has tasked me with overseeing the harassment of the local Shadowpine troll camps. We have a policy of keeping them off balance until the day when we can launch a brutal offensive to wipe them out.\n\nUntil then, we need all of the volunteers that we can get so that those Shadowpine troll numbers are decreased.\n\nThink you could head east to Zeb'Tela and hurt them a little?",o="杀死8个暗松影法师和8个暗松猎头者，然后向远行者营地的远行者索兰娜复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Shadowpine Shadowcasters and 8 Shadowpine Headhunters, and return to Farstrider Solanna at Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="你在札布泰拉的攻击行动进行的怎么样了？",pEN="How are you doing with the attack on Zeb'Tela?",c="很好，很好！你处理的非常好，让我们来看看你能否接下更困难一点的任务。",cEN="Good, good! You handled that very well! Let's see if you're up to something a little more difficult now."}
Q[9277]={d="接下来的这项任务稍微有点挑战性。南边的塞布努瓦聚集了一批更强的暗松巨魔。我们要继续削减巨魔的数量；因此，我派你转至塞布努瓦对付暗松巨魔，随便你用什么方法，杀死他们就成。\n\n$n，怎么样？你准备好了吗？",dEN="Time for something a little more challenging. Zeb'Nowa, to the south, is where the more powerful Shadowpine trolls make their home. In our continuing effort to keep the troll numbers to a minimum I'm dispatching you to go down there and assail them by whatever means you have at your disposal.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? Ready to deal with some more trolls?",o="杀死10个暗松驭豹者和10个暗松妖术师，然后向远行者营地的远行者索兰娜复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Shadowpine Catlords and 10 Shadowpine Hexxers, and return to Farstrider Solanna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",p="你在札布诺瓦的攻击完成了吗？",pEN="Is your assault on Zeb'Nowa complete already?",c="不可思议！你真的应该和队长谈谈加入远行者的事！\n\n好了，$n，你已给了我们需要的空间喘口气，继续增强我们的军力。事实上，依据你的估计根本没有那么多巨魔！或许我们现在可以加入塔奎林攻打死亡之域的行列？\n\n我想你有获得一些经验吧。拿去，这是你的奖赏。",cEN="Unbelievable! You really should talk to the captain about joining up as a Farstrider.\n\nAlright, <name>, you've given us the breathing room that we need to continue building up our forces here. Actually, by your account there aren't many of those trolls left at all! Maybe now we can join with Tranquillien and attack Deatholme?\n\nI think you've earned a little something. Take your pick."}
Q[9278]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为特别感谢你购买《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼品券交给碧蓝岗哨的雅艾莱尔。你会得到一份礼物：一个小伙伴，它将陪伴你踏上追寻冒险与荣耀的旅程。\n\n再次感谢，祝你在《魔兽世界》中玩得愉快！|n",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Jaeleil in Azure Watch. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将碧蓝岗哨礼品券交给碧蓝岗哨的亚埃雷尔。",oEN="Bring the Azure Watch Gift Voucher to Jaeleil in Azure Watch.",p="您好！很高兴见到您！\n\n我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品！",pEN="Greetings! It is a pleasure to meet you!\n\nI see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="你确实是一位$g特别的英雄:特别的英雄;，$n。我们欢迎你来到艾泽拉斯世界，并送给你这些独一无二的礼物之一！",cEN="You are indeed a special hero, <name>. We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts!"}
Q[9279]={d="别管我的伤势了，$g兄弟:姐妹。我们当中有任何人能够活下来，就已经是个奇迹了！\n\n看来你对当前的情况并不是很清楚，毕竟你一直休眠了好几周的时间。\n\n迁跃的途中发生了一些事，埃索达也因此坠毁了。许多人都已经死了。\n\n但我一直确信你还活着，$n。有你在为我们努力的话，我想我们的情况很快就能转危为安的！普罗尼图斯让我在你醒了之后把你叫去他那里，他就在山脚下等着你呢。沿路向西南走过去就可以找到他了。",dEN="Nevermind my injuries, <brother /sister>. It's a miracle that any of us are alive!\n\nIt didn't look like you'd pull through; you've been in suspension for weeks.\n\nSomething happened and the Exodar crashed. Many have died.\n\nBut I'm relieved that you are alive, <name>. With you leading our efforts, I'm sure we'll get to safety soon! Proenitus asked me to send you to him when you awoke. He's waiting for you at the bottom of the hill. Just follow the path southwest.",o="与埃门谷坠毁点的普罗尼图斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Proenitus at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",c="$n，以我永恒的灵魂之名，见到你真好！我不知道为什么埃索达会失事。只有这部分船上的我们还活着。\n\n如果我们要救所有能救的人时间就不多了！",cEN="<name>, by my eternal soul, it is good to see you! I don't know why the Exodar crashed. Only those of us that were in this part of the ship remain.\n\nThere's not much time if we're to save everyone that we can!"}
Q[9280]={d="我们当前最紧迫的问题就是，治疗水晶的存量已经几乎为零了。我们必须立刻补充这种水晶。\n\n但糟糕的是，当前补充水晶的唯一可行办法就是从周围的蛾类生物血液中分解出有用的物质，因为它们的血液中含有某种非常合适的替换品。\n\n这些蛾类生物在谷中遍地都是，西北方更加集中一些。",dEN="Our immediate concern is the depleted state of our healing crystals. We must replenish them quickly!\n\nUnfortunately, the only way to do this at this point is to extract the blood from the local vale moths. Their blood will make for a suitable substitute.\n\nThe moths can be found in many places around the vale, but they are mostly concentrated in the northwest.",o="从附近的峡谷蛾身上取得8瓶蛾血，然后将它们交给埃门谷坠毁点的普罗尼图斯。",oEN="Acquire 8 Vials of Moth Blood from the nearby Vale Moths and give them to Proenitus at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="$n，你为治疗水晶采集到所需的蛾血了吗？幸存者散布在整个山谷里，时间紧迫！",pEN="<name>, have you harvested the necessary moth blood for the healing crystals yet? With survivors scattered all over the vale, time is of the essence!",c="真令人遗憾，那些生物必须死亡才能让我们生存下去——不分青红皂白的杀戮不是我们德莱尼人的作风。不过，你所收集的血清会补充我们的治疗水晶，所以它们不会死得毫无价值。",cEN="Regrettable that those creatures had to die so that we might live - indiscriminate killing is not the draenei way. However, the blood you gathered will replenish our healing crystals, so their deaths will not be in vain."}
Q[9281]={d="魔导师坎迪瑞斯派我来这里猎杀那些具有攻击性的野生动物。如果能解除这些家伙构成的威胁，我们就准备在这块地方创建一座前哨站，监视亡灵天灾的动向。\n\n要说我在做学徒时学会了什么诀窍，那就是把事情委托给别人来做——尤其是那些有生命危险的事情！\n\n如果你感兴趣的话，就去西边和南边猎杀巨型纺丝蜘蛛和鬼爪破坏者，我会给你一笔不小的报酬。",dEN="Magister Kaendris sent me down here to clear the area of any hostile wildlife. Once this area is secured, the magisters plan to turn it into some sort of advance outpost against the Scourge.\n\nNow if there's one thing I've learned as an apprentice it's to delegate responsibility - especially in matters that endanger one's life!\n\nIf you're interested, I'll pay you well to kill the greater spindlewebs and ghostclaw ravagers to the west and south of here.",o="杀死10只巨型纺丝蜘蛛和10只鬼爪破坏者，然后向幽魂之地安迪尔林庄园的学徒沃尔伊复命。",oEN="Apprentice Vor'el at Andilien Estate in the Ghostlands wants you to slay 10 Greater Spindlewebs and 10 Ghostclaw Ravagers.",p="你完成了我要你去做的任务吗，$n？",pEN="Did you take care of the business we discussed, <name>?",c="谢谢你帮我的忙，$n。想到要冒险通过离死亡之域这么近的树林真是令人害怕。",cEN="Thanks for giving me a hand, <name>. I was dreading the thought of venturing into the woods this close to Deatholme."}
Q[9282]={d="$n，魔导师和远行者不可能随时保持看法一致。但是说到达尔坎，我们都认为必须设法击败他和他的军团。\n\n东北方远行者营地的游侠维恩娜掌握了敌人的重要信息。去跟她谈谈，看看能不能帮上忙。",dEN="Magisters and Farstriders may not see eye to eye all the time, <name>. When it comes to Dar'Khan, however, we're all in agreement that a way must be found to defeat him and his legions.\n\nRanger Vynna, at the Farstrider Enclave northeast of here, has come across important information regarding our enemy. Speak to her and see if you can be of assistance.",o="太阳圣殿的魔导师坎迪瑞斯要你去跟幽魂之地远行者营地的游侠维恩娜谈一谈。",oEN="Magister Kaendris, at the Sanctum of the Sun, wants you to talk to Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave in the Ghostlands.",c="坎德立斯派你来的？我有个任务要交给你，$c。",cEN="Kaendris sent you? I might have a task for you, <class>."}
Q[9283]={d="治疗水晶已经重新充满了，但这不是我们帮助伤者的唯一办法。所有德莱尼人都能运用纳鲁的赐福来治疗。你必须用这项能力，或其他治疗法术，去救治一位坠机幸存者。\n\n你会发现大多数幸存者都在西面和西北面的区域，不过坠机把我们都散落到了整个山谷各处。\n\n幸存者受到了辐射能量水晶的影响，所以你可以凭环绕他们的红色光晕找到他们。\n\n你必须救他们，$n。",dEN="The healing crystals are replenished, but that is not the only way we can help the injured. All draenei can tap the gift of the Naaru to heal. You must use this or other healing ability to heal one of the crash survivors.\n\nYou'll find most of the survivors in the areas to the west and northwest, but the crash scattered us all over the vale.\n\nThe survivors have suffered from exposure to the irradiated power crystals, so you should be able to find them by the red glow that surround them.\n\nYou must save them, <name>.",o="对遍布埃门谷的德莱尼幸存者之一使用你的纳鲁的赐福或其他治疗能力，然后回到埃门谷坠机地点向扎尔杜恩复命。",oEN="Use your Gift of the Naaru or other healing ability on one of the Draenei Survivors spread throughout Ammen Vale, then return to Zalduun at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="有你的帮忙我们会安然度过！",pEN="We'll survive this yet with your help.",c="赞美圣光！你完成了一个真正的$g英雄:女英雄会做的事，$n！你拯救的那个德莱尼，能够延续生命，都靠你无私的奉献！\n\n请收下这个补给包。你看起来比我需要它。",cEN="The Light be praised! You've done what only a true <hero /heroine> could have done, <name>! The draenei you saved owes their continued life to your selflessness!\n\nPlease, take this supply pouch. You look like you can use it more than I."}
Q[9292]={d="你在憎恶的尸体上找到一块散发着腐坏能量的破碎水晶。",dEN="On the corpse of the fallen abomination, you discover a cracked crystal, slowly pulsing with necrotic energy.",o="将破碎的死灵水晶交给暴风城门外的奥林中尉。",oEN="Bring the Cracked Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Orrin outside the gates of Stormwind.",p="你需要协助吗？",pEN="Is there something you need?",c="嗯，你从一具受到憎恨侵袭的尸体身上取得这项物品？\n\n我们已听说天灾军团召唤亡域基础营地的事。我猜他们想在暴风城里也造一个。很好，这样他们就等着迎接失败吧。",cEN="Hm, you took this from the corpse of one of the invading abominations?\n\nWe have received word about the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they wanted to create one inside Stormwind. It is good that they were unseccessful."}
Q[9293]={d="有一块从船体中脱离出来的能量水晶掉落入了附近的一处湖泊中，污染了湖水。埃门谷中的许多植物与动物都因此而受到了辐射的影响，产生了变异。\n\n我当前构思出了一个方法，或许可以消除湖水的污染，但我必须首先进行一些分析实验，这需要一些变异鞭笞者的样本进行分析。在西边的埃门平原一带就可以找到这些变异生物。\n\n你愿意帮我采集一些样本回来吗，$c？",dEN="The nearby lake has been contaminated by one of the ship's power crystals. Many of the plants and animals of Ammen Vale have been mutated because of this.\n\nI have a theory on how to heal the lake, but I must have samples from the mutated lashers for analysis. They can be found to the west in the Ammen Fields.\n\nWill you help me, <class>?",o="收集10份鞭笞者样本，把它们交给埃门谷坠毁点的植物学家塔蕾克丝。",oEN="Gather 10 Lasher Samples and return them to Botanist Taerix at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="要想有机会净化这座湖，我需要所有样本都保持完好。\n\n我们的时间不多了，$c！",pEN="I'll need all of the samples in good condition if we're to have a chance of cleansing the lake.\n\nWe don't have much time, <class>!",c="这些样本很不错。谢谢你，$c！\n\n你出去的时候，我设法找到了一些器材来分析样本。应该不会花太久的时间。",cEN="These will do. Thank you, <class>!\n\nWhile you were out, I managed to gather some equipment together to make an analysis of the samples. This should only take a moment."}
Q[9294]={d="谢天谢地，我想这应该是有效的！我现在给你一份中和媒介，你要将它洒在南方的银链湖中。它将中和能量水晶所产生的辐射效果。\n\n到了湖边之后，你需要游进湖里去，将中和媒介倒在水晶周围。不用担心，你不会在辐射下暴露很长时间的。",dEN="Thank goodness, I think it'll work! I have an agent for you to spread at Silverline Lake to the south. It will neutralize the effects of the irradiated ship's power crystal that fell there.\n\nSwim out and scatter the neutralizing agent near it. Don't worry, you won't be exposed long enough to become irradiated.",o="将中和媒介散布在辐射能量水晶旁，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的植物学家塔蕾克丝复命。",oEN="Disperse the Neutralizing Agent at the Irradiated Power Crystal, then return to Botanist Taerix at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="你将中和剂洒在湖里的速度越快，就会有越少的生物因为喝了湖水而产生突变——包括我们！\n\n很遗憾我们对已经被感染的生物束手无策，要是我的实验器材还完整就好了。",pEN="The sooner you disperse the agent at the lake, the fewer native creatures that will be mutated by drinking the water, including ourselves!\n\nI'm sorry that we can't do anything to help the poor creatures that have already been infected. If only my lab equipment were intact.",c="从你所描述的听来，中和剂发挥作用了！我只希望我能知道它会维持多久，我们真的需要把那个能量水晶从湖里整个删除。\n\n谢谢你，$n！我会要泰顿立刻在俘虏的野兽身上试试中和剂。",cEN="From what you describe, the neutralizing agent worked! I just wish that I knew how long it will last; we really need to remove that power crystal from the lake entirely.\n\nThank you, <name>! I will tell Tedon to try the neutralizing agent on one of the captured beasts at once."}
Q[9295]={d="你在某个天灾士兵的尸体上找到了这封信。破旧发黄的信纸散发着霉臭，看来它在亡灵手里已经有些日子了。或许圣光之愿礼拜堂的家伙会对此感兴趣的……",dEN="You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...",o="将被撕碎的信交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的名单登记员。",oEN="Take the Torn Letter to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="多悲哀啊。这些话语，清楚的是要传达给某个士兵深爱的人，只是它永远也到不了目的地了。里面写的事情是多年前发生的，我不确定原本的收件者是否还活着。\n\n不过，还是有希望。有他写的名字和讯息，我大概可以找到那户人家！需要一点时间调查，不过暴风城的图书馆员还欠我个人情……\n\n谢谢你把这个带来给我。有你的帮忙，我们终于能让某人的心灵得到平静。",cEN="How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.\n\nThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...\n\nThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last."}
Q[9299]={d="你在杀掉的众多天谴军团爪牙其中一人身上找到这封信。从它的样子和气味判断，它已经和不死族在一起一些日子了。或许圣光之愿礼拜堂的某人会对它有兴趣进而好好的研究它...",dEN="You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...",o="将干净的便条带到东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂交给名册保管者。",oEN="Take the Careworn Note to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="什么事吗？你手里拿着的是什么？",pEN="Yes? What do you have there?",c="真悲惨。这些显然是写给士兵所爱之人的话，却始终没能送达。信中详述的事情发生在多年前；我不确定收信人是否还在世。\n\n不过还有希望。凭他留下的姓名和信息，我也许能找到他的家人！这需要做些查证，但暴风城的图书管理员欠我一个人情……\n\n谢谢你把这个带来给我。有你的帮助，我们也许终能给某人一份心安。",cEN="How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.\n\nThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...\n\nThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last."}
Q[9300]={d="你在某个天灾士兵的尸体上找到了这封信。破旧发黄的信纸散发着霉臭，看来它在亡灵手里已经有些日子了。或许圣光之愿礼拜堂的家伙会对此感兴趣的……",dEN="You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...",o="将破旧的信交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的名单登记员。",oEN="Take the Ragged Page to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="多悲哀啊。这些话语，清楚的是要传达给某个士兵深爱的人，只是它永远也到不了目的地了。里面写的事情是多年前发生的，我不确定原本的收件者是否还活着。\n\n不过，还是有希望。有他写的名字和讯息，我大概可以找到那户人家！需要一点时间调查，不过暴风城的图书馆员还欠我个人情……\n\n谢谢你把这个带来给我。有你的帮忙，我们终于能让某人的心灵得到平静。",cEN="How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.\n\nThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...\n\nThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last."}
