Q[9302]={d="你在某个天灾士兵的尸体上找到了这封信。破旧发黄的信纸散发着霉臭，看来它在亡灵手里已经有些日子了。或许圣光之愿礼拜堂的家伙会对此感兴趣的……",dEN="You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...",o="将被弄皱的信交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的名单登记员。",oEN="Take the Crumpled Missive to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="多悲哀啊。这些话语，清楚的是要传达给某个士兵深爱的人，只是它永远也到不了目的地了。里面写的事情是多年前发生的，我不确定原本的收件者是否还活着。\n\n不过，还是有希望。有他写的名字和讯息，我大概可以找到那户人家！需要一点时间调查，不过暴风城的图书馆员还欠我个人情……\n\n谢谢你把这个带来给我。有你的帮忙，我们终于能让某人的心灵得到平静。",cEN="How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.\n\nThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...\n\nThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last."}
Q[9303]={d="沙娜安需要我们帮她回收一些埃索达的零件。塔蕾克丝准备了一个接种装置，它可以让生活在附近这片地区的木巢枭兽得到拯救。\n\n你只需靠近那些尚未被辐射影响到的枭兽，然后对它们使用这枚水晶就可以了。而那些已经被辐射影响的枭兽……很遗憾，你只能杀死它们。到东南方的木巢山去，枭兽们就居住在那里的木巢林地中。",dEN="Zhanaa needs our help to salvage parts from the Exodar. Taerix prepared an inoculum that can be given to the Nestlewood owlkin that live in the area of a lot of the salvage.\n\nJust get close to the unaffected ones and use the crystal on them. Unfortunately, you'll have to kill the others. You'll find the owlkin at Nestlewood Thicket and Nestlewood Hills to the southeast.",o="对6只木巢枭兽使用疫苗水晶，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的守备官奥达尔复命。",oEN="Use the Inoculating Crystal on 6 Nestlewood Owlkin. Then return to Vindicator Aldar at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="你已经给枭兽注射完疫苗了吗？",pEN="The more we can do to clear up Nestlewood, the faster Zhanaa can get back to work.",c="许多枭兽已经接种完毕，我们可以专心离开这里了，不必再担心会把这个地区的枭兽族群赶尽杀绝。\n\n来，从这些里面挑吧。你干得很好，理应$g得到奖赏:得到奖赏;！",cEN="With many of the owlkin now inoculated, we can focus on getting out of here and not have to worry about wiping out the owlkin population in the area.\n\nHere, choose from these. You've done good work, and you deserve to be rewarded!"}
Q[9304]={d="你在杀掉的众多天谴军团爪牙其中一人身上找到这封信。从它的样子和气味判断，它已经和不死族在一起一些日子了。或许圣光之愿礼拜堂的某人会对它有兴趣进而好好的研究它……",dEN="You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...",o="将弄脏的文件带到东瘟疫之地的圣光礼拜堂交给名册保管者。",oEN="Take the Smudged Document to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="什么事吗？你手里拿着的是什么？",pEN="Yes? What do you have there?",c="多悲哀啊。这些话语，清楚的是要传达给某个士兵深爱的人，只是它永远也到不了目的地了。里面写的事情是多年前发生的，我不确定原本的收件者是否还活着。\n\n不过，还是有希望。有他写的名字和讯息，我大概可以找到那户人家！需要一点时间调查，不过暴风城的图书馆员还欠我个人情……\n\n谢谢你把这个带来给我。有你的帮忙，我们终于能让某人的心灵得到平静。",cEN="How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.\n\nThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...\n\nThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last."}
Q[9305]={d="我们最近成功地从坠毁地区回收了一个已经损坏的全息图象发射器。如果我们能把它修好，就有机会找到其它在埃门谷之外的幸存者了。\n\n埃索达坠毁时，有些备用零件也散落出了船外。本来我们可以迅速回收的，可它们现在被这一地区的枭兽全部运走了。\n\n$n，你必须立刻到南方的木巢林地和木巢山去，回收那些备用零件。",dEN="We managed to recover a damaged holographic emitter from the crash. If we repair it, we'll have a chance to find other survivors outside of Ammen Vale.\n\nThere were devices from the ship that could be salvaged for spare parts in the area, but the local owlkin carried them off before we could get to them.\n\n<name>, you must go south to Nestlewood Thicket and Hills to find the spare parts.",o="收集4份发射器备用零件，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的技师沙娜安复命。",oEN="Collect 4 Emitter Spare Parts and then return to Technician Zhanaa at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="等我们收集完那些备用零件，我相信我们就能修好这个发射器。幸运的话，还可以跟留在那边的人谈话。",pEN="When we have those spare parts, I know that we'll get this emitter repaired. With any luck there will be someone else out there left to talk to.",c="让我看看那些东西。\n\n很好，我想这些会很有用，做得好，$n。这个发射器相当复杂所以需要花点时间来完成修补。准备好后我会告诉你。\n\n在这同时，你可以去找守备官奥达尔看看他是否需要你的协助。",cEN="Let me take a look at those.\n\nYes, I think that these will do nicely; good job, <name>. The emitter is rather complex so it may take some time to finish the repairs. I'll let you know when it's ready.\n\nIn the meantime, you might see if Vindicator Aldar has anything he could use you for."}
Q[9309]={d="我们最近数次确认了暗影山附近有一些非正常活动的迹象。\n\n这很让人不安，我已经向那里派出了数名斥候，要求他们彻底侦察那边的信息。但其中有一名斥候现在仍然还未回来，也没有收到他的报告。\n\n$C，我要求你立刻去西南方侦察，到湖的另一边找到图兰，然后看看是什么让他迟到了。",dEN="We now have several separate confirmations of unusual activity up on the Shadow Ridge.\n\nThis is disturbing; we thought that the scouting missions already undertaken had been thorough. One of my scouts hasn't reported back yet.\n\n<class>, I need you to head southwest to the other side of Silverline Lake and find Tolaan, and see what has delayed him.",o="在埃门谷中的暗影山找到图兰，并与之交谈。",oEN="Find and speak with Tolaan at Shadow Ridge in Ammen Vale.",c="救命……血精灵！他们……袭击……我。时间……不多了。",cEN="Help... blood elves! They... ambushed... me. Don't have... long."}
Q[9310]={d="你在怪物的尸体上找到一块散发着微弱的腐坏能量的水晶。",dEN="On the corpse of the fallen wight, you find a crystal faintly radiating necrotic energy.",o="将暗淡的死灵水晶交给幽暗城庭院处的卢卡中尉。",oEN="Bring the Faint Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Rukag in the courtyard of the Undercity.",c="你说这是从攻击城市的活尸身上找到的？\n\n我们已听说天灾军团召唤亡域基础营地的事。我猜他们想在幽暗城里也造一个。我们以后要严加提防。",cEN="You say this was taken from a wight attacking the city?\n\nWe have received word of the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they were trying to create one in the Undercity. We will have to be vigilant in the future."}
Q[9311]={d="我有一个计划，我们必须杀死他们的领袖。没有了领袖，他们也许就会立刻撤退并重组，这样我们就获得了修复装置的宝贵时间。\n\n守备官奥达尔应该明白这一点。杀死血精灵的测量员，然后向他报告我们发现的一切。",dEN="I have a plan. We must kill their leader. Without their master, perhaps they will retreat to regroup. We just need to buy time until the repairs are completed.\n\nThen Vindicator Aldar must know of this. Kill the surveyor, then return and tell him what we've found.",o="杀死测量员卡蒂瑞丝，并把这个消息通知给埃门谷坠毁点的守备官奥达尔。",oEN="Slay Surveyor Candress and then inform Vindicator Aldar at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="那么那是真的……埃门谷这里有一批侦察血精灵小队！他们怎么跟踪到我们的？\n\n我要立刻派个人去把托兰带回来！",pEN="Then it is true... a scouting party of blood elves here in Ammen Vale! How did they follow us?\n\nI'll get someone out there immediately to bring Tolaan back.",c="感谢你解决掉血精灵测量员。想必她就是他们的领导者。放心，我们会处理仍留在这附近的其它人。\n\n请选择一项武器做为我答谢你的奖赏。",cEN="I thank you for dealing with the blood elf surveyor. Surely she was their leader. Rest assured, we will deal with whatever remnant of them is still nearby.\n\nPlease, take one of these weapons as a sign of my gratitude."}
Q[9312]={d="$n，在你去调查暗影山的情况时，沙娜安已经快把全息图象发射器修理好了。你去与她谈谈吧。",dEN="<name>, while you were out investigating the Shadow Ridge, Zhanaa here has been going on about the holographic emitter. You might want to speak with her.",o="与埃门谷坠毁点的技师沙娜安谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Technician Zhanaa at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",c="我完成了，我完成了！我想我把发射器修好了！来，我只要开启这个水晶它应该就可以运作。\n\n看看这个发射器，$n。看来它开始运作了……看起来好像有个人的影像要出现了！",cEN="I got it, I got it! I think I managed to fix the emitter! Here, I'll just activate this last crystal and that should do it.\n\nTake a look at the emitter, <name>. It looks like it's beginning to work... someone is appearing!"}
Q[9313]={d="总算有了个不错的结果。$n，现在你立刻转至这个碧蓝岗哨去找戴维恩！\n\n你看，这里有一条小小的通路一直向西，可以走到这座小岛的外侧。之后，你需要跨过这条晶水河，到达另一边那座较大的岛屿上，继续沿着路走就可以找到碧蓝岗哨了。\n\n到了那边以后，看看是否能说服他们派遣一些救援人员带着补给过来。我们这里剩下的人也很快就会在适当时候迁移过去的。\n\n谢谢你，没有你的帮助我们不可能取得这样的进展！",dEN="By all that is good, <name>, you must go at once to this Azure Watch and speak with Dyvuun!\n\nThere is a path that leads west off of this tiny isle. Follow it and cross the Crystalbrook River to arrive on the larger part of the isle. Continue to follow the path and you should find Azure Watch.\n\nSee if you can convince them to send us some aid and supplies. The rest of us will follow when we can.\n\nThank you, we wouldn't have made it without you!",o="与秘蓝岛的碧蓝岗哨中的技师戴维恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Technician Dyvuun at Azure Watch on Azuremyst Isle.",c="啊，很高兴再见到你！我很高兴我们都把发射器修好了，不然我们也不会发现彼此。别担心，我们会记得为埃门谷提供帮助和补给的。\n\n说到帮助，既然你来到了这儿，你就四处走走，向其它人介绍一下你。我知道这儿还有很多事要做。",cEN="Ah, good to see you again! I'm glad that we were both able to get our emitters fixed or we might never have found one another. And don't worry, we'll see to it that Ammen Vale gets help and supplies.\n\nSpeaking of assistance, now that you're here, go around and introduce yourself to the others. I know that there's plenty to do."}
Q[9314]={d="$C！刚才有一些变异生物突然跳出来，把我的腿弄伤了。\n\n我原本是在碧蓝岗哨收到了沙娜安的信息之后，被派出来执行侦察任务的。现在，是否能请你代替我向看护员谢尔兰汇报一下？她必须获知这边到底有多少人在等待碧蓝岗哨的支持。你只需要渡过晶水河，然后一直沿路走，就可以到达碧蓝岗哨了。\n\n假如你需要在那边休息的话，也可以让她帮你安排一个简便的住所。",dEN="<class>! A couple mutated beasts jumped me and my leg is injured.\n\nI was sent on a scouting mission from Azure Watch after we received word from Zhanaa. Please, could you go speak with Caregiver Chellan in my stead? She needs to know how many people to expect in Azure Watch. Just cross the Crystalbrook River here and continue following the road until you get to Azure Watch.\n\nBe sure to ask her for a place for yourself to stay in.",o="与秘蓝岛上的碧蓝岗哨中的看护员谢尔兰谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Caregiver Chellan at Azure Watch on Azuremyst Isle.",c="哦，你一定是我们听说的其中一位生还者！\n\n很高兴你来了。别担心，我们会派个人去看看艾宇的腿伤。\n\n我对你从艰苦的痛苦折磨中存活下来的故事相当感兴趣。你是一个勇敢的人，才能到达这里。",cEN="Oh, you must be one of the survivors we've been hearing about!\n\nI'm glad that you came. Don't worry, we will send someone to see to Aeun's injured leg.\n\nI'm most interested in hearing all about your harrowing story of survival. You're a brave one to have made it all the way here."}
Q[9315]={d="靠近一点，我就要……死了。\n\n我奉命来这儿……猎杀蛛怪，但是范迪瑞尔还不知道……这里有一个蛛怪的领袖。\n\n<垂死的血精灵咳出一大口鲜血。>\n\n你必须……杀死阿诺克苏塔。最好叫上你的伙伴。那家伙在日冕村……附近游荡。",dEN="Come closer, I am ... dying.\n\nI was sent here ... to slay these Nerubians, but Vandril didn't ... know that they have a leader.\n\n<The dying blood elf coughs up a good amount of blood.>\n\nYou must find and ... slay Anok'suten. Get help. She wanders around ... Suncrown Village.",o="杀死阿诺克苏塔，然后向幽魂之地塔奎林的奥术师范迪瑞尔复命。",oEN="Slay Anok'suten and return to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="一个蛛魔蛛怪领袖？没有任何侦察报告提到关于这个安罗科舒顿的事！",pEN="A nerubian leader? None of the scouting missions reported anything about this Anok'suten!",c="情报如此粗糙，我向你道歉，$c。要是我事先知道这个阿诺克苏塔，一定会告诉你。\n\n我们的人手太分散了，事情一件件从指缝里漏掉！",cEN="I apologize for the shoddy intelligence, <class>. Had I known of this Anok'suten ahead of time, I surely would have told you.\n\nWe're spread too thin and things are slipping through the cracks!"}
Q[9324]={d="从奥格瑞玛中心偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是博学者或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the heart of Orgrimmar itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...",o="将奥格瑞玛烈焰交给节日博学者。",oEN="Return the Flame of Orgrimmar to the Festival Loremaster.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="这是什么？除非我弄错了，这簇火焰是从奥格瑞玛的心脏地带取来的！兽人和巨魔的狂烈之心映照在它灼热的高温里。潜入敌人巢穴盗取圣火，你可真勇敢！\n\n不知道其他几座城市里还潜藏着怎样的力量……",cEN="What's this? Unless I'm mistaken, this flame has been taken from the heart of Orgrimmar itself! The fierce hearts of the orcs and trolls are reflected in its searing heat. What a fine addition to our collection--how brave you are, stealing into the enemy's lair to retrieve the sacred flame!"}
Q[9325]={d="从雷霆崖萨满祭司身上偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是博学者或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the shaman of Thunder Bluff, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...",o="将雷霆崖烈焰交给节日博学者。",oEN="Return the Flame of Thunder Bluff to the Festival Loremaster.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="除非我猜错了，否则这个火焰应该是从雷霆崖的悬崖边拿到的！听听它和精神力量的共鸣！你真是个厉害的窃贼，$n。收下这个做为你的奖励。现在，如果我们能有全部四个城市的火焰……",cEN="Unless I miss my guess, this fire has been taken from the cliffs of Thunder Bluff! How it sings with the power of the spirits! You are quite the thief, <name>. Take this as just payment for your skill. Now, if only we had the flames of all three cities..."}
Q[9326]={d="从幽暗城上面的洛丹伦废墟偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是博学者或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the ruins above the Undercity, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...",o="将幽暗城烈焰交给节日博学者。",oEN="Return the Flame of the Undercity to the Festival Loremaster.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="嗯……真是把奇怪的火焰！它很柔和，几乎是无火苗的闷烧，但它的中心又很强烈。你说你是从幽暗城取得它的吗？好极了。如果有了全部四个城市的火焰，谁知道我们能怎么样？",cEN="Hm... what a strange fire! It is subdued, nearly smoldering, but the heat is intense. And you received this from the Undercity, you say? Fascinating. With the flames of all three cities, who knows what we could accomplish?"}
Q[9328]={d="这是我们血精灵一族的历史新篇章的开始，$n。我们将收复所有失地，并与希尔瓦娜斯和她的盟友紧密地连接在一起。\n\n将这个叛徒的徽记拿去交给银月城的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆。他一定是最渴望听到这个消息的人。",dEN="This is the beginning of a new chapter in the history of our race, <name>. Our lands will be reclaimed and we shall cement our bond with Sylvanas and her allies.\n\nTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City. He'll be eager to hear the news.",o="将达尔坎的徽记交给银月城的洛瑟玛·塞隆。",oEN="Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.",p="你想和我说话，$c？我不记得我们有约。",pEN="You seek audience with me, <class>? I do not recall hearing of an appointment.",c="我没想到会这么快就见到你。\n\n这真是个好消息，$n，比你可能想象的还要好。",cEN="Now that's one face I was not expecting to see so soon.\n\nThis is quite the good news, <name>, in more ways than you can imagine."}
Q[9329]={d="我知道被遗忘者出现在这儿很诡异，可他们确实是来帮忙的。跟高级执行官玛尔伦谈谈，他就在镇子西边的哨塔里。\n\n另外，$c，跟他谈完之后回到我这儿来，我还有件相当紧迫的艰巨任务要交给你去办！",dEN="I know it seems strange, but the Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren. He's in the tower on the west side of town.\n\nAnd, <class>, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!",o="与塔奎林的高级执行官玛尔伦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Executor Mavren at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",p="我知道这看起来很奇怪，但被遗忘者确实是来帮忙的。你该去见见他们的首领，高等执行官玛弗伦。他就在镇子西边的塔楼里。\n\n还有，$n，跟他谈完之后回到我这儿来；有件凶险的事必须立刻处理！",pEN="I know it seems strange, but the Forsaken are here to help. You should speak with their leader, High Executor Mavren. He's in the tower on the west side of town.\n\nAnd, <class>, when you're done talking with him return to me; I have something dire that needs to be dealt with immediately!",c="我知道我们被遗忘者在你们眼中就像怪物，但我向你保证，我们对你们的人民绝无恶意。我们会来这里是因为与血精灵有共同的敌人背叛者达克汗！他已重回世上并率领着天灾军团从死亡之域往南入侵这片土地。\n\n来自这片土地的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者，她曾是个精灵，现在是我们的领导者。她曾和达克汗交手过，所以也跟你们一样希望达克汗死！\n\n我们会一同击败他的，$c！",cEN="We Forsaken are here because of a common enemy with the blood elves: Dar'Khan! He has returned and now commands the Scourge that are invading this land from his steadfast, Deatholme, to the south.\n\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner, who originally hails from these lands, and used to be an elf, has a history with Dar'Khan and wants him dead!\n\nWe will defeat him, <class>, and you will help us do it!"}
Q[9330]={d="从暴风城中心偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是诗人或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the heart of Stormwind itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...",o="将暴风城烈焰交给节日诗人。",oEN="Return the Flame of Stormwind to the Festival Talespinner.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="这把烧地明亮的火焰……你说这是从暴风城来的？了不起！那一定是趟真正的冒险！当然，我会给你一点报酬。如果你又找到这样类似的东西，记得再来和我谈谈。",cEN="And this brightly-burning fire... you say it came from Stormwind? Remarkable! That must have been quite an adventure! I'll pay you for this, of course. If you find anything else like this, be sure to speak with me again."}
Q[9331]={d="从铁炉堡中心偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是诗人或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the heart of Ironforge itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...",o="将铁炉堡烈焰交给节日诗人。",oEN="Return the Flame of Ironforge to the Festival Talespinner.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="这个热烈的火焰一定是从铁炉堡的大厅来的它和那些矮人一样坚定。做得好，$n。如果我有其它城市的火焰……啊，没事。这是你的酬劳。",cEN="This hearty flame must be from the halls of Ironforge; it's as stalwart as the dwarves themselves. A fine catch, <name>. If I had the fires of the other cities... ah, but never mind. Here is your payment."}
Q[9332]={d="从泰达希尔海岸边偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是诗人或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the shores of Teldrassil, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...",o="将达纳苏斯烈焰交给节日诗人。",oEN="Return the Flame of Darnassus to the Festival Talespinner.",p="你几乎在发着光芒，$r。你带了什么来？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="这火焰里满是古老的哀伤，$n。你说你是从泰达希尔的根部取来的？真有意思！这是给你的奖赏。要是再找到类似的东西就回来找我；我也许用得上。",cEN="This fire aches of ancient sorrow, <name>. You pulled this from the roots of Teldrassil, you say? Fascinating! Here is a reward for your skill. Return to me should you find anything else like this; I may have a use for it."}
Q[9338]={p="即使你对我们提供的奖励没有兴趣，这些徽章仍象征着我们互相的信任和友谊。\n\n把它们带来给我。如果你的职责表现良好，我会做好应有的记录的。",pEN="Even if you have no need for the material rewards we offer, these badges still mark our mutual trust and friendship.\n\nBring them to me. I'll make due note of your service should your performance go above and beyond the call of duty.",c="你为我们带来荣耀，$n。有你持续的努力我们会克服所有障碍的。",cEN="You honor us, <name>. With your continued efforts we will overcome all obstacles."}
Q[9339]={c="你今天证明了自己，$n。\n\n我没什么别的能给你了，不过我有一顶王冠；对$g一位征服者:一位征服者;来说倒是相称的礼物。愿它照亮你的前路。",cEN="You've proven yourself, today, <name>.\n\nWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way."}
Q[9340]={d="联盟的军队几乎包围了猎鹰岗哨，我们的处境相当危险。艾泽拉斯世界的血精灵朝圣者们蜂拥而至，我们必须修筑一条安全的路线，躲避敌人的窥探。\n\n我已经想好了解决此事的办法，那就是开辟一条穿越大裂隙的秘密通道。\n\n好吧，我知道那儿盘踞着凶猛的剥石者，可它们只是一群野兽而已。给它们点教训，它们就不敢滋扰我们了。我要你转至大裂隙猎杀这些家伙，让它们知道我们的厉害。",dEN="We're dangerously close to becoming fenced in by Alliance forces. With the influx of sin'dorei pilgrims from Azeroth, we must establish a route that's safe from our enemies' prying eyes.\n\nI've given it some thought and have arrived at a solution. We're to establish a secret path through the Great Fissure.\n\nYes, even though the area is crawling with brutal rock flayers, they are merely beasts and can be taught to fear us. I want you to go and kill a good number of them. They shall learn fear.",o="猎鹰岗哨的游侠队长维恩雷要你转至猎鹰岗哨以东的大裂隙，杀死8个石镰幼崽和3个石镰突击者。",oEN="Ranger Captain Venn'ren at Falcon Watch wants you to slay 8 Stonescythe Whelps and 3 Stonescythe Alphas at the Great Fissure, east of Falcon Watch.",p="你回来了。任务完成了吗？",pEN="You've returned. Is the task done?",c="做得好，$n。石镰怪现在应该知道要离我们远一点了。",cEN="Good job, <name>. That should teach the rock flayers to stay far away from us."}
Q[9345]={d="在我试图进入塞斯高的时候，一名燃烧军团的巡逻兵发现了我。我拼命地逃，想躲进不远处的那些塔里去，可是他们放出了地狱猎犬，扑倒了我，几乎差点把我弄成残废！\n\n后来，我挣扎着逃到了这里，不过我的一条腿已经严重骨折了。石头守卫安比兰发现我之后，把我带到了这里。\n现在，我必须先想办法医治好这条腿。北边白骨之谷那里生长着一种刺叶植物，用它制成的药膏应该能够缓解我的伤痛，让我痊愈。",dEN="Just as Zeth'Gor came into view, a Legion patrol caught sight of me. I ran, hoping to duck into one of the towers in the distance, but one of their felhounds caught up with me and nearly hamstrung me!\n\nI managed to escape, but my leg is in terrible shape. Stone Guard Ambelan found me and brought me here.\nNow, I have to find a way to tend to my leg. Spineleaf grows in and around the Valley of Bones to the north . A salve made from it will dull the pain enough for me to travel.",o="将制作药膏所需的12片地狱火刺叶交给断背岗哨的葛雷拉格。",oEN="Gather 12 Hellfire Spineleaf plants for a salve and return to Grelag at Spinebreaker Post.",p="你把那些植物带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought the plants?",c="这些就是我所需要的。我要开始准备药膏并完成我的夹板再回到萨尔玛。我怎么感觉我知道当先知雷古库特看到我的时候她会说什么？\n\n<葛雷拉格无趣地叹了口气。>\n\n谢谢你的帮忙，$n。我这还有一些剩下的骨叶，你可以将它们带走，谁知道这些叶子在何时会证明它的用途呢？",cEN="These should do the job. I'm going to prepare the salve and finish my splint before making my way back to Thrallmar. Why do I have the feeling that I know what Far Seer Regulkut will say when she sees me?\n\n<Grelag sighs half-heartedly.>\n\nThank you for your help, <name>. I have some of the spineleaf left over. You're welcome to take it with you. Who can tell when it will prove useful?"}
Q[9349]={d="我快饿死了！\n\n这不是很讽刺吗？一个快饿死的厨子？\n\n<莱加西干笑了一声，敲了敲口袋里一张折起的羊皮纸。>\n\n照我们先前看的那张旅游地图，在我们被毫不客气地打下来之前——西南方靠近泰罗卡森林的地方有一片区域。它叫裂角小径，据说那里遍地都是美味的掠食者蛋！\n\n只要有人够胆去那儿给我弄些回来，我就能做出一桌盛宴！",dEN="I'm starving!\n\nThere's irony in that, wouldn't you say? A starving cook?\n\n<Legassi laughs half-heartedly and taps a folded piece of parchment he has in his pocket.>\n\nAccording to this tourist map we were following - before we were so rudely shot down - there's an area to the southwest, near Terokkar Forest. It's called the Razorthorn Trail, and supposedly it's brimming with delicious ravager eggs!\n\nI could cook up quite a feast if only someone were brave enough to go down there and get me some!",o="将12枚饥饿掠食者的卵交给地狱火半岛飞艇坠毁点的雷加希。",oEN="Retrieve 12 Ravager Eggs for Legassi at the Zeppelin Crash in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你取回那些蛋了没？\n\n<雷加希的肚子等得咕噜咕噜叫。>",pEN="You have those eggs yet?\n\n<Legassi's stomach grumbles in anticipation.>",c="想吃美味的料理，就需要特级的食材。这些蛋看起来太棒了！\n\n我刚洗完我的锅子，所以欢迎你跟我一起品尝美食！",cEN="In order to have great cuisine, you need to have great ingredients. And these eggs look great!\n\nI've just finished cleaning off my frying pan, so you're more than welcome to join me for a meal!"}
Q[9351]={d="虽然飞艇的机身已经修好了，但我还得找一些能烧的东西来发动引擎。我们的燃料全部用完了，在这个地方又搞不到新的燃料！\n\n在我们的正南面有个叫迁跃平原的地方，那里有许多失去控制的、凶猛的虚空行者。不过在我看来，那就是一群活蹦乱跳活泼可爱的活电池。\n\n如果你能帮我搞到些它们的精华，我就可以将飞艇的引擎改为由它们驱动的装置，说不定能比以前飞得更远哩！",dEN="Even if I can get the zeppelin's frame repaired, I'll have to find something else to power the engine. I'm all out of fuel and there's no place to fill up around here!\n\nTo the south of us is an area of broken land called the Warp Fields. It's full of rogue and uncontrolled voidwalkers, but I like to think of them as walking batteries.\n\nIf you can bring me enough of their essence, I can convert the zeppelin's engine to run on it. Five gold says I'll even get better mileage out of it, too!",o="把10份浓缩的虚空行者精华带给飞艇坠毁点的\"尖叫\"斯克里德·幸运脑袋。",oEN="Bring 10 Condensed Voidwalker Essences to \"Screaming\" Screed Luckheed at the Zeppelin Crash.",p="你取到精华了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get the essence?",c="太完美了！事实上，我想它会发挥极佳的功用。我会重新设计引擎来充分利用这份额外的动力。我是说，如果，当我们顺利离开这里，我将会展示我的新设计，让每一位回到52区的人欣赏！",cEN="This is perfect! In fact, I think it's going to work so well, I might just have to redesign the engine to take advantage of all this extra power. If, I mean, when we get out of here, I'll have to show my design to everyone back at Area 52!"}
Q[9352]={d="我除了时刻警惕失心者滋扰生事之外，还要处理一堆声称看到暗夜精灵的虚假情报。\n\n虽然事实证明大多数情报都是子虚乌有，但是有件事倒是值得深入调查下。最近，我们的主要能源供给站西部圣殿遭到了严重破坏，传言都说是达纳苏斯的暗夜精灵干的。\n\n去那儿看看有没有可疑的家伙出没。然后向驻守在西部圣殿的魔网监护者薇兰妮亚汇报情况。",dEN="Besides the constant threat that the Wretched represent, I also have to deal with all kind of fictitious reports of night elf sightings.\n\nThough most reports are unfounded, one recent incident demands further investigation. The West Sanctum, one of our primary energy sources, has suffered a terrible malfunction and rumors of Darnassian sabotage are rampant.\n\nTravel there and deal with anyone that looks suspicious. Report back to Ley-Keeper Velania, who watches over the sanctum.",o="转至鹰翼广场西南方的西部圣殿击败在那一带出现的入侵者，然后将你发现的情况汇报给魔网监护者薇兰妮亚。",oEN="Travel to the West Sanctum, southwest of Falconwing Square and defeat any intruders present there. Report your findings to Ley-Keeper Velania.",p="你发现了什么吗？与暗夜精灵也有关吗？",pEN="Have you uncovered anything? Are the night elves behind this?",c="暗夜精灵？这里？那些小人！\n\n你觉得他们和我的圣殿运作不良有关吗？如果你有任何消息，最好立即送给艾尔杜上尉。",cEN="Night elves? Here? Those rats!\n\nDo you suppose they had anything to do with the malfunction in my sanctum? If you have any information, you'd better take it to Captain Sunbrand at once!"}
Q[9355]={d="你好，$c。总算有援兵过来了，现在我们终于可以开始处理周边生物所造成的问题了！\n\n我们的首要目标是确保西南边的那条道路的交通安全，但现在那些该死的硬壳穿地虫在那里频繁出没，将路面也破坏得凌乱不堪。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我们解决那些可恶的家伙，洛萨之子将感激不尽。不过，你千万得小心，它们很敏感。",dEN="Well met, <class>. Now that reinforcements are finally arriving, we can recapture some semblance of a normal life.\n\nOne of our first goals is to restore the flow of men and goods along the road to the southwest, but it must be reclaimed from the crust bursters that've overrun the area.\n\nIf you're willing to help us deal with this menace, you would have the gratitude of the Sons. Watch carefully for the disturbed ground they leave in their wake.",o="杀死15只游荡的硬壳穿地虫，然后向荣耀堡的工头比格姆斯复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Marauding Crust Bursters and return to Foreman Biggums at Honor Hold.",p="你清理完道路了吗？",pEN="Were you able to clear the road?",c="做得好，$n。不过我们先不要高兴的太早。我确定我们还没完全消灭那些虫仔。如果你又在这附近看到他们窜头窜脑，洛萨之子会准备好杀死他们的！",cEN="Well done, <name>. We shouldn't be too quick to congratulate ourselves, though. I'm certain we haven't seen the last of those worms. If they show their hideous heads around these parts again, the Sons'll be ready for them!"}
Q[9356]={d="斯克里德总爱说他飞得\"像黄油一样顺滑\"。我看是\"黄油手\"才对！\n\n瞧瞧那边那堆残骸。他管那叫\"颠簸\"着陆。\n\n当然，我们是被打了，可要是他不总吹嘘自己的驾驶技术，我倒愿意多体谅他一点！\n\n我打算给他做一批翅膀，好让他长点记性。往东去白骨谷，你能找到啃骨秃鹫。它们的翅膀肥美多汁，正合我用。",dEN="Screed likes to say his flying is as \"smooth as butter.\" I think \"butterfingered\" is more like it!\n\nTake a look at the wreckage over there. He calls it a \"rough\" landing.\n\nSure, we got shot at, but I'd be willing to cut him a little more slack if he didn't brag about his piloting skills so often!\n\nI think I'm going to make him a batch of wings to drive the point home. To the east, in the Valley of Bones, you'll find bonestripper buzzards. Their wings are plump, juicy, and perfect for my needs.",o="将12只强壮的秃鹫翅膀交给飞艇坠毁点的雷加希。",oEN="Bring 12 Plump Buzzard Wings to Legassi at the Zeppelin Crash.",p="我等不及想看到他开始修复飞艇时的表情了。自从失事之后，他老是抱怨我整天只会想着食物。嗯，当他在做修复工作时，我们总是要解决食物来源的问题！",pEN="I can't wait to see the look on his face when he digs in. Ever since the crash, he's been complaining that all I can think of is food. Well, someone's got to feed us while he tinkers with the zeppelin!",c="掠食者煎蛋卷。有了！\n\n地狱野猪熏肉。有了！\n\n美味秃鹫翅膀。有了！\n\n真是棒极了的一餐。你真该尝一尝。",cEN="Ravager Eggs. Bam!\n\nHellboar Bacon. Bam!\n\nBuzzard Wings. Bam! Bam!\n\nWhat a great meal. You've really got to try it."}
Q[9358]={d="别以为这座村庄很安全，天灾士兵和失心者经常分别从东西两侧对我们发动进攻。\n\n游侠萨蕾恩负责保卫边界的安全，防止天灾士兵从死亡之痕攻入。沿着东边的道路离开村子，看看你能否帮她一把。",dEN="Don't take the safety of this village for granted. We're under siege by the Scourge on the east and the Wretched to the west.\n\nRanger Sareyn keeps our borders safe from the undead that pour in from the Dead Scar. Follow the road eastwards out of town and see if you can lend her a hand.",o="向永歌森林晴风村外的游侠萨蕾恩报到。",oEN="Report to Ranger Sareyn outside Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods.",c="你是来帮我们的？你怎么不早点说？我们永远都欢迎帮手！",cEN="You're here to help us? Why didn't you say so earlier? We can always use a hand!"}
Q[9359]={d="你在镇压失心者一事上帮了大忙。游侠们在对抗阿曼尼巨魔的战事中，一定用得上你这样的人。\n\n到东北方的远行者营地去找科雷尔巴中尉，看看你能帮她什么忙。",dEN="Your help in subduing the Wretched has been invaluable. The Farstriders would surely have use for someone like you in their fight against the Amani trolls.\n\nLook for the Farstrider Retreat to the northeast of here, speak to Lieutenant Dawnrunner and see what assistance she might need.",o="向永歌森林远行者营地的达恩·晨行者中尉报告。",oEN="Report to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat in Eversong Woods.",c="你是来帮忙的吗？太好了！\n\n对抗阿曼尼巨魔的战役让我们付出了代价，我们永远欢迎像你这样的战士。",cEN="You're here to help? Excellent!\n\nThe battle against the Amani trolls has taken its toll on us and capable fighters such as yourself are always welcome."}
Q[9360]={d="虽然你看不懂作战计划书中的文字，但是你发现有幅地图上清晰地标示着远行者居所和晴风村的位置。\n\n最好把这一情况汇报给远行者居所的达恩·晨行者中尉。",dEN="Though you don't understand the language in these battle plans, you clearly make out a map marking the positions of the Farstrider Retreat and Fairbreeze Village.\n\nYou'd best let Lieutenant Dawnrunner at the Farstrider Retreat know about this.",o="将阿曼尼入侵计划交给远行者居所的达恩·晨行者中尉。",oEN="Deliver the Amani Invasion Plans to Lieutenant Dawnrunner at Farstrider Retreat.",p="你想要给我什么东西？",pEN="What do you want to show me?",c="巨魔一边把我们困在这里一边策划着攻击晴风村。我们完全没料想到。",cEN="The trolls have been keeping us pinned here while planning an attack on Fairbreeze Village. We were not expecting this at all."}
Q[9361]={d="这些蛋好极了，但为什么我们不再来点别的呢？\n\n加上一些熏肉会让这顿大餐更加完美，而且，我知道在哪里能弄到熏肉。\n\n你看，这片区域到处都有地狱野猪，而且这里没有人去检查它们的肉是否能够食用，也没有人会烹饪那些肉。不过我们非常幸运！\n\n<雷加希在背包里仔细翻找，拿出了一个小瓶子。>\n\n这个虽然不是专为猪肉所准备的，不过，你要知道，烹饪需要创意！",dEN="Those eggs are superb, but what do you say we kick it up another notch?\n\nA side of bacon would round out the meal perfectly and I know just where to get it.\n\nThis place is littered with helboars. Of course, there's no one here to inspect and tenderize the meat, but we're in luck!\n\n<Legassi rummages around in his pack and produces a flask.>\n\nThis wasn't made for use on pork, but cooking is as much about improvisation as anything else!",o="飞艇坠毁点的雷加希要你收集8块纯净的地狱野猪肉。你必须首先猎杀地狱野猪，然后利用净化药剂来净化被污染的地狱野猪肉。",oEN="Legassi at the Zeppelin Crash wants you to gather 8 Purified Helboar Meat. To purify the meat, use the Purification Mixture on the Tainted Helboar Meat you gather from Helboars.",p="你成功地净化了地狱野猪肉吗？",pEN="Were you successful in purifying the helboar meat?",c="嗯……\n\n它看起来可以吃了，只要再适当调味一下。千万不要告诉斯里克他的早餐哪里来的，好吗？",cEN="Hmm...\n\nThis looks edible, if spiced properly. Just don't tell Screed where his breakfast came from, ok?"}
Q[9362]={d="没什么时间了，$n！我的探知法术最近发现了一个很强大的法术源。但我却不能离开法师塔，所以只有请你帮我杀死那个占有这件神器的邪恶生物。\n\n这个邪恶的家伙名叫军阀克雷利安，他躲藏在守卫森严的辛玛洛神殿。把他烧成灰，然后将他垂涎已久的虹彩贝壳给我带回来。",dEN="There isn't much time, <name>! My scrying spells have revealed a powerful source of magic. I cannot leave the tower, and would ask you to kill the vile creature in possession of this artifact.\n\nThe pathetic little cretin is known as Warlord Krellian, hiding behind his guards in the Temple of Zin-Malor. Burn him to ashes and take the prismatic shell he covets so dearly.",o="为大法师克希雷姆夺回虹彩贝壳。大法师克希雷姆就居住在艾萨拉北部悬崖上的一座塔中。",oEN="Retrieve the Prismatic Shell for Archmage Xylem. The Archmage resides in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara.",p="没有时间可以浪费了！你拿到贝壳了吗？",pEN="There is not time to waste! Have you the shell?",c="我必须说，这个贝壳有一种奇怪的光环。看来要奖励你取得它的一部分报酬就是派你去测试它的魔法潜力……",cEN="I must say, this shell has a strange aura. It seems only fitting that part of your reward for retrieving it would be to test its magical capabilities..."}
Q[9363]={d="将阿曼尼巨魔的计划告知晴风村的游侠戴戈利恩。虽然祖玛洛什已死，晴风村还是要做好充足的准备。告诉戴戈利恩我会尽快派去援军的。",dEN="Go to Fairbreeze Village and notify Ranger Degolien of the Amani plans. Even with Zul'Marosh dead, Fairbreeze must prepare for a troll attack. Tell Degolien I will send him reinforcements as soon as possible.",o="与永歌森林晴风村的游侠戴戈利恩谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Fairbreeze Village in Eversong Woods and speak to Ranger Degolien.",c="你带来的消息相当重要，$n。既然我们知道了巨魔的计划，就能准备攻击了。\n\n我们不会被抓到的。",cEN="The information you've brought is of vital importance, <name>. Now that we know of the trolls' plans we can prepare for an attack.\n\nWe won't be caught with our guard down."}
Q[9364]={d="我的研究发现了这个虹彩贝壳的一个特殊用途。\n\n带上这个贝壳，到艾萨拉四处找一些恶鞭纳迦，使用一下变形术看看。如果你愿意等一段时间，那么这个贝壳上所附带的光环会使他们分裂为几个小一些的相似物体。尽快杀死这些物体，贝壳就可以收集它们的精华。\n\n等贝壳满了之后，回来找我。",dEN="My research has revealed a unique purpose for the prismatic shell.\n\nCarry the shell and cast your polymorph spell on the Spitelash in Azshara. If you wait a few moments, the chaotic aura of the shell will cause them to split into several smaller clones for a few moments. Kill these clones as quickly as possible, and the shell will collect their essence.\n\nWhen the shell is full, return it to me.",o="对艾萨拉的恶鞭纳迦使用变形术，然后杀死几秒钟后出现的相似体。当你杀了50个相似体后，回去向大法师克希雷姆复命。",oEN="Polymorph the Spitelash of Azshara and kill the clones that appear several seconds later. When you have slain 50 Polymorph Clones, return to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.",p="你收集到那些魔法了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the magic?",c="太棒了！太棒了！\n\n现在我们就可以重新将这魔法组成新的法术。看啊！",cEN="Splendid! Splendid!\n\nNow we are able to reform this magic into a new spell. Behold!"}
Q[9365]={c="你今天证明了自己，$n。\n\n我没什么别的能给你了，不过我有一顶王冠；对$g一位征服者:一位征服者;来说倒是相称的礼物。愿它照亮你的前路。",cEN="You've proven yourself, today, <name>.\n\nWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way"}
Q[9366]={d="此地东北方的阿苟纳之池曾是德莱尼人的圣地，恶魔阿苟纳的血液洒入池水后，整片区域都被污染了。\n\n虽然事隔多时，被稀释的恶魔之血仍然蕴涵着强大的力量。盘踞在那儿的恐惧魔也拥有了阿苟纳血液中的邪恶力量。杀死他们，替我取回一些邪恶样本。我不会让你白忙活的。",dEN="Northeast of here lie the Pools of Aggonar. Once a sacred site to the draenei, their waters were corrupted after the blood from the demon Aggonar was spilled into them.\n\nThat blood, though old and diluted, still possesses tremendous power. Terrorfiends now walk the area, empowered by the pure demonic energies of the original blood. Slay them and retrieve as much felblood as you can. I'll make it worth your while.",o="猎鹰岗哨的阴沉的利亚森要你转至阿苟纳之池，从恐惧魔身上收集6份邪血样本。",oEN="Ryathen the Somber at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring him 6 Felblood Samples from the Terrorfiends that inhabit the Pools of Aggonar.",p="邪血样本……你弄到手了吗，$n？",pEN="The felblood... did you obtain it, <name>?",c="这些样本里含有的能量非常庞大，$n。现在我们只需要确定我们能持续从这里取得恶魔之血。",cEN="The energy contained in these samples is tremendous, <name>. Now we just need to ensure that our access to this felblood continues uninterrupted."}
Q[9369]={d="我们是德莱尼人。许多族人在飞船坠毁时身负重伤，亟待医治，可是治疗水晶已经所剩不多了。我们必须迅速补充库存！\n\n眼下这种窘迫的局面，也只能用峡谷蛾的血液作为治疗水晶的替换品。\n\n峡谷蛾随处可见，不过它们大多分布在西北边。",dEN="We are the draenei. Our ship crashed and, since we have many wounded, our immediate concern is the depleted state of our healing crystals. We must replenish them quickly!\n\nUnfortunately, the only way to do this at this point is to extract the blood from the local vale moths. Their blood will make for a suitable substitute.\n\nThe moths can be found in many places around the vale, but mostly in the northwest.",o="从附近的峡谷蛾身上收集8瓶蛾血，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的普罗尼图斯复命。",oEN="Acquire 8 Vials of Moth Blood from the nearby Vale Moths and bring them to Proenitus at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="你弄到治疗水晶必要的飞蛾血清了吗？溪谷里到处都是生还者，时间紧迫！",pEN="Have you harvested the necessary moth blood for the healing crystals yet? With survivors scattered all over the vale, time is of the essence!",c="真令人遗憾，那些生物必须死亡我们才能生存——不分青红皂白的杀戮不是我们德莱尼人的作风。不过，你所收集的血清会补充我们的治疗水晶，所以他们不会死得毫无价值。",cEN="Regrettable that those creatures had to die so that we might live - indiscriminate killing is not the draenei way. However, the blood you gathered will replenish our healing crystals, so their deaths will not be in vain."}
Q[9370]={d="我们的斥候在阿苟纳之池俘获了一名德莱尼圣骑士。当时他正在操办某种净化仪式，看来德莱尼人企图净化阿苟纳之池。我们必须阻止他们，否则邪血样本的来源就会被切断！\n\n我们从圣骑士身上搜出一枚信号宝石，这东西似乎是用来标记安全地点的，这样那些自称为“学者”的德莱尼牧师就知道该在哪里启动净化仪式了。将这颗宝石放置在阿苟纳祭坛附近，击败靠近它的德莱尼人。\n\n我建议你最好带上一两个朋友。",dEN="Our scouts captured a draenei paladin at the Pools of Aggonar. He was to take part in a cleansing ritual to purify the pools. We must stop the draenei from succeeding or we will lose our supply of felblood!\n\nHe was carrying this signaling gem, looking to mark a spot where a priest - or \"anchorite\" as they call themselves - could perform their rituals in safety. Place the gem near the Altar of Aggonar and be ready to ambush any approaching draenei.\n\nI suggest that you take a friend or two along.",o="转至阿苟纳之池，将信号宝石放置在阿苟纳祭坛附近，击败被召唤出来的德莱尼学者。完成任务后返回猎鹰岗哨，将信号宝石交还给阴沉的利亚森。",oEN="Place the Signaling Gem near the Altar of Aggonar at the Pools of Aggonar and defeat any Draenei Anchorites that respond to your summons. Return to Ryathen the Somber at Falcon Watch with the Signaling Gem after completing this task.",p="你回来了，$n。你结束了德莱尼愚蠢的行为吗？",pEN="You've returned, <name>. Did you put an end to the draenei's folly?",c="那会让那些神圣的狂热者不再干扰别人的事。",cEN="That'll show those holy fanatics to mind their own business."}
Q[9371]={d="$n，植物学家塔蕾克丝需要帮助。她和她的学徒们在西边，就在飞船外。",dEN="<name>, Botanist Taerix is in need of your assistance. You'll find her with her apprentices to the west, outside the ship.",o="与埃门谷坠毁点的植物学家塔蕾克丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Botanist Taerix at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",c="喔，谢天谢地你来了。我们还有很多事要做。",cEN="Oh, thank goodness you've come. We have much to do."}
Q[9372]={d="欢迎来到塞纳里奥哨站，$c。我们很少结交外面的朋友，不过，依然很高兴见到你。为了研究这个破碎世界中的生物与生态，我常常会转至许多偏远的角落。\n\n不过，上一次塞纳里奥远征队派我去研究外域中最危险的野生生物时，我却发现了一件惊人的事情。当这里的许多生物遭受辐射之后，它们的身体都发生了可怕的变异。当前，我正在收集血样，试图研究这些变异。如果你愿意帮忙的话，我会非常感激你的。",dEN="Welcome to the Cenarion Post, <class>. We don't often get company out here, but I'm grateful for the visit. My work with the creatures of this desolate land requires me to travel to many remote places.\n\nThe Cenarion Expedition has dispatched me to study some of the most dangerous wildlife in Outland, and I've made a startling discovery. While many creatures here have already undergone radical changes, they continue to mutate. I'm collecting blood samples to document the changes, and any help would be welcome.",o="地狱火半岛塞纳里奥哨站的塞安·红鬃要你从笨拙的地狱野猪身上收集6份地狱野猪血样。",oEN="Thiah Redmane, at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula, has asked you to gather 6 Helboar Blood Samples from Hulking Helboars.",p="你收集到鲜血样本了吗？",pEN="Were you able to collect the blood samples?",c="做得好，$n。这些鲜血样本对我的研究和远征队对外域生物更广阔的研究会很有帮助。\n\n如果我可以分离出造成这些生物持续改变的因子，或许我就能调制解药。",cEN="Well done, <name>. These blood samples will prove helpful in my research and in the Expedition's wider studies of Outland's creatures.\n\nIf I could isolate what causes these creatures to change continuously, perhaps I could concoct an antidote."}
Q[9373]={d="仔细地显示过这只坏掉的皮箱子之后，你发现它很明显是遭到了那些虫子消化道内的腐蚀性液体的破坏。它表面的皮革似乎经过了一些简单的加工，但装饰与加工的细节已经无从辨认，也无法提供线索了。\n\n皮箱上唯一能看清楚的是一小块已经磨损很严重的塞纳里奥议会的标志。除此以外，你没有办法了解更多有关这个小皮箱的情况了。因此，你认为最好的处理方法就是将它交给一名塞纳奥议会的成员。",dEN="Upon examining the battered leather case, it becomes apparent that the container's damage must've been caused by the caustic fluid of the worm's digestive tract. The leather appears to have been intricately tooled at one time, but the details of its adornment can no longer be made out.\n\nThe only recognizable feature of the case is a worn logo of the Cenarion Circle. Knowing nothing about the contents of the case, you decide the best course of action would be to deliver it to a Circle member.",o="转至地狱火半岛西部的沙纳尔废墟，将被腐蚀的皮箱交给驻扎在废墟附近的塞安·红鬃。",oEN="Return the Eroded Leather Case to Thiah Redmane, camped near the Ruins of Sha'naar in western Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你好，$c。你怎么会到我的营地来？",pEN="Good day, <class>. What brings you to my encampment?",c="谢谢你把这个带来给我，$c。我还纳闷怎么这么久都没听到远征队的消息。不知道这则讯息是多久以前就被发出，而信差不知道发生什么事了。\n\n这些钱是给你的。",cEN="Thank you for bringing this to me, <class>. I was wondering why I hadn't heard from the Expedition in so long. I wonder how long ago this message was dispatched and what befell its carrier.\n\nHere's a bit of coin for your trouble."}
Q[9374]={d="来到外域后，我的丈夫埃雷利恩便对阿苟纳之池着了迷。他耗费大量的时间去那儿研究软泥怪！\n\n几天前，他突然失踪了。他们都说他已经死了，劝我放弃一切希望。\n\n我唯一能做的就是找回他的研究笔记。转至阿苟纳之池的东北方寻找他的日记，他总是把它放在那个褐色的背包中。",dEN="My husband, Arelion, had been fascinated with the Pools of Aggonar ever since we arrived in Outland. He spent much of his time studying slimes, of all things!\n\nHe went missing in there a few days ago. They say he's dead and there's nothing I can do about it.\n\nOne thing I can do is try to ensure that his research doesn't die with him. Go northeast to the pools and look for his journal. He always carried it inside a brown knapsack.",o="地狱火半岛猎鹰岗哨的魔导师卡尔琳达要你转至阿苟纳之池，找回埃雷利恩的日记。",oEN="Magistrix Carinda at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to go to the Pools of Aggonar and retrieve Arelion's Journal.",p="找到了吗，$n？你可以在地狱火半岛北边找到阿苟纳之池。",pEN="Any luck, <name>? You'll find the Pools of Aggonar north of Hellfire Citadel.",c="我丈夫的日记……根本不是研究记录！\n\n我怎么会这么傻？\"灌注了邪能物质的软泥怪的魔法特性\"，他把我骗得好苦。",cEN="My husband's journal... it's not about research at all!\n\nHow could I've been such a fool? \"Magical properties of fel-infused slime forms,\" he really had me going there."}
Q[9375]={d="<这名伤痕累累的血精灵脸上露出如释重负的神情。>\n\n求你了，$c，把我从这笼子里放出去！我不顾马蒂克·托尔塞多里的警告，愚蠢地抢在大部队前面离开了萨尔玛。\n\n我遭到了可怕生物的袭击，那一定就是他说的掠食者。我勉强把它们赶退了，可那只是麻烦的开始。\n\n我正包扎伤口时，那些鸟人被发现了，把我拖进这个洞穴，关进了笼子里！我必须赶到猎鹰岗哨！",dEN="<The battered blood elf's face displays relief at your presence.>\n\nPlease, <class>, get me out of this cage! I foolishly set out from Thrallmar ahead of the main group, despite Martik Tor'seldori's warnings.\n\nI was set upon by horrible creatures that could only be the ravagers he talked about. I managed to drive them off, but that was only the beginning of my troubles.\n\nAs I bound my wounds, those bird men found me, dragged me back to this cave, and locked me in this cage! I must get to Falcon Watch!",o="护送受伤的血精灵朝圣者返回猎鹰岗哨，然后与塔雷里斯·晨光谈一谈。",oEN="Protect the Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim on her way to Falcon Watch, then speak with Taleris Dawngazer.",p="你有什么需要，$c？",pEN="What do you need, <class>?",c="<塔雷利斯对前哨站的几个血精灵大吼。>\n\n把她带进去看看她的伤势！\n\n<塔雷利斯转国投来看着你。>\n\n她很幸运被你找到了，$c。我本来还以为她在那里活不了多久呢。\n\n你知道她之前说了些什么吗？",cEN="<Taleris shouts to several of the blood elves at the outpost.>\n\nGet her inside and see to her wounds!\n\n<Taleris turns back to you.>\n\nShe's fortunate that you found her when you did, <class>. I don't think she'd have lasted much longer out there.\n\nCan you make out what she was saying?"}
Q[9376]={d="这名受伤的朝圣者在昏迷中似乎一直在说着什么，好象有提到什么背包的样子。\n\n那么，你遇到她的时候，在附近看到过她的背包吗？\n\n嗯……她一定是在逃走的时候把它弄丢了。南边峡谷的钢牙掠食者常常会袭击单身的旅行者。\n\n如果她不能平静下来的话，我是没有办法为她疗伤的，唉，她的倔强会要了她的命……\n\n去尘羽峡谷看看能否找到她的营地吧，或许她把背包遗留在那里了。",dEN="That wounded pilgrim seems to be shouting something about a pack.\n\nWhen you encountered her, did you see a pack nearby? Hmm...\n\nShe must've left it when fleeing from her attackers. The quillfang ravagers, in their ravine to the south, are known to attack solitary travelers.\n\nIf she doesn't calm down, I won't be able to tend her wounds. Her stubbornness may just cost her her life.\n\nGo to Dustquill Ravine and see if you can find her campsite. I'm willing to bet she left it there.",o="受伤的血精灵朝圣者在尘羽峡谷宿营时遭到了钢牙掠食者的袭击。转至那处营地寻找丢失的背包。",oEN="The Wounded Blood Elf Pilgrim was attacked by Quillfang Ravagers while camped in Dustquill Ravine. Find her camp and search it for the missing pack.",p="事情进展的不太好。这样一来，她永远都无法再上路了。你能找到那个背包吗？",pEN="Things aren't going well. At this rate, she'll never make it back onto the road. Were you able to find that pack?",c="谢谢你把它拿来，$n。我不知道那个受伤的朝圣者到底有着什么重要的东西，但她拒绝让任何人靠近她，除非那个背包到了她的手里。",cEN="Thank you for returning this, <name>. I'm not sure what significance it holds for the wounded pilgrim, but she refuses to let anyone get near her until it's in her hands again."}
Q[9381]={d="最近，朝圣者的大批涌入和联盟军队的不断进犯都清楚地表明，猎鹰岗哨正经历着一个多事之秋。连我这样的人，最近在有空的时候都会帮那些游侠们准备箭支。不过，最近空闲太少，我已经有很长时间无法去收集箭尾要用的羽毛了。\n\n如果你能帮我收集一些啄骨秃鹫的尾羽，我会给你一些钱作为报酬的。我以前经常在猎鹰岗哨北边的巨兽尸骨周围找到它们，你也可以去那边看看。",dEN="With the influx of pilgrims and the encroachment of Alliance forces, things around Falcon Watch have gotten quite busy lately. In my spare time, I usually help prepare batches of arrows for the rangers, but I haven't had the chance to gather feathers for the fletching in a long time.\n\nI could offer you a bit of coin if you'd be willing to gather the tail feathers of the bonestripper vultures. In the past, I've found them circling the bones of large beasts to the north of Falcon Watch.",o="从啄骨秃鹫身上收集8片啄骨秃鹰的尾羽，把它们交给猎鹰岗哨的驯鹰者德蕾娜·河风。",oEN="Gather 8 Bonestripper Tail Feathers from Bonestripper Vultures and bring them to Falconer Drenna Riverwind at Falcon Watch.",p="你拿到那些羽毛了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get all the feathers?",c="这些就足够了。我还担心游侠会有好一阵子没有足够的箭，但现在我又少了一件要担心的事了。谢谢你的帮忙，$c。",cEN="These should do the job. I was concerned that the rangers might be short on arrows for a while, but that's one less thing I have to worry about. Thank you for your help, <class>."}
Q[9383]={d="血精灵就是滥用魔法者的典型，$c。现在，他们已经无法控制魔法的能量，更确切地说，他们已经沦为了魔法的奴隶，彻底根本无法摆脱对魔法能量的依赖与沉迷了。来到外域之后，他们开始汲取外域的虚空行者的力量，并强化了他们那种源自恶魔的法术。\n\n我准备了一块附有符咒的水晶，它可以中和一个虚空行者的身躯，使它被毁灭后就立即切断与这个世界的关联，去试试它吧。我常常看见虚空行者出现在地狱火堡垒东南边的迁跃平原。",dEN="The blood elves epitomize the irresponsible use of magic, <class>. They do not control magical energy. Rather, they are slaves to it and will suffer nothing to stand between them and their addiction. They consume the energies of Outland's voidwalkers to power their demonic magics.\n\nI've prepared a crystal charged with a spell that will allow us to neutralize a voidwalker and sever its link to this world when destroyed. I've mostly seen the voidwalkers in the Warp Fields to the southeast of Hellfire Citadel.",o="在失控的虚空行者受伤之后对其使用净化水晶，然后返回塔哈玛特神殿向艾尔萨娜复命。",oEN="Use the Sanctified Crystal against a wounded Uncontrolled Voidwalker and return to Elsaana at the Temple of Telhamat.",p="你使用水晶的魔法来对抗失控的虚无行者了吗？",pEN="Have you used the crystal's magic against an uncontrolled voidwalker?",c="你做的很好，$n。看来遏制水晶当前已受到控制，但没人知道这样的状况能维持多久。我们会持续监控，同时准备更多的水晶。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. It seems the containment crystal is holding for now, but how long it will last remains a mystery. We'll keep an eye on it and prepare more of the crystals in the meantime."}
Q[9385]={d="荣耀堡派我们来消灭这一带的鸦人势力，到了这边以后，我们觉得这里是个不错的地方，于是就驻扎了下来。然而，我们却根本没有发现这里与钢牙掠食者的老巢竟然如此接近。\n\n它们都是些非常凶猛的掠食者，经常骚扰这里，让我们根本无法进行工作。如果你愿意帮我们干掉它们的话，我们愿意支付你一笔不错的报酬，你觉得怎么样呢？",dEN="So Honor Hold sends us to deal with the arakkoa and we set up camp here thinking hey isn't this a great spot. Little did we know how close we were to the quillfang ravagers.\n\nThey are relentless predators and have made any sort of work on our part impossible. There's a bit of coin in it for you if you can deal with them for us. Do you feel up to it?",o="杀死10只钢牙掠食者，然后向地狱火半岛的格雷尼·长须复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Quillfang Ravagers and return to Gremni Longbeard in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你在处理掠食者威胁上有所斩获了吗？",pEN="Have you made any progress against the ravagers?",c="做得好，$n。这应该让那些怪物知道了谁才是老大！",cEN="Well done, <name>. That should teach those beasts who's boss!"}
Q[9387]={d="那些没有堕落的德莱尼人，例如这个倒霉的家伙，都是圣光忠实的拥护者。究竟是什么导致这个伟大的种族分化出破碎者和失落者呢？\n\n我听来的说法是恶魔的力量导致了德莱尼人的变异。我想验证这种推测是否属实。\n\n此地西北方便是沙纳尔废墟。那儿聚集着地位低下的破碎者，伊利达雷监工负责看管他们。将监工身上的恶魔精华带回来给我，这样我就能用它们在德莱尼人身上做试验了。",dEN="Uncorrupted draenei, like this unlucky fellow here, are virtuous champions of the Light. What corruption caused their great race to devolve into the Broken and Lost Ones?\n\nI've heard a theory that exposure to fel energies is what caused the mutation. I would like to put that theory to the test.\n\nNorthwest of here lie the Ruins of Sha'naar. There you will find lowly Broken commanded by Illidari taskmasters. Bring me demonic essences from the taskmasters so that I can test them on this draenei.",o="转至地狱火半岛的沙纳尔废墟，从伊利达雷监工身上收集5个恶魔精华。完成任务后返回猎鹰岗哨，向药剂师艾瑟森复命。",oEN="Travel to the Ruins of Sha'naar in Hellfire Peninsula and obtain 5 Demonic Essences from the Illidari Taskmasters. Return to Apothecary Azethen at Falcon Watch after you've completed the task.",p="你取得了那些精华吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the samples?",c="你真的帮了很大的忙，$n。现在让我们看看可以从样本中了解什么。",cEN="You've been most helpful, <name>. Now let's see what we can learn from our blue friend."}
Q[9390]={d="请听听我所说的话，$c。我的兄弟瑟丹为了与玛格汉岗哨的兽人取得联系，在很久以前就离开了。他就是这样一个不切实际的家伙，认为现在时机已经成熟，可以将我们的隔阂抛在脑后，大家从此和平相处。\n\n他已经失踪好几天了，我担心他出事了……\n\n你能让我放心，帮我去找找他吗？瑟丹应该是在东边的某个地方。",dEN="Hear my plight, <class>. My brother, Sedai, left long ago to contact the orcs of Mag'har Post. Ever the idealist, he thought the time was ripe to set our differences aside and negotiate a peace with them.\n\nHe's been missing for days and I fear for the worst.\n\nWould you set my mind to rest and look for him? Sedai must be somewhere nearby to the east.",o="学者欧巴迪要你去塔哈玛特神殿东边附近的区域寻找他的兄弟瑟丹。",oEN="Anchorite Obadei wants you to look for his brother, Sedai, nearby to the east in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="你找到年轻德莱尼圣骑士的尸体。他看起像是背部受到了重击而死的。",cEN="You've found the body of a young draenei paladin. He appears to have been slain by a blow to his back."}
Q[9391]={d="我们成功地削减了剥石者的数量，现在只需要指引朝圣者们踏上这条安全的通道。带上这柄燃烧的火炬返回大裂隙，在东边寻找沿途的三座灯塔。\n\n点燃三座灯塔，然后回来向我复命。当你点燃灯塔时，小心那些被吸引而来的剥石者。",dEN="With the rock flayer population thinned, all that's left is to signal the safe path to our pilgrims. Return to the Great Fissure with this torch and seek the three beacons that mark the path from the east.\n\nLight the three beacons and return to me. Be warned that the beacons will attract any nearby rock flayers when you first light them.",o="转至地狱火半岛的大裂隙，点燃南部灯塔、西部灯塔和中部灯塔。完成任务后返回猎鹰岗哨，将燃烧的火炬还给游侠队长维恩雷。",oEN="Ranger Captain Venn'ren at Falcon Watch wants you to go to the Great Fissure in Hellfire Peninsula and light the Southern Beacon, Western Beacon and Central Beacon. Return to him with the Lit Torch after you've completed this task.",p="你完成我所交代的事了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="大裂缝虽然仍然很危险，但它会是我们朝圣者一条安全的路径。\n\n联盟看守着进出猎鹰岗哨的所有道路，它是我们必须奋不顾身去保卫的道路。",cEN="The Great Fissure, though still dangerous, will prove to be a useful path for our pilgrims.\n\nWith the Alliance watching all the roads in and out of Falcon Watch this is the manner of desperate act that is required of us."}
Q[9394]={d="达斯维瑟广场的看守者失踪了！魔导师和其它同伴撤离时一定是忘记通知他一起走了。我估计他还在达斯维瑟广场的某处，不过我可不敢贸然进入那块危机四伏的是非之地。\n\n$c，你能帮我寻找他的下落，确定他安然无恙吗？",dEN="The Duskwither groundskeeper has gone missing! Someone must have forgotten to tell him to leave when the magister and everyone else did. I know that he's still somewhere around here on the grounds, but I dare not go looking for him myself with all of these magical creatures roaming about.\n\nWill you find him for me, <class>, and make sure that he's alright?",o="转至永歌森林的达斯维瑟广场寻找看守者维林森。",oEN="Find Groundskeeper Wyllithen on the Duskwither Grounds in Eversong Woods.",c="你是谁？你不是博学者的学徒之一，我确定！\n\n被派来帮我处理这一团混乱，一定是！",cEN="Who are you? You're not one of the magister's apprentices, that's for certain!\n\nSent here to help me clean up this mess, no doubt!"}
Q[9395]={d="如果萨瑟利尔男爵再催我给他置办什么宴会的补给，老娘就要用大火球秒人了！我看起来像是采办宴会的人吗？！萨瑟利尔这蠢货和他手下那帮马屁精根本无视我们还在这儿孤军奋战！当然，这话咱们俩知道就行了。\n\n我们忙得要死，拼命保卫奎尔萨拉斯仅存的土地！$C，你能帮我跑一趟吗？沿着西边的道路去萨瑟利尔庄园，叫他给我闭嘴！",dEN="I swear that I'm going to fireball someone if I get one more request from Lord Saltheril concerning supplies for his party! Do I look like a party planner?! Between you and me, that fool and his sycophants are living in denial that we're under attack here!\n\nSome of us are actually busy with, oh, I don't know, defending what's left of Quel'Thalas! <class>, would you please head over to Saltheril's Haven and see if you can shut him up? It's just down the road to the west.",o="与永歌森林萨瑟利尔庄园的萨瑟利尔男爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Saltheril at Saltheril's Haven in Eversong Woods.",c="啊，魔导师晨行者终于肯回应我那些小小的请求了。我该去银月城的摄政王面前谈谈她这态度。她可真是无礼！\n\n不过这事你用不着操心。既然你来了，也许我终于能拿到那些等了好久的宴会补给品了？",cEN="Ah, good of Magistrix Dawnstrider to finally respond to my simple requests. I should take up the matter of her attitude with the regent lord in Silvermoon. She's quite rude!\n\nNothing for you to concern yourself with though. Now that you're here, maybe I'll finally be able to get those party supplies that I've been waiting for?"}
Q[9396]={d="外域隐藏着许多秘密，$n。要揭开这些秘密，我们需要的只是时间。\n\n半人半鸟的鸦人氏族掌握着古老而神秘的知识，可以帮助我们探索这个世界。转至南边的哈尔什巢穴。从哈尔什鸟人手中夺得魔法卷轴，将它们带回来给我。",dEN="Outland holds many secrets, <name>. It's only a matter of time before we uncover them all.\n\nThe half-bird, half-man species of the arakkoa possesses ancient arcane knowledge that would aid us greatly in our exploration of this world. Travel to the Den of Haal'esh, south of here. Obtain any magical scrolls that the Haal'eshi might be carrying on them and bring them to me.",o="将4个哈尔什卷轴交给地狱火半岛猎鹰岗哨的奥术师卡雷希斯·晨星。",oEN="Bring 4 Haal'eshi Scrolls to Arcanist Calesthris Dawnstar at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你取得了卷轴吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the scrolls yet, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。外域的秘密不久后就会被我们揭开了。\n\n成为这世界的主宰是我们的注定的。",cEN="Good work, <name>. Outland's secrets will not stay hidden from us for very long.\n\nIt's our destiny to become the masters of this world."}
Q[9397]={d="哈尔什鸦人驯养了一种名叫卡利鸟的飞禽，它们的羽毛非常漂亮。\n\n我设法抓来了一只雄性小卡利鸟，凭我的经验，驯养这种鸟类应该不成问题。不过雌性卡利鸟非常罕见，如果能抓来一只雌鸟，我就能尝试繁殖出它们的后代。但是……她必须是一只小卡利鸟才行。若是强行将成年卡利鸟囚禁起来，她肯定无法存活。\n\n带上这个笼子转至南边的哈尔什巢穴。在卡利鸟巢穴中搜寻那些即将孵化的鸟蛋，如果你能为我抓回一只雌性小卡利鸟，我一定会好好奖赏你的。",dEN="The Haal'eshi arakkoa have domesticated a beautiful bird species called the kaliri.\n\nI've managed to capture a young male and they appear to be trainable. The females are much rarer, but if I had one I could attempt to breed them. She has to be young, though... a hatchling. An older wild bird wouldn't survive in captivity.\n\nTake this cage and travel south, to the Den of Haal'esh. Search the nests for eggs that are ready to hatch. If you bring me back a female hatchling, I'll reward you handsomely.",o="转至地狱火半岛的哈尔什巢穴，在卡利鸟巢穴中寻找雌性小卡利鸟。利用空鸟笼捕获雌性小卡利鸟，将其交给猎鹰岗哨的驯鹰者德蕾娜·河风。",oEN="Travel to the Den of Haal'esh in Hellfire Peninsula and search the Kaliri Nests for a Female Kaliri Hatchling. Use the Empty Birdcage to capture it and bring it to Falconer Drenna Riverwind at Falcon Watch.",p="你回来了。你带回了雌性卡利幼鸟吗？",pEN="You've returned. Did you bring me the kaliri female?",c="你办到了！你捉到了一只雌性幼鸟！\n\n她很珍贵的。非常感谢你，$n。",cEN="You did it! You caught a female hatchling!\n\nShe's precious. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[9398]={d="外域的破碎者是个悲惨的民族，他们的生存权利和自由一直在遭受着无止境的侵害。所以，当黑暗之门开启时，他们满怀着希望大批地涌入了这里，希望转至我们的世界，这一点也不奇怪。\n\n然而不幸的是，栖息在大裂隙附近的那些掠食者却把这些从南边惶恐逃亡过来的兄弟姐妹们当成了唾手可得的猎物。你必须到那里去削减掠食者的力量，这样我们的同胞的生存机会就能改善许多。",dEN="The Broken that live in Outland have endured endless violence. It is of little surprise that as soon as the Dark Portal opened they flocked to it in droves with hopes of escaping this land.\n\nUnfortunately for our confused brothers and sisters coming from the south, the rock flayers that inhabit the Great Fissure see them as easy prey. Go there and thin the rock flayer population, so that our kin might have a chance.",o="地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的斥候瓦努拉要你杀死8只石镰幼崽和4只石镰突击者。",oEN="Scout Vanura at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to slay 8 Stonescythe Whelps and 4 Stonescythe Alpha.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。我交给你的任务完成了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>. Have you completed the task I asked of you?",c="你做得很好，$n。靠着夺取别人的生命以存活总是一件不幸的事情，即使对象是一只如同石镰怪的危险野兽也是一样。\n\n谢谢你完成了这个残酷的任务。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. It is always unfortunate to have to resort to taking a life, even when it's that of a dangerous beast such as the rock flayer.\n\nYou have my thanks for carrying out this grim task."}
Q[9399]={d="你该不会认为大多数破碎者都是邪恶的吧？其实，他们大多本性善良，只是缺少正确的道德与信仰指引而已。\n\n在见到欧麦尼——也就是神殿中的这些德莱尼人以前，我也几乎完全迷失了自我。\n\n兽人的恶魔法术折磨着我们的思想，从而让我们很容易受到他们的迷惑，被他们利用。\n\n除此以外，恶魔们也会和伊利丹联手，他们常常袭击地狱火半岛，并将我们变成他们的奴隶。直到欧麦尼出现之后，我们才有了希望。到西南边的沙纳尔废墟去杀掉那些伊利达雷监工，我的人民才有希望获得自由！",dEN="You probably think most Broken are evil, don't you? In reality many just lack guidance.\n\nBefore I met the Omenai, I too was lost.\n\nOur minds suffered terrible pain from the orcs' demonic magic. We are easily confused and taken advantage of.\n\nDemons allied with Illidan raid Hellfire daily and capture our kind as slaves. With the Omenai we now have hope. Travel to the Ruins of Sha'naar, southwest of here, and slay the Illidari taskmasters so my people may be free!",o="转至沙纳尔废墟，杀死4名伊利达雷监工，然后向地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的伊坎复命。",oEN="Slay 4 Illidari Taskmasters at the Ruins of Sha'naar and return to Ikan at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你回来了！你完成任务了吗？",pEN="You've returned! Did you complete your task?",c="你办到了！我欠你一份人情，$n。看看那些出现的残冠人们。\n\n在我的领导下，他们将会学习到许多传统，等着瞧吧。",cEN="You did it! I'm in your debt, <name>. Look at all the Dreghoods that are showing up.\n\nUnder my guidance they'll learn all about the old ways, you'll see."}
Q[9400]={d="$n，最近我们发现，我们派驻在猎鹰岗哨的特使陷入了被刺杀的危险之中。地狱火堡垒刺探到了我们的计划，今天上午早些时候派出了一支敢死队准备发动突袭。\n\n我们的斥候报告说，当前有一位名叫克伦·断脊者的刺客正在堡垒北方的路边待命。立刻过去杀死这名刺客。要让那帮邪兽人知道，我们可不是好对付的！",dEN="<name>, we recently uncovered a plot to assassinate our envoy to Falcon Watch. Hellfire Citadel learned of our plans to send an expedition there earlier this morning and set up an ambush.\n\nOur scouts have informed me that an assassin known as Krun Spinebreaker waits along the road north of the Citadel. Go there and slay this assassin. Show the fel orcs we're not to be trifled with!",o="纳兹格雷尔要求你到地狱火堡垒北方的道路附近寻找一个名叫克伦·断脊者的刺客。",oEN="Nazgrel wants you to travel to the road north of Hellfire Citadel and look for an assassin named Krun Spinebreaker.",c="这具尸体的特征跟地狱火堡垒的刺客克伦·断脊者的描述吻合。当你把尸体翻过来时，你注意到他背后插着一把石斧。",cEN="The corpse matches the description of Krun Spinebreaker, Hellfire Citadel's assassin. As you turn the body over, you notice a stone axe protruding from his back."}
Q[9401]={d="你从尸体上拔下了这把石斧，放在眼前仔细检查。这把武器的制造工艺有点不同寻常。\n\n它的样式与外形的确是兽人风格，但材料却是你从来没有见过的。纳兹格雷尔或许会对这把武器有点兴趣。",dEN="You pull the stone axe out of the body to examine it more closely. There's something unusual about the craftsmanship of the weapon.\n\nIts origin appears orcish, though the materials aren't like anything you've seen before. Nazgrel might be interested in seeing the weapon.",o="将重型石斧交给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Bring the Heavy Stone Axe to Nazgrel in Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="告诉我，刺客死了吗？",pEN="Tell me, is the assassin dead?",c="他是被这个武器杀死的？不可能！\n\n我们……找到他们了吗？",cEN="He was killed by this weapon? It can't be!\n\nHave we... found them?"}
Q[9402]={d="你是……$n，对吧？别因为我知道你的名字就得意，我有个学生一直对你赞不绝口，嘴就没停过。\n\n嗯……你要是想给他或她留下点印象，何不帮我做件事？我身后的池塘底下有一只蔚蓝小瓶。潜下去，把它捞上来带给我。",dEN="So... <name> is it? Don't be flattered I know your name, one of my students has been fawning over you and won't shut up.\n\nHmm... if you'd like to impress <her/him>, why don't you do something for me? There's an azure phial at the bottom of the pond behind me. Dive in, retrieve it, and bring it here.",o="在萦语水池底部为指导者安瑟隆找到碧蓝瓶。",oEN="Dive to the bottom of Stillwhisper Pond and retrieve the Azure Phial for Instructor Antheol.",p="叫你潜水的事情进行的如何？",pEN="How's the water?",c="哦，干得不错……我叫你跳进池塘，你就真跳了。我真想象不出，要是你的好朋友开口，你还会做出什么来。\n\n你想要报酬的话，就是这个：在弄清自己能有什么好处之前，绝不要动一根手指。$c的头脑就是$g他:她;最强大的武器。记住这一点，多用用你的脑子。",cEN="Oh, well done... I told you to jump in a pond, and you did. I can only imagine what you'd do if one of your good friends asked it of you.\n\nIf you want a reward for your efforts, it is this: never lift a finger without first knowing what's in it for you. The <class>'s mind is his greatest weapon. Remember that and try to use yours a bit more."}
Q[9403]={d="既然你上了这一小课，我就再给你点更实在的。这次关乎你在近身战斗中自保的能力。当然，只有在最危急的关头才该动用近战，但那不是你$g毫无准备:毫无准备;的借口。\n\n我可以帮你制作一根配得上你这种学识的法杖。你只需拿上替我取回的那只小瓶，到艾兰达瀑布脚下取水灌满。路很好找，从这里沿着河往东南走就是。",dEN="Now that you've learned a little lesson, I'll offer you something more substantial. It concerns your ability to defend yourself in close combat. Of course, you should only resort to melee in the most dire of circumstances, but that is no excuse to be unprepared.\n\nI can assist you in creating a staff befitting a mage of your learning. Simply take the phial you retrieved for me and fill it at the base of Elrendar Falls. Just follow the river southeast from here.",o="指导者安瑟隆希望你能在碧蓝瓶中装满艾伦达尔瀑布的水。",oEN="Instructor Antheol wants you to fill the Azure Phial at Elrendar Falls.",p="只有从艾兰达瀑布取得之最纯净的水才能被跟法术一起使用。你拿到它了吗？",pEN="Only water from the Elrendar Falls has the purity required for use with magic. Do you have it?",c="来看看你给我带了什么来……\n\n<他拿起玻璃瓶到光源下仔细地检视。>\n\n很好，这很适合。做得好，$n。",cEN="Let's see what you've brought me...\n\n<He holds the phial up to the light and examines it closely.>\n\nYes, this will do. Well done, <name>."}
Q[9404]={d="你应该注意到在艾伦达尔瀑布附近行走的那些树了吧？作为大自然的守护者，它们身上都有着原始的魔法能量，我们可以使用你收集的水来改造这些魔法能量。\n\n不幸的是，这些绿色的守护者们都是些狂暴而扭曲的生物，所以如果你想找到一根有用的树枝，也许需要干掉许多守护者。",dEN="You may have noticed the walking trees near Elrendar Falls. As the keepers of nature, they are infused with a primal magic we can reform to our own purposes using the pure water you have already brought to me.\n\nUnfortunately, the green keepers are gnarled and twisted creatures, so you may need to kill a few before you find a useable branch.",o="清理永歌护卫者，直至你找到指导者安瑟隆所需要的生命绿枝。",oEN="Slay the Eversong Green Keepers until they yield a Living Branch for Instructor Antheol.",p="你拿到了吗？快把它交给我！",pEN="Do you have the living branch? Hand it over quickly!",c="你已完成我要你做的事了，$n，你可以拿走你的奖励了。",cEN="You've done as I've asked, <name>, and you may take your reward now."}
Q[9405]={d="你应该知道，酋长之所以在这支远征军中投入了这么多的资源，其理由只有一个。这个世界曾是我们的故乡，这里是我们的根源所在。\n\n来到这里，对于一个兽人与一个血精灵来说有着完全不同的意义。他们来到这里，是为了寻找一处新的家园，而我们则是回到了久违的故乡。\n\n不知是谁用我们兽人的工艺制成了这把石斧，但我们一定要找到他。它很重要，有了它，就可以利用我们最传统的方法来找到制作者。把这武器拿给先知雷古库特看看，她知道该做什么。",dEN="As you know, the warchief put his power behind this expedition for one reason. This is the world we came from. This is where our roots lie.\n\nThis journey means different things to orcs and blood elves. To them it's a search for the promised land. To us it's more like returning home.\n\nWhoever made this axe is familiar with the old ways and we must contact them. This is too important for us to use ordinary tracking methods. Show the weapon to Far Seer Regulkut; she will know what to do.",o="将重型石斧交给萨尔玛的先知雷古库特。",oEN="Bring the Heavy Stone Axe to Far Seer Regulkut at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="告诉我你在找了什么，我可以帮助你找到它。",pEN="Tell me what you seek, so that I may help you find it.",c="我了解纳兹格雷尔的要求，$c。不要再说了。",cEN="I understand Nazgrel's request, <class>. Say no more."}
Q[9406]={d="这……这就是你从黑暗之门的那一边带来的消息吗？你是说……你是说杜隆坦的儿子正统治着那边的国度，还……还已经摆脱了恶魔的操控？现在，他的手下已经回到了这个世界？！你要我们相信这些吗？\n\n希望这不是你开的玩笑，$c。这对我的人民来说意味着……不，这简直无法形容……我必须立刻通知纳格兰那边，必须立刻通知地狱咆哮大人。\n\n把这封信送给你在萨尔玛的上级。告诉他们，玛格汉欢迎他们回家！",dEN="This news you bring from beyond the Dark Portal... you want us to believe the son of Durotan now rules over the lands beyond it... free from any demonic taint? And that now his people have returned to this world?\n\nI hope for your sake that this isn't some manner of joke, <class>. What this means to my people... cannot be described. I must send word to Nagrand at once! Hellscream must hear about this.\n\nTake this letter back to your leader in Thrallmar. Tell him the Mag'har welcome them!",o="将玛格汉的来信送给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Deliver the Letter from the Mag'har to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你带了什么来给我们，$n？",pEN="What do you bring us, <name>?",c="你$g确定:确定;吗？$n，这非常重要。那些兽人对我们的事业大有帮助，无论在这里还是在我们家乡！",cEN="You're certain of this? True orcs... here in Hellfire! This is big news, <name>.\n\nWe must inform the warchief at once."}
Q[9407]={d="多年来，黑暗之门一直静默矗立……被人遗忘。但它不再沉默了。\n\n在击退这里的恶魔进攻之后，我们的部队冲过传送门，在恶魔自己的土地上与他们交锋！\n\n如今我们陷入了一场残酷的战争，有人认为我们或许赢不了。所以，与外域的恶魔作战、确保我们取胜，就是我们的职责，也是我们冷峻的乐趣，$n。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我们，就立刻向中将奥里昂报到。他在外域等你……|n",dEN="For years the Dark Portal loomed silent... forgotten. But it is silent no longer.\n\nAfter stopping the demonic assault here, our forces breached the portal and met the demons on their own ground!\n\nNow, we are locked in a savage war, and there are some who think we might not win. So it is our duty, our grim pleasure, to battle the fiends of Outland and ensure our victory, <name>.\n\nIf you would help us, then report to Lieutenant General Orion at once. He awaits you in the Outland...",o="穿过黑暗之门，找到中将奥里昂。他在传送门另一边的外域等候你的到来。|n",oEN="Travel through the Dark Portal and find Lieutenant General Orion. He awaits your arrival on the other side, in Outland.",c="我们的远征队安全的通过黑暗之门并且创建一个新的据点叫做萨尔玛。但是如你所见，燃烧军团进驻并将我们与我们的弟兄们分开。很明显地，恶魔们想要重建黑暗之门以防止我们从艾泽拉斯获得任何的援兵。",cEN="Our Expedition made it safely through the Portal and set up a new base called Thrallmar. Yet as you can see. the Burning Legion moved in and cut us off from our brothers. Clearly, the demons hope to retake the Dark Portal and prevent us from gathering reinforcements from Azeroth."}
Q[9409]={d="你收集到的蛾血足以填补治疗水晶的需求缺口，将这一组药水瓶交给牧师扎尔杜吧，他在飞船的中央室里照顾受伤的伙伴。",dEN="Now that you've gathered all that we need to replenish our healing crystals, I need you to deliver the vials to Zalduun, our priest. You'll find him tending to our wounded inside the central chamber of the ship.",o="将一组药水瓶交给埃门谷坠毁点的扎尔杜。",oEN="Deliver the Bundle of Vials to Zalduun at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="嗨，$c。你拿着什么？是给我的吗？",pEN="Hello, <class>. What have you there? Is it for me?",c="做得好！这很适合补充我们消耗的治疗水晶。\n\n但既然你来到这里，我想我有另一件事要交给你，你愿意吗？",cEN="Good work! This will do nicely to replenish our depleted healing crystals.\n\nBut now that you're here, I think I have another use for you, if you're willing?"}
Q[9410]={d="使用幽灵狼吧，即使是最优秀的战狼在追踪技巧上也无法与它们匹敌，$n。元素之灵的感官与了解世界的方式和我们完全不同。它们并不是使用嗅觉，而是使用心灵来进行追踪。\n\n去吧， $c，将这支图腾带上，在你发现那把石斧的地方使用它。",dEN="Even our best tracking wolves' senses can fail them, <name>. The spirits have a way of seeing the world differently than ours. The being you will call forth will find the person you seek, for they'll be drawn not to their scent but their essence.\n\nGo now, <class>, take this totem with you and use it at the location you found the stone axe.",o="在你找到克伦·断脊者尸体的地方使用先祖狼魂图腾，并跟随先祖狼魂前进。",oEN="Use the Wolf Totem at the location where you found Krun Spinebreaker's body and follow the Ancestral Spirit Wolf.",p="你还$g活着:活着;，算是走运。",pEN="You are lucky to be alive.",c="你是谁，竟敢不经通报就擅自进入？利迦感应到有灵魂伴随着你，所以我命令我的人守护在这。\n\n说吧，但注意你的言辞，我们可是很少相信这么接近堡垒的陌生人。",cEN="Who are you to walk in here unannounced? I ordered my men to stay their hand only because Ryga sensed that the spirits were with you.\n\nSpeak freely, but choose your words wisely. We rarely trust strangers this close to the Citadel."}
Q[9415]={d="你就是蓝墙元帅的新兵吗？当然是的。\n\n你还在等什么？好士兵正在沙漠里送命。想到就要加入他们，难道你不兴奋吗？\n\n现在，出发吧，别在半路上$g被烤干:被烤干;了。",dEN="Are you Marshal Bluewall's new recruits? Of course you are.\n\nWhat are you waiting for? Good soldiers are dying in the desert. Aren't you excited to join them?\n\nNow, get going and don't dry out on the way.",o="与佐拉虫巢附近联盟营地的布鲁沃尔元帅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.",c="联盟需要所有有能力的人。部落一直从北方大陆获得稳定的援军物资，我们要撑下去实在很艰难。\n\n让我把情况解释给你听。",cEN="The Alliance needs every able body they can get. The Horde has been receiving a steady supply of reinforcements from the northern part of the continent, and it's been a struggle to keep up.\n\nLet me explain the situation to you."}
Q[9416]={d="你一定就是吉里卡将军招募来的新兵了？来的正是时候，沙漠里激战正酣呢！\n\n现在矮人几乎每天都能得到增援，我们要想争夺希利苏斯的资源的话，可不能失去任何据点。\n\n立刻到将军那里去接受命令，我的任务可不是训练你，只是找到你而已。",dEN="You must be one of General Kirika's new recruits. It's about time you showed up. Bodies wear down quick in the desert.\n\nThe dwarves have been getting reinforcements daily, and we can't afford to lose ground in our struggle for resources in Silithus.\n\nGet your instructions from the General. It's not my job to train you, just find you.",o="与雷戈虫巢附近部落营地的吉里卡将军谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with General Kirika at the Horde encampment near Hive'Regal.",c="你能来很好，但没时间闲聊了。你需要指令，然后就得出发。\n\n$g听好了:听好了;。",cEN="It's good that you're here, but there's no time to waste making small talk. You need instructions, and then you need to get out there.\n\nListen up."}
Q[9417]={d="鸦人是一种非常聪明的生物……他们可能跟你遇见过的所有侏儒一样聪明。更厉害的是，他们也同样精通魔法，并且，所有鸦人都无一例外地有着暴躁易怒的坏脾气。\n\n最近他们常常袭击荣耀堡周围的巡逻兵，这也是我们被派到这里来的原因。不过呢，你瞧，米伦和我都是众所周知的超级射手！但我们擅长的是森林围猎和射击比赛……而不是对付这些……这些会放闪电的鸟人。\n\n所以，你愿意助我们一臂之力吗？你在西南方就能找到哈尔什巢穴。",dEN="The arakkoa are smart creatures... smart as any gnome you ever met. They have this way with magic and a violent temper, however.\n\nLately they've taken to attacking Honor Hold patrols, which is why we were sent here. See, Mirren and I are world-famous marksmen, we are! But fowl and game are what we specialize in... not these... lightning-invoking birdmen.\n\nSo what do you say you give us a hand in this one assignment? You'll find the Den of Haal'esh to the southwest.",o="地狱火半岛的格雷尼·长须要你杀死4名哈尔什风行者和6名哈尔什利爪卫兵。",oEN="Gremni Longbeard in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to slay 4 Haal'eshi Windwalkers and 6 Haal'eshi Talonguards.",p="你回来了！如何？",pEN="You're back! How did you do?",c="干得太棒了，$n！我在此授予你$g荣誉长须:荣誉长须;的称号。\n\n留下来跟我们一起喝一杯吧，怎么样？",cEN="Great job, <name>! I hereby proclaim you an honorary Longbeard.\n\nStick around and have a drink with us, won't you?"}
Q[9418]={d="<当你将宝珠逐渐拿过来时，忽然某个声音对你说起话来。>\n\n我知道你不是鸦人，所以我想跟你做笔交易，让我获得自由。我叫埃拉纳斯，是空气元素的首领之一。不幸的是，我被哈尔什的法师亚维鲁利用妖术困在了这个宝珠内。\n\n首先，你要找到鸦人囚禁我的祭坛，它就隐藏在鸦人洞穴的东南边。然后，你必须将宝珠带去那里，释放我出来，并把宝珠交给我，这样一切就都结束了。到时候，为了感谢你让我重获自由，我会送你一些珍贵的财宝！",dEN="<As you hold the orb closer to you, you hear a voice address you.>\n\nI sense you're not of the arakkoa, so I will attempt to barter for my freedom. My name is Aeranas. I once ruled over the eastern winds. The Haal'eshi mage, Avruu, trapped me inside this orb.\n\nFind the altar the arakkoa used to enslave me. It is hidden to the southeast of the arakkoa's den. Approach it with the orb and give it to me once I'm free. In exchange for my liberty I'll reward you with powerful treasure!",o="转至地狱火半岛哈尔什巢穴东南方的哈尔什祭坛，将亚维鲁的宝珠交给重获自由的埃拉纳斯。",oEN="Take Avruu's Orb to the Haal'eshi Altar southeast of the Den of Haal'esh in Hellfire Peninsula and give it to Aeranas once he's free.",p="我一直盼望的自由终于是我的了！",pEN="The freedom I've yearned for is finally mine!",c="有了这个宝珠我又重获自由。拿着这个奖励，凡人，这样我们的帐就一笔勾销了。",cEN="With this orb I regain my liberty. Take your reward, mortal, so that our debt may be settled."}
Q[9419]={d="最近我们发现部落正在希利苏斯的沙漠上进行一些扫荡行动，以争夺宝贵的资源，不过不必担心这些家伙。我们不认为他们值得我军在酷热的沙漠上派驻大批兵员。\n\n但是，资源的重要性却是不容质疑的，我们也决定做出一些行动。\n\n如果你有能力的话，立刻进入沙漠地区，夺回一些希利苏斯水晶尘，然后回到这里。",dEN="We recently found out that the Horde has been scavenging the Silithus desert for resources, but paid them little mind. We thought it could not be worth it to station large numbers in this sweltering desert.\n\nHowever, it was discovered the importance of the resources, and now we are scrambling to catch up.\n\nIf I have your assistance, you must go into the desert and recover the silithyst and return it here.",o="找到一份水晶尘，将其送到水晶尘萃取器那里，然后向佐拉虫巢外联盟营地的布鲁沃尔元帅复命。",oEN="Find and deliver Silithyst to the Silithyst Extractor, then speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.",p="在外要小心，但动作也要$g快:快;。我们没时间可浪费。",pEN="Be careful out there, but also be quick. We have no time to lose.",c="感谢圣光你成功了。\n\n如果我们可以早点这么做，我们的需求就不会如此迫切了。我们绝对不能让沙漠里的物资落入部落手中。",cEN="Thank the Light you were successful.\n\nNow if we could only have started this sooner, our need would not be so desperate. We must keep the bounty of the desert from falling into the hands of the Horde."}
Q[9420]={d="南边哈尔什巢穴的鸦人驯养了一种巨型的卡利鸟，而这种鸟类的羽毛是艾泽拉斯世界许多贸易站重金收购的目标。想想吧，要是卖一批过去，我就能买无数的麦酒了！\n\n总之，你帮我搞一些卡利鸟的羽毛回来，我会送给你一顶我家特制的帽子，你觉得怎么样？放心，你决不可能在别的地方找到那样一顶绝世好帽的！来，做笔交易吧，怎么样？",dEN="The arakkoa at the Den of Haal'esh, south of here, breed a magnificent species of birds called kaliri. Their feathers would fetch a bundle at the trading posts back in Azeroth. Just think of all the ale I could buy then!\n\nTell you what, you bring me a stack of kaliri feathers and I'll give you my very own hat. What do you say? You'll never find a hat like this one! Do we have a deal?",o="转至哈尔什巢穴，从各种卡利鸟身上收集8片卡利鸟的羽毛，将它们交给地狱火半岛的米伦·长须。",oEN="Mirren Longbeard in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring him 8 Kaliri Feathers from the various kaliri found in the Den of Haal'esh.",p="你把卡利羽毛带回来给我了吗，$c？",pEN="Did you bring me the kaliri feathers, <class>?",c="你完成了你的部分。我想一言为定吧！\n\n这是你该获得的。好好善待它。",cEN="You did your part. I guess a deal is a deal!\n\nHere you go, friend. Treat it well."}
Q[9422]={d="不久以前，我们开始吸收希利苏斯沙漠中水晶资源的力量。过去，开采过程中唯一遇到的危险不过是那些以沙漠为家的野兽，以及沙漠的干旱和炎热。\n\n但现在联盟似乎也开始争夺这些我们先发现的东西了。现在看来，我们正在展开一场竞赛，双方都想要彻底占领这些资源，并防止它们落入对方的手中。\n\n我需要一切可以依靠的力量，希望你能帮助我。",dEN="For some time now, we have been tapping the crystal resources of the Silithus desert. The only dangers we faced were from the creatures that made this place their home and the oppressive sand and dust and heat.\n\nBut now the Alliance seems to have caught on to what we have found here. It is now a race between us to capture the natural resources, and keep them from the other.\n\nI need every set of hands that is available. I hope I have yours.",o="找到一份水晶尘，将其送到水晶尘萃取器那里，然后向雷戈虫巢外部落营地的吉里卡将军复命。",oEN="Find and deliver Silithyst to the Silithyst Extractor then speak with General Kirika at the Horde encampment near Hive'Regal.",p="小心沙漠里的危险，$n。有联盟在沙丘里埋伏，你的任何一步都可能是最后一步。",pEN="Be wary of the dangers of the desert, <name>. With the Alliance lurking in the dunes, any step could be your last.",c="你做的很好，$n。这些资源会加入我们的库存之中，每一分都是我们的优势，敌人的弱势。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. These resources will be added to our stockpiles, and every bit is to our gain and our enemy's loss."}
Q[9423]={d="瑟丹的确已经死了，你要回去把这个不幸的消息告诉欧巴迪。",dEN="With Sedai's death confirmed, you're left with the unpleasant task of returning to Obadei with the grim news.",o="返回地狱火半岛的塔哈玛特神殿向学者欧巴迪复命，告诉他瑟丹已经死了。",oEN="Return to Anchorite Obadei at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula and inform him of Sedai's death.",c="瑟丹，我亲爱的兄弟……\n\n那些卑劣的兽人！他手无寸铁，他们怎么可以这样做？\n\n让我一个人静一静，$n。我很感谢你的协助，但是我还是希望现在能一个人静一静。",cEN="Sedai, dear brother...\n\nThose cowardly orcs! He was unarmed, how could they?\n\nLeave me be, <name>. I thank you for your assistance but I wish to be alone with my thoughts now."}
Q[9424]={d="瑟丹就像是玛库鲁的兄弟。我们欠他的实在太多了！他们说玛库鲁疯了，可如果这些欧麦尼不为瑟丹的死亡做点什么，他们才是最疯狂的！\n\n在这个世界上玛库鲁拥有的东西不多，不过你愿意帮瑟丹报仇的话，他会把他唯一的财产给你。\n\n玛库鲁在东北边的山坡上看到过玛格汉步兵。他们对我们充满了敌意！我们绝对不能对他们仁慈！去为瑟丹报仇！把他们的先祖念珠带回来证明他们已经死掉了！",dEN="Sedai was like a brother to Makuru. We owe him our lives and more! They call Makuru crazy but if the Omenai are not going to do anything about his death then they're the crazy ones!\n\nMakuru doesn't have much to call his own in this world, but he will give you his only possession if you avenge Sedai.\n\nI've seen the brown orc Mag'har grunts before, up in the hills to the northeast. They hate us! They don't deserve our mercy! Go, avenge Sedai! Bring me their ancestral beads as proof!",o="地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的玛库鲁要你带回10个玛格汉先祖念珠。",oEN="Makuru at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring him 10 Mag'har Ancestral Beads.",p="你帮助玛库鲁替瑟丹报仇了吗？",pEN="Did you avenge Sedai for Makuru?",c="很好……报仇了！你做得很好。\n\n拿着这个。这是瑟丹给的礼物。只是玛库鲁不太想看到。",cEN="Yes... revenge! You did good.\n\nYou take this now. It was a gift from Sedai. It only makes Makuru sad to see it."}
Q[9425]={d="啊，$c，能在这儿见到你真高兴！我有一项非常适合你的任务要交给你。\n\n作为部落的新成员，我们必须向其它盟友伸出援手，这样他们也会礼尚往来的。\n\n转至东南方的希尔斯布莱德丘陵，到那座被遗忘者的城镇塔伦米尔去，跟顾问达斯多恩谈谈。",dEN="Ah, good to see you here, <class>! I've a task that you are perfectly suited to.\n\nAs new members of the Horde, we need to make sure that we support their efforts and help them with their problems. That way they'll be more receptive to helping us with ours.\n\nTravel to the Forsaken town, Tarren Mill, in the Hillsbrad Foothills to the southeast. Check in with Advisor Duskingdawn when you arrive.",o="转至希尔斯布莱德丘陵的塔伦米尔，与顾问达斯多恩谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Tarren Mill in the Hillsbrad Foothills and speak with Advisor Duskingdawn.",c="$g又一位:又一位;我的$g兄弟:姐妹;赶来帮忙了。好！要支援我们新的被遗忘者朋友，可有不少事要做，$n。去四处问问，看你能帮上谁的忙。\n\n我知道你一定会竭尽全力支持他们！",cEN="My, my! Another of my brothers arrives to pitch in. Good! There is much to be done in support of our new Forsaken friends, <class>. Ask around to see who you can help out.\n\nI know that you will support them to your utmost ability!"}
Q[9426]={d="昔日的德拉诺世界发生了翻天复地的变化。恶魔的力量在大地的某些地方留下了永恒的烙印。\n\n阿苟纳之池便是被污染的圣地之一。那儿曾经流淌着德莱尼氏族神圣的泉水，但是现在，恶魔阿苟纳的血液污染了圣水的精华。如果我们想要夺回阿苟纳之池，就必须清理掉那些被邪血污染的生物。转至东边的阿苟纳之池，杀死盘踞在那里的恐惧魔和腐泥怪。",dEN="Much has changed since the days when we called this land Draenor. Parts of the land have been forever changed by the demons' taint.\n\nOne such place is known as the Pools of Aggonar. It was once the location of our people's sacred springs. The blood of the demon Aggonar fouled the very essence of the holy waters. This fel blood has spawned foul beings that must be cleansed if we're ever to reclaim the pools. Travel east of here and slay the Terrorfiends and slimes that wander the pools.",o="智者阿曼恩要你转至阿苟纳之池，杀死6个恐惧魔和6个起泡的腐泥怪。",oEN="Amaan the Wise wants you to go to the Pools of Aggonar and slay 6 Terrorfiends and 6 Blistering Rots.",p="你完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="是的，我感觉恶魔力量愈来愈薄弱了。\n\n你做得很好，$n。",cEN="Yes, I feel the fel presence in the pools weakening.\n\nYou've done well, <name>."}
Q[9427]={d="我想麻烦你再跑一趟，帮助我们实现净化阿苟纳之池的愿望。你成功地削弱了恶魔的势力，现在只需带上这个净化水瓶，将它倒在阿苟纳之池的污染源——阿苟纳的尸体上。\n\n恶魔的尸骨就在阿苟纳之池的最北边。千万小心，我觉得他的精华并没有完全离开这个世界。",dEN="I must ask that you finish what we've set in motion. Now that the demonic influence has weakened you must take this cleansing vial and pour it at the very source of the taint - Aggonar's own corpse.\n\nYou will find the demon's bones at the northern end of the pools. Beware, I sense that Aggonar's essence has not quite left this world.",o="转至阿苟纳之池，对阿苟纳的尸体使用净化水瓶。当阿苟纳的精华被净化之后，回去向智者阿曼恩复命。",oEN="Amaan the Wise wants you to travel to the Pools of Aggonar and use the Cleansing Vial at Aggonar's corpse. Return to him when Aggonar's essence is cleansed from the water.",p="你回来了，$n。这些水已经净化了吗？",pEN="You return, <name>. Are the waters cleansed?",c="阿苟纳的本质以他腐败的产物赖以为生。因为你成功地击败了恶魔，我们才能再次让池子恢复到原本的纯净。\n\n我们非常感谢你，$n。你的付出对这个世界有极大的影响。",cEN="The essence of Aggonar lived on in the form of his foul offspring Aggonis. With your success in defeating the demon, we can begin to work towards restoring the pools to their former purity.\n\nYou have our thanks, <name>. Your work will have a deep impact in this world."}
Q[9428]={d="<大使凑到你耳边压低了嗓门儿。>\n\n我对你的名头早有耳闻，$n。我想要你去灰谷的碎木岗哨跑一趟。往南一直走，穿越杜隆塔尔和贫瘠之地，然后在路口往北转就到了。\n\n去那儿跟萨苏恩·火盟谈谈。路上小心，灰谷是个相当危险的地方！",dEN="<The ambassador keeps her voice low as she leans in close.>\n\nYour reputation precedes you, <name>. I want you to travel to Splintertree Post in Ashenvale. The easiest way to get there on foot is to travel west through Durotar and the Barrens, and then turn north at the fork in the road.\n\nWhen you arrive, speak with Advisor Sunsworn. Travel carefully; Ashenvale can be a very dangerous place!",o="转至灰谷的碎木岗哨，与顾问萨苏恩·火盟谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Splintertree Post in Ashenvale and speak with Advisor Sunsworn.",c="大使发出了命令，所以我一直在等你。\n\n大使只是要你在这里尽你最大的努力帮助我们。她说了某些关于巩固我们和部落关系的事。\n\n四处问问——在岗哨后面还有很多需要帮忙的事。我听说那里有另一个叫做佐拉姆加前哨站的部落岗哨，就在西方沿岸。",cEN="The ambassador sent word ahead, so I've been expecting you.\n\nThe ambassador simply wants you to do as much as you can to help out around here. She said something about making sure to cement our relationship with the rest of the Horde.\n\nAsk around - there are others in need of help further back in the Post. And I hear that there's another Horde outpost called Zoram'gar Outpost on the coast all the way to the west."}
Q[9429]={d="我听说在暴风王国那边有一种奇特的荆棘。它生长在暮色森林中某处被邪恶与腐朽的亡灵气息所饱满灌注了的土地上。\n\n鉴于我们这里这么忙，我希望你能去跑一趟。转至东南方的人类城镇——夜色镇。学者德尔兰会在那边等待着你的到达。",dEN="I am told that there is a thorn in the side of the kingdom of Stormwind. It is known as Duskwood, and it is a place that is filled with evil and the vile stench of undeath.\n\nAs we're trying to help as much as we can, I would like for you to travel southeast to the main human settlement there, named Darkshire. Anchorite Delan will be awaiting your arrival.",o="转至暮色森林的夜色镇，与学者德尔兰谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Darkshire in Duskwood and speak with Anchorite Delan.",c="你好，$n。我想你这一路走来应该平安无事吧？\n\n这些可怜人四面都受到夜行生物的侵扰。我们希望你能尽力帮助他们，把黑暗逼退。\n\n在镇上走走，认识认识这里的居民。拜托了，$n，尽你所能帮帮他们。",cEN="Greetings, <class>. I trust that you're journey here was uneventful?\n\nThese poor souls are beset upon all sides by the creatures of the night. It is our wish that you lend them what aid you can in pushing back the darkness.\n\nTravel about the town and get to know its inhabitants. Please, <name>, help them in any way that you can."}
Q[9430]={d="正如我之前所说的，我并没有看到别人无法看到的东西。我不会对你帮助玛库鲁这件事做任何评论，我想你需要的是对自己见到的事物有更深入的了解。\n\n到西南边的沙纳尔废墟去寻找散落在那里的圣物。如果运气好的话，你会找到我们所需要的东西。\n\n你不会马上就明白这个任务的意义，不过你一定要有信心，$n。只有拥有足够的耐心时，你才能明白其中的道理。",dEN="As I've told you before, I do not require eyes to see what others cannot. I will not pass judgment on what you did on Makuru's behalf, yet I think you need to see beyond what your eyes show you.\n\nTravel southwest to the Ruins of Sha'naar and salvage any relics you find. If fate wills it you will find what we need.\n\nThe meaning of my request might not be immediately apparent. Have faith though, <name>. Clarity comes to those with patience.",o="地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的智者阿曼恩要你去沙纳尔废墟找回10个沙纳尔圣物。",oEN="Amaan the Wise at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to travel to the Ruins of Sha'naar and retrieve 10 Sha'naar Relics.",p="你拿到沙纳尔圣物了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you retrieve the Sha'naar relics, <name>?",c="你非常幸运。如我所期望的一样，你已经找到和这些相同的特殊圣物。",cEN="You're very fortunate. Just as I had hoped, you've found a special relic among these other ones."}
Q[9431]={d="你一定很想问，怎么会有一个血精灵站在千针石林的风蚀丘陵上，而不是在银月城的厅堂之中的？\n\n我的同族们抛弃了我，不再需要我了。我所有有关自然可以治愈我们那种魔瘾的论文都被烧毁了。\n\n现在我可以自由自在地在这里进行研究，可惜的是，我的研究材料用光了。如果你愿意从栖息在千针石林最西边的雷鸣岩石元素身上帮我采集一些净化过的泥土，并帮我带去给我在白沙岗哨的同事，那么我会非常感谢你的。",dEN="What's a sin'dorei doing standing on the top of a windswept butte in Thousand Needles instead of the halls of Silvermoon?\n\nIt's simple. My brethren will no longer have me. Every copy of my treatise on natural cures for our magical addiction was burned.\n\nI can safely pursue my research here, but I am without my reagents. If you'd be willing to gather purifying earth from the thundering boulderkin near the western end of the Needles and deliver it to my associate at Whitereach Post, I'd appreciate it.",o="从雷鸣岩石元素身上收集两份纯净之土，把它们交给白沙岗哨的维兹罗。",oEN="Gather 2 handfuls of Purifying Earth from Thundering Boulderkin and take them to Wizlo Bearingshiner at Whitereach Post.",p="魔导师艾洛塞的笔记有点隐秘，但我想我了解她想告诉我的话。如果你有她说的泥土，我就能将它放进你需要用来取月亮井之水的容器中。",pEN="Magistrix Elosai's note was a bit cryptic, but I think I understand what she wants me to do. If you have the earth she talked about, I can put it into the vessel you'll need for the moonwell water.",c="什么？她没提到月亮井？那是她脑中一直以来所想的。我承认整件事有点古怪，但我怎能拒绝客户，尤其当她是我唯一的客户时？\n\n或许试着溜进暗夜精灵聚居地并从他们的月亮井偷水，不是我帮客户做的最聪明的事，但她的钱和任何人的一样都是金币啊！",cEN="What? She didn't mention the moonwell? That's what she had in mind all along. I admit the whole thing's a bit wacky, but who am I to turn away a client, especially when she's the only one I've got?\n\nMaybe trying to sneak into a night elf settlement and steal water from their moonwell isn't the most prudent thing I've ever helped a customer do, but her money is as gold as anyone else's!"}
Q[9432]={d="很高兴你能来帮忙，事实上我们非常需要你的帮助。\n\n作为联盟的一份子，我希望你能转至暗夜精灵城阿斯特兰纳，它坐落在灰谷，那是卡利姆多大陆黑海岸南边的一座大森林。\n\n到达那里后，请与守备官帕兰纳尔谈一谈，看看能不能帮那里的居民做点什么事。",dEN="I am glad that you are here to help. In fact, there is something that you can do.\n\nAs part of our inclusion within the Alliance, I would like for you to travel to the night elf town, Astranaar. It is located in Ashenvale, a large forest that is south of Darkshore on the continent of Kalimdor.\n\nPlease speak with Vindicator Palais when you arrive to see if there's anything that you can do to help the inhabitants.",o="到灰谷的阿斯特兰纳去，与守备官帕兰纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Astranaar in Ashenvale and speak with Vindicator Palais.",c="见到一张半熟不熟的脸总是好的。你一定就是$n了。使者瓦卢斯特拉捎信来说你要来。\n\n灰谷的人民需要我们的帮助，$n。去跟阿斯特兰纳的市民谈谈，看看你能帮上什么忙。",cEN="Always good to see a semi-familiar face. You must be <name>. Emissary Valustraa sent me word to expect you.\n\nThe people of Ashenvale need our assistance, <class>. Speak with the citizens of Astranaar to see how you can help."}
Q[9433]={d="嘿，别这么看着我！我可没说我会派你带着汲取器和广口瓶去萨兰纳尔的月井那里！\n\n但我……哦……你看……我正在帮另外一位客户修理产品。事实上，我已经在萨兰纳尔附近安置了遥控机器人，也在隐蔽的地方安装了一个便携式控制台。你所需要做的，就是带这个控制单元过去，躲避在控制台的掩体内，然后使用控制台操作着机器人去办事就可以了。很简单吧！\n\n但你要保密，如果我的客户知道了我把遥控机器人从包装里拿了出来，她非用我的耳朵勒死我不可！",dEN="Stop looking at me like that! I didn't say I was going to send you to Thalanaar's moonwell out in the open with dipper and a flask!\n\nI've been, err... tinkering with a product I was transporting for a client. In fact, I've already set up a portable control console for the Robotron out near Thalanaar. You'll need to bring this control unit with you and use it in the vicinity of my concealed console.\n\nIf my client ever heard that I so much as removed Robotron from its packaging, he'd hang me by my ears!",o="在千针石林边界靠近萨兰纳尔的一处灌木丛中找到隐蔽的控制台，并在那里控制机器助手3000型进入萨兰纳尔收集一份月亮井的水，然后把水交给白沙岗哨的维兹罗。",oEN="Use the Robotron Control while standing near the Concealed Command Console hidden in a small cluster of bushes on the rim of the needle closest to Thalanaar to take command of a Robotron 3000. Pilot the robot to the western edge of Thousand Needles where the Alliance outpost of Thalanaar is located. Use the robot to collect a sample of the moonwell's water and return it to Wizlo Bearingshiner at Whitereach Post.",p="它照做了吗？",pEN="Did it do the job?",c="它运作的比我想象得要好！这为老地精足智多谋又加了一笔！\n\n唯一的问题就是它布满了灰尘！我要花一辈子的时间才能把这个东西给清理干净并放回它的木箱。\n\n当然，我也有的是时间。",cEN="That worked better than I expected! Chalk up another one for good old goblin ingenuity!\n\nThe only problem is that it's hopelessly covered in dust! It's going to take me forever to get this thing cleaned up and replaced in its crate.\n\nOf course, time is the one thing I have in ample supply."}
Q[9434]={d="<维兹罗从机器人中取出了井水样本，并放入了一个还放有雷鸣石元素土和其它几件物品的箱子中。>\n\n给你，这就是魔导师艾洛塞清单上的所有东西了。告诉她，能为她服务我非常荣幸，祝她在研究方面有好运气。",dEN="<Wizlo retrieves the water sample from the robot and places it in a crate with the boulderkin earth and several other items.>\n\nThere you go, that's everything on Magistrix Elosai's list. Tell her that it's been a pleasure working with her and that I wish her luck in her research.",o="将这箱材料交给乱风岗的魔导师艾洛塞。",oEN="Deliver the Crate of Reagents to Magistrix Elosai at Freewind Post.",p="你和维兹罗收集好试剂了吗？",pEN="Were you and Wizlo able to gather the reagents?",c="太好了，看来所有东西都在这了。现在，我要做的就是把全部的东西混合在一起然后试试看。如果这个药水的效果会跟我的研究结论相同，那么我就发明了一种能减少我的人民对于魔法上瘾影响的好方法了。\n\n你将要目睹历史的过程了，$n。想想看，如果没有你的帮忙，这一切都不可能成真。",cEN="Excellent, it appears everything is here. Now, all I have to do is mix everything together and give it a try. If this tonic does what my research indicates it should do, I may have discovered a way to lessen the effects of my people's magic addiction.\n\nYou're about to witness history in the making, <name>. Just think, without your help, this wouldn't have been possible."}
Q[9435]={d="关于希尔斯布莱德，我这里有个真理要告诉你，那就是：这片土地命中注定是要笼罩在战争阴影之下的。即使是一辆装满石头的无害马车，也会成为被攻击的目标。\n\n如果只是丢了一辆装满建筑材料的马车，倒也无伤大雅，可这辆马车上偏偏装有从碧玉矿洞运来的一箱稀有水晶样本，那正是我十分想研究的。被遗忘者的小分队截走了这辆车，把它带去了东北方的一处他们想要重建的哨塔里。回收这些水晶是当前最紧迫的事，$c！",dEN="If there's one great truth about Hillsbrad, it's that this region is destined to live under the shadow of war. Even something as innocuous as a cartload of stone is a target.\n\nNormally the loss of building materials is no great setback, but the most recent shipment from the Azurelode mine contained a crate of rare crystals I was eager to study. Forsaken raiders intercepted the cart and drove it northeast to a tower they're attempting to rebuild. It's imperative that we retrieve those crystals, <class>!",o="从被遗忘者手中夺回一箱稀有的水晶，把它交给南海镇的忽尔兰。",oEN="Retrieve the Shipment of Rare Crystals from the Forsaken and return it to Huraan in Southshore.",p="你从被遗忘者那里夺回了水晶吗？",pEN="Were you able to retrieve the crystals from the Forsaken?",c="感谢圣光！从工头信中的语调看来，那箱水晶似乎蕴含着矿洞里唯一所知的样本。如果我们弄丢了它们，$n，我们就永远也看不到这样的东西了。\n\n我太感谢你的帮忙了。",cEN="Thank the Light! From the tone of the foreman's letter, it sounded as if that box of crystals contained the only known samples from the mine. If we had lost them, <name>, we may never have seen another like them.\n\nI can't thank you enough for your help."}
Q[9436]={d="很高兴见到你，$c。我当前正在进行一项行为学调查，研究我在旅途中所见到的各个巨魔部族的不同战斗技巧。当前，我发现了一种很有意思的趋势：最北边的伽什废墟和巴拉尔废墟的血顶巨魔使用着一种与北方森林中的阿曼尼巨魔相似的战术。\n\n他们的魔法与其它巨魔的不同，形成了一种十分独特的分支。他们利用这样的魔法成为了这里最强大的部族。这或许是对抗阿曼尼巨魔的关键，但在那之前，我得先找到更多的研究素材。",dEN="Well met, <class>. I've made a habit of studying the fighting techniques of the various troll tribes in my travels, and I've noticed a trend. The Bloodscalp trolls at the Tkashi Ruins and Bal'lal Ruins to the north use some of the same tactics as the Amani of the northern forests.\n\nTheir magic seems to have diverged in an interesting direction and they've used it to become the strongest tribe in the area. It could form the core of a powerful weapon against the Amani, but first I must find out more about it.",o="格罗姆高营地的纳密斯·鹰眼希望你能从某个血顶萨满祭司身上带回一个血顶图腾给他。",oEN="Nemeth Hawkeye at Grom'gol Base Camp wants you to bring him a Bloodscalp Totem from a Bloodscalp Shaman.",p="别让我失望，$n。如果我们可以让这个血顶魔法屈服在我们的意志之下，我的人民就能消灭阿曼尼威胁了。",pEN="Do not fail me, <name>. If we can bend this Bloodscalp magic to our will, my people may yet eliminate the Amani threat.",c="做得好。现在，这很令人好奇……\n\n这个图腾上的铭文是用巨魔不可能学习的语言所写的，但却是我们可理解的语言。持有者的名字是一个叫奈亚斯的水元素盟友并注明他是值得引导其力量的人。\n\n这真是意想不到，但也不完全那么糟，$n。有你的帮忙，我想更进一步研究它。",cEN="Well done. Now, this is curious...\n\nThe inscription on this totem is in a language no troll could ever hope to learn, but one that is known to us. It names the bearer as an ally of a water elemental named Naias and marks him as one worthy to channel his power.\n\nThis is most unexpected, but not entirely bad, <name>. With your help, I'd like to pursue this further."}
Q[9437]={d="这里的食人魔除了讲些粗俗笑话、酿点酸啤酒、没事拿头撞人之外，什么用都没有。我的船“破晓行者号”搁浅后，赛拉摩的那些混蛋卷走了我的货物和最后一名活着的船员。我一路找到这里求助，可我把遭遇讲给那些没用的食人魔听时，他们只会呆呆地盯着我。\n\n我需要$g一位:一位;可靠的$r帮我找回残余的货物，并从东北方的北角塔救出伊萨妮娅——他们被关在那里。",dEN="The ogres here are useful for little more than crude jokes, sour ale, and bouts of headbutting. When my ship, the Dawn Runner, ran aground, those curs from Theramore made off with my cargo and last surviving crewman. I made my way here searching for help, but those good-for-nothing ogres stared blankly at me when I told them my story.\n\nI could use the help of a reliable <race> in recovering what remains of my cargo and freeing Ithania from North Point Tower, to the northeast, where they're being held.",o="转至北点哨塔，从塞拉摩军队手中夺回黎明号的货物，搭救大副伊萨妮亚，然后返回蕨墙村向巴尔兰达·新星复命。",oEN="Balandar Brightstar in Brackenwall Village wants you to reclaim the Dawn Runner Cargo and rescue his first mate Ithania from forces of Theramore at North Point Tower.",p="你从那些光鲜亮丽的私掠船员手中救出了伊萨妮亚并取回我的货物吗？",pEN="Have you freed Ithania and reclaimed my cargo from those glorified privateers?",c="做得好，$n！只要等伊萨妮亚休息一下，我的准备完成后，我们就会离开这个荒地回到文明世界。",cEN="Well done, <name>! As soon as Ithania has had time to rest and my preparations are complete, we'll depart this sodden wasteland and head back to civilization."}
Q[9438]={d="自从我们踏上外域土地的第一步起，酋长就一直在等待着这一刻。现在，你将荣幸地亲自将玛格汉的消息告诉他。\n\n快去吧，$n。带上这封信，这里已经盖上了我的私人印章。没什么消息比你所带去的这个更能令他高兴了。",dEN="The warchief has been waiting for word of this ever since we set foot on Outland. Now you get the honor of giving him the news of the Mag'har yourself.\n\nGo quickly, <name>. Take this letter with you; it bears my personal seal. There is nothing that Thrall wants to hear more than the message you bear.",o="转至奥格瑞玛，将纳兹格雷尔的来信交给萨尔。",oEN="Travel to Orgrimmar and give Thrall the Letter from Nazgrel.",p="你带来外域的消息了，$n？快说！",pEN="You bring news from Outland, <class>? Speak at once!",c="<当萨尔开始阅读纳兹格雷尔的讯息时，惊讶的神色慢慢爬上了他的脸庞。>\n\n我的人民……我们一定要去找他们。我们一定要尽快转至纳格兰！",cEN="<You watch Thrall's jaw slacken as he begins to read the message from Nazgrel.>\n\nMy people... we must reach them. We must reach Nagrand as soon as possible!"}
Q[9439]={d="这里就是卡加斯？啊，天啊……我还以为这里是一处……一处……呃，一处城市，一处荒野中的文明象征。\n\n看来我是大错特错了。这样几间挤满了脏兮兮、只会咧嘴傻笑的野蛮人的劣质小木屋怎么有资格被称作远征军的总部？当我告诉这群粗鄙无礼的野蛮人，一群黑铁矮人抢劫了我然后溜进苦痛堡垒的时候，他们竟然敢嘲笑我。我想，只有你才能帮助我夺回财产和尊严了，是不是？",dEN="This is Kargath? Oh, dear. I expected a, a... well, some kind of settlement, some sign of civilization here in the wilderness.\n\nThere must be a mistake; surely this hovel full of uncouth, unwashed, sniggering savages can't be the headquarters of the Expeditionary Force. The loutish barbarians had the gall to laugh at me when I told them about how the Dark Iron dwarves robbed me and then disappeared into the Angor Fortress. I can count on you to help me recover my possessions and my dignity, can't I?",o="从苦痛堡垒中夺回顾问的背包和顾问的细剑，然后向卡加斯的顾问萨洛法斯复命。",oEN="Retrieve the Advisor's Pack and Advisor's Rapier from their holding places in the Angor Fortress and return them to Advisor Sarophas at Kargath.",p="看在逐日者的份上，别盯着我看！我被迫穿着这件肮脏的衣服就已经够糟的了！在我经历过这么多事后，我最不希望的一件事就是被人盯着看。你从那些黑铁矮人称为堡垒的狭小地窖收集到我的财产了吗？",pEN="For Sunstrider's sake, don't stare at me! It's bad enough I'm forced to endure out here in my soiled clothing! After all I've been through, the last thing I need is to be gawked at. Did you manage to collect my possessions from that hole-in-the-ground those Dark Irons call a fortress?",c="你简直是个$g创造奇迹的人:创造奇迹的人;，$n！我跟你说，我这辈子从没这么急着换身衣服。\n\n还有我的佩剑！没了剑，我感觉自己跟没穿衣服一样。\n\n你该$g受到嘉奖和酬谢:受到嘉奖和酬谢;。谁也不能说萨罗法斯忘了那些一路上帮过他的小人物！",cEN="You're a miracle worker, <name>! I tell you, I've never been so eager for a change of clothes in my life.\n\nAnd my rapier! I felt positively naked without my blade.\n\nYou are to be commended and rewarded for your efforts. Never let it be said that Sarophas failed to acknowledge the little people who've helped him along the way!"}
Q[9440]={d="我正在想办法强化一件可以用来对付德莱尼人的武器，你一定要帮助我！\n\n失落者是德莱尼人退化后的产物，我打算用他们来做实验。我只需要你喂一些污染过的饲料给失落者圈养的牲畜吃，就可以了。这样一来，他们屠宰这些牲畜并吃下它们的肉以后就会被诅咒啦！避难营的学者阿弗恩必定手足无措！\n\n快去快去！在农田避难所的东北方向就可以找到失落者和他们的牲畜笼。",dEN="I'm perfecting a weapon to use against the draenei and you're going to help me!\n\nThe Lost Ones are the backward cousins of the draenei, and I've been experimenting on them. I just need you to feed some fel-tainted morsels to their captured livestock. In turn, when they slaughter and eat the animals, they'll be cursed! That'll show that stuffy Anchorite Avuun at the Harborage!\n\nGo now, hurry! You'll find the Lost Ones and their caged animals to the northeast at the Fallow Sanctuary.",o="将邪恶侵蚀的食物喂给被失落者捕获的猎物。然后将剩馀的饲料带回去交给悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的瑟尔希·暗歌。",oEN="Feed the Fel-Tainted Morsels to the Lost Ones' captured animals. Then return the leftovers to Cersei Dusksinger at Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你把所有的食物都喂了被他们捕捉的动物吗？慢着！你没有给关在笼子中那些愚蠢的人类吃吧？，你有吗？\n\n喔，很好！不然真是浪费食物！",pEN="Did you feed their captured animals all of the morsels? Wait! You didn't give any to that stupid human they have out there in the cage, did you?\n\nOh, good! That would have been a waste!",c="喔，太棒了！我等不及要验收最近这一批货的效果了！\n\n嗯，你做了一件令人钦佩的工作，甜心。真希望我能给你比这个更多的东西来感谢你提供的娱乐，但你能了解的。沼泽这里没什么钱可赚。\n\n我相信为了乐趣这也是值得的！",cEN="Oh, excellent! I can't wait to measure the effects from this latest batch!\n\nWell, you did an admirable job, sweetie. Wish I could give you more than this for the entertainment you've provided, but you know how it is. There's not much money to be made out here in the swamp.\n\nI'm sure it was worth it just for the fun!"}
Q[9441]={d="听到你给我带来的消息后，我想我本应立刻动身转至外域，但是杜隆塔尔这里却有一些重要的事情需要我处理。\n\n我立刻会准备一批合适的礼物送给玛格汉，当然，我也会派出我最信任的外交官。这无疑需要一些时间……现在我需要立即派人代表我们去与他们交涉。\n\n我想我可以信任你，$n。立刻转至地狱火半岛上的玛格汉岗哨，并为我的同胞们效力吧。别让我失望，$n。都靠你了。",dEN="I'd leave for Outland this very minute after hearing the news you brought. Important matters require my attention in Durotar, however.\n\nI will arrange for a fitting tribute to be sent to the Mag'har immediately. I will send my most trusted diplomats as well. This will all take time... I need someone to represent us there right now.\n\nI must place my trust on you, <name>. Go to the Mag'har Post in Hellfire and render whatever services you can to my kin. Do not fail me, <name>. Too much depends on this.",o="萨尔希望你立刻回到地狱火半岛，向玛格汉岗哨的格尔坎·血拳报到，并为他效力。",oEN="Thrall wants you to return to Gorkan Bloodfist at Mag'har Post in Hellfire Peninsula and offer him your services.",c="你在我们需要的时候前来协助我们，这对我们意义重大。我们不会轻易忘记你或派你来的那个人。\n\n我们感谢你。",cEN="It means very much to us that you come to aid us in our time of need. We'll not easily forget you nor he who sends you.\n\nYou have our thanks."}
Q[9442]={d="$n，你肯帮忙真是太好了。步兵们误饮了被污染的水后都病倒了，眼下我正缺一种药材来配制治疗药膏。我需要一种罕见的蘑菇——枯顶蘑菇。\n\n我们的首要任务是确保玛格汉岗哨的隐秘性，因此我不能冒险外出寻找药材。地狱火半岛上，只有岗哨南边的大裂隙一带的某处洞穴中生长着枯顶蘑菇。\n\n如果你要去那儿寻找蘑菇的话，请加倍小心。",dEN="It is good that you've offered to aid us, <name>. Our grunts have fallen sick from drinking contaminated water and I'm missing an ingredient to produce a healing salve. I'm in need of a rare mushroom called drycap.\n\nOur foremost orders are to keep our location secret and not risk being spotted while looking for it, or I would go myself. The only place in Hellfire Peninsula where drycap grows is a cave at the Great Fissure, south of here.\n\nBe extremely careful if you choose to seek it.",o="从大裂隙的洞穴中采摘一朵枯顶蘑菇，将其交给地狱火半岛玛格汉岗哨的唤地者利迦。",oEN="Earthcaller Ryga at Mag'har Post in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring her 1 Drycap Mushroom from a cave inside the Great Fissure.",p="你取得了我需要的蘑菇吗，$n？",pEN="Did you obtain the mushroom I need, <name>?",c="格尔坎说了一些你的好话，果然所言不虚。\n\n谢谢你的帮忙。",cEN="Gorkan said good things about you. They're all turning out to be true.\n\nThanks for your help."}
Q[9443]={d="我曾是光明使者乌瑟尔的学生，他是白银之手骑士团的创立者。我亲眼看到他如何错误地教导阿尔萨斯王子。那导致了我的家园奎尔萨拉斯的毁灭，我把这一切都归咎于乌瑟尔和他的无能！如今竟还有一座纪念他的陵墓——真是好得很。\n\n我的线人说，那些血色蠢货把一件他的\"圣物\"供在炉谷大门附近那座瞭望塔的顶上。\n\n到西瘟疫之地去，把它给我取回来。",dEN="I was once a pupil of Uther Lightbringer, founder of the Knights of the Silver Hand. I saw how he mishandled Prince Arthas's training. It led to the destruction of my homeland, Quel'Thalas, and I blame Uther and his incompetence for all of it! And now he has a tomb in his honor - how lovely.\n\nMy sources tell me that the scarlet fools are keeping one of his 'holy' relics atop their guard tower near the gates of Hearthglen.\n\nGo to the Western Plaguelands and retrieve it for me.",o="拿到光明使者的印记，把它交给西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的麦拉·黎明之刃。",oEN="Obtain the Mark of the Lightbringer and return it to Mehlar Dawnblade at the Bulwark in the Western Plaguelands.",p="等你取得了他的“记号”，我们就要把它做些改变，让它变的更好。",pEN="When you've managed to retrieve his 'mark', we're going to change it a bit; make it better.",c="第一步已经完成。把光明使者的印记交给我，我会把它改造成更合适的东西。\n\n到那时，我的复仇才算真正开始，$n！",cEN="The first step is complete. Hand me the Mark of the Lightbringer and I will transform it into something more suitable.\n\nThen my revenge will begin in earnest, <class>!"}
Q[9444]={d="这样就好多了。我已经在其中加入了一些邪恶的魔法。\n\n现在，你必须把这个东西带到他那坐落在西瘟疫之地的陵墓去，在乌瑟尔的雕像前使用这个已被亵渎的神圣符记！你一定要接近那里，这样才能完成任务。\n\n你只需要从安多哈尔遗迹的西南侧沿路过去就可以找到他的陵墓。完成任务后再回来找我。\n\n动作快些，$c！",dEN="There, that's better. I've added a little fel magic to it.\n\nNow, you must take it to his resting place in the Western Plaguelands. Use the corrupted holy symbol in the presence of Uther's statue to defile his tomb! You'll have to get close for it to work.\n\nTo find the tomb go southeast of the Ruins of Andorhal. Return to me when the deed is done.\n\nBe quick about it, <class>!",o="亵渎乌瑟尔之墓，并向西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的麦拉·黎明之刃复命。",oEN="Defile Uther's Tomb and return to Mehlar Dawnblade at the Bulwark in the Western Plaguelands.",p="那么，完成了？乌瑟尔之墓被亵渎了？",pEN="It is done, then? Uther's Tomb is defiled?",c="原谅我？他原谅我？！\n\n我不在乎那个老鬼魂要说什么——那是他的错！所有发生在奎尔萨拉斯的事都是因为他的无能！\n\n很明显亵渎并没有发挥作用。去吧，消失在我的视线！我一定要好好想一想。",cEN="Forgives me? He FORGIVES ME?!!!\n\nI don't care what that old ghost had to say - it was his fault! Everything that's happened to Quel'Thalas was a result of his incompetence!\n\nIt is clear that the defiling did not work. Go, be gone from my sight! I must think this through."}
Q[9446]={d="现在你已经夺回了光明使者的印记，剩下的事就是把它交还到乌瑟尔之墓去了。\n\n你愿意陪同我完成这件事吗？这里离陵墓并不远，我也很希望你能陪伴我一起去。等下回来之后你可以再向高阶牧师玛多妮尔汇报这件事。\n\n你觉得怎么样，$n？",dEN="Now that you've recovered the Mark of the Lightbringer, all that is left is to return it to Uther's Tomb.\n\nWould you be willing to accompany me there to do this? It's not far and I would enjoy your company. Afterward you can come back here and relate the experience to High Priestess MacDonnell.\n\nWhat say you, <name>?",o="护送学者特卢恩转至西瘟疫之地的乌瑟尔之墓，然后与西瘟疫之地冰风岗的高阶牧师玛多妮尔谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Anchorite Truuen to Uther's Tomb in the Western Plaguelands. Afterward, speak with High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你不是该和隐士·楚恩一起走到乌瑟尔之墓吗？",pEN="Aren't you supposed to be walking to Uther's Tomb with Anchorite Truuen?",c="光明使者显现在你面前了？太不可思议了！而这一切都多亏了你对那位学者无私的援助。\n\n就算那些传闻只有一半可信，乌瑟尔也是个了不起的人。而和他一样，对艾泽拉斯所有善良的人来说，你就是$g一位真正的英雄:一位真正的英雄;，$n！",cEN="The Lightbringer appeared before you? That is amazing! And you made it all possible through your selfless help to the anchorite.\n\nIf even half of the stories are to be believed, Uther was a great man. And, like him, you are a true hero to all of the good people of Azeroth, <name>!"}
Q[9447]={d="我利用你采摘到的蘑菇配制好了一剂治疗药膏，它能帮助步兵恢复体力。带上药膏医治岗哨附近疲惫的步兵，完成任务后回来向我复命。",dEN="I've prepared a simple salve that should restore our grunts' strength with the herbs you brought me. Take it and administer it to any debilitated grunts you see in the vicinity. Return to me when you're done.",o="唤地者利迦要你对地狱火半岛玛格汉岗哨附近的那些疲惫的玛格汉步兵使用治疗药膏，医治10个疲惫的玛格汉步兵。",oEN="Earthcaller Ryga wants you to administer the Healing Salve to 10 Debilitated Mag'har Grunts nearby Mag'har Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你回来了，$n。你的任务完成了吗？",pEN="You've returned, <name>. Is your task complete?",c="愿灵魂祝福你，$n。玛格汉永远欠你一份人情。",cEN="May the spirits bless you, <name>. The Mag'har are in your debt."}
Q[9448]={d="那个血精灵女巫瑟尔希·暗歌一直在诅咒失落者，我敢肯定！我不知道这是为了什么，她又是怎样做的，但这一切的结果都是悲剧。一些失落者当前被腐化得更深了，邪恶的能量充斥着他们体内！\n\n$C，你是否感觉自己有些可怜这些生物了？他们不应该在这样可怕的状况中继续活下去。\n\n你在农田避难所就可以找到这些被诅咒的失落者，只需沿路一直向东。",dEN="That blood elf witch, Cersei Dusksinger, has been cursing the Lost Ones, I just know it! I don't know why or how, but the results are tragic. Several of the Lost Ones have now been further corrupted - cursed with even more fel energies!\n\n<class>, can you find it in you to take pity on these poor creatures? They should not have to live out the rest of their lives in such a horrible condition.\n\nYou'll find these cursed Lost Ones at the Fallow Sanctuary, east down the path.",o="杀死3名被诅咒的失落者，然后向悲伤沼泽避难所的学者阿弗恩复命。",oEN="Slay 3 Cursed Lost Ones and then return to Anchorite Avuun at the Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你做得对，$c。失落者已经受了太多苦。他们不该再遭受这种额外的屈辱。",pEN="You are doing the right thing, hunter. The Lost Ones have suffered so much already. They shouldn't have to suffer this further indignity.",c="那么就完成了。感谢你展现你的怜悯。一旦被瑟赛喂给他们的任何东西而导致腐败，就没有什么办法可以解决。\n\n他们现在很平静，希望我对其他元素的研究也能有个结果，让他们恢复原状。",cEN="It is done then. I thank you for showing your compassion. Once corrupted by whatever Cersei was feeding them, there is nothing else that could be done.\n\nThey are now at peace and hopefully my studies of the others will bear fruit so that they can be rehabilitated."}
Q[9449]={d="$n，时机已经成熟。你的能力日益强大，可以和这个世界的元素之灵直接交谈了。\n\n但是，我得提醒你。德莱尼人在无意间闯入这个世界，突如其来的不速之客以及飞船坠落引发的负面效应激怒了大地之灵，破坏了元素间的平衡。\n\n想要制造大地图腾，就必须与峡谷之灵交谈。你可以在位于西北方山丘地带的元素圣谷找到他。",dEN="The time has come, <name>. You have grown to the point where you are ready to commune directly with the elemental spirits of this world.\n\nBut be warned. I can sense that the manner of our entry into this world, and its unfortunate side effects, have angered the earth spirits and caused an imbalance of the elements.\n\nIf you are to create your earth totem, you must first speak with the Spirit of the Vale. You will find it in the Sacred Grove, nestled in the hills to the northwest.",o="与埃门谷的元素圣谷中的峡谷之灵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Spirit of the Vale at the Sacred Grove in Ammen Vale.",c="在你们族人对这些岛屿所做的一切之后，你竟还敢来寻求我的智慧，陌生人！不过，你的勇气确有可称道之处，我就传授你一些知识吧。\n\n你脚下的大地是万物的根基。天空、流水，乃至伟大的火焰——全都依托在它的肩头。其他元素常常掀起混沌的狂澜，而大地始终如一。它赐予你存在的核心以力量与坚韧。\n\n现在，去证明你自己吧，萨满。",cEN="You are bold to seek my wisdom after what your people have done to these islands, stranger! Still, there is much to be said for your bravery, so I will impart to you some knowledge.\n\nThe earth beneath your feet forms the foundation for all things. The sky, the waters, even great fire - all rest upon its shoulders. While those others often form chaotic tempests, the earth abides. It grants strength and fortitude to the core of your being.\n\nNow you will prove yourself, shaman."}
Q[9450]={d="突如其来的德莱尼人严重破坏了埃门谷中的元素平衡。飞船坠落，激怒了大地之灵；其它元素生物赶来平息这场骚乱，却遭到了强烈的反击。元素们只有在和睦相处的情况下才能达成默契。\n\n因此，你得承担起促成元素间平衡的重担。在我身后的这片树林中，躁动的大地之灵正在与其它三种元素交战。请设法重建元素间的平衡。",dEN="The balance of the elements has been disrupted by the violent intrusion of the draenei to the Vale. Your crash has caused the spirits of earth to be enraged and turn upon the other elements who have come to quell them. You will learn that an understanding of the elements can only come when all are in harmony.\n\nThus, it falls to you to seek a balance. Behind me in the grove you will find the restless spirits of earth warring upon the other three elements. Help restore the balance.",o="杀死4个躁动的大地之灵，然后向埃门谷的元素圣谷中的峡谷之灵复命。",oEN="Slay 4 Restless Elements of Earth and then return to the Spirit of the Vale at the Sacred Grove in Ammen Vale.",c="你做得很好。削减不安的灵魂你就能帮助治疗元素间的不平衡，那也是你的人民无意造成的。\n\n在你的萨满之旅中，当你召唤我们的力量时一定要记住这点。一定要保持平衡。",cEN="You have done well. By thinning out the restless spirits you have helped to heal the imbalance between the elements, which your people inadvertently caused.\n\nThroughout your journey as a shaman you must keep this in mind when calling upon our power. The balance must be preserved."}
Q[9451]={d="现在我就将一块取自我身体的碎片交给你，你可以用它来制造大地图腾。回去向派你来这里的人复命吧。\n\n我们的命运从此紧密相联，大地的力量将永远与你相随。等到你离开尘世之日，尸骨回归大地，万物在轮回中达成平衡。\n\n好好运用我们的力量吧。",dEN="I will now give you a piece of my physical being that you may create your earth totem. Return it to he who sent you here.\n\nYou and I will be bound together for all time. Throughout your life the forces of earth will be at your disposal. The balance will come when your bones return to us at the end of your days.\n\nUse our power wisely.",o="将大地水晶交给埃门谷坠毁点的费曼瓦尔。",oEN="Deliver the Earth Crystal to Firmanvaar at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="破碎者和德莱尼会一起重获对元素秘密更深的了解。\n\n你带回制造大地图腾所需的物品了吗？",pEN="Together, the Broken and the draenei will regain a deeper understanding of the mysteries that the elements hold.\n\nHave you returned with that which is necessary for the creation of your earth totem?",c="你做得很好，$n。在帮助树林的元素取得平衡时，你也创造了德莱尼和这世界的大地元素间的平衡。或许这也会为那些不认同我们的人带来一点谅解？\n\n我会帮你制造一个图腾，让你可以召唤大地的力量。时间久了，你就会知道更多大地的秘密。\n\n现在，带走你的图腾吧，萨满。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. In helping to restore the balance of the elements at the grove, you have also created a balance between the earth element of this world and the draenei. Perhaps this will help to bring understanding to those amongst us who do not approve of our ways?\n\nI will create for you a totem through which you will be able to call on the power of earth to do your bidding. And with time, more of the mysteries of earth will be revealed to you.\n\nNow, take your totem, shaman."}
Q[9452]={d="我发现这里的水中到处都是这种活蹦乱跳的红钳鱼，这种鱼味道可棒啦！只要有一张渔网，我就可以捞到许多的鱼给许多德莱尼人吃了！可惜的是，我前几天在河边捞鱼的时候被一群鱼人给偷袭了，它们还把我打伤了，让我没法继续捞鱼。我需要帮助，需要帮助！\n\n在东边晶水河里的红钳鱼群旁使用这张渔网捞一些鱼吧。\n\n怎么样？能帮忙吗？干完记得把渔网也还我。",dEN="I've found that these waters are bustling with red snapper, a very tasty fish. With a fishing net, I can catch enough to feed dozens of draenei! Unfortunately, I was recently attacked by a creature known as a murloc while netting in the river and have suffered some injuries that prevent me from doing my job. I need help!\n\nUse this fishing net near schools of red snapper, found in the Crystalbrook river to the east to catch the fish.\n\nWhat do you say? Remember to return the net when you are finished.",o="使用德莱尼渔网抓住10只红钳鱼。任务完成后把鱼和渔网交给秘蓝岛的迪泰娜。",oEN="Use the Draenei Fishing Net to catch 10 Red Snappers. Return both the fish and the net to Diktynna on Azuremyst Isle when the task is complete.",p="小心鱼人：奇怪又特别讨人厌的小生物。",pEN="Watch out for murlocs: Strange and extremely annoying little creatures.",c="我希望鱼人没造成太多麻烦，$n。你所做的事让我欠你太多了。\n\n或许我可以教你如何钓鱼？我甚至可以提供钓鱼竿和小玩意。",cEN="I hope the murlocs didn't cause too much trouble, <name>. I owe you a great debt of gratitude for all that you've done.\n\nPerhaps I could teach you how to fish? I'll even supply the fishing pole and a bauble."}
Q[9453]={d="你做得非常不错，$n。我们的人民一定会对你能够施以援手表示非常感谢。说到这个，你愿意帮我将这些红钳鱼带给他们吗？只需要带去给碧蓝岗哨的艾克提恩就可以啦。\n\n他一直在等待着这批鱼，你应该不难找到他。",dEN="You did a wonderful job, <name>. Our people will be thankful for this bounty. With that said, would you mind taking this haul of red snapper to Acteon at Azure Watch?\n\nHe shouldn't be hard to find as he is awaiting this catch.",o="将一箱红钳鱼交给碧蓝岗哨的艾克提恩。",oEN="Deliver the Crate of Red Snapper to Acteon at Azure Watch.",p="你觉得我的护甲怎么样？我自己制作的！这和我们习惯上穿的不太一样，但却极为舒服。",pEN="What do you think of my armor? Crafted it myself! It's a little different than what we'd traditionally wear but extremely comfortable.",c="可怜的迪泰娜……那个鱼人把她吓了一大跳。\n\n<艾克提恩叹了口气。>\n\n希望她的伤会很快好起来……\n\n我想你是来找工作的。嗯，在碧蓝岗哨有很多工作可找！",cEN="Poor Diktynna... That murloc gave her quite a scare.\n\n<Acteon sighs.>\n\nHopefully she will recover from the injuries soon...\n\nSo I presume you're looking for work. Well there's plenty of that to be found at Azure Watch!"}
Q[9454]={d="你最近越来越有名了，$n。要不要也来尝试一下狩猎？\n\n在德拉诺的时候，我们族中最优秀的猎人经常会狩猎一种名叫塔布羊的生物，它和这片地区的月痕鹿倒是十分相似。\n\n如果你认为自己非常具备德莱尼猎人的气质，不如到野外去尝试猎杀月痕鹿吧，一定要把你的背包装满月痕鹿肉再回来。\n\n碧蓝岗哨南边就有许多月痕鹿，小心别被它们的角顶伤！",dEN="You're starting to make a name for yourself, <name>. How about trying your hand at hunting?\n\nBack on Draenor, our greatest hunters would hunt a beast that resembled the moongraze stag of this region known as a talbuk.\n\nIf you think yourself draenei enough, go out into the wilds and kill enough stags to fill your pack with meat.\n\nYou will find them grazing south of Azure Watch. Watch out for their horns!",o="将6份月痕鹿的嫩腰肉交给碧蓝岗哨的艾克提恩。",oEN="Bring 6 Moongraze Stag Tenderloins to Acteon at Azure Watch.",p="成年鹿的毛皮容易损坏，不过也因此形成柔软多汁的鹿肉。",pEN="The stag hides are frail which tend to make for tender, succulent flesh.",c="做得好，$n，做得真好！\n\n来，你不在的时候我煮了一些嫩腰肉。或许你也想要食谱？",cEN="Well done, <name>, well done!\n\nHere, I cooked up some tenderloins while you were gone. Maybe you'd like the recipe, too?"}
Q[9455]={d="这块你从夜行豹幼崽身上找出的水晶看起来应该是埃索达的一部分。这样或许就能解释为什么这个地区的动物有着大量反常的行为和举动了。\n\n将这块水晶带回碧蓝岗哨，大主教一定非常想要了解这个小发现。",dEN="The crystal you found on the nightstalker runt's body appears to be a piece of the Exodar. This may help explain the unusual appearance and demeanor of some of the animals in this region.\n\nTake the crystal back to Azure Watch. The exarch will surely want to know about this discovery.",o="将微微发光的水晶交给碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯。",oEN="Deliver the Faintly Glowing Crystal to Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",p="你找到了什么？在哪里？",pEN="You found what? Where?",c="这种东西怎么会跑到夜间潜猎者的胃里？失事的残骸已经让更多野兽感染了吗？",cEN="How did such a thing end up in the stomach of a nightstalker? Could the debris from the crash have contaminated more beasts?"}
Q[9456]={d="对于你的发现，我不会用任何借口或是理由来搪塞。这的确是我们的错。我们已经收到报告说坠毁时崩裂的水晶碎片流入了东边的河水中，不过我们还暂时没有采取行动。现在，我们要么只是坐在这座小岛上朝天哭诉着岛上发生的悲剧，要么干脆真正站出来做些什么，以阻止悲剧的蔓延。\n\n现在，我希望你能立刻回到荒野中去，尽量杀死更多已被感染的夜行豹。",dEN="I'm not going to make any excuses for what you've found. This is clearly our fault. We had gotten reports of crushed crystal fragments showing up in the river to the east but chose to ignore the implications. Now we can either sit around on this island and cry about the tragedy that has befallen this land or we can do something about it and prevent it from spreading.\n\nIf you've got the stomach for it, I want you to go back into the wilds and kill as many of the infected nightstalkers as you can find.",o="碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯要求你杀死8只感染的夜行豹幼崽。",oEN="Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch has asked that you slay 8 Infected Nightstalker Runts.",p="我们不能冒险让感染继续扩散。我从秘血岗哨收到的报告已经够糟了。现在就要去阻止！",pEN="We can't risk this contamination spreading. The reports I've heard come from Blood Watch are bad enough. This has to be stopped now!",c="我只希望这一切不会太晚……",cEN="I just hope it's not too late..."}
Q[9457]={d="这么说，这个奈亚斯就是使血顶巨魔掌握了这种奇特法术的幕后主使者？我不得不承认，调查走到这个方向，是我当前最不希望看到的。但无所谓，我们的发现肯定是有用的。\n\n在海岸西北方有一座小岛，当前它被许多次级水元素占据了。那里还有一块巨大的厚石板，或许是巨魔们用以祭祀水元素的祭坛。将你找到的图腾带到那个祭坛去，看看我们是否能够引出这个奈亚斯，然后将他的力量转化为另一种我们更喜欢的形式。",dEN="So this Naias is the mastermind behind the Bloodscalp and their exotic magic? I'll admit, this is the last place I expected my inquiry to lead, but no matter, our findings may still prove useful.\n\nOff the coast to the northwest is an island inhabited by lesser water elementals. There's a crude stone slab there that might serve as an altar for the likes of the trolls. Take the totem you found to that altar. Let's see if we can draw this Naias out and distill his power into a more agreeable form.",o="在奈亚斯祭坛附近使用奈亚斯的礼物，召唤出水元素奈亚斯。击败它之后，将奈亚斯之心交给格罗姆高营地的纳密斯·鹰眼。",oEN="Use the Gift of Naias near the Altar of Naias to summon the water elemental Naias. Defeat him and return to Nemeth Hawkeye at Grom'gol Base Camp with the Heart of Naias.",p="有奈亚斯的消息吗，$n？",pEN="What news of Naias, <name>?",c="我能感觉到这颗宝石中蕴藏的纯粹力量，$n。我会把它送往银月城，让我们的魔导师进一步研究，但我相信它在我们对抗阿曼尼的战斗中会派上用场。\n\n你为取得这颗宝石立下了不可估量的功劳，我会确保游侠们知道促成这一发现的$g那位:那位;$r的名字。",cEN="I can feel the raw power contained in this gem, <name>. I'll send it to Silvermoon for our magisters to study further, but I am sure it will prove useful in our struggle against the Amani.\n\nYour help has been invaluable in procuring this gem, and I will see to it that the Farstriders know the name of the <race> who made this find possible."}
Q[9460]={d="克尔图斯·暗叶报到！\n\n呃……但你是谁呢？如果你是为我的报告而来，那你就得先帮我一个忙。\n\n我准备袭击暗夜精灵哨兵部队的间谍，但我打算让我忠实的蝙蝠维丝帕尔去打头阵。她需要嗅到敌人的味道才能确定攻击的目标。\n\n你能悄悄进去，在哨兵部队的首领身上为她找到一些东西吗？",dEN="Keltus Darkleaf reporting for duty!\n\nOh... who are you, anyhow? If you are here for my report, I insist you help me first.\n\nI am planning to attack the sentinel spies, but I intend to send in my faithful Whisper as a first strike. She just needs a scent to hone in on them.\n\nSurely someone of your skill could sneak in and steal something from the sentinel leader?",o="克尔图斯·暗叶希望你能从哨兵队长身上偷取一张花边手帕。",oEN="Keltus Darkleaf wants you to pickpocket the Lacy Handkerchief from the Sentinel Leader and bring it to him.",p="你弄到了吗？",pEN="Did you get something?",c="太棒了！这样的私人物品带着强烈的入侵者气味——足以引导私语进入他们的军队……",cEN="Excellent! Such a personal item carries a strong scent of the intruders--enough to guide Whisper into their ranks..."}
Q[9461]={d="先知维伦听说你顺利通过了你的试炼，并传话说希望你能去见见他。你与他见面之后才能得到你的火焰图腾。\n\n这是无上的荣耀，你必须尽快赶到埃索达去见他！",dEN="You should know that The Prophet has been asking for you, having heard of your success in your trial. The creation of your fire totem will have to wait until you have spoken with him.\n\nThis is a rare honor; you must hurry to the Exodar to see him at once!",o="在埃索达的圣光穹顶中找到先知维伦。",oEN="Seek out Prophet Velen at the Vault of Lights in the Exodar.",c="嗨，$n，我一直在等你。我想你今天应该过的很好？",cEN="Hello, <name>, I have been expecting you. I trust this day finds you well?"}
Q[9462]={d="$n！是时候让你接受进一步的精神训练了。去碧蓝岗哨找萨满祭司图伦吧，他会向你介绍火焰的力量和控制它的方法。",dEN="<name>! It is time for you to receive further training in the ways of the spirits. You should seek out Tuluun, the shaman at Azure Watch. He can begin your introduction to understanding and harnessing the power of flame.",o="与秘蓝岛上的碧蓝岗哨中的图伦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tuluun at Azure Watch on Azuremyst Isle.",c="来得正是时候，$n。我希望你已经$g准备好:准备好;继续你的训练了。下一个任务会很艰难。",cEN="Just in time, <name>. I hope you are ready to continue your training. This next task will be a difficult one."}
Q[9463]={d="我最近发现岛上的鞭笞者的枝条具备十分优良的治疗能力。经过适当的处理，我们可以把这些枝条制成某种强力的治疗药膏。但糟糕的是，碧蓝岗哨这里有太多受伤的德莱尼人，我们的药品存量已经严重不足了。\n\n而且，现在还有一名意外的可爱访客受了重伤，躺在这里。昨天，我们发现她倒在了晶水河旁，并且失去了意识。如果你能收集一些枝条来，我想我们就能救她一命了。\n\n碧蓝岗哨的东面和南面都有根须诱捕者出没。",dEN="I have found that lashers milling about on the island hold restorative medicinal properties in their vines. Through proper treatment, the vines can be broken down into a powerful healing ointment. Unfortunately, with so many injured draenei passing through Azure Watch, we are always in short supply.\n\nOur delicate guest was found injured and unconscious by the Crystalbrook only yesterday. If you bring me vines, we may be able to save her.\n\nYou will find root trappers both south and east of Azure Watch.",o="碧蓝岗哨的学者法蒂玛希望你帮她收集8份根须诱捕者的枝条。",oEN="Anchorite Fateema at Azure Watch wants you to bring her 8 Root Trapper Vines.",p="我担心她的病况正持续恶化中。",pEN="I fear that her health is in steady decline.",c="让我们期望这个药膏会强化她的灵魂吧！",cEN="Let us hope that this ointment will strengthen her spirit!"}
Q[9464]={d="你将再次接受考验，如果你想要制造一根可以控制火焰力量的图腾，就必须了解这种混乱的元素力量。\n\n海岸的东北边有一处被称做灰烬林地的烈焰圣地。坦普就在那片被烧毁的树林中，他是一位具有强大力量的火焰元素，你必须去跟他谈谈。\n\n现在就去找他，愿艾泽拉斯世界的精神元素与你同在。",dEN="Once again you are to be tested, and this time the chaotic element of fire must be understood if you're to create a totem to harness its energies.\n\nTo the northeast on the coast is a sacred place of fire known as Emberglade. Amidst its burned trees stands Temper, a fire elemental of great power, and the one that you must speak with.\n\nGo to him now and may the elemental spirits of Azeroth go with you.",o="与秘蓝岛灰烬林地中的坦普谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Temper at Emberglade on Azuremyst Isle.",c="我相信你眼中的熊熊大火是来自想成长及理解的欲望？很好！\n\n塔奴蓝派你来这里是因为他看见了你有潜力学习并解决埃索达失事所造成的问题。\n\n我们会看见的。",cEN="I trust that the burning I see behind your eyes is from a desire to grow and understand? Good!\n\nTuluun has sent you here because he sees your potential to both learn and help with a problem that the crash of your Exodar has caused.\n\nWe shall see."}
Q[9465]={d="我的一个名叫赫图尔的同胞已经被你们那艘坠毁的飞船弄疯了。他开始要求当地所有的枭兽膜拜他。\n\n一定要制止这样的行为！我们不能狂妄地以为自己是个神灵！恢复平衡的重任就交给你了。\n\n首先，你必须到西边的止松要塞去，取回被那里的疯狂枭兽抢走的仪祭火炬。\n\n将火炬带回来给我。",dEN="One of my brethren, Hauteur, has gone insane, no doubt because of the crash of your ship. He's begun demanding that the local owlbeasts worship him.\n\nThis will not continue! None of us would ever impersonate a god! It falls to you to restore the balance.\n\nFirst, you must retrieve their ritual torch, which has been taken by the crazed wildkin inside Stillpine Hold to the west.\n\nReturn the torch to me.",o="取回仪祭火炬，把它交给秘蓝岛灰烬林地中的坦普。",oEN="Retrieve the Ritual Torch and return it to Temper at Emberglade on Azuremyst Isle.",p="你拿到火炬了？",pEN="You have the torch?",c="看到它的火焰永远都不会熄灭了吗？那是郝特的杰作。那是他自大的象征。火焰本来就是要消耗，燃烧殆尽后自行熄灭，等待下一次重新再来。\n\n我会帮你弄熄火焰，但你要对付郝特的话它就一定要是点燃的。我们会让它燃烧久一点。",cEN="See how its fire never goes out? That is the work of Hauteur. It is a symbol of his arrogance. Flame is meant to consume that which it burns and then itself die, to be reborn anew another time.\n\nI would help you douse the torch, but it must stay lit for you to deal with Hauteur. We will let it burn a little while longer."}
Q[9466]={d="游侠队长有令，悬赏捕杀邪恶的剥石者母兽——黑色利爪的勇士。\n\n黑色利爪最近一次被发现是在大裂隙的某处洞穴中。取回它的爪子，以此为证领取奖赏。",dEN="By order of the Ranger Captain, a reward is hereby offered for the slaying of the vicious rockflayer matriarch known as Blacktalon the Savage.\n\nBlacktalon was last sighted inside a cave in the Great Fissure. Individuals seeking the reward are to present the creature's claws as proof of the deed.",o="将黑色利爪的爪子交给地狱火半岛猎鹰岗哨的游侠队长维恩雷。",oEN="Bring Blacktalon's Claws to Ranger Captain Venn'ren at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你有黑色利爪的消息？",pEN="You have news regarding Blacktalon?",c="你是个勇敢的$c，$n。那个野蛮的野兽夺走了我手下许多最棒的猎人性命。\n\n收下这个奖励，你赢得了它。",cEN="You're a brave <class>, <name>. That savage beast took many of my best hunters' lives.\n\nTake this reward, you've earned it."}
Q[9467]={d="西南边秘银岛上有一处月翼洞穴，那里的枭兽都被赫图尔迷惑了，认为他是值得崇拜的神明。但他其实只是一个堕落的元素生物而已，只有终结他的生命，才能终结他的痛苦。这把火炬是毁灭他的关键之物。\n\n赫图尔会定期要求这些枭兽以他的名义焚烧一座雕像。所以当你点燃雕像的时候，他就会出现。杀掉他，将他的灰烬给我带回来。我会给你一个小背包，里面的宝珠可以直接把你传送回来。",dEN="The owlbeasts of Moonwing Den on Silvermyst Isle, far to the southwest, have been deluded into thinking that Hauteur is a god to be worshipped. What he truly is, is a fallen elemental who needs to be put out of his misery. That torch is the key to his downfall.\n\nHauteur regularly demands that these owlbeasts burn an effigy in his honor. So, when you light it, he will come. Slay him and bring me the ashes. Then use the orb in the satchel that I will give you to return to me here.",o="取得赫图尔的灰烬，把它交给秘蓝岛灰烬林地中的坦普。在你得到灰烬后，可以用背包里的回归宝珠传送回坦普身边。",oEN="Retrieve Hauteur's Ashes and then return them and the Ritual Torch to Temper at Emberglade on Azuremyst Isle. Remember that you can use the Orb of Returning to teleport back to Temper once you have the ashes.",p="没拿到郝特的骨骸就不要来跟我说话。",pEN="Do not speak to me again until you have Hauteur's ashes.",c="你今天上了很宝贵的一课。这是个结束和新开始的故事。\n\n当我们第一次交谈时，我告诉你火焰不只是毁灭，也是重生的元素力量。你的行为同时摧毁和拯救了郝特，因为他会从他的灰烬中重生。",cEN="It is a valuable lesson that you learn here today. It is the story of endings and new beginnings.\n\nWhen first we spoke I told you that fire was not just destruction, but also a renewing force of the elements. Through your actions you have both destroyed and saved Hauteur, for he shall be reborn from his ashes."}
Q[9468]={d="今天你完成了一件非常重要的任务，它能帮助你加深对火焰的理解。记住，一定要对火焰保持崇敬的态度，这样才能不被它的力量吞噬。\n\n我将赫图尔的一部分灰烬留给你，这样你就可以用它来制造你的火焰图腾。记住你为了得到它所学到的东西。\n\n现在，回去找图伦吧。",dEN="You have done a great thing here today in your pursuit of understanding your relationship to the flame. Remember to always treat it with the utmost respect lest you get burned.\n\nI saved a portion of Hauteur's ashes for you. Use them in the creation of your fire totem and remember all that you have learned in their attainment.\n\nNow, return to Tuluun.",o="将赫图尔的灰烬交给秘蓝岛上的碧蓝岗哨中的图伦。",oEN="Deliver Hauteur's Ashes to Tuluun at Azure Watch on Azuremyst Isle.",p="你的边角看起来有点烧焦了。你和火焰的沟通进行得如何，$n？",pEN="You look a bit singed around the edges. How fared your communion with the flame, <class>?",c="你经历了毁灭的净化之火，$g获得新生:获得新生;，$n。这与$r族人当下所经历的磨难并无不同。而通过把傲然从他自己手中救出，你已稳固了与这个世界的元素火焰之间的联系。",cEN="You have passed through the cleansing fire of destruction and been renewed, <name>. This is not unlike the tribulation the <race> people are currently undergoing. And through saving Hauteur from himself, you have secured your connection to the elemental fire of this world."}
Q[9469]={d="当我最终得到弗斯塔德·蛮锤的接见时，我希望能得到大多数蛮锤矮人的支持，$n。\n\n羽须是蛮锤矮人中非常出名的一个人，他不仅有着出神入化的狮鹫训练技巧，而且还是一个十分睿智的长者。如果说这世界上只有一个矮人能说服弗斯塔德·蛮锤的话，那么就一定是他了。\n\n我本来想亲自去见他，但我却无法在等待接见的时候离开鹰巢山。请到南方的羽须居所去找他，问问他是否愿意与我好好谈谈。",dEN="When I am finally granted an audience with Falstad Wildhammer, I hope to have our strongest advocate among the Wildhammer dwarves at my side, <name>.\n\nFeatherbeard is revered among his people, both for his legendary gryphon training skills and for his wisdom. If anyone can sway Falstad Wildhammer, it is he.\n\nI would go to see him myself, except that I cannot leave the confines of Aerie Peak while awaiting my audience. Visit Featherbeard at his residence to the south and ask if he will speak with me.",o="转至羽须的小屋，若他在家的话，拜访他；若他不在，那么调查一下他去了哪里。",oEN="Go to Featherbeard's Hovel and visit the dwarf if he is at home. If he is not at home, search for evidence of where he can be found.",c="羽须的日记看来最近写了不少。翻开最后一篇，你开始寻找线索了解他去了哪里。",cEN="Featherbeard's journal appears to have a large number of recent entries. Leafing back to the beginning of the latest ones, you begin searching for clues about where he might have gone."}
Q[9470]={d="辛特兰那崎岖而连绵的丘陵地区不仅仅是蛮锤矮人与狮鹫的家，也是许多森林巨魔部族的藏身之处。\n\n巨魔们将蛮锤矮人视作他们古老土地上的入侵者，从不放过任何通过攻击狮鹫来打击与挑衅蛮锤矮人的机会。想要在蛮锤矮人的眼中证明自己的价值，有一个最好的办法就是去杀死枯木巨魔的领袖，巫医麦金。这样就可以抑制住敌人对狮鹫的猎杀势头。巫医麦金藏在伯根的棚屋，就在沙德拉洛以西。",dEN="The rugged terrain of the Hinterlands is not only home to the Wildhammer dwarves and their gryphons, but also to a number of forest troll tribes.\n\nThe trolls view the Wildhammers as squatters on their ancestral lands and spare no opportunity to accost the dwarves by attacking the gryphon aeries. One way to prove ourselves in the eyes of the Wildhammer is to help staunch these attacks by killing a Witherbark leader, Witch Doctor Mai'jin, who shelters in a cave at Bogen's Ledge, to the west of Shadra'Alor.",o="鹰巢山的鲁雷斯大使要求你杀死巫医麦金和他的蜘蛛宠物查卡斯。",oEN="Ambassador Rualeth at Aerie Peak wants you to slay Witch Doctor Mai'jin and his pet spider Tcha'kaz.",p="你带着巫医梅金的死讯回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with news of Witch Doctor Mai'jin's death?",c="做得好，$n。蛮锤会很高兴知道他们不是独自和枯木奋战。让他们知道联盟可以是保护狮鹫的可靠伙伴会让我们的论点更有份量一点。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The Wildhammers will be heartened to know that they don't stand against the Witherbark trolls alone. Showing them that the Alliance can prove a reliable partner in protecting the gryphons should lend more weight to our proposition."}
Q[9471]={d="蛮锤矮人一直以来都是狮鹫的伙伴，保姆和训练师。狮鹫的天敌非常多，特别是森林巨魔的部族中有许多猎头者。\n\n此外，有些时候，威胁则来自大自然的中的食肉动物，例如狼。单独的食肉动物无法与狮鹫对抗，但群居的食肉动物在猎物匮乏的情况下，会选择以狮鹫作为捕猎目标。捕杀狼群的话，可以降低它们对于狮鹫的威胁，也可以帮助我们联盟取得蛮锤矮人的好感。",dEN="The Wildhammer dwarves act as companions, caretakers, and trainers to the gryphons. The gryphons have no shortage of enemies, especially among the forest troll tribes.\n\nSometimes, though, the threat comes from natural predators, such as wolves. A single animal is no match for a gryphon, but packs have taken to targeting gryphons more often because normal prey is scarce. Culling the wolves can help to reduce their impact on the gryphons and ingratiate us to the Wildhammer.",o="鹰巢山的鲁雷斯大使要求你杀死10只癞皮银鬃狼和5只银鬃狼。",oEN="Ambassador Rualeth at Aerie Peak wants you to kill 10 Mangy Silvermane and 5 Silvermane Wolves.",p="你削减了银鬃的数量吗？",pEN="Have you culled the silvermane population?",c="<当你交出你的报告时鲁德斯大使对你点点头。>\n\n你做的很好。银鬃狼群被削减的事一定会让蛮锤知道。等我和他们的领导者见面时，我相信你的行为会在联盟中获得良好的回应。请收下这些钱以表达我的感谢，$n。",cEN="<Ambassador Rualeth nods as you give your report.>\n\nYou have done well. The culling of the silvermane will not go unnoticed by the Wildhammer. When I meet with their leaders, I am certain that your deeds will reflect well upon the Alliance. Please accept this coin as a small token of my thanks, <name>."}
Q[9472]={d="有那么多重要的事情要做，埃雷利恩居然还能挤出时间去见他的“恋人”！\n\n这件事已经再清楚不过了。薇拉·火语，这个混账……我要让她知道跟魔导师作对的下场。\n\n带上这个卷轴去找薇拉。想办法诱使她离开岗哨，然后利用卷轴来对付她。\n\n埃雷利恩在日记中提到，她难以抗拒塞纳里奥德鲁伊的特酿热酒。转至地狱火半岛西边的赞加沼泽，或许你能在塞纳里奥庇护所买到这种酒。",dEN="With all the important matters at hand Arelion still found time in his schedule to see a mistress!\n\nIt's all becoming perfectly clear. Viera Sunwhisper, that filthy wench... we'll show her to never cross a magistrix again.\n\nTake this scroll and find Viera. Find a way to lure her away from town and use the scroll on her.\n\nArelion mentioned she couldn't resist a particular wine harvested by the cenarion druids. You might find some at Cenarion Refuge, just inside Zangarmarsh, west of here.",o="猎鹰岗哨的魔导师卡尔琳达要你诱使薇拉·火语离开岗哨，然后对她使用卡尔琳达的惩戒卷轴。",oEN="Magistrix Carinda at Falcon Watch wants you to lure Viera Sunwhisper away from the settlement and then use Carinda's Scroll of Retribution on her.",p="嗯，$n。完成了吗？",pEN="Well, <name>. Is it done?",c="非常好！那个小贱货暂时不会再跟别人的丈夫乱搞了。\n\n这是给你的一点小意思。我想这件事只有我俩知道就好，$n。",cEN="Excellent! That little backstabber won't be running off with anyone's husband any time soon.\n\nHere's a little something for your troubles. I trust we can keep this incident between us, <name>."}
Q[9473]={d="仅仅依靠这种药膏恐怕很难挽救她，她太虚弱了。或许还有其它的办法……\n\n秘蓝岛的森林中蕴藏着许多的秘密，其中之一就是某种名叫碧蓝金鱼草的稀有植物，这种植物据说是一种万能药，可以医治所有的病症与伤痛。\n\n这种植物的样子很容易鉴定，它与秘蓝岛上的其它植物在颜色上有着巨大的反差，一般都在生长在蓝松树下，还会闪闪发光。快去吧！\n\n哦，对了，$n，你还得小心那片地区的根须痛击者。它们以碧蓝金鱼草为食，或许会攻击你。",dEN="The girl is too far gone for mere ointments to be effective. There may be another way...\n\nThe forest of Azuremyst holds many secrets, one of those being a rare plant known as the azure snapdragon that some claim to be a panacea - a cure all.\n\nYou can identify the plant by its stark contrast to the other plants of Azuremyst and its need to grow at the base of the azure pine trees. Make haste!\n\nAnd <name>, be wary of the root threshers of the region as they consume snapdragon for sustenance.",o="碧蓝岗哨的丹达尔希望你帮他收集5株碧蓝金鱼草。",oEN="Daedal at Azure Watch wants you to bring him 5 Azure Snapdragon Bulbs.",p="别浪费时间，$g男孩:女孩。",pEN="Do not waste time, <boy/girl>.",c="看看这个植物神奇的效用！",cEN="Watch as the plant works its magic."}
Q[9474]={d="尽管我来到艾泽拉斯的时间还不长，但我已经了解到了许多这里的英雄事迹。在他们所有人当中，光明使者乌瑟尔无疑是最伟大的。虽然他最终被自己最得意的学生阿尔萨斯背叛，但乌瑟尔无疑仍是个顶天立地的英雄。\n\n为了纪念他，我希望能将一些东西归还到他的陵墓中。据说血色十字军保存着一件乌瑟尔的圣物，它被放在壁炉谷大门附近的一座哨塔上。\n\n$c，请帮我取回它。",dEN="In the short time that I have been on Azeroth I have studied many of its heroes. Of them all, Uther Lightbringer stands above the rest. A hero for the ages, in the end Uther was betrayed by his most promising pupil, Arthas.\n\nIn his honor, I would like to return something he lost to his nearby tomb. It is rumored that the Scarlet Crusade is keeping one of his holy relics atop their guard tower near the gates of Hearthglen.\n\nPlease, <class>, go and retrieve it.",o="取得光明使者的印记，然后把它交给西瘟疫之地冰风岗的学者特卢恩。",oEN="Obtain the Mark of the Lightbringer and return it to Anchorite Truuen at Chillwind Camp in the Western Plaguelands.",p="光明使者的印记是乌瑟尔对圣光信念的一个强大象征。",pEN="The Mark of the Lightbringer is a powerful symbol of Uther's faith in the Light.",c="谢谢你，$c！取得这个神圣象征对我和其它尊敬怀念乌瑟尔·光明使者的人而言有着极大的意义。",cEN="Thank you, <class>! The recovery of this holy symbol means a great deal to myself and others that honor the memory of Uther Lightbringer."}
Q[9475]={d="仔细检查过后，你猜测这具已经被彻底打扁敲碎了的骸骨应该属于羽须。骸骨的手中握有一张已经揉成一团，破烂不堪的纸张。你小心翼翼地将这张纸取下摊平，发现上面一张潦草手绘的地图和几句匆忙写下的笔记。\n\n地图看起来像是描绘着沙德拉洛附近的三座神殿，并且在几处地方画有“X”形的记号，想必那里就是藏匿被盗的狮鹫卵的地点了。你将地图小心折好，收进了背包中，打算在一处更安全的地方仔细检视它。",dEN="Looking over the remains, you surmise that this broken and battered skeleton must be all that is left of Featherbeard. Clutched in one skeletal hand is a torn and stained sheaf of paper. You gently remove and unroll it, revealing a hand-drawn map and a few hastily scrawled notes.\n\nThe map appears to be a rendering of Shadra'Alor and its three temples with 'x' marks in several places, presumably the locations of the stolen eggs. You place the map in your pack for inspection at a safer location.",o="收集5枚狮鹫卵，然后向鹰巢山的鲁雷斯大使复命。",oEN="Gather 5 Gryphon Eggs and return them to Ambassador Rualeth at Aerie Peak.",p="你脸上的神情说明你是$g一个:一个;带来坏消息的人。你发现了什么？",pEN="The look on your face marks you as the bearer of bad news. What have you discovered?",c="<将蛋交给大使，你描述在羽须小屋及沙德拉洛的发现。>\n\n枯木族杀了羽须？\n\n<鲁德斯的脸在你描述这位矮人的死及与鲁德斯的任务关联时恐怖的扭曲着。>\n\n我明白为什么他觉得必须去寻找这些蛋，但我希望他该想到带其它人一起去。他的死无疑将激怒弗斯塔德·蛮锤，并引发对巨魔的复仇，这必定会无限期地延后我们的会面。",cEN="<Handing the eggs to the ambassador, you describe the findings at Featherbeard's Hovel and Shadra'Alor.>\n\nThe Witherbark killed Featherbeard?\n\n<Rualeth's face contorts in horror at your description of the dwarf's death and the implications for Rualeth's mission.>\n\nI understand why he felt he had to go in search of the eggs, but I wish he'd thought to bring others along. His death will no doubt enrage Falstad Wildhammer, triggering retaliation against the trolls, and delaying my audience indefinitely."}
Q[9476]={d="日记中主要记载了最近枯木巨魔进攻蛮锤部族的狮鹫巢穴并盗取狮鹫卵的行为数量大大增长的事情，羽须对此十分担心。对于附近小规模的枯木巨魔定居点的侦察与搜索也没有获得任何情报。\n\n最后一条中写道，羽须怀疑一个名叫麦金的巫医是所有侵袭行为的幕后主使者。最后，文中提到了这个矮人亲自转至沙德拉洛调查的强烈意愿。",dEN="The journal's most recent entries detail Featherbeard's concern about a growing number of Witherbark troll raids on the Wildhammer gryphon aeries and a rash of egg thefts. A search of the smaller Witherbark settlements in the area appears to have yielded no information.\n\nThe last entry describes Featherbeard's suspicion that a Witherbark witch doctor named Mai'jin is behind the raids. The last, hastily written sentence states the dwarf's intention to travel to Shadra'Alor in search of the eggs.",o="转至沙德拉洛一带寻找羽须的踪迹。",oEN="Travel to Shadra'Alor and search for traces of Featherbeard.",c="祭坛上有一堆看起来属于男性矮人的骨头。没有可辨识的特征，但你决定检查尸体来确定这是否是羽须的遗体。",cEN="Upon the altar is a heap of bones that appear to have belonged to a dwarven male. No identifying features remain, but you decide to search the body for confirmation that these are the remains of Featherbeard."}
Q[9483]={p="就因为我们参与这次的朝圣并不代表我们要放弃所有生命的乐趣。距离我上次喝杯好酒已经是好几世代前的事了。\n\n为了一瓶塞纳里奥热酒要我杀人也无所谓！\n\n我完全不知道我怎么会堕落到喜欢喝暗夜精灵酿的酒。",pEN="Just because we're on this pilgrimage doesn't mean we have to give up all of life's pleasures. It's been ages since I had a good wine.\n\nI'd literally kill for a bottle of cenarion spirits!\n\nI know, I know, how unfashionable of me to enjoy a drink brewed by night elves.",c="就算我们是在朝圣，也不代表必须放弃一切乐趣。我已经好几个世纪没好好喝过一杯了。\n\n为了一瓶塞纳里奥烈酒，让我杀人也愿意！\n\n是啊，我真不知道自己怎么会堕落到喜欢暗夜精灵的佳酿。",cEN="You know, maybe we can become friends after all. Follow me; we don't want to have to share this with the others now, do we?\nRelated"}
Q[9487]={d="奥术掠夺者是野蛮粗暴的魔法生物。它们装备着重甲，可以轻而易举地击晕对手。但是，你可以无视奥术掠夺者的防御能力，避开它们的攻击。$n，这就是你作为法师的优势。\n\n转至晨星之塔轰杀奥术掠夺者，从它们的残骸中收集蕴藏着魔法能量的结晶碎片。晨星之塔就在东边的湖泊对岸。",dEN="Arcane reavers are magical creations of brute strength. They are heavily armored and deliver stunning blows. You, however, can bypass their defenses and avoid their attacks. Your spellcraft is not without many advantages, <name>.\n\nTravel to Dawnstar Spire and blast apart the arcane reavers. From their remains, collect the crystallized fragments of magical energy and return to me. Dawnstar Spire is found to the east, across the lake.",o="奥术师范迪瑞尔要你为他收集10块奥术残片。",oEN="Arcanist Vandril wants you to collect 10 Arcane Fragments for him.",p="你没靠那些畜生太近吧？",pEN="Didn't get too close to the brutes, I hope?",c="真是浪费，使用魔法来建造有肉体力量的生物。毕竟，我一直认为那是我们和较弱的种族结盟的原因。\n\n你摧毁他们是对的，这样我们就能把残存的物质拿来做更好的运用。",cEN="Such a waste, using magic to construct beings of physical strength. I always thought that's why we allied with the lesser races, after all.\n\nYou were good to destroy them so we can use what remains for a more suitable purpose."}
Q[9488]={d="你收集的这些奥术残片很不错。\n\n想知道做什么用？为你这样的$c制作一件漂亮的长袍！\n\n现在我们只需要一些亚麻布和一个纺丝蜘蛛的丝囊就万事俱备了。你可以在纺丝蜘蛛身上找到丝囊，当然首先你得杀死它们。",dEN="The arcane fragments you collected will do nicely.\n\nNicely for what, you ask? For making a splendid robe fit for a <class> like yourself!\n\nAll we need now is some linen cloth and a spindleweb silk gland. You can find the silk gland from any spindleweb spider, preferably after killing them.",o="将15张亚麻布和1个纺丝蜘蛛的丝囊交给奥术师范迪瑞尔。",oEN="Arcanist Vandril wants you to bring him 15 Linen Cloth and a Spindleweb Silk Gland.",p="没有必须的材料就无法完成长袍。但你知道这点，对吧？",pEN="The robe cannot be completed without the necessary supplies. But you knew that, didn't you?",c="你真的不必知道制作一件魔法长袍的复杂手续，$n，你只要知道把什么带给我就好。\n\n老实说，你带来的东西可以做好几件长袍。我赚到的利益会比制作你的长袍所需的花费还多，甚至还够买一些好东西给我自己。看来要好好感谢你了！",cEN="You really don't need to know the intricacies of crafting a magical robe, <name>, you just need to know what to bring me.\n\nAnd let me be honest, you brought enough for several robes. The profit I'll make should more than cover the costs to make your robe, and even enough to buy myself something nice. Looks like the thanks belong to you!"}
Q[9489]={d="$n，你能来真是太好了。天灾军团在不断袭击我们的城市，我担心守卫们会丧失士气。\n\n杰拉和她的游侠在南边的死亡之痕严阵以待，你赶紧到那里去，召唤圣光的力量为他们祝福吧。",dEN="<name>, it is good you are here. The Scourge attack our city with such endless hate that I fear the morale of our guard is breaking.\n\nHurry to the Dead Scar just south of the city where Jaela and her rangers stand ready. Fill them with the power of the Light through your blessings.",o="对死亡之痕的6个永歌游侠施放真言术：韧。",oEN="Cast Power Word: Fortitude on 6 Eversong Rangers in the Dead Scar.",p="你给予他们希望了吗？",pEN="Have you given hope where it waned?",c="游侠们已带着敬畏和尊敬提到你的祝福了。现在你知道圣光对我们多重要了，让我们能帮助他人，不过要在我们先帮助自己之后。",cEN="Already the rangers speak of your blessings with awe and respect. Now you can see how the Light serves us, allowing us to help others, but only after we have helped ourselves."}
Q[9490]={d="生活在岩石地域的掠夺者是一种狡诈而好斗的生物，它们的一生是短暂而凶暴的。不过，跟它们种群的女王“凶猛的黑色利爪”相比，普通的掠夺者都简直跟鹦鹉一样乖巧了。\n\n我的堂弟就是被这个所谓的女王给吃掉的，唉……我发誓总有一天要让这只“黑色利爪”付出代价。如果你能将它死亡的证明带回来给我，我愿意把我一生的储蓄都给你算作报酬，你觉得怎么样？\n\n哦，对了，你最好带上一些高大威猛，而且装备精良的朋友们一起去。那只黑色利爪就在大裂隙的洞穴中，你很容易就能找到它，祝你好运！",dEN="Rock flayers are mean, nasty, violent creatures. But the plain ones are like tame beasts when compared to their matriarch, Blacktalon the Savage.\n\nMy cousin got eaten by her and it wasn't pretty. I swore that one day Blacktalon would pay for that. You bring back proof of that monster's death and I will give you my life's savings. Deal?\n\nYou're going to need some friends to kill Blacktalon. Big tough friends with sharp swords. You'll find her inside a cave in the Great Fissure. Good luck!",o="转至大裂隙杀死凶猛的黑色利爪，将黑色利爪的爪子交给地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的伊坎。",oEN="Obtain Blacktalon's Claws from Blacktalon the Savage at the Great Fissure and bring it to Ikan at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你带回黑色利爪死亡的证据了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you bring back proof of Blacktalon's death, <name>?",c="没错，我记得这些锐利的爪子！\n\n收下这个奖励，$n。你完成了一个危险的任务。你值得这些奖励。",cEN="Yes, I remember these sharp claws!\n\nTake this reward, <name>. That was a dangerous task you just did. You deserve every bit of this reward."}
Q[9491]={d="昨天有个富得流油的商人路过这里，说阿曼尼地下墓穴里数不清的陪葬箱中有一只\"极具考古价值\"的戒指。他要是不谈那戒指，就在说他愿意为它出多少钱。\n\n这样吧，盗贼工具我来出，你要是能把戒指带回来，我给你的报酬够你自己买上十来只戒指！",dEN="A rich, and I mean filthy rich, merchant came through here yesterday talking about some ring of \"immense archeological importance\" locked in one of the countless burial chests found in the Amani Catacombs. When he wasn't talking about the ring, he was talking about how much he'd pay for it.\n\nTell you what, I'll front the thieves' tools, and if you manage to bring the ring back, I'll pay you enough to buy ten rings of your own!",o="塔奎林的埃拉兰要你从阿曼尼地下墓穴中取回那枚布满凹痕的金戒指。",oEN="Eralan in Tranquillien wants you to retrieve the Pitted Gold Band from the Amani Catacombs.\n\n(Requires ability: Pick Lock, learned from the Rogue Subtlety tree in Character Advancement)",p="求求你告诉我你找到戒指了。那个商人用不了多久就会找到他自己的$n。",pEN="Please tell me you found the ring. It won't be long before that merchant finds his own <class>.",c="这就是那枚戒指，对吧？没什么看头，不过你也知道，一个精灵眼里的垃圾……\n\n可别忘了你的报酬。尽管在这儿花掉它，别不好意思，亲爱的！",cEN="This is the ring, is it? Not much to look at, but you know what they say about one elves' trash...\n\nAnd let's not forget your payment. Don't feel shy about spending it right here sweetie!"}
Q[9492]={d="身在外域，你所必须面对的数个悲惨事实之一就是：这片土地长久以来一直笼罩在邪兽人势力的阴影之下。我们洛萨之子曾相信自己已用鲜血换回了荣耀堡片刻的安宁，可事实上，真正的和平从未降临过这里。\n\n洛萨之子绝对不会向任何兽人屈服，无论他们的皮肤是绿色，棕色，还是现在的红色。我们要么战胜他们，要么全部光荣战死。要想获得真正的胜利，就必须攻下地狱火堡垒。现在，去把他们那个自封为“酋长”的卡加斯·刃拳干掉，你会得到封赏的。",dEN="The permanence of the orcish threat is one of the sad truths of Outland. There was a time when we Sons of Lothar believed we'd purchased Honor Hold's safety with our blood, but there was to be no peace.\n\nThe Sons will yield to no orc - green, brown, and now red - we will overcome them or die trying. If we are to have any expectation of victory, we must take the fight to them in Hellfire Citadel. Bring me the weapon of their self-styled 'Warchief' Kargath Bladefist and you will be well rewarded.",o="将卡加斯酋长之拳交给荣耀堡的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩。",oEN="Bring Warchief Kargath's Fist to Force Commander Danath Trollbane in Honor Hold.",p="你带回“大酋长”卡加斯·刃拳死亡的证据了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with proof of 'Warchief' Kargath Bladefist's demise?",c="做得好，$n。有你在地狱火堡垒的胜利，我们就对兽人造成了很大的打击。\n\n我一定要和大元帅洛摩斯谈谈接下来的事，并确定兽人保持在防守状态。既然我们有了援军，就能做比防御荣耀堡更多的事。",cEN="Well done, <name>. With your victory in Hellfire Citadel, we have struck a major blow against the orcs.\n\nI must speak with Field Commander Romus about following up and ensuring that the orcs stay on the defensive. Now that we've been reinforced, we can do far more than simply defend Honor Hold."}
Q[9493]={d="我们对于地狱火堡垒内邪部落的存在所知确实甚少，而且，就这样一点信息，也付出了许多生命的代价。\n\n邪部落的各军团都由卡加斯·刃拳指挥，他们残忍，好战，并因邪恶魔法的加持而拥有无穷尽的力量。其中的精英是碎手军团，他们的军团士兵、勇士和百夫长都深受其它士兵的敬畏，是其它军团的中下层军官。\n\n尽可能地消灭他们吧，这将是我们破坏邪部落领导和指挥体系的作战中最为重要的一步。",dEN="We know precious little about the Fel Horde presence in Hellfire Citadel and our information has come at the cost of many lives.\n\nFel Horde troops under the command of Kargath Bladefist are a brutal, battle-hardened lot fortified by foul magics. The elite of this force, the Shattered Hand legionnaires, champions, and centurions are feared by the regulars and serve as an officer corps.\n\nTargeting and eliminating them is a necessary first step in any successful assault on the Fel Horde's leadership.",o="荣耀堡的战地指挥官洛姆斯要求你杀死8名碎手军团士兵、4名碎手百夫长和4名碎手勇士。",oEN="Field Commander Romus at Honor Hold wants you to kill 8 Shattered Hand Legionnaires, 4 Shattered Hand Centurions, and 4 Shattered Hand Champions.",p="我不会天真到认为击败了碎手军团士兵就预告了我们对魔狱部落的胜利，但这的确是个很好的开始。",pEN="I am not so naive as to think that the defeat of the Shattered Hand legionnaires heralds our victory over the Fel Horde, but is a good first step.",c="这是个很棒的消息，真的，$n。有了地狱火堡垒的报告进展，我们或许可以把注意力转到出现在半岛和外域其它地方的魔狱部落。",cEN="That is excellent news, indeed, <name>. With progress to report from Hellfire Citadel, perhaps we can afford to turn our attention to the Fel Horde presence other parts of the peninsula and Outland as a whole."}
Q[9494]={d="艾泽拉斯那边的老学究们看来是龟缩在高塔里太久太久了，向大家展示真正尖端的研究成果的重任显然已经落在了我的肩膀之上！他们不敢玩火，没关系，我敢，即使是双手都被火焰吞噬也没什么。\n\n地狱火堡垒内的破碎大厅里的高阶术士奈瑟库斯拥有一对神秘的火盆。凭借这个，他就可以进行某种强大的召唤仪式。用他的容器装着邪能灰烬，给我带一份回来，$n。",dEN="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is! They're afraid to play with fire and that's exactly what I intend to do, once I get my hands on the fire, that is.\n\nWithin Hellfire Citadel's Shattered Halls, Grand Warlock Nethekurse performs unrivaled magical feats augmented by the powers of a pair of strange braziers. Using the vessel he uses to contain these fel embers, capture one and bring it back to me, <name>.",o="荣耀堡的大法师萨布兰希要求你给她带回一块邪能灰烬。",oEN="Magus Zabraxis at Honor Hold wants you to bring her a Fel Ember.",p="你把，呃，余烬带来了吗？",pEN="Did you bring the, err, ember?",c="做得好！我不期望模仿大术士奈德克斯的技艺，我也不渴求，但如果忽略魔化余烬的力量那我们就是蠢蛋了。\n\n不过，还是有些人会禁止我要着手的研究类型，因此，我的努力一定要保密。拜托不要跟任何人说起这些事，$n。",cEN="Well done! I can't hope to replicate the feats of Grand Warlock Nethekurse, nor should I aspire to, but we would be fools to ignore the power of the fel embers.\n\nHowever, there are those who would forbid the type of research I'm about to embark upon, and for that reason, I must keep my efforts secret. Please do not speak of this to anyone, <name>."}
Q[9495]={d="将所有的兽人从腐化之血的诅咒中解救出来，这远远没有想象中的那么容易，$n。萨尔酋长已经目睹了太多兽人英雄倒在命运之手的操控之下。现在，似乎卡加斯·刃拳也要落到这个下场了。\n\n卡加斯·刃拳当前正在地狱火堡垒的破碎大厅当中做着他的白日梦，宣称他是那个邪部落的唯一的“酋长”。有了那群狂热而嗜血的军团的帮助，他不将萨尔玛夷为平地是不会善罢甘休的。萨尔酋长已经下了命令，不惜一切代价消灭卡加斯和他的军团。",dEN="The struggle to free the orcish people from our tainted blood has not been easy, <name>. Warchief Thrall has seen too many orcish heroes laid low by fate's hand. Now, it seems Kargath Bladefist numbers among them.\n\nIn the Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel, Kargath has claimed the title of 'Warchief' of the Fel Horde. With an army of crazed, bloodthirsty fel orcs at his back, he won't rest until Thrallmar is destroyed. Warchief Thrall has commanded us to defeat Kargath and his forces at all costs.",o="将卡加斯酋长之拳交给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Bring Warchief Kargath's Fist to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",p="你有卡加斯·刃拳战败的证据吗？",pEN="Have you proof of Kargath Bladefist's defeat?",c="你干得很好，$n。在鼎盛时期，卡加斯·刃拳是位出色的战士，是他族人的英雄和榜样。\n\n他的死对我们所有人都是打击，对大酋长萨尔尤其如此。无论他在最后的日子里变成了什么，我们都不该忘记卡加斯曾经是那个兽人，也不该忘记从他的堕落中可以汲取的教训。\n\n为了你对部落的效劳，$n，你将$g得到奖赏:得到奖赏;，可以从这些武器中任选一件。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. In his prime, Kargath Bladefist was a fine warrior, a hero and example to his people.\n\nHis death is a blow to us all, but especially to Warchief Thrall. Whatever happened to him in his final days, we should not forget the orc Kargath once was, nor the lessons to be learned from his downfall.\n\nFor your service to the Horde, <name>, you are to be rewarded with your choice from among these weapons."}
Q[9496]={d="撇开霸主裂拳的辱骂不谈，$n，这支邪部落可不是好惹的。\n\n据我们所知，卡加斯·刃拳麾下的邪部落部队凶悍残暴、久经沙场，还被污秽的魔法强化过。这支部队的精锐——碎手军团士兵、勇士和百夫长——是邪部落的军官团，普通士兵都惧怕他们。\n\n要想斩首邪部落，第一步就是除掉这些军官。|n",dEN="Overlord Maimfist's insults aside, <name>, this Fel Horde is nothing to be trifled with.\n\nFrom what we know, Fel Horde troops under the command of Kargath Bladefist are a brutal, battle-hardened lot fortified by foul magics. The elite of this force, the Shattered Hand legionnaires, champions, and centurions are feared by the Fel Horde regulars and serve as an officer corps.\n\nTargeting and eliminating them is a necessary first step in any successful assault on the Fel Horde's leadership.",o="萨尔玛的暗影猎手塔金要求你杀死8名碎手军团士兵、4名碎手百夫长和4名碎手勇士。",oEN="Shadow Hunter Ty'jin at Thrallmar wants you to kill 8 Shattered Hand Legionnaires, 4 Shattered Hand Centurions, and 4 Shattered Hand Champions.",p="一旦碎手军团士兵被击破，我们就能开始进展对付魔狱部落的战役。你完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Once the Shattered Hand legionnaires have been broken, we can begin to make progress in our campaign against the Fel Horde. Have you carried out your mission, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。既然军团士兵被击破了，在战场上挑战魔狱部落就会更容易，虽然他们仍是可怕的敌人。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. With the legionnaires broken, it will be easier to face the Fel Horde on the battlefield, though they remain a formidable enemy."}
Q[9498]={d="我的族人不久前建好了猎鹰岗哨，那是地狱火半岛西南地区、地狱火堡垒之外的一处行动基地。你在那里永远会$g受到欢迎:受到欢迎;，$n。\n\n你要是想找活干，就去那儿告诉游侠队长文恩伦是我派你去的。他会给你安排配得上你这份本事的任务。",dEN="My people recently finished building Falcon Watch, a base of operations in the southwestern region of Hellfire Peninsula - beyond Hellfire Citadel. You are welcome there as an ally, <name>.\n\nIf you're looking for work, go there and tell Ranger Captain Venn'ren that I sent you. He will see to it that you're given tasks worthy of someone of your caliber.",o="转至地狱火半岛的猎鹰岗哨，向游侠队长维恩雷报到。",oEN="Report to Ranger Captain Venn'ren at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="欢迎来到猎鹰岗哨，$r。我们欢迎所有的部落盟友，尤其是玛提克推荐的。",cEN="Welcome to Falcon Watch, <race>. All our Horde allies are welcome here, especially those recommended by Martik."}
Q[9499]={d="$n，你还呆在这儿做什么？你没听说我们在地狱火半岛新建了一处辛多雷哨站吗？\n\n你肯定愿意跟血精灵同伴呆在一起，远离这里的……气味。猎鹰岗哨与地狱火堡垒遥遥相对，就在地狱火半岛的西南方。向游侠队长维恩雷报到，他会照顾你的。\n\n通往猎鹰岗哨的道路非常危险，沿途都有联盟的侦察员巡逻。我建议你跟你的伙伴同行，最好是血精灵同伴。",dEN="What are you still doing here, <name>? Didn't you hear we built a proper sin'dorei outpost here in Hellfire Peninsula?\n\nSurely you'd rather be among fellow blood elves and away from all this... smell. You'll find Falcon Watch in the southwest, beyond Hellfire Citadel. Report to Ranger Captain Venn'ren; he will take care of you.\n\nThe road ahead is dangerous and heavily patrolled by Alliance scouts. I would recommend travelling with companions. Blood elves, preferably.",o="转至地狱火半岛西南方的猎鹰岗哨，向游侠队长维恩雷报到。",oEN="Travel to Falcon Watch in the southwest of Hellfire Peninsula and report to Ranger Captain Venn'ren.",c="欢迎来到猎鹰岗哨，$g兄弟:姐妹。许多其它的血精灵没那么幸运可以走到这一步。\n\n这真是可耻，我们在外域的工作才正要开始。",cEN="Welcome to Falcon Watch, <brother/sister>. Many other blood elves haven't been fortunate enough to make it this far.\n\nIt's a terrible shame; our work in Outland has just begun."}
Q[9500]={d="距你上次接受考验已经过了很久。先知努波顿一直在打听你。你的智慧想必大有长进，因为你被召去学习水元素的奥秘了。\n\n你还记得在埃索达的水晶大厅里上哪儿找他，对吧？",dEN="It's been a while since last you were tested. Farseer Nobundo has been asking for you. You must have grown greatly in wisdom because you are being called to learn the mysteries of the element of water.\n\nYou remember where to find him at the Crystal Hall inside of the Exodar, right?",o="与埃索达内水晶大厅的预言者努波顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall inside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",c="我们又见面了。我一直在远处注视着你的进步，$n，我很满意。\n\n是时候让你与水元素沟通，学习它的奥秘，把自己交付给水，从而学会驾驭它。",cEN="We meet again. I have been watching your progress from afar, <class>, and I am pleased.\n\nThe time has come for you to commune with the element of water, to learn its mysteries and give yourself over to the water so that you might in turn learn to master it."}
Q[9501]={d="一位名叫阿奎欧斯的强大水元素在等着你。秘血岛的水元素遇到了巨大的不平衡状态，显然，这与那些血精灵有关。\n\n在秘血岛北海岸的海面下有一处隐藏着的暗礁，你可以在那里找到阿奎欧斯。\n\n带上这瓶药水，它可以帮助你到达阿奎欧斯身边。",dEN="A powerful water elemental named Aqueous has requested your presence. It would seem that there is a great imbalance occurring in the water element on Bloodmyst Isle. Not surprising given the unnatural predilections of the blood elves.\n\nYou will find Aqueous in a hidden reef under the waves off the northern shore of Bloodmyst Isle.\n\nTake this potion; it can help you to get to her once you get into the water near the reef.",o="与秘血岛藏帆暗礁的阿奎欧斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Aqueous in the Hidden Reef at Bloodmyst Isle.",c="别害怕，$n。我们会用心在这里交谈。\n\n我很感激先知诺柏多派你来找我。有一股强大的干扰不断在污染着秘血岛的水。就连盲人都能感觉到它对生物和环境的影响。\n\n我们会一起努力来阻止这个污染散播的更远。",cEN="Do not fear, <name>. While you are here we will speak using our minds.\n\nI am grateful to Farseer Nobundo for sending you to me. There is a great disturbance that is polluting the waters on and around Bloodmyst Isle. Not even the blind would fail to notice the effect this is having on its creatures and the environment.\n\nYou and I will work together to stop this corruption before it spreads further."}
Q[9502]={d="距你上次接受考验已经过了很久。先知努波顿一直在打听你。你的智慧想必大有长进，因为你被召去学习水元素的奥秘了。\n\n你还记得在埃索达的水晶大厅里上哪儿找他，对吧？",dEN="It's been a while since last you were tested. Farseer Nobundo has been asking for you. You must have grown greatly in wisdom because you are being called to learn the mysteries of the element of water.\n\nYou remember where to find him at the Crystal Hall inside of the Exodar, right?",o="与埃索达内水晶大厅的预言者努波顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall inside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",c="我们又见面了。我一直在远处注视着你的进步，$n，我很满意。\n\n是时候让你与水元素沟通，学习它的奥秘，把自己交付给水，从而学会驾驭它。",cEN="We meet again. I have been watching your progress from afar, <class>, and I am pleased.\n\nThe time has come for you to commune with the element of water, to learn its mysteries and give yourself over to the water so that you might in turn learn to master it."}
Q[9503]={d="为了与其它的元素平衡，水元素是维系所有生命的源泉。它孕育了生命，所有的生命都离不开它。然而它一旦遭到污染，所有的生命都会灭亡。\n\n我们必须知道水被污染的程度。在西南边有一处被污染的水体，它被称作污淤之池。到那里去，帮我从居住在池塘里的水之魂身上找一些邪恶精华回来。",dEN="In balance with the other elements, water is the source and sustenance of all living things. It gives and nurtures life, and all rely upon it for their existence. Yet, when polluted, it also brings life to an end.\n\nWe must determine the extent of the damage that has been done. To the southwest is one such contaminated body of water that has come to be known as the Foul Pool. Travel there and extract the foul essence from the water spirits that inhabit the pool.",o="收集6份邪恶精华，把它们交给秘血岛藏帆暗礁的阿奎欧斯。",oEN="Collect 6 Foul Essences and return them to Aqueous in the Hidden Reef at Bloodmyst Isle.",p="你这么快就从我不幸的姐妹身上收集好腐败精华了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you collected the foul essences of my unfortunate sisters so soon, <name>?",c="谢谢你，$c。这些应该够我研究这种腐化了。之后我们就能更清楚下一步该怎么做。",cEN="Thank you, <class>. These should be enough so that I can examine this corruption. Then we will have a better idea of how to proceed."}
Q[9504]={d="情况比我担心的更糟。污染相当严重，如果不加以制止的话，这片海洋乃至整个艾泽拉斯都会受到影响！\n\n我们需要一份未被污染的水源样本来对比污染的程度。这座岛的东南方还有未被污染的区域。到那里有怒鳞纳迦居住的废墟去，取得那里的泉水。\n\n带上这只波涛之袋，用它取得泉水样品。行动一定要快，$n！",dEN="It is worse than I feared. The corruption is very potent and if unchecked it could spread to the ocean currents and be carried throughout all of Azeroth!\n\nWe are going to need a sample of the purest water to counter this malignancy. There are ruins on the untainted portion of this island, to the southeast. Go there, where the Wrathscale naga reside, and take from their fountain.\n\nUse this bota bag to gather the sample. Hurry, <name>!",o="将水注满空的波涛之袋，然后把它交给秘血岛藏帆暗礁的阿奎欧斯。",oEN="Fill the Empty Bota Bag and then return to Aqueous in the Hidden Reef at Bloodmyst Isle.",p="你从废墟弄来纯净的水了吗？",pEN="You have the pure water from the ruins?",c="要分离水很容易，但把足够的水聚集在一起就会产生挡不住的力量。它冲刷泥土和火焰，轻易地将空气推到一边。\n\n我们就是那股阻挡不了的力量，$n，不是那些毒害了秘血岛的人！",cEN="Water parts easily, yet put enough of it together and it will create an unstoppable force. It washes away earth and fire, and easily pushes air out of the way.\n\nWe are that unstoppable force, <name>, not those that have poisoned Bloodmyst Isle!"}
Q[9505]={d="先知曾说起过这一天：在这座岛上，在这个新世界里，我们的盟友会找到我们。\n\n\"我们将受到考验。他们会要求我们为父辈的罪孽付出代价……\"\n\n当时我不明白他话里的意思，但看到这个生物和它对我们的反应，我渐渐懂了。我们族人的腐化，连这里都能感受到。\n\n往南去吧。我们就是在那儿发现这个生物的。找到它的同类，把我们的情况告诉他们。",dEN="The Prophet spoke of this day: That on this island, in this new world, our allies would find us.\n\n\"We will be tested. They will ask that we pay for the sins of our fathers...\"\n\nAt the time, I did not understand the meaning behind his words, but seeing this creature and her reaction to us, it is now coming into focus. The corruption of our people has been felt even here.\n\nVenture south. It is there that we found this being. Find its kin and tell them of our people.",o="丹达尔希望你到南方去寻找这个受伤的生物提到的人。",oEN="Daedal wants you to travel south and seek out the people that the injured creature mentioned.",c="你说你找到了我们的一个成员而且她还受伤了？我会立刻派一个人员去你们的村子！",cEN="You say that you've found one of our crew and that she is injured? I will send one of my crewmen to your village immediately!"}
Q[9506]={d="我是联盟海军司令部所属的海军上将奥德修斯。我们的船最近因为遭受到了多次袭击，被迫在你们的岛上停留下来。当然，说起来非常尴尬，我们前几天竟然被一些地精成功混上了两艘战舰，甚至被他们成功地避开了我们的斥候。\n\n昨天夜里，当大部分的船员都在船舱里睡觉时，他们突然出现并袭击了我们！\n\n更奇怪的是，他们只是拿走了我们的航海设备，然后就直接跳船了！\n\n后来他们消失在了东边的那处灌木丛中，你能过去帮我们搜索一下我们的装备吗？你可能需要使用武力。",dEN="I am Admiral Odesyus of Alliance Naval Command. Our ship was forced to port on your island due to an infestation of sorts. It's embarrassing to even talk about, but goblins somehow managed to stow away in the holds of both of my ships.\n\nLast night, while most of the ship's crew was asleep below deck, they struck!\n\nStranger still, they took our navigation gear and jumped ship!\n\nThey disappeared into the thicket, east of here. Will you go in search of our gear? It will make for a strong gesture.",o="奥德修斯营地的海军上将奥德修斯希望你能夺回被风险投资公司偷走的航海罗盘和航海图。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Nautical Compass and Nautical Map stolen by the Venture Co.",p="运气如何，陌生人？",pEN="Any luck, stranger?",c="你真是个机智的人！有了我们的航海工具，我们就能知道自己偏离航道多少了。\n\n但是等等，这是什么？地图里还卷着一个东西。让我看看……\n\n这些是风险投资公司的穆戈尔欧·瑞斯丹克所下的命令。根据这些计划，他们想挖光岛上的水晶残骸，并在完成后劫走我们的船。\n\n我的老天爷啊！这是为什么他们要逼迫我们登陆吗？他们怎么会知道我们的计划？\n\n我闻到叛徒的味道……",cEN="You're a resourceful one! With our navigation gear, we can figure out just how far we've veered off course.\n\nBut wait, what's this? There's something rolled up in the map. Let me see...\n\nThese are orders from Mogul Razdunk of the Venture Company. According to these plans, they're here to strip-mine the island of the crystal wreckage, then hijack our ships once they're finished.\n\nBy Bronzebeard's bushy brow! This is why they forced us to land? How could they know of our plans?\n\nI smell a traitor..."}
Q[9508]={d="我知道污染源在哪里了。这都是由于一些疯狂的研究活动所导致的，你必须去阻止它！\n\n在污淤之池西南边有一小片营地，你可以在那里找到正在进行“研究”的污染者塔希恩，他制造出的污染物渗透到了周围的水中。\n\n利用你在灰谷找到的纯水毁掉他的贮藏桶，他一定会跳出来的。\n\n我们必须让这一切都立刻结束！",dEN="I have determined where the corruption is coming from. It is the by-product of some demented research and you're going to put an end to it!\n\nJust to the southwest of the Foul Pool is a small camp. There you will find the 'research' of Tel'athion the Impure. This is where he produces the filth that has been seeping into the island's water.\n\nUse the pure water you obtained from Ashenvale to destroy his cache of barrels. That will be sure to bring him out.\n\nWe will have an end to this!",o="将塔希恩的徽记交给秘血岛藏帆暗礁的阿奎欧斯。",oEN="Bring the Head of Tel'athion to Aqueous in the Hidden Reef at Bloodmyst Isle.",p="你成功了吗？",pEN="Have you succeeded?",c="那么就完成了！危险解除，你让秘血岛的水复原了。随着时间过去，水和其它元素结合后会自己治愈。\n\n不幸的是，血精灵并不知道污染了他们的环境，他们自己也会死亡的！",cEN="It is done then! The crisis is averted and you have put in motion the restoration of the water on Bloodmyst Isle. Over time, the water, in conjunction with the other elements, will heal itself.\n\nIt is unfortunate that the blood elves cannot see that by contaminating their surroundings they're killing themselves off as well!"}
Q[9509]={d="我留下了一些你从灰谷带回来的水，这并非因为我怀疑你办事的能力。相反，我知道你一定能成功，我只是想确定你能将某些特别的东西带回去交给努波顿。\n\n给你，$n，带上这瓶纯净的水。有了它，你就可以得到一根有着强大力量的水之图腾。\n\n预言者努波顿在埃索达等着你回去。",dEN="I held back a little of the water from Ashenvale, not because I doubted your ability to deal with the situation. Rather, I knew that you would succeed, and I wanted to make sure that you had something special to take back to Nobundo.\n\nHere, <name>, take this flask of pure water. It will ensure that you receive a very powerful water totem.\n\nFarseer Nobundo awaits your return at the Exodar.",o="将纯水之瓶交给秘蓝岛埃索达的预言者努波顿。",oEN="Take the Flask of Purest Water to Farseer Nobundo inside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",p="元素对我说了你完成的伟大事绩。来，让我们谈谈。",pEN="The elements have spoken to me of the great deeds you have accomplished. Come, let us speak.",c="你展现了超出你年纪的智慧，$n。我可以感觉水元素对你的行为感到很满意。收下你带来的纯水并将它的精华与你新的水图腾结合在一起是我极大的荣耀。\n\n今后记得水的训诫，你将会对元素的认知和掌握了解更多。",cEN="You have comported yourself with wisdom beyond your years, <name>. I can sense that the water element is pleased with your actions. It will be my great honor to take the pure water that you bear and combine its essence into your new water totem.\n\nRemember well the lessons of water as you go forward and you will gain an even greater understanding and mastery of the element."}
Q[9511]={d="<TXT>你在卡加斯的尸体上找到的文件，详细记载着似乎是对荣耀堡发动的一场大规模入侵的计划。",dEN="The documents you found on Kargath's body detail plans on what appears to be a massive invasion on Honor Hold.\nRelated"}
Q[9512]={d="上将是对的，你可真是足智多谋。或许你能帮我做饭？\n\n要是我今天晚上又给船员们做鸡当饭吃，他们非把我丢去划舢板不可。\n\n其实，我发现这海边上竟然有这么多又肥又大的螃蟹，多到数不清！要不你给我打些螃蟹肉来吧，我一辈子也忘不了你这份恩情的。\n\n你就帮帮我这个从良的老海贼吧。",dEN="The Admiral be right, ye are a resourceful one. Mayhap ye could help Cookie out?\n\nIf I serve the crew chicken for dinner again, I'll be sent to the brig fer sure.\n\nI noticed that thar be crawlers all along the coastline - lots o' crawlers! Bring me crawler meats and I'll be forever indebted to ya.\n\nHelp a reformed pirate out?",o="把6块疾行爬行者的肉带给奥德修斯登陆点的\"厨子\"麦克弱酱。|n",oEN="\"Cookie\" McWeaksauce at the Odesyus' Landing wants you to bring him 6 Skittering Crawler Meat.",p="啊……呃……喔天啊……嗯，抱歉$g小伙子:小姑娘，我要练习一下海盗的事免得我忘记……",pEN="Arrr... Yarr... Shiver me timbers... Er, sorry <lad/lass>, I gotta practice me pirate lest I forget it...",c="愿你的心受祝福，$g陌生人:陌生人;。这可大大有助于提振船员的士气。",cEN="Bless yer heart, stranger. This'll go a long ways in liftin' the morale o' the crew."}
Q[9513]={d="大部分人都把我们流落到这里、陷入这种进退两难的境地视为不幸或时运不济，但我却感觉我们来到这里是有一个必然的原因。看不见的命运之手将我们推上了这条道路，很快那个原因就会逐渐显现。\n\n在西边有一座古代暗夜精灵的城市，现在已经是废墟了，并且它已经被纳迦占领。我绝对无法坐视纳迦盘踞在我们祖先的土地上不管。\n\n你已经展示出自己身为$c的优秀能力，请帮我清理遗迹中那些不受欢迎的客人，并以此纪念我的祖先吧。",dEN="While some may look at our current predicament as an unfortunate turn of events, I sense that we are here for a reason. The invisible hand of fate has pushed us in this direction. The reason why will become evident in time.\n\nTo the west lies an ancient night elf city, now in ruin and overrun with naga. It would be remiss of me to sit idly by as the naga tainted my ancestral lands.\n\nYou have shown yourself a capable <class>. Honor my people and cleanse the ruins of their unwelcome inhabitants.",o="秘蓝岛奥德修斯营地的女祭司基琳·伊尔蒂娜要求你杀死5只怒鳞侍从、5只怒鳞纳迦和5只怒鳞海妖。",oEN="Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill 5 Wrathscale Myrmidons, 5 Wrathscale Naga and 5 Wrathscale Sirens.",p="你为我的人民做了一件好事，$n。",pEN="You do a good thing for my people, <name>.",c="赞美艾露恩！不安的灵魂终究会得到安息。",cEN="Elune be praised! The restless spirits may find tranquility after all."}
Q[9514]={d="你完全无法理解这块石板上所有符号所表达的内容。或许女祭司能够解读这些神秘的符文。",dEN="You cannot make out any of the symbols on the tablet. Perhaps the priestess would be able to decipher the mysterious runes.",o="将布满符文的石板带给碧蓝秘岛奥德修斯登陆点的女祭司凯琳·伊尔迪纳尔。|n",oEN="Take the Rune Covered Tablet to Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle.",p="你找到什么了？",pEN="You've found something?",c="我看不懂这些符文，不过我知道谁可以看懂……",cEN="I can't read these runes but I know someone who can..."}
Q[9515]={d="纳迦的入侵绝对是灾难性的，$n。我曾见过纳迦所能造成的灾难，而且再也不愿再看见这种灾难降临在任何地方。我想，这个督军斯雷提兹就躲藏在岛上的某个洞穴之内，或许就在西边的海岸上。\n\n立刻找到督军斯雷提兹，结束他的统治吧。",dEN="A naga invasion would be disastrous, <name>. I've seen what naga can do and I would not want to see such a catastrophe befall any being. If I were to guess, this Warlord Sriss'tiz will be hidden in a cave - probably along the coast to the west.\n\nFind Warlord Sriss'tiz and put an end to his reign.",o="秘蓝岛奥德修斯营地的女祭司基琳·伊尔蒂娜要求你杀死督军斯雷提兹。",oEN="Priestess Kyleen Il'dinare at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill Warlord Sriss'tiz.",p="保持警惕！",pEN="Remain vigilant!",c="督军斯里斯特兹已死，纳迦入侵的可能如今只是遥远的记忆。我们暂时安全了……\n\n我得承认，我错怪你了，$n。你已证明自己和阿克蒙德那种渣滓毫无共同之处。收下这份来自暗夜精灵的礼物吧。",cEN="With Warlord Sriss'tiz dead, the possibility of a naga invasion is now only a distant memory. We are safe, for the time being...<name> must admit, I was wrong to think badly of you, <name>. You have shown that you are nothing like the filth that was Archimonde. Accept this as a gift from the night elves."}
Q[9516]={d="我绝不能容忍他们在这个世界存在！燃烧军团几乎彻底毁灭了我们的种族！我们被迫逃到了一个新的世界，创建了新的家园，可他们竟然又追了过来！这样的事情重复太多次了！\n\n不能再这样下去了！\n\n当前燃烧军团还有一部分残留部队盘踞在南边的冥火岭、屠魔峡谷和屠魔山。他们都是上次军团入侵时进入这个世界的馀孽。\n\n在一切还没有变得太糟糕的时候，赶快去把他们都清除掉！",dEN="I will not tolerate their existence on this world! The Burning Legion all but destroyed our race and we fell back to settle a new home on a new world. Then they came again. And we retreated, over and over.\n\nNo more!\n\nThere is a remnant of the Legion to the south in the regions known as Felfire Hill, Demon Fall Canyon and Demon Fall Ridge. They are what is leftover from a force that once long ago invaded this world.\n\nGo and destroy as many as you can before it is too late!",o="杀死6个玛诺洛克鞭笞者、6个恶魔守卫和6个灼热的地狱火，然后向灰谷林歌神殿的守备官维达尔复命。",oEN="Slay 6 Mannoroc Lashers, 6 Felguards and 6 Searing Infernals, and then return to Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="那些恶魔还存在吗？",pEN="Are there demons yet standing?",c="我尊重你，也感谢你，$n。也许我们终于能在这里建立新家园，不必再为燃烧军团担惊受怕了。",cEN="You have my respect and thanks, <class>. Perhaps we'll be able to create a new home here without having to worry about the Burning Legion yet again."}
Q[9517]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到林歌营地，$c。你看到帐篷的地方，终有一天会立起房屋，但这样的雄心需要源源不断的建筑材料。我实在不忍心下令让工人砍伐这片林地里的古树，可我们西边的邻居对森林却没有这般敬畏。\n\n我们要从战歌伐木场取走他们多余的木料，再从西边的萨特要塞回收一些被污染的木料。把木料带给战歌伐木场的纳尔，他是一位先祖，会为我们净化它。",dEN="Welcome to Forest Song, <class>. Where you see tents, there will one day be buildings, but such ambitions require a steady stream of building materials. I cannot bring myself to order our workers to fell any of the ancient trees of this grove, but our neighbors to the south and west have no such reverence for the forest.\n\nWe shall relieve the Warsong loggers of their excess, and reclaim some of the tainted wood from the satyr stronghold to the west. Bring the wood to Gnarl, who will purify it for our use.",o="将15块战歌木材和5块萨提纳尔木材交给林歌神殿的纳亚尔。",oEN="Bring 15 pieces of Warsong Lumber and 5 Satyrnaar Fel Wood to Gnarl at Forest Song.",p="<长者一边转向你一边发出咯吱声。>\n\n建筑师尼莫斯说你会从伐木者营地和污染的萨提纳尔带来木材。",pEN="<The ancient creaks as it turns toward you.>\n\nArchitect Nemos said that you might be bringing wood salvaged from the deforesters' encampment and befouled Satyrnaar.",c="用兽人粗糙的刀身砍下的木头一定是扭曲的，毕竟它暴露在极端的元素中",cEN="Wood cut with orcs' crude blades is warped as surely as that exposed to elemental extremes. Nothing sound can be built with it, but I shall purify it and return it to Architect Nemos and his men for their use. Some good will come from this tragedy, after all."}
Q[9518]={d="战歌伐木营地就是我们如锦缎般美丽的大地上的一处锈斑。每次我们暂时成功地阻止了他们，监工古尔萨克就会让他手下的伐木工加倍砍伐我们的树木！\n\n现在，兽人砍伐下的树木已经远远超过了他们所需要的，他们甚至就让那些砍下来的新鲜树木堆在一旁腐烂！这绝对不是我们所能容忍的，$n，我们一定要让他们知道，我们是绝对不会容忍任何毁灭我们土地的行为！\n\n去吧，战斗吧，直到监工古尔萨克和他的手下全都死掉为止！",dEN="The Warsong Lumber Camp is a blight upon an embattled landscape. Every time we make progress in halting their operations, Overseer Gorthak orders his loggers to redouble their efforts!\n\nNow, the orcs are cutting more wood than they can possibly use, leaving it to rot while their blades bite into fresh trees! This is an affront to all we stand for, <name>, and we will show them that we'll not suffer further destruction of our lands!\n\nGo, and do not rest until Overseer Gorthak and his minions are dead!",o="林歌神殿的哨兵卢希尔·星语要求你杀死监工古尔萨克、2台战歌伐木机、5名部落伐木工和10名部落斥候。",oEN="Sentinel Luciel Starwhisper at Forest Song wants you to kill Overseer Gorthak, 2 Warsong Shredders, 5 Horde Deforesters, and 10 Horde Scouts.",p="只要监工高萨克还活着，我就会对抗他。伐木场有什么消息？",pEN="As long as Overseer Gorthak lives, I will oppose him. What news from the lumber camp?",c="我们终于发出一个兽人不敢忽视的讯息了。任何到伐木场替换高萨克的监工或工头都会感受我的愤怒！\n\n我们一定要把握我们的优势，$n，而且在战歌伐木营地成为遥远的记忆，树木高耸在地上之前都不能停歇。",cEN="At last we have sent a message that the orcs won't dare ignore. Any overseer or foreman who sets foot within the camp to replace Gorthak will feel my wrath!\n\nWe must press our advantage, <name>, and never rest until the Warsong Lumber Camp is a distant memory and a glade of trees stands upon that ground."}
Q[9519]={d="我们西边有一处叫作萨提纳尔的地方，过去曾是由我的人民所建的重要神殿。里面藏有一件名叫艾露恩的圣杯的无价圣物，艾露恩的祭司们曾将它交给神殿的守卫保管。据说这圣杯具有治愈之力，所以曾有无数的朝圣者前去祭祀。\n\n或许这听起来像是老婆婆讲的故事，但假如确实如此，那么或许这件圣物将是治愈这片森林的关键所在。我必须了解清楚，$n。",dEN="The area to our west, now called Satyrnaar, was once a prominent shrine built by my people. It housed a priceless relic, the Chalice of Elune, entrusted to the shrine's keepers by the priests of Elune. Pilgrims once traveled to the shrine to experience the healing powers the chalice was rumored to hold.\n\nThese stories might be nothing but old wives' tales, but if there is any truth to them, the relic may hold the key to rejuvenating the wounded forest. I must know, <name>.",o="将艾露恩的圣杯交给林歌神殿的凯尼斯·静风。",oEN="Bring the Chalice of Elune to Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song.",p="你感觉到了吗，$n，腐败的气息弥漫在风中？如果我们什么都不做，它就会持续蔓延。这就是为什么我要寻找艾露恩的圣杯的原因。你可以找到它吗？",pEN="Can you feel it, <name>, the touch of corruption upon the wind? If we do nothing, it will continue to advance. That is why I seek the Chalice of Elune. Were you able to find it?",c="做得好，$n。就算持续暴露在萨特的腐败气息中，这股力量也不会因此黯淡。就算经过了这么多年，你不是仍能看到它发出的光芒吗？",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. There is certainly a latent power here, one that not even constant exposure to the corruption of the satyr can dim. Do you see how it still shines, after all these years?"}
Q[9520]={d="这张羊皮纸是恶魔留下的，最令人惊奇的是，上面的文字竟然是用通用语写的！这里提到了迪亚索鲁斯和戈加农，这是两个声名狼籍的恐惧魔王，它们统领着周围的恶魔。\n\n这里明确地写出了恶魔们进攻北面林歌神殿的具体计划。最近有一些德莱尼人在那里创建了新的营地。\n\n或许林歌神殿的守备官维达尔会对此感兴趣？",dEN="The demon dropped this parchment, which is amazingly written in the Common tongue! The ones mentioned in it, Diathorus and Gorgannon, are the two infamous dreadlords that control the demons hereabouts.\n\nThe plans detail preparations for a demonic attack on Forest Song to the north; the location where a new draenei settlement is being established.\n\nPerhaps Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song would be interested in these?",o="将恶魔的计划交给灰谷林歌神殿的守备官维达尔。",oEN="Deliver the Diabolical Plans to Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="你手里拿着什么，$g先生:小姐？",pEN="What do you have there, <sir/ma'am>?",c="我的老天爷啊，不可能！他们计划要攻击我们林歌神殿？！\n\n有我在就不可能！\n\n<复仇者维达将恶魔草写的计划书在手中捏皱。>\n\n不。我们不会允许这样的事发生！",cEN="By the Seven Crystals of Ata'mal, this cannot be! They plan to attack us here at Forest Song?!\n\nNot on my watch!\n\n<Vindicator Vedaar crumples the demon-scrawled plans in his fist.>\n\nNo. We will not allow this to happen!"}
Q[9521]={d="对部落的战事并不只是从林歌营地展开的，$n。在东南方靠近贫瘠之地边界的地方，银翼林地有规模更大的银翼哨兵驻守。从那里，哨兵远歌指挥着我们对抗所有妄图摧毁我们领地的人。\n\n我这份最新报告给哨兵远歌送得有点迟了，可我又不放心让林歌营地无人看守。\n\n我急需你帮忙，把报告尽快送到她手上！",dEN="The battle against the Warsong Lumber Camp isn't being waged from Forest Song alone, <name>. There's a more substantial Silverwing Sentinel presence at Silverwing Grove to the southwest, near the border with the Barrens. From the grove, Sentinel Farsong directs our efforts against those who would destroy our lands.\n\nI'm a bit late in sending my latest report to Sentinel Farsong, but also hesitant to leave Forest Song unattended. If your travels take you near Silverwing Grove, would you deliver my report?",o="将哨兵卢希尔的报告送给银翼树林的哨兵艾蒂亚·轻歌。",oEN="Deliver Sentinel Luciel's report to Sentinel Farsong at Silverwing Grove.",p="你手里拿的是什么，$n？",pEN="What's that you have there, <class>?",c="谢谢你送来这份报告，$n。从哨兵卢希尔的记述来看，我们最担心的事似乎已经发生了。我们每推进一步，部落就更决心要造成尽可能大的破坏。\n\n我们不能退让；我们祖传土地的命运悬于一线。前线若有更多像你这样的人，我相信我们一定能取胜。你愿意加入我们的战斗吗？",cEN="Thank you for delivering this report, <class>. From what Sentinel Luciel writes, it seems our worst fears have come to pass. With each advance we make, the Horde appears more determined to do as much damage as possible.\n\nWe can't afford to back down; the fate of our ancestral lands hangs in the balance. With more people like you on the frontlines, I'm certain we could triumph. Will you join our fight?"}
Q[9522]={d="$n，确保燃烧军团的这次进攻永不发生，就落在你肩上了。你必须去杀掉他们的首领。没有了他们，其余的恶魔基本上就是无脑的。\n\n你会在恶魔坠落峡谷找到戈加农，就在邪火岗以南、曼诺洛斯那支断裂悬浮的长矛附近。\n\n搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯栖息在恶魔坠落山脊顶上的墓穴中。要找到那道山脊，就从恶魔坠落峡谷出发，在部落的格罗姆·地狱咆哮纪念碑附近找一条上坡的路。\n\n把他们的武器带给我。",dEN="<name>, it falls to you to see that this attack by the Burning Legion never comes to pass. You must go and slay their leaders. Without them the rest of the demons are essentially mindless.\n\nYou will find Gorgannon in Demon Fall Canyon south beyond Felfire Hill, near Mannoroth's floating, broken spear.\n\nDiathorus the Seeker resides somewhere in the barrow den atop Demon Fall Ridge. To find the ridge, look for a ramp up from Demon Fall Canyon near the Horde's monument to Grom Hellscream.",o="杀死戈加农和搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯，然后向灰谷林歌神殿的守备官维达尔复命。",oEN="Kill Gorgannon and Diathorus the Seeker, and then return to Vindicator Vedaar at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="我们的暗夜精灵斥候报告攻击的准备似乎仍在进行。那些恐惧领主一定要立刻死掉，$n！",pEN="Our night elf scouts report that preparations for the attack may still be ongoing. Those dreadlords must die soon, <name>!",c="燃烧军团再也无法在这里威胁我们了！你把我们从一场很可能输掉的战斗中解救了出来，$n。\n\n我向你致谢，也代表阿古斯之手向你致以最深的感激。有你站在我们这边，是我的荣幸。",cEN="Never again will the Burning Legion threaten us here! You have delivered us from a fight we very likely would have lost, <class>.\n\nI give you thanks and the deepest gratitude of the Hand of Argus. It honors me to have you at our side."}
Q[9523]={d="女祭司告诉我，西边的废墟是暗夜精灵文明留下的遗迹。这让我想起我爸总说的关于暗夜精灵废墟的话：\"孩子，只要看见暗夜精灵的废墟，附近准有暗夜精灵的遗物。\"\n\n要是我不雇上第一个碰到的人去替我挖暗夜精灵的遗物，我还算什么矮人？现在快去吧！",dEN="The priestess tells me that the ruins to the west are what's left of a night elf civilization. That got me thinking about what my pappy used to always say about night elf ruins, \"Sonny, whenever you see night elf ruins, night elf relics are sure to be close by.\"\n\nNow what kind of a dwarf would I be if I didn't hire the first person I saw to go digging up night elf relics for me? Now get going!",o="秘蓝岛奥德修斯营地的考古学家阿达曼特·铁心要求你给他找到8块上古圣物。",oEN="Archaeologist Adamant Ironheart at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ancient Relics.",p="没拿到古代圣物就不要回来。",pEN="Don't come back without some ancient relics.",c="我爸爸会很骄傲的！他的儿子在他碰到的第一个暗夜精灵废墟就大捞了一笔……当然，是因为你的帮忙。没错，别担心。我不会在这个发现中忽略你的名字的。你叫做$n，对吗？他们会在铁炉堡了解所有关于你的事。",cEN="My pappy would be proud! His boy strikes it big at the first set of night elf ruins he comes across... With your help, of course. Yes, don't worry, I won't leave you out of the discovery. Your name is <name>, right? They'll learn all about you in Ironforge."}
Q[9524]={d="联盟，在这里？！仔细听好了，$c。\n\n卡加斯捕获了我们的几名士兵，其中包括一名重要的军官奥琳娜上尉。你必须在她被处决之前想办法把她营救出来。\n\n不用担心我，我喘口气以后自然会马上离开这里。",dEN="Alliance, here?! Listen carefully, <class>.\n\nKargath has captured several of our soldiers. Captain Alina, an important officer is among them. You must try to save her before she is executed.\n\nDon't worry about me, I'll find a way out as soon as I catch my breath.",o="在地狱火堡垒内的奥琳娜上尉被处决前救出她。\n\n该任务必须在英雄等级难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="Rescue Captain Alina inside Hellfire Citadel before she is executed.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",c="感谢你，$n。我必须声明我不期待一支救援小组行动。\n\n我会集中剩下的囚犯并将他们带回荣耀堡。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. I must admit I didn't expect a rescue party to be on its way.\n\nI will round up the remaining prisoners and lead them back to Honor Hold."}
Q[9525]={d="我刚刚从卡加斯的监狱中活着逃了出来，$n。还有几个其它俘虏今天就要被处决了，一位重要的军官也在其中。\n\n如果这位沙塔·碎骨上尉被杀的话，将给我们带来很大的损失。你一定要想尽一切办法把他救出来。我……我恐怕难以继续前进了……",dEN="I was fortunate to escape Kargath's prison today, <name>. Several prisoners are scheduled to be executed, an important officer among them.\n\nIt would be a huge blow against our forces if Captain Boneshatter was slain. You must do what you can to rescue him. I'm too weak to go on...",o="在地狱火堡垒内的沙塔·碎骨上尉被处决前救出他。\n\n该任务必须在英雄等级难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="Rescue Captain Boneshatter inside Hellfire Citadel before he is executed.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",c="你让我今天心情大好，$n。等我死的时候，我一定要死在战场上……浑身沾满对手的鲜血，还要拉上他们一起走。",cEN="You've brightened my day, <class>. When I die, I will make sure it's in the battlefield... covered in the blood of my opponents and taking them down with me."}
Q[9526]={d="$g小家伙:小家伙;，南边有一片夜歌森林的区域，近来被叫做邪火岗。看到恶魔在那儿横行无忌、散播腐化，实在令人痛心。\n\n你愿意帮忙夺回那片土地吗？\n\n我一直为这样的用途留着一些种子。把它们带到邪火岗，种在肥沃的土堆里。",dEN="Little one, to the south is an area of Nightsong Woods that has in recent times come to be called Felfire Hill. It is very sad to see the demons crawling over it, spreading their corruption.\n\nWould you do something to help take back the land?\n\nI have a number of seeds that I have been saving for such a purpose. Take them to Felfire Hill and plant them in the fertile dirt mounds.",o="将8棵小树苗种植在肥沃的土壤中，然后向灰谷林歌神殿的纳亚尔回报。",oEN="Plant 8 Tree Seedlings in the Fertile Dirt Mounds and then return to Gnarl at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="你还没把我全部的种子都种下去吧？",pEN="Surely you have not yet planted all of my seeds?",c="好。虽然这些幼苗要长大还要好几年的时间，但最终它们会帮我们对抗冥火岭的恶魔。\n\n安心地离开吧，小$g兄弟:姐妹。",cEN="Good. Though it may take a great deal of your years for the seedlings to grow into ancients, in the fullness of time they will aid us in our fight against the demons at Felfire Hill.\n\nGo in peace, little <brother/sister>."}
Q[9527]={d="我们与这座岛上的枭兽和平共存了许多年。你完全可以想象出，当它们风暴般席卷海滩并袭击我们时，我那无比惊讶的表情。\n\n我们当时竭尽全力与它们对抗，可它们还是在力量上轻易压倒了我们。后来，我被沉重的一击彻底打昏了过去，一直没有醒来，我真希望我的家人当时没有遭受任何痛苦。\n\n我醒来以后，周围已经是一片死寂了。黄沙被他们的血彻底染成了一片赤红。他们大概全部被吃了。\n\n我已经不求复仇或是别的什么了，$n。只求我能得回她们的遗体，以便安葬。",dEN="We had lived peacefully among the Owlbeasts of this island for many years. You can imagine my surprise when they stormed the beach and attacked us.\n\nI fought tooth and nail but was easily overpowered. As I blacked out from the vicious blows that I had been dealt, I prayed that my family not suffer.\n\nWhen I awoke, all was quiet. The sand was soaked red with blood - their blood. They were devoured whole.\n\nI care not for vengeance, <name>. I only ask that their remains be returned to me for proper burial.",o="秘蓝岛的库雷要求你回收他的家人的遗体。",oEN="Cowlen on Azuremyst Isle wants you to recover the Remains of Cowlen's Family.",p="我的妻子叫萨尔瑞莎，我的女儿是麦格文。",pEN="My wife was named Thalrisa and my daughter, Magwin.",c="谢谢你，$n。他们的灵魂现在可以安息了。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Their spirits will be at peace now."}
Q[9528]={d="我的家人几周前被这座岛上的鱼人和枭兽攻击了。我想尽办法才逃了出来，而我的父母……恐怕已经被杀了吧。现在，我不知道现在该去哪，也不知道该做些什么，但……我一定要想办法回家，无论那里变成了什么样子，都要回家……你能帮助我穿过森林吗？",dEN="My family was attacked by the murlocs and owlkin of this island several weeks ago. I managed to escape but I think that both my mother and father have been slain. I don't know what I'm going to do now, but I must try and get back to my home - or what's left of it... Will you help me get through the forest?",o="护送麦戈薇穿越小岛，回到家中。",oEN="Escort Magwin through the island to her home.",p="嗨，$n。",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="<喜悦的泪水滑落科伦的脸庞。>\n\n我要如何才能回报你，$n？拜托，收下这个传家宝。它象征着暗夜精灵间一份神圣的友谊，信任和爱。你是我的$g兄弟:姐妹……",cEN="<Tears of joy stream down Cowlen's face.>\n\nHow can I ever repay you for this, <name>? Please, take this heirloom. It symbolizes a sacred bond of friendship, trust and love amongst night elves. You are a <brother/sister> to me - from this day until the end of time..."}
Q[9529]={d="我相信你的小鬼确实是一个有用而且有趣的帮手，但你也应该尝试去征服更强大的恶魔：虚空行者。\n\n沿着死亡之痕一直走，直到你穿过艾伦达尔河。在河的南边捡一颗发出红色光芒的石头，把它带回来。你的命运之路将在你面前展现。",dEN="While I'm certain your imp has proven a useful and sometimes entertaining servant, it is time you mastered a more powerful demon: the voidwalker.\n\nTravel down the Dead Scar until it is crossed by the Elrendar River. Just south of the river, locate one of the blue glowing stones and take it. Your path will be revealed there.",o="在死亡之痕找到一颗虚空石。",oEN="Obtain a Voidstone from the Dead Scar.",c="当你注视着石头，你的视线开始旋转……",cEN="As you gaze into the stone, your vision begins to swirl..."}
Q[9530]={d="我一直以来都在怀疑是否会有这样的情况，但现在已经证明确有其事了。\n\n我们当中确实有一个叛徒。\n\n在这份地精文件里面所提到的计划中，我嗅到了共谋的气息。我当前还不知道这个叛徒是谁，所以我需要你的帮助，找出他。现在这种状况下，我的每一个船员都无法信任了。\n\n我现在需要一棵中空的树干和许多树叶，这样计划就能成功了。到我们北边的树林里去找找看有没有树干，另外也要收集一些树叶，看看森林里面有没没有吧。",dEN="I've wondered about this for some time now, but this proves it to be true.\n\nThere is a traitor among us.\n\nThe plans left behind by the goblins document the conspiracy. Since I don't know who it could be, I'm going to need your help in finding the traitor. None of my crew can be trusted.\n\nIf this is going to work, I'm going to need a hollowed out tree and leaves. Search near the loggers north of us for the tree. You'll need to find the leaves by yourself. Check the forest.",o="秘蓝岛奥德修斯营地的海军上将奥德修斯要求你收集一株中空的树干和5堆树叶。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him a Hollowed Out Tree and 5 Piles of Leaves.",p="我爱计划成形的时候……",pEN="I love it when a plan comes together...",c="我一定要警告你，我接下来要叫你做的事很危险。如果你决定不帮我，我也不会看轻你的，$n。",cEN="I must warn you, what I ask of you next will be dangerous. I won't think less of you if you decide not to help me out, <name>."}
Q[9531]={d="根据他们的计划，这个叛徒和地精们的领袖吉兹尔会在西侧岛屿的一处小海湾的沙滩上见面。我要求你到那里去监视他们的会面，$n。\n\n还记得我要你带回来的树干和树叶吗？你一定要穿着它们去监视会面，这是最好的伪装了！\n\n到那处小海湾去，找找看有没有纳迦的旗帜。找到旗帜以后立刻在旁边使用伪装包把自己伪装起来，然后等待他们的会面。很快这个叛徒就会在那里和地精会面的。查明他的身份以后，立刻回来找我。",dEN="According to the plans, the traitor and the leader of the goblins, Geezle, are to meet at a cove on the western island. I need you to be at that meeting, <name>.\n\nRemember the tree and leaves? You're going to wear them! It's a perfect disguise.\n\nGo to the cove and look for a naga flag. If the flag is there, it means a meeting is planned. Use the disguise kit when you see the flag and wait. Eventually the traitor will show up. Let the meeting finish then return to me with the identity of the scoundrel.",o="秘蓝岛奥德修斯营地的海军上将奥德修斯要求你监视吉兹尔与叛徒的会面与谈话。\n\n确认叛徒的身份之后回去向他复命。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing on Azuremyst Isle wants you to observe the meeting that is to take place between Geezle and the traitor.\n\nReturn to him when you know the identity of the traitor.",p="背叛者会希望他从未惹上联盟海军指挥！",pEN="That traitor is going to wish he never messed with Alliance Naval Command!",c="不敢相信！自始至终竟是侏儒……我早该知道了！",cEN="I can't believe it! It was the gnome all along... I should have known!"}
Q[9532]={d="$n，我们的一个斥候在执行他的任务时过于专注了，多次侦察敌人的营地却没有给我提交任何报告。\n\n你必须找到这个名叫克尔图斯·暗叶的密探，拿到他的报告，尽快把它们带回来给我。到西南边环绕金雾村的艾尔伦达河就可以找到他了。安达洛斯一带的暗夜精灵是他追踪的目标，他应该不会离那些家伙太远。",dEN="<name>, one of our scouts has taken too strong an interest in his duties. He surveys our enemies relentlessly, but sends no reports of his findings.\n\nYou must find this spy, Keltus Darkleaf, convince him to hand over his report and return it to me as swiftly as possible. He can be found far to the southwest, where the Elrendar River forks and flows around Goldenmist Village. The night elves of An'daroth are his quarry, and he won't be far from them.",o="找到克尔图斯·暗叶。",oEN="Locate Keltus Darkleaf.",c="我希望你看到我正在重重的掩护下……至少我本来是。",cEN="I hope you can see I am deep under cover... at least I was."}
Q[9533]={d="在建筑师尼莫斯和守备官维达尔的监督下，我的族人在灰谷东部展开了一项重要的工程。\n\n建造工作并不轻松，$n，因为他们面临的挑战和敌人都不少。我知道建筑师尼莫斯和他在林歌营地的同胞会感激任何帮助，他也请我把有意相助的人派过去。\n\n再来跟我谈谈，我会安排你尽快赶到他们那里。",dEN="My people have undertaken an important endeavor in the eastern part of Ashenvale, with support and cooperation from the kaldorei.\n\nUnder the supervision of Architect Nemos and Vindicator Vedaar, they are revitalizing an old night elf outpost. The task of building won't be easy, <name>, for the challenges and enemies they face are many. I know Architect Nemos and his compatriots at Forest Song would appreciate any help they can get, and he has asked me to send any interested <men/women> his way.",o="前往灰谷的林歌营地，与建筑师尼莫斯谈谈。\n\n守备官帕拉纳尔可以为你提供交通工具，让你尽快抵达。",oEN="Make your way to Forest Song and speak with Architect Nemos.",c="在林歌神殿看到新来者真好。\n\n复仇者帕拉那尔正派来尽可能多的人手，我们感谢每一个人的帮助。\n\n看看四周，$c。现在或许不多，但随着时间和我们暗夜精灵的盟友帮忙，我们会建起一个值得叫家的地方。还有很多事要做，欢迎你提供协助。",cEN="It's good to see another new arrival here at Forest Song.\n\nVindicator Palanaar is sending as much help as she can muster and each set of hands is appreciated.\n\nTake a look around, <class>. It may not be much now, but with time and help from our night elf allies, we'll build a settlement worthy of calling home. There is much to be done here and any help you can provide would be welcome."}
Q[9534]={d="那支恶魔般的燃烧军团残部，已经当我们的战歌伐木场心头之刺太久了！\n\n到此为止！\n\n那些恶魔正从东边的邪火岗、恶魔坠落峡谷和恶魔坠落山脊发动进攻。\n\n去尽可能多地消灭他们，为你自己和部落赢得荣耀！",dEN="The remains of the demonic Burning Legion have been making raids against our Warsong Lumber Camp!\n\nNo more!\n\nThe demons are attacking from the areas known as Felfire Hill, Demon Fall Canyon and Demon Fall Ridge to the east.\n\nGo and destroy as many as you can to bring glory to both yourself and the Horde!",o="杀死6个玛诺洛克鞭笞者、6个恶魔守卫和6个灼热的地狱火，然后向灰谷碎木岗哨的瓦鲁莎复命。",oEN="Slay 6 Mannoroc Lashers, 6 Felguards and 6 Searing Infernals, and then return to Valusha at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="那里还有没有恶魔的存在？你说你自己是个$r？作战是没有时间休息的！",pEN="Are there not demons yet standing? You call yourself a <race>? This is no time to be taking a break from the fighting!",c="这样好多了！没什么比让我们的世界摆脱恶魔要来的好了。他们也是有价值的敌人，不像联盟的懦弱种族。",cEN="That's better! There's nothing quite like ridding our world of a demon. And they make for worthy opponents as well, unlike the weak races of the Alliance."}
Q[9535]={d="这张羊皮纸是恶魔留下的，最令人惊奇的是，上面的文字竟然是用通用语写的！这里提到了迪亚索鲁斯和戈加农，这是两个声名狼籍的恐惧魔王，它们统领着周围的恶魔。\n\n这里明确地写出了恶魔们进攻西北方的碎木岗哨的具体计划。\n\n或许碎木岗哨的瓦鲁莎会对此感兴趣？",dEN="The demon dropped this parchment, which is amazingly written in the Orcish tongue! The ones mentioned in it, Diathorus and Gorgannon, are the two infamous dreadlords that control the demons hereabouts.\n\nThe plans detail preparations for a demonic attack on Splintertree Post to the northwest.\n\nYou're certain that Valusha at Splintertree Post would be interested in these.",o="将恶魔的计划交给灰谷碎木岗哨的瓦鲁莎。",oEN="Deliver the Diabolical Plans to Valusha at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="你手里拿的是什么，$g斥候:斥候;？",pEN="What do you have there, scout?",c="警戒！他们计划要攻击我们碎木岗哨？！\n\n只有我还有一口气在就不能让这种事情发生！\n\n<瓦露莎将恶魔草写的计划书在手中捏皱。>\n\n不。我们不会让这种事发生！他们是这个世界的祸害！",cEN="Dreadlords! They plan to attack us here at Splintertree Post?!\n\nNot while I still draw breath!\n\n<Valusha crumples the demon-scrawled plans in her fist.>\n\nNo. We will not allow this to happen! They are a blight upon our world!"}
Q[9536]={d="$n，你要确保燃烧军团的这次进攻永不发生！去杀了这些恐惧魔王！没有了他们，其余的恶魔基本上就是无脑的。\n\n你会在恶魔坠落峡谷找到戈加农，就在邪火岗以南、曼诺洛斯那支断裂的长矛附近。\n\n搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯住在恶魔坠落山脊顶上的墓穴里。\n\n带着他们的武器回来，作为你功绩的凭证。",dEN="<name>, you will see to it that this attack by the Burning Legion never comes to pass! Go and slay these dreadlords! Without them the rest of the demons are essentially mindless.\n\nYou will find Gorgannon in Demon Fall Canyon south beyond Felfire Hill, near Mannoroth's floating, broken spear.\n\nDiathorus the Seeker resides somewhere in the barrow den atop Demon Fall Ridge. To find the ridge, look for a ramp up from Demon Fall Canyon near the monument to Grom Hellscream.",o="杀死戈加农和搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯。",oEN="Kill Gorgannon and Diathorus the Seeker.",p="那些恐惧领主一定要快点死掉，$n！",pEN="Those dreadlords must die soon, <name>!",c="燃烧军团再也不能把兽人、也不能把部落的任何其他种族变成奴隶了！\n\n打得英勇，$n！你胸中跳动着真正的部落之心！你为我们带来了莫大的荣耀！",cEN="Never again will the Burning Legion make slaves of the orcs, or any other race of the Horde!\n\nBravely fought, <class>! You have the true heart of the Horde beating inside of you! You give us much honor!"}
Q[9537]={d="斯帕克必须被绳之以法！\n\n我要你下到海滩去，找到那个狡诈的侏儒。找到他之后，从他嘴里撬出一切情报！\n\n联盟的一位高级官员若犯下叛国罪行，谁知道还有多少人已被腐化？\n\n还有，$n，必要时可以动用武力……|n",dEN="Spark must be brought to justice!\n\nI need you to go down to the beach and find that deceitful gnome. Once you find him, get whatever information you can out of him!\n\nIf a high ranking official of the Alliance has committed treasonous acts, who knows how many others are corrupt?\n\nAnd <name>, use force if you have to...",o="奥德修斯登陆点的奥德修斯上将要你从工程师\"斯帕克\"·超磨那里夺回叛徒的通信记录。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing wants you to recover the Traitor's Communication from Engineer \"Spark\" Overgrind.",p="你找到那个撒谎的无赖了吗？",pEN="Did you find the lying dog?",c="不可思议！这全都是他们计划的一部分！\n\n这个消息一定要让国王和你的领导者知道。这个牵连会令人难以致信。",cEN="Incredible! This was all part of their master plan!\n\nThis information must reach the king and your own leaders. The implications are staggering."}
Q[9538]={d="我想我破解出来了，$n！\n\n<奥伦指向那根图腾。>\n\n关于静松熊怪语言，我们需要知道的一切都印在他们的图腾上。只要对他们的符号运作方式有最基本的了解，我们就能研究这些图腾，学会与他们交流。\n\n我已经把符号矩阵的基本原理写在这张羊皮纸上。研读它，然后去查看那根图腾。它应该会指引你找到下一根语言图腾。\n\n等你回来时已经成为一位有学问的$r了，就去找阿鲁古谈谈。",dEN="I think I've cracked it, <name>!\n\n<Aurren points to the totem.>\n\nAll that we need to know about the Stillpine furbolg language is imprinted on their totems. With just a rudimentary understanding of how their symbols work, we can study the totems and learn to communicate with the furbolgs.\n\nI've written down the basics of the symbol matrix on this parchment. Study it and then examine the totem. It should lead you to the next language totem.\n\nSpeak to Arugoo when you return an educated <race>!",o="阅读奥鲁恩给你的止松熊怪语言入门，以便和碧蓝岗哨的阿基达图腾交流。",oEN="Read the Stillpine Furbolg Language Primer that Aurren gave you and interact with the Totem of Akida at Azure Watch.",p="你可以听见一个低音的嗡嗡声从图腾里散发出来。",pEN="You can hear a low-pitched hum emanating from the totem.",c="这图腾有不同的原始印记。你看到图腾表面刻着猫头鹰、熊、狼和雄鹿。\n\n你注意到一堆陌生的象征让你的嘴巴发出了阿基达的声音。",cEN="The totem has various primal markings. You see owls, bears, wolves and stags carved into the surface.\n\nYou note a strange collection of symbols that makes your mouth form the word A-K-I-D-A."}
Q[9539]={d="你开始研究图腾，并发现自己很难读出上面的单词与短语。然而，渐渐地，这些词语开始在你脑海中形成语句。你认为图腾正告诉你：登上附近的小山，向东北方前进。",dEN="You begin to read the totem, barely able to pronounce the awkward words and phrases. Slowly, words start to form in your head. You think that the totem is telling you to go up the nearby hill, to the northeast.",o="根据线索找到库欧图腾。",oEN="Find the Totem of Coo using the clues provided to you.",c="这图腾有不同的原始印记。你看到图腾表面刻着猫头鹰、熊、狼和雄鹿。\n\n你注意到一堆陌生的象征让你的嘴巴发出了库欧的声音。",cEN="The totem has various primal markings. You see owls, bears, wolves and stags carved into the surface of the totem.\n\nYou note a strange collection of symbols that makes your mouth form the word C-O-O."}
Q[9540]={d="你开始研究图腾，并发现自己很难读出上面的单词与短语。然而，渐渐地，这些词语开始在你脑海中形成语句。你认为图腾正在告诉你：跨过东边的晶水河。或许你的目的地就在河的另一边。",dEN="You begin to read the totem, better able to pronounce the words and phrases. Words start to form in your head. You think that the totem is telling you to go across the Crystalbrook river to the east. Perhaps your destination is on the other side of the river.",o="根据线索找到提克提图腾。",oEN="Find the Totem of Tikti using the clues provided to you.",c="这图腾有不同的原始印记。你看到图腾表面刻着猫头鹰、熊、狼和雄鹿。\n\n你注意到一堆陌生的象征让你的嘴巴发出了提克提的声音。",cEN="The totem has various primal markings. You see owls, bears, wolves and stags carved into the surface of the totem.\n\nYou note a strange collection of symbols that makes your mouth form the word T-I-K-T-I."}
Q[9541]={d="你已经能够非常轻松地阅读这根图腾上的符号了。句式与图形所代表的形象迅速融入了你熟悉的单词之中。你相当确定它在指引你沿着河流向南前进。或许有些什么东西在河床底部。",dEN="The symbols on this totem seem to translate much faster. The patterns and imagery all seem to blend into familiar words. You are fairly certain the totem is pointing you south, down the river. Something is at the bottom of the river itself.",o="根据线索找到尤尔图腾。",oEN="Find the Totem of Yor using the clues provided to you.",c="这图腾有不同的原始印记。你看到图腾表面刻着猫头鹰、熊、狼和雄鹿。\n\n你注意到一堆陌生的象征让你的嘴巴发出了尤尔的声音。",cEN="The totem has various primal markings. You see owls, bears, wolves and stags carved into the surface of the totem.\n\nYou note a strange collection of symbols that makes your mouth form the word Y-O-R."}
Q[9542]={d="你在这些图腾上没有再发现任何辨认不出的符号与文字了，你发现你竟然能以阅读母语的速度阅读这些图腾。\n\n这些标记与符号指示出了另一处熊怪洞穴的位置，就在这里的正西方。通过你对这些符号和语言的深入理解，你知道你的目的地正是刺臂村。你的意志会指引你前进的方向，但如果你迷路了，你知道你应该可以沿着这条森林中古老的精灵小路向西走到那里。",dEN="You no longer see unrecognizable symbology in the totems. The totem of Yor reads to you just as easily as your native tongue.\n\nThe markings identify another furbolg den, due west of here. You are able to expertly decipher the language on the totem and know that your destination is Bristlelimb Village. Yor will guide you but if you get lost, you know that you are able to take the ancient elven road in the forest leading west to reach your destination.",o="根据线索找到瓦克图腾。",oEN="Find the Totem of Vark using the clues provided to you.",c="当你阅读图腾时，你的嘴巴构成了一个字——瓦克。你知道这代表了正义。",cEN="As you read the totem, your mouth forms the word V-A-R-K. You understand this to mean justice."}
Q[9543]={d="我们与兽人之间的冲突从来没有停止过，$n。由于他们的嗜血，我们差一点就被灭绝了，从那个时候起，即便是没有遭到兽人们恶魔般的攻击，我们也会避开他们。\n\n可是，复仇……不是瑟丹所期望的。与我们的长者智者阿曼恩谈一谈。他知道该怎样做。",dEN="Our history with the orcs is one of constant conflict, <name>. We were once near driven to extinction due to their bloodlust and have since then avoided them even when not under demonic influence.\n\nYet, this retaliation... it's not what Sedai would've wanted. Speak with our elder, Amaan the Wise. He will help shed light on these events.",o="与地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的智者阿曼恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Amaan the Wise at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="我能帮你什么忙吗，$n？你听起来很忧虑。",cEN="Can I offer you any assistance, <name>? You sound troubled."}
Q[9544]={d="这根图腾上的图案描绘了静松与刺肢两个熊怪部族之间的一场战争。上面的刻纹显示，刺肢对静松熊怪做出了丧尽天良的事。\n\n在这场混乱之中，一个预言开始应验：一位英雄将会崛起——他身上没有熊怪的血脉——并拯救静松部族。\n\n到刺肢村去杀死刺肢熊怪，夺取他们的钥匙。用钥匙解救静松的俘虏。等你把他们都救出来后，回到静松的阿鲁古那里去！|n",dEN="The images on this totem depict a war between the Stillpine and the Bristlelimb furbolg tribes. The etchings show that the Bristlelimb have done unconscionable things to the furbolgs of Stillpine.\n\nAmidst the chaos, a prophecy has begun to unfold: A hero will rise - not of furbolg blood - and save the Stillpine tribe.\n\nSlay Bristlelimb furbolgs at Bristlelimb Village for their keys. Use the keys to free the Stillpine captives. Return to Arugoo of the Stillpine when you have freed them all!",o="在刺臂村中释放8名止松俘虏。完成任务之后回到碧蓝岗哨，找止松部族的阿鲁古复命。",oEN="Free 8 Stillpine Captives from cages found in Bristlelimb Village. Return to Arugoo of the Stillpine at Azure Watch when you have completed this task.",p="[熊怪语] 这么说，阿基达的预言是真的……$g一位英雄:一位英雄;被送到了我们面前。",pEN="[Furbolg] So the prophecy of Akida is true... A hero has been delivered to us.",c="[熊怪语] 预言说，会有人挺身而出，把我们从刺肢的压迫中解救出来——连精灵们自己都会宣告$g这位英雄:这位英雄;的到来。\n\n如今，你来了。\n\n我向你躬身致敬，$g伟人:伟人;。",cEN="[Furbolg] The prophecy spoke of one that would rise and deliver us from the oppressive grasp of Bristlelimb -- that the spirits themselves would herald the arrival of this hero.\n\nAnd now, you have come.\n\nI humble myself before you, great one."}
Q[9545]={d="顽固者禁锢了自己的思想，相信只有他们才是对的。睿智者却能看到导致当前局势和未来发展的各种可能性。\n\n把这件圣物带到你发现瑟丹的地方去。$n不要只用你的眼睛去看，更要用你的思想去思考。",dEN="The stubborn close their mind and convince themselves of one truth. The wise keep an open mind to the different possibilities leading to and stemming from the present.\n\nTake this relic with you to where you found Sedai. See not with your eyes, <name>, but with your mind.",o="地狱火半岛塔哈玛特神殿的智者阿曼恩要你回到瑟丹的尸体旁，使用先知的圣物。任务完成之后回去向他复命。",oEN="Amaan the Wise at the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to return to Sedai's Corpse, northeast of the Temple of Telhamat, and use the Seer's Relic at that location. Return to him after you've completed this task.",p="你见到幻象了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you seen the vision yet, <name>?",c="我希望你见到的幻象会让你对瑟丹的死有些洞察。圣物让你看见一连串导致现况的事件。真相或许会不同，我们当然永远不会知道。\n\n你现在知道了这些事会有不同的行动吗？\n\n谁知道我们和兽人的斗争会不会继续呢？重要的是要对可能性抱持开放的态度。",cEN="I hope the vision you witnessed helped you gain some perspective on Sedai's death. The relic showed you a likely series of events leading up to the present. The truth may have been different, we'll never know for sure.\n\nWould you act differently knowing what you know now?\n\nWho can say whether our conflict with the orcs will continue? What's important is to remain open to the possibilities."}
Q[9547]={d="$n， 预言者努波顿希望你去见他。是时候让你去了解最后一种元素——空气的奥秘了！\n\n我希望你知道，我对你当前为止所有的表现都非常满意。相信接下去你会做得更好。",dEN="<name>, Farseer Nobundo has been asking for you. It must be time for you to learn the secrets of air, the last of the elements!\n\nI want you to know that I'm very proud of all that you have accomplished thus far. I know that you have great things ahead of you.",o="与埃索达水晶大厅中的预言者努波顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall inside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",c="终于说到它了，四大元素中的最后一个：空气。你认为自己已经足够$g睿智:睿智;，可以继续了吗，$n？",cEN="And finally we come to it, the last of the four great elements: air. Do you think yourself wise enough to continue, <name>?"}
Q[9548]={d="嘘！小声点，别让人注意到我。\n\n如果被鱼人发现，试验就完蛋了！我现在已经面临资料被毁坏的危险了。\n\n昨天我出去寻找食物的时候，有一些鱼人到处游走，发现了我的营地。结果我回来的时候恰巧看到有两个鱼人正在搬走装着我大部分设备的柳条箱！箱子一定在附近的某个鱼人营地中，但我不能冒着被发现的危险出去寻找。你能帮帮我吗？",dEN="Shh! Keep your voice down and don't call attention to me.\n\nIf the murlocs detect my presence, the experiment will be ruined! I've already come perilously close to contaminating my data.\n\nWhile I was foraging yesterday, one of them must've wandered too close and discovered my camp. I returned just in time to see two of them carrying off a crate with most of my equipment! It's bound to be in one of their settlements around here, but I can't risk revealing my presence. Are you willing to help?",o="找回克劳伯的设备，把它交给躲在海滩龟壳中的克劳伯·维兹班。",oEN="Bring Clopper's Equipment back to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell.",p="你找到我的装备了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to find my equipment?",c="这真是太棒了！我的装备被偷却让我对这些鱼人的天性有了更多的了解，这比几个礼拜的观察所能获得的见解还要多！\n\n我已经知道要在报告中说些什么了。\n\n'当黑沙面对高科技文化的产物时，他们对人类物种新兴的文化特色一点兴趣也没有。'\n\n真是太高明了！铁炉堡的绅士们会很爱它的！我太感谢你了，$n。",cEN="This is fantastic! The theft of my equipment has given me more insight into the nature of these murlocs than I could have possibly gained in weeks of observations!\n\nI know what I'm going to say in my report already.\n\n'When faced with the products of a technologically superior culture, the Blacksilt displayed none of the curiosity characteristic of emerging cultures in humanoid species.'\n\nIt's brilliant! The gentlemen in Ironforge are going to love it! I can't thank you enough, <name>."}
Q[9549]={d="我的观察报告和论文详细地介绍了有关黑沙鱼人的情况，$n，但这仅仅只是开始。我准备把黑沙鱼人利用最基本的工艺技能制造出的物品带回铁炉堡。\n\n问题是黑沙鱼人随身携带这些物品，杀掉它们又会让我内疚。你能不能帮我收集到黑沙先知身上的神像，还有黑沙士兵和黑沙巡滩者身上的小刀？我不会询问你是用什么方法得到的。",dEN="My observations and writings about the Blacksilt murlocs are quite illuminating, <name>, but they are just the beginning. I plan to return to Ironforge with items produced by the Blacksilts' rudimentary crafting skills.\n\nThe problem is that the Blacksilt carry these items with them at all times, and I can't have their blood on my conscience. If you're willing to help me gather the idols carried by Blacksilt seers and crude knives of the Blacksilt warriors and shorestrikers, I won't ask how you came by them.",o="收集3个粗糙的鱼人神像和6把粗糙的鱼人小刀，把它们交给躲藏在海滩龟壳里的克劳伯·维兹班。",oEN="Bring 3 Crude Murloc Idols and 6 Crude Murloc Knives to Clopper Wizbang, who is hiding in a beached turtle shell.",p="你弄到那些让我带回铁炉堡的样本了吗？",pEN="Do you have those samples for me to send back to Ironforge?",c="太惊人了，简直太惊人了！它们完美无缺，$n。我已经能想见它们摆在铁炉堡博物馆玻璃柜里的样子。展板的说明文字几乎自己就在我脑子里写出来了！\n\n多亏你的帮助，我的研究才重新走上了正轨。你的名字怎么拼？我一定要在报告里把你列为$g合著者:合著者;。\n\n船上有个家伙为了抵赌债，给了我这张‘藏宝图’，可神话学不是我的研究领域。水手们真是群迷信的家伙。",cEN="Astounding, simply astounding! These are perfect, <name>. I can already see them under the glass in the museum in Ironforge. The text for the display is virtually writing itself in my head!\n\nYour help has been invaluable in getting my studies back on track. How do you spell your name? I'll make sure it appears in my report as co-author.\n\nOne of the chaps on the ship gave me this 'treasure map' to cover a gambling debt, but mythology isn't my area of study. Superstitious lot, sailors."}
Q[9550]={d="从这张潦草的地图上看不出任何有关画图者的信息，但可以看出画图人的手一直在颤抖。弯弯曲曲的线条和记号显示出，在一座被水淹没的高塔西边有一处由破裂的柱子搭建的小亭。\n\n如果这张地图是真的，这片废墟应该位于岛的东海岸。你无法预见会在那里找到什么，但它被记录下来显然说明它具有足够的重要性。",dEN="The crudely-drawn map reveals nothing of its maker, but it appears to have been drawn with an unsteady hand. Wavering lines and symbols depict a small pavilion with broken columns located to the west of a partially submerged tower.\n\nIf the map is to be believed, this cluster of ruins appears to be located on the eastern coast of the island. You have no idea what you'll find, but it was important enough for the map's creator to record.",o="找出图中描述的亭子，寻找画图人所记录的信息。",oEN="Locate the pavilion described by the map and search for what the map's maker was trying to record.",p="或许这本旧日记是藏宝图标记点的出处。",pEN="Perhaps this old journal is what the map is referencing.",c="仔细地检查这本书，你推论这一定是本日记。它的书页写满了优雅的字迹，和藏宝图上的大不相同。很多页的文字都被制图者的图画和笔迹弄的模糊不清。\n\n在制图者描述船员的海岸假期、豪饮故事下，几乎不可能辨视出原本的文字。",cEN="Examining the book carefully, you conclude that it must be a journal. Its pages are filled with an elegant script differing from that of the map. The text of many of the pages is obscured by drawings and writing in the mapmaker's hand.\n\nIt's nearly impossible to make out the text beneath the mapmaker's tales of drunken carousing during shore leave."}
Q[9551]={d="$n， 预言者努波顿希望你去见他。是时候让你去了解最后一种元素——空气的奥秘了！\n\n我希望你知道，我对你当前为止所有的表现都非常满意。相信接下去你会做得更好。",dEN="<name>, Farseer Nobundo has been asking for you. It must be time for you to learn the secrets of air, the last of the elements!\n\nI want you to know that I'm very proud of all that you have accomplished thus far. I know that you have great things ahead of you.",o="与埃索达水晶大厅中的预言者努波顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall inside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",c="终于说到它了，四大元素中的最后一个：空气。你认为自己已经足够$g睿智:睿智;，可以继续了吗，$n？",cEN="And finally we come to it, the last of the four great elements: air. Do you think yourself wise enough to continue, <name>?"}
Q[9552]={d="强大的空气之灵在召唤你，$n，而你应该响应它的召唤。\n\n在埃索达坠毁的山脉北面有一条狂风小径，我希望你能沿着它往上走。我最博学的学生维兰达就在山顶的洞穴里。\n\n请听听她的会跟你说些什么，完成她交给你的任务。当你回来的时候，你对空气元素的了解会进一步加深。",dEN="The great spirit of air calls out to you, <name>, and it is time for you to take heed.\n\nI wish for you to travel up the Wildwind Path on the north facing of the mountain that the Exodar has crashed into. At its peak you will find a cave and within will be one of my most accomplished pupils, Velaada.\n\nPlease, listen to her wisdom and do as she bids. When you return you will have a greater understanding of the element of air.",o="与秘蓝岛狂风山的维兰达谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Velaada at Wildwind Peak on Azuremyst Isle.",c="风中有低语告诉我你会来，$n。\n\n先知努波顿对你评价很高，而我听说了你一路的作为之后，也是如此。",cEN="It was whispered to me on the winds that you would be coming, <class>.\n\nFarseer Nobundo thinks very highly of you, and from what I have heard of your travels, so do I."}
Q[9553]={d="虽然空气是无形的，但它无处不在，是渗透力最强的一种力量。\n\n尽管你看不见它，这个洞穴的岩石是由空气雕琢而成的，海洋中的水被风吹拂而惊起波涛，火焰失去了空气就会熄灭。记得别让那些元素听到这些！\n\n你应该与附近的元素贤者谈谈。苏苏鲁斯在悬崖的北部边缘等着你。去找他吧，你会有所领悟的。",dEN="While air may seem ethereal, it is an all pervasive force, covering and permeating everything around us.\n\nThough you cannot see it, the rocks of this cave are composed mostly of air, the waters of the oceans are saturated in it and without it, fire cannot be sustained. Just don't let those elements hear you repeat that!\n\nWho you really wish to speak with for such wisdom is nearby. At the northern edge of the precipice, Susurrus awaits you. It is from him that you will gain understanding.",o="与秘蓝岛狂风山的苏苏鲁斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Susurrus at Wildwind Peak on Azuremyst Isle.",c="我一直在等候你的到来，$n。你来寻求智慧，我还感知到了别的什么。\n\n很好，我们开始吧。",cEN="I have been awaiting your arrival, <class>. You come seeking wisdom, and something else I sense.\n\nVery well, let us begin."}
Q[9554]={d="虽然我其他的兄弟姐妹都要求你完成了种种任务，我不会再向你索取什么了。我想，你已经足以‘赎清’你的飞船从我天空坠落此地的过错了。我能看出，你心中已具备足够的智慧，能审慎地运用空气元素。\n\n把我存在的这一部分带回给先知努波顿，好让他帮你制作你的图腾。等你$g准备好:准备好;了，我会载你飞回埃索达。",dEN="While my brothers and sisters of the other elements have demanded that you perform various tasks, I will not ask anything further of you. I think that you have done enough to 'atone' for the accident of your ship falling to this place from my skies. I can see that you have all the wisdom within you already to use the element of air wisely.\n\nTake this portion of my being back to Farseer Nobundo so that he might help you fashion your totem. And when you're ready, I will fly you back down to the Exodar.",o="将空气之漩交给埃索达的预言者努波顿。",oEN="Return to Farseer Nobundo at the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle with the Whorl of Air.",p="这么快就回来了？你的头发还真乱。\n\n<诺柏多会心地露齿而笑。>",pEN="Back so soon? Your hair looks ruffled.\n\n<Nobundo grins knowingly.>",c="我为你感到骄傲，$n。别人动摇退缩之处，你坚持了下来，并在此过程中加深了对元素和对自身的理解。在你今后的人生中牢记这些教诲，你会因此更加$g睿智:睿智;。\n\n现在，把苏苏鲁斯的旋涡交给我，好让我把它注入你的空气图腾。与其他图腾一样，它既是焦点，也是你与元素之间所缔结联系的见证。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="I am proud of you, <name>. You have persevered where others falter, and in the process you've gained a greater understanding of the elements and yourself. Remember their lessons as you go through life and you will be the wiser for it.\n\nNow, hand me the whorl from Susurrus so that I may imbue it into your air totem. As with the other totems, it will serve as both a focus and a reminder of the connection that you have forged with the elements."}
Q[9555]={d="我非常感谢你选择了萨满祭司这个充满艰难的职业。虽然很少有人可以坚持下来，但是我预见到了向破碎者学习萨满教义对我们的未来非常重要。\n\n我们称他们为破碎者，但实际上他们曾经也是德莱尼人。邪恶的魔法改变了他们，使得他们不能再召唤圣光的力量。一些人谴责他们和他们所传授的萨满教义，但他们并非邪恶之徒。\n\n我希望你能与预言者努波顿谈一谈。他是我所认识的最有智慧的萨满祭司，你在他的指导下会学到很多东西的。",dEN="I am thankful that you have chosen the difficult path of the shaman. Few enough do, but I foresee it as critical to our future that we learn shamanism from the Broken.\n\nThey are called that, but once they were draenei. Fel magics transformed them, and that is why they cannot call upon the power of the Light. Some disapprove of them and the shamanism they teach, but they are not evil.\n\nI wish you to speak with Farseer Nobundo. He is the wisest shaman I know and you will learn much with his guidance.",o="与埃索达水晶大厅中的预言者努波顿谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall in the Exodar.",c="你好。见到一位$g乐于:乐于;接纳萨满之道的$r总是令人欣慰，这样的人实在太少了。\n\n你已经学会不凭外表评判火焰，同样也不该凭外表评判我。\n\n你来到这里，是因为你已经$g准备好:准备好;制作你的火焰图腾了。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Greetings. It is always heartening to meet a <race> who is open to the way of shamanism. There are so few.\n\nYou have learned not to judge the flame for its outward appearance, just as you should not judge mine.\n\nYou are here because you are ready to create your fire totem."}
Q[9556]={d="在争夺哨塔的战斗中，你无疑付出了巨大的努力，进行了艰苦的作战，$r。我们希望能给予你一些东西，报答你为保卫这片土地而做出的努力，但首先，你必须向我们证明你已经理解了这些曾经发生在此处的悲剧的重要性。\n\n在斯坦索姆沿街找到一瓶圣水。找到以后，带着它回到暴风城和幽暗城的法师区……在那里，如果你确实是得胜而归的话，你会发现我的同伴。",dEN="You've no doubt been fighting long and hard among the towers, <race>. We would like to give something back to you in return for your defense of these lands, but first, you must prove to us you understand the weight of the tragedies that took place here.\n\nWalk the streets of Stratholme and find a vial of the holy water. Once you have it, travel to the mage quarter of Stormwind or the Undercity... There, if you are victorious within these lands, you will find my colleague.",o="从斯坦索姆城内收集到一瓶斯坦索姆圣水，在你的阵营获得东瘟疫之地的胜利之后，将圣水交给暴风城或幽暗城内法师区的洛丹伦法师。",oEN="Collect a bottle of Stratholme Holy Water from within the city of Stratholme and deliver it to the Lordaeron Mage within the Mage Quarter of Stormwind or the Undercity when your side is victorious in the Eastern Plaguelands."}
Q[9557]={d="你没有办法了解日记的内容，于是开始思索有谁能够帮助你将写日记人的笔迹与画图者的潦草字迹区分开来。\n\n你想起学者菲索斯，他收藏了无数来自各种文明的古董。你希望富有经验的学者菲索斯能帮你读懂日记的内容。",dEN="Lacking the means to read the book's contents, you think about who might be able to help you separate the author's words from the mapmaker's scrawl.\n\nRemembering Anchorite Paetheus's collection of artifacts from countless cultures, you wonder if his experienced eye might be able to help you decipher the book's contents.",o="把这本日记交给秘血岗哨的学者菲索斯。",oEN="Take the Ancient Journal to Anchorite Paetheus in Blood Watch.",p="圣光照耀你所有的努力，$c。你手里拿着什么？",pEN="The Light shine upon you in all your endeavors, <class>. What is it you have there?",c="嗯……这真的很有趣。没问题，我想我可以辨别出这本书原着所写的东西。\n\n我应该有了程序需要的所有东西。这应该只需要一会儿。",cEN="Hmm... this is most intriguing. Yes, I should be able to make out what the original author wrote in the pages of this book.\n\nI should have everything I need for the process. This should only take a moment."}
Q[9558]={d="我们遇到了麻烦：鸦人强盗劫掠了我们大部分补给商队，所以我雇了几个矮人去对付他们。\n\n他们是兄弟。格雷姆尼·长须是老大。\n\n我有点担心他们的处境。那些疯狂的矮人往包里塞的麦酒比食物和弹药还多！也许你可以去看看他们？\n\n鸦人的巢穴——哈尔艾什兽穴——就在西边很远的地方，在大裂隙的另一边。他们在那里西北、尘羽峡谷以南扎了营。",dEN="We were having a problem with arakkoa bandits raiding many of our supply caravans, so I hired some dwarves to take care of them.\n\nThey were brothers; Gremni Longbeard was the oldest.\n\nI'm a little worried about them. Those crazy dwarves packed more ale than food or ammunition! Maybe you can go check up on them?\n\nThe arakkoa's hideout, the Den of Haal'esh, can be found to the far west of here - beyond the Great Fissure. They set up camp northwest of there, south of Dustquill Ravine.",o="转至地狱火半岛荣耀堡以西的哈尔什巢穴，在巢穴西北方寻找格雷尼·长须的下落。",oEN="Look for Gremni Longbeard northwest of the Den of Haal'esh, to the far west of Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="你怎么找到我们的，$c？不论如何，我想你是被派来帮我们的。那我们就动工吧！",cEN="How'd you find us, <class>? No matter, I imagine you were sent here to give us a hand. Let's get to work then!"}
Q[9559]={d="$g应许者:应许者;，你必须北上前往我族人的家园——静松要塞。在那里，你将面对最令人生畏的挑战。\n\n去吧，大酋长静松正等候你的到来。",dEN="Promised one, you must travel north to the home of my people - Stillpine Hold. It is there that you will face your most daunting challenge.\n\nGo now, High Chief Stillpine awaits your arrival.",o="与止松要塞的止松老酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold.",c="数百年来，我们与这片土地上的生物大体和平共处。几个月前，库尔兹开始看到凶险的预兆。我们长久享有的和平即将失去，而这场灾难的规模谁也无法预知！\n\n看来诸神将要粉碎我们的土地，让朋友和敌人一同与我们为敌。但还有别的东西……在这场混乱之中，一位英雄将会崛起，一位血脉不同于静松的英雄。$g应许者:应许者;将把我们从毁灭中解救出来。\n\n<预言中的英雄就是你。$g朋友:朋友;$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="For centuries, we lived in relative peace with the creatures of the land. Several months ago, Kurz began to see dark omens. The peace that we enjoyed for so long was to be lost. The extent of the catastrophe could not be known!\n\nSo it would be that the gods would shatter our land - turning both friend and foe against us. But there was something else... Amidst the chaos, a hero would rise: A hero not of Stillpine blood. The Promised One would deliver us from devastation.\n\nThat prophesied hero was you."}
Q[9560]={d="我和我兄弟在东边的树林里打猎时，遭到了奇怪虫形野兽的伏击。这样的异形在碧蓝秘岛上从未出现过！这会不会是末日将至的征兆？会不会是命中注定要由你来阻止的那场末日？\n\n如果你真是$g应许者:应许者;，你就会打倒那些末日的造物……并把它们的毛皮带给我。有了它们的毛皮，我就能制作威力强大的护甲！\n\n往东，在道路的另一边就能找到它们。",dEN="My brother and I were hunting in the woods to the east when we were ambushed by strange, insect-like beasts. Such aberrations have never before been seen in Azuremyst! Could they be a sign of the coming apocalypse? The apocalypse that YOU are destined to prevent?\n\nIf you truly are the Promised One, you will strike the creatures of the apocalypse down... and bring me their hides. From their hides, I can fashion armor of great power!\n\nFind them to the east, beyond the road.",o="秘蓝岛止松要塞的莫多要求你给他带回8张掠食者的皮。",oEN="Moordo at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to bring him 8 Ravager Hides.",p="他们是丑陋的小生物。就连盲目者麦格特都能看见他们……他是盲人。",pEN="They are ugly little creatures. Even the Blind Watcher could see them... and he's blind.",c="不只预言是真的，连这个护甲都超棒的！它绝对是配得上勇士的护甲！而且我以折扣价卖给你，就没有毛的那一件。\n\n我开玩笑的……第一件是赠送的。",cEN="Not only is the prophecy true, this armor is also amazing! Surely it is armor fit for a champion! And I will sell it to you at discounted prices, furless one.\n\nI jest... The first piece is complimentary."}
Q[9561]={d="翻译好了，$n。当翻译可真不是个简单的工作……\n\n<学者菲索斯指着译文末尾的那一段文字。>\n\n“敌人已经接近我们。我们必须召集所有的幸存者退到东边的神殿去。那是我们在岛上最后的据点，一定要让所有幸存者知道这一点。我会小心地在神殿埋藏好我最后的一些财产，希望有人会发现，知道我们发生了什么事。”",dEN="The translation is ready now, <name>.\n\n<Anchorite Paetheus points out a block of text at the end of his translation.>\n\n'The enemy is nearly upon us. We've gathered up all the survivors and retreated to the temple to the east. It's the last ground we truly hold on the island, and there is a sense among the survivors that we will make our last stand here. I've taken care to bury my last few possessions on the grounds of the temple, with the hope that someone will find them and know what happened here.'",o="找到诺尔凯的日记中提到的地方和他埋藏多年的财物。",oEN="Find the location described in Nolkai's journal and discover his long-buried possessions.",c="杂草和灌木掩盖着土里一块不寻常的凸起物。\n\n你挖了几分钟后看到一个旧盒子，几乎就和诺尔凯在日记中所描述的一模一样。",cEN="Grasses and shrubs cover an unnatural bulge in the earth.\n\nA few minutes spent digging reveals an old box, almost certainly the one mentioned in Nolkai's journal."}
Q[9562]={d="这几天真是最黑暗的日子，救世主大人，现在就连鱼人也跑来踩我们的尾巴！若只是尾巴，只是自尊的话，倒也没什么，但它们伤害到的可不仅只是自尊而已。\n\n我们这边和沙鳞鱼人的关系一直很微妙，但我们从来没有料到它们竟然有胆对我们发动那样的大规模袭击，还抢走了我们全部的食物储备！请立刻到西边的淤泥海岸去，夺回我们的食物！\n\n还有，如果你看见某只深色皮肤的鱼人在它那全是蹼的脚趾上套了块白色毛皮的话……",dEN="These are dark days, Promised One. Even the murlocs are kicking our tails - literally. Unfortunately, more than just my ego has been bruised.\n\nWhile our relationship with the Siltfin murlocs had always been tenuous, never could we have imagined that they would have the gall to attack us and steal from our food stores! Travel west to the Silting Shore and recover our stolen food-stuffs!\n\nAnd if you see a dark-skinned murloc with a patch of white fur stuck in between his webbed toes...",o="秘蓝岛止松要塞的古尔弗要求你找回5袋止松谷物。",oEN="Gurf at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to recover 5 sacks of Stillpine Grain.",p="一只鱼人从我后面踢我一脚还对我吐口水……就在光天化日之下！",pEN="A murloc kicked me in the behind and spit on me... in broad daylight!",c="嗯……美味的谷物……帕卡特会很高兴的！",cEN="Mmmmm... Delicious grain... Parkat will be delighted!"}
Q[9563]={d="那你是想得到我们的信任？我现在已经不会再那么轻易相信别人了。\n\n不久之前，这里刚刚有人背叛了我们，投奔了鸦人的阵营，这件事让我非常愤怒。\n\n这么说吧，如果你能向荣耀堡证明你的忠诚，比如……给我搞一杯守望堡烈酒回来……是的，听起来不错……到那个时候我就会派事情交给你去做。\n\n守望堡的波尼储藏了许多上好的烈酒。",dEN="So you want to gain our trust? I don't trust many people these days.\n\nWe lost one of our own not long ago to the arakkoa. It's got me a bit on edge.\n\nTell you what, if you can prove your loyalty to Honor Hold and... bring me a mug of Nethergarde Bitter... yes, that sounds rather good about now... I'll have a deal to offer you then.\n\nBernie at Nethergarde Keep keeps the bitter in stock.",o="将一杯守望堡烈酒交给米伦·长须。完成任务后，你在荣耀堡的声望必须达到友好才能完成这个任务。",oEN="Mirren Longbeard wants you to bring him 1 Nethergarde Bitter. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Honor Hold to complete this quest.",p="烈酒很难找吗？守望堡的老波尼应该有储存几桶。\n\n除非他的都喝光了……那就太悲惨了！",pEN="Having trouble finding the bitter? Good old Bernie at Nethergarde Keep should stock barrels of it.\n\nUnless he's run out... that would be disastrous!",c="哎呀，没错！你看起来是个相当不错的$r。我想我可以信任你。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Why, yes! You seem to be quite an OK <race>. I suppose I can trust you."}
Q[9564]={d="你取回了古尔夫在与鱼人搏斗时\"弄丢\"的那块毛皮。把毛皮还给古尔夫，并告诉他那头可怕的穆尔古古拉已被击杀。",dEN="You recover the piece of fur that Gurf had \"lost\" in his struggle with the murlocs. Return the fur to Gurf and let him know that the fearsome Murgurgula has been slain.",o="将古尔弗的尊严交给秘蓝岛止松要塞的古尔弗。",oEN="Return Gurf's Dignity to Gurf at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle.",p="这是我想的那个东西吗？",pEN="Is that what I think it is?",c="<克夫在那块毛皮上吐了口口水，想把它黏回背上那块无毛的地方。>\n\n这应该没问题了！希望某个萨满能把损坏修补回来。",cEN="<Gurf spits on the clump of fur and tries to affix it to the hairless patch on his backside.>\n\nThis will have to do for now! Hopefully one of the shaman will be able to repair the damage."}
Q[9565]={d="身为酋长，我当前最关心的事情就是止松要塞内污染的根源。\n\n为什么这些曾是朋友的枭兽要攻击我们呢？为什么它们要占据止松要塞呢？\n\n或许止松要塞深处隐藏着这一切问题的答案吧。到止松要塞内部去，搜索有关污染源的线索。",dEN="As High Chief, my immediate concern is the root of the corruption in Stillpine Hold.\n\nWhy did the wildkin - once our allies - attack us? Why have they taken residence in Stillpine Hold?\n\nPerhaps something inside will hold the answer. Search Stillpine Hold for clues as to the source of corruption.",o="在止松要塞内寻找线索。",oEN="Search Stillpine Hold for clues.",c="血水晶散发出一种病态的光环渗入洞穴的水源中。",cEN="The blood crystal radiates a sickly aura that seeps into the water of the cave."}
Q[9566]={d="从表面上看，这块水晶像是埃索达的一块碎片。然而它出了极其严重的问题：通体血红，并正在迅速溶入洞穴的水源之中。\n\n这或许能解释碧蓝秘岛上那些生物异常凶暴的行为。带着这个消息回到大酋长静松那里。|n",dEN="On the surface, the crystal appears to be a piece of the Exodar. Something has gone terribly wrong with this crystal, however, as it is blood red and rapidly dissolving into the water supply of the cave.\n\nThis may explain the unusually aggressive behavior of the creatures in Azuremyst. Return to High Chief Stillpine with this information.",o="与止松要塞的止松老酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold.",c="你看到的这些血水晶，我的斥候在北方看过更多。\n\n感谢你的帮但现在我要你去和长者商讨。等我和村子里其它的长者谈过之后会再请你来。",cEN="These blood crystals that you saw; my scouts have seen many more to the north.\n\nI thank you for aid but now ask that you leave me to confer with the elders. I will call for you once I have spoken with the other elders of the village."}
Q[9567]={d="很高兴在血之守望这里又看到一张新面孔，$c。虽说血精灵是最紧迫的威胁，但这座血雾岛上还住着其他阴险的生物。\n\n纳兹维斯萨特尤其令人担忧。它们是污秽的恶魔造物，操纵着黑暗魔法，以埃索达坠毁所造成的腐化为食。\n\n我们必须遏制它们，但首先得了解更多。往西南去纳兹维安，从它们那座怪诞的纪念碑上尽可能搜集情报。",dEN="It's good to see another new face here in Blood Watch, <class>. Although the blood elves are the most immediate threat, there are other sinister creatures that call Bloodmyst Isle home.\n\nThe Nazzivus satyr are of particular concern. They are foul, demonic creatures, commanding dark magics and feeding on the corruption created by the Exodar's crash.\n\nWe must hold them in check, but first we must learn more about them. Go southwest to Nazzivian and learn what you can from their grotesque monument.",o="找到纳兹维安的碑石，将得到的纳兹维安碑石雕文交给秘血岗哨的守备官艾蕾希亚。",oEN="Find the Nazzivus Monument in Nazzivian and retrieve a Nazzivus Monument Glyph. Return to Vindicator Aalesia in Blood Watch when you have one of the glyphs.",p="你成功的取得对纳兹维安萨特的了解吗？",pEN="Were you successful in obtaining knowledge of the Nazzivus satyr?",c="做得好，$n。看看我能从这些碑文中学到什么，这样我们就可以计划下一步要怎么做。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Let me see what I can learn from this glyph, so we can plan our next move."}
Q[9568]={d="情况比我预想的还要糟，$n。我们德莱尼人很清楚，为了换取力量和永生的许诺而把灵魂卖给燃烧军团会有什么下场。\n\n岛上的萨特——纳兹维斯——正是当初那个与军团结盟的扭曲生物的后裔。我担心他们会找到办法，用埃索达水晶的力量来对付我们。\n\n你已经看到他们对这片土地做了什么。想想萨特拿到水晶会干出什么来。往西南去纳兹维安，发起我们的攻势！",dEN="It's worse than I had imagined, <name>. We draenei know well what comes of selling one's soul to the Burning Legion in return for promises of power and immortality.\n\nThe satyr on this island, the Nazzivus, are descendents of that first, twisted creature who allied with the Legion. I fear that they will find a way to use the power of the Exodar's crystals against us.\n\nYou've seen what they've done to the land. Imagine what the satyr could do with them. Go southwest to Nazzivian and begin our offensive!",o="血色守望的复仇者艾蕾希亚要你杀死10个纳兹维斯萨特，5个纳兹维斯盗贼，和5个纳兹维斯魔语。",oEN="Vindicator Aalesia at Blood Watch wants you to kill 10 Nazzivus Satyr, 5 Nazzivus Rogues, and 5 Nazzivus Felsworn."}
Q[9569]={d="既然萨特已经知道了我们的存在，我们必须告诉他们，德莱尼人绝对不能容忍燃烧军团的爪牙出现在这里。\n\n为了躲避燃烧军团和它的爪牙的追杀，德莱尼人有很长一段时间都在逃亡，$n。一旦燃烧军团发现我们，它们绝对不会心慈手软。\n\n我们一定不能让萨特利用埃索达坠毁泄漏出的能量和水晶作为武器！到北边的阿克萨林去，杀掉它们的首领，找到它所收集的被腐蚀的水晶！",dEN="Now that we have made our presence known to the satyr, we must send a message that we will not tolerate the Burning Legion's hounds in these lands.\n\nToo long have the draenei fled in the wake of the Legion and its minions, <name>. Wherever they have found us, they have shown no mercy.\n\nWe must not permit the satyr to exploit the Exodar's crash and use the corrupted crystals as weapons. Go north to where their leader resides in Axxarien, destroy him, and recover the corrupted crystals he has been gathering!",o="杀掉5个阿克萨林暗影行者、5个阿克萨林唤魔者和塞弗拉克斯，然后收集5块被腐蚀的水晶，把它们交给秘血岗哨的守备官艾蕾希亚。",oEN="Kill 5 Axxarien Shadowstalkers, 5 Axxarien Hellcallers, and Zevrax, then gather 5 Corrupted Crystals and return to Vindicator Aalesia in Blood Watch.",p="<守备官艾蕾希亚像是看着你的后方而不是看着你，她的心思系着那些萨特。>\n\n你有照着我的话把萨特首领给铲除吗？",pEN="<Vindicator Aalesia seems to look through you rather than at you, her mind fixed on dealing with the satyr.>\n\nHave you moved against the satyr leader as I have asked?",c="他们没了首领，我们又取回了被污染的水晶，我们就能安非常安全地对抗萨特了。天知道还有多少这些可恶的生物在外游荡。\n\n我和先行官米库拉斯很感激你提供的协助，使我们能在萨特变成更强大的威胁前对抗他们。你的努力提醒我们：警惕是对抗燃烧军团和他们爪牙的关键。",cEN="Without their leader, and with the recovery of the corrupted crystals underway, we can safely keep the satyr in check. Light knows how many more of these wretched creatures are out there.\n\nHarbinger Mikolaas and I are grateful for the help you've provided in dealing with the satyr before they could become a larger threat. Your work stands as a reminder that vigilance is the key to victory against the Legion and its minions."}
Q[9570]={d="水晶风暴平息之后，一头神话般的巨兽出现在我们的村庄里。这头巨兽——库尔肯——是被入侵的野生枭兽带来的，它把我们的村庄夷为平地。许多静松族人为了保卫家园死在这头恶魔手中，此后又有许多人在试图制服它时丧命。\n\n在我的幻象中，我看见有人击败了库尔肯。那个人一定就是你，$n。你是我们唯一的希望。进入静松要塞，杀死库尔肯，把它的毛皮带给我作为凭证。|n",dEN="After the crystal storm had subsided, a beast of myth appeared in our village. Brought here by the invading wildkin, this beast, the Kurken, laid waste to our village. Many Stillpine were slain in defense of our lands by this fiend and many have since lost their lives attempting to subdue the beast.\n\nIn my visions, I have seen one defeat the Kurken. The one must be you, <name>. You are our only hope. Enter Stillpine Hold and slay the Kurken. Bring me his hide as proof of deed.",o="秘蓝岛止松要塞的启示者库尔兹要求你杀死库肯，并带回库肯的毛皮。",oEN="Kurz the Revelator at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to kill the Kurken and bring back the Kurken's Hide.",p="<库尔兹对你嘟囔着。>",pEN="<Kurz grunts at you.>",c="$g应许者:应许者;取得了胜利！\n\n预言即将完全应验。至于那张毛皮……$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="The Promised One has emerged victorious!\n\nThe prophecy is nearly complete. Now about that hide..."}
Q[9571]={d="把库尔肯的毛皮带到村子另一头的穆尔多那里。他会用毛皮为你制作你想要的物品。|n",dEN="Take the Kurken's hide to Moordo, on the other side of the village. He will fashion the hide into an item of your choice.",o="将库肯的毛皮交给止松要塞的莫多。",oEN="Deliver the Kurken's Hide to Moordo at Stillpine Hold.",p="你好啊，$g英雄:英雄;！",pEN="Hello, hero!",c="这是我做过最坚固的护甲！好好利用它，$n。",cEN="This is the strongest armor I've ever made! Make good use of it, <name>."}
Q[9572]={d="快点，时间真的不多了。萨尔玛的存续现在已经是危在旦夕！\n\n我们西边有地狱火堡垒虎视耽耽，东边又有燃烧军团的威胁。现在燃烧军团暂时把注意力转向了黑暗之门那边，我们必须利用这个机会给地狱火堡垒中的邪兽人以一次真正的打击。完成这次打击的关键在于破坏他们的城墙！\n\n立刻到那里去，杀死他们的领袖，然后把证据交给屋子那边的卡萨雷兹。",dEN="Quick, there isn't much time. Thrallmar's existence balances on the razor's edge!\n\nWe're caught between Hellfire Citadel in the west and the Burning Legion to the east. With the Legion's attention turned toward the Dark Portal we must take this opportunity to strike at the fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel. The key to this is to first break through their ramparts!\n\nGo there, slay their leaders, and then bring back proof to Caza'rez across the room from me!",o="杀死巡视者加戈玛、无疤者奥摩尔和座龙纳杉，并将加戈玛之手、奥摩尔之蹄和纳杉之颅交给地狱火半岛上的萨尔玛内的卡萨雷兹。",oEN="Slay Watchkeeper Gargolmar, Omor the Unscarred and the drake, Nazan. Return Gargolmar's Hand, Omor's Hoof and Nazan's Head to Caza'rez at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="是$n，对吗？斯托克顿告诉我要等你的报告。\n\n我相信你带来了好消息？",pEN="<name>, right? Stok'ton told me to be expecting your report.\n\nI trust that you bring good news?",c="这是个好的开始。那三个家伙死了他们的军队就会陷入混乱，他们的炮火也会沉默，我们就能更轻易地接近并拿下堡垒！\n\n不过，我有预感这事情没有看起来那么简单——所以我要请你做件事。\n\n不过目前为止，你做的很好。从这些萨尔玛护甲中选一件吧。",cEN="It's a good start. With those three dead their forces should be in disarray. And with their artillery up there silenced we'll have an easier time getting close enough to take the citadel!\n\nBut there's more to this than meets the eye - I can feel it - so I'm going to have something else for you to do.\n\nFor the time being, though, you've done well. Take your pick of any of these from the Thrallmar armory."}
Q[9573]={d="我是止松酋长，这个部族遗产的继承者。正如您所见，我的卫兵已经给那些想要从止松要塞中攻出来的疯狂枭兽们设了一个通向死亡的圈套。可是我们现在所有人都必须守在这里，没法攻入堡垒里面。如果您能进去并刺杀它们的领袖，或许我们就能有机会展开攻击。\n\n找到欧莫鲁酋长，消灭它。哦，顺便杀死您在路上遭遇到的所有疯狂枭兽吧。",dEN="I am Stillpine the Younger, heir to the Stillpine legacy. As you can see, my defenders have set up a death trap for the raving wildkin that attack from inside Stillpine Hold. While we are able to hold them off out here, none of my defenders have been able to infiltrate the hold. If you could get inside and slay their leader, it might give us an opportunity to strike!\n\nFind Chieftain Oomooroo and destroy him. Slay any crazed wildkin that you encounter inside as well.",o="碧蓝秘岛静松要塞的小静松要你杀死首领欧莫鲁和9只疯狂的野生枭兽。|n",oEN="Stillpine the Younger at Stillpine Hold on Azuremyst Isle wants you to slay Chieftain Oomooroo and 9 Crazed Wildkin.",p="任务完成了吗？",pEN="Is the task complete?",c="这就是我们需要的机会！我会立刻发出攻击！止松部族感谢你的帮忙，$n！",cEN="This may very well be the opportunity that we needed! I will send an attack at once! The Stillpine thank you for your service, <name>!"}
Q[9574]={d="因为我们的到来，秘血岛一直在改变。埃索达坠落后，碎片散落在整座岛上，我想这会给野生动植物造成不良的影响。\n\n在证实我的想法前，我需要了解更详细的情况。水晶的能量似乎对于树木的影响最大，这样的话，我们应该可以从树人身上看到某些征兆。如果你能帮我从堕落的树人身上找些树皮样本回来，我就能进行深入的研究了。",dEN="Bloodmyst Isle was forever changed by our arrival. The Exodar's crash scattered debris all over the islands and I think it's beginning to have an adverse effect on the wildlife.\n\nBefore I can be certain of my conclusion, I'll need to get a closer look. The crystals seem to have affected the trees the fastest, so it seems that the treants would be the most likely to show symptoms. If you bring me samples of bark from corrupted treants, I can begin my in-depth studies.",o="找到6片晶化树皮，把它们交给秘血岗哨的莫莱。",oEN="Bring 6 pieces of Crystallized Bark to Morae in Blood Watch.",p="你拿到我要的样本了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get the samples I need?",c="这些够我研究的了。谢谢你，$n。如果你又找到其它水晶腐败秘血岛自然生物的证据，立即通知我。",cEN="There's more than enough here for my research. Thank you, <name>. If you find any other evidence that the crystals are corrupting Bloodmyst's native creatures, let me know right away."}
Q[9575]={d="快，$c，时间不多了。荣耀堡的存亡悬于一线！\n\n我们夹在西边的地狱火堡垒和东边的燃烧军团部队之间。军团的注意力转向了黑暗之门，我们必须抓住这个机会打击地狱火堡垒的邪兽人。关键在于先突破他们的城墙！\n\n去那里，杀掉他们的首领，再把证据带回来交给大厅另一头的加尼，就说是我叫你去的！",dEN="Quick, <class>, there isn't much time. Honor Hold's existence balances on the razor's edge!\n\nWe're caught between Hellfire Citadel in the west and the forces of the Burning Legion to the east. With the Legion's attention turned toward the Dark Portal we must take this opportunity to strike at the fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel. The key to this is to first break through their ramparts!\n\nGo there, slay their leaders, and then bring back proof to Gunny across the hall here from me!",o="杀死巡视者加戈玛、无疤者奥摩尔和座龙纳杉，并将加戈玛之手、奥摩尔之蹄和纳杉之颅交给地狱火半岛上的荣耀堡内的冈尼。",oEN="Slay Watchkeeper Gargolmar, Omor the Unscarred and the drake, Nazan. Return Gargolmar's Hand, Omor's Hoof and Nazan's Head to Gunny at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="$n，对吧？查德威克告诉我等着你的报告。\n\n你在我面前磨蹭什么？！你的任务完成了吗？你是$g个彻头彻尾的蠢货:个彻头彻尾的蠢货;吗？你真让我恶心！\n\n现在把你那没用的皮囊挪到城墙上去，做你该做的事！听见没有？！",pEN="<name>, right? Chadwick told me to be expecting your report.\n\nWHAT are you doing in my presence?! Is your assignment complete? Are you a complete and utter lackwit? You make me want to vomit!\n\nNow get your worthless hide up on those ramparts and do what you were instructed to do! Do you hear me?!",c="你知道什么比错误更让我痛恨吗？我以金子来打赌你没办法打倒它，甜心。\n\n太棒了！那三个家伙死了他们的军队就会陷入混乱，他们的炮火也会沉默，我们就能更轻易地接近并拿下堡垒！\n\n不过，我有预感这事情没有看起来那么简单——所以我要请你做件事。来，从这些护甲中选一件作为你的奖励。",cEN="Do you know what I hate worse than being wrong? Losing gold on a bet that you couldn't pull it off, sweetheart.\n\nOutstanding! With those three dead their forces should be in disarray. And with their artillery up there silenced we'll have an easier time getting close enough to take the citadel!\n\nI have a feeling there's more to this than meets the eye, though - so I'm going to have something else for you to do. Here, take one of these from the armory."}
Q[9576]={d="你仔细端详这枚做工粗糙的吊坠，注意到那块水晶在微微搏动。尽管它发出的光很微弱，你几乎能感觉到它散发着一种不对劲的气息。\n\n你不太确定是什么附上了残忍鳍的身，让他造出这枚吊坠，但这个发现太重要了，不能置之不理。你或许该把它拿给血之守望的某个人看看。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="Examining the crudely constructed pendant, you notice the crystal pulsating softly. Though it emits little light, you can almost feel the crystal radiating a sense of wrongness.\n\nYou're not quite sure what might have possessed Cruelfin to create this pendant, but the find is too important to ignore. You should probably show it to someone at Blood Watch.",o="将红色水晶坠饰交给秘血岗哨的莫莱。",oEN="Bring the Red Crystal Pendant to Morae at Blood Watch.",p="你手里拿着什么？",pEN="What is it you have there?",c="这非常奇怪，。我不记得我们以前见过鱼人佩戴任何饰物。\n\n考虑到水晶碎片已知的腐蚀性影响，佩戴这枚吊坠的鱼人一定相信它能赋予自己支配同伴的力量。要是他借此迅速压过其他鱼人、实力大增，我一点也不会感到意外。$n",cEN="This is most curious, <class>. I don't believe we've ever seen the murlocs wearing any kind of adornment before.\n\nGiven the corrupting influence that the crystal shards are known to have, the murloc that wore this pendant must have believed it granted him power over his fellows. I wouldn't be surprised if he had rapidly outgrown his fellow murlocs and gained in strength."}
Q[9578]={d="你想念你的家人吗，$n？有许多家庭登上了埃索达，但很少能再次重聚。\n\n我正在寻找我的丈夫加莱恩，他是冷却核心的技师。冷却核心的残骸在西边，那里到处都是血精灵！\n\n我必须找到加莱恩！即便是他死去的消息也比杳无音讯要好。我的丈夫戴着一条和我脖子上的这条一模一样的坠饰，那是我姐姐送给我们的礼物。",dEN="Do you think often of your family, <name>? There were a number of families aboard the Exodar, but I've heard of very few being reunited.\n\nI, myself, am looking for traces of my husband Galaen, who was a technician in the Cryo-Core. The wreckage of it is located to the west, and it's swarming with blood elves!\n\nI must find out what became of Galaen! Even news of his death is better than never knowing. My husband will be wearing a pendant identical to my own; they were a gift from my sister.",o="寻找莫莱的丈夫加莱恩。",oEN="Search for Morae's husband Galaen.",c="尸体的穿着看起来像是埃索达的技师，但莫莱描述的护身符却不见踪影。",cEN="The corpse appears to be dressed in the manner of an Exodar technician, but the pendant described by Morae is absent."}
Q[9579]={d="你没有办法通过莫莱提供给你的信息辨认出尸体是不是加莱恩，但从被撕碎的衣服上看，像是被人搜过身。\n\n灾难过后，这一带的血精灵一定会来夺取那些有价值的东西，包括加莱恩脖子上那条镶着宝石的护身符。\n\n尽管莫莱的丈夫在埃索达坠毁时未能幸免于难，但你相信如果能找回被血精灵夺走的护身符，她也会很感激你的。",dEN="You have no means of identifying the corpse as Galaen with the information Morae gave you, but the clothing appears to have been torn in search of valuables.\n\nThe blood elves in the area would've claimed anything of value from the wreckage, including Galaen's jeweled amulet.\n\nAlthough her husband did not survive the crash, you believe that Morae would be grateful if you recovered her husband's amulet from the blood elves.",o="将加莱恩的护符交给秘血岗哨的莫莱。",oEN="Bring Galaen's Amulet to Morae at Blood Watch.",p="<莫莱怀抱希望地看着你。>\n\n你有找到加莱恩的任何蛛丝马迹吗？",pEN="<Morae looks at you hopefully.>\n\nDid your search turn up any trace of Galaen?",c="<你告诉莫莱你在冷却核心的残骸身上找到的东西。>\n\n所以……他……\n\n我想我也大概猜到了，但就是不想让自己相信。这不是我希望听到的消息，但我非常感谢你帮忙找到加莱恩。",cEN="<You tell Morae of your findings in the wreckage of the Cryo-Core.>\n\nSo... he's...\n\nI guess I knew on some level, but just wouldn't let myself believe it. It's not the news I was hoping for, but you have my deepest thanks for finding Galaen."}
Q[9580]={d="相信你在秘血岛这段时间已经看到，我们将这里改变了不少。我经受的考验和经历告诉我，任何一种环境中的生物，即便是这里的，也多少可以派上用场。\n\n我们的资源所剩不多，必须动脑子去想想如何发掘新的资源。我正在收集遍布全岛的棕熊身上的肉，以此补充我们的贮藏。如果烹饪方法正确，它们的肉是可以安全食用的。如果你要出去走走的话，为什么不帮我找些熊肉回来，补充我们的库存呢？",dEN="As I'm sure you've seen in your time on Bloodmyst Isle, very little remains unchanged by our arrival. My training and experience has taught me that even the products of an environment like this one can be put to use.\n\nWith so few resources, we must rely on our ingenuity to provide for us. I've been supplementing our stores with meat from the bears that wander this island. With the proper preparation, it can safely be eaten. If you're going to be out in the field, why not help replenish our stocks?",o="收集8块老年棕熊的肉，把它们交给秘血岗哨的追踪者兰塞恩。",oEN="Bring 8 Elder Brown Bear Flanks to Tracker Lyceon in Blood Watch.",p="打猎进行的怎么样，$n？",pEN="How goes the hunt, <name>?",c="这会让我们这阵子都有足够的补给，处理它一定会让我忙上好一会儿。谢谢你的帮忙，$n。",cEN="This will keep us supplied for quite a while, and preparing it for consumption will certainly keep me busy. Thank you for your help, <name>."}
Q[9581]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到血之守望，$c。监督前哨的防御是我的首要任务，但埃索达的首领们还给我指派了各种其他职责。\n\n问题是，这座岛如此危险，派出大批研究人员根本谈不上安全。我需要有人去岛上各处采集一系列水晶样本。\n\n我需要的第一个样本，来自城南过桥后那片被掠食者占据的飞船残骸。",dEN="Welcome to Blood Watch, <class>. Seeing to the defenses of the outpost is my primary concern, but I've also been tasked with a variety of other duties by our leaders at the Exodar.\n\nThe problem is that it's hardly safe to send out large amounts of researchers when the island is this dangerous. I need someone to gather a series of crystal samples from various sites on the island.\n\nThe first sample I need must come from the ravager infested ship debris south of the town and across the bridge.",o="使用水晶矿锄在坠毁点水晶上采集一份坠毁点水晶样本，把它交给秘血岗哨的先行官米库拉斯。",oEN="Get an Impact Site Crystal Sample using the Crystal Mining Pick on the Impact Site Crystal and bring it to Harbinger Mikolaas in Blood Watch.",p="你收集到第一个水晶样本了吗？",pEN="Were you able to gather the first crystal sample?",c="由于这个水晶裂片来自秘血岛较无污染的区域，它让我们的研究员有个基准可以比较岛上其它地区的样本。\n\n在我们弄到一整套样本前我不能把它寄出去，但这是个很棒的开始。如果你愿意帮忙收集其它的样本，我会确保你获得应有的奖励。",cEN="This crystal shard will give our researchers a baseline to compare against samples from other parts of the island, since it comes from one of Bloodmyst's less corrupted regions.\n\nI won't be able to send it off until we have a full set of samples, but this is a great start. If you're willing to help gather the other samples, I'll see to it that you're rewarded for your efforts."}
Q[9582]={d="我们的飞船坠毁时，船上兽栏所在的舱室分离了出去，坠落在岛上的东北角。前两天，有人将这把钥匙交给了我，这把钥匙所对应的笼子中关着的是死亡掠食者，世上最为危险的物种之一。这种生物的表皮可以反射大部分的魔法，但却并不坚硬，用一把利刃就可以轻松杀死它。\n\n拿着这把钥匙，去让这只生物从牢笼中获得自由，也让它的灵魂从痛苦中获得解脱。如果它从笼中逃脱出来，并对当前已经千疮百孔的生态环境造成更大的损害，我们绝对承受不起。",dEN="When the ship crashed, our menagerie was scattered on the northeast beaches of this isle. I have been handed a key that unlocks the cage holding one of the deadlier specimens, a death ravager. The creature is little armored but resistant to most magic. It must be killed by a simple blade.\n\nTake this key and release the creature from both its prison and its pain. We cannot afford to have it escape and cause even more damage to the ecology than we already have.",o="打开掠食者的牢笼，干掉死亡掠食者，然后向碧蓝岗哨的鲁安达复命。",oEN="Unlock the Ravager Cage and kill the Death Ravager, then return to Ruada at Azure Watch in Azuremyst.",p="你解决掉那个野兽了吗？",pEN="Have you put down the beast?",c="<罗达严肃地点点头。>\n\n这样就完成了。\n\n你已经准备好下一次的学习了，$n，不过我不是那个教你的人。",cEN="<Ruada nods solemnly.>\n\nThen it is done.\n\nYou are ready for your next lesson, <name>, but I will not be the one to teach it to you."}
Q[9584]={d="既然已经有了作为衡量标准的水晶，我们现在就需要从岛上更危险的区域寻找其它的样本。\n\n接下去需要的样本来自秘血岗哨西北边的刀林，那里的血精灵持有我们要的水晶。有报告说他们对水晶进行改造，把它加入某种魔法装置中。你去看看能否找到一块他们还未使用过的水晶，从上面采集一块样本给我。",dEN="Now that we have the baseline crystal, we're going to need samples from more dangerous areas of the island to complete the set I'll be sending to the Exodar.\n\nThe next sample must come from the crystals controlled by the blood elves in the Bladewood area to the northwest of Blood Watch. I have heard reports that they alter and harvest the crystals for use in some magical apparatus. See if you can find one that has not yet been incorporated into one of their devices, and mine a sample from it.",o="使用水晶矿锄在变异的秘血水晶上采集一份变异水晶样本，把它交给秘血岗哨的先行官米库拉斯。",oEN="Get an Altered Crystal Sample using the Crystal Mining Pick on the Altered Bloodmyst Crystal and bring it to Harbinger Mikolaas in Blood Watch.",p="你弄到第二份水晶样本了吗？",pEN="Do you have the second crystal sample?",c="<先兆者米科拉斯审视着那块水晶碎片。>\n\n这块碎片与最初那件样本大不相同。\n\n<先兆者米科拉斯把水晶举向光亮处。>\n\n你看到它那样搏动了吗？这让人担忧。我会在报告里记下血精灵似乎对这块水晶所做的改动。再次感谢你的帮助，$n。",cEN="<Harbinger Mikolaas examines the crystal shard.>\n\nThis shard is much different from the initial sample.\n\n<Harbinger Mikolaas holds the crystal up to catch the light.>\n\nDo you see how it pulsates like that? That's worrisome. I'll make a note in my report of the alterations the blood elves appear to have made to this crystal. Thank you again for your help, <name>."}
Q[9585]={d="在我将所有的水晶送回埃索达前，还差一个样本没有收集到，$n。最后一类样本来自西北边的萨特要塞阿克萨林。\n\n我不知道能从这块水晶样本上发现些什么，但是我敢肯定一定会有一些腐蚀的迹象。像你所做的那样，小心地从那里的水晶上采集碎片，否则我们的研究员就没法进行正确的比较了。",dEN="There's just one sample remaining before I can send this set of crystals to the Exodar, <name>. The final sample must come from the satyr stronghold of Axxarien to the northwest.\n\nI'm not certain what to expect from this crystal sample, but I'm sure there will be some signs of corruption. Take care to mine your shard from the crystal that looks like the ones you took your previous samples from, or else our researchers cannot make a valid comparison.",o="使用水晶矿锄在阿克萨林水晶上采集一份阿克萨林水晶样本，把它交给秘血岗哨的先行官米库拉斯。",oEN="Get an Axxarian Crystal Sample using the Crystal Mining Pick on the Axxarien Crystal and bring it to Harbinger Mikolaas in Blood Watch.",p="你带着我要的最后一个样本回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the last sample for my set?",c="<先行官米库拉斯从你手里接过最后一个水晶。>\n\n这样就完整了，剩下要做的就是把它们装箱送到埃索达。\n\n<先行官因为任务完成显得很高兴。>\n\n别误会，$n，我相信这研究是有价值的，但我们还面对着外面许多其它要紧的问题。",cEN="<Harbinger Mikolaas accepts the last crystal from you.>\n\nThat rounds out the set. All that remains to be done is to box them and send them to the Exodar.\n\n<The harbinger seems glad to be done with the task.>\n\nDon't get me wrong, <name>, I'm sure the research is valuable, but we're faced with a number of other pressing problems out here."}
Q[9586]={d="我们这里的一位草药师塔瓦拉进森林采药，但是到现在还没回来。我害怕她受伤，如果那样的话，她可能需要帮助，但我自己却没办法去找她。\n\n请你去帮我找她吧，如果她受了伤，也请你帮她治疗一下，$c朋友。她离开碧蓝岗哨后，一直向东走向那些温泉的方向去了。",dEN="Tavara, one of our herbalists, has been gone far too long in her search for herbs. I fear she is hurt and in need of help, yet I cannot look for her myself.\n\nPlease find her and lend your healing if needed, fellow <class>. She was heading east towards some hot springs when she left Azure Watch.",o="碧蓝岗哨的古安要求你找到塔瓦拉并治好她的伤势。",oEN="Guvan at Azure Watch wants you to find Tavara and heal her wounds.",p="你找到塔瓦拉了吗？",pEN="Have you found Tavara?",c="谢谢你帮助塔瓦拉。许多人对这片土地并不熟悉，总在意想不到的地方遇上麻烦。\n\n如果你愿意穿上这件长袍，我会深感荣幸。它标志着你是碧蓝岗哨的守护者之一，也是圣光$g虔诚的信徒:虔诚的信徒;。",cEN="Thank you for helping Tavara. So many are unfamiliar with these lands and find trouble where they least expect.\n\nIt would honor me if you were to wear these robes. They mark you as one of the protectors of Azure Watch and a devout follower of the Light."}
Q[9587]={d="你快速查看传令官瓦兹鲁登一动不动的尸体，发现一封卷起的信件，封印尚且完好。血红的墨迹中印着一个精致的\"I\"。你拆开信笺，读到的内容令人极为不安。\n\n荣耀堡的指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩一定想看看这个！",dEN="Giving the lifeless form of Vazruden the Herald the once-over, you discover a rolled letter, its seal yet unbroken. An elaborate \"I\" is pressed within the blood-red ink. Cracking the note open, the message that you read is most disturbing.\n\nForce Commander Danath Trollbane back at Honor Hold will definitely want to take a look at this!",o="将不祥的信件交给地狱火半岛上荣耀堡的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩。",oEN="Take the Ominous Letter to Force Commander Danath Trollbane at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你拿着什么东西吗，$g年轻人:女士？",pEN="What's that you have there, <son /ma'am>?",c="你说这有伊利丹的签名？！给我吧。\n\n<军队指挥官阅读这封信，之后又看了第二遍，思考了片刻。>\n\n你所带来的这个消息的确是不祥的没错。知道这个消息后，我们必须加快我们对抗地狱火堡垒及鲜血熔炉的计划。你已经表达你可以完成这任务，所以我要你来带领这些计划。\n\n甘尼将会给你下一个任务，不过我想这比你第一次的任务更加危险。\n\n愿圣光与你同在，$n！",cEN="It's signed by Illidan you say?! Let me have that.\n\n<The commander reads the letter, and then again a second time, thinking a moment before going on.>\n\nThis news that you bring is ominous indeed. Knowing this, we must accelerate our plans against Hellfire Citadel and this Blood Furnace. Because you have shown that you can get the job done, I want you to head up those plans.\n\nGunny will give you your next mission, though I suspect it will be far deadlier than your first.\n\nLight be with you, <name>!"}
Q[9588]={d="你快速查看传令官瓦兹鲁登一动不动的尸体，发现一封卷起的信件，封印尚且完好。血红的墨迹中印着一个精致的\"I\"。你拆开信笺，读到的内容令人极为不安。\n\n萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔一定想看看这个！",dEN="Giving the lifeless form of Vazruden the Herald the once-over, you discover a rolled letter, its seal yet unbroken. An elaborate \"I\" is pressed within the blood-red ink. Cracking the note open, the message that you read is most disturbing.\n\nNazgrel back in Thrallmar will definitely want to take a look at this!",o="将不祥的信件交给地狱火半岛上萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Take the Ominous Letter to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你手里拿的是什么信，$n？",pEN="What is that letter you have there, <class>?",c="你说这有伊利丹的签名？！给我吧。\n\n<纳兹格雷尔阅读这封信，之后又看了第二遍，思考了片刻。>\n\n你所带来的这个消息的确是不祥的没错。知道这个消息后，我们必须加快我们对抗地狱火堡垒及鲜血熔炉的计划。你已经证实你可以完成这任务，所以我要你来带领这些计划！\n\n百夫长卡沙瑞斯将会给你下一个任务，但是我想这比你第一次的任务更加危险。\n\n为了部落，$n！",cEN="It's signed by Illidan you say?! Let me have that.\n\n<Nazgrel reads the letter, and then again a second time, thinking a moment before going on.>\n\nThis news that you bring is ominous indeed. Knowing this, we must accelerate our plans against Hellfire Citadel and this Blood Furnace. Because you have shown that you can get the job done, I want you to head up those plans!\n\nCenturion Caza'rez will give you your next mission, though I suspect it will be far deadlier than your first.\n\nLok'tar ogar, <name>!"}
Q[9589]={d="那封信里的内容若是传出去，恐怕会让这里炸了锅。要是大家知道了信里的内容，一定会要求我们得想办法对付那些新近出现的邪兽人。可我们还得对付东边的燃烧军团，这可真糟糕。\n\n所以，你看，你的机会来了，甜心！你不如立刻去地狱火堡垒的鲜血熔炉散散步，多棒的主意！\n\n快到那里去，杀死一些邪兽人，然后采集一些他们的血样回来。\n\n你觉得你能搞定吗？",dEN="That letter is going to get folks all riled up around here. They'll think there's something we might do about all those new fel orcs being created if only we knew how it was being done. It's bad enough that we have to fight the Burning Legion to the east.\n\nSo, it's your lucky day, sweetness! You get to take a stroll into what they call the Blood Furnace inside Hellfire Citadel. Sounds hot!\n\nGet in there, kill some fel orcs and bring back samples of their blood.\n\nYou think you can handle that?",o="收集10份邪兽人血样，把它们交给地狱火半岛上的荣耀堡内的冈尼。",oEN="Collect 10 Fel Orc Blood Vials and return them to Gunny at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你拿到那些血了，亲爱的？如果我们要你去弄到手那就一定是很重要的，你知道吧？",pEN="You have that blood, darlin'? Might be kind of important if we asked you to get it, you know?",c="太——棒——了！从现在起，$n，你就是这个可悲星球可悲残骸上我最喜欢的人！\n\n等我把这血样交给他们研究，那帮书呆子准会激动得尿裤子。谁知道呢，也许我们能在对抗那些该死的邪兽人的战斗中找出新武器来。$T",cEN="Out-frikkin-standing! As of right now <name>, you are my favorite person on the sorry remains of this sorry planet!\n\nI'm sure that the eggheads are going to wet themselves when I hand that blood over to them for study. Who knows, maybe we'll find a new weapon in the fight against those damned fel orcs?"}
Q[9590]={d="那封信真是令人困扰，绝不仅仅因为它是背叛者所书写的。现在，我们已经知道他们正在制造某种新类型的邪兽人了，必须想点办法阻止这一切发生！可我们还得对付东边的燃烧军团，这已经够糟糕了，而现在又要有一支庞大的邪兽人军团即将出现在西边！\n\n你必须立刻潜入地狱火堡垒里面的鲜血熔炉，从那里带一些邪兽人的血样回来。",dEN="That letter is disturbing, and not just because it comes from the Betrayer. We must know how they are creating these new fel orcs if we're to defeat them! It's bad enough that we must fight the Burning Legion on our eastern flank, but now a new army of fel orcs to the west!\n\nYou must infiltrate this Blood Furnace inside Hellfire Citadel. Bring back samples of blood from the fel orcs that you find in there.",o="收集10份邪兽人血样，把它们交给地狱火半岛上的萨尔玛内的卡萨雷兹。",oEN="Collect 10 Fel Orc Blood Vials and return them to Centurion Caza'rez at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你没这么快就收集好血液了吧？",pEN="Surely you have not collected all of the blood so quickly?",c="我对你的能力印象深刻，$n。你不只一次，而是二次为我们渗入地狱火堡垒完成要求的工作。\n\n我会确保这些血被送到可以解开秘密的人手里。谁知道，或许我们可以找到一个方法来扭转局势？",cEN="I am impressed with your abilities, <name>. Not once, but twice now you have infiltrated Hellfire Citadel for us and accomplished what was asked of you.\n\nI will see to it that this blood is delivered to those who can unlock its mysteries. Who knows, perhaps we can find a way to reverse the process?"}
Q[9594]={d="这块盔甲碎片是由一种黑漆漆的金属铸造的，似乎在不断吸收光亮。尽管它看起来似乎没有被施加魔法，不过你仍能明显地感觉到它充满邪恶的力量。\n\n只有一支军队会使用这样的盔甲——燃烧军团。燃烧军团出现在这个地方只可能有一个原因，那就是调动岛上的萨特来攻击德莱尼。\n\n去干掉这里的萨特，然后返回秘血岗哨，将这块盔甲碎片交给守备官艾蕾希亚。",dEN="The armor scrap is forged from a deep black metal that seems to absorb light. Although it doesn't appear to be enchanted, there is an unmistakable sense of wrongness about it.\n\nSuch armor is only used by one force - the Burning Legion. The Legion's presence here can only mean that they're intending to mobilize the island's satyr against the draenei.\n\nTake action against the local satyr, then return to Blood Watch and show this armor scrap to Vindicator Aalesia.",o="除掉8个纳兹维安萨特和8个纳兹维安魔誓者，然后将瑟拉克的护甲块交给秘血岗哨的守备官艾蕾希亚。",oEN="Kill 8 Nazzivus Satyr and 8 Nazzivus Felsworn, then bring Tzerak's Armor Plate to Vindicator Aalesia in Blood Watch.",p="怎么了，$n？你手里拿的是什么？",pEN="Yes, <class>? What is it you have there?",c="你把这个带来给我是非常正确的，$n。这绝对是恶魔守卫的护甲碎片。\n\n那么，就如我所担心的。纳兹维安萨特正在重建和燃烧军团的联系。如果我们不阻止他们，萨特和他们的恶魔盟友就会把我们踩在脚下。我会立刻通知先行官米库拉斯。",cEN="You've done well in bringing this to me, <name>. This is, without a doubt, an armor fragment from a felguard.\n\nThen, it is as I feared. The Nazzivus satyr are renewing their contacts with the Burning Legion. If we don't stop them, the satyrs and their demonic allies will overrun us. I will notify Harbinger Mikolaas right away."}
Q[9595]={d="既然你选择了$c之路，你就必须掌握他人所不知的克制。不受约束的魔法能腐蚀灵魂、毁灭世界。\n\n要彻底明白这一点，你必须直面一个被自己所驾驭的魔法吞噬的人。前往碧蓝秘岛西北海岸的海滩，用你的法术大量击杀鱼人。这股力量的展露会引来潜伏在那里的邪恶力量——一个奎尔多雷法师幽魂。击败它。\n\n办完之后，去埃索达的光明穹顶找巴蒂。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You have chosen the path of the <class>, and so you must learn control. Magic, when unchecked, can corrupt souls and destroy worlds.\n\nTo fully understand, you must face one who has been consumed by magic. Travel to the beaches on the northwest coast of Azuremyst Isle and use your spells to decimate the murlocs. The display of power will attract the attention of the evil force lurking there, a Quel'dorei magewraith. Defeat it.\n\nWhen you have finished, seek out Bati at the Vault of Lights in the Exodar.",o="杀死淤泥海岸附近的鱼人以召唤出奎尔多雷法师怨灵，并消灭它。完成之后与埃索达圣光穹顶的巴蒂谈一谈。",oEN="Kill Murlocs of the Silting Shore to summon a Quel'dorei Magewraith, then destroy it. Afterwards, speak with Bati at the Vault of Lights in the Exodar.",p="你挑战了你的梦魇吗？",pEN="Have you faced your nightmares?",c="面对每一道法术，你都必须硬起心肠抵御它诱人的吸引，只在行善需要时才动用它。但愿那个幽魂让你看清了：一旦你变得$g疏忽大意:疏忽大意;，会变成什么样子——一个没有头脑的魔法奴隶。",cEN="With every spell you must steel yourself against its seductive lure, using it only as needed for the purposes of good. Hopefully the wraith granted a glimpse of what you might turn into should you become careless--a mindless slave to magic."}
Q[9598]={d="当圣骑士们决意为圣光献出一切和保卫我们的人民免受威胁的时候，我负责指引他们获得更强大的力量。\n\n是时候让你迈出成为真正勇士的第一步了。如果你愿意的话，我会给你一本圣洁之书。阅读书中的内容后，你对圣光的理解会更加深入，知道你应该做些什么。如果你能够对此有所体会，而且具备必需的能力，那你就将成功地获得更强的力量。",dEN="I am responsible for putting paladins on the path to greater virtue as they devote themselves to the Light and defend our people from threats.\n\nThe time has come for you to take your first step towards being truly virtuous. If you accept it, I will give you a tome of divinity. In studying it, you shall learn some about the Light, and what is expected of you. If you understand it, and are capable, then you will succeed in attaining greater abilities.",o="阅读圣洁之书后和约尔谈一谈。",oEN="Study the Tome of Divinity and speak with Jol.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n",pEN="Welcome back, <name>",c="我想你已经花时间读过那本书了。\n\n那么你应该已经$g准备好:准备好;接受考验了。埃索达坠毁在这些新土地上之后，总有做不完的事：怜悯与体谅之举……需要帮助的人……要杀的生物……\n\n通过证明你有帮助他人的耐心，尤其是帮助那些不幸之人，你就证明了自己是圣光的仆人，也是心智健全之人。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="You've spent time reading the book, I hope?\n\nThen you should be prepared to have yourself tested. There are always tasks to be done in the wake of the Exodar's crash throughout these new lands: acts of compassion and understanding...people who need help...creatures to slay...\n\nBy proving you have the patience to help others, especially those who are less fortunate, you prove that you are a servant of the Light and of sound mind."}
Q[9600]={d="那么你的任务，$n，就是帮助我们的新盟友——静松熊怪。\n\n几个年轻的静松萨满撞上了刺肢的营地，被屠戮殆尽。拿上这枚生命徽记，复活其中一位萨满。\n\n刺肢飞地位于道路以东，就在你跨过连接碧蓝秘岛与血雾岛的那座桥之后。办完之后来跟我谈谈。|n",dEN="Your task then, <name>, is to aid our new allies, the Stillpine furbolgs.\n\nSeveral of the younger Stillpine shaman stumbled across a Bristlelimb camp and were slaughtered to the last. Take this Symbol of Life and resurrect one of the shaman.\n\nBristlelimb Enclave is located to the east of the road just after you cross the bridge spanning Azuremyst and Bloodmyst Isle. Speak with me when you have done this.",o="约尔希望你利用生命符记复活一个年轻的熊怪萨满祭司，然后回去向她复命。",oEN="Jol wants you to resurrect a Young Furbolg Shaman with the Symbol of Life and return to her.",p="所有的生命都值得被拯救，只要不与我们作对就好。只有我们的敌人才要永远安息。",pEN="All life is worth saving, if it does not oppose us. Only our enemies should be laid to rest permanently.",c="不要因为受你帮助者的茫然失措而难过。那些刚刚重返生者世界的人常常会感到迷惘，更何况同时还要面对一个陌生的存在。\n\n这位年轻萨满多亏了你才得以从如此严酷的一课中幸存，让你能随心所欲地调用这份力量，也是理所应当的。",cEN="who.....who are you? .....Jol? Yes! Praise the Light! We are ok thanks to the forces Jol sent us to help in our battles. Yes I am fine...although I cannot say the same about my brothers...."}
Q[9601]={d="血骑士麦拉·黎明之刃要你过去见见他，$n。他就在亡灵壁垒，守卫着提斯法瑞林地与西瘟疫之地的通路。\n\n他可不是一个有耐心的人，让他一直在那里等着绝对是不明智的做法。",dEN="The blood knight Mehlar Dawnblade has requested an audience with you, <name>. Mehlar can be found at the Bulwark, guarding the passage between Tirisfal Glades and the Western Plaguelands.\n\nHe is not known for his patience. It would not be wise to keep him waiting.",o="与亡灵壁垒的麦拉·黎明之刃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mehlar Dawnblade at the Bulwark.",c="啊……看来时候到了。\n\n<玛拉会心地点点头。>",cEN="Ahh... it seems it is time.\n\n<Mehlar nods knowingly.>"}
Q[9602]={d="你必须立刻让你的人民得知这些信息，$n。如果不是你勇敢的行动延缓了凯尔萨斯和他那邪恶主人的计划，毫无疑问这里还要继续受到攻击。\n\n把这个叛徒的证据交给你的领袖吧。他们一定得亲自看看这些东西，或许他们更能理解上面文字的涵义。",dEN="You must get this information to your people, <name>. While your brave acts have certainly slowed down the plans of Kael'thas and his dark master, the attacks will undoubtedly continue.\n\nTake the traitor's communication to your leaders. They must see this for themselves. Perhaps they will be able to better understand some of what was written.",o="将叛徒的证据交给碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯。",oEN="Deliver the Traitor's Communication to Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You have returned!",c="<主教米奈奥斯从你手中接过信开始阅读。>\n\n他们这些该死的家伙……他们最好全都进入虚空。他们有个间谍一直在观察我们的所做所为！持续多久了？\n\n我会立刻通知维伦！\n\n你帮了我们一个很大的忙，$n。回到你的岗位上，因为等预言者指示我该怎么做之后我就会通知你了。",cEN="<Exarch Menelaous takes the letter from you and begins to read it.>\n\nDamn them... Damn them all to the Nether. They've had a spy watching everything that we've done! And for how long?\n\nI will notify Velen at once!\n\nYou've done us a great service, <name>. Be on guard as I will be contacting you once the Prophet has given me instruction as to what to do."}
Q[9603]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到碧蓝岗哨，$c。请原谅这里的杂乱。人们很容易把简单的事物视作理所当然，比如一间设施齐备、货品充足的旅店——直到你不得不从一无所有中把它建起来。\n\n我们设法抢救出了这个舱体用作建筑，但没有合适的家具和急救物资，这间旅店不过是个自命不凡的帐篷。埃索达的努尔古尼提出为我们打包一批物资，以解燃眉之急，但我需要有人把这份清单送过去。",dEN="Welcome to Blood Watch, <class>. Please excuse the disorder you see around you. It's easy to take simple things for granted, like a fully furnished and stocked inn, until you're forced to build one from nothing.\n\nWe've managed to salvage this pod for a building, but without the proper furnishings and first aid supplies, the inn is little more than a glorified tent. Nurguni at the Exodar has offered to put together a package to help with our most immediate needs, but I need someone to deliver this list to him.",o="将托菲尔的清单交给秘血岗哨的角鹰兽管理员兰度。",oEN="Take Topher's List to Laando, the Hippogryph Master at Blood Watch.",p="你好，$n。你有兴趣租一只角鹰兽吗？",pEN="Good day, <name>. Are you interested in renting a hippogryph?",c="所以你要去埃索达？\n\n那会是个长途旅行，但别担心，我有办法让你很快就到那里。",cEN="So you need to go to the Exodar?\n\nThat's going to be a long trip, but don't worry, I have a way to get you there very quickly."}
Q[9604]={d="只需要花一点点钱，你就可以乘坐角鹰兽飞去埃索达。\n\n乘坐角鹰兽既快又安全，那些携带着重要消息的人都会选择这种途径。如果你愿意的话，我可以帮你安排。",dEN="For a small fee, you can rent one of my hippogryphs to fly you to the Exodar.\n\nTaking the hippogryph is a faster, not to mention safer, alternative for someone carrying an important message. If you'd like to take a ride, speak to me again and I'll make the arrangements.",o="乘坐角鹰兽从兰度处飞往埃索达。到达后，将托菲尔的清单交给纳鲁之座的努古尼。",oEN="Purchase a hippogryph ride to the Exodar from Laando. When you land, take Topher's List to Nurguni in the Seat of the Naaru at the Exodar.",p="你好，$g朋友:朋友;。你看起来走了很远的路。有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Greetings, friend. You look like you've come a long way. How can I help you?",c="太棒了！你带了塔伏尔的单子来！我正希望今天可以收到呢。来看看他需要什么。\n\n<鲁古尼看完单子后开始在箱子里放入各种物品。>\n\n他要的东西大多都在这里了。床对角鹰兽来说太大了没办法运送，我会另外安排货车送过去的。",cEN="So you've brought Topher's list. Excellent! I was hoping to receive this today. Let's see what he needs.\n\n<Nurguni reads over the list and begins placing various items in a box.>\n\nThat's most of what he requested. The pieces for the beds are simply too large to be delivered by hippogryph, but I'll make arrangements to have them sent by wagon."}
Q[9605]={d="箱子在这里，$n。这应该够切兰把旅店开起来了。告诉他，以后有需要可以继续下订单。碧蓝岗哨急需一个地方来照料伤员、安置来往的旅人。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;返回碧蓝岗哨时，去埃索达纳鲁王座附近找斯特凡诺斯。",dEN="Here's the box, <name>. That should be enough for Topher to get the inn up and running. Let him know that he can keep sending in orders as the need arises. Blood Watch urgently needs a place to care for the wounded and put up any travelers they receive.\n\nWhen you're ready to return to Blood Watch, seek out Stephanos near the gates of the Exodar.",o="找到埃索达外的斯泰法努斯，乘坐他的角鹰兽回到秘血岗哨。",oEN="Find Stephanos outside the Exodar and purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch.",p="你要去哪，$c？",pEN="Where are you headed, <class>?",c="所以你要带着这个包裹回去秘血岗哨？没有问题，$c。再和我谈谈我就可以让你带着那些补给品上路了。",cEN="So you're headed back to Blood Watch with this package? No problem at all, <class>. Just speak with me again and we'll get you on your way with those supplies."}
Q[9606]={d="如果我没有记错，秘血岗哨的角鹰兽管理员是兰度。如果你之前和他聊过天，那你就可以乘坐我的角鹰兽直接飞到他那里去。\n\n有一个道理你一定要明白：训练过的角鹰兽通常只会飞去它们的主城，或者那些你曾经拜访过的角鹰兽管理员处。\n\n既然你曾经乘坐过兰度的角鹰兽，那你就可以带着托菲尔的补给品按原路飞回秘血岗哨。",dEN="If I remember correctly, Blood Watch's hippogryph master is Laando. If you've spoken to him before, then you can take one of my hippogryphs to him.\n\nThat's a good lesson to know: hippogryphs are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they'll only take you to a remote hippogryph master after you've already been there.\n\nSince you arrived on one of Laando's hippogryphs, you can also use that route to return to Blood Watch with the caregiver's supplies.",o="与斯泰法努斯谈一谈，然后租用一头角鹰兽回秘血岗哨。达到后，将努古尼的补给品交给托菲尔·罗阿。",oEN="Speak with Stephanos to purchase a hippogryph ride back to Blood Watch. Once you have arrived, deliver Nurguni's Supplies to Caregiver Topher Loaal.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。努尔古尼把清单上的东西都凑齐了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>. Was Nurguni able to gather everything on the list?",c="<将箱子交给塔伏尔，你告诉他鲁古尼已在安排将较大的物品用货车运送。>\n\n太棒了！现在，我终于能铺几张床，设立急救站，让我们遇到的伤者和任何生还者都有更好的对待。\n\n我无法表达对你有多感激，$n秘血岗哨的复仇者也感谢你。",cEN="<Handing Topher the box, you tell him that Nurguni is making arrangements to have the larger items delivered by wagon.>\n\nSplendid! Now, I'll finally be able to set up some beds and a first aid station so that we can better treat the wounded and any survivors we encounter.\n\nI can't thank you enough for your help, <name>. You have my thanks and that of the Blood Watch's vindicators."}
Q[9607]={d="$C，立刻集合一支部队去彻底调查地狱火堡垒的鲜血熔炉！现在就去！\n\n我们布置在附近的魔法阵显示出这里发生了一些非常奇怪的事情。但鲜血熔炉内又有某种强大的魔法屏障阻隔了我们的探测与调查。这太可疑了！\n\n那里面的抵抗非常强烈，我们以往派去执行这个任务的人从没有回来过！\n\n记得彻底侦察那边的情况，然后把所见的一切都报告给指挥官。",dEN="<class>, put together a force to investigate the Blood Furnace inside Hellfire Citadel at once! And that means today, princess!\n\nThe magic we have at our disposal indicates that something unnatural is occurring in there. But something more powerful inside is blocking any detailed arcane investigations. It figures!\n\nYou can expect heavy resistance - no other mission that we've sent in there has yet to return!\n\nScout it entirely and then report back to the force commander with what you witness.",o="全面调查鲜血熔炉，然后向地狱火半岛上的荣耀堡内的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩汇报。",oEN="Fully investigate the Blood Furnace and then report to Force Commander Danath Trollbane at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="士兵，汇报！鲜血熔炉你都探查完了吗？",pEN="Private, report! Have you scouted all of the Blood Furnace yet?",c="他们有一个深渊领主？！\n\n<远征军指挥官看看四周其它人注视着他，降低他的声音说起悄悄话。>\n\n就是它。他们一定是利用这个深渊领主的血液来制造这些不知为何没有与燃烧军团结盟的新邪兽人。如果他们可以对咖啡色皮肤的兽人这样做，他们也可以对绿皮肤的兽人这样做。对于所有新涌入黑暗之门的部落兽人来说，这很不妙！\n\n我们一定要直击他们的军事力量中心，而且要快！",cEN="THEY HAVE A PIT LORD?!\n\n<The force commander looks around at the stares of the others and then lowers his voice to a whisper.>\n\nThat seals it. They must be using the blood from this pit lord to create new fel orcs that are somehow not aligned with the Burning Legion. And if they can do this to the brown orcs, they can do it to the green ones too. With all of the new Horde orcs streaming in through the Dark Portal, that's not good!\n\nWe must strike at the heart of their military might, and soon!"}
Q[9608]={d="$C，你现在必须立刻集合一支部队去彻底调查地狱火堡垒里的鲜血熔炉！现在就去！\n\n我们布置在附近的魔法阵显示出这里发生了一些非常奇怪的事情。但鲜血熔炉内又有某种强大的魔法屏障阻隔了我们的探测与调查。这太可疑了！\n\n那里面的抵抗非常强烈，我们以往派去执行这个任务的人从没有回来过！\n\n记得彻底侦察那边的情况，然后把所见的一切都报告给萨尔酋长大人的顾问纳兹格雷尔。",dEN="<class>, you must gather a group to investigate the Blood Furnace inside Hellfire Citadel at once!\n\nThe magical scrying that we have at our disposal indicates that something unnatural is occurring in there. But a powerful force inside is blocking any detailed arcane investigations, so it must be very important.\n\nYou should expect heavy resistance - no other mission that we've sent in there has ever returned!\n\nScout it entirely and then report back to Nazgrel, advisor to Thrall, with what you witness.",o="全面调查鲜血熔炉，然后向地狱火半岛上的萨尔玛内的纳兹格雷尔汇报。",oEN="Fully investigate the Blood Furnace and then report to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你调查完整个鲜血熔炉了吗？你有什么消息要告诉我？",pEN="Have you scouted all of the Blood Furnace yet? What do you have to tell me?",c="他们有一个深渊领主？！\n\n<纳兹格雷尔注意到其它人瞄了他一眼，降低他的声音说起悄悄话。>\n\n就是它。他们一定是利用这个深渊领主的血液来制造这些不知为何没有与燃烧军团结盟的新邪兽人。如果他们可以对玛格汉的咖啡色皮肤兽人这样做，他们也可以对我们这样做！\n\n我们要直击他们的军事力量中心，而且要快！",cEN="THEY HAVE A PIT LORD?!\n\n<Nazgrel notices the glances of the others assembled and lowers his voice to a whisper.>\n\nThat seals it. They must be using the blood from this pit lord to create new fel orcs that are somehow not aligned with the Burning Legion. And if they can do this to the Mag'har brown orcs, they can do it to us!\n\nWe'll have to strike at the heart of their military might, and soon!"}
Q[9609]={d="玛格图尔通知我说，附近有一位束手无策的守夜人需要帮助。很显然，他所负责护送的马车队本来是从夜色镇出发的，但是遭到了失落者的攻击。据说他是唯一的幸存者。\n\n他就在南边不远的地方。拜托你，$c，请你一定要帮助他。",dEN="Magtoor has informed me that there's a stranded watcher nearby. Apparently the caravan he was escorting from Darkshire was attacked by Lost Ones. It sounds as if he's the sole survivor.\n\nHe's somewhere to the south. Please, <class>, lend him your aid.",o="找到悲伤沼泽的卫兵比格斯。",oEN="Find Watcher Biggs in the Swamp of Sorrows.",c="什么？是一位德莱尼人从港口派你来的？真奇怪。\n\n好吧，我可不是会拒绝援助的人。谢谢你能来，$n！",cEN="What? A draenei sent you here from the Harborage? How odd.\n\nWell, I'm not one to turn down assistance. Thanks for coming, <class>!"}
Q[9610]={d="我对研究艾泽拉斯的历史非常有兴趣，不知道你是否愿意帮助我？\n\n附近的沼泽地区有一处非常重要的历史遗迹，我希望你能帮我探索一下拿来。泪水之池就在东南方，据说在那里的岸边和水底埋藏着阿塔莱巨魔文明留下的神器。\n\n但你要小心，那里现在被一只年老的绿龙索姆努斯和他手下的龙类仆从守护着，水中有还有肉食性的鱼类，非常危险！",dEN="I am interested in studying Azeroth's past and I'm wondering if you'd be willing to help?\n\nThere is a nearby place of historical significance within the swamp that I would like for you to venture to. The Pool of Tears lies to the southeast. It is said that upon its shores and within its depths are buried artifacts of the Atal'ai troll civilization.\n\nBut beware, it is guarded by Somnus, an ancient green dragon, and his dragonkin, as well as carnivorous fish in the pool itself!",o="取得5个阿塔莱神器，将它们交给悲伤沼泽避难营的霍拉鲁。",oEN="Obtain 5 Atal'ai Artifacts and return them to Holaaru at the Harborage in the Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我期待着你收集好足够的阿塔莱神器，这样我就能开始研究它们了。我迫切的想了解他们曾经伟大的文明究竟发生什么事了。",pEN="I look forward to you gathering enough of the Atal'ai artifacts so that I might begin to study them. I'm eager to discover what happened to their once-great civilization.",c="谢谢你，。研究这些器物够我忙上一阵子了。如果我们不了解你们世界的历史，破碎者和德莱尼人又怎能真正融入彼此呢？$n",cEN="I thank you, <class>. The study of these artifacts should keep me occupied for some time. How else are we Broken and draenei to fit in if we do not come to understand the history of your world?"}
Q[9612]={d="你救了我的命，$n！太感谢你了！要不是你来了，那只野兽非把我撕成碎片不可。\n\n如果你见到了碧蓝岗哨的大主教，请一定要告诉他我还平安，告诉他是你救了我。我想他听到这样的消息一定会很高兴的！",dEN="You saved my life, <name>! Thank you so much! That beast would have torn me to shreds if it weren't for you.\n\nIf you see the exarch at Azure Watch, tell him of what you did. I'm sure he'll be pleased to hear such news!",o="与碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",c="做得好，$n。做的非常好！你成为了一个特别的德莱尼——在你同年的人当中脱颖而出。收下这个做为奖励！",cEN="Well done, <name>. Well done indeed! You are turning out to be a special <race> - a cut above the others of your age. Take this as a reward!"}
Q[9616]={d="这看起来是像是一张悬赏通告。你无法理解上面的血精灵语言，但你注意到了上面描绘有一个狂笑着的血精灵站在一个死去的德莱尼人身上，还有一个代表着血精灵货币的符号。\n\n他们一定是在狩猎德莱尼人！你必须马上通知大主教。",dEN="This appears to be a bounty ledger. You cannot understand the blood elf language but you note that there is a picture depicting a dead draenei, a smiling blood elf standing over the corpse, and a symbol of what you think is some sort of blood elf currency.\n\nThey've put a hit out on draenei! You must inform the exarch.",o="将血精灵布告交给碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯。",oEN="Take the Blood Elf Communication to Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",p="什么事？我很忙，$n。",pEN="Yes? I'm very busy, <name>.",c="感谢沃洛斯！你把这个带来给我真是太好了，$n。这些血精灵四处游荡就是为了……嗯，血。要立刻通知维伦！收下这个做为奖励。",cEN="By the beardless, geometric head of O'ros! It is good you brought this to me, <name>. These blood elves are out for... well, blood. Velen will be informed at once! Take this as a reward."}
Q[9618]={d="你的本事让人印象深刻，我相信委托你把我的报告交给瑟兰尼斯是不会错的。",dEN="Your sleight of hand was most impressive. There's no question that I can trust you to take these reports to Zelanis.",o="将克尔图斯·暗叶的报告交给银月城的瑟兰尼斯。",oEN="Bring Keltus Darkleaf's Reports to Zelanis in Silvermoon City.",p="你找到卡特斯了吗？",pEN="Were you able to locate Keltus?",c="所有这些报告都是来自卡特斯？他真的都很忙。\n\n卡特斯是盗贼中的盗贼——他很少遵照信上的命令，常常用自己的方法来解决事情！不过，别误会，因为他是我最信任的间谍之一，没有他我们会很茫然。\n\n你今天做了示范性的工作。请接受这把剑，将它刺入我们敌人的背后吧。",cEN="All of these reports are from Keltus? He's been quite busy, that's for sure.\n\nKeltus is a <class> among rogues--he rarely follows orders to the letter, and often takes matters into his own hands! Don't take that wrong, however, as he is one of my most trusted spies and we would be lost without him.\n\nYou've done an exemplary job today. Please accept this blade and guide it into our enemy's back."}
Q[9619]={d="虚空石显现出一座被幽灵笼罩着的多层建筑。图像时而模糊，时而清晰，又出现了一些其它的建筑物，你断定这是金雾村。\n\n屋顶和树木一闪而过，你可以看到一条沿着艾伦达尔河一直向西，最终到达金雾村的路。\n\n到那里之后，在村庄中心的建筑物顶部使用虚空石召唤一只虚空行者。只有打败它，你才能回到导师那里去。",dEN="The voidstone reveals a vision of a multi-story building haunted by ghostly figures. As the scene sharpens and blurs, other buildings come into view, leading you to believe it is Goldenmist Village.\n\nRooftops and tree canopies suddenly flash by, revealing the way to Goldenmist by following the Elrendar River to the west.\n\nOnce there, use the voidstone near the rune of summoning atop the center building and defeat the summoned voidwalker. Only then can you return to your teacher.",o="在金雾村使用虚空石召唤出虚空行者，打败它，然后回到银月城的塔莱尼娅身边。",oEN="Use the Voidstone to summon a Voidwalker in Goldenmist Village, defeat it, and return to Talionia in Silvermoon City.",p="你沿着虚无石显现出来的路走了吗？",pEN="Have you followed the path revealed by the voidstone?",c="我真惊讶你会站在这里，$n。许多学徒都死在虚无行者的手下，甚至是虚无石本身。\n\n虚无行者现在听你使唤了。好好利用你的仆人。",cEN="I'm impressed you are standing here, <name>. Many an apprentice has perished to the voidwalker, or even the voidstone itself.\n\nThe voidwalker is now yours to command. Use your new servant well."}
Q[9620]={d="当我们在秘血岗哨驻扎下来后，我派出测量小队帮我们绘制更可靠的秘血岛地图。大多数时候，他们都能安全地带着我们需要的信息回来，但是我派去东边废墟的测量小队到现在都没有回来报告。\n\n我很担心，不知道他们发生了什么事情，可是我没有多馀的人手可以派去寻找他们了。$n，去找到他们，帮助他们将测量数据带回来。",dEN="As we've gotten ourselves established here at Blood Watch, I've been sending out survey teams to create more reliable maps of the island. In most cases, they returned unharmed with the data we need, but the team I sent east to the ruins hasn't reported back.\n\nI worry about what might have happened to them, but I can't spare the men to send another mission after them. Find them, <name>, and lend them any assistance they require to return with their survey data.",o="先行官米库拉斯希望你找到他派去洛雷萨兰废墟的测量小组，尽力帮助他们。",oEN="Harbinger Mikolaas wants you to find the Survey Team he sent to the Ruins of Loreth'Aran and assist them in any way you can.",c="德莱尼测量小组的尸体四处散落在这里，身上满是被纳迦的武器伤害过的痕迹。地上都是他们补给的剩余物和测量装备，但他们的存储测量数据的水晶却不见踪影。",cEN="The bodies of the <race> survey team are scattered all over the ground here, pierced by naga weaponry. The area is littered with the remains of their supplies and survey equipment, but their data crystals are nowhere to be seen."}
Q[9621]={d="在我们潜在的新盟友之中，似乎有些人还对我们的能力有所质疑。如果他们发觉我们连自己家门口的问题都不能摆平，又怎么会觉得我们能对他们有所帮助呢？\n\n你做的事情将会改变这个状况。我们的能力很快就不再会受到任何质疑。我们将很快以与新盟友们对等的身份加入部落。\n\n将这封信交给被遗忘者的领袖，希尔瓦娜斯女王。她一直站在我们这一边，达尔坎的死讯对她来说无疑将会是最美妙的音乐。做好长途旅行的准备吧，$n。如果一切顺利，她可能会派你去奥格瑞玛。",dEN="There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies. Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?\n\nThis changes everything. No longer will our power be questioned. We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.\n\nTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken. She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears. Prepare for a long trip, <name>. If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar.",o="到提瑞斯法林地去，将洛瑟玛·塞隆的信交给被遗忘者的首都幽暗城中的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades.",p="啊，一位来自奎尔萨拉斯的访客！你带来了什么消息？",pEN="Ah, a visitor from Quel'Thalas! What news do you bring?",c="看来他的生命已经结束了。可恶的背叛者已经得到了该有的报应。\n\n你对血精灵和部落的帮助很大。达克汗是萨尔用来拒绝他们加入我们同盟的借口。你为新部落开创了新局面，$n。\n\n我也看到洛索玛有了其它的消息会大大地改善他与萨尔的关系。非常好！",cEN="It is done then. The foul traitor got what he deserved.\n\nYou did this yourself? An impressive feat that proves that your race remains worthy, <name>.\n\nI see that Lor'themar has additional news that will greatly improve his relations with Thrall."}
Q[9622]={d="要塞得救了，很快我的人民就能重返祖传的家园。预言已经应验，静松一族繁荣的新时代即将开始。\n\n但我担心，黑暗正笼罩着你的族人。还有许多疑问悬而未决——那些未曾得见的预言幻象。\n\n回到你的首领那里去，把你在这一切的所见所闻告诉他们。\n\n还有，听好了，$g应许者:应许者;，如果你哪天需要静松一族的帮助，只需开口便是。",dEN="The Hold is saved and soon my people will make their way back to the ancestral home. The prophecy has come to pass and a new age of prosperity begins for the Stillpine.\n\nBut I fear that darkness looms ahead for your own people. There are questions left unanswered - visions of prophecy unseen.\n\nReturn to your leaders and tell them of what you have seen here.\n\nAnd Promised One, should you ever require the aid of Stillpine, you have merely to ask.",o="与碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch.",c="你说幻象？真有趣……而这个预言成真了？\n\n但你说他们见到了埃索达的力量核心？而且沃洛斯也在幻象里？这会是什么意思？",cEN="Visions you say? Interesting... And this prophecy has come to pass?\n\nBut you say they saw the power core of the Exodar? And O'ros was also in the vision? What can it mean?"}
Q[9623]={d="你在我们新家园的荒野中活了下来，也证明了自己出类拔萃。我相信你已经成熟到可以去援助血雾岛前线作战的人了。阿古斯之手正需要像你这样的$r。\n\n去向驯兽者托拉留斯报到。你会在埃索达外面找到他，他正在照料雷象。把这份命令交给他，他就能向你说明你在血雾岛的新职责。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You have survived the wilds of our new home and shown yourself a cut above the others. I believe that you have come of age to assist those battling on the front lines of Bloodmyst. The Hand of Argus could use a <race> like you.\n\nReport to Torallius the Pack Handler. You will find him outside the Exodar, tending to the elekk. Give him these orders so that he may direct you towards your new duties on Bloodmyst.",o="碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯要求你将主教的命令交给埃索达门外的象群管理器妥拉留斯。",oEN="Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch has asked that you deliver the Exarch's Orders to Torallius the Pack Handler, standing outside of the Exodar.",p="<托拉留斯扶了扶眼罩，打量着你。>\n\n这就是我们能提供给阿古斯之手的最好人选？",pEN="<Torallius adjusts his eyepatch to look at you.>\n\nThis is the best we can offer the Hand of Argus?",c="<妥拉留斯叹气。>\n\n好吧，让我看看那些命令。",cEN="<Torallius sighs.>\n\nAlright, let me have a look at those orders."}
Q[9624]={d="我有一个惊人的发现，$c。在岛上没有被污染的地方生长出了一种不寻常的水果，我称之为沙梨。它们生长在靠近树根的地方。\n\n我用它们做了一些馅饼，但只要我一不留神，雷象就会在周围徘徊，偷走我的水果。我很愿意收集足够多的水果与动物们共享，但我已经没有多馀的库存，而馅饼的需求又回升了。我需要制作另一批馅饼，你愿意帮我收集水果吗？我保证我一定会让大家一起分享的！",dEN="I've made a wonderful discovery, <class>. On the uncorrupted part of the island grows a remarkable fruit called the sand pear. They're found near the bottoms of the trees.\n\nI've been preparing pies from them, but if I'm not careful, the elekk will start to wander over and steal my fruit. I've taken to gathering enough to share with the animals, but my stores are gone and the craving for pie has returned. Would you be willing to help gather the fruit I need for another batch of pies? I promise I'll share!",o="凯希尔路口的奥纳尔希望你能帮他找到10个沙梨。",oEN="Aonar at Kessel's Crossing wants you to bring him 10 Sand Pears.",p="沙梨越来越难找，当然，这也表示雷象的美味点心也越来越少。你可以收集到所有我需要的水果吗？",pEN="The sand pears are getting harder to find and, of course, that means less pie and fewer treats for the elekk here. Were you able to gather all the fruit I'll need?",c="你找的很辛苦吗？我都要花上越来越多的时间才能回来。\n\n我很快就要全部停工了，因为我没有空余时间！谢谢你帮我收集沙梨，$n。这让我在雷象产期结束前还能做最后几个电信。",cEN="Did you have a difficult time finding enough? It's been taking me longer with each trip.\n\nSoon, I'll have to stop altogether since I won't be able to spare the time. Thank you for gathering the pears for me, <name>. It gives me a chance to make a last pie or two before the season's out."}
Q[9625]={d="他疯了吗？怎么能把这种事托付给一个名不见经传的年轻$r？！\n\n你最好记住这一点，小子：你永远也进不了阿古斯之手！你没那个胆量！\n\n我想这回我还是得顺着他。去血雾岛的凯塞尔十字路口找沃尔坎。从这里沿大路往北走，到岔路口继续往北就是。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="Is he crazy? Entrusting something like this to some no-named <race> youngling!\n\nJust remember this kid: You'll never make it as a Hand of Argus! You don't have the guts!\n\nI guess I'll have to humor him this time. Speak with Vorkhan at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle. Just follow the road north from here, and when it forks, just keep on going north.",o="与秘血岛的雷象管理器沃克汉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Vorkhan the Elekk Herder on Bloodmyst Isle.",c="行啊，你都走到这儿了！趁你还没流太多血，赶紧干活吧。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Well ya made it this far! Let's put ya to work before you get too bloodied up."}
Q[9626]={d="你知道的，我还没有丧失对往昔的故乡与人民的爱。我曾为了银月城能在幽暗城与奥格瑞玛的谈判桌上有一席之地而与兽人针锋相对。\n\n你带来的消息可以让任何反对者闭上嘴。立刻将这封信送给奥格瑞玛的萨尔酋长。身为部落的领袖，他会最终接受你们种族的效忠宣誓。\n\n我已经在信上盖了自己的印章，表明了我个人的认可。到城市的西北方去，你就可以找到地精飞艇的空港，搭乘飞艇可以很快到达杜隆塔尔。",dEN="I haven't lost any love for my homeland or its people, as you know. I've fought tooth and nail for Silvermoon to be allowed a place beside Undercity and Orgrimmar at the negotiating table.\n\nThis should silence any opposition. Take this letter to Thrall in Orgrimmar. As leader of the Horde he will have the final say on accepting your race's pledge.\n\nI've added my own seal to the letter as a personal endorsement. Go northwest of the city and board the zeppelin bound for Durotar at the tower.",o="希尔瓦娜斯·风行者要求你将她的密信交给杜隆塔尔首都奥格瑞玛的萨尔。",oEN="Lady Sylvanas Windrunner wants you to take the Letter Sealed by Sylvanas to Thrall in Orgrimmar, capital of Durotar.",p="你是来见我的吗，$r？有话快说。我可没时间讲究你们种族的那些礼数。$g朋友:朋友;",pEN="You've come to see me, <race>? Speak and be quick. I've no time for the formalities of your race.",c="<萨尔开始读信。>\n\n希尔瓦娜斯还真是执着……居然派来了一位银月城的勇士。她以为这样就能改变什么吗？<Thrall comienza a leer la carta.>$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="<Thrall begins to read the letter.>\n\nSylvanas is a persistent one. So she's sent one of Silvermoon's own champions... how does this change anything?"}
Q[9627]={d="你的人民在联盟的背叛中遭受了巨大的损失与伤痛。你已经成功地解决了来自达纳苏斯与铁炉堡的间谍。你现在又已经成功地在家门口击败了一名强大的天灾军团军官。你们的价值已经不容置疑。\n\n很显然，现在，你需要我们，而我们也需要你。回去向洛瑟玛报告吧。告诉他我已经清晰而明确地了解了他要传达过来的信息。\n\n<酋长用力揉碎了手中的信。>\n\n欢迎加入部落，精灵。",dEN="Your people suffered a great betrayal by the Alliance. You've succeeded in fending off Darnassian attacks as well as spies from Ironforge. Now you've defeated a powerful Scourge leader at the footsteps of your home. Your worthiness is no longer in question.\n\nIt is now apparent that you need us and we need you. Return to Lor'themar. Tell him I received his message loud and clear.\n\n<The warchief crushes the letter inside his palm.>\n\nWelcome to the Horde, elf.",o="回到银月城，向洛瑟玛·塞隆复命。",oEN="Return to Silvermoon City and report back to Lor'themar Theron.",c="你的努力帮了我们种族的事业一个大忙。萨尔不但相信我们有能力在敌人面前处理状况，他还相信他可以利用我们和外域的联系来接近他的人民。\n\n不完全是事实，但也不是个谎言。\n\n准备好接受很大的改变吧，$n。我们现在是部落正式的一员了。",cEN="Your work has helped advance our race's cause a tremendous deal. Not only does Thrall believe we're capable of handling ourselves in the face of the enemy, he also believes he can use our link with Outland as a means to reach his people.\n\nNot exactly the truth, but not a lie either.\n\nBrace yourself for great changes, <name>. We are now officially part of the Horde."}
Q[9628]={d="要想帮助测量员完成他们的任务已经来不及了，但看上去他们已经收集到了先行官米库拉斯想要寻找到的情报。在他们被洗劫过的背包里找不到记载着测量数据的水晶，所以一定是被怒鳞纳迦夺走了。\n\n你知道先行官米库拉斯一定会因为测量人员的伤亡而感到伤心难过，但他肯定也希望能夺回珍贵的测量数据。",dEN="It's too late to assist the cartographers in completing their mission, but it appears they collected the data Harbinger Mikolaas was expecting. The crystal storing their survey information was not among their ransacked packs, so it must be in the hands of the Wrathscale naga.\n\nYou know that Harbinger Mikolaas will be saddened by the loss of the survey crew, but would want to salvage the survey data.",o="从测量人员尸体附近的怒鳞纳迦手中夺回测量数据水晶，把它交给秘血岗哨的先行官米库拉斯。",oEN="Obtain the Survey Data Crystal from the Wrathscale near the dead cartographers and return it to Harbinger Mikolaas at Blood Watch.",p="你知道是什么让测量小组没有回来吗？",pEN="Were you able to find out what was keeping the survey team from returning?",c="<你把勘测队的遭遇告诉了先兆者米科拉斯。他接过你带来的水晶，却沉默了很久。>\n\n他们都是好人，$n，而且他们知道自己的任务会有危险。我很感激你帮我找到他们、找回水晶。",cEN="<You tell Harbinger Mikolaas of the survey team's fate. He accepts the crystal from you, but remains silent for a long moment.>\n\nThey were good men, <name>, and they knew their mission would be dangerous. I'm grateful for your help in locating the team and recovering the crystal.\n\n<The harbinger's fists clench.>\n\nWe've lost too many good men already, and our mission has only just begun."}
Q[9629]={d="西南边海岸的黑沙鱼人是一群古怪的生物。在某些方面它们完全缺乏感知能力，然而在别的时候，它们又显示出了卓越的组织性。\n\n我对此有一些粗略的理论，但迄今为止还没有真正地对它们进行过考察。我想出了个办法，可以帮助我追踪那些我感兴趣的鱼人，而且不会造成什么严重的后果或者扰乱它们的自然行为。如果你愿意帮我去标记出这些鱼人，我非常乐意付给你一些酬劳。",dEN="The Blacksilt murlocs on the southwestern coast are curious creatures. In some ways, they act barely sentient, yet in others, they show a remarkable degree of organization.\n\nI have a few theories about that, but no real way to test them until recently. I've devised a method that will allow me to track the murlocs I'm interested in without doing any lasting harm or interfering with their natural behavior. If you're willing to help with the marking, I'll gladly pay you for your assistance.",o="秘血岗哨的莫莱希望你用鱼人标记枪去“标记”6个黑沙斥候。",oEN="Morae at Blood Watch wants you to 'mark' 6 Blacksilt Scouts using the Murloc Tagger.",p="仪器有用吗？你为我的研究标记好鱼人了吗？",pEN="Did the device work? Have you marked the murlocs for my research?",c="做得好，$n。我本来担心标记仪器会运作不良，但看来一切都有照着计划进行。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I was worried that the marking device might malfunction, but it seems like everything went according to plan."}
Q[9630]={d="$n，现在到处都在传颂着你的大名。你能在卡拉赞自由通行，这可是很多凡人做不到的。\n\n不知道我是否可以请你帮个小忙？一直以来，紫罗兰之眼都在设法寻找麦迪文的日记。\n\n不幸的是，我们派去卡拉赞的密探全都杳无音信。拉维恩是最后一位进入卡拉赞的密探，你能不能去探访他的下落，看看有没有麦迪文的日记的线索？",dEN="Your name is getting around, <name>. You've made your way into and out of Karazhan - more than most mortals can claim.\n\nI need to ask a special favor of you. As part of our research, the Violet Eye has been trying to track down Medivh's own journal.\n\nUnfortunately, none of the agents we've sent inside have come out. Wravien was the last to be sent; see if you can find him and see about any leads on the journal.",o="逆风小径的大法师奥图鲁斯要你进入卡拉赞，与拉维恩谈一谈。",oEN="Archmage Alturus at Deadwind Pass wants you to go into Karazhan and speak to Wravien.",c="真是丰富的资讯……我可以在这待上好几年！我相信达拉然会理解的……",cEN="A vast wealth of information... I could spend years here! I'm sure Dalaran will understand..."}
Q[9631]={d="我还有一个细节没有考虑到。这块龙骨碎片中蕴藏的麦迪文的精华残留物已经完全丧失了活力。换句话说，它就像阿坎纳苟斯一样，已经死了。\n\n但是，我们还有办法！我知道有个人可以帮我们解决这个难题。\n\n将焦骨碎块交给虚空风暴52区的卡琳娜·拉瑟德，她明白该怎么做。",dEN="There is a small detail I've forgotten to take into account. The residue of Medivh's essence contained in this bone fragment is completely devoid of life - just like Arcanagos.\n\nThere is a way, however. And I know just the person to help us.\n\nTravel to Area 52 in Netherstorm and show the bone fragment to Kalynna Lathred. She will know just what to do.",o="将焦骨碎块交给虚空风暴52区的卡琳娜·拉瑟德。",oEN="Take the Charred Bone Fragment to Kalynna Lathred at Area 52 in Netherstorm.",p="奥图鲁斯派你来的。星星已预测你的到来。",pEN="Alturus sent you. The stars spoke of your arrival.",c="奥图鲁斯想让整只龙死而复生？用想的就知道这不是件简单的事。\n\n让我们讨论一下该如何为彼此提供协助，$n。",cEN="Alturus wants to raise a whole dragon back from the dead? Not an easy task by any stretch of the imagination.\n\nLet us discuss how we can be of mutual assistance, <name>."}
Q[9632]={d="先行官米库拉斯保卫秘血岗哨的表现值得称赞，$c。但是我们的敌人太多，而我们的资源太少。\n\n我们的敌人非常清楚我们的弱势，可是他们还不知道你与联盟的部队有联络。我准备了一封介绍信，向离这最近的联盟居住地奥伯丁的人民示好，并提议共同对抗我们的敌人。把信带上，在埃索达西边码头附近找到女猎手凯拉·夜弓。",dEN="Harbinger Mikolaas has done a commendable job of safeguarding Blood Watch, <class>, but our enemies are many and our resources few.\n\nOur weakness is well known to our enemies, but your contact with the forces of the Alliance is something they haven't accounted for. I have prepared a letter of introduction to the people of Auberdine, the closest Alliance settlement, proposing cooperation in the fight against our foes. Take it with you and seek out Huntress Kella Nightbow near the docks west of the Exodar.",o="将介绍信交给秘蓝岛的女猎手凯拉·夜弓。",oEN="Take the Letter of Introduction to Huntress Kella Nightbow in Azuremyst Isle.",p="你好，$c。你带了什么来？",pEN="Greetings, <class>. What have you there?",c="我可以让你到达奥伯丁。你只要坐一小会儿船就可以到！",cEN="I can help you get to Auberdine. Fortunately, it's only a short boat trip away!"}
Q[9633]={d="你在码头稍等片刻，就可以看到一艘船从黑海岸的奥伯丁港口方向驶过来。等到船上的乘客都下了船你就可以上去了。\n\n经过一小段旅程之后，船将在奥伯丁靠港，你就可以去传递消息了。\n\n你最好将信交给我的一个老朋友桑迪斯·织风，他在镇里算是个备受尊敬的人。",dEN="If you wait out on the dock, you'll see the boat arriving from the port of Auberdine in Darkshore. Once it has offloaded its passengers, you'll be able to board.\n\nAfter a short journey, the boat will put in at Auberdine and you'll be able to deliver your message.\n\nIt's probably best to take this to Thundris Windweaver, an old friend of mine and a well-respected citizen of the town.",o="在女猎手凯拉·夜弓附近的码头乘船去奥伯丁。到达奥伯丁后，将介绍信交给桑迪斯·织风。",oEN="Take the boat from the dock near Huntress Kella Nightbow to Auberdine. Once you have arrived in Auberdine, take the Letter of Introduction to Thundris Windweaver.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到奥伯丁，$g朋友:朋友;。是什么风把你吹到黑海岸来的？",pEN="Welcome to Auberdine, friend. What brings you to Darkshore?",c="<桑迪斯从你手中接过信并快速地开始阅读，一边点着头。>\n\n德莱尼口中的秘蓝岛和秘血岛，在很久以前都是我的族人居住的地方。学者菲索斯和他的同胞所面临的一些威胁来自于暗夜精灵古老的敌人。\n\n我确信奥伯丁的人民愿意向我们的新盟友提供协助。等我和我的人民及哨兵谈过之后，我就会通知菲索斯。",cEN="<Thundris accepts the letter from you and reads it quickly, nodding.>\n\nThe isles the <race> call Azuremyst and Bloodmyst were inhabited long ago by my people. Some of the threats faced by Anchorite Paetheus and his brethren are ancient enemies of the night elves.\n\nI am certain that the people of Auberdine are willing to provide what aid we can to our new allies. As soon as I have spoken with the townspeople and the sentinels, I will send word to Paetheus."}
Q[9634]={d="在我们的旅行中学到的一件很重要的事情就是：遇到不同世界的野生生物时必须倍加小心。当埃索达坠毁的时候，上面装载着外域中的多种不同生物，包括一种被称作掠食者的凶猛虫类。\n\n它们中的一些已经死掉，但多数幸存了下来，在荒野中游荡。如果我们不加以阻止，它们必定会扰乱岛上的生态平衡。\n\n在凯希尔路口西边靠近海岸的地方，你可以找到许多掠食者。",dEN="One thing we've learned in our travels is that extreme care must be taken when introducing wildlife from one world to another. When the Exodar crashed, it was carrying specimens of various Outland species, including an insectoid predator called the ravager.\n\nSome of the specimens were lost, but many others survived and took to the wild. If we don't keep them in check, they will upset the natural balance here on the islands.\n\nYou'll find these ravagers to the west of Kessel's Crossing, near the coast.",o="杀掉10个秘血幼崽，然后向秘血岛凯希尔路口的雷象管理器沃克汉复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Bloodmyst Hatchlings then return to Vorkhan the Elekk Herder at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle.",p="我们一定要在掠食者开始取代秘血岛当地的捕食者前采取行动。你开始削减掠食者的数量了吗？",pEN="We must act before the ravager displaces Bloodmyst Isle's native predators. Have you begun culling the ravager population?",c="做得好，$n。掠食者数量需要再观察一阵子，但我们有了个好的开始。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The ravager population will bear watching for some time to come, but we've made a good start."}
Q[9635]={d="沼泽气体真是奇妙，能派上大用场，伙计！但首先得把它抽上来，而这，$g朋友:朋友;，就需要一台加速微尘抽取器。\n\n我本可以把图纸直接给你，但得先要点回报。来些备用零件怎么样？我上次看的时候，死沼那台坏掉的蒸汽泵旁边还堆着不少，就在东北很远的地方。\n\n我听说那些枯萎的巨人把零件撒得满干涸湖床都是。",dEN="The swamp gas is truly amazing, and can be very useful, mon! But first, you gotta be able to suck it up, and that, my friend, requires a Zapthrottle Mote Extractor.\n\nNow, I could just give you the schematics, but I'll need something in return first. How about some spare parts? Last time I checked, there were plenty laying around near the broken steam pump at the Dead Mire, far to the northeast.\n\nI heard that the withered giants spread the pieces all over that dried-out lake bed.",o="将15个蒸汽泵零件交给赞加沼泽萨布拉金的马克·迪沃。",oEN="Bring 15 Steam Pump Parts to Mack Diver at Zabra'jin in Zangarmarsh.",p="你弄到那些零件了吗？我要先忙着潜水。",pEN="You got those parts yet? I've got some diving to do.",c="很好！如果我们再有魔铁外壳，魔铁螺丝，精密奥金转换器和一些源生生命就好。然后我们就能真的做点东西了！\n\n好好好，你值得这个奖励，$n。玩的愉快！",cEN="Alright! Now if we only had a stretchy loop, a parchment clamp, a guzzle tube and some sticky duck ribbon. Then we could really make something!\n\nOk, ok, I guess you've earned this, <name>. Have fun!"}
Q[9636]={d="你见过沼气吗？就是沼泽中那种发光的气体？\n\n利用气阀微粒提取器就能提取出沼气。我可以将提取器的结构图给你，不过我需要一些蒸汽泵的零件来修理工程设备。\n\n东北方有一处死亡泥潭，泥潭中的蒸汽泵附近就散落着许多零件，我想一定是枯萎的巨人弄坏了蒸汽泵。\n\n我们以此做为交换条件如何？",dEN="Have you seen the swamp gas? Isn't it just shiny?\n\nIt takes a Zapthrottle Mote Extractor to suck 'em dry though. I could give you the plans to make one, but I really need some spare parts to fix stuff 'round here.\n\nLast time I checked, there were plenty of parts laying around near the steam pump at the Dead Mire to the northeast. I think the withered giants broke the pump out there.\n\nShall we help each other out?",o="将15个蒸汽泵零件交给赞加沼泽泰雷多尔的凯莉·弗莱。",oEN="Bring 15 Steam Pump Parts to K. Lee Smallfry at Telredor in Zangarmarsh.",p="你弄到那些零件了吗？在隐士安霍尔把我脖子扭下来之前我有一个压缩线圈要修理！",pEN="You got those parts yet? I've got a compression coil to fix before Anchorite Ahuurn starts breathing down my neck!",c="闪亮！而且真的，哪个工程师会觉得自己有足够的备用零件呢？喔，或许我可以卖掉一些多余的零件来买一些提古勒和弗洛尔的草莓冰淇淋？！我爱死草莓了！你觉得他们这附近有卖吗？\n\n好好好，我想你赢得了这个，$n。玩的愉快！",cEN="Shiny! And really, what engineer ever has enough spare parts just hanging around? Ooh, maybe I could sell off the extra and buy me some of that Tigule and Foror's Strawberry Ice Cream?! I just love strawberries! Do you think they have any around here?\n\nOk, ok, I guess you've earned this, <name>. Have fun!"}
Q[9637]={d="为了追求一些禁断的知识，我被迫离开了肯瑞托；讽刺的是，现在这帮家伙竟然请求我利用这样的知识反过来帮助他们。\n\n想要我伸出援手的话，不难。不过，你得先帮我做件事，替我取回两本书典，都是我梦寐以求的东西。\n\n第一本书是《暮色魔典》，在一个名叫奈瑟库斯的兽人术士手中；另一本是《忘却之名》，是鸦人领袖——黑暗编织者塞斯的东西。",dEN="I left the Kirin Tor in pursuit of knowledge forbidden by those of my order; it is beyond ironic that I am now asked to assist them with that very same knowledge.\n\nIf I'm to perform this favor for you, you will have to do something for me first. I want you to obtain two of the tomes I've been searching for.\n\nThe first one is called the Tome of Dusk and is owned by the orc warlock known as Nethekurse. The second, known as the Book of Forgotten Names, belongs to the arakkoa known as Darkweaver Syth.",o="从地狱火堡垒破碎大厅的高阶术士奈瑟库斯手中夺得暮色魔典，从奥金顿塞泰克大厅的黑暗编织者塞斯手中夺得忘却之名，将它们交给卡琳娜·拉瑟德。\n\n该任务必须在英雄难度下完成。",oEN="Kalynna Lathred wants you to retrieve the Tome of Dusk from Grand Warlock Nethekurse in the Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel and the Book of Forgotten Names from Darkweaver Syth in the Sethekk Halls in Auchindoun.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic difficulty.",p="你弄到我要的秘典了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the tomes I seek, <name>?",c="非常好，$n。我试图取得这些书有好久的时间了。很庆幸我们能彼此帮助。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. I've been trying to attempt these books for a very long time. It is fortunate that we were able to be of mutual assistance."}
Q[9638]={d="我的任务就是来寻找这本日记？不可能……我完全想不起来……\n\n我想起来了！你说的是格拉达夫。我来卡拉赞时就见他在找什么日记。想必他现在已经找到了，你为何不去直接问他本人呢？\n\n我不是不愿意帮你……但是这些书籍实在是太……太有趣了！",dEN="Was I supposed to be looking for this journal? It can't be... I don't quite recall...\n\nOf course! It is Gradav you're thinking of. He was looking for the book when I got here. Surely he must've found it by now; why don't you go ask him about it?\n\nI'd lend you a hand... but these books are just so... interesting!",o="与卡拉赞守护者的图书馆中的格拉达夫谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Gradav at the Guardian's Library in Karazhan.",c="你没看到我在忙吗？你要干嘛？",cEN="Can't you see I'm in the middle of something here? What do you want?"}
Q[9639]={d="日记？什么日记？你说的是卡姆希丝吧。\n\n去问她好了。我可不能中断手中的实验，不然这么路复用夫就白费了！",dEN="Journal, what journal? You're thinking of Kamsis, surely.\n\nGo and ask her about it. I can't leave my project right now or all my work will be wasted!",o="与卡拉赞守护者的图书馆中的卡姆希丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Kamsis at the Guardian's Library in Karazhan.",c="你说的日记……我被派来这里找日记的，对吧？",cEN="The journal you speak of... I was sent here to look for it wasn't I?"}
Q[9640]={d="让我想想。紫罗兰之眼……麦迪文的日记……啊，我全都想起来了。\n\n我记得在我开始阅读这些卷轴之前，就已经找到了你说的那本日记……\n\n埃兰……对，是埃兰要去了那本日记，他可真和蔼。我也只能把日记交给他咯。为什么？你难道不知道他是麦迪文的父亲吗？",dEN="Let me think for a second. The Violet Eye... Medivh's Journal... Why yes, it's all coming back to me now.\n\nI believe I had the journal you're looking for before I started to read these scrolls...\n\nAran... yes, Aran asked me for the book. So nicely too. I just had to give it to him. He's Medivh's father after all, did you know?",o="将麦迪文的日记交给卡拉赞守护者的图书馆中的卡姆希丝。",oEN="Obtain Medivh's Journal and return to Kamsis at the Guardian's Library in Karazhan.",p="你不是在找一本日记还是什么的吗？",pEN="Weren't you looking for a journal or something?",c="你找到你要找的东西了吗？你在找某个东西，对吧？",cEN="Did you find what you were looking for? You were looking for something, weren't you?"}
Q[9641]={d="埃索达的坠毁导致邪恶的水晶碎片散落在秘血岛全境，污染了水和环境。\n\n我们甚至已经在许多动物体内找到了被它们误食的水晶碎片。我找到了一个办法，可以净化碎片，并使其变成有用的水晶。如果你愿意帮我带些碎片回来，我愿意用我净化好的水晶作为交换。到当前为止，我从居住在岛上污染区的熊、掠食者、巨蛾和树人身上都找到过水晶碎片。",dEN="The Exodar's crash scattered pieces of fouled crystals all over Bloodmyst Isle, corrupting the water and the landscape.\n\nWe've even begun finding pieces of the crystals inside the flesh of animals taken for meat. I've uncovered a way to purify the shard and turn them into functional crystals, so if you bring me enough shards, I'll trade one of my completed crystals for them. So far I've found the shards in the bodies of bears, ravagers, flutterers, and treants inhabiting the corrupted part of the island.",o="秘血岗哨的守备官波鲁斯希望你帮他收集10块辐射水晶碎片。",oEN="Vindicator Boros at Blood Watch wants you to bring him 10 Irradiated Crystal Shards.",p="你从秘血岛的生物身上收集到水晶碎片了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered crystal shards from the creatures of Bloodmyst?",c="做得好。这些会为另一批增强水晶提供纯原材料。\n\n从我制作的三种水晶中选择一种吧，我发现它们对追踪不同的猎物各有所长。",cEN="Well done. These will provide the raw materials for another batch of enhancement crystals.\n\nYou're welcome to choose from among the three kinds of crystals I can make. I find each of them useful for stalking different kinds of prey."}
Q[9642]={p="如果你有更多辐射水晶碎片，我很乐意和你交换。",pEN="If you have more of the irradiated crystal shards, I'd be happy to exchange them for another of my crystals.",c="非常好，这里是我的水晶，$n。好好使用它们。",cEN="Very well, here are the crystals that I have, <name>. Use them well."}
Q[9643]={d="一个聪明的猎手善于利用一切资源，$c。即便是最怪异的生物也拥有着我们可充分利用的特征。\n\n秘血岗哨不断地遭到炎鹰部队的攻击，我们正借助包括陷阱在内的多种自然防御方法来增强防卫。我觉得鞭笞者的荆棘藤蔓非常适合制作陷阱，锋利的刺和致命的毒药一定可以将毫无戒备的攻击者致于死地。给我带些变异的荆棘巨藤回来，我就可以开始制作陷阱了。",dEN="A good woodsman makes use of every available resource, <class>. Even the most bizarre creatures possess attributes we can use to our advantage.\n\nWith Blood Watch under constant assault from the Sunhawks, we're looking to a variety of natural defenses including traps. The lasher's thorny vines are perfectly suited to the construction of the traps I have in mind. The combination of sharp spines and deadly toxin will fell unwary attackers. Bring me the vines of mutated constrictors so that I can begin my work.",o="秘血岗哨的追踪者兰塞恩希望你帮他收集6根荆棘巨藤。",oEN="Tracker Lyceon at Blood Watch wants you to bring him 6 Thorny Constrictor Vines.",p="你弄到巨藤了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to get the constrictor vines?",c="这些看来够坚固可以拿来用。谢谢你的帮忙，$n。你对秘血岗哨防御的贡献不会被遗忘的。",cEN="These seem sturdy enough to do the job. Thank you for your help, <name>. Your contribution to Blood Watch's defense will not be forgotten."}
Q[9644]={d="你完成了契约中规定的义务。我将把你的灵魂和那条死去的蓝龙绑定在一起。\n\n在主宰的露台上有一罐骨灰，碰触那罐骨灰，就可以释放出里面的能量，令阿坎纳苟斯的焦骨碎块复生。击败复生后的阿坎纳苟斯，你就可以得到奥图鲁斯一直想要的精华了。\n\n但是，不要高兴得太早，星相显示你根本无法成功复活阿坎纳苟斯。事实上，这个法术只会将那些骸骨组合某个极度恐怖的生物。\n\n是的，那就是骨龙夜之魇！",dEN="You fulfilled your end of the deal. I will now bind your essence to that of the dead blue dragon.\n\nThere is an urn in the Master's Terrace, should you touch that urn, you'll now release its energy anl bring life back to the charred remains of Arcanagos. Defeat the creature and retrieve its essence immediately! You will need to take it to Alturus.\n\nShould you fail, the stars predict you will have let a great terror loose upon the skies.\n\nA terror known as Nightbane!",o="进入卡拉赞的主宰的露台，碰触黑色骨灰，召唤夜之魇并杀死它，然后从夜之魇的尸体上取得暗淡的奥术精华，并将它交给大法师奥图鲁斯。",oEN="Go to the Master's Terrace in Karazhan and touch the Blackened Urn to summon Nightbane. Retrieve the Faint Arcane Essence from Nightbane's corpse and bring it to Archmage Alturus.",p="你带来了什么消息呢，$n？",pEN="What news do you bring, <name>?",c="这太惊人了！你不仅带回了麦迪文的日记，还取回了他本体的一缕精华。\n\n这缕残留的精华虽然微弱，却能向我们揭示关于麦迪文的关键情报。我们不会忘记这件事的，。$n",cEN="This is astounding! Not only have you brought back Medivh's Journal, but you've also retrieved a fragment of his very essence.\n\nAs faint as this lingering essence is, it will reveal to us vital information about Medivh. We will not forget this, <class>."}
Q[9645]={d="日记？什么日记？\n\n哦，对了。那本日记！紫罗兰之眼派我来卡拉赞寻找的那本日记。我全都想起来了。\n\n<卡姆希丝将日记翻到了某一页。>\n\n这就是奥图鲁斯感兴趣的内容。你知道吗？别人的日记是记录回忆的工具，而麦迪文的日记就是他的回忆本身。\n\n试试吧，去主宰的露台阅读这本日记以后，你就会明白我的意思了。然后，你替我把这本麦迪文的日记交给奥图鲁斯，我还想在这里多待上一阵子。",dEN="Journal? What journal?\n\nOh, right. That journal! The Violet Eye sent me here for it. It's all coming back now.\n\n<Kamsis points to a page in the journal.>\n\nThis is the page that Alturus is interested in. Did you know that while other people's journals serve as a record of their memories, Medivh's is literally just that?\n\nTry it. Go to the Master's Terrace and read the page; you'll see just what I mean. Might as well report to Alturus while you're at it. I'm afraid I'll be here for a while.",o="进入卡拉赞的主宰的露台，阅读麦迪文的日记。完成任务后将麦迪文的日记交给大法师奥图鲁斯。",oEN="Go to the Master's Terrace in Karazhan and read Medivh's Journal. Return to Archmage Alturus with Medivh's Journal after completing this task.",p="你回来了！你带来了什么消息？",pEN="You've returned! What news do you bring?",c="我们派去的密探屈服于卡拉赞的魔法真是一件可耻的事。至少你设法取得了他们寻找的东西。",cEN="It is a shame that the agents we sent succumbed to Karazhan's magic. At least you managed to obtain what they were after."}
Q[9646]={d="根据先行官米库拉斯的命令，凡是能证明自己杀掉了凶猛的棕熊死爪的勇士都将获得18枚银币的奖赏。\n\n死爪是一头极度危险的野兽，他在秘血岗哨西北边海岸杀死了一整支勘测队。旅行者应避免涉足那一带。",dEN="By order of Harbinger Mikolaas: A bounty of 18 silver to be paid to the brave soul who returns with proof of the marauding bear Deathclaw's demise.\n\nDeathclaw should be considered extremely dangerous and is responsible for the killing of a survey team on the coast to the northwest of Blood Watch. Travelers are advised to avoid the area.",o="将死爪的爪子交给秘血岗哨的先行官米库拉斯。",oEN="Bring Deathclaw's Paw to Harbinger Mikolaas in Blood Watch.",p="有什么我能帮忙的吗，$c？",pEN="How can I help you, <class>?",c="做得好。据我所知，这不是场好打的仗。你不仅赢得你的奖励，还获得了我们的尊重，$n。",cEN="Well done. From what I've heard, it couldn't have been an easy fight. You've more than earned your reward, <name>."}
Q[9647]={d="当我们第一次见到巨蛾时，它们身上已经出现了一些堕落的迹象，然后情况就变得越来越糟……\n\n现在事情已经发展到它们开始破坏一切的地步。它们的这种行为都是受了埃索达坠毁后散落的水晶碎片的影响。我们没有其它办法，只能杀掉秘血岗哨北边的巨蛾。",dEN="When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination.\n\nIt has progressed to the point where they damage nearly everything they come in contact with. They're amplifying the damage being done by the crystal shards scattered by the Exodar's crash. We have no choice but to begin culling their population in the lands north of Blood Watch.",o="秘血岗哨的追踪者兰塞恩要你杀掉10只鲜艳的蓝翼巨蛾。",oEN="Tracker Lyceon at Blood Watch wants you to kill 10 Royal Blue Flutterers.",p="你剔除掉那些蛀虫了没？",pEN="Have you culled the moths?",c="待这段时间过去，我们必须想出一个办法来让这些物种恢复他们原本的状态，但现在定期地削减他们的数量仍是最好的方法。谢谢你的帮忙，$n。",cEN="In time, we'll have to devise a plan for returning the species to its native state, but for now, periodically culling their numbers is about the best we can hope for. Thank you for your help, <name>."}
Q[9648]={d="你知道吗，去寻找采集蘑菇比吃下蘑菇要危险得多？蘑菇采集者常常会身陷未知的险境，而且还有隐藏在黑暗中的猛兽的威胁！\n\n如果生活中一点危险都没有，那该是怎样的一番体验呢？我需要收集一些蘑菇。在这片还未被探索过的荒野中，你可以找到四种不同类型的蘑菇：水生臭角菇、血蘑菇、致命孢子簇和邪锥蘑菇。它们是秘血岛的不同区域所特有的物种。把这些蘑菇带回来给我。",dEN="Did you know mushroom hunting is far more dangerous than mushroom consumption? Mushroom hunters expose themselves to many unknowns - not including potential wildlife dangers!\n\nWhat would life be without a little danger? I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus. They are each unique to various regions in Bloodmyst. Bring them to me.",o="玛凯雷的耶塞拉希望你找到一个水生臭角菇、一个血蘑菇、一个致命孢子簇和一个邪锥蘑菇。",oEN="Jessera of Mac'Aree at Blood Watch wants 1 Aquatic Stinkhorn, 1 Blood Mushroom, 1 Ruinous Polyspore, and 1 Fel Cone Fungus.",p="记住，我所要的蘑菇都是秘血岛上独特的品种。",pEN="Remember, the mushrooms I requested are each unique to the different environments of Bloodmyst.",c="嗯，我有警告你——对吧？希望这些东西能补偿你经历的一些不安。等你恢复力量再来找我，或许我会有另一个工作给你——当然是跟蘑菇有关的！",cEN="Well, I did warn you - did I not? Hopefully this payment more than makes up for the mild discomfort that you may have suffered. Return to me when you have gained strength and perhaps I will have another job for you - mushrooms of course!"}
Q[9649]={d="很高兴又见到你，$n！你上次完成我交付的任务时效率高得出奇。也许你对另一件事也会感兴趣？\n\n东北方是 Wormscar 岛——抱歉，是巨龙伤痕岛，那里生长着一种名为伊瑟拉之泪的稀有蘑菇，得名于岛上栖息的绿色雏龙。我只需要一小份蘑菇样本，但我必须提醒你，岛上的居民并不欢迎访客。小心行事。|n",dEN="Good to see you again, <name>! You were exceptionally efficient in completing the last task that I offered you. Perhaps you would be interested in another?\n\nTo the northeast lies Wyrmscar Island, home to a rare species of mushroom known as Ysera's tear - named after the green dragonlings that inhabit the island. I only require a small sampling of the mushroom, but I must warn you that the denizens of the island do not welcome visitors. Tread carefully.",o="玛凯雷的耶塞拉希望你找到2个伊瑟拉之泪。",oEN="Jessera of Mac'Aree at Blood Watch wants 2 Ysera's Tears.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back so soon?",c="我希望这不是个太费力的工作，$n。你再一次地证明了自己是个能干又谨慎的$r。我向你表达我的感谢并提供一点金币上的报酬。",cEN="I hope this wasn't too strenuous a task, <name>. Once again you have proven yourself a competent and considerate <race>. I offer my gratitude and a small bit of monetary compensation."}
Q[9663]={d="你来得正好，$n。过去的一个星期里，血精灵在这片地区的活动变得更加猖獗。我们的密探报告说，那些自称炎鹰部队的血精灵近期会袭击秘蓝岛。我需要你去通知我们的同盟和同胞。\n\n通知止松要塞的止松老酋长、碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯和奥德修斯营地的海军上将奥德修斯。\n\n事情非常紧急，所以我把我的雷象借给你。记住，一定要让它远离水域。",dEN="You're just in time, <name>. Blood elf activity in this area has doubled in the past week. Our agents have informed us that the blood elves that call themselves Sunhawks plan to launch an offensive upon Azuremyst soon. I need you to get a warning out to our allies and compatriots.\n\nWarn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing.\n\nTime is of the essence so I am lending you my elekk. Be sure to keep it out of water.",o="凯希尔路口的凯希尔要你把血精灵即将入侵的消息通知给止松要塞的止松老酋长、碧蓝岗哨的大主教梅内莱厄斯和奥德修斯营地的海军上将奥德修斯。你只有15分钟的时间。（记住让雷象远离水体。）",oEN="Kessel at Kessel's Crossing wants you to warn High Chief Stillpine at Stillpine Hold, Exarch Menelaous at Azure Watch and Admiral Odesyus at Odesyus' Landing of the imminent blood elf invasion. Return to Kessel when you complete this task. You have 15 minutes. (Be sure to keep it out of water.)",p="没有时间松懈了！",pEN="This is no time to relax!",c="做得好，$n。这个困难的试验考验着你的能力，但是你的成绩非常亮眼。要成为一个阿古斯之手的士兵，你一定要通过许多这样的考验。",cEN="Well done, <name>. This was a difficult test of your abilities, but you have passed with flying colors. To become a soldier of the Hand of Argus, you must pass many such tests."}
Q[9666]={d="你见过那些蛇人吗？那些称自己为纳迦的家伙？\n\n〈凯希尔轻蔑地说。〉\n\n他们趁着天黑，在三天前攻击了这个营地。你能相信那些野兽们的胆子居然有这样大吗？\n\n我想让你去教训教训他们的首领，$n。东北边的怒鳞巢穴是克希兹领主的老窝。找到他，在那里把他干掉，然后将这面旗帜插在他的尸体上。\n\n让他们在我们的军旗前感到恐惧吧！",dEN="Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga?\n\n<Kessel spits.>\n\nThey dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago. Can you believe the audacity of those primitive beasts?\n\nI need you to deliver a message to their leadership, <name>. To the northeast is Wrathscale Lair, home to Lord Xiz. Find him, slay him where he stands and drive this banner through his corpse.\n\nLet them know fear whenever they should see our standard!",o="秘血岛凯希尔路口的凯希尔要你杀掉怒鳞巢穴的克希兹领主，并将德莱尼军旗插在他的尸体上。",oEN="Kessel at Kessel's Crossing on Bloodmyst Isle wants you to kill Lord Xiz at Wrathscale Lair and drive the Draenei Banner through his dead body.",p="完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="我很抱歉你得这么做，$n。用武力去压制不是德莱尼的做法——但有的时候这是唯一的方法。\n\n这是人生的其中一个真理，许多人了解的时候已经来不及了。当我们被兽人屠杀的时候，这么做是为了我们的人民。\n\n成为一个阿古斯之手就像重生，而重生总伴随着痛楚……",cEN="I am sorry that you had to do that, <name>. Heavy-handed violence is not the <race> way, but sometimes it is the only way.\n\nThis is one of life's truths that many do not understand until it is too late. So it was for our people, when we were slaughtered at the hands of the orcs.\n\nBecoming a Hand of Argus is a process of rebirth. And with birth comes pain..."}
Q[9667]={d="救救我，$n！刺肢熊怪抓住了我，打算把我献祭给他们那些邪神！\n\n大酋长刺肢保管着打开这个笼子的钥匙。要逼他现身，你必须杀死西边仅两个营地之外的邪恶刺肢熊怪。只要你杀得够多，他一定会来复仇！他一出现，就杀了他，夺下钥匙！\n\n如果你能救我，我父亲会重重酬谢你！",dEN="Help me, <name>! The Bristlelimb captured me and are planning to sacrifice me to their foul gods!\n\nHigh Chief Bristlelimb holds the key that opens the cage. To force him to appear, you must slaughter the evil Bristlelimb furbolgs that inhabit the enclave, just two camps to the west of this camp. If you kill enough of them, he will surely come for vengeance! When he shows up, kill him and get the key!\n\nMy father will richly reward you if you can save me!",o="将止松公主救出牢笼，然后与秘血岗哨的止松大使弗拉萨布谈一谈。\n\n你必须杀掉刺臂酋长才能拿到牢笼的钥匙。",oEN="Release Princess Stillpine from her cage and then speak with Stillpine Ambassador Frasaboo at Blood Watch.\n\nYou must kill High Chief Bristlelimb for the key that opens the cage.",p="我时间不多了，$n。他们很快就会杀了我……",pEN="I don't have much longer, <name>. They will kill me soon...",c="你再一次的证明你就是预言中的英雄人物。大酋长永远的感激你$n——还有这些止松圣物可供你选择……",cEN="Once again you have proven yourself to be all that was prophesied. You have the eternal gratitude of the high chief <name> -- and these Stillpine relics to choose from..."}
Q[9668]={d="阿古斯之手的将士严守军令、有勇有谋，更重要的是，他们个个倍受尊敬。$c，某些优点在你身上已经初具雏形了。\n\n如果你有志加入阿古斯之手，就向秘血岗哨的主教埃德门图斯报到吧。他和他的属下会将你训练成一名合格的德莱尼士兵。\n\n$n，记住：倍受尊敬的人的行事之道有时可能并非你所想的那样。\n\n沿着这条道路往北走就到秘血岗哨了。",dEN="A Hand of Argus soldier is many things: Obedient, brave, intelligent, and above all, honorable. You may yet exhibit some of these traits, <class>.\n\nReport to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch if you are still interested in joining the Hand. He and his subordinates will further train you in the ways of the draenei soldier.\n\nAnd remember this, <name>: Honorable people do not always perform honorably. Sometimes they cannot.\n\nYou will find Blood Watch just up this road, to the north.",o="与秘血岗哨的主教埃德门图斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch.",c="我有预感你能一直撑到现在，$c。如果你愿意继续往前走，我很乐意指导你……",cEN="I had a feeling that you would make it this far, <class>. If you are willing to go further, I am willing to teach you..."}
Q[9669]={d="一个星期前，我和我的远征队正在秘血岛西部的荒野中勘察时，遭到了嗜血蜘蛛的袭击。水晶造成的腐蚀影响在它们身上表现得很明显，这些蜘蛛变得巨大且极具攻击性。\n\n我逃了出来，但是我的队员就没那么幸运了。我们不能让其它人也遭受同样的悲惨命运，去西边的琥珀蛛网小径，杀掉那些蜘蛛和它们的首领萨拉肯。",dEN="About a week ago, my research team and I were out exploring the western wilds of Bloodmyst when we were attacked by bloodthirsty spiders. The effect of the crystal contamination was clearly evident as these spiders were massive and extremely aggressive.\n\nI managed to escape but my team wasn't so lucky. We must not let the same fate befall others. Go west to the Amberweb Pass and destroy the spiders and their matriarch, Zarakh.",o="杀掉8个秘网编织者、8个秘网吸血者和它们的首领萨拉肯。任务完成后向秘血岗哨的阿彻鲁斯复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Myst Spinners, 8 Myst Leechers and their leader, Zarakh. Return to Achelus at Blood Watch when the task is complete.",p="那是场可怕的灾难……",pEN="It was a terrible mess...",c="不可思议！你找到幸存者了吗？\n\n<阿凯鲁斯压低了声音，几乎成了耳语。>\n\n说实话，$n，再没有别人愿意接下这个任务了。你是个勇敢的$c……<Achelus baja la voz hasta quedarse en un susurro.>$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Incredible! Did you find any survivors?\n\n<Achelus lowers his voice to a whisper.>\n\nI'll be honest, <name>; nobody else was willing to take on this mission. You are a brave <class>..."}
Q[9670]={d="那是一场血淋淋的混乱，$n。我们被一大群这种蜘蛛伏击了。它们的母体以惊人的速度扑向我们，把我们裹进了茧里。\n\n被蛛网缠住之后，她开始在我们旁边产卵。我们本来是要当她幼崽的食物！食物！\n\n我割开蛛网逃了出来，但我不会丢下其他人。到现在我都没能靠近那个隘口。你愿意搭把手吗？\n\n把那些茧全部毁掉！但愿还有几位同伴活着！|n",dEN="It was a bloody mess, <name>. We were ambushed by a large pack of these spiders. Their progenitor descended upon us with incredible speed and wrapped us up in cocoons.\n\nAfter we were webbed, she began to lay eggs near us. We were to be food for her young! FOOD!\n\nI managed to cut my way out and escape but I will not leave the others behind. So far I've been unsuccessful in nearing the pass. Would you lend a hand?\n\nDestroy those cocoons! Hopefully some of our team is still alive!",o="研究员考内留斯要你救出5个远征队研究员。",oEN="Researcher Cornelius has asked that you free 5 Expedition Researchers.",p="运气如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="你救了超过一半的队员！你的英勇行为绝对会传回秘血岗哨和主教那里的。再次谢谢你，$n。",cEN="You rescued over half the team! Word of your deed will definitely get back to Blood Watch and the exarch. Thanks again, <name>."}
Q[9671]={c="你是$n？是时候了！我正准备要放弃找你了！\n\n邮箱里有个紧急的讯息在等着你。给我的那个人是一个秘蓝岛来的人类舰队司令。舰队司令·奥迪席什么的……我忘记名字了。他说你知道他是谁。\n\n<赫米瑟斯耸耸肩。>",cEN="Are you <name>? It's about time! I'd just about given up on finding you!\n\nThere's an urgent message waiting for you at the mailbox. The person that gave it to me was a human admiral from Azuremyst. Admiral Odesy-something... the name escapes me. He said you would know who he was.\n\n<Hermesius shrugs.>"}
Q[9672]={d="$g亲爱的朋友:亲爱的朋友;：\n\n写这封信时我的手在发抖。我祈祷它能及时送到你手上。\n\n昨夜，“迷失的希望号”船长爱德华·海恩斯出现在我的帐篷前。就是二十年前死于坏血病的那个爱德华·海恩斯。\n\n这个幽灵给我讲了一个让我心胆俱寒的故事。我需要你听听它，并完成一项使命。你愿意吗？你愿意去你基地东北方的巨龙伤痕岛寻找爱德华吗？\n\n谨致问候，\n\n奥德修斯上将|n",dEN="Dear friend,\n\nMy hand trembles as I ink this letter. I pray that it reaches you in time.\n\nLast night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.\n\nThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of your base?\n\nRegards,\n\nAdmiral Odesyus",o="海军上将奥德修斯要你找到艾德华·汉斯船长，然后与他谈一谈。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes.",c="你听说过血咒吗，$g旱鸭子:旱鸭子;？没有，你当然没听说过。血咒就是弄沉所有这些船的东西。这里那片腐坏、被亵渎的水域叫做血咒暗礁——一个你绝不会想去的地方。我自己在这儿待了二十年。\n\n坏血病？呸！我死在这片荒凉的海岸上，成了龙的食物……啊，不过那是另一个故事了。眼下，我们得去救那些困在暗礁里的可怜灵魂。",cEN="Have you heard of the bloodcurse, landlubber? No, of course you haven't. The bloodcurse is what sunk all these ships. The spoiled, desecrated part of the water here is known as Bloodcursed Reef - a part of the world you never want to visit. I've been here myself for 20 years.\n\nScurvy my foot! I died on these wild shores as food for the dragons... Ah, but that's another story for another time. Right now, we have to help the poor souls that are trapped in that reef."}
Q[9673]={d="在你和你所选中的宠物能够良好地配合作战之外，还有许多有关宠物的训练和照料事宜等着你去了解和学习呢。银月城的野兽训练师哈森尼斯会教你如何处理的。\n\n只要我的学生也能尊重他，那么他总是愿意付出同等的尊重。去找他吧，别让我失望。",dEN="Beyond bonding with your chosen pet, there remains the intricacies of caring and training it. For this, Halthenis the beast trainer of Silvermoon City can show you the way.\n\nHe always shows the utmost respect for my students, if they do the same for him. Do not disappoint me.",o="与银月城的哈森尼斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Halthenis in Silvermoon City.",c="所以你已经学了一点东西，是吗？\n\n<海德尼斯仔细地看着你。>\n\n你可以用新学习的技能对这城市和所有人的福祉有所贡献。让我教你如何训练你的宠物做一些有趣的花招，像是挖出敌人的内脏，然后你就可以走了。",cEN="So you've learned a bit, have you?\n\n<Halthenis looks at you carefully.>\n\nYou'll serve the city, and our greater cause, well with your newly-learned skills. Allow me a moment to show you how to train your pet to do some interesting tricks, like disemboweling your enemy, and you can be on your way."}
Q[9674]={d="他们说当世界分崩离析的时候，这片土地放声痛哭。无数的暗夜精灵坠入湮灭的深渊，被扭曲成一种令人憎恶的怪物——纳迦。\n\n他们听命于扭曲的女王艾萨拉，所有从他们的海域中经过的人都会被杀死。从几千年前到现在一直都是这样——直到今天。\n\n你要做的第一件事就是消灭掉暗礁中的血咒纳迦。",dEN="They say when the world was sundered, this land cried the loudest. It was here that thousands of night elves faded into oblivion and in their place rose terrible creatures of hate - the naga.\n\nObedient to their twisted queen, Azshara, they would destroy all that would dare pass through their sea. It would remain this way for thousands of years - until now.\n\nThe first order of business is to remove the bloodcursed naga from the reef.",o="巨龙伤痕岛的船长爱德华·海恩斯要你杀死10名血咒纳迦。|n",oEN="Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to kill 10 Bloodcursed Naga.",p="他们是恶心的生物……",pEN="They're nasty creatures...",c="这是一个好的开始，但还有很多事要做！",cEN="A good start, but there's much more to be done!"}
Q[9675]={d="哦，还有一件事！你应该去找一下埃索达的甘纳尔。他会教你许多有关照顾和训练宠物的知识。\n\n他就在贸易阶梯的西南角。",dEN="Oh, one more thing! You'll want to speak with Ganaar at the Exodar. He'll be able to teach you the last bits of knowledge necessary to care for your pet and train it.\n\nYou can find him in the southwest corner of the Traders Tier.",o="与埃索达贸易阶梯内的甘纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ganaar at the Traders Tier of the Exodar.",c="懂得如何喂养和复活你死去的宠物，并不像你上一位老师轻描淡写所说的那样，只是\"额外的调剂\"。更重要的是，训练能让你的宠物以自身无法做到的方式成长。\n\n我已经从熊怪那里学到了许多，所以仔细听好，我把这些知识传授给你。",cEN="Knowing how to feed and revive your pet from death is not just an extra \"tidbit\" as your last teacher so mildly put it. Even more so, training allows your pet to improve in ways they couldn't have on their own.\n\nI've already learned much from the furbolgs, so pay attention and I'll pass the knowledge on to you."}
Q[9677]={d="$n，你在初期训练中表现出色，在那些即将成为血骑士的人中脱颖而出。你已经$g准备好:准备好;进入下一阶段的训练，为此，骑士领主布拉德瓦罗本人要求与你谈谈。\n\n我毫不怀疑骑士领主布拉德瓦罗想为你设下一场试炼，考验你的能力与训练成果。你会在银月城远行者广场的血骑士总部找到他。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="<name>, you have excelled in your early training and distinguished yourself among those who would become Blood Knights. You are ready to undertake the next phase of your training and, to that end, Knight-Lord Bloodvalor himself has asked to speak with you.\n\nI have no doubt that Knight-Lord Bloodvalor wishes to set a trial for you to test your abilities and training. You will find him in the Blood Knight headquarters in Silvermoon City's Farstriders' Square. I wish you well, <name>.",o="与银月城远行者广场的骑士领主布拉德瓦罗谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Farstriders' Square in Silvermoon City.",c="欢迎，年轻的$g新兵:新兵;。你如此迅速地回应我的召唤，对你自己是个好兆头。\n\n那我们就免去客套吧，那种事最好留给廷臣之流去做。\n\n你的飞速进步引起了我的注意，$n。我们要看看你是否把这些课程真正记在了心里。",cEN="Welcome, young initiate. That you have answered my summons so promptly bodes well for you.\n\nLet us dispense with pleasantries, then, as they are best left to courtiers and their ilk.\n\nYour rapid progress has caught my attention, <name>. We will see if you have taken your lessons to heart."}
Q[9678]={d="你已经学习过许多关于战斗与牺牲这方面的事了，见习骑士。但你还有更多的东西需要掌握。\n\n对圣光的理解与掌握需要你拥有高度集中的精神和坚固而强大的意志力。没有这些，你至多只能算是个比一般的街头小混混略强一点的小人物而已。\n\n在幽魂之地的东北边界附近有一座小岛，名叫苦难岛，我们一般都在那里磨砺自己的技艺。你会在那里的一处洞穴中找到一只火盆。跪在火盆前，点亮它，并集中精神，看看你眼前会发生什么吧。",dEN="You have learned much of combat and bloodshed, initiate, but there is much more to our order.\n\nMastery of the Light requires a focused mind and tremendous willpower. Without these, you are little better than a street thug.\n\nThere is an island in the northeastern reaches of the Ghostlands, called the Isle of Tribulations, that we use to hone these skills. You will find a brazier within a shallow cave there. Kneel before the brazier, light it, and focus on what you see before your eyes.",o="转至骑士领主布拉德瓦罗所描述的那座小岛，找到洞穴，并点亮火盆。当第一个试炼完成之后，向银月城的骑士领主布拉德瓦罗复命。",oEN="Travel to the island Knight-Lord Bloodvalor described, find the cave, and light the brazier. When the First Trial is over, return to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Silvermoon City.",p="愿圣光的力量在你每次的奋战中都为你所用。",pEN="May the Light bend to your will in all endeavors.",c="我知道你在想什么。\n\n没错，我派静刃去杀你。\n\n这不是冒犯，$n，这是个必要的测试。血骑士是一个兄弟会，但我们务必要确定我们的兄弟保持警戒并且随时准备应付突发状况。一定要杀死静刃才能让你了解这个意义吗？\n\n是的，而且那就和你任何的武器训练一样重要。",cEN="I know what must be going through your mind.\n\nYes, I sent Stillblade to kill you.\n\nDo not take offense, <name>; it was a necessary test. The Blood Knights are a brotherhood, but we must ensure that our brothers are alert and prepared at all times. Was it necessary to take Stillblade's life to make the point to you?\n\nYes, and that is as much a part of your training as any sword drill."}
Q[9680]={d="卡姆希丝说得对！这里面的内容至关重要。\n\n你看，这里写道，当时麦迪文将自身生命的精华与他所施展的法术相融合，击败了蓝龙阿坎纳苟斯。如果这是真的，那就意味着我们有很大的机会从蓝龙的尸骸中分离出麦迪文的生命精华的残留物质。天啊，这逆风小径中，竟掩藏着这样伟大的未知奥秘，等待着世人发觉。\n\n你立刻到卡拉赞之塔南方的山脉中去取回一块龙骨的碎片回来。",dEN="Kamsis was right! This information is extremely important.\n\nIf Medivh weaved his own essence into the magic he used to defeat the dragon, it is quite possible we could retrieve even a faint residue of that essence from the dragon's remains. What great insight may lie beneath the ashes of Deadwind Pass, awaiting discovery.\n\nGo to the mountains south of Karazhan and bring me back a bone fragment of seemingly draconic origin.",o="大法师奥图鲁斯要求你转至逆风小径，从卡拉赞以南的山脉中取回一块焦骨碎块。",oEN="Archmage Alturus wants you to go to the mountains south of Karazhan in Deadwind Pass and retrieve a Charred Bone Fragment.",p="你取回我要的骨头碎片了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you retrieved the bone fragment I require, <name>?",c="太棒了！虽然这个碎片很小，但它充满了能量，我可以感觉的到！",cEN="Excellent! Though small in size, this fragment is teeming with energy, I can feel it!"}
Q[9681]={d="不要认为我这样做很过分，$n。桑利亚斯·静刃很清楚地知道他被派过去的使命。他充分理解并接受了他的职责，他是所有热诚而积极的血骑士所要学习的榜样。\n\n我在这里说的话可不是在为他歌功颂德，$n。桑利亚斯·静刃对我们的卓越贡献远比这些要伟大，而你则是他获得新生的工具。\n\n你当前所学习到的所有圣光之道，不过是些上不得厅堂的小把戏小伎俩而已。在凯尔萨斯背叛了我们，并且夺走了我们的能量源之后，你必须学习掌控圣光的新方法。立刻去找阿斯塔洛·血誓吧。",dEN="Do not think me unduly harsh, <name>. Stillblade knew well what he was being sent to do. He understood and accepted his duty and is an example for all aspiring Blood Knights.\n\nMy words are no eulogy, <name>. Stillblade's service to us is far from over and you will be the instrument of his resurrection.\n\nYour education in the order's ways has just begun. With the betrayal of Kael'thas and the loss of our power source, you must learn new methods of wielding the Light. Seek out Magister Astalor Bloodsworn.",o="与血骑士总部楼下密室中的魔导师阿斯塔洛·血誓谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Magister Astalor Bloodsworn in the hidden chamber beneath Blood Knight headquarters.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;，年轻的$n。\n\n血骑士的力量取自一个拥有强大力量的存在。\n\n<魔导师指向房间中央那个巨大的被囚禁者。>\n\n是不是很壮观？这是我们敬爱的凯尔萨斯王子赐下的礼物，也是血骑士掌控圣光的根基。这个生物吝于借出它的力量，所以我们想出了一个按我们自己的条件夺取力量的办法。",cEN="Welcome, young <class>.\n\nThe power of the Blood Knights is taken from a being of immense power.\n\n<The magister gestures to the large, captive being in the center of the room.>\n\nIsn't it magnificent? 'Twas a gift from our beloved Prince Kael'thas, and it is the foundation of the Blood Knights' mastery of the Light. This creature begrudges us its power, so we have devised a method for claiming it on our own terms."}
Q[9682]={d="在比你找到血咒纳迦的地方更深的暗礁中，你会发现那些绝望的血咒航海者，那些被血咒夺去生命的灵魂。\n\n我现在要你做的事情会让人感到悲痛……但他们必须被消灭，把他们被诅咒的躯壳带回来给我。\n\n他们的灵魂必须得到安息。完成我交代的事情后回来找我，我还有最后一件事要麻烦你帮忙。",dEN="On a ledge of the reef, deeper than where you found the bloodcursed naga, you will find the hopeless ones: The bloodcursed voyagers, ghosts of those taken by the bloodcurse.\n\nIt is regrettable, what I ask of you now... but they must be destroyed and their cursed shells brought back to me.\n\nTheir souls must be put to rest. Return to me when you have done as asked and I shall give you one final task.",o="龙痕岛的艾德华·汉斯船长要你找到4个血咒之魂。",oEN="Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to recover 4 Bloodcursed Souls.",p="不必为他们的死亡哀悼，$n。",pEN="Do not mourn their demise, <name>.",c="你帮了绝望者一个大忙，$n。不过还有最后一个任务：杀死血咒的领导者。",cEN="You have done the hopeless ones a great service, <name>. There is but one final task: Destroy the leader of the Bloodcursed."}
Q[9683]={d="你可以在南边找到血咒岛。岛上的神殿供奉着纳迦女王艾萨拉的雕像。毁掉那座雕像，把它彻底烧掉！这一定会让血咒部族的首领埃托弗极其愤怒。\n\n杀掉埃托弗，然后回来找我！",dEN="To the south you will find Bloodcurse Isle. Atop the island you will find a shrine dedicated to the beloved queen of the naga, Azshara. Destroy the statue - burn it in effigy! This will surely draw the ire of Atoph, the Bloodcursed leader.\n\nSlay Atoph and return to me!",o="龙痕岛的艾德华·汉斯船长要你毁掉艾萨拉女王的雕像，并杀掉血咒者埃托弗。",oEN="Captain Edward Hanes on Wyrmscar Island wants you to destroy the Statue of Queen Azshara and kill Atoph the Bloodcursed.",p="一定要把阿托夫引诱出来！",pEN="Atoph must be lured out!",c="你成功了！几百个灵魂都对你所做的一切感激不尽。\n\n让我给你一个礼物……",cEN="You did it! Hundreds of souls are grateful for all that you have done.\n\nAllow me to make an offering..."}
Q[9684]={d="拿着这只瓶子，$n。启动其中的魔法，你就可以吸取这些魔导师身上残存的光明能量。他们曾经负责控制那个被我们捕获的纳鲁，因此纳鲁的能量还有一部分留在他们体内。\n\n这应该就足以让你的伙伴起死回生了。\n\n不用为这些魔导师担心，$n。我正在照料他们，而且索拉纳·血怒大人向我保证过，莉亚德琳大人正在积极寻找新的能量源。",dEN="Take this vessel, <name>. The enchantment it bears will allow you to draw the last vestiges of the Light surrounding these magisters. They once tended the captive naaru and some of its energy yet remains within them.\n\nIt will be just enough to restore your comrade to life.\n\nDo not worry about the magisters, <name>. I have seen to their care, and Lord Solanar assures me that Lady Liadrin seeks a new source of power even now.",o="用血精灵魔导师身上的能量装满微光容器，然后向银月城的骑士领主布拉德瓦罗复命。",oEN="Use the Shimmering Vessel on the Blood Elf Magisters to fill it and return to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Silvermoon City.",p="你和博学者阿斯塔洛·血誓谈过了吗？",pEN="Have you spoken with Magister Astalor Bloodsworn?",c="干得好，$n。圣光赐予的力量永远不会自然而然地降临到血骑士身上，但我们也不至于天真到会被某一个存在的意志所阻挠，无论它多么强大。\n\n我们对奥术的精通为你开启了这条道路和这些力量，$g新兵:新兵;。很少有人有胆量或能力驾驭它们，但我知道你不会让骑士团失望。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The powers granted by the Light will never come 'naturally' to the Blood Knights, but we are not so naive as to be thwarted by the will of a single being, however powerful.\n\nOur mastery of the arcane has unlocked this path and these powers for you, initiate. Few have the stomach or the aptitude to wield them, but I know you will not disappoint the order."}
Q[9685]={d="在你准备这只瓶子的时候，我派一些人去带回了桑利亚斯·静刃的遗体。你可以在银月城旅店的顶楼找到他，应该还有一个侍从陪在他边上。你现在就立刻到他那里去，利用瓶中的魔法力量使他重新获得生命吧。\n\n时间很宝贵，$n。如果时间过得太久，即使是圣光的力量也无法使他回到我们身边了。在你复活了桑利亚斯·静刃之后，立刻回到我这里来。",dEN="While you were preparing the vessel, I sent a group of initiates to retrieve Sangrias Stillblade. You will find him on the top level of Silvermoon's inn with an attendant. Make your way there with all haste and unleash the vessel's magic to restore him to life.\n\nTime is of the essence, <name>. Once he has been dead for too long, not even the Light can bring him back to us. Return to me once you have resurrected Stillblade.",o="带着装满的微光容器到银月城旅店去，使用其中的力量复活桑利亚斯·静刃。",oEN="Take the Filled Shimmering Vessel to Silvermoon City's inn and use its magic to resurrect Sangrias Stillblade.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$g新兵:新兵;。既然你已经知道了我们力量来源的真相，也展现出了驾驭它的能力，我就授予你在战场上复活阵亡者的能力。\n\n忠于骑士团，在训练中精益求精，你的力量就会不断增长。",cEN="Welcome back, initiate. Now that you know the truth about the source of our power and you have demonstrated your skill in wielding it, I will grant you the ability to resurrect the fallen in the field.\n\nStay true to the order and excel at your training and you will only continue to grow in power."}
Q[9686]={d="你即将获得骑士团中的专家头衔，$n。首先，你必须通过另一场试炼来证明自己的价值。\n\n第二次试炼与第一次不同之处在于，这次不会有任何意外。摆在你面前的挑战很简单：你必须在战斗中面对并击败4名血骑士冠军。\n\n你接受挑战后，亭子中央会出现一块水晶。触碰它以开始试炼，不要走远。\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？",dEN="You stand on the verge of adept status in the order, <name>. First, you must prove your worthiness by undertaking another trial.\n\nThe Second Trial differs from the first in that there will be no surprises this time. The challenge before you is simple; you must face and best four Blood Knight champions in combat.\n\nWhen you accept the challenge, a crystal will appear in the middle of the pavilion. Touch it to begin your trial and do not stray far from the building.\n\nAre you prepared?",o="击败克雷伦·血伤一旁帐篷中的勇士布拉维·血怒、勇士莱伦德·光痕、勇士玛尔娅·迅刃和勇士斯塔克·射日者，完成第二项试炼。",oEN="Complete the Second Trial by defeating Champion Bloodwrath, Champion Lightrend, Champion Swiftblade, and Champion Sunstriker in the pavilion near Master Kelerun Bloodmourn.",p="血骑士宁死也不会向敌人屈服。记住这点，$n。",pEN="A Blood Knight would rather die than submit to the enemy. Remember that, <name>.",c="干得好，$n！你已经证明自己$g有资格:有资格;成为血骑士的正式成员，并晋升为$g专家:专家;。不过，在你的入会仪式举行之前，还有几项任务要完成。",cEN="Well done, <name>! You have proven yourself worthy of full membership in the Blood Knights and elevation to adept status. However, there are a few more tasks that remain before your induction can take place."}
Q[9687]={d="不久前，在这片区域一直过着平静生活的枭兽出现在了岸边。他们一个接一个地偷走了死去龙族的尸骨。我不知道是什么让这些生物如此地不安，也不知道为什么他们要偷走龙骨，不过因为这样的行为，龙族的灵魂无法得到安息。\n\n到西边去，穿过红砂海滩，你会看到怒羽山。进入枭兽的营地，找回被偷走的龙族尸骨吧。",dEN="Not long ago, the once tranquil owlkin of the region appeared on the shores of this island. One by one they would come to steal the bones of the fallen dragons. I do not know what would cause these creatures such distress or why they would want the bones of the deceased, but the spirits of the brood have grown restless due to this sacrilege.\n\nTo the west, across the Crimson Reach, you will find Ragefeather Ridge. Venture to the owlkin encampments and recover the pilfered dragon bones.",o="龙痕岛的托雷斯王子要你找回8根龙骨。",oEN="Prince Toreth on Wyrmscar Island wants you to recover 8 Dragon Bones.",p="龙的战争已过去好久了。所剩仅有骨头和被激怒的伊瑟拉后裔残存者。",pEN="The dragon wars have long since passed. All that remains are bones and the agitated remnants of Ysera's brood.",c="一个仪式？枭兽已经和平的住在这块土地好几千年了。这样的事是脱离常轨的！\n\n真是遗憾……",cEN="A ritual? The owlkin had lived in harmony with the land for thousands of years. Such a thing is an aberration!\n\nSuch a pity..."}
Q[9688]={d="你在岛上看到的幼龙是躁动不安的绿龙之魂。他们跟我一样被困在了这里，灵魂无法得到安息。\n\n找回他们的尸骨让他们暂时安定了一些，不过你还必须采取进一步的行动才能永久解决这个问题。\n\n毁掉他们的怨魂，在那之前我都不能离开这里。一定要彻底解救他们！",dEN="The whelps that you see on this island are the agitated spirits of the green dragonflight. Like me, they are bound to the land, unable to ascend to their final resting place in the Dream.\n\nRecovering the bones of the fallen has settled them somewhat but you must take further action.\n\nDestroy their ethereal manifestations. I cannot leave this place until it is done. They must be released!",o="龙痕岛的托雷斯王子要你杀掉5只绿色雏龙和5只绿色龙崽。",oEN="Prince Toreth at Wyrmscar Island has asked that you slay 5 Viridian Whelps and 5 Viridian Broodlings.",p="看到这种情景让我感到很痛苦。拜托，我们不要再谈下去了。",pEN="It pains me to watch. Please, let us not speak of this any further.",c="虽然你的任务令人感到不忍心，但总是要有人把它完成。现在你必须正式面对事件背后的邪恶力量。",cEN="As reprehensible as your task was, it had to be done. Now you must look into the face of evil."}
Q[9689]={d="许许多多的黑龙在战斗中被杀死了。其中有一个死亡之翼的亲信军官，他的灵魂至今仍出没在这里。如果你望向天空，就会看到他那幽灵般的面孔浮现在空中。即便已经死去，他的仇恨还是那么强烈。\n\n带上你之前帮我收集到的龙骨到岛上的山顶去，把它们放在永燃火堆中。这样一定可以把刺喉引下来。等他出现以后，毁灭他的灵魂。",dEN="Many of the black dragonflight were slain during the attacks. One of them, a lieutenant of Deathwing himself, still haunts this place. If you look to the heavens, you can see his spectral countenance circling the skies. His hatred is so great that he remains even in death.\n\nTake the bones that you gathered for me earlier to the top of the mountain on this island and place them in the ever-burning pyre. This act should signal Razormaw to descend. When he does, slay his undead form.",o="龙痕岛的托雷斯王子要你杀掉刺喉。",oEN="Prince Toreth at Wyrmscar Island has asked that you slay Razormaw.",p="我建议你多带几名盟友一同转至，$n。",pEN="I recommend that you bring allies, <name>.",c="事情已经发生多久了？一千年？或许是一万年？你为我和我的往生族民们做了一件伟大的事，$n。请接受这件蕴含强大魔力的物品做为罗萨伦的感谢",cEN="How long has it been? A thousand years? Ten-thousand perhaps? You have done me and the memory of my people a great service, <name>. Please accept this item of power as a token of appreciation from Loreth'Aran - in honor of your deeds."}
Q[9690]={d="$g新兵:新兵;$n，你一直努力随我们的魔导师学习圣光的奥秘。你已经了解我们力量的来源，也明白了血骑士的职责。\n\n现在，是时候接受第二次试炼，争夺血骑士中$g专家:专家;的地位了。试炼将由凯勒伦·血哀大师在城北某处主持。穿过银月城废墟，在通往逐日者之岛的桥前取道向东。",dEN="Initiate <name>, you have worked hard to master the powers of the Light won by our magisters. You have learned the source of our abilities and of the duties of a Blood Knight.\n\nThe time has come for you to undergo the Second Trial, and contest for status as an adept among the Blood Knights. The trial will be administered by Master Kelerun Bloodmourn at a location north of the city. Travel north through the Ruins of Silvermoon and take the east path immediately before the bridge to Sunstrider Isle.",o="向克雷伦·血伤报到。",oEN="Report to Master Kelerun Bloodmourn.",c="等你$g准备好:准备好;了，我会告诉你更多关于这场试炼的事。做好准备，想开始时再来跟我谈谈。",cEN="When you are ready, I will tell you more about the trial you are to undergo. Make your preparations and speak to me again when you wish to begin."}
Q[9691]={d="立刻返回银月城向骑士领主布拉德瓦罗报到吧。你的到达就会让他了解到试炼的结果。\n\n他会告诉你，若想成为一名正式骑士，接下来你还有哪些剩馀的任务需要完成。抬高你的徽记，$n。许多人都曾接受过这个试炼的挑战，但却很少有人能成功地回来。",dEN="Return to Silvermoon City and report to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor promptly. Your arrival will tell him all he needs to know about the outcome of the trial.\n\nHe will tell you of your remaining tasks on the road to becoming an adept. Hold your head high, <name>. Many undertake this trial, but very few return to tell of their success.",o="向银月城的骑士领主布拉德瓦罗报到。",oEN="Return to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Silvermoon City.",c="我知道你有潜力通过试炼，$n。你剩下的职责大部分都是一些仪式，但它们可不比挑战我们一个拿着武器的勇士来的安全。仔细听好，我就会告诉你还要做些什么来取得你的新军阶。",cEN="I knew you had the potential to pass the trial, <name>. Your remaining duties are mostly ceremonial, but they are no less dangerous than staring down one of our champions with his weapon drawn. Listen closely, and I will tell you what else you must do to claim your new rank."}
Q[9692]={d="在新晋专家被血骑士的行列接纳之前，他或她必须筹齐资源，打造本团标志性的武器——血淬长戟。\n\n你还必须赢得佩戴本团徽记的权利。骑士团创立时，徽记是按固定数量铸造并分发的，因此每位新专家都从前辈那里继承自己的徽记。你的徽记来自一位曾勇敢领军突袭戴索姆的阵亡骑士。\n\n我为你准备了一份指引说明。",dEN="Before a newly-minted adept can be accepted into the ranks of the Blood Knights, <he/she> must procure the resources to create our order's distinctive weapon, the blood-tempered ranseur.\n\nYou must also earn the right to wear our order's insignia. When the order was founded, a set number were forged and distributed, so each new adept inherits <his/hers> from a veteran. Your insignia will come from a fallen knight who bravely led an assault on Deatholme.\n\nI have prepared a set of notes to guide you.",o="将一块被污染的科尔宝石、一箱血铸铁锭、一份愤怒者之血和一枚血骑士徽章交给银月城的骑士领主布拉德瓦罗。",oEN="Bring a Corrupted Kor Gem, a Crate of Bloodforged Ingots, a quantity of Blood of the Wrathful, and a Blood Knight Insignia to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Silvermoon City.",p="你取得所有要你拿到的东西了吗？",pEN="Have you done all that was asked of you?",c="非常好，$n。材料已经收集完毕。剩下的就是要铸造武器了。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. It's all here. All that remains is to forge the weapon."}
Q[9693]={d="$n，阿古斯这个词对你有什么特殊的含义吗？许多德莱尼人大概都忘记了那是我们曾经的家园，甚至可能对此一无所知。在那个动荡不安的时代，我们断然与堕落者决裂，拜萨格拉斯所赐，昔日的同胞变成了扭曲的恶魔。他们自称为艾瑞达人。\n\n艾瑞达人……这个词原本的意思……\n\n<埃德门图斯咂着嘴，似乎在品尝这个词语的味道。>\n\n恶心。\n\n别浪费时间了。去找守备官波鲁斯接受训练吧。",dEN="What does Argus mean to you, <name>? Many draenei probably do not know or remember our home planet. It is there that we split from the man'ari: the twisted demonic reflections of ourselves that were 'gifted' by Sargeras. Or as they call themselves, eredar.\n\nEredar... this word once held meaning.\n\n<Admetius smacks his lips as if to taste the word.>\n\nDisgusting.\n\nLet us not waste anymore time. Find Vindicator Boros to begin your training.",o="秘血岗哨的主教埃德门图斯要你去跟守备官波鲁斯谈一谈。",oEN="Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch has told you to speak with Vindicator Boros.",c="啊，$n……我听过你。你就是那个在15分钟内使在秘蓝岛跑了个来回的人，对吗？呃，应该不是。\n\n你准备好以圣光之名抛头颅洒热血了吗？为了维伦？为了阿古斯？\n\n<波鲁斯笑了笑。>\n\n我说慢一点好了。",cEN="Ah, <name>... I've heard about you. You're the one that made the Kessel Run in under 15 minutes, right? Bah, probably not.\n\nAre you ready to spill some blood in the name of the Light? For Velen? For Argus?\n\n<Boros laughs.>\n\nI'll slow down."}
Q[9694]={d="秘血岗哨是阿古斯之手驻守的两座前哨站之一。另一处便是碧蓝岗哨，你已经去过了。秘血岛上的情形却截然不同。我们初次到来时，秘血岛跟秘蓝岛一样美丽。我们甚至把这里命名为银风岛，但是如今，疾病侵蚀着整座岛屿，更糟糕的是，部分血精灵侥幸在埃索达的清剿中逃生。我有一项任务要交给你：转至西北方的刀林，消灭躲藏在那儿的血精灵。",dEN="Blood Watch is one of two forward bases operated by the Hand of Argus. You have already been to the other base, Azure Watch; things are completely different in Bloodmyst. When we first got here, the land was as beautiful as Azuremyst. We even called it Silvergale but now sickness is spreading across the land, worse yet, the blood elves that we were battling on the Exodar survived the crash. This brings me to your assignment: Venture northwest into Bladewood and terminate any blood elves that you find.",o="杀死10个炎鹰间谍，然后向秘血岗哨的守备官波鲁斯复命。",oEN="Vindicator Boros at Blood Watch wants you to slay 10 Sunhawk Spies.",p="他们数量太多以致于我认为他们好像是以倍数成长。",pEN="There are so many of them that I cannot help but think that they are somehow multiplying.",c="你回来了——而且平安无事！\n\n我有些好消息，$n。我们收到了一些新的资讯关于更多生还者可能的所在位置，同时我们发现了一个新的失事地点！等我处理完那些事情，我会再找你来的。",cEN="You have returned - and in one piece!\n\nI have some good news, <name>. We have received some new information about the possible location of more survivors. A new crash site has been discovered! When I am done attending to those matters, I will call for you."}
Q[9696]={d="审讯者埃莉西亚精通萨拉斯语。将这封信件交给她，听听她怎么说。",dEN="Our chief interrogator, Elysia, is fluent in Thalassian. Take the document to her and see what she has to say.",o="将炎鹰信函交给秘血岗哨的审讯者埃莉西亚。",oEN="Take the Sunhawk Missive to Interrogator Elysia at Blood Watch.",p="我现在有点忙，密探$n。你要说的事最好很重要。",pEN="I'm a bit busy here, agent <name>. This better be important.",c="<埃莉西亚阅读着文件。>\n\n如果这份文件说的是真的，血精灵已打开了通往外域的传送门！这也就是证实了他们的援军数量为什么永无止尽……",cEN="<Elysia reads from the document.>\n\nIf what this document says is true, the blood elves have opened a portal to the Outland! It would certainly explain their seemingly endless numbers..."}
Q[9697]={d="赞加沼泽的生态环境是一项重要的研究课题，尤其是孢子人和沼泽领主的生活习性。相信我，一旦涉足这项科研领域，你就会发现研究工作非常有挑战性。\n\n转至赞加沼泽西部的塞纳里奥岗哨，跟观察者莉萨奥谈谈吧。沿着西边的道路一直走就到了。她有些……迂腐，可别受她影响。\n\n啊，你还要当心她的猫。",dEN="There's important research to be conducted into the ecology of the local creatures, especially the sporelings and bog lords of the marsh. And trust me, once you get out into the field, you'll find the work to be challenging.\n\nSeek out Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in the western region of the marsh toward the south. Follow the path west and you will eventually find her. She can be a bit -- studious -- but don't let that get to you.\n\nOh, and watch out for her cat.",o="与赞加沼泽塞纳里奥岗哨的观察者莉萨奥谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in Zangarmarsh.",c="喔，很好……终于有人来帮忙了！由于要做的事情太多，我需要待在这里安排全部的事情。\n\n我希望你准备好干活了。",cEN="Oh, good... help finally! There's just so much to do, and I need to stay here to organize it all.\n\nI hope that you're ready to get your hands dirty."}
Q[9698]={d="$n，你必须亲自把译文交给维伦，我不信任那个疯疯癫癫的信使。\n\n告诉先知，血精灵正从外域获得增援，而且他们在埃索达的德莱尼人中间安插了一名间谍。维伦住在埃索达内的光明穹顶。\n\n快点！|n",dEN="I need you to deliver the translated documents to Velen personally, <name>. I don't trust that deranged messenger.\n\nExplain to the Prophet that the blood elves are receiving reinforcements from the Outland and that they have a spy amongst the draenei at the Exodar. Velen resides in the Vault of Lights inside the Exodar.\n\nMake haste!",o="将炎鹰信函的译文交给埃索达的先知维伦。",oEN="Take the Translated Sunhawk Missive to Prophet Velen at the Exodar.",p="<维伦微笑着。>\n\n你好，$n。我一直在等你。",pEN="<Velen smiles.>\n\nGreetings, <name>. I have been expecting you.",c="<维伦开始阅读文件。>\n\n真有趣……这的确解释了很多事情。",cEN="<Velen begins to read the document.>\n\nInteresting... This does indeed explain much."}
Q[9699]={d="$n，感谢你及时送信给我。你已经逐渐成长为阿古斯之手的优秀成员了。\n\n要是能查明秘血岛上的血精灵头目是谁就好了，更重要的是，我们得找到太阳之门的位置……那儿必定派有重兵把守。\n\n对搜索工作有兴趣吗？\n\n如果你愿意的话，就把我的命令交给守备官波鲁斯。他会给你安排新的任务的。",dEN="I thank you for the timely delivery, <name>. You are turning out to be one of the Hand's better agents.\n\nIf only we knew who they reported to in Bloodmyst and more importantly, where this sun portal was... They seem to have it tightly guarded - wherever it may be.\n\nWould you be interested in some reconnaissance work?\n\nIf so, take these orders back to Vindicator Boros. He will give you your next mission.",o="将维伦的命令交给秘血岗哨的守备官波鲁斯。",oEN="Take Velen's Orders to Vindicator Boros at Blood Watch.",p="怎么样呢？",pEN="Well?",c="这是个好计划，但也很危险。我想你会没事的。",cEN="It's a good plan, but a dangerous one. I'm sure you'll be fine."}
Q[9700]={d="维伦说，如果血精灵一直在打开这座岛与外域之间的裂隙，那么开启传送门的地方就会留下残余或异常。你必须搜寻岛上出现这些异常的地点。\n\n当心，$n；有些异常会是来自虚空的生物。若发现虚空异常，就杀了它们！有任何新发现都回来向我汇报。先从北边、扭曲活塞附近开始搜寻。|n",dEN="Velen states that if the blood elves have been opening rifts between this island and the Outland, there will be residue or anomalies left in the areas where the portals have been opened. You must search the island for locations that exhibit or display these anomalies.\n\nBe warned, <name>; some of these anomalies will be creatures from the void itself. Should you find void anomalies, slay them! Report back to me with any new information that you may find. Begin your search to the north, near the Warp Piston.",o="转至太阳传送站杀死5个虚空畸能，然后向秘血岗哨的守备官波鲁斯复命。",oEN="Vindicator Boros at Blood Watch wants you to locate the Sun Portal Site and slay 5 Void Anomalies.",p="我听过传闻说那区域有奇怪的生物出现。不管他们是当地的突变动物或是真正的虚空畸能都是你要去调查的事情。",pEN="I've been hearing reports of strange creatures appearing in the area. Whether they are mutated indigenous animals or true void anomalies is something that you need to find out.",c="你说你在跳跃引擎看到了几个虚空畸能？他们到底打开这个太阳之门几次了？这是个非常糟的消息……\n\n唉，你学会了所有我能教你的事，$n。等时候到了库卢斯就会要你前去找他了。",cEN="How many did you say you saw at the Warp Piston? Just how many times have they opened up this sun portal? This is very bad news...\n\nAlas, you have learned all that I am able to teach you, <name>. Kuros will call for you when it is time."}
Q[9701]={d="我们要尽可能地调查居住在孢子村的孢子人，了解它们的生活习性，以及他们与其它生物之间的关系。这就是我当前的工作：观察并记录它们的活动情况。\n\n我希望你转至西边的孢殖林，调查整片区域，然后向我汇报你的发现。",dEN="We need to learn all that we can of the sporelings at Sporeggar and their relationship to the creatures around them. One way to do that is what I'm doing; passive observation while making a note of their interactions.\n\nI need you to head over to the Spawning Glen to the west. Investigate the whole area and then return to tell me what you saw.",o="调查赞加沼泽的孢殖林，然后返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥岗哨，向观察者莉萨奥汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the Spawning Glen in Zangarmarsh, and then report back to Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in Zangarmarsh with your findings.",p="这么快就回来了？你对孢子村的孢子人观察对我的研究是非常重要的。我希望你不是敷衍了事的那种人。展现一点耐心确定你探勘了整个重生峡谷再给我你最后的报告。",pEN="Back so soon? Your observation of the Sporeggar sporelings is critical to my research. I hope you aren't the type to rush things. Show patience and make certain that you have explored the entirety of the Spawning Glen before giving me your final report.",c="什么？！孢殖林的泥沼领主在吃孢子人的孢子囊？情况不妙！",cEN="What?! The bog lords of Quagg Ridge are EATING the sporelings' pods? This isn't good!"}
Q[9702]={d="我一直在想，沼泽领主为何离开自己的地盘，跑去孢殖林觅食——难道是饥饿难耐？这可不行！\n\n唔，通常我不会插手这种闲事，但是如果任由它们吞食孢子囊，孢子人很快就会绝种的！\n\n我决定留在这儿，你去东边的泥泞山跑一趟吧，调查究竟是什么原因导致沼泽领主吞食孢子囊。",dEN="I was wondering why the bog lords were crossing the road to go to the Spawning Glen - they must be starving for some reason. This just will not do!\n\nI mean, normally I wouldn't get involved, but if they continue to eat all of the sporeling pods they'll wipe them out!\n\nHere's what we'll do: I'll stay here and you head to the Quagg Ridge to the east and look for dietary clues as to why they're raiding the sporelings.",o="将10份丢弃的食物交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥岗哨的观察者莉萨奥。",oEN="Collect 10 pieces of Discarded Nutriment and then return to Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in Zangarmarsh.",p="你一定要小心地收集所有的证据，$c！我们正在拼凑一个很大谜题的碎片。你犯一个错就会让我们导出错误的结论。\n\n那么我们对赞加沼泽的生态学能有多少了解呢",pEN="Be sure that you collect all of the evidence carefully, <class>! We're fitting the pieces of a giant puzzle together here. A mistake on your part could lead us to the wrong conclusions.\n\nThen where would we be in our understanding of Zangarmarsh's ecology?",c="这就是你的发现？那就怪了。这些除去外皮的蘑菇看起来既奇怪又熟悉。\n\n我得好好思考一下。别离开这里！",cEN="This is what you found? That's odd. These husked mushroom remains are both unusual and somehow look familiar.\n\nI have to think on this a moment. Don't go anywhere!"}
Q[9703]={d="我们另有小队在追查太阳传送门的线索，$n。我需要你专注于手头的任务。\n\n博罗斯收到了另一处坠机点的新报告。我们后来查明，那处坠机点其实就是埃索达的低温核心。那是一个舱体存放区，存放着与我们在埃门谷爬出来的那种完全相同的舱体。\n\n该区域还存放着医疗物资。前往低温核心，就在血之守望正西方。搜寻物资，也搜寻幸存者。|n",dEN="We have others pursuing leads on the sun portals, <name>. I need you to focus on the task at hand.\n\nBoros has received new reports of another crash site. What we've since discovered is that the crash site is actually the Exodar's cryo-core. This is a pod holding area that houses pods exactly like the ones we draenei crawled out of in Ammen Vale.\n\nThis area also holds medical supplies. Head to the Cryo-Core, directly west of Blood Watch. Search for supplies and search for survivors.",o="取回12箱医疗补给品，然后向秘血岗哨的守备官库卢斯复命。",oEN="Vindicator Kuros at Blood Watch wants you to recover 12 boxes of Medical Supplies.",p="消息正确吗？",pEN="Was the information accurate?",c="只有血精灵？没有生还者？这真是麻烦。我要花点时间思考，$n。或许伊索姆或波鲁斯还有任务要你完成。",cEN="Just blood elves? No survivors? This is troubling. I'll need some time to think this through, <name>. Perhaps Aesom or Boros have an assignment for you to complete."}
Q[9704]={d="信使是个艰苦的差事，需要频繁往返于逐日岛和鹰翼广场。时间紧迫，路途遥远，最糟糕的是还要对付失心者！\n\n南面的道路一直通往银月城废墟……盘踞在废墟中的失心者会为了几块法力水晶大肆杀戮。我们曾派出一位信使投递艾洛娜的包裹，我想他大概已经惨遭不幸了。\n\n你似乎跃跃欲试想要证明自己的实力。那么，转至黎明之路寻找这位信使的下落吧。",dEN="It's hard work being an outrunner between Sunstrider Isle and Falconwing Square. Tight deadlines, long hours and worst of all... the Wretched!\n\nThe road south goes through the ruins of Silvermoon... the place is crawling with Wretched ready to kill you for a few mana crystals. Unfortunately, I think that's what happened to the last outrunner we sent with one of Erona's packages.\n\nI see you're eager to prove yourself. Venture into Dawning Lane and see if you can find any traces of our outrunner.",o="往南进入银月城废墟，在黎明之路附近寻找被杀死的信使。",oEN="Go south into the ruins of Silvermoon and look for the Slain Outrunner in Dawning Lane.",c="除了那一个包裹外信使的东西都被偷了。看起来和奥拉莉恩描述的艾洛娜的包裹一样。",cEN="The outrunner's belongings have all been stolen with the exception of one package. It seems to match Alarion's description of Erona's package."}
Q[9705]={d="经过仔细辨认，这个包裹确实是魔导师艾洛娜的东西。奥拉莉恩应该会让你把这东西归还给她吧。",dEN="You take the package and confirm that indeed it comes from Magistrix Erona. Alarion would probably want you to bring it to her.",o="将艾洛娜的包裹交给信使奥拉莉恩。",oEN="Return to Outrunner Alarion with Erona's Package.",p="你发现了什么，$n？",pEN="What did you find, <name>?",c="以太阳之井之名！这是我们这个月失去的第三个信使了。\n\n我欣赏你冒险进入黎明之路的勇气，卫兵要严查这些卑鄙的怪物了。",cEN="By the Sunwell! That's the third outrunner we've lost this month.\n\nI appreciate your courage in venturing into Dawning Street. The guards need to keep a closer eye on these blasted Wretched."}
Q[9706]={d="你颤抖着捡起日记。一定要把这场悲剧告知库卢斯。将这本日记交给他。",dEN="Your hands tremble as you pick up the book. Kuros must be told about this tragedy. Return the book to him.",o="把加莱恩的日记带给血之守望的守备官库罗斯。|n",oEN="Take Galaen's Journal to Vindicator Kuros at Blood Watch.",p="你手上拿的是什么东西，$n？那是一本日记吗？",pEN="What have you got there, <name>? Is that a journal?",c="<库卢斯阅读着日记，脸色变得愈发苍白，眼泪从他脸庞滑落。>\n\n撒鲁安是我的良师……我的益友……我最近才替换了他在三人执政团的位子——在我们放弃寻找他后。\n\n<库卢斯的脸愤怒的扭曲。>\n\n玛提斯……",cEN="<Kuros' face turns pale as he reads the journal; tears stream down his face.>\n\nSaruan was my master... my teacher... my mentor... I took his place among the Triumvirate only recently - after we had given up searching for him.\n\n<Kuros' face contorts in anger.>\n\nMatis..."}
Q[9707]={d="你又一次在骑士团与你的同龄人面前证明了自己的价值。我现在怀着极大的喜悦授予你正式骑士的衔位，$n。凯尔萨斯王子也会为你而感到自豪的。\n\n我们所有人都为能与你并肩作战而感到荣幸。继续以身作则，让那些想要加入我们的血精灵以你为榜样吧。你要拒绝一切仁慈与懦弱，保卫你的人民与兄弟，并继续提高你在圣光运用上的造诣。\n\n现在，去领取那把象征晋级的武器吧。",dEN="Once again, you have proven yourself worthy before the order and your peers. It is with great pleasure that I bestow upon you the rank of adept, <name>. Prince Kael'thas himself would be proud of you.\n\nAny of us would be honored to fight by your side on the field of battle. Continue to serve as an example for those who aspire to join us. Show neither mercy nor weakness, defend your people and your brothers tirelessly, and hone your mastery of the Light.\n\nNow, claim the weapon befitting your new rank.",o="将这箱材料交给银月城的波玛尔。",oEN="Take the Crate of Materials to Bemarrin in Silvermoon City.",p="恭喜你，$n。达到$g专家:专家;军衔绝非易事，相信我。我见过多少人走进那座建筑，而其中又有几人能撑到带着这些材料回来见我。",pEN="Congratulations, <name>. Achieving the rank of adept is no mean feat, believe me. I've seen the number of people who enter that building, and how few of them last long enough to visit me bearing these materials.",c="看来你有了所有我需要的东西。开始动手吧！",cEN="It looks like you've got everything I'll need. Let's get started!"}
Q[9708]={d="唔，对，我记得曾在赞加沼泽的某处见过这种特殊的蘑菇！\n\n此地以北就是菌杆沼泽。真是个奇怪的地名，不过我从来没有去过那儿。我需要一些蘑菇样本来验证自己的猜测是否正确。\n\n$c，千万小心。听说菌杆沼泽是食人魔的驻地，恐怕你得从他们手中抢些蘑菇样本。这或许就是沼泽领主不去那儿觅食的原因。",dEN="Yes, that's it, I knew I had seen this particular phylum of mushroom elsewhere in the marsh!\n\nTo the north is a place known as the Hewn Bog. Odd name for the place if you ask me, but I've never been there. I'll need samples of those mushrooms to confirm my hypothesis.\n\nJust be careful, <class>. I'd heard that ogres have moved in to the area, so you'll have to get the samples from them. Could that be why the bog lords are no longer going there for their food?",o="将15份蘑菇样本交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥岗哨的观察者莉萨奥。",oEN="Collect 15 Mushroom Samples and return them to Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in Zangarmarsh.",p="你弄到那些样本了吗？",pEN="Do you have those samples yet?",c="我们想的没错。破碎者的存在和他们做的事解释了一切。现在我知道为什么要叫蛮沼村了，真笨！\n\n我们得对这个情况想些办法，但是什么办法呢？我们不能就这样杀掉所有的破碎者，他们和所有泥沼的其它生物一样有权利待在那里！",cEN="We definitely have a match here. And the presence of the ogres and what they were doing there explains everything. Now I get why it's called the Hewn Bog, duh!\n\nWe have to do something about this situation, but what? We can't just wipe out all of those ogres; they have every bit as much a right to be here as any of the other creatures in the marsh!"}
Q[9709]={d="$C，我想到解决此事的办法了。我要你再去北边跑一趟，深入食人魔驻地的中心！\n\n菌杆沼泽西北方有一座巨大的蘑菇桥，桥对面的浮岛名叫安葛洛什要塞。\n\n食人魔肯定会把蘑菇储存在要塞中。我敢打赌那儿到处都是蘑菇，说不定你还可以在食人魔身上找到它们！\n\n替我带回几箱蘑菇，我会试着为沼泽领主提供新的食物。",dEN="<class>, I've got an idea. I want you to head north again, this time into the heart of ogre territory!\n\nNorthwest of the Hewn Bog there is a place named Ango'rosh Stronghold, which sits on a floating island across a large mushroom bridge.\n\nThe ogres must be storing the harvested mushrooms there. I bet you'll find them all over the place, and probably on the ogres themselves, too!\n\nBring me a sufficient number and I will try to do something about providing the bog lords with a new source of nourishment.",o="将10箱蘑菇交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥岗哨的观察者莉萨奥。",oEN="Collect 10 Boxes of Mushrooms and return them to Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Watchpost in Zangarmarsh.",p="你带回我们帮泥沼领主规划新菜园所需要的蘑菇吗？",pEN="You have all of the mushrooms that we need to create a new garden for the bog lords?",c="这些真是完美！喔，谢谢你，$c！\n\n你是那么的小心，没有扰乱自然秩序，我们也在短时间里收集了这么多资讯！\n\n现在，来看看我们为泥沼领主栽种新食物补给的小计划是否能成功吧。",cEN="These are perfect! Oh, thank you, <class>!\n\nYou've been ever so careful not to disturb the natural order of things, and we've gathered so much information in such a short amount of time!\n\nNow, let's see if our little plan to grow a new food supply for the bog lords is going to work."}
Q[9710]={d="一切都已经准备好了，$n。很快你就将拥有一件与你的地位相称的武器。",dEN="I've got everything prepared, <name>. Very soon you will have a weapon befitting your new status.",o="等待波玛尔为你锻造出你的武器。",oEN="Wait while Bemarrin forges your weapon.",c="来吧，$n。为银月城和你的军队好好的使用它吧。",cEN="Here it is, <name>. Use it well in the service of Silvermoon and your order."}
Q[9711]={d="$n，玛提斯必须受到正义的制裁。我要你搜寻他的下落，将他带回三人执政团。\n\n在岛上搜寻这个混蛋。一旦发现他的踪迹，就打响信号枪。我的人在看到信号后会立即赶来抓捕玛提斯。完成任务后向我复命。",dEN="Matis will be brought to justice, <name>; and I want you to be the one to find him and bring him back to the Triumvirate.\n\nScour the island for this killer. Should you find him, use this flare gun. When my trackers see the flare, they'll come and assist in capturing Matis. Return to me after he's been captured.",o="秘血岗哨的守备官库卢斯要你俘获残忍的玛提斯。",oEN="Vindicator Kuros at Blood Watch wants you to capture Matis the Cruel.",p="像玛蒂斯这种级别的士兵不会独自行动。外面小心点。",pEN="A soldier of Matis' stature won't be traveling alone. Be careful out there.",c="三人执政团已决定立刻审讯玛提斯。今天你让一个罪魁祸首受到正义的制裁，年轻的$r。\n\n你为三人执政团中的两人都完成令人钦佩的任务，现在只剩下伊索姆了。",cEN="The Triumvirate has decided to try Matis immediately. You have brought an arch-criminal to justice on this day, young <race>.\n\nYou have performed admirably for two of three; only Aesom remains."}
Q[9712]={d="你在骑士团中的服务非常优异而出色，$n。你对圣光之力的运用技巧证实了魔导师阿斯塔洛与他的同伴教授你这些知识的努力没有白费，他们的工作是值得的。\n\n既然你已经掌握了圣光的力量，那么你完全可以召唤出一匹健壮的战马，作为你忠实的坐骑。\n\n继续为骑士团带来贡献与荣耀吧，$n，更加美好的前台在等待着你。",dEN="You have distinguished yourself in the service of the order, <name>. Your skill in wielding the Light energies granted by Magister Astalor and his fellows has proven you worthy to receive a new kind of knowledge.\n\nWith the Light at your command, it is possible to summon a fearsome warhorse that will serve as your faithful mount.\n\nContinue to serve with dedication and honor, <name>, and even greater boons await you.",o="去银月城或奥格瑞玛与骑士领主布拉德瓦罗谈谈，学习如何召唤你的萨拉斯战马。",oEN="Talk to Knight-Lord Bloodvalor in Silvermoon or Orgrimmar to learn how to summon your Thalassian Warhorse."}
Q[9714]={p="我们仍然需要从盘牙水库的幽暗沼泽跛行者，泥沼巨人和幽暗沼泽蝠那里弄来更多的血红木槿。帮我以一束五朵的数量带来我会很感激你。",pEN="We can still use more of the sanguine hibiscus from the shamblers, bog giants and underbats of the Underbog at Coilfang Reservoir. Bring them to me in bunches of five and I will be most grateful.",c="很不错，可我们一直都需求更多这种东西。或许你会很快再去幽暗沼泽？",cEN="These will do nicely, but we can always use more. Perhaps you will find yourself in the Underbog again soon?"}
Q[9715]={d="红色木槿的用途广泛，因此我们需要补充这种花朵的储量。它们原本跟灌木一样茂密，但是沼泽水位下降后，就只能在盘牙水库的幽暗沼泽中见到红色木槿了。\n\n据说蹒跚者、泥沼巨人和幽暗蝠将其视为美食。如果你愿意帮助我们的话，就去猎杀这些沼泽生物，将红色木槿带回来给我。",dEN="We must replenish our supply of sanguine hibiscus, which we use for a number of purposes. They used to grow thick as shrubs, but the lowering of the marsh's water levels means that they can only be found now in the Underbog at Coilfang Reservoir, under Serpent Lake.\n\nIt is said that the shamblers, bog giants, and underbats there consider them a delicacy. So, if you are to help us, you must retrieve the flowers from them.",o="将5朵红色木槿交给赞加沼泽孢子村的舒特。",oEN="Collect 5 Sanguine Hibiscus and return them to Gzhun'tt at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="你收集到我需要的红色木槿了吗？",pEN="Do you have all of the hibiscus that I asked you to gather?",c="很不错，可我们一直都需求更多这种东西。或许你会很快再去幽暗沼泽？",cEN="These will do nicely, but we can always use more. Perhaps you will find yourself in the Underbog again soon?"}
Q[9716]={d="我们满怀期冀地来到外域，希望能发现新的物种。刚到赞加沼泽时，我们所见的是一处繁荣茂盛的生态系统。\n\n可惜最初的判断是错误的。经过测量，我们发现这个区域的湖泊和沼泽的水位在不断下降。\n\n这很可能给当地的动植物带来毁灭性的灾难。转至西南方的暗泽湖，调查水位下降的原因。",dEN="We came to Outland expecting to find small pockets of life. What we discovered in Zangarmarsh was a lush environment with a thriving ecosystem.\n\nOur initial assessment of the area was deceiving, however. The water levels at the lakes and marshes have consistently been going down since we started taking measurements.\n\nThe impact this could have on the local animal and plant life is disastrous. Go to Umbrafen Lake, southwest of here, and look for clues related to this water depletion.",o="调查暗泽湖水位下降的原因，然后返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥避难所，向伊谢尔·风歌复命。",oEN="Investigate the cause of the water depletion at Umbrafen Lake. Then return to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你发现了什么吗，$n？",pEN="Did you discover anything, <name>?",c="是纳迦搞的鬼！但是为什么呢？从你的描述听来，那个蒸汽抽水机一定是沼泽水位下降的部分原因！\n\n不论如何——这解释了他们对我们公开的敌意。不要浪费时间了，我要你为我们进行另一个任务。",cEN="The naga are behind this! But why? From what you describe, that steam pump must be part of the cause for the water levels dropping in the marsh!\n\nNo matter - this explains their open hostility towards us. Let's not waste any time, I need you to perform another task for us."}
Q[9717]={d="虽然我们爱好和平，却不得不与泥沼巨人交战。有句谚语是这么说的：蘑菇，战争，都要不择手段！\n\n霍加尔芬是泥沼巨人的首领之一，他负责照料那株名叫幽暗孢子的特殊植物。如果这株寿命已有千年的植物受到任何损伤，对霍加尔芬而言必定是个沉重的打击。\n\n转至盘牙水库的幽暗沼泽，偷偷摘取一片幽暗孢子叶。相信我，他会察觉你的行为的。",dEN="While we are a peaceful people, we are at war with the spore giants, whether we like it or not. And there is a saying amongst us that all is fair in mushrooms and war!\n\nOne of the leaders of the spore giants, Hungerfen, has been tending a very special plant, known as the Underspore, to perfection for millennia. It would break his spirit if something were to happen to that plant.\n\nTravel to the Underbog in Coilfang Reservoir and steal a frond off of it for us. Trust me, he'll notice.",o="将一片幽暗孢子叶交给赞加沼泽孢子村的塔苏。",oEN="Gather an Underspore Frond and return it to T'shu at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="幽暗沼泽是个极其危险的地方。你要是拒绝前往，我不会觉得你$g是:是;懦夫。可你要是没能带回我要的东西，我也不会感谢你。",pEN="The Underbog is a very dangerous place. I would not consider you a coward if you were to balk at going there. I also wouldn't be appreciative of you if you did not return with what I've asked for.",c="<孢子人发出了一声像是从鼻子喷气的笑声。>\n\n太完美了！当他们发现你所做的事后，孢子巨人的士气绝对会大受打击的。\n\n或者，他们会因为受辱而很快再攻击我们。\n\n<塔苏做了个耸肩的动作。>",cEN="<The sporeling makes a sound that is vaguely reminiscent of snorting laughter.>\n\nPerfect! No doubt the morale of the spore giants will be at an all time low once they realize what you've done.\n\nEither that, or they'll be so incensed that they'll attack us again soon.\n\n<T'shu makes a shrugging motion.>"}
Q[9718]={d="我们必须查明纳迦的活动范围，以便采取相应的措施。\n\n逐一调查赞加沼泽的湖泊将会耗费大量时间。如果你愿意的话，我可以使用魔法将你变形为更适合执行侦察任务的飞鸟。\n\n当你准备就绪后，就在我附近的平台上使用这个护符。完成任务后，我会指引你安全返回的。",dEN="We must determine how widespread the naga's activity truly is and react accordingly.\n\nExploring each body of water in Zangarmarsh could be a lengthy undertaking. If you allow me to, I will use my magic to mold your shape to one more suited to scouting the marsh.\n\nHold this amulet above the balcony near me when you're ready to begin. I will guide your way back to safety after we're done.",o="伊谢尔·风歌要求你使用风暴乌鸦护符，然后调查赞加沼泽的主要湖泊。",oEN="Ysiel Windsinger wants you to use the Stormcrow Amulet to explore the major lakes in Zangarmarsh.",p="嗨，$n。",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="如我所想的一样。纳迦在赞加沼泽所有的主要湖泊都设立了抽水站。\n\n如果还想保住沼泽的话就一定要阻止他们。",cEN="It is as I suspected. The naga have set up pumping stations at all the major lakes in Zangarmarsh.\n\nThey must be stopped if the marsh is to have a future."}
Q[9719]={d="一直以来，我们都将泥沼游荡者视为最大的威胁。如今我们却要面临来自泥沼巨人的攻势，恐怕无力与宿敌抗衡。\n\n$c，你是位颇具实力的勇士。你愿意前往盘牙水库的幽暗沼泽，杀死泥沼游荡者之母——黑色阔步者吗？\n\n做为凭证，将它的大脑带回来给我。",dEN="Historically the greatest danger to my people has been from the marsh walkers. With the new problems we are facing from spore giants, we cannot afford another attack from our ancient enemies.\n\nYou have proven yourself to be capable, <class>. Do you think that you'd be able to journey to the Underbog in Coilfang Reservoir and eliminate the great mother of the marsh walkers, known as The Black Stalker?!\n\nBring me her brain as proof.",o="将黑色阔步者的大脑交给赞加沼泽孢子村的肯尼克斯。",oEN="Bring the Brain of the Black Stalker to Khn'nix at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="你回来了。这表示黑色阔步者已不在这个世界上了吧？",pEN="You have returned. Does this mean that The Black Stalker is no more?",c="黑色阔步者死了！通常我不会陶醉于这种屠杀行为，但那个族母和她的子嗣几个世纪以来带给我们的痛苦实在是无法用言语形容。\n\n很不幸的现在她的另一个后代将要取代她的位子，但那还需要时间，使我们有空间喘口气，暂时先不用担心沼泽游荡者的事。",cEN="The Black Stalker is dead! Normally I would not revel in such butchery, but the pain that the great mother and her brood have put my people through over the centuries is unspeakable.\n\nIt is unfortunate that now another of her progeny will transform to replace her, but that will take time and give us some breathing room so that we will not have to worry about the marsh walkers for a while."}
Q[9720]={d="我无法理解纳迦为何要将水排出自己的栖息地，我只知道必须制止他们的行为。\n\n这些种子包含着大地的愤怒，我要你利用它们破坏纳迦的蒸汽泵控制台。\n\n从种子中抽出的藤蔓会像你的手臂一样粗壮，像铸铁一样坚硬。$n，去吧。恢复赞加沼泽原有的生态平衡。",dEN="I cannot begin to comprehend why the naga would drain the water out of their own habitat. What I do understand is a need to put a stop to their operations.\n\nThese seeds carry with them the rage of the earth. Take them to the steam pumps operated by the naga and use them on their controls.\n\nThe vines that grow from the seeds will be as thick as your arm and as strong as iron. Go, <name>. Restore the balance that the naga have upset.",o="伊谢尔·风歌要你利用铁藤种子，破坏毒蛇湖、暗泽湖、沼光湖和环礁湖的蒸汽泵控制台，然后返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，将剩馀的铁藤种子还给她。",oEN="Ysiel Windsinger wants you to use the Ironvine Seeds on the Steam Pump Controls at Serpent Lake, Umbrafen Lake, Marshlight Lake and the Lagoon. Then return to her at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh with any leftover seeds you have.",p="完成了吗，$c？",pEN="Is it done, <class>?",c="完成了。沼泽现在已经没事了。\n\n千万别以为这是我们最后一次听到纳迦的消息。在我们继续外域任务的同时也要对敌人保持警惕。",cEN="It is done, then. The marsh has been saved for now.\n\nDon't think for a second that this will be the last we hear of the naga. We must remain vigilant of our enemy as we continue with our mission in Outland."}
Q[9721]={d="最近一段时间里，你对骑士团的卓越贡献，以及你身为骑士的逐渐进步，我们都看在眼中。事实上，索拉纳·血怒——女伯爵莉亚德琳的左膀右臂——已经决定召见你。\n\n这是一个只有极少人才能获得的光荣，$n。通常来说，索拉纳·血怒只将骑士团的阶级和文书管理工作交给我，但这次，他对你有了一些个人上的兴趣。别让他等太久，$n。",dEN="Your dedication to our order and advancement through the ranks has not gone unnoticed. In fact, Lord Solanar Bloodwrath, Lady Liadrin's right hand and a hero in his own right, has asked to speak with you.\n\nThis is a rare honor, <name>. Normally, Lord Solanar leaves the management of the order's rank-and-file to me, but he has taken a personal interest in you. Do not tarry, <name>.",o="与银月城的索拉纳·血怒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Solanar Bloodwrath in Silvermoon City.",c="我们很快就会讨论你造访的目的了。首先，我要说我真的对你的努力和使用圣光的技巧印象深刻。",cEN="We will discuss the purpose for your visit soon. First. let me say that I am indeed impressed by your service and your skill in wielding the Light."}
Q[9722]={d="在骑士团的各阶级之中，存在着一个仅由精英骑士组成的内环议会。议会的成员都是由领导层亲自挑选出的最具奉献精神、最值得信赖，以及技巧最为优秀的血骑士。这些大师们最显着的标志就是他们所拥有的萨拉斯战马坐骑。\n\n每名议会的预备成员都必须拥有一个议会内的推荐人，并需要表现出他们对骑士团核心原则的奉献与尊崇。\n\n鉴于你的优秀表现，我已被选为你的推荐人，将以血骑士大师的身份推荐你加入议会，不知道你是否愿意加入。",dEN="Within the ranks of our order, there exists an inner circle of elite knights. Members of the circle represent the most dedicated, skilled, and trustworthy of all Blood Knights and are handpicked by the leadership. Most simply know the masters by their thalassian charger mounts.\n\nEach candidate for membership must have a sponsor within the circle and must demonstrate their dedication to the order's central tenets.\n\nI have chosen to sponsor you for standing as a Blood Knight master, if this is your wish.",o="再次与索拉纳·血怒交谈，接受他对你的推荐。",oEN="Speak with Lord Solanar Bloodwrath again to accept his offer of sponsorship.",c="你选择接受我的提议，这说明你很不错，$n。祝你在即将交付给你的任务中好运，但我相信你绝对能够胜任。\n\n我会按从易到难的顺序交代任务，等你$g准备好:准备好;了我们就开始。",cEN="That you have chosen to accept my offer speaks well of you, <name>. I wish you luck in the tasks I am about to set for you, but I'm certain you'll prove yourself more than capable.\n\nI will present the tasks in order from easiest to most difficult and we may begin when you are prepared."}
Q[9723]={d="血骑士的忠诚并不止于剑尖，$n。骑士团对成员的要求不只是操练和战斗。真正的骑士会为骑士团的一切事务出力，哪怕那些事表面上并不光鲜。\n\n这第一项任务既不激烈，也不荣耀，但若没有这样的贡献，骑士团就会分崩离析。我要给你一份物品清单，魔导师阿斯塔洛·血誓的人需要这些来为我们持续供应法术所需的圣光能量。",dEN="A Blood Knight's loyalty does not stop at the end of <his/her> blade, <name>. The order asks more of its members than mere drilling and combat. A true knight contributes to all of the order's activities, even the ones that may not seem glorious on the surface.\n\nThis first task is neither combat intensive, nor glorious, but without such contributions, the order would fall apart. I will give you a list of items Magister Astalor Bloodsworn's men require to keep us supplied with Light energy for our magics.",o="将40块符文布、6块奥金锭、10株太阳草、5个黑暗符文和150枚金币交给银月城的索拉纳·血怒。",oEN="Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Sungrass, 5 Dark Runes, and 150 Gold to Lord Solanar Bloodwrath in Silvermoon City.",p="你带着博学者阿斯塔洛·血誓要的材料回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the materials Magister Astalor requires?",c="非常好。看来所有东西都在这里。\n\n别担心，你的下一个任务会让你有很多机会挥舞你的武器，我保证。\n\n我要让新加入者把所有的东西带给博学者阿斯塔乐。还有更多重要的事要做的时候就不需要派你去做这些琐碎的差事了。",cEN="Excellent. It appears everything is here.\n\nDon't worry. your next task will include plenty of opportunities to wield your weapon again, I promise.\n\nI'll have an initiate bring it all to Magister Astalor. There's no need to send you on such a trivial errand when there are more important things to be done."}
Q[9724]={d="塞纳里奥远征队已经成为了一个强大且独立的组织。这件事情非常重要，我们必须提醒塞纳里奥议会。\n\n用不着担心，我不会让你回月光林地的。在地狱火半岛上就有我们的信使。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has become a large organization with a good degree of autonomy. These events are important enough that we need to warn the Cenarion Circle.\n\nDo not worry, I will not ask you to travel back to Moonglade; we have emissaries as nearby as Hellfire Peninsula.",o="与地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站中的阿米希尔·迷雾行者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Amythiel Mistwalker at Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="你说的赞加沼泽纳迦活动是非常紧迫的。伊谢尔将这消息传达给我们是很睿智的。她没忘记远征队不能没有议会的支持。",cEN="The news you bring about the naga activity in Zangarmarsh is dire. Ysiel was wise in sending word to us. She hasn't forgotten that the Expedition cannot exist without the Circle's support."}
Q[9725]={d="我们血骑士以保卫奎尔萨拉斯为己任，$n。这是你所接受的一切训练的核心目的。我们的敌人凶猛残暴而冷酷无情，银月城和她的居民却能因为我们的努力与盟友们的援助而安然无恙。\n\n我最近收到了一些消息，据说一批新生成的天灾军团出现在了我们领土与东瘟疫之地的边界附近。而众多天灾军团的攻城设备及负责操作它们的工程师也已经到位，似乎想要进攻幽魂之地。一定要阻止它们！",dEN="We Blood Knights are bound to defend Quel'Thalas, <name>. This is a central part of your training. Our enemies are fierce and unrelenting. Silvermoon and its people remain free by our efforts and the support of our allies.\n\nI have received some disturbing reports of a renewed Scourge presence to the southeast of our border with the Eastern Plaguelands. A company of Scourge siege engineers and their equipment appear to be staging for an attack on the Ghostlands. They must not be permitted to succeed.",o="银月城的索拉纳·血怒要求你摧毁3台天灾绞肉车，并杀死15名天灾攻城技师。",oEN="Lord Solanar Bloodwrath in Silvermoon City wants you to destroy 3 Scourge Meat Wagons and kill 15 Scourge Siege Engineers.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。你击退天灾和他们的运尸车了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>. Have you beaten back the Scourge and their meatwagons?",c="你展现了对家园的忠诚和对命令的奉献，$n。在你获得大师的称号之前我还有最后一个任务要给你。",cEN="You have done well in demonstrating your loyalty to your homeland and dedication to the needs of the order, <name>. I have one last task for you before you may lay claim to the title of master."}
Q[9726]={d="东北边血鳞领地的纳迦正在追杀我们的人民。我们绝对不容许这样的事情继续发生，$c！\n\n希望你能去给他们点颜色瞧瞧，同时也可以证明我们之间的友谊。",dEN="The naga of the Bloodscale Enclave to the northeast have begun to kill our people. We cannot allow this to continue, <class>!\n\nWe suggest that you teach them a lesson as proof of our friendship.",o="杀掉12个血鳞驱奴者和6个血鳞女巫，然后向赞加沼泽孢子村的舒特复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Bloodscale Slavedrivers and 6 Bloodscale Enchantresses, and then return to Gzhun'tt at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="你去拜访过那些纳迦了吗？",pEN="Have you paid the naga a visit yet?",c="\n\n我们很高兴看到我们的友谊得到再次确认，$n。既然我们有了这样$g一位:一位;强大的盟友，那些异教纳迦今后再想骚扰我们，也许就得三思了。<Gzhun'tt te señala con la cabeza.>$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="<Gzhun'tt nods to you.>\n\nWe are pleased that you have affirmed our friendship, <name>. Perhaps the naga heathens will think twice about harassing us in the future now that we have such a powerful ally?"}
Q[9727]={d="有报告说东北边血鳞领地的纳迦还在继续追杀我们的人民。我们觉得你有经验去解决这件事，$c！\n\n我想委托你去好好教训教训他们，作为我们友谊延续的证明。",dEN="Reports have come in that the naga of the Bloodscale Enclave to the northeast continue to kill our people. We thought that you had dealt with this, <class>!\n\nI suggest that you to teach them a lesson as proof of our continued friendship.",o="杀掉12个血鳞驱奴者和6个血鳞女巫，然后向赞加沼泽孢子村的舒特复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Bloodscale Slavedrivers and 6 Bloodscale Enchantresses, and then return to Gzhun'tt at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="你去拜访过那些纳迦了吗？",pEN="Have you paid the naga a visit yet?",c="<舒特对你点点头。>\n\n我们很高兴你重新肯定了我们的友谊，$n。既然你已经多次把我们的决心表达的很清楚了，他们对我们无意义的攻击会停止了吧？",cEN="<Gzhun'tt nods to you.>\n\nWe are pleased that you have reaffirmed our friendship, <name>. Surely now that you have made our point clear multiple times, their senseless attacks upon our people will cease?"}
Q[9728]={d="在塞纳里奥远征队的德鲁伊们忙于研究植被和勘测湖泊时，我承担起了保卫庇护所的重责。\n\n自打我们来到赞加沼泽，纳迦就在毫无征兆的情况下多次对我们发动突袭。我们已经尽力牵制他们的攻势，可惜毕竟人手有限。\n\n我想让你转至纳迦在赞加沼泽的各个据点，让他们明白我们不是好惹的。把纳迦的爪子带回来给我，作为你击杀他们的证据。",dEN="While the druids from the expedition have made themselves busy studying plants and researching the lakes, I've made it my business to deal with the hostiles in the area.\n\nEver since we set foot in Zangarmarsh, the naga have launched lethal attacks against us without warning. We've done our best to keep them at bay, but our resources are limited.\n\nI want you to go to the various naga strongholds in Zangarmarsh and show them that we're not to be crossed. Bring me their claws as proof of your victories.",o="将30个纳迦爪子交给塞纳里奥庇护所的监护者哈穆特。",oEN="Warden Hamoot at the Cenarion Refuge wants you to bring him 30 Naga Claws.",p="再见到你真好，$n。你猎捕纳迦的事进行的如何了？",pEN="It's good to see you again, <name>. How's your hunt for the naga going?",c="做得好，$n。你抒发一点心里的痛悔是好的。这些纳迦是邪恶的生物——比艾泽拉斯的纳迦更坏。",cEN="Good job, <name>. You'd do well to shed any feelings of remorse you might harbor. These naga are vicious creatures - even more so than the Azerothian ones."}
Q[9729]={d="纳迦惹恼了弗沃尔！孢子人是弗沃尔的朋友，所以弗沃尔要抢走萨斯里斯圣柜。\n\n我们去附近的纳迦村落吧。你愿意帮忙吗？那就叫上你的朋友！",dEN="Little naga make Fhwoor angry! Sporelings good friend to Fhwoor, so Fhwoor get naga ark.\n\nWe go into nearby naga village. You help? Bring friends!",o="护送弗沃尔进入沼光湖水域，在蒸汽泵处找回萨斯里斯圣柜，保护弗沃尔携带圣柜安然返回，然后向赞加沼泽孢子村的舒特复命。",oEN="Escort Fhwoor into the area of the Marshlight steam pump to retrieve the Ark of Ssslith. Bring Fhwoor and the ark back safely and then report back to Gzhun'tt at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="费沃尔还好吗？你取回圣柜了吗？",pEN="Is Fwhoor alright? Have you recovered the ark?",c="弗沃尔是个好巨人。我们一阵子前从纳迦手中把他救出来，后来他就留在这里帮我们的忙。\n\n我们只能希望纳迦能明白我们可以轻易渗入他们的村子，偷取他们最珍贵的财产。这意味着我们可以做更多可怕的事。也许他们就会回到洞穴并还给我们安静的日子？",cEN="Fhwoor's a good giant. We saved him from the naga a while ago and he's stayed here helping us with things ever since.\n\nWe can only hope that the naga will take the hint and realize that if we can infiltrate their village and steal their most prized possession, we can do much worse. Perhaps now they will return to their reservoir and leave us in peace?"}
Q[9730]={d="塞纳里奥远征队重金悬赏击杀暗潮纳迦首领——哈格哈兹王子的勇士。塞纳里奥斥候最后一次发现哈格哈兹是在赞加沼泽中南部的环礁湖。\n\n暗潮纳迦曾多次袭击塞纳里奥远征队，他们的首领被视为极度危险的人物。\n\n诛杀哈格哈兹王子的勇士可在监护者哈穆特处领取奖赏。",dEN="A bounty is hereby declared by the Cenarion Expedition on Rajah Haghazed, leader of the Darkcrest naga. Haghazed was last sighted by Cenarion scouts at the Lagoon, in the central southern region of Zangarmarsh.\n\nThe Darkcrest have been linked to numerous attacks against the Cenarion Expedition and their leader is considered extremely dangerous.\n\nThose seeking to claim the bounty are advised to report to Warden Hamoot.",o="杀死环礁湖的哈格哈兹王子，然后返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥远征队，向监护者哈穆特领取奖赏。",oEN="Slay Rajah Haghazed at the Lagoon and return to Warden Hamoot at the Cenarion Expedition in Zangarmarsh for a reward.",p="你想谈谈关于哈格哈兹王子的赏金？他死了吗？没什么好说的了！",pEN="You want to talk about the bounty for Haghazed? Well, is he dead? There isn't much else to talk about!",c="我不喜欢艾泽拉斯的纳迦而且我更不喜欢这里的纳迦。我们的任务不能维持和平真是一件憾事，但你不会看到我为死去的纳迦掉泪。\n\n这是你杀掉暗潮首领的奖励，$n。",cEN="I didn't like the naga in Azeroth and I like them less here. It's a real shame our mission could not remain a peaceful one, but you won't see me shedding tears for dead naga.\n\nHere's your reward for taking care of the Darkcrest leader, <name>."}
Q[9731]={d="这张结构图上绘制着连接毒蛇湖和邻近湖泊的地下排水系统。\n\n如果图表属实的话，那么毒蛇湖的中心必定有一台巨大的抽水泵。核实这个消息是否属实，然后返回塞纳里奥庇护所复命。",dEN="The schematics you've obtained show an underground system of drains and pumps that connect the lakes in the region to Serpent Lake.\n\nIf the schematics are correct, there is a giant drain in the center of Serpent Lake. Confirm this and bring the news to Cenarion Refuge.",o="转至毒蛇湖搜寻抽水泵的踪迹，然后向塞纳里奥庇护所的伊谢尔·风歌汇报你的发现。",oEN="Search Serpent Lake for signs of a drain. Return to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge with news of your discovery.",p="你带来了什么消息，$n？",pEN="What news do you bring, <name>?",c="纳迦把毒蛇之湖变成了赞加沼泽的一个巨大水槽。他们到底在干嘛？\n\n你把这个消息带来给我们很好，$n。我们会派一组人去调查你发现的这个排水设备。同时我有个不同的任务要给你。",cEN="The naga have turned Serpent Lake into a giant water sink for the rest of Zangarmarsh. What could they possibly be doing?\n\nYou've done well in bringing this news to us, <name>. We will send a team to investigate this drain you've discovered. I have a different task for you in the meanwhile."}
Q[9732]={d="转告伊谢尔，我们会尽快提供增援。\n\n大家正为月光林地和希利苏斯的事务忙得不可开交，但是我们会尽量抽调人手转至塞纳里奥庇护所帮忙的。",dEN="Return to Ysiel and let her know that help will be extended to her as soon as it is possible.\n\nAffairs in Moonglade and Silithus have kept our members occupied, but we will do our best to send the necessary resources to the Cenarion Refuge.",o="返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，向伊谢尔·风歌复命。",oEN="Return to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",c="再见到你真好，$n。我们需要你尽快的帮忙。",cEN="You are a welcome sight, <name>. Matters at the Cenarion Refuge have only gotten worse since you left."}
Q[9735]={d="血骑士能够以一种那些所谓的“圣骑士”完全无法理解的精妙技巧运用圣光的力量。但尽管我们发挥出了圣光的真正潜能，他们仍然保持着对我们的轻视。\n\n我们必须把自己的力量展示给他们，告诉他们，我们绝对不是他们可以随意嘲讽的对象。我当前已经有了一个主意，不过它有些复杂，也很艰难。但我想，你一定可以胜任。那么，首先你需要潜入提尔之手修道院的图书馆区，并获得一瓶提尔之手圣水。",dEN="A Blood Knight master possesses incredible skill at wielding and weaving the Light in a way that other so-called 'paladins' can never comprehend. It doesn't stop them from despising us for unleashing the Light's true potential.\n\nWe must send them a message and show them that we are not to be trifled with. What I have in mind will be neither brief nor easy, but if you are committed, the first step will be to infiltrate the library wing of the Tyr's Hand Abbey and procure a vial of Tyr's Hand holy water.",o="银月城的索拉纳·血怒要求你给他带回一瓶提尔之手圣水。",oEN="Lord Solanar Bloodwrath in Silvermoon City wants you to bring him a vial of Tyr's Hand Holy Water.",p="你弄到水了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get the water?",c="嗯……这个份量有点少，但如果我们小心点，这应该足够。你知道，血色十字军相信他们是为圣光奉献的。我想他们应该仍是，只是方式扭曲了，而那正是我所希望利用的。\n\n他们错误的热情甚至污染了这水的祝福，非常适合我的目的。",cEN="Hmm... this is a rather small amount. but if we're careful. it should be sufficient. You see. the Scarlet Crusade believes itself dedicated to the Light. I suppose they still are, in a twisted sort of way, and that's exactly what I'm hoping to capitalize on.\n\nTheir misguided zeal has even tainted the blessing spoken over this water, making it ideal for my purpose."}
Q[9736]={d="既然水已经有了，我们还需要若干用量精确的材料。其中一些稀有而昂贵，但我已经找到了一两处货源，$n。\n\n你可以向扎勒买一份奥术催化剂——她是死亡之痕附近广场上一家店铺的商人。达尔莉亚是死亡之痕潜行者训练师附近的毒药商，出售暮光之尘。\n\n要配成这剂混合物，我还需要一颗艾泽拉斯钻石和一颗纯净的黑钻石。",dEN="Now that we have the water, we're going to need a number of reagents in precise quantities. Some of these substances are rare and expensive, <name>, but I have located sources for two.\n\nYou should be able to purchase some arcane catalyst from Hagrus, the reagent vendor in one of the shops found in the drag. Rekkul, the poison merchant near the rogue trainers also in the drag, stocks crepuscular powder.\n\nTo complete my mixture, I'll also need an azerothian diamond and a pristine black diamond.",o="银月城的索拉纳·血怒要求你给他带回一份奥术触媒、一份黄昏之尘、一颗艾泽拉斯钻石和一颗原始黑钻石。",oEN="Lord Solanar Bloodwrath in Silvermoon City wants you to bring him 1 Arcane Catalyst, 1 Crepuscular Powder, 1 Azerothian Diamond, and 1 Pristine Black Diamond.",p="你收集到我要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the reagents I'll need?",c="既然我们有了所有的材料，我就能准备混合物了。\n\n<一个缓慢的笑容在女伯爵莉亚德琳脸上展开。>\n\n这全都非常完美，$n。等到完成后，我会详细告诉你还有什么事要做。",cEN="Now that we have all the reagents, I can prepare the mixture.\n\n<A slow smile spreads across Lady Liadrin's face.>\n\nIt's all coming together perfectly, <name>. When this is finished, I'll give you the details about what remains to be done."}
Q[9737]={d="我们利用圣光的方式才是最完美的方式，$n。一定让那些自称“圣骑士”的家伙们知道他们利用圣光的方式有多么的愚蠢，一定要把这个事实明明白白地摆在他们的面前。\n\n阿隆索斯礼拜堂是白银之手骑士团组建的地方，似乎在毁灭斯坦索姆的大火之中也被完整地保存了下来。这处教堂里的永恒之焰有着圣光力量的保护，但如果你使用这份药剂的话，就可以熄灭那里的火焰，保护结界也会不复存在。火焰熄灭之后，我们对圣光的统驭之力就会被全世界知晓了。",dEN="Ours is the true way of utilizing the Light, <name>. To show others that would call themselves 'paladins' the folly of their ways, I intend to send an unmistakable message.\n\nThe Alonsus Chapel, where the Order of the Silver Hand was founded, seems immune to the destruction of Stratholme. The chapel's eternal flame affords it the Light's protection, but when you use this mixture to extinguish the flame, that protection will be no more. It will burn, and our dominion over the Light will be proven to the world.",o="在阿隆索斯礼拜堂的永恒之焰上使用熄焰之水，除去圣光的保护，然后消灭所有试图保卫礼拜堂的人。",oEN="Use the Extinguishing Mixture near the eternal flame in the Alonsus Chapel to remove the Light's protection. Be prepared to fight anyone who may attempt to defend the chapel.",p="你有照我的话做并传达了我的讯息吗？世界上的假圣骑士都一定要知道他们的时代已经结束了。",pEN="Have you done as I asked and delivered my message? The false paladins of the world must surely know their time has come to an end.",c="干得好，$n。所有与我们为敌的人都该好好留意你发出的警告。我们的敌人应当明白自己身处险境，从最低微的步兵到最$g强大的:强大的;$g英雄:英雄;。\n\n你已在导师之列赢得了一席之地。你的勤勉与本领是所有血骑士的榜样。作为你新身份的象征，我授予你召唤并驱使萨拉斯战马的能力。",cEN="Well done, <name>. All who would oppose us would do well to heed the warning you delivered. Our foes should know that they are in peril, from the lowest foot soldier to the mightiest <hero/heroine>.\n\nYou have earned your place in the ranks of the masters. Your dedication and prowess serve as an example for all Blood Knights. As a symbol of your new status, I grant you the ability to summon and command the thalassian charger."}
Q[9738]={d="你必须帮助我！伊谢尔派我们来这里调查神秘的蒸汽泵事件，以及纳迦为什么要利用蒸汽泵排出沼泽地的水。但是我的几位同伴闹了别扭，竟然撇下我独自行动。\n\n那四个家伙有时候脾气是挺古怪，不过我还是很喜欢他们的。\n\n我要你查明他们到底出了什么状况，我很担心他们遭遇不测。去奴隶围栏和幽暗沼泽看看吧。\n\n谢谢你，$c。",dEN="You have to help me! We were sent here by Ysiel to investigate the mystery of the steam pumps and why they're being used to drain the water from the marsh. But my friends split up and went on recklessly without me.\n\nThose four can be such jerks sometimes, but I love them anyway.\n\nThat is why I need you to discover what became of them, though I fear the worst. Seek them in both the Slave Pens and the Underbog.\n\nThank you, <class>.",o="查明缚地者雷葛、博学者拜特、除草者格林萨姆和唤风者克劳恩的下落，然后返回赞加沼泽的盘牙水库，向观察者杰哈恩复命。",oEN="Discover what happened to Earthbinder Rayge, Naturalist Bite, Weeder Greenthumb, and Windcaller Claw. Then, return to Watcher Jhang at Coilfang Reservoir in Zangarmarsh.",p="你知道我那四个同伴的下落了吗？",pEN="Have you discovered the whereabouts of my four companions yet?",c="我很高兴我的一些朋友还活着，但得知其他人的下场让我心碎。\n\n至少他们是死在了一生最热爱的事情上。你帮我了结这件事，我永远感激你，$n。\n\n请收下其中一件，作为谢意的表示。<suspiro>",cEN="I'm glad that some of my friends yet live, but it breaks my heart to hear of the fate of others.\n\nAt least they died doing what they loved most in life. You have my eternal gratitude for helping me with this, <name>.\n\nPlease, take one of these as a sign of gratitude."}
Q[9739]={d="喂，叫你呢！你必须帮助我们！\n\n真菌巨人正在吞食孢子囊！必须想点什么办法，不然我们的孩子就都没命了！\n\n孢子囊刚刚开始生长的时候体积较大，随着囊内空气的消耗会逐渐缩小。寻找那些体积较小的成熟的孢子囊，尽你所能地拯救它们！",dEN="You there! You must help us!\n\nThe fungal giants are devouring all of our spore sacs! You must do something, or we'll lose our young!\n\nThe spore sacs start out large and become smaller as the air inside them is depleted. Look for the small, mature spore sacs and save as many of them as you can!",o="孢殖林的法恩森要你收集10个成熟的孢子囊。",oEN="Fahssn at the Spawning Glen wants you to collect 10 Mature Spore Sacs.",p="孢子囊！你拿到它们了吗？",pEN="The spore sacs! Did you get them?",c="你办到了！我的族人感谢你。\n\n我希望你了解……这是我们幼崽出生的地方。我们不能让这些野兽吞噬孢子囊！",cEN="You've done it! You have my people's thanks.\n\nI hope you understand... this is where our young ones come from. We can't let these beasts devour the sacs!"}
Q[9740]={d="谢谢你，我们已经找到了太阳之门的位置。血精灵可随意移动传送门的位置，以此对付突发状况，所以上次让你空跑一趟也就不足为奇了。\n\n但是，可移动的传送门有许多弊端。太阳之门靠传送门控制器固定。如果我们卸下控制器，就可以摧毁传送门。太阳之门现在的位置在这里的西边，矢量感应器南面的区域。去找到它，摧毁它！",dEN="Thanks to you and the work you did, my scouts were able to find the sun gate. The elves keep the portal location mobile so that they can move it at a moment's notice. That's why the site you investigated was empty.\n\nThe strength of such a system is also its greatest weakness. The sun gate is stabilized by portal controllers. If we can take down the controllers, the portal will be ours to destroy. The current sun gate location can be found west of here, south of the Vector Coil. Find it and destroy it!",o="秘血岗哨的守备官伊索姆要你摧毁太阳之门。",oEN="Vindicator Aesom at Blood Watch wants you to destroy the Sun Gate.",p="你一定要先毁掉他们的传送门控制器才能摧毁传送门！",pEN="You must take out their portal controllers before you can destroy the gate itself!",c="太棒了！我们切断了他们的补给线。现在我们要做的就是把他们给解决掉！",cEN="Smashing! We've cut off their supply line. Now all that we need to do is finish them off!"}
Q[9741]={d="数日前，伊索姆派我的人外出搜寻太阳之门。当然，我们找到了……\n\n<洛伊指着约莉。>\n\n愚蠢的血精灵在打开传送门的同时，释放了虚空的力量。现在这儿出现了成群的虚空幼体。\n\n我们必须在它们成长为虚空畸能之前杀掉它们。西南方的太阳之门附近聚集了大量这种生物。杀死它们，然后向伊索姆复命。",dEN="Aesom sent my squad out on a reconnaissance mission to search for the sun gate a few days ago. Needless to say, we found it...\n\n<Loryi points at Jorli.>\n\nWhatever those fool elves are transporting through that portal is causing void energy to be released. The area is teaming with void critters.\n\nWe must destroy them before they have a chance to grow into void anomalies. You'll find the source of the creatures southwest of here, near the sun gate. Kill them and report back to Aesom when you're done.",o="杀死12只虚空幼体，然后向血之守望的守备官伊索姆汇报。|n",oEN="Kill 12 Void Critters and report to Vindicator Aesom at Blood Watch.",p="虚空幼体变成虚空畸能。说实话，我们真的不知道这些生物是什么……名字只是一个分类的方法。",pEN="Void critters grow into void anomalies. Truth be told, we really don't know what these creatures are... the name is more of a classification.",c="那里真是一团乱吧？你做的很好，$n。我会派一些人去帮他们的。",cEN="It's a real mess up there, eh? You've done well, <name>. I'll send some anchorites out to help Loryi and Jorli."}
Q[9742]={p="你救了更多的孢子囊吗，$r？",pEN="Have you rescued any more spore sacs, <race>?",c="是的！你又救下了更多的孢子囊。\n\n你和其他的外来者不一样。我会让我的人民知道你的功绩！\n\n<此任务可重复完成，直至达到友善声望。>",cEN="Yes! You've saved more spore sacs.\n\nYou're different than the other outsiders. I'll let my people know about your deeds!\n\n<This quest is repeatable up to friendly reputation.>"}
Q[9743]={d="孢子人与沼泽领主是世代的宿敌。过去，我们利用长矛和石块与之抗衡。近来他们似乎变得更具攻击性……并且更加不计后果。他们不再惧怕我们，也无视我们手中的武器。\n\n你的威慑力和装备都远胜于我们。如果你愿意替我们打败沼泽领主的话，孢子人会永远感激你的！把他们的卷须带回来给我，这样我就知道你确实在帮助我们了。",dEN="Us sporelings and the bog lords have never gotten along well. In the past, we've managed to keep them at bay with spears and stones. Lately they seem to have become more aggressive... or more desperate. They do not fear us or our weapons.\n\nYou are much scarier and better armed than us. If you were to fight the boglords for us, we'd be forever in your debt! Bring me their tendrils so I know how many you've killed.",o="将6根沼泽领主的卷须交给赞加沼泽孢殖林的法恩森。",oEN="Fahssn at the Spawning Glen in Zangarmarsh wants you to bring him 6 Bog Lord Tendrils.",p="泥沼领主杀的怎么样了？教育那些畜生不要再进入孢子人的领土！",pEN="How's the bog lord slaying going? Teach those brutes not to come into sporeling territory!",c="你活着回来了！我会把您的事迹告诉其他孢子人！$n，$g屠戮巨人者:屠戮巨人者;！",cEN="You made it back alive! I'll let the other sporelings know about you! <name>, the giant slayer!"}
Q[9744]={p="你杀了许多巨人，但还有更多随侍在后。他们仍在攻击我们的孢子囊！",pEN="You killed many giants, but there are still many more left. And they're still attacking our spore sacs!",c="不可思议！你杀死的巨人数量需要几百个孢子同胞才能办到。我会让大家都知道你的英勇事绩！\n\n<这个任务可以一直重复进行直到友好声望阶级。>",cEN="Unbelievable! It would take hundreds of sporelings to slay as many giants as you have. I will make sure to let everyone know of your feats!\n\n<This quest is repeatable up to friendly reputation.>"}
Q[9746]={d="$n，胜利在望。我们已经发现了太阳之门，很快就能彻底切断血精灵的补给线。首先，我们要削减他们的数量。\n\n此地以西有许多炎鹰部队营地。炎鹰火法师和炎鹰防御者是那里的主要防备力量。去杀死他们，然后向我复命。",dEN="Victory is close at hand, <name>. With the discovery of the sun gate, it won't be long until their supply lines are completely closed off. Now is the time to strike at their numbers.\n\nTo the west you will find numerous Sunhawk camps. The Sunhawk pyromancers and defenders occupy the vast majority of the area. Find them, kill them and return to me.",o="血之守望的守备官伊索姆要你杀死10名炎鹰火法师和10名炎鹰防御者。|n",oEN="Vindicator Aesom at Blood Watch wants you to slay 10 Sunhawk Pyromancers and 10 Sunhawk Defenders.",p="他们的首领不可能永远躲着我们。我们会有目的和计划地找到所有可能的藏身地点，直到找到希隆娜丝为止。",pEN="Their leader can't hide from us forever. We will systematically eliminate every possible hiding place until Sironas is found.",c="这绝对会使他们的防御变弱，让他们在仓促行事的时候三思而行！",cEN="This will surely soften up their defenses and make them think twice before rushing foolishly into our ranks!"}
Q[9747]={d="纳迦真是可憎的生物，但是暗地里帮助纳迦的破碎者和失落者更加令人厌恶！\n\n其中尤以暗泽失落者部族的行径最为恶劣，他们利用黑暗的魔法奴役其它人。暗泽失落者对企图逃跑的奴隶非常残忍，如果我离开庇护所，肯定会被他们干掉的。\n\n转至南边的暗泽村，杀死暗泽失落者和他们的首领卡塔鲁，否则我就要在惶惶不安中度过馀生了。",dEN="The naga are terrible, yes. But even more terrible are the traitor tribes of Broken and Lost Ones that helped them!\n\nThe worst of all are the Lost Ones of the Umbrafen tribe; they use dark magic to trap and enslave others. They're especially cruel to escaped slaves and would slit my throat if I left the refuge even for a day.\n\nTravel to Umbrafen Village south of here and kill them and their leader, Kataru. Until then I will fear for my life every single day.",o="塞纳里奥庇护所的伊卡因希望你转至暗泽村，杀死卡塔鲁、8个暗泽先知、6个暗泽巫医和6个暗泽神谕者。",oEN="Ikeyen at the Cenarion Refuge wants you to travel to Umbrafen Village and slay Kataru, 8 Umbrafen Seers, 6 Umbrafen Witchdoctors and 6 Umbrafen Oracles.",p="你回来了，卡塔鲁和暗泽村的那些怪物都死了吗？",pEN="You've returned; are Kataru and the Umbrafen slavers dead?",c="谢谢你，$n。我终于能安心地在夜里睡觉了。要不是我又老又弱，我就会自己对付我的敌人。\n\n拿着这些金子。虽然不多，但你的好心不能没有报酬。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I will finally sleep comfortably at night. Were I not so old and weakened I would deal with my own enemies.\n\nTake this gold. It is not much, but your kindness cannot go unpaid."}
Q[9748]={d="据我们的萨满祭司说，由于水源受到污染，水元素变得躁动难安。我们知道西边的山脉中散落着埃索达的能量核心。一定是能量核心泄漏出的挥发性液体污染了水源！我要你去采集水样。\n\n<伊索姆指着一只小瓶，点了点头。>\n\n拿上这只小瓶，沿着河岸往北走，在秘血岛河流入海口附近取一份水样，然后把水样带回来给我。",dEN="Our shaman claim that the elements of water have become greatly agitated by the pollution of the water source. We know that the Exodar's power core is lodged into the mountain to the west. It must be leaking volatile fluids into the water supply! I need you to get me more information.\n\n<Aesom points to a flask and nods.>\n\nYou are to take this flask and follow the beach north until you reach the area where the rivers of Bloodmyst drain into the ocean. Take a sample from that location and return to me.",o="用水样瓶取回一份秘血岛水样，然后向秘血岗哨的守备官伊索姆复命。",oEN="Vindicator Aesom at Blood Watch wants you to use the Water Sample Flask to get a Bloodmyst Water Sample.",p="不要喝那个水，$n！",pEN="Don't drink the water, <name>!",c="就如我想的一样，这个水会变成红色是因为核心液体渗漏所造成的污染。\n\n我希望你没有在任何一个被污染的水里游泳。",cEN="As I suspected, the water has turned red due to contamination from leaking core fluid.\n\nI hope you didn't swim in any of that contaminated water."}
Q[9751]={d="昨夜，“迷失的希望号”船长爱德华·海恩斯出现在我的帐篷前。就是二十年前死于坏血病的那个爱德华·海恩斯。\n\n这个幽灵给我讲了一个让我心胆俱寒的故事。一个我需要你听听的故事，一项我需要你完成的使命。你愿意吗？你愿意去血之守望东北方的巨龙伤痕岛寻找爱德华吗？|n",dEN="Last night, Edward Hanes, captain of the ship 'Lost Hope', appeared before me in my tent. The same Edward Hanes that died of scurvy 20 years ago.\n\nThis apparition told me a tale that made my heart tremble. A tale that I need you to hear and a mission that I need you to accomplish. Will you do it? Will you seek out Edward on Wyrmscar Island, northeast of Blood Watch?",o="海军上将奥德修斯要你找到艾德华·汉斯船长，然后与他谈一谈。",oEN="Admiral Odesyus has asked that you find and speak with Captain Edward Hanes.",c="你听说过血咒吗，$g旱鸭子:旱鸭子;？没有，你当然没听说过。血咒就是弄沉所有这些船的东西。这里那片腐坏、被亵渎的水域叫做血咒暗礁——一个你绝不会想去的地方。我自己在这儿待了二十年。\n\n坏血病？……呸！我死在这片荒凉的海岸上，成了龙的食物……啊，不过那是另一个故事，留到别的时候再讲。眼下，我们得去救那些困在暗礁里的可怜灵魂。",cEN="Have you heard of the bloodcurse, landlubber? No, of course you haven't. The bloodcurse is what sunk all these ships. The spoiled, desecrated part of the water here is known as Bloodcursed Reef - a part of the world you never want to visit. I've been here myself for 20 years.\n\nScurvy my foot! I died on these wild shores as food for the dragons... Ah, but that's another story for another time. Right now, we have to help the poor souls that are trapped in that reef."}
Q[9752]={d="你必须帮助我逃离此地！\n\n我在附近采集草药时，这群野蛮人突然将我团团围住，企图绑架我。我奋力反抗，无奈他们人多势众。\n\n帮助我返回塞纳里奥庇护所，摆脱这帮渣滓和他们那邪恶魔法的控制！",dEN="You must help me get out of here!\n\nI was gathering herbs nearby when a handful of these little savages abducted me. I tried to fight them off, but there were too many of them.\n\nHelp me return to the Cenarion Refuge and away from these cruel wretches and their vile magic!",o="护送凯拉·长鬃返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，然后向伊谢尔·风歌复命。",oEN="Escort Kayra Longmane to the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh. Report to Ysiel Windsinger when you've completed this task.",c="你救了我的一个德鲁伊。你的恩情，我们永远报答不完，$n。\n\n远征队和我都一样感谢你。",cEN="You rescued one of my druids. We could never repay you, <name>.\n\nYou have my thanks as well as that of the expedition."}
Q[9753]={d="我们已经摸清了敌人的情况。血精灵的头目是个名叫希隆娜丝的恶魔，这家伙一直在密谋消灭我们。他们的最终目标是奴役沃洛斯，重新统治埃索达。\n\n赞美圣光，我们已经摧毁太阳之门，切断了他们的补给线。不幸的是，矢量感应器还在污染着大地，血精灵利用那些被放射性源污染的变异生物滋扰生事。\n\n埃德门图斯已经想出对付他们的法子了。去找他吧。",dEN="We've learned much of our enemies in recent days. The blood elves are led by a being known as Sironas and plot to destroy us. Ultimately, they seek to enslave O'ros and regain control of the Exodar.\n\nLight be praised, we have stopped their supply line by destroying the sun gate. Unfortunately, they continue to use the contaminant of the Vector Coil to poison the land, using the mutagenic properties of the fallout to their advantage.\n\nWith this knowledge, Admetius has devised a plan. Seek him out.",o="与秘血岗哨的主教埃德门图斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch.",c="我需要你的帮忙，$n。我有个计划可以推翻整个炎鹰部队，但我们进行之前，需要收集一些重要的资讯。\n\n我们需要确认他们主要防御的弱点。不幸的是，我们一直无法接近旋绕导航器来判断他们的防御。如果我们可以和囚犯谈谈，就能取得需要的资讯，冲破防线并摧毁旋绕导航器。\n\n你听到我说的话了，我要把这可恶的一切结束。",cEN="I am in need of your services, <name>. I have a plan to topple the entire Sunhawk army, but before we can progress, we need to gather some vital information.\n\nWe need to identify the weaknesses in their primary defense. Unfortunately, we have been unable to get close enough to the Vector Coil to gauge their defenses. If we could get the prisoner to talk, we could get the information that we needed to break through the line and destroy the Vector Coil.\n\nYou heard me, I want to blow the damned thing up."}
Q[9756]={d="我们的审讯尝试惨遭失败，$n。酷刑当然是完全不考虑的。我们需要的是$r内部的人。\n\n我可以对你施法，让你在外貌和言谈上变成血精灵；也许通过这种欺骗，我们能从被俘的特工口中套出需要的情报。\n\n我要你借这副伪装，从囚犯那里榨取一切能榨取的情报。\n\n还有一件事，$n，不要离开血之守望，否则法术会失效。",dEN="Our attempts at interrogation have failed miserably, <name>. Torture is - of course - out of the question. What we need is a draenei on the inside.\n\nI can cast a spell upon you that would make you appear blood elf and adjust your language. Through subterfuge, we may be able to get the information we need out of the captured agent.\n\nUnder this guise, I want you to get whatever information you can out of the prisoner.\n\nAnd <name>, do not leave Blood Watch while disguised as the spell will fail.",o="与秘血岗哨的被抓住的炎鹰间谍交谈，了解炎鹰的相关信息。完成任务后向主教埃德门图斯复命。",oEN="Speak to a Captured Sunhawk Agent at Blood Watch and recover Sunhawk Information. Return to Exarch Admetius when the task is complete.",p="不成功就不要回来！",pEN="Do not return until you have succeeded!",c="啊哈！干得好，$n。确实干得好。你$g准备好:准备好;把血精灵的威胁从我们这座岛上永远铲除了吗？",cEN="A-ha! Well done, <name>. Well done, indeed. Are you ready to eradicate the blood elf menace from our island forever?"}
Q[9758]={d="那么，$g朋友:朋友;，就请你回到奥术师范德里尔那里去吧，我知道他正急着派你去执行你在幽魂之地的第一个任务。\n\n我们指望你了，$n。别让我们失望。",dEN="Now my friend, if you would be so kind as to return to Arcanist Vandril, I know that he is very anxious to send you out on your first mission here in the Ghostlands.\n\nWe're counting on you, <name>. Don't let us down.",o="返回幽魂之地的塔奎林，与奥术师范迪瑞尔谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Arcanist Vandril at Tranquillien in the Ghostlands.",c="喔很好，你来了！正好是时候……有很多事要做！",cEN="Oh good, there you are! And just in time... there is much to be done!"}
Q[9759]={d="如果你珍惜自己的性命，就别接这项任务。看到山那边突出来的那个巨大能量核心了吗？接下这份重担的人得一路杀穿那座山，与炎鹰大军作战，还要在我给核心装设爆破装置时保护我。希隆娜丝那个艾瑞达也在上面。\n\n你要是现在走开，我对你的看法不会改变，$n。\n\n但也许你就是$g那个:那个;注定要摧毁矢量感应器、干掉希隆娜丝的人。你是吗？",dEN="Don't accept this assignment if you value your life. You see that gigantic power core jutting out of the mountain side over yonder? Whoever takes on this burden will need to fight their way through that mountain, battling an army of Sunhawks while protecting me as I rig the core up for demolition. Sironas the eredar is somewhere up there as well.\n\nI won't think less of you if you just walk away, <name>.\n\nBut maybe you're the one - the one to destroy the Vector Coil and take down Sironas. Well, are you?",o="在爆破专家莱戈苏尝试摧毁矢量感应器的过程中保护他，并杀死希隆娜丝。完成任务后向秘血岗哨的主教埃德门图斯复命。",oEN="Follow and protect Demolitionist Legoso as he attempts to destroy the Vector Coil and slay Sironas. Return to Exarch Admetius at Blood Watch should you complete the mission.",c="你拯救了整个秘血岛和秘蓝岛，保卫德莱尼在艾泽拉斯的生命，$n！这样的行为，没有什么样的感谢，任何奖励，或是什么东西足以真正表达我们的感激。\n\n不过，还有很多人被留在德拉诺，无法在此经历这历史性的一刻。你一定要找到回去的路。回去外域，阿古斯的英雄。把我们的人民带回家。那个你拯救的家。在艾泽拉斯的家……",cEN="You have saved the whole of Bloodmyst and Azuremyst, securing the <race> way of life on Azeroth, <name>! For this, there can be no amount of thanks, no reward, nothing large enough in scope to truly express our appreciation.\n\nYet, there are still so many that were left behind on Draenor who cannot be here for this historic event. You must find your way back. Find your way back to the Outland, Hero of Argus. Bring our people home. Home to the land that you saved. Home to Azeroth..."}
Q[9760]={d="$n，我不会让你独自承担起破坏矢量感应器和杀死希隆娜丝的重任的；但是，你可以帮那些愿意接受这项危险任务的勇者清理沿途的障碍。\n\n沿着北边的道路离开秘血岗哨，在分岔路口往左转，守备官营地就在这条岔路的西边。考尔琳在那儿等你。",dEN="I would not ask you to single-handedly bear the burden of destroying the Vector Coil and slaying Sironas, <name>; however, I believe that you can be of some help in clearing the way for others that might take on such a dangerous assignment.\n\nTake the road going north out of Blood Watch and follow it until you get to the fork. Once there, take the left road and follow it until you see Vindicator's Rest - it will be slightly west of the road itself. Corin will be waiting for you.",o="去血雾岛的守备官营地，与守备官考尔琳谈谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest on Bloodmyst Isle.",c="或许你会是那个带领我们人民走入一个繁荣和平新世代的人。",cEN="Perhaps you will be the one to deliver our people into a new age of prosperity and peace."}
Q[9761]={d="只有历经战火洗礼、高贵无畏和意志坚定的德莱尼人才有资格接受莱戈苏的任务。主教是不会指派阿古斯之手的成员来破坏矢量感应器、杀死希隆娜丝的。他拒绝将任何德莱尼人派去完成那个任务——因为这无异于自杀……\n\n<考尔琳叹了口气。>\n\n我的职责是削弱炎鹰部队的防御力量。杀掉那些驻守在矢量感应器附近的炎鹰血精灵，为未来的勇士清除路障吧。",dEN="Only the most battle hardened, noble and positively fearless of draenei will submit to Legoso's mission. The exarch will not order any agent of the Hand to take on the task of destroying the Vector Coil and dispatching Sironas. He refuses to send any draenei to their death - which is what the mission is: suicide...\n\n<Corin sighs.>\n\nMy job is to soften up the Sunhawk defenses. You are to slay Sunhawks near the Vector Coil and keep the path clear for our champion - whoever that may be.",o="守备官营地的守备官考尔琳要你杀死8名炎鹰破坏者和8名炎鹰特工。|n",oEN="Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest wants you to slay 8 Sunhawk Saboteurs and 8 Sunhawk Agents.",p="你有在这附近看到勇敢又强大的不寻常的德莱尼吗？",pEN="Do you see any unusually brave and powerful draenei around here?",c="希望在他们召唤援军来保护你刚守卫的区域前会有一个英雄到来。",cEN="Hopefully a hero arrives before they are able to call forth reinforcements to guard the area you just secured."}
Q[9762]={c="这些岛屿是几千人的家。大部分的人毕生都会待在这里。如果你想要的话，你也可以这么做。但那不是你想要的，对吗，$n？\n\n<维伦点了点头。>\n\n你离开人世之前会做更多伟大的事。你一定要拥抱你的命运并和它正面交锋！\n\n在你离开之前，我要给你两个礼物：这件长袍只有阿古斯之手最令人崇敬的人才可以穿上，而这是我们最睿智的圣人才能戴的玺戒。骄傲的穿戴上它们吧，$n。",cEN="These islands will serve as the home to thousands. Most of these people will remain here their entire lives. If you so desired, you could do the same. But that's not what you want, is it, <name>?\n\n<Velen nods.>\n\nYou will do many more great things before you pass. You must embrace your destiny and meet it head on!\n\nBefore you leave, I present you with two gifts: This tabard is worn by only the most revered of the Hand of Argus and this signet ring worn by our wisest sages. Wear them both with pride, <name>."}
Q[9763]={d="当你悄悄地隐藏在敌人的藏身之处外面的入口时，会发现一些非常有用的情报。\n\n几个小时前，我看到有一群纳迦穿过了左边第二个隧道的石门。我不太懂他们的语言，但是我非常肯定地听清了其中一个词：卡利瑟里斯。\n\n那里一定是通往督军卡利瑟里斯的指挥营——蒸汽地窟的入口。你必须找到并阻止他。我太虚弱了，没有办法帮上一点忙。",dEN="There are benefits to hiding very, very quietly at the entrance of your enemy's hideout.\n\nJust hours ago I saw a group of naga go through the stone archway on the second tunnel from the left. I'm not well versed in their language, yet I clearly understood one word: Kalithresh.\n\nThat must be the entrance to the steam vaults, where Warlord Kalithresh has been commanding his troops from. You must find him and stop him. I am too weak to be of any assistance.",o="观察者杰哈恩要求你找到并杀死盘牙水库的督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Watcher Jhang wants you to find and slay Warlord Kalithresh inside Coilfang Reservoir.",p="卡利斯瑞怎么样了？他死了吗，$n？",pEN="What of Kalithresh? Is he dead yet, <name>?",c="我们在这区域最大的敌人终于死了。你帮了远征队一个大忙，$n。\n\n我们永远都欠你一份人情。",cEN="Our biggest enemy in the region is finally dead. You've done the expedition a great favor, <name>.\n\nWe shall be forever in your debt."}
Q[9764]={d="这封信中记载了一份详细的指令，是下达给那些操作蒸汽泵的盘牙纳迦的。指令中提到塞纳里奥德鲁伊已经进入盘牙水库，并命令他们一旦发现入侵者就格杀勿论。这份命令还指示需要将其它湖泊引入盘牙水库的水量翻倍。信上盖有声名狼藉的瓦丝琪的印章。\n\n塞纳里奥远征队的德鲁伊会对这封信感兴趣的。将它交给远征队的首领伊谢尔·风歌吧。",dEN="This letter contains detailed orders to the Coilfang naga operating the steam vaults. It warns of the arrival of Cenarion druids into the region and orders them to be slain on sight. The rate of water redirection from other lakes into Coilfang Reservoir is to be doubled. The orders bear the seal of the infamous Lady Vashj.\n\nThis letter would be of great interest to the druids of the Cenarion Expedition. Take it to their leader, Ysiel Windsinger.",o="将瓦丝琪女王的命令交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的伊谢尔·风歌。",oEN="Deliver the Orders from Lady Vashj to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你手里拿着什么，$n？",pEN="What's that you have there, <name>?",c="瓦斯琪！\n\n这比我们预料的还惊人。我们对抗纳迦的小胜利根本不算什么。\n\n瓦丝琪女王也涉入其中，所以比我们还强大的力量正在运作中。\n\n你把这带来给我们是对的，$n。现在我们一定要准备作战了。",cEN="Vashj!\n\nThis is much more than we bargained for. Our small victories here and there against the naga mean nothing.\n\nIf Lady Vashj is involved in this, then forces much greater than us are at work.\n\nYou've done well in bringing this to us, <name>. Now, we must prepare for war."}
Q[9765]={d="塞纳里奥远征队抱着和平的意图而来，却不得不面临与纳迦的这场全面战争。\n\n远征队的许多成员斗志昂扬地准备投入战斗，可惜我们的装备过于简陋。替我夺回一些纳迦的武器来，这样我们就能将它们重新铸造成利刃和箭头。\n\n$n，我们要利用盘牙武器铸造最好的兵器。盘牙水库便是纳迦的据点。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition began as a peaceful venture, yet we now face the prospect of all out war with the naga.\n\nWe have many among us who are willing to fight but are ill equipped. Bring me the naga's own weapons so that we may reforge them into glaives and arrowheads.\n\nOnly the best armaments will have materials useful to us, <name>. You will have to seek out the naga of Coilfang Reservoir.",o="从盘牙水库的纳迦手中夺得盘牙武器，将它们交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的伊谢尔·风歌。",oEN="Obtain Coilfang Armaments from naga at Coilfang Reservoir and return them to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你弄到我要的装备了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the armaments I seek, <name>?",c="这些非常适合，$n。你找到任何多的装备就带来给我。我们的需求量很大而我们的资源很不足。",cEN="These will do perfectly, <name>. Bring any more armaments you find. Our need is great and our resources are scarce."}
Q[9766]={p="我们会将纳迦自己的钢铁拿来铸造成武器对付他们。帮我把你在盘牙水库找到的装备带来给我。",pEN="We will forge the naga's own steel into weapons to use against them. Bring me all the armaments you manage to salvage from Coilfang Reservoir.",c="做得好，$n。这样纳迦就会知道不能小看我们。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. The naga will learn not to underestimate us."}
Q[9769]={d="<玛加沙莞尔一笑。>\n\n我敢打赌，如果他们知道自己身上的衣物取材于昆虫的翅膀，这种流行趋势立马就会终结。\n\n一开始，我们杀死岗哨附近的萤火虫仅仅是因为它们妨碍了我们的建筑工作。后来，有位商人曾在沼泽鼠岗哨留宿一晚，次日就买走了所有的虫翼！\n\n据说他利用虫翼来制作衣服。唔，我还是喜欢自己的盔甲。如果你能收集到一些虫翼，我很乐意将它们买下来。",dEN="<Magasha chuckles softly to herself.>\n\nI bet if they knew they were wearing bug parts, the fashion trend would end very quickly.\n\nWe first started killing the bugs 'round here 'cause they were getting in the way of our construction. Some enterprising merchant stops here, spends the night, and next thing you know he's buyin' up all the bug wings we have!\n\nSays he makes clothes out of 'em. I be stickin' to my armor, thanks. But if you gather the wings of any of the fireflies, I'll gladly buy 'em.",o="猎杀赞加沼泽的萤火虫，将8片透明的虫翼交给沼泽鼠岗哨的玛加沙。",oEN="Bring 8 Diaphanous Wings from any species of Zangarmarsh fireflies to Magasha in Swamprat Post.",p="那是什么？你被萤光蛾咬啦？\n\n<玛加沙对她自己的笑话咯咯笑个不停。>",pEN="What's that, there? Been bitten by the wing bug, have ya?\n\n<Magasha chuckles at her own joke.>",c="这些翅膀非常好，$n。这是你的酬劳。\n\n<玛加沙弯曲一个翅膀并将它拿到头旁边。>\n\n不，不适合我，但我要跟谁抱怨？\n\n<玛加沙耸耸肩。>\n\n有钱能使鬼推磨。",cEN="These be fine ones, <name>. Here's your payment.\n\n<Magasha bends one of the wings and holds it up to her head.>\n\nNope, not my thing, but who'm I to complain?\n\n<Magasha shrugs.>\n\nCoin speaks."}
Q[9770]={d="有时候我真希望德恩加能派一位萨满祭司来沼泽鼠岗哨，或者至少给我们一根图腾来牵制沼牙撕裂者吧。\n\n这些害虫泛滥成灾！事情有些不大对头，难道它们没有天敌吗？\n\n我们轮流负责捕杀沼牙撕裂者，真是疲惫不堪。$n，你来得正是时候。祝贺你！现在就出去猎杀这些该死的害虫吧！",dEN="Sometimes I wish Denjai had sent a shaman with us, or at least given us a totem to keep the marshfang rippers at bay.\n\nThe whole place is crawling with the pests! It's just not right. Shouldn't something be eating these despicable things?\n\nWe've all been taking turns playing exterminator. You showed up at just the right time, <name>. Congratulations! Now get out there and mop up some marshfangs!",o="沼泽鼠岗哨的里维伊要你去杀死10只沼牙撕裂者。",oEN="Reavij at Swamprat Post wants you to kill 10 Marshfang Rippers.",p="我还是看的见沼牙生物，$n。你当然没那么快就完成。",pEN="I still see marshfangs, <name>. Surely you can't be done so soon.",c="你已经杀了足够的数量吗？\n\n<里维伊笑了笑。>\n\n我们的访客都待不久是有原因的。\n\n如果我有选择的话，我会找个更宜人的地方当前哨，但我宁愿解决那些沼牙生物也不想再忍受玛加沙的脾气了。",cEN="Had your fill already?\n\n<Reavij laughs.>\n\nThere's a reason why our visitors don't stay long.\n\nIf I had a choice, I'd find a more agreeable spot for the post, but I'll take marshfangs over Denjai's temper any day."}
Q[9771]={d="既然你已经熟悉了地形，我还有件事要请你帮忙。此地西北方有一处神秘的区域，我们称它为死亡泥潭。去过的人都说泥潭中没有任何生命的迹象，当然他们在那里停留的时间并不长。\n\n斥候尤尔巴自愿去调查死亡泥潭。三天前他就离开了哨所，到现在也没有回来。通常他不会离开那么长的时间而不送回任何报告的。$n，你愿意去找他吗？",dEN="Now that you're familiar with the terrain, I'd like to ask your help with something else. The Dead Mire, we've taken to calling the area to the northwest, is an eerie place. No one has ever reported seeing anything alive there, but they didn't stay for very long, either.\n\nScout Jyoba volunteered to investigate the area and report on his findings. He left the post three days ago and hasn't returned. It's not like him to be gone that long without sending some kind of report. Will you search for him, <name>?",o="在赞加沼泽的死亡泥潭搜寻斥候尤尔巴的下落。",oEN="Search for Scout Jyoba at the Dead Mire in Zangarmarsh.",c="这具尸体和祖莱描述的完全一样，杀他的生物是在他毫无防备的时候下的手——他的武器都还在鞘里，一个小墨水瓶也打翻在附近的地上。",cEN="The battered corpse matches Zurai's description perfectly. Whatever killed the scout appears to have taken him by surprise, as his weapon is sheathed and the contents of a small inkwell stain the nearby ground."}
Q[9772]={d="枯萎的蘑菇碎粒布满斥候尤尔巴的尸体。杀死他的一定是某种浑身长满菌类的生物，比如说盘踞在死亡泥潭的枯萎的巨人。枯萎的巨人很可能趁尤尔巴坐下来写报告时偷袭了他。\n\n若是找不到那份报告，我们根本无从得知他究竟发现了什么秘密。如果你找到了尤尔巴的报告，就把它交给祖莱。",dEN="Flecks of withered fungus dot the body of Scout Jyoba. Whatever killed him must've been made of the same dying fungus as the giant wilting mushrooms of the Dead Mire. Perhaps one of the withered giants caught him by surprise as he sat writing his report.\n\nWithout the text of the report, it's nearly impossible to tell what the scout discovered. If the report can be found, it should be returned to Zurai.",o="从枯萎的巨人手中夺回斥候尤尔巴的报告，把它交给沼泽鼠岗哨的祖莱。",oEN="Retrieve Scout Jyoba's Report from the Withered Giants and return it to Zurai at Swamprat Post.",p="你回来了，但尤尔巴没跟你一起回来。他怎么了？",pEN="You're back, but Jyoba's not with you. What became of him?",c="<祖莱从你手中接过报告并简略阅读它。>\n\n这里大部分的资讯我们都已经知道了。那区域里的一切几乎都干枯或凋谢，但这里有个新线索。\n\n他说真菌巨人缺乏水份后似乎变的很狂暴。从你的描述看来，那八成是杀了他的凶手。\n\n我会吩咐我的人避开那个区域。我们不能再失去更多人手了。",cEN="<Zurai accepts the report from you and glances over it.>\n\nMuch of this is information we already know. Everything in the area seems to be dried or wilting, but here's something new.\n\nHe says the fungal giants seem to have gone berserk from the lack of moisture. From your description, that must be what killed him.\n\nI'll instruct my men to avoid the area. We can't afford any more casualties."}
Q[9773]={d="蘑菇汤、蘑菇粥、蘑菇丸子、蘑菇酱！\n\n蘑菇、蘑菇、蘑菇！这里能吃的只有蘑菇。如果你饿了，厨师会扔给你一把斧头，让你自己去采些蘑菇回来！\n\n唔，我厌倦了每餐都吃蘑菇。我曾在这附近的湖泊中见过某种鳗鱼。虽然它们的长相着实恶心，但总比蘑菇好！\n\n我得吃顿像样的食物才行，说吧，我出多少钱可以让你替我弄些鱼肉大餐来？",dEN="Mushroom soup, mushroom stew, mushroom sauce!\n\nMushroom, mushroom, mushroom! It's all there is to eat around here. If you say you're hungry, the cook hands you an axe and tells you to go chop down your dinner!\n\nWell, I'm tired of mushrooms. I've seen fish in the lakes around here. Sure, they look like a nasty piece of work, but they've got to be better than mushrooms!\n\nHow much will it cost me to hire you to bring me my first decent meal in weeks?",o="猎杀暗泽鳗鱼，将8份电鳗鱼片交给沼泽鼠岗哨的玛加沙。",oEN="Gather 8 Eel Filets from Umbrafen Eels and bring them to Magasha at Swamprat Post.",p="告诉我你不是空着手回来的，$n。",pEN="Tell me you haven't come back empty-handed. <name>.",c="终于，在千篇一律的蘑菇之后可以休息一下了！如果你不是一身鱼腥味的话，我会拥抱你！\n\n让我们来看看其它人闻到鱼在火上烤的时候会有多么羡慕。",cEN="Finally, a break from the monotony of mushrooms! If you didn't smell like fish, I'd hug you.\n\nLet's see how jealous the others get when they smell the meat cooking over the fire."}
Q[9774]={d="里维伊带来了他的皮甲，真是明智啊。用不了多久，沼泽地潮湿的环境就会让我这身锁甲完全报废。\n\n我一直在设法替换这些快要生锈的部件。居住在沼泽中的多头蛇具有厚重的鳞片，能帮助它们抵御湿气。\n\n但是，要筛选出合适的鳞片却颇为费事。那些品质优良的鳞片要么被撕裂，要么因为长期的磨损，已经薄得不适合制作护甲了。去较大的湖泊中帮我找些厚重多头蛇鳞片来吧。",dEN="Reavij was wise to bring leather armor. This swamp will render my mail useless before long.\n\nI've been replacing the scales bit by bit as I'm able. The hydra in the marsh have thick, protective scales that stand up well to the dampness of their home.\n\nFinding suitable ones is a tedious process, though. All too often, the best scales are torn or worn too thin for use in armor. Bring me any good ones that you might get from the hydra in the larger lakes.",o="将12块厚重多头蛇鳞片交给沼泽鼠岗哨的祖莱。",oEN="Zurai at Swamprat Post wants you to bring him 12 Thick Hydra Scales.",p="我看到你在奸笑了。是的，我的护甲在所有的旧金属都替换完成前都会看起来很奇怪，但这样总比毫无防护来的好。",pEN="I see you smirking. Yes, my armor's going to look a bit odd until I've replaced all the old metal, but it's better this than unprotected.",c="谢谢你，$n。每一小片都派的上用场。\n\n我还要很久的时间才能替换完全，但事实上，我在等待巡逻的时候还有什么事可以做呢？",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Every little bit helps.\n\nI've still got a long way to go, but let's face it, what else am I going to do between patrols?"}
Q[9775]={d="暗影猎手登贾伊一定在等着我关于新前哨进展的报告。我已经准备好了，但自从失去了斥候乔巴，我实在抽不出人手把报告送到西边的扎布拉金基地去。\n\n如果你往那个方向去，能不能帮忙带给他？登贾伊起初有点吓人，但熟悉之后就不算什么了。",dEN="Shadow Hunter Denjai will no doubt expect to receive a report about my progress in establishing our outpost. I've prepared a short summary of what we've accomplished here already, but with the loss of Scout Jyoba, I can't spare a runner to take the report to Denjai's base of Zabra'jin to the west.\n\nIf you're headed that way, would you mind bringing this to him? Shadow Hunter Denjai can be a little intimidating at first, but once you get used to him, he's not so bad.",o="将祖莱的报告交给赞加沼泽中萨布拉金的暗影猎手德恩加。",oEN="Bring Zurai's Report to Shadow Hunter Denjai at Zabra'jin in Zangarmarsh.",p="你看起来不像是我的人。说吧，$r。",pEN="You don't look like one of my men. Speak your piece, <race>.",c="你为什么不说你有祖莱的报告？我一直在等他的消息。\n\n我派他去那里向我们报告东边边界的消息，而不是在那里无所事事。让我看看他有什么话要说。",cEN="Why didn't you say you had a report from Zurai? I've been waiting to hear from him.\n\nI sent him out there to give us a presence on the eastern border, not sit on his hands. Let's see what he has to say."}
Q[9776]={d="泰雷多尔的居民大多是从燃烧军团对德莱尼人的大屠杀中侥幸逃生的流亡者。我希望永远守护泰雷多尔，让它成为战乱中所有盟友的安全港。有一些人迫切地希望与我们结盟，但是又觉得自己还没有准备好。\n\n$n，我们应该竭尽所能地帮助他们。伊库提率领一群破碎者隐居在毒蛇湖西北方的古代神殿废墟中。去那里找到他们，伸出你的友谊之手。",dEN="As you know, many of Telredor's inhabitants are refugees from the war that decimated the draenei. It is my goal to maintain Telredor as a safe haven for all of our allies in this struggle. There are some who desire to join us, but feel they are not yet ready.\n\nWe owe them whatever help we can provide, <name>. A group of Broken under the leadership of Ikuti have taken shelter in the ruins of an old temple to the northwest of Serpent Lake. Seek them out and extend your hand in friendship to them.",o="与赞加沼泽中奥雷柏尔营地的伊库提谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ikuti at the Orebor Harborage in Zangarmarsh.",c="如果隐士安霍尔把你当做朋友，那么或许你是值得信任的。请原谅我的谨慎，$r，只是通常不谨慎就会让我的人民招致死亡。欢迎你来和我们一起避难，或许我们对彼此的信任就会增长。",cEN="If Anchorite Ahuurn counts you a friend, then you may prove trustworthy. Please forgive my wariness, <race>, but it is often all that stands between my people and death. You are welcome to shelter among us, and perhaps our mutual trust will grow."}
Q[9777]={d="这片沼泽里几乎没有什么能烧的东西，$r，所以我们只好另想办法为特雷多照明。沼泽里的许多生物和植物都会发出柔和的光。\n\n把发光的生物关起来既困难又残忍，于是我们转而用一种蘑菇作为光源。\n\n我们在这里采摘并培育亮光蘑菇，但需求所迫，我们有时还得去采集新的产量。这种绿色的小蘑菇常常长在特雷多附近那些大蘑菇的根部。",dEN="There is little in this swamp that will burn, <race>, so we must resort to other means for lighting Telredor. Many of the creatures and plants in the marsh emit a soft glow.\n\nIt's difficult and cruel to confine the glowing creatures, so we've turned to a species of mushroom for our light source.\n\nWe pick and cultivate the fulgor mushroom here, but our needs require us to gather new crops occasionally. The small green mushrooms often grow at the base of larger ones near Telredor.",o="将6个灿烂的孢子交给泰雷多尔的鲁埃姆。",oEN="Bring 6 Fulgor Spores to Ruam at Telredor.",p="照情况来看，我们需要很快的补充蘑菇。",pEN="From the looks of things, we'll need to replenish our spores soon.",c="这些是很好的孢子，应该可以让我们持续运作好一段时间。谢谢你帮我们补充物资，$n。",cEN="These are good spores and they should keep us going for quite some time. Thank you for helping us to replenish our supplies, <name>."}
Q[9778]={d="离开塞纳里奥庇护所之前，一定要去跟守望者哈穆特谈谈。他负责远征队的安全。\n\n要是我不给你这样$g一位:一位;经验丰富的冒险者指条路，他永远不会原谅我。",dEN="Before you leave Cenarion Refuge, make sure you speak with Warden Hamoot. He's in charge of the expedition's security.\n\nHe would never forgive me if I didn't send a seasoned adventurer like you his way.",o="向赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的监护者哈穆特报到。",oEN="Report to Warden Hamoot at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",c="伊谢尔派你来的？我当然会用像你这样的人！我们永远都需要一些打手。",cEN="Ysiel sent you? Of course I can use someone like you! We're always in need of a little muscle."}
Q[9779]={d="$n，很高兴见到你。或许你能帮我解决眼下的难题。\n\n位于炎鹰部队后方的密探回报，他们发现炎鹰士兵正在研究一份非同寻常的文件。\n\n可惜我们没能获得这份文件的副本，因此我要你转至血精灵营地取回文件。我相信，只要你采取足够强硬的手段，我们必定能从某个炎鹰士兵那儿获得相关的信息。我允许你随心所欲地使用武力。",dEN="It is good to see you again, <name>. I have a quandary that you might be able to solve.\n\nOur agents situated behind Sunhawk lines have reported seeing Sunhawk soldiers parsing an unusual document.\n\nUnfortunately, we have been unsuccessful in acquiring a copy of the document for ourselves. I need you to go out in the field and try to recover the document. I am certain that if you apply enough pressure, a Sunhawk agent will turn over the information we seek. I leave the use of force to your discretion.",o="不断杀死炎鹰血精灵，直到你找到炎鹰信函，然后向秘血岗哨的守备官波鲁斯复命。",oEN="Kill Sunhawk elves until you find the Sunhawk Missive, then return it to Vindicator Boros at Blood Watch.",p="这么快就回来了？你找到信函了吗？",pEN="Back so soon? Have you found the missive?",c="<守备官波鲁斯看着文件。>\n\n这是萨拉斯语。幸好，我知道谁可以翻译……",cEN="<Vindicator Boros eyes the document.>\n\nThis is in Thalassian. Fortunately, I know just the person that can translate it..."}
Q[9780]={d="真高兴能在这里见到新面孔。我和海尔伦初次来到泰雷多尔时，也像陌生人那样拘谨，不过那似乎是很久以前的事了。\n\n我们欢迎所有路经此地的冒险者，并努力确保泰雷多尔维持着充足的食物供给。虽然我们无法回报好心肠的泰雷多尔学者，但是我们会以他们为榜样，将温暖的关怀传递到每个角落。\n\n附近的湖泊中生活着一种名叫电鳗的鱼类，它们的肉是我们的主要食物来源。如果你愿意帮忙的话，就去收集一些电鳗鱼片吧。",dEN="It's good to see another fresh face here. When Haalrun and I first came to Telredor, we were the only outsiders, but that seems like a lifetime ago.\n\nStill, we try to welcome newcomers and ensure that there's always enough food and supplies. We can never fully repay the kindness of the Telredor anchorites, but we can follow their example and extend it to others.\n\nIf you would like to help, the nearby lakes are populated with a fish called the Umbrafen eel, whose meat is a staple of our diet.",o="将8份电鳗鱼片交给泰雷多尔的诺兰妮。",oEN="Noraani at Telredor wants you to bring her 8 Eel Filets.",p="你有任何鱼肉可贡献给我们储藏吗？",pEN="Have you any fish to contribute to our stores?",c="谢谢你的帮忙，$n。我们不会忘记你的慷慨协助。",cEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. Your generosity will not be forgotten."}
Q[9781]={d="上次外出狩猎时，我发现一群巨魔正在建造新的岗哨。毫无疑问，他们已经开始捕杀沼泽地的动物了。\n\n如果他们打算长期驻扎下来的话，食物的竞争将变得非常激烈。我们总不能无缘无故地向这些巨魔发动攻击吧？但是，我们可以设法减轻大自然中跟我们竞争食物的动物所带来的压力。\n\n干掉一只泥潭多头蛇，就少了三张贪吃的嘴！多划算啊！",dEN="On my last hunting trip, I caught sight of a new outpost being built by a group of trolls. No doubt they've begun hunting these lands, too.\n\nIf they establish a permanent presence out here, the competition for food will be fierce. We cannot take direct action against them without provocation, but we can remove some of the natural competition for food.\n\nFor each mire hydra you kill, that's three fewer mouths to feed!",o="杀死10只泥潭多头蛇，然后向泰雷多尔的海尔伦复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Mire Hydra and return to Haalrun at Telredor.",p="狩猎进行得如何，$g朋友:朋友;？",pEN="How goes the hunt, friend?",c="做得好。那应该可以减缓这里迫切的食物补给需求，虽然我们还需要找到新的食物来源。鱼和蘑菇够了，但我们永远不能低估了变化。",cEN="Well done. That should ease the demand on the food supply around here for the immediate future, although we're going to need to find new sources of food. Fish and mushrooms suffice, but variety can never be underestimated."}
Q[9782]={d="$n，我与泰雷多尔的学者们共同生活了一段时间，对赞加沼泽的生态环境有了深刻的了解。最近，我留意到东北方的沼泽地出现了令人不安的变化。\n\n所有的生命似乎都无缘无故地开始枯萎并死亡。我大概猜到发生了什么事，但也仅仅是我个人的推测而已。如果你能取回一份泥土样本，我或许能弄清楚真相。",dEN="I have lived among the anchorites of Telredor for some time, <name>, and in that time I've come to know the marsh quite well. Recently, I've started to notice a disturbing change in the land to the northeast.\n\nVirtually all life there has begun to wither and die, seemingly without explanation. I have a few ideas as to what might be happening, but they are little more than speculation. If you were to bring me a sample of the soil in that area, I may be able to get to the bottom of this mystery.",o="将一份死亡泥潭土壤样本交给泰雷多尔的守备官伊达尔。",oEN="Bring a Dead Mire Soil Sample to Vindicator Idaar at Telredor.",p="你拿到死亡泥潭土壤样本了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get a sample of the soil in the Dead Mire?",c="嗯……泥土看起来已经耗尽了，所以这不可能是问题的原因，我认为。这里的共同关联是什么？为什么所有的东西都突然死亡了呢？",cEN="Hmm... The soil seems to be depleted, so it can't be the cause of the problem, as I'd thought. What's the common link here? Why is everything suddenly dying?"}
Q[9783]={d="$n，你带回的泥土样本几乎完全失去了水分。如果连土壤都干涸的话，生活在死亡泥潭的生物一定面临着巨大的痛苦。\n\n瞧瞧那些枯萎的真菌巨人，难以忍受的苦楚令他们丧失了心智，到处攻击别的生物。\n\n这些巨人根本不明白发生了什么事。我们没有能力挽救枯萎的巨人，只能选择结束他们的痛苦。",dEN="The soil sample you brought me is nearly devoid of moisture, <name>. If the soil itself is losing moisture, then the creatures that live in the Dead Mire must be suffering terribly.\n\nI've seen what happens when the region's fungal giants begin to wither and die. The pain drives them mad, causing them to attack anything in their path.\n\nThese creatures have no idea what's happening to them. They're beyond our ability to save, so the best we can do is to end their suffering.",o="泰雷多尔的守备官伊达尔要你去杀死12个枯萎的巨人。",oEN="Vindicator Idaar at Telredor wants you to kill 12 Withered Giants.",p="消灭死亡泥潭的生物让我很痛苦，但我们也救不了他们。我们能做的就是努力让该区域复原，养育一个新世代。",pEN="It pains me to kill the creatures of the Dead Mire, but they are beyond saving. The best we can do is work to restore the area and nurture a new generation.",c="谢谢你帮忙解决这个困难的任务，$n。我们在死亡泥潭的工作还没结束，但现在我们会致力于复原区域的平衡。",cEN="Thank you for helping with this difficult task, <name>. Our work in the Dead Mire is not yet done, but now our efforts will focus on doing what we can to restore balance to the area."}
Q[9784]={p="我还需要更多的未鉴定过的植物。随着湖泊的水分流失，我有预感入侵当地生态的品种数量正不断的攀升。不过，我需要更多的数据来支持我的理论。",pEN="I could still use some more plant parts. With the lakes losing their water, I've a feeling the number of invasive species is on the rise. I need more numbers to back up my theory, however.",c="非常好。继续带给我更多的植物。\n\n<这个任务可以重复进行直到声望达到尊敬。>",cEN="Excellent. Keep bringing me more plant parts if you find any.\n\n<This quest is repeatable up to Honored reputation.>"}
Q[9785]={d="$n，你已经赢得了塞纳里奥远征队的信任。现在，与我们的盟友——古树埃西恩和克勒斯谈谈吧，获得他们的祝福。\n\n这些古树所赐的印记可以赋予你强大的力量。随着你在塞纳里奥远征队的声望不断提升，印记的力量也会相应增强。\n\n$n，去吧，请求古树赐福与你。",dEN="You've earned the trust of the Cenarion Expedition, <name>. It is time you spoke to the ancients allied with our cause, Ashyen and Keleth, and asked for their blessing.\n\nCarrying the mark of an ancient will fill you with great power. These boons will become more powerful as your renown among us increases.\n\nGo, <name>, and ask the ancients for their blessing.",o="唤风者塔鲁·黑蹄要求你与塞纳里奥庇护所的埃西恩和克勒斯谈一谈，获得古树的祝福。",oEN="Windcaller Blackhoof wants you to speak to the ancients Ashyen and Keleth at Cenarion Refuge and obtain their blessings.",p="你和古树谈过了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you spoken to the ancients yet, <name>?",c="你回来了。你得到古树的祝福了吗？",cEN="You've returned. Did you receive the ancients' blessings?"}
Q[9786]={d="在兽人大肆屠杀我的族人之前，泰雷多尔曾是德莱尼学者和灵魂师的庇护所。一部分德莱尼学者和守备官奉命管理这片区域的数座神殿。\n\n在混战中，我们与驻守神殿的学者失去了联系，尤其是西南方的博哈姆神殿。有报告称一支失落者氏族已经在那儿安营扎寨。调查博哈姆废墟，然后向我汇报情况。",dEN="Before my people were decimated by the orcs, Telredor served as a retreat for draenei anchorites and spiritualists. A small order of anchorites and vindicators maintained a number of shrines in this region.\n\nDuring the war, we lost contact with the anchorites assigned to the shrines, particularly the Boha'mu temple to the southwest. I've heard reports that a tribe of Lost Ones has settled in the area and may even be using the ruins. Visit the Boha'mu Ruins and tell me of what you find there.",o="泰雷多尔的学者安霍尔要你去侦察博哈姆废墟。",oEN="Anchorite Ahuurn at Telredor wants you to explore the Boha'mu Ruins.",p="你探勘过波哈姆废墟了吗？你能想象他们全盛辉煌的时期是什么样子吗？",pEN="Have you examined the Boha'mu Ruins? Can you imagine what they were like in their full splendor?",c="所以，蛮沼村的破碎者已接管废墟了？真有趣。他们一定记得自己的继承物和该地点的重要性。我们一定要了解更多，$n。这个神庙可能是解救破碎者和重新团结许多德莱尼的关键。",cEN="So, the Feralfen Lost Ones have taken over the ruins? Most intriguing. They must remember something of their heritage and the significance of the site. We must learn more, <name>. This temple could hold the key to redeeming the Lost Ones and reuniting the many threads of draenei."}
Q[9787]={d="从你在博哈姆废墟观测到的情况来看，这支失落者氏族似乎恢复了对野兽之灵的崇拜。想要接近他们，就必须了解到更多关于该氏族信仰的信息。\n\n返回蛮沼村，小心地收集一些雕像，把它们带回来供我研究。$n，尽量避免惹恼蛮沼失落者，否则很可能破坏我们与他们创建沟通的机会。",dEN="From what you've told me about your observations at the Boha'mu Ruins, it seems this tribe of Lost Ones has reverted to the worship of animal spirits. Before we can approach them, we must know more of their beliefs.\n\nReturn to Feralfen Village and discreetly gather some of their idols so that I may study them. Try to avoid angering them, <name>, as it may hurt our chances of making contact with them.",o="将6个蛮沼雕像交给泰雷多尔的学者安霍尔。",oEN="Gather 6 Feralfen Idols and return them to Anchorite Ahuurn at Telredor.",p="你拿到雕像了吗？",pEN="Do you have the idols?",c="这应该足够了，$n。他们似乎对鸟类很迷恋，但是这很奇怪，因为赞加沼泽没有土生的鸟类。这代表什么？\n\n他们有可能遇到了鸦人吗？对一个萨满民族而言，他们可能喜欢强大的鸟类灵魂化身。",cEN="These should be more than sufficient, <name>. They seem to be fixated on birds, which is odd, because there aren't any bird species native to Zangarmarsh. What could this mean?\n\nCould they have encountered the arakkoa? To a shamanistic people, they might seem like the embodiment of a powerful bird spirit."}
Q[9788]={d="我逃出暗泽村后，就躲藏在村子南边的洞穴中。我根本不知道沼泽生物和孢子人正在争夺那处洞穴！\n\n在匆忙撤离洞穴时，我不小心落下了一只装满我全部珍宝的箱子。\n\n我好不容易才带着宝箱逃离暗泽村，没想到这么快又失去了它，这简直是命运对我的嘲弄。如果你愿意帮我找回它，我就送你一件好东西。$n，你觉得怎么样？",dEN="Soon after I escaped the Umbrafen tribe, I holed up in a cave south of their village. Little did I know that the cave was being fought over by marsh beasts and spore men!\n\nI had to leave in a hurry and left behind a box containing my only worldly possessions.\n\nAfter managing to sneak out of Umbrafen with my belongings it was terrible irony that I would lose them so soon after. If you're willing to bring them back to me I'll give you one of my very own personal items. What do you say, <name>?",o="进入暗泽村以南的一处洞穴寻找伊卡因的物品，把它们还给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的伊卡因。",oEN="Look for Ikeyen's Belongings inside a cave south of Umbrafen. Return them to Ikeyen at Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你找到我的东西了吗，$n？那洞穴离暗泽村不远，就在纳格兰的边界附近。",pEN="Did you find my belongings, <name>? The cave is not far from Umbrafen, near the border with Nagrand.",c="我的东西！全都在这！\n\n谢谢你，$n。如我所承诺的，我要让你选一个物品。我没有太多东西，但我的族人永远都乐于分享仅有的一切。",cEN="My things! They're all here!\n\nI thank you, <name>. As promised, I'll let you pick one of the items for yourself. I don't have much to offer, but my people have always shared what little we have."}
Q[9789]={d="你想在这次狩猎远征中赢得一席之地？那你得先证明自己。\n\n我可不在乎你以前猎过什么。在我看来，你要是没猎过我们这儿猎的东西，就等于从没猎过。要是你觉得自己够$g强悍:强悍;，就从裂蹄牛开始吧！\n\n远征队附近就有，往南也有。",dEN="You want to earn a place in this safari? You'll have to prove yourself.\n\nI don't care what you've hunted before, you haven't hunted until you hunt what we hunt here. Start with the clefthoof if you're <man /tough> enough.\n\nI know that I've seen them in the immediate area around the safari and also close by to the south.",o="杀死12头裂蹄牛，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里复命。",oEN="Hunt down 12 Clefthoof and return to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Safari in Nagrand to prove yourself.",p="纳格兰的裂蹄牛是个很好的挑战。我已经猎捕到好一些了。\n\n你进行的怎么样？",pEN="The clefthoof of Nagrand are a good challenge. I've bagged myself quite a few.\n\nHow are you doing with that?",c="一个不错的开始。不过这只是个开始。\n\n低等的裂蹄牛证明不了什么。来面对更大的挑战吧。",cEN="A fair start. But that's just the beginning.\n\nThe lesser clefthoof prove nothing. Let's move you up to a bigger challenge"}
Q[9790]={d="生活在这穷乡僻壤，迫使我们学会了就地取材，物尽其用。当然，你最好别去细想某些材料的来源。\n\n我发现暗光钉刺者的翅膀具有防水效果。它们的质地坚韧、轻薄而富有弹性。\n\n<海尔伦轻声地笑了。>\n\n瞧你脸上的表情。我说过，别去细想这些材料的来源。如果你正要出去走走，能不能帮我带回一些虫翼？",dEN="Living in such a remote location has taught us to make use of everything available. Of course, you have to learn to stop thinking about where some of these materials come from first.\n\nI've found that the wings of the umbraglow stingers are very helpful for waterproofing. They're strong, thin, and flexible.\n\n<Haalrun chuckles.>\n\nI see the look on your face. Like I said, it takes time to get used to the idea. If you're going to be out and about, would you mind bringing me some of the wings?",o="猎杀赞加沼泽的萤火虫，将8片透明的虫翼交给泰雷多尔的海尔伦。",oEN="Haalrun at Telredor wants you to bring him 8 Diaphanous Wings from any of the firefly species in Zangarmarsh.",p="你收集到那些萤火虫翅膀了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to gather any diaphanous wings?",c="谢谢你，$n。\n\n<海尔伦笑了笑。>\n\n至少你不用清理它们。这是所有工作中最讨厌的一个，但一旦完成后，你永远也不会知道它是来自于一只庞大的昆虫。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\n<Haalrun smiles sympathetically.>\n\nAt least you don't have to clean them. That's the worst job of the lot, but once it's done, you'd never know they were attached to a giant insect."}
Q[9791]={d="在兽人与德莱尼人交战期间，为了避免遭受袭击或是沦为俘虏，我们很少离开泰雷多尔。现在，我们时常会冒险外出，但是沼泽地依然危机四伏。\n\n最近几个月，虚空鳐越发肆虐起来。不知道是不是跟激烈的捕食竞争有关，它们频繁地攻击我们的粮草征收队。如果我们能削减泰雷多尔附近的虚空鳐的数量，或许它们就不会再来滋扰生事了。",dEN="During the orcs' war against my people, gatherers rarely left Telredor for fear of being attacked or captured. Now, we venture out more often, but the marsh is no less perilous.\n\nIt seems that the nether rays have grown bolder in recent months. I don't know if it has something to do with more competition for their normal prey, but they've been attacking our foraging parties on a regular basis. If we can thin their ranks in the area around Telredor, perhaps they would learn to leave us alone.",o="杀掉10个沼牙撕裂者，然后向泰雷多尔的诺兰妮复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Marshfang Rippers and return to Noraani at Telredor.",p="你的沼牙打猎进行的顺利吗？",pEN="Have you been successful in your marshfang hunt?",c="谢谢你帮忙清除了一些沼牙撕裂者，$n。如果他们有点智慧的话，或许他们就会知道生命和放生是最好的选择。\n\n<诺兰妮耸了耸肩。>\n\n巨大，过度生长又有智慧的虫子。不知道那是什么样子……",cEN="Thank you for your help in clearing out some of the marshfang rippers, <name>. If they had any intelligence, perhaps they'd learn that it's best to live and let live.\n\n<Noraani shrugs.>\n\nGiant, overgrown bugs with intelligence. I wonder what that would be like..."}
Q[9792]={d="在我们打交道的过程中，你一直光明磊落，$n，而如今在我族人之间，信任是极难得的。\n\n我族中一大批同胞已在南边纳格兰的古老德莱尼城市塔拉安家。要前往塔拉，沿大路向南进入纳格兰，然后继续往东南走，直到你来到奥舒古恩东边的峭壁之间。\n\n任何像你这样帮助过我们的人，都会受到塔拉人民的欢迎。\n\n去找守望者莫伊布夫·吉尔，告诉他你已经赢得了我的信任。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You've been honorable in our dealings, <name>, at a time when trust is hard to win among my people.\n\nA large group of my brethren have made their home in the old draenei city of Telaar in Nagrand, to the south. To reach Telaar, take the road south into Nagrand, then continue southeast until you find yourself in the cliffs east of Oshu'gun.\n\nAnyone who has aided us, as you have, would be welcome among the people of Telaar.\n\nSeek out Nahuud and tell him you have earned my trust.",o="转至纳格兰，与塔拉的纳霍德谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nahuud at Telaar in Nagrand.",c="伊库提就像我的兄弟一样。他的朋友就是我的朋友。我们欢迎你，$n，感谢你帮助我们的人民。",cEN="Ikuti is like a brother to me. A friend of his is a friend of mine. You are welcome here, <name>, and you have our thanks for assisting our people."}
Q[9793]={d="先知维伦坚持不懈寻求盟友的事迹鼓舞了外域的德莱尼人，他们开始搜寻自己的同盟。燃烧军团将我们逐出城镇和神殿，却没能摧毁我们的文明。\n\n泰罗卡森林的图雷姆曾经是我的家园，也是第一座被兽人侵占的城镇。我很久都没有收到来自图雷姆的消息了。转至泰罗卡森林的奥蕾莉亚要塞，将这封信交给安达尔吧，顺便查探那儿的情况。",dEN="Prophet Velen's search for allies has emboldened those draenei remaining in Outland to begin a search of their own. The Legion's war on my people drove us from our cities and temples, but they have not destroyed the traces of our civilization.\n\nTuurem, my former home in the Terokkar Forest, was one of the first cities overrun by the orcs. It's been too long since I've received news of its status. Take this letter to Andarl in the Allerian Stronghold within Terokkar and see what you can find out.",o="将守备官伊达尔的信交给泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的安达尔。",oEN="Take Vindicator Idaar's Letter to Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="How may I help you?",c="嗯……我记得我有听过我们的斥候谈起北边森林有个德莱尼居住地的废墟。我本身不太了解那废墟的事，不过你可以和一些斥候聊聊。",cEN="Hmm... I remember hearing our scouts speak of the ruins of a draenei settlement in the forest's northern reaches. I don't know much about the ruins, personally, but you're welcome to talk to some of the scouts."}
Q[9794]={d="$n，我想请你帮个忙。通常我都是自己来做这件事，不过眼下实在是忙不过来。\n\n我的朋友基亚隆居住在北边刀锋山的希尔瓦纳。他希望近期能收到我的回信，不过我怀疑信件的内容只会令他心情不悦。\n\n如果你能帮我把这封信交给他，我会非常感谢你的。我要强调一下，这事儿非同小可，你绝对不能私下拆阅。只有基亚隆有权阅读此信。",dEN="<name>, I have a favor to ask of you. Normally, I would do this myself, but my hands are already beyond full.\n\nI have an associate named Kialon at Sylvanaar in the Blade's Edge Mountains to the north. He's expecting to hear from me in the near future, although I suspect he won't like what I have to say.\n\nIf you would deliver my response to him, you would have my gratitude. I must insist, and this is very important, that you not attempt to read the letter. It is for Kialon's eyes alone.",o="将迪莫斯的信交给刀锋山希尔瓦纳的基亚隆。",oEN="Deliver Timothy's Letter to Kialon at Sylvanaar in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="<基亚隆怀疑地看着你。>\n\n我不认识你，$r。你有事找我吗？",pEN="<Kialon eyes you suspiciously.>\n\nI don't know you, <race>. Do you have business with me?",c="所以你带了迪莫斯的答复来？\n\n<基亚隆读了一下信，然后笑了。>\n\n他说他把一切都搞定了。他说不需要帮忙。我就知道！\n\n有些人就是不会变。看，他还有时间纠正我的拼写。\n\n<基亚隆发出一声无趣的叹息。>\n\n我不该寄这封信的。我忘了。专家永远都能掌控情势。永远。",cEN="So you've brought Timothy's response?\n\n<Kialon pauses a moment to read the letter, then laughs.>\n\nHe's got everything under control, he says. Doesn't need help, he says. I could've predicted that!\n\nSome people never change. Look, he even took the time to correct my spelling.\n\n<Kialon lets out a half-hearted sigh.>\n\nI shouldn't have sent the letter. I forgot. The specialist always has the situation under control. Always."}
Q[9795]={d="食人魔似乎并不满足于与纳迦结盟，他们还将自己的领地扩张到了沼泽地。这帮渣滓占领了西北边的大部分地区，萨布拉金已是岌岌可危。\n\n食人魔军队数量庞大，简直杀之不尽。一旦他们决定攻打萨布拉金，我不知道我们能坚持多久。转至位于北部山脉的雷神要塞，将我们的处境告诉奈克塔尔。无论他给予我们什么样的帮助，我们都会感激不尽的。",dEN="As if the naga and their allies weren't enough, the ogres are extending their reach in the marsh. They've already conquered most of the area to the northwest and there isn't much of a buffer left.\n\nFor each one we kill, several more take their place. I'm not sure how long we'll be able to hold Zabra'jin once they decide to attack. Make your way north into the mountains, to the orcish stronghold of Thunderlord Stronghold and let Nekthar know of our plight. Any help he can spare would be most welcome.",o="转至刀锋山的雷神要塞，与奈克塔尔谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains and speak with Nekthar.",c="玛加沙在寻求协助？我很希望能派一些援军去他那里，但我们这里也正短缺人手。我们自己也在烦恼出现在这里的食人魔。\n\n等我可以的时候，我会让他知道我们掌握的当地食人魔部族消息和他们的策略。或许如果他可以活久一点的话，我们就能对那些恶棍来个双叉攻击。",cEN="Denjai seeks help? I'd send him reinforcements, but we're spread thin here as it is. We've got trouble of our own with the ogres up here.\n\nWhen I can, I'll give him what information we have on the local ogre tribes and their tactics. Perhaps if he can survive long enough, we'll be able to launch a two-pronged assault on the vile scum."}
Q[9796]={d="除了暗影猎手德恩加之外，泰罗卡森林裂石堡的莫萨卡也在等待我发回报告。裂石堡的信使频繁路经沼泽地，因此她迫切地想要了解岗哨建设的进展。\n\n她说一旦沼泽鼠岗哨建成，就立即告诉她。如果你愿意去裂石堡跑一趟的话，我会非常感谢你的。岗哨很快就能投入正常使用了，但是还有很多事情等着我们去做。\n\n沿着南边的道路穿越赞加沼泽，进入泰罗卡森林，抵达图雷姆后继续往南走便是裂石堡。",dEN="Shadow Hunter Denjai isn't the only one expecting a report from me. Mokasa at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar is eager to hear of our progress, especially since most of her messengers travel through here.\n\nShe asked me to send word once Swamprat Post was completed. If you wouldn't mind delivering the news, I'd be very grateful. We may be up and running, but there is still much to be done.\n\nTo get to Stonebreaker Hold, follow the road south out of Zangarmarsh, into Terokkar Forest and beyond Tuurem.",o="转至泰罗卡森林的裂石堡，与莫萨卡谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mokasa at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",c="他也是时候让前哨发挥功用了。我们已经丧失太多人手在联盟先遣骑手上。",cEN="It's about time he got that outpost up and running. We've lost far too many runners to Alliance outriders."}
Q[9797]={d="<信使喘着气，示意你坐下。>\n\n$r，他们可能难逃此劫！以你最快的速度赶往加拉达尔吧。\n\n<见你一脸茫然，信使详细地解释起来。>\n\n玛格汉氏族的家园就在纳格兰。沿着南边的道路穿越赞加沼泽，在第一个交叉口往东转，玛格汉氏族的驻地就座落在湖畔附近。\n\n向我们的指挥官克洛坎上尉伸出援手。加拉达尔绝不能失守！",dEN="<Still catching his breath, the messenger gestures for you to sit.>\n\nThey may not survive, <race>! Get to Garadar as quickly as your legs will carry you.\n\n<In response to your blank stare, the messenger elaborates.>\n\nThe home of the Mag'har, lies to the south, in Nagrand. Take the southern road out of the marsh, then turn east at the first fork and look for a large settlement on the lake.\n\nFind our commander, Captain Kroghan, there and offer him what assistance you can. Garadar must not fall!",o="转至纳格兰的加拉达尔，与克洛坎上尉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Kroghan at Garadar in Nagrand.",c="<虽然克洛坎上尉试图隐藏，但他脸上仍扫过松了一口气的表情。>\n\n你也该是时候到这里了！你不是一个军人，但我们欢迎任何除了会挥舞武器或吟诵法术的强壮$r。加拉达尔的人民是所有部落的同类，为了他们的防御而流血我们很骄傲。",cEN="<Even though he endeavors to hide it, a look of relief spreads over Kroghan's face.>\n\nIt's about time you got here! Granted, you're not an army, but any able-bodied <race> than can wield a weapon or chant a spell is welcome here. The people of Garadar are kin to all the Horde and we are proud to shed our blood in their defense."}
Q[9798]={d="这些计划书似乎挺重要的，你应该将它们交给坠毁点的守备官奥达尔。",dEN="These plans seem important. You should take them to Vindicator Aldar at the crash site.",o="将血精灵计划书交给埃门谷坠毁点的守备官奥达尔。",oEN="Take the Blood Elf Plans to Vindicator Aldar at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="你拿着什么？",pEN="What have you got there?",c="来，让我看看那些计划书。\n\n血精灵跟踪我们到了这里？他们真是坏到骨子里了，应该让他们消失在这世界上！\n\n<守备官平复了一下他的心情。>\n\n我道歉，刚刚失礼了。你发现这个消息让我们欠你一个人情，$n。",cEN="Here, let me read those plans.\n\nThe blood elves have followed us here? They are evil to the core and should be wiped from existence!\n\n<The vindicator takes a moment to regain his composure.>\n\nI apologize, that was uncalled for. We are indebted to you for uncovering this information, <name>."}
Q[9799]={d="此地的鞭笞者大多聚集在西边的埃门平原。由于地下水源已经被附近的湖水污染，植物学家塔蕾克丝担心在我们净化湖水之前，这些鞭笞者恐怕无法繁衍后代。\n\n转至埃门平原采集一些被污染的花朵，我或许能找出解决办法来。被污染的花朵有着非比寻常的红色花瓣，很容易辨认。",dEN="The Ammen Fields to the west are the primary breeding ground of the local lasher population. With the corruption of the water table from the nearby lake, Botanist Taerix is worried that the lashers will not be able to repopulate themselves once we've cleansed the lake.\n\nGo to the Ammen Fields and pick some of the corrupted flowers for me so that I might take a look at them and see what can be done. You should be able to identify them by their uncharacteristic red petals.",o="采集3朵被污染的花朵，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的学徒维莎尔复命。",oEN="Gather 3 Corrupted Flowers and return them to Apprentice Vishael at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="嗨，$c。你弄到那些花了吗？",pEN="Hello, <class>. Do you have those flowers yet?",c="这些看起来像完好的品种。谢谢你完成了这里的工作。等我有时间分析它们，我应该就能知道如何使平原复原了。",cEN="These look like fine specimens. Thank you for performing the field work. Once I can find the time to analyze these, I should be able to tell what it will take to restore the fields."}
Q[9800]={d="你目前的装备还不足以面对纳格兰的元素之灵。在你帮得上大地之环之前，得先帮帮你自己。\n\n往西你会看到几堆粪便，是纳格兰野生动物的遗留物。你必须在粪便里寻找被消化过的纳格兰腰果残渣。有了这种豆子，我就能做出一片药片，助你对抗那永不安宁的自然之力。\n\n等你收集到至少两把腰果再回来见我……是食人魔尺寸的拳头两把。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You are ill-equipped to face the restless elements of Nagrand. Before you can help the Earthen Ring, you must help yourself.\n\nTo the west you will find dung heaps left behind by the wildlife of Nagrand. You must search the dung for the digested remnants of the Nagrand caracoli. From this bean I am able to make a tablet that will aid you in your battle against the restless forces of nature.\n\nReturn to me when you have collected no less than two fists worth of caracoli... Ogre sized fists.",o="将8颗挖出来的卡拉果交给纳格兰元素王座的元素师鲁艾普。",oEN="Elementalist Lo'ap at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to bring him 8 Digested Caracoli.",p="<元素师鲁艾普做出两个拳头对立的样子并不可置信地摇摇头。>\n\n巨魔般尺寸的拳头……",pEN="<Elementalist Lo'ap makes two fists and shakes his head in disapproval.>\n\nOgre sized...",c="请不要用王座神圣的水洗你的身体。\n\n<元素师鲁艾普拿出一个预先准备好的药片。>\n\n将这个放在你的舌头下面让时间融化它。等它融解了，你就能像在呼吸空气一样在水里呼吸。",cEN="Please do not wash yourself in the sacred waters of the Throne.\n\n<Elementalist Lo'ap holds a prepared caracoli tablet up.>\n\nYou place this under your tongue and allow it ample time to dissolve. Once it has dissolved, you will be able to breathe water as if it were air."}
Q[9801]={d="我觉得失落者对德莱尼人恐怕不会有什么好脸色，但对鸦人说不定会欢迎。我可以配一瓶药水，让你在一段时间内变成鸦人的模样，但需要几样无法储存、必须新鲜使用的材料。\n\n给我带一把孢子蝠的眼睛和一些沼泽阔步者的触须来。这两种生物都生活在特雷多周边的荒野里。",dEN="I have a feeling that these Lost Ones may not respond well to a draenei, but would welcome an arakkoa. I can create a potion that will allow you to take on the form of an arakkoa for a short time. It requires a couple of reagents which cannot be stored and must be used within hours of being gathered.\n\nYou will need to bring me a handful of sporebat eyes and some fen strider tentacles. Both species dwell in the wilderness surrounding Telredor.",o="将4只孢子蝠的眼睛和4根沼泽阔步者的触须交给泰雷多尔的学者安霍尔。",oEN="Anchorite Ahuurn at Telredor wants you to bring him 4 Sporebat Eyes and 4 Fen Strider Tentacles.",p="你收集到材料了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the reagents?",c="这些会非常有用。让我混合一下这个药水。",cEN="These will do quite nicely. Allow me a moment to mix up the potion."}
Q[9802]={d="赞加沼泽的湖泊日益干涸，我们尚未查明具体原因，但是许多植物正面临灭绝的危险。\n\n做为远征队的编目者，我的任务是记录和鉴定植株，帮助我们更好地了解它们的特性。\n\n如果你愿意帮忙，就替我采集一些未鉴定过的植物。如果你恰好是草药师的话，可以直接从地面上采集到这种植物，当然你也可以在沼泽生物身上找到它们。",dEN="The lakes of Zangarmarsh are slowly being drained of their water. We don't quite know why, but we do know that many plants species are in danger of becoming extinct.\n\nAs the expedition's cataloguer, it is my job to track and identify these plants so we can better understand what's happening to them.\n\nIf you'd like to help, bring me unidentified plant parts. They can be picked right from the ground if you're an herbalist, and the indigenous creatures of the swamp may also carry plant parts on them.",o="将10株未鉴定过的植物交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的劳兰娜·萨维尔。",oEN="Bring 10 Unidentified Plant Parts to Lauranna Thar'well at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你找到植物部件了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you find any plant parts, <name>?",c="本地品种的数量减少情形令人忧心。侵入性品种的增加可能和最近的生态干扰有关。不过我还没有足够的资讯可做结论。\n\n<劳兰娜一边检视那些植物一边在日记上草草记下一些笔记。>\n\n带着这些，$n。它们或许对你有用。\n\n把任何你找到的其它未鉴定过的植物带来。我就会把它们统计在我的资料里。",cEN="The decrease in native species is certainly a cause for concern. The increase in invasive species could be related to the recent disturbance in the ecosystem. I don't have enough information to make a conclusion, yet.\n\n<Lauranna jots down some notes on a journal as she goes through the plant parts.>\n\nTake these, <name>. They might be of some use to you.\n\nBring me any other plant parts you find. I'll incorporate them into my statistics."}
Q[9803]={d="是时候向蛮沼失落者表明我们的诚意了，让他们明白圣光并没有抛弃他们。带上我为你准备的药水，转至博哈姆废墟。\n\n到达废墟后立即喝下药水，伪装成蛮沼失落者崇拜的猛禽之魂的模样。与长者库鲁提谈一谈，告诉他德莱尼人将蛮沼失落者视为失散多年的同胞，我们期待着与他们的重聚。",dEN="The time has come for us to embrace the Feralfen and teach them that the Light has not forsaken them. Take the potion I've prepared and carry it with you to the Boha'mu Ruins.\n\nOnce you arrive at the ruins, drink the potion to assume the form of one of their bird spirits. Speak with Elder Kuruti and let him know the draenei are ready to welcome his people as our long lost brothers.",o="到达博哈姆废墟后饮下安霍尔的药剂，伪装成鸦人，然后与长者库鲁提谈一谈。",oEN="Drink Ahuurn's Elixir while standing in the Boha'mu Ruins. Speak to Elder Kuruti while you are in the form of an arakkoa.",p="你和蛮沼村的长者谈过了吗？",pEN="Did you speak with the Feralfen elder?",c="他们拒绝？他们可以选择自己想要的道路，当然，但他们的选择让我太惊讶了。我认为所有的德莱尼，包括破碎者和破碎者，都会记得我们全都是同一个种族的一份子。\n\n我们是不该欺骗他们，但难道他看不出我们的意图是友善的吗？",cEN="They refused? They are welcome to choose their own path, of course, but their choice surprises me. I would think that all the draenei, including the Broken and Lost Ones, would still remember that we're all a part of the same people.\n\nI suppose he is right about the folly of deceiving them, but still, could he not see that our intentions were friendly?"}
Q[9804]={d="纳格兰水域中那异常的潮汐涨落令天歌湖的湖水之魂躁动不安。它们沿着水道，企图将骚乱的种子传播到其它地方。\n\n流水之贤者瓦图苏以幻像的形式出现在我们面前，请求大地之环伸出援手，找出这场骚乱的根源，令躁动的元素恢复平静。\n\n我们一定要揪出破坏自然平衡的幕后真凶，不过首先你必须解决元素王座眼前的难题。杀死湖水之魂，然后向我复命。",dEN="The disturbance in the ebb and flow of the waters of Nagrand has greatly agitated the water spirits of Skysong Lake. They have in turn begun sowing destruction throughout the waterways of the area.\n\nWatoosun of the Water has come to us in a vision and granted us permission to remedy the problem - so long as the source of the disturbance is also dealt with...\n\nWe will get to the source, but first you must deal with the problems immediate to the Throne. Destroy the agitated lake spirits and return to me.",o="消灭8个湖水之魂，然后向纳格兰元素王座的元素师鲁艾普复命。",oEN="Elementalist Lo'ap at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to destroy 8 Lake Spirits.",p="在你还没潜入太深的湖底时使用纳格兰樱桃。",pEN="Use the Nagrand cherries before delving too deeply into the lake.",c="<元素师鲁艾普在水里跪下并开始祈祷。>\n\n大地之环对所做的事并不自豪。我们做该做的事来治疗大地。",cEN="<Elementalist Lo'ap kneels in the water and says a prayer.>\n\nThe Earthen Ring takes no pride in what was done. We do what we must to heal the land."}
Q[9805]={d="卑鄙的失落者！那群家伙被放逐到赞加沼泽后，仍然蠢蠢欲动，企图将污秽的种子传播到世界的其它角落。\n\n我已向元素寻求解决之道，并与他们达成了共识：要根治这场骚乱，就得让失落者尝尝元素的厉害！\n\n这蔟活火取自伊森拉图斯的火焰精华。转至东南方的风茅村，用活火焚毁失落者的小屋！让他们看看那熊熊燃烧的怒火！",dEN="The wretched Lost Ones, heretofore banished to the swamps of Zangarmarsh, are seeking to spread their filth to other parts of our world.\n\nI have sought the wisdom of the furies and gained their blessing. To stop the source, we must unleash the elements upon them!\n\nI give you living fire, plucked from the fiery essence of Incineratus himself. Travel to Windyreed Village, southeast of here, and unleash the living fire upon their huts! Let them see the fury of the elements!",o="纳格兰元素王座的元素师鲁艾普要你焚毁风茅村的大棚屋、西部棚屋、南部棚屋和东部棚屋。\n\n完成任务后将活火还给元素师鲁艾普。",oEN="Elementalist Lo'ap at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to destroy the Large Hut, the Western Hut, the Southern Hut and the Eastern Hut at Windyreed Village.\n\nReturn the Living Fire to Elementalist Lo'ap when the task is complete.",p="我非常惭愧地告诉你，是我的族人想在纳格兰的水源建造沼泽地。",pEN="With great shame I tell you that it is my own kin who seek to drudge up the waters of Nagrand and create marshland.",c="你的努力抑止了污染的散播，但又有其它的问题显现出来。",cEN="Your efforts have stifled the spread of pollution but other troubles have surfaced."}
Q[9806]={d="孢子蝠和泥沼游荡者通常聚集在沼泽地的长杆蘑菇附近，它们的附肢上堆积着许多成熟的孢子。\n\n瞧，我们身材矮小，能够采集到的孢子非常有限。你能帮我们从孢子蝠和泥沼游荡者身上收集成熟的孢子吗？所有的孢子人都会感谢你的。",dEN="Spore bats and marsh walkers accumulate fertile spores on their appendages from wandering around the tallstalk mushrooms in the marsh.\n\nAs you can see, we're a short people so our options for gathering these spores are limited. Seek out the spore bats and marsh walkers and gather the fertile spores. All of Sporeggar will be in your debt.",o="从赞加沼泽的孢子蝠和泥沼游荡者身上收集6个成熟的孢子，把它们交给孢子村的格沙弗。",oEN="Gshaff wants you to gather 6 Fertile Spores from the various Zangarmarsh Spore Bats and Marsh Walkers. Return to Ghsaff at Sporeggar when you've completed this task.",p="你回来了，$n。你取得了成熟的孢子吗？",pEN="You're back, <name>. Did you obtain the fertile spores?",c="这些是很棒的孢子，$n！成熟的孢子对重建我们的城镇来说是很重要的。在经历泥沼领主攻击后，我们的物品异常短缺。",cEN="These are great spores, <name>! Tallstalks are vital to rebuilding our town. And after all the bog lord attacks we've suffered, we're in quite the short supply."}
Q[9807]={p="我们永远都需要成熟的孢子，$r。亮顶蘑菇是非常有用的东西，种植它们让我们可以做更多的事。",pEN="We can always use more fertile spores, <race>. Tallstalks are incredibly useful mushrooms. Being able to grow them lets us do many things with them.",c="感谢你的帮忙，$n。你会继续努力吧？",cEN="Your help is appreciated, <name>. You will keep it up, yes?"}
Q[9808]={d="我看见你们使用亮闪闪的金属圆片来交换各自需要的东西。其实我们跟你们差不多吧，不过我们用的是亮闪闪的圆蘑菇。\n\n沼泽地里遍布着亮顶蘑菇，你只需要懂得如何采集这些蘑菇而不至于将它们弄坏就行了。如果你愿意帮助我们采集一些亮顶蘑菇，我就告诉你该怎么做。$n，你觉得怎么样？",dEN="I've seen your kind use shiny round pieces of metal to trade for things that you need. We're not so different from you. We use shiny round mushrooms as our currency.\n\nGlowcap mushrooms grow everywhere in the marsh, you just have to know how to pick them from the ground without wrecking them. I'll teach you how to do it, if you promise to bring us some for our reserves. What do you say, <name>?",o="将10枚亮顶蘑菇交给赞加沼泽孢子村中的姆希菲。",oEN="Bring 10 Glowcaps to Msshi'fn at Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh.",p="你找到亮顶蘑菇了吗，$n？它们在沼泽里到处都是。\n\n如果你注意的话，远远就可以看见它们闪亮的白光了。",pEN="Did you find any glowcaps, <name>? They're literally everywhere in the marsh.\n\nYou can spot their bright glow from far away if you pay attention.",c="这可以让我们和其它孢子人交换食物和补给。孢子村感谢你，$n！",cEN="This will help us trade with other sporelings for food and supplies. Sporeggar thanks you, <name>!"}
Q[9809]={p="如果你有更多亮顶蘑菇就给我。我们的村子永远都需要更多亮顶蘑菇。",pEN="I'll take more glowcaps if you have them. Our village can always use more of them.",c="谢谢你，$n。身为孢子村的长者，我一定要确保我的人民有足够的补给。你让我的工作更轻松了。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. As Sporeggar's elder, I must ensure my people have adequate supplies. You make my task that much easier."}
Q[9810]={d="瓦图苏设法抵御了这场灾难的侵袭，可惜这位贤者却不慎在净化过程中制造出了一块扭曲的灵魂精华。这块灵魂精华汇集了最可怕的元素污染质！\n\n转至西南方的沼泽地，瓦图苏的污染精华就藏匿在日泉湖的深处。\n\n杀死瓦图苏的污染精华以及日泉湖中被污染的水元素生物。",dEN="Watoosun was able to shed the stink of corruption; but in doing so, created a twisted spirit essence. A spirit essence composed of the vilest corruption found amongst the elements!\n\nYou will find this polluted spirit of the swamp southwest of here, hidden in the depths of Lake Sunspring.\n\nFind and destroy the polluted essence of Watoosun and any corrupt offspring that it may have created.",o="杀死瓦图苏的污染精华和8个湖水涌动者，然后向纳格兰元素王座的元素师鲁艾普复命。",oEN="Elementalist Lo'ap at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to destroy Watoosun's Polluted Essence and 8 Lake Surgers.",p="大地之环会尽全力帮忙。",pEN="The Earthen Ring will help in any way possible.",c="在污染的精华被摧毁的一刻，元素赞颂你的胜利！大地之环感谢你并请你选一个奖励。",cEN="The elements sang of your victory the moment the disturbed essence was destroyed! The Earthen Ring thanks you and wishes for you to choose a reward."}
Q[9811]={d="这是血精灵历史新篇章的开始，$n。你让我们的种族与你的种族之间的联系更加紧密了。\n\n将这个叛徒的首级拿去交给银月城的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆。他一定是最渴望听到这个消息的人。",dEN="This is the beginning of a new chapter in blood elf history, <name>. You've helped cement the bond between my race and yours, <race>.\n\nTake the traitor's head to Regent Lord Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City. He'll be eager to hear the news.",o="将达尔坎的徽记交给银月城的洛瑟玛·塞隆。",oEN="Take Dar'Khan's Head to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.",p="你是来求见我的？我不记得有过预约。",pEN="You seek audience with me? I do not recall hearing of an appointment.",c="你杀了达克汗，$r？了不起。我有预感我们的人民很快就会变成好朋友了。",cEN="So you killed Dar'Khan, <race>? Impressive. I've a feeling my people and yours will soon get to be very good friends."}
Q[9812]={d="在我们潜在的新盟友之中，似乎有些人还对我们的能力有所质疑。如果他们发觉我们连自己家门口的问题都不能摆平，又怎么会觉得我们能对他们有所帮助呢？\n\n你做的事情将会改变这个状况。我们的能力很快就不再会受到任何质疑。我们将很快以与新盟友们对等的身份加入部落。\n\n将这封信交给被遗忘者的领袖，希尔瓦娜斯女王。她一直站在我们这一边，达尔坎的死讯对她来说无疑将会是最美妙的音乐。做好长途旅行的准备吧，$n。如果一切顺利，她可能会派你去奥格瑞玛。",dEN="There were doubts about our capabilities among our potential new allies. Of what use could we be to them when perceived as unable to deal with our problems at home?\n\nThis changes everything. No longer will our power be questioned. We'll be able to join the Horde as equals.\n\nTake this letter to Sylvanas, ruler of the Forsaken. She's already on our side but the news of Dar'Khan's death will be music to her ears. Prepare for a long trip, <name>. If all goes well she will send you to Orgrimmar.",o="到提瑞斯法林地去，将洛瑟玛·塞隆的信交给被遗忘者的首都幽暗城中的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Bring the Letter from Lor'themar Theron to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity, the Forsaken capital in Tirisfal Glades.",p="有人告诉我，一位来自奎尔萨拉斯的访客要来。说实话，我本以为会是个血精灵。\n\n你带来了什么消息？",pEN="I was told a visitor from Quel'Thalas was coming. I was expecting a blood elf, to tell you the truth.\n\nWhat news do you bring?",c="那么事情已经了结了。那个邪恶的叛徒得到了应有的下场。\n\n你为血精灵和部落立下了大功。达尔坎曾是萨尔拒绝让他们加入我们同盟的借口。你为一个新的部落扫清了道路，$c。\n\n我还看到洛瑟玛另有消息，那会大大改善他与萨尔的关系。太好了！",cEN="It is done then. The foul traitor got what he deserved.\n\nYou've been of great service to the blood elves and to the Horde. Dar'khan was Thrall's excuse to deny them entry into our alliance. You've cleared the way for a new Horde, <class>.\n\nI also see that Lor'themar has additional news that will greatly improve his relations with Thrall. Excellent!"}
Q[9813]={d="你知道的，我还没有丧失对往昔的故乡与人民的爱。我曾为了银月城能在幽暗城与奥格瑞玛的谈判桌上有一席之地而与兽人针锋相对。\n\n你带来的消息可以让任何反对者闭上嘴。立刻将这封信送给奥格瑞玛的萨尔酋长。身为部落的领袖，他会最终接受辛多雷的效忠宣誓。\n\n我已经在信上盖了自己的印章，表明了我个人的认可。到城市的西北方去，你就可以找到地精飞艇的空港，搭乘飞艇可以很快到达杜隆塔尔。",dEN="I haven't lost any love for my homeland or its people, as you know. I've fought tooth and nail for Silvermoon to be allowed a place beside Undercity and Orgrimmar at the negotiating table.\n\nThis should silence any opposition. Take this letter to Thrall in Orgrimmar. As leader of the Horde he will have the final say on accepting the sin'dorei's pledge.\n\nI've added my own seal to the letter as a personal endorsement. Go northwest of the city and board the zeppelin bound for Durotar at the tower.",o="希尔瓦娜斯·风行者要求你将她的密信交给杜隆塔尔首都奥格瑞玛的萨尔。",oEN="Lady Sylvanas Windrunner wants you to take the Letter Sealed by Sylvanas to Thrall in Orgrimmar, capital of Durotar.",p="怎么了，$n？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="<萨尔开始读信。>\n\n血精灵终于解决掉他们的小麻烦了。别介意它借助了你和整个被遗忘者军队的帮助才完成工作。\n\n<萨尔笑了起来。>\n\n我想这谁都阻止不了。最后我们会需要他们就像他们需要我们一样。",cEN="<Thrall begins to read the letter.>\n\nSo the blood elves finally took care of their little problem. It is no surprise that it took your help as well as that of an entire Forsaken regiment to get the job done.\n\n<The Warchief breaks into laughter.>\n\nI suppose there's no stopping this. In the end we need them just as much as they need us."}
Q[9814]={d="朋友，你喜欢蘑菇吗？赞加沼泽萨布拉金附近生长着一种威力强大的蘑菇。\n\n不过你要当心，它们被称为爆顶蘑菇是有原因的。如果你没有做好防护措施就贸然靠近的话，它会突然爆炸！砰！形成一团有毒的孢子云。\n\n我利用这种蘑菇预测吉凶，可是已经快用完了。",dEN="You like mushrooms, mon? There be a powerful one here in Zangarmarsh, growin' real close to Zabra'jin.\n\nYou gotta be careful, though, mon. They be callin' it the burstcap for a reason. If you be gettin' too close without takin' the proper precautions, it'll blow right up on you! Poof! Right into a cloud o' toxic spores.\n\nI been usin' them for readin' the omens, but they be almost gone now.",o="将6枚爆顶蘑菇交给巫医托尔加什。",oEN="Bring Witch Doctor Tor'gash 6 Burstcap Mushrooms.",p="你弄到蘑菇了吗，老兄？",pEN="Have you got the mushrooms, mon?",c="这些可真不错，伙计！\n\n听我说。既然你玩得痛快，又帮了蘑菇的忙，我就让你也来凑凑这份热闹！$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="These be excellent, mon!\n\nI'll tell you what. Since you been a good sport and helped with the mushrooms, I'll let you in on the fun!"}
Q[9815]={d="在纳格兰被污染的各处水域之中，以西南方哈兰盆地的情况最为严重。那里有许多躁动难安的水元素在废弃的哈兰城下徘徊。一般来说，某些元素生物的残骸不会对环境造成任何影响，泥泞爪牙则不然，必须将它们的残骸全部销毁。\n\n泥泞爪牙死后，会留下沾满淤泥的核心。如果不加处理的话，就会继续扩散开来，对环境造成负面影响。\n\n杀掉泥泞爪牙，将沾满淤泥的核心带回来给我。",dEN="The most affected elements of water can be found in the Halaani Basin, southwest of here, beneath the abandoned city of Halaa. While some distressed elements can be destroyed without any impact upon the environment, spawns of muck must be physically removed from the world once destroyed.\n\nYou see, muck spawns leave behind globules of tainted debris that if left untouched will spread and further contaminate the environment.\n\nDestroy these muck spawns and bring back their muck-ridden cores.",o="将5个沾满淤泥的核心交给纳格兰元素王座的元素师鲁艾普。",oEN="Elementalist Lo'ap at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to retrieve 5 Muck-ridden Cores.",p="不要留下任何沾满淤泥的核心！",pEN="Do not leave any tainted muck behind!",c="大地之环感谢你，$n。元素也感谢你。我们感谢并会记住你对净化我们世界持续的努力。",cEN="The Earthen Ring thanks you, <name>. The elements also give their thanks. Your continued efforts in cleansing our world are appreciated and noted."}
Q[9816]={d="朋友，你不觉得赞加沼泽少了点什么吗！这里居然没有鱼人。\n\n别担心，我来解决这个问题。看见加尔戈和古尔戈了吗？我准备将鱼人作为礼物送给失落者！\n\n带上这只笼子转至匕潭村，在村子东北角把它们放出来。当然，我可不能让加尔戈和古尔戈跟着你去那种危险的地方，但是我会给你一笼子各色各样的小鱼人。将鱼人笼放在那块平坦的岩石上，然后打开笼门！",dEN="This marsh be missin' one thing, mon! There be no murlocs here.\n\nDon't worry, mon, I got a plan to fix the problem. See Gargle 'n' Gurgle over there? I plan to give the gift o' murlocs to the Lost Ones!\n\nTake this cage with you to Daggerfen Village an' release 'em in the northeastern cluster of huts. Now you know I can't be riskin' Gargle 'n' Gurgle with you, but I'll give you a cage full o' colorful young murlocs. Just set it on the flat rock you be findin' up there and open the door!",o="将鱼人笼放在匕潭村附近的平坦的岩石上。",oEN="Take the Murloc Cage and place it on the flat rock near Daggerfen Village.",p="<巫医托尔加什咧嘴一笑。>\n那些小家伙失落者喜欢他们的礼物吗？<El médico brujo Torghast sonríe .>",pEN="<Witch Doctor Tor'gash grins.>\n\nDid the lil' Lost Ones like their gift?",c="做得好，老兄！我希望他们玩的愉快！",cEN="Excellent work, mon! I do hope they had a good time!"}
Q[9817]={d="塞纳里奥远征队悬赏击杀血鳞纳迦的首领弗亚希王女的勇士。这名纳迦女巫最后一次被发现是在赞加沼泽北部的毒蛇湖。\n\n血鳞纳迦极度危险，想要挑战他们的首领的勇士必须非常小心谨慎。\n\n成功击杀弗亚希王女之后，请向塞纳里奥庇护所的监护者哈穆特领取奖赏。",dEN="A bounty is hereby declared by the Cenarion Expedition on Rajis Fyashe, leader of the Bloodscale naga. The naga sorceress was last sighted at Serpent Lake, in the northern region of Zangarmarsh.\n\nThe Bloodscale are to be considered extremely dangerous and their leader is to be approached with extreme caution.\n\nThose seeking to claim the bounty are advised to report to Warden Hamoot at Cenarion Refuge.",o="杀死毒蛇湖的弗亚希王女，然后返回赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，向监护者哈穆特领取奖赏。",oEN="Slay Rajis Fyashe at Serpent Lake and return to Warden Hamoot at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh for a reward.",p="你是来领取弗亚希王女的赏金吗？这是我今天听到最好的消息了。",pEN="You're here to claim the bounty for Fyashe? That's the best news I've heard all day.",c="我打赌血鳞纳迦下次要攻击远征队斥候时会三思而行。拿着这个做为奖励，$n。这是你应得的。",cEN="I'll bet the Bloodscale will think twice about attacking expedition scouts again. Take this as a reward, <name>. You've earned it."}
Q[9818]={d="最近，不知是什么东西在地底哀嚎。它总是在敲击着地面，仿佛在宣泄怒火。\n\n*砰*\n\n<温塔格抡起拳头拍了拍他的胸脯。>\n\n它不停地制造这种声音，剧烈的震击令大地也摇晃起来。这分明是冲我们来的。\n\n戈达乌应该知道究竟是什么生物在地底滋扰生事，搅得元素不得安宁。\n\n跟戈达乌谈谈吧。不，要听戈达乌说，你别出声。千万要仔细听戈达乌说……",dEN="Something rails the underneath. It beats the ground as if to punish.\n\n*Thud*\n\n<Untrag beats his chest with his fist.>\n\nIt makes this sound a hundred-thousand times. Endlessly it beats. The earth reels. It is calling out to us now.\n\nGordawg speaks to me. Gordawg knows that something forces the elements out. Something from the underneath.\n\nGo now and speak to Gordawg. No, listen to Gordawg, do not speak. Hear Gordawg...",o="与戈达乌沟通。",oEN="Communicate with Gordawg.",c="<戈达乌似乎在对你点头。>\n\n坐下。",cEN="<Gordawg appears to be nodding at you.>\n\nSit."}
Q[9819]={d="把篡位者带上来。沿着土路走。首先让那些受折磨的大地之灵安息；它们必须重新睡去。\n\n<戈达乌格一拳砸进地里，抓起一把臭气熏天的泥土。>\n\n必须睡去！\n\n<戈达乌格指向东南方。>\n\n灵魂在山附近，在丘陵附近，在岩石附近，在大地附近。\n\n让它们睡去。\n\n塔拉里盆地……东南方。|n",dEN="Bring up the usurper. You will find him. Follow earthen path. First you put to rest tortured earth spirits. Must sleep once more.\n\n<Gordawg smashes his fist into the ground and brings up very foul smelling soil.>\n\nMust sleep!\n\n<Gordawg points southeast.>\n\nFind spirits near mountains. Near hills. Near rocks. Near earth.\n\nPut to sleep.\n\nTelaari Basin... Southeast.",o="纳格兰元素王座的戈达乌要你消灭10个被折磨的地灵。",oEN="Gordawg at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand has asked that you destroy 10 Tortured Earth Spirits.",p="他们沉睡了吗？",pEN="Do they sleep?",c="<戈达乌肯定地点点头。>\n\n很好。灵魂安息了。",cEN="<Gordawg nods in approval.>\n\nGood. Spirits sleep now."}
Q[9820]={d="死亡通缉令：格罗阿克，安葛洛什食人魔砍伐蘑菇行动的监工。\n\n这个蛮横的渣滓和他的斧头帮走狗砍光了萨布拉金以北的蘑菇林。我们必须阻止格罗阿克，否则他和他的手下就会开辟出一条直达萨布拉金城墙的通道。\n\n击杀格罗阿克的勇士请将他的徽记交给暗影猎手德恩加，领取重赏。",dEN="Wanted - Dead or Alive: Boss Grog'ak, overseer of the Ango'rosh mushroom-cutting operation.\n\nThis brute and his axe-wielding cronies are responsible for chopping down the mushrooms to the north of town. Unless he is stopped, he and his band will cut a path to the walls of Zabra'jin.\n\n<He/She> who presents the head of Boss Grog'ak to Shadow Hunter Denjai shall be well-rewarded.",o="将格罗阿克的徽记交给萨布拉金的暗影猎手德恩加。",oEN="Bring Boss Grog'ak's Head to Shadow Hunter Denjai in Zabra'jin.",p="你拿着什么，$n？",pEN="What do you have there, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。不过这些食人魔距离我们前哨这么近，着实让我担心。看来他们从北边的山上往下渗入已经有一段时间了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The presence of these ogres so close to our outpost does have me worried, though. It seems like they've been filtering down from the northern mountains for some time."}
Q[9821]={d="<戈达乌捡起一块岩石咀嚼起来。>\n\n戈达乌要辨别味道。戈达乌知道这块岩石来自何处。\n\n<戈达乌抬起脚，重重地踏向大地。>\n\n瞧。纳格兰。\n\n<戈达乌让你观察他的脚印。地面竟然凹显出一幅完美的纳格兰地形图，戈达乌要你转至地图上被标记的地方消灭被激怒的碾压者。>\n\n杀掉它们！把岩石碎片带给戈达乌！\n\n带上地图。",dEN="<Gordawg picks up a rock and begins to chew on it.>\n\nGordawg tastes. Gordawg knows where this earth has been.\n\n<Gordawg raises one of his massive legs and stomps the ground.>\n\nLook. See Nagrand.\n\n<Gordawg directs you to the imprint of his foot. Within the imprint you see what appears to be a perfect geological map of Nagrand, marked with the locations of where you can find the elementals Gordawg wants you to destroy.>\n\nBREAK THEM! Bring Gordawg the pieces to eat.\n\nTake the map.",o="将10块被激怒的碾压者的核心交给纳格兰元素王座的戈达乌。",oEN="Gordawg at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand has asked that you bring him 10 Enraged Crusher Cores.",p="戈达乌吃着这块石头。戈达乌找到了侵占者。把核心给我带来！",pEN="Gordawg eats this rock. Gordawg finds usurper. Bring rock!",c="<戈达乌把咀嚼过的石块吐出来，在你面前形成了一个碎石堆。>\n\n毒药。这些石头不是纳格兰的。这些石头是毒药做的。你要摧毁毒药石块。你要找到侵占者古罗克。",cEN="<Gordawg spits out the chewed up rock, pelting you with a hail of rubble.>\n\nPoison. These rocks are not Nagrand. These rocks are from poison. You destroy poison rock. You find usurper."}
Q[9822]={d="食人魔选择在萨布拉金附近砍伐蘑菇绝非偶然。我猜测他们准备攻击萨布拉金。\n\n$n，我必须搞清楚这件事。食人魔在西北方设立了另一处哨站——安葛洛什营地。如果他们在密谋袭击计划，一定会留下证据的。$n，转至安葛洛什营地搜寻食人魔进攻计划的线索。将任何可疑的东西都带回来给我。",dEN="The position of the ogres' mushroom-cutting operation can't be an accident. I can't escape the suspicion that they're preparing for an attack on Zabra'jin.\n\nI must know for certain, <name>. The ogres have another outpost to the northwest, the Ango'rosh Grounds. If they're staging for an attack, there will be evidence of their plans there. Go there, <name> and search the camp for signs of their intentions. Return to me with anything that might be suspicious.",o="将安葛洛什攻击计划交给交给萨布拉金的暗影猎手德恩加。",oEN="Bring the Ango'rosh Attack Plans to Shadow Hunter Denjai in Zabra'jin.",p="你找到食人魔攻击意图的证据了吗？",pEN="Have you found proof of the ogres' intentions?",c="<暗影猎手玛加沙检查着计划书。>\n\n我知道了！食人魔的恶臭总是带着一股暗示的威胁。既然我们有了他们意图的证据，我们一定要比他们先采取行动。",cEN="<Shadow Hunter Denjai examines the plans.>\n\nI knew it! The stench of ogres always carries an implicit threat. Now that we have proof of their intentions, we must act before they do."}
Q[9823]={d="要解除安葛洛什食人魔的威胁，就必须杀死他们的首领戈尔费斯大王。不过，我们还可以做得更有威慑力一些。\n\n转至安葛洛什要塞，与我们的敌人战斗吧。要塞就在萨布拉金西北方某座小岛的洞穴中。跨越沼泽地边缘那株倒下的蘑菇形成的桥梁，就能看见要塞了。\n\n$n，不要心软。这帮家伙绝不会放过我们。",dEN="In order to end the Ango'rosh threat, we must kill their leader, Overlord Gorefist. We'll do better than that, though. We'll make an example of the overlord and his followers.\n\nGo to the Ango'rosh Stronghold and deal with our foes. The stronghold is located in a cave on a small island to the northwest of Zabra'jin. You'll see a bridge made from a fallen mushroom beyond the Ango'rosh Camp.\n\nShow no mercy, <name>. They certainly wouldn't spare any of us.",o="杀死戈尔费斯大王、10个安葛洛什殴斗者和10个安葛洛什食魂者，完成任务后向萨布拉金的暗影猎手德恩加复命。",oEN="Kill Overlord Gorefist, 10 Ango'rosh Maulers, and 10 Ango'rosh Souleaters and report back to Shadow Hunter Denjai in Zabra'jin.",p="安葛洛什威胁不断向我们逼近。你消灭了他们的领导者吗？",pEN="The threat of the Ango'rosh looms over us. Have you eliminated their leader?",c="我们要庆祝你在安葛洛什的胜利，$n。不知道那些食人魔畜生什么时候会再找到一个嗜血的酋长。\n\n不管如何，我们会准备好对付他们。",cEN="Your victory over the Ango'rosh is to be celebrated, <name>. I wonder how long it will be before those ogre brutes find themselves another bloodthirsty chieftain.\n\nNo matter, we'll be ready for them."}
Q[9824]={d="我正在设法获取卡拉赞能量的印记……当然，是为了一个私人项目。可惜在这上面我什么也捕捉不到。要是能靠近一处地下水源，我的水晶就能清晰得多地接收那些信号。\n\n我听说过一处地下池塘，还有我们下方地窖里的一口井。可这地方到处游荡着鬼魂，对我这把年纪的人来说，下去冒险太危险了。你说呢？愿意帮一个老人这个忙，替我去做占卜吗？",dEN="I'm trying to obtain an imprint of Karazhan's energy... for a personal project, of course. Unfortunately, I'm not getting anything up here. If I could get near an underground water source, my crystal would pick up the signals much more clearly.\n\nI've heard of an underground pond as well as a well in a cellar below us. This whole place is crawling with ghosts however, and venturing there would be hazardous for someone my age. What do you say; will you help an old man and perform the scrying for me?",o="在麦迪文的酒窖内的地下水源附近使用紫罗兰占卜水晶，然后向卡拉赞外的大法师奥图鲁斯复命。",oEN="Use the Violet Scrying Crystal near underground sources of water in the Master's Cellar and return to Archmage Alturus outside of Karazhan.",p="读数，$n。你探测到了吗？",pEN="The readings, <name>. Did you complete them?",c="这些读数是不好的预兆，$n。卡拉赞应该在放射出各种秘法流……只不过它变成一个巨大的能量真空。没有讯号。什么都没有。除了一个非常微弱的恶魔回音。\n\n这是坏消息，$n。",cEN="These readings do not bode well, <name>. Karazhan should be emanating all manner of arcane currents... instead it has become a huge energy vacuum. No signals. Nothing. Except for a very faint demonic echo.\n\nThis is bad news, <name>."}
Q[9825]={d="你也注意到那些徘徊在卡拉赞外的幽灵与鬼魂了吧。它们出现在此地的原因当前完全不明，这令我非常困扰！\n\n去帮我从它们身上收集一些幽灵精华来，或许我可以研究出它们的来意。$n，卡拉赞中隐藏着许多秘密，而我，决心揭开这些秘密之后的真相。",dEN="As you may have noticed, the outside of Karazhan is crawling with ghostly beings. The reason for their existence is unknown and unknowns bother me!\n\nBring me their ghostly essence so that I may study their nature. Karazhan has many secrets, <name>. I'm determined to uncover all of them.",o="将10个幽灵精华交给卡拉赞外的大法师奥图鲁斯。",oEN="Bring 10 Ghostly Essences to Archmage Alturus outside of Karazhan.",p="你取得我需要的幽灵精华了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained the ghostly essences I require, <name>?",c="太好了。我会研究这些精华，$n。谢谢你的帮忙。",cEN="Fascinating. I will study these essences, <name>. I thank you for your help."}
Q[9826]={d="$n，探测结果并不乐观。我向来不是个守口如瓶的人，那么就让我告诉你一些关于我所属的组织——紫罗兰之眼的内幕吧。\n\n我们是达拉然肯瑞托法师议会直属的密探，负责监视麦迪文和卡拉赞之塔的状况，避免这里局势失控。\n\n在麦迪文失踪后，我们对这里展开了一次非常迅速的“调查行动”，然后这里就沉寂了下来。\n\n那么，这是一份详细的调查报告，将它交给达拉然巨坑外的大法师塞德瑞克，他也是紫罗兰之眼的成员。",dEN="These signs do not bode well for us, <name>. I've never been one for secrecy so I will tell you a bit about my organization, the Violet Eye.\n\nWe are agents of the Kirin Tor, the Magus Senate of Dalaran. We were assigned to keep an eye on Karazhan and Medivh, in case things got out of hand.\n\nWhich they did... very quickly, after Medivh disappeared.\n\nThis report details my findings. Take it to Archmage Cedric, also from the Violet Eye; you will find him in the outskirts of Dalaran Crater.",o="将奥图鲁斯的报告交给达拉然巨坑外的大法师塞德瑞克。",oEN="Bring Alturus's Report to Archmage Cedric in the outskirts of Dalaran Crater.",p="阿尔图鲁斯竟把这件事告诉了你？那个老糊涂。\n\n我想损失已经造成了，那不如也利用一下你。我想你会合作的吧？",pEN="Alturus entrusted you with this information? That old fool.\n\nI suppose the damage is done, we might as well make use of you. I suppose you will cooperate?",c="你知道紫罗兰之眼吗？看着倒不像。",cEN="You know of the Violet Eye? You do not look familiar."}
Q[9827]={d="仔细地检查孢芽之后，你发现许多可能曾被用来容纳某种东西的凹痕。这枚怪异的蘑菇是一个谜团，它完全不健康，但是你找不到任何线索来了解它可能曾经派作什么用场。\n\n也许熟悉赞加沼泽生态的人应该可以告诉你更多有关这种孢芽的情况。",dEN="A close inspection of the basidium reveals a number of indentations that might have once held something. The alien mass of fungus presents something of a puzzle. It's far from healthy, but you have little clue as to what function it might normally perform.\n\nPerhaps someone more familiar with the denizens of Zangarmarsh would be able to tell you more about the basidium.",o="将枯萎的孢芽交给赞加沼泽中泰雷多尔的鲁埃姆。",oEN="Take the Withered Basidium to Ruam in Telredor in Zangarmarsh.",p="你拿着什么，$n？",pEN="What is it you have there, <name>?",c="它看起来像泥沼巨人的孢子台，但我从没看过这种状态的。我听说死亡泥潭的巨物也开始枯萎，但它进展的速度远比我所想的还快。\n\n死亡泥潭曾是个湖泊，就像泥沼里其他湖一样，而且是巨物的重生地。但是水退了，这样的改变似乎让巨物无法生长。如果这样的情形持续下去，巨物会完全消失。",cEN="It looks like the basidium of a bog giant, but I haven't seen one in this condition before. I'd heard that the giants in the Dead Mire had begun to wither, but it's far more advanced than I expected.\n\nThe Dead Mire was once a lake like the others in the marsh, and it served as the spawning ground for the giants. With the waters receding, it seems the changes are preventing the giants from sporing. If this continues, the giants may disappear entirely."}
Q[9828]={d="仔细地检查孢芽之后，你发现许多可能曾被用来容纳某种东西的凹痕。这枚怪异的蘑菇是一个谜团，它完全不健康，但是你找不到任何线索来了解它可能曾经派作什么用场。\n\n也许熟悉赞加沼泽生态的人应该可以告诉你更多有关这种孢芽的情况。",dEN="A close inspection of the basidium reveals a number of indentations that might have once held something. The alien mass of fungus presents something of a puzzle. It's far from healthy, but you have little clue as to what function it might normally perform.\n\nPerhaps someone more familiar with the denizens of Zangarmarsh would be able to tell you more about the basidium.",o="将枯萎的孢芽交给赞加沼泽中沼泽鼠岗哨的里维伊。",oEN="Bring the Withered Basidium to Reavij at Swamprat Post in Zangarmarsh.",p="你拿着什么，$n？",pEN="What is it you have there, <name>?",c="它看起来像泥沼领主的孢子台，但我从没看过这种状态的。我听说死亡泥潭的巨物也开始枯萎，但它进展的速度远比我所想的还快。\n\n死亡泥潭曾是个湖泊，就像泥沼里其他湖一样，而且是巨物的重生地。但是水退了，这样的改变似乎让巨物无法生长。如果这样的情形持续下去，巨物会完全消失。",cEN="It looks like the basidium of a boglord, but I haven't seen one in this condition before. I'd heard that the giants in the Dead Mire had begun to wither, but it's far more advanced than I expected.\n\nThe Dead Mire was once a lake like the others in the marsh, and it served as the spawning ground for the giants. With the waters receding, it seems the changes are preventing the giants from sporing. If this continues, the giants may disappear entirely."}
Q[9829]={d="奥图鲁斯的报告书令我非常不安。自卡拉赞之塔封印了自身，截断了与外界的一切联系时，我们就感觉到了情况的恶化。我们曾派出过一些探子进入塔中，但是卡拉赞封闭之后就没有人再回来。现在……这里竟然散发出这么浓重的恶魔气息。我们必须彻底调查这里。\n\n这世界上只有两个可以重新打开卡拉赞封印的人——星界法师麦迪文和他的学徒卡德加，曾被认为都已经死了。\n\n我们当然希望前者确实死掉了，但后者，他的学徒卡德加，有消息说当前还活着，在一处名叫沙塔斯城的地方。立刻找到他，并将奥图鲁斯的报告书交给他。",dEN="Alturus's report is unsettling. We thought it was bad when Karazhan sealed itself off to the outside world. We had agents inside; we never heard from any of them again. Now this... demonic emanation. We must investigate it.\n\nThe only people who can reopen Karazhan were presumed dead: Khadgar and Medivh.\n\nWhile we hope that the latter is indeed gone, we recently learned that his apprentice, Khadgar, is alive and well in a place called Shattrath City. Find him and give him Alturus's report.",o="将奥图鲁斯的报告交给泰罗卡森林中沙塔斯城的卡德加。",oEN="Deliver Alturus's Report to Khadgar in Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest.",c="紫罗兰之眼？你别说话。\n\n把你说的报告给我看看。",cEN="The Violet Eye? You don't say.\n\nShow me this report you speak of."}
Q[9830]={d="在和德莱尼人交谈时，我总觉得他们的语气中透露出被逐出家园的怨气。他们似乎非常同情破碎者，认为我们失去了某种东西。\n\n虽然圣光不再眷顾破碎者氏族，但是丰富的阅历使我们对自然界的了解更加深入。\n\n我的族人能洞悉到许多潜在的机会，却很少有德莱尼人能如此独具慧眼。举个例子吧，此地的南面和西面是沼光抽血者的聚集地，这种生物分泌的毒液具有广泛的用途，无论是狩猎还是疗伤都用得着。",dEN="When I speak to draenei, I often get the sense that they consider themselves removed from their environment. Many seem to pity my brethren, the Broken, who they say have lost something.\n\nWe Broken may have lost our inclination toward the Light, but our experiences have brought us closer to the land.\n\nMy people see opportunities where few draenei do. Take, for example, the venom of the marshlight bleeders that live to the south and west. It has a wide variety of uses from hunting to healing.",o="将6份沼光抽血者的毒液交给奥雷柏尔营地的普尔鲁。",oEN="Bring 6 Marshlight Bleeder Venom to Puluu at the Orebor Harborage.",p="我想示范毒液对隐士安霍尔和泰雷多尔其它人的功用。那需要我库存的双倍份量。",pEN="I hope to demonstrate the uses of bleeder venom to Anchorite Ahuurn and the others at Telredor. That's going to require me to double my supply.",c="谢谢你带毒素来，$n。若要不消耗我个人的存货又要让我的示范成功，那还有好长的路要走。",cEN="Thank you for bringing this venom, <name>. It will go a long way toward making my demonstration possible without depleting my personal stores."}
Q[9831]={d="这份报告书里提到的情况让我十分担忧，$n，看来的确需要进入卡拉赞调查，但你也要知道，进入卡拉赞是十分困难的。\n\n当初，我本人在外域几乎走投无路，处境十分艰难，于是我就将卡拉赞的钥匙分成三个部分藏了起来。\n\n当时，我将它们分别放进了三个魔法容器中，分别藏匿在三个我认为十分安全的地方。\n\n可是，时过境迁……随着黑暗势力逐渐笼罩了外域，这些地方也不再有安全可言。第一部分碎片在奥金顿中，那个区域当前被暗影议会占据着。将这块碎片带回来给我吧。",dEN="I am deeply troubled by the news in this report, <name>. Gaining entry into Karazhan will be difficult, however.\n\nYou see, when it became apparent that I was stranded here I split the key into three fragments.\n\nI placed the keys inside enchanted containers, and in turn placed those in places that were safe at the time.\n\nWith the dark changes Outland has endured this no longer is the case. The first fragment is in a section of Auchindoun taken over by the Shadow Council. Return this fragment to me.",o="卡德加要求你进入奥金顿的暗影迷宫中，回收储藏在那里的一个奥术容器中的第一块钥匙碎片。",oEN="Khadgar wants you to enter the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun and retrieve the First Key Fragment from an Arcane Container hidden there.",p="你拿到碎片了吗，$c？不要花费很长时间才能把这件事做好。",pEN="Have you obtained the fragment, <class>? You would do well not to waste any time in this matter",c="你做的很好，$n。我都不确信你会成功。\n\n容器附魔着一个强大的法术，没有一双慧眼可看不到它。我很高兴它没有避开你。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. I wasn't sure you would succeed.\n\nThe containers are enchanted with a potent spell that masks their presence from unworthy eyes. I'm glad to see they did not elude you."}
Q[9832]={d="第二部分的钥匙，被我藏在了毒蛇湖的湖底，当时那里还不叫这个名字。纳迦们占据了毒蛇湖之后，在湖中央安装了巨大的抽水装置。恐怕容器也被吸进了盘牙水库的深处。\n\n第三部分则更加难以回收，我原本将其留在了风暴要塞，当时那里在纳鲁的掌控之下。可现在凯尔萨斯占领了要塞，而我原来存放容器的地方也变成了一处监狱。\n\n把这些钥匙的碎片给我带回来吧，$n。一切都要依靠你了。",dEN="I hid the second fragment at the bottom of Serpent Lake, long before it was called that. The giant drain installed there after the naga took over has likely pulled the container into the depths of Coilfang Reservoir.\n\nThe third fragment will prove the most trying, as I left it inside Tempest Keep back when it was controlled by the naaru. Kael'thas now rules it and the chamber where I left it has become a prison.\n\nBring me these remaining fragments, <name>. Much depends on your success.",o="从盘牙水库内的一个奥术容器中拿到第二块钥匙碎片，从风暴要塞内的一个奥术容器中拿到第三块钥匙碎片。任务完成之后向沙塔斯城的卡德加复命。",oEN="Obtain the Second Key Fragment from an Arcane Container inside Coilfang Reservoir and the Third Key Fragment from an Arcane Container inside Tempest Keep. Return to Khadgar in Shattrath City after you've completed this task.",p="你的钥匙碎片找的怎么样了，$n？",pEN="How goes your search for the key fragments, <name>?",c="你拿到碎片了。这非常了不起，$n。你确实$g有资格:有资格;持有卡拉赞的钥匙。\n还剩下一个小问题。",cEN="You have the fragments. This is most impressive, <name>. You're certainly worthy of holding the key to Karazhan.\nA small problem remains."}
Q[9833]={d="我们跟随伊库提来到赞加沼泽，此行的目的之一就是开辟一条安全通道，帮助德莱尼人与居住在纳格兰塔拉的库雷尼人创建通信。为了让信使在塔拉和泰雷多尔之间通行无阻，我们必须确保道路的安全。\n\n在来时的路上，我们多次遭到沼牙切割者的袭击。尽管我们将它们全部击退，但是对孤单的信使而言，这些野兽必定会带来巨大的威胁。削弱它们的数量才能确保信使的安全。",dEN="One of the reasons Ikuti led us to Zangarmarsh was to help open the lines of communication between the draenei and the Kurenai home city of Telaar in Nagrand. In order for messengers to pass swiftly between Telaar and Telredor, the roads must be secured.\n\nOn our way here, we were attacked repeatedly by marshfang slicers. We were able to fight them off, but they would pose a formidable threat to a solitary messenger. Reducing their numbers will help ensure the safety of our messengers.",o="奥雷柏尔营地的普尔鲁要你杀死12个沼牙切割者。",oEN="Puluu at the Orebor Harborage wants you to kill 12 Marshfang Slicers.",p="你在保卫道路上有何进展吗？",pEN="Have you made progress in securing the roads?",c="这是很棒的消息。虽然道路离完全安全还有很大的距离，但信差是聪明又机智的。",cEN="That's excellent news. The way is still far from perfectly safe, but the messengers are clever and resourceful."}
Q[9834]={d="马克图总能在老远就看见一个穿着闪亮护甲走过来的德莱尼人，哪怕是在这片昏暗的沼泽里！\n\n马克图本想笑话他们，但转念想起他们对库雷尼一直很好，就想教教他们库雷尼是怎么做护甲的。\n\n沼泽爪鞭笞者那种深色鳞状毛皮，是马克图这辈子穿过的最好的护甲。如果$n能从蛇湖深处给马克图带回一些这种鞭笞者的毛皮，他就乐意分享自己的护甲。",dEN="Maktu can always see a draenei approaching in his shiny armor from a mile away, even in this murky swamp!\n\nMaktu wants to laugh at them, but then he remembers that they have been kind to the Kurenai and he wants to teach them about how Kurenai make armor.\n\nThe dark, scaly hides of the fenclaw thrashers make some of the best armor Maktu has ever worn. If <name> can bring Maktu some of these hides from the fenclaw thrashers deep in Serpent Lake, he'll be happy to share some of his armor.",o="将8张泥爪皮交给奥雷柏尔营地的玛克图。",oEN="Bring 8 Fenclaw Hides to Maktu at the Orebor Harborage.",p="$n有普尔鲁要的皮革吗？",pEN="Does <name> have hides for Maktu?",c="普尔鲁认为这些是很好的皮革。它们会做出非常好的护甲。\n\n谁知道？说不定还有剩下的皮革可以让普尔鲁做一些护甲给德莱尼。",cEN="These are good hides, Maktu thinks. They will make very good armor.\n\nWho knows? There might even be enough left over for Maktu to make some armor for the draenei."}
Q[9835]={d="你看到的这一小群破碎者，来自纳格兰一个更大的聚居地。我们自称库雷尼，是渴望与德莱尼兄弟重聚的破碎者。\n\n我这一队人来此，是为了加强与特雷多德莱尼人的联系。\n\n如果安格罗什食人魔得逞，这座神庙就撑不了多久了。他们已经砍光了劈开沼泽的高大蘑菇，离我们的庇护所越来越近。如果你愿意自称是我们的朋友，就帮我们对抗这个敌人吧。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="The small band of Broken you see here is a mission from a larger settlement in Nagrand. The Kurenai, as we call ourselves, are Broken who desire to reunite with our draenei brothers.\n\nMy group has come here to strengthen Kurenai ties to the draenei of Telredor.\n\nIf the Ango'rosh ogres have their way, this temple will not stand much longer. They have cleared the Hewn Bog of its towering mushrooms and draw ever closer to our refuge. If you would call yourself our friend, aid us in fighting this enemy.",o="杀死10个安葛洛什食人魔和5个安葛洛什萨满祭司，然后返回奥雷柏尔营地向伊库提复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Ango'rosh Ogres and 5 Ango'rosh Shaman and return to Ikuti at the Orebor Harborage.",p="对抗安葛洛什的战役进行的怎么样了？",pEN="How goes the fight against the Ango'rosh?",c="安葛洛什威胁已经暂时控制住了，但我确信他们不会轻易放弃。自从我结束了德莱尼身份后就忘记了许多事情，但破碎者的固执是永远的记忆。",cEN="The Ango'rosh threat is contained for the moment, but I'm certain they won't give up that easily. I've forgotten many things since the end of my life as a draenei, but the stubbornness of the ogres is an enduring memory."}
Q[9836]={d="所有碎片已经组合完毕，这就是我当学徒时使用过的那把钥匙了。看上去倒是跟以前没什么两样，但是如果你想用它来打开卡拉赞的大门，这东西不过是一块废金属罢了。\n\n除非获得麦迪文的同意，否则这把钥匙就毫无价值。唔，我当然知道麦迪文已经死了。这事儿不是不可能，只是有些难办而已。\n\n在艾泽拉斯世界，有一处名叫时光之穴的地方，青铜龙守护着那块圣地。设法进入时光之穴，返回过去，说服麦迪文让这把钥匙重新获得打开卡拉赞大门的能力吧。",dEN="I've put together the very key I used as an apprentice. It looks completely functional as far as keys go. In regards to opening Karazhan, however, this might as well be a piece of scrap metal.\n\nWithout Medivh's consent, the key is worthless. Yes, of course I know Medivh is dead. This merely makes things difficult, not impossible.\n\nThere is a place in Azeroth called the Caverns of Time, guarded by the bronze dragonflight. Find a way inside, travel back in time and get Medivh to enable the key.",o="进入时光之穴，说服麦迪文让复原的学徒钥匙重新获得打开卡拉赞大门的能力。",oEN="Go into the Caverns of Time and convince Medivh to enable your Restored Apprentice's Key.",p="你是谁，你想怎么样？",pEN="Who are you and what do you want?",c="那把钥匙，我认得。那是卡德加的钥匙……当然我还没交给他。",cEN="That key, I recognize it. That is Kadghar's key... of course I haven't given it to him yet."}
Q[9837]={d="我似乎有一些关于你和这把钥匙的未来事件的记忆。\n\n<麦迪文看着你，仿佛刚见了鬼。>\n\n你前方有一段艰难的岁月，$n。但愿你的力量不会辜负你。\n\n至于这把钥匙，等卡德加派人来接我时，我要把它交给他。我再找不到比这更好的$g学徒:学徒;了。\n\n我想你也需要一把属于自己的钥匙。\n\n<麦迪文伸手探入长袍，把自己的钥匙递给你。>\n\n去吧。祝你好运，$c。",dEN="I seem to have memories about future events surrounding you and this key.\n\n<Medivh looks at you like he's just seen a ghost.>\n\nYou have trying times ahead of you, <name>. Let us hope your strength does not fail you.\n\nRegarding the key, I am to hand it to Khadgar when he's sent to me. I couldn't hope for a better apprentice.\n\nI suppose you will need a key of your own.\n\n<Medivh reaches into his robe and hands you his own key.>\n\nGo on then. And best of luck, <class>.",o="将麦迪文的钥匙交给沙塔斯城的卡德加。",oEN="Return to Khadgar in Shattrath City and show him the Master's Key.",c="他自己的钥匙？真是不可思议！\n\n我没有在我们的时间线里感觉到任何干扰，所以我想它始终都在。现在没有回头路了，$n。钥匙是你的也只有你可以拥有了。",cEN="His own key? That's incredible!\n\nI do not sense any disturbances in our timeline, so I suppose it was meant to occur all along. There's no turning back now, <name>. The key is yours and only yours."}
Q[9838]={d="$n，命运已经将重要的使命赋予了你。如果紫罗兰之眼的调查结果确实可信，那么你就必须向他们伸出援手。\n\n尽管我与大法师塞德瑞克有许多不睦，可是像奥图鲁斯这样的人，他们所从事的研究工作还是至关重要的。总之，帮助他们的同时，你也要提防被紫罗兰之眼所利用。话说回来，如果卡拉赞真是面临危机，甚至成为了危机本身，恐怕也只有紫罗兰之眼能为你指引方向，帮助你消灭其中的邪恶力量。回到奥图鲁斯那儿吧，竭尽全力帮助他。",dEN="A great responsibility has been bestowed upon you, <name>. If the signs that the Violet Eye has observed are to be trusted, then you must help them.\n\nFor all my disagreements with Cedric, the work that men like Alturus do is still important. Beware that they do not use you, however. Remember it is you who the key is bound to, not them. But if the danger in Karazhan is real, then it is they who are best prepared to guide you in dealing with it. Go back to Alturus and help him in any way that you can.",o="与卡拉赞外的大法师奥图鲁斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Archmage Alturus outside Karazhan.",c="我派你去送报告而你带了一把钥匙回来？你一定是真人不露相，$n。",cEN="I sent you to deliver a report and you come back with a key to this place? There must be more to you than meets the eye, <name>."}
Q[9839]={d="食人魔首领是整个氏族的核心。一旦失去首领，安葛洛什部族就会瓦解，他们会自相残杀，争夺新一任首领的头衔。\n\n尽管食人魔曾在这片区域出没，但是他们的主要势力聚集在西北边的安葛洛什要塞。沼泽地边缘有一株倒下的蘑菇，要塞就位于那座蘑菇桥对面小岛上的洞穴中。\n\n去那里杀死戈尔费斯大王，缓解奥雷柏尔营地的危机。",dEN="The centerpiece of any ogre tribe is its leader. Without leadership, the Ango'rosh's organization will disappear and they'll resort to infighting to determine who will lead next.\n\nAlthough we've seen the ogres out and about in this area, their true strength is concentrated in their Ango'rosh Stronghold to the northwest. It's located in a cave on a small island connected to the marsh by a fallen mushroom.\n\nGo there and defeat Overlord Gorefist. That should provide us with a well-deserved respite.",o="杀死戈尔费斯大王和10个安葛洛什殴斗者，完成任务后向奥雷柏尔营地的伊库提复命。",oEN="Ikuti wants you to kill Overlord Gorefist and 10 Ango'rosh Maulers. Return to the Orebor Harborage once you have completed the task.",p="完成了吗？你解决掉血拳主宰了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Have you dealt with Overlord Gorefist?",c="终于！我们感谢你帮忙巩固我们在奥雷伯尔港的地位。我会把你的行为传话到纳格兰，塔拉的库雷尼那里。未来将会有许多机会让我们的人民一起合作。",cEN="At last! You have our thanks for your help in securing our position at the Orebor Harborage. I will send word of your deeds to the Kurenai city of Telaar in Nagrand. There will be many more opportunities for our peoples to work together."}
Q[9840]={d="既然进入麦迪文之塔的钥匙已经掌握在了我们手中，好吧，确切的说是掌握在你手中，那么我们的首要任务就是对塔中的情况进行一次初步判断。\n\n很久以前，紫罗兰之眼的一位密探金娜曾成功潜入卡拉赞，并将探察到的所有信息用密文写入了日记。不幸的是，卡拉赞关闭之后，我们很快就得到了她的死讯。但是，卡拉赞的铁匠库雷恩也曾受雇紫罗兰之眼。虽然他不是组织的成员，不过他应该能帮我们找到金娜的日记。进入卡拉赞跟他谈谈。",dEN="Now that we've found a way back into Medivh's Tower - or rather you have - the first thing we need to do is try to get a sense of what the situation inside is.\n\nOne of our agents who had managed to infiltrate Karazhan kept an encoded log of her observations. Unfortunately her death was confirmed shortly before Karazhan was shut down. Koren, Karazhan's blacksmith, was under our pay. Though not a member of the Violet Eye, he should be able to help us find Keanna's log. Look for him inside.",o="进入卡拉赞寻找库雷恩。",oEN="Find Koren inside Karazhan.",c="<卡尔仑带着不确定的眼神看着你。>\n\n我完全不知道你所说的紫罗兰之眼。我只是个铁匠而已。",cEN="<Koren looks at you with an uncertain look.>\n\nI know nothing of this Violet Eye you speak of. A blacksmith is all I am."}
Q[9841]={d="这吵死人的嗡嗡声简直让人没法干活！你听见了吗？\n\n我满脑子都是这声音！我知道谁在制造噪音——那些该死的沼光抽血者！噪音总是从村子的南边和西边传来。\n\n沼光抽血者体型庞大，不能象对付小虫子那样拍死、踩死或是赶走它们。消除噪音的唯一办法就是杀死它们。$n，我可不管你准备用什么方法，总之让它们安静下来！",dEN="It's impossible to work with all this infernal buzzing! Do you hear it?\n\nI can't get it out of my head! I know exactly what's making the noise, too. It's those damnable marshlight bleeders! The noise always comes from the south and west of the village.\n\nThey're too big to swat, crush underfoot, or wave away. The only way to stop that unholy droning is to kill them. I don't care how you do it, <name>, just quiet them!",o="杀死8个沼光抽血者，然后向萨布拉金的加巴林卡复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Marshlight Bleeders and return to Gambarinka at Zabra'jin.",p="那声音似乎变的越来越远了。那是我一厢情愿的想法还是你真的解决掉那个麻烦了？",pEN="The sound seems to have receded into the distance. Is that wishful thinking or have you really done something about the problem?",c="我也是这样想。我已经可以听出它的差别了。我终于能回去工作，多亏了你。如果你需要什么商业补给，别忘了加巴林卡！",cEN="I thought so. I can hear the difference already. I'll finally be able to get back to work, thanks to you. If you ever find yourself in need of tradeskill supplies, don't forget ol' Gambarinka!"}
Q[9842]={d="沼泽地潮湿的环境使我的金属工具严重受损。这让原本简单的木工活变得困难许多，所以我放弃了使用金属刀刃。\n\n萨布拉金的南边和西边生活着一种名叫沼牙切割者的沼泽生物，它们锋利的附肢是我所使用过的最好的刀刃，同时还具有防锈和抗磨损的功能。当然，要灵活运用这种利器需要一点点技巧，不过这对我来说已经不成问题了。如果你能帮我取回一些沼牙切割者之刃的话，我会非常感激你的。",dEN="The damp atmosphere of the marsh has taken a toll on my metal tools. It's made woodworking a lot more difficult than it ought to be, so I've given up on metal blades.\n\nIt turns out that the marshfang slicers living to the south and west of town grow blades that are sharper than any steel I've ever owned. They're also resistant to rust and wear. It's just a little tricky to attach them to a handle, but I think I've got it figured out. I'd appreciate any blades you could bring me.",o="将10柄沼牙切割者之刃交给萨布拉金的加巴林卡。",oEN="Bring 10 Marshfang Slicer Blades to Gambarinka at Zabra'jin.",p="你收集到那些刀刃了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to scare up some of those marshfang blades?",c="这些应该足够我用上一阵子了！我想其它人已经开始注意了。已经有些人出价要买我的剑了。贩卖它们可以提供我比平时更好的生意。",cEN="These should keep me supplied for some time to come! I think some of the others have begun to take notice. I've had several offers to buy my blades already. Selling them on the side might provide better business than my customary goods."}
Q[9843]={d="再说一次，你要找谁来着？金娜？\n\n哦哦，我以前也曾在卡拉赞见过一个名字也叫金娜的女人，她那时一直呆在会客间那边。我本应保守这个秘密的。\n\n你说你替紫罗兰之眼办事？不，我从来没听过这个组织。\n\n如果你不介意的话，我回去干活了。\n\n<库雷恩一瞬间就似乎已经完全忘记了你。>",dEN="Who did you say you were looking for again? Keanna?\n\nI once met someone with that name. She was staying up at the guest chambers. I was supposed to keep that a secret now, wasn't I?\n\nDid you say you were with the Violet Eye? No, I've never heard of them.\n\nI need to return to my work now, if you don't mind.\n\n<Koren seems to have forgotten about you already.>",o="在卡拉赞的会客间搜寻金娜的日记，然后将它交给卡拉赞外的大法师奥图鲁斯。",oEN="Search the Guest Chambers inside Karazhan for Keanna's Log and bring it to Archmage Alturus outside Karazhan.",p="琪安娜的日志……你找到了吗？",pEN="Keanna's log... did you find it?",c="你找到日志了。我希望我们需要的资讯就在这里，$n。",cEN="You found the log. I sure hope the information we need is in here, <name>."}
Q[9844]={d="基安娜最后几页记录证实了我们对卡拉赞内部存在恶魔的怀疑。\n\n她察觉到一名燃烧军团特工的降临，并称其来自塔顶。\n\n她的记录到此为止。\n\n卡拉赞是个极其重要的地方，$c。它是一道通往虚空的传送门，一座照亮其他世界的灯塔。一旦落入错误之手，后果不堪设想。必须阻止这些恶魔的入侵。而你，$n，是唯一持有钥匙的人。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="Keanna's last few entries confirm our suspicions of a demonic presence inside Karazhan.\n\nShe detected the arrival of a Burning Legion agent whose location she describes as coming from the top of the tower.\n\nHer entries stop there.\n\nKarazhan is a very important place, <class>. It is a portal into the nether, a beacon shining into other worlds. The possible repercussions of it falling into the wrong hands are unthinkable. This demonic intrusion must be stopped. And you, <name>, are the only one with a key.",o="大法师奥图鲁斯要求你消灭出现在卡拉赞顶部的恶魔。",oEN="Archmage Alturus wants you to destroy the Demonic Presence at the top of Karazhan.",p="我不敢问，$n。卡拉赞里的情况变的如何？",pEN="I dread to ask, <name>. What has become of the situation inside Karazhan?",c="你办到了！读数恢复正常了！\n\n我们一定要把这个消息告诉赛卓克。他一定会对你的成就很惊讶的。",cEN="You did it! Yes, the readings are becoming normal once again!\n\nWe must give this news to Cedric. He's going to be very impressed with your achievement."}
Q[9845]={d="长途跋涉穿越荒凉的地狱火半岛后，待在有水的地方真是舒坦，我原本还担心外域很可能没有适合垂钓的地方呢。\n\n现在，我真高兴随行带了渔具过来。大多数时候，钓鱼是一件非常愉快的事情，如果没有毒蛇湖里那些讨厌的泥爪毁坏者的话。\n\n它们不仅把鱼吓跑了，还胆敢咬掉我鱼钩上的诱饵。我不得不花更多的时间一次次地重装诱饵，根本没法钓到任何东西！",dEN="It's a relief to be in someplace with water after trekking through the wasteland of Hellfire Peninsula. I was worried there might not be any respectable fishing holes in Outland.\n\nNow I'm glad I lugged my fishing supplies along. For the most part, the fishing's been good, except for those no good fenclaw thrashers in Serpent Lake.\n\nNot only do they scare the fish away, but they're bold enough to snap the bait right off my hook. I spend more time re-baiting the hook than I do catching anything!",o="杀死10个泥爪毁坏者，然后向萨布拉金的苏尔加亚复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Fenclaw Thrashers and return to Zurjaya at Zabra'jin.",p="我现在可以安全的钓鱼了吗？",pEN="Is it safe for me to fish again?",c="我等不及回去钓鱼了！现在我可以带着真正的鱼回到镇上去，加巴林卡也不能再嘲笑我了！",cEN="I can't wait to return to fishing! Now I'll be able to return to town with some real fish in my bucket and Gambarinka won't be able to make fun of me anymore!"}
Q[9846]={d="据说沼泽地中最强大的失落者氏族——蛮沼氏族拥有某种神奇的药膏。虽然这个流言有可能是假的，但一切可能帮我引导这个世界灵魂的东西都不容忽视。\n\n$n，从蛮沼秘法师、蛮沼猎人和蛮沼德鲁伊手中夺得保护图腾。图腾上的雕文应该记载着我想要知道的东西。",dEN="The most powerful tribe of Lost Ones in the marsh, the Feralfen, are said to possess powerful medicine. There may be no truth to such rumors, but anything that might help me channel the spirits of this world cannot be ignored.\n\nFind the Feralfen mystics, hunters and druids, <name>, and capture their totems. Everything I need to know should be apparent from the carvings.",o="将10根蛮沼保护图腾交给萨布拉金的先知亚尼迪。",oEN="Bring 10 Feralfen Protection Totems to Seer Janidi at Zabra'jin.",p="你收集到那些图腾了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered those totems?",c="嗯……它们似乎分成了毒蛇之魂和翼鸟之魂。有自尊心的暗矛巨魔不会致力于崇拜翼鸟。它们的灵魂太脆弱，善变，最好留给阿曼尼的萨满。\n\n但是毒蛇的就不同了，$n，毒蛇灵魂拥有强大的力量而这就是我要研究的灵魂。",cEN="Hmm... They seem to be divided between images of a serpent spirit and a bird spirit. No self-respecting Darkspear troll engages in bird worship. Their spirits are weak, capricious, and best left to the Amani.\n\nBut the serpent, <name>, the serpent wields considerable power and this is the spirit I shall study."}
Q[9847]={d="我们必须查明蛮沼毒蛇之魂到底蕴藏着多大的力量，以及它是否愿意服从我们的意志。如果我能随意支配来自外域的灵魂的力量……难以想象！\n\n带上图腾转至博哈姆废墟，将它插在台阶底部的地面上。只有这样，我们才能通过毒蛇之魂了解到究竟是谁使用过保护图腾。",dEN="We must find out how much power this Feralfen snake spirit possesses and whether it can be bent to our will. Imagine what I could do with the powers of an Outland spirit at my command!\n\nTake this totem with you and make your way to the foot of the stairs leading to the Boha'mu Ruins. Plant the totem in the ground and it should do the rest. The spirit should not be able to tell who has used the totem until it has manifested.",o="转至博哈姆废墟，将蛮沼图腾插在台阶底部的地面上。然后返回萨布拉金，向先知亚尼迪汇报你的发现。",oEN="Take the Feralfen Totem to the foot of the stairs at the Boha'mu Ruins and plant it in the ground. Report your findings to Seer Janidi at Zabra'jin.",p="你召唤出蛮沼村灵魂了吗？",pEN="Were you able to summon the Feralfen spirit?",c="<你把使用图腾后发生的事告诉了先知亚尼迪。>\n\n灵魂攻击你了吗？它一定和那些破碎者有更密切的关系。要强迫它为我效命必定要耗费庞大的力气。我得在这悲惨的世界上寻找一种新的力量来源。",cEN="<You tell Seer Janidi about what happened when you used the totem.>\n\nThe spirit attacked you? It must have a higher affinity for those Lost Ones than I'd thought. There's no way to compel it to serve me without expending considerable effort. I'll have to search for a new source of power in this wretched world."}
Q[9848]={d="虫子、虫子、虫子！赞加沼泽到处都是虫子，营地的同伴们似乎为此深感困扰。\n\n呸，我真是受够这些虫子了！不过有件更有趣的事情吸引了我的注意。营地以西是一座失落者村落，他们自称为匕潭失落者。\n\n整个部族由训练有素的暗杀者组成。我留意到他们所配制并使用的某种强效毒药，我迫切地想要了解这种毒药，但是我需要一份配方和一小瓶样本。",dEN="Bugs, bugs, bugs! The marsh is full of them and my companions here seem obsessed with them.\n\nWell, I've had it with the bugs! Something far more intriguing has captured my interest. To the west, there is a village of Lost Ones who call themselves the Daggerfen.\n\nThe whole tribe consists of highly specialized assassins. I've noticed them mixing and using a particularly potent kind of poison. I'm dying to know more about the poison, but that's going to require a copy of the recipe and a sample vial.",o="将匕潭毒药手册和一只匕潭毒药瓶交给奥雷柏尔营地的迪莫斯·丹尼斯。",oEN="Bring the Daggerfen Poison Manual and a Daggerfen Poison Vial to Timothy Daniels at the Orebor Harborage.",p="你在匕潭村找到我要的东西，解开那个毒药的秘密了吗？",pEN="Did your search of Daggerfen Village yield the information I need in order to get to the bottom of this poison puzzle?",c="<迪莫斯快速翻阅手册。>\n\n他们使用拉格维花做为毒药的基底？不，不可能。拉格维花没有毒性特质。\n\n把拉格维花放进毒药里就像盗贼使用双手锤一样。当然，你可以这么做，但那不是你使命的本质！我不懂……\n\n<迪莫斯清了清他的喉咙。>\n\n我是说，谢谢你把这些东西带给我。我会在时机允许时试试这毒药。",cEN="<Timothy leafs through the manual.>\n\nThey're using ragveil as a base for the poison? No, that can't be right. Ragveil has no toxic properties.\n\nIncluding ragveil in a poison is like a rogue wielding two maces. Sure, you can do it, but it isn't true to the essence of your calling! I just can't understand...\n\n<Timothy clears his throat.>\n\nI mean, thank you for fetching these for me. I'll try out the poison as soon as time permits."}
Q[9849]={d="<戈达乌从后背掰下一块岩石。>\n\n我把这块代表大地之怒的碎片交给你。将戈达乌的石块砸向破碎奔行者。击碎他们的外壳，看看这帮家伙的真面目。杀死侵占者的爪牙，然后返回元素王座，将侵占者的名字告诉戈达乌。\n\n破碎奔行者分布在纳格兰西南方的边缘地带。",dEN="<Gordawg breaks off a piece of ebon rock from his back.>\n\nYou are granted a piece of the fury of the earth. Take the boulder of Gordawg and hurl it at the poison rock. Shatter their shells to discover the truth. Destroy the minions of the usurper and return to Gordawg with the name.\n\nYou find the shattered elements at the edge of the world. Southwest.",o="纳格兰元素王座的戈达乌要你杀死30个戈隆克的爪牙。",oEN="Gordawg at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand has asked that you slay 30 Minions of Gurok.",p="戈达乌要你带着石块回来。",pEN="Gordawg wants the boulder returned.",c="古罗克！古罗克背叛了元素！",cEN="GUROK! Gurok betrayed the elements!"}
Q[9850]={d="看来猎杀裂蹄牛对你来说已经不在话下，不过裂蹄公牛就不那么容易对付了，它是比裂蹄牛更危险的猎物。\n\n杀死十二头裂蹄公牛，然后再来夸耀你的狩猎技能吧。\n\n你可以在营地以西和以南方向的纳格兰中心地带找到它们的踪迹。",dEN="You've proved to me that you can find and take down a regular clefthoof, but far more dangerous are the clefthoof bulls.\n\nBag yourself twelve of those. Then you can talk to me of your hunting prowess.\n\nLook for them all along the middle region of Nagrand to the west and south.",o="杀死12头裂蹄公牛，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Clefthoof Bulls and then speak to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Safari in Nagrand about your prowess.",p="你以为那些公裂蹄牛会就这样在营火前阵亡在你脚边吗？",pEN="You think the clefthoof bulls are just going to fall dead at your feet here in front of the campfire?",c="令人惊叹。非常令人惊叹。\n\n你有潜力，$g小子:姑娘;。现在我要给你一个真正尽兴的机会……",cEN="Impressive. Most impressive.\n\nYou've got potential, kid. Now I'm going to give you the chance to have some real fun!"}
Q[9851]={d="班塔尔是外域最凶猛、最难捕捉的裂蹄牛。她也是毛最浓密的。\n\n据说她带着自己的裂蹄牛群在奥舒古恩附近的灵魂之地游荡。\n\n你想真正证明自己的$g狩猎:狩猎;本领吗？把她的角带给我！",dEN="Banthar is the fiercest and most elusive of all the clefthoof in Outland. She's also the hairiest.\n\nIt is said that she roams with her clefthoof herd in the Field of Spirits near Oshu'gun.\n\nYou want to truly prove your hunting mastery? Bring me her horn!",o="将班塔尔的犄角交给纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里。",oEN="Acquire the Horn of Banthar and return it to Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="温暖的火堆和一个$g女人:男人陪你闲聊是在家做的事。在这里我们要猎杀大型猎物或搏命演出。",pEN="A warm fire and a woman at your side for idle chit-chat is something you can get at home. Here we hunt big game or die trying.",c="你办到了！你击败了班塔尔！我从未怀疑，$n。\n\n来，我认为你比这些奖励更有价值。",cEN="You did it! You took down Banthar! I never had a doubt, <name>.\n\nHere, I think you've more than earned this."}
Q[9852]={d="纳格兰所有生灵中的女王名叫象牙。她是一头前所未见的巨型雷象！\n\n听到这个名字你就该发抖。巴赫洛、开膛者和班塔尔与她相比都不算什么。据说她住在西南方一座俯瞰奥舒古恩的巨大峭壁上。有胆量的话，把她那颗巨大的心脏带给我。\n\n要不要留封信给我，好在你回不来的时候转交给你的亲属？",dEN="The queen of all that dwell in Nagrand is known as Tusker. She's a giant elekk the likes of which you won't see anywhere else!\n\nYou're right to be fearful of that name. Bach'lor, Gutripper, and Banthar are nothing when compared to her. It is said that she can be found on a huge bluff far to the southwest overlooking Oshu'gun. Bring me her massive heart if you dare.\n\nDo you want to leave a letter with me so that I can have it delivered to your next of kin in the likely event that you don't return?",o="将塔丝克之心交给纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里。",oEN="Bring the Heart of Tusker to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Safari in Nagrand.",p="承认你没那个胆猎捕这片大地上最强大的动物不是什么可耻的事，$n。",pEN="There's no shame in admitting that you haven't the spine to hunt the mightiest of animals this land has to offer, <name>.",c="$n！你让这个老矮人的心里充满了喜悦。\n\n你已经证明了自己；你已跻身精英之列！其他人要么吓得逃走，要么被那头巨兽踩在脚下丧命。而你用头脑、机敏和决心证明了你对狩猎的精通。\n\n收下这个，并且记住：只要你愿意，随时欢迎来与我并肩狩猎！$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="<name>! You bring joy to this old dwarf's heart.\n\nYou have now proven yourself; you've joined the ranks of the elite! Others ran away in fear, or died, trampled under the foot of the beast. You used your mind, your cunning, your determination to prove your mastery of the hunt.\n\nTake this and know that you are always welcome to hunt at my side!"}
Q[9853]={d="必须召唤出古罗克。你，召唤古罗克，然后杀掉他。\n\n去西北方的战槌山，那里的食人魔将古罗克当作神崇拜。收集战槌食人魔的徽记，摆放在战槌山的大地印记上。只有这样才能召唤出古罗克。记得，7枚徽记。\n\n如果你能获胜，就将古罗克的徽记带回来交给戈达乌。戈达乌会毁掉他的徽记。\n\n<戈达乌做出猛烈撕咬的动作，你脚下的大地震颤起来。>",dEN="Gurok must be summoned. You summon Gurok and you destroy.\n\nYou must go to Warmaul Hill to the northwest and find where ogre worships Gurok. You put ogre skull from Warmaul ogres on Gurok's earthen brand. Only then will Gurok come. Seven skulls.\n\nIf you live, bring Gordawg back Gurok earthen head. Gordawg crushes head.\n\n<Gordawg bites down hard, shaking the earth beneath your feet.>",o="杀死侵占者古罗克，将古罗克的徽记交给纳格兰元素王座的戈达乌。",oEN="Gordawg at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand has asked that you destroy Gurok the Usurper and bring back Gurok's Earthen Head.",p="戈达乌吃掉古罗克的力量。",pEN="Gordawg eat Gurok power.",c="<戈达乌大口咀嚼着古罗克的徽记，几乎要瓦解了石头形态。>\n\n古罗克的统治时期结束。土灵元素自由了。一切沉睡。胜利者获得奖励！",cEN="<Gordawg chomps down hard on Gurok's earthen head, nearly disintegrating the stone formation.>\n\nGurok's reign has come to an end. The earthen elements are free. All sleep now. Champion gets reward!"}
Q[9854]={d="$c，你是否跟我一样向往猎手的生活？你知道追捕猎物时如何保持沉着冷静吗？知道怎样才算是对倒下的猎物的尊敬吗？我会教你领悟其中的秘诀。\n\n纳格兰葱翠的大草原上生活着无数野生动物。去猎杀一些风鹏，然后再来跟我谈话。\n\n营地四周都能找到它们的踪迹。",dEN="Do you live for the hunt as I do, <class>? Do you seek the quietude that comes as you stalk your prey? Would you know what it is to honor the last heartbeats of your fallen quarry? I will help you to achieve this.\n\nNagrand is a lush land, full of life in the midst of this broken world. Bring down a handful of the windrocs and then we will speak more.\n\nYou can find them in many places nearby in all directions around our camp.",o="杀死12只风鹏，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的“好儿子”沙度·远行者复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Windrocs and then return to Fitz at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="你可曾体会到，明白自己在自然中的位置所带来的那份宁静？你是$g猎人:猎物;，还是猎物？",pEN="Have you come to know the peace that comes with knowing your place in nature? Are you the hunter or the hunted?",c="每一天都是一个礼物——因为明天我们要比今天更迅捷地驰骋在草原上。我们会张开双臂努力达到我们今晚所梦想的目标，虽然它可能总是会难倒我们。",cEN="Every day is a gift. Make the most of it. For tomorrow we shall stride swifter over the plains than today. We will spread our arms further and strain to achieve that which tonight we can only dream of, though it may ever elude us."}
Q[9855]={d="想要猎杀最强大的野兽，就必须保持进取心！在你茫然不知所措的时候，我会为你指明方向。\n\n纳格兰生活着另一种更可怕的风鹏。下一步就是猎杀那些饥饿的风鹏。你可以在营地以西和西南方向的纳格兰中心地带找到它们的踪迹。",dEN="You must always push yourself if you are to one day stalk the mightiest of prey! While you are not yet ready, I will point you in the right direction.\n\nThere is another breed of windroc even deadlier. Seek out the ravenous windroc to test your mettle against. You will find them in the heart of Nagrand to the west and southwest.",o="杀死12只饥饿的风鹏，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的“好儿子”沙度·远行者复命。",oEN="Hunt down 12 Ravenous Windrocs and then return to Fitz at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="你可曾学会平复心跳？像平静的湖水一样$g静默:静默;而耐心，等待合适的时机扑倒猎物？",pEN="Have you learned yet to calm the beating of your heart? To be as still as a calm lake and patient, waiting for the right moment to strike down your quarry?",c="你再次证明了你的技能，$c。现在你一定要去猎捕最凶猛的风鹏。",cEN="You have proven your skill once more, <class>. Now you must go on to stalk the fiercest of the windrocs."}
Q[9856]={d="$c，备战吧。勇敢地面对风鹏的女王——裂肠者！你杀了这么多女王的子民；为了表示对猎物的尊重，至少你要给她复仇的机会吧！去遥远的西边寻找裂肠者，她跟体型较大的风鹏生活在一起。\n\n如果你能战胜她，就把裂肠者的眼睛带回来。",dEN="You are ready, <class>. Ready to face the mother of all windrocs, Gutripper! Honor demands that after hunting so many of her children that you give her the chance to defeat you! Seek her out amongst the greater windroc far to the west.\n\nShould you survive, bring her eye to me.",o="将裂肠者的眼睛交给纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的“好儿子”沙度·远行者。",oEN="Bring the Eye of Gutripper to Fitz at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="你挑战了裂肠者吗？",pEN="Have you faced Gutripper yet?",c="她的眼睛看起来好像她还活着一样。你觉得她还是能看透你的灵魂吗？\n\n$n，你现在可以自称为一个精英的狩猎人了。你离追踪这片土地最终的猎物，长牙又更进一步了！\n\n这是你的努力所赚取的报酬。愿它对你有所助益。",cEN="Her eye looks as if it is still alive. Do you think that she can still see into your soul?\n\n<name>, you can now count yourself as one of the elite safari hunters. And you are another step closer to stalking the ultimate prey of this land, Tusker!\n\nYou've earned the right to have this. May it serve you well."}
Q[9857]={d="我今天不想外出狩猎。你愿意替我跑一趟吗？\n\n我跟赫米特提过，今天会去猎杀一些塔布羊。塔布羊在纳格兰广为分布，雄性塔布羊更是上等的猎物。你可以在附近的树林中找到它们。\n\n你能胜任这件差事吗？",dEN="I don't think that I'm up to the hunt today. Do you think that you might take my place?\n\nI told Hemet that I was going to see about bagging us some of those talbuk that seem to be all over the place. The stags are especially nice to hunt. You can find them congregated around the nearby trees.\n\nThink that you could take care of that for me?",o="杀死12头塔布雄羊，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的哈罗德·兰恩复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Talbuk Stags and then return to Harold Lane at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="我想在这里躺久一点。我很快就没事了。",pEN="I'm just going to lay here a little while longer. I should be fine soon.",c="你猎到那些雄鹿的故事……讲得不错……<咳嗽>……$c。不过我觉得你还能做得更好。我心里另有件事要交给你。<tose>",cEN="That's a good tale... ...of how you bagged all of those stags, <class>. But I think that you can do better. I've got something else in mind for you."}
Q[9858]={d="这道该死的抓伤快把我拖垮了。嗯……你能不能再……<咳嗽>……替我接手这次狩猎？\n\n这回你得去猎荆棘掠食者。它们比雄鹿更坚韧、更狡猾，所以小心点。你会在……<咳嗽>……纳格兰中部、西面和南面的树荫下找到它们。\n\n去吧，出去……<咳嗽>……让赫米特看看你的本事。我没事的。<tose><tose><tose>",dEN="This darned scratch is getting the worst of me it would seem. So, are you up to filling...... in for me again?\n\nThis time you're going to bag yourself some thorngrazers. They're tougher and wilier than the stags, so keep your wits about you. Look for them... ... sheltered under the trees in the middle of Nagrand to the west and south.\n\nGo on, get out there and...... show Hemet what you're made of. I'll be fine.",o="杀死12头塔布羊食棘者，然后向纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的哈罗德·兰恩复命。",oEN="Hunt down 12 Talbuk Thorngrazers and then return to Harold Lane at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="我想……<咳嗽>……你已经收拾掉那些……<咳嗽>……荆棘掠食者了吧？<tose><tose>",pEN="I don't suppose...... you've taken care of those...... thorngrazers yet?",c="<咳嗽>，<咳嗽>……$n！你做到了。那就只剩……一件事……<咳嗽>……了。<tose><tose><tose>",cEN=", ... <name>! You did it. There's only...... one thing left to...... do then."}
Q[9859]={d="<剧烈地咳嗽。>\n\n别担心……<咳嗽>……我。我会没事的。只是……<咳嗽>……擦破点皮。\n\n还是老样子，我想你……<咳嗽>……得再一次替我……<咳嗽>……顶上。\n\n你必须去寻找伟大的巴赫洛，雄鹿……<咳嗽>……之王。带上几个朋友也没关系。\n\n把他的蹄子带一只给我……<咳嗽>，<咳嗽>……作为凭证。\n\n你会在……<咳嗽>……纳格兰最西端找到他带着鹿群。<Tose convulsivamente.><tose><tose><tose><tose><tose><tose><tose><tose>",dEN="<Wracking cough.>\n\nDon't worry about...... me. I'll be fine. It's just a...... scratch.\n\nJust the same, I think you'll... ... have to fill in for me one more... ... time.\n\nYou must seek out the great Bach'lor, king of...... the stags. It's ok if you... ... take friends along.\n\nBring me one of his hooves..., ... as confirmation.\n\nLook for him...... leading his herd in the far west of Nagrand.",o="将巴克洛尔的蹄子交给纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的哈罗德·兰恩。",oEN="Obtain the Hoof of Bach'lor and return it to Harold Lane at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="<哈罗德虚弱地看着你，勉强挤出一个笑容。>\n\n你拿到……<咳嗽>……蹄子了吗？<tose>",pEN="You have... the hoof?",c="哇！你做到了！那真是巴赫洛的蹄子！\n\n嗯，我好像感觉好多了。来，让我给你点东西，庆祝你$g狩猎:狩猎;本领得到了证明！",cEN="Wow! You did it! That's really Bach'lor's hoof!\n\nUm, I'm starting to feel much better it would seem. Here, let me give you something in celebration of your proven hunting prowess!"}
Q[9860]={d="$n，立即去向塞德瑞克报告。你给予紫罗兰之眼的重大贡献必将得到回报。\n\n$c，好好想想，你希望我们和我们的组织给你什么；不过你放心，你帮助了达拉然的大法师们，我们是绝不会让你后悔的。",dEN="Return to Cedric at once, <name>. The aid you've given the Violet Eye will not go unrewarded.\n\nThink what you want of us and our organization, <class>, but gaining the favor of the archmages of Dalaran will not be something you regret.",o="与达拉然巨坑外的大法师塞德瑞克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Archmage Cedric in the outskirts of Dalaran Crater.",c="奥图鲁斯告诉我所有发生的事了，$n。不过，这并不是结束。卡拉赞仍对外人封闭，燃烧军团在我们没有能力的时候重新攻击也是迟早的事。\n\n除非你接受命运给你的责任。\n\n<赛卓克伸出张开的手心递给你一个镶着单颗紫罗兰水晶的戒指。>\n\n你说怎么样，$n？",cEN="Alturus told me all about what happened, <name>. This is not the end of it, however. With Karazhan remaining sealed to outsiders, it's only a matter of time until the Legion renews its attacks while we stand powerless in the sidelines.\n\nUnless you accept the responsibility that fate has bestowed upon you, that is.\n\n<Cedric extends an open palm towards you, holding a badge with the Violet Eye's symbol on it.>\n\nWhat do you say, <name>?"}
Q[9861]={d="这团飘忽不定的空气元素用你难以理解的语言述说着什么。你认为这是被称为古卡利姆多语的元素语言。或许元素王座那里的人会对这件与众不同的东西有独到的见解。",dEN="This amorphous mass of elemental air is speaking to you in a language that you cannot understand. You believe the language to be the tongue of the elements: Kalimag. Perhaps someone at the Throne of the Elements could shed some insight on this unusual find.",o="返回元素王座寻找某个会讲古卡利姆多语的人，将呼嚎之风交给他。",oEN="Find someone at the Throne of the Elements that knows how to speak Kalimag and show them the Howling Wind.",p="在这里！快！",pEN="Give it here! Quickly!",c="这是个苦恼的请求，$r。一股外在力量正在破坏元素。",cEN="It is a distress call, <race>. An outside force is attempting to subvert the elements."}
Q[9862]={d="暗血氏族在捕捉并折磨空气之灵！他们是我的亲族：一支侍奉邪恶的穆塞莱克——盘牙的兽王——的破碎者部族。\n\n空气之灵说，暗血腐蚀者正在捕捉其他的空气之灵，用它们在各元素之间播撒混乱。看来暗血氏族最近洗劫了西南方一个叫日泉的兽人村庄，正用强大的元素魔法搅扰湖泊。找到那些腐蚀者，消灭他们。",dEN="Murkblood are capturing and torturing the spirits of air! Murkblood are my kin: A tribe of the Broken who serve the vile Musel'ek, beast lord of Coilfang.\n\nThe air spirit states that the Murkblood putrifiers are capturing other spirits of air and using them to sow chaos into the ranks of the elements. It would seem that the Murkblood have recently sacked an orc village to the southwest known as Sunspring and are using powerful elemental magic to disturb the lake. Find the putrifiers and destroy them.",o="纳格兰元素王座的元素师莫格要你杀死5个暗血净化者。",oEN="Elementalist Morgh at the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand wants you to slay 5 Murkblood Putrifiers.",p="风灵声称黑暗之血在寻找日泉岗哨的某个东西……",pEN="The air spirit claims that the Murkblood are searching for something at Sunspring...",c="你看到他们控制元素？风也向他们屈服了？\n\n<莫夫沉思了一会儿。>\n\n这很麻烦，$n。我一定要和其它人商量。\n\n我们感谢你的努力，$n。或许你该回到你的村子，看看他们有没有其它关于黑暗之血和他们恶毒目标的消息。",cEN="You saw them controlling the elements? The wind bent to their will?\n\n<Morgh is lost in thought for a moment.>\n\nThis is troubling, <name>. I must consult with the others.\n\nWe thank you for your efforts, <name>. Perhaps you should return to your village and see if they have any other information about the Murkbloods and their nefarious goals."}
Q[9863]={d="盖亚安祖母的病情加重之后，玛格汉氏族就不断遭到外族侵袭，而卑鄙的暗血氏族在我们四面受敌之际乘虚而入！\n\n这些天来，暗血破碎者发动了不下五次攻击。他们还占领了原本属于我们的日泉岗哨。\n\n我们必须要打击暗血氏族的嚣张气焰，给他们点颜色瞧瞧！杀掉那些信仰邪教的家伙，将他们随身携带的神像抢回来，这样他们就知道厉害了。",dEN="With our leadership in ruin, we are left open to attacks from all sides. The foul Murkblood tribe could not have picked a better time to attack us!\n\nIn recent days, we have been subject to no less than 5 assaults from the Broken. They have even taken over our only other territorial holding in the area: Sunspring Post.\n\nWe must strike and show them that we are not powerless! Strike down the vile idolaters and bring me their twisted idols of worship so that they may ride the lightning.",o="将10个暗血神像交给纳格兰加拉达尔的先知古库斯。",oEN="Farseer Kurkush at Garadar in Nagrand wants you to bring him 10 Murkblood Idols.",p="请帮我们完成任务，我们无法自己完成。",pEN="Do this for us because we cannot do it for ourselves.",c="你给闪电之子带来希望，$n。如果我们的领导者不能保护我们，或许还有其它人可以——比如你。",cEN="You have given the Lightning Sons hope, <name>. If our leader will not protect us, perhaps there are others that are capable - like you."}
Q[9864]={d="加拉达尔最近遭受袭击后，一群年轻的玛格汉士兵决定向暗血氏族发起反攻。他们被愤怒冲昏了头脑，根本听不进任何劝阻。这些孩子离家已有一周时间了。\n\n$r，恳请你一定要找到这些孩子们的下落！他们才刚刚成年而已，如何能与凶蛮的暗血氏族抗衡？\n\n沿着西边的道路寻找这支战斗小队，他们就是从那条路离开的。\n\n$n，记得绕道避过哈兰。那儿冲突不断，很不安全。",dEN="After the last Murkblood raid, a group of younglings decided to act. We tried to stop them but the rage had taken hold. It has now been one week since we last saw our beloved younglings.\n\nPlease, <race>, you must find them! They have just barely reached adolescence. How can they expect to defeat such savages?\n\nThey took the road leading west out of town. Follow that road around and look for signs of our younglings.\n\nAnd <name>, avoid Halaa if you value your life. It is a war-zone.",o="找到失踪的加拉达尔战斗小队。",oEN="Try and find the missing Garadar war party.",c="我听过我们族人的故事。他们说我们曾是战士……",cEN="I have been told stories of my people. They say that once, we were warriors..."}
Q[9865]={d="陌生人，虽然我不认识你，不过能请你帮个忙吗？虽然乞求他人的帮助令我感到很羞愧，但是整个战斗小队只有我一人侥幸活了下来。\n\n满腔的怒火让我难以自制。我……我要报仇，血债血偿！你可曾有过这样的经历？我想要抡起斧头，将敌人统统劈成两半，直到耗尽最后的气力，再也挥不动武器。\n\n正南方就是日泉岗哨。我们的敌人就盘踞在那儿……杀了他们……不留活口……",dEN="I do not know you, stranger, but I ask for your help. I feel shame for this, but I am only one orc.\n\nEmotions have surfaced that I have never felt. I... I seek vengeance. Blood for blood. Do your people ever feel this? I wish to pick up my axe and split my enemies in two. To swing the weapon until my arms fall lifelessly at my sides, exhausted.\n\nSunspring Post is directly south of this procession. It is there that you will find our enemies... Kill them... Kill them all...",o="消灭20个暗血清道夫和10个暗血掠夺者。",oEN="Kill 20 Murkblood Scavengers and 10 Murkblood Raiders.",p="每死一个我的同胞，我就要杀死他们十个！",pEN="For each of my kin that they slew, ten of them must die!",c="<萨鲁法尔转身面对你。>\n\n我闻到的是血吗？很遗憾我未能助你一臂之力。你一定非常自豪。光是想到你所做的事，我的胸膛就鼓胀起来。\n\n像你这样的人还有吗？在你来的地方，还有更多的英雄吗？<Colmillosauro se gira hacia ti.>$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="<Saurfang turns to face you.>\n\nIs it blood that I smell? I regret being unable to lend assistance. How proud you must be. My chest swells just knowing what you have done.\n\nAre there others like you? Where you come from, do more heroes exist?"}
Q[9866]={d="$n，能帮我最后一个忙吗？我不想回加拉达尔。我命中注定要漂泊流浪……总有一天，我要做出一番大事来。\n\n请你转告先知考尔胡克，我不回家了。我不能回家。我必须游历整个世界……他会明白的。",dEN="Will you do me one last honor, <name>? I do not wish to return to Garadar. I believe that my destiny lies elsewhere - that I will serve a greater purpose someday.\n\nPlease, return to Farseer Corhuk and tell him that I will not be returning. That I cannot return. I must walk the earth... He will understand.",o="返回加拉达尔，将消息告诉先知考尔胡克。",oEN="Deliver the news to Farseer Corhuk at Garadar.",c="<先知考尔胡克失神地盯着地面，随即肯定地点了点头。>\n\n<先知考尔胡克将眼泪擦去。>\n\n这孩子和他父亲一样……愿魂灵在他之后的道路上有所仁慈。",cEN="<Farseer Corhuk stares at the ground, lost in contemplation. He nods his head affirmatively.>\n\n<Farseer Corhuk wipes a tear away.>\n\nThe son is the father... May the spirits have mercy on those that stand in his way."}
Q[9867]={d="新近爆发的战争夺走了许多伙伴的性命。\n\n数十年来，我们与纳格兰的食人魔一直处于交战状态；最近却遭遇了新的威胁。暗血破碎者氏族袭击了西南方的渔村——日泉岗哨，而村里的兽人要么被屠杀，要么被逐出了家园。\n\n虽然别的族人认为我们应该将入侵者悉数杀掉，不过我觉得“擒贼先擒王”方为上策。我不知道暗血酋长是谁，不过我想你应该辨认得出。",dEN="We have lost many friends in recent weeks.\n\nFor decades we have dealt with the ogres of Nagrand but now a new threat has arisen. The Broken tribe of Murkblood attacked our fishing village to the southwest, Sunspring Post, and managed to kill or evict all of the orcs that inhabited the town.\n\nWhile the others feel that the best course of action is to kill indiscriminately, I know that we must destroy their leadership. I do not know who their leader is but I suspect that you will know when you find him.",o="将暗血酋长奥托尔的徽记交给纳格兰加拉达尔的先知玛加迪。",oEN="Farseer Margadesh at Garadar in Nagrand wants you to bring him the Head of Ortor of Murkblood.",p="帮我把他们领袖的头颅带来，$n。",pEN="Bring me their leader's head, <name>.",c="这是我们敌人的面孔？我将它置于长矛上，公示在加拉达尔的入口附近。如果他们想再攻击我们，他们就要掂量这样做的后果……",cEN="So, this is the face of our enemy? I will have this put upon a pike and placed outside of Garadar, near the gates. Should they think to attack us again, they will see the consequences for their actions looking down upon them..."}
Q[9868]={d="谢谢你，$g陌生人:陌生人;，要不是你，我肯定早就被杀了。\n\n三夜前暗血氏族夜袭加拉达尔时绑架了我。我发现的事情足以撼动外域的根基：他们图谋夺回卡尔达什图腾！我们绝不能让图腾落入他们手中。\n\n你必须帮我逃出去。要是我出了什么事，就去加拉达尔，把这里发生的一切告诉加尔鲁什。",dEN="Thank you, stranger. They would have surely killed me had it not been for you.\n\nI was kidnapped by these Murkbloods 3 nights ago during a nighttime raid on Garadar. What I have since uncovered may very well shake the foundation of the Outland: these savages seek to recover the totem of Kar'dash! We cannot allow the totem to fall into the hands of the Murkbloods!\n\nYou must help me escape. And stranger, if I do not make it back to Garadar, you must tell Garrosh what happened here...",o="护送玛格汉俘虏逃离日泉岗哨，完成任务后返回加拉达尔，向加尔鲁什复命。",oEN="Escort the Mag'har Captive out of Sunspring Post. Speak to Garrosh at Garadar if you succeed.",p="<加尔鲁什几乎没有看到你出现。他看起来非常地沮丧。>",pEN="<Garrosh barely acknowledges your presence. He appears deeply depressed.>",c="有什么差？主母快死了。再活下去也没意义了……",cEN="What does it matter? The Greatmother is dying. Life is not worth living..."}
Q[9869]={d="$r，你好。我是大地之环的元素师犹基。我来塔拉的目的是让库雷尼方面了解元素生物的近况。\n\n你能帮我个忙吗？请你转至纳格兰北部山丘地带、天歌湖对岸的元素王座，告诉元素师沙尔瓦克我已经平安抵达塔拉。她会奖励你的，这对你来说不过是个举手之劳吧。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Ioki, elementalist of the Earthen Ring. I have come to Telaar to inform the Kurenai of the state of the elements.\n\nCould I ask a favor of you? Would you travel to the Throne of the Elements in the northern hills of Nagrand, beyond Skysong Lake, and tell elementalist Sharvak that I have arrived at Telaar safely? She will surely reward you for this small deed.",o="元素师犹基希望你转至元素王座，与元素师沙尔瓦克谈一谈。",oEN="Elementalist Ioki wants you to travel to the Throne of the Elements and speak with Elementalist Sharvak.",c="啊，谢谢你的讯息。或许你不介意帮忙大地之环？元素不断变迁。我们可以使用所有能获得的协助。",cEN="Ah, thank you for the message. Perhaps you would not mind helping out the Earthen Ring? The elements are in flux. We can use all of the assistance that we can get."}
Q[9870]={d="$r，你好。我是大地之环的元素师亚尔哈。我来加拉达尔向玛格汉氏族汇报元素的情况。\n\n你能帮我个忙吗？转至纳格兰北部、天歌湖对岸的元素王座，告诉元素师沙尔瓦克我已经平安抵达加拉达尔，好吗？她会奖励你的，这对你来说不过是个举手之劳吧。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Yal'hah, elementalist of the Earthen Ring. I have come to Garadar to inform the Mag'har of the state of the elements.\n\nCould I ask a favor of you? Would you travel to the Throne of the Elements in the northern hills of Nagrand, beyond Skysong Lake, and tell elementalist Sharvak that I have arrived at Garadar safely? She will surely reward you for this small deed.",o="元素师亚尔哈希望你转至元素王座，与元素师沙尔瓦克谈一谈。",oEN="Elementalist Yal'hah wants you to travel to the Throne of the Elements and speak with Elementalist Sharvak.",c="啊，谢谢你的讯息。或许你不介意帮忙大地之环？元素不断变迁。我们可以使用所有能获得的协助。",cEN="Ah, thank you for the message. Perhaps you would not mind helping out the Earthen Ring? The elements are in flux. We can use all of the assistance that we can get."}
Q[9871]={d="羊皮纸上是一张粗略绘制的纳格兰地图。地图上塔拉所在的位置画着一个大大的红X。看来这些野蛮人正计划进攻那座城市。把暗血氏族的入侵计划带到塔拉交给阿雷克隆。|n",dEN="The parchment holds a crudely painted map of Nagrand. There is a big red 'X' where Telaar would be on the map. It would seem that these savages are planning an attack on the city. Take the Murkblood invasion plans to Arechron in Telaar.",o="将暗血入侵计划交给纳格兰的塔拉的阿雷克隆。",oEN="Take the Murkblood Invasion Plans to Arechron at Telaar in Nagrand.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What is it?",c="<阿雷克隆将拳头击在他的手心上。>\n\n奥托尔……奸诈的混蛋！",cEN="<Arechron slams his fist into his hand.>Ortor... Treacherous bastard!"}
Q[9872]={d="羊皮纸上粗略地描绘着纳格兰的地图。在加拉达尔的位置画着一个红色的大叉。看来这帮野蛮的家伙计划入侵这座镇子。将暗血入侵计划交给加拉达尔的加尔鲁什。",dEN="The parchment holds a crudely painted map of Nagrand. There is a big red 'X' where Garadar would be on the map. It would seem that these savages are planning an attack on the city. Take the Murkblood invasion plans to Garrosh in Garadar.",o="将暗血入侵计划交给加尔鲁什。",oEN="Take the Murkblood Invasion Plans to Garrosh.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What is it?",c="<加尔鲁什揉烂地图把它丢进火里。>\n\n有什么用？他们已经攻击我们好几个礼拜。这不是新闻了。\n\n你不懂吗？我们太累了……盖亚安苏母快死了。",cEN="<Garrosh crumples up the map and throws it into the fire.>\n\nWhat's the use? They've been attacking us for weeks. This is nothing new.\n\nDon't you understand? We're done for... Greatmother Geyah is dying."}
Q[9873]={d="这些入侵计划书应该是由暗血酋长奥托尔所拟定的。他原本曾是一位高贵的破碎者，精通于驾驭元素的力量，但可惜现在已经成为沼地领主穆塞雷克身边一条摇尾乞怜的哈巴狗了。\n\n计划书中写道，他们已经占领了西北方一座名叫日泉岗哨的兽人村落。\n\n立刻转至日泉岗哨杀死暗血酋长奥托尔。你所做的一切都是为了我们大家的生存……",dEN="These invasion plans were written by someone I once knew. Ortor of Murkblood, once a noble Broken, versed in the way of the elements, now a muck addled yes-man of Musel'ek the bog lord.\n\nThe plans state that they have taken over an orc village northwest of here known as Sunspring.\n\nTravel to Sunspring Post and rid the world of Ortor of Murkblood. What you do, you do for the good of us all...",o="杀死暗血酋长奥托尔，然后向纳格兰塔拉的阿雷克隆复命。",oEN="Arechron at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to kill Ortor of Murkblood.",p="记住，$n，奥托尔是个强大的萨满。",pEN="Remember, <name>, Ortor is a shaman of great power.",c="你说有一千个死掉的兽人？是什么造成这样大胆的兽人土地入侵行动？他死掉是好的但这一切只是凤毛麟角。",cEN="A thousand dead orcs you say? What could have triggered such an audacious advance into orc lands? It is good that he is dead but there is more to this than what meets the tentacle."}
Q[9874]={d="$n，我刚刚得知日泉岗哨那场惨绝人寰的悲剧。邪恶的暗血氏族侵占了西北方的日泉岗哨，大肆杀戮居住在那儿的兽人。更糟糕的是，他们开始将尸体抛入日泉湖。一旦尸体腐烂，我们的主要水源就会遭到严重污染。\n\n我要交给你的这项任务相当恶心，但是势在必行。带上这把魔油火炬，返回日泉岗哨，烧掉那些腐烂的兽人遗体……",dEN="I have just gotten word of a catastrophe of epic proportions, <name>. The foul Murkblood have sacked the orc village of Sunspring Post, northwest of here, and murdered its residents. To make matters worse, they have begun dumping the bodies into Sunspring Lake. Should those bodies rot, our primary source of water in the region will be compromised.\n\nIt's a gruesome task that I give you next but it must be done. Take this enchanted torch and return to Sunspring. Burn all of the rotting orc corpses...",o="纳格兰塔拉的智者奥通布要你用液态火焰火炬烧毁10具日泉村民的尸体。任务完成后把液态火焰火炬交还给他。|n",oEN="Otonbu the Sage at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to use the Torch of Liquid Fire to destroy 10 Sunspring Villager corpses. Return the Torch of Liquid Fire when the task is complete.",p="兽人不会了解我们在做什么，但它一定要完成。这是为了兽人和破碎者好。",pEN="The orcs will not understand what we are doing but it must be done. For the good of both orc and Broken.",c="<欧图布叹气。>\n\n这会让我们和兽人再维持10年和平的机会受到挫折。至少我们还能在这看看那些尸体如果腐烂会发生什么事。",cEN="<Otonbu sighs.>\n\nThis will set back any chance of peace with the orcs another 10 years. At least we will be around to see those years as opposed to what could have happened had those corpses been allowed to rot."}
Q[9875]={d="劳拉娜一定是漏掉了这种植物。你确信自己发现的是一种尚未被她著作收录的物种。最好拿给她看看，听听她怎么说。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="Lauranna must've missed this particular plant. You're certain you've discovered a species not yet catalogued by Lauranna's work. You'd best show it to her to see what she makes of it.",o="将未归类的植物交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的劳兰娜·萨维尔。",oEN="Bring the Uncatalogued Species to Lauranna Thar'well at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="一个新物种！你确定吗？\n\n<劳拉娜翻看着一页页笔记和图谱。>\n\n干得好，$n。我们得把它加进名录里。\"紫叶$n草\"听起来怎么样？我觉得挺好。<Lauranna ojea hojas de notas y diagramas.>$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="A new species! Are you sure?\n\n<Lauranna flips through pages of notes and diagrams.>\n\nNice job, <name>. We'll have to add this one to our list. How does \"Purple Leafed <name>rium\" sound to you? It does have a ring to it."}
Q[9876]={d="我派了一小队德鲁伊去调查你在蛇湖发现的排水口。本以为他们很快就会回来。不用说，他们至今未归。\n\n我们视你为最能干的$g盟友:盟友;之一，所以想请你帮我们找到他们，查明他们出了什么事。",dEN="I sent a small group of our druids to investigate the drain you discovered inside of Serpent Lake. They were expected to return shortly after. Needless to say, they did not.\n\nYou are amongst our most capable allies; I ask you to seek them and find out what became of them.",o="伊谢尔·风歌要你转至赞加沼泽的盘牙水库，在入口附近搜寻塞纳里奥远征队德鲁伊的下落。",oEN="Ysiel Windsinger wants you to look for signs of Cenarion Expedition Druids near the entrance to Coilfang Reservoir in Zangarmarsh.",c="感谢塞纳留斯你出现了。我的伤势让我无法到外面求援。",cEN="Thank Cenarius you showed up. My injuries prevented me from going back to the outside for help."}
Q[9877]={d="在对抗亡灵天灾的过程中，我们遭遇了惨痛的人员伤亡。每天都有许多将士被杀害，但是更多的俘虏则要面对更悲惨的命运。\n\n亡灵天灾通常不会关押囚犯。对那些被囚禁在戴索姆的将士而言，死亡或许是更好的选择。他们被强行灌下令人意志崩溃的毒药，惨遭严刑拷打，受尽了折磨。\n\n塔奎林的药剂师雷兹特恩已经研制出解药，去他那儿取回这救命的药膏。",dEN="The battle against the Scourge is not one without casualties. Many are slain every day yet many more meet a worse fate.\n\nIt is not uncommon for the Scourge to take prisoners. Death would be preferable to what awaits them in Deatholme. They're interrogated and tortured while under the effects of horrible will-breaking poisons.\n\nApothecary Renzithen in Tranquillien has developed a remedy; go to him and retrieve this restorative draught.",o="与塔奎林的药剂师雷兹特恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Apothecary Renzithen in Tranquillien.",c="珍妮达派你来救死亡之域的囚犯？她一定相当器重你，$n。",cEN="Janeda's sending you to rescue the Deatholme prisoners? She must think very highly of you, <name>."}
Q[9878]={d="暗血氏族在纳格兰滋扰生事，严重影响了我们周围的环境。元素们躁动难安，由此波及到此地所有生物。更糟糕的是，日泉岗哨的大屠杀事件重新点燃了兽人们对破碎者的新仇与旧恨。\n\n虽然库雷尼跟暗血是截然不同的两个氏族，可在兽人看来，我们都是十恶不赦的破碎者。\n\n我们必须解决眼下这进退维谷的窘境。转至西北方的日泉岗哨，消灭盘踞在那儿的暗血破碎者。",dEN="The appearance of the Murkblood in Nagrand has had a profound negative impact on our environment. The elementals are all in flux which has, in turn, greatly disturbed the wildlife. Worse yet, the razing of Sunspring Post has reignited the hatred that the orcs held for our people.\n\nWhile the Kurenai are a different tribe than the Murkblood, all an orc sees is Broken.\n\nWe must make an effort to solve this dilemma. Travel to Sunspring Post, northwest of here, and resolve the Murkblood problem.",o="消灭10个暗血清道夫和5个暗血掠夺者，然后向纳格兰塔拉的智者普里鲁鲁克复命。",oEN="Poli'lukluk the Wiser at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to kill 10 Murkblood Scavengers and 5 Murkblood Raiders.",p="黑暗之血是破碎者中一个恶毒的部族，$n。虽然他们看起来像库雷尼但他们绝对是野蛮，凶残的野兽。",pEN="Murkblood are a nefarious tribe of Broken, <name>. They may look like Kurenai but they are most assuredly savage, murdering beasts.",c="不知道兽人是否会了解或感谢你所做的一切，但纳格兰的确因此脱离险境。谢谢你，麻烦解决者……",cEN="It is doubtful that the orcs will understand or appreciate what you just did but Nagrand is better off for the deed. Thank you, problem solver..."}
Q[9879]={d="要不是你出现，我早就死了，$g陌生人:陌生人;。他们在寻找一件失落圣物的过程中已经杀害了太多库雷尼。\n\n他们要找的是卡尔达什图腾。我无法理解的是，他们为什么认为我们会知道关于那图腾的事。图腾难道不是兽人的器具吗？\n\n你必须把这个消息带给阿雷克隆。也许他知道暗血氏族为什么绑架并折磨库雷尼，只为逼问一件兽人器具的下落。\n\n趁更多人赶来之前，我们走吧。",dEN="I would have been killed had you not come along, stranger. They have already murdered so many Kurenai in their search for a lost relic.\n\nWhat they seek is the totem of Kar'dash. Why they think that we would know anything about this totem, I cannot understand. Is a totem not an orcish implement by nature?\n\nThis information must be taken back to Arechron. Perhaps he knows why Murkblood are kidnapping Kurenai and torturing them for information regarding an orcish device.\n\nLet's go before more come.",o="护送库雷尼俘虏逃离日泉岗哨，完成任务后返回塔拉，向阿雷克隆复命。",oEN="Escort the Kurenai Captive out of Sunspring Post. Speak to Arechron at Telaar if you succeed.",c="是的，我知道图腾的事……但这故事还有很多来龙去脉。唉，我不能擅自向你揭露这件事。只有被选中的人才能知道。",cEN="Yes, I know of the totem... but there is much more to this story. Alas, I lack the authority to reveal this information to you. Only the chosen may be privy to such knowledge."}
Q[9882]={d="节点亲王哈拉迈德大人严令禁止我们在沃舒古中开采水晶，惟恐这样会激怒某位强大的纳鲁。这令我们的工作严重受阻。\n\n不过，我已经找到空子可钻了。\n\n你看，被这块大钻石吸引来的虚灵可不仅仅只有我们星界财团而已，还有个名叫加瓦克希的盗贼头目领着一帮虚灵手下也进入了沃舒古，并且已经开始搬运那些大块的碎片了。\n\n$r，你的任务就是替我们夺得那些水晶碎片，这可不算是我们亲自开采的。偷取这些盗贼的东西可不算偷，对吧？",dEN="Nexus Prince Haramad has ordered us to not begin work inside of Oshu'gun as it might anger a certain powerful naaru. Sort of puts a damper on our operation.\n\nI think I might've found a loophole, however.\n\nYou see, we're not the only ethereals drawn to this colossal diamond. A thief called Gava'xi has led a band of rogue ethereals into Oshu'gun and they've begun to dislodge large fragments from it.\n\nYour job, <race>, is to go there and retrieve what is rightfully ours.",o="将10块沃舒古水晶碎片交给纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的杰赫。",oEN="Obtain 10 Oshu'gun Crystal Fragments and bring them to Gezhe at Aeris Landing in Nagrand.",p="你取回我要你弄到的水晶碎片了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you retrieved the crystal fragments I asked of you, <name>?",c="真是令我惊讶。这些碎片的状态大部分都非常好。\n\n我会为你向我们人民说些好话的。",cEN="Color me impressed. These are in excellent condition, for the most part.\n\nI will make sure to put in a good word for you with our people."}
Q[9883]={p="你有更多水晶碎片？确定你拿的都已不属于那座山了，我们可不想跟纳鲁惹上麻烦。",pEN="You've got more crystal fragments? Make sure you're not taking any that are still attached to the mountain; we wouldn't want to stir up trouble with the naaru.",c="继续拿水晶碎片来，$n。我们不能让这些小偷拿走我们的财产。\n\n虽然说它们也还不完全是我们的。当然，。",cEN="Keep the crystal fragments coming, <name>. We cannot let these thieves take our property.\n\nEven if it's not ours just quite yet. A technicality, of course."}
Q[9884]={c="星界财团以善待朋友而闻名。每月月初，我都会为你准备好一些宝石，作为你效力的报酬。\n\n你得到的宝石品质取决于你对我们有多忠诚。希望你能$g明智:明智;一点，继续留在我们这边。",cEN="The Consortium is well known for taking good care of its friends. At the beginning of each month I'll have some gems ready for you as payment for your services.\n\nThe quality of the gems you get will depend on how loyal you've been to us. Here's to hoping you do the smart thing and stay with us."}
Q[9885]={c="星界财团以善待朋友而闻名。每月月初，我都会为你准备好一些宝石，作为你效力的报酬。\n\n你得到的宝石品质取决于你对我们有多忠诚。希望你能$g明智:明智;一点，继续留在我们这边。",cEN="The Consortium is well known for taking good care of its friends. At the beginning of each month I'll have some gems ready for you as payment for your services.\n\nThe quality of the gems you get will depend on how loyal you've been to us. Here's to hoping you do the smart thing and stay with us."}
Q[9886]={c="星界财团以善待朋友而闻名。每月月初，我都会为你准备好一些宝石，作为你效力的报酬。\n\n你得到的宝石品质取决于你对我们有多忠诚。希望你能$g明智:明智;一点，继续留在我们这边。",cEN="The Consortium is well known for taking good care of its friends. At the beginning of each month I'll have some gems ready for you as payment for your services.\n\nThe quality of the gems you get will depend on how loyal you've been to us. Here's to hoping you do the smart thing and stay with us."}
Q[9887]={c="星界财团以善待朋友而闻名。每月月初，我都会为你准备好一些宝石，作为你效力的报酬。\n\n你得到的宝石品质取决于你对我们有多忠诚。希望你能$g明智:明智;一点，继续留在我们这边。",cEN="The Consortium is well known for taking good care of its friends. At the beginning of each month I'll have some gems ready for you as payment for your services.\n\nThe quality of the gems you get will depend on how loyal you've been to us. Here's to hoping you do the smart thing and stay with us."}
Q[9888]={d="我从石拳食人魔夜袭我村庄的行动中逃生，捡回一条命。\n\n可我要问你，$g陌生人:陌生人;：这又是为了什么？\n\n<约林指向加尔鲁什。>\n\n他拒绝援助我们。食人魔在我的家园里横行无忌，他却坐在这里，对着火堆哭泣。我们变成了什么？我们又会变成什么？\n\n我已经派斥候基尔拉斯去了那座村庄，如今那里叫血环废墟。你能找到他并帮他一把吗？他藏在纳格兰与泰罗卡的边界上。",dEN="I have escaped certain death, surviving a cowardly nighttime attack by Boulderfist ogres upon my village.\n\nBut I ask you, stranger: For what?\n\n<Jorin points to Garrosh.>\n\nHe has refused to give us assistance. Ogres are rampaging through my town and he sits here, weeping into a fire. What has become of us? What will become of us?\n\nI've sent a scout, Kilrath, to the village, now the Bleeding Hollow Ruins. Will you find him and give him your assistance? He hides on the border of Nagrand and Terokkar.",o="约林·死眼要你找到吉尔拉斯并跟他谈谈。",oEN="Jorin Deadeye has asked that you find and speak with Kilrath.",c="<吉尔拉斯压低了声音对你说。>\n\n这些食人魔特别奇怪，他们也特别愚笨。看那个胖的怎么教那个……呃……没那么胖的跳舞。那是催眠。",cEN="<Kilrath speaks in a hushed tone.>\n\nThese ogres are extremely peculiar. They are also extremely stupid. Look how the fat one makes the, um, lesser fat ones dance. It's mesmerizing."}
Q[9889]={d="数日来，我一直在观察这帮野蛮的食人魔。他们当中的那个大胖子说要等待时机，但是他究竟在等什么就不得而知了。\n\n我倒是有个法子，不过你得使用暴力。杀掉他手下的仆从，然后将这家伙揍个半死。他一定会跪地求饶，乖乖地吐露秘密的。",dEN="I have been watching these beasts for days. The fat one says that he is waiting for something. What he is waiting for, however, is a mystery.\n\nI have a plan but it is going to involve some violence on your part. You will need to kill several of his subordinates and then beat him within an inch of his life. Do this and I am certain he will tell us everything that we need to know.",o="泰罗卡森林的吉尔拉斯要求你杀死10名石拳入侵者，并击败无情的安克尔，让他招供。",oEN="Kilrath in Terokkar Forest has asked that you kill 10 Boulderfist Invaders and beat Unkor the Ruthless until he talks.",p="我投降！我投降！",pEN="I submit! I submit!",c="放我一条生路，我会告诉你所有你想知道的事！",cEN="Let me live and I'll tell you whatever you want to know!"}
Q[9890]={d="许多年来，石拳氏族统治着外域所有的食人魔。食人魔在克罗尔的统领下团结一致，也满足于分到的土地。可近几个月来，我们失去了许多投奔新氏族——战槌——的食人魔。战槌夺走了我们在纳格兰的大部分土地，还杀害了我们许多同胞。\n\n我们别无选择，只能占据这座小镇。我们正在被赶尽杀绝……\n\n克罗尔失踪了，石拳氏族陷入一片混乱。兰泰索·刃拳在他缺席期间掌权。|n",dEN="For many years, Boulderfist ruled all ogres in the Outland. The ogres were united under Krol and content with the lands that they were given. In the past few months, we have lost many ogres to a new clan known as Warmaul. Warmaul has taken most of our land in Nagrand and killed many of our people.\n\nWe had no choice but to take this town. We are being exterminated...\n\nKrol has gone missing and Boulderfist is in turmoil. Lantresor of the Blade rules in his absence.",o="返回泰罗卡森林，将安克尔供述的秘密告诉吉尔拉斯。",oEN="Take the information that you beat out of Unkor back to Kilrath in Terokkar Forest.",c="慢，$n。我不过是个地位低下的盗贼。我不知道该怎么处理这样的讯息。",cEN="Slow down, <name>. I am but a lowly rogue. I have no idea what to do with such information."}
Q[9891]={d="返回加拉达尔，将安克尔探察到的秘密告诉约林。这帮食人魔毁了我们的家园，杀害我们的同胞，仅仅是为了争夺更多的生存空间。约林听到这个消息必定会勃然大怒。\n\n愿先祖的灵魂与你同在……我会继续躲在这儿观察动向；如果你有需要的话，尽快回来找我。",dEN="Take what you have learned and tell Jorin at Garadar. I can assure you that he won't be happy to know that our village was destroyed and many of our people killed because the ogres needed more space.\n\nMay the ancestors watch over you... I will be hiding in the bushes if you need me for anything else.",o="返回纳格兰的加拉达尔，将安克尔供述的秘密告诉约林·死眼。",oEN="Take the information that you beat out of Unkor to Jorin Deadeye at Garadar in Nagrand.",c="所以他们认为心血来潮的驱赶并屠杀兽人是对的咯？我相信这和我们首领的懦弱无能无关……要是他能像他父亲一样充满激情就好了……",cEN="So they think that they are within their rights to displace and slaughter orcs on a whim, eh? I'm sure that this had nothing to do with our leader being an impotent whelp... If only he'd gotten a fraction of the passion that his father had..."}
Q[9892]={p="你取得更多战争串珠了吗？你可以在远北找到很多食人魔，就在赞加沼泽的边界附近。",pEN="Have you obtained any more warbeads? You'll find plenty of ogres to the far north, near the border with Zangarmarsh.",c="我们会因此大赚一笔，$n。我会确保科瑞希知道你在这里的努力。",cEN="We'll make a good profit on these, <name>. I'll make sure Khoraazi hears about your work here."}
Q[9893]={d="$n，不知道什么时候我们才能开采沃舒古的水晶。眼下我们只能呆在这儿干耗着。\n\n幸运的是，我发现了另一项收入来源。纳格兰的食人魔都佩戴着黑曜石制成的作战念珠，这种矿石在许多地方都价值不菲。\n\n最近瑟利德为了解决埃瑞斯码头的安全问题已经干掉了不少食人魔。他搞的那些作战念珠就当是我们额外的收入吧……抱歉，我自言自语了。总之，你什么都不用管，只需去从食人魔身上把东西拿来，然后交给我。",dEN="All this waiting around for Oshu'gun to be ready for digging is eating into our profits, <name>.\n\nFortunately, I've devised an alternate source of income. The ogres of Nagrand wear warbeads made of obsidian, a mineral that commands a hefty price in many other worlds.\n\nZerid already has had to take care a few of the brutes as a matter of security. Think of the warbeads as an added bonus. Or better yet, don't think about it too much and just bring them to me.",o="将10串黑曜石作战念珠交给纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的杰赫。",oEN="Bring 10 Obsidian Warbeads to Gezhe at Aeris Landing in Nagrand.",p="那些巨魔待你如何，$n？他们很难搞吧？",pEN="How are those ogres treating you, <name>? Tough bunch, aren't they?",c="太好了。在我们等待沙塔尔完成沃舒古里不知道什么的家务时，这能维持我们的收入。",cEN="Excellent. This will keep us in business while we wait for the Sha'tar to finish whatever housekeeping it is they need to do inside Oshu'gun."}
Q[9894]={d="在赞加沼泽的旅途中，你可能遇见过一些远征队的观察者。他们通常在户外作业：记录沼泽地特有的生物，收集样本以及核对物种目录。\n\n$c，观察者的安全非常重要。因为沼泽兽的袭击，我们不得不召回派去南边蘑菇洞的观察者。监护者哈穆特认为只要杀死它们的首领克拉其大王，沼泽兽的攻击就会立即结束。",dEN="In your travels, you might have encountered some of the expedition's watchers. They do the majority of the field work: documenting the unique inhabitants of the marsh, collecting samples, and making contact with sentient species.\n\nThe safety of the watchers is paramount, <class>. We've had to recall the watchers we sent to explore Funggor Cavern to the south, because of marshbeast attacks. Warden Hamoot believes that killing their leader, Lord Klaq, will bring a swift end to the attacks.",o="杀死克拉其大王，然后向塞纳里奥庇护所的唤风者塔鲁·黑蹄复命。",oEN="Kill Lord Klaq and return to Windcaller Blackhoof at the Cenarion Refuge.",p="你找到并解决掉卡拉奎领主了吗？",pEN="Have you located and dealt with Lord Klaq?",c="我和观察者都非常感谢你，$n。他们听到可以继续在南方工作而不用担心遭到攻击一定会欢欣鼓舞的。",cEN="You have my gratitude, <name>, and that of the watchers. They will be heartened to hear that they can continue their work to the south without fear of attack."}
Q[9895]={d="$n，你仔细观察过周围的环境吗？这片土地呈现出明显的病态，它挣扎着想要保持平衡却失败了。\n\n如果你留意到沼泽地的生态，必定能看出一些端倪。某些生物以惊人的速度生长着，体型大大超过同类物种，变得越来越具有侵略性。\n\n沼泽之鞭正是不受抑制、过度生长的生物的典型。如果你愿意的话，就去庇护所南边的沼泽地亲眼看看。\n\n一定要做好防御准备。这只怪物不懂什么是仁慈。",dEN="Have you observed your surroundings closely, <name>? This is an ailing landscape, struggling to keep itself in balance and losing the fight.\n\nIf you know where to look, you can see the symptoms. Members of some species rapidly outgrow their peers and become more aggressive.\n\nA good example of this uncontrolled growth is the marshtrekker Boglash. If you wish to see it for yourself, look no further than the waterways south of the refuge.\n\nBe prepared to defend yourself. The creature knows no mercy.",o="找到沼泽之鞭并杀死它，然后向塞纳里奥庇护所的莱森·月火复命。",oEN="Locate and deal with Boglash, then return to Lethyn Moonfire at Cenarion Refuge.",p="你遇到伯卡拉兹了吗？",pEN="Have you encountered Boglash?",c="既然你已亲眼看过失衡的症状，在你的旅途中要小心它们。",cEN="Now that you've seen the symptoms of imbalance with your own eyes, be mindful of them in your travels."}
Q[9896]={d="以卡兹格罗斯的名义发誓，这儿真是炙热难耐！我没有理由责怪先前撤离的队伍，但是大伙儿心里明白，迫使他们离开的并不是热浪。唔，这帮家伙不愿意承认罢了，他们是因为惧怕黑钉才撤离的。\n\n探险队曾驻扎在此地以西德莱尼双塔的南面，就在蛮沼村以北。那儿分布着巨大的胡蜂群，他们常常受到无情的攻击！我迫不及待地想知道，当我将黑钉之刺带回铁炉堡时，他们的脸上会有什么样的表情！",dEN="By Khaz'goroth's flaming navel, it's hot here! I can't blame the first party for leaving, but everyone knows 'twasn't the heat that drove them away. No, it was Blacksting, although they won't admit it.\n\nThey were camped just to the south of the glowing draenei towers to the west, just north of the Feralfen Village, when the giant wasp appears out of nowhere and attacks! I can't wait to see the looks on their faces when I bring the creature's stinger back to Ironforge and show it to them!",o="将黑钉之刺交给泰雷多尔的勘探员柯纳尔。",oEN="Bring Blacksting's Stinger to Prospector Conall at Telredor.",p="你弄到黑钉之刺了吗？记住，如果它有损坏那就没用了。",pEN="Did you manage to get the stinger? Remember, it's useless to me if it's damaged.",c="你想象不到我有多感激你，小子。我要好好享受这一刻……",cEN="I can't thank you enough, <lad/lass>. I'm going to enjoy this..."}
Q[9897]={d="我是很乐意与他人分享的。你从甘克雷手中救了我的命，我真是太高兴了！我从赞加沼泽收集了大量皮革，分一点给别人完全不成问题！",dEN="I don't mind sharing. I'm just glad to be saved from that creep, Gankly! And I collected tons of skins from Zangarmarsh, so it's no problem at all!",o="将一捆皮革交给纳格兰奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地的哈罗德·兰恩。",oEN="Give the Bundle of Skins to Harold Lane at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",p="克里斯滕真是个非常……<咳嗽>……大方的人，愿意分享她的毛皮，你不觉得吗？<tose>",pEN="Kristen is a very nice...... person to share her skins, wouldn't you agree?",c="嗯，我看不出你究竟对拯救克莉斯坦有没有帮助。但如果她给你一捆皮革那么你就没事了。\n\n这是你的奖励。",cEN="Well, I couldn't see if you helped out with saving Kristen, or not. But if she handed you one of her bundles of skins then you're alright in my book.Here's your reward."}
Q[9898]={d="她将属于我。没错，她一定会是我的。\n\n玛加沙难道不是你所见过的最美丽的巨魔吗？我必须想办法赢得她的心。当然，现在她的眼里只有祖莱，不过我要改变这一切。我已经想好了一个简单有效的办法。\n\n我要向她证明，我是位优秀的猎手。朋友，这就是我要交代你的事情。西边的德莱尼双塔以南有一只名叫黑钉的巨蜂。将黑钉之刺带回来给我，我就可以施展我的魅力了。",dEN="She will be mine. Oh yes - she will be mine.\n\nIsn't Magasha the most beautiful troll you've ever seen? I have to find a way to win her heart. Sure, she has her eye on Zurai, but that is about to change. My foolproof plan will see to that.\n\nAll I need is a way to demonstrate my superior hunting skills, and that's where you come in my friend. There's a gigantic bog wasp known as Blacksting that roams the area south of the glowing draenei towers to the west. Bring me its stinger and I'll work my magic.",o="将黑钉之刺交给沼泽鼠岗哨的里维伊。",oEN="Bring Blacksting's Stinger to Reavij at Swamprat Post.",p="我的运气就要改变了——我有预感。",pEN="My luck is about to change - I can feel it.",c="太棒了！我永远不会忘记你是怎么帮我赢得她的芳心的。事实上，你可以成为我们婚礼上的$g贵宾:贵宾;。",cEN="Fantastic! I'll never forget how you helped me to win her heart. In fact, you can be a guest of honor at our wedding."}
Q[9899]={d="想办法让里维伊清醒过来吧！他完全忘记了自己的职责，整天就想着怎么讨我欢心。我试着不去理睬他，也劝说过他好几次，可根本无济于事。\n\n我不得不替他收拾这堆烂摊子。他原本奉命杀掉孢子之翼，但我打赌这只蝙蝠还活得好好的。如果你有时间的话，能不能去死亡泥潭西部杀死孢子之翼？我要利用这段时间，让里维伊清醒过来。",dEN="Someone needs to find a way to make Reavij come to his senses! He's ignoring his duty and instead, he's devoting all his energy to getting my attention. I've tried ignoring him and telling him to stop. Nothing seems to work.\n\nUntil he gets over this, I'm left cleaning up after him. He was supposed to have dealt with Sporewing, but I'll bet the monster is alive and well. If you have time, would you mind going to the western part of the Dead Mire and killing the bat? I'll deal with Reavij in the meantime.",o="沼泽鼠岗哨的玛加沙要你杀死孢子之翼。",oEN="Magasha at Swamprat Post wants you to kill Sporewing.",p="我发誓他的想法一点都没改变。我想我要请暗影猎手德恩加把我传送回萨布拉金。",pEN="There's no changing his mind, I swear. I think I'm going to have to ask Shadow Hunter Denjai for a transfer back to Zabra'jin.",c="至少这儿还有人肯出份力。谢谢你处理了那件事，$n。我得跟祖莱谈谈里维伊的事。他的那些小算盘和整天做白日梦，我们已经受够了。",cEN="At least someone is pulling <his/her> weight around here. Thank you for taking care of that matter, <name>. I need to have a word with Zurai about Reavij. His scheming and daydreaming have gone on long enough."}
Q[9900]={d="杰赫看待问题总是会往好的方面想，他认为我们大可利用在沃舒古活动的虚灵盗贼获取水晶碎片，可是这帮虚灵严重威胁着埃瑞斯码头的安全。\n\n他们的首领加瓦克希更是名极度危险的罪犯。而我的首要职责就是消灭这类隐患。\n\n如果你想要证明自己的实力，就去做掉加瓦克希吧。我保证会好好奖励你的。",dEN="The presence of rogue ethereals in this area might amuse Gezhe, who sees nothing but opportunity wherever we go, but it's a true threat to the security of our operations.\n\nTheir leader, Gava'xi, is a dangerous criminal and I've made it my top priority to see to it that he is neutralized.\n\nIf you're looking to make yourself useful, go and take care of Gava'xi. I will see to it that you're rewarded properly.",o="杀死沃舒古附近的加瓦克希，然后向纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的瑟利德复命。",oEN="Slay Gava'xi near Oshu'gun and return to Zerid at Aeris Landing in Nagrand.",p="你回来了，$r。加瓦克希死了吗？",pEN="You've returned, <race>. Is Gava'xi dead?",c="多亏了你，我们不用再担心加瓦克希了。现在让我们来看一下你的奖励。",cEN="We won't have to worry about Gava'xi anymore, thanks to you. Let us arrange for your reward now."}
Q[9901]={d="探险者协会派出的第一支远征队发回报告，称他们被一只名叫孢子之翼的巨型蝙蝠袭击。他们在沼泽地中并未停留太久便匆忙离开了，因此没有机会杀死它，我打算帮他们解决这个问题。\n\n远征队在报告中提到这只蝙蝠在死亡泥潭的西南方活动。我听守备官伊达尔说，死亡泥潭就在泰雷多尔的东北方。",dEN="The first expedition the league sent reported encountering a gigantic spore bat they'd taken to calling Sporewing. They had to leave in a hurry, so they didn't have the chance to kill him while they were here, so I figured I'd finish the job for them.\n\nWhat's left of their report suggests that the creature can be found in the southwestern parts of the Dead Mire. I think Vindicator Idaar mentioned that it's to the northeast of Telredor.",o="泰雷多尔的勘探员柯纳尔要求你干掉孢子之翼。",oEN="Prospector Conall at Telredor wants you to kill Sporewing.",p="你找到斯柏温了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to track down Sporewing?",c="做得好，$n。我想我们已让整个勘察小组相形失色了。等我回到铁炉堡，我相信我会得到我想要的任务。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I think you and I have managed to outshine a whole team of prospectors. When I get back to Ironforge, I'm sure I'll get my choice of assignments."}
Q[9902]={d="在穿越纳迦聚集地的旅途中，我才了解到残忍的纳迦是如何对待那些倒霉的同胞的。在西南方的沼光湖，我亲眼目睹了一名极度邪恶的工头玩起致命的游戏。每当那只名叫恐爪的龙虾人要进食时，他便强行将奴隶们赶到沼光湖的小岛上。\n\n我没有必要继续描述接下来发生的事情了。我们势单力薄，不能直接向纳迦发动攻击；但是我们可以杀死这只宠物，阻止这种残忍的取乐方式。",dEN="Traveling through naga-infested lands has shown me the cruel truth about how my less fortunate brethren are treated. At Marshlight Lake, to the southwest, I observed a particularly malicious taskmaster playing a deadly game. He orders his slaves out to the islands in Marshlight Lake when he knows that Terrorclaw, a giant bogstrok, is ready to feed.\n\nI needn't describe what results. We are too few to take on the naga directly, but we can deprive them of their amusement by killing their pet.",o="杀死恐爪，然后向奥雷柏尔营地的普尔鲁复命。",oEN="Slay Terrorclaw and return to Puluu at the Orebor Harborage.",p="我很惭愧我不能为我被奴役的同胞多做些什么，但至少我们阻止了更多不必要的死亡。",pEN="I am ashamed that I cannot do more to help my enslaved brethren. but at least we have prevented more needless deaths.",c="谢谢你，$n。或许有了德莱尼的帮助，这个沼泽有一天会脱离纳迦的魔掌。我无法想象被迫服侍他们会是什么样子。\n\n普尔鲁不常谈到，但他曾是一个奴隶。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Perhaps with the help of the draenei, this marsh will one day be free of naga. I can't imagine what it must be like to be forced to serve them.\n\nHe doesn't talk about it often, but Maktu was once a slave."}
Q[9903]={d="你杀死了很多小多头蛇，但是我怀疑穆拉格什对此毫不在意。这头狡猾凶残的巨兽令许多垂钓者吃足了苦头。\n\n看来我们要给它带来的麻烦划上句号了。穆拉格什就躲藏在东北方毒蛇湖的深处，它早已风光不在，可惜它自己还没有意识到这一点。",dEN="You've dealt with most of the little hydra, but I doubt Mragesh was impressed by your display. He's a cunning, ferocious beast and he's dogged many an angler in his time.\n\nI intend to be the last one he'll ever bother. He's bound to be hiding deep in the waters of Serpent Lake, to the northeast. He's a has-been; he just doesn't know it yet.",o="杀死穆拉格什，然后向萨布拉金的苏尔加亚复命。",oEN="Slay Mragesh and return to Zurjaya in Zabra'jin.",p="你把老穆拉格什\"解决\"掉了吗？",pEN="Have you \"retired\" old Mragesh?",c="我想那个老家伙一定知道他来日不多了。有这些新人来，老规矩站不住脚了。他的灵魂现在安息也好。",cEN="I'm sure the old boy must've seen his days coming to an end. With all these new arrivals, the old order couldn't stand. It's just as well his spirit is at rest now."}
Q[9904]={d="我在沼泽地中钓到过各种各样的鱼，不过有件事却始终让我耿耿于怀。你看，我连电鳗和泥鳞狂鱼都钓上来过，但是上次我在沼光湖的小岛上钓鱼时，眼看一个巨型泥沼龙虾人上了钩，却被它咬断鱼线逃走了。\n\n这家伙名叫恐爪，在它死掉之前我都不会安心的。恐爪身型庞大，普通的渔夫是不可能捉到它的，因此我们只能采用古老的办法，那就是直接杀死它。",dEN="I've caught every kind of fish that lives in the marsh, but there's one that eludes me. Sure, I've caught eels and mudfin frenzies. But the last time I was out on one of the islands in Marshlight Lake, I hooked a gigantic bogstrok that snapped my line and got away.\n\nTerrorclaw, he's called, and I won't rest until he's dead. He's too big for any fisherman to catch, so I suppose we'll just have to kill him the old-fashioned way.",o="杀死恐爪，然后向萨布拉金的苏尔加亚复命。",oEN="Kill Terrorclaw and return to Zurjaya at Zabra'jin.",p="我想恐惧之爪应该死了吧？",pEN="I take it Terrorclaw lives no more?",c="终于！人们说每个伟大的渔夫都有一段关于\"跑掉的那条鱼\"的故事，可我还没遇到过哪个生物能从我手里逃掉……不管用什么办法。",cEN="At last! They say every great fisherman has a story of \"the one that got away,\" but I haven't yet met a creature I couldn't beat one way or another."}
Q[9905]={d="上次玛克图在毒蛇湖收集多头蛇鳞片时，遭到一头前所未见的巨型多头蛇的袭击。玛克图伸手去取他的长矛，但是已经来不及了。他侥幸蛇口逃生。\n\n谁知道呢？说不定下次就没这么幸运了。玛克图不希望有下次。你愿意帮玛克图报仇，杀死穆拉格什吗？",dEN="Last time Maktu was out hunting hydras for hides at Serpent Lake, he was attacked by the biggest hydra he's ever seen. Maktu reached for his spear, but it was too late. He had just enough time to escape becoming hydra food.\n\nWho knows? Maybe next time, Maktu not be so lucky. Maktu wants to be there so there won't be a next time. Will you help Maktu get his revenge on Mragesh?",o="找到穆拉格什并杀死他，然后返回奥雷柏尔营地向玛克图复命。",oEN="Locate and kill Mragesh, then return to Maktu at the Orebor Harborage.",p="要是很久以前，普尔鲁可能会拿莫拉吉斯的皮来做强健的护甲。莫拉吉斯现在已经太老了。皮革太软不适合做好的护甲。",pEN="Long time ago, Maktu might have used Mragesh's hide to make strong armor. Mragesh far too old for that now. Hide too soft for good armor.",c="<普尔鲁认可地点点头。>\n\n普尔鲁感谢你的帮忙。普尔鲁终于可以放下心来。他不会再突如其来的被攻击了。",cEN="<Maktu nods approvingly.>\n\nMaktu is thankful for your help. Maktu's pride is satisfied. He will not be caught off guard again."}
Q[9906]={d="食人魔只会屈从于力量。一旦我们显露出内心的软弱，他们就会利用这一点彻底击溃我们。\n\n加尔鲁什大概已经放弃了抵抗，任由那些强盗侵犯我们的家园，但是我绝不会束手就擒！$n，我要你给石拳食人魔捎个信，用他们看得懂的语言：暴力。\n\n转至此地东南方的火刃废墟，让他们尝尝玛格汉氏族的厉害。\n\n$n，对了，在你离开之前不妨问问其它人，看他们是否愿意帮助你，与你同去。",dEN="Ogres are moved by one thing: Might. If we expose ourselves to them as being weak, they will take advantage of that weakness and wipe us out.\n\nGarrosh might be ready to lie down and let the ogre dogs take our lands but I am not! I need you to deliver a message to the Boulderfist, <name>. The only type of message that they are capable of understanding: Brutality.\n\nTravel to the Burning Blade Ruins, southeast of here and show them the might of the Mag'har.\n\nAnd <name>, check in with the others before leaving.",o="纳格兰加拉达尔的约林·死眼要你杀死8个石拳打击者和8个石拳秘术师。",oEN="Jorin Deadeye at Garadar in Nagrand has asked that you slay 8 Boulderfist Crushers and 8 Boulderfist Mystics.",p="这些该死的食人魔必须得到惩罚！",pEN="I'm sending out a small organized search party for the rest of the villagers.",c="我们的任务尚未完成。食人魔还需要得到更多的教训！",cEN="Our task is not yet finished. There are more that must be taught a lesson!"}
Q[9907]={d="此地的正西边就是哈兰盆地。石拳食人魔的突击部队就驻扎在盆地的北风裂谷和南风裂谷中。\n\n我要你以玛格汉氏族的名义，杀死你遇见的所有石拳食人魔。",dEN="Directly west of here you will find the Halaani Basin. Within the basin are the twin clefts of Nagrand: Northwind and Southwind. Boulderfist shock troops use the clefts to hide their ogre mounds.\n\nI need you to track down those troops and kill all that you encounter in the name of Mag'har.",o="纳格兰加拉达尔的约林·死眼要你杀死10个石拳战士和10个石拳法师。",oEN="Jorin Deadeye at Garadar in Nagrand has asked that you slay 10 Boulderfist Warriors and 10 Boulderfist Mages.",p="一定要提醒他们在这里谁说了算。",pEN="They must be reminded that we are a force to be reckoned with in this region.",c="如果这样依然无法让他们就此罢休，那就没有别的办法了。你践行了玛格汉的正义，$n。对于正义，玛格汉会给予大大的奖励。",cEN="If this does not freeze the blood in their veins, nothing will. You have done the Mag'har justice, <name>. And for justice, Mag'har rewards greatly."}
Q[9910]={d="如果你正要转至火刃废墟的话，我恰好有项任务要拜托你。带上这些玛格汉军旗，将它们插在火刃食人魔营地三处最显眼的地方。我建议你挑选那些引人注目的区域，比如那些营地上层熊熊燃烧的篝火堆。总之，将玛格汉军旗分别插在第一堆火刃篝火、第二堆火刃篝火和第三堆火刃篝火附近。\n\n让这些军旗可以时刻提醒那些侥幸捞到一条命的食人魔，我们玛格汉兽人不是好惹的！",dEN="If you're venturing into the Burning Blade Ruins, I have a task for you. Take these Mag'har battle standards and place them at three distinct locations in the ogre compound. An area of high visibility is recommended. Look for the gigantic flaming pyres on the upper levels. Place a standard near the first, second, and third Burning Blade pyres.\n\nThe standard will leave a lasting impression upon any ogres who may have missed the battle.",o="纳格兰加拉达尔的秘法师埃尔卡甘要你将玛格汉军旗分别插在第一堆火刃篝火、第二堆火刃篝火和第三堆火刃篝火附近。完成任务后将剩馀的玛格汉军旗还给他。",oEN="Elkay'gan the Mystic at Garadar in Nagrand wants you to use the Mag'har Battle Standard at the First Burning Blade Pyre, Second Burning Blade Pyre, and Third Burning Blade Pyre. Return the left-over Mag'har Battle Standards to him when you are finished.",p="因恐惧而敬畏你的敌人！这方法非常好。",pEN="Respect from fear! It is as good as any other kind.",c="你还想进行另一个任务？一个更棘手的任务？",cEN="Perhaps you would like another task? A more delicate matter, eh?"}
Q[9911]={d="这块带血的下颚骨是虚空鳐的骨头，这只体型庞大的虚空鳐一定是赞加沼泽中最大的生物。从下颚骨的构造来看，“伯爵”放弃了食用腐肉的传统，改吃新鲜的肉类。\n\n想必塞纳里奥远征队会对这件样本感兴趣的。去泥泞山西边的营地找观察者莉萨奥谈谈吧。",dEN="This bloody mandible comes from an unbelievably large creature. The nether ray that it belonged to has to be the largest ever seen in Zangarmarsh. Judging from the condition of the mandible, the count must've abandoned a diet of carrion in favor of living flesh.\n\nSurely the Cenarion Expedition would be interested in such a specimen. Watcher Leesa'oh has a small camp to the west of Quagg Ridge.",o="把\"伯爵\"安古拉的下颚骨带给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥哨站的观察者莉萨奥。",oEN="Bring \"Count\" Ungula's Mandible to Watcher Leesa'oh at the Cenarion Outpost in Zangarmarsh.",p="<看守者惊讶的眨了几次眼。>\n\n你从哪里弄到这个……东西？",pEN="<The watcher blinks several times in surprise.>\n\nWhere did you get that... thing?",c="你确定那是真的？我是说，我知道这片沼泽里有很多大型野生动物，可有巨型生物，也有巨——型——虫子。\n\n话说回来，孢子人确实讲过一个故事，说在沼泽领主入侵之前，曾有一头可怕的虚空鳐让他们闻风丧胆。\n\n万一那些故事是真的呢？天哪，远征队会想知道这件事的。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Are you sure that's real? I mean, I knew there was large wildlife in the marsh, but there are giant creatures and then there are GIANT bugs.\n\nCome to think of it, the sporelings did mention a story about a fearsome nether ray that used to terrorize them before the boglord incursion.\n\nWhat if the stories are true? Oh, dear. I'd better take that for safekeeping. The expedition will want to know about this."}
Q[9912]={d="塞纳里奥议会派驻外域的主要远征军组织被称为塞纳里奥远征队。尽管它最早是由塞纳里奥议会直接领导的探险队，但现在已经发展成了一支人数众多、完全独立的军队。\n\n远征队的首领伊谢尔·风歌希望我们能派些自愿者去她的哨站。转至赞加沼泽东部的塞纳里奥庇护所向她报告。沿着西边的大道一直往前走就到了。",dEN="The Cenarion Circle's main expeditionary force in Outland is known as the Cenarion Expedition. Though it began as a small venture controlled directly by the Cenarion Circle, it's become a large and fairly autonomous body.\n\nThe expedition's leader, Ysiel Windsinger, has asked us to direct volunteers to her outpost. Report to her at the Cenarion Refuge in eastern Zangarmarsh. Take the main path to the west and it will lead you directly there.",o="转至赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，与伊谢尔·风歌谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ysiel Windsinger at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",c="欢迎来到塞纳里奥庇护所，$n。我希望你是来协助我们的任务。我们有很多工作要做。",cEN="Welcome to Cenarion Refuge, <name>. I hope you've come to aid us in our mission. We've much work ahead of us."}
Q[9913]={d="星界财团正在寻找像你这样足智多谋的勇士。我们是最诚实、最勤勉、最容易相处的虚灵。\n\n星界财团对你的要求只有忠诚、奉献和一点道德上的灵活性而已。如果你对此感兴趣的话，就去我们的首领杰赫谈谈。他就在沃舒古北面的埃瑞斯码头。",dEN="My organization, the Consortium, is looking for a few resourceful individuals just like yourself. You'll be hard pressed to find ethereals more honest, hard-working or pleasant to be around than us.\n\nAll we require is loyalty, dedication and a reasonable amount of moral flexibility. If you're interested, speak to Gezhe, our ground operations leader. You will find him at Aeris Landing, north of Oshu'gun.",o="向纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的杰赫报到。",oEN="Report to Gezhe at Aeris Landing in Nagrand.",c="你$g准备好:准备好;开工了吗，$r？我想我这儿有份再适合你不过的任务。",cEN="Are you ready to get to work, <race>? I think I've got the perfect task for you."}
Q[9914]={d="象牙，那可是供不应求的紧俏货。许多顾客都不顾路途遥远赶来排队抢购。\n\n我可以考虑让你入伙，分你一笔利润。\n\n纳格兰野生雷象的象牙成色极佳，属于最受欢迎的品种。不过，好斗的雷象例外，它们的象牙破碎太多，品质过于低劣。\n\n别担心，这不属于偷猎；我与兽人和德莱尼都达成了协议。\n\n怎么样，你入伙吗？",dEN="Ivory is a much sought after prize. I have many customers lined up in far off places to purchase it.\n\nI could be convinced to let you in on a cut of the profits.\n\nThe wild elekk roaming Nagrand have the high quality of tusks that I'm after. Steer clear of the bull elekk; their ivory isn't in the condition that I desire.\n\nOh and don't worry, it's not poaching; I have an understanding with both the orcs and the draenei.\n\nDo you and I have an understanding?",o="将3对象牙交给纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的沙德雷克。",oEN="Collect 3 Pair of Ivory Tusks and return them to Shadrek at Aeris Landing in Nagrand.",p="我只要象牙。当然如果你有别的理由，我们可以重新协商你的利润。不过结果的话……。",pEN="It's ivory that I'm after, not excuses. Of course, if you'd rather, we can renegotiate your percentage of the profits. I doubt that you'd be pleased with the result.",c="我一刻也没怀疑过你，$g朋友:朋友;。大多数都是上等货色，虽然有点脏、有些划痕……不过我觉得它们值我们先前议定的价钱。\n\n希望我们今后还能继续做生意。",cEN="Never doubted you for a second, friend. Most of those look like fine specimens, if a bit dirty and scratched up. Still, I think they're worth the value we agreed upon previously.\n\nI hope that we can continue to do business in the future."}
Q[9915]={p="我还需要更多对野生雷象的象牙。不幸的是，我的经费短缺无法支付你的利润。不过，如果你持续提供我需要的东西，你就会得到星界财团的欢心。",pEN="I still have a need for more pairs of ivory tusks from the wild elekk that roam this land. Unfortunately, my budget will no longer handle your cut of the profits. If you continue to provide me what I need, however, you will be ingratiating yourself with the Consortium.",c="上等的象牙样本，品质更佳，虽然有些看着有点脏。星界财团感激你，$n。",cEN="Excellent, more fine tusk specimens, though some look a bit dingy.You have the far-reaching gratitude of the Consortium, <name>."}
Q[9916]={d="石拳食人魔洗劫了我们的村落，将偷来的补给箱运去了西边哈兰盆地的北风裂谷和南风裂谷。\n\n如果你要去那边的话，就替我留意一下这些血环补给箱吧。如果我们能拿回这些补给箱，或许能帮加拉达尔减轻一点负担。",dEN="The Boulderfist have moved the supplies they stole from our village to the twin clefts of Nagrand, found west of here in the Halaani Basin.\n\nWhile you are in the area, keep your eye out for the supply crates. If we can get those back, it would ease much of the burden that has fallen upon the matrons of Garadar.",o="纳格兰加拉达尔的秘法师埃尔卡甘要你找回10个血环补给箱。",oEN="Elkay'gan the Mystic at Garadar in Nagrand wants you to recover 10 Bleeding Hollow Supply Crates.",p="或许有一天孩子们不用再承受饥饿的痛苦。",pEN="The children might be able to go a day without feeling hunger pangs.",c="我们大部分的财产都在攻击中被偷或被毁了。作为奖励这里有一些可能对你有用的东西……",cEN="Most of our possessions were destroyed or stolen in the attacks. I cannot offer you much, but there are some items that you may find useful..."}
Q[9917]={d="是我眼花了，还是那边有一队食人魔狩猎队？食人魔跑到离他们的土丘这么远的地方来做什么？我一点也不喜欢这样，$g陌生人:陌生人;。先是暗血氏族，现在又是食人魔。我们根本没有足够的人手应对所有威胁我们土地的敌人。\n\n你能去东边调查一下食人魔的动向吗？他们的前哨就在此地以东约两百步。要是看到石拳猎人，就说明你到对地方了。杀了他们，找出他们的计划！",dEN="Do my eyes deceive me or is there an ogre hunting party over yonder? What could ogres be doing this far from their mound? I don't like this one bit, stranger. First Murkbloods and now ogres. We just don't have the manpower to handle all of these threats to our land.\n\nCould you investigate the ogre presence to the east for us? Their forward camp is about 200 paces east of here. You'll know you're at the right place if you see the Boulderfist hunters. Kill them to find the plans!",o="找回石拳计划书，然后向纳格兰塔拉的女猎手彬图克复命。",oEN="Huntress Bintook at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to recover Boulderfist Plans.",p="你有发现任何消息吗？",pEN="Have you found any new information?",c="<宾图克读着那些计划。>\n\n以圣光之名！他们的字迹简直糟透了。就我能看懂的来说，他们要么计划\"吃掉蓝皮人并占领他们的村庄\"，要么就是想在村里烤个蓝莓派。还真说不准是哪种。我们必须查个水落石出！",cEN="<Bintook reads the plans.>BY THE LIGHT! Their penmanship is atrocious. From what I can gather, they're either planning to \"eat the blue skins and take their village\" or bake a blueberry pie. It really could go either way. We must get to the bottom of this!"}
Q[9918]={d="作战计划书出自某个食人魔中尉之手。他应该是叫达普，或者是拉普吧。\n\n<彬图克将羊皮纸放在一旁，仰起头来想了想。>\n\n也有可能是比利。\n\n我想你得再跑一趟，跟这位比利或者拉普或者达普……管他叫什么！跟这家伙谈谈。小心翼翼地靠近他，若是谈话行不通，那就拳脚伺候。",dEN="The battle plans were written up by an ogre lieutenant. His name is either Dump or Lump.\n\n<Bintook turns the parchment sideways and cocks her head.>\n\nIt could also be Billy.\n\nAnyhow, I think you should go back out there and have a word with Billy or Lump or Dumpy or whatever! Try to approach him diplomatically. If that doesn't work, try using some muscle.",o="与拉普交谈，获取足够的情报后向纳格兰塔拉的女猎手彬图克复命。",oEN="Huntress Bintook at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to speak to Lump. Return to Huntress Bintook when you have gathered the information that she requested.",p="他可能在山脊上睡觉。",pEN="He'll probably be asleep on a ridge.",c="喔天啊！这只是小型侦察和猎捕集会吗？你一定要告诉姆摩尔你的发现。",cEN="Oh my! This is a small scouting and hunting party? You must tell Mo'mor what you have discovered."}
Q[9919]={d="你是个善良的$r，$n。不像我见过的某些人。\n\n你该去见见我其余的族人，他们会非常感激你的帮助。把这些孢子囊带给我的首领姆希芬。你会在北边的孢子村找到他。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You're a kind <race>, <name>. Not like some of the others I've met.\n\nYou should meet the rest of my people; they'll be very grateful for your help. Take these spore sacs to my leader, Msshi'fn. You will find him in Sporeggar, north of here.",o="去赞加沼泽孢殖林北边的孢子村，将抢救出来的孢子囊交给姆希菲。",oEN="Go to Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh, north of the Spawning Glen, and deliver the Salvaged Spore Sacs to Msshi'fn.",p="你有东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You've something to show me, <name>?",c="你帮忙保护了下一代的孢子人，$r。我们只能以欢迎你来作客做为答谢。留下来一会儿，见见其它的孢子人。他们会有很多问题问你，我希望你不介意。",cEN="You've helped protect the next generation of sporelings, <race>. We can only repay you by welcoming you into our homes. Stay for a bit and meet the other sporelings. They will have many questions, I hope you don't mind."}
Q[9920]={d="你必须立即找到姆摩尔！他应该就在塔拉中央的喷泉旁边。将食人魔的原话一字不漏地告诉他！",dEN="You must seek out Mo'mor immediately! You will find him in the center of Telaar, by the fountain. Tell him exactly what the ogre told you.",o="纳格兰塔拉的女猎手彬图克要你去找击碎者姆摩尔谈一谈。",oEN="Huntress Bintook at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to speak to Mo'mor the Breaker.",c="<姆摩尔看起来很困惑。>\n\n所以，有一支新的食人魔部族正将石拳越来越往南推进。这真是相当麻烦。我们一定要先解决这个离家最近的情况……",cEN="So, a new tribe of ogres is forcing the Boulderfist further and further south. This is quite troubling. We must first deal with the situation closest to home..."}
Q[9921]={d="这些食人魔狩猎队分明是入侵者的先遣部队。我们必须在这帮家伙纠集大军夷平城镇之前歼灭他们。\n\n你的双手将不可避免地沾满鲜血，$r。\n\n食人魔的主营地设在塔拉正东方，泰罗卡森林边界处的火刃废墟处。要让石拳氏族知道，塔拉绝不会屈服！",dEN="These ogre hunting parties are a precursor to invasion. We must strike at them before they have a chance to amass an army big enough to take over our town.\n\nYou're going to need to get your hands dirty, <race>.\n\nThe largest collection of Boulderfist in this region can be found at the Burning Blade Ruins, almost directly east of Telaar, near the border of Terokkar. Go there and show the Boulderfist that Telaar will not bend to their will!",o="杀死8个石拳打击者和8个石拳秘术师，然后向纳格兰塔拉的击碎者姆摩尔复命。",oEN="Mo'mor the Breaker at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to kill 8 Boulderfist Crushers and 8 Boulderfist Mystics.",p="我们最近才刚把泰拉抢回来。我们不会再失去它！",pEN="We have only recently taken back Telaar. We will not lose it again!",c="太好了。你刚好找到那个笨蛋信上提的生物吗？\n\n不管怎样，我们一定要继续努力。我收到报告指出有更多的食人魔活动需要立刻解决！",cEN="Excellent. Did you happen to locate this Lantresor creature that the stupid one's letter mentioned?\n\nRegardless, we must press on. I have gotten reports of more ogre activity that must be dealt with at once!"}
Q[9922]={d="$n，干得漂亮。准备好接受新任务了吗？\n\n报告称石拳食人魔的另一支分遣队躲藏在纳格兰西北部哈兰盆地中的两个大裂谷里。\n\n去对付那些剩下的石拳食人魔吧。",dEN="You made a strong showing, <name>. Are you ready for more?\n\nI have received reports of a large contingent of Boulderfist ogres hidden in the twin clefts of Nagrand, northwest of here in the Halaani Basin.\n\nVenture forth to the clefts and deal with the remaining Boulderfist ogres.",o="杀死10个石拳战士和10个石拳法师，然后向纳格兰塔拉的击碎者姆摩尔复命。",oEN="Mo'mor the Breaker at Telaar in Nagrand has asked that you slay 10 Boulderfist Warriors and 10 Boulderfist Mages.",p="小心盆地里的元素，$n。",pEN="Beware the elementals in the basin, <name>.",c="做得好！我当前在研究石拳氏族提到的战槌氏族。现在你已完成的任务必须被奖励。",cEN="Excellent work! I am currently researching the Warmaul tribe that the Boulderfist lieutenant mentioned. Now the tasks you have performed must be tested."}
Q[9923]={d="救命！他们要吃掉我！我就知道！\n\n找到钥匙，我知道它一定在某个食人魔身上。\n\n你要是能把我弄出去，我父亲会重重酬谢你！他是塔拉的首领，阿雷克隆。|n",dEN="HELP! They're gonna eat me! I just know it!\n\nFind the key, I know it has to be on one of these ogres.\n\nIf you get me out of here, my father will reward you handsomely! He's the leader of Telaar, Arechron.",o="找到石拳钥匙并释放科尔基。若你成功，就去塔拉与阿雷克隆谈谈。|n",oEN="Find the Boulderfist Key and Free Corki. Speak with Arechron in Telaar should you succeed.",p="那个孩子……\n\n<阿雷克隆不开心的摇摇头。>\n\n他会把我给气死。",pEN="That boy...\n\n<Arechron shakes his head in disapproval.>\n\nHe'll be the death of me.",c="我真的很抱歉，$r。他总是搞一堆麻烦。我真想用皮带把他拴住……",cEN="I'm really sorry about this, <race>. He's always getting himself into trouble. I just wish I could put a leash on him..."}
Q[9924]={d="<阿雷克隆叹了口气。>\n\n这真是太丢人了。你还记得我儿子科尔基吗？你不久前刚把他从燃烧之刃废墟救出来。唉，他的好奇心又把自己坑了。他跟我说要去替叔叔莫莫尔调查石拳食人魔的威胁，然后就跑去了北边哈拉尼盆地的食人魔土丘。\n\n你觉得你能找到他吗？我会永远感激你。|n<Arechron suspira.>",dEN="<Arechron sighs.>\n\nThis is so embarrassing. Do you remember my boy, Corki? You rescued him from the Burning Blade Ruins recently. Well, his curiosity has gotten the best of him once more. He told me that he was going to investigate the Boulderfist menace for 'uncle' Mo'mor and ran off to the ogre mounds in the Halaani Basin, north of here.\n\nDo you think you could track him down? I would be eternally grateful.",o="塔拉的阿雷克隆要你去搭救考尔奇。",oEN="Arechron at Telaar has asked that you find and free Corki.",p="你找到他了吗？",pEN="Did you find him?",c="非常感谢你，$n。他妈妈今后会看好他。",cEN="Thank you so much, <name>. His mother will deal with him from now on."}
Q[9925]={d="杰赫不顾我们的安危，将星界财团的营地设立在靠近沃舒古的地方。他为何这么做？就因为这家伙认为在码头做买卖比在南边的山脉能多获得十个百分点的收入。\n\n至于那些距我们只有十步之遥的空灵爪牙，那就是我这个安全官员的事儿了，完全与杰赫无关。\n\n替我杀掉一些空灵爪牙，我就付你星界财团本地安全预算的十个百分点。别激动，这笔预算的金额没你想象的那么多。",dEN="Gezhe chose to base our operations as close to Oshu'gun as possible, without any regard for the safety of our crew. Why? Because he projected a ten percent increase in productivity by setting up shop here instead of in the mountains to the south.\n\nNever mind the crazed voidspawn wandering all of ten feet away from us. That would be the security officer's problem, not Gezhe's.\n\nKill some voidspawn for me and I'll pay you a tenth of our security budget. Don't get excited, it's not much of a budget.",o="纳格兰埃瑞斯码头的瑟利德要求你杀死沃舒古附近的8个空灵爪牙。",oEN="Zerid at Aeris Landing in Nagrand wants you to kill 8 Voidspawn near Oshu'gun.",p="你解决掉那些空灵爪牙了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you take care of the voidspawn, <name>?",c="你让我的脸上露出一丝笑容，$n。或者应该说，假如我有脸的话。\n\n继续努力，我们就会成为最好的朋友。",cEN="You bring a smile to my face, <name>. Or you would, rather, if I had a face.\n\nKeep it up and you and I are going to be the best of friends."}
Q[9927]={d="<兰特瑞索递给你一捆旗帜。>\n\n这些是我最近收集到的一批战槌食人魔军旗。\n\n我要你转至正南方的基尔索罗要塞，尽你所能地杀死那里的基尔索罗成员。每杀死一名基尔索罗士兵，就在尸体上插一面战槌食人魔军旗。完成这项任务以及计划所需的另一项任务之后，回来向我复命。",dEN="<Lantresor hands you a pack full of banners.>\n\nThese are Warmaul ogre banners that I recently acquired.\n\nI want you to travel to Kil'sorrow Fortress, directly south of here, and kill as many of the Kil'sorrow filth as you can find. Drive a Warmaul ogre banner through the heart of each fallen Kil'sorrow soldier. Return to me when you have completed this task and the other that this plan requires.",o="转至基尔索罗堡垒，将10面战槌食人魔军旗插在基尔索罗成员的尸体上，然后返回纳格兰火刃废墟向兰特瑞索·火刃复命。\n\n将没有用完的战槌食人魔军旗还给兰特瑞索。",oEN="Lantresor of the Blade at the Burning Blade Ruins in Nagrand wants you to drive 10 Warmaul Ogre Banners through the bodies of Kil'sorrow members at Kil'sorrow Fortress.\n\nReturn any unused Warmaul Ogre Banners.",p="<兰特瑞索困惑地张开眼睛。>\n\n完成了吗？",pEN="<Lantresor's eyes open in bewilderment.>Is it done?",c="你能想象他们对发生的事有多困惑吗，$r？。",cEN="Can you imagine their puzzlement over what is happening, <race>? This will be glorious."}
Q[9928]={d="要实现我的计划，你就得从基尔索罗堡垒偷些军备过来。\n\n在堡垒中搜寻装有基尔索罗军备的箱子，然后把这些箱子统统带回来给我就可以了。\n\n基尔索罗堡垒就在火刃废墟正南偏西一点的位置。",dEN="You will need to steal Kil'sorrow armaments from Kil'sorrow Fortress if my plan is to work.\n\nSearch the fortress for crates of Kil'sorrow armaments. Bring whatever you can find to me.\n\nKil'sorrow Fortress is located directly south and a little to the west of the Burning Blade Ruins.",o="纳格兰火刃废墟的兰特瑞索·火刃要你收集10份基尔索罗军备。",oEN="Lantresor of the Blade at the Burning Blade Ruins in Nagrand wants you to collect 10 Kil'sorrow Armaments.",p="我们会点燃两个氏族间至今都未见的仇恨！",pEN="We will ignite a hatred heretofore unseen between the two clans!",c="太好了！我们的下一个目标就是嘲颅废墟。",cEN="Excellent! Our next target will be the Laughing Skull Ruins."}
Q[9931]={d="我要你在那些战槌食人魔愚蠢而肥胖的脑袋里播下仇恨的种子。去吧，嘲颅废墟就坐落在此地西北方的山脚下。\n\n<兰特瑞索指着你带回来的基尔索罗军备箱。>\n\n你认得这些旗子吗？这就是基尔索罗军旗。我要你杀入嘲颅废墟，将这些基尔索罗军旗插在战槌食人魔的尸体上。记住，战槌食人魔的老巢在西北方，别找错了地方。",dEN="Now you must plant the seed of war in the fat, useless heads of the Warmaul. To the northwest, near the mountains, you will find the Laughing Skull Ruins.\n\n<Lantresor points into the crate of armaments you brought him.>\n\nDo you recognize those banners? They are Kil'sorrow banners. I want you to take a stack of Kil'sorrow banners and plant them on the corpses of Warmaul ogres. Remember, northwest is where you will find the ogres.",o="纳格兰火刃废墟的兰特瑞索·火刃要你杀入嘲颅废墟，将10面基尔索罗军旗插在战槌食人魔的尸体上。\n\n将没有用完的基尔索罗军旗还给兰特瑞索。",oEN="Lantresor of the Blade at the Burning Blade Ruins in Nagrand wants you to drive 10 Kil'sorrow Banners through the bodies of Warmaul ogres at the Laughing Skull Ruins.\n\nReturn any unused Kil'sorrow Banners.",p="你能预料到下次会发生什么事吗？",pEN="Can you predict what will happen next?",c="计划执行得非常完美，$n。我已准备好看看你努力的成果了。",cEN="The plan is perfect, <name>. I am already seeing the fruits of your labor."}
Q[9932]={d="你在基尔索罗堡垒的这一场杀戮为我们创造了非常有利的机会。这些基尔索罗士兵的尸体完全可以用来伪装一个混战后的现场。\n\n现在，你立刻转至嘲颅废墟的嘲颅营地。营地中应该有一堆燃烧的战槌篝火堆，当你清理掉碍事的战槌食人魔以后，就点燃这张潮湿的毛毯。我手下的石拳食人魔看到烟雾信号后就会悄悄潜入，将基尔索罗士兵的尸体丢弃在营地中。\n\n这将会是战争的导火索！",dEN="Your rampage through Kil'sorrow Fortress has provided us with a special opportunity. We have enough bodies to make it appear as if a great battle has taken place.\n\nTravel to the Laughing Skull Ruins and find the Laughing Skull Courtyard. There should be a blazing pyre in the courtyard. Make sure the area is secure and then use this blanket to send up smoke signals. When my ogres see the smoke, they will sneak in and plant the bodies of slain Kil'sorrow soldiers.\n\nThat should be the final straw!",o="纳格兰火刃废墟的兰特瑞索·火刃要你转至嘲颅营地，在燃烧的战槌篝火堆处点燃潮湿的毛毯，利用烟雾向食人魔传递信号。",oEN="Lantresor of the Blade at the Burning Blade Ruins in Nagrand wants you to use the Damp Woolen Blanket at the Blazing Warmaul Pyre in the Laughing Skull Courtyard to signal his ogres.",p="你现在知道为什么你永远打赢不了我了吗？",pEN="Do you now understand why you could never win a war against me?",c="我必须承认，我已经几十年没有感到这么有活力过了。你做得很好，$n。",cEN="I must admit, I have not felt this alive in decades. You have performed well, <name>."}
Q[9933]={d="<兰特雷索指着一只没有标记的箱子。>\n\n拿去吧。这是我献给你族人的礼物。你单凭一己之力把我的氏族从灭绝中拯救了出来。\n\n你可以告诉你的首领：兰特雷索·刃拳和他的石拳食人魔接受这份和平的提议。\n\n<兰特雷索鞠了一躬。>|n",dEN="<Lantresor points to an unmarked crate.>\n\nTake it. It is my offering to your people. You have single-handedly saved my clan from extermination.\n\nYou may tell your leader that Lantresor of the Burning Blade and his Boulderfist ogres accept the offering of peace.\n\n<Lantresor bows.>",o="将火刃的议和礼物交给纳格兰的塔拉的阿雷克隆。",oEN="Take the Burning Blade Peace Offering to Arechron at Telaar in Nagrand.",p="你说和平？",pEN="Peace you say?",c="拜托，$n，拿走和平礼物里你想要的东西。毕竟，没有你的努力，这一切都不可能发生。",cEN="Please, <name>, take from the peace offering whatever it is that you may desire. After all, without your efforts, this would not have been possible."}
Q[9934]={d="<兰特瑞索指着一个没有标志的箱子。>\n\n拿着。这是我送给你的人民的礼物。是你让我的氏族免遭灭顶之灾。\n\n回去告诉你的首领，火刃废墟的兰特瑞索和整个石拳食人魔氏族愿意与你们和平相处。\n\n<兰特瑞索鞠了一躬。>",dEN="<Lantresor points to an unmarked crate.>\n\nTake it. It is my offering to your people. You have single-handedly saved my clan from extermination.\n\nYou may tell your leader that Lantresor of the Burning Blade and his Boulderfist ogres accept the offering of peace.\n\n<Lantresor bows.>",o="将火刃的议和礼物交给加拉达尔的加尔鲁什。",oEN="Take the Burning Blade Peace Offering to Garrosh at Garadar.",p="<加尔鲁什看起来对礼物不为所动。>",pEN="<Garrosh seems unmoved by the offering.>",c="<加尔鲁什把木箱踢到一边。>\n\n你在浪费时间，$r。拿走木箱里任何你想要的东西。我和加拉达尔都不需要这些没用的装饰品。",cEN="<Garrosh kicks the crate aside.>\n\nYou waste your time, <race>. Take whatever you desire from the crate. I nor Garadar have any need for these useless trinkets."}
Q[9935]={d="死亡通缉令：\n\n基尔索罗的巫婆吉塞尔达和她的仆从们犯下了诸多谋杀、绑架、行窃、举行活祭仪式、与燃烧军团来往密切等重大罪行。\n\n他们聚集在纳格兰东南部的基尔索罗堡垒，就在纳格兰与泰罗卡森林的交界处附近。\n\n谁能让吉塞尔达得到正义的制裁，就能从加拉达尔的监护者布罗克处领到一笔丰厚的赏金。",dEN="Wanted: Dead or Alive\n\nGiselda the Crone of Kil'sorrow and her lackeys for murder, ritual sacrifice, communing with the Legion, kidnapping, and burglary.\n\nKnown to congregate at Kil'sorrow Fortress in southeastern Nagrand, near the border of Terokkar.\n\nLarge gold reward to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar to anyone able to bring Giselda to justice.",o="杀死巫婆吉塞尔达以及任意10名基尔索罗成员，完成任务后向加拉达尔的监护者布罗克复命。",oEN="Slay Giselda the Crone and any combination of 10 Kil'sorrow Agents. Return to Warden Bullrok at Garadar should you complete this task.",p="你是来领取奖励的吗？",pEN="Are you here to collect a reward?",c="那个老巫婆被杀了！这消息真是太棒了，$n。这是你的奖励。",cEN="The crone has been slain! This is wonderful news, <name>. Here is your reward."}
Q[9936]={d="死亡通缉令：\n\n基尔索罗的巫婆吉塞尔达和她的仆从们犯下了诸多谋杀、绑架、行窃、举行活祭仪式、与燃烧军团来往密切等重大罪行。\n\n他们聚集在纳格兰东南部的基尔索罗堡垒，就在纳格兰与泰罗卡森林的交界处附近。\n\n谁能让吉塞尔达得到正义的制裁，就能从塔拉的监护者莫布吉尔处领到一笔丰厚的赏金。",dEN="Wanted: Dead or Alive\n\nGiselda the Crone of Kil'sorrow and her lackeys for murder, ritual sacrifice, communing with the Legion, kidnapping, and burglary.\n\nKnown to congregate at Kil'sorrow Fortress in southeastern Nagrand, near the border of Terokkar.\n\nLarge gold reward to be dispensed by Warden Moi'bff Jill at Telaar to anyone able to bring Giselda to justice.",o="杀死巫婆吉塞尔达以及任意10名基尔索罗成员，完成任务后返回塔拉向监护者莫布吉尔复命。",oEN="Slay Giselda the Crone and any combination of 10 Kil'sorrow Agents. Return to Warden Moi'bff Jill at Telaar should you complete this task.",p="你是来领取奖励的吗？",pEN="Are you here to collect a reward?",c="那个老巫婆被杀了！这消息真是太棒了，$n。这是你的奖励。",cEN="The crone has been slain! This is wonderful news, <name>. Here is your reward."}
Q[9937]={d="你已经摧毁了纳格兰最大的两个威胁，$n。你$g准备好:准备好;对付灵魂之地的祸害了吗？\n\n饥饿者杜恩统治着奥舒古恩周边地区，所过之处尽成焦土。迄今为止，还没有人能把纳格兰从这头凶猛的格隆手中解救出来。召集你的盟友，前往此地西南很远、奥舒古恩附近的灵魂之地，找到杜恩。杀了他，我向你保证，报酬一定与这任务的难度相称。|n",dEN="You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, <name>. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?\n\nDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, far southwest of here, near Oshu'gun, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand.",o="杀死饥饿者杜恩，完成任务后向监护者布罗克复命。",oEN="Slay Durn the Hungerer. Return to Warden Bullrok if you manage to complete this task.",p="为了玛格汉！",pEN="For the Mag'har!",c="杜恩那杀人的魔爪终于松开了！纳格兰因为你而有了更光明的明天，$g英雄:英雄;。干得好！",cEN="Durn's murderous grip has been loosed! Nagrand has a brighter tomorrow because of you, hero. Well done!"}
Q[9938]={d="你已经摧毁了纳格兰最大的两个威胁，$n。你$g准备好:准备好;对付灵魂之地的祸害了吗？\n\n饥饿者杜恩统治着奥舒古恩周边地区，所过之处尽成焦土。迄今为止，还没有人能把纳格兰从这头凶猛的格隆手中解救出来。召集你的盟友，前往此地以西的灵魂之地，找到杜恩。杀了他，我向你保证，报酬一定与这任务的难度相称。",dEN="You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, <name>. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?\n\nDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, west of here, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand.",o="杀死饥饿者杜恩，完成任务后向塔拉的监护者莫布吉尔复命。",oEN="Slay Durn the Hungerer. Return to Warden Moi'bff Jill if you manage to complete this task.",p="不要浪费时间！一定要阻止杜恩！",pEN="Waste no time! Durn must be stopped!",c="杜恩那杀人的魔爪终于松开了！纳格兰因为你而有了更光明的明天，$g英雄:英雄;。干得好！",cEN="Durn's murderous grip has been loosed! Nagrand has a brighter tomorrow because of you, hero. Well done!"}
Q[9939]={d="死亡通缉令：\n\n顾问佐尔布曾策划多起针对加拉达尔的袭击事件，并伙同其手下的劫掠者和萨满祭司杀害了无数的兽人。毫无疑问，他是个心狠手辣的危险份子。\n\n佐尔布盘踞在纳格兰北部的嘲颅废墟。\n\n谁能杀死顾问佐尔布，就能从加拉达尔的监护者布罗克处领到一笔丰厚的赏金。",dEN="Wanted: Dead or Alive\n\nZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.\n\nZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.\n\nReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar.",o="杀死顾问佐尔布、5个战槌萨满祭司和5个战槌劫掠者，完成任务后向监护者布罗克复命。",oEN="Slay Zorbo the Advisor, 5 Warmaul Shaman and 5 Warmaul Reavers. Return to Warden Bullrok if you manage to complete this task.",p="你是来领取奖励的吗？",pEN="Are you here to collect a reward?",c="这是加拉达尔人民伟大的胜利！做得好，$n！",cEN="This is a great victory for the people of Garadar! Well done, <name>!"}
Q[9940]={d="死亡通缉令：\n\n顾问佐尔布曾策划多起针对塔拉的袭击事件，并伙同其手下的劫掠者和萨满祭司杀害了无数的破碎者。毫无疑问，他是个心狠手辣的危险份子。\n\n佐尔布盘踞在纳格兰北部的嘲颅废墟。\n\n谁能杀死顾问佐尔布，就能从塔拉的监护者莫布吉尔处领到一笔丰厚的赏金。",dEN="Wanted: Dead or Alive\n\nZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Telaar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless Broken. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.\n\nZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.\n\nReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Moi'bff Jill at Telaar.",o="杀死顾问佐尔布、5个战槌萨满祭司和5个战槌劫掠者，完成任务后向塔拉的监护者莫布吉尔复命。",oEN="Slay Zorbo the Advisor, 5 Warmaul Shaman and 5 Warmaul Reavers. Return to Warden Moi'bff Jill if you manage to complete this task.",p="你是来领取奖励的吗？",pEN="Are you here to collect a reward?",c="这是塔拉人民伟大的胜利！做得好，$n！",cEN="This is a great victory for the people of Telaar! Well done, <name>!"}
Q[9944]={d="盖亚安祖母一直告诫我们要勤勉自律，承担起保卫氏族的重任。她要我们为加尔鲁什树立榜样，让他明白生命的意义。\n\n我一直负责处理氏族内的各项事务，在盖亚安祖母病重倒下之后更是忙得不可开交。不知道你是否愿意帮帮我？\n\n数日之前，我们派一支车队转至先祖之地送丧，可他们至今未归。你能帮我们寻找车队的下落吗？他们是从西边的道路离开加拉达尔的，你也沿着那条道路走吧，记得绕开哈兰。",dEN="Greatmother says that we must press on and serve our people. She says that we must serve as an example for Garrosh - to show that life goes on.\n\nI have so many matters to attend to here, especially with Greatmother having taken ill. Would you honor the Mag'har by helping one of their matrons?\n\nSeveral days ago we sent a funeral procession to the Ancestral Grounds and they have yet to return. Will you go search for them? They took the western road out of Garadar. Follow it around and avoid Halaa.",o="寻找失踪的玛格汉车队。",oEN="Search for the missing Mag'hari procession.",c="三十个兽人，$r！在原本的三十个人里，只有我和安格雷兹活下来。我们在日泉岗哨附近找到了年轻的兽人——萨鲁法尔——他几乎要断气了。很明显，他是为了另一个动机来到这里……",cEN="Thirty orcs, <race>! Of those original thirty, only Ungriz and I remain. We found the young orc, Saurfang, nearly dead near Sunspring. Apparently he was here for another reason..."}
Q[9945]={d="在转至先祖之地的途中，我们遭到了战槌食人魔的伏击。他们从四面八方涌来，很快就杀死了车队的卫兵和其它兽人，躺在车上的长者遗体也惨遭亵渎。\n\n难道这样的羞辱就能显示战槌氏族的强大？就连石拳食人魔都不会犯下如此低劣的恶行。\n\n$n，即使是身为玛格汉氏族的灵魂师，我也有很多力所不能及的事，所以我需要你的帮助。请你立刻转至西北方的战槌山寻找那帮强盗，杀光他们！",dEN="We were en route to the Ancestral Grounds when we were ambushed by Warmaul. They came from all sides, killing several of the procession guards and many of the others. They even desecrated the remains of the elder in the wagon.\n\nAnd for what? So they could humiliate us and display their power. Not even Boulderfist would have sunk so low.\n\nI am a spiritual orc, <name>, but even I have limitations. Find the attackers at Warmaul Hill to the northwest and destroy them!",o="纳格兰玛格汉车队的长者尤尔雷要求你杀死8个战槌蛮兵和8个战槌术士。",oEN="Elder Yorley at the Mag'hari Procession in Nagrand has asked that you slay 8 Warmaul Brutes and 8 Warmaul Warlocks.",p="这只是一小步而已。一定要让食人魔们看到对与错的不同。",pEN="This is merely one step in a long process. Ogres, like dogs, must be shown the difference between right and wrong. Telling them does no good.",c="这是个好的开始，但我们一定要解决掉他们的首领，这样才会对他们有所威慑。",cEN="It is a good start, but their leader must be dealt with for your actions to have any lasting impact."}
Q[9946]={d="$r，你见过食人魔之王吗？很少有人能从他的魔爪下逃生。我们要对付的正是这样一位残暴的君主。\n\n那些野蛮的战槌食人魔全都听命于考瓦尔。据说他甚至撵走了原本统治着那些食人魔的戈隆，大摇大摆地登上王座，并解散了为戈隆服务的食人魔氏族，将他们重新揉成了一个新的氏族，是的，战槌食人魔就此诞生。\n\n去战槌山洞窟的深处杀掉考瓦尔，将他的徽记带回来给我。",dEN="Have you ever seen an ogre king, <race>? Few have and lived to tell the tale. Unfortunately, that is exactly what we are dealing with here.\n\nThe leader of these barbarians is an ogre named Cho'war. Rumor has it that Cho'war was the ogre responsible for forcing the gronn out of the cave. Cho'war then declared himself king and dissolved the ogre clans that served under the gronn. Thus, Warmaul was born.\n\nFind Cho'war deep in the caves of Warmaul Hill. Slay him and bring me his head.",o="纳格兰玛格汉车队的长者尤尔雷要求你杀死掠夺者考瓦尔，并将考瓦尔的徽记带回来复命。",oEN="Elder Yorley at the Mag'hari Procession in Nagrand has asked that you slay Cho'war the Pillager and retrieve the Head of Cho'war.",p="考瓦尔那儿绝对戒备森严。",pEN="He will undoubtedly be heavily guarded.",c="这颗头颅会悬挂在加拉达尔的大门上让所有人都瞧一瞧。食人魔会在打断玛格汉神圣的仪式前先掂量掂量自己的能耐。",cEN="This head will be posted at the gates of Garadar for all to see. The ogres will think twice before interrupting sacred Mag'hari rituals."}
Q[9948]={d="我只知道食人魔喜食新鲜的肉类。也就是说，他们很可能将掳去的玛格汉战俘暂时囚禁起来，以保持食物的新鲜。想想就令人作呕，但是我们可以利用这一点。\n\n转至战槌山寻找玛格汉俘虏。牢笼的钥匙通常由各个牢笼附近的食人魔保管。\n\n杀掉看守牢笼的食人魔，夺得钥匙，搭救玛格汉俘虏。",dEN="If I know anything about ogres, it's that they like their food fresh. This means that the Mag'har that they captured are more than likely being kept alive until they are ready to serve. It's a sickening thought, I know, but one that we must use to our advantage.\n\nVenture to Warmaul Hill and search for Mag'har prisoners. If you find prisoners, then you will find keys to their cages on the nearby Warmaul ogres.\n\nKill ogres for their keys and release the prisoners.",o="纳格兰玛格汉车队的长者安格雷兹要求你去释放5个玛格汉俘虏。",oEN="Elder Ungriz at the Mag'hari Procession in Nagrand has asked that you free 5 Mag'har Prisoners.",p="<安格雷兹叹了一口气。>\n\n我知道可能要求的有点多，$n，但一定让他们活着回来……",pEN="<Ungriz sighs.>\n\nI know it's a lot to ask for, <name>; but bring them back alive...",c="你做到了没人认为可能做到的事，把我们失踪的兄弟姐妹带了回来。对玛格汉来说，你就是$g一位:一位;英雄，$n。所有人都会知道你的名字和你的事迹。",cEN="You have done what none thought was possible and brought back our missing brothers and sisters. You are a hero to the Mag'har, <name>. All will know your name and the deeds that you have performed for us."}
Q[9951]={d="快，藏起来！纳弗塔拉那双眼睛正死死地盯着你……它也盯着我们！\n\n我可不敢冒险去塔顶跟它交谈，但你就不同了……你似乎知道该跟它说些什么。千万小心，它不喜欢玩笑话，更容忍不了愚蠢的言行。\n\n如果可以的话，说服它下来品茶吧。不过，你要尽一切办法让它别那么盯着我！",dEN="Quick, hide! The eyes of Naphthal'ar are upon you... upon us all!\n\nI dare not go to the top of the tower to speak with it, but you... you look as if you might know the right words to say. Just be careful, it doesn't like jokes and will not suffer fools easily.\n\nIf you can, convince it to come down for tea. But, by all means, get it to stop staring at me!",o="杀死纳弗塔拉，然后返回泰罗卡森林的塞纳里奥树林向监护者忒洛斯复命。",oEN="Kill Naphthal'ar and then return to Warden Treelos at the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",p="我们根本不该邀他们来晚餐。这绝对是肯定的！\n\n不然，我们至少该坚持多上几道菜再吃他们带来的甜点。",pEN="We should never have invited them to dinner. That much is certain!\n\nOr, at least, we should have insisted upon a couple of courses before the dessert that they brought.",c="这是最好的方式，真的。如果它接受礼貌邀请的话，它就不会有事了。\n\n<监护者忒洛斯似乎恍惚了一下。>\n\n你是谁，你在这里干嘛？你要趁还来得及，快点离开这里！",cEN="It's for the best, really. If it cannot civilly accept an invitation then it has no business attending.\n\n<Warden Treelos looks momentarily confused.>\n\nWho are you and what are you doing here? You must get out of here quickly before it is too late!"}
Q[9954]={d="<阿雷克隆递给你一张脏兮兮的信纸。>\n\n我刚收到这封信。是统治着纳格兰西北疆域的战槌食人魔氏族寄来的。信上说考尔奇落到了他们手上，如果我们不满足他们的要求，他们就要吃掉考尔奇。虽说考尔奇是个正牌的蠢材，可他毕竟还是我的孩子。$n，你愿意搭救他吗？\n\n他应该被关押在战槌山的某个牢笼中，你得去那边找他。",dEN="<Arechron shows you a grime covered letter.>\n\nI just received this letter. It's from a clan of ogres known as Warmaul that rule the northwestern lands of Nagrand. It says that they have Corki and if we don't cooperate, they're going to eat him. Admittedly, Corki is a moron, but he's still my blood. Will you rescue him, <name>?\n\nI presume that he's locked up in a cage somewhere on Warmaul Hill. That should be your first stop.",o="阿雷克隆要你转至战槌山寻找考尔奇。",oEN="Arechron wants you to find Corki at Warmaul Hill.",c="他们这次把我锁了起来，$n。战槌之王考瓦尔有钥匙。",cEN="They've got me locked up good this time, <name>. The Warmaul king, Cho'war, has the key."}
Q[9955]={d="$n，那些食人魔称他为掠夺者考瓦尔。他赶走了统治战槌食人魔的戈隆，自己做了氏族之王。你最好相信我的话，他是个可怕的对手！\n\n我听厨师说考瓦尔居住在那边的大洞穴中……无论如何，取来钥匙，把我从这鬼地方救出去！如果我们能逃得此劫，我父亲必定会好好赏赐你的！救出我之后，就去找他吧。",dEN="They call him Cho'war the pillager, <name>. He's the ogre that forced out the gronn that used to rule over these ogres. You better believe he's powerful!\n\nThe chef said that Cho'war lives in the big cave - wherever that may be... Get that key and get me out of here! If we live through this, my father will no doubt give you the big reward! As soon as I'm free, seek him out.",o="夺得考瓦尔的钥匙，将考尔奇从牢笼中释放出来，完成任务后返回塔拉向阿雷克隆复命。",oEN="Corki wants you to get Cho'war's Key so that you can free him from his cage. Return to Arechron at Telaar should you manage this task.",p="考尔奇在哪？",pEN="Where's Corki?",c="谢谢你，$n。考尔奇被送去刀锋山和暗夜精灵一起住了。希望他们能让他远离麻烦。\n\n至于奖励……",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Corki's been sent away to live among the night elves in Blade's Edge. Hopefully they'll be able to keep him out of trouble.\n\nAbout that reward..."}
Q[9956]={d="我是商队的一名成员，我们当时奉命将一批货物运往赞加沼泽的奥雷柏尔营地。然而，就在车队行进到沼泽边界附近时，一队战槌食人魔突然拦住了我们的去路。他们残忍地杀害了商队的其它成员，将我和所有的货物一并劫回了营地。\n\n谢天谢地，他们忘了锁住关押我的牢笼，于是我趁他们睡着时逃了出来。\n\n虽然伙伴们都不幸罹难，可是那些被偷走的货物还是能用的，请你一定要帮我们回收。战槌山就在纳格兰西北部。",dEN="I was part of a caravan taking supplies to the Orebor Harborage in Zangarmarsh. As we were nearing the border of the marsh, we were jumped by a vicious squad of Warmaul ogres. They killed the others and took me prisoner, along with all of our supplies.\n\nThankfully, they neglected to place a backing on my cage. When they fell asleep, I made my escape.\n\nIt's too late for my comrades but we could really use the supplies they stole. Warmaul Hill is in the northwestern mountains of Nagrand.",o="收集10个塔拉补给箱，把它们交给塔拉的女猎手琪玛。",oEN="Huntress Kima at Telaar in Nagrand wants you to recover 10 Telaar Supply Crates.",p="我觉得自己好蠢。阿雷克隆的儿子，考尔奇问我发生了什么事然后我就告诉他。现在他又再次失踪了！",pEN="I feel so stupid. Arechron's son, Corki, asked me what happened and I told him. Now he's gone missing again!",c="不可思议！你怎么一个人把这些东西搬回来的？",cEN="Amazing! How did you manage to carry all of that back by yourself?"}
Q[9957]={d="泰罗卡森林的塞纳里奥树林中居住着一群德鲁伊，我们有好些日子没收到他们的消息了。\n\n$N，去那儿看看是不是出了什么状况。转至塞纳里奥树林的最快路线是沿着道路往南走，再转向沙塔斯城东面的岔路。",dEN="We haven't heard from the druids at the Cenarion Thicket of Terokkar Forest in quite some time.\n\n<name>, I'd like for you to go down there and check in with them to see what's happening. There are several ways to get there, but the fastest is to head south along the path, and then take the road that branches east from Shattrath City once you're in the forest.",o="与泰罗卡森林地区的塞纳里奥树林中的某位德鲁伊谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with one of the druids at the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",c="我很高兴塞纳里奥庇护所派你来。这片树林的德鲁伊都被杀死了！只有我和另一个人还活着，而他也疯了。\n\n我不知道发生了什么事，但我想追根究底。不管是什么原因，它来的很快且不合常理。\n\n你会帮我吗？",cEN="I'm glad that the refuge sent you. The druids of the thicket have been slain! Only myself and one other have survived, and he's insane.\n\nI don't know what happened, but I intend to get to the bottom of it. Whatever it was, it happened quickly and feels unnatural.\n\nWill you help me?"}
Q[9960]={d="$c，你好。塞纳里奥树林中居住着一群德鲁伊，不过我们有好些日子没收到他们的消息了。\n\n去那儿看看是不是出了什么状况。塞纳里奥树林就在这片森林的西北方。",dEN="Hey there, <class>. We haven't heard from the druids of the Cenarion Thicket in quite some time.\n\nI want you to go over there and check to see what's happening. You can find it by heading northwest through the forest.",o="与泰罗卡森林地区的塞纳里奥树林中的某位德鲁伊谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with one of the druids at the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",c="我很高兴塞纳里奥庇护所派你来。这片树林的德鲁伊都被杀死了！只有我和另一个人还活着，而他也疯了。\n\n我不知道发生了什么事，但我想追根究底。不管是什么原因，它来的很快且不合常理。\n\n你会帮我吗？",cEN="I'm glad that Stonebreaker Hold sent you. The druids of the thicket have been slain! Only myself and one other have survived, and he's insane.\n\nI don't know what happened, but I intend to get to the bottom of it. Whatever it was, it happened quickly and feels unnatural.\n\nWill you help me?"}
Q[9961]={d="$C，有件要紧事要你跑一趟。塞纳里奥树林中居住着一群德鲁伊，不过我们有好些日子没收到他们的消息了。通常每隔几天我们就能收到他们的来信的。\n\n去那儿看看是不是出了什么状况。塞纳里奥树林就在这片森林的西北方。",dEN="<class>, I have urgent business for you. We haven't heard from the druids of the Cenarion Thicket in quite some time. This is unusual as we usually hear from them at least once every few days.\n\nI want you to go up there and make sure that they're alright. You can find the thicket by heading northwest through the forest.",o="与泰罗卡森林地区的塞纳里奥树林中的某位德鲁伊谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with one of the druids at the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",c="我很高兴塞纳里奥庇护所派你来。这片树林的德鲁伊都被杀死了！只有我和另一个人还活着，而他也疯了。\n\n我不知道发生了什么事，但我想追根究底。不管是什么原因，它来的很快且不合常理。\n\n你会帮我吗？",cEN="I'm glad that Stonebreaker Hold sent you. The druids of the thicket have been slain! Only myself and one other have survived. and he's insane.\n\nI don't know what happened, but I intend to get to the bottom of it. Whatever it was, it happened quickly and feels unnatural.\n\nWill you help me?"}
Q[9962]={d="准备好迎接你的第一场战斗了吗？只要你开口，我就安排一切；你只需去鲜血之环等候对手到来。\n\n这场战斗的对手是断趾，一头凶猛的裂蹄牛。\n\n祝你好运！希望你是带着朋友来的。\n\n记住，当你们中有一人面朝下倒在竞技场地上时，战斗就结束了。|n",dEN="So are you ready for your first battle? If you are, let me know and I'll get things started. All you have to do is go wait in the Ring of Blood for your opponent to arrive.\n\nThis fight is against Brokentoe, a ferocious clefthoof.\n\nGood luck! I hope you brought friends.\n\nAnd remember, the fight's over when either you or your opponent are lying face down on the arena floor.",o="击败断蹄，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat Brokentoe. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="嗯，不错。真的很不错……你有潜力，孩子。这里有一些让你填满荷包的金子……",cEN="Hrm, not bad. Not bad at all... You've got potential, kid. Here's a little gold to line your pockets with..."}
Q[9967]={d="下一场战斗是一对搭档——准确说是孪生兄弟。他们自称\"蓝色兄弟\"。\n\n现在退缩还来得及，$n。我完全理解。\n\n但你要是想找点刺激，就走进鲜血之环，等候暗血双子到来。\n\n站到最后的人获胜！",dEN="This next battle involves a duo - twin brothers to be precise. They call themselves the \"Blue Brothers.\"\n\nIt's not too late to chicken out, <name>. I'd certainly understand.\n\nBut if you're ready for some action, step in the Ring of Blood and wait for the Murkblood twins to arrive.\n\nLast one standing is the winner!",o="击败自称为蓝色兄弟的暗血双胞胎，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat the Murkblood Twins that call themselves the Blue Brothers. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="我承认我以为你没有祷告，$n！真是太精采了！要不要再来一场比赛？我有超棒的对手在排着队。",cEN="I'll admit that I didn't think you had a prayer, <name>! That was amazing! So how 'bout another fight? Gurgthock's got the perfect match lined up."}
Q[9968]={d="塞纳里奥树林中的巨蛾不知何故发生了巨变。 \n\n这儿曾栖息着许多种生物，现在却只剩巨蛾了。它们本是性情温顺的小昆虫，如今却变得极具攻击性。\n\n我要将邪恶巨蛾与普通的巨蛾进行比较。你能替我收集这两类蛾子的标本吗？那些未受影响的蛾子分布在南边和北边。\n\n我想这必定与德鲁伊被杀一事有关。",dEN="Something strange has changed the teromoths of the thicket.\n\nWhere once there was a diversity of life in there, now only the teromoths remain. And while before they were at peace, now they are agitated and will not hesitate to attack you should you get close.\n\nI need to compare the vicious ones to the normal. Collect for me a number of samples from both. You'll find the unaffected teromoths both to the south and the north.\n\nI'm certain this is related to whatever killed all of the druids.",o="收集4份巨蛾样本和4份邪恶巨蛾样本，然后向泰罗卡森林中塞纳里奥树林外的缚地者塔弗格伦复命。",oEN="Collect 4 Teromoth Samples and 4 Vicious Teromoth Samples. Then return to Earthbinder Tavgren just outside of the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",p="你弄到我要的样本了吗？",pEN="Do you have my samples?",c="真奇怪。这些飞蛾样本充满了一种能量，我认为是一股纯粹的法力能量。\n\n看起来是有什么东西引起生物大量的死亡，事后还残留着一股强大的能量磁场。但是由于某种原因，那些飞蛾竟然存活了下来，而且陷入了被激怒的状态。\n\n很显然的这股奇怪的能量是某样东西攻击树林后而留下来的副作用。",cEN="Odd. The samples from the vicious teromoths are infused with what feels to me to be pure mana.\n\nIt would seem that whatever caused all of this death also left behind that strong field of residual energy. But for some reason the teromoths were not killed by it; instead being driven into an agitated state.\n\nIt seems apparent that this strange energy is the by-product of whatever attacked the thicket."}
Q[9970]={d="$n，这将是一场苦战。你有没有叫上可靠的朋友来帮忙？食人魔从刀锋山找来了一位名叫洛卡达尔的巨人！相信我，你必须跟你的朋友们一起战斗。这家伙看起来就很猛！他跟岩石一样坚韧，事实上他就是个极能打的石巨人！\n\n如果你想要跟他较量一番，就进入鲜血竞技场，等待他登场吧。",dEN="This fight is gonna be painful, <name>. Do you have any friends that are brave enough to help you out? The ogres managed to get a giant from Blade's Edge named Rokdar! Trust me, you're gonna need friends, he seems unbeatable! He's hard as a rock - literally!\n\nIf you still want to fight him, step into the Ring of Blood and he will come.",o="击败裂石之王洛卡达尔，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat Rokdar the Sundered Lord. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="你让巨魔流了不少汗，小鬼！这次有些特别不一样的东西——不要一次把它们全用完。\n\n你准备好下一场挑战了吗？",cEN="You've got the ogres sweatin', kid! Here's a little something extra this time - don't use 'em all in one place.\n\nAre you ready for another fight? Gurgthock's bettin' the bank on you!"}
Q[9971]={d="不知道是谁杀光了这儿的德鲁伊。我一直在此地以南的白骨荒野进行调查研究，因此逃得一劫。\n\n请你一定要伸出援手，帮我揭开这场惨剧的真相。如果可以的话，进入塞纳里奥树林寻找线索吧。我记得曾在树林中看见一具破碎者的尸体，他旁边还有个奇怪的物体。这条线索可能对我们有所帮助。\n\n别担心忒洛斯，他虽然受到惊吓失了心智，可我相信他不会伤害你。",dEN="I have no idea what killed all of the druids here. I've been away for a couple of days on a survey of the Bone Wastes to the south.\n\nPlease, you must help me to uncover what's behind this horrible tragedy. Go into the thicket and look for a clue that might reveal something to us. When I was in there briefly, I could have sworn I saw a dead Broken and a strange object next to him.\n\nAnd don't worry about Treelos - he might have been driven insane by what happened, but I think he's mostly harmless.",o="调查破碎者的尸体旁的奇怪物体，看看究竟是什么在滋扰塞纳里奥树林，然后向塞纳里奥树林外的缚地者塔弗格伦复命。",oEN="Investigate the Strange Object next to the Broken Corpse to determine what might have befallen the Cenarion Thicket. Then return to Earthbinder Tavgren just outside the thicket in Terokkar Forest.",p="你发现了什么吗？",pEN="Have you discovered anything yet?",c="所以，我是对的。那是一具破碎者的尸体吗？你确定他旁边地上有个奇怪的物体？\n\n真是不合理。那个破碎者去那里做什么？他拥有的是什么东西？\n\n就是那个东西导致他遇害的吗？",cEN="So, I was right. That was the corpse of one of the Broken? And you can confirm that there was a strange object on the ground next to him?\n\nThis doesn't make any sense. What would one of the Broken be doing here? And what is that thing it had with him?\n\nIs it what caused all of this death?"}
Q[9972]={d="你在外面杀得可真狠，$g小子:姑娘;！下一场他们请来了高手。据说是个虚空领主之类的东西……他们绝不想让你对上他们的冠军。你听见那个蠢货莫戈尔冲你吠了吗？赌注已经涨上天了。\n\n进环里去，速战速决！",dEN="You're murderin' 'em out there, kid! They got a ringer for the next match. They say he's a void lord or something... No way do they want you up against their champion. Did you here that palooka, Mogor, yapping at you? The bets are through the roof!\n\nGet in that ring and take this one out fast!",o="击败瑟克拉加斯，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat Skra'gath. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="$g小子:姑娘;！就是这一场！下一战是重头戏。冠军争夺战！\n\n好吧，保持冷静。别让食人魔知道我们在搞什么名堂。毕竟我也要从这里抽成的。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="KID! KID THIS IS IT! The next fight is the big one! The championship!\n\nOk, keep it cool. We don't want the ogres to know that we got anything going on. I get a cut of all this, after all."}
Q[9973]={d="他们不得不把冠军从刃拳的角斗场调过来……他是拿山地巨人练出来的……一次打三个。\n\n你要是赢了这场，就会成为$g新的冠军:新的冠军;。你觉得自己的胜算如何，小子？有戏吗？只要你点头，我就押上全部家当赌你赢。\n\n现在进去赢下它！",dEN="They had to ship the champion in from the Blade's Edge gladiator pits. He was training on mountain giants - three at a time.\n\nIf you win this one, you become the new champion. What do you think your odds are, kid? Do you have a shot? Just give me the word and I'll bet the house on you.\n\nNow get in there and win!",o="击败战槌勇士，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat the Warmaul Champion. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="喔天啊。穆戈尔以战槌英雄的身份加入战斗。你必须打败他！\n\n从来没人说战槌有好的运动家……呃……食人魔。",cEN="Oh boy. Mogor has invoked his right of battle as hero of the Warmaul. You have to fight him!\n\nNobody ever said the Warmaul were good sports... erm... ogres."}
Q[9977]={d="<古格索克正数着他那一大堆金币。>\n\n你可让我赚了一大笔，$g小子:姑娘;。你要是能击败莫戈尔，我保证让你觉得值。你在鲜血之环受的所有苦最终都会有回报。\n\n现在进去，让那些食人魔看看你是什么做的！",dEN="<Gurgthock is counting his massive pile of gold.>\n\nYou've made me a lot of money, kid. If you can defeat Mogor, I promise to make it worth your while. All that pain you suffered in the Ring of Blood is gonna end up paying off.\n\nNow get in there and show these ogres what you're made of!",o="击败战槌英雄穆戈尔，获胜之后找巨魔仆从伍迪领取奖励。",oEN="Defeat Mogor, Hero of the Warmaul. Should you win, speak with Wodin the Troll-Servant to collect your reward.",p="当你或你的对手阵亡倒地时打斗就结束了。",pEN="The fight's over when you or your opponent are dead on the floor.",c="古格索克说过会让你觉得值，$g小子:姑娘;。随便挑吧！",cEN="Gurgthock told you he'd make it worth your while, kid. Take your pick!"}
Q[9978]={d="此事依然毫无头绪，但是我知道如何获得更多的线索。\n\n埃博尔是位消息灵通的破碎者商人。如果你能让他开口说话，我们必定能得到些有趣的信息。\n\n他一般在图雷姆和沙塔斯城之间往返。当心些，他随身带着一名护卫呢。",dEN="I don't know what to make of all of this, but I do know how we can find more clues.\n\nEmpoor is a Broken merchant that traffics in all sorts of goods and information. If you were to persuade him to talk, I'm sure he might have something interesting to say.\n\nHe travels the road here between Tuurem and Shattrath. Watch out, though -- he travels with a bodyguard.",o="在泰罗卡森林中，图雷姆和沙塔斯城之间的大路上找到并说服埃博尔将他所知道的一切都告诉你。",oEN="Find Empoor on the road between Tuurem and Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest. Convince him to tell you what he knows.",c="好，好……我会告诉你我所知道的事，但我知道的不多！",cEN="Fine, fine... I'll tell you what I know, but it's not much!"}
Q[9979]={d="我奉命为沙塔斯城中的一位虚灵运送货物。\n\n我最后一次见他是在贫民窟的天涯旅店外。他名叫星界商人拉斯莱，我就知道这么多！\n\n想知道更多的话，你直接找他问去吧！",dEN="I was asked to pick up and deliver some boxes of goods from an ethereal in Shattrath City.\n\nLast I saw him, he was standing outside of the World's End Tavern in Lower City. His name is Wind Trader Lathrai, and that's all that I know!\n\nWant more answers, go talk with him!",o="与沙塔斯城贫民窟天涯旅店附近的星界商人拉斯莱谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Wind Trader Lathrai near the World's End Tavern in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",c="有什么事吗？我能帮你什么忙，$r？",cEN="Yes? How may I help you today, <race>?"}
Q[9981]={d="立刻进入沙拉斯鸦巢，$n！现在时间非常宝贵。如果阿拉卡发现你已经破除了他们的防御体系，他们一定会换个地方关押迪罗姆的，甚至把他杀掉。\n\n如果可能的话，带上一两个朋友帮助你，闯入那里面看起来确实很困难。那些鸟人对他们的囚犯看守得十分严密，绝不会允许他们轻易逃脱。如果你找到了迪罗姆，立刻消灭他身边的守卫，带他回到裂石堡，并通知罗卡格。",dEN="Make your way to Veil Shalas with all haste, <name>! Time is of the essence here. If the arakkoa discover what you've done to their defenses, they may attempt to move Dugar, or even kill him.\n\nIf you can, bring a friend or two with you. It's likely to be rough there. The bird-men have gone to great lengths to secure their prisoner and they're not likely to give him up easily. After you've found Dugar and dealt with his captor, return to Stonebreaker Hold and notify Rokag.",o="前往迷雾撒拉斯，杀了卢安卡，再释放杜葛尔。完成任务后再向裂石堡的罗卡格回报。",oEN="Venture into Veil Shalas, kill Luanga, and free Dugar. Report to Rokag at Stonebreaker Hold when you have completed your mission."}
Q[9982]={d="上周，有位暗夜精灵乘坐着虚空幼龙来到镇上。他说自己名叫奥图里斯，然后向城民们询问了一些关于纳格兰的问题。\n\n最夸张的是，他宣称还自己的职责是追杀燃烧军团。你听听这癫狂的言语，你能想象吗？居然还有人愿意猎杀恶魔？\n\n奥图里斯临走之前让我们告诉那些想要成为英雄的人，说什么如果人愿意做点有意义的事，就尽管去找他。他会一直在纳格兰西部恭候诸位的大驾。",dEN="A being riding atop a nether drake arrived in town late last week. He introduced himself as Altruis and then proceeded to ask us several questions about Nagrand.\n\nHe claimed that he was hunting Legion. That such insanity was actually his job. Can you imagine? A person that would willingly hunt demons?\n\nBefore he left, he asked that we let the would-be heroes in town know that he will be staying in western Nagrand for awhile and that should they seek a purpose, to find him.",o="如果你想与燃烧军团作战，就到纳格兰西部去找到受难者奥图里斯。",oEN="If you are looking to fight the Burning Legion, find Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand.",c="我的出现吓到你了吗？你知道我是谁吗？",cEN="Does my appearance startle you? Do you know what I am?"}
Q[9983]={d="上周，有位暗夜精灵乘坐着虚空幼龙来到镇上。他说自己名叫奥图里斯，然后向城民们询问了一些关于纳格兰的问题。\n\n最夸张的是，他宣称还自己的职责是追杀燃烧军团。你听听这癫狂的言语，你能想象吗？居然还有人愿意猎杀恶魔？\n\n奥图里斯临走之前让我们告诉那些想要成为英雄的人，说什么如果人愿意做点有意义的事，就尽管去找他。他会一直在纳格兰西部恭候诸位的大驾。",dEN="A being riding atop a nether drake arrived in town late last week. He introduced himself as Altruis and then proceeded to ask us several questions about Nagrand.\n\nHe claimed that he was hunting Legion. That such insanity was actually his job. Can you imagine? A person that would willingly hunt demons?\n\nBefore he left, he asked that we let the would-be heroes in town know that he will be staying in western Nagrand for awhile and that should they seek a purpose, to find him.",o="如果你想与燃烧军团作战，就到纳格兰西部去找到受难者奥图里斯。",oEN="If you are looking to fight the Burning Legion, find Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand.",c="我的出现吓到你了吗？你知道我是谁吗？",cEN="Does my appearance startle you? Do you know what I am?"}
Q[9984]={d="尽管你无法辨认出卷轴上的奇怪笔迹，但还是可以从公文最后华丽的印章中看出，这份卷轴出自一位颇有地位的鸦人之手。卢埃加或许就是那个抓捕和监禁迪鲁姆的鸦人，还负责审问他。不过，他看上去也是接到了另一个地位更高的鸦人之命令才负责这件事的。\n\n你突然想起山德曾说过，安达尔对鸦人研究颇多，或许他能读懂卷轴中的内容。",dEN="Although you cannot read the strange script on the scroll, the ornate seal at the bottom of the document implies that it was drafted by an arakkoa of high standing. Luanga may have masterminded the capture and interrogation of Deirom, but it seems he was taking orders from someone else.\n\nYou remember Thander mentioning that Andarl has studied the arakkoa. Perhaps he can decipher the scroll's contents.",o="将卢埃加的命令交给泰罗卡森林中奥蕾莉亚要塞的安达尔。",oEN="Take Luanga's Orders to Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",c="这上面大部分我都能读，足以了解个大概。写这封信的人在赞扬卢安加取得的进展，并鼓励他继续审问他的客人。\n\n信中还写道，斯奇提斯的准备工作正按计划推进，他们很快就能准备好夺回祖传的土地。\n\n我对写信人提到的这个斯奇提斯并不熟悉，但不管它在哪儿，听起来鸦人正在那里集结军队！必须立刻把这件事告诉山德尔。",cEN="I can read most of this, enough to get a general idea. Whoever wrote this is praising the 'progress' made by Luanga and encouraging him to continue interrogating his 'guests.'\n\nMeanwhile, it says, 'the preparations in Skettis are proceeding as planned' and that they will 'soon be ready to reclaim their ancestral lands.'\n\nI'm not familiar with this 'Skettis' mentioned by the writer, but wherever it is, it sounds like the arakkoa are assembling an army there! Thander must be told about this immediately."}
Q[9985]={d="尽管你无法辨认出卷轴上的奇怪笔迹，但还是可以从公文最后华丽的印章中看出，这份卷轴出自一位颇有地位的鸦人之手。卢埃加或许就是那个抓捕和监禁杜加尔的鸦人，还负责审问他。不过，他看上去也是接到了另一个地位更高的鸦人之命令才负责这件事的。\n\n你突然想起罗卡格曾说过，库加托克对鸦人研究颇多，或许他能读懂卷轴中的内容。",dEN="Although you cannot read the strange script on the scroll, the ornate seal at the bottom of the document implies that it was drafted by an arakkoa of high standing. Luanga may have masterminded the capture and interrogation of Dugar, but it seems he was taking orders from someone else.\n\nYou remember Rokag mentioning that Kurgatok has studied the arakkoa. Perhaps he can decipher the scroll's contents.",o="将卢埃加的命令交给泰罗卡森林中裂石堡的库加托克。",oEN="Bring Luanga's Orders to Kurgatok at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",c="这上面大部分我都能读，足以了解个大概。写这封信的人在赞扬卢安加取得的进展，并鼓励他继续审问他的客人。\n\n信中还写道，斯奇提斯的准备工作正按计划推进，他们很快就能准备好夺回祖传的土地。\n\n我对写信人提到的这个斯奇提斯并不熟悉，但不管它在哪儿，听起来鸦人正在那里集结军队！必须立刻把这件事告诉罗卡格。",cEN="I can read most of this, enough to get a general idea. Whoever wrote this is praising the 'progress' made by Luanga and encouraging him to continue interrogating his 'guests.'\n\nMeanwhile, it says, 'the preparations in Skettis are proceeding as planned' and that they will 'soon be ready to reclaim their ancestral lands.'\n\nI'm not familiar with this 'Skettis' mentioned by the writer, but wherever it is, it sounds like the arakkoa are assembling an army there! Rokag must be told about this immediately."}
Q[9986]={d="我们必须让那些该死的鸦人知道，任何攻击我们的人都要付出惨重的代价。否则，我们在泰罗卡森林内的所有商人、信使和士兵将会面临他们的威胁。\n\n我的斥候已经确认了鸦人在这个地区各个主要定居点的首领。去吧，找到里斯克鸦巢的阿什卡兹、西诺鸦巢的埃伊特和基斯鸦巢的乌达克，将他们全部定点清除。",dEN="We need to show the arakkoa that they cannot attack our people with impunity. If we don't stop them here, the roads will no longer be safe for our merchants, couriers, or soldiers.\n\nMy scouts have identified the leaders of each of the major arakkoa settlements in the area. Seek out Ashkaz, Ayit, and Urdak, in Veil Reskk, Veil Shienor, and Veil Skith and kill them.",o="杀死里斯克鸦巢的阿什卡兹，西诺鸦巢的埃伊特和基斯鸦巢的乌达克，然后返回奥蕾莉亚要塞向山德复命。",oEN="Kill Ashkaz in Veil Reskk, Ayit in Veil Shienor, and Urdak in Veil Skith and return to Thander at the Allerian Stronghold.",p="再见到你真好，$n。你完成了我交代的事吗？",pEN="It's good to see you again, <name>. Have you done as I asked?",c="做得好，$n。我们不用再担心鸦人什么时候又会攻击我们的商人和信差了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. We have enough to worry about without wondering when the arakkoa will accost our merchants and messengers again."}
Q[9987]={d="我们必须让那些该死的鸦人知道，任何攻击我们的人都要付出惨重的代价。否则，我们在泰罗卡森林内的所有商人、信使和士兵将会面临他们的威胁。\n\n我的斥候已经确认了鸦人在这个地区各个主要定居点的首领。去吧，找到里斯克鸦巢的阿什卡兹、西诺鸦巢的埃伊特和基斯鸦巢的乌达克，将他们全部定点清除。",dEN="We need to show the arakkoa that they cannot attack our people with impunity. If we don't stop them here, the roads will no longer be safe for our merchants, couriers, or soldiers.\n\nMy scouts have identified the leaders of each of the major arakkoa settlements in the area. Seek out Ashkaz, Ayit, and Urdak, in Veil Reskk, Veil Shienor, and Veil Skith and kill them.",o="杀死里斯克鸦巢的阿什卡兹，西诺鸦巢的埃伊特和基斯鸦巢的乌达克，然后返回裂石堡向罗卡格复命。",oEN="Kill Ashkaz in Veil Reskk, Ayit in Veil Shienor, and Urdak in Veil Skith and return to Rokag at Stonebreaker Hold.",p="$g欢迎:欢迎;回来，$n。你对付过那些鸦人首领了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>. Have you dealt with the arakkoa leaders?",c="做得好，$n。我们不用再担心鸦人什么时候又会攻击我们的商人和信差了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. We have enough to worry about without wondering when the arakkoa will accost our merchants and messengers again."}
Q[9988]={d="别让山德尔那伙人骗了你。他们看着像一帮可怕的战士，可那身钢铁底下，不过是一群花花公子！\n\n而且他们不戴帽子绝不出现在公众面前。那是些毛毡和毛皮做的奢华帽子，上面插着你所能想象到的最俗艳的羽毛。\n\n最好的羽毛当然来自鸦人，而我的存货快用完了。你要是能替我收集，我会乐意付钱。",dEN="Don't let Thander and company fool you. They may look like a band of fearsome warriors, but underneath all that steel, they're nothing more than a troop of dandies!\n\nAnd they won't be seen in public without their hats. They're extravagant affairs made from felt and fur, complete with the gaudiest feathers you've ever seen.\n\nThe most desirable feathers come from any of the arakkoa, of course, and my supply is running low. I'll gladly pay you if you'll collect them for me.",o="给奥蕾莉亚要塞的洛瑟蕾丝带回30片鸦人的羽毛。",oEN="Bring 30 Arakkoa Feathers to Ros'eleth in the Allerian Stronghold."}
Q[9989]={d="记得当我第一次来到外域并倾听这里各种灵魂的声音时，我对自己听到的东西感到非常诧异。同时，我也留意到有些灵魂的声音我竟然无法聆听清楚。\n\n我尝试过各种办法，仍然接触不到这些鸦人的灵魂。他们的魔法与我们的完全不同，但我还不能确定接触他们的灵魂是否超出了我的能力范围。\n\n总之，帮我找一些鸦人的羽毛回来吧，或许依靠这些他们身上的东西，我就能接触到他们的灵魂。",dEN="When I first came to Outland, and opened my ears to the voices of its spirits, I was amazed at what I heard. In time, I also came to notice which spirits I couldn't hear.\n\nFor all my attempts, I have never been able to make contact with the spirit of an arakkoa ancestor. Their magic is fundamentally different from ours, but I'm not convinced that their spirits are beyond my reach.\n\nBring me feathers from many arakkoa; perhaps having some token from them will provide the link I need.",o="将30片鸦人的羽毛交给裂石堡的玛鲁卡兹。",oEN="Bring 30 Arakkoa Feathers to Malukaz at Stonebreaker Hold."}
Q[9990]={d="我想起来了。大约一个月前，我确实将几盒奇异的工程零件卖给了埃博尔。我不知道它们有什么用处，只知道这批货物是运往图雷姆的。\n\n或许那里还留有一两只盒子？",dEN="You know, come to think of it, I do recall selling several boxes of strange and exotic engineering parts to Empoor about a month ago. I'm not sure what they'd be used for, but I know that they were delivered to Tuurem.\n\nPerhaps one or more of those boxes is still there?",o="找到密封的盒子，将其交给塞纳里奥树林外的缚地者塔弗格伦。",oEN="Find the Sealed Box and then deliver it to Earthbinder Tavgren just outside of the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",p="你带来了什么消息，$n？",pEN="What news do you bring, <name>?",c="虚灵组织？送到图雷姆的物品？特殊的工程学零件？还有一个血精灵准备要将最后一箱送到火翼岗哨？\n\n这些话是什么意思？！这些跟塞纳里奥树林里的那些德鲁伊有什么关系？\n\n我想我们该看看箱子里的东西。",cEN="Ethereals? Goods delivered to Tuurem? Exotic engineering parts? And a blood elf getting ready to deliver this last box to Firewing Point?\n\nWhat does all of this mean?! How does it relate to what happened to the druids in the Cenarion Thicket?\n\nI think we should have a look inside that box."}
Q[9991]={d="做我的眼睛需要你格外用心。奈瑟兰达姆斯会带你穿过军团的营地，但你必须把所见的一切都记录下来。哪怕是最细微、你觉得无关紧要的细节，也可能对我们的目的有用。\n\n首先，我要你留意营地里的建筑类型，以及营地的防御构成。\n\n奈瑟兰达姆斯随时待命，$n。别害怕，他会保你平安。|n",dEN="To be my eyes will require some diligence on your part. Nethrandamus will take you through the Legion camps, but you must catalog everything that you see. Even the smallest detail that you may think to be inconsequential could be useful for our purposes.\n\nPrimarily, I want you to note what structures are in the camps and what comprises the camps' defenses.\n\nNethrandamus is ready when you are, <name>. Do not be afraid, he will keep you safe from harm.",o="好好享受这趟旅程吧。调查完毕之后跟奥图里斯谈一谈。",oEN="Sit back and enjoy the ride. Speak to Altruis when the survey is complete.",p="从没坐过虚空龙飞行吧？",pEN="Never flown on the back of a nether drake, eh?",c="做得好，$n！现在我们有计划反击的重点了！",cEN="Excellent work, <name>! We now have a point from which we can plan our counter-attack."}
Q[9992]={d="你不觉得这片森林里的树很漂亮吗？我经常会希望能在艾泽拉斯世界也看到这么美丽的树。\n\n可是我很犹豫该不该将种子带回去。这些树种跟普通的种子不同，很难运输，带上它们将会给旅程增加许多不便。这些包藏在坚硬的松果内的种子一旦成熟，就会从树枝上掉下来。\n\n如果你在旅行途中见到掉落下来的松果，能帮我把里面的种子带一些回来吗？",dEN="Aren't the trees in the forest beautiful? I've often wondered if they would survive on Azeroth.\n\nI'm hesitant to send back seedlings, though. It's a rough trip and they're much harder to transport than something like a sack of seeds. The seeds are stored in tough cones that fall from the tree's branches once they've reached maturity.\n\nIf you come upon some of those cones in your travels, would you mind bringing some of the seeds back to me?",o="收集30颗奥雷巴种子，把它们交给奥蕾莉亚要塞的洛瑟蕾丝。",oEN="Gather 30 Olemba Seeds and return them to Ros'eleth in the Allerian Stronghold.",p="我开始收集种子了，但我需要一些帮忙才能有足够的种子带回暴风城的公园。",pEN="I've started a seed collection, but I'm going to need some help before I have enough to send back to the park in Stormwind.",c="谢谢你带来这些种子。我快要可以将第一批送回去了！",cEN="Thank you for bringing these seeds. I've almost got enough to send back the first batch!"}
Q[9993]={d="森林里奥雷巴树上结的那些油乎乎的种子非常有用。我一直想要收集这类种子，榨出它们的油，然后再想想能用它来做什么。\n\n你看，外面的森林中到处都是奥雷巴树，许多种子都被浪费掉了。总之，我不管最后榨出来的是食用油也好，灯油也好，武器油也好，我希望不要浪费那些种子！\n\n将你从奥雷巴果中收集到的种子带回来给我，森林里到处都是这些玩意。",dEN="The oily seeds from the forest's olemba trees could prove very valuable. I'd like to gather a larger quantity of them, press them for their oil, and then see what I can do with it.\n\nJust think, there's a whole forest full of trees out there, producing a lot of seeds that go to waste. I don't care if it turns out to be cooking oil, lamp oil, or weapon oil, I won't let it go to waste!\n\nBring me any of the seeds that you happen to gather from the olemba cones. They're all over the place.",o="将30颗奥雷巴种子交给裂石堡的拉克妮亚。",oEN="Bring 30 Olemba Seeds to Rakoria in Stonebreaker Hold.",p="你有种子给我吗？",pEN="Do you have any seeds for me?",c="这是个好的开始，但我们需要更多才能挤出相当份量的油！",cEN="That's a good start, but we're going to need more than that if we're to press a respectable amount of oil!"}
Q[9994]={d="我不知道你怎么想，但是我对这些东西压根没有了解。我只知道它们看上去相当危险！\n\n$n，我想你应该将这箱零件交给东南方奥蕾莉亚要塞的杰奈·星语。她或许知道这些东西的来历。",dEN="I don't know about you, but I have no idea what all of those things are. I do know one thing though - they look dangerous!\n\n<name>, I think you should take this box of parts to Jenai Starwhisper at the Allerian Stronghold to the southeast. She may have some idea of what these are.",o="将这一箱零件交给泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的杰奈·星语。",oEN="Deliver the Box of Parts to Jenai Starwhisper at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你看起来有些担忧。怎么了，$c？$g朋友:朋友;",pEN="You look concerned. What is it, <class>?",c="喔不！这真是个可怕的消息！我不敢相信仅有两个塞纳里奥的朋友活下来，其他的居然都死了。\n\n好吧，让我看看那些零件。我只希望它们不是我所猜想的东西。\n\n没错，正如我担心的——这些是炸弹零件。我们在沙塔斯城的眼线告诉我们部分虚灵组织为他们交易对象进口违禁品。",cEN="Oh no! That's horrible news! I can't believe that all but two of our Cenarion friends are dead.\n\nAlright, let me have a look at those parts. I'm just hoping they aren't what I suspect that they might be.\n\nYes, as I feared, I believe these are bomb parts. Our eyes and ears in Shattrath City have been feeding us information about some of the ethereals importing proscribed goods from other dimensions that they're in contact with."}
Q[9995]={d="我不知道你怎么想，但是我对这些东西压根没有了解。我只知道它们看上去相当危险！\n\n$n，我想你应该将这箱零件交给东南方裂石堡的图基。他或许知道这些东西的来历。",dEN="I don't know about you, but I have no idea what all of those things are. I do know one thing though - they look dangerous!\n\n<name>, I think you should take this box of parts to Tooki at Stonebreaker Hold to the southeast. He may have some idea of what these are.",o="将这一箱零件交给泰罗卡森林裂石堡的图基。",oEN="Deliver the Box of Parts to Tooki at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你看起来忧心忡忡的样子。那是什么，$c？",pEN="You look concerned. What is it, <class>?",c="哦，不！这消息太可怕了！我简直不敢相信，我们塞纳里奥的朋友只剩下两个人还活着。\n\n好吧，让我看看这些零件。我只希望它们不是我所怀疑的东西。",cEN="Oh no! That's horrible news! I can't believe that all but two of our Cenarion friends are dead.\n\nAlright, let me have a look at those parts. I'm just hoping they aren't what I suspect that they might be."}
Q[9996]={d="火翼岗哨的血精灵为凯尔萨斯和伊利丹效力。从你说的情况来看，血精灵显然在利用图雷姆的破碎者偷运零件，企图制造某种杀伤力极强的武器。\n\n无论他们在打什么鬼主意，现在我们能做的就是削减这帮家伙的数量。\n\n除掉火翼血精灵！转至北边的火翼岗哨，给他们点颜色瞧瞧。",dEN="We know that the blood elves of Firewing Point are working for Kael'thas and Illidan. And from what you've told me, clearly they are using the Broken of Tuurem as smuggling go-betweens for the creation of some horrible weapon.\n\nWhatever they're up to out there, the most efficient thing that we can do right now is to thin out their numbers.\n\nThe Firewing blood elves need to be taken out! Head up to Firewing Point to the north and see to it.",o="杀死10个火翼防御者、10个火翼血警卫和10个火翼术士，然后向泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚岗哨的米利迪安中尉复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Firewing Defenders, 10 Firewing Bloodwarders, and 10 Firewing Warlocks. Then report back to Lieutenant Meridian at the Allerian Post in Terokkar Forest.",p="回报。你从火翼岗哨带回了什么消息？",pEN="Report. What news do you bring from Firewing Point?",c="这是个好的开始，而且根据你在庭院所看到的和我们接收到的消息一样，看来当前情况非常紧急了！",cEN="That's a good start, but based on what you witnessed there in the courtyard, as well as intelligence that I've received, we have a far more pressing matter at hand!"}
Q[9997]={d="火翼岗哨的血精灵为凯尔萨斯和伊利丹效力。从你说的情况来看，血精灵显然在利用图雷姆的破碎者偷运零件，企图制造某种杀伤力极强的武器。\n\n无论他们在打什么鬼主意，现在我们能做的就是削减这帮家伙的数量。\n\n除掉火翼血精灵！转至东北方的火翼岗哨，给他们点颜色瞧瞧。",dEN="We know that the blood elves of Firewing Point are working for Kael'thas and Illidan. And from what you've told me, clearly they are using the Broken of Tuurem as smuggling go-betweens for the creation of some horrible weapon.\n\nWhatever they're up to out there, the most efficient thing that we can do right now is to thin out their numbers.\n\nThe Firewing blood elves need to be taken out! Head over to Firewing Point to the northeast and see to it.",o="杀死10个火翼防御者、10个火翼血警卫和10个火翼术士，然后向泰罗卡森林裂石堡的卡乌尼中士复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Firewing Defenders, 10 Firewing Bloodwarders, and 10 Firewing Warlocks. Then report back to Sergeant Chawni at Stonebreaker Camp in Terokkar Forest.",p="回报。你从火翼岗哨带回了什么消息？",pEN="Report. What news do you bring from Firewing Point?",c="这是个好的开始，而且根据你在庭院所看到的和我们接收到的消息一样，看来当前情况非常紧急了！",cEN="That's a good start, but based on what you witnessed there in the courtyard, as well as intelligence that I've received, we have a far more pressing matter at hand!"}
Q[9998]={d="东边废墟里邪兽人最近的到来，既让山德尔困惑，也让他忧虑。他们一刻也没耽误，立刻开始修筑防御工事、修复建筑。\n\n工程日夜不停，$n。我已经派出一名最可靠的agent去监视，但我们经不起拖延。对他们的工人动手，然后去食骨者废墟以北的奥蕾莉亚岗哨找塞洛里亚·暗影斗篷。她会给你进一步的指示。",dEN="The recent arrival of the fel orcs at the ruins to the east both puzzles and troubles Thander. They wasted no time in starting to construct fortifications and repair the buildings.\n\nThe construction goes on day and night, <name>. I've dispatched one of my most reliable agents to keep watch, but we can ill afford to delay action. Move against their workers, then seek out Theloria Shadecloak at the Allerian Post to the north of the Bonechewer Ruins. She'll give you further instructions.",o="杀死12名扭曲的苦工，然后向奥蕾莉亚岗哨的塞洛莉娅·影衣报告。",oEN="Kill 12 Warped Peons and then report to Theloria Shadecloak at the Allerian Post.",p="我猜是波尔泰姆派你来阻挠他们的苦工吧？",pEN="I take it Bertelm sent you to hamper the efforts of their peons?",c="<高等精灵点点头。>\n\n这是个好的开始，但波尔泰姆派你来是对的。我有个新发现或许能解释邪兽人出现在这的原因。",cEN="<The high elf nods.>\n\nIt's a good start, but Bertelm was right to send you to me. I've made a discovery that may help explain the fel orc presence here."}
Q[9999]={d="只要传送器还立着，我们对熔炉营地所做的一切都不会有持久效果。我们必须找到摧毁军团设施的办法。\n\n我需要时间来筹划一次进攻。你要是能拖住他们的工程师和工匠，就能大大拖慢他们的进度，为我争取到需要的时间。",dEN="As long as the transporters stand, nothing we do to the forge camps will have any permanence. We must find a way to destroy the Legion structures.\n\nI need time to devise a plan of attack. If you can keep their engineers and tinkerers busy, it would greatly slow down their progress, buying me the time I need.\n\nStay as far away as possible from the overseers, <name>. They are extremely dangerous beings.",o="纳格兰西部的受难者奥图里斯要求你除掉2个恶魔卫士军团士兵、3个莫尔葛工程师和8个甘尔葛修理工。",oEN="Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand has asked that you kill 2 Felguard Legionnaires, 3 Mo'arg Engineers and 8 Gan'arg Tinkerers.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back so soon?",c="如我所猜想的一样。没有特定能摧毁那些装置的方法。然而也并不是没有办法……",cEN="It is as I suspected. There are no conventional means of destroying fel steel. All is not lost, however..."}
Q[10000]={d="我们在萨尔玛的军队认为地狱火堡垒附近区域的邪兽人已经全部清除掉了，但是最近，在东边废墟一带，我们又发现了一些邪兽人。\n\n现在，我们必须阻止他们在那里建立新的据点。罗卡格已经派追踪者凯德去监视他们的行动了，但我们还得采取进一步的措施来阻止他们继续深入废墟。\n\n你先去废墟里清理一些他们的苦工，然后去北边的树林找里找到凯德。他会告诉你接下去做什么。",dEN="Our forces at Thrallmar thought they had the fel orcs contained in the Hellfire Citadel area, but the recent arrivals at the ruins to the east say otherwise.\n\nWe can't permit them to gain a foothold here. Rokag has dispatched Shadowstalker Kaide to the ruins to keep an eye on them, but we have to do something to keep them from digging in.\n\nGo to the ruins, decimate their peons, and then look for Kaide in the trees to the north. He'll tell you where to go from there.",o="杀死12名扭曲的苦工，然后向追踪者凯德报告。",oEN="Kill 12 Warped Peons and then report to Shadowstalker Kaide.",p="我正要传个消息给罗卡格建议发动攻击，但我看现在不太需要了。",pEN="I was about to send a message back to Rokag recommending an attack, but I see that won't be necessary.",c="恐怕阻止邪兽人将不只是干扰他们的工人。我发现那解释了他们出现在这里的原因并加强了我们一定要快点动作的信念。",cEN="Stopping the fel orcs is going to take more than merely harassing their workers, I'm afraid. I've made a discovery that's shed some light on the reason for their presence here and it's reinforced my belief that we must act quickly."}
Q[10001]={d="所有铸魔营地的都是由一名莫尔葛主规划师进行设计的。这个人将会负责规划铸魔营地中各个建筑物类型、位置和数量。而且，这些信息将会被整理成一份蓝图，由该营地的主规划师随身携带，妥善保管。\n\n我们现在需要的就是这份主规划师的蓝图。一旦这东西到手，我们就可以去找我的一位老朋友，并说服他帮助我们。\n\n总之你，你现在先去杀掉莫尔葛主规划师，并夺得蓝图。他现在应该就在铸魔营地中。",dEN="All forge camps have a master planner. The master planner dictates what types of structures are present at a forge camp and how each structure is situated. Moreover, this information is kept on a set of blueprints that the planner carries around on their person.\n\nWe need the master planner's blueprints. Armed with such exacting information, we could persuade an acquaintance of mine to lend some assistance.\n\nFind the mo'arg master planner and take his blueprints. He will be stationed behind the forges.",o="纳格兰西部的受难者奥图里斯要求你取回主规划师的蓝图。",oEN="Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand has asked that you recover the Master Planner's Blueprints.",p="不论如何一定要避开监工。绝对不能让他们见到你。后果会不堪设想！",pEN="Avoid the overseers at all costs. They must not be let on to your presence. The results could be disastrous!",c="希望我的朋友知道如何摧毁铸魔营地。毕竟他是燃烧军团工程师……",cEN="My acquaintance will hopefully know of a way to destroy the camps. He was a Legion engineer, after all..."}
Q[10002]={d="过去这几天，我一直在观察一名往返于邪兽人要塞、并与邪兽人首领交谈的血精灵女子。从她的肢体语言看，她显然在下达命令。可为什么呢？她传达的是谁的命令？\n\n好奇心压过了我的判断力，她离开邪兽人营地时我跟了上去。她一路向北，去了火翼岗。我在抵达血精灵前哨外围之前停了下来。\n\n在她再次离开邪兽人营地之前，杀了她。|n",dEN="Over the past couple of days, I've observed a blood elf woman traveling to and from the fel orc stronghold and conversing with the fel orc leader. From her body language, she's clearly issuing orders. But why? Whose orders is she conveying?\n\nMy curiosity got the better of my judgment and I shadowed her when she left the fel orc encampment. She headed north, to Firewing Point. I stopped before reaching the perimeter of the blood elf outpost.\n\nKill her before she leaves the fel orc camp again.",o="找到莉塞蕾·火纹并杀掉她，然后向塞洛莉娅·影衣复命。",oEN="Locate and slay Lisaile Fireweaver, then return to Theloria Shadecloak.",p="营地里的活动持续在扩大。你完成了你的任务吗？",pEN="The activity in the camp continues to escalate. Have you carried out your mission?",c="<塞洛莉娅对你点点头。>\n\n做得好。我们替自己争取了一点时间。血精灵会对他们朋友发生的事开始好奇。希望到那时候，我们会更了解他们的意图。",cEN="<Theloria nods at you.>\n\nWell done. We have bought ourselves a little time. The blood elves will grow curious about what happened to their friend. Hopefully, by that time, we will have a better understanding of their intentions."}
Q[10003]={d="在过去的几天里，我看到过一个女血精灵出入邪兽人的要塞，与邪兽人的首领进行会谈。从她的肢体语言中，我可以看出她是在发布命令。但这到底是怎么回事？她是在传达谁的命令？\n\n我对此充满好奇，所以我在她离开邪兽人营地时跟踪她，结果发现她往北边的火翼岗哨去了。我在火翼岗哨边界停止了跟踪。\n\n在她下一次离开邪兽人营地前杀掉她。",dEN="Over the past couple of days, I've observed a blood elf woman traveling to and from the fel orc stronghold and conversing with the fel orc leader. From her body language, she's clearly issuing orders. But why? Whose orders is she conveying?\n\nMy curiosity got the better of my judgment and I shadowed her when she left the fel orc encampment. She headed north, to Firewing Point. I stopped before reaching the perimeter of the blood elf outpost.\n\nKill her before she leaves the fel orc camp again.",o="找到莉塞蕾·火纹并杀掉她，然后向追踪者凯德复命。",oEN="Locate and slay Lisaile Fireweaver, then return to Shadowstalker Kaide.",p="我们让他们准备越久就越难将他们根除。你切断他们的联系了吗？",pEN="The longer we permit them to make preparations, the more difficult it will be to root them out. Have you killed the liaison?",c="<凯德对你点点头。>\n\n做得好。我们赢得了一点时间。血精灵会对他们朋友发生的事开始好奇，我们会更了解他们的意图。\n\n等到时机到来，我会告诉罗卡格我们的进度。",cEN="<Kaide nods at you.>\n\nWell done. We have bought ourselves a little time. The blood elves will grow curious about what happened to their friend. Hopefully, by that time, we will have a better understanding of their intentions.\n\nWhen the time is right, I will inform Rogak of our progress."}
Q[10004]={d="带上这份蓝图转至泰罗卡森林的沙塔斯城。在沙塔斯城贫民窟中寻找一位名叫萨萨拉比姆的莫尔葛。他最近经常会在酒吧买醉，想要依靠饮酒来平复心中的哀痛。\n\n你得试着说服他伸出援手，首先耐心地说明你的来意，如果这法子不奏效，就得用用你的拳头了。",dEN="Take the blueprints and travel to Shattrath City in the Terokkar forest. Once at Shattrath, go to the Lower City and look for a mo'arg by the name Sal'salabim. He'll probably be at the bar, drinking away his sorrows.\n\nBy the way, you may need to convince him to lend his assistance. Try to approach him with patience and understanding. If that does not work, use your fists.",o="纳格兰西部的受难者奥图里斯要你把策划大师的蓝图带给沙塔斯城的萨萨拉比姆，并说服他帮助你。|n",oEN="Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand wants you to take the Master Planner's Blueprints to Sal'salabim in Shattrath City and convince him to help you.",p="<萨萨拉比姆揉着他的头。>\n\n[恶魔语]lk il romath sardon。",pEN="<Sal'salabim rubs his head.>\n\n[Demonic] Ik il romath sardon.",c="冷静，$R！萨萨拉比姆会帮你的忙。",cEN="Calm down, bright eyes! Sal'salabim will help."}
Q[10005]={d="$n，庆祝完我们的胜利后，我想你应该返回塞纳里奥树林，跟缚地者塔弗格伦谈谈。\n\n他一定很想知道那场惨剧的真相。",dEN="<name>, after you're done celebrating here, I think that you should go back to the Cenarion Thicket and speak with Earthbinder Tavgren.\n\nI'm certain that he'll want to know what really happened out there.",o="与泰罗卡森林塞纳里奥树林外的缚地者塔弗格伦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Earthbinder Tavgren just outside the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",c="一个利用纯净法力可以毁掉我们城镇的炸弹！但是为什么血精灵要制造这样一个东西用来对付我们？塞纳里奥树林曾是一个和平宁静的地方。\n\n理由一定被锁在监护者忒洛斯的脑海里，我不知道该怎么解救他。或许他的心智会随着时间被治愈？\n\n不论如何，我要谢谢你帮助我厘清这些事情。我只希望这个悲剧永远不会再降临在任何人身上！",cEN="A bomb utilizing pure mana that can take out whole towns! But why? Why would the blood elves create such a thing and use it on us? The Cenarion Thicket was a place of peace and repose.\n\nWhatever the reason, it must be locked inside the head of Warden Treelos, and I have no idea how to cure him. Perhaps his mind will heal in time?\n\nRegardless, I want to thank you for helping me to figure out what happened. I can only hope that this tragedy will never befall anyone else ever again!"}
Q[10006]={d="$n，庆祝完我们的胜利后，我想你应该返回塞纳里奥树林，跟缚地者塔弗格伦谈谈。\n\n他一定很想知道那场惨剧的真相。",dEN="<name>, I think that after you're done celebrating here, you should go back to the Cenarion Thicket and speak with Earthbinder Tavgren.\n\nI'm certain that he'll want to know what really happened out there.",o="与泰罗卡森林塞纳里奥树林外的缚地者塔弗格伦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Earthbinder Tavgren just outside the Cenarion Thicket in Terokkar Forest.",c="一个利用纯净法力可以毁掉我们城镇的炸弹！但是为什么血精灵要制造这样一个东西用来对付我们？塞纳里奥树林曾是一个和平宁静的地方。\n\n理由一定被锁在监护者忒洛斯的脑海里，我不知道该怎么解救他。或许他的心智会随着时间被治愈？\n\n不论如何，我要谢谢你帮助我厘清这些事情。我只希望这个悲剧永远不会再降临在任何人身上！",cEN="A bomb utilizing pure mana that can take out whole towns! But why? Why would the blood elves create such a thing and use it on us? The Cenarion Thicket was a place of peace and repose.\n\nWhatever the reason, it must be locked inside the head of Warden Treelos, and I have no idea how to cure him. Perhaps his mind will heal in time?\n\nRegardless, I want to thank you for helping me to figure out what happened. I can only hope that this tragedy will never befall anyone else ever again!"}
Q[10007]={d="你得了解山德和波尔泰姆的心理，他们连群鸟人都不能忍，就更不会允许如此强大的敌人在我们的大门口创建起据点。所以，得他们让派些援军过来。要攻击邪兽人营地的驻军，仅仅依靠我们两人的力量是不够的。\n\n我们必须抑制住来自邪兽人的威胁。我决定了，你去骚扰他们，我会想办法阻止他们的援兵。",dEN="Knowing Thander and Bertelm, they won't tolerate such a large buildup of hostile forces on our doorstep. Asking them to dispatch members of the garrison to participate in an attack on the camp isn't an option either. It would just leave us too vulnerable to attack.\n\nIt falls to us to do what we can to diminish the threat the fel orc buildup poses. Kill what you can of their forces and I will look for ways to stall any reinforcements.",o="杀死10名噬骨蹂躏者和6名噬骨碎脊者，然后向塞洛莉娅·影衣复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Bonechewer Devastators and 6 Bonechewer Backbreakers and return to Theloria Shadecloak.",p="你的攻击成功吗？",pEN="Was your attack successful?",c="事情开始好转了。我想如果我们可以阻止邪兽人增加他们的援军，我们就能保住这个前哨。",cEN="Things are starting to look up. I think if we can prevent the fel orcs from reinforcing their fellows here, we can keep this post under control."}
Q[10008]={d="如果立刻把邪兽人没有被完全消灭干净通知萨尔玛，那边一定会增派更多的援兵过来碾平一切。但是，说实话，我不太希望情况演变成这样，所以我们一点风声都不要透露出去，知道吗？\n\n如果我们剿灭这些邪兽人的速度足够快，那就不会引起裂石堡以外任何人的关注。所以，现在就开始行动吧。\n\n你现在立刻拿起武器，用你能想到的一切办法去袭击他们——只要能将邪兽人消灭干净，怎样都好。",dEN="If word reaches Thrallmar that they've failed to contain the fel orcs, we're going to be receiving a lot of company down here. Frankly, I'm not sure I want all that attention, so we're going to keep this little problem under wraps, got it?\n\nIf we can inflict enough casualties on the fel orcs, chances are their presence will never come to the attention of anyone outside Stonebreaker. So, let's end it now.\n\nWade in there, swing your weapon, wave your hands, or whatever it is you do - just kill fel orcs.",o="追踪者凯德要你杀死10名噬骨蹂躏者和6名噬骨碎脊者。",oEN="Shadowstalker Kaide wants you to kill 10 Bonechewer Devastators and 6 Bonechewer Backbreakers.",p="告诉我选你执行这个任务是对的……",pEN="Tell me I wasn't wrong to trust you with this mission...",c="我知道你见识多广，但你要了解，$n，有些故事最好留在它们发生的地方。这样你懂了吗？",cEN="I know you're well-traveled, but understand, <name>, that some stories are best left where they happened. Do we understand each other?"}
Q[10009]={d="<萨萨拉比姆大笑起来。>\n\n这是都是我萨萨拉比姆设计的。\n\n<萨萨拉比姆指着蓝图上绘制的建筑物。>\n\n瞧这些塔。恶魔猎手双眼不能视物，对吧？可怜的奥图里斯。如果他能看见铸魔营地的构架，恐怕会失声痛哭。\n\n只要你肯帮萨萨拉比姆，萨萨拉比姆就帮你。\n\n<萨萨拉比姆递给你一本账本。>\n\n这些家伙欠萨萨拉比姆的钱。很多很多钱。为萨萨拉比姆讨回债务，他们肯定不愿意乖乖交出金币，你得使用武力，好在你是个强者。连萨萨拉比姆都不是你的对手呢！",dEN="<Sal'salabim laughs.>\n\nThis Sal'salabim design.\n\n<Sal'salabim points to the architecture and formations on the blueprints.>\n\nLook at towers. Demon hunter no can see, yes? Poor, poor Altruis. He cry if he had eyes, yes?\n\nYes, Sal'salabim help but first you help Sal'salabim.\n\n<Sal'salabim gives you a ledger.>\n\nThese creatures owe Sal'salabim golds. Many golds. Go collect for Sal'salabim and come back. They no give you Sal'salabim gold easy. Have to fight, but you strong. You defeat Sal'salabim!",o="沙塔斯城的萨萨拉比姆要你取回拉里克的债款、库什库什的债款和弗鲁恩的债款。",oEN="Sal'salabim at Shattrath City wants you to recover Raliq's Debt, Coosh'coosh's Debt and Floon's Debt.",p="没有拿到萨萨拉比姆的金子就不要回来！",pEN="You no come back without Sal'salabim golds!",c="现在成交，不过当萨萨拉比姆告诉你的时候，不可以生气，好吗？",cEN="Now, deal is deal but when Sal'salabim tell you, you not be mad, yes?"}
Q[10010]={d="<萨萨拉比姆指着蓝图。>\n\n你看见邪能火炮在哪儿了？\n\n<萨萨拉比姆画了个箭头，表示改变方向。>\n\n你把邪能火炮转过来，用来打他们的建筑。\n\n等等！别生气！有件事你不知道。监工们有转动火炮的钥匙。你得先拿到钥匙！每个监工各有一把。\n\n没那么容易，是吧？\n\n把消息带回去给奥图里斯。|n",dEN="<Sal'salabim points to the blueprint.>\n\nYou see where fel cannons are?\n\n<Sal'salabim draws an arrow denoting a change of direction.>\n\nYou turn fel cannon around and use on structures.\n\nWait! Don't be mad! One thing you not know. Overseers have key to turn cannons. You need key first! One from each overseer!\n\nNot so easy, eh?\n\nTake information back to Altruis.",o="沙塔斯城的萨萨拉比姆要你返回纳格兰西部向受难者奥图里斯复命。",oEN="Sal'salabim at Shattrath City wants you to return to Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand.",c="当然！我们会以其武器还治其人之身！",cEN="Of course! We will use their own weapons against them!"}
Q[10011]={d="召集你的盟友，$n。要面对监工，你需要他们。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;了，杀掉每个营地的监工。夺下他们的钥匙，用它把邪能火炮转向那些营地开火。摧毁营地之后再回来见我。",dEN="Gather your allies, <name>. You will need them if you are to face an overseer.\n\nOnce you have a suitable group, find and kill the overseers at each camp. Take their keys and use them to turn and fire the fel cannons upon the camps. Return to me once the camps are destroyed.",o="纳格兰西部的受难者奥图里斯要求你摧毁铸魔营地：仇恨和铸魔营地：畏惧。",oEN="Altruis the Sufferer in western Nagrand has asked that you Destroy Forge Camp: Hate and Destroy Forge Camp: Fear.",p="完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="我们胜利了！燃烧军团的进展已经得到了控制！\n\n我给你英勇的行为一个奖励选择！",cEN="We are victorious! The Legion's advances have been halted!\n\nI offer you a choice of rewards for your heroic deeds!"}
Q[10012]={d="这张潦草无比的计划书明显出自于某一个邪兽人的手笔。虽然你不知道它到底在说什么，但里面隐含的意思却非常清楚：邪兽人接受了火翼岗哨的血精灵下达的命令。\n\n为什么这两个种族会联合起来？波尔泰姆或许会知道一些内幕。你决定把地图带回奥蕾莉亚要塞去交给他。",dEN="The writing on the plans is far too delicate and precise to have come from any of the fel orcs. You can't make out what the text says, but the implications are pretty clear: the fel orcs are taking orders from the blood elves at Firewing Point.\n\nWhy would the two forces be working together? Bertelm might have some insight into this odd alliance. You decide to make your way back to the Allerian Stronghold and show him the map.",o="将邪兽人的计划交给泰罗卡森林中奥蕾莉亚要塞的波尔泰姆。",oEN="Bring the Fel Orc Plans to Bertelm at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你在那儿找到什么了吗，$n？",pEN="What is it you have there, <name>?",c="<波尔泰姆从你手中接过计划书并阅读它们。>\n\n如果你没有把这份计划书带来，我只能说你真是疯了，但现在它在这里，非常清楚。邪兽人不只效命于血精灵，很明显的，他们受命要抓住我们的注意力。\n\n这份计划书带来了比答案更多的问题，但它让我们更了解我们面对的是什么情形。",cEN="<Bertelm takes the plans from you and looks them over.>\n\nIf you hadn't brought this map, I'd say you were out of your mind, but here it is, plain as day. Not only are the fel orcs here to serve the blood elves, but it appears, they've been ordered to keep us occupied.\n\nThis map raises more questions than it answers, but it gives us a better idea of what we're facing here."}
Q[10013]={d="这张潦草无比的计划书明显出自于某一个邪兽人的手笔。虽然你不知道它到底在说什么，但里面隐含的意思却非常清楚：邪兽人接受了火翼岗哨的血精灵下达的命令。\n\n为什么这两个种族会联合起来？罗卡格或许会知道一些内幕。你决定把地图带回裂石堡去交给他。",dEN="The writing on the plans is far too delicate and precise to have come from any of the fel orcs. You can't make out what the text says, but the implications are pretty clear: the fel orcs are taking orders from the blood elves at Firewing Point.\n\nWhy would the two forces be working together? Rokag might have some insight into this odd alliance. You decide to make your way back to Stonebreaker Hold and show him the map.",o="将邪兽人的计划交给泰罗卡森林中裂石堡的罗卡格。",oEN="Bring the Fel Orc Plans to Rokag at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你手里拿着什么，$n？",pEN="What is it you have there, <name>?",c="<罗卡格从你手中接过计划书并阅读它们。>\n\n凯德说的是真的！那些邪兽人垃圾果然在搞鬼，我从没想过他们会和血精灵串通。\n\n从这份地图看来，邪兽人是要让我们无暇分心……但为什么呢？这真是让我心神不宁，$n。你这么快把它带过来是正确的行为。",cEN="<Rokag takes the plans from you and looks them over.>\n\nSo Kaide was right! Those fel orc scum are up to something. I never would've guessed they were colluding with the blood elves, though.\n\nAccording to this map, the fel orcs are to keep us busy... but why? This is disturbing news, <name>. You were correct in bringing it to me right away."}
Q[10016]={d="你在旅途中遇到过森林座狼吗？我在绘制这片森林北部边缘的地图时，有机会观察过它们。除非你已经$g做好:做好;战斗准备，否则我可不建议你靠近它们。\n\n它们不怕我们，会毫不犹豫地保卫自己的领地。\n\n这种生物的尾巴可真漂亮。我一直在收集足够多的尾巴，想做一件新斗篷，可座狼总有办法从我的陷阱里逃走……你愿意帮我吗？",dEN="Have you come across the timber worgs in your travels? I've had the opportunity to observe them while mapping some of the northern reaches of the forest. I wouldn't recommend getting close to them unless you're prepared for combat.\n\nThey have no fear of us and won't hesitate to defend their territory.\n\nIt's fitting that such a creature would have a magnificent tail. I've been trying to collect enough of them to trim a new cloak, but the worgs have a habit of evading my snares. Will you help?",o="奥蕾莉亚要塞的波尔泰姆想让你收集12条森林座狼的尾巴。这些尾巴可以从森林座狼和森林座狼前锋身上获得。",oEN="Bertelm at the Allerian Stronghold wants you to bring him 12 Timber Worg Tails. The tails can come from either Timber Worgs or Timber Worg Alphas.",p="你在森林的严苛环境中生存下来了。你带了我披风需要的尾巴来吗？",pEN="I see you've managed to survive the rigors of the forest. Have you brought any tails for my cloak?",c="啊，干得好，$g朋友:朋友;。这些比我预想的还要漂亮。能做出一件上好的斗篷。\n\n<贝尔特尔姆朝旅店那边瞥了一眼。>\n\n是啊，会是一件好斗篷。",cEN="Ah, well done, friend. These are finer than I thought they'd be. They'll make a fine cloak.\n\n<Bertelm glances toward the inn.>\n\nYes, a fine cloak it shall be."}
Q[10017]={d="每天涌入沙塔斯城寻求庇护的难民越来越多了。很多人还受了严重的伤，他们能活着坚持到这里，可真是个奇迹。\n\n我可以医治大部分的寻常伤症。身为一名奥尔多医者，我所接受过的训练让我对此有着良好的准备和应对经验。染毒的伤症则略麻烦一些，更何况我这里的抗毒剂储备量已经不太够了。\n\n给从我当地的巨牙蜘蛛身上取一些毒囊来吧，这样我就能制作更多的解毒剂了。在泰罗卡地区东南方的那块地方，你就可以找到那些蜘蛛。",dEN="More and more refugees come through the gates of Shattrath City each day. Some have sustained such injuries, it's a real wonder they made it here.\n\nI can deal with most of the conventional injuries; my training as an Aldor healer has prepared me for that. Poison wounds are more problematic as my anti-venom supplies have begun to run low.\n\nBring me venom sacs from the local dreadfang spiders so I can produce more antidotes. You'll find a pocket of the spiders in the southeastern region of Terokkar.",o="给沙塔斯城的莎妮尔带回8个巨牙毒囊。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring 8 Dreadfang Venom Sacs to Sha'nir in Shattrath City.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你拿到毒囊了吗，$n？这些难民等不了太久的。",pEN="Have you obtained the venom sacs, <name>? These refugees can't wait much longer.",c="感谢你，$n。奥尔多会记得你的行为。",cEN="You have my thanks, <name>. The Aldor will hear of your actions."}
Q[10018]={d="很久以前，当兽人部落还居住在泰罗卡森林的时候，他们非常崇拜狼的野性。而在他们离开之后，兽人开始变得不再需要狼之魂，并将它遗弃在了森林中。\n\n在那些日子里，狼之魂渐渐地感到孤独，最后离开了森林。\n\n我相信我能将狼之魂召唤回泰罗卡森林，就像我们一样回到祖先的家园。我要为仪式准备一些用森林中狼的毛皮制作的祭袍，这样才能指引灵魂回来。",dEN="Generations ago, when orc clans still called Terokkar Forest home, the wolf spirit played an important role in their lives. When the orcs departed, they had no longer had any need for the spirit and they left it behind.\n\nIn time, the spirit grew lonely and it too left the forest.\n\nI believe I can bring the wolf spirit back to his ancestral home, just as we orcs have returned. The ritual will require me to create vestments from the pelts of the wolves of the forest to guide the spirit back to its home.",o="给裂石堡的玛鲁卡兹带回12块森林座狼的毛皮交。",oEN="Bring 12 Timber Worg Pelts to Malukaz at Stonebreaker Hold.",p="你找到我需要的毛皮了吗？",pEN="Were you able to find all the pelts that I need?",c="这些非常完美，$n！这就是我想要的。",cEN="These are perfect, <name>! I could not have asked for better."}
Q[10019]={p="很多难民还需要治疗他们中毒的伤口。你带了更多的毒囊来给我吗，$n？",pEN="Many refugees still need treatment for their poisonous wounds. Have you brought more venom sacs for me to use, <name>?",c="谢谢你，$n。纳鲁已对这些不幸的灵魂加强保护，如果他们到了沙塔斯却因为先前的伤口而死去那会是一大憾事。\n\n<这个任务可以重复进行直到声望到达中立。>",cEN="You have my thanks, <name>. The naaru have extended their protection to these unfortunate souls; it would be a shame if they made it to Shattrath and perished to previous wounds.\n\n<This quest can be repeated up to Neutral reputation.>"}
Q[10020]={d="我右侧的这位女士的头部曾受过非常严重的创伤。虽然她很幸运地活了下来，却失去了视力。\n\n有一种非常传统的方法可以治愈她的眼睛，但是这需要使用一种原始蜥蜴的血。\n\n不幸的是，这里来自世界各地的偷猎者数量实在太多，导致栖息在泰罗卡森林里的蜥蜴数量正在逐渐变少。\n\n有一只名叫“凝石者”的蜥蜴非常着名，我小时侯就经常听到它的名字。据说它就住在东边，陆地的尽头。\n\n把它的血带回来给我，这样萨恩莉亚就能重见光明了。",dEN="The woman to my right suffered a severe injury to the head. She survived, but lost her eyesight.\n\nA traditional cure used among my people requires the blood of a very old basilisk.\n\nUnfortunately, due to poaching from various groups, Terokkar basilisks don't tend to live very long.\n\nThere is one basilisk whose name I've known since I was a youngling. It is known only as \"Stonegazer\" and it's rumored to live east of here, near the land's edge.\n\nBring me its blood so that Zahlia may see once again.",o="将凝石者的血交给沙塔斯城的莎妮尔。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring Stonegazer's Blood to Sha'nir in Shattrath City.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你取得血液了吗，$n？没有它，萨恩莉亚就无法再见到她的儿子。",pEN="Have you obtained the blood, <name>? Without it, Zahlia may never see her son again.",c="谢谢你，$n。照顾那些有需要的人是一件困难的工作，但是时间久了我发现它也有它的奖励。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Caring for those in need is a difficult task, but in time I've discovered that it is its own reward."}
Q[10021]={d="以前，有许多德莱尼人生活在这个地区，而我们奥尔多则担负着守卫德莱尼圣地与祭坛的任务。现在，这些圣地与祭坛大多已经被我们的敌人摧毁或占据了。\n\n从这里向东去，就有一处鸦人的据点。这处据点是故意创建在过去我们的三处神圣祭坛之上的。那些鸦人利用他们的邪恶魔法扭曲并亵渎了圣地中原生的纯洁能量。\n\n把这个带到那处据点去，用它净化那里的三座祭坛。",dEN="Much of this region was inhabited by draenei long ago. We Aldor were charged with the safeguarding of our holy sites and altars. Many of them have since been destroyed or taken over by our enemies.\n\nTo the east of here there is an arakkoa outpost. It was purposefully built on the location of three of our sacred altars. The arakkoa use their foul magic to warp and defile the innate power of our shrines.\n\nTake this to the arakkoa outpost and use it to cleanse the three altars.",o="伊沙娜希望你能转至沙塔斯城正东方的鸦人前哨站，使用神圣之瓶净化东部祭坛、西部祭坛和北部祭坛。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Ishanah wants you to go to the Arakkoa outpost east of Shattrath City and use the Blessed Vial to cleanse the Eastern Altar, the Western Altar and the Northern Altar.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成了你的任务吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="感谢你，$n。我们是圣光的守护者，不能背弃我们的责任，就算是在最艰难的时期也一样。",cEN="You have my thanks, <name>. We are keepers of the light and cannot forsake our responsibilities, even in the most difficult of times."}
Q[10022]={d="我这里已经有了许多非常漂亮的毛皮，但是，我还是最想得到一件由狼的毛皮作成的斗篷兜帽，那样一切就完美了。想想，假如你看到你的敌人披着森林里最狡猾的掠夺者的毛皮，是不是会感觉害怕呢！\n\n我曾捕捉过那只叫铁腭的老狼，但没有成功。那时候我试过将它逼上死路，试过最精巧的陷阱，也试过最诱人的肉饵，但是都失败了……它可真聪明。\n\n这家伙通常都游荡在森林东北边的扩展区域。如果你能帮我捉到它，我一定会支付你一大笔报酬的。",dEN="Now that I have the fur I'll need for the trim, I've been thinking that the pelt of a particular wolf would make a good hood for my cloak. Imagine seeing your enemy clad in the pelt of the most cunning predator in the forest!\n\nI've tried trapping old Ironjaw without success. I've tried cornering him, outsmarting him, and baiting him. None of it has worked.\n\nHe stalks the northeastern reaches of the forest, and I'd gladly reward you if you could succeed where I have failed.",o="为奥蕾莉亚要塞的波尔泰姆带回铁腭的毛皮。",oEN="Bring Ironjaw's Pelt to Bertelm at the Allerian Stronghold.",p="连铁颚也把你耍了，朋友？还是说你终究比那老家伙更$g狡猾:狡猾;？",pEN="Has old Ironjaw gotten the better of you, too, friend? Or have you managed to outsmart the old fellow?",c="我向你的本领致敬，$n。你证明了自己是$g更胜一筹的:更胜一筹的;$c。\n\n我不会忘记你帮我做成这件斗篷的恩情。它将是独一无二的，我会自豪地穿着它。",cEN="I bow to your skills, <name>. You have proven yourself the superior hunter.\n\nI won't forget your help in making this cloak. It will truly be a one-of-a-kind piece and I'll wear it proudly."}
Q[10023]={d="收集第一批毛皮的工作，你完成得非常出色。\n\n不过，制作祭袍还需要另一块特殊的毛皮。你知道吗，森林中有一只很特别的狼，它年老却相当狡猾，还是森林中狼群的族长。它是一只力量非常强大的食肉动物，名叫铁腭。\n\n我常常看到它在森林的东北边漫步。如果能将它的毛皮添加到祭袍中，一定能为狼之魂指明道路。\n\n不要为铁腭的死亡而感到悲伤，它会为此受到所有人的尊敬。",dEN="You've done well in gathering the first pelts.\n\nThe final piece of the vestments requires a pelt unlike any other. There is one particular wolf, an old and cunning one, that has earned his place as the patriarch of the forest wolves. He is known among them as Ironjaw, the mighty hunter.\n\nIn my visions, I have seen him wandering the northeastern region of the forest. Including his pelt in the vestments will surely light the wolf spirit's path.\n\nDo not mourn Ironjaw. He will be well honored.",o="将铁腭的毛皮交给裂石堡的玛鲁卡兹。",oEN="Bring Ironjaw's Pelt to Malukaz at Stonebreaker Hold.",p="灵魂在等待着，$n。你拿到狼王的毛皮了吗？",pEN="The spirit awaits, <name>. Have you the pelt of the wolf patriarch?",c="这张毛皮比我期望的还要华丽！这是个好兆头，$n，灵魂们会因为你为这场仪式所做的贡献而眷顾你。\n\n我用剩下的毛皮为你做了一顶头盔，$n。它表明你是一位强大的$g猎人:猎人;，也是泰罗卡森林巨狼之灵的$g盟友:盟友;。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="The pelt is even more magnificent than I had hoped! This is a good omen, <name>, and the spirits will favor you for your contribution to this ceremony.\n\nI have fashioned a helmet for you from the remaining pelts, <name>. It identifies you as a mighty hunter and an ally of the great wolf spirit of Terokkar Forest."}
Q[10024]={d="我们的领袖先知沃雷塔尔曾是凯尔萨斯最重要的一名顾问。有一天，他的预言梦境却警告他说，如果凯尔继续沿着当前的道路走下去，那么等待我们整个种族的只有毁灭。\n\n梦境一般都是非常模糊和不确定的，但我们的炼金师为他发明了一种药剂，使他可以集中感官与意识去了解梦境的内容。然而，这种药剂需要一种非常稀有的材料：蜥蜴的眼球。我之前的供货商，也就是这个可怜的虚灵，太令我失望了。\n\n在泰罗卡的岩石地域寻找这些湿鳞蜥蜴吧，把它们的眼球带回来给我。",dEN="Our leader, Voren'thal the Seer, was once a close advisor to Kael'thas. His prophetic visions warned him that Kael's path would lead to the destruction of our race.\n\nThe visions are usually vague and unfocused, but our alchemists have devised an elixir to help him focus his clairvoyance. Unfortunately, this elixir calls for a rare ingredient: basilisk eyes. My usual source, this pathetic ethereal, has failed me.\n\nSeek the dampscale basilisks in the rocky regions of Terokkar and bring me their eyes.",o="将8颗湿鳞蜥蜴的眼睛交给沙塔斯城的奥术师艾蒂莉亚。\n\n为占星者完成任务将会使你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring 8 Dampscale Basilisk Eyes to Arcanist Adyria in Shattrath City.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你为沃雷塔尔的精华取得蜥蜴眼了吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the basilisk eyes for Voren'thal's elixir?",c="这些眼睛的状态都很好，$n。继续努力你很快就会成为占星者的朋友了。",cEN="These are all in excellent state, <name>. Carry on and you will soon count the Scryers as your friends."}
Q[10025]={p="制作一小瓶的沃雷塔尔精华就要很多的蜥蜴眼。给我更多必定可以引来占星者的认同。",pEN="It takes many basilisk eyes to make even a small dose of Voren'thal's elixir. Bringing me more would certainly incur the Scryers' favor.",c="我谢谢你，$n。有朝一日，沃雷塔尔的幻象或许会决定我们种族的命运。我们理应尽力确保那些幻象尽可能准确。<此任务可重复完成，直至达到中立声望。>",cEN="I thank you, <name>. Voren'thal's visions might one day decide the fate of our race. It would behoove us to do our best to ensure that those visions are as accurate as possible.\n\n<This quest can be repeated up to Neutral reputation.>"}
Q[10026]={d="虽然承认这件事令我的确很尴尬，但是最近泰罗卡森林里发生了许多奇怪的事情，这在我当学徒的时候可从未发生过。\n\n比如说，我的魔法在泰罗卡森林内偶尔会失效，而且我肯定所有的施法步骤都没有出错。第一次发生这样的事情时，我差点疯掉。\n\n不过，我想我已经找到原因了。这片森林里到处都有一种叫迁跃跟踪者的怪兽，它们首选魔法能量，而且能影响施法者施法。最好的解决办法就是杀掉它们。",dEN="It's embarrassing to admit this, but something has happened to me here in Terokkar Forest that hasn't occurred since my apprentice days.\n\nOccasionally, my spells will fizzle when I know I've done everything correctly. I almost drove myself crazy the first time it happened.\n\nI think I've found the cause. The forest is full of creatures called warp stalkers, demonic creatures with an affinity for magic and a habit of disturbing magical flows. The best way to deal with them is simply to kill them.",o="奥蕾莉亚要塞的安达尔要求你杀死10只迁跃跟踪者。",oEN="Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold wants you to kill 10 Warp Stalkers.",p="你处理掉堡垒附近的扭曲巡者了吗？",pEN="Have you cleared the warp stalkers from the vicinity of the stronghold?",c="<安达尔用长袍的袖子在他的额头上轻拍了几下。>\n\n感谢老天。我正开始纳闷是否森林里剩下的生物都被迫离开了。",cEN="<Andarl dabs at his forehead with the sleeve of his robe.>\n\nThank goodness. I was beginning to wonder if the things had displaced the rest of the forest's creatures."}
Q[10027]={d="没有什么事情能比在施法时被某些未知的力量所干扰更让人烦心了。在做了四次尝试后，我终于明白这绝对不是巧合，于是我派了凯比希尔出去调查此事。\n\n我敢保证，你这辈子绝对没有遇到过比它还爱顶嘴的小鬼，让它干点活可真难。\n\n不过它最后还是找到了问题的根源，是一种叫作迁跃跟踪者的怪物在从中捣鬼。无论出现在什么地方，它们总是习惯于扰乱魔法能量流。我已经受够了，把它们都干掉。",dEN="There's nothing more annoying than preparing to cast a spell, only to have it interrupted by some unseen force. After the fourth time, I knew it couldn't be coincidence and I sent Keb'ezil out to investigate.\n\nI guarantee you'll never encounter an imp that talks back more than Keb.\n\nAnyway, he managed to find the source of the problem, a pesky creature known as a warp stalker. They have a habit of disturbing the magical energy wherever they blink into existence. I've had enough of their interference.",o="杀死10只迁跃跟踪者，然后向裂石堡的库加托克复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Warp Stalkers and return to Kurgatok at Stonebreaker Hold.",p="凯比希尔想知道是否能安全地掷出一个火球而不让他再次出糗。\n\n<小鬼发出了几次卡嗒声后，术士便转向他。>\n\n不，不是我的暗影箭！收回它，你这个过度生长的小妖精！",pEN="Keb'ezil wants to know if it's safe to hurl a fireball without embarrassing himself again.\n\n<The imp makes a few clicking sounds and the warlock turns toward him.>\n\nNo, it wasn't my shadow bolt! Take it back, you overgrown pixy!",c="凯比希尔很欣慰你解决了那个小问题，对吧，凯比希尔？\n\n<因为小鬼无视它的主人，库托加克似乎很愤怒。>\n\n你要原谅它不好的态度。你知道恶魔是什么样子……",cEN="Keb'ezil is relieved that you've taken care of that little problem, aren't you, Keb?\n\n<The imp ignores its master, presumably out of indignation.>\n\nYou'll have to forgive his bad manners. You know how demons can be..."}
Q[10028]={d="在图雷姆废墟中有许多富含原始魔法能量的容器。非常幸运的是，当前侵占了图雷姆的那些破碎者并不知道这些容器的存在。但是，恐怕不久之后他们就会发现这一点。\n\n如果我们这些幸存者能够掌握容器中的魔法能量，或许就能抵挡住恶魔魔法的引诱。每拯救一名奎尔多雷，都能为我们赢得失去的荣耀。帮我带一些那种容器回来，$c。",dEN="Amid the ruins of Tuurem are a number of vessels containing raw, magical energy. We are fortunate that the Broken who have overrun the city are ignorant to the resource in their midst, but we cannot assume they will remain so forever.\n\nWith those vessels and their power in hand, the scattered survivors of my people can resist the lure of demonic magic. Every quel'dorei we can save from our prince's folly is one more that can help us regain our lost glory. Bring me these vessels, <class>.",o="为奥蕾莉亚要塞的洛瑟蕾丝带回8个德莱尼容器。",oEN="Bring 8 Draenei Vessels to Ros'eleth at the Allerian Stronghold.",p="你找到任何完整的容器了吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any intact vessels?",c="我希望这些不是城里仅有的容器。这是个好的开始，但我怀疑我们需要比这些更多的容器。",cEN="I hope these aren't the only intact vessels in the city. This is a good start, but I suspect we'll need many more than this."}
Q[10030]={d="无数德莱尼人在奥金顿大爆炸中不幸罹难，尸骨就散落在白骨荒野。他们不安宁的灵魂仍在世间飘荡。\n\n$C，帮帮我吧，将他们的尸骨带往最终的安息之地！只有这样，他们才能安然长眠。\n\n收集无眠之骨，将它们交给白骨荒野中心奥金顿的疯狂的拉姆杜尔。尽管此人名字古怪，可他懂得如何处理这些尸骨。",dEN="The bones of the dead draenei litter the Bone Wastes from the explosion of Auchindoun. Their spirits are restless, and cannot move on to the next life.\n\n<class>, you must help me to recover their bones and take them to their final resting place! Only then will they be at peace; only then will they know comfort.\n\nGather up the restless bones with care and deliver them to Ramdor the Mad at Auchindoun in the center of the Bone Wastes. Despite his name, he will know how to care for them.",o="收集10根无眠之骨，交给泰罗卡森林白骨荒野正中、奥金顿观察之环西侧的疯子拉姆多尔。|n",oEN="Collect 10 Restless Bones. Deliver them to Ramdor the Mad, just off the western side of the Ring of Observance in Auchindoun, which is in the middle of the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",p="这是什么？你是谁？",pEN="What's this? Who are you?",c="太好了，正好是我需要的……更多的骨头。\n\n<拉姆杜尔叹了口气。>\n\n好吧好吧，我会确认这些属于我们光荣祖先的遗体，而且会有一个体面的葬礼，别担心。\n\n假如你真的想帮助这些往生者的话还有一件事情你可以帮忙。",cEN="Great, just what I needed... more bones.\n\n<Ramdor sighs.>\n\nYes, yes, I will see to it that these remains of our honored ancestors are given a proper burial, have no fear.\n\nThere is something else that you can do if you're truly interested in aiding the dead."}
Q[10031]={d="奥金顿大爆炸使许多德莱尼人的灵魂堕落腐化。如今，他们痛苦地在白骨荒野徘徊着。\n\n$n，求求你，让他们获得安宁吧。消灭奥金顿外的失落的幽魂和破碎的骷髅。\n\n什么？你认为让他们继续在痛苦中挣扎会更好？\n\n完成任务后你就返回难民车队，告诉苏拉文你都做了什么。",dEN="Many spirits of the draenei were corrupted by the explosion of Auchindoun. Now they wander the wastes in torment.\n\n<name>, I beseech you to put them to rest. Destroy the lost spirits and broken skeletons that haunt the Bone Wastes beyond Auchindoun's walls.\n\nWhat? You think leaving them to wander in blind agony would be better?\n\nAfterward, return to Soolaveen at the Refugee Caravan and tell him of that which you have done.",o="消灭10个失落之魂和10具破碎骷髅，然后去泰罗卡森林白骨荒野的难民车队见苏拉文。|n",oEN="Destroy 10 Lost Spirits and 10 Broken Skeletons, and then speak with Soolaveen at the Refugee Caravan in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",p="$n？是什么让你回到我这儿来？你按我的要求把亡者的骨骸交给拉姆多尔了吗？",pEN="<name>? What brings you back to me? Did you deliver the bones of the restless to Ramdor as I requested?",c="你做了必须做的事，没有什么需要原谅的。虽然听说我的一些先祖被腐化、最终沦为可怕的不死生物让我很痛心，但多亏你的行动，他们如今已安息。\n\n谢谢你让他们得到解脱，$n。请收下这份微薄的谢礼，作为我对你和你的无私的敬意。",cEN="You have done that which needed doing and there is nothing to forgive. Though it saddens me to hear that they were corrupted into a horrible undeath, through your actions you have put them to rest.\n\nThank you for setting them free, <name>. You must accept a humble token of my regard for you and your selflessness."}
Q[10033]={d="通缉：白骨荒野的白骨秃鹫。这些携带着瘟疫的白骨秃鹫必须被悉数消灭！\n\n虽然它们的行踪遍布白骨荒野，但多数集中在北边的腐臭山。\n\n完成任务后可以向泰拉·远途领取奖赏。",dEN="A bounty is declared on the bonelashers of the Bone Wastes. As known carriers of the plague, they are to be destroyed forthwith!\n\nWhile they can be found throughout the wastes, they are known to congregate at Carrion Hill in the north.\n\nReport to Taela Everstride afterward to collect your reward.",o="杀死20只白骨秃鹫，然后向泰罗卡森林内奥蕾莉亚要塞的泰拉·远途复命。",oEN="Kill 20 Bonelashers and then report to Taela Everstride at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="我猜你是为了鞭骨者的赏金对吧？",pEN="I suppose you're after the bonelasher bounty too?",c="是的，我相信你杀了所有的白骨秃鹫。很明显地从上尉要你交回的悬赏布告就可以证明。\n\n<泰拉挖苦似的看了你一眼>\n\n我会把你的话记在上面。不知道该怪谁去承揽这个职务的，不过还是谢谢你为联盟出的力。这里有些东西是要给你的补偿。",cEN="Yeah, I'm sure that you killed all of those bonelashers. It's obvious since the captain asked for you to turn in proof on that wanted poster.\n\n<Taela gives you a sarcastic look.>\n\nI'll take your word for it. I'm not certain who I angered to pull this duty, but thanks for your efforts on behalf of the Alliance. Here's a little something for all of your trouble."}
Q[10034]={d="白骨荒野的白骨秃鹫袭击了玛乌格，令他身染疾症。他现在想要杀死所有的白骨秃鹫！\n\n虽然它们的行踪遍布白骨荒野，但多数集中在北边的腐臭山。\n\n完成任务后向玛乌格·锐箭领赏吧。",dEN="The bonelashers of the Bone Wastes bit Mawg and made him sick. Now he wants all of them destroyed!\n\nWhile they can be found throughout the wastes, they are known to congregate at Carrion Hill in the north.\n\nReturn to Mawg Grimshot after you've done the deed and he'll give you a good reward.",o="杀死20只白骨秃鹫，然后向泰罗卡森林裂石堡的玛乌格·锐箭复命。",oEN="Kill 20 Bonelashers and then report to Mawg Grimshot at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="我闻到的味道是你手上的鞭骨者的血吗？",pEN="Is that bonelasher blood on your hands that I smell?",c="你一定杀了很多白骨秃鹫吧！太好了，我恨它们！自从我被它们袭击后，我持续有昏晕的症状。\n\n你能了解这有多尴尬吗？嘿，就把这个当作是你帮我报仇的谢礼吧。",cEN="You must have killed a lot of those bonelashers! Good, I hate them! Ever since I was bit by one of them, I keep having fainting spells.\n\nDo you realize how embarrassing that is? Here, take this as thanks for exacting some revenge for me."}
Q[10035]={d="白骨荒野中有一只非常可怕的生物，只有最无畏的勇者才有胆去猎杀它。\n\n没错，我说的便是白骨秃鹫之王托古斯，它盘踞在位于白骨荒野西部边缘的哈兹鸦巢。\n\n可是鸦人们在那附近扎了一个被称为托古斯克星的大型稻草人，这玩意令托古斯胆怯不已。不过，如果你能将托古斯的配偶特拉克拉的残骸放在稻草人脚下，它必定会不顾一切地飞离鸦巢冲过来。你可以在白骨荒野北边的腐臭山找到特拉克拉。\n\n如果成功杀死了托古斯，记得将一片托古斯的尾羽带回来给我。",dEN="There's a creature in the Bone Wastes so fearsome that only the dauntless dare to stalk him.\n\nI speak of Torgos, king of the bonelashers, who circles over Veil Rhaze on the western edge of the wastes.\n\nToo bad that there's an arakkoan scarecrow there, known as Torgos's Bane, which keeps him at bay. I'd bet if you laid his mate Trachela's carcass at the foot of that scarecrow he'd come down anyway. She can be found at Carrion Hill in the northern wastes.\n\nBring me one of Torgos's tail feathers.",o="利用特拉克拉的残骸引出托古斯，将托古斯交给泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的泰拉·远途。",oEN="Call down Torgos with Trachela's Carcass. Acquire a Tail Feather of Torgos and return it to Taela Everstride at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你拿到羽毛了吗？我是否应该为了你的勇于尝试的勇气而奖赏你呢？",pEN="You have the feather? Am I to reward you for your foolhardy bravery?",c="令我印象深刻，$c。托古斯是我在纳格兰这边所知道最凶猛的生物。\n\n这个嘛，我想这值得从奥蕾莉亚要塞的宝藏中给你某个东西。挑一个吧。",cEN="Color me impressed, <class>. Torgos was one of the toughest creatures I know of this side of Nagrand.\n\nWell, I suppose that's good enough for something from the Allerian Stronghold treasury. Take your pick."}
Q[10036]={d="我想要白骨秃鹫之王托古斯的命！\n\n不久前，我在白骨荒野西部边缘的哈兹鸦巢狩猎时，它突然扑向我。\n\n<玛乌格拍了拍他的眼罩。>\n\n它啄瞎了我的眼睛，那么我就要它的命！将一片托古斯的尾羽带回来给我，我会好好奖赏你的。\n\n鸦巢附近竖着一个被称为托古斯克星的稻草人，这玩意令托古斯胆怯不已。不过，如果能将托古斯的配偶特拉克拉的残骸放在稻草人脚下，它必定会不顾一切地飞离鸦巢。\n\n你可以在白骨荒野北边的腐臭山找到特拉克拉。",dEN="I want Torgos, king of the bonelashers, dead!\n\nNot long ago, while I was out hunting at Veil Rhaze on the western edge of the wastes, he fell upon me.\n\n<Mawg taps his eyepatch.>\n\nHe took my eye, and now I would have his life! Bring me one of his tail feathers as proof and I'll give you a worthy reward.\n\nYou'll need his mate Trachela's carcass though to call him down as he's deathly afraid of the old arakkoan scarecrow known as Torgos's Bane.\n\nFind her at Carrion Hill in the northern wastes.",o="利用特拉克拉的残骸引出托古斯，将托古斯交给泰罗卡森林裂石堡的玛乌格·锐箭。",oEN="Call down Torgos with Trachela's Carcass. Acquire a Tail Feather of Torgos and return it to Mawg Grimshot at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="你杀了它吗？托古斯死了？！\n\n你的证据呢？",pEN="Did you kill him? Is Torgos dead?!\n\nYou have proof?",c="真是太感谢了，$n！你帮我报了仇，而就像我承诺的，你将得到你的奖赏！\n\n从这些当中挑一个并好好的使用它！",cEN="I thank you, <name>! You have exacted my revenge, and as promised you will be rewarded!\n\nTake your pick of one of these and use it well!"}
Q[10037]={d="说到湖泊，东北边的那面湖泊是钓鱼的好地方。我以前常常跟朋友们一起去，但是现在，我妈妈不再让我去那个地方了。\n\n她总是说那里很危险，但是，我只看到一些小蜘蛛出现在湖泊周围啊。或许，或许……说不准这些蜘蛛会对你做些什么吧……\n\n但是，但是呢，我特别爱吃湖里的鳗鱼。如果你恰好也要去湖泊那边的话，能不能帮我带回来一些呢？你放心，这些狂躁不安的鳗鱼一旦被制服，就能轻易地带回来了哦。",dEN="Speaking of lakes, there's a lake with real good fishin' up to the northeast. I used to go up there with my friends, but my mom won't let me go anymore.\n\nShe says it's too dangerous, but I haven't seen anything up there but a few little spiders. Like spiders can do anything to you...\n\nMy favorites were always the eels that live up there. If you're going to be up by the lake, would you think about bringing back some of the eels? They're feisty but once you subdue 'em, you can bring 'em back no problem.",o="为沙塔斯城的塞瑟带回8条新鲜的亮鳞电鳗。",oEN="Bring 8 Pristine Shimmerscale Eels to Seth in Shattrath City.",p="<塞瑟用力拉了拉你的披风。>\n\n你有找到鳗鱼吗？有吗？有吗？",pEN="<Seth tugs on your cloak.>\n\nDid you find the eels? Didja?",c="谢了！我都快想不起上一次有鳗鱼时什么时候了！\n\n我要怎么煮它们呢？",cEN="Thanks! I can't remember the last time I had eel!\n\nHow should I cook 'em?"}
Q[10038]={d="我刚刚收到一份来自格兰戈瓦村的报告，据说一队暗影氏族的成员在那座废弃的村落安营扎寨。\n\n$n，去跟列兵维克斯谈谈，看你能不能帮他查明这帮鬼鬼祟祟的家伙想做什么。出了要塞往西走，绕过裂石堡就是格兰戈瓦村了。列兵维克斯在村子北面的入口。",dEN="A report's just come in from one of our scouts near Grangol'var Village. He says that a shadowy band has moved into the ruins there.\n\n<name>, I want you to speak with Private Weeks and see how you can assist him to figure out what this unknown group is up to. Just head west past Stonebreaker Hold. His last report puts his position near the north entrance to the village.",o="与泰罗卡森林格兰戈瓦村北方入口附近的列兵维克斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Private Weeks near the north entrance to Grangol'var Village in Terokkar Forest.",c="也该有人来协助我了。我在一个星期前就把报告送到奥蕾莉亚要塞了！\n\n真是流程麻烦！",cEN="It's about time someone came out here. I sent that report to the Allerian Stronghold over a week ago!\n\nBureaucracy!"}
Q[10039]={d="我接到消息，我们在格兰戈尔瓦村附近的一名斥候正在监视一伙最近进入该地区的可疑分子。\n\n$n，我要你去和斥候内夫蒂斯谈谈，看看你能怎么帮她查明这些不速之客在搞什么名堂。\n\n从这里往南走，然后转正西，绕过白骨荒野北缘。她最近一次报告的位置在村庄南入口附近。",dEN="I am informed that one of our scouts near Grangol'var Village is currently observing a shadowy band that has recently moved in there.\n\n<name>, I want you to speak with Scout Neftis and see how you can assist her in figuring out what this unknown group is up to.\n\nJust head south out of here, and then due west, skirting the north of the Bone Wastes. Her last report puts her position near the southern entrance to the village.",o="与泰罗卡森林格兰戈瓦村南方入口附近的斥候奈弗蒂丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Scout Neftis near the south entrance to Grangol'var Village in Terokkar Forest.",c="也该有人来协助我了。我在一个星期前就把报告送到裂石堡！\n\n真是流程麻烦！",cEN="It's about time someone came out here. I sent that report to Stonebreaker Hold over a week ago!\n\nBlood elves and their bureaucracy!"}
Q[10040]={d="我不知道他们是什么人，但我知道他们怀有敌意。\n\n我会给你一套伪装，要你进去找三个在我看来相当\"健谈\"的人说话。跟新兵、劳工和顾问谈谈。\n\n但要小心，有几个猎人能看穿你的伪装……他们看起来不好惹！还有，无论如何都不要离开村庄——这伪装很不结实。要是弄丢了，回来找我，我再给你一套。",dEN="I don't know who they are, but I know they're hostile!\n\nI'm going to give you a disguise, and I want you to go in there and speak with three of them that I've observed as being 'chatty'. Talk with the initiate, the laborer, and the advisor.\n\nJust watch out; there're a few hunters in there who'll be able to see through your disguise and they look tough! And whatever you do, don't leave the village -- the disguise is kind of flimsy. If you lose your disguise, come back to me and I'll give you another.",o="在伪装状态下，与阴暗新兵、阴暗劳工和阴暗顾问交谈，然后向泰罗卡森林格兰戈瓦村的列兵维克斯复命。",oEN="While in disguise, speak with the Shadowy Initiate, the Shadowy Laborer and the Shadowy Advisor. Then return to Private Weeks at Grangol'var Village in Terokkar Forest.",p="你跟他们都谈过了吗？他们说了什么？",pEN="You speak with all of them yet? What did they have to say?",c="太好了，你终于回来了！嗯嗯，你发现了什么？他们是谁？",cEN="Good, you finally made it back! Okay, what did you figure out? Who are they?"}
Q[10041]={d="我不知道他们是什么人，但我知道他们怀有敌意。\n\n我会给你一套伪装，要你进去找三个在我看来相当\"健谈\"的人说话。跟新兵、劳工和顾问谈谈。\n\n但要小心，有几个猎人能看穿你的伪装……他们看起来不好惹！还有，无论如何都不要离开村庄——这伪装很不结实。要是弄丢了，回来找我，我再给你一套。",dEN="I don't know who they are, but I know they're hostile!\n\nI'm going to give you a disguise, and I want you to go in there and speak with three of them that I've observed as being 'chatty'. Talk with the initiate, the laborer, and the advisor.\n\nJust watch out; there're a few hunters in there who'll be able to see through your disguise and they look tough! And whatever you do, don't leave the village -- the disguise is kind of flimsy. If you lose your disguise, come back to me and I'll give you another.",o="在伪装状态下，与阴暗新兵、阴暗劳工和阴暗顾问交谈，然后向泰罗卡森林格兰戈瓦村的斥候奈弗蒂丝复命。",oEN="While in disguise, speak with the Shadowy Initiate, the Shadowy Laborer and the Shadowy Advisor. Then return to Scout Neftis at Grangol'var Village in Terokkar Forest.",p="你跟他们都谈过了吗？他们说了什么？",pEN="You speak with all of them yet? What did they have to say?",c="太好了，你终于回来了！嗯嗯，你发现了什么？他们是谁？",cEN="Good, you finally made it back! Okay, what did you figure out? Who are they?"}
Q[10042]={d="什么！这帮家伙是暗影议会的成员？！\n\n$n，你必须返回格兰戈瓦村消灭他们！我要你杀掉他们的暗影主宰，并且尽可能多地干掉阴暗刽子手和阴暗召唤者。\n\n完成任务后向奥蕾莉亚要塞的加维·砂锤中尉复命。\n\n$c，祝你好运！",dEN="What! Those guys are Shadow Council?!\n\n<name>, you have to go back in there and waste them! I want you to take out their leader and as many of their executioners and summoners as you can.\n\nAfter you're done with that, report back to Lieutenant Gravelhammer at the Allerian Stronghold.\n\nGood luck, <class>!",o="杀死10个阴暗刽子手、10个阴暗召唤者和暗影主宰格里弗，然后向泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的加维·砂锤中尉复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Shadowy Executioners, 10 Shadowy Summoners and Shadowmaster Grieve, and then return to Lieutenant Gravelhammer at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="那么，你找到什么呢，$g小伙子:小姑娘？",pEN="Well, what did ye find out, <lad/lass>?",c="这的确是个可怕的讯息！恩，看来似乎我派你去帮忙维克斯是对的。我们最不希望看到的一件事就是暗影议会伫立在我们门前！\n\n$n，我认同你在格兰戈瓦村的努力，以此授予你有权从这些奖励品中挑选一项作为奖赏。",cEN="That's dire news indeed! Well, it would seem I made the right choice in sending you out there to help Weeks. The last thing that we want is the Shadow Council establishing themselves right on our doorstep!\n\n<name>, in recognition of your efforts at Grangol'var Village, I hereby grant you the right to your pick of any of these fine rewards."}
Q[10043]={d="什么！这帮家伙是暗影议会的成员？！\n\n$n，你必须返回格兰戈瓦村消灭他们！我要你杀掉他们的暗影主宰，并且尽可能多地干掉阴暗刽子手和阴暗召唤者。\n\n完成任务后向裂石堡的顾问菲埃拉复命。\n\n$c，祝你好运！",dEN="What! Those guys are Shadow Council?!\n\n<name>, you have to go back in there and waste them! I want you to take out their leader and as many of their executioners and summoners as you can.\n\nAfter you're done with that, report back to Advisor Faila at Stonebreaker Hold.\n\nGood luck, <class>!",o="杀死10个阴暗刽子手、10个阴暗召唤者和暗影主宰格里弗，然后向泰罗卡森林裂石堡的顾问菲埃拉复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Shadowy Executioners, 10 Shadowy Summoners and Shadowmaster Grieve, and then return to Advisor Faila at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="那么，你找到什么呢？",pEN="Well, what did you find out?",c="这真是不幸的消息。当然，派你去帮忙奈弗蒂丝是对的决定。接下来我们面对的的是暗影议会就在我们门口创建据点！\n\n$n，你替你自己赚得了好东西。来吧，挑一个。",cEN="That is unfortunate news! But, of course, I made the right choice in sending you out there to help Neftis. The last thing that we need is the Shadow Council establishing a strong point right on our doorstep!\n\n<name>, you've earned yourself something nice. Go ahead, take your pick."}
Q[10044]={d="盖亚安祖母要我来找你，并替她向你传个口信。是这样的，她想再跟你谈谈。\n\n$n，我先警告你，虽然祖母病重的消息令我意志很消沉，不过你若是惹恼了她，我还是会召集玛格汉氏族的勇士把你给劈了！她在大厅里等你。\n\n<加尔鲁什指着北边的那座大型建筑物。>\n\n耐心地听她的话，她吩咐你的事情一律照办。",dEN="The Greatmother has asked that I seek you out and deliver a message. She wishes to speak with you at once.\n\nMy will has been sapped but make no mistake, <name>, if you anger the Greatmother, I will come down upon you with all the force that I can muster. She is in the main hall.\n\n<Garrosh points at the large building to the north.>\n\nListen to what she has to say and do as she tells you.",o="与盖亚安祖母谈谈，听听她要跟你说什么。|n",oEN="Speak to Greatmother Geyah and listen to what she has to tell you.",p="请坐吧，$g亲爱的:亲爱的;。",pEN="Please, sit down, dear.",c="我们得先开拓你的心智，这样你才能与先祖交流。",cEN="We must first expand your mind so that you may commune with the ancestors."}
Q[10045]={d="$n，卡舒尔宗母想跟你谈谈。但在此之前，你必须先去采集一些特殊的草药，我要为你配制一瓶开拓心智的药水，让你具备与先祖的灵魂沟通的能力。\n\n我需要一根泰罗卡森林的奥雷巴根须、一颗赞加沼泽的沼泽莓、一片纳格兰的塔拉蕨和一株刀锋山的龙脊草草。这张羊皮纸上记载了四种草药的地理位置。集齐草药后回来向我复命。",dEN="Mother Kashur wishes to speak with you, <name>. Before this becomes possible, you must collect the herbs required to create a potion that will expand your mind, allowing you to commune with the spirits.\n\nYou must gather Olemba root from Terokkar, marshberries from Zangarmarsh, Telaari fronds from Nagrand and dragonspine from the Blade's Edge mountains. I have written down instructions on this parchment as to the cultivation of these herbs. Return to me when you have gathered the materials.",o="纳格兰加拉达尔的盖亚安祖母要你带给她1根奥雷巴根须、1颗沼泽莓、1片塔拉蕨和1株龙脊草。|n",oEN="Greatmother Geyah at Garadar in Nagrand has asked that you collect 1 Olemba Root, 1 Marshberry, 1 Telaari Frond and 1 Dragonspine.",p="你好，$g亲爱的:亲爱的;。",pEN="Hello, dear.",c="你非常聪明，$n。我们最厉害的孩子都要花两倍的时间来收集这些药草。\n\n<盖亚安苏母将这些草药混合成药剂，然后将药剂放到你的嘴巴边，示意你喝下去。>\n\n别害怕。",cEN="You are very resourceful, <name>. Our greatest gatherers would have taken twice as long to collect the herbs.<Greatmother Geyah mixes the herbs into a potion and then places the tincture to your lips, forcing you to drink.>Do not be afraid."}
Q[10047]={d="“荣耀之路”，他们如此称呼它。这条路从他们那阴森恐怖的要塞中心一直扩展到黑暗之门，路上铺满了我的同胞的尸骨。\n\n他们像对待动物一样追杀我们，摧毁我们的家园，折磨我们的幸存者。这样做还远远不够，他们甚至把我们的尸骨当做铺路石，不让我的同胞得到圣光的照耀。\n\n那些被折磨的灵魂至今还徘徊在这地方，大声呼喊着要解脱出来。$n，我希望你能帮我完成这件事情。",dEN="The 'Path of Glory,' they called it. A road leading from the heart of their gruesome fortress to the Dark Portal, paved with the bones of my people.\n\nIt wasn't enough for them to hunt us down like animals, destroy our cities, and torture those who survived. No, they had to use our bones as paving stones, denying my brethren a proper burial under the Light.\n\nThose tortured souls still wander these lands, crying out for release. I ask you, <name>, help me in this undertaking.",o="在荣耀之路上使用德莱尼圣水净化8个被践踏的骷髅，然后返回荣耀堡向位面占卜者克雷夫复命。",oEN="Cleanse 8 Trampled Skeletons on the Path of Glory with Draenei Holy Water, then return to Warp-Scryer Kryv at Honor Hold.",p="这哭号声似乎比之前微弱了……愿圣光能给予他们更多庇护。",pEN="The cries seem somehow... fainter than they were before. The Light grant it's more than wishful thinking.",c="对你的努力致上我最真挚的感谢，$n。虽然尚有非常多未完成的事，但知道我们已经帮助他们得到永远的安息还是很高兴。",cEN="You have my sincere thanks for your efforts, <name>. Though much remains to be done, it gladdens me to know we have helped some find their long-deserved rest."}
Q[10048]={d="我需要一些粉尘，但不是普通的粉尘。\n\n附近森林中的华丽的巨蛾翅膀上复盖着一种魔法粉尘，可以让试图捕获它们的生物平静下来。我可以利用这种粉尘来破除鸦人之眼的魔法结界。这样，我们就可以用它们来追踪迪鲁姆的下落。\n\n我不需要太多，几小撮粉尘就行。",dEN="I'm going to need dust, but not just any dust.\n\nThe royal teromoths that inhabit the forest nearby have a magical dust upon their wings, which they use to pacify those that hunt them. I can make use of that property of the dust to assuage the resistance that I am feeling from the arakkoa eyes you retrieved. This, in turn, will allow me to use them to find Deirom.\n\nI won't need much, perhaps half a dozen handfuls, or so.",o="收集7撮安抚粉尘，将它们交给奥蕾莉亚要塞的安达尔。",oEN="Collect 7 handfuls of Pacifying Dust for Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold."}
Q[10049]={d="我需要一些粉尘，但不是普通的粉尘。\n\n附近森林中的华丽的巨蛾翅膀上复盖着一种魔法粉尘，可以让试图捕获它们的生物平静下来。我可以利用这种粉尘来破除鸦人之眼的魔法结界。这样，我们就可以用它们来追踪杜加尔的下落。\n\n我不需要太多，几小撮粉尘就行。",dEN="I'm going to need dust, but not just any dust.\n\nThe royal teromoths that inhabit the forest nearby have a magical dust upon their wings, which they use to pacify those that hunt them. I can make use of that property of the dust to assuage the resistance that I am feeling from the arakkoa eyes you retrieved. This, in turn, will allow me to use them to find Dugar.\n\nI won't need much, perhaps half a dozen handfuls, or so.",o="收集7撮安抚粉尘，将它们交给裂石堡的库加托克。",oEN="Collect 7 handfuls of Pacifying Dust for Kurgatok at Stonebreaker Hold."}
Q[10050]={d="我们入侵接近尾声时，南边的军械库遭到了部落阴险的死亡骑士袭击。那些邪恶的幽影诅咒了军械库的守军，把他们的灵魂困在生者与死者的国度之间。\n\n必须让这些高尚的灵魂得到解脱！我求你了，$n，终结我战友们的折磨吧，因为我自己下不了手杀死他们。",dEN="Near the end of our invasion, the Armory to the south fell under attack by the Horde's insidious Death Knights. Those vile shades cursed the Armory's defenders - and trapped their souls between the realms of the living and the dead.\n\nThose noble souls must be set free! I beg you, <name>, end my comrades' torment, for I have not the heart to slay them myself.",o="荣耀堡卫兵维斯洛要你转至南边的远征军物资库，杀死12个步兵的阴魂、10个巫师的阴魂和5个骑士的阴魂。",oEN="Honor Guard Wesilow wants you to defeat 12 Unyielding Footmen, 10 Unyielding Sorcerers, and 5 Unyielding Knights at the Expedition Armory to the south.",p="我的要求对其它人来说是件恐怖的事。但你得了解的是许多人都不愿意靠近废墟。那些记忆跟伤痛太过鲜明，但我们不能让那些灵魂继续徘徊下去。\n\n他们存在的愈久，就失去更多他们与过去生活的连结，而变的残暴。",pEN="What I asked of you is a terrible thing to request of anyone. But what you must understand is many of the men won't go near the ruins. The memories and the pain are too fresh, but we can't allow the spirits to continue to wander.\n\nThe longer they persist, the more they shed their remaining ties to their past life and give themselves over to malevolence.",c="洛萨之子感谢你的帮忙，虽然很少人愿意提起军械库的事。",cEN="The Sons appreciate your efforts, even if few are willing to speak of the armory."}
Q[10051]={d="谢天谢地你出现了！\n\n$C，我需要你帮我逃出去。我有关乎奥蕾莉亚要塞安危的情报，很可能还关乎整个外域！\n\n我代表塞纳里奥远征队来这里执行外交任务，但你也看到了，他们并不太友好。你要是能帮我脱险，我保证你会得到丰厚的酬谢。",dEN="Thank goodness for you!\n\n<class>, I need you to help me escape. I have information vital to the security of the Allerian Stronghold and probably all of Outland!\n\nI came here from the Cenarion Expedition on a diplomatic mission, but as you can see, they weren't very friendly. If you help me get to safety, I can assure you that you will be handsomely rewarded!\n\nWe won't be able to do this on our own - you do have a group with you, right?",o="护送伊斯拉·星鬃逃离火翼岗哨，然后向泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的乌瑞克·猎日者上尉复命。",oEN="Escort Isla Starmane to safety and then report to Captain Auric Sunchaser at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",c="伊斯拉·星鬃刚离开，不过她给了我一份完整的报告，大概说明在火翼岗哨发生的事。她之所以会这么的烦恼塞纳里奥树林是可以理解的。卑鄙的血精灵！\n\n她告诉我你是如何帮忙保护她的，所以我们才能收到那个资讯。奥蕾莉亚要塞感激你的帮忙。\n\n请接受这份代表我们谢意的礼物。",cEN="Isla Starmane just left, but she gave me a full rundown on what's going on out at Firewing Point. It's understandable that she's quite distraught over what happened to the Cenarion Thicket. Nasty blood elves!\n\nShe told me how you were instrumental in saving her so that we could get that information. Allerian Stronghold is indebted to you for your service.\n\nPlease, accept this gift on behalf of us all."}
Q[10052]={d="谢天谢地你出现了！\n\n$C，我需要你帮我逃出去。我有关乎碎石堡安危的情报，很可能还关乎整个外域！\n\n我代表塞纳里奥远征队来这里执行外交任务，但你也看到了，他们并不太友好。你要是能帮我脱险，我保证你会得到丰厚的酬谢。",dEN="Thank goodness for you!\n\n<class>, I need you to help me escape. I have information vital to the security of Stonebreaker Hold and probably all of Outland!\n\nI came here from the Cenarion Expedition on a diplomatic mission, but as you can see, they weren't very friendly. If you help me get to safety, I can assure you that you will be handsomely rewarded!\n\nWe won't be able to do this on our own - you do have a group with you, right?",o="护送伊斯拉·星鬃逃离火翼岗哨，然后向泰罗卡森林裂石堡的顾问菲埃拉复命。",oEN="Escort Isla Starmane to safety and then report to Advisor Faila at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",c="伊斯拉·星鬃刚离开，不过她给了我一份完整的报告，大概说明在火翼岗哨发生的事。她之所以会这么的烦恼塞纳里奥树林是可以理解的。卑鄙的血精灵！\n\n她告诉我你是如何帮忙保护她的，所以我们才能收到那个资讯。裂石堡感激你的帮忙。\n\n请接受这份代表我们谢意的礼物。",cEN="Isla Starmane just left, but she gave me a full rundown on what's going on out at Firewing Point. It's understandable that she's quite distraught over what happened to the Cenarion Thicket.\n\nShe told me how you were instrumental in saving her so that we could get that information. Stonebreaker Hold is indebted to you for your service.\n\nPlease, accept this gift on behalf of us all."}
Q[10055]={d="增援固然好，可我没见他们拖着装满锭块或木料的货车来。\n\n四处看看吧，$g朋友:朋友;。树木紧缺，矿坑里又塞满了军团的渣滓。\n\n我的补给状况糟透了，能替代的我都替代了，但现在该开始回收一切能用的东西了。\n\n荣耀之路南缘散落着攻城机械的残骸。想不想去干一趟回收的活儿？",dEN="Reinforcements are great, but I don't see 'em haulin' any wagons loaded with ingots or timber.\n\nTake a look around, friend. Trees are in short supply, and the mines are overrun with Legion scum.\n\nI'm in a bad way fer supplies, and I'm makin' what substitutions I can, but it's time to start reusing what we can.\n\nThe southern edge of the Path o' Glory is strewn with the ruins of siege machinery. Some pieces of 'em are still usable. Feeling up to a bit o' a salvage operation?",o="给荣耀堡的达姆菲带去8块回收的金属和8块回收的木材。",oEN="Bring 8 pieces of Salvaged Metal and 8 pieces of Salvaged Wood to Dumphry at Honor Hold.",p="你可以从外面那些尘土、灰烬及焦炭中找些可用物资回来吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any usable materials out there underneath all the dust, ash, and char?",c="状况比我想象的好。当然，要去掉这些铁锈、焦炭及其它相似物需要一点时间，但我不会抱怨的。",cEN="This is in better condition than I thought it'd be. Sure, it's going to take some time to work off all the rust, the char, and the like, but I'll not complain."}
Q[10057]={d="尽管你帮了大忙，远征军物资库那里却仍处于混乱的状态。没有人知道那里到底发生了什么事情，也没人清楚真正是什么样的诅咒将那些已死士兵的鬼魂禁锢在废墟中。\n\n不过，或许我们完全理解错了。我一直以为每一个鬼魂都是被废墟所禁锢的，但也有很大可能是他们的首领在束缚着他们！\n\n大法师辛托尔和塔沃斯少校的鬼魂应该就在其它鬼魂附近，或许击败他们就可以让其它人得到安息。",dEN="The disturbances at Expedition Armory continue, despite your best efforts. No one truly knows everything that happened there, nor exactly what binds the spirits of the fallen soldiers to the ruins.\n\nPerhaps we've been approaching this the wrong way. I've always assumed that each of the ghosts had a tie to the ruins, but what if their ties were to their leaders?\n\nArch Mage Xintor and Lieutenant Commander Thalvos were particularly close to their men, so perhaps overcoming their ghosts will calm the rest.",o="击败大法师辛托尔和塔沃斯少校的鬼魂，然后向荣耀堡西北部哨塔的荣耀堡卫兵维斯洛复命。",oEN="Overcome the ghosts of Arch Mage Xintor and Lieutenant Commander Thalvos and return to Honor Guard Wesilow in the tower northwest of Honor Hold.",p="你有办法打倒废墟里的军官吗？",pEN="Were you able to overcome the officers at the ruins?",c="我们只能希望这些步兵的灵魂会跟随着军官的鬼魂安息。再一次感谢你的帮忙，$n。",cEN="We can only hope that with the quieting of the ghosts of the officers, the spirits of the foot soldiers will follow. Thank you once again for your help, <name>."}
Q[10058]={d="<牧师把目光缓缓地从杯子前转移到了你的身上。>\n\n难道你不知道，千万不要去打扰借酒消愁的人吗？\n\n唉，有什么用？我觉得有陌生人来是件好事，不过，不知道图拉扬会怎么想？\n\n我记得许多年前，我们从艾泽拉斯出发的前夜，我把《圣光的秘密》借给了他。在战争期间和之后的许多年里，他每天都阅读那本书中的内容，激励他身边的人，赐予他们祝福。\n\n然而，当他必须再次离开我们的时候，他把书还给了我。而我，就像个傻子一样，居然以为把它放在物资库南边的营房中会很安全，就一直把它丢在那里了。",dEN="<The priest's gaze slowly moves from his mug to you.>\n\nDon't you know better than to bother a man in his cups?\n\nOh, what's the use? I suppose newcomers are a good sign. What would Turalyon think?\n\nI remember the eve of our departure, when I gave Mysteries of the Light to him. During the campaign and the ensuing years, he never forgot to read his daily passage to the men.\n\nWhen he left us again, he gave the book back to me. Like a fool, I believed it safe in my quarters to the south of the armory.",o="将《圣光的秘密》交给荣耀堡的玛格尔·戴维迪库斯神父。",oEN="Retrieve Mysteries of the Light and return it to Father Malgor Devidicus at Honor Hold.",p="我想我要求过你不要打扰我。这是什么？",pEN="I thought I asked you not to bother me. What is it?",c="这真的是我要的东西吗？真难相信它竟在战争中保存了下来。废墟的状况并不是太好，我很高兴能再得到它。\n\n这是我仅有的图拉扬的遗物了。\n\n<戴维迪库斯神父似乎正强忍着泪水。>\n\n当你长久与某人并肩作战，彼此的感情会变得比家人更加亲近。",cEN="Is that really it? It's hard to believe it survived the battle. Conditions in the ruins haven't been kind to the book, but still, I'm glad to have it.\n\nIt's the only token I have of Turalyon.\n\n<Father Devidicus seems to be fighting back tears.>\n\nWhen you fight beside someone for so many years, they become closer than even family."}
Q[10063]={d="照顾小孩！你能相信吗？\n\n他们许诺我可以从事非常有前途的挖掘工作，结果却把我派到奥德修斯船长手下照顾一个小侏儒！\n\n我从来没听说过有侏儒希望成为一名勘探者。\n\n看上去我得负责照顾一个侏儒，结果他迷上了鱼人！\n\n嗯，他已经到北部海岸的一个古老的龟壳里蹲点去研究鱼人了。如果你不相信的话，到那里去看看好了！",dEN="Babysitting! Would you believe it?\n\nThey pulled me out of a promising dig and sent me along with Captain Odesyus' expedition to babysit that little gnome!\n\nI'd never heard o' a gnome wanting to become a prospector before, so I asked.\n\nSeems we are takin' gnomes now, and this particular one has a fascination with murlocs!\n\nWell, he's gone off and set up shop in an old turtle shell on the northern shore of the island. Go and have a look if you don't believe me!",o="找到在秘血岗哨北海岸的龟壳里扎营的克劳伯·维兹班。",oEN="Find Clopper Wizbang camped in an old turtle shell on the shore north of Blood Watch.",c="我就知道！那个脾气怪诞的老矮人本应帮忙提我的设备及收集资料，但他所做的就是在那个陌生的德莱尼城镇，把自己喝到不省人事。",cEN="I thought so! That grumpy old dwarf was supposed to help me carry my equipment and gather data, but all he does is sit in that strange draenei town, drinking himself into a stupor."}
Q[10064]={d="阿古斯之手在前方创建了一座前哨站，但他们的人数远远少于血精灵和堕落的野兽。没有支持者，他们的前哨站将面临被攻陷的危险，这样我们就没法继续留意矢量感应器周围发生的事件了。\n\n向西北边守备官营地的斥候约莉报告，看看你能帮上什么忙吧，$n。",dEN="The Hand of Argus has established a forward base at Vindicator's Rest, but they are sorely outnumbered by both the blood elves and mutated wildlife. Without backup, their outpost is in danger of falling, and we'd have no way to keep an eye on events near the Vector Coil.\n\nReport to Scout Jorli at Vindicator's Rest to the northwest and offer her your assistance, <name>.",o="向守备官营地的斥候约莉报告。",oEN="Report to Scout Jorli at Vindicator's Rest.",c="我希望秘血岗哨会派遣援军过来，一旦他们了解我们在对抗的是什么的话。",cEN="I was hoping Blood Watch would send reinforcements once they learned what we're up against."}
Q[10065]={d="当我们去侦察炎鹰部队和他们的传送门时，我受了重伤。斥候洛伊帮我止住了流血，并试图找到一条出路将我送回秘血岗哨。\n\n为了能安全地回去，我们不得不放弃任务。\n\n不过一旦离开这个地方，我们就会遭到掠食者袭击。如果你能帮我们干掉一些野蛮的掠食者，我们回去的路途就会更加安全。",dEN="During our mission to reconnoiter the Sunhawks and their portal, I sustained a serious wound. Scout Loryi has managed to staunch the bleeding and she's trying to figure out a way to evacuate me to Blood Watch.\n\nThe problem is that we'd have to abandon our position here in order to guarantee a safe return.\n\nAs soon as we leave this consecrated ground, we'll be set upon by ravagers. If you can clear some of the enraged ravagers, it might allow us to make the trip back safely.",o="杀掉10个被激怒的掠食者，然后向守备官营地的斥候约莉复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Enraged Ravagers and return to Scout Jorli at Vindicator's Rest.",p="你已经准备好去清理一些这的掠食者了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to clear some of the ravagers in the area?",c="情况看起来有所好转了，但我还是在犹豫——是否在这里等着军医的到来比较好。",cEN="It looks a bit better out there, but I still wonder if I wouldn't be better off waiting for a medic here."}
Q[10066]={d="我们不敢丢弃前哨站，也不敢去离守备官营地太远的地方徘徊。靠近矢量感应器的那些变异生物因为水晶泄漏出的能量发生了巨大的变化。\n\n堕落的纠结者似乎获得了某种感知能力，它们学会了制造、安装和隐藏邪恶的陷阱，即便是最小心的士兵也会被它们捕获。\n\n如果我们继续面临这样的处境，那就永远都无法对抗炎鹰部队。杀掉那些纠结者，$n。",dEN="We don't dare abandon our post, or wander too far from Vindicator's Rest, <race>. The mutated creatures closest to the Vector Coil have been changed profoundly by energy leaking from the crystals.\n\nThe mutated tanglers appear to have gained a certain degree of sentience. They've learned to create, set, and conceal vicious traps that can ensnare even the most careful warrior.\n\nWe'll never be able to move against the Sunhawks if we're constantly forced to look underfoot. Attack the problem at its source, <name>.",o="杀掉8只变异的纠结者，然后向守备官营地的守备官考尔琳复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Mutated Tanglers and report to Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest.",p="你已经准备好去清理这些突变的纠缠者了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to clear any of the mutated tanglers?",c="做得好，$n。现在从秘血岗哨派遣援兵会容易多，或在准备与炎鹰部队对抗时不用担心纠结者在干什么了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. It's going to be much easier to get reinforcements from Blood Watch, or launch strikes against the Sunhawks without having to worry about what the tanglers are up to."}
Q[10067]={d="大部分接触到水晶能量的生物都发生了相同的变化：它们的身上出现了奇怪的记号，变得更具攻击性，在它们的身体中都有小的水晶碎片。而北边的污秽的水之魂似乎整个身体都变成了水晶。\n\n我从未见过水晶会造成这样的影响，当我们侦察污淤之池时，它们显得尤其危险。我们必须赶在炎鹰部队将它们作为一种新的能量源之前除掉它们。",dEN="Most of the creatures touched by the crystals' energy have been corrupted in the same ways: strange marks on their flesh, increased aggression, and small crystal shards in their bodies. However, the fouled water spirits north of here appear to be turning entirely to crystal.\n\nI've never seen anything react to the crystals this way before, when we explored the foul pool, they were particularly dangerous. We must get rid of them before the Sunhawks can exploit them as a new source of energy.",o="除掉6个污秽的水之魂，然后向守备官营地的守备官考尔琳复命。",oEN="Kill 6 Fouled Water Spirits and return to Vindicator Corin at Vindicator's Rest.",p="你已经开始着手清理污浊的水精灵了吗？",pEN="Have you begun to clear the fouled water spirits?",c="做得好，$n。不要漏掉任何消灭炎鹰部队补给的机会是很重要的。",cEN="Well done, <name>. It's important not to overlook any opportunity to deny the Sunhawks sustenance."}
Q[10068]={d="有件事得麻烦你跑一趟。\n\n护井者索兰尼亚需要帮助。你的办事能力毋庸置疑，必定能讨得他的欢心。\n\n沿着室内的坡道往上走，他就在外面的平台上。",dEN="And now, I need for you to do something.\n\nWell Watcher Solanian is in need of your services. You would do well to ingratiate yourself with him.\n\nHe awaits you on the exterior platform that the ramp in this chamber leads up to.",o="与逐日岛的太阳之塔上的护井者索兰尼亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",c="啊，好，一位$c。我一直在等你。\n我这儿有几项特别适合你的任务。$g朋友:朋友;\n",cEN="Ah good, a <class>. I've been expecting you.\nThere are a few tasks that I have which you are particularly suited to."}
Q[10069]={d="有件事得麻烦你跑一趟。\n\n护井者索兰尼亚需要帮助。你的办事能力毋庸置疑，必定能讨得他的欢心。\n\n沿着室内的坡道往上走，他就在外面的平台上。",dEN="And now, I need for you to do something.\n\nWell Watcher Solanian is in need of your services. You would do well to ingratiate yourself with him.\n\nHe awaits you on the exterior platform that the ramp in this chamber leads up to.",o="与逐日岛的太阳之塔上的护井者索兰尼亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",c="啊，好，一位$c。我一直在等你。\n我这儿有几项特别适合你的任务。$g朋友:朋友;\n",cEN="Ah good, a <class>. I've been expecting you.\n\nThere are a few tasks that I have to which you are particularly suited to."}
