Q[10072]={d="有件事得麻烦你跑一趟。\n\n护井者索兰尼亚需要帮助。你的办事能力毋庸置疑，必定能讨得他的欢心。\n\n沿着室内的坡道往上走，他就在外面的平台上。",dEN="And now, I need for you to do something.\n\nWell Watcher Solanian is in need of your services. You would do well to ingratiate yourself with him.\n\nHe awaits you on the exterior platform that the ramp in this chamber leads up to.",o="与逐日岛的太阳之塔上的护井者索兰尼亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",c="啊，好，一位$c。我一直在等你。\n我这儿有几项特别适合你的任务。$g朋友:朋友;\n",cEN="Ah good, a <class>. I've been expecting you.\n\nThere are a few tasks that I have to which you are particularly suited to."}
Q[10073]={d="有件事得麻烦你跑一趟。\n\n护井者索兰尼亚需要帮助。你的办事能力毋庸置疑，必定能讨得他的欢心。\n\n沿着室内的坡道往上走，他就在外面的平台上。",dEN="And now, I need for you to do something.\n\nWell Watcher Solanian is in need of your services. You would do well to ingratiate yourself with him.\n\nHe awaits you on the exterior platform that the ramp in this chamber leads up to.",o="与逐日岛的太阳之塔上的护井者索兰尼亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Well Watcher Solanian at the Sunspire on Sunstrider Isle.",p="你掌握腐化了？",pEN="Have you mastered Corruption?",c="啊，好，一位$c。我一直在等你。\n我这儿有几项特别适合你的任务。$g朋友:朋友;\n",cEN="Well done, <name>. You are quickly becoming one of my best students and I look forward to continuing your training in the future."}
Q[10074]={d="这座基地曾是德莱尼人研究纳鲁水晶的主要设施。\n\n我们发现了一批关于\"钻石\"山奥舒古恩水晶的研究笔记，堪称金矿。看来这一带的一切都残留着奥舒古恩水晶的粉末。你在本地区冒险时若发现粉末，就带回来给我，我会以一份谢礼相赠，你可以拿它去向军需官购物。",dEN="This base was the primary draenei research facility for the study of naaru crystals.\n\nWhat we have discovered is a veritable goldmine of research notes about the crystals from the \"diamond\" mountain, Oshu'gun. It would seem that everything in this region carries with it some residual powder of the Oshu'gun crystals. If you find any powder while adventuring in this region, return it to me and I shall reward you with a token of my appreciation which you may use to make purchases from the quartermaster.",o="将10份沃舒古水晶尘样本交给哈兰的主研究员阿米蒂恩。",oEN="Chief Researcher Amereldine at Halaa wants 10 Oshu'gun Crystal Powder Samples.",p="从山上来的结晶粉末充满着这个区域的地心。",pEN="The crystalline powder from the mountain is infused within the earthen core of this region.",c="太棒了，$n。这将会帮助我们与外域中出现的联盟垃圾们对抗。",cEN="Wonderful, <name>. This will help us in our battle against the Alliance filth that have surfaced in the Outland."}
Q[10075]={p="这座基地曾是德莱尼人研究纳鲁水晶的主要设施。\n\n我们发现了一批关于\"钻石\"山奥舒古恩水晶的研究笔记，堪称金矿。看来这一带的一切都残留着奥舒古恩水晶的粉末。你在本地区冒险时若发现水晶粉末，就带回来给我，我会以一份谢礼相赠，你可以拿它去向军需官购物。",pEN="This base was the primary draenei research facility for the study of naaru crystals.\n\nWhat we have discovered is a veritable goldmine of research notes about the crystals from the \"diamond\" mountain, Oshu'gun. It would seem that everything in this region carries with it some residual powder of the Oshu'gun crystals. If you find any powder while adventuring in this region, return it to me and I shall reward you with a token of my appreciation which you may use to make purchases from the quartermaster.",c="我一直都接受水晶粉末的捐献，$n。你每捐献一组发现的样本都将会得到补偿的。",cEN="I am always accepting crystal powder contributions, <name>. You will be compensated for each set of samples that you recover."}
Q[10076]={d="这座基地曾是德莱尼人研究纳鲁水晶的主要设施。\n\n我们发现了一批关于\"钻石\"山奥舒古恩水晶的研究笔记，堪称金矿。看来这一带的一切都残留着奥舒古恩水晶的粉末。你在本地区冒险时若发现粉末，就带回来给我，我会以一份谢礼相赠，你可以拿它去向军需官购物。",dEN="This base was the primary draenei research facility for the study of naaru crystals.\n\nWhat we have discovered is a veritable goldmine of research notes about the crystals from the \"diamond\" mountain, Oshu'gun. It would seem that everything in this region carries with it some residual powder of the Oshu'gun crystals. If you find any powder while adventuring in this region, return it to me and I shall reward you with a token of my appreciation which you may use to make purchases from the quartermaster.",o="将10份沃舒古水晶尘样本交给哈兰的主研究员卡托斯。",oEN="Chief Researcher Kartos at Halaa wants 10 Oshu'gun Crystal Powder Samples.",p="从山上来的结晶粉末充满着这个区域的地心。",pEN="The crystalline powder from the mountain is infused within the earthen core of this region.",c="太棒了，$n。这将会帮助我们与外域中出现的联盟垃圾们对抗。",cEN="Wonderful, <name>. This will help us in our battle against the Horde filth that have surfaced in the Outland."}
Q[10077]={p="这座基地曾是德莱尼人研究纳鲁水晶的主要设施。\n\n我们发现了一批关于\"钻石\"山奥舒古恩水晶的研究笔记，堪称金矿。看来这一带的一切都残留着奥舒古恩水晶的粉末。你在本地区冒险时若发现水晶粉末，就带回来给我，我会以一份谢礼相赠，你可以拿它去向军需官购物。",pEN="This base was the primary draenei research facility for the study of naaru crystals.\n\nWhat we have discovered is a veritable goldmine of research notes about the crystals from the \"diamond\" mountain, Oshu'gun. It would seem that everything in this region carries with it some residual powder of the Oshu'gun crystals. If you find any powder while adventuring in this region, return it to me and I shall reward you with a token of my appreciation which you may use to make purchases from the quartermaster.",c="我一直都接受水晶粉末的捐献，$n。你每捐献一组发现的样本都将会得到补偿的。",cEN="I thank you for your contribution, <name>. Should you find more, you know where to bring them!"}
Q[10078]={d="既然我们的营救计划已经取得了进展，是时候准备进行第二步计划了。\n\n在荣耀之路的另一边，部落仍旧在利用他们古老的掷刀车对付我们。$n，别被它们的年龄蒙骗，这些武器仍然非常危险。我们要继续夺回一切可用的东西，同样我们也不能指望部落会毁掉他们的武器。\n\n带上这个火把，烧毁那些残馀的攻城器械，我必须尽力保证荣耀堡的安全。",dEN="Now that we've gotten our salvage operation off the ground, it's time to begin the second phase of the plan.\n\nAcross the Path of Glory, the Horde still has their old blade throwers trained on us. Don't let their age fool you, <name>, they're still very dangerous. Much as we're working to reclaim what we can, we can't assume the Horde is going to dismantle their weaponry.\n\nTake this torch and burn the remaining siege equipment. I'll take no chances with Honor Hold's safety.",o="使用燃烧的火把烧毁分布在荣耀之路周围的部落掷刀车，然后将燃烧的火把交给荣耀堡的达姆菲。",oEN="Use the Flaming Torch to burn the Horde Blade Throwers overlooking the Path of Glory. Then, bring the Flaming Torch to Dumphry in Honor Hold.",p="你看起来精神很好。烧了部落攻城器械让你回复了活力吗？",pEN="You seem to be in good spirits. Has burning Horde siege machinery put the spring back in your step?",c="就是这股精神！\n\n我很高兴我们终于有了援军，但我不太确定他们对部落的想法。我来的地方，任何用武器指着你的都是敌人而且需要像个敌人一样的解决掉！",cEN="That's the spirit!\n\nI'm glad we finally got some reinforcements, but I'm not so sure about their attitude toward the Horde. Where I come from, anyone with a weapon pointed at you is an enemy and needs to be dealt with like one!"}
Q[10079]={d="那帮该死的甘尔葛小恶魔竟然占领了矿井！\n\n他们不但赶走了我派去的所有工人，还日日夜夜敲打个不停，要把所有的矿石都采光！更糟糕的是，现在达纳斯又开始唠叨个没完！他说如果我不能尽快地解决这件事，他就要拿走我的麦酒！\n\n但是，没有一个矿工愿意帮忙，我的卫兵们也正喝得晕头转向。\n\n$n，我求你了，帮帮我。达纳斯可以夺走我的尊严，但绝不能他拿走我的麦酒！",dEN="The mine's been overrun by a plague of gan'arg misfits!\n\nNot only did they run all my workers out of the tunnels, but they're pounding away in there night and day! To make things worse, now I've got Danath on me back! He says he's going to take away me ale ration if I don't get this taken care of soon!\n\nNone of the miners'll go in there, and the guards are busy drinking themselves silly.\n\nI'm begging you, <name>, help me here. Danath can take me dignity, but he'll never take me ale!",o="杀死12个甘尔葛工兵，然后向工头比格姆斯复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Gan'arg Sappers and return to Foreman Biggums.",p="告诉我震摇已经结束了而我的人能够回去工作了……拜托？",pEN="Tell me the shaking's over and my boys can get back to work... please?",c="以铜须的……铜须的胡子起誓，你做到了！！你真是个英雄，$n！$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="By Bronzebeard's bronze... beard, you've done it! You're a hero, <name>."}
Q[10081]={d="药水生效后，看到什么都别惊慌。那些灵魂一直都在我们周围。这药水能让你的心智理解并最终看见灵魂。你要想与卡舒尔宗母交谈，就必须在药效影响之下。\n\n你会在很远的地方找到她，向西南去，在先祖之地。|n",dEN="Do not be alarmed by what you might see once the effect has taken hold! These spirits are all around us - always. The potion allows your mind to be able to understand and ultimately see the spirits. You will need to be under its influence if you are to speak with Mother Kashur.\n\nYou will find her a great ways to the southwest, at the Ancestral Grounds.",o="盖亚安祖母要你去跟卡舒尔宗母谈一谈。",oEN="Greatmother Geyah wants you to speak with Mother Kashur.",c="你所喝的那瓶药剂并没有真正的效果。你只能看到愿意现身的灵魂。这瓶药剂只是证明你的信念及奉献而已。这是个考验而且你通过了……",cEN="The potion that you drank has no real effect. You can only see a spirit if they allow it. The potion is merely a symbol of your belief and dedication. It was a test and you passed..."}
Q[10082]={d="瞧见那些游荡在先祖之地的灵魂了吗？这儿本是一块祥和安宁的净土。\n\n最近，不知道为什么，原本沉睡在宁静之中的先祖灵魂突然复苏，变得躁动不安起来。我们必须揭开滋扰这片净土的根源，不过，更首要的问题是眼前的混乱。\n\n徘徊在先祖之地的鬼魂并不是兽人先祖的灵魂本身，他们只是先祖意识形态的某种存在方式。消灭那些激动的兽人灵魂，完成任务后回来向我复命。",dEN="Do you see them walking around us? The Ancestral Grounds are normally quiet and undisturbed.\n\nAs of late, the ancestral spirits have risen and are extremely agitated. Something is causing a great disturbance to the spirits. We must discover what that something could be, but first, we must put the immediate threat to rest.\n\nThese ghosts that you see walking about are not truly the ancestors but a representation of their state of being. You must destroy the agitated orc spirits. Do this and return to me.",o="卡舒尔宗母要你让8个躁动的兽人灵魂安息。|n",oEN="Mother Kashur has asked that you put to rest 8 Agitated Orc Spirits.",p="你不需要药剂就可以看到灵魂了，$n。",pEN="You do not need a potion to see spirits, <name>.",c="没有用。他们还是继续出现。一定是有某种更加邪恶的事物暗中进行着。",cEN="It's no use. They continue to rise. There must be something more insidious underway."}
Q[10085]={d="$n，我要你调查几座曾有先祖灵魂出没的村落，看看那里是否还有他们的踪迹。\n\n转至此地以北的日泉岗哨，更北处山脚下的嘲颅废墟，东北方的加拉达尔，以及位于纳格兰和泰罗卡森林交界处的血环废墟，调查这四座村落的情况。\n\n完成任务后回来向我复命。",dEN="I need for you to journey to the villages of the ancestors, <name>. Seek each one out and see if the ancestors remain.\n\nVisit Sunspring Post to the north, visit the Laughing Skull Ruins far to the north against the mountains, visit Garadar to the northeast, and finally, visit the Bleeding Hollow Ruins on the borders of Nagrand and the Terokkar Forest, to the east.\n\nReturn to me once you have observed the ancestors in their homes.",o="纳格兰先祖之地的卡舒尔宗母要你去拜访日泉岗哨、嘲颅废墟、加拉达尔和血环废墟。",oEN="Mother Kashur at the Ancestral Grounds in Nagrand has asked that you Visit Sunspring Post, Visit Laughing Skull Ruins, Visit Garadar and Visit Bleeding Hollow Ruins.",p="像风一样快速的动身吧，$n。",pEN="Move as the wind, <name>.",c="这非常的麻烦。你说这些村落中的先祖都不在吗？他们全都往南方去了？",cEN="This is very troubling. You say that none of the ancestors were at their villages? That they were all moving south?"}
Q[10086]={d="你相信吗？这些兽人居然雇佣我帮他们制造炸药来炸毁要塞。这是我梦想已久的工作！糟糕的是我们的材料已经不够了，不过像我这样聪明的地精知道该怎样去做！\n\n你愿意帮帮我吗？我需要荣耀之路两边的攻城器械周围散落的木材和金属，一定要小心那些红皮肤的兽人！\n\n任务完成后，你会得到丰厚的奖赏！",dEN="Would you believe it? These orcs hired me to help them shore up damaged fortifications and build explosives. What a dream job! It's too bad we're so short on materials, but a clever goblin like myself learns how to make do!\n\nCan you help me? I need salvaged wood and metal from the ruined battlements along the Path of Glory. Go down there and salvage, and watch out for those red-skinned orcs!\n\nWhen you're done, come back for big rewards!",o="给萨尔玛的泽格·纳克布斯带去8块回收的金属和8块回收的木材。",oEN="Bring 8 pieces of Salvaged Metal and 8 pieces of Salvaged Wood to Megzeg Nukklebust in Thrallmar.",p="回收物资的工作进行的如何呢？你有找到可以利用的东西吗？",pEN="So how did the salvage mission go? Did you find anything useful?",c="这些东西简直是太棒了！虽然有点弯曲以及烧过的焦痕，但是我一向都可以把粗糙的材料做成高度精密的爆裂物。\n\n感谢你，$n。你真的具有捡破烂的才能！",cEN="This stuff is great! A little bent and a little burnt, but I've never let low grade materials stop me from making precision high explosives.\n\nThanks, <name>. You really have an eye for quality trash!"}
Q[10087]={d="我是一个非常非常幸运的地精。我要制作的炸弹和工程装备很快就能在重要的任务中派上用场了！\n\n说到任务，我刚收到来自萨尔玛的一条命令：毁掉在荣耀之路附近的联盟火炮……这些设施令部落的要塞时刻处于危险中。带上这只火把，去毁掉你看到的每一座火炮。点燃火把就行啦！",dEN="I'm a lucky, lucky goblin. I get to make explosives and killing machines, knowing they'll be used immediately on important missions!\n\nSpeaking of missions, I just got one from Thrallmar command: burn the Alliance cannons on the far side of the Path of Glory... the ones pointing dangerously close to Horde fortifications. Take this torch and make your way to each cannon. Fire the torch and watch the sparks fly!",o="利用燃烧的火把烧毁东部联盟火炮和西部联盟火炮，然后返回萨尔玛向泽格·纳克布斯复命。",oEN="Use the Flaming Torch to burn the Eastern Alliance Cannon and the Western Alliance Cannon, and then return to Megzeg Nukklebust in Thrallmar.",p="我一直在找火炮被烧毁的明显迹象——燃烧的烟云或者着火的邪兽人的哀号声……\n\n你的任务成功了吗？",pEN="I've been looking for the telltale signs of burning cannons -- smoke plumes, or the cries of burning fel orcs...\n\nAny luck on your mission?",c="我就知道！从这边我不能辨识摧毁的情形，但是我可以想象它的惨状。太棒了！\n\n做得好，$n。萨尔玛指挥官将会很高兴听到你的捷报。",cEN="I thought so! I couldn't quite make out the destruction from here, but I can imagine how it must have looked. Splendid!\n\nWell done, <name>. Thrallmar command will be happy to hear of your success!"}
Q[10091]={d="啊！他们一直在拷问我，想让我吐露所有的秘密。\n\n我屈服了……他们竟然将别的间谍喂给赫尔默吃，还说我就是下一个。但是我没有泄露任何重要的信息！\n\n这帮疯子！他们试图召唤自己根本无力控制的恶魔力量！\n\n他们利用某种特殊的装置制造灵魂碎片，以此强化召唤能力，你必须偷走这些装置！\n\n我原本打算和你一起去的，但我必须先返回沙塔斯城，向贫民窟的间谍女王报告。",dEN="Gah! They've been torturing me, trying to get me to tell them everything that I know.\n\nI failed - they fed the others to Hellmaw, and I was to be next. But I told them nothing!\n\nThey're crazy! They're hell-bent on summoning demonic forces that they have no way of controlling!\n\nThey're using special devices to make their soul shards, and their summoning, more powerful. You must steal these devices!\n\nI would join you, but I must return to Shattrath City to report to the Lower City's spymistress.",o="偷取5个灵魂装置，将它们交给沙塔斯城圣光广场的间谍女王梅丽萨·海克隆。",oEN="Steal 5 Soul Devices and deliver them to Spymistress Mehlisah Highcrown at the Terrace of the Light in Shattrath City.",p="怎么了？有什么我能为你效劳的吗，$n？",pEN="Yes? What can I do for you, <class>?",c="吐刚先前才来这里将他的报告交给我。他应该和你一起留下帮忙的！\n\n我派他出去协助葛瑞克萨了。我想他们会是很适合的一对。\n\n所以，这些就是暗影议会用来提升他们召唤力量的灵魂仪器？它们看起来很危险——或许占星者能好好利用它们？\n\n来，选择一个做为奖励，这是你削弱暗影议会在迷宫的运作应得的。",cEN="To'gun was here earlier giving me his report. He should have stayed with you to help!\n\nI sent him back out there to assist Grik'tha. I think they make a cute couple.\n\nSo, these are the soul devices that the Shadow Council were using to enhance their summoning power? They look dangerous to me"}
Q[10093]={d="幸运的是，荣耀之路不是我的族人们唯一留下过足迹的地方。在西边，虽然有些地方已经被占领，仍有部分圣地幸运地逃过了浩劫，被保留了下来。\n\n维伦大人准备转至艾泽拉斯世界时，一些决定留下来的族人在那些圣地重建了家园。\n\n在地狱火半岛西边的塔哈玛特神殿中，你可以找到由智者阿曼恩所带领的一小支德莱尼人，我敢肯定他一定很想见见你。",dEN="Fortunately, the Path of Glory is not the only trace of my people in these lands. To the west, a few of our holy sites survive, although some have been overrun.\n\nWhile Velen prepared for the journey that would lead him to Azeroth, those of us who would remain behind sought to reestablish a presence at our holy places.\n\nIn the western part of the Hellfire Peninsula, you will find a small group of draenei at the Temple of Telhamat, led by Amaan the Wise. I am certain he'd be interested in meeting you.",o="转至地狱火半岛西部的塔哈玛特神殿，与智者阿曼恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Amaan the Wise at the Temple of Telhamat in western Hellfire Peninsula.",c="啊，原来你已经见过占卜者克里夫了。他是个睿智而有天赋的人，任何他称为朋友的$r也是我的朋友。\n\n请自便，去认识认识其他把这座神庙称为家的人吧。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Ah, so you've met Seer Kryv. He is a wise and gifted man and any <race> he would name a friend is also a friend of mine.\n\nMake yourself comfortable and introduce yourself to the others who call the temple home."}
Q[10094]={d="两年前，暗影议会在奥金顿的召唤仪式导致了这座宏伟陵墓的爆炸，并由此形成了白骨荒野。\n\n如今，在奥金顿里面，暗影议会与某种强大得令人难以置信的势力正在激烈地战斗着。\n\n$n，你必须进入暗影迷宫，探察究竟是什么在与暗影议会交战，看看这场战争是否会对我们构成威胁。间谍们曾提起一本名叫鲜血法典的禁断之书，据说暗影议会用它启动某种邪恶的召唤仪式。\n\n看看书中是否提到什么线索吧。",dEN="It has been two years since the Shadow Council summoning that resulted in the explosion of this once-great mausoleum, and the formation of the Bone Wastes.\n\nNow they are at war with an unbelievably powerful force on the inside.\n\n<name>, you must make your way into the Shadow Labyrinth to determine what they are up against, and to see if it poses a threat to us. Our spies speak of their use of a forbidden book of unholy summoning, known only as the Codex of Blood.\n\nSeek your answers within its pages.",o="阅读奥金顿暗影迷宫中的鲜血法典。",oEN="Read from the Codex of Blood in the Shadow Labyrinth of Auchindoun.",c="打开这本因魔法而悬浮的书册，一股恐惧席卷而来。\n\n一定有什么不对劲！\n\n你持续读着，但你所看到的内容似乎非常惊人！",cEN="Opening the magically suspended tome, a sense of dread overwhelms you.\n\nSomething is most definitely wrong here!\n\nYou read on, but what you read seems unbelievable!"}
Q[10095]={d="暗影议会两年前召唤出的庞然大物已经摆脱了他们的控制！那场召唤仪式导致了奥金顿大爆炸，并由此形成了白骨荒野。\n\n这只名叫摩摩尔的生物想要颠复暗影议会，逃离奥金顿，在我们的世界重获自由！\n\n沃匹尔大师和暗影议会的其它领袖都已经丧命，现在只有你能消灭那只怪物了，你将是外域唯一的希望！\n\n$n，你应该很清楚，你和你的同伴绝不能失败！",dEN="The Shadow Council has lost control of the cosmic being that they summoned here almost two years ago! It is what caused the explosion of Auchindoun, and the creation of the Bone Wastes beyond.\n\nKnown only as Murmur, it threatens to overrun the Shadow Council and break free into the outside world!\n\nWith the grandmaster, and the rest of their leadership dead, you are Outland's last hope against this monstrosity!\n\n<name>, you know at the core of your being that you and your companions dare not fail!",o="杀死摩摩尔，然后返回沙塔斯城的圣光广场，将暗影迷宫的秘密告诉间谍女王梅丽萨·海克隆。",oEN="Destroy Murmur and inform Spymistress Mehlisah Highcrown at the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City of the events that have transpired inside the Shadow Labyrinth.",p="$n，你从暗影迷宫带回了什么消息阿？",pEN="<name>, you bring news from the Shadow Labyrinth? Is the danger there finally dealt with?",c="摩摩尔已经快要获得自由了？！他们已经控制它两年了……我怀疑是什么使他们在这么久的时间后失去对它的控制？\n\n$n，打倒那个怪物你就能拯救我们所有人！我不禁害怕要是那怪物获得自由了，那沙塔斯城及外域其它地方会变成怎样！\n\n我很高兴你帮我们取得了事情的掌控权并对付奥金顿的暗影议会威胁。我们要怎么奖励你呢？",cEN="Murmur almost broke free?! They've had that thing contained in there for two years... I wonder what they did wrong to lose control over it after all this time?\n\n<name>, by putting that beast down you've likely saved all of us! I cringe to think what would have happened to all of us here, and the rest of Outland, if that thing had somehow managed to break free!\n\nI'm glad you helped us to take matters into our own hands and deal with the Shadow Council threat at Auchindoun. How can we ever reward you?"}
Q[10096]={d="伊卡因反复跟我描述他在洞穴中的遭遇，真是恐怖的经历！\n\n或许我们应该帮帮那些可怜的孢子人。伊卡因说他们原本居住蘑菇洞中，最近却被沼泽生物侵占了家园。\n\n转至西南方的蘑菇洞，帮孢子人干掉一些沼泽生物怎么样？",dEN="Ikeyen's been telling me stories about what happened to him down in those caves and I think it's just awful!\n\nYou know, maybe we should do something to help out those poor sporeloks. Ikeyen says that they live there in the Funggor Cavern, but that the marsh beasts have recently invaded.\n\nWhy don't you go down there and see if you can clear some of those marsh beasts out? It's just to the southwest.",o="杀死10个沼泽掘泥者和10个沼泽潜伏者，然后向塞纳里奥庇护所的劳兰娜·萨维尔复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Marsh Dredgers and 10 Marsh Lurkers, and then return to Lauranna Thar'well at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="什么？这么快就回来了？变怎样了？",pEN="What? Back so soon? How did it go?",c="太好了！那些沼泽怪物们没有权利去侵犯孢子人的家！\n\n要是这些生物们能够学着和平共处会更好，不过那是不可能的，所以我们会在这关切情况！\n\n这里，请从中挑选一样做为你提供帮助的酬谢。",cEN="Good! Those marsh beasts have no right to invade the home of the sporeloks!\n\nIt would be better if these creatures would learn to live in harmony, but when that's not possible, we'll be here to take care of the situation!\n\nHere, please take one of these as thanks for your help."}
Q[10097]={d="塞泰克在奥金顿爆炸后便离开了斯克提斯，此事的起因源于我们的主人终将降临的预言。\n\n我的兄弟塞斯是他们的领袖之一，他说我们必须进入神庙遗迹，迎接我们的神。\n\n我们在神庙废墟创建了定居点，并将它命名为塞泰克大厅；但这时，我对塞斯和他的盟友艾吉斯起了疑心。\n\n不久，塞斯就将我逐出塞泰克大厅，但是他拒绝让我带走我的妹妹拉卡。你愿意帮我救出她吗？",dEN="The Sethekk departed Skettis with great fanfare when Auchindoun exploded. Surely it must've been an omen of our master's arrival.\n\nMy brother, Syth, was one of their leaders and told us we were obligated to go into the temple ruins and face our god.\n\nAfter we took up residence in the ruins, calling them the Sethekk Halls, I began to doubt my brother and his ally, Ikiss.\n\nIn time, Syth had me cast out of the Halls, but he refused to let me take our sister Lakka with me. Will you help me rescue her?",o="进入塞泰克大厅，杀死黑暗编织者塞斯，然后解救被囚禁的拉卡。完成任务后向塞泰克大厅外的伊斯法尔复命。",oEN="Kill Darkweaver Syth in the Sethekk halls, then free Lakka from captivity. Return to Isfar outside the Sethekk Halls when you've completed the rescue.",p="你有找到她吗，$n？她还被扣留在大厅里吗？",pEN="Did you find her, <name>? Was she still being held within the halls?",c="我没办法充分表达出我的感谢，$n。知道拉卡已经获得自由表示我能够斩断与塞泰克剩下的关联了。\n\n一部分的我对于希斯的死无法原谅我自己，但却不得不这么做。在我到达斯克提斯后，我会为他举行葬礼。也许他的灵魂会在为将我们人民误导入歧途这件事赎罪后找到安息。",cEN="I can't thank you enough, <name>. Knowing that Lakka is free means I can cut the rest of my ties to the Sethekk.\n\nPart of me will never forgive myself for Syth's death, but it had to be done. When I reach Skettis, I will perform the death rites for him. Perhaps his spirit will find rest once it has atoned for leading our people astray."}
Q[10098]={d="我的族人崇拜一位名叫泰罗克的远古英雄。小鸦人听着他的故事长大，幻想能拥有他那样漂亮的羽毛。\n\n他曾与族人们共同生活达数百年之久，却在某一天突然神秘消失，只留下了他的面具、羽毛和手稿。\n\n鸦人氏族非常珍视这些圣物。当塞泰克从斯克提斯分裂出去时，他们掳走了这几件东西，我们为此心碎不已。\n\n对于塞泰克大厅的情况，我只是略知一二，不过我把它们都写下来了，应该对你有些用处。",dEN="My people honor an ancient hero named Terokk. Arakkoa hatchlings are regaled with stories of his deeds and descriptions of his beautiful plumage.\n\nHe dwelt among my people for hundreds of years, but mysteriously vanished one day, leaving only his mask, spear, and writings behind.\n\nThe relics are cherished by the arakkoa, but they were heartbroken when the Sethekk bore the objects away from Skettis at their departure.\n\nI have written down what little I know about their location within the halls.",o="将泰罗克的面具、泰罗克的羽毛和泰罗克的传说交给塞泰克大厅外的伊斯法尔。",oEN="Bring Terokk's Mask, Terokk's Quill, and the Saga of Terokk to Isfar outside the Sethekk Halls.",p="泰罗克的遗物已经从斯克提斯离开太久了。你能把他们从塞泰克带回来吗？",pEN="The relics of Terokk have been absent from Skettis for too long. Were you able to recover them from the Sethekk?",c="我也许永远都无法原谅自己在这场塞泰克的罪行中所扮演的脚色，但也许通过归还泰罗克的遗物这件事，我可以开始解放我自己。\n\n感谢你在这件事上的帮忙，$n。你不知道今日你所做的事是有多么的重要。",cEN="I may never truly be forgiven for my role in the crimes of the Sethekk, but perhaps by restoring the relics of Terokk to my people, I can begin to redeem myself.\n\nThank you for helping me in this, <name>. You have no idea of the magnitude of what you've done this day."}
Q[10099]={d="那些可恶的甘尔葛仍然在不断地涌入矿井！你刚杀掉一个，马上就会又出现更多！\n\n一定有人在矿井的最深处指挥着这次入侵。上一次的战斗中你表现非常出色，圣光告诉我，恐怕你是唯一一个敢于深入矿井探险的勇士了。拜托你，找出这次入侵事件的指挥者，让他付出应有的代价！",dEN="Those infernal gan'arg keep scurrying into the mine! For each one you kill, two or three more seem to take its place!\n\nThere's got to be someone down there in the deepest reaches of the mine directing the incursion. You seemed to do well against them last time, and Light knows you're the only one brave enough to venture back into the mine. Find out who's responsible for this disturbance and make him pay!",o="进入荣耀堡的地下矿洞，找到并杀死兹克拉，然后向工头比格姆斯复命。",oEN="Locate and kill Z'kral in the mines beneath Honor Hold, then report back to Foreman Biggums.",p="我几乎不敢开口问。看到你活着从矿里出来只可能说明两件事：要么你杀了那混蛋，要么你吓破了胆。那么，是哪一种？$g朋友:朋友;",pEN="I'm almost afraid to ask. Seeing you come out of the mine alive means one of two things: either you killed the bastard, or you lost your nerve. Well, which is it?",c="我很开心你试着去处理这个事，这个……你说他叫他自己什么来着？兹洛卡？\n\n从你的描述中，听起来比较像是“它”而不是“他”，不过无论怎样结果就是它死了。",cEN="I'm glad you managed to take care of, of... what did you say he called himself? Z'kral?\n\nFrom your description, it sounds more like an 'it' than a 'him' but all that matters is it's dead."}
Q[10101]={d="巨大的钻石山——沃舒古，曾是兽人一族的圣地。每年春天，各个氏族都会聚集在沃舒古，欢庆万物的复苏。萨满祭司在那里与先祖的灵魂进行沟通。在黑暗侵袭我们之前，沃舒古一直是我们兽人文化的核心。但是，自从兽人氏族联合起来成为部落之后，沃舒古的先祖灵魂便陷入了沉寂，不再理会我们。\n\n现在，不知是什么惊扰了他们的长眠。转至沃舒古，查明是什么在滋扰那些灵魂。",dEN="Oshu'gun - the diamond mountain - was once sacred to my people. It was there that the clans would gather every year to celebrate the springtime festival. It was there that our shaman communed with the honored ancestors. It was the center of our culture - until the shadows overtook us. When the clans became a horde, the spirits of Oshu'gun fell silent. The ancestors turned their backs on us.\n\nYet something now draws them from their rest. Venture to Oshu'gun and discover what could trouble the spirits so.",o="纳格兰先祖之地的卡舒尔宗母要求你转至沃舒古寻找克乌雷。",oEN="Mother Kashur at the Ancestral Grounds in Nagrand has asked that you seek out the vision you had. Find K'ure in Oshu'gun.",c="<一股温和优美的声音充满你的内心。>\n\n我是纳鲁——克乌雷，$n。你正站在我辈船舰中央。\n\n沃舒古——兽人如此称呼它——是第一艘将德莱尼带来这世界的飞船。虽然我们几百年前从天空坠毁在这儿，我衰弱的能量持续困在这个残骸里。很遗憾，我就是兽人灵魂烦恼的来源。",cEN="<A gentle, melodic voice fills your mind.>\n\nI am K'ure of the naaru, <name>. You stand within the heart of my ancient vessel.\n\nOshu'gun, as the orcs named it, is the ship that first brought the draenei to this world. Though we fell from the heavens and crashed here many hundreds of years ago, my weakened energies have remained trapped within this wreckage. Regrettably, I am the source of the orc spirits' pain."}
Q[10102]={d="数百年来，我体内的能量不断衰减，这导致沃舒古的中心渐渐形成了一处虚空，开始吞噬附近的灵魂。我眼睁睁地看着这么多兽人的灵魂被吸入漩涡却无能为力。最近，我的敌人又利用虚空漩涡召唤出大量恶魔，把它们编入燃烧军团。\n\n只有阿达尔能封印我的虚空漩涡，解放兽人的灵魂。去泰罗卡森林的沙塔斯城找他吧，我感觉得到，他就在那里。",dEN="As my energies bled away over the centuries, a void slowly grew in my place - devouring the souls of those nearby. Helplessly, I watched as generations of orc souls were drawn into the vortex. Recently, my enemies harnessed the vortex and used it to draw countless void minions into their Burning Legion.\n\nNow, the key to ending this cycle and freeing the orc spirits lies with another naaru - A'dal. I have sensed his essence within the ancient city of Shattrath in the Terokkar Forest.",o="与沙塔斯城的阿达尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with A'dal in Shattrath City.",c="克乌雷派你来是明智之举。虽然我们无法协助你和那些受苦的兽人先组，但有一个人可以。\n\n那个人即将随着圣光而重生……",cEN="K'ure was wise to send you here. While we cannot assist you with the suffering of the orc ancestors, there is one that can.\n\nOne that is soon to be reborn of Light..."}
Q[10103]={d="随着战地指挥官洛姆斯和他麾下军队的到达，联盟和他们的德莱尼朋友们现在变得越来越大胆了。他们将这里一直到沙塔斯城的每一个旧德莱尼废墟都占据并武装了起来。\n\n相应的，巨魔们也在赞加沼泽东边的死亡泥潭南侧创建了一处新的前哨站，似乎是叫沼泽鼠岗哨。我很高兴他们居然能适应那里的艰难环境，反正我是无法忍受的。\n\n最近，岗哨的指挥官要我派些多馀的人手过去，你过去看看吧。",dEN="With the arrival of Field Commander Romus and his forces, the Alliance and their draenei friends have grown bold. They're militarizing every old draenei ruin from here to Shattrath.\n\nIn response, the trolls have established a new outpost in the eastern part of Zangarmarsh, just south of the Dead Mire. Swamprat Post, they're calling it. I'm glad they have a sense of humor about living in a place like that, because I wouldn't relish it.\n\nThe post's commander has asked me to send anyone I can spare.",o="转至赞加沼泽的沼泽鼠岗哨，向祖莱报到。",oEN="Report to Zurai at Swamprat Post in Zangarmarsh.",c="说实话，我本以为会有更多增援，但看来只能靠你了。$g欢迎:欢迎;来到沼泽鼠岗哨。",cEN="To be honest, I had expected more, but you'll have to do. Welcome to Swamprat Post."}
Q[10104]={d="来自图雷姆的传闻令人不安。据说疯狂的破碎者和失落者占据了城镇的废墟，猎人们则趁机盗取德莱尼氏族的圣物。\n\n很难确定这消息是真是假，但是我们有责任保卫图雷姆。转至泰罗卡森林的奥蕾莉亚要塞，与安达尔谈谈。他似乎是研究圣物的学者，应该比别人更清楚图雷姆的现状。",dEN="The rumors from Tuurem are unsettling. Some say the town's ruins are overrun with crazed Broken and Lost Ones, while opportunistic artifact hunters steal draenei relics.\n\nIt's hard to know which are true and which aren't, but we have a responsibility to safeguard the ruins as best we can. Find Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest. He is something of a student of magical relics. More than anyone else, he's likely to know what's going on there.",o="与泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的安达尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Andarl at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",c="我很高兴你的破碎者朋友觉得我是他们圣物的专家，但老实说，自从到达这里后我还没有多余的时间去研究它们。那绝对是我的目的，但是在我抵达后，我发现有其它的东西吸引了我的注意力。",cEN="I'm flattered that your Broken friend considers me a scholar of his people's relics, but to be honest, I haven't had much chance to study them since my arrival here. It was certainly my intent, but when I arrived, I found that there were other matters that required my attention."}
Q[10105]={d="沼泽鼠岗哨已经建成，但是我们对赞加沼泽进出道路的控制依然非常薄弱。泰罗克森林也不甚安全。尽管如此，裂石堡的拉克妮亚还是希望获得岗哨建设进展的消息。\n\n$n，她是个精明能干的人，跟她打交道一定要多加小心。拉克妮亚希望利用这些道路运输货物，但是别指望她会考虑到我们的利益。哪儿有钱赚，她就往哪儿钻。",dEN="Now that Swamprat Post is complete, our control of the roads in and out of the marsh is much less tenuous. Our presence in Terokkar Forest is much less secure. Even so, at Stonebreaker Hold, Rakoria awaits word of our progress.\n\nShe's sharp and capable, <name>, but be careful around her. She's got a lot of goods she's eager to move along the roads, but don't assume she's got our best interests at heart. Rakoria goes where she believes there's profit to be found.",o="与泰罗卡森林裂石堡的拉克妮亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Rakoria at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",c="我希望他的人可以尽快将岗哨完成，无论付出什么代价。终于还是完成了。",cEN="I'd hoped his men would have the outpost complete sooner, but it's not costing him money. Still, it's progress."}
Q[10106]={d="地狱火堡垒与我们的军队一直有着小规模的冲突与交战。当前，我们自己的领地大多守备稳固，但一直没能对他们发动真正的进攻。为了筹备进攻，我们要首先占领地狱火堡垒外围的战略要地。\n\n我们的斥候当前确定了三处互成犄角之势的工事，希望你能协助这三处的防守。占领所有工事之后回来向我报告。\n\n愿你能在接下来的战斗中有好运气，$n，毫无疑问，你得面对部落的威胁，他们也同样想占领这三处重要的工事。",dEN="The Hellfire Citadel wages constant battles with our forces. We are holding our own so far, but we can't yet launch a real offensive against them. To do that, we need forward staging areas.\n\nOur scouts identified three fortifications near Hellfire Citadel. We want you to help secure these forts. Capture each fort, and then report back to me.\n\nMay fortune shine upon you in the conflicts ahead, <name>, for you will no doubt clash with Horde forces eager to gain these same fortifications.",o="占领了望台、竞赛场和碎石岭，然后向地狱火半岛上荣耀堡内的委任官翠希·普罗维尔复命。",oEN="Capture the Overlook, the Stadium and Broken Hill, then return to Warrant Officer Tracy Proudwell in Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="$n，等你协助占领每一个堡垒的占领行动后回来找我！",pEN="<name>, return to me when you have aided in the capture of each of the forts!",c="做得好，$n。你这次的行动有助于我们在地狱火半岛的战斗。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Your actions in the field are instrumental in our battle for Hellfire Peninsula."}
Q[10107]={d="根据吉尔拉斯的最新情报，石拳食人魔的首领居然是个兽人！这位兽人长者曾经与我们的父辈一起跨越黑暗之门作战，回来后便一直居住在火刃废墟中。我想派你去寻找这位兽人的下落，并试着说服他召回石拳食人魔。此地东南方，纳格兰与泰罗卡森林交界处便是火刃废墟，他就居住在废墟的上层平台。$n，祝你好运！\n\n当心，他是位剑圣……",dEN="Kilrath sends news of the Boulderfist leader: He is an orc! An ancient orc that passed through the Dark Portal in the time of our fathers and has since returned to his homeland. I wish for you to track down this orc and try to convince him to pull back the Boulderfist ogres. He resides on an upper platform in the Burning Blade Ruins to the southeast near the border of Terokkar. Good luck, <name>!\n\nBe warned, he is a blademaster...",o="加拉达尔的约林·死眼要你转至火刃废墟，找兰特瑞索·火刃谈一谈。",oEN="Jorin Deadeye at Garadar in Nagrand has asked that you find and speak with Lantresor of the Blade in the Burning Blade Ruins.",c="所以你的决定是什么？打一架还是帮我忙？",cEN="So what is your decision? Will it be war or will you lend your assistance?"}
Q[10108]={d="据女猎手的密探汇报，石拳部族的领主是位兽人！这位生活在我们父辈那个年代的兽人长者曾经跨越黑暗之门作战，回来后便一直居住在火刃废墟中。我想派你去寻找这位兽人的下落，并试着说服他召回石拳食人魔。此地东方就是火刃废墟，他就居住在废墟的上层平台。$n，祝你好运！\n\n当心，他是位剑圣……",dEN="The huntress's agents send news of the Boulderfist leader: He is an orc! An ancient orc that passed through the Dark Portal in the time of our fathers and has since returned to his homeland. I wish for you to track down this orc and try to convince him to pull back the Boulderfist ogres. He resides on an upper platform in the Burning Blade Ruins to the east. Good luck, <name>!\n\nBe warned, he is a blademaster...",o="塔拉的击碎者姆摩尔要你去跟火刃废墟的兰特瑞索·火刃谈一谈。",oEN="Mo'mor the Breaker at Telaar in Nagrand has asked that you find and speak with Lantresor of the Blade in the Burning Blade Ruins.",c="所以你的决定是什么？打一架还是帮我忙？",cEN="So what is your decision? Will it be war or will you lend your assistance?"}
Q[10109]={d="瞧见那些鸟蛋了吗？以口臭的加兹鲁维的名义发誓，我一定要搞到这些蛋！唔，你看上去很能打的样子。\n\n$r，如果你能为我收集一样东西，等我调试好超级蹦床4000型，我就送你一把启动这玩意的钥匙！你想知道超级蹦床4000型有什么用处？有了这宝贝，你几乎什么都能做……\n\n我要你从纳格兰的大气元素身上收集气元素实体。别跟我说你找不到气元素，它们遍布整个纳格兰！",dEN="Do you see them?? By Gazlowe's horrific halitosis, I will have those eggs! Say, you look like you might be of some use.\n\nI'll tell you what, <race>; if you gather a few items for me to make my Jump-a-tron 4000 functional, I'll give you a key that will let you operate the machine as well! What can you do with a Jump-a-tron 4000 you say? What can't you do is more like it...\n\nI'll need air elemental gas from the air elementals of Nagrand. They're all over the place so don't ask me where to find 'em!",o="将3份气元素实体交给纳格兰南部氏族岗哨对面的瓦萨特。",oEN="Wazat across from Clan Watch in southern Nagrand wants you to bring him 3 Air Elemental Gases.",p="拿到气体了吗？",pEN="Got gas?",c="太棒了！现在只要些许的调整这个东西就会像新的一样棒了。喔对了，你的钥匙！拿去吧。\n\n顺带一提，这个装置还是有一些技术性问题需要解决。呃，小心一点就是了。",cEN="Excellent! Now just a few adjustments and this thing will be as good as new. Oh yes, your key! Here you go.\n\nBy the way, the Jump-a-tron still has a few kinks that I need to work out. Um, just be careful."}
Q[10110]={d="在我们的故乡肆虐的所有地狱火堡垒邪兽人都必须要消灭干净！但要想攻击地狱火堡垒，我们必须首先占领堡垒外围的几处战略要地。\n\n巡逻队发现有三处工事正好适合我们的目的。但联盟竟与我们不谋而合，现在已经派出部队占领了那里！\n\n我要求你立刻阻止联盟的行动，并占领这些工事。协助我军占领工事之后，立刻回来向我报告。\n\n为了部落！",dEN="The fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel must be scoured from our birthland! To attack them, we must first secure forward staging points near the Citadel.\n\nOur outrunners found three fortifications that will suit this purpose, but the Alliance has the same idea and even now sends forces to take them!\n\nWe want you to stop the Alliance and capture these forts. Aid in the capture of each fort and then return to me.\n\nFor the Horde!",o="占领了望台、竞赛场和碎石岭，然后向地狱火半岛上萨尔玛的传令官布莱肯·黑眼复命。",oEN="Capture the Overlook, the Stadium and Broken Hill, then return to Battlecryer Blackeye in Thrallmar.",p="在你协助占领完每一个堡垒后回来找我吧！",pEN="Return to me after you have helped capture each fort!",c="做得好，$n。我几乎可以听到在那些堡垒战斗的声音。我真希望在那里看见他们！",cEN="Nice work, <name>. I could almost hear the battles waged at those forts. I wish I was there to see them!"}
Q[10111]={d="既然你已经$g入会:入会;，我要你去把那只蛋弄来！用跳跃器试着正中巢穴中心。但要小心！跳不好可能会受伤，甚至造成永久性损伤。",dEN="Now that you've been initiated, I want you to get me that egg! Use the Jump-a-tron and try to hit the nest dead center. But be careful! Bodily injury or serious permanent damage may occur from a bad jump.",o="纳格兰的瓦萨特要你利用超级蹦床4000型从附近树上的鸟巢中偷取神秘的鸟蛋。",oEN="Wazat in Nagrand wants you to use the Jump-a-tron 4000 to get to the nest in the nearby tree and steal the Mysterious Egg.",p="我有跟你说我对蛋的爱恋程度吗？",pEN="Did I mention my love for eggs? Completion",c="嗯，这不是蛋……嘿！我也爱鸡！我只要拿菜刀从它的鸡爪中间切下去就可以了！感谢你！",cEN="Well, it's no egg... Hey! I love chicken too! I'll just chomp right through this ginourmous talon! Thanks!"}
Q[10112]={d="嗯？你说一个箱子？还是好几个？你知道那箱子是用什么材料做的吗？\n\n那个商人叫什么来着？恩普尔？你确定他$g是:是;破碎者？我跟他们那种人打交道不多。\n\n要是你能帮我个忙，也许我的记性就能被唤醒。\n\n斯奇提斯鸦人——一群原始施法者——最近偷走了我一大批珍奇货物的运货。我要把它们全部找回来！\n\n你会在沙塔斯城正南方找到斯奇提斯之幕。",dEN="Hmmm? A box you say? Or was it several? Do you know what material the box was constructed from?\n\nAnd what was the name of this merchant? Empoor? Are you certain that he's one of the Broken? I don't do much business with their kind.\n\nPerhaps my memory would be jogged if you were to do me a favor?\n\nThe Skithian arakkoa - primitive casters that they are - recently stole a huge shipment of my more exotic goods. I want it all back!\n\nYou can find Veil Skith just to the south of Shattrath City.",o="将5箱拉斯莱的货物交给沙塔斯城贫民窟天涯旅店附近的星界商人拉斯莱。",oEN="Retrieve 5 of Lathrai's Stolen Goods. Return them to Wind Trader Lathrai near the World's End Tavern in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",p="嗯，我好像想起来了点什么了。",pEN="Hmm, is my memory improving?",c="是的，没错，我确定现在都想起来了。\n\n而我认为你在这件事上的努力值得比得到你所需要的消息来的更多。",cEN="Yes, indeed, I do believe that it's all getting clearer now.\n\nAnd I think that your diligence in this matter deserves more than just the information that you seek."}
Q[10113]={d="\"出去给我们找点补给\"，他说。我差点死了大概十五次！破碎者也许算不上世界上最热情好客的一群人，但至少他们不会把我的皮肉从骨头上撕下来。\n\n总之，我不回去了。我猎杀大型猎物的日子已经结束了。要是你哪天往东北去赞加沼泽，碰上奈辛瓦里狩猎队，告诉他们\"霰弹枪\"不干了。\n\n嘿，也许你能接替我的位置！祝你好运，陌生人。",dEN="\"Go out and find us some supplies,\" he said. I was nearly killed about 15 times before I found this place! These Broken might not be the most hospitable bunch but at least they're not trying to tear my skin from my bones.\n\nAnyway, I'm not going back. My days of huntin' big game are over. If you end up heading northeast towards Zangarmarsh and run into the Nesingwary Safari, let them know that \"Shotgun\" quit.\n\nHey, maybe you can take my place! Good luck, stranger.",o="\"霰弹枪\"琼斯要你去纳格兰东北郊外的奈辛瓦里狩猎队找赫米特·奈辛瓦里谈谈。",oEN="\"Shotgun\" Jones wants you to speak with Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Safari on the outskirts of northeast Nagrand.",c="我想我们得找一个替换的助理。喂，你看起来挺有力的$c。有没有兴趣找个工作啊？或者你是来打猎的？",cEN="I suppose we'll have to find a replacement water boy. Say, you look like a powerful <class>. Interested in a job? Or did you come for the hunt?"}
Q[10114]={d="这些兽人从没见过牛头人，你信吗？要不是克罗根队长，他们这会儿多半已经把我下锅了。\n\n哎呀，我太失礼了：我是奥尔霍恩·远行者，神眼猎人！我是奈辛瓦里远征队的一员，我们从艾泽拉斯来这里猎杀大型猎物。你要是对狩猎感兴趣，不妨去见见我的同伴；他们就在奈辛瓦里狩猎队，此地以东靠近赞加沼泽边界。|n",dEN="These orcs have never seen a tauren before - if you can believe such a thing. If it weren't for Captain Kroghan, they would have probably been serving me for their next meal right about now.\n\nBut where are my manners? I am Ohlorn Farstrider, hunter extraordinaire! I am part of the Nesingwary expedition that came up here from Azeroth in search of big game. If you are interested in the hunt, perhaps you should visit my crew at the Nesingwary Safari, due east of here near the border of Zangarmarsh.",o="欧洛恩·远行者要你转至纳格兰的奈辛瓦里狩猎队营地，跟“好儿子”沙度·远行者谈一谈。",oEN="Ohlorn Farstrider wants you to speak with Shado 'Fitz' Farstrider at the Nesingwary Safari in Nagrand.",c="听到他还安好的消息让我松了口气。你想参加狩猎吗？",cEN="I am relieved to hear that he is safe. Have you come to join the hunt?"}
Q[10115]={d="库雷尼人和德莱尼人常常会出现意见分歧，尤其是在对待失落者的问题上。我们乐意去帮助那些向我们求助的失落者，但不会主动伸出援手。德莱尼人则想要使所有的失落者得到“救赎”。\n\n但是，某些失落者部族已经偏离了正道，例如匕潭失落者。此地西边就是他们的村落，匕潭失落者滥用毒药、善于欺诈，他们的恶行已经到了难以容忍的地步。\n\n我们必须好好教训这帮渣滓，不能任由他们胡作非为。",dEN="The Kurenai and the draenei don't always see eye to eye, particularly on the issue of the Lost Ones. We are content to help the Lost Ones who seek us out, but we won't pursue them. Some draenei are intent on 'redeeming' them all.\n\nHowever, there are times when even the Lost Ones go too far, such as the Daggerfen. In their village to the west, they dabble in poisons and deceit, arts that come unnaturally to us.\n\nWe must put an end to this before the vile Daggerfen can extend their influence.",o="杀死3个匕潭刺客和15个匕潭泥居者。",oEN="Slay 3 Daggerfen Assassins and 15 Daggerfen Muckdwellers.",p="你有看到这些匕潭失落者做了什么吗？现在你了解为什么我们必须将他们与其它破碎者隔离了吧。",pEN="Have you seen what the Daggerfen have done? Now you understand why we must isolate them from the other Lost Ones.",c="你做的很好，$n。匕潭失落者远在任何的正常规范之外，不过我不确定德莱尼会在这状况中适当的采取行动。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. The Daggerfen are beyond redemption by anyone's standards, but I'm not certain that the draenei would've acted with the proper speed in this situation."}
Q[10116]={d="通缉：穆玛基酋长！邪恶堕落的匕潭部族首领因对奥雷柏尔营地犯下的罪行而被通缉。\n\n穆玛基和他的同党必须为数起谋杀库雷尼和德莱尼的行径付出代价。只有经验丰富的勇士才能击败他。\n\n旅行者应该尽量避免在奥雷柏尔营地西边的匕潭村区域行走。\n\n领取奖赏者必须向伊库提出示足以证明自己杀掉穆玛基酋长的证据。",dEN="Wanted: Chieftain Mummaki - leader of the foul and degenerate Lost One tribe of the Daggerfen, for his brutal attacks against the Orebor Harborage.\n\nThe chieftain and his band of assassins are responsible for the deaths of numerous Kurenai and draenei and should only be approached by seasoned combatants.\n\nTravelers are advised to avoid the Daggerfen Village area to the west of the Orebor Harborage.\n\nTo claim the bounty, present proof of the chietain's demise to Ikuti.",o="将穆玛基酋长的图腾交给奥雷柏尔营地的伊库提。",oEN="Bring Chieftain Mummaki's Totem to Ikuti at the Orebor Harborage.",p="你得到穆玛基酋长的图腾了吗？",pEN="So you wish to claim the bounty on Chieftain Mummaki?",c="太棒了！有许多人想要领取这份奖赏，但都没有回来过。不难了解他们发生了什么事。\n\n我很放心我们不用再被穆玛基及他的堕落所困扰了。",cEN="Remarkable! There have been others who tried to claim the bounty, but they never returned. It's not hard to figure out what happened to them.\n\nI'm relieved that we'll no longer be troubled by Mummaki and his degenerates."}
Q[10117]={d="通缉：穆玛基酋长！邪恶堕落的匕潭部族首领因对萨布拉金犯下的罪行而被通缉。\n\n穆玛基和他的同党必须为数起谋杀信使和斥候的行径付出代价。只有经验丰富的勇士才能击败他。\n\n旅行者应该尽量避免在萨布拉金西北边的匕潭村区域行走。\n\n领取奖赏者必须向暗影猎手德恩加出示足以证明自己杀掉穆玛基酋长的证据。",dEN="Wanted: Chieftain Mummaki - leader of the foul and degenerate Lost One tribe of the Daggerfen, for his brutal attacks against Zabra'jin and its inhabitants.\n\nThe chieftain and his band of assassins are responsible for the deaths of numerous scouts and messengers and should only be approached by seasoned combatants.\n\nTravelers are advised to avoid the Daggerfen Village area to the northwest of Zabra'jin.\n\nTo claim the bounty, present proof of the chietain's demise to Shadow Hunter Denjai.",o="将穆玛基酋长的图腾交给暗影猎手德恩加。",oEN="Bring Chieftain Mummaki's Totem to Shadow Hunter Denjai.",p="你得到穆玛基酋长的图腾了吗？",pEN="So you wish to claim the bounty on Chieftain Mummaki?",c="你拥有我的感激，$n。我都已经开始打算我必须自己带领大批的军力去那里解决掉穆玛基。当然，就没有办法知道之后萨布拉金会发生什么事了。",cEN="You have my thanks, <name>. I was beginning to think that I was going to have to take a substantial part of the garrison up there and deal with Mummaki myself. Of course, there's no telling what might have happened to Zabra'jin then."}
Q[10118]={d="在赞加沼泽的所有失落者部族中，匕潭失落者以狡猾和侵略性着称。他们的组织性极强，从不掩饰想控制沼泽地中其它失落者的野心。\n\n死在他们手中的斥候和信使已经不计其数，我再也经不起任何人员伤亡了。\n\n如果我们不赶快采取行动的话，他们就会完全控制萨布拉金附近的所有通道。",dEN="Of all the Lost One tribes in Zangarmarsh, the Daggerfen are the most cunning and most aggressive. They are highly organized and make no secret of the fact that they desire control over the other Lost Ones in the marsh.\n\nTheir attacks have already taken quite a toll on my scouts and messengers. I cannot afford to lose any more men.\n\nIf we don't act soon, they'll have complete control over the roads and Zabra'jin will effectively be surrounded.",o="杀死3个匕潭刺客和15个匕潭泥居者，然后返回萨布拉金向暗影猎手德恩加复命。",oEN="Slay 3 Daggerfen Assassins and 15 Daggerfen Muckdwellers and return to Shadow Hunter Denjai at Zabra'jin.",p="匕潭失落者唯一了解的事就是快速又残暴的攻击。他们应该知道我们不会让他们任意妄为。",pEN="The only thing the Daggerfen understand is swift and brutal action. They should know that we will not let them have their way.",c="我认为你可以试着传送一则相当强烈的讯息给他们。也许现在，剩下的其它人就不会如此害怕与匕潭失落者对战。或者，要是他们会怕，他们会因缺乏勇气而觉得羞耻。",cEN="I think you've managed to send a fairly strong message to them. Perhaps now, the rest of my men won't be so afraid to take the fight to the Daggerfen. Or, if they are, they'll find themselves ashamed by their lack of bravery."}
Q[10119]={d="20年来，黑暗之门一直是一座无声的纪念碑，对一段早已被忘却的历史的纪念。\n\n<雷索恩环视四周。>\n\n我从未想到过自己会看到这一天的到来，但是我们就站在这里，望向无底的深渊。\n\n我们的军队在黑暗之门的另一侧陷入混战，如果得不到支持的话，我们很可能会输掉这场残酷的战争。$c，你必须跨越黑暗之门，伸出援手。\n\n立即向指挥官杜隆报到吧。他就在外域等着你……",dEN="For 20 years the Dark Portal has remained a silent monument - a eulogy to a time long since forgotten.\n\n<Relthorn looks around.>\n\nI never thought to see this day, yet here we stand, looking into the abyss.\n\nOn the other side of this gate we are locked in a savage war - a war that we cannot win without support. You must go through the Dark Portal and help our troops, <class>.\n\nReport to Commander Duron at once. He awaits you in Outland...",o="穿过黑暗之门，找到杜隆指挥官。他在另一边的外域等候你。|n",oEN="Travel through the Dark Portal and find Commander Duron. He awaits your arrival on the other side - in the Outland.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到外域，$n——$g欢迎:欢迎;来到这场噩梦！虽然先头远征军毫发无伤地通过了，但军团正试图夺回黑暗之门，阻止我们的增援到来。\n\n我虽然很想让你留在这里帮忙，但我们的部队和部落士兵足以击退那些企图夺取这座平台的军团小队。\n\n我们需要你去最能发挥你才能的地方。",cEN="Welcome to Outland, <name> -- welcome to the nightmare! Though the initial Expeditionary Force made it through unscathed, the Legion is attempting to retake the Dark Portal and prevent any of our reinforcements from coming though.\n\nAs much as I'd like your aid here, our troops and the Horde soldiers are able to fend off the Legion platoons that are attempting to take control of this platform.\n\nWe need you where your talents can best be utilized."}
Q[10120]={d="我手下的部队当前在联盟的帮助下正坚守着这里的防线，不过，我需要你帮助我送一份报告到萨尔玛去，递交给克拉库克将军。有了他的帮助，我们就可以把这些恶魔一扫而空，彻底赶回他们的深渊老家去！跟后面平台上的维拉加·乱羽谈谈吧。她会送你尽快过去的。",dEN="Aided by the Alliance, my forces will hold the line here, but I need you to deliver my report to General Krakork in Thrallmar. With his help, we'll be able to drive these demons back into the abyss that spawned them! Speak to Vlagga Freyfeather who stands on the platform behind us. She'll speed you on your way.",o="地狱火半岛上黑暗之门旁的沃雷恩中将要求你将沃雷恩的报告交给维拉加·乱羽。",oEN="Lieutenant General Orion at the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring Orion's Report to Vlagga Freyfeather.",p="我看到你在跟沃雷恩谈话——一定是很重要的事吧……",pEN="I saw you speaking with Orion - it must be important business...",c="那么你就是奥里昂新派来的信使？我祈祷你比上一个运气好，$c。军团步步紧逼，你步行根本到不了萨尔玛。只要你一句话，我忠实的双足飞龙就会安全地把你送到那里。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="So you're Orion's new messenger? I pray you fare better than the last one he sent, <class>. With the Legion pressing in, you'd never make it to Thrallmar on foot. Say the word, and my faithful wyvern will deliver you there safely."}
Q[10121]={d="这里到处都是新的敌人，但燃烧军团仍旧是我们远征军最大的威胁。我最信赖的一位军官——斯古尔·碎颅者中士最近一直在研究燃烧军团的战术，也试图了解他们来到这里的真正目的。去南墙外的补给车队那里找他吧。\n\n$n，一定要小心燃烧军团。千万别低估了这群阴险狡诈的东西。",dEN="Though this land is full of strange new enemies, the Burning Legion is still the greatest threat to our Expedition. One of my most trusted warriors, Sergeant Shatterskull, has been studying the Legion's tactics - trying to discern the demons' true purpose in this land. Seek him out at the supply caravan just outside the southern wall.\n\nAnd <name> - be wary of the Legion. Their evil cannot be underestimated.",o="转至萨尔玛以东的补给车队，与斯古尔·碎颅者中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sergeant Shatterskull at the Supply Caravan just outside of Thrallmar, to the east.",c="毫无疑问的在你从黑暗之门来的飞行途中可以看到岛上遍布着军团的士兵。虽然我们在约五年前的海加尔山战役中击败了他们，这些邪恶的恶魔还是不停的回来。如果这是他们所渴望的挑战，那么部落也会相同的回应他们！\n\n我们兽人有许多消灭军团的理由。你呢，$n？我该不该告诉你有关我们敌人的事呢？",cEN="No doubt you saw the Legion's warriors dotting the landscape on your flight from the Dark Portal. Though we defeated them at the Battle of Mount Hyjal some five years past, the cursed demons just keep coming back for more. If it's a challenge they crave, then the Horde will answer in kind!\n\nWe orcs have more than just a score to settle with the Legion. What about you, <name>? Shall I tell you of our enemy?"}
Q[10123]={d="末日领主卡扎克是外域一带燃烧军团的最高指挥官。虽然我们现在还没有办法直接去挑战卡扎克，但我们可以先斩除他的左臂右膀——那些燃烧军团的高级军官。\n\n当前，有一队恐惧魔王驻扎在东边的魔火峡谷，他们负责指挥和制造那些在我们头顶上飞来飞去的地狱火。去干掉他们和他们的手下，燃烧军团会因此受到重创。",dEN="Doom Lord Kazzak commands the Burning Legion in Outland. While we can't get to Kazzak - yet - we can and must get to his lieutenants that command Legion troops from the ground.\n\nThey have stationed dreadlords in Felspark Ravine, east of here. They are responsible for these infernal storms that rain down upon our heads. To take them and their minions out would be a great set back to the Burning Legion.",o="萨尔玛东侧补给车队的斯古尔·碎颅者中士要求你杀死4个唤火小鬼、6个地狱火战争使者和1个恐惧召唤者。",oEN="Sergeant Shatterskull at the Supply Caravan east of Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to kill 4 Flamewaker Imps, 6 Infernal Warbringers and 1 Dreadcaller.",p="只要奥术师和他的血法师们坚持在前线，萨尔玛就安全了。",pEN="Thrallmar is safe so long as the arcanist and his bloodmages remain at the front.",c="表现的太好了，士兵。攻击的频率一定会减低——至少在他们招来更多的恐惧领主前。\n\n现在有个坏消息：我收到了有关你的最新命令……",cEN="Outstanding work, soldier. The frequency of the attacks is sure to lessen - at least until they bring forth more dreadlords.\n\nNow for the bad news: I've got your new orders..."}
Q[10124]={d="最高统帅部已经注意到了你最近在战斗中的英勇表现，$c。他们想派你去前线与大督军霍恩·重拳阁下领导着的分队会合。那支分队作战非常积极，决心彻底消灭燃烧军团，所以你应该很容易就可以融入那里……\n\n往东边走前进两百步，然后在路的分叉口转向南边继续前进。不久之后，你就会在路边看到机甲残骸，那里曾经是一座老农场。到达那里之后，你要向前线指挥官托尔克报告。\n\n现在就出发吧！",dEN="Your battle prowess has been noted by high command, <class>. They want to send you to the front lines to meet up with Maimfist's crew. They're radicals, devoted to the complete extermination of the Burning Legion, so you may fit right in...\n\nHead east about 200 paces and veer south at the jutting mass of land. You'll see Reaver's Fall where an old farm used to stand. Once there, you are to report to Foward Commander To'arch.\n\nNow move out!",o="转至机甲残骸，向前线指挥官托尔克报到。",oEN="Report to Forward Commander To'arch at Reaver's Fall.",c="所以你是那个负责解决掉地狱火的人，是吗？真是个好消息——我们需要像你这种能够解决这些恶魔的士兵！",cEN="So you're the one responsible for clearing out Felspark, eh? That's good to hear - we need soldiers like you who can take these fiends head on!"}
Q[10129]={d="我们已经找到了燃烧军团当前所使用的两条运输增援军的主要线路：穆尔凯斯和沙德拉兹之门。\n\n如果你沿着荣耀之路一直向西走，就可以在路边看见它们了。而我要你做的，就是把它们都给我炸上天！\n\n这是你要用的炸弹，是我请52区的一个地精技师特别设计的。现在，去和空军指挥官布拉克谈一谈，他会给你配置一只双足飞龙的。",dEN="We've identified the two main transporters that the Burning Legion are using to bring in reinforcements: Gateway Murketh and Gateway Shaadraz.\n\nIf you look east up the Path of Glory, you'll see them on either side of the road. I want you to bomb them both into oblivion!\n\nHere are the bombs you'll use, specially designed by a goblin in Area 52. Now, speak with Wing Commander Brack -- he'll put you on a wyvern.",o="与空军指挥官布拉克谈谈，轰炸穆尔凯斯之门和沙德拉兹之门，然后向机甲残骸处的前线指挥官托尔克复命。",oEN="Speak with Wing Commander Brack, bomb Gateway Murketh and Gateway Shaadraz and then return to Forward Commander To'arch at Reaver's Fall.",p="假如你在第一次操作的时候失败了，这里是第二个炸弹……",pEN="If you missed during your first pass, take another...",c="他们需要数周的时间才能恢复！了不起的工作，$n。燃烧军团从未预期过如此严重的反击。",cEN="That will set them back weeks! Fantastic work, <name>. The Legion never expected such heavy resistance."}
Q[10132]={d="你看见北边那块巨大的红色水晶了吗？那是不久前从空中掉下来的，还引起了这周围的大规模地震。\n\n后来，我们过去调查它的时候，发现有许多以前从未见过的巨人徘徊在四周。\n\n这块水晶一定有古怪，它散发出的能量也非常奇异。但是，我没有时间去处理这件事情，我必须时刻提防着那些山丘巨人。\n\n如果可能的话，我希望你能带上你的朋友们，一起去坠星山帮我解决掉那些山丘巨人。",dEN="You see that huge red crystal to the north? It fell from the sky not long ago, causing a massive earthquake.\n\nWhen we came out here to investigate the disturbance, we found all of these colossi wandering about that weren't previously here.\n\nThere's definitely something strange about that crystal and the energies that it's emanating, but I don't have time for that. Those mountain giants are my immediate concern.\n\nI want you to head up to Fallen Sky Ridge with some friends and deal with them.",o="杀死5个暴怒的巨人，然后返回地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，向图拉希恩复命。",oEN="Slay 5 Raging Colossi and then return to Tola'thion at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你已经消灭了这个巨大的威胁了吗？",pEN="You have eliminated the colossal menace?",c="做得好。\n\n假如你问我，所有我们必须做的是杀死足够的那些巨人，然后我们就不必再担心那片山脊或位在山脊中间的那颗奇怪水晶。\n\n来，从这些物品之中选取一个作为塞纳里奥远征队送给你的礼物。",cEN="Good work.\n\nIf you ask me, all that we have to do is kill enough of those colossi, and then we won't have to worry any longer about the ridge or that strange crystal in the middle of it.\n\nHere, take one of these as a gift from the Cenarion Expedition."}
Q[10134]={d="当这个巨人在你面前缓缓倒下时，突然一小块水晶碎片从它身上掉了下来。\n\n尽管这块碎片映衬在山丘巨人那庞大身躯旁是那么的渺小，但你还注意到了它。拾起它之后，你感到它非常的沉重。似乎它是从坠星山那块巨大的水晶上的散落下来的碎片。\n\n这显然是一个线索，能使大家了解清楚这里为什么会发生那么多奇怪的事。你认为南边塞纳里奥哨站的德鲁伊一定会想研究研究这块碎片。",dEN="As the colossus falls under the weight of your attacks, you notice for the first time that it was holding a red crystal fragment.\n\nWhile it was small and unnoticeable in the mountain giant's hand, it's a fairly hefty piece for you to carry around. It also suspiciously looks like it's a piece of the giant crystal in the middle of the ridge.\n\nIt's most definitely a clue as to the strangeness that is occurring here, and you're sure that the druids at the Cenarion Post to the south will want to see it.",o="将火红水晶碎片交给地狱火半岛塞纳里奥哨站的图拉希恩。",oEN="Deliver the Crimson Crystal Shard to Tola'thion at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你手中的水晶还真大。那是你到坠星山那边杀死巨人时得到的吗？\n\n让我看看。",pEN="That's a big crystal you have there. Did you get that while you were up at the ridge killing colossi?\n\nLet me take a look at it.",c="嗯。对我来说，看起来就像是一大块尚未提炼的水晶。\n\n我能清楚的感觉到它散发出一股令人厌恶、邪恶的气息，但那究竟不在我职责的范围内。我到这里是来结束巨人的威胁的。",cEN="Hmph. Just looks like a big lump of unrefined crystal to me.\n\nAdmittedly, I can feel a sickly, evil aura emanating off of it, but that's not exactly in my line of work. I'm just here to put an end to the mountain giant menace."}
Q[10136]={d="魔导师文森特·血鹰破译了你之前找到的燃烧军团信件。看来这份计划书是卡扎克麾下的军官阿拉修斯所拟。很明显阿拉修斯统领着燃烧军团部署在地狱火半岛的陆军。是时候解决这个麻烦了，$n。用武力去结束这一切。\n\n到西边的阿苟纳之池去，干掉这个所谓的“燃烧军团领主”。今天，部落将要夺回地狱火半岛，让燃烧军团见鬼去吧！",dEN="Magister Bloodhawk finally deciphered the Legion missive you found earlier. It turned out to be attack plans sent by one of Highlord Kazzak's lieutenants - Arazzius the Cruel. Apparently, Arazzius commands the Legion ground forces in Hellfire. The time has come to terminate his command, <name>. Terminate with extreme prejudice.\n\nHead west to the Pools of Aggonar and put an end to this so-called 'Legion lord'. Today, the Horde reclaims Hellfire Peninsula. Let the Legion be damned.",o="除掉残酷的阿拉修斯，然后返回萨尔玛向纳兹格雷尔复命。",oEN="Kill Arazzius the Cruel, then return to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",p="命运来的时候谁都挡不住，$n。残忍的阿拉修斯已经苟活得够久了。把他的死讯告诉那些胆敢反抗部落之人。这也是你存在的意义。",pEN="Destiny calls, <name>. Arazzius the Cruel has eluded justice long enough. Let his death be a message to all those who would oppose the Horde. You are next.",c="将来部落的后代们，会流传歌颂今日发生的壮举，$n——关于你英勇事迹的歌曲。我希望萨尔可以在这边跟我们一起庆祝。燃烧军团已经玩完了——而地狱火半岛如今再次回到我们部落的手中啦！这个充满破坏与蹂躏的世界看起来还是存有希望——而我们部落在其中还可以拥有一席之地。\n\n为了部落！",cEN="For generations to come, they will sing songs of this day, <name> - songs of your valor. I wish Thrall had been here to celebrate this victory with us. The Legion is undone - and Hellfire now belongs to the Horde once again! There may yet be hope for this ravaged world - and our peoples' place within it.\n\nLok'tar ogar!"}
Q[10140]={d="等你$g准备好:准备好;了，我会安排你直飞荣耀堡。\n\n到了那里，去找伊斯多尔元帅，把杜隆的报告交给他。见到又一位来自故乡的新兵他会很高兴，而且我相信那份报告里的内容一定很重要！",dEN="When you're ready, I'll arrange a flight straight to Honor Hold.\n\nFrom there, speak with Marshal Isildor and give him Duron's report. He'll be happy to see another recruit from the homelands, and I'm sure the information in that report is important stuff!",o="乘座狮鹫转至荣耀堡，将杜隆的报告交给伊斯多尔元帅。",oEN="Take a flight to Honor Hold and deliver Duron's Report to Marshal Isildor.",p="感谢圣光你安全的将它送达这里。荣耀堡需要集合所有经验丰富的战士。",pEN="Thank the Light you made it here safely. Honor Hold needs all the seasoned warriors it can muster.",c="我们对这个被遗弃，残破的世界的远征已经几乎裹足不前了。$n。我们遇到了超乎我们估计的阻碍。\n\n好像我们单单对抗燃烧军团的处境还不够恶劣一样——这片土地上还存在着我们以前从未遇过的邪恶事物。",cEN="Our expedition to this forsaken, wreck of a world has almost ground to a halt, <name>. We encountered more resistance than we bargained for.\n\nAs if facing the Burning Legion again wasn't bad enough - there are horrors in this land unlike anything we've ever encountered."}
Q[10141]={d="当燃烧军团入侵艾泽拉斯世界时，他们在外域这里也没闲着。多年来，我们都在追踪着他们的活动。但是，$c，这次他们最新的行动却是我们以前完全没有见过的。\n\n立刻到东补给车队去，找沃图姆斯中士报到。她负责对那些入侵者执行具体的监视行动，并分析他们的行动目的。\n\n你要快一点行动，同时也要注意安全，$n，绝对不要低估燃烧军团。",dEN="While the Burning Legion invaded Azeroth, they were also at work here, in Outland. We have tracked their movements over the years, but this latest activity, <class> - well, this is beyond anything we've seen.\n\nSeek out Sergeant Altumus near the eastern supply caravan. She has been monitoring the invaders and may have insights into their purpose.\n\nBe swift - and take care, <name> - the Burning Legion is not to be underestimated.",o="与荣耀堡外面的东补给车队的沃图姆斯中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sergeant Altumus at the East Supply Caravan just outside of Honor Hold, to the east.",c="远征军指挥官达纳斯可能误会了我对增援部队的要求。你看起来很有能力，但是……我要求的是一整营的部队！\n\n你看，我们有一些恶魔泛滥的问题……",cEN="Force Commander Danath may have misunderstood my request for reinforcements. You look capable, but... I asked for a full sized battalion!\n\nYou see, we have a bit of a demon problem..."}
Q[10142]={d="末日领主卡扎克指挥着外域所有的燃烧军团部队。当然，我们当前还不能直接和卡扎克对抗，但我们可以——而且必须——开始铲除他军团中的军官，彻底扰乱他们的指挥体系。\n\n他们在东边的苦痛之路派驻了一批恐惧魔王。正是这些恐惧魔王负责着在我们头顶上不停地降下地狱火之雨。立刻清除他们，还有他们的手下，这样燃烧军团就将遭受重大的损失。",dEN="Doom Lord Kazzak commands the Burning Legion in Outland. While we can't get to Kazzak - yet - we can and must get to his lieutenants that command Legion troops from the ground.\n\nThey have stationed dreadlords at the Path of Anguish, east of here. They are the ones responsible for these infernal storms that rain down upon our heads. To take them and their minions out would be a great set back to the Burning Legion.",o="荣耀堡外面的东补给车队的沃图姆斯中士要求你杀死4只唤火小鬼、6只地狱火战争使者和1只恐惧召唤者。",oEN="Sergeant Altumus at the East Supply Caravan east of Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to kill 4 Flamewaker Imps, 6 Infernal Warbringers and 1 Dreadcaller.",p="只要弓箭手看守着我们的领空，荣耀堡就会很安全。",pEN="Honor Hold is safe so long as the archers guard our skies.",c="杰出的表现，士兵。他们攻击的频率必定会降低——至少直到他们运送新的恐惧领主前来战线。\n\n现在宣布坏消息:我要下新的命令给你……",cEN="Outstanding work, soldier. The frequency of the attacks is sure to lessen - at least until they bring forth new dreadlords.\n\nNow for the bad news: I've got your new orders..."}
Q[10143]={d="你在之前数次作战之中所体现出的战斗力，已经被所有的高级指挥官注意到了，$c。他们希望能派你去前线与罗哈姆斯的小分队会合。那是一群激进分子，对毁灭燃烧军团的事业非常狂热。或许……你在他们那里会感觉比较自在一点……\n\n向东前进大约400步的距离，穿越白骨之谷，走到一处被毁坏的魔能机甲旁，远征军岗哨就矗立在那边的一处燃烧军团基地旧址上。到达那里之后，立刻向前线指挥官金斯顿报到。\n\n去吧！",dEN="Your battle prowess has been noted by high command, <class>. They want to send you to the front lines to meet up with Rohamus's crew. They're radicals, devoted to the complete extermination of the Burning Legion, so you may fit right in...\n\nHead east about 400 paces, across the Valley of Bones, until you run into a destroyed fel reaver. You'll see Expedition Point where a Legion base used to stand. Once there, you are to report to Forward Commander Kingston.\n\nNow move out!",o="向远征军岗哨的前线指挥官金斯顿报到。",oEN="Report to Forward Commander Kingston at Expedition Point.",c="很高兴见到你，士兵。\n\n聊够了……现在听着——我要给你一项非常重要的任务，而且只许成功……并且存活下来！",cEN="Glad to meet you, soldier.\n\nEnough chatting... now listen up -- I have a vital mission for you and I want you to succeed... and survive!"}
Q[10144]={d="你从这里一直向西北方走，就可以到达军团前线。那里部署着许多通向外域各地的传送门，使这里的燃烧军团能够随时得到增援。$n，我们决定摧毁所有的传送门！\n\n带上这捆雷管，它是由52区的技师设计的，可以利用恶魔自身的力量产生强大的爆炸！首先你要杀死格雷姆传送门和凯勒兹传送门旁边的那些军团士兵，收集他们身上的恶魔符文石，然后在传送门内使用雷管去引爆这些符文石……接下来，我们就可以看烟火表演了！！\n\n快去吧，$n，完成任务之后向我复命。",dEN="You'll find the Legion front to our northeast, and spaced along it are portals used to gather reinforcements from throughout Outland. We, <name>, are going to destroy those portals!\n\nTake this primer. Designed in Area 52, it uses the demons' own power as an explosive device! Defeat Legion forces around Portals Grimh and Kaalez to gather demonic rune stones, use the primer to detonate the stones inside the portals... then watch the fireworks!!\n\nGo, <name>, and return to me when your mission is complete.",o="消灭格雷姆传送门和凯勒兹传送门附近的敌人，收集它们身上的恶魔符文石。\n\n然后在格雷姆传送门和凯勒兹传送门内使用金斯顿的雷管。\n\n完成任务后，将剩馀的炸药还给前线指挥官金斯顿。",oEN="Defeat enemies around Portal Grimh and Portal Kaalez to gather Demonic Rune Stones.\n\nUse Kingston's Primer inside Portal Grimh and Portal Kaalez.\n\nReturn to Forward Commander Kingston with the remaining explosives.",p="真希望我能到那里观赏烟火展示。那些爆裂物的威力强大！",pEN="I wish I could be there to watch the fire display. Those explosives pack a big punch!",c="做得好，$n。瘫痪那些传送门将会好一段时间的切断燃烧军团源源不绝的援军！\n\n但是我们还不能休息……",cEN="Well done, <name>. Disabling those portals will stem the flow of Legion reinforcements for a long time!\n\nBut we can't rest yet..."}
Q[10146]={d="就在黑暗之门的西边，有两处巨大的传送装置，它们分别被称作穆尔凯斯之门和沙德拉兹之门。\n\n如果你沿着荣耀之路一直向西走，就可以在路边看见它们了。而我要你做的，就是把它们都给我炸上天！\n\n这是你要用的炸弹，是我请52区的一个地精技师特别设计的。现在，去和空军指挥官达比利谈谈吧，他会用狮鹫把你一路送过去的。",dEN="Just west of the Dark Portal are two huge transporters: Gateway Murketh and Gateway Shaadraz.\n\nIf you look east up the Path of Glory, you'll see them on either side of the road. I want you to bomb them both into rubble!\n\nHere are the bombs you'll use, specially designed by a goblin in Area 52. Now, speak with Wing Commander Dabir'ee -- he'll put you on a gryphon and send you on your way.",o="与空军指挥官达比利谈谈，轰炸穆尔凯斯之门和沙德拉兹之门，然后向远征军岗哨的前线指挥官金斯顿复命。",oEN="Speak with Wing Commander Dabir'ee, bomb Gateway Murketh and Gateway Shaadraz and then return to Forward Commander Kingston at Expedition Point.",p="这是个非常重要的任务，$n。是个我不会轻易相信随便任何人的任务。",pEN="This is a vital mission, <name>. It's one I would not trust to just anyone.",c="毫无疑问的，那将减缓他们的行动！我想你让我的心情变得异常的好，$n！",cEN="That will slow them down, there's no denying it! I think you just put me in an uncharacteristically good mood, <name>!"}
Q[10159]={d="我们当前正为扫清那些棘牙岭的掠食者而战。毕竟，如果我们这里与赞加沼泽庇护所之间的联系被完全切断，事态就太过糟糕了。\n\n其实，我们并也不想将这些生物全部赶出家园，但它们经常袭击这里的旅行者，而且最近变得越来越具备攻击性，因此，我们已经没有其它选择了。\n\n如果你愿意帮忙的话，就太好了。",dEN="We've been fighting an ongoing battle to keep the pass through Thornfang Hill to the west clear of ravagers. It would be bad if we were to become completely cut off from the refuge in Zangarmarsh.\n\nWe don't want to displace the creatures, but there seems to be little choice as their attacks on travelers through the area have become more aggressive.\n\nClear some of the ravagers out of there if you can.",o="杀死8只棘牙掠食者和8只棘牙喷毒者，然后返回地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，向玛霍拉姆·硬蹄复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Thornfang Ravagers and 8 Thornfang Venomspitters, and then return to Mahuram Stouthoof at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你清理棘牙陵的进展得如何？",pEN="How fares your attempt to clear Thornfang Hill?",c="随着掠食者被清除了，那些往返于赞加沼泽去塞纳里奥庇护所的旅人应该会比较轻松了。\n\n塞纳里奥远征队感谢你。",cEN="With the ravagers cleared, travelers to and from the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh should have an easier time of it.\n\nThe Cenarion Expedition is indebted to you."}
Q[10160]={d="有传闻说，最近战场出现了一批新的兽人，而且他们的数量还在不断增加。相对于我们一直以来面对的那些兽人，这群新兽人体型更加巨大，性格也更加残忍与狡猾。如果这个传闻是真的，那们我们原本就已势单力薄的军队恐怕根本无法与之抗衡。\n\n我已经委托深得我信任的阿曼蒂中尉前去调查这个传闻。如果你愿意在这危机关头帮助我们的话，就请直接去找她吧。她的分队当前驻扎在荣耀堡西边那处古老的哨塔里。\n\n$n，离开荣耀堡后一定要格外小心，你将要面对的是一个完全陌生而又充满危险的新世界。",dEN="Rumors have surfaced that some new breed of orc is on the rise. Larger, meaner - more cunning than the brutes we're familiar with. If these rumors are true then our forces, already stretched, may be taxed beyond their limit.\n\nI have entrusted my lieutenant, Amadi, with investigating this matter. If you would help us in this dark hour, seek her out. She is stationed at the broken tower just west of the Hold.\n\nAnd <name> - be careful out there. You're heading into a dangerous new world.",o="与荣耀堡西部哨塔内的阿曼蒂中尉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lieutenant Amadi at the old guard tower just west of Honor Hold.",c="<阿曼蒂中尉点头。>\n\n非常好，我们需要所有我们能取得的帮助。在南方堡垒附近持续增加的邪兽人使我忧心。我派了一个斥候去调查，但是他还没有回来。",cEN="<Lieutenant Amadi nods.>\n\nGood, we need all the help we can get. The increasing fel orc presence around the Southern Rampart concerns me. I sent out a scout to investigate, but he hasn't yet returned."}
Q[10161]={d="遇到紧急情况时，保持头脑清醒永远都是飞行员的职责，尤其是当你的副驾驶唯一听从的指令来自他的肚子时。\n\n好消息是，我们不必等上几天让零件运来。坏消息是，那些\"备用\"零件从这儿一路散落到了东边的白骨谷。\n\n另一个坏消息？那些备件也不太备得住。它们，呃，在我们急速下降的时候掉了。你能帮我收集到足够重新起飞的数量吗？",dEN="In the event of an emergency, it's always the pilot's job to keep a level head, especially when the only orders your co-pilot follows come from his stomach.\n\nThe good news is that we won't need to wait days for replacement parts to be imported. The bad news is that the \"spare\" parts got scattered from here to the Valley of Bones to the east.\n\nThe other bad news? The spare parts aren't so spare. They, uh, fell off during our rapid descent. Could you help me collect enough to get us off the ground again?",o="收集30块飞艇残骸，带给飞艇坠毁点的\"尖叫\"斯克里德·幸运脑袋。",oEN="Collect 30 pieces of Zeppelin Debris and bring them to \"Screaming\" Screed Luckheed at the Zeppelin Crash.",p="你找到足够多的零件了吗？要是没有，我可能得动用莱加西老在挥的那口平底锅了。到时候我就得给这艘飞艇改名叫\"飞行煎锅\"了。",pEN="Did you find enough of the parts? If not, I might have to use that frying pan Legassi keeps waving around. Then, I'd have to rename the zeppelin the \"Flying Skillet.\"",c="这些零件有的歪七扭八的，但是应该足够这里使用了。随着一些充满创意的行为，我有自信能够让它起作用！",cEN="Some of this is in pretty bad shape, but there should be enough to work with here. With some creative engineering, I'm confident I can make it work!"}
Q[10162]={d="既然你已经有了翅膀，也许你有兴趣再跑一趟轰炸任务？\n\n这次我们锁定了军团的主要生产区，就在北边熔炉营地的后面。我要你骑上双足飞龙，把那该死的地方夷为平地！\n\n炸弹给你，等你$g准备好:准备好;起飞时，去找空军指挥官布拉克。",dEN="Now that you've got your wings, perhaps you'd be interested in running another bombing mission?\n\nThis time we've isolated the Legion's main production area, behind the forge camps to the north. I need you to get on a wyvern and destroy the whole damned thing!\n\nHere are your bombs - now, talk to Wing Commander Brack when you're ready for takeoff.",o="地狱火半岛机甲残骸的前线指挥官托尔克要求你杀死20个甘尔葛苦工和5个莫尔葛监工，并摧毁5门邪能火炮。",oEN="Forward Commander To'arch at Reaver's Fall in Hellfire Peninsula has asked that you destroy 20 Gan'arg Peons, 5 Mo'arg Overseers and 5 Fel Cannons.",p="让他们知道领空权是我们的！",pEN="Show them that not even the skies are safe!",c="你似乎从一出生就擅长飞行，$n。表现得很不错！双足飞龙的身上甚至连一道抓痕都没有！",cEN="You fly as if you've been doing this your entire life, <name>. Outstanding performance out there! Not even a scratch on the wyvern destroyers!"}
Q[10163]={d="既然你已经有了翅膀，也许你有兴趣再跑一趟轰炸任务？\n\n这次我们锁定了军团的主要生产区，就在北边熔炉营地的后面。我要你骑上狮鹫，把那该死的地方夷为平地！\n\n炸弹给你。等你$g准备好:准备好;起飞时，去找狮鹫管理员风啸。|n",dEN="Now that you've got your wings, perhaps you'd be interested in running another bombing mission?\n\nThis time we've isolated the Legion's main production area, behind the forge camps to the north. I need you to get on a gryphon and destroy the whole damned thing!\n\nHere are your bombs - now, talk to Gryphoneer Windbellow when you're ready for takeoff.",o="地狱火半岛破碎岗哨的空军指挥官格莱芬加尔要求你杀死20个甘尔葛苦工和5个莫尔葛监工，并摧毁5门邪能火炮。",oEN="Wing Commander Gryphongar at Shatter Point in Hellfire Peninsula has asked that you destroy 20 Gan'arg Peons, 5 Mo'arg Overseers and 5 Fel Cannons.",p="让他们知道领空权是我们的！",pEN="Show them that not even the skies are safe!",c="你似乎从一出生就擅长飞行，$n。表现得很不错！狮鹫的身上甚至连一道抓痕都没有！",cEN="You fly as if you've been doing this your entire life, <name>. Outstanding performance out there! Not even a scratch on the gryphon destroyers!"}
Q[10164]={d="$n，看来你有着丰富的冒险经历，甚至进入过奥金尼地穴探险。\n\n我是个幸运的幽灵。我既没有沦为利维休斯的仆从，也没有成为大大主教玛拉达尔那罪恶的通灵术实验中的牺牲品。尽管你杀死了利维休斯，玛拉达尔却还活着，继续折磨着地穴中痛苦的灵魂。\n\n我希望你做的事很简单。进入奥金尼地穴杀死大大主教玛拉达尔，让那些被禁锢的灵魂得以安息。",dEN="You've had quite an adventure, <name>. And before you've even set foot inside of the Auchenai Crypts.\n\nI am one of the fortunate spirits. I was neither bound to Levixus nor a part of Exarch Maladaar's vile experiments in necromancy. While you have destroyed Levixus, Maladaar lives on, continuing to torment the spirits inside the crypts.\n\nWhat I ask is simple. Enter the Auchenai Crypts and destroy Exarch Maladaar so that the spirits trapped inside can finally rest in peace.",o="奥金顿奥金尼地穴外的奥德里姆斯宗父要你进入奥金尼地穴，消灭大大主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Greatfather Aldrimus standing outside the Auchenai Crypts of Auchindoun has asked that you enter the Auchenai Crypts and destroy Exarch Maladaar.",p="拯救那些灵魂，$n。",pEN="Save the spirits, <name>.",c="你做到了，$n！灵魂被释放了！\n\n虽然我没有一个物质上的表示，但我仍然能以来自精灵世界的物品奖赏你。小心使用，像这样的物品经常是具爆炸性且能更使它们的用户受到重大伤害。",cEN="You've done it, <name>! The spirits are freed!\n\nAlthough I am without a material manifestation, I am still able to reward you with items from the spirit world. Use them with caution as such items are often volatile and can cause great harm to their user."}
Q[10165]={d="沙法尔真是个精明的家伙，我一定要治治他……星界社团只能眼睁睁地看着他将墓穴里值钱的东西劫掠一空。$r，瞧瞧我手下的这帮蠢材，他们根本无力突破沙法尔的防线，不如我们来做笔交易吧。\n\n进入法力陵墓，杀死节点亲王沙法尔。带回沙法尔的护腕带，做为你杀死他的凭证。我不会亏待你的。",dEN="That Shaffar is a shrewd one - I'll give him that... He's managed to keep the Consortium out while he safely pillages this crypt for all it's worth. I have no faith in these imbeciles actually breaking through Shaffar's defenses so I'll make you a deal, <race>.\n\nEnter the Mana-Tombs and kill Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Bring me back his body wrap as proof of this deed and I'll reward you handsomely.",o="法力陵墓外的节点亲王哈拉迈德要你杀死节点亲王沙法尔，并将沙法尔的护腕带交给他。",oEN="Nexus-Prince Haramad located outside of the Mana-Tombs wants you to kill Nexus-Prince Shaffar and bring Shaffar's Wrappings back to him.",p="我不喜欢\"分享\"。",pEN="I don't like to \"share.\"",c="另一个竞争者消失了……你为了一个噬尸兽做了一件好事，$r。如果你来虚空风暴，来拜访我。我就住在风暴尖塔。",cEN="Another competitor goes under... You do good work for a flesh beast, <race>. If you are ever in Netherstorm, look me up. I make my home at the Stormspire."}
Q[10166]={d="这件坠饰让我想起了那段非比寻常的岁月，真是一段美好的时光……\n\n可惜现在我已经不需要任何回忆了。\n\n让这件坠饰和回忆都埋入焦痕谷的符石吧。我就是在那儿遇见那位树人长者的。让所有关于这位故人的回忆都一起埋葬了吧。",dEN="This pendant brings back memories of a different time. A better time.\n\nUnfortunately, memories are the last thing I need right now.\n\nI want you to bury this by the runestone in the Scorched Grove. It was there that I first met the treant elder. Put my old friend's memory to rest.",o="拉莉亚娜·河风要你将怀特巴克的坠饰放在焦痕谷的符石上。",oEN="Larianna Riverwind wants you to place Old Whitebark's Pendant by the runestone at the Scorched Grove.",p="你回来了，$n。你做得还不够吗？",pEN="You've returned, haven't you done enough?",c="我已经不再属于这个世界了，而且必须承认失败。这片土地已经永远改变了，没有什么会是永远不变的。\n\n把这个墬饰留在这里给我吧，$n。也许有一天，在精灵们消失很久以后，一颗新生之树会在这个特别的地方生长……",cEN="I no longer belong to this world and must admit defeat. The land has forever changed and nothing will ever be the same.Leave the pendant here with me, maybe one day, long after the elves are gone, a new tree will grow on this very spot - amongst a burnt forest and the husks of dead treants."}
Q[10167]={d="奥金尼地穴深处有一座坟墓。破碎的外域随处都可以看到墓穴，惟有这座坟墓与众不同。奥金顿的陵墓群就起源于这座墓穴。\n\n进入奥金顿的奥金尼地穴，找到这处坟墓。杀死墓穴的守卫，解救出被关押在墓穴中的灵魂。那个灵魂就是一切的关键……",dEN="Deep within the Auchenai Crypts is a tomb: A tomb unlike any that exists on this shattered realm. It was from this tomb, the first tomb, that the vast mausoleum of Auchindoun was born.\n\nYou must venture to the Auchenai Crypts of Auchindoun and find this tomb. Slay the guardian of the crypt to release the captive spirit within. The spirit holds the key...",o="前往泰罗卡森林白骨荒野的奥金尼地穴，杀死主教玛拉达尔，解救多尔之灵。|n",oEN="Travel to the Auchenai Crypts in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest and slay Exarch Maladaar to free the spirit of D'ore.",p="<迪欧瑞的鬼魂哼了几下。>\n\n你好啊，$n。",pEN="<D'ore's spirit hums.>\n\nGreetings, <name>.",c="记忆是生动的，$n。我的能量完全被爆炸吸收。当预言者维伦和他的德莱尼同胞抬起我的遗体并且将它们带来这里时，我只是一个黯淡的虚无能量。在经过许多仪式之后，我那变小的身体被埋葬在这个石棺内。我花了差不多一千年一直在重生……",cEN="The memory is vivid, <name>. My energies were wholly drained from the crash. I was only a dim speck of void energies when the Prophet Velen and his draenei compatriots lifted my remains and brought them here. After much ceremony, my diminished form was laid to rest within this sarcophagus. I have been regenerating for nearly a thousand years. The cycle is almost complete..."}
Q[10168]={d="数百年来，无数奥金顿的灵魂被卷入了我体内黯淡的精华之中，我的能量一直不断衰竭，奥金尼地穴也因此频发灾难。\n\n很遗憾，没有什么能阻止这个循环。这便是纳鲁生命的轮回——没有虚空，圣光也不可能存在。\n\n惟一的挽救措施就是在纳格兰的兽人灵魂堕落为虚空生物之前消灭他们。这座墓穴中的灵魂之镜可以搭救他们……",dEN="For several centuries, the spirits of Auchindoun coalesced into my darkened essence. Many of the catastrophes that befell this crypt were a direct result of my weakened state.\n\nRegrettably, there is nothing that can be done to stop this cycle. It is a facet of the naaru condition - without the void, the Light cannot exist.\n\nYour only recourse is to destroy the ancient spirits of Nagrand before they transform into creatures of the void. Use the soul mirrors found throughout this crypt to free them...",o="在奥金尼地穴中找到一面灵魂之镜，用它召唤纳格兰上古兽人先祖的黑暗之魂。消灭15个黑暗的灵魂，让兽人先祖得以安然长眠。\n\n完成任务后，向先祖之地的卡舒尔宗母复命。",oEN="Locate a Soul Mirror somewhere in the Auchenai Crypts and use it to call forth a Darkened Spirit from Ancient Orc Ancestors in Nagrand. Destroy 15 Darkened Spirits so that the ancestors may rest in peace.\n\nReturn to Mother Kashur at the Ancestral Grounds when this task is complete.",p="<卡舒尔宗母看起来很生气。>\n\n这些纳鲁远比世界上所有形态的生命还要聪明。",pEN="<Mother Kashur is visibly upset.>These naaru are wise beyond all manner of life on this world.",c="你已经完成了一次长远又危险的旅行，冒着生命危险去确保玛格汉的安全和我们先祖的宁静。对此我不知道要怎么表达我的感谢。",cEN="You have completed a long and dangerous journey, risking life and limb to ensure the safety of the Mag'har and the serenity of our ancestors. For this I am thankful beyond what words could convey."}
Q[10170]={d="$n，返回加拉达尔，向盖亚安祖母汇报这个好消息吧。玛格汉氏族必定会因此欢欣鼓舞。地狱咆哮之子说不定也能摆脱悲伤，重新振作起来。",dEN="Return to Greatmother Geyah at Garadar with news of your victory, <name>. This will surely lift the spirits of the Mag'har. Perhaps even the young Hellscream will be lifted from his malaise.",o="返回加拉达尔，与盖亚安祖母谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Garadar and speak to Greatmother Geyah.",c="我要你亲自告诉加尔鲁什这个消息。",cEN="I want you to personally deliver this news to Garrosh."}
Q[10171]={d="$n，你给予了玛格汉氏族太多的帮助，你的英勇事迹传遍了整个氏族，连加尔鲁什都已经知道了。去找他吧，告诉他你所取得的成就。告诉他，你为他和他的子民所做的一切。你的话必定可以激励加尔鲁什。",dEN="You have done so much for the Mag'har, <name>. Your accomplishments are known to all, including Garrosh. Go to him now and tell him of your latest victory. Tell him that you do what you do for him and his people. Surely he will be lifted by your words.",o="加拉达尔的盖亚安祖母要你去跟加尔鲁什谈一谈。",oEN="Greatmother Geyah at Garadar has asked that you speak with Garrosh.",c="每个人都觉得骄傲——我们的族人能活着看见另一个冬天。但那之后还有什么呢？\n\n也许你应该来领导这个氏族，$n。也许当祖母过世，我就可以继而死去。最后请让我抹去地狱咆哮的羞耻。我一直以来都渴望这样的平静。",cEN="Everyone is proud. Proud that our people will live to see another winter. But beyond that? What is there?\n\nMaybe you should lead this clan, <name>. Maybe then I will be allowed to die when the Greatmother passes. Allowed to finally erase the shame of my family name. I long for such peace."}
Q[10172]={d="你是个高尚的$r，$n。你为玛格汉做了很多。没有人能否认你为我族人所立的功劳。唉，玛格汉的时代已经走到尽头了。你比任何人都更清楚地让我看到，我不适合领导这些人。我受到诅咒的血统太深了。我不会……我不能成为第二个地狱咆哮，再次诅咒兽人。\n\n求你，$n，回去见祖母，把我对你说的话告诉她。我羞愧得不敢见她……不敢直视她的眼睛。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You are an honorable <race>, <name>. You have done much for the Mag'har. No one could ever deny your service to my people. Alas, the time of the Mag'har is at an end. You have shown me, more than anything, that I am unfit to lead these people. My cursed blood runs too deep. I will not... I cannot become the second Hellscream to damn the orcs.\n\nPlease, <name>, return to the Greatmother and tell her what I have told you. I am too ashamed to see her... to look into her eyes.",o="将加尔鲁什所说的话转告给盖亚安祖母。",oEN="Speak to Greatmother Geyah and tell her what Garrosh told you.",p="<盖亚安祖母躺了下来。>",pEN="<Greatmother Geyah is lying down.>",c="<眼泪从盖亚安祖母的脸上流了下来。>\n\n去找你的大酋长。告诉他我在这里等他……",cEN="<Tears stream down Greatmother Geyah's face.>\n\nSeek out your warchief. Tell him that I await him here..."}
Q[10173]={d="请允许我作个自我介绍，$c。\n\n我名叫拉文德维尔，是大法师瓦格斯的学徒。\n\n我的导师当前……暂且说是状况不适吧。我来到这里是有要事的。\n\n城东南方的阿尔科隆遗迹当前已被燃烧军团所占据，成了他们进行邪恶活动的温床。他们在遗迹里活动的目标既不是我，也不是我的导师，而是由他们的领袖埃克拉斯所持有的大法师的法杖。\n\n这份召唤粉尘可以帮你诱使那个恶魔从藏身地现身，将它撒在遗迹中心的火盆里吧。",dEN="Allow me to introduce myself, <class>.\n\nI am Ravandwyr, apprentice to the Archmage Vargoth.\n\nMy master is... indisposed, shall we say. I am here on a matter of great importance.\n\nThe Arklon Ruins southeast of the city are a hotbed of Burning Legion activity. Their purpose in the ruins concerns neither me nor my master, but their leader, Ekkorash, possesses the archmage's staff.\n\nThis conjuring powder will allow you to draw the demon out of hiding. Sprinkle it on the brazier at the center of the ruins.",o="从审讯者埃克拉斯手中夺得大法师瓦格斯的法杖，将它交给52区的拉文德维尔。要使埃克拉斯从藏身处现身，你需要向遗迹中心的火盆喷撒召唤粉尘。",oEN="Retrieve Archmage Vargoth's Staff from Ekkorash the Inquisitor and bring it to Ravandwyr in Area 52. To bring Ekkorash out of hiding, sprinkle the Conjuring Powder on the brazier in the center of the ruins.",p="大法师瓦格斯之杖归还，我才会休息。你可以从恶魔的手中将它抢回来吗？",pEN="I will not rest until Archmage Vargoth's staff is restored to him. Were you able to wrest it from the demon's grasp?",c="啊，你设法取回了法杖。让人印象深刻，$n。或许你是我一直寻找的那个人。\n\n喔，是的，你的报酬……\n\n<拉文德维尔将几个硬币放到你的手掌上。>\n\n毫无疑问的你期望得更多，但是那也要随着时机而来。现在，将机会当成是真正的报酬。",cEN="Ah, so you managed to recover the staff. Impressive, <name>. Perhaps you are the one I've been looking for.\n\nOh yes, your reward...\n\n<Ravandwyr presses a few coins into your palm.>\n\nNo doubt you had higher expectations, but that too will come with time. For now, consider opportunity the true reward."}
Q[10174]={d="现在，你可以依靠大法师的法杖与他取得联络了。\n\n他居住在紫罗兰之塔中，就在东南方一座浮空的“岛屿”上。这座被诅咒的塔楼既是他的庇护所，也是他的监狱。肯瑞托法师无法进出紫罗兰之塔，这导致我不能与导师见面。\n\n这根法杖的魔法可以渗透塔楼的防御层，不过需要由肯瑞托议会之外的人来激活它。\n\n利用大法师的法杖生成他的影像，告诉他当前的状况，告诉他，我没有辜负他的期望。",dEN="Now, you will be able to use the archmage's staff to contact him.\n\nHe resides in the Violet Tower, on an 'island' to the southeast. The tower is both sanctuary and prison to him, cursed as it is. Kirin Tor can neither enter nor leave, keeping me apart from my master.\n\nThe staff's magic can penetrate the tower's defenses, but only if invoked by one outside the Kirin Tor.\n\nTake the archmage's staff and use it to conjure his image. Tell him what has happened and that I have not completely failed him.",o="利用大法师瓦格斯的法杖与他取得联系。\n\n如果你弄丢了大法师瓦格斯的法杖，可以向52区的拉文德维尔再要一根。",oEN="Use Archmage Vargoth's Staff to make contact with Archmage Vargoth.\n\nIf you lose Archmage Vargoth's Staff, speak to Ravandwyr at Area 52 to receive a replacement.",c="<当你传达拉文德维尔的讯息时，大法师瓦格斯的影像同时检查着你。>\n\n拉文德维尔凡事都能符合他师傅的期望。当我给他权杖并且要他逃离时，我原本希望一旦凯尔萨斯的部队从塔里撤出，他可以使用它来寻求协助并解救我。从那以后，我已经学到了许多有关诅咒的种类。\n\n这是可以被破除的，$n，但是会需要你的协助。",cEN="<Archmage Vargoth's image examines you as you convey Ravandwyr's message.>\n\nRavandwyr has everything a master can expect of his apprentice. When I gave him the staff and told him to flee. I hoped that he would use it to find help and free me once Kael'thas's forces withdrew from the tower. Since then, I have learned a great deal about the nature of the curse.\n\nIt can be broken, <name>, but it will require your help."}
Q[10175]={d="回到你的世界去吧，$n。去见我的孙儿，告诉他，他的血脉就在这里——在这个支离破碎的世界上。\n\n告诉他，他父亲的传承仍然延续着。\n\n把一切都告诉他……|n",dEN="Return to your world, <name>. Go to my grandchild and tell him that his blood is here - on this shattered world.\n\nTell him that his father's legacy lives on.\n\nTell him everything...",o="转至奥格瑞玛，将盖亚安祖母的口信告诉萨尔。",oEN="Venture to Orgrimmar and deliver Geyah's message to Thrall.",c="<萨尔的声音带上了一种雷云般空洞的质感。>我……我有一个祖母？她还活着？",cEN="<Thrall's voice takes on the hollow essence of a storm cloud.>I... I have a grandmother? She lives?"}
Q[10176]={d="你已经集齐了破除凯尔萨斯的诅咒所需的物品，要做的事情仅剩一件了。凯尔萨斯封印紫罗兰之塔时，将一个名叫阿尔凯洛斯的奥术傀儡留在了塔楼顶层。\n\n你必须击败阿尔凯洛斯，让我恢复塔内的魔法系统。\n\n当你进入紫罗兰之塔的那一刻起，凯尔萨斯的诅咒就会在你身上生效。\n\n击败阿尔凯洛斯之后，你要登上塔楼，协助我准备仪式。",dEN="Now that you've gathered all the items I'll need to break Kael'thas's curse, one thing remains to be done. When Kael'thas sealed the tower, he placed an arcane golem, known as Ar'kelos, at the bottom of the tower.\n\nYou must defeat Ar'kelos in order allow me to work magic within the tower again.\n\nWhen you enter the Violet Tower, the curse will begin to affect you.\n\nOnce you have defeated Ar'kelos, ascend the tower and assist me in making preparations for the ritual.",o="进入肯瑞瓦村中心的紫罗兰之塔，击败阿尔凯洛斯，然后与大法师瓦格斯谈一谈。",oEN="Enter the Violet Tower at the center of Kirin'Var Village and defeat Ar'kelos, then speak with Archmage Vargoth.",p="终于，我们见面了。",pEN="At last, we meet.",c="你做的很好，$n。摧毁这个结界将有助于我可以更容易的解除这个塔的诅咒。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. Destroying the dampening field will make it much easier for me to prepare the magic that will lift the tower's curse at last."}
Q[10177]={d="我在奥金顿安插了许多间谍，他们不断地给我发来令人烦恼的报告。自从数年前的大爆炸事件后，那里的麻烦事就层出不穷。\n\n最近，奥金顿的局势再次恶化，暗影议会正在筹划发动战争。尽管这些报告还缺乏细节，但是我们可以了解到，他们在奥金顿内秘密进行着准备工作。\n\n你必须立刻转至暗影迷宫的入口，战地指挥官玛弗恩会将你派到最需要的地方去。",dEN="I have spies within Auchindoun and they have been sending me disturbing reports. That place has been nothing but trouble ever since it exploded a couple of years ago.\n\nSomething in there has gone horribly wrong - again - and the Shadow Council is now on a war footing. Though the reports were lacking on details, their preparations appear to be directed inward.\n\nYou must make your way to the entrance of the Shadow Labyrinth. My field commander, Mahfuun, will fill you in on what needs to be done.",o="转至泰罗卡森林的奥金顿，向暗影迷宫入口处的战地指挥官玛弗恩报到。",oEN="Report to Field Commander Mahfuun at the entrance to the Shadow Labyrinth at Auchindoun in Terokkar Forest.",c="你也该到了。\n\n梅丽莎说几天前就会派人来。而我们在这儿奋战的时间比那还长！",cEN="It's about time that you arrived.\n\nMehlisah said that she would be sending help days ago. And we've been fighting in here longer than that!"}
Q[10178]={d="托古恩真是个蠢货！我们在这儿苦苦支撑，抵御敌人的攻击；他却返回奥金顿，试图收集更多的信息，还想营救其它的间谍！\n\n我都不知道我该爱他还是该宰了他！\n\n暗影议会利用魔法发现了我们的踪迹，我们不得不匆促撤离奥金顿，可惜大多数间谍没能顺利逃生。\n\n如果你敢进入暗影迷宫的话，能帮忙寻找托古恩的下落吗？我担心他会遭遇不测。",dEN="To'gun, the fool! We're barely holding off the attacks here, and he goes back in to get more information and try to save the other spies!\n\nI don't know whether to love him or kill him!\n\nThe Shadow Council must have used magic to ferret us out, because all of our spies had to get out of there in a hurry. Most of us didn't make it.\n\nPlease, if you're brave enough to enter the Shadow Labyrinth, will you keep an eye peeled for To'gun? It's been a while, and I fear the worst.",o="进入奥金顿的暗影迷宫，寻找间谍托古恩的下落。",oEN="Locate Spy To'gun in the Shadow Labyrinth of Auchindoun.",c="什么？葛瑞克萨在我之后派你来这里吗？\n\n我不知道是否应该感到感动还是要叫她傻瓜！\n\n你认为你能帮助我逃出这只笼子吗？它有点难度的。",cEN="What? Grik'tha sent you in here after me?\n\nI don't know whether to be touched or call her a fool!\n\nDo you think you could help me get out of this cage? It's a bit cramped."}
Q[10180]={d="我试着劝说伊斯法尔留在这里，留在安全的沙塔斯城，可他根本听不进去，竟然决定再次孤身犯险，进入奥金顿。\n\n之前他侥幸从塞泰克大厅捡回一条命，如果这次再被俘虏，恐怕就没那么幸运了。\n\n他想营救妹妹的决心令我敬佩，但是凭他一己之力，绝无成功的希望。\n\n$n，找到伊斯法尔，和他谈谈。如果你不能劝他回来，或许你可以帮他救出拉卡？",dEN="I tried to persuade Isfar to remain here, in the safety of Shattrath, but he would have none of it. Instead, he's decided to venture out to Auchindoun again on his own.\n\nHe was lucky enough to escape the Sethekk Halls once, but if they discover him, there won't be a second time.\n\nI admire his desire to free his sister, but he's not going to be able to do it without help.\n\nFind Isfar and have a word with him, <name>. If you can't persuade him to come back, perhaps you could help him rescue Lakka?",o="与奥金顿塞泰克大厅入口附近的伊斯法尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Isfar, who can be found near the entrance to the Sethekk Halls in Auchindoun.",c="我本该猜到他会派你来跟踪我。他试图想要说服我回到塞泰克大厅，但是我不能让拉卡在那里和其他鸦人共存。",cEN="I should've suspected he would send you after me. He tried to talk me out of returning to the Sethekk Halls, but I couldn't live with myself if I allowed Lakka to die in there."}
Q[10182]={d="这把剑品质非凡，做工精美，配重也完美契合战斗法师。剑柄末端刻着肯瑞托的印记和\"达斯里克\"这个名字。\n\n你把武器在手中翻过来，察觉到金属中透出一种不对劲的感觉，仿佛这件物品被撕扯在两个世界之间。这会不会就是把战斗法师达斯里克的灵魂锚定在这个世界的东西？\n\n也许把它放回原处就能断开这层联系，让达斯里克的灵魂终于得以安息。",dEN="The sword is of exceptional quality, finely crafted and perfectly balanced for a battle-mage. The seal of the Kirin Tor and the name \"Dathric\" are engraved into the weapon's pommel.\n\nTurning the weapon over in your hands, you notice a sense of wrongness radiating from the metal, as if the item is torn between two worlds. Could this be the item anchoring Battle-Mage Dathric's spirit to this world?\n\nPerhaps returning it to its proper place can break the bond, freeing Dathric's spirit to rest at last.",o="在巫师街内找到战斗法师达斯利克的家，将剑放回他的武器架上。然后与肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Battle-Mage Dathric's quarters in Wizard's Row and return the blade to his weapon rack. Then, speak with Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village.",p="你找到什么了，$n？",pEN="What have you found, <name>?",c="你做的很好，$n。我不再感应到达斯立克灵魂的任何骚动。我愿意付出更多以得到再一次与他对话的机会，但他最终安息了那就够了。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. I can no longer sense any restlessness in Dathric's spirit. I would give much for the opportunity to speak to him one more time, but it is enough that he is finally at rest."}
Q[10183]={d="我在这儿研究虚空、以太流之类的东西。这地方远离城镇的灯火与喧嚣，再理想不过了。这座桥不错吧？要是我能让这堆破玩意儿一直运转下去就好了。\n\n嘿，你知道吗，你要是想找活儿干，52区多的是！顺着这条路走，在岔路口往右拐就是。\n\n你何不把我最新的研究笔记送给火箭主管富塞拉奇？有X-52火箭飞船那一摊子事，我敢说他肯定有很多活儿给你干！",dEN="I'm out here studying the nether - the ethereal currents and all that. This is an ideal spot away from the lights and hubbub of town. Isn't this bridge great? If I could just keep this junk working.\n\nHey, you know, if you're looking for work there's plenty at Area 52! It's just up the path and take a right at the fork in the road.\n\nWhy don't you deliver my latest research notes to Rocket-Chief Fuselage? I'm sure that he'd have plenty for you to do, what with the X-52 rocket ship, and all!",o="将虚空学家的笔记交给虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。",oEN="Deliver the Netherologist's Notes to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="忙阿忙阿。没有时间可以浪费了！有一艘火箭船等着施工呢！\n\n你要干嘛？",pEN="Busy, busy. No time to waste! There's a rocket ship to be built!\n\nWhat do you want?",c="喔，哥白尼终于决定回报他的发现了，是吗？懒惰的科学家！\n\n这是什么？\n\n<这位主管快速翻阅这些纪录好几次，明显的一脸不可置信。>\n\n他这里说到流动在虚空风暴间的狂暴虚空力量会在几个月内将所有东西都扯成碎片。\n\n这实在令我们太困扰了——现在我们得加快火箭船的建造时间！",cEN="Oh, Coppernickels finally decided to report his findings, did he? Lazy scientists!\n\nWhat's this?\n\n<The chief riffles through the notations a few times, clearly with a look of disbelief.>\n\nHe says here that the violent nether-energies flowing through the Netherstorm are going to rip everything to shreds in only a few months.\n\nThat's inconvenient - now we'll have to move up the time-table on building the rocket ship!"}
Q[10184]={d="村中的大多数幽灵生前都是肯瑞托的法师。他们丧失了往昔的记忆，带着沉重的怨念游荡在废墟中。\n\n但是，最开始的时候并不是这样的。那场袭击后，灵魂们只是显得不太安分而已，远没有像现在这样充满敌意。时间一久，他们却变得越来越暴戾。我已经不敢靠近村子的南部了，他们恐怕连我都不会放过。请你净化法师们愤怒的灵魂，让他们平静下来吧。",dEN="Most of the spirits in the village are little more than pale remnants of Kirin Tor mages. They retain no knowledge of their former selves and wander the ruins in blind anger.\n\nIt wasn't always like this, though. In the immediate aftermath of the attack, the spirits were restless, but not spiteful. With the passage of time they have only grown more aggressive. I dare not venture into the southern part of the village, for they will not spare even me. Quiet them and let us hope it will purge their anger.",o="肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯要求你去肯瑞瓦村广场消灭20个被杀死的幽魂。",oEN="Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village wants you to defeat 20 Severed Spirits in Kirin'Var's Town Square.",p="它让我痛到了解能为我们的同胞做的太少了。",pEN="It pains me to know there is so little to be done for our comrades.",c="<管理者戴沃斯温和的摇摇他的头。>\n\n这不是他们应得的，但却是我们能做的。",cEN="It is not what they deserved, but it is the best we can do."}
Q[10185]={d="血精灵将肯瑞瓦村夷为平地后，便在西北方建起了一座高大的建筑物。没有大法师的知识，我们也无从得知那座建筑物的用途。\n\n不过，有点事倒是明摆着：血精灵的活动导致饥饿的法力生物如潮水般涌入村落。它们似乎对巫师街特别感兴趣，不断亵渎着法师们的遗物。我们必须制止这群法力生物。",dEN="After the blood elves leveled Kirin'Var Village, they started the construction of a large building to the northwest. Without the expertise of the archmage, we can't say for certain what's going on there.\n\nOne thing is clear, though. The blood elf activities have unleashed a tide of ravenous mana elementals on the village. They seem drawn to the ruins of Wizard Row, wreaking further destruction. We cannot permit this to continue.",o="杀死10个法师杀手和10个法力搜寻者，然后向肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Mageslayers and 10 Mana Seekers and return to Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village.",p="你有设法解决一些村庄废墟里的法力生物吗？",pEN="Have you managed to clear out some of the mana creatures from the village ruins?",c="<管理者看起来很沮丧。>\n\n我几乎可以预见从地平线涌出的下一波。除掉他们暂且是可行，但仍需要长久的评估。",cEN="<The custodian looks dismayed.>\n\nI can already see the next wave coming over the horizon. Culling them will work for the time being, but more permanent measures are needed."}
Q[10186]={d="就让我成为第一个欢迎你到来的人吧，三等见习技师$n！\n\n我们正忙于一项伟大的工程——虚空火箭X-52！\n\n不过，首先我们得准备好零件和燃料，这就是你要做的事。\n\n我需要水晶——注意，是大量的水晶，我要利用这些水晶构造火箭的以太锂引擎矩阵。德莱尼人那里到处都是水晶！\n\n你可以在北边的恩卡特废墟搞到水晶！当心那些德莱尼幽灵。",dEN="Let me be the first to welcome you aboard, Junior Technician 3rd Grade <name>!\n\nWe're building my masterpiece out here - the X-52 Nether-Rocket!\n\nBut first we need to get all of the parts and fuel for it. That's where you come in.\n\nTo start, I need crystals - LOTS of crystals - for the rocket's Etherlithium Engine Matrix. The draenei had crystals coming out of their ears!\n\nSo head north to the Ruins of Enkaat and get them for me! Nevermind all of the draenei ghosts.",o="将10块以太锂矩阵水晶交给虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。",oEN="Collect 10 Etherlithium Matrix Crystals and return them to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="X-52虚空火箭看起来像是准备好可以发射了吗？我是为了我驾驶座的舒适而漫行虚空的吗？开发陌生的新世界？寻找新科技及商机？勇敢的去那些没有地精去过的地方？\n\n不是的！\n\n因此，我希望你能有我给你之后的那些水晶。",pEN="Does it look like the X-52 Nether-Rocket is ready for liftoff? Am I cruising the Twisting Nether in the comfort of my command chair? Exploiting strange new worlds? Seeking out new technology and business opportunities? Boldly going where no goblin has gone before?\n\nNo!\n\nSo, I hope you have those crystals that I sent you after.",c="哇！看起来很劣质呢。也许我们可以将它们使用在第三引擎歧管？\n\n尽管如此，做得好，资浅技师第三级！你很快就可以变成资浅技师第二级了。",cEN="Gah! Those look rough. Maybe we can use them in the tertiary engine manifold chamber?\n\nStill, a good job Junior Technician 3rd Grade! You'll make 2nd Grade in no time."}
Q[10188]={d="多年前，在我们离开艾泽拉斯世界之前，肯瑞托议会曾授予远征军一件威力强大的神器——克拉苏斯的魔符。在我们与兽人的战争中，它的存在就是我们胜利的保障；事实上，这枚魔符还能破除禁锢我的妖术。\n\n但是，凯尔萨斯夺走了我全部的财产，并将魔符交给留驻此地的缚法者玛亚纳保管。玛亚纳若是意识到这件神器的力量，肯定不会心甘情愿地拱手相让。",dEN="Before we departed Azeroth all those years ago, the Kirin Tor entrusted our expedition with a powerful artifact, the Sigil of Krasus. It was a great boon to us in our battle against the orcs and it could play a key role in helping me break the enchantment that imprisons me.\n\nHowever, when Kael'thas divested me of my possessions, he gave the sigil to Spellbinder Maryana, who remained behind with the garrison. If he truly realized what he had in his possession, he wouldn't have given it away so easily.",o="转至紫罗兰之塔西北方的法力熔炉：库鲁恩，从缚法者玛亚纳手中夺得克拉苏斯的魔符。",oEN="Retrieve the Sigil of Krasus from Spellbinder Maryana at Manaforge Coruu, northwest of the Violet Tower.",p="如果我要解开这座塔的诅咒，我就必须有那个魔符。",pEN="If I am to be free of the tower's curse, I must have the sigil.",c="啊，它就像我记得的那样尊贵。你感觉不到从它身上发出的力量吗？\n\n当然，还有很多事要做，但关于魔符的交还，我对你表示深刻的感谢。",cEN="Ah, it is as magnificent as I remembered. Can you not feel the power radiating from it?\n\nOf course, there is much more to be done, but you have my deepest thanks for restoring the sigil to me."}
Q[10189]={d="在来52区的路上，你大概已经发现了一座法力熔炉。那座巨大的紫色建筑物正源源不断地汲取着能量，想起来了吗？\n\n我们奉沙塔尔之命来这儿调查敌情。如果能搞到人员名册就好了。那上面记载着法力熔炉驻军的身份以及他们的计划，都是非常宝贵的信息。\n\n阿拉森上尉率领着一支弩炮队驻扎在法力熔炉：布纳尔外，他手中必定有一本名册。替我们取回布纳尔人员名册。",dEN="You may have noticed one of Kael's manaforges on your way here. You know, the large purple buildings sucking energy from the sky?\n\nWe were sent here by the Sha'tar to investigate them. You can help our information gathering efforts by obtaining a personnel roster. Giving us an idea of who's there and what they do will prove to be invaluable information.\n\nWe believe Captain Arathyn, leading a ballista team just outside of Manaforge B'naar, is in possession of one such roster. Obtain it for us.",o="52区的间谍大师萨罗迪恩要你从法力熔炉：布纳尔外的阿拉森上尉手中夺得布纳尔人员名册。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Spymaster Thalodien at Area 52 wants you to go to the outskirts of Manaforge B'naar and retrieve the B'naar Personnel Roster from Captain Arathyn.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你拿到我要你去拿的东西了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you obtain the items I asked of you, <name>?",c="好极了！有了这份名单我们在瞄准法力熔炉那些凯尔萨斯的部下时就可以做出适合的决定。\n\n真糟糕，我开始爱上随意杀掉他的仆从这件事。",cEN="Excellent! With this roster we can make more educated decisions when targeting Kael's followers at the manaforges.\n\nIt's too bad, I was beginning to take a liking to killing his lackeys indiscriminately."}
Q[10190]={d="我肩负着从废墟中收集机械零件的重要任务，眼下却遭遇了电能不足的麻烦事。\n\n相位猎手——就是那些长得像法力浮龙的生物——体内充满了能量！它们漂浮在虚空中，在这座岛的边缘地带就能找到相位猎手。\n\n将电池装在充能器上，对着虚弱的相位猎手使用充能器，吸满电能后关闭它就行了。",dEN="I have the very important task of collecting the machinery inside these ruins, but I'm having a problem keeping all of my bots charged up.\n\nThe phase hunters - those wyrm-looking things - have lots of energy! You can find them all over the edges of this island, floating in from the nether.\n\nFill the battery on this recharging blaster by using it on a phase hunter when they're very weak, and then finish it off to soak up the last of its energy.",o="对相位猎手使用电池充能器，直到电池充能等级到达10。然后将它交给虚空风暴恩卡特废墟的机器人专家艾蕾。",oEN="Use the Battery Recharging Blaster on enough Phase Hunters to get the Battery Recharge Level to 10. Then return it to Bot-Specialist Alley at the Ruins of Enkaat in the Netherstorm.",p="你已经将电池充满电了吗？",pEN="Have you recharged the battery in that blaster yet?",c="嘿，小心点，看看你拿那东西指着哪儿！你把它设成杀了！！！\n\n看样子你把电池充满了，还充过头了。这下可帮了大忙，能让这些家伙继续撑下去。",cEN="Hey, watch where you're pointing that thing! You've got it set to 'Kill'!!!\n\nIt looks like you've recharged the battery, and then some. This'll help immensely to keep these guys going."}
Q[10191]={d="你好，$r。充能完毕，我的各项机能已全面恢复。\n\n这片废墟中散落着许多脆弱的德莱尼机械装置，我需要将它们回收。我腕部的伸缩装置配有精细的机械臂，以及最新型的可燃及助燃气体吸收泵，可以妥当地处理那些脆弱的装置。\n\n但是，盘踞在废墟中的幽灵很可能会攻击我，因此我需要你和你的朋友陪我一起进去，保护我的安全。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. I am charged up and fully functional.\n\nThere are fragile draenei machines in these ruins, which I must retrieve. I am equipped with delicate servos in my wrist actuators, and the latest in combustion-pneumatic bump soakers. Handling them with care will not be an issue.\n\nHowever, the ghosts that haunt these ruins will likely attack, so I will need you and your friends along for protection.",o="护送麦克斯米林V型穿越恩卡特废墟并返回安全地带，然后与虚空风暴恩卡特废墟外的机器人专家艾蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Escort the Maxx A. Million Mk. V through the Ruins of Enkaat and back out to safety. Then speak with Bot-Specialist Alley just outside the Ruins of Enkaat in the Netherstorm.",p="这么快就回来了？\n\n麦克斯米林V型还好吗？！",pEN="Back so soon?\n\nIs everything okay with the Maxx A. Million Mk. V?!",c="你做到了！你做到了！我要亲你！\n\n喔，该死……麦克斯米林V型又要没电了。啊阿还好，它还够维持到完成这个工作，那才是最重要！\n\n火箭主管弗斯拉格会很乐意将这些德莱尼机械吊挂在X-52虚空火箭里的！那表示是对我的升等！我好开心阿，我一定要给你奖励！\n\n来，从这些里面挑一个吧。",cEN="You did it! You did it! I could just kiss you!\n\nOh, darn... the Maxx A. Million Mk. V is out of juice again. Ah well, he had enough to get the job done, and that's what counts!\n\nRocket-Chief Fuselage will be pleased to get these draenei machines hooked up inside the X-52 Nether-Rocket! That means a promotion for me! I'm so happy, I just have to give you a reward!\n\nHere, take your pick from one of these."}
Q[10192]={d="肯瑞托议会将另一件克拉苏斯的物品也授予了远征军，就是那本名叫《克拉苏斯的魔法纲要》的法术书。书中记载了克拉苏斯掌握的全部法术，这本魔法纲要曾在战争中为我们赢得了巨大的优势。\n\n不过，在凯尔萨斯和他的军队攻陷肯瑞瓦村之前，一个试图修习通灵术的学徒偷走了《克拉苏斯的魔法纲要》。他和他的党羽为了掩人耳目，将纲要分成了数份，各自保存在他们位于镇子南部的家中。",dEN="The Kirin Tor sent one other of Krasus's possessions with our expedition. It was his spellbook, called Krasus's Compendium. Containing all the spells he mastered, it lent us a much-needed advantage in the war.\n\nBefore Kael'thas and his forces laid siege to Kirin'Var, the compendium had been stolen from me by a rebellious apprentice intent on studying necromancy. The apprentice and his followers divided and studied the text in secret, locking themselves inside their houses in the southern part of town.",o="转至肯瑞瓦村的城镇广场，收集克拉苏斯的魔法纲要 - 第一章，克拉苏斯的魔法纲要 - 第二章和克拉苏斯的魔法纲要 - 第三章。",oEN="Reclaim Krasus's Compendium - Chapter 1, Krasus's Compendium - Chapter 2, and Krasus's Compendium - Chapter 3 from Kirin'Var Village's Town Square.",p="你把书带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought the book?",c="<大法师瓦格斯的影像看来像在检查这本手册。>\n\n表皮有点受损，但想想它遭遇过的事，能够保存着真是个奇迹。护送它，$n。没了这本书，我们打破塔的防御的机率就变小了。",cEN="<Archmage Vargoth's image seems to inspect the compendium.>\n\nIt's a little worse for the wear, but considering the treatment it's been through, it's a miracle all of it survived. Safeguard it, <name>. Without it, we stand little chance of being able to break the tower's ward."}
Q[10193]={d="根据名册上的信息，我们查明法力熔炉运作的核心是迁跃大师和迁跃工程师。正是他们负责监督法力熔炉中所谓迁跃能量\"的提取，并通过一套地下管道系统输送到遥远的目的地。\n\n该地区唯一其他的专业人员是地质学家。其余的人要么属于军方，要么是魔导师的走狗；两者都可以轻易替换。\n\n进去，杀掉凯尔的专家。那才会让他最痛。",dEN="Based on the roster information, we know that the brains of the manaforge operations are the warp-masters and warp-engineers. It is they who oversee the retrieval of a so called \"warp-energy\" by the manaforge and its delivery to a remote destination via a system of underground pipes.\n\nThe only other specialists in the area are geologists. Everyone else is either part of the military or a magister crony; both easily replaced.\n\nGet in there and kill Kael's specialists; that's what'll hurt him the most.",o="52区的间谍大师萨罗迪恩要你进入法力熔炉：布纳尔，杀死2名日怒空间主宰、6名日怒迁跃技师和8名日怒地质学家。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Spymaster Thalodien at Area 52 wants you to go to Manaforge B'naar and slay 2 Sunfury Warp-Masters, 6 Sunfury Warp-Engineers and 8 Sunfury Geologists.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="进行的怎样，$n？有任何消息吗？你最近为我做了什么？",pEN="How goes it, <name>? Got any news? What have you done for me lately?",c="你是个可靠的$g家伙:小姑娘，$n。如果还有比我杀掉凯尔萨斯的走狗更让我高兴的事，那就是找其它人来替我下手。\n\n这方法可以让我少沾点血腥。",cEN="You're one reliable fellow, <name>. If there's one thing I like more than killing Kael's lapdogs, it is having someone else do it for me.\n\nLess blood on my clothes that way."}
Q[10194]={d="你外出执行任务时，我们又发现了一座法力熔炉。它位于此地以东，被称为法力熔炉：库鲁恩。\n\n我手下最出色的两名密探已经在这座法力熔炉外设立了秘密的着陆点。请你协助他们潜入敌军内部，窃取一切有用的信息。\n\n到52区外面去找维罗妮娅，她会备好一头双足飞龙，载你转至法力熔炉：库鲁恩。着陆后跟卡勒迪斯·晨光谈谈，他会为你安排任务的。",dEN="While you were gone, my men uncovered another one of these manaforges. It is east of here and is known as Manaforge Coruu.\n\nTwo of my best spies have arranged a secret landing spot outside of the manaforge. You are to help them infiltrate Kael's forces and obtain whatever information you can.\n\nSpeak to Veronia just outside the city walls; she's arranged for a windrider that will take you to Manaforge Coruu. Once there, speak to Caledis Brightdawn; he will brief you on your mission.",o="与52区外的维罗妮娅谈一谈，她会安排你飞往法力熔炉：库鲁恩。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Speak to Veronia outside Area 52 and fly to Manaforge Coruu.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",c="帮你付的机票钱可不便宜。希望你有足够的能耐完成工作。",cEN="Arranging for your flight wasn't cheap. Let's hope you have what it takes to get the job done."}
Q[10197]={d="潜入凯尔军中可不是件容易的事。我可以运用幻象术将你伪装成凯尔的追随者，不过我没法模仿这帮家伙制服上的小细节，那样的话，伪装就很可能被识破。\n\n将一件日怒长袍、一副日怒手套和一枚日怒卫士勋章带回来给我，这样就能让我的幻象术效果更加逼真。",dEN="Infiltrating the ranks of Kael's army will not be an easy task. With my knowledge of illusionary magic I could pass you off as one of Kael's followers, but there are certain details in their uniforms I could not replicate.\n\nBring me a set of their robes, a pair of their gloves and a Sunfury guardsman medallion. This will make the results of my magic much more convincing.",o="收集一件日怒奥术师长袍、一副日怒研究员手套和一枚日怒卫士勋章，然后返回虚空风暴的法力熔炉：库鲁恩，将它们交给卡勒迪斯·晨光。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Obtain a set of Sunfury Arcanist Robes, one pair of Sunfury Researcher Gloves and a Sunfury Guardsman Medallion and bring them to Caledis Brightdawn at Manaforge Coruu in Netherstorm.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",p="你有拿到我要的那些东西吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the outfit pieces I asked of you?",c="太好了！当我完成你的伪装，你就可以混入日怒军队而不被发现了。",cEN="Excellent! When I'm through with you, you will be able to slip among the Sunfury ranks unnoticed."}
Q[10198]={d="我利用你取回的东西做了件日怒制服，并对它施放了幻象术。\n\n几分钟前，指挥官纳萨托·晨铸来到法力熔炉：库鲁恩，准备与奥术师阿尔杜尼斯会面。纳萨托随身带着一帮护卫，他们必定是准备商谈要事。潜入日怒军营，看看能不能探得这次会面的详情。\n\n啊，差点忘了。你最好离奥术傀儡远些，它们在法力熔炉中巡逻，可以看穿伪装上的幻象术。",dEN="I've prepared a uniform with the pieces you obtained. It is magically enhanced to complete the illusion.\n\nWe spotted Commander Dawnforge going in to meet Arcanist Ardonis a few minutes ago. He had a full retinue of guards with him, so whatever they're discussing is bound to be incredibly important; see if you can catch any of it.\n\nOh, I almost forgot. You'll want to stay away from the arcane golems patrolling the manaforge. They will see right through the illusion.",o="利用日怒伪装包进入法力熔炉：库鲁恩，偷听指挥官纳萨托·晨铸和奥术师阿尔杜尼斯的谈话。完成任务后向法力熔炉：库鲁恩的卡勒迪斯·晨光复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Use the Sunfury Disguise, go into Manaforge Coruu and listen to the conversation between Commander Dawnforge and Arcanist Ardonis. Report back to Caledis Brightdawn at Manaforge Coruu after completing this task.\n\nCompleting tasks for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="窃听的如何阿，$n？你最好快一点。我已经开始坐立不安了。",pEN="How goes the eavesdropping, <name>? You'd best hurry. I'm getting antsy here.",c="法力熔炉杜隆有困难？我相信间谍大师萨洛迪恩会很想听到这个消息。我们先专注在这里的工作吧。",cEN="Manaforge Duro is in trouble? I'm sure Thalodien will love to hear the news. Let's wrap up the job here first."}
Q[10199]={d="眼下只缺最后一种原料了，它可以让这瓶混合物发挥额外的效力。\n\n瞧见那些在岩肤劫掠者旁边游荡的虚空鳐了吗？它们的钉刺就再好不过了。替我收集一些虚空鳐的钉刺，我就能分解出其中的毒液！\n\n只要在混合物中加入这种毒液，效果肯定好得很！",dEN="So, I'm just missing the one ingredient that'll give my concoction that little extra kick that it needs.\n\nThe sting of the nether rays, roaming around near the shaleskin flayers, delivers quite a punch. Bring me some of their stingers and I'll extract the venom right out of them!\n\nI'm certain the results will be explosive!",o="将5根虚空鳐的钉刺交给虚空风暴52区的布兹。",oEN="Obtain 5 Nether Ray Stingers for Boots at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="如果我能从这些虚空鳐的钉刺萃取出足够的毒液，我想我们会拥有有史以来最具爆炸性的燃料！",pEN="If I can drain the venom from enough of those nether ray stingers, I think we might just have the most explosive fuel ever devised!",c="哇噢！好极了，现在我们正在讨论呢！\n\n就让我拿着这些小美人们将不好的东西挤出来。这实在该做成一桶火箭燃料酒将大家狠狠的击飞！\n\n来，就让我将岩肤油及这个刺毒混在一起，看看会发生什么事……",cEN="Wow! Alright, now we're talking!\n\nLet me just take those little beauties and squeeze the badness right out of them. This should make a rocket fuel brew that'll blow everyone's socks off!\n\nHere, just let me mix the shale oil and this stinger venom together, and we'll see what happens...."}
Q[10200]={d="最好立即把这消息告诉萨罗迪恩，我会留下来毁掉我们曾在这儿活动的证据。\n\n如果凯尔发现我们的踪迹就完蛋了。我们窃听秘密的行动还是不要让敌人发觉比较好。",dEN="It would be best if this information got back to Thalodien as soon as possible. I'll stay here and cover our tracks.\n\nIt wouldn't do us much good to have Kael'thas find out what we were snooping around here. Secret information is always better if your enemy doesn't know you have it.",o="返回虚空风暴的52区，向间谍大师萨罗迪恩复命。",oEN="Return to Spymaster Thalodien at Area 52 in Netherstorm.",c="你一直都令我惊讶，$n。那真是你在揭露法力熔炉寇鲁这项秘密行动中莫大的功绩。",cEN="You do not cease to amaze me, <name>. That was quite the feat of stealth you pulled off at Manaforge Coruu."}
Q[10201]={d="这些油总算准备好了，现在我们马上准备开始进行第一次试验。这种油质量很重，看起来是一种非常好的的武器油。\n\n不过，要真正验证这一点，还是得靠专家。看到那边通缉公告旁边站着的葛雷克了吗？噢，好吧，他虽然不是一个耍笔杆子的普通“专家”，但所有的兽人都知道他耍枪的本事！\n\n将这个油的样本带去给他，让他用他的枪去试试。等他试验完之后，告诉我他觉得这个油怎么样。",dEN="The oil is finally ready for its first test. It seems heavy enough to serve as a high quality weapon oil.\n\nThe only way to find out is to have a professional try it out. See Grek over there by the wanted posters? Sure, he's no poet, but the orc knows his way around a weapon!\n\nTake a sample of the oil to him and ask him to use it on his weapon. After he's had a chance to test it out, let me know what he thinks of it.",o="找到葛雷克，让他用枪试试油的品质。试验完成之后，向拉克妮亚报告结果。",oEN="Find Grek and ask him to try it on his weapon. Once he's tried out the oil, return to Rakoria with the results.",p="那么，你有测试的结果了吗？",pEN="Well, do you have the test results?",c="<拉克妮亚听你讲完了测试的结果，然后她仰头大笑。>",cEN="<You tell Rakoria the results of the test and she throws her head back, laughing.>"}
Q[10202]={d="有位日怒魔导师最近频频与我们联系，称自己想要背叛凯尔投靠占星者，并说他掌握着对我们有利的重要信息。我们调查过此人的底细，确定他不是凯尔派来的卧底，便接纳了他的诚意。\n\n他暂时还呆在法力熔炉：艾拉，因此我们之间的交流变得极其困难。跟他谈谈，看看他都知道些什么内幕消息。就算他提供的信息只有他吹嘘的一半重要，我们也可以利用他办事。",dEN="We've recently been contacted by a Sunfury magister who wishes to join our ranks and swears he has information we're in need of. We've checked our informants to make sure he's not a double agent and he checks out.\n\nHe's stationed in Manaforge Ara which makes communication difficult. Talk to him and see what he knows. If he's half as useful as he claims to be, we'll be able to put him to good use.",o="转至法力熔炉：艾拉，与魔导师塞雷杜恩谈一谈。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Go to Manaforge Ara and speak to Magister Theledorn.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",c="该是你上场的时候了。我开始怀疑占星者是不是真的感兴趣。",cEN="It's about time you showed up. I was beginning to wonder if the Scryers were interested at all."}
Q[10203]={d="看到横穿52区的那道裂隙了吗？那是我们弄出来的！\n\n它给X-52虚空火箭提供了各种好东西，可我们的装备快不够用了。\n\n我们原本在东南方的阿尔克隆废墟有个行动点，直到燃烧军团插了进来。我要你把这台超强解构电击器带到废墟去。用它把我们的装备传送给裂隙下面的首席爆破师布拉斯特菲兹。\n\n三级初级技师$n，这是你晋升的机会。别搞砸了！<sonrisa>",dEN="See the fissure running through Area 52? We did that!\n\nIt's yielding up all sorts of goodies for the X-52 Nether-Rocket, but we're running short on equipment.\n\nWe had an operation at the Arklon Ruins to the southeast until the Burning Legion moved in. I need you to take this Ultra Deconsolodation Zapper to the ruins. Use it to beam our gear back to Lead Sapper Blastfizzle down in the fissure.\n\nJunior Technician 3rd Grade <name>, this is your chance for that promotion. Don't blow it!",o="利用超级拆解器将高转速挖掘器、机械气压挖掘爪、多光谱地形扫描仪和一大车炸药带回52区。然后向虚空风暴52区裂隙东端的首席工兵布拉斯特菲兹报到。",oEN="Use the Ultra Deconsolodation Zapper to beam the Hyper Rotational Dig-A-Matic, Servo-Pneumatic Dredging Claw, Multi-Spectrum Terrain Analyzer, and the Big Wagon Full of Explosives back to Area 52. Then report to Lead Sapper Blastfizzle at the eastern end of the fissure that runs through Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="这地方是不是很棒啊？而且每天都生产出崭新且奇特的东西！\n\n真是幸运，我们差点在探钻下来时毁了这座城镇。",pEN="Isn't this place great? And everyday yields something new and exotic!\n\nWhat a stroke of luck that we nearly destroyed the town digging down here.",c="你一定就是那个从废墟中把所有损坏的设备都传回我们这里的人！为你喝彩！\n\n我已经重新将这些设备配置到我们其它的地点。现在我们就能够借由一项重要的命令来加速我们在这整个岛的裂缝作用！虚空火箭要马上完成！\n\n呃呃，那是之后的事。等等，你说你传了4个回来给我们吗？我只收到3个……",cEN="You must be the one that zapped all of that sapping equipment back to us here from the ruins! Hooray for you!\n\nI've already reallocated the equipment out to our other locations. Now we'll be able to expedite our fissure operations on this whole island by an order of magnitude! The nether-rocket will be completed in no time!\n\nHmmm, that's odd. Wait a minute, did you say that you sent four things back to us? I only got three..."}
Q[10204]={d="凯尔的魔导师已将法力熔炉使用得炉火纯青，瞬间就能汲取到大量能量。\n\n他们利用小块的血宝石碎片，从巨大的血宝石水晶中源源不断地抽取能量。\n\n转至法力熔炉：布纳尔，从日怒魔导师手中夺得一块碎片，然后用这块碎片汲取大块水晶的能量。\n\n完成任务后回到我这儿来，让我研究能量光环的效果。别担心，它所引发的任何副作用都只是暂时的。",dEN="Kael's magisters have refined their usage of mana crystals to the point where they can siphon large amounts of energy in a matter of seconds.\n\nThey do this by attuning smaller bloodgem crystal shards to larger, fully charged ones.\n\nGo to Manaforge B'naar and obtain one of these shards from a Sunfury magister and use it to siphon energy from one of the larger crystals.\n\nReturn to me so that I may study the effects of the aura. Do not worry; any side effects should be temporary.",o="魔导师拉恩娜要你进入法力熔炉：布纳尔，从日怒魔导师手中夺得血宝石碎片。在较大的血宝石水晶附近使用这块碎片，然后返回52区向她复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Magistrix Larynna wants you to go to Manaforge B'naar and obtain a Bloodgem Shard from a Sunfury Magister. Use this shard near the larger Bloodgem crystals and return to her at Area 52.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你调查过日怒博学者使用的那些血宝石了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you investigate the bloodgems used by the Sunfury magisters, <name>?",c="嗯嗯……就如同我想得一样。\n\n暴露在这种等级的原始能量下大幅扩大了我们与生俱来的魔法沉溺。\n\n我不意外凯尔因为这样而侥幸成功基本上他所有的部下都是喝这个的。",cEN="Hmmm... just as I suspected.\n\nExposure to this level of raw energy greatly magnifies our innate addiction to magic.\n\nI'm not surprised Kael gets away with what he does; all his subordinates are basically drunk on this."}
Q[10205]={d="迁跃掠夺者奈萨德必须解决掉！我不知道他是怎么在我那一击下活下来的，但不能让他继续在外面搞他的勾当。\n\n回去干掉奈萨德。他在废料堆西南角附近设了一个小型的虚灵营地。\n\n别像我一样失手，$c。",dEN="Warp-Raider Nesaad must be dealt with! I have no idea how he survived my attack, but he cannot be allowed to continue his operation out there.\n\nGo back and take out Nesaad. He keeps a small ethereal camp near the southwestern corner of the Heap.\n\nDon't fail like I did, <class>.",o="杀死星界强盗奈萨德，然后返回虚空风暴52区，向虚空猎手卡尔伊复命。",oEN="Kill Warp-Raider Nesaad and then return to Nether-Stalker Khay'ji at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="结束了吗？星界强盗奈萨德死了？",pEN="It's over then? Warp-Raider Nesaad is dead?",c="听到那个杂碎终于被解决了真是松了口气。你做得很好，$n……我可以这样放肆的直呼你的名讳吗？\n\n如果你愿意的话，我有另一个任务需要完成。一个非常重要而且很明显的你应该能够轻易应付的对象。",cEN="It's a relief to hear that scum is finally dealt with. You do good work, <name>... may I be so forward as to call you by your name?\n\nIf you're willing, I have another task that needs doing. One that is very important and someone of your obvious skill should be able to handle with ease."}
Q[10206]={d="那些奸猾的虚灵和我们一样，都是彻头彻尾的机会主义者。他们渴望得到利益，我就给他们利益。但是没有人，我是说没有人，可以染指爆缸航天局的财产！\n\n南边那块机甲废场是我们的，我们没说给他们，他们不能抢！\n\n要制造出伟大的虚空火箭X-52，我们需要一切能够得到的新技术。我们必须以同样的手段回敬那帮偷东西的虚灵，这样才显得公平。\n\n不如你现在就去机甲废场，看看能不能从他们鼻子底下搞些他们的科技成果来。",dEN="Those ethereal clowns are as opportunistic as us, I'll give them that. But no one, and I mean NO ONE, moves in on a B.O.O.M. claim!\n\nThe Heap to the south is ours!\n\nIf we're to finish the X-52 Nether-Rocket, we're going to need all of the new tech that we can get our hands on. And since the ethereals are stealing from us, I think it's only fair that we repay them in kind.\n\nWhy don't you head down there and see if you can acquire some of their technology out from under their noses!",o="收集10件虚灵科技的产品碎片，将它们交给虚空风暴52区的维勒老爹。",oEN="Collect 10 pieces of Ethereal Technology and return them to Papa Wheeler at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="这么快就带着他们的技术回来咯？你最好不要只是在这扯我的后腿，$c。\n\n这里的X-52计划成功与否，就全靠你赶快将那些东西带来给我们了！",pEN="Back with their tech so soon? You better not just be pulling my leg here, <class>.\n\nThe success of the X-52 project out here depends upon you getting us that stuff a.s.a.p.!",c="嘿嘿，虚灵组织的混蛋！\n\n感谢你为我们带来了这三个部分，$c。我发誓我会将这些小宝贝们好好的勾在火箭内。我怀疑他们在做些什么？应该会找得很快乐吧！\n\n嗯嗯，我看看是否我可以挖出点钱来打发你。",cEN="Hehe, ethereal suckers!\n\nThanks for getting us these parts, <class>. I bet we can just hook these babies right up inside the rocket. I wonder what they do? Should be fun finding out!\n\nHmm, let me see if I can dig up some pocket change to throw your way."}
Q[10208]={d="就在此地正东方，是军团前线。前线各处分布着地狱火传送门和门户，用来向地狱火半岛乃至整个外域输送增援。我们要摧毁那些传送门！\n\n带上这些起爆药。它们由52区设计，用恶魔自身的力量作炸药！击败希卢斯传送门和克鲁尔传送门周围的军团部队，收集恶魔符文石，用起爆药在传送门内引爆四块符文石，然后看着吧！任务完成后回来见我。",dEN="Directly east of here is the Legion Front. Spaced across the front are infernal portals and gateways, used to bring reinforcements to Hellfire Peninsula and throughout Outland. We're going to destroy those portals!\n\nTake these primers. Designed in Area 52, they use the demons' own power as an explosive! Defeat Legion forces around Portals Xilus and Kruul to gather demonic rune stones, use the primer to detonate four stones inside the portals, and watch! Return to me when your mission is complete.",o="消灭希鲁斯传送门和科卢尔传送门附近的敌人，收集它们身上的恶魔符文石。\n\n然后在希鲁斯传送门和科卢尔传送门内使用托尔克的雷管。\n\n完成任务后，将剩馀的炸药还给地狱火半岛机甲残骸处的托尔克。",oEN="Defeat enemies around Portal Xilus and Portal Kruul to gather Demonic Rune Stones.\n\nUse To'arch's Primer within Portal Xilus and Portal Kruul.\n\nReturn to To'arch with To'arch's Primers at Reaver's Fall in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="军团会对你带给他们的惊喜措手不及，对吧，$n？",pEN="The Legion won't be prepared for the surprise you have for them, eh <name>?",c="做得好！我从这里几乎还能感觉到爆炸的震动！\n\n现在，我们还有一个爆炸任务要给你……",cEN="Well done! I could almost feel the tremors of the explosions from here!\n\nNow, we have one more bombing mission for you..."}
Q[10209]={d="接下来你必须帮我救出我的魔宠格拉修斯，它被血精灵召唤师坎西恩捉去了。在凯尔萨斯派来毁灭肯瑞瓦村的军队中，坎西恩是地位最高的魔导师之一。他将格拉修斯当作战利品，得意地在其它人面前炫耀。\n\n当然，我敢肯定这个蠢货一定尝试过强迫格拉修斯为他效力。从占卜结果来看，坎西恩就在“法力熔炉：杜隆”，你应该知道这个地方吧。",dEN="The next thing we must do is reclaim my familiar, Glacius, from the blood elf summoner who holds it captive. Summoner Kanthin was one of the most senior magisters in the force Kael'thas sent to decimate Kirin'Var. It's only natural that he would claim my familiar as a kind of trophy.\n\nI'm certain that Kanthin, fool that he is, has tried to compel Glacius to serve him. My scrying has revealed that Kanthin is now stationed at 'Manaforge Duro,' if that terminology has any meaning for you.",o="转至位于日怒堡北部岛屿的法力熔炉：杜隆，从召唤者坎西恩手中夺回格拉修斯之石。",oEN="Defeat Summoner Kanthin at Manaforge Duro, on the island to the north of Sunfury Hold, and reclaim the Stone of Glacius from him.",p="你有安全的取拿到格拉修斯之石吗？",pEN="Have you secured the Stone of Glacius?",c="<你不确定这是苦恼呢，还是这位大法师真的是在笑。>\n\n随着我的最后一个财产归还，我有了所有用来破解凯尔萨斯魔法所需要的物品。我现在就要开始执行法术了。",cEN="<You're not sure whether it's just distortion. or the archmage really is smiling.>\n\nWith the last of my possessions restored, I have everything I need to break through Kael'thas's magic. I'll begin working the spell right away."}
Q[10210]={d="欢迎来到沙塔斯城，$c。这里或许是整个外域里唯一能让你感觉到安全的地方。\n\n一群自称为沙塔尔的纳鲁赶走了这附近的所有恶魔。\n\n如果你从来没有见过纳鲁，那么或许你该去看看圣光广场内的阿达尔。这位沙塔尔的领袖的外貌比我见过的任何生物都要使人敬畏。他们的出现，真是令这里与这片荒凉大地上的任何其它地方都变得截然不同了。",dEN="Welcome to Shattrath City, <class>. This might be the one place in all of Outland where you'll find any semblance of safety.\n\nA group of naaru known as the Sha'tar drove the demons away from here.\n\nIf you've never met a naaru, you ought to see A'dal inside the Terrace of Light. The leader of the Sha'tar is an awe-inspiring sight if I ever saw one. Sure is a change of pace from anything else in this bleak land.",o="与沙塔尔的领袖阿达尔谈一谈，他就在圣光广场的中央。",oEN="Speak to A'dal, the leader of the Sha'tar, in the center of the Terrace of Light.",c="<在你与阿达尔谈话时，充斥着你感官的圣光和你接近阿达尔时一样强烈。合谐的钟声不停的萦绕在你的脑海里。>\n\n<你在这觉得很安全。>",cEN="<The light that filled your senses as you approached A'dal intensifies as you address him. Melodic chimes continue to ring within your head.>\n\n<You are safe here.>"}
Q[10211]={d="别拿那么多的问题去打扰阿达尔，$c。他是你所能面对的最强大的存在。\n\n你看起来有点陌生。我猜你应该很想了解一些有关这座城市的事吧？\n\n我本想亲自带你去参观这里，可我不巧需要和阿达尔讨论一些战略决策。那么我召唤一位仆从代替我去如何？希望你不会觉得这样很失礼。好，那就这样吧！",dEN="Do not burden A'dal with petty inquisitions, <class>. That just might be the most powerful being you ever come face to face with.\n\nYou do not look familiar. I suppose you want to learn about the city?\n\nYou'll have to excuse me if I don't give you a tour myself, but I'm a bit busy discussing strategy with A'dal. Perhaps you'll find a summoned servant acceptable in my stead? Excellent!",o="跟随卡德加的仆从游览城市并聆听这里的历史故事。完成任务后回去向卡德加复命。",oEN="Follow Khadgar's servant and listen to its story. Return to Khadgar after completing this task.",p="人类的故事是短暂的，$n。而城市的故事才能长远流传。",pEN="The stories of men are ephemeral, <name>. The stories of cities last well into the years.",c="我希望你有学到一两件有关沙塔斯的事，$n。也许需要点时间才有办法了解所有的事情。",cEN="I hope you learned a thing or two about Shattrath, <name>. It might take some time for things to sink in."}
Q[10212]={d="离开之前，我必须交代好奥格瑞玛的事务。告诉祖母，她的孙子很快就去看望她了。",dEN="I must set things in order before I leave. Return to the Greatmother and tell her that her grandson comes.",o="回纳格兰加拉达尔去见盖亚安祖母。|n",oEN="Return to Greatmother Geyah at Garadar in Nagrand.",c="你真是玛格汉的$g英雄:英雄;，$n。要不是你，我们肯定早就被食人魔和破碎者侵占了。\n\n我们是个贫穷的民族，但确实有一些蕴含力量的器物。请你务必从我们的箱子里挑一件。",cEN="You are truly the hero of the Mag'har, <name>. If not for you, we would have surely been overrun by the ogres and Broken.\n\nWe are a poor people but we do have some artifacts of power. Please, I insist that you take from our coffer."}
Q[10213]={d="当我在荒野中受伤休息的时候，我目睹了一起地精飞艇坠毁的事故。它坠落在了西北边的远征军物资库那边。\n\n飞艇着了火，一些地精浑身冒火，尖叫着像火球般从空中跌落下来。当然，我的伤痛非常严重，而且我流了很多血，以上这些可能只是我的幻觉。\n\n如果你能找到幸存者的话，我们可以在断背岗哨为他们提供庇护所。",dEN="When I was wounded in the wastes I saw a goblin zeppelin crash. It went down to the northwest, beyond the Expedition Armory.\n\nThe zeppelin was on fire. Shrieking, burning goblins were falling like bombs from the sky. Of course I was in a lot of pain and I had lost a lot of blood. I may have imagined the whole thing.\n\nIf you can find any survivors, we can offer them sanctuary here at Spinebreaker Post.",o="寻找飞艇坠毁事故的幸存者。",oEN="Search for crash survivors.",c="我们是被燃烧军团击中坠毁的，虽然我们有挥舞休战的旗帜。谁知道燃烧军团会这么残暴？\n\n我们不能跟你去断背岗哨。我们需要修理我们的飞艇并重新上路。",cEN="We were shot down by the Burning Legion, even though we waved a flag of truce. Who knew the Burning Legion was so mean?\n\nWe cannot come with you to Spinebreaker Post. We need to repair our zeppelin and be on our way."}
Q[10216]={d="沙法尔手下的虚灵将我们完全隔绝在了法力陵墓外。不过我已经想好了对付他的法子。虽然我们无法从正门进入，但是陵墓内应该设有好几台传送器。\n\n我要你去替我的手下清理陵墓的通路，然后激活传送器，将我们传送到法力陵墓中。\n\n通路清理完毕后，直接激活沙法尔的房间之前那个房间中的传送器就可以了。放心吧，我不会让你白跑这一趟的……",dEN="Shaffar's ethereals have completely blocked us out of the Mana-Tombs. Thankfully, I've got a plan. While we can't go in through the front door, there are sure to be several transporters inside.\n\nI want you to clear the way for my crew first and then I want you to activate one of their transporters to teleport us inside.\n\nActivate the teleporter in the chamber right before Shaffar's chambers when the way has been cleared. Don't worry, I'll make it worth your while...",o="工匠莫法鲁斯要你杀死10个虚灵盗墓者、5个虚灵巫师、5个节点盗贼和5个虚灵缚法者。\n\n全部搞定之后，激活沙法尔房间的前一个房间中的虚灵传送器。",oEN="Artificer Morphalius wants you to kill 10 Ethereal Crypt Raiders, 5 Ethereal Sorcerers, 5 Nexus Stalkers and 5 Ethereal Spellbinders.\n\nOnce that's done, find the Ethereal Transporter in the chamber before Shaffar's and activate it.",p="这个装备有上百个按钮，没有一个你能看得懂的。",pEN="This device has over a dozen buttons, none of which look familiar to you.",c="<你闭上了眼睛按了一个钮。>",cEN="<You close your eyes and press a button.>"}
Q[10218]={d="你以为是谁！？莫法鲁斯那个饭桶已经被“降职”了，现在由我来处理他留下的烂摊子。我只有一件事需要你帮忙，在我从沙法尔的灵体收集器中收集灵体能量时保护我。如果我顺利完成使命的话，哈拉迈德会亲自奖励你的！\n\n怎么样？护送我穿越法力陵墓并收集这些令人目瞪口呆的宝藏，听起来如何？你看，你已经完成大部分的工作了！我们身后已经没有活的东西了，不是吗？",dEN="Who were you expecting!? That idiot Morphalius was 'de-prioritized.' Now I'm here to clean up his mess. All I need from you is to watch my back as I go through Shaffar's ether gatherers and suck them dry of all that they have collected. If I successfully complete my mission, Haramad himself will reward you!\n\nWhat do you say? Escort me through the Mana-Tombs and then collect some incredible treasure? You already did most of the work anyway! Nothing's alive back behind us, right?",o="护送低温工程师沙赫恩穿过法力陵墓，在他从沙法尔的灵体收集器中收集灵体能量时保护他。\n\n完成任务后向节点亲王哈拉迈德复命，他就在星界财团设立在法力陵墓外的营地中。",oEN="Escort Cryo-Engineer Sha'heen safely through the Mana-Tombs so that he can gather the ether held inside Shaffar's ether collectors.\n\nReport to Nexus-Prince Haramad located outside the Mana-Tombs at the Consortium encampment should you succeed.",p="嗨，小噬尸兽。",pEN="Hello, little flesh beast.",c="看看工匠莫法鲁斯的点子的成果，我决定让他复职了。做得好啊小噬尸兽。的确是做得好！\n\n记住，要是你想找工作或是到虚空风暴的时候，到风暴尖塔来找我。",cEN="Seeing as how this was Morphalius's idea, I decided to give him his old job back. Well done little flesh beast. Well done, indeed!\n\nRemember, if you're ever looking for work and happen to be in Netherstorm, come find me at the Stormspire."}
Q[10220]={d="我到这里来是为了和那些阴魂进行交流的。这些阴魂过去曾是一群值得骄傲的联盟士兵，但很久之前，他们全部都战死了。从此以后，他们被诅咒的灵魂就盘踞在西边的遗迹中。\n\n若是他们能够加入我们，我们就可以得到一批强力的援军了。想想吧，这样一群拥有不死之身的战士能够帮助我们御敌，那该有多好。可是，这些阴魂都因仇恨而变得疯狂与扭曲，恐怕不会与我好好交流。\n\n或许，我们应该使用武力逼迫他们与我们结盟。",dEN="I was sent here to make contact with the Unyielding spirits. These once proud Alliance soldiers were defeated long ago, and now their cursed spirits haunt the ruins to the west.\n\nIf they would only join us we would gain a powerful ally. Imagine, a legion of undying warriors to use against our enemies. But these undead are mad with hatred and will not listen to me.\n\nPerhaps they can be forced to join us.",o="莫迪巴要求你转至断背岗哨以西的远征军物资库，击败12个步兵的阴魂、8个骑士的阴魂和6个巫师的阴魂。",oEN="Mordiba wants you to defeat 12 Unyielding Footmen, 8 Unyielding Knights, and 6 Unyielding Sorcerers at the Expedition Armory to the west of Spinebreaker Post.",p="你让那些不屈的灵魂见识到反抗被遗忘者的下场了吗？",pEN="Have you taught the Unyielding the consequences of defying the Forsaken?",c="这些灵魂已经知道部落的力量了。毋庸置疑，他们很快就会接受听取我的结盟提议的。",cEN="The Unyielding have felt the strength of the Horde. No doubt they will soon be in the mood to listen to my proposed alliance."}
Q[10221]={d="$n，斯巴奇·尤伯萨斯特这家伙以前一直在我的保护之下。我们来到52区后，他老是不肯带上虚空头盔，终于在某一天摇身一变，成了臭名昭着的砰砰博士！\n\n他偷走了许多重要的挖掘设备，躲藏在东北方的某处营地！他和他的那些砰砰机器人已经对52区构成了巨大的威胁。\n\n我要你立即转至城镇外砰砰博士的营地，结果他的性命！利用这些砰砰厄运炸弹炸飞他。\n\n小心点，不要离他或者那些砰砰机器人太近！",dEN="<name>, my former protege, Sparky Uberthruster, wouldn't wear his helmet while down here and one day transformed into the infamous Dr. Boom!\n\nAnd he stole off to the northeast with most of our sapping equipment! He and his Boom Bots have been a menace to Area 52 ever since.\n\nI need you to go to his Camp of Boom just outside of town and put an end to him! Use these Boom's Doom bombs to take him out.\n\nAnd make sure not to get too close to him or his Boom Bots!",o="杀死砰砰博士，然后将胜利的消息汇报给虚空风暴52区的首席工兵布拉斯特菲兹。",oEN="Kill Dr. Boom and return with the good news to Lead Sapper Blastfizzle at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="你将我们从砰砰博士的蹂躏中解救出来了吗？我发誓现在将不会有任何爆炸性的武器了，虽然那非常的有趣！\n\n我们真的应该要常常那样做。",pEN="Have you saved us from the depredations of Dr. Boom? I promise this time there won't be any exploding wagons, though that was a lot of fun!\n\nWe really should do that more often.",c="我会一直想念斯帕奇。但如今既然他不在了，知道砰砰博士再也不能吓唬我们，我们都能睡得安稳些了！\n\n就让这成为给你的一个教训吧。不戴虚空头盔就别到这儿来！\n\n说吧，我该怎么报答你？<Snif>",cEN="I'll always miss Sparky. But we'll all sleep better now knowing that as Dr. Boom he is no longer around to terrorize us!\n\nJust let this be a lesson to you. Don't come down here without a nether helmet!\n\nNow, how can I repay you?"}
Q[10222]={d="凯尔萨斯王子的军队摧毁了肯瑞瓦村，将大法师囚禁在紫罗兰之塔，然后便退驻到了东北方的日怒堡。我们眼睁睁地看着他们庆祝着“伟大的胜利”却毫无复仇之力。\n\n绝不能容忍他们这样行恶！为我们的复仇事业而战吧，$n。转至日怒堡，让那些双手沾满鲜血的罪人得到正义的裁决。",dEN="After Prince Kael'thas's forces destroyed the village and imprisoned the archmage in the Violet Tower, they withdrew to Sunfury Hold to the northeast. The very men who destroyed our village and slew our fellows toast their 'amazing victory' while we are helpless to avenge the fallen.\n\nWe must not allow these crimes to go unanswered! Be the instrument of our vengeance, <name>. Go to Sunfury Hold and claim the lives of those responsible for this crime.",o="肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯要你杀死10名日怒射手。",oEN="Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village wants you to kill 10 Sunfury Archers.",p="完成了吗，$n！你已经为了肯瑞瓦村庄的沦陷复仇了吗？",pEN="Is it done, <name>? Have you avenged the fallen of Kirin'Var Village?",c="你今日所做的事虽然永远无法挽回村子的沦陷，可也许这有助于安抚他们的灵魂。虽然，说实话，再多的暴力行为都无法平息我对凯尔萨斯的怒火。",cEN="What you've done this day can never bring back the fallen, but perhaps it can help soothe their spirits. Although, truth be told, no amount of blood can quench my anger over the actions of Kael'thas."}
Q[10223]={d="我永远都不会忘记袭击肯瑞瓦村的血精灵首领。他穿着一身血红色的铠甲，佩戴着我从未见过的徽章。\n\n跟其它血精灵军官不同，这位残忍的首领竟然冲锋在最前线。那场战争中，许多肯瑞托法师都死在他的箭下。他在日怒堡驻留了一段时间，然后就被凯尔萨斯派去法力熔炉：杜隆，镇压那里的骚乱。$n，找到他的下落，让他的弓弦永久沉寂吧。",dEN="I'll never forget the blood elf who led the attack. He wore a tabard with a device I've never seen before, over top of crimson armor.\n\nHe was ferocious and merciless, leading from the front where most other blood elf officers would never be seen. He was responsible for the deaths of many Kirin Tor mages that day, but he didn't linger long at Sunfury Hold. Kael'thas has ordered him to Manaforge Duro to aid in their attempt to control the area. Find him, <name>, and silence his bow for good.",o="肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯要你杀死达尔利斯·晨击。",oEN="Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village wants you to kill Master Daellis Dawnstrike.",p="你完成任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you finished the task, <name>?",c="<你并不确定，但是看起来管理者戴沃斯已经快要落泪了。>\n\n终于，结束了。如果我可以选择离开这个世界，我会的，但事实上我却不知道该如何放手。为了那些在村庄牺牲的人们，这是个困难但明确的决定。我想这就是我们为了在这个地方维持强大势力所要付出的代价吧。",cEN="<You're not certain, but it seems as though Custodian Dieworth is on the verge of tears.>\n\nAt last, it is through. If I could will myself out of existence, I would, but the truth is I don't know how to let go. For the ones in the village, it is difficult but straightforward. I suppose this is the price we pay for retaining such strong ties to this place."}
Q[10224]={d="身为X-52的技术主管，我必须确保这艘虚空火箭的主引擎具备最优化的性能。\n\n可惜我到现在都还没有把这些主引擎造出来。\n\n$C，眼下的情况非常窘迫！除了引擎核心外，所有的零件都齐了。\n\n不过，我想我们可以利用法力怨魂的精华来发动引擎。\n\n它们遍布在岛屿北部那些闪闪发光的沟渠附近。当然，52区里可没这种生物。",dEN="As the X-52's chief of engineering, I have to see to it that the nether-rocket's main engines are in tip-top shape.\n\nUnfortunately, I haven't built them yet.\n\n<class>, I'm in dire straits here! I have almost all of the parts. All that I'm missing is the engine core.\n\nLuckily for us, I think we can make use of the essence from the local mana wraiths to jump-start the engines.\n\nThey can be found near most of the glowing trenches in the northern part of the island. Except for here in Area 52, of course.",o="将7块法力怨魂精华交给虚空风暴52区的主工程师特雷普。",oEN="Collect 7 Mana Wraith Essences and return them to Chief Engineer Trep at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="你拿到所有精华了吗？",pEN="You have all of those essences yet?",c="哇喔，好多精华喔！\n\n好了，让我们看看将它及以太锂矩阵水晶混合后会发生什么事。",cEN="Wow, that's a lot of essence!\n\nOk, let's see what happens when I mix it with the etherlithium matrix crystals."}
Q[10225]={d="$n！我要你将这些以太锂水晶交给主工程师特雷普，他是我们的，嗯，领头的工程师。\n\n他应该知道如何处理这些水晶。如果他不知道，你就在那里盯着他，直到他想出法子来！",dEN="<name>! I need you to take all of these etherlithium crystals over to Chief Engineer Trep, my, uh, chief of engineering.\n\nHe should know what to do with them. And if he doesn't, you see to it that he finds out!",o="将以太锂矩阵水晶交给虚空风暴52区的主工程师特雷普。",oEN="Deliver the Etherlithium Matrix Crystals to Chief Engineer Trep at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="嗯，嗨。我现在有点忙。你有什么东西要给我吗？",pEN="Um, hi. I'm a little busy here. What's that you have there?",c="喔，以太锂矩阵水晶。耶，这些听起来很重要耶！\n\n就放在这边，我会尽快找出它们的用途。",cEN="Ooh, etherlithium matrix crystals. Yeah, those sound important!\n\nLet's just put them over here and I'll get to figuring them out in a moment."}
Q[10226]={d="该死，这玩意根本就不行！\n\n噢噢，我想到个新主意！我曾让塞希罗制作过一台元素能量萃取器，不知道这东西收集来的能量管不管用，但至少我们可以试试。\n\n南边的碎裂废土分布着许多碎裂的滚石和迁跃畸变体，它们体内的能量可以发动引擎！\n\n击败元素生物后，利用这台萃取器将它们的能量转化为便于收集的固体。然后把那些固体带回来给我就行啦。",dEN="Darn it, that didn't do it!\n\nOk, I've got another idea! I had Xyrol whip up an elemental power extractor. I'm not certain exactly what this power will do, but I know that I can use it.\n\nThe sundered rumblers and warp aberrations on the ledge of the Crumbling Wastes to the south have just what I need for the engines!\n\nThe extractor will change the form of their power into something solid that you'll be able to gather up after you've defeated them.",o="萃取5份元素能量，将它们交给虚空风暴52区的主工程师特雷普。",oEN="Extract 5 Elemental Power for Chief Engineer Trep at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="你从那些元素生物身上得到力量了没？喔，我不是想催你或什么的。只不过我的生活及工作都靠你了。",pEN="You have the power from those elementals yet? Oh, don't hurry or anything. It's just my life and career on the line.",c="这才像话嘛！太好了，现在我想我们可以开工了。\n\n就让我将这些东西倒到这个什么什么里面，我相信将会喷出一个全功能的引擎核心。\n\n喔，嘿，我猜我应该要感谢你保住了我的小命！嘿嘿。",cEN="That's more like it! Alright, now I think we're in business.\n\nJust let me dump this stuff into the thing"}
Q[10227]={d="我看见许多死去的德莱尼人。他们就在我们周围。\n\n唉，没人相信小孩子的话，连我妈妈都认为我在说谎。\n\n<哈雷指着拉姆杜尔。>\n\n只有他相信我……他也能看见死人。他为此恼怒不已，真是孩子气呀！\n\n我觉得这件事真好笑。我说我看见了幽灵，大家只是笑着拍我的头，试图安慰我。拉姆杜尔也能看见幽灵，可是他们都认为他疯了。我真希望我永远都不会长大！\n\n在你进去之前，最好先和拉姆杜尔聊聊。他以前还是个死亡祭司呢。",dEN="I see dead draenei. They're all around us.\n\nBah, nobody believes me because I'm a child. Not even my own mommy believes me.\n\n<Ha'lei points to Ramdor.>\n\nHe believes me, though... He sees them too. Boy does he get angry about it!\n\nIt's kind of funny. I see ghosts and people just smile and pat me on the head, trying to placate me. Ramdor sees ghosts and people label him as crazy. I sure hope I never grow up!\n\nYou should probably talk to Ramdor before you go inside. He was once a death priest.",o="与奥金尼地穴外的疯狂的拉姆杜尔谈一谈，他就站在地穴入口附近的骨堆上。",oEN="Speak to Ramdor the Mad, standing on the bone pile outside of the Auchenai Crypts.",c="那小孩子是对的。我曾经是个“死亡祭司”。\n\n<拉姆杜尔抽搐了一下。>\n\n真是令人讨厌的名称。\n\n这条走廊后面就是奥金尼地穴。你会在里面找到修道院的幸存者。当然，他们现在都疯了，彻底的疯了！我想我是唯一的例外——是他们之中最后一个还有理智的人。当然，我因为我的信仰而被逐出教会。\n\n你说，我的信仰是什么呢？",cEN="The child is correct. I was once a \"death priest.\"\n\n<Ramdor winces.>\n\nSuch an unsavory title.\n\nThrough that corridor lies the Auchenai Crypts. Inside you will find the remnants of my priory. They are all mad now, of course. Insane to the last! I suppose I stood out, being the last one among them with any common sense. Of course, I was excommunicated for my beliefs.\n\nWhat are my beliefs, you say?"}
Q[10228]={d="我认为应当让亡者安息——这五百多年来一直是我们在照料他们。玛拉达尔另有打算；他退进了回忆墓穴，开始他的死灵法术实验。\n\n我希望你没打算进去……在帮我摆脱这些该死的灵魂之前。我知道他们把宝物藏在哪儿，$r。引起你的兴趣了吧，嗯？\n\n把沙塔斯奥尔多 Ezekiel 手中的亡者之书带给我。|n",dEN="I believe that the dead, which we have been caring for these last 500 odd years, should be left alone. Maladaar has other plans. He has retreated to the Crypt of Remembrance to start his experiments... Necromancy.\n\nI hope you weren't thinking about going in there... Not before helping me out so that these damned spirits will finally leave me alone. I know where they keep their treasures, <race>. Got your attention, eh?\n\nBring me the book of the dead, held by the Aldor, Ezekiel of Shattrath.",o="与沙塔斯城的伊瑟基尔谈一谈。",oEN="Find and speak with Ezekiel of Shattrath in Shattrath City.",c="亡者之书？从来没听过……不过这是有关什么的啊？是谁要你来的？",cEN="Book of the dead? Never heard of it... What's this about anyway? Who sent you?"}
Q[10229]={d="这本书卷上似乎用某种隐秘的联盟密码语言记录着一些历史事件。那个当前逗留在断背岗哨的历史学家奥尔森研究阴魂已经很久了，或许他能够破解这种联盟密码，并翻译整本书的内容。",dEN="This tome appears to be some sort of history written in a secret Alliance cipher. Althen, the historian in Spinebreaker Post, has studied the Unyielding for some time; he may be able to crack the Alliance code and decipher the book.",o="将神秘的典籍交给断背岗哨的史学家奥尔森。",oEN="Take the Mysterious Tome to Althen the Historian in Spinebreaker Post.",p="这是什么？一本传达不屈者意念的书？真是奇怪。我研究看看。也许我有办法知道不屈者的历史。",pEN="What is this? A book carried by an Unyielding spirit? How strange. Let me study it. Perhaps I can learn the history of the Unyielding.",c="我一辈子都在研究先祖历史。但我从未见过像这样的一本书。里面记载整个军械库的历史，包括毁灭之后发生的事。\n\n不屈者延续了他们的历史，即使是在他们于战斗中沦陷后。借由这本书我们将可了解不屈者并说服他们加入。",cEN="I have studied ancient history my entire un-life. I have never seen anything like this book. It tells the entire history of the Armory, including events that happened after its destruction.\n\nThe Unyielding have kept their history, even after they had fallen in battle. With this book we will be able to understand the Unyielding and convince them to join us."}
Q[10230]={d="或许我们之前接触阴魂的方式是完全错误的？\n\n这本书中的内容告诉我，远征军物资库很久以前就被兽人和死亡骑士毁灭了。这些阴魂是被禁锢在这里的一批复仇之灵，与邪兽人各氏族进行着永恒的战争。\n\n现在，他们所想的事情除了复仇之外再无它物。我们必须让阴魂们击败他们最憎恨的敌人。请你再去一趟远征军物资库，找到塔沃斯少校。他身上带着一只可以召唤所有阴魂的战斗号角。把它带回来给我。",dEN="Perhaps we have taken the wrong approach to the Unyielding?\n\nThe tome tells me the Expedition Armory was destroyed by orcs and death knights long ago. The Unyielding remain here as vengeful spirits trapped in an eternal battle against the fel orc clans.\n\nThey think only of revenge. We must arrange for them to defeat their most hated enemies. Enter the Expedition Armory once again and find Lieutenant Commander Thalvos. He carries a battle horn that can summon the Unyielding. Bring it to me.",o="从塔沃斯少校那里拿到顽强战斗号角，把它交给断背岗哨的史学家奥尔森。",oEN="Take the Unyielding Battle Horn from Lieutenant Commander Thalvos and bring it to Althen the Historian in Spinebreaker Post.",p="我们得尽快帮助不屈者。要是我们能够说服他们加入我们，部落将获得一个有利的盟友。",pEN="We must help the Unyielding soon. If we can convince them to join us the Horde will have gained a powerful ally.",c="你做得很好 $n。这个先祖号角使我们能够招集不屈者。\n\n不过，得要他们愿意才行。",cEN="You have done well <name>. This ancient horn will allow us to summon the Unyielding.\n\nThat is, if they are willing."}
Q[10231]={d="拉姆杜尔？呃，让我想想……拉姆杜尔……哦，是那个死亡祭司。他要亡者之书做什么？唔，无所谓。很抱歉，我没说实话，但那本书真的不在我这儿。准确地说，我不再拥有它了。它被偷走了，或许是某个卑贱的难民干的。\n\n奥金顿已是了无生气的死地，亡者之书对我们来说没有任何用处了。如果你找到它，就留着好了。\n\n上周我还看见那帮无赖鬼鬼祟祟地在附近出没。就从他们身上开始调查吧。现在他们可能在贫民窟玩骰子。",dEN="Ramdor? Hrm, let me think... Ramdor... Oh yes, the death priest. What does he want with the book? Well it doesn't matter. Yes I lied to you and no I don't have the book. Not anymore, anyway. It was stolen. Probably by one of those filthy refugees.\n\nBesides, Auchindoun is now defunct. We have no use for the book. If you find it, you can keep it.\n\nLike I said, I saw some of those ruffians snooping around the terrace last week. Start your search with them. They're probably playing dice in the slums.",o="埃泽基尔说书被偷了。你最好找到那些恶棍，看看他们有没有什么线索。|n",oEN="Ezekiel said the book has been stolen. Your best bet is to find the Ruffians and see if they have any information.",p="你要啥？",pEN="Whaddya want?",c="好，好！不要伤害我们。我们是有这本书不过我们卖掉了……",cEN="Ok, ok! Don't hurt us. We had the book but we sold it..."}
Q[10232]={d="沿着道路往东走，桥对面的废料场原本是我们的地盘，可现在被燃烧军团侵占了。\n\n这会给我们造成很大的麻烦！先是阿尔科隆废墟，接下来是废料场，局势越来越糟糕了，不知道52区的火箭计划是否会受到影响。\n\n$n，我要你转至废料场消灭那些恶魔！我本想亲自动手的，但我是个讨厌打斗和杀戮的博爱者。\n\n没错，这是一项艰难的任务，我知道！",dEN="The Burning Legion has moved in on our claim at the Scrap Field down the path and across the bridge to the east.\n\nThis could be a huge problem for us! With the Legion at the Arklon Ruins, and now there, it's starting to look bad for us - and the rocket project - here at Area 52.\n\n<name>, I need you to go out there and deal with those demons! I'd do it, but I'm a lover, not a fighter.\n\nYep, this is going to be trouble, I can feel it!",o="杀死5名莫尔葛铁匠和15名甘尔葛工程师，然后向虚空风暴52区的维勒老爹复命。",oEN="Kill 5 Mo'arg Doomsmiths and 15 Gan'arg Engineers. Then return to Papa Wheeler at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="希望你对付燃烧军团那场混战能扛得住。\n\n我讨厌的东西不多，比违背约定的人更甚的，也就只有侏儒了，<咳嗽>，但恶魔无疑也算一样！<tos>$g朋友:朋友;",pEN="I sure hope that you're up to that tussle with the Burning Legion.\n\nThere aren't many things that I hate worse than those that renege on a deal, or gnomes, but demons are certainly one of them!",c="唉，这既是好消息也是坏消息，不是吗？我们打击了他们，但燃烧军团在虚空风暴上横行无忌，而且离我们越来越近，我不知道会怎样。\n\n我有种感觉，我们这儿恐怕得好一阵子改变策略了。希望你能帮上我们的忙，$n。",cEN="Well, that's good and bad news, now isn't it? We've dealt them a blow, but with the Burning Legion running free all over the Netherstorm - and getting closer to us here - well, I don't know how it's going to go.\n\nI have a feeling that we're going to have to change gears here for a while. Hope you'll be able to help us out, <name>."}
Q[10233]={d="哪怕我们杀光日怒堡的驻军，也不能阻止血精灵重新夺回城堡。凯尔萨斯的追随者狂热而顽强，如果我们留下任何有用的器物，他们肯定会利用这些东西向我们发动反击。\n\n不行，必须毁掉日怒堡的一切。焚毁那里的帐篷和弩车！\n\n<鬼魂攥紧了拳头。>\n\n$n，你可以从日怒护火者手中夺得火炬来完成这项任务。",dEN="Ridding Sunfury Hold of its garrison is not sufficient to keep the blood elves from reoccupying it. Kael'thas's followers are zealous and tenacious. Leaving them anything to use at Sunfury is effectively an invitation to return.\n\nNo, it must all be destroyed. See to it that their tents and artillery burn to ashes!\n\n<The ghost's fists clench.>\n\nSteal torches from the Sunfury flamekeepers to accomplish your task, <name>.",o="使用燃烧的火把烧毁4台日怒弩车和4顶日怒帐篷，然后向肯瑞瓦村的巫师上尉莫尔兰复命。",oEN="Using a Flaming Torch, destroy 4 Sunfury Ballistas and 4 Sunfury Tents and return to Lieutenant-Sorcerer Morran at Kirin'Var Village.",p="烟从日怒要塞的堡垒中升起。那是你的杰作吗？",pEN="Smoke rises from the Sunfury Hold fortifications. Is that your handiwork?",c="<巫师上尉莫尔兰严肃的点头。>\n\n肯瑞托很难从建筑物本身的利益来欣赏它，但我们并不会因为对抗敌人而觉得良心不安，就算死的也一样。",cEN="The Kirin Tor hardly relish destruction for its own sake, but we have no qualms about acting against our enemies, even in death."}
Q[10234]={d="你看起来像个挺能干的年轻人！不知道你能否帮我一把？\n\n东边是废料场，燃烧军团已经进驻了那里。那里到处都是巨大的邪能机甲残骸，还有一大堆他们似乎不在意的小零件。\n\n我要你去那儿给我弄一大堆那种小一点的邪能机甲零件回来！$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You look like a capable young <man/woman>! I was wondering if you could lend me a hand?\n\nTo the east is the Scrap Field, which the Burning Legion has moved into. It's full of huge fel reaver parts. There're also a whole bunch of smaller parts in there that they don't seem to care about.\n\nI want you to get in there and get me a lot of those smaller fel reaver parts!",o="收集10个魔能机甲零件，然后返回虚空风暴的中央生态圆顶，将它们交给中央圆顶哨站的维勒老妈。",oEN="Gather 10 Fel Reaver Parts and return them to Mama Wheeler at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",p="你取得那些零件了吗？随着燃烧军团每次一个一个进驻我们在这里的领地，我们所剩的时间不多了。",pEN="You have those parts yet? With the Burning Legion moving in on each of our claims around here one at a time, we unfortunately have little time.",c="我认为这些都得现在就去做了。只要我们能够将他们吓跑。\n\n嘿，这让我想到了个办法！",cEN="These will have to do for now, I suppose. If only we could scare them off.\n\nHey, that gives me an idea!"}
Q[10235]={d="你知道什么能让他们泄气吗？把他们的首领干掉！\n\n听说这招到哪儿都管用。等他们看到一个像你这样的$c干掉了他们的首领……嘿，我敢打赌他们会夹着尾巴逃回山里！\n\n回那里去，把那个叫末日之爪的大块头揪出来。听说他藏在废料场东部、管道下面。\n\n把他的手爪也带给我！说不定我们能派上用场。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="You know what might just discourage them? Take out their leader!\n\nIt seems to work everywhere else from what I've heard. And when they see a <grizzled /tough> <class>, such as yourself take out their leader... why, I bet they'll tuck tail and run for the hills!\n\nGet back in there and take out the big one they call Doomclaw. I hear he keeps himself in the eastern part of the Scrap Field underneath the pipe.\n\nBring me his claw, too! Maybe we can make use of it.",o="取得厄运之爪的手，然后返回虚空风暴的中央生态圆顶，将它们交给中央圆顶哨站的维勒老妈。",oEN="Obtain Doomclaw's Hand and deliver it to Mama Wheeler at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",p="解决厄运之爪了没？",pEN="Dealt with Doomclaw yet?",c="他，嗯……他说什么？他们将要侵犯52区？！\n\n喔，这太糟了……糟透了！",cEN="He, uh... he said what? THEY'RE GONNA GO AFTER AREA 52?!\n\nOh, this is not good... not good!"}
Q[10236]={d="我真不敢相信我竟然会离开藏宝海湾来到外域。我的兄弟斯克里·拉克希德许诺说我能在这里赚一大笔钱，但这家伙倒是乘坐飞艇离开了，把我留在这个破矿井里混吃等死。\n\n这鬼地方整天被地狱野猪、恶魔还有邪兽人攻击，叫我怎么活？我的伐木机昨天也坏了，修理机器的备用零件还被邪兽人偷走了。他们把零件搬到了西南边的裂谷中，没准就丢在那边呢。",dEN="I can't believe I left Booty Bay to come to Outland. My cousin Screed Luckheed promised me I would make a fortune, but instead he flew off in his zeppelin and left me here to try to scrape a living out of this mine.\n\nHow am I suppose to make a living here with helboars and demons and fel orcs attacking all the time? My shredder here was broken yesterday and the parts I need to fix it were stolen by fel orcs. They took the parts into the fissure to the southwest and may have dropped them there.",o="找到6个伐木机备用零件，然后返回萨尔玛西北方的矿洞，将它们交给工头拉泽克拉兹。",oEN="Find 6 Shredder Parts and return to Foreman Razelcraz by the mine northwest of Thrallmar.",p="你帮我的伐木机找到修理的零件了吗？我希望赶快修好他我才能继续去矿洞工作。不论如何我都必须要赚钱过日子，只有这样我才能赚足够的钱买一张回去藏宝海湾的单程票。",pEN="Did you find some spare parts for my shredder? I really want to get it fixed so I can get back to mining. I have to make a living somehow, if only so I can buy a one-way ticket back to Booty Bay.",c="喔耶，你找到零件了！也许现在我可以修好我的伐木机了。假如我可以赚到足够的钱我就可以回去藏宝海湾了。\n\n我真希望我的堂弟，史哥利德·幸运心，还有他的飞艇一起坠机。我不敢相信他骗我来外域。",cEN="Hurray, you found some parts! Now maybe I can get my shredder working. If I earn enough money I might be able to get back to Booty Bay.\n\nI sure hope my cousin, Screed Luckheed, crashes that stupid zeppelin of his. I can't believe he tricked me into coming to Outland."}
Q[10237]={d="$n，你必须立即把这个消息传递给52区！快！\n\n告诉火箭主管，燃烧军团已经盯上我们了！",dEN="<name>, you have to get word back to Area 52 immediately! Hurry!\n\nTell the rocket-chief that the Burning Legion is after us now!",o="将坏消息告诉虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。",oEN="Deliver the bad news to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",c="嘿，你在开玩笑，对吧？燃烧军团就因为那样而怪罪于我们吗？\n\n但是你才是元凶吧！\n\n天啊，我的头痛到像这个火箭那么大了。好啦，好啦，看来我们需要改变计划了。\n\n如果燃烧军团认为他们会来这里，毁掉我们的城镇以及破坏我漫游扭曲虚空的梦想，那他们就太天真了。\n\n我刚好知道有一个地精可以帮助我们。",cEN="Heh, you're kidding, right? The Burning Legion is blaming us for all of that?\n\nBut YOU'RE the one that did it!\n\nOy, I have a headache and it's as big as this rocket. Okay, okay, this calls for a change of plans.\n\nIf the Burning Legion thinks that it's going to come here, destroy our town and ruin my dream of cruising through the Twisted Nether, they are sadly mistaken.\n\nAnd I know just the goblin to help us out."}
Q[10238]={d="为什么邪兽人要偷走我的伐木机零件？我讨厌他们。这帮家伙老是溜进营地偷东西。几天前，他们竟然偷走了三名苦工！现在，矿洞的其它苦工都跑光了，他们可不想被邪兽人吃掉。\n\n没苦工叫我怎么开矿啊？要是你能把那些苦工救回来，没准其它人就肯回来工作了。邪兽人的营地就在西南边的城墙下。",dEN="Why would fel orcs steal my shredder parts? I hate them so much. They just sneak into my camp here and take things all the time. A couple of days ago they stole three of my peons! Now the rest of my peons have run off because they are afraid they are going to be eaten by fel orcs.\n\nI can't run a mine without peons. If you could save the peons that I lost maybe the others would come back. The fel orcs have their camps along the wall to the southwest.",o="从邪兽人的营地中救出曼尼、莫恩和雅克，然后返回萨尔玛西北方的矿洞，向工头拉泽克拉兹复命。",oEN="Rescue Manni, Moh and Jakk from the Fel Orc camps and return to Foreman Razelcraz by the mine northwest of Thrallmar.",p="你救回我的苦工了没？拜托快一点，我怕他们很快就会被吃掉而且他们应该不好吃。假如邪兽人吃了倒胃口的话他们可是会迁怒到我呢。",pEN="Have you saved my peons yet? Please hurry, I'm afraid they are going to be eaten and they probably won't taste very good. If they taste really bad the fel orcs might get really mad at me.",c="感谢你拯救了我的苦工们。也许现在我就可以叫他们拿着零件去修我的伐木机，赚到足够的钱然后离开外域。我等不及想回去藏宝海湾了。",cEN="Thank you for saving my peons. Now maybe I can get them to fix my shredder with those parts you found. earn some money and get out of Outland. I can't wait to be back in Booty Bay."}
Q[10239]={d="我们并非是唯一与法力生物抗争的势力。血精灵也深受它们的困扰，不过我并不清楚原因。\n\n无论血精灵在法力熔炉遭遇了怎样的麻烦，他们却没有收手的意思。我发现，他们用各种方法杀死法力生物，其中最有效的就是利用高度集中的能量形成魔法防御屏障。\n\n转至法力熔炉：库鲁恩夺取一些能量源，然后带回来给我。如果有机会的话，别忘记给血精灵制造一点麻烦。",dEN="We are not the only ones battling the influx of the mana beings. The blood elves, too, are troubled by them, but I'm not sure why.\n\nWhatever they're involved in over there, they don't seem to be stopping. Instead, I've seen them employ a variety of methods to kill the creatures. The most effective involves magical defenses fueled by some sort of concentrated energy.\n\nCapture some of these energy sources and bring them to me. Don't hesitate to stymie the elves if an opportunity presents itself.",o="肯瑞瓦村的巫师上尉莫尔兰要你转至法力熔炉：库鲁恩，取回10块能量隔离器。",oEN="Lieutenant-Sorcerer Morran at Kirin'Var Village wants you to capture 10 Energy Isolation Cubes from the blood elf operations at Manaforge Coruu.",p="你有办法取得他们的能源隔离器吗？",pEN="Were you able to gather any of their energy sources?",c="<莫尔兰小心翼翼地处理其中一个容器。>\n\n我不相信我之前曾看过任何跟这一样的东西。一定有很多的能量悬浮在这里，但是是以原始的状态。我们得小心处理，不过我想我们能找到方法来改写这些能量进而协助抵挡那些法力生物。",cEN="I don't believe I've seen anything like this before. There's certainly a lot of energy suspended in here, but it's in a raw form. We'll have to be careful with it, but I think we can find a way to adapt this to help ward off the mana creatures."}
Q[10240]={d="现在，我们计划利用这些从血精灵手中夺来的能量源在村子周围创建起一道能量壁障。我不敢保证这绝对有效，但总得试试看。\n\n否则法力生物就会源源不断地涌进村落，继续吞噬肯瑞托法师的灵魂。\n\n利用这个装置激活村子周围的小符文。如果力场分布得没有错，每激活一块符文，你就能感受到周围的变化。",dEN="We are prepared to try to construct a perimeter around the village using the energy source taken from the blood elves. I can't guarantee that it will work, but we have to attempt it.\n\nOtherwise, the mana creatures will surely continue devouring the spirits of the fallen Kirin Tor.\n\nUse this device at the small runes around the perimeter of town to release the energy there. If I've woven the field correctly, we should start noticing a difference once you've used the device at each point.",o="对东部符文、东北部符文和西部符文使用符文激活装置。你可以在肯瑞瓦村城镇广场和巫师街周边找到这些符文。完成任务后向巫师上尉莫尔兰复命。",oEN="Use the Rune Activation Device near the East Rune, Northeast Rune, and West Rune. The runes can be found around the perimeter of Kirin'Var Village's Wizard Row and Town Square districts. Return to Lieutenant-Sorcerer Morran once you've completed the task.",p="你启动了所有的符文了吗？我很急切的想知道是否我们无法改善这里的血精灵秩序。任何凯尔萨斯的手下可以做到的事，真正的肯瑞托可以做的更好。",pEN="Have you activated all the runes? I'm eager to see if we can't improve upon the blood elf method here. Anything one of Kael'thas's men can do. real Kirin Tor can do better.",c="做得好。抓紧你的手，$n。我要启动防护罩了。",cEN="Excellent work. Keep your fingers crossed, <name>. I'm going to activate the shield."}
Q[10241]={d="沙塔尔派我们来调查凯尔萨斯的军队运转法力熔炉的情况。不幸的是，占星者威胁说，如果我们不派兵支持，他们就拒绝履行信息收集义务。\n\n如果因为政治原因导致任务失败，我们可承担不起这样的后果。因此，我们同意削弱法力熔炉的防御力量，让占星者安全完成他们的工作。\n\n向奥尔多证明你的忠诚吧，去消灭驻守法力熔炉：布纳尔的日怒魔导师和日怒血卫士。",dEN="We were sent here by the Sha'tar to investigate the manaforges that Kael'thas' army is operating here. Unfortunately, the Scryers threaten to renege on their information-gathering duties unless we support them with military action.\n\nWe can't afford to compromise this mission over politics, so we've agreed to weaken the manaforge's defenses so that the Scryers can do their work.\n\nProve your loyalty to the Aldor and slay the Sunfury magisters and bloodwarders that guard Manaforge B'naar.",o="杀死8名日怒魔导师和8名日怒血卫士，然后向52区的大主教欧雷里斯复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Slay 8 Sunfury Magisters and 8 Sunfury Bloodwarders and return to Exarch Orelis at Area 52.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="你完成任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。先知者已经揭露了宝贵的资讯以感谢你的扰乱行动。也许这次他们会真的跟我们分享了。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. The Scryers have uncovered valuable information thanks to your distraction. Maybe they'll actually share it with us this time."}
Q[10242]={d="$n，真是可惜，现有的设备无法进行我想要做的血液检测。不过，我可以找断背岗哨的药剂师阿尔布雷克帮忙，他有合适的器械。\n\n我有一份血环兽人的血样，是萨尔玛的间谍执行任务时收集到的。将这份血样交给阿尔布雷克研究研究。\n\n要去断背岗哨的话，跟空军指挥官布拉克谈谈就可以了。他就在南边那群双足飞龙旁边。",dEN="<name>, my equipment here is, unfortunately, not configured for all the tests I'd like to perform. However, my colleague at Spinebreaker Post, Apothecary Albreck, possesses the required implements.\n\nI have acquired a sample of Bleeding Hollow blood -- gained from a past mission of Thrallmar's agents. Take the sample to Albreck and allow him to study it.\n\nTo reach Spinebreaker Post, speak with Wing Commander Brack, near the wyverns to the south.",o="机甲残骸的药剂师塞兰娜要你与空军指挥官布拉克谈一谈，搭乘双足飞龙转至断背岗哨，并将血环血样交给断背岗哨的药剂师阿尔布雷克。",oEN="Apothecary Zelana at Reaver's Fall wants you to speak with Wing Commander Brack to take a wyvern to Spinebreaker Post, and then bring the Bleeding Hollow Blood Sample to Apothecary Albreck at Spinebreaker Post.",p="欢迎来到断背岗哨。我能帮你什么忙吗？",pEN="Welcome to Spinebreaker Post. How might my talents serve you?",c="一个血液测试，是吗？我很荣幸。我向来喜欢与血液为伍……",cEN="A blood test, is it? It will be my pleasure. I always enjoy working with blood..."}
Q[10243]={d="占星者得到了一份法力熔炉：布纳尔的人员名册，他们花了一整天时间挑选暗杀目标。\n\n然而，占星者却没有留意到写在名册边上的一串潦草的符号。这些符号似乎是进出像埃索达或是风暴要塞这样的纳鲁建筑物的密码。\n\n进入法力熔炉寻找控制台，将控制台上的读数拓在这个卷轴上。我们必须确认这些符号的来源。",dEN="The Scryers obtained a personnel roster for Manaforge B'naar and are now having a field day picking out assassination targets.\n\nThey've missed one small bit of information, scribbled on the side of the roster. It appeared to be a password or code like those used to access naaru-made technology like the Exodar or Tempest Keep.\n\nGo inside the manaforge and look for a control panel. Copy its readouts on this scroll as well as you can. We must confirm our suspicions about the origin of the technology.",o="进入法力熔炉：布纳尔，找到布纳尔控制台。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Go inside Manaforge B'naar and find the B'naar Control Console.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="这个在你面前出现的符号看起来怪异且难懂。",pEN="The symbols scrolling in front of you look alien and unintelligible.",c="你打开了卷轴准备好要将这些怪异的符号复制下来。",cEN="You unwrap the scroll and ready yourself to copy down the strange symbols."}
Q[10245]={d="无数图形在你眼前快速掠过，你尝试着拓下它们的形状。卷轴上的拓文虽欠精确，但它们足以证明奥尔多的猜想是否正确了。",dEN="You try to transcribe the shapes as you see them flash across your eyes. The results are less than exact, but should serve as adequate evidence to prove or disprove the Aldor's suspicions.",o="将布纳尔控制台拓文交给虚空风暴52区的学者卡尔亚。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Deliver the B'naar Console Transcription to Anchorite Karja at Area 52 in Netherstorm.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="让我们看看你带了什么要给我们，$n。",pEN="Let us see what you've brought to us, <name>.",c="你做得很好，$n。给我几分钟去看一下你的誊本。\n\n你拥有全体牧师的感谢，$c。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. Allow me a few moments to go over your transcription.\n\nYou have the priesthood's thanks, <class>."}
Q[10246]={d="你在法力熔炉：布纳尔获得了令人侧目的成就。我敢肯定学者卡尔亚一定希望你在法力熔炉：库鲁恩也有同样优秀的表现。\n\n最近我们得到消息，一大群地位显赫的日怒奥术师和研究者被派驻到了法力熔炉：库鲁恩，我要你以他们为作战目标。如果你能成功的话，这将是对敌人的一次沉重打击。",dEN="Your success at Manaforge B'naar was quite noteworthy. I'm sure that Anchorite Karja will ask you for a repeat performance at Manaforge Coruu next.\n\nWe've learned of a particularly important regiment of Sunfury arcanists and researchers being deployed there and I would like you to target them. Succeed and you will deliver a crushing blow against our enemy's forces.",o="转至法力熔炉：库鲁恩，杀死8名日怒奥术师和5名日怒研究员，完成任务后向大主教欧雷里斯复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Travel to Manaforge Coruu and slay 8 Sunfury Arcanists and 5 Sunfury Researchers. Return to Exarch Orelis when you've completed this task.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="做得好，$n。有你的全力奉献我们必定能打败我们的敌人。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. With your dedication we're sure to defeat our enemy."}
Q[10247]={d="城外东边就是实验场。我们的首席实验家沃米萨博士就在那里捣鼓魔能机甲，虚灵科技，当然，还有地精科技。\n\n$n，鉴于你在担任三等见习技师期间的优良表现，我们决定派你过去！\n\n去吧，我相信他能想出拯救52区的办法。\n\n不过，你很可能会成为沃米萨博士的实验品。如果我是你的话，我会带上朋友一同转至实验场，以防万一。",dEN="On the outskirts of town to the east are the Proving Grounds. Our top experimentalist, Doctor Vomisa, has been toying with a combination of fel reaver, ethereal, and of course, goblin technologies there.\n\nThis is in no small part thanks to your gathering efforts Junior Technician 3rd Grade, <name>!\n\nGo to him; I know that he'll have a solution for saving Area 52.\n\nAnd since he's likely to use you as a test subject, if I were you, I'd bring some friends along just in case.",o="与虚空风暴实验场的工程学博士沃米萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Doctor Vomisa, Ph.T. at the Proving Grounds in Netherstorm.",c="哎呀呀，看来我们运气不错，年轻人。\n\n我刚刚完成了最新发明——废料收割者X6000——的建造！\n\n而你将荣幸地帮我测试它，好让它能用于52区的防御！",cEN="Well. well, it would appear that we are in luck, young man.\n\nI was just recently able to finish the construction of my latest invention, the Scrap Reaver X6000!\n\nAnd you're going to have the honor of helping me test it so that it can be used in defense of Area 52!"}
Q[10248]={d="工程学博士沃米萨愿意为您效劳！来，拿着这个控制器。我要你启动它，遥控我新造的这台再造机甲X6000型四下转转。\n\n别跑远了！控制器是连接在控制台上的。要是你跑得太远，遥控设备就会停止运转。\n\n记得把所有的功能都测试一下……我会根据实验结果来校准它的随动系统。",dEN="Doctor Vomisa, Ph.T. at your service. Here, take this controller. I want you to activate it and give my newly-invented Scrap Reaver X6000 a spin.\n\nJust stay nearby! The controller is tied to my console here, and if you get too far away, the robot will cease to function.\n\nTry out everything... I'll be watching and calibrating its servos based upon your test run.",o="启动再造机甲X6000型控制器并测试其性能，灵活应对测试过程中的突发状况。然后向虚空风暴实验场的工程学博士沃米萨汇报实验结果。",oEN="Activate the Scrap Reaver X6000 Controller and test out its capabilities. Then give your feedback to Doctor Vomisa, Ph.T at the Proving Grounds in the Netherstorm. Deal with any problems that arise.",p="你觉得如何？是否需要大翻修呢？",pEN="What did you think? Still needs some tweaking, eh?",c="很好，$g亲爱的:亲爱的;。刚才真是太刺激了！我敢拿我所有的钱打赌，废料收割者X6000表现得相当出色，尽管它的驾驶员是个$g新手:新手;。\n\n呵呵，不，别生气，我只是开个玩笑。毕竟你刚刚把52区和X-52虚空火箭从必死之局中救了出来。",cEN="Well, my boy that certainly was exciting! And for my money, I'd say that the Scrap Reaver X6000 performed admirably, despite its rookie pilot.\n\nHehe, no, don't take offense, I was just kidding. After all, you just saved Area 52 and the X-52 Nether-Rocket from certain doom!"}
Q[10249]={d="我敢肯定火箭主管有话要对你说！\n\n如果我是你的话，我就会立即返回52区与他谈一谈！",dEN="I'm certain that the rocket-chief is going to want to have a word or two with you!\n\nIf I were you, I wouldn't hesitate to get back to Area 52 and speak with him!",o="立刻向虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格报到！",oEN="Report to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm immediately!",c="$n！或者我该叫你一级初级技师$n？！唉，我在骗谁呢？跳一级根本配不上你所做的事。我要让你当我的首席军官！\n\n你救了我们所有人，更重要的是救了X-52虚空火箭！我真想亲你一口……但我不会的。\n\n所以，请接受52区的谢意。挑你的奖赏吧！",cEN="<name>! Or, should I say Junior Technician 1st Grade <name>?! Oh hell, who am I kidding? Skipping a grade isn't a good enough reward for what you've done. I'm going to make you my first officer!\n\nYou've saved all of us, and more importantly the X-52 Nether-Rocket! I could just kiss you... but I won't.\n\nInstead, please let me present you with the gratitude of Area 52. Take your pick!"}
Q[10250]={d="这里的正东方有一处已被摧毁的联盟攻城塔，现在那里只有一片废墟。很久以前，许多联盟的战士牺牲在那处攻城塔中，而且他们的军旗也被一个邪兽人军官夺取了。\n\n到联盟的军旗下面去吹响这只战斗号角。它会引起乌尔特拉克的注意，也会召来那些在战斗中倒下的士兵。",dEN="East of here is an old destroyed Alliance siege tower. Now scavengers loot it for old nails and bits of scrap. Long ago, many Alliance warriors lost their lives at this tower and their banner was captured by Urtrak, a foul orc commander.\n\nBlow the Unyielding battle horn near the Alliance banner. This will get the attention of Urtrak. It may also summon forth warriors who fell in battle long ago.",o="在联盟战旗附近吹响顽强战斗号角。然后杀死乌尔特拉克，并向断背岗哨的史学家奥尔森复命。",oEN="Blow the Unyielding Battle Horn near the Alliance Banner. Kill Urtrak and then return to Althen the Historian at Spinebreaker Post.",p="你在攻塔时吹了这个号角了吗？我们必须快点进行这件事。谁知道萨尔玛何时会需要不屈者。",pEN="Have you blown the horn by the siege tower yet? We must do this soon. Who knows when Thrallmar will have need of the Unyielding.",c="很高兴听到不屈者加入了你的战斗。我以为他们只会听从他们自己的战斗号角，但是我并不确定。也许是因为我们给予他们最渴望的复仇机会。\n\n你已经杀死乌崔克而我们必须向远征队军械库的指挥官霍卡尔斯回报你的胜利消息。他会了解你对他们的付出。",cEN="I am glad to hear that the Unyielding joined you in your battle. I thought they might come to the sound of their own battle horn, but I could not be sure. Perhaps we have given some of them the vengeance they so desperately crave.\n\nYou have slain Urtrak and we must report your victory to Commander Hogarth in the Expedition Armory. He will understand the risks you have taken on his behalf."}
Q[10251]={d="昨晚来了两个德莱尼人。他们不知怎么得知那本书在我们手上，提出了非常慷慨的价钱要\"帮我们脱手\"。\n\n我们没问他们要那本书做什么，但那个年轻的一直在说\"大师的宏伟蓝图\"，谁知道是什么意思。\n\n听着，有钱赚的时候我从不问问题。他们给了我们一大笔金币，我们把书给了他们。\n\n他说他们住在纳格兰——塔拉以北那座废弃的旧军械库。",dEN="A couple of draenei paid us a visit last night. They'd somehow learned that we had the book in our possession and made a very generous offer to \"take it off our hands.\"\n\nWe didn't ask them what they wanted with the book but the young one kept talking about \"the master's grand design,\" whatever that means.\n\nLook, I don't ask questions when money is in play. They gave us a lot of gold and we gave them the book.\n\nHe said that they lived in Nagrand - in the old Abandoned Armory, north of Telaar.",o="转至纳格兰废弃的军械库寻找博学者尼特林的下落。",oEN="Find Nitrin the Learned at the Abandoned Armory in Nagrand.",c="种种迹象都在那里，我却视而不见。\n\n军团的掌控一天比一天紧。连这些地方也不例外……\n\n要是我早知道……要是我早知道我的孩子在与恶魔来往……他们给了他力量，然后让他尝到了那力量的滋味。仅此而已……\n\n书已经不在了。被列维休斯带走了。他的计划只有我和他那位黑暗主人知道。\n\n$g陌生人:陌生人;，我不知道你此生是否行过正道，但你必须知道：那孩子必须被阻止。",cEN="The signs were all there but I turned a blind eye.\n\nThe Legion's grasp grows stronger every day. Even in these parts...\n\nHad I known... Had I known that my boy was communing with demons... They offered him power and then gave him a taste of that power. That was all that it took...\n\nThe book is gone. Taken by Levixus... His plans are known only to me and his dark master.\n\nStranger, I don't know if you've ever done right in your life, but know this: the boy must be stopped."}
Q[10252]={d="利维休斯已经开始实施他的计划了。他站在奥金顿遗址顶部，诵读着亡者之书。他叫着亡者的名字，将他们召唤出来，然后利用恶魔的仪祭扭曲这些灵魂的意志，使其成为他的仆从。如果不阻止利维休斯的话，他一定会控制奥金顿的所有亡者！\n\n但是……你必须做好充分的准备。你是无法与你看不见的敌人作战的。\n\n<尼特林递给你一张羊皮纸。>\n\n替我找来这些材料，我就为你配制一瓶通灵药剂。它能打开你的心智，让你看到灵魂的世界。",dEN="It has already begun. Levixus stands atop the ruins of Auchindoun and reads from the book of the dead. He calls the dead out by name and, through demonic ritual, binds the tortured souls to his will. He will raise all of Auchindoun if given the chance!\n\nBut... you must first prepare. You cannot do battle with that which you cannot see.\n\n<Nitrin hands you a parchment.>\n\nBring me the items I require to brew the tincture. It will open your mind and allow you to see into the spirit world.",o="收集1颗山丘戈隆的眼球、1个完美的大型风鹏之喙和1份老迈裂蹄牛的脂肪，然后返回纳格兰废弃的军械库，把它们交给尼特林。",oEN="Nitrin at the Abandoned Armory in Nagrand wants you to bring him 1 Mountain Gronn Eyeball, 1 Flawless Greater Windroc Beak, and 1 Aged Clefthoof Blubber.",p="利维休斯的军队每分每秒都在壮大。你一定要加紧脚步。",pEN="Levixus's army grows in size and power with each second that passes. You must hurry.",c="$g陌生人:陌生人;……我对你并不坦诚。一旦你喝下这瓶药水，你将永远能看见死者的世界。你饮下的这份配方，是奥金顿所有死亡祭司的入门仪式。许多人在药效成形后发了疯。看见死者是……极其骇人的。\n\n<尼特林把药水送到你唇边。>\n\n你还想继续吗？",cEN="Stranger... I was not forthright with you. Once you drink this potion, you will forever see into the world of the dead. This recipe that you drink of is a rite of initiation for all death priests of Auchindoun. Many go mad after its effects have taken hold. Seeing the dead is ... shocking.\n\n<Nitrin puts the potion up to your lips.>\n\nDo you wish to continue?"}
Q[10253]={d="$n，去吧。利维休斯就在奥金顿遗迹的顶部。从白骨荒野南侧进入奥金顿，他被灵魂的风暴围绕着……\n\n杀死利维休斯，夺走亡者之书。一旦你得到那本被诅咒的书，就立即销毁它！一定要销毁它，绝不能让它落入其它野心家手中。",dEN="Go now, <name>. You will find Levixus on the uppermost ruins of Auchindoun. Enter there from the southern reaches of the Bone Wastes. He stands amidst a storm of souls...\n\nDestroy him and take the book of the dead. Once you have the cursed book in your possession, destroy it! Destroy it so that such an atrocity can never again be made possible.",o="杀死利维休斯，夺得亡者之书。\n\n将亡者之书交给疯狂的拉姆杜尔，他就站在奥金顿的奥金尼地穴入口外。\n\n你们之间有协议的，还记得吗？",oEN="Destroy Levixus and take the Book of the Dead from his possession.\n\nDeliver the Book of the Dead to Ramdor the Mad standing outside the Auchenai Crypt entrance of Auchindoun.\n\nYou had a deal, remember?",p="你是谁，你想要干嘛？喔……是你喔。",pEN="Who are you and what do you want? Oh... It's YOU.",c="要是那位老德莱尼让你毁掉那本书，你为什么没毁？\n\n<拉姆多尔瞪着你。>\n\n呸，有什么区别呢。你或许$g贪心:贪心;，但至少你$g诚实:诚实;。\n\n而我呢……我是靠撒谎才拿到这本书的。我根本不知道这些可怜迷失的灵魂把宝物藏在哪儿，就算知道我也不会告诉你——不过——我确实有样东西给你。你今天做了件好事。也许是件了不起的事……你理应得到奖赏。\n\n顺便说一句，$g欢迎:欢迎;加入我们。\n\n<拉姆多尔指向那些灵魂。>",cEN="If the old draenei said to destroy the book, why didn't you?\n\n<Ramdor glares at you.>\n\nBah, what's the difference. You might be greedy but at least you're honest.\n\nMe on the other hand... I lied to get this book. I have no idea where these poor lost souls kept their treasure nor would I tell you if I did - however - I do have something for you. You did a good thing on this day. Perhaps a great thing... You should be rewarded.\n\nBy the way, welcome to the fold.\n\n<Ramdor points to the spirits.>"}
Q[10254]={d="<伊斯多尔元帅狠狠地对着地面啐了一口。>\n\n好吧，是该拿报酬的时候了，立刻去向城堡内的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩报到。他和他的顾问见到你毫无疑问会非常高兴的。\n\n<伊斯多尔元帅笑着向你敬了个礼。>\n\n为了联盟而战！",dEN="<Marshal Isildor spits in the dust.>\n\nWell, time to earn your pay. Report at once to Force Commander Trollbane within the keep. He and his advisors will no doubt be heartened to see you.\n\n<Marshal Isildor salutes you stoically.>\n\nFor the Alliance!",o="伊斯多尔元帅要求你向荣耀堡的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩报到。",oEN="Marshal Isildor wants you to report to Force Commander Danath Trollbane in Honor Hold.",c="很高兴见到你，我的$g兄弟:姐妹。我很开心你来了。我是达纳斯——洛萨之子的领导者，这个要塞的远征军指挥官。",cEN="Well met, my <brother/sister>. I'm glad you've come. I am Danath - leader of the Sons of Lothar, and force commander of this hold."}
Q[10255]={d="我想，我们可以利用本地生物血液中的某些成分来制作解毒药剂。你觉得我疯了吗？别那么看着我好不好！\n\n你要知道，这是自然界中的普遍规律，通常能治愈毒症的成分都是来源于毒素本身，我就是遵循着这个规律在尝试。\n\n将这些野猪身上的恶魔力量祛除之后，或许它们就不会再这样具有攻击性了。我们也可以借机仔细地观察一下净化的过程和状况，看看怎样才能更好地帮助其它物种。",dEN="I think there's something we can use in the blood as the base of an antidote. Don't look at me like I've lost my mind!\n\nIt's a common theme in nature. Often, the cure for something can be derived from the toxin itself. That's just what I aim to do.\n\nRidding the boars of their demonic influence would probably eliminate their aggression and give us insight into how to best attempt to help other species.",o="对笨拙的地狱野猪使用塞纳里奥解毒剂，并观察解毒剂的效果。然后返回地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，向塞安·红鬃汇报实验的结果。",oEN="Use the Cenarion Antidote on a Hulking Helboar and observe the results. Once you have the results of the experiment, return to Thiah Redmane at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你知道实验的结果了吗？",pEN="Do you have the results of the experiment?",c="<当你描述了实验的结果，塞安·红鬃瞪大了眼睛。>\n\n这，这怎么可能呢？我确定我正确的调配了解毒剂！\n\n它明明就可以解开蜘蛛还有蛇的毒液，那么为什么这次会失败呢？也许是外域的差异性造成的吧，$n。我最好把这项讯息传递给其它的同伴们知道。",cEN="<Thiah Redmane's eyes widen as you describe the results of the experiment.>\n\nBut, how could that happen? I'm certain I prepared the antidote correctly!\n\nI've seen it work with spider and snake venoms, so why would it backfire here? Perhaps that's one of Outland's many peculiarities, <name>. I'd best pass this information along to my comrades."}
Q[10256]={d="回想起来，我真该预料到凯尔萨斯拥有如此强大的魔法能力。他是一位很有天份的法师，然而凯尔袭击肯瑞瓦村的那天，他所使用的法术完全超出了我的想象。\n\n凯尔萨斯施加在紫罗兰之塔的结界令我无法探察周围的敌情，不过好在它还不能阻止你来替我完成这项工作。\n\n但是你首先得搞到一块透镜。法力熔炉：杜隆以西的平原生活着一位名叫阿匹克斯的巨人，他身上有质地非常不错的水晶，我们可以利用这种水晶制成探知透镜。",dEN="In retrospect, I suppose I should've expected Kael'thas's magic to be this robust. He's always been a talented mage, but I've never seen anything like the power he wielded during the attack on the tower.\n\nThe ward keeps me from being able to scry out the force holding it in place, but it doesn't preclude you from scrying.\n\nYou'll require a focus, though. A crystal-bearing giant named Apex roams the plains to the west of Manaforge Duro. One of its crystals would make an excellent scrying focus.",o="找到阿匹克斯并夺得阿匹克斯的聚焦水晶，然后返回紫罗兰之塔，在大法师瓦格斯的宝珠旁使用阿匹克斯的聚焦水晶，查明破除塔内诅咒的钥匙在谁手中。",oEN="Locate Apex and obtain Apex's Crystal Focus from him. Return to the Violet Tower and use Apex's Crystal Focus near Archmage Vargoth's Orb to discover who holds the key to breaking the tower's curse.",c="<你描述了你占卜的结果。>\n\n你是说，指挥官萨拉妮丝？嗯……\n\n她是凯尔萨斯的顾问之一，但一定不是位法师。我从那次肯瑞瓦村庄的攻击中记起她。我认为你的想法是对的，$n。她不用亲自维持咒语，但是她可以拥有它的钥匙。",cEN="Commander Sarannis, you say? Hmm...\n\nShe's one of Kael'thas's advisors, but certainly not a mage. I remember her from the attack on Kirin'Var Village. I think your impressions are correct, <name>. She's not maintaining the curse personally, but she holds the key to it."}
Q[10257]={d="凯尔萨斯将钥石交给指挥官萨拉妮丝这样的人保管，我一点都不觉得惊讶。凯尔萨斯王子在许多方面都非常优秀，他绝对不是傻子。\n\n为了永久破除这个诅咒，你必须杀入风暴要塞夺回钥石。\n\n一旦钥石被摧毁，我就能重获久违的自由。",dEN="It doesn't surprise me that Kael'thas has put the key to this ward in the hands of someone like Commander Sarannis. Prince Kael'thas is a great many things, but he is no simpleton.\n\nIn order to break this curse once and for all, you must enter Tempest Keep and claim the keystone.\n\nOnly once the keystone has been destroyed will I regain my freedom.",o="进入风暴要塞的生态船，从指挥官萨拉妮丝手中夺得钥石，将它交给紫罗兰之塔的大法师瓦格斯。",oEN="Venture into Tempest Keep's Botanica and retrieve the Keystone from Commander Sarannis. Bring it to Archmage Vargoth at the Violet Tower.",p="你拿到钥石了吗？",pEN="Did you obtain the keystone?",c="<当你把钥石交给他时，大法师的眼睛发亮。>\n\n真是惊人！根据我所看到的少许关于法兰伦的命运，我不确定我想要出去了，但是这会比我困在这里度过余生来得好多了。",cEN="Amazing! From what little I've seen of the fate of Farahlon, I'm not certain I want to go outside, but it's much better than being trapped here for the rest of my days."}
Q[10258]={d="物资库的指挥官霍加斯在东边的那座塔中徘徊。你一定要把干掉乌尔特拉克的消息告诉他，也许这样他就会对你友好些，当然，也许……他可能会干脆吞噬你的灵魂。我们是永远无法了解一个幽灵的感情的。\n\n阴魂仍然对我们保持着敌对态度，他们很有可能会杀了你。千万小心，$n。",dEN="Hogarth, the commander of the Armory, is in the eastern tower. You must report your victory over Urtrak to him. Perhaps he will be friendly? Of course he may try to consume your soul. One can never tell with spirits such as these.\n\nThe Unyielding are still against us and will no doubt kill you if they can. Be careful <name>.",o="向远征军物资库的指挥官霍加斯报到。",oEN="Report to Commander Hogarth in the Expedition Armory.",c="我们在很久以前的战争中输给了邪兽人。你杀了乌崔克帮我们赢回了一点自尊。\n\n从我们的武器之中选一把带着吧。当你跟我们最痛恨的敌人战斗的时候，使用这个武器，那么从我们的诅咒之中脱离的战友将会赶来协助你。\n\n在你离开之前，曾经在围攻哨塔战死的同伴们想要表扬你消灭了我们的敌人。",cEN="We lost our battle against the fel orcs so very long ago. You have restored some of our lost honor by killing Urtrak.\n\nTake one of our weapons with you. When you are fighting our most hated foes, use this weapon, and those who are free of our curse will come to your aid.\n\nBefore you leave, those who died at the siege tower wish to honor you for destroying our enemies."}
Q[10259]={d="黑暗之门战事迭起！银色黎明正在拼死奋战，一旦他们战败，恶魔的火焰就将烧遍整个世界。\n\n帮帮我们吧，$n。转至黑暗之门，伸出援手，与我们的兄弟姐妹并肩作战。阻止这可怕的黑暗之潮！银色黎明需要你，艾泽拉斯需要你！",dEN="Battle rages non-stop at the portal! The Argent Dawn is fighting a desperate fight -- and if we lose, then there will be no end to the demon's fire.\n\nHelp us, <name>. Enter the breach and lend aid to our brothers and sisters. Help stem this tide of darkness! The Argent Dawn -- and the world -- needs you!",o="杀死6个入侵的恶魔卫士，然后向银色使者普罗维尔复命。",oEN="Kill 6 Invading Felguards and then return to Argent Emissary Proudwell.",c="谢谢你，$n。在战斗的混乱之中，$g英雄们:英雄们;在黑暗中熠熠生辉。你的光芒真切地闪耀着！",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Among the chaos of battle, heroes burn bright against the darkness. Your light shines true!"}
Q[10261]={d="悬赏：我需要一根歼灭者机械臂来替换长管光谱分析仪中损坏的零件。\n\n你和你的朋友可以去西边的法力熔炉：布纳尔，看看那里的血精灵是否有这类备用零件。法力熔炉中似乎有奥术歼灭者活动。\n\n请将一根品质完好的歼灭者机械臂交给52区的维勒老爹。",dEN="WANTED: 1 Annihilator Servo to replace the failing one in my Long Neck Spectrum Analyzer.\n\nYou and your friends might want to check with the blood elves at Manaforge B'naar to the west to see if they have any spares. They seem to have a few arcane annihilators roaming about.\n\nPlease deliver the servo in pristine condition to Papa Wheeler at Area 52.",o="将一根歼灭者机械臂交给虚空风暴52区的维勒老爹。",oEN="Obtain an Annihilator Servo and deliver it to Papa Wheeler at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="我希望你是来关照我张贴的悬赏布告的！",pEN="I hope that you're here concerning the wanted ad that I placed!",c="喔呵！你知道要得到这些东西有多难吗？这跟我在这里收到的普通零件可不一样。\n\n告诉你吧，我要你从我的旧货盒中拿取一样东西做为报酬。我相信那里有你可以用得东西。如果不是的话，就卖掉吧。\n\n好了，让我从你手中接过这样东西并在这个坏掉的伺服电动机爆炸前放进我的长颈光谱分析器中。",cEN="Woo hoo! Do you know how hard these things are to come by? It's not like I'm getting a regular shipment of parts out here.\n\nTell you what, as payment I want you to take something out of my box of junk. I'm sure there'll be something in there you can use. And if not, sell it.\n\nAlright, let me just take that off of your hands and get it into my Long Neck Spectrum Analyzer before the failing servo in it explodes!"}
Q[10262]={d="我还有件事要你帮忙。\n\n一个名叫萨克希斯的虚灵组织已经脱离了星界财团，经营起自己的生意来。他们居然和日怒血精灵有贸易往来，我无法容忍这种行径！\n\n我偷偷潜入了南边的机甲废场，那里就是萨克希斯虚灵的营地。在干掉了他们的领袖之后，我不得不逃回52区。\n\n$C，返回机甲废场，把他们的徽记带回来给我。当然，你不必赶尽杀绝，给他们点颜色瞧瞧就可以了，这帮家伙全是懦夫。",dEN="There is something else that I want your help with.\n\nA group of ethereals, known as the Zaxxis, have cut their relationship with the Consortium and gone into business for themselves. They've even cut deals with the Sunfury blood elves. This will not be tolerated!\n\nI infiltrated their group at the Heap to the south. But after I took out their leader, I had to escape here to Area 52.\n\n<class>, go down there and bring back their insignias. Of course, not all wear them because they're cowards.",o="收集10枚萨克希斯徽记，将它们交给虚空风暴52区的虚空猎手卡尔伊。",oEN="Collect 10 Zaxxis Insignias and return them to Nether-Stalker Khay'ji at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="完成了吗？你有除去外域的萨克希斯渣滓，并将他们的徽记带来给我了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Have you wiped the Zaxxis scum from the face of Outland and brought me their insignia?",c="这些徽记是一个好开始。\n\n不幸的是，当你在聚集之地时，我在萨希斯的其它密探其中之一捎话给我，星界强盗奈萨德还活着！",cEN="These insignia are a good start.\n\nUnfortunately while you were at the Heap, one of my other agents amongst the Zaxxis sent word to me that Warp-Raider Nesaad still lives!"}
Q[10263]={d="沙塔斯城的纳鲁一直在寻找着某种能够改变星界财团审事态度的方式。\n\n走运的是，最近这些虚灵和虚空风暴的血精灵们在生意场日益敌对起来，于是我们就有了机会。\n\n星界财团在镇上有一名代表，名叫虚空猎手卡尔伊，他最近惹上了一群变节的虚灵。作为奥尔多的代表，我希望你能去向他提供帮助，让他成为我们的朋友。",dEN="The naaru of Shattrath City have been trying to find a means to bring the Consortium over to their way of seeing things.\n\nLuck would have it that the business relationship between the ethereals and the blood elves of the Netherstorm has recently soured.\n\nThere's a Consortium representative in town named Nether-Stalker Khay'ji who recently ran into trouble with a pack of renegade ethereals. As a representative of the Aldor, I would like for you to help him in any way that you can.",o="到虚空风暴去，与52区的虚空猎手卡尔伊谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nether-Stalker Khay'ji at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",c="你好，$r。\n\n你该不是碰巧有空可以进行一个有点重要的修复任务吧？",cEN="Hello, <race>.\n\nYou don't happen to be available for a recovery mission of some importance?"}
Q[10264]={d="沙塔斯城的纳鲁一直在寻找着某种能够改变星界财团审事态度的方式。\n\n走运的是，最近这些虚灵和虚空风暴的血精灵们在生意场日益敌对起来，于是我们就有了机会。\n\n星界财团在镇上有一名代表，名叫虚空猎手卡尔伊，他最近惹上了一群变节的虚灵。作为占星者的代表，我希望你能去向他提供帮助，让他成为我们的朋友。",dEN="The naaru of Shattrath City have been trying to find a means to bring the Consortium over to their way of seeing things.\n\nLuck would have it that the business relationship between the ethereals and the blood elves of the Netherstorm has recently soured.\n\nThere's a Consortium representative in town named Nether-Stalker Khay'ji who recently ran into trouble with a pack of renegade ethereals. As a representative of the Scryers, I would like for you to help him in any way that you can.",o="到虚空风暴去，与52区的虚空猎手卡尔伊谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nether-Stalker Khay'ji at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",c="你好，$r。\n\n你该不是碰巧有空可以进行一个有点重要的修复任务吧？",cEN="Hello, <race>.\n\nYou don't happen to be available for a recovery mission of some importance?"}
Q[10265]={d="我们的领袖——节点亲王哈拉迈德派我转至东南方的阿尔科隆废墟，取回一件水晶神器。\n\n那里是一处古老的德莱尼文明废墟，我和此地的地精遇到了同样的麻烦：燃烧军团已经进驻阿尔科隆废墟并启动了挖掘工事。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我的话，就进入废墟将那件水晶神器从恐惧魔王匹塔塞隆手中抢回来吧。",dEN="Our leader, Nexus-Prince Haramad, has tasked me with the acquisition of a crystal artifact from the Arklon Ruins to the southeast.\n\nThey're old draenei ruins. Unfortunately for both myself and the goblins here, the Burning Legion has decided to move in to perform their own excavation.\n\nIf you're willing to help me, go to the ruins and take the crystal artifact from the dreadlord named Pentatharon.",o="将一件阿尔科隆水晶神器交给虚空风暴52区的虚空猎手卡尔伊。",oEN="Obtain an Arklon Crystal Artifact and return it to Nether-Stalker Khay'ji at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="我有印象王子正在寻找一颗特别的水晶，但是我不确定它是什么。\n\n你已经从恐惧领主那拿到一个了吗？",pEN="I get the impression that the prince is looking for a particular crystal, but I'm not certain what it is.\n\nHave you already recovered the one from the dreadlord?",c="让我看一下那东西。\n\n嗯，看来似乎没有什么特别的。我怀疑这就是那个东西吗，虽然你所描述燃烧军团在废墟活动的方式，听起来好像他们正在寻找某些特别的东西。\n\n让我们期望这不会是节点亲王那么想拥有的水晶。",cEN="Let me have a look at that.\n\nHmm, there doesn't appear to be anything special about it. I doubt this is it, though the manner in which you describe the Burning Legion's activities at the ruins, it sounds as if they're searching for something in particular as well.\n\nLet us hope that it's not the crystal that the nexus-prince wants so badly."}
Q[10266]={d="在你转至阿尔科隆废墟执行任务时，我收到了本地区另一位虚灵特使的支持请求。似乎血精灵拒绝支付货款，星界财团在夺回财产的事情上遇到了一些“麻烦”。\n\n出了52区后沿着东边的道路走，过了桥便是一座浮岛，岛上的中央生态圆顶内设有一座哨站。你可以在哨站中找到我的同事加鲁斯。",dEN="While you were at the Arklon Ruins, I received a request for assistance from one of our representatives out in the field. It would appear that the Consortium is having some 'difficulties' in trying to recover property from the blood elves, which they refuse to pay for.\n\nPlease head east out of Area 52 and cross the bridge to the next island over. You'll find my associate, Gahruj, at the Midrealm Post, just inside of Eco-Dome Midrealm.",o="转至虚空风暴中央生态圆顶的中央圆顶哨站，找到加鲁斯并为他效力。",oEN="Seek out and offer your services to Gahruj. He is located at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",c="没错，是真的。血精灵在另一批已经送达的货物买卖上食言了。\n\n因为虚空猎手卡尔伊对你的保证，我希望你能在这件事情上协助我。",cEN="Yes, it's true. The blood elves have reneged on yet another purchase of goods that has already been delivered.\n\nAs Nether-Stalker Khay'ji has vouched for you, I am hopeful that you will be able to assist me in this matter."}
Q[10267]={d="我们与血精灵之间的贸易关系看来就此终结了。几周前，我们按订货单为法力熔炉：杜隆送去了一批探测设备，但是血精灵拒绝付款。\n\n$n，我要你去东边的法力熔炉：杜隆跑一趟。他们似乎正为肆虐的法力生物烦恼不已，你可以趁机混入法力熔炉。\n\n我根本不关心他们的境遇，我只想取回星界财团的财产。",dEN="Our business relations with the blood elves appear to be at an end. A few weeks ago a large shipment of surveying equipment was delivered to them at Manaforge Duro. They have refused to pay for it.\n\n<name>, I would ask that you pay the blood elves of Manaforge Duro to the east a visit. They appear to be having some trouble with an infestation of mana creatures there, so take advantage of their preoccupation.\n\nI care not what happens to them, but I would very much like to see the return of our property.",o="收集10箱测量装置，然后返回虚空风暴中央生态圆顶的中央圆顶哨站，将它们交给加鲁斯。",oEN="Collect 10 Boxes of Surveying Equipment and return them to Gahruj at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",p="你拿到那些血精灵拖欠的测量装置了吗？",pEN="Do you have possession of the surveying equipment which the blood elves defaulted on?",c="嗯，我个人对于解决了这桩小生意感到很开心。我不记得何星界财团何时与那样粗野且无法信任的生物交易过。\n\n不过，你好像很值得信任，$n。或许你不介意帮我更多的忙？",cEN="Well, I for one am glad that this petty little business is behind us. I cannot remember a time when the Consortium has had dealings with such boorish and untrustworthy beings.\n\nYou, however, seem to be very trustworthy, <name>. Perhaps you wouldn't mind doing me one more favor?"}
Q[10268]={d="节点亲王哈拉迈德刚刚派来特使向我转达了他的意愿，亲王殿下希望我们立刻将这件无价之宝归还到他本人手中。如果你能帮我跑这一趟的话，我会由衷地感激你。\n\n能够得到节点亲王的召见将是无上的荣耀，我相信他会非常乐意聆听你在虚空风暴的冒险故事。\n\n转至北边的风暴尖塔吧，亲王将在塔顶的大厅中接见你。哦，你可能会注意到，他通常以全息影像的方式现身。",dEN="Nexus-Prince Haramad has conveyed to me that he is interested in the immediate return of this property to him personally. I would greatly appreciate if you would deliver it in my stead.\n\nIt is a great honor to gain an audience with the nexus-prince, and I am sure that he would be keenly interested in hearing the tales of your adventures here in the Netherstorm.\n\nSeek out his chamber atop the Stormspire to the north. He is often present as a holographic image, which you may address.",o="转至虚空风暴的风暴尖塔，将测量装置交给节点亲王哈拉迈德的影像。",oEN="Deliver the Surveying Equipment to the Image of Nexus-Prince Haramad at the Stormspire in the Netherstorm.",p="靠近一点。",pEN="Approach.",c="欢迎来到风暴尖塔，$c。请享用星界财团的殷勤招待。\n\n你可以将那个设备放在任何地方。我猜你可能很快地就要背起它了。",cEN="I welcome you to the Stormspire, <class>. Please enjoy the hospitality of the Consortium.\n\nYou may place that equipment anywhere. I suspect that you'll be picking it back up rather soon."}
Q[10269]={d="还有一个原因让我们必须取回那些测量装置。德莱尼人的传说中曾提到一颗神奇的水晶，它对我来说非常重要。\n\n据说这颗水晶中蕴藏着能与神祗媲美的力量！但现在，它很可能落入了燃烧军团的手中。\n\n$n，利用测量仪找到第一个三角点。我想它应该在法力熔炉：乌提斯以东的某个地方。\n\n找到之后，与法力熔炉：乌提斯所在的浮岛上的商人哈斯辛谈一谈，他是我派驻在那里的代理人。",dEN="There is another reason for the retrieval of the surveying equipment. There is a crystal from draenei legend of great importance to me.\n\nIt is said that the crystal bestows god-like powers to its bearer! But it is in danger of being unearthed by others - namely the Burning Legion.\n\n<name>, take the equipment and use it to find the first triangulation point. We know it to be somewhere to the east near Manaforge Ultris.\n\nAfterward, check-in with my agent, Dealer Hazzin, on the Manaforge Ultris island.",o="利用三角测量仪找到一号三角点。找到之后，立刻转至虚空风暴法力熔炉：乌提斯的维序派哨站，向商人哈斯辛汇报三角点的位置。",oEN="Use the Triangulation Device to point your way toward the first triangulation point. Once you have found it, report the location to Dealer Hazzin at the Protectorate Watchpost on the Manaforge Ultris island in the Netherstorm.",p="你好，$g旅行者:旅行者;。你来找哈津，是需要我的货物吗？",pEN="Hello, traveler. You come to Hazzin because you are in need of my goods?",c="<商人哈斯辛降低他的声音变成耳语一般。>\n\n啊，我知道你的任务。这对节点亲王哈拉迈德来说非常重要！\n\n既然我们知道第一个三角测量点的位置，你必须迅速动身去找到第二个！",cEN="<Dealer Hazzin lowers his voice to a whisper.>\n\nAh, I know of your mission. It is one of great importance to Nexus-Prince Haramad!\n\nNow that we know the location of this first triangulation point, you must move swiftly to find the second!"}
Q[10270]={d="看你那表情，我就知道你是那种懂得欣赏好利润的$r。\n\n我以经营异域珍品闻名，眼下正要开启一项新的商业冒险。\n\n我需要一个可靠的分包人，去天穹之脊为我取货。\n\n首先，你得重新激活一处传送平台。泽昂通道里有一块备用电源，就在法力熔炉乌尔特里斯南侧。护卫者组织在那里活动，所以你也许能循着他们的追踪器找到目标。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="From the look on your face, I can tell you're a <race> who appreciates a good profit.\n\nI've built a reputation as a dealer in exotic goods, and I'm about to launch a new venture.\n\nI need a reliable subcontractor to procure the goods from the Celestial Ridge.\n\nFirst, you'll need to re-energize a teleport pad. There is a spare power pack in Access Shaft Zeon, which is on the south side of Manaforge UItris. The Protectorate is operating in there, so you may be able to follow their tracers to your goal.",o="取回传送器能量包，将它带至法力熔炉：乌提斯东边苍穹之脊上的虚灵传送器。激活传送器，然后将传送器能量包交给星界商人玛里德的影像，让他进行安装。",oEN="Retrieve the Teleporter Power Pack and bring it to the Ethereal Teleport Pad on the Celestial Ridge to the east of Manaforge Ultris. Activate the pad and give the Teleporter Power Pack to the Image of Wind Trader Marid so he can install it.",p="你$g准备好:准备好;谈生意了吗，$n？",pEN="Are you prepared to discuss business now, <name>?",c="这个电池应该要为了我们的目标保留。一旦钱进帐后，我们就能将它改良得更好。\n\n有这样的东西就够了。每个讨论的片段都会造成利益的损失。",cEN="This power cell should hold for our purposes. Once the money starts rolling in, we'll improve it even more.\n\nEnough with such things. Every moment spent in discussion translates to lost profit."}
Q[10271]={d="你肯定已经看见了，这一带生活着许多处于不同生长阶段的虚空龙。无论是幼龙还是成年虚空龙，体内都蕴涵着某种精华。凯……呃，我的一名客户迫切地想要得到它。\n\n大多数人都不敢冒着生命危险来收集龙类精华，因此我们只能自己动手啦。你可以从虚空龙身上收集到这种精华，但关键问题在于我们是否能联手创建起一条稳定的供应渠道。这样，你搞到第一批之后就立即带回来给我。",dEN="As you've no doubt seen, the area is teeming with nether dragons in various stages of growth. All nether dragons, young and old, contain an essence that's highly desired by K -- err, by a client of mine.\n\nMost people aren't willing to risk their lives to gather it, so we've got the place to ourselves. You can start by gathering the essence from any of the creatures out here, but it's imperative that we start building a supply right away. Return to me once you have the first batch.",o="收集8份虚空龙类精华，然后返回虚灵传送器区域。你可以从虚空幼龙或虚空之龙身上收集到虚空龙类精华。",oEN="Gather 8 Nether Dragon Essence, then return to the Ethereal Teleport Pad area. Nether Dragon Essence may be obtained from Nether Drakes or Nether Dragons.",p="我相信你会有很多问题，所有的问题都会在适当的时间得到回答。",pEN="I'm certain you have many questions, all of which will be answered in due time.",c="想想看，卑鄙的虚灵组织要把这些精华像糖果一样卖给血精灵……",cEN="And to think, that wretched ethereal was going to sell these essences to the blood elves like so much candy..."}
Q[10272]={d="谣传此地近来有奇异的龙族血脉出现，我们正是来调查此事真实性的，据说它们可能是死亡之翼的后代。不过，这些龙显然不是普通的黑龙。\n\n如果有机会检查它们的卵，或许我们就能了解到更多秘密。这些虚空龙非常仇视蓝龙，因此我根本无法接近它们的卵，你能帮帮我吗？",dEN="We've come here to investigate rumors of a strange breed of dragons, perhaps even descendents of Deathwing himself. These are clearly not ordinary black dragons, though.\n\nWe'll know more once we've had a chance to examine their eggs. Their hatred for my flight runs deep, so I can't get close enough to gather the eggs. Will you agree to help?",o="收集15枚虚空龙卵，然后向苍穹之脊的泰莉和乔拉德复命。",oEN="Gather 15 Nether Dragonkin Eggs, then return to Tyri and Jorad on the Celestial Ridge.",p="你可以去收集蛋吗？",pEN="Were you able to gather the eggs?",c="这些蛋会得到良好的运用，$n。谢谢你同意帮助我们。\n\n不过，在我们继续之前，还有其它事情需要我们先处理。",cEN="These will work quite nicely, <name>. Thank you for agreeing to help us.\n\nBefore we can continue, however, there is something else we'll need to address."}
Q[10273]={d="你以前的雇主——风商玛里德——一定是听说你现在在帮我们了。通过我的投影，我看见他的虚空潜伏者进入了这一带，想追踪我们。\n\n到目前为止我们都躲开了，但在问题变得更严重之前，必须先解决玛里德。\n\n如果你对他的判断没错，玛里德会不惜一切保证他产品的供应。回到他那里去，告诉他你$g准备:准备;提出一笔交易。把他引开，然后杀了他。",dEN="Your former employer, Wind Trader Marid, must've gotten wind that you're helping us now. Through my projection, I've seen his nether-stalkers entering the area, hoping to track us down.\n\nWe've been able to evade them so far, but Marid must be dealt with before the problem grows more severe.\n\nIf your impressions of Marid are correct, he'll do just about anything to secure the supply of his product. Return to him and tell him you're prepared to offer a deal. Lure him away and slay him.",o="与星界商人玛里德谈一谈，诱使他离开商栈。杀死玛里德后向苍穹之脊的泰莉和乔拉德复命。",oEN="Speak with Wind Trader Marid and lure him away from his trading post. Deal with him and then return to Tyri and Jorad on the Celestial Ridge.",p="这个玛利德是个笨蛋，或者我该说，曾经是个笨蛋。",pEN="This Marid is a fool, or shall I say, was a fool.",c="既然那令人讨厌的虚灵组织已经被解决掉了，我们可以努力专注去了解这些虚空龙了。我有一个机会可以去检查这些蛋，而且我得到了一些发现。",cEN="Now that that troublesome ethereal has been dealt with, we can focus our efforts on understanding these nether dragons. I've had a chance to examine the eggs and I've made a few discoveries."}
Q[10274]={d="虚空龙的性情与它们的黑龙同宗一样凶暴而狂躁，但也有一些截然不同的地方。虚空龙的孵化期和成长期十分短暂，身上涌动着奇特的能量。这种能量流是在德拉诺世界毁灭的时候产生的，从而导致了虚空龙这一族群的诞生。\n\n我还需要了解更多的细节，我相信这种能量可以为蓝龙所用。如果我能取代这些虚空龙的领袖维拉库，充分展示我的统御力，我们就能令其它虚空龙屈服。",dEN="The nether dragons have the same ferocious temperament as their black dragon forbears, but there is something entirely alien about them. They hatch and mature rapidly, harnessing the strange energies that forged their kind in the destruction of Draenor.\n\nThere is so much more I need to know about them, but I believe the powers may be of use to my own flight. If we can displace the leader of these drakes, Veraku, with a show of dominance, we can cow the rest of them into submission.",o="转至苍穹之脊的南端，使用蓝龙的挑战激怒维拉库。击败他后向苍穹之脊的泰莉和乔拉德复命。",oEN="Use the Challenge of the Blue Flight to provoke Veraku on the southern edge of the Celestial Ridge. Defeat him and return to Tyri and Jorad on the Celestial Ridge.",p="你去挑战并且打败维拉库了吗？",pEN="Have you challenged and defeated Veraku?",c="做得好，$n。的确做得很好。虚空龙族最初不愿接受一条蓝龙混在他们之中，但是随着时间和我坚定的展示权威，他们会到这里这。分布的，单独的，没有一位可靠的领导人，我们必须警戒避免它们落入邪恶力量的统治，永远保持他们的控制权。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Well done indeed. The nether dragonkin will not accept a blue dragon among them at first, but with time and the firm demonstration of my authority, they will come around. Scattered, isolated, and without a definitive leader, we must be vigilant in preventing them from falling under the sway of a malevolent power, keeping them in check all the while."}
Q[10275]={d="根据你提供的一号三角点的信息，我对这台三角测量仪进行了重新校正。你可以采用同样的方法寻找二号三角点。\n\n我唯一能告诉你的就是它可能在极远的西方。\n\n一旦你发现了二号三角点，立即与节点亲王的另一名代理人——星界商人图鲁曼取得联系，他乔装成武器商，藏身于法力熔炉：艾拉所在的浮岛上，过了桥就能看见他的商栈。",dEN="I've recalibrated the triangulation device with the information that you provided from the first point. You'll use it in exactly the same manner to discover the second.\n\nAll that I can tell you is that the second point is somewhere far to the west.\n\nOnce you've located it, speak with Wind Trader Tuluman; another of the nexus-prince's agents. He's posing as a weapon merchant at a small trading post next to the bridge, which leads to the island that Manaforge Ara is on.",o="利用三角测量仪找到二号三角点。找到之后，立刻转至虚空风暴法力熔炉：艾拉对面的图鲁曼的营地，向星界商人图鲁曼汇报三角点的位置。",oEN="Use the Triangulation Device to point your way toward the second triangulation point. Once you have found it, report the location to Wind Trader Tuluman at Tuluman's Landing, just on the other side of the bridge from the Manaforge Ara island in the Netherstorm.",p="你要买还是要卖？",pEN="You wish to buy or sell?",c="的确非常好。节点亲王会很高兴！\n\n我们现在知道第2个点了，它将告诉我们第3个点在哪里，以及水晶的大概位置！",cEN="Very good indeed. The nexus-prince shall be pleased!\n\nWe now have the second point, which will now tell us where the third is, and the general vicinity of the crystal!"}
Q[10276]={d="利用一号和二号三角点的资料，我敢确定那颗水晶就在东北方法兰伦废墟的上方。\n\n不幸的是，数据显示它一直在移动，这就是说燃烧军团很可能已经得到了这颗水晶！\n\n为了以防万一，我建议你召集几个朋友一同转至法兰伦废墟。\n\n从恶魔手中夺回水晶，将它交给节点亲王哈拉迈德吧。",dEN="With the data from both the first and second points, I'm now certain that the crystal is at the top of the Ruins of Farahlon to the northeast.\n\nUnfortunately, the data indicates that the crystal is moving, which means that it has already been discovered, probably by the Burning Legion!\n\nJust in case, I recommend that you take some friends along.\n\nSlay the demon that has the crystal and return it to Nexus-Prince Haramad.",o="夺得阿塔玛水晶，然后返回虚空风暴的风暴之塔，将它交给节点亲王哈拉迈德的影像。",oEN="Recover the Ata'mal Crystal and deliver it to the Image of Nexus-Prince Haramad at the Stormspire in the Netherstorm.",p="又见面啦，我的朋友。水晶找的如何阿？",pEN="Hello again, my friend. How fare your efforts to find the crystal?",c="出乎我最疯狂的想象之外，我从没想到你能取回水晶！\n\n还真的将它交给我！你知道它有多么强大吗？\n\n你的无私是鼓舞人心和无可非议的，$n！你给了我许多值得思考的事。",cEN="Beyond my wildest dreams, I never thought that you would be able to retrieve the crystal!\n\nAnd then to actually give it to me! Do you have any idea how powerful it is?\n\nYour selflessness is inspirational and beyond reproach, <name>! You have given me much to think about."}
Q[10277]={d="$n，你好。请跟随时光监护者。她会帮助你理解这一切……",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Please follow the custodian. She will make things a bit more... clear.",o="时光之穴的安多尔姆要你跟随时光监护者游览时光之穴。",oEN="Andormu at the Caverns of Time has asked that you follow the Custodian of Time around the cavern.",p="直到你至少初步了解到发生的事情前都不要回来。",pEN="Do not return until you have at least a rudimentary understanding of what is happening.",c="希望你现在对于在等着你的东西有更多的了解。",cEN="Hopefully you now have a better understanding of what is expected of you."}
Q[10278]={d="我长久以来漫游外域，探寻虚空的真相。如今我已年老体衰。也许你愿意帮我？\n\n我必须弄清虚空行者的秘密。你得找到西边的迁跃平原。远征军械库以西、深渊边缘有一处时空薄弱之地。在迁跃平原使用我这台不稳定的迁跃裂隙发生器，制造一道迁跃裂隙。你必须从穿越而来的生物身上收集迁跃虚空。",dEN="Long have I wandered through Outland, searching for the truth of the void. Now I am old and weak. Perhaps you will help me?\n\nI must learn the secrets of the voidwalkers. You must find the Warp Fields to the west. West of the Expedition Armory there is a dark place on the edge of the abyss where time and space are weak. Use my unstable warp rift generator in the Warp Fields to create a warp rift. You must gather warp nether from the creatures that come through.",o="在迁跃平原使用不稳定的迁跃裂隙生成器。从不稳定的虚空行者身上收集3份迁跃虚空能量，把它们交给断背岗哨的疯狂的欧加斯。",oEN="Use the Unstable Warp Rift Generator in the Warp Fields. Gather 3 Warp Nethers from Unstable Voidwalkers and return them to Ogath the Mad in Spinebreaker Post.",p="你有试着使用我的实验设备吗？我认为我的不稳定的迁跃裂隙生成器会在如此接近坑道的深处的地方发生作用。",pEN="Have you managed to use my experimental device yet? I think my unstable warp rift generator will work out there so close to the abyss.",c="难以相信。你碰触了虚空本身！$n，你保住了我毕生的研究。不过还有更多事必须完成，而你可以帮助我。",cEN="Unbelievable. You have touched the void itself! <name>, you have saved my life's work. But there is more that must be done, and you can help me."}
Q[10279]={d="啊，$n，我们一直盼着你呢。让我的兄弟载你去见青铜龙的首领吧。他在时光之穴的底部等着你……",dEN="Ah, <name>. We have been expecting you. Please, allow one of my brothers to fly you down to the master. He awaits you below...",o="与时光之穴的安多尔姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Andormu at the Caverns of Time.",c="我们必须帮你准备好进行即将发生的战斗……",cEN="We must prepare you for the battles that lie ahead..."}
Q[10280]={d="我是位信守诺言的虚灵，$n。你的行为令我深受感动。\n\n给，将这块阿塔玛水晶转交给纳鲁吧。是你从恶魔手中夺回了这颗水晶，因此由你将它献给纳鲁是再合适不过的了。\n\n你可以使用我的私人传送装置直接抵达沙塔斯城。只要踩上去，你就会被传送过去。\n\n将阿塔玛水晶交给圣光广场中的纳鲁阿达尔，愿自由之风伴你前行。",dEN="I am an ethereal of my word, <name>. You have truly inspired me.\n\nI am now going to give you the ata'mal crystal to hand over to the naaru. As it was your heroics that made this possible, I wish for you to deliver it.\n\nYou may use my personal teleporter to go directly to Shattrath City. Simply step through it and you will be transported there.\n\nGive the crystal to the naaru known as A'dal on the Terrace of Light. May the trade winds be at your back.",o="将阿塔玛水晶交给沙塔斯城圣光广场的阿达尔。",oEN="Deliver the Ata'mal Crystal to A'dal on the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City.",p="<纳鲁说话的美妙口音充满了你的内心。>\n\n我感觉到你带着某种拥有巨大力量的东西，$r。你带给我的是什么呢？",pEN="<The musical tinkling of the naaru's speech fills your mind.>\n\nI sense that you have something of great power with you, <race>. What is it that you bring to me?",c="你取回了灵魂之歌！这个阿塔玛水晶就是预言者维伦转至埃索达进行他不幸的任务前留给族人保管的东西。\n\n奇怪的是他并没有预见它会落入燃烧军团的手中，就算只是暂时而已。\n\n或者，也许他预见了？也许他预见了这全部的事，所以将它留在那里好让你可以取回水晶并且来到这里把它交付给我？\n\n我觉得那就是事情的实情。你是你族人的伟大英雄，$n！",cEN="You have recovered Spirit's Song! It is the ata'mal crystal that Prophet Velen left behind with his people for safekeeping before he went upon his ill-fated mission to the Exodar.\n\nOdd that he did not foresee it falling into the hands of the Burning Legion, if even for a short time.\n\nOr, perhaps he did? It may be that he foresaw all of this, and left it there so that you would retrieve the crystal and deliver it to me here?\n\nI sense that is the truth of it. You are a great hero of your people, <name>!"}
Q[10281]={d="你好，$n。别害怕。这只是我当前形态的投影而已，也是我和我的伙伴秘密监视周围动向的方式，既安全又有效。\n\n之前企图跟你套近乎的虚灵，就是那个叫玛里德的家伙，他不过是个披着合法商人外衣的大骗子，你还不如与我合作得好，我是为了揭开异种龙类的谜团才来到这片山脊的。来苍穹之脊的最北端找我吧，我们可以详细谈谈。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Do not be alarmed. This is merely a projection of my current form. It's the only way my companion and I could keep watch without revealing ourselves.\n\nThe ethereal who approached you, Marid, is little better than a swindler in the guise of a legitimate merchant. I'd like you to consider working with me instead. My purpose out here is to find out more about the unusual dragonkin on this ridge. Meet me at the north end of the ridge and we will discuss this further.",o="找到苍穹之脊北端的泰莉，与她谈一谈。",oEN="Find Tyri at the north end of the Celestial Ridge and speak with her.",c="我叫泰瑞苟萨，属玛里苟斯血脉，但大家都叫我泰瑞。我的同伴是$c乔拉德·梅斯。\n\n关于这些奇异龙类的传闻已经传得很远，我担心会有太多人为了牟利蜂拥而来，却根本没弄清自己面对的是什么。我们希望你能帮我们在别人发现它们之前，更深入地了解这些生物。",cEN="My name is Tyrygosa, of the brood of Malygos, but most call me 'Tyri.' My companion is the <class> Jorad Mace.\n\nWord of these strange dragonkin has already traveled far and I fear that too many will rush to exploit them for profit without realizing the true nature of what they're dealing with. With your help, we're hoping to gain insight into these creatures before others discover their presence."}
Q[10282]={d="西边是通往旧希尔斯布莱德丘陵的时光通道，准确的说是7年前的希尔斯布莱德丘陵。\n\n永恒之龙的爪牙们企图将部落的酋长萨尔永远囚禁在敦霍尔德城堡。\n\n你应该明白，要是萨尔无法逃离敦霍尔德城堡，这世界就将不复存在。\n\n组织一队冒险者，穿越时光通道进入旧希尔斯布莱德丘陵。\n\n跟伊洛希恩谈谈。",dEN="To the west is the timeway to Hillsbrad of the past - 7 years to be exact.\n\nForces are working against the Horde warchief, Thrall, attempting to prevent him from ever escaping Durnholde Keep.\n\nIf Thrall never escapes, this world - as you know it - will cease to exist.\n\nGather a group of adventurers and take the timeway to old Hillsbrad. Two of our agents await you inside.\n\nSpeak with Erozion on the other side.",o="时光之穴的安多尔姆要求你进入旧希尔斯布莱德丘陵，与伊洛希恩谈一谈。",oEN="Andormu at the Caverns of Time has asked that you venture to Old Hillsbrad and speak with Erozion.",c="我们最担心的事很快就会成真。在这次短暂骚动背后主导的力量是一群被称为无尽重生的新种飞龙。我们不知道他们从何而来或是为何破坏时间之道。\n\n在这个时光区域中，他们拐走了塔蕾莎，塔米思·佛斯顿的女儿，埃德拉斯·布拉克摩尔的秘书，敦霍尔德的统治者以及艾泽拉斯所有俘虏集中营的监工。",cEN="Our worst fears might soon be realized. The forces at work behind this temporal disturbance are a new flight of dragons known as the Infinite. We do not know where they came from or why they are destroying timeways.\n\nIn this pocket of time, they have kidnapped Taretha Foxton, daughter of Tammis Foxton, the secretary of Aedelas Blackmoore, ruler of Durnholde and overseer of all internment camps on Azeroth."}
Q[10283]={d="塔蕾莎是挽救萨尔性命的关键人物，她还教会了萨尔如何思考，为他日后成长为部落酋长奠定了坚实的基础。\n\n正是塔蕾莎在敦霍尔德城堡采取的声东击西战术，帮助萨尔成功脱逃。\n\n永恒之龙却将塔蕾莎囚禁在塔伦米尔。倘若我们袖手旁观的话，就不会发生这场混乱，萨尔也无从逃脱。你必须利用我交给你的燃烧弹，焚毁敦霍尔德城堡的收容所。引爆燃烧弹后，跟被关押在敦霍尔德城堡地牢中的年轻的萨尔谈谈。",dEN="Taretha was integral in Thrall's survival and upbringing and instrumental in shaping Thrall's life.\n\nIt was Taretha who created the original diversion at Durnholde, allowing Thrall to escape.\n\nNow the Infinite have captured Taretha and hold her at Tarren Mill. The diversion will not happen without our involvement. You must use the incendiary devices that I give you and burn down the internment lodges in Durnholde. When you have done this, speak with young Thrall in the basement prison of Durnholde.",o="进入敦霍尔德城堡，将伊洛希恩交给你的燃烧弹包分别放入5间收容所内的木桶，并启动定时装置。\n\n引爆燃烧弹后，与被关押在敦霍尔德城堡地牢中的萨尔谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Durnholde Keep and set 5 incendiary charges at the barrels located inside each of the internment lodges using the Pack of Incendiary Bombs given to you by Erozion.\n\nSpeak to Thrall in the basement prison of Durnholde Keep when you have the Internment Lodges Set Ablaze.",p="你是谁？",pEN="Who are you?",c="你是塔蕾莎的朋友？这就是她的新计划？那好吧……$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="You are friends of Taretha? So this is her new plan? Very well then..."}
Q[10284]={d="你现在看我，只看到一个男孩，但在我的心里和灵魂深处，藏着我的梦想。我为我的族人做了规划，$g陌生人:陌生人;。总有一天，他们会推翻压迫者，团结一致地站起来。他们会挣脱束缚他们的锁链，而从这场起义中将诞生兽人的部落。\n\n我向你保证，$g陌生人:陌生人;，如果我们能活着离开这里，等我有能力报答这份无私之举时，我会去找你……我一定会找到你。\n\n<萨尔点了点头。>\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;了，我们就出发。",dEN="You look upon me now and see only a boy, but in my heart and soul I hide my dreams. I have plans for my people, stranger. One day, they shall overthrow their oppressors and rise as one. They will break free from the bonds that hold them and from that uprising shall be born the orcish Horde.\n\nI promise you, stranger, should we make it out of here alive, when I have the means to reward this selfless deed, I will seek you out... I will find you.\n\n<Thrall nods.>\n\nWe will leave when you are ready.",o="等你$g准备好:准备好;继续时，告诉萨尔。跟随萨尔离开敦霍尔德城堡，帮他救出塔蕾莎，完成他的命运。\n\n完成此任务后，去旧希尔斯布莱德与埃罗齐恩谈谈。",oEN="When you are ready to proceed, let Thrall know. Follow Thrall out of Durnholde Keep and help him free Taretha and fulfill his destiny.\n\nSpeak with Erozion in Old Hillsbrad should you complete this task.",p="<伊洛森点了点头。>",pEN="<Erozion nods.>",c="你完成了一件伟大的事，$n。哎呀，这个年轻大酋长对这些事件的回忆一定和当时分毫不差……安杜姆就在主人的藏身处等着你。",cEN="You have done a great thing, <name>. Alas, the young warchief's memory of these events must be as they originally were... Andormu awaits you in the master's lair."}
Q[10285]={d="历史的进程得以维护，永恒之龙企图在旧希尔斯布莱德丘陵引发混乱的阴谋已经被粉碎。\n\n立即向安多尔姆复命吧，他在主宰之巢等着你。",dEN="This timeline has been restored and the assault of the Infinite Dragonflight upon Hillsbrad has been quashed.\n\nReturn to Andormu at once. He awaits your arrival in the master's lair.",o="返回塔纳利斯沙漠的时光之穴，向幼时的安多尔姆复命。",oEN="Return to the child Andormu at the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris desert.",c="请接受青铜龙的这份礼物。这些物品将会在你踏上时间之旅的时候协助你。",cEN="Please accept a gift from the bronze flight. These items will assist you in your journeys through time."}
Q[10286]={d="埃雷利恩在日记中写下的并不是什么学术研究笔记，而是关于他与一名年轻的血精灵女子的风流韵事！我怎么会蠢到这个地步？\n\n可惜日记中没有提到这个荡妇的名字。阿利迪斯是埃雷利恩的同事，也是他最好的朋友和知己。去审问他，查明我的丈夫到底和谁有暧昧关系。\n\n我看到阿利迪斯离开猎鹰岗哨往赞加沼泽去了。沿着北边的道路走，它一直通向西边的赞加沼泽。",dEN="Arelion's journal does not deal with any sort of scholarly studies. It details his escapades with a young female blood elf! How could I've been such a fool?\n\nUnfortunately, the floozy's identity is not revealed in this journal. Aledis, a colleague of Arelion's, was his best friend and confidant. Go question him and find out who he was having this affair with.\n\nI saw Aledis leave Falcon Watch for Zangarmarsh. Follow the road headed north from town; it'll eventually lead west, toward Zangarmarsh.",o="魔导师卡尔琳达要你审问魔导师阿利迪斯，他已经离开猎鹰岗哨，往赞加沼泽的方向去了。",oEN="Magistrix Carinda wants you to interrogate Magister Aledis, last seen traveling from Falcon Watch to Zangarmarsh.",c="我会告诉你想知道的讯息，$c。放下你的武器，我不想惹更多麻烦了。",cEN="I'll talk, <class>. Put your weapon down, I don't want any more trouble."}
Q[10287]={d="我是埃雷利恩的朋友，但我不会为了他丢掉自己的性命。他的“恋人”是薇拉·火语。\n\n去告诉他的妻子吧。不知道这个彪悍的女人会做出什么事来？",dEN="I'm Arelion's friend, but I'm not going to take the beating of my life for him. His mistress is Viera Sunwhisper.\n\nGo tell that harpy of a wife of his. What's she going to do anyway?",o="向地狱火半岛猎鹰岗哨的魔导师卡尔琳达复命。",oEN="Return to Magistrix Carinda at Falcon Watch in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="薇拉·火语吗？那个被宠坏的污秽女人。\n\n我将让她知道我不是个轻易让人愚弄的人！",cEN="Viera Sunwhisper? That lousy little brat.\n\nI will show her I'm not one to be trifled with!"}
Q[10288]={d="我要你去和阿米什·蛮锤谈谈，他就站在我们南边30步远的地方。他可以安排你搭乘狮鹫直飞荣耀堡。到达荣耀堡之后，你会先和伊斯多尔元帅碰面。我这里还准备了一份书面报告，描述了这里的情况。你要把这份报告带给他，并向他报到。\n\n这就是我给你的命令，立刻去执行！你的力量将一定可以帮助我们对付那些恶魔，别在这里浪费时间了。荣耀堡更加需要你的帮助。",dEN="I want you to speak with Amish Wildhammer, standing about 30 paces south of us, and catch the first flight to Honor Hold. When you arrive at Honor Hold, you'll be greeted by Marshal Isildor. I have prepared a report detailing our situation here. Give him the report, and tell him you're ready for duty.\n\nYou have your orders, soldier, now move out! And though your blood must be burning to help us against the fiends below, waste no time here. Honor Hold needs you even more.",o="地狱火半岛上黑暗之门的指挥官杜隆要求你将杜隆的报告交给阿米什·蛮锤。",oEN="Commander Duron at the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula wants you to bring Duron's Report to Amish Wildhammer.",p="我看过你在那跟杜隆交谈。你一定是在进行一项重要的任务吧！",pEN="I saw you speaking with Duron over there. You must be on an important mission!",c="要送报告去荣耀堡？没问题——我用我的狮鹫把你又快又安全地送到那儿。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Reports for Honor Hold? No problem -- we'll get you there fast and safe on one of my gryphons!"}
Q[10289]={d="等你$g准备好:准备好;了，我会召唤一头双足飞龙送你去萨尔玛。到了之后，把奥里昂的报告交给克拉库克将军。\n\nLok'tar Ogar，$n。祝你好运。",dEN="When you're ready, I'll summon a wyvern to fly you to Thrallmar. Once you arrive, deliver Orion's report to General Krakork.\n\nLok'tar ogar, <name> - good luck.",o="乘坐维拉加·乱羽的双足飞龙转至萨尔玛，并将沃雷恩的报告交给克拉库克将军。",oEN="Take Vlagga Freyfeather's Wind Rider to Thrallmar. Bring Orion's Report to General Krakork.",p="来自沃雷恩的报告吗？快一点拿过来！\n\n<克拉库克克将军皱着眉头迅速地审视了潦草的文件。>\n\n可恶，这是我们所担心的。沃雷恩和他的战士们随时可能被包围！",pEN="A report from Orion? Give it here, quickly!\n\n<Frowning, General Krakork quickly scans the tattered document.>\n\nDamn, it's just as we feared. Orion and his warriors could be overrun at any moment!",c="我将集结我所能调动的军队，并且派他们去援助在黑暗之门的沃雷恩的部队。不久之后燃烧军团将忘不了部落的战吼声！至于你$n，你今天已经为萨尔玛做了一项伟大的事。我期待你在这里能给我们很大的协助……假如你有让自己生存下去的智慧的话。",cEN="I'll rally what troops I can and send them to aid Orion's forces at the Dark Portal. The Legion will not soon forget the battle cry of the Horde! As for you <name>, you've done a great service for Thrallmar this day. I expect you'll be a great help to us here... if you have the wits to survive, that is."}
Q[10290]={d="此地东北方就是虚空石。虚空石的景致跟这里的青翠绿地截然不同，暴露在地表外的水晶石几乎结成了阵。我们将水晶中包含的矿物质命名为法兰石，以此纪念这片土地以前的主人。\n\n我们开采到的少量法兰石成了市面上的抢手货。不过，高纯度的法兰石并非来自沉积水晶岩，而是取自虚空石附近的石巨人身上。如果你能帮我收集天然法兰石的话，我就与你分享销售收入。",dEN="To the northeast is an area called the Netherstone, a landmark not seen when this was a lush, green land. Newly-exposed crystal formations have shown us a mineral we've called farahlite in honor of this land's former identity.\n\nThe tiny amount of farahlite we've mined has already proven popular with our clients. The highest grade of the mineral comes not from static deposits, but from the giants around the Netherstone. I can offer you a cut of the profits if you'll help supply the higher grade farahlite.",o="收集4块天然法兰石，将它们交给风暴尖塔的伊格努比。",oEN="Gather 4 pieces of Raw Farahlite and return to Zuben Elgenubi at the Stormspire.",p="我了解收集天然法兰石的风险，但是做生意也是如此。不愿意冒险的商人最好关门大吉，为自己减少麻烦。",pEN="I understand the dangers of gathering farahlite are great, but so are the opportunities. A merchant who isn't willing to take the risk may as well close his doors and save himself the trouble.",c="啊，是的。这种等级确实是我所期待的。假如我们能从巨人身上取得稳定的进货来源，我们也许能完全的放弃开采水晶矿。",cEN="Ah, yes. This is precisely the grade I was hoping for. We may give up mining the crystal formations altogether if we can secure a supply from the giants."}
Q[10291]={d="尽管我军将士的勇猛无可匹敌，但我们在这片废土上仍然举步维艰。立刻向兵营内的纳兹格雷尔大人报到，他正需要一批忠诚的死士，譬如你。如果无法保住在这里的阵地，我们将一无是处，毫无价值。现在，快去吧！",dEN="Though our warriors are without peer, our hold on this wasteland is still tenuous. Report to Nazgrel inside the barracks - he has need of agents... such as you. If we can't protect our holdings here, we'll be of no use to anyone. Now go!",o="萨尔玛的克拉库克将军要求你向纳兹格雷尔报到。",oEN="General Krakork in Thrallmar wants you to speak with Nazgrel.",c="我们已经在这个该死的荒原失去了许多勇敢的战士。我不想再派更多的新兵去送死。\n\n<纳兹格雷尔通过他残破不堪的狼型面罩严厉的怒视着你。>\n\n反正，假如克拉库克克将军派你来见我，那就表示你有可取之处。那么你的意思呢，$n？你愿意荣誉地为你的大酋长服务吗？",cEN="We've already lost many brave warriors to this cursed wasteland. I have little interest in sending more untested recruits to the slaughter.\n\n<Nazgrel glares at you sternly through his ragged wolf-mask>\n\nStill, if General Krakork sent you to me, he must have seen something in you. What say you then, <name>? Will you serve your warchief with honor?"}
Q[10293]={d="有了优良的基准产品，接下来我们需要寻找品质更高的水晶。当然，当前为止我们开采到的法兰石已经相当不错了，但是我知道哪里有更好的水晶。\n\n我们要从法兰伦石巨人族长克拉格斯卡身上直接采集一份样品！他与别的石巨人一起生活在虚空石。他的后背生长着巨大的法兰石水晶簇，那正是我们需要的东西。打倒这个巨人，然后将他身上的法兰石核心带回来。",dEN="Now that we've got a good baseline product, we're going to need something of higher quality. Certainly the farahlite we've gathered so far is nice, but I know there's better out there.\n\nWe'll have to get a sample directly from Cragskaar, the patriarch of the Farahlon giants! You should be able to find it among the other giants in the Netherstone area. It's got huge pieces of farahlite jutting from its back and that's exactly what we need. Fell the giant and collect a farahlite core from it.",o="风暴尖塔的伊格努比要你取回一个法兰石核心。",oEN="Zuben Elgenubi at the Stormspire wants you to obtain a Farahlite Core.",p="你仍然活着，表示你已取得核心，或者你已经改变主意。是哪一个呢？",pEN="You're still alive, which means you've either got the core, or you've changed your mind. Which is it?",c="做得好！我等不及要测试这东西了。",cEN="Well done! I can't wait to put this to the test."}
Q[10294]={d="我们得略微改进一下我这台迁跃裂隙生成器。这样，你带着它到虚空山脉去，就在这里的正东方。你去的路上要小心避开塞斯高。在塞斯高那边东侧的山里应该有条隐秘的小路，直接沿着这条小路过去，就可以找到虚空山脉了，那是一片位于深渊边缘的可怕的地方。\n\n到了那边以后，你要先杀死几只虚空行者，然后把它们的灵魂碎片带回来。有了它们的力量，我就可以大大强化迁跃裂隙生成器的功率，打开一扇永远不会关闭的传送门了。",dEN="We have to improve my warp rift generator. You must take it to Void Ridge. Head east of here. You must avoid the foul fort of Zeth'Gor. To the east beyond Zeth'Gor is a small pass through the mountains. Through this pass you will find Void Ridge, a terrible place on the edge of the abyss.\n\nYou must kill the walkers that you find there, and bring me shards of their souls. With their power we will improve upon the warp rift generator and open a portal to the beyond that cannot be closed.",o="转至虚空山脉杀死当地的生物。收集40块虚空山脉灵魂碎片，把它们交给断背岗哨的疯狂的欧加斯。",oEN="Go to Void Ridge and kill the creatures you find. Collect 40 Void Ridge Soul Shards and return them to Ogath the Mad in Spinebreaker Post.",p="你已经完成了吗？你拿到我们需要的碎片了吗？",pEN="You have done it then? You have the shards that we need?",c="非常好，迁跃裂隙生成器几乎完成了。我们只需要最后一种原料。不久我们将能打开一道迁跃裂隙通往深渊的最深处。\n\n谁知道什么奇怪的生物会穿过裂隙而来？想想看$n，通过探索未知学得的知识所带来的益处是不可限量的。",cEN="Excellent. the warp rift generator is almost complete. There is only one final ingredient we require. Soon we shall be able to open up a warp rift to the deepest parts of the abyss.\n\nWho knows what strange creature may come through? Think of it <name>. the power such knowledge will bring is limitless."}
Q[10295]={d="我的迁跃裂隙生成器完成了。现在你可以直接用它召唤出一个真正的虚空行者贵族，只有它的灵魂碎片才能告诉我们，那无底深渊之中到底有些什么样的存在。\n\n立刻转至虚空山脉，在那里的深渊边缘寻找一簇一簇的水晶石，对，它们的学名叫虚空石。然后，你在那些虚空石旁边使用我的迁跃裂隙生成器，虚空男爵加拉希斯会跨越巨大的空间裂隙出现在你的面前。\n\n杀死这只生物，把它的灵魂碎片给我带回来。",dEN="My warp rift generator is complete. You can now use it to summon a true prince of the void, a creature whose soul shard will tell us much of what lies beyond.\n\nGo south in Void Ridge and use my warp rift generator near the void stones. Look for a cluster of crystals near the edge of the abyss. A huge warp rift will form and Void Baron Galaxis will surely appear.\n\nDestroy this creature and bring me his soul shard.",o="杀死虚空男爵加拉希斯，并得到他的灵魂碎片，把它交给断背岗哨的疯狂的欧加斯。",oEN="Kill Void Baron Galaxis and collect his soul shard. Take the shard to Ogath the Mad in Spinebreaker Post.",p="你解决虚空男爵加拉希斯了没？",pEN="Have you destroyed Void Baron Galaxis yet?",c="你挽救了我一生的工作，$n。\n\n他们说我疯了，他们嘲笑我，他们认为我为虚空山脉和扭曲虚空而着魔发狂。现在有这块灵魂裂片我就能解开虚无行者的秘密了。我将拥有深渊的力量。",cEN="You have saved my life's work <name>.\n\nThey called me insane. they laughed at me. they thought I was mad for my obsession with the Void Ridge and Warp Fields. Now with this soul shard I can unlock the secrets of the voidwalkers. I will command the power of the abyss."}
Q[10296]={d="永恒之龙撕下伪装，露出了阴险狡猾的真面目。他们计划杀死守护者麦迪文，阻止黑暗之门的开启。从表面上看，这对联盟来说是件好事；但是事实上，这将导致一场大灾难，直接导致艾泽拉斯世界的毁灭。\n\n你必须穿越时光通道，进入黑色沼泽。向西走，然后往南，一直走到达存放着沼泽标本的房间，途中你会遇到未来的我。与黑色沼泽的萨艾特谈谈吧。",dEN="The Infinite Dragonflight have abandoned all pretense of subtlety. They plot to destroy the Guardian, Medivh, and prevent the Dark Portal from ever opening. While outwardly, this may appear a boon to the forces of the Alliance, it is in actuality catastrophic and will result in your world ending.\n\nYou must venture through the timeway leading to the Black Morass. Go west and then south, past my future self, until you reach the tunnel that houses the swamp specimens. Cross over and speak with Sa'at.",o="深入时光之穴，转至正在发生黑暗之门开启这一历史事件的黑色沼泽，与萨艾特谈一谈。",oEN="Travel through the Caverns of Time to the Black Morass during the opening of the Dark Portal and speak with Sa'at.",c="的确，如果兽人从未到达艾泽拉斯，今日的联盟也不会存在。迟早内战将爆发，更进一步减弱人类王国。\n\n最终燃烧军团将侵入艾泽拉斯，在没有任何防卫者的情况下毁灭它。",cEN="Indeed, if the orcs never make it to Azeroth, the Alliance will never form. Eventually civil war will break out, further weakening the human kingdoms.\n\nUltimately the Burning Legion will invade Azeroth, destroying it in the absence of any defenders."}
Q[10297]={d="在这条时间之路的另一端，在黑色沼泽的深处，守护者麦迪文正狂热地设法开启黑暗之门，为兽人降临艾泽拉斯的时代拉开序幕。永恒之龙已派出他们的裂隙领主来阻止这一切。\n\n裂隙会零散地在沼泽各处显现。永恒之龙会从裂隙中涌出，试图摧毁麦迪文的护盾，最终杀死麦迪文本人。\n\n杀死他们的裂隙领主和首领！一直这样做，直到麦迪文成功。若你需要援助，就使用这枚时光信标。",dEN="Beyond this timeway, in the heart of the Black Morass, the Guardian, Medivh, feverishly works to open the Dark Portal, heralding in the age of orcs upon Azeroth.\n\nThe Infinite have sent their rift lords to stop this from happening.\n\nScattered across the morass, rifts will materialize. Infinite will pour out of the rifts and attempt to destroy Medivh's shields and, ultimately, Medivh.\n\nKill their rift lords and leaders! Do this until Medivh succeeds. Use this chrono-beacon should you require aid.",o="时光之穴黑色沼泽的萨艾特要求你保护麦迪文，直到他成功开启黑暗之门。\n\n任务完成后向萨艾特复命。",oEN="Sa'at inside the Black Morass of the Caverns of Time has tasked you with defending Medivh until he succeeds in opening the Dark Portal.\n\nReturn to Sa'at should you succeed in your task.",p="你在每一个时光之袋只可以使用一个时间信号灯。",pEN="You may only use one chrono-beacon per pocket of time.",c="做得好，$n。安杜姆这个孩子，希望再一次与你谈话。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. The child, Andormu, wishes to speak to you once more."}
Q[10298]={d="$n，去向幼时的安多尔姆复命吧。他在这个时间分支外等你，就在主宰之巢。\n\n我听见了龙翼拍打的声音。流沙之鳞对你的能力相当感兴趣，或许他们也想跟你谈谈。",dEN="Return to the child, Andormu, <name>. He awaits you outside this pocket of time, in the master's lair.\n\nI hear flutterings. The Scale of Sands has shown interest in your abilities. Perhaps they too would like to speak with you.",o="返回塔纳利斯沙漠的时光之穴，向幼时的安多尔姆复命。",oEN="Return to the child, Andormu, at the Caverns of Time in the Tanaris desert.",c="你又一次的拯救了这个世界的现在还有未来，$n。为了你的成就，请接受这些物品当作奖赏。",cEN="Once more you have secured the present and the future of this world, <name>. Please accept these items as reward for your accomplishments."}
Q[10299]={d="若是强行摧毁法力熔炉，由此引发的大爆炸很可能会波及整个外域，我们可不能冒这样大的风险。\n\n从你取回的拓文来看，控制台配备了紧急关闭装置，纳鲁科技通常会在建筑物中使用这种安全的控制机制。\n\n要关闭控制台，你就必须夺得控制水晶。根据我们掌握的情报来看，这颗水晶就在工头瑟瑞狄斯手中。",dEN="We cannot shut down the manaforges by force as we'd risk causing an explosion that would shake Outland to the core.\n\nAccording to your transcription, there is an emergency shutdown that permanently disables the technology - a safety mechanism common in naaru constructs.\n\nTo perform this procedure you will have to obtain a crystal that will allow you to communicate with the console. This access crystal is in the possession of an overseer called Theredis according to our information.",o="返回法力熔炉：布纳尔，从工头瑟瑞狄斯手中夺得布纳尔控制水晶。使用水晶关闭法力熔炉：布纳尔控制台，然后向学者卡尔亚复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Return to Manaforge B'naar and obtain the B'naar Access Crystal from Overseer Theredis. Use it at the Manaforge B'naar console to shut it down and report back to Anchorite Karja.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你已经完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you succeeded in your task, <name>?",c="圣光眷顾着你，$n。我们全都祈求你的成功。",cEN="The Light smiles upon you, <name>. We were all praying for your success."}
Q[10300]={d="<拉文德维尔仔细检查着法杖，突然注意到杖头部分缺失了。>\n\n这太野蛮了！埃克拉斯肯定将水晶杖头拆了下来挪作它用，完全破坏了杖头与法杖其它部分的魔力平衡。\n\n杖头一旦损坏，势必会大大削弱法杖的力量。若是能找到合适的德莱尼水晶，我应该可以修复它。我听地精们说，北边恩卡特废墟的鬼魂身上有这种水晶。",dEN="<Ravandwyr inspects the staff, noting that part of the headpiece seems to be missing.>\n\nSimply barbaric! Ekkorash must've taken the staff's crystalline headpiece for use in some other trinket, not realizing that it works in concert with the rest of the staff.\n\nAs long as it remains broken, the staff's power is greatly diminished. With a suitable draenei crystal, I should be able to repair it. I've heard the goblins remarking about the crystals carried by the ghosts at the Enkaat Ruins to the north.",o="从恩卡特废墟的鬼魂身上收集4块无瑕的水晶碎片，将它们交给52区的拉文德维尔。",oEN="Obtain 4 Flawless Crystal Shards from the ghosts at the Enkaat Ruins and return them to Ravandwyr at Area 52.",p="你已经设法找到适合当作大法师法杖头部配件的水晶了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to find some suitable crystals for a new headpiece for the archmage's staff?",c="<拉文德维尔仔细地检验水晶，然后从中挑选一个。>\n\n这水晶应该可以。我将重新雕塑法杖以装上新的法杖头部。\n\n当大法师瓦格斯看见法杖时，他将感到失望，但是如果这么做可以释放主人，我能承担主人的失望。",cEN="<Ravandwyr carefully examines the crystals. then selects one.>\n\nThis crystal should work. I'll reshape the stave's socket to secure the new headpiece.\n\nWhen Archmage Vargoth sees it, he will be disappointed, but I can bear my master's disappointment if it means we've freed him."}
Q[10301]={d="你夺回了克拉苏斯的魔法纲要，这令我非常欣慰。但是如果没有紫色单片眼镜的话，这本书就是一摞废纸。睿智的克拉苏斯非常清楚，许多人都会觊觎书中记载的强大法术；于是他为魔法纲要设置了完美的防护机制。\n\n只有知识渊博的法师才能利用紫色单片眼镜揭开书中的秘密。\n\n在凯尔萨斯进攻这里时，他手下一位名叫掠法者玛拉瑟雷的军官将眼镜抢走，带去了日怒堡东北方的一处法师塔中。她只是把它当成了一件有点价值的小玩意收藏着。",dEN="While I'm glad to have most of Krasus's Compendium back, it's useless without the heliotrope oculus. You see, Krasus was well aware of the sheer power of the spells recorded in the book and took steps to safeguard them from prying eyes.\n\nOnly a knowledgeable mage can use the oculus to unlock the compendium's secrets.\n\nDuring Kael'thas's attack, one of his lieutenants, Spellreaver Marathelle, looted it and took it to Sunfury Hold northeast of the tower. No doubt she thought it a pretty little bauble.",o="从日怒堡的掠法者玛拉瑟雷手中夺得紫色单片眼镜。",oEN="Obtain the Heliotrope Oculus from Spellreaver Marathelle at Sunfury Hold.",p="你拿到紫色单片眼镜了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the oculus?",c="太好了，$n。现在，我们已经获得大多数我们需要用来破除凯尔萨斯之魔法的东西了。\n\n如果血精灵丧失他们本地的指挥官而感到苦恼的话，当然更好。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. Now, we have most of what we'll need to attempt to break Kael'thas's magic.\n\nAnd if the blood elves suffer from the loss of their local commander, so much the better."}
Q[10302]={d="埃索达那些带有辐射的能量核心一直在破坏这里的环境。最明显的后果就是它们附近冒出的那些奇怪生物。\n\n也许我们能对它们做些什么，但眼下它们的数量已经多到我们应付不来了。\n\n我要你出去把它们的数量削减一些，也许我好好想想之后会有别的办法。",dEN="The irradiated power cores from the Exodar have been wreaking havoc on the environment here. The most obvious effect has been the appearance of the strange creatures that seem to have sprung up near them.\n\nThere may be something we can do to help them, but now, their sheer numbers are becoming too much for us to handle.\n\nI'd like you to go out and cull their numbers somewhat, and perhaps I'll have another idea after giving it some thought.",o="杀死8个暴躁的变异体，然后向埃门谷坠毁点的植物学家塔蕾克丝复命。",oEN="Kill 8 Volatile Mutations, then return to Botanist Taerix at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",p="我正在进行我认为对这些奇怪生物有效的解决办法。我只是需要更多的时间。",pEN="I am working on a solution I think may be effective with the strange creatures. I just need more time.",c="已经完成了吗？那真是个好消息。希望将来我们可以找到一个方法避免杀害那些畸变体。\n\n我相信我已经想出一个计划使我们对这个问题可以有别的解决方法，但是我将需要你的帮忙。",cEN="You're finished? That's good news. Hopefully, we can find a way to avoid the killing of these mutated beasts in the future.\n\nI believe I have formed a plan that might give us an alternative solution to this problem, but I will need your help."}
Q[10303]={d="你必须解除……血精灵的……威胁。查明……他们的……目的！\n\n他们就在我身后的……山脊中。",dEN="You must eliminate... the blood elf... threat. Find out... what they're... up to!\n\nThey're on the... ridge behind me.",o="杀死10个血精灵斥候，然后向埃门谷暗影山的图兰复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Blood Elf Scouts then return to Tolaan in the Shadow Ridge of Ammen Vale.",p="他们的人数太多了……我们必须削弱他们，否则那些幸存者将没有机会对抗他们。",pEN="There are too many of them... We must whittle them down or else the survivors will have no chance against them.",c="这些血精灵想杀死我们全部。我们该怎样让他们转移到别的方向？",cEN="These blood elves mean to kill us all. How are we to divert them from this course?"}
Q[10304]={d="在你的帮助下，我们迅速解决了这个难题，速度快到令人咋舌。\n\n我当前没有别的事情要交给你做了。剩下的就交给我和学徒们吧。\n\n去跟飞船另一侧的守备官奥达尔谈谈吧。",dEN="With your help, we were able to find a solution to our problems faster than I could have hoped.\n\nI don't have any other work for you to do. My apprentices and I can handle the rest.\n\nYou should go speak with Vindicator Aldar on the other side of the ship.",o="与埃门谷坠毁点的守备官奥达尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Vindicator Aldar at the Crash Site in Ammen Vale.",c="$n，是吗？自从你来到这里，我已经听到关于你的英勇事迹以及你在近来所完成的工作。\n\n我们很明确需要你的帮助让事情恢复正常。我相信在那里的萨那，也需要你的帮助。",cEN="<name>, is it? I've heard good things about you and the work you've been doing in the short time since you came to.\n\nWe'll definitely need your help getting things back to normal. Zhanaa, over there, could also use your help, I'm sure."}
Q[10305]={d="虽说是肯瑞托法师之物，这本破旧的书卷却并不是什么法术书。书页里都是手抄体的故事，字体娟秀，还配有精美的彩色插画。\n\n书卷看上去比它的主人还要古老，很可能是系列的传家宝吧。贝尔玛拉的灵魂至今仍在肯瑞瓦村的废墟中徘徊，这本书卷似乎是她在世间最后的羁绊。将它放回贝尔玛拉家中的书架上，或许就可以平息她的怒火。",dEN="This worn, sturdy tome is no spellbook, as you might expect a Kirin Tor mage to carry. The pages of the volume are covered with hand-copied stories, accompanied by colorful illustrations.\n\nThe tome seems to be far older than its former owner and may have even been a family heirloom. A powerful tie to the book may have been the last thread tying Belmara's spirit to the ruins of Kirin'Var. Returning it to its proper place on the bookshelf in her quarters might help appease her restless spirit.",o="在巫师街内找到防御法师贝尔玛拉的住所，将书放回书架上。然后与肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Abjurist Belmara's quarters in Wizard Row and return the book to its Bookshelf. Then, speak with Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village.",p="你发现了什么，$n？",pEN="What have you found, <name>?",c="啊，是的。我已经听说弃绝者贝马拉有一本旧的故事书，但是我不知道她将它带到了外域。你已经找到这本书并且将它带回她的住处，我相信她的灵魂将得到更多的宁静。",cEN="Ah, yes. I'd heard that Abjurist Belmara had an old book of stories, but I had no idea that she brought it with her to Outland. I'm certain her spirit will rest easier knowing that you've found it and returned it to her dwelling."}
Q[10306]={d="这件披风无疑出自高等精灵匠人之手，即便是以肯瑞托法师的标准来看，它也称得上材质华美、价格不菲的精品。你看不懂绣在披风上的符号与文字，但显然衣料中附着了魔法属性。\n\n或许它仍然将主人的灵魂羁绊在这个物质位面中。如果是这样的话，就将这件披风放回咒术师鲁米拉斯家中的衣柜里，或许就能破除羁绊，让他的灵魂得到安息。",dEN="The cloak, undoubtedly of high elven craftsmanship, is richly tailored, even by the standards of the Kirin Tor. The symbols and characters sewn into the cloak's fabric hold no meaning for you, but clearly imbue the garment with magical properties.\n\nPerhaps this object binds the spirit of its former owner to this plane of existence. If so, returning it to the dresser in Conjurer Luminrath's quarters might break the spirit's link to this world, allowing it to rest.",o="在巫师街内找到咒术师鲁米拉斯的住所，将披风放回衣柜里。然后与肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Conjurer Luminrath's quarters in Wizard Row and return the mantle to his Dresser. Then, speak with Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village.",p="你发现了什么，$n？",pEN="What have you found, <name>?",c="我们总是常常说卢瑞斯不论穿什么衣服都会搭配那件披风。对他来说，红色在搭配上与白色、黑色、紫色、蓝色、黄色、橘色和绿色同样好。他绝不会连续两天穿相同的长袍，但他总是穿着那件披风……",cEN="We used to always comment that Luminrath would wear that cloak with just about anything. To him, red went equally well with white, black, purple, blue, yellow, orange, and green. He would never wear the same robe two days in a row, but the cloak was always there..."}
Q[10307]={d="看着这顶帽子，你禁不住怀疑有哪位肯瑞托法师会拥有这样的头部装备。从帽子的磨损程度看得出，它的侏儒主人无论走到哪里都戴着它。\n\n你试着戴上帽子，发现除了一点点想要跳舞的冲动外，这顶帽子没有任何魔法属性。\n\n这件珍贵的物品很可能将主人的灵魂羁绊在了村庄中。将它放回考利恩家中的小提箱里，或许就能让法师的灵魂得到自由了吧。",dEN="Looking at the hat, you find yourself asking if any Kirin Tor mage would own such headgear. Judging from the hat's wear, it seems the gnome wouldn't go anywhere without it.\n\nYou try on the hat momentarily, discovering no magical properties beyond a faint urge to dance.\n\nThe treasured possession might be the source of the dead mage's bond to the village. Placing the hat in the footlocker in Cohlien's quarters might free his spirit.",o="在巫师街内找到考利恩·霜纹的住所，将帽子放回小提箱中。然后与肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Cohlien Frostweaver's quarters in Wizard Row and return the hat to his Footlocker. Then, speak with Custodian Dieworth at Kirin'Var Village.",p="你发现了什么，$n？",pEN="What have you found, <name>?",c="<管理者听到了考林的名字以后露出了微笑。>\n\n关于那顶帽子你说对了。他总是穿着它而且不会让它离开他的视线。\n\n他曾经有一个法师同事，我不方便透露名字，“借走了”那顶帽子然后恶作剧的把它藏起来。不用说你也知道后来考林的寒冰箭让他改变了主意。\n\n我会非常想念小考林的。他对女精灵很有一套。",cEN="<The custodian smiles at the mention of Cohlien's name.>\n\nYou're absolutely right about the hat. He wore it all the time and wouldn't let it out of his sight.\n\nThere were a couple of times when a fellow mage, who shall remain nameless, 'borrowed' the hat and hid it as a prank. Needless to say the threat of one of Cohlien's frostbolts changed his mind.\n\nI'm going to miss little Cohlien. He had quite a way with the elven women."}
Q[10308]={p="星界财团非常想铲除南边废料堆的所有萨克斯is叛军。\n\n$n，如果你想进一步讨我们欢心，就回到那里，带更多他们的身份徽记回来。",pEN="The Consortium is keenly interested in wiping out all of the Zaxxis rebels at the Heap to the south.\n\n<class>, if you would like to ingratiate yourself further with us, go back down there and bring back more of their affiliation insignia.",c="叛徒，全都是！\n\n干得好，$n！你要是再找到回那儿的路，我随时都想给徽记收藏添点新货！",cEN="Traitors, all of them!\n\nGood work, <class>! If you find your way back down there again, I'm always looking to add to my collection of their insignia!"}
Q[10309]={d="你看到西南边那台废弃的邪能机甲了吗？是不是很美？\n\n我要它的心脏！\n\n什么？当然有心脏……什么东西没有呢？\n\n\n\n过去，把它撬开，把我想要的东西带回来，我就给你一笔可观的发现者报酬。\n\n哦，要是我是你，我会带上一两个朋友。这些萨克斯is虚灵可不是好惹的！\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;开始时，带上这台邪能电击器去给它起搏。",dEN="You see that scrapped fel reaver over there to the south? Isn't it a thing of beauty?\n\nI want its heart!\n\nWhat? Yes, of course it has a heart... what doesn't?\n\n<N. D. looks indignant for a moment.>\n\nGo on over there, pry it open, bring back what I want and I'll give you a nice finder's fee in return.\n\nOh, and I'd take a friend or two along if I were you. These Zaxxis ethereals are a pretty mean bunch!\n\nTake this fel zapper to jumpstart its heart when you're ready to begin.",o="将魔能机甲之心交给虚空风暴机甲废场的米西·米恩卡普。",oEN="Recover the Heart of the Fel Reaver and deliver it to N. D. Meancamp at The Heap in the Netherstorm.",p="我的视力一定是随虚空辐射线而去了。你取得魔能机甲之心了吗？",pEN="My eyesight must be going from all of the nether radiation. You have that fel reaver's heart yet?",c="哇，看看这个……一颗还在跳动的邪能机甲心脏！嗯，它其实并不是真的在\"跳动\"，但你懂我意思。\n\n我迫不及待想拿这东西派上大用场。或者，也许卖掉它。我认识几个傻……呃，客户，他们可能会有兴趣。\n\n拿着，这是你应得的，还多给了些！",cEN="Wow, look at that... a beating fel reaver heart! Well, it's not really 'beating', but you know what I mean.\n\nI can't wait to put this thing to good use. Or, maybe sell it. I know a few suck... er, clients that might be interested.\n\nHere, you've earned your pay and then some!"}
Q[10310]={d="燃烧军团已经占领了附近的魔能机甲废料场，我们必须竭尽全力阻止这群该死的恶魔继续向前推进，入侵到这里。\n\n他们在南边有一处名为登陆场：破坏的营地，营地中设有迁跃门。\n\n我要你护送我进入营地，并在我破坏迁跃门时确保我的安全。\n\n完成任务后，就返回北边中央生态圆顶的中央圆顶哨站，将这一好消息告诉加鲁斯。\n\n不过，我们恐怕还需要另外一两位朋友来帮忙。",dEN="With the Burning Legion nearby at the fel reaver scrap field, we must do what we can to stop the flow of demons into the area.\n\nThey have a warp-gate to the south in an area that they've cleverly named Invasion Point: Destroyer.\n\nI need you to go with me to the site and keep me safe while I sabotage it.\n\nAfterward, go to the Midrealm Post to the north inside Eco-Dome Midrealm and apprise Gahruj of our success.\n\nWe're going to need a friend or two of yours along to help with this.",o="护送德里亚到达登陆场：破坏的迁跃门，并在他尝试破坏迁跃门的过程中保护他的安全。然后返回虚空风暴的中央生态圆顶，向中央圆顶哨站的加鲁斯复命。",oEN="Escort Drijya to the warp-gate at Invasion Point: Destroyer, and see to it that he is kept safe while he attempts to sabotage it. Then speak to Gahruj at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",p="我可以帮你什么吗？",pEN="How may I help you?",c="这消息太棒了，$g朋友:朋友;！\n\n你和德里贾为我们立了大功。迁跃门一废，附近的恶魔就得不到更多增援了。\n\n请允许我以星界财团的正式方式酬谢你。",cEN="That is most excellent news, my friend!\n\nYou and Drijya have done us a great service. With that warp-gate out of commission, the nearby demons will not be getting any further reinforcements.\n\nPlease allow me to reward you in the proper manner of the Consortium."}
Q[10311]={d="$C，你肯帮忙真是再好不过了。\n\n这附近的燃烧军团魔能机甲的行动变得越来越大胆，我们的安全已经开始受到威胁了。那些恶魔还经常从南面的登陆场：破坏得到增援。\n\n我的同胞德里亚已经赶去那里侦察情况了，他想看看自己能否摧毁燃烧军团的迁跃门。\n\n去登陆场找他吧，尽你所能地帮助他。",dEN="<class>, it is good to see a helpful face around here.\n\nThe Burning Legion at the nearby fel reaver heap has become more bold, and I am beginning to fear for our safety here. The demons are constantly receiving reinforcements from Invasion Point: Destroyer to the south.\n\nMy compatriot, Drijya, has gone down there to scout and see if he can do something about the Burning Legion's warp-gate.\n\nPlease find and assist him in any way that you can.",o="与虚空风暴登陆场：破坏的德里亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Drijya near Invasion Point: Destroyer in the Netherstorm.",c="我希望加鲁斯派你来是为了帮助我完成我的任务。",cEN="I hope that Gahruj has sent you to help me with my mission."}
Q[10312]={d="看来我们的期望落空了，上一次的行动并没有彻底消除他们的攻击性。你看，那些曾被你制服的邪恶幽灵再度出现镇子的街道上。\n\n我们必须揭开其中的隐秘。躁动难安的灵魂……难道肯瑞瓦的毁灭才刚刚拉开序幕吗？\n\n肯瑞瓦的城镇大厅就在村子的东南角，那里保存着一本村民资料的名册。我听说战斗法师达斯利克负责保管它，说不定他的灵魂还守护着这本名册。",dEN="Silencing the spirits has not bled them of their aggression as we had hoped it would. The malevolent spirits you subdued have reemerged in the streets of the town.\n\nWe must uncover what is causing this to happen. The destruction of Kirin'Var was just the beginning, or else the spirits would have been quieted by now.\n\nThe town hall in the southern section of Kirin'Var maintained a logbook of all the residents. Last I heard, it was in the keeping of Battle-Mage Dathric. Perhaps his spirit still has it.",o="从肯瑞瓦村的城镇大厅中取回肯瑞瓦名册，将它交给管理器戴沃斯。",oEN="Retrieve the Annals of Kirin'Var from the town hall of Kirin'Var Village and return it to Custodian Dieworth.",p="你找到名册了吗？",pEN="Were you able to find the registry?",c="<管理者戴沃斯接过你手中的名册，匆匆翻阅那些书页。>\n\n嗯……\n\n看起来我猜的没错，这件事有规律可寻。\n\n最具侵略性和最危险的鬼魂与居住在村庄里的最强大和最高等级的肯瑞托相符。比较起来市镇居民和小贩好像被忽略了。这意味着什么？",cEN="Hmm...\n\nIt seems I was right. There is a pattern here.\n\nThe most aggressive and dangerous ghosts coincide with the most powerful and highest ranking Kirin Tor who resided in the village. The townspeople and tradesmen seem overlooked by comparison. What could this mean?"}
Q[10313]={d="如果我们直觉没有错，这些法力熔炉应该都是利用风暴要塞的科技建造而成的。这样一来，整个外域恐怕就岌岌可危了。\n\n风暴要塞的能量补给机制绝对不适合在靠近陆地的地方使用。虽说能量管道是凯尔萨斯设计的，但是传输过程中产生的强大迁跃能量流也足以使整片陆地失去生机。\n\n必须采取行动！带上这颗宝珠转至法力熔炉布纳尔，它能监测到迁跃能量的强度。在法力熔炉管道的末端，也就是管道进入地下的那里使用它。",dEN="If our instincts are right and these manaforges have been made using technology from Tempest Keep, then all of Outland could be in grave danger.\n\nTempest Keep's energy-recharging mechanisms were never supposed to be used this close to the land. The warp energies are capable of destroying this very land, even when contained within Kael's pipelines.\n\nTake this orb to Manaforge B'naar; it is attuned to measure warp energies. Use it at the pipelines' ends, where they go into the earth.",o="52区的大主教欧雷里斯要你将迁跃共鸣宝珠带往法力熔炉：布纳尔，并在法力熔炉四条管道的末端使用它。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Exarch Orelis in Area 52 wants you to take the Warp-Attuned Orb to Manaforge B'naar and use it at the end of its four pipelines.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你执行过我要的测量了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you performed the measurements I asked for, <name>?",c="这是重要的消息，$n。从管线流出的扭曲能量具高危险性。\n\n我们必须找到方法关闭法力熔炉，否则爆炸之后外域只会剩下几块碎片而已。",cEN="This is grave news, <name>. The warp energies emanating from the pipelines are dangerously high.\n\nWe must find a way to shut down the manaforges or what little remains of Outland will be shattered into pieces."}
Q[10314]={d="你从没见过如此奇特的魔法装置，它显然不是血精灵的制品。\n\n你发现，一旦有幽灵靠近建筑物，球体所发出的光芒就会变得强烈；而当幽灵走远后，光芒也会逐渐黯淡下来。毫无疑问，这台装置与幽灵的堕落有着密切的关系。\n\n但是它的设计原理仍然还是一个谜。如果你将观测结果告知管理器戴沃斯，再从幽灵身上收集一些碎片供他研究，或许他能揭开其中的秘密。",dEN="The strange magical device resembles nothing you've ever seen before. It's certainly not of blood elf manufacture.\n\nAs you sense spirits moving closer to the building, the orb glows with a greater intensity, which fades as the spirits leave. There's no question that it plays a role in the corruption of the ghosts.\n\nHow it works remains a mystery. Perhaps Custodian Dieworth will have some insight if you can provide the remains of some of the spirits along with your observations.",o="从肯瑞瓦村礼拜堂广场中扭曲的幽灵身上收集10份令人厌恶的残留物，将它们交给管理器戴沃斯。",oEN="Collect 10 Loathsome Remnants from the twisted spirits in Kirin'Var Village's Chapel Yard and bring them to Custodian Dieworth.",p="你发现了什么，$n？",pEN="What have you discovered, <name>?",c="<管理者戴沃斯检验残余物。>\n\n你描述的装置听起来好像是一种通灵法术的媒介……我本该知道那个不学好的学徒会因此而堕落。我本以为他的训练会使他远离今日的堕落程度，但是我想他已经证明我是错的。",cEN="<Custodian Dieworth examines the remnants.>\n\nThe device you described sounds like a necromantic focus... I should've known that no-good apprentice would stoop to this. I thought his training would keep him from going this far. but I guess he's proven me wrong."}
Q[10315]={d="所有血精灵都是蠢货！和他们解除贸易关系真是件值得庆幸的好事。我走遍了宇宙中的每个角落，却从来没有见过这样自私自利的生物。\n\n他们利用法力熔炉不断地侵蚀着我们周围的土地，那么我们就在桥对面的法力熔炉：艾拉搞点破坏好了。\n\n据我所知，要想稳定法力熔炉的能量流，血精灵的虚空法师们必须利用血宝石不停地引导能量。转至法力熔炉：艾拉，干掉那些虚空法师！",dEN="The blood elves are fools! I'm glad that our trade relations with them have fallen apart. In all of my travels throughout the cosmos, I have never encountered beings so selfish.\n\nThey continue to destroy the land around us with their manaforges, so let's see if we can put a dent in their operations across the bridge at Manaforge Ara.\n\nTheir nethermancers channel energy to and from the blood gems to stabilize the flow of power. Go over there and wipe them out!",o="消灭15名日怒虚空法师，然后返回虚空风暴内的图鲁曼的营地，向虚空猎手奥尔苏复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Sunfury Nethermancers and return to Nether-Stalker Oazul at Tuluman's Landing in the Netherstorm.",p="你计划要杀掉几个虚空术师？",pEN="How many nethermancers have you managed to fell?",c="任何我们能推动他们停止在这些法力熔炉所做的事都是好事。\n\n他们当然不会跟你讲道理。而且我很清楚无论他们的领导人在想什么，他们都是疯狂的。\n\n如果不会冒犯你的话，我想要给你属于你们国度的钱币作为达成星界财团目标之忠诚服务的报酬。",cEN="Anything that we can do to encourage them to stop what they're doing at these manaforges is a good thing.\n\nThey certainly do not seem to be able to be reasoned with. And it seems clear to me that whatever their leaders have in mind, they are insane.\n\nAs remuneration for your faithful service to the goals of the Consortium, I would like to offer you the coin of your realm if it does not offend you."}
Q[10316]={d="那个让鬼魂发生变异的幕后黑手显然制订了详细的计划，他首先挑选了几位最强大的法师作为目标，但这是为什么呢？要想扭曲肯瑞托法师的灵魂，需要以强大的法术来构筑诅咒仪式。\n\n为什么要耗费这么大的精力来对付肯瑞托法师呢？嗯……我认为这是凯尔萨斯的又一个阴谋，他试图将肯瑞瓦村变得更加凄惨。如果这附近有血精灵作祟的话，他们很可能就躲藏在桥对面的房子里。",dEN="Whoever is behind the transformation of the spirits has been very deliberate in their actions, taking care to target the most powerful mages first, but why? The kind of magic required to influence the spirits of slain Kirin Tor mages must be very powerful.\n\nWhy would a powerful mage go to all this trouble? I'm inclined to say this is another plot of Kael'thas's, designed to cause more misery here. If there are blood elves here, they're likely to be hiding in the houses across the covered bridge.",o="在肯瑞瓦村的礼拜堂广场寻找操纵鬼魂滋扰村庄的幕后黑手的线索。",oEN="Search Kirin'Var Village's Chapel Yard for clues about who is behind the manipulation of the spirits.",c="一个发光的宝珠座落在一个方形台座顶上。乍看之下，它好像是魔法能源的储藏处，但是储存的是哪种能量，又是给谁使用的呢？",cEN="A glowing orb sits atop a square-shaped pedestal. At first glance, it seems to be a repository for magical energy, but what kind of energy, and for whose use?"}
Q[10317]={d="血精灵将法力熔炉：艾拉地下的矿井命名为特雷卢姆矿井。自从法力熔炉：乌提斯地下的矿井被毁后，特雷卢姆矿井便成为运转法力熔炉所需原料的唯一来源点。\n\n这样一来，我们就能轻而易举地彻底破坏血精灵的采矿工事，甚至还能将这座矿井据为己有！\n\n我要你转至法力熔炉：艾拉，干掉那里的工头萨杜恩·日落。特雷卢姆矿井就在浮岛后方偏左的位置。",dEN="The blood elves call the mine underneath Manaforge Ara the Trelleum Mine. Ever since they lost the one underneath Manaforge Ultris, this is where their sole supply of material for running the forges is coming from.\n\nNeedless to say, it would be a boon for us to cripple their mining operation. Perhaps we'd even be able to move in and take it over for ourselves?\n\nWhatever the case, I want you to go in there and deal with Foreman Sundown. The mine is around the back of the island to the left.",o="转至虚空风暴法力熔炉：艾拉地下的特雷卢姆矿井，对付工头萨杜恩·日落。",oEN="Deal with Foreman Sundown inside the Trelleum Mine, which is underneath Manaforge Ara in the Netherstorm.",c="<工头压低音调说着。>\n\n你来这里是要杀死我吗？嗯。我猜虚灵组织尚未知道所有的事情，是吧？\n\n我不是你想杀的人，相信我。",cEN="<The foreman speaks in hushed tones.>\n\nYou came in here to kill me? Hmph. Well I guess the ethereal don't know everything, do they?\n\nI'm not the one that you want, trust me."}
Q[10318]={d="我曾是法力熔炉的工头，不过我已经被降职了。不久前我忽然意识到，当初从奎尔萨拉斯一路朝圣来到外域，经历多少苦难，而这一切全都是个骗局。\n\n这是凯尔萨斯为了壮大他在虚空风暴的军队而布下的骗局。\n\n我试图说服同胞们离开燃烧军团，但他们性情顽固，不肯相信我。\n\n你能帮我个忙吗？去干掉督工格林加尔，然后回到你的虚灵朋友那里，告诉他我不再与他为敌了。",dEN="I used to be the foreman here. But now that I've been demoted, I've come to realize our pilgrimage from Quel'Thalas to Outland was all a lie.\n\nA lie perpetrated by Kael'thas to strengthen his forces here in the Netherstorm.\n\nI've tried to convince my brethren that we should leave, especially with the Burning Legion here, but they are all too stubborn.\n\nDo me a favor? Kill Overmaster Grindgarr. Then return to your ethereal and tell him that I am no longer his enemy.",o="杀死督工格林加尔，然后返回虚空风暴内图鲁曼的营地，向星界商人图鲁曼复命。",oEN="Slay Overmaster Grindgarr. Then return to Wind Trader Tuluman at Tuluman's Landing in the Netherstorm.",p="你带了什么有关法力熔炉艾拉的消息吗？你解决了工头日落吗？",pEN="What news do you bring from Manaforge Ara? Did you deal with Foreman Sundown?",c="一个末日守卫征服者？真是奇怪！燃烧军团在那边做什么呢？\n\n所以，一部分的血精灵正在逃离。我们应该记住这点，假如我们将来想靠武力征服那里的话。至少这些事情带来了一些好消息，不是吗？\n\n来吧，$n，收下这个东西还有我最深的感激吧。",cEN="A doomguard overmaster? That's odd! What's the Burning Legion doing in there?\n\nSo, some of the blood elves are defecting. We'll keep that in mind if we ever attempt to take the place by force. At least there's some good news that has come from all of this, no?\n\nPlease, <name>, take this with my deepest gratitude."}
Q[10319]={d="我想事情已经水落石出了。你应该已经和学徒拉文瑞德尔见过面了吧，不过大法师还有一位名叫纳比留斯的学徒。\n\n他是个勤奋的学生，却因沉迷通灵术而无法自拔。当凯尔萨斯率领大军逼近肯瑞瓦村时，纳比留斯借机背叛了大法师，将紫罗兰之塔的防御机密告诉了凯尔萨斯。\n\n他似乎已经沦为巫妖。如果要阻止他继续做恶，就必须夺得他的护符匣。你要知道，这个狡猾的家伙绝对不会将它埋在他视线之外的地方。",dEN="I suppose an explanation is in order. You've met one of the archmage's apprentices, Ravandwyr, but there was also another named Naberius.\n\nHe was an ardent student, but was drawn to necromancy. When Kael'thas appeared with his forces, Naberius seized the opportunity to betray the archmage, handing over the secrets to the tower's defense.\n\nNow, it seems, he has become a lich. If we are to stop him, we must capture his phylactery. Knowing him, he would've buried it somewhere out of sight in his domain.",o="在肯瑞瓦村的礼拜堂广场中找到纳比留斯的护符匣，将它交给管理器戴沃斯。",oEN="Recover Naberius's Phylactery from Kirin'Var Village's Chapel Yard district and bring it to Custodian Dieworth.",p="在我们能攻击他之前，你必须取得纳比留斯的护命匣。否则，他会是刀枪不入的。",pEN="You must recover Naberius's phylactery before we can attack him. Otherwise, he will be invulnerable.",c="做得好，$n。这个护命匣将是我们获胜的关键。当你与纳比留斯战斗时，我将粉碎护命匣，使他暴露在你的攻击中。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Possession of the phylactery will be the key to our victory. When you enter battle with Naberius, I will smash it, exposing him to your attacks."}
Q[10320]={d="大法师沃格斯早已意识到纳比留斯研习通灵术的危险。但我想，他恐怕未曾预料到自己的学徒会给肯瑞托带来这场毁灭性的灾难。\n\n你必须击败纳比留斯，$n。否则，他将继续奴役肯瑞托法师的灵魂，让他们永远得不到安宁，最终他将使肯瑞瓦的每一寸土地都落入毁灭的深渊。\n\n只要得到了他的护符匣，我们就可以派出两到三名刺客对付他，否则，谁有知道他会对赶去围剿他的军队用出什么样的法术呢？",dEN="Archmage Vargoth saw the danger in Naberius's pursuit of necromancy, but I don't think he ever anticipated that his own apprentice would wreak this much destruction upon the Kirin Tor.\n\nYou must defeat him, <name>, or else he will continue enslaving the spirits of our fallen brothers, robbing them of their rightful rest and destroying what little remains of Kirin'Var.\n\nWith his phylactery in hand, he can be confronted by two or three combatants, but who knows what his magic might do to more foes?",o="肯瑞瓦村的管理器戴沃斯要你击败礼拜堂广场中的纳比留斯。",oEN="Custodian Dieworth in Kirin'Var Village wants you to confront and defeat Naberius in the village's Chapel Yard.",p="你消毁了那个卑鄙的纳比留斯的尸体了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed the lich of that wretched Naberius?",c="击败纳比留斯是一项伟大的成就，$n。我一直在想假如当时纳比留斯没有背叛大法师的话，我们可能有击溃凯尔萨斯大军的机会。",cEN="The defeat of Naberius is a great achievement, <name>. I can't help thinking that we might have had a chance against Kael'thas's forces if the apprentice's loyalties had been in the right place that day."}
Q[10321]={d="你在布纳尔的成功为我们燃起了新的希望，$n。\n\n我们和占星者分享了最新的发现；作为回报，他们将剩下几座法力熔炉的情况告诉了我们。\n\n当前，仍有三座法力熔炉在运作中，而且都在日怒血精灵的掌控之下。\n\n转至东边的法力熔炉：库鲁恩，从工头希兰娜手中夺得库鲁恩控制水晶。对法力熔炉：库鲁恩的控制台使用水晶，启动紧急关闭装置。\n\n$n，我们都指望你了。",dEN="Your success at B'naar has given us a great deal of hope, <name>.\n\nWe've shared our discoveries with the Scryers and in return they've given us more information on the remaining manaforges.\n\nThree other manaforges still stand, in full control of the Sunfury army.\n\nYou will find Manaforge Coruu to the east. Overseer Seylanna holds the access crystal there. Obtain it and use it on the manaforge's control console to begin the emergency shutdown.\n\nWe're all counting on you, <name>.",o="转至52区以东的法力熔炉：库鲁恩，从工头希兰娜手中夺得库鲁恩控制水晶。对法力熔炉：库鲁恩的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉，然后向学者卡尔亚复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Travel to Manaforge Coruu, east of Area 52, and obtain the Coruu Access Crystal from Overseer Seylanna. Use it at the Manaforge Coruu Console to shut it down and return to Anchorite Karja.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task yet, <name>?",c="做得好。只剩两个法力熔炉保持运作。\n\n很快地凯尔萨斯的主要动力就会被切断了。",cEN="Excellent work. Only two manaforges remain active.\n\nSoon Kael'thas will be cut off from his main source of power."}
Q[10322]={d="我们收到消息说，仍在运行的两座熔炉中，日怒血精灵突然失去了对法力熔炉：杜隆的控制。\n\n大群狂乱的法力生物被高速增长的能量流所吸引，冲入了法力熔炉。\n\n如果杜隆发生爆炸的话，很可能引发波及整个外域的大规模连锁反应。你必须从工头安萨奈尔手中夺得控制水晶，并安全关闭法力熔炉：杜隆。",dEN="We've received news from one of the two manaforges that remain operational. The Sunfury army is losing control of Manaforge Duro.\n\nDroves of errant mana creatures have been attracted to it by its increased energy production - the manaforge is in chaos.\n\nAn explosion at Duro has the potential to cause a chain reaction that would endanger all of Outland. Overseer Athanel is in possesion of the access crystal you need to safely disable the manaforge.",o="学者卡尔亚要你转至法力熔炉：杜隆，从工头安萨奈尔手中夺得杜隆控制水晶。对法力熔炉：杜隆的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Anchorite Karja wants you to go Manaforge Duro and obtain the Duro Access Crystal from Overseer Athanel. Use it at the Manaforge Duro Console to shut it down.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task yet, <name>?",c="纳鲁祝福你，$n。你付出会得到回报。",cEN="You are blessed by the naaru, <name>. Your dedication to the cause will not go unnoticed or unrewarded."}
Q[10323]={d="现在仅剩一座法力熔炉来维持整个风暴要塞的能源供给了。如果我们能摧毁法力熔炉：艾拉，凯尔就不得不启用他之前储存的能量。\n\n关闭西北方的法力熔炉：艾拉，给予凯尔萨斯最沉重的一击。\n\n最后一块控制水晶由工头阿扎拉德保管。注意，这是凯尔最后一座仍在运行中的法力熔炉，恐怕你会遭到非常顽强的抵抗。你可能会需要可靠的朋友帮忙。",dEN="One manaforge is all that keeps Tempest Keep functional. After we bring Manaforge Ara down, Kael will have to resort to depleting whatever energy he's got stored up.\n\nTravel to Manaforge Ara, in the northwest, and deliver the final blow that we need by shutting it down.\n\nThe last access crystal is in the possession of Overseer Azarad. Be warned that we expect heavy opposition in the last of Kael's functional manaforges. You're likely to need the assistance of reliable friends.",o="转至法力熔炉：艾拉，从工头阿扎拉德手中夺得艾拉控制水晶。对法力熔炉：艾拉的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Travel to Manaforge Ara and obtain the Ara Access Crystal from Overseer Azarad. Use it at the Manaforge Ara console to shut it down.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成我要求的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the task I asked of you, <name>?",c="燃烧军团？与凯尔萨斯·逐日者结盟？\n\n这真是个可怕的消息。这解释了我们在这及影月谷所见到的景象。\n\n我们必须马上将消息传回沙塔斯城。",cEN="The Burning Legion? Allied with Kael'thas Sunstrider?\n\nThis is dire news. It explains much about what we've seen here and in Shadowmoon.\n\nWe must send word back to Shattrath City immediately."}
Q[10324]={d="干得好，$n！\n\n你利用月痕雄鹿好好地磨练了自己的狩猎技术，现在是时候让你面对更强大一些的猎物了，比如月痕巨鹿。你可千万不要被月痕巨鹿寻常的那种温顺与懒洋洋的样子给骗了。只要一被激怒，它们马上就会变为最可怕的野兽。\n\n在这里的正北方就可以找到这些月痕巨鹿，祝你狩猎愉快。",dEN="Well done, <name>! Well done!\n\nNow that you've cut your teeth with the moongraze stag, it's time you graduated to more formidable prey. Do not allow the casual disinterest of the moongraze bucks to fool you: when provoked, they are a fearsome foe.\n\nYou'll find the bucks north of here. Good hunting.",o="将6张月痕鹿皮交给碧蓝岗哨的艾克提恩。",oEN="Bring 6 Moongraze Buck Hides to Acteon at Azure Watch.",p="这些雄鹿的皮革是坚固而表面布满粗线条的图案，他们的肉非常的坚韧——虽然不能吃但是我们有其它的用途。",pEN="The buck hides are rugged and strong, making for very tough flesh - almost inedible, but we can use them for other purposes.",c="太好了！你正成长为$g一名:一名;了不起的$g猎人:猎人;，$n。\n\n想不想看起来更像我一点？你的机会来了！你外出狩猎时，我用身边剩下的一些鹿皮做了这些物件。挑一件吧！",cEN="Wonderful! You're turning into quite the hunter, <name>.\n\nHow would you like to look more like me? Well here is your chance! While you were out hunting, I fashioned these items out of some buck hides I had laying around. Take your pick!"}
Q[10325]={d="你应该已经知道了，$n，我们奥尔多是圣光的守护者，是纳鲁的仆从。\n\n而我们最直接的敌人就是燃烧军团——那群以扭曲和毁灭世界，腐化和侵蚀无辜种族为乐的恶魔。\n\n如果你想对奥尔多证明自己的价值，那么就给我带一些低级燃烧军团士兵和暗影议会成员的徽记回来吧。暗影议会在白骨荒野有一处据点，而燃烧军团的据点则大多分布在刀锋山脉和纳格兰。",dEN="As you probably know, <name>, the Aldor are keepers of the Light and servants of the naaru.\n\nDiametrically opposed to us are the agents of the Burning Legion - demons bent on the destruction of worlds and the corruption of the innocent.\n\nIf you wish to prove yourself to the Aldor, bring me the insignias of low-ranking Legion and their Shadow Council followers. We know of a Shadow Council hideout in the Bone Wastes and there are many Legion outposts in Nagrand and the Blade's Edge Mountains.",o="将10枚基尔加丹印记交给沙塔斯城内的圣光护卫者阿德因。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将会使你在占星者声望中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring 10 Marks of Kil'jaeden to Adyen the Lightwarden in Shattrath City.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你手上有任何我们敌人的徽记吗，$n？",pEN="Do you bear any of our enemies' insignias, <name>?",c="对抗燃烧军团的恶魔和崇拜他们的疯狂教徒不是件容易的事，$n。你已经展现了伟大的功勋和勇气。坚持下去，你在奥尔多中的名望将继续成长。",cEN="Facing the demons of the Burning Legion and the mad cultists that worship them is no small feat, <name>. You've shown great dedication and courage. Keep it up and your renown among the Aldor will continue to grow."}
Q[10326]={p="你身上还有我们敌人的徽记吗，$n？燃烧军团仍是威胁，我们会继续追剿他们，无论在哪里发现。",pEN="Do you bear more of our enemies' insignias, <class>? The Burning Legion continues to be a threat and we continue to pursue them anywhere that we find them.",c="你不断证明着自己的价值，$n。无论在哪里遇到圣光的敌人，都与之战斗；你的行动会得到优厚的回报。",cEN="You continue to prove your worth, <name>. Fight the enemies of the Light wherever you may find them; your actions will be well-rewarded."}
Q[10327]={p="我将拿走你剩下的所有印记。别担心你的行为将被正式的表扬。",pEN="I'll take any leftover marks you might have. Do not worry; your actions will be duly noted.",c="你不断向我们证明自己的价值，$n。无论何时遇到圣光的敌人，都与之战斗；你的行动会得到回报。",cEN="You continue to prove your worth, <name>. Fight the enemies of the Light wherever you may find them; your actions will be well-rewarded."}
Q[10328]={d="法力熔炉的事一直在困扰着我，$n。纳鲁的科技水平遥遥领先，即便是凯尔萨斯，也应该需要数年时间才能掌握。\n\n凯尔萨斯的军队纪律严明，他们会及时销毁所有书面通信证据，情报收集工作非常艰难。\n\n我们接到消息，法力熔炉：杜隆遭到了法力生物的入侵。血精灵很可能还来不及销毁那里的文件和简报。立刻将这些东西带回来给我。",dEN="Something about these manaforges has been bothering me, <name>. Naaru technology is incredibly advanced; it should've taken Kael'thas years to even begin to understand it.\n\nInformation-gathering on the subject has been difficult as Kael's army is well disciplined and destroys all evidence of written communication.\n\nWe've been informed Manaforge Duro is under attack by mana creatures. It is possible that those defending it have not yet destroyed their briefings. Obtain them and bring them to me.",o="转至法力熔炉：杜隆，从日怒军团士兵手中夺得日怒军事简报和日怒奥术简报。完成任务后向大主教欧雷里斯复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Go to Manaforge Duro and retrieve the Sunfury Military Briefing and the Sunfury Arcane Briefing from the Sunfury units stationed there. Return to Exarch Orellis when you've completed this task.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你去法力熔炉杜隆取得简报的进展如何？",pEN="Did you have any luck with the briefings from Manaforge Duro?",c="做得好，$n！让我们看看能从这些简报里发现些什么。",cEN="Excellent job, <name>! Let us see what can be learned from these briefings."}
Q[10329]={d="你外出执行任务时，我和奥尔多进行了一番友好的谈话。法力熔炉极像是风暴要塞中纳鲁科技的改良建筑物。当然，大多数纳鲁建筑物都会配备安全装置，倘若出现紧急情况，就可以启动安全装置彻底废掉这类建筑物。\n\n通常，他们会利用控制水晶来关闭建筑物的控制台。瞧！这本名册上写道，工头瑟瑞狄斯掌管着控制水晶。夺得水晶，看看能不能派上用场。",dEN="I was having a friendly discussion with the Aldor while you were gone. Manaforges sure look like modified naaru technology from Tempest Keep. Apparently, most naaru constructs have certain safeguards that allow them to be permanently disabled in case of emergency.\n\nThe procedure is usually initiated at a control console via an access crystal. Lo and behold, according to the roster you secured, such a crystal is in the possession of a fellow called Overseer Theredis. Obtain it and see what you can do.",o="返回法力熔炉：布纳尔，从工头瑟瑞狄斯手中夺得布纳尔控制水晶。对法力熔炉：布纳尔的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉，然后向间谍大师萨罗迪恩复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Return to Manaforge B'naar and obtain the B'naar Access Crystal from Overseer Theredis. Use it at the B'naar Control Console to shut it down, then report back to Spymaster Thalodien.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="计划成功了吗？老实跟你说我预计有一半的机会你会一起被炸死。",pEN="Did the plan work? I was half-expecting you to get blown up, to tell you the truth.",c="这么做当然会成功！我是一个间谍大师我刺探到的军情永远是正确的。\n\n无论如何，我有一个全新的刺激任务等着你去完成。你想听吗？当然你想。",cEN="Of course it worked! I'm a spymaster; my information is always accurate.\n\nAnyhow, I have a whole new exciting job lined up for you. You want to hear about it? Of course you do."}
Q[10330]={d="萨罗迪恩告诉我说，你成功地关闭了法力熔炉：布纳尔。他希望能如法炮制地关闭法力熔炉：库鲁恩，因此下令寻找拥有控制水晶的人。我们已经查明工头希兰娜掌管着控制水晶。\n\n去关闭法力熔炉：库鲁恩吧。这次别偷偷摸摸的。直接夺得水晶，关掉法力熔炉，杀死企图阻止你的技师，然后撤退。\n\n快，凯尔的走狗很快就能查到我们的下落。",dEN="Thalodien told us of your success in disabling Manaforge B'naar. He expects a repeat performance here and asked us to keep an eye out for anyone using a crystal to access the console inside. Overseer Seylanna holds the access crystal, we're sure of it.\n\nGo back in there and finish the operation. No need to be stealthy anymore; get the crystal, begin the shutdown, kill the technicians trying to stop you and get out.\n\nHurry, it won't be long before Kael's lapdogs sniff us out.",o="从工头希兰娜手中夺得库鲁恩控制水晶。对法力熔炉：库鲁恩的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉，然后向卡勒迪斯·晨光复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Obtain the Coruu Access Crystal from Overseer Seylanna. Use it at the Coruu Control Console to shut down the manaforge and return to Caledis Brightdawn.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task yet, <name>?",c="我们听到了那阵骚动，正打算离开。很高兴看到你没被打得太惨。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="We heard all the commotion and were just about to leave. Glad to see you didn't take too bad of a beating."}
Q[10331]={d="你有没有在附近看见一把重型铁匠锤？我原本要用它给阿莫尔林那老家伙的马匹钉上铁蹄的，可现在却找不到了。\n\n我翻遍了整座马厩，找了十来次，还是一无所获。会不会是哪个学徒捡到铁锤，把它带回我的铁匠铺了？你愿意到那边去帮我找找吗？我的铺子就在城镇广场塔楼的东南边。",dEN="You haven't seen a heavy smithing hammer lying around by chance, have you? I brought it out here with me to finish the shoes for some of old man Amorlin's horses, but I can't find it.\n\nI've searched the barn no less than a half dozen times and I just can't seem to find it. Maybe one of the other apprentices retrieved it and took it back to the smithy? Would you be willing to go down there and take a look? The workshop is to the southeast of the tower in the Town Square.",o="从肯瑞瓦学徒手中夺回铁匠锤，将它交给肯瑞瓦村的学徒安德雷萨。",oEN="Retrieve the Smithing Hammer from the Kirin'Var Apprentices and bring it back to Apprentice Andrethan in Kirin'Var Village.",p="你找我的锤子找的还顺利吗？",pEN="Did you have any luck finding my hammer?",c="感谢老天爷！现在我可以继续工作了。我知道你会觉得我疯了，竟然不在一般锻造的适合地点制造可以帮我赢得熟练工地位的作品，但是我不能冒险让其它的学徒们抄袭我的作品。",cEN="Thank goodness! Now I can get back to work. I know you think I'm crazy, working on the piece that will earn me journeyman status away from the forge proper, but I can't run the risk of one of the other apprentices copying my design."}
Q[10332]={d="终于，我的学徒课程全部结束了！我真是等不及要告诉罗恩苏斯大师了。\n\n<学徒认真地听你你描述取回铁锤的经历。>\n\n他们攻击了你？所有人？圣光啊，他们一定是疯了！\n\n那我们要怎么办，$n？难道必须要杀死罗恩苏斯大师，哦，说出这话已经让我十分悲痛了。这样下去……我或许就是肯瑞瓦村唯一的铁匠了，但我相信我的能力足以满足全镇的需要。",dEN="At last, my journeyman project is complete! I can't wait to formally present it to Master Rhonsus.\n\n<The apprentice looks at you as you describe your experiences retrieving the hammer.>\n\nThey attacked you? All of them? By the Light, they've gone mad!\n\nWhat are we to do, <name>? It grieves me to say so, but it may be necessary to kill Master Rhonsus. It would leave me as the only smith in Kirin'Var, but I believe my training is sufficient to serve the town's needs.",o="肯瑞瓦村的学徒安德雷萨要你消灭镇上铁匠大师罗恩苏斯的鬼魂。",oEN="Apprentice Andrethan in Kirin'Var Village wants you to kill the ghost of Rhonsus, the town's master blacksmith.",p="<眼泪在这个徒弟开口时冒上了他的眼眶。>\n\n你已经……解决罗恩苏斯大师了吗？",pEN="<There appear to be tears in the apprentice's eyes as he speaks.>\n\nHave you... dealt with Master Rhonsus?",c="我的一切知识技能都是罗恩苏斯大师教我的。我将通过我的技能服务肯瑞瓦的人们来纪念他。",cEN="Master Rhonsus taught me everything I know about my trade. I will honor his memory by using my skills to serve the people of Kirin'Var."}
Q[10333]={d="嗯，$n，不知道你是否能再帮我一个忙。\n\n我有个合作伙伴正在野外进行实验，她非常需要帮助。你不如去看看她那里的情况？\n\n我想维勒老妈一定会感激你的，别在意她的刀子嘴。\n\n她正在东部为我们拓展利益，你可以在中央生态圆顶的中央圆顶哨站中找到她。",dEN="Say, <name>, I was wondering if you could do me another favor.\n\nMy partner out in the field could probably use a hand. I was wondering if you could go check in on her.\n\nI'm sure that Mama Wheeler will appreciate the help. Just don't mind her sharp tongue.\n\nShe's trying to look out for our interests to the east. You'll find her just inside Eco-Dome Midrealm at the Midrealm Post.",o="转至虚空风暴的中央生态圆顶，与中央圆顶哨站的维勒老妈谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mama Wheeler at the Midrealm Post inside Eco-Dome Midrealm in the Netherstorm.",c="什么？！他叫我“合伙人”吗？我是他的妻子！\n\n他说我有一根刻薄的舌头！唔，当我回到52区时，我要给他又大又绿的一记耳光！\n\n但是我很高兴你在这里。他有一件事情说对了——我非常需要你的帮助！",cEN="What?! He called me his 'partner'? I'm his wife!\n\nAnd he said I had a sharp tongue! Ooh, when I get back to Area 52, I'm going to box his big, green ears!\n\nBut I'm glad that you're here. He was right about one thing; I can definitely use your help!"}
Q[10334]={d="在哪里呢，我的贝希跑到哪里去了？那次袭击之后，我就一直在农田和礼拜堂广场附近寻找她，可怎么都看不见她的身影！\n\n贝希留下的唯一对象就是这个老铃铛了。过去她一听到铃铛响就会跑过来，但是我这把骨头恐怕已经摇不响它了。\n\n我把贝希的铃铛交给你，你能帮我到田地那边去摇摇铃铛，看看她会不会出现……或许贝希正四处寻找着这铃铛的声音呢。",dEN="Where, oh where has my Bessy gone? After the attack, I searched the fields and the Chapel Yard for her, but she was nowhere to be seen!\n\nAll I have left of her is this old cowbell. She usually comes running when she hears it, but these feeble old bones probably couldn't shake it hard enough.\n\nI'll loan you Bessy's bell if you're willing to go out to the fields and ring it as hard as you can. Perhaps all Bessy's waiting for is a little more cowbell.",o="在虚空风暴肯瑞瓦村礼拜堂小丘附近的农田中找到贝希。",oEN="Find Bessy in the fields near Kirin'Var Village's Chapel Hill in Netherstorm.",p="<这只牛站在本来的地方，怀疑地看着你。>",pEN="<The cow looks at you distrustfully, but stands its ground.>",c="<从你的背包取出颈铃来，你摇动铃铛一会儿并把它给似乎认得这个铃铛的贝斯看。母牛允许将这个铃铛的绳子系在她的颈子上，并且期待的看着你。>",cEN="<Removing the bell from your pack, you ring it a couple of times and show it to Bessy, who seems to recognize it. The cow allows the bell's cord to be fastened around her neck and looks at you expectantly.>"}
Q[10335]={d="我打算立刻转至法兰伦废墟进行挖掘工作！但问题是那里恶魔肆虐，根本无法进入！\n\n或许你能帮我做些挖掘之前的初期准备工作？\n\n我想在遗迹东北角的三处地点放下测量标记。测量点附近各有一面德莱尼旗帜，很好辨认。\n\n放好测量标记后回来找我。",dEN="I have to get over to the Ruins of Farahlon to start my excavations! The problem is that the place has been infested by demons!\n\nMaybe you could do some preliminary work for me?\n\nThere are three locations within the ruins to the northeast where I want you to place surveying markers. Each is near a draenei banner.\n\nReturn to me when you've managed to place all three markers.",o="放置好三枚测量标记，然后返回虚空风暴的风暴尖塔里，向塞菲里恩复命。",oEN="Place the three Surveying Markers and then return to Zephyrion at the Stormspire in the Netherstorm.",p="动作真快。你一定是一个非常有效率的人，已经将那3个标记全部放置妥当。",pEN="That was fast. You must be a very efficient person to have placed all three of those markers already.",c="你不会扯我的后腿吧？那真是最好的消息啊！\n\n现在你已经完成了轻松的实地调查工作，我可以带着我的团队到废墟上面去寻宝了。\n\n感谢你，$c。",cEN="You're not just pulling my bandage, right? That's most excellent news!\n\nNow that you've done the surveying grunt-work, I'll be able to take my team up to the ruins and see what's there to be procured.\n\nYou have my thanks, <class>."}
Q[10336]={d="几周前，燃烧军团占据了法兰伦废墟，彻底阻碍了我们调查遗迹并挖掘文物的计划。\n\n今天早些时候我收到情报，据称一个名叫库鲁萨斯的恐惧魔王杀光了军中的其它将士，然后便开始召唤恶魔来侍奉他。\n\n$C，我要你转至东北方的法兰伦废墟，将这些恶魔全部消灭。",dEN="A few weeks ago, the Burning Legion moved into the Ruins of Farahlon, thwarting our plans to excavate the site for its artifacts.\n\nThen earlier today, I learned that one of their dreadlords, Culuthas, somehow killed off all of the other Burning Legion. He has since summoned in demons that serve him.\n\n<class>, I want you to go up to those ruins to the northeast and rid them of their demon infestation.",o="杀死10只库鲁萨斯的猎犬和5只库鲁萨斯之眼。然后返回虚空风暴的风暴尖塔，向虚空猎手纳乌希思复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Hounds of Culuthas and 5 Eyes of Culuthas. Then return to Nether-Stalker Nauthis at the Stormspire in the Netherstorm.",p="你把所有法拉隆废墟的恶魔都杀掉了没？",pEN="Have you killed all of the demons at the Ruins of Farahlon yet?",c="做的真好。\n\n在库鲁萨斯的恶魔被杀后，塞菲里恩将能安全的把他的挖掘队带进法拉隆废墟。\n\n收下这枚金币代表我对你的感激。",cEN="Truly an exceptional job.\n\nWith the demons of Culuthas slain, Zephyrion will be able to safely take his excavation team into the Ruins of Farahlon.\n\nAccept this coin as a token of my gratitude."}
Q[10337]={d="你意识到贝希仍然盯着你看，就指了指萨德尔所处的位置。你告诉这头奶牛，说你想护送她安全返家。说完之后你才明白，要让奶牛听懂你的话是不可能的。\n\n你只好耸了耸肩，准备好护送她回到萨德尔身边。",dEN="Realizing that Bessy is still staring at you, you gesture toward Thadell's location. You find yourself promising to protect the cow on her way home. Upon finishing your sentence, you realize there's no possible way the cow could understand anything you've said.\n\nShrugging your shoulders, you prepare to guard the bovine on her way back to Thadell.",o="护送贝希安全返回她的主人萨德尔那里。",oEN="Escort Bessy safely back to her owner, Thadell.",c="贝斯，是你吗？\n\n<农夫转身走向你。>\n\n谢谢你带回我的贝斯，$n。没有她我活不下去！",cEN="Bessy, is that you?\n\nThank you for bringing back my Bessy, <name>. I couldn't live without her!"}
Q[10338]={d="法力熔炉：杜隆遭到攻击，局势已经失控？这真叫我为难！如果杜隆被摧毁，风暴要塞也就在劫难逃了。唯一的缺憾是……风暴要塞被摧毁时引发的大爆炸势必会将这片被遗忘的土地夷为平地。\n\n凯尔萨斯死掉固然很好，可是白白搭上这许多无辜的生命……就不太好吧。没办法，只能由我们来收拾凯尔萨斯留下的烂摊子咯。你只能转至法力熔炉：杜隆，在这座法力熔炉爆炸前关闭它。控制水晶由工头安萨奈尔掌管。",dEN="So Manaforge Duro is under attack and Sunfury forces have lost control? What a dilemma! If Duro goes down, then Tempest Keep goes down. Only drawback is... if Tempest Keep is destroyed, the explosion will probably take what little remains of this forsaken land with it.\n\nDead Kael'thas is good. Dead everyone else is... not that great, I suppose. It pains me to ask this of you, but go to Manaforge Duro and shut it down before it goes up in flames. The access crystal is held by Overseer Athanel.",o="返回法力熔炉：杜隆，从工头安萨奈尔手中夺得杜隆控制水晶。对法力熔炉：杜隆的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉，然后向间谍大师萨罗迪恩复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Return to Manaforge Duro and obtain the Duro Access Crystal from Overseer Athanel. Use it at the Duro Control Console to shut it down and report back to Spymaster Thalodien.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成关闭的任务了吗？你得在我改变对这整个计划的心意前快点完成。",pEN="Did you complete the shut down? You should hurry before I change my mind about the whole deal.",c="你已经关掉了三个法力熔炉了，$n。凯尔萨斯现在一定昏倒了吧。",cEN="That makes three manaforges you've shut down, <name>. Kael'thas must be having a real fit right about now."}
Q[10339]={d="此地正南方就是复仇军前沿基地。最近，大批复仇军在那里筹备着什么行动……或许他们是想突袭乌提斯。\n\n万一他们的目标是我们就麻烦了，我们绝不能冒这个风险，$c。立刻突破他们的外围防御网，摧毁他们的训练设施。\n\n杀死索瓦克斯上尉和他手下的士兵后，找到复仇军发射器 - 塞塔。利用它与我取得联系，我会传达给你后续的命令。",dEN="Directly south of here you will find the Ethereum Staging Grounds. The Ethereum are there, preparing for something... Perhaps an assault on Ultris.\n\nWe can't take any chances, though, <class>. Break through their perimeter defenses and take out their training facility.\n\nOnce you've destroyed their soldiers and Captain Zovax, locate Ethereum transponder Zeta and use it to establish contact with me to get your next set of orders.",o="指挥官阿米尔要你杀死5名复仇军刺客、5名复仇军突击队员、2名复仇军研究员和索瓦克斯上尉，然后启动复仇军发射器 - 塞塔。",oEN="Commander Ameer wants you to kill 5 Ethereum Assassins, 5 Ethereum Shocktroopers, 2 Ethereum Researchers and Captain Zovax then activate Ethereum Transponder Zeta.",p="做得好，凡人……",pEN="Well done, fleshling...",c="我们必须收集他们已经储存在这个区域的任何资料。",cEN="We must gather whatever data that they've stored in this area."}
Q[10340]={d="$n，你曾在前线完成过那么重要的任务，现在你又显示出在武装狮鹫驾驶方面的天赋与才能……我想，我有件非常适合你的任务要交给你。\n\n这项新的任务要求你转至蛮锤部族设置在黑暗之门附近一处浮空岛屿上的前线攻击基地——破碎岗哨。那边的状况有些不太好，人员都因长期作战而身心疲惫，但你是一个富有勇气与感染力的人，在那边一定不会有问题的。\n\n和空军指挥官达比利谈谈吧，他会送你去破碎岗哨。到了那里以后，立刻向狮鹫管理员鲁恩托格·蛮锤报到。",dEN="<name>, you've done a great job here at the front, and you showed a lot of talent with that armored gryphon... I think I have another mission in mind for you.\n\nThis new mission launches from Shatter Point -- an attack base the Wildhammers set up on a floating piece of land near the Portal. It's a little unnerving there, but you have tough guts. You'll be fine.\n\nTalk to Wing Commander Dabir'ee and have him send you to Shatter Point. From there, report to the gryphon master Runetog Wildhammer.",o="前线指挥官金斯顿要求你与空军指挥官达比利交谈，搭乘狮鹫转至破碎岗哨，并向鲁恩托格·蛮锤报告。",oEN="Forward Commander Kingston wants you to speak with Wing Commander Dabir'ee, ride a gryphon to Shatter Point, and then report to Runetog Wildhammer.",c="哈哈，一位来自大陆的新鲜$r！别担心——碎天者号也许会让你有点晕，可她不会飞得太远！\n\n而且她只翻过一次……或者两次。$g朋友:朋友;",cEN="Hah hah! A fresh <race> from the mainland! Well don't worry -- Shatter Point might make you queasy but she doesn't stray far!\n\nAnd I've only seen her flip upside down once... or twice."}
Q[10341]={d="$n，你打探回来的消息对我们大为有利。如此一来，你就能顺利地混入法力熔炉：杜隆，狠狠地打击凯尔军队的嚣张气焰。\n\n趁法力熔炉：杜隆陷入混乱之际杀掉那些掉队的日怒士兵。\n\n跟萨罗迪恩不同，我不喜欢无意义的屠杀；不过放弃此次战略优势就太可惜了。",dEN="The news you've discovered is fortunate, <name>. Not only do you get to waltz into Manaforge Duro unfettered, this also presents a great opportunity to deal a blow to Kael's army.\n\nUse the mana creature assault to your advantage and pick off any Sunfury stragglers you run into.\n\nI do not take particular glee in the senseless slaughter of my own kin the way that Thalodien does, but the tactical advantage here is too high to pass up.",o="杀死8名日怒咒术师、6名日怒弓箭手和4名日怒百夫长。完成任务后返回52区向魔导师拉恩娜复命。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Slay 8 Sunfury Conjurers, 6 Sunfury Bowmen and 4 Sunfury Centurions. Return to Magistrix Larynna at Area 52 after completing this task.\n\nCompleting tasks for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",p="你完成了你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="你做得很好，$n。凯尔萨斯的军队会很难从你今天的打击中恢复。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. Kael's army will not easily recover from the blow you've dealt today."}
Q[10342]={d="我在52区售卖饮料，赚了不少钱。可我还想要赚更多！\n\n火箭主管总是向我抱怨说他找不到能让X-52飞上天的燃料。\n\n我们可以帮他搞定这个小问题。\n\n首先，我必须要从此地的岩肤劫掠者的油块上分解出原油来！浓缩后的原油就可以用作混合燃料的燃基。\n\n去那些紫色的岩石附近寻找岩肤劫掠者吧，替我取回它们身上的油块。",dEN="I make a good living selling drinks to the boozehounds around here. But I want something more!\n\nThe rocket-chief is always telling me how he can't perfect the rocket fuel needed to get the X-52 off of the ground.\n\nWe can solve that little problem for him.\n\nFor starters I need to extract the oil from the shale of the local shaleskin flayers! It'll form a concentrated, if explosive, base for the mix that I have in mind.\n\nFind the flayers, and their shale, all over the place near the purple rocks.",o="收集5块岩肤油块，将它们交给虚空风暴52区的布兹。",oEN="Collect 5 Shaleskin Shale and give them to Boots at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="你取得足够的油块了吗？我需要大量去淬取出可用于X-52 虚空火箭燃料所需的油。",pEN="You have enough of that shale yet? I'm going to need a lot of it to extract the amount of oil that'll be needed for the X-52 Nether Rocket's fuel.",c="好了！第一号原料完成了。\n\n现在，要是你加把劲，我们可以继续收集某种可提供岩肤油一点需要额外刺激的东西来将虚空火箭推进扭曲虚空里……或者是发生爆炸，看看哪个会先发生。",cEN="OK! Ingredient number one is down.\n\nNow, if you're up to it, we'll move on to something that'll give the shale oil that little extra kick that it'll need to blast the nether rocket into the Twisting Nether... or oblivion, whichever comes first."}
Q[10343]={d="凯尔萨斯首先朝肯瑞瓦村西北角的军官区发动了攻击，当时那里突然传来雷鸣般的噪音，接着便从空中落下一道闪电。军官区成为了肯瑞瓦村破坏最为严重的区域。血精灵撤军后，就发生了怪事。\n\n由纯法力构成的生命体突然如潮水般从四面八方涌入村中。到当前为止，我们还能勉强牵制住肆虐的法力生物。不过如果我们能了解到凯尔萨斯所用武器的更多信息，就有机会彻底切断它们的来路。",dEN="Kael'thas's assault on Kirin'Var began with thundering noise and a bright flash of light in the officer quarters to the northwest. The destruction there was the most severe and after the withdrawal of the blood elves, a strange thing began to happen.\n\nBeings of pure mana began streaming into the village from all over the area. For now, we're containing them as we can, but with more information about the weapon Kael'thas used, I hope to cut off the flow of mana creatures entirely.",o="在肯瑞瓦村中法力生物肆虐的地区收集一块魔法炸弹碎片，将它交给巫师上尉莫尔兰。",oEN="Search the mana creature infested area of Kirin'Var Village for a Mana Bomb Fragment and bring it to Lieutenant-Sorcerer Morran.",p="你有找到凯尔萨斯用来攻击村子所剩下的武器吗？",pEN="Did you find the remains of the weapon Kael'thas used against the village?",c="一枚法力炸弹？\n\n<莫尔兰将手中的碎片翻来翻去。>\n\n几乎难以想象！即使在达拉然里最聪明的人也不可能想象出一种像这样的武器。一定是这场大骚动在虚空中撕破一道裂隙，让这些生物可以进入我们的土地。",cEN="A mana bomb?\n\n<Morran turns the fragment over in his hands.>\n\nIt's nigh unthinkable! Even the best minds in Dalaran couldn't have conceived of a weapon like this. The sheer magnitude of the disturbance must've torn a rift in the nether, giving these creatures access to our lands."}
Q[10344]={d="空军指挥官格莱芬加尔负责管理这处蛮锤矮人的据点。如果你是第一次来到破碎岗哨，那么就应该去向他报到。\n\n他就在那边的哨塔废墟里。",dEN="Wing Commander Gryphongar runs this outfit of Wildhammers. If this is your first time to Shatter Point, then you should report to him.\n\nYou'll find him inside what's left of that tower over yonder.",o="与破碎岗哨的空军指挥官格莱芬加尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Wing Commander Gryphongar in Shatter Point.",c="你与鲁恩托格谈过了吗？他是一个好的矮人。将他的狮鹫保持在良好状态，随时准备好战斗。\n\n我是格莱芬加尔，破碎岗哨的指挥官。我知道这看起来不漂亮，但这块岩石是一个突击地狱火的重要据点。你会看到狮鹫不停地飞进飞出！\n\n忠告？这里有一些：保持你的设备满载，掏空你的胃，以及将你的视线盯在地平线……如果破碎岗哨开始摇晃，就抓住不会漂浮离开的东西！",cEN="You spoke with Runetog? A fine dwarf he is. Keeps his gryphons in good shape and battle ready.\n\nI'm Gryphongar, commander here at Shatter Point. I know it's not pretty, but this hunk of rock is a vital staging point for sorties into Hellfire. You'll see gryphons flying out and in non-stop!\n\nAdvice? Here's some: keep your gear stowed, your stomach empty, and your eye on the horizon... if Shatter Point starts to teeter, then grab onto something that won't float away!"}
Q[10345]={d="$r，瞧见这些尸体了吗？是阿克努斯干的。他吸干了尸体，只留下一具干枯的躯壳。但是，你千万别被表象欺骗了！尸体中蛰伏着蠢蠢欲动的血肉兽，随时准备伏击那些放松警惕的蠢材。\n\n我刚刚接到新的指令，必须留在这里等待增援。不如你拿上我的点火器，替我烧毁矿井中的干枯的尸体。无论如何，我们必须完成任务。",dEN="You see these corpses, <race>? Arconus is responsible for this slaughter. He's sucked them dry, leaving nothing more than a fleshy husk. But don't let the bodies fool you! Inside those corpses lie flesh beasts, waiting to pounce on the unsuspecting fool that gets too close.\n\nI've got my orders. I must remain here until backup arrives. That doesn't mean that you can't take my igniter and destroy the withered corpses that litter the mines. One way or another, the mission must be completed.",o="对12具枯萎的尸体使用护卫者点火器。任务完成后，把护卫者点火器交还给泽昂通道外的特工阿拉克斯。|n",oEN="Use the Protectorate Igniter on 12 Withered Corpses. Return the Protectorate Igniter to Agent Araxes outside of Access Shaft Zeon when the task is complete.",p="亚希克斯找得如何？",pEN="Any luck in finding Ya-six?",c="你救了我的裹尸布，$n。护卫者组织会知道你今天的所作所为的，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;。",cEN="You saved my wrappings, <name>. The Protectorate will know of what you've done on this day, friend."}
Q[10346]={d="$n，你已经证明自己是$g一名:一名;干练的狮鹫骑手，我们可以派你多跑几趟深渊平台上空的出击任务。你说呢，$c？想再多飞一会儿吗？",dEN="<name>, you've proven yourself as a capable gryphon rider, and we could use you on more sorties over the Abyssal Shelf. What say you, <class>? Do you want some more flight time?",o="地狱火半岛破碎岗哨的狮鹫骑士维比洛要求你杀死20个甘尔葛苦工和5个莫尔葛监工，并摧毁5门邪能火炮。",oEN="Gryphoneer Windbellow at Shatter Point in Hellfire Peninsula has asked that you destroy 20 Gan'arg Peons, 5 Mo'arg Overseers and 5 Fel Cannons.",p="在这个地狱岩床上仍然有许多的目标，$n。当你准备好进行下一回合时找只狮鹫吧。",pEN="There are still plenty of targets on the Abyssal Shelf, <name>. Grab a gryphon when you're ready for another run.",c="这次进展如何？你状况很不错喔……或许好到甚至可以进行下一个回合！",cEN="How'd it go out there this time? You're in pretty good shape... maybe even good enough for another run!\nRelated"}
Q[10347]={d="$n，你$g准备好:准备好;再去深渊平台出击一次了吗？我担心，如果我们不对那里的军团部队保持压力、任由他们巩固控制，我们可能会遭到来自北方的大规模恶魔进攻。\n\n你说呢，$c？想不想再骑上一头驭风者，把深渊平台再狠狠砸一遍？",dEN="<name>, are you ready for another sortie over the Abyssal Shelf? I fear that, if we do not maintain pressure on the Legion forces there and allow them to strengthen their hold, then we may suffer a large demon attack from the north.\n\nWhat say you, <class>? Do you want to take another windrider and hammer the Abyssal Shelf one more time?",o="地狱火半岛机甲残骸的空军指挥官布拉克要求你杀死20个甘尔葛苦工和5个莫尔葛监工，并摧毁5门邪能火炮。",oEN="Wing Commander Brack at Reaver's Fall in Hellfire Peninsula has asked that you destroy 20 Gan'arg Peons, 5 Mo'arg Overseers and 5 Fel Cannons.",p="军团一定会认为他们哪怕是岩床上也不安全了。我们一定要不断的攻击他们！",pEN="The Legion must not think they are safe high atop the Abyssal Shelf. We must hit them repeatably!",c="其它的双足飞龙飞行员对你赞扬极高，$n。你在地狱岩床上的击杀得到了相当多的分数。保持好成绩！",cEN="The other windrider pilots speak highly of you, <name>. You've scored quite a lot of kills on the Abyssal Shelf. Keep up the good works!\nRelated"}
Q[10348]={d="听说一群来自艾泽拉斯的德鲁伊对我们的生态圆顶技术颇为感兴趣。\n\n塞纳里奥远征队的代表们急于获取生长在圆顶内的植物，尤其是那种叫象牙铃的植物，它以治疗功效闻名。它们长在中庭生态圆顶里大株植物周围的灌木丛中。\n\n如果你愿意为我第一次交货采集这些草药，我就与你分享利润。$g朋友:朋友;",dEN="I hear that a group of 'druids' from Azeroth has taken quite an interest in the effects of our eco-dome technology.\n\nThe Cenarion Expedition's representatives are eager to get access to the plants growing within the domes, particularly one called the ivory bell, known for its healing properties. They're found in clumps of brush around larger plants in Eco-Dome Midrealm.\n\nI'll share the profits with you if you're willing to gather the herbs for my first delivery.",o="收集15株象牙铃笼草，然后向中央圆顶哨站的玛尔达德复命。",oEN="Gather 15 Ivory Bells and return to Mehrdad at Midrealm Post.",p="你设法去采取这些铃笼草了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to gather the herbs?",c="有趣的选择，对吧？这个治疗的效果最好是很惊人。我可是为这个相貌平凡的花定了很高的价格呢。",cEN="Interesting choice, isn't it? The healing properties had better be miraculous. I'm charging a lot of money for a rather plain looking flower."}
Q[10349]={d="你应该把这块水晶碎片交给缚地者。她跟你一样……总是喜欢思考，并以揭开一个又一个的谜团为乐。\n\n其实在我看来，她倒是根本不用去想那么多事的。\n\n你把这块水晶碎片交给她吧，然后，为了弄清坠星山事件的真相，她肯定会丢一堆麻烦的事情给你去做的。",dEN="You should take the crystal lump over to the earthbinder. She's just like you... always needing to get to the bottom of a mystery and thinking all of the time.\n\nIf you ask me, she thinks a little too much.\n\nJust give it to her and I'm sure that she'll get you into a heap of trouble figuring out what is going on up there on the ridge.",o="将火红水晶碎片交给地狱火半岛塞纳里奥哨站的缚地者加兰蒂娅·夜风。",oEN="Take the Crimson Crystal Shard to Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="那就是来自坠星山上水晶裂片的一部分吗？",pEN="Is that a piece from the giant crystal shard up on Fallen Sky Ridge?",c="噢，太好了！我一直等待把那件东西弄到手，但是图拉希恩一直拖拖拉拉的。\n\n他应该是到那去帮我调查坠星山发生了什么事。相反的他只是不断的派你这种可怜的傻瓜——别生气——上去那里送死。\n\n假如你给我水晶，或许我能找到在它与巨人之间的关联。",cEN="Oh, excellent! I've been waiting to get my hands on a piece of that thing, but Tola'thion's been dragging his feet.\n\nHe's supposed to be out here helping me to investigate what's going on up on Fallen Sky Ridge. Instead he's just been sending poor dupes like you - no offense - up there into the slaughter mill.\n\nIf you give me the crystal maybe I can find a link between it and the colossi."}
Q[10350]={d="在我这里学习的这段时间里，你掌握了许多艰难的技术，现在是时候把你托付更有智慧的老师了。\n\n贝霍玛特在我初出茅庐的时候曾经训练过我，他将是你新导师。我告诉过他说，你马上就会去找他，他也正期待着你的到达呢。\n\n他就在埃索达内贸易阶梯最高处的战士平台的中央。",dEN="While you have learned many hard lessons from me during our time together, it is time that I entrusted you to wiser hands.\n\nBehomat, who trained me when I was as green as grass, will be your new teacher. I have told him that you will be seeking him out, and he is expecting you.\n\nYou will find him at the center of the Warriors' Terrace, at the highest point of the Traders Tier of the Exodar.",o="与埃索达贸易阶梯的贝霍玛特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Behomat at the Traders Tier of the Exodar.",c="啊，你终于来了。我是贝霍玛特，我将指导你修习$g之:之;道。鲁阿达跟我说过你对抗掠食者的试炼，我印象深刻。我有一份礼物给你。\n\n我们从埃索达残骸中抢救出来的东西不多，必须交给最有能力的人。挑一件适合你战斗风格的武器，带着你配得上它的觉悟去使用它。\n\n说到战斗风格，是时候学点新东西了。$C",cEN="Ah, so you've finally come. I am Behomat, and I will instruct you in the ways of the <class> arts. Ruada told me of your trial against the ravager, and I am impressed. And I have a gift for you.\n\nWhat we have scavenged from the wreckage of the Exodar is little, and must be given to those most able. Please take a weapon suited to your fighting style and carry it with the knowledge you have earned it.\n\nAnd speaking of fighting styles, it's time you learned something new."}
Q[10351]={d="一定是水晶散发出的邪恶力量将那些山丘巨人吸引到周围，而且还令它们发狂了。\n\n那块水晶实在太大了，我们根本没办法把它移走，毁掉它似乎也不太现实……不过，我想我知道一个办法，至少可以驱散它的力量。\n\n我已经在坠星山的水晶西北角布置了一个法阵。你将这粒种子带到法阵去，引导它蕴涵的魔法能量，通过细雨、骄阳和轻风这些自然的力量治愈那片土地。\n\n不过，$n，你一定要小心，我可以感觉到有一股外界的力量……邪恶的力量盘踞在那里！",dEN="It must be that the evil emanations from that giant crystal are summoning the mountain giants and driving them insane.\n\nIt's too big to move, and beyond our ability to destroy, but I know a way to quell its power.\n\nI've summoned a circle at the northwest corner of the crystal on the ridge. Take this seed to the circle and channel its powers to heal the land through the natural forces of rain, growth and insect repopulation.\n\nBeware, <name>, I sense an external force at play here... this is not natural!",o="在缚地者法阵中使用新生之种，治愈水晶周围的土地。然后返回地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，向缚地者加兰蒂娅·夜风汇报情况。",oEN="Use the Seed of Revitalization at the Earthbinder's Circle to heal the land around the crystal. Then, return to Earthbinder Galandria Nightbreeze at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula with any information that you gain.",p="有用吗？你看到了什么？你找出是谁或者什么东西在背后主导发生在坠星山的事件吗？",pEN="Did it work? What did you learn? Did you find out who or what is behind what happened at Fallen Sky Ridge?",c="戈利亚松？计算者帕萨雷恩？\n\n凯尔萨斯！？\n\n凯尔萨斯王子也牵涉其中？\n\n<缚地者勃然大怒。>\n\n他做的简直是疯狂！从天上投下巨型水晶、毁坏大地，只可能是疯子的行径！\n\n我可以向你保证，如果他们再敢这么做，塞纳里奥远征队一定会迎击他们的部队。\n\n我们欠你一份大人情，$n。",cEN="Goliathon? Pathaleon the Calculator?\n\nKAEL'THAS!?\n\nPrince Kael'thas has a hand in this?\n\n<The earthbinder fumes.>\n\nIt is insanity what he has done! Dropping giant crystals from the sky and decimating the land can only be the work of a madman!\n\nI can assure you, the Cenarion Expedition will counter any further attempts by their forces to do this ever again.\n\nWe owe you a great debt, <name>."}
Q[10352]={p="如果你身上带着六十块 Wool 布，并且已经$g准备好:准备好;捐赠，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10353]={d="两天前，我和阿拉克塞奉命来到乌提斯。我们的任务是找到并消灭虚空领主阿克努斯。我们一路追踪着他来到这座矿井，发现他一直在这片区域吸取其它生物体内的能量。\n\n在与阿克努斯初次交战的过程中，我和阿拉克塞失散了。眼下我身负重伤，被困在这里动弹不得。但任务绝不能就这样失败！\n\n如果你能消灭阿克努斯的话，指挥官一定会对你表示感谢的。你愿意接受这项任务吗？我的镜像会协助你作战。",dEN="Araxes and I were deployed to Ultris 2 days ago. Our mission: Find and terminate the void lord Arconus. We tracked him to this mine and discovered that he'd been feeding off the energies of the creatures in the area.\n\nA fire-fight broke out which resulted in Araxes and I separating. Now I'm stuck here, badly injured. The mission is in shambles!\n\nIf you can take out Arconus, high command would be grateful. Should you accept this mission, I will assist by providing a reflection of myself as a guardian.",o="虚空风暴瑟安竖井的代理人亚希克斯要你杀死贪婪者阿克努斯，然后向虚空风暴维序派哨站的指挥官阿米尔复命。",oEN="Agent Ya-six at Access Shaft Zeon in Netherstorm has asked you to slay Arconus the Insatiable and return to Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm.",p="报出名来，凡人？报上你的名来？",pEN="Status, fleshling? What is your status?",c="亚希克斯呢？他还健在吗？\n\n我们只好希望如此了。我无法让增援部队回到他们那里……复仇军现在占领了整个地区。\n\n抱歉，我差点忘记你的报酬了。",cEN="And Ya-six? Did he make it?\n\nLet's damn well hope so. I was unable to get reinforcements back to them... Ethereum have the entire area covered now.\n\nMy apologies, I nearly forgot about your reward."}
Q[10354]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10355]={d="我们必须搞清楚灾害的波及范围究竟有多广。你带回的孢芽来自于某个泥沼巨人。沼泽领主是泥沼巨人的近亲，但是他们的体型较大，足以抵御困扰发生在泥沼巨人身上的衰竭现象。\n\n我们最好查明死亡泥潭的水位变化是否影响到了居住在那里的其它生物。\n\n返回死亡泥潭，替我取回一些多头蛇的样本和沼泽领主的样本。",dEN="We must determine how far the damage has spread. The basidium you brought me comes from a bog giant. Their larger, hardier cousins, the bog lords, should prove more resistant to the degeneration that's struck the giants.\n\nIt would be good to know how the changes in the Dead Mire have affected the other creatures out there, too.\n\nReturn to the Dead Mire and see if you can get samples from the bog lords and the hydra in the area.",o="将5份干燥的多头蛇样本和5份枯萎的沼泽领主样本交给泰雷多尔的鲁埃姆。",oEN="Gather 5 Parched Hydra Samples and 5 Withered Bog Lord Samples and bring them to Ruam at Telredor.",p="你能够去收集这些样本吗？",pEN="Were you able to gather the samples?",c="<洛安玛检验了那些样本，看起来很忧伤。>\n\n这正是我所担心的，$n。逐渐干枯的环境对那些从没想过要住在沼泽以外的生物造成很大的负担。我们只好继续观察该区域然后跟塞纳里奥远征队协商看看我们能做些什么。",cEN="<Ruam examines the samples, looking distressed.>\n\nIt's exactly as I'd feared, <name>. The drying environment is taking a heavy toll on creatures never meant to live outside swampy environments. We'll have to continue to monitor the area and consult with the Cenarion Expedition to see if anything can be done."}
Q[10356]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且已经$g准备好:准备好;捐赠，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10357]={p="$n，你为我们布料募捐行动作出了巨大贡献。我们正努力补充储备，但有一种布料严重短缺——符文布。我们急需它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，请把你能匀出来的符文布带给我。我们一开始只接受六十块的单次捐赠，之后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[10358]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于埃索达的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n——要是没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族出力，我们一定会吃很多苦。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[10359]={p="如果你身上带着六十块 Wool 布，并且已经$g准备好:准备好;捐赠，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$N！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10360]={p="和其它纺织材料一样，我们的丝绸库存也已经降到了历史最低点。如果有足够的补给，我们就可以达成预期的目标。\n\n如果你愿意将丝绸作为礼物送给我们的话，那你在我们中的地位无疑将大大提升！那么，要是你有60块丝绸并且愿意把它们捐出来，那现在就可以给我了。",pEN="A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10361]={p="如果你身上带着六十块魔纹布，并且已经$g准备好:准备好;捐赠，现在就可以交给我了。",pEN="If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.",c="太好了！我们感谢你慷慨的捐赠，$n！",cEN="Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, <name>!"}
Q[10362]={p="$n，你为我们布料募捐行动作出了巨大贡献。我们正努力补充储备，但有一种布料严重短缺——符文布。我们急需它，希望你能像过去一样帮助我们！\n\n如果你$g愿意:愿意;，请把你能匀出来的符文布带给我。我们一开始只接受六十块的单次捐赠，之后再看情况。",pEN="<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!\n\nIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.",c="太棒了——我向你保证，这些一定能派上用场。再次感谢你的帮助！如果没有你的话，我们肯定会一筹莫展的。\n\n鉴于你一贯的慷慨，我会欣然接受你随时捐赠更多的符文布。请及时与我联系，我个人可以确保你所做得好事一定会被广为传颂！",cEN="Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.\n\nWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!"}
Q[10363]={p="你好，$n！我们的符文布一直比较紧缺，如果你可以省出一些符文布来给我们的话，我们总是表示欢迎的。要是你可以再给我们20块符文布，那么我可以保证，你一定会因为对于银月城的贡献而被大家认同。\n\n随时欢迎你捐献符文布。",pEN="Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.",c="$n——要是没有像你这样的$g英雄:英雄;为部族出力，我们一定会吃很多苦。感谢你持续不断的努力！",cEN="<name> - without heroes like you working on behalf of the tribe, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!"}
Q[10365]={d="你的表现远比我们任何人预想的都要出色。法力熔炉阿拉是凯尔最后一处仍在运作的法力熔炉。它就在这里的西北方，不过你得绕上一大圈才能抵达。我们要你把它关停。\n\n最后的通行水晶在监工阿扎拉德手中。据我们所知，那是凯尔最后一处能量来源，所以做好遭遇顽强抵抗的准备吧。要是我的话，会带上几个朋友一起去。\n\n嗯……阿扎拉德。对一个辛多雷来说，这名字可真够古怪的。\n",dEN="You've done much better than any of us anticipated. Manaforge Ara is the last of Kael's working manaforges. You'll find it northwest of here, though you're likely to have to do some circumnavigating to get to it. We want you to shut it down.\n\nThe last access crystal is in the possession of Overseer Azarad. This is Kael's very last source of energy as far as we know, so expect heavy opposition. I'd bring a couple of friends along if I were you.\n\nHmm... Azarad. What an odd name for a sin'dorei.",o="转至法力熔炉：艾拉，从工头阿扎拉德手中夺得艾拉控制水晶。对法力熔炉：艾拉的控制台使用水晶关闭法力熔炉。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Travel to Manaforge Ara and obtain the Ara Access Crystal from Overseer Azarad. Use it at the Manaforge Ara console to shut it down.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成了我要求你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the task I asked of you, <name>?",c="燃烧军团与凯尔合伙？嘿！听到这情报沃雷塔尔将会很高兴。\n\n你认为来自艾泽拉斯的数千位朝圣者想要与燃烧军团有关联吗？我认为不会喔！",cEN="The Burning Legion is in cahoots with Kael? Hah! Voren'thal is going to have a field day with this information.\n\nDo you think the thousands of pilgrims that have come from Azeroth want to be allied with the Burning Legion? I think not!"}
Q[10366]={d="光与纯净之路并不好走，$n。有时连我自己也难以坚守这条路。\n\n你应当去埃索达寻找我的导师乔尔。我初踏此路时便是她教导的我，我想她会在你身上看到一名$g出色的新学徒:出色的新学徒;。\n\n你会在埃索达的光明穹顶、守备官圣殿里找到乔尔，那是一间被明亮光晕环绕的房间。",dEN="The path of the Light and purity is not an easy one to walk, <name>. Even I, at times, struggle with following its course.\n\nYou should seek out my master, Jol, at the Exodar. She trained me when I was beginning my journey, and I believe she will find in you a new star pupil.\n\nYou will find Jol in the Vault of Lights of the Exodar at the Vindicators' Sanctum, a room surrounded by a vibrant glow of light.",o="与埃索达守备官圣殿的约尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jol in the Vindicators' Sanctum of the Exodar.",c="$N，我一直在等你。\n\n图拉斯对你赞不绝口，我迫不及待想继续指导你走上圣光之路。当你$g准备好:准备好;解锁对自身技能与力量的更深领悟时，我会为你引路。",cEN="<name>, I have been expecting you.\n\nTullas has sung your praises and I am eager to continue your training on the path of Light. When you are ready to unlock greater understanding of your abilities and power, I will guide you."}
Q[10367]={d="在每个被奴役的破碎者部族中，必定有一位叛徒作祟。这个卑鄙的家伙为了得到力量不惜出卖自己的同胞。\n\n沙纳尔废墟中心的阶梯顶部有一间小屋。那便是背叛者的居所。\n\n他现在恰好不在，如果你有耐心的话，可以悄悄地潜进去。小屋中有个箱子，里面的钥匙可以打开囚禁残冠长者的镣铐。把钥匙带回来给我。\n\n千万小心，无情的阿尔泽斯就在小屋附近徘徊。",dEN="Anywhere you see a tribe of enslaved Broken you will also find a traitor. A despicable being who sold his brothers for promises of power.\n\nThere is a hut at the top of the stairs in the center of the ruins. That's the turncoat's hut.\n\nHe's not there right now, so you will be able to sneak in if you're patient. Inside you will find a coffer with a key inside of it. That key unlocks the chains that keep the Dreghood elders prisoner. Bring it to me.\n\nBeware, Arzeth the Merciless wanders nearby.",o="沙纳尔废墟的纳拉杜要你在附近的小屋中找到沙纳尔钥匙。",oEN="Naladu at the Ruins of Sha'naar wants you to obtain the Sha'naar Key from a nearby hut.",p="你拿到钥匙了吗，$n？",pEN="Did you obtain the key, <name>?",c="感谢你，$n。我的人民很快就会获得自由，感谢你。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. My people will soon be free thanks to you."}
Q[10368]={d="残冠长者被囚禁后，氏族的灵魂便陷入了绝望。带上这把钥匙，去搭救残冠长者。\n\n救出抚风者莫洛德、召火者阿库鲁和唤水者埃伊兰。一旦他们重获自由，灵魂就会返回残冠氏族。",dEN="The Dreghood spirit is broken because our elders are imprisoned. Take this key and go downstairs to free them.\n\nThey are Morod the Windstirrer, Akoru the Firecaller and Aylaan the Waterwaker. Once they are free, the spirits will return to the Dreghood tribe.",o="搭救被囚禁在沙纳尔废墟的抚风者莫洛德、召火者阿库鲁和唤水者埃伊兰。完成任务后向纳拉杜复命。",oEN="Free Morod the Windstirrer, Akoru the Firecaller and Aylaan the Waterwaker at the Ruins of Sha'naar. Return to Naladu after completing this task.",p="告诉我，$n。那些残冠长者是否已经被释放了？",pEN="Tell me, <name>. Have the Dreghood elders been released?",c="我能感觉到，$n！精灵们要回归我们身边。",cEN="I can feel it, <name>! The spirits are returning to us."}
Q[10369]={d="没错，元素的灵魂已经回到了我们身边！虽然我们不如从前那样强大，但是使用得当的话，一点点魔法都会发挥巨大的功效。\n\n阿尔泽斯的主子赐予了他可怕的力量。带上这根法杖，它曾是残冠氏族力量的象征。利用它对付阿尔泽斯，法杖能让阿尔泽斯的力量暂时消失。趁机杀死他，我们才能获得真正的自由！",dEN="Yes, the elemental spirits have returned to us! We are not as strong as we once were, but a little magic can go a long way in the right hands.\n\nArzeth has great powers bestowed upon him by his dark lord. Take this staff. It was once a great symbol of our tribe. Use it against Arzeth and his powers will be temporarily removed from him. Defeat him then, so that my people may finally be free!",o="对无情的阿尔泽斯使用残冠长者法杖，趁阿尔泽斯失去力量时杀死他。完成任务后向沙纳尔废墟的纳拉杜复命。",oEN="Use the Staff of Dreghood Elders on Arzeth the Merciless and slay him after he's lost his powers. Return to Naladu at the Ruins of Sha'naar after completing this task.",p="完成了吗，$n？阿尔泽斯死了吗？",pEN="Is it done, <name>? Is Arzeth dead?",c="没错，$n。我曾经是大地守卫者纳拉杜。\n\n就是我背叛了其它的残冠长者换取力量的空泛诺言。如果你想的话，你现在就能轻视我。重要的是我的部族再一次得到自由，而精灵们也已经回到我们身边。\n\n我无法再被部族的其它人接纳，但是我现在能安稳地死去了。愿大地之灵能够在我的兄弟中找到一位新的服侍者。",cEN="It is true, <name>. I was once Naladu the Keeper of Earth.\n\nIt was I who betrayed the other Dreghood elders in exchange for empty promises of power. You can despise me now if you wish to. What matters is that my tribe is free once again and that the spirits have returned to us.\n\nI will not be joining the rest of the tribe, but I can die in peace now. May the spirit of earth find a new servant among my brothers."}
Q[10371]={d="一位名叫约鲁斯·大麦酒的矮人战士向所有技艺精湛的联盟战士发出了挑战。\n\n他在东部王国的赤脊山脉，湖畔镇旅店里等候。旅途会很漫长，但对一个需要证明自己的人来说，这值得，$n。",dEN="A dwarven warrior known as Yorus Barleybrew has issued a challenge to all skilled Alliance warriors.\n\nHe waits at the Lakeshire Inn, in a place known as the Redridge Mountains in the Eastern Kingdoms. The journey will be long, but it'll be worth it for you to test yourself, <name>.",o="与赤脊山湖畔镇的犹鲁斯·麦酒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Yorus Barleybrew at the Lakeshire Inn in Redridge Mountains.",c="哈！你听说了我的挑战，对吗？\n\n请坐下来听我说。来一杯酒，慢慢享受……因为这也许是你这辈子最后一次喝酒了。",cEN="Hah! So you heard of my challenge, did you?\n\nWell sit down and listen. Have a drink, and savor it... because it might be your last."}
Q[10372]={d="我在塔奎林的一位同事艾拉兰向我发来了请求，需要我派人过去协助她完成一件十分紧急的工作。\n\n我并不知道她在想什么，但出于纪律原因，我是不会问的。如果你能证明自己具备足够的能力来完成这项工作的话，我希望你能到幽魂之地的塔奎林与艾拉兰谈谈。\n\n她的性格可能不怎么温和，甚至有点粗暴，但她绝对是一个值得信赖的人。",dEN="Eralan, an associate of mine in Tranquillien, has made an inquiry about securing some help for an urgent job.\n\nNow, I don't know what she has in mind because I don't ask questions, but you've proven yourself more than capable. I want you to travel to Tranquillien in the Ghostlands and have a word with Eralan.\n\nShe may be a bit gruff, but she's trustworthy.",o="与塔奎林的艾拉兰谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Eralan in Tranquillien.",c="我正开始怀疑泽拉尼斯到底有没有收到那封信。\n\n很好。我们开始干活吧。",cEN="I was beginning to wonder if Zelanis received that letter.\n\nGood. Let's get to work."}
Q[10373]={d="大家都听着！大家都听着！所有的英雄都应该聆听这号召的声音！\n\n暴风城已经发出了备战的号召！所有勇士都应该拿起武器，一同面对来自东部王国北部地区亡灵天灾的威胁！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，联盟的安全岌岌可危！\n\n联盟的英雄们——去向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到吧，他的大本营就在奥特兰克山脉北边的冰风岗！",dEN="Hear ye, hear ye! All heroes are called upon to heed these words!\n\nA call to arms has been issued by the Kingdom of Stormwind! All able bodied individuals are entreated to take up arms against the dark threat of the Scourge in the northern lands of the Eastern Kingdoms! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist who has set up his base camp in Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains!",o="找到指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特。他的大本营位于奥特兰克山脉以北的冰风岗。",oEN="Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，$g英雄:英雄;。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是我们北方和东北方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁。我很高兴听到，责任与为大局服务的号角声没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;弄脏双手，那么在这瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着$g愿意并有能力的英雄:愿意并有能力的英雄;去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, especially with the looming threat of the Scourge to our north and northeast. I am glad to hear that the clarion call of duty and service to the greater good did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[10374]={d="部落的英雄们，请聆听这召唤的声音——部落召唤你们迅速行动起来！\n\n战斗的号角已经吹响，所有勇士都应拿起武器，准备与天灾军团殊死作战！城中传言四起，东部王国的废墟中滋生出了新的威胁！它们已经在幽暗城东面的瘟疫之地大量集结，部落的安全岌岌可危！\n\n部落的英雄们——去向高级执行官德灵顿报到吧，他的大本营就在提瑞斯法林地东部的亡灵壁垒！",dEN="Heroes of the realm, hear me - the Horde calls upon you for swift action!\n\nA call to arms has been issued for all able bodied individuals to take up arms against the Scourge! Rumors fly of new threats rising from the ruins of the Eastern Kingdoms. They loom to the east of the Undercity, in the northern reaches of the lands now known as the Plaguelands!\n\nHeroes of the realm - seek out High Executor Derrington, who has set up his base camp at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade!",o="找到高级执行官德灵顿。他将自己的大本营建在提瑞斯法林地和幽暗城以东的亡灵壁垒。",oEN="Seek out High Executor Derrington. His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity.",c="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到瘟疫之地，英雄。这里是艾泽拉斯最危险的边境之一，尤其是东方还笼罩着天灾军团的威胁，而再往东更远的地方也是如此。我很高兴听到，责任与为部落服务的号召没有在你耳边白响！\n\n如果你$g准备好:准备好;动手干活，那么在瘟疫之地的边缘，有太多的事等着愿意并有能力的英雄去做。",cEN="Welcome to the Plaguelands, hero. This is one of the most dangerous frontiers in Azeroth, with the looming threat of the Scourge to our east, and then even further still eastward from there. I am glad to hear that the call of duty and service to the Horde did not fall on deaf ears with you!\n\nIf you are ready to get your hands dirty, then there is plenty for willing and able heroes to do here on the edge of the Plaguelands."}
Q[10380]={d="$n，两个最危险的敌人已经结为同盟，而我们竟然一无所知！\n\n如果是占星者故意隐瞒这个消息的话，我并不会为此感到惊讶。但是，我们必须面对现实。燃烧军团已经和凯尔萨斯的日怒军团站到了同一阵线上。\n\n凯尔萨斯能够利用风暴要塞的科技，肯定和燃烧军团的恶魔有关。根据欧雷里斯的指示，我命令你立即消灭他们。",dEN="We've been so blind, <name>, that the alliance of two of our most dangerous enemies went completely unnoticed.\n\nI wouldn't be surprised if the Scryers had something to do with hiding this information from us, but we must now face the reality. The Burning Legion and Kael'thas' Sunfury army serve under the same banner.\n\nThese demons are the only reason Kael'thas was ever able to utilize the technology in Tempest Keep. Under Orelis's orders I must command you to destroy them.",o="图鲁曼的营地中的凯兰恩要你杀死6名甘尔葛迁跃修理师、3名命运之女和3名莫尔葛空间主宰。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Kaylaan at Tuluman's Landing in Netherstorm wants you to slay 6 Gan'arg Warp-Tinkers, 3 Daughters of Destiny and 3 Mo'arg Warp-Masters.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你完成任务了吗，$N？",pEN="Have you succeeded in your task, <name>?",c="那时就完成了。我们来这里，奉我们大师们的命令来猎杀它们。完全不留余地。\n\n有时会让你心存怀疑。",cEN="It is done then. We come here, hunt them down and slay them at the bidding of our masters. No quarter is given or expected.\n\nMakes you wonder sometimes."}
Q[10381]={d="我的使命已经结束。我一如既往地完成了欧雷里斯交代的所有指令。\n\n到此为止吧。凯尔萨斯和燃烧军团既已结为同盟，我想一场大屠杀——也就是所谓的远征即将拉开序幕。\n\n他们先是将我们圣地让给了敌人，现在还想让我们为保卫他们流血牺牲。请你回去转告欧雷里斯，从今以后让纳鲁亲自上阵作战吧。",dEN="My mission here is finished. I did what Orelis ordered me to - I've never failed to.\n\nNo more. I foresee a great carnage - a crusade, they'll call it - following the news of this alliance between Kael'thas and the Burning Legion.\n\nFirst they give our holiest city away to our enemies and then they ask us to die fighting their enemies. Go back to Orelis; tell him the naaru can fight their own fights from now on.",o="返回52区，向大主教欧雷里斯报到。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Report back to Exarch Orelis at Area 52.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",c="你带来的坏消息令我满心悲痛。我们两个协力抗敌，而最亲爱的沙塔斯之子却失去了他的方向。",cEN="The bad news you bring fills my heart with sorrow. Two of our deadliest foes join forces and one of the dearest sons of Shattrath has lost his way."}
Q[10382]={d="好吧，$n，希望你已经$g准备好:准备好;迎接我们行动的下一阶段。燃烧军团从不休息——我们也不能！骑上一只狮鹫飞到荣誉岗哨去，那是军团前线附近的一个小据点。\n\n去和布洛克元帅谈谈。你到那儿时他会给你指示。哦，替我向那个脸色苍白的舔盾货问声好。 |n",dEN="Well, <name>, I hope you're prepared for the next phase of our operation. The Legion never rests - and neither shall we! Take a gryphon and fly over to Honor Point - it's a small post near the Legion Front.\n\nSpeak with Field Marshal Brock. He'll have instructions for you when you arrive. Oh, and tell that pasty-faced shield-kisser I said 'hello'.",o="乘坐狮鹫飞往荣耀岗哨，抵达之后与巴洛克元帅谈一谈。",oEN="Take a gryphon to Honor Point and speak with Field Marshal Brock.",c="你好，$c。我很高兴那个粗暴的老矮人终于适时的派来救援了！",cEN="Well met, <class>. I'm glad that crusty old dwarf finally saw fit to send us some help!"}
Q[10384]={d="仔细查看你四周，这台传送器附近应该有一份复仇军数据单元。找到这份数据单元，取出里面的内容。\n\n然后立刻将它带回传送器面前！",dEN="Look around you, fleshling. Very close to this transponder should be an Ethereum data cell. Locate that data cell, open it, and retrieve the contents.\n\nBring it back to this transponder at once!",o="复仇军前沿基地中的复仇军发射器 - 塞塔所投射出来的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你带回复仇军数据单元。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - Ethereum Transponder Zeta - wants you to recover the Ethereum Data Cell.",p="你拿到数据单元了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the data cell?",c="<你将数据单元交出让阿米尔可以阅览这个计划。>\n\n没事……该死！他们是很聪明没错但是绝没有阿米尔那么聪明！\n\n我将要求你去做的事情非常危险。要是你不想继续的话我可以理解，凡人。",cEN="<You hold the data cell out so Ameer can read the plans.>\n\nNothing... Damn them! They're clever but not as clever as Ameer!\n\nWhat I'm about to ask you to do is quite dangerous. I'll understand if you don't want to continue, fleshling."}
Q[10385]={d="复仇军利用一种名叫传达者的东西在各个前线基地之间传递消息。\n\n想要发现并解读传达者携带的信息，只有一个办法。不幸的是，这样做很可能使你受到无可挽回的脑部损伤。\n\n如果你仍然有兴趣的话，就转至前线基地杀死复仇军虚灵，取出他们的精华。饮下虚灵精华后，你就能暂时看见复仇军传达者，精华的有效时间足以让你摧毁传达者并解读它携带的信息。",dEN="They're using relays to transfer information around the staging grounds.\n\nThere is only one way for you to see these relays and extract the information they hold. Unfortunately, doing so may cause you irreparable brain damage.\n\nIf you're still interested, you'll need to slay Ethereum here at the staging grounds and take their essences. Once you have an essence, drink it down. It will temporarily allow you to see an Ethereum relay - giving you enough time to destroy a relay and extract its information.",o="复仇军前沿基地中的复仇军发射器 - 塞塔所投射出来的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你带回15份复仇军中继数据。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - Ethereum Transponder Zeta - wants you to recover 15 pieces of Ethereum Relay Data.",p="你拿到中继数据了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the relay data?",c="复仇军之所以存在的原因现在完全了解了。\n\n复仇军不是到这里猎捕迪门修斯！他们想在这里操控虚无！\n\n他们在这个法力熔炉里操作虚无能量以结合他们自己的能量成为一种叫做奈萨斯潜猎者的生物。\n\n他们毫无疑问地使用一台原始加速器去完成转化过程。",cEN="The Protectorate's reason for existence is now fully realized.\n\nThe Ethereum are not here to hunt Dimensius! They are here to become void!\n\nThey are manipulating the void energy at this manaforge to bond their own energy into a creature known as a nexus-stalker.\n\nThey are undoubtedly using a proto-accelerator to complete the transformation."}
Q[10388]={d="希望你旅途愉快，$g朋友:朋友;。你外出时来了个信使——看来纳兹格雷尔又给你派了新差事。你最好回萨尔玛去见他。我总觉得军团才刚刚活动开筋骨。|n",dEN="Hope you enjoyed your flight, friend. A messenger arrived while you were away - seems Nazgrel's got a new use for you. You'd best head back to Thrallmar and check in with him. I have a feeling the Legion's just getting warmed up.",o="返回萨尔玛，与纳兹格雷尔交谈。|n",oEN="Return to Thrallmar and speak with Nazgrel.",c="喔，$n，你来的正是时候。我们的斥候已经发现，燃烧军团驻军在我们后方山坡上的其实是他们的“冶炼场”。那边就是燃烧军团的恶魔们用来制造他们的地狱火魔能机甲的地方。如果我们动作够快的话就可以瓦解他们的生产了！",cEN="Ah, <name>, you've come just in time. Our scouts have discovered that the Legion positions on the ridge behind us are actually 'forge camps'. It's there that the demons are constructing their infernal fel reavers. If we move against them quickly we can disrupt their production!"}
Q[10389]={d="你好，$n。我破译出了燃烧军团的信件，发现了这些恶魔进攻地狱火半岛的战略计划。似乎有一大群可怕的恐惧魔聚集在了西边的阿苟纳之池附近。我们绝对不能允许这样一支庞大的军队来攻击我们。你必须赶到那里去，杀掉那些该死的恶魔，削弱他们的力量。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. I've deciphered the Legion missive and uncovered the demons' strategic plans for this Peninsula. Apparently, there is a large group of hellish terrorfiends gathering near the Pools of Aggonar in the west. We cannot allow such a force to go unchallenged. You must go there and decimate their cursed numbers.",o="魔导师文森特·血鹰要你在阿苟纳之池杀掉10个恐惧魔。",oEN="Magister Bloodhawk wants you to kill 10 Terrorfiends in the Pools of Aggonar.",p="嗯，$C——你打败恐惧魔了吗？",pEN="Well, <class> - have the terrorfiends been defeated?",c="太棒了，$n。我就知道你会凯旋归来！军团的失败之日越来越接近了！",cEN="Bravo, <name>. I knew you would be victorious! The Legion's defeat draws ever nearer!"}
Q[10390]={d="$n，我们有理由相信最东边的铸魔营地尚未完工。军团的甘尔葛仆从正在昼夜赶工，想让那处设施尽快运转起来。我们绝不能让他们得逞。\n\n向东前往铸魔营地：天罚，杀死 10 名甘尔葛。把他们的主人——剃刀锯的头颅带给我，军团的地狱火铸造就要彻底停摆了！|n|n",dEN="<name>, we have reason to believe that the easternmost forge camp is not yet complete. The Legion's gan'arg servants are working 'round the clock to get the facility up and running. We can't allow that to happen.\n\nHead east to Forge Camp: Mageddon and slay 10 gan'arg. Bring me the head of their master - Razorsaw - and the Legion's fel reaver production will grind to a halt!",o="萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔命令你攻击铸魔营地：暴虐，杀死10个甘尔葛仆从，然后将剃刀电锯的徽记带回去交给纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Nazgrel in Thrallmar wants you to attack Forge Camp: Mageddon and kill 10 Gan'arg Servants and return with the head of Razorsaw.",p="快点，$c，我们得在这些恶魔建造完成前让该死的机器停工！",pEN="Move quickly, <class>, we've got to shut down Forge Camp: Mageddon before the demons finish its construction!",c="做得好，$c，那是我们需要担心的铸魔营地中较小型的一个。不过这会让军团花一些时间来恢复这些设备。你刚为我们争取到了我们缺乏的东西！",cEN="Well done, <class>, That's one less forge camp we'll need to worry about. It'll take the Legion a while to get that facility back up and running. You've just bought us the one thing we'd run out of - time."}
Q[10391]={d="还有第二处生产设施，铸魔营地：怒火，就在萨尔玛的正东北方。恶魔们沿着山脊布置了多门邪能火炮——而且全都直直对准了我们！你必须潜入营地，摧毁这些邪能火炮。\n\n$n，你一定要确保把它们全部引爆——否则谁也阻止不了军团把火雨地狱倾泻到我们头上！ |n",dEN="There is a second production facility, Forge Camp: Rage, that lies to the immediate northeast of Thrallmar. The demons have positioned a number of their fel cannons along the ridge - and they're aimed straight at us! You must enter the camp and destroy these fel cannons.\n\n<name>, you must be sure to detonate them all - or nothing will stop the Legion from raining fiery hell down upon our heads!",o="摧毁铸魔营地：狂乱中的3座邪能火炮I型，然后返回萨尔玛向纳兹格雷尔复命。",oEN="Destroy 3 Fel Cannon MKIs in Forge Camp: Rage and return to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",p="军团随时都有可能对我们发射，$N！你得去毁掉那些该死的火炮！",pEN="The Legion could start shelling us at any time, <name>! You need to destroy those blasted cannons!",c="我知道你很勇敢，$n，但这次你又一次突破了自己！我们听到那些可怜的火炮从这里爆炸！那应该可以让军团们学到别低估了杜隆坦之子！",cEN="I knew you had spirit, <name>, but you've outdone yourself this time! We heard those wretched cannons exploding from here! That should teach the Legion not to underestimate the Sons of Durotar!"}
Q[10392]={d="我们为你感到荣耀，$n。不过现在我们必须在燃烧军团恢复实力之前再给他们一次重击！萨尔玛的北边就是登陆场：歼灭，里面有一座传送门负责传送燃烧军团的增援军。\n\n你必须设法使它过载，把它炸成灰烬。开启传送门的钥匙在登陆场指挥官阿利萨玛尔身上。杀掉他，找到钥匙，用钥匙打开传送门后炸毁它。愿酋长祝福你。",dEN="You are an honor to us, <name>. But now we must strike before the Legion recovers! To the north of Thrallmar lies Invasion Point: Annihilator. It houses a warp-portal through which the Legion draws its reinforcements.\n\nYou must overload that portal - and blast it back to the abyss it came from. The portal's activation key will be held by the Point's commander - Warbringer Arix'Amal. Slay him. Take the key. Use it on the portal and do what must be done. May the warchief's blessings be with you.",o="杀掉阿利萨玛尔，找到燃烧军团传送门钥匙，利用它毁掉怨恨符文，然后返回萨尔玛向纳兹格雷尔复命。",oEN="Slay Arix'Amal to get the Burning Legion Gate Key. Use the Burning Legion Gate Key on the Rune of Spite, then return to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",p="快点，$n。传送门每开一秒就多一个邪恶的恶魔来到这个世界！",pEN="Hurry, <name>. Every second that warp-portal stands open, another foul demon is brought into this world!",c="赞美先祖，你做到了，！军团遭受了惨重的失败——萨尔玛再次安全了。啊，只要我有一百个像你这样有胆识又有谋略的战士，这片破碎的土地早就被驯服了！我向你致敬。\n\n<纳兹格雷尔干脆利落地向你敬礼> <Nazgrel te saluda tajantemente> $n",cEN="Praise the ancients, you've done it, <name>! The Legion has suffered a terrible defeat - and Thrallmar is safe once again. Ah, if I had but a hundred warriors with your heart and cunning, this broken land would be tamed already! I salute you.\n\n<Nazgrel salutes you crisply>"}
Q[10393]={d="纸条上的文字是一些晦暗难辨的潦草涂鸦。你越是盯着看，那些符号就越像是在你眼前扭曲、灼烧。萨尔玛只有一个人能解读如此邪恶的文字——血精灵法师鲜血之鹰。 |n|n",dEN="The text on the note is written in some dark, indecipherable scrawl. The more you stare at them, the more the symbols seem to twist and burn before your eyes. There is only one in Thrallmar that can transcribe such vile script - the blood elf Magister Bloodhawk.",o="将燃烧军团信件交给交给萨尔玛的魔导师文森特·血鹰。",oEN="Take the Burning Legion Missive to Magister Bloodhawk in Thrallmar.",p="我没有太多时间可以浪费，$c。这就是让你要烦我的东西吗？",pEN="I have little time to waste, <class>. What is this you pester me with?",c="你把这份文件带给我是对的。这可能是一份要求制造更多魔能机甲的命令——或者新的攻击计划！我需要一些时间才能解读这份命令。去吧。当我有更进一步的了解我会叫你来的。\n\n<在你转身离开的时候博学者血鹰对你点了点头。>\n\n你是一个行家，$n。我应该会很期待听到你的新事迹。",cEN="You were right to bring this to my attention. This could be a production order for additional fel reavers - or new attack plans! This will take some time to decipher. Leave me. I will summon you when I know more.\n\n<Magister Bloodhawk nods to you as you turn to leave>\n\nYou are a sharp one, <name>. I shall be watching your progress with interest."}
Q[10394]={d="仔细听好，$n。我们一直在侦察前方山脊沿线的军团营地。我们有理由相信，这些所谓的「铸魔营地」正是恶魔们建造那些该死的地狱火铸造机的地方。\n\n你能看到最近的目标，铸魔营地：天罚，就在西边。我们的情报显示它还处于建造之中。如果你能杀死甘尔葛仆从和他们的主人——剃刀锯，我们就能让军团的地狱火生产彻底停摆！ |n|n",dEN="Pay close attention, <name>. We've been surveying the Legion camps that lie along the ridge ahead. We have reason to believe that these so-called 'Forge Camps' are where the demons are constructing those blasted Fel Reavers.\n\nYou can see the closest target, Forge Camp: Mageddon, to the west. Our intelligence suggests that it's still under construction. If you can slay the Gan'arg Servants and their master - Razorsaw - we can bring the Legion's Fel Reaver production to a grinding halt!",o="杀掉铸魔营地：暴虐的剃刀电锯和10个甘尔葛仆从，然后返回荣耀岗哨向巴洛克元帅复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Gan'arg Servants and Razorsaw at Forge Camp Mageddon and return to Forward Commander Brock at Honor Point.",p="不要告诉我你害怕了，$C。要是他们完成了炼治场的兴建，你就有比那些魔能机甲更多需要担心的事！去吧！",pEN="Don't tell me your getting cold feet, <class>? If they finish construction on that Forge Camp, you'll have more to worry about than just those Fel Reavers! Get to it!",c="好吧，我必须说，我很感动，$n。我之前根本不认为你有勇气完成这个任务。做得好。真的做得很好。",cEN="Well, I must say, I am impressed, <name>. I didn't think you had the mettle for this mission. Well done. Well done, indeed."}
Q[10395]={d="纸条上的文字是一些晦暗难辨的潦草涂鸦。你越是盯着看，那些符号就越像是在你眼前扭曲、灼烧。荣耀堡只有一个人能解读如此古老的文字——德莱尼秘法师克里夫。\n\n把燃烧军团密信带给驻守在荣耀堡作战室的界缘占卜师克里夫。|n",dEN="The text on the note is written in some dark, indecipherable scrawl. The more you stare at them, the more the symbols seem to twist and burn before your eyes. There is only one at Honor Hold who can decipher such archaic script - the draenei mystic, Kryv.\n\nTake the Burning Legion Missive to Warp-Scryer Kryv who resides within the War-Room at Honor Hold.",o="将燃烧军团信件交给荣耀堡的位面占卜者克雷夫。",oEN="Take the Missive to Warp-Scryer Kryv in the main keep of Honor Hold.",p="这是什么，$c？我感觉你找到的东西说明了一场即将到来的灾难。",pEN="What is it, <class>? I sense you've found something that speaks of a coming doom.",c="你很幸运的拦截到了这封书信，$n。虽然这得花费我一点时间来解译，但我已经能够感受到从这份卷轴里发出的恨意及急迫。我担心军团对这片大陆的真正目的将会很快显露出来……\n\n给我一点时间辨认这个字迹。\n\n<位面占卜者克里夫开始阅读这份恶魔书信。>",cEN="It is fortuitous that you intercepted this missive when you did, <name>. Though it will take me some time to decipher, I can already sense the hatred and urgency woven into this scroll. I fear the Legion's true motives in this land will soon be made evident...\n\nGive me a moment to decipher this script.\n\n<Warp-Scryer Kryv begins to read the demonic missive>"}
Q[10396]={d="我们的第二个目标是铸魔营地：狂乱，它就在铸魔营地：暴虐的西边。但现在的问题是，恶魔们将许多邪能火炮直接瞄准了部落的前哨基地萨尔玛！尽管这听起来有些奇怪，但我们确实需要部落帮忙守住黑暗之门的战线。因此绝对不能让萨尔玛失守，你必须在燃烧军团击败我们的同伴之前毁掉这些火炮！",dEN="Now we focus on the second target - Forge Camp: Rage. It lies just west of Mageddon. Trouble is, the demons have a number of fel cannons aimed straight at the Horde's outpost of Thrallmar! Though I can scarcely believe it, we actually need the Horde to help us hold the line at the Dark Portal. We can't afford to let Thrallmar fall. You've got to destroy these cannons before the Legion pulverizes our allies!",o="摧毁铸魔营地：狂乱中的3座邪能火炮I型，然后返回荣耀岗哨向巴洛克元帅复命。",oEN="Destroy 3 Fel Cannon MKIs in Forge Camp: Rage and return to Field Marshal Brock at Honor Point.",p="军团随时都有可能开始炮轰部落，$N！你得摧毁那些该死的火炮！",pEN="The Legion could start shelling the Horde at any time, <name>! You need to destroy those blasted cannons!",c="我得承认，，你天生就是个战士！那些部落乡巴佬恐怕永远不知道他们离末日有多近。为了敌人挺身犯险，这需要真正的品格。正是这种荣誉与担当维系着联盟！\n\n<布洛克元帅干脆利落地向你敬礼。> $n $g你:你;",cEN="I have to hand it to you, <name>, you're a fighter born! Those Horde yokels may never know how close they came to the end. It takes real character to step in harm's way on behalf of your enemies. That's the kind of honor and commitment that holds the Alliance together!\n\n<Field Marshal Brock salutes you crisply.>"}
Q[10397]={d="我们找到了军团在山脊上的最后一处基地——入侵据点：歼灭者。它位于铸魔营地：怒火的西北方——里面有一座传送门，军团一直在通过它调集援军！\n\n你必须关闭那座传送门，阻止更多恶魔涌来。据点的领主，战争使者阿利克斯·阿玛尔，掌握着传送门的启动钥匙。从他手中夺过来，把那扇该死的门户彻底关上！ |n",dEN="Well, we've located the Legion's final base on the ridge - Invasion Point: Annihilator. It lies northwest of Forge Camp: Rage - and it houses a warp-portal through which the Legion has been drawing its reinforcements!\n\nYou've got to close that portal to prevent any more demons from coming through. The Point's overlord, Warbringer Arix'Amal, holds the portal's activation key. Take it from him and shut that blasted gateway down!",o="杀掉阿利萨玛尔，找到燃烧军团传送门钥匙，利用它毁掉怨恨符文。",oEN="Slay Arix'Amal. Take the Burning Legion Gate Key. Use the Burning Legion Gate Key on the Rune of Spite.",p="你关闭传送门了没，$n？当你在这拖拖拉拉的同时，就有更多的恶魔进入了外域！",pEN="You close down that war-portal yet, <name>? While you're here shuffling your feet, there are more demons entering Outland!",c="做得好！这应该会大大削弱那些试着想要悄悄偷袭我们的恶魔数量。感谢不足以表达我对你提供帮助的谢意，$n。",cEN="Great job! That should drastically cut down on the number of demons trying to creep up our backsides. I can't thank you enough for your help out here, <name>."}
Q[10399]={d="这正是我担心的。你先前杀死的那个恶魔阿利克斯·阿玛尔，是在为一位秘密的军团领主效力——残忍的阿莱兹。看来这个新恶徒已经在阿贡纳之池附近集结了一支地狱恐魔大军。\n\n你必须前往那里，在那群恐魔向我们发起进攻前消灭它们。但要当心，$g朋友:朋友;——阿贡纳之池坐落在一处饱受折磨的剧毒山谷中。那些被诅咒的池水就在此处西北，地狱火堡垒之外。\n\n愿圣光与你同在，$n。 |n",dEN="It is just as I feared. Arix'Amal - the demon you killed earlier, was working for a secret Legionlord - Arazzius the Cruel. It appears this new villain has amassed a force of hellish terrorfiends near the Pools of Aggonar.\n\nYou must journey there and slay the terrorfiends before they strike against us. But be wary, friend - the Pools of Aggonar lie within a tortured, poisonous valley. You can find the cursed pools to the northwest of here, beyond Hellfire Citadel.\n\nLight be with you, <name>.",o="在阿苟纳之池杀掉10个恐惧魔，然后向荣耀堡的位面占卜者克雷夫复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Terrorfiends in the Pools of Aggonar and return to Warp-Scryer Kryv in the main keep of Honor Hold.",p="我感觉到你心中一股日渐增长的黑暗，$C。你正视过你的恐惧吗？或是它还在阿苟纳之池那等待着你呢？",pEN="I sense a growing darkness within your heart, <class>. Have you faced your fear? Or does it still await you at the Pools of Aggonar?",c="我预见了这场伟大的胜利，$n。今日，神圣的纳鲁偏爱你。",cEN="I foresaw this great victory, <name>. The blessed naaru smile upon you this day."}
Q[10400]={d="尊敬的界缘占卜师已经告诉我你所冒的风险，$n，也向我讲述了你所发现的新敌人。如果克里夫所言不虚，这个「残忍的阿莱兹」的强大与邪恶，丝毫不亚于洛萨之子所面对过的任何敌人。\n\n$n，你现在愿意为我们挺身而出吗？你愿意直面这位军团领主，将圣光的正义降于他身吗？若愿意，你会在阿贡纳之池找到他。若不愿意，他的邪恶必定会先找上你。 |n",dEN="The honorable Warp-Scryer has told me of your perils, <name> - and of the new foe you've discovered. If Kryv is to be believed, this 'Arazzius the Cruel' is as powerful and evil as any foe the Sons of Lothar have ever faced.\n\nWill you stand for us now, <name>? Will you face this Legionlord and deliver the Light's justice upon him? If so, you will find him at the Pools of Aggonar. If not, his evil will most certainly find you.",o="在阿贡纳之池杀死残忍的阿莱兹，然后回到荣耀堡要塞向统帅达纳斯·托尔贝恩复命。|n",oEN="Slay Arazzius the Cruel in the Pools of Aggonar and return to Force Commander Danath Trollbane in the keep of Honor Hold.",p="告诉我，$N，任务完成了吗？军团领主被制伏了吗？",pEN="Tell me, <name>, has the deed been done? Has the Legionlord been vanquished?",c="赞美圣光，我就知道你可以的！阿拉休斯和他的爪牙被消灭了！军团很快就会滚回家，我们将再度的安全了。当正义被彰显，我们也就可以回家。\n\n谢谢你，$n——联盟及洛萨之子今日以你为荣！",cEN="Light be praised, I knew you'd do it! Arazzius and his minions are no more! Soon, we'll have the Legion running for home and this battered world will be safe once more. Then, when justice has been met, we can return home as well.\n\nThanks you, <name> - the Alliance and the Sons of Lothar honor you this day!"}
Q[10403]={d="或许残冠氏族还存有一线希望。被伊利达雷恶魔奴役之前，我是氏族的四名长者之一。我原本以为另外三位长者都已亡故，但后来才知道至少还有两人活着——他们跟我一样被囚禁起来，无力逃脱。\n\n至今我都没能找到纳拉杜的下落，我担心他可能遭遇不测。废墟顶部还有许多小屋，或许你可以去找找他。如果所有的残冠长者都活着，对我们的氏族而言将会是个天大的好消息。",dEN="Perhaps not all hope is lost for the Dreghood. I am one of four elders that guided this tribe before we were enslaved by the Illidari. I thought the others were dead, but I've slowly learned that at least two others are alive - chained down and powerless just as I am.\n\nI've not yet been able to find Naladu and fear for the worst. There are more huts in the ruins upstairs; perhaps you could look for him. It would be a great boon for our tribe if all our elders were alive.",o="转至沙纳尔废墟，寻找纳拉杜的下落。",oEN="Seek out Naladu inside the Ruins of Sha'naar.",c="你是来帮助我的部族的吗，$r？真不寻常。没有多少人会关心这块土地上的破碎者命运。",cEN="You've come to help my tribe, <race>? How unusual. There aren't many that care about the fate of the Broken in this land."}
Q[10405]={d="我们必须摧毁将复仇军的虚灵变异为节点猎手的特殊机器。但是这种机器是虚灵科技的产物，直接破坏原质加速器根本不起作用。我们得破坏那些传输魔法能量的管道。\n\n眼下还缺一份材料，没有它，我无法制造能使管道能量超负荷的设备。为了校准这台设备，我要你从尚未变异的虚灵执政官或主宰身上拿来他的裹布。",dEN="We must destroy the machinery that is making these nexus-stalker aberrations possible. To strike at their proto-accelerator would be futile as it is an ethereal creation. We must instead destroy the manaforge energy tube that they are using as a conduit.\n\nI have all that I need to create a device to overload the conduit save for one item. I need a wrapping from an archon or overlord that might be transforming soon in order to calibrate the device.",o="复仇军前沿基地中的复仇军发射器 - 塞塔所投射出来的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你带回1条精制复仇军裹布。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - Ethereum Transponder Zeta - wants you to recover 1 Prepared Ethereum Wrapping.",p="你拿到裹布了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the wrapping?",c="太好了！现在校准装置。",cEN="Excellent! Now to calibrate the device."}
Q[10406]={d="我要派一名爆破手去安放干扰装置。你只要确保他安放干扰器时不受伤害就行。\n\n保护好他！如果有敌人攻击他，他不会还手，因为他只是一个全息影像——但影像是可以被摧毁的！\n\n任务完成后回来找我。|n",dEN="I'm sending one of my demolitionists out to place the disruption device. Just make sure no harm comes to him as he's placing the disruptor.\n\nKeep him protected! He will not fight back if enemies attack him as he is only a holographic image but the image can be destroyed!\n\nReturn to me once the job is done.",o="复仇军前沿基地中的复仇军发射器 - 塞塔所投射出来的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你护送维序派爆破师转至法力熔炉：乌提斯的管道，并在他破坏时保护他的安全。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - Ethereum Transponder Zeta - wants you to escort the Protectorate Demolitionist to the Manaforge Ultris conduit and keep him protected while he works to sabotage the pipeline.",p="他一定得成功！",pEN="He must succeed!",c="感谢你，他们的计划泡汤了！现在只剩下一件事情……萨哈达尔。",cEN="Thanks to you, their plans are in ruin! Now only one thing remains... Salhadaar."}
Q[10407]={d="索克雷萨，这个声名狼藉的艾瑞达人统领着整个虚空风暴的燃烧军团部队。单是提起他的名字，就足以令大多数德莱尼人吓得发抖。索克雷萨驻扎在西北方的某座浮岛上，只有他最信任的军官才有资格与他会面。\n\n你必须夺得传送石才能进入那座浮岛，这可不是件容易的事。传送石的上半部在铸魔基地：湮灭的熔炉主管莫鲁格手中，而下半部则由铸魔基地：炼狱的希尔洛斯保管。",dEN="The infamous eredar, Socrethar, leads the Burning Legion in Netherstorm. Mentioning his name is enough to make most draenei shudder. He gives orders from an island in the northwest that only his most trusted lieutenants can access.\n\nTo get there you will need to obtain a teleportation stone, which won't be an easy task. The first half of the stone is in the possession of Forgemaster Morug at Forge Base: Oblivion. The second half is held by Silroth at Forge Base: Gehenna.",o="52区的学者卡尔亚要你从铸魔基地：湮灭的熔炉主管莫鲁格手中夺得索克雷萨之石的上半部，并从铸魔基地：炼狱的希尔洛斯手中夺得索克雷萨之石的下半部。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Anchorite Karja at Area 52 wants you to obtain the First Half of Socrethar's Stone from Forgemaster Morug at Forge Base: Oblivion and the Second Half of Socrethar's Stone from Silroth at Forge Base: Gehenna.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="你拿到索克雷萨之石了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained Socrethar's teleportation stone, <name>?",c="你对我们理想的奉献足以作为模范，$n。现在我们已经拥有了索克雷萨之石，只剩下一件事情需要去做。",cEN="Your dedication to our cause is exemplary, <name>. With Socrethar's teleportation stone in our possession only one thing remains to be done."}
Q[10408]={d="我这里还有一个扰流器，它能摧毁环绕着萨哈达尔的三根管道。一旦管道尽数被毁，萨哈达尔身上的保护力场就会消失。$n，那样的话，他会爆发出你前所未见的狂暴力量，你将与他展开激烈的战斗。\n\n如果你决意要铲除萨哈达尔，我就将这个扰流器交给你。",dEN="I have in my possession another disruptor, one capable of destroying the three conduits that surround Salhadaar. Once the conduits are destroyed, Salhadaar's protective force fields will be down. For this act, he will strike at you with a ferocity you have never before witnessed, <name>.\n\nIf you are willing to rid the world of Salhadaar, I will give you the disruptor.",o="复仇军前沿基地的复仇军发射器 - 塞塔中投射出来的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你使用维序派扰流器关闭萨哈达尔防御力场，然后杀死节点之王萨哈达尔。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - Ethereum Transponder Zeta - wants you to use the Protectorate Disruptor to bring down Salhadaar's force fields and then destroy Nexus-King Salhadaar.",p="他……他真的死了吗？被杀了？",pEN="Is... Is he really dead? Destroyed?",c="已经一千年了，或许更久，自从萨哈达尔开始他的圣战以消灭所有挡住他的事物。我几乎不能相信这是它的最后……你已经为我们所有人做了件伟大的事，$n，而为此你将被奖赏。",cEN="It has been a thousand years, maybe more, since Salhadaar began his crusade to exterminate all that would stand in his way. I can hardly believe that this is the last we'll see of him... You have done all of us a great service, <name>, and for that you will be rewarded."}
Q[10409]={d="在面对拥有强大力量的艾瑞达人时，以数量制胜恐怕是无稽之谈。他们的腐蚀力足以令凡人迅速堕落，只有意志最坚定的勇士才敢于面对这种挑战。\n\n召集你最亲密和最优秀的战友，带上这块传送石，转至位于铸魔基地：湮灭和铸魔基地：炼狱之间的登陆场：霸王。欧雷里斯和卡尔亚会在索克雷萨之座等你，我还会派阿德因一同去帮助你。\n\n圣光必胜，$n！让索克雷萨消亡吧！",dEN="When facing eredar of great power, large armies are useless for the most part. Their corruptive powers over mortal souls are such that only the strongest-willed can even stand face to face with them.\n\nTake this stone to the Invasion Point: Overlord, between Forge Base: Oblivion and Gehenna and bring your closest, strongest friends with you. Orelis and Karja will meet you at Socrethar's Seat; I will send Adyen along with them.\n\nMay the Light prevail today, <name>. May Socrethar meet his end.",o="高阶祭司伊沙娜要你转至虚空风暴西北角的军团传送控制器，利用它传送到索克雷萨之座，然后击败索克雷萨。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="High Priestess Ishanah wants you to go to the Legion Teleporter at the northwestern corner of Netherstorm and use it to teleport to Socrethar's Seat. Once there, defeat Socrethar.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="愿圣光与你同在，$C。",pEN="Light be with you, <class>.",c="完成了，$n。索克雷萨已经被消灭。\n\n我和其它人将自我们的伤口恢复，$n。但是，索克雷萨魔法的愤怒远非年轻的凯兰恩所能承受的。即使是我最强大的祷言也无法唤起他。\n\n那是不堪忍受的遗憾，一个如此年轻的人在战斗中阵亡。不过，最后他的强大意志能使它从军团的腐败中恢复，则是我们感到欣慰的地方。",cEN="It is done, <name>. Socrethar has been destroyed.\n\nI and the others will recover from our wounds, <name>. The wrath of Socrethar's magic was far too much for young Kaylaan, however. Not even my strongest prayer could raise him.\n\nIt is an unbearable pity that one so young would fall in battle. However, in the end his will was strong enough to recover from the Legion's corruption and we may find solace in that."}
Q[10410]={d="是时候面对索克雷萨了，$n。对我们来说，挑战艾瑞达人的领袖并不是一件容易的事。如果准备得不够妥当，那么任何微小的错误都会让我们付出生命的代价。\n\n带上索克雷萨的传送石，转至沙塔斯城的永恒圣光神殿，去找高阶祭司伊沙娜。她会告诉我们要如何应对当前的情况。",dEN="The time has come to face Socrethar, <name>. Confronting an eredar leader isn't something that's taken lightly among us. A single mistake is likely to cost us our lives if we're ill-prepared.\n\nTake Socrethar's teleportation stone to High Priestess Ishanah at the Shrine of Unending Light in Shattrath City. She will determine how we need to handle the situation.",o="返回沙塔斯城奥尔多高地的永恒圣光神殿，将索克雷萨的传送石交给高阶祭师伊沙娜。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Take Socrethar's Teleportation Stone to High Priestess Ishanah at the Shrine of Unending Light on the Aldor Rise in Shattrath City.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="什么困扰着你呢，孩子？",pEN="What troubles you, child?",c="索克雷萨……我记得那个名字。他曾经是一位着名的圣光战士，而骄傲是他唯一的瑕疵。",cEN="Socrethar... I remember that name. He was once a renowned warrior of the Light and pride was his only flaw."}
Q[10411]={d="你在法力熔炉的废墟四周可以发现大量从迪门修斯体内渗透出的流质。滴水的淤泥怪已经占据了乌提斯外围的池塘，池塘正下方就是复仇军的前线基地，基地中到处都是一种名叫空灵废弃者的流质生命体。\n\n要对付这些软泥怪，最好的办法就是用电磁冲击枪将它们轰成小水珠。利用这瓶药剂强化你的电流攻击能力吧，如此一来，那些软泥怪就会衰变成原始的形态。消灭那些水珠！",dEN="Around the ruined manaforge you will find the run-off of Dimensius's handy work. Seeping sludge occupies the pools that surround Ultris. Directly below those pools, where the Ethereum Staging Grounds now stand, you will find even more run-off in the form of void waste.\n\nThe best method of disposal is to use electro-shock to break slimes down to globules. Use this elixir to augment your attacks with electricity. The resultant discharge will break the slimes up into their raw form. Destroy the globules!",o="虚空风暴保护者哨站的调查员纳乌德要你摧毁 30 个虚空残渣球和 30 个渗漏淤泥球。|n",oEN="Researcher Navuud at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm has asked that you destroy 30 Void Waste Globules and 30 Seeping Sludge Globules.",p="淤泥怪和荒废者都带有极毒。如果不予理会的话，他们将形成凝结的虚无恐兽！",pEN="Both the sludge and waste are extremely toxic. They will form into a congealed void horror if left unchecked!",c="我希望不会太迟。你有发现附近或是在虚无荒废者被吸入的地区有任何异常的大型泥浆怪的出现？",cEN="I hope it's not too late. Did you notice any abnormally large slimes at or near the area where the void wastes drain into?"}
Q[10412]={d="凯尔萨斯·逐日者已将我们视为一个巨大的威胁，这早就不再是什么秘密了。让我们勇敢地面对他们吧，并不是所有银月城的辛多雷都愿意追随凯尔萨斯的。\n\n此外，我们与凯尔萨斯·逐日者之间的冲突也早已不只停留在文字与纸面上，这也不是秘密了。现在，占星者与凯尔萨斯的军队只要一见面就会交战。而你唯一向我们证明自身价值的方式，就是让我们分享你的力量，$n。\n\n凯尔的低阶追随者身上都带有用于标识其阶级的火翼徽记。将它们带回来给我。",dEN="It is no secret that Kael'thas Sunstrider perceives us as a great threat. Let's face it - not many sin'dorei, fresh from Silvermoon, are willing to join the sort of company that Kael keeps.\n\nIt's also no secret that this is not just a war of words. Scryers and the armies that serve Kael'thas attack each other on sight. The only way to prove you're with us, <name>, is to do your share of fighting.\n\nKael's lower ranking followers wear Firewing signets to indicate their rank. Bring them to me.",o="沙塔斯城的魔导师菲亚琳要求你给她带回10个火翼徽记。\n\n为占星者完成任务将会使你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Magistrix Fyalenn in Shattrath City wants you to bring her 10 Firewing Signets.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="继续，$n。请说。",pEN="Go on, <name>. Speak.",c="干得好，$n。看来你终究会是个有用的$g盟友:盟友;。",cEN="Well done, <name>. You might prove to be a useful ally after all."}
Q[10413]={d="你小心地将虚空软泥留下的泥浆装入瓶中。\n\n维序派哨站的研究员纳乌德一定会对此感兴趣的！快把这瓶虚空软泥带给他吧！",dEN="You carefully fill a vial with the fallen void horror's ooze.\n\nResearcher Navuud at the Protectorate Watch Post would be quite interested in such a find! Take it to him at once!",o="将一瓶虚空软泥交给虚空风暴维序派哨站的研究员纳乌德。",oEN="Take the Vial of Void Horror Ooze to Researcher Navuud at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm.",p="哇，你看起来有点脏……你是掉进什么地方里面？",pEN="Hrm, you look a bit dirty... What have you gotten yourself into?",c="什么！？你跟一个虚无恐兽交手？而且还活着？！难以置信！\n\n这个样品比等重的黄金还有价值，像这样的发现应该要好好奖励。",cEN="WHAT!? You faced off against a void horror? And lived?! Incredible!\n\nThis sample is worth its weight in gold. A find like this deserves a reward."}
Q[10414]={p="即使是最小的贡献也会被注意到，$n。我们的敌人很多，但是我们将战胜他们！",pEN="Even the smallest contribution to our cause is noted, <name>. Our enemies are many, but we shall prevail!",c="太好了……凯尔萨斯的部队人数持续缩减而我们的数目持续上升。\n\n<这个任务可以重复进行直到声望阶级达到尊敬。>",cEN="Yes... Kael's numbers continue to dwindle as our numbers continue to grow.\n\n<This quest can be repeated up to Honored reputation.>"}
Q[10415]={p="你最近为我们做了什么，$n？对凯尔萨斯的战争是不会自己开始的，你知道吗？",pEN="What have you done for us lately, <name>? The war against Kael'thas is not going to fight itself, you know?",c="太好了！反抗我们的人都将被消灭！\n\n<这个任务可以重复进行直到声望阶级达到尊敬。>",cEN="Excellent! All who oppose us will be crushed!\n\n<This quest can be repeated up to Honored reputation.>"}
Q[10416]={d="奥法宝典并不是一般的描写或记载奥术魔法相关内容的书籍，它们蕴涵着某种自身固有的能量。而我可以将这种能量吸收并转化，合成为一枚奥术符文。\n\n如果你在冒险的旅途中找到奥法宝典的话，可以把它带来给我，我愿意帮你将其转化成这种符文。只有最强大的施法者身上才会带着我所说的奥法宝典。而在外域，最强的施法者一般就是指凯尔手下的血精灵，但这也并不是绝对的。",dEN="Arcane tomes are not ordinary books that happen to deal with arcane matters. There is intrinsic power in them - a power I've learned to synthesize into a single arcane rune.\n\nShould you find an arcane tome in your travels I will give you one such rune. Only the most powerful wielders of magic carry the books I need. In Outland this usually means Kael's blood elves - but you'd be surprised by where such tomes often turn up.",o="沙塔斯城的先知沃雷塔尔要你取得一本奥术典籍。\n\n为占星者完成任务会降低你在奥尔多中的声望。",oEN="Voren'thal the Seer in Shattrath City wants you to obtain an Arcane Tome.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",p="你拿到秘法宝典了没，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained an arcane tome yet, <name>?",c="像许诺的那样，$n。秘典所有的自然力量，被浓缩成一个符文。",cEN="As promised, <name>. The entirety of the book's raw power, condensed into a single rune."}
Q[10417]={d="无论星界财团在何处搭建新营地，我们都会利用生态圆顶科技。你要知道，我们时常需要在环境恶劣的地方做生意，而生态圆顶的力场能为我们提供可控的、适合生物生存的大气环境。\n\n然而，虚空风暴中的那些暴戾的生命体和多变的气候已经开始毁坏用于维持生态圆顶的装置了，特别是那些我们部署在东边的力场发生器。我已经启动了诊断程序，希望能分析出修复损害的办法。你能帮我取回诊断报告吗？",dEN="Wherever the Consortium establishes a presence, we bring our eco-dome technology. The fields allow us to work in a controlled and life-sustaining atmosphere since we often find ourselves in hostile environments.\n\nNetherstorm's volatile conditions and creatures have begun to destroy the equipment that sustains our domes, especially the generator east of here. I've started a diagnostic there in hopes of understanding what can be done to combat the damage. Would you collect the results and bring them to me?",o="取回诊断报告，将它们交给中央圆顶哨站的玛尔达德。",oEN="Retrieve the Diagnostic Results and return them to Mehrdad at Midrealm Post.",p="你取得诊断报告了吗？",pEN="Did you get the diagnostic results?",c="<玛尔达德点头，然后检验诊断报告。>\n\n这真是令人烦恼。损害比我想象的更加严重。我能送一些工具到风暴尖塔去开始修理，但是那没用，除非我们能先将损坏设备的东西给隔离。",cEN="This is worrisome. The damage is much more severe than I believed. I can send to the Stormspire for some tools to begin repairs, but that's useless unless we've isolated what's damaging the equipment in the first place."}
Q[10418]={d="在这片区域收集装置损害的线索时，我在北边的小湖里发现了一些护罩发生器的残骸。我真不明白为什么鳄鱼会对这些设备感兴趣，但我们必须解决这个问题。\n\n星界财团对此的态度非常明确。如果要在装置和鳄鱼之间做出选择的话，那么让这些野兽去死吧。如果你能帮我解决它们，我是不会亏待你的。",dEN="In searching the area for clues about the damage to our equipment, I've seen pieces of the shield generators at the bottom of the small lake to the north. I'm not sure why the crocolisks have taken an interest in the equipment, but we have to put a stop to this problem.\n\nThe Consortium is quite clear on this matter. If it comes down to a choice between the equipment and crocolisks, the animals will have to go. I'll make it worth your while to deal with them.",o="中央圆顶哨站的玛尔达德要你杀死8条钩鳞鳄鱼。",oEN="Mehrdad at Midrealm Post wants you to kill 8 Barbscale Crocolisks.",p="你释放了那些动物的生命了吗？不要误解我，我真的是一个动物爱好者，不过不是当动物们把给予它们食物和庇护的人的手给咬掉的时候。",pEN="Have you put the creatures out of their misery? Don't get me wrong, I'm really an animal lover, but not when the animals are biting the hand that feeds and shelters them.",c="这地区已经看起来更清楚了。遮罩十分有用，但是主要缺点是他们在某些地方刺激繁茂的生长，加速当地生物种类的生长和发展。",cEN="The area's looking clearer already. The domes are quite useful, but the major drawback is the rampant growth they encourage in some places, accelerating the growth and proliferation of native species."}
Q[10419]={p="你拿到更多的秘法宝典了吗，$N？",pEN="Have you obtained any more arcane tomes, <name>?",c="包含在这本秘典里的力量是惊人的。然而一个纯正心灵的人却可以轻易的将它压缩成一个符文。",cEN="The power contained in this tome is tremendous. Yet it is easily condensed into a single rune by one with a clear mind."}
Q[10420]={d="这处神殿是外域最为神圣的地点之一。在这里，你可以感受到相当强大的圣光之力，即使是沾染了最邪恶的污迹的物品，也可以在这里得到净化。\n\n最近，你在与恶魔交战的时候，是否曾经获得一些邪能装备呢？把它们交给我，我可以利用圣光的力量将它们净化。",dEN="This temple is one of the holiest places in all of Outland. The power of the Light here is so strong, that even items with the strongest fel taint can be cleansed of a worldly item.\n\nShould you run into any fel armaments in your confrontations with demonic enemies, bring them to me and I will demonstrate the cleansing power of the Light.",o="将一套邪能装备交给沙塔斯城的伊沙娜。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring a Fel Armament to Ishanah in Shattrath City.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation to decrease.",p="你有拿到任何邪能装备没，$n？",pEN="Have you obtained any fel armaments yet, <name>?",c="看着当令人厌恶的物质瓦解时。看着当金属转为灰尘时。\n\n圣光净化全部事物，只剩下最纯净的躯体。",cEN="Watch as foul materials disintegrate. Watch as metal turns to dust.\n\nThe Light cleanses all and only the purest residue remains."}
Q[10421]={p="你今天有拿到任何邪能装备吗？让圣光消灭他们，$n。别让哪些污秽的生物残存在这世界上。",pEN="Have you run into any fel armaments lately? Let the Light do its work, <name>. Do not allow these foul objects to remain in this world.",c="将恶魔势力从这个世界除净。让圣光照耀大地。",cEN="The fel materials are removed from this world. Only the Light's residue remains."}
Q[10422]={d="十天前，泰拉留斯上尉带领一小队士兵去了南边的复仇军前沿基地，至今杳无音信。\n\n他们很可能遭到了伏击，说不定已经命丧敌手，但是我的仪器接收到了奇怪的信号。\n\n我认为是求援信号，但是这东西以前出过好几次差错，所以我们也不敢肯定。如果泰拉留斯还活着，他应该是被囚禁起来了。你必须设法营救他，或许牢笼的钥匙就在守卫身上。",dEN="Captain Tyralius took a platoon of soldiers south towards the Ethereum Staging Grounds 10 days ago. We haven't heard from him or his crew since.\n\nChances are good that they were ambushed and killed but I'm getting a curious reading from my instruments.\n\nI think it's a distress signal but these things have been wrong before. If Tyralius is still alive, they're keeping him in one of their prisons. You'll have to locate the prison and open it with a key, probably found on the warden.",o="虚空风暴保护者哨站的剥皮师维里迪乌斯要你找到并解救泰拉留斯上尉。|n",oEN="Flesh Handler Viridius at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm has asked that you find and free Captain Tyralius.",p="你找到泰拉里斯了吗？",pEN="Did you find Tyralius?",c="谢谢你，$n。泰拉里斯受到了严重的伤害，但是我想它应该可以称过去。\n\n他提及监狱的场所，很像你从中拯救他的那个。监狱充满来自整个宇宙的生物！\n\n当我们准备好可以突破它时，我们会进行联系。星界财团已经表示对派遣一些团队并且着手进行一些技术来突破复仇军的封锁感到兴趣。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. Tyralius suffered massive injuries but we think he's going to make it.\n\nHe mentioned fields of prisons, much like the one you rescued him from. Prisons full of creatures from all across the universe!\n\nWe'll be in touch should a need arise to crack those open. The Consortium has already expressed some interest in sending some teams out and is working on some technology to break through the Ethereum's locks."}
Q[10423]={d="首席技师贾巴尔很想知道诊断程序的结果。他要我们留意圆顶发生器的运行状况，如果力场变得越来越不稳定的话，力场产生的效果也会变得更加难以控制。这对我们和任何其它生活在圆顶下的生物来说都是一场灭顶之灾。\n\n贾巴尔就在风暴尖塔，从生态圆顶出发一路向北，越过桥梁就能看见风暴尖塔底部的升降机了。把诊断结果告诉贾巴尔吧。",dEN="Master Engineer Ghabar will want to know about the results of the diagnostics. If anything, they caution us to keep a close eye on the workings of our dome generators. As the fields become more and more unstable, their effects will become harder to control. It could spell disaster for our expedition and anything else housed within the domes.\n\nYou'll find Ghabar at the Stormspire. Just follow the road north from this eco-dome and across the bridge. It'll lead you to the elevator at the base of the spire.",o="与虚空风暴中风暴尖塔的贾巴尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ghabar at the Stormspire in Netherstorm.",c="<你介绍自己并且报告玛尔达德对遮罩领地的诊断报告。>\n\n玛尔达德仅仅是一位技师，但是他拥有观察入微之热心的眼睛。如果他的报告是正确的，那么我们将需要尽快诊断我们其余的遮罩生成器。",cEN="<You introduce yourself and report the results of Mehrdad's diagnostics at EcoDome Midrealm.>\n\nMehrdad is little more than a technician, but he possesses a keen eye for detail. If his observations are correct, then we'll need to take diagnostics at the rest of our dome generators as soon as possible."}
Q[10424]={d="如果玛尔达德的诊断结果正确无误——当然，我相信他不会犯错，那么生态圆顶要有大麻烦了。\n\n看来玛尔达德并没有查明造成这种状况的根本原因。以前也曾发生过生物损坏发生器的情况，但从来都没有这么严重过。\n\n为了安全起见，我打算派你去风暴尖塔的主圆顶发生器运行一次诊断程序，它就在最东端的苏瑟伦生态圆顶上。",dEN="If Mehrdad's results are correct -- and I have no reason to believe they're faulty -- then the rest of the domes could be in trouble.\n\nI do think Mehrdad has failed to identify the underlying cause of the failures. From time to time, creatures damage the generators, but never this severely.\n\nTo be on the safe side, I'd like for you to run a set of diagnostics at the Stormspire's main dome generator, located in Eco-Dome Sutheron at the very eastern edge of the dome.",o="在苏瑟伦生态圆顶发生器旁使用诊断设备，然后将诊断设备报告交给风暴尖塔的贾巴尔。",oEN="Use the Diagnostic Device while standing near the Eco-Dome Sutheron Generator and bring the Diagnostic Results back to Ghabar at the Stormspire.",p="你取得那些诊断报告了吗？",pEN="Did you get those diagnostics?",c="这些结果正好符合玛尔达德的猜测，但是为什么？我能想起的唯一可能解释是一些遮罩生成设备已经失效或者失踪。那将使遮罩明显地衰弱，并且失去平衡，正如诊断表明的。",cEN="These results match Mehrdad's exactly, but why? The only possible explanation I can think of is that some of the dome generation equipment has failed or gone missing. That would cause the domes to weaken significantly and fall out of balance as the diagnostics indicate."}
Q[10425]={d="感谢卡雷什！他差点把我撕成碎片！\n\n我是保护者部队的士兵，血肉之躯。大约 10 天前，我所在的排被派去执行侦察任务。当我们穿过这座岛屿上层的岩架时，一群以太人袭击了我们。至少我觉得是以太人。他们的能量颜色一样，但缠布看起来像是虚空。\n\n只有泰拉留斯活了下来。我想他们把他关进了牢房。\n\n我得赶回保护者哨站去！你能护送我回去吗？|n",dEN="Thank K'aresh! He would have torn me apart!\n\nI'm a Protectorate soldier, fleshling. My platoon was sent on a recon mission about 10 days ago. As we were moving across the upper ledges of this island, a group of Ethereum jumped us. At least I think it was Ethereum. They had the same energy color but their wrappings looked void.\n\nOnly Tyralius was spared. I think they put him in a prison cell.\n\nI've got to get back to the Protectorate Watch Post! Can you escort me back?",o="护送被俘虏的维序派前锋返回虚空风暴的维序派哨站。",oEN="Escort the Captured Protectorate Vanguard back to Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm.",p="嗯？",pEN="Yes?",c="<指挥官阿米尔露出高兴的表情。>\n\n做得好，新兵！这名士兵可能是攻下复仇军行动的主要关键。",cEN="<Commander Ameer appears pleased.>\n\nWell done, fleshling! This soldier might be the key to taking down the Ethereum's entire operation."}
Q[10426]={d="看看周围，$c！很神奇吧？生命体难以置信地在复苏！虽然这是虚灵的生态圆顶的副产品，但你想想，如果远征队也能掌握这种科技，那将会发挥多大的效用。\n\n我准备和这些虚灵好好协商，看能不能获得这项技术。不过，我想要更直观地了解它对植株的影响力。\n\n这是我制造的调节器，它能将圆顶的能量集中照射在那些鞭笞者身上。你愿意帮我做这项实验，然后告诉我结果吗？",dEN="Just look around you, <class>! Isn't it amazing? Of course, this incredible resurgence of life is a byproduct of the ethereal domes, but imagine what it could do in the hands of the expedition.\n\nI'm preparing to negotiate with the ethereals for access to their technology, but I'd like to get a better idea of its effects on plant-based life.\n\nI've built a device to concentrate the dome's energies on the lashers in this area. Would you be so kind as to test it for me and share the results?",o="对法兰伦鞭笞者使用能量力场调节器并观察实验结果，进行10次实验后返回风暴尖塔，向欧瑞恩·月焰汇报情况。",oEN="Use the Energy Field Modulator on Farahlon Lashers. Observe the results and report back to Aurine Moonblaze at the Stormspire when you have conducted 10 tests.",p="你有试着去集中遮罩的能量吗？",pEN="Did you try focusing the dome's energy?",c="喔我的天！集中遮罩的能量似乎会持续加快它的成长并使它产生强大的侵略性。如果我们真的获得使用这项技术的能力，我们必须确定要正确地校验它。",cEN="Oh my! Focusing the dome's energy seems to continue accelerating growth to the point where it breeds extreme aggression. If we do get the ability to use this technology, we have to be sure to calibrate it correctly."}
Q[10427]={d="你在鞭笞者身上进行的实验取得了令人惊愕的结果，但我还想确认它对动物是否同样有效。\n\n从生态圆顶中的塔布羊身上收集一些信息吧，我想这比研究鞭笞者更为有效。\n\n你可以利用这个标记器，催眠并标记生命力衰弱的塔布羊，便于我追踪它们的生长状况。但是标记器对活蹦乱跳的塔布羊可不起作用，你得先令它们耗尽精力。",dEN="Your work with the lashers turned up some astounding information, but I wonder if it holds true for animals as well.\n\nGathering information on the talbuks that live underneath this dome is going to be trickier than studying the lashers, I'm afraid.\n\nUsing this tagging device, you can put a weakened talbuk to sleep and apply a tag that I'll use to track the animal as it matures. The tagging mechanism won't work unless the talbuk has expended most of its energy.",o="为风暴尖塔的欧瑞恩·月焰标记12只塔布羊。你可以使用塔布羊标记器来标记雄性塔布羊和雌性塔布羊。",oEN="Tag 12 Talbuks for Aurine Moonblaze at the Stormspire. You may tag either Talbuk Sires or Talbuk Does using the Talbuk Tagger.",p="你替足够的塔巴克贴上标记了吗？",pEN="Were you able to tag enough of the talbuk?",c="做得好。我将密切注意那些你加上标示的，并且看看是否他们与遮罩里其它生命成熟的一样迅速。\n\n只要控制得适当，我们能使用这技术去使外域和艾泽拉斯被毁坏的地区恢复生机。",cEN="Excellent work. I'll keep a close eye on the ones you tagged and see if they mature as quickly as the other lifeforms in the dome.\n\nWith the proper control, we could use this technology to regrow the ruined areas of Outland and Azeroth."}
Q[10428]={d="我们这位身负重伤的客人发了高烧，似乎还做了噩梦。她在说梦话的时候提到了一位名叫库雷的渔夫，这位渔夫似乎就在秘蓝岛西南海岸外的秘银岛上。\n\n这里事情很多，乱作一团，恐怕没有人能够去那边一探究竟了，但我仍然有一点担心。或许你能帮上忙，$n？",dEN="In the fevered dreams of our injured guest, she spoke of a fisherman, Cowlen, who was in some distress at Silvermyst Isle, to the southwest, off the coast of Azuremyst.\n\nWith all that has been happening, no one has had the opportunity to look into it, but I do feel a bit of worry. Perhaps there's something you can do, <name>?",o="在秘银岛东南角正对秘蓝岛海岸边的码头上找到库雷。",oEN="Find Cowlen at the southeast docks of Silvermyst Isle off the coast of Azuremyst.",c="我的家人……我做了什么……我怎么会这样做？\n\n为什么要这样惩罚我？",cEN="My family... What have I done... What could I have done?\n\nWhy must I be punished so?"}
Q[10429]={d="圆顶科技竟然如此强大！当然，$n，我们不能毫无节制地滥用这种力量。\n\n如果生物生长得过于旺盛，肥沃的土地将因此变得贫瘠。\n\n谣传东边池塘中就生活着这种巨型生物，据说有的虚灵商人无聊时就利用那些大型多头怪进行狩猎娱乐。我想要进一步了解这种过度生长的生物，你能取回它的心脏供我研究吗？",dEN="The dome technology possesses such power! Certainly, there are bounds beyond which we dare not go, <name>.\n\nCreatures allowed to grow too large or too fast could be just as bad as a barren landscape.\n\nI have heard rumors of just such a creature in the pool to the east. I've heard the ethereal merchants conspiring to catch the overgrown hydra for sport, but I have another purpose in mind for the giant. Bring me the creature's heart so I may study it.",o="风暴尖塔的欧瑞恩·月焰要你取回一颗巨大的多头怪之心。",oEN="Aurine Moonblaze at the Stormspire wants you to bring her a Hulking Hydra Heart.",p="你从那个巨大的海蛇身上取得样本了吗？",pEN="Did you get the sample from the monstrous hydra?",c="<阿鲁尼收下那颗心。>\n\n就算是那种尺寸的生物，这个心也太大了。它努力跟上生物的庞大身体。我怀疑它可能在达到正常寿命的一半之前就死了。\n\n即使这样做有很大的风险，我决定说服星界财团分享他们的技术。现在有太多承诺要放弃。",cEN="Even for a creature of that size, this heart is far too large. It struggled to keep up with the creature's gigantic body. I have little doubt it would've died before reaching half its normal lifespan.\n\nEven with such risks, I'm determined to convince the Consortium to share their technology. There's too much promise here to give up now."}
Q[10430]={d="我一直在研制便携式的发生器维修包，供星界财团在气候恶劣的地区使用。虽然当前的设计并非为虚空风暴定制的，但我想问题应该不大。\n\n我准备派一批最优秀的技师在虚空石西边方的边缘生态圆顶对它进行测试。将维修设备交给塔沙尔吧，他知道如何使用它。如果效果不错的话，我们就利用维修包来强化大型生态圆顶的护罩发生器。",dEN="I've been working on a portable generator repair kit for use in some of the harsher climates that the Consortium operates in. Granted, it wasn't designed for Netherstorm, but we shouldn't have any problems with it.\n\nI had already scheduled a test with one of my best techs up at Eco-Dome Farfield beyond the Netherstone to the northeast. Take this prototype to Tashar. He'll know what to do with it. If it works, we can use it to reinforce the shield generators at the larger domes.",o="将实验维修设备交给虚空风暴边缘生态圆顶的塔沙尔。",oEN="Bring the Repair Apparatus to Tashar at Eco-Dome Farfield in Netherstorm.",p="看来你已经取得原型了。是贾巴尔派你来的吗？",pEN="It looks like you've got the prototype. Did Ghabar send you?",c="这个东西看起来有点奇特。贾巴尔绝对不是为了虚空风暴而制造这个东西。\n\n别露出惊讶的表情，$n。跟我们在其它工作的环境比较起来虚空风暴的环境算是温和的了。然而一个失败的遮罩总是会令人担心。",cEN="This looks a little peculiar. Ghabar definitely didn't have Netherstorm in mind when he designed it.\n\nDon't look so surprised, <name>. Netherstorm is tame compared to some of the environments I've worked in. Nevertheless, a failing dome is always a concern."}
Q[10431]={d="日怒军团的简报足以证明凯尔萨斯在建设和运行法力熔炉的过程中接受了外界的帮助。究竟是谁在暗地里支持凯尔依然是个谜，但是我们可以在法力熔炉：艾拉找到答案。\n\n我已经派出人手侦察那一带的情况。转至北边的图鲁曼的营地，与凯兰恩谈一谈。看看他在法力熔炉：艾拉有什么发现。一定要揪出暗中协助日怒军团的家伙。",dEN="The Sunfury briefings support the theory that Kael'thas has been receiving outside help in constructing and running these manaforges. Who this is remains a bit of a mystery, though we're likely to find out in Manaforge Ara.\n\nI've sent a group of my men to scout the surrounding area. Go to Tuluman's Landing, north of here, and speak to Kaylaan. See what he's discovered at Manaforge Ara. Find out who is assisting the Sunfury army and take care of them.",o="转至52区以北的图鲁曼的营地，与凯兰恩谈一谈。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务将降低你在占星者阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Go to Tuluman's Landing, north of Area 52, and speak to Kaylaan.\n\nPerforming quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",c="奥雷利斯就派了你一个来帮忙？他一定相当看重你。我们快把这事了结吧。",cEN="You're all the help Orelis is sending? He must think very highly of you.\n\nLet's get this over with."}
Q[10432]={d="你大概也注意到了，法力熔炉：艾拉遍布着燃烧军团的仆从。凯尔萨斯已经与燃烧军团结为盟友。他定然察觉到伊利丹堕入了疯狂的边缘，对魔法的渴求促使他投靠燃烧军团麾下。\n\n如果此事证据确凿，那么这支实力雄厚的联合军队可不容小觑。占星者已经得到确切消息，称法力熔炉的燃烧军团将士们都听从凯尔萨斯的指挥。\n\n将凯尔萨斯的命令交给萨罗迪恩吧。",dEN="As you may have noticed, there are servants of the Burning Legion all over Manaforge Ara. Kael'thas has entered an alliance with the Burning Legion. He must've caught wind of Illidan's descent into insanity and switched paymasters accordingly.\n\nIf the Scryers get definite proof of this, it will give them a considerable political advantage. I know for a fact that the Legion forces at this manaforge have orders that bear Kael's seal.\n\nGet these orders and bring them to Thalodien.",o="从法力熔炉：艾拉的恶魔手中夺得8份凯尔萨斯的命令，将它们交给52区的间谍大师萨罗迪恩。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Obtain 8 Orders from Kael'thas from demons at Manaforge Ara and bring them to Spymaster Thalodien in Area 52.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation to decrease.",p="喔？萨洛迪恩有说什么吗？",pEN="Well? What did Theledorn have to say?",c="这是一件大事，$n。非常大！\n\n沃雷塔尔将会想要尽快听到这事。",cEN="This is big, <name>. Very big!\n\nVoren'thal is going to want to hear about this as soon as possible."}
Q[10433]={d="虚灵都是聪明而机警的家伙，因此我不得不伪装成普通的毛皮商人。事实上我是52区的商业间谍，奉命来到这里评估他们搭建生态圆顶的科技。\n\n我需要你的帮助，$c。你看，必要的时候，我们就会利用非地精的间谍。\n\n我要你伪装成猎手，给我弄些锋牙山猫的毛皮回来，中央生态圆顶内到处都是这种山猫。",dEN="The ethereals are clever and very observant, so it's no accident that I'm here posing as a simple furrier. In fact, I've been sent from Area 52 to appraise the technology the ethereals use to generate their eco-domes.\n\nI'd like to enlist your help, <class>. We've been asked to use non-goblin agents whenever possible.\n\nWhat I want you to do is bring me a number of ripfang lynx pelts in the guise of a hunter. You can find the lynxes all over Eco-Dome Midrealm.",o="为中央圆顶哨站的舒利·波尔带回10张锋牙山猫的毛皮。",oEN="Bring 10 Ripfang Lynx Pelts to Shauly Pore at Midrealm Post.",p="<舒利提高了声量以吸引那里的虚灵组织注意。>\n\n有任何毛皮要卖的吗？",pEN="Have any pelts to sell me?",c="<舒利对你带回来的毛皮露出赞叹的表情。>\n\n这些毛皮品质太好了，真的太棒了！我愿意付给你最高的价钱！多少钱才可以让你继续维持这种服务呢？",cEN="These are magnificent, utterly magnificent! I'll pay you top coin for these! How much to retain your services?"}
Q[10434]={d="干得不错。\n\n<舒利对你眨了眨眼睛。>\n\n我想这样他们就会相信我是普通的皮毛商人了。现在我要派你去联络我在风暴尖塔的同伴，虚灵应该不会对你起疑心的。\n\n去风暴尖塔寻找粗暴的贾森和针眼奥蒂吧。他们会告诉你所有你需要知道的事情。就说是舒利派你去的。",dEN="Excellent job.\n\n<Shauly winks at you.>\n\nI think they're buying it. Now, when I send you up to speak with my associates at the Stormspire, there won't be any suspicion at all.\n\nYou'll want to look for Action Jaxon and Audi the Needle up there. They'll tell you everything you need to know. Tell 'em Shauly sent you.",o="与虚空风暴中风暴尖塔的针眼奥蒂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Audi the Needle at the Stormspire in Netherstorm.",c="<你自我介绍，并且告诉奥蒂是舒利派你来的。>\n\n啊，是呀，我们一直希望有人能帮上忙，呃——帮忙搬动一些，嗯，商品。",cEN="<You introduce yourself and tell Audi that Shauly sent you.>\n\nAh, yes, we've been expecting someone to help us, err move some, uh, merchandise."}
Q[10435]={d="<奥迪环顾四周，然后压低了声音。>\n\n我相信肖莉已经跟你讲过一些我们在这里的工作。当贾克森和我在野外「狩猎」时，我们一直在收集虚灵生态穹顶发生器的部件，并把它们藏在我们猎物的巢穴里——生态穹顶远野的迅猛龙巢穴。\n\n那是风暴尖塔东北方的一处偏远地带，靠近虚空石。我想你在那儿不会遇到太多虚灵，但你愿意帮我们收集穹顶发生器的部件吗？\"\" $g你:你;",dEN="<Audi looks around and then lowers her voice.>\n\nI'm sure Shauly told you a bit about our work here. When Jaxon and I are out in the field 'hunting,' we've been collecting pieces of the ethereal eco-dome generators and hiding them in the nests of our prey, the raptors in Eco-Dome Farfield.\n\nIt's a remote area to the northeast of the Stormspire, close to the Netherstone. I don't anticipate you'll run into many ethereals there, but would you be willing to help us collect the dome generator pieces?",o="风暴尖塔的针眼奥蒂要你取回10块掩码生成器碎片。",oEN="Audi the Needle at the Stormspire wants you to bring her 10 Dome Generator Segments.",p="你收集到所有东西了吗？",pEN="Did you collect everything?",c="做得好！计划里最难的部分已经完成了。现在，所有我们需要的是如何将这些带回到52区的方法，并同时吸引塞纳里奥探险队的兴趣。这里应该足够我们自己的需要，加上一点额外的利润。",cEN="Excellent work! The most difficult part of the project is done. Now, all we need is a way to get these back to Area 52 and attract the interest of the Cenarion Expedition as well. There should be enough here for our own needs and to earn a little profit on the side."}
Q[10436]={d="我们必须首先确保这片区域没有其它干扰因素才能进行实验。我是指那些过度生长的蜥蜴类的生物。\n\n<塔沙尔指了指远处的镰牙迅猛龙。>\n\n如果它们在发生器充能时突然冲上去咬一口，天知道会发生什么事。在我担任技师的这些年里，见过不少诡异的事情，例如目睹某些可爱的小动物成长为异型怪兽。",dEN="Before we can begin the test, we have to make certain the area is clear of anything that might interfere. In our case, that means these overgrown lizards.\n\n<Tashar gestures toward the scythetooth raptors.>\n\nThere's no telling what might happen if one those decides to take a nice bite out of the generator while it's charging. I've seen a lot of strange things in all my years as a technician, including more than a few abominations that had their beginnings as humble animals.",o="边缘生态圆顶的塔沙尔要你杀死12只镰牙迅猛龙。",oEN="Tashar, stationed at Eco-Dome Farfield, wants you to kill 12 Scythetooth Raptors.",p="你把测试区域清除了吗？",pEN="Have you cleared the test area?",c="做得好。看起来一切都就绪了。我们准备要开始了。",cEN="Well done. It looks like everything is in order. We're ready to begin."}
Q[10437]={d="虚空领主迪门修斯利用法力熔炉：乌提斯顶部的虚空裂隙进入了我们的世界。这处裂隙使得迪门修斯能在物质世界和扭曲虚空间自由穿行，免疫一切物理伤害。如果我们能切断空灵管道的能量流，迪门修斯将被困在这个位面，再也无法进行相位变换。那样的话，我们就能轻而易举地消灭它了。\n\n要完成这个计划，我们需要你从迪门修斯创造的虚空生物身上收集一些来自虚空领主本体的碎片。",dEN="Atop Manaforge Ultris lies the tear in the nether that the void lord, Dimensius, came through. That tear provides Dimensius with a link to the void, rendering him immune to physical harm. If we can get a lock on the conduit that Dimensius is using to keep himself phased out of this plane of existence, we can destroy it and then destroy Dimensius.\n\nTo do this, we're going to first need you to collect fragments of Dimensius from the void creatures that he sends out to do his dirty work.",o="虚空风暴维序派哨站的达比雷教授要你取回8块迪门修斯的碎片。",oEN="Professor Dabiri at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm wants you to recover 8 Fragments of Dimensius.",p="你收集到足够的碎片了吗？",pEN="Have you collected enough fragments?",c="太好了。有了这些碎片，我们就能校准一颗炸弹摧毁乌提斯上面的虚无导线。随着虚无导线的摧毁，迪门修斯将无法与虚无连结并变得毫无防御！",cEN="Excellent. With these fragments, we can calibrate a bomb that will destroy the void conduit atop Ultris. With the void conduit destroyed, Dimensius's connection with the void will be severed and he will be left defenseless!"}
Q[10438]={d="给，。拿着这个相位干扰器，上坐骑！保护者部队的虚空幼龙会把你送到离乌尔特里斯足够近的地方，好让你把干扰器投到虚空导管上。\n\n尽可能多地投下干扰器炸药，确保彻底湮灭！\n\n准备好后，去和虚空幼龙交谈，它会带你上去。\n\n如果你偏离了目标，就得先回来找我多拿些炸弹才能再上去。 $n $g你:你;",dEN="Here it is, <name>. Take this phase disruptor and mount up! The Protecotrate nether drake will fly you close enough to Ultris so that you can drop the disruptor on top of the void conduit.\n\nDrop as many disruptor charges as possible to ensure complete annihilation!\n\nWhen you are ready, speak with the nether drake and he'll take you up.\n\nIf you miss the mark you will have to get more bombs from me before you can go up again.",o="虚空风暴保护者哨站的达比雷教授要你在进入乌尔特里斯顶端虚空导管的射程后使用相位干扰器。尽可能多地投下相位干扰器炸药以确保彻底湮灭。只要你靠得足够近、能够使用它，相位干扰器炸药就会自动锁定虚空导管。\n\n若你成功，就回去见达比雷教授！|n",oEN="Professor Dabiri at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm wants you to use your Phase Disruptor when you get in range of the Void Conduit that rests atop Ultris. Drop as many charges of the Phase Disruptor as you can to ensure total annihilation. The Phase Disruptor charges will automatically home in on the Void Conduit so long as you are close enough to use it.\n\nReturn to Professor Dabiri should you succeed!",p="你击中目标了吗？",pEN="Did you hit the mark?",c="出击的时候到了！随着裂隙消失，迪门修斯的身体及魔力上变得不堪一击！",cEN="The time to strike has come! With the tear gone, Dimensius is vulnerable to physical and magical attacks!"}
Q[10439]={d="你的英勇举动迫使阿米尔做出了反应！他派出了赛义德上尉和复仇者！\n\n现在只剩下一件事：摧毁迪门修斯。\n\n你准备好时，我就召唤赛义德。如果他眼下没有在别处作战，他会在那里等候你的命令——就在此处正东方。\n\n等你准备好开战时告诉他，他就会率部行动！\n\n祝你好运，血肉之躯！我们追猎迪门修斯已经追了上千年！ $g你:你;",dEN="Your brave actions have forced Ameer to react! He has deployed Captain Saeed and the Avengers!\n\nNow all that is left to do is destroy Dimensius.\n\nWhen you are ready, I will call for Saeed. If he is not currently fighting another battle, he will be awaiting orders from you - directly east of here.\n\nLet him know when you are ready to fight and he will put his troops in motion!\n\nI wish you luck, fleshling! We have hunted Dimensius for a thousand years!",o="虚空风暴维序派哨站的达比雷教授要你与萨义德上尉谈一谈，然后跟随他的军队转至法力熔炉：乌提斯，杀死诸界吞噬者迪门修斯！",oEN="Professor Dabiri at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm wants you to speak with Captain Saeed and then follow his army to Manaforge Ultris and kill Dimensius the All-Devouring!",p="虚无领主怎么样了？",pEN="What of the void lord?",c="一千年来，我们知道的就是战斗。我们已经保护我的人民以免遭受虚无生物及虚灵组织同类的攻击。\n\n现在，我们憎恨的敌人之一已经死亡了——终于。\n\n我致上十亿名虚灵组织的感谢，凡人。",cEN="For a thousand years, all we have known is conflict. We have defended our people from the attacks of both void creature and ethereal alike.\n\nNow, one of our most hated enemies lies dead - finally.\n\nI give you the thanks of a hundred million ethereals, fleshling."}
Q[10440]={d="实验非常成功！我们可以利用这台装置进行生态圆顶的修复作业了。\n\n返回风暴尖塔汇报实验结果吧，告诉贾巴尔我已查明引发掩码生成器运行故障的基本原因。$n，数座生态圆顶护罩发生器的重要功能单元都不翼而飞。这不是意外事件，也绝对不是技术故障。换句话说，我们遭窃了。",dEN="The test was a resounding success! We can certainly use this device to start repairing the domes.\n\nCarry word of the test results to the Stormspire and let Ghabar know that I've also found a pattern in the damage to the shield generators. Key pieces of generator units have gone missing from a number of sites. This is no accident, <name>, no technological failure. We're being stolen from.",o="返回虚空风暴中的风暴尖塔，与贾巴尔谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Ghabar at the Stormspire in Netherstorm.",c="我会让我的技师马上去修复这些机器。\n\n不过，塔沙尔对于仪器损坏的怀疑让我忧心。我不认为有任何人那么大胆敢来偷我们的机器。至少没有人知道我们有这种技术。或许是闭锁风暴尖塔的时候了。",cEN="I'll have my techs get to work on those repairs right away.\n\nTashar's suspicion of sabotage worries me, though. I can't think of anyone who would be bold enough to steal our technology. Not anyone who knows what we're capable of, anyway. It may be time to lock down the Stormspire."}
Q[10442]={d="$C，有一个叫塞安·红鬃的牛头人需要我们的帮助。她现在跟塞纳里奥远征队在一起，驻扎在通往赞加沼泽的道路南边的一处规模岗哨里。\n\n你看到棘牙岭以后，就基本上已经到达那处岗哨了。\n\n你愿意到那里去看看她需要什么帮助吗？我不想为了这一点点小事打扰到游侠队长维恩雷大人。",dEN="<class>, there's some tauren by the name of Thiah Redmane that keeps pestering us for assistance. She's with the Cenarion Expedition, and they've setup a little post just to the west on the south side of the the road leading to Zangarmarsh.\n\nIf you hit Thornfang Hill, you've gone too far.\n\nDo you think you might head over there and see what she needs? I don't want to have to bother Ranger Captain Venn'ren with such trivialities.",o="驯鹰者德蕾娜·河风要你转至地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，帮助塞安·红鬃。",oEN="Falconer Drenna Riverwind wants you to offer your services to Thiah Redmane at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="喔，天啊，你一定就是我几个星期前从猎鹰岗哨请求协助的帮手吧。\n\n好吧，你现在来了，有很多事要做。我要你从这件开始做。",cEN="Oh, goodness, you must be the help I requested weeks ago from Falcon Watch.\n\nWell, you're here now and there's a lot to be done. I have just the thing to start you out."}
Q[10443]={d="艾泽拉斯的塞纳里奥议会也派了一支远征队到外域来。据我了解，他们应该是来调查这里的环境，并同时试图挽救这里所遭受的生态危机。\n\n他们当前驻扎在西面，在通向赞加沼泽的道路南侧创建了一处小规模的岗哨。\n\n走到棘牙岭附近，你就可以看到他们的岗哨了。\n\n你愿意去那里看看能否帮上什么忙吗？与塞安·红鬃谈一谈吧，就是她来向找我们寻求帮助的。",dEN="The Cenarion Circle has sent an expedition to Outland and, as I understand it, they are here to study what has happened and to help reverse any damage that they can.\n\nThey've setup a little post just to the west on the south side of the road leading to Zangarmarsh.\n\nIf you hit Thornfang Hill, you've gone too far.\n\nWould you please go and see how you might help them? Speak with Thiah Redmane as she is the one that sent the request to us for assistance.",o="智者阿曼恩要你转至地狱火半岛的塞纳里奥哨站，帮助塞安·红鬃。",oEN="Amaan the Wise would like for you to offer your services to Thiah Redmane at the Cenarion Post in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="喔，天啊，你一定是我对塔哈玛特神庙提出要求而来的帮手。\n\n我很高兴你来了，我们有很多事情要做，而且我这里刚好有样东西可以帮助你开始着手。",cEN="Oh, goodness, you must be the help that I requested from the Temple of Telhamat.\n\nI'm glad that you're here; there's a lot to be done, and I have just the thing to start you out."}
Q[10444]={d="必须立即采取行动！\n\n我要你跟火翼岗哨前线附近的米利迪安中尉谈谈。他应该知道我们下一步该怎么做。\n\n去吧，向奥蕾莉亚岗哨外的米利迪安中尉报到并汇报眼下的局势。岗哨位于此地东北方，就在火翼岗哨以南那条河流的南岸。\n\n$n，祝你成功。",dEN="This calls for immediate action!\n\nWe have someone out in the field closer to Firewing Point that I want you to speak with. He'll have a better idea of what our next step should be.\n\nReport to Lieutenant Meridian out at the Allerian Post and apprise him of the situation. You'll find the post to the northeast on the southern bank of the river just south of Firewing Point.\n\nGodspeed, <name>.",o="杰奈·星语要你转至泰罗卡森林的奥蕾莉亚岗哨，向米利迪安中尉报到。",oEN="Jenai Starwhisper wants you to report to Lieutenant Meridian at the Allerian Post in Terokkar Forest.",c="炸弹零件。所以我的怀疑是正确的。那不是我希望的事。\n\n好吧，接下来你跟我还有一些讨厌的事情要处理。",cEN="Bomb parts. So my suspicions were true. That's not something that I wanted to be right about.\n\nOkay, you and I have some grim business ahead of us then."}
Q[10446]={d="他们正在庭院里建造第二颗法力炸弹。我的情报显示，炸弹的最终密码由沙尔斯·沃多恩掌握，他是火翼岗哨项目的监工。\n\n$n，你必须再回到那里，从他手中取回最终密码。他待在最高那座尖塔的顶端。\n\n把最终密码带到中央庭院里他们正在建造的那颗法力炸弹那儿，然后引爆它。\n\n只有这样，我们才能确定埃雷利安要塞安全了。",dEN="They're building a second mana bomb in the courtyard. My intel suggests that the final code for the bomb is being held by Sharth Voldoun, the overseer of the project at Firewing Point.\n\n<name>, you have to go back in there and retrieve the final code from him. He keeps himself to the top of the highest spire.\n\nTake the final code to the mana bomb that they're working on in the central courtyard and set it off.\n\nOnly then will we be certain that the Allerian Stronghold is safe.",o="米利迪安中尉要你使用终极密码引爆魔法炸弹，然后向泰罗卡森林奥蕾莉亚要塞的杰奈·星语复命。",oEN="Lieutenant Meridian wants you to use The Final Code to set off the Mana Bomb. Then report back to Jenai Starwhisper at the Allerian Stronghold in Terokkar Forest.",p="莫瑞狄恩中尉一直都在通报我们有关火翼岗哨的状况。一切都还好吗？",pEN="Lieutenant Meridian has been keeping us apprised of the situation at Firewing Point. Is everything okay?",c="你做到了！你拯救了我们！你救了整个奥蕾莉亚要塞！\n\n随着他们部队的覆灭、领导者的死亡以及法力炸弹的摧毁，我们现在能够更自在的呼吸了。\n\n$n，我从来都没有这么忘我过……你如此的英勇！请接受这个代表我们所有人心意的东西。",cEN="YOU DID IT! YOU SAVED US! YOU SAVED THE ALLERIAN STRONGHOLD!!\n\nWith their forces decimated, their leader dead and the mana bomb destroyed, we can all breathe much easier now.\n\n<name>, I've never seen such selflessness... such heroism! Please, accept this on behalf of all of us."}
Q[10447]={d="他们正在庭院里建造第二颗法力炸弹。我的情报显示，炸弹的最终密码由沙尔斯·沃多恩掌握，他是火翼岗哨项目的监工。\n\n$n，你必须再回到那里，从他手中取回最终密码。他待在最高那座尖塔的顶端。\n\n把最终密码带到中央庭院里他们正在建造的那颗法力炸弹那儿，然后引爆它。\n\n只有这样，我们才能确定碎石堡安全了。",dEN="They're building a second mana bomb in the courtyard. My intel suggests that the final code for the bomb is being held by Sharth Voldoun, the overseer of the project at Firewing Point.\n\n<name>, you have to go back in there and retrieve the final code from him. He keeps himself to the top of the highest spire.\n\nTake the final code to the mana bomb that they're working on in the central courtyard and set it off.\n\nOnly then will we be certain that Stonebreaker Hold is safe.",o="卡乌尼中士要你使用终极密码引爆魔法炸弹，然后向泰罗卡森林裂石堡的图基复命。",oEN="Sergeant Chawni wants you to use the Final Code Sheet to set off the Mana Bomb. Then report back to Tooki at Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.",p="丘尼士官一直都在通报我们有关火翼岗哨的状况。一切都还好吗？",pEN="Sergeant Chawni has been keeping us apprised of the situation at Firewing Point. Is everything okay?",c="你做到了！你拯救了我们！你救了整个裂石堡！\n\n随着他们部队的覆灭、领导者的死亡以及法力炸弹的摧毁，我们现在能够更自在的呼吸了。\n\n$n，我从来都没有这么忘我过……你如此的英勇！请接受这个代表我们所有人心意的东西。",cEN="YOU DID IT! YOU SAVED US! YOU SAVED STONEBREAKER HOLD!!\n\nWith their forces decimated, their leader dead and the mana bomb destroyed, we can all breathe much easier now.\n\n<name>, I've never seen such selflessness... such heroism! Please, accept this on behalf of all of us."}
Q[10448]={d="这需要立即行动！\n\n我们在靠近火翼岗哨的野外还有个人，我要你去和她谈谈。她对下一步该怎么做会更清楚。\n\n去碎石营地向上士乔尼报到，把情况告诉她。\n\n从要塞北边的路走。到了图雷姆中部后，沿路向东。营地就在火翼岗哨西南方那条河的岸边。\n\n祝你好运，$n。",dEN="This calls for immediate action!\n\nWe have someone out in the field closer to Firewing Point that I want you to speak with. She'll have a better idea of what our next step should be.\n\nReport to Sergeant Chawni out at Stonebreaker Camp and apprise her of the situation.\n\nTake the road north out of the hold. From the middle of Tuurem, follow the road to the east. You'll find the camp on the bank of the river that lies just southwest of Firewing Point.\n\nGood luck, <name>.",o="图基要你转至泰罗卡森林的裂石营地，向卡乌尼中士报到。",oEN="Tooki wants you to report to Sergeant Chawni at Stonebreaker Camp in Terokkar Forest.",c="炸弹零件。所以我的怀疑是正确的。那不是我希望的事。\n\n好吧，接下来你跟我还有一些讨厌的事情要处理。",cEN="Bomb parts. So my suspicions were true. That's not something that I wanted to be right about.\n\nOk, you and I have some grim business ahead of us then."}
Q[10449]={d="药剂师塞兰娜一直在研究地狱火半岛一带的野生动物，她也需要一份你之前采集到的血样。运气好的话，她或许能检测出令噬骨邪兽人的皮肤变红的原因！\n\n塞兰娜在萨尔玛东南方的机甲残骸。沿着道路往东走，你很快就会看见一块发着绿光的大块金属残体，那就是你的目的地。她在那群双足飞龙后面设立了一处营地。",dEN="Apethecary Zelana has been studying the beasts of Hellfire Peninsula in the field. She wants a sample of the blood you gathered; with luck, she might discover what turned those Bonechewer freaks' skins red!\n\nZelana is at Reaver's Fall, southeast of Thrallmar. Follow the road east and when you see a destroyed, green-glowing hunk of metal, you're there. She has a camp set up behind the wyverns.",o="萨尔玛的乌托克·断斧要你转至机甲残骸，将噬骨血样交给药剂师塞兰娜。",oEN="Vertok Axebreaker in Thrallmar wants you to bring Bonechewer Blood Samples to Apothecary Zelana at Reaver's Fall.",p="为部落效劳是我的荣幸。我能帮你什么忙？",pEN="It is my honor to serve the wishes of the Horde. How might I aid you?",c="啊，太好了。噬骨者氏族的血。我对这些兽人很好奇……他们仍是过去堕落的恶魔，但他们的力量却比我所听过的更强大了……\n\n嗯，让我们开始吧？",cEN="Ah, yes. The blood of the Bonechewer clan. I am very curious about these orcs... they are still the depraved fiends of the past, but their strength and power is greater than what I had heard...\n\nWell, let us begin, shall we?"}
Q[10450]={d="噬骨邪兽人！他们都该死！一看到他们的红色皮肤和堕落的模样，我浑身就热血沸腾！\n\n$n，我有项任务要给你。去干掉那些噬骨邪兽人，然后收集一些他们污秽的血液。有一位药剂师需要这些血液来做检测，结果出来以后，我们或许就能了解到这些兽人是如何被恶魔腐化身心的。事实上，我们也是刚刚摆脱这种腐化。\n\n噬骨邪兽人分布在南边荣耀之路两侧的碉堡废墟附近，任务完成后回来向我复命。",dEN="Bonechewers! They should all die! The sight of their red skin and depravity makes my blood boil!\n\nI have a mission for you, <name>. Kill Bonechewer orcs and collect their vile blood. There is an apothecary who needs the blood for her tests, so we can discover how these orcs fell to the demon taint, a taint from which we so recently freed ourselves.\n\nBonechewers scavenge near the ruined battlements along the Path of Glory, to the south. Return to me when your mission is complete.",o="将12瓶噬骨之血交给萨尔玛的乌托克·断斧。",oEN="Bring 12 Bonechewer Blood Vials to Vurtok Axebreaker in Thrallmar.",p="你挑战了噬骨氏族吗，$n？我希望他们的鲜血洒满大地！",pEN="Did you face the bonechewers, <name>. I hope their blood was spilled in great gouts!",c="哈！所以你真的挑战了噬骨者——我们堕落的亲戚。做得好，$n。我唯一的烦躁的就是他们不能放下他们的生命，我只能用溅洒他们的鲜血来平息我的怒气！",cEN="Hah! So you did meet the bonechewers, our depraved cousins. Well done, <name>. My only regret is that more of them could not lay down their lives and spill their blood, to cool my outrage!"}
Q[10451]={d="感谢大地之母！我和其他人几天前就分散了。我本想查明水之魂所感到的那股异动的源头。我的搜寻把我带到了盘牙，在那里我发现纳迦正在污染影月谷的水源。\n\n不幸的是，我被发现了，还被抓了起来。真不敢想他们为我准备了什么可怕的东西。\n\n我们必须离开这里！帮我逃出去，然后去诅咒祭坛找托尔洛克。|n",dEN="Thank the Earthmother! I parted ways with the others several days ago. I was intent on discovering the source of the disturbance that the spirits of water were feeling. My search led me to Coilskar where I discovered that the naga were befouling the water supply of Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nUnfortunately, I was discovered and taken prisoner. There's no telling what ghastly things they had in store for me.\n\nWe must leave this place! Help me escape and then seek out Torlok at the Altar of Damnation.",o="护送大地治愈者维尔达逃离库斯卡水池，然后转至古尔丹之手以西的诅咒祭坛，向大地治愈者托洛克复命。",oEN="Escort Earthmender Wilda out of Coilskar Cistern and then seek out Earthmender Torlok at the Altar of Damnation, found at the western outskirts of the Hand of Gul'dan.",p="你找到威尔达姐妹了吗？",pEN="You found sister Wilda?",c="赞美大地之母。我确定威尔达将会找到回家的路。请收下这个以表我们的谢意。",cEN="Praise the Earthmother. I am certain that Wilda will find her way home. Please accept this as a token of our appreciation."}
Q[10455]={d="我们当前正在全力进行着活木林生态环境的培育，但这里的山猫数量有些超出了控制范围。\n\n虽然林地山猫的数量曾经处于比较稳定的状态，但是现在它们已经威胁到了希尔瓦纳的生存空间，并可能导致许多令人不愉快的事情。\n\n我现在甚至怀疑拉什鸦巢的那群鸦人正是此事的幕后黑手，但现在，最迫切的问题还是来自于这些山猫本身。\n\n若是你能帮助我们解决这个问题，那可就真是太好了。",dEN="We've been growing the Living Grove at an accelerated rate, but somehow the lynxes there have become lost to our control.\n\nWhere once their population was stable, the grovestalker lynxes are now beginning to encroach upon Sylvanaar, and there have been a number of unpleasant incidents of late.\n\nI suspect that the arakkoa of Veil Lashh are somehow behind it, but the immediate issue is with the lynxes themselves.\n\nI would be most grateful if you would help us to deal with this situation.",o="杀死12只林地山猫。",oEN="Slay 12 Grovestalker Lynxes.",p="我不是说过实话吗？林地追踪者猞猁已经成了威胁，不仅威胁着走这条路的人，也威胁着希尔瓦纳本身。\n\n它们的死令人遗憾，但我们创造活林地的初衷，正是要让希尔瓦纳被一片兼具自然之美与宁静的防御地带环绕。",pEN="Did I not speak the truth? The grovestalker lynxes have become a menace not only to those who would travel the path here, but also to Sylvanaar itself.\n\nTheir deaths are regrettable, but the whole point of our creation of the Living Grove is so that Sylvanaar can be surrounded by a defensive region of natural beauty and tranquility.",c="速度很快。你确定有解决到足够的量吗？\n\n很好，有其他的事情需要你帮忙，如果你愿意的话。",cEN="That was fast. Are you sure that you dealt with as many as was necessary?\n\nExcellent, there's something else that you can help us with if you are willing?"}
Q[10456]={d="那些肮脏污秽的部落在东边创建了一处定居点。他们还带了一大群恐狼来，估计要用来看家或是当作座骑。\n\n这些野兽经常冲过桥来劫掠和骚扰我们的营地。它们甚至捕食了我们的许多精灵龙，这已经严重影响了活木林内所有植物的授粉，影响到了它们的生长和繁殖。\n\n你立刻从这里东侧出镇，越过血槌峡谷上的桥，到东边的锯齿山去猎杀那里的狼群，记得将它们的尾巴砍下来作为证据！",dEN="The filthy races of the Horde have taken over a settlement to the east. They've brought with them a large pack of the dire wolves that they prefer to use as mounts and sentries.\n\nThese sentries have been marauding across the bridge that separates us. They've been stalking our fey drakes, which are critical to the pollination of the Living Grove.\n\nUse the east exit to traverse the bridge over Bloodmaul Ravine that leads to the Jagged Ridge to the east, and bring me their tails as proof!",o="收集4条雷神恶狼的尾巴。",oEN="Collect 4 Thunderlord Dire Wolf Tails.",p="我无法充分的强调杀掉那些雷神恶狼的必要性。他们的存在危及到活木林的稳定以及我们在这的工作。",pEN="I cannot stress strongly enough the need for those Thunderlord dire wolves to be dealt with. Their very existence endangers the stability of the Living Grove and all of our work here.",c="很好。我会看看是不是可以将这些尾巴做成什么有用的东西。\n\n毋庸置疑的这些部落会找方法补足他们的狼群数量，不过现在我们可以透口气了。\n\n$n，如果你愿意的话我有其它的事要要求你保护希尔瓦纳及活木林。",cEN="Good. I'll see if I can fashion something useful from these tails.\n\nNo doubt that the Horde will find a way to replenish the numbers of their wolf pack, but for now we can breathe a little easier.\n\n<name>, if you are willing there's something else that I would ask of you in defense of Sylvanaar and the Living Grove."}
Q[10457]={d="尽管你已经为防卫活木林做出了许多卓越的贡献，但我还是觉得这处新的家园需要更多的保护。\n\n拜托你，带上这棵已被我灌注入自然之力的小树苗。只要在那些被我埋下了种子的地方使用它，它就会令种子迅速成长，破土而出，成为强大的树人卫士。\n\n这些树人卫士对于林地的防御体系来说相当重要，既然你选择了希尔瓦纳作为长期的住所，想必你也会很重视这套防御体系。",dEN="Though you've done a great deal of good work in defense of our new home here, I still feel that the Living Grove needs more protection.\n\nPlease, take this small tree bough that I have imbued with the force of nature. When used upon the seedlings that I have planted out in the grove, it will call down a storm to accelerate the growth of a treant defender.\n\nThese treants are critical to the defense of the grove, especially if you choose not to make Sylvanaar your home for long.",o="在5处活木林树苗上使用莉娜的树枝，召唤生物保卫活木林。",oEN="Use Rina's Bough on 5 of the Grove Seedlings to summon forth defenses for the Living Grove.",p="活林地的防御加固得怎么样了？\n\n利什 veil 的鸦人对我们意图不明，而部落就在峡谷对面，我担心如果我们不尽快行动，就会陷入难以保护新家园和我们在林地中成果的窘境。",pEN="How fares the bolstering of the Living Grove's defenses?\n\nWith the intentions of the arakkoa at Veil Lessh unknown, and the Horde just on the other side of the ravine, I fear that if we do not move quickly we will find ourselves in a poor situation to protect our new home and our work in the grove.",c="既然你已经加固了林地的防御，我感觉安全多了。\n\n你赢得了我们的感谢与敬意，$n。\n\n当然，我刚想起还有一件事需要我们处理！",cEN="Now that you have strengthened the grove's defenses, I feel much safer.\n\nYou've earned our thanks and appreciation, <name>.\n\nOf course, it just occurred to me that there's something else that we need to take care of!"}
Q[10458]={d="我们必须设法挽救现在的局面。跟这片区域的元素沟通，看看有什么补救措施！\n\n$r，我将灵魂图腾交给你。如果你在图腾附近杀死暴怒的元素之灵，灵魂图腾将吸收它们的灵魂。使用图腾吸收元素生物的灵魂，然后向我复命。\n\n首先对付火之灵和土之灵吧，将装满土之魂和火之魂的灵魂图腾交给我。",dEN="We must try and make amends. We must commune with the elements of this region and see if anything can be done!\n\nI grant you the totem of spirits, <race>. If you slay an enraged elemental spirit in close proximity of the totem, it will consume the elemental's soul. You must use the totem to consume many souls before you may return to me.\n\nDo this for the spirits of fire and earth first. Return to me when the totem is full.",o="使用灵魂图腾俘获8个土之魂和8个火之魂，然后向影月谷诅咒祭坛的大地治愈者托洛克复命。",oEN="Earthmender Torlok at the Altar of Damnation in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to use the Totem of Spirits to capture 8 Earthen Souls and 8 Fiery Souls.",p="我担心这片大陆可能失去希望了。",pEN="I fear that this land may be without hope.",c="当这个区域的所有元素之灵被放置到这个图腾里时，我们会与他们交流并找出是否能为影月谷做得事。",cEN="When all of the elemental souls of this region have been placed inside the totem, we will commune with them and find out if anything can be done for Shadowmoon Valley."}
Q[10460]={c="你确定要走这条路吗，？这可不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n这枚戒指中蕴含着一滴永恒之井的井水。当你在流沙之鳞中证明自己的价值时，它的力量也会随之增长。 $g你:你; $N",cEN="Are you sure this is the path you seek to take, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThis ring is imbued with a droplet from the Well of Eternity. It will grow in power as you prove yourself to the Scale of the Sands."}
Q[10461]={c="你确定要走这条路吗，？这可不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n这枚戒指中蕴含着一滴永恒之井的井水。当你在流沙之鳞中证明自己的价值时，它的力量也会随之增长。 $g你:你; $N",cEN="Are you sure this is the path you seek to take,<name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThis ring is imbued with a droplet from the Well of Eternity. It will grow IN power as you prove yourself to the Scale of the Sands."}
Q[10462]={c="你确定要走这条路吗，？这可不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n这枚戒指中蕴含着一滴永恒之井的井水。当你在流沙之鳞中证明自己的价值时，它的力量也会随之增长。 $g你:你; $N",cEN="Are you sure this is the path you seek to take, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThis ring is imbued with a droplet from the Well of Eternity. It will grow in power as you prove yourself to the Scale of the Sands."}
Q[10463]={c="你确定要走这条路吗，？这可不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n这枚戒指中蕴含着一滴永恒之井的井水。当你在流沙之鳞中证明自己的价值时，它的力量也会随之增长。 $g你:你; $N",cEN="Are you sure this is the path you seek to take, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThis ring is imbued with a droplet from the Well of Eternity. It will grow in power as you prove yourself to the Scale of the Sands."}
Q[10464]={d="你已经立下誓言，$c。现在就看你如何将它贯彻到底了。\n\n好好为流沙之鳞效力，你会得到回报。\n\n若你失败，我们所知的时间线将会崩解！",dEN="You've made your pledge, <class>. Now it is up to you to see it through.\n\nServe the Scale of the Sands well and you will be rewarded.\n\nFail and the timeline as we know it will be unravelled!",o="在流沙之鳞中达到尊敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Honored reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Lady Jaina Proudmore during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你一直对我们很有贡献，$N。",pEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>.",c="你已经证明了你的价值，$r。至少，提升到某个阶段了。\n\n诺兹多姆的最佳伙伴这个荣耀可是没那么容易得到的。",cEN="You've proved your worth, <race>. Up to a certain point, at least.\n\nThe favor of Nozdormu's prime mate is not obtained easily."}
Q[10465]={d="$c，你既然做出了承诺，就要实现自己的诺言。\n\n为流沙之鳞效力，你就会获得应得的奖励。如果你失败的话，历史的进程将被破坏！",dEN="You've made your pledge, <class>. Now it is up to you to see it through.\n\nServe the Scale of the Sands well and you will be rewarded. Fail and the timeline as we know it will be unravelled!",o="在流沙之鳞中达到尊敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Honored reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Lady Jaina Proudmore during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你一直对我们很有贡献，$N。",pEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>.",c="你已经证明了你的价值，$r。至少，提升到某个阶段了。\n\n诺兹多姆的最佳伙伴这个荣耀可是没那么容易得到的。",cEN="You've proved your worth, <race>. Up to a certain point, at least.\n\nThe favor of Nozdormu's prime mate is not obtained easily."}
Q[10466]={d="$c，你既然做出了承诺，就要实现自己的诺言。\n\n为流沙之鳞效力，你就会获得应得的奖励。如果你失败的话，历史的进程将被破坏！",dEN="You've made your pledge, <class>. Now it is up to you to see it through.\n\nServe the Scale of the Sands well and you will be rewarded. Fail and the timeline as we know it will be unravelled!",o="在流沙之鳞中达到尊敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Honored reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Lady Jaina Proudmore during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你一直对我们很有贡献，$N。",pEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>.",c="你已经证明了你的价值，$r。至少，提升到某个阶段了。\n\n诺兹多姆的最佳伙伴这个荣耀可是没那么容易得到的。",cEN="You've proved your worth, <race>. Up to a certain point, at least.\n\nThe favor of Nozdormu's prime mate is not obtained easily."}
Q[10467]={d="$c，你既然做出了承诺，就要实现自己的诺言。\n\n为流沙之鳞效力，你就会获得应得的奖励。如果你失败的话，历史的进程将被破坏！",dEN="You've made your pledge, <class>. Now it is up to you to see it through.\n\nServe the Scale of the Sands well and you will be rewarded. Fail and the timeline as we know it will be unravelled!",o="在流沙之鳞中达到尊敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Honored reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Lady Jaina Proudmore during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你一直对我们很有贡献，$N。",pEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>.",c="你已经证明了你的价值，$r。至少，提升到某个阶段了。\n\n诺兹多姆的最佳伙伴这个荣耀可是没那么容易得到的。",cEN="You've proved your worth. <race>. Up to a certain point. at least.\n\nThe favor of Nozdormu's prime mate is not obtained quickly."}
Q[10468]={d="$n，你实现了自己的诺言。为此，你获得了青铜龙的赏识。\n\n只要你继续维护发生在海加尔山的历史事件的正常进程，那么我将不断在永恒之戒中注入力量，直至达到它所能容纳的能量的颠峰。这一天不会太远的。",dEN="You've carried out the promise you made to us, <name>. And for that you've gained the recognition you deserve.\n\nAs you continue to become attuned with past events surrounding mount Hyjal, I can continue to tap into the power contained in your ring. It won't be long until it has reached its full potential.",o="在流沙之鳞中达到崇敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助萨尔之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Revered reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Thrall during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你回来了。想要跟我谈谈吗？",pEN="You've returned. You wish to speak to me?",c="你确实是位$g可敬的盟友:可敬的盟友;。随着你力量的增长，永恒指环也在成长！",cEN="You are a worthy ally indeed. As you grow in power so does the band of eternity!"}
Q[10469]={d="$n，你实现了自己的诺言。为此，你获得了青铜龙的赏识。\n\n只要你继续维护发生在海加尔山的历史事件的正常进程，那么我将不断在永恒之戒中注入力量，直至达到它所能容纳的能量的颠峰。这一天不会太远的。",dEN="You've carried out the promise you made to us, <name>. And for that you've gained the recognition you deserve.\n\nAs you continue to become attuned with past events surrounding mount Hyjal, I can continue to tap into the power contained in your ring. It won't be long until it has reached its full potential.",o="在流沙之鳞中达到崇敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助萨尔之后，把你的永恒指环交给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Revered reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Thrall during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你回来了。想要跟我谈谈吗？",pEN="You've returned. You wish to speak to me?",c="你确实是位$g可敬的盟友:可敬的盟友;。随着你力量的增长，永恒指环也在成长！",cEN="You are a worthy ally indeed. As you grow in power so does the band of eternity!"}
