Q[10729]={c="你对你的决定有把握吗，$n？这可不是你可以随便决定的事喔。\n\n紫罗兰徽记会随着力量而成长，只要你继续对紫罗兰之眼证明你自己。",cEN="Are you certain of your choice, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThe Violet Signet will grow in power as you continue to prove yourself to the Violet Eye."}
