Q[10738]={d="$n，你没有令我们失望。不过，我们也对你寄予了更大的期望。\n\n继续为紫罗兰之眼效力吧，你会得到满意的回报的。",dEN="You have not disappointed us, <name>. We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.\n\nContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded.",o="当你在紫罗兰之眼的声望达到崇敬后，将紫罗兰徽记交给逆风小径的大法师蕾尔达。",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="你的贡献并非无人注意，$n。你的印记或许看来没有改变，但它的力量会随着你持续证明自己的忠诚而获得强化。",cEN="Your services have not gone unnoticed, <name>. Your signet may look the same, but its powers grow as you continue to prove your loyalty."}
