Q[10741]={d="$n，你没有令我们失望。不过，我们也对你寄予了更大的期望。\n\n继续为紫罗兰之眼效力吧，你会得到满意的回报的。",dEN="You have not disappointed us, <name>. We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.\n\nContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded.",o="当你在紫罗兰之眼的声望达到崇敬后，将紫罗兰徽记交给逆风小径的大法师蕾尔达。",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="你的贡献并非无人注意，$n。你的印记或许看来没有改变，但它的力量会随着你持续证明自己的忠诚而获得强化。",cEN="Your services have not gone unnoticed, <name>. Your signet may look the same, but its powers grow as you continue to prove your loyalty."}
Q[10742]={d="决战的时刻即将来临。我们要将苟克从巢穴中引出，然后杀掉这个祸根。苟克一死，刀塔食人魔必定不敢再来侵犯莫克纳萨氏族。转至格鲁尔的巢穴，在巢穴外苟克的祭坛处吹响我的战斗号角。我会跟你并肩作战，共同击败格鲁尔之子。",dEN="Now it comes to this. We will bring Goc forth from his lair, and we will destroy him. With Goc dead, the Bladespire ogres will threaten the Mok'Nathal no longer. Go to Goc's altar outside Gruul's Lair, then blow my horn. I will come, and we will face the son of Gruul together.",o="在苟克的祭坛处吹响雷克萨的战斗号角，杀死苟克。",oEN="Use Rexxar's Battle Horn at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc.",p="只有让戈克和食龙者戈格罗姆死去，我们才能解放莫克纳萨。",pEN="Only through the deaths of Goc and Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater will we free the Mok'Nathal.",c="战斗是艰苦的，而你战斗的非常好，$n。我很荣幸能在对抗茍克的战斗中站在你身旁。我的感谢无法用言语形容。\n\n莫克纳萨应该知道这些大失败，但是我还不准备面对他们。我知道我的父亲的心意，并且我知道我的心。仍然有许多我能学习并且变得更强大的，以向他显示我是他真正的儿子。",cEN="The battle was hard and you fought well, <name>. I am honored to have stood by your side in the battle against Goc. I am thankful beyond words.\n\nThe Mok'Nathal should know of these great defeats, but I am not ready to face them yet. I know my father's mind, and I know my heart. There is still much I can learn and do to become stronger, to show to him that I am his true son."}
Q[10744]={d="立即去向库德兰·蛮锤大人汇报这个好消息吧！空军指挥官努埃恩和士兵们日夜守卫着蛮锤要塞的安全，这次胜利必定能鼓舞他们的士气。燃烧军团的威胁已被清除，库德兰大人也可以专心对付伊利丹了。虽然我们还未在此地站稳阵脚，可毕竟已经取得了一次大胜。",dEN="You must bring word of our success to Kurdran Wildhammer immediately! His men, under Wing Commander Nuainn, have fought nonstop to keep Wildhammer Stronghold safe and your return will surely bolster their spirits. With the threat from the Legion out of the way, Kurdran can finally turn his attention to dealing with the forces of Illidan. Our place here is far from secure, but we've won a major victory this day.",o="返回蛮锤要塞，与库德兰·蛮锤谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Wildhammer Stronghold and speak with Kurdran Wildhammer.",c="<库德兰听着你的报告。>\n\n的确是好消息！几天前，我想都没想到我们能够击败军团的围攻。\n\n你不只终止他们的进犯，还破坏了他们后方的战争机器！蛮锤氏族对你的勇猛表现充满感谢，$n。",cEN="<Kurdran listens to your report.>\n\nThat is good news, indeed! Mere days ago, I wouldn't have dreamt that we could break the Legion's siege on the stronghold.\n\nNot only have you halted their offensive, but you've broken the back of their war machine as well! You have the gratitude of the Wildhammer clan for your valor, <name>."}
Q[10745]={d="立即去向奥巴洛恩大王汇报这个好消息吧！影月谷燃烧军团的威胁已被清除，奥巴洛恩也可以专心对付其它敌人了。\n\n我们总算摆脱了腹背受敌的窘态，库卡隆卫兵们嘴上虽然不承认，心里可美着呢。",dEN="You must bring word of our success to Overlord Or'barokh immediately! Now that we've crushed the Legion and obliterated their presence in Shadowmoon Valley, the overlord can turn his attention to our other foes.\n\nAlthough the Kor'kron guard will never admit it, they'll be glad we're no longer fighting on two fronts.",o="返回影月村，与奥巴洛恩大王谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Shadowmoon Village and speak with Overlord Or'barokh.",c="<大王听着你的报告。>\n\n真是好消息！守住对抗军团邪恶的防线花费太多资源了。现在我希望我的人民可以休息一下，他们的精神一直太紧绷了。\n\n今日你证实了你对部落的价值。库卡隆守卫会很荣幸随时为你待命。",cEN="<The overlord listens to your report.>\n\nExcellent news! Holding the line against the Legion's infernals was taking too many resources. Not that I expected my men to break, but they were greatly strained.\n\nYou have proven your worth to the Horde this day. The Kor'kron guard would be honored to fight by your side anytime."}
Q[10747]={d="我得好好检查检查那些他们在黑翼集会所培育出来的雏龙。\n\n在他们那处洞穴内的基地周围，有许多雏龙在活动。洞穴内还有一个大规模的龙蛋群，只要你接近，就会有雏龙从中破壳而出。\n\n拜托你，$n，带上这张网，捉几只雏龙过来。\n\n向西走过龙颅之桥，然后一路穿越龙颅小径，再沿着道路穿过格里施纳和乌鸦林，就可以找到它们了。",dEN="I need to examine the whelps that they are raising at the Blackwing Coven.\n\nThere should be an abundance of them flying around inside their cavernous base, as well as a number of eggs, which if you get close to them will likely hatch.\n\nPlease, <name>, take the net and capture a handful of them alive for me.\n\nFind them by heading west across the Wyrmskull Bridge and heading through the Wyrmskull Tunnel. Follow the path to its end past Grishnath and the Raven's Wood.",o="萨米亚·因克林要求你使用黑色龙崽之网捕捉10只拜龙教黑色龙崽。",oEN="Use the Blackwhelp Net to capture 10 Wyrmcult Blackwhelps.",p="你在捕抓这些幼龙时有遇到很多麻烦吗？我希望你不会被烧焦！",pEN="Did you run into much trouble snatching the whelps? I hope you didn't get singed!",c="喔我的老天啊，这些比我本来期望的还要多呢！你一定要为了你的勇猛行为受到赞美！\n\n这只优秀的黑龙的幼崽看起来适合用来作一个好的开始。开始检查他们吧。\n\n请接受这个当做报酬。收下吧！",cEN="Oh my goodness, these are more than I'd hoped for! You are certainly to be lauded for your heroics!\n\nThis looks like a fine brood of blackwhelps to make a start with. Examining them, that is.\n\nPlease, accept this as payment. I insist!"}
Q[10748]={d="他们让我们别无选择，$n。现在看来，必须除掉他们的头目——灰烬之喉玛克纳尔，才能彻底消灭黑翼集会所的威胁。\n\n我不知道你经过那附近的时候有没有见过他的样子，他算是一只半龙人，半身是人，半身是龙。他很强，千万不要轻敌！\n\n迅速解决掉他，这样就能确保卢安荒野和常青林的安宁与和谐了。",dEN="They've left us no choice, <name>. It's time to put an end to the threat from the Blackwing Coven by taking out their leader, Maxnar the Ashmaw.\n\nI don't know if you caught a glimpse of him while you were in there, but he's one of the dragonkin, half-man, half-dragon. And he's tough, so don't underestimate him!\n\nFinish it quickly and with any luck you'll secure the safety of Evergrove and the Ruuan Weald.",o="立刻杀死灰烬之喉玛克纳尔。",oEN="Slay Maxnar the Ashmaw.",p="你已经解决了灰喉麦克斯纳尔？\n\n找到他有很麻烦吗？如我所了解的你一进到洞穴后如果是朝右边进去，那些弯来拐去的路最终都会引你到它所在的地方。",pEN="You've dealt with Maxnar the Ashmaw already?\n\nAre you having trouble finding him? As I understand it if you head to the right once you enter their caverns, it will eventually curve around and lead you to him.",c="知道我们敌人的首领已经被解决掉使我们现在可以松一口气了。不只如此，你还守住了整片山区免于受到他们的破坏。\n\n不管他们最终的目的为何，你都把他们击退了！\n\n我们对你感激不尽，$n。请收下这个以表我们的敬意，还有我们无尽的欢迎。",cEN="Now we can breathe more easily knowing that the leader of our enemy has been dealt with. Not only that, but you've saved the entire mountain range from their depredations.\n\nWhatever their ultimate goals, you've foiled them!\n\nYou have our gratitude, <name>. Please accept this token of our esteem, as well as our unending hospitality."}
Q[10749]={d="来，把这个拿给你的主人。我相信无论出于什么原因，雷克萨都会好好利用它。\n\n哦，还有，一定要提醒他他欠我一个人情。\n\n他知道我想要什么，而且我确信，无论他打算怎么替我弄到它，我们再见面的时间会比你想象的更早。\n\n现在，做个乖巧的小$g男孩:女孩;，把这个送去给雷克萨。",dEN="Here, take this to your master. I'm sure that whatever the reason, Rexxar will put it to good use.\n\nOh, and do be certain to remind him that he owes me.\n\nHe knows what I want, and I'm certain that however he intends to obtain it for me, I'll be seeing you again sooner than you think.\n\nNow, do be a good little <boy /girl> and run this up to Rexxar.",o="将萨博迈恩男爵的毒药交给刀锋山雷神要塞的雷克萨。",oEN="Deliver Baron Sablemane's Poison to Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="$c，你这么快就回来了喔？有拿到毒药吗？",pEN="<class>, you are back so soon? Do you have the poison?",c="这个毒药的用途并不光明正大。但是却可以完成我们想要做得事。",cEN="This is unsavory business, this use of poisons. But it will do what we want."}
Q[10750]={d="$n，我从驭风者那儿得知，日蚀血精灵正在谋划一次大规模的行动。他们当前已经开始在东南方的征服之路一带聚集兵力。\n\n我要你转至日蚀岗哨附近的征服之路侦察敌情。判断清楚局势后，使用这支信号枪。一名库卡隆驭风者会在看到信号之后去接应你。将你探得的情报告诉他，而他也会给你下一步的指示。",dEN="Word has come from my wind riders, <name>. The Eclipsion blood elves are planning something big. They have begun forming their armies at the Path of Conquest, far to the southeast - adjacent to Eclipse Point.\n\nI want you to travel to the Path of Conquest and assess the situation. Once you have done so, use this flare gun to signal a wind rider. One will swoop down from the sky to meet you. Inform them of what you have discovered and they will give you your next set of orders.",o="转至影月谷的征服之路。",oEN="Travel to the Path of Conquest in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="你有什么要报告的吗，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="没错，这些讨厌的家伙们正忙于进行某些邪恶的事。我们必须进行更深入的调查……",cEN="Indeed, these troublesome whelps are up to something insidious. We must investigate further..."}
Q[10751]={d="$r，我们必须得继续深入调查。我和另一些驭风者将进入征服之路的上空。真希望我们能查探到更详细的敌情。不过，请你为我们清理前面路上的障碍，当然，最重要的是，确保我们不被血精灵的弓箭给射下来！\n\n在你成功削减他们的数量之后，使用库卡隆信号枪，给我们的驭风者编队发出信号。",dEN="We're going to need more time, <race>. I'm going to fly further ahead with some of the other wind riders. Hopefully, we can gather some more information. What I need from you now is to clear a path and more importantly, keep their arrows pointed away from us!\n\nCall for a wind rider with the Kor'kron flare gun once you have thinned their numbers.",o="杀死20名日蚀士兵、10名日蚀骑兵和10名日蚀缚法者。",oEN="Slay 20 Eclipsion Soldiers, 10 Eclipsion Cavaliers, and 10 Eclipsion Spellbinders.",p="你有什么要报告吗，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="你不会相信的，步兵。",cEN="You won't believe this, grunt."}
Q[10752]={d="不久之前，莱恩·狼行者离开达纳苏斯，穿过奥伯丁往灰谷方向去了。她跟我提起过熊怪的事，可惜我没机会向她询问详细状况，$c，或许你能帮她一把。沿着南面的道路离开奥伯丁，越过灰谷边界后继续往南走。莱恩·狼行者就在阿斯特兰纳。",dEN="Recently Raene Wolfrunner came through Auberdine from Darnassus and was heading to Ashenvale; she said something about the Furbolgs. I wasn't given an opportunity to ask more about her situation but perhaps you can seek her out and lend her your aid <class>. Take the southern road out of Auberdine. Once you reach Ashenvale border continue your path down the road. There you will find Astranaar and Raene Wolfrunner.",o="与阿斯特兰纳的莱恩·狼行者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar.",c="你是说桑迪斯·织风仍然认为我需要人照顾吗？看来我要提醒他当初是谁救了谁，他似乎忘了是我救他远离伤害。\n\n既然你来了，$R，也许我可以找点事情给你做。",cEN="So Thundris Windweaver still thinks I need looking after? I'll need to remind him who saved whom; he seems to forget it was I that pulled him from harm's way.\n\nWell now that you're here, <race>, perhaps I can find something for you to do."}
Q[10753]={d="燃烧军团所犯下的恶行可谓磬竹难书。对于这片土地上任何敢于反抗他们的生物，他们都会派出军团实行残忍的清洗政策，而无力反抗他们的种族已经一个接一个地都灭绝了。$n，帮助我阻止他们对自然所犯下的罪孽吧。\n\n越过东边的丘陵地带，你就会看见刀刃峡谷内，正有燃烧军团的爪牙在那里腐化着大自然。阻止这一切，尽可能多地杀掉邪能腐蚀者和魔誓生物吧。",dEN="The number of atrocities committed by the Burning Legion is countless. Even as we speak, they send their legion forces against the creatures of this land. Helpless to defend against their power, they fall one by one. <name>, help me stop these crimes of nature destroy all which they corrupt.\n\nOver the hill, east of here, you will see the corruption spreading across Bladed Gulch. Kill the ones causing the crime, the Fel Corrupters, and as many Felsworn as you can.",o="杀死4只魔誓鳞翼风蛇、4只魔誓刃喉龙和2只邪能腐蚀者。",oEN="Slay 4 Felsworn Scalewing, 4 Felsworn Daggermaw, and 2 Fel Corrupters.",p="你已经执行正义了吗？",pEN="Have you delivered the hand of justice?",c="知道我们摧毁了当初艾露恩所创造的东西，我并不感到自豪，但是燃烧军团腐化大地这件事需要被阻止。你做得很好$c。",cEN="I do not pride myself knowing we destroyed what Elune has created, but the corruption needed to be stopped. You have done well <class>."}
Q[10754]={d="这件模具看上去是用来浇铸某种钥匙的。从背后雕刻的图像来看，它似乎跟地狱火堡垒有关。\n\n或许荣耀堡的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩会对此感兴趣。",dEN="This freshly cast mold was to be used to create a key of some sort. From the image engraved on its back, it appears to be related to Hellfire Citadel.\n\nMaybe this could prove to interest to Danath, the force commander at Honor Hold.",o="将原始钥匙模具交给地狱火半岛荣耀堡的远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩。",oEN="Bring the Primed Key Mold to Force Commander Danath at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你有什么东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You've something to show me, <name>?",c="这有可能吗？让我仔细看这个模子。",cEN="Could this be? Let me take a closer look at that mold."}
Q[10755]={d="这件模具看上去是用来浇铸某种钥匙的。从背后雕刻的图像来看，它似乎跟地狱火堡垒有关。\n\n或许萨尔玛的部落统领纳兹格雷尔会对此感兴趣。",dEN="This freshly cast mold was to be used to create a key of some sort. From the image engraved on its back, it appears to be related to Hellfire Citadel.\n\nMaybe this could prove to interest to Nazgrel, the leader of the Horde's forces in Thrallmar.",o="将原始钥匙模具交给地狱火半岛萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Bring the Primed Key Mold to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你有什么东西要给我吗，$n？",pEN="You've something to show me, <name>?",c="一个钥匙模子？这有可能可以让我们进入破碎大厅吗？",cEN="A key mold? Could this be what grants us access to the Shattered Halls?"}
Q[10756]={d="钥匙柄上的符号……雕刻在模具内的符号很难辨别，但是我能认出这是碎手邪兽人的钥匙。\n\n这是个很好的机会，这把钥匙可以让你进入破碎大厅。\n\n与我们的铁匠罗霍克谈一谈。如果说有谁能铸造这把钥匙的话，只能是他了。",dEN="The symbol on the key's handle... it is hard to make it out inside the mold, but I recognize it as the Shattered Hand's own.\n\nThere is a good chance this key will allow you to enter the Shattered Halls.\n\nSpeak to Rohok, our resident blacksmith. If anyone can forge this key it is he.",o="将原始钥匙模具交给萨尔玛的罗霍克。",oEN="Bring the Primed Key Mold to Rohok at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What is this?",c="纳兹格雷尔想要我去做一把钥匙吗？他忘记我们在战场里吗？那里还有成堆刀剑和矛要锻造！",cEN="Nazgrel wants me to work on a key? Does he forget we're in a battlefield? There are blades and spears to forge!"}
Q[10757]={d="邪兽人铁匠或许算不上技艺最精湛的铁匠，但他们还是有两把刷子的。想要利用这个模具配制出能用的钥匙，就必须以魔铁锭为熔料——其它材料很可能会破坏模具。\n\n我需要几块魔铁锭、一点奥法之尘还有几颗火焰微粒。我会试着铸造钥匙，但是我不保证能成功。",dEN="Fel orc blacksmiths may not be the most skilled in the world, but there is some craftsmanship to their trade. Only fel iron can be used with this mold if we want to end up with a working key - anything else would probably end up breaking it.\n\nBring me some fel iron bars, a bit of arcane dust and motes of fire. I'll try my hand at it, but I make no promises.",o="将4块魔铁锭、2份奥法之尘和4颗火焰微粒交给地狱火半岛萨尔玛的罗霍克。",oEN="Bring 4 Fel Iron Bars, 2 Arcane Dust and 4 Motes of Fire to Rohok at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你拿到我要的原料了吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the materials I requested?",c="太好了。让我们试试。",cEN="Excellent. Let's give it a shot."}
Q[10758]={d="$n，真是糟透了！不管我往火堆里扔多少煤块，就是达不到需要的温度。\n\n我唯一能想到的热源就是燃烧军团的魔能机甲，只有利用它体内的高温才能对钥匙进行淬火处理。\n\n我曾亲眼目睹魔能机甲被摧毁时的景象。毁损的机甲喷射着火花和蒸汽，在浓烟中轰然倒地。将钥匙模具插入魔能机甲的残骸中淬火。想要摧毁魔能机甲的话，我建议你叫上几个朋友。",dEN="It's no good, <name>! No matter how many coals I put to the fire, it's just not enough heat.\n\nThere's only one thing I can think of that is hot enough to temper this key and it is the insides of the Legion's fel reavers.\n\nI've only ever seen one downed once. I remember seeing its insides fuming, shooting fire and steam as it fell. Take this mold and plunge it into a fallen fel reaver. I recommend you get yourself some friends if you plan to take one down.",o="摧毁地狱火半岛的魔能机甲，将未淬火的钥匙模具插入魔能机甲的残骸，然后将灼烧过的钥匙模具交给萨尔玛的罗霍克。",oEN="Destroy a Fel Reaver in Hellfire Peninsula and plunge the Unfired Key Mold into its remains. Bring the Charred Key Mold to Rohok in Thrallmar.",p="你完成我要求你的事了吗，$c？",pEN="Did you do what I asked of you, <class>?",c="你已经成功了！剩下唯一要做的事情只有去试一试它。",cEN="You've succeeded! Only thing left for you to do is try it out."}
Q[10759]={d="我觉得这些这几页日记上的内容应该可以凑成一篇完整的文献，可现在我绞尽脑汁也没理出什么头绪来。\n\n我们最好能找到日记中提到的这名逃亡者。如果他已经背弃了族人，你就有机会说服他帮助我们了解黑暗教团鸦人的阴谋。\n\n沿着西北方通往熔岩平原的道路开始搜寻吧，他很可能在平原上的某处避难。",dEN="I get the feeling that all the pieces are here, but I just can't put them together in a way that makes sense.\n\nI think our best lead is to attempt to locate this deserter. If he left his comrades at the camp, there's a chance you might be able to persuade him to help us understand what the dark conclave arakkoa are planning.\n\nStart your search for him along the road in Magma Fields to the northwest. It seems a likely place for him to take refuge.",o="在熔岩平原找到帕沙恩，并与他谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Parshah in the Magma Fields and speak to him.",c="<鸦人嘎嘎笑了几声。>\n\n是的，我是在指挥官日志中所提到的背弃者。我一直在等那一天，当其它人感觉到那些我曾经称为兄弟们所造成的威胁。",cEN="<The arakkoa cackles.>\n\nYes, I am the deserter mentioned in the commander's journal. I have been waiting for the day when others might recognize the threat posed by those I once called brothers."}
Q[10760]={d="东边的斯克瑟隆废墟是个诡异的地方，苦工们都相信那片土地被诅咒了。\n\n然而，这里没有多少树木，因此他们不得不冒险进入鸦人的废墟砍伐木材。于是，鸦人之魂终日折磨着那些苦工，汲取他们的生命来强化邪恶的魔法。\n\n我们必须查明黑暗教团的意图，及时阻止威胁蔓延。你现在就转至斯克瑟隆废墟，搜寻黑暗教团神秘计划的证据。",dEN="The Sketh'lon Wreckage, just to the east, is an eerie place. The peons are convinced that it's cursed.\n\nThere are few trees here, so the peons have no choice but to venture into the arakkoa ruins to chop wood. The arakkoa spirits prey on the work groups, draining their life and using it to fuel their foul magics.\n\nWe must find out what is driving the dark conclave and stop them before their influence expands. Search the Sketh'lon Wreckage for evidence of their plans.",o="从斯克瑟隆废墟黑暗教团的鸦人身上夺得斯克瑟隆指挥官的日记 - 第1页、斯克瑟隆指挥官的日记 - 第2页，以及斯克瑟隆指挥官的日记 - 第3页，将它们交给影月村的卡格鲁尔中士。",oEN="Recover the Skethlon Commander's Journal Page 1, Skethlon Commander's Journal Page 2, and Skethlon Commander's Journal Page 3 from the Dark Conclave arakkoa at the Sketh'lon Wreckage to Sergeant Kargrul at Shadowmoon Village.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="<中士翻阅着日记的书页。>\n\n我没看到多少有用的东西，不过有几条记录可能派得上用场。看起来这些鸦人直到死前都在筹备某种繁复的魔法仪式，可为什么呢？这里还有一条关于「逃兵」的奇怪记录。\"\"",cEN="I don't see much of use here, but there are a couple of entries that could prove useful. It looks as though these arakkoa were preparing some kind of elaborate magical ritual up until the time of their deaths, but why? There's also a curious note here about a 'deserter.'"}
Q[10761]={d="谁也无法解释这些鸦人的灵魂为何依然盘踞在这个世界，以及他们为何对兽人如此恨之入骨，欲杀之而后快。\n\n日记中提到的那个逃亡者或许能提供线索。如果他真的背弃了族人，你就有机会说服他帮助我们了解黑暗教团鸦人的邪恶计划。\n\n这条大路通向东南方的熔岩平原，沿途寻找他吧。",dEN="There's nothing here that would explain why the spirits of these arakkoa have remained in this world or how they came into thirst for the blood of orcs.\n\nI think our best lead is to try to find the deserter mentioned in the journal. If he left his comrades at the camp, there's a chance you might be able to persuade him to help us understand what the dark conclave arakkoa are planning.\n\nStart your search for him on the road through the Magma Fields to the southeast.",o="在熔岩平原找到帕沙恩，并与他谈一谈。",oEN="Locate Parshah in the Magma Fields and speak to him.",c="<鸦人嘎嘎笑了几声。>\n\n是的，我是在指挥官日志中所提到的背弃者。我一直在等那一天，当其它人感觉到那些我曾经称为兄弟们所造成的威胁。",cEN="<The arakkoa cackles.>\n\nYes, I am the deserter mentioned in the commander's journal. I have been waiting for the day when others might recognize the threat posed by those I once called brothers."}
Q[10762]={d="钥匙柄上有着一个奇特的符号……这种符号应该很难在熔铸的模具上直接印刻出来，不过我认得出这是碎手氏族的标记。\n\n这是个很好的机会，你可以利用这模具配出钥匙，并进入破碎大厅。\n\n与达姆菲谈一谈。他精通各种铁匠工艺，如果他都无法配制出钥匙，那就没人能办得到了。",dEN="The symbol on the key's handle... it is hard to make it out inside the mold, but I recognize it at the Shattered Hand's own.\n\nThere is a good chance this key will allow you to enter the Shattered Halls.\n\nSpeak to Dumphry. He is a master of his craft. If he can't craft this key for you, no one can.",o="将原始钥匙模具交给荣耀堡的达姆菲。",oEN="Bring the Primed Key Mold to Dumphry in Honor Hold.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What is this?",c="一把钥匙吗？达纳斯应该让我们做攻城机具的！",cEN="A key? Danath should have us working on siege engines!"}
Q[10763]={d="虽然邪兽人都是些没脑子的笨蛋，但是他们的锻造技术却不像你想得那样简单。如果我们想要让铸造出的这把钥匙真正能起作用，那么在铸造时就只能使用魔铁，而其它的材料都有可能造成铸造失败的结果。\n\n给我带一些魔铁锭、奥法之尘和火焰微粒回来。我要亲自试试看，不过不敢保证成功。",dEN="Fel orcs might be complete barbarians but their smithing is not as primitive as you might think. Only fel iron can be used with this mold if we want to end up with a working key - anything else would probably end up breaking it.\n\nBring me some fel iron bars, a bit of arcane dust and motes of fire. I'll try my hand at it, but I make no promises.",o="将4块魔铁锭、2份奥法之尘和4颗火焰微粒交给地狱火半岛荣耀堡的达姆菲。",oEN="Bring 4 Fel Iron Bars, 2 Arcane Dust and 4 Motes of Fire to Dumphry at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你有拿到我要求的资源吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the materials I requested?",c="让我试试看。让我看看邪兽人的制品到底是如何的。",cEN="Let's try it then. Let's see what fel orc crafting is all about."}
Q[10764]={d="不行啊。$g小伙子:姑娘，看来炉子的温度不够啊……这些材料根本无法熔化和混合。\n\n不过，你知道么，燃烧军团使用的那些魔能机甲是利用某种由十分灼热的魔火所构成的核心所驱动的。那种魔火比一般火的温度要高上许多。\n\n如果你能找到足够的人手去毁掉一台魔能机甲，就可以将这个模具放进机甲的核心中进行加温。$c，一定要小心，那些魔能机甲的战斗力是非常强大的。",dEN="It's not working, <lad /lass>. I cannot give it enough heat... the materials will not be properly tempered.\n\nYou know, the Fel Reavers used by the Burning Legion are powered by a scalding core of fel fire - it burns much hotter than normal fire.\n\nIf you could find enough people to take one down, you could heat the mold in the insides of the fallen reaver. Beware, <class>, those fel reavers pack quite a punch.",o="摧毁地狱火半岛的魔能机甲，将未淬火的钥匙模具插入魔能机甲的残骸，然后将灼烧过的钥匙模具交给荣耀堡的达姆菲。",oEN="Destroy a Fel Reaver in Hellfire Peninsula and plunge the Unfired Key Mold into its remains. Bring the Charred Key Mold to Dumphry in Honor Hold.",p="你完成我要求你的事了吗，$c？",pEN="Did you do what I asked of you, <class>?",c="你做到了，$g少年:少女！剩下要做的只有把它带到地狱火堡垒并且杀一些兽人！",cEN="You've done it, laddie! Only thing left to do is for you to take it to Hellfire Citadel and kill yourself some orcs!"}
Q[10765]={d="在征服之路的南端，一辆静止的商队附近，我发现了一场看起来像是巨人与一位血精灵大臣之间的会面。你大概也注意到路上那些更小的巨人了。这一切都不太对劲，$g新兵:新兵;。\n\n我要你一路打过去，搅了这场聚会。能从那现场带走什么就带走什么，然后用信号枪呼叫我们中的一员。",dEN="At the southern end of the Path of Conquest, near a stationary caravan, I discovered what looked like a meeting between a giant and a blood elf chancellor. You've probably already noticed the smaller giants on the path as well. Something is just not right about all of this, grunt.\n\nI want you to fight your way to this meeting and break up the party. Recover whatever you can from the scene and then call for one of us with the flare gun.",o="杀死特派使者莉芙·血叶和强大的考罗克，夺得伊利丹的命令。",oEN="Slay Chancellor Bloodleaf and Corok the Mighty and recover Illidan's Command.",p="你有什么要报告吗，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report. soldier?",c="因此他们试图获得那些巨人的支持，呃？我有一个计划能切断这个邪恶的联盟。",cEN="So they are attempting to gain the favor of the giants. eh? I have a plan that promises to sever this unholy union."}
Q[10766]={d="现在我们可以进入燃烧军团位于登陆场：灾难的基地了，所以我们要设法摧毁整个基地。只有歼灭影月谷这一地区内的全部燃烧军团部队，才能确蛮锤要塞的安全。\n\n我已经派出了一支先遣部队转至登陆场，帮助你清除燃烧军团的残馀势力。你现在立刻返回军团要塞，进入绿色水晶下的传送装置。普雷西会在登陆场：灾难等你。",dEN="Now that we have access to the Legion's base at Invasion Point: Cataclysm, we need to figure out a way to shut down their operations there. Wildhammer Stronghold won't be safe until the Legion's presence is erased from Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nI've sent an advance party up to the invasion point to help you formulate a plan to destroy the Legion's supplies. Go back to Legion Hold and step into the teleporter with the green crystals above it. Plexi will meet you at your destination.",o="转至登陆场：灾难，向普雷西报到。",oEN="Report to Plexi at Invasion Point: Cataclysm.",c="很高兴见到你，$n。我的名字是普莱克希。\n\n我不会以拘泥的形式让你感到厌烦。我们两个都知道我们为什么在这里。现在，让我们开始工作吧。",cEN="Pleased to meet you, <name>. Name's Plexi.\n\nI won't bore you with formalities. We both know why we're here. Now, let's get to work."}
Q[10767]={d="现在我们可以进入燃烧军团位于登陆场：灾难的基地了，所以我们要设法摧毁整个基地。只有歼灭影月谷这一地区内的全部燃烧军团部队，才能确保影月村的安全。\n\n我已经派出了一支先遣部队转至登陆场，帮助你清除燃烧军团的残馀势力。你现在立刻返回军团要塞，进入绿色水晶下的传送装置。纳斯坎会在登陆场：灾难等你。",dEN="Now that we have access to the Legion's base at Invasion Point: Cataclysm, we need to figure out a way to shut down their operations there. Shadowmoon Village won't be safe until the Legion's presence is erased from the valley.\n\nI've sent an advance party up to the invasion point to help you formulate a plan to destroy the Legion's supplies. Go back to Legion Hold and step into the teleporter with the green crystals above it. Nakansi will meet you at your destination.",o="转至登陆场：灾难，向纳坎斯报到。",oEN="Report to Nakansi at Invasion Point: Cataclysm.",c="你一定是血卫士古尔莫克让我等的那个$g$r:那个$r;。我心里有个计划，但需要你的帮助来完成准备工作。",cEN="You must be the <race> Blood Guard Gulmok told me to expect. I have a plan in mind, but I'll need your help to complete the preparations."}
Q[10768]={d="现在我们驭风者部队必须返回影月村，马上开始准备发动下一轮的进攻。而你，我命令你在这边收集一些日蚀血精灵身上的徽章。\n\n收集到足够的徽章之后，你可以使用库卡隆信号枪召唤来一名驭风者。$r，接下来你就要当间谍了！",dEN="The wind riders must return to Shadowmoon Village to prepare for the next phase of our assault. What I need from you now are the tabards that these blood elves wear.\n\nWhen you have collected enough tabards, call for a wind rider using the Kor'kron flare gun. Prepare yourself for a bit of espionage, <race>!",o="收集10件伊利达雷徽章。",oEN="Collect 10 Illidari Tabards.",p="你有什么要报告的，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="啊哈！这些将完成的十分好。",cEN="Ah-ha! These will do quite nicely."}
Q[10769]={d="附魔材料全是研究员提欧鲁斯准备的，我所要做的不过是将伊利达雷徽章浸入这些混合物中。好，完成了，这件徽章现在已经融合了伊利达雷的精华。\n\n带上这件魔化伊利达雷徽章，转至位于日蚀岗哨西南方的日蚀平原。你一进入平原后就立即换上它，伪装成伊利丹的手下，之后，利用这伪装杀死那些在平原上游荡的疯狂的巨人。这样一来，他们必定会认为血精灵缺乏与其结盟的诚意！",dEN="Researcher Tiorus was kind enough to put this concoction together for the final strike. I merely pour it upon this tabard that you have provided for me and the item is imbued with the essence of the Illidari filth.\n\nTake the enchanted tabard and travel to the Eclipsion Fields, southwest of Eclipse Point. Once there, use the tabard to transform into an agent of Illidan. While in disguise, slay the crazed colossi that wander the field. They will think it an attack by the Eclipsion and sever all ties!",o="伪装成伊利达雷血精灵，杀死5个疯狂的巨人，然后向影月谷内影月村的奥巴洛恩大王复命，并将库卡隆信号枪一并交还给他。",oEN="Slay 5 Crazed Colossus while in disguise as an Illidari blood elf and return to Overlord Or'barokh at Shadowmoon Village in Shadowmoon Valley. He will also want his Kor'kron Flare Gun returned.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You have returned!",c="好，好，好……这不是我派到野外的那个$g新兵:新兵;吗。你回来了，而且毫发无伤。\n\n<奥尔巴罗克点头。>\n\n我就知道你不会让我失望，士兵。你阻止了伊利达雷的一次重大推进，也因此为自己赢得了一点奖赏。",cEN="Well, well, well... If it isn't the grunt I sent out into the field. You're back and in one piece.\n\n<Or'barokh nods.>\n\nI knew you wouldn't let me down, soldier. You've stopped a major Illidari advance and, in doing so, earned yourself a little reward."}
Q[10770]={d="在这里的东北方有一处高地，那里被我古老家乡燃烧之后留下的厚厚的尘埃复盖着。那曾是一片郁郁葱葱、枝繁叶茂的大森林，但是却被燃烧军团派遣小鬼烧光了，无数的生灵死于非命。尽管这件事已经过去了好几个世纪，但我复仇的信念却一直没有消逝过。那些小鬼的数量繁多，这让我们收复失地的工作进展艰难，但若是你去的话，一定会让它们感到恐惧的。\n\n你愿意帮助我吗？",dEN="Northeast of here, on the plateau above us lies the burnt ashes of my ancient home. A great wood flourished there before the Burning Legion sent their imps to burn us away. So many died that even centuries later my tired old heart hungers for revenge. There are too many of them for us to ever reclaim the land, but you could make them afraid.\n\nSurely you will help me?",o="古树莫斯伍德要求你杀死8只灼烧小鬼，然后回去向他复命。",oEN="Mosswood the Ancient wants you to kill 8 Scorch Imps and then return to him in Ruuan Weald.",p="不久我将安息于森林的深处。在我将根深入地下，并且永远闭上双眼前，我希望知道那些卑鄙的小鬼遭受处罚并且死亡。",pEN="Soon I will sleep the deep sleep of the forest. Before I dig my roots deep and close these old eyes forever I hope to know that those wretched imps suffered and perished.",c="它们的数量实在太多，我们永远无法全部杀死他们，但是你已经给我希望了。或许我应该再稍微努力试试几个世纪来让我深爱的树木复活。",cEN="There are so many that we can never kill them all, but you have given me hope. Perhaps I shall try a little harder for another few centuries to revive my beloved wood."}
Q[10771]={d="一直沿着路向东走，越过山顶后再折向北方，你就会到达我那失落已久的家乡。\n\n那里曾是一片美丽而宁静的大森林，它的名字我已经记不清了。但是在几百年前，燃烧军团召唤出了无数的小鬼和其它火元素生物进攻了那里。于是，我的家园毁灭了，宗族的成员四散奔逃，只有我还留在这里。\n\n现在，我这里有一些铁根种子，它们当中蕴涵着强大的魔法力量，可以在肥沃的火山灰里健康成长。替我将它们种植在那里吧，我会以一些古老的财宝回报你的。",dEN="If you follow the road east and up the side of the mountain, then turn north, you will come to my long lost home.\n\nOnce there was a wood there. Its name is forgotten. Long ago the Burning Legion summoned scorched imps and other creatures of flame. My home was destroyed and my people fled. Now only I remain.\n\nI have saved some ironroot seeds that could be planted in fertile volcanic soil. Their magic is strong. Do this for me and I will share with you the treasures of a forgotten age.",o="古树莫斯伍德要求你转至焦火荒野，将铁根种子植入那里三堆不同的肥沃的火山灰中，然后回到卢安荒野向他复命。",oEN="Mosswood the Ancient wants you to journey to Skald and plant Ironroot Seeds in three different mounds of Fertile Volcanic Soil and then return to him in Ruuan Weald.",p="完成了吗？你把那些小鬼他们老家了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Did you return some life to my ancient home?",c="你杀死了那么多的邪恶小鬼。知道这消息我就能早点安心休息了。",cEN="You destroyed many of those foul little creatures. I can rest easier knowing that so many were destroyed."}
Q[10772]={d="我的狮鹫骑士带回来一些消息！日蚀血精灵正在筹划什么大动作。他们已经开始在征服之路集结军队，就在此处以东——紧邻日蚀岗哨。\n\n我要你前往征服之路，评估那里的局势。做完之后，用这把信号枪给一名狮鹫骑士发信号。会有一人从天而降与你碰面。把你们的发现告诉他，他会给你下一步的命令。",dEN="My gryphon riders have come back with a bit of news! The Eclipsion blood elves are planning something big. They've begun forming their armies at the Path of Conquest, located east of here - adjacent to Eclipse Point.\n\nI want you to travel to the Path of Conquest and assess the situation. Once you've done so, use this flare gun to signal a gryphon rider. One will swoop down from the sky to meet you. Tell 'em what you've discovered and they'll give you the next set of orders.",o="转至影月谷的征服之路。",oEN="Travel to the Path of Conquest in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="你有什么要报告的吗，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="没错，这些讨厌的家伙们正忙于进行某些邪恶的事。我们必须进行更深入的调查……",cEN="Indeed, these troublesome whelps are up to something insidious. We must investigate further..."}
Q[10773]={d="$r，我们必须得继续深入调查。我和另一些狮鹫骑士将进入征服之路的上空。真希望我们能查探到更详细的敌情。不过，请你为我们清理前面路上的障碍，当然，最重要的是，确保我们不被血精灵的弓箭给射下来！\n\n在你成功削减他们的数量之后，使用蛮锤信号枪，给我们的狮鹫骑士编队发出信号。",dEN="We're going to need more time, <race>. I'm going to fly further ahead with some of the other gryphon riders. Hopefully, we can gather some more information. What I need from you now is to clear a path and more importantly, keep their arrows pointed away from us!\n\nCall for a gryphon rider with the Wildhammer flare gun once you have thinned their numbers.",o="杀死20名日蚀士兵、10名日蚀骑兵和5个考罗克之子。",oEN="Slay 20 Eclipsion Soldiers, 10 Eclipsion Cavaliers, and 5 Sons of Corok.",p="你有什么要报告的，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="你不会相信这的，士兵。",cEN="You won't believe this, soldier!"}
Q[10774]={d="在征服之路的南端，有一处商队的大棚车营地。在那里，我发现一个巨人在和一个血精灵使者密会。你大概也已经注意到，这一带有许多体型较小的巨人出没。这事情绝对不简单，士兵。\n\n我要你杀入征服之路，到密会的现场去破坏他们的谈判，再看看能否搜寻到什么线索和信息。完成任务后，使用信号枪给我们狮鹫骑士发出信号。",dEN="At the southern end of the Path of Conquest, near a stationary caravan, I discovered what looked like a meeting between a giant and a blood elf chancellor. What are giants even doing here? Something is just not right about all of this, grunt.\n\nI want you to fight your way to this meeting and break up the party. Recover whatever you can from the scene and then call for one of us with the flare gun.",o="杀死特派使者莉芙·血叶和强大的考罗克，夺得伊利丹的命令。",oEN="Slay Chancellor Bloodleaf and Corok the Mighty and recover Illidan's Command.",p="你有什么要报告的，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="因此他们试图获得那些巨人的支持，呃？我有一个计划能切断这个邪恶的联盟。",cEN="So they are attempting to gain the favor of the giants, eh? I have a plan that could serve to sever this unholy union."}
Q[10775]={d="现在我们狮鹫骑士编队必须返回蛮锤要塞，马上开始准备发动下一轮的进攻。而你，我命令你在这边收集一些日蚀血精灵身上的徽章。\n\n收集到足够的徽章之后，你可以使用蛮锤信号枪召唤来一名狮鹫骑士。$r，接下来你就要当间谍了！",dEN="The gryphon riders must return to Wildhammer Stronghold to prepare for the next phase of our assault. What I need from you now are the tabards that these blood elves wear.\n\nWhen you have collected enough tabards, call for a gryphon rider using the Wildhammer flare gun. Prepare yourself for a bit of espionage, <race>!",o="收集 10 件伊利达雷外衣。|n",oEN="Collect 10 Illidari Tabards.",p="你有什么要报告的，士兵？",pEN="What have you to report, soldier?",c="啊哈！这些将完成的十分好。",cEN="Ah-ha! These will do quite nicely."}
Q[10776]={d="附魔材料全是诺姆斯准备的，我所要做的不过是将伊利达雷徽章浸入这些混合物中。好，完成了，这件徽章现在已经融合了伊利达雷的精华。\n\n带上这件魔化伊利达雷徽章，转至位于日蚀岗哨西南方的日蚀平原。你一进入平原后就立即换上它，伪装成伊利丹的手下，之后，利用这伪装杀死那些在平原上游荡的疯狂的巨人。这样一来，他们必定会认为血精灵缺乏与其结盟的诚意！",dEN="Gnomus was kind enough to put this concoction together for the final strike. I merely pour it upon this tabard that you have provided for me and the item is imbued with the essence of the Illidari filth.\n\nTake the enchanted tabard and travel to the Eclipsion Fields, southwest of Eclipse Point. Once there, use the tabard to transform into an agent of Illidan. While in disguise, slay the crazed colossi that wander the field. They will think it an attack by the Eclipsion and sever all ties!",o="伪装成伊利丹的手下，杀死5个疯狂的巨人，然后向影月谷内蛮锤要塞的大领主尤雷加尔复命，并将蛮锤信号枪一并交还给他。",oEN="Slay 5 Crazed Colossus while in disguise as an agent of Illidan and return to Thane Yoregar at Wildhammer Stronghold in Shadowmoon Valley. He will also want his Wildhammer Flare Gun returned.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You have returned!",c="好，好，好……这不是我派到野外的那个$g士兵:士兵;吗。你回来了，而且毫发无伤。\n\n<约雷加尔点头。>\n\n我就知道你不会让我失望，士兵。你阻止了伊利达雷的一次重大推进，也因此为自己赢得了一点奖赏。",cEN="Well, well, well... If it isn't the soldier I sent out into the field. You're back and in one piece.\n\n<Yoregar nods.>\n\nI knew you wouldn't let me down, soldier. You've stopped a major Illidari advance and, in doing so, earned yourself a little reward."}
Q[10777]={d="你从指挥官的日记中读到的故事是真的。当初，就在古尔丹集结兽人大军准备入侵艾泽拉斯世界时，我的族人们勇敢地提出抗议，想要阻止这场灾难。古尔丹获悉了这一切，便施放强大的法术摧毁了我们氏族的营地，扭曲了族人们的灵魂。\n\n必须在黑暗教团的家伙释放出更可怕的邪灵前阻止他们！转至北方的斯克瑟隆废墟寻找阿斯迦，取回他随身携带的图腾。这样，我们就能制止黑暗教团的计划了。",dEN="What you read in the commander's journal is true. While the orcish Horde massed under Gul'dan, my people sought to defend ourselves from the threat by striking against him. Gul'dan learned of their intentions and cast a mighty spell that destroyed our camps and twisted the spirits of my brothers.\n\nThey must be stopped before they unleash a greater evil. In the Sketh'lon Wreckage to the north, seek out Asghar and bring me the totem he carries. With it, we can begin to thwart the dark conclave's plans.",o="将斯克瑟隆作战图腾交给熔岩平原的帕沙恩。",oEN="Bring the Sketh'lon War Totem to Parshah in the Magma Fields.",p="你从阿斯迦那取得图腾了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the totem from Asghar?",c="<帕沙恩检查着图腾。>\n\n很好。过了这么多年这个旧图腾也没失去它的力量，但是只有它还不够制止黑暗教团。",cEN="<Parshah examines the totem.>\n\nGood. This old totem hasn't lost its power over the years, but it alone is not enough to stop the dark conclave."}
Q[10778]={d="斯克瑟隆作战图腾尚不足以与黑暗教团的邪恶魔法抗衡。\n\n我们可将图腾和其它拥有强大力量的物品组合起来，制作成一根聚能法杖。虽然已经无法将族人们从堕落的深渊中拯救出来，可我们至少能阻止他们越陷越深。\n\n首先我需要莉安丝魔棒，它在东南方日蚀岗哨的血精灵们手中。它被放置在废墟顶层的营帐中，周围有重兵把守。千万小心，$n。",dEN="The totem alone is not strong enough to counteract the sinister magics of the dark conclave.\n\nWe can combine it with other objects of power, forming a staff to focus the energies. We cannot rescue my brethren from the depths of their depravity, but we can stop them.\n\nOne of the items I need for the staff is the Rod of Lianthe, held by the blood elves at Eclipse Point to the southeast. It is kept in a pavilion on the top tier of the ruins and will be heavily guarded. Use caution, <name>.",o="从日蚀岗哨的血精灵身上夺得莉安丝的钥匙，用它打开莉安丝的保险箱并取出莉安丝魔棒。然后向熔岩平原的帕沙恩复命。",oEN="Obtain Lianthe's Key from any of the blood elves at Eclipse Point and use it to open Lianthe's Strongbox and claim the Rod of Lianthe. Return the rod to Parshah in the Magma Fields.",p="你有拿到那根魔棒吗？",pEN="Did you manage to get the rod?",c="做得好。这样的一个宝物不应该只是被隔离在一个黑暗的箱子里。我们将看见它用于有价值的目的。",cEN="Well done. Such a treasure deserves better than to be shut away in a dark chest. We shall see it used for a worthy purpose."}
Q[10780]={d="制作法杖还缺一样东西。我们必须将法杖的力量调整成可以针对黑暗教团精神力量的属性。\n\n收集散落在斯克瑟隆营地周围的羽毛来制作法杖。那个营地位于这里以南，蛮锤要塞以东。\n\n古尔丹强大的力量彻底摧毁了族人们的肉身，只剩下他们的灵魂在世间游荡，可事情远没有终结。鸦人还汲取了残留的魔法力量，他们那邪恶的仪式不断吞噬着族人们的灵魂。",dEN="There is one last element missing from the staff. We must direct the staff's power toward the Dark Conclave spirits.\n\nWe can do that by gathering feathers scattered on the ground at the Sketh'lon Base Camp and using them in the staff. The base camp is to the south, east of Wildhammer Stronghold.\n\nGul'dan's magic utterly destroyed my brethren, leaving only their spirits, but it did not stop there. The magic fed on the spell the arakkoa were preparing, forging a sinister force that engulfed the spirits.",o="收集8片斯克瑟隆羽毛，然后向熔岩平原的帕沙恩复命。",oEN="Gather 8 Sketh'lon Feathers and bring them to Parshah in the Magma Fields.",p="你收集到法杖所需要的羽毛了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the feathers for the staff?",c="<帕沙恩接过斯克瑟隆羽毛，摇着头。>\n\n如果他们那天死了，就会更好一点儿，但是不会那么简单的。那古尔丹的魔法将会把他们变成他们试图制止的威胁，是一种特别残酷之命运的扭曲。",cEN="<Parshah accepts the ash-dusted feathers, shaking his head.>\n\nIt would've been better if they had died that day, but nothing is ever that simple. That Gul'dan's magic would turn them into the kind of threat they tried to stop is a particularly cruel twist of fate."}
Q[10781]={d="他们很可能正在征服之路附近搜寻你的下落。$r，快逃命去吧！\n\n别管我了，我已经不行了……这帮家伙……我已经听见他们的脚步声了。现在就走！否则肯定来不及了！快逃走吧！如果你选择留下来，就必须奋战到底！\n\n若是你能在战斗中活下来，请一定要将此地的情形转告给沙塔斯城的阿达尔。",dEN="They are probably searching for you on the Path of Conquest as we speak. You must make your escape, <race>!\n\nLeave me, I'm done for... They... I think I hear them coming. It's now or never! Get out! If you choose to stay, you will have to fight!\n\nIf you fight and somehow manage to survive, take what you have learned here and deliver that knowledge to A'dal in Shattrath City.",o="击败驻守在火红岗哨的伊利丹的部队！\n\n获胜后向沙塔斯城的阿达尔复命。",oEN="Battle the forces of Illidan at Crimson Watch and survive!\n\nReturn to A'dal at Shattrath City should you emerge the victor.",p="<阿达尔向你表示问候。>",pEN="<A'dal greets you.>",c="这枚 crimson 徽记会被查清楚的。他们对德拉诺的一切生命都构成威胁。我预见有一天，他们黑暗的主子必须为自己的罪行付出代价。$g英雄:英雄;，也许那个人就是你。",cEN="This Crimson Sigil will be investigated. They pose a threat to all life on Draenor. I foresee a day when their dark master has to answer for his crimes. Perhaps it will be you who brings him to justice, hero."}
Q[10782]={d="法杖就快做好了！\n\n这片被诅咒的土地上依然涌动着古尔丹残存的力量，我们需要将这种力量灌入未完成的杖头。东边的魔能熔池附近有一座诅咒祭坛，就在死亡熔炉南面。\n\n那儿禁锢着古尔丹的残骸碎片。如果携带未完成的杖头进入祭坛，某些实体可能会对此做出回应，你可别惊慌失措。此行危险重重，请千万小心。",dEN="The staff is nearly finished!\n\nAll that remains is to imbue the headpiece with power flowing from the echoes of Gul'dan in this accursed place. To the east, near the Fel Pits and south of the Deathforge, is the Altar of Damnation.\n\nThere, fragments of Gul'dan's past are trapped. When you carry the unfinished headpiece of the staff into the area around the altar, don't be surprised if some of the entities react to it. You will be carrying a dangerous object with strong connections to the cataclysm.",o="带上未完成的杖头，转至诅咒祭坛，在古尔丹附近使用未完成的杖头。将充满能量的杖头交给熔岩平原的帕沙恩。",oEN="Equip the Unfinished Headpiece, travel to the Altar of Damnation, and use it while standing near Gul'dan. When the headpiece is energized, return to Parshah in the Magma Fields.",p="你带着充满能量的杖头回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the imbued headpiece?",c="<帕沙恩小心翼翼地接过杖头，然后将它握在手里。>\n\n这东西拥有足够的力量让我们中在斯克瑟隆营地里黑暗教团的所有努力。",cEN="<Parshah accepts the headpiece, handing it gingerly.>\n\nThis holds the power that we'll need to disrupt the dark conclave's efforts in the Sketh'lon Base Camp."}
Q[10783]={d="我的计划是在食人魔营地投毒，然后杀掉统治他们的戈隆。\n\n我曾在刀锋山遇见过一位名叫萨博迈恩男爵的炼金大师，我们可以试着说服他帮忙。\n\n穿过雷神要塞北边的峡谷，去鲜血之环找他吧。听听萨博迈恩开出的价码，就由你来决定是否要跟他达成协议。",dEN="Here is my plan. We will poison the ogres and then destroy their gronn master.\n\nDuring my travels in these mountains, I met a man named Baron Sablemane. He is a master of the alchemical arts, and may be convinced to assist us.\n\nYou will find him at the Circle of Blood, down in the canyon to the north of here. Whatever price he requires, I will leave it to your discretion to accept.",o="与刀锋山鲜血之环的萨博迈恩男爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="你好，<race>。我是黑鬃男爵。雷克萨的朋友就是我的朋友。",cEN="Hello, <race>. I am Baron Sablemane. A friend of Rexxar's is a friend of mine."}
Q[10784]={d="<托查克凑到你耳边，压低了嗓门。>\n\n$n，有你这样的勇士帮助我们对抗食人魔真是荣幸。我相信雷克萨已经制定了周密的计划，但是我还想请你帮个忙，在你返回雷神要塞前能不能去血槌营地杀些食人魔？\n\n这样会收到事半功倍的效果。\n\n沿着雷神要塞北边的坡道一直走，在坡道尽头往西穿越巨龙之末，然后往北穿越沸土峡谷和刃喉谷就到了。",dEN="<Tor'chunk leans in close to whisper.>\n\n<name>, you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres so far. And while I have every confidence in what Rexxar has planned, I would still ask that you crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp before returning.\n\nThat way we'll be doubly certain of the outcome.\n\nTo get there, head north down the ramp out of Thunderlord. Then, at the base of the ramp, head west across Dragons' End and north through the Churning Gulch and Daggermaw Canyon.",o="杀死10个血槌粗暴者和5个血槌术士。",oEN="Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks.",p="你消灭血槌营地了没？",pEN="Have you destroyed the Bloodmaul Camp yet?",c="<吐查克明显的点了点头嘉许你杀敌的勇猛。>\n\n你持续的让我印像深刻，$n。每一次打倒一个食人魔之时，我们就更进一步击退了我们的仇敌。",cEN="<Tor'chunk nods his head in obvious approval of your killing prowess.>\n\nYou continue to impress me, <name>. Every time one of those stinking ogres is felled, we come one step closer to ridding ourselves of an unworthy foe."}
Q[10785]={d="我对格鲁尔之子和他们的父亲简直恨之入骨。他们残忍地杀害了我的族人，连毫无抵抗力的孩子都没有放过，我要复仇。\n\n这是龙火制成的陷阱，如果你够聪明的话，应该能利用它杀死戈隆。\n\n把龙火陷阱交给雷克萨吧。平息我心中的怒火！",dEN="There's is no cause of fury greater in this world than that of Gruul and his sons. They slaughtered my people - my children - and now I will have revenge.\n\nI have fashioned a trap from dragon fire, and if you're clever enough, you can use it to kill even a gronn.\n\nJust hurry, take the trap to Rexxar. My thirst for revenge must be quenched.",o="将龙火陷阱交给刀锋山雷神要塞的雷克萨。",oEN="Deliver the Dragonfire Trap to Rexxar at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你有在戈隆的大袋里找到沙伯迈恩所需要的吗？他给了我们什么？",pEN="Did you recover whatever was in that gronn's sack for Sablemane? What has he given us?",c="嗯，一个由龙火的精华制作的陷阱吗？我很好奇沙伯迈恩是如何得到这种稀有的物质吗？\n\n那一点都不重要。重要的是我们将用它来杀死一个格鲁尔的儿子！",cEN="Hmm, a trap fashioned from the essence of dragon fire? I wonder how Sablemane comes by such rarified substances?\n\nIt does not matter. What does matter is that we are going to use it to slay a son of Gruul."}
Q[10786]={d="我知道雷克萨要你转至砾石营地执行任务，恰好有件事可以交给你顺路去办。\n\n我们必须把握一切机会，击毙盘踞在刀锋山的食人魔，否则他们就会攻入雷神要塞，摧毁我们用生命换来的土地！\n\n砾石营地在遥远的西北方。转至北面的卢安荒野，然后向西转，穿越隧道和乌鸦林就到了。\n\n$n，我要你杀死砾石营地的刀塔食人魔。消灭他们！",dEN="I know that Rexxar has plans for you to head to Boulder'mok. I have something that I want you to do while you are there.\n\nWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!\n\nBoulder'mok lies far to the northwest. Travel north to Ruuan Weald, and from there head west through the tunnel and past the Raven's Wood.\n\n<name>, I want you to kill the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok. Wipe them out!",o="杀死5个砾石蛮兵和3个砾石萨满祭司，然后返回刀锋山的雷神要塞向托查克·双爪复命。",oEN="Slay 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman, and then return to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at Thunderlord Stronghold in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="我们在短时间内已经走了很长的路，你和我。我敢说，你是我所见过的最能干的食人魔猎手。\n\n那么，我相信你很快就会去解决圆石莫克食人魔了？ $g你:你;",pEN="We have come a long way in a short time, you and I. I dare say that you are the most capable ogre hunter that I have ever known.\n\nI trust then that you will deal with the Boulder'mok ogres soon?",c="<托尔查克听你讲述在圆石莫克的冒险时咧嘴笑了。>\n\n啊，我真希望能和你一起在那里。让我告诉你一件事，：永远不要接受任何让你远离战斗荣耀的职责！\n\n哈！你杀了那么多食人魔，这些山里还给我剩下几个吗？！ $n $g你:你;",cEN="<Tor'chunk grins at the story that you tell him about your adventures at Boulder'mok.>\n\nAh, I wish that I could have been there with you. Let me tell you something, <name>: never accept any duty that keeps you from the glory of battle!\n\nHah! After all of the ogre killing that you've done, are there any still left in these mountains for me?!"}
Q[10788]={d="你的老师，银月城的塔莱尼娅想要见你，$n。我想你现在已经可以学习召唤并控制更为强大的恶魔了，所以我建议你尽快跟她会面。沿着谋杀小径前行，塔莱尼娅就在那个名叫“圣殿”的洞穴中——这名字可真讽刺。",dEN="One of your masters, Talionia, in Silvermoon City has sent a summons for you, <name>. I'm certain it is time you learned to summon and control a more powerful demon, so I suggest you see her at once. I understand Talionia is found in The Sanctum, a cozy little den of evil found along Murder Row.",o="转至银月城，与塔莱尼娅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Talionia in Silvermoon City.",c="那么$g这位:这位;旅行者回来了……\n\n希望我的讽刺够明显，$n，因为你逼我发出召唤，给我添了很大麻烦。想想看，你离被烧成灰只差一根地狱卫士的头发，而他们根本没有头发。\n\n仔细听好，这堂课我不会讲第二遍。",cEN="So the world traveler returns...\n\nI hope my sarcasm is evident, <name>, for you have inconvenienced me greatly by forcing me to send out a summons. Consider that you are but a felguard's hair away from incineration, and they don't have any hair.\n\nPay attention closely, this is not a lesson you'll get twice."}
Q[10789]={d="啊，$n，你终于露面了。\n\n幽暗城魔法区的凯伦丁·哈加尔传话来叫你回去。这家伙的耐性可不大好，所以我急着把这事儿告诉你。",dEN="Ah, so there you are, <name>.\n\nCarendin Halgar has sent out word for you to come see him in the Magic Quarter of Undercity. He is not known for his patience, so I would not wait long.",o="转至幽暗城，与凯伦丁·哈加尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Carendin Halgar in Undercity.",c="是的，我从你的眼窝里看出来了。你渴望学到更多。\n\n很好，这是一堂我们双方都会享受的课。 $g你:你;",cEN="Yes, I can see it in your eye sockets. You are eager to learn more.\n\nVery well, this is a lesson we'll both enjoy."}
Q[10790]={d="$R，离家多时了吧？是不是该回去跟你的老师甘鲁尔·血眼讨教点新知识了？他的博学多识几乎人尽皆知。\n\n甘鲁尔就居住在奥格瑞玛的暗影裂口。",dEN="You are a long way from home, <race>. Perhaps it is time you returned to learn from your master, Gan'rul Bloodeye. His knowledge is known to all of our craft, even those of us here.\n\nGan'rul dwells in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",o="转至奥格瑞玛，与甘鲁尔·血眼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gan'rul Bloodeye in Orgrimmar.",c="你渴望的是被禁止的知识，是吗？我能给你……",cEN="It is the forbidden knowledge you hunger for, is it? I can give you that..."}
Q[10791]={d="我在仪式上要穿的祭服快完成了。在我做最后修饰的时候，希望你能把这香放到我左边符文石旁的蜡烛边。\n\n我相信这能帮我们吸引狼灵的注意，因为它是在兽人氏族时代制作的。我几乎能想象出我的先祖在一次成功狩猎后，用它举行向狼灵致敬的仪式。\n\n放好香之后，我就开始仪式。",dEN="I've nearly completed the vestments that I'll wear during the ceremony. As I add the finishing touches, I'd like you to set this incense by the candles near the runestone to my left.\n\nI believe it will help us to attract the wolf spirit's attention, since it was made in the days of the orcish clans. I can almost imagine my ancestors using it in a ceremony paying tribute to the wolf spirit after a successful hunt.\n\nOnce you've placed the incense, I'll begin the ceremony.",o="在玛鲁卡兹的棚屋中靠近烛台的地方使用仪祭熏香，并观看仪式。仪式完成之后，与玛鲁卡兹谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Ceremonial Incense near the candles in Malukaz's hut and observe the ceremony. When the ceremony is complete, speak with Malukaz again.",p="与狼魂重建联系正是我旅行的开始。",pEN="Reestablishing ties with the wolf spirit is just the beginning of my journey, not the end.",c="这是难以置信的！我在不确定是否狼魂将回应我们召唤的旅行上出发，但现在彷佛觉得他总是到过这里。或许他到过，$n。\n\n或许他正等着兽人意识到他们的选择已经做了。",cEN="This is incredible! I set out on this journey unsure of whether the wolf spirit would answer our summons and now it feels as though he's always been here. Perhaps he was, <name>.\n\nPerhaps he was waiting for the orcs to realize what their choices had wrought."}
Q[10792]={d="血环氏族背离了兽人高贵的传统！只有誓死与玛诺洛斯的嗜血诅咒抗争过的勇士才算得上真正的兽人。我们鄙视那些邪恶的表亲，瞧瞧他们软弱低贱的模样……堕落的兽人应该被烧死！\n\n进入东边血环兽人的据点塞斯高，烧毁他们的建筑物。从血环苦工手中夺得火炬，利用塞斯高的熔炉点燃火炬并将它们扔进兽人的房舍、兽栏和兵营。焚毁塞斯高，然后再回来找我！\n\n为了部落！",dEN="The Bleeding Hollow clan have betrayed their noble heritage! We, the orcs who fought and died to save ourselves from the fel taint of Mannoroth, look upon our vile cousins and see only weakness and ignobility... and for that, they must burn!\n\nEnter Zeth'Gor, their bastion to the east, and burn their buildings. Kill peons for their torches, ignite them at their forge, and hurl the burning torches at their hovels, their stable and their barracks. Burn them all, and then return to me!\n\nFor the Horde!",o="从血环苦工手中夺得火炬，利用塞斯高的熔炉点燃火炬，并将它们扔进塞斯高的建筑物中。",oEN="Kill Bleeding Hollow Peons for their torches, ignite them at Zeth'Gor's forge then throw the burning torches at Zeth'Gor Buildings.",p="塞斯高必须被烧毁，$n！当你的任务完成时，再次与我谈话。",pEN="Zeth'Gor must burn, <name>! Speak with me again when your task is complete.",c="哈！我从这里就能看见塞斯高的烟雾和火焰！那些血环恶魔可能已烧成灰，并且远离了真正兽人的视线！\n\n感谢你，$n。你帮助烧毁了每一个兽人灵魂的梦魇。",cEN="Hah! I could see the smoke and flames of Zeth'Gor from here! May the Bleeding Hollow fiends burn to ash and drift far from the sight of any true orc!\n\nThank you, <name>. You helped burn away an afront to every orc's spirit."}
Q[10793]={d="日志中记载了伊利丹军队近期的动向，还提到了瓦萨雷克率兵驻守征服之路的原因。原来这家伙亲手俘虏了一名沙塔尔高级将领。\n\n当前，这位将军被关押在位于征服之路南端的火红岗哨。一个名叫火色魔印的神秘组织负责看守囚犯。你若是想要调查此事，最好叫上你的朋友一同转至。",dEN="This journal documents the recent activities of Illidan's armies. It also explains why Val'zareq was parading around the Path of Conquest. He was personally responsible for the capture of a high general of the Sha'tar.\n\nThis general is being held at a post known as Crimson Watch, located at the southern end of the Path of Conquest. A mysterious faction, calling itself the Crimson Sigil, is charged with his incarceration. If you choose to investigate, it would be wise to bring allies.",o="转至火红岗哨寻找玛库斯·奥拉林，他是沙塔尔的高级将领。\n\n你可以在一间水晶监狱中找到他。",oEN="Locate Marcus Auralion, High General of the Sha'tar, at Crimson Watch.\n\nLook for him inside a crystalline prison.",p="<阿瑞利恩将军漂浮在水晶中间。>\n\n你……你在这里做什么？",pEN="<General Auralion is floating in the middle of the crystal.>\n\nWha... What are you doing here?",c="你杀掉他们的征服者了？那么我们没有很多时间……\n\n赤红法印是一个由伊利丹杰出的爪牙所组成团体。他们是在黑暗神庙外所有伊利达雷部队之指挥系统的顶端。这些士兵直接与这里的背叛者通信，并毫无疑问地执行他的命令。\n\n他们无疑是对这个世界发动攻击的恶魔，践踏挡住他们道路的所有人。",cEN="You slew their conqueror? Then we haven't much time...\n\nThe Crimson Sigil is a group comprised of Illidan's elite minions. They are at the top of the chain of command for all Illidari forces outside of the Black Temple. These soldiers communicate directly with the Betrayer here, carrying out his orders without question.\n\nThey are the fiends that will undoubtedly lead an assault on this world, trampling under foot all that would stand in their way."}
Q[10794]={d="$n，这世界上还有许多我们尚未掌握的秘密。奥格瑞玛的碎手氏族可以帮助你学会这些秘密的其中之一：制造毒药。做他们要求你做的事情，首先获得他们的信任吧。\n\n想去奥格瑞玛的话，你必须使用银月城的传送装置抵达幽暗城。然后走出幽暗城外，找到附近的一处飞艇空港。从那里就可以直接飞到奥格瑞玛了。到了那边后，去暗影裂谷中找到申苏尔吧。",dEN="<name>, there are secrets in the world that we do not yet possess. The Shattered Hand in Orgrimmar can lead you to one of these secrets: the method for brewing deadly poisons. Do as they ask and you will gain their trust.\n\nTo reach Orgrimmar, take the portal in Silvermoon City to Undercity. Then, travel outside the city and find the nearby tower where the goblin Zepplins pick up their passengers. From there, fly to the city of Orgrimmar where you can find Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow.",o="与奥格瑞玛的申苏尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Shenthul in Orgrimmar.",c="因此，你想要为碎手工作吗？好像我们每天都有新人进来。\n\n仔细听好，我将解释你必须做些什么。",cEN="So, you want to work for the Shattered Hand? Seems like we're getting someone new every day.\n\nPay close attention and I'll explain what you have to do."}
Q[10795]={d="我在常青林见过你好几次，一直想跟你商量件事。\n\n我接到好几份报告，称血槌食人魔准备对希尔瓦纳和卢安荒野发动攻击。我们还不知道是谁在背后捣鬼，不过先下手为强，必须将他们的计划扼杀在摇篮中！\n\n食人魔的作战基地血槌营地就在卢安荒野的西北方，去干掉他们的首领多古克！",dEN="Good, I've seen you around and I've been meaning to speak to you about a matter of some importance.\n\nThere are reports coming in that for some reason the Bloodmaul ogres are planning an offensive against Sylvanaar and Ruuan Weald. We don't know who or what is pushing them to do this, but I intend to nip their plan in the bud!\n\nBloodmaul Camp is where the attacks are to be staged from. Head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald and you will find it. I want you to kill their leader, Dorgok!",o="转至血槌营地杀死多古克。",oEN="Slay Dorgok at Bloodmaul Camp.",p="我无法足够强烈地表示你尽快杀死多古克有多重要。",pEN="I cannot express strongly enough how important it is that you kill Dorgok as quickly as possible.",c="多古克一死，血槌食人魔就没有领导了，且应该会处在混乱里，直到另一位领导人从他们的行列里出现。\n\n谢谢你，$c，我认为我们现在能呼吸得容易一点了。",cEN="With Dorgok dead, the Bloodmaul ogres are without leadership, and should be in disarray until another leader arises from within their ranks.\n\nThank you, <class>, I think we can breathe a little easier now."}
Q[10796]={d="听说你狠狠地打击了食人魔的嚣张气焰，大家都为此感到自豪。现在我要你再次拿起武器，踏平血槌营地！\n\n沿着卢安荒野西北方的坡谷一直走就是血槌营地了。\n\n$c，祝你好运！",dEN="I've heard that you've done us more than proud in the fight against the ogres thus far. Now, I would ask that you face them again. I want you to crush the ogres at Bloodmaul Camp!\n\nTo get down there, head northwest down the ramp out of the Ruuan Weald. You'll find them at the base of the ramp.\n\nGood luck, <class>!",o="杀死10个血槌粗暴者和5个血槌术士。",oEN="Slay 10 Bloodmaul Maulers and 5 Bloodmaul Warlocks.",p="你摧毁了血槌营地了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed the Bloodmaul Camp yet?",c="<中尉点头，显然赞许你的杀戮本领。>\n\n我很佩服，。你的名声看来名副其实。\n\n每当有一个食人魔倒下，我们就离摆脱一个无意让我们安宁的危险更近一步。 <name>",cEN="<The lieutenant nods her head in obvious approval of your killing prowess.>\n\nI am impressed, <name>. Your reputation seems to be well-deserved.\n\nEvery time one of the ogres is felled, we come one step closer to ridding ourselves of a danger that has no intention of leaving us in peace."}
Q[10797]={d="一尊小雕像从多古克掌中滑落。雕像上的人物竟然与某个戈隆惊人地相似。\n\n指挥官海弗斯·石墙一定会对此感兴趣的！沿着东面的坡谷进入卢安荒野，去常青林找他吧。",dEN="A token in the form of a small statuette falls from Dorgok's dead clutch. It bears a striking resemblance to one of the gronn.\n\nSurely, Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Ruuan Weald, up the ramp to the east, would be interested in this!",o="将高格鲁姆的信物交给刀锋山常青林的指挥官海弗斯·石墙。",oEN="Deliver Gorgrom's Favor to Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你好，$g少年:少女，你带来什么消息？",pEN="Hello, <lad/lass>, what news do you bring?",c="喔，漂亮。看起来很像总是在指挥周遭刀塔食人魔的那些戈隆。\n\n奇怪的是你应该在血槌领导人之一的手里找到它。",cEN="Oh, now that's pretty. Looks a lot like those gronn that are always bossing the Bladespire ogres around.\n\nOdd that you should find it in the hands of one of the Bloodmaul leaders."}
Q[10798]={d="这真是个坏消息。原来是食龙者高格鲁姆暗地里指使血槌食人魔滋扰希尔瓦纳！\n\n刀塔食人魔已经搅得我们不得安宁了，我想不通他为什么还要操纵血槌食人魔来对付希尔瓦纳。要想与戈隆抗衡，单凭我们的力量是不够的。\n\n我认识一位名叫萨博迈恩男爵的能人，他精通各种奇异的魔法。去鲜血之环找他吧，沿着坡道往南走，穿过东南方的峡谷就到了。\n\n向萨博迈恩男爵寻求帮助，请他替我们制作对付戈隆的陷阱。",dEN="This is bad news. Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater is behind the recent Bloodmaul plans against Sylvanaar!\n\nWhy he's manipulating them, and not just using the Bladespire, I don't know. But if we're to deal with a gronn, we're going to need help.\n\nI know a man who is wise in the ways of all sorts of exotic magics. Baron Sablemane is his name, and you can find him at the Circle of Blood, back down the ramp to the northwest, and then southwest through the canyon.\n\nAsk him to fashion us a trap for the gronn.",o="与萨博迈恩男爵谈谈。他就在刀锋山的鲜血之环。",oEN="Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="啊，一个自负联盟来的使者。告诉我，仆人，为什么你在这里，为这事恳求我，而不是你的杰出指挥官？\n\n会是他害怕我吗？它意味着某些关于不是你的事情，但是我还没完全决定那是什么。",cEN="Ah, an envoy from the vaunted Alliance. Tell me, lackey, why is it that you are here, begging me for this thing, instead of your illustrious commander?\n\nCould it be that he is afraid of me? It says something about you that you are not, but I haven't quite decided yet what that is."}
Q[10799]={d="嗯，我会帮你制作龙火陷阱，但是你得用别的东西来交换。\n\n鲜血之环附近居住着一个戈隆，他手中有我想要的东西。但是你不能直接面对他，至少现在还不是时候。\n\n我打算利用硬壳穿地虫的毒囊配制某种催眠粉。\n\n硬壳穿地虫就分布在西南方的沸土峡谷，把它们的毒囊带回来给我，动作快点！",dEN="Very well, I'll create this trap, but first I want something in return.\n\nThere happens to be a nearby gronn that is in possession of an item that I want, but you can't face him, not yet anyway.\n\nSo, you and I are going to fashion a sleeping powder from the poison of the nearby crust bursters.\n\nYou'll find them in the Churning Gulch to the southwest. Bring me a number of their glands, and be quick about it!",o="将7个硬壳穿地虫的毒囊交给刀锋山鲜血之环的萨博迈恩男爵。",oEN="Collect 7 Crust Burster Venom Glands.",p="你弄到全部的地壳穿刺者毒腺了吗？如果不是，就离开这里不要浪费我的时间！",pEN="You have all of the venom glands? If not, begone and waste no more of my time until you do!",c="非常好，以世人的角度来看，一份简单的工作完成了。现在，把腺体交给我，我就会进行最困难的部分。",cEN="Very well. A simple, if mundane, task has been completed. Now, hand me the glands and I will perform the difficult part."}
Q[10800]={d="我真是个天才。催眠粉已经配制好了，利用它去对付那个名叫格鲁洛克的戈隆吧。我说过，这家伙手中有我想要的东西。\n\n转至鲜血之环另一侧，巨龙之末东部边缘的诅咒洞窟寻找他的踪迹。\n\n如果我是你的话，一拿到格鲁洛克的包裹，我就会立即离开。催眠粉的有效时间不会持续太长的。",dEN="I've outdone myself again. I've fashioned a sleeping powder for you to use on Grulloc, the gronn I spoke of who is guarding what I want.\n\nGrulloc keeps himself at the Cursed Hollow, an area at the eastern edge of Dragons' End on the other side of the Circle of Blood.\n\nIf I were you, I wouldn't tarry long once you have his sack. The effects of the dust won't last long.",o="偷走格鲁洛克的包裹，将它交给刀锋山鲜血之环的萨博迈恩男爵。",oEN="Collect Grulloc's Sack.",p="你再次来到我面前，$c。这必定代表着你已经从格鲁洛克的鼻子下面取出袋子。",pEN="You are before me again, <class>. This must mean that you've procured the sack out from underneath Grulloc's nose.",c="<沙伯迈恩男爵凝视着戈隆的袋子里面，看起来好像很满足。>\n\n非常好，你已经履行约定了。现在，我将给你的指挥官海法斯·石墙那个陷阱。",cEN="<Baron Sablemane peers inside the gronn's sack and seems satisfied.>\n\nVery well, you have upheld your end of the bargain. And now, I will gift your Commander Stonewall with the trap."}
Q[10801]={d="我对格鲁尔之子和他们的父亲简直恨之入骨！他们残忍地杀害了我的族人，连毫无抵抗力的孩子都没有放过，我要复仇！\n\n这是龙火制成的陷阱，如果你够聪明的话，应该能利用它杀死戈隆。\n\n我知道你有自己的计划，不过我不在乎你杀死的是哪一个。把龙火陷阱交给指挥官海弗斯·石墙吧。\n\n平息我心中的怒火！",dEN="There's nothing more that I hate in this world than the sons of Gruul and their father! They slaughtered my people, and my children, and now I will have a taste of revenge!\n\nI have fashioned a trap from some dragon fire, and if you're clever enough, you might just be able to use it to kill a gronn.\n\nI'm sure that you have a particular gronn in mind; it matters not to me which one you kill. Just hurry, take the trap to your Commander Stonewall.\n\nMy thirst for revenge must be quenched!",o="将龙火陷阱交给刀锋山常青林的指挥官海弗斯·石墙。",oEN="Deliver the Dragonfire Trap to Commander Haephus Stonewall at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="男爵帮我们做了陷阱了吗？强大的足以杀死一只戈隆吗？",pEN="Did the baron fashion us a trap? One powerful enough to kill a gronn?",c="嗯，一个由龙火焰的本质制作的陷阱吗？不知道沙伯迈恩怎样得到这样稀薄的物质？\n\n一点儿也不重要。重要的是我们将用它来杀死一个格鲁尔的儿子！",cEN="Hmm, a trap fashioned from the essence of dragon flame? I wonder how Sablemane comes by such rarified substances?\n\nIt does not matter. What does matter is that we are going to use it to slay a son of Gruul!"}
Q[10802]={d="必须让食人魔明白，我们不是好惹的。得给他们点颜色看看。\n\n杀入砾石营地，取得食人魔的徽记。\n\n在高格鲁姆的祭坛处布下陷阱，诱使高格鲁姆落入圈套。利用陷阱杀死高格鲁姆后，将可怕的图腾插在他的尸体旁。那些食人魔就会知道，如果他们胆敢再次来犯的话，高格鲁姆和那些死去的同伴就是他们的下场。",dEN="We must show the ogres that we are not to be trifled with. We must send a message.\n\nTravel to Boulder'mok and kill the ogres there. Make sure you keep their heads.\n\nThen go to Gorgrom's altar and place the trap there for him. Gorgrom will appear, and you must lure him into the trap. When he is dead, mount your grisly totems near his corpse, so that the ogres may look at their fallen master and their fallen brothers, and know the price for seeking to destroy us.",o="转至砾石营地，从砾石食人魔手中夺得3根可怕的图腾。在高格鲁姆的祭坛处使用萨博迈恩的陷阱召唤并杀死食龙者高格鲁姆。\n\n高格鲁姆死后，将3根可怕的图腾插在他旁边，然后返回刀锋山常青林向指挥官海弗斯·石墙复命。",oEN="Collect 3 Grisly Totems from Boulder'mok ogres. Then, use Sablemane's Trap at Gorgrom's Altar to summon and kill Gorgrom the Dragon-Eater.\n\nWhen Gorgrom is dead, place the 3 Grisly Totems near his corpse.",p="讯息被递送了吗？",pEN="Has the message been delivered?",c="做得好，$n。做得好！\n\n我怀疑我们会从巨魔和他们的主人那里听到更多消息。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Well done!\n\nI suspect we will hear little more from the ogres and their master."}
Q[10803]={d="我知道你要转至砾石营地执行任务，恰好有件事可以交给你顺路去办。\n\n我们必须把握一切机会，击毙盘踞在刀锋山的食人魔，否则他们就会攻入常青林，摧毁我们用生命换来的土地！\n\n砾石营地就在西边。往西南方前进，越过大桥和隧道，乌鸦林以西就是砾石营地了。\n\n$n，我要你杀死砾石营地的刀塔食人魔。",dEN="I know that we have plans for you to head to Boulder'mok. I have something that I want you to do while you are there.\n\nWe must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us, and all that we have bled and died for will be for nothing!\n\nBoulder'mok lies to the west. Travel southwest, cross the bridge and head through the tunnel. On the west side of the Raven's Wood you will find them.\n\n<name>, I want you to wipe out the Bladespire ogres of Boulder'mok.",o="杀死5个砾石蛮兵和3个砾石萨满祭司。",oEN="Slaughter 5 Boulder'mok Brutes and 3 Boulder'mok Shaman.",p="我敢说，你是我所见过的最能干的食人魔猎手。\n\n那么，我相信你很快就会去解决圆石莫克食人魔了？ $g你:你;",pEN="I dare say that you are the most capable ogre hunter that I have ever known.\n\nI trust then that you will deal with the Boulder'mok ogres soon?",c="<费尔韦瑟中尉听你讲述在圆石莫克的冒险时咧嘴笑了。>\n\n啊，我真希望能和你一起在那里。让我告诉你一件事，：永远不要接受任何让你远离战场荣耀的职责！\n\n哈！你杀了那么多食人魔，这些山里还给我剩下几个吗？！ $n $g你:你;",cEN="<Lieutenant Fairweather grins at the story that you tell her about your adventures at Boulder'mok.>\n\nAh, I wish that I could have been there with you. Let me tell you something, <name>: never accept any duty that keeps you from the glory of the battlefield!\n\nHah! After all of the ogre killing that you've done, are there any still left in these mountains for me?!"}
Q[10804]={d="不知道它们受到了什么惊吓，$r。\n\n<莫德奈指着盘旋在空中的虚空幼龙。>\n\n它们甚至不肯下来进食。已经有好几只虚空幼龙精疲力竭，直挺挺地坠落在地。\n\n我们必须挽救它们的性命！虚空幼龙以岩爪劫掠者为食。猎杀水晶附近的岩爪劫掠者，将岩爪劫掠者肉块放在地上等待虚空幼龙前来进食。只要你站立不动，别做任何进攻性的动作，它们是不会伤害你的。",dEN="Something has them spooked, <race>.\n\n<Mordenai points to the nether drakes flying overhead.>\n\nThey won't even come down to feed. I have seen several fall to the earth, dead from exhaustion before their bodies hit the ground.\n\nWe must save them! The Rocknail flayers that are found near the crystals are their natural prey. Kill flayers and take their carcasses. Place a carcass in the field and stand extremely still. As long as you do not make any aggressive motions, they will not attack you.",o="影月谷灵翼平原的莫德奈要你喂养8只成熟的灵翼幼龙。",oEN="Mordenai at Netherwing Fields in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to feed 8 Mature Netherwing Drakes.",p="我不能靠自己救出他们，$n！",pEN="I cannot save them by myself, <name>!",c="你是个善良而富有同情心的，。 $g你:你; $g你:你; $g你:你;",cEN="You are a kind and compassionate <race>, friend."}
Q[10805]={d="你真是位足智多谋的勇士，现在我要派你去对付格鲁尔和他的儿子们，为我报仇雪恨。\n\n刀塔氏族备受戈隆的宠爱。你或许杀过不少刀塔食人魔，但是应该还没有跟他们中的强者较量过吧。\n\n格鲁尔安排了最强壮的食人魔驻守在巢穴外，你必须削弱他们的防御力量。往北穿越刃喉谷，格鲁尔的巢穴就在刃喉谷尽头。",dEN="You've proven yourself resourceful, and now I think I'm going to put you to personal use in my own fight against Gruul and his sons.\n\nThe Bladespire clan are the favored of the gronn, and while you may have thinned out their numbers elsewhere, you haven't yet dealt with their strongest.\n\nGruul protects the exterior of his lair with only the toughest of ogres, and it is those that you must kill. Head north through the Daggermaw Canyon and you will find Gruul's Lair at the end.",o="杀死10个刀塔执行者、5个刀塔战斗法师、5个刀塔掠食者和他们的首领芬戈洛姆。",oEN="Slay 10 Bladespire Enforcers, 5 Bladespire Battlemages, 5 Bladespire Ravagers and their leader, Fingrom.",p="你设法消灭在格鲁尔的巢穴的刀塔食人魔了吗？\n\n不要给我理由，$g男孩:女孩！完成这工作！",pEN="Have you managed yet to decimate the Bladespire ogres at Gruul's Lair?\n\nDo not come to me with excuses, <boy/girl>! Get the job done!",c="非常好，我选你带领我的战斗是明智选择。我想，事情进展到全新的局面了。\n\n你记得你从在格鲁洛克的鼻子下面为我偷的那个小东西吗？你将要有机会充分利用它了。",cEN="Very well, I chose wisely when I selected you to spearhead my fight. Time to ramp things up to a whole new level, I think.\n\nYou remember that little goodie that you stole for me out from underneath Grulloc's nose? You're going to get a chance to put it to good use."}
Q[10806]={d="与刀塔食人魔的统治者——苟克决战的时刻即将来临。我要亲临现场，见证戈隆的死亡。\n\n在苟克的祭坛处使用我的徽记，我会与你并肩作战。\n\n让我们共同击败苟克吧。",dEN="The time has come for us to face Goc, the master of the Bladespire ogres. It is also time that I take a hand in events, to see the last of the gronn's life.\n\nTake my signet ring. When you come to the Altar of Goc, use it, and I will come to join you.\n\nTogether we will destroy Goc.",o="在苟克的祭坛处使用萨博迈恩的徽记，杀死苟克。",oEN="Use Sablemane's Signet at the Altar of Goc, then kill Goc.",p="不久之后，格鲁尔全部的儿子都将被消灭。 ",pEN="In time, all the sons of Gruul will be destroyed.",c="你身为$r的战斗出色的令人吃惊，很荣幸有你在我身边。我的转变一定让你感到相当的惊讶。我相信它没吓到你吧？\n\n让我们替我的真实身份保密，好吗？做为报答，和感谢你的内行服务，我准许你选择这些小玩意中的任何一个。",cEN="You fought surprisingly well for a <race>, and it was an honor to have you at my side. My transformation must have been quite a surprise for you. I trust it was not too startling?\n\nLet us keep my true identity between the two of us for now, shall we? In return, and for your adept service, I grant you your choice of any of these baubles."}
Q[10807]={d="灰舌氏族是所有破碎者中最可怕的存在，这个氏族的成员都经过阿卡玛的精挑细选，个个生性邪恶、嗜血成瘾。即使是与伊利丹麾下的其它纳迦部队、恶魔部队或是血精灵部队相比，他们的残忍与无情也毫不逊色。眼下，有大批灰舌破碎者盘踞在北方的巴尔里废墟一带。我们要先下手为强，在这帮家伙有机会攻击我们之前削弱他们的势力。",dEN="The Ashtongue tribe is feared among all Broken. It consists of the most vicious and bloodthirsty individuals, handpicked by Akama himself. They are as fierce and ruthless as any naga, demon or blood elf in Illidan's army and they have been deployed in large numbers at the Ruins of Baa'ri, to the north. Go there and put a dent in their numbers before they get a chance to mount an attack on us.",o="劝诫者瓦伦要你进入巴尔里废墟，杀死3名灰舌驯兽者、4名灰舌战士和6名灰舌萨满祭司。\n\n为占星者完成任务将降低你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级。",oEN="Varen the Reclaimer wants you to go to the Ruins of Baa'ri and slay 3 Ashtongue Handlers, 4 Ashtongue Warriors and 6 Ashtongue Shaman.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="你已经完成我交给你的任务了吗，$n？",pEN="Have you completed the task I requested of you, <name>?",c="占星者万岁，$n。你已经完成预言者的命令打败了伊利丹的追随者。",cEN="Glory to the Scryers, <name>. You've done the Seer's bidding by defeating those who follow Illidan."}
Q[10808]={d="黑暗教团当前正在斯克瑟隆营地以南的熔岩坑举行仪式，企图召唤强大的上古邪灵。\n\n他们汲取了古尔丹残存的魔法，强化了自身的力量，想要帮助邪灵来到我们的世界！$n，我们绝不能让这种事发生。一旦黑暗教团的奸计得逞，上古邪灵引发的毁灭性后果简直难以想象！\n\n带上法杖转至熔岩坑，彻底破坏黑暗教团的召唤仪式！",dEN="The spirits of the dark conclave seek to summon an ancient and powerful evil through a ritual conducted at the lava pits to the south of the Sketh'lon Base Camp.\n\nGul'dan's magic mingled with their own, empowering them to aid this creature in manifesting in our world! We must not allow this to happen, <name>. The death and destruction it would bring are unimaginable!\n\nCarry the staff with you to the site of the summoning and use its magics to stop the dark conclave once and for all!",o="杀死黑暗教团仪祭者，然后使用帕沙恩的法杖破坏黑暗教团的召唤仪式。完成任务之后向熔岩平原的帕沙恩复命。",oEN="Slay the Dark Conclave Ritualists and use the Staff of Parshah to end the Dark Conclave's summoning ritual, then return to Parshah in the Magma Fields.",p="完成了吗，$n？你阻止黑暗教团完成仪式了吗？",pEN="Is it done, <name>? Have you stopped the dark conclave from completing their ritual?",c="我已经寻找一种可制止黑暗教团的方法许多年了，而你已经在我失败的地方成功了。教团的黑暗仪式将不再威胁我们。\n\n我经常为多年以前放弃我全部的同伴感到内疚，但是现在我终于知道我做了正确的决定。那么，要不是因为我摇摆的良心，我可能只是他们其中的一个幽影了。",cEN="I have sought a way to stop the dark conclave for years, and you have succeeded where I failed. The conclave's dark rituals will threaten us no more.\n\nI often feel guilty for abandoning my fellows all those years ago, but now I finally know that I made the right decision. If not for my wavering conscience then, I might have ended up as a shade among them."}
Q[10809]={d="告示上写着：\n\n「狼主克鲁什率领着血环氏族的座狼骑手。他的首级已被悬赏，因为他的骑手让通往碎脊哨站的补给列车付出了惨重代价。」\n\n「斥候报告他就在塞斯高一带。能将这名恶徒的首级带给我的人，将赢得部落的感谢和一笔丰厚的赏金。」\n\n「——暗嚎上尉」\"\"\"\"\"\"",dEN="The poster reads:\n\n\"Worg Master Kruush leads the worg riders of the Bleeding Hollow clan. A price has been placed on his head, for his riders exact heavy tolls on supply trains to Spinebreaker Post.\"\n\n\"Scouts report him within Zeth'Gor, and the hero able to bring the severed head of this villain to me will earn the thanks of the Horde, and a large bounty.\"\n\n\"-Captain Darkhowl\"",o="杀死座狼主宰卡鲁什，将他的徽记交给断背岗哨的达克霍尔上尉。",oEN="Kill Worg Master Kruush and bring his head to Captain Darkhowl in Spinebreaker Post.",p="报告，$n。我在你袖子上看见的是卡鲁什的血吗？我希望是！",pEN="Report, <name>. Is that Bleeding Hollow blood I see on your sleeve? I hope so!",c="啊，因此你杀了那个恶棍卡鲁什！做得好，$n！做得好！他的死将使那些受诅咒的座狼骑士受挫。事实上，我希望你在突袭塞斯高期间解决掉他们一些人！\n\n这里是你的报酬。这是你应得的！",cEN="Ah, so you slew that villain, Kruush! Well done, <name>! Well done! His death will defang those cursed worg riders. In fact, I hope you took a few of them out during your foray into Zeth'Gor!\n\nHere's your reward. You earned every piece of it!"}
Q[10810]={d="当你检查着这个破碎的面具时，似乎听到其中传出了某种奇怪的声音。如果这个面具没有损坏，或许声音还会更清晰一些。\n\n卢安荒野的塔利·萨普纳波或许能修好这个面具。",dEN="As you examine the damaged mask, you hear strange sounds coming from within. If the mask wasn't damaged you might be able to hear the sounds more clearly.\n\nO'Mally Zapnabber in Ruuan Weald might be able to fix the mask.",o="将损坏的面具交给卢安荒野的欧玛利·萨普纳波。",oEN="Deliver the Damaged Mask to O'Mally Zapnabber at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="别来烦我！你看不出来我正在解开神秘力量的秘密吗？",pEN="Don't be bothering me! Can't you see I'm trying to unlock mysterious powers?",c="喔，你拿来了什么？让我仔细的看看，$c。是的，是的……这跟我想的一样。嘿，让我帮你把这个面具修好吧。",cEN="Ah, what's that you have? Let me take a closer look, <class>. Yes, yes... it's just what I thought it was. Here, let me fix this mask for you."}
Q[10811]={d="他们的守护者翱翔在高空之上，$n。也许你对他孩子们展现的善意打动了他的心。去找到奈尔萨拉库，争取他的帮助。你们合力，或许能解决虚空之翼幼龙的困境。\n\n<莫德奈指向天空。>\n\n高飞吧，$g朋友:朋友;……",dEN="Their patron soars high above, <name>. Perhaps the kindness that you showed his children has moved his heart. Seek Neltharaku out and enlist his aid. Together, you may be able to solve the plight of the Netherwing drakes.\n\n<Mordenai points to the sky.>\n\nFly high, friend...",o="寻找奈尔萨拉库，虚空龙族的领袖。",oEN="Seek out Neltharaku, patron of the Netherwing Dragonflight.",c="我的孩子已经告诉我你的英雄行为，$r。你愿意继续帮助我们吗？",cEN="My children have told me of your heroic deeds, <race>. There is more that you can do."}
Q[10812]={d="好了，现在应该没问题了。啊？你问这是什么？怎么说呢，它是个联络工具，有了这个，那些傻瓜就可以互相联络了。谁是傻瓜？就是燃烧军团呀！我建议你把这个面具带去给荒野之王安塔里恩看看，他就在那边踱着方步呢。他老是走来走去的，静不下来。\n\n好了，快去吧，他最近一直想搞到一个这种面具。",dEN="Ok, it should work now. What is it, you ask? Why, it's a communication device - it allows those blockheads to communicate with each other. You know, the Burning Legion! I would suggest that you hand this mask to Wildlord Antelarion. He's over there pacing around. Always moving, he is.\n\nWell get moving, he's been trying to get his hands on one of these for sometime now.",o="将神秘的面具交给刀锋山常青林的荒野之王安塔里恩。",oEN="Deliver the Mystery Mask to Wildlord Antelarion at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="我不敢相信我的眼睛。",pEN="I cannot believe my eyes.",c="你手上的面具叫做邪誓防毒面具，而且从外观上看来并没有破损。这下子我们可以在铸魔营地：怒火制造的麻烦就很多了。你有兴趣帮助我们吗，$n？",cEN="That mask you hold in your hands is a Felsworn gas mask and by the appearance, it's not damaged. The trouble we can cause Forge Camp: Anger is boundless. Are you interested in helping us out, <name>?"}
Q[10813]={d="$n，你勇敢地进入血环兽人的老巢——可怕的塞斯高，并毫发无伤地回来了！既然你这么强，一定有能力帮助我窥探血环氏族最强的巫师格里洛克的思想！\n\n使用这块碎片捕获格里洛克之眼，让眼球与你连接在一起，然后回到我这儿来，走近我的锅……它会令格里洛克之眼与你分离。\n\n去吧，$n。小心一点。只要稍不留神，格里洛克之眼就可能把你暴露给我们的敌人。",dEN="<name>, you have braved the lair of the Bleeding Hollow orcs, dreaded Zeth'Gor, and survived! Perhaps you have the strength to aid me, for I aim to gaze into the mind of its darkest witch, Grillok!\n\nTake this shard. Use it to ensorcel an Eye of Grillok and bind it to yourself. Return here and approach my cauldron... and it will pull the eye from you.\n\nGo, <name>. And use care -- An Eye of Grillok will betray you to our enemies if given the slightest opening!",o="使用塞萨克的碎片捕获格里洛克之眼，然后利用塞萨克的熔锅使格里洛克之眼与你分离。完成任务后将塞萨克的碎片还给塞萨克。",oEN="Use Zezzak's Shard to capture an Eye of Grillok, then approach Zezzak's cauldron to extract it. After it is removed, return Zezzak's Shard to him.",p="血环氏族的兽人很久以前是黑暗的盟友……甚至是比现在更黑暗的敌人。",pEN="The orcs of the Bleeding Hollow Clan were dark allies long ago... and even darker enemies now.",c="我感激你，$n。你已经再次英勇地面对塞斯高，并且把它的黑暗靠近你的心。我将研究这颗眼睛，或许能识破它的主人，格里洛克的秘密。\n\n让我们希望他再也不能使用它的魔法！",cEN="I am indebted to you, <name>. You have again braved Zeth'Gor and held its darkness close to your heart. I will study the eye and perhaps pierce the secrets of its master, Grillok.\n\nLet us hope that he can no longer use its magic!"}
Q[10814]={d="这些信息可能对你有用。请仔细听我说，$r。",dEN="I have information that you may find useful. Please listen to what I have to tell you, <race>.",o="与奈尔萨拉库谈一谈，听听他的故事。",oEN="Speak with Neltharaku and listen to his story.",p="允许我告诉你我完整的故事。",pEN="Allow me to finish telling you my tale.",c="所以你会帮助我们吗？",cEN="So you will help us?"}
Q[10816]={d="$n，你狠狠地打击了盘踞在巴尔里废墟的灰舌破碎者。现在，让我们再来看看你如何对付伊利丹麾下的其它恐怖军队。\n\n影月氏族的邪兽人占领了阿塔玛平台，那儿曾是我的族人们使用阿塔玛水晶举行神圣仪式的圣地。\n\n我们确信这帮家伙将那块阿塔玛水晶藏在了阿塔玛平台附近，可惜我占卜不到它的下落。无论如何，邪兽人侵占了德莱尼人的圣地，他们就得死。",dEN="You did well against the Broken in Baa'ri, <name>. Let's see how well you do against Illidan's most feared army.\n\nThe fel orcs of the Shadowmoon Clan occupy the Ata'mal Terrace, once a very holy site where ata'mal crystals were used in spiritual ceremonies.\n\nWe had reason to believe they were hiding an actual ata'mal crystal in the vicinity, but our scrying has revealed nothing. Nevertheless, the fel orcs are on draenei holy ground and their presence must be dealt with.",o="杀死8名影月斩杀者、8名影月天选者和4名影月暗法师，然后向守备官奥鲁门复命。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Vindicator Aluumen wants you to slay 8 Shadowmoon Slayers, 8 Shadowmoon Chosen and 4 Shadowmoon Darkweavers.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="嘿，$n。你带了什么消息回来？",pEN="Hail, <name>. What news do you bring?",c="做得好，$c。愿圣光继续保护你。",cEN="Excellent work, <class>. May the Light continue to protect you."}
Q[10817]={d="你对灰舌破碎者打得不错，。如果你有胆量，我这还有个挑战给你。\n\n不久之前，群星圣殿遭到伊利丹邪兽人的猛烈袭击。\n\n我们已经查明，这是占据阿塔玛平台的影月兽人所为。\n\n让他们知道，谁袭击了占星者都别想全身而退。 $n $g你:你;",dEN="You did well against the Ashtongue Broken, <name>. I have another challenge for you, should you be up to it.\n\nNot too long ago, the Sanctum of the Stars suffered a tremendous attack by Illidan's fel orcs.\n\nWe've determined it was perpetrated by the Shadowmoon orcs who occupy the Ata'mal Terrace.\n\nShow them that the Scryers are not to be trifled with.",o="劝诫者瓦伦要求你杀死8名影月斩杀者、8名影月天选者和4名影月暗法师。\n\n为占星者完成任务会使你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Varen the Reclaimer wants you to slay 8 Shadowmoon Slayers, 8 Shadowmoon Chosen and 4 Shadowmoon Darkweavers.\n\nCompleting quests for the Scryers will cause your Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="嘿，$n。你带了什么消息回来？",pEN="Hail, <name>. What news do you bring?",c="你今天获得我最大的尊敬，$n。\n\n杀死一个邪兽人不是一项容易的任务。大量屠杀他们则是，呃……英勇的。",cEN="You've gained my utmost respect today, <name>.\n\nSlaying one fel orc is not an easy task. Massacring a score of them is, well... heroic."}
Q[10818]={d="$n，当你在外头当你的了不起的$c时，黑鬃男爵派他的宠物龙带了个口信来。\n\n他点名要找你。据我了解，他想让你领头去打他自己对付格鲁恩的那一仗。\n\n我想你是整个外域最有资格帮他的人，但要是我的话，我会先联系几个朋友，请他们到鲜血之环与你汇合。",dEN="<name>, while you were out being one hell of a <class>, Baron Sablemane sent his pet dragon up here with a message.\n\nHe's asked for you personally. From what I understand, he wants you to head up his own fight against the gronn.\n\nI guess you're the most qualified person in all of Outland to help him, but if I were you, I'd get in contact with a couple of friends first and ask them to join you at the Circle of Blood.",o="萨博迈恩男爵邀请你与他商谈要事。去刀锋山的鲜血之环找他吧。",oEN="Speak with Baron Sablemane at the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="啊，我看你是决定从容不迫地回应我的召唤了。\n\n没关系，我有的是时间实施复仇，而我打算让你在接下来的战斗中做我的$g代言人:代言人;！",cEN="Ah, I see that you decided to take your sweet time answering my summons.\n\nNo matter, I have plenty of time to exact my revenge, and I intend for you to be my proxy in the coming battle!"}
Q[10819]={d="现在，我有一个特殊任务要交给你去办，$n。我要你渗透入东边的铸魔营地：怒火。一旦渗透成功，就立刻戴上这个魔誓防毒面具，并找到军团联络器的位置。找到之后，立刻用它与随便什么家伙交谈。\n\n如果成功的话，你就可以把那些恶魔彻底引入混乱和圈套里了！我想想，就告诉那群恶魔，营地里发生了暴动吧。\n\n祝你好运，$c。",dEN="I have a very special mission for you, <name>. I need you to infiltrate Forge Camp: Anger east of here. When you enter the camp you will need to wear the Felsworn gas mask and locate the Legion communicator. Once you have located the communication device speak with whomever is on the other side of the device.\n\nIf all works out you can trick the demon into something devious! Try telling the demon that Camp Anger has revolted.\n\nGood luck to you <class>.",o="戴上魔誓防毒面具，并在铸魔营地：怒火内使用军团联络器。",oEN="Wear the Felsworn Gas Mask and use the Legion Communicator at Forge Camp: Anger in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="这样算什么意思？没有人可以召唤我！有话快说，不然我就让你永远说不出来！",cEN="What's the meaning of this! No one summons me! Speak, or I will silence you forever!"}
Q[10820]={d="你要是再一声也不吭，你就死定了！说话！说话呀！\n\n什么？营地里有叛乱？绝对不可能！我的仆从从来不会有胆子反抗我的权威。\n\n什么，是真的？好吧，背叛的代价，可是会越来越沉重的，直到他们根本无法负担。让他们都永远闭上嘴吧！完成了命令再来向我报告。",dEN="For every moment I hear silence, you draw closer to your death! SPEAK!\n\nWhat? The camp has revolted? This cannot possibly be true! My minions would not dare undermine my authority.\n\nWell then, every last one of them will pay for this treachery, they will pay dearly. Silence them all and be done with it! Report back to me once you have carried out my order or you shall be dealt with.",o="杀死4名末日熔炉随从和4名末日熔炉技师。",oEN="Slay 4 Doomforge Attendants and 4 Doomforge Engineers.",p="我已经失去耐性了，为什么那些人还没解决呢？",pEN="My patience is tiring, why have you not finished them?",c="这下子就可以告诉其它人不听我的话的下场……\n\n对了……末日哀嚎者在哪里？为什么你要向我回报这场叛变而不是她？",cEN="That will surely teach those that don't do as I say...\n\nBy the way... where is Doomcryer? Why have you reported this revolt to me and not she?"}
Q[10821]={d="什么？厄运传令者对这次的叛乱袖手旁观？她也敢！她以前好几次都想取代我的地位，不过失败了。这是最后一次了，我不会再给她机会了。这个位子是我的，我不给，她不能抢！你必须立刻把她召唤出来，干掉她。\n\n召唤她到铸魔营地：怒火的钥匙是由她手下最精锐的怒火守卫拿着的。把那五支钥匙抢来，启动营地里的五块军团方尖塔。方尖塔的作用时间很短，所以你要尽量同时启动它们。记住，怒火守卫不是只会看守钥匙的简单人物。",dEN="Doomcryer did nothing to stop the revolt? How dare she! She has been trying to undermine my authority for some time. However, this time will be her last. You must summon her and deal with her personally.\n\nHer anger guards hold the keys that summon her to Forge Camp: Anger. Retrieve the five keys and activate the five Legion obelisks. The obelisks have a short duration, so make sure they are all activated at the same time. Remember, the anger guards carry more keys.",o="杀死厄运传令者。",oEN="Slay Doomcryer.",p="你想被我加入可派去送死的士兵名单吗？拿到那些钥匙然后杀死末日哀嚎者！",pEN="Are you looking to join my list of those expendable? Get those keys and silence Doomcryer!",c="好消息，这真是个好消息，$n。我无法要求一个更好的结局了。我们的人民非常感谢你的付出请从下列这些给英雄物品当中选择一样吧。\n\n你的名字将永远留在我们人民的心中。",cEN="That is great news, great news indeed <name>. I could not have asked for a better outcome. Your service to our people is most greatly appreciated, choose one of the following heroic items.\n\nYour name will forever be remembered in our peoples heart."}
Q[10822]={p="即使是最小的贡献也会被注意到，$n。我们的敌人很多，但是我们将战胜他们！",pEN="Even the smallest contribution to our cause is noted, <name>. Our enemies are many, but we shall prevail!",c="占星者胜利！凯尔萨斯的力量很快就会粉碎。",cEN="Kael's army will soon fall."}
Q[10823]={p="你最近为我们做了什么，$n？对凯尔萨斯的战争是不会自己开始的，你知道吗？",pEN="What have you done for us lately, <name>? The war against Kael'thas is not going to fight itself, you know?",c="太棒了！这样就可以让凯尔萨斯知道不要低估我们的力量。",cEN="Excellent! That'll show Kael'thas not to underestimate our power."}
Q[10824]={d="凯尔萨斯疯狂地扩充兵力，占星者的生存面临着危机。来自奎尔萨拉斯的血精灵不断加入凯尔萨斯的部队，为他赢得这场战争添加筹码。他的兵力越雄厚，获胜的希望就越大。\n\n但是，我们的新兵数量堪忧。向占星者证明你的价值吧，转至西边的日蚀岗哨和东北方的卡拉波废墟，消灭那些与凯尔萨斯和伊利丹结盟的高阶血精灵，将他们佩戴的日怒徽记带回来给我。",dEN="The survival of the Scryers hinges on outrecruiting Kael'thas. Every pilgrim from Quel'Thalas that joins his side brings him closer to victory. The opposite is true for us.\n\nSoon, however, we will run out of recruits and it will come down to what side can kill the other quicker. Prove your worth to the Scryers by bringing me Sunfury signets worn by high-ranking blood elves allied with Kael'thas and Illidan. You'll find them at Eclipse Point to the west and the Ruins of Karabor, to the northeast.",o="将10枚日怒徽记交给群星圣殿的战斗法师弗亚拉。\n\n为占星者完成任务会使你在奥尔多阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Battlemage Vyara at the Sanctum of the Stars wants you to bring her 10 Sunfury Signets.\n\nPerforming quests for the Scryers will cause you Aldor reputation level to decrease.",p="继续，$n。说吧。",pEN="Go on, <name>. Speak.",c="凯尔的精灵极其训练有素。做得好。",cEN="Kael's elves are extremely well-trained. Excellent job."}
Q[10825]={d="这颗奇特的魔法宝珠从鸦人廓羽下掉落。\n\n它笼罩着诡异的紫色光晕，随着听不见的节拍脉动。握着它让你略显$g不适:不适;，于是你赶紧把它塞进了背包。\n\n也许西边鲁安林地的护树者查恩——穿过隧道、越过龙骨桥就能到——会有兴趣研究它？",dEN="This strange, magical orb drops from beneath the contour feathers of the arakkoa.\n\nSuffused with an eerie, purple glow, the orb pulses to an unheard beat. Holding it makes you mildly uncomfortable, and so you quickly place it within your pack.\n\nPerhaps Tree Warden Chawn at Ruuan Weald to the west, through the tunnel and across the Wyrmskull Bridge, would be interested in examining it?",o="将格里施纳宝珠交给刀锋山卢安荒野的护树者查恩。",oEN="Deliver the Orb of the Grishna to Tree Warden Chawn at Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="$c，你感觉到了吗？我感觉到附近有反常和邪恶的东西。",pEN="<class>, do you feel that? I sense something unnatural and evil nearby.",c="是的，你手里拿着的是那个宝珠！奇怪，它看起来是鸦人的设计。你最近是在格里施纳吗？\n\n好吧，那解释了一切，但我怀疑这物体有着什么残忍的意图。虽然它散发出邪恶，但也彷佛觉得它连接着自然界。\n\n来，让我试着启动它。它里面的邪恶如此强大，这里有着某种残余记忆……",cEN="Yes, it's that orb you have there! Odd, it appears to be of arakkoan design. Were you recently at Grishnath?\n\nAll right, that explains that, but I wonder what diabolical purpose this object serves. Though it radiates evil, it also somehow feels as if it were connected to the natural world as well.\n\nHere, allow me to try activate it. The evil is so strong within it, there's some sort of residual memory here...."}
Q[10826]={d="现在你应该早已明白为什么我们要与燃烧军团及其爪牙为敌了吧。\n\n如果你想向奥尔多证明自己的价值，就转至西边的军团要塞和死亡熔炉，消灭燃烧军团的高阶将士和暗影议会的爪牙们，将他们佩戴的萨格拉斯印记带回来给我。",dEN="By now it should be clear to you why we oppose the Burning Legion and those who serve them.\n\nIf you wish to prove yourself to the Aldor, bring me the insignias of high-ranking Legion and their Shadow Council followers. Here in Shadowmoon you will find a strong Legion presence to the far west in Legion Hold and the Deathforge.",o="将10枚萨格拉斯印记交给影月谷的先驱者萨隆尼。\n\n为奥尔多完成任务会使你在占星者阵营中的声望等级降低。",oEN="Bring 10 Marks of Sargeras to Harbinger Saronen in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nCompleting quests for the Aldor will cause your Scryers reputation level to decrease.",p="你身上还有我们敌人的印记吗，$n？",pEN="Do you bear any of our enemies' insignias, <name>?",c="你的勇气令人敬佩，$g朋友:朋友;。让所有人都知道，你是祭司团真正的$g盟友:盟友;！",cEN="Your courage is strong, friend. Let it be known to all that you are a true ally of the priesthood!"}
Q[10827]={p="你佩带了更多我们敌人的徽记了吗，$c？燃烧军团仍是一个威胁，我们将继续在任何我们找到他们的地方追捕他们。",pEN="Do you bear more of our enemies' insignias, <class>? The Burning Legion continues to be a threat and we continue to pursue them anywhere that we find them.",c="继续证明你的价值，$n。跟圣光的敌人战斗吧，不管他们在哪里；你的行为将获得良好的报酬。",cEN="You continue to prove your worth, <name>. Fight the enemies of the Light wherever you may find them; your actions will be well-rewarded."}
Q[10828]={p="我愿意收下你身上任何多的印记。别担心你的行为将受到适当的表扬。",pEN="I'll take any leftover marks you might have. Do not worry; your actions will be duly noted.",c="继续证明你的价值，$n。跟圣光的敌人战斗吧，不管他们在哪里；你的行为将获得良好的报酬。",cEN="You continue to prove your worth, <name>. Fight the enemies of the Light wherever you may find them; your actions will be well-rewarded."}
Q[10829]={d="这下糟了！鸦人正在利用邪恶的灵魂支配古树和守卫者！\n\n幸好还有一位古树没受到影响。他的名字叫特维布尔，如果我们还想拯救乌鸦林内所有古树的话，你就必须马上去找到他！\n\n到乌鸦林去，在刚经过格里施纳的交岔路口就可以看到他。",dEN="This is troubling! The arakkoa are causing the ancients and protectors to become possessed by evil spirits!\n\nBut, there is one ancient that could not possibly have been affected. His name is Treebole, and you must go to him at once if we're to save the trees of the Raven's Wood!\n\nGo back to the Raven's Wood. You will find him at the fork in the path just past Grishnath.",o="找到居住在刀锋山乌鸦林的知识古树特维布尔并与他谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Treebole, an ancient of lore who lives in the Raven's Wood of the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="你好，矮小的$g$r:$r;。我枝头的鸟儿低声告诉我你会来。\n\n你是来帮森林里的树木摆脱它们的恶念附身的吗？",cEN="Greetings, tiny <race>. The birds in my boughs whispered to me that you were to be expected.\n\nYou are here to help free the trees of the woods from their possession?"}
Q[10830]={d="格里施纳让邪恶的柯柯之灵控制了许多叶须古树和石皮古树的思想。\n\n我们必须拯救乌鸦林中所有的树木，不然很快我们就会永远失去它们！\n\n去格里施纳找一些格里施纳鸦人宝珠，将其内蕴涵的魔法能量与恶鸦身上的恐怖绒毛中蕴涵的魔法能量结合起来。\n\n之后，再使用组合而成的驱魔羽毛引出古树身上的柯柯的灵魂，并杀死它，就可以挽救一切了。石皮古树的力量十分强大，恐怕无法被仪式所影响，但只要你能拯救足够多的叶须古树，它们也能得到解放。",dEN="The Grishna have caused the leafbeards and stonebarks to be inhabited by evil koi-koi spirits.\n\nWe must save the trees or soon all of the Raven's Wood will be lost forever!\n\nCombine the magic of a Grishnath orb, found throughout Grishnath, with a dire pinfeather from a dire raven.\n\nUse the resultant exorcism feather to draw out and slay the koi-koi spirit as quickly as possible. The stonebarks are too powerful for this ritual, but if enough leafbeards are saved, they will be freed as well.",o="收集5颗格里施纳鸦人宝珠和5根恐怖绒毛，然后将它们合成驱魔羽毛。利用这些羽毛从乌鸦林叶须古树身上召唤出5只柯柯的灵魂，并杀死它们。",oEN="Collect 5 Grishnath Orbs and 5 Dire Pinfeathers and then combine them into Exorcism Feathers. Use these feathers to exorcise and slay 5 Koi-Koi Spirits from the Raven's Wood Leafbeards.",p="居住在树林里的邪恶魔物开始渗入树林里所有属于大自然的生物。\n\n你必须动作快一点，$N，在一切来不及挽回之前！",pEN="The evil that is inhabiting the trees is beginning to seep into every natural thing in the woods.\n\nYou must act quickly, <name>, before all is lost!",c="邪恶正从乌鸦林中退去！你能感觉到吗，？\n\n小家伙，你把我们以及周围所有的生灵都从必然的毁灭中拯救了出来！\n\n我在枝头藏了四枚魔法戒指，专为这样的时刻准备——当英雄挺身而出成就伟业之时。\n\n你就是这样的英雄！谨代表整个乌鸦林，我们感谢你。 $n $g你:你;",cEN="The evil is lifting from the Raven's Wood! Can you feel it, <name>?\n\nYou have saved us, and all of the surrounding wildlife, from certain destruction, little one!\n\nI keep stashed four magic rings amongst my boughs for such occasions as this, when a hero arises to do some great deed.\n\nYou are one such hero! On behalf of all of the Raven's Wood, we give you thanks."}
Q[10831]={d="如果你对月布裁缝感兴趣的话，我可以教你。月布裁缝在制造原始月布时，消耗同等的材料却能获得两倍于普通裁缝的产量，而且还能学到很多独一无二的图样。你只需要通过一项简单的测试就能成为一名月布裁缝。\n\n你得转至塞纳里奥庇护所，在月亮井中制造一块原始月布样品。我会为你提供所有的材料。完成任务后，将原始月布样品带回来给我。",dEN="I can teach you the ways of mooncloth tailoring, if you are interested.. By specializing in mooncloth tailoring, creating primal mooncloth will yield twice the normal amount and you will have access to several exclusive patterns. All that is required is that you pass a simple test.\n\nAs to the test, your task is to create a small sample of primal mooncloth in the moonwell at Cenarion Refuge. I will provide all the materials you'll need. When you've created the sample, bring it back to me for examination.",o="在塞纳里奥庇护所的月亮井中将一块魔化灵纹布制造成原始月布样品。将原始月布样品交给沙塔斯城贫民窟的纳丝玛拉·月歌。\n\n*注意！* 你只能选择一种裁缝专精。",oEN="Use the Square of Imbued Netherweave while standing in Cenarion Refuge's moonwell to create a Sample of Primal Mooncloth. Bring the completed sample back to Nasmara Moonsong in Shattrath's Lower City.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one tailoring specialization.",p="你制作了原始月布样本了吗？",pEN="Have you created the primal mooncloth sample?",c="<娜丝玛拉仔细查看布料，在手中翻来覆去。>\n\n这是极其优质的样本，。你会成为一位出色的月布裁缝。 $N $g你:你;",cEN="<Nasmara examines the cloth, turning it over in her hands.>\n\nThis is an exceedingly fine sample, <name>. You will make an excellent mooncloth tailor."}
Q[10832]={d="如果你对魔焰裁缝的技术感兴趣的话，我可以教你。但我得先提醒你，这可是一项危险的事业。\n\n在虚空风暴制造魔法布会招来强大的虚空怨灵。我需要更多的虚空怨灵精华来研究如何减少这一负面效应。\n\n带上虚空怨灵信标转至虚空风暴，用它召唤虚空怨灵。将虚空怨灵精华带回来给我，我就收你为徒。魔焰裁缝技术在制造魔法布时，消耗同等的材料却能获得两倍于普通裁缝的产量。此外，你还能学到很多独一无二的图样。",dEN="I can teach you the ways of spellfire tailoring if you wish, but be warned, it's a dangerous pursuit.\n\nCreating spellcloth in Netherstorm attracts powerful nether-wraiths. I'm searching for a way to lessen backlash, but I need more nether-wraith essence for my research.\n\nTake this beacon with you to Netherstorm and use it to summon a nether-wraith. Bring back its essence and I'll agree to teach you. As a spellfire tailor, you'll receive twice as much cloth and have access to exclusive patterns.",o="将虚空怨灵精华的样本交给沙塔斯城贫民窟的金吉·斯比维尔。\n\n*注意！* 你只能选择一种裁缝专精。",oEN="Bring a sample of Nether-wraith Essence to Gidge Spellweaver in Shattrath's Lower City.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one tailoring specialization.",p="你取得虚空怨灵的样本了吗？",pEN="Did you get the nether-wraith sample?",c="<吉奇查看着虚空怨灵精华。>\n\n即便是这么小一份精华样本，也散发着力量。也许我误解了正在发生的事。我们并不是通过从环境中汲取能量而激怒了怨灵。恰恰相反，怨灵和环境本就是同一个东西！\n\n既然你已经成了一位魔火裁缝，如果有任何新发现，请务必告诉我。 $g你:你;",cEN="<Gidge examines the nether-wraith essence.>\n\nEven this small a sample of the creature's essence radiates power. Perhaps I misunderstood what's happening. We're not angering the wraiths by taking energy from the environment. Rather, the wraiths and the environment are the same thing!\n\nDon't hesitate to let me know if you make any further discoveries, now that you've become a spellfire tailor."}
Q[10833]={d="如果你成为暗纹专家，你制作的暗影布将是普通裁缝的两倍，并且能获得几种专属图样。\n\n当然，任何裁缝都能使用暗影祭坛，但暗纹裁缝与祭坛的共鸣更深，能解锁极少有人能理解的力量。\n\n把这颗水晶带到影月谷东部，找到从虚空之翼平原向南延伸的虚空之翼小径。在世界边缘附近，你会找到暗影祭坛。在那里使用水晶。 $g你:你;",dEN="If you become a shadoweave specialist, you will make twice as much shadowcloth as an average tailor and have access to several exclusive patterns.\n\nOf course, any tailor can use the Altar of Shadows, but a shadoweave tailor possesses a deeper attunement to the altar, unlocking powers that few can fathom.\n\nTake this crystal to eastern Shadowmoon Valley, and find Netherwing Pass leading south from the Netherwing Fields. Near the world's edge, you will find the Altar of Shadows. Use the crystal there.",o="在暗影祭坛附近使用深影水晶，使你与祭坛产生更强大的魔法共鸣，然后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，向安迪恩·达克斯宾复命。\n\n*注意！* 你只能选择一种裁缝专精。",oEN="Use the Crystal of Deep Shadows near the Altar of Shadows to deepen your attunement to the altar, then return to Andrion Darkspinner in Shattrath's Lower City.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one tailoring specialization.",p="你有使用水晶的力量来加深你与暗影祭坛的融合吗？",pEN="Have you used the crystal's power to deepen your attunement to the Altar of Shadows?",c="我能看见你已成功的勘查祭坛了。你身上已有微妙而不可见的差异，但不用怀疑它确实存在。",cEN="I can see that your visit to the altar was a success. There is a subtle difference about you that few will see, but there's no doubt it's there."}
Q[10834]={d="“暗眼”格里洛克将身体的一部分献祭给了黑暗势力，因此获得强大的魔法能力。他失去了一只眼睛，原本眼球的位置被灼烧成可怖的窟窿……他用眼罩遮住了这处背叛者的象征，这眼罩中也是有秘密的。\n\n将格里洛克的眼罩带来给我，$n，我一定会重重奖励你的……",dEN="Grillok Darkeye has wagered a piece of himself to dark powers, and gained great magic for it. His lost eye burns deep in some hellish pit, now a demon's trinket... and the patch that covers his betrayal holds its own dark secrets.\n\nBring me Grillok's eyepatch, <name>, and I will reward you greatly for your service...",o="杀死“暗眼”格里洛克，将格里洛克的眼罩交给断背岗哨的塞萨克。",oEN="Kill Grillok Darkeye and bring Grillok's Eyepatch to Zezzak in Spinebreaker Post.",p="血环兽人的罪恶没有止境，而且只有他们的碎手亲戚可以和他们匹敌。",pEN="The evils of the Bleeding Hollow orcs know no bounds, and are rivaled by only their Shattered Hand cousins.",c="啊，是的。就像在战斗中失去一只手或者一条腿的人会常常感觉到他们被切断的四肢，我怀疑格里洛克是否仍在他黑暗的梦里抓着他失去的眼睛……\n\n我也会做这个梦，如果我们幸运的话，那或许我会知道是什么驱使格里洛克和血环兽人屈从于恶魔的。",cEN="Ah, yes. Just as some who lost a hand or a leg in battle will oftentimes feel their severed limb, I wonder if Grillok still clutched at his lost eye in his dark, dark dreams...\n\nI too will dream on this, and if fortune is with us then perhaps I will learn what drew Grillok and the Bleeding Hollow orcs to succumb to demons."}
Q[10835]={d="$n，我就当前针对血环兽人的研究发现写了一份初步报告。我在萨尔玛的同事安东尼维奇一定很想看。他也在研究邪兽人的相关现象……希望能避免这样的悲剧再次降临在我们的兽人盟友身上。\n\n把这份报告书带给他，我会继续研究你带来的血样。运气够好的话，我们就能分析出使邪兽人陷入痛苦之中的真正原因了。",dEN="<name>, I have prepared a preliminary report of my findings regarding the Bleeding Hollow orcs. My colleague in Thrallmar, Apothecary Antonivich, will be happy to receive them. He too studies the phenomenon of fel orcs... in hopes of preventing such a tragedy from again befalling our orcish allies.\n\nTake him this report, and I will continue my study of the blood you brought me. If fortune is with us, we will isolate the cause of the fel orc affliction.",o="将阿尔布雷克的发现交给地狱火半岛萨尔玛的药剂师安东尼维奇。",oEN="Bring Albreck's Findings to Apothecary Antonivich at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="祝你有美好的一天，$n。你在地狱火半岛过的如何？我相信是不错的……",pEN="Good day, <name>. And how is your stay in Hellfire Peninsula? I trust it has been fruitful...",c="啊，来自阿尔布雷克的报告吗？非常好。皇家药剂师协会热切地工作想了解地狱火半岛的兽人是如何变成邪兽人的。他们的背叛是不可原谅的……而我们必须保证我们的兽人朋友可永远免于未来的腐败。",cEN="Ah, a report from Albreck? Very good. The Royal Apothecary Society works feverishly to determine how the orcs of Hellfire Peninsula became fel orcs. Their betrayal is unforgivable... and we must ensure that our orc friends are forever safe from future corruption."}
Q[10836]={d="我一时半会儿也想不出法子来挽救我的子嗣和配偶。凡人，你得为我争取时间。\n\n转至灵翼平原东部边缘的龙喉要塞，杀掉那里的龙喉兽人。你制造的这场骚乱应该能阻挠他们的计划。\n\n千万小心，部分龙族成员已经被龙喉兽人侵蚀了心智。等待他们的只有死亡。我允许你一并了结他们的性命。",dEN="I require time so that I may devise a plan to save my children and mate. You will buy me this time, mortal.\n\nVenture into Dragonmaw Fortress, located on the eastern edge of the Netherwing Fields, and lay waste to all Dragonmaw orcs that you find. The ensuing chaos and confusion should have a considerable impact on their plans.\n\nBe warned, some of my kin are too far gone - their minds corrupted by the Dragonmaw. For them, the only resolution is death. You have my permission to end their lives as well.",o="杀死15名龙喉兽人，然后向飞翔在影月谷灵翼平原上空的奈尔萨拉库复命。\n\n任何龙喉要塞的龙喉兽人都可以。",oEN="Neltharaku, flying high above Netherwing Fields in Shadowmoon Valley, wants you to slay 15 Dragonmaw Orcs.\n\nAny Dragonmaw Orc in Dragonmaw Fortress will suffice.",p="你已经完成了吗？我只能希望一切不会太迟……",pEN="Is it done? I can only hope that it is not too late...",c="做得好，$n。我发现了一个方法可以释放被关在龙喉要塞里被奴役的龙了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I have discovered a way in which we can free the enslaved drakes that are being held at Dragonmaw Fortress."}
Q[10837]={d="我能将自己的精华注入灵藤水晶，形成魔化灵藤水晶。这种魔化水晶蕴涵的力量足以从龙喉兽人手中释放那些被奴役的虚空幼龙。\n\n转至灵翼浮岛收集灵藤水晶，灵翼浮岛是漂浮在影月谷东南边缘的一座小岛。当你收集到足够的灵藤水晶后就回来向我复命。\n\n$n，当心居住在岛上的龙喉兽人。",dEN="I believe that I can imbue nethervine crystals with my own essence. The power contained within these imbued crystals should be sufficient to free enslaved drakes of their masters' grasps.\n\nTravel to Netherwing Ledge, an island located off the broken shelf of Shadowmoon Valley, to the southeast. It is on Netherwing Ledge that you will find nethervine crystals. Return to me when you have collected enough crystals to fill your packs.\n\nAnd <name>, Beware the Dragonmaw that now inhabit the island.",o="翱翔在影月谷虚空之翼平原上空的奈尔萨拉库要你从虚空之翼岩架收集 12 块虚空藤水晶。|n",oEN="Neltharaku, flying high above Netherwing Fields in Shadowmoon Valley, wants you to collect 12 Nethervine Crystals from Netherwing Ledge.",p="我需要灵藤水晶。",pEN="I require nethervine crystals.",c="<奈尔萨拉库从你那里拿走水晶。>\n\n我现在将为你准备水晶。",cEN="<Neltharaku takes the crystals from you.>\n\nI will prepare the crystals for you now."}
Q[10838]={d="恶魔占卜器现在准备好了。把它带到地狱火堡垒后面的地狱火盆地，在地面上召唤它。它随后会开始与地狱火堡垒共鸣。共鸣完成后，与占卜器交谈，把它告诉你的一切记录下来。把那份记录带给我……\n\n去吧，，但只在准备好时再去。毫无疑问，地狱火堡垒会侦测到占卜器并派出守卫来摧毁它！ $N $g你:你;",dEN="The Demoniac Scryer is now ready. Take it behind Hellfire Citadel, to Hellfire Basin, and summon it upon the ground. It will then begin to attune itself to Hellfire Citadel. After its attunement, speak to the Scryer and transcribe what it tells you. Bring that transcription to me...\n\nGo, <name>, but only when you are ready. There is no doubt that Hellfire Citadel will detect the Scryer and send wardens to destroy it!",o="在地狱火盆地使用恶魔占卜器，等待它与地狱火堡垒创建共鸣，然后与恶魔占卜器交谈并获得恶魔占卜器之语。\n\n完成任务后将恶魔占卜器和恶魔占卜器之语一起交给萨尔玛的药剂师安东尼维奇。",oEN="Use the Demoniac Scryer in Hellfire Basin, wait for it to attune, and then take a reading.\n\nReturn the Demoniac Scryer and the Demoniac Scryer Reading to Apothecary Antonivich in Thrallmar.",p="你弄到信息了吗？你的恶魔占卜器成功了吗？",pEN="Do you have the reading? Has your mission with the Demonaic Scryer been successful?",c="你获得信息了吗？很好——我确信这数据将证明我们的研究无价。我将转达药剂师席莲娜和阿尔布雷克。\n\n你应该感到骄傲，$N。你的力量和英勇是毋庸置疑的……与你对部落的奉献一样。",cEN="You obtained the reading? Excellent -- I am sure this data will prove invaluable to our research. I will disseminate it to Apothecaries Zelana and Albreck.\n\nYou should be proud, <name>. Your strength and bravery is unquestionable... as is your service to the Horde."}
Q[10839]={d="基斯鸦巢位于难民车队西北方，就在沙塔斯城以南某处隐蔽的小树林中。据说鸦人在这座斯克提斯的属地上创建了一座邪恶的祭坛。想要救赎基斯鸦巢的鸦人，就必须净化这座泰罗克黑石。\n\n对着黑石使用这根净化法杖，它受到过阿达尔的赐福，应该可以净化黑石。出发吧，愿圣光与你同在。",dEN="Veil Skith lies to the northwest of the caravan and to the south of Shattrath in a secluded grove of the forest. It is rumored that the colony of Skettis has constructed a maligned altar of worship. This Darkstone of Terokk must be purified if the arakkoa of Skith are ever to be redeemed.\n\nTake this Rod of Purification and cast it upon the Darkstone. Blessed by A'dal, the rod's purity might be enough to bring clarity to the Darkstone. Go now and may the light shine upon thee.",o="对基斯鸦巢的泰罗克黑石使用净化之杖，然后向白骨荒野难民车队的基尔利克复命。",oEN="Use the Rod of Purification on the Darkstone of Terokk in Veil Skith and return to Kirrik the Awakened at the Refugee Caravan in the Bone Wastes.",p="黑暗围绕我们。你有什么关于基斯鸦巢的事要说吗？",pEN="Darkness surrounds us. What have you to say about Veil Skith?",c="我听到有爆炸。不是用我的耳朵，而是用我的心。\n\n假如神圣纳鲁，阿达尔的触摸不足以救赎鸦人，那没有什么可以。未将他们自己交给圣光的那些人只是邪恶的仆人。\n\n他们必须被消灭。",cEN="I heard the explosion from here. Not with my ears, but with my heart.\n\nIf the touch of the blessed Naaru, A'dal, is not enough to bring the arakkoa to redemption, nothing will be. Those who have not given themselves over to the Light are mere servants of evil.\n\nThey must be destroyed."}
Q[10840]={d="在东边焦土之下，掩埋着圣光之墓，那是一处不为人知的死者安息之地。而在我的车队被袭击之前，我正准备去清除游荡在那附近大量邪灵。\n\n但现在，我却得知另外一种邪恶的灵体生物已经完全占据了圣光之墓。那些该死的虚灵居然还开始大肆掠夺很多年以前与那些死者共同安息在陵墓中的宝物。\n\n在我的车队处于困境中时，我绝对不能离开，你是否可以帮忙替我去圣光之墓完成的我的工作呢？",dEN="To the east, buried under the charred sand, is the Tomb of Lights, a lost resting place of the dead. Before our caravan was ambushed I was going to journey to the tomb and cleanse it of evil spirits.\n\nLittle did I know it was already infested with another kind of evil. Even now the ethereals plunder the bodies of the fallen for trinkets and keepsakes that were given to the dead centuries ago.\n\nThere is little I can do while our caravan struggles to survive.",o="高阶祭司奥戈鲁要你去圣光之墓，杀死10名虚灵邪术师和10名虚灵掠夺者，然后回到难民车队向他复命。",oEN="High Priest Orglum wants you to journey to the Tomb of Lights and kill 10 Ethereal Nethermancers and 10 Ethereal Plunderers and then return to him at the Refugee Caravan.",p="你消灭了多少虚灵组织？我希望那足够从圣光之墓中将他们驱赶出来。",pEN="How many ethereals have you destroyed? I hope it will be enough to drive them from the Tomb of Lights.",c="在外域的荒野里，我们很少有英雄来保护我们的权利，但是你已经让他们惧怕了$c。我认为虚灵组织不会很快忘记$n强壮的右臂。",cEN="Out here in the wilds of Outland we are weak with few heroes to defend our rights, but you have given them something to fear <class>. I do not think the ethereals will soon forget the strong right arm of <name>."}
Q[10842]={d="圣光之墓现在已经被暗影议会所腐蚀了，里面那些死去的德莱尼人的灵魂受到了深入骨髓的诅咒，成为了内心中充满愤怒、困惑，以及对生者之怨念的邪灵。\n\n进入那座墓穴，找到那些悲惨的牺牲品。让他们得到最后的安息。",dEN="The Tomb of Lights has become corrupted by the Shadow Council and the draenei dead have become cursed spirits, angry and confused with a burning hatred for the living.\n\nEnter the tomb and seek out these tragic victims. Give them the rest that they deserve.",o="高阶祭司奥戈鲁要你去圣光之墓，击败5名复仇的德莱尼。",oEN="High Priest Orglum wants you to journey into the Tomb of Lights and defeat 5 Vengeful Draenei.",p="你已经救了我们。我们该怎么感谢你？",pEN="You have saved us all. What can we do to thank you?",c="你还不知道你在这里做了什么的时候，$n，你已经将我们这么多人从永恒的黑暗中拯救出来。我为尚活着的人能做的事很少，而且没有什么东西足以用来感谢你。带走对你有用的东西吧。",cEN="You cannot know what you have done here <name>. You have saved so many of us from an eternity of darkness. There is little that I can do for the living and nothing that I could give that would thank you enough. Take what seems useful to you."}
Q[10843]={d="自被遗忘的年代起，我们就一直与刃拳食人魔交战。\n\n我们成功把他们逼退，如今他们只在刃拳前哨还勉强握有一席之地。它在你来时的路上，就在剃刀岭的西南边缘。\n\n杀死他们的首领诺什·布罗格纳特，向我证明你的价值。\n\n让我们看看你与食人魔作战时是什么$g成色:成色;。",dEN="Since time forgotten we have fought with the Bladespire ogres.\n\nWe have managed to push them back so that now they only hold a tenuous grip at Bladespire Outpost. It's back the way that you came, on the southwestern edge of the Razor Ridge.\n\nProve your worth to me by killing their leader, Gnosh Brognat.\n\nLet us see what stuff you are made of when fighting the ogres.",o="杀死刀塔哨站的食人魔首领诺什·布罗纳特。",oEN="Slay Gnosh Brognat, leader of the ogres at the Bladespire Outpost.",p="莫克纳萨不接受失败，或者找理由。要不就是你消灭敌人，要不就是$g他:她杀死你！\n\n既然你正站在我面前，你一定已经杀死了莱欧洛克斯。",pEN="The Mok'Nathal do not accept failure, or make excuses. Either you vanquish your foe, or he kills you!\n\nSince you are standing before me, you must have killed Gnosh Brognat already.",c="<莱欧洛克斯以锐利的眼睛打量你，好像要测量你一样。>\n\n诺什·布罗纳特的死是所有莫克纳萨的恩惠。这对你是件好事。\n\n让我们看看是否我们能将你高超的本领再提升一些。",cEN="<Leoroxx appraises you with a keen eye, seemingly trying to take your measure.>\n\nThe death of Gnosh Brognat is a boon to all of the Mok'Nathal. This is a good thing for you.\n\nLet us see if we can push the boundaries of your prowess just a bit more."}
Q[10845]={d="我的猎手刚从歌唱山脊的侦察任务中回来。看来那片水晶上大量滋生的虚空幼龙数量激增，眼看就要涌到我们眼皮底下了。\n\n既然你已经证明自己是个能干的$g杀手:杀手;，那就看看你作为$c的本事能否比得上一头成年幼龙。\n\n向南穿过鳞翼岩架就能找到歌唱山脊。进去，杀死它们的巢母，恐翼。",dEN="My hunters have just returned from a scouting mission to the Singing Ridge. It seems that the nether drakes, which infest the crystals there, have increased greatly in number, and threaten to spill out into our laps.\n\nSince you have proven yourself a competent slayer, let us see if your <class> skills are the match of an adult drake.\n\nFind the Singing Ridge by heading south through the Scalewing Shelf. Enter and slay their brood mother, Dreadwing.",o="杀死恐惧之翼。",oEN="Slay Dreadwing.",p="虽然在我眼里你不能更进一步，但是承认你无法胜任杀死美声山脊虚空龙之母的挑战并不羞耻。\n\n那是你要告诉我的吗？",pEN="Though you will not further yourself in my eyes, there is no shame in admitting that you aren't up to the challenge of slaying the mother of the Singing Ridge nether drakes.\n\nIs that what you are here to tell me?",c="不是吗？你杀死了恐翼？也许我看错你了，$c。\n\n也许吧。\n\n不过，你已经杀死了我们面对的三大威胁的首领。这值得$g骄傲:骄傲;。\n\n我送你一份礼物以表谢意，但别让它冲昏你的头脑。你仍然没有完全理解身为莫克纳萨意味着什么，而我们可能还有用得着你本事的地方。",cEN="No? You slew Dreadwing? Perhaps I was wrong about you, <class>.\n\nPerhaps.\n\nStill, you have slain the chiefs of the three greatest threats that we face. That is something to be proud of.\n\nI offer you a token of my appreciation, but don't let it go to your head. You still do not fully understand what it is to be Mok'Nathal, and we may still have need to call upon your skills."}
Q[10846]={d="<莱欧洛克斯死死地盯着你，不由令你心生寒意。>\n\n你对莫克纳萨氏族一无所知。我们在夹缝中艰难求生，你能理解吗？\n\n如果你想体会这种感受，就必须经受严酷的生存考验。\n\n村子南边的托格玛洞穴是维克鸦人的地盘。他们将食人魔战俘囚禁在洞穴中，那里也是鸦人首领维克的栖身处。\n\n杀死维克！",dEN="<Leoroxx looks you in the eye with the kind of stare that chills your soul.>\n\nYou come to the Mok'Nathal, but you do not understand us. You do not understand our struggle to survive.\n\nIf you would understand us, then you will have to endure a taste of that struggle.\n\nTo the south are the Vekh'nir arakkoa. They have enslaved a group of ogres in the caverns known as Trogma's Claim and their leader, Vekh is in there.\n\nSlay him!",o="除去维克鸦人的首领维克。",oEN="Slay Vekh, leader of the Vekh'nir arakkoa.",p="我们有很多敌人。有些是我们选择的，而有些，像是维克尼尔，却不是我们选择的。\n\n不管怎样，我们将杀死他们的所有首领，直到没有一个可以站在我们面前。",pEN="We have many enemies. Some we have chosen, and some, such as the Vehk'nir, we have not.\n\nRegardless, we shall slay all of their chieftains until none stand before us.",c="维克尼尔是我们最不足道的对手。\n\n所以，你懂得怎么杀一只大鸟了。这不能让你成为$g真正的战士:真正的战士;。这不能让你完全理解我们的方式。\n\n但这是个开始。",cEN="The Vekh'nir are the least of our adversaries.\n\nSo, you know how to slay an overgrown bird. This does not make you a true warrior. This does not give you a full understanding of our ways.\n\nBut it's a start."}
Q[10847]={d="斯克提斯弥漫着一股不祥的气息。\n\n恐怖的邪恶力量笼罩了整个鸦人氏族，命运已经露出狰狞的面孔。我们曾滥用黑暗魔法，做了不少坏事。在阿达尔的指引之下，我才了解到圣光的真谛，并由此得到救赎。\n\n泰罗克通过施放了黑暗魔法的宝珠监视斯克提斯的所有属地。从泰罗卡森林北部的里斯克鸦巢和西诺鸦巢偷回宝珠，让我也透过斯克提斯之眼看看泰罗克都在监视些什么。",dEN="Doom harkens from the cliffs of Skettis.\n\nMy people, the arakkoa, face a fate shrouded in unspeakable evil. Too often have we abused dark magic for wrongdoing. Through A'dal I have learned of the Light and of redemption.\n\nTerokk watches his colonies from Skettis through orbs enchanted by the black art. Steal these Eyes from Veil Reskk and Veil Shienor in northern Terokkar. Let me see what Terokk sees. Let me look through the eyes of Skettis.",o="将里斯克鸦巢之眼和西诺鸦巢之眼交给沙塔斯城贫民窟的救赎者瑞拉克。",oEN="Bring the Eye of Reskk and the Eye of Shienor to Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",p="你回来了，<class>。你带来了什么消息？",pEN="You have returned, <class>. What news do you bring?",c="你的英勇应该被赞扬。斯克提斯的守护者不愿意舍弃他们的财产。\n\n但是过去的豪壮行为只是现在的微小结果。我们要看看这样的英勇行为在未来是否会坚持下去，因为泰罗克注视着南方。\n\n这些眼睛全部都在看着。",cEN="Your bravery should be commended. The guardians of Skettis do not part with their belongings willingly.\n\nBut heroics of the past are of little consequence now. We shall see if such bravery continues to persist in the future, for Terokk's gaze fixates on the south.\n\nThese Eyes are all seeing."}
Q[10848]={d="哈兹鸦巢是斯克提斯最邪恶的属地。\n\n尽管奥金顿大爆炸将整座村落夷为平地，泰罗克的力量依然侵蚀了游荡在那里的邪灵。转至西边的哈兹鸦巢，消灭那些可悲的幽灵。他们聚集在位于白骨荒野和泰罗卡森林边界的暗影墓穴。\n\n这将是我们向泰罗克和斯克提斯守护者发动的第一轮攻击。",dEN="Veil Rhaze was a particularly wicked colony of Skettis.\n\nDespite the village's eradication by the Auchindoun disaster, Terokk's influence remained in the maligned spirits there. Travel west to Veil Rhaze and slay those murderous wretches. You'll find them to the west of the Shadow Tomb, on the border of Bone Wastes and Terokkar Forest.\n\nThis will be our first blow against Terokk and the guardians of Skettis.",o="杀死4只死爪幽魂、4个尖啸幽魂和2只幽灵乌鸦，然后向难民车队的基尔利克复命。",oEN="Kill 4 Deathtalon Spirits, 4 Screeching Spirits and 2 Spirit Ravens and return to Kirrik the Awakened at the Refugee Caravan.",p="邪恶在维尔雷兹滋长。铲除它，<race>。",pEN="Evil grows in Veil Rhaze. Put it down, <race>.",c="那些邪恶的灵魂应当受死。他们对其它人会造成的死亡已是足够的理由。\n\n我们不能奢望救回那些在泰罗克掌握之下的人。我们将以圣光的名义给他们毁灭性的一击。",cEN="Those foul spirits deserved to die. The death they would have wrought on others is reason enough.\n\nWe cannot hope to redeem those in Terokk's grasp. But we shall deliver them a devastating blow in the name of the Light."}
Q[10849]={d="还有另一位鸦人也选择了背弃泰罗克的道路，那就是觉醒者基尔利克。\n\n在基尔利克看来，泰罗克根本称不上先知，不过是个夸夸其谈的骗子罢了。泰罗克唯一预见到的只有他自己的恶行招致的厄运而已。\n\n基尔利克引领着我们勇敢地逃离了斯克提斯。而在我们转至沙塔斯城寻求圣光的救赎时，他则转至别的属地搭救其它不甘堕落的鸦人。\n\n这封信件讲述了泰罗克通过宝珠监视属地的情况。必须把此事告诉基尔利克！走出沙塔斯城之后，你沿着南边的道路进入白骨荒野，寻找难民车队，就可以找到他。",dEN="Other arakkoa took part in the betrayal of Terokk.\n\nKirrik recognized Terokk as a charlatan, not a prophet. The only prophecy Terokk envisioned was the doom borne of his own bidding.\n\nIt was Kirrik who led us bravely from Skettis. After our pilgrimage to Shattrath, Kirrik traveled to the colonies in search of others.\n\nThis missive tells of what the Eyes have seen. Kirrik must be told! Follow the road south out of Shattrath to the Bone Wastes and look for the caravan.",o="将瑞拉克的信件交给白骨荒野难民车队的觉醒者基尔利克。",oEN="Take Rilak's Missive to Kirrik the Awakened at the Refugee Caravan in the Bone Wastes.",p="你长途跋涉替我带来了消息。",pEN="You have traveled far and bear news for me.",c="瑞拉克的描述令我怵目惊心，旅人。就如你看见商队那边的状况一样，最近泰罗卡森林充满了哀伤与阴郁。",cEN="Rilak's tale is grim, traveler. As you can see from the state of the caravan, there is much sorrow and darkness in the forest of Terokk these days."}
Q[10850]={p="你打开魔能机甲加燃料的盖子。",pEN="You uncover an opening through which fuel is loaded into the fel reaver.",c="天罚机甲的引擎开始发出轰隆声与劈啪声因为你倒错了燃料。",cEN="The fel reaver's engine begins to rumble and sputter as you supply it with the incorrect fuel."}
Q[10851]={d="有些氏族奉行正确的行事之道，以此表达对先祖的尊敬；有些氏族则误入了歧途。\n\n刀塔食人魔总是随身携带着图腾，但他们不是利用图腾来表达对先祖的敬意，而是滥用它们来满足自己的控制欲。\n\n我们应该偷走他们的图腾，因为刀塔食人魔不配拥有哪怕一根图腾！只有我们才能更好地利用它们。\n\n刀塔哨站位于莫克纳萨村以西，就在剃刀山的西南方。杀死刀塔秘术师和刀塔打击者，将他们的图腾带回来给我！",dEN="There is the right way to honor one's ancestors, and there is the wrong way.\n\nThe Bladespire ogres carry totems with them, but they do not use them to show their respect. Instead, they seek to use them to manipulate and control.\n\nWe should steal their totems because they are unworthy! We will then put them to better use.\n\nGo to the Bladespire Outpost to the west, just southwest of the Razor Ridge. Slay the Bladespire mystics and crushers, and take their totems from them!",o="收集5根刀塔图腾。",oEN="Collect 5 Bladespire Totems.",p="你已经去剑刃岗哨取走他们的图腾了吗？",pEN="Have you gone to Bladespire Outpost and taken their totems from them?",c="这些看起来像是不错的灵魂聚合品。我们应该可以在它们之中找到一两个图腾可以用在正当的用途上。\n\n事实上，我想到一个使用他们的用途！",cEN="This looks like a good assortment. We should be able to find a respectful use for one or two of them.\n\nIn fact, I have an idea for how to do just that!"}
Q[10852]={d="我们在这里遇到了大麻烦。一些鸟人趁着夜晚闯了进来，引起了一场大骚乱。太吓人了。都不知道我们什么时候才能继续前进。\n\n而且，我的一些朋友在那次骚乱之后就不见了，我们完全不知道他们在哪。我想，搞不好是是那群可怕的鸟人把他们带到西北边去了。他们现在说不定正被锁在笼子里，说不定，都已经被吃掉了！如果你能去找他们的话，那就再好不过了。说实话，我非常担心他们的安危。",dEN="We broke down here because some guys came in the night and made a lot of noise. It was scary. I don't know when we are going to get moving again.\n\nSome of my friends are missing though. I don't know where they are. I think those scary bird men took them away to the northwest. They probably are all locked up in cages and stuff. If you find them that would be great. I'm kind of worried about them.",o="伊森要你去基斯鸦巢找到12位失踪的伙伴，然后回难民车队向他复命。",oEN="Ethan wants you to find 12 of his missing friends in Veil Skith and then return to him at the Refugee Caravan.",p="我好无聊，没有人可以陪我玩。你找到我的朋友了吗？",pEN="I'm bored, there's nobody to play with. Have you found my friends?",c="你找到了我所有的朋友！现在我有玩伴了。谢谢你， 先生。\n\n既然我有小朋友一起玩了，也许你想要我的一个玩具？这样你也有东西可以玩了。 <name>",cEN="You found all my friends! Now I have someone to play with. Thank you, Mister <name>.\n\nSince I have kids to play with maybe you would like one of my toys? That way you have something to play with too."}
Q[10853]={d="我们必须拯救晶歌山脉中的虚空幼龙之灵。\n\n在孵化前，这些虚空幼龙原本是黑龙。\n\n但是当德拉诺世界爆炸时，一股虚空力量席卷了所有生灵，由此产生的副作用改变了黑龙卵。\n\n孵化出的虚空幼龙沦为扭曲的异形生命体，我们要帮助它们恢复以往的平静。\n\n转至晶歌山脉，杀死灵魂召唤图腾附近的虚空幼龙，然后将虚空幼龙之灵带回来。",dEN="The spirits of the nether drakes in the Singing Ridge are in need of liberation.\n\nThe nether drakes were not always nether drakes. They used to be black drakes.\n\nBut then, with the destruction of this world, a wave of nether energy washed over everything and had the side-effect of changing the drakeling eggs.\n\nNow they are all twisted versions of their former selves. We must help them to find peace.\n\nDo this by slaying a drake near to the spirit calling totem, and then take its spirit from it.",o="利用灵魂召唤图腾收集8个规模虚空幼龙之灵。",oEN="Use the Spirit Calling Totems to collect 8 Lesser Nether Drake Spirits.",p="美声山脊的那些龙也许对我们是一种威胁，但是我想他们是崇高的生物。\n\n或者说，至少他们曾经是如此。我希望你可以拯救他们的灵魂。\n\n假如你需要更多的图腾，我还有多的可以给你。",pEN="The drakes of the Singing Ridge may pose a threat to us, but I think they are majestic creatures.\n\nOr, at least they were. I hope that you will be able to save their spirits.\n\nAnd if you are in need of more totems, I have a few to spare.",c="你今日做了一件好事，<class>。幼龙们的灵魂如今获得自由，必定会再次真正歌唱。而它们留下的残余灵魂也是强效的药剂。\n\n我在想，你愿意往北走一趟吗？关于虚灵的活动，有件事让我很好奇。\n\n我从他们那个方向感觉到了大量的痛苦。",cEN="You have done a good thing this day, <class>. The spirits of the drakes will truly sing again now that they have been freed. And the residual part of their spirits that they leave behind are powerful medicine, too.\n\nI wonder, are you up for a journey to the north? There is something that I am curious about concerning the activities of the ethereal.\n\nI sense a great deal of pain coming from their direction."}
Q[10854]={d="带上魔化灵藤水晶返回龙喉要塞。寻找被奴役的虚空幼龙，然后释放灵藤水晶中的魔法能量。我的精华将喷涌而出，帮助幼龙挣脱束缚。幼龙受尽折磨必定相当虚弱，你得帮它打败龙喉兽人！\n\n$n，解救被奴役的虚空幼龙，然后向我复命。",dEN="Take this enchanted nethervine crystal and make your way back to Dragonmaw Fortress. Once there, seek out the enslaved drakes and invoke the magic of the nethervine crystal. My own energies will pour forth, causing the drakes to break free from the bond of their captors. When you see that the drake has broken free, help it defeat its captor! It will most assuredly be weak from the imprisonment.\n\nRelease all that you can find and return to me, <name>.",o="解救5只被奴役的灵翼幼龙，然后向飞翔在影月谷灵翼平原上空的奈尔萨拉库复命。",oEN="Neltharaku, flying high above Netherwing Fields in Shadowmoon Valley, wants you to free 5 Enslaved Netherwing Drakes.",p="别浪费时间，我们还有很多事情要做！",pEN="Waste no time, we have much work to do!",c="<奈尔萨拉库大笑。>\n\n兽人看到幼龙以那种方式反戈相向，一定震惊不已。干得好，。也许你真的是我们龙族的英雄。 <name>",cEN="<Neltharaku laughs.>\n\nThe orcs must have been shocked to see the drakes turn on them in such a manner. Well done, <name>. Perhaps you truly are the hero of our flight."}
Q[10855]={d="对，没错，魔能机甲！它无疑是燃烧军团所造出的最可怕的机械生物。情报显示，燃烧军团准备投入三台魔能机甲对风暴尖塔发动攻击。\n\n幸运的是，他们还没有启动这些机甲。我们可以趁机搞点破坏，而不用与这些机械怪物硬碰硬地死磕。\n\n转至铸魔基地：湮灭，从甘尔葛机械师手中夺得浓缩灵能瓦斯，然后将其注入魔能机甲的燃料箱中。我相信机甲的引擎根本无法承受这种烈性燃料。",dEN="Ah, yes - the fel reaver! Certainly the Legion's most terrible mechanical creation. There are no less than three of these abominations aimed at the Stormspire.\n\nFortunately for us, they are not active yet. This affords us the possibility of dealing with them through sabotage instead of brute force.\n\nObtain condensed nether gas from the gan'arg at Forge Base: Oblivion and fill a nearby fel reaver's fuel tank with it. I've a feeling its engine won't handle it too well.",o="从风暴尖塔西北方的铸魔基地：湮灭里的甘尔葛机械师身上收集5份浓缩的虚空气体，将它们灌入附近一台未激活的魔能机甲内。完成任务后向虚空猎手纳乌希思复命。",oEN="Obtain 5 Condensed Nether Gas from Gan'arg Mekgineers at Forge Base: Oblivion, northwest of the Stormspire, and load them into a nearby Inactive Fel Reaver. Return to Nether-Stalker Nauthis after you've completed this task.",p="你试过我的小实验了吗，？ <name>",pEN="Did you try out my little experiment, <name>?",c="这真是好消息，。既然我们知道该如何对付这些了，我就可以雇人去破坏所有剩下的掠夺者。 <name>",cEN="That is excellent news, <name>. Now that we know how to deal with these, I can have hirelings sabotage any remaining reavers."}
Q[10856]={d="破坏敌人的机械生物只能略微改善我们所处的窘境，$n。铸魔基地：湮灭是燃烧军团装配魔能机甲的集结点，铸魔基地：炼狱则是军团的主营地，他们在那里架设了大量的传送装置。\n\n我要你转至铸魔营地：炼狱，削减恶魔军队的数量。那里驻扎着整编的天罚使者军团，我们不能容忍这支部队的存在。",dEN="Brave acts of industrial sabotage will only get us so far, <name>. Just as Forge Base: Oblivion serves as an assembly site for Fel Reavers, Forge Base: Gehenna serves as a staging ground for their army as it is where the majority of the Legion's teleportation devices are located.\n\nI want you to go in there and put a dent in their numbers. They must have a full regiment of wrathbringers by now and we just can't allow that.",o="虚空猎手纳乌希思要你转至风暴尖塔以北的铸魔基地：炼狱，消灭12名天罚使者。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Nauthis wants you to slay 12 Wrathbringers at Forge Base: Gehenna, north of the Stormspire.",p="进行的如何？你有机会教训一下那些燃烧军团吗？",pEN="How goes it? Did you get a chance to show the Legion a lesson or two?",c="干得好，。继续保持，我会在 Nexus 王子面前替你说句好话。 <name>",cEN="Nice work, <name>. Keep it up and I'll put in a good word with the Nexus Prince."}
Q[10857]={d="或许你觉得斩杀恶魔很有意思，但是燃烧军团总是能通过传送装置迅速补充兵力，因此我们必须破坏他们的传送装置，才能一劳永逸地解决问题。\n\n可惜我这里没有高性能的爆炸物……但是我们可以向看守传送装置的莫尔葛恶魔“借”。\n\n带上这根魔杖……它可以扰乱莫尔葛恶魔脑波的频率。返回铸魔基地：炼狱，对莫尔葛恶魔使用魔杖。它的控制时间不会太长，你必须利用这段时间对传送装置使用莫尔葛的爆破能力。",dEN="As fun as killing demons might be, it does us little good when the Legion can keep using its teleporters to replace anything we kill.\n\nUnfortunately, I don't have any high-powered explosives handy... but the mo'arg that maintain the teleporters do.\n\nTake this rod... I've tuned its powers to interfere with mo'arg brain frequencies. Return to Forge Base: Gehenna and use it on any mo'arg you see. You won't have long, but you'll be able to use their demolition charges on the nearby teleporters.",o="虚空猎手纳乌希思要你转至铸魔基地：炼狱，对莫尔葛恶魔使用精神干涉魔杖，然后对铸魔基地内的三处传送装置使用他们的引爆传送器能力。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Nauthis wants you to use the Mental Interference Rod on the Mo'arg at Forge Base: Gehenna and use their Detonate Teleporter ability on the three teleporters in the forge camp.",p="你成功了吗？传送器已经被摧毁了吗？",pEN="Is it done then? Are the teleporters shut down?",c="多亏了你，，我能稍微松口气了。当然，这只是打个比方！\n\n我想你现在会想要某种形式的报酬吧。 <name>",cEN="Thanks to you, <name>, I'll breathe a little easier. Figure of speech, of course!\n\nI suppose you'll want some form of reward now."}
Q[10858]={d="再次向你求助让我感到羞愧，$n，但你是我们龙族唯一的希望。没有我的伴侣，虚空之翼的族群可能会彻底消亡。\n\n前往龙喉要塞的顶端，找到卡瑞纳库。\n\n我们会在头顶盘旋。一旦他们的防御出现缺口，虚空之翼的力量就会俯冲下来助你。|n",dEN="It shames me to ask for your assistance once more, <name>, but you are my flight's only hope. Without my mate, the netherwing brood may die out completely.\n\nMake your way to the top of Dragonmaw Fortress and find Karynaku.\n\nWe will be flying overhead. Should a break appear in their defenses, the might of the netherwing will swoop down to assist you.",o="转至龙喉要塞，寻找卡瑞纳库。",oEN="Seek out Karynaku at Dragonmaw Fortress.",c="一定是锁链的关系。它们耗尽了我的力量。唯一的方法是从祖鲁希德那边取得钥匙然后释放我。",cEN="It is the chains. They sap my power. The only way is to get the key from Zuluhed and unbind me."}
Q[10859]={d="拉扎安虚灵拥有一些奇怪的装置，能发射出细小的粉红色光球，它们总是让我联想到灵魂。\n\n这种光球与虚灵死亡时体内迸发出的巨大的黄色光球截然不同。\n\n我要你转至北边的拉扎安码头，利用图腾收集到一些粉红色光球。\n\n将它们带回来，这样我或许就能知道这到底是什么东西了。",dEN="The Razaani ethereals have strange devices that emit small, pink floating light orbs. They remind me of souls.\n\nThey are not to be confused with the large yellow balls that break free of the ethereal when they die, these are something else entirely.\n\nI'd like for you to head north to Razaan's Landing and drop some totems, which will attact the pink light orbs.\n\nBring them back to me so that I might determine exactly what they are.",o="唤灵者多戈加尔要你利用宝珠收集图腾收集15颗拉扎安光球。",oEN="Use the Orb Collecting Totem to collect 15 Razaani Light Orbs.",p="你已经收集完毕所需的雷森光球了吗？",pEN="Have you collected all of the Razaani Light Orbs that are needed?",c="我感觉有些不对劲。\n\n拜托，，把图腾给我。我必须检查那些宝珠！ <name>",cEN="Something does not feel right.\n\nPlease, <name>, hand me the totem. I must examine those orbs!"}
Q[10860]={d="你饿吗，$r？只有善于自助的人才能得到魂灵的眷顾。如果你想享受美餐，那就听好了——这世上不会有免费的东西，美味佳肴也是如此！\n\n剃刀山的迅猛龙以及鳞翼岩床的鳞翼蛇是制作两道佳肴的主料。给我带一些迅猛龙肋排和蛇肉回来，我就为你烹饪美食。\n\n如果你办事够利索的话，我甚至可以教你怎么制作这两道菜。",dEN="Hungry, <race>? The Great Spirit helps those that help themselves. If you want to earn a meal, I suggest that you listen up, because Braagor there isn't going to give you anything for free, nor as tasty!\n\nThe raptors and scalewings of Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf have everything that's needed for two of the most delicious dishes you'll ever taste. Bring me their raptor ribs and serpent flesh, and I'll make some of each for you.\n\nI may even teach you how to cook them up for yourself, if you hurry.",o="收集3根迅猛龙肋排和3块蛇肉。",oEN="Collect 3 Raptor Ribs and 3 Serpent Flesh.",p="你已经找齐了所有的材料了吗？讲到这里我都快流口水了！",pEN="Have all of the ingredients yet? Talking about it with you has made my mouth water!",c="嗯，我已经可以想象它们的味道了。快，把材料交给我……我要把它们切好拿去烤！\n\n你很幸运，这种东西可以保存很久，我的意思是很久！那么，这些给你，而且你还这么好心的帮我的储藏室补货我想你也应该得到它的食谱。",cEN="Mmm, I can taste them already. Quickly, hand over those parts... I'm going to get them diced up and onto the fire!\n\nLuckily for you, this stuff keeps, and I mean for a long time! So, take these, and I suppose you can have the recipes as well for being so kind as to restock my larder."}
Q[10861]={d="西南方的雷希鸦巢是斯克提斯的属地之一，泰罗克的爪牙企图在鸦人幼雏孵化之前就令他们堕落。雷希鸦巢的黑暗巫师们对那些尚未孵化的蛋施加了暗影诅咒，一旦幼雏破壳而出，就会对泰罗克唯命是从。\n\n你现在立刻转至雷希鸦巢，在诅咒生效之前打破鸟蛋。如果为时已晚的话，你可以杀掉那些邪恶的雏鸟。\n\n要记住，圣光在黑暗中最为耀眼。",dEN="In the wretched colony to the southwest known as Veil Lithic, Terokk's minions are attempting to befoul their avian brethren before they hatch. The dark sorcerers of Lithic encase eggs in a shadowy curse. When the hatchlings emerge, they mindlessly serve Terrok.\n\nTravel to Veil Lithic and prematurely break the eggs before the curse has time to seep in. Even if you are too late, you can put down the tainted ones.\n\nRemember, the Light shines brightest in the darkness.",o="打破雷希鸦巢中被诅咒的鸟蛋。解救3只雏鸟，并杀死3只邪恶的雏鸟，然后向难民车队的基尔利克复命。",oEN="Break the cursed eggs in Veil Lithic. Redeem 3 Hatchlings and slay 3 Malevolent Hatchlings before returning to Kirrik the Awakened at the Refugee Caravan.",p="你完成你的命令了吗？在太迟之前毁掉恶魔！",pEN="Have you done your bidding? Quash the evil before it is too late!",c="解决鸦人的幼鸟是件残忍的工作，然而忽视酝酿中的邪恶也是一件可怕的事情。你已经做得很好了。阿达尔的恩惠照亮在你的心上。",cEN="It is grim work toiling with someone's hatchlings, yet ignoring the brewing evil would be a bleak proposition as well. You have done well. A'dal's favor shines upon your heart."}
Q[10862]={d="那些可恶的鸦人简直是无孔不入，整天都在寻求着攻击我们的机会。他们会袭击我们派出去的猎人，有时候甚至还会侵入到我们的城墙之内。尽管我们已经在全力消灭他们，可他们的魔法太强，常常都能从我们手中逃走。\n\n不过，我还知道，另有一些鸦人声称他们不想与部落采取敌对态度，这些鸦人就居住在西北边的沙塔斯城。救赎者瑞拉克是他们的首领。去贫民窟把他找出来，逼迫他向我们伟大的部落投降。",dEN="The cowardly arakkoa attack us daily. They ambush our hunters and sometimes even raid inside our walls. We kill them when we can, but their magic is strong and they often escape our warbands.\n\nI have learned that some arakkoa claim to be friendly with the Horde. They live in Shattrath City to the northwest. Rilak the Redeemed is their leader. Search for him in the Lower City, and when you find him, demand his surrender.",o="罗卡格要你在沙塔斯城贫民窟找到救赎者瑞拉克，逼迫他和他的同族向部落投降。",oEN="Rokag wants you to seek out Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City section of Shattrath City and demand that he and his people surrender to the Horde.",c="你的人民很愤怒但是我所能做的事情有限。我们之中的一些人受到了纳鲁力量的洗礼而永远的改变了。至于那些在野外的鸦人则维持原本的样子。",cEN="Your people are angry but there is little I can do. Some of us have been touched by the power of the naaru and we are forever changed. Those of us who remain in the wild are as we have always been."}
Q[10863]={d="在边境地区，我们每天都得对付这群鸦人的骚扰。他们想什么时候攻击就什么时候攻击，他们可能直接过来攻击这里，也可能袭击我们的供给线，还可能杀掉我们派出去的斥候。\n\n可是，我们对这些神秘的生物知之甚少。我听说在西北边的沙塔斯城居住着一群友好的鸦人。或许他们会愿意分享同族的秘密。\n\n救赎者瑞拉克是他们的首领，他就居住在贫民窟的北边，去找他吧。",dEN="Out here on the frontier we have to deal with the arakkoa every day. They strike at us when they please, raiding our supply lines and killing our scouts.\n\nYet we know very little about these enigmatic creatures. I have received news that northwest of here in Shattrath City there are arakkoa who are not hostile. They might be willing to share the secrets of their race.\n\nRilak the Redeemed is their leader. He resides in the northern part of the Lower City.",o="德娜·肯尼迪要你找到沙塔斯城贫民窟的救赎者瑞拉克，并与他谈一谈。看看他对鸦人都知道些什么。",oEN="Lady Dena Kennedy wants you to seek out Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City section of Shattrath City and find out what secrets he will share of the Arakkoa.",c="算你聪明知道来找我。我可以告诉你很多事情。",cEN="You are wise to find me. There is much that I can show you."}
Q[10864]={d="我有一种分析邪恶魔法的设备，叫作恶魔占卜器。我想让你使用它进行分析工作，但在那之前……你必须先取悦它。你看，这里面囚禁着一个具备高度智慧的生物，它的需求……怎么说呢……很古怪。\n\n要想取悦它，你就得杀兽人，而且还必须是碎手兽人。占卜器想要他们的灵魂。\n\n收割到足够的灵魂后再回来找我。地狱火堡垒北边、南边以及堡垒周围都有碎手兽人。",dEN="I have a device, the Demoniac Scryer, that can analyze fel magic. I would have you use the Scryer, but first... you must appease it. The Scryer, you see, has trapped within it a creature of vast intelligence and its needs are, shall we say, quite eccentric.\n\nTo appease the Scryer, you must kill orcs. Specifically, they must be Shattered Hand orcs -- the Scryer demands their souls.\n\nReturn to me when the souls are reaped. You will find the orcs north, and south, and surrounding... Hellfire Citadel.",o="杀死20个碎手兽人，然后向萨尔玛的药剂师安东尼维奇复命。",oEN="Kill 20 Shattered Hand orcs, then return to Apothecary Antonivich in Thrallmar.",p="恶魔占卜器仍未得到安抚，。等你收割了碎手兽人的灵魂之后再回来找我。 <name>",pEN="The Demonaic Scryer is not yet appeased, <name>. Return to me after you have reaped the souls of Shattered Hand orcs.",c="干得好，。你的灵魂背负着许多死亡……现在恶魔占卜器会为你履行职责了。\n\n但愿你已经为即将到来的试炼做好了准备…… <name>",cEN="Well done, <name>. Your soul is burdened with many deaths... and the Demonaic Scryer will now perform its duties for you.\n\nLet us hope you are ready for the coming trial..."}
Q[10865]={d="快，你必须将拉扎安码头的情况告诉莱欧洛克斯！\n\n那些光球是由灵魂凝聚而成的，其中一些是莫克纳萨氏族成员的灵魂！",dEN="Quickly, you must inform Leoroxx of what is transpiring up at Razaan's Landing!\n\nThose orbs were comprised of souls, some of them Mok'Nathal!",o="唤灵者多戈加尔请你立即将拉扎安虚灵的阴谋告知莱欧洛克斯。莱欧洛克斯就在刀锋山的莫克纳萨村。",oEN="Speak with Leoroxx about what the Razaani ethereal are up to. He can be found at Mok'Nathal Village in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="你所说的，有可能发生吗？我在说什么啊？既然招魂师都这么说了，当然可能发生。\n\n记得之前我说过我们可能需要你的进一步帮忙吗？看来我好像可以预知未来。",cEN="What you say, is it even possible? What am I saying? Of course it is, if the spiritcallers say so.\n\nRemember before when I said that we might need your further assistance? It would seem that I can tell the future."}
Q[10866]={d="他蛰伏在我的思想里。等待我崩溃的那一刻……要我屈服于他的意志。\n\n他的死期到了。我要呼唤他，告诉他我愿意俯首听令。你必须趁他现身之际杀掉这个家伙，拿到钥匙！\n\n祖鲁希德是位兽人长者，拥有深不可测的强大力量，他必定得到了伊利丹的力量。你是在用生命做赌注，你真的愿意做这样大的牺牲吗？",dEN="He hides in my thoughts, mortal. He waits for me to break... for me to bend to his will.\n\nAnd this will be his undoing. I will call for him. I will tell him that I will do as he asks. When he appears, kill him and take the key!\n\nKnow this: Zuluhed is an ancient orc with unknown powers. He has surely been empowered further by Illidan. You risk your life for me in doing as I ask. Are you certain you wish to make such a sacrifice?",o="杀死疲惫的祖鲁希德，取回祖鲁希德的钥匙，并用它打开祖鲁希德的锁链，释放卡瑞纳库。",oEN="Kill Zuluhed the Whacked and recover Zuluhed's Key. Use Zuluhed's Key on Zuluhed's Chains to free Karynaku.",p="<卡瑞纳库呻吟着。>",pEN="<Karynaku groans.>",c="我自由了！你救了我们，！ <name>",cEN="I am free! You have saved us, <name>!"}
Q[10867]={d="只有一个办法能阻止他们……阻止他们亵渎莫克纳萨氏族先祖的灵魂！\n\n愿亡者的灵魂能享受安宁……$n，如果你愿意帮助我们的话，就立即返回拉扎安码头。\n\n杀死拉扎安虚灵，直到他们的首领节点亲王拉扎安露面。从拉扎安手中夺得灵魂之盒，然后将它交给唤灵者多戈加尔！",dEN="There can be only one response to this... this, DEFILEMENT of the souls of our ancestors!\n\n<name>, if you would aid us to restore the souls of our honored dead to their rightful place, go back to Razaan's Landing.\n\nGo back up there and kill the razaani until their leader, Nexus-Prince Razaan shows his cowardly face. Kill him and get those souls back, and then give them over to Spiritcaller Dohgar!",o="夺得灵魂之盒。",oEN="Collect the Collection of Souls.",p="你完成了吗？我们祖先的灵魂已经安全的从邪恶的虚灵组织手上取回了吗？",pEN="Have you done it? Are the souls of our ancestors safely recovered from the evil of the ethereals?",c="那些虚灵渣滓和他们的首领死了真好。我愿千种瘟疫降临到他们的同胞身上！\n\n，你为所有莫克纳萨所做的一切会得到奖赏！你真正是我们中的英雄。\n\n现在，让我们把我们先祖的灵魂释放到净化之火中吧。 <name>",cEN="Good that the ethereal filth and their leader are dead. I wish a thousand plagues upon their brethren!\n\nYou are to be rewarded for you actions on behalf of all of the Mok'Nathal, <name>! You are truly one of our heroes.\n\nLet us now release the souls of our ancestors to the cleansing fire."}
Q[10868]={d="那些鸦人再次偷袭了我们，他们这一次在夜间侵入，行动迅速，而且在我们的主力部队冲出去反击之前就利用黑暗魔法逃走了，甚至还有空利用召唤法阵救走了那些已被我军重创的士兵。但是，如果我们去攻击他们的老巢，他们恐怕就没有办法逃走了。里斯克鸦巢和西诺鸦巢就在北边和东北边。\n\n立刻找到这两个巢穴，消灭尽量多的鸦人。",dEN="The arakkoa have attacked us again, this time striking in the night and then using their dark magic to escape before we could charge out to meet them in numbers. They use their summoning circles to rescue their warriors from certain death but they cannot run from us if we attack their homes. Veil Reskk and Veil Shienor lie to the north and northeast.\n\nFind these arakkoa nests and kill as many as you can.",o="顾问菲埃拉要你杀掉14个西诺鸦爪战士和6个西诺巫师，然后返回裂石堡向她复命。",oEN="Advisor Faila asks that you kill 14 Shienor Talonites and 6 Shienor Sorcerers and then return to her in Stonebreaker Hold.",p=" 杀了多少鸦人？他们从你面前逃走了吗？当你冲进他们的营地时，他们是不是逃跑躲起来了？ <name>",pEN="How many arakkoa have slain <name>? Did they run from you? Did they run and hide when you stormed into their camp?",c="干得好，<class>。鸦人已经学会了畏惧部落的力量。",cEN="Well done <class>. The arakkoa have learned to fear the might of the Horde."}
Q[10869]={d="那群该死的鸦人再次攻击了我们。这一次他们趁着天黑进行袭击，然后趁我们集结军队反攻之前，利用他们的黑暗魔法逃走了。\n\n我要你立刻转至北边的里斯克鸦巢和西边的西诺鸦巢，到那里去干掉里面的所有鸦人。他们看来对我们完全没有任何畏惧之意，所以我们至少要削弱他们的力量，若能震慑到他们，则更好。",dEN="The arakkoa have attacked us again, this time striking in the night and then using their dark magic to escape before we could marshal our soldiers.\n\nVeil Reskk and Veil Shienor lie to the north and northwest. Find these arakkoa nests and kill as many as you can. They may not fear us, but at least we can thin their numbers.",o="加维·砂锤中尉要你杀掉14个西诺鸦爪战士和6个西诺巫师，然后返回奥蕾莉亚要塞向他复命。",oEN="Lieutenant Gravelhammer asks that you kill 14 Shienor Talonites and 6 Shienor Sorcerers and then return to him in Allerian Stronghold.",p="，你杀了多少鸦人？ <name>",pEN="How many arakkoa have you slain <name>?",c="干得好，<class>。鸦人已经学会了畏惧联盟的力量。",cEN="Well done <class>. The arakkoa have learned to fear the might of the Alliance."}
Q[10870]={d="让我送你回到莫德奈那里吧。他一定想要再见你一面。",dEN="Allow me to return you to Mordenai. I am certain that he wishes to see you once more.",o="让卡瑞纳库把你送回灵翼平原的莫德奈身边。",oEN="Let Karynaku return you to Mordenai in the Netherwing Fields.",c="你已经证明了自己是虚空之翼的盟友。我的母亲自由了，我的兄弟姐妹都得救了！\n\n也许有一天，我们会再次召唤你。当那一天到来时，要知道你会被张开双臂迎接——作为虚空之翼巨龙军团的一员兄弟。",cEN="You have proven yourself as an ally of the Netherwing. My mother is free and my brothers and sisters are saved!\n\nPerhaps someday, we will call for you again. When that day comes, know that you will be welcomed with open arms - a brother to the Netherwing Dragonflight."}
Q[10873]={d="我们的小哨站不断遭到袭击。几夜前，骨荒原东南边缘的虚空网山脊的蜘蛛突袭了我们。它们毒倒了许多族人，把他们用蛛网裹起来带走了。我们的一些战士拿起武器，几乎没做任何准备就追了上去。\n\n从那以后，我们再没见过那些俘虏，也没见过我们的狩猎队。我们希望有些人还活着，也许被蜘蛛关押着。我们人手很少。你愿意去寻找我们的族人吗？|n",dEN="Our small outpost is under constant attack. Several nights ago, we were raided by the spiders of Netherweb Ridge, on the southeastern edge of the Bone Wastes. They poisoned many of our people, wrapped them in webs and carried them away. Some of our warriors took up arms and with little preparation pursued the spiders.\n\nWe have not seen the captives or our hunting parties since. We hope that some may still be alive, perhaps imprisoned by the spiders. Our numbers are few. Will you search for our people?",o="斥候纳弗林要你去灵网山脊解救6名被网住的沙塔尔战士，然后返回沙塔尔营地向他复命。",oEN="Scout Navrin wants you to travel to the Netherweb Ridge and free 6 Webbed Sha'tar Warriors and then return to him at Sha'tari Base Camp.",p="你找到我们失踪的人了吗？",pEN="Did you find our missing people?",c="你救了那么多人。我以为我们再也见不到他们了。我们怎么谢你都不够，。 <name>",cEN="You saved so many. I didn't think we would ever see them again. We cannot thank you enough, <name>."}
Q[10874]={d="泰罗克的老巢斯克提斯位于白骨荒野以东，那里的沙拉斯鸦巢是泰罗克势力范围内最难以对付的属地。泰罗克的先遣军就在沙拉斯鸦巢的要塞公然向圣光挑起了战争。\n\n沙拉斯鸦巢的驻军利用复杂的魔法信号火焰与他们的主人传递信息。$r，转至东边的沙拉斯鸦巢熄灭信号火焰。只有阻止沙拉斯鸦巢传递消息，我们才有可能摧毁整个斯克提斯。\n\n但是，现在说这个还为时过早。",dEN="Terokk's perch, Skettis, looms above the Bone Wastes to the east. At the base of Skettis lies Veil Shalas, the most formidable of Terokk's colonies. It is through the stronghold of Veil Shalas that Terokk's forward sages wage war against the Light.\n\nThe evil-doers of Shalas communicate with their master using a complex system of magical signal fires. Travel to the east, <race>, and extinguish the fires. Once Veil Shalas is silenced, we can begin to plot the fall of Skettis.\n\nBut I get ahead of myself.",o="难民车队的基尔利克要你熄灭沙拉斯鸦巢的4簇信号火焰。",oEN="Kirrik the Awakened at the Refugee Caravan wants you to extinguish the four signal fires of Veil Shalas.",p="沙拉斯鸦巢必须要被消灭！",pEN="Veil Shalas must be silenced!",c="我们目睹了被诅咒的浓烟从这里升起。你非常勇敢，<class>。",cEN="We witnessed the cursed smoke rise from here. You are most brave, <class>."}
Q[10875]={d="$n，在你带着恶魔占卜器行动期间，我把你对抗邪兽人的事迹传了出去。我们在萨尔玛的杰出领袖纳兹格雷尔想和你谈谈。我相信他心里有个血腥的任务……",dEN="<name>, during your foray with the Demoniac Scryer, I sent word of your exploits against the fel orcs. Nazgrel, our illustrious leader in Thrallmar, wishes to speak with you. I believe he has a bloody mission in mind...",o="与地狱火半岛的萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="听到你对抗邪兽人的种种行动，真是好消息，。药剂师们花了大量时间和资源研究他们堕落的成因，虽然这些情报无比珍贵……但我兽人的血液在沸腾，渴望给这些叛徒一记重击！\n\n仔细听，我来解释我的任务…… <name>",cEN="It is good to hear of all your moves against the fel orcs, <name>. The apothecaries have spent much time and resources studying the cause of their corruption, and although such information is invaluable... my orc blood burns to strike a severe blow against these betrayers!\n\nListen close, and I will explain my task..."}
Q[10876]={d="指挥官戈拉克斯正在地狱火堡垒外训练碎手军官，要把这些军官磨砺成最嗜血的利刃。你必须杀死他，$n。失去他对邪兽人来说将是一次非常沉重的打击。\n\n但是，光杀死他还不够。\n\n你把这面旗子带上，到时候别忘了插在他旁边。戈拉克斯的上级——卡加斯之手——如果还流淌有哪怕一滴真正的兽人之血，那么他就一定会接受你的挑战！\n\n卡加斯之手的徽记，就是我想要的东西。",dEN="Force Commander Gorax is training Shattered Hand captains at the base of Hellfire Citadel, honing them to a bloody razor's edge. You must kill him, <name>, for his loss would be a mighty blow to the fel orcs.\n\nHowever, that is not all you must do.\n\nTake this banner. Place it atop Gorax's corpse. Gorax's commander, the Hand of Kargath, must answer your challenge if he has even a drop of true orc blood within him!\n\nHis head, the head of the hand of Kargath, is what I seek.",o="杀死指挥官戈拉克斯，将部落的挑战插在他旁边。然后杀死卡加斯之手，将卡加斯之手的徽记交给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Kill Force Commander Gorax, place the Challenge From the Horde upon his corpse, kill The Hand of Kargath, and then bring the Head of the Hand of Kargath to Nazgrel in Thrallmar.",p="你直面过卡加斯之手了吗，？ <name>",pEN="Have you faced the Hand of Kargath, <name>?",c="你完成了一件伟大的事，。邪兽人是所有真正兽人的耻辱。如果说我们有一个恐惧，那就是再次屈服于恶魔的腐化。所以你看，我们与邪兽人的战争不仅仅是对抗凶猛敌人的战斗——它也是一场我们内心的战斗。\n\n而凭借力量——你一次又一次展现出的力量——这将是一场我们会赢的战斗。 <name>",cEN="You have done a great deed, <name>. The fel orcs are a shame to all true orcs. If we have one fear, it is the fear of succumbing to demonic corruption once again. So you see, our war against the fel orcs is more than merely a battle with fierce foes -- it is also a battle within ourselves.\n\nAnd with strength, strength you have shown time again, it is a battle we will win."}
Q[10877]={d="很久以前，有一支车队奉命转至奥金顿古老的墓穴中寻找恐怖圣物。找到圣物之后，他们被那强大的力量吓得逃走了，但圣物却仍然毁灭了他们。那个圣物中蕴涵着邪恶的力量，一旦被触碰就能召唤出强大的妖魔。后来，他们所有人都死在了篷车旁，就在这里向东的某个地方。\n\n不过，这个黑暗的神器却是击败那只飘荡在白骨荒野上的受诅者泰里布斯的关键之物。如果你愿意的话，就帮我把它找回来，要小心，你的生命，甚至是你的灵魂都将面临危险。",dEN="Long ago a caravan went to Auchindoun with a mission to take a Dread Relic from the ancient tombs beneath the necropolis. They fled, but the relic was their undoing. The relic is evil and it summons evil when touched. Their caravan was destroyed somewhere to the east.\n\nThis dark artifact is the key to a terrible plan to defeat Teribus the Cursed, a creature that flies over the Bone Wastes. Help me if you wish, but your life and even your soul will be at risk.",o="沃尔昆要你去东边被遗弃的篷车找回恐怖圣物。任务完成后向沃尔昆复命。",oEN="Oakun wants you to travel east to the Derelict Caravan to recover the Dread Relic. Return to Oakun when the task is complete.",p="你已经取得恐怖圣物了吗？我们必须拥有它。",pEN="Do you have the Dread Relic? We must have it.",c="你能成功回来真是不可思议。恐怖圣物比我所担心的还要强大。只有一个强而有力的英雄才能在运送如此亵渎的邪恶遗物时撑过如此长的旅途。",cEN="It is incredible that you succeeded. The Dread Relic is far more powerful than I feared. Only a mighty hero could have survived the long journey back carrying such blasphemous evil."}
Q[10878]={d="我们的车队遭到暗影议会秘教信徒的袭击之后，派遣了一位斥候来到沙塔斯城寻求帮助。可是，这里的卫兵却认为我们现在已经安全了，他们完全低估了那些疯子。\n\n总之，我们绝对会被这些秘教新兵在半夜里割破喉咙。所以，你最好能在他们来攻击我们之前把他们解决掉。\n\n在南边的奥金顿北门就能找到那些袭击者。",dEN="After our caravan fell prey to an attack by Shadow Council cabal cultists, scouts were sent to Shattrath to call for help. The guards think we're safe for now, but they underestimate these madmen.\n\nI, for one, am not looking forward to having my throat slit by some cabal initiate in the middle of the night. Do us all a favor and take the fight to them, before they come to us.\n\nYou will find our attackers south of here, at Auchindoun's northern entrance.",o="难民车队的米克达要你消灭8名秘教散兵，4名秘教织法者和2名秘教新兵。",oEN="Mekeda at the Refugee Caravan wants you to kill 8 Cabal Skirmishers, 4 Cabal Spell-Weavers and 2 Cabal Initiates.",p="我交代你的事做了吗，？我为我们的性命担忧。 <name>",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>? I fear for our lives.",c="我现在可以松一口气了，。暗影议会暂时会被挡住。\n\n他们是杀人犯和懦夫，你展现出的勇气会让他们不敢轻举妄动。 <name>",cEN="I can breathe a sigh of relief for now, <name>. The Shadow Council will be held off for the time being.\n\nThey are murderers and cowards and your display of courage will keep them at bay."}
Q[10879]={d="斯克提斯对我们发动了攻击！你召集到足够的盟友守护沙塔斯城了吗？\n\n阻止他们的攻击！",dEN="Skettis has waged war on us! Have you gathered enough to help with Shattrath's defense?\n\nHold off the attackers!",o="击败入侵者，然后与瑞拉克谈一谈。",oEN="Hold off the attackers and speak with Rilak the Redeemed.",p="现在不是闲聊的时候，。我们正遭受攻击！挡住入侵者！ <name>",pEN="This is no time for idle chatter, <name>. We're under attack! Hold off the invaders!",c="我赞赏你的战斗本领，<class>。你已经证明自己是圣光真正的捍卫者。愿阿达尔的祝福照耀你最黑暗的时刻。\n\n但请望向远方的地平线。阴云笼罩着斯克提斯。特罗克无疑正在谋划他的下一步。沙塔斯暂时安全。但只有明天知道，什么样的恐怖会降临到我们头上。",cEN="I applaud your prowess in combat, <class>. You have proven yourself to be a true defender of the Light. May A'dal's blessing shine upon your darkest hours.\n\nBut look far into the horizon. Dark skies loom above Skettis. Terokk is undoubtedly plotting his next move. Shattrath is safe for now. But only tomorrow knows what terror will descend upon us."}
Q[10880]={d="这封信上印有一个黑色的图章，尽管它所使用的语言你可以理解，但似乎仍然使用了某些暗语。\n\n或许难民车队里有人能读得懂这封信。",dEN="This message bears a dark seal and though the language seems somewhat familiar, it appears to be encoded.\n\nPerhaps someone at the Refugee Caravan will know something about it.",o="将秘教的命令交给泰罗卡森林难民车队的米克达。",oEN="Bring the Cabal Orders to Mekeda at the Refugee Caravan in the Bone Wastes.",p="你想给我看什么东西吗，？ <name>",pEN="You wish to show me something, <name>?",c="哦，对了……这是用暗影密码的基本型式所写成的。我对它的了解还不够完美但是应该足够翻译这封信。\n\n当你住在贫民窟的难民还有流放者当中你就会学到不少这种不正当的知识。",cEN="Ah, yes... this was written in a basic form of the shadow cypher. My knowledge of it is not perfect but it should suffice to translate this.\n\nYou learn much about unsavory subjects when you live among outcasts and refugees in the Lower City."}
Q[10881]={d="许多人认为是暗影议会制造了爆炸使得奥金顿被炸得粉碎。根据这个传说所说，他们唤醒了居住在奥金顿里的一个非常邪恶的存在。\n\n如果传闻是真的，那个恶魔一定与他们发生了激烈的战斗。根据这份命令所述，一些暗影议会成员逃离了奥金顿，并将许多圣物藏在了暗影墓穴。\n\n这其中，有三件圣物是非常强大的，它们是伟大的祖先阿鲁内、克埃林和阿塔洛的遗物。我要你去把它们找回来。",dEN="Many believe it was the Shadow Council that caused the explosion that tore Auchindoun apart. It is rumored they awoke a great evil inside.\n\nIf that is true, then that evil must have turned against them. According to these orders, part of the Shadow Council is fleeing Auchindoun. They are using the Shadow Tomb to store powerful artifacts from Auchindoun.\n\nThree of these are sacred, for they belonged to the powerful patriarchs Arunen, K'alen and Atalor. I must ask you to retrieve them.",o="进入难民车队西边的暗影墓穴，找回阿鲁内的披风、克埃林的木槌和阿塔洛的卷轴。任务完成后返回难民车队向米克达复命。",oEN="Go into the Shadow Tomb, west of the Refugee Caravan and retrieve the Drape of Arunen, the Gavel of K'alen and the Scroll of Atalor. Return to Mekeda at the Refugee Caravan after you've completed this task.",p="你把圣物取回来了吗，？我们不能让暗影议会用它们的力量来做邪恶的事。 <name>",pEN="Have you retrieved the relics, <name>? We cannot allow the Shadow Council to use their power for dark purposes.",c="也许圣光已经忘了我，但是我从未忘记圣光。这些遗物对我的同胞来说曾经是神圣的。\n\n让暗影议会将它们的力量使用在邪恶的行为上是……无法想象的！",cEN="The Light might have forgotten me, but I have not forgotten the Light. These relics were once very sacred to my people.\n\nAllowing the Shadow Council to use their power for evil is... unthinkable!"}
Q[10882]={d="<在阿达尔的「声音」中能听出一个不和谐的音符。>\n\n凯尔萨斯王子选错了他的看守，如今我们关押在禁魔监狱里的那些实体正在挣脱出来。\n\n其中尤其有一个，一位名叫先驱者斯凯里斯的古神仆从，正试图促成他主子征服宇宙中所有世界的愿景。\n\n，你绝不能让他逃脱。回到风暴要塞，进入禁魔监狱，趁还来得及，杀死先驱者斯凯里斯！\"\" $n",dEN="<A discordant note can be detected in A'dal's 'voice'.>\n\nPrince Kael'thas has chosen his warden poorly, and now the entities that we kept locked up within the Arcatraz are breaking free.\n\nOne in particular, a servant of the Old Gods known as Harbinger Skyriss, seeks to usher in his masters' vision of conquering all of the worlds in the universe.\n\n<name>, you must not allow him to escape. Return to Tempest Keep, enter the Arcatraz, and slay Harbinger Skyriss before it is too late!",o="进入风暴要塞的禁魔监狱，杀死预言者斯克瑞斯。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的圣光广场，向阿达尔复命。",oEN="You have been tasked to go to Tempest Keep's Arcatraz satellite and slay Harbinger Skyriss. Return to A'dal at the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City after you have done so.",p="<阿达尔把注意力集中在你身上，他的目光几乎令人无法承受。>\n\n安多里安，也许你并不明白你任务的重大？没有时间可以浪费了……召集一队同伴，进入禁魔监狱。\n\n终结先驱者斯凯里斯。",pEN="<A'dal focuses his attention upon you, his gaze almost unbearable.>\n\nAndorrian, perhaps you do not understand the magnitude of your mission? There is no time to waste... gather yourself a group of compatriots and enter the Arcatraz.\n\nPut an end to Harbinger Skyriss.",c="你再次证明了自己的价值。如果先驱者斯凯里斯挣脱出来，无数人会在随之而来的冲突中丧生，就像你所在的世界艾泽拉斯上另一位古神仆从斯凯拉姆那样。\n\n，作为回报我能给你的东西相比之下也许微不足道，但请相信，它承载着沙塔尔永恒的感激。 <name>",cEN="Once again you have proven your mettle. Had Harbinger Skyriss broken free, countless thousands would have perished in the ensuing conflict, just as happened with another servant of the Old Gods, Skeram, on your world of Azeroth.\n\n<name>, what I have to offer in return may seem a pittance in comparison, but know that it comes with the everlasting gratitude of the Sha'tar."}
Q[10883]={d="你已经证明自己有能力成就伟业，$n。你发现诅咒密码以及凯尔萨斯的牵连，对我们的事业至关重要。如果凯尔使用那密码，这世界残存的一切都可能崩塌。\n\n阿达尔确信必须阻止凯尔，如今正在寻找愿意接受试炼的冒险者。那些证明自己力量的人将得到纳鲁的恩赐。\n\n<卡德加点头。>\n\n阿达尔在等待……|n",dEN="You have proven yourself capable of great feats, <name>. Your discovery of the Cipher of Damnation and Kael'Thas' involvement is most important to our cause. Should Kael use the cipher, what little is left of this world may collapse.\n\nA'dal is convinced that Kael must be stopped and now seeks adventurers willing to undergo trials. Those that prove their strength will be granted favor by the naaru.\n\n<Khadgar nods.>\n\nA'dal awaits...",o="与沙塔斯城的阿达尔交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with A'dal in Shattrath City.",c="风暴要塞是一个纳鲁的创造物，凡人。进入船舰总是需要我们的许可。尽管回去风暴要塞已经被认为是没有必要的了。或许，对凡人种族来说是一种骄傲，但是纳鲁很少对这样的东西感兴趣。\n\n我们现在转至那里是因为我们必须如此。我们不能让凯尔萨斯使用诅咒密码。\n\n如今通道已经打开了，只有愚者才会毫无准备地进去。不要低估那些试炼的意义，凡人。",cEN="Tempest Keep is a naaru creation, mortal. Access to the vessel has always been within our power to grant. A return to Tempest Keep, though, had been deemed unnecessary. A point of pride for a mortal race, perhaps, but naaru invest little in such things.\n\nWe go now because we must. Kael'thas cannot be allowed to utter the words of damnation.\n\nWhile the way is open, only a fool would enter unproven. Do not underestimate the purpose of the trials, mortal."}
Q[10884]={d="你必须通过四项试炼，才能被纳鲁认可为$g合格者:合格者;。\n\n在地狱火堡垒的破碎大厅里，关押着三个你的族人。他们被那个残忍的家伙卡加斯·刃拳扣押在那里。他想处决他们，以此彰显自己的雄风与力量。你必须在这样的暴行发生前救出这些囚犯。作为凭证，把那把未使用过的刽子手之斧带给我。刃上不能沾一滴血！|n",dEN="Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.\n\nWithin the Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel are three of your people. They are held there by the merciless one, Kargath Bladefist. He seeks to execute them as a sign of his virility and power. You must save these prisoners before such an atrocity can come to pass. As proof of deed, bring me the unused axe of the executioner. It must not have a drop of blood on its blade!",o="沙塔斯城的阿达尔要求你从地狱火堡垒的破碎大厅中取回未使用的刽子手之斧。\n\n该任务必须在英雄等级难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to recover the Unused Axe of the Executioner from the Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",p="<阿达尔向你表示问候。>",pEN="<A'dal greets you.>",c="干得好，。你通过了仁慈的试炼。 <name>",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have passed the trial of mercy."}
Q[10885]={d="你必须通过四项试炼，才能被纳鲁认可为$g合格者:合格者;。\n\n力量的试炼分为两部分。你必须摧毁盘牙水库蒸汽地窟的首领，督军卡利瑟里斯，并把他的三叉戟带给我。在奥金尼地穴的暗影迷宫杀死名为摩摩尔的异界存在，把它的精华带给我。\n\n做到这些，你就通过了力量的试炼。",dEN="Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.\n\nThe trial of strength is divided in two. You must destroy the leader of the Coilfang Steamvaults, Warlord Kalithresh, and bring me his trident. Slay the extra-planar being known as Murmur, in the Shadow Labyrinth of Auchindoun, and bring me his essence.\n\nDo this and you will have passed the trial of strength.",o="沙塔斯城的阿达尔要求你取回卡利瑟里斯的三叉戟和摩摩尔的精华。\n\n该任务必须在英雄等级难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to recover Kalithresh's Trident and Murmur's Essence.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",p="<阿达尔向你表示问候。>",pEN="<A'dal greets you.>",c="干得好，。你通过了力量的试炼。 <name>",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have passed the trial of strength."}
Q[10886]={d="你必须通过四项试炼，才能被纳鲁认可为$g合格者:合格者;。\n\n在旅途中，我们遇到过许多危险的生物。其中一些被我们囚禁，关进了如今被称为风暴要塞禁魔监狱的地方。\n\n然而，有一名囚犯只是环境的受害者。一个在错误的时间搭上了错误的纳鲁飞船的偷渡者。\n\n前往禁魔监狱，救出那个侏儒，米尔豪斯·法力风暴。确保他活下来。",dEN="Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.\n\nIn our travels we have encountered many dangerous beings. Some of these beings we incarcerated and placed in what is now known as the Arcatraz of Tempest Keep.\n\nThere is one prisoner, however, that is a victim of circumstance. A stowaway who was in the wrong naaru vessel at the wrong time.\n\nVenture to the Arcatraz and rescue the gnome, Millhouse Manastorm. Ensure his survival.",o="沙塔斯城的阿达尔要求你从风暴要塞的禁魔监狱中救出米尔豪斯·法力风暴。\n\n该任务必须在英雄等级难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to rescue Millhouse Manastorm from the Arcatraz of Tempest Keep.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",p="<阿达尔向你表示问候。>",pEN="<A'dal greets you.>",c="干得好，。你通过了坚韧的试炼。 <name>",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have passed the trial of tenacity."}
Q[10887]={d="我很感激你的帮助，$n。我还以为我会被杀掉呢。\n\n不过，现在我们得赶紧离开这里了，用不了多久就会有更多的秘会教徒来追捕我们。",dEN="I appreciate your help, <name>. I was certain I was going to be killed.\n\nLet's get out of here with a hurry. It won't be long before more cultists come after us.",o="帮助阿库诺回到泰罗卡森林的难民车队。任务完成后与米克达谈一谈。",oEN="Help Akuno find his way to the Refugee Caravan. Speak to Mekeda after you've completed this quest.",p="什么事，？ <name>",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你救出了阿库诺，我的一位挚友。为此我欠你一份情，。 <name>",cEN="You rescued Akuno, a dear friend of mine. For this I am in your debt, <name>."}
Q[10889]={d="泰罗克必定会发动复仇的反攻。\n\n立即转至沙塔斯城，向瑞拉克报信！",dEN="Your actions, while brave, will surely rouse a vindictive response from Terokk.\n\nHurry to Shattrath. Send word to Rilak!",o="转至沙塔斯城，与贫民窟的救赎者瑞拉克谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Shattrath City and speak with Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City.",c="斯克提斯的防卫者在他们的栖息地不断的成长。沙塔斯城有麻烦了。我们一定会感受到泰罗卡复仇的猛烈攻击。\n\n赶快召集一队防御兵！去跟防卫者格纳斯纳谈话并且让他知道你已经准备好对抗攻击我们的敌人了！",cEN="The guardians of Skettis grow restless from their perch. Shattrath is in trouble. We will surely feel the brunt of Terokk's revenge.\n\nMuster a defense party quickly! Speak with Defender Grashna and let him know you are ready to bear arms against our attackers!"}
Q[10891]={d="加基森有位名叫德罗泰恩的矮人能向你传授锻造君王板甲的技艺。转至塔纳利斯沙漠找他吧！",dEN="There's a dwarf in Gadgetzan by the name of Derotain Mudsipper who'll teach you how to make imperial plate armor. All you gotta do is get to the Tanaris desert and find him. Interested?",o="与塔纳利斯加基森的德罗泰恩·泥饮者交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Derotain Mudsipper at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",c="当然我将教你怎样制造帝国的金属盔甲！它可能花费你一点钱……用瑟银锭来付款！",cEN="Of course I'll teach you how to make imperial plate armor! It might cost you a bit of gold... in the form of thorium bars!"}
Q[10892]={d="加基森有位名叫德罗泰恩的矮人可以教你如何锻造君王板甲。转至塔纳利斯沙漠就可以找到他，有兴趣吗？",dEN="There's a dwarf in Gadgetzan by the name of Derotain Mudsipper who'll teach you how to make imperial plate armor. All you gotta do is get to the Tanaris desert and find him. Interested?",o="与塔纳利斯加基森的德罗泰恩·泥饮者交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Derotain Mudsipper at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",c="当然我将教你怎样制造帝国铠甲！它可能花费你一点钱……而且你得用瑟银锭来付款！",cEN="Of course I'll teach you how to make imperial plate armor! It might cost you a bit of gold... in the form of thorium bars!"}
Q[10893]={d="那些黑翼拜龙教徒彻底占据了隧道，我们面临的情况越来越严峻了。坦白地讲，他们人数太多了。\n\n尽管我们当前还能应付他们小规模的进犯，但如果对方全力认真进攻这里的话，我们几乎无法对他们造成任何阻碍。\n\n当前的状况要求我们必须选出一个人，穿越隧道到另一边去，刺杀他们的领袖德莱卡·长尾。你愿意成为这个人吗？",dEN="With the Blackwing wyrmcultists massing in the tunnel, we're hard pressed to deal with the situation. Quite frankly, they have the numbers.\n\nAnd while we've been able to take care of any of their people that get too close, the fact remains that if they attack in earnest, we're going to be overrun.\n\nThe situation calls for someone to get through to the other end of the tunnel, and take out their leader, Draaca Longtail. Up for some fun?",o="消灭龙颅小径内的拜龙教领袖德莱卡·长尾。",oEN="Slay Draaca Longtail, the leader of the wyrmcultists in the Wyrmskull Tunnel.",p="她死了吗？\n\n，如果我们想在这里有一战之力，就需要你杀死德拉卡·长尾，在他们的队伍中散布混乱！ <name>",pEN="Is she dead?\n\n<name>, if we're to have a fighting chance here, we need you to sow confusion into their ranks by killing Draaca Longtail!",c="由于德拉卡已被解决，我们应该可以利用现在的情势。他们将会彼此争夺看谁能掌权，这将会减轻一些压力。\n\n那就是，除非在你给我的笔记中提到的监工出来取代她的位置。\n\n让我们看看是否你能做点什么保证那绝不会发生！",cEN="With Draaca out of the picture, we should be able to take advantage of the situation. They'll be in-fighting over who should be in charge, and that will relieve some of the pressure.\n\nThat is, unless the overseer mentioned in that note you gave me comes to take her place.\n\nLet's see if you can do something to make sure that never happens!"}
Q[10894]={d="嗯嗯，我也不是很清楚我们现在该做些什么。我并不擅长制订军事计划。\n\n但观察者希德·月影一定知道该怎么做。他正在龙颅之桥以西的龙颅小径一带领导着那里的防御力量。事实上，我们在那边驻扎了一支守备部队，以防拜龙教采取什么行动。\n\n拜托你了，把这张便笺立刻送给他。",dEN="Hmm, I'm not certain what we should do. I'm not much of a military planner.\n\nWatcher Moonshade will know what to do. He's heading up our defensive efforts at the Wyrmskull Tunnel to the west at the end of Wyrmskull Bridge. We have a force out there just in case the cultists try anything funny.\n\nPlease, take the note to him with all due haste.",o="将会议记录交给刀锋山龙颅小径入口附近的观察者希德·月影。",oEN="Deliver the Meeting Note to Watcher Moonshade at the entrance of the Wyrmskull Tunnel in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="我可以帮你什么？你是从永恒树林带消息来吗？",pEN="How can I help you? You bring news from Evergrove?",c="就跟我想的一样，那样并不好！\n\n我想到一个方法可以帮助你，但是首先，我在想你可以帮助我们吗？\n\n人人为我，我为人人。",cEN="It's as I thought, and that's not good!\n\nI've got an idea for how to help you, but first, I was wondering if you might help us out first?\n\nYou scratch my back, I'll scratch yours."}
Q[10895]={d="是时候从空中打击塞斯高了！我们的狮鹫骑士已经准备好出击了，。但他们需要有人在地面为他们指引目标。你准备好执行这项秘密任务了吗？\n\n把这些烟雾信标带进塞斯高，西边血环氏族的要塞。他们有四座守卫塔：一座在北墙附近，一座在南墙附近，一座在他们的熔炉旁，还有一座坐落在山脚下。在每座塔下放置一个信标，我们就飞进来把它们炸掉！ $n $g你:你;",dEN="It's time to strike Zeth'Gor from the air! Our gryphon riders are ready for a sortie, <name>. But they need someone on the ground to direct their fire. Are you ready for a covert mission?\n\nTake these smoke beacons into Zeth'Gor, the Bleeding Hollow stronghold to the west. They have four guard towers: one near their northern wall, one near their southern wall, one near their forge and another nestled in their foothills. Place a beacon underneath each of the towers and we'll fly in and bomb them!",o="将烟雾信标放置在塞斯高的四座哨塔下，然后向远征军岗哨的空军指挥官达比利复命。",oEN="Use the smoke beacon at each of Zeth'Gor's towers, and then return to Wing Commander Dabir'ee at Expedition Point.",p="时间紧迫，。我们必须烧掉那些守卫塔！ <name>",pEN="Time is crucial, <name>. We need those guard towers burned!",c="我从这里就能看到浓烟和火焰！干得好，！我们的狮鹫骑士对你的赞扬可不止一两句——你刚才做的事需要极大的胆量…… <name>",cEN="I could see the smoke and flames from here! Good job, <name>! You received more than a few words of praise from our gryphon riders -- what you just did took a lot of guts..."}
Q[10896]={d="这片土地上的所有树木都已经被奥金顿释放出来的能量破坏掉了，那股恶魔能量亵渎与腐蚀了周围的环境，将茂密的森林变成了现在你眼中的这片废土。而那些存活下来的树木，现在正遭受着木螨的侵扰，它们在树皮下蠕动，啃咬着树木的躯干。\n\n东北侧林地边缘的那些腐烂的森林愤怒者和被感染的根须漫步者身上都有木螨滋生。杀掉那些怪物，然后再杀掉从它们身上掉下来的木螨。",dEN="The trees of this land are ravaged by the power that was unleashed from Auchindoun. The foul magic that was unleashed blasted the land into the wastes you see all around. The trees that survived are now infested with wretched wood mites that crawl under their bark and gnaw at their flesh.\n\nRotting forest-rages and infested root-walkers are breeding grounds for the mites. They are found along the edge of the wood to the east. Destroy these creatures and then kill the mites that flee their husks.",o="拉库泰要你杀掉25只木螨，然后返回难民车队向他复命。在腐烂的森林愤怒者和被感染的根须漫步者身上都可以找到木螨。",oEN="Lakotae wants you to kill 25 Wood Mites and then return to him at the Refugee Caravan. The mites can be found living inside the bodies of Rotting Forest-Ragers and Infested Root-Walkers.",p="你消灭了最坏的侵扰了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed the worst of the infestations?",c="你为帮助泰罗卡森林做了很多，。最严重的螨虫群落被摧毁后，我们也许还能收复这片荒废的土地。 <name>",cEN="You have done much to help Terokkar Forest, <name>. With the worst of the mite colonies destroyed we may yet be able to reclaim this wasted land."}
Q[10897]={d="炼金师可以利用不同植物的药效，配制出恢复力量和生命的药水。\n\n我熟悉外域中的所有植物，可以教会炼金师们如何有效得利用它们。如果你对此感兴趣的话，我有一项任务要交给你。\n\n据说风暴要塞的高级植物学家弗雷温着有一本内容全面的植物学指南。将它和你配制的药水样本一同带回来给我，我就教给你想学的东西。",dEN="As you know, plants have properties that allow alchemists to re-energize and reinvigorate others through potions.\n\nMy familiarity with the plants of Outland allows me to teach alchemists how to make the most out of them. If you're interested in expanding your knowledge of potions, I have but one task to ask of you.\n\nHigh Botanist Freywinn in Tempest Keep is rumored to have written a comprehensive botany guide. Bring it to me along with samples of your work and I'll teach you the knowledge you seek.",o="劳兰娜·萨维尔要你转至风暴要塞的生态船，从高级植物学家弗雷温手中夺得植物学家的指南。此外，将5瓶超级治疗药水、5瓶超级法力药水和5瓶特效无梦睡眠药水一并交给她。\n\n*注意！* 你只能选择一种炼金术专精。",oEN="Lauranna Thar'well wants you to go to the Botanica in Tempest Keep and retrieve the Botanist's Field Guide from High Botanist Freywinn. In addition she also wants you to bring her 5 Super Healing Potions, 5 Super Mana Potions and 5 Major Dreamless Sleep Potions.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",p="你确定吗，？专精药剂会使你无法再追求其他专精。 <name>",pEN="Are you sure about this, <name>? Specializing in potions will prevent you from pursuing other specializations.",c="太好了！看起来你渴望着学习，那就让我们开始吧。我将教你怎样让你用在炼金术药水里的植物起最大效用。\n\n你将发现如果你知道你正做什么，你能使药草拥有很大的用途。有时候，你能以一份药水的材料做出两罐药水。",cEN="Excellent! It looks like you're eager to learn, so let's get to it. I will teach you how to make the most out of the plants you use in your alchemical potions.\n\nYou will find that you can make herbs go a really long way if you know what you're doing. Sometimes you will be able to make two potion with materials you initially judged necessary for just one."}
Q[10898]={d="天空之翼在你周围绕来绕去。\n\n你觉得他是想让你跟着他走。",dEN="Skywing flutters around you.\n\nYou get the feeling he wants you to follow him.",o="护送天空之翼，完成之后向沙塔斯城的救赎者瑞拉克报告。",oEN="Escort Skywing and report to Rilak the Redeemed in Shattrath City.",p="你为什么而来呢？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="哎呀，可怜的天翼处在“禁锢者”卢安卡可怕的诅咒之下！\n\n天翼转至沙拉斯鸦巢试图说服其它人正视圣光的道路。他们并未轻视他的行动，特别是坐在斯克提斯的门阶上。\n\n卢安卡是泰罗克最惧怕的密探之一。你已经释放了天翼，做得好！我感谢你。",cEN="Alas, poor Skywing was under the dreaded curse of Luanga the Imprisoner!\n\nSkywing traveled to Veil Shalas to attempt to sway others in seeing the way of the Light. They didn't take lightly to his actions, especially sitting on the doorstep of Skettis.\n\nLuanga was one of Terokk's most feared agents. You have done well by freeing Skywing! I thank you."}
Q[10899]={d="任何炼金师都会告诉你，物质是可塑的，任何物质都能转化为另一种——但没有什么真正被创造或消灭。\n\n一位真正的转化大师能够学会克服这一限制——而我可以教你如何获得这种精通！\n\n作为一名准，你无疑熟悉原始之力——所有原始力量物质化身的结合体。向我展示你转化本领的证明，我就会与你分享我的知识。 $g你:你; $g你:你;",dEN="Any alchemist will tell you that matter is malleable, any substance can be transformed into another - but nothing is really created or destroyed.\n\nA true master of transmutation can learn to overcome this limitation - and I can teach you how to obtain this mastery!\n\nAs a prospective transmuter you're undoubtedly familiar with primal might - the combination of the material representation of all primal forces. Show me proof of your transmuting prowess and I will share my knowledge with you.",o="虚空风暴风暴尖塔的萨雷维要你给他带去4份源生之能。\n\n*注意！* 你只能选择一种炼金术专精。",oEN="Zarevhi at the Stormspire in Netherstorm wants you to bring him 4 Primal Mights.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",p="你确定要成为一名转化大师？假如你专精在这个领域的话就不能专精在药水或者药剂上。",pEN="Are you sure you want to become a master transmuter? If you specialize in this field you will find it impossible to specialize in potions or elixirs.",c="干得漂亮，！这些转化在各方面都完美无缺！\n\n现在我会教你，炼金转化过程如何能凭空召唤出物质！好好运用你的知识吧，转化大师。\n\n现在，恕我失陪，我得去见一位对原始之力感兴趣的买家。 <name>",cEN="Excellent work, <name>! These transmutations are perfect in every way!\n\nI will now teach you the manner in which the alchemical transmutation process can conjure matter out of thin air! Make good use of your knowledge, master transmuter.\n\nNow, if you'll excuse me, I have to go see a buyer interested in primal might."}
Q[10900]={c="烧了它，<race>。把一切都烧光！他们什么都不配得到！你听见了吗！什么都——不——配！他们必须为做过的事付出代价。为他们仍在做的事。\n\n如果我能挣脱这些该死的束缚，我会亲手杀了瓦丝琪。\n\n又或者，你是想替奈普图隆办事？她的死对我们双方都有好处，软皮。你愿意帮我打造那柄神圣的短棒吗。",cEN="Burn it down, <race>. Burn it all down! They deserve nothing! Do you hear me! NOTHING! They must pay for what they have done. For what they continue to do.\n\nI would kill Vashj myself if I could break free of these damned bindings.\n\nOr maybe you seek to do the work of Neptulon? Her death serves both of us, soft-skin. Will you assist me in forming the sacred cudgel."}
Q[10902]={d="我几乎把毕生心血都投入到精炼药剂的事业中去了。尽管我获得了许多成功，但仍有一个愿望未尽。至今，我还无法制造出永生药剂。\n\n不过，我已经知道我缺少什么材料了。我听说在艾泽拉斯世界有一处地方叫作时光之穴。有许多被称为裂隙领主和裂隙守卫者的怪物会在那里切入和切出时间线。\n\n这样频繁的切入和切出时光会让时光之河本身流出眼泪，最终将使时光那种无穷尽的特性扭曲并晶体化，形成某种精华。把这种精华和你的工作样本一起带回来，我就会教给你我所知道的一切。",dEN="I've devoted my life to perfecting my elixirs. Despite my success, I haven't been able to create an elixir of eternal life.\n\nI think I know the reagent I'm missing. I've heard of a place called the Caverns of Time in Azeroth where intruders known as rift lords and rift keepers phase in and out of the timeline.\n\nThis intrusive time-shifting creates tears in time itself, twisting it infinitely into crystallized essences. Bring these to me along with samples of your work and I'll teach you all I know.",o="进入时光之穴的黑色沼泽，从裂隙领主和裂隙守卫者身上获取10份永恒精华。将这些与5瓶特效防御药剂、5瓶掌控药剂和5瓶特效敏捷药剂一起交给沙塔斯城贫民窟中的罗罗基姆。\n\n*注意* 你只能选择一种炼金术专精。",oEN="Go to the Black Morass in the Caverns of Time and obtain 10 Essences of Infinity from Rift Lords and Rift Keepers. Bring these along with 5 Elixirs of Major Defense, 5 Elixirs of Mastery and 5 Elixirs of Major Agility to Lorokeem in Shattrath's Lower City.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",p="精华！你已经拿到了吗？",pEN="The essences! Do you have them?",c="假如你带来的这些东西是指标的话，那就表示你对药剂很有心得。你将会是个很好的学生。\n\n这些精华将会提供我足够的材料来调配我的配方。我的发现将会使我在所有的炼金师中非常出名！\n\n现在，假如你愿意学习的话，我就愿意教你。",cEN="You are very good with elixirs, if these are any indication. You will make a fine student.\n\nThese essences will provide me enough materials to formulate my recipe. I will be known among all alchemists for this discovery!\n\nNow, if you're willing to learn, I am willing to teach."}
Q[10903]={d="$n，在你转至塞斯高执行任务的时候，我收到了一条关于前线指挥官尤勒斯上校的消息。他前几天在高加兹前哨的战斗里中了邪恶的魔法，被恶魔力量腐化了，现在的情况非常糟糕。\n\n你已经在对抗邪兽人的战斗中取得了这么多优秀的战果，你的作战技巧完全不用质疑，可你的精神，又是否如你的肉体一般强健呢？\n\n请你立刻回到荣耀堡，与克拉图谈谈，他就在荣耀堡旅店的二楼。",dEN="<name>, while you were on your mission in Zeth'Gor, I received news of my commanding officer, Colonel Jules. He was stricken with a demonic corruption while fighting near the Gor'gaz Outpost, and his situation has grown very bad.\n\nYou have made such great gains for us against the fel orcs. Your strength in battle is without question... is your spirit just as strong?\n\nPlease, return to Honor Hold and speak with Klatu, in an upper room at the Honor Hold inn.",o="与荣耀堡旅店内的助手克拉图谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Assistant Klatu, at Honor Hold's inn.",c="是，是真的。这些日子以来，尤勒斯上校的情况已经变的更糟。学者巴拉达忙于为他祈祷……希望他会被治愈。",cEN="Yes, it is true. Colonel Jules' situation has grown much worse these past days. Anchorite Barada is busy praying for him... let us hope he may be cured."}
Q[10904]={d="我们必须阻止燃烧军团继续利用死亡之门，必须要关闭它。不过，首先得毁掉他们的两道迁跃门才行！\n\n但问题是，我们没有任何摧毁大型设施所需要的工具，所以你必须利用他们自己的武器去对付他们。\n\n那边的死亡之力、死亡注视者、死亡熔炉锻造师，还有死亡熔炉技师的身上都携带有邪能火炮的炮弹。\n\n虽然一般来说没有东西可以摧毁那几道门，但如果你能将这些炮弹带回来给我，我就能在其中灌注入自然的愤怒能量！",dEN="We must shut down the Burning Legion's access to Death's Door, but first you're going to destroy their two warp-gates!\n\nThe problem is, we can't even scratch one of those things, so you're going to need to use their own weapons against them.\n\nThe death's might, death's watch, deathforge over-smiths and deathforge technicians carry the ammunition for the fel cannons.\n\nNormally it wouldn't affect any of them, but if you bring the cannonballs to me, I will imbue them with Nature's unbridled wrath!",o="常青林德鲁伊要你收集5枚邪能炮弹。任务完成后，使用德鲁伊信号弹通知刀锋山死亡之门的常青林德鲁伊。",oEN="Collect 5 Fel Cannonballs.",p="你弄到炮弹了吗？",pEN="Do you have the cannonballs yet?",c="那些东西比我想象得还要臭！\n\n快一点，把它们交给我，我会让它们充满自然的力量，这样它们就会对它们的恶魔主人和邪恶的创造物造成致命的影响。",cEN="Those things stink more than I thought they would!\n\nQuickly, hand them over to me and I will imbue them with Nature's force such that they will prove extremely deadly to their fel masters and their unnatural creations."}
Q[10905]={d="我对炼金术可说是无所不知，但你知道，泛则不精。想要学有专攻，就得向那些在炼金术的分支领域独有建树的人讨教。\n\n如果你对制作药水感兴趣，我建议你去找塞纳里奥远征队的劳兰娜·萨维尔。\n\n她可以传授你关于草药的知识，教你制作稀有药材。去赞加沼泽找她吧，告诉她是我叫你去的。",dEN="My knowledge of alchemy is vast. It is, however, general in nature. If you wish to specialize, you will have to find others who have narrower fields of study.\n\nIf you wish to specialize in potion creation, I would recommend that you seek the help of Lauranna Thar'well of the Cenarion Expedition.\n\nHer knowledge of plants will allow you to make the most of your raw materials. Look for her in Zangarmarsh and tell her I sent you to her.",o="转至赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所，与劳兰娜·萨维尔谈一谈。\n\n*注意！*你只能选择一种炼金术分支。",oEN="Speak to Lauranna Thar'well at Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",c="你想让我帮你研究药剂？很好，。看看我们能做些什么。 <name>",cEN="You want me to help you with your study of potions? Very well, <name>. Let's see what we can do."}
Q[10906]={d="我对炼金术可说是无所不知，但你知道，泛则不精。想要学有专攻，就得向那些在炼金术的分支领域独有建树的人讨教。\n\n如果你对制作药剂感兴趣，我建议你去找一位名叫罗罗基姆的鸦人。\n\n他在药剂制作方面的造诣堪称登峰造极，这家伙把所有时间都浪费在研制长生不老药剂上了，可惜至今未果。去拜他为师吧。",dEN="My knowledge of alchemy is vast. It is, however, general in nature. If you wish to specialize, you will have to find others who have narrower fields of study.\n\nIf you wish to specialize in elixir creation, I would recommend that you seek the help of the arakkoa known as Lorokeem.\n\nHis knowledge of elixirs is unmatched, yet he squanders his skill pursuing an elixir of eternal life. Find him and see what he can teach you.",o="转至沙塔斯城的贫民窟，与罗罗基姆谈一谈。\n\n*注意！*你只能选择一种炼金术分支。",oEN="Speak to Lorokeem in Shattrath's Lower City.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",c="你想跟我学习吗？嗯，好吧。也许你是合适的学生。",cEN="You want to learn from me? Hmmm, yes. Perhaps you'll be a suitable student."}
Q[10907]={d="我对炼金术可说是无所不知，但你知道，泛则不精。想要学有专攻，就得向那些在炼金术的分支领域独有建树的人讨教。\n\n如果你对转化感兴趣，我建议你去找一位名叫萨雷维的虚灵。他居住在虚空风暴的风暴尖塔。\n\n他对转化的精通……嗯，无以伦比！看看你能从他那儿学到些什么，但是要小心——虚灵们最擅长讨价还价。",dEN="My knowledge of alchemy is vast. It is, however, general in nature. If you wish to specialize, you will have to find others who have narrower fields of study.\n\nIf you wish to specialize in transmutation, I would recommend that you seek the help of the ethereal known as Zarevhi. He resides in the Stormspire in Netherstorm.\n\nHis mastery of transmutation is... well, outlandish! See what you can learn from him, but beware - ethereals drive a hard bargain.",o="转至虚空风暴的风暴尖塔，与萨雷维谈一谈。\n\n*注意！*你只能选择一种炼金术分支。",oEN="Speak to Zarevhi at the Stormspire in Netherstorm.\n\n*WARNING!* You can only select one alchemy specialization.",c="你想让我帮你研究转化？很好，。看看我们能做些什么。 <name>",cEN="You want me to help you with your study of transmutations? Very well, <name>. Let's see what we can do."}
Q[10908]={d="和一个鸦人说话，你看起来很$g惊讶:惊讶;。我不怪你。我的族人，鸦人，理应让人畏惧。\n\n如果你想了解更多，就去沙塔斯城找救赎者瑞拉克。他可以在贫民窟北部和其他斯克提斯流放者在一起找到。\n\n而且，$n，我们还会再谈的。",dEN="You look surprised to be talking to me. I do not blame you. My people, the arakkoa, deserve to be feared.\n\nSpeak with Rilak the Redeemed in Shattrath City if you wish to know more. He can be found in the northern part of the Lower City, with the other outcasts of Skettis.\n\nAnd, <name>, we will speak again.",o="觉醒者基尔利克要你去跟沙塔斯城贫民窟的救赎者瑞拉克谈一谈。",oEN="Kirrik the Awakened wants you to speak with Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",c="我们终于见面了，。请原谅我省去了客套，因为时间紧迫。 <name>",cEN="So we meet, <name>. You must forgive the lack of formalities for time is of the essence."}
Q[10909]={d="尤勒斯上校是上次在碎手邪兽人的据点高加兹前哨附近作战时候被诅咒的。我的导师巴拉达正竭尽全力以拯救这位可怜的军官，可他需要帮助。尤勒斯那饱受折磨的灵魂需要平和下来，而让他平和下来的途径……我想，只有复仇这一种了。\n\n将学者的圣物带往高加兹前哨，放置在地上，并将附近的碎手兽人杀死。这样一来，邪兽人体内的邪恶精魂就会被直接释放出来。之后，你必须消灭这些邪恶精魂，这样尤勒斯的灵魂才能复原。",dEN="Colonel Jules was cursed in a battle near the Gor'gaz Outpost, a haunt for Shattered Hand fel orcs. My master, Barada, works feverishly to cure the poor human, but he needs help. The Colonel's tormented spirit seeks peace, and his path to peace is, I fear, a path of vengeance.\n\nTake this anchorite relic to Gor'gaz Outpost. Place it upon the ground near Shattered Hand orcs and defeat them. This will release their fel spirits -- you must slay those fel spirits for Jules' own spirit's recovery.",o="荣耀堡的克拉图要你在荣耀堡西南方的高加兹前哨使用学者的圣物，杀死圣物附近的碎手狂战士，然后消灭10个被释放的邪灵，为尤勒斯上校复仇。",oEN="Klatu in Honor Hold wants you to use the Anchorite Relic at Gor'gaz Outpost southwest of Honor Hold, slay Shattered Hand Berserkers near the relic, and then slay 10 released Fel Spirits to avenge Colonel Jules.",p="碎手兽人的邪能灵魂是可怜的朱尔斯灵魂上的毒疮。告诉我，……他得到安抚了吗？ <name>",pEN="The fel spirits of the Shattered Hand orcs are a blight to poor Jules' soul. Tell me, <name>... has he been appeased?",c="碎手兽人是邪恶和绝望的，但拯救尤勒斯上校的道路如此血腥让我的心十分悲伤。",cEN="The Shattered Hand orcs are foul and beyond hope, but my heart is saddened that the road to salvation for Colonel Jules holds such bloodshed."}
Q[10910]={d="现在我们面临着来自燃烧军团的进一步威胁。南边有一座被称作死亡之门的传送门，它直接通向军团繁殖那些邪恶爪牙的可怕世界。\n\n你现在立即出发，沿着斜坡往东走，离开常青林，再沿着道路一直向南前进，经过刀刃峡谷、拉扎安码头、剃刀山和鳞翼岩床之后，再沿着斜坡向下进入维克哈营地并穿过隧道，就可以到达莫克纳萨村南边的死亡之门了。\n\n到达那里之后，使用这枚德鲁伊信号弹。",dEN="Now there is an even greater threat from the Burning Legion. To the south is a portal known as Death's Door, which opens upon the horrific world where the Legion breeds its deadly hounds.\n\nTo get there, exit Evergrove by heading east up the ramp. Follow the path south, through the Bladed Gulch, Razaan's Landing, Razor Ridge and the Scalewing Shelf. Then, take the ramp down into the Vekhaar Stand and enter Death's Door through the tunnel, south of Mok'Nathal.\n\nOnce there, use this druid signal.",o="荒野之王安塔里恩希望你转至死亡之门。到达那里后，利用德鲁伊信号弹召唤出一名常青林德鲁伊，然后与他交谈。",oEN="Use the Druid Signal at Death's Door to call down and speak with an Evergrove Druid.",c="野蛮领主安德烈利安派你来找我们，使我们松了一口气。问题已经比我们一开始担心的还要严重多了！",cEN="It is a relief that Wildlord Antelarion has sent you to us. The problem is much worse than first we feared!"}
Q[10911]={d="现在是你利用自然能量炮弹，摧毁燃烧军团基地的时候了。\n\n死亡之门有两座迁跃门，燃烧军团通过迁跃门召唤扭曲虚空的恶魔，以此强化后援兵力。南北两座迁跃门都在邪能火炮的射程之内。\n\n利用自然能量炮弹控制死亡之门邪能火炮，摧毁南部迁跃门和北部迁跃门。\n\n在火炮的压制下攻击迁跃门，并阻止燃烧军团的防御者破坏邪能火炮。",dEN="Now that the ammunition can affect the Burning Legion, it's time for you to use it.\n\nThere are two warp-gates, which are used for teleportation and enhancement of the void terrors. One is in the south and the other in the north, and each is within range of a fel cannon.\n\nUse the naturalized ammunition to take control of each fel cannon and destroy the warp-gates.\n\nAttack the gate with artillery to begin, and be prepared to kill its defenders to keep the cannon alive if necessary.",o="利用自然能量炮弹控制死亡之门邪能火炮，摧毁南部迁跃门和北部迁跃门。然后使用德鲁伊信号弹召唤一名常青林德鲁伊，告诉他你已完成任务。",oEN="Use the Naturalized Ammunition to take control of the Death's Door Fel Cannons. Use the cannons to destroy both the South Warp-Gate and the North Warp-Gate.",p="你已经摧毁那两座位面传送门了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed both of the warp-gates yet?",c="你的英勇行径真是太了不起了！\n\n很好，摧毁那两座位面传送门之后，只剩下一件事可以做。",cEN="Your prowess is staggering!\n\nVery well, with the warp-gates out of the picture, there's only one thing left to do."}
Q[10912]={d="犬王拜尔蒙必须死！他负责主持着令传送门生效的仪式。\n\n死亡之门就在峡谷的最北端，你看到它的时候，也就意味着你找到了拜尔蒙。\n\n带上这根魔杖，它会对你有帮助的。当你与犬王拜尔蒙战斗时，立刻使用它，我的两个朋友就会出现，助你一臂之力。\n\n击败拜尔蒙之后，立刻回去向荒野之王安塔里恩复命。\n\n还有，$n，谢谢你来这里为我们贡献自己的力量。",dEN="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning.\n\nThe Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon. When you find it, you will find Baelmon.\n\nYou're going to need help on this one, so take this wand. When you battle the Hound-Master, use it and a couple of my friends will come to your aid.\n\nAfter you have defeated Baelmon, return to Wildlord Antelarion.\n\nAnd, <name>, thank you for all that you've gone through for us here.",o="杀死犬王拜尔蒙。",oEN="Slay Baelmon the Hound-Master.",p="事情已经解决了吗？死亡之门的危机已经解除了吗？",pEN="It is over then? Has the danger at Death's Door been averted?",c="你真是个了不起的<race>！如果说之前我认为我们欠你的，那么现在，我们简直无从报答你。\n\n但我们会尽力一试。谢谢你，常青林的<hero/heroine>！",cEN="You are truly an amazing <race>! If I thought that we were indebted to you before, then now there is simply no way in which we could ever repay you.\n\nBut we'll give it a try. Thank you, <hero/heroine> of Evergrove!"}
Q[10913]={d="难道没有办法阻止堕落继续发生吗？我的士兵们与奥金尼的士兵交战多日了，到现在还不知道什么时候战争才能结束。可是，每一名死者——不管是奥金尼的士兵还是沙塔尔的士兵——他们的灵魂都被带到了未知的领域。\n\n我绝对不允许这样的事情发生！虽然不能好好地安葬他们，但也绝对不能让那些魔鬼夺走他们的灵魂！带上这个火把到正东边的战场去。烧掉你看到的每一具遗体！我们不能让他们利用这些遗体来进行任何邪恶的祭祀。",dEN="Is there nothing that can be done to stem the tide of corruption? My soldiers have been battling the Auchenai for days now with no end in sight. Each casualty, whether Auchenai or Sha'tar, is snatched from the battlefield - their souls lifted and taken to parts unknown.\n\nI will not have it! A proper burial is out of the question but those fiends will not have their souls! Take this torch and travel to the field of battle, directly east of here. Burn every corpse you see! We will not fuel their rituals.",o="泰罗卡森林白骨荒野沙塔尔前哨站的指挥官拉瓦伊要你焚烧8名被杀死的奥金尼战士和8名被杀死的沙塔尔守备官的遗体。",oEN="Commander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to burn 8 Slain Auchenai Warriors and 8 Slain Sha'tar Vindicators.",p="这个问题很难启齿，我知道……",pEN="It's a terrible thing to ask, I know...",c="<指挥官拉瓦伊双手托住了他的头。>\n\n这样不够……这样是不够的。",cEN="<Commander Ra'vaj holds his head in his hands.>\n\nIt's not enough... It's just not enough."}
Q[10914]={d="这样还不够，我们需要一位真正的英雄。奥金尼的士兵数量还在源源不断地增加，我们的军队很快就会被彻底被击败。\n\n<指挥官拉瓦伊看着你。>\n\n你是我们所期待的英雄吗？回到战场上去吧，与他们的士兵战斗，让他们的注意力集中到与你的战斗上，这样我的斥候们才能深入敌后去探察他们到底在干些什么。",dEN="It is not enough. A hero is needed. Our forces are overwhelmed as the Auchenai continue to grow in number.\n\n<Commander Ra'vaj looks at you.>\n\nWill you be the hero? Return to the field of battle and strike at their soldiers. Keep them occupied so that my scouts can get behind their lines and see what they are creating.",o="泰罗卡森林中白骨荒野沙塔尔前哨站的指挥官拉瓦伊要你消灭12名奥金尼学徒和5名奥金尼厄运预言者。",oEN="Commander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to slay 12 Auchenai Initiates and 5 Auchenai Doomsayers.",p="不要留活口！",pEN="Take no prisoners!",c="你做到了，！因为你，我们有了一个新发现…… <name>",cEN="You've done it, <name>! Because of you, we have made a new discovery..."}
Q[10915]={d="他们偷取这些灵魂是为了把它们填入某个从奥金尼地穴挖出的灵柩中。我的斥候们认为那具灵柩中所容的正是奥金尼地穴第一任大主教的遗体。他们想复活这个古老的家伙！\n\n你必须奋力闯进奥金顿西边，在他们将他复活之前消灭掉一切。跟着那些正向那边走过去的灵魂，你就不会迷路。\n\n听着，无论你在灵柩中看到了什么，都必须毁灭他！",dEN="They are feeding the souls they steal to a coffin that they have dragged out from the Auchenai Crypts. My scouts believe the contents of the coffin to contain the first exarch of the crypts. They seek to resurrect the ancient one!\n\nYou must battle your way to the western side of Auchindoun and disturb the contents of that coffin before they feed it enough souls. Should you lose your way, follow the walking souls.\n\nDestroy whatever is inside that coffin!",o="泰罗卡森林中白骨荒野沙塔尔前哨站的指挥官拉瓦伊要你消灭掉奥金尼棺材里装着的生物。",oEN="Commander Ra'vaj at the Sha'tari Outpost in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest wants you to destroy the contents of the Auchenai Coffin.",p="你必须在那个古老的祸害恢复它的力量之前摧毁它。",pEN="You must destroy the ancient evil before it has regained its powers.",c="胜利是属于我们的！这场战败会让奥金尼受挫好几个礼拜。",cEN="Victory is ours! This defeat will set the Auchenai back several weeks."}
Q[10916]={d="学者巴拉达计划利用驱魔仪式来破除尤勒斯上校身上的腐蚀，他需要一个助手，一个准备完全的助手……\n\n我不得不尴尬地承认，我把我的念珠在荣耀堡的庭院里搞丢了。我猜应该是那只叫菲菲的小狗把它偷走藏起来了，但我找不到在哪儿。你能与他的主人委任官翠希·普罗维尔谈谈，她应该知道菲菲把它的宝贝都藏在哪里了。",dEN="Anchorite Barada plans to exorcise the corruption from Colonel Jules, and will require an assistant for the task. Such an assistant must be prepared...\n\nI am ashamed to admit that my prayer beads were lost in Honor Hold's courtyard. I believe the dog Fei Fei stole them and buried them, but I do not know where. If you speak with his master, Warrant Officer Tracy Proudwell, perhaps she will know where Fei Fei hides his stolen treasures.",o="将德莱尼祈祷念珠交给荣耀堡的助手克拉图。",oEN="Recover the Draenei Prayer Beads and bring them to Assistant Klatu in Honor Hold.",p="你找到祈祷念珠了吗，？它们的力量对许多神圣仪式都至关重要……包括驱邪仪式。 <name>",pEN="Have you found the prayer beads, <name>? Their powers are crucial to many holy rites... including the rite of exorcism.",c="你找到祈祷念珠了！干得好，。你真是个奇迹——前一刻还在斩杀地狱火半岛的恐怖之物，下一刻就找回了失落的宝物。你的族人真令人振奋！\n\n你能找回这些念珠真是太好了……因为在即将到来的驱邪仪式中，它们将是无价之宝。 <name>",cEN="You found the prayer beads! Well done, <name>. You are a wonder, indeed -- you slay the horrors of Hellfire Peninsula one moment and find lost treasures the next. Your people truly inspire!\n\nIt is good that you recovered these beads... for they will be invaluable in the exorcism ritual to come."}
Q[10917]={d="作为一个从故乡被放逐出来的鸦人，我永远也不会忘记斯克提斯的同胞们对我们进行的屠杀。我这一生都无法消除这种恐惧，不过，这并不意味着我不想报复。\n\n我还藏有一些财产，如果你愿意帮我消灭掉那些随时都会来暗杀我的鸦人，我非常乐意将财产分一部分给你。这样吧，你就将居住在泰罗卡森林内的各个鸦巢中的鸦人羽毛给我带回来，以此证明他们的死亡。",dEN="As an outcast, I am marked by death by arakkoa loyal to the city of Skettis. I cannot leave these walls for fear of my life, but that doesn't mean I cannot strike at them in retaliation.\n\nI have a small cache of treasure that I'm willing to part with, should you help me strike back at my would-be assassins. Bring me feathers from the denizens of the various Veils of Terokkar as proof of their demise.",o="将30片鸦人的羽毛交给沙塔斯城贫民窟的维卡克斯。",oEN="Bring 30 Arakkoa Feathers to Vekax in Shattrath's Lower City.",p="你带来我要的羽毛了吗，？ <name>",pEN="Do you bring the feathers I asked for, <name>?",c="<当你出示他敌人已死的证据时，维卡克斯高兴地尖叫起来。>\n\n对，这会让斯克提斯知道，我们这些流放者不会坐以待毙地接受惩罚。这是答应你的报酬。如果你再给我提供羽毛，我还能安排更多。",cEN="<Vekax squawks in glee as you present him with proof of his enemies' demise.>\n\nYes, that will show Skettis that we Outcasts will not take their punishment lying down. Here is the reward I promised you. I can arrange for more, should you provide me with additional feathers."}
Q[10918]={p="斯克提斯的手下仍然在不远的距离监视着我们这些流亡者。现在所有我们在沙塔斯城外的人都离死不远。\n\n帮我带回来更多的羽毛当作你战胜他们的证明。",pEN="Skettis's lapdogs still keeps a close watch over us, outcasts. The moment any of us sets foot outside Shattrath we'll be as good as dead.\n\nBring me more feathers as proof of your victory over them.",c="<当你出示他敌人已死的证据时，维卡克斯高兴地尖叫起来。>\n\n对，这会让斯克提斯知道，我们这些流放者不会坐以待毙地接受惩罚。这是答应你的报酬。如果你再给我提供羽毛，我还能安排更多。\n\n<此任务可重复完成，直至达到尊敬声望。>",cEN="<Vekax squawks in glee as you present him with proof of his enemies' demise.>\n\nYes, that will show Skettis that we Outcasts will not take their punishment lying down. Here is the reward I promised you. I can arrange for more, should you provide me with additional feathers.\n\n<This quest can be repeated up to Honored reputation.>"}
Q[10919]={p="菲菲以期待的眼神看着你……",pEN="Fei Fei looks at you expectantly...",c="<飞飞欢快地叫着，叼起狗零食。它左看右看……琢磨着该把这个新宝贝藏在哪儿……>\n相关",cEN="<Fei Fei barks happily and grabs the doggy treat. He looks left and right... deciding where he should hide this new treasure...>\nRelated"}
Q[10920]={d="当那些巨牙寡妇蛛攻击前哨站时，我们仿佛听到纳鲁的声音在召唤我们奋起反抗。蜘蛛在夜幕的掩护下逃走时，我们毅然选择追击这些怪物。在黑暗之中，我们发现一部分被捉走的同胞已经被杀死，而且听到了另一部分幸存的人与那些蜘蛛殊死搏斗的声音。\n\n临近天亮时，我们追赶到了这里，与巨牙寡妇蛛群展开了一场激烈的战斗。但是，我们被击败了。我想，不久之后，毒液就会发作，我和同伴们将就此倒在这里。但是，在我永远闭上双眼之前，我必须看到所有的巨牙寡妇蛛都被尽数消灭。",dEN="When the dreadfang widows attacked our outpost we heard the voice of the naaru calling us to battle. We pursued the creatures into the night. Some of our people we found dead in the dark, others we could hear struggling against their captors.\n\nBy morning we had come to this place and we fought a fierce battle but we were beaten. Dreadfang poison will soon take my companions and I cannot last long. Before I die I must know that the dreadfang widows were beaten.",o="守备官海雷恩要你杀掉20只巨牙寡妇蛛，然后返回灵网山脊西边向他复命。",oEN="Vindicator Haylen wants you to slay 20 Dreadfang Widows and then return to him just west of Netherweb Ridge.",p="我可以感觉到毒液在我的血液中流窜。纳鲁在呼唤我，我可以看见引领我的光了。你已经战胜那些巨牙寡妇蛛了吗？",pEN="I can feel the poison flowing through my veins. The naaru call to me, I can see the light. Are the dreadfang widows defeated?",c="我在这里就听到了你战斗的声音，<class>。你胜利的声音让我的心充满了希望。如果你能战胜如此可怕的逆境，也许我也能找到力量，把我的同伴从这个可怕的地方带出去。",cEN="I heard the sounds of your battle from here, <class>. The sounds of your victory filled my heart with hope. If you can win against such terrible odds, perhaps I can find the strength to drag my companions from this terrible place."}
Q[10921]={d="虽然你已经杀掉了许多的巨牙寡妇蛛，但它们的数量仍在不断增长，很快，它们就能再次形成可以攻击我们的规模。它们的蛛后泰罗卡狼蛛隐藏在灵网山脊深处，就是它繁殖出了这些可恶的怪物。为了我们的安全，必须斩草除根，去把它干掉。",dEN="You have slain many of the dreadfang widows but they will continue to spawn and soon they will strike at us again. Deep within Netherweb Ridge is the lair of the Terokkarantula, the brood-mother of these gruesome creatures. If we are to be safe, she must die.",o="守备官海雷恩要你杀掉泰罗卡狼蛛，然后返回灵网山脊西边向他复命。",oEN="Vindicator Haylen wants you to kill the Terokkarantula and then return to him west of Netherweb Ridge.",p="你已经杀死泰罗卡狼蛛了吗？",pEN="Has Terokkarantula been slain?",c="这些蜘蛛已经被打败了。你已经杀了许多，而且连他们的蛛后都在你面前倒下了。我已经中毒太深所以无法以战斗的方式获得自由。\n\n请从我的装备中挑几样带走吧。这样可以减轻我的负担而且提供你转至沙塔尔前哨的回程所需的工具。",cEN="The dreadfangs are beaten. You have killed many and even their foul mother has fallen before you. I am too poisoned to fight my way to freedom.\n\nPlease, take some of my equipment. It will lighten my load and give you the tools you need to make the journey back to Sha'tar Outpost."}
Q[10922]={d="啊！你看上去是个有点能力的家伙，$r。嘿，你知道么！我和我的队员希望能找到一个护卫，在我们挖掘通向北边的隧道时能保护我们的安全。要知道，报酬相当丰厚哦！而且你要做的，仅仅是确保我和我的同伴们不会被那些可恶的怪物们杀掉，不要你去挖土的！\n\n如果你能顺利地完成任务，保证我们不出任何意外的话，杜瓦弗维兹会给你一大笔钱的！",dEN="Oy! You look like you can take care of yerself, <race>. Me and the crew here are looking for a bodyguard to watch over us while we hit a dig site to the north. The pay is pretty good and all you gotta do is make sure no nasty creatures kill me or any of my employees.\n\nIf you successfully make it back without any casualties, Dwarfowitz over there will pay ya.",o="护送勒托尔和他的船员，在他们挖掘时保护他们。如果你成功，就回到沙塔尔前哨站向杜瓦托维茨复命。|n",oEN="Escort Letoll and his crew and protect them while they make their dig. Return to Dwarfowitz at the Sha'tari Outpost if you succeed.",p="活干完了才付钱，。",pEN="You get paid when the job is done, <sonny/missy>.",c="一只筛骨虫！太棒了！这可是历史上主考古学家雷托尔头一次有了新发现。",cEN="A bone wurm! Fantastic! This may actually be the first time in recorded history that Letoll has actually made a discovery."}
Q[10923]={d="如果想要挑战受诅者泰里布斯，你就必须利用恐怖圣物进行一场邪恶的巫术仪式。在东北方奥金顿的另一侧，有一处聚集有许多通灵师的痛苦之丘。\n\n那里的奥金尼亡语者和奥金尼厄运预言者带有许多毁灭徽记。这种毁灭徽记上附着着力量强大的通灵附魔。如果有足够多的徽记，你就能将它们的力量和恐怖圣物的力量相结合，命令泰里布斯来面对你了。",dEN="Now you must use the Dread Relic in a foul necromantic ritual if you wish to challenge Teribus the Cursed. To the northeast, beyond Auchindoun, is the Writhing Mound, a place where necromancers gather.\n\nThe auchenai death-speakers and doomsayers carry doom skulls that are laced with powerful necro-enchantments. If you collect enough skulls you can use their power along with the power of the Dread Relic to command Teribus to face you.",o="沃尔昆要你将恐怖圣物带到痛苦之丘，在那里杀死一些奥金尼亡语者和奥金尼厄运预言者，并收集20个毁灭徽记。然后找到痛苦之丘召唤法阵，利用恐怖圣物召唤出受诅者泰里布斯并杀死它。任务完成后向沃尔昆复命。",oEN="Oakun wants you to take the Dread Relic to the Writhing Mound. Once there, kill Auchenai Death-Speakers and Auchenai Doomsayers to collect 20 Doom Skulls. Then find the Writhing Mound Summoning Circle and use the Dread Relic to summon and destroy Teribus the Cursed. Return to Oakun when the deed is done.",p="泰罗卡的受诅者泰利布斯已经被净化了吗？",pEN="Has Teribus the Cursed been purged from the skies of Terokkar?",c="已经从泰罗卡净化了一个巨大的邪恶宿主。沙塔尔欠你一份人情。",cEN="A great evil has been cleansed from Terokkar. The Sha'tar are in your debt."}
Q[10924]={d="这片区域中分布着许多迁跃追迹者，它们的血液可用作强效的材料。这种稀有的原料是我这里最畅销的货物之一。\n\n通常我都带上小鬼塞比特外出采集血液。迁跃追迹者的血液具有高度的腐蚀性，对我们来说过于危险，但塞比特就完全没问题。\n\n我要忙着打点店里的生意，根本抽不出时间。你能帮我收集血液吗？塞比特这家伙特别容易走神，杀死追迹者后你要停在尸体旁，让塞比特去干它的活。",dEN="The blood of the warp chasers in this area is a powerful and rare reagent. It's one of my biggest sellers.\n\nNormally, I take my imp, Zeppit, out to help me gather it. Warp chaser blood is simply too caustic to be handled safely by you or I, but it doesn't bother Zeppit.\n\nThings are getting busier here at the shop, so if I send Zeppit with you, will you help gather the blood? Zeppit's attention tends to wander, so you'll need to be close to the chaser when it dies for Zeppit to do his work.",o="为扳钳镇的萨布奥斯带回8瓶迁跃追迹者之血。",oEN="Bring 8 vials of Warp Chaser Blood to Sab'aoth at Cosmowrench.",p="塞皮有乖乖合作和你一同取得我要的血吗？",pEN="Did Zeppit cooperate enough for you to get all the blood I'll need?",c="这些足以提供我大量的需求了。\n\n我希望我的小鬼没有给你太多麻烦。他有张令人讨厌的嘴。",cEN="This should prove a large enough supply for my needs.\n\nI hope the imp didn't give you too much trouble. He has a bit of a nasty mouth on him."}
Q[10926]={d="我们现在已经无法靠自己的力量回去了。巨牙蜘蛛毒液的毒性太强了，你必须帮帮我们！返回沙塔尔营地报信，斥候纳弗林会派救援队来找我们的。",dEN="We will not make it back on our own. The dreadfang poison is too strong. You must return to Sha'tari Base Camp for us. Scout Navrin will send a rescue party out to find us.",o="守备官海雷恩要你返回白骨荒野的沙塔尔营地，与斥候纳弗林谈一谈。",oEN="Vindicator Haylen wants you to return to the Sha'tari Base Camp in the Bone Wastes and speak with Scout Navrin.",c="知道我们的勇士们跟巨牙寡妇蛛的突出表现，我很欣慰。我们马上会派出救援队。",cEN="It is good to know that some of our warriors fought well against the dreadfang widows. We will send a rescue party immediately."}
Q[10927]={d="天影指挥官希望这条隧道被清理干净，好让我们加快与避风港的贸易。我不能离开我的岗位，所以这项任务就交给你了。清理隧道，立刻向天影指挥官报到！|n",dEN="Commander Skyshadow wants this tunnel cleared out so we can expedite trade with the Harborage. I must not leave my post here so I am leaving the task in your hands. Clear the tunnel and report to Commander Skyshadow at once!",o="杀死6只洞穴蛛。",oEN="Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers.",p="我发誓我告诉过哨兵月语者下达直接命令。你难道没有服从吗？",pEN="I swore I told Sentinel Moonwhisper to give direct orders. Are you not obeying them?",c="干得好，<class>。那条隧道是我们通往沼泽的生命线。",cEN="Good work, <class>. That tunnel is our lifeline to the swamp."}
Q[10928]={d="托尔查克·双爪希望这条隧道被清理干净，好让我们加快与沼泽鼠岗哨的贸易。我不能离开我的岗位，所以这项任务就交给你了。清理隧道，立刻向托尔查克·双爪报到！|n",dEN="Tor'chunk Twoclaws wants this tunnel cleared out so we can expedite trade with Swamp Rat. I must not leave my post here so I am leaving the task in your hands. Clear the tunnel and report to Tor'chunk Twoclaws at once!",o="杀死6只洞穴蛛。",oEN="Slay 6 Cavern Crawlers.",p="我发誓我告诉过步兵格拉赫下达直接命令。你难道没有服从吗？",pEN="I swore I told Grunt Grahk to give direct orders. Are you not obeying them?",c="干得好，<class>。那条隧道是我们通往沼泽的生命线。",cEN="Good work, <class>. That tunnel is our lifeline to the swamp."}
Q[10929]={d="你愿意再帮我们探险者协会一个忙吗？我们对这些骨虫非常好奇，想要研究研究。\n\n你看，这里有一只鼓，到时候你把它带到白骨荒野去使劲敲，看看会发生什么事情。如果骨虫出现的话，就杀掉它，并且把尸体带回来给我们研究。我们需要很多虫尸的样本，才能更有效地进行试验。",dEN="How would you like to do a little more work for the Explorers' League? These bone worms have us all quite intrigued.\n\nI've got a drum right here that you can use out in the Bone Wastes. Just bang on the damned thing and see what you get. If it's a worm, kill it and bring back the carcass for us to study. We'll need a good lot of carcasses to get a valid testing sample.",o="白骨荒野沙塔尔前哨站的杜瓦弗维兹要你带回8具成年筛骨虫的尸体。",oEN="Dwarfowitz at the Sha'tari Base Camp in the Bone Wastes wants you to bring him 8 Mature Bone Sifter Carcasses.",p="我们认为那只从洞口跳出来的实际上是一只幼虫！",pEN="We think the one that popped up at the dig was actually a baby worm!",c="沙漠侏儒？对啊，没错……沙漠会对一个人产生奇怪的影响。\n\n我想有了这些虫子的尸体，我们可以有突破性的进展！",cEN="Sand gnomes? Yea, sure... The desert can do strange things to a person.\n\nI think we're about to make a breakthrough here with these worms!"}
Q[10930]={d="我猜得果然没错！你带回来的这些尸体都其实都是幼年的骨虫。你知道这意味着什么吗，这附近肯定有一只成年的骨虫！如果有一些它所喜爱的食物，我们就可以把它引诱出来。让我想想……成年的骨虫！啊！\n\n我想起来了，我过去在东边白骨荒野的另一侧见过一些裂蹄牛。你到那里去杀死一只裂蹄牛。然后，你在一旁敲打这只鼓。希望到时候那只成年的骨虫会出来寻找食物。如果你将它杀掉，记得把它的内脏带回来给我！",dEN="I was right! These carcasses you brought me belong to the baby bone worms. Do you know what that means? It means that somewhere out there is a big one! I think we can get it to come out if we can provide the right kind of food. Let's see... something big! Yes!\n\nI remember seeing clefthooves east of here on the other side of the Bone Wastes. Get out there and kill a clefthoof. Once it's dead, use the drums. Hopefully the big one will come up to feed. If you manage to kill it, bring me its organs!",o="骨荒原沙塔尔基地营的杜瓦托维茨要你取回巨型骨虫的器官。\n\n他也想要回他的鼓槌。|n",oEN="Dwarfowitz at the Sha'tari Base Camp in the Bone Wastes wants you to recover Enormous Bone Worm Organs.\n\nHe wants his Fumper back too.",p="带个队友一同前去吧！",pEN="Take a friend with you!",c="太神奇了！看看这个器官！这叫阿猫阿狗的东西竟然有某种粉尘在它阿猫阿狗的器官里面。噢！我还是不要用那些科学术语令你厌烦。我倒是从幼虫身上拔出一些牙齿制作这些异常锋利的刀。想要一把吗？",cEN="Amazing! Look at this stuff! The thing-a-ma-whatever has some sort of dust inside its whatcha-ma-bobber. Bah! I won't bore you with all this scientific jargon. I did manage to pull a few teeth from the little ones to make these incredibly sharp knives. Want one?"}
Q[10935]={d="$n，现在我们必须去拯救尤勒斯上校了。他的状况又有恶化，巴拉达担心如果我们还不能净化他身上的腐蚀，他就要永远离开我们了。\n\n拿着这串念珠去找学者巴拉达，马上开始仪式。不要让任何人打扰到仪式的进行……，如果一切顺利，我想尤勒斯上校还是能拯救回来的。他的情况好转之后，和他谈谈，然后再回来找我。",dEN="<name>, it is time to save Colonel Jules. His condition has worsened and Barada fears that, if we do not cleanse him of his corruption, he will be lost to us.\n\nTake the prayer beads you found and speak with Anchorite Barada to begin the ritual. Let no disruptions stop the ritual... and if all goes well, Colonel Jules will be saved. Speak with Jules when he is saved, then return to me.",o="与学者巴拉达交谈，利用祈祷念珠帮助巴拉达完成仪式。与获救的尤勒斯上校交谈，然后向助手克拉图复命。",oEN="Speak with Anchorite Barada. Use the prayer beads to help with the ritual, and then speak with Colonel Jules when he is saved. Finally, return to Assistant Klatu.",p="去找隐士巴拉达，。要让上校得救，他的仪式必须成功。 <name>",pEN="Go to Anchorite Barada, <name>. He must succeed with his ritual if the colonel is to be saved.",c="你做到了，。你救了朱尔斯上校的灵魂，把他体内的黑暗送回了它来的地方。这是一件伟大而高尚的壮举！英雄的一天！ <name>",cEN="You have done it, <name>. You have saved Colonel Jules' soul and cast the darkness within him back to where it came. A great, noble deed this is! A hero's day!"}
Q[10936]={d="刚才我们正在忙碌的时候，有位信使一直等在大厅里。我想他现在已经累得去休息了，要么就是看到尤勒斯的身体浮起来的时候被吓跑了吧。\n\n不管了，总之他说远征军指挥官达纳斯正在找你。我建议你现在马上就去兵营里请求觐见他。",dEN="While we were busy, a messenger was waiting out in the hall. I suppose he grew tired, or perhaps he simply ran away at the sight of Jules floating around the room.\n\nEither way, Force Commander Danath is looking for you. I suggest that you seek an audience with him inside the barracks as quickly as possible!",o="助手克拉图要你转至地狱火半岛荣耀堡的兵营，与远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩谈一谈。",oEN="Assistant Klatu has informed you that Force Commander Danath Trollbane has been seeking you. Speak to him in the barracks at Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",c="你来得正是时候！我从那个德莱尼牧师那边听说了你最近的消息。你吓坏了我的信差！\n\n既然你已经完成了那些事情，我帮你策划了一个小任务需要你去地狱火堡垒一趟。",cEN="It's about time! I heard all about what you've been up to with that draenei priest. You totally freaked my messenger out!\n\nNow that you're done with that, I have a little mission planned for you to Hellfire Citadel."}
Q[10937]={d="我收到的情报显示，地狱火堡垒内外的所有碎手邪兽人正在严密的组织下准备发动一次全面攻击。毫无疑问，他们对于你前几日针对各邪兽人氏族所取得的成功很恼火，想要展开报复行动。\n\n现在你只要沿着荣耀之路走到头，到达堡垒的下面，你就会发现所有的邪兽人都在忙着进行准备工作，这下你就能攻其不备了。\n\n杀死他们的头目，教官祖罗克！",dEN="I'm receiving reports that the Shattered Hand fel orcs, out in front of Hellfire Citadel, are organizing for what looks like an all-out assault. No doubt, they're not happy about your successes against all of the clans.\n\nGet to the base of the citadel, where the Path of Glory ends. You'll find the fel orcs busy with their preparations, but you're going to catch them with their pants down.\n\nEliminate the one that's in charge of that force. Kill Drillmaster Zurok!",o="远征军指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩命令你尽快杀死教官祖罗克。完成任务后返回地狱火半岛的荣耀堡，向远征军指挥官复命。",oEN="Force Commander Danath Trollbane has ordered you to kill Drillmaster Zurok with all due haste. Return to the force commander at Honor Hold in the Hellfire Peninsula once the drillmaster is dead.",p="训练员死了吗？嗯，或许是我的斥候搞错了？",pEN="Is the drillmaster dead? Hmm, maybe my scouts are wrong?",c="在亲耳听你说之前，我本来不会相信。我们的斥候已经陆续带回消息，说碎手部族没了他们那位宝贵的教官发号施令，已经陷入混乱。\n\n你走了很长的路，。我相信你会收下这套护甲以及我的谢意。骄傲地穿上它吧，这是你应得的！ <name>",cEN="I wasn't going to believe it until I heard it from you, personally. Already our scouts are trickling in with information that the Shattered Hand are in disarray without their precious drillmaster to tell them what to do.\n\nYou've traveled a long road, <name>. I trust that you will accept this armor along with my thanks. Wear it proudly, you've earned it!"}
Q[10938]={d="既然你已经集齐了所有祝福卡组成一副牌，第九张牌神秘地出现了，背面与前八张一模一样。牌上写着：「把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。」你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。\"\"",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Blessings cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把祝福套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Blessings Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的祝福套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Blessings! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套祝福套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Blessings. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[10939]={d="既然你已经集齐了所有风暴卡组成一副牌，第九张牌神秘地出现了，背面与前八张一模一样。牌上写着：「把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。」你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。\"\"",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Storms cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把风暴套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Storms Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的风暴套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Storms! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套风暴套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Storms. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[10940]={d="既然你已经集齐了所有怒火卡组成一副牌，第九张牌神秘地出现了，背面与前八张一模一样。牌上写着：「把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。」你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。\"\"",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Furies cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把报复套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Furies Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的报复套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Furies! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套报复套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Furies. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[10941]={d="既然你已经集齐了所有疯狂卡组成一副牌，第九张牌神秘地出现了，背面与前八张一模一样。牌上写着：「把这些牌带回暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。」你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。\"\"",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Lunacy cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把愚人套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Lunacy Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的愚人套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Lunacy! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套愚人套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Lunacy. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[10942]={d="有个特别的小女孩会非常高兴能有你这个朋友，哪怕只是短短一段时间。\n\n拿着这只哨子。用它，你就能召唤你答应资助的那个孩子。它只能维持有限的时间——事实上，比儿童周本身长不了多久。\n\n，请召唤你的孤儿吧。我知道她会无比兴奋地见到你，并有机会走出城市去闯荡！ $g你:你; $n",dEN="One special little girl is going to be very happy to have you as a friend, even if it is for a short while.\n\nTake this whistle. With it, you will be able to call for the child that you have agreed to sponsor. It will only last for a limited time - not much longer than Children's Week itself, in fact.\n\nPlease, <name>, call upon your orphan. I know that she will be more than excited to meet you and have the opportunity to venture out of the city!",o="使用血精灵孤儿哨召唤出你将在儿童周期间照看的小孩。",oEN="Use the Blood Elf Orphan Whistle to call for the ward that you will be looking after during Children's Week.",c="嗯，你就是我的领养人吗？我是瑟兰德雅！我从婴儿时期就在这里长大。战争夺走了我的父母亲，所以我只好住在孤儿院。\n\n这里的环境还不错，但是我一直想出去走走——我从来没有踏出这个城市过。我已经列出一张名单包含所有我想去的好地方，以及所有我想要做的事情。\n\n等你准备好就带我出发吧！",cEN="Hmph, you're my sponsor? I'm Salandria! I've been here ever since I was a little baby. My parents were taken by the war, so I have to live here at the orphanage.\n\nIt's not that bad, but I always wanted to go places -- I haven't ever stepped foot outside of the city. I've already made a list of all the cool places that I want to go, and the awesome things that I want to do.\n\nI'm ready to go when you are!"}
Q[10943]={d="有个特别的小女孩会非常高兴能有你这个朋友，哪怕只是短短一段时间。\n\n拿着这只哨子。用它，你就能召唤你答应资助的那个孩子。它只能维持有限的时间——事实上，比儿童周本身长不了多久。\n\n，请召唤你的孤儿吧。我知道她会无比兴奋地见到你，并有机会走出城市去闯荡！ $g你:你; $n",dEN="One special little girl is going to be very happy to have you as a friend, even if it is for a short while.\n\nTake this whistle. With it, you will be able to call for the child that you have agreed to sponsor. It will only last for a limited time - not much longer than Children's Week itself, in fact.\n\nPlease, <name>, call upon your orphan. I know that she will be more than excited to meet you and have the opportunity to venture out of the city!",o="使用德莱尼孤儿哨召唤出你将在儿童周期间照看的小孩。",oEN="Use the Draenei Orphan Whistle to call for the ward that you will be looking after during Children's Week.",c="你一定就是儿童周里要当我大哥哥的那个冒险者！我叫多尔娜，很高兴认识你。\n\n<她有一瞬间显得很伤心。>\n\n爸爸妈妈都在战争中死了，我一生都住在孤儿院。其实那里挺好的，但我一直想去别的地方看看。\n\n我已经列好了一份我们可以去的地方的清单，可以吗？我就知道我们在一起一定会玩得很开心！\n\n你准备好了我就出发！",cEN="You must be the adventurer who's going to be my big brother for Children's Week! I'm Dornaa, pleased to meet you.\n\n<She looks sad for a moment.>\n\nMother and father were killed in the war, and I've lived in the orphanage all my life. It's nice, actually, but I've always wanted to go places and see things.\n\nI've already made a list of places we could visit, if that's okay? I just know that we're going to have a great time together!\n\nI'm ready to go when you are!"}
Q[10944]={d="再次感谢你，$n，我知道你的名字。既然阿卡玛相信你，让你加入了他的计划，那么我也将给予你完全的信任。\n\n纳迦已经发现我正在谋求推翻伊利丹的统治，还想用拷打与折磨这些老掉牙的手段让我说出秘密。真可惜，我什么也没有告诉他们，冥想的力量帮我抵抗住了神经中传来的痛苦……而这些，正是阿卡玛教给我的。\n\n后来，伊利丹要求这些纳迦把我带到他那里去。他可以直接看穿我的躯体，进入我的灵魂，窃取其中的秘密。\n\n必须向阿卡玛报告这一切，我们的计划当前已经陷入了极度的危机之中！",dEN="Thanks again, <name>. I recognize your name. Akama has entrusted you with his plans and so I will trust you as well.\n\nThe naga discovered I was working against Illidan and tried to get me to speak by torturing me. I did not tell them a thing - Akama himself taught me to master pain through meditation.\n\nIllidan asked the naga to bring me to him. He would have seen right through my flesh and into my soul's deepest secrets.\n\nAkama must be warned. Our plans are in jeopardy!",o="转至影月谷内的守望者牢笼，与阿卡玛谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to the Warden's Cage in Shadowmoon Valley and speak to Akama.",c="我感谢你，。奥卢姆是我最亲密的朋友和最忠诚的追随者之一。他的贡献对我们的计划至关重要。 <name>",cEN="I thank you, <name>. Olum is one of my dearest friends and most trusted followers. His contributions have been of vital importance to our plans."}
Q[10945]={d="我有个朋友叫哈克乌。她说她曾经被邪恶的真菌巨人追赶，慌乱之中迷了路，所幸被孤儿院收留。\n\n我们在这儿快乐地生活着，直到去年她的家人得知她的下落，接她离开了孤儿院。我记得她住在一个名叫孢子村的地方。\n\n我想去看看她和她生活的蘑菇村庄。孤儿院监护员说孢子村就在孢子湖和沼光湖之间，就在赞加沼泽西部。\n\n带我去好吗？带我去好吗？求你了？！",dEN="I had a friend named Hch'uu. She told me that she ended up in the orphanage because she had to run away from an evil fungal giant and got lost.\n\nWe had great fun until her people came and took her away last year. I think she said she was going to live at a place called Sporeggar.\n\nI'd like to go to see her and have a look at her mushroom village. The orphan matron told me that it is on the west side of Zangarmarsh, between the Sporewind and Marshlight lakes.\n\nCan we go? Can we go? Please?!",o="带上孤儿萨兰蒂亚，转至位于赞加沼泽的孢子村。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。然后，跟哈克乌谈一谈。",oEN="Take your orphan, Salandria, to Sporeggar in Zangarmarsh. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive. Then, speak with Hch'uu.",c="感谢你让我有再一次看到瑟兰德雅的机会。一年以来我一直很想念她，我们的友情依然没变。\n\n我们约定好当我们长大之后要做一位勇敢的冒险家，就像你一样！",cEN="Thank you for this chance to once again see Salandria. I have missed her so much this past year, but we are still good friends.\n\nWe agreed that when we grow up, we're both going to be brave adventurers, just like you!"}
Q[10946]={d="奥鲁姆的牺牲太巨大了。我从未要求他为这份事业贡献出自己的生命，但他却义无反顾地这么做了。\n\n如果我们还想让伊利丹继续认为自己仍处于安全的境地，就必须服从他的命令，至少现在如此。\n\n我当前统率着一支数量庞大的灰舌军团，但除了其中的死誓者以外，军团内没有任何其它人值得信任。\n\n所以，必须要由你去执行伊利丹的命令。带上这件兜帽，它上面附有特殊的魔法。穿上它之后，在你杀死凯尔萨斯的凤凰时，所有人都会以为你是我的手下。",dEN="Olum's sacrifice was tremendous. I would never have asked him to give up his life myself. But it is done.\n\nIf we're to lure Illidan back into a false sense of security, we need to do his bidding - at least for now.\n\nI command a vast army of Ashtongue, but - aside from the Deathsworn - none can be trusted.\n\nYou are to perform the deed that Illidan demands. Take this cowl; it is magical in nature. You will appear to be one of my men to any who see you slaying Kael's phoenix, Al'ar.",o="转至风暴要塞，在穿着灰舌兜帽的情况下杀死奥。完成任务之后回到影月谷，向阿卡玛复命。",oEN="Travel into Tempest Keep and slay Al'ar while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Return to Akama in Shadowmoon Valley once you've completed this task.",p="事情办妥了吗，？伊利丹可不是个有耐心的主人！ <name>",pEN="Is the deed done, <name>? Illidan is not a patient master!",c="你做得很好，。这会让我们更进一步，把伊利丹的注意力从我们身上，以及从……\n\n<阿卡玛朝玛维·影歌的方向看去。>\n\n还有更多工作要做，。 <name><name>",cEN="You've done well, <name>. This will bring us a step closer to shifting Illidan's focus away from us and from...\n\n<Akama looks in Maiev Shadowsong's direction.>\n\nMore work remains to be done, <name>."}
Q[10947]={d="伊利丹的注意力已经转移到了凯尔萨斯身上，这都得感谢你。我们现在有机会继续行动了。\n\n我曾在梦境中见过一件神器——巫妖雷基·冬寒的护符匣，它必定能帮助我们对付背叛者。可惜当雷基在海加尔山战役败北之后，护符匣便丧失了原有的能量。\n\n要取回这件神器也不是没有办法。传说青铜龙军团在艾泽拉斯世界中守护着一处神秘的地方……过去和现在的交汇之地。去吧，那里就是你的目的地。",dEN="Illidan's attention is now on Kael'thas, thanks to you. The time has come to make our move.\n\nI've had a vision of an artifact that will aid us in our final struggle - the phylactery of a lich known as Winterchill. Unfortunately its power was lost forever after his defeat in the Battle of Mount Hyjal.\n\nThere might be a way to retrieve this artifact, however. Legend speaks of a place in Azeroth guarded by bronze dragons... a place where past and present meet. It is there you will find what we seek.",o="转至塔纳利斯的时空之穴，进入海加尔山战役之后击败雷基·冬寒，将他的时光护符匣交给影月谷的阿卡玛。",oEN="Go to the Caverns of Time in Tanaris and gain access to the Battle of Mount Hyjal. Once inside, defeat Rage Winterchill and bring the Time-Phased Phylactery to Akama in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="你取回命匣了吗，？ <name>",pEN="Have you retrieved the phylactery yet, <name>?",c="我的预兆……现在全都变清楚了。这个神器的力量超越了灵魂……控制它……将它吸取到自身……我会利用那些力量来夺回属于我的东西！我们挑战伊利丹的时刻已经来临了！",cEN="My vision... it all becomes clear now. The powers this artifact has over a soul.... to contain it... to siphon it into itself... I will use those powers to reclaim what belongs to me! The time has arrived for us to take the fight to Illidan!"}
Q[10948]={d="你也许会奇怪，我为什么要费这么大周章隐藏我的意图。为什么不公开与纳鲁结盟呢？\n\n我的本质——我的灵魂——被囚禁在黑暗神殿之中。伊利丹随时都能毁掉我……直到现在！这命匣将让我重新掌控自己的灵魂。\n\n时候到了，$n。我会带领玛维和我的死誓者直抵伊利丹的门前。\n\n去和阿达尔谈谈，把我们的计划告诉他。如果我们同时出击，就能突破伊利丹的防御。",dEN="You might wonder why I go to such lengths to hide my intentions. Why not throw my lot in openly with the naaru?\n\nMy very essence - my soul - is held prisoner inside the Black Temple. Illidan could destroy me any moment... until now! This phylactery will allow me to regain control of my soul.\n\nThe time has come, <name>. I'll lead Maiev and my Deathsworn to Illidan's doorstep.\n\nSpeak to A'dal and and tell him of our plan. If we strike together we'll break through Illidan's defenses.",o="转至沙塔斯城，将阿卡玛的请求告诉阿达尔。",oEN="Travel to Shattrath City to tell A'dal about Akama's request.",c="<阿达尔的光源围绕着你表示欢迎。你感觉到他知道你将要提出的问题。>",cEN="<A'dal's light surrounds you as he welcomes you back. You have a feeling he knows what you're about to ask of him.>"}
Q[10949]={d="<阿达尔在你的脑海中展现出了一个纳鲁飘浮在黑暗神殿之外的景象，他的身边站着无数的德莱尼守备官与血精灵魔导师，正在与神殿中不断涌出的强大敌人作战。你立刻理解了阿达尔的意思，这就是阿卡玛所需要的帮助。>",dEN="<A'dal shows you an image of a naaru outside of the Black Temple, fighting alongside draenei vindicators and blood elf magisters. You immediately understand that this is the distraction Akama is waiting for.>",o="转至影月谷的黑暗神殿入口处，与克希利谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to the entrance to the Black Temple in Shadowmoon Valley and speak to Xi'ri.",c="<希瑞对于你的出现表示认同。他似乎专心注意着周遭的战斗。>",cEN="<Xi'ri appears to acknowledge your presence. He seems to be focused on the battle in the surrounding area.>"}
Q[10950]={d="有位路经孤儿院的牧师跟我们讲过奥金顿的故事，据说那地方对德莱尼一族至关重要，就在这附近哦。\n\n他说奥金顿曾经是德莱尼人的埋骨地，但是不久前发生了爆炸事件。\n\n我想去奥金顿的仪式广场看看。孤儿院监护员说那地方就在白骨荒野的中间，泰罗卡森林的南部。\n\n亲爱的$n$g先生:小姐，拜托你，带我去好吗？",dEN="One of the priests that comes to visit told a story about a place nearby. It's called Auchindoun, and it's supposed to be very important to the draenei.\n\nHe said it used to be the place where the bodies of the draenei were taken when they died. But some time ago, something bad blew it up.\n\nI'd like to see its Ring of Observance. The orphan matron told me that it is in the middle of the Bone Wastes, on the south side of the Terokkar Forest.\n\nPlease, <Mr. /Miss> <name>, can we go?",o="带上孤儿多尔南，转至位于奥金顿中心仪式广场的集合石。奥金顿就在泰罗卡森林内的白骨荒野的中心地带。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, to the Meeting Stone at the Ring of Observance in the middle of Auchindoun. Auchindoun, in turn, is in the middle of Terokkar Forest's Bone Wastes. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.",c="喔，真是太棒了！我是说，它看起来相当老旧……·而且没错，的确有人把它炸毁了。但看看它！\n\n喔，你有抬头看看天空吗？\n\n美翻了！",cEN="Oh, it's just wonderful! I mean, it looks pretty old... and yeah, someone sure did blow it up. But just look at it!\n\nOoh, and did you look up at the sky?\n\nNeato!"}
Q[10951]={d="我们游览了这么多有趣的地方，怎么能错过黑暗之门呢？！\n\n大人们总是跟我们讲那些关于黑暗之门的恐怖故事，他们说那儿有很多恶魔和其它诡异生物，总之是个非常危险的地方。\n\n<萨兰蒂亚转动着眼珠。>\n\n但是有你保护我，情况应该不会太糟，是吗？\n\n我想去亲眼看看。黑暗之门应该在地狱火半岛东部边缘吧，你还记得确切的方位吗？",dEN="How can we look at all of these interesting places and not see the Dark Portal?!\n\nThe grown-ups are always trying to tell us scary stories about it and how it's so dangerous, with lots of demons, and stuff.\n\n<Salandria rolls her eyes.>\n\nBut you're here, so it can't be too bad, right?\n\nI want to see for myself. You remember where it is on the east edge of Hellfire Peninsula?",o="带上孤儿萨兰蒂亚，登上命运阶梯，站在地狱火半岛的黑暗之门前。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。",oEN="Take your orphan, Salandria, up the steps of the Stair of Destiny to stand before the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.",c="那些故事根本没说到这里有多酷。真是太棒了！\n\n它真的是由一个叫麦迪文的强大巫师所制造的吗？\n\n不知道它的另一边有什么东西？你去过那里，对吗？嗯，我们一定要到黑暗之门另一边的地方去！",cEN="The stories don't even come close to how cool this place is. It's amazing!\n\nIs it true that a powerful wizard named Medivh created it?\n\nI wonder what's on the other side? You've been there, right? Hmm, we should definitely go someplace on the other side of the Dark Portal!"}
Q[10952]={d="要是我们没别的地方可去，那就去黑暗之门吧！\n\n孤儿监护员们总是说那儿很危险，居住着很多恶魔什么的，还说只有象你这样的英雄才能跨越黑暗之门。\n\n<多尔南转动着眼珠。>\n\n但是有你保护我，情况应该不会太糟，是吗？\n\n我真得很想去亲眼看看。黑暗之门就在地狱火半岛东部边缘吧，你还记得确切的方位吗？",dEN="There's one place that if we don't go anywhere else, we have to go to: the Dark Portal!\n\nThe orphan matrons are always trying to scare us with stories about how dangerous it is, with lots of demons, and people like you coming through it.\n\n<Dornaa rolls her eyes.>\n\nBut you're here, and nice, so it can't be too bad, right?\n\nI want to see it for myself. You remember where it is on the eastern edge of Hellfire Peninsula?",o="带上孤儿多尔南，登上命运阶梯，站在地狱火半岛的黑暗之门前。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, up the steps of the Stair of Destiny to stand before the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.",c="孤儿监护员的故事根本没说到这里有多酷。真是太棒了！她说它是由一个叫麦迪文的强大巫师所制造的。\n\n它的另一边有什么东西？你去过那里，对吗？我们一定要到黑暗之门另一边的地方去看看！",cEN="The orphan matron's stories don't even come close to how cool this place is. It's amazing! She said that it was created by a powerful wizard named Medivh.\n\nWhat's on the other side of it? You've been there, right? We should most definitely go someplace on the other side of the Dark Portal!"}
Q[10953]={d="你知不知道元素王座这个地方？据说啊，它就在纳格兰大草原上，那儿有许多许多强大的元素生物。\n\n很快，我就要变成为一个厉害的法师了，或者术士也行！我得掌握驾驭元素力量的能力。\n\n要不咱俩一起去元素王座？\n\n<萨兰蒂亚狡猾地看着你。>\n\n你肯定会获益良多的！那地方就在加拉达尔北边，天歌湖的对岸。",dEN="Have you heard of the Throne of the Elements? It's supposed to be this place in Nagrand where there are these powerful elementals.\n\nOne day soon, I'm going to be a powerful mage, or maybe a warlock. I'm gonna have to learn about some of the elemental forces!\n\nDo you think maybe that we could go there?\n\n<Salandria looks at you slyly.>\n\nYa know, it would be educational to go there. It's supposedly just north of Garadar, on the other side of Skysong Lake.",o="带上孤儿萨兰蒂亚，转至位于纳格兰的元素王座。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。然后，与元素师沙尔瓦克谈一谈。",oEN="Take your orphan, Salandria, to the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive. Then, speak with Elementalist Sharvak.",c="你把一名小孩带来这里？你真鲁莽，但是我可以确保她的安全，只要她不要太靠近辛纳瑞塔斯。\n\n嗯，可惜她是一名血精灵。如果她与这片大地有很深的缘分的话，我们可以教她一些本领让她协助我们治愈这片大地。但是，也许暴露在这些元素的周遭会开启她对这方面的天赋。\n\n安全的带她离开并且好好的照顾她吧。",cEN="You bring a child here? Foolhardy, but I promise that she will come to no harm, at least as long as she doesn't get too close to Incineratus.\n\nHmm, unfortunate that she's a blood elf. Were she capable of a deep connection to the world, we could teach her some things so that she might aid us to heal its wounds. But, perhaps her exposure to the elements here will give her some insight into their workings.\n\nGo in peace and see to it that you take good care of her."}
Q[10954]={d="我有点想念我的哥哥希尔了。他比我大几岁，所以监护员们让他去纳格兰给虚灵们当学徒了。\n\n要是能去看看他就好了。他一直很喜欢地质学一类的东西，想必他在那儿过得挺开心的。\n\n孤儿监护员跟我说他在纳格兰一处名叫埃瑞斯码头的地方受训。埃瑞斯码头就位于沃舒古山脉的西北方，沿着塔拉西边的道路一直走就能到。",dEN="I miss my brother, Jheel. He's a couple of years older than me, so they let him start an apprenticeship with the ethereal in Nagrand.\n\nIt sure would be nice to go visit him. He loves geology and stuff, so I bet he's having a great time.\n\nThe orphan matron told me that he's training at a place called Aeris Landing in Nagrand. It's supposed to be along the road, far to the west of Telaar, and northwest of the great mountain, Oshu'gun.",o="带上孤儿多尔南，转至位于纳格兰的埃瑞斯码头。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。然后与希尔谈一谈。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, to Aeris Landing in Nagrand. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive. Then, speak with Jheel.",c="喔，我好想朵娜。谢谢你带她来拜访。这里只有虚灵组织让我很孤单。他们对这个沃舒古的事业一直都很严肃。\n\n但等我通过了切割宝石的考验后就能回去拜访孤儿院了。我上个礼拜差一点就及格了，但我相信我明天就会通过考试的！",cEN="Oh, I've missed Dornaa so much. Thank you for bringing her to visit. It gets lonely here with only the ethereal around. And they're so serious all the time with this Oshu'gun business.\n\nBut I get to go back and visit the orphanage after I pass my gemcutting exams. I almost passed them last week, but I'm sure that I'll do better on the test tomorrow!"}
Q[10955]={d="早在塞纳里奥议会统一所有的德鲁伊教派之前，猛禽德鲁伊就负责将飞行的诀窍传授给那些年轻有为的德鲁伊。猛禽德鲁伊教派解散后，原先的成员在传授飞行诀窍时就更为小心谨慎了。\n\n莫希斯·轻翼仍然在挑选合适的学徒，只有为数很少的德鲁伊能掌握各种形态，不过你似乎可以满足莫希斯对学生的要求。去赞加沼泽的塞纳里奥庇护所找他吧。",dEN="Before all of the druidic orders coalesced into the Cenarion Circle, the Druids of the Talon were responsible for teaching promising young druids the mysteries of flight. With the dissolution of the order, former members teach the skill sparingly.\n\nEven now, Morthis Whisperwing continues his search for a suitable apprentice. Few druids have truly mastered all the forms available to them, but you show the promise Morthis requires of his students. Seek him out at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",o="与赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼谈一谈。",oEN="Seek out Morthis Whisperwing at the Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",c="<莫希斯觉得你有点可疑。>\n\n我一直以来都在寻找可以传授知识的学徒。虽然猛禽德鲁伊不再是个正式的团体，但我仍要坚守到我生命的最后一刻。\n\n我今后收你做学徒。于我，我会教你风暴乌鸦的秘密；于你，你必须遵照我的吩咐做好所有准备。你明白吗？",cEN="Have you brought the Ingredients for the draught? <Morthis considers you somewhat skeptically.>\n\nI have long searched for an apprentice to pass my knowledge to. Though the Druids of the Talon are no longer a formal group, I shall remain one to the last of my days.\n\nI accept you as my apprentice from this moment forward. For my part, I will teach you the secrets of the stormcrow. For your part, you must be prepared to do all I ask. Do you understand?"}
Q[10956]={d="你知道纳鲁的故事吗？这些天使般的神灵一直以来都在无私地帮助德莱尼人。我曾在沙塔斯城附近见过他们。\n\n他们说有一位名叫沃洛斯的纳鲁去了你们的世界，就在埃索达城中。我想亲眼看看他。\n\n你能带我去吗？我敢打赌，要是我们利用沙塔斯城圣光广场的传送门，一定很快就能到达那儿！要是你在埃索达中迷了路，可以随时查看你的地图。",dEN="Do you know anything about the naaru? They're these angelic beings that have been helping the draenei for a really long time. I've seen a bunch around Shattrath.\n\nThey say that one naaru, O'ros, was with the Exodar when it traveled to your homeworld. I should like to see for myself.\n\nCan you take me there? I bet we could get there fast by using one of the portals inside the Terrace of Light at Shattrath City! When we get there, if you get lost, we could always just look at your map.",o="带上孤儿多尔南转至秘蓝岛的埃索达，将她带到纳鲁之座底部的沃洛斯面前。如果你到达时她不在你身边，记得召唤她。\n\n进入主城后你可以查看地图确定沃洛斯的位置。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, to stand before O'ros at the bottom of the Seat of the Naaru inside of the Exodar, which is on Azuremyst Isle. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.\n\nRemember that you can use your map inside the city.",c="<与其说是听到，不如说是感觉到奥罗斯那如音乐般的声音在你脑中回荡。>\n\n，谢谢你把这个孩子带到我这里。她确实非常特别，总有一天会成长为德莱尼人中一位重要的人物。这在很大程度上要归功于你对她的善意，以及你给她留下的印象。 <name>",cEN="<You feel, more than hear, the musical voice of O'ros chiming in your mind.>\n\nThank you for bringing this child to me, <name>. She is very special indeed, and will grow up one day to be an important figure amongst the draenei. This is in no small part due to the kindness that you have shown her, and the impression that you have made."}
Q[10957]={d="尽管当时停留在外域的大部分破碎者都决定效忠伊利丹，但最睿智的阿卡玛却有所保留。不过，他也知道，在那时候公开反对背叛者，只会将他的种族引领上全面灭绝的道路。\n\n因此，他采取了隐忍的策略，并将这个绝密的计划一直保守到今天。如果今天我们失败了，后果将是灾难性的……不仅仅是阿卡玛，不仅仅是破碎者，整个外域都会陷入毁灭。这个世界上还没有任何人能像伊利丹一样，给我们造成这样大的恐慌与痛苦。\n\n帮助阿卡玛释放他的灵魂吧，这样他就能带你转至伊利丹的最终秘室了。",dEN="When Illidan obtained the Broken's allegiance, Akama was our wisest. He knew that openly opposing the Betrayer would lead to the extinction of our race.\n\nInstead he has plotted and schemed for this very moment under utmost secrecy. Failure would be catastrophic... not just for Akama, not just for the Broken, but for all of Outland. No one this close to Illidan has ever been able to deliver such a terrible blow to him.\n\nHelp Akama free his soul and he will grant you access to Illidan's sanctum.",o="击败黑暗神殿内的阿卡玛之影，帮助阿卡玛夺回灵魂的控制权。完成任务之后向先知坎奈复命。",oEN="Help Akama wrest control back of his soul by defeating the Shade of Akama inside the Black Temple. Return to Seer Kanai when you've completed this task.",p="什么事，？ <name>",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="完成了，。向伊利丹发起攻击的时刻到了。 <name>",cEN="It is done, <name>. The time to strike at Illidan has come."}
Q[10958]={d="<你的目光落在克希利身上，脑海中同时充满了坚定与决绝的念头。你的使命还没有结束，你现在必须进入黑暗神殿，并找到阿卡玛的追随者们。>\n\n<一切都要仰仗阿卡玛了。>",dEN="<As you look up at Xi'ri, your mind becomes focused and your will determined. Your work here is not done; you must go inside the Black Temple and find Akama's followers.>\n\n<Much depends on Akama's success.>",o="在黑暗神殿内找到阿卡玛的死誓者。",oEN="Find Akama's Deathsworn inside the Black Temple.",c="我们一直在等你，。阿卡玛急需你的帮助。 <name>",cEN="We've been expecting you, <name>. Akama is in great need of your help."}
Q[10959]={d="伊利丹麾下的诸位军官已被击败，阿卡玛大人现在应该能够强行打开通向伊利丹秘室的大门了。召集你的盟友，趁阿卡玛打开大门时冲入秘室。\n\n我们还不知道玛维的情形，或许我们不得不在没有她助阵的情况下提前行动。\n\n我希望你和你的盟友能完成历史赋予你们的使命。伊利丹与阿卡玛见面之后，他们两人里恐怕只有一个会活下来。",dEN="With Illidan's lieutenants defeated, Akama will be able to force open the doors to Illidan's sanctum. Be ready to bring your force inside as soon as Akama does.\n\nWe still do not know what has become of Maiev, but we must make our move without her.\n\nI hope your force is up to the task. Illidan will not be pleased to see Akama.",o="先知坎奈要求你击败黑暗神殿内的伊利丹。",oEN="Seer Kanai wants you to defeat Illidan inside the Black Temple.",p="什么事，？ <name>",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="一切都如预言所说，。伊利丹的副官们一个接一个倒下……如今背叛者本人也迎来了他的末日！\n\n要知道，：阿卡玛所做的每一个决定，以及自伊利丹到来后他生命中的每一刻，都是为这一刻而谋划的。伊利丹终于死了，我们的族人……自由了！ <name><name>",cEN="It is as it was foretold, <name>. One by one, Illidan's lieutenants have fallen... and now the Betrayer himself has met his demise!\n\nKnow this, <name>: every decision Akama made and every moment of his life since Illidan arrived, Akama planned for this moment. Illidan is finally dead and our people... are free!"}
Q[10961]={d="很久之前，用于传授风暴乌鸦形态知识的圣物被托付给克林塔尔·梦行者保管。\n\n克林塔尔的躯体在月光林地的兽穴中休眠，他的灵魂则在翡翠梦境中徜徉。\n\n我得准备一剂可以令他的灵魂复苏的药膏。制造这种混合剂需要一些普通的草药，还有生长在赞加沼泽高大的蘑菇顶端的沼泽花。采集沼泽花的时候要小心，它们非常脆弱，而且可能会爆发出致命的毒气。",dEN="Long ago, the relics used to teach the ways of the stormcrow were entrusted to an ancient druid.\n\nYour training requires these relics, so we must wake their guardian from his slumber.\n\nI will prepare a potion you can use to ease the process. The mixture requires common herbs, as well as bogblossom, which usually grows atop the tallest mushrooms in the marsh. Fly up there and pursue them but take care, as they're quite fragile and may explode violently if mishandled.",o="将10株沼泽花、10簇远古苔和10株梦露花交给塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼。",oEN="Bring 10 Bogblossoms, 10 Ancient Lichen, and 10 Dreaming Glory to Morthis Whisperwing at the Cenarion Refuge.",p="你弄到准备药剂需要的所有材料了吗？请小心别把花粉洒在我的身上。这种花粉会让我不停的打喷嚏。\n\n<莫希斯嗅了一下材料然后打了个喷嚏。>",pEN="Have you brought the ingredients for the draught? Take care not to get pollen on me, please. I sneeze uncontrollably in its presence.\n\n<Morthis sniffs at the indignity represented by a sneeze.>",c="你把配制药剂的材料带来了吗？请小心别让花粉沾到我身上。一闻到它的味道我就会不停地打喷嚏。\n\n<莫西斯对打喷嚏这种失态嗤之以鼻。>\n\n<莫西斯从你手中接过草药，仔细检查。他取出一个小瓶，开始调配药剂。>\n\n这只需要一会儿，。然后，你必须前往月光林地。 <Morthis olfatea la indignidad que representa un estornudo> <name>",cEN="Have you brought the Ingredients for the draught? Take care not to get pollen on me, please. I sneeze uncontrollably in its presence.\n\n<Morthis sniffs at the indignity represented by a sneeze.>\n\n<Morthis accepts the herbs from you, inspecting them. Producing a vial, he begins mixing the potion.>\n\nThis will only take a moment, <name>. Then, you must travel to Moonglade."}
Q[10962]={d="曾经有位年老的牧师路经孤儿院，给我们讲过时空之穴的故事。他说位于时间中心的时空之穴起着维护历史进程的重要作用。\n\n我不知道那是什么意思，但是他说那儿驻守着守护世界的龙族！我想看看龙长什么样！\n\n我们可以去时空之穴吗？那位牧师说入口就在那片名叫塔纳利斯的沙漠东部边缘。\n\n我们去了那里之后，你能给我买件纪念品吗？",dEN="In the orphanage, the old priest that comes by told us stories about the Caverns of Time. He said that it sits in the middle of time, and is really important for keeping things straight.\n\nI don't know what that means, but he said that there were dragons there that were helping to save the world! I want to see a dragon!\n\nDo you think that we could go there? He said that the entrance was on the eastern edge of a great desert named Tanaris.\n\nMaybe you could buy me a souvenir while we're there?",o="将孤儿多尔南带到时光之穴中央平台上的扎拉多姆面前。如果你到达时她不在你身边，记得召唤她。\n\n然后在时间守护者的军需官艾鲁尔米那儿为她购买一个玩具龙，艾鲁尔米就在入口通道底部附近。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, to stand before Zaladormu, the dragon on the dais in the middle of the Caverns of Time. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.\n\nThen, purchase a Toy Dragon for her from the Keepers of Time Quartermaster, Alurmi, near the bottom of the entrance tunnel.",p="你认为他们所说的关于时光之穴的事都是真的吗？",pEN="You think it's true what they say about the Caverns of Time?",c="太棒了！一只专属于我的龙！我希望有天能够幸运到有只龙当我的朋友。\n\n<朵娜开心的跳上跳下，用力抱住她的新玩具。>\n\n这真是一趟最棒的旅行！我真希望永远不会结束。",cEN="Neato! A dragon of my very own! One day I hope that I'm lucky enough to have a dragon as a friend.\n\n<Dornaa bounces up and down with joy, fiercely hugging her new toy.>\n\nThis has been the best trip ever! I hope it never ends."}
Q[10963]={d="曾经有位年老的牧师路经孤儿院，跟我们讲起时光之穴的故事。他说位于时间中心的时光之穴起着维护历史进程的重要作用。\n\n我不知道那是什么意思，但是他说那儿驻守着守护世界的龙族！我真想看看龙是长什么样的啊！\n\n我们可以去时光之穴吗？那位牧师说入口就在那片名叫塔纳利斯的沙漠东部边缘。\n\n还有还有，我们去了之后，你可以给我买件纪念品吗？",dEN="In the orphanage, the old stinky priest that comes by told us stories about the Caverns of Time. He said that it sits in the middle of time, and is really important for keeping things straight.\n\nI don't know what that means, but he said that there were dragons there that were helping to save the world! I want to see a dragon!\n\nI think we should go there. He said that the entrance was on the eastern edge of a great desert named Tanaris.\n\nYou could buy me a souvenir while we're there!",o="将孤儿萨兰蒂亚带到时空之穴中央平台上的扎拉多姆面前。如果你到达时她不在你身边，记得召唤她。\n\n然后在时光守护者的军需官艾鲁尔米那儿为她购买一个玩具龙，艾鲁尔米就在入口通道底部附近。",oEN="Take your orphan, Salandria, to stand before Zaladormu, the dragon on the dais in the middle of the Caverns of Time. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.\n\nThen, purchase a Toy Dragon for her from the Keepers of Time Quartermaster, Alurmi, near the bottom of the entrance tunnel.",p="要是他们对于时光之穴的说法是真的，那么这里一定是一个强大力量之地。",pEN="If what they say about the Caverns of Time is true, then it must be a place of great power.",c="太帅了！一只专属于我的龙！有天我打算要拥有一只真的龙。\n\n<瑟兰德雅狡猾的看着她的新玩具，心里不知道在转着什么主意。>\n\n这真是一趟最棒的旅行！我希望永远不要结束。",cEN="Awesome! A dragon of my very own! Someday I plan to own a real one.\n\n<Salandria slyly eyes her new toy, the gears within her mind turning.>\n\nThis has been the best trip ever! I hope it never ends."}
Q[10964]={d="带上唤醒戒卫转至月光林地的怒风兽穴。克林塔尔·梦行者就在最南端的那个驻有梦境守卫者的洞穴中。\n\n喂他服下药膏，等待他慢慢苏醒。在克林塔尔·梦行者的灵魂与身体重新结合的过程中，他会处于异常脆弱的状态；当然，他是不可能认出你的。$n，一旦他恢复神志，请立即通报你的身份。他需要你的帮助才能收集到仪式所需的圣物。",dEN="Take the ward with you and travel to Moonglade, to the Stormrage Barrow Dens. Within the southernmost of the Stormrage Barrow Dens, watched over by the dreamwardens, you will find Clintar Dreamwalker.\n\nAdminister the potion and watch over him while he wakes. He'll be extremely vulnerable as his spirit reunites with his body and he certainly won't recognize you. Declare yourself to him as soon as he comes around, <name>. He will need your help to gather the relics for the ceremony.",o="使用唤醒戒卫帮助克林塔尔·梦行者从翡翠梦境中苏醒。当他恢复意识后跟他谈谈。",oEN="Use the Ward of Waking to help Clintar Dreamwalker emerge from the Emerald Dream. When he is conscious, speak to him.",p="<你准备把药剂喂给沉睡中的<class>。>",pEN="<You prepare to administer the potion to the sleeping <class>.>",c="<德鲁伊从沉睡中醒来，迷迷糊糊、面容憔悴。他的目光在房间里四处扫视，寻找着看不见的追兵。>\n\n莫西斯？\n\n不，你不是莫西斯……你是谁，<race>，为什么要打扰我的休息？\n\n<尽管问话充满敌意，德鲁伊看起来却几乎为被唤醒而松了一口气。>",cEN="<The druid emerges from his sleep, groggy and haggard looking. His gaze darts around the room in search on unseen pursuers.>\n\nMorthis?\n\nNo, you're not Morthis... Who are you, <race>, and why have you disturbed my rest?\n\n<Despite the hostility of the question, the Druid looks almost relieved to have been awakened.>"}
Q[10965]={d="<克林塔尔听你传达莫希斯的指示，他点着头，脸上却流露出忧虑的神情。>\n\n我无法完全从翡翠梦境中脱身，但是这块取自我的灵魂的碎片可以帮助你寻找圣物。$r，好好保护它，这东西相当脆弱。\n\n翡翠梦境已经成为了危机重重的是非之地。它紧紧地抓住我，只有等这儿恢复正常，我才可能全身而退。你所看到的不过是梦境中折射出的影像！",dEN="<Clintar listens as you relay Morthis' instructions, nodding, but clearly fearful.>\n\nI cannot extricate myself fully from the Emerald Dream to help you, but a fragment of my spirit will guide you in your search for the relics. Guard it well, <race>, for it is a fragile thing.\n\nThe Emerald Dream itself has become an alien, dangerous place. Its grasp on me is strong, and I will not be whole until the Emerald Dream returns to normalcy. What you see around you is but an echo of the reality inside the dream!",o="在克林塔尔·梦行者的灵魂收集艾维娜圣物时保护他，然后与梦境卫士鲁罗萨谈一谈。",oEN="Protect Clintar Dreamwalker's Spirit while it gathers the relics of Aviana, then speak to Dreamwarden Lurosa.",p="快点，<race>。如果这些生物逃出古墓，处于危险中的就不止克林塔尔·梦行者一个了。",pEN="Be quick, <race>. If these creatures escape the barrow, Clintar Dreamwalker will not be the only one in danger.",c="你很幸运，克林塔尔足够强大，能将自身灵魂的分裂维持这么久，。很少有德鲁伊能在翡翠梦境中遭受攻击时还能完成这样的壮举。好好守护这些圣物！ <name>",cEN="You are fortunate that Clintar was strong enough to maintain the split in his essence for so long, <name>. Few druids can manage that kind of feat while under attack in Emerald Dream. Guard the relics well!"}
Q[10966]={d="糟糕！我该返回沙塔斯城的孤儿院了。\n\n跟你在一起的日子非常愉快。$n，你是世界上最好的人！就像我的大$g哥哥:姐姐一样！\n\n<多尔南的眼中泛起泪花。>\n\n我会想你的！长大之后，我要做一个像你一样的人！！！",dEN="Darn it all! I guess it's time to go back to the orphanage at Shattrath City.\n\nI've had such a great time. You're the best person in all of the worlds, <name>! You're my big <brother /sister> now!\n\n<Dornaa's eyes begin to well up with tears.>\n\nI'm going to miss you so much! When I grow up, I'm going to be just like you!!!",o="将德莱尼孤儿哨归还给沙塔斯城贫民窟的孤儿院长莫希。",oEN="Return your ward to the Shattrath City orphanage by handing in the Draenei Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Mercy in the Lower City.",p="很高兴再见到你，<class>。我相信你和年幼的多尔娜一起度过了美好的时光吧？",pEN="It is good to see you again, <class>. I trust that you and young Dornaa had a wonderful time together?",c="知道有你这样的英雄愿意如此无私地付出时间，对灵魂是件好事。\n\n我一眼就能看出，你和多尔娜共度的时光给她留下了极深的印象。让孩子们有机会走出去看看世界是好事。\n\n来，她告诉我，她希望你照顾她最喜欢的一只宠物，就像你照顾她一样。留个念想。\n\n别见外，常来。",cEN="It is good for the soul to know that there are heroes such as yourself that are willing to give of their time so selflessly.\n\nI can tell already that your time together with Dornaa has made a huge impression. It's good for the children to have a chance to get out and see the world.\n\nHere, she told me that she wanted you to take care of one of her favorite pets, just like you took care of her. Something to remember her by.\n\nDon't be a stranger."}
Q[10967]={d="糟糕！我该返回沙塔斯城的孤儿院了。\n\n跟你在一起的日子非常愉快。$n，你是世界上最好的人！就像我的亲$g哥哥:姐姐一样！\n\n<萨兰蒂亚的眼中泛起泪花。>\n\n我会想你的！长大之后，我要做一个像你一样的人！！！",dEN="Darn it all! I guess it's time to go back to the orphanage at Shattrath City.\n\nI've had such a great time. You're the best person in all of the worlds, <name>! You're my big <brother /sister> now!\n\n<Salandria's eyes begin to well up with tears.>\n\nI'm going to miss you so much!!!",o="将血精灵孤儿哨归还给沙塔斯城贫民窟的孤儿院长莫希。",oEN="Return your ward to the Shattrath City orphanage by handing in the Blood Elf Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Mercy in the Lower City.",p="很高兴再见到你，<class>。我相信你和年幼的萨兰德里亚一起度过了美好的时光吧？",pEN="It is good to see you again, <class>. I trust that you and young Salandria had a wonderful time together?",c="知道有你这样的英雄愿意如此无私地付出时间，对灵魂是好事。\n\n我一眼就能看出，你和萨兰德里亚共度的时光给她留下了极深的印象。让孩子们有机会走出去看看世界是好事。\n\n来，她告诉我，她希望你照顾她最喜欢的一只宠物，就像你照顾她一样。留个念想。\n\n别见外，常来。",cEN="It is good for the soul to know that there are heroes such as yourself that are willing to give of their time so selflessly.\n\nI can tell already that your time together with Salandria has made a huge impression. It's good for the children to have a chance to get out and see the world.\n\nHere, she told me that she wanted you to take care of one of her favorite pets, just like you took care of her. Something to remember her by.\n\nDon't be a stranger."}
Q[10968]={d="我感觉得出，这孩子颇有与众不同之处。\n\n你应该带她去见埃索达的预言者努波顿。我想他一定盼着你们俩呢。\n\n努波顿大人就在水晶大厅的最顶层。",dEN="I am sensing something very special about this child indeed.\n\nYou should take her to visit Farseer Nobundo, here in the Exodar. I believe that he has been expecting the two of you.\n\nLook for Nobundo upon the highest terrace in the Crystal Hall.",o="带上孤儿多尔南，转至秘蓝岛埃索达的水晶大厅拜访预言者努波顿。如果你到那儿时她不在你身边，记得召唤出她来。\n\n记住，你在城里可以查看地图。",oEN="Take your orphan, Dornaa, to visit Farseer Nobundo at the Crystal Hall inside of the Exodar, which is on Azuremyst Isle. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.\n\nRemember that you can use your map inside the city.",c="我曾经期望，但又绝望于她只是我幻像的一部分。这个孩子真是惊人！\n\n从没听过在今时今日能有任何一位德莱尼能够不经训练即能展现对元素拥有如此的能力。他一定是从某位先祖之处继承了这种力量。\n\n我会派送一封书信到沙塔斯城给孤儿监护员要求能够将这个小孩送来和我们在一起。\n\n拜托，在那之前你要确保她的安全。",cEN="I had hoped, but despaired she was only a figment of my imagination. The child is amazing!\n\nIt's unheard of in this day and age that one of the draenei should exhibit such ability with the elements without any training. She must have inherited this power from an ancient ancestor.\n\nI will send a missive to the orphan matron in Shattrath City requesting that the child be allowed to come stay with us.\n\nPlease, keep her safe until then."}
Q[10969]={d="看来有一股外部势力对财团的生意产生了兴趣。过去两天里有五名财团商人失踪了。我们有理由相信以太人牵涉其中。如果你有兴趣帮忙，就去保护者哨站找阿米尔指挥官。\n\n你会在下一座岛上、此处正东方找到保护者哨站。 |n",dEN="It would seem that an outside force has taken an interest in the business practices of the Consortium. Five Consortium dealers have gone missing in the past two days. We have reason to believe the Ethereum are involved. If you are interested in assisting, seek out Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post.\n\nYou will find the Protectorate Watch Post directly east of here on the next island.",o="转至维序派哨站，找到指挥官阿米尔。",oEN="Seek out Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post.",c="嗯，没错，但并不光只有星界财团的商人失踪而已。",cEN="Aye, it is true, but the Consortium are not the only group claiming losses."}
Q[10970]={d="上次进入复仇军的地盘执行侦察任务时，我们发现了这个球状监牢并将它带了回来。当时要不是监牢中发出微弱的求救信号，我们根本不会留意到它。\n\n我们猜测有位伙伴被困在这里面，但是想要不伤害里面的人就打开它几乎是不可能的。\n\n或许复仇军的成员可能会随身携带着这个监牢的钥匙。只要夺得一把钥匙，我们就能揭开其中的秘密了。",dEN="We salvaged this prison orb on our last scouting mission into Ethereum territory. We'd have never found it had it not been for the distress signal that it was faintly emitting.\n\nWe think one of our own might be locked up in there but we have no way of opening the orb up without harming whatever is inside.\n\nWhat we know about the Ethereum is that any of their members could - at any given time - be carrying a key to unlock an orb. Retrieve one and return so that we may uncover the mysteries of this orb.",o="为虚空风暴维序派哨站的指挥官阿米尔夺得复仇军监狱钥匙。",oEN="Recover the Salvaged Ethereum Prison Key for Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm.",p="进展的如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="退后，。这很可能是个以太人的陷阱。 <name>",cEN="Stand back, <name>. This could very well be an Ethereum trap."}
Q[10971]={d="<阿米尔举起一枚标识牌。>\n\n我在一名维序派前锋的尸体上找到了这块身份标识牌。我猜他们在所有的囚犯身上都挂上了这种标识牌。\n\n接下来，我要将这些标识牌归档研究，看看能否对他们的刑狱系统有所了解。如果你找到更多的复仇军监狱钥匙的话，就用它们打开此地正南方复仇军前沿基地的监狱。将你发现的标识牌统统带回来给我。",dEN="<Ameer holds up a tag.>\n\nI found this prisoner I.D. tag with the remains of the fallen vanguard. I can only assume that all of their prisoners are tagged in the same manner.\n\nI'm going to start cataloguing the tags in hopes of making sense of their penal system. If in your adventures you find more Ethereum prison keys, you can use them to open the Ethereum prisons at the Ethereum Staging Grounds - directly south of here. Bring me back any and all I.D. tags that you find.",o="虚空风暴维序派哨站的指挥官阿米尔要你取回一块复仇军囚犯标识牌。",oEN="Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm wants you to bring him an Ethereum Prisoner I.D. Tag.",p="你找到标识牌了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered any I.D tags?",c="看起来他的功能不只是辨识身份而已。标签上有一些用某种密码编写的文字。我就快要破解它了，也许只要再几片就可以了。",cEN="It seems to be more than just an identifier. There is some sort of code written on these tags. I'm on the verge of breaking it wide open. Perhaps if I had a few more pieces."}
Q[10972]={d="我需要更多的身份标识牌，$n。我发现这些身份标识牌不仅用于标识囚犯身份，还记录着囚犯被囚禁的地点！\n\n一旦破解了标识牌的密码，我们就能找到所有被俘虏的伙伴，然后以最小的代价将他们解救出来。",dEN="I am in need of more I.D tags, <name>. What I've discovered thus far is that this is not just a way to catalogue prisoners but it also documents locations!\n\nOnce this code is broken we'll be able to pinpoint exactly where all of our allies are held and free them with minimal hostile action received.",c="我们离真相很近了，。 <name>",cEN="We are close to the truth, <name>."}
Q[10973]={d="我破解了密码！每块标牌都被分成若干片段。标牌正面总是相同的，写着：「一千个世界……」我不确定这句话是什么意思，但听起来很阴险。\n\n标牌背面是重要统计数据。第一组符文标明位置，第二组标明囚犯类型。此外，这些钥匙似乎可以组合成一把特殊的钥匙，能开启另一种监狱。现在我只差更多钥匙了……\"\"",dEN="I have cracked the code! Each tag is broken up into several segments. The front side of the tag is always the same and states: \"A Thousand Worlds...\" I am unsure as to the meaning of this phrase but it sounds insidious.\n\nOn the back side of the tag are the vital statistics. The first set of runes indicates location and the second indicates prisoner type. Furthermore, it would seem that the keys can be combined to form a special key that accesses another prison type. Now I just need more keys...",o="虚空风暴维序派哨站的指挥官阿米尔要你取回5把复仇军监牢钥匙。",oEN="Commander Ameer at the Protectorate Watch Post in Netherstorm wants you to bring him 5 Ethereum Prison Keys.",p="我知道你付出了很多，但是想想这样你可以拯救多少人啊！",pEN="I know it's asking a lot but think of the lives that could be saved!",c="<阿米尔灵巧地组合起钥匙，开始读取新形成的钥匙石板上的刻痕。>\n\n「一千个世界破碎，还有一千个世界待征服……此乃 Nexus 之王的意志。」\n\n<阿米尔把石板翻过来，开始读背面。>\n\n巴什伊尔的静滞室？\"\"",cEN="<Ameer deftly combines the keys and begins to read the markings on the newly formed key tablet.>\n\n\"A thousand worlds shattered, a thousand worlds more to overcome... Such is the will of the Nexus-King.\"\n\n<Ameer turns the tablet over and begins to read from the back-side.>\n\nStasis chambers of Bash'ir?"}
Q[10974]={d="复仇军在刀锋山最北端创建了一处名叫巴什伊尔码头的营地。根据钥匙石板上的记录，复仇军在那里设立了更大的监狱。他们将这些监狱命名为静止间。\n\n这块钥匙石板能让你进入巴什伊尔码头的特殊静止间——阿尔法静止间。\n\n我的全息影像会在码头等你完成探查任务。到那边再联络吧。",dEN="The Ethereum have a settlement on the northernmost shelf of Blade's Edge Mountains known as Bash'ir's Landing. According to the key tablet, much larger versions of the prisons are kept at Bash'ir's. It should also be noted that the Ethereum refer to those prisons as stasis chambers.\n\nThe key tablet grants access to a very specific stasis chamber at the landing known as Stasis Chamber Alpha. Take the key and investigate.\n\nMy image will be awaiting your return at Bash'ir's Landing. Speak to me there.",o="使用复仇军钥匙石板 - 阿尔法开启刀锋山巴什伊尔码头的阿尔法静止间。\n\n将阿尔法静止间的证物交给巴什伊尔码头的指挥官阿米尔的影像。",oEN="Use the Ethereum Key Tablet - Alpha to open Stasis Chamber Alpha at Bash'ir's Landing in Blade's Edge Mountains.\n\nReturn Evidence from Alpha to the Image of Commander Ameer at Bash'ir's Landing.",p="你办到了！有什么发现吗？",pEN="You made it! Any luck?",c="<指挥官阿米尔的影像仔细查看你带回来的证据。>\n\n情况比我想的还糟……这些密室中关的都是许许多多不同世界的凶猛野兽与生物。他们希望有一天可以控制这些野兽，听从他们的命令。我们必须杀光他们！",cEN="<The image of Commander Ameer rummages through the evidence.>\n\nIt is worse than I thought... These chambers hold ferocious beasts and creatures from many, many different worlds. They hope to one day command the beasts to do their bidding. We must destroy them all!"}
Q[10975]={p="我们陷入了僵局，。你收集的数据已经给了我们足够的信息，去解救被关押在虚空风暴各小监狱中的盟友，但我们必须继续推进，铲除巴什伊尔登陆点这里更强大的以太人威胁。\n\n加入对抗以太人的战斗！把以太人监狱钥匙带给我，我会为你锻造以太人静滞室钥匙，供你在巴什伊尔的静滞室上使用。 <name>",pEN="We're at an impasse here, <name>. The data you've collected has given us enough information to save our allies being held at the smaller prisons of Netherstorm but we must press forward and eradicate the larger Ethereum threats here at Bash'ir's Landing.\n\nJoin the battle against the Ethereum! Bring Ethereum prison keys to me and I shall forge Ethereum stasis chamber keys for you to use on the stasis chambers of Bash'ir.",c="总还有更多工作要做，。现在去找一间静滞室，摧毁里面潜伏的一切邪恶！ <name>",cEN="There is always more work that must be done, <name>. Now seek out a stasis chamber and destroy whatever evil lurks within!"}
Q[10976]={d="我必须查明复仇军到底在奥金顿的法力陵墓中藏着什么东西。\n\n如果你与巴什伊尔静止间内的怪兽打斗过的话，应该见过一种名叫节点之王的印记的东西。如果你找到这种印记，立即带回来给我！它是制作法力陵墓静止间钥匙所需的最后一件材料。",dEN="What I must now know is what the Ethereum have held inside the Mana-Tombs of Auchindoun.\n\nIn your battles against the beasts of the stasis chambers of Bash'ir you may run across an item known as the Mark of the Nexus-King. Should you find such an item, return it to me immediately! It is the final piece in crafting a key that will allow access to the stasis chamber inside the Mana-Tombs.",o="刀锋山巴什伊尔码头的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你取回节点之王的印记。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at Bash'ir's Landing in the Blade's Edge Mountains wants you to bring him a Mark of the Nexus-King.",p="这将是你最艰巨的任务，。 <name>",pEN="This will be your most daunting task, <name>.",c="终于！\n\n<指挥官阿米尔读着节点之王印记上面的记载。>\n\n最后2名囚犯？我不敢想象里头有什么恐怖的东西在等着……",cEN="At last!\n\n<Commander Ameer reads from the Mark of the Nexus-King.>\n\nTwo final prisons? I shudder to think what horrors lie in wait..."}
Q[10977]={d="我利用你取回的这枚节点之王的印记铸造了一把新钥匙，可以用来打开法力陵墓内的静止间。\n\n从印记上雕刻的文字来看，法力陵墓设有两处静止间，一处在入口附近，另一处则在节点亲王沙法尔旁边。我给你的这把钥匙能打开入口附近的静止间。\n\n我要你进入奥金顿的法力陵墓，打开法力陵墓静止间。",dEN="The Mark of the Nexus-King that you recovered has allowed me to forge a new key for the stasis chambers found inside the Mana-Tombs.\n\nAccording to the glyphs on the mark, two exist: one near the front and one near Nexus-Prince Shaffar. This key that I am about to give you will open the stasis chamber near the front.\n\nI want you to go to the Mana-Tombs of Auchindoun and open the Mana-Tombs Stasis Chamber.",o="刀锋山巴什伊尔码头的指挥官阿米尔的影像要你进入奥金顿的法力陵墓，对静止间使用法力陵墓静止间钥匙。\n\n此任务必须在英雄难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="The Image of Commander Ameer at Bash'ir's Landing in the Blade's Edge Mountains wants you to use the Mana-Tombs Stasis Chamber Key on the Stasis Chamber inside the Mana-Tombs of Auchindoun.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",c="你的英雄事迹已经传开了，。哈拉迈德和我都认为你所做的值得一份丰厚的奖赏。\n\n不过……算了，你做得已经够多了。凭良心，我不能再向你要求什么了。 <name>",cEN="Word has gotten back of your heroics, <name>. Haramad and I both agree that what you've done deserves a great reward.\n\nThough... Nevermind, you've done enough. I cannot in good conscience ask anything more from you."}
Q[10978]={d="圣物已经取回，你必须立刻离开这里，$n。克林塔尔置自己和梦境守卫者的安全于不顾，帮助你找回圣物；现在，他必须专心对抗那些滋扰翡翠梦境的入侵者了。\n\n将圣物交给莫希斯·轻翼，并将你看到的情形告诉他。或许他可以帮助我们判断入侵翡翠梦境的人究竟是谁。",dEN="Now that the relics have been recovered, you must leave this place with all haste. Clintar risked his safety and that of the dreamwardens to help you, <name>, but now he must fully devote his attention to fighting the force that has invaded the Emerald Dream.\n\nTake the relics back to Morthis Whisperwing, along with word of what you've seen here. He may be able to help us identify just what Clintar is struggling against.",o="将艾维娜圣物交给赞加沼泽塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼。",oEN="Bring the Relics of Aviana to Morthis Whisperwing at Cenarion Refuge in Zangarmarsh.",p="克林塔尔帮助你取得圣物了吗？",pEN="Did Clintar help you recover the relics?",c="<当你讲述在古墓穴中的经历时，莫西斯从你手中接过圣物。>\n\n这是非常令人不安的消息，。翡翠梦境中出现过许许多多奇怪的扰动，但我不记得有任何提及外力篡改它的记载。你确定克林塔尔是这么认为的吗？ <name>",cEN="<Morthis accepts the relics from you as you describe your experiences in the barrow dens.>\n\nThis is most troubling news, <name>. There have been any number of strange disturbances in the Emerald Dream, but I can't remember any mention of outside forces tampering with it. Are you certain that's what Clintar believes?"}
Q[10979]={d="你确定自己在兽穴中看到了一只乌鸦？\n\n事情越来越令人困惑了。看来我们没法直接帮助克林塔尔和梦境守护者，但是如果我们能查明究竟是什么在滋扰翡翠梦境，或许就有办法阻止这些神秘的入侵者。\n\n有报告称刀锋山上一支远古的鸦人部族已经复苏，而他们所崇拜的神正是一只乌鸦。去常青林找阿尔索恩·风歌，或许这支鸦人部族与翡翠梦境有着千丝万缕的关系！",dEN="Are you certain you saw a raven in the barrow den?\n\nThis is a troubling development. There's little we can do to help Clintar and the dreamwardens directly, but if we can learn more about what's threatening the Emerald Dream, we may be able to stop it.\n\nWe've been learning about the resurgence in an ancient arakkoa cult in Blade's Edge -- one that venerates a raven god. Go to the Evergrove and find Arthorn Windsong. There may be a connection between what's happening there and in the Emerald Dream!",o="与刀锋山常青林的阿尔索恩·风歌谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Arthorn Windsong at the Evergrove in Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="<阿尔索恩听你解释莫希斯·轻翼派你来调查乌鸦之神的教派与月光林地发生的奇异事件之间的关联性。虽然对这个消息很震惊，她似乎对这个讯息本质更失望。>\n\n我的天啊……\n\n我一直在帮助坦莫研究那个乌鸦教派，但是我们从未想象过他们的教徒已经将势力扩展到刀锋山以外的地方！",cEN="<Arthorn listens as you explain that Morthis Whisperwing sent you to investigate a connection between the cult of the raven god and strange happenings in Moonglade. Though shocked at the news, she seems more disappointed at the message's nature.>\n\nOh my...\n\nI've been helping Timeon with his research on the raven cult, but we never imagined its patron had any reach beyond Blade's Edge!"}
Q[10980]={d="从你告诉我的情况看，莫西斯的怀疑似乎可信，但我们需要确证。\n\n泰米恩在研究中发现了一些线索，表明一本「乌鸦之书」曾是这个教派的古老经文。\n\n鸦人的灵魂不会向你显形。带上这块石头前往刀锋山西部的高峰，乌鸦林以南，取得一只以太鳐之眼，将它们组合以增强你的视力。去寻找泰米恩辨认出的那个幽灵，长者塞卡尔。\"\"",dEN="From what you've told me, Morthis's suspicions seem plausible, but we need confirmation.\n\nIn his research, Timeon has uncovered clues that a \"book of the raven\" served as an ancient scripture to the cult.\n\nThe arakkoa spirits will not reveal themselves to your eyes. Take this stone with you to the high peaks in the western part of Blade's Edge, to the south of Raven's Wood, obtain an aether ray eye, and combine them to augment your sight. Search for the ghost Timeon identified as Sai'kkal the Elder.",o="使用一颗以太鳐之眼和你的先知之石找到乌鸦教派的幽灵。在漩涡峰寻找长者塞克卡尔的灵魂，向他询问有关乌鸦之书的问题，然后向常青林的阿尔索恩·风歌复命。",oEN="Use an Aether Ray Eye with your Seer's Stone to reveal the raven cult ghosts. Search the Vortex Pinnacle for the spirit of Sai'kkal the Elder and question him about the book of the raven, then return to Arthorn Windsong.",p="<阿尔索恩充满希望的看着你。>\n\n你找到任何关于乌鸦之书的讯息吗？",pEN="<Arthorn looks at you hopefully.>\n\nWere you able to track down any information about the book?",c="就算在鸦人当中，这些教徒也被视为异端，这难道不令人惊叹吗？传统祭司竟然恨他们恨到要毁掉他们的圣典，这太不可思议了！我们必须弄到那本书，。\n\n它是揭开乌鸦之神之谜、阻止他占据翡翠梦境的关键。\n\n如果我们成功，也许莫西斯终于会同意收我做学徒！ <name>",cEN="Isn't it amazing that even among arakkoa, the cultists were considered heretics? That the traditional priests hated them enough to destroy their holy text is incredible! We must get our hands on that book, <name>.\n\nIt's the key to unraveling the mystery of the raven god and preventing him from taking over the Emerald Dream.\n\nPerhaps Morthis will finally agree to take me as a student if we succeed!"}
Q[10981]={p="只有最坚定、身经百战的冒险者才会接受我这个提议，。如果你愿意面对法力陵墓中第二间静滞室的恐怖之物，我能够合成一把钥匙。带一枚 Nexus 之王的印记给我，我就会为你制作。 <name>",pEN="Only the most steadfast and battle-hardened of adventurers will take me up on this offer, <name>. Should you wish to face the horrors of the second stasis chamber in the Mana-Tombs, I am able to synthesize a key. Bring me a mark of the Nexus-King and I will make it so.",c="我已经完成你的要求了，这是通往萨法尔私人密室的钥匙。",cEN="As promised, here is the key to Shaffar's personal stasis chamber."}
Q[10982]={c="你为保护者部队和财团做了很多，。那么，我们的新钥匙中的第一把归你，再合适不过了。有了这把钥匙，你随时都能打开沙法尔的私人静滞室，而且不会消耗钥匙本身。\n\n<阿米尔点头。>\n\n它是永久的，将永远伴随你。 <name> <Ameer asiente>",cEN="You have done much for the Protectorate and the Consortium, <name>. It is only fitting, then, that the first of our new keys goes to you. With this key you will be able to open Shaffar's personal stasis chamber at any time without having expended the key itself.\n\n<Ameer nods.>\n\nIt is permanent and will be with you forever."}
Q[10983]={d="莫戈多格很聪明！是他派葛罗克来城里寻求帮助的。血槌氏族需要帮助。\n\n莫戈多格说，让有能力的强者去刀锋山帮他。他就在鲜血之环的塔顶。莫戈多格很聪明！",dEN="Mog'dorg wise! Him send Grok to city, look for help. Bloodmaul clan need help.\n\nMog'dorg say, send powerful little ones to him at Blade's Edge Mountains. Him stand on tower at Circle of Blood. Mog'dorg wise!",o="与枯瘦的莫戈多格谈一谈，他就在刀锋山鲜血之环外的某座塔顶上。",oEN="Visit Mog'dorg the Wizened atop one of the towers just outside the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="格罗克说我很睿智？我可不知道。\n\n也许是因为我是族中唯一真正试图把我们从刃拳氏族的灭顶之灾中拯救出来的人，还有支持他们的格鲁尔和他的儿子们。\n\n，我希望你是来把我们从必然的毁灭中解救出来的。 <class>",cEN="Grok said that I am wise? I don't know about that.\n\nPerhaps it is because I am the only one in my clan that is truly trying to save us from annihilation by the Bladespire clan, and Gruul and his sons, who are backing them.\n\nI hope that you have come to deliver us from certain doom, <class>."}
Q[10984]={d="<弗埃卢那水晶般清澈的声音在你脑海中回荡。>\n\n贫民窟中有位食人魔，他不停地向路人乞求帮助。可惜很多人对他的哀求充耳不闻。\n\n你愿意帮帮他吗？\n\n他名叫葛罗克，就在东南边商人聚集之地。\n\n谢谢你，$n。",dEN="<V'eru's voice fills your mind with crystalline tone and clarity.>\n\nThere is an ogre down in the Lower City, pleading for the assistance of passersby. They have all turned a deaf ear upon his plight.\n\nDo you think you might aid him?\n\nHis name is Grok, and he is sitting near the merchants to the southeast.\n\nThank you, <name>.",o="与沙塔斯城贫民窟的食人魔葛罗克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Ogre, Grok, in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",c="你帮助葛罗克吗？葛罗克需要帮助！血槌氏族需要帮助！",cEN="You help Grok? Grok need help! Bloodmaul clan need help!"}
Q[10985]={d="<克希利身上发出阵阵淡泊的光芒，而他身边的奥尔多和占星者军队也回应着他的命令。克希利的军团已经完全准备好了，随时可以将伊利丹的军队压制住，并为阿卡玛吸引敌人的注意力。现在，这位纳鲁正等待着你给出进攻开始的信号。>",dEN="<Xi'ri pulses with lights as the Aldor and Scryer forces around him respond to his orders. Xi'ri's army is ready to push Illidan's forces back and create a distraction for Akama. The naaru awaits your request to begin the attack.>",o="在克希利的军队发动佯攻之后，保护阿卡玛和玛维进入影月谷内的黑暗神殿。",oEN="Ensure that Akama and Maiev enter the Black Temple in Shadowmoon Valley after Xi'ri's forces create a distraction.",p="<希瑞对你打了招呼。>",pEN="<Xi'ri acknowledges your presence.>",c="<你感觉手中出现了一个物品，希瑞脉动着能量。这是你替阿卡玛交给阿达尔的勋章，借由纳鲁的魔法加强了力量。沙塔尔将卡拉伯尔勋章委托给你，有了它就能进入黑暗神庙。>",cEN="<Xi'ri pulses with energy as you feel an object materialize in your hands. It is the medallion you gave to A'dal on Akama's behalf, its power augmented by the naaru's magic. The Sha'tar have entrusted you with the Medallion of Karabor, and with it access to the Black Temple.>"}
Q[10986]={d="就算乌鸦之书的残片都在，要找到它们也很困难。我们最好是利用比你的视线更为敏锐的眼睛。\n\n观察者艾莱亚在纳格兰暮光岭的东部边缘研究当地的各种鸟类。去那儿找她吧，在她的帮助下，你或许可以借助鸟类敏锐的视线找到乌鸦之书的残片。",dEN="Locating the pieces of the Book of the Raven, if they survive at all, is going to be difficult. Our best hope is to use a keener pair of eyes than your own.\n\nDown in western Nagrand, on the eastern lip of the Twilight Ridge, Watcher Elaira studies the various bird species that make their home there. Visit her and see if she can help you harness avian sight to gather the pieces of the Book of the Raven.",o="与纳格兰暮光岭的观察者艾莱亚谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Watcher Elaira at the Twilight Ridge in Nagrand.",c="<艾莱亚听你描述搜寻乌鸦之书还有阿尔索恩建议使用鸟类的敏锐视觉来寻找遗失的碎片。>\n\n这是个很棒的主意而且纳格兰的鸟类繁多，但是问题是要使用哪一种鸟呢？",cEN="<Elaira listens as you describe your search for the Book of the Raven and Arthorn's suggestion to use birds to locate the missing pieces of the tablet.>\n\nIt's an excellent idea and Nagrand is teeming with candidates, but which one to use?"}
Q[10987]={d="纳格兰的野生麻鹰是视觉最为敏锐的食肉鸟类。但是由于体型较小，因此受到风鹏的排挤，纳格兰大部分区域已经难寻它们的踪迹。\n\n大多数的麻鹰栖息在暮光岭。如果你能捕获一只麻鹰，我可以训练它去寻找被掩埋的书典残片。\n\n但是捕捉麻鹰并不是件容易的事，它们极易受到惊吓，一旦有陌生人靠近就会立即飞走。我建议你悄悄接近这些敏感的生物，伺机投掷罗网。",dEN="The wild sparrowhawks of Nagrand have the keenest sight of all the predatory birds here. But, because of their size, they've been pushed out of most areas by the larger windrocs.\n\nMost of the sparrowhawks nest here, on the Twilight Ridge. If you can catch one, I'll train it to spot the pieces of your buried tablet.\n\nIt's going to be difficult, though. The sparrowhawks are very skittish and will flee at your approach. I'd suggest cornering one or prowling to get close enough to cast your net.",o="用麻鹰网捕捉一只野生麻鹰，把它交给暮光岭的观察者艾莱亚。",oEN="Use the Sparrowhawk Net to capture a Wild Sparrowhawk and bring it to Watcher Elaira on the Twilight Ridge.",p="你已经抓到麻鹰了吗？",pEN="Did you catch one of the sparrowhawks?",c="做得好！虽然我还在获得麻鹰信赖的阶段，但是我对它们的了解已经足以帮你训练一只麻鹰。",cEN="Well done! I'm still in the process of getting the hawks to trust me, but I know enough about them to train this one for your needs."}
Q[10988]={d="经过训练，这只麻鹰已经能对鸟哨声做出反应了。吹响鸟哨，它就会飞到你身边，指引你寻找书典残片。阿尔索恩捎话过来说，你要找的残片应该都在斯克提斯及其周围的峡谷中，去那里找麻鹰吧。\n\n当你集齐残片后，将鸟哨还给阿尔索恩，她会将这只麻鹰放归大自然的。\n\n代我向阿尔索恩问好。",dEN="I've trained your sparrowhawk to respond to a specific whistle. When it hears the sound, the bird will fly to you and guide you to the location of the nearest tablet fragment. Arthorn sent word that the fragments you're looking for are buried in the Skettis area of southeastern Terokkar Forest, so the bird will wait for you there.\n\nWhen you've gathered all the stones, return the whistle to Arthorn and she will see to the animal's care and release.\n\nConvey my greetings to Arthorn when you see her.",o="在斯克提斯收集8块乌鸦石，把它们交给刀锋山常青林的阿尔索恩·风歌。",oEN="Gather 8 Raven Stones from Skettis and bring them to Arthorn Windsong at Evergrove in Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你收集的碎片够让我重组乌鸦之书了吗？",pEN="Did you recover enough of the Book of the Raven for me to reconstruct it?",c="<阿尔索恩从你手中拿走了乌鸦之书的碎片然后开始重组它们。>\n\n有些字已经磨损了，但是我应该可以辨别大部分的内容……",cEN="<Arthorn accepts the fragments of the Book of the Raven from you and begins piecing them together.>\n\nSome of the characters have been worn away, but I should be able to make out most of this..."}
Q[10989]={d="先知莫格多格在塔顶等你。他让我找一个像你这样的。你去跟他谈谈聪明的事。\n\n现在就去，但别告诉任何人。这是个秘密！ $g你:你; $c",dEN="Mog'dorg the Wizened waits for you at top of da tower. He tells me to look for a <race> <class> just like you. You go speak with him about smart things.\n\nGo now, but don't tell no one. It's a secret!",o="与枯瘦的莫戈多格谈一谈，他在刀锋山的鲜血之环外，卓尔特身旁的塔顶上。",oEN="Speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened atop the tower where Chort is standing, just outside the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="终于，丘特派来的人里头有人看起来可以帮的上我的忙。我正在设法拯救血槌氏族免于被刀塔氏族消灭，而格鲁尔之子一直在支持着刀塔氏族。\n\n我相信你可以协助我们的秘密组织并且帮助我们的族人获得自由。",cEN="Finally, Chort has sent me someone who looks like they might be able to help. I am trying to save the Bloodmaul from annihilation by the Bladespire clan, and Gruul's sons, who are backing them.\n\nI trust that you will be the one to aid our secret society and deliver us into freedom."}
Q[10990]={d="《乌鸦之书》告诉我们，乌鸦的追随者捕获了对手的灵魂，并将它们束缚在石制神龛之中。每座神龛都设有一名守卫看管，以防乌鸦的敌人试图释放他们。\n\n第一座神龛属于鹰，位于泰罗卡森林朱恩湖以南、碎石堡以西的丘陵中。\n\n石板上说，鹰奋力而战，却被一群敌人压倒。你的熊形态的护甲与耐力正适合这场战斗。",dEN="The Book of the Raven tells us the raven's followers captured and bound the spirits of his rivals within stone shrines. A guardian was set to watch over each, lest the raven's enemies attempt to free them.\n\nThe first of the shrines is the eagle's, found in the hills to the south of Lake Jorune and west of Stonebreaker Hold in Terokkar Forest.\n\nThe tablet says that the eagle fought valiantly, but was overcome by a swarm of enemies. The armor and endurance of your bear form is well-suited to this fight.",o="击败雄鹰守护者，取得雄鹰精华。使用阿尔索恩的麻鹰哨以召唤麻鹰传递你获胜的消息。\n\n如果你弄丢了阿尔索恩的麻鹰哨，可以回到常青林找阿尔索恩·风歌再拿一个。",oEN="Defeat the Guardian of the Eagle and obtain the Essence of the Eagle. Use Arthorn's Sparrowhawk Whistle to call Arthorn's Sparrowhawk to relay news of your success.\n\nIf you lose Arthorn's Sparrowhawk Whistle, return to Arthorn Windsong at the Evergrove for a replacement.",p="<麻鹰似乎用阿尔索恩的声音说话。>\n\n你已经成功的释放雄鹰灵魂的精华了吗？",pEN="<The sparrowhawk seems to speak with Arthorn's voice.>\n\nDid you succeed in freeing the essence of the eagle spirit?",c="<阿尔索恩似乎通过麻鹰的感知感觉到取回的精华力量。>\n\n即使经过了数千年的束缚，雄鹰的力量依然惊人。假如其它的精华也像雄鹰的一样强大，乌鸦之神将会对你感到畏惧。",cEN="<Arthorn seems to feel the power in the recovered essence through the sparrowhawk's senses.>\n\nEven after thousands of years of captivity, the eagle's power remains strong. If the other essences are as strong as the eagle's, the raven god will be right to fear you."}
Q[10991]={d="<麻鹰口中传出阿尔索恩的声音。>\n\n崇拜乌鸦之神的鸦人们还封印了猎鹰精华。\n\n它被禁锢在斯克提斯附近的神殿中，昭示着乌鸦祭司那叱诧风云的辉煌岁月。\n\n那座神殿就在斯克提斯西北方的艾雷诺湖岸边。\n\n要战胜猎鹰守护者，你必须借助猎鹰的力量。在猎豹形态下，利用你的速度和敏捷，趁守护者恢复能力之前击败他！",dEN="<The bird speaks with Arthorn's voice.>\n\nThe second spirit bound by the raven's followers was the falcon.\n\nIt was subdued and imprisoned close to Skettis as a reminder to the raven-priests when they held power.\n\nOn the shores of Lake Ere'Noru, to the northwest of Skettis, you'll find the falcon's shrine.\n\nTo overcome the falcon's guardian, you'll need to use the falcon's strengths to your advantage. Use the speed and grace of your cat form to defeat the guardian before it reaches full strength!",o="击败猎鹰守护者，取得猎鹰精华。使用阿尔索恩的麻鹰哨以召唤麻鹰传递你获胜的消息。\n\n如果你弄丢了阿尔索恩的麻鹰哨，可以回到常青林找阿尔索恩·风歌再拿一个。",oEN="Defeat the Guardian of the Falcon, obtain the Essence of the Falcon. Use Arthorn's Sparrowhawk Whistle to call Arthorn's Sparrowhawk to relay news of your success.\n\nIf you lose Arthorn's Sparrowhawk Whistle, return to Arthorn Windsong at the Evergrove for a replacement.",p="<阿尔索恩的声音又一次由麻鹰发出。>\n\n你已经取得猎鹰的精华了吗？",pEN="<Once again, Arthorn's voice issues from the sparrowhawk.>\n\nDo you have the falcon's essence?",c="<雀鹰忠实地传达着阿尔索恩的话。>\n\n干得好，。我本担心猎鹰的囚牢已在奥金尼的爆炸中被毁。我们就快准备好直面安苏了，。我很想和你同去，亲眼看着这个自封的「神」被丢回孕育他的深渊！\"\" <name><name>",cEN="<The sparrowhawk dutifully conveys Arthorn's words.>\n\nWell done, <name>. I'd feared that the falcon's prison had been destroyed in the explosion of Auchindoun. We're almost prepared to confront Anzu, <name>. I'd love to go with you, to be there when this self-styled \"god\" is cast back into the pit that spawned him!"}
Q[10992]={d="<阿尔索恩的声音向你传来。>\n\n《乌鸦之书》中提到的最后一位、也是最强大的一位灵魂，是鹰的灵魂。它被囚禁在远离斯克提斯的地方，在奥金尼东南方一座偏远小岛上的神龛里。\n\n我相信这一描述最符合我们称之为哀翼角的那座岛。\n\n石板上把鹰的守卫描述为几乎对这只鸟的利爪免疫。放弃物理攻击，召下群星的怒火来击败这个敌人。不要重蹈鹰的覆辙。",dEN="<Arthorn's voice addresses you.>\n\nThe last, and strongest, of the spirits spoken of in the Book of the Raven is that of the hawk. It was imprisoned far from Skettis, in a shrine on a remote island southeast of Auchindoun.\n\nI believe this description best matches the island we know as Sorrow Wing Point.\n\nThe tablet describes the hawk's guardian as nearly invulnerable to the bird's claws. Forsake physical attacks and call down the fury of the stars to defeat this foe. Do not repeat the hawk's mistake.",o="击败山鹰守护者，将山鹰精华交给常青林的阿尔索恩·风歌。",oEN="Defeat the Guardian of the Hawk and bring the Essence of the Hawk to Arthorn Windsong at the Evergrove.",p="你已经战胜山鹰守护者并取得它的精华了吗？",pEN="Did you overcome the hawk's guardian and win its essence?",c="既然我们拥有全部的精华，莫希斯·轻翼就必须找到一个方法将它们合成一个符咒让你对付乌鸦之神，将他从翡翠梦境中引诱出来并且击败他。我会通过灵魂们传送我的意思给乌鸦之神，希望他了解我理论的重要性。\n\n每一个灵魂都会受到和我给你的符咒一样的祝福。",cEN="Now that we have all the essences, Morthis Whisperwing must find a way to combine them into an amulet that you'll be able to use to challenge the raven god, draw him out of the Emerald Dream and defeat him. I'll be sending him my notes on the spirits with the hope that he'll realize the value of my insight.\n\nEach of the spirits has blessed a charm I've prepared for you."}
Q[10993]={d="将这些精华交给莫希斯·轻翼，并告诉他我们收集到的关于鸦神的新情报。\n\n莫希斯懂得如何利用这些精华引出鸦神安苏。快去找他吧，不知道克林塔尔和梦境守卫者还能在鸦神的攻击下坚持多久！\n\n<在你准备转身离开的时候，阿尔索恩抓住了你的手臂。>\n\n$n，拜托你告诉莫希斯，我帮你了多大的忙。我担心他不知道我为此做出的贡献！",dEN="Bring the essences to Morthis Whisperwing, along with word of our findings about the raven god.\n\nMorthis will know best how to use the essences and information in drawing Anzu out into the open. Make your way to him quickly, for there's no telling how long Clintar and the dreamwardens can withstand the raven's assault!\n\n<Arthorn grabs your arm before you turn to leave>.\n\nPlease, <name>, tell Morthis how much of a help I've been to you. I fear he will not see my hand in this work!",o="将阿尔索恩的包裹交给塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼。",oEN="Bring Arthorn's Package to Morthis Whisperwing at Cenarion Refuge.",p="我一直在等阿尔索恩的消息。你们发现了什么呢？",pEN="I've been waiting for word from Arthorn. What have you discovered?",c="<莫希斯收下了包裹，打开并且取出阿尔索恩的笔记。他读完了这些笔记，并未对作者做出任何评论。>\n\n以某种程度上来说，终于知道敌人的真面目让我松了一口气，但是这个安苏拥有相当强大的力量。了解敌人的名称与实力是很重要的，但是我们还没准备好面对他。",cEN="<Morthis accepts the package, opens it to discover Arthorn's notes, and reads over them without commenting on the author.>\n\nOn one level, I'm relieved to finally know the identity of our enemy, but this Anzu is a being of considerable power. Knowing the nature and the name of your adversary is vital, but we are not yet ready to face him."}
Q[10994]={d="如果把这些精华结合到一颗稀有宝石里，比如一枚南怒月石，等你$g准备:准备;好挑战安苏时，就能把它们释放出来。\n唯一的问题是，南怒月石只生长在艾萨拉一侧的河边，以及靠近河流源头的崖壁上。\n最后一批前去寻找月石的暗夜精灵队伍遭遇了悲剧。\n他们的船至今仍停泊在河中、他们望见月石的地方附近。\n睁大眼睛，从艾萨拉一侧走陆路靠近那里。",dEN="If the essences are combined within a rare gemstone such as a Southfury moonstone, you'll be able to release them when you're prepared to challenge Anzu.\n\nThe only problem is that Southfury moonstones are only found on the Azshara side of the river, on the cliffs near the river's source.\n\nTragedy befell the last night elf party that sought the stone. Their boat is still anchored in the river near where they sighted the moonstone. Keep your eyes open and approach the site by land from the Azshara side.",o="将一块南国之怒月亮石交给塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼。",oEN="Bring a Southfury Moonstone to Morthis Whisperwing at the Cenarion Refuge.",p="看起来你经过了重重考验才来到这里。寻找月亮石真的那么难吗？",pEN="You look like you've been through quite an ordeal. Was the moonstone really that hard to find?",c="<莫希斯的眼神泛着泪光，同时对你所描述的寻找历程以及想起你几乎要失去月亮石的经过感到好笑。他整理一下自己的情绪然后注视着这个发光的石头。>\n\n我要开始将那些鸟类的灵魂精华注入月亮石。不久之后你就可以准备好挑战我们的敌人了。",cEN="<Morthis seems torn, at once desiring to laugh at your story, and mindful of how close you came to losing the moonstone. He settles for staring at the glowing stone.>\n\nI'll get to work on infusing it with the bird spirit essences. Soon, you'll be prepared to challenge our enemy."}
Q[10995]={d="诅咒洞窟就在东边巨龙之末的边界。当前，格鲁尔之子格鲁洛克正在那里密谋着他那愚蠢的计划。\n\n不过，我听说他有一件重要财产被人用诡计偷走了，是不是你干的？真不错，唯一的遗憾是他居然没被杀掉。\n\n如果我们想要重获自由，你还得去把他另一件最珍贵的财产给我夺回来。那就是他的父亲在与黑龙军团作战时得到的巨龙颅骨，后来他的父亲把那东西赏赐给了他。而得到这个巨龙颅骨的唯一办法，就是杀死他。",dEN="To the east, at the terminus of Dragons' End, is the Cursed Hollow. Therein, Grulloc, son of Gruul, plots his dimwitted schemes.\n\nI heard that one of his possessions was stolen from him through trickery. Was that you? Unfortunate that he was not slain in the process.\n\nIf we are to regain our freedom, I would have you take his most prized possession, a dragon skull from when he rejoiced in his father's slaying of the black dragonflight. The only way you'll get the skull is to vanquish him.",o="夺回格鲁洛克的巨龙颅骨，将其交给刀锋山鲜血之环塔顶上的枯瘦的莫戈多格。",oEN="Collect Grulloc's Dragon Skull.",p="格鲁洛克已经死了吗？",pEN="Is Grulloc no more?",c="确实，那一定是一场苦战，<class>。\n想到他不会再在这里盯着我们，我大大松了一口气。我会把这个颅骨送到乔特那里妥善保管。\n我开始觉得，有你的帮助，我们也许真能办成这件事。",cEN="Indeed, it must have been a difficult struggle, <class>. I feel greatly relieved now that he will not be breathing down our necks here.\n\nI will send this skull down to Chort for safekeeping. I'm beginning to think that with your help, we might just pull this off."}
Q[10996]={d="玛古克一般在东南边的剃刀山上巡逻，那是因为他的父亲派他去看守东边的山脉。他非常喜欢去威胁那些妨碍到他的生物。\n\n因为他是格鲁尔的儿子，所以，如果我们想要继续活下来，他就必须被消灭，而你将负责执行这一任务。\n\n玛古克一直随身带着一只宝箱，你记得把箱子带回来给我，以证明你确实把他干掉了。当然，箱子里的东西你可以随意处置。",dEN="On the Razor Ridge, above and to the southeast, Maggoc patrols. His father assigned him as the warden of the eastern mountain range, and he revels in terrorizing any creature that gets in his way.\n\nAs a son of Gruul, he must be done away with if my clan is to survive. That's where you come in.\n\nMaggoc carries a treasure chest with him at all times. Prove to me that he has been slain by bringing me his precious chest. Feel free to keep whatever you find within it.",o="夺取玛古克的宝箱。",oEN="Collect Maggoc's Treasure Chest.",p="你取得宝箱了吗？",pEN="Do you have the chest?",c="你说箱子里面是空的？真可惜，但是你可以由此得知我们在对抗的这种残忍暴行。\n\n随着玛古克的死亡，我们已经越来越接近实现我的梦想，一个可以让我们决定自己命运的食人魔家园。",cEN="You say it was empty? Unfortunate, but you can see the mindless brutality that we're up against.\n\nWith the fall of Maggoc, we are one step closer to realizing my dream of a home for the ogres where we can determine our own destiny."}
Q[10997]={d="你熟悉沙塔斯城吗，$c？在它的西北边有个地方叫壁垒山，进去的唯一途径是乘坐飞行坐骑。\n\n格鲁尔的一个儿子斯莱格控制了居住在那里的戈杜尼食人魔。虽然他们距离我们的确非常遥远，但我们也不能让他有好日子过，否则他在知道其馀的兄弟被杀害之后，很可能会回来给我们制造麻烦。\n\n$n，你赶紧到那里去干掉他，将他的军旗带回来，作为他死亡的证明。",dEN="Are you familiar with Shattrath City, <class>? Above it to the northwest is a place called the Barrier Hills, which you can only get to upon a flying mount.\n\nOne of Gruul's sons, Slaag, exiled himself and took control of the Gordunni ogres that reside there. Even at such a distance, we cannot afford to leave him in peace, lest he return when the rest of his brothers have been slain.\n\n<name>, you must travel there, and bring back his standard as proof that he has been dealt with.",o="夺取斯莱格的军旗。",oEN="Collect Slaag's Standard.",p="你把斯莱格的军旗带回来了吗？",pEN="Do you return with Slaag's standard in hand?",c="斯拉格走了，真是让人松口气。我们再也不用担心他卷土重来的阴影了！如果你不介意，我要把这面战旗带走，作为山里所有食人魔希望的象征。谢谢你，<name>。\n\n\n\n",cEN="What a relief that Slaag is gone. No longer will we be threatened by the looming specter of his return!\n\nIf you do not mind, I will take the standard as a symbol of hope for all of the ogres of the mountains.\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[10998]={d="还有一个格隆要杀：碎颅者斯库洛克。\n他把自己藏了起来，不过有办法把他引出来。\n他曾跟随一位名叫邪恶的维姆戈尔的食人魔法师学习。关键是要拿到他的法术书。\n必须在维姆戈尔之环的火圈内站立才能召唤他。\n你会在东北方群山之中、破碎荒野以南找到维姆戈尔之环。",dEN="There is one more gronn to be slain: Skulloc Soulgrinder. He keeps himself hidden away, but there is a way to coax him forth.\n\nHe was trained by an ogre warlock known as Vim'gol the Vile, whose grimoire you must retrieve!\n\nVim'gol must be summoned by standing within a fire ring at his circle. Find Vim'gol's Circle in the mountains, to the northeast, near the Broken Wilds.\n\n<name>, if you hear Vim'gol talk about growing bigger, get people back into each of the five fire rings to interrupt his casting!",o="夺取维姆高尔的魔典。",oEN="Collect Vim'gol's Vile Grimoire.",p="你已经召唤邪恶的维姆高尔并且从他的手中取得魔典了吗？",pEN="Have you summoned forth Vim'gol the Vile and taken the grimoire from his dead clutches?",c="我在想应不应该碰触如此邪恶的东西。然而如果我们想知道其中的记载并且引诱斯古洛克从藏身处现身的话，就必须阅读它。",cEN="I hesitate to even touch such a tainted thing of evil. Yet read it we must if we are to glean what knowledge it contains and bring forth Skulloc from his hiding place."}
Q[11000]={d="魔典是击败斯古洛克的关键之物。\n\n转至磨魂者之穴，大声诵读魔典，启动召唤仪式。仪式中将出现一件名叫磨魂者的物品，与此同时，被斯古洛克残害的灵魂们也会现身，试图毁掉这件物品。你必须阻止他们，让斯古洛克的真身完全被召唤到这个世界。\n\n往北穿越鲜血之环另一边的刃喉谷就能到达磨魂者之穴，就在格鲁尔的巢穴的正前方。\n\n将斯古洛克的灵魂带回来。",dEN="The grimoire is the key to Skulloc's downfall.\n\nRead aloud from the book at Soulgrinder's Barrow to initiate the ritual. An object known as the Soulgrinder will appear, as well as Skulloc's ghostly victims, who will try to destroy it. You must keep them from doing so long enough to force Skulloc fully into the world.\n\nFind the barrow by heading north through the Daggermaw Canyon on the other side of the Circle of Blood. It is on the right side before Gruul's Lair.\n\nBring back Skulloc's soul.",o="夺得斯古洛克的灵魂。",oEN="Collect Skulloc's Soul.",p="你已经取得斯古洛克的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Have you taken Skulloc's soul yet?",c="那就都结束了。\n你把我们从被格鲁尔之子奴役的枷锁中解放了出来。你让血槌氏族免于必然的灭绝。\n言语无法描述刀锋山所有食人魔——无论血槌还是刀锋山——欠你的恩情有多大，<name>。\n往下看，食人魔们此刻正聚集起来向你献上贡品。就让格鲁尔和他的傀儡、老王玛古尔缩在他们的巢穴里发抖吧。\n到下面去见食人魔们，做我们的新国王！",cEN="It is over then. You have freed us from the shackles of our enslavement to the Sons of Gruul. You have given the Bloodmaul Clan a reprieve from certain extinction.\n\nWords cannot describe the extent of the debt that ALL of the ogres of the Blade's Edge Mountains, Bloodmaul and Bladespire alike, owe you, <name>.\n\nLook down, even now the ogres gather to pay you tribute. Let Gruul and his puppet, the old king, Maulgar, cower within their lair. Go to the ogres below as our new king!"}
Q[11001]={d="我们不能再浪费时间对付乌鸦之神了。\n你必须把注入精华的月石带到一个力量强大的地方，把这位神祇从翡翠梦境相对安全的庇护中引出来。\n深入塞泰克大厅，把月石放在乌鸦之爪中。你会在鹰爪之王大厅前的那间密室找到它。\n必须让安苏相信，他的追随者已聚集起来迎接他重返这个世界。\n等他现身之后，绝不要留情！",dEN="We must waste no time in dealing with the raven god. You must take the essence-infused moonstone to a place of great power in order to lure the god from the relative safety of the Emerald Dream.\n\nDescend into the Sethekk Halls and set the moonstone in the clutches of the raven's claw. You'll find it in the chamber before the talon king's hall.\n\nAnzu must be made believe that his followers have gathered to welcome him back into the world. Once he has manifested, show him no mercy!",o="杀死乌鸦之神，然后向塞纳里奥庇护所的莫希斯·轻翼复命。\n\n这项任务必须在英雄难度的地下城中完成。",oEN="Slay the Raven God and return to Morthis Whisperwing at Cenarion Refuge.\n\nThis quest must be completed in Heroic dungeon difficulty.",p="你从塞泰克大厅带来了什么消息呢？你打败安苏了吗？",pEN="What news from Sethekk Halls? Have you defeated Anzu?",c="很高兴再次见到你，<name>。\n你战胜乌鸦之神的功绩，远比我可能给你设下的任何考验或成人仪式更重要。\n你真正证明了，自己配得上利爪德鲁伊守护了无数世代的知识。",cEN="It's good to see you again, <name>. Your triumph over the raven god counts for far more than any test or rite of passage that I might set for you.\n\nYou have truly proven yourself worthy of the knowledge guarded by the Druids of the Talon for countless generations."}
Q[11002]={d="伊利丹·怒风的邪兽人大军源头已被摧毁。那座工厂停止了它那阴森的产出——至少暂时如此。\n剩下的只有几件小饰物和这颗被砍下的头颅——一件配得上英雄的战利品。\n把玛瑟里顿的头颅交还给荣耀堡的达纳斯·托尔贝恩。|n",dEN="The source of Illidan Stormrage's fel orc army has been vanquished. The manufactory halts production of its grim product - at least for now. All that remains are a few trinkets and this severed head - a fitting trophy for a hero.\n\nReturn Magtheridon's head to your factions Commander in Hellfire Peninsula.",o="把玛瑟里顿的头颅交还给地狱火半岛荣耀堡的部队指挥官达纳斯·托尔贝恩。",oEN="Return Magtheridon's Head to your faction's Commander in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="从有记忆开始，这是我第一次感受到了安静。",pEN="For the first time - in as long as I can remember - there is silence.",c="这场失败不只是对伊利丹的打击。燃烧军团也同样踉跄……\n一位深渊领主指挥官被击败了。围攻地狱火堡垒对燃烧军团而言已毫无意义。他们的全部力量无疑都会转向黑暗神殿。\n伊利丹的救赎即将到来……而且很快。",cEN="This defeat is not only a blow to Illidan. The Legion too reels... A pit lord commander has been defeated. The siege of Hellfire Citadel now holds no purpose for the Burning Legion. All of their efforts will undoubtedly be turned upon the Black Temple.\n\nRedemption comes for Illidan... and soon."}
Q[11003]={d="伊利丹·怒风的邪兽人大军源头已被摧毁。那座工厂停止了它那阴森的产出——至少暂时如此。\n剩下的只有几件破烂和这颗被砍下的头颅——一件配得上部落英雄的战利品。\n把玛瑟里顿的头颅交还给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。|n",dEN="The source of Illidan Stormrage's fel orc army has been vanquished. The manufactory halts production of its grim product - at least for now. All that remains are a few trinkets and this severed head - a fitting trophy for a hero of the Horde.\n\nReturn Magtheridon's head to Nazgrel at Thrallmar.",o="将玛瑟里顿的徽记交给萨尔玛的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Return Magtheridon's Head to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="从有记忆开始，这是我第一次感受到了安静。",pEN="For the first time - in as long as I can remember - there is silence.",c="这场失败不只是对伊利丹的打击。燃烧军团也同样踉跄……\n一位深渊领主指挥官被击败了。围攻地狱火堡垒对燃烧军团而言已毫无意义。他们的全部力量无疑都会转向黑暗神殿。\n伊利丹的救赎即将到来……而且很快。",cEN="This defeat is not only a blow to Illidan. The Legion too reels... A pit lord commander has been defeated. The siege of Hellfire Citadel now holds no purpose for the Burning Legion. All of their efforts will undoubtedly be turned upon the Black Temple.\n\nRedemption comes for Illidan... and soon."}
Q[11004]={d="天空指挥官阿达里斯在斯克提斯的一次突袭中受了重伤。从那以后他就时醒时昏。\n我担心他已经陷入了高热谵妄。在短暂的清醒时刻，他要求我配制一种用鸦人携带的暗影之尘制成的药剂。\n他似乎相信那能让他看进一个暗影世界，鸦人真正的首领就住在那里。\n我一点也不信这套胡话，但我担心在弄到这种药剂之前他不会安分。你愿意帮我吗？\n\"\"",dEN="Sky Commander Adaris was seriously injured during a Skettis incursion. He's been in and out of consciousness since.\n\nI fear he has succumbed to a feverish delirium. During brief lucid moments he demands that I prepare an elixir made from shadow dust carried by the arakkoa. He seems to believe it will allow him to see into a \"world of shadows\" where the arakkoa's true leaders dwell.\n\nI do not believe this nonsense for a second, but I fear he won't rest until I obtain such an elixir. Will you help?",o="瑟维里要你进入斯克提斯，从居住在那里的鸦人身上找到6份暗影之尘。",oEN="Severin wants you to venture into Skettis and retrieve 6 Shadow Dusts from the arakkoa that dwell there.",p="你拿到那些尘了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the dust, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。我会给指挥官用一小份……顺着他的意思。剩下的你留着吧，也许你能派上用场。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. I will administer a small amount to the commander... to humor him. You can keep the rest, perhaps you'll find a use for it."}
Q[11005]={d="谢谢你把我的胡言乱语记在心上。一直以来，我们都在千方百计地想要粉碎斯克提斯的统治。现在，我们已经得知三位被称为鸦爪祭司的牧师负责统领整个斯克提斯，不过，从来没有人能够亲眼见过他们——现在我们已经知道为什么会这样了。\n\n跟瑟维里谈谈，利用他发现的药剂找到并杀死伊沙尔、斯卡基克和塞尔利克三位鸦爪祭司。有传言说，他们就居住在黑风湖东岸的奥拉克鸦巢。",dEN="Thank you for paying heed to my fevered rants. All along we had been trying to identify and destroy the Skettis chain of command; we had learned of three clerics known as the talonpriests, but we'd never seen them with our own two eyes. Now we know why.\n\nTalk to Severin to obtain more of the elixir he discovered. Use the elixir to find and kill the three talonpriests: Ishaal, Skizzik and Zellek. They're rumored to dwell in Veil Ala'rak, near the eastern shore of Blackwind Lake.",o="从瑟维里那儿获取暗影药剂。转至斯克提斯，利用暗影药剂找到并杀死伊沙尔、斯卡基克和塞尔利克三位鸦爪祭司。完成任务后向空军指挥官阿达利斯复命。",oEN="Obtain an Elixir of Shadows from Severin and use it to find and slay Talonpriest Ishaal, Talonpriest Skizzik and Talonpriest Zellek in Skettis. Return to Commander Adaris after completing this task.",p="事情办好了吗，<name>？要不是我身上有伤，我会亲手宰了那些该死的鸟人。",pEN="Is the deed done, <name>? I'd kill those blasted birdmen myself if it weren't for my injuries.",c="你做得很好，<name>。你杀掉那些利爪祭司，给了敌人沉重一击。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You've dealt a tremendous blow to the enemy by slaying the talonpriests."}
Q[11006]={p="看来指挥官并不是胡言乱语。交给我更多的暗影之尘，我就给你另一份药剂。",pEN="It looks like the commander was not delirious after all. Bring me more dust and I'll prepare another elixir for you.",c="继续把暗影之尘交给我。你要多少药剂我都可以给你。\n\n这是指挥官的命令。",cEN="Keep bringing the dust to me. I'll prepare as many elixirs as you need.\n\nCommander's orders."}
Q[11007]={d="耳畔传来轻柔的歌唱声，纳鲁知道你已经获胜。你仿佛听见他们的指示，俯身从凯尔萨斯·逐日者尚在抽搐的尸体上拾起了这块翠绿的魔珠。这东西蕴藏着什么秘密？\n\n或许沙塔斯城的阿达尔知晓内情。",dEN="The air around you hums - a gentle hum. The naaru are aware of your victory. Perhaps they are the reason you were compelled to pick up this sphere from the still-twitching remains of Kael'thas Sunstrider. What secrets could it hold?\n\nPerhaps A'dal in Shattrath City could make sense of the item.",o="将翠绿的魔珠交给沙塔斯城的阿达尔。",oEN="Take the Verdant Sphere to A'dal in Shattrath City.",p="你听见我的呼唤了吗？是的……",pEN="You heard my call? Yes...",c="<阿达尔的思想与你合而为一。>\n\n那个球体……奇怪。你知道他还活着吗？是的。他就在这里——球体的里面。当然他受了很重的伤。他现在呼唤了一股更强大的力量。不，不是伊利丹。\n\n更强大的力量。\n\n欺诈者基尔加丹来了……\n\n不是来这里……\n\n<阿达尔在你的脑海中指示着另一个地方。>\n\n艾泽拉斯。不明地点。\n\n休息一下吧。现在你的兄弟和姐妹们将会重新夺回风暴要塞。\n\n<阿达尔哼起了战斗之歌。>",cEN="<A'dal's thoughts intermingle with your own.>\n\nThe sphere... Strange. Did you know that he lived? Yes. It is here - in the sphere itself. Maimed for certain. He calls to a higher power now. No, not Illidan.\n\nHigher.\n\nKil'jaeden the Deceiver comes...\n\nNot here...\n\n<A'dal points your mind elsewhere.>\n\nAzeroth. Unknown.\n\nRest. Your brothers and sisters will retake Tempest Keep now.\n\n<A'dal hums a song of battle.>"}
Q[11008]={d="你觉得你能成为一个空中卫队的成员？那我们必须瞧瞧你在空中应对敌人的本事如何。\n\n鸦人饲养了一大群不同种类的宠物，用来攻击我们的斥候。我希望你将这些炸弹带去，炸掉鸦人巢穴上面的孵化场。小心看守孵化场的巨型卡利鸟，它们会抓住你稍微走神的瞬间，毫不留情地将你从坐骑上击落。",dEN="You think you have what it takes to be part of the Skyguard? We'll have to see how you handle yerself in the air.\n\nThe arakkoa are breeding a gargantuan variety of their attack pets and are using it against our scouts. I want you to take these blasting charges and use them to destroy hatcheries above the arakkoa's dwellings. Avoid the monstrous kaliri guarding the hatcheries. They'll knock you off your mount before you know what hit you.",o="找到斯克提斯巢穴上面的巨大的卡利鸟蛋，利用天空卫队的炸弹毁掉它们。完成任务之后回去向空军上尉杜尔因复命。",oEN="Seek out Monstrous Kaliri Eggs on the tops of Skettis dwellings and use the Skyguard Blasting Charges on them. Return to Sky Sergeant Doryn.",p="你的工作完成了没？",pEN="Did you finish your assignment yet?",c="干得太棒了，<name>！这会让那些鸟人明白什么叫制空权！",cEN="Excellent job, <name>! That'll show those bird men the meaning of air superiority!"}
Q[11009]={d="在你的帮助下，血槌食人魔摆脱了被奴役的命运，现在我们要重新统一各食人魔氏族。这是一项艰苦而漫长的使命，诸氏族之间的仇恨是很难化解的。\n\n不过，眼下有件更为紧迫的事要交给你去做，请你立刻转至西边高地上的奥格瑞拉。你必须保护奥格瑞拉免受虚灵、恶魔和黑龙的袭击，就像戈隆曾经保护我们那样。\n\n当你到达奥格瑞拉后，去找库洛尔谈谈吧。",dEN="Now that you have delivered us from bondage, we can begin the process of reunifying the clans. This will take some time; old grudges are difficult to overcome.\n\nBut more pressing, you must go to Ogri'la in the heavens above to the west. You must defend it, and us, from those forces above that the gronn used to protect us from: ethereals, demons, and worst of all, the black dragonflight.\n\nWhen you find ogre heaven, seek out the wisdom of Chu'a'lor on how best to proceed.",o="与刀锋山奥格瑞拉的库洛尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Chu'a'lor at Ogri'la in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="莫格多格提前捎了信来，说我会等到你。我很高兴你来了。既然格鲁尔之子已被摧毁，这座山间台地以及北边那座的各色居民，决定来劫掠我们下面那些食人魔兄弟，就只是时间问题了——而且时间不会太长。我相信你会帮我们阻止这一切。\n\n\n\n",cEN="Mog'dorg sent a message ahead, saying that I should expect you. I am glad that you came.\n\nWith the Sons of Gruul destroyed, it is only a matter of time - a short amount at that - before the various inhabitants of this mountain terrace, and the one to the north, decide to prey upon our ogre brothers down below.\n\nI trust that you will help us to prevent that,\n."}
Q[11010]={d="你有飞行坐骑……这也值得炫耀？你以为自己能熟练驾驭飞行坐骑？\n\n北面的铸魔营地：天罚和南面的铸魔营地：恐怖是我的心腹之患，同样它们也对爱好和平的奥格瑞拉构成了威胁。在邪能火炮的攻击下，天空卫士伤亡惨重，根本无法侦察敌情。\n\n想要证明自己的实力吗？带上这些炸弹，瞄准铸魔营地的邪能炮弹堆投掷吧！当心别被炮弹击中！",dEN="You have a flying mount... so what! You think you have what it takes to use it properly?\n\nForge Camp: Wrath and Forge Camp: Terror, to the north and south, are a major pain in my backside, as well as being a threat to peaceful Ogri'la. With all of those fel cannons shooting down the Skyguard left and right, we can't get through there to take care of business.\n\nYou want to prove yourself? Take these bombs and knock out their ammo stacks. Just don't let them shoot you down, too!",o="使用天空卫队炸弹炸毁15堆邪能炮弹。",oEN="Use the Skyguard Bombs to destroy 15 Fel Cannonball Stacks.",p="你用炸弹炸掉他们的炮弹堆了吗？",pEN="You take out their stacks of fel cannonballs yet?",c="哎呀呀，看来你终究还是有几分本事。\n干得好。也许老凯勒终究看错你了。\n<天空中士范德利普得意地笑了笑。>",cEN="Well, well, well, I guess you had it in you after all. Good work. Maybe Old Man Keller was wrong about you after all.\n\n<Sky Sergeant Vanderlip smirks.>"}
Q[11011]={d="你击败了鸦神安苏，这真是了不起的成就。不过，我认为他肯定不肯善罢甘休，并且会再找机会返回外域。\n\n只要鸦神的追随者还在，他就可能死灰复燃。收下这颗灌注精华的月亮石以防万一吧。",dEN="Your defeat of Anzu, the raven god, is truly a remarkable accomplishment. He may not abandon his quest to return to Outland, I fear.\n\nAs long as he has followers here, he will attempt to rise again. Keep the essence-infused moonstone with you in case we have not heard the last of Anzu.",o="与莫希斯·轻翼谈谈，获得一颗灌注精华的月亮石。",oEN="Speak with Morthis Whisperwing to receive an Essence-Infused Moonstone.",c="把月石留在身上，<name>。要是你怀疑安苏正在积蓄力量、试图再次回到这个世界，就用它再一次击败他。",cEN="Keep the moonstone with you, <name>. If you suspect that Anzu is gathering his strength to attempt another return to this world, use it to defeat him once again."}
Q[11012]={c="我们失去了土地。我们的孩子在夜晚被偷走，被迫成为奴隶——或是更糟……\n\n<摩德奈的声音紧绷。>\n\n是时候了，我的盟友。是时候让我们夺回原本属于我们的东西！你已证明自己是个有能力的战士并有怜悯的灵魂。\n\n你愿意誓死协助灵翼之龙军团夺回我们的土地并重建我们的家园吗？你愿意誓死看守飞行军队并让血统重生吗？立下这个誓约让我们为我们的家园和挚爱的人奋战！",cEN="Our lands are lost. Our children stolen in the night, forced into slavery - or worse...\n\n<Mordenai's voice tenses.>\n\nThe time is now, my ally. The time to retake what was once ours has come! You have proven yourself a capable combatant and compassionate soul.\n\nWill you swear to assist the Netherwing Dragonflight in retaking our lands and rebuilding our homes? Will you swear to watch over the flight and allow the bloodline to be born anew? Swear this and let us battle for our home and our loved ones!"}
Q[11013]={d="灵翼浮岛……那本是灵翼龙族的避难所，如今却沦为龙喉氏族横行之地。虽然兽人们侵占了我们的领地，可是他们无法削弱龙族强大的魔法力量。凭借这种力量，我们可以掩盖你的真实身份，帮助你安全混入龙喉氏族。\n\n我已经备好一封书信，我要你飞往龙喉营地，将它交给莫格霍尔大王。届时，你将以伊利丹·怒风麾下一名邪兽人的身份开始新的生活。",dEN="Netherwing Ledge... What was once a bastion of sanctuary for the Netherwing is now home to the Dragonmaw. While the orcs may have control of our territory, our magic there is still strong. Strong enough to cloak your true identity and allow you to infiltrate the ranks of Dragonmaw.\n\nI have prepared this letter for you to present to their leader, Overlord Mor'ghor. Fly headlong into the maw of our enemy and seek out Dragonmaw Base Camp to start your new life as a fel orc of Illidan Stormrage.",o="前往灵翼岩架，把伊利达雷服役文书交给龙喉营地的领主莫格霍尔。|n",oEN="Travel to Netherwing Ledge and deliver the Illidari Service Papers to Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp.",p="<莫格霍尔嘟囔着。>\n\n你迟到了……",pEN="<Mor'ghor grunts.>\n\nYou're late...",c="<莫格霍尔读了信大笑起来。>\n\n死亡骑士？你连死亡骑士的靴子都没办法擦亮，废物。\n\n<莫格霍尔仔细地打量你。>\n\n但是好像……你或许可以当个苦工。如果连这都干不好的话我就把你丢进深渊让你自生自灭……",cEN="<Mor'ghor reads the letter and laughs.>\n\nA death knight? You couldn't shine the boots of a death knight, maggot.\n\n<Mor'ghor looks you over.>\n\nBut yes... You might be able to work your way up to peon. At the worst, I'll toss you into the pit and leave you to die..."}
Q[11014]={d="<莫格霍尔将服役文书揉成一团，随手扔到一旁。>\n\n好吧，重要的事先说。想加入我统率的龙喉军团，你就得干活——谁也不能例外。去找点事做吧，别搞砸了。我会根据你的表现决定要不要再派你做些别的事。\n\n与龙喉营地中心的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息谈一谈。他会根据你的技能，为你安排适当的差事。\n\n好了，滚吧！",dEN="<Mor'ghor crumples up the service letter and tosses it aside.>\n\nAlright grunt, first things first. If you're gonna join my beloved Dragonmaw army, you'll need to work. Everyone works up here on the ledge. Get a job and don't screw it up and I'll see if there might be something more interesting for you to do later.\n\nGo talk to Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath. He's standin' in the middle of town. He'll assess your skills and assign work as he sees fit.\n\nNow get out of my face!",o="与龙喉营地的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at Dragonmaw Base Camp.",c="瓦尔库勒会帮你找个好工作的，苦工。你可以获得一个最适合你技能的工作和灵翼水晶。你必须每天填一次你的工作令。\n\n是的，就是做一堆狗屁工作，不过就连卓越者也都是从苦工做起。",cEN="Varkule gonna set you up right, grunt. You get your choice of one job best suited to your skills and Netherwing crystal collection. You'll be required to fill your work orders once per day.\n\nYeah, it's a bunch of crap jobs but even the ascendants started out as peons."}
Q[11015]={d="啥都不擅长？没关系。就算是你这种笨蛋，在这儿也能派上用场。只要去岩架上找生物杀掉就行。有时候它们的尸骸上会带着虚空水晶。收集那些东西带回来给我，我就算你今天的工单完成了。|n",dEN="No good at nothin'? That's fine. Even lunkheads like you can be used around here. Just find creatures on the ledge and kill 'em. Sometimes they'll have nether crystals on their carcasses. Gather those and bring 'em back to me and I'll consider your work order for the day complete.",o="将30块灵翼水晶交给影月谷龙喉营地的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息。",oEN="Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 30 Netherwing Crystals.",p="灵翼水晶有很多用处。主要是用来制造武器和护甲……",pEN="Nether crystals are used for lots of things. Mainly makin' weapons and armor...",c="今天就到这里吧，孩子。明天如果你还活着再来找我。",cEN="You're done for today, kid. Come back tomorrow if you're still alive."}
Q[11016]={d="嗯，剥皮师？这儿可是剥皮师的天堂啊！猎杀水晶蔟附近的剥石者，替我收集一些虚空矿洞剥石者的外皮。",dEN="A skinner, eh? Well you'll find plenty to skin here! You gotta search for flayers around crystal formations. Take 'em down and take their hides. Sometimes they'll have a hide worth keepin'. Bring those to me.",o="将35张虚空矿洞剥石者的外皮交给影月谷龙喉营地的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息。",oEN="Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 35 Nethermine Flayer Hides.",p="我们拿剥石者皮革来制作护甲内衬和建筑陷阱。",pEN="We use the flayer hides for armor lining and structural tarps.",c="今天就到这里吧，孩子。明天如果你还活着再来找我。",cEN="You're done for today, kid. Come back tomorrow if you're still alive."}
Q[11017]={d="采药者？！很有趣的营生啊……我们的法师和萨满祭司正好需要你的帮助。灵翼浮岛上的灵尘灌木拥有奇异的花粉，对他们研究魔法很有帮助。替我收集一些灵尘花粉，今天的任务就算完成了。",dEN="A flower picker?! Hilarious... Unfortunately, our mages and shaman need your services. The netherdust bushes that grow on this ledge have special pollen that is apparently very useful in their magical dealings. Bring me that stuff and I'll consider your work order complete.",o="将40份灵尘花粉交给影月谷龙喉营地的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息。",oEN="Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 40 Netherdust Pollen.",p="像我说的，虚空之尘花粉是我们法术施放者使用的东西。",pEN="Like I said, netherdust pollen is used by our spell casters.",c="今天就到这里吧，孩子。明天如果你还活着再来找我。",cEN="You're done for today, kid. Come back tomorrow if you're still alive."}
Q[11018]={d="矿工！\n\n<瓦尔库勒向你敬礼。>\n\n咱们真是志趣相投！瓦尔库勒也是一名矿工！没有什么比蓬头垢面地挖掘矿脉更有趣的事了，对吧？\n\n寻找虚空矿脉，替我收集一些虚空矿石。",dEN="A miner!\n\n<Varkule salutes.>\n\nAn orc after my own heart! That's how Varkule got his start - minin'! There ain't nothin' better than getting down and dirty in the mines, is there?\n\nNow get out there and find those nethercite deposits. Strip 'em for all their worth and bring me back the ore.",o="将40块虚空矿石交给影月谷龙喉营地的工头瓦尔库勒·龙息。",oEN="Taskmaster Varkule Dragonbreath at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 40 Nethercite Ore.",p="在那里的贾格会用矿石来加强我们的武器和护甲。",pEN="Gug over there is gonna use the ore to reinforce our weapons and armor.",c="今天就到这里吧，孩子。明天如果你还活着再来找我。",cEN="You're done for today, kid. Come back tomorrow if you're still alive."}
Q[11019]={c="你该不会以为我们会让你一个人去面对那支邪兽人大军吧？<亚兹尔的双眼闪烁着半透明的蓝色光芒。>没错，我们就在你身边，<name>。在你要夺回灵翼土地的使命中，你每为邪兽人做一件事，我们就守在你身旁，确保他们遭受足够的挫折。在你执行破坏任务时，你得保持低调，别引来多余的注意。\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="Didn't think we'd leave you to face the fel orc army by yourself, did you?\n\n<Yarzill's eyes flicker a translucent blue.>\n\nAye, we are here with you, <name>. For every service you perform for the fel orcs in your quest to reclaim Netherwing lands, we'll be at your side to make sure that they suffer a sufficient setback.\n\nYou'll need to keep a low profile so as not to draw any unwanted attention to yourself during your sabotage missions."}
Q[11020]={d="龙喉兽人几乎在每丛水晶簇都设立了苦工营地。直接杀掉兽人必定会惹来不必要的麻烦，但是我们可以略施妙计，既能削减他们的数量，又不会引起莫格霍尔的怀疑。\n\n在影月谷中猎杀那些被感染的野生动物，取出它们的邪能腺体。将邪能腺体和这团羊肉混合起来，放在苦工营地附近。他们只要吃上一口就会倒地身亡！",dEN="The Dragonmaw have peons stationed at nearly every crystal formation up here. While the outright slaying of them would draw far too much unwanted attention to you, there is a way that we can thin their numbers and remain below the suspicious eyes of Mor'ghor.\n\nVenture into the wilds of Shadowmoon Valley and slay the tainted wildlife. Take from them their corrupt fel glands. Use those fel glands with this mutton that I'll give you near the peons. They'll take one bite and fall deathly ill!",o="影月谷龙喉营地的佣兵亚兹尔要你用亚兹尔的羊肉配合邪能腺体，毒倒12处龙喉苦工营地的苦工。|n",oEN="Yarzill the Merc at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to use Yarzill's Mutton in conjunction with Fel Glands to poison 12 Dragonmaw Peon Camps.",p="这是桩脏活，<name>。",pEN="It is dirty work, <name>.",c="<亚兹尔压低声音耳语。>干得好，<name>。\n眼下先躲好。\n明天再来找我，我们可以再做一次。",cEN="<Yarzill speaks in a low whisper.>\n\nExcellent work, <name>. Lay low for now. Come back to me tomorrow and we can do it again."}
Q[11021]={d="这本神秘的书籍是从鸦爪祭司伊沙尔的尸体上找到的。书页中有一些你难以理解的神秘符号和天体图表。\n\n你根本看不懂上面的文字，似乎是某种古老的鸦人语。或许你应该将它交给空军指挥官阿达利斯。",dEN="This mysterious tome was on Talonpriest Ishaal's body. It contains arcane symbols and charts of celestial bodies beyond your comprehension.\n\nAll writing is in a language you don't understand; likely an ancient version of the arakkoa written tongue. Perhaps you should bring this to Sky Commander Adaris.",o="将伊沙尔的历书交给斯克提斯北面的空军指挥官阿达利斯。",oEN="Bring Ishaal's Almanac to Sky Commander Adaris north of Skettis.",p="你有东西要给我看吗？",pEN="You've something to show me?",c="你给我带来了什么？我看不清这本书上的字迹，<name>……我失血过多……一定是把我的视线弄模糊了。",cEN="What have you brought to me? I can't make out the writing on this tome, <name>... my loss of blood... must've blurred my vision."}
Q[11022]={d="$n$G国王:女王陛下，请等等！在你转至奥格瑞拉之前，不如跟枯瘦的莫戈多格谈谈！",dEN="<King /Queen> <name>! You speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened before you leave and go to Ogri'la!",o="与枯瘦的莫戈多格谈一谈，他就在刀锋山鲜血之环东侧的塔楼顶部。",oEN="Speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened. He stands atop the tower on the east side of the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="好伙计，我很高兴你决定在离开前再来和我谈谈。",cEN="My good man, I am glad that you have decided to speak to me again before leaving."}
Q[11023]={d="$n，邪能火炮依然令我们头痛不已。\n\n别误会，上次你出色地完成了轰炸任务。可惜功亏一篑，那帮该死的恶魔迅速补充了弹药供给。如此一来，天空卫士飞越铸魔营地时平添了许多危险，奥格瑞拉的安全状况也令人堪忧。\n\n怎么样？再来一次空袭如何？",dEN="We're still having problems with those flak cannons, <name>.\n\nDon't get me wrong -- I think that you did an outstanding job the last time out -- but, that doesn't change the fact that those damned demons seem to be replenishing their ammo supplies faster than we can knock them out. And that means we're having a hell of a time getting our people through there, not to mention the risk those demons pose to Ogri'la.\n\nWhat do you say? Want to take another shot at it?",o="使用天空卫队炸弹炸毁15堆邪能炮弹。",oEN="Use the Skyguard Bombs to destroy 15 Fel Cannonball Stacks.",p="轰炸任务进行的如何呢？",pEN="How goes the bombing run?",c="干得出色，<name>！我本想让你再上天去轰炸他们一轮，但这里的政策是确保我们的飞行员得到充足的休息和娱乐。抱歉，规矩不是我定的，但我绝对会严格执行！",cEN="Outstanding work, <name>! I'd have you back up in the air and bombing them again, but policy around here is to make sure that our pilots get plenty of R&R. Sorry, I don't make the rules, but I sure as hell enforce them!"}
Q[11024]={d="贫民窟中有个名叫瑞拉克的鸦人……他是值得信赖的。把这本书籍……交给他看看。\n\n<阿达利斯将书递给你之后又陷入了神志不清的状态。>",dEN="There is an arakkoa in Lower City by the name of Rilak... He can be trusted. Take the book... to him.\n\n<Adaris drifts into unconsciousness as he returns the book to you.>",o="将伊沙尔的历书交给沙塔斯城贫民窟中的救赎者瑞拉克。",oEN="Bring Ishaal's Almanac to Rilak the Redeemed in the Lower City section of Shattrath City.",p="解释一下！为什么你身上有着斯克提斯的味道！",pEN="You have the smell of Skettis on you! Explain yourself!",c="这不可能……这曾经属于一个鸦爪祭司所有。你从何处得到这个东西？",cEN="This cannot be... this belonged to a talonpriest once. How did you ever come across it?"}
Q[11025]={d="经过适当的处理之后，奥格瑞拉山脉出产的水晶就会展示出多种诡异的能量。\n\n居住在山顶的所有生物都在觊觎着这些水晶碎片，企图利用水晶实现自己的梦想，它们之间甚至形成了某种默契。\n\n要帮助我们，你自己首先必须要了解这种埃匹希斯碎片，去收集一些埃匹希斯碎片，把它们带回来给我吧。奥格瑞拉的任何生物身上都可能会带有埃匹希斯碎片，你还可以在剥石者开采水晶的挖掘地附近找到这种碎片。",dEN="When prepared correctly, the crystals of the mountains exhibit strange powers, such as the clarity of mind that we have found here in Ogri'la.\n\nAll of the creatures atop the mountains covet the crystal shards and use them to further their own goals. An economy has even sprung up around them.\n\nTo assist us, you must first learn about the Apexis shards. Bring me some. In addition to the creatures here having them, they can sometimes be found where the flayers dig at the larger crystals.",o="取得5块埃匹希斯碎片。",oEN="Collect 5 Apexis Shards.",p="当你了解那些碎片和水晶的本质与用途，你就能对底下的巨魔同胞们提供更大的帮助。\n\n那些碎片的名字来自于曾经居住在山顶的一个已经灭亡的古鸦人文明。\n\n你把那些碎片带来了吗？",pEN="As you come to a understand the shards and crystals, you will be better able to assist us in protecting ourselves and our ogre brethren below.\n\nThe shards themselves get their name from an ancient and now-extinct arakkoan civilization, which used to live atop the mountains here.\n\nDo you have the shards with you?",c="<朱阿洛尔左边的脑袋开始说话。>这些就可以了。记住，碎片的真正价值不在于它能为你买到什么，甚至也不在于它妥善锻造后能为你带来什么——尽管这一点还有些争论。<他右边的脑袋接着说道，……>真正的价值在于获取碎片的旅程。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Chu'a'lor's left head begins to speak.>\n\nThese will do fine.\n\nRemember,\n, the value of the shard is not in what it can purchase for you. It is not even in what it can potentially do for you when properly forged, though there is some debate over that.\n\n<His right head finishes,...>\n\nThe true value is in the journey to attain the shard."}
Q[11026]={d="朋友，你来的真是时候！我们需要帮助。做为回报，你会得到某件珍奇的器物，这对你我都有好处。\n\n我们早已摒弃残暴的陋习，但是附近的恶魔对奥格瑞拉和天空卫队的安全造成了威胁。这些恶魔能反复以新的形体重生，简直杀之不尽！\n\n利用这颗水晶打开放逐之门。如果你在传送门附近杀死恶魔，他们的精华就会被卷入传送门中，永远地从这个世界上消失！",dEN="You've arrived at the perfect time, friend! We are in need of assistance. In return, you will receive something very rare, which will help us both in the end.\n\nWe're not a violent ogre any longer, but the demons nearby threaten to overrun us and the Skyguard. The problem with demons is that, once killed, they come right back in new bodies!\n\nBut, if you use this crystal to summon a banishing portal, when they die near it, their essences will be drawn in and banished back from whence they came!",o="转至刀锋山的铸魔营地：天罚或是铸魔营地：恐怖，利用放逐水晶放逐15个恶魔。",oEN="Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror.",p="我们相信你已经使用放逐水晶把整个燃烧军团的杂碎们送回去了？！",pEN="We trust that you've used the banishing crystal to send a whole slew of those Burning Legion things packing?!",c="这算是给他们一个教训！\n当然，现在该谈你的报酬了。北边铸魔营地：暴怒的恶魔在他们的南面边界造了一座特殊传送器。\n这道实验性传送门被用来扩张铸魔营地，我想我们不必告诉你，要是他们扩张过头会对我们有什么影响。\n不过，要是我们是你，就会把这枚黑暗符文拿给加赫，问他你能帮上什么忙。别对他太苛刻，<name>。\n和你一样，他在这儿也是新来的。",cEN="That'll teach them! And, of course, now for your reward.\n\nThe demons of Forge Camp: Wrath, to the north, have created a special transporter on their southern border. This experimental gate is being used to expand the forge camp, and we don't think we need to tell you how that will effect us if they expand too far.\n\nHowever, if we were you, we'd take this darkrune over to Gahk, and ask him how you can help. Just take it easy on him, <name>. Like you, he's new here."}
Q[11027]={p="那营地的恶魔整天都在修那座传送器。\n加赫说<name>这次要狠狠砸他们！可加赫还需要另一枚黑暗符文才能做水晶熔铸黑暗符文。\n要是小<race>没有黑暗符文，就去找克朗克。\n他每天都试着做一枚黑暗符文！也许你s能从他的杂物袋里弄到一枚？\n！",pEN="Da demons of dat camp fixes da transporter all da times. Gahk say <name> smash dems better dis time!\n\nBut, Gahk need another darkrune ta make da crystalforged darkrune.\n\nIf little <race> not have a darkrune, you talk with Kronk. Him try ta make one darkrune every day! Maybe yous get one in his grab bag?!",c="哈哈，好！\n加赫喜欢黑暗符文！拿上加赫之前做的水晶熔铸黑暗符文。\n<name>记住，先控制降解者，然后用锤子砸碎沙特鲁尔传送器上的魔法护盾。\n把另一个恶魔放出来，和它打，这样你也能控制它！然后再砸碎并控制更多恶魔，直到没有恶魔再来！\n这样你就救了奥格瑞拉！",cEN="Haha, good! Gahk like darkrunes! You take crystalforged darkrune dat Gahk make earlier.\n\n<name> remember, control da degrader, den use hammer to smash da magic shield on Shartuul's transporter. Let out da other demon and fight him so you control him, too! Den smash and control more demons until no more come!\n\nDen you save Ogri'la!"}
Q[11028]={d="这本历书预示了泰罗克的归来，他是鸦人历史上最强大、最可怕的斯克提斯之王。\n\n$n，我一直以为这只是个传说，但是鸦爪祭司的现身和伊沙尔的历书不约而同地印证了这一点。\n\n泰罗克正在逐渐恢复元气。你必须把握唯一的机会，将他召唤至我们的世界。不过眼下尚且为时过早……赶快返回斯克提斯跟阿达利斯谈谈此事吧，希望他能为我们指明正确的方向。",dEN="This almanac presages the return of Terokk, the most powerful and terrible Skettis king in arakkoa history.\n\nI always believed this to be the mere legend, <name>. The return of the talonpriests and your recovery of this tome indicate otherwise.\n\nWith each day, Terokk comes closer to returning to full strength. Your only chance is to bring him to our world prematurely. Return to Skettis and speak to Adaris about this. Let us hope he has the wisdom to do the right thing.",o="向在黑风码头的空军指挥官阿达利斯汇报泰罗克归来一事。",oEN="Return to Sky Commander Adaris at Blackwind Landing in Terokkar Forest with the news about Terokk's return.",c="鸦人想把泰罗克从时间之幕的另一侧带回来，而瑞拉克…\n…想找到加速这一过程的方法？\n他疯了吗？\n<阿达里斯随着力气的消退重新躺了下去。>你已经尽到职责了，<name>。该让我的人接手这里了。\n这已经变成纯粹的军事事务。",cEN="The arakkoa seek to bring Terokk back beyond the veil of time and Rilak... wants to find a way to accelerate the process? Is he out of his mind?\n\n<Adaris lays back down as his strength fades.>\n\nYou've done your duty, <name>. It is time you let my men take over from here. This has become a purely military matter."}
Q[11029]={d="$n，包里装的是一件伪装服。看起来不太靠谱，是吧？\n\n我曾为星界财团的走私贩子们制作这样的伪装服，帮助他们搜寻稀有的古籍。斯克提斯的中心小岛——泰罗克之墓上居住着一位名叫萨哈克的鸦人书吏，他年岁已高，双目近乎失明。\n\n穿上伪装跟他谈谈，取回那本名叫《仇敌的血脉》的书籍。$n，小心。其它鸦人是可以轻易看穿这件伪装服的。",dEN="Open the package, <name>. It is a disguise. It doesn't look very convincing, does it?\n\nI craft them for ethereal smugglers in search of rare books. There is an arakkoa scribe who dwells in the central island in Skettis, Terokk's Rest; his name is Sahaak. He is old and nearly blind.\n\nUse the disguise to speak with him and obtain the book known as the Adversarial Bloodlines. Be careful, <name>. The disguise won't fool the other arakkoa.",o="穿上粗糙的鸦人伪装服，从萨哈克那儿取得《仇敌的血脉》，然后向哈吉克复命。",oEN="Use the Shabby Arakkoa Disguise to obtain the Adversarial Bloodlines from Sahaak and return to Hazzik.",p="那本书，<name>。你拿到了吗？",pEN="The book, <name>. Have you obtained it?",c="太好了！这本书记载了泰罗克古老敌人的子嗣。有人预言他们的死亡会随着泰罗克的归来而发生。",cEN="Excellent! This book catalogs the descendants of Terokk's ancient enemies. It is prophesied that their demise will be followed by Terokk's return."}
Q[11030]={d="$C，我们遇到了麻烦——瞧瞧这帮孩子。自从天空卫队驻扎到奥格瑞拉附近后，孩子们便整日吵着要加入天空卫队。\n\n做为父亲，我为此倍感自豪，也想帮助他们达成梦想。你愿意转至北边或南边的铸魔营地，利用邪能水晶熔炉帮我制作不稳定的野兽合剂吗？\n\n这种合剂需要10块埃匹希斯碎片。我们本应该为你提供原料的，可惜现在恰好缺货。",dEN="<class>, we've got a problem -- we have lots of sons. And ever since the Skyguard moved in nearby, all our sons ever talk about is joining their ranks.\n\nAs a proud father, we want them to have every advantage for when they apply. So, would you go to the fel crystalforge at either forge camp to the north or south, and procure a magic flask for our sons? You can't miss their green smoke.\n\nWe think that they take ten apexis shards to make. We'd give you the shards, but we don't have any at the moment.",o="取得不稳定的野兽合剂。",oEN="Collect an Unstable Flask of the Beast.",p="你弄到那个魔法药水了吗？那对托尔库斯而言可是全世界。",pEN="You have that magic flask, yet? It will mean the world to little Torkus Jr.",c="你救了我们一命，<name>。\n我们的小伙子们听到这个消息会兴奋坏的！好，那么解决了一个，还剩一个。\n我们跟你提过他们还需要另一个魔法瓶，对吧？",cEN="You're a lifesaver, <name>. Our boys are going to be so excited to hear the news!\n\nOK, so one down and one to go. We did tell you about the other magical flask that they're going to need, didn't we?"}
Q[11031]={p="你决定违背先前的选择？我想我可以帮你改变它。最终达拉然在意你的忠诚比你选择如何表现它来的多。\n\n这花费可不低。当然我需要你把旧的戒指交回来。",pEN="You've decided against your previous choice? I suppose I can help you reverse it. In the end Dalaran cares more about your loyalty than how you choose to show it.\n\nIt won't be cheap. And of course, I will need your old ring back.",c="小心地做下一个决定。我们会尽最大的努力来帮助我们的盟友，可是达拉然的资源也是有限的。",cEN="Make this next decision carefully. We do our best to accommodate our allies, but even Dalaran's resources have their limits."}
Q[11032]={p="你决定违背先前的选择？我想我可以帮你改变它。最终达拉然在意你的忠诚比你选择如何表现它来的多。\n\n这花费可不低。当然我需要你把旧的戒指交回来。",pEN="You've decided against your previous choice? I suppose I can help you reverse it. In the end Dalaran cares more about your loyalty than how you choose to show it.\n\nIt won't be cheap. And of course, I will need your old ring back.",c="小心地做下一个决定。我们会尽最大的努力来帮助我们的盟友，可是达拉然的资源也是有限的。",cEN="Make this next decision carefully. We do our best to accommodate our allies, but even Dalaran's resources have their limits."}
Q[11033]={p="你决定违背先前的选择？我想我可以帮你改变它。最终达拉然在意你的忠诚比你选择如何表现它来的多。\n\n这花费可不低。当然我需要你把旧的戒指交回来。",pEN="You've decided against your previous choice? I suppose I can help you reverse it. In the end Dalaran cares more about your loyalty than how you choose to show it.\n\nIt won't be cheap. And of course, I will need your old ring back.",c="小心地做下一个决定。我们会尽最大的努力来帮助我们的盟友，可是达拉然的资源也是有限的。",cEN="Make this next decision carefully. We do our best to accommodate our allies, but even Dalaran's resources have their limits."}
Q[11034]={p="你决定违背先前的选择？我想我可以帮你改变它。最终达拉然在意你的忠诚比你选择如何表现它来的多。\n\n这花费可不低。当然我需要你把旧的戒指交回来。",pEN="You've decided against your previous choice? I suppose I can help you reverse it. In the end Dalaran cares more about your loyalty than how you choose to show it.\n\nIt won't be cheap. And of course, I will need your old ring back.",c="小心地做下一个决定。我们会尽最大的努力来帮助我们的盟友，可是达拉然的资源也是有限的。",cEN="Make this next decision carefully. We do our best to accommodate our allies, but even Dalaran's resources have their limits."}
Q[11035]={d="龙喉兽人在灵翼浮岛的东北边缘设立了港口，用于运送灵翼水晶和灵翼圣物。龙喉碎天者负责将货物从港口运往龙喉要塞，龙喉晋升者则担当起地面的守卫工作，防止入侵者滋扰生事。\n\n我们可以利用龙喉空港这个防御缺口，狠狠地打击龙喉兽人的嚣张气焰。\n\n飞往龙喉空港，袭击运送货物的龙喉碎天者，夺回被偷走的灵翼圣物！",dEN="On the northeast edge of this island exists a dock used for the packaging and transport of Netherwing crystals and relics. Dragonmaw Transporters transport the goods from the dock to Dragonmaw Fortress while Dragonmaw Ascendants guard the ground from any would-be attackers.\n\nThis leaves one opening for you to make a strike at the Dragonmaw: The Dragonmaw Skyway.\n\nFly to the shattered islands of the Dragonmaw Skyway and ambush the transporters that use the route. Recover our stolen relics!",o="将10件灵翼圣物交给影月谷龙喉营地的雇佣兵亚兹尔。",oEN="Yarzill the Merc at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to recover 10 Netherwing Relics.",p="死掉的兽人是不会讲故事的，<name>。确保那些龙喉运输工别逃掉。",pEN="Dead orcs tell no tales, <name>. Make sure those Dragonmaw transporters do not escape.",c="<亚兹尔低声说。>你在为灵翼做出巨大的贡献，<name>。\n我们会一点一点推翻龙喉。\n一场疾病正在他们内部滋长，一场无药可医的疾病…\n…\n如果你对龙喉天桥的更多活计感兴趣，明天再来找我。",cEN="<Yarzill whispers.>\n\nYou are doing the Netherwing a great service, <name>. Slowly, we will topple the Dragonmaw. From the inside a disease now grows - a disease with no cure...\n\nReturn to me tomorrow if you are interested in more work at the Dragonmaw Skyway."}
Q[11036]={d="首先，我得承认我不太明白这份订单是干嘛用的。不过，火箭主管弗斯拉格列出了详细的说明——这批果脯需以品质上等的水果为原料，必须经过严格的防腐和密封处理。\n\n他还提出了别的要求，失重状态、低气压什么的。我根本就不懂这些术语，好在他开出的价格不错，那么我就按他的吩咐交货吧。总之，将这个食品箱交给52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。沿着这条道路进入虚空风暴后一直走就到52区了。",dEN="I'll be the first to admit I'm not quite sure what this order is for, but Rocket-Chief Fuselage's instructions were very specific -- only the very best fruit, preserved to survive a long voyage and sealed against the elements.\n\nThere were other specifications, zero-gravity this and low pressure that. I don't pretend to understand it, but the price is right, so he'll get his superfood. Bring this crate to him up at Area 52. After crossing into Netherstorm, keep following the road until you see the town.",o="将这箱果脯交给虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。",oEN="Bring the Preserved Fruit to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="这是老欧洛克要送给我的东西吗？",pEN="Is that the delivery from Old Orok?",c="<主管检视木箱里的东西。>\n\n看起来都不错。清单上的项目又完成了一样。现在我们所要做的就是让火箭离开地面！",cEN="<The chief inspects the crate's contents.>\n\nEverything looks good here. That's one more thing to cross off the list. Now all we need to do is get the rocket off the ground!"}
Q[11037]={d="$n，我曾看见巨大的箭形物体迅速蹿至高空，后面还拖着长长的火焰尾巴。这种与众不同的景象令我百思不得其解。虽然对法师而言，这样的把戏简直是小菜一碟，但是我很清楚，那绝对不是什么魔法效果。\n\n艾泽拉斯世界的居民从来没有取得过这样的成就。$n，你必须找出那东西的制造者，并慷慨地伸出援手。若是没有你的帮助，他们的创造物或许会失败。",dEN="I've had a most unusual vision, <name>, and I don't know quite what to make of it. I've seen an arrow, an immense arrow, riding into the sky on a trail of fire. Such a feat is trivial for a skilled mage, but somehow I know the arrow I saw is not the product of magic.\n\nIt will be unlike anything the people of Azeroth have ever achieved. You must seek out the people working on this, <name>. Lend them your help, for without it, their efforts may yet fail.",o="与52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52.",c="<主管听你描述关于先知所预见的景象。>\n\n嗯，关于这件事情我一无所知，但我们倒是非常需要你的帮忙。看看我身后的巨大火箭！那就是X-52……\n\n是不是你见过最美丽的火箭呢？",cEN="<The chief listens as you describe the seer's vision.>\n\nWell, I don't know about any of that, but we could certainly use your help around here. Behold the rocket behind me! That's the X-52...\n\nIsn't it the most beautiful thing you've ever seen?"}
Q[11038]={d="不久前，高阶祭司伊沙娜派遣大主教欧雷里斯率领一队学者转至虚空风暴。此行的目的是调查凯尔萨斯的动向，不过到当前为止，我们还没有收到任何反馈报告。\n\n我担心他们势单力薄，恐怕难以完成使命。你的知识和经验必定对大主教欧雷里斯有所帮助。你愿意转至52区帮帮他吗？",dEN="Not long ago, High Priestess Ishanah sent a small group of anchorites to Netherstorm, under the command of Exarch Orelis. They were to investigate the activities of Kael'thas and his minions, but we haven't received any reports of their findings yet.\n\nI worry that our presence in the area might not be strong enough to carry out the mission. I'm certain that the exarch could benefit from your knowledge and experience. Are you willing to travel to Area 52 and assist him?",o="与52区的大主教欧雷里斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Exarch Orelis at Area 52.",c="所以你来这里是为了帮我们找出凯尔萨斯在策划什么阴谋吗？非常感谢你的帮忙。虚空风暴充斥着血精灵密探，他们所从事的秘密行动已经使这片大地面临被分化的危机。",cEN="So you're here to help us determine exactly what Kael'thas is planning? Your help is most welcome. Netherstorm is crawling with blood elf agents whose activities threaten to tear the land asunder."}
Q[11039]={d="不久前，沃雷塔尔派了一队密探转至虚空风暴，想要调查凯尔萨斯的动向。我们的首领非常信任间谍大师萨罗迪恩和他手下的密探，便接受了他要求增援的请求。\n\n萨罗迪恩发回的报告非常简短地说他遇到了一些麻烦事。$n，转至52区向他报到，尽你所能地帮助他吧。",dEN="Some time ago, Voren'thal dispatched a small team to Netherstorm to investigate the activities of Kael'thas. Our leader has the utmost confidence in Spymaster Thalodien and his compatriots, and has decided to honor his request for reinforcements.\n\nThalodien's report was brief, but clear that he's encountered something of great importance. Report to him at Area 52 and assist him in any way possible, <name>.",o="向52区的间谍大师萨罗迪恩报到。",oEN="Report to Spymaster Thalodien at Area 52.",c="<间谍大师的脸上露出了短暂的失望表情。>\n\n我原本期待的是至少一个小队的援军，但是假如沃雷塔尔认为只有你适合这个工作，那么我会跟着调整我的计划。",cEN="<A brief look of disappointment crosses the spymaster's face.>\n\nI was hoping for at least a squad, but if Voren'thal saw fit to send only you, then I will adjust my plans accordingly."}
Q[11040]={d="我与地精合作的次数，你用一只手就能数得过来，更多的时候我们是竞争关系。但是，当火箭主管弗斯拉格说他需要材料时，我还是不忍心拒绝他的请求。\n\n这只箱子里装的都是我不需要的零件，不过火箭主管或许能用得上。如果你正要去52区的话，就顺路把这箱子带给他，好吗？\n\n说不定装上这些做工精细的侏儒零件后，他的工程制品就不会爆炸了！",dEN="You can count on one hand the number of times I've collaborated with a goblin. We're far more likely to be in competition with them, but when I received Rocket-Chief Fuselage's request, I just couldn't refuse him.\n\nThis crate is full of parts I'm not using here, but that the rocket-chief might be able to put to use on his project. Would you be kind enough to deliver them if you're on your way to Area 52?\n\nWho knows, maybe some fine gnomish parts could keep his creation from exploding!",o="将波希的备用零件交给虚空风暴52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格。",oEN="Bring Bossi's Spare Parts to Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52 in the Netherstorm.",p="那个木箱看起来很像地精工程大师的东西。是波西派你来的吗？",pEN="That crate has the look of a master gnomish engineer about it. Did Bossi send you?",c="我连某些零件是用来干嘛的都不知道！我确定我可以利用其中一些零件，但我从来没想过我必须学着用侏儒的方式来思考！",cEN="I don't even know what some of these parts do! I'm certain I'll find a use for some of them, but I never suspected I'd have to learn to think like a gnome!"}
Q[11041]={d="以圣主之名……为伊利丹的荣耀而战！\n\n莫格霍尔大王下令，不惜一切代价确保灵翼浮岛的安全。岛上的虚空幼龙要么被我们俘虏，要么已经逃之夭夭；剥石者趁势猖獗起来，严重影响了水晶的开采工事。\n\n杀光它们，还有母兽巴莱什以及她的配偶阿尔沃安。\n\n这是莫格霍尔大王的命令！\n\n<看来这个兽人正被此事烦得焦头烂额，不妨趁此机会证明你对莫格霍尔的忠诚！>",dEN="In the name of our great master... For the glory of Illidan!\n\nBy order of Overlord Mor'ghor, the great plateau of Netherwing Ledge is to be secured. With all Netherwing drakes captured or forced off of the land, rock flayers are running rampant and threatening crystal harvesting operations.\n\nDestroy them all, their den mother and her consort, Arvoar.\n\nMor'ghor commands it!\n\n<It would appear that this orc failed to take the plateau. It is time to prove your worth to Mor'ghor!>",o="杀死10只灵翼矿洞剥石者和母兽巴莱什。完成任务后向龙喉营地的莫格霍尔大王复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Overmine Flayers and Barash the Den Mother. Return to Overlord Mor'ghor at the Dragonmaw Base Camp should you succeed.",p="谁敢接近莫格？最好是很重要的事。",pEN="Who dares approach Mor'ghor? This had better be important.",c="所以你从我手下的监工遗体身上取得了命令并自己接下了任务？你的确让莫格印象深刻。做得好……",cEN="So from the remains of one of my own overseers you recovered the command and took matters into your own hands? You have managed to impress Mor'ghor. Well done..."}
Q[11042]={d="我最近被一个奇怪的梦境幻象所困扰，$n。我看见一团巨大的烟雾迅速蹿至高空，后面还拖着长长的火焰尾巴，速度越来越快。这种与众不同的景象令我百思不得其解。我只知道这绝非自然现象，也不是恶魔的创造物。\n\n我没看清它的模样，不过它应该是许多人的心血之作。看来这些创造者需要帮助。\n\n$c，转至虚空风暴寻找它的创造者，并慷慨地伸出援手吧。",dEN="A strange vision haunts me, <name>. I see a continuous cloud of smoke ascending toward the sky, left in the wake of a giant fire moving ever faster away. It is not a natural phenomenon, nor a creation of evil; that much I know.\n\nI have no knowledge of what it looks like, save that it is the product of the labor of many. Yet, without more hands, it may never come to be.\n\nTravel to Netherstorm, <class>. Locate those responsible for this creation and offer them your aid.",o="与52区的火箭主管弗斯拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Rocket-Chief Fuselage at Area 52.",c="<主管听你描述关于先知所预见的景象。>\n\n嗯，关于这件事情我一无所知，但我们倒是非常需要你的帮忙。看看我身后的巨大火箭。那就是X-52……\n\n是不是你见过最美丽的火箭呢？",cEN="<The chief listens as you describe the seer's vision.>\n\nWell, I don't know about any of that, but we could certainly use your help around here. Look at the behemoth behind me. That's the X-52...\n\nIsn't it the most beautiful thing you've ever seen?"}
Q[11043]={d="我听说蛮锤矮人在影月谷南部的蛮锤要塞中饲养了一批狮鹫。如果你正要去那儿的话，就代表我跟他们谈谈好吗？我想到了一些改善狮鹫坐骑的好点子！\n\n为什么要局限于一般的盔甲呢？我们可以给它们装上高度计、后视镜，或者是火箭！若是将这些宝贝玩意儿绑在狮鹫背上，大胆想象它们的飞行速度吧！我会把这样的武装狮鹫命名为“高机动全装甲强袭作战狮鹫8000型改”。你说，这是否很劲了？",dEN="I've heard that the Wildhammer dwarves maintain a gryphon roost at their fortress down in southern Shadowmoon Valley. If you're going down there, would you speak to them on my behalf? I have some ideas on how to improve their gryphons!\n\nWhy stop at armoring them when you could attach an altimeter, a rear view mirror, and rocket? Imagine how fast you could go with one of those babies strapped to your gryphon's back! I'll call it the TurboGryphon 8000!",o="与影月谷蛮锤要塞的拉瑟尔·火须谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Brunn Flamebeard at Wildhammer Stronghold in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="<拉瑟尔的脸色涨红，直到在他的胡须下逐渐退去。>\n\n他想对我的狮鹫做什么？\n\n假如那个小混蛋在狮鹫上装了兽鞍以外的任何东西的话，我就要亲自飞去刀锋山把他说的什么火箭插进他的喉咙里！",cEN="<Brunn's face reddens until its color is indistinguishable from his beard.>\n\nHe wants to do WHAT to my gryphons?\n\nIf that little pipsqueak puts anything other than a saddle on them, I'll personally travel up to Blade's Edge and stuff that rocket o' his down his throat!"}
Q[11044]={d="我常常在睡梦中被灾难的幻象惊醒——绿色的火焰雨不断地砸向要塞和工事。这种幻象已经折磨我好几周的时间了，直到最近我才了解到其中的寓意。\n\n在遥远的东方，影月谷的蛮锤矮人们正在遭受燃烧军团和其它敌人的袭击。他们勇敢地抵抗着敌人的进攻，但是孤军作战势必会落败。$n，转至蛮锤要塞，帮助矮人们战斗吧。",dEN="A vision of cataclysm often disturbs my rest -- a rain of green fire falling to the earth, felling the valiant defenders of a mighty fortress. It has haunted me for weeks now, although I have only recently come to understand its meaning.\n\nTo the far east, in Shadowmoon Valley, the Wildhammer dwarves endure constant attacks from the Burning Legion and numerous other foes. They fight bravely, but without relief, their enemies will triumph. Go to their side, <name>. Help them in their fight.",o="与蛮锤要塞的空军指挥官努埃恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Wing Commander Nuainn at Wildhammer Stronghold.",c="你说梦境？我才不管他是梦见、有人写信告诉他还是由一个深渊领主亲口告诉他。他真是没用！重要的是你来到了这里，我的朋友。我们需要集结所有的力量。",cEN="A vision, you say? I don't care if he saw it in a vision, read it in a letter, or heard it from the mouth of a pit lord. He was dead on! What matters is that you're here, friend, and we need all the help we can get."}
Q[11045]={d="影月谷历经沧桑，在漫长的岁月中演变成如今的模样。鲜有人愿意触碰这段历史，惟恐为这片死气沉沉的大地带来新的生机。\n\n当然，并非所有人都这么胆小。仲裁者索鲁斯一直在探索那些徘徊在影月谷中的幽灵的秘密。不过，他的研究工作举步维艰，我想他一定需要帮助。\n\n如果你有机会转至蛮锤要塞，就去找他谈谈吧。",dEN="The history of Shadowmoon Valley is a long and troubled one. Few delve into it for fear of breathing new life into the unspeakable atrocities that took place there.\n\nNot all are so timid, though. Zorus the Judicator searches for the truth about the ghosts of Shadowmoon's past. It is a staggering undertaking, one with which he would welcome help, I'm sure.\n\nIf you should venture into the valley, look for Zorus at Wildhammer Stronghold, in the central portion of the valley's southern region.",o="与蛮锤要塞的仲裁者索鲁斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Zorus the Judicator at Wildhammer Stronghold.",c="芬提说的没错而我很欢迎你的帮忙。",cEN="Fantei speaks the truth and I would welcome your help."}
Q[11046]={d="影月谷历经沧桑，在漫长的岁月中演变成如今的模样。鲜有人愿意触碰这段历史，惟恐为这片死气沉沉的大地带来新的生机。\n\n当然，并非所有人都这么胆小。主药剂师希尔达迦一直在探索徘徊在影月谷中的幽灵的秘密。她的研究工作举步维艰，我想她一定需要帮助。\n\n如果你有机会转至影月村，就去找她谈谈吧。",dEN="The history of Shadowmoon Valley is a long and troubled one. Few study it for fear of breathing new life into the unspeakable atrocities that took place there.\n\nNot all are so timid, though. Chief Apothecary Hildagard's research delves into the ghosts of Shadowmoon's past. It is a staggering undertaking, one with which she would welcome help, I'm sure.\n\nIf your travels bring you there, seek Hildagard at Shadowmoon Village, in the northwestern reaches of the valley.",o="与影月村的主药剂师希尔达迦谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Chief Apothecary Hildagard at Shadowmoon Village.",c="芬提的记忆力很好。我上一次去沙塔斯城买药剂材料已经是一个月前的事了。但是，他说的没错。我需要帮忙。",cEN="Fantei has a good memory. It's been months since I was last in Shattrath to buy reagents. He's right, though. I could use the help."}
Q[11047]={d="作为双足飞龙管理员的学徒，我的职责之一就是在双足飞龙没有飞行任务的时候照料它们。可是它们的数量太少，几乎轮不上休息。\n\n如果我们不尽快调来一批新的双足飞龙，恐怕它们会累坏的。影月谷西部的影月村设有一处大型的双足飞龙训练场，达玛·蛮鬃在那儿负责饲养和训练工作。\n\n你能跟她谈谈我们面临的窘境吗？",dEN="As an apprentice wind rider master, one of my tasks is to care for the beasts when they're not flying. The problem is that we have so few here, there's very little downtime for any of them.\n\nI'm afraid we'll work them all to death if we don't receive any replacements. There's a large stable down in Shadowmoon Village, in western Shadowmoon Valley. Dama Wildmane oversees the wind rider care and training there.\n\nWould you speak with her on our behalf and let her know about our situation?",o="与影月谷影月村的达玛·蛮鬃谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Dama Wildmane at Shadowmoon Village in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="<达玛听完了阿迦尔的请求。>\n\n我无法保证会有多的双足飞龙，但是我会尽力帮忙。因为我们连其它买家以及哨站所订购的双足飞龙都无法准时交货了。",cEN="<Dama listens to Agadai's request.>\n\nI can't guarantee that there will be any wind riders available, but I'll see what I can do. As it is, we're having trouble keeping up with the demands of other buyers and outposts."}
Q[11048]={d="我原本奉命暂时留守加拉达尔一段时间，然后再向影月村的血卫士古尔穆克报到。在驻留期间，我发现加拉达尔需要一位常驻联络员，以便随时与部落保持联系。\n\n我也明白血卫士古尔穆克需要人手支持，但是我想他应该能理解明白这里的任务也十分需要我来完成。转至影月谷西北方的影月村，转告血卫士古尔穆克，我要晚些时日才能向他报到。",dEN="My original orders were to remain in Garadar for a short time, then continue on and report to Blood Guard Gulmok at Shadowmoon Village. What I've seen in my time here is that Garadar could benefit from a long term Horde liaison.\n\nI know that Blood Guard Gulmok needs all the troops he can get, but I know he'll understand that my mission here isn't yet complete. Travel to Shadowmoon Village, in northwestern Shadowmoon Valley, and inform Blood Guard Gulmok of my delayed arrival.",o="与影月村的血卫士古尔穆克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Blood Guard Gulmok at Shadowmoon Village.",c="<古尔穆克对克洛坎的决定抱怨连连。>\n\n我了解他的难处，但是我们这里的战壕同样也需要人员的补充啊！燃烧军团日夜不停的以恶魔火炮轰我们。假如克洛坎行程耽搁的话，他的缺就由你来替补吧！",cEN="<Gulmok grumbles upon hearing of Kroghan's decision.>\n\nI understand his point of view, but we need warm bodies in the trenches here too! The Legion's bombarding us with infernals day and night. If Kroghan's going to be delayed, you can take his place on the field!"}
Q[11049]={d="如果你在灵翼浮岛上发现灵翼龙卵，就把它们统统带回来给我。\n\n不过，灵翼龙卵极其罕见。找不到的话，也不必产生挫败感。大多数灵翼龙卵都被龙喉兽人运往了未知的地方。\n\n你能在岛上的各种生物身上找到灵翼龙卵，它们零星地分布在水晶簇、矿洞、虚空矿脉或是灵尘灌木附近。\n\n保持低调，别引起莫格霍尔的注意。",dEN="Should you discover any Netherwing eggs while exploring, bring them to me.\n\nBe warned, a Netherwing egg is a rare discovery. Do not become frustrated if you cannot locate one. These Dragonmaw have been very thorough in collecting most of them and shipping them off to parts unknown.\n\nEggs might be found on creatures of the island, near crystal formations, in the mines, or even inside a nethercite node or netherdust bush.\n\nKeep a low profile. We don't need Mor'ghor catching wind of your actions.",o="将一枚灵翼龙卵交给影月谷龙喉营地的雇佣兵亚兹尔。",oEN="Yarzill the Merc at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to recover a Netherwing Egg.",p="搜寻龙蛋行动进行的怎么样了？",pEN="How goes the egg hunt?",c="奈萨拉库会非常满意，<name>。干得好。",cEN="Neltharaku will be most pleased, <name>. Well done."}
Q[11050]={p="我们可不能让那些蛋落到不该落的人手里，<name>。\n你若是再找到多余的蛋，就带给我。\n只要记住保持低调，还要避免引起怀疑！",pEN="We don't need those eggs to get into the wrong hands,<name>. Bring me any additional eggs that you may find.\n\nJust remember to keep a low profile AND avoid raising suspicion!",c="你是真正的英雄，<name>。",cEN="You are a true hero, <name>."}
Q[11051]={d="如果恶魔如我们所料——而事实确实如此，因为我们仔细研究过他们——他们会急忙修补自己珍爱的传送器所受的任何损伤。\n所以，如果你想有机会再得到一枚黑暗符文，就再拿上我们的放逐水晶，去消灭更多恶魔。再说，你也想帮我们削弱恶魔造成的威胁，对吧？\n我们说有机会，是因为这个过程的结果并不总是相同。\n你可能得到一枚黑暗符文，也可能得到完全不同的别的东西。\"\n\"",dEN="If we know the demons, and we do because we've studied them extensively, they're fast at work repairing any damage that has been done to their precious transporter.\n\nSo, if you want a chance at another darkrune, take our banishing crystal back out there and eliminate more demons. Besides, you want to help us to lessen the threat that the demons pose, yes?\n\nWe said \"chance\" because the process we use yields mixed results. You might get a darkrune, or you might get something else entirely.",o="转至刀锋山的铸魔营地：天罚或是铸魔营地：恐怖，利用放逐水晶放逐15个恶魔。",oEN="Use the Banishing Crystal to banish 15 demons at Forge Camp: Wrath or Forge Camp: Terror.",p="像你这样经验丰富的老手，放逐恶魔应该毫无困难。你没什么困难吧，<race>？",pEN="A seasoned pro such as yourself shouldn't be having any difficulty banishing demons. You're not having any difficulties, right, <race>?",c="我们真希望制作黑暗符文的过程万无一失，<name>。可惜并非如此。\n请拿上这个袋子，看看里面，瞧瞧我们今天弄出了什么。\n我们自己都不敢去看。记住，如果你得到了一枚黑暗符文，就拿去给加赫换一枚水晶熔铸黑暗符文。\n这样你就能再一次击落沙特鲁尔的传送器。\n哦，还有，<name>，别忘了明天再来领取放逐水晶。总有更多恶魔需要被放逐。",cEN="We wish the process of creating a darkrune was foolproof, <name>. Alas, it is not. Please, take this bag and look in it to see what we've wrought today. We couldn't bear to look ourselves.\n\nRemember, if you get a darkrune, take it to Gahk to exchange for a crystalforged darkrune. Then you'll be able to once more bring down Shartuul's transporter.\n\nOh, and <name>, don't forget to come by again tomorrow and pickup the banishing crystal. There are always more demons to be banished."}
Q[11053]={d="很少有苦工能像你这样活了这么久还没死的。而有幸得到晋升，彻底摆脱贱民生活的苦工就更罕见了。\n\n<瓦尔库勒拍了拍手掌。>\n\n喏，大王要见你。毫无疑问，你得到晋升了。",dEN="Rare it is that a peon survives for as long as you have. Rarer still is when a peon rises from the dregs to attain a new rank.\n\n<Varkule claps.>\n\nThe Overlord has called for you, grunt. A new rank awaits, no doubt.",o="与影月谷龙喉营地的莫格霍尔大王谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="我一直在密切关注你的活动，<name>。你已经证明自己是龙喉不可或缺的人才。\n既然如此，我要把你晋升为监工。随着这个头衔而来的，是你必须履行的新职责。\n起身吧，监工<name>！起身去营地里寻找那些需要你帮助的人。",cEN="I have been following your activities closely, <name>. You have proven to be an invaluable asset to Dragonmaw. With that said, I am going to promote you to Overseer. With that rank comes new responsibilities that you must fulfill.\n\nRise, Overseer <name>! Rise and seek out those that need your assistance at the base camp."}
Q[11054]={d="那么你就是新任监工了，嗯？好吧，任何好监工都需要一样东西：一件合适的惩戒武器。在你出去给那些苦工敲敲脑袋之前，你得先有自己的家伙。\n每个监工都得自己收集材料来打造自己的家伙，你也不例外。我需要节皮皮革和泰兰图斯的硬化之皮。你会在虚空风暴北部地区的生态圆顶远野找到泰兰图斯。\"\n\"\"\"",dEN="So you're the new overseer, eh? Well there's one thing any good overseer needs and that's the proper disciplinary weapon. Before you can go out there and knock some sense into these peons you need to have your \"piece.\" Each overseer has to gather the materials required to make their own \"piece\" and you'll be no different.\n\nI'll need knothide leather and the hardened hide of Tyrantus. You'll find Tyrantus in Eco-Dome Farfield, located in the northern reaches of Netherstorm.",o="影月谷龙喉营地的总监工泥块要你带给他10块节皮皮革和1张泰兰图斯的硬化之皮。|n",oEN="Chief Overseer Mudlump at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 10 pieces of Knothide Leather and 1 Hardened Hide of Tyrantus.",p="还有苦工要管教，<name>！动作快点！",pEN="There's peons to be disciplined, <name>! Hurry it up!",c="啊啊啊！\n看来你终究还是能当上监工的。那条超大的蜥蜴可是许多兽人的祸害！\n<El Jefe Supervisor Mudlump comienza a fabricar el arma>.",cEN="ARRR! You might make it as an overseer after all. That oversized lizard has been the bane of many an orc!\n\n<Chief Overseer Mudlump begins to fashion the weapon>."}
Q[11055]={d="这是你的飞踢回旋镖。\n像它这样的还有很多，但这一件是你的。作为监工，你会用这个飞踢回旋镖在桀骜不驯的苦工心里播下恐惧。\n正确使用飞踢回旋镖能灌输服从，确保他们俯首帖耳。\n到水晶原野去，见到偷懒的苦工就管教一番。让他们见识飞踢回旋镖的威力！\n|n",dEN="This is your booterang. There are many like it but this one is yours.\n\nAs an overseer you will use this booterang to sow terror into the hearts of defiant peons. Proper use of the booterang will instill obedience and ensure subservience.\n\nVenture forth to the crystal fields and discipline any peons that you see slacking off. Show them the might of the booterang!",o="影月谷龙喉营地的高级监工玛德拉普要你惩罚20名懒惰的龙喉苦工，然后将训诫靴还给他。",oEN="Chief Overseer Mudlump at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to discipline 20 lazy Dragonmaw Peons. You will also need to return your Booterang.",p="全靠手腕的功夫，<name>。",pEN="It's all in the wrist, <name>.",c="辛苦的一天！但很值得，对吧？看到那些没用的畜生认真的挖掘那些水晶让你的心很欣慰……总之，今天就这样吧。明天再来用训诫靴惩罚那些偷懒的苦工。",cEN="A hard day's work! It pays off, though, doesn't it? Warms your heart seeing those worthless runts slavering over those crystals... Anyhow, that's all for today. Come back tomorrow for another round of booterang discipline."}
Q[11056]={d="别让别人注意到我们的谈话。阿达利斯会不高兴的。\n\n$n，我在鸦人社会中属于身份最低的那个等级。根据泰罗卡的法律，我本该被鸦爪祭司献祭给他们所崇拜的黑暗力量。你刚才说，那些鸦爪祭司正谋划着将泰罗卡召唤回这个世界，如果这是真的，那么不论你的上司说什么，你也一定要想办法去阻止他们！\n\n有些东西你肯定会用得上，我过去在上层夏尔克鸦巢的房子里藏了一个包裹，把它带回来给我！",dEN="Do not draw attention to our conversation. Adaris would not approve.\n\nI belong to the lowest caste of arakkoa, <name>. During Terokk's rule I would've been sacrificed to the dark powers worshipped by his talonpriests. If what you say is true and the talonpriests are seeking Terokk's return, then you must prevent them from succeeding - regardless of what your leader says!\n\nI've something to offer you that you'll find useful. There is a package at my old dwelling in Upper Veil Shil'ak. Bring it to me!",o="进入斯克提斯的东部区域，在哈吉克的住处中找到哈吉克的包裹，然后把包裹带回去给他。",oEN="Obtain Hazzik's Package at his dwelling in eastern Skettis and return to him with it.",p="你回来了，<name>。我刚开始以为你把我放弃了。",pEN="You've returned, <name>. I was beginning to think you'd given up on me.",c="太好了，<name>。你会看到我言出必行。",cEN="Excellent, <name>. You will see that I'm true to my word."}
Q[11057]={d="$c，我们理解你想要帮助奥格瑞拉的迫切心情。但是，在接受你的帮助之前，我另有一件事要交给你去做。\n\n奥格瑞拉下面，有许多同胞正被格鲁尔之子奴役。枯瘦的莫戈多格想要领导食人魔推翻戈隆的统治，你不如先去和他谈谈。\n\n他就在鲜血之环竞技场东边的塔楼顶部。",dEN="We commend your zeal in wanting to help out here in Ogri'la, <class>. However, we have a favor to ask of you before we can accept your assistance.\n\nDown below our brethren are enslaved to the Sons of Gruul. Please, speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened, who is leading an ogre resistance against their gronn masters.\n\nSeek him out atop the tower on the eastern side of the Circle of Blood arena.",o="到刀锋山鲜血之环外某座塔的塔顶，与长者莫格多格谈谈。|n",oEN="Speak with Mog'dorg the Wizened atop one of the towers just outside the Circle of Blood in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="你是上面派来的？看来我的任务真的受到祝福了！我试着拯救血槌不让他们被刀塔氏族和支持他们的格鲁尔之子歼灭。\n\n我相信你就是那个能够帮助我们这个秘密集团，并且带给我们自由的人。",cEN="You were sent from on high? Truly my mission is blessed! I am trying to save the Bloodmaul from annihilation by the Bladespire clan, and Gruul's sons, who are backing them.\n\nI trust that you will be the one to aid our secret society and deliver us into freedom."}
Q[11058]={d="很久以前，在奥格瑞拉居住着一支名叫埃匹希斯的鸦人氏族。现在，埃匹希斯氏族早已灭绝，他们在这一带留下了许多文明的遗物——埃匹希斯圣物。\n\n我们发现，采用适当的方法就可以令它们展示出潜在的能量。每件埃匹希斯圣物都有独特的色彩序列，只要以正确的顺序安放水晶，就能激发圣物中所蕴藏的潜能。\n\n你必须使用埃匹希斯碎片来引导埃匹希斯圣物内的能量。当你利用埃匹希斯圣物获得埃匹希斯的感应效果后，就回来找我吧。",dEN="Long ago a now-extinct sect of the arakkoa known as the Apexis lived here. Remnants of their civilization are still present. We call them apexis relics.\n\nWhat we know about them is that, when properly used, they grant a boon. Each relic presents a colored sequence which, when the crystals are pressed in the correct order, leads through a series of levels, each harder than the last.\n\nAn apexis shard is needed to power the relic. Return when you have attained the insight of the apexis vibration.",o="利用埃匹希斯圣物获得埃匹希斯的感应效果，然后。",oEN="Gain Apexis Vibrations from an Apexis Relic.",p="你学会如何使用圣物了吗？我们和北边的沙塔尔天空卫队都对你所学到的东西很有兴趣。",pEN="Have you learned how to use the apexis relic yet? Both we and the Sha'tari Skyguard just to the north are interested in what you learn about them.",c="<朱阿洛尔对你的成就满意地点头。>你头脑灵活，<name>。我们花了长得多的时间才成功用上那件遗物。既然你知道怎么用了，你想用多少次都行。只要记住，它们需要一枚埃匹希斯碎片才能驱动。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Chu'a'lor nods his heads at you in satisfaction at your accomplishment.>\n\nYou have a quick mind, <name>. It took us much longer to successfully make use of the relic.\n\nNow that you know how, you can do so as much as you care to. Just remember that they require an apexis shard to power them."}
Q[11059]={d="你已经掌握了小块埃匹希斯圣物的使用方法，不过你应该也留意到了它们环绕着体积更大的物体。\n\n这些埃匹希斯纪念碑的使用方法与埃匹希斯圣物如出一辙，不过需要四个人使用更多的埃匹希斯碎片才能激活它们。\n\n在激活埃匹希斯纪念碑的过程中，它还会召唤出埃匹希斯卫士。但是，这些水晶构造体生物早已背叛了它们的鸦人主子，演变成了威胁奥格瑞拉的祸害。\n\n去杀掉一尊埃匹希斯卫士，并带回它的徽记做为凭证。",dEN="You've figured out how to use the single-person relics, but as you may have seen, there are bigger ones, which they surround.\n\nThese larger apexis monuments function in much the same way, but they take many more apexis shards to activate and require four persons to operate.\n\nOf greater concern to us are the guardians that are summoned through their use. These crystal constructs turned on their arakkoan masters long ago, and now endanger Ogri'la.\n\nWe would ask that you destroy one and bring us proof.",o="将埃匹希斯卫士的徽记交给刀锋山奥格瑞拉的库洛尔，作为你击杀埃匹希斯卫士的证据。",oEN="Collect an Apexis Guardian's Head.",p="我们厌恶暴力，但至少我们派你去对抗的结构不是一个活的生命。\n\n说到这，你弄到那个头颅了吗？",pEN="We abhor violence, but at least the construct that we have sent you against isn't a living being.\n\nSpeaking of which, do you have the head?",c="<朱阿洛尔带着明显的敬意注视着你。>令我们印象深刻的不只是你和你朋友们的机敏，我们还欠你一份人情——奥格瑞拉和天空卫队的所有人都一样，因为你帮助保护了我们这里的生活方式。还有记住，<name>，你随时可以召集其他人，回到那些较大的埃匹希斯纪念碑去使用它们；只要你拥有足够的埃匹希斯碎片来驱动就行。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Chu'a'lor beams at you with obvious respect.>\n\nNot only are we impressed with the mental alacrity of you and your friends, but we are indebted to you, as is all of Ogri'la and the Skyguard, for helping to protect our way of life here.\n\nAnd remember, <name>, at any time you can gather others and return to any of those larger apexis monuments to make use of them; as long as you have enough apexis shards to power it that is."}
Q[11060]={d="恶魔正在把铸魔营地：暴怒扩建得更大。很快他们就会太强大，把我们碾碎。你先去碾碎他们！",dEN="Da demons are making da Forge Camp: Wrath bigger. Soon, dey be too big and crush us. You crush dem first!",o="控制住降解者，尽量附身穿过传送门的恶魔来阻止他们！",oEN="Take control of da degrader and possess as many of da demons dat come through da gate as you can ta stop dem!",p="恶魔正在把铸魔营地：暴怒扩建得更大。\n很快他们就会太强大，把我们碾碎。你先去碾碎他们！\n沙特鲁尔的传送器是关键，但它被一道魔法护盾和一个叫降解者的恶魔保护着。\n用你强大的<class>本领，制作一枚特殊的黑暗符文，让你能控制降解者。<race>把黑暗符文交给加赫，我们把水晶熔铸黑暗符文交还给<race>。\n控制住降解者，尽量附身穿过传送门的恶魔来阻止他们！",pEN="Da demons are making da Forge Camp: Wrath bigger. Soon, dey be too big and crush us. You crush dem first!\n\nShartuul's transporter is da key, but it protected by a magic shield and a demon called a degrader. Us powerful <class>, and make special darkrune dat give you control of da degrader. <race> give Gahk darkrune, us give <race> crystalforged darkrune back.\n\nTake control of da degrader and possess as many of da demons dat come through da gate as you can ta stop dem!",c="小<race>，记住，当你控制降解者时，你要用它的锤子砸碎扭曲传送门的护盾，放出里面的恶魔。\n然后你砸碎那个恶魔并控制它。\n接着另一个恶魔会来，你再控制它，直到艾瑞达监工出现。然后你把他也砸碎！\n！\n！",cEN="Little <race>, remember, when you control da degrader, you use its hammer ta smash da warp-gate's shield and let loose da demon within.\n\nDen you crush dat demon and control it. Den another demon come and you control it, until da eredar overseer come.\n\nDen you crush him too!!!"}
Q[11061]={d="要制作另一种合剂，只能利用巴什伊尔码头的水晶熔炉。那是一处虚灵的营地，他们对外来者很不友好，恐怕你得费些力气才能得到这种合剂。\n\n巴什伊尔码头的位置……唔，乘坐飞行坐骑往东北偏北方向前进，飞越铸魔营地：天罚之后就到了。巴什伊尔的水晶熔炉就在码头的东北角。\n\n$n，谢谢你。对我的孩子们来说，它意味着整个世界！",dEN="As to that other magical flask, it can only be obtained from one spot: Bash'ir Landing. It's an ethereal base, and they aren't too friendly with outsiders, so it might be a little dangerous to obtain.\n\nWhere's Bash'ir Landing, you ask? Well, if you get on your flying steed and head north by northeast, well past Forge Camp: Wrath, you'll eventually spot it. The Bash'ir crystalforge itself is at the northeast corner of the landing.\n\nThank you for doing this, <name>. It'll mean the world to our sons!",o="为他取得不稳定的巫术合剂。",oEN="Collect an Unstable Flask of the Sorcerer for him.",p="巫术合剂绝对会让我的儿子们变的更聪明，那对他们到了沙塔尔天空卫队之后要做的事会有很大的帮助。",pEN="That sorcerer's flask is sure to make my boys more intelligent than they already are, and that should help immensely with what they'll need to do once they're in the Sha'tari Skyguard.",c="我们对你感激不尽，<name>！现在有了这两瓶药剂，虽然不太稳定，我们就能把一个小伙子送到北边的天空卫队哨站去了。来，稍等一下，我们这就叫他们一个人过来。<托尔库斯右边的脑袋低声吼叫着呼唤他的小伙子。>\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="We can't thank you enough, <name>!\n\nNow with these two flasks, unstable though they may be, we'll be able to send one of our boys north to the Skyguard Outpost.\n\nHere, just wait a moment and we'll call for one of them.\n\n<Torkus's right head shouts out for his boy in a low growl.>"}
Q[11062]={d="$n，不知你是否愿意去北边的天空卫队哨站拜访一下我们的朋友？\n\n天空指挥官凯勒和他率领的天空卫队负责维护哨站以及奥格瑞拉的安全。他请求我们派遣一位有能力的勇士前去帮忙。\n\n这个人就是你！\n\n尽快赶往天空卫队哨站吧，记得替我们问候他。",dEN="<name>, we were wondering if you might be willing to visit our friends just to the north at the Skyguard Outpost?\n\nSky Commander Keller and his Skyguard are here running missions for our mutual protection, and he's asked us to send along anyone that we feel would excel at helping out.\n\nThat would be you!\n\nHead up there as soon as you can, and please, give him our regards.",o="库洛尔要求你与刀锋山天空卫队哨站的天空指挥官凯勒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sky Commander Keller at the Skyguard Outpost in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="欢迎来到天空卫队前哨！你知道这是我亲手建造的地方。\n\n对，全部！\n\n<天空指挥官看起来变得正经。>\n\n那么，如果你来这里和我说话就表示你想打一场仗。老库洛尔要你来找我是对的。我们永远都需要新血来处理这附近的事务。\n\n如果你不介意，我想请你先和我在对面的天空上尉范德里普谈谈。别在意她的毒舌，虽然那可能比她身上带的任何刀剑都锐利。",cEN="Welcome ta the Skyguard Outpost! I built it with me own hands ya know.\n\nYeah, the whole thing!\n\n<The sky commander looks serious.>\n\nSo, ye must be lookin' ta spoil for a fight if ye're here talkin' ta me. It was kind of old Chu'a'lor ta send ye along. We can always use fresh meat for the grinder around here.\n\nIf ye don't mind, I'd like ya ta start by having a talk with my sergeant across the way: Vanderlip. Don't mind her tongue, though it be sharper than the greatsword she be carrying."}
Q[11063]={c="所以你想加入碎天者？你证明了自己是个有能力的龙喉兽人，但那对外域的天空而言不算什么。你必须回答这个问题：你会飞行吗？\n\n我不是指骑上一只虚空龙送一批水晶到那些传送者垃圾的堡垒。我是在说成为一个最厉害的……顶尖兽人……\n\n在西边有六个骑手。击败他们我就会给你碎天者之翼。",cEN="So you wanna join the Skybreakers, eh? You've certainly proven yourself an able Dragonmaw but that means nothing in the skies of Outland. The question has to be answered: CAN YOU FLY?\n\nAnd I don't just mean being able to mount up on a nether drake and delivering a shipment of crystals to the fort like those transporter scrubs. I'm talking about being the best... The top orc...\n\nOver to the west there are six riders. Defeat them all and I will grant you Skybreaker wings."}
Q[11064]={d="别让这些白发骗了你。\n我骑术还是比你好十倍！也别以为这条老狗袖子里没藏着什么花招。\n现在你要做的就是跟着我，尽量别从坐骑上被摔下来。\n你要是能做到，老头子就认输。你准备好，我们就起飞。\n|n",dEN="Don't let the gray hair fool you, grunt. I'm still ten times the rider that you are! And don't go thinking that this old dog doesn't have any tricks up his sleeve.\n\nNow all you gotta do is follow me and try not to get knocked down off your mount. If you can do that, Oldie will admit defeat.\n\nWe'll lift off as soon as you're ready.",o="跟随老家伙默格·脏颚，同时尽力留在你的飞行坐骑上。如果你击败了老家伙默格·脏颚，就去影月谷龙喉营地，把你的胜利报告给贾伊·诺斯利夫。\"\"\"\"",oEN="Follow Murg \"Oldie\" Muckjaw while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Murg \"Oldie\" Muckjaw, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="不复往日？喔，这位强者是如何的堕落呢……我相信其它骑手会更具挑战性。",cEN="Pumpkins? Oh how the mighty have fallen... I am certain the other riders will prove to be much more challenging."}
Q[11065]={d="想帮天空卫队和奥格瑞拉一把吗？\n在你走开之前先听我说完，$g猛男:小妞;。\n我们需要新的坐骑！\n对巴什伊尔高地的轰炸任务和出击已经耗尽了我们的坐骑。在旋涡尖塔周围以及水晶之脊西北方飞行的以太鳐看来挺合适。\n你甚至不必把它们带到这里来，虽然那样也不错。\n只要驯服并拴住它们，我们稍后自己去取。\n你觉得能给我弄来一些吗？",dEN="Wanna help the Skyguard and Ogri'la?\n\nJust hear me out before you walk away, <hot stuff /girly>. We're in need of remounts! The bombing runs and missions to Bash'ir Landing have taken a toll on our mounts.\n\nThe aether rays that fly around Vortex Pinnacle, and the Crystal Spine to the northeast, look like they'd do just fine. Bring them back here.\n\nThink you can wrangle me up some?",o="天空卫士卡提要你用牧绳捕捉5只以太鳐。",oEN="Use the Wrangling Rope to capture 5 Aether Rays.",p="你抓到一些虚空鳐了吗？你看起来还蛮会使用套绳的，所以应该花不了你太多的时间。",pEN="You wrangle me some aether rays yet? You look like you might have some skill with rope, so it shouldn't take you too long.",c="哇呼！干得好，<name>！\n那些鳐会变成极好的坐骑！别走开，小子…\n…沙塔尔天空卫队永远欢迎像你这样明显有本事的人！",cEN="Woo hoo! Nice job, <name>! Those rays are going to make excellent mounts!\n\nStick around kid... the Sha'tari Skyguard can always use a man of your obvious talents!"}
Q[11066]={d="嗯，我希望你能帮助天空卫队捕获更多的以太鳐！我看得出来，你是个使用索套的能手！如此一来，我们不仅能补充飞行坐骑的数量，还能更好地保护奥格瑞拉。\n\n你可以在漩涡峰和东北方的水晶之脊上空找到以太鳐的踪迹。\n\n你愿意帮忙吗？",dEN="So, I hope that you're up to helping us wrangle up even more aether rays! From what I can see, you're a natural with the rope! And it's for a good cause, because not only do we get fresh mounts, but it helps us to protect Ogri'la, which the ogres appreciate.\n\nRemember, the aether rays fly around Vortex Pinnacle, and the Crystal Spine to the northeast.\n\nThink you can wrangle me up some more?",o="天空卫士卡提要你用牧绳捕捉5只以太鳐。",oEN="Use the Wrangling Rope to capture 5 Aether Rays.",p="你为我们干得很出色，<name>。我想让你知道，我们真的很感激你为保持我们坐骑储备所做的一切！",pEN="You're doing great work for us, <name>. I want you to know that we really appreciate everything that you're doing to keep us stocked up in fresh mounts!",c="你总是让我惊叹！\n这样吧…\n…\n你何不明天再来，我们让绳子先凉一凉？\n<卡蒂笑了。>太感谢你了，<name>！",cEN="You continue to amaze me! Tell you what... why don't you come back tomorrow and we'll let the rope cool off for now?\n\n<Khatie laughs.>\n\nThank you so much, <name>!"}
Q[11067]={d="龙喉待你不薄，$n。\n就连我这样一个疲惫不堪的受诅咒者也得到了机会。\n现在，如果你想向破天者证明自己的价值，就得打败我。我会像甩掉一身跳蚤一样把你从我尾巴上甩下去…\n…\n你$g准备好:准备好;，我们就起飞。",dEN="Dragonmaw treat you right, <name>. Even a worn out cursed being like me is given a chance. Now if you want to prove your worth to the Skybreakers, you will have to defeat me.\n\nI'm going to shake you off my tail like a bad case of fleas...\n\nWe'll lift off when you are ready.",o="驾驶飞行坐骑紧紧跟随粗野的特罗普。击败粗野的特罗普之后，将你的胜利消息报告给向影月谷龙喉营地的亚恩·诺斯利。",oEN="Follow Trope the Filth-Belcher while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Trope the Filth-Belcher, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="川普击败了我一些最厉害的骑手。别让他的污秽骗了你。",pEN="Trope defeated some of my best riders. Don't let the filthiness fool you.",c="有趣……你的下一场比赛绝对会更困难。克洛克不是省油的灯。",cEN="Interesting... Your next match will undoubtedly prove much more difficult. Corlok is no slouch."}
Q[11068]={d="你在挑战我？别逗我笑！\n你是认真的？\n那好吧！你要做的就是别死。\n你能做到不死，对吧？\n就算我朝你扔颅骨、绕着你那可怜骑术飞圈子也一样？你$g准备好:准备好;就告诉我，我们就起飞。",dEN="You are challenging ME? Don't make me laugh!\n\nYou're serious? Very well then! All you need to do is not die. You can manage to not die, right?? Even if I'm hurling skulls at you and flying circles around your pathetic riding skills?\n\nJust let me know when you're ready and we'll lift off.",o="驾驶飞行坐骑紧紧跟随兽医考洛克。击败兽医考洛克之后，将你的胜利消息报告给向影月谷龙喉营地的亚恩·诺斯利。",oEN="Follow Corlok the Vet while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Corlok the Vet, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="下两个骑手是艾泽拉斯最顶尖的矮人和兽人。你不可能赢的！",cEN="The next two riders were the two top pilots that the dwarves and orcs of Azeroth had to offer. You stand no chance!"}
Q[11069]={d="我在那个地狱般的洞里待了三年。作为该死的霜狼氏族的战俘待了三年。被迫坐在他们的塔里，听他们没完没了地抱怨通往丹巴达尔的那座桥。\n抱怨什么不公平，巴拉巴拉……\n战争本来就不公平！让他们全都见鬼去吧！他们一放了我，我就永远离开了那地方，回到这里开始新生活。\n现在我和穆尔夫在争当这里最顶尖的兽人。你要是想要这个位置，就得从我身上跨过去。\n你准备好我们就开始。\"\"",dEN="Three years I spent in that hell hole. Three years a prisoner of war to the damnable Frostwolf Clan. Made to sit in their tower and listen to them endlessly whine about the bridge to Dun Baldar. About how it's \"unfair\" that blah, blah, blah, blah... War isn't fair! To hell with 'em all!\n\nThe minute I was freed I left that place forever and came here to start a new life. Now Mulv and I are vying for the top orc spot. If you want it, you're gonna have to go through me, scrub.\n\nWe go when you're ready.",o="驾驶飞行坐骑紧紧跟随空军指挥官艾克曼。击败空军指挥官艾克曼之后，将你的胜利消息报告给向影月谷龙喉营地的亚恩·诺斯利。",oEN="Follow Wing Commander Ichman while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Wing Commander Ichman, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="我不敢相信！穆维里克是你的下一个挑战。你不可能会在那场比赛中存活的。",cEN="I don't believe it! Mulverick is your next challenge. There's no way you'll survive that match."}
Q[11070]={d="三年的血汗与泪水。主要是泪水…\n…一个久经沙场的老兵在全面战争面前能流下的眼泪，多得惊人！他们骑着马跳进我们的塔了！\n为什么他们的基地防守那么好？他们抢了我们的救济小屋，我要开小差！\n一群软蛋……\n黑暗之门一开，我就搭上第一班车离开了那座哭城。现在我可是龙喉的顶尖好手。你$g想当:想当;顶尖兽人，就得打败我。\n你准备好我们就开始。\"\n\"\"\n\"\"\"\n\"\"",dEN="Three years of blood, sweat and tears. Mostly tears... The amount of crying that a hardened soldier does when it comes down to all-out war is amazing!\n\n\"They're jumping into our tower with their horses!\" \"Why is their base so well defended?\" \"They're taking our relief hut, I'm going A.W.O.L.!\"\n\nWimps...\n\nI took the first train out of \"cry-town\" the minute the Dark Portal opened. Now I'm a top gun for the Dragonmaw. If you want to be top orc, you'll have to defeat me.\n\nWe go when you are ready.",o="跟随空军指挥官穆尔弗里克，同时尽力留在你的飞行坐骑上。如果你击败了空军指挥官穆尔弗里克，就去影月谷龙喉营地，把你的胜利报告给贾伊·诺斯利夫。|n",oEN="Follow Wing Commander Mulverick while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Wing Commander Mulverick, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="穆维里克是我见过最有天赋的骑手。唯一让他无法坐到顶尖兽人位置的问题，就是他的鲁莽。",pEN="Mulverick is the most gifted rider I've ever seen. The only thing holding him back from the top orc spot is his recklessness.",c="嗯看来现在只有你和队长了，蛮兵。祝你好运！你会需要的！",cEN="Well it looks like it's just you and the captain now, grunt. Good luck! You're gonna need it!"}
Q[11071]={d="你竟然有胆挑战我汤告鲁士？你周围的世界会彻底堕入黑暗，而天堂也会被我的流星击为碎片。\n\n你不会有任何机会的，士兵。不过，你既然这么渴望一死……\n\n若只是为了向那些做着同样愚蠢的梦，犯着同样愚蠢的错误人们展示我的力量，那么我就来好好享受你的惶恐与不安吧。\n\n你准备好了我们就开始！",dEN="You dare challenge Skyshatter? The world around you will fall into darkness as the heavens are torn asunder by my meteors.\n\nYou stand no chance, soldier. Yet it is your desire to die...\n\nI will entertain this morbid obsession if only to prove a point to any that might foolishly dream of making the same mistake.\n\nWe ride when you are ready!",o="驾驶飞行坐骑紧紧跟随汤告鲁士·碎空。击败汤告鲁士·碎空之后，将你的胜利消息报告给向影月谷龙喉营地的亚恩·诺斯利。",oEN="Follow Captain Skyshatter while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Captain Skyshatter, report your victory to Ja'y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="第二名也不赖，<name>。你可以顶替穆尔弗里克在阵容里的位置……",pEN="Second place isn't that bad, <name>. You can take Mulverick's spot on the line-up...",c="我从没想过会有人那么厉害能击败碎天者。你知道这代表了什么意义吧？你现在是顶尖兽人！你一定要守住你的头衔。",cEN="I never dreamed any would be skilled enough to defeat Skyshatter. You do know what this means, right? You are now the top orc! You must defend your title."}
Q[11073]={d="我……\n我对你和那个鸦人囚犯的往来睁一只眼闭一只眼，$n。看来你与他合作的直觉是对的。\n你必须明白……以我现在的处境，如果我支持你把泰罗克带到这个世界的努力，就会面临哗变。\n拿上哈兹克为你准备的东西，继续你的计划吧。时机到来时，我会命令我的人支援你。\n我建议你也带上一支自己的队伍。恐怕你只有一次机会。",dEN="I... I've turned a blind eye to your dealings with the arakkoa prisoner, <name>. It looks like your instincts to cooperate with him were right.\n\nYou must understand... I would've faced a mutiny in my current state if I endorsed your efforts to bring Terokk to this world.\n\nTake the items that Hazzik prepared for you and go ahead with your plan. I will command my men to back you up when the time comes. I recommend that you bring a force of your own as well. I fear you'll only get one chance at this.",o="将哈吉克准备好的失落的祭品带到斯克提斯中央的徽记堆，召唤出泰罗克并击败它。完成这个任务之后回去向空军指挥官阿达利斯复命。",oEN="Take the Time-Lost Offering prepared by Hazzik to the Skull Pile at the center of Skettis and summon and defeat Terokk. Return to Sky Commander Adaris when you've completed this task.",p="办好了吗，<name>？泰罗克被击败了吗？",pEN="Is it done, <name>? Has Terokk been defeated?",c="你让我们所有人都感到无比自豪，<name>。我会把你的功绩传回沙塔斯。天空卫队将永远欠你一份人情。",cEN="You've made us all very proud, <name>. I'll send word of your deeds back to Shattrath. The Skyguard will be forever in your debt."}
Q[11074]={d="这本书中列有斯克提斯爪之祭司所囚禁着的所有泰罗克的宿敌的后裔，包括猎手吉萨拉克、水晶巨人卡尔洛格，还有被贬为异端的黑暗尖啸者阿克卡莱和风怒者瓦克奇斯。必须要在泰罗克回到这个世界之前将他们全部杀死。\n\n你首先需要夺取一些迷失鸦人身上带着的卷轴，然后在斯克提斯的召唤法阵中烧掉卷轴，召唤并杀死它们，从它们身上各找一样信物带回来。要知道，它们都是非常非常强大的存在，你最好带上几个朋友一起去。",dEN="The descendants held prisoner by the Skettis talonpriests are listed in this book. Gezzarak the Huntress, Garokk the Crystal Giant, the heretic known as Darkscreecher Akkarai and Vekkaz the Windrager. They will all need to be slain before Terokk returns to this world.\n\nYou will need the scrolls carried by the time-lost arakkoa and burn them at the summoning circles all over Skettis. Bring me a token from each one. These are powerful beings you will be facing; you would do well to bring friends.",o="从斯克提斯的迷失鸦人身上收集迷失卷轴，然后将它们拿到召唤法阵的徽记堆内，召唤出泰罗克仇敌的后裔，并击败它们。然后带着阿克卡莱之爪、卡尔洛格之脊、瓦克奇斯之鳞和吉萨拉克之爪回去向哈吉克复命。",oEN="Collect Time-Lost Scrolls from the time-lost arakkoa in Skettis and bring them to a Skull Pile inside a summoning circle in Skettis. Summon and defeat the descendants of Terokk's adversaries and return to Hakkiz with Akkarai's Talon, Garokk's Spine, Vekkaz's Scale and Gezzarak's Claw.",p="我要每个泰罗克劲敌子嗣的象征物品。只有这样我们才能准备好召唤泰罗克。",pEN="I require a token from each of the descendants of Terokk's greatest adversaries. Only then will we be ready to summon Terokk.",c="太好了！拿上这个。\n我把你获得的东西打包好了。它们能让你召唤泰罗克。小心，<name>。\n他是有史以来最强大的鸦人。别小看他！",cEN="Excellent! Take this. I've prepared this bundle with the items you obtained. They will allow you to summon Terokk.\n\nBeware, <name>. He is the most powerful arakkoa to ever exist. Do not underestimate him!"}
Q[11075]={d="灵翼矿洞需要你的帮助，监工$n。\n\n两天前的突发事件迫使我们中断了灵翼矿洞的开采作业。一名矿工在深井下工作时，将他的镐敲在了一片非同寻常的水晶阵列上，而那片水晶竟然是一只虚空龙身上的附着物！这头被惊醒的野兽变得狂暴不已，杀死了所有的矿工。\n\n立即转至西南方的灵翼矿洞，向矿洞女王报到。他们就在矿洞入口处等你。",dEN="Your help is required at the Netherwing Mines, overseer <name>.\n\nTwo days ago our mining operations came to a grinding halt when we made a grim discovery. A miner was working in the depths of the mine and struck his pick upon an unusual crystal formation. Unfortunately, this crystal formation was attached to a very angry nether dragon. The beast woke from its slumber and annihilated all of our workers.\n\nReport to the Mistress of the Mines. They await you at the mouth of the mines, southwest of here.",o="转至灵翼浮岛，找到矿洞女王。",oEN="Seek out the Mistress of the Mines on Netherwing Ledge.",c="矿工都很努力工作，但他们没有人敢多踏进矿洞里一步。他们宁愿死也不要到深处采矿！你要完成他们不能做到的任务。",cEN="The miners are working hard but none dare step foot further into the mines. They choose death rather than being forced to mine deeper! It is going to be your job to carry out the duties and tasks that they failed to complete."}
Q[11076]={d="我们的劳动成果！成堆的货物被散乱地丢弃在矿洞中！当前的情况是一片混乱，我们根本没法取回货物。\n\n$n，这就是我叫你过来帮忙的原因。你在这里的日常工作就是深入矿洞，收集那些被矿工抛下的货物。\n\n将灵翼矿洞的货物带回来，交给我或是我的姐妹。",dEN="Much of our hard work lies scattered about in these mines. Carts full of cargo are littered across every inch of this mine! We just can't get to any of it with the current infestation.\n\nThat's where you come in, <name>. Your daily duty here at this mine is to collect the cargo left behind by the miners and deep mine workers.\n\nGather the nethermine cargo and return it to me or my sister.",o="影月谷灵翼矿洞的矿洞女王要你取回15份虚空矿洞的货物。",oEN="The Mistress of the Mines at the Netherwing Mines in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to recover 15 Nethermine Cargo crates.",p="你收集完货物了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the cargo?",c="干得好，<name>。明天再来，接受矿坑深处的新任务。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Return tomorrow for another mission into the depths of the mine."}
Q[11077]={d="被惊醒的虚空龙引发了一连续的骚动，混乱的场面激怒了其它居住在矿洞中的生物。其中，虚空矿洞剥石者和虚空矿洞掠食者简直是龙喉氏族的眼中钉。你必须帮助我们清除这些野兽，我要你把这当做日常的工作来做。\n\n去吧，尽量削减它们的数量！",dEN="That dragon waking up riled up a host of other nasty creatures in these mines. Two types are proving to be a thorn in the side of the Dragonmaw: Nethermine flayers and Nethermine ravagers. You must help us by killing them off. All I ask is your involvement once per day.\n\nGet in there and kill as many as you can!",o="影月谷灵翼矿洞的龙喉工头要你杀死15只虚空矿洞剥石者和5只虚空矿洞掠食者。",oEN="The Dragonmaw Foreman at the Netherwing Mines in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to kill 15 Nethermine Flayers and 5 Nethermine Ravagers.",p="剥石者侵扰的问题解决的怎么样了？",pEN="How's that flayer infestation problem coming along?",c="今天就到这里吧，监工。明天再来进行另一次的任务。",cEN="That'll be enough for today, overseer. Come back tomorrow for another round of clean up."}
Q[11078]={d="当你在这附近飞行时，一定注意到了那几条在高空盘旋的巨龙，不过想必你还没有跟它们交过手吧？$n，去帮我们干掉那些巨龙如何！\n\n雷文达克和欧比斯迪一直盘踞在奥格瑞拉上空，因斯迪安和弗雷文则在东北方的高空作威作福，它们在各自的领地上修筑了巢穴。如果你和你的朋友能打破巢穴中的龙蛋，必定会激怒巨龙。\n\n将龙齿带回来给我，做为你击杀巨龙的凭证。天空的统治者要么是它们，要么就是我们。",dEN="As ye've flown around, ye must have noticed the dragons above. I trust ye haven't fallen victim ta their rage. Help us put an end ta it, <name>!\n\nRivendark and Obsidia lord over this terrace, while Insidion and Furywing rule the skies over yon terrace ta the northeast. Each has a perch on their respective domains. I be wondering if ye and yer friends will go ta one, <lad /lass>, break open an egg and attract the dragon down.\n\nBring me some teeth as proof. Ta rule the skies, it's either them or us.",o="收集龙齿。",oEN="Collect Dragon Teeth.",p="你的任务进展如何，<name>？不用我说你也知道，这对我们继续在这一带飞行有多重要。",pEN="How fares yer mission, <name>? I needn't tell ye how important this be ta our continued ability ta fly around up here.",c="很好！那些牙齿看起来利的可以咬断任何东西！\n\n让我鼓励你和你的朋友继续维持这样的表现！那些龙是凶猛的掠夺者让天空变的非常危险。\n\n你或许也注意到，龙鳞。我听说如果你在它们身上各取得一个鳞片，它们很适合用来做强大的披风。如果你不满意得到的披风，我很乐意用一个顶尖水晶来做交换。",cEN="Yes! Those teeth look like they be sharp enough ta cut through just about anything!\n\nAnd let me encourage ye and yer friends ta keep up the good work! Those dragons be fierce predators that make the skies wholly unsafe.\n\nYe might have noticed, too, the dragon scales. I hear they be good fer making powerful cloaks if ye get one o' each o' their scales. And if yer not happy with the cloak ya get, I'll be willing ta trade ye an apexis crystal fer it."}
Q[11079]={d="加赫有时觉得聪明就是愚蠢。加赫不想动脑子。\n我要$g小:小;去砸大恶魔！\n他们有头目，头目都有鞭子，用来打小恶魔。你给加赫带一条鞭子来！\n你去燃烧的绿色邪能水晶棱柱那里的铸魔营地挑战恶魔头目。\n用很多埃匹希斯碎片把它们召来。它们叫加尔瓦诺斯、布拉库斯、扎克辛和莫尔葛焚化者。",dEN="Gahk think being smart is dumb sometimes. Gahk not want to think. Me want little <race> to smash big demons!\n\nDey have some chiefs, and da chiefs all have whips to hurt da little demons. You bring Gahk a whip!\n\nYou challenge demon chief in forge camps at burning, green, fel crystal prism. Use many apexis shards to get dem to come. Dey called Galvanoth, Braxxus, Zarcsin and da Mo'arg Incinerator.",o="取得一根魔鞭。",oEN="Collect a Fel Whip.",p="你弄到魔鞭了吗？",pEN="Yous have da whip?",c="加赫喜欢鞭子。\n也许加赫会拿鞭子抽恶魔！\n我跟<race>说，只要<race>有朋友和很多碎片，<race>随时都能召唤恶魔头目。",cEN="Gahk like whip. Maybe Gahk take whip and beat demons with it!\n\nMe say to <race> that <race> summon demon chiefs anytime <race> have friends and many shards."}
Q[11080]={d="既然你已经感受到了埃匹希斯的感应所带来的启迪，那么就继续探索埃匹希斯圣物的奥秘吧。你的发现会使我们获益匪浅！\n\n增强你的能力与埃匹希斯圣物之间的关联，你就能领悟到更高深的知识，这就是埃匹希斯的顿悟。\n\n当你利用埃匹希斯圣物获得埃匹希斯的顿悟效果后就回来找我吧。",dEN="Now that you have felt the enlightening vibrations of the apexis relics, it is time for you to further your understanding of their workings. We are very eager to benefit from your observations!\n\nAs you progress in your ability to attune to the relics, you will gain a higher level of knowledge. This recognition will come in the form of an emanation from the relic.\n\nReturn to us when you have attained such an emanation.",o="利用埃匹希斯圣物获得埃匹希斯的顿悟效果。",oEN="Gain Apexis Emanations from an Apexis Relic.",p="你从圣物那里取得了放射增益吗？",pEN="Do you have the emanation from the apexis relic about you?",c="你在遗物方面的敏锐依旧让我们惊叹。。\n我们能否建议你每天至少练习一次使用遗物，好保持这份敏锐的头脑？",cEN="You continue to amaze us with your acumen as concerns the relics.\n. May we suggest that you practice with the relics at least once a day to maintain such a sharp edge to your mental acuity?"}
Q[11081]={d="这份文档概述了暗血破碎者的叛逃计划。看来他们企图利用那只虚空龙分布我们的注意力，想要借此机会集体逃亡。矿洞中横七竖八地躺满了暗血破碎者的尸体，很明显，他们的计划失败了。\n\n将这份逃亡计划交给矿洞女王。",dEN="This document outlines a revolt planned by the Murkblood broken. It seems that the dragon was to be used as a diversion to draw attention away from their escape. Looking at all of the corpses littering the mine, it would be safe to assume that their plans failed.\n\nReturn the escape plans to the Mistress of the Mines.",o="将暗血逃亡计划交给矿洞女王。",oEN="Take the Murkblood Escape Plans to the Mistress of the Mines.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What's this?",c="做得好，监工。莫格霍尔会知道你为龙喉做的杰出表现。\n\n现在回去找这些黑暗之血无赖。他们策划逃亡？他们敢违抗外域真正的领主？他们的主人会为此付出代价！",cEN="Excellent work, overseer. Mor'ghor will hear of your outstanding service to the Dragonmaw.\n\nNow back to these Murkblood dogs. They plan an escape, eh? Dare they defy the one true lord of Outland? Their masters will pay for this!"}
Q[11082]={d="这群愚蠢的矿工居然还制订出了逃跑计划。我们必须揪出煽动他们叛逃的幕后主使，然后狠狠地惩罚他。我要你深入矿洞，寻找暗血监工的下落。如果他们还没有被矿洞中的野兽给干掉的话，那肯定是找到什么隐秘之处藏起来了。\n\n如果你搜出一名暗血监工，就立即拷问他，逼他供出逃亡计划的主使者。得知幕后主谋的真实身份后，将监工之手带回来向我复命。",dEN="These miners are far too stupid to concoct any type of escape plan. We must find and punish the source. Venture into the depths of the mine and seek out the Murkblood overseers. If they have not been overcome by the denizens of the mine, they will undoubtedly be hiding.\n\nOnce you locate one, interrogate him until he reveals the true mastermind behind the escape. Return to me with the identity of this traitor and the hand of the overseer.",o="找到一名暗血监工，然后审讯他。向矿洞女王汇报审讯的结果，并将监工之手交给她。",oEN="Find a Murkblood Overseer and interrogate him. Return to the Mistress of the Mines with the Murkblood information and the Hand of the Overseer.",p="怎么样？为什么那么久？",pEN="Well? What's taking so long?",c="无可奉告？或许等他躺在这个该死的矿洞地上失血而死的时候他就会想起来……想起和伊利丹的力量作对是什么意思！",cEN="Nothing to say? Perhaps as he lies bleeding to death on the floor of this cursed mine he will remember... Remember what it means to cross the forces of Illidan!."}
Q[11083]={d="别管那只虚空龙，$n。我们自有别的安排……\n\n灵翼矿洞深处有一群疯狂的暗血破碎者，自从虚空龙捣毁矿洞后，他们就被困在了下面。孤立无援的感受大概不好受吧，才两天而已，这帮家伙就彻底丧失了理智。\n\n他们竟然有了食尸的癖好，并开始自残肢体。我们绝不容许这些癫狂的生物存在。去干掉他们！一个不剩！",dEN="Don't worry about this dragon, <name>. We've got plans for it...\n\nDeeper in this mine is a band of crazed Murkblood. After the dragon broke out, they were cut off from the exit. Somehow, after a mere 2 days of isolation, they've lost all sense of decency.\n\nThey've resorted to cannibalism and the promotion of mayhem. We don't need that kind of madness in this place. Find 'em and kill 'em. All of 'em.",o="影月谷灵翼矿洞的驱奴者鲁纳格要你杀死疯狂的暗血工头和5名疯狂的暗血矿工。",oEN="Ronag the Slave Driver in the Netherwing Mines of Shadowmoon Valley wants you to slay the Crazed Murkblood Foreman and 5 Crazed Murkblood Miners.",p="问题解决了吗？\"\"",pEN="Is the problem \"solved\"?",c="不，我不了解……你会觉得就算再过两天，他们也不至于那么饿。黑暗之血……\n\n<罗纳葛摇摇他的头。>\n\n可恶他们真笨……",cEN="Yeah, I don't understand it... You would think that they wouldn't even be that hungry after 2 days. Murkblood...\n\n<Ronag shakes his head.>\n\nDamn they're stupid..."}
Q[11084]={d="哇呀呀，你……你还活着。很好，莫格霍尔大王要在他的塔楼召见你，要是你死了的话我还真不好交差。快去吧！",dEN="Well, well, well... still alive I see. That's good, because Mor'ghor has requested your presence in his tower at once. Get a move on!",o="与影月谷龙喉营地的莫格霍尔大王谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="<莫格霍尔点点头。>没错，我说的是上尉。你又赢得了一次晋升，<name>。你干活的样子可完全不像我见过的任何邪兽人。继续保持，也许有一天你能当上领主。现在出去接管指挥吧。我建议你去争取赢得破天之翼。\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Mor'ghor nods.>\n\nThat's right, I said captain. You've earned another promotion, <name>.\n\nYou certainly don't work like any fel orc I've ever seen. Keep this up and you might make overlord some day.\n\nNow get out there and take command. I would suggest you try and earn your Skybreaker wings."}
Q[11085]={d="太好了，$n。我非常感谢你特意过来帮助我。\n\n我在执行侦察任务的时候，被那些鸦人所饲养的大怪鸟从虚空鳐的背上给撞了下来。\n\n趁一切还来得及，我们赶紧离开这里吧。",dEN="Hail, <name>. I thank you for coming to my aid.\n\nThe arakkoa's monstrous birds knocked me from my nether ray while on a scouting mission.\n\nLet's get out of here, while we can.",o="护送天空卫队囚犯转至安全的地方，然后向空军上尉杜尔因复命。",oEN="Escort the Skyguard Prisoner to safety and report to Sky Sergeant Doryn.",p="什么事，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="谢谢你救出我们的一名斥候，<name>。我们每天都在损失好人，而新兵根本不够填补空缺。",cEN="Thank you for rescuing one of our scouts, <name>. We lose good people every day and there aren't enough new recruits to replace them."}
Q[11086]={d="身为一名龙喉队长，你最重要的责任之一就是扼杀燃烧军团在外域的一切活动。记住，让那些打扰到伊利丹大人的家伙都永远闭嘴，这是你的义务！\n\n现在，那群愚蠢的恶魔正尝试在纳格兰西方的暮光岭一带创建一处传送门。他们必须为背叛而付出代价，而你，就将是我们派去收取这代价的代表。\n\n转至暮光岭，消灭那里的恶魔。对他们的防御工事，你至少每天得发动一次攻击。",dEN="One of your responsibilities as a captain of Dragonmaw is to snuff out Burning Legion activity in Outland. It is your duty to silence those that defy Lord Illidan!\n\nThe demons foolishly attempt to stabilize the portal found on the Twilight Ridge of western Nagrand. They must pay for their treachery, and you will be the orc that collects on their debt.\n\nTravel to the Twilight Ridge and lay waste to its inhabitants. You will be responsible for making at least one attack per day on their fortifications.",o="影月谷龙喉营地的莫格霍尔大王要你杀死20名死影密探。",oEN="Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to kill 20 Deathshadow Agents.",p="毕竟，是我们的伊利丹大人把那些恶魔从外域放逐并关闭了他们的传送门。一切都应向伊利丹的辉煌成就鞠躬。",pEN="It was our lord, after all, that banished the demons from Outland and closed their portals. All should bow down to the magnificence of Illidan.",c="做得好，队长！伊利丹大人会知道你的英雄事迹的！",cEN="Excellent work, captain! Lord Illidan will hear of your heroism!"}
Q[11089]={d="雷萨赫尔顿领导着纳格兰暮光谷的恶魔。让这样一个力量强大的艾瑞达人在这个世上嚣张，实在是有损我们伊利达雷的脸面……但是我们也没有足够的力量去对付雷萨赫尔顿。至少在当前战火已经烧到黑暗神殿门口的状况下，我们没有……哦……不对……我有个更好的计划。\n\n你，没错，你将去制服雷萨赫尔顿，将他丢进暮光传送门去，将他放逐出这个世界。但要执行这个计划，必须先铸造一台灵魂火炮。\n\n把清单上所列的东西带回来给我。",dEN="Reth'hedron now lords over the Twilight Ridge of Nagrand. An eredar of such power being loosed upon this world does not bode well for the Illidari. Alas, we do not have the resources required to slay Reth'hedron. Not with the war the Sha'tar have brought to the Black Temple. No... I have a better plan.\n\nYou will subdue Reth'hedron, banishing him back through the Twilight Portal. For this a soul cannon must be fashioned.\n\nReturn to me with the materials on this list.",o="影月谷龙喉营地的伊利达雷领主巴塔斯要你将2块魔钢锭、1个精金框架、1个氪金能量核心和1份完美的奥术精华交给他。",oEN="Illidari Lord Balthas at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley wants you to bring him 2 Felsteel Bars, 1 Adamantite Frame, 1 Khorium Power Core and 1 Flawless Arcane Essence.",p="你收集好制作灵魂火炮需要的材料了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the components required to fashion the soul cannon?",c="<巴塔斯熟练地将你带给他的材料组合在一起。>\n\n你现在可以进行计划的第二阶段了，队长。",cEN="<Balthas deftly combines the components you brought him.>\n\nYou are now ready for the second phase of the plan, captain."}
Q[11090]={d="<巴塔斯手里拿着一件古怪的装置。>\n\n这是一台灵魂火炮，完成同调操作的火炮具备毁灭性的效果。我已经将它与我的血液进行了同调，而雷萨赫尔顿体内流动着的血液和我的完全相同。是的，他是我的兄弟。哎，可惜他选错了效忠的主子，而这也就导致了他的灭亡。\n\n带上灵魂火炮转至纳格兰的暮光岭，找到雷萨赫尔顿并向他开火！你必须待在你的座骑上，确保距离在射程之内。只要你坚持得住，最终他只能落败而逃！",dEN="<Balthas holds up an alien looking device.>\n\nThis is a soul cannon. Its effects are devastating when attuned. This one is attuned to my blood. The same blood flowing through the veins of Reth'hedron - my brother. Aye, his misplaced allegiance will be the end of him.\n\nTake the cannon and fly to the Twilight Ridge in western Nagrand. Locate Reth'hedron and fire! You must stay on your mount and within range for the effects to take hold. Stand your ground against him and he will have no choice but to flee!",o="影月谷龙喉营地的伊利达雷领主巴塔斯要你转至纳格兰，对征服者雷萨赫尔顿使用灵魂火炮。\n\n完成任务后归还灵魂火炮。",oEN="Illidari Lord Balthas at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley has tasked you with using the Soul Cannon on Reth'hedron the Subduer in Nagrand.\n\nYou must also return the Soul Cannon.",p="完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="他会回来的，但眼下燃烧军团对伊利丹大人的战争已经被削弱了。他会知道你的功绩的，上尉。",cEN="He will be back, but for now the Legion's war against Lord Illidan is weakened. He shall know of your deeds, captain."}
Q[11091]={d="我们为有你这样的英雄感到骄傲。我想让你去见见霍纳斯。\n\n他是我们最信赖的军需官，负责向奥格瑞拉的忠诚盟友提供物资。\n\n而你，$n，你就是我们的盟友。\n\n有时间的话就去找他谈谈吧，据说他为你准备了一件小礼物，以此表示我们对你的感激之情。",dEN="You honor us with your efforts on our behalf. And now there is someone that we would like for you to meet.\n\nJho'nass is our most trusted quartermaster. He maintains a stock of goods that we provide for sale to only the most dedicated of friends to Ogri'la.\n\nYou are one such friend, <name>.\n\nWhen you find the time, go and speak with him. As we understand it, he has prepared a little something for you as a token of our appreciation.",o="跟刀锋山奥格瑞拉的霍纳斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Jho'nass at Ogri'la in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="嘿，老兄，那太棒了。我们听说你一直在做好事。\n真酷。\n我们有种预感，你会把奥格瑞拉这里的事情理顺，让我们平平安安，一切都舒舒服服的。来，收下这个。\n没什么大不了的，只是我们为你这份努力准备的一份慰问品。\n随便看看我们的货物吧。我们有很多你想要的好东西。",cEN="Hey. man. that's great. We hear you've been doing good things. That's cool. We've got a feeling that you're going to make things right for us here in Ogri'la, and keep us safe, and everything nice and mellow.\n\nHere, take this. It's nothing much, just a care package that we whipped up as a thanks for your effort.\n\nFeel free to look around at our goods. We have a lot of really choice stuff that you're gonna want to get."}
Q[11092]={d="$n队长！\n\n<工头瓦尔库勒对你敬了个礼。>\n\n莫格霍尔大王请你立刻转至他的房间接受觐见！",dEN="Captain <name>!\n\n<Taskmaster Varkule salutes you.>\n\nOverlord Mor'ghor has asked to see you in his chambers at once!",o="与影月谷龙喉营地的莫格霍尔大王谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="伊利丹大人亲自要我推荐你为远征军指挥官，这是史无前例的！你会是龙喉兽人中第一个在黑暗神庙外达到这样军阶的人。",cEN="Lord Illidan himself has asked that I promote you to the rank of commander! This is unprecedented. You will be the first Dragonmaw to reach such a rank outside of the Black Temple."}
Q[11093]={d="只要加以合适的训练，虚空鳐也能成为一种无比忠诚而且高度服从的坐骑。但糟糕的是，我们在与斯克提斯的战争之中损失了太多的虚空鳐。\n\n每天，都会有无数的鸦人试图突破我们的包围网，这些可怜的家伙们随时要上战场，根本得不到休息。更何况，这里给养不足，饲料也不够。就算它们命大，没在战斗里被那些该死的鸟人杀掉，恐怕也得饿死。\n\n如果你想帮忙的话，就带上一只虚空鳐去南边的森林里放放风吧。它们现在连迁跃追猎者的肉也能接受了——只要足够新鲜。",dEN="Nether rays are surprisingly loyal and obedient once properly trained. Unfortunately the war on Skettis is taking a toll on them.\n\nWe have dozens of sorties a day - the poor fellows rarely get a break. And with recent shortages on feed, if those blasted birdmen don't kill them on a mission then starvation will.\n\nIf you can lend a hand, take one of our rays to the woods in the south. They don't mind warp chaser meat as long as it's a fresh kill.",o="在黑风码头南边的森林内使用虚空鳐的笼子，并在饥饿的虚空鳐旁杀死黑风追迹者。完成任务之后回去向天空卫队训练师德萨克复命。",oEN="Use the Nether Ray Cage in the woods south of Blackwind Landing and slay Blackwind Warp Chasers near the Hungry Nether Ray. Return to Skyguard Handler Deesak when you've completed your task.",p="你回来了！你的虚空鳐有乖乖的吗？",pEN="You're back! Did your ray behave well?",c="谢谢你照顾那只鳐，<name>。天晓得这些家伙吃饱了飞得好多了。我们可不想我们的小伙子因为鳐太虚弱飞不动而被击落。",cEN="Thanks for taking care of the ray, <name>. Goodness knows these guys fly much better when they're well-fed. We don't want our boys getting shot down because their ray was too weak to fly."}
Q[11094]={d="指挥官$n，立正！现在，你将立刻领导一队碎天者转至攻击黑暗神殿西北方的占星者哨站。只要摧毁了群星圣殿，我们与库斯卡岗哨之间的补给线就可以重新运作起来了。\n\n快去吧，用这个信号枪指引碎天者展开攻击！",dEN="Commander <name>, stand at attention! You are to take a battalion of Skybreakers and sack the Scryers' outpost located at the foot of the Netherwing Fields. With the Sanctum of the Stars destroyed, our lines of communication to our posts at Eclipse Point and Illidari Point will once more be open.\n\nGo now! Use this flare gun to signal the Skybreakers for the attack!",o="将任务的相关情报和龙喉信号枪一起交给群星圣殿的奥术师塞里斯。",oEN="Deliver news of your mission along with the Dragonmaw Flare Gun to Arcanist Thelis at the Sanctum of the Stars in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="安顿下来，孩子。",pEN="Settle down, child.",c="你来找我们是件好事。或许我们可以利用这次攻击扭转对龙喉的情势。",cEN="It is good that you came to us. Perhaps we can use this attack to our advantage and turn the tables on the Dragonmaw."}
Q[11095]={d="龙喉氏族也就只敢趁我们不备时发动攻击。要是我们有所准备的话，他们肯定没有取胜的机会。\n\n$n，我要你引他们来战。\n\n<塞里斯点了点头。>\n\n对，没错……这是陷阱。莫格霍尔大王不是给了你一把信号枪吗？将信号枪交给这座建筑物外面的指挥官霍布。",dEN="The Dragonmaw only dare attack us when our guard is down. They would face certain defeat if they were to attack us while we were prepared.\n\nI want you to let them come, <name>.\n\n<Thelis nods.>\n\nYes... a trap. Take this flare that their overlord gave you and deliver it to Commander Hobb. He is standing guard right outside this building.",o="将龙喉信号枪交给影月谷群星圣殿的指挥官霍布。",oEN="Give the Dragonmaw Flare to Commander Hobb at the Sanctum of the Stars in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="<赫布点点头。>",pEN="<Hobb nods.>",c="<赫布露齿而笑。>\n\n史上最致命的陷阱……",cEN="<Hobb grins.>\n\nThe deadliest trap ever laid..."}
Q[11096]={d="这么说，你想加入天空卫队？好吧，我知道你确实能飞……可你会战斗吗？\n\n天空卫队誓死保卫沙塔斯免受一切威胁。当前居住在北方壁垒山中的戈杜尼食人魔是最紧迫的威胁。\n\n这些食人魔已经危害到了沙塔斯的地面交通和人员安全。这就是我们必须要去解决的问题。现在让我们来看看你能帮上什么忙吧。",dEN="So you want to join the Skyguard? Well, I know you can fly... but can you fight?\n\nThe Skyguard is sworn to protect Shattrath from the dangers that loom above us, both near and far. The Gordunni ogres who dwell in the Barrier Hills to the north are an immediate threat to us.\n\nReaching the ogres has been problematic for Shattrath's ground units. That's where we come in. See what you can do to help contain them.",o="在壁垒山杀死任意20个戈杜尼食人魔，然后向沙塔斯城的尤拉复命。",oEN="Slay any 20 Gordunni Ogres in the Barrier Hills and return to Yuula in Shattrath City.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="做得好，高手。我有预感，你会和我们处的很好。",cEN="Good job, ace. I've a feeling you're going to fit in well with us."}
Q[11097]={d="拿上这些占星者勋章。等这一切结束后，莫格霍尔会需要你胜利的证明。他会认得出这些来自阵亡占星者士兵的尸体。\n现在只剩下用信号弹给龙喉劫掠者报信了。等你$g准备好:准备好;，我们就把他们碾碎。\n只要跟我说一声。\"\"",dEN="Take these Scryer medals. Mor'ghor will need proof of \"victory\" once this is over. He will recognize them as coming from the corpses of fallen Scryer soldiers.\n\nNow all that remains is to use the signal flare to alert the Dragonmaw raiders. We will crush them when you are ready. Just give me the word.",o="协助指挥官霍布和占星者守卫星辰圣所。等你们消灭所有龙喉部队后，带着占星者勋章回到龙喉营地向领主莫格霍尔复命。|n",oEN="Assist Commander Hobb and the Scryers in defending the Sanctum of the Stars. Once all of the Dragonmaw forces have been defeated, return to Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp with the Scryer Medals.",p="你把他们粉碎在你脚下了吗，指挥官？",pEN="Did you crush them under your boot, commander?",c="<莫格霍尔大笑。>\n\n哈！我就知道你不会让我失望，指挥官！我要你每天带领一个团队转至群星圣殿至少一次。他们会别无选择而离开影月谷！",cEN="<Mor'ghor laughs.>\n\nHAH! I knew you wouldn't let me down, commander! I want you to lead a raid on the Sanctum of the Stars at least once per day. They will have no choice but to leave Shadowmoon!"}
Q[11098]={d="壁垒山只是我们的战略目标之一。最近，位于鸦羽山另一侧的鸦人巢穴斯克提斯逐渐成为了我们的新的威胁，虽然这处鸦人势力离我们甚远，但是他们的强大力量绝对不容忽视。\n\n几个月前，斥候回报说那里有大规模的鸦人活动，紧接着沙塔斯城就遭到了攻击。我们已经在斯克提斯外围部署了部队。\n\n转至斯克提斯外的黑风码头将这些爆炸物交给空军上尉杜尔因。顺便告诉他，你是我派去的新兵。",dEN="The Barrier Hills are only one of the fronts where we've been deployed. A less immediate but far more dangerous threat looms from beyond the Skethyl Mountains, from within the arakkoa city of Skettis.\n\nA few months ago our scouts detected a huge increase in arakkoa activity there. Several attacks against Shattrath followed. We've stationed forces outside of their city since.\n\nTake these explosives to Sergeant Doryn at Blackwind Landing, just outside Skettis. Tell him you're a new recruit.",o="转至位于斯克提斯外的黑风码头，将炸药包交给空军上尉杜尔因。",oEN="Take the Explosives Package to Sky Sergeant Doryn at Blackwind Landing outside Skettis.",p="你有什么要给我的吗，小子？",pEN="You've something for me, lad?",c="感谢你的物资；我们会善用它们！一个新兵？嗯，让我们看看你是块什么料。",cEN="Thanks for the supplies; we'll put them to good use! A new recruit? Well, let's see what you're made of."}
Q[11099]={d="指挥官$n，立正！现在，你将立刻领导一队碎天者转至攻击黑暗神殿西北方的奥尔多哨站——沙塔尔祭坛。只要摧毁了沙塔尔祭坛，我们与库斯卡岗哨之间的补给线就可以重新运作起来了。\n\n快去吧，用这个信号枪指引碎天者展开攻击！",dEN="Commander <name>, stand at attention! You are to take a battalion of Skybreakers and sack the Aldor outpost located northwest of our beloved Black Temple. With the Altar of Sha'tar destroyed, our lines of communication to our posts at Coilskar will once more be open.\n\nGo now! Use this flare gun to signal the Skybreakers for the attack!",o="将任务的相关情报和龙喉信号枪一起交给沙塔尔祭坛的学者希拉。",oEN="Deliver news of your mission and the Dragonmaw Flare Gun to Anchorite Ceyla at the Altar of Sha'tar.",p="安顿下来，孩子。",pEN="Settle down, child.",c="你来找我们是件好事。或许我们可以利用这次攻击扭转对龙喉的情势。",cEN="It is good that you came to us. Perhaps we can use this attack to our advantage and turn the tables on the Dragonmaw."}
Q[11100]={d="龙喉只敢在我们放松警惕时袭击我们。\n要是他们在我们有所准备时来攻，必然会被打败。我要你放他们过来，$n。\n<塞拉点点头。>没错…\n…\n一个陷阱。\n拿上他们领主给你的信号弹，把它交给指挥官阿库斯。他就在这座建筑外站岗。\n|n",dEN="The Dragonmaw only dare attack us when our guard is down. They would face certain defeat if they were to attack us while we were prepared.\n\nI want you to let them come, <name>.\n\n<Ceyla nods.>\n\nYes... a trap. Take this flare that their overlord gave you and deliver it to Commander Arcus. He is standing guard right outside this building.",o="将龙喉信号枪交给影月谷沙塔尔祭坛的指挥官阿库斯。",oEN="Give the Dragonmaw Flare to Commander Arcus at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="<阿克斯点点头。>",pEN="<Arcus nods.>",c="<阿克斯露齿而笑。>\n\n史上最致命的陷阱……",cEN="<Arcus grins.>\n\nThe deadliest trap ever laid..."}
Q[11101]={d="拿上这些奥尔多勋章。等这一切结束后，莫格霍尔会需要你胜利的证明。他会认得出这些来自阵亡占星者士兵的尸体。\n现在只剩下用信号弹给龙喉劫掠者报信了。等你$g准备好:准备好;，我们就把他们碾碎。\n只要跟我说一声。\"\"",dEN="Take these Aldor medals. Mor'ghor will need proof of \"victory\" once this is over. He will recognize them as coming from the corpses of fallen Aldor soldiers.\n\nNow all that remains is to use the signal flare to alert the Dragonmaw raiders. We will crush them when you are ready. Just give me the word.",o="协助指挥官阿库斯和奥尔多保卫沙塔尔祭坛。击溃所有龙喉军队后，带上奥尔多勋章返回龙喉营地，向莫格霍尔大王复命。",oEN="Assist Commander Arcus and the Aldor in defending the Altar of Sha'tar. Once all of the Dragonmaw forces have been defeated, return to Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp with the Aldor Medals.",p="你把他们粉碎在你脚下了吗，指挥官？",pEN="Did you crush them under your boot, commander?",c="<莫格霍尔大笑。>\n\n哈！我就知道你不会让我失望，指挥官！我要你每天带领一个团队转至沙塔尔祭坛至少一次。他们会别无选择而离开影月谷！",cEN="<Mor'ghor laughs.>\n\nHAH! I knew you wouldn't let me down, commander! I want you to lead a raid on the Altar of Sha'tar at least once per day. They will have no choice but to leave Shadowmoon!"}
Q[11102]={d="你能变成乌鸦飞来飞去……这也值得炫耀？你从高空命中过地面的目标吗？想试试空战吗？\n\n北面的铸魔营地：天罚和南面的铸魔营地：恐怖是我的心腹之患，同样它们也对爱好和平的奥格瑞拉构成了威胁。在邪能火炮的攻击下，天空卫士伤亡惨重，根本无法侦察敌情。\n\n想要证明自己的实力吗？带上这些炸弹，瞄准铸魔营地的邪能炮弹堆投掷吧！当心别被炮弹击中！",dEN="You can fly around as a crow... so what! Ever annihilate something on the ground while you were flying? Want to?\n\nForge Camp: Wrath and Forge Camp: Terror, to the north and south, are a major pain in my backside, as well as being a threat to peaceful Ogri'la. With all of those fel cannons shooting down the Skyguard left and right, we can't get through there to take care of business.\n\nWant to prove yourself? Take these bombs and knock out their ammo stacks. Just don't let them shoot you down, too!",o="使用天空卫队炸弹炸毁15堆邪能炮弹。",oEN="Use the Skyguard Bombs to destroy 15 Fel Cannonball Stacks.",p="你用炸弹炸掉他们的炮弹堆了吗？",pEN="You take out their stacks of fel cannonballs yet?",c="哎呀呀，看来你终究还是有几分本事。\n干得好。也许老凯勒终究看错你了。\n<天空中士范德利普得意地笑了笑。>",cEN="Well, well, well, I guess you had it in you after all. Good work. Maybe Old Man Keller was wrong about you after all.\n\n<Sky Sergeant Vanderlip smirks.>"}
Q[11103]={p="你戒指里的力量是可塑的，虽然改变你的选择不容易。你确定你想替换它现在的形态吗？",pEN="The power within your ring is malleable, though reversing your choice is not easy. Are you sure you want to replace its current form?",c="时间之沙向前流逝很容易。它们可以倒着流，但困难度很高。",cEN="The sands of time flow forwards easily. They can be made to flow backward, but with great difficulty."}
Q[11104]={p="你戒指中的力量是可塑的，不过要逆转你的选择并不容易。你确定要替换它当前形态吗？",pEN="The power within your ring is malleable, though reversing your choice is not easy. Are you sure you want to replace its current form?",c="小心地做下一个决定。我们会尽最大的努力来帮助我们的盟友，可是达拉然的资源也是有限的。",cEN="The sands of time flow forwards easily. They can be made to flow backward, but with great difficulty."}
Q[11105]={p="你戒指里的力量是可塑的，虽然改变你的选择不容易。你确定你想替换它现在的形态吗？",pEN="The power within your ring is malleable, though reversing your choice is not easy. Are you sure you want to replace its current form?",c="时间之沙向前流逝很容易。它们可以倒着流，但困难度很高。",cEN="The sands of time flow forwards easily. They can be made to flow backward, but with great difficulty."}
Q[11106]={p="你戒指里的力量是可塑的，虽然改变你的选择不容易。你确定你想替换它现在的形态吗？",pEN="The power within your ring is malleable, though reversing your choice is not easy. Are you sure you want to replace its current form?",c="时间之沙向前流逝很容易。它们可以倒着流，但困难度很高。",cEN="The sands of time flow forwards easily. They can be made to flow backward, but with great difficulty."}
Q[11107]={d="我知道我身份低微，根本没有资格直接带口信给您。请您原谅我的无礼。莫格霍尔大王要您立刻转至他的房间接受觐见。",dEN="I am unworthy to even carry a message directed at you, sir. Please forgive me for this indulgence. Overlord Mor'ghor has requested your presence in his chambers at once!",o="与影月谷龙喉营地的领主莫格霍尔谈谈。|n",oEN="Speak to Overlord Mor'ghor at Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="<name>，你是龙喉的第一位大领主。主人亲自决定来这里为你晋升。",cEN="You are the first highlord of the Dragonmaw, <name>. The master himself has chosen to come here to promote you."}
Q[11108]={d="来吧，$g大领主:大领主;$n！伊利丹本人正等着我们！",dEN="Come, highlord <name>. Illidan himself awaits us!",o="与伊利丹·怒风会面。如果你有幸活下来，就转至沙塔斯城的贫民窟寻找巴萨姆斯。",oEN="Meet Illidan Stormrage. Seek out Barthamus in the Lower City of Shattrath should you survive.",p="你经历了一场了不起的冒险，<name>。",pEN="You've had quite an adventure, <name>.",c="我是第一个，你知道吗。\n一个怪物被遗弃的孩子……\n<巴萨姆斯摇了摇头。>我们欠你一切，<name>。\n你单枪匹马粉碎了龙喉帝国，还收集到足够让我族兄弟忙上十辈子的情报。\n这不算什么，但我们有些东西可以给你…\n…我的亲属们各自表示愿意在你前往外域的任务中与你同行。\n只要你开口，他们就会与你结契。",cEN="I was the first, you know. The abandoned child of a monster...\n\n<Barthamus shakes his head.>\n\nWe owe you everything, <name>. You have single-handedly shattered the Dragonmaw empire and gathered enough information to keep my brethren occupied for ten lifetimes.\n\nIt is not much but there is something that we can offer... My kin have each offered to join you on your mission in Outland. Simply ask and they will bond with you."}
Q[11109]={c="很高兴认识你，<name>。\n我们一直密切关注你的冒险，也感激你为灵翼龙族所做的一切。\n如果你选择我做你的同伴，我会载你飞到天涯海角再飞回来。无论你要求什么，我都会尽力办到。\n请注意，你只能在外域的旅途中从我们中选一个。\n一旦做出选择，就不能反悔。",cEN="It is an honor to meet you, <name>. We have all been keeping a close eye on your adventures and are grateful for all that you have done for the Netherwing Dragonflight.\n\nIf you choose me as your compatriot, I will fly you to the ends of this world and back. Whatever it is that you ask of me, I will do my best to comply.\n\nBe warned that you may only select one of us for your journeys in Outland. Once the selection has been made, you cannot change your mind."}
Q[11110]={c="很高兴认识你，<name>。\n我们一直密切关注你的冒险，也感激你为灵翼龙族所做的一切。\n如果你选择我做你的同伴，我会载你飞到天涯海角再飞回来。无论你要求什么，我都会尽力办到。\n请注意，你只能在外域的旅途中从我们中选一个。\n一旦做出选择，就不能反悔。",cEN="It is an honor to meet you, <name>. We have all been keeping a close eye on your adventures and are grateful for all that you have done for the Netherwing Dragonflight.\n\nIf you choose me as your compatriot, I will fly you to the ends of this world and back. Whatever it is that you ask of me, I will do my best to comply.\n\nBe warned that you may only select one of us for your journeys in Outland. Once the selection has been made, you cannot change your mind."}
Q[11111]={c="很高兴认识你，<name>。\n我们一直密切关注你的冒险，也感激你为灵翼龙族所做的一切。\n如果你选择我做你的同伴，我会载你飞到天涯海角再飞回来。无论你要求什么，我都会尽力办到。\n请注意，你只能在外域的旅途中从我们中选一个。\n一旦做出选择，就不能反悔。",cEN="It is an honor to meet you, <name>. We have all been keeping a close eye on your adventures and are grateful for all that you have done for the Netherwing Dragonflight.\n\nIf you choose me as your compatriot, I will fly you to the ends of this world and back. Whatever it is that you ask of me, I will do my best to comply.\n\nBe warned that you may only select one of us for your journeys in Outland. Once the selection has been made, you cannot change your mind."}
