Q[11113]={c="很高兴认识你，<name>。\n我们一直密切关注你的冒险，也感激你为灵翼龙族所做的一切。\n如果你选择我做你的同伴，我会载你飞到天涯海角再飞回来。无论你要求什么，我都会尽力办到。\n请注意，你只能在外域的旅途中从我们中选一个。\n一旦做出选择，就不能反悔。",cEN="It is an honor to meet you, <name>. We have all been keeping a close eye on your adventures and are grateful for all that you have done for the Netherwing Dragonflight.\n\nIf you choose me as your compatriot, I will fly you to the ends of this world and back. Whatever it is that you ask of me, I will do my best to comply.\n\nBe warned that you may only select one of us for your journeys in Outland. Once the selection has been made, you cannot change your mind."}
Q[11114]={c="很高兴认识你，<name>。\n我们一直密切关注你的冒险，也感激你为灵翼龙族所做的一切。\n如果你选择我做你的同伴，我会载你飞到天涯海角再飞回来。无论你要求什么，我都会尽力办到。\n请注意，你只能在外域的旅途中从我们中选一个。\n一旦做出选择，就不能反悔。",cEN="It is an honor to meet you, <name>. We have all been keeping a close eye on your adventures and are grateful for all that you have done for the Netherwing Dragonflight.\n\nIf you choose me as your compatriot, I will fly you to the ends of this world and back. Whatever it is that you ask of me, I will do my best to comply.\n\nBe warned that you may only select one of us for your journeys in Outland. Once the selection has been made, you cannot change your mind."}
Q[11117]={d="听着。你听见了吗？\n那些山丘里有动静。是鹿角兔！这些狡猾的野兽被美酒节的气味吸引来了。\n我本想抓几只，可我磕伤了小腿，追不上它们。不过你能帮我！\n拿上这张网，罩住那些小坏蛋。给我带五只回来，我会好好谢你！哦，还有一件事。\n要看见这些生物，你需要一副酿酒护目镜。需要的话就跟我说一声。",dEN="Here now. Ye hear that? There be sounds in them hills. Those're the wolpertingers! Wily beasts, they are, attracted by the smells o' Brewfest. I've a mind to catch me some, but I knocked me shin and can't outrun the buggers. Ye can help me, though!\n\nTake this net and cast it over the little blighters. Bring me a good five of 'em and I'll make it worth yer while! One more thing - ye gotta see through the eyes of a drunk to spot 'em! Load up on the booze or ask me fer some Synthebrew Goggles!",o="葛达克·猎枪要你用鹿角小飞兔网捕捉5只昏迷的鹿角小飞兔。他说，你必须喝得酩酊大醉，或者是戴上合成酿酒护目镜，才能看见它们。",oEN="Goldark Snipehunter has asked you to capture 5 Stunned Wolpertingers using the Wolpertinger Net. He mentioned that you must be intoxicated or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see them.",p="你喝得够$g醉:醉;，能看见那些小坏蛋了吗？",pEN="Were ya drunk enough to see the little buggers?",c="嘿，你瞧瞧！你弄到了一大堆鹿角兔，真的！<他端起酒壶痛饮了一口。>我告诉你我要怎么办。既然你是$g个:个;这么准的$c，我就让你留一只给自己！\n\n\n\n",cEN="Well, lookee there! Ye've got yerself a right bushel o' wolpertingers, ye do!\n\n<He takes a deep drink from his tankard.>\n\nI'll tell ye what I'm gonna do. Since ye're such a spot-on <class>, I'll let ye keep one'a these fer yer very own!"}
Q[11118]={d="喝醉是美酒节由来已久的传统，几乎算是必须的！\n问题是，我不断收到来自艾泽拉斯的报告，说庆典被幻觉困扰！\n这可不行！这些雷象无法被普通武器伤到——它们会直接穿过去——所以拿上这件了不起的侏儒机械装置，去别的啤酒花园把它们电到九霄云外。\n记住，你必须喝醉或者戴上酿酒护目镜才能看见它们！\n需要的话就来找我。",dEN="Getting drunk is a time-honored tradition at Brewfest -- it's damn near required! Thing is, I'm getting reports across Azeroth saying the celebration's plagued by hallucinations! We can't have that!\n\nThese elekks can't be harmed by normal weapons -- they pass right through 'em -- so take this fabulous piece of gnomish machinery, visit the other beer gardens, and zap 'em to oblivion. Remember, you have to be drunk or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see 'em! Talk to me if you need a pair.",o="转至暴风城、达纳苏斯和埃索达城外的啤酒店，分别杀死三头雷象，然后向葛达克·猎枪复命。你必须在醉酒或者戴上合成酿酒护目镜的情况下才能看见这些粉色的雷象。",oEN="Visit the beer gardens outside of Stormwind, Darnassus, and the Exodar, zap three elekks at each location, and return to Goldark Snipehunter. You must be drunk or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see the pink elekks.",p="那些讨厌的粉红雷象被解决掉了吗？",pEN="Are those pesky pink elekks gone yet?",c="做得好！粉红雷象……多荒谬的幻觉！",cEN="Good work! Pink elekks... what a preposterous notion!"}
Q[11119]={d="嘿，$g小子:丫头;！想找点乐子吗？\n每隔两小时，我的以太技师就会对东北方刀锋山深处的巴什伊尔高地发动一次突袭。他们说是在那里研究巴什伊尔水晶熔炉，但那是一次突袭，没别的说法。\n我们用那座水晶熔炉补给，总有多余的东西可以卖。\n去降落台找以太技师学徒谈谈。他会告诉你下次任务什么时候出发。\n\"\"",dEN="Heya, <boyo /girly>! Up fer some fun are ye?\n\nEvery couple o' hours, me aether-techs launch an assault on Bash'ir Landing, far ta the northeast in the Blade's Edge Mountains. They say that they're there 'studying' the Bash'ir crystalforge, but it's an assault; there be no two ways about it. We use the crystalforge to resupply, and there's always extra to be sold.\n\nGo on down ta the landin' pad and speak with the aether-tech apprentice. He'll tell ye when the next mission is ta launch.",o="与刀锋山天空卫队哨站的以太技师学徒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Aether-tech Apprentice at Skyguard Outpost in the Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="不管凯勒怎么说，我仍认为我们的任务是需要循序渐进的。\n\n没错，我们在经过那里的时候会补给天空卫队。前提是我们要能待得够久。\n\n你看起来愿意替我们清除虚灵组织。如果你可以撑得够久，我们就会卖给你水晶熔炉制造的剩余物品，所以带着你的圣物碎片和水晶吧！\n\n我们$4581d后出发。",cEN="Despite how Keller cares to characterize it, I prefer to think of our missions as research-oriented.\n\nBut yes, we do resupply the Skyguard while we're there. That is if we can stay long enough to do so.\n\nYou look like you'd be willing to keep the ethereals off of our backs. If you can manage to for long enough, we'll sell you surplus items that we create at the crystalforge, so bring your apexis shards and crystals!\n\nWe leave in 2 hours."}
Q[11120]={d="瞧，我们在这里做生意呢。人们喝得烂醉如泥？这正是生意红火的表现呀。不过我们遇到了一件麻烦事，幻象生物在美酒节上捣乱，对我们的收益造成了不小的影响。我收到报告称，酒鬼们——呃，尊贵的客人们被那些粉色的雷象烦透了。\n\n我可不能让客人们为了这等小事烦恼。来，带上这台射线发射器，去别处的啤酒店解决掉那些雷象好吗？记得一定要喝醉，或者戴上合成酿酒护目镜才能看到那些幻象生物。想要合成酿酒护目镜的话，就来找我吧。",dEN="Look. We're running a business here. People being drunk? It's good business. But I'll tell ya one thing that puts a cramp in the profits - hallucinations. Wouldn't ya know it, the boys are reporting that the sot- er, the loyal customers are seeing pink elekks everywhere.\n\nI don't need my customers unsettled. Look, take this ray and travel to the other beer gardens to take care of 'em for me, would ya? And be sure to get drunk or wear Synthebrew Goggles! Talk to me if ya need a pair.",o="转至银月城、雷霆崖和幽暗城外的啤酒店，分别杀死三头雷象，然后向高达克·枪猎复命。你必须在醉酒或者戴上合成酿酒护目镜的情况下才能看见这些粉色的雷象。",oEN="Visit the beer gardens outside of Silvermoon, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, zap three elekks at each location, and return to Glodrak Huntsniper. You must be drunk or wearing the Synthebrew Goggles to see the pink elekks.",p="你搞定了我们提到的小问题吗？",pEN="Ya clear up that little problem we talked about?",c="干得好，小伙子。把这些拿去当作是报酬吧。",cEN="Ya did good, kid. Here, take this as payment for the job ya did."}
Q[11122]={d="这么说，你想帮忙置办美酒节？我恰好有项任务交给你。骑上一头赛羊转至卡拉诺斯，替我取回一些酒桶。\n\n弗莱恩·火酒在一座小山坡上等着你呢，他附近就有一堆酒桶。当你跑近他时，他会把酒桶抛给你，然后你带着酒桶回到这儿来，再把酒桶抛给波尔·冻石就行啦。不过你每次只能携带一只酒桶。\n\n准备好出发了吗？",dEN="So you want to help out at Brewfest? I've got the perfect task for ya. I'll put you on one of my racing rams and you head down to Kharanos. I've got some kegs I need to pick up.\n\nFlynn Firebrew is waiting on a hill near a stack of kegs. He'll toss you a keg when you get near, then you run the keg back here and toss the keg to Pol Amberstill. You can only carry one at a time.\n\nReady?",o="从卡拉诺斯的弗莱恩·火酒那儿接过一只酒桶，然后将它交给波尔·冻石。在赛羊消失之前取回3只酒桶。",oEN="Get a keg from Flynn Firebrew in Kharanos and return it to Pol Amberstill. Do this 3 times before your ram goes away.",p="我需要那些酒桶！你还在等什么！？！",pEN="I need those kegs! So, what are yeh waitin' for!?!",c="多亏了你的帮忙！只要美酒节还在进行，那些黑铁矮人也不放弃攻击的话，就还是需要人来帮我运送酒桶。如果你还想多赚几个奖品章，你可以每天都来找我。\n\n就先这样吧，我还得付给你今天的酬劳呢。这些是你的奖品章，祝你在美酒节玩得开心！",cEN="Thanks a lot for your help! As long as Brewfest is going and the Dark Iron Dwarves are attacking, I'll need some help shipping kegs. So if you want to work for more tickets, talk to me every day.\n\nBut enough about that, I need to pay you for the job you just did. Here are your tickets, have fun at Brewfest!"}
Q[11123]={d="可怜的詹姆斯还没从树荫旅店的毁灭和他的家人被杀害的阴影中恢复过来。我和伙计们正在尽一切努力找到犯下这些罪恶的混蛋。\n\n我已经派出了最好的调查员塔雷姆去了废墟，但这对于任何人来说都是个艰巨的任务。如果你愿意帮助塔雷姆的话，我们会非常感谢的。圣光作证，我们都很愿意去那里帮忙。\n\n这条大路会将你引向旅店，不过要多加小心，你的旅程超出了我们士兵的保护范围。",dEN="Poor James never recovered from the destruction of the Shady Rest and the murder of his family. The boys and I are doing what we can to find the monsters who did this.\n\nI've sent our best investigator, Inspector Tarem, out to the ruins, but this is too big a job for any one man. If you'd lend Tarem a hand, we'd appreciate it. Light knows, we'd all like to be out there helping.\n\nThe main road will lead you to the inn, but take care. Your journey will take you beyond the protection of my soldiers.",o="去和树荫旅店的调查员塔雷姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Inspector Tarem at the Shady Rest Inn.",c="很高兴看到维姆斯上尉终于把别人也派来参与这项调查了。\n我在整个区域撒了一层反光粉。它会显现出可疑的物品和痕迹，帮你集中精力。\n仔细检查粉末照亮的一切。",cEN="It's good to see that Captain Vimes is finally assigning others to this investigation.\n\nI've used a reflective powder to dust the area. It will reveal suspicious objects and markings, helping you to focus your efforts. Look over anything the dust illuminates."}
Q[11124]={d="如果你沿着村子南边的路走，再往西进入贫瘠之地，就会看到阴暗休息旅店的废墟。\n塞拉摩已经派了一名调查员来查明这家旅店是怎么遭难的。\n我在旅店里安插了一个人当眼线，可我不信任那些人类查明真相的能力。无论你查到了什么，都别给那个调查员一丝线索。\n一切由我们来处理。\n\"",dEN="If you follow the road south from the village, and then west toward the Barrens, you'll come across the ruins of the Shady Rest Inn.\n\nTheramore has sent an investigator to discover how the inn met its fate. Normally, I'd advise you to steer clear, but we have orders from Orgrimmar to 'assist' in the investigation.\n\nAccept any help the Theramore investigator offers, even feed him a tidbit or two of information if you'd like, but save your real findings for me.",o="去和树荫旅店的调查员塔雷姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Inspector Tarem at the Shady Rest Inn.",c="<调查员以一种不信任的眼神看着你。>\n\n我听说你要来……协助这次的调查。好得很。\n\n我在废墟使用这些粉尘，来帮助我寻找可能辨认出攻击者的线索。它会让任何与攻击相关的痕迹发光。不要犹豫去检查所有可疑的东西。",cEN="<The inspector regards you with what can only be distrust.>\n\nI've been told that you're to... aid in this investigation. Very well, then.\n\nI've been using this powder to search the ruins for clues that might help identify the attackers. It will illuminate anything that might have been involved in the attack. Don't hesitate to examine anything that looks suspicious."}
Q[11126]={d="见到你很荣幸，$c。我来到塞拉摩是为了帮忙解决这些叛逃者的麻烦。他们不仅到处张贴宣传海报，甚至已经有一些人渗透进了我们的城镇。\n\n这些叛逃者正到处散布着谣言和宣传资料，希望能说服其它人加入他们的队伍。\n\n事实上，从城镇到码头的每个岗哨附近都能看到他们的身影。找到他们，揭露他们，然后羞辱他们。在现在这个节骨眼上，任何事情都有可能给他们带来更多的同情者。",dEN="It's good to meet you, <class>. I've come to Theramore to help eliminate the problem of the deserters. Not only have some of the men abandoned their posts, but some have filtered back into the town.\n\nThese deserter agents are spreading lies and propaganda, hoping to convince others to join their ranks.\n\nThey're at virtually every guard post throughout the town and the docks. Find them, expose them, and discredit them. At this point, anything more risks inspiring more sympathy for them.",o="与5个叛逃煽动者对质，然后向塞拉摩码头附近的加莉亚·哈斯汀汇报。",oEN="Confront 5 Deserter Agitators and return to Calia Hastings near the docks in Theramore.",p="你把那些叛逃者间谍赶出塞拉摩了吗？",pEN="Have you driven the deserter agents from Theramore?",c="做得好，$n。我想我们已设法在他们还没准备好时将他们揭发了。他们的间谍可能曾经认为待在城里就安全了。\n\n我想一段时间之后，那些煽动者又会回来散布他们的谎言。我们要用你争取到的时间进一步地让他们闭嘴。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I think we managed to catch them off guard. Their agents probably thought themselves safe within the city walls.\n\nGiven time, the agitators will return and spread their lies again. We'll use the time you've bought to shut out the deserters further."}
Q[11128]={d="这些叛逃者并非只是在说服卫兵那么简单。我们还在码头的一艘船上发现了大量不知道怎么偷运进来的叛逃者传单。\n\n那艘用来运送传单的船现在还停泊在塞拉摩，就在最远端的码头那里。如果你能潜入那艘船，夺走他们宣传资料的话，他们的人就会失去最有力的工具。不过小心！这艘船被一群经验丰富的海盗控制着，而且货物很可能被藏在船长室里。",dEN="The deserter agents were doing far more than just chatting up the guards. We've found a number of leaflets the deserters somehow managed to smuggle in on a ship in the docks.\n\nThe ship used to transport the leaflets is still in Theramore, at the farthest dock. If you can sneak aboard and capture the rest of their propaganda documents, their agents will lose their most powerful tool. Be careful! The ship is manned by seasoned privateers and the cargo is probably being kept in the captain's quarters.",o="将叛逃者传单交给塞拉摩码头附近的加莉亚·哈斯汀。",oEN="Bring the Deserter Propaganda to Calia Hastings near the docks in Theramore.",p="你拿到了那些剩下的宣传单了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to find and capture the remaining propaganda leaflets?",c="<军情七处的探员赞许地点点头。>\n\n干得好。我正好有个计划让这些叛逃者身败名裂，在塞拉摩没有立足之地。",cEN="<The SI:7 agent nods in approval.>\n\nExcellent. All that remains is to discredit the deserters so that they'll never gain a foothold in Theramore again, and I have just the plan to do it."}
Q[11129]={d="帮帮忙啊，$n！我的小狗凯雷不见了！我只知道它应该是在血蹄村周围跑丢的，现在它一定又饿又着急！\n\n你能帮我找到它，然后给它喂点东西吃吗？它吃饱了之后就会回家了。\n\n如果你要给它喂食，就得先找到食物。它最喜欢的食物是鲜嫩的陆行鸟肉。你可以在东边找到许多陆行鸟，把它们的肉带给凯雷就行啦！看到它之后把肉放在地上，它就会过来的。",dEN="Help, <name>! My prized puppy, Kyle, has run away! I just know he's running around Bloodhoof Village, lost and hungry.\n\nWill you find him and feed him? Once he eats he will settle down and come home.\n\nTo feed him you will need to find food. His favorite meal is tender strider meat. Just venture east and you should find plenty of striders. Hunt one down and take its succulent meat to Kyle. When you see Kyle in town, put the meat down and he is sure to come to you.",o="血蹄村的阿哈布·麦蹄希望你帮他给小狗凯雷喂食。\n\n让凯雷吃过鲜嫩的陆行鸟肉之后回去向阿哈布·麦蹄复命。",oEN="Ahab Wheathoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore wants you to feed his prized puppy, Kyle the Frenzied.\n\nFeed Kyle Tender Strider Meat and return to Ahab Wheathoof.",p="你找到凯尔了吗？",pEN="Did you find Kyle?",c="干得好，$n！凯尔一吃饱就跑回来睡着了。感谢你的帮忙。",cEN="Fantastic work, <name>! Kyle came home as soon as he ate and went straight to bed. Thank you for your help."}
Q[11130]={d="走近点，$g亲爱的:亲爱的;！\n让老格里夫塔瞧瞧你身上那些闪闪发亮的东西…\n…\n嗯。\n是是是，不赖，但我知道你还能做得更好。好得多，多得多。\n<格里夫塔凑近低声说。>到处都有闪亮的小宝贝，$n，只要你懂得去哪儿找！\n今天是你的幸运日；我认识一个人，他能帮你找到多到拿不完的宝贝。\n去祖阿曼附近找我老朋友巴德，把这个给他看。\n告诉他老格里夫塔派你来的，他就会让你参与他的新项目。",dEN="Come closer, <man/sweetheart>! Let ol' Griftah look at yer shiny things....\n\nHmm. Yeh, yeh, not bad, but ya can do better. Much, much better.\n\n<Griftah leans in and whispers.>\n\nThere be priceless shinies everywhere, <name>, ya just gotta know where to look! It be yer lucky day; I know a fella who can help ya find more shinies than ya can ever carry.\n\nVisit my ol' friend, Budd, near Zul'Aman and show him this here. Ya be tellin' him ol' Griftah sent ya and he'll let ya in on his new project.",o="格里伏塔要求你将他的便笺交给幽魂之地的巴德，他就在祖阿曼外。",oEN="Griftah wants you to take Griftah's Note to Budd in the Ghostlands, just outside of Zul'Aman.",p="<巴德狐疑地打量着那张纸条。>你那儿拿的是什么，<class>？\n\n",pEN="<Budd eyes the note suspiciously.>\n\nWhat have you there, <class>?",c="<巴德读了纸条。>啊哈！\n格里夫塔的朋友？欢迎！\n你的时机好得无可挑剔，朋友。\n命运弄人，我最近失去了我最新的一批合伙人。很惨，真的，但巨大的回报往往代价高昂。\n最好别去想那些消极的事！\n你一定听说过我无数的事迹和发现吧。告诉你，那些和这件事比起来都不算什么！\n事实是，我们就要在祖阿曼创造历史了，而命运的安排让你站上了第一线！",cEN="<Budd reads the note.>\n\nAhh! A friend of Griftah? Welcome!\n\nYou have impeccable timing, friend. As fate would have it, I recently lost my latest partners. Tragic, truly, but great rewards often have a high price. Best not to dwell on the negative!\n\nYou've doubtlessly heard of my countless exploits and discoveries. Well, all of that was nothing compared to this! Truth is, we're close to making history here at Zul'Aman and, by fate's decree, you're in on the ground floor!"}
Q[11131]={d="你一定要帮帮我们！无头骑士正在进攻我们的村庄。到处都是火焰！孩子们有危险！\n\n$n，加入消防队吧。拿上水桶去灭火，或者把它递给更靠近火焰的伙伴。只有扑灭所有的火焰才能拯救我们！",dEN="You must help us! The Headless Horseman is attacking the village. Fires are everywhere! The children aren't safe!\n\nPlease, <name>, join the fire brigade. Grab a bucket and toss it on the fires, or pass it to a friend who's closer to the blaze. Put out all the fires and we may yet be saved!",o="穿戏服的孤儿院长希望你帮忙扑灭村子里的所有火焰。在所有火焰都被扑灭后，回去向穿戏服的孤儿院长汇报。",oEN="The Costumed Orphan Matron wants you to help put out all the village fires. When they are out, speak again to the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="<name>，你答应过要救那些孩子！",pEN="<name>, you promised to save the children!",c="哦，谢谢你！愿圣光祝福你的善举，善良的<lord/lady>，英雄！黑暗骑士的阴影仍笼罩着这里，但至少眼下，村子免于他的烈焰。",cEN="Oh, thank you! May the Light bless your good works, kind <lord/lady>. The shadow of the Dark Horseman yet looms, but at least, for now, the village is safe from his flames."}
Q[11132]={d="我的高深理论证实了关于祖阿曼蕴藏巨额宝藏的传闻。人人都会有坐骑和宅邸！\n不过先说正事。毕竟你得先挣到属于你的那份…\n…我们最初的行动没有我期望的那么顺利。\n事实上，我的地图，还有我借给地图的那批新兵，都不见了。他们当时在追一头名叫纳洛拉克的巨魔野兽。\n别管那些人手了，我要的是那张地图！办成了，你就会作为帮巴德·内德雷克揭开祖阿曼秘密的人载入史册！",dEN="My inscrutable theories confirm rumors of vast treasure in Zul'Aman. There'll be mounts and mansions for everyone! First things first, though. You must earn your share, after all....\n\nOur initial efforts here haven't gone as well as I hoped. In fact, my map, and the recruits I lent it to, have gone missing. They were after a troll-beast named Nalorakk.\n\nForget the crew, I need that map! Succeed, and you'll go down in history as the one who helped Budd Nedreck unlock the secrets of Zul'Aman!",o="战斧岭的巴德·奈德雷克要你转至祖阿曼的高阶祭司纳洛拉克所在的平台，找回他的地图。",oEN="Budd Nedreck in Hatchet Hills wants you to retrieve his map from High Priest Nalorakk's terrace in Zul'Aman.",p="啊，是的，<name>，不是吗？你取回我的地图了吗？\n\n",pEN="Ahh yes, <name>, isn't it?\n\nHave you recovered my map yet?",c="<巴德显得有些吃惊。>哦？\n你找到了？\n咳，我是说，你当然找到了！\n干得好，<class>。\n让我看看能不能给你找点好东西…\n…\n啊，对，这个应该可以。",cEN="<Budd looks a bit shocked.>\n\nOh? You've found it?\n\nAhem, I mean, of course you have! Well done, <class>.\n\nLet me see if I can find you a little something nice... ahh yes, this should do."}
Q[11133]={d="我已经把你从叛逃者手中夺来的传单修改了。现在，任何人读到这些传单，都会得到一个和他们的本意截然相反的观点。\n\n如果我们将这些传单分发给足够多的卫兵，那样这些叛逃者在我们的领地里就会陷入空前的窘境。\n\n<加莉亚递给你一叠修改过的传单。>\n\n你为什么不在我策划下一步行动的时候赶紧行动起来呢？",dEN="I've altered the leaflets you captured from the deserters' mercenary friends at the docks. Now, anyone who reads them will get an entirely different view of the deserters and their aims.\n\nIf we distribute these to enough of the guards, the deserters will be too embarrassed to ever reestablish their presence within our walls.\n\n<Calia hands you a stack of the altered leaflets.>\n\nWhy don't you get started while I plan our next move?",o="加莉亚·哈斯汀希望你向6个塞拉摩卫兵发放修改过的传单，然后返回塞拉摩码头附近向她复命。",oEN="Calia Hastings wants you to distribute the Altered Leaflets to 6 Theramore Guards, then report back to her near the docks in Theramore.",p="我想我听到了兵营传来的笑声。你把我给你的传单都发出去了吗？",pEN="I thought I heard laughter coming from the barracks. Did you distribute those leaflets I gave you?",c="<在你形容那些守卫看到传单的反应时，加莉亚笑得差点呛到。>\n\n正如我所预期！我想这下任何叛逃者间谍再想来渗透塞拉摩，只会被大笑着轰出去！",cEN="<Calia chuckles as you describe the guards' reactions to the propaganda.>\n\nJust as I'd hoped! I think it's safe to say any deserter agents who try to infiltrate Theramore will be laughed right out of town!"}
Q[11134]={d="现在我们已经把这些叛逃者从塞拉摩扫了出去，是时候完成最后一击了。我的线人告诉我，叛逃者们正在一艘停泊在码头东南面小岛旁的船上部署着行动。\n\n逮捕他们的首领贾维斯·格雷希德，这样应该会让其它人失去战斗的决心。去船上找到他，并说服他投降。如果他表现出战意的话，我一点都不惊讶。不过当他知道自己不可能获胜的时候，他一定会投降的。",dEN="Now that we've eliminated the deserters from Theramore, it's time to complete this operation. My local contacts have reported that the deserters base their operations in a ship moored on a small island to the southeast of the docks.\n\nArresting their leader, Gavis Greyshield, should cause the others to lose their will to fight. Find him within the ship and convince him to surrender. I wouldn't be surprised if he puts up a bit of a fight for show, but then surrenders when he understands he can't win.",o="抓住贾维斯·格雷希德，然后向塞拉摩码头附近的加莉亚·哈斯汀复命。",oEN="Capture Gavis Greyshield, then report to Calia Hastings near the docks in Theramore.",p="你完成了对叛逃者基地的突袭任务吗？",pEN="Have you completed your assault on the deserter base?",c="加维斯的请求并不像听起来那么离谱。处理得当的话，吉安娜女士可以让那些逃兵回归阵营，当然，那是她的决定。\n与你合作很愉快，$n。\n没有你的帮助，我怀疑这次行动不会这么顺利。等我在暴风城做报告时，会把你说成终结逃兵威胁的$g那位:那位;$c。",cEN="Gavis' request isn't as outlandish as it might sound. With the proper handling, Lady Jaina can return the deserters to the fold, but that is her decision, of course.\n\nIt's been a pleasure working with you, <name>. Without your help, I doubt the operation would've gone so smoothly. When I make my report in Stormwind, it will name you as the <class> who ended the deserter threat."}
Q[11135]={d="无头骑士被赶走了，但整个万圣节期间，他随时都可能回来。$n，终结我们的痛苦，终结他那疯狂的悲歌吧！在他接上脑袋的时候去挑战他，消灭他！\n\n他安息在提瑞斯法林地的血色修道院深处。找到他的南瓜神龛，然后对他说：\n\n　　骑士啊，醒来吧\n　　末日正向你迈开脚步\n　　死亡没有令你安息\n　　湮灭才是你的归宿！\n\n去吧，$n，愿圣光与你同在。",dEN="The Headless Horseman is driven away, but he will return as long as Hallow's End looms. <name>, end our misery, and the insane lament of the Horseman. Face him when he is joined with his head, and destroy it!\n\nHe rests in the Forlorn Cloister of the Scarlet Monastery, in Tirisfal Glades. Find his pumpkin shrine and say this:\n\nHorseman, rise\nYour time is nigh\nYou felt death once\nNow, know demise!\n\nGo, <name>. And may the Light go with you.",o="找到无头骑士的南瓜神龛。",oEN="Find the Headless Horseman's pumpkin Shrine.",c="祭坛的原貌已经无法辨认，但它现在的主人却毋庸置疑……",cEN="The origin of this shrine is unknown, but there is no doubt to whom it pays homage..."}
Q[11136]={d="我们的斥候最近带回来了一条非常令人困扰的消息。他们说最近有一群戴着红色面巾的迪菲亚强盗出现在了塞拉摩北部城墙外的恐惧海岸。\n\n那附近的一些船只残骸说明，他们所乘坐的船只很可能遭遇了海难，不过我们的情报还是不够完全。本城北部的重要哨塔——警戒岗哨的维摩尔上尉当前正在找人协助情报的收集和调查工作。",dEN="Reports from our scout patrols have recently taken a disturbing turn. They tell of men wearing red Defias bandanas walking the Dreadmurk Shore north of Theramore's walls.\n\nWreckage in the area suggests they may be survivors of a shipwreck, but our information is limited. Captain Wymor at Sentry Point, a guard tower to the north of the city, is looking for help in following up on the reports.",o="向警戒哨岗的维摩尔上尉报到。",oEN="Report to Captain Wymor at Sentry Point.",c="<船长毫不掩饰他在评估你的能力。>那你听说过最近海岸外的沉船事件了？\n很好，我正需要有人帮忙证实我对幸存者的猜测。\n欢迎上船。",cEN="<The captain makes no effort to hide that he's assessing your abilities.>\n\nSo you've heard about the recent shipwreck off the coast? Good, I could use some help confirming my suspicions about the survivors. Welcome aboard, <name>."}
Q[11137]={d="我手下的斥候前几天报告说，有一条受了重创的远航帆船搁浅在了东北方的海滩上。不过，海难并不是那条船上唯一不寻常的地方，报告还指出，船上的全部幸存者都戴着红色的头巾！\n\n要知道，迪菲亚兄弟会的主要成员都是石匠和公会成员，没有水手。那么这群人在一片他们完全不感兴趣的大陆上对着船只的残骸又在干些什么呢？\n\n据说他们的头目就在哨塔东北边海岸对面的那座岛屿上。杀死他，把他那里的所有文件都带回来。",dEN="My scouts have reported a shipwreck just off the beach to the northeast. Shipwrecks aren't all that unusual out here, but the reports also indicated the survivors were all wearing red bandanas!\n\nThe Defias are craftsmen and guildsmen, not sailors. What are they doing at the site of a shipwreck on a continent they've no interest in?\n\nTheir leader is rumored to reside on a large island just off the coast to the northeast of the tower. Kill him and retrieve any documents you find in his possession.",o="从加恩·马瑟斯手中夺得迪菲亚命令书，把它们交给警戒岗哨的维摩尔上尉。",oEN="Obtain the Defias Orders from Garn Mathers and bring them to Captain Wymor at Sentry Point.",p="你逮到他们的领袖了吗？",pEN="Were you able to track down their leader?",c="<维莫尔船长接过命令书读了一遍。>贵重货物到底可能指什么？迪菲亚在暴风城一带干过些小宗走私，但这看起来超出了他们的能力范围。\n这些命令书的措辞暗示着一位富有或出身高贵的幕后主使。\n\"\"",cEN="<Captain Wymor accepts the orders from you and reads over them.>\n\nWhat in the world could 'precious cargo' refer to? The Defias have done some small time smuggling back in lands of Stormwind, but this seems out of their league. The language of these orders suggests a wealthy or noble patron."}
Q[11138]={d="根据你带来的这些命令书所说，这些迪菲亚的家伙们当前第一优先要做的事情，就是找到并确保那个什么货物的安全。\n\n暴风城军情七处有一位救援潜水员名叫雷恩·米克基尔，当前正在塞拉摩工作。他听说海难的消息之后，就转至了迪菲亚兄弟会占据的那座小岛附近。\n\n如果我们想从迪菲亚兄弟会手里搞到这个所谓的货物，就必定需要他的帮助。总之，你可以到你之前刚刚拜访过的那座岛屿北边的一处小岛旁去找他，他应该就在小岛东北边的水里潜伏着。",dEN="From the wording of the orders you recovered, it looks like the first priority of the Defias will be to locate and secure whatever cargo they possessed.\n\nSI:7 has had a salvage diver named Renn McGill working out of Theramore for some time. When he heard about the shipwreck, Renn went north to dive near the islands the Defias now occupy.\n\nIf we're to beat the Defias to this cargo, we'll need his help. Look for him in the waters northeast of a small island just north of the island you visited earlier.",o="将迪菲亚命令书交给恐惧海岸水边的雷恩·米克基尔。",oEN="Bring the Defias Orders to Renn McGill in the waters off the Dreadmurk Shore.",p="你好，$c。什么风把你吹到这里来？",pEN="Well met, <class>. What brings you out here?",c="<雷恩看着那些指令。>\n\n所以那艘船上有些有价值的货物！我们一定要在迪菲亚发现之前先找到它们。他们并不是潜水员，但如果你要帮我一起找那些货物的话，我们就会需要他们的一些装备。",cEN="<Renn looks over the orders.>\n\nSo there was valuable cargo on board! We have to locate it before the Defias recover it. These guys are no divers, but we're going to need some of their gear if you're to help me find the cargo."}
Q[11139]={d="从这儿到阿尔卡兹的水底散落着大量残骸，迪菲亚已经派出潜水员在四处搜索了。借他们一些装备的助力，我们就能把你武装好、准备好加入搜寻。\n不过你得先练练创造性的借用。在这座岛上找一只装潜水装备的箱子，还有能修好它的东西。拿到之后带来给我，我很快就能把你的装备准备好。\n\"\"",dEN="There's plenty of wreckage strewn across the bottom of the water from here to Alcaz, and the Defias have already got divers out there looking around. With the help of some of their gear, we can get you suited up and ready to join the hunt, but you'll have to do some creative \"borrowing\" first.\n\nSearch this island for a crate of diving gear and something to repair it with. When you've got them, bring them to me and I'll have your gear ready in no time!",o="将工具包和损坏的潜水设备交给尘泥沼泽的雷恩·米克基尔。",oEN="Bring the Tool Kit and Damaged Diving Gear to Renn McGill in the Dustwallow Marsh.",p="让我们看看你从迪菲亚那儿借到了什么。\"\"",pEN="Let's see what you managed to \"borrow\" from the Defias.",c="哇喔，这装备的状况比我想得还严重，还有这些工具……\n\n好吧，既然我说过要帮你把装备修好，我最好现在开始动手。",cEN="Wow, this is in worse shape than I'd thought, and these tools...\n\nWell, I said I'd get this back into working condition for you, so I'd better get to work."}
Q[11140]={d="呃，我确实能把这东西彻底修好，能让你真的用它去潜水。只是……时间上的估算略有一点小错误。\n\n沉船的残骸当前遍布整个海底，在这座岛屿东边的海岸直到奥卡兹岛之间几乎都是。这顶头盔可以确定出残骸的位置，你可以用它来寻找残骸。然后，再利用这个打捞设备来搜索残骸，看看那个什么货物是否在其中。小心点，别太接近奥卡兹岛，那些多头蛇非常凶暴和危险。",dEN="Well, I was able to make enough repairs to this gear to let you dive for awhile, anyway. I wouldn't count on it holding out for a long time, though.\n\nThe wreckage of the ship is strewn along the bottom from the east coast of this island out toward Alcaz Island. While that helm holds out, locate pieces of the wreckage on the bottom between this island and Alcaz. Use this salvage kit to search the wreckage for pieces of the cargo. Be careful not to venture too close to Alcaz Island. Those hydra are fierce.",o="将6只打捞上来的保险箱交给尘泥沼泽的雷恩·米克基尔。",oEN="Bring 6 Salvaged Strongboxes to Renn McGill in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你有找到任何与迪菲亚货物有关的残骸吗？",pEN="Did your search of the wreckage reveal anything about the Defias cargo?",c="<雷恩翻查着你找回的那些保险箱里的东西。>干得好。现在，让我们看看我们的贵重货物在不在里面…\n…\n\"\"",cEN="<Renn rifles through the contents of the strongboxes you recovered.>\n\nGood work. Now, let's see if our 'precious cargo' is in here...."}
Q[11141]={d="啊……你必须立刻把我们的发现通报给吉安娜女士，刻不容缓！迪菲亚兄弟会似乎是在运送某个囚犯，我们还不清楚那个囚犯的身份，以及他是否还活着。\n\n不过有一点很肯定，$n。迪菲亚兄弟会对这个囚犯相当客气，看来他的身份十分重要。吉安娜女士一定能从这些发现中了解到些什么，你必须立刻到塞拉摩中央的法师塔顶上去找她。",dEN="You must bring news of our findings to Lady Jaina without delay! If the Defias were transporting a prisoner, there's no telling who it might be or if the person is still alive!\n\nOne thing is for certain, <name>. The Defias wouldn't go to all this trouble for some petty grudge. Their prisoner must have been someone of importance. Lady Jaina would know better than anyone else what these findings mean. You'll find her at the top of the mage tower at Theramore's center.",o="与塞拉摩的吉安娜·普罗德摩尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lady Jaina Proudmoore in Theramore.",c="你和雷恩做得很好，发现这个情报并且立刻回报是正确的。现在，我们必须确认你的发现。如果我们弄错了，牵连实在太广。",cEN="You and Renn have done excellent work in bringing this information to light and reporting it immediately. Now, we must confirm your findings. The implications are too great if we are wrong."}
Q[11142]={d="看来，我们派瑞恩潜伏在奥卡兹岛一带的决定是对的。现在，我们需要更加仔细地调查那座岛，不过那样的话，我们恐怕得派整整一个军团的士兵帮我们开道。\n\n问题是，塞拉摩的防务很紧张，没有多馀的兵力。我已经安排了这里的飞行管理员的学徒卡萨·赤翼来协助你，她会用她的狮鹫送你去进行空中侦查。\n\n奥卡兹岛上隐藏着迪菲亚兄弟会的一切有关这次绑架的秘密。",dEN="It looks like Renn's hunch about Alcaz Island was right. We need to survey that island, but it would take a whole brigade of troops to fight our way in there.\n\nTheramore's defenses can't weather such a hit, so I've arranged with Cassa Crimsonwing, the apprentice to Theramore's gryphon master, to allow you to use one of her beasts to survey Alcaz from the air.\n\nAlcaz Island holds the key to the mystery of the Defias' involvement in this kidnapping.",o="与卡萨·赤翼谈一谈，乘坐她的狮鹫调查奥卡兹岛。调查完成之后，回去向塞拉摩的吉安娜·普罗德摩尔报告。",oEN="Speak to Cassa Crimsonwing and use one of her gryphons to survey Alcaz Island. When your survey is complete, speak with Lady Jaina Proudmoore in Theramore.",c="<吉安娜女士专心地聆听你空中侦察的报告。>\n\n一个符文法阵，龙类生物？迪菲亚兄弟会与“她”结盟了？那个叛徒？\n\n<吉安娜女士平复一下自己的情绪，准备要向你解释。>",cEN="<Lady Jaina listens intently as you report the results of your aerial survey.>\n\nA rune circle, dragonkin? The Defias have allied themselves with HER? The traitor?\n\n<Lady Jaina composes herself and prepares to explain.>"}
Q[11143]={d="我已经把你在树荫旅店收集到的证据告诉调查员塔雷姆了。他似乎确信这些蹄印和你在那里找到的盾牌都非常明显地证明了这一切都是牛头人的恐怖图腾氏族所为。\n\n随着恐怖图腾在沼泽越来越活跃，这一切看上去都不仅仅是一场巧合。现在我派你去和达利尔上尉谈谈，他一直以来都在关注着恐怖图腾。沿着这条路往北出城，转至北点哨塔，就是沿路的第二座岗哨。",dEN="I've spoken with Inspector Tarem regarding the evidence you gathered from the ruins of the Shady Rest Inn. He seems certain that the hoofprints and the shield you found there point to the Grimtotem clan of tauren.\n\nWith reports of Grimtotem activity on the rise in the marsh, this has to be more than a mere coincidence. I'm sending you to speak with Captain Darill, who is something of an expert on the Grimtotems. Follow the road north out of town to North Point tower. It's the second outpost on the road.",o="向北点哨塔的达利尔上尉报告。",oEN="Report to Captain Darill at North Point.",c="维米斯上尉认为恐怖图腾与树荫旅店的摧毁有关？他们并不是我最怀疑的对象，但是维米斯上尉既然派你来继续追查，他一定有他的理由。更何况，恐怖图腾已经成为我们的芒刺好一阵子了，我们非常高兴能有额外的帮手。",cEN="Captain Vimes thinks the Grimtotems are behind the destruction of the Shady Rest Inn? They wouldn't have been first on my list of suspects, but if Captain Vimes sent you here to follow up on a lead, he must have his reasons. Regardless, the Grimtotems have been a thorn in our side for some time and we're always glad to have the extra help."}
Q[11144]={d="恐怖图腾可能是牛头人中最好战的部族，但是他们绝不是是一盘散沙。如果是他们烧毁了树荫旅店，那么他们必定是从他们的部族长者那里接受了命令才会这么做。\n\n在这里的西北方，有一处庞大的恐怖图腾定居点——黑蹄村。他们一直把黑蹄村作为进攻哨塔的基地，我打赌如果你去那里寻找的话，一定会找到命令书之类的东西。去黑蹄村的长者那里寻找证据吧。",dEN="The Grimtotems may be the most warlike of all the tauren clans, but they're by no means unorganized. If they're the ones who put the torch to the Shady Rest Inn, they'll have had orders from one of their clan elders.\n\nThere's a large Grimtotem settlement called Blackhoof Village to the northwest. They've been using it as a base to attack the tower, but I'll bet that you'll find the orders you're looking for there. Check the village's elders for traces of the orders you seek.",o="将恐怖图腾作战计划交给北点哨塔的达利尔上尉。",oEN="Bring the Grimtotem Battle Plan to Captain Darill at North Point Tower.",p="你有找到任何命令的线索吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any trace of the orders?",c="<达利尔上尉粗略地看了一下作战计划。>\n\n没有比这更明显的证据了。他们打算自己对抗在这个区域殖民的人类，我怀疑塞拉摩就是他们的下一个目标。",cEN="<Captain Darill glances at the battle plan.>\n\nI'd say it doesn't get any clearer than this. They've taken it upon themselves to fight back against human settlements in the area and I have little doubt Theramore is next on their list."}
Q[11145]={d="我们正在尽全力不让恐怖图腾的那些混账接近这里，但他们一直都在发动对哨塔的攻击。更糟的是，他们发现并俘虏了上尉派去收集情报的斥候，开始在路上驻守起来。\n\n我怀疑那些俘虏都被关押在黑蹄村，就在这里的西北方。根据我对恐怖图腾的了解，村里的卫兵很可能会随身带着囚笼的钥匙。我不管你怎么做，$c，我只想看到我们的人活着回来。",dEN="We're doing all we can to keep the Grimtotem raiders at bay, but they keep launching assaults on the tower. Even worse, they've managed to discover and capture the patrols the captain sends out to gather information and safeguard the road.\n\nI suspect the captives are being held in Blackhoof Village, to the northwest. Knowing the Grimtotems, the defenders of the village probably carry the keys to the prisoners' cages with them. I don't care what you have to do, <class>, just bring back my men alive.",o="北点哨塔的卢卡斯中士希望你能解救5名塞拉摩囚犯。",oEN="Sergeant Lukas at North Point Tower wants you to free 5 Theramore Prisoners.",p="你释放了那些在黑蹄村的俘虏吗？",pEN="Did you manage to free the captives at Blackhoof Village?",c="从黑蹄村被释放的俘虏已经开始回报了。俘虏所提供的情报让我们能在下一次对抗恐怖图腾的战斗中取得优势。\n\n我和我的手下们衷心地感谢你。",cEN="The freed captives have already begun returning from Blackhoof Village. The information the captain is receiving from the prisoners will give us an advantage in our next battle against the Grimtotems.\n\nYou have my thanks and that of the men."}
Q[11146]={d="这片沼泽的东北部有一块地方被一群肮脏无比的迅猛龙占据了。它们夺走了不止一个士兵的生命，但我想，我们可以利用它们来对付那帮牛头人邻居。\n\n将这根绳子带过去，用它抓捕几只血沼迅猛龙或是血沼尖啸龙来，当然，你得先制服它们。只有你先在战斗中将它们打得晕头转向以后才可以抓捕。总之，会有点困难，加油吧。",dEN="The patch of swamp to the northeast is home to a particularly nasty breed of raptors. We've lost more than one unwary soldier to them, but I think we can turn them against our Grimtotem neighbors.\n\nTake this rope and use it to capture bloodfen raptors or bloodfen screechers that you've subdued. I wouldn't try to capture one of the beasts until you've weakened them quite a bit in combat. It's going to be quite a struggle.",o="北点哨塔的卢卡斯中士要求你捕捉6只迅猛龙。血沼迅猛龙或是血沼尖啸龙都可以满足他的要求。",oEN="Sergeant Lukas at North Point Tower wants you to capture 6 raptors. You can capture either Bloodfen Raptors or Bloodfen Screechers.",p="你抓到了那些迅猛龙吗？",pEN="Did you capture those raptors?",c="你看起来受了一点抓伤，不过不太严重。你的遭遇绝对会比那些恐怖图腾遇上我们的新朋友来得好呢。",cEN="You look a little scratched up, but nothing major. You're certainly in a lot better shape than the Grimtotems will be when our new raptor friends get done with them."}
Q[11147]={d="既然我们已经有了这些迅猛龙，下一步就是鼓励它们去攻击西北方黑蹄村的恐怖图腾。我这里有一块剩下的……\n其实细节并不重要。它会当你的诱饵。把它放在黑蹄村中央风车附近的地上。\n要是训练到位，剩下的迅猛龙自己会处理。\"\"",dEN="Now that we've got our raptors, our next move is to \"encourage\" them to attack the Grimtotems at Blackhoof Village to the northwest.\n\nI've got a leftover haunch of... well, it doesn't really matter what it is. It'll be your bait. Set it down on the ground in Blackhoof Village near the windmill in the center of the settlement. The raptors should take care of the rest, if their training took.",o="北点哨塔的卢卡斯中士要求你将迅猛龙诱饵放在黑蹄村的风车附近。",oEN="Sergeant Lukas at North Point Tower wants you to place the Raptor Bait near the windmill in Blackhoof Village.",p="你把迅猛龙放进了黑蹄村了吗？",pEN="Have you set the raptors loose in Blackhoof Village?",c="<中士毫不掩饰他的大笑。>\n\n很好。这样应该可以阻止他们一两次的劫掠。",cEN="<The sergeant doesn't bother to hide his grin.>\n\nGood. That ought to forestall a raid or two."}
Q[11148]={d="如果你在树荫旅店找到的装备是属于恐怖图腾部队的话，那么很可能他们在西北部的营地里会有更多类似的装备。\n\n我们还不能从黑蹄村得到更多的情报。不过从袭击者的规模来看，那里驻守着大量的部队。\n\n想办法去那里弄一些他们的装备来，这样我们就可以拿它们和你在旅店找到的那些比较一下了。",dEN="If the equipment you found at the ruins of the inn belonged to a Grimtotem attack party, there's likely to be more just like it within their camp to the northwest.\n\nWe haven't been able to gather much information about Blackhoof Village, but judging from the size of the raiding parties, there's a substantial force based there.\n\nDo whatever you have to to capture some of their equipment so that we can compare it with your findings from the inn.",o="北点哨塔的达利尔上尉希望你能交给他7件黑蹄军备。",oEN="Captain Darill at North Point Tower wants you to bring him 7 Blackhoof Armaments.",p="你从黑蹄村拿到那些武装了吗？",pEN="Did you get those weapons from Blackhoof Village?",c="<达利尔上尉检查着你从黑蹄村带来的武装。>\n\n毫无疑问，他们完全符合，但还有一个问题——这些武装从来没有用在战斗中。黑蹄村一定不是沼泽中唯一的恐怖图腾据点。",cEN="<Captain Darill inspects the armaments you've brought from Blackhoof Village.>\n\nThere's no doubt about it. These match the description exactly, but there's just one problem -- these have never been used in battle. Blackhoof Village must not be the only Grimtotem post in the marsh."}
Q[11149]={d="我实在抽调不出其它人手来帮你寻找恐怖图腾的另一个据点了，但我觉得有人也许可以帮助你。\n\n在这里南面的泥潭沼泽深处，有一个属于塔贝萨的农场。她看起来像是个隐士，但事实上她是个法师，还是个有名的占星者。沿着这条路往南，到她的农场去寻求她的帮助，找出究竟是谁该为树荫旅店的屠杀负责。",dEN="I can't spare any men to help search for a second Grimtotem outpost, but I think I know of someone who might be able to help you.\n\nDeep in the Quagmire, to the south, there is a small farmstead owned by Tabetha. She may seem little more than an old hermit, but the truth is that she's a mage and scryer of some renown. Follow the road south to her farm and seek her help in finding the culprits responsible for the massacre at the Shady Rest Inn.",o="与塔贝萨农场的塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha at her farm.",c="所以你希望我帮你占卜窥探恐怖图腾，对吧？要是我跟你说没有必要，你要怎么办？",cEN="So you want me to scry for Grimtotems, eh? And what will you say when I tell you there's no need?"}
Q[11150]={d="不用占卜也能看出我这些新邻居正在惹什么麻烦。而如果真如你所说，就是他们烧了阴暗休息旅店，那就再没有理由容忍他们待下去了。\n拿上这支火把，把他们的营地夷为平地！你会在我的农场正北方、靠近大路的地方找到恐角。绝对错不了，恐怖图腾用他们偏爱的那种图腾把自己宣扬得可够显眼的。\n\"\"",dEN="There's no scrying necessary to see the trouble my new \"neighbors\" are creating. And if this is the band that burnt down the Shady Rest Inn, as you claim, there's no reason to tolerate their presence any longer.\n\nTake this torch and raze their camp to the ground! You'll find Direhorn just to the north of my farm. You can't miss it, really, as the Grimtotems have done a splendid job of announcing their presence with those totems they favor.",o="烧毁恐角岗哨的北部帐篷、东部帐篷和东北部帐篷，然后回到塔贝萨的农场，向塔贝萨复命。",oEN="Burn the North Tent, East Tent, and the Northeast Tent at Direhorn Post, then return to Tabetha at her farm.",p="你有好好利用那把火炬吗？",pEN="Have you put that torch to good use?",c="我希望恐怖图腾收到我们的警告了。任何再回来的企图将会遭遇比被火烧还惨的后果，这一点我和我的学徒们能跟你保证。",cEN="I hope the Grimtotems got the message. Any attempt to return will be met with far worse than a mere torch. My apprentices and I will see to that."}
Q[11151]={d="尽管这些恐怖图腾的家伙对我来说只能算是一个小麻烦，维米斯队长还是应该得知你所做的一切。把你追捕和解决了那些烧毁树荫旅店的家伙的消息告诉他吧。\n\n尽管这一切还是救不了海厄尔一家，但也许恐怖图腾在攻击塞拉摩人的时候会有所顾忌。",dEN="Although these Grimtotems were simply a nuisance to me, Captain Vimes will want to know of your deeds. Bring him the news that you have tracked down and dealt with those responsible for the burning of the Shady Rest Inn.\n\nIt's too late to save Jim Hyal's family, but perhaps the Grimtotems will think twice before attacking anyone connected to Theramore.",o="与塞拉摩城堡中的的盖兰·维米斯队长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Captain Garran Vimes at Foothold Citadel in Theramore.",c="<上尉专心地聆听你的报告。>\n\n我们已经替詹姆斯和他的家人复仇了，但这也无法让那些被摧毁的事物回复旧观。",cEN="<The captain listens to your report intently.>\n\nWe have avenged James and his family, but not even that can restore what was destroyed."}
Q[11152]={d="我希望有办法让詹姆斯·海厄尔的妻儿知道我们已经将杀害他们的凶手绳之以法了。\n\n<维米斯队长拿出了一个小花圈。>\n\n有人说只要这样做，即使我们不能联系到他们，他们的在天之灵也会安息。我希望你可以把这个花圈放在海厄尔家族的墓碑前，就是塞拉摩大门北面墓地中的大石碑。",dEN="I wish we had a way of letting James Hyal's wife and son know that we have brought their murderers to justice.\n\n<Captain Vimes produces a small wreath decorated with flowers.>\n\nThere are some who say that their spirits will know, even if we cannot reach them. It's not much, but I'd like you to lay this wreath at the Hyal family monument. It's one of the larger stones in the graveyard just north of Theramore's gates.",o="塞拉摩城堡中的盖兰·维米斯队长想让你在海厄尔家族墓碑前放上一个花圈。",oEN="Captain Garran Vimes at Foothold Citadel wants you to lay the Wreath at the Hyal Family Monument.",p="你已经献上花圈了吗？",pEN="Did you lay the wreath?",c="<在你讲述海厄尔家族墓地的事情时，维米斯队长露出了一点淡淡的笑容。>\n\n他们能了解真的很好。你没有跟他们谈起詹姆斯的事吧？\n\n我会把他妻子的消息传给他，不过我很怀疑他能明白。",cEN="<Captain Vimes smiles slightly as you relate the events you witnessed at the Hyal family grave.>\n\nIt's good to know that they understand. You didn't tell them about James, did you?\n\nI'll deliver his wife's message to him, but I doubt he'll understand."}
Q[11153]={d="我们的船全沉了！\n我们需要你帮忙打破下方破碎海峡的海盗封锁的首领！拿上这些集束炸弹，搭上哈罗迈泽借给我们的飞艇。\n他会载你飞过那些无赖海盗的甲板上空，你可得给他们点颜色看看！\n要是你不能把他们炸成碎片，恐怕我们永远都打不打破这道封锁。\"\n\"",dEN="All of our ships are sunk! We need your help to break the pirate blockade below in the Shattered Straits!\n\nTake these cluster bombs and hitch a ride on the zeppelin that Harrowmeiser has 'loaned' to us. He'll fly you over the decks of those pirate scoundrels, and you make sure to give it to them good!\n\nIf you can't bomb them to smithereens, I'm afraid we'll never be able to break the blockade.",o="拿上彼得罗夫的集束炸弹，投到足够多的海盗头上，杀死25名封锁海盗并摧毁10门封锁火炮。完成之后，回西卫堡向轰炸手彼得罗夫复命。",oEN="Take Petrov's Cluster Bombs and drop them on enough pirates to kill or destroy 10 Blockade Pirates and 5 Blockade Cannons. Once you've accomplished that, return to Bombardier Petrov at Westguard Keep.",p="我们已经谈过了，对吧？这表示你完成了！你一定已经给那些腐烂的北海海盗一些颜色瞧瞧\n\n对吧？",pEN="We're talking again are we? That must mean that you've done it! You've shown those rotten Northsea pirates a thing or two!\n\nRight?",c="这才是我要听的！\n你有那份胆识，<name>，这毫无疑问！\n你看明天等我们做出更多集束炸弹后你能再来一趟吗？\n我本想现在就再派你出去，可我的助手费克纳特去收集更多蝙蝠粪便还没回来。\n不知道是什么让他耽搁这么久？",cEN="That's what I wanted to hear! You've got the stuff, <name>, that's for sure!\n\nYou think maybe you could come back again tomorrow when we've made more cluster bombs? I'd have you back out there right now, but my assistant, Feknut, isn't back from collecting more bat guano for them.\n\nI wonder what's taking him so long?"}
Q[11154]={d="嗨，叫你呢……快来帮帮我！\n\n匹特洛夫让我来这里收集制造炸弹所需的蝙蝠粪便。这分明是让我去送死嘛！\n\n北边的裂木森林中挂满了暗爪蝙蝠，但是你别想叫我挪动一步，除非是回家！\n\n嗯……我觉得你可以帮我搞定这件事！好不好呀？求求你啦！！\n\n给，这是特制的爆竹。将它们扔到那些蝙蝠的下方，它们肯定会被爆炸声吓得屎尿齐流！",dEN="You, yes you... I need your help!\n\nPetrov sent me up here to get bat guano for the cluster bombs he's making back at the keep. He sent me to my doom!\n\nThe darkclaw bats hang out in the Rivenwood to the north, but I'm not taking a step off of this platform unless it's to go home!\n\nBut you... you could get it for me! Yes? Pretty please?!!!\n\nHere, take these firecrackers. My thinking is that if you drop 'em underneath the bats, the guano will be scared right out of them!",o="将10坨暗爪蝙蝠的粪便交给嚎风峡湾钢铁之门的工程师菲纳特。",oEN="Collect 10 Darkclaw Guano and deliver them to Engineer Feknut at Steel Gate.",p="拜托告诉我你拿到蝙蝠粪便了？！",pEN="Please tell me that you have the darkclaw guano?!",c="呃，这是什么味儿？\n啊，是你！好吧，看来我确实派你去干了件臭活！\n谢谢你，<class>。\n别担心，我们一离开这儿，我就把这些东西送回给彼得罗夫。\n<费克纳特大声朝探险者们喊叫。>你们听见了吗，伙计们？\n我们赶紧离开这鬼地方！！\n！",cEN="Ugh, what's that smell? Ack, it's you! Well, I guess I did send you on a smelly job!\n\nThank you, <class>. Don't worry, I'll get this stuff back to Petrov as soon as we get out of here.\n\n<Feknut yells out loud to the explorers.>\n\nYou hear that guys? Lets get the hell out of here!!!"}
Q[11155]={d="我们饲养的家禽都离奇失踪了。如果不能尽快补充食物，麻烦就大了。那样的话，我们要担心的就不仅仅是这附近的野兽了！\n\n你瞧，我负责照顾这一大帮人的饮食。你能去东边跑一趟，帮我搞些肉回来吗？准确地说，我想要烹制铲齿鹿肉。\n\n小心那些雄鹿……它们很讨厌！",dEN="With all of the strange disappearances of our livestock, we better resupply in a hurry, or the beasties around these parts will be the least of our worries!\n\nSeeing as I'm in charge of feeding this lot, I'm going to need you to head east and get me some meat. More to the point, I'm looking to cook us up some tender shoveltusk meat.\n\nJust beware the stags... they're mean!",o="将6块铲齿鹿肉交给西部卫戍要塞的厨师凯图·黑罐。",oEN="Chef Kettleblack has asked you to obtain 6 Shoveltusk Meat and deliver them to her at Westguard Keep.",p="这世间没有比铲齿鹿腹侧的柔软嫩肉更奢侈的了！",pEN="There's nothing as sumptuous as the tender meat carved from the flanks of a shoveltusk!",c="这够给弟兄们做一顿好饭了。<厨师凑得更近，在你耳边低语。>来，<小子:亲爱的>，给自己也拿点。你看起来确实该在身上多长点肉了！\n\n\n\n",cEN="This will make a fine meal for the men.\n\n<The chef leans in closer to whisper in your ear.>\n\nHere, <boy /deary>, take some for yourself. You look like you could use some more meat on your bones!"}
Q[11156]={d="恐怖图腾的成员聚集在这里北面的恐角岗哨，现在他们真是越来越大胆了。在晚上，你能常常听到他们在颂唱与这里的居民战斗的“事迹”。\n\n他们决心把我们从农场上赶走，但是塔贝萨在这里训练了一代代的学徒，怎么会说走就走呢？我们尽全力保护着农场，但学徒加里奥在上次战斗中受伤了。\n\n去恐角岗哨消灭你所找到的一切恐怖图腾成员！必须阻止他们的进攻！",dEN="The Grimtotems up at Direhorn Post, just to the north, are getting bolder by the day. At night, you can often hear them chanting about their deeds in battle against people who've tried to settle here.\n\nThey're determined to drive us from Tabetha's farm even though she's trained generations of apprentices here. We've defended the farm as best we can, but Apprentice Garion was wounded in the last attack.\n\nGo to Direhorn Post and kill any Grimtotem you can find! The attacks must stop.",o="在恐角岗哨消灭12个恐怖图腾成员，然后向塔贝萨农场的学徒莫兰恩复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Direhorn Grimtotems and return to Apprentice Morlann at Tabetha's Farm.",p="关于阻止恐怖图腾进攻，你有任何进展吗？",pEN="Have you made any progress in stopping the Grimtotem attacks?",c="<学徒莫兰恩点点头。>\n\n很好。如果你把前来骚扰叫作陪伴的话，我不认为我会想念他们的。你会觉得至少在沼泽中可以获得些许隐私权，懂吗？",cEN="<Apprentice Morlann nods.>\n\nGood. Can't say I'll miss the company, if you can call it that. You'd think at least in the middle of the swamp you'd get some privacy, you know?"}
Q[11157]={d="$n，这件事只有交给你来办我才放心。瞧见东南方那片着火的森林了吧，我要你去那儿对付始祖幼龙和满地的始祖龙蛋！\n\n灰烬龙巢的火势一直没有得到控制，一定是某种神秘的魔法力量在作祟。如果不尽快采取措施的话，再过几周我们就会被大火包围！\n\n摧毁始祖龙蛋，杀掉始祖龙崽，帮助我们解除威胁吧。",dEN="<name>, I don't trust anyone but you to take care of this. I need the proto-drake eggs and proto-whelps in the burning forest to the southeast destroyed!\n\nSince we arrived here, the Ember Clutch has been ablaze; there must be some sort of perverse magic at work. And lately it seems to be growing. My men tell me that if we don't do something quickly, we'll be surrounded on all sides by the fire within a few weeks' time!\n\nGet down there and eliminate the threat by destroying those eggs and the proto-whelps.",o="摧毁15枚始祖龙卵，并杀死15只始祖龙崽，然后返回西部卫戍要塞，向亚当斯上尉复命。",oEN="Destroy 15 Proto-Drake Eggs and 15 Proto-Whelps, and then return to Captain Adams at Westguard Keep.",p="你进行得如何？",pEN="How go your efforts?",c="干得好！运气好的话，毁灭这些蛋和幼龙应该足以逼退这些热腾腾的野兽，并且阻止魔法火焰的扩散。\n\n等等……那是什么声音？那听起来像是某种翅膀拍动声。",cEN="Good work! With any luck at all, the destruction of their egg clutches and whelps should drive off those fiery beasts and prevent that magical blaze from spreading.\n\nWait... what's that sound? It sounds like the beating of wings."}
Q[11158]={d="在这里见到布罗格让你吃惊吗，$g小:小;$r？别担心。\n泥链镇的哥布林是布罗格的朋友，你也可以成为朋友。新领主没有为黑龙人摧毁旧家园、杀害布罗格许多老朋友而复仇，于是布罗格离开了蕨墙村。\n布罗格来这里是为了让朋友们的灵魂安息并为他们复仇，但布罗格需要帮忙做准备。仪式需要带有强大魔法的羽毛，就像镇子西边血沼巢穴的迅猛龙身上所带的那种。",dEN="Are you startled by Brogg's presence here, little <race>? Don't worry. Goblins at Mudsprocket are Brogg's friends and you can be, too.\n\nBrogg left Brackenwall Village when new overlord not take revenge against black dragonkin for destroying old home and killing many of Brogg's old friends. Brogg come here to lay friends spirits to rest and avenge them, but Brogg need help preparing. For ritual, Brogg need feathers with strong magic, like ones worn by raptors at Bloodfen Burrow to the west of town.",o="将5片血沼羽毛交给泥链镇的布洛格。",oEN="Bring 5 Bloodfen Feathers to Brogg at Mudsprocket.",p="<布洛格满怀希望地看着你。>\n\n你带了血沼羽毛吗？",pEN="<Brogg looks at you hopefully.>\n\nYou bring Brogg feathers?",c="<布洛格收下那些羽毛。>\n\n布洛格对这些羽毛感到很满意。魔力很强。布洛格不知道迅猛龙如何给这些羽毛力量，但迅猛龙羽毛总是最适合仪式了。",cEN="<Brogg accepts the feathers.>\n\nBrogg pleased with these feathers. Very strong magic. Brogg not know what raptors do to give feathers power, but raptor feathers always best for ritual."}
Q[11159]={d="布洛格已经完成了图腾，它可以让朋友们的灵魂回归安息。那些龙打过来的时候，杀死了几乎所有没来得及逃走的朋友。布洛格和莫格穆洛克大王，一直希望能领导其它幸存下来的石槌食人魔发动反击。\n\n不过，反击一直没有开始，而死去同胞们的灵魂却一直困扰着布洛格与其它人。把这根图腾带到石槌废墟去，在那些食人魔的骸骨旁使用它，将他们的灵魂吸引到你这里，击败那些灵魂，就能让他们获得安息了。",dEN="Brogg has completed the totem that will put the spirits of his friends to rest. When the dragonkin came, they killed all Stonemaul who did not flee. Brogg fled with Overlord Mok'Morokk, hoping to lead a counterattack with other Stonemaul survivors.\n\nThe counterattack never came and the spirits of the Stonemaul dead still haunt Brogg and the others. Take this totem north to Stonemaul Ruins and use it near ogre skeletons to draw the spirit to you. Defeat the spirit to give it rest with its bones.",o="泥链镇的布洛格要求你让10个石槌之魂得到安息。",oEN="Brogg, at Mudsprocket, wants you to put 10 Stonemaul Spirits to rest.",p="布洛格一定要知道，你有没有带给那些暴力的石槌之魂平静？",pEN="Brogg must know, have you brought peace to the violent spirits of the Stonemaul?",c="布洛格感谢你的帮忙，虽然他知道莫格穆洛克大王一定不会感谢你。起码幸存的石槌终于可以专心面对生者的问题，而让死者获得归属。布洛格现在只剩下一件事了。",cEN="Brogg thanks you for your help, although he knows Overlord Mok'Morokk never will. At least surviving Stonemaul can finally focus on problems with the living and leave dead where they belong. Only one thing remains for Brogg to do."}
Q[11160]={d="当那些龙跑过来夺走布洛格的家时，大多数的石槌食人魔都逃跑了，没来得及带走任何东西，甚至包括氏族的旗帜。\n\n布洛格知道旗帜就藏在石槌食人魔山中，不过现在，那地方被称作火焰洞穴了。布洛格一定要夺回旗帜，用它向那些杀死了朋友们的龙复仇。\n\n总之，布洛格氏族的领地，现在叫火焰洞穴，就在泥链镇的西北方向，不过那里现在全是龙了。旗帜一定就藏在洞穴深处，要小心，$n。",dEN="When the dragons came and took over Brogg's old home, Stonemaul ogres fled and left everything behind, including clan's banner.\n\nBrogg knows banner was kept deep in Stonemaul ogre mound, but these days it's called Den of Flame. Brogg must have clan banner to get his revenge on dragons who killed his friends.\n\nBrogg's clan's old mound, Den of Flame, is northwest of Mudsprocket and crawling with dragonkin. Banner will be deep inside the cave. Be careful, <name>.",o="夺取石槌战旗，并将它交给泥链镇的布洛格。",oEN="Retrieve the Stonemaul Banner and bring it to Brogg at Mudsprocket.",p="你带了氏族军旗吗？",pEN="You bring Stonemaul banner?",c="布洛格感谢你，$n，布洛格对氏族战旗有个大计划。",cEN="You have Brogg's thanks, <name>. Brogg has big plans for clan banner."}
Q[11161]={d="要想做出布洛格在仪式上必须要用到的图腾，就需要那些曾杀死朋友们的生物的精华。布洛格的敌人所发散出来的仇恨与愤怒，将会给魔法灌入仇恨的力量。\n\n去找火鬃斥候、火鬃灰尾龙人，还有火鬃守卫，杀死它们，再在尸体上使用图腾。龙类只有在死去的时候才会释放出精华。\n\n这些家伙就在西北方的火焰洞穴和北方的石槌废墟一带活动。",dEN="To make the totem Brogg will need for his ritual, he must use the essences of the creatures who killed his friends. The hate and anger of Brogg's enemies will fuel the magic of his vengeance.\n\nTrack down Firemane ash tails, scouts, or scalebanes and use Brogg's totem on their corpses. Only when the dragonkin die will they give up their essences.\n\nThe creatures you seek swarm over the Den of Flame to the northwest and the Stonemaul Ruins to the north.",o="将10份黑龙精华交给泥链镇的布洛格。",oEN="Bring 10 Black Dragonkin Essences to Brogg at Mudsprocket.",p="你拿到那些精华了吗？布洛格一定要有那些东西才能替他的朋友复仇！",pEN="Do you have the essences? Brogg must have them to avenge his friends!",c="布洛格感谢你，$n，一旦布洛格把这些魔法加进图腾里，就可以使布洛格死去的朋友获得救赎。",cEN="You have Brogg's thanks, <name>. Once Brogg adds their magic to the totem, it will be able to redeem the spirits of Brogg's fallen friends."}
Q[11162]={d="布洛格已经决定要对沼泽里那些黑龙展开复仇了。$n，你可以给我很大的帮助。你会帮忙吗？\n\n把布洛格的氏族旗帜带上，到东边去找一处类似龙嘴的洞穴，把旗帜插在那里。这样就象征着我正式对奥妮克希亚宣战了。\n\n布洛格，还有石槌氏族一定要夺回属于我们自己的土地！",dEN="Brogg relishes the thought of taking his revenge on the black dragonkin of the marsh. <name>, you have been very helpful in preparing for this moment. Will you help?\n\nTake Brogg's clan banner and travel east until you see a cave like a dragon's mouth. At the entrance to that cave, plant Stonemaul banner and issue Brogg's challenge to Onyxia.\n\nBrogg and the Stonemaul will have their lands back!",o="将石槌战旗插在奥妮克希亚的巢穴入口附近，等待奥妮克希亚的回应，然后回去向泥链镇的布洛格复命。",oEN="Plant the Stonemaul Banner near the entrance to Onyxia's Lair, wait for Onyxia's response, then return to Brogg at Mudsprocket.",p="布洛格要进行他的复仇！",pEN="Brogg will have his revenge!",c="<Brogg escucha mientras relatas tu experiencia en la entrada de la guarida de Onyxia>布罗格早就怀疑奥妮克希亚太懦弱，不敢与你正面交锋。黑色龙族就是这样，只在稳操胜券时才进攻。布罗格感谢你的帮助，$n，他永远不会忘记你为他所做的一切。布罗格绝不会放弃让石槌氏族回归故土的追寻。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Brogg listens as you recount your experience at the entrance to Onyxia's lair.>\n\nBrogg suspected Onyxia would be too much of a coward to confront you. Just like black dragonflight to attack when victory is guaranteed.\n\nBrogg is grateful for your help, <name>, and he will never forget what you have done for him. Brogg will never give up his quest to bring Stonemaul back where they belong."}
Q[11163]={d="<Donna mira alrededor y te susurra>$n，我接下来要告诉你的事必须保密，明白吗？我是被沙塔斯维和者派来潜入巴德那伙人的。老实说，从你一到这儿起，你就是我调查中的关键关注对象。但你的功绩已经洗清了所有嫌疑。事实上，因为你除掉了那个疯狂的首领祖尔金，我不得不为你的付出给你奖赏。\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="<Donna looks around and then whispers to you.>\n\n<name>, what I'm about to tell you must remain confidential, understood?\n\nI've been sent by the Shattrath Peacekeepers to infiltrate Budd's gang here. Truth be told, since you first arrived you've been a key person of interest in my investigation.\n\nBut your deeds have since cleared you of any suspicion. In fact, for your slaying of the crazed warlord, Zul'Jin, I'm compelled to reward you for your efforts.",o="向多娜·布拉斯库报告你的英雄事迹，并领取你的奖励。多娜现在驻扎在祖阿曼外面的幽魂之地。",oEN="Report to Donna Brascoe to collect a reward for your heroism in Zul'Aman. Donna is currently stationed in the Ghostlands, just outside Zul'aman.",c="「唐娜环顾四周，然后对你低语。」<name>，我接下来要告诉你的事必须保密，明白吗？我是被沙塔斯维和者派来潜入巴德那伙人的。老实说，从你第一次来到这里起，你就是我调查中的关键人物。但你的功绩从此洗清了你的嫌疑。事实上，因为你处决了那个疯狂的督军祖尔金，我不得不为你的付出给你奖赏。\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Donna looks around and then whispers to you.>\n\n<name>, what I'm about to tell you must remain confidential, understood?\n\nI've been sent by the Shattrath Peacekeepers to infiltrate Budd's gang here. Truth be told, since you first arrived you've been a key person of interest in my investigation.\n\nBut your deeds have since cleared you of any suspicion. In fact, for your slaying of the crazed warlord, Zul'Jin, I'm compelled to reward you for your efforts."}
Q[11164]={d="嗨，朋友！你是新来的吧？ 我托你办件事吧....\n\n巴德一直想让他的森林巨魔伪装变得更逼真。他说他就快完成了——只是需要最后一点加工，只是需要点獠牙而已……\n\n我的剥皮才能在这里毫无用处，拔那些巨魔的獠牙让我感到恶心。\n\n带10根巨魔獠牙回来给我，怎么样，朋友？",dEN="'Ey mon! You be new around 'ere, eh? Lemme ask a favor of ya.\n\nBudd's been refinin' his forest troll disguise. Says that he be close now - just be needin' one last touch. Tusks.\n\nMy skinnin' talents be wasted 'ere. Somethin' about yankin' troll tusks be makin me queasy.\n\nBring me back 10 troll tusks, eh mon?",o="普雷蒙要你从祖阿曼的巨魔身上收集10根森林巨魔獠牙，把它们带回巴德的营地交给他。",oEN="Prigmon needs you to collect 10 Forest Troll Tusks from the trolls in Zul'Aman. Bring them to him at Budd's camp in the Ghostlands.",p="快点，兄弟！\n\n如果我再不快点给那些獠牙，他就要把我送进祖阿曼去试验他的面具。",pEN="Hurry, mon!\n\nBudd be sendin' me into Zul'Aman alone to test his mask if I don't be givin' him those tusks soon!",c="啊哈，这些正是我要的！这就是我答应你的报酬，<class>。\n\n",cEN="Ahh yeah, these be just what I be needin'!\n\nHere be the payment I promised ya, <class>."}
Q[11165]={d="听着，老兄，还有件事得替老普里格蒙办。我的废物表弟尊加姆被困在祖阿曼里了。他还活着——我昨晚还看见他的信号弹亮着呢！他害我卷进这摊烂事，我本该让他烂在那儿，可他还欠我一大笔钱。你尽力帮他脱身，剩下的收账交给我！\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="Lissen mon, there be sumthin' else needs doin fer ol' Prigmon.\n\nZungam, my good-fer-nuthin' cousin, be stuck inside Zul'Aman. He still be alive too - I seen his signal flare just last night!\n\nI should be lettin' him rot fer gettin' me tied up in this mess, but he be owin' me big money.\n\nDo what ya can to help him out, then leave the collectin' to me!",o="普雷蒙希望你深入祖阿曼，找到并帮助他的表兄苏加姆。",oEN="Prigmon has tasked you with locating and assisting his cousin Zungam, somewhere within Zul'Aman.",c="我自由了！\n\n他们抓住我的时候，几乎把我所有的东西都拿走了，但靠过来——收下我最后的一点钱币吧。\n\n除此之外，我还可以留在这里提供一点服务……",cEN="I be free!\n\nDey took most everyting when dey nabbed me, but here - take the last of my coin fer your troubles.\n\nAnd the least I can be doin' is stickin' around to offer my services...."}
Q[11166]={d="那些蠢货怎么会失败？我告诉过他们要小心。\n我甚至给了他们地图和伪装，帮他们掩人耳目。唉…\n…至少他们的失败给你留下了这个机会。\n要是你成功了，就能加入我和我的队伍，分享我们很快就会赢得的无量名声。说实话，我并不是需要更多名声。\n我地图上还有几处地方需要进一步勘察，才能开始安全的发掘……",dEN="How did those fools fail? I told them to be careful - even gave them disguises to help them blend in. Ahh, well. The bright side of their failure is that this opportunity falls to you.\n\nSucceed, and you'll be well on your way to joining my crew and sharing in the immeasurable fame that will soon be mine. Not that I need any more, mind you.\n\nThere are yet a few portions of my map that require further exploration before our excavation can be initiated....",o="进入祖阿曼并调查哈尔拉兹的大厅、加亚莱的平台和埃基尔松的平台。将这些地方的细节报告给巴德，他的营地就在幽魂之地。",oEN="Enter Zul'Aman and visit Halazzi's Chamber, Jan'alai's Platform, and Akil'zon's Platform. Report the details of those areas to Budd, at his camp in the Ghostlands.",p="我相信我手制的伪装能够你在祖阿曼适当的保护。\n\n你替我勘查过那些区域了吗？还是我应该要开始找取代你的人？",pEN="I trust that my hand-crafted disguises have given you adequate protection in Zul'aman.\n\nHave you scouted those areas for me? Or shall I begin looking for your replacements?",c="<巴德努力维持镇定。>呃——那么，<name>——是，呃，你该回来的时候了。是的——事实上，你耽搁了整个行动。那么现在，我们来把这张地图补完吧……\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Budd struggles to maintain his composure.>\n\nErr - So, <name> - it's, uhhh, about time you returned. Yes - in fact you're holding up the entire operation.\n\nNow then, let's get to filling in this map...."}
Q[11167]={d="阿尔萨斯让我们所有人都变成了这幅佝偻的样子，剥落了我们死后的宁静。随后，我们皇家药剂师学会也决定大力研究自己的药剂。\n\n现在，这种药剂已经研究完成，并且我们还计划将它运用在这里，天灾军团的腹地。\n\n然而，那条载有幽暗城实验室新培植的药剂的船却被联盟海军击沉了。立刻到东南边的沉船残骸边上去回收装有药剂的容器，挽回越多越好。",dEN="Not long after Arthas condemned us to this wretched existence, we in the Royal Apothecary Society endeavored to create a plague of our own. A plague that would devour all flesh: living, dead or undead.\n\nWe've succeeded in creating this plague and we're here to hand deliver it to the Scourge's doorstep.\n\nThe Alliance intercepted the ship carrying the latest strain engineered in our Undercity laboratories. Head to the wreckage southeast of here and salvage whatever containers you can.",o="复仇港的药剂师雷杉德尔要求你从东南边的沉船残骸附近回收10个完整的药剂容器。",oEN="Apothecary Lysander at Vengeance Landing wants you to recover 10 Intact Plague Containers from the wrecked ship to the southeast.",p="你拿到那些容器了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the containers, <name>?",c="你安全地回来了，真不错。其实光是带着这些容器就染疫的机率，也并非完全没有，不过我想我应该早提醒过你了。",cEN="It's good that you're back in one piece. The danger of becoming infected from handling these containers is not non-existent. I suppose I should've warned you about that earlier."}
Q[11168]={d="我感觉长时间的海上旅行似乎影响了药剂的效果。我们得用一种强力的催化剂刺激出药剂本身的活性。\n\n根据我的记忆，洛丹伦大陆那边一种小体型的热带棕壳潮行蟹体内就有蕴涵着非常厉害的催化剂，它的麻痹性甚至可以在几秒内把一只食人魔弄得不醒人事。而附近海滩上的这些螃蟹似乎是那些热带潮行蟹的变种，理论上体内也应该有强烈的催化活性。\n\n而且，根据我们熟知的“体型大一切都大”的原则，这些本地变种体内巨大的毒腺一定具有更强的催化活性。给我弄一些回来！",dEN="I've a feeling the long trip across the sea is affecting the effectiveness of our plague. What is needed is a potent toxin to boost the potency of the strain.\n\nThe crabs near this beach are a distant relative of the much smaller brown-shelled tidecrawler. The smaller tropical variety produces a paralytic toxin strong enough to knock out an ogre.\n\nAs we all know bigger is better! The much larger glands on the local variety should prove more potent. Bring me a few!",o="从巨型潮行蟹身上获取3个巨型毒腺，把它们交给复仇港的药剂师雷杉德尔。",oEN="Bring 3 Giant Toxin Glands from Giant Tidecrawlers to Apothecary Lysander at Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord.",p="你拿到我要找的毒素腺体了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the toxin glands I seek, <name>?",c="你不断证明着自己的能力，<name>。\n但愿这份毒素足以把我们的瘟疫提升到需要的水平。\n至少它应该能帮助削弱受试者，让他们更容易被感染。",cEN="You continue to prove your competence, <name>. Hopefully this toxin will be enough to boost our plague to the levels that we need to.\n\nAt the very least it should help weaken the recipient and make them more susceptible to infection."}
Q[11169]={d="我在上次恐怖图腾进攻的时候受伤了，不过在受伤之前，我从敌人那里夺取了一根奇怪的图腾。\n\n那个东西在战斗中会发出让人感到刺痛的魔法箭，不过我实验了这么久，还是想不出它是怎么运作的。如果你愿意帮我测试一下那图腾的话，我很愿意把它借给你。\n\n那些令人讨厌的尘泥杂斑鳄鱼把农场周围的泥沼地当成了自己的家。相信我，你不会找不到它们的。尽量在图腾附近和鳄鱼战斗吧。",dEN="During the last Grimtotem attack, I was wounded, but not before I managed to capture a curious totem our enemies were using against us.\n\nIt seemed to be emitting raw bolts of energy during the battle, but in all my experiments, I haven't managed to figure out how it works. I'll loan the totem to you if you agree to help me test it.\n\nThe watery areas surrounding the farm are home to pesky mottled drywallow crocolisks and drywallow daggermaws. Try fighting the crocolisks near the totem.",o="塔贝萨农场的学徒加里奥希望你在10头尘泥杂斑鳄鱼身上测试被捕获的图腾。",oEN="Apprentice Garion at Tabetha's Farm wants you to test the Captured Totem on 10 Mottled Drywallow Crocolisks or Drywallow Daggermaws.",p="你测试图腾的时候可有什么好运？",pEN="Have you had any luck testing the totem?",c="<学徒仔细听着你关于测试情况的描述。>\n\n薄雾和一些闪电？就这样？那个图腾一定不只这些！恐怖图腾不会把这种东西带上战场除非它有一些实际的功效。",cEN="<The apprentice listens as you describe your experiment.>\n\nA haze and some lightning? That's it? There's got to be more to the totem than just that! The Grimtotems aren't likely to bring something like this to the battlefield unless it has some kind of utility."}
Q[11170]={d="我们最近收到的情报指出，联盟军队即将获得大量的增援。这时机真是好得不能再好了！\n\n就先让联盟派过来的那些北方舰队预备兵尝尝这种药剂的厉害吧！\n\n带上这些药剂瓶，然后去找蝙蝠管理员卡米蕾，告诉她你要征用一只蝙蝠执行特殊任务。\n\n等你骑着蝙蝠飞到海上之后，使用你的药剂瓶就可以了。真想马上知道实验的结果呀！",dEN="We've just received word of reinforcements coming to the aid of the Alliance forces. Their timing couldn't be better!\n\nWe're in sore need of test subjects and these North Fleet reservists will do nicely!\n\nTake these plague vials with you and speak to Camille, the Bat Handler. Tell her you need to commandeer a riding bat for a special assignment for us.\n\nOnce you're at sea, drop the vials on the reinforcement fleet. I can't wait to see the results!",o="与蝙蝠管理员卡米蕾交谈，骑乘蝙蝠前去拦截联盟的增援部队。飞到联盟舰队上空时，使用药剂瓶拦截他们并统计16份测试结果。",oEN="Speak to Bat Handler Camille and take a riding bat to intercept the Alliance reinforcements. Once above their fleet, use the Plague Vials to infect 16 North Fleet reservists.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You're back!",c="嗯……实地测试的结果……不太令人满意！",cEN="Hmmphh.... the reports from the field are.... not encouraging!"}
Q[11171]={d="太好了！我隆重进入祖阿曼的一切都差不多准备好了。\n你干得不错，$n。我跟我的队伍谈过，他们挺喜欢你的，我甚至可以说你快成我们中的一员了。\n只剩一件事要办——干掉那个所谓妖术领主的家伙。\n其实没什么大不了的。你站到那可怜虫面前，他多半转身就跑。\n虚弱年老的巨魔就爱给自己加些吓人的头衔，好掩盖自己的缺陷，你明白吧？|n",dEN="Excellent! Everything's nearly ready for my grand entrance into Zul'Aman.\n\nYou've done a fine job, <name>. I've spoken with my crew and they're warming up to you nicely. I'd say you're very close to becoming a permanent member of the team. Only one thing remains for you to do - dispatch that 'Hex Lord' fellow.\n\nNothing to it, really. You stand up to this wretch and he'll likely just turn and run. Weaker, older trolls just add intimidating titles to their name to make up for their deficiencies, you see?",o="战斧岭的巴德·奈德雷克要你转至祖阿曼，杀死妖术领主玛拉卡斯。",oEN="Budd Nedreck in Hatchet Hills wants you to kill Hex Lord Malacrass in Zul'Aman.",p="我希望你明白我给了你多大的机会，迪德threexs。你收拾掉老玛拉卡斯了吗？\n\n",pEN="I hope you appreciate the magnitude of the opportunity I've given you, Diedthreexs.\n\nHave you taken care of old Malacrass yet?",c="终于！既然轻松的活干完了，我终于能再在历史上留下一个印记了。\n但首先，还有一件小事要处理——你……\n恐怕，<name>，我该让你走的时候到了。\n我觉得你在这里的潜力已经到头了，甚至是被大大超越了。不过别难过。\n毕竟，要参与如此非凡的事件还不失理智，需要格外杰出的人。看这儿，我有点小东西给你，好让你记住我。",cEN="Finally! Now that the light work is done, I can at last make yet another mark on history. But first, there's one small matter to attend to - You....\n\nI'm afraid, <name>, that the time has come for me to let you go. I feel that your potential has been reached here, if not far exceeded.\n\nDon't feel bad, though. After all, it takes an exceptional type of individual to participate in such extraordinary events and not lose their wits. And look here, I have a little something for you to remember me by."}
Q[11172]={d="不久前，一艘地精飞艇坠毁在了东面。几天前，一个热砂集团的代表经过了这里。\n\n她到处询问着关于飞艇上的货物和飞行员比吉尔的消息，不过我们都没有仔细查看过坠毁现场。我怀疑她一个人能否清理坠毁现场，或者找回飞船运载的货物。\n\n如果你有时间的话，就去比吉尔的飞艇残骸，看看你有什么可以帮到她的吧。飞艇残骸就在这里的东面，山脉的附近。",dEN="Not long ago, a goblin zeppelin crashed to the east. A representative of the Steamwheedle Cartel passed through here a few days ago.\n\nShe was looking for information about the zeppelin's cargo and it's pilot, Beezil, but none of us really got a good look at the crash. I doubt she'll be able to clean up after the wreck by herself, much less recover whatever cargo the vessel might have carried.\n\nIf you have time, you may want to check up on her out at Beezil's Wreck, due east of here, near the mountains.",o="与比吉尔的飞艇残骸处的莫希·斯蒂格里谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Moxie Steelgrille at Beezil's Wreck.",c="所以你是说那些隐居的法师们派你来的吗？我怎么知道该不该相信你呢？\n\n我想我的确需要帮助。反正这里也不会有法师用的上的东西。",cEN="So those hermit mages sent you? How can I be sure that I can trust you?\n\nI suppose I can use the help. There's not much here a mage would be interested in, anyway."}
Q[11173]={d="如果你指望学徒莫兰恩去做些什么的话，我想他所能做的也只有对着材料发牢骚了。\n\n我通常都是无视他，但根本不起作用。这次，我要试些不同的方法。\n\n如果我在他发现之前把缺少的材料放回去，也许他就能让我安静一会了。我们都要用到的最常用的材料是沼泽毒药，那东西可以从农场北面沼泽的暗牙爬行者和毒性切割者身上得到。如果你能帮我弄来毒药，我就可以在莫兰恩发现前把它放回去。",dEN="If there's one thing you can count on Apprentice Morlann to do, it's whine about reagents.\n\nNormally, I just ignore him, and it never works. This time, I'm going to try something different.\n\nMaybe if I replace the missing reagents before he notices, he'll leave me alone. The most common reagent we both use is marsh venom, which comes from the darkfang creepers and noxious shredders in the marsh north of the farm. If you bring me the venom, I'll replace it before Morlann notices it's gone.",o="将6瓶沼泽毒药交给塔贝萨农场的学徒加里奥。",oEN="Bring 6 vials of Marsh Venom to Apprentice Garion at Tabetha's Farm.",p="你取得毒液了吗？莫兰恩随时都可能发现它不见了……",pEN="Did you get that venom? Morlann's going to discover that it's gone any moment now...",c="<学徒加里奥检视着毒药。>\n\n这真是太完美了！他将不会发现任何差异之处。",cEN="<Apprentice Garion inspects the venom.>\n\nThis is absolutely perfect! He'll never know the difference."}
Q[11174]={d="看看这个地方！到处都是软泥怪，要是我不想点什么办法控制它们的话，它们就会腐蚀掉残骸和飞艇的货物！\n\n我不能空手回去，$c！在这些软泥怪消化掉所有东西之前，帮我消灭它们吧！\n\n这台设备充电后可以将能量集中到这些软泥怪身上，让它们爆炸。飞艇的能量核心碎片应该可以给这台设备提供能量，靠近主坠毁点的那个始终可以正常工作，不过其它的时好时坏。",dEN="Just look at this area! It's swarming with oozes. If I don't find some way to keep them under control, they'll corrode the wreckage and the zeppelin's cargo!\n\nI can't go back empty-handed, <class>! Help me dissolve these oozes before they've digested everything!\n\nThis device, when powered, will concentrate energy on the slimes, causing them to explode. The zeppelin's fragmented power core should power the device. The one near the main crash works all the time, but the others flicker on and off.",o="莫希·斯蒂格里希望你去溶解10只软泥怪，然后回到比吉尔的飞艇残骸旁向她复命。",oEN="Moxie Steelgrille wants you to dissolve 10 oozes and report back to her at Beezil's Wreck.",p="你对这些软泥怪的进展如何呢？",pEN="Did you make any progress against those oozes?",c="嗯，这里的确看起来空多了……\n\n我想接下来是时候抢救这些残骸了。",cEN="Well, it does look a little cleaner out there...\n\nI suppose it's time to get down to the business of salvaging this wreckage."}
Q[11175]={d="是真的吗？进入低语峡谷的探险者真的都发疯了吗？\n\n几天前，我的女儿伊蕾娜带领一队探险者协会的成员去了北边的钢铁之门。发生了这样可怕的事，我很担心她。\n\n$c，像我这样的老头子恐怕经不起旅途的颠簸。你能帮我跑一趟，确认她是否安全吗？",dEN="Tell me, is it true? Did the explorers that went into Whisper Gulch go mad?\n\nMy daughter is the overseer of the Explorers' League that went north to some place called Steel Gate. With the horrible events that have befallen us, I fear for her safety.\n\nPlease, <class>, I am too old to make the journey. Her name is Irena. Will you go make certain that she is alright?",o="转至钢铁之门找到石衣老爹的女儿，工头伊蕾娜·石衣。",oEN="Old Man Stonemantle has asked you to find his daughter, Overseer Irena Stonemantle, at Steel Gate.",c="呃，我就知道！他真是超超超超超超级保护过度！真是丢脸。\n\n不过我也很高兴你来了——我们全都是，我们很需要你的帮忙！",cEN="Grrr. I knew it! He's sooooo over-protective! This is just embarassing.\n\nNot that I'm not happy to see you... I am! We all are. We can use your help!"}
Q[11176]={d="研究工作才刚刚开始。不过我们从西部卫戍要塞带来了一批飞行器，有望提高工作效率。\n\n问题是……我们缺少熟练的飞行员。北边裂木森林的局势持续恶化，我决定尽快搞定这里的事情，然后启程返回家园。\n\n如果你愿意帮忙的话，就和探险队的考古学家谈一谈。他们就在遗址北面和南面的飞行器旁。",dEN="Our work out here is really just beginning. But now that we've brought these flying machines in from Westguard Keep, it should really pick up.\n\nThe problem is that we're lacking enough qualified pilots. And with things getting worse in the Rivenwood to the north, I'd like to get things wrapped up here quickly and then head back home.\n\nIf you can lend a hand, go have a chat with one of my chief archaeologists. You'll find them next to the flying machines on the north and south sides of the site.",o="伊蕾娜·石衣要你和钢铁之门的钢铁之门首席考古学家谈一谈。",oEN="Explorer Irena Stonemantle has asked you to speak with a Steel Gate Chief Archaeologist at Steel Gate.",c="伊蕾娜派你过来，对吧？很好，我们有工作要交给你！",cEN="Irena sent you over, did she? Good, we've got work for you then!"}
Q[11177]={d="有个当地人称作沼泽之眼贾尔的家伙，独自住在沼泽里。不久前，在前任主人神秘失踪之后，他接管了沼泽之光庄园。\n我喜欢时不时派人去看看他。他某种程度上让我想起我爷爷，你知道吗？\n有人说他脑子不太正常。如果你沿塞拉摩外的路往西北走，会在路转向西之前的女巫丘陵一带找到沼泽之光庄园。\n\"\"\n\"\"",dEN="There's a fellow the locals know as \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl, who lives alone out in the swamp. Sometime ago he \"took over\" Swamplight Manor after the previous owners disappeared under mysterious circumstances.\n\nI like to send someone to check up on him every once in a while. He kind of reminds me of my grandfather, you know? Some say he's not quite right in the head.\n\nIf you're headed northwest on the road out of Theramore, you'll find Swamplight Manor in the Witch Hill area, before the road turns west.",o="到沼泽之光庄园与沼泽之眼贾尔谈谈。\"\"",oEN="Speak to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at Swamplight Manor.",c="离开我的草坪……除非，也就是说，你想帮老沼泽之眼做点饭。你说呢？\"\"",cEN="Get off my lawn... unless, that is, you want to help old \"Swamp Eye\" with a little bit of cooking. Whad'ya say?"}
Q[11178]={d="当你观察这只瓶子时，你突然想起了祖阿曼外面那个狂妄的家伙。\n\n你迫不及待地想要看到巴德的表情！",dEN="As you examine the pulsating vial, your thoughts turn to the petulant little man outside Zul'Aman.\n\nYou can't wait to see Budd's expression when he sees this!",o="把祖尔金之血交给祖阿曼外面幽魂之地的巴德。",oEN="Bring the Blood of Zul'jin to Budd at his camp in the Ghostlands, outside Zul'Aman.",p="<巴德努力掩饰对你的不满。>又是你……我不知道还能怎么说——我实在太忙于自己的准备工作，没法再牵着你的手了。相信我，<name>，这都是为你好。也许靠着某种奇迹，你最终能给自己挣个名头。真要是那样，你就可以说，你的事业是从无与伦比的巴德·内德雷克这里起步的！\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",pEN="<Budd tries to mask his displeasure at your presence.>\n\nYou again....\n\nI don't know how else to say it - I'm simply too busy with my preparations to hold your hand any longer.\n\nTrust me, <name>, it's all for the best. Perhaps, by some miracle, you might eventually build a name for yourself.\n\nIf so, you'll be able to say that you got your start from the incomparable Budd Nedreck!",c="你说这是…\n…\n祖尔金本人的血？\n<巴德定了定神，继续说道>好吧，我感谢你这份心意，<class>，但我本可以轻松干掉他。\n他绝不可能像传说里那么可怕。这种事总是被夸大得离谱，你以后会明白的。\n更可能的是，那个可怜的老糊涂是被关节炎折腾垮的！\n不管怎么说，我想这算是你对我在这里给你的关照最起码的回报吧。\n现在，快走开！\n我得处理掉这瓶恶心的东西！",cEN="Th-the Blood of Zul'jin himself you say?\n\n<Gathering himself, Budd continues>\n\nWell, I appreciate the gesture, <class>, but I could've taken him down with ease. There's no way he was as fearful as the legends say. These things have a way of being utterly overstated, as you'll learn in time. More likely, the pitiful old cretin was overcome with arthritis!\n\nAnyway, I suppose it was the least you could do as payment for the kindness I've shown you here.\n\nNow off with you - I must dispose of this vile vial!"}
Q[11180]={d="我长途跋涉来到这里拜访加尔的新家，但无尽的恐惧一直在笼罩着我！这里肯定有什么东西有问题，并不是只有我的感觉有问题而已……\n\n你看到那些在女巫岭附近游荡的鬼魂和尸体了吗？如果说有人会知道这里曾经发生过了什么，我想也只有他们了。在这附近寻找复活的躯壳和复活的游魂，打败他们，让他们安静下来，在这些恶魔吞噬掉加尔之前，看看你能从他们身上了解到什么！",dEN="I traveled out here to pay Jarl a visit at his new home and it's been a nonstop horror show ever since! There's something seriously wrong here and I can't be the only one who sees it...\n\nHave you seen the ghosts and corpses shambling about Witch Hill? I've a feeling that if anyone knows what happened here, it is them. Seek out these risen husks and risen spirits in the surrounding area, grant them rest through combat, and see what you can learn from them before this evil consumes Jarl!",o="水光庄园的摩丹特·格雷斯比希望你能从10个复活的躯壳或复活的游魂身上收集到信息。",oEN="Mordant Grimsby at Swamplight Manor wants you to gather information from 10 Risen Husks or Risen Spirits.",p="你从在此出没的冤魂身上知道了些什么？",pEN="What have you learned from the spirits haunting this place?",c="<摩丹特拿出羊皮纸与笔，开始记录你的发现。>\n\n通过你的发现，那些鬼魂不只是此地过去的居民，而是每一个曾在这里生活过的人。\n\n某种东西腐化并且杀害了他们。那些人无法及时发现问题。我们一定得要阻止这件事，$n！",cEN="<Mordant produces a small sheet of paper and a pen, beginning to scribble down notes on your findings.>\n\nFrom your findings, the spirits in this place must amount to everyone who ever lived on this land, not just the previous occupants.\n\nSomething has been corrupting and killing them. Those who follow don't learn the truth until it's too late. We have to put an end to this, <name>!"}
Q[11181]={d="在我身为草药师的这么多年里，我观察到大自然可以为大部分烦人的问题提供完美的解决方案。我曾经读到流浪法师和巫医经常使用一种被称为“除巫草”的草药，它的烟能将恶魔从隐藏的暗处吸引出来。\n\n如果这是真的，那么除巫草应该就生长在女巫岭的浅水附近。它有着阔叶和红色茎秆，你应该很容易就能分辨出来。把你能找到的药草都带回来给我吧，$n。它可能是我们唯一的希望了。",dEN="In my years as an herbalist, I've often observed that nature will provide subtle cures to the most vexing of problems. I've read that hedge mages and witch doctors often use the smoke of an herb known as witchbane to draw evil from its hiding places.\n\nIf true, this would mean witchbane should be growing near the shallow waters of Witch Hill. You should be able to identify it by its broad leaves and reddish central stalk. Bring me any of the herb you can find, <name>. It may be our only hope.",o="将9根除巫草交给水光庄园的摩丹特·格雷斯比。",oEN="Bring 9 sprigs of Witchbane to Mordant Grimsby at Swamplight Manor.",p="你有替我找到任何草药吗？我们得加快动作，要赶在那种不知名的邪恶大举入侵控制这个地区之前。",pEN="Were you able to gather any of the herb? We must work quickly, before whatever evil is behind this infestation consolidates its hold on this area.",c="<摩丹特收下了你给他的草药。>\n\n这完全符合那些描述！我在你出去的时候准备好了火炬。接下只需要把草药固定在火炬的末端就行了。",cEN="<Mordant accepts the bunch of herbs from you.>\n\nThese match the description exactly! I prepared the torch while you were out. All that remains is to fasten the herbs to the end here."}
Q[11182]={d="平衡是自然界的主旋律。只有剔除那些不和谐的音符，才能实现真正的平衡。\n\n这么说吧，杀死幼龙抑或是摧毁龙蛋的做法是治标不治本的。新近崛起的维库人以及他们的主人——斯克尔德·达拉克森才是这场森林火灾的罪魁祸首。\n\n去击败他们吧，他们的巢穴就在灰烬龙巢南部。",dEN="All things in nature seek a balance. It is only through the interference of those not in tune with that harmony that the balance is shifted.\n\nYou waste your efforts when you kill the whelps and drakes. The real culprits behind the expansion of these magically burning woods are the newly awakened vrykul and their master, Skeld Drakeson.\n\nIf it's blood on your hands that you seek, start with them. You will find their lair on the south side of the Ember Clutch.",o="杀死斯克尔德·达拉克森和5名掠龙训练者，完成任务后向灰烬龙巢中的灰烬龙巢古树复命。",oEN="Slay 5 Dragonflayer Handlers and Skeld Drakeson. If you manage to do so, return to an Ember Clutch Ancient in the Ember Clutch.",p="对付那些好管闲事杂碎的事情你进行得如何了，小家伙？",pEN="How fare your efforts against the meddlesome handlers, little one?",c="真悲哀啊，我们得靠掠食者来解决另外一种掠食者，但这就是自然的法则。\n\n或许现在那些始祖龙和他们的幼龙能够恢复到平静的生活。虽然我很怀疑，在维库人重新苏醒的情况下它们是否真的办得到。",cEN="Unfortunate that one predator must be used to put down another, but that is the natural order of things.\n\nPerhaps now the proto-drakes and their whelps can go back to living peacefully. Somehow I doubt it with the reawakening of the vrykul."}
Q[11183]={d="火把已经准备好了。把它插在码头的尽头，对可能出现的一切情况做好准备吧。\n\n我不知道火把的浓烟会带来什么……如果真的有东西出现的话。我必须说，我对这种民间魔法是有所怀疑的，但现在我们也没有时间来想其它办法了。看在你和加尔的份上，祝你好运。",dEN="The torch is ready. Plant it at the end of the dock and be prepared to face whatever comes forth.\n\nI have no idea what the torch's smoke may reveal... if anything emerges at all. I must say, I have my doubts about this kind of folk magic, but we haven't time for anything else. For your sake and Jarl's, I wish you luck.",o="水光庄园的摩丹特·格雷斯比希望你将火把放置在码头的尽头，并打败随后出现的任何东西。",oEN="Mordant Grimsby at Swamplight Manor wants you to plant the torch at the end of the dock and defeat anything that appears.",p="结束了吗？",pEN="Is it over?",c="它有用吗？\n\n<摩丹特清了清喉咙。>\n\n我的意思是……它有用！加尔和我欠你一份情，$n。现在唯一的问题就是我朋友对于家具的品味了，不过我想这恐怕没那么好解决。",cEN="It worked?\n\n<Mordant clears his throat.>\n\nI mean... it worked! Jarl and I are in your debt, <name>. Now the only remaining problem is my friend's taste in furniture, and I'm afraid that won't be solved as easily."}
Q[11184]={d="旅行者以及从事野外作业的热砂港雇员请注意，不要靠近城镇西边的鲜血沼泽墓穴。\n\n大群迅猛龙盘踞在那片区域，它们的首领“贪婪的血爪”既残忍又狡猾，至少有两名热砂港工程师惨死于这只野兽的利爪之下。\n\n如果谁能替泥链镇解除威胁，德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔愿意慷慨解囊，奖赏这位勇士。",dEN="Travelers and Steamwheedle personnel working in the field are advised to avoid the Bloodfen Burrow to the west of town.\n\nThe area is overrun with raptors lead by the cruel and cunning Goreclaw the Ravenous, who has already killed at least two Steamwheedle engineers.\n\nDrazzit Dripvalve has authorized a generous reward to be paid to the individual who rids Mudsprocket of this menace.",o="杀死贪婪的血爪，然后向泥链镇的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔复命。",oEN="Kill Goreclaw the Ravenous and report to Drazzit Dripvalve at Mudsprocket.",p="你看起来对自己信心满满。是来领那只怪物迅猛龙的赏金吗？",pEN="You look pretty satisfied with yourself. Come to claim the bounty on that monstrous raptor?",c="感谢上天终于有人担下了这个任务。我差点以为我得把赏金加到三倍才有人肯把那只蠢迅猛龙给干掉，但我们的预算可付不出这笔数字！",cEN="Thank goodness someone's finally taken me up on that offer. I was just thinking that I might need to triple the reward to get that stupid raptor killed, and our budget couldn't afford that!"}
Q[11185]={d="这封信是从一名被遗忘者药剂师尸体上找到的，其中包含令人警觉的证据，证明恐怖图腾与洛丹伦的新主子之间有紧密同盟。\n为表诚意，并作为我们新近建立的信任的象征，我们已派出药剂师希拉协助你们在卡利姆多对抗我们共同的敌人。\n没有人能挡在我们联合的力量与决心面前。这封信应当交给塔贝萨农场的军情七处特工安戴罗·波特。\n\"\n\"",dEN="Recovered from the body of a Forsaken apothecary, this letter contains alarming evidence of a close alliance between the Grimtotems and the new masters of Lordaeron.\n\n\"As a demonstration of good faith and a symbol of our newfound trust, we have dispatched Apothecary Cylla to aid you in battling our mutual enemy in the land of Kalimdor. None will stand before our combined might and determination.\"\n\nThis letter should be brought to the attention of the SI:7 agent at Tabetha's Farm, Andello Porter.",o="将密封的信函交给塔贝萨农场中的安德罗·波特。",oEN="Bring the Sealed Letter to Andello Porter at Tabetha's Farm.",p="你身上带着的是什么东西呢，$c？",pEN="What is that you're carrying, <class>?",c="<安德罗阅读这封信件，对信中的内容感到震惊。>\n\n我们一直以来都担心部落和被遗忘者之间的合作关系，而这封信证实了我们的疑虑。随着被遗忘者暗中供应的魔法和装备，恐怖图腾将成为更可怕的敌人。卡利姆多的势力平衡可能因此而变的动荡不安。",cEN="<Andello reads the letter, shocked at its contents.>\n\nWe've long had misgivings about the cooperation between the Horde and the Forsaken, and this only confirms those suspicions. With the backing for Forsaken magic and arms, the Grimtotems would become an even more fearsome enemy. The balance of power in Kalimdor could shift considerably."}
Q[11186]={d="这封信是从一名被遗忘者药剂师尸体上找到的，其中包含令人警觉的证据，证明恐怖图腾与洛丹伦的新主子之间有紧密同盟。\n为表诚意，并作为我们新近建立的信任的象征，我们已派出药剂师希拉协助你们在卡利姆多对抗我们共同的敌人。\n没有人能挡在我们联合的力量与决心面前。这封信应当交给塔贝萨农场的军情七处特工安戴罗·波特。\n\"\n\"",dEN="Recovered from the body of a Forsaken apothecary, this letter hints at an underground correspondence between Undercity and the Grimtotem leadership.\n\n\"As a demonstration of good faith and a symbol of our newfound trust, we have dispatched Apothecary Cylla to aid you in battling our mutual enemy in the land of Kalimdor. None will stand before our combined might and determination.\"\n\nPerhaps Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village will know how to handle this information.",o="将密封的信函交给蕨墙村的纳泽尔·血矛。",oEN="Bring the Sealed Letter to Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village.",p="你拿的是什么，<class>？",pEN="What is that you're carrying, <class>?",c="假如这封信的内容属实，那么被遗忘者必须提出合理的解释！\n\n恐怖图腾卖弄的这些小动作一直以来都在挑衅着酋长的耐心。我们过去一直把它视为牛头人一族的问题，但是这封信将改变这一切。\n\n我们需要一些时间来调查这件事，但是别跟其他人谈起你今天的所见所闻。",cEN="If this is what it appears to be, the Forsaken have some explaining to do!\n\nThe antics of the Grimtotems have long tried the Warchief's patience. We have traditionally treated it as a matter to be settled among the tauren people, but this letter may change it.\n\nIt will take time to investigate these suspicions, but do not speak to anyone of what you have seen this day."}
Q[11187]={d="可恶！！！始祖龙正在攻击要塞！\n\n按理说你摧毁了龙蛋，杀掉了幼龙，它们应该吓得逃跑才对。\n\n你确实那样做了对吧？\n\n$n，恐怕这反而招来了它们的报复。去跟我的顾问法师中尉玛利斯特谈一谈，他会告诉你如何对付这些凶猛的野兽。",dEN="THIS IS OUTRAGEOUS! Those proto-drakes are attacking the keep!\n\nBeasts such as that should have been scared off when you took care of their clutches and whelps.\n\nYou did take care of them, right?\n\n<name>, this calls for more direct action. Speak with my advisor, Mage-Lieutenant Malister. He'll provide you with the means to get at those infernal creatures.",o="亚当斯上尉要你与法师中尉玛利斯特谈一谈，他就在西部卫戍要塞中。",oEN="Captain Adams has asked you to speak with his advisor, Mage-Lieutenant Malister, at Westguard Keep.",c="<Malister te hace acercarte y te habla en susurros>我担心过会发生这样的事。我试图劝阻上尉不要这样做，可他是个行动派矮人，对事情该如何进行有着十分明确的看法。我们来谈谈还剩哪些选择。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Malister beckons you closer and speaks in whispered tones.>\n\nI was worried that something like this might happen. I tried to dissuade the captain from this course of action, but he is a dwarf of action with a definite outlook on how things should proceed.\n\nLet us speak of the options left to us."}
Q[11188]={d="我们激怒了灰烬龙巢的始祖龙，它们很可能会持续攻击要塞……这可不行。\n\n我讨厌做挖肉补疮的蠢事，但是当前看来只能杀掉这些生物了。虽然这样做令我于心不忍，可我们别无选择。\n\n喏，这是我的魔杖。我已经设法延长了它的射程，可惜威力很一般。不过没关系，它能吸引始祖龙的注意就行啦。",dEN="Now that we've riled up these Ember Clutch proto-drakes, they may be inclined to continue their attacks upon the keep. This will not do.\n\nI hate to compound one wrong with another, but in this case it would appear that we will have to destroy the creatures. A regrettable course of action, but one that we need to undertake regardless.\n\nTake my wand. I've been experimenting with increasing its range, but it doesn't pack much of a punch. However, what it will do is get a proto-drake's attention.",o="西部卫戍要塞的法师中尉玛利斯特要你杀死3只始祖幼龙。",oEN="Mage-Lieutenant Malister at Westguard Keep has tasked you with the destruction of 3 Proto-Drakes.",p="真不幸，队长要你去激怒那些始祖龙。尽管他们欠缺一般我们熟知的龙族智慧，但他们依旧看起来像是种高贵的生物。更别提这带给我们的处境。\n\n我能斗胆询问你状况解决了吗？",pEN="It is unfortunate that the captain had to have you go rile up the proto-drakes. Though they seem to lack the intelligence of some of the dragons we know, they still seem to be noble creatures. Not to mention the situation it places us in.\n\nDare I ask if you have dealt with the situation?",c="<法师中尉叹了口气。>确实是不幸的事。算了，木已成舟。运气好的话，那些在余烬岗长成龙的新生雏龙不会记得我们在这里做过的可耻行径。运气再好一点，那片魔法森林的边界也不会继续扩张。来，<name>，请从国库里收下这点微薄的补偿，为你添的麻烦。这是我们至少能做的。\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="<The mage-lieutenant sighs.>\n\nUnfortunate business to be certain. Well, what's done is done. With any luck the new whelps that grow to be drakes at Ember Clutch will not retain a memory of our shameful actions therein.\n\nAnd with a bit more luck, the boundaries of that magical forest will not continue to spread.\n\nHere, <name>, please take this pittance from the treasury for all of your troubles. It's the least that we can do."}
Q[11189]={d="你好。\n我死了吗？我想是的，因为我正飘在自己身体上方！\n哦，多不幸的变故。\n我正要向伊蕾娜求婚，天灾就袭击了我们。\n我知道她还活着……\n我能在心里感觉到她。\n$c，你觉得能把我安全地带到她那儿去吗？\n天灾仍然能看见我的鬼魂，无疑能对我做出可怕的事。我想再看一眼她美丽的脸。\n你能替我告诉她我爱她吗？",dEN="Hello there. Am I dead? I think I am, because I'm hovering over my body!\n\nOh, what an unfortunate turn of events. I was about to propose to Irena when the Scourge descended on us.\n\nI know that she's still alive... I can feel her in my heart.\n\n<class>, do you think you might safely get me to her? The Scourge can still see my ghost, and no doubt can do horrible things to me.\n\nI'd like to look upon her beautiful face one last time. You can tell her that I love her for me.",o="护送探险者贾伦的鬼魂安全地送到探险者艾琳娜·石衣身边，她就在嚎风峡湾的钢铁之门。",oEN="Escort the Ghost of Explorer Jaren safely to Explorer Irena Stonemantle at Steel Gate in the Howling Fjord."}
Q[11190]={d="$G小子:丫头;，是哪个天才把我们的火炮做成了这么个不标准的尺寸？现在我们得造特制的炮弹才能从这些鬼东西里打出去！你要是能出去把我们已经打出去的炮弹找回来，我会对你另眼相看。照这些蠢货的打法，那些东西毫无疑问散落在南边和东边到处都是。<炮手把双手分开，让你大概知道炮弹有多大。>那肯定比我们从零开始造要快得多。\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="<Lad /Lass>, who's the genius that made our cannons a non-standard size? Now we have ta make special cannonballs ta shoot out o' the infernal contraptions!\n\nI would look kindly on ye if ye would go out and find the balls we've already shot. No doubt with the way these louts shoot they be all o'er the place ta the south and east.\n\n<The cannoneer spaces his hands apart to give you an idea of how big the cannonballs are.>\n\nThat would be faster than us making 'em from scratch fer a certainty.",o="收集10颗西部卫戍要塞炮弹，将它们交给西部卫戍要塞的炮兵伊莱。",oEN="Cannoneer Ely has tasked you with rounding up 10 Westguard Cannonballs and returning them to him at Westguard Keep.",p="我们这边的弹药快见底了，危险得很，<class>。\n我们的敌人需要挨顿狠揍，尤其是斯考恩！\n你还有更多炮弹给我们吗？",pEN="We're runnin' dangerously low on rounds 'round here, <class>. Our enemies need poundin', especially Skorn!\n\nYa got more balls fer us?",c="哦，保佑你，<name>，保佑你！\n就把它们放在你站的地方。\n我很快会叫一个小伙子来搬，这样我们就不用担心没炮弹打斯考恩了。",cEN="Oh, bless ya, <name>, bless ya!\n\nJust set 'em down right where yer standin'. I'll have one o' the boys come load 'em up soon enough and we can stop worryin' 'bout runnin' out o' balls ta shoot at Skorn."}
Q[11191]={d="东边的灯塔已经坏掉许多年了，但巴布·菲兹托克一直在想方设法让它重新开始正常工作。\n\n我不知道她自己的详细计划和想法，但这毕竟可以使船只进出港口更加便捷顺利，也能增快货物的航运，所以我无法拒绝她。说实话，比起上战场，在港口服务真可以说是一件完全没什么可以抱怨的工作了。",dEN="The old lighthouse out to the east hasn't worked for some time, but Babs Fizzletorque has gotten it into her head to get it working again.\n\nI don't know how she plans to do it by herself, but she claims that it'll make the movement of ships and goods into the docks smoother, so I can't really object. Drawing duty on the docks is really nothing to complain about when you could be on the front lines, you know?",o="与塞拉摩东边岛上灯塔里的巴布·菲兹托克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Babs Fizzletorque at the lighthouse on the island east of Theramore.",c="太好了。我正好需要你的大力帮忙。我的首要工作就是重新点亮那盏灯。",cEN="Good. I can use all the help you can offer. My first priority is to get that lamp re-lit."}
Q[11192]={d="灯塔里古老的航海日志上记载着，可以用生活在这附近海岸的蛇颈龙的油作为燃料。\n\n<巴布在提起这种过时的技术时皱了一下鼻子。>\n\n我想这会有用的，虽然只能算是个土办法。日志上还写着，最年幼的黑色蛇颈龙是最好的选择，而那些家伙就生活在塞拉摩的码头下面。\n\n如果你要去那里的话，能帮我弄点灯塔所需的燃料吗？",dEN="The old log in the lighthouse indicates that the lamp was fueled with oil from the threshers that live along the coast here.\n\n<Babs wrinkles her nose at the mention of such outdated technology.>\n\nI suppose it's a practical, if inelegant solution. The log says that the oil taken from the youngest murk threshers works the best, and those live right underneath the docks of Theramore.\n\nIf you're up for it, would you help resupply the lighthouse with fuel?",o="将4瓶蛇颈龙油交给塞拉摩附近灯塔的巴布·菲兹托克。",oEN="Bring 4 containers of Thresher Oil to Babs Fizzletorque at the lighthouse near Theramore.",p="你取得那种蛇颈龙油了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get any of that thresher oil?",c="老实说，我有点怀疑，但这是现在唯一可行的办法。一旦我们让那座灯塔重新运作，我相信就有时间可以寻找其他方法提供那盏灯燃油了。",cEN="Well, I have my doubts, but this is the only solution available right now. Once we have it up and running, I'm sure there will be time to look at other ways to fuel the lamp."}
Q[11193]={d="你知道吗，那座老灯塔里能翻出的东西真让人吃惊。我点亮灯之后，在上面一只旧箱子里发现了这本书。\n「巴布斯举起书，夸张地念出书名。\n」深渊恶徒！怎么我一想到自己可能见到其中一只就要晕过去了呢？\n我相信这书能逗人笑上几回，可我现在实在没时间读书。\n你知道谁会喜欢它吗……\n码头那个鱼贩，脏手迈克尔·克劳。\n他收集旧书。\"\n\"\n\"\"",dEN="You know, it's amazing what you can find in that old lighthouse. After I lit the lamp, I noticed this book in one of the old trunks up there.\n\n<Babs holds up the book and reads the title dramatically.>\n\n\"Dastardly Denizens of the Deep!\"\n\nWhy, I think I might swoon if I ever saw one of these! I'm sure it's good for a laugh or two, but I simply don't have time for reading right now.\n\nYou know who might enjoy it, though... that fishmonger on the docks, \"Dirty\" Michael Crowe. He collects old books.",o="把《深渊恶徒》带给塞拉摩码头的脏手迈克尔·克劳。\"\"",oEN="Bring Dastardly Denizens of the Deep to \"Dirty\" Michael Crowe on the Theramore docks.",p="今天想买什么呢？婢鲈看起来相当新鲜。",pEN="What'll it be today? The snook is quite good.",c="嗯，巴布还真好心叫你送来给我。我不知道你看过这本书了没，不过书中的故事有许多都是真的。你也知道它们并不完全是水手们虚构的。",cEN="Well, now, that was thoughtful o' Babs to send that over. I don't know if you've leafed through it or not, but there's a lot of truth to the tales in that book. Sailors didn't just make it all up, you know."}
Q[11194]={d="哦，我相信你和巴布肯定觉得这本书中的奇异描述和草图很可笑，但是你有没有想过，那可能是一些传说的真相？\n\n如果你听得足够仔细，我想你仍然可以听到水手们谈论起泰瑟尔，书上所记载的生活在这里的海洋生物！当然，如果你真的想知道更详细的情况，可以去问问老纳特·帕格。\n\n他在狂潮湾的小岛上有个钓鱼营地，就在尘泥海湾的西南。",dEN="Oh, I'm sure you and Babs had a good laugh over the outlandish descriptions and sketches in the book, but have you stopped to consider there might be some truth to the legends?\n\nIf you listen closely enough, I bet you can still hear sailors talk about Tethyr, the sea creature the book says lives right here! Of course, if you wanted to know for sure, you could always ask old Nat Pagle.\n\nHe's got a small fishing camp on a little island in Tidefury Cove, which is southwest across Dustwallow Bay.",o="转至狂潮湾的纳特的码头，与纳特·帕格谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Nat Pagle at Nat's Landing in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="原来你想听关于深海怪物的事迹吗？嗯……这样吧，我跟你打个商量，但是就你的方面来说将会牵涉到很多的酒精以及一些尴尬的场面。",cEN="So you want to know about sea monsters? Hmm... well, I'll make you a deal, but it's going to involve a lot of alcohol and some embarrassment on your part."}
Q[11195]={d="我很感动，$n，这是实话。\n我已经不记得上次有$g个:个;$r帮尊加姆脱困是什么时候了。\n这家伙忙着把我锁起来的时候，我从他那儿抢来了这个。\n看起来不值什么，但要说谁能判定它的价值，那就是我的好朋友格里夫塔。\n如果你能活着离开这里，也许值得把它带去沙塔斯城给他看看。",dEN="I'm touched, <name>, an' dat be da truth. I'm not rememberin' the last time a <race> helped Zungam outta trouble.\n\nI snatched this from one of them savages when he was busy chainin' me up. It don't look like much, but if anyone can determine its worth, it be my good friend, Griftah!\n\nIf ya be makin' it outta here alive, it might be worth takin' this to him out in Shattrath City.",o="将破烂的巫毒人偶交给沙塔斯城的格里伏塔。",oEN="Take the Tattered Voodoo Doll to Griftah in Shattrath City.",p="嘿，<name>！\n我听说你正在打进巴德的队伍。你不会为这一步后悔的，朋友，这点我可以保证。\n你那儿拿的是什么，老兄？",pEN="Hey, <name>! I hear ya been workin' yer way into Budd's crew. Ya won't live to regret that move, friend, I can promise ya that.\n\nWhatcha got there, mon?",c="嘿，你这是从哪儿弄来的？\n不，不，别告诉我——这是从妖术领主本人那儿来的！现在一切都清楚了。\n强大的魔精！\n这件遗物的持有者，无论遭受多少耻辱，永远都会受同伴尊敬。难以置信！\n「格里夫塔把娃娃举到空中时，一枚小小的生锈护符从它脖子上掉了下来。\n巨魔正要把它扔掉，随后眼里闪过一丝光，转向了你。」我现在身上没金币，老兄，但你可以拿走这个…\n…",cEN="Hey now, where ya be gettin' this?\n\nNo, no, don't tell me - this be comin' from the Hex-Lord himself! It all be clear now. Strong mojo! The bearer of this relic, no matter how many disgraces he be sufferin', be always honored by his peers. Incredible!\n\n<As Griftah holds the doll in the air, a small, rusty charm falls from around its neck. The troll begins to discard it, but then turns toward you with a gleam in his eye.>\n\nI gots no coins right now, mon, but ya be welcome to this here..."}
Q[11198]={d="不管有没有海怪，我们都不会拿我们航运的安全冒险。我已经命令最好的射手准备好迎战那个泰瑟尔。\n炮兵已经在码头的防御上增设了三门迫击炮。我要下令点亮灯塔的灯。如果泰瑟尔真的来袭，你的任务就是操作迫击炮，在那头野兽杀光所有射手之前干掉它。\n不过我可不会在同一个地方站太久。使用迫击炮很可能会引来它的注意。",dEN="Sea monster or no, we're not going to risk the safety of our shipping. I've ordered our best marksmen to prepare for a confrontation with this Tethyr. The artillerymen have augmented the dock's defenses with three mortars.\n\nI'm going to order the lighthouse's lamp illuminated. If Tethyr does attack, it will be your job to operate the mortars and take down the beast before it can kill all of the marksmen. I wouldn't stand in one place too long, though. Using the mortars is likely to draw its attention.",o="塞拉摩码头的米尔斯少校希望你打败泰瑟尔。",oEN="Major Mills at the Theramore docks wants you to defeat Tethyr.",p="回报你的情况。",pEN="Make your report.",c="干得好，$n！我得承认，当我第一次看那个怪兽的时候，我怀疑我们能不能守住码头，但你却漂亮地使守军团结在一起！",cEN="Well done, <name>! I'll admit, when I caught my first glimpse of that beast, I had doubts about our ability to defend the docks, but you held together the defenders brilliantly!"}
Q[11199]={d="$n，谢谢你帮我们解决了该死的始祖龙，我还有另一项任务要交给你。\n\n根据侦察兵汇报，南边的村落有被遗忘者出没，行动非常可疑。他们聚集在那座名叫哈尔格林德的维库人村子里，显然是在策划什么阴谋。\n\n你最好去调查清楚。与斥候诺勒斯谈一谈，看看他有什么新发现。\n\n你可以在哈尔格林德以西的灰烬长矛塔楼找到他。",dEN="<name>, now that those damnable proto-creatures have been dealt with, I've another task for you.\n\nOne of my scouts has reported back some suspicious activity by the Forsaken to the south. It looks like they're up to no good at the vrykul village known as Halgrind.\n\nI want you to personally take over the investigation down there. Speak with Scout Knowles to find out what he's uncovered and proceed from there.\n\nHis last reported position is at the Ember Spear Tower, just to the west of Halgrind.",o="亚当斯上尉要你转至灰烬长矛塔楼，向斥候诺勒斯报到。",oEN="Captain Adams has asked you to report to Scout Knowles at the Ember Spear Tower.",c="喔，很好，帮帮我，刚好赶上！",cEN="Oh good, help, and just in time!"}
Q[11200]={d="我们从旅店的废墟里收集了尽可能多的线索。我不知道调查的结果到底是什么，但我们必须知道真相。\n\n这些蹄印和有着莫萨恩记号的盾牌，让我感觉到恐怖图腾可能和这件事有关。他们最近在沼泽地里创建了一个被称作黑蹄村的定居点，就在这里的东北方向。去黑蹄村寻找更多莫萨恩的武器制品吧。",dEN="We've gleaned as much as we can from the ruins of the inn. I'm concerned about where the investigation will lead us from here, but we must know the truth.\n\nBetween the hoofprints and the shield with Mosarn's mark, I'm lead to believe that the Grimtotems may have been involved. They've recently established a settlement in the swamp, Blackhoof Village to the northeast. Travel to Blackhoof Village and search for more arms of Mosarn's manufacture.",o="蕨墙村的克罗格希望你去收集7份黑蹄军备。",oEN="Krog at Brackenwall Village wants you to bring him 7 Blackhoof Armaments.",p="你在黑蹄村的搜索行动有什么发现吗？",pEN="What did your search of Blackhoof Village reveal?",c="<克罗格检查你从黑蹄村带回来的武器和装备。>\n\n这肯定是莫萨恩的作品。询问莫萨恩可能会引起太多的关注，但我们在对付恐怖图腾上仍有其它的选择。",cEN="<Krog inspects the weapons and armor you've brought from Blackhoof Village.>\n\nThis is unmistakably the work of Mosarn. Questioning him further may draw too much attention, but we have a bit more freedom in dealing with the Grimtotems."}
Q[11201]={d="随着恐怖图腾在千针石林的行动被揭露，现在很多牛头人都对他们产生了怀疑。我们了解到恐怖图腾的高阶成员使用谋杀和绑架的手段来提升他们的影响里，也许我们会变成他们的下一个目标。\n\n东北边靠近蓝色沼泽的黑蹄村是恐怖图腾新的大型据点。他们的长者都按照从雷霆崖送来的命令行事。去看看你是否能截获他们的命令书，把它们拼凑起来，了解恐怖图腾的计划。",dEN="With the activities of the Grimtotems in Thousand Needles brought to light, many tauren now regard them with suspicion. We've seen high-ranking Grimtotems engage in murder and kidnapping to advance their interests and I fear we may become their next target.\n\nBlackhoof Village, to the northeast, near Bluefen, is a large new Grimtotem settlement. Their leaders, the elders, will all have orders from Thunder Bluff. See if you can capture the orders and piece them together to learn the Grimtotems' plans.",o="把恐怖图腾作战计划交给蕨墙村的克罗格。",oEN="Bring the Grimtotem Battle Plan to Krog at Brackenwall Village.",p="你有找到任何命令的线索吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any trace of the orders?",c="<Krog lee el plan de batalla>我毫不怀疑恐怖图腾正在对人类的行动下手。\n我不明白的是他们对我们的意图。\n恐怖图腾的举动过去曾在部落内部引起紧张，但大酋长总能化解。",cEN="<Krog reads over the battle plan.>\n\nThere's no doubt in my mind that the Grimtotems are moving against the humans. What I don't understand is what their intentions are toward us. The actions of the Grimtotems have caused tension within the Horde in the past, but the Warchief has always diffused it."}
Q[11202]={d="被遗忘者在搞鬼，而据我所知，那些瘟疫泥浆罐就是其中的重要一环。\n如果可以提议的话，$g先生:女士;，我们大概该在他们还能继续利用这些东西之前把它们毁掉。\n我已经擅自准备了一捆来自余烬岗的火把。\n这些东西已经烧了好几天了！\n来，我相信你比我更能用它们来摧毁那些罐子。",dEN="The Forsaken are up to no good and from what I can tell, those plague tanks of sludge are a big part of it.\n\nIf I may suggest, <sir /ma'am>, we should probably destroy them before they can get any more use out of the things. I took the liberty of preparing a bundle of torches from the Ember Clutch. These things have been burning for days!\n\nHere, I'm sure you can put them to better use than I in destroying those tanks.",o="灰烬长矛塔楼的斥候诺勒斯要你利用永燃火炬摧毁哈尔格林德附近的4只药剂罐。",oEN="Scout Knowles at the Ember Spear Tower has recommended that you use the Ever-burning Torches to destroy the four Plague Tanks surrounding Halgrind.",p="真的很难说明这里到底发生了什么事。你把那些瘟疫药剂罐烧毁了吗？",pEN="It's hard to tell from all the way over here exactly what's happening down there. Did you manage to put those plague tanks to the torch?",c="太好了！\n\n但你在瘟疫药剂罐里面找到的是什么？你说被遗忘者在对那里的维库人散布瘟疫？",cEN="Nice!\n\nBut what's this about the stuff you found inside those tanks? Are you saying that the Forsaken are spraying a plague upon the vrykul down there?"}
Q[11203]={d="你在黑蹄村找到的武器似乎并未在实战中使用过，只是用作练习器械而已，这意味着摧毁树荫旅店的恐怖图腾部队仍然逍遥法外。\n\n在南面，泥潭沼泽的中心，有一位名叫塔贝萨的女巫。尽管她是个人类，但是她很值得我们尊重，而且她还帮助我们训练了一些法师。\n\n去寻求她的帮助，寻找那些焚毁旅店的恐怖图腾部队。一定不能让联盟觉得我们是和恐怖图腾串通一气的。",dEN="The arms you captured in Blackhoof Village have not seen any combat beyond mere training exercises, which means the Grimtotems who destroyed the Shady Rest are still at large.\n\nTo the south, in the heart of the Quagmire, lives the witch Tabetha. Though she is a human, she has dealt honorably with us and trained some of our mages.\n\nAsk her for assistance in tracking down the band of Grimtotem responsible for burning the inn. The Alliance must not be allowed to think we were complicit in the attack.",o="转至泥潭沼泽的农场，与那里的塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha at her farm in the Quagmire.",c="<塔贝萨露出了浅浅的微笑。>\n\n克罗格要我对那些恐怖图腾占卜，是吗？嗯，这件事我不需要使用任何魔法。\n\n看起来我们拥有共同的敌人。恐怖图腾在这附近建立了一座岗哨，这对我和学生们是个很大的威胁。",cEN="<Tabetha smiles slightly.>\n\nKrog wishes me to scry for the Grimtotems, eh? Well, I have no need of magic in this case.\n\nIt seems we have a mutual enemy. The Grimtotems have built an outpost nearby and are a constant thorn in the side of me and my students."}
Q[11204]={d="我希望可以帮助你，但我确实没有更多的信息可以告诉你了。我和我的学徒们制造了这么多武器和装备，根本不可能知道每件装备到底都是谁在使用。\n\n我们不仅仅供货给保卫牛头人领地的勇士们，恐怖图腾也对我的制品有着特别的首选。一个有经验的战士一看就知道什么是好装备。",dEN="I hope I've been helpful to you and I'm sorry I can't offer more information. My apprentices and I produce such a large volume of arms and armor that it's almost impossible to recall details about any individual piece.\n\nNot only do we outfit the braves defending tauren lands, but the Grimtotems have a particular fondness for my work. A seasoned warrior knows good work when he sees it.",o="与蕨墙村的克罗格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Krog at Brackenwall Village.",c="他真的说恐怖图腾是他最大的客户吗？莫萨恩给我们的消息比他所想的还多。这么多的证据都指向恐怖图腾，我想我们找到了第一个嫌疑犯了。",cEN="He actually said that the Grimtotems are his biggest customers? Mosarn gave us more help than he knows. With this much pointing toward the Grimtotems, I think we just found our first suspects."}
Q[11205]={d="不用占卜也能看出我这些新邻居正在惹什么麻烦。而如果真如你所说，就是他们烧了阴暗休息旅店，那就再没有理由容忍他们待下去了。\n拿上这支火把，把他们的营地夷为平地！你会在我的农场正北方、靠近大路的地方找到恐角。绝对错不了，恐怖图腾用他们偏爱的那种图腾把自己宣扬得可够显眼的。\n\"\"",dEN="There's no scrying necessary to see the trouble my new \"neighbors\" are creating. And if this is the band that burnt down the Shady Rest Inn, as you claim, there's no reason to tolerate their presence any longer.\n\nTake this torch and raze their camp to the ground! You'll find Direhorn just to the north of my farm. You can't miss it, really, as the Grimtotems have done a splendid job of announcing their presence with those totems they favor.",o="烧毁恐角岗哨的北部帐篷、东部帐篷和东北部帐篷，然后回到塔贝萨的农场，向塔贝萨复命。",oEN="Burn the North Tent, East Tent, and the Northeast Tent at Direhorn Post, then return to Tabetha at her farm.",p="你有好好利用那把火炬吗？",pEN="Have you put that torch to good use?",c="恐怖图腾应该可以轻易地了解我们最近的行动想表达的敌意。\n\n至于你，你在蕨墙村的联络人一定很想知道你干的好事。我知道烧毁树荫旅店这件事可能会成为部落和联盟之间情势紧绷的导火线。假如我遇到塞拉摩派来的调查员，我会很高兴的转达恐怖图腾独力犯下这起事件。",cEN="The Grimtotems should have no trouble understanding our latest message.\n\nAs for you, your contact at Brackenwall Village will want to know of your success. I know the destruction of the Shady Rest Inn could be a source of tensions between the Horde and Alliance. If I encounter any investigators from Theramore, I will gladly tell them the Grimtotems acted on their own."}
Q[11206]={d="我怀疑恐怖图腾不会放弃把人类赶出沼泽的行动，虽然我觉得你并不太在乎。\n至少我们已经处置了在阴暗休息旅店犯下罪行的那些人。\n去告诉派你来的那个人，他的复仇渴望已经得到满足。",dEN="I doubt the Grimtotems will give up their campaign to drive humans from the marsh. At least we have dealt with the perpetrators of the crimes at the Shady Rest Inn.\n\nI'm sure the investigator who sent you doesn't need to be told this, but the Horde can no longer afford not to rein in the Grimtotems. There will be a day when their actions will put the Horde in a regrettable position.\n\nNeither Lady Jaina nor Warchief Thrall desire another war, but are they willing to do what's necessary to avoid it?",o="回到蕨墙村的克罗格那里复命。",oEN="Return to Krog at Brackenwall Village.",c="<克罗格听你汇报。>我印象深刻，<name>。\n我本以为恐怖图腾那些罪犯会更难找到。\n塔贝萨的警告没有被当成耳旁风，但惩戒恐怖图腾不是我的职责。当然，我会在给大酋长的报告中提到这件事。\n在大酋长处理恐怖图腾之前，不要对任何人提起。\n你很好地解开了阴暗休息旅店之谜，也让我们免受塞拉摩的怀疑。",cEN="<Krog listens to your report.>\n\nI'm impressed, <name>. I would've thought that the Grimtotem criminals would've been more difficult to locate.\n\nTabetha's warnings have not fallen on deaf ears, but it is not my place to chastise the Grimtotems. I will, of course, mention it in my report to the Warchief. Do not speak of it to anyone until Thrall has dealt with the Grimtotems. You have done well in solving the mystery of the Shady Rest and sparing us from the suspicion of Theramore."}
Q[11207]={d="这艘飞艇运送了足足6个月的补给品给我们的泥链镇！当然，他们可以想办法坚持一段时间，但他们没法坚持太久。\n\n我被派到这里来寻找任何我能找到的货物，但飞船的残骸支离破碎地散落在这块区域。我确信有很多货物没能在坠毁中幸存下来，但你能帮我找到尽可能多的货物吗？",dEN="This zeppelin was carrying six months' worth of supplies to us at Mudsprocket! Sure, they've been able to barter for some of what they need, but they won't hold out forever.\n\nI've been sent out here to recover what I can of the cargo, but the wreckage is scattered all over the marsh in this area. I'm sure a lot of the cargo didn't survive the crash, but are you willing to help me recover what we can?",o="比吉尔的飞艇残骸处的莫希·斯蒂格里要你找回8件飞艇上的货物。",oEN="Moxie Steelgrille at Beezil's Wreck wants you to recover 8 pieces of Zeppelin Cargo.",p="<莫希看起来相当地担忧。>\n\n货物都还在吗？你有找到幸免的货物吗？",pEN="<Moxie looks frantic with worry.>\n\nDid the cargo survive? Did you find any of it?",c="哇！你收回的货物比我预期可找到的还多。我不确定德拉兹特以为我们能找到多少货物，但是现在他应该对我们寻回的数量感到高兴才对。",cEN="Wow! You certainly found a lot more than I expected would be out there. I'm not sure how much Drazzit thought we were going to find out here, but he's going to have to be happy with this for now."}
Q[11208]={d="德拉兹特会很高兴看到这些货物的，不过我不觉得这地方已经被清理干净了，所以我还不能离开这里。如果你有时间的话，你愿意帮我把货物送到泥链镇去给他吗？\n\n如果你还没去过那里，那我告诉你，那里是石槌废墟另一边的一个小小的定居点。你也可以沿着塔贝萨的农场那边的路过去。在你到达泥链镇以后，你要做的事情就是找到德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔。",dEN="Drazzit will expect to hear something from me soon, but I don't think the site is secure enough for me to leave. If you have time, would you be willing to take some of the salvaged cargo down to him at Mudsprocket?\n\nIf you haven't been there yet, it's a small settlement to the southwest of here, beyond the Stonemaul Ruins. You can take the road there from Tabetha's Farm, too. When you get to Mudsprocket, the guy you're looking for is Drazzit Dripvalve.",o="把飞艇上的货物交给泥链镇的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔。",oEN="Take the Zeppelin Cargo to Drazzit Dripvalve at Mudsprocket.",p="嗯？",pEN="Yes?",c="<德拉兹特接过货物。>我饿得能吃下一头龙！\n幸好莫克西终于把这批货物弄下来了一些。\n我们已经被迫跟那个食人魔掷骰子，赌他打猎弄到的任何东西！",cEN="<Drazzit accepts the cargo from you.>\n\nI'm so hungry, I could eat a dragon! Thank goodness Moxie finally got some of that cargo down here. We've been reduced to playing dice against the ogre for whatever he's managed to kill on his hunting trips!"}
Q[11209]={d="这么说你$g找到:找到;了《深渊恶徒》的一个副本？好吧，我以经验告诉你，书里写的全是真的。\n我亲眼见过几只。但你想知道关于泰瑟尔的事。\n我说过会跟你做笔交易，所以我要你做的是：我正在研制一种新鱼饵，但这一种还没试验过。拿上这团糊……\n对，味儿是有点冲……\n涂在身上，然后游到西南边那艘沉船去。要是你活下来了，告诉我效果怎么样！",dEN="So you found a copy of Dastardly Denizens of the Deep, did you? Well, I can tell you from experience, it's all true. I've even seen a few of 'em with my own eyes.\n\nBut you want to know about Tethyr. I said I'd make you a deal, so here's what I want you to do. I'm working on a new line of baits, but I haven't tested this one yet.\n\nJust take this paste -- yeah, it smells a little foul -- smear it on yourself, and swim over to that wrecked ship to the southwest. If you survive, let me know how it works!",o="纳特的码头上的纳特·帕格想让你去测试一下他的新鱼饵。",oEN="Nat Pagle at Nat's Landing wants you to test his new fish bait.",p="记住，交易条件是……没被咬之前别回来。\"\"",pEN="Remember, the deal is \"don't come back until something bites you.\"",c="不错嘛，但你要知道，如果我是你的话，我会尽快去洗个澡。\n\n现在，关于你的海怪……\n\n为了你好，现在先多喝两杯吧。",cEN="Not bad at all, but you know, I think I'd get a bath in as soon as possible, if I was you.\n\nNow, about your sea monster...\n\nHelp yourself to a brew or two in the meantime."}
Q[11210]={d="是的，泰瑟尔真的存在，而且它就在塞拉摩附近的水域里。\n\n它对亮光有着特别的爱好，这就是他们关闭灯塔的原因。\n\n如果你再次点亮灯塔的话，它马上就会游回来。不过一个神智正常的人是不会这么做的。\n\n啊哈！那肯定就是你的计划了！很高兴能和你喝两杯，不过如果泰瑟尔真的把你变成了鱼饵，不要抱怨老纳特没有提醒过你。如果你确定要这么做的话，先去和塞拉摩港口的米尔斯少校商量一下吧。",dEN="Yes, Tethyr is certainly real, and he lives in the waters off Theramore.\n\nHas a thing for bright lights. He's the reason they shut down the lighthouse in the first place, you know...\n\nAnd if you light it up again, he'll come right back. But no one in their right mind would do that.\n\nSo that must be your plan! It's been good sharing a drink with you, but don't blame ol' Nat if Tethyr REALLY turns you into fish bait. If you're going to do this, make sure you consult Major Mills at the Theramore docks.",o="与塞拉摩港口的米尔斯少校谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Major Mills at the docks in Theramore.",c="<你重复你和纳特·帕格的会面经过，并且小心地跳过“鱼饵测试”那一段。>\n\n嗯，听起来我们已经知道该做些什么了。我会负责那些准备事项。",cEN="<You recount your experiences with Nat Pagle, carefully omitting the portion about the 'bait test.'>\n\nWell, it sounds like we've got our work cut out for us. I'll make the preparations."}
Q[11211]={d="在那个地精……她叫什么名字来着……对了，莫希·斯蒂格里！总之，在她经过这里转至飞艇废墟的时候，她说泥链镇遇到了一些麻烦。\n\n那艘坠毁的飞艇本来是要把新鲜的补给带给他们的。如果你沿着这条路往南走，越过石槌废墟，泥链镇就在你眼前了。\n\n你为什么不去找那里的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔，看看他是否有什么事情需要你的帮助？",dEN="When that goblin... what's her name... Boxie, Foxy... Moxie, that's it! Anyway, when she came through here on her way to the zeppelin wreck, she said the town of Mudsprocket was having some problems.\n\nThat crashed zeppelin was bringing them fresh supplies. If you follow the road south from here, past the Stonemaul Ruins, you'll eventually come to Mudsprocket.\n\nWhy don't you check in with Drazzit Dripvalve down there and see if there's anything you can do to help?",o="与泥链镇的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Drazzit Dripvalve at Mudsprocket.",c="多亏了塔贝萨派你来找我。我想向她商借一些粮食直到飞艇残骸的问题解决为止，但是我知道当前她也没有多余的粮食可以援助我。假如你想参与刺激的冒险，可以参考我布告某只凶猛的迅猛龙悬赏令。",cEN="It's good of Tabetha to send you down here. I'd prevail upon her for some food until the wreckage from the zeppelin is taken care of, but I know she's got none to spare at the moment. If you're feeling adventurous, I've posted a bounty for the death of a particularly nasty raptor."}
Q[11212]={d="有一位老巫女塔贝萨居住在沼泽的深处。我们对她的了解也不多，只是她会偶尔出现在这里，然后留下很长一串货物订单而已。她还经常帮助我们，并且在我们的军队与部落剑拔弩张时，她数次平息了可能发生的战事。\n\n她过去一直和我们定期联络，最近却一直没有她的消息了。\n\n如果你有空，是否能去看看她？你只需要一直沿着北点哨塔一侧的道路前进就可以了，路会折向南方，然后进入泥潭沼泽。她的小农庄就在路旁。",dEN="Deep in the heart of the swamp lives an old woman named Tabetha. We've never really known much about her, save that she's a good deal older than she appears. She's helped us from time to time and helped keep the peace here between the Horde and our forces.\n\nShe used to keep in regular contact, but we haven't received one lately.\n\nCould you check in with her when you have time? Just follow the road beyond North Point Tower, where it turns south and into the Quagmire. You can see her farm from the road.",o="与泥潭沼泽中的一处小农庄里的塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tabetha at her farm in the Quagmire.",c="多亏了塞拉摩派人来找我。你那个守卫朋友说的没错。我们附近来了一些新邻居，而他们可不懂得敦亲睦邻。",cEN="It's good of Theramore to send someone. Your guard friend's suspicions were correct. We've got some new neighbors, and they aren't the kind you'd bring a casserole."}
Q[11213]={d="一个名叫塔贝萨的人类女性居住在靠近沼泽中央的小农场里。一般情况下，我是不会和一个人类交往的，不过她的帮助确实对我们很有裨益。\n\n不幸的是，我们很久都没有联系她了，而我正想找个人去她的农场看看是否一切都安然无恙。\n\n沿着南面的那条路离开村庄，在进入沼泽深处后，靠近泥潭沼泽中央的地方就是她的农场。",dEN="A human woman named Tabetha lives on a small farm near the middle of the marsh. Ordinarily, I wouldn't associate with a human, but her help has proven useful at times.\n\nUnfortunately, she's been out of touch for quite some time now and I'm looking for someone to travel down to her farm to see if everything's all right.\n\nIf you follow the road south out of the village, then into the swamp's interior, you'll find her farm near the middle of the Quagmire.",o="与泥潭沼泽农场里的塔贝萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Tabetha at her farm in the Quagmire.",c="幸好纳泽尔想到派人来看看。我们附近搬来了一个新的邻居，而自从他们创建营地之后就不断的制造麻烦。",cEN="It's fortunate Nazeer thought to send someone. We've got some new neighbors and they've been nothing but pests since they set up camp."}
Q[11214]={d="热砂集团最近在尘泥沼泽的南部创建了一座新的据点，叫作泥链镇。如果我记没错，那么它应该就在石槌废墟和塔贝萨农庄的正南方。\n\n这对我们来说，是一个创建新贸易线路的机会，吉安娜女士也让我派一名代表过去，与他们创建联系。你愿意过去吗？",dEN="The Steamwheedle Cartel has recently established a new outpost in the southern part of Dustwallow Marsh. It's called Mudsprocket, if I recall, and it's located on the main road south out of Tabetha's Farm and the Stonemaul Ruins.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for us to establish new trade contacts and Lady Jaina wants me to send a representative down there to establish contact. Would you be willing to go?",o="与泥链镇的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Drazzit Dripvalve at Mudsprocket.",c="这么说来塞拉摩想跟我们做生意啰？嗯，我可不想拒绝这个提议。这里的物资目前相当的吃紧，所以我们需要所有的交易门户畅通！",cEN="So Theramore is interested in doing business? Well, that's not an offer I'd turn down. Supplies are pretty scarce here right now, so we need all the business contacts we can get!"}
Q[11215]={d="热砂集团在沼泽南部新建的哨站处境不是太好。给泥链镇运送补给的飞艇坠毁了，使他们陷入了没有重要工具、食物和药品支持的窘迫处境。\n\n沿着路向南走，走进沼泽的深处。经过塔贝萨的农场和石槌废墟之后就可以到达泥链镇，向那里的领导者提供任何你可以提供的帮助吧。",dEN="The Steamwheedle Cartel's new outpost in the southern part of the marsh isn't faring so well. The zeppelin carrying supplies to Mudsprocket crashed, leaving them without vital tools, food, and medical supplies.\n\nFollow the road down south and into the marsh's interior. You'll pass by Tabetha's Farm and the Stonemaul Ruins before the road brings you to Mudsprocket. Offer any help you can provide to the town's leadership.",o="与泥链镇的德拉兹特·迪普瓦尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Drazzit Dripvalve at Mudsprocket.",c="多亏了塔贝萨派你来找我。我想向她商借一些粮食直到飞艇残骸的问题解决为止，但是我知道当前她也没有多余的粮食可以援助我。假如你想参与刺激的冒险，可以参考我布告某只凶猛的迅猛龙悬赏令。",cEN="I won't turn down any help! We're in the process of setting up here and trying to make the most of what we've got, until those supplies from the zeppelin arrive."}
Q[11216]={d="我的导师让我到这里来寻求帮助，不过糟糕的是，我只被允许在贫民窟这里活动，而且这里的人看起来不像能帮得上忙的样子。\n\n不过你不同，你更像是一位冒险者。如果你有兴趣帮助我们的话，请到麦迪文过去的住所——卡拉赞之塔外面，与我的导师奥图鲁斯谈谈吧。\n\n与此同时，我得想办法获得进入城市其它部分的许可。据说我们以前的某个同事也在这里。",dEN="I was sent here by my mentor to look for assistance, but unfortunately I'm not allowed outside of Lower City and the individuals that frequent this establishment tend to be less than helpful.\n\nYou do seem different, more like the adventurous type. If you're interested in aiding our cause, speak to Archmage Alturus outside of Medivh's old dwelling, Karazhan.\n\nIn the meantime, I'm going to see about gaining access to the rest of the city. One of our old associates is rumored to be here.",o="与逆风小径卡拉赞外的大法师奥图鲁斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Archmage Alturus outside of Karazhan in Deadwind Pass.",c="感谢你这段时间以来的协助。前方还有更重要的工作在等着我们。",cEN="I thank you for taking the time to come to our aid. We've important work ahead of us."}
Q[11217]={d="飞艇的坠毁延缓了补给品的到达，我们的药品和绷带都用完了。\n\n我们正在利用一切可以获得的资源，不过这些虫子、伤者和一切与我们为敌的家伙都让我们焦头烂额，我快要坚持不下去了！我找到了一种草药，可以治疗伤口和缓解疼痛，但它也快要用完了。\n\n这种草药被称为龙尾草，它遍布在村子东面的黑龙谷和巨龙沼泽地区。那种植物的茎杆是卷曲的，而且似乎会微微地跳动。",dEN="With the zeppelin crash delaying supplies, we've run out of medicines and bandages.\n\nWe're making use of what we can, but between all the insects, the injuries, and the enemies we're encountering here, I can barely keep up! I've found one herb that seems to help heal wounds and dull pain, but it, too, is in short supply.\n\nIt's called wyrmtail, and it's abundant in the Dragonmurk and Wyrmbog areas east of town. The plants themselves are made of coiled stalks, and seem to pulsate when you look at them.",o="泥链镇的吉兹克斯·格里古格希望你帮他收集8根龙尾草。",oEN="Gizzix Grimegurgle at Mudsprocket wants you to bring him 8 Wyrmtail stalks.",p="你有找到龙尾草吗？",pEN="Did you find any of the wyrmtail?",c="感谢你！这将使我们能在莫希从飞艇失事地回来之前继续从事一些野外的活动。",cEN="Thank you! This will help keep our guys going out in the field until Moxie returns with the rest of the supplies from the zeppelin crash."}
Q[11218]={d="$n，亚当斯上尉交给我一项棘手的任务，而我需要你的帮助。\n\n我在探险者协会的一群同事进入北边的低语峡谷从事挖掘工事，但他们突然全都疯掉了。你能想象吗？他们会攻击所有企图接近峡谷的人。\n\n亚当斯上尉的脑子里却只有矿石供给这一件事情。好在我有办法解决眼前的难题。\n\n我要你进入低语峡谷，炸开矿脉，然后把矿石碎片和宝石给我带回来。维持要塞的运作可不便宜！\n\n不过我要警告你，那里的矿石很奇怪！",dEN="<name>, the captain's tasked me with a mission. I'd like you to help.\n\nA bunch of my fellow Explorers' League people went nuts digging up stuff in the Whisper Gulch just to the north. They're attacking anyone trying to get in!\n\nThe captain is only concerned with the ore for the keep. Lucky for us, I have just the thing to do the trick.\n\nGet in there, blow up the ore, and bring it back along with any gems you find. Running this place isn't cheap you know!\n\nI gotta warn you though, that ore is strange!",o="利用斯迪尔林的安全雷管收集6份低语峡谷矿石碎块和18颗低语峡谷宝石，将它们交给西部卫戍要塞的斯迪尔林。",oEN="Use Steelring's Foolproof Dynamite to collect 6 Whisper Gulch Ore Fragments and 18 Whisper Gulch Gems. Then return them to Sapper Steelring at Westguard Keep.",p="在这里的建筑工事似乎没完没了，我真希望你能拿到让我们能继续工作的东西。",pEN="Construction on this place seems to be a never-ending task. I just hope that you're able to get us what we need to continue.",c="矿石带给你奇怪的感觉？也许我们根本就不会用到那些东西。\n\n<斯迪尔林看了看，往后退一步，然后改变了话题。>\n\n这些宝石看起来真不错！不知道我可以从中得到些什么？当然啦，总是有旧东西要修、新东西要做。\n\n你知道吗，我真的觉得跟你一块儿工作有很多油水可以捞。收下这些……至少，这是我能做到的！",cEN="The ore gave you a strange feeling? Maybe we won't use that stuff after all.\n\n<Steelring looks at the stuff and takes a step back, changing the subject.>\n\nThose gems look really nice! I wonder what I can get for them? Of course, there are always repairs, and new stuff to be made.\n\nYou know, I've really found working with you to be profitable. Take this... it's the least that I can do!"}
Q[11219]={d="部落的孩子们需要你，$n。无头骑士——曾经的人类圣骑士，如今疯狂的恶魔——放火烧了我们的城镇！\n你必须扑灭那些火！\n抓起水桶泼向火焰，或者把它扔给离火更近的同伴。扑灭所有火焰，挫败无头骑士的阴谋！",dEN="The Horde's children need you, <name>. The Headless Horseman, once a human paladin and now an insane fiend, has set fire to our village! You must put out those fires!\n\nGrab a bucket and throw it onto the blaze, or toss it to an ally who is closer to the flames. Extinguish all the fires and thwart the Headless Horseman!",o="戴面具的孤儿院长希望你能帮忙扑灭村子里的所有火焰。在扑灭了所有火焰之后，回去向戴面具的孤儿院长汇报。",oEN="The Masked Orphan Matron wants you to help put out all the village fires. When they are out, speak again to the Masked Orphan Matron in town.",p="部落的孩子需要你！别抛下他们！",pEN="The Horde's children need you! Do not abandon them!",c="火势被扑灭了！你和你的救火队胜利了！呀哈！\n\n无头骑士的攻击失败了，但除非他和他的头一起被消灭，他还会再回来的。\n\n在此之前，让我们好好享受你为这些孩子们带来的安全吧。我很荣幸能目睹你今天勇敢的行为。",cEN="The fires are out! You and your fire brigade were victorious! Hah!\n\nThe Headless Horseman's attack has failed, but until he and his head are destroyed together, He will return.\n\nUntil then, however, let's take comfort in the safety you brought our children. I am honored to have watched your brave work today."}
Q[11220]={d="除非消灭了无头骑士的脑袋，否则他的残暴永远都不会结束。\n\n无头骑士栖息在提瑞斯法林地的血色修道院深处。去那里念出这些句子：\n\n　　骑士啊，醒来吧\n　　末日正向你迈开脚步\n　　死亡没有令你安息\n　　湮灭才是你的归宿！\n\n恶魔将会被唤醒，消灭无头骑士的脑袋，这样他就不会再困扰我们了。",dEN="Until the head of the Headless Horseman is destroyed, his rampage will not end.\n\nThe Horseman rests within the Forlorn Cloister of the Scarlet Monastery, in Tirisfal Glades. Go to his pumpkin shrine and speak these words:\n\nHorseman, rise\nYour time is nigh\nYou felt death once\nNow, know demise!\n\nThis will rouse the fiend. Destroy the head of the Horseman and he will plague us no longer.",o="找到无头骑士的南瓜神龛。",oEN="Find the Headless Horseman's Pumpkin Shrine.",c="祭坛的原貌已经无法辨认，但它现在的主人却毋庸置疑……",cEN="The origin of this shrine is unknown, but there is no doubt to whom it pays homage..."}
Q[11221]={d="我们来到诺森德的目标是干掉阿尔萨斯。联盟是我们唯一的绊脚石，看到他们时绝对不能手软。\n\n我们已经摧毁了他们最东边的舰队，但那些残馀份子却在南边的荒弃海岸设置了路障，躲藏了起来。\n\n我们的部队早该摧毁他们的临时工事，但显然我们低估了他们的求生欲望。到战场上去找到我的部下，黑暗游侠莉安娜和死亡猎手拉扎尔，让他们报告当前的形势。",dEN="Our mission in Northrend is to destroy Arthas. The Alliance are but an obstacle that we'll crush wherever we find them.\n\nWe've managed to destroy their easternmost fleet; but the survivors have barricaded themselves on the Derelict Strand, south of here.\n\nOur forces should've overwhelmed their make-shift defenses long ago, but we underestimated their will to live. Seek my officers in the field, Dark Ranger Lyana and Deathstalker Razael and get them to report on the situation.",o="转至复仇港南方的鲜血谷，与战场上的黑暗游侠莉安娜和死亡猎手拉扎尔谈一谈。完成任务后向高级执行官安希尔姆复命。",oEN="Speak to Dark Ranger Lyana and Deathstalker Razael in the battlefield at the Bleeding Vale south of Vengeance Landing. Return to High Executor Anselm when you've completed this task.",p="你带着报告回来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Are you back with your report, <name>?",c="火炮阻碍了我们的攻势？我会让他们见识看看什么才叫火炮。",cEN="Cannons are holding us back? I'll show them cannons."}
Q[11224]={d="谣传北面的低语峡谷发生了可怕的事。数日前，探险者协会的一批勘查员进入了峡谷，据说他们发现了某种能令人发疯的东西。\n\n最要命的是，他们带走了绝大多数的骡子和装备。我可不想失去那些骡子！\n\n如果你碰巧要去那里，又碰巧遇见我的骡子的话，就悄悄地靠近，然后挥舞手臂吓唬它们。这样。它们肯定会害怕得跑回来。",dEN="I've heard rumors of bad happenings in the Whisper Gulch to the north. Most of the Explorers' League went down into that place, and some say they went mad with what they discovered.\n\nThat doesn't change the fact that they took most of our mules and equipment with them, though. I won't lose those mules!\n\nIf you find yourself in there, and happen across any of my mules, just get up close on them and threaten them with a raised hand. They'll spook and come home for sure.",o="探险者阿比盖尔要你对10头被遗弃的驮运用/举起表情，然后回西卫堡找她。",oEN="Explorer Abigail has asked you to /raise 10 Abandoned Pack Mules and then return to her at Westguard Keep.\n\nHandle emote \"/raise\" on the Abandoned Pack Mules and they will do their job for you!",p="这对我们来说真是一大打击。我甚至不想知道他们在那里到底发现了什么。\n\n光是用想象的，就足够让我一整晚睡不着觉了。",pEN="This is quite a blow to our efforts. I don't even want to know what they discovered down there.\n\nIt's enough to keep me awake at night just trying to imagine what it could be.",c="我欠你一份人情，<class>。\n至少找回大部分驮运和装备后，我们可以指望很快恢复实力。\n请收下这个。",cEN="I'm indebted to you, <class>. At least with most of the mules and equipment recovered, we can hope to rebuild our numbers soon.\n\nPlease, take this."}
Q[11225]={d="这片沼泽似乎对人类有奇怪的影响。\n有些人仅仅因为住在这里就发疯了。凡是定居在沼泽之光庄园的人，都以惊人的方式发了疯。\n最新那位主人，一个叫沼泽之眼贾尔的家伙，已经开始显露迹象了。\n我并不完全明白那里在发生什么，你若能去查一查，我会很感激。那座庄园在沼泽的东边边缘。\n往东走，穿过蓝沼，经过北角塔。\n庄园在一片闹鬼的地方，名叫女巫丘陵。\"\n\"",dEN="The marsh seems to have a strange effect on humans. Some grow mad simply by living here.\n\nAnyone who has ever settled at Swamplight Manor has gone mad in a spectacular way. The latest owner, one \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl, is already showing signs.\n\nI don't completely understand what's happening there, you'd have my thanks for looking into it.\n\nThe manor is at the eastern edge of the swamp. Trek east across Bluefen and past North Point Tower. The manor is in a haunted patch of land called Witch Hill.",o="到沼泽之光庄园与沼泽之眼贾尔谈谈。\"\"",oEN="Speak with \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at Swamplight Manor.",c="你是来这里监视我的吗？不是？\n\n或许你有对美食的鉴赏力，嗯？好，你能帮得上忙！",cEN="Have you come here to spy on me? No?\n\nPerhaps you have an appreciation for fine cuisine, then? Good, you can help!"}
Q[11227]={d="高级执行官要我派猎犬把那些敌人的斥候探子还有间谍都给挖出来，但这帮死狗……你看，是瘟疫犬……的确是死狗……不把它们喂饱就不肯干活。\n\n我们的军人一点都没有意识到这群死狗有多么挑食，军队配给的那些垃圾狗食它们闻都不要闻，还怎么能指望靠狗抓斥候呢？\n\n如果……我是说如果，你有时间的话，不如帮我们喂饱它们。你看，西边有许多乌鸦，那些乌鸦的肉是这些死狗最爱吃的，虽然我们不觉得美味。怎么样，帮我带着一条狗去打一些乌鸦牙祭吧？",dEN="The high executor wants me to use my dogs to sniff out enemy scouts, but I can tell you right now these plaguehounds aren't going anywhere until they're properly fed.\n\nIf our military doesn't understand that these beasts are picky enough to not eat the rubbish they've given me, then they can't expect them to be of any use in the field.\n\nYou seem to have some time on your hands, why don't you take one of these dogs out hunting for crows out west? Their meat isn't very tasty to us, but my boys love it!",o="复仇港的猎犬管理员伯提乌斯要求你使用瘟疫犬笼召唤一只饥饿的瘟疫犬，并用复仇港西边那些峡湾乌鸦的肉将它喂饱。",oEN="Pontius, the kennel keeper at Vengeance Landing, wants you to use the Plaguehound Cage to summon a Hungry Plaguehound and feed it Crow Meat from Fjord Crows west of Vengeance Landing.",p="你喂饱了那个小恶棍吗？",pEN="Did you feed this little rascal here yet?",c="你猎到几只乌鸦了吗，<boy/girl>？好<boy/girl>，好<boy/girl>！\n啊，这些猎犬让我想起我在提瑞斯法培育纯种犬的日子…\n…那真是好时光！",cEN="Did you hunt down some crows, <boy/girl>? Good <boy/girl>, good <boy/girl>!\n\nAh, these hounds remind me of my days raising purebreds in Tirisfal... those were good times!"}
Q[11228]={d="瞧瞧弗塔根公爵派来驻守瓦加德港口的军队，如果他认为这帮毫无经验的小杂兵能成功地牵制敌人的攻势，那就大错特错了。\n\n<玛卡洛伊扬起眉毛，打量着你的装备。>\n\n啧啧，你似乎混得不错嘛。\n\n瓦加德港口在战略上的重要性是不言而喻的，但是盘踞在空中的这些怪兽对当前的战况来说无疑是雪上加霜啊。\n\n向西北边的凯勒中将报到吧，告诉他你是个有能耐的强者。",dEN="Fordragon's got another thing coming if he thinks the group of green-gilled scrubs he sent to defend this port can hold out much longer.\n\n<Macalroy raises an eyebrow as he examines your equipment.>\n\nYou, however, might fare a bit better.\n\nThe importance of holding this port cannot be stated enough; and with those monsters flying overhead, the situation around here has gone from bad to worse.\n\nReport to Vice Admiral Keller just northwest of here and let him know that you're all out of bubble gum.",o="与瓦加德港口的凯勒中将谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Vice Admiral Keller at Valgarde Port.",c="那个矮人说的是真的。我们不能失去这个港口。这是联盟在这片冰寒地狱中唯二安全的港口之一——另一个在西边几百里外的北风苔原海岸。",cEN="The dwarf speaks the truth. We can't afford to lose this port. It's one of two safe harbors that the Alliance has on this chunk of frozen hell - the other being a few hundred miles west of here on the coast of the Borean Tundra."}
Q[11229]={d="我们已经派了风行者号、女王的复仇号和湮灭号驻守在荒弃海岸的东面。去向舰队指挥官哈克尔船长传达我的命令，让他们摧毁联盟的火炮。\n\n与我们的蝙蝠训练员卡米蕾谈一谈，向她索要转至舰队驻地的通行证。快去吧，$n，我们在联盟身上多浪费一分钟，与阿尔萨斯战斗的时间就会减少一分钟。",dEN="We have the Windrunner, the Queen's Reprisal and the Oblivion stationed just east of the Derelict Strand. Send orders to the fleet's commander, Captain Harker, that they're to destroy the Alliance's cannons.\n\nSpeak to our bat handler, Camille, and ask for passage to the fleet's location. Be quick, <name>, every minute we spend fighting the Alliance is a minute we could've spent fighting Arthas.",o="与复仇港的蝙蝠管理员卡米蕾交谈，然后转至风行者号，向甲板上的哈克尔船长报到。",oEN="Speak to Bat Handler Camille at Vengeance Landing and obtain passage to the Windrunner. Report to Captain Harker aboard the ship.",c="希望你准备好战斗了，<name>。女王的舰队需要你！",cEN="I hope you're ready to fight, <name>. The Queen's fleet needs you!"}
Q[11230]={d="这次行动本来是十拿九稳的。他们的部队饥寒交迫，伤病又多，装备也很烂。可我们还是中了他们的圈套。\n\n我们本来从南面靠近这些礁石，想要隐蔽起来。可那些联盟狗突然冒出来，占领了我们的船。\n\n我现在不得不告诉你，无论你想让我们炮击什么地方，都必须先帮忙夺回我们的船。",dEN="This should have been a walk in the park. Their forces are hungry, injured and ill equipped. Yet somehow, we walked right into their trap.\n\nWe approached these reefs from the south to gain cover and were immediately boarded by the Alliance dogs.\n\nI'm sorry to say, if you want our cannons to fire at anything, you're going to have to help us take our ships back.",o="风行者号上的哈克尔船长要求你杀死15名北方舰队陆战队员。",oEN="Captain Harker aboard the Windrunner wants you to kill 15 North Fleet Marines.",c="干得漂亮，可是把那些杂种削弱了不少。我的手下应该可以解决剩下的家伙了。",cEN="Nice work paring those mongrels down to size. My men will be able to clean up the rest."}
Q[11231]={d="上尉也许不在乎，但据我们掌握的一点点情报，维库人正在北方的加勒布朗进行某种残忍的觉醒仪式。\n他们用活人献祭来助长他们那邪恶的仪式！\n$C，你必须阻止他们！\n不管那些笼子里关的是谁、是什么，都必须把它们放出来。我敢打赌钥匙就在维库人手里。\n圣光知道，我们最不需要的就是更多那种古怪的维库人四处游荡，或者更糟——他们唤醒什么更邪恶的东西。\n\"\n\"",dEN="The captain may not care, but from the little we know, the vrykul are conducting heinous rites in some sort of 'awakening' ritual up north in Gjalerbron.\n\nThey're using living sacrifices to fuel their unholy rituals!\n\n<class>, you must put a stop to this! It matters not who or what is in those cages, they must be freed. I'd bet that the vrykul hold the keys.\n\nThe Light knows the last thing we need is more of those strange vrykul walking about, or worse yet, them wakening something even more evil!",o="莱瓦里安神父要你去搜集足够的亚勒伯龙牢笼钥匙，用它们解救10个亚勒伯龙囚犯。完成任务后，返回西部卫戍要塞向他复命。",oEN="Father Levariol has asked you to collect enough Gjalerbron Cage Keys to free 10 Gjalerbron Prisoners. Return to him at Westguard Keep when you manage to do so.",p="只要亚勒伯龙的囚犯被释放，维库人就无法继续他们不洁的仪式。\n\n你是阻止他们的唯一希望。",pEN="With the prisoners at Gjalerbron freed, the vrykul will be unable to continue their unholy rites.\n\nYou're our only hope of stopping them.",c="圣光祝福你，孩子！有了你的帮助，圣光甚至能照亮最黑暗的角落。\n\n拜托，收下这个以补偿你的善行义举。我可以看见你所释放的那些人获救。起码，那些真的与圣光和联盟同在的人，都回到这座要塞了。",cEN="Bless you child! With your help, the Light shines even in the darkest of places.\n\nPlease, take this as just compensation for your good deeds. I shall see to the salvation of those you freed; at least, those truly within the Light, and the Alliance, who returned here to the keep."}
Q[11232]={d="现在我们可以发动反击了。但是现在的能见度比预期的要差一些，我们需要你到岸上去标记出打击目标。\n\n联盟的军队死守着西边的荒弃海岸，我要你带上这些烟雾弹，利用它们标记出荒弃海岸北墙外的炮位。\n\n标记了所有火炮的位置之后，你就立刻去向莉安娜报告。我们会照顾好自己的。",dEN="We should be able to kill our way back to our guns. Unfortunately, visibility is less than desirable so you will have to mark our targets from the ground.\n\nTake these smoke flares with you and use them to mark the locations of the cannons along the northern wall in the Derelict Strand, west of here, where the Alliance are holding out.\n\nLet Lyana know as soon as the way is clear for the ground troops. We can take care of ourselves over here.",o="使用烟雾信号弹标记出荒弃海岸北墙外的联盟火炮位置。完成任务后向鲜血谷的黑暗游侠莉安娜复命。",oEN="Use the Smoke Flares at the location of the Alliance Cannons on the northern wall of the Derelict Strand. Report to Dark Ranger Lyana at the Bleeding Vale after you've completed this task.",p="那些火炮，<name>。有人打算处理它们吗？",pEN="The cannons, <name>. Is someone going to take care of them?",c="太棒了。我会用信号通知我们的地面部队开始行动。",cEN="Excellent. I will signal our ground troops to make their move."}
Q[11233]={d="你已经在战场上用行动证明了自己，$n。你的出色表现正使得战局向着对我们有利的方向发展。\n\n现在我要交给你一项非常重要的任务。我不知道我们的劣势还会持续多久，所以必须采取一些非常手段。\n\n我要求你在我们的进攻掩护下潜入敌人后方，刺杀他们的首领。他们分别是：欧斯勒上尉，塞雷尼中尉和洛瑞克中士。祝你好运，$c。",dEN="You've proven yourself in the field of battle, <name>. You might very well have changed the tides in our favor.\n\nI've an important assignment for you now. I'm not sure how much longer the weakness we've exposed is going to last, so we must use the element of surprise to our advantage.\n\nI want you to use the confusion created by our attack and go behind enemy lines to assassinate their leaders. In order of rank, they are: Captain Olster, Lieutenant Celeyne and Sergeant Lorric. Good luck, <class>.",o="复仇港南方的黑暗游侠莉安娜要你潜入荒弃海岸，杀死欧斯勒上尉、塞雷尼中尉和洛瑞克中士。",oEN="Dark Ranger Lyana south of the Vengeance Landing wants you to kill Captain Olster, Lieutenant Celeyne, and Sergeant Lorric at the Derelict Strand.",p="联盟的领袖们死了吗，<name>？在杀掉他们之前别回来。",pEN="Are the Alliance leaders dead, <name>? Do not return until they are.",c="这无疑代表着我方的胜利。安希尔姆听到这个消息一定非常开心。",cEN="This marks undisputable victory for our forces. Anselm will be most glad to hear about this."}
Q[11234]={d="把这个消息告诉老安希尔姆吧。胜利比预期中来得晚了一些，但总好过失败。告诉他，我们的部队只要几个小时就能消灭这些垂死挣扎的家伙。\n\n一切荣耀都将归于女妖之王！",dEN="Let's send word back to old Anselm then. Victory has come later than expected, but better late than never. Tell him it will take our forces a few hours at most to finish off the stragglers here.\n\nGlory to the Banshee Queen!",o="回到嚎风峡湾的复仇港，向高级执行官安希尔姆复命。",oEN="Report back to High Executor Anselm at Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord.",c="该是时候了。联盟长久以来都是我们心中的刺。\n\n不过，没有时间庆祝了。看看西边，看来我们有访客了。",cEN="It was about time. The Alliance has been a thorn in our side for a long time now.\n\nThere's no time to celebrate, however. Look to the west, it appears we have visitors."}
Q[11235]={d="现在我们有另一个问题。活着回来的斥候告诉我，维库人在北方那座主堡垒里图谋不轨。\n他们把那地方叫作加勒布朗，不过那个Gj要念成Sh…\n…多古怪的生物。\n这不重要。重要的是你到那里去，尽可能多地干掉那些生物，并弄清他们在密谋什么。\n我知道我可以指望你，$n。\"\n\"\n\"\"",dEN="And now we have a different problem. My scouts that have lived to return have informed me that the vrykul are up to no good at their main fortress to the north.\n\nThey call the place Gjalerbron, though you'd pronounce the 'Gj' as if it were an 'Sh'. Odd creatures.\n\nBut that's not important; what is, is that you get up there and put an end to the lives of as many of those creatures as you can while trying to figure out what they're up to.\n\nI know that I can count on you, <name>.",o="亚当斯上尉要你去杀死15个亚勒伯龙战士、8个亚勒伯龙符文法师和8个亚勒伯龙沉睡卫士，然后返回西部卫戍要塞向他复命。",oEN="Captain Adams has asked you to kill 15 Gjalerbron Warriors, 8 Gjalerbron Rune-casters, and 8 Gjalerbron Sleep-watchers. Afterward, return to him at Westguard Keep.",c="干得好，<name>，这事了结了真是让人松口气。但你所说的关于那个地方的情况仍让我不安，我想我们的清剿还没有结束！\n\n",cEN="Good work, <name>, and good riddance.\n\nBut, what you say about that place troubles me still, and I think our culling is not quite at an end!"}
Q[11236]={d="天灾在加勒布朗，他们身边还带着亡灵法师！他们一定是在设法把维库人拉进阿尔萨斯的阵营。我要你把那些死灵领主的首领除掉！不惜一切代价，$n，但一定要让死灵霸主梅真和他企图达成的一切都化为泡影。我绝不会眼看着维库人成功与天灾结盟！到加勒布朗右后方的平台上找梅真。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="The Scourge are at Gjalerbron and they have necromancers with them! They must be working to bring the vrykul into Arthas' fold.\n\nI want the leader of these necrolords eliminated!\n\nDo whatever it takes, <name>, but see to it that Necro Overlord Mezhen, and whatever he's attempting to accomplish, is neutralized.\n\nI will not see the vrykul successfully allied with the Scourge!\n\nLook for Mezhen on the platform in the rear right section of Gjalerbron.",o="杀死通灵主宰麦森，然后返回西部卫戍要塞向亚当斯上尉复命。",oEN="Kill Necro Overlord Mezhen. Then, return to Captain Adams at Westguard Keep.",p="你确定你杀了梅真和他的死灵领主们吗，<class>？",pEN="Are you sure that you killed Mezhen and his necrolords, <class>?",c="<上尉松了一口气。>好，这应该能减轻我们一些压力。<name>，你一次又一次证明了自己对西卫堡和整个联盟的价值。从国库里挑点东西吧，<boy /girl>！这是我们最起码能做的！\n\n\n\n",cEN="<The captain breathes a sigh of relief.>\n\nWell, that should take some of the pressure off of us.\n\n<name>, time and again you have proven yourself invaluable to Westguard Keep and the Alliance at large. Pick something from the treasury, <boy /girl>! It's the least we can do!"}
Q[11237]={d="这些计划清晰地表明了一场即将对西部卫戍要塞发动的进攻。看来盘旋在空中的冰霜巨龙格拉希恩将会被用作进攻的手段。\n\n法师中尉玛利斯特应该可以提供一些建议，将计划交给他，他就在南方的要塞中。",dEN="These plans detail an imminent attack upon Westguard Keep. It would appear that the frost wyrm, Glacion, who circles overhead is to be used for the offensive.\n\nSurely Mage-Lieutenant Malister would be of some assistance in this matter. Deliver the plans to him at the keep to the south.",o="转至西部卫戍要塞，将亚勒伯龙攻击计划交给法师中尉玛利斯特。",oEN="Deliver the Gjalerbron Attack Plans to Mage-Lieutenant Malister at Westguard Keep.",p="什么？！攻击要塞的计划！\n\n一只冰霜巨龙？！",pEN="What?! Plans for an attack upon the keep?\n\nA FROST WYRM?!!!",c="<name>，我们不能让这种事发生！",cEN="<name>, we can't let this come to pass!"}
Q[11238]={d="幸亏你把这份计划书交给了我，$n。你必须带着援军转至北边的亚勒伯龙，杀死那条龙和它的主人，唤龙者维尔！\n\n我们说话这会儿，那条冰霜巨龙说不定已经在路上了。\n\n但如果我对这份计划的理解正确无误，只要能找到唤龙者放在亚勒伯龙左后区平台上的号角，吹响它就可以把格拉希恩召唤回去。等它着陆以后，你必须击败它！\n\n同时，$n，请把那只号角带回来交给我。我们不能让它再落入邪恶的人手里。",dEN="You were right to bring this to me, <name>. You must take help back north with you to Gjalerbron and slay that wyrm and its master, Wyrmcaller Vile!\n\nEven now, as we speak here, the frost wyrm may be on its way.\n\nHowever, if I'm reading these plans correctly, blowing the wyrmcaller's horn on his platform, outside in the rear left area of Gjalerbron, will call Glacion back. When the creature lands, destroy it!\n\nAnd <name>, please bring me the horn. We wouldn't want it falling back into the wrong hands.",o="杀死唤龙者维尔，使用唤龙者的号角召唤并杀死格拉希恩。然后返回西部卫戍要塞，将号角交给法师中尉玛利斯特。",oEN="Slay Wyrmcaller Vile and use the Wyrmcaller's Horn to call down and slay Glacion. Then, return with the horn to Mage-Lieutenant Malister at Westguard Keep.",p="攻击被阻止了吗？你杀掉冰霜巨龙和他的主人了吗？\n\n拿回号角了吗？",pEN="Is the attack averted? Are the frost wyrm and its master destroyed?\n\nDid you retrieve the horn?",c="哇，那号角真冷！\n你再一次把西卫堡从必然的毁灭中救了出来。\n你真是个奇特的<man /woman>，<name>。真希望像你这样的人能更多一些。\n好吧，这当然值得一份奖赏。\n你更喜欢哪一个？",cEN="Wow, that horn is cold!\n\nOnce again you've saved Westguard Keep from certain doom. What a curious <man /woman> you are, <name>. If only there were more of you.\n\nWell, this certainly calls for a reward. Which do you prefer?"}
Q[11239]={d="你的效劳堪称典范，$n，但有件事让我不安：天灾。\n圣光无法容忍他们的存在，我们也不能。\n我希望这不算要求过分，但我想让你回到北方的加勒布朗，把那个邪恶巢穴里的亵渎天灾碾碎！也别忘了去加勒布朗地下的觉醒大厅查看。\n净化是得救的钥匙，$g我的孩子:我的孩子;。\n让我们为你骄傲！",dEN="Your service has been exemplary, <name>, but there is something that is troubling me: the Scourge.\n\nThe Light cannot abide their presence, and neither shall we. I hope that it is not asking you too much, but I would have you return north to Gjalerbron and crush the unholy Scourge in that vile lair! Be sure to check for them in the Waking Halls beneath Gjalerbron as well.\n\nPurification is the key to salvation, my child. Make us proud!",o="消灭10个不死的看守者、4个可怕的丧尸和2个腐烂的畸形妖，然后返回西部卫戍要塞向莱瓦里安神父复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Deathless Watchers, 4 Fearsome Horrors, and 2 Putrid Wights. Afterward, inform Father Levariol at Westguard Keep of your success.",p="圣光经由你的行为散播出去，并进入所有的事物中。\n\n没有任何生物，没有任何地方，不管有多怪异，都无法可以逃过它的愤怒！",pEN="The Holy Light moves through your actions and in all things.\n\nNo creature, no place, no matter how wicked, can escape its wrath!",c="<牧师无声地为你念了一段祝福。>愿圣光保佑你，<name>，你回应了我的祈祷。骄傲地立于圣光之中，抬起头，知道你的行为无比神圣！我相信教会的金库能为你提供一些有用的东西。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<The priest quietly mouths a benediction for you.>\n\nBless you, <name>, you have answered my prayers. Stand proudly in the Light, chin held high with the knowledge that your actions were most holy!\n\nI'm certain that the church's coffers can yield up something of use to you."}
Q[11240]={d="朋友，有件事我不得不告诉你。在你外出执行任务时，亚当斯上尉对低语峡谷表现出极大的兴趣。\n\n他打算除掉探险者协会的老领队。我猜测军队很快就会对峡谷中剩馀的勘察员发动攻击，以彻底解决问题。\n\n帮我个忙吧？返回低语峡谷，杀死斯奎格·埃德亨特。我记得他在西北角的洞穴中。",dEN="So, I hate to say it, pal, but while you were out, the captain took a keener interest in that place.\n\nLooks like he wants my old Explorers' League boss in there dead. My guess would be that we're gearing up for an offensive to clear out the rest of them, and the captain wants their head lopped off, as it were.\n\nDo me a favor? Head back into Whisper Gulch and put an end to Squeeg Idolhunter. From what I remember, my guess would be that he's in the cave in the northwest corner.",o="杀死斯奎格·埃德亨特，然后返回西部卫戍要塞向工兵斯迪尔林复命。",oEN="Slay Squeeg Idolhunter and then report back to Sapper Steelring at Westguard Keep.",c="<这个工兵咕哝着，像是他希望你没有成功一样。>\n\n上尉听到你成功了一定会很开心。\n\n你知道，由于你是如此积极解决低语峡谷的事务，你何不就从这些当中挑一个去？",cEN="<The sapper grumbles as if he wishes that you hadn't succeeded.>\n\nThe captain will be pleased to hear of your success.\n\nYou know, since you've been such a good sport in dealing with this Whisper Gulch business, why don't you take your pick of one of these?"}
Q[11241]={d="谢谢你们把我从这鸟地方救出来，$n。其实我根本就不想惹到这群联盟，也完全不想弄清楚他们运的到底都是些什么货。\n\n算了算了，赶紧跑吧，以后再找他们算账。哦，那边有篝火？",dEN="Thanks for bailing me out of this mess, <name>. I was not looking forward to what these Alliance scumbags had in store for me.\n\nLet's get out of here and see if we can get back at them somehow. Is that a campfire over there?",o="护送药剂师哈恩斯离开荒弃海岸。完成这个任务之后回到嚎风峡湾的复仇港，向药剂师雷杉德尔复命。",oEN="Escort Apothecary Hanes out of the Derelict Strand. Report to Apothecary Lysander at Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord when you've completed this task.",c="药剂师哈内斯还活着？你把联盟的补给烧成了灰？\n他一定从中得到了不少乐趣。\n不管怎样，皇家药剂师协会欠你一份人情，<name>。我们从我们漆黑、漆黑的心底感谢你。",cEN="Apothecary Hanes is alive? You burned the Alliance supplies to the ground? He must've gotten a real kick out of that.\n\nAt any rate, the Royal Apothecary Society is in your debt, <name>. We thank you from the bottom of our black, black hearts."}
Q[11242]={d="我曾被愤怒囚禁，$n，而你把我解放了出来。\n我以为自己做得对，如今我的灵魂为带给艾泽拉斯善良民众的恐惧与死亡而哭泣。\n谢谢你引领我重回圣光。\n愿我再也不会迷失这条正道。\n把这本残破的祈祷书带给一位孤儿院女总管，让孩子们知道我再也不会纠缠他们了。",dEN="Rage was my prison, <name>, and you have freed me. Though I thought I did right, my soul now weeps for the terror and the death I have caused the good people of Azeroth.\n\nThank you for leading me back to the Light. May I never again lose my way.\n\nTake this torn prayer book to an orphan matron, so the children may know that I will haunt them no more.",o="将这本破损的圣典交给闪金镇、卡拉诺斯或秘蓝岗哨的穿戏服的孤儿院长。",oEN="Take the Tome of Thomas Thomson to the Costumed Orphan Matron in Goldshire, Kharanos or Azure Watch.",p="你有什么要给我吗，善良的<name>？",pEN="You have something for me, good <name>?",c="这是什么？托马斯·汤姆森的典籍？可那是无头骑士被诅咒之前的名字！\n这意味着他终于自由了吗？这意味着他再也不会折磨艾泽拉斯的善良民众了吗？\n多么令人欢欣的日子！<name>，你的功绩将与我们长存。孩子们，以及孩子们的孩子们，都会传唱你的名字！",cEN="What is this? The tome of Thomas Thomson? But that is the name of the Horseman before he was cursed! Does this mean that he is finally free? Does this mean he will no longer torment the good people of Azeroth?\n\nWhat a joyous day! <name>, your feat will live long with us. The children, and their children, will sing your name!"}
Q[11243]={d="一旦瓦加德港口失守，连接诺森德的主要供给线就会被切断。那样的话，我们沦为巫妖王的奴隶便是迟早的事了。我不清楚你的情况，但是我的妻子和三个孩子还在艾尔文森林等我回家，说什么我都要奋力一搏。\n\n眼下战况危急，我们必须调用所有能派上用场的人手。去前门帮助卫兵抵御那些怪物的入侵吧！",dEN="If Valgarde falls, our primary supply line into Northrend will cease to exist. From there it'll only be a matter of time before we're all servants of the Lich King. Now I don't know about you, but I've got a wife and three kids back in Elwynn and I'll be damned if I'll go down without a fight.\n\nThe situation here is critical and we can use all the manpower you're able to muster. Get to the front gate and help the guards defend the city against the invading monsters!",o="嚎风峡湾瓦加德港的凯勒中将要你杀死12名掠龙入侵者或掠龙座狼。|n",oEN="Vice Admiral Keller at Valgarde Port in the Howling Fjord wants you to slay 12 Dragonflayer Invaders or Dragonflayer Worgs.",p="世界的命运可能就掌握在我们手中。",pEN="The fate of the world may very well rest with us.",c="你给了我们的守军他们所需的额外支援，<name>。多亏了你，士气比以往任何时候都高。我想他们能自己应付剩下的猛攻了。我对你有更大的计划……",cEN="You gave our defenders the extra support they needed, <name>. Morale is higher than ever now, thanks to you. I think they'll be able to handle the remaining onslaught on their own. I've got bigger plans for you..."}
Q[11244]={d="我们在这里待了一个月，那些畸形的巨人就凭空出现了。我们对任何形式的攻击都毫无准备，也为自己的自满付出了惨重代价。\n一整支考古队失踪了，还有一些镇民被掳走带进了废墟。从那以后我们一直处于守势。更糟的是，我们派去营救同胞的斥候被维库人用鱼叉钉住，弃在瓦加德正北方森林里等死。\n拔掉那些鱼叉，救出我们的斥候！|n",dEN="We'd been here for a month when those malformed giants appeared out of thin air. We were ill-prepared for any sort of attack and paid dearly for our complacency. An entire archaeology team was lost and several townsfolk were abducted and taken to the ruins. We've been on the defensive ever since.\n\nTo make matters worse, the scouts we sent to rescue our people have been harpooned by the vrykul and left for dead in the forest directly north of Valgarde. Dislodge those harpoons and free our scouts!",o="嚎风峡湾瓦加德港口的凯勒中将要你解救8名奄奄一息的瓦加德斥候。",oEN="Vice Admiral Keller at Valgarde Port in the Howling Fjord wants you to rescue 8 Valgarde Scouts that have been impaled and left for dead.",p="找到那些斥候！",pEN="Find those scouts!",c="维库人对我们斥候所做的行为既残酷又野蛮。这是一种恐吓战术，想要削弱我们的决心……想让我们怕得四处逃命。\n\n它们失败了。\n\n我们要让这些混蛋瞧瞧和联盟开战会怎样！",cEN="What the vrykul did to our scouts was a gruesome display of savagery. It was a scare tactic, meant to weaken our resolve... to send us running in fear for our lives.\n\nIt failed.\n\nWe are going to show those monsters what it means to wage war against the Alliance!"}
Q[11245]={d="$g先生:女士，如果我们想要通过斯克恩，就必须清除那些塔楼！\n\n如果您注意过那些塔楼，就会发现楼顶上站满了施法者。太靠近它们的话，我们都会完蛋的！\n\n但我们已经从西部卫戍要塞请求了火力支持。为了准确地摧毁那些塔楼，我们要尽量靠近它们，然后放出定位的烟幕弹。\n\n别靠得太近就行了！",dEN="<Sir /Ma'am>, as we move through Skorn, we have to bring down those towers!\n\nIf you have a look at them, you'll notice that their tops are lined with casters. Getting too close to them would mean certain doom for us!\n\nHowever, we do have it within our means to call in cannon volleys from Westguard Keep. To do so, we need to get close enough so that you can lob a smoke flare atop of them.\n\nJust don't get too close!",o="西部卫戍军士要你转至斯克恩，利用军士的烟幕弹标记四座塔楼的位置，供炮击定位用。",oEN="The Westguard Sergeant has informed you that using the Sergeant's Flare to target all four of the towers at Skorn for cannon volleys would be advisable.",p="只要那些投掷器存在，太过靠近的下场就只有死。",pEN="Getting too close to those towers is certain death as long as those casters are up there.",c="瞄得真好，<sir /ma'am>！回要塞后我得记着请那些炮手喝一轮。",cEN="Excellent targeting, <sir /ma'am>! I'll have to remember to buy a round for the cannoneers back at the keep."}
Q[11246]={d="我们得到报告说，这些维库人会死而复生。他们和天灾军团不一样，是另一种形式的不死生物。\n\n我们不能冒这个险。\n\n来，拿着我的刀。当我们穿过这个地区的时候，你要用它确保那些被我们打倒的维库人不会再突然跳起来。这本该是我的工作，可惜我的胃比较脆弱。\n\n<中士幸灾乐祸地笑了笑。>\n\n这把刀我已经磨了一上午了，肯定非常好用。",dEN="We've had reports that these vrykul can rise from the dead; not unlike the Scourge, but a different kind of undeath.\n\nLet's not take any chances.\n\nHere, take my machete. As we move through this place, you'll need to carve up the remains of the vrykul that we take down. I'd do it, but I have a sensitive stomach.\n\n<The sergeant smirks.>\n\nI spent all morning sharpening it, so it should do the job.",o="西部卫戍军士要你转至斯克恩，利用军士的弯刀确保20个斯克恩部族的维库人无法复活。",oEN="The Westguard Sergeant has asked you to use The Sergeant's Machete to dismember 20 Vrykul of the Winterskorn tribe at Skorn.",p="我很确定，我不想看到这些大块头在我们打倒之后又站起来！",pEN="One thing that I know for certain is that I don't want to see any of these bigguns standing back up after we've knocked 'em down!",c="好吧，<sir /ma'am>，我得说，你办那件事的时候有点太热心了。<中士警惕地看着你。>总之，如果你不介意，我现在要把我的砍刀拿回来了。它看起来钝了，我们可不想你不小心滑一跤，把我也给劈了。\n\n\n\n",cEN="Well, <sir /ma'am>, I have to say that you went about that particular business with a bit of zeal.\n\n<The sergeant looks at you warily.>\n\nAnyway, if you don't mind, I'll be taking my machete back now. It looks dull and we wouldn't want you to accidentally slip and carve me up, too."}
Q[11247]={d="亚当斯上尉给了我严格的命令，要确保对这处设施造成足够的基础设施破坏。不过，既然这里由你指挥，那就由你决定，$g先生:女士;。我能否建议我们烧掉斯科恩下层的两座长屋和那座兵营？我们只要进到每座建筑里，把这支火把扔进去就行。\n\n\n\n",dEN="Captain Adams gave me strict instructions to make sure that a good deal of infrastructure damage was inflicted on this site.\n\nHowever, since you're in charge out here, that's at your discretion, <sir /ma'am>.\n\nMay I suggest that we burn down the two longhouses and the barracks that are in the lower area of Skorn? All we have to do is get inside each and throw this torch.",o="西部卫戍军士要你转至斯克恩，利用军士的火炬烧毁东北方的长屋、西北方的长屋以及兵营。",oEN="The Westguard Sergeant has orders that you should use the Sergeant's Torch to set fire to the Northeast and Northwest Longhouses and the Barracks at Skorn.",p="我有个建议，当我们放火烧掉这些建筑时，可以不要在里面待太久吗？",pEN="May I suggest that when we set the buildings ablaze, we not tarry too long inside of them?",c="很好，<sir /ma'am>。\n这没有你的帮助是办不到的。\n我相信等我们在这里办完事，上尉会对我就此事的报告感到满意。",cEN="Very good, <sir /ma'am>. That couldn't have been done without your help.\n\nI'm sure that the captain will be pleased with my report on the matter once we're done here."}
Q[11248]={d="$n，我不得不把这个极其危险的任务交给你，也只有你才能完成它。\n\n维库人的堡垒斯克恩就坐落在我们的东方。我的探子回报说，那些“巨人”打算攻击我们。我的部队分布在海湾各地，所以我没有足够的人手去攻占那里。\n\n因此，你是最佳的人选。我已经派了一名军士先行潜入那里。在斯克恩出示这枚令牌，他就会现身并听从你的指挥。",dEN="<name>, I must now ask you to undertake an operation so hazardous, so deadly, that only you can see it through.\n\nThe vrykul fortress, Skorn, sits on our eastern border. My scouts inform me that those 'giants' are poised to strike us, and with my forces scattered all over the fjord, I don't have the men to take the place by force.\n\nInstead, you're going to use your cunning. I've sent a sergeant ahead with the details. Show this command insignia at Skorn and he'll reveal himself and follow your orders.",o="亚当斯上尉要你转至斯克恩，在那里使用西部卫戍令牌，然后跟西部卫戍军士谈一谈。",oEN="Captain Adams has asked you to use the Westguard Command Insignia at Skorn, and then to speak with the Westguard Sergeant.",c="很高兴认识你，<sir /ma'am>！\n我很期待与你共事。\n说到这个，我们有很多事要做。",cEN="A pleasure to meet you, <sir /ma'am>! I look forward to working with you.\n\nSpeaking of which, we have a great deal to do."}
Q[11249]={d="这张巨大的卷轴是用龙皮制作的。展开这张长达十尺的卷轴之后，你看到复盖着鳞片的卷轴上画着一副维库人的神秘仪式的场景。\n\n一个维库领主，在一群天使形象的生物的环绕中，正缓缓升入天堂。而这副图的后台，则是一个神秘而巨大的黑影。\n\n你突然意识到，这就是斯克恩的领主正要去做的事。你必须阻止他！在斯克恩的顶层，领主的房间外已经堆好了一大捆木柴。",dEN="This huge scroll is made from dragon skin. Unfurling its more-than-ten-foot length, you can see that the images painted upon its scaly surface depict a mysterious vrykul ritual.\n\nA vrykul thane, surrounded by angelic-looking beings, ascends into the heavens. A mysterious, darkened figure looms large in the picture's background.\n\nA tingling in your gut tells you that the thane of Skorn is about to do this. You must stop it! A large pyre sits at the top of Skorn in front of the thane's lodge.",o="在领主的火堆附近展开维库升华卷轴，召唤出维库领主并杀死他。完成以后，鉴于这种仪式的性质，你确信西部卫戍要塞里的莱瓦里安神父会对这张卷轴感兴趣。",oEN="Present the Vrykul Scroll of Ascension near the Thane's Pyre to call him out and slay him. Afterward, due to the nature of the ritual, you're sure that Father Levariol at Westguard Keep will be interested in seeing the scroll.",p="嗯？我可以帮你什么吗，孩子？",pEN="Yes? How may I help you, my child?",c="是的，<my son /my daughter>，那东西看起来很不祥，显然你说得对。\n谢谢你把这卷卷轴带给我。\n我非常想研究它的含义。如果要我斗胆猜一猜，我会说这些维库人有超越死亡的办法；至少对那些配得上的人是这样。\n击败冬颅领主之后，你证明了他并不配。\n要是你没杀掉他，天知道他会变成什么，又会给我们降下什么样的恐怖。",cEN="Yes, <my son /my daughter>, that is ominous-looking, and you obviously had the right of it.\n\nThank you for bringing this scroll to me. I am very keen to study its implications. If I were to hazard a guess, I would say that these vrykul have a way to transcend death; at least those that are worthy.\n\nBy defeating the Winterskorn thane, you proved him unworthy. The Light only knows what he would have become, and what terror he might have rained down upon us, had you not slain him."}
Q[11250]={d="我们——好吧，是你——完成了派我们来这里要完成的一切，$g先生:女士;。\n我得承认，能听命于$g一位如此出色的年轻:一位如此出色的年轻;$r，真是件愉快的事。\n上尉肯定想知道你的成功，但如果你出于什么原因决定留在这里，我随时听候差遣。",dEN="We -- well, you -- have done everything that we were sent here to accomplish <sir /ma'am>. I must say that it's been a pleasure taking orders from such a fine, young <race>.\n\nThe captain is sure to want to hear of your success, but if you decide to stay out here for whatever reason, I am at your disposal.",o="将西部卫戍令牌交给西部卫戍要塞的亚当斯上尉。",oEN="Return the Westguard Command Insignia to Captain Adams at Westguard Keep.",p="既然你人在这里，我想斯克恩已经不复存在对吗？",pEN="I gather that since you're here, Skorn is no more?",c="这可真是难以置信的好消息！\n我就知道你能办到，<name>！\n至少这里还有人能拿出成果来！\n好吧，这值得一份奖赏。\n来吧，随便挑；国库对你敞开。",cEN="That's unbelievably good news! I knew that you could pull it off, <name>!\n\nAt least someone around here can produce results!\n\nWell, this calls for a reward. Go ahead, take your pick; the treasury is open to you."}
Q[11251]={d="我们费了很大的劲，总算完成了对挖掘场的调查。\n\n情况并不乐观。那里的人要么被杀要么被虏走，只有极少数的老兵幸免于难。\n\n侦察兵能做的只有这些啦，接下来就要靠你了。\n\n东北方的小山坡传来阵阵激烈的交战声。$c，去那里瞧瞧吧。或许我们能从幸存者口中得到敌人的情报。",dEN="It's come at great cost, but we've completed our inspection of the site.\n\nThe news isn't good. Nearly everyone has been slain or captured. Only a few veteran guards remain unaccounted for.\n\nThe scouts have done all we can here. You must pick up where we've left off.\n\nSounds of a skirmish are coming from up the hill to the northeast. Have a look, <class>. We can only hope there are some who have survived, and that they may have some intel we can use against this enemy.",o="斥候瓦罗瑞要你转至龙颅村的东北方调查情况。",oEN="Scout Valory wants you to investigate the sounds of battle coming from the northeast of Wyrmskull Village.",c="虽然有点迟，但很高兴能看到一张友善的脸。\n\n现在别傻站在那边蹭鼻子。我们还有工作要做！",cEN="Late though ye may be, it's good to see a friendly face.\n\nNow stop standin' around with yer thumb up yer nose. there's work to be done!"}
Q[11252]={d="听着，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。我已经干掉了我该干掉的那些东西…\n…也替你干了你那份。\n你该知道的是这个……\n维库人在战斗中无所畏惧。看起来他们其实渴望战死沙场。\n以他们的数量和那股凶悍，我们注定完蛋……\n就这么简单。不过有一个人他们极为敬重，叫英格瓦。\n我不知道他们为什么要寻求他的赞许，但把他干掉，你就能给他们的士气致命一击。也许那样我们才有一线机会。",dEN="Listen up, youngster. I've put down me share of these creatures - and your share too fer that matter. Here be what ya need to know....\n\nThe vrykul are fearless in a fight. Seems they actually yearn fer a death in battle. With their numbers and that ferocity, we're doomed - plain and simple.\n\nThere's one they esteem though, goes by the name of Ingvar. I dunno why they be seekin' his praise, but bring him down and you'll deal a mighty blow to their spirit.\n\nThen, perhaps, we'll have a chance....",o="防御者墨尔顿指派你去消灭乌特加德城堡的劫掠者因格瓦尔。\n\n将因格瓦尔的徽记交给凯勒中将。",oEN="Defender Mordun has tasked you with the execution of Ingvar the Plunderer who resides deep in Utgarde.\n\nYou are then to bring his head to Vice Admiral Keller.",p="很高兴看到你安然无恙，<name>。我们已经承受了能承受的最大伤亡。\n\n",pEN="Good to see you're well, <name>.\n\nWe've had about as many casualties as we can handle.",c="太棒了！这也许就是我们一直在等待的转机。干得好，<name>！\n\n\n\n",cEN="Outstanding!\n\nThis could be the turn of luck we've all been hoping for.\n\nWell done, <name>!"}
Q[11253]={d="既然这流氓的肚子填饱了，也许他会更愿意合作一些。\n这是他的牵绳。等你$g准备:准备;好，就来笼子这儿带他走。\n我不知道安塞尔姆指望你找到什么，但不管那狗把你带到哪儿，都仔细找找线索。",dEN="Now that this rascal's belly's full, maybe he will be more willing to cooperate. Here's his leash, just come get him from his cage whenever you're ready to take him.\n\nI don't know what Anselm expects you to find, but look for clues wherever it is that the dog takes you.",o="在复仇港的天灾犬笼子附近使用天灾犬绳，然后在天灾猎犬的带领下仔细搜寻线索。",oEN="Use the Plaguehound Leash near the plaguehound cages at Vengeance Landing and look for clues at the location you're led to by the Plaguehound Tracker.",c="这个斑驳的卷轴布满了鲜明的图案。你觉得这应该就是猎犬管理者要你去寻找的线索。",cEN="This scaly scroll is covered in stark painted images. You've a feeling this is the sort of thing the kennel keeper had in mind when he asked you to look for clues."}
Q[11254]={d="仔细辨认后，你发现这张卷轴其实是一幅精心绘制的嚎风峡湾地图。各个村落都以相应的氏族徽记进行标识。\n\n复仇港所在的位置却画着一颗硕大的骷髅头。\n\n这幅地图对高级执行官安希尔姆来说显然具有极高的军事价值。",dEN="Upon closer inspection, the scroll appears to be a heavily-illustrated map of the fjord. The location of various villages are depicted in what seem to be tribal symbols.\n\nThe location of Vengeance Landing is marked with a disproportionately large skull.\n\nThis map will almost certainly be of military value to High Executor Anselm.",o="将龙皮地图交给复仇港的高级执行官安希尔姆。",oEN="Bring the Dragonskin Map to High Executor Anselm in Vengeance Landing.",p="你有什么要给我看的吗，<class>？",pEN="You've something to show me, <class>?",c="<指挥官专心地看着地图，偶而抬起头看看峡湾附近的地形。>\n\n这里是东部的海岸线。掠龙者和斯克恩的村落在这里和这里……而我们在这里，标记着死亡。",cEN="<The high executor looks at the map intently, occasionally looking up at landmarks around the Fjord.>\n\nHere's the eastern coastline over here. The Dragonflayer and Winterskorn villages are here and here... and this must be us over here, marked for death."}
Q[11255]={d="$n，战争远远没有结束。我们必须搭救村子中的幸存者。\n\n<凯勒中将对你点了点头。>\n\n前往北方的龙颅村寻找幸存者的下落吧。如果他们被囚禁起来了，你要设法打开牢笼。\n\n或许他们能提供更为详细的关于畸形巨人的情报。",dEN="This battle is far from over, <name>. If our people are still alive inside that village, someone has to go and get 'em.\n\n<Vice Admiral Keller nods at you.>\n\nHead north and enter Wyrmskull Village. Once there, look for our people. If they are imprisoned you'll need to find a way to break them out.\n\nMaybe they'll have some more information about what it is that we're actually fighting.",o="嚎风峡湾瓦加德港口的凯勒中将要你营救3名被俘虏的瓦加德囚犯。",oEN="Vice Admiral Keller at Valgarde Port in the Howling Fjord wants you to rescue 3 Captured Valgarde Prisoners.",p="拿出点骨气来，<name>！这里可是人命关天！",pEN="Put some backbone into it, <name>! People's lives are at stake here!",c="你救回来的士兵提供了我们一些有用的消息。那些怪物自称叫“维库”。居住在龙颅村的部族由一个叫做亚尼斯的秘术师领导，而他又是另一个叫做“劫掠者”因格瓦尔的维库人的手下。",cEN="Those soldiers you rescued had a good bit of information for us. These monsters call themselves 'vrykul.' The tribe that's taken up residence in Wyrmskull Village is led by a mystic named Yanis who himself is an underling of another vrykul known as Ingvar the Plunderer."}
Q[11256]={d="$n，维库人的堡垒，斯克恩，就坐落在南面。那里面的奇怪的巨人们最近醒了过来，并开始不停地攻击我们。\n\n我的斥候告诉我说，他们已经做好了向这里发动进攻的准备，而我现在并没有能力来抵挡这样的一支部队。我们只能离开北面，去一个稍微安全点的地方。\n\n我希望你能想办法为我们争取一点时间。我已经派了一个勇士去了解更多的信息。在斯克恩出示这枚徽章，他就会尽全力地帮助你。",dEN="<name>, the vrykul fortress, Skorn, sits to the south. Its strange giants have recently awakened and have begun to spread, attacking us wherever they can.\n\nMy scouts inform me that they are poised to strike at us here, but I do not have the strength to repel such a force. Instead, we will prepare to leave north to less dangerous lands.\n\nI ask that you use your cunning to buy us time. I've sent a brave ahead with the details. Show this emblem at Skorn and he'll reveal himself and do all he can to aid you.",o="灰烬图腾酋长要求你转至斯克恩，在那里使用冬蹄徽章，然后与冬蹄勇士谈一谈。",oEN="Chieftain Ashtotem has asked you to use the Winterhoof Emblem at Skorn, and then to speak with the Winterhoof Brave.",c="与你并肩作战的同时了解你的族人，会很有意思，<class>。我们继续吗？\n\n",cEN="It will be interesting to learn about your people, <class>, while fighting alongside you.\n\nShall we proceed?"}
Q[11257]={d="我们的长者说这些维库人是可以复生的，他们可能就像你们所说的“天灾军团的行尸走肉”差不多，不过只是另一种复生方式。\n\n我们最好不要冒险行事。\n\n过来，拿上我的弯刀。在我们穿过这个地区的时候，确保那些被我们杀死的维库人不会再跳起来。\n\n我花了一个早晨的时间使它变得更锋利，我想应该够用了。",dEN="Our elders say that these vrykul may be able to rise from the dead; not unlike the walking dead you call the Scourge, but a different kind of undeath.\n\nWe should not take any chances.\n\nHere, take my machete. As we move through this place, carve up the remains of the vrykul that we slay.\n\nI spent the morning sharpening it, so it should cleave even through their thick bones.",o="冬蹄营地勇士要你转至斯克恩，利用勇士的弯刀确保20个斯克恩部族的维库人无法复活。",oEN="The Winterhoof Brave has asked you to use The Brave's Machete to dismember 20 Vrykul of the Winterskorn tribe at Skorn.",p="你也同意这些维库人的习俗很古怪吧，<name>？",pEN="These vrykul have strange customs, would you not agree, <name>?",c="你以前干过那种事吗？你用我那把砍刀的手法看起来像是练过的。<那位勇士警惕地看着你。>我现在把它收回来了，<class>。\n\n\n\n",cEN="Have you done that before? Your skill with my machete seemed practiced.\n\n<The brave looks at you warily.>\n\nI'll take it back from you now, <class>."}
Q[11258]={d="酋长灰图腾命令我摧毁这里的许多建筑。不过，这里由你指挥，所以这事就落到你手上，$n。我建议我们烧掉斯科恩下层的两座长屋和那座兵营。我们只要进到每座建筑里，用这支火把把它们点着。\n\n\n\n",dEN="Chieftain Ashtotem ordered me to destroy many buildings here.\n\nHowever, you are in charge, so it falls to your hands, <name>.\n\nI suggest that we burn down the two longhouses and the barracks that are in the lower area of Skorn. All we have to do is get inside each and set them ablaze with this torch.",o="冬蹄勇士建议你转至斯克恩，利用勇士的火炬烧毁东北方的长屋、西北方的长屋以及兵营。",oEN="The Winterhoof Brave suggests that you use the Brave's Torch to set fire to the Northeast and Northwest Longhouses and the Barracks at Skorn.",p="我建议建筑物起火以后就不要待在附近了。火灵对破坏的渴望不会放过我们两个的。",pEN="I suggest that when we set the buildings ablaze, we not stay inside of them. The fire spirit will not spare us in its thirst to destroy.",c="<冬蹄勇士朝你点点头，明显地对你使用火炬的方式表示赞许。>\n\n让这些维库人感受大地的热度吧，让他们了解一下恐惧是怎么写的！",cEN="<The brave nods at you in clear approval of your handling of the torch>\n\nLet these vrykul feel the heat of the land. Let them know the fear they would instill in others!"}
Q[11259]={d="在我们穿越斯克恩的同时，还必须把那些塔楼给端掉。\n\n如果你有注意的话，就会发现它们的顶端站满了法师。要是离它们太近，无疑就意味着毁灭。\n\n不过，我们可以调用冬蹄营地的双足飞龙向这里进行空中打击。要这么做的话，我们就得尽可能靠近塔楼，然后你向塔楼顶部抛射一发烟幕弹。\n\n不过不要太靠近了。",dEN="As we move through Skorn, we must destroy the towers.\n\nIf you have a look at them, you'll notice that their tops are lined with casters. Getting too close to them would mean certain doom.\n\nHowever, we can call in wind rider air strikes from Camp Winterhoof. To do so, we need to get close enough so that you can lob a smoke flare atop of them.\n\nJust don't get too close.",o="冬蹄勇士要你转至斯克恩，利用勇士的烟幕弹为空袭部队标记四座塔楼的位置。",oEN="The Winterhoof Brave has informed you that using the Brave's Flare to target all four of the towers at Skorn for air strikes would be advisable.",p="只要那些施法者还在上面，靠近那些哨塔就是找死。",pEN="Getting too close to those towers is certain death as long as those casters are up there.",c="你的臂力真强，<name>。看来那些御风者终于派上了点用场，而不是整天站在那里喝酒。\n\n",cEN="You have a strong arm, <name>.\n\nIt looks as if those wind riders finally made themselves useful instead of just standing around and drinking all day."}
Q[11260]={d="这张巨大的卷轴是用龙皮制作的。展开这张长达十尺的卷轴之后，你看到覆盖着鳞片的卷轴上画着一副维库人的神秘仪式的场景。\n\n一个维库领主，在一群天使形象的生物的环绕中，正缓缓升入天堂。而这副图的背景，则是一个神秘而巨大的黑影。\n\n你突然意识到，这就是斯克恩的领主正要去做的事。你必须阻止他！在斯克恩的顶层，领主的房间外已经堆好了一大捆木柴。",dEN="This huge scroll is made from dragon skin. Unfurling its more-than-ten-foot length, you can see that the images painted upon its scaly surface depict a mysterious vrykul ritual.\n\nA vrykul thane, surrounded by angelic-looking beings, ascends into the heavens. A mysterious, darkened figure looms large in the picture's background.\n\nA tingling in your gut tells you that the thane of Skorn is about to do this. You must stop it! A large pyre sits at the top of Skorn in front of the thane's lodge.",o="在领主的火堆附近展开维库升华卷轴，召唤出维库领主并杀死他。完成以后，鉴于这种仪式的性质，你确信冬蹄营地里的安卡祖母会对这张卷轴感兴趣。",oEN="Present the Vrykul Scroll of Ascension near the Thane's Pyre to call him out and slay him. Afterward, due to the nature of the ritual, you're sure that Greatmother Ankha at Camp Winterhoof will be interested in seeing the scroll.",p="嗯？我可以帮你什么吗，孩子？",pEN="Yes? How may I help you, child?",c="没错，那是不祥的东西，你显然做了对的选择。\n\n谢谢你把这个卷轴带来给我，我非常想要研究一下这东西的意涵。如果要我大胆做出猜测，我会说这些维库人有可以超越死亡的方法——至少那些都是有资格的人。\n\n由于你击败了斯克恩族长，你证明了他没有资格。圣光不知道如果你没有杀掉他，他会变成什么样子，还有他会对我们做什么恐怖的事。",cEN="Yes, that is ominous-looking, and you obviously had the right of it.\n\nThank you for bringing this scroll to me. I will study its implications. If I were to hazard a guess, I would say that these vrykul have a way to transcend death; at least those that are worthy.\n\nBy defeating the Winterskorn thane, you proved him unworthy. Who knows what he would have become, and what terror he might have rained down upon us, had you not slain him?"}
Q[11261]={d="你完成了我们指派的所有任务，$c。我必须承认你干得很棒。看来$r并不像我最初所想的那样奇怪。\n\n灰烬图腾酋长一定很想知道你的成就，不过如果你决定待在这里的话，我会仍然和你并肩战斗。",dEN="You have done everything that we were sent here to do, <class>. I must admit that you fight well. Your people are not as strange as I first thought.\n\nChieftain Ashtotem is certain to want to hear of your success, but if you decide to stay out here for whatever reason, I will continue to fight at your side.",o="将冬蹄徽章交给冬蹄营地的灰烬图腾酋长。",oEN="Return the Winterhoof Token to Chieftain Ashtotem at Camp Winterhoof.",p="你从斯科恩带来了什么消息，<name>？",pEN="What news do you bring of Skorn, <name>?",c="真是好消息！你为我们即将开始的迁徙提供了许多喘息的空间。\n\n请收下其中一样谢礼吧。",cEN="That is good news indeed! You have given us some breathing room to further our preparations for leaving.\n\nPlease, take one of these as a sign of our appreciation."}
Q[11262]={d="最后，终于有人来了。我在这里待得太久，脑子都快不清醒了。\n我们整支侦察队，只剩我一个。我会把报告交给你，接下来就由你根据这些情报行动。\n要知道，这些情报来之不易。\n这些维库人是毫不留情的战士。以他们的数量和野蛮的战术，我们唯一的希望就是干掉他们的首领，祈祷这能在他们内部引发混乱。\n他叫英格瓦。任务完成之后，把他的头带给安塞尔姆。",dEN="Finally, someone's come. I've been here far too long and my wits are beginning to fail me. Of our entire recon party, only I remain.\n\nI shall give you my report and it will be up to you to act upon the information. Know this, <class>; it did not come cheaply.\n\nThese vrykul are relentless fighters. Given their numbers and their savage tactics, our only hope is to bring down their leader and pray it brings chaos to their ranks.\n\nIngvar is his name. Bring his head to Anselm when your duty is done.",o="黑暗游侠玛尔拉要求你杀死乌特加德城堡内的劫掠者因格瓦尔，然后把他的徽记交给复仇港的高级执行官安希尔姆。",oEN="Dark Ranger Marrah has asked you to kill Ingvar the Plunderer in Utgarde Keep, then bring his head to High Executor Anselm at Vengeance Landing.",p="打起精神来，<race>。\n有大量工作要做。\n可以说，这还只是冰山一角。",pEN="Gird up, <race>.\n\nThere's much work to be done. This is just the tip of the iceberg, so to speak.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。\n他们的首领已被除掉，我们对付这些维库人的行动应该会更顺利。\n这样的功劳不能没有奖赏！",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. With their leader removed, our efforts against these vrykul should be more successful.\n\nService such as this cannot go unrewarded!"}
Q[11263]={d="我几个活着回来的信使告诉我，维库人在西边那座主堡垒里醒来了。那是个被称为加勒布朗的禁地。信使们说维库人正在举行古怪的仪式。我们不能让这种事继续下去。你$g愿意:愿意;继续帮助我们吗？你会在维库人完成他们正在做的事、来攻击我们之前，杀掉加勒布朗的维库人吗？\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="My longrunners that have lived to return have informed me that the vrykul have awakened at their main fortress to the west.\n\nIt is a forbidden place known as Gjalerbron. The longrunners tell me that the vrykul are performing strange rituals.\n\nWe cannot allow this to continue.\n\nAre you willing to continue to assist us? Will you kill the vrykul at Gjalerbron before they finish whatever they are doing and attack us here?",o="灰烬图腾酋长要你杀死15个亚勒伯龙战士、8个亚勒伯龙符文法师和8个亚勒伯龙沉睡卫士，然后返回冬蹄营地向他复命。",oEN="Chieftain Ashtotem has asked you to kill 15 Gjalerbron Warriors, 8 Gjalerbron Rune-casters, and 8 Gjalerbron Sleep-watchers. Afterward, return to him at Camp Winterhoof.",p="亚勒伯龙的战况如何？",pEN="How is the fight at Gjalerbron coming?",c="我感谢你，<name>。\n我知道你对我或我的族人没有任何义务。\n你所说的关于那个地方的情况仍让我不安，我预感到我们的清剿还没有完全结束。",cEN="You have my thanks, <name>. I know that you do not have any duty to me or my people.\n\nWhat you say about that place troubles me still, and I sense that our culling is not quite at an end."}
Q[11264]={d="亚勒伯龙有亡灵出没？还有亡灵巫师？\n\n我们必须消灭他们的首领。\n\n$n，我要你不惜一切代价杀死通灵主宰麦森，粉碎他的阴谋。\n\n我们绝不能让维库人与亡灵联合起来！\n\n麦森就在亚勒伯龙右后区的平台上。",dEN="The dead ones are at Gjalerbron and they have necromancers with them?\n\nWe must eliminate the leader of these necrolords.\n\nDo whatever it takes, <name>, but see to it that Necro Overlord Mezhen, and whatever he's attempting to accomplish, is neutralized.\n\nWe cannot afford to see the vrykul successful in whatever they are doing with these undead creatures!\n\nLook for Mezhen on the platform in the rear right section of Gjalerbron.",o="杀死通灵主宰麦森，然后返回冬蹄营地向灰烬图腾酋长复命。",oEN="Kill Necro Overlord Mezhen. Then, return to Chieftain Ashtotem at Camp Winterhoof.",c="<El jefe Ashtotem exhala un suspiro de alivio>这应该能减轻一些压力。<name>，你一次又一次证明了自己对冬蹄营地牛头人的价值。请从我们的奖赏中挑一样吧。我坚持。\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Chieftain Ashtotem breathes a sigh of relief.>\n\nThat should take some of the pressure off.\n\n<name>, time and again you have proven your value to the taunka of Camp Winterhoof. Please, choose something from our bounty. I insist."}
Q[11265]={d="据我们掌握的一点点情报，维库人正在西边的加勒布朗进行某种觉醒仪式的邪恶礼拜。\n他们用活人献祭来助长他们那邪恶的仪式！$n，你必须阻止他们。\n不管那些笼子里关的是谁、是什么，都必须把它们放出来。\n我猜钥匙就在维库人手里。\n我们最不需要的就是更多那种古怪的维库人来威胁我们，或者更糟——他们唤醒什么更邪恶的东西…\n…\"\n\"",dEN="From the little we know, the vrykul are conducting unnatural rites in an 'awakening' ritual to the west in Gjalerbron.\n\nThey're using living sacrifices to fuel their rituals.\n\n<name>, you must stop this. It matters not who or what is in those cages, they must be freed. I would guess that the vrykul hold the keys.\n\nThe last thing we need is more of those strange vrykul threatening us, or worse, them wakening something even more evil....",o="安卡祖母要你去搜集足够的亚勒伯龙牢笼钥匙，用它们解救10个亚勒伯龙囚犯。完成任务后返回冬蹄营地向她复命。",oEN="Greatmother Ankha has asked you to collect enough Gjalerbron Cage Keys to free 10 Gjalerbron Prisoners. Return to her at Camp Winterhoof when you manage to do so.",p="只要亚勒伯龙的囚犯被放走，维库人就无法继续他们的仪式了。",pEN="With the prisoners at Gjalerbron freed, the vrykul will be unable to continue their rituals.",c="听到你的成功，我肩膀上的大石头终于落了下来。而我也很开心的知道你所救出的囚犯就是牦牛人。\n\n请你收下这个礼物，回报你所做的一切。我要去照顾那些你救出来的牦牛人人。",cEN="A great stone is lifted from my shoulders to hear of your success. And I smile to know that some you freed were taunka.\n\nPlease, take this as a gift for what you have done. I shall see to the health of those you freed."}
Q[11266]={d="这些计划清晰地表明了一场即将对冬蹄营地发动的进攻。看来盘旋在空中的冰霜巨龙格拉希恩将会被用作进攻的手段。\n\n塞莉亚·冰鬃应该可以提供一些建议，将计划交给她，她就在东面的营地里。",dEN="These plans detail an imminent attack upon Camp Winterhoof. It would appear that the frost wyrm, Glacion, who circles overhead, is to be used for the offensive.\n\nSurely Celea Frozenmane would be of some assistance in this matter. Deliver the plans to her at the camp to the east.",o="将亚勒伯龙攻击计划交给冬蹄营地的塞莉亚·冰鬃。",oEN="Deliver the Gjalerbron Attack Plans to Celea Frozenmane at Camp Winterhoof.",p="什么？！计划攻击我们的营地？\n\n凶手是一只天上的巨龙？！",pEN="What?! Plans for an attack upon our camp?\n\nFROM A GREAT WYRM IN THE SKY?!!!",c="<name>，我们不能让这种事发生！",cEN="<name>, we cannot let this come to pass!"}
Q[11267]={d="你把这件东西交给我是非常正确的选择，但是我的双足飞龙恐怕无法战胜一条龙。你必须带着援军回到西边的亚勒伯龙去，杀死那条冰霜巨龙和它的主人——唤龙者维尔！\n\n我们说话这会儿，那条冰霜巨龙说不定已经在路上了！\n\n但如果我对这份计划的理解正确无误，只要找到唤龙者放在亚勒伯龙左后区平台上的号角，然后吹响它就可以把格拉希恩召唤回去。等它着陆以后，你必须击败它！\n\n$n，请把那只号角带回来交给我。我们不能让它再落入邪恶的人手里！",dEN="Your instincts were right to bring this to me, but my wind riders cannot fight a dragon. You must take help back west with you to Gjalerbron and slay the frost wyrm and its master, Wyrmcaller Vile!\n\nEven now it may be on its way!\n\nIf I'm reading these plans correctly, blowing the wyrmcaller's horn on his platform, outside in the rear left area of Gjalerbron, will call Glacion back. When the creature lands, destroy it!\n\nAnd <name>, bring me the horn. We wouldn't want it falling back into the wrong hands!",o="杀死唤龙者维尔，使用唤龙者的号角召唤并杀死格拉希恩。然后返回冬蹄营地，将号角交给塞莉亚·冰鬃。",oEN="Slay Wyrmcaller Vile and use the Wyrmcaller's Horn to call down and slay Glacion. Then, return with the horn to Celea Frozenmane at Camp Winterhoof.",p="阻止攻击了吗？巨龙和他的主人被杀掉了吗？\n\n你拿回号角了吗？",pEN="Is the attack averted? Is the great death wyrm and its master destroyed?\n\nDid you retrieve the horn?",c="这号角冷得像大地……\n也许更冷！\n你从必然的毁灭中拯救了冬蹄营地，虽然我们本来也不会在这里待太久了。你真是个奇特的<man/woman>，<name>。\n也许从大洋彼岸来的那些<race>家伙终究没那么糟。\n这值得一份奖赏。你更喜欢哪一个？",cEN="This horn is as cold as the land... perhaps even colder!\n\nYou have saved Camp Winterhoof from certain doom, not that we'll be staying here much longer. What a curious <man/woman> you are, <name>. Perhaps you <race>-types from over the ocean are not so bad after all.\n\nThis calls for a reward. Which do you prefer?"}
Q[11268]={d="你为我们提供的帮助远远超出了我们的期望，$n，不过仍然有件事情让我感到烦心：就是这些所谓的天灾。\n\n大地和空气之灵，地下的水与火，都不能忍受他们的存在，但似乎对他们毫无办法。那么，我们要负责解决他们！\n\n也许我的要求太过分了，但我希望你能回到西面的亚勒伯龙去，消灭这群天灾！别忘了顺便检查一下亚勒伯龙下面的苏醒之厅！",dEN="Your assistance to us has been tremendous, <name>, but there is something that is troubling me: these so-called Scourge.\n\nThe spirits of the land and air, the waters and the fire below the world, would not abide their presence, but seem to do nothing about them. We will see to it that they are dealt with!\n\nPerhaps it is asking too much, but I would have you return west to Gjalerbron and destroy the unnatural Scourge in that vile lair. Be sure to check in the Waking Halls below Gjalerbron as well!",o="消灭10个不死的看守者、4个可怕的丧尸和2个腐烂的畸形妖，然后返回冬蹄营地向安卡祖母复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Deathless Watchers, 4 Fearsome Horrors, and 2 Putrid Wights. Afterward, inform Greatmother Ankha at Camp Winterhoof of your success.",p="你消灭了那些横行亚勒伯龙的僵尸了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed the walking dead at Gjalerbron?",c="<大母点头赞许你的行为。>谢谢你，<name>，你做了正确的事，也为我们争取到了一点额外的时间来完成离开的准备。我们很快就要踏上北上的旅程了。我太老了；我们走的时候，我没法把所有东西都带上。你愿意带走其中一样吗？\n\n\n\n",cEN="<The greatmother nods her approval of your actions.>\n\nThank you, <name>, you have done what is right and you have bought us a little more time to finish our preparations for leaving. We will soon make the journey north.\n\nI am too old; when we go, I will not be able to carry everything with me. Would you like to take one of these?"}
Q[11269]={d="再过几天，联盟的先锋部队就该抵达这里了。我们得提前为将士们准备好过冬的物资，眼下就差披风啦。\n\n斑点角鹰兽的羽毛是绝好的内层填充材料，不过存货已经不多了！\n\n$n，帮帮我吧。如果不能按期缝制好足够数量的披风，亚当斯上尉肯定会扒了我的皮！现在正是角鹰兽换毛的季节，要塞附近的荒野上随处可见它们散落的羽毛。把你找到的羽毛都带回来交给我。",dEN="The vanguard of the Alliance force will be arriving within days. The soldiers will be expecting their winter gear to be prepared, but I've still got more cloaks to make.\n\nI've been using spotted hippogryph down for the cloaks' linings, but my stock won't last!\n\nYou've got to help me, <name>. Captain Adams will have my hide if those cloaks aren't ready in time! Bring me all the down you can find out there. It's dropped to the ground by molting hippogryphs flying over the wilderness around the fort.",o="基尔·克利瑟要你去收集10根斑点角鹰兽的羽毛。",oEN="Gil Grisert wants you to bring him 10 clumps of Spotted Hippogryph Down.",p="你有带任何羽毛来吗？我非常需要它……",pEN="Have you brought any of that down? I could really use it...",c="谢天谢地！这应该足以及时完成命令了。当然，我会等到队伍抵达才会入睡，不过那远比把亚当斯上尉惹毛来得好多了。\n\n我听他们说过他的故事！",cEN="Thank goodness! This should be enough to finish the order in time. Of course, I won't sleep until the troops arrive, but that's far better than risking Captain Adams' wrath.\n\nI've heard the stories they tell about him!"}
Q[11270]={d="我们正在慢慢消灭暴风城的北方舰队驻扎在这片海岸上的残馀部队。漂往西方的尸体暗示着这场战斗是多么的残酷。\n\n这并不妨碍我优雅的审美趣味，但却说明我们正处在危险之中。\n\n在巫妖王的领地上，死者随时可能重新站起来攻击我们。带上这根火把——你要进行净化仪式，让逝者安息。",dEN="We're slowly finishing off the remnants of Stormwind's North Fleet stationed on this coast. The bodies to the west are a testament to how brutal this confrontation has been.\n\nThis does not happen to bother my refined aesthetics, but it does present a danger to our lives.\n\nIn the lands of the Lich King, the dead are a weapon that can rise against us at any point in time. Take this torch - you're going to make sure that doesn't happen.",o="复仇港的高级执行官安希尔姆要求你到镇子的西边去，使用净化之炬净化10具尸体。",oEN="High Executor Anselm at Vengeance Landing wants you to take the Burning Torch and use it to burn 10 of the corpses littered to the west of town.",p="我不在意之前你杀过多少的巨人、龙或是狗头人。去完成这份工作，并在完成后回来这里。",pEN="I don't care how many giants, dragons or kobolds you've killed before. Get this job done and come back when you're finished.",c="我很高兴你证明了你是听从命令的人。如果我从每个身穿闪亮护甲来到这里、自以为高于指挥体系的笨蛋手中都收取一枚铜币……我看我大概已经攒了好几枚金币了。\n\n既然你已经证明你是个遵守纪律的人，我还有其它任务，更符合像你这种程度的对象。",cEN="I'm glad you've proven you can follow orders. If I had a copper piece for every arrogant fool in shiny armor to come here and think they're above the chain of command... well, I'd have a few gold.\n\nNow that you've demonstrated a measure of discipline, I have other tasks more suitable for someone of your caliber."}
Q[11271]={d="斑点角鹰兽的羽毛用途广泛，在我们的日常生活中扮演着重要的角色，从制作箭羽到仪式用的服饰都用得上这种材料。眼下正是收集绒毛的季节，可惜我们很快就要撤离冬蹄营地了，我必须抓紧最后的机会。\n\n这次迁移路途遥远，但是我相信在你的帮助下，我们有能力为所有人员配备足够的物资。局势越来越严峻了，危机随时可能降临。\n\n你可以在营地附近的地面上找到那些羽毛。",dEN="The down of the spotted hippogryph is prized by my people and used for everything from fletching to ceremonial clothing. We're making preparations to leave the post, so this is the last chance I'll get to gather it this season.\n\nWith your help, I'll have enough to make sure everyone has the equipment they need for the long trek into the hills. Conditions worsen very quickly up there and a storm can blow in without warning.\n\nThe down can be found all over the ground in the area surrounding the post.",o="冬蹄营地的安霍塔·白霜要你去收集10根斑点角鹰兽的羽毛。",oEN="Ahota Whitefrost at Camp Winterhoof wants you to bring him 10 clumps of Spotted Hippogryph Down.",p="你有收集到些羽毛吗？",pEN="Have you gathered any of the down?",c="因为你的贡献我们得以作好旅行的准备。我没什么东西可以答谢你，不过你可以从我多出来的战斗装备中选一件拿走。",cEN="With your contribution, we'll be well prepared for the journey. I haven't much to offer you for your help, but I will give you a choice of some of my spare combat gear."}
Q[11272]={d="那个精灵王子以为他可以来我的城里侮辱我的女王、杀我的人，然后全身而退？\n他以为我们会袖手旁观，看着乌特加德的部众集结起来发动进攻？\n一百万年也休想。\n你要$g直接:直接;走进乌特加德，当着可能在看的所有维库大猩猩的面杀掉他。我要让阿尔萨斯知道我们来了，而且是动真格的。\n办完之后，到乌特加德要塞里去见黑暗游侠玛拉，她会处理掉任何…\n…\n遗留问题。",dEN="This elf prince thinks he can come to my town, insult my queen, kill my men and get away with it? He thinks we're going to stand by while the hordes of Utgarde build up to launch an attack?\n\nNot in a million years.\n\nYou're going to walk right into Utgarde and kill him in front of any of these vrykul gorillas that might be watching. I want Arthas to know that we've arrived and we're playing for keeps.",o="高级执行官安希尔姆要求你进入乌特加德城堡，杀死凯雷塞斯王子。",oEN="High Executor Anselm wants you to to go into Utgarde and slay Prince Keleseth.",p="很高兴再次见到你，<name>。除非你还没杀掉那个精灵怪物，那样的话，换作是我早就走了。",pEN="It is good to see you again, <name>. Unless you haven't killed that aberration of an elf yet, in which case I'd get going if I were you.",c="复仇的感觉真好。尽管把这当作是真正复仇的开胃菜吧。\n\n阿尔萨斯将很快得到报应。只有这样我才能死而无憾。",cEN="Revenge feels good. To think that this is but a taste of what's to come.\n\nArthas will get what he deserves soon enough. Then and only then will I die a happy man."}
Q[11273]={d="该死！见鬼！就在那群怪物发动突袭之前，我们刚刚取得了一个重大的考古发现！但现在，只有我一个人活着回到了瓦加德。当前我和所有其它队员们都失去了联系，连他们的生死都不清楚，但是，无论如何，必须找回我们发掘出来的文物！\n\n如果你要去龙颅村那边的话，能不能帮我去找找我的队伍？哪怕只剩下一丝希望，我们也绝对不能放弃那些挖掘出来的东西！\n\n你可以先去找普罗伊，他是我逃跑之前见到的最后一个活人。",dEN="We were on the brink of an archaeological breakthrough when those monsters attacked! Sadly, I was the only one to make it back to Valgarde. Now I don't know if my crew is dead or alive, but the artifacts we uncovered on that dig must be found!\n\nIf you're heading into Wyrmskull Village, will you keep an eye out for my team? If there's any hope of recovering that information, we must pursue it!\n\nSearch for Pulroy first. He was the last one I saw before I made my escape.",o="在龙颅村内搜寻普罗伊。",oEN="Search Wyrmskull Village for Pulroy.",c="你找到了普尔罗伊。\n看来有点晚了。当你查看尸体时，你看到普尔罗伊死握的手里紧紧攥着一本日记。\n翻开日记，你读到的东西像是垂死矮人的潦草字迹。",cEN="You've found Pulroy. A bit too late it seems.\n\nWhile looking over the corpse you see a journal clenched tightly in Pulroy's death grip. Upon examining the journal you read what appears to be the scribbling of a dying dwarf."}
Q[11274]={d="致任何看到这篇日记的人：\n\n那群该死的怪物占领了龙颅村的遗迹。他们来这里找什么，或是说来这里的目的，这一切完全都是个谜。但无论如何，古物在这群野兽一般的人手中是绝对不安全的。\n\n塞德和我躲起来的时候，一不留神找到了一个新的线索：可以解读石板的密码表！可惜昨天晚上我俩也失散了。他手里拿着密码表，而石板在格罗菲尔德和戴加恩手里，具体在哪没人知道了……\n\n你一定要找到塞德。\n\n- 普罗伊",dEN="To whomever finds this journal:\n\nThese bloodthirsty monsters have taken up residence in the ruins of Wyrmskull. What they want or why they're here is a mystery. In any case, the artifacts are not safe with those beast-men around.\n\nZedd and I made a new discovery while hiding out: a cipher to decode the tablets! Unfortunately Zedd and I were separated late last night. He had the cipher. Tablets were with Glorenfeld and Daegarn. Location unknown...\n\nFind Zedd.\n\n-Pulroy",o="在龙颅村内搜寻塞德。",oEN="Search Wyrmskull Village for Zedd.",c="你找到塞德了。你虽然不是医生，但也看得出来塞德痊愈的希望渺茫。\n\n看起来他们好像准备把他拿去喂座狼。真可怕……",cEN="You've found Zedd. You're no doctor but the prognosis for Zedd is most assuredly negative.\n\nIt looks as if they were preparing to feed him to the worgs. Gruesome..."}
Q[11275]={d="我的族人世代以狩猎雪人为业，今年将是我首次参加狩猎活动。这很可能是我们撤离哨站前的最后一次狩猎了。\n\n营地附近的雪地上游荡着许多山羊，我必须利用它们的犄角制作一只声音宏亮的号角才能去狩猎。听长者们说，号角能模拟出雌性雪人发情时的叫声，其实我挺怀疑这个说法的。\n\n$n，帮我取回一批完好无损的犄角吧，我会从中挑选一只来制作号角。",dEN="My people have been hunting the giant yeti of these hills for generations and I will be participating for the first time this year. It will probably be the last before we leave the post forever.\n\nTo prepare for the hunt, I must fashion a loud horn from the horns of the dire rams that roam the snowy areas near our camp. The elders tell me the sound mimics the mating call of the female yeti, but I have my doubts.\n\nBring me the best dire ram horns you can find, <name>, and I'll select one from among them.",o="冬蹄营地的诺库玛·雪眼要你将6只完整的羊角交给她。",oEN="Nokoma Snowseer at Camp Winterhoof wants you to bring her 6 Undamaged Ram Horns.",p="你带着合适的角来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought any suitable horns?",c="这些都是上好的号角，<name>。\n让我看看，挑出我在狩猎中要用的那一只。\n剩下的我会给工匠们，让他们用在雕刻上。",cEN="These are all fine horns, <name>. Let me examine them and select the one I will use in the hunt.\n\nI'll give the rest to the craftsmen for use in their carvings."}
Q[11276]={d="泽德身上没有密码的踪迹。\n仔细搜查这一带之后，你发现地上写着一些字：格洛和戴伊在墓穴里。他们有密码和石板。\n也许你该前往这里正北方的墓穴，去找格洛菲尔德和戴加恩。\n横跨座狼坑的那座桥会直接把你引向通往墓穴深处的隧道。\"\n\"",dEN="There's no sign of the cipher on Zedd. After carefully searching the area you discover some writing in the dirt:\n\n\"Glor and Dae inside catacombs. Have cipher and tablets.\"\n\nPerhaps you should head into the catacombs located just north of here and search for Glorenfeld and Daegarn. The bridge crossing the worg pit will lead you right to the tunnel leading down into the catacombs.",o="在乌特加德墓穴内搜寻格罗菲尔德。",oEN="Search the Utgarde Catacombs for Glorenfeld.",c="总算来了！\n普尔罗伊和泽德都死了。\n还有戴加恩…\n…\n<格洛菲尔德摇了摇头。>被掠龙酋长带进了这些墓穴深处。\n我听见那个大块头杂种提到什么献祭给恐怖之王。\n密码就藏在戴加恩脏兮兮的胡子里。\n怎么？\n矮人总把东西藏在胡子里！\n\"\n\"",cEN="About bloody time! Pulroy and Zedd are dead.\n\nAnd Daegarn...\n\n<Glorenfeld shakes his head.>\n\nTaken by the Dragonflayer chieftain into the depths of these catacombs. I overheard that oversized mongrel mention something 'bout a sacrifice to the \"Dread King.\"\n\nThe cipher is hidden away in Daegarn's grimy beard.\n\nWhat? Dwarves hide things in their beards all the time!"}
Q[11277]={d="他们把戴加恩关在附近那座大斗技场的笼子里。据我打听到的，掠龙人会放出囚犯和他们最强的角斗士搏斗。\n然后他们把输家丢进地下室，天灾的亡灵法师就在那里把他们变成食尸鬼！太可怕了！不过先办正事！\n石板散落在这座地牢各处。在你想着当$g英雄:英雄;之前，先把它们找回来。",dEN="They're keepin' Daegarn locked up in a cage at the large fightin' ring nearby. From what I've gathered, the Dragonflayers bring out their prisoners to battle against their most powerful gladiators. They dump the losers in the basement where Scourge necromancers turn 'em into ghoulies! It's horrifying!\n\nBut first things first! The tablets are strewn about all across this dungeon. Let's get those recovered before you go off tryin' to be a hero.",o="乌特加德墓穴的格罗菲尔德要你收集10块龙颅石板。",oEN="Glorenfeld at the Utgarde Catacombs wants you to collect 10 Wyrmskull Tablets.",p="检查所有角落与缝隙！",pEN="Check every nook and cranny!",c="你干得很好，伙计。现在我们已经弄到了石板，我们可以去试着救出戴加恩，并找到密码，帮我们解开隐藏在这些古老神器背后的意义！\n\n我拿好这些石板，你去救戴加恩。",cEN="You've done well, mate. Now that we've secured the tablets we can try and save Daegarn's life and recover the cipher that will help us decode the meaning behind these ancient relics!\n\nI'll hold on to these tablets, you rescue Daegarn."}
Q[11278]={d="在发掘这些圣物的时候损失了两位最好的队员，这真是个耻辱。为了保存这些史料的安全，他们甚至付出生命的代价，太悲哀了……\n\n<格罗菲尔德将密码表与石板小心地包裹在了一块布中。>\n\n把这些带回瓦加德。接下来的事情交给米科索夫就可以了，他会知道该怎么做的。\n\n我？我不会有问题的。你就放心离开吧！",dEN="'Tis a shame we lost two of our best dwarves while uncovering these relics. They sacrificed their lives to keep this information safe.\n\n<Glorenfeld wraps the cipher and tablets in a tattered cloth.>\n\nTake these back to Valgarde. McSorf will know what to do with the find.\n\nAs for me? I'll be alright on my own. I've gotten this far in one piece!",o="将格罗菲尔德的包裹交给瓦加德港口的贝尔塔德·米科索夫。",oEN="Take Glorenfeld's Package to Beltrand McSorf at Valgarde Port.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You're back!",c="要把这些石板分类可能需要一点时间。而我先前的所有研究都说明了这里原本住着人类的祖先。那些维库人可能把他们全杀了。不管如何，等我把这些古物分类完毕后，我就会知道得更多消息。",cEN="Sorting these tablets out is going to take some time. All I can gather from a precursory study is that whatever used to be here was an ancestor of the humans. Those vrykul things probably killed 'em all off. Anyhow, we'll know more once I get these relics set up."}
Q[11279]={d="我们正在研制的这种新瘟疫太妙了，我认为应该扩大它的试验范围。拿原始雏龙试试怎么样？！想想那些可能性。能够感染的不仅是人形生物，还能把我们的触角伸向任何生物！来，我囤了一罐多余的瘟疫，就等着合适的时机和地点，而你看上去正合适。到西北方的琥珀监牢去，喷洒那些蛋，然后从孵化出来、染上瘟疫的原始雏龙身上取得样本。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="This new plague that we're working on is wonderful and I think we should expand its testing.\n\nHow about testing it on proto-whelps?!\n\nJust think of the possibilities. The ability to infect not only humanoids, but extend our reach to any creature!\n\nHere, I've hoarded an extra plague canister for the right time and place, and you look like the right person.\n\nSpray the eggs at Ember Clutch to the northwest, then get specimens from the plagued proto-whelps that hatch.",o="将10份被感染的始祖龙崽样本交给新阿加曼德的药剂师提灵哈斯特。",oEN="Plaguebringer Tillinghast has asked you to collect 10 Plagued Proto-Whelp Specimens and deliver them to him at New Agamand.",p="没有样本我要如何分辨这个最新的凋零试剂是不是可以用于其它所有的物种身上呢？",pEN="Without those samples, how am I to tell if this latest strain of the plague can be expanded for use on all sorts of creatures?",c="什么？！不，不可能。\n\n该死！\n\n这一批瘟疫除了将始祖龙变绿之外，对他们似乎没有任何实际效果！\n\n在所有接触到的生物身上使用这股瘟疫的梦想似乎又化为乌有了！",cEN="What?! No, this can't be right.\n\nCURSES!\n\nThis batch of the plague doesn't seem to have had any real effect on the proto-whelps at all other than to make them glow green!\n\nMy dream of using the plague upon anything we come into contact with seems to have gone up in smoke!"}
Q[11280]={d="等等，我有个主意！\n也许杀不死那些雏龙，是因为我们把药喷在了蛋壳外面。\n$n，我们得让瘟疫进到它们体内！\n我知道！\n我这里有些染疫的肉。\n把它带到琥珀监牢去，让它们吃下去！\n不，不对，我们想得太小了。\n让我们引一头在上空盘旋的原始龙飞下来吃掉它。\n对！\n别离开那块肉，观察会发生什么。\n没错，它可能会攻击你，但这就是进步的代价。",dEN="Wait, that gives me an idea! What if it didn't kill the whelps because it was sprayed on the outside of their eggs?\n\n<name>, we have to get the plague inside of them!\n\nI know! I've got some plagued meat here. Take it to the Ember Clutch and get them to eat it!\n\nBut no, we're thinking too small. Let's get one of the proto-drakes flying overhead to come down and eat it.\n\nYes!\n\nStay close to the meat and observe what happens. Yes, it might attack you, but such is the price of progress.",o="新阿加曼德的药剂师提灵哈斯特要你利用提灵哈斯特的特殊肉块吸引一头始祖幼龙，并观察它进食后的反应。",oEN="Plaguebringer Tillinghast at New Agamand wants you to use Tillinghast's Plagued Meat to attract down a Proto-Drake and observe its reaction to eating the stuff.",p="好啦，拿出来！我们的小实验有用吗？\n\n始祖龙喜欢它的点心吗？它有从体内开始溶解吗？",pEN="Well, out with it! Did our little experiment work?\n\nDid the proto-drake like its snack? Did it dissolve from the inside?",c="不——！\n！\n！<瘟疫使者开始哭泣。>我所有的希望…\n…\n我所有的梦想，全毁了！\n别管我，<name>。\n让我独自绝望吧。我什么都不是。\n来，你干脆把我这些身外之物都拿走吧。\n等其余的药剂师听说了我的失败，我就完了，反正也用不上这些东西了。",cEN="NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!\n\n<The plaguebringer begins to cry.>\n\nAll of my hopes... all of my dreams, ruined!\n\nLeave me, <name>. Leave me to my despair. I'm nothing.\n\nHere, you might as well take all of my worldly possessions. When the rest of the apothecaries hear of my failure, I'll be done for and won't need them anyway."}
Q[11281]={d="我在犄角上绘制了草案，但是在雕刻之前我得搞清楚它能不能正常发声。听安霍塔讲，他去了哨站东北方的瀑布测试号角。氏族的猎人世代利用寒冰瀑布的音效来测试狩猎用的号角。我真是迫不及待地想要对此有更多了解！\n\n你能帮我测试这只号角吗？如果它能正常发声的话，很可能会引来雪人，所以你最好做好战斗的准备！测试完毕后把号角带回来给我。",dEN="The horn has been roughed out, but before I make the traditional carvings, I want to be certain that it will work. Ahota tells me that he tests his horns at the foot of the frozen waterfall to the northeast of the post. Ahota tells me that our hunters have used the acoustics of frozen water in this way for generations. I can't wait to learn more!\n\nWill you help me test out the horn? If I've done everything right, you may even attract a yeti, so be prepared! Bring the horn back once you've tested it.",o="测试雕刻过的号角，然后返回冬蹄营地向诺库玛·雪眼汇报测试结果。",oEN="Test the Carved Horn and then return to Nokoma Snowseer at Camp Winterhoof with the results.",p="你有机会测试号角吗？",pEN="Did you get a chance to test that horn?",c="「诺科玛听着你关于测试的报告。」听说号角效果那么好，我松了一口气…\n…如果你说的都是真的，也许还好得过头了。\n你确定那头野兽说话了？\n如果那是真的，我不知道自己还能不能继续这场狩猎。我得跟酋长灰图腾谈谈。\n这只号角最后也许只会变成纯装饰品，但那不会减损它的价值。谢谢你所有的帮助，<name>。",cEN="<Nokoma listens to your report from the test.>\n\nI'm relieved that the horn worked so well... maybe too well if what you're saying was true. You're sure the beast spoke? I don't know if I can go on with the hunt if that's true. I'll have to speak with Chief Ashtotem about it.\n\nThis horn may end up being merely decorative, but that won't diminish its worth. Thank you for all your help, <name>."}
Q[11282]={d="等你像戈斯一样身经百战之后，你就会明白，击败敌人的最好方式就是让他们对死亡产生恐惧！\n\n但那些维库人却从来不知道什么是恐惧。你刚杀死一个，马上会冲上来另一个拿着更大号武器的……还呜呀呜呀地发出怪叫。\n\n唯一能让这帮家伙害怕的方法就是杀死他们中最厉害最邪恶的那几个。\n\n越过封锁线，杀死那些维库人，直到他们的英雄露面为止！然后将那三个人干掉，再把女王陛下的旗帜插在他们面前。这样维库人才会害怕！",dEN="When you've been in lots of fight like Gorth, you learn that to beat enemy good you have to make them really scared to die!\n\nBut these vrykuls not afraid. You kill one and another comes... screaming louder and with a bigger weapon than the one before.\n\nOnly thing that makes vrykuls afraid is when we kill the biggest and baddest vrykul of all.\n\nGo fight the Winterskorn across the blockade until hero vrykuls show up! Then you kill them dead and put queen's flag on corpses. They must learn to fear!",o="戈斯要你杀死放血者伍尔弗、恶毒的奥瑞克和贡纳·索瓦德森，并将被遗忘者旗帜插在他们面前。你需要杀死数名封锁线对面的维库人，直到他们露面。",oEN="Gorth wants you to kill Ulf the Bloodletter, Oric the Baleful and Gunnar Thorvardsson and drive the Forsaken Banner through their corpses. Slay Vrykul across the Forsaken blockade until they appear.",p="你杀死那几个维库人了？他们一定很难缠！",pEN="You kill them vrykuls? They sure is tough!",c="杀得好。我看到维库人一见希尔瓦娜斯的旗帜就吓得跌倒。对我们来说可是件好事！",cEN="You do some good killings over there. I see vrykul men fall and get stabbed with Sylvanas flag. Our side doing good!"}
Q[11283]={d="那些维库人源源不断地从西边的镇子里涌来！\n\n戈斯有个法子。你进入那个镇子，杀死那些斯克恩维库人。这样就能阻止他们了！",dEN="Them vrykuls just keeps coming and coming out from town west of here. No end in sight!\n\nGorth has an idea. You go INSIDE town and kill them Winterskorn there. THEN they stop coming here!",o="戈斯中士要你转至拜尔海姆，杀死16名斯克恩维库人。",oEN="Sergeant Gorth wants you to kill 16 Winterskorn Vrykul inside Baleheim.",p="你杀够了吗？斯克恩维库人的城镇就在对面！",pEN="You done with the killings yet? Winterskorn town right across from here!",c="你杀人的技术一定练习了很久，你几乎跟戈斯一样厉害！",cEN="You must have lots of practice with doing killings. You almost as good as Gorth!"}
Q[11284]={d="那些哨兵完全不把我当回事，你愿意帮帮我吗？我带领一群矿工在桥对面的矿洞开采矿石，为转至灰熊丘陵的远征军锻造武器。\n\n但是有只大雪人冲进了矿洞，霸占了隧道！我们尝试过高声呵斥，想要吓跑他，可这家伙就是赖着不走，连烟熏的法子都不管用。\n\n你瞧，镇子附近的雪地上生活着许多霜角山羊，或许你可以利用山羊肉诱使大雪人出洞？帮帮忙吧？我们已经被逼得走投无路了！",dEN="Maybe if the sentries won't help me, you will? I'm the foreman of the mine just across the bridge. My men are mining ore for the weapons our expeditionary force will need to carve a path into the Grizzly Hills.\n\nA giant yeti has invaded the mine, blocking the tunnel we need to expand! We've tried yelling at him and smoking him out, but nothing's worked.\n\nMaybe you could rouse it from its sleep with a meal of meat from the frosthorn rams in the snowy areas around town? Please? We're desperate!",o="维德瓦堡垒的工头科尔贝要你击败裂角。",oEN="Foreman Colbey at Fort Wildervar wants you to defeat Shatterhorn.",c="你成功了？圣光在上啊，你真是个活生生的奇迹！我正开始想要找个理由向亚当斯上尉说明，为什么他手下的武器无法准时完成！",cEN="You've done it? By the Light, you're a walking miracle! I was beginning to think I'd personally have to explain to Captain Adams why his men's weapons weren't ready in time!"}
Q[11285]={d="光杀死这些维库人还不够。我们应该烧毁他们的房子！嗯……还有桥梁。为了安全起见，还是烧掉整个镇子比较妥当！\n\n带上火把转至西边的拜尔海姆，点燃所有建筑物！狠狠地教训他们。",dEN="Killing the Winterskorns maybe not enough. Maybe we burn their houses too! Uh... and their bridges. We should burn whole town to be safe!\n\nYou take this torch. Go to Baleheim, to the west, and burn EVERYTHING! That teach them good.",o="戈斯中士要你转至拜尔海姆，使用戈斯的火把烧毁1座斯克恩民房、1座斯克恩了望塔、1座斯克恩桥梁和1座斯克恩兵营。",oEN="Sergeant Gorth wants you to go to Baleheim and use Gorth's Torch to burn 1 Winterskorn Dwelling, 1 Winterskorn Watchtower, 1 Winterskorn Bridge and 1 Winterskorn Barracks.",p="你把所有的建筑都烧完了吗？你确定没有遗留？",pEN="You done burning everything? Make sure you not leave something not burned.",c="我想你已经烧毁所有的东西了。我看到了几处没有起火……但是对戈斯来说已经很不错了。",cEN="I guess you burned everything. I see couple of spots not burning... but is close enough for Gorth."}
Q[11286]={d="我肩负着不同寻常的使命，有位老朋友在梦境中指引我来到这里。可我只看见这些小家伙用他们的机器在地面制造大洞，这让我非常生气。\n\n我看出来了，这些矮人在挖掘古器，这里埋藏的古器对我们来说有着重要的历史意义。\n\n我希望你能替我找回它们，别让那些矮人挡住你的去路。",dEN="I came out here for a different reason; an old friend of mine has been calling to me in my dreams. But now that I see these small things with their machines making a big hole in the ground, it makes my blood boil.\n\nFrom what I can see, these dwarves, as they are known, are digging up artifacts; artifacts that could be important to our past.\n\nI want you to go down there and get these things for me. Don't let any of those dwarves stand in your way.",o="将10件钢铁之门古器交给嚎风峡湾钢铁之门的先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者。",oEN="Sage Mistwalker has asked you to collect 10 Steel Gate Artifacts. When you have all of them, return to him at Steel Gate.",p="你从钢铁之门收集了多少古器？",pEN="How many artifacts have you managed to gather from this Steel Gate?",c="<先知对于你做的事赞许地点点头。>\n\n或许我会尽快找些时间好好研究一下这些古器，了解这些古器所代表的意义。\n\n但是，现在有更要紧的事情要处理。",cEN="<The sage grunts his approval at your actions on his behalf.>\n\nPerhaps I will be able to find the time soon to study these artifacts and come to an understanding of their significance.\n\nBut now there are more pressing matters to attend to."}
Q[11287]={d="$C，我的孩子拉瑞恩·迷雾行者离家有些日子了，至今没有收到他的任何音讯。这片土地危机四伏，我非常担心他的安危。\n\n他说他眼前反复显现狼的幻象，接着就带着一队远行者往西边去了，说是要寻找幻象的真相。我记得他说要去钢铁之门看看。\n\n你能帮我找到他吗？希望他平安无事。",dEN="<class>, I grow worried that my son, Sage Mistwalker, has been gone for such a long time. The land is cruel and deadly.\n\nHe spoke of a recurring vision that he had of a wolf, and went west with a small group of longrunners to seek its source. I believe the name of the place he mentioned was Steel Gate.\n\nWill you find him? I want to make sure that no ill has befallen him.",o="安卡祖母要你去寻找先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者的下落。他应该在嚎风峡湾的钢铁之门附近。",oEN="Greatmother Ankha has asked you to check on the condition of Sage Mistwalker. She believes him to be at or near Steel Gate.",c="我的母亲不应该担心我的安危，但是我感谢你的到来，陌生人。\n\n既然你来了，那么你可以替我做几件事？",cEN="My mother should not concern herself with my safety. But, I thank you for coming, stranger.\n\nSince you are here, perhaps you will help me with a few things?"}
Q[11288]={d="「埃雷斯喘着气，努力开口。\n」我是银色北伐军的使者，身负神圣的职责。我们的军队在瘟疫之地被屠杀殆尽。\n到黎明时分，那件神器被净化，重新变得纯净如新。\n为了它的救赎，太多人牺牲了……\n还有希望…\n…还有时间。\n那件神器被抛进了下方的死者巢穴，就在我们脚下深处。\n由那些毫不留情的亡者看守着。<Ares 的身体散发出刺目的光芒。>圣光…\n…\n会……\n保护…\n…你。\n|n",dEN="<Ares gasps for air as he tries to speak.>\n\nI am an envoy of the Argent Crusade, charged with a sacred duty.\n\nOur forces were decimated in the Plaguelands. By the light of dawn, the artifact was cleansed and made pure once more. So many perished in the wake of its redemption.\n\nThere is still a chance... still time.\n\nThe artifact was hurled into the den of the fallen, far below us. Guarded by the unmerciful dead.\n\n<Ares' body glows with blinding light.>\n\nLight. Will. Protect. You.",o="乌特加德墓穴的誓缚者阿瑞斯要你夺回圣器。\n\n这是一项限时任务。",oEN="Ares the Oathbound in the Utgarde Catacombs wants you to recover the Sacred Artifact.\n\nThis is a timed quest.",p="<你发现阿瑞斯失去了意识。>",pEN="<Ares is unconscious.>",c="你感觉到一股强制之力使你将这把神圣之刃放置在阿瑞斯的身旁。\n\n在放好后，你马上又感受到令人目眩的圣光。",cEN="You feel compelled to place the sacred blade next to the body of Ares.\n\nUpon doing this you are once again blinded by light."}
Q[11289]={d="「埃雷斯笑了。\n」圣光万岁。\n你做到了！\n「埃雷斯咳嗽起来。\n」带上那件神器，把它送回瓦加德。\n伊鲁伦·真刃领主想把它收回去。\n带着荣誉战斗，$g朋友:朋友;。\n永远。\n荣誉。\n「埃雷斯死去了。\n」",dEN="<Ares smiles.>\n\nGlory to the Light. You have done it!\n\n<Ares coughs.>\n\nTake the artifact and return it to Valgarde. Lord Irulon Trueblade awaits its return.\n\nFight with honor, friend. Always. Honor.\n\n<Ares dies.>",o="将圣器交给瓦加德的伊鲁伦·图布雷勋爵。",oEN="Return the Sacred Artifact to Lord Irulon Trueblade at Valgarde.",p="以圣光之名！",pEN="By the Light!",c="许许多多的人为了收回这柄剑而牺牲。唉，我担心英勇的阿瑞斯不会是最后一个。\n\n但是你替圣光行道，英雄。这把圣洁之剑将会由提里奥·弗丁大人亲自使用。即便是现在，银色北伐军依旧朝着冰冠冰川前进。弗丁大人誓言将亲自摧毁这道诅咒之地的大墙！只要有了这把剑，他就有机会能与巫妖王一搏。\n\n弗丁大人仍是我们最大的希望。",cEN="Many men and women died to recover this blade. Alas, I fear valiant Ares will not be the last.\n\nBut you do the Light's work, hero. This sacred blade will be wielded by Lord Tirion Fordring himself. Even now the Argent Crusade works toward Icecrown. Lord Fordring has vowed that he will tear down the walls of the cursed place himself! And with the blade, he just might stand a chance against the Lich King.\n\nLord Fordring remains our greatest hope."}
Q[11290]={d="我们无法获知因格瓦尔的行踪，不过从当前掌握的信息来看，亚尼斯就在龙颅村的座狼圈旁的洞穴中。\n\n你营救回来的士兵们说亚尼斯手中有掠龙作战计划。\n\n我要你返回龙颅村，夺得他们的作战计划。若是维库人阻挠你前进，就将他们统统干掉，亚尼斯也不例外！",dEN="While we were able to gather very little information as to the whereabouts of Ingvar, we do know that Yanis resides in a cave next to the worg pit inside Wyrmskull Village.\n\nIntelligence gathered from the rescued soldiers indicates that Yanis guards Dragonflayer battle plans.\n\nI need you to go back to Wyrmskull and recover those plans. Kill any vrykul that get in your way - including Yanis!",o="嚎风峡湾瓦加德港的凯勒中将要你把掠龙作战计划带给他。|n",oEN="Vice Admiral Keller at Valgarde Port in the Howling Fjord has asked that you bring him the Dragonflayer Battle Plans.",p="你找到掠龙作战计划了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the Dragonflayer battle plans?",c="<海军中将凯勒看了一眼计划的内容。>\n\n太好了！事情看起来，嚎风峡湾中还存在这更多的维库村落，一支不同的维库部族正准备袭击西部卫戍要塞。可恶，就我所知，可能已经太晚了。我已经有几天没有听到西部卫戍要塞一带的消息了。不论如何，我们一定要警告西部卫戍要塞！",cEN="<Vice Admiral Keller glances over the plans.>\n\nOutstanding! By the looks of things, there are many more vrykul villages in the fjord. A different tribe of vrykul is preparing an assault on Westguard Keep. Hell, for all I know it may already be too late. We haven't heard from Westguard in days. Either way, we must alert Westguard!"}
Q[11291]={d="<凯勒中将把作战计划卷了起来。>\n\n瓦加德港口的局势已在控制中，现在你必须带上作战计划转至位于峡湾西部峭壁的西部卫戍要塞。与飞行管理员助理艾米鲁尔·冬风谈一谈，乘坐她的狮鹫飞往西部卫戍要塞。\n\n抵达目的地后去找亚当斯上尉，他负责处理西部卫戍要塞的所有事宜。将作战计划交给他，看完之后他自然会明白要如何应付。",dEN="<Vice Admiral Keller rolls up the battle plans.>\n\nWe've got all the information we need to keep Valgarde protected. You must take these battle plans to Westguard Keep, located on the western fjord cliff wall. Speak with the flight master assistant, Emilune Winterwind. She will put you on the back of a gryphon headed towards Westguard.\n\nOnce there, find Captain Adams. He's the one in charge. Adams will know what to do with these plans.",o="把掠龙作战计划带到嚎风峡湾西卫堡的亚当斯上尉那里。|n",oEN="Take the Dragonflayer Battle Plans to Captain Adams at Westguard Keep in the Howling Fjord.",p="瓦加德没有沦陷？真是意外。\n\n一定是因为你的帮忙。肯定跟凯勒没有关系。",pEN="Valgarde has not fallen? That's a surprise.\n\nMust be due to your help. It sure wasn't because of Keller.",c="<亚当斯上尉从你手中接过计划。>\n\n我很开心你决定过来这里。我的顾问们跟我想必需要花一点时间来研读这些计划。在这一段时间内，我们会尽量利用我们可取得的帮助！",cEN="<Captain Adams takes the plans from you.>\n\nI'm glad you decided to come over. My advisors and I will need some time to study these plans. In the meantime, we can use all the help we can get!"}
Q[11292]={d="很高兴认识你。\n我从灰熊丘陵来，想和你那些同伴做生意。我的族人正在那里经营一座大型哨站，你北上的时候值得去看看。\n我在这一带的林地和雪原里布下了陷阱。\n用捕获猎物的肉和毛皮，我就能有很多货物跟镇民交换。如果你$g愿意:愿意;帮忙从陷阱里取回猎物，我可以分你一份利润。\n不过要小心：在那里的捕食者可不只你一个。",dEN="Glad to meet you. I've come here from the Grizzly Hills to do business with your cohorts. My people maintain a large outpost there, and you'd do well to visit it when you head north.\n\nI've set up traps in the woodlands and snowy areas around here. With the meat and the furs from the creatures they capture, I'll have plenty to barter with the townspeople.\n\nI can offer you a share of my profits if you're willing to help gather prey from the traps. Beware though, you won't be the only predator out there.",o="将8份被陷阱捕获的猎物交给维德瓦堡垒的猎户杰森。",oEN="Trapper Jethan at Fort Wildervar wants you to bring him 8 pieces of Trapped Prey.",p="希望你没有空手而回。我想我们之间有过协定。",pEN="I hope you haven't returned empty-handed. I thought we had a deal.",c="<猎户杰森检视了你带给他的生物。>\n\n做得很好。这些货物中有一些价格可以卖得比较好，不过我应该有足够的能和当地人交易的数量。",cEN="<Trapper Jethan inspects the creatures you've brought him.>\n\nNicely done. Some of these will fetch a better price than others, but I should have plenty to trade with the locals."}
Q[11293]={d="我们计划在美酒节上推销大麦酒。你得在银行外、军事区、探险者大厅以及秘法区的旗帜下高声叫喊。我自然会为你提供便利，喏，我的赛羊借你用4分钟哦。这根马鞭也给你。你稍微鞭打一下它就行啦，要是你抽得太厉害的话，它就会离开你。",dEN="We need to get the word out about the Barleybrews at Brewfest. You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward. I'll make things easy though, I'll lend you some racing ram reins and a racing ram for 4 minutes. Use the reins to let him go, but try not to tire him out.",o="在银行外、军事区、探险者大厅以及秘法区的旗帜下高声叫喊，宣传美酒节。",oEN="Spread the word about Brewfest at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.",p="你完成了美酒节的宣传了吗？更重要的是，你让大家知道麦酒了吗？",pEN="Have you finished spreading the word about Brewfest? But more importantly, did you let people know about the Barleybrews?",c="做得好！这样的大肆宣传一定可以增加我们的生意。\n\n这是我们答应你的报酬。麦酒总是信守承诺。\n\n噢，你可以改天再来帮忙宣传麦酒的好名声。",cEN="Well done! That kinda shouting is sure to bring business our way.\n\nAnd we promised you a reward, here it is. The Barleybrew's keep their word.\n\nOh, and come back any other day if you want to help spread the good name of Barleybrew."}
Q[11294]={d="现在是推销雷霆啤酒的大好时机。你得在银行外、军事区、探险者大厅以及秘法区的旗帜下高声叫喊。\n\n我自然会为你提供便利，喏，我的赛羊和马鞭借你用4分钟哦。\n\n你稍微鞭打一下它就行啦，铁炉堡中可没有苹果箱，我们绝对不能输给大麦酒的推销员。",dEN="It's time to let people know that the Thunderbrew have heard their cries for good brew. You need to shout at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.\n\nWe'll make it easy though. We'll lend you a ram AND some reins for 4 minutes.\n\nBe careful with going too fast though since you won't find any apple crates in Ironforge... We can't take the chance of helping out the Barleybrew messengers.",o="在银行外、军事区、探险者大厅以及秘法区的旗帜下高声叫喊，宣传美酒节。",oEN="Spread the word about Brewfest at the flags outside the bank, in the Military Ward, in the Hall of Explorers and in the Mystic Ward.",p="你让大家知道雷酒将在美酒节登场吗？",pEN="Did you let everyone know that the Thunderbrews are here at Brewfest?",c="做得好！让那些骄傲的麦酒家的人瞧瞧。\n\n这是我们承诺过的酬劳我们雷酒可是很大方的，麦酒那些家伙只是会给虚伪的承诺和假名声。\n\n你要谨慎地选择。\n\n要是你打继续这种正确的选择，你可以改天再来帮忙宣传。",cEN="Good job! That'll show those arrogant Barleybrews.\n\nWell we promised you a reward and here it is. We Thunderbrew reward you with prizes, the Barleybrew reward you with foul odors and false promises.\n\nYou chose wisely.\n\nIf you want to keep making the right choice, stop by another day and help us spread the word."}
Q[11295]={d="长久以来，我们对维库人知之甚少。几百年的各项历史记录中都没有出现过有关他们的记载。直到我们踏上这片大陆追击阿尔萨斯时，才得知了他们的存在。\n\n你带回来的这张地图非常清楚地指出，如果我们的军队想继续深入诺森德大陆，那么就必须战胜这些维库人。\n\n我手下最优秀的一名军官，憎恶戈斯当前正在负责升降机附近哨站的防务。你去协助他对拜尔海姆先行展开进攻。如果维库人想进攻我们，肯定得先从拜尔海姆出兵。",dEN="No one seems to know very much about the vrykul. Our records show no signs of activity in their lands for centuries. Yet here they are, just as we move against Arthas.\n\nThe map you retrieved makes it clear that we'll have to defeat them if our forces are to get any further into Northrend.\n\nOne of my best sergeants, an abomination known as Gorth, oversees the blockade beyond the lift. Assist him in launching a pre-emptive strike on Baleheim. If a vrykul attack occurs, it will be launched from there.",o="与复仇港西边升降机旁的哨站内的戈斯中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Sergeant Gorth at the blockade near the elevator west of Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord.",c="你是来帮忙的？很好……很好……\n\n戈斯已经厌倦了整天杀维库人。欢迎帮忙！",cEN="You come to help? Good... good...\n\nGorth was getting tired of killing vrykuls all day. Help is welcome!"}
Q[11296]={d="有什么东西——很可能就是被称为天灾的行走亡者——惊扰了这一带的生物。护送贤者到这里时，我们因为裂魂寡妇失去了大部分猎人——那些巨大而致命的蜘蛛栖息在北方的裂魂森林。我必须留在这里保护仅剩的这点人手，但你……你能去看看我那些信使是不是还活着、被困在裂魂寡妇的茧里吗？你愿意吗，$g外乡人:外乡人;？\n\n\n\n\n\n",dEN="Something, most likely the walking dead known as the Scourge, has agitated the creatures hereabouts.\n\nWhile escorting the sage here, we lost most of our hunting force to the riven widows -- huge and deadly spiders, which inhabit the Rivenwood to the north.\n\nI must stay here to protect the small force we have left, but you... you could see if my longrunners are still alive, trapped within the riven widow's cocoons.\n\nWould you do this, stranger?",o="远行者斯图卡·天云要你去营救7名冬蹄远行者，完成任务后钢铁之门向他复命。",oEN="Longrunner Skycloud has asked you to free his 7 Winterhoof Longrunners. Once you have managed to do so, return to him at Steel Gate.",p="我希望我的部队还活着。\n\n蜘蛛的刺毒并不会立刻致命——它们会让猎物活得久些，从而让那些小蜘蛛孵化后可以大快朵颐。",pEN="I hold out hope that my hunting force is still alive.\n\nThe sting of the widows is slow to be fatal. They like to keep their victims alive long enough that their babies will be able to gorge themselves when they hatch.",c="那是非常勇敢的举动，<class>。\n我原不知道你的族人也能如此无私。下次我会听从长者的警告，远离裂魂森林。\n我建议你也这么做。",cEN="That was a very brave act, <class>. I did not know that your people were capable of such selflessness.\n\nNext time I will heed the warnings of my elders and steer clear of the Rivenwood. I advise you to do the same."}
Q[11297]={d="即使是支撑着一切的大地，也无法抵挡死亡之潮的冲刷。亡者横行于其上，散播着糜烂与腐败的气息……\n\n最近有一小队远征军登上了西边那些悬崖峭壁，在低语峡谷附近创建了一座营地。你去看一看吧，$n。一定要了解他们的目的，最重要的是，他们身上可能携带着瘟疫，一定要阻止瘟疫传染进我们的土地，明白吗？从这里向西南方朝着悬崖前进，一直走到海岸旁，大概就可以找到他们了。那座应该营地就在钢铁之门的挖掘场西边。",dEN="Even the earth cannot hold back the tide of death washing over it. Corpses walk the land, spreading their putrefaction with alarming speed.\n\nA small expedition has made its way up the western cliffs and rests near Whisper Gulch. Take a look for yourself, <name>. See if you can learn their purpose and dissuade them from bringing their poisons into our lands. Travel southwest from the post, toward the cliffs overlooking the western beach. Their camp will be west of the excavation at Steel Gate.",o="与药剂师营地的药剂师玛尔苏斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Apothecary Malthus at the Apothecary Camp.",c="啊，没错，独居在北边的牛头人——我曾经看过他们躲躲藏藏的，他们还以为没被发现。我猜他们还以为这片大陆是他们的？不过这些不提也罢。\n\n我不期盼有任何的同伴，不过既然你都来这进行那个愚蠢的任务了，你应该做点有用的事。",cEN="Ah, yes, the reclusive bison-men of the north. I've seen them skulking about, believing themselves unseen. I suppose they fancy this land theirs? Well, that's but one of many things that will change shortly.\n\nI wasn't expecting any company, but while you're here on that fool's errand, you might as well make yourself useful."}
Q[11298]={d="东南方有一片地区叫作低语峡谷，那里聚集了一群探险者协会的矮人，好吧，这不是重点。重点是，他们都疯了，完全疯了！他们竟然主动攻击我们的补给车队，抢走了所有的物资。\n\n我一直在想弄清楚他们为什么疯成这样！当前来看，我怀疑他们的酒有问题。嗯嗯，我得再仔细研究研究，这样，你去给我偷几桶酒回来。对，趁他们忙着挖来挖去的时候动手就可以了。",dEN="To the southeast is an area called Whisper Gulch. It's overrun with members of the Explorers' League who've gone mad! They attacked our caravan as it passed through the area, and they've harried our foraging parties as well.\n\nI must know what's causing this madness! I suspect that whatever they're drinking from the kegs scattered around the gulch contributes to their insanity. I want you to steal the kegs from those dwarves while they're busy mining away.",o="将5只矮人酒桶交给药剂师营地的药剂师玛尔苏斯。",oEN="Apothecary Malthus at the Apothecary Camp wants you to bring him 5 Dwarven Kegs.",p="你拿到那些酒桶了没？",pEN="Did you get those kegs or not?",c="<药剂师给自己倒了一大杯饮料。>\n\n好吧，我要喝了！",cEN="<The apothecary pours out a tankard of the beverage for himself.>\n\nWell, here I go!"}
Q[11299]={d="收集石板的时候，我估计你已经见过关押戴加恩的那个房间了。对，就是穿过这条走廊然后走下楼梯那里。关押戴加恩的房间应该就在楼梯下面，但估计锁得很严实！\n\n去找他吧。至少，你得把密码表从他那里拿过来。",dEN="You might have already seen the room where Daegarn is being held while you were gatherin' the tablets. It's through this corridor and then down a set of steps. Daegarn will be in the room at the bottom of the steps - locked up tight!\n\nGet down there and find him. At the very least you might be able to get the cipher from him.",o="在乌特加德墓穴的审判竞技场中找到戴加恩。",oEN="Find Daegarn in the Ring of Judgement located inside the Utgarde Catacombs.",c="呀，你找到我了。呀哈！\n\n但没有，我没有密码。那些野兽第一个检查的就是我的胡子！沃鲁夫才是有密码的那个人。他是斗士的首领。",cEN="Yep. You found me. Woopedy-do!\n\nAnd no, I don't have the cipher. My beard was the first thing those beasts checked! Oluf's the one that's got it now. He's the chieftain of the gladiators."}
Q[11300]={d="只要你打败他们的那一票角斗士，沃鲁夫就会亲自下场了。这恐怕是拿回密码表的唯一方法。上吧，杀进审判竞技场，杀得他们片甲不留！要是拿回了密码表，你就直接到入口那边去找格罗菲尔德。\n\n我？别管我了！我们马上就要找到人类物种演变过程中遗失的那一环了！",dEN="Oluf will come out if you defeat the other gladiators. That's 'bout the only way we're getting' that cipher back. Put on your whompin' boots and get busy in the Ring of Judgement. If you do manage to get the cipher back, return it to Glorenfeld o'er near the entrance to these catacombs.\n\nMe? Don't worry about me! We're on the brink of discovering the missing link to human-kind!",o="击败审判竞技场内的所有角斗士，然后挑战残暴的沃鲁夫。击败沃鲁夫并夺回古代密码表。\n\n将古代密码表交给乌特加德墓穴入口处的格罗菲尔德。",oEN="Defeat the gladiators at the Ring of Judgement and face Oluf the Violent. Defeat Oluf and recover the Ancient Cipher.\n\nReturn the Ancient Cipher to Glorenfeld at the entrance to the Utgarde Catacombs.",p="戴加恩？密码表？",pEN="Daegarn? The cipher?",c="太神奇了！真的有人在审判这些东西？到什么程度？！又有什么目的？\n\n好吧，别在意那些鬼扯了。总有人能解开这些东西。我们拿回了密码表和石板——而这场灾难只有两个人牺牲。",cEN="Fascinating tale! Something is actually judgin' these things? To what end?! For what purpose?\n\nWell, never mind that nonsense. Someone else can figure out that stuff. We got the cipher and the tablets back - and only two fatalities in the whole ordeal."}
Q[11301]={d="是不是玛尔苏斯又把你抓过去灌输那些所谓的啤酒桶和疯矮人的奇幻故事啦？\n\n以科学的观点看来，我固然不否认那些矮人确实是疯了，但我深刻质疑偷盗啤酒的正当性及其对科学研究的贡献程度。\n\n科学研究真正需要的是头脑，你明白吗？我们要揭开表面现象看本质，或许……能直接发现某种可用于研究的材料。\n\n拿上这把锯子转至东南方的低语峡谷，先把那些疯矮人干掉，然后采集他们的……嗯……样本。",dEN="Has Malthus drawn you in with his blather about beer kegs and crazy dwarves?\n\nI'm not questioning that the dwarves are crazy, but I don't think stealing their beer is going to do any good.\n\nWhat we need is brains. Lots of brains. We'll get down to the bottom of this mystery in no time, and perhaps even find a new component for the plague.\n\nTake this saw, go southeast into the Whisper Gulch, and kill yourself some dwarves. Use the saw to help you harvest the brains and bring them back here.",o="将12份疯狂探险者的“样本”交给药剂师营地的药剂师葛瑞克。",oEN="Apothecary Grick at the Apothecary Camp wants you to bring him 12 Deranged Explorer Brains.",p="你拿到了那些“样本”了吗？如果没有的话我要把锯子要回来了。你最好不要想把锯子给带走。",pEN="Did you get those brains? If not, I want my saw back. You'd better not walk off with that saw.",c="这些大脑太美了！简直华丽！\n正是我需要的东西。\n谢谢你的帮助，<name>。现在我要让马尔萨斯看看他那副啤酒眼镜看不出真相。",cEN="These brains are beautiful! Gorgeous, even! They're exactly what I need.\n\nThank you for your help, <name>. Now I'll show Malthus the truth his beer goggles couldn't reveal."}
Q[11302]={d="我们第一次到达这附近为要塞选址的时候，曾经在北边的两处林地附近遇到了一些怀有敌意的生物。再后来，我们穿越镇子南边的那块被冰雪复盖的林地时，又遇到了几只饶有兴趣地观察着我们的树妖。不过，跟北边那些林地里的不同，她们没有攻击我们。\n\n当时，我们被这里的鬼天气折磨得晕头转向，而且又饿又累，她们完全可以不费吹灰之力就把我们杀个精光，可她们没有那么做。\n\n或许我们应该主动和她们接触一下，去争取所有能够争取到的盟友？你愿意转至冰雪林地，向她们表达我们的友善之意吗？",dEN="When we first scouted locations for the fort, we encountered hostile creatures at two of the glades here in the north. When we passed the snow-covered one directly south of the town, the dryads there watched us with interest, but did not attack.\n\nWe were tired and worn down by the weather. They could've easily killed several of our men, but they didn't.\n\nPerhaps, in reaching out to them, we might discover unexpected allies. Are you willing to travel to the Frozen Glade and make contact with them?",o="与冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lurielle at the Frozen Glade.",c="「露丽尔听着你的自我介绍。\n」终于见到你真是太好了，<name>。我们很久以来就希望你和其他的新来者能派出代表。\n我们很少冒险走出林间空地的边界，尤其是在大地正经历这些变化的时候。",cEN="<Lurielle listens as you introduce yourself.>\n\nIt is good to finally meet you, <name>. We have long hoped that you and the other newcomers might send representatives. We don't often venture beyond the borders of our glades, especially amid the changes the land is going through."}
Q[11303]={d="拜尔海姆的维库人已经彻底失败了，毫无疑问。可是他们的首领还藏在镇上，拒绝投降。\n\n戈斯已经派林德尔和他的刺客到西北方去埋伏了。你去和林德尔说话，告诉他怎么把维库人指挥官引出来。杀了他。你一定要杀了他。",dEN="The vrykuls in Baleheim is completely defeated, no doubt about it. But still their leader stays in town and won't give up.\n\nGorth sends Lydell and his assassins to make good ambush to the northwest. You talk to Lydell and figure out how to get Vrykul chieftain to come out. Then you kill him. You kill him real good.",o="转至林德尔的伏击点，与林德尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Lydell at Lydell's Ambush.",c="我们全都出席了宴会，但“贵客”却待在家里。",cEN="We all showed up to the party, but the guest of honor stayed at home."}
Q[11304]={d="复仇港这里的实验装备恐怕不是最好的。毕竟，这里只是一座小小的军港而已。\n\n我需要你帮我将这份菌株样品交给新阿加曼德的首席药剂师哈瑞斯。沿拜尔海姆外面的路向南走，沿着路走到西边就可以到达那里了。\n\n你必须尽快把样品送过去，$n。我们的敌人每天都在变强，数量上我们也不再有任何优势。所以，我们必须发展出一种真正可靠的武器来应对他们的挑战！",dEN="I'm afraid our equipment isn't exactly the best here at Vengeance Landing. After all it's a military controlled outpost.\n\nI will need you to take a sample of this strain to Chief Plaguebringer Harris in New Agamand, follow the road beyond Baleheim south and then west. They have better equipment there - he will know what to do.\n\nYou must hurry, <name>. Our enemies are stronger and more numerous than us. We need to develop a viable weapon against them!",o="转至嚎风峡湾西部的新阿加曼德，将雷杉德尔的菌株交给首席药剂师哈瑞斯。",oEN="Bring Lysander's Strain to Chief Plaguebringer Harris in New Agamand in western Howling Fjord.",p="是的，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="这个菌株绝对不是没有价值，朋友！那些复仇港的蠢蛋老早就把答案含在嘴里了！",cEN="This strain is far from worthless, my friend! Those fools at Vengeance Landing have had all the answers right under their own noses!"}
Q[11305]={d="我们已经在一处叫哈尔格林德的维库人村落里连续散布了好几周的药剂了，但还是出了一些问题。\n\n$n，从当前的试验结果来看，几乎所有物种都会受到药剂影响，但由于环境变化，难免会携带不少杂质。因此我们需要配制出能对维库人生效的新的配方。\n\n在我们攻陷哈尔格林德时，维库人酋长逃出了村子。你可以在西边找到他。作为掠龙氏族的首领，他的样本非常理想。",dEN="We've been spraying down the vrykul village of Halgrind for weeks now and the vrykul just won't drop dead.\n\nLet's face it, <name>, by now our Plague has been exposed to humans, dwarves, dogs, livestock... you name it. As our strains adapt to their hosts, more impurities get thrown in the mix. What we need is a strain made custom for the vrykul's biology.\n\nHalgrind's chieftain fled the town after we took it over; you'll find him west of here. As a patriarch of the Dragonflayer clan, his blood is ideal.",o="转至托尔瓦德的营地，从托尔瓦德身上取得掠龙族长的样本，将它交给新阿加曼德的首席药剂师哈瑞斯。",oEN="Obtain the Dragonflayer Patriarch's Blood from Thorvald at Thorvald's Camp and bring it to Chief Plaguebringer Harris in New Agamand.",p="你拿到我需要的样本了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the sample I require, <name>?",c="这就可以了。现在是做点真正药剂师工作的时候了，<name>！",cEN="This will do. It's time for some real apothecary work now, <name>!"}
Q[11306]={d="到当前为止，你做得都很不错，$n。接下来我要教给你一些更深入的技术和知识，帮助你更好地了解你的任务。\n\n拿着这只空瓶子，到我左边的坩埚里去盛一些液体来，然后把它和我右边的那些药剂样本混合起来，仔细调配比例，直到你获得了一种完美均衡的混合溶液为止。",dEN="You've done well so far, <name>. I'd like to teach you some of my more advanced techniques, so that you gain a better understanding of the plague.\n\nTake this empty flask and fill it with blood from the cauldron to my left. Mix it with the plague samples to my right until you obtain a well balanced mix.",o="在大锅旁装满药剂师的空瓶，然后在其中混入哈瑞斯的药剂样本，最终调制出一瓶均衡的溶液。\n\n完成调制任务后向首席药剂师哈瑞斯复命。",oEN="Fill the Empty Apothecary's Flask at the Cauldron of Vrykul Blood, then mix the Flask of Vrykul Blood with Harris's Plague Samples nearby until you've obtained a Balanced Concoction.\n\nReturn to Chief Plaguebringer Harris when you've completed this task.",p="你的实验进展如何，<name>？如果你对所涉及的学问有什么疑问，尽管问！",pEN="How is your experiment going, <name>? Let me know if you have any questions behind the science involved!",c="太好了！\n你是个聪明的学生，<name>。现在到了有趣的部分。\n投放！",cEN="Excellent! You are an apt pupil, <name>.\n\nNow comes the fun part. Deployment!"}
Q[11307]={d="现在已经制造出专门为维库人调配的新药剂了，如果一切顺利，接触到药剂喷雾之时，他们就可以到地狱同他们的依米伦王相见了。\n\n哈尔格林德就在这里的正北方，我们的药剂师以前就在那里做过研究，应该不难找。",dEN="Now that we have a strain of the plague that has adapted to vrykul carriers, we really ought to test it on our specimens in Halgrind. If all goes according to plan, they will disintegrate immediately as the plague devours their innards!\n\nYou will find Halgrind north of here. Our plaguebringers are deploying the previous strain there - shouldn't be hard to spot.",o="潜入哈尔格林德，找到10名被感染的掠龙维库人并使用药剂喷雾。",oEN="Venture into Halgrind and use the Plague Spray on 10 Plagued Dragonflayer Vrykul. Return to Chief Plaguebringer Harris to report the results.",c="瘟疫没有把我们的实验体分解掉？你确定吗，<name>？？\n！一定是有什么外部因素我们没有考虑到……也许是这里气候的低温？\n也许……是菌株的变异！",cEN="The plague didn't disintegrate our subjects? Are you certain, <name>??!\n\nThere must be an external factor we're not accounting for... perhaps the low temperatures of this climate? Perhaps... a mutation in the strain!"}
Q[11308]={d="作为一个非常务实的人，我要宣布我们在这里的研究取得了成功。说到底，哪支军队经不起让士兵自相残杀呢？\n我很快就会把我们的成就传遍复仇港。但首先我需要你处理一下我们的实验场。\n去找锯子珍妮，让她给你定制一头憎恶。要那种带点爆炸力的…\n…你懂我的意思。\n\"\"",dEN="Being the practical man that I am, I'm going to declare our research here a success. After all, what army can't be stopped by turning its rank and file against each other?\n\nI will send word of our achievements to Vengeance Landing soon enough. But first I need you to take care of cleaning up our experimentation site.\n\nSee \"Hacksaw\" Jenny about making you a custom abomination. One packing some explosive power if you catch my drift.",o="到新阿加曼德与锯子珍妮谈谈。\"\"",oEN="Speak to \"Hacksaw\" Jenny in New Agamand.",c="你想要什么？没看见我正忙着吗？",cEN="What do you want? Can't you see I'm in the middle of something?"}
Q[11309]={d="所以哈里斯想要点能拆房的东西，嗯？\n行，我能帮上忙。不过你得给我弄些零件来。\n我可不能把精选的材料浪费在一个会炸成碎片的东西上。\n首先，我需要铲角兽的韧带……\n比人类的好用多了。\n我还需要一磅肉。一个叫安东的家伙卖的肉很便宜。\n他常在西边那条路上来往。",dEN="So Harris wants a demolition job, eh? Yeah, I can help out.\n\nYou're gonna have to get me some parts, though. I can't afford to use up my choice components on something that's gonna get blown up.\n\nFirst of all, I'm going to need shoveltusk ligaments... way better than the human kind.\n\nI will also need a pound of flesh. A fellow known as Anton sells cheap meat. He travels up and down the road to the west.",o="新阿加曼德的锯子珍妮要你取得6条铲角兽韧带和1份一磅重新鲜肉。\"\"",oEN="\"Hacksaw\" Jenny in New Agamand wants you to obtain 6 Shoveltusk Ligaments and 1 Fresh Pound of Flesh.",p="你收集到我要的材料没有？",pEN="You get my components yet?",c="太棒了！没错，没错，这些正好！",cEN="Excellent! Yes, yes, these will do just fine!"}
Q[11310]={d="完成了，给你！我们的这个新朋友可能会有点……怎么说呢，不稳定。所以我建议你在抵达哈尔格林德前不要把它放出来。\n\n一旦你抵达那里，用这只憎恶在维库人最多的地方“转一圈”，然后直接自爆，就行了，轻松愉快。\n\n之后，你要记得把所有剩下来的“零件”给我带回来，没准还能有别的用处呢！",dEN="Well, here you are! Our friend's going to be somewhat... unstable. So I suggest not putting him together until reaching Halgrind.\n\nOnce you're there, use the abomination to round up as many vrykul as you can before self-destructing.\n\nCome back with whatever's left once you're done. I can always use more body parts!",o="在哈尔格林德使用憎恶组装包，用你那只无脑憎恶聚拢染疫的维库人。至少杀死20个，完成后回新阿加曼德找锯子珍妮。\"\"",oEN="Use the Abomination Assembly Kit in Halgrind and round up plagued Vrykul with your Mindless Abomination. Slay at least 20 and return to \"Hacksaw\" Jenny in New Agamand when you're done.",p="你清理干净哈尔格林德了吗？",pEN="Are you done with the cleanup in Halgrind?",c="干得好，<name>。我说，你不是在找点更……长期的事做吧？我这儿可真需要点帮手！",cEN="Great job, <name>. Say, you wouldn't be looking for something more... permanent, would ya? I could sure use some help around these parts!"}
Q[11311]={d="要在这样恶劣的环境下生存，就必须像我们一样敢于接受自然的挑战。北部雪山中元素生物的数量急速增长，稍微放松警惕的话，它们就能要了你的命。\n\n在撤离营地之前，我们计划再次缩减它们的势力范围，就算是为自然界的平衡尽最后一份心力吧。你也瞧见啦，这次迁移还有许多准备工作没有做，你能不能帮帮我们呢？\n\n我要你杀死营地附近雪山中的咆哮的旋风或是碎冰元素。",dEN="If you are to survive here, as we have, you must learn to face the environment's challenges head on. The elements will claim your life if you're not vigilant, as the proliferation of elementals in these northern hills shows.\n\nWe must cull the elementals one last time before we can leave this place. Are you willing to aid us while we continue to make preparations?\n\nYou must kill any iceshard elementals or howling cyclones you encounter in the snowy hills surrounding the outpost.",o="冬蹄营地的驯风者卡根要你杀死附近雪山中的8个元素生物，咆哮的旋风或是碎冰元素都可以。",oEN="Wind Tamer Kagan at Camp Winterhoof wants you to kill 8 mountain elementals. You may kill either Howling Cyclones or Iceshard Elementals.",p="你削减了那些元素的数量了吗？",pEN="Have you culled the elementals?",c="元素生物的影响开始褪去，但它们还是会回来。我们已经争取了足够的时间，让我们得以完成在此地的任务并且离开。",cEN="The influence of the elemental spirits has receded, but it will return. We've bought ourselves the time we need to complete our tasks here and take our leave."}
Q[11312]={d="世代以来，我们的同胞都是听着那些飞舞在原野之上、腾跃在林地之间的冰之妖精的传说长大的。小时候，我也曾忽视父母的劝告，试图去冒险，去寻找她们的身影，结果却是我差点被冻死在荒野上。\n\n如今，想要找到她们倒是不用再梳遍整片森林了。不知为什么，她们决定揭开神秘的面纱，与我们直接交流。或许……与这片森林所发生的剧变有关。你现在立刻转至东南方，到冰雪林地去找到那些妖精。不过要小心，路上要直接穿过扭曲之林，那里很危险。",dEN="For generations, my people have told tales of frost nymphs cavorting in glades hidden away in the wilderness. I used to search for them as a child, against the advice of my parents, until I nearly froze to death.\n\nThese days, it isn't necessary to comb the forests for them. They've decided to reveal themselves for reasons I can only guess, but I don't think the change can be ignored. Venture southeast to the Frozen Glade and seek out the nymphs, but beware; you will pass the Twisted Glade on your way.",o="与冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lurielle at the Frozen Glade.",c="「露丽尔听着你的自我介绍。\n」很高兴认识你，<class>。我的姐妹们常常替我们留意在林间搜寻的牛头人，但我们的女王禁止我们与外来者往来。\n你现在能见到我们，只是因为大地变得不安，我的许多姐妹都身处危险。",cEN="<Lurielle listens as you introduce yourself.>\n\nIt is good to meet you, <class>. My sisters have often watched the taunka search the forests for us, but we are forbidden by our queen from interacting with outsiders. You only see us now because the land has become unsettled and many of my sisters are in danger."}
Q[11313]={d="原本，环绕在这片林地周围的冰元素都是我们最忠实的伙伴，可是现在，一股暴烈与毁灭的力量横扫了整片大地，竟将它们变成了敌人！\n\n我与姐妹们最痛苦的经历也不过如此了。为了抓住最后一丝希望，我们甚至放弃了从不与外界接触的律令，寻求你的帮助。只有你才能帮助我们抵抗这腐蚀着林地、并毒害着姐妹们的枯萎与凋零！\n\n我们已经从那些冰元素的尸体上收集了一些核心，而且一直妥善地保存着。或许依靠这些核心，我们可以让它们复生！你也愿意帮忙收集吗？",dEN="The ice elementals surrounding our glade were once our companions, but a volatile and destructive force has swept through the land, turning them against us!\n\nThis is but one of the horrors my sisters and I have endured. We have revealed ourselves to you in the hope that you will help us stave off the decay that has crept into our glades and poisoned our sisters!\n\nWe've been gathering the cores of the ice elementals and keeping them safe so that one day, we might be able to restore them. Will you help?",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要求你为她带回15块冰冷核心。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to bring her 15 Icy Cores.",p="你拿到冰冷核心了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered any of the cores?",c="「露丽尔默默地从你手中接过核心。」谢谢你，<name>。「露丽尔悲伤地看着那些冰冷的核心。」我保证，我的朋友们，我会尽我所能让你们复原。\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="<Lurielle accepts the cores from you quietly.>\n\nThank you, <name>.\n\n<Lurielle glances at the icy cores sadly.>\n\nI promise, my friends, I will do all I can to restore you."}
Q[11314]={d="西南边有一片林地，过去它与这里几乎一模一样。然而，神秘的力量与诡秘的魔法在不久之前把那里彻底改变了。现在，那片林地已经摆脱了正常气候的制御，变得不再寒冷，而生活在那里的姐妹们，也被这种改变逼入了疯狂的深渊。\n\n甚至当我们尝试去接近她们的时候，还被她们攻击了！恐怕她们当中大多数都已经无法挽救了，但我不能放弃希望！\n\n带上我的坠饰，转至西南方的活力之林，试试使用它拯救我的姐妹们。",dEN="To the southwest was a glade that used to look much like this one. Mysterious forces and alien magics are reshaping the land. The glade has thawed, the sisters living there driven mad by the sudden change.\n\nWe thought to reach out to them, but they attacked us. I fear many may be beyond saving, but I cannot give up hope.\n\nTake my pendant, travel southwest to the Vibrant Glade, and use it to try to free my sisters.",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要你对7只冰冷树妖使用她的坠饰。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to use her pendant on 7 Chill Nymphs.",p="你有办法用我的坠饰治疗姐妹们吗？",pEN="Were you able to heal any of my sisters using the pendant?",c="所以我的姐妹们还有希望？\n\n<鲁莉尔蕾的目光从你身上离开，望向了地面。>\n\n没有早点想到使用坠饰让我充满了罪恶感。我们得救出更多的姐妹们。",cEN="So there is hope for my sisters?\n\n<Lurielle looks away from you, then down at the ground.>\n\nI feel guilty for not thinking of the pendant sooner. We might have saved even more of the sisters."}
Q[11315]={d="西南方活力之林内的姐妹们过去一直很喜欢那些缤纷绚丽而又卓然天成的血色常青藤，甚至一直把那些藤条当作床。然而，那种将她们逼疯的神秘力量同样也改变了这些可怜的植物。\n\n现在，这些原本温和的植物疯狂生长了起来。它们的茎变成了鞭子一般的荆棘，随时都会将任何试图接近的人紧紧地缠绕起来，并无情地绞杀。因此，在夺回林地之前，我们必须先驯服这些植物，或者……把它们全部连根铲除！\n\n去吧，尽你的全力清理这些植物。它们已经完全失去了大自然的控制。",dEN="The sisters who lived in the Vibrant Glade, to the southwest, used to tend to gorgeous beds of scarlet ivy, but the same force that has driven them mad has transformed their beloved ivy.\n\nThe vines now grasp at the feet of the unwary, or lash at any who approach the glade. Before we can reclaim the glade, the vines must be tamed and uprooted.\n\nClear as much of the ivy as you are able. It has already begun to grow out of control.",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要求你杀死8只血色常青藤。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to kill 8 Scarlet Ivy.",p="你从活力之林回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned from the Vibrant Glade?",c="谢谢你的帮助，<name>。生机林间空地曾是一处美丽的地方，等我们回到那里，我们会让它重新美丽起来。",cEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. The Vibrant Glade was once a beautiful place, and when we return to it, we shall make it so again."}
Q[11316]={d="在这里的西边，也有一处林地被神秘的魔法力量变成了极为可怕的地方。现在，我们称那里为扭曲之林。那里的树林中，岩石后，池塘里，突然多出了无数凶猛可怖的野兽。\n\n我不知道这些野兽是从哪里来的，也不知道究竟是什么力量在操纵着它们，但我知道，我们必须要消灭它们！\n\n如果继续让它们统治那片林地，那里一定会被毒化得无法挽回。清除那些生物，为我的姐妹们复仇！",dEN="The glade to the west has been transformed into a hideous place called the Twisted Glade. Horrible beasts dwell among the trees, stones, and pool of the glade.\n\nI cannot guess where the creatures came from or what horrible forces animate them, but they must be dealt with!\n\nI fear that if they are allowed to dominate the glade, they will poison it beyond redemption. Clear the glade of these creatures who murdered our sisters.",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要求你杀死10只棘藤爬行者。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to kill 10 Thornvine Creepers.",p="你有亲眼看到扭曲林地的惨状吗？",pEN="Have you seen the horrors of the Twisted Glade for yourself?",c="你做得很好，<name>。如果在大地开始变化时我们就有像你这样的盟友，也许我们还能保住一些已经失去的东西。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. If we'd had allies like you when the land first began to change, perhaps we might have been able to preserve some of what we've lost."}
Q[11317]={d="我们敢于进入裂木森林都是因为我那杂乱无章的梦。最近我总是在做噩梦，内容都是关于我的座狼朋友——乌尔芬。他在寻求帮助，你必须赶快去帮助他。\n\n不过你既不懂得座狼的语言，也无法安全地在座狼群中穿行。别担心，我有个法子。\n\n首先，你必须通过冥想来净化你的灵魂。\n\n在冬蹄营地东北方的霜刃峰顶有一座神龛，沿着西边山脚的道路往上走就到了。\n\n在那里进行冥想，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="We braved the Rivenwood because of my troubled dreams concerning my worg life-friend, Ulfang. He has called out for help, and you must go to him.\n\nBut, you do not have the means to speak with him, or walk amongst the other worgs. I know a way.\n\nFirst, you must cleanse your inner turmoil.\n\nThere is a shrine that sits at the top of Frostblade Peak, northeast of Camp Winterhoof. A single path leads up to it from the western base of the mountain.\n\nMeditate there and then return to me.",o="钢铁之门的先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者建议你转至霜刃神龛，通过冥想净化你内心的杂念。",oEN="Sage Mistwalker at Steel Gate has advised you to cleanse yourself of Your Inner Turmoil through meditation at the Frostblade Shrine.",p="你在神龛找到了内心的平静吗？你的杂念消除了吗？",pEN="Did you find inner peace at the shrine? Is your turmoil gone?",c="我可以感受到你的变化。\n\n你准备好进行下一步了吗？",cEN="Already I can sense the change within you.\n\nAre you ready for what comes next?"}
Q[11318]={d="所以你想试试赛羊？\n希望你$g准备:准备;好迎接那速度了。不过在你出丑之前，你得先向我证明你能驾驭这些生物。\n计划是这样的：我借你一副赛用缰绳，让你骑上一头公羊。\n你要向我证明你会骑。让它小跑、慢跑和疾驰各保持8秒。\n如果你需要关于如何操控公羊的说明，去问我的学徒波尔·琥珀之踝。",dEN="So you want to check out the racing rams? Well I hope you're ready for speed. BUT before I let you loose in the world, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine creatures.\n\nSo here's the deal: I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.\n\nKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each. If you need instructions how to handle the ram, talk to my apprentice, Pol Amberstill.",o="你有4分钟时间驾驭赛羊，让它保持三种不同的速度各8秒。",oEN="You have 4 minutes to ride the ram and maintain 3 different levels of speed for 8 seconds.",p="你能够掌控速度吗？",pEN="Were you able to handle the speed?",c="干得不错！掌握公羊的操控需要时间。但一旦你掌握了，你会希望每头公羊都是赛羊。\n什么？我的奖赏呢？哈哈哈…\n…你骑上了最快的公羊！还想要更多？\n那这样如何……你得到的奖赏是有机会在美酒节期间帮助其他人。\n对一个热心年轻的赛羊骑手来说，活儿和奖赏都多得很。\"\"",cEN="Nice work there! It takes time to get the hang of controlling your ram. But once you do, you'll wish every ram was a racing ram.\n\nWhat's that? \"Where's my reward?\" Ha Ha Ha... you got to ride the fastest ram around! You want more? Well how about this...\n\nYou've been rewarded with the chance to help other people around Brewfest. There's plenty of work, and rewards, for an eager, young, ram racer."}
Q[11319]={d="西北边有一处现在被称为扭曲之林的地方，过去它曾是一群丛林守护者的家园。那时候，他们和姐妹们一起维护着附近林地的和平与安宁。\n\n然而，当林地被魔法力量改变时，那里的姐妹们都死去了，可不知为什么，这些守护者却存活了下来，并沦为了邪恶力量的奴仆，转而在林地里播撒着剧毒植物的种子。这些种子具有强烈的侵占性，甚至会剥夺其它健康植物的生命力，令它们完全无法生存。\n\n我会给你一颗冰元素的冰冷核心，当你摧毁了一颗孢子之后，你必须用冰冷核心将其冻住，阻止它再生。",dEN="The glade to the northwest, now the Twisted Glade, used to be home to a number of keepers of the glade. Together with the sisters, they saw to the glade's upkeep.\n\nWhen the glade changed, the sisters died, but somehow the keepers managed to survive. Now, they seed the land with poisonous spores that wither healthy greenery.\n\nI'll give you one of the cores from the ice elementals. Once you've destroyed a spore, use the ice crystal to freeze it and keep it from regenerating.",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要求你冻结8个孢子。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to freeze 8 Spores.",p="这个扭曲的林地是个可怕的地方。我从没想过我们的家会变成这么恶心的东西。",pEN="The Twisted Glade is a terrible place. I never imagined our homes could become something so loathesome.",c="寒冰核心很有用？我得记下来。不过我也知道守护者不会因为我们破坏了他们的心血一次就停手。",cEN="The ice core worked well for you? I'll have to remember that. I'm certain the keepers will not stop just because we've destroyed their work once."}
Q[11321]={d="美酒节除了赛羊会外，还有一项传统，那就是饮酒狂欢！如果你有时间的话，就将这张礼品券交给贝尔比吧。她就在美酒节营地的后面。要是你看不见她，没关系，她一定会看见你的。\n\n无论如何，将礼品券交给她，你就能免费领到一只美酒节酒杯。她还出售各种美酒哦。",dEN="Brewfest isn't just about racing rams, it's also about drinking! When you have a moment, take this voucher to Belbi Quikswitch. She's near the back of the Brewfest camp. If you can't see her, don't worry, she'll be sure to see you.\n\nIn any case, take this voucher to her to get your free Brewfest stein. She'll also be more than happy to handle any and all other Brewfest transactions.",o="在美酒节营地的贝尔比处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Belbi Quikswitch in the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="噢，只是张酒杯兑换券……说不定你还花了一番力气才弄来。好吧，这是你今年的酒杯。\n\n不过我猜我应该还会常常再看到你。无论如何，要是想兑换美酒节奖卷，你找我就对了……\n\n或他找我……\n\n噢噢喔……或是他……",cEN="Aww, it's just a stein voucher... Maybe you're just playing hard to get. So here's this years stein for you.\n\nBut I suspect I'll be seeing a lot more of you. After all, if you want any Brewfest tickets redeemed, I'm your girl...\n\nor maybe I'm his girl...\n\nooohhh.... or his..."}
Q[11322]={d="最近我一直在做噩梦，梦中频频出现一头名叫乌尔芬的座狼。他需要帮助，你必须找到他。\n\n不过你既不懂得座狼的语言，也无法安全地在座狼群中穿行。别担心，我有个法子。\n\n首先，你必须通过冥想来净化你的灵魂。\n\n遥远的东北方有一座霜刃峰，在那座山峰的顶端有一处神龛，沿着西边山脚的道路往上走就到了。\n\n在那里进行冥想，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="Of late I've had nightmares concerning a worg named Ulfang. He has called out for help, and you must go to him.\n\nHowever, you do not have the means to speak with him, or walk amongst the other worgs. I know a way.\n\nBut first, you must cleanse your inner turmoil through meditation.\n\nThere is a shrine that sits at the top of Frostblade Peak, far to the northeast. A single path leads up to it from the western base of the mountain.\n\nMeditate there to cleanse yourself and then return to me.",o="钢铁之门的观察者莉莎·月叶建议你转至霜刃神龛，通过冥想净化你内心的杂念。",oEN="Watcher Moonleaf at Steel Gate has advised you to cleanse yourself of Your Inner Turmoil through meditation at the Frostblade Shrine.",p="你在神龛找到了内心的平静吗？你的杂念消除了吗？",pEN="Did you find inner peace at the shrine? Is your turmoil gone?",c="我可以感受到你的变化。\n\n你准备好进行下一步了吗？",cEN="Already I can sense the change within you.\n\nAre you ready for what comes next?"}
Q[11323]={d="我从梦里了解到，乌尔芬就在裂木森林西北边缘的某个洞穴里。\n\n他的处境非常危险！\n\n我会给你一件魔法斗篷，当你穿着它进入裂木森林后，就会变成座狼的样子。这件斗篷非常脆弱，完全依靠那片闹鬼的树林里的奇怪魔法能量才能生效。虽然它只对座狼有效，但它可以让你顺利找到乌尔芬。\n\n我请求你，$c，去帮帮他吧。",dEN="From my dreams, I know that Ulfang is in a cave on the snowy northwestern edge of the Rivenwood.\n\nHe is in great danger.\n\nI have devised a magical disguise that will make you appear as a worg while you are within the Rivenwood. The disguise is weak, relying upon the strange magics of that haunted wood. While it will only convince the worgs, it will allow you to get close to Ulfang.\n\nPlease, <class>, find and help him.",o="先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者要你转至裂木森林，找到并帮助乌尔芬。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以找先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者再要一件。",oEN="Sage Mistwalker has asked you to seek out and help Ulfang in the Rivenwood.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Sage Mistwalker for a replacement.",c="你看起来，闻起来都不一样……你不是我的狼群中的一员。跟我说你的故事；我被困在这里什么也没有，但我有的是时间。",cEN="You look and smell different... you are not one of my pack. Tell me your story; I have nothing but time while I am trapped in here."}
Q[11324]={d="既然你夺得了塔隆斯里克的眼珠，那你一定也能看见迦瓦尔并咬断他的喉咙！\n\n$R，去裂木森林的西部杀死迦瓦尔吧，你杀掉他以后，就回去告诉迷雾行者，我又一次成为头狼了！",dEN="When you've eaten Talonshrike's eyes, you should be able see Garwal and rip out his throat!\n\n<race>-thing, seek out and slay Garwal in the western Rivenwood. After you have killed him, go and tell Mistwalker that I am once more the alpha worg!",o="乌尔芬要你去杀死迦瓦尔。然后返回钢铁之门，将座狼伪装还给先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to slay Garwal. Then, return the Worg Disguise to Sage Mistwalker at Steel Gate.",p="<name>，你回来了。乌尔方有什么消息？",pEN="<name>, you have returned. What news of Ulfang?",c="迦瓦尔绝对不是座狼！我很了解这些生物……他们是狼人。\n\n不过，乌尔芬说它是从灰熊丘陵南下而来的？怪了，那儿可没有什么狼人才对。\n\n我非常感谢你帮助乌尔芬重返它在狼群中的地位。终于，我们能高枕无忧了。\n\n感激不尽，请你一定要收下这份谢礼。",cEN="Garwal was not a worg at all! I know of these creatures... they are called worgen.\n\nBut, Ulfang indicated that it came south from the Grizzly Hills? Odd. There aren't any worgen there.\n\nI thank you for helping to restore Ulfang to his proper place amongst his pack. Now we both will be able to sleep peacefully.\n\nPlease, you must accept this as a sign of gratitude."}
Q[11325]={d="我从梦里了解到，乌尔芬就在裂木森林西北边缘的某个洞穴里。\n\n他的处境非常危险！\n\n我会给你一件魔法斗篷，当你穿着它进入裂木森林后，就会变成座狼的样子。这件斗篷非常脆弱，完全依靠那片闹鬼的树林里的奇怪魔法能量才能生效。虽然它只对座狼有效，但它可以让你顺利找到乌尔芬。\n\n我请求你，$c，去帮帮他吧。",dEN="From my dreams, I know that Ulfang is in a cave on the snowy northwestern edge of the Rivenwood.\n\nHe is in great danger!\n\nI have devised a magical disguise that will make you appear as a worg while you are within the Rivenwood. The disguise is weak, relying upon the strange magics of that haunted wood. While it will only convince the worgs, it will allow you to get close to Ulfang.\n\nPlease, <class>, find and help him.",o="观察者莉莎·月叶要你转至裂木森林，找到并帮助乌尔芬。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以找观察者莉莎·月叶再要一件。",oEN="Watcher Moonleaf has asked you to seek out and help Ulfang in the Rivenwood.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Watcher Moonleaf for a replacement.",c="你看起来，闻起来都不一样……你不是我的狼群中的一员。跟我说你的故事；我被困在这里什么也没有，但我有的是时间。",cEN="You look and smell different... you are not one of my pack. Tell me your story; I have nothing but time while I am trapped in here."}
Q[11326]={d="既然你夺得了塔隆斯里克的眼珠，那你一定也能看见迦瓦尔并咬断他的喉咙！\n\n$R，去裂木森林的西部杀死迦瓦尔吧，你杀掉他以后，就回去告诉月叶，我又一次成为头狼了！",dEN="When you've eaten Talonshrike's eyes, you should be able see Garwal and rip out his throat!\n\n<race>-thing, seek out and slay Garwal in the western Rivenwood. After you have killed him, go and tell Moonleaf that I am once more the alpha worg!",o="乌尔芬要你去杀死迦瓦尔。然后返回钢铁之门，将座狼伪装还给观察者莉莎·月叶。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to slay Garwal. Then, return the Worg Disguise to Watcher Moonleaf at Steel Gate.",p="<name>，你回来了。乌尔方有什么消息？",pEN="<name>, you have returned. What news of Ulfang?",c="迦瓦尔绝对不是座狼！根据你的形容，听起来更像是狼人！\n\n不过，乌尔芬说他是从南方的灰熊丘陵过来的？奇怪了，那边可没有什么狼人才对。\n\n我非常感谢你帮助乌尔芬重返它在狼群中的地位。终于，我能高枕无忧了。\n\n感激不尽，请你一定要收下这份谢礼。",cEN="Garwal was not a worg at all! The thing you describe him turning into sounds a lot like a worgen!\n\nBut, Ulfang said that it came south from the Grizzly Hills? Odd. There aren't any worgen there.\n\nI thank you for helping to restore Ulfang to his proper place amongst his pack. Now we both will be able to sleep peacefully.\n\nPlease, you must accept this as a sign of gratitude."}
Q[11327]={d="该死的，我们需要一些治疗瘟疫的物品。\n\n我想起来了！\n\n你去摧毁那些容器的时候，我正好看见一个从新阿加曼德来的药剂商人被维库人拖到哈尔格林德里面去了，就在那边。可怜的家伙。\n\n$n，我需要那个药剂商人的货物。你能到哈尔格林德去把他的包裹找回来吗？",dEN="Well darn, we need some of that plague-stuff.\n\nI know!\n\nWhile you were destroying the vats, I happened to spy one of the apothecaries from New Agamand being pulled into Halgrind by the vrykul down in there. Poor fella'.\n\n<name>, I'd bet anything that apothecary has the goods on him. Think you could go into Halgrind and retrieve his package?",o="斥候诺勒斯要你转至哈尔格林德，夺回药剂师的包裹。然后返回灰烬长矛塔楼向他复命。",oEN="Scout Knowles has asked you to retrieve the Apothecary's Package from inside Halgrind. Once you have it, return to the scout at the Ember Spear Tower.",p="那个地方看起真像是个噩梦。不管是不是维库人，没有人应该要沦为皇家药剂师协会的受害者。\n\n幸好我平安地站在这里。你拿到包裹了吗？",pEN="That place looks like a nightmare. Vrykul or not, no one deserves to be the victim of the Royal Apothecary Society.\n\nGlad I'm standing safely over here. You find that package yet?",c="天啊……这是什么鬼？！看看这些东西！\n\n我们要立刻把这东西送回要塞，刻不容缓！",cEN="Holy... what the hell?! Look at this stuff!\n\nWe need to get this back to the keep a.s.a.p.!"}
Q[11328]={d="好吧，我想你得回要塞去，把这个东西交给贝比·鲁诺兹。她只能算是个业馀炼金师，但她也是我们这儿唯一懂炼金术的人了。\n\n关于贝比……她就喜欢喝两杯。所以你应该能在旅店找到她，而且多半喝得昏天黑地。\n\n我想她应该知道怎么办。",dEN="Right, so I think you should get this stuff over to Peppy Wrongnozzle back at the keep. She's something of an amateur alchemist, but she's the only one we've got.\n\nOne thing about Peppy; she does love her drink. So, you'll likely find her at the tavern 'soaking up the atmosphere'.\n\nI'm sure she'll know what to do.",o="斥候诺勒斯要你将药剂师的包裹送往西部卫戍要塞，交给贝比·鲁诺兹。",oEN="Scout Knowles has asked you to deliver the Apothecary's Package to Peppy Wrongnozzle at Westguard Keep.",p="呀，你想要啥……嗝？",pEN="Yeah, whadya want ...hic?",c="喔……唉，这可不一样！\n\n好吧，让我瞧瞧这东西。我最喜欢用炼金术修修补补了！\n\n很有趣，很有趣……喏，我想我知道要做什么了。这个混一点进去，然后再加一点那个。\n\n你知道吗，我猜加一点酒进去也会有点效果吧……嗝！",cEN="Oh... hey, that'sh different!\n\nOkay, let me shee that shtuff. I jusht love tinkering with alchemy!\n\nInteresting, interesting... here, I think I know jusht what to do. A little mixing of that with the jusht the right amount of thish.\n\nYou know, I think a little dash of this rotgut will help, too ...hic!"}
Q[11329]={d="见鬼，我这辈子再也不想看见咸鱼了！每天我不停在这里往一个又一个的桶里塞上一条又一条的鱼，好不容易钓够了塞满一桶，抬头一看居然还有几百个桶在等着塞！\n\n钓鱼又不容易……要是没把纳特·帕格卖我的高级鱼饵用完就好了。那鱼饵效果之好有如魔法一般！算了，不扯了，继续钓鱼……希望一小时之内至少能钓上来一只。\n\n我听说北方鲇鱼可以做成非常不错的鱼饵，但……要潜进又冰又冷的湖水在那些浓密的水草间游来游去地捉它们，这未免太疯狂了。我是肯定不会去的，但……你或许……好吧，只是或许……会去的。",dEN="I never want to see another barrel of salted fish as long as I live! Filling barrels day in and day out, and there are still more to be filled!\n\nI wish I hadn't used up all that bait I bought from Nat Pagle. Worked like magic, it did. Now I'm lucky if I can catch a fish an hour!\n\nI hear the northern barbfish make pretty good bait, but who's crazy enough to dive into a freezing cold lake and hack up the water plants in search of them? Not me... but maybe, just maybe, I can persuade you to...",o="维德瓦堡垒的克里斯托弗·斯洛安要求你给他带回5条北方鲇鱼。",oEN="Christopher Sloan at Fort Wildervar wants you to bring him 5 Northern Barbfish.",p="看来你安然无恙，拿到鱼饵了吗？",pEN="You look like you're still in one piece. Get any of that bait?",c="哇，这些鱼真的是丑得可以，但是如果真的有用，我想我不会介意的。等到远征军走了以后我才能松一口气，回到我原本只需要为了晚餐而钓鱼的时候。",cEN="Well, these certainly are ugly enough, but I suppose I don't care if it actually works. I'll be relieved once the expedition has passed through and I can go back to simply fishing for my dinner."}
Q[11330]={d="瞧，被遗忘者的药剂！\n\n但我肯定不会自己喝的。我知道你也不愿意！\n\n哦，那个……我有办法了！\n\n我们在要塞下面的牢房里关了一个维库长老。你为什么不把这种混合剂带去让那头巨兽喝呢……嗝儿？！",dEN="Voila, inshtant plague vacshine!\n\nBut I sure as heck am not going to try thish on myself. And I know you don't want to be my tesht shubject!\n\nOh, I've got... I've got an idea!\n\nWe've got a vrykul prishoner being held down in the cells under the keep. Why don't you take thish mix I whipped up down there, and get that giant to drink it ...hic?!",o="西部卫戍要塞的贝比·鲁诺兹要你让疯狂的掠龙维库长老喝下贝比的特殊混合剂，并观察药剂的效果。",oEN="Peppy Wrongnozzle at Westguard Keep has suggested that you take her Peppy's Special Mix and administer it to the Dragonflayer Vrykul Prisoner to witness its results.",c="啊？糟透了！该死，我把事情搞砸了。事实上，我认为我替他们完成了……嗝！\n\n<贝比扮了个鬼脸并灌了一大口不知道是什么的怪酒。>\n\n好吧，我希望事情不会坏到这个地步，不过看起来好像没有选择的余地……嗝。",cEN="Huh? Well that sucks! Darn, I made thingsh worsh. In fact, I think I perfected their plague for them ...hic!\n\n<Peppy grimaces and takes a huge gulp of whatever noxious brew she's been drinking.>\n\nWell, I wash hoping that it wouldn't come down to thish, but it looks like there'sh no alternative ...hic."}
Q[11331]={d="情况是这样的，你看，我不会自己去把这个消息告诉上尉。我只是个业馀炼金师，这不是我的工作，而且我在休息！\n\n而且他的脾气太坏了……而且你比我更熟悉他！\n\n所以，你到要塞去把这事告诉他吧。我想他一定会合理地处理这件事……嗝儿。\n\n<贝比又转身去喝酒了。>",dEN="Here'sh the deal. I'm not going to the captain with thish news. I'm an amateur alchemist, thish ishn't my job, and I'm on break!\n\nBeshides, he'sh a big grumpkin... and you know him better than I do!\n\nSho, jusht go up into the keep and tell him. I'm sure he'll be reashonable about the whole thing ...hic.\n\n<Peppy turns back to her drinking.>",o="贝比·鲁诺兹让你转至西部卫戍要塞，将关于被遗忘者疫病的坏消息告诉亚当斯上尉。",oEN="Peppy Wrongnozzle has suckered you into giving the bad news about the Forsaken plague to Captain Adams. Visit him at Westguard Keep.",c="是的，<name>，现在又有什么事？什么？！！被遗忘者的超级瘟疫能转眼把你化掉？你把我那个维库囚犯放跑了？<上尉看起来几乎有些伤心，厌恶地啐了一口。>好吧，我知道我们该做什么。或者更确切地说，是你该做什么！\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="Yes, <name>, what is it now?\n\nWHAT?!! A Forsaken super plague that melts you in no time?\n\nYou oozed my vrykul prisoner?\n\n<The captain looks almost sad and spits in disgust.>\n\nAlright, I know what we need to do. Or rather, what YOU need to do!"}
Q[11332]={d="皇家药剂师协会正在研究一种新瘟疫，准备把我们全撂倒？！\n\n我不能让这种事发生！\n\n到院子里去跟格雷尔·岩锤谈一谈。他会给你一头狮鹫和一些炸弹，我希望你能去把新阿加曼德的瘟疫罐炸个粉碎！",dEN="The Royal Apothecary Society thinks they're going to perfect a new plague to melt us down where we stand?!\n\nNot on my watch!\n\nGet out to the courtyard and speak with Greer Orehammer. He's got a gryphon and some bombs ready for you. I want you to bomb the plague tanks at New Agamand to smithereens!",o="亚当斯上尉命令你转至新阿加曼德，对瘟疫罐投下5颗炸弹。完成任务后返回西部卫戍要塞向他复命。",oEN="Captain Adams has ordered you to get 5 bomb hits on the Plague Tanks at New Agamand. Do not return to him at Westguard Keep until you have accomplished that.",p="那些瘟疫罐毁掉了吗？那新瘟疫像必然的死亡一样悬在我们头顶，<class>！",pEN="Those plague tanks destroyed, yet? That new plague looms over our heads like certain death, <class>!",c="干得好，<name>，干得好！<上尉似乎欢喜得忘乎所以。>那会让那些没用的被遗忘者知道，别来惹我们！我得说，你为自己从国库里赢得了一些东西！\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="Nicely done, <name>, nicely done!\n\n<The captain seems beside himself with glee.>\n\nThat'll show those good-for-nothing Forsaken to think about messing with us!\n\nI'd say you've earned yourself something from the treasury!"}
Q[11333]={d="虽然探险者协会能够从他们的考古发现中推测出一些零碎的古代信息，中将或许能通过强大的力量抽取一些现在的信息，但唯有灵魂可以知晓全部的真相。\n\n我可以通过一些特殊的材料进入灵魂的世界。那里揭示了诺森德的过去、现在和未来。\n\n如果你想了解详细的情况，我就要用到我的材料包了。不过我把它落在了一条船上，现在这条船就沉在东面的匕鞘湾底下。",dEN="While the Explorers' League may discern bits and pieces of the past through their archaeological findings and the Vice Admiral might extract some knowledge of the present through brute force, the truth lies with the spirits.\n\nWith the proper reagents I am able to see into the spirit world. It is there that the past, present and future of Northrend resides.\n\nIf you wish to learn more, I will require my reagent pouch. It was lost in a ship that is now at the bottom of Daggercap Bay, just east of here.",o="瓦加德的智者索拉留斯要你找回他的材料包。",oEN="Thoralius the Wise at Valgarde wants you to find his Reagent Pouch.",p="你找到我的材料包了吗？",pEN="Have you found my reagent pouch?",c="虽然因为泡水而受损了一些，但应该还能用。\n\n<索拉留斯把手伸入袋子里，掏出了一些造型奇怪的香。>\n\n现在把它们丢进火里，然后吸入那些气体！\n\n<索拉留斯把香丢进燃烧的熏香炉中。>\n\n<索拉留斯深吸了一口气。他的身体也随之颤抖起来。>\n\n什……什么……这不可能……我不能……",cEN="A bit worse for the wear but still functional.\n\n<Thoralius reaches into the pouch and removes some odd looking roots.>\n\nNow to place them in the fire and inhale!\n\n<Thoralius throws the roots into the smoldering incense burner.>\n\n<Thoralius inhales deeply. His body begins to quiver.>\n\nWha... What... It cannot be... I cannot..."}
Q[11343]={d="灵魂世界已经被巫妖王控制了。噩梦凝结成的恐怖生物看守着元素的世界。我感到这些瓦格里维库人在守护着一个可怕的秘密。\n\n我已经老了，虚弱得无法再进去一次了。你必须代我去一次，$n。\n\n带着这只香料炉转至龙颅村，使用它进入灵魂的世界。你要搜索龙颅村东北角的那座最大的建筑物！记得躲开那些瓦格里维库人，否则他们会把你永远禁锢在他们的世界里。",dEN="The spirit world has fallen under the sway of the Lich King. Fearsome creatures made of pure nightmare now stand watch over the realm of the elements. I sense that these val'kyr are guarding a terrible secret.\n\nI am too old and weak to survive another journey. You must go in my place, <name>.\n\nTake this incense burner to Wyrmskull Village and use it to enter the spirit world. Find the large dwelling in the northeast! Avoid the val'kyr at all costs lest they make you a permanent fixture in their world.",o="智者索拉留斯要你进入灵魂世界，搜索龙颅村并找出龙颅村的秘密。",oEN="Thoralius the Wise wants you to search Wyrmskull Village while you are in the spirit world and find information about the Secrets of Wyrmskull.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="我不明白。你所看到的生物看起来像是攻击瓦加德的维库人？",cEN="I do not understand. The creatures that you saw looked like the vrykul that are attacking Valgarde?"}
Q[11344]={d="我们只知道维库人是最近才出现在诺森德的。那为什么我们会在一万五千年前的影像里看到维库人？如果维库人之前就在诺森德生活，我们怎么会不知道呢？\n\n你必须立刻转至尼弗莱瓦。你要取道东北，穿过龙颅村，越过水坝。尼弗莱瓦就位于海湾的悬崖之上。\n\n你到达尼弗莱瓦以后，要使用焚香炉寻找那里的线索。",dEN="All that we know of the vrykul indicates that they only recently appeared in Northrend. Why, then, are we seeing vrykul in visions that date back 15,000 years? Surely if the vrykul had previously existed in Northrend we would have known.\n\nYou must press on to Nifflevar. To get there you must go northeast, through Wyrmskull Village, and take the path leading up through the dam. Nifflevar is on the bluffs of the fjord.\n\nUse the incense burner once you arrive at Nifflevar and search the area for clues.",o="智者索拉留斯要你进入灵魂世界，搜索尼弗莱瓦并找出尼弗莱瓦的秘密。",oEN="Thoralius the Wise wants you to search Nifflevar while you are in the spirit world and find information about the Secrets of Nifflevar.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="维库人生下的人类孩子？伊米隆下令杀死所有人类后代？\n<索拉留斯沉默了片刻。>尽管我非常想否认摆在眼前如此清楚的事实，但我做不到。\n人类并不存在探险者协会所说的那种已灭绝的缺失环节。维库人就是那个缺失环节。\n他们是人类的祖先。\n\"\"",cEN="Human children born of vrykul? And Ymiron ordered the deaths of all human born offspring?\n\n<Thoralius goes silent for a moment.>\n\nAs much as I wish to deny what is so plainly presented to me, I cannot. There is no extinct \"missing link\" to humans as the Explorers' League proposed. The vrykul are the missing link. They are the progenitors of humanity."}
Q[11346]={d="铁矮人侵占了东南方那片广阔的岩地——巨人平原。据侦察兵汇报，矮人们哄骗石巨人从地下显身，然后在他们身上雕刻符文。\n\n我猜不透铁矮人的动机，不过我怀疑他们企图将石巨人转化成武器。铁符文唤石者和铁符文束缚者随身携带的秘典中必定有关于石巨人符文的资料。\n\n$n，从他们手中夺得秘典的书页，拼凑成完整的书籍交给我。",dEN="The vast rocky area to the southeast, Giants' Run, has been overrun by Iron Dwarves. Scouts have reported seeing the dwarves coaxing stone giants from the ground, then carving runes on them.\n\nI can't fathom their motives, but I suspect they're somehow trying to turn the giants into weapons. The iron rune stonecallers and binders carry large tomes with them, which must contain the runes they're carving on the giants.\n\nCapture the pieces of this book, assemble them, and bring it back to me, <name>.",o="维德瓦堡垒的勘测员贝瓦尔要你将符文之书交给他。",oEN="Prospector Belvar at Fort Wildervar wants you to bring him The Book of Runes.",p="你把书带回来了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the book?",c="<勘测员贝瓦尔翻阅着符文之书。>\n\n嗯嗯……内容实在太多了。我需要一点时间来阅读，而且如果我们想要了解这些符文的话，我们就需要亲自制作看看。",cEN="<Prospector Belvar browses the book of runes.>\n\nHmm... there's so much here. I'm going to need some time to study it, and if we hope to understand these runes, we'll need to try to make our own."}
Q[11348]={d="我在这块石板上刻了几行符文，你能感受到它们所散发的能量吗？和铁矮人使用的符文相比，这些符文较为低等。但是我们依然可以利用它们粉碎铁矮人的阴谋。\n\n带上符文转至巨人平原，对一个尚未被改造的石巨人使用符文。\n\n在符文的作用下，石巨人会听从你的指挥并逐渐恢复原有的力量。接下来，你要在他的帮助下击败缚石者穆迪斯，这家伙就是盘踞在巨人平原的铁矮人领袖。",dEN="Can you feel the power emanating from the runes I've carved on this tablet? They're smaller versions of the runes that the Iron Dwarves are using. We'll use it to shut down their operation.\n\nTake it to Giants' Run and use it on a stone giant that the dwarves have not altered.\n\nThe giant should obey you, but I've tailored the runes to restore it to its natural state after a time. The giant may prove a valuable ally in the battle against Binder Murdis, the leader of the Iron Dwarf forces at Giants' Run.",o="维德瓦堡垒的勘测员贝瓦尔要你去测试命令符文，并击败缚石者穆迪斯。",oEN="Prospector Belvar at Fort Wildervar wants you to test the Rune of Command and defeat Binder Murdis.",p="你测试过符文了吗？",pEN="Have you tried the rune?",c="你能击败缚石者穆迪斯真是太好了，但铁矮人不会轻易放弃的。\n\n我们在了解他们如何使用符文上获得了很多进展。或许下一次我们遭遇他们时，我们的知识将会变成优势。",cEN="You've done well in defeating Binder Murdis, but the Iron Dwarves won't give up easily.\n\nWe've made a lot of progress in understanding how they manipulate runes. Perhaps next time we encounter them, our knowledge will give us an advantage."}
Q[11349]={d="我这倒是有锄头、铁锤和凿子什么的，可惜它们不能雕刻符文。铁矮人使用的雕琢工具就不一样啦，他们在铸造工具时向里面灌注了魔法力量。\n\n使用这样的工具进行雕刻，符文就不仅仅是简单的字符了，它们具备了束缚、支配与扭曲的力量。\n\n这些我都了然于心，眼下就缺少雕琢工具进行实践了。转至巨人平原的铁矮人营帐附近寻找工具箱，把它们带回来给我。",dEN="I've got a set of picks, hammers, and chisels with me, but they won't work for carving these runes. The tools used by the Iron Dwarves are imbued with magic during their forging.\n\nWhen they're used to carve runes, the symbols form much more than mere words. These runes have the power to bind, compel, and twist.\n\nI believe I know how it works, but without a set of those tools, I can't be certain. Look for kits resembling mine near the Iron Dwarf pavilions at Giants' Run and bring them to me.",o="将一套铁符文雕刻工具交给维德瓦堡垒的勘测员贝瓦尔。",oEN="Bring a set of Iron Rune Carving Tools to Prospector Belvar at Fort Wildervar.",p="你带着那些工具回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with those tools?",c="<贝瓦尔仔细地处理这些工具。>\n\n我要来试用这些工具。如果我们想要了解铁矮人的动机并打败他们，我就需要了解符文确实的功用。",cEN="<Belvar handles the tools carefully.>\n\nI'm going to try these out. If we're to understand the Iron Dwarves' motives and defeat them, I need to know exactly what the runes are doing."}
Q[11350]={d="灰烬图腾酋长派我穿越冰雪林地，侦察东南方那片广阔的岩地——巨人平原。\n\n那里已经被铁矮人占领了，我还瞧见很多石巨人从地下显身。矮人们在巨人身上雕刻符文，似乎打算改造他们。\n\n铁符文唤石者和铁符文束缚者随身携带的秘典中必定有关于石巨人符文的资料。\n\n从他们手中夺得秘典的书页，拼凑成完整的书籍交给我。这是我们破解他们阴谋的唯一途径。",dEN="Chieftain Ashtotem dispatched me on a scouting mission to Giants' Run, a broad, rocky plateau to the southeast, past the Frozen Glade.\n\nThe area has been taken over by Iron Dwarves who seem to be altering the giants as they emerge from the earth.\n\nThe iron rune stonecallers and binders carry large tomes with them, which must contain the runes they're carving on the giants.\n\nCapture the pieces of this book, assemble them, and bring it back to me. It's the only way we'll understand their plans.",o="冬蹄营地的远行者贝姆比要你将符文之书交给他。",oEN="Longrunner Pembe at Camp Winterhoof wants you to bring him The Book of Runes.",p="你找到书了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the book?",c="<远行者翻阅着符文之书。>\n\n我虽然不是博学大师，但我对铁矮人的语言还算熟悉。我猜他们刻在巨人身上的符文是来自于他们日常的用语，虽然有些许的不同。",cEN="<The longrunner browses the book of runes.>\n\nI'm no loremaster, but I have some familiarity with the language of the Iron Dwarves. I think the runes they're carving on the giants are derived from their spoken language, but there are some differences."}
Q[11351]={d="我大致猜到了铁矮人在做些什么。他们在铸造符文雕刻工具时向里面灌注了魔法力量。\n\n使用这样的工具进行雕刻，符文就不仅仅是简单的字符了，它们具备了束缚、支配与扭曲的力量。\n\n如果能搞到这样一套工具，我或许能模拟出秘典中的符文。我这里有一只从巨人平原的铁矮人营帐附近捡回的箱子，不过里面是空的。去那里寻找这样的箱子，替我弄回一套完整的工具来。",dEN="I think I've figured out what the Iron Dwarves are doing. The tools they use are imbued with magic during their forging.\n\nWhen they're used to carve runes, the symbols form much more than mere words. These runes have the power to bind, compel, and twist.\n\nIf I had a set of those tools, I could mimic the runes in the book. I captured one of these boxes from one of the pavilions at Giants' Run, but it was empty. Look for similar boxes and recover a set of tools from them.",o="将一套铁符文雕刻工具交给冬蹄营地的远行者贝姆比。",oEN="Bring a set of Iron Rune Carving Tools to Longrunner Pembe at Camp Winterhoof.",p="你带回来那些工具了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with those tools?",c="<贝姆比检查着那些工具。>\n\n它们比我想象得还要更精致，稍等一下让我试试看。",cEN="<Pembe examines the tools.>\n\nThese are more delicate than I'd thought. Allow me a moment to try them out."}
Q[11352]={d="我在这块石板上刻了几行符文，你能感受到它们所散发的能量吗？和铁矮人使用的符文相比，这些符文较为低等。但是我们依然可以利用它们粉碎铁矮人的阴谋。\n\n带上符文转至巨人平原，对一个尚未被改造的石巨人使用符文。\n\n在符文的作用下，石巨人会听从你的指挥并逐渐恢复原有的力量。接下来，你要在他的帮助下击败缚石者穆迪斯，这家伙就是盘踞在巨人平原的铁矮人领袖。",dEN="Can you feel the power emanating from the runes I've carved on this tablet? They're smaller versions of the runes that the Iron Dwarves are using. We'll use it to shut down their operation.\n\nTake it to Giants' Run and use it on a stone giant that the dwarves have not altered.\n\nThe giant should obey you, but I've tailored the runes to restore it to its natural state after a time. The giant may prove a valuable ally in the battle against Binder Murdis, the leader of the Iron Dwarf forces at Giants' Run.",o="冬蹄营地的远行者贝姆比要你去测试命令符文，并击败缚石者穆迪斯。",oEN="Longrunner Pembe at Camp Winterhoof wants you to test the Rune of Command and defeat Binder Murdis.",p="你测试过符文了吗？",pEN="Have you tried the rune?",c="你能击败缚石者穆迪斯真是太好了，但铁矮人不会轻易放弃的。\n\n当我的族人往北，我很确信我们会再次遭遇铁矮人。下一次，我们会在他们开始之前就先打败他们。",cEN="You've done well in defeating Binder Murdis, but the Iron Dwarves won't give up easily.\n\nAs my people move north, I'm certain we will encounter the Iron Dwarves again. Next time, we will be prepared to thwart them before they can dig in."}
Q[11353]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[11354]={d="今天，有位顾客对伊利丹的传令官及其坐骑表现出莫大的兴趣。当然，我指的是传令官瓦兹德和纳杉。\n\n想要领取酬金的话，就转至地狱火堡垒，进入地狱火城墙，将纳杉的骑鞭带回来。\n\n我得到的情报有点奇怪，据说纳杉的骑鞭是由纳杉自己来保管的，而且还据说这头龙从来都不肯让传令官使用骑鞭。",dEN="Today I have a buyer who is interested in a piece that's held by the mount of Illidan's herald. I, of course, speak of Vazruden the Herald and his dragon mount, Nazan.\n\nIf you want the finder's fee that I offer in return, find them flying above the Ramparts at Hellfire Citadel and return with the dragon's riding crop.\n\nMy sources tell me that the item in question is personally held by the dragon. It is said that Nazan refuses to allow Vazruden to strike him with it.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得纳杉的骑鞭。将骑鞭带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Nazan's Riding Crop. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="请把骑乘马鞭交给我。",pEN="The riding crop please.",c="我又可以满足一位客户的要求了。这件物品看起来状况良好。你可以领取赏金了。\n\n请你明天再回来，我将有新的任务要交给你执行。",cEN="Another soon-to-be satisfied customer. It looks like it's in fine condition. You are to be rewarded.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11355]={d="东边的巨人平原起了骚动，刻有符文的石巨人开始往北边的霜刃峰迁徙。我不知道他们的目的地是哪儿。\n\n刻在他们身上的符文散发着诡异的光芒，驱使他们前进。如果你能击倒巨人，从他们体表剥下一些符文，符文的效力就会消散，便于我们展开研究。\n\n利用这把锄从巨人身上剥下一些符文石板，然后把它们给我带回来。",dEN="To the east, at Giants' Run, rune-inscribed stone giants have started to migrate north toward Frostblade Peak. What their ultimate destination is, I do not know.\n\nThe glowing runes inscribed in the stone flesh of the giants guide them on their journey.\n\nUse this pick to deactivate the runes on the giants' corpses and return with your findings.",o="维德瓦堡垒的研究员艾德兰要你在4个符文石巨人的尸体上使用符文搜寻之锄。",oEN="Researcher Aderan at Fort Wildervar wants you to use the Runeseeking Pick on the corpses of 4 Runed Stone Giants.",p="你找到了些什么？",pEN="What have you found?",c="「研究员阿德兰听着你的发现。」北和西的符文出现了好几次？那是一条被高度强化的前进指令，但这些符文不只是推进力。\n有什么东西在吸引它们，可那是什么呢？\"\n\"\"\"",cEN="<Researcher Aderan listens to your findings.>\n\nThe runes for \"north\" and \"west\" appeared multiple times? There's a highly reinforced command to move in that direction, but the runes are more than propulsion. Something is attracting them, but what?"}
Q[11356]={d="万圣节期间，人类的孤儿院会组织孤儿前往联盟的乡村村庄参观。那些可怜的孩子会很想见到像你这样真正的$g一名:一名;$c！\n你为什么不去看看他们？\n你会在艾尔文森林的闪金镇、丹莫罗的卡拉诺斯和秘蓝岛的碧蓝岗哨找到这些孤儿。去找那些孩子的看护人——一位乔装打扮的孤儿院女总管，她会把孩子们介绍给你。",dEN="During Hallow's End, human orphanages have organized trips for their orphans to visit Alliance countryside villages. Those poor children would love to see a real <class> like yourself!\n\nWhy don't you visit them? You'll find orphans at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest, Kharanos in Dun Morogh and Azure Watch in Azuremyst. Speak to the children's ward, a costumed orphan matron, and she'll introduce you to the children.",o="到闪金镇、卡拉诺斯或秘蓝岗哨去，与穿戏服的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with a Costumed Orphan Matron in either Goldshire, Kharanos or Azure Watch.",c="你来这里拜访这些孩子！太好了！她们小小的生命中已经感受过太多悲苦。能够看到一个像你这样的真正英雄，真是太好了。这一定能够振奋他们的精神！",cEN="You're here to visit the children! Wonderful! They have known such heartache in their short lives. It is good that they see real heroes like you. It really lifts their spirits!"}
Q[11357]={d="万圣节期间，兽人孤儿们被带去拜访许多部落村庄。孤儿院的女总管们认为，让他们亲眼见到真正的英雄对他们有好处。\n你为什么不去看看他们？像你这样勇敢的$g一名:一名;$c可以用你的英勇事迹鼓舞他们的精神！\n去杜隆塔尔的剃刀岭、提瑞斯法林地的布瑞尔，或者永歌森林的鹰翼广场。找那位戴着面具的孤儿院女总管谈谈，她会把孩子们介绍给你。",dEN="For Hallow's End, orc orphans were taken on a trip to many Horde villages. The orphan matrons thought it would be good for them to see real heroes adventuring in the field.\n\nWhy don't you visit them? A brave <class> like yourself could strengthen their spirits with tales of your valor! Go to either Razor Hill in Durotar, Brill in Tirisfal Glades or Falconwing Square in Eversong Woods. Speak with the masked orphan matron and she'll introduce you to the children.",o="到剃刀岭、布瑞尔或者鹰翼广场去，与戴面具的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with a Masked Orphan Matron in either Razor Hill, Brill or Falconwing Square.",c="孩子们喜欢看到投入于工作的英雄。我希望有一天，这些孤儿都能成为部落中的有力成员，然后在光荣的战役中力战而死！\n\n啊，想到这样高尚的命运就让我忍不住想掉泪……",cEN="The children love to watch heroes at their work. It is my hope that, one day, each of these orphans will grow into a strong member of the Horde, and ultimately die in glorious battle!\n\nAh, thoughts of such a fine fate brings mist to my eyes..."}
Q[11358]={d="如果能查明是什么东西诱使巨人朝西北方迁徙，我们或许可以设法阻止他们。\n\n虽然我破译了你取回的样本上的一部分符文，但是我更想了解那些我没看懂的文字的含义。我曾经在巨人平原东北部，与霜刃峰的雪原交界处见过一块巨大的残破石板。带上这份样本，去与那里的石板进行比较，看看能不能有所发现。",dEN="If we can locate what's luring the giants northwest, we might be able to stop them before they reach their destination.\n\nAlthough I was able to decipher many of the runes on the samples you brought me, the ones I don't know concern me the most. When I visited Giants' Run, I noticed a large broken tablet jutting from the ground where the northeastern part of the area met the snow at the foot of Frostblade Peak. Take this sample, compare the runes with the tablet, and see what you can learn.",o="维德瓦堡垒的研究员艾德兰要你对符文样本与破碎石板进行比较。",oEN="Researcher Aderan at Fort Wildervar wants you to compare the Rune Sample with the Broken Tablet.",p="你查出来为什么诱因吸引那些巨人了吗？",pEN="Have you discovered what lodestone attracts the giants?",c="<艾德兰听你叙述你的发现。>\n\n原来如此！麦加利斯一定是那些铁矮人计划的核心。我们一定要在计划实现之前摧毁它！",cEN="<Aderan listens as you describe your findings.>\n\nOf course! This Megalith must be the key to the Iron Dwarves' plans. We must destroy it before their plan comes to fruition!"}
Q[11359]={d="在缚石者穆迪斯改造出的符文巨人中，拥有强大力量的麦加利斯脱颖而出，成为巨人迁徙行动的领头者。只要击败麦加利斯，巨人就会像无头苍蝇一样丧失方向。远征军赶来后，我们的士兵就能逐个消灭剩馀的巨人，将铁矮人驱逐出巨人平原。\n\n转至巨人平原的北部边界，在霜刃峰的丘陵地带搜寻麦加利斯的下落并击败他！",dEN="Binder Murdis created Megalith to be the most powerful of the runed giants and to lead them in their mission. Defeating Megalith will leave them lost and without direction. After the expeditionary force arrives, our soldiers will be able to isolate and defeat the remaining giants and oust their Iron Dwarf masters from their camps.\n\nSearch the foothills of Frostblade Peak, north of Giants' Run for Megalith and defeat him!",o="击败麦加利斯，然后返回维德瓦堡垒，向研究员艾德兰复命。",oEN="Defeat Megalith and return to Researcher Aderan at Fort Wildervar.",p="你来带麦加利斯被击败的消息了吗？",pEN="Do you bring news of Megalith's downfall?",c="你击败巨石之灵做得很好，但我在意他最后说的话。\n你确定他说的是石铸之地？\n我不知道有哪个地方叫这个名字，但听起来像是一个源自泰坦的词。\n铁矮人对这种东西有什么打算？\n这值得关注，<name>，因为我们必须在铁矮人的计划得逞之前找到它。",cEN="You've done well in felling Megalith, but I wonder about his final words.\n\nYou're sure he said the Stoneforge?\n\nI know of no place with that name, but it sounds like a word with origins in the titans. What plans do the Iron Dwarves have for such a thing? This bears watching, <name>, for we must find it before the Iron Dwarves' plan comes to fruition."}
Q[11360]={d="在无头骑士的威胁之下，闪金镇的英雄们随时都准备着组成消防队，扑灭这里的火势。你愿意加入我们吗？\n\n就在这里北边不远，暴风城的卫兵们已经创建了一处小营地，练习救火。你也到那里去练习吧，用小水桶把水泼到火盆上就行了。小水桶在水缸周围放了许多，你可以自由取用。\n\n再见，$n。你完成了消防队的练习之后，请再过来找我们！",dEN="With the Headless Horseman at large, the heroes of Goldshire are always ready to form a fire brigade. Do you want to help?\n\nNorth of here, guards set up a small area to practice fighting fires. Go there and throw buckets onto the blazes. You can fill a bucket from the water barrel here, or the one near the fires.\n\nGood bye, <name>. When you're done with fire brigade practice, please visit us again!",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后与穿戏服的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Throw Water Buckets onto 5 fires, and then speak with the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="你好，<name>。你一直在精进你的灭火技巧吗？别忘了北边那片练习场！",pEN="Hello, <name>. Have you been perfecting your fire fighting techniques? Don't forget about the practice area to the north!",c="你身上全给烟灰弄脏了！你想必已经扑灭了那些火焰！\n\n干得好！身为一个救火队的荣誉成员，我请求你在村庄需要你的时候回来帮助我们！",cEN="You're wet and smudged with soot! You must have been extinguishing fires!\n\nWell done! As an honorary member of the Goldshire Fire Brigade, I beg you to return here if ever the village needs you!"}
Q[11361]={d="那些步兵在村外设了一处灭火练习场。\n最近剃刀岭的建筑经常着火——你该去搭把手，练习当个消防员！从剃刀岭西边出去，过了村子围墙后向右转。\n找到练习场，然后抓起水桶泼向那些练习用的火堆。",dEN="The grunts set up a fire training area outside the village. These days, Razor Hill's buildings often catch fire -- you should lend a hand and train as a fire fighter!\n\nHead west out of Razor Hill, then turn right as you pass the village's wall. Find the training area, then grab buckets and toss them on the practice fires.",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后回到剃刀岭，与戴面具的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Toss Water Buckets on 5 fires, then speak with the Masked Orphan Matron in Razor Hill.",p="你扑灭过火了吗，<name>？练习场在剃刀岭西出口的西边。",pEN="Have you dowsed any fires, <name>? The training area is west of Razor Hill's western exit.",c="干得好，<name>！孩子们，好好看看这位<class>。像他一样长得强壮又勇敢，总有一天你们也会为部落而战。",cEN="Well done, <name>! Children, take a good look at this <class>. Grow strong and brave like him and one day you too will fight for the Horde."}
Q[11362]={d="俗话说青菜萝卜各有所爱，就拿我刚接待的顾客来说吧。\n\n地狱火堡垒中有个名叫击碎者克里丹的邪兽人，他有一柄极其寻常的法杖，根本不值一哂，但这位顾客偏偏就指名要这柄法杖。\n\n我怎么能拒绝顾客的请求呢？\n\n想要领取酬金的话，就转至鲜血熔炉，从克里丹手中夺回法杖。",dEN="There is no accounting for taste. Take my most recent buyer for instance.\n\nThere is a blood orc within Hellfire Citadel known as Keli'dan the Breaker. He bears a most mundane stave; certainly nothing to take a second glance at. And yet, this is what my customer wishes.\n\nWho am I to say no?\n\nIf you desire my compensation, you will find him and his stave within the Blood Furnace.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得克里丹的羽饰法杖。将法杖带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Keli'dan's Feathered Stave. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我们再次的交谈……你一定取回手杖了。",pEN="We are speaking again... you must have the stave.",c="也许我会将一些新的羽毛绑在手杖上，然后再寄给那位买家。我想有这么多鸦人在附近，那些羽毛只算是小事一桩，不会影响你应该取得的赏金。\n\n请你明天再回来，我将有新的任务要交给你执行。",cEN="Perhaps I will have new feathers tied onto it before shipping it on to the buyer. I'm certain with so many arakkoa hereabouts it will not prove difficult. A small matter, and nothing to detract from your reward in any case.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11363]={d="今天我接待了一名腰缠万贯的收藏家，这位贵客想要购买某件特殊的器物。\n\n酋长卡加斯·刃拳总是随身携带着一枚印章，用来签署各类官方文件。我要你替我夺回这东西。\n\n卡加斯·刃拳就在破碎大厅深处。毫无疑问，你需要铲除大量兽人杂兵才能到达酋长面前，不过我深信你会凯旋的。",dEN="Today I have a very wealthy collector in need of something very unique indeed.\n\nWarchief Kargath Bladefist carries upon his person his seal of command, which he uses to sign all official documents. I want you to retrieve it for me.\n\nYou will find him deep within the Shattered Halls. No doubt you will have to wade through a veritable army to get to him. I have no doubt that you will succeed.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得刃拳的印记。将印记带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Bladefist's Seal. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我听说大酋长用武器取代了他的双手。这是真的吗？",pEN="I have heard it whispered that the warchief has weapons in place of his hands. Is this true?",c="你夺回这件东西的英勇行为应该被诗人们记载在羊皮纸上才对。这是你的赏金，你的行径远比这点小钱来的伟大。\n\n请你明天再回来，我将有新的任务要交给你执行。",cEN="Truly a daring acquisition that the bards should put pen to parchment for. Here, you have more than earned this.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11364]={d="你经常质疑你的主人吗？玛哈杜恩可绝对不会。\n\n现在，我需要的就是破碎之手氏族百夫长的血。你可以在地狱火堡垒的破碎大厅中找到他们。\n\n如果你还想要赏金，就赶紧去杀了他们再回来。",dEN="Do you question your master? Neither does Mah'duun.\n\nThe blood of the centurions of the Shattered Hand clan is what I seek. You will find them within the Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel.\n\nIf you want the bounty, you will not return until you have slain them all.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死4名碎手百夫长。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun has tasked you with the deaths of 4 Shattered Hand Centurions. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="你回来了。那些百夫长都死了吗？",pEN="You have returned. The centurions all lay dead?",c="很好，你已经赚到这笔赏金了。\n\n明天再回来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="Very well, you have earned your bounty.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11365]={d="东边的巨人平原起了骚动，刻有符文的石巨人开始往北边的霜刃峰迁徙。我不知道他们的意图，也不清楚他们的目的地。\n\n刻在他们身上的符文散发着诡异的光芒，驱使他们前进。如果你能击倒巨人，从他们体表剥下一些符文，符文的效力就会消散，便于我们展开研究。\n\n利用这把锄从巨人身上剥下一些符文石板，然后把它们给我带回来。",dEN="To the east, at Giants' Run, rune-inscribed stone giants have started to migrate north toward Frostblade Peak. I know nothing of their goals, nor of their destination.\n\nThe glowing runes inscribed in the stone flesh of the giants guide them on their journey. Fell some of these giants.\n\nTake this pick with you and use it on the corpses of the runed stone giants. It will deactivate the runes. Once you've tested enough giants, return to me with your findings.",o="冬蹄营地的先知厄丹要你在4个符文石巨人的尸体上使用符文搜寻之锄。",oEN="Sage Edan and Camp Winterhoof wants you to use the Runeseeking Pick on the corpses of 4 Runed Stone Giants.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you found?",c="「贤者听着你的发现。」北和西的符文一次又一次出现？\n我不是这些符文的专家，但它们的重复出现暗示着一条强大的指令。不过，这些刻痕不只是被动的方向指示。\n它们在把巨人拉向某个东西，可那是什么呢？\n\"\"\n\"\"",cEN="<The sage listens to your findings.>\n\nThe runes for \"north\" and \"west\" appeared over and over? I'm not an expert in these runes, but the repetition of them suggests a strong command.\n\nThese carvings are more than passive directions, though. They seem to pull the giants toward something, but what?"}
Q[11366]={d="我们必须查明是什么把巨人吸引向西北，这样就能在他们抵达目的地之前阻止他们。虽然符文样本给了我们一些线索，但那些我不认识的符文最让我担心。我造访巨人跑道时，注意到一块巨大而破碎的石板从地面突出，就在那片区域的东北部与霜刃峰脚下积雪相接的地方。拿上这个样本，把符文和那块石板比对一下，看看你能查明这块磁石的什么来历。\n\n\n\n",dEN="We must find what's luring the giants northwest, so we can stop them before they reach their destination.\n\nWhile the rune samples gave us some clues, the unknown runes worry me.\n\nWhen I visited Giants' Run, I noticed a large broken tablet jutting from the ground where the northeastern part of the area met the snow at the foot of Frostblade Peak. Take this sample, compare the runes with the tablet, and see what you can learn about the identity of this lodestone.",o="冬蹄营地的先知厄丹要你对符文样本与破碎石板进行比较。",oEN="Sage Edan at Camp Winterhoof wants you to compare the Rune Sample with the Broken Tablet.",p="你查出来是什么诱因吸引那些巨人了吗？",pEN="Have you discovered what lodestone attracts the giants?",c="<先知厄丹听你叙述发现。>\n\n麦加利斯？一份石板的文字翻译！这个麦加利斯一定是那些铁家伙神秘计划的核心。",cEN="<Edan listens as you describe your findings.>\n\nMegalith? A literal transcription from the tablet! This Megalith must be the centerpiece of the iron ones' mysterious plans."}
Q[11367]={d="在缚石者穆迪斯改造出的符文巨人中，拥有强大力量的麦加利斯脱颖而出，成为巨人迁徙行动的领头者。只要击败麦加利斯，巨人就会像无头苍蝇一样丧失方向。当我们向北迁徙时，我会请求酋长派遣一队士兵对付剩馀的巨人。没有了巨人的助力，那些铁矮人肯定抵挡不了多久。\n\n转至巨人平原的北部边界，在霜刃峰的丘陵地带搜寻麦加利斯的下落并击败他！",dEN="Binder Murdis created Megalith to be a kind of keystone for the runed giants and to lead them in their mission. Defeating Megalith will leave them lost and without direction. I will ask Chieftain Ashtotem to divert some of our men as we move north and dedicate them to eliminating the last of the runed giants. Without their giants, the Iron Dwarves cannot stand against us.\n\nSearch the foothills of Frostblade Peak, north of Giants' Run for Megalith and defeat him!",o="击败麦加利斯，然后返回冬蹄营地，向先知厄丹复命。",oEN="Defeat Megalith and return to Sage Edan at Camp Winterhoof.",p="你带来麦加利斯被击败的消息了吗？",pEN="Do you bring news of Megalith's downfall?",c="你击倒巨石之灵做得很好，但我在意他的遗言。\n你确定他说的是石铸之地？那不是我们族人知道的名字，但听起来可能是外来者所说的泰坦的造物。\n铁矮人向来是狡猾而危险的敌人，<name>。\n我们必须盯住这些巨人，在他们实施计划之前找到这个石铸之地。\"\n\"",cEN="You've done well in felling Megalith, but I wonder about his final words.\n\nYou're sure he said the Stoneforge?\n\nIt is not a name our people know, but it sounds like it might be a creation of the \"titans\" the ousiders speak of. The Iron Dwarves have ever been a cunning and dangerous foe, <name>. We must watch these giants and find this Stoneforge before they can carry out their plans."}
Q[11368]={d="我有个不太寻常的请求。有个特别特别有钱的家伙通过地下渠道向我求购一件令人毛骨悚然的东西。\n\n明确地讲，她想要夸格米拉的心脏。\n\n我听说那只动物有三颗心脏，不过一颗就足够满足我们这里的订单了。如果我记得没错，你可以在奴隶围栏里一处很深的水池中找到它。",dEN="I have an unusual request. A certain wealthy individual that I am in contact with off-world is interested in a macabre piece.\n\nSpecifically, she wants the heart of Quagmirran.\n\nI hear that the beast has three, but one will suffice for our purposes. As I understand it, you can find Quagmirran resting within a deep pool of water at the Slave Pens.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你取回夸格米拉之心。将心脏带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Heart of Quagmirran. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我想你在运送的过程中应该懂得如何保藏这颗心脏吧？",pEN="I trust that you know of a way to preserve the heart in transit?",c="现在我才觉得可惜，没有叫你顺便把另外两颗心脏一起带回来。也许下一次吧。不管如何，你得赢得了你的奖赏。\n\n明天再来找我吧，我还有别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="Now that I think of it, it's a pity I didn't ask you to return with the other two hearts as well. Perhaps next time. In any case, you've earned your commission.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11369]={d="据说，赞加沼泽的所有沼泽行者都有一个共同的母体，那就是黑色阔步者。假如黑色阔步者死去，它曾产下的卵就会孵化出来，成为新的黑色阔步者。\n\n现在，有位买家对那些卵感兴趣，据说她的动物园里想要添加一只新动物，以吸引游客。\n\n如果你对我开出的赏金感兴趣，就赶快去幽暗沼泽的黑色阔步者那里搞来它的卵吧。",dEN="There is only ever one great mother of the marsh walkers in Zangarmarsh. She is always known as the Black Stalker, and she hatches from one of the eggs left behind when her mother dies.\n\nI have a buyer who is interested in one of those eggs. He mentioned something about adding her as a zoo attraction.\n\nIf you are interested in the reward I am offering, travel to the Underbog and slay the Black Stalker for her egg.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你取回一枚黑色阔步者的卵。将卵带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem wants you to obtain a Black Stalker Egg. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我们再次交谈是因为你已经拿到了蛋，对吧？太杰出了，让我看看它！",pEN="We're speaking again because you have the egg? Outstanding, let me see it!",c="可以从蛋中感受到生命的脉动并不稀奇？我最好赶快把蛋送去给买家。我们可不希望它在这里孵化，对吧？\n\n你的酬劳已经准备好了。\n\n明天再来找我吧，我还有别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="Is it not amazing to feel the life pulsing within the egg? I must hurry to deliver it to the purchaser. We wouldn't want it hatching here now would we?\n\nYour payment is ready.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11370]={d="许多人都可以从头衔上得知，督军卡利瑟里斯是一位非常强大的战士，可是很少人知道他还是一位军事大师。\n\n我有一位客户恰好知道此事，而且对他的军事论文非常非常感兴趣。\n\n我要你立刻转至盘牙水库里的蒸汽地窟，去把那本书给我带回来。",dEN="While it is known that Warlord Kalithresh of the naga is a great warrior in his own right, there are fewer who know that he has codified all of his knowledge.\n\nOne of my customers is aware of it though, and is keenly interested in obtaining his treatise.\n\nI ask that you travel to the Steamvault in Coilfang Reservoir and obtain this book for me.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得督军的论文。将论文带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Warlord's Treatise. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我的顾客有点不耐烦了。我相信他想要了解督军的战术思考，好帮助他进行他的计划。",pEN="My customer grows restless. I believe he wishes to plumb the depths of the warlord's tactical thinking to help with one of his ongoing conflicts.",c="嗯，我怕我的顾客没有足够的时间把整本书看完了。不过，这不是我们该担心的事情。这是你的酬劳。\n\n明天再来找我，我还有别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="Indeed, I fear my customer will not have time to peruse the entirety of this book. Nevertheless, that is not our concern. Here is your reward.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11371]={d="玛哈杜恩听到了一些消息，并且打算借你的手去做些事情。\n\n总之，有人要我去想办法搞定那些盘牙部族的侍从，盘牙水库的蒸汽地窟就是他们的藏身之所。\n\n去吧，记住，他们必须被彻底消灭。",dEN="Mah'duun hears and obeys, and I now ask you to be my instrument.\n\nIt has been related to me that the myrmidons of the coilfang tribe must be destroyed. Seek them out within the humid confines of the Steamvault underneath Coilfang Reservoir.\n\nI will accept nothing less than their utter annihilation.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死14名盘牙侍从。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun has asked you to slay 14 Coilfang Myrmidons. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="你和盘牙部属的战斗进展的如何了？",pEN="How fares your fight against the coilfang myrmidons?",c="我相信这场战斗值得你所消耗的时间？起码赏金一定是值得的。\n\n明天再来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="I trust that it was a fight worthy of your time? Certainly this bounty will be.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11372]={d="最近，有一位牛头人女士的丈夫马上就要升任酋长了，因此她来找我，希望能为丈夫的帽子上添加一片特别的装饰。\n\n因此，她想要利爪之王艾吉斯的羽毛，对，就是那个卑鄙而可憎的利爪之王艾吉斯。\n\n如果你对赏金有兴趣的话，就立刻到奥金顿的塞泰克大厅里去干掉他吧。",dEN="I've recently been approached by a tauren whose husband is about to be elevated to chieftain. She wishes to make a special addition to his headdress.\n\nSpecifically, she wants to obtain the headfeathers from the dastardly Talon King Ikiss.\n\nIf you are interested in collecting my reward, travel to Auchindoun's Sethekk Halls and find him.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得艾吉斯的冠羽。将羽毛带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire The Headfeathers of Ikiss. Deliver them to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="酋长仪式的日期快要到了。",pEN="The time of the chieftain's ceremony grows near.",c="我相信这些羽毛会为酋长的头饰增色不少。\n你挣得了你的报酬，<class>。\n明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。",cEN="I am sure that these feathers will make a fine addition to the chieftain's headdress. You have earned your compensation, <class>.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11373]={d="今天我要请你帮个私人忙，但报酬一定会与风险相称。\n我的家族和枢纽王子沙法尔及其追随者有些，嗯，旧账。\n如果他佩戴的那枚护符落到我手里，那就意味着有人把他处理掉了。如果你对我开的赏金感兴趣，就去奥金顿的法力陵墓里他的巢穴走一趟。\n\"\n\"",dEN="Today I have a personal request of you, yet the reward will certainly match the danger.\n\nMy family has a 'history', shall we say, with Nexus-Prince Shaffar and his followers. If the amulet he wears were to fall into my hands then surely that would mean that he had been dealt with.\n\nIf the bounty I am offering is of interest to you then journey to his lair within Auchindoun's Mana-Tombs.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得沙法尔的精致饰物。将饰物带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem wants you to obtain Shaffar's Wondrous Amulet. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="没多少人知道萨法尔的魔力来自于他的护符。没有了护符他就失去了力量。\n\n不过，你有了这个就表示他已经死了。",pEN="Not many know that the source of Shaffar's magic rests solely within his amulet. Without it he is powerless.\n\nThen again, if you have it that must mean that he is dead.",c="<你可以感觉到风之贸易者获得了很大的满足。>\n\n很好，我很高兴听到他死去的消息。或许我能自己解开他护符的秘密。不然，我也可以把它卖个好价钱。\n\n我相信这样的报酬应该很适当。\n\n明天再来找我，我还别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="<You sense a deep level of satisfaction from the wind trader.>\n\nGood, I am glad to hear of his demise. And perhaps I will be able to unlock the secrets of his amulet for myself. If not, then I will sell it for a handsome price.\n\nI trust that this reward is sufficient.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11374]={d="在奥金尼地穴中，那些人为了了解通灵魔法的真谛，正进行着一系列令人作呕的实验。无数无辜的灵魂在那里受到了无止境的折磨与摧残。\n\n我有一位客户非常希望解放这些灵魂。我听说这些灵魂被囚禁在一块灵魂宝石之内，而这块宝石就在大大主教玛拉达尔的手上。\n\n立刻到地穴内找到他，把宝石抢回来吧。",dEN="Within Auchindoun's Auchenai Crypts many unsavory experiments are undertaken in the pursuit of a greater understanding of the necromantic arts. Many are the spirits that are tortured or destroyed therein.\n\nI have a customer who is interested in the liberation of one of those spirits. I have been informed that this spirit is contained within a soul gem held by none other than Exarch Maladaar himself.\n\nSeek him out within the crypts with all due haste and return to me with the gem.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得主教的灵魂宝钻。将宝钻带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to recover The Exarch's Soul Gem. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="你能想象自己永远被禁锢在宝石中吗？",pEN="Can you imagine being trapped within a gem for all eternity?",c="你真是位女英雄，<name>。\n我相信我的客户会找到办法，把他挚爱之人的灵魂从宝石中释放出来。活儿干得好，你的报酬在等着你。\n明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。",cEN="You're quite the heroine, <name>. I am certain that my customer will find a way to free the spirit of their loved one from within the gem. For a job well done, your payment awaits.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11375]={d="等我说完，你也许就不想接这桩委托了。\n我有一位古怪的客户，专门研究已死的现实。据说那个被称为低语的生物毁灭了它最后一次被召唤来的世界。\n这位教授有兴趣研究他所谓的低语，以弄清低语是如何达成这种壮举的。\n你愿意前往奥金顿的暗影迷宫，为我取回它吗？\"\n\"",dEN="When I'm done speaking, you may not want to take this commission.\n\nI have an eccentric client who specializes in the study of dead realities. It is rumored that the being known as Murmur destroyed the last world from which he was summoned. The professor is interested in examining his 'whisper' as he called it to understand how it is that Murmur accomplished such a feat.\n\nWill you journey to the Shadow Labyrinth within Auchindoun and retrieve it for me?",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得摩摩尔的低语。将这件器物带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain Murmur's Whisper. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="我甚至不太确定一个低语要如何在物质世界中具现，但教授向我保证，当你看到的时候你就会明白。\n\n也许那个东西像是个喉头？",pEN="I'm not even certain what form a whisper is supposed to take in the physical world, but the professor assures me that you'll know it when you see it.\n\nPerhaps it is something akin to the being's voice box?",c="我还担心你回不来了。我想你应该没有因为和摩摩尔战斗而聋了？\n\n这是你的奖赏。毫无疑问教授一定会很高兴的，虽然我有点担心他要拿这东西做什么。\n\n明天再来吧，我还有别的任务要你帮忙。",cEN="I was worried that you might not return. I trust that you didn't go deaf from fighting Murmur?\n\nHere is your reward. The professor will be pleased no doubt, though I worry what he ultimately wishes to do with this thing.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11376]={d="玛哈杜恩听说在暗影迷宫之内有一些可怕而残忍的六臂女魔头。\n\n立刻到奥金顿去，把这些恶魔都找出来，然后干掉。\n\n如果你连这么简单的委托都不能完成，我们以后恐怕就再也不用谈什么生意了。",dEN="Mah'duun has heard it said that none are as cruel as the six-armed demonesses inside the Shadow Labyrinth.\n\nGo to Auchindoun, seek them out, kill them all.\n\nIf you cannot accomplish so simple a task, we do not have anything further to say to one another.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死3名恶毒导师。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 3 Malicious Instructors. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="那些导师，她们都死光了吗？没有？\n\n我不是说没杀光她们之前不要回来吗？",pEN="The instructors, they are all dead? No?\n\nDid I not say not to return unless you had killed them all?",c="我很满意。通过虚空传达意旨的，也会同样满意。哈杜恩准备好你的赏金了。\n\n明天再来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="I am satisfied. He who speaks through the nether shall be as well. Mah'duun has your bounty prepared.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'deen."}
Q[11377]={d="我正在给一些与众不同的客人准备伙食。他们中有个家伙在从斯克提斯飞来的途中被一头巨大的卡利鸟撞了个嘴啃泥——他的腿严重骨折了。\n\n他们希望我能给他的康复聚会提供一点特别的食物：炖卡利鸟。\n\n我可以把我的烹锅借给你，这样你就可以用它来烹制美味了。这个食谱其实很简单，不过你需要一根巨型卡利鸟的翅膀和一些迁跃兽汉堡。",dEN="I'm providing the catering for some unusual party guests tonight. One of these fellows was flying around in Skettis and got knocked to the ground by a monstrous kaliri--his leg was broken badly.\n\nThey've requested something special for his get well party: Kaliri Stew.\n\nI can loan you my cooking pot so you can whip up a batch of stew for me. The recipe itself is simple, but you'll need to get a giant kaliri wing and some cooked warp burgers.",o="贫民窟的巨石洛克希望你用他的烹锅制作一些炖卡利鸟，完成之后回去找他。",oEN="The Rokk in Lower City has asked you to cook up some Kaliri Stew using his cooking pot. Return to him when it's done.",p="我是不是闻到什么很美味的东西？",pEN="Do I smell something tasty?",c="噢，我真的闻到美味的食物了！我希望你好好揍了一顿那些臭鸟。\n\n别客气，自己拿一些多的。我相信你的才能一定可以派上好用场的。",cEN="Oh, I do smell something tasty! I hope you gave that bird quite a good beating.\n\nPlease, help yourself to some of my extra stock. I'm sure someone of your talent could put it to good use."}
Q[11378]={d="我客户的品味从平庸到奇异都有。\n而有时他们想用找来的奇异物件做非常平庸的事。\n我眼下这桩委托就是如此。\n我的客户——必须隐去姓名——想得到时光猎手的头，挂在墙上做标本。\n$C，你能找到办法回到过去，前往旧希尔斯布莱德，为我这位爱好狩猎标本的雇主取得那颗头吗？",dEN="The tastes of my customers range from the mundane to the exotic. And sometimes they want to do very mundane things with the exotic objects they seek.\n\nSuch is the case with my latest request. My client, who shall remain nameless, wishes to obtain the head of the Epoch Hunter to mount on his wall.\n\n<class>, will you find a way to travel back in time to Old Hillsbrad and procure said head for my trophy-hunting patron?",o="商人扎雷姆要求你取回时空猎手的徽记。将徽记带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain the Epoch Hunter's Head. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="时空猎手的头颅……怎么会有人想要把这种东西挂在墙上？\n\n而且还不是亲自去猎杀它，而是叫他的朋友去对付那个东西？\n\n我猜，他只是在说谎。",pEN="The head of the Epoch Hunter... how does one come to the decision that they want it mounted on their wall?\n\nAnd even then, to not hunt the beast yourself, what does one say to their friends when asked how the fight went?\n\nHe'll lie, I suppose.",c="我看你完好无损地回到了现在。<El comerciante del viento mira a su alrededor>看起来什么都没变。不过话又说回来，我怎么会知道呢？切口不错；我的客户会满意的。这是你的报酬。明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="I see you are returned to the present time intact.\n\n<The wind trader looks around.>\n\nIt doesn't appear that anything has changed. But then again, how would I know?\n\nThat's a nice cut; my customer will be pleased. Here is your reward.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11379]={d="我正在尝试创造一些充满活力的东西。不过说实话，现在我更像是一个只会纸上谈兵的地精，我已经失去了冒险的感觉。\n\n但你……让我想起了我年轻的日子，一手握着剑，一手握着一口锅子。准备去征服整个世界吧！\n\n我希望你能拿上我最喜爱的烹锅去刀锋山，把一些肋排和香脆蛇——已经煮熟的最棒的香料——放在深渊烈焰使者的尸体上烤一下，那可是唯一可以把它们烤透的东西。",dEN="I'm trying to invent something with some real zing. But to be honest, I'm more of an idea goblin these days. I've lost my sense of adventure.\n\nBut you... remind me of my younger days; ready to take on the world with a sword in one hand and a skillet in the other.\n\nI want you to take my beloved cooking pot and head out to Blade's Edge. Throw in some shortribs and crunchy serpent--already cooked for extra flavor--and broil it over an abyssal's corpse, the only thing hot enough to do the trick.",o="贫民窟的巨石洛克希望你用他的烹锅、两份莫克纳萨肋排和一份香脆蛇制作一些恶魔烧烤，完成之后回去找他。",oEN="The Rokk in Lower City has asked you to cook up some Demon Broiled Surprise using his cooking pot, two Mok'Nathal Shortribs and a Crunchy Serpent. Return to him when it's done.",p="我的小实验进行的如何了呢？",pEN="Any luck with my little experiment?",c="看看这样东西……\n\n<洛克尝了一口这道混合的菜肴，他的脸呈现出一种既痛快又开心的奇特表情。>\n\n我的阿达尔啊，这味道真棒！像你这么有潜力的厨师应该随时都带着烹饪的材料。从我储备的材料中拿走一些吧，我以你为荣。",cEN="Now look at that...\n\n<The Rokk takes a sip of the concoction and his face twists into a bizarre mask of pain and delight.>\n\nSweet A'dal that's good! A cook with your potential shouldn't be without his proper materials. Take some of my extra stock and make me proud."}
Q[11380]={d="你知不知道，我刚把鱼和肉储存起来，就有个人过来要求我做一份既可以让他吃饱、又能让他精神振奋的食物：魔法草莓大餐。\n\n不幸的是，魔法莓只生长在虚空风暴的生态圆顶里。对了，虚灵对魔法莓有着特别的偏爱，所以风暴尖塔附近的魔法莓都被采光了。\n\n我只相信只有那些受过良好烹饪训练的厨师才能采到最好的魔法莓，所以不要让我失望！",dEN="Wouldn't you know it, I think my foodstuffs are up to date and someone comes along and requests the unusual: Mana Berry Delight.\n\nUnfortunately, mana berries are only found in the eco-domes of Netherstorm. Just don't bother looking around Stormspire--it's picked clean.\n\nI could only trust someone trained in the culinary arts to pick the best berries, so don't let me down!",o="贫民窟的巨石洛克要求你从虚空风暴的生态圆顶中收集15颗魔法莓，完成之后回去找他。",oEN="The Rokk in Lower City has asked you collect 15 Mana Berries from the Eco-Domes in Netherstorm.",p="运气如何，朋友？",pEN="Any luck, friend?",c="这些可是我见过的过最多汁的魔法莓了，光是瞧着它们就让我变聪明了。\n\n看来我不太需要那些鱼肉的存货了，那就送你一些？相信你一定可以做出一些美味的料理。",cEN="Those are the juiciest mana berries I've ever seen. I think I'm getting smarter just by looking at them.\n\nSince I no longer need most of my meat and fish stock, why don't you take some? I'm certain you could make something delicious."}
Q[11381]={d="我感觉到了一股强烈的杀气。我还从未收到过这么多购买我的名菜——灵魂之汤的订单。。\n\n我一眼就能看出，你和我一样醉心厨艺……那么你愿意帮我一把，顺便赚点小钱吗？\n\n过来，拿上我的烹锅，收集一些裂蹄牛肉，并且我会让你分享我的秘密。什么让我的汤如此大补？因为那不是鸡肉——我在纳格兰的先祖之地烹饪它，让它在那里吸收了所有灵气。",dEN="Death is in the air. I've never had so many orders for my famous soup--it lifts your spirits and soothes the soul.\n\nAnd I know a fellow cook when I see one! Would you like to help me out and get a cut of the profits?\n\nHere, take my cooking pot, gather some clefthoof meat and I'll let you in on a little secret. What makes my soup so good for the soul? It's not chicken--I cook it at the Ancestral Grounds in Nagrand to soak up all that spiritual stuff there.",o="贫民窟的巨石洛克希望你用他的烹锅制作一些灵魂之汤，完成之后回去找他。",oEN="The Rokk in Lower City has asked you to cook up some Spiritual Soup using his cooking pot. Return to him when it's done.",p="什么闻起来这么香？",pEN="What smells so good?",c="我可没闻过这么香的汤——只要一小撮胡椒就完成了。\n\n这是先前答应过的酬劳。你做得挺好好，我大概得割舍一些先前的存货了。",cEN="That is a fine batch of spiritual soup if I ever did smell one. Just a pinch of pepper and it's done.\n\nAs promised, here's your cut. And because you did such a fine job, I'm going to throw in some of my extra stock."}
Q[11382]={d="我敢发誓，这个客户一定是疯了。你看，世上有许多值得你去追求的东西，但也有你绝对不该想的！\n\n现在我的这个客户的脑子绝对绝对是进水，魔法冰川水！他竟然觊觎垂涎起埃欧努斯的沙漏了。\n\n对，你没有听错，永永恒之龙的埃欧努斯！\n\n但是……但是……他付出了能把一个国王赎回来的钱，我又有什么好说的？总之，去吧，到时光之穴的黑色沼泽去，把那沙漏给我取回来。",dEN="I swear that some of my customers are crazy. There are possessions that you go after, and there are ones that you dare not even think of!\n\nMy current client is clearly over-the-top insane. He covets the hourglass that Aeonus holds.\n\nYes, you heard right, Aeonus of the Infinite Dragonflight!\n\nWho am I to argue since he's paying a king's ransom? So, ready to go to the Caverns of Time and travel to the Black Morass to retrieve it for me?",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得埃欧努斯的沙漏。将沙漏带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire Aeonus's Hourglass. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="要是我是你，我一定会非常小心应付时光旅行。你说不定会不小心杀死你的某一位祖先，以致于抹消你现在的存在！",pEN="If I were you, I would be very careful with time-travel. You wouldn't want to accidentally do something, like kill one of your ancestors, and then accidentally erase yourself from the present!",c="奇怪，那东西里的沙子还在往上落。\n我想我会尽快把它送到新主人手里。\n谢谢你干得漂亮，<class>。\n你确实挣得了你的佣金。\n明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。",cEN="Odd that the sands in that thing are still falling upward. I think I will have it delivered to its new owner with all due haste.\n\nI thank you for a job well done, <class>. You have certainly earned your commission.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11383]={d="玛哈杜恩知道你该去哪儿，玛哈杜恩还知道你必须得去杀裂隙领主，但问题是，玛哈杜恩不知道你什么时候该去。\n\n我知道这话你不明白，不过传来的命令就是这样了。\n\n转至时光之穴的黑色沼泽，一切就都会明白了。",dEN="Mah'duun knows where you must go. Mah'duun knows that you must kill rift lords. But, Mah'duun does not know exactly when.\n\nI know that does not make sense, but the voice on the winds was not more specific.\n\nTravel to the Black Morass through the Caverns of Time and the way shall be made clear.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死4名裂隙领主。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 4 Rift Lords. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="我们在说话，但我感觉到裂隙领主们还没有全部死掉。等他们都死了再回来，<class>。\n\n",pEN="We are speaking, but I sense that all of the rift lords are not yet dead.\n\nReturn again when they are, <class>.",c="你找到了回到过去、再回到现在的路。\n你一定是一位了不起的<class>，<race>。赏金到手了。\n明天再来，风会再一次向玛赫杜恩低语。",cEN="You found your way back in time, and then back again. You must be a great <class>, <race>. The bounty is earned.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11384]={d="不久之前，一位卡多雷德鲁伊曾请求过我，喔，真的很令人同情。当然，开价也不错！\n\n总之，达纳苏斯方面希望能让一株叫作跃迁扭木的古树获得新生。当前，这棵树陷入了精神的混乱或是说污染，我不太确定。总之，你可以在风暴要塞的生态船那边找到。\n\n哦，她还说，她们只需要一小条嫩枝就可以使它重生。",dEN="Not long ago, I was approached by a kaldorei druidess with a touching request. And plenty of gold, of course!\n\nIt would appear that the forces of Darnassus wish to restore an ancient of the arcane known as Warp Splinter. The giant tree has been confused or corrupted, I'm not certain, but you'll find it inside of the Botanica at Tempest Keep.\n\nShe said that all they would need to regrow him was a small clipping.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得一份扭木碎片。将碎片带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain a Warp Splinter Clipping. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="你不知道怎么去生态船？你不会认错的……它就在风暴要塞，靠近虚空风暴的东侧边缘。",pEN="Did you lose your way to the Botanica? You can't miss it... it's at Tempest Keep off of the eastern edge of the Netherstorm.",c="哇，你拿到了！它好细小。不过，等那些德鲁伊完成了他们的计划——我听说得花上非常久的时间——迁跃扭木就会重新长成。\n\n这是先前答应的酬劳。\n\n明天再来找我，我还有别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="Aw, you did get it! It's so tiny. And yet, when the druids are done with it -- a process I am told will take a very long time -- Warp Splinter will be regrown anew.\n\nAnd here is your reward as promised.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11385]={d="今天，有人向玛哈杜恩传信说，希望看见那些寻日者部队手下的导魔者全都完蛋。\n\n他们就在风暴要塞的生态船里。\n\n如果你想要赏金，就去杀了那些导魔者。",dEN="It has been whispered to Mah'duun that the channelers of the military unit known as the Sunseekers must be killed today.\n\nThey are to be found within the Botanica at Tempest Keep.\n\nYou want the bounty, you kill the channelers.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死6名寻日者导魔者。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to kill 6 Sunseeker Channelers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="我们怎么可以在导魔师尚未死去前闲谈呢？",pEN="How can it be that we are speaking when the channelers are not all lying dead?",c="现在他们全都死去了，再也没有导魔师了。通过虚空低语者获得了满足，你可以领取你的赏金了。\n\n明天再来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="And now they are dead, channeling no longer. He who whispers upon the nether is satisfied and you have secured the bounty.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11386]={d="我一直以为计算者帕萨雷恩是用魔法把自己的影像投射到外域的。\n看来我错了。我最近这位客户告诉我，那个血精灵用一种机械装置与凯尔萨斯王子的特殊项目首领们通讯。\n据我所知，他是从虚空风暴的萨克斯叛军那里弄到的。\n我的客户想得到那台投射器。你为什么不去拜访一下帕萨雷恩？\n你会在风暴要塞的能源舰里找到他。",dEN="I always assumed that Pathaleon the Calculator used magic to project his image across Outland. Apparently I was wrong.\n\nMy latest customer tells me that the blood elf uses a mechanical device for his communication with the leaders of Prince Kael'thas's special projects. As I understand it, he acquired it from the Zaxxis rebels in the Netherstorm.\n\nMy client wishes to obtain the projector. Why don't you pay Pathaleon a visit? He can be found within the Mechanar at Tempest Keep.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得帕萨雷恩的投影仪。将投影仪带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to acquire Pathaleon's Projector. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="并不是那个投射科技有什么特别之处，而是它能投射的范围才是真正的技术突破！",pEN="It's not that projector technology is something special in and of itself, but the range of this particular model is a true breakthrough!",c="我忍不住想把它留下，把钱退给我的客户。它肯定能扩大我生意的范围。<El comerciante de vientos suspira>不过，我有一份名声要维持。说到我的名声，谢谢你帮我维持它。这是你的佣金。明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",cEN="I'm tempted to keep it for myself and return my client's money. It could certainly expand the reach of my business.\n\n<The wind trader sighs.>\n\nHowever, I have a reputation to uphold.\n\nSpeaking of my reputation, thank you for helping me to maintain it. Here is your commission.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11387]={d="玛哈杜恩接到了指示，说在能源舰中有些机器必须被拆掉。\n\n去风暴要塞，找到那些风暴锻铸摧毁者，摧毁它们。\n\n然后你就可以回来领取赏金了。",dEN="There are mechanical constructs within the Mechanar which Mah'duun has been told must be dismantled.\n\nGo to Tempest Keep, find the tempest-forge destroyers and destroy them.\n\nThen you may return to collect the bounty.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死5名风暴锻铸摧毁者。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to destroy 5 Tempest-Forge Destroyers. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once they all lie dead in order to collect the bounty.",p="<虚空巡者歪着头，显然对你的出现感到困惑。>\n\n那些毁灭者还没有被全数消灭。",pEN="<The nether-stalker cocks his head in apparent confusion at your presence.>\n\nThe destroyers have not all been destroyed.",c="哈杜恩喜欢和构装生物作战，它们不像有机生物那样麻烦。\n\n赏金是你的了。\n\n明天再来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="Mah'duun enjoys fighting constructs; they are less messy than organic beings.\n\nThe bounty is yours.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11388]={d="今天的客户似乎在寻找某样很特别的东西。\n\n据说，上古之神有一位仆从叫作预言者斯克瑞斯，它身上携带着一份上古之神的卷轴，里面写着让他操控宇宙中的其它生物为他们服务的指示。\n\n我当前这位买主想要这份卷轴，至于读不读得懂，他不关心。\n\n现在，立刻去风暴要塞的禁魔监狱，帮我把这份卷轴抢回来吧。你说怎么样，$c？",dEN="Today's client seeks something truly unique.\n\nIt is said that Harbinger Skyriss is a servant of the Old Gods. It is also said that he carries a large scroll that contains their instructions for his domination of life in the universe on their behalf.\n\nMy current buyer wishes to get <his /her> hands on that scroll, nevermind that <he /she> won't be able to read the language upon it.\n\nTravel to Tempest Keep's Arcatraz and get it for me, will you, <class>?",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得斯克瑞斯的卷轴。将卷轴带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式下完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Scroll of Skyriss. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed on Heroic difficulty.",p="牵扯进入上古诸神的事情一定非常危险。\n\n幸好是你不是我！",pEN="It must be a very dangerous thing to do to meddle directly in the affairs of the Old Gods.\n\nBetter you than me!",c="我不敢碰那卷卷轴，免得我也冒上引起上古之神注意的风险。我会让一名助手去处理运送。你挣得的报酬远远超过了你应得的，<class>，我祝你在已知世界里好运连连。明天再来，我会有另一个请求要交给你。\n\n\n\n",cEN="I dare not touch the scroll lest I too risk the notice of the Old Gods. I will have one of my assistants handle its delivery.\n\nYou have more than earned your reward, <class>, and I wish you all the luck in the known worlds.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11389]={d="禁魔监狱内的所有哨兵都陷入了混乱状态。里面的囚犯发动了暴乱，而那些守卫竟然攻击前去帮助他们的人。\n\n玛哈杜恩从灵风之中听到了雇主的要求，他要我们摧毁那些哨兵。\n\n去完成这个委托，赏金就是你的了。",dEN="The sentinels within the Arcatraz have gone haywire. The prisoners run rampant and the guards attack those that would help.\n\nMah'duun hears the speaker on the nether winds. The speaker says to destroy the sentinels.\n\nAccomplish this and today's bounty is yours.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死5名禁魔监狱斥候。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，找他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to dismantle 5 Arcatraz Sentinels. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once that has been accomplished in order to collect the bounty.",p="你不知道怎么去风暴要塞和禁魔监狱吗？它们位在虚空风暴的东边，一个在高空中，而另一个高度较低，看你想去哪一个地方。",pEN="Do you not know how to get to Tempest Keep and the Arcatraz? East through the Netherstorm and then fly or fall, the choice is yours.",c="既然那些哨兵已经被摧毁了，也许纳鲁会叫星界财团取代他们？哈杜恩并不知道也不想知道。\n\n你已经可以领取赏金了。\n\n明天再来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="With the sentinels destroyed, perhaps the naaru will ask the Consortium to replace them? Mah'duun does not know and does not care.\n\nYou have earned the bounty.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11390]={d="那么，你还在等什么呢？我们有大把工作要做！\n\n这是飞行器的钥匙。将3袋古器运到钢铁之门北面和南面的起重机平台上。我会在平台上做好标记，免得你找不到。\n\n快去吧！别浪费时间了！",dEN="Well, what are you waiting for, there's work to be done!\n\nHere's the keys to our flying machine. Grab three sacks of relics and haul them up to the crane platforms on the north and south sides of Steel Gate. I'll mark them for you.\n\nHurry up! We haven't got all day!",o="钢铁之门首席考古学家希望你将3袋古器从挖掘场底部运到钢铁之门北边或南边的平台上。\n\n利用飞行器上的抓升钩搬运古器。\n\n完成任务后向钢铁之门首席考古学家复命。",oEN="The Steel Gate Chief Archaeologist wants you to transport 3 Sacks of Relics from the bottom of the site and take them to the platform on the north or south side of Steel Gate.\n\nUse the grappling hook on the flying machine to do this.\n\nReport back to him after you've done so.",p="哎？你拖运完所有东西了吗？",pEN="Eh? You finished with all of that hauling?",c="干得好，不过我觉得你应该要补习一下基础的驾驶课程。\n\n哎，没关系，有总比没有好。这是你今天的报酬。",cEN="Good job, though I think ye might be wanting a refresher course in basic piloting.\n\nWell, no matter, one warm body's as good as another. Here's yer haul for the day."}
Q[11391]={d="嗯？你又回来找活干了？\n\n很好，来，给你钥匙。我们今天没什么需要搬运的，你只要出去巡逻一圈，留神任何可疑情况就行了，明白吗？\n\n我已经在飞行器上装载了火箭弹和机关枪——以防万一嘛。",dEN="Eh? Yer back for another day's work?\n\nWell, alright, here's the keys. We don't need any haulin' today, so just keep an eye out for anything suspicious, okay?\n\nI've hooked her up with some rockets and a machine gun - just in case.",o="你现在是钢门最好的$g飞行员:飞行员;了，所以钢门首席考古学家要你在挖掘场周围巡逻，击退任何来袭者。巡逻结束后回去向他汇报。\n\n",oEN="You're Steel Gate's ace pilot now, so the Steel Gate Chief Archaeologist wants you to keep patrol around the dig site and fight off anything that attacks.\n\nReport back to him when you're done with your patrol.",p="石像鬼？！我看过他们！你把他们全都解决了吗？\n\n这世界到底发生什么事，连矮人在挖掘时都会被攻击。",pEN="Gargoyles?! I saw them out there! Did ya take care of 'em all?\n\nWhat's the world comin' to when a dwarf cannot even dig without being attacked.",c="瞄得准，高手。\n\n这是你的报酬。明天再来巡一趟，有听到吗？",cEN="Nice shooting, ace.\n\nHere's your wages. Come back tomorrow for another round, ya hear?"}
Q[11393]={d="$n，我的未婚夫贾伦带着一小队探险者往西去了，去查证关于寒冰海岸神器的传闻。\n但那里有鱼人，我怕他们已经遭遇了最坏的情况。你总有时间去看看他们是否安然无恙吧？\n往西南方向有一条通往海滩的路，不过要小心座狼和潜伏在树林里的其他东西。",dEN="<name>, my betrothed, Jaren, went west with a small group of explorers to check into rumors of artifacts on the Chillmere Coast. But there are murloc down there, and I fear the worst has befallen them.\n\nSurely you have time to see if they're alright? There's a way down to the beach just to the southwest, though watch out for the worgs and other things lurking in the woods.",o="工头伊蕾娜·石衣希望你去找到她的未婚夫，探险者亚伦。",oEN="Overseer Irena Stonemantle has asked you to locate her fiance, Explorer Jaren.",c="<当你告诉他，谁派你来找他时，探险者露出了微笑。他依旧压低了声音。>\n\n伊蕾娜关心我？她简直就和她的父亲一样。",cEN="<The explorer beams a smile as you tell him who sent you. He continues in hushed tones.>\n\nIrena was concerned about me? She gets that from her father you know."}
Q[11394]={d="有传言说切米尔海岸埋藏着珍贵的古器，于是我跟随探险队来这里调查实情。我原本以为海滩是鱼人的地盘，但是当我看见这一切时，简直不敢相信自己的眼睛！\n\n<探险者伸出头来瞧了瞧四周。>\n\n天灾军团占领了切米尔海岸，他们将鱼人和其它生物变成了一具具的行尸走肉！\n\n$C，我们应该做点什么。你能解决掉那些天灾军团的成员吗？",dEN="Originally I came down here to investigate some rumors about artifacts to be dug up. I knew that there were murlocs along the coast here, but I never in a million years thought I'd see this.\n\n<The explorer pokes his head out to look around the tree.>\n\nThe Scourge are out there, and they're changing murlocs, and anything else they can get their hands on, into the walking dead!\n\n<class>, I think it's our duty to do something about this. Think you could take out a good chunk of those Scourge?",o="探险者亚伦要你转至切米尔海岸，在那里杀死15名任意种类的天灾军团成员，完成任务后向他复命。",oEN="Explorer Jaren has asked you to kill 15 Scourge of any type along the Chillmere Coast. Return to him once you have done so.",p="我不知道，<class>，看起来你消灭的还不够多。",pEN="I don't know, <class>, it doesn't look like you've destroyed enough of them yet.",c="<Jaren 对你的成功显得非常兴奋，但他示意你压低声音说话。>\n\n干得好，<name>！不过你身上沾满了天灾军团的黏液。也许你该考虑去海峡里快速泡个澡。水很冷，但能很快把你洗干净。",cEN="<Jaren seems very excited about your success, but motions you to keep your conversation to a whisper.>\n\nGreat job, <name>! That's a lot of Scourge goo all over your stuff though. You might want to think about a quick dip in the strait. It's cold, but it'll get you cleaned up right quick."}
Q[11395]={d="死去的天灾军团成员手中紧握着一件装置，上面镶嵌着一枚宝石，看上去很像是悬浮在天灾水晶顶端的那种宝石。\n\n应该把这玩意儿交给探险者亚伦瞧瞧。",dEN="The Scourge creature you just destroyed had this device held in its clutches. It has a jewel set into it which looks similar to the one that tops the scourging crystals.\n\nSurely, Explorer Jaren would like to have a look at this.",o="将天灾设备交给切米尔海岸的探险者亚伦。",oEN="Deliver the Scourge Device to Explorer Jaren on the Chillmere Coast.",p="你手里那个装置真奇怪，<class>。让我仔细看看。",pEN="What an odd-looking device you have there, <class>. Let me have a closer look at it.",c="我知道这是什么！<name>，这是控制那些天灾水晶的装置！\n\n我敢打赌它肯定能用来关闭它们的力场。嗯……\n\n<探险者若有所思，琢磨着你拿到这个装置意味着什么。>",cEN="I know what this is! <name>, it's a controlling device for those scourging crystals!\n\nI bet anything that it can be used to shut down their force fields. Hmmm.\n\n<The explorer looks thoughtful as he ponders the implications of you having the device.>"}
Q[11396]={d="瞧，控制器侧面有个按钮。我敢打赌，如果你离天灾水晶够近的话，就可以用控制器关闭它的护盾。接下来嘛，在护盾恢复之前摧毁水晶就行啦。\n\n$n，怎么样？你愿意接受这项任务吗？只要你顺利地关闭护盾并摧毁水晶，就能得到一份很棒的奖励。\n\n天灾军团疯狂地将其它生物转换成他们的同类，这是我们唯一能阻止他们的方法。",dEN="Look at the button on the side of the controller here. I bet if you got close enough to one of those scourging crystals, you could use the controller to bring its shield down. Then it would simply be a matter of destroying the thing before its shield goes back up.\n\nWhat do you say, <name>? You up for it? I can guarantee a nice reward for you if you can bring down those shields and destroy the crystals.\n\nIt's the least we can do to keep the Scourge from making more of their own kind.",o="切米尔海岸的探险者亚伦要你摧毁3颗天灾水晶。",oEN="Explorer Jaren on the Chillmere Coast has asked you to destroy 3 Scourging Crystals.",p="我不知道，<name>。我想你还得再干掉几只那种东西。",pEN="I don't know, <name>. I think you need to take out a few more of those things.",c="太好了！\n\n<Jaren 迅速环顾四周，确认没有东西注意到他的失态。>\n\n好吧，你当然有资格从我在这里找到的这些东西里挑一件。\n\n还有，<name>，如果你碰巧又回到钢门，替我向伊蕾娜问好，让她知道我还好。",cEN="Nice!\n\n<Jaren looks around quickly to make sure that nothing noticed his outburst.>\n\nAlright, you certainly earned your pick of one of these things I found while I was down here.\n\nAnd, <name>, if you happen to find yourself back at Steel Gate, give Irena my love and let her know that I'm okay."}
Q[11397]={d="我来这里是为了调查附近有天灾军团出现的传言。我本以为下面海岸上只有鱼人，可从没想过会看到这种场面！\n\n天灾军团就在下面，他们正把那些鱼人，以及一切能抓到的东西，都变成行尸走肉！\n\n$C，我们绝不能容许他们制造更多的同类，尤其是用鱼人来制造！营地西北方有一条通往海滩的坡道。去及时处理掉那些天灾军团吧！",dEN="I came here to investigate a rumor about a Scourge presence nearby. I expected murlocs along the coast down below, but I never thought I'd see this!\n\nThe Scourge are down there, and they're changing murlocs, and anything else they can get their hands on, into the walking dead!\n\n<class>, we will not suffer them to create more of their kind, especially not from murlocs! There is a ramp down to the beach just northwest of the camp. See to it that you deal with the Scourge in a timely fashion!",o="药剂师安娜斯塔西娅要你转至切米尔海岸，杀死15名任意种类的天灾军团成员。完成任务后返回药剂师营地向她复命。",oEN="Apothecary Anastasia has asked you to destroy 15 Scourge of any type along the Chillmere Coast. Return to her at the Apothecary Camp once you have done so.",p="这很有趣……我上次观察的结果显示你击杀的数量还不够。也许你应该要再加把劲？",pEN="That's interesting, when last I looked it didn't appear as if you'd destroyed enough of them yet. Perhaps you might redouble your efforts?",c="<安娜斯塔西娅思索了一阵子。>\n\n你的工作令人满意，然而我感觉到我们应该多做点什么以阻止天灾军团在这片海滩上的扩张。",cEN="<Anastasia ponders your success for a moment.>\n\nA satisfactory job to be certain, yet somehow I sense that there's something else we should be doing to stop the efforts of the Scourge on that beach."}
Q[11398]={d="死去的天灾军团成员手中紧握着一件装置，上面镶嵌着一枚宝石，看上去很像是悬浮在天灾水晶顶端的那种宝石。\n\n应该把这玩意儿交给药剂师安娜斯塔西娅瞧瞧。",dEN="The Scourge creature you just destroyed had this device held in its clutches. It has a jewel set into it which looks similar to the one that tops the scourging crystals.\n\nSurely, Apothecary Anastasia would like to have a look at this.",o="将天灾设备交给药剂师营地的安娜斯塔西娅。",oEN="Deliver the Scourge Device to Apothecary Anastasia at the Apothecary Camp.",p="你手里那是什么，<class>？让我仔细看看！",pEN="What's that you have there, <class>? Let me have a closer look at it!",c="我可以告诉你这是什么，<name>。这是控制下面那些天灾水晶的装置！\n\n我敢打赌它肯定能用来关闭它们的力场。嗯……\n\n<La boticaria parece pensativa mientras reflexiona sobre las implicaciones de que tengas el dispositivo>",cEN="I can tell you what this is, <name>. It's a controlling device for those scourging crystals down there!\n\nI bet anything that it can be used to shut down their force fields. Hmmm.\n\n<The apothecary looks thoughtful as she ponders the implications of you having the device.>"}
Q[11399]={d="瞧，控制器侧面有个按钮。我敢打赌，如果你离天灾水晶够近的话，就可以用控制器关闭它的护盾。接下来嘛，在护盾恢复之前摧毁水晶就行啦。\n\n$n，怎么样？你愿意接受这项任务吗？只要你顺利地关闭护盾并摧毁水晶，就能得到一份很棒的奖励。\n\n你无法拒绝这样一个削弱天灾士兵数量的大好机会——尤其是考虑到“天灾鱼人”这种可怕的东西时……",dEN="Look at the button on the side of the controller here. I bet if you got close enough to one of those scourging crystals, you could use the controller to bring its shield down. Then it would simply be a matter of destroying the thing before its shield goes back up.\n\nBrave enough to hazard another trip down there, <name>? I can guarantee a nice reward for you if you can bring down those shields and destroy the crystals.\n\nHow can you refuse if it means less Scourge, especially ones made from murlocs?",o="药剂师营地的药剂师安娜斯塔西娅要你摧毁3颗天灾水晶。",oEN="Apothecary Anastasia at the Apothecary Camp has asked you to destroy 3 Scourging Crystals.",p="你摧毁的天灾水晶数量还不够。你要摧毁够多才能拿到报酬。",pEN="You still haven't destroyed enough scourging crystals. No reward until you do so.",c="<Anastasia 转过身，对她的魅魔笑了笑。>\n\n好吧，<name>，我承认你确实有资格从这些东西里挑一件。",cEN="<Anastasia turns and smiles at her succubus.>\n\nVery well, <name>, I concede that you have certainly earned a choice of one of these."}
Q[11400]={d="如果你将手上的戳印给波尔·冻石看看，就能从他那里买到赛羊会的赛羊。",dEN="If you show this hand stamp to Pol Amberstill, the Ram Racing Apprentice, he'll allow you to purchase Brewfest riding rams.",o="把\"荣誉酿酒师\"手印带给丹莫罗美酒节场地入口附近的波尔·冻石。",oEN="Bring the \"Honorary Brewer\" Hand Stamp to Pol Amberstill near the entrance to the Brewfest Grounds in Dun Morogh.",p="你手上那个是\"荣誉酿酒师\"的印章吗？",pEN="Is that an \"Honorary Brewer\" stamp you've got on your hand?",c="干得好，<name>……你赢得了节日酿酒师们的信任，获得了购买美酒节坐骑山羊的权利。",cEN="Good job, <name>... you've won the trust of the festival's brewers, earning the right to purchase a Brewfest riding ram."}
Q[11403]={d="我曾被愤怒囚禁，$n，而你把我解放了出来。\n我以为自己做得对，如今我的灵魂为带给艾泽拉斯善良民众的恐惧与死亡而哭泣。\n谢谢你引领我重回圣光。\n愿我再也不会迷失这条正道。\n把这本残破的祈祷书带给一位孤儿院女总管，让孩子们知道我再也不会纠缠他们了。",dEN="Rage was my prison, <name>, and you have freed me. Though I thought I did right, my soul now weeps for the terror and the death I have caused the good people of Azeroth.\n\nThank you for leading me back to the Light. May I never again lose my way.\n\nTake this torn prayer book to an orphan matron, so the children will know that I will haunt them no more.",o="将这本破损的圣典交给杜隆塔尔、布瑞尔或鹰翼广场的穿戏服的孤儿院长。",oEN="Take the Tome of Thomas Thomson to a Masked Orphan Matron in Durotar, Brill or Falconwing Square.",c="什么？这本神圣的典籍曾属于一位臭名昭著的联盟圣骑士。他就是无头骑士吗？这是否意味着无头骑士已经被击败了？\n\n这是光荣的一天，<name>！你的传说将熠熠生辉，愿它比无头骑士的恐怖统治长久两倍。",cEN="What? This holy tome once belonged to an infamous paladin of the Alliance. Was he the Headless Horseman? Does this mean that the Horseman is defeated?\n\nThis is a glorious day, <name>! Your legend will shine bright, and may it last for twice the years of the Horseman's reign of fear."}
Q[11405]={d="许多悲伤蜡烛装饰着这座南瓜祭坛，摇曳的火光似乎是在窃笑与嘲讽着你……",dEN="Many dreary candles adorn this pumpkin shrine, which grins, taunting...",o="将一根悲伤蜡烛插入翻过的泥土。",oEN="Take a Dreary Candle to the Loosely Turned Soil.",p="这处的泥土最近曾被翻开过。蚯蚓爬到泥土表层挣扎地想要逃开底下的黑暗深渊。",pEN="This dirt has been recently disturbed. Earthworms lie in the topsoil, squirming to escape the dark depths beneath them.",c="你要放下蜡烛，把无头骑士从他注定毁灭的安息中召唤出来吗？\n相关",cEN="Will you lay the candle down and call the Headless Horseman from his doomed rest?\nRelated"}
Q[11406]={d="远征军部队北伐在即，这几天亚当斯上尉也一直非常关注维德瓦堡垒那边的准备工作是否完备。那边的斥候和工匠一直在按命令筹备着各类装备和补给，保障我们的军队能顺利翻山进入丘陵地带。\n\n要知道，上尉的脾气可不怎么好，所以我希望派人先去确保一下准备工作进展顺利。维德瓦堡垒在东北方，比斯克恩还要再远些。走到临近灰熊丘陵边界的那些被冰雪复盖的区域，就可以找到它了。到了那里之后，去找基尔·克利瑟，向他确认准备工作的进展。",dEN="When the expeditionary force moves north, Captain Adams expects everything to be ready at Fort Wildervar. The scouts and craftsmen there have been tasked with preparing the gear and rations for our men for the climb into the hills.\n\nThe captain's famous for his temper, so I want to send someone ahead to check on the preparations. Fort Wildervar is far to the northeast, beyond Skorn, up in the snow-covered areas near the border with Grizzly Hills. Find Gil Grisert there and make sure he is prepared.",o="与维德瓦堡垒的基尔·克利瑟谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gil Grisert at Fort Wildervar.",c="所以是军需官派你来的？\n\n<基尔看起来松了一口气。>\n\n说老实话，我们这边的进度有点落后，如果想达成目标我们会需要一点帮忙。\n\n<基尔颤抖了一下。>\n\n没人想要面对亚当斯上尉的怒火。",cEN="So the quartermaster sent you?\n\n<Gil seems relieved.>\n\nTo be honest, we're running a bit behind here and we're going to need some help making our goals.\n\n<Gil shudders.>\n\nNone of the men want to brave the wrath of Captain Adams."}
Q[11407]={d="你想要为美酒节增添光彩吗？我们要你在力量谷的拍卖所外、荣誉谷、智慧谷以及精神谷的旗帜下高声叫喊。\n\n我的赛羊和马鞭借你用4分钟哦。\n\n千万小心，吝啬的地精们可不会在奥格瑞玛里面放上苹果箱。",dEN="So, do you want to help bring strength and honor to Brewfest? We need you to shout at the flags outside the auction house in the Valley of Strength, in the Valley of Honor, in the Valley of Wisdom and in the Valley of Spirits.\n\nWe'll lend you a racing ram for 4 minutes and also give you these racing reins.\n\nBe careful though, the cheap goblins didn't put any apple crates along the way.",o="在力量谷的拍卖行外、荣誉谷、智慧谷以及精神谷的旗帜下高声叫喊，宣传美酒节。",oEN="Spread the word about Brewfest at the flags outside the auction house in the Valley of Strength, in the Valley of Honor, in the Valley of Wisdom and in the Valley of Spirits.",p="你结束了为美酒节的宣传了吗？",pEN="Have you finished spreading the word about Brewfest?",c="你信守诺言，让人知道了我们啤酒大师的名号。感谢你。这是我们答应的奖品章，很高兴能交给你这些。我想那些巨魔一定很吝于支付这些奖品章……\n\n改天再回来帮忙美酒节的宣传吧。",cEN="You kept your word and let people know about our brewmasters. Thank you. We promised you these tickets, and gladly give them to you. I imagine the trolls are a bit more stingy with handing over their tickets...\n\nCome back another day to help us spread the word about Brewfest."}
Q[11408]={d="我们计划在美酒节上推销巨魔酿造的美酒。你得在力量谷的拍卖所外、荣誉谷、智慧谷以及精神谷的旗帜下高声叫喊。\n\n不过我会为你提供便利的，喏，我的赛羊和马鞭借你用4分钟哦。\n\n千万小心，地精们可不会在奥格瑞玛中放上苹果箱，他们是一帮不折不扣的吝啬鬼。",dEN="We need to spread the word about the trolls at Brewfest. Ya need to shout at the flags outside the auction house in the Valley of Strength, in the Valley of Honor, in the Valley of Wisdom and in the Valley of Spirits.\n\nBut I'll make it easy for ya, I'll lend you a racing ram for 4 minutes. I'll also give you these racing reins.\n\nBe careful though, the goblins didn't put any apple crates along the way. They are cheap like that.",o="在力量谷的拍卖行外、荣誉谷、智慧谷以及精神谷的旗帜下高声叫喊，宣传美酒节。",oEN="Spread the word about Brewfest at the flags outside the auction house in the Valley of Strength, in the Valley of Honor, in the Valley of Wisdom and in the Valley of Spirits.",p="你结束了为美酒节的宣传了吗？更重要的是，你让大家知道了惊人的巨魔啤酒了吗？",pEN="Have you finished spreading the word about Brewfest? But more importantly, did you let people know about the amazing troll brew?",c="你做到了！客人会像潮水般涌来我们这边，得及早准备！感谢！\n\n对了，这是我们承诺过的酬劳。可不能忘了这个……\n\n改天再回来帮忙美酒节的宣传吧。",cEN="Ya did it! We gotta get ready for the flood of customers that are sure to come our way! Thanks!\n\nOh, that's right, and we promised you a reward. Can't forget about that...\n\nFeel free to stop by again another day to help us spread the word some more."}
Q[11409]={d="你想要参加赛羊会？矮人们都说自己是驾驭山羊的高手，不过说实话，他们大多数时候都醉醺醺的，骑羊能又什么难的？\n\n在你大显身手之前，你得证明自己能够驾驭这些彪悍的坐骑。\n\n那么，我会借你一根特殊的马鞭和一头赛羊。你需要证明自己的驾驭能力。\n\n让赛羊保持快走、慢跑和疾跑状况各8秒。",dEN="So you want to check out the racing rams? The dwarves think they have got a handle on it, but let's be honest, they are drunk most of the time, so how hard can it really be?\n\nNow before I let you strut your stuff, you'll need to show me that you can handle these fine, legally obtained creatures.\n\nSo here's the deal: I'll lend you some racing reins and the use of a ram. You need to prove to me that you can handle using these rams.\n\nKeep the ram at a trot, canter and gallop for 8 seconds each.",o="你有4分钟时间驾驭赛羊，让它保持三种不同的速度各8秒。",oEN="You have 4 minutes to ride the ram and maintain 3 different levels of speed for 8 seconds.",p="你能够掌控速度吗？",pEN="Have you got a handle on riding racing rams?",c="干得漂亮！要学会怎么操控你的山羊得花上不少时间。当你一旦做到，你就会希望每只山羊都是竞速山羊。\n\n你说什么？“我的报酬在哪里？”哈哈哈……你得试试最快的山羊！你想要更多？那这样如何……\n\n你赢得了替美酒节服务的权力，那边有许多事情 可做，有许多的报酬。尤其是对一个年轻急躁的山羊赛手。",cEN="Hey, that wasn't too bad... are you sure you're not a dwarf?\n\nSo there's plenty more racing to be had and it's not just from me. All over the Brewfest grounds you'll find people in need of a decent ram racer. So go and make yourself useful.\n\nOh and don't forget, these rams were legally obtained. I just want to make sure we're clear."}
Q[11410]={d="你带来的鲇鱼很不错，做成的鱼饵对大多数的鱼都有效果，不过……我担心它会引来那只水怪！\n\n刚到这里的时，我在鱼钩上用过一些纳特·帕格的鱼饵，当时想也没想就抛杆入水。结果……一只大水怪咬住了鱼钩，并且在挣扎的时候把线缠在了它体表那嶙峋的冰柱上！\n\n那时候要不是我眼疾手快切断了线，早就被拖进水里吃掉了！在干掉这只名叫霜鳞的怪物之前，我是绝对不敢用新鱼饵的。这个工作就交给你了，到湖中央沉船那边去使用这种新鱼饵，把那只水怪诱出来干掉。它一定会上钩的！一定！",dEN="The barbfish you brought should work well as bait for most fish, but I fear it'll attract a monster!\n\nWhen I first arrived, I put some of Nat Pagle's favorite bait on my hook and cast it into the water. A huge monster latched on, with giant teeth and icicles hanging from its fins!\n\nWould've pulled me into those icy waters if I hadn't cut the line! I can't use the new bait until ol' Frostfin's been dealt with. Use this bait near the sunken boat in the middle of the lake. He won't be able to resist!",o="维德瓦堡垒的克里斯托弗·斯洛安要你击败霜鳞。",oEN="Christopher Sloan at Fort Wildervar wants you to defeat Frostfin.",p="我很渴望尝试新饵。\n\n你处理霜鳍的情况还顺利吗？",pEN="I'm itching to try out the new bait.\n\nHave you had any luck with Frostfin?",c="我们终于可以安安静静地钓鱼了！当然，等我们钓上东西的时候，探险队就会赶来把一切都据为己有。\n\n我们谢谢你，<name>。别在这儿见外。",cEN="At last, we can finally fish in peace! 'Course, by the time we catch anything, the expedition'll arrive and claim it all for themselves.\n\nYou have our thanks, <name>. Don't be a stranger 'round here."}
Q[11411]={d="我以前跑腿当信使的时候，曾在峡湾的两岸远远看见过许多本地的原住民。其中有一种最为神秘，从远距离上看，这类原住民跟牛头人很像，但如果靠近仔细观察的话，两者之间又有所不同——这些原住民显然要比普通牛头人更强壮，体格更高大，毛发也更粗糙一些。\n\n我在哈尔格林德和斯克恩的北边找到了一处他们的定居点，就在那边的森林中。那个定居点据说叫冬蹄营地，在亚勒霍恩丘陵地的脚下，也就是苍松岭的边界旁。你去与他们接触一下吧，看看他们是否能对我们有所帮助。",dEN="In my travels as a courier, I've seen a number of strange denizens of the Howling Fjord, but one group stands out. From a distance, they look like tauren, but upon closer inspection, they're quite different -- sturdier and shaggier.\n\nI found one of their settlements far to the north, beyond Halgrind, Skorn, and the northern forests. Camp Winterhoof, it's called, and it sits in the foothills of Gjalerhorn near the border with Grizzly Hills. Make contact with them, and see if they might be of use to us.",o="与冬蹄营地的灰烬图腾酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Chieftain Ashtotem at Camp Winterhoof.",c="<酋长聆听着你的自我介绍。>\n\n外地人，我是灰烬图腾酋长，我的族人是牦牛人，我们说话真诚。在我的族人之中，信赖是要挣来的，不是施舍来的。我允许你可以在他们之中行走，并且提供你的协助。时间越来越紧迫，我的族人将不惜借助外地人的协助。",cEN="<The chieftain listens as you introduce yourself.>\n\nI am Chieftain Ashtotem, and my people are the taunka, and I will speak truly, outsider. Among my people, trust is earned, not given. You have my leave to walk among them and offer your assistance. Time grows short and some of them may welcome even an outsider's help with their preparations."}
Q[11412]={d="你在这儿真好，我们遇到大麻烦了！替我运送酒桶的地精在离开剃刀岭的路上遇到了意外事件。你必须替我们运回那些酒桶！\n\n骑上一头赛羊转至剃刀岭吧。\n\n当你跑近他时，他会把酒桶抛给你，然后你带着酒桶回到这儿来，再把酒桶抛给我的助手就行啦。我们总共需要3只酒桶。这事儿你要是能办得妥当，我或许能安排些别的工作给你。",dEN="Am I glad you're here. We are in big trouble! The goblin that was supposed to be bringing us more brew had an accident on his way from Razor Hill. You gotta get us that brew!\n\nI'll put you on one of my racing rams and you follow the road to Razor Hill.\n\nOnce you get near him he'll toss you a keg, then you run the keg back here and toss the keg to my more capable assistant. For now, all we want are 3 kegs. Do a good job and maybe we'll have another job for you.",o="转至剃刀岭，途中你会遇见一名束手无策的地精，从他手中接过一只酒桶，然后将它交给雷恩的助手。在赛羊消失之前取回3只酒桶。",oEN="Get a keg from the Goblin stranded on the road to Razor Hill and return it to Ram Master Ray's assistant. Do this 3 times before your ram goes away.",p="你看到那个地精制造的麻烦了吗？我希望你一路上并没有摔着。",pEN="Did you see the mess that goblin made? I hope you didn't do too much reckless off-roading.",c="多亏了你的帮忙！只要美酒节还在进行，那些黑铁矮人也不放弃攻击，而我们的供应商仍然被困在峡谷之中的话，我就需要有人来帮我运送酒桶。如果你还想多赚几个奖品章，你可以每天都来找我。\n\n这些是你的奖品章，玩得开心点！",cEN="Thanks for your help! As long as Brewfest is going and the Dark Iron Dwarves are attacking and our supplier is stuck in that canyon, I'll need some help shipping kegs. So if you want to work for more tickets, talk to me every day.\n\nHere are the tickets we promised you. Have fun!"}
Q[11413]={d="我们不仅供应美酒，还独家出售啤酒杯呢！瞧这些漂亮的杯子，非常具有纪念意义哦！这是一张礼品券。\n\n与美酒节营地背后的布利克斯谈一谈。他是个古怪的家伙，总是带着一副护目镜。他负责兑换礼品券，以及出售各类美酒。",dEN="Not only are we supplying brew to everyone, we also have steins to give out! Beautiful, commemorative steins all obtained by the most legal of means! Here's a voucher for one.\n\nTalk to Blix near the back of the Brewfest camp. He's pretty strange, even more so now that he's always wearing those goggles. He'll handle the voucher for you, and any other Brewfest transaction.",o="在美酒节营地背后的布利克斯·菲克维特处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Blix Fixwidget in the back of the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="这是什么？酒杯兑换券？你喜欢喝酒吗？太棒了！我把酒杯给你以后，你就可以喝个痛快了！然后再多喝几杯。也许接着再多来几杯……跟着，重点来了，再回来找我。\n\n听着，我知道迟早你一定会再回来找我的。假如你想要兑换美酒节奖券或者酒桶保管者印记的话，你就要回来找我。\n\n总而言之，这是你的酒杯，记得以后有需要的话再来找我。",cEN="What's this? A stein voucher? So you like drinking? Great! After I give you this stein, go have a few drinks! Then a few more. Maybe have a few more after that... Then, now this is important, come see me.\n\nLook, I know you'll be back eventually. If you want your Brewfest tickets redeemed, or Keg Protector marks redeemed, you have to see me.\n\nAnyways, here's the stein, and remember to talk to me later."}
Q[11414]={d="那位观察者月叶简直太不可思议了！如果你是她$gamigo:amiga;，那你也是$gel mío:la mía;。\n\n在上次满月之前，我一直是头狼。后来，那头古怪的白色座狼加瓦尔从北方而来，在我那些曾经的兄弟的帮助下，他很快成了头狼。他身上有些不对劲。\n\n要帮我，你得先杀掉那些背叛我的家伙。\n\n比约莫夫常在一个叫钢门的地方西北方狩猎。然后去东南方，在西矛塔附近找瓦格。\n\n你的伪装骗不过他们。",dEN="Watcher Moonleaf is from my dreams! If you are her friend, you are mine.\n\nI was alpha male until the last full moon. Then the strange white worg, Garwal, came from the north, and with the help of my once-brothers, he quickly became alpha worg. There is something unnatural about him.\n\nTo help, you must first kill those who betrayed me.\n\nBjomolf hunts to the northwest of a place called Steel Gate. And look for Varg to the southeast, near the West Spear Tower.\n\nThey will not be fooled by your form.",o="乌尔芬要你去杀死背叛他的座狼，比奥莫弗和瓦尔戈。完成任务后，穿着斗篷回到裂木森林向他复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以去找观察者莉莎·月叶再要一件。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to kill the traitorous worgs, Bjomolf and Varg. Return to him in disguise in the Rivenwood after you have done so.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Watcher Moonleaf for a replacement.",c="你口鼻上叛徒的血腥味让我很舒爽，兄弟之间是不应该彼此攻击的。",cEN="The smell of their blood upon your muzzle pleases me. Brothers should not turn on each other."}
Q[11415]={d="这位迷雾行者简直太不可思议了！如果你是他的$gamigo:amiga;，那你也是$gel mío:la mía;。\n\n在上次满月之前，我一直是头狼。后来，那头古怪的白色座狼加瓦尔从北方而来，在我那些曾经的兄弟的帮助下，他很快成了头狼。他身上有些不对劲。\n\n要帮我，你得先杀掉那些背叛我的家伙。\n\n比约莫夫常在两脚生物称之为钢门的地方西北方狩猎。然后去东南方，在西矛塔附近找瓦格。\n\n你的伪装骗不过他们。",dEN="Mistwalker is from my dreams! If you are his friend, you are mine.\n\nI was alpha male until the last full moon. Then the strange white worg, Garwal, came from the north, and with the help of my once-brothers, he quickly became alpha. There is something unnatural about him.\n\nTo help, you must first kill those who betrayed me.\n\nBjomolf hunts to the northwest of a place the two-legs call Steel Gate. And look for Varg to the southeast, near the West Spear Tower.\n\nThey will not be fooled by your form.",o="乌尔芬要你去杀死背叛他的座狼，比奥莫弗和瓦尔戈。完成任务后，穿着斗篷回到裂木森林向他复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以去找先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者再要一件。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to kill the traitorous worgs, Bjomolf and Varg. Return to him in disguise in the Rivenwood after you have done so.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Sage Mistwalker for a replacement.",p="<乌尔芬的喉咙里传来一阵低嚎。>\n\n毕欧莫夫和瓦尔格还没死！",pEN="<A low growl rises from Ulfang's throat.>\n\nBjomolf and Varg are not dead!",c="你口鼻上叛徒的血腥味让我很舒爽，兄弟之间是不应该彼此攻击的。",cEN="The smell of their blood upon your muzzle pleases me. Brothers should not turn on each other."}
Q[11416]={d="迦瓦尔用一种奇怪的魔法隐藏了自己的踪迹。除非他自己愿意，没有人能看见或闻到他。但我们也许能有办法。\n\n我的敌人，那头名叫塔隆斯里克的鹰，据说有一双能看穿一切的眼睛。如果你能拿到她的眼珠，就一定能看见迦瓦尔。\n\n塔隆斯里克的巢穴在维库人的据点斯克恩西南方的一条瀑布底下。只要你去翻动鹰巢里的卵，她就会从天空冲下来攻击你。\n\n把她的眼珠给我带回来。",dEN="Garwal hides himself behind an unnatural magic. None can see him unless he wants you to. There may be one chance we can take, though.\n\nMy enemy, the great eagle, Talonshrike, is said to have eyes that can see anything. If you were to take her eyes, then you would surely be able to see Garwal.\n\nTalonshrike keeps her nest at the base of a waterfall just to the southwest of the vrykul place called Skorn. If you touch the eggs in her nest, she will come down from the sky to kill you.\n\nGet her eyes.",o="乌尔芬要你去拿到巨鹰之眼。完成任务后，穿着斗篷回到裂木森林向他复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以去找观察者莉莎·月叶再要一件。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to collect the Eyes of the Eagle. Return to him in disguise in the Rivenwood after you have done so.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Watcher Moonleaf for a replacement.",p="你拿到巨鹰之眼了？",pEN="You have the eyes of the eagle?",c="<乌尔芬因你击败了他的敌人而嗥叫。>\n\n荣耀属于你。我真希望最后咬住她颈脖的是我的嘴。\n\n我们可不要浪费了她的牺牲品。东西在这，吃了它！",cEN="<Ulfang howls loudly at your defeat of his great eagle enemy.>\n\nThe honor of the kill is yours. I wish that it had been my maw to finally close upon her neck.\n\nLet us not waste the sacrifice that she has made for us. Here, eat them!"}
Q[11417]={d="迦瓦尔用一种奇怪的魔法隐藏了自己的踪迹。除非他自己愿意，没有人能看见或闻到他。但我们也许能有办法。\n\n我的敌人，那头名叫塔隆斯里克的鹰，据说有一双能看穿一切的眼睛。如果你能拿到她的眼珠，就一定能看见迦瓦尔。\n\n塔隆斯里克的巢穴在维库人的据点斯克恩西南方的一条瀑布底下。只要你去翻动鹰巢里的卵，她就会从天空冲下来攻击你。\n\n把她的眼珠给我带回来。",dEN="Garwal hides himself behind an unnatural magic. None can see him unless he wants you to. There may be one chance we can take, though.\n\nMy enemy, the great eagle, Talonshrike, is said to have eyes that can see anything. If you were to take her eyes, then you would surely be able to see Garwal.\n\nTalonshrike keeps her nest at the base of a waterfall just to the southwest of the vrykul place called Skorn. If you touch the eggs in her nest, she will come down from the sky to kill you.\n\nGet her eyes.",o="乌尔芬要你去拿到巨鹰之眼。完成任务后，穿着斗篷回到裂木森林向他复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了座狼伪装，可以去找先知拉瑞恩·迷雾行者再要一件。",oEN="Ulfang has asked you to collect the Eyes of the Eagle. Return to him in disguise in the Rivenwood after you have done so.\n\nIf you somehow lose the Worg Disguise, return to Sage Mistwalker for a replacement.",p="你拿到巨鹰之眼了？",pEN="You have the eyes of the eagle?",c="<乌尔芬因你击败了他的敌人而嗥叫。>\n\n荣耀属于你。我真希望最后咬住她颈脖的是我的嘴。\n\n我们可不要浪费了她的牺牲品。东西在这，吃了它！",cEN="<Ulfang howls loudly at your defeat of his great eagle enemy.>\n\nThe honor of the kill is yours. I wish that it had been my maw to finally close upon her neck.\n\nLet us not waste the sacrifice that she has made for us. Here, eat them!"}
Q[11418]={d="一只勇敢的角鹰兽在堡垒上空盘旋，时不时俯冲下来捕捉猎物。杰森朝他射了好几箭，可是都没有命中目标！\n\n我们给这只出色的角鹰兽取了个名字叫钢羽，不过就是搞不懂他为什么就喜欢在维德瓦堡垒附近出没。大多数角鹰兽都不喜欢人类。\n\n研究员艾德兰用角鹰兽的羽毛制作了一枚护符，据说这枚护符能让用户通过钢羽的眼睛观察世界。",dEN="We see one brave hippogryph circling over the fort, then swooping down and taking prey. Jethan over there has taken a couple of shots at the creature, but his arrows bounced right off!\n\nWe've taken to calling this remarkable creature Steelfeather, but we can't see why he prefers the area around Fort Wildervar. Most hippogryphs are wary of people.\n\nResearcher Aderan has helped us fashion a charm from one of the creature's feathers. He claims it will allow the user to see through Steelfeather's eyes.",o="找到盘旋在维德瓦堡垒上空的钢羽，利用饰羽符咒揭开他的秘密。然后向基尔·克利瑟报告情况。",oEN="Locate Steelfeather circling Fort Wildervar and use the Feathered Charm to discover his secret. Report your findings to Gil Grisert.",p="艾德兰的符咒有用吗？",pEN="Did Aderan's charm work?",c="你看到一个巢，里面还有幼崽？嗯……所以我们的\"他\"其实是\"她\"，是吧？\n\n我想这就说得通了。换了是我，也不会因为有新邻居就搬走一窝幼崽。\n\n<Gil 假装恶狠狠地瞪了捕兽者 Jethan 一眼。>\n\n只要老 Jethan 不再想着把她做成战利品，我相信我们一定能相处得很好。",cEN="You saw a nest, with hatchlings? Hmm... so our \"he\" is actually a \"she,\" eh?\n\nI guess that settles it. I suppose I wouldn't want to move a nest full of hatchlings just because of a new neighbor, either.\n\n<Gil favors Trapper Jethan with a mock glare.>\n\nI'm sure we'd get along just fine if ol' Jethan would stop trying to make a trophy of her."}
Q[11419]={d="如果你将手上的戳印给德利兹·塔波奎克看看，就能从他那里买到赛羊会的赛羊。",dEN="If you show this hand stamp to Driz Tumblequick, the Ram Racing Apprentice, he'll allow you to purchase Brewfest riding rams.",o="把\"荣誉酿酒师\"手印带给杜隆塔尔美酒节场地入口附近的德利兹·塔波奎克。",oEN="Bring the \"Honorary Brewer\" Hand Stamp to Driz Tumblequick near the entrance to the Brewfest Grounds in Durotar.",p="你手上那个是\"荣誉酿酒师\"的印章吗？",pEN="Is that an \"Honorary Brewer\" stamp you've got on your hand?",c="干得好，<name>……你赢得了节日酿酒师们的信任，获得了购买美酒节坐骑山羊的权利。",cEN="Good job, <name>... you've won the trust of the festival's brewers, earning the right to purchase a Brewfest riding ram."}
Q[11420]={d="两周前，我们的主工程师搞到了一把维库人的鱼叉。没错，那帮杂种就是用这玩意儿击沉了我们的船只。经过潜心研究，他居然鼓捣出了一本详尽的操作手册。\n\n不幸的是，他被绑架到了北边的龙颅村。我们找到这位工程师时，他已经奄奄一息了，那本手册也不见了。临死前他告诉我们，那本手册就在龙颅村西北角的乌特加德墓穴中。替我取回它！",dEN="Two weeks ago our chief engineer got his hands on a vrykul harpoon gun - the same type of gun that the vrykul use to take down our ships. By studying that gun he managed to put together a comprehensive operation manual.\n\nUnfortunately he was abducted and taken north of here to Wyrmskull Village. We eventually did find him, but near death and without the manual. His dying words indicated that the manual was lost in the Utgarde Catacombs, located at the northwest end of Wyrmskull. Get me that manual!",o="瓦加德的守卫队长索雷克要你取回鱼叉操作手册。",oEN="Guard Captain Zorek at Valgarde in Howling Fjord wants you to recover the Harpoon Operation Manual.",p="你找到手册了吗？",pEN="Did you find the manual?",c="<索雷克迅速翻阅着手册。>\n\n嗯，有意思……\n\n根据这本手册，维库人有一种特殊工具让他们可以精准地控制鱼叉猎枪。那个东西看起来有点像是我们船上的轮子。而且，这个东西是可携带的，可以像把钥匙一样插在鱼叉猎枪上。我们需要得到这个东西！",cEN="<Zorek flips through the manual.>\n\nHrm, interesting...\n\nAccording to the manual, the vrykul have a special tool that allows them to control the harpoon guns with deadly accuracy. It looks a bit like the wheel of one of our ships. Furthermore, it's portable and seems to plug into the harpoon guns like a key. We need to get our hands on one of those!"}
Q[11421]={d="趁着维库人的军队陷入混乱，我们发动反攻吧！带上鱼叉控制器转至尼弗莱瓦，在靠近村子的悬崖上寻找最北端的鱼叉房。\n\n维库人在那里堆放了大批捕鲸用的鱼叉，你只需抢来一把，朝着悬崖下的龙颅村扫射！我要你摧毁长屋、码头和仓库，并杀死转至阻止你的卫兵！\n\n完成你的使命，匕鞘湾的安全就靠你啦！",dEN="We must strike while the vrykul forces are in disarray! Take the harpoon control mechanism to Nifflevar and locate the northernmost harpoon building on the bluff side of the village.\n\nOnce there, commandeer one of the vrykul harpoon guns that are stationed on the building's deck. Use the harpoon gun to rain hell upon Wyrmskull Village! Destroy the longhouse, dockhouse, storage facility and any defenders that the vrykul may send at you!\n\nDo this and Daggercap Bay will become a much safer port!",o="嚎风峡湾的约格莫夫·冰锤中尉要你摧毁掠龙长屋、掠龙码头和掠龙仓库，并杀死8名掠龙防御者。\n\n完成任务后将鱼叉控制器交给他。",oEN="Lieutenant Icehammer in the Howling Fjord wants you to destroy the Dragonflayer Longhouse, Dragonflayer Dockhouse, Dragonflayer Storage Facility and 8 Dragonflayer Defenders.\n\nReturn the Harpoon Control Mechanism to him once the task is complete.",p="龙颅村失火了吗？",pEN="Is Wyrmskull up in flames?",c="干得漂亮，<name>！你干掉了他们相当一部分的龙骑士，还把他们的头目彻底激怒了。\n\n你准备好回瓦加德，把这个好消息告诉索雷克了吗？如果准备好了，我有个疯狂的主意！",cEN="Excellent work, <name>! You took out a good chunk of their dragon riders and really pissed off their leadership.\n\nAre you ready to head back to Valgarde and report the good news to Zorek? If so, I've got a crazy idea!"}
Q[11422]={d="<他在地上画出一些潦草的符号，你从中辨认出三叉戟、摩尔古鱼人、一艘破船、太阳，旁边还有一幅模糊的人像，似乎代表你本人。>\n\n<你想了很久才明白这只鱼人的意思。他是要你转至切米尔海岸夺回一柄三叉戟，可太阳是什么意思呢？啊，指的是他的儿子吧。>\n\n<他的儿子肯定是变成了摩尔古鱼人！他要你转至南边的船只残骸附近，杀死他的儿子，夺回三叉戟。>",dEN="<From the scratches he makes in the rock, you see several symbols: a trident, a mur'ghoul, the sun, a wrecked ship, and a rough stick-figure of yourself.>\n\n<Puzzling out what the murloc is conveying takes a while. Obviously he wants you to get a trident from the Chillmere Coast, but the image of the sun is puzzling. That is until you realize he means his son.>\n\n<His son was changed into a mur'ghoul! He wants you to find him to the south near the wrecked ship and return with his trident.>",o="老冰鳞要你夺得腐鳃的三叉戟，然后返回切米尔海岸的小岛上向他复命。",oEN="Old Icefin wants you to obtain Rotgill's Trident. Return it to him on the small island on the Chillmere Coast.",p="<老冰鳞瞪着一双死鱼眼研究着你，仔细寻找有关他儿子的三叉戟消息。>",pEN="<One of Old Icefin's dead fish-like eyes studies you, clearly looking for signs of his son's trident.>",c="<老冰鳞伸手拿走它儿子的三叉戟，它的手微微颤抖着——会是因为这个老鱼人在伤心吗？>\n\n<在它眼底凝聚的只是水气而已吗？>",cEN="<Reaching out to take his son's trident from you, Old Icefin's hand shakes a little. Could it be that the aged murloc is grieving?>\n\n<Is that just extra moisture pooling at the base of his eye?>"}
Q[11423]={d="随着我们的军队逐步深入诺森德大陆，诸多敌对势力也在节节败退。他们的房屋将被熊熊的战火烧毁，他们的尸体也将被可怕的瘟疫吞噬。所有他们兴盛过与存在过的痕迹，都将被无情地彻底抹除。\n\n但这并不令我感到有多么兴奋，相反，身为一名历史学者，我对此感到十分担忧。东边那座维库人的小镇尼弗莱瓦很快就要被复仇港派出的军队踏平了。可是维库人的吟游诗人赫尔古斯曾经居住在那里，这位伟大的诗人着有三部史诗，分别是《寒冬诅咒的传说》《女武神的传说》和《双子的传说》。趁尼弗莱瓦还没被毁灭，把它们带回来给我。",dEN="As our armies march through Northrend, our enemies will not suffer mere defeat. Their houses will burn, their corpses will be devoured by our plagues, all trace of their existence will be lost.\n\nThis worries me as a seeker of knowledge. The eastern town of Nifflevar will soon be razed by our forces in Vengeance Landing. The vrykul bard, Helgus, lived there and wrote three sagas: the Saga of the Twins, the Saga of the Winter Curse and the Saga of the Val'kyr. Obtain them before Nifflevar is destroyed.",o="进入幽刃岗哨北方的尼弗莱瓦，寻找寒冬诅咒的传说、女武神的传说和双子的传说。",oEN="Go into Nifflevar, north of Ghostblade Post and look for the Saga of the Winter Curse, the Saga of the Val'kyr and the Saga of the Twins.",p="那些卷轴呢，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="The scrolls, <name>? Did you obtain them?",c="这价值连城，<name>。我必须加倍努力抢救并翻译维库人的文献。\n\n别误会。我们的敌人必须被消灭……但他们的古老知识不必。",cEN="This is of tremendous value, <name>. I must renew my efforts in salvaging and translating vrykul texts.\n\nDon't get me wrong. Our enemies need to be destroyed... their ancient knowledge doesn't."}
Q[11424]={d="在这种战争时节，零件收集工作做起来总是不太难的。对我来说，到处都能找到合用的零件。\n\n不过话说回来，虽然不难，却也不是特别的简单。尤其是幽暗城那些书呆子科学家们做了无数的药剂散布到无数的镇子里以后，大多数上好的材料都被破坏了\n\n要找趁手的材料真的很困难，不过好在还有些地方可以考虑。南边有处地方叫作盾牌岭，那里还有不少完好的徽记，给我取一些回来，我会给你一笔丰厚报酬的。",dEN="My work should be extremely easy in a time of war. There ought to be usable body parts everywhere.\n\nIt's not that simple, though. With these eggheads making all sorts of killer plagues and sending them to enemy towns, most of the material gets contaminated.\n\nThere is a place, though, where usable samples exist. Shield Hill, south of here, is an ancient vrykul burial ground where the dead walk but are not afflicted with any plague - ours or the Lich King's. Get me some bones, I'll pay ya well.",o="\"锯子\"珍妮要你从新阿加曼德以南的盾牌岭的复活维库人身上带回 5 根古代维库人骨头。",oEN="\"Hacksaw\" Jenny wants you to bring her 5 Ancient Vrykul Bones from the reanimated Vrykul in Shield Hill, south of New Agamand.",p="拿到我要的东西了？",pEN="Got my bones then?",c="嗯嗯嗯……这些就可以了。虽然其中一些看起来有些古怪。\n\n告诉你——我已经处理尸块好几年了，我的胃从来都没有过这种怪异的感觉。不过君子一言，驷马难追。这是你的报酬。",cEN="Hmmmmph... these will do for now. There seems to be some oddness to them.\n\nI tell ya - I've handled body parts for years now and never have I had such a weird feeling in my stomach. Anyway, a deal is a deal. Here's your payment."}
Q[11426]={d="$n，放心吧。我正在构思一个大计划！绝对震撼！你相信我，照我说的去做准没错。\n\n接下来，我们要搞到手册中提到的控制设备。我觉得吧，龙颅村中那些握着鱼叉的维库人身上肯定有这玩意儿。他们就聚集在村子东边码头的长屋附近。",dEN="Don't worry, <name>; this is all going to lead to something big! HUGE! You're just going to have to trust me for now and do as I ask of you.\n\nWe need to get the mechanism mentioned in the manual for the next step of the plan. I have a strong suspicion that you'll find one on one of those vrykul that operate the harpoon guns in Wyrmskull Village. You'll find them on the east side of the village, on the docks by the longhouses.",o="将鱼叉控制器交给瓦加德的守卫队长索雷克。",oEN="Guard Captain Zorek at Valgarde in Howling Fjord wants you to bring him a Harpoon Control Mechanism.",p="你找到控制器了吗？",pEN="Did you locate the mechanism?",c="太棒了！那些发育过度的猴子很快就会知道惹毛了联盟会有什么下场！",cEN="Outstanding! Those overgrown apes will soon know what it means to mess with the Alliance!"}
Q[11427]={d="你看到东北方悬崖上那些维库人的建筑了吗？维库人称那个地方为尼弗莱瓦。他们对我们护卫舰的大部分鱼叉攻击都是从那里发起的。\n\n那么，你知道吗？反击的时候到了，$n。我需要你带上这个鱼叉控制装置，去与冰锤中尉会合，他藏在尼弗莱瓦西北方的一座维库人建筑里。\n\n等你$glisto:lista;，我就把你放到我们的一只狮鹫背上，眨眼间把你送到他那里。|n",dEN="Do you see those vrykul buildings on the bluffs to the northeast? The vrykul call that place Nifflevar. It's where most of their harpoon attacks on our frigates originate.\n\nWell guess what? The time for payback has come, <name>. I need you to take this harpoon control mechanism and meet up with Lieutenant Icehammer, who is hiding out in a vrykul building northwest of Nifflevar.\n\nWhen you're ready I'll place you on the back of one of our gryphons and zip you right to him!",o="守卫队长索雷克要你将鱼叉控制器交给驻扎在尼弗莱瓦外的约格莫夫·冰锤中尉。",oEN="Guard Captain Zorek wants you to take the Harpoon Control Mechanism to Lieutenant Icehammer stationed outside of Nifflevar.",p="这是什么？我看起来像保姆吗？",pEN="What is this? Do I look like a babysitter?",c="<冰锤中尉从你手中接过鱼叉控制装置。>\n\n啊，你人来还带礼物喔！",cEN="<Lieutenant Icehammer takes the harpoon control mechanism from you.>\n\nAh, you come bearing gifts!"}
Q[11428]={d="你一直是我们的$gun gran amigo y aliado:una gran amiga y aliada;，$n。还有一件事我必须请求你。\n\n你已经见识过扭曲林地的腐化和栖息在那里的野兽。除非我们采取行动，否则黑魂守护者会继续从我们林地的水与土壤中滋生这些可憎之物。\n\n最强大的黑魂守护者名叫凋叶守护者。杀了他，$n，为林地的救赎开辟道路，就像你曾经救赎了我的姐妹们一样。",dEN="You have been a great friend and ally to us, <name>. There is one more thing I must ask of you.\n\nYou have seen the corruption of the Twisted Glade and the beasts that dwell there. The blacksouled keepers will continue raising these abominations from the waters and soil of our glade unless we act against them.\n\nThe most powerful of the blacksouled keepers is known as Keeper Witherleaf. Slay him, <name>, and open the way for the redemption of the glade as you once redeemed my sisters.",o="冰雪林地的鲁莉尔蕾要求你杀死凋零之叶。",oEN="Lurielle at the Frozen Glade wants you to kill Keeper Witherleaf.",p="你除掉扭曲林地的守护者凋叶了吗？",pEN="Have you rid the Twisted Glade of Keeper Witherleaf?",c="得知守护者与我们反目时，我的心都碎了。我们曾把他们视为兄弟和最亲密的朋友。\n\n我为失去的兄弟姐妹们哀悼，但如果没有你的帮助，我们的未来就没有任何希望。你永远是我们的座上宾，<name>。",cEN="My heart broke when I learned the keepers had turned against us. Once, we considered them our brothers and our closest friends.\n\nI grieve for the brothers and sisters we have lost, but without your help, there would be no hope for our future. You will always be welcome among us, <name>."}
Q[11429]={d="我才不会将这样的任务随便交给那些没经验的小杂兵。\n\n如果你想证明自己具备完成这项任务的实力，就照我说的去做。\n\n带上这面军旗转至正北方的拜尔海姆。我要你将旗帜插在拜尔海姆的中央，并击败前来抢夺旗帜的维库人，维护联盟的尊严！你能做到的话，再回来找我吧！",dEN="I'm not about to put the fate of this mission into the hands of some untested scrub.\n\nNow, if you want to prove to me that you've got what it takes to carry out this mission, you'll need to do what I tell you.\n\nTake this battle standard and head over to Baleheim, directly north of here. Once you're at Baleheim, find the center of town and drop our flag. Fight off any vrykul dirt bags that attempt to take down our beloved flag and return to me once you've established Alliance dominance!",o="嚎风峡湾的约格莫夫·冰锤中尉要你将联盟军旗插在拜尔海姆中央，然后击败前来抢夺旗帜的维库人。\n\n完成任务后将联盟军旗还给他。",oEN="Lieutenant Icehammer in the Howling Fjord wants you to place the Alliance Banner in Baleheim and then defend the banner against attackers.\n\nReturn to Lieutenant Icehammer with the Alliance Banner should you survive.",p="我看看，还活着嘛。很明显的你并没有很辛苦。",pEN="Still alive, I see. Clearly you're not trying hard enough.",c="为了联盟！你很强，<name>。强到足以在尼弗莱瓦敲碎维库人的脑袋。",cEN="For the Alliance! You're a strong one, <name>. Strong enough to crack some vrykul skull at Nifflevar."}
Q[11430]={d="你在拜尔海姆的表现相当不错，$n。在你拍着自己的背邀功之前，尼弗莱瓦还有事情要做。\n\n我们已经找到了对我们护卫舰发动大部分鱼叉攻击的维库人——他叫亚弗斯。你会在尼弗莱瓦悬崖上的主要鱼叉设施里找到他，就在此地的东南方。\n\n找到他，并以他对联盟犯下的罪行处决他。\n\n别让我失望，$n！|n",dEN="That was a fairly strong showing at Baleheim, <name>. Before you go off patting yourself on the back there's work to be done at Nifflevar.\n\nWe've located the vrykul responsible for the majority of the harpoon attacks on our frigates - goes by the name of Yavus. You'll find him in the main harpoon structure on the bluffs of Nifflevar, southeast of here.\n\nTrack him down and execute him for crimes against the Alliance!\n\nDo me proud, <name>!",o="嚎风峡湾的约格莫夫·冰锤中尉要你转至尼弗莱瓦，杀死鱼叉指挥官雅弗斯。",oEN="Lieutenant Icehammer in the Howling Fjord wants you to slay Harpoon Master Yavus at Nifflevar.",c="他们将得花点时间找个人来替换雅弗斯。现在正是进行索雷克计划的大好时机！当他们急着想要重新取回尼弗莱瓦的控制权时，你就用他们自己的鱼叉猎枪来对付他们！",cEN="It'll take them a while to find a replacement for Yavus. Now is the perfect time to unleash Zorek's plan! While they're scurrying to regain control of Nifflevar, you're going to use their own harpoon guns against them!"}
Q[11431]={d="嘿！我是位癫狂的矮人！矮人们相信，当你醉到一定程度的时候，就能看见那些无形的生物。事实上，它们现在就可能在美酒节的营地附近转悠呢！但是你只有在醉酒的状态下才能看见它们。\n\n矮人们从来不会拒绝开怀畅饮的机会。\n\n我敢打赌你一定也想来几杯吧……那么，用这张网替我捕捉5只鹿角小飞兔吧，我是从一位喝得醉醺醺的矮人手中搞到这东西的。\n\n如果你看不见鹿角小飞兔，那就从我这里拿一副合成酿酒护目镜带上，它也能让你像喝醉了一样！",dEN="Hey there! I'm a crazy dwarf! We dwarves believe when you get enough brew together, invisible creatures show up. In fact they are probably wandering around the Brewfest grounds right now! But you can only see them if you are really drunk.\n\nWe dwarves will come up with any excuse to drink.\n\nI bet you want a reason to drink too... So here it is, bring me 5 of those wolpertingers with this net I got from a really drunk dwarf.\n\nIf you can't see them, get some Synthebrew Goggles from me - almost as good!",o="那个\"矮人\"格洛德拉克·古斯尼普要你用鹿角小飞兔网捕捉 5 只被击晕的鹿角小飞兔。他说你必须处于醉酒状态，或者戴上合成酿酒护目镜才能看见它们。",oEN="The \"dwarf,\" Glodrak Huntsniper, has asked you to capture 5 Stunned Wolpertingers using the Wolpertinger Net. He mentioned that you must be intoxicated or wearing Synthebrew Goggles to see them.",p="你有带东西给我或是你只是需要另一个喝得烂醉的理由？",pEN="Were ya drunk enough to see the little buggers?",c="哎呀，瞧瞧这些好东西！你可是抓了一大堆鹿角小飞兔啊！\n\n<他从酒杯里大大地喝了一口。>\n\n我告诉你我要怎么办。既然你这么出色，是个<class>，我就让你从这些小家伙里挑一只，归你自己！",cEN="Well, lookee there! Ye've got yerself a right bushel o' wolpertingers, ye do!\n\n<He takes a deep drink from his tankard.>\n\nI'll tell ye what I'm gonna do. Since ye're such a spot-on <class>, I'll let ye keep one'a these fer yer very own!"}
Q[11432]={d="我听到了你和莱瓦里安神父的谈话。恕我直言，他对你的指导还不够。\n\n你还得去解决那些在亚勒伯龙地下的苏醒之厅中休眠的维库人！\n\n我相信唤醒他们就是毁灭他们的关键。亡灵巫师手中可能有能让这些维库人在未成熟的状态下提前苏醒的东西。\n\n提前苏醒对这些维库人来说必定是非常致命的。",dEN="I've overheard what you've had to say with Father Levariol. Allow me to suggest that he's not having you go far enough.\n\nYou must also deal with the vrykul that lie dormant in the Waking Halls beneath Gjalerbron!\n\nI have no doubt that the rituals involved with awakening them are the key to their downfall. Most likely the necrolords have some device that you can use to bring the vrykul out of their dormant state prematurely.\n\nSurely such a disruption will prove fatal to the vrykul.",o="法师中尉玛利斯特要你杀死5名休眠的维库人。完成任务后返回西部卫戍要塞向他复命。",oEN="Mage-Lieutenant Malister has tasked you with slaying 5 Dormant Vrykul. Return to him at Westguard Keep when you have done so.",p="<name>，我不太相信你已经处理掉了足够多的休眠维库人。等你做到了再回来。",pEN="<name>, I find it implausible that you have dealt with enough of the dormant vrykul. Come back when you have done so.",c="你做了必须做的事。虽然有些人可能认为杀死毫无防备者很不光彩，但在这种情况下，你要是换种做法才真是个傻瓜。\n\n而且我们当然不能让他们就那么站着，等着被仪式唤醒，对吧？\n\n你为我们在下面那些地下墓穴里所做的一切很勇敢，<name>。",cEN="You did what had to be done. Though some might consider it dishonorable to slay the helpless, in this case you would have been a fool to have done otherwise.\n\nAnd we certainly couldn't have just left them standing there to be ritually wakened, now could we?\n\nIt was a brave thing you did for all of us down in those catacombs, <name>."}
Q[11433]={d="我无意中听到你跟安卡祖母的谈话。恕我直言，她对你的指导还不够。\n\n你还得去解决那些在亚勒伯龙地下的苏醒之厅中休眠的维库人！\n\n我相信唤醒他们就是毁灭他们的关键。亡灵巫师手中可能有能让这些维库人在未成熟的状态下提前苏醒的东西。\n\n提前苏醒对这些维库人来说必定是非常致命的。",dEN="I've overheard what you've had to say with Greatmother Ankha. With all due respect, she's not having you go far enough.\n\nYou must also deal with the vrykul that lie dormant in the Waking Halls beneath Gjalerbron!\n\nI have no doubt that the rituals involved with awakening them are the key to their downfall. Most likely the necrolords have some device that you can use to bring the vrykul out of their dormant state prematurely.\n\nSurely such a disruption will prove fatal to the vrykul.",o="安霍塔·白霜要你杀死5名休眠的维库人。完成任务后返回冬蹄营地向他复命。",oEN="Ahota Whitefrost has tasked you with slaying 5 Dormant Vrykul. Return to him at Camp Winterhoof when you have done so.",p="我不太相信你解决了那么多的冬眠维库人。等你完成之后再来找我。",pEN="I find it unlikely that you have dealt with enough of the dormant vrykul. Come back when you have done so.",c="你做了必须做的事。不明智的人也许会认为趁他们苏醒时杀死毫无防备者很不光彩，但在这种情况下，你要是换种做法才真是个傻瓜。\n\n而且我们当然不能让他们就那么站着，等着被仪式唤醒，对吧？\n\n你为我们在下面那些地下墓穴里所做的一切很勇敢，<race>。",cEN="You did what had to be done. The unwise might consider it dishonorable to slay the helpless while they awaken, but in this case you would have been a fool to have done otherwise.\n\nAnd we certainly couldn't have just left them standing there to be ritually wakened, now could we?\n\nIt was a brave thing you did for all of us down in those catacombs, <race>."}
Q[11434]={d="我的巨额财富来自我对那些一般海盗不感兴趣的财宝的眼光，比如绘画、古董、收藏品之类的。\n\n多年前，康拉德的船队沉没在这里的南方。所有的金币和珠宝都已经被人捞走了，但那里还留着两件古董。一件是殿堂级的阿曼尼花瓶，另一件是一座雄鹰雕像。\n\n把这两件古董给我带来，我会向其它海盗担保你。另外，我还会给你一些小玩意，让你的水下作业更加轻松。",dEN="I've made my fortune by specializing in treasure that regular pirates don't appreciate: art, antiquities, collector's pieces.\n\nBlack Conrad's fleet sank south of here years ago. All the gold and jewelry was picked clean by divers, but two ancient relics remain there. One is a museum-quality Amani vase, the other is an eagle figurine.\n\nGo and retrieve them for me and I'll vouch for you with the other pirates. I'll even throw in something to make your underwater adventure a bit more manageable.",o="无赖港的帅哥泰里要求你到南方的沉船上找到一只阿曼尼花瓶和一座雄鹰雕像，并把它们交给他。",oEN="Handsome Terry at Scalawag Point wants you to bring him 1 Amani Vase and 1 Eagle Figurine from the shipwreck to the south.",p="你拿到我的遗物了吗，<name>？这世上没人能光靠一张好看的脸混下去……连我也不行！",pEN="Did you obtain my relics, <name>? Nobody gets by in this life on good looks alone... not even me!",c="<name>，我们要一起去很多地方。凭我这张脸和你的……干劲，我们肯定能大赚一笔。",cEN="We're going to go places together, <name>. With my good looks and your... can-do attitude, we're sure to make a killing."}
Q[11436]={d="飞越嚎风峡湾的陡峭悬崖一直是个大难题！而我在结合维库人的技术和矮人的心灵手巧以后，终于想出了解决办法。通过改装和仔细调整，我制造出了冰锤牌鱼叉控制器！当然这个产品还没有测试过，但这难道不就是我叫你来的意义所在吗？\n\n拿着这个控制器去找到尼弗莱瓦的大炮，然后用它把你自己发射到瓦加德去。把你的好消息告诉索雷克。哦，当然了，你可以留下那个控制器。",dEN="Navigating the steep bluffs of Howling Fjord can be nerve-racking! I've come up with a solution to ease that burden by utilizing vrykul technology and dwarven ingenuity. With just a few adjustments and some fine tuning I've created Icehammer's harpoon controller! Of course it hasn't been tested, but that's what you're here for!\n\nTake the controller to the big gun in Nifflevar and use it to launch yourself into Valgarde. Report your victory to Zorek. Oh yea, you can keep the controller.",o="使用尼弗莱瓦的大型维库鱼叉炮把你自己发射到瓦加德去。向守卫队长索雷克报告你战胜维库人的消息。",oEN="Use the large Vrykul Harpoon Gun in Nifflevar to launch yourself into Valgarde. Report your victory over the Vrykul to Guard Captain Zorek.",p="<索雷克瞠目结舌地看着你。>",pEN="<Zorek raises an eyebrow at you.>",c="你疯了，<name>！什么样的变态会拿鱼叉炮当交通工具把自己发射出去？\n\n不过我想，要想在那边悬崖上完成你做的事，确实得有点疯劲！干得太棒了！我们收到消息说，龙颅氏族的首领英格瓦暴跳如雷！也许有一天你会准备好把他踩进泥里——以我们深爱的联盟之名。",cEN="You are insane, <name>! What kind of degenerate would actually launch themselves from a harpoon gun as a method of travel?\n\nBut I guess you need to be a little crazy to pull off what you did up there on the bluffs! Fantastic work! We've gotten word that the Dragonflayer leader, Ingvar, is furious! Maybe one day you'll be ready to stomp his face into the dirt - in the name of our beloved Alliance."}
Q[11439]={d="卡拉诺斯最勇敢的矮人们已经组建了一支消防队，随时准备抵御无头骑士的进攻。你想帮忙吗？\n\n巡山人在这里的南边设立了一处练习场，训练大家的灭火技术。你也到那里去练习吧，用小水桶把水泼到火盆上。小水桶在水缸周围放了许多，你可以自由取用。\n\n再见，$n。你完成了消防队的练习之后，请再过来找我们！",dEN="The brave dwarves of Kharanos can form a fire brigade in an instant, now that the Headless Horseman is around. Do you want to help?\n\nSouth of here, the mountaineers set up a small area to practice fighting fires. Go there and throw buckets onto the blazes. You can fill a bucket from the water barrel here.\n\nGood bye, <name>. When you're done with fire brigade practice, please visit us again!",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后与穿戏服的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Throw Water Buckets onto 5 fires, and then speak with the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="你好，<name>。你一直在磨练自己的灭火技巧吗？别忘了南边的练习场！",pEN="Hello, <name>. Have you been perfecting your fire fighting techniques? Don't forget about the practice area to the south!",c="你身上全给烟灰弄脏了！想必你已经扑灭了那些火焰！\n\n干得好！身为救火队的荣誉成员，我请求你在村庄需要你的时候回来帮助我们！",cEN="You're smudged with soot! You must have been extinguishing fires!\n\nWell done! As an honorary member of the Kharanos Fire Brigade, I beg you to return here if ever the village needs you!"}
Q[11440]={d="在无头骑士的威胁之下，秘蓝岗哨的英雄们随时都准备着组成消防队，扑灭这里的火势。你愿意加入我们吗？\n\n就在这里西边不远，卫兵们已经创建了一处小营地以便练习救火。你也到那里去练习吧，用小水桶把水泼到火盆上就是了。小水桶在水缸周围放了许多，你可以自由取用。\n\n再见，$n。你完成了消防队的练习之后，请再过来找我们！",dEN="With the threat of the Headless Horseman looming, the peacekeepers have been diligent in forming a fire brigade when needed. Do you want to help?\n\nWest of here, toward the Exodar, the peacekeepers set up a small area to practice fighting fires. Go there and throw buckets onto the blazes. You can fill a bucket from the water barrel here.\n\nGood bye, <name>. When you're done with fire brigade practice, please visit us again!",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后与穿戏服的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Throw Water Buckets onto 5 fires, and then speak with the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="你好，<name>。你一直在磨练自己的灭火技巧吗？别忘了西边的练习场！",pEN="Hello, <name>. Have you been perfecting your fire fighting techniques? Don't forget about the practice area to the west!",c="你身上全给烟灰弄脏了！想必呢已经扑灭了那些火焰！\n\n干得好！身为救火队的荣誉成员，我请求你在村庄需要你的时候回来帮助我们！",cEN="You're wet and smudged with soot! You must have been extinguishing fires!\n\nWell done! As an honorary member of the Azuremyst Fire Brigade, I beg you to return here if ever the village needs you!"}
Q[11441]={d="与铁炉堡外的美酒节营地中的美酒节组织者谈一谈，免费领取一杯啤酒。",dEN="Speak to the Brewfest Organizer at the Brewfest Grounds outside of Ironforge and receive a free beer.",o="与美酒节组织者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Brewfest Organizer.",c="什么？！一杯免费啤酒？好吧，好吧。我猜我们决定今年要这么做了。",cEN="Ho ho! Come for your free beer?"}
Q[11442]={d="在铁炉堡外的美酒节会场找到美酒节组织者，领取免费的啤酒。",dEN="[PH] Speak to the Brewfest Organizer at the Brewfest Grounds outside of Ironforge and receive a free beer.",o="与美酒节组织者交谈，以领取免费的啤酒。",oEN="[PH] Speak to the Brewfest Organizer and receive a free beer.",c="嘿嘿！要来拿你的免费啤酒吗？",cEN="Ho ho! Come for your free beer?"}
Q[11443]={d="嘿……呃……怎么样？你在下面这儿做什么？\n\n我？呃……嗯，你看……我……呃……正在清理这个地方！凯勒亲自下的命令！他对我说，\"哈利，我要你戴上潜水钟，去匕首湾的沉船里搜寻我们自己的东西……\n\n喂，既然你在这儿，也许你能帮我一把。整个海湾里到处都是好东西，呃，我是说补给品。出去把你找到的东西都带回来给我。戴上这个潜水头盔，免得你没了空气憋死。",dEN="Hey... Uh... What's up? What are you doing down here?\n\nMe? Oh... Well, you see... I'm... Um... I'm trying to clean this place up! Orders from Keller himself! He says to me, \"Harry, I want you to put on a divin' bell and search the shipwrecks of Daggercap for OUR stuff...\"\n\nSay, maybe you could lend me a hand while you're down here. Throughout the bay here are all kinds of goodies, err, I mean supplies. Go out and bring me back whatever you find. Use this diving helm so you don't run out of air and die.",o="匕鞘湾海底的哈洛德·拉格拉斯要你打捞10只瓦加德补给箱。",oEN="Harold Lagras at the bottom of Daggercap Bay wants you to recover 10 Valgarde Supply Crates.",p="你找到补给箱吗？",pEN="Did you find those supplies?",c="哇！你的效率可真高。对嗯，把这些木箱交给我就对了。我需要把他们登记列单，还有一些你没受过训练也不会懂的事情。别担心，我一定会让凯勒你知道你在这里的成绩！对对对，你可以走了。快走吧！",cEN="Wow! You sure are efficient. Yep, well, just give me those crates. I'll need to document them and take inventory and some other stuff that you haven't been trained to deal with or understand. Don't worry; I'll be sure to let Keller know what a great job you did down here! Yep. Yea, you can leave now. Skedaddle!"}
Q[11446]={d="与奥格瑞玛外的美酒节营地中的美酒节组织者谈一谈，免费领取一杯啤酒。",dEN="Speak to the Brewfest Organizer at the Brewfest Grounds outside of Orgrimmar and receive a free beer.",o="与美酒节组织者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Brewfest Organizer.",c="什么？！一杯免费啤酒？好吧，好吧。我猜我们决定今年要这么做了。",cEN="What?! A free beer? Yeah, yeah. I guess we said we'd do that this year."}
Q[11447]={d="在铁炉堡外的美酒节会场找到美酒节组织者，领取免费的啤酒。",dEN="[PH] Speak to the Brewfest Organizer at the Brewfest Grounds outside of Ironforge and receive a free beer.",o="与美酒节组织者交谈，以领取免费的啤酒。",oEN="[PH] Speak to the Brewfest Organizer and receive a free beer.",c="嘿嘿！要来拿你的免费啤酒吗？",cEN="What?! A free beer? Yeah, yeah. I guess we said we'd do that this year."}
Q[11448]={d="全是一些无法解读的神秘文字！就算是有这份密码表，我也完全搞不出任何头绪来。必须得承认，解译密码完全不是我的强项。\n\n你带上这些密码表和石板立刻去找我们的密码破译员斯坦瓦德，请求他的帮助吧。不过糟糕的是，我两周没和斯坦瓦德联系上了。他前几天和二十多个科学家一起去了峡湾东南边一处峭壁上的挖掘站，自那以后就一直没他的消息。我想，最好的办法就是让米克高维尔用飞行器带你过去，省时省力。",dEN="It's all a bunch of cryptic nonsense! Even with this cipher I can't make heads or tails of these tablets. Admittedly, cryptography is not my strong point.\n\nYou'll need to take the cipher and tablets to our cryptographer, Stanwad. Unfortunately, I haven't heard from Stanwad in two weeks. He took a team of twenty scientists to the dig sites on the southeastern bluffs of the fjord and hasn't been heard from since. The best I can do is have McGoyver over there give you a lift with his flying machine.",o="将米科索夫的包裹送给嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的斯坦瓦德。",oEN="Deliver McSorf's Bundle to Stanwad at the Explorers' League Outpost in Howling Fjord.",p="<斯坦瓦德嘟哝着。>",pEN="<Stanwad grumbles.>",c="<斯坦瓦德从你手中接过包裹开始把资料分类。>\n\n哇，你说为了拿到这份资料死了多少人？\n\n<斯坦瓦德摇摇头。>\n\n你应该要觉得高兴，米克索夫和那群低能手下发现的是冻土荒原中的一份古老文件。他没有提到一般蔬菜的图案，或是那些人嘴大嚼蔬菜的象形文字？你根本不需要那些该死的密码就能破解这些编码！",cEN="<Stanwad takes the bundle from you and begins sorting the data.>\n\nWow. How many people did you say died to get this information?\n\n<Stanwad shakes his head.>\n\nYou'll be happy to know that what McSorf and his crew of bumbling imbeciles discovered is an ancient recipe for tundra stew. Did he not notice the icons of common vegetables and the pictograph of a humanoid mouth chompin' down on said veggies? You don't need a damned cipher to break this code!"}
Q[11449]={d="卫兵们在镇外不远的地方设立了一处消防练习点。我们绝对不能让布瑞尔的建筑物处在火灾的威胁之下。你也应该去参加练习，成为一名消防员！\n\n从西门经过墓地，然后一直沿路走，就能找到训练营。到那里拿个水桶就赶紧开始练习灭火吧！",dEN="The deathstalkers have set up a fire training area outside the town. We cannot afford further damage to the buildings of Brill - you should do your duty and train as a fire fighter.\n\nHead west past the graveyard, following the road. You'll find the training area there.",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后回到布瑞尔，与戴面具的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Toss Water Buckets on 5 fires, then speak with the Masked Orphan Matron in Brill.",p="你扑灭过火了吗，<name>？训练场在布瑞尔西边。",pEN="Have you dowsed any fires, <name>? The training area is west of Brill.",c="干得好，<name>。孩子们，好好看看这位<class>。让她成为你们的好榜样。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Children, take a good look at this <class>. Let her be a strong example to you."}
Q[11450]={d="卫兵们在镇外不远的地方设立了一处消防练习点。我们绝对不能让无头骑士摧毁我们耗费了如此巨大的代价才重建起来的建筑物。你也应该去参加练习，成为一名消防员！\n\n从南边出门，然后走到十字路口，就能找到训练营了。",dEN="The guards have set up a fire training area outside the town. We cannot allow the Horseman to destroy what we have worked so hard to rebuild - you should do your duty and train as a fire fighter.\n\nHead south through the gate to the crossroads. You'll find the training area there.",o="将小水桶里的水倒在5处火盆上，然后回到鹰翼广场，与戴面具的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="Toss Water Buckets on 5 fires, then speak with the Masked Orphan Matron in Falconwing Square.",p="你扑灭过火了吗，<name>？训练场在猎鹰之翼广场南边。",pEN="Have you dowsed any fires, <name>? The training area is south of Falconwing Square.",c="干得好，<name>。孩子们，好好看看这位<class>。愿<him/her>成为你们效仿的好榜样。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Children, take a good look at this <class>. Let <him/her> be a fine example for you to follow."}
Q[11452]={d="死去的首领手中握着一卷羊皮纸，你从中辨认出了下面墓穴里正在举行的仪式场景。\n\n但维库人的王后安格博达女王似乎在唤醒伊米隆国王时遇到了困难。仪式就在亚勒伯龙最北端的寒冬大厅中举行。\n\n如果你动作够快，或许还来得及阻止她。",dEN="A sheaf of parchment drops from the still hand of the overlord. Upon it you can discern the outline of the rituals that are taking place in the catacombs below.\n\nHowever, it appears that the queen of the vrykul, Angerboda, is having difficulty awakening King Ymiron. The ritual is taking place within the large chamber, known as the Winter's Terrace, on the north end of Gjalerbron.\n\nIf you hurry, you may be able to stop her before it is too late.",o="击败安格博达女王并阻止唤醒伊米隆国王的仪式。完成任务后，回到西部卫戍要塞向亚当斯上尉复命。",oEN="Defeat Queen Angerboda and stop the ritual to awaken King Ymiron. Should you manage to do so, return to Westguard Keep and report your success to Captain Adams.",p="<name>，你带来了什么消息？",pEN="<name>, what news do you bring?",c="我不确定自己是不是乐意听到这个！巫妖王放过伊米隆只表示一件事：麻烦。可惜你没办法把他们夫妻一起杀死。\n\n但你终究为我们争取了宝贵的时间。\n\n或许通过你的方法，你有机会再次遇见伊米隆国王。不过我相信下次他只会更难缠。",cEN="I'm not sure that I like the sound of that one bit! The Lich King absconding with Ymiron can only mean trouble. Unfortunate that you weren't able to kill him along with his queen.\n\nStill, you've put a huge dent in their plans and bought us the valuable time that we need.\n\nAnd who knows, with the way you get around, you'll likely run into King Ymiron again. I'm sure that he won't fare so well the next time you meet."}
Q[11453]={d="死去的首领手中握着一卷羊皮纸，你从中辨认出了下面墓穴里正在举行的仪式场景。\n\n但维库人的王后安格博达女王似乎在唤醒伊米隆国王时遇到了困难。仪式就在亚勒伯龙最北端的寒冬大厅中举行。\n\n如果你动作够快，或许还来得及阻止她。",dEN="A sheaf of parchment drops from the still hand of the overlord. Upon it you can discern the outline of the rituals that are taking place in the catacombs below.\n\nHowever, it appears that the queen of the vrykul, Angerboda, is having difficulty awakening King Ymiron. The ritual is taking place within the large chamber, known as the Winter's Terrace, on the north end of Gjalerbron.\n\nIf you hurry, you may be able to stop her before it is too late.",o="击败安格博达女王并阻止唤醒伊米隆国王的仪式。完成任务后，回到冬蹄营地向灰烬图腾酋长复命。",oEN="Defeat Queen Angerboda and stop the ritual to awaken King Ymiron. Should you manage to do so, return to Camp Winterhoof and report your success to Chieftain Ashtotem.",p="<name>，你带来了什么消息？",pEN="<name>, what news do you bring?",c="我不确定自己是不是乐意听到这个！巫妖王放过伊米隆只表示一件事：麻烦。可惜你没办法把他们夫妻一起杀死。\n\n但你终究为我们争取了宝贵的时间。\n\n或许通过你的方法，你有机会再次遇见伊米隆国王。不过我相信下次他只会更难缠。",cEN="I'm not sure that I like the sound of that one bit! The Lich King absconding with Ymiron can only mean trouble. Unfortunate that you weren't able to kill him along with his queen.\n\nStill, you've put a huge dent in their plans and bought us the valuable time that we need.\n\nAnd who knows, with the way you get around, you'll likely run into King Ymiron again. I'm sure that he won't fare so well the next time you meet."}
Q[11454]={d="这张纸片似乎是那些黑铁入侵者不小心落下的。\n\n图样很复杂，是用某种矮人密码写成的，但末尾的签名——\"寇仁·恐酿\"——相当清晰，其中还提到了黑石深渊深处的痛饮者。你应该去找出幕后主使，终结这些袭击。",dEN="This scrap of paper seems to have been left behind accidentally by the Dark Iron invaders.\n\nWhile the plans are complicated and written in some form of coded Dwarvish, the signature at the end - \"Coren Direbrew\" - is clear enough, as is mention of the Grim Guzzler deep within Blackrock Depths. You should seek out the instigator and put an end to these raids.",o="在黑石深渊的酒吧中找到科林·烈酒。",oEN="Find Coren Direbrew in the Grim Guzzler within Blackrock Depths.",c="真是可惜，你们这些家伙在上面狂欢，却没喝到最好的佳酿——我们的酒！有人邀请我们参加比赛吗？当然没有。你打了场仗，转眼你的酒就不够格了！所以没错，我们砸了你们几个酒桶，砸得有理！\n\n呃……不过既然你们已经突破了我们的防线什么的，也许你能帮我做点事……",cEN="It's a damn shame, it is, you lot cavorting up there without drinking the finest of the fine brews - ours! Did we get an invite to the competition? Of course not. Ya fight in some war and suddenly yer beer's not good enough! So aye, we smashed up yer kegs a bit, and rightly so!\n\nEr... seeing as you've smashed through our defenses and all, though, maybe ya can do something fer me..."}
Q[11455]={d="我们海盗有许多出名的特征，但卫生从来都不是其中一项。大多数海盗船上的老鼠都是船员数量的五到六倍。\n\n难怪我们搬到这里以后，岛上的熊都感染上了疫病。总之，上头要我们杀光这些熊。\n\n我刚巧听说有一种熊麝香在暴风城的贵族中很流行。我们可以杀死这些熊，然后把麝香卖掉。我已经预见到了巨大的商机！你还有什么想法吗？",dEN="Us pirates are known for many things, but hygiene isn't one of them. Most pirate ships be carrying five or six times as many rats as people.\n\nIt's no wonder all the bears on this island caught the rabies soon after we moved in. Long story short, the boss wants 'em all dead.\n\nIt just so happens I know a recipe for a bear musk fragrance popular among Stormwind nobles. We kill the bears and sell the musk. I see a fine business opportunity for us here. What say ye?",o="无赖港里的帅哥泰里要你从附近的狂暴棕熊身上收集4份熊麝香。",oEN="Handsome Terry at Scalawag Point in Howling Fjord wants you to obtain 4 Bear Musk from the Rabid Brown Bears in the surrounding area.",p="你有熊麝香要给我吗，伙计？",pEN="Ye got the bear musk for me, matey?",c="干得好！或许这没像在公海劫掠那么大胆，不过如果我错失了这个机会，那么我就是个该死的甲板清理员之子。",cEN="Excellent work! It might not be quite as daring as plundering the high seas, but I'd be a darned son of a deckswabber if I passed on this opportunity."}
Q[11456]={d="我们海象人以鱼为主食。但在食物短缺的时候，我们偶尔也会捕猎陆地上的动物。\n\n附近的伊斯卡尔村最近被海盗袭击了，难民不断涌到我们这里来。\n\n这周我们在海上的收获并不多，但这岛上有许多铲齿鹿，它们的肉又肥又多。\n\n为了帮助我的同胞，请你去捕猎这些巨大的动物，把它们的肉带给我。",dEN="We tuskarr rely mostly on our fish catch for sustenance. In times of great need, however, we will on occasion hunt land animals.\n\nThe nearby village of Iskaal was recently attacked by pirates and the survivors just keep pouring in.\n\nOur catch has been modest this week, but there are many shoveltusk on the island and their meat is plentiful.\n\nAid my people by hunting these great beasts and obtaining their meat.",o="卡玛古的长者阿图伊克要你转至长矛岛，从长矛岛铲齿鹿身上收集6份长矛岛铲齿鹿肉。",oEN="Elder Atuik at Kamagua in Howling Fjord wants you to obtain 6 pieces of Island Shoveltusk Meat from Island Shoveltusk in the Isle of Spears.",p="你拿到了我们需要的肉吗？",pEN="Have you obtained the meat we need?",c="谢谢你，<name>。我的人民正处在极度困难的时期。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. My people are in a time of great need."}
Q[11457]={d="战争之神伊斯利鲁克，在我们的部族中被描绘成一头银色的雄鹰。部落里一直流传着伊斯利鲁克打败了一百头座狼、拯救了它的孩子的传说。\n\n现在，我们也要为拯救自己的族人而战斗了。首先，我们要制作新的武器。在这座小岛的雪原上生活的霜翼奇美拉的犄角非常锋利，可以制成很好的矛头。请你帮我带一些最好的角回来。",dEN="Issliruk, the spirit of war, is depicted as a silver eagle by my people. Our stories tell of how Issliruk fought against a hundred worgs to save his young.\n\nIt is time for us, too, to fight against our foes to save our brethren. We will need to craft new weapons. The horns of the frostwing chimaera that make their home in the snowy parts of the island are sharp and are easily crafted into spear tips. Bring me the best of these horns that you can find.",o="长者阿图伊克要你去收集3根奇美拉角。",oEN="Elder Atuik wants you to obain 3 Chimaera Horns.",p="很高兴再见到你，<race>。",pEN="It's good to see you again, <race>.",c="你不断证明自己是个有价值的盟友，<name>。你的所作所为不会被忘记。",cEN="You continue to prove your worth as an ally, <name>. Your actions will not be forgotten."}
Q[11458]={d="伊斯利鲁克的图腾已经准备好了，$n，我要谢谢你。我们必须暂时抛弃平静的生活，打击那些侵犯我们领地的敌人。\n\n那些攻击伊斯卡尔的海盗已经失去了理智，他们杀死了所有的俘虏。到东方的伊斯卡尔去做你该做的事吧。带上这只号角，当你需要我们的帮助时，就吹响它。",dEN="The totem of Issliruk is ready, <name>, and for that I thank you. We must cast our peaceful ways for the time being and strike at those who've attacked our land and our kin.\n\nThe pirate slavers that raided Iskaal have lost their minds and slaughtered all their captives. Go to Iskaal, to the east of here and do what must must be done. Take this horn and call on my brethren should you need assistance.",o="长者阿图伊克要你转至伊斯卡尔，消灭8个疯狂的北海奴隶贩子。如果你需要帮助，可以吹响卡玛古号角。",oEN="Elder Atuik wants you to go to Iskaal and slay 8 Northsea Slavers. Use the Horn of Kamagua should you need assistance.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="你是个了不起的盟友，<name>。我的人民将永远感激你。",cEN="You are a formidable ally, <name>. My people will forever be in your debt."}
Q[11459]={d="我就喜欢这样，$gcompay:mami;。你想让我帮你找出是哪个孬种在糊弄$gcompay:mami;船员吗？\n\n你得给我带只呱呱叫的来，$gcompay:mami;。之后我就告诉你那混蛋是谁。不，不，是呱呱叫的会告诉你。你自己用眼睛看吧，就是这样。\n\n再给我带把刀来，伙计。走吧，伙计。",dEN="Is like dis, mon. Ye be wantin' me 'elp spotting some craven bag-o-wire been cardin' da crew?\n\nYe gotta bring me a croaker, matey. Aft I an' I show ye who da blaggard be, mon. Nah, nah, croaker show ye. Ye'll ku fer yerself with yer own deadlights, yahso.\n\nBring us a carver yahso too, 'atsteppa. Galang, bucko.",o="回去向帅哥泰里询问塞吉到底想要些什么。",oEN="Return to Handsome Terry to decipher what Zeh'gehn asked of you.",c="塞吉说的话，你一个字都听不懂？嗯，那可不嘛。\n\n让我来给你说一下吧。",cEN="You didn't understand a thing Zeh'gehn said? Well, of course not.\n\nLet's see then."}
Q[11460]={d="猎鹰训练术的关键在于训鹰者与猎鹰之间的关系。你必须赢得它们的信任！\n\n<希达尔格指着他脚边笼子里的猎鹰。>\n\n首先，你要通过喂食来博得这些动物的信任。\n\n这种名叫岩石猎鹰的鸟类以幼虫为食，而这片稀松的岩地正是峡湾幼虫的温床。我要你用幼虫来喂养笼子里的猎鹰。",dEN="The first and most important factor in falconry is the bond between the falconer and <his/her> bird. Trust must be earned by the master!\n\n<Hidalgo points to the falcons in the cage at his feet.>\n\nIf you are to earn their trust you will first need to fill their bellies.\n\nThe fjord rock falcon, as these birds are known, primarily eat grubs. Throughout the fjord you will find loose rocks that serve as breeding grounds for these grubs. Find a grub and return here to feed the falcons in the cage.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的希达尔格要你用一只峡湾幼虫喂养关在他脚边笼子里的猎鹰。",oEN="Hidalgo at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to find a Fjord Grub and feed it to one of the falcons in the cage by his feet.",p="这是一项重要的练习，<name>。如果你想成为一名鹰猎者，就必须学会如何喂养你的猎鹰。",pEN="This is an important exercise, <name>. If you are to become a falconer you must learn how to feed your bird.",c="是的，<name>。我能看到伙伴之间的纽带正在形成。她已经认你为主人了。",cEN="Yes, <name>. I can see the bond of companionship forming. She has accepted you as master."}
Q[11464]={d="我听说你替特里办了件不错的差事。我一直盼着有个可靠的人能出现在这一带。\n\n你看，海盗们喜欢赌博，可他们不喜欢偿还欠下的赌债。\n\n如果你有兴趣替我收些钱回来，我愿意分你一份。\n\n先从简单的开始吧。\"银月\"哈利有点古怪，他的帐篷里藏着各种昂贵的血精灵小玩意儿，可我每次去看他，他都装穷。把我的金子拿回来。",dEN="I heard you did a little work for Terry. I was hoping someone reliable would show up around these parts.\n\nSee, pirates love to gamble. They, however, do not love to pay their gambling debt.\n\nIf you're interested in collecting some coin on my behalf, I'd be willing to give you a cut.\n\nLet's start you out with an easy one. \"Silvermoon\" Harry's a bit of an eccentric, keeps all sorts of expensive blood elf knickknacks inside his tent - yet when I see him he always pretends to be broke. Get my gold.",o="无赖港的塔鲁克要你收回\"银月\"哈利的欠债。",oEN="Taruk at Scalawag Point wants you to collect \"Silvermoon\" Harry's Debt.",p="你回来啦。你拿到他欠我的钱了吗？",pEN="You're back. Did you get what's owed to me?",c="干得好。这是你那一份，<name>。这种活儿还多着呢。\n\n这座岛上赖账的海盗可不少。",cEN="A job well done. Here's your cut, <name>. There's more where this came from.\n\nThere's no shortage of deadbeat pirates on this island."}
Q[11465]={d="我率领一支商队从瓦加德出发，路过这里时遭到了掠龙氏族的袭击，我竟然是唯一的幸存者。混乱中，一车峡湾火鸡也不见了。这正是你训练岩石猎鹰的大好机会呀。\n\n<希达尔格将笼子递给你。>\n\n带上这只猎鹰笼，沿着营地西边的道路一直走。利用猎鹰捕获走失的火鸡，完成任务后回来向我复命。\n\n记得要喂养猎鹰！",dEN="I was leading a caravan here from Valgarde that was attacked by Dragonflayers. I was the only survivor of that ambush. Unfortunately, I couldn't make it back here with the cargo of fjord turkeys. This is the perfect opportunity for you to get your feet wet with your rock falcon.\n\n<Hidalgo hands you a cage.>\n\nTake this falcon cage and head west down the road leading out of this camp. Use the falcon to capture the loose turkeys and return here when you've gathered enough.\n\nRemember to feed the falcon!",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的希达尔格要你利用训练过的岩石猎鹰捕捉5只峡湾火鸡。\n\n完成任务后将笼子交给希达尔格。",oEN="Hidalgo at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Trained Rock Falcon to recover 5 Fjord Turkeys.\n\nReturn to Hidalgo with the cage once you have completed this task.",p="你必须要持续喂食你的猎鹰，否则它就会把猎物给吃了。",pEN="Your falcon must be constantly fed or else it will eat the prey that you are sending it to kill.",c="真是一群耐心又聪明的混蛋！我们不能再继续低估我们的敌人了。这些维库人可真是致命的狩猎者！\n\n也许是时候让你猎一些更困难的猎物了，而不是抓几只肥胖的火鸡，对吧？",cEN="Clever fiends. And patient too! We need to stop underestimating our enemy. Those vrykul are deadly hunters!\n\nRegardless, mission accomplished. Perhaps it is time for you to hunt something a bit more elusive than a fat turkey, eh?"}
Q[11466]={d="我们的下一个顾客，杰克·亚当，并不像哈瑞那样好对付。他整天都在和他那群强壮的海盗朋友们一起喝酒。这次我们不要使用武力，因为使用武力的话对你来说结局会很悲惨。\n\n看看你是不是可以利用他嗜酒的习性，因为他只能喝一丁点。\n\n也许某个酒吧女郎能助你一臂之力。等他出门以后，看看你是否有机会把你的手滑到他的口袋里，帮我取回我的那份。",dEN="Our next customer, Jack Adams, won't be the pushover that Harry was. He spends all day drinking with his friends, tough pirates all of them. Let's not use force this time, could get ugly.\n\nSee if you can use his drinking habit to your advantage. There's only so much alcohol someone can handle before passing out.\n\nMaybe one of the bar wenches will be of assistance. Once he's out, see if you can slip your hand into his pocket and get what's mine.",o="无赖港的塔鲁克希望你帮他讨回杰克·亚当的赌债。",oEN="Taruk at Scalawag Point in Howling Fjord wants you to collect Jack Adams' Debt.",p="你把我东西拿回来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you get what's mine, <name>?",c="你让我印象深刻，<name>。而我不是那种轻易就被打动的人。",cEN="I'm impressed, <name>. And I'm not the type who's easily impressed."}
Q[11467]={d="你可能听说过康纳德，他是这一地区有名的海盗。\n\n呃，他跟我赌过一把，当然他也没有付赌债。\n\n我很想把钱收回来，但问题是……他已经死了。\n\n我几乎准备要把他的欠债都给一笔勾销了，结果我发现了这个……\n\n<塔鲁克展开一张长矛岛的地图，你发现东北方的高原区域画着一把大叉。>\n\n他把他的财宝藏在了海象人的土地上，我希望你能帮我把它拿回来。要是我让那个混账就这么没还清赌债就走了，我就活该下地狱。",dEN="You might've heard of Black Conrad, he's a famous pirate around these parts.\n\nWell, he had a thing for gambling on my fights. He had a thing for not paying, too.\n\nI'd love to collect, but trouble is... he's dead.\n\nI was about ready to write the whole thing off, when I came across this...\n\n<Taruk unfolds a map of the Isle of Spears with an X on a northeastern plateau.>\n\nHe hid his treasure on tuskarr land. I want you to get it. I'll be damned if I let that bilge sucker get away without paying.",o="无赖港的塔鲁克要你转至伊斯卡尔以北的长矛岛，在该岛的东北尽头寻找康纳德的宝藏。",oEN="Taruk at Scalawag Point wants you to search for Black Conrad's Treasure on the plateau in the northeastern end of the Isle of Spears, just north of Iskaal.",p="你找到宝藏了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you find the treasure, <name>?",c="我要拿走黄金，这是康纳德欠我的。剩下你可以留着。\n\n如果你需要一点更保值的东西，我敢保证我能替你安排一些。愿你的航行风吹不息，朋友。",cEN="I'll take the gold, as it is what Conrad owed me. The rest is for you to keep.\n\nIf you're ever in need of something more permanent, I'm sure I could arrange for something. In the meantime, may the wind blow strong in your sail, friend."}
Q[11468]={d="$n，你能感受到自己与猎鹰之间的亲密关系吗？你们被一条看不见的纽带连接起来了。如果我说一旦时机成熟，你就能拥有鹰眼的视野，你相信吗？真的，那是猎鹰训练术的最高境界。\n\n但是首先，你还要接受更多的狩猎训练！你必须将这只猎鹰训练成反应敏锐的猛禽。让它去对付更可怕的敌人！峡湾隼就栖息在这四周的树梢上，它们就是你的下一个目标！",dEN="Do you feel the closeness, <name>? Surely you feel a true bond forming between you and your falcon. Would you believe me if I told you that when the time is right you'll be able to see through the eyes of your bird? Aye, it is the ultimate level of falconry.\n\nBut first you must hunt more! The bird must hone and quicken its reflexes. Send it against a more formidable opponent! The fjord hawks of the region make the tops of the trees around us their homes. They shall be your next target!",o="啸风峡湾探险者协会前哨站的希达尔格要你用训练好的岩石猎鹰捕捉 10 只峡湾隼。\n\n完成后带着笼子回去见希达尔格。|n",oEN="Hidalgo at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use your Trained Rock Falcon to capture 10 Fjord Hawks.\n\nReturn to Hidalgo with the cage when you have completed this task.",p="你必须持续喂食你的猎鹰，否则它就会把你捕抓的猎物给吃了。",pEN="Your falcon must be constantly fed or else it will eat the prey you are sending it to kill.",c="哎，猎鹰的地域性很强，且常常成群结队的旅行。我想我应该在派你出发前就先告诉你的。",cEN="Aye, the hawks are very territorial and often travel in packs. I suppose I could have told you that before I sent you out into the field."}
Q[11469]={d="是啊，我得在疯狂约纳过来巡视之前把甲板擦得一尘不染。而且我才不会跪着擦！\n\n问题是，我们的肥皂用光了。不过这与其说是我的问题，不如说是你的问题，$gbucanero:bucanera;。既然你是$gel novato:la novata;，我给你安排了一趟特别的差事。\n\n这座岛的西北海岸有一大群海狮。在附近的浮冰中间你会找到那头领头的公海狮，大罗伊。把他的脂肪带回来给我，我就能变出你见过的最好的肥皂！",dEN="Yeah, I got to get the deck swabbed spotless afore Mad Jonah comes 'round. An' I ain't gonna do it on my hands and knees neither!\n\nProblem is, we're all outa soap. That's more your problem than mine though, mate. Being the newbie 'round here, I gots a special trip for ya to make.\n\nUp on the northwest coast of this island, there's a whole mess o' sea lions. Amongst the nearby ice floes you'll find the alpha bull, Big Roy. Bring me back his blubber and I'll magic-up the best soap ya ever seen!",o="斯卡特·弗洛斯普要你取回制作魔法肥皂的主要原料——大个子罗伊的脂肪。完成任务后返回无赖港东边的海盗船向她复命。",oEN="Scuttle Frostprow wants you to obtain Big Roy's Blubber as the main ingredient for her magic swabbin' soap. Return to her on the eastern pirate ship at Scalawag Point when you have it.",p="脂肪在哪里？别告诉我它身上什么都没有。\n\n大个子罗伊该死地胖成那样，它还会动真是个奇迹！",pEN="Where's that blubber? An' don't try to tell me he ain't got none either.\n\nThat Big Roy's so damned big it's a wonder he can still galumph around!",c="额……我从来没闻过这么臭的东西！\n\n过来，把东西放在这里吧。让我来施法，它就会变成肥皂！",cEN="Ew, that's a stink if I ever smelled one!\n\nGo on now, put it down right here. I'll cast my spell and she'll be swabbin' soap for sure!"}
Q[11470]={d="你已经$gpreparado:preparada;，可以进入鹰猎的下一步了，$n。\n\n带着你训练好的猎鹰去此地东边的石墙升降梯旁的维库鹰巢。你将在那里放出猎鹰去偷取峡湾隼的蛋。它们的巢穴位于鹰巢周围峭壁的偏僻处。找到那些巢穴，用你的猎鹰去搜取鹰蛋！\n\n小心峡湾隼女族长，$n。如果你遭到攻击，就用猎鹰的逃脱和翱翔技能逃走。",dEN="You are most definitely ready for the next step in falconry, <name>.\n\nTake your trained falcon east of here, to the vrykul hawk roost near the Stonewall Lift. From the roost you will send out your falcon to steal the eggs of the hawks. Their nests will be located in remote areas of the cliff walls surrounding the roost. Locate those nests and use your falcon to scavenge for the eggs!\n\nBeware the fjord hawk matriarchs, <name>. Should you come under attack, use your falcon's escape and soar abilities to flee!",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的希达尔格要你利用训练过的岩石猎鹰偷取8枚峡湾隼的卵。\n\n完成任务后将笼子交给希达尔格。",oEN="Hidalgo at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use your Trained Rock Falcon to capture 8 Fjord Hawk Eggs.\n\nReturn to Hidalgo with the cage when you have completed this task.",p="现在由你掌控了，<name>。指挥你的猎鹰，把那些蛋给我带回来。",pEN="You are in control now, <name>. Guide your falcon and bring me those eggs.",c="好极了，<name>！好极了！你和你的猎鹰之间有着牢固的血脉纽带！也许不久的将来，你就能执行一些针对维库人的侦察任务了？",cEN="Bravo, <name>! Bravo! The bond of kinship between you and your falcon is strong! Perhaps you can run some reconnaissance missions against the vrykul in the not-too-distant future?"}
Q[11471]={d="我知道你来这里的目的，$n。他们派你来杀死我们的首领，约纳·斯特林。\n\n我愿意帮助你——约纳的领导已经快把我们全毁了。\n\n同时攻击部落和联盟的舰队？那就是自杀！明知道海象人离开这里的气候环境就会在几天内死去还把他们当奴隶卖掉？真是灾难！\n\n约纳就藏在西边的洞穴里，把他的望远镜给我带来。我一当上首领，就会立即下令停止攻击你的盟友。",dEN="I know why you're here, <name>. You've been sent to kill our leader, Jonah Sterling.\n\nI'd like to offer my help. Jonah's leadership threatens our operation.\n\nAttacking the Horde and the Alliance fleets simultaneously? Suicidal. Trying to sell the tuskarr as slaves when they die days after leaving this climate? Disastrous.\n\nJonah's hideout is located inside a cave west of here. Bring me his spyglass as proof of the deed and my first action as lead will be to end all attacks against your allies.",o="无赖港的安妮·波恩要你把“疯狗”约纳·斯特林的望远镜交给她。",oEN="Annie Bonn at Scalawag Point wants you to bring her Jonah Sterling's Spyglass.",p="怎么样，<name>。你拿到约纳的望远镜了吗？\n\n我可不能光凭你一句话就相信那场刺杀，你明白吗？毕竟我是个海盗。",pEN="Well, <name>. Did you get Jonah's spyglass?\n\nI can't just take your word for the assassination, you know? I am a pirate after all.",c="约纳·斯特林的日子终于到头了！他绝没想到这个\"小妞\"能做到。\n\n随着约纳的死讯在海盗中传开，我会巩固自己的领导地位。你的盟友再也不会受到我手下的骚扰了，<name>。",cEN="Jonah Sterling's days are finally over! He never thought this \"wench\" would make it.\n\nAs word of Jonah's death spreads among the pirates I will consolidate my leadership. Your allies won't get any more trouble from my crew, <name>."}
Q[11472]={d="北海海盗杀掉了岛上的海狮之王，大个子罗伊。他们用它的脂肪做成肥皂来清洗甲板！\n\n<阿努尼克叹了口气。>\n\n现在已经看不见成双成对的海狮了，我们必须恢复这个物种的数量。\n\n此地东南方就是双子海岸，居住在那里的雄性暗礁海狮喜食美味的暗礁鱼。你可以在这座小岛的东面和西面找到这种美味的鱼。\n\n用这张网收集足够的暗礁鱼，至少一打吧，越多越好啦。用它将一只雄性暗礁海狮引到峡湾对面的雌性暗礁海狮身边。",dEN="The Northsea Pirates slaughtered the isles' alpha sea lion bull, Big Roy. They made soap from him to clean the decks of their ships!\n\n<Anuniaq sighs.>\n\nNow the sea lions won't mate. Help me to repopulate their numbers.\n\nThe reef bulls can be found at the Twin Shores to the southeast. They crave the tasty reef fish that can be found on the east and west sides of the isles.\n\nTake this net and gather enough fish, at least a dozen -- maybe more, to lure a bull across the strait to a reef cow.",o="利用美味的暗礁鱼将雄性暗礁海狮引到雌性暗礁海狮身边。帮助它们找到真爱后，返回嚎风峡湾的卡玛古，向阿努尼克复命。",oEN="Toss Tasty Reef Fish at a Reef Bull to lead it to a Reef Cow. Once you have helped the two to find true love, return to Anuniaq at Kamagua.",c="这真是好消息！现在会有更多公海狮游过海峡与母海狮交配。很快岛上就会有很多新的礁石幼崽。\n\n谢谢你，<race>。无论你过去做过什么，要知道你为卡玛古的未来出了力！\n\n如果要确保它们的数量恢复，我们还得继续努力。请明天再来，这样我们就能帮另一对海狮相聚了。",cEN="This is good news! Now more bulls will swim across the strait to mate with the cows. Soon there will be plenty of new reef pups on the isles.\n\nThank you, <race>. Whatever you might have done in the past, know that you have helped with Kamagua's future!\n\nWe'll have to keep up the good work if we're going to see to it that their numbers are replenished. Please come back again tomorrow so that we can help another couple find each other."}
Q[11473]={d="我们的副首领安妮·波恩最近有些神经兮兮的，她总觉得我们中间出了叛徒。你信吗？\n\n反正我们可以用一个非常简单的办法找出那些蛀虫。你看，亲爱的老塞吉正好是一个非常出色的巫医。他的系列技艺传自祖尔……什么什么的。\n\n去告诉他，我们需要他帮忙占卜。我得提醒你，$n，我们这儿能听懂塞吉说话的人可不多。",dEN="Our second in command, Annie Bonn, has been acting rather paranoid as of late. She seems sure we have an infiltrator in our ranks, can ye believe it?\n\nAnyhow, we have a foolproof way of uncovering rats around these parts. See, good ole' Zeh'gehn over here happens to be an authentic witch doctor. His family hails all the way from Zul... something or other.\n\nGo let him know that we're in need of his divination skills. I must warn ye, <name>, only one or two of us can understand anything Zeh'gehn says.",o="与无赖港的塞吉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Zeh'gehn at Scalawag Post.",c="哎呀，伙计。你来找俺干嘛呀？",cEN="Ku here, mate. Ye come fe see I an' I, aye?"}
Q[11474]={d="真是跟以前一样，所有的工作又都堆到我们这队人身上了。那个米科索夫的队伍没有白白牺牲，真得谢天谢地啊！他们找到的密码表或许对我们研究这边发现的东西能有点帮助——但前提是我们真能进到遗迹里发现点什么东西！这帮该死的铁矮人，不知道从哪里冒出来的，突然就来一大群，把我们轰出来不说，居然还想把这个挖掘站给填埋掉！你能相信吗？这帮混蛋居然想把我们的发现给埋掉！\n\n总之，去那边找沃尔特谈谈，他会给你分派工作的。",dEN="As usual, the real work is left up to me and my crew. Thankfully McSorf's team didn't die for nothin'. The cipher they recovered will help us crack the stuff we've found up here - that is if we can ever get back to it! Damned iron dwarves have sprung up like leaks all over the place and are now attemptin' to bury the sites! Can you believe it? Bastards want to bury our finds!\n\nAnyhow, talk to Walt over yonder. He'll get you started.",o="与沃尔特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Walt.",c="我们队里一半以上的人不是死了就是失踪了，新手。这是我们在这片高崖上的最后据点。那些该死的铁矮人把我们从伊瓦尔德废墟和巴尔古废墟里都赶了出来。现在我有个计划，能趁他们把所有好东西都埋起来、让我们永远失去那些数据之前，重新杀回去。",cEN="Over half our team is dead or missing, junior. This is our last stand up here on the high bluffs. Those damned iron dwarves pushed us out of both Ivald's Ruin and Baelgun's. Now I've got a plan to get us back inside before they bury up all our goodies and we lose that data forever."}
Q[11475]={d="我研究这台没启动的构造体有好几天了，$n。我认为我也能仿造出一台跟这台一样的、超级完美的、令人着魔的构造体出来，对，里面还能坐进去一个人。靠这玩意，我们就能轻而易举地骗过那些白痴铁矮人，光明正大地混进巴尔古挖掘场里面去啦。\n\n不过，我现在手里只有铁锤和烙铁，这样可什么都干不了。我需要我的工具！那群铁矮人出现的时候，我吓得扭头就跑，结果把工具丢在伊瓦尔德废墟里了。帮我取回来！\n\n伊瓦尔德废墟就在东北不远的地方。",dEN="I've been studying this deactivated construct for days, <name>. I think I can create a reasonable facsimile of the golem that would have room inside to fit one passenger. The idea being that it would fool those iron dwarves and allow us to get inside Baelgun's.\n\nNow I'm not gonna be able to make anything with a hammer and poker. I need my tools! Unfortunately I left those behind at Ivald's Ruin when the iron dwarves first attacked. Get me my tools!\n\nIvald's Ruin is located far to the northeast.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要求你取回他的建造工具。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to recover his Building Tools.",p="步骤1：替沃尔特取得他的工具。",pEN="Step 1: Get Walt his tools.",c="现在我拿到了我的工具，可以开始动工了。喔，只要我有材料的话。你接下来要帮我取得那些材料。",cEN="Now that I've got my tools, the building can begin. Well, as soon as I have some materials. You'll be getting those for me next."}
Q[11476]={d="这一带有些海盗……我们有自己独特的说话方式。泽格恩有……很多种不同的说话方式……全都混在一起。\n\n依我看，他想要一只青蛙和一把刀。\"\n银月\"哈利也许有把不贵的刀。镇上到处都是青蛙，抓一只，连同刀一起给他送去。\n\n我可不想落得那只小东西的下场，你懂我的意思吧……\n",dEN="Some of the pirates around here... we have our own special way of talking. Zeh'gehn has... many different special ways of talking... all mixed together.\n\nFrom what I can tell he wants a frog and a knife.\n\n\"Silvermoon\" Harry might have a knife on the cheap. There's frogs all over town, just grab one and bring it to him along with the knife.\n\nI'd hate to be in the poor critter's shoes, if you know what I mean.",o="从\"银月\"哈利那里弄一把闪亮的刀，并在无赖角捕捉一只无赖蛙。把这些东西带给无赖角的泽格恩。",oEN="Get a Shiny Knife from \"Silvermoon\" Harry and capture a Scalawag Frog. Bring these to Zeh'Gehn at Scalawag Point.",p="你拿到刮刮和呱呱了吗，老兄？",pEN="Ye get the croaker and carver, mon?",c="感激感激，阿呆。呱呱看起来真会叫！",cEN="Much obliged, bucko. Croaker's lookin' real cris!"}
Q[11477]={d="小声点，$r。这些铁矮人很容易开枪。别被下面挖掘场里的动静骗了。那些铁皮怪物根本不是在挖东西！不，恰恰相反——他们在把遗址埋起来！不知出于什么鬼理由，他们不想让任何人发现这个地方。\n\n什么样的矮人会埋掉古代遗物和挖掘场？我告诉你是什么样：就是那种该被你不顾一切地杀掉的矮人！进去把他们干掉！",dEN="Keep it down, <race>. These iron dwarves are quick on the trigger. Now don't let the activities down in the dig fool you. Those steel-skinned abominations aren't digging anything up! No sir - on the contrary - they're burying the site! For whatever whacked out reason, they don't want anyone finding this place.\n\nWhat kind of dwarf buries ancient relics and dig sites? I'll tell you what kind: the kind you kill with reckless abandon! Get in there and take 'em out!",o="伊瓦尔德废墟的东尼要求你杀死10名铁符文毁灭者、5名铁符文劳工和5名铁符文先知。",oEN="Donny at Ivald's Ruin in the Howling Fjord wants you to kill 10 Iron Rune Destroyers, 5 Iron Rune Laborers and 2 Iron Rune Sages.",c="干得好，<name>。这会稍微拖慢他们的填埋进度。",cEN="Good job, <name>. That'll slow down the burial process a little."}
Q[11478]={d="大概你还没有去南边的探险者协会哨站拜访过我的弟弟斯坦瓦德吧。不如你就帮东尼一个忙，把这封信交给他，如何？他一定会对这边铁矮人的活动很感兴趣的。\n\n一路向南走，在进入巴尔古挖掘场之前，你就会在路的右边看见他们的哨站。",dEN="I see that you haven't visited my brothers at the Explorers' League Outpost south of here. Why don't you do Donny a favor and deliver this message to Stanwad. He'll be interested to hear about the activities of the iron dwarves up here.\n\nLike I said, mount up and start heading south. You'll see the outpost right before you get to Baelgun's.",o="将东尼的信交给探险者协会哨站的斯坦瓦德。",oEN="Deliver Donny's Letter to Stanwad at the Explorers' League Outpost.",p="来自东尼的消息？",pEN="News from Donny?",c="没错，这是我们已经知道的事情。不过还好，至少东尼还活着。",cEN="Yea, this isn't anything we don't already know. At least Donny's still alive."}
Q[11479]={d="呱呱叫的已经开口了，$gcompay:mami;。\"乌鸦腿\"丹就在那边那条船上。\n\n最好去把那个混蛋揪出来，伙计。让这帮家伙知道这里不是好惹的。等你把他收拾了再回去见特里。",dEN="Croaker's spoken, matey. \"Crowleg\" Dan's on da ship yonder.\n\nBest go trace that blaggard, mon. Show'im dis set's not fe be crossed. Gaan back fe Terry when ye keelhaul 'is behind.",o="去挑战无赖角一艘船上的丹\"乌鸦腿\"。完成后与英俊的特里交谈。",oEN="Confront \"Crowleg\" Dan, who is in one of the ships at Scalawag Point. Speak to Handsome Terry when you've completed this task.",c="这真是个难过的消息。丹是我的老朋友……而且他还欠我钱！不管怎样，如果他替那些南海的杂种工作，那他就是活该。\n\n而你，我的朋友。你现在可要一帆风顺了。",cEN="That's some sad news. Dan was me old friend... AND he owed me money. Either way, if he was working with the Southsea mongrels he got what he deserved.\n\nAs for you, my friend. You're on your way up. Literally."}
Q[11480]={d="你为我们所做的一切并不是徒劳的，$n。我们的副首领，伟大的安妮·波恩十分关注你的出色表现，她想要见你。",dEN="All the good work you've done for us hasn't gone unnoticed, <name>. Our second in command, the delightful Annie Bonn, is incredibly impressed with what you've done so far and wants to meet you.",o="与无赖港的安妮·波恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Annie Bonn at Scalawag Point.",c="哎呀呀。这不是<name>吗。你出现在无赖港，除了那个蠢货特里的某个地精朋友，没人听说过你。\n\n这么说吧，我对你来这里的目的有点……怀疑……",cEN="Well, well, well. If it isn't <name>. You show up at Scalawag point, no one's heard of you except some goblin friend of that half-wit Terry.\n\nLet's just say I'm a bit... skeptical... of your intentions here."}
Q[11481]={d="以纳鲁之名，$r，我感谢你的努力。\n\n然而我们的工作远未结束，我必须请求你承担一项至关重要的任务——其重要程度不亚于我此前发布的任何任务。\n\n我们的兵力太过分散。为了应对压力，我们不得不派出一支分队前往艾泽拉斯，调查太阳之井高地的事态进展。\n\n那里需要你，$n。去向拉雷索尔报到。告诉他，我真希望能多拨出些人手。",dEN="By the naaru, I thank you, <race>, for your efforts.\n\nOur work is far from finished, however, and I must request that you undertake a critical mission - one as important as any I've issued.\n\nOur forces are spread thinly. To compound the strain, we've had to dispatch a contingent to Azeroth to investigate developments at the Sunwell Plateau.\n\nYou are needed there, <name>. Report to Larethor. Tell him that I wish we could spare more men.",o="沙塔斯城奥尔多高地的圣光护卫者阿德因要求你转至太阳之井高地，与主教拉雷索尔谈一谈。",oEN="Adyen the Lightwarden on the Aldor Rise in Shattrath City has requested that you travel to Sunwell Plateau and speak with Larethor.",c="又一个来自沙塔斯的士兵？真是让人欣喜！\n\n真希望像你这样的人能多一些，不过我们只能用手头这些人凑合了。外面无论发生什么，都不会等我们准备好。\n\n四处看看吧，<class>。要做的事很多。搭把手，尽你的一份力。\n\n哦对了，别去招惹那些占星者……呃，我是说占星者。看来我们这回是同一条船上的人了……",cEN="Another soldier from Shattrath? A welcome sight!\n\nWish there were more of you, but we'll make due with what we have. Whatever's going on out here won't wait for us to make ready.\n\nHave a look around, <class>. There's much that needs doing. Pitch in and do your share.\n\nOh, yeah, and don't go tauntin' the cryers - err, Scryers. Looks like we're in this thing together...."}
Q[11482]={d="听我说，$r。\n\n你的职责要求你返回艾泽拉斯。所有有能力的人都必须立即前往太阳之井高地报到。\n\n恐怕我没有更多情报可以分享，除了这一点：\n\n这次任务你将与奥尔多联手。到达后找一位名叫拉雷索尔的德莱尼人交谈。\n\n看来形势要求我们放下分歧，携手合作。\n\n做好准备，$gamigo:amiga;，这事很严重。",dEN="Hear me, <race>.\n\nDuty requires that you return to Azeroth. Every able person is to report to the Sunwell Plateau immediately.\n\nI'm afraid I have no more information to share, except this:\n\nYou'll be joining forces with the Aldor for this mission. Speak with a draenei by the name of Larethor when you arrive.\n\nApparently, the situation calls for us to set our differences aside and join forces.\n\nPrepare yourself, friend. This sounds serious.",o="沙塔斯城占星者之台的达斯雷·射日者要求你转至太阳之井高地，与主教拉雷索尔谈一谈。",oEN="Dathris Sunstriker on Scryer's Tier in Shattrath City has insisted that you travel to Azeroth at once and report to Larethor at the Sunwell.",c="欢迎来到太阳之井高地，占星……什么？哦，占星者，对，当然。我不是刚这么说的吗？\n\n好了，现在我们把几件事说清楚。那些墙后面正在发生一些严重的事，处理它对双方人民都有利。既然我们谁都没有单独行动的兵力，那就一起……合作。明白了吗？\n\n那么，我们开始吧，好吗？",cEN="Welcome to Sunwell Plateau, cryer - What's that? Oh Scryer, yes of course. Isn't that what I said?\n\nWell, now, let's get a few things straight. There's some serious business going on behind those walls and it's in the interest of both of our people to address it. And since neither of us have the forces to go it alone, we're going to work - TOGETHER. Got that?\n\nNow let's get started, shall we?"}
Q[11483]={d="工具？有了。材料？没有。\n\n要想把这东西造出来，没材料可不行，这事就拜托你了。\n\n首先，我是说首先，$n，要构造基本的骨架，我需要尼弗莱瓦那边的大桶，还有瓦加德那边的黑铁条，再从拜尔海姆搞来一根高强度绳索。\n\n尼弗莱瓦和拜尔海姆都是维库人的镇子，在西北方。瓦加德就在匕鞘湾里，也在西北边，到那里以后，你可以去找米克高维尔要黑铁条。等你收集到了所有材料以后，米克高维尔还可以开飞机把你送回这里来。",dEN="Tools? Check. Materials? Negative.\n\nIf we're going to build this thing, you're going to have to get me the materials.\n\nFirst things first, <name>. For the skeletal structure I'm going to need a large barrel from Nifflevar, some dark iron ingots from Valgarde, and industrial strength rope from Baleheim.\n\nNifflevar and Baleheim are vrykul towns northwest of here. Valgarde is located in Daggercap Bay, also to the northwest. Speak with McGoyver to get the ingots. He'll fly you back here once you're all done.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你带回一只大桶、一根高强度绳索和一些黑铁条。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to bring him a Large Barrel, Industrial Strength Rope and Dark Iron Ingots.",p="你拿到了那些材料了吗？",pEN="Have you got the infrastructure materials?",c="太好了。结合这些东西再加上一层外皮，就可以做出一个完美的铁符文魔像的复制品。",cEN="Excellent. These combined with the skin will make for a flawless clone of the constructs the iron dwarves use."}
Q[11484]={d="固然对一台机械来说，内部的骨架非常重要，但我们也不能就此忽视它的外表。尤其是它得跟那些铁矮人造出来的一模一样才行，如果我们还想糊弄过关的话！\n\n这一点对我来说完全不算什么。\n\n你只需要给我带回来一张本地区的天然铲齿鹿皮和一些钢质棱条就行了，当然，你得到西北方的尼弗莱瓦或是拜尔海姆，去跟那里的维库人“借”一些钢质棱条来……",dEN="While the infrastructure for a piece of machinery like this is important, we can't underestimate the appearance of the construct. If we're to fool the iron dwarves the clone must be exact!\n\nI can make this happen.\n\nBring me a pristine shoveltusk hide from the shoveltusk of this region and steel ribbing from vrykul in Nifflevar or Baleheim to the northwest.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你带回一张天然铲齿鹿皮和一根钢质棱条。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to bring him a Pristine Shoveltusk Hide and Steel Ribbing.",p="我们将会尽量努力夺回我们圣物！",pEN="We'll be back collecting our relics in no time!",c="我几乎已经完成了整个构造体，只等基本框架完成。",cEN="I'll have the construct all ready to go as soon as the infrastructure is complete."}
Q[11485]={d="好了，$n。是时候让你爬进这个大家伙里，学习它的基本用法了。等你$gpreparado:preparada;，就上工作台，我送你进构造体里。\n\n你的第一课是使用它的传送系统。你会注意到铁矮人在挖掘场周围设置了特殊的符文雕刻。他们的构造体就是靠这些符文雕刻启动，并从一处飞往另一处的。用我在这里造的符文雕刻试试看。|n",dEN="Alright, <name>; the time has come for you to climb inside this thing and learn how to use its basic abilities. When you're ready, get on the work bench and I'll get you situated inside the construct.\n\nYour first lesson is going to be using the construct's transportation system. You'll notice that the iron dwarves have set up special rune carvings around the dig site. Their constructs use those rune carvings to power up and fly from point to point. Try it with the rune carving I built here.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你在沃尔特的铁符文雕像上使用铁符文构造体的火箭助推技能。\n\n完成任务，你可以在宠物选项菜单中点击解散宠物来解散构造体。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Iron Rune Construct's Rocket Jump ability at Walt's Iron Rune Carving.\n\nDismiss your construct by dismissing it from the pet window once you have completed the quest.",p="别对这些反对者多费唇舌！",pEN="Don't take any lip from these naysayers!",c="你差不多可以把这件艺术品带上战场了，<name>！",cEN="You're almost ready to take this work of art into the field, <name>!"}
Q[11486]={d="我知道像你这样的$g小子:姑娘最喜欢阻止冲突了，对吧？你想要让你们的美酒节平平安安地办完，不要出乱子。那么我有一个提议……\n\n在这只酒杯中装满我们最棒的烈酒，然后把它交给铁炉堡外的美酒节组织者，这样我们黑铁矮人也算是参加了这个节日！全艾泽拉斯最棒的烈酒来自这里！黑石山的深处！不要忘了这一点！",dEN="I know a bright <lad/lass> like ya wants to stop the hostilities on the surface, eh? Ya want yer nice and merry Brewfest to go off without a hitch. I'll make ya a deal.\n\nTake this keg of our finest brew to the Brewfest Organizer outside Ironforge, so that we Dark Iron dwarves can be rightly represented! The best brew in all of Azeroth comes from right here in this mountain, and don't ya ferget it!",o="将黑铁啤酒杯交给丹莫罗的埃菲库格·铁桶。",oEN="Take the Dark Iron Ale Keg to Ipfelkofer Ironkeg in Dun Morogh.",p="这是什么？",pEN="What's this?",c="所以你去拜访了黑铁矮人，想制止他们的破坏行动？不久前他们又发动了袭击。看来黑铁矮人的承诺和他们的酒一样靠得住，是吧？\n\n不过，你出手相助还是要谢谢你。来，把从山底深处带回来的这种\"麦酒\"拿去喝一杯当奖赏吧。打败那么多黑铁矮人，可真够口渴的！",cEN="So you visited the Dark Iron and sought to put a stop to their sabotage? They attacked again a bit ago. Seems a Dark Iron's word is as good as their brew, eh?\n\nStill, what you did to help is appreciated. Here, take a mug of the \"ale\" you brought from the depths of that mountain as your reward. Thirsty work, defeating all those Dark Irons!"}
Q[11487]={d="我知道像你这样的$g小子:姑娘最喜欢阻止冲突了，对吧？你想要让你们的美酒节平平安安地办完，不要出乱子。那么我有一个提议……\n\n在这只酒杯中装满我们最棒的烈酒，然后把它交给奥格瑞玛外的美酒节组织者，这样我们黑铁矮人也算是参加了这个节日！全艾泽拉斯最棒的烈酒来自这里！黑石山的深处！不要忘了这一点！",dEN="I know a bright <lad/lass> like ya wants to stop the hostilities on the surface, eh? Ya want yer nice and merry Brewfest to go off without a hitch. I'll make ya a deal.\n\nTake this keg of our finest brew to the Brewfest Organizer outside Orgrimmar, so that we Dark Iron dwarves can be rightly represented! The best brew in all of Azeroth comes from right here in this mountain, and don't ya ferget it!",o="将黑铁啤酒杯交给杜隆塔尔的塔波尔·斯威雷格。",oEN="Take the Dark Iron Ale Keg to Tapper Swindlekeg in Durotar.",p="你拿来的是什么？",pEN="What's that ya got there?",c="所以你去拜访了黑铁矮人，想制止他们的破坏行动，是吧，小子？你知道吗，他们又发动袭击了。看来黑铁矮人的承诺和他们的酒一样靠得住。\n\n不过我想，你出手相助还是要谢谢你。来，把从山底深处带回来的这种\"麦酒\"拿去喝一杯当奖赏吧。不，说真的。这已经是我最起码能做的了。",cEN="So you visited the Dark Iron and sought to put a stop to their sabotage, eh, kid? They attacked again, you know. Seems a Dark Iron's word is as good as their brew.\n\nStill, what you did to help is appreciated, I guess. Here, take a mug of the \"ale\" you brought from the depths of that mountain as your reward. No, really. It's the least I can do."}
Q[11488]={d="欢迎来到太阳之井，$c。你最好尽快习惯这里的事态，并且随时准备贡献自己的一切力量……要知道，这里太需要你的贡献了！\n\n我？对，我这里确实有些事情需要别人帮忙处理，不过我还不清楚你是否已经准备好了。\n\n我们有一位线人当前正潜伏在魔导师平台内，为我们收集情报。但是这几天以来我们一直没有收到他的报告，我对此非常担心。\n\n魔导师平台就在东边那块高地之上。他给我们提供的情报非常重要。\n\n你能帮我们处理这件事吗，$r？",dEN="Welcome to the Sunwell, <class>. Get yourself settled in and contribute however you can - there's much to do!\n\nMe? Yes, I have a little something that needs doing, but I'm not sure you're up to the task.\n\nWe've had a contact embedded in Magisters' Terrace gathering intelligence for us. He's recently failed to report and I'm growing concerned.\n\nThe terrace is just up the rise to the east. The information he was collecting is vital to our mission.\n\nThink you can handle it, <race>?",o="破碎残阳基地的主教拉雷索尔要求你转至魔导师平台，寻找血精灵间谍塔雷斯的踪迹。",oEN="Exarch Larethor at the Shattered Sun Staging Area wants you to search Magisters' Terrace and find Tyrith, a blood elf spy.",p="我不记得订过清洁服务……啊，对，我就是药剂师胡默尔。\n\n……等等，这是什么意思？你以为这些无关紧要的纸就能拦住我？哈！",pEN="I don't remember ordering a cleaing service... why yes, I am Apothecary Hummel.\n\n...wait, what is the meaning of this? You think these meaningless papers can stop me? Hah!",c="……靠近些……仔细听我说……",cEN="...Come closer... Listen carefully to my words...."}
Q[11489]={d="这台构造体最重要的工作就是收集数据。我在那边的马车上放了一件铁矮人的圣物。那是一种浮在半空的、充满闪电能量的水晶。\n\n坐上驾驶座，我把你放回构造体里去。进入驾驶舱以后，就把它开过去，试试能不能利用构造体的数据收集能力把那些测试数据收集起来。",dEN="The most important part of your job while controlling the construct is the collection of data. I've placed an iron dwarf relic in the cart over yonder. It's the floating, lightning infused crystal.\n\nGet on the work bench and I'll put you back in the construct. Once you're back in the driver's seat, use the construct's data collection ability to pick up the test data.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你在沃尔特的铁符文雕像上使用铁符文构造体的收集数据技能。\n\n完成任务，你可以在宠物选项菜单中点击解散宠物来解散构造体。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Iron Rune Construct's Collect Data ability while standing near the Iron Dwarf Relic.\n\nDismiss your construct by dismissing it from the pet window once you have completed the quest.",c="太完美了！简直像魔法一样！",cEN="Perfect! Works like a charm!"}
Q[11490]={d="到平台去……用那颗宝珠。\n\n<Tyrith 喘了口气。>\n\n快……必须阻止他们……趁他们还没……\n\n<Tyrith 死了。>",dEN="<Tyrith winces in pain as he speaks.>\n\nGo to the terrace... use the orb.\n\n...They're...feeding the sunwell....\n\n<Tyrith gasps for breath.>\n\nHurry... They must be stopped... before they can....\n\n<Tyrith dies.>",o="塔雷斯要求你使用魔导师平台内的阳台上的宝珠。",oEN="Tyrith wants you to use the orb on the balcony in Magisters' Terrace.",p="去仔细地看看宝珠，凡人。",pEN="Go and peer into the orb, mortal.",c="我认为我们今天的交会并非巧合。\n\n我可以感应到命运的交缠……",cEN="I consider it to be no coincidence that our paths cross this day.\n\nI sense the tendrils of destiny...."}
Q[11491]={d="你$gsiempre debes tener:siempre debes tener;一套备用方案，以防主计划失败！所以我在构造体里内置了一些反侦察系统。\n\n你崭新的坐骑在挖掘场里可能会引起怀疑。这就是你的虚张声势技能的用途！只要在任何被质问的时候使用它，就能免受伤害。\n\n在 Lebronski 的地毯上走一趟，拿他试试。等他开始又哼又喘的时候，就用虚张声势！\n\n准备好开始时就上工作台。",dEN="You always gotta have a contingency plan in case your main plan backfires! That's why I've built in some anti-intelligence systems into the construct.\n\nYour shiny new ride might rouse some suspicion while you're at Baelgun's excavation site. That's what your bluff ability is for! Just use that any time you're confronted and you'll be safe from harm.\n\nTest it out on Lebronski by walking on his rug. Once he starts huffin' and puffin', use the bluff!\n\nGet on the work bench when you're ready to begin.",o="啸风峡湾探险者协会前哨站的沃尔特要你走过 Lebronski 的地毯后，对 Lebronski 使用铁符文构造体的虚张声势技能。\n\n完成任务后从宠物窗口解散你的构造体。|n",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Iron Rune Construct's Bluff ability on Lebronski after you've walked on his rug.\n\nDismiss your construct by dismissing it from the pet window once you have completed the quest.",p="别担心他，<name>。他会消气的……",pEN="Don't worry about him, <name>. He'll get over it...",c="你证明给他看了！该是让你正式上场了。\n\n要有信心，我希望啦……",cEN="You showed him! Now it's time to put you in the field.\n\nFeeling confident, I hope..."}
Q[11492]={d="欢迎来到太阳之井，凡人。你来的正是时候。\n\n你应当也已经看到了，现在燃烧军团正夜以继日地将太阳之井内的强大能量运用于他们那些邪恶而卑贱的目的。\n\n凯尔萨斯也重新站了起来，并继续领导和统筹着他的部队配合燃烧军团。我们必须再一次阻止他。\n\n但是，现在有一件更加紧急和复杂的事情等着我去处理，凯尔萨斯的命运恐怕必须交给你来完结了。千万不要让我失望。\n\n祝你好运，我们很快还会再见面的。",dEN="Welcome to the Sunwell, mortals. Your arrival is indeed timely.\n\nAs you've now witnessed, the Legion forces work tirelessly, manipulating the Sunwell's power to achieve their malevolent ends.\n\nKael'thas has risen from the ashes of defeat and once more leads them in their efforts. Find him, mortals. He must again be stopped.\n\nOther, equally urgent matters require my immediate attention. I shall leave Kael's fate to you. Do not fail.\n\nWith luck, we shall speak again.",o="卡雷苟斯要求你击败魔导师平台内的凯尔萨斯。取下凯尔萨斯的徽记之后，立刻向破碎残阳基地的主教拉雷索尔复命。",oEN="Kalecgos has asked you to defeat Kael'thas in Magisters' Terrace. You are to take Kael's head and report back to Larethor at the Shattered Sun Staging Area.",p="好吧，<class>，我得承认，我以为再也见不到你了。\n\n你带来了什么消息？",pEN="Well, <class>, I must admit, I wasn't sure I'd see you again.\n\nWhat news do you bring?",c="<Larethor 专心地听着你讲述在魔导师平台的所作所为。>\n\n我们会怀念 Tyrith——他是个好人。不过多亏了你，他的死没有白费。\n\n我低估了你，<race>。请代表太阳之井攻势收下这个——一份配得上你这样的英雄的礼物。",cEN="<Larethor listens intently as you explain your deeds in Magisters' Terrace.>\n\nTyrith will be missed - good man, that one. Thanks to you though, his death wasn't in vain.\n\nI've underestimated you, <race>. Please, accept this on behalf of the Sunwell Offensive - a gift worthy of a hero such as yourself."}
Q[11494]={d="你的构造体已经$glisto:lista;，随时可以出发。所有技能都经过了检查，我还给这台机器编好了程序，让它能听懂并能说泰坦的语言。\n\n把构造体带到此地正南方的巴尔古挖掘场，从散落在那里的闪电灌注遗物中收集数据。记住，要是有铁矮人怀疑你的构造体是假的，就用虚张声势糊弄过去。还有别忘了在符文之间用火箭跳跃移动！\n\n准备好就上工作台！",dEN="Your construct is ready to go. All abilities have been given a once over and I've programmed the machine to both comprehend and speak the language of the titans.\n\nTake the construct to Baelgun's Excavation Site, due south of here, and collect data from the lightning infused relics that litter the site. Remember to bluff any iron dwarves that suspect your construct to be a fake. And don't forget about rocket jumping from rune to rune to get around in there!\n\nGet on the table when you're ready!",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你使用铁符文构造体的收集数据技能收集15份铁符文数据。\n\n完成任务后，你可以在宠物选项菜单中点击解散宠物来解散构造体。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Iron Rune Construct's Collect Data ability to collect 15 sets of Iron Rune Data.\n\nDismiss your construct by dismissing it from the pet window once you have completed the quest.",c="沃尔特再一次证明了他确实是头号矮人！你现在觉得我的构造体怎么样，Lebronski！\n\n谢谢你，<name>。等我琢磨出怎么把数据从构造体里弄出来，这些数据无疑会是无价之宝。",cEN="And once again Walt proves that he is indeed the top dwarf! What do you think of my construct now, Lebronski!\n\nThank you, <name>. This data will undoubtedly prove to be invaluable - as soon as I figure out how to get it out of the construct."}
Q[11495]={d="我们在巴尔古挖掘场挖开的那个洞穴……许多人见了都是绕着走的……我倒也不怪他们胆小。那个洞穴里一直发出雷鸣一般的声音，$n！轰鸣的雷声！\n\n而且你要知道，所有进去探索过的人都遭遇了不幸！好多人甚至再也没回来过。于是到最后，就没有任何人敢进去那里了。\n\n不过，既然你要去巴尔古挖掘场，不如帮我们去查看一下那个洞穴吧。仔细研究一下那里面的泰坦雕塑，然后把你了解到的东西告诉我。",dEN="The cavern that we opened at Baelgun's was the one place that most steered clear of... Can't say I blame 'em. The sound of thunder shot out of that cave, <name>! Loud, booming thunder!\n\nI think near the end, it was abandoned by all. Bad, bad things happened to any that went in to explore - most never coming back.\n\nI want you to check that cave out while you're at Baelgun's. Explore around the titan statue inside and report back with your findings.",o="嚎风峡湾探险者协会哨站的沃尔特要你使用铁符文构造体仔细探索巴尔古挖掘场内的雷霆洞穴。\n\n完成任务，你可以在宠物选项菜单中点击解散宠物来解散构造体。",oEN="Walt at the Explorers' League Outpost in the Howling Fjord wants you to use the Iron Rune Construct to explore the thundering cave at Baelgun's Excavation Site.\n\nDismiss your construct by dismissing it from the pet window once you have completed the quest.",p="运气如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="难以置信！那些铁家伙到底在搞什么名堂？他们在风暴峭壁做什么？这个洛肯又是谁？！我会把这些情报转呈给我们位于龙骨荒野的中央行动基地，<name>。我也会告诉他们，你在获取这些情报上功不可没。",cEN="Incredible! What could those iron menaces be up to? What are they doing in the Storm Peaks? And what is this Loken!? I'll forward this information to our central base of operations in the Dragonblight, <name>. I'll also let 'em know that you were invaluable in the acquisition of said info."}
Q[11497]={d="虽然这从长远看可能会影响我的生意，但你看上去就是那种梦想骑着自己的坐骑翱翔天际，而不是被别人带着飞来飞去的人。\n\n我完全理解这种感觉。\n\n你，$gesos:esas;，得去影月谷西南角的蛮锤要塞。到了那里，找伊尔萨·烈酒谈飞行训练的事。提醒你，她的训练可不便宜。但我想你会发现这钱花得值。$g",dEN="Though it may end up hurting my business in the long run, you look the sort that dreams of flying <his /her> own mount through the skies, rather than being flown from place to place.\n\nI understand the feeling completely.\n\nYou, my friend, need to head to Wildhammer Stronghold in the southwest corner of Shadowmoon Valley. When you get there, speak with Ilsa Blusterbrew about some flight instruction. Mind you, her training's not cheap. But, I think that you'll find it worth your while.",o="与影月谷蛮锤要塞的伊尔萨·枪酒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Ilsa Blusterbrew at Wildhammer Stronghold in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="所以，是我亲爱的尤拉派你来的？好家伙……我要记得给他捎上一瓶酒，感谢他送来的这些人。\n\n如果这是要学习如何飞行，那你可是来对了地方。只要一些费用，不太便宜，我就会教你如何在风中呼啸飞行！\n\n等你学成，别忘了和那边的拉瑟尔谈谈，买一只我们漂亮的狮鹫！",cEN="So, me boyo, Nutral, sent ya along did he? Good man... I'll need ta remember ta send him along a pint fer all o' the business he's sendin' me way.\n\nIf it's the learnin' o' how ta fly right and proper yer after, ye've come ta the right place. No one flies finer than us Wildhammer and those we train. Fer a fee, and not a small one mind ya, I'll teach ya how ta soar through the skies!\n\nAnd when yer done, don't forget ta talk ta Brunn over there about buying one o' these gryphon beauties!"}
Q[11498]={d="虽然这从长远看可能会影响我的生意，但你看上去就是那种梦想骑着自己的坐骑翱翔天际，而不是被别人带着飞来飞去的人。\n\n我完全理解这种感觉。\n\n你，$gesos:esas;，得去影月谷西北角的影月村。到了那里，找奥尔罗克谈飞行训练的事。提醒你，他的训练可不便宜。但我想你会发现这钱花得值。$g",dEN="Though it may end up hurting my business in the long run, you look the sort that dreams of flying <his /her> own mount through the skies, rather than being flown from place to place.\n\nI understand the feeling completely.\n\nYou, my friend, need to head to Shadowmoon Village in the northwest corner of Shadowmoon Valley. When you get there, speak with Olrokk about some flight instruction. Mind you, his training's not cheap. But, I think that you'll find it worth your while.",o="与影月谷影月村的欧尔洛克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Olrokk at Shadowmoon Village in Shadowmoon Valley.",c="鲜血与雷霆啊，尤拉又送了个步兵来给我！好你个德莱尼……\n\n<欧洛克一口啐在地上，就吐在你的脚边。>\n\n如果你是想来学习如何驾驭你的坐骑在天空飞行的话，你找对地方了。为了回报你的大笔学费，我会教导你一切所需的知识以及如何避免丢脸地摔死。\n\n等你学成，别忘了和那边的达玛·蛮鬃谈谈，从我们的兽栏中买一只双足飞龙！",cEN="Blood and thunder, Nutral sent me another ground grunt! Good man... for a draenei.\n\n<Olrokk spits on the ground near your feet.>\n\nYou've come to the right place if you want to learn how to ride your own mount through the skies. In return for a big sack of gold, I'll teach you what you need to know and not fall dishonorably to your death.\n\nAnd when you're done, don't forget to talk to Dama Wildmane over there about buying one of the windriders from our stable!"}
Q[11499]={d="$C，今天我要让你执行一件几乎不可能完成的任务。今天，你必须得到血精灵之王凯尔萨斯的徽记之戒。\n\n没错，这是真的，有谣言说他其实没有死在风暴要塞，而是被某些邪恶的手段救活了回来。他上一次再度出现是在奎尔丹纳斯岛上的魔导师平台。至于他在那里做些什么，就让别人来告诉你吧。反正我只知道有无数的收藏家在询问我要多少钱才能买到他的戒指，所以我决定先把戒指搞到手再说。\n\n或者说，我决定让你先帮我把戒指搞到手再说。",dEN="<class>, today I ask the impossible. Today, you must obtain the signet ring of Kael'thas Sunstrider, lord of the blood elves!\n\nIt's true, the rumors of his death within Tempest Keep were ill-founded. He has appeared once more, this time at the Magisters' Terrace on the Isle of Quel'Danas. What he is doing there is a tale for someone else to tell you. What I know is that I have innumerable collectors interested in his princely ring, and I mean to acquire it for them.\n\nOr rather, I mean for you to do so.",o="商人扎雷姆要求你夺得凯尔萨斯王子的徽记之戒。将戒指带回沙塔斯城的贫民窟交给他，就能领取奖赏。\n\n该任务只能在英雄模式的魔导师平台完成。",oEN="Wind Trader Zhareem has asked you to obtain The Signet Ring of Prince Kael'thas. Deliver it to him in Shattrath's Lower City to collect the reward.\n\nThis quest may only be completed at the Magisters' Terrace on Heroic difficulty.",p="如此靠近太阳之井，魔导师平台一定是个非常危险的地方。\n\n我相信你应该不会为此而迟疑？",pEN="The Magisters' Terrace must be a very dangerous place indeed being so close to the Sunwell.\n\nI trust that you're not having second thoughts?",c="所以，血精灵王子这次真的死了？真可惜，我一直觉得他挺有格调的。想到一个那么高傲的人却得为这么琐碎的小钱而死。\n\n不过就如大家讲的，在商言商。你赢得了你的酬劳，冒险者。\n\n明天再来找我，我还有别的任务要托付给你。",cEN="So, the blood elf prince is truly dead this time? A pity, I always thought he had class. To think that one so lofty could be brought down for such a paltry sum.\n\nBut as they say, business is business. Your reward is earned, adventurer.\n\nCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill."}
Q[11500]={d="玛哈杜恩再一次收到了风带来的消息，我们要把痛苦妖女送回地狱之中。\n\n玛哈杜恩知道，这些恶魔就在奎尔丹纳斯岛上的魔导师平台里面。\n\n除掉她们，你就能得到赏金，否则，你就得不到。",dEN="It has been whispered to Mah'duun that the sisters of torment are to be sent back to the hells from which they sprang.\n\nMah'duun knows that these demons can be found at the Magisters' Terrace on the Isle of Quel'Danas.\n\nYou will do this thing to earn the bounty, or you will not.",o="虚空猎手玛哈杜恩要求你杀死4名痛苦妖女。完成任务后返回沙塔斯城的贫民窟，向他领取奖赏。",oEN="Nether-Stalker Mah'duun wants you to slay 4 Sisters of Torment. Return to him in Shattrath's Lower City once you have done so in order to collect the bounty.",p="那个会说话的借虚空之风向玛哈杜恩低语。它说你还没有处理掉那些姐妹。\n\n<name>一点都不在乎赏金吗？",pEN="That which speaks speaks upon nether winds whispers to Mah'duun. It says that you have not yet dealt with the sisters.\n\nDoes <name> care nothing for the bounty?",c="谁能说那些痛苦妖女需要被杀死呢？你在意吗？\n\n哈杜恩认为你只在意赏金罢了。\n\n明天再回来找我吧，风将再一次向玛哈杜恩轻声低诉……",cEN="Who can say why the demonic sisters needed to be slain? Do you care?\n\nMah'duun thinks you care enough to collect the bounty, though.\n\nReturn again tomorrow and the winds will have whispered once more to Mah'duun."}
Q[11501]={d="西卫要塞需要知道这里发生了什么，$n。我要你$gmismo:misma;亲自把消息带给亚当斯上尉。\n\n等你$gpreparado:preparada;，告诉我一声，我就把你放回构造体里做最后一次飞行。它会把你送到西卫要塞，不过很可能中途就炸了。\n\n很荣幸与你共事。",dEN="Westguard needs to know what's going on here, <name>. I want you to personally deliver the news to Captain Adams.\n\nWhenever you're ready, let me know and I'll put you back in the construct for one final flight. It'll take you to Westguard Keep, but more than likely blow up in the process.\n\nIt's been a pleasure...",o="与西部卫戍要塞的亚当斯上尉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Adams at Westguard Keep.",c="太好了……好像天灾军团到处找麻烦还不够似的，现在又冒出个暴怒的古代泰坦构造体要对付！\n\n我需要些时间来消化这些情报，<race>。在此期间，这里有大量的活要干。",cEN="Wonderful... As if having the Scourge all up our you-know-whats wasn't enough, now we got some angry ancient titan construct to deal with!\n\nI'll need some time to chew on this information, <race>. In the meantime there's plenty of work that needs doing here."}
Q[11502]={d="我们不是好战的种族，$r，但当战争敲响我们的家门时，我们不会逃避。\n\n联盟和部落在西北方的哈兰城交战。我们不知道血精灵在谋划什么，但部落的任何胜利都将是灾难。我们的人民与兽人之间的历史充满了流血与背叛。\n\n去哈兰杀掉敌人，你将得到金钱、荣誉和名望的$grecompensado:recompensada;。",dEN="We are not a warlike race, <race>. However when war comes to our lands, we do not run away from it.\n\nThe Alliance and the Horde wage war in the city of Halaa, to the northwest. We do not know what the blood elves are scheming, but any victory for the Horde would be disastrous. The history between our people and the orcs is one of bloodshed and betrayal.\n\nGo and slay the enemy in Halaa and you will be rewarded in coin, honor and renown.",o="在哈兰击败10名敌对方玩家，然后向塔拉的拉库尔复命。",oEN="Defeat 10 enemy players in Halaa and return to Lakoor in Telaar.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Is your task done, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。你的努力不会被忽视。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. Your efforts will not be ignored."}
Q[11503]={d="我们的宿敌德莱尼人带着无数强大的盟友回来了。现在他们在西南方的哈兰挑起了战争。\n\n我们无法容忍他们取得胜利，否则加拉达尔肯定会陷入危险之中。\n\n立刻到那里去，干掉那些帮助我们宿敌的人。",dEN="Our ancient enemy, the draenei, have returned with powerful allies. They wage war in Halaa, southwest of here.\n\nWe cannot allow them a victory there as Garadar would be next without a doubt.\n\nGo and slay those who would aid our ancient enemy.",o="在哈兰击败10名敌对方玩家，然后向加拉达尔的卡尔托格复命。",oEN="Defeat 10 enemy players in Halaa and return to Karrtog in Garadar.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Is your task done, <name>?",c="你替我们的同胞带来了莫大的光荣。我们感谢你。",cEN="You bring great honor to our people. You have our thanks."}
Q[11504]={d="我们东面的那条小路通往海象人的主要狩猎地。至少是以前的主要狩猎地……\n\n最近以来，我们的猎人回到卡玛古后，声称那里到处充斥着亡灵，残害着周围的生物！那也就是我和我的儿子来这里的原因。长者阿图伊克希望我们能找到答案。\n\n你能在我们需要的时候助我们一臂之力吗？我在寻找愿意去盾牌岭冒险的英雄，盾牌岭就在这里的东南面。去调查一下那些被亵渎的墓地，把你的发现的线索给我带回来。",dEN="The path east of us is a primary hunting trail of the tuskarr. At least that's what it used to be...\n\nMore recently our hunters have been returning to Kamagua claiming that the dead have risen and are out for blood! That is what has brought my son and me here. Elder Atuik asks that we find resolution in the bluffs.\n\nWill you assist us in our time of need? I seek heroes willing to brave the perils of Shield Hill, southeast of here. Search the desecrated graves for clues and return your findings to me.",o="上古升降梯的奥弗斯希望你去寻找芬基尔的线索、洛丁的线索、伊斯多弗的线索和温丹的线索。",oEN="Orfus of Kamagua at the Ancient Lift in the Howling Fjord wants you to find Fengir's Clue, Rodin's Clue, Isuldof's Clue and Windan's Clue.",p="卡鲁亚克海民需要你的帮助！",pEN="The tuskarr need your help!",c="<奥弗斯鬓胡竖了起来。>\n\n海盗……他们的邪恶是没有尽头的吗？\n\n我们一定得找回这些被偷走的神器，并将东西还回这个被诅咒的地方，这样我的族人们才可以重获平静。",cEN="<Orfus's whiskers bristle.>\n\nPirates... Is there no end to the depths of their depravity?\n\nWe must recover the stolen artifacts and return them to this cursed place so that my people may once more know peace."}
Q[11505]={d="奥金顿的灵魂并不参与联盟与部落之间的冲突，但赢得他们的好感会让我们的阵营在这一带占据优势。\n\n古老的传统要求生者在白骨荒野的灵魂之塔前表达敬意——但只在一天中的特定时刻。如果你能在这些时刻帮助守住一座塔，你就帮助灵魂站到了我们这一边。\n\n如果我们成功赢得灵魂的好感，他们会赐予我们一份助力，帮助我们实现目标。",dEN="Auchindoun's spirits have no stake in the conflict between the Alliance and the Horde, but incurring their favor will give our side an edge in the region.\n\nAncient custom directs the living to pay their respects at spirit towers in the Bone Wastes - though only at specific times of the day. If you can help secure a tower during these times, you will have helped bring the spirits to our side.\n\nShould we succeed in gaining the spirits' favor, they will grant us a boon that will aid us in our endeavors.",o="帮助联盟占据白骨荒野上的一座灵魂之塔。",oEN="Help the Alliance secure a tower in the Bone Wastes.",p="灵魂们躁动不安，<name>。你完成任务了吗？",pEN="The spirits are restless, <name>. Have you accomplished your task?",c="灵魂们只差一步就能平静地安息。能获得它们的眷顾是件好事，尤其是我们得在离它们安息之地如此靠近的地方掀起战争。",cEN="The spirits are one step closer to resting in peace. It is good to incur their favor, especially when waging war so close to their place of rest."}
Q[11506]={d="也许德莱尼人是我们的敌人，但他们在奥金顿的祖先之魂躁动不安，不效忠于任何一方。\n\n德莱尼人的习俗要求他们在一天中的不同时刻到灵魂之塔前表达敬意。如果你能在这些时刻帮助守住一座塔，你就能帮助灵魂在奥金顿重归安宁。\n\n联盟会试图夺取这些塔，以赢得亡者的好感。我们必须确保成功的是我们，而不是他们。",dEN="The draenei might be our enemies, but the spirits of their ancestors in Auchindoun are restless and have no allegiance.\n\nThe draenei's custom required them to pay their respects at spirit towers at various times during the day. If you can help secure a tower during these times, you will help the spirits return to peace in Auchindoun.\n\nThe Alliance will try to capture the towers in order to secure the dead's favor. We must ensure that our side succeeds instead.",o="帮助部落占据白骨荒野上的一座灵魂之塔。",oEN="Help the Horde secure a Spirit Tower in the Bone Wastes.",p="奥金顿的灵魂依旧围绕在我们四周。他们会给予我们协助吗？",pEN="The spirits of Auchindoun are all around us. Will they grant us their boon?",c="灵魂们只差一步就能平静地安息，并且赐予我们他们的眷顾。\n\n尽管这只是暂时的，但依旧能给予我们的敌人羞辱的一击，他们的祖先居然反过来与他们为敌。",cEN="The spirits are closer to finding peace and have bestowed their favor onto us.\n\nA humiliating blow to our enemy that their own ancestors would side against them, even if only temporarily."}
Q[11507]={d="<奥弗斯把你给他的线索捆扎在一起。>\n\n我的人民正悲惨地卷入一场与北海海盗的战争。如果说有哪个海象人能帮我们纠正海盗们所犯下的大错，我想那也只有卡玛古的长者阿图伊克了。你一定要马上把这些线索交给他。\n\n要去卡玛古的话，你必须乘坐我身后的这架上古升降梯，直达卡玛古，找到长者阿图伊克。",dEN="<Orfus bundles up the clues you brought him.>\n\nMy people are bitterly entrenched in a war with the Northsea Freebooters. If any tuskarr could help us in our quest to right the wrongs of the pirates, it will be Elder Atuik of Kamagua. You must take these clues to him at once.\n\nTo get to Kamagua you must take the Ancient Lift, behind me. Take the lift directly to Kamagua and find Elder Atuik.",o="嚎风峡湾的奥弗斯希望你能把他的包裹交给卡玛古的长者阿图伊克。",oEN="Orfus of Kamagua in the Howling Fjord wants you to deliver Orfus's Bundle to Elder Atuik at Kamagua.",p="来自奥弗斯的消息？",pEN="News from Orfus?",c="奥弗斯是个优异的卡鲁亚克海民——我们当中最强的战士。我知道他绝对不会让我们失望。\n\n让我看看你带来的是什么。",cEN="Orfus is a good tuskarr - one of our strongest warriors. I knew he would not let us down.\n\nAllow me to see what it is that you have brought."}
Q[11508]={d="海盗们已经在这里南方远端建造了一座被称为无赖港的港口。而且不幸的是，他们还部署了很多致命的防御设施。\n\n不过有个人也许可以帮我们潜入无赖港。\n\n最近有个名叫格雷兹克斯·斯宾德斯纳普的海盗来我们的村子寻求食物和保护。作为交换，他给我们提供敌人的情报，并向他们误报了我们的战斗计划。去他的船上找他吧，就在这里西南的海岸边。",dEN="The pirate thieves have set up port at Scalawag Point, far to the south. Unfortunately, they have fortified their camp with many deadly defenses.\n\nThere is someone that might be able to assist us in infiltrating Scalawag.\n\nA pirate mercenary by the name of Grezzix Spindlesnap recently came to our village in search of food and shelter. In exchange he gives us information about our enemies and feeds them misinformation about our attack plans. Seek him out at his ship just off the coast here - southwest.",o="与格雷兹克斯·斯宾德斯纳普谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Grezzix Spindlesnap.",c="呀，伙伴。格雷兹克斯从来都不喜欢把他的手弄脏！格雷兹克斯的海盗生涯很不错，只要格雷兹克斯不用做任何工作都好。\n\n我见过那些神器。那就是我为什么在这而不待在无赖港的原因！那里都是些很坏，很坏的……\n\n嘿，这可是你自己的性命，对吧？你想要进入无赖港的话，格雷兹克斯可以帮你。",cEN="Yarr, matey. Grezzix never did like to get his hands dirty! A pirate's life for Grezzix is a good one, so long as Grezzix doesn't have to do any of the work.\n\nI've seen those artifacts. It's the reason I'm here and not at Scalawag myself! Bad, bad things those are...\n\nHey, it's your life though, right? You wanna get inside Scalawag and Grezzix can help."}
Q[11509]={d="北海海盗都敬畏格瑞希克斯。我觉得他们是认可我的特殊才能，嫉妒我这艘了不起的船。你要做的就是跟着我的船工卢一起走，你就能混得……混得跟锡罐一样。海盗就爱锡罐。\n\n准备好出发时跟卢谈谈，他会带你去无赖角。\n\n哦对了，你最好先去跟\"银月\"哈利谈谈。他更清楚他们偷走的那些东西。在他面前说话小心点。他是个怪人……对血精灵痴迷得很，对血精灵是$gloco:loca;。",dEN="The Northsea Freebooters all fear and respect Grezzix. I'm thinking they recognize my special talents and envy my amazing ship. All you need to do is tag along with my cabin boy, Lou, and you'll be in like... In like tin. Pirates love tin.\n\nJust talk to Lou when you're ready to go and he'll take you to Scalawag.\n\nOh yea, you'll want to talk to \"Silvermoon\" Harry first. He'll have more information on the stuff they pilfered. Just watch what you say around him. He's a freak... crazy for blood elves.",o="与无赖角的\"银月\"哈利谈谈失踪的维库人神器。",oEN="Speak with \"Silvermoon\" Harry at Scalawag Point about the missing Vrykul artifacts.",c="<哈瑞瞠目结舌地看着你。>\n\n所以你跟我一样，对吗？有点古怪。\n\n<哈瑞放低声音。>\n\n这里没有人穿成那样。\n\n关于那些神器……每个与那东西有过接触的人最后都会死亡，失踪或是两者皆是。\n\n如果你还有兴趣知道更多的内容，我会帮你——不过要收费的。\n\n<哈瑞眨眨眼。>\n\n你施惠于我，我会努力不恩将仇报的。",cEN="<Harry raises an eyebrow at you.>\n\nSo you're like me, eh? A little eccentric.\n\n<Harry whispers.>\n\nNobody dresses like that around here.\n\nAbout those artifacts... Everyone that came into contact with that stuff has ended up dead, missing or both.\n\nIf you're still interested in learning more, I can help - but it'll cost you.\n\n<Harry winks.>\n\nYou scratch my back and I'll try to not stick a dagger in yours."}
Q[11510]={d="约纳·斯特林发疯后做的第一件事，就是夺走我珍爱的辛多雷占卜水晶，把它喂给了我命中的克星——虎鲸\"小滑头\"。\n\n这鬼名字可不是我起的。我只知道她就在无赖角东南方那些船只外的海域游弋。宰了那条胀气的金鱼，把我美丽的辛多雷水晶从它胃里掏出来。\n\n办成这件事，我们就能谈正事了。",dEN="One of the first things Jonah Sterling did after he went crazy was to take my prized sin'dorei scrying crystal and feed it to the bane of my existence, \"Scoodles\" the orca.\n\nNo I didn't name the damned thing. I just know that she swims out past the ships directly southeast of Scalawag. Kill that overinflated goldfish and rip out my beautiful sin'dorei crystal from its stomach.\n\nDo this and we can get down to business.",o="无赖角的\"银月\"哈利要你从虎鲸\"小滑头\"那里夺回他的辛多雷占卜水晶。",oEN="\"Silvermoon\" Harry at Scalawag Point wants you to recover his Sin'dorei Scrying Crystal from the orca, \"Scoodles.\"",p="你迷路了吗？我可不希望你迷路。",pEN="Are you lost?",c="<哈瑞从你手上接过水晶，温柔地抚摸着它。>\n\n喔，我的宝贝！那个又大又坏的鲸鱼伤害了你吗？现在都没事了。我再也不会让你离开我的视线了！\n\n<哈瑞抬起头看着你。>\n\n嗯，我们谈到那里了？",cEN="<Harry takes the crystal from you and gently pets it.>\n\nOh my precious! Did the big, mean whale hurt you? It'll be ok. I'll never let you out of my sight again!\n\n<Harry looks up at you.>\n\nSo, where were we?"}
Q[11511]={d="那些神器都受了诅咒，你要是去找它们就是$gloco:loca;，$r。我敢肯定，凡是直接接触过那些东西的人，不是疯了就是死了。\n\n就拿那根法杖来说。我最后听到的消息是，载着它的船被弃置在长矛群岛的海岸上，就在此地以北。\n\n如果你想要那东西，就去船舱里找。\n\n但无论如何，千万别把它带到这里来！还有离阿卜杜勒远点！他会把你的心掏出来，$gamigo:amiga;。",dEN="Those artifacts are cursed and you'd be crazy to go looking for them, <race>. I know for certain that anyone that's come into direct contact with any of those items has either gone mad or been killed.\n\nTake that staff, for example. Last I heard the ship that held it was abandoned and left to rot on the coast of the Isle of Spears, north of here.\n\nIf you want that thing, check the ship's hold.\n\nWhatever you do, don't bring that staff back here! And steer clear of Abdul! He'll tear your heart out.",o="取回风暴之怒法杖，把它交给啸风峡湾的卡玛古的奥弗斯。|n",oEN="Recover the Staff of Storm's Fury and deliver it to Orfus of Kamagua in the Howling Fjord.",p="你拿到法杖了吗？",pEN="You have the staff?",c="我们必须把所有神器都归还，<name>。等四件都集齐了，你就把它们放回各自的坟墓。",cEN="We must return all of the artifacts, <name>. When all four are gathered, you will put them back in their graves."}
Q[11512]={d="有人说约纳从来都没有这么不正常过，我知道原因，是那颗心。那颗该死的冰冷之心！我看到了他把它从墓穴中拔出时的那一刹那，他整个人都变了。我能看到他的血液在血管中冻结了……随后疯狂完全地占有了他。\n\n他离开了我们，一个人躲在这座岛北面的山洞里。我听说他把冰冷之心扔在了洞穴的深处。已经太晚了……\n\n如果你敢把那颗心带回这里的话，信不信我会亲手杀了你？",dEN="Some say Jonah was never quite right in the head, but I know the truth. It was the heart. That damned frozen heart! I saw the change in him the second he pulled it from the grave. I could see the blood freeze in his veins... It was then that the madness truly took over.\n\nHe left us to hole up in his cave on the north side of this island. Last I heard he had thrown the heart in the back of his bear den. Too little, too late...\n\nI'll kill you myself if you even think about bringing that heart back here!",o="找回伊斯多弗的冰冷之心，把它交给嚎风峡湾的海象人——卡玛古的奥弗斯。",oEN="Recover the Frozen Heart of Isuldof and deliver it to Orfus of Kamagua in the Howling Fjord.",p="伊……伊苏多弗的冰冷之心？",pEN="The... The Frozen Heart of Isuldof?",c="我们必须把所有神器都归还，<name>。等四件都集齐了，你就把它们放回各自的坟墓。",cEN="We must return all of the artifacts, <name>. When all four are gathered, you will put them back in their graves."}
Q[11514]={d="我们必须维持传送门的能量供应，否则它会直接坍塌。所以，我们还得继续从巴什伊尔码头的那些虚灵手中抢夺法力晶格。码头就在刀锋山的西北角，偏北方向。\n\n记住，你要先从虚灵手里抢到一台相位设备，才能定位那些法力晶格的位置。\n\n你还必须小心那些相位浮龙，那是虚灵们部署在那里守卫法力晶格的。",dEN="We must maintain the energy to our portal or it will collapse. The mana cells that the ethereals at Bash'ir Landing have hidden will continue to serve our purposes. The landing sits atop the northwestern corner of the Blade's Edge Mountains, far to the north.\n\nRemember, acquire a phase device from one of the ethereals and then use it to locate the smuggled goods.\n\nJust be cautious of the phase wyrms that they use to guard the mana cells.",o="取得 10 个走私法力电池，然后回去见沙塔斯城圣光广场平台的先知纳苏恩。",oEN="Obtain 5 Smuggled Mana Cells and return them to Exarch Nasuun on the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City.",p="<name>，你今天为我们获取法力电池的进展如何？",pEN="<name>, how fare your efforts to obtain mana cells for us this day?",c="这些法力电池可以继续维持传送门的能量。\n\n明天再来找我，我要派你去再多弄点来。",cEN="These mana cells will continue to power the portal.\n\nReturn tomorrow and I will send you out to obtain more."}
Q[11515]={d="当凯尔萨斯的部队通过那道传送门撤退时，他最忠诚的侍从们得到了可怕的奖励。他们留了下来，啜饮着恶魔的血液。\n\n这些血液改变了他们，赐予了他们新的力量，也证明了他们的堕落。\n\n从恶魔身上取得血液样本，用血液激活魔能虹吸宝石的能量，然后夺走这些傲慢蠢货的新力量。在他们变得虚弱之后杀死他们，然后回来向我复命。",dEN="When Kael's forces retreated through that portal, his most loyal lackeys were rewarded with an abominable gift. They stayed behind and gorged themselves on the blood of demons for days.\n\nThe blood has changed them, given them new powers. It will also prove their undoing.\n\nObtain blood samples from other demons. Use them to power this fel siphon and deprive these arrogant fools of their new powers. Slay them in their weakened state and return to me.",o="基尔加丹王座的魔导师瑟伊拉希望你使用魔能虹吸宝石杀死4个憔悴的魔血精灵。你需要用附近的天怒先锋身上的恶魔血液来启动魔能虹吸宝石。",oEN="Magistrix Seyla at the Throne of Kil'jaeden wants you to kill 4 Emaciated Felbloods by using the Fel Siphon on them. You will need Demonic Blood from nearby Wrath Heralds to power the Fel Siphon.",p="这些怪物是我们种族的耻辱。你必须消灭他们，<name>。",pEN="These freaks are a disgrace to our race. You must destroy them, <name>.",c="蠢货。他们学会了汲取邪能，却没学会如何留住它。\n\n我们很走运，<name>。一个经验丰富的邪血精灵无疑会是个难缠的对手。",cEN="Fools. They learned to drain fel energy but did not learn how to retain it.\n\nWe were lucky, <name>. An experienced felblood would've surely been a formidable opponent."}
Q[11516]={d="我们必须得关闭这道传送门，阻断燃烧军团向太阳之井增援。\n\n拿上这些灰烬，里面有我创造的活焰。只要有足够的能量支持，它就能产生强大的破坏力。\n\n在活焰周围杀死那些游荡的魔能火花，这样活焰就可以逐渐得到能量，变得越来越活跃。\n\n等你完成后，把活焰带到传送门那里去，它知道下一步该怎么做。",dEN="We have to shut down this gateway to stop Legion reinforcements to the Isle of Quel'Danas.\n\nTake these embers, they contain one of my creations: a living flare. It is designed to act as a powerful destructive force - as long as it has been provided enough energy.\n\nFind the fel sparks that wander the area and slay them near the living flare. The flare will grow in power each time, until it becomes unstable.\n\nOnce you've achieved this bring the flare to the gateway. It will know what to do.",o="基尔加丹王座的魔导师瑟伊拉希望你使用炽热的灰烬召唤一个活焰，在它周围消灭大型魔能火花，它就会逐渐变成一个不稳定的活焰。带着不稳定的活焰去摧毁军团传送门。",oEN="Magistrix Seyla at the Throne of Kil'jaeden wants you to use the Sizzling Embers to summon a Living Flare and slay Incandescent Fel Sparks near it until it becomes an Unstable Living Flare. Return to the Legion Gateway with the Unstable Living Flare to destroy it.",p="办好了吗，<name>？我们必须阻止更多军团部队增援凯尔萨斯。",pEN="Is it done, <name>? We must stop further Legion forces from reinforcing Kael'thas.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。恶魔们也许过段时间就能修好传送门。我想我们只好再把它炸一次了。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. The demons might repair the gateway in due time. I suppose we'll just have to blow it up again."}
Q[11519]={d="如果你仔细听的话，应该能听到东北方传来的炮声。那是艾尔雷斯船长的船——慈悲修女号。但事实上，艾尔雷斯和他的整个船队在一个月前都被全部杀死了。\n\n<哈瑞点了点头。>\n\n是的，那是艘鬼船……\n\n如果你想了解盾牌的下落，就去找艾尔雷斯吧。\n\n慈悲修女每隔5分钟就会停泊在这里和索罗夫海岸之间的小岛上，寻找更多的灵魂去当它的船员。在这片地方可从来都不缺灵魂……",dEN="If you listen real close you can hear cannon fire coming from the northeast. That's Captain Ellis's ship, Sister Mercy. Thing is, Ellis and his entire crew were killed 'bout a month ago.\n\n<Harry nods.>\n\nGhost ship...\n\nIf it's info you be wantin' 'bout the shield, Ellis is the man to ask.\n\nSister Mercy docks on the small island between here and Sorlof's Strand to pick up more souls for the ship's crew 'bout once every five minutes. There be no shortage of souls 'round these parts...",o="与慈悲修女号上的艾尔雷斯船长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Ellis aboard the Sister Mercy.",c="啊，我和我的船员的确盗走了那面盾！我们一直想把盾从那个坏蛋饭桶无赖，索罗夫那里抢回来！你来帮忙的吧？\n\n如你所见的，我们的船员都是骷髅！\n\n<船长艾尔雷斯大笑。>\n\n慈悲修女号需要另外一个弹药手，来操作船尾甲板的这些大炮。我想你能胜任这个工作的吧，好伙计？\n\n帮我的船员把索罗夫拿下，就和你分宝藏！你可以分到盾牌，其余的归我和我的船员！",cEN="Arrr, me'n'me crew pilfered that thar shield! We be tryin' to get her back from that no good, landlubbin' scallywag, Sorlof! Ye come to help, arrr?\n\nWell, as ye can see we be runnin' a skeleton crew!\n\n<Captain Ellis laughs.>\n\nSister Mercy be needin' another powder monkey to man the big'uns o'er on the poop deck. Think ye be up to the job, me hearty?\n\nHelp me crew take Sorlof down and we'll split the booty! Ye can have the shield, me'n'me crew gets the rest!"}
Q[11521]={d="我的存货当前很充足，但仍然需要大量的荆刺根须来保证日常所需。\n\n采集这些根须的确很困难，但我知道有一种特别的方式可以获得它们。\n\n利用荆刺剥石者的腺体，就可以控制一头掠食者来帮你挖出这些根须。\n\n想要找到这些根须的话，从外域的沙塔斯城一直往东北飞，就能到达荆刺高地了。\n\n$n，等你采集到了5份根须后就回到我这里来吧。",dEN="My stocks are presently sufficient, but I'll need plenty of razorthorn roots to keep up with the demand.\n\nCollecting the roots is difficult, but I know a special method of extraction.\n\nUsing the glands of the Razorthorn flayers, one can control a ravager there and use it to expose a root.\n\nTo find the roots, travel to Outlands and fly northeast from Shattrath until you reach Razorthorn Rise.\n\nReturn to me, <name>, once you have collected five of the roots.",o="阳湾港口的玛尔娜希望你转至外域的荆刺高地，收集5根荆刺根须给她。",oEN="Mar'nah at Sun's Reach Harbor wants you to travel to Razorthorn Rise in Outlands, collect 5 Razorthorn Roots, and return to her.",p="说真的，<name>，我太忙了，没空闲聊。\n\n等你采齐那些根须再告诉我。",pEN="Really, <name>, I'm far too busy for idle chatter.\n\nLet me know when you've gathered those roots.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。\n\n再次感谢你的帮助！",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nThank you again for your help!"}
Q[11523]={d="我们已经成功地让圣殿周围的水晶结界恢复正常，但为什么就这么罢手呢？我们的其它建筑都需要创建防御措施，不过失心者仍然在顽固地偷取着结界的能量。\n\n消灭那些失心者，夺回他们手上的法力馀烬，用以激活圣殿的结界。我们的安全就全都靠它了。",dEN="We've succeeded in reactivating the crystal wards around the sanctum, but why stop there? We'll build defenses around the other structures, but the Wretched are stubborn and continue to steal power from the crystal wards.\n\nHunt them down and get the mana remnants they carry. Use the remnants to energize the sanctum wards; the safety of our operation depends on it.",o="破碎残阳基地的瑟里斯·黎明之心希望你能从失心魔瘾者和失心吞噬者那里获取4份法力馀烬，用它们激活阳湾港建筑物外围的水晶结界。",oEN="Captain Theris Dawnhearth at the Shattered Sun Staging Area wants you to obtain 4 Mana Remnants from Wretched Fiends and Wretched Devourers and use them to energize one of the Crystal Wards surrounding the structures in Sun's Reach.",p="你重新激活了一块水晶结界吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you reactivated a crystal ward, <name>?",c="干得好，<name>。结界正在逐渐恢复力量。太阳之痕很快就会归我们所有！",cEN="Good work, <name>. The wards are slowly regaining their power. Sun's Reach will be ours in no time!"}
Q[11525]={d="我的计划成功了。依靠这些奥术守卫的帮助，我们已经成功得拿下了阳湾圣殿。\n\n我制造了一批新的水晶，可以让更多的奥术守卫接受我们的指令。把它们放入那些被打败的奥术守卫的外壳里。成功控制它们之后，我会把它们部署到别的地方去。",dEN="My plan to replace the damaged crystals on the erratic sentries has been a success. We've managed to take the Sun's Reach Sanctum with their help.\n\nI've crafted new crystals that will bring more of them under our control; place them inside the hulls of defeated sentries. We'll deploy them to other locations once they're converted.",o="破碎残阳基地的守备官夏安希望你将调和过的水晶核心放入5台被打败的奥术守卫体内，将它们转换成友军。",oEN="Vindicator Xayann at the Shattered Sun Staging Area wants you to place the Attuned Crystal Cores inside 5 defeated Erratic Sentries to turn them into friendly units.",p="你把那些哨兵转化了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you converted the sentries, <name>?",c="太好了。这些转换后的奥术守卫可以守护我们的周边环境了。",cEN="Excellent. The converted sentries will help to secure our perimeter."}
Q[11526]={d="我们已经派出一名精英人员前去调查南边黎明广场中央的恶魔传送门的状况，但她一直没有回来。\n\n带上这张卷轴，这是我们从一名敌人的尸体上搜出来的。我们相信它能让你使用那座传送门，一旦穿越了那道传送门以后，立刻找到魔导师瑟伊拉，并尽可能协助她。",dEN="We sent one of our operatives to investigate the fel portal in the middle of Dawning Square, south of here. She never returned.\n\nTake this scroll we found on one of the enemy corpses. We believe it will grant you access through the portal. Once through, find Magistrix Seyla and aid her in any way you can.",o="在黎明广场的传送门附近使用军团传送卷轴。穿越传送门之后，立刻找到魔导师瑟伊拉。",oEN="Use the Captured Legion Scroll near the portal at Dawning Square. Once you've gone through the portal, find Magistrix Seyla.",p="安静，<class>。军团的部队正监视着大门南侧。",pEN="Keep quiet, <class>. The Legion's forces watch the south of the gate.",c="瑟里斯还担心我的安危，这真是太贴心了。但我这里却还有更严重的问题，非常严重。",cEN="It's very sweet of Theris to worry about my hide, but we've got bigger problems here. Much bigger."}
Q[11527]={d="唉，我们有麻烦了，$gcompay:mami;。我的炮手们叛变了！船员们正在下面收拾那些叛变的炮手，同时想办法踢索洛夫的屁股。\n\n你得下去处理那些叛变的老海狗，把他们的火药拿来给艉楼甲板上那门大炮用。\n\n由你来操纵那门大炮，索洛夫肯定完蛋，他的战利品就归我们了！",dEN="Aye, we got problems, matey. Me gunners have mutinied! M'n'the crew up top be tryin' to kick Sorlof's keester while dealin' with the mutinous gunners down'blo.\n\nYe're gonna have to go down'blo and deal with those mutinous sea dogs and take their blastin' powder for the big'un o'er on the poop deck.\n\nWith ye mannin' the big'un, Sorlof is sure to die and give up the booty!",o="啸风峡湾仁慈姐妹号上的埃利斯船长要你从船舱中取回 5 桶爆破火药。|n",oEN="Captain Ellis aboard the Sister Mercy in the Howling Fjord has asked that you recover 5 Barrels of Blasting Powder from the ship's hold.",p="叛乱的水手真是太多了！",pEN="Mutinous sea dogs and giants abound!",c="那些不忠的船底老鼠总算得到了一点教训！现在是时候来填装大炮了，兄弟！",cEN="Here's to hopin' those treacherous bilge rats learned their lessons! Now it be time to man the big'un, matey!"}
Q[11529]={d="我的船员会把那门大炮为你装填准备妥当，$gcompay:mami;。它就舒舒服服地待在船头，在船的另一边。过去操纵它，等索洛夫一进入视野就准备开火。\n\n等我们把那个旱鸭子打下来，你得替我们把战利品捞回来，毕竟我们没法离开这艘该死的船！把战利品带回来给我，你就能拿到你那份——那面盾牌……",dEN="Me crew is gonna get the big'un all primed an'ready for ya, matey. She's restin' snuggly on the bow, o'er on the other side of the ship. Go'n man it and be ready to fire when Sorlof is in our sights!\n\nOnce we take that landlubber down, ye'll have to recover the booty for us, seein' as how we can't leave the damned ship! Bring that booty back to me and ye'll get your cut - the shield...",o="用大炮杀死索罗夫，夺得索罗夫的宝藏。将索罗夫的宝藏交给慈悲修女号上的艾尔雷斯船长。",oEN="Slay Sorlof using the Big Gun and recover Sorlof's Booty. Return Sorlof's Booty to Captain Ellis aboard the Sister Mercy.",p="招子放亮点，伙计们！",pEN="Smartly, me hearty!",c="约定就是约定，伙计！",cEN="A deal's a deal, me hearty!"}
Q[11530]={d="这是你要的盾。我希望它不会像诅咒我和我的手下那样诅咒你。别害怕，不过你不能待在这里……我确信还是有东西会想要把它夺回去的。\n\n现在就拿着那东西离开我的船！",dEN="Here's yer shield. Me hopes it doesn't curse ye like it did me'n'me crew. Ye don't have to go home, but ye can't stay here... I be certain that thar be some that would be interested in getting' it back.\n\nNow get that thing off me ship!",o="将古神之盾带到嚎风峡湾的上古升降梯去，交给卡玛古的奥弗斯。",oEN="Return the Shield of the Aesirites to Orfus of Kamagua at the Ancient Lift in the Howling Fjord.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You have returned!",c="我们必须把所有神器都归还，<name>。等四件都集齐了，你就把它们放回各自的坟墓。",cEN="We must return all of the artifacts, <name>. When all four are gathered, you will put them back in their graves."}
Q[11531]={d="这件奇怪的发动机零件不像水泵零件，也不像你所见过的任何机械零件。或许凯莉·弗莱知道点什么吧。",dEN="This strange engine part doesn't look like it fits in a steam pump, much less anything else you've seen. Perhaps K. Lee Smallfry might know something about it.",o="将奇怪的发动机零件交给泰雷多尔的凯莉·弗莱。",oEN="Take the Strange Engine Part to K. Lee Smallfry in Telredor.",p="天哪！你手里拿的是什么，<name>？",pEN="Oh goodness! What've you got there, <name>?",c="<凯莉·弗莱注视着那个引擎零件，接着望向远方。>\n\n这东西真的很特别。很难说这东西从哪里来的——说不定是从天上掉下来的。我得要保留这个东西，并且付钱补偿你。\n\n这件事最好你知我知，别向任何人提起比较好。\n\n<凯莉·弗莱堆起她最有魅力的笑容。>",cEN="<K. Lee looks at the engine part and then stares off into the distance for a moment.>\n\nThis is somethin' real special. Difficulty to say where it's from--like it just fell out of the sky. I'm gonna hold on to this and pay you for your troubles.\n\nBetween you and me though, I think it's best if we didn't mention this to anyone.\n\n<K. Lee puts on her most charming smile.>"}
Q[11533]={d="多亏了我们对死亡之痕中军团部队的空袭，我们已经从敌人手中夺下了军械库。\n\n事实上，对军团的空袭效果太好了，我们打算继续下去。带上这些奥术炸弹，用它们对付他们的军队。\n\n$gpreparado:preparada;准备好飞行时，去阳湾港找艾琳·破云谈谈。",dEN="We've taken the armory from the enemy thanks to our aerial attacks against the Legion's forces in the Dead Scar.\n\nAs a matter of fact, it's gone so well that we're going to continue our air strikes against them. Take these arcane charges and use them against their forces.\n\nTalk to Ayren Cloudbreaker at the Sun's Reach Harbor when you're ready for flight.",o="战斗法师阿瑞娜要你在$gpreparado:preparada;准备飞越死亡之痕时与艾琳·破云交谈。到达后使用奥术炸弹杀死 2 名深渊领主、3 名艾瑞达巫师和 12 名愤怒执行者。",oEN="Battlemage Arynna wants you to speak to Ayren Cloudbreaker when you're ready to fly over the Dead Scar. Once there, use the Arcane Charges to kill 2 Pit Overlords, 3 Eredar Sorcerers and 12 Wrath Enforcers.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you accomplished your mission, <name>?",c="今天杀死的恶魔，我们明天就不需要对付他们。继续加油。",cEN="Any demons we kill today are demons that we do not have to fight tomorrow. Keep it up."}
Q[11534]={d="我真高兴能看到你在这里，$c！现在我们已经从失心者手里抢回了这处圣殿，当务之急就是在这里创建起一座通向外域沙塔斯城的传送门。\n\n我尊贵的上司——主教纳苏恩当前正领导着别动队中的许多法师处理传送门的能量维持事宜。他要求我派一些有前途的后备兵去帮助他。\n\n拜托你了，立刻转至沙塔斯城，到圣光广场的阿达尔身旁去找他。",dEN="I am most glad that you are here, <class>! When we took this sanctum from the wretched, we hurried to create a magical portal that leads here from Shattrath City in the Outland.\n\nMy liege lord, Exarch Nasuun, is heading up the Offensive's efforts to maintain that portal. He asked me to send along any promising candidates who have what it takes to help with acquiring more energy to fuel it.\n\nPlease, travel to Shattrath City and speak with him inside A'dal's chamber on the Terrace of Light.",o="商人波塔努斯要求你转至沙塔斯城，与圣光广场上的主教纳苏恩谈一谈。",oEN="Tradesman Portanuus has asked you to speak with Exarch Nasuun on the Terrace of Light in Shattrath City.",c="波塔努斯派你来的？很好，我们没多少时间可以浪费了！",cEN="Portanuus sent you? Good, we haven't any time to spare!"}
Q[11536]={d="既然我们有了铁砧，我就能真正开工了。\n\n无论我们收到多少补给，我总能把暗棘铁矿派上用场。如果想在这里取得成功，我们就需要源源不断的武器和护甲。\n\n此地以东的海岸上有一群纳迦。他们正在收集矿石，装进箱子运给军团。把他们的矿石夺过来，对我们的帮助可不止一点……",dEN="Now that we have an anvil, I can really get to work.\n\nNo matter how many supplies we receive, I'll always be able to put the Darkspine Iron Ore to good use. We'll need a constant supply of weapons and armor if we're to be successful here.\n\nThere are a group of naga on the coast to the east of here. They're collecting ore and placing it in chests for shipment to the Legion. Relieving them of their ore will help our efforts in more ways than one....",o="阳湾军械库的铁匠霍尔萨希望你去杀死东面的暗脊侍从，夺取他们的钥匙，然后从他们的箱子里偷取3块矿石。",oEN="Smith Hauthaa in Sun's Reach Armory wants you to kill Darkspine Myrmidon to the east and use their keys to steal three pieces of the ore from their chests.",p="你去拿我要求的矿石了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the ore I asked for?",c="太好了！这些矿石能够帮我维持士兵武器与盔甲的供应。\n\n你的帮助真的意义重大！",cEN="Excellent! This will help me keep our soldiers in weapons and armor.\n\nYour help is truly making a difference!"}
Q[11537]={d="我们必须持续不断地消灭燃烧军团的部队，挫败他们的锐气。\n\n仇恨使者是燃烧军团的特种部队，专门负责增援重要的战略地点。燃烧军团的士兵会因为他们的到来而更加奋勇作战，因为他们对仇恨使者的恐惧远大于对我们的恐惧。\n\n今天我们会改变这一切。拿上这面战旗，去黎明广场扫荡恶魔。等到他们派出仇恨使者后，干掉他，把战旗插在他的尸体上。",dEN="We must continue to defeat and demoralize the armies of the Legion.\n\nThe emissaries of hate are Legion shocktroopers deployed to reinforce tactical Legion positions. The enemy rallies around them for they fear them more than they fear us.\n\nToday we will change that. Take this banner and slay the demons of the Legion. When you meet the emissary, slay and impale him.",o="先驱者伊努罗希望你转至黎明广场，杀死仇恨使者和6名燃烧军团恶魔，然后将破碎残阳战旗插在仇恨使者的尸体上。",oEN="Harbinger Inuuro wants you to slay 6 Burning Legion Demons and the Emissary of Hate in Dawning Square. Use the Shattered Sun Banner to impale the Emissary of Hate's corpse.",p="你成功了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you succeeded, <name>?",c="你的奉献堪称楷模，<name>。我们要让燃烧军团看看我们的本事。",cEN="Your dedication is exemplary, <name>. We will show the forces of the Burning Legion what we're capable of."}
Q[11540]={d="晨锋军队已经被我们赶出了阳湾港口，这一带已经完全在我们的控制之下了。但不知道为什么……我并不满意。\n\n我希望你能转至西面的晨星村，消灭任何残馀的晨锋部队。他们追随凯尔萨斯来到这里时，命运就已经注定了。",dEN="We've driven the Dawnblade army out of the Sun's Reach Harbor. Sun's Reach is ours in its entirety. Yet somehow... I'm not entirely satisfied.\n\nI want you to go to Dawnstar Village, west of here, and slay any surviving Dawnblade combatants. They sealed their fate when they followed Kael to this place.",o="阳湾军械库的魔导师伊拉斯塔希望你去消灭6个晨锋召唤者、6个晨锋血骑士和3个晨锋射手。",oEN="Magister Ilastar at Sun's Reach Armory wants you to slay 6 Dawnblade Summoners, 6 Dawnblade Blood Knights and 3 Dawnblade Marksmen.",p="你把晨锋那些渣滓干掉了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you slain the Dawnblade scum, <name>?",c="不知道凯尔萨斯·逐日者王子在听到他的军队溃败时，他的脑袋里在想什么？\n\n他会感到绝望吗？还是无助恐惧？\n\n我倒是很希望他这样觉得。",cEN="What thoughts go through Prince Kael'thas Sunstrider's head when he hears of his armies' defeats?\n\nDoes he feel despair? Helplessness? Fear?\n\nI sure hope so."}
Q[11541]={d="纳迦占领了东南面的绿鳃海岸。那些被称为暗脊海妖的女性纳迦用魔法奴役了当地的鱼人。\n\n我有责任破坏纳迦在那里所进行的一切活动，这也就是你来这里的原因。\n\n$C，我希望你能从那些女性纳迦身上夺取控制宝珠，将它们扔在绿鳃奴隶周围，打碎宝珠就能让鱼人恢复自由。\n\n我想这样鱼人就会被激怒，反抗他们的主人。",dEN="The naga have taken the Greengill Coast to the southeast. Their females, the Darkspine sirens, are using magic to enslave the indigenous murlocs.\n\nIt's my responsibility to see to it that whatever the naga are up to over there is disrupted. That's where you come in.\n\n<class>, I want you to get the controlling orbs from the female naga and throw them near the Greengill slaves, breaking the orb and setting the murlocs free.\n\nMy guess is that the murlocs will be incensed and turn on their masters.",o="瓦琳德拉上尉希望你能解救10个绿鳃奴隶。完成任务之后，去阳湾港口的银月之傲号上向她复命。",oEN="Captain Valindria wants you to free 10 Greengill Slaves. Return to her onboard the Silvermoon's Pride at Sun's Reach Harbor once you have done so.",p="我的斥候告诉我，纳迦今天所受的干扰还不够多。",pEN="My scouts tell me that there hasn't yet been enough disruption of the naga today.",c="今天这样就够了。缓慢而稳定就是关键。过多的干扰会让他们把注意力转到我们身上这可不是我们想要的。\n\n明天再来找我，我们可以继续进行这边的工作。",cEN="That's enough for today. Slow and steady is the key here. Too much disruption and they'd turn their attention directly upon us; something that we don't want.\n\nCome back again tomorrow and we'll work on it some more."}
Q[11543]={d="我们刚刚攻占了阳湾港口，然而不幸的是，有一支满载着晨锋预备兵的舰队正在路上，凯尔萨斯的军队很快就将得到增援。\n\n带上这瓶油，向艾雷·碎云要一只龙鹰。你可以骑着龙鹰飞经舰队上空，一旦达到攻击距离，就用油在他们的船帆上放火。\n\n之后，你要降落在船上，攻击那些预备兵。他们的船帆着火以后，肯定会忙作一团，从而无心防御你的攻击。",dEN="We've managed to capture Sun's Reach in its entirety. Unfortunately a fleet of Dawnblade reservists is on its way to take back the harbor.\n\nTake this oil and secure a dragonhawk from Ayren Cloudbreaker. You should be able to fly within reach of the ships' sails; once you're close enough, set them on fire.\n\nLand in one of the ships and attack the reservists. With their ship sails on fire they won't be able to mount much of a defense.",o="阳湾军械库的守备官凯兰要求你去跟艾雷·碎云谈一谈，并飞越晨锋部队的增援舰队。将火油投掷到对方的船帆上，使之引燃。落地后，再杀死6名晨锋预备兵。",oEN="Vindicator Kaalan at the Sun's Reach Armory wants you to speak to Ayren Cloudbreaker and fly over the Dawnblade reinforcement fleet. Use the Flaming Oil to set the ship sails on fire as you fly and once you land, slay 6 Dawnblade Reservists.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you accomplished your task, <name>?",c="干得好，<name>。港口要等很久才会有增援了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. It should be a long time before the harbor receives any reinforcements."}
Q[11544]={d="影月谷东面的阿塔玛平台对于德莱尼人来说是个神圣的地方，但现在那里满地都是邪兽人。他们用从那里挖掘出的特殊矿石制造着邪恶的武器和装备。\n\n我需要这些装备，用它们和纳迦那里抢来的矿石制造合金。我们的学者已经让铁砧具备了净化金属的能力。\n\n从影月天选者、影月斩杀者和影月暗法师身上找到这些装备。把它们拿到这里来，在我的铁砧上打碎并净化它们，然后把净化过的阿塔玛金属交给我。",dEN="The Ata'mal Terrace in eastern Shadowmoon Valley is holy to the draenei, but is now overrun by fel orcs. They have dug up the special ore from that place and created corrupted weapons and armor.\n\nI need the armaments to form an alloy with the naga ore. Our anchorites have blessed my anvil with the ability to cleanse them.\n\nRetrieve the armaments from the Shadowmoon chosen, slayers and darkweavers. Return them here, breaking down and purifying them upon my anvil, and then hand me the cleansed results.",o="铁匠霍尔萨要求你在奎尔丹纳斯岛阳湾军械库的铁砧上打碎阿塔玛军备，以此制造5块净化过的阿塔玛金属。",oEN="Smith Hauthaa needs you to produce 5 Cleansed Ata'mal Metal. Do so by breaking down Ata'mal Armaments on her anvil at the Sun's Reach Armory on the Isle of Quel'Danas.",p="我需要所有能弄到手的净化阿塔玛金属，<class>。",pEN="I need all of the cleansed Ata'mal metal that I can get my hands on, <class>.",c="感谢你，我的朋友。现在我可以制造更多的特殊合金来锻造部队的武器与盔甲了。\n\n我手边还有一些在拆解过程中产生的萃取物可以方便地使用于你的武器上。别客气，请从中挑选对你最有帮助的吧。\n\n明天再来找我，我必定还需要更多的金属。",cEN="Thank you, my friend. Now I will be able to fashion more of the special alloy that is going into the creation of our forces' weapons and armor.\n\nAnd, I have some leftover extract from the process, which you'll likely find handy for use on your weapons. Please, take your pick of whichever will serve your purposes.\n\nReturn to me again on the morrow. No doubt I will need more armaments."}
Q[11546]={d="欢迎你，$n。\n\n我有多种方式可以帮助你进行作战准备。\n\n比如说，我最近领悟了一种独特的药剂配方。\n\n艾泽拉斯很多野外地区都生长着血莓，长久以来人们只把它们当成是一种公害而已。不过我了解到，在这种植物受到太阳之井能量的影响后，就会产生一种特殊成分——提取这种成分可以提升用户的能力。\n\n从附近的灌木丛中找一株样本给我，我会让你知道我所指的是什么。",dEN="Welcome, <name>.\n\nThere are a number of ways I can assist you in your efforts here.\n\nFor example, I've recently discovered a recipe for a unique elixir.\n\nThe bloodberry grows wild in many regions of Azeroth and has long been considered nothing more than a nuisance. I've learned though, that when exposed to the Sunwell's power this plant takes on special properties that can be distilled and imbibed to magnify one's abilites.\n\nBring me a sample from the nearby bushes and I'll show you what I mean.",o="阳湾港口的玛尔娜希望你从奎尔丹纳斯岛上的灌木丛中收集5颗血莓。",oEN="Mar'nah at the Sun's Reach Harbor wants you to gather 5 Bloodberries from the bushes found on Quel'Danas.",p="你收集到那些血莓了吗？",pEN="Have you gathered those berries yet?",c="太好了，<name>。\n\n希望这能对你在这里的努力有所帮助。",cEN="Excellent, <name>.\n\nI hope this will aid you in your efforts here."}
Q[11547]={d="一群不劳而获的家伙！\n\n你们都只想取得便利，却从没想过要去制造一道最简单的传送门。\n\n也许给你们一点小小的教训会让你们对我在这里所做的一切有所感激。\n\n拿上这颗水晶，在这里西面的血水晶、南面的黎明广场传送门和东南方的绿鳃海岸一带的纳迦神殿那里调节水晶。\n\n也许这样你就会认识到传送魔法的珍贵……",dEN="Freeloaders!\n\nYou all want instant gratification - never giving thought to the effort required to create even the simplest of portals.\n\nPerhaps a little education will instill a bit of gratitude for my ceaseless efforts.\n\nTake this crystal. Attune it to the Bloodcrystal to the west, at the Dawning Square portal just south of here, and at the naga shrine at Greengill Coast to the southeast.\n\nPerhaps then you'll appreciate your precious translocations....",o="阳湾圣殿的星术师达纳里安希望你在血水晶、黎明广场传送门和绿鳃海岸的纳迦神殿上使用星术师的水晶。",oEN="Astromancer Darnarian in the Sun's Reach Sanctum wants you to use the Astromancer's Crystal at the Bloodcrystal, the Dawning Square portal, and the naga shrine at Greengill Coast.",p="你和水晶调谐好了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you attuned the crystal yet, <class>?",c="好好好。现在让我们来瞧一瞧？\n\n看来事情都很顺利，非常好。\n\n如果你的数据有任何瑕疵，可就没人知道你会跑去哪儿了，别怪我没提醒你，到时候你就只能怪自己了。",cEN="Yes, yes. Let's have a look now, shall we?\n\nThings seem to be in order. Very well. Here is your translocator.\n\nIf any of your readings are faulty, there's no telling where you'll end up, and mind you, you'll only have yourself to blame."}
Q[11548]={d="我们已经为那些在本次战争中牺牲的人们建起了一座纪念碑。对牺牲者的家人与爱人，对那些永远失去了挚爱的人们来说，这只能给他们一些微薄的安慰。\n\n我还在募集一笔捐款，以供养那些已经牺牲的英雄们留下的遗族。如果你愿意的话，请帮助他们吧。",dEN="We've built a memorial to honor those slain in battle. It's but a small consolation to the families that lost their loved ones.\n\nI am taking up a collection to aid the orphans and spouses of our war heroes. If you can spare a small donation it would go a long way.",o="奎尔丹纳斯岛阳湾港的学者艾尤莉希望你捐赠10枚金币。",oEN="Anchorite Ayuri at Sun's Reach in Sunwell Isle wants you to donate 10 gold.",p="你愿意捐款吗？",pEN="Do you wish to make a donation?",c="你有一颗高尚的心，<name>。在战争的混乱和胜利的狂喜中，人们很容易忘记阵亡者。亡者的亲友们感谢你。",cEN="You are a virtuous soul, <name>. It is easy to forget the fallen amidst the turmoil of war and the euphoria of victory. The friends and families of the dead thank you."}
Q[11549]={d="你已经为我们做了许多事情，$n。我们非常感谢你的协助。\n\n不过，不知道你是否注意到屋外正在募捐的学者艾尤莉？她是一位非常有魅力的善良人，但尽管如此，捐献的数额却还不太够。\n\n如果你愿意捐一笔钱给她，协助她的事业，我想你一定会声名远扬的。你觉得怎么样？",dEN="You've done so much for us, <name>. We greatly appreciate your assistance.\n\nYou might have noticed Anchorite Ayuri's efforts outside. She has a big heart and is very convincing, but the donations do not quite add up to what she had expected.\n\nIf you were to make a large contribution to her cause, I will make sure that word of your deeds in this war spreads far and wide. What do you say?",o="学者卡伊索斯希望你捐献1000枚金币以协助学者艾尤莉的事业。若完成这个任务，你将会获得“破碎残阳的$n”的称号。",oEN="Anchorite Kairthos wants you to donate 1000 gold to aid in Anchorite Ayuri's efforts. You will be known as <name> of the Shattered Sun if you complete this quest.",p="你打算要捐款了吗？",pEN="Are you ready to make the contribution?",c="你确实是个慷慨的人，也是个值得尊敬的盟友。从今往后，你将被称为破碎残阳的<name>，所有在此战斗过的人都会知道你的功绩！",cEN="You truly are a generous person and a worthy ally. From now on you shall be known as <name> of the Shattered Sun and all who fought here will know of your deeds!"}
Q[11550]={d="尽管我们已经付出了巨大的牺牲，但仍然没能阻止凯尔萨斯执行他那罪恶的计划。现在太阳之井已经被重新激活，准备迎接欺诈者的入侵。\n\n在我和阿达尔前面的这个指示器代表着太阳之井当前的防御状况。他们升起了数道极其强大的魔法屏障，将我们的攻击部队完全隔离在了内部各处核心密室的外面。现在，就是现在，毫无疑问就是我们最需要世界各地之援助的时刻了。\n\n立刻转至奎尔萨拉斯的正北方，向奎尔丹纳斯岛上的大法师奈苏尔报到。",dEN="Despite our best efforts, Kael'thas's sinister plans have been carried out. The Sunwell has been re-ignited in preparation for the Deceiver's arrival.\n\nThe object that stands before me and below A'dal is a representation of the current status of the Sunwell's defenses. Mighty barriers have been raised, stymieing our attacks against the inner chambers. If ever there were a time that our world needed assistance, it would be now.\n\nReport to Archmage Ne'thul at the Isle of Quel'Danas, north of Quel'Thalas.",o="转至奎尔萨拉斯正北方的奎尔丹纳斯岛，向大法师奈苏尔报到。\n\n铁炉堡和银月城的飞行管理员可以将你送到目的地。",oEN="Report to Archmage Ne'thul on the Isle of Quel'Danas, north of Quel'Thalas.\n\nFlight masters in Ironforge and Silvermoon City will get you to your destination.",c="基尔加丹挟着燃烧军团的全部力量逼近这个世界。要是召唤仪式完成，我们的世界会再次陷入混沌的痛苦挣扎中。你在奎尔丹纳斯岛的协助将会是我们对抗燃烧军团的关键。\n\n我们的法师正在努力穿透太阳之井的屏障。尽力帮助破碎残阳来对抗燃烧军团吧。",cEN="Kil'jaeden bears down upon this world with the full force of the Burning Legion. Should the summoning complete, our world will once more be flung into the throes of chaos. Your assistance on the Isle of Quel'Danas is critical to our success against the Burning Legion.\n\nOur mages are working on bringing down the barriers blocking access to the Sunwell. Do your part in battling the forces of the Legion by helping the Shattered Sun Offensive."}
Q[11554]={c="<name>，你在攻势中的援助没有被忽视。奥尔多和占星者的联合部队向你致谢。",cEN="Your aid in the offensive has not gone unnoticed, <name>. The combined forces of the Aldor and Scryers offer you their thanks."}
Q[11555]={c="你在这场至关重要的战斗中不断证明自己，<name>。请收下这个，作为我们不变感激的象征。",cEN="You continue to prove yourself in this most important battle, <name>. Please accept this as a token of our continued gratitude."}
Q[11556]={c="没有你，我们到不了今天这一步，<name>。奥尔多和占星者的联合力量不足以粉碎军团和凯尔。我们很庆幸有像你这样优秀的盟友。",cEN="We couldn't have gotten where we are without you, <name>. The combined might of the Aldor and Scryers is not enough to crush the Legion and Kael. We are thankful to have allies of your caliber among us."}
Q[11557]={c="你是我们最优秀的战士之一，<name>。你的名字将在我们的队伍中流传很久。请代表我们的部队收下这份小小的礼物。",cEN="You are one of our very best, <name>. Your name will be known throughout our ranks for a long time to come. Please accept this small gift on behalf of our forces."}
Q[11559]={d="既然你已经学会了冬鳞鱼人的语言，不妨与他们接触试试。说到打交道，最好的方法当然是做生意啦。\n\n鱼人将蚌壳看得比什么都重要。你看，呀噜咕噜是冬鳞氏族唯一幸存的商人，如果我是你的话，我就将一堆冬鳞蚌壳送给他做礼物。\n\n冬鳞村以及洞穴附近的水渠中到处都是那种蚌壳。",dEN="Now that you can speak with the Winterfin, it is time for you to let them get to know you. One of the best ways to do that is to conduct business with them.\n\nThe murlocs prize clams over any other object and their only surviving merchant is Ahlurglgr. If I were you, I'd collect a handful of Winterfin clams and give them to him as a gift.\n\nThe clams can be found all over down in the trench, as well as across it in the Winterfin village and their caverns.",o="收集5只冬鳞蚌壳，将它们交给冬鳞避难所的呀噜咕噜。",oEN="Collect 5 Winterfin Clams and deliver them to Ahlurglgr at Winterfin Retreat.",p="这是什么？你是谁？\n\n你是那种<race>东西！你怎么会说我们的话？",pEN="What's this? Who are you?\n\nYou're one of those <race> things! How can you speak our tongue?",c="这些是给我的？这是什么<race>的把戏吗？不是？\n\n那好吧，谢谢你！等你有更多蛤蜊的时候随时回来，我们做笔生意！",cEN="These are for me? Is this some sort of <race> trick? No?\n\nWell then, thank you! Come back any time that you have more clams, and we'll do business!"}
Q[11560]={d="啊，你总算回来啦！\n\n在那场事故中，地壳运动导致洼地下沉以及洞穴抬升。居住在洞穴中的龙虾人克拉西姆斯趁机虏走了许多冬鳞蝌蚪。\n\n村落中的鱼人也不知遭遇了什么变故，全都听从于克拉西姆斯的指挥。\n\n$C，你必须穿越洼地，解救被困在村落和洞穴中的蝌蚪。\n\n冬鳞氏族的未来就靠你了！",dEN="Oh good, you're back!\n\nWhen the landslide at the village across the water exposed the caverns, a malevolent lobstrok, known as Claximus, came out of the caves and stole the Winterfin tadpoles away.\n\nSomething happened to all of the murlocs that followed him in there, and when they re-emerged, they were under his control.\n\n<class>, you must swim across the waters and rescue the Winterfin tadpoles in the village and caverns.\n\nThe future of the Winterfin tribe depends upon you!",o="国王姆嘎姆嘎要你解救20只冬鳞蝌蚪。完成任务后返回冬鳞避难所向他复命。",oEN="King Mrgl-Mrgl has asked you to rescue 20 Winterfin Tadpoles. Return to him at Winterfin Retreat once you have done so.",p="如果不能救出更多的蝌蚪，不管我们做了什么:冬鳞鱼人就一点未来都没有了！",pEN="If more tadpoles aren't rescued, it won't matter what we do: the Winterfin murlocs will cease to have any chance of a future at all!",c="现在无论发生什么，冬鳍鱼人都能有一个安稳的未来了。\n\n你的无私值得称赞和奖赏，<name>！",cEN="Now no matter what happens, the Winterfin murlocs have a secure future.\n\nYou are to be commended, and rewarded, for your selflessness, <name>!"}
Q[11561]={d="昔日的兄弟姐妹已经沦为我们的仇敌。他们掳走冬鳞蝌蚪，将我们逐出村落，还杀害了不计其数的同胞。\n\n$r，证明你的实力吧！穿越裂谷，杀死他们！\n\n虽然国王姆嘎姆嘎对你很有好感，但是只有在你完成这项任务后，我们才会考虑完全接纳你。如果任务失败，你最好滚得远远的，再也别回来！",dEN="Our brothers and sisters across the water are now our mortal enemies. They have kidnapped our tadpoles, driven us out of our village, and killed more of us than I can count.\n\nProve yourself, <race>! Swim across the rift and slay them!\n\nDespite the favor that the new king has shown you, only then will we consider accepting you here. Fail to do so, and you might as well leave now and never return!",o="冬鳞避难所的吧咕姆咕要你杀死15名冬鳞鱼人，战士、智者或是巡滩者都行。",oEN="Brglmurgl at Winterfin Retreat has asked you to kill 15 Winterfin murlocs. Any combination of warriors, oracles, and shorestrikers will do.",p="如果你杀死那么多的冬鳞叛徒，那为什么我看过去水中的时候，还会看到这么多那种家伙？",pEN="If you have killed so many of the Winterfin betrayers, why is it that when I look out across the water, I still see too many of them?",c="我很满意。我能闻到你手上他们血液的铜腥味。\n\n对你来说这是个不错的开始，<race>。",cEN="I am pleased. I can smell the coppery tang of their blood on your hands.\n\nThis is a good start for you, <race>."}
Q[11562]={d="这件事真叫我难以启齿啊……我被敲竹杠了！\n\n姆姆咕咕趁替我整理东西的机会偷走了那件备用的鱼人服，还威胁说要在其它鱼人面前拆穿我的真面目。\n\n我想我用不着向你解释这件事的严重性吧！而且，我还有一项计划也因为缺少鱼人服而搁浅了。\n\n$n，去冬鳞避难所偏北角找姆姆咕咕谈一谈吧。无论他提什么要求，你都要照做。",dEN="I have something embarrassing to admit: I'm being blackmailed!\n\nMrmrglmr agreed to clean some of my things, and got hold of my spare murloc costume. He's threatening to reveal my true nature to the other murlocs.\n\nI need not explain to you what a disaster that would be! Besides, I have a plan that's going to require that we get that costume back.\n\nPlease, <name>, go to Mrmrglmr at the other end of the Retreat to the north and do whatever he asks of you.",o="国王姆嘎姆嘎要你与冬鳞避难所西北角的姆姆咕咕谈一谈。",oEN="King Mrgl-Mrgl has asked you to speak with Mrmrglmr at the northwest end of Winterfin Retreat.",c="哦，那你一定就是那个所谓的姆嘎姆嘎国王的跟班了。我猜是<race>派你来安抚我的？\n\n好极了，我正好有件差事适合像你这么强的人去做！",cEN="Aw, so you must be the so-called King Mrgl-Mrgl's lackey. I suppose that <race> has sent you to appease me?\n\nGood, I have just the thing that needs doing for someone as powerful as you!"}
Q[11563]={d="瞪大你那双哀怨的小眼睛仔细看看，北部海湾中的逆戟鲸正在肆意杀害我们的同胞！\n\n想要替你的暗夜精灵“国王”讨回那件备用的鱼人服，就得帮我取回逆戟鲸首领咕拉咕拉的头。他总是逆着汹涌的命运之潮而游，那些被海妖的死亡之歌所诱的生灵统统成为了他的腹中餐！\n\n$r，赶紧行动吧。冬鳞鱼人都快死绝了，你却还在这里和我悠闲地聊天！",dEN="If your pathetic little eyes were any good, you'd see that we're being slaughtered by the orcas to the north in the bay!\n\nAssuming your precious night elf king wants his spare costume back, I think you'll do me a favor and bring back the head of the king of the orcas, Glrggl: he who swims against the tides of fate -- eradicating the hope of life for all those who hear the siren song of death upon the waves!\n\nBe quick about it, <race>, Winterfin murlocs are losing their lives even as we waste time talking!",o="冬鳞避难所的姆姆咕咕要你将咕拉咕拉的徽记带回来给他。",oEN="Mrmrglmr wants you to return to him at Winterfin Retreat with Glrggl's Head.",p="如果你没有取来咕拉咕拉的头颅，那就不要浪费我的时间！",pEN="If you don't have Glrggl's head, don't waste my time!",c="不错。这东西可以煮成一顿大餐！\n\n逆戟鲸首领一死，它们对我们的攻势也将减轻，它们会忙着争夺群体统治权。",cEN="Not bad. This will make a nice feast!\n\nWith the king of the orcas dead the attacks upon us should diminish while the whales fight amongst themselves for dominance."}
Q[11564]={d="我听说，你正打算去捕猎逆戟鲸的首领咕拉咕拉。\n\n这本来也是稀松平常的事儿，但是如果你喝过鲜美的鲸鱼汤，就一定会感叹还是活着好啊。从分布在幽光海湾的逆戟鲸身上取几块肥美的逆戟鲸脂肪回来，我就让你尝尝这世间的美味。\n\n快去吧……我还得仔细处理下这颗巨大的逆戟鲸头呢。",dEN="Word is, strange <race>, that you might be going after the king of the orcas, Glrggl.\n\nThat's all fine and good, but if you want to taste the stew that makes life worth living, then you'll bring me back the succulent blubber of the orcas that swim in Glimmer Bay.\n\nHurry... I have quite a bit of cutting to do on this carcass if you want to reap the benefits of your efforts.",o="北风苔原冬鳞避难所的屠夫布咕布噜要你去收集7块肥美的逆戟鲸脂肪。",oEN="Cleaver Bmurglbrm has tasked you with acquiring 7 Succulent Orca Blubber. Return with them to him at Winterfin Retreat.",p="你拿到我需要的逆戟鲸脂肪了吗？",pEN="Do you have all of the orca blubber that I require?",c="啊，好的，这些正合适。\n\n随便把它们放在哪儿都行。你可以拿走一些我昨晚剩下的炖菜。既然你一直在帮我们解决其他麻烦，我的食谱也归你了。",cEN="Aw yes, these will do nicely.\n\nJust plop them down anywhere. You can have some of my leftover stew from last night. And since you've been helping us with our other problems, you can have my recipe, too."}
Q[11565]={d="很好，如果那个“国王”肯一心一意地帮助我们抵御外敌，我就为他保守秘密。\n\n把这个还给他吧。我仔细清洗过这件鱼人服了，不过我想不明白他为什么要搞两套伪装。\n\n或许他是有什么计划吧？",dEN="Very well, your king's secret is safe with me as long as he continues to help us against our enemies.\n\nHere, take this to him. I cleaned it up nicely, though I have no idea why he needs a second disguise.\n\nMaybe he has something in mind for you?",o="返回冬鳞避难所，将国王姆嘎姆嘎的备用鱼人服交给他。",oEN="Return King Mrgl-Mrgl's Spare Suit to him at Winterfin Retreat.",p="你拿到我那套备用礼服了吗，<name>？",pEN="Do you have my spare suit, <name>?",c="<看着备用的鱼人服，国王兴奋地摩擦着他鱼人装上的附肢。>\n\n干得不错。现在我们回归正题。我有件非常重要的事情要让你去做。",cEN="<Upon seeing the spare murloc suit, the king rubs his costumed appendages together.>\n\nNicely done. Now, back to the pressing matter at hand. I've got something of great importance for you to do."}
Q[11566]={d="$n，让我们结束这场骚乱吧。如果冬鳞鱼人想在这里繁衍生息的话，就必须除掉克拉西姆斯！\n\n我要你穿上这件备用的鱼人服，以投降为借口进入冬鳞洞穴。你手上举着小白旗，他们是不会攻击你的。\n\n克拉西姆斯就躲在洞穴最西南的角落。我要你杀死克拉西姆斯，将他的钳带回来作为你完成这项任务的凭证。",dEN="The time has come to put an end to this unnatural situation, <name>. For the Winterfin murlocs to have a chance at a future, Claximus must die!\n\nI want you to take my spare murloc suit and enter the Winterfin Caverns under the pretext of surrender. With the white flag in hand, the murlocs won't attack you.\n\nYou'll find him in the southwestern most corner of the caverns. Once you get close enough, deal with Claximus. Bring me one of his claws as proof that the grisly deed has been done.",o="冬鳞避难所的国王姆嘎姆嘎要你将克拉西姆斯的钳子带回来给他。",oEN="King Mrgl-Mrgl at Winterfin Retreat has asked you to bring him a Claw of Claximus.",p="你办到了吗，<class>？克拉克斯姆斯死了吗？",pEN="Have you done it, <class>? Is Claximus dead?",c="很遗憾，但必须如此。爪子我收下了，<name>。\n\n谢谢你给予我们的一切帮助。克拉克斯姆斯被击败后，也许我们能重新聚集剩下的鱼人，封住那些洞穴。\n\n请收下这个，我的朋友……与你给我们的一切帮助相比，这已经是我最起码能做的了！",cEN="Regrettable, but necessary. I'll take the claw, <name>.\n\nThank you for all of the help you've given us. With Claximus defeated, maybe we'll be able to reunite the remaining murlocs and seal off those caverns.\n\nPlease, my friend, take this... it's the least I can do for all of the help you have rendered us!"}
Q[11567]={d="我曾经呆在那艘载有甲胄的船上。当时我们正在转舵折回这里，突然被一艘被遗忘者的驱逐舰攻击了。\n\n他们强行登上了我们的船，夺走了所有的财宝，随后弄沉了她。\n\n那是我最后一次看到甲胄。如果你想要去找的话，就坐我的小船从无赖港转至那艘驱逐舰所在的小岛吧。我的女人奥兰雅就在外面，跟她谈谈。她会帮你上船的。\n\n如果你找到甲胄，给我带回来！",dEN="I was on the vessel that was bringing in the armor. We'd just boarded the ship and were headin' back here when we were attacked by a Forsaken destroyer.\n\nThey boarded our ship, took all the booty for themselves, and then sunk her.\n\nThat was the last I'd seen of that armor. If you want, you can take my bomber from Scalawag to the dreaded isle that the destroyer be docked. Talk to my woman, Alanya, outside. She'll get you on the bomber.\n\nIf you manage to find the stuff, don't you dare bring it back!",o="找回克瓦迪尔上古甲胄，把它交给嚎风峡湾卡玛古的奥弗斯。",oEN="Recover the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir and deliver it to Orfus of Kamagua in the Howling Fjord.",p="你找到上古甲胄了吗？",pEN="Have you found the armor?",c="我们必须把所有神器都归还，<name>。等四件都集齐了，你就把它们放回各自的坟墓。",cEN="We must return all of the artifacts, <name>. When all four are gathered, you will put them back in their graves."}
Q[11568]={d="<奥弗斯交给你一个背包。>\n\n背包里装着你找回的圣物。到东南边的盾牌岭去，找到这些物品被偷走前所在的墓穴，把它们放回原来的位置。我希望这样能让那些神出鬼没的灵魂们安静下来。\n\n勇敢些，$n……",dEN="<Orfus hands you a satchel.>\n\nWithin this satchel are the artifacts that you recovered. Locate the burial mounds of Shield Hill, far to the southeast, where the items were originally stolen from and return the artifacts. It is my hope that this gesture will quell the spirits that now haunt our hunting grounds.\n\nBe strong, <name>...",o="在盾牌岭那些被掠夺过的墓穴处使用维库圣物，将伊斯多弗的冰冷之心、古神之盾、风暴愤怒法杖和克瓦迪尔上古甲胄放回它们原本的位置。\n\n完成任务之后回到上古升降梯，向卡玛古的奥弗斯复命。",oEN="Use the Bundle of Vrykul Artifacts at the ransacked burial mounds of Shield Hill to return the Frozen Heart of Isuldof, the Shield of the Aesirites, the Staff of Storm's Fury and the Ancient Armor of the Kvaldir.\n\nReturn to Orfus of Kamagua at the Ancient Lift should you succeed.",p="完成了吗？灵魂平静下来了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Are the spirits at rest?",c="坏消息，<name>。我的人民身处危险之中，必须得到警告。这些海上的畸形怪物绝不会对卡鲁亚克人心慈手软。",cEN="Grim tidings, <name>. My people are in danger and must be warned. These sea faring aberrations will take no mercy upon the Kalu'ak."}
Q[11569]={d="我必须离开这些洞穴！有某种魔法物质正从上面的寒冷之息渗进来，影响着所有人的心智。\n\n我可不想像其他人那样被控制！\n\n钥匙大师乌尔姆格格尔在下面南边的洞穴里。我的笼子钥匙在他手上。把钥匙从他那里拿来给我，这样我就能打开笼子逃出去了。\n\n快点！",dEN="I have to get out of these caverns! There's magic stuff seeping in from Coldarra, above, and affecting everyone's minds.\n\nI don't intend to be controlled like these others!\n\nKeymaster Urmgrgl is in the cave below and to the south. He holds the key to my cage. Get it from him and bring it back so that I can unlock my cage and get out of here.\n\nHurry!",o="冬鳞洞穴的咕啦咕啦要你夺回呜啦咕噜的钥匙。",oEN="Glrglrglr inside the Winterfin Caverns has asked you to retrieve Urmgrgl's Key.",p="你拿到钥匙了吗？\n\n不，我其它什么事都不管。我只想离开这里！",pEN="Do you have the key?\n\nNo, I don't care about any of these others. I just want to get out of here!",c="快！把它递过来！",cEN="Quickly, hand it here!"}
Q[11570]={d="这笼子似乎不是很结实，但是我才不会在没把握的情况下傻兮兮地自己跑出去。\n\n你愿意帮助我逃离这里吗？$r，没时间可以浪费了。\n\n如果我们能顺利逃脱，请转告国王我已经安全归来。他会好好奖赏你的。",dEN="The lock on my cage doesn't look too solid, but I'm not foolish enough to try to leave without assistance.\n\nWill you help me safely get out of these caverns? There's no time to waste, <race>.\n\nWhen you get back to the retreat, please let the king know that I'm okay. He's sure to give you a reward.",o="护送噜呱吧呱抵达安全区域，然后返回冬鳞避难所，向国王姆嘎姆嘎汇报这一好消息。",oEN="Escort Lurgglbr to safety and then report to King Mrgl-Mrgl at Winterfin Retreat with the good news.",p="是的，<name>，我能为你做什么？",pEN="Yes, <name>, what can I do for you?",c="这个消息真是太好了！你刚才说噜呱吧呱发现了从洞穴弥漫出的东西正是造成疯狂的原因？\n\n那肯定是考达拉的魔法越来越强大了。魔枢之战……那是一场蓝龙军团与其余龙族之间的战争，尸横遍野。\n\n很快，我们全都会被牵扯进去的！",cEN="This is wonderful news! And you say that Lurgglbr discovered that the emanations from the caverns are what caused this insanity?\n\nIt must be that the magic from Coldarra is growing stronger. The Nexus War... the battle between the blue dragonflight and all of the other dragons, is spilling over.\n\nSoon, we will all be embroiled in it!"}
Q[11571]={d="你必须学会冬鳞鱼人的语言才能帮得上忙。这就要借助自然与魔法的双重力量了。\n\n我将这枚空贝壳交给你。水渠底部生活着一位名叫斯卡德尔的元素生物，她拥有水和空气的力量。\n\n击败她后，你就利用这枚贝壳从她的残骸上收集魔法气体。把装满气体的贝壳带回来给我，我就将冬鳞鱼人的语言灌注到你的头脑中。\n\n嘿嘿，你挺走运的。我从朋友那儿学来的水下呼吸法术刚好能派上用场。",dEN="To help, you must learn how to speak the Winterfin dialect. We'll work with the forces of nature and magic to do that.\n\nTake this empty conch shell. At the bottom of the watery trench below exists Scalder, an elemental of air and watery fury.\n\nOnce she is defeated, use the conch upon her remains to capture her magical steam. Return the full conch to me, and I'll imbue my knowledge of the Winterfin tongue into you.\n\nLuckily, a friend taught me a water breathing spell, which I will cast upon you.",o="冬鳞避难所的国王姆嘎姆嘎要你对斯卡德尔的尸体使用空贝壳，然后将国王的充盈贝壳交给他。",oEN="King Mrgl-Mrgl has given you a conch to use upon Scalder's remains. Return The King's Filled Conch to him at Winterfin Retreat.",p="你用贝壳装满了斯卡德尔的魔法气体了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to fill the conch with Scalder's steam?",c="现在我可以使用斯卡德尔的精华，好将我对冬鳞鱼人语言的知识传授给你。",cEN="Now I will be able to use Scalder's essence to impart my understanding of the Winterfin murloc tongue to you."}
Q[11572]={d="回到卡玛古的长者阿图伊克那里去。他和我的其它同胞必须立即得知行将出现在海洋中的厄运。\n\n<奥弗斯颤抖着。>\n\n乘坐上古升降梯去找他。请快一点！",dEN="Return to Elder Atuik at Kamagua. He and the rest of my people must be warned of this impending doom that approaches from the sea.\n\n<Orfus shivers.>\n\nUse the Ancient Lift to reach him. Please hurry!",o="将坏消息传达给卡玛古的长者阿图伊克。",oEN="Deliver the bad news to Elder Atuik at Kamagua.",c="卡鲁亚克人感谢你所做的一切，<name>。现在我们必须为战斗做准备，并警告海对岸的兄弟姐妹们即将到来的灾难。\n\n我希望还不算太晚……",cEN="The Kalu'ak thank you for all that you have done, <name>. We must now prepare for battle and warn our brothers and sisters across the sea of what is to come.\n\nI hope it is not too late..."}
Q[11573]={d="你好，$gviajero:viajera;。我是卡鲁亚克人的短牙。你们的人称我们为海象人。我和我的伙伴最近被派去调查我们一条狩猎小径上发生的怪事。当我们靠近那个叫盾牌岭的墓地时，遭到了亡灵的袭击。我运气好，活着到了这个营地，但我不知道奥弗斯怎么样了。\n\n我们在此地东南方悬崖边的古代升降梯处走散了。你能去看看他是否平安吗？",dEN="Hail, traveler. I am Lunk-tusk of the Kalu'ak. We are known as tuskarr to your people. My partner and I were recently sent up to investigate strange happenings along one of our hunting trails. It was when we approached the graveyard known as Shield Hill that we were attacked by the undead. I was lucky to make it to this camp, but I am uncertain as to what became of Orfus.\n\nWe parted ways at the Ancient Lift, southeast of here along the cliff edge. Will you go see if he is ok?",o="转至嚎风峡湾的上古升降梯，寻找卡玛古的奥弗斯。",oEN="Find Orfus of Kamagua at the Ancient Lift in Howling Fjord.",c="朗塔斯……他……他还活着？今天总算有点好消息了……",cEN="Lunk-tusk lives? At least there is some good news to be had on this day..."}
Q[11574]={d="我已经把记得的事情全告诉他们了，为什么没人相信我？\n\n当时我正在裂隙边上采草药，那些带着魔法生物的黑暗巫师就突然出现了——我被包围了！\n\n我的头上出现了一只魔法盒子，它把我吸了进去。就在盒子要关上的时候，一群骑着红龙的人把我救了下来。那场面太壮观了！\n\n我还没谢过他们的救命之恩呢。求你了，$c，帮我找到他们，向他们转达我的谢意。",dEN="I told them all that I remember. Why don't they believe me?\n\nI was gathering herbs by the rift. They came from nowhere, dark wizards with magical beasts - I was surrounded!\n\nA magical box appeared above me, opened up and pulled me inside. Just as it began to close around me, my rescuers swooped in on the backs of red drakes. It was breathtaking!\n\nI never thanked them for saving me. Please, <class>, find them, and pass on my gratitude.",o="恩多拉要你到战歌要塞北方的琥珀崖去找到她的救命恩人，并转达她的谢意。",oEN="Endorah wants you to go to Amber Ledge north of Warsong Hold and thank those there for rescuing her.",c="你可以告诉你的朋友，能拯救她是我们的荣幸，也是我们的职责。\n\n她所遭遇的情况就我来看，是巨大谜团的一小部分。\n\n达拉然在尽一切的努力来解开这个谜团，但老实说，我们需要更多的协助……",cEN="You can tell your friend that her rescue was our pleasure, as well as our duty.\n\nHer encounter was but a small piece in what I believe to be a large puzzle.\n\nDalaran is sparing no effort in solving this mystery and to be honest, we could use a bit of assistance...."}
Q[11575]={d="我已经把记得的事情全告诉他们了，为什么没人相信我？\n\n当时我正在裂隙边上采草药，那些带着魔法生物的黑暗巫师就突然出现了——我被包围了！\n\n我的头上出现了一只魔法盒子，它把我吸了进去。我发誓我没有撒谎！\n\n就在盒子要关上的时候，一群骑着红龙的人把我救了下来——真是太神奇了！抓我的人被冲散了，我才逃了出来。\n\n我还没谢过他们的救命之恩呢。求你了，$c，帮我找到他们，向他们转达我的谢意。",dEN="I told them all that I remember. Why don't they believe me?\n\nI was gathering herbs by the rift. They came from nowhere, dark wizards with magical beasts. I was surrounded!\n\nA huge magical cube appeared above me. It opened up and pulled me inside. I swear it's true!\n\nJust as it began to close around me, my rescuers swooped in on the backs of drakes - It was amazing! My captors scattered and I was able to escape.\n\nI never thanked them for saving me. Please, <class>, if you see them, pass on my gratitude.",o="无畏要塞的米吉要你到北方的琥珀崖去找到她的救命恩人，并转达她的谢意。",oEN="Midge in Valiance Keep wants you to go to Amber Ledge to the north and thank those there for rescuing her.",c="你可以告诉你的朋友，能拯救她是我们的荣幸，也是我们的职责。\n\n她所遭遇的情况就我来看，是巨大谜团的一小部分。\n\n达拉然在尽一切的努力来解开这个谜团，但老实说，我们需要更多的协助……",cEN="You can tell your friend that her rescue was our pleasure, as well as our duty.\n\nHer encounter was but a small piece in what I believe to be a large puzzle.\n\nDalaran is sparing no effort in solving this mystery and to be honest, we could use a bit of assistance...."}
Q[11576]={d="你好，$r。我是达拉然的加伦。\n\n不久前，这道裂隙还是个平静的地方——至少在地热方面是这样。\n\n可最近，地震以惊人的频率接连发生，大地上出现了裂痕，暴露出独特的混沌能量场。\n\n我在这里的任务就是测绘并监控这些异常。我的仪器显示，西南方的崖壁上又出现了一处异常。\n\n带上这个装置，找到新的扰动处时使用它。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. I am Garren of Dalaran.\n\nNot long ago, the rift was a peaceful place - geothermally speaking at least.\n\nRecently though, earthquakes have occurred with alarming frequency and scars in the earth have appeared, exposing unique energy fields of chaotic power.\n\nMy mission here is to chart and monitor these anomalies. My instruments indicate that another has appeared on the cliff face to the southwest.\n\nTake this device with you and use it when you locate the new disruption.",o="琥珀崖的盖伦要你在悬崖异常处使用奥术测量器。",oEN="Garren on Amber Ledge wants you to use the Arcanometer at the Cleftcliff Anomaly.",p="你采集到我要的读数了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you taken the readings I requested, <class>?",c="太惊人了！这是最严重的环境灾害。\n\n但是我担心后头还有更糟糕的事情。",cEN="Fascinating! This is the largest disruption yet.\n\nThough the worst is yet to come, I fear."}
Q[11580]={c="亵渎这团火焰！",cEN="Desecrate the Horde's Silverpine bonfire!"}
Q[11581]={c="亵渎这团火焰！",cEN="Desecrate the Alliance's Westfall bonfire!"}
Q[11582]={d="你听到了吗？！那只是一场馀震而已……几分钟之前那次才叫天崩地裂呢！\n\n看来我不得不再次请你帮忙了。我的仪器显示在西边的水下深处发生了一次巨大的扰动。\n\n和以前一样，我需要你带着这件仪器去收集扰动的数据。\n\n我会给你施加一个水下呼吸的法术。如果在你找到目标地点之前法术效果就要消失了，回来告诉我一声，我会重新对你施放这个法术。",dEN="Did you feel that?! That was just an aftershock... you should've been here a few minutes ago!\n\nI'm afraid I must call upon your services again. My instruments indicate that there is an immense disruption just west of here, far beneath the water's surface.\n\nJust as before, I need you to take the arcanometer and capture the anomaly's data.\n\nI'll cast a spell that will enable you to breathe underwater. If it wears off before you find it, come let me know and I'll renew its effects.",o="琥珀崖的盖伦要你在峭壁断层处使用奥术测量器，并将读数带回去交给他。",oEN="Garren at Amber Ledge wants you to use the Arcanometer at the Sundered Chasm anomaly and return to him with the readings.",p="怎么样，<class>？\n\n你找到异常点了吗？",pEN="Well, <class>?\n\nWere you able to locate the anomaly?",c="它有多大？\n\n这是不可能的！我必须立刻向达拉然报告！",cEN="It was how big?\n\nThat's impossible! I need to report to Dalaran at once!"}
Q[11583]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Westfall flame!"}
Q[11584]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Silverpine Forest flame!"}
Q[11585]={d="Throm-Ka，$r！欢迎来到战歌要塞。看到部落如此杰出的$gun héroe:una heroína;响应了号召，我心中充满自豪。\n\n这座坚不可摧的堡垒是部落坚韧不拔的证明。我们历经苦战，才在诺森德建立起这个立足点。我们前往冰冠冰川的旅程从这里开始，而在地狱咆哮之子的领导下，我们必将成功！\n\n加尔鲁什在下面等你。\n\nLok'tar ogar！",dEN="Throm-Ka, <race>! Welcome to Warsong Hold. My heart swells with pride to see that such a distinguished hero of the Horde has answered the call of duty!\n\nThis impregnable fortress is a testament to the tenacity of the Horde. Through much we have battled to establish this foothold in Northrend. It is from here that our journey to Icecrown begins and it is through the leadership of the son of Hellscream that we will succeed!\n\nGarrosh awaits your arrival below.\n\nLok'tar ogar!",o="与战歌要塞的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Garrosh Hellscream in Warsong Hold.",c="部落的，？\n\n<加尔鲁什嗅了嗅你周围的空气。>\n\n恐惧……\n\n<加尔鲁什啐了一口。>\n\n你活不了多久。",cEN="A hero of the Horde, eh?\n\n<Garrosh sniffs at the air around you.>\n\nFear...\n\n<Garrosh spits.>\n\nYou won't last long."}
Q[11586]={d="Throm-Ka，$r！欢迎来到战歌要塞。看到部落如此杰出的$gun héroe:una heroína;响应了号召，我心中充满自豪。\n\n这座坚不可摧的堡垒是部落坚韧不拔的证明。我们历经苦战，才在诺森德建立起这个立足点。我们前往冰冠冰川的旅程从这里开始，而在地狱咆哮之子的领导下，我们必将成功！\n\n加尔鲁什在下面等你。\n\nLok'tar ogar！",dEN="Throm-Ka, <race>! Welcome to Warsong Hold. My heart swells with pride to see that such a distinguished hero of the Horde has answered the call of duty!\n\nThis impregnable fortress is a testament to the tenacity of the Horde. Through much we have battled to establish this foothold in Northrend. It is from here that our journey to Icecrown begins and it is through the leadership of the son of Hellscream that we will succeed!\n\nGarrosh awaits your arrival below.\n\nLok'tar ogar!",o="与战歌要塞的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Garrosh Hellscream in Warsong Hold.",c="别以为我忘了你在纳格兰为我的人民做过什么，<name>。地狱咆哮从不忘事。\n\n因此我欠你一份人情，也正因如此我现在给你这个机会：跑吧。离开这里，永远别回头。\n\n回你的家去，为垂死的人祈祷吧。",cEN="Do not think that I have forgotten what you did for my people in Nagrand, <name>. Hellscream never forgets.\n\nFor that I am indebted to you and it is why I give you this chance now: run. Leave this place and never look back.\n\nReturn to your home and say a prayer for the dying."}
Q[11587]={d="$c，你好。我是多纳森，达拉然的使者。\n\n请原谅我的唐突，但是局势危急，我不得不寻求帮助。艾泽拉斯世界的许多法师都被绑架了，我奉命招募人手来协助调查这件事的内幕。\n\n我打算从南边的营地入手。我要你转至营地中，解救一名被囚禁的法师。当然，你得从那附近的法师猎手身上找到奥术牢笼的钥匙。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I am Donathan, a loyal representative of Dalaran.\n\nForgive my abruptness, but we find ourselves in the midst of a crisis. Mages all across Azeroth are being abducted and I have been authorized to conscript anyone able to assist in the unraveling of this mystery.\n\nThe camp just south of ours is where our investigation begins. I call upon you to rescue one of the imprisoned mages held there. You must obtain a key from one of the mage hunters and use it to open an arcane prison.",o="琥珀崖的图书馆员多纳森要你转至蓝玉营地，从蓝玉法师猎手那里夺得蓝玉监狱钥匙，利用它从奥术牢笼中解救一名被囚禁的法师。",oEN="Librarian Donathan on Amber Ledge wants you to collect the Beryl Prison Key from one of the Beryl Mage Hunters at Beryl Point and use it to release a trapped mage from an arcane prison.",p="我相信你正努力救出被囚禁的法师……",pEN="I trust you are working diligently to rescue an imprisoned mage....",c="你做得很好，<name>。\n\n肯瑞托感激地接受你的援助。要知道，你为我们提供的任何服务都不会没有回报。\n\n请收下这份微薄的礼物，作为达拉然感激之情的象征。",cEN="You have done well, <name>.\n\nThe Kirin Tor graciously accept the assistance you have rendered. Know that any service you provide us will not go unrewarded.\n\nPlease, accept this humble offering as a token of Dalaran's appreciation."}
Q[11590]={d="$n，我们遇到麻烦了。\n\n我刚刚得知，一位奉命从达拉然赶来的大法师失踪了。我们很自然地联想到，法师猎手与这件事脱不了干系。\n\n时间紧迫，我们必须尽快查明艾瓦诺尔女士的下落并设法营救她。\n\n带上这件装置返回蓝玉营地，对一名临死的蓝玉巫师使用它。它的束缚效果能持续很长时间，足够让你把他押回这里接受调查的了。",dEN="<name>, we have a situation.\n\nI've just learned that one of our archmages en route from Dalaran has gone missing. Naturally, we suspect the mage hunters are behind her disappearance.\n\nTime is clearly of the essence. We must know what has become of Lady Evanor at once if we are to have any hope of rescuing her.\n\nTake this device. Return to Beryl Point and use it on a Beryl sorcerer when he is near death. It should bind him long enough for you to bring him here for questioning.",o="多纳森要你转至蓝玉营地，对一名受伤的蓝玉巫师使用奥术镣铐，并将他带回琥珀崖。",oEN="Donathan wants you to use the Arcane Binder on a wounded Beryl Sorcerer at Beryl Point and return to Amber Ledge with him.",p="你已经抓到一名绿柱石巫师了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you captured a Beryl sorcerer yet, <name>?",c="干得漂亮，<name>。\n\n我们马上就把他准备好接受审讯。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nWe'll have him prepared for his interrogation at once."}
Q[11591]={d="钢腭那个蠢货！他为了抄近路，居然想带着我们的补给车队穿过一处牦牛人墓地！\n\n我们才刚刚和那些牦牛人达成协议，就出了这样的事情！\n\n现在车队就停在墓地的废墟里，被惊扰的牦牛人幽灵从坟墓里跑了出来，现在已经包围了车队。\n\n到南方去看看你能不能解决这个麻烦吧，$c。我派步兵沃塔·怒拳带了些人过去帮忙了。\n\n你不如去看看是不是有什么可以帮忙的？",dEN="That dimwitted cur, Steeljaw, tried to take our caravan of supplies on a shortcut through a taunka graveyard!\n\nWe just struck up relations with them!\n\nNow the caravan lies in ruins, overrun by the taunka spirits that rose out of their graves as he was trampling them.\n\nHead south and see if you can salvage the situation, <class>. I sent Grunt Ragefist and a few others down there with him to help out.\n\nWhy don't you see if you can lend a hand.",o="转至钢腭的车队，找到步兵沃塔·怒拳。",oEN="Speak with Grunt Ragefist at Steeljaw's Caravan.",c="这可不妙，<class>。\n\n长跑者傲蹄说，这里是他敬爱的祖先的墓地。",cEN="This isn't good, <class>.\n\nLongrunner Proudhoof says that these are the burial grounds of his honored ancestors."}
Q[11592]={d="一个名叫斯尔加·钢腭的兽人为了节省时间，居然试图穿越我们的墓地。这最好不是你们部落惯用的做事手法，$r，否则牦牛人会让你们吃不了兜着走！\n\n不过你看起来似乎是愿意帮忙解决问题的。很好！\n\n斯尔加·钢腭那该死的幽灵还在这里游荡，惊扰着我的祖先。我们必须干掉他！\n\n如果我们成功了，你就到北方的要塞去向你们的博古洛克大王复命吧。\n\n怎么样？",dEN="One of your orcs named Steeljaw tried to save some time by taking a shortcut through our burial grounds. This had better not be how your Horde normally acts, <race>, or you will find the taunka to be the end of you!\n\nBut, you look as if you want to help fix this situation. Good!\n\nSteeljaw's cursed spirit now haunts this place and disturbs the remains of my ancestors. We must put an end to him!\n\nIf we live through this, tell your Overlord Bor'gorok at the outpost to the north.\n\nAre you with me?",o="帮助远行者达玛·傲蹄和他的士兵突袭钢腭的车队，并杀死指挥官斯尔加·钢腭的幽灵。\n\n完成任务后，转至北风苔原的博古洛克前哨站，向博古洛克大王复命。",oEN="Help Longrunner Proudhoof and his Warsong raiders to survive the assault upon Steeljaw's Caravan and finish off the spirit of Force-Commander Steeljaw.\n\nIf successful, report to Overlord Bor'gorok at Bor'gorok Outpost.",c="鲜血与雷霆！你挽救了我们对牛头人刚刚建立起来的关系。\n\n谢谢你摆平了这件事。Aka'Magosh，<name>！",cEN="Blood and thunder! You've salvaged our newborn relations with the taunka.\n\nThank you for putting the situation to rights. Aka'Magosh, <name>!"}
Q[11593]={d="那些死难者应该像英雄一样被埋葬，但我们不能把他们葬在牦牛人的圣地里。\n\n我不会让你他们的尸体拖回来，我要你拿上这个到墓地里去。如果你找到死难的车队守卫和工人，就用这火把让他们安息吧。\n\n向死难者致敬，$c！",dEN="Our fallen deserve a hero's funeral, but we cannot bury them here on sacred taunka ground.\n\nI'll not ask you to drag their bodies back here, but take this and head further into the cemetary. When you come across our dead caravan guards and workers, put them to the torch.\n\nHonor our dead, <class>!",o="钢腭的车队处的步兵沃塔·怒拳要你用火把烧掉10具车队卫兵和车队工人的遗体。",oEN="Grunt Ragefist at Steeljaw's Caravan has asked you to use Ragefist's Torch to burn any combination of 10 Dead Carvan Guards and Workers.",p="我只是在看，然后发现了我们阵亡者的尸体还在外面。\n\n履行你对部落的职责，<class>！",pEN="I was just looking, and spotted the corpses of our fallen still out there.\n\nDo your duty to the Horde, <class>!",c="谢谢你，<class>。我们是部落，我们不会抛下阵亡的同胞！\n\n首先，这事根本就不该发生。钢颚是个蠢货！",cEN="Thank you, <class>. We are the Horde, we do not leave our dead behind!\n\nIt should never have been necessary in the first place. Steeljaw was a fool!"}
Q[11594]={d="指挥官斯尔加·钢腭干的蠢事把事情搞得一团糟。他到底是怎么想的？居然让车队穿过牦牛人的墓地！\n\n可事情已经发生了，现在我们必须收拾残局。\n\n博古洛克大王要我尽一切可能帮助远行者达玛·傲蹄，现在远行者要我们设法让他的祖先重新安息。\n\n你说什么，$c？你是不是够$g 种:胆去完成这个简单的任务呢？",dEN="Force-Commander Steeljaw's idiocy caused this mess. What was he thinking taking a caravan through a taunka burial mound?\n\nStill, what's done is done. Now it is up to us to deal with the consequences.\n\nOverlord Bor'gorok asked me to help Longrunner Proudhoof in any way that I can. The longrunner has asked that we lay to rest the spirits of his ancestors.\n\nWhat do you say, <class>? Are you <man /strong> enough to handle such a simple task?",o="让20个牦牛人的灵魂安息，幽灵先知或者复苏的远行者都可以。完成任务之后回到钢腭的车队，向步兵沃塔·怒拳复命。",oEN="Put 20 taunka spirits, either Ghostly Sages or Risen Longrunners, to rest and then report back to Grunt Ragefist at Steeljaw's Caravan.",p="如果你做得很棒，为什么我还是可以看到他们？",pEN="If you did such a good job, why is it that I can still see them out there?",c="干得好，<class>！你对抗亡灵的経験一定很丰富。就算以前没有，现在也有了一些。\n\n如果想在诺森德活下去，你会需要它的。",cEN="Well done, <class>! You must have a great deal of experience fighting the undead. And, if you didn't before, you have some now.\n\nYou'll need it if you're going to survive in Northrend."}
Q[11595]={d="地狱咆哮肩负着整个部落的重担。别因为他的脾气就懈怠了自己的职责，$n。\n\n<萨鲁法尔点了点头。>\n\n你以为我会忘记奥格瑞玛$gdel héroe:de la heroína;的名字吗？把奈法利安的头颅插上长矛的机会可不是天天都有的！\n\n天灾军团已经开始进攻这座堡垒。我们的士兵勉强守住了阵线，但急需增援。去向拉兹格尔报到，他就驻守在战歌要塞外。",dEN="Hellscream has the weight of the Horde upon his shoulders. Do not be dissuaded from your duties because of his temperament, <name>.\n\n<Saurfang nods.>\n\nDid you think that I would forget the name of a hero of Orgrimmar? It is not every day that I have the pleasure of putting the head of Nefarian on a pike!\n\nThe Scourge have begun their assault upon this fortress. Our soldiers steady the line, but are in desperate need of backup. Report to Razgor. He is stationed directly outside of Warsong Hold.",o="向战歌要塞南方小屋里的拉兹格尔大王报到。",oEN="Report to Overlord Razgor at the hut on the south side of Warsong Hold.",c="<拉兹格尔领主敬礼。>\n\n你的名声早已传到这里，<name>。",cEN="<Overlord Razgor salutes.>\n\nYour reputation precedes you, <name>."}
Q[11596]={d="别被地狱咆哮吓住，免得影响了你为部落而战的决心，$r。在这片冰封的荒野上，他的负担太重了。在他的指挥下，我们要么彻底打败天灾军团，要么就让艾泽拉斯的所有生命就此消失，所以我们需要你的力量和智慧。\n\n天灾军团已经开始攻击这座堡垒了。我们的士兵决不退缩，但他们非常需要支持。去向拉兹格尔报道吧，他就驻扎在战歌要塞的外面。",dEN="Do not let Hellscream dissuade you from your duties as a soldier of the Horde, <race>. He bears a terrible burden in these frozen wastes, with the outcome of his charge resulting in victory over the Scourge or the extinction of all life on Azeroth. It is for this reason that we require your strength and wisdom.\n\nThe Scourge have begun their assault upon this fortress. Our soldiers steady the line, but are in desperate need of backup. Report to Razgor. He is stationed directly outside of Warsong Hold.",o="向战歌要塞南方小屋里的拉兹格尔大王报到。",oEN="Report to Overlord Razgor at the hut on the south side of Warsong Hold.",c="正是时候……蛛魔光是这个礼拜的数量就增加了一倍。我们要争取一切可能的援助。",cEN="Just in time... The Nerubians have seemingly doubled in number in just a week's time. We could use all the help we can get out here."}
Q[11597]={d="看来我们总是在最艰难的时刻相遇，$gSeñor Escarabajo:Señora Escarabajo;。上次见面时，你不是正在把世界从某种毁灭中拯救出来吗？\n\n<萨鲁法尔轻笑了一声。>\n\n不管你那位年轻的酋长怎么说，你的帮助在诺森德都大受欢迎。\n\n要是能再多一打像你这样实力的士兵，我们现在就能坐在奥格瑞玛的暖火旁了。\n\n去向拉兹格尔领主报到，就在战歌要塞正门外，南边。",dEN="It seems that we always meet in the direst of circumstances, Scarab Lord. Were you not saving the world from certain destruction the last time we met?\n\n<Saurfang chuckles.>\n\nYour assistance is most welcome in Northrend, despite what the young chieftain might say.\n\nIf we had even a dozen more soldiers with your power, we would be sitting in Orgrimmar right now, hunched over a warm fire.\n\nReport to Overlord Razgor, right outside the main entry to Warsong Hold, to the south.",o="向战歌要塞南方小屋里的拉兹格尔大王报到。",oEN="Report to Overlord Razgor at the hut on the south side of Warsong Hold."}
Q[11598]={d="战歌要塞处于10尺厚的钢铁与岩石的保护之下，可外面那座采石场却完全暴露在蛛怪的威胁中。\n\n<拉兹格尔大王指了指西边。>\n\n在它背后，成百上千的天灾军团士兵正在集结，等待着进攻的命令。如果蛛怪利用采石场的地下通道攻入城中，毫无疑问，这里会被阿尔萨斯的天灾军团夷为平地。\n\n我们绝不能坐视不管，我要你主动出击，杀光采石场中的蛛怪。\n\n士兵，鲜血与雷霆！出发吧！",dEN="While Warsong is protected by 10 feet of steel and stone on all sides, this quarry is soft and primed for attacks by the Nerubians.\n\n<Razgor points west.>\n\nBeyond this quarry stand thousands of Scourge, awaiting orders to attack. Should the Nerubians take down our inner defenses, we will be overrun by the undead legions of Arthas.\n\nWe can't let that happen - which is why you're going on the offensive and slaughtering the Nerubians in the quarry.\n\nBlood and thunder, soldier! Take 'em both with you.",o="战歌要塞的拉兹格尔大王要你杀死15只尼鲁巴尔蛛魔。",oEN="Overlord Razgor at Warsong Hold wants you to kill 15 Nerub'ar Nerubians.",p="不是我们在蛛魔虫族的隧道系统上面盖东西，而是那些混蛋把隧道朝我们挖！",pEN="We didn't build on the Nerubian tunnel system, those monsters tunneled to us!",c="你减缓了他们的攻势，但它们的数量却越来越多。你有办法找到它们卵囊的位置吗？",cEN="You've slowed them down, but more are sure to join the fight. Were you able to locate any of their egg sacs while in the quarry?"}
Q[11599]={d="不久之前，我们系列的一位朋友威廉·奥雷顿托人给我捎来了一条口信。他说……他说就在他来无畏要塞报名参军的同一天，我的哥哥也在新兵名单里。可是……据我所知，哥哥他早就去世许多年了。\n\n所以，为了来这里找他，我变卖了自己的一切财产，赌上了我的一切希望。但是，现在我却只能被那些愚蠢而效率底下的官僚按在这里消磨时光。他们甚至还威胁我说，如果我再继续调查下去，就把我抓起来丢进监狱。\n\n看来，我确实需要一位人缘好、面相善、能混进上面的人帮我……对，比如说你。如果你愿意帮助我的话，请去找威廉吧，我听说他就在致远郡矿洞。",dEN="I recently received word from William Allerton, a family friend, that my brother enlisted here in Valiance Keep on the same day he did. Thing is... my brother's been dead for years.\n\nI sold everything I owned to come looking for Thassarian, only to be stonewalled by the local bureaucracy. I've even been threatened with arrest if I keep snooping around.\n\nI need someone in the good graces of the higher-ups... someone like you. If you can help me, I heard that William's stationed at the Farshire mine.",o="转至致远郡矿洞，寻找威廉·奥雷顿。",oEN="Look for William Allerton inside the Farshire mine.",c="那具尸体的特征与莉蕾萨形容的威廉·奥雷顿一样。但是说来奇怪，他的身上没有爪痕或咬痕。",cEN="The corpse matches the description that Leryssa gave you of William Allerton. Oddly enough, there are no bite or claw marks on him."}
Q[11600]={d="威廉的脖子似乎是被某样十分锋利的刀刃砍断了。\n\n经过仔细调查之后，你又发现了一条可以带给莉蕾萨的消息——你发现了一张写有威廉·奥雷顿姓名的征兵通知书。",dEN="William's neck has been cut by a sharp object.\n\nFurther inspection reveals a single clue to bring to Leryssa - an enlistment card bearing the name of William Allerton.",o="将征兵通知书交给北风苔原无畏要塞中的莉蕾萨。",oEN="Bring the Enlistment Card to Leryssa at Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra.",p="你和威廉谈过了吗，<name>？",pEN="You spoke to William, <name>?",c="你认为威廉是被天灾军团随意杀死的吗？事情太可疑了。\n\n这一定有什么内幕。我们要找到萨萨里安。",cEN="Do you think William's death was a random killing by the Scourge? Things sure seem fishy.\n\nSomething's up. We must find Thassarian."}
Q[11601]={d="可怜的奥雷顿先生或许能帮助我们找到我的哥哥。\n\n<莉蕾萨拿出一本十分厚重的卷册翻查起来，看起来似乎是军队的征兵花名册。>\n\n好吧，这东西是我“借”来的，行吗，借来的！我们来看看，那张征兵通知书上有日期吗？\n\n威廉说他在征兵册上看到了萨萨里安的名字，这么说他们俩的名字应该离得不远，不远……啊啊，有了！\n\n他被编入了……山字营？联盟其它所有的军队单位都是以城镇的名字命名的。\n\n这个山字营……里面都是谁？他们驻扎在哪儿？看来我们得打探些小道消息了。去看看旅馆老板那边有没有听说过这些事情。",dEN="Poor Mr. Allerton might yet help us find my brother.\n\n<Leryssa unveils a voluminous book, not unlike an army recruitment ledger.>\n\nI borrowed it, ok? Let's see, does that enlistment card have a date?\n\nWilliam saw Thassarian at the enlistment line. Their entries must be near each other... here it is!\n\nHe was assigned to... Unit S? All the other military units are named after Alliance towns.\n\nWho's in the unit? Where are they deployed? We need rumors. See if the innkeeper's heard anything.",o="与无畏要塞旅店里的詹姆斯·迪肯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to James Deacon at the inn in Valiance Keep.",c="没法说我一定可以帮到你，朋友。不过我或许知道几个能够帮你的对象。",cEN="Can't say I can help you friend. But I might know someone who can."}
Q[11602]={d="对采石场的空中侦察显示，蛛魔把它们的卵存放在基地周围的脚手架上。这些家伙真聪明……它们把卵放在高处干燥的地方，远离冲突的中心。\n\n你得回到那里去找到那些卵。找到它们，砸碎它们，再把它们扔了。\n\n每摧毁一颗卵，就意味着少二十只蛛魔啃食我们的尸体。|n",dEN="Aerial reconnaissance of the quarry reports that the Nerubians are storing their eggs on the scaffolding surrounding the base. Smart beasts these are... They're keeping the eggs high and dry, away from the epicenter of conflict.\n\nYou're going to have to go back out there and track down their eggs. Find 'em, smash 'em, and trash 'em.\n\nEach egg destroyed means twenty less Nerubians feeding on our corpses.",o="战歌要塞的拉兹格尔大王要你摧毁10个尼鲁巴尔蛛卵簇。",oEN="Overlord Razgor at Warsong Hold wants you to destroy 10 Nerub'ar Egg Sacs.",p="你需要摧毁那些卵囊！",pEN="You need to destroy those egg sacs!",c="尽管我们竭尽全力，它们还是源源不断地涌来。总得有个了结，<name>。",cEN="They just keep on coming, despite our best efforts. Something's gotta give, <name>."}
Q[11603]={d="军队恐怕是科布恩那个老家伙一生中唯一牵挂和依赖的事物了。他退役之后也一直和军队保持着关系。\n\n将军的名字，每个支队、旅团、特遣队的编号与编制，这些东西他说起来那可真是如数家珍。他一定可以帮上你的忙。\n\n问题是，他的脑子有点不太好使了，性格也很孤僻。要是没有他最喜欢的库尔提拉斯葡萄酒，恐怕你根本没法跟他说上话，只有那种酒才能让他回到当初身为海军远征舰队一员的岁月。\n\n不过，我好几个月来都没有进过这种酒了。上次有一条从库尔提拉斯过来的商船在东北边的海岸触礁沉没了，不如你那里去碰碰运气吧，看看能不能给老科布恩捞上来一瓶两瓶的。",dEN="The military was all that old man Colburn had. After he retired, he still clung to it like a lifeline.\n\nHe knows the name of every general, unit, brigade, detachment... you name it. He's the man you need.\n\nProblem is, his mind is scarred. He won't talk to anyone unless he gets his Kul Tiras wine. Takes him back to the times he was a marine.\n\nI haven't received a shipment in months. The last merchant ship out of Kul Tiras sunk northeast of here. See if you can salvage a bottle to bring Colburn.",o="从无畏要塞东北方的船只残骸附近打捞一瓶库尔提拉斯葡萄酒，把它交给无畏要塞旅店里的老人科布恩。",oEN="Salvage a bottle of Kul Tiras Wine from the underwater shipwreck northeast of Valiance Keep and bring it to Old Man Colburn in the Valiance Keep inn.",p="<老人面无表情地抬起头看着你。>",pEN="<The old man looks up at you with a blank look on his face.>",c="嗯嗯嗯……不会太苦……不会太涩……就像过去的日子一样，和小伙子一起在兵营的日子。",cEN="Mmmmm... not too bitter... not too dry... it's just like the old days, with the lads at the barracks."}
Q[11604]={d="S 小队，S 小队……呃……这说不通……应该用某个城镇来命名才对……\n\n夜色镇的人被派去了龙骨荒野。闪金镇的小伙子们被派去了峡湾。我在哪儿听过……\n\n啊，对了……那个逃兵！兵营监狱里有个掉头跑的家伙，不久前刚被关进去。\"他说那个 S 代表自杀\"，一直念叨个没完。\"\n\n去找那个逃兵。他也许能给你一些情报。",dEN="Unit S... Unit S.... hmmmpph.... don't make any sense... it oughta be named after a town...\n\nDarkshire was sent to Dragonblight. The Goldshire boys were sent to the Fjord. Where did I hear...\n\nOh, yes... the deserter! There's a turn-tail in the barracks prison. Got thrown in not too long ago. Kept saying that \"S\" stood for suicide.\n\nLook for the deserter. He might have some information for you.",o="进入无畏要塞兵营内的监狱，与关在那里的逃兵谈一谈。",oEN="Find the prison inside Inner Hold in Valiance Keep and speak to the deserter.",c="你要干嘛？我问题已经够多了！",cEN="Whad'ya want? I have enough problems as it is!"}
Q[11605]={d="<当你凝视着那座石像时，一个遥远的声音在你脑海中回响。>\n\n别害怕，$gforastero:forastera;。我是长者阿特卡诺克，海象人一族古老的长者，生前是个技艺娴熟的工匠，数百年来一直是这座采石场的守护者。\n\n采石场被侵占了，许多雕像尚未完工，而祖先的灵魂则在世间游荡。你愿意帮我纠正这一切吗？\n\n首先，我必须知道那些游荡祖先的名字。去雕像附近寻找标记。",dEN="<A distant voice echoes in your head as you regard the stone statue.>\n\nDo not be startled, stranger. I am Elder Atkanok, an ancient ancestor of the tuskarr people, a skilled craftsman in my own time and the guardian of this quarry for centuries.\n\nThe quarry has been overrun, leaving many statues unfinished while the ancestors' spirits wander the world. Will you aid me in righting this wrong?\n\nFirst, I must know the names of these wandering ancestors. Look for the markers near their statues.",o="冷石采掘场外的长者阿特卡诺克要你找到长者克苏克、长者萨加尼和长者塔克勒特的石像。",oEN="Elder Atkanok outside Coldrock Quarry wants you to identify the statues of Elder Kesuk, Elder Sagani, and Elder Takret.",p="<遥远的声音重返脑海。>\n\n你找到这些先祖的名字了吗？",pEN="<The distant voice returns.>\n\nHave you recovered the names of the wandering elders?",c="<当你走近他的雕像时，长者阿特卡诺克的声音向你致意。>\n\n干得好，<name>。有了游荡长者的名字，我们就能继续举行袭击中被中断的仪式。不过，在长者的灵魂被引向他们的石像之前，我们必须安抚那些被杀害的工匠和萨满的灵魂。否则，祖先的灵魂可能永远听不到仪式的召唤。",cEN="<Elder Atkanok's voice greets you as you approach his statue.>\n\nWell done, <name>. With the names of the wandering elders, we can continue the ceremonies disrupted during the attack. However, before the elders' spirits can be led to their stones, we must calm the spirits of the murdered craftsmen and shaman. Otherwise, the ancestor spirits may never hear the ceremony's call."}
Q[11606]={d="我们可以杀死我们见到的每一只蛛魔，摧毁我们找到的每一枚卵，但是只有彻底炸毁它们修筑的隧道才能阻止这些家伙。那样的话，我们就需要大批弹药，可是大部分库存都让地精和铁匠们拿去制造攻城坦克和武器了。\n\n好在巨石采掘场有一批存货——就埋在层层叠叠的蛛魔排泄物下面。尽快替我取回一些来。",dEN="We can kill all the Nerubians that we see and destroy all the eggs that we find, but those things won't stop coming until we blow their tunnels and passageways up. Of course, we can't do that without some heavy grade munitions. Unfortunately, most of our stockpile is being used up by the goblins and blacksmiths for our siege tanks and weaponry.\n\nWe do happen to have a pretty good supply of the stuff out in Mightstone Quarry - underneath all the Nerubian crap. You'll just have to go out and get it for me.",o="战歌要塞的军需官霍尔古斯要你找回15箱战歌军需品。",oEN="Quartermaster Holgoth at Warsong Hold wants you to recover 15 crates of Warsong Munitions.",p="我们快没时间了，<class>。",pEN="We're running out of time here, <class>.",c="如果我没算错——虽然我常常算错——你会需要大概10—20个爆盐深水炸药。\n\n喔耶，你会将这些家伙击回它们的虫孔。",cEN="If my calculations are correct - and they're often not - you're gonna need about 10-20 seaforium depth charges.\n\nOh yea, you'll be planting these mothers into their sinkholes."}
Q[11607]={d="在采掘场里劳作的萨满祭司和工匠都在那次袭击中被杀害了，灵魂世界因此陷入混乱。除非我们能安抚被杀害的灵魂，否则就无法指引先祖之魂回到各自的家园。\n\n入侵者并未留意到灵魂的存在，他们的蓝玉猎犬却能有所感应并将灵魂禁锢起来。\n\n杀死那些蓝玉猎犬，利用残馀的能量释放被禁锢的无辜者的灵魂。",dEN="In the attack on the quarry, the shaman and craftsmen working here were slain. The violence threw the spirit world into utter chaos and we'll be unable to guide the ancestors home unless we find a way to soothe the spirits of the murdered.\n\nThe aggressors themselves pay no heed to the spirits, but their companions, the beryl hounds, sense the spirits and hold them in thrall.\n\nKill the beryl hounds, and using the raw energy left behind, break the imprisonment of the spirits of the innocent.",o="冷石采掘场外的长者阿特卡诺克要你释放3名卡斯卡拉工匠和3名卡斯卡拉萨满祭司的灵魂。",oEN="Elder Atkanok, on the outskirts of Coldrock Quarry, wants you to free the spirits of 3 Kaskala Craftsmen and 3 Kaskala Shaman.",p="这些无辜的灵魂好吗？",pEN="How fare the spirits of the innocent?",c="我能感觉到灵魂世界的动荡开始平息。你做得很好，<name>。祖先的灵魂很幸运能在这危难时刻得到你的帮助。",cEN="I can sense the upheaval in the spirit world beginning to calm. You have done well, <name>. The spirits of the ancestors are fortunate to have your help in this time of need."}
Q[11608]={d="东，南，西，北。在这座要塞周围的巨石采掘场内分布着四个尼鲁巴尔虫孔。\n\n<霍尔古斯递给你一只包裹。>\n\n$n，别掉以轻心。一个不小心，你就会被炸得灰飞烟灭。\n\n里面装着高能爆盐炸药。将它们塞进那些尼鲁巴尔虫孔，如果顺利的话，应该能摧毁它们的隧道。\n\n快去吧！",dEN="North, south, east and west. Those are the locations that you should be concerned about. Surrounding this fortress, within Mightstone Quarry, are four perfectly situated Nerub'ar sinkholes.\n\n<Holgoth hands you a bundle.>\n\nBe very careful with that package, <name>. Mishandle it and you'll be dog meat.\n\nInside the bundle are seaforium depth charges. Get to each of those Nerub'ar sinkholes and plant a depth charge at their center point. If all goes well, the tunnels will collapse.\n\nGet a move on!",o="战歌要塞的军需官霍尔古斯要你利用高能爆盐炸药包摧毁要塞东西南北四个方向的尼鲁巴尔虫孔。",oEN="Quartermaster Holgoth at Warsong Hold wants you to use the Seaforium Depth Charge Bundle to destroy the Nerub'ar sinkholes to the south, east, west and north of Warsong Hold.",p="如何？",pEN="Well?",c="那会阻止它们的——至少我认为能阻止它们。不管怎样，你已经尽到了你的本分。一个<race>还能要求什么呢，对吧？",cEN="That'll stop 'em - at least I think it'll stop 'em. Either way, you've done your part. That's all an <race> can ask for, no?"}
Q[11609]={d="被杀害的工匠和萨满祭司的灵魂已经重获自由，我们可以继续先前被打断的仪式了。你必须以海象人萨满祭司的身份来主持仪式，这样的话你就需要一套仪式必备的道具。\n\n没时间打造新的了，你不妨在采掘场中仔细搜寻，说不定能找到在战乱中遗落的道具。$n，小心点，它们都是上百年的古器。你可能得从入侵者手中夺回这些器物。",dEN="With the spirits of the murdered craftsmen and shaman at rest, the way is clear for us to complete the ceremonies interrupted by the attack. You must perform a role traditionally reserved for a tuskarr shaman, and you must possess all the necessary ritual items.\n\nThere is no time to craft new ones, so you will need to scour the quarry for those left by the victims of the attack. Handle these objects with care, <name>, for some are centuries old. You may need to wrest them from the hands of the invaders.",o="将6个海象人仪式道具交给冷石采掘场外的长者阿特卡诺克。",oEN="Bring 6 Tuskarr Ritual Objects to Elder Atkanok, who stands outside Coldrock Quarry.",p="你找回了一整套的仪式物品吗？",pEN="Have you recovered a full set of ritual items?",c="<Sostienes los objetos ante la estatua del Anciano Atkanok>\n\n这些够用了，虽然它们的状态很糟糕。其中一些历经了数百年的使用，最终却被野蛮人砸坏抢走。",cEN="<You hold the objects before the statue of Elder Atkanok.>\n\nThose will suffice, although they are in a sad state. Some of them have survived centuries of use, only to be battered and stolen by barbarians."}
Q[11610]={d="在你的帮助下，先祖之魂总算有机会重返家园了，卡斯卡拉工匠和萨满祭司精心雕凿的石像便是他们的安息之地。\n\n先前，指引先祖之魂的仪式被入侵者打断了，你必须继续完成那个仪式。带上你从采掘场找回的仪式道具，站在那些刻有先祖之魂名字的石像前，吟诵这首圣歌。\n\n<你的耳畔回荡着一曲艰涩难懂的歌，歌词却牢牢地印在你的脑海中。>",dEN="With your help, the ancestor spirits can now be guided to their rightful homes, the statues lovingly prepared by Kaskala's craftsmen and shaman.\n\nThe ceremonies for these ancestors were interrupted during the attack on the quarry, and you will need to complete them. Take with you the objects that you recovered from the quarry, stand in front of the statues with the name markers, and recite this chant.\n\n<Words in a strange language flood your head, but you have no difficulty recalling them.>",o="长者阿特卡诺克要你指引长者克苏克、长者萨加尼和长者塔克勒特的灵魂回到各自的石像中。",oEN="Elder Atkanok wants you to guide the spirits of Elder Kesuk, Elder Sagani, and Elder Takret to their stone monuments.",p="你替先祖们完成祭祀仪式了吗？",pEN="Have you completed the ceremonies for the ancestors?",c="祖先们找到了自己的雕像，这都得感谢你，<name>。卡斯卡拉的工匠们会回到采石场，确保祖先的血脉延续不断。至于我们，祖先们会继续饶有兴致地注视着你，因为你的道路似乎才刚刚开始。",cEN="The ancestors have found their statues, and they have you to thank, <name>. The craftsmen of Kaskala will return to the quarry and ensure that the line of ancestors continues unbroken. For our part, the ancestors will continue to observe you with interest, as it seems your path is just beginning."}
Q[11611]={d="<莫尔图斯叹了口气。>\n\n苦工……也许我们该立个牌子，请蛛网怪免费吃一顿。\n\n你看，苦工的问题在于：一、他们比穿溜冰鞋和芭蕾裙的豺狼人还蠢；二、他们比患风湿的侏儒还弱。当然，他们是第一批被天灾军团抓走的。\n\n这让我有点为难，你明白吗？没有苦工，体力活就停摆了。没有苦工，就没有建设。\n\n找到我的苦工并释放他们，$r。如果他们还活着，你会在巨石采石场各处发现他们被蛛网缠住。|n",dEN="<Mortuus sighs.>\n\nPeons... We may as well post up a sign offering the Nerub'ar a free meal.\n\nSee, the problem with a peon is that: (1) they're dumber than dirt; and (2) they're weaker than a leper gnome. Of course they're the first to be taken by the Scourge!\n\nThis puts me in a bit of a predicament, you see. Without peons, manual labor comes to a halt. No peons, no construction.\n\nFind and release my peons, <race>. If they're alive, you'll find 'em spun up in webbing throughout Mightstone Quarry.",o="战歌要塞的工头摩尔图斯要你释放5个战歌苦工。",oEN="Foreman Mortuus at Warsong Hold wants you to free 5 Warsong Peons.",c="大多数的苦工回来了。总之，只有比较聪明的几个才知道我们在巨大的铁石建筑里面……\n\n除此之外，做的太好了。我听说你把好几个苦工救了出来。\n\n喔，对，对啦，堡垒……嗯……上下都在讨论你。",cEN="Most of them made it back. The ones smart enough to know that we're inside the gigantic metal and stone building, anyway...\n\nRegardless, a job well done. I hear you sprung more than a couple peons loose.\n\nOh yes, you're the talk of the... um... fortress."}
Q[11612]={d="$c，很高兴见到你。我叫伊塔鲁克，曾经是冷石采掘场的一名工匠。\n\n在准备进行最后一次仪式时，我和同伴正在雕凿新的石像，突然发现空中飘来许多神秘的蓝色平台。\n\n平台着陆后，蜂拥而上的法师猎手就在采掘场中肆意杀戮。如果我们不加以阻止的话，他们就会摧毁所有的石像，卷走海象人的古器。你愿意帮我击败入侵者吗？",dEN="You're a welcome sight, <class>. My name is Etaruk, and I used to be a craftsman here at the Coldrock Quarry.\n\nMy companions and I were preparing a new set of statues for their last set of rites when we saw those mysterious blue platforms come flying over the plateau.\n\nWhen they landed, the mages they carried swarmed the quarry, murdering my fellows and plundering the quarry. If we don't stop them, they'll destroy our statues and make off with our artifacts. Will you help me defeat the invaders?",o="冷石采掘场入口附近的伊塔鲁克要你杀死12名蓝玉财宝猎人。",oEN="Etaruk, camped near the entrance to the Coldrock Quarry, wants you to kill 12 Beryl Treasure Hunters.",p="你开始骚扰矿场中的敌人了吗？",pEN="Have you started ridding the quarry of our enemies?",c="既然这些奇怪的法师知道卡斯卡拉的人民和他们的盟友不会轻易放弃采石场，我们就必须继续努力，彻底击败他们。\n\n我在卡斯卡拉的兄弟们也遭到了攻击，无法支援我们，但有你的帮助，<name>，我们就能战胜这些掠夺者。",cEN="Now that these strange mages know that the people of Kaskala and their allies will not give up the quarry so easily, we must maintain our efforts and defeat them completely.\n\nMy brothers in Kaskala have also come under attack and will not be able to support us, but with your help, <name>, we can overcome these pillagers."}
Q[11613]={d="他们称自己为“克瓦迪尔”。我们世代流传的某个传说就是与他们有关的；我们将他们称为“图克哈里克”——迷雾中的行者。\n\n就是这些迷雾中冒出来的巨人毁灭了我们的村庄，杀害了我身边的每一个人，其中还包括我的父亲埃鲁伊克。\n\n按照海象人的传统，我必须为我的亲人报仇。\n\n但我只是个渔夫，至今还没通过成年试炼……要我去和那些卑鄙的克瓦迪尔人正面对抗完全不可能啊。\n\n如果你能帮我履行这个责任的话，我会对你表示由衷的感激。",dEN="They call themselves the Kvaldir. My people have legends about them; we call them the tuk-hariq - walkers of the fog.\n\nMy village was destroyed by these giant mist-men. Everyone I knew was slain, including my father Ariut.\n\nBy tuskarr law I must seek retribution against those who shed my kin's blood.\n\nI am but a fisherman and I've not yet passed the test of manhood... I cannot stand toe-to-toe with the vile Kvaldir.\n\nIf you were to carry out my blood duty for me, I will be in great debt to you.",o="卡鲁克希望你杀死6个斯卡迪尔袭击者和5个斯卡迪尔船工。",oEN="Karuk wants you to slay 6 Skadir Raiders and 5 Skadir Longboatsmen.",p="你成功了吗，<race>？克瓦迪尔是残忍的战士。别指望他们会手下留情。",pEN="Did you succeed, <race>? The Kvaldir are cruel warriors. Do not expect any quarter from them.",c="你帮了我的人民一个大忙，<name>。不过，我还得再请求你一件事。",cEN="You've done my people a great favor, <name>. I must ask one more thing of you, however."}
Q[11614]={d="我们是奉瓦里玛萨斯的命令来到这里的！暗影密探的任务只有一个：刺探情报。当然，偶尔也会有一些暗杀任务。\n\n我手下最好的一个探子前几天失踪，我已经好几天没有得到他的消息了，恐怕最糟糕的情况已经发生了。不，我不是指死亡。死亡还算是个理想的结果。我担心他可能潜逃……甚至可能叛变了。\n\n他最后一次出现在是北边的巨石采掘场。他本该是去收集关于蛛魔的情报……去找到他。\n\n但愿他已经死了……",dEN="We are here by order of Varimathras! The mission of the Shadowstalkers is a simple one: spy. Well, spy with a little assassination on the side.\n\nOne of my best field agents has gone missing. I haven't heard from him in days, which has left me fearing the worst. No, not death! Death would be ideal. I fear he may have gone rogue... turned traitor even.\n\nHis last known location was northern Mightstone Quarry. He was gathering intelligence on the Nerubians. Find him.\n\nHe better be dead...",o="转至巨石采掘场寻找暗影密探卢瑟尔。",oEN="Find Shadowstalker Luther in Mightstone Quarry.",c="情况比死还严重……很怪的是，蛛魔并没有吃掉尸体。\n\n在一阵小心的检验后，你发现卢瑟的死是自己造成的——致命的毒药。很聪明。这样蛛魔就不会接近这个中毒的尸体。\n\n你注意到卢瑟手中握着一本日志。",cEN="It doesn't get much deader than this... Strangely, the Nerubians did not devour the corpse.\n\nAfter careful examination you see that Luther's death was self inflicted - deadly poison. Smart. Nerubians won't come near this toxic corpse.\n\nYou notice that Luther is holding a journal."}
Q[11615]={d="你快速翻阅日记，寻找着重要信息。在最后一页，你发现了一些非常潦草的文字：\n\n通灵领主。我估计至少有一打。\n\n西边的农场已经成了恐怖的天灾军团生产基地。\n\n数不清的牺牲者。\n\n我想他们已经发现我了。他们想要抓我。我不能被活捉。\n\n剧毒药丸。如果他们想吃我的话，一定会大吃一惊的。\n\n请把这些情报转交给巴尔苏斯。",dEN="You skim through the pages of the book, looking for anything of importance. On the last page you discover what appears to be frantic scribbling:\n\nNecrolords. At least a dozen by my count.\n\nFarms to west being used as some sort of horrible spawning glade for Scourge.\n\nRow upon row of victims.\n\nI think they're on to me. Made a dash for the hold. I won't be captured alive.\n\nDreadvenom hemotoxin. If they decide to bite into me, they'll be in for a surprise.\n\nTake this information back to Barthus.",o="把卢瑟尔的日记交给战歌要塞的暗影密探巴尔苏斯。",oEN="Take Luther's Journal to Shadowstalker Barthus at Warsong Hold.",p="他死了吗？",pEN="Is he dead?",c="<巴尔苏斯快速翻到日志的最后一页并开始阅读。>\n\n这是非常糟的消息。一定得马上向地狱咆哮报告。",cEN="<Barthus flips to the last page of the journal and begins reading.>\n\nThis is very bad news. Hellscream must be notified at once."}
Q[11616]={d="<巴尔苏斯把最后一页撕下并卷了起来。>\n\n立刻把它交给地狱咆哮！同时我会派一队斥候去侦察那些农场。\n\n务必要告诉地狱咆哮：我们需要增援。",dEN="<Barthus tears out the last page and rolls it up.>\n\nTake this to Hellscream at once! In the meantime, I'm going to send a team to scout out the farms.\n\nBe sure to tell Hellscream that we're going to need reinforcements.",o="把巴尔苏斯的便笺交给战歌要塞的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮。",oEN="Take Barthus's Note to Garrosh Hellscream at Warsong Hold.",p="打扰我是有什么重要的事吗？不要用没意义的事来烦我！",pEN="What is the meaning of this interruption? Do not burden me with nonsense!",c="<地狱咆哮看了日志页。>\n\n就这样吗？",cEN="<Hellscream reads the journal entry.>\n\nIs that all?"}
Q[11617]={d="你也留意到漂浮在采掘场上空那些蓝白色的平台了吧。它们原本是法师猎手空降到这里的交通工具，如今却被用于运送海象人的古器和石像残片。\n\n我们得在他们撤离采掘场之前阻止他们。\n\n采掘场的挖掘工都携带着炸药，利用它们来摧毁那三座浮空平台吧。他们的首领呆在降落在地面的那座平台上，我们待会再来对付他。",dEN="I'm sure you've seen those blue and white platforms hovering over the quarry. They're the transportation the mage hunters used to land their forces here, and now they're loading them up with our artifacts and fragments of our statues.\n\nWe must stop them before they leave the quarry.\n\nThe small creatures digging in the quarry carry explosives. Take them and use them to destroy the three floating platforms. The leader keeps watch from a fourth, grounded platform, but we'll deal with him afterward.",o="冷石采掘场外的伊塔鲁克要你摧毁北部平台、东部平台和西部平台。",oEN="Etaruk, outside the Coldrock Quarry, wants you to destroy the North Platform, the East Platform, and the West Platform.",p="你成功地摧毁了那些法师猎手的飞行平台吗？",pEN="Have you succeeded in destroying the mage hunters' flying platforms?",c="那些法师猎手会发现掠夺我们的矿场偷走我们的东西可没那么简单。有了你的帮助，我们可以夺回矿场，导正现在的情况。",cEN="The mage hunters won't find it as easy to plunder our quarry and steal our artifacts as they'd imagined. With your help, we'll win back the quarry and set things right again."}
Q[11618]={d="<地狱咆哮摇了摇头。>\n\n你显然没有意识到我们正在试图赢得一场战争，$r。我必须把所有兵力集中到主战场上，所以我无法给这些小规模的冲突地区调拨真正意义上的士兵。\n\n<地狱咆哮停下来想了想。>\n\n如果巴尔苏斯需要人手增援农场……\n\n<地狱咆哮拍了拍手。>\n\n……我会给他增援的！到西边向巴尔苏斯的刺客报告，告诉他们增援已经到了。",dEN="<Hellscream shakes his head.>\n\nYou may not have noticed that we're trying to win a war here, <race>. I need all available soldiers at the primary points of conflict. This means that we don't have any real soldiers to spare for these minor incursions.\n\n<Hellscream pauses to think.>\n\nIf Barthus wants reinforcements at the farm...\n\n<Hellscream claps his hands together.>\n\n...he shall have them! Report to Barthus's assassins at the farms, west of here. Let them know that reinforcements have arrived.",o="转至战歌要塞西边的战歌农场哨站，向暗影密探伊克里斯报到。",oEN="Seek out Shadowstalker Ickoris at the Warsong Farms Outpost west of Warsong Hold.",c="就这个？地狱咆哮只派来了一个<race> <boy/girl>？\n\n要是我还有下巴，它现在准掉到地上了。",cEN="This is it? Hellscream sent a single <race> <boy/girl>?\n\nIf I still had a jaw it would be on the floor right now."}
Q[11619]={d="我的父亲被这群匪徒的首领——残忍的贾梅尔杀害了。那个凶手就住在海滩上的山洞里。\n\n你已经解决了他的手下，去把他也结果了吧，$n。为我的父亲复仇，我会尽全力报答你的恩情。",dEN="My own father was slain by the leader of this raiding party, Gamel the Cruel. He has made his abode inside a cave on the beach.\n\nYou've dealt with his men already. Finish what you've started, <name>. Avenge my father and I will share with you what little I still have.",o="卡鲁克希望你转至裂鞭海岸，击败残忍的贾梅尔。",oEN="Karuk wants you to defeat Gamel the Cruel at Riplash Strand.",p="你击败加梅尔了吗，<race>？",pEN="Did you defeat Gamel, <race>?",c="你做到了，<name>！被杀害的海象人的灵魂现在可以安息了——他们的死已经得到了报仇！",cEN="You did it, <name>! The spirits of the slain tuskarr can now rest in peace - their deaths have been avenged!"}
Q[11620]={d="$r，我知道谁能解开这个谜团。有传言说克瓦迪尔将一名纳迦女祭司囚禁在海岸西边的神殿中。\n\n她肯定非常仇视那些不请自来的家伙。或许我的父亲也希望你们俩能合作吧。",dEN="There is someone who might shed light on this mystery, <race>. It is rumored that the Kvaldir have kept a naga priestess alive at the temple on the west side of the shore.\n\nShe will no doubt have great reason to resent her uninvited Kvaldir guests. Perhaps my father is expecting her to cooperate with you in some way.",o="转至裂鞭海岸的蛇鳞神殿寻找维赫亚。",oEN="Look for Veehja at the Shrine of Scales on Riplash Strand.",c="嘶嘶嘶嘶嘶嘶嘶！你是来嘲笑我的吗，<race>？",cEN="Hsssssssssssss! Have you come to mock me, <race>?"}
Q[11623]={d="馆长因萨维斯统领着入侵的法师猎手部队。海象人世代以狩猎海中和陆地上的野兽为生，但是我从未见过像馆长因萨维斯这样的家伙。\n\n他乘坐的飞行平台就停靠在采掘场的上层，监管着手下法师猎手实施抢劫。$n，我相信你就是先祖派来拯救我们的英雄，希望你能帮我将这帮入侵者永远逐出采掘场。",dEN="The leader of the mage hunter forces is a fearsome creature called Curator Insivius. My people have hunted the beasts of the seas and land for countless generations, but I've never seen anything like this curator before.\n\nHe's landed one of those flying disks on the upper rim of the quarry and oversees the operation from there. <name>, I can only believe the ancestors themselves sent you to my rescue and I hope you will help me drive the mage hunters from this quarry once and for all.",o="冷石采掘场入口附近的伊塔鲁克要你杀死馆长因萨维斯。",oEN="Etaruk, on the outskirts of the Coldrock Quarry, wants you to kill Curator Insivius.",p="你解决了监管者吗？",pEN="Have you done away with the curator?",c="馆长和他的手下一定以为采石场是块容易下手的肥肉，但你让他们知道了不是这样，<name>。我对你的帮助深表感激，我相信祖先们会继续看顾你。",cEN="The curator and his men must've thought the quarry an easy target for their looting, but you've shown them otherwise, <name>. I am deeply grateful for your help and I'm certain the ancestors will continue to watch over you."}
Q[11624]={d="我必须搞清楚我的导师——先知格雷姆沃克究竟出了什么事！\n\n他一直在犸格莫斯附近观察猛犸人的活动。就在刚才，有个随从狼狈地逃了回来。据说他们遭到了攻击，先知也被虏进了洞穴深处。\n\n在你动身转至危机四伏的犸格莫斯之前，我希望你能与元素之魂谈一谈，看能不能了解到更多情况。\n\n西边的埃德拉纳斯废墟中居住着一位名叫因波莉安的气元素，她很睿智，或许她能为你指引方向。",dEN="I must find out what happened to my master, Farseer Grimwalker!\n\nEarlier, he was observing the magnataur at nearby Magmoth. But one of his grunts just returned, saying that the group had been crushed, and that the farseer was dragged into the depths of the place.\n\nBefore I send you on a suicide mission, I wish to consult with the spirits to learn more.\n\nThere is an air elemental known as Imperean in the ruins of Eldra'nath to the west. She is wise and may give you the information we seek.",o="与埃德拉纳斯废墟的因波莉安谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Imperean at the Ruins of Eldra'nath.",c="你来这里真是愚蠢，小<race>。\n\n你在找什么？",cEN="You are foolish to come here, little <race>.\n\nWhat is it that you seek?"}
Q[11625]={d="五百年前，艾萨拉女王将一头名为利维洛斯的巨兽囚禁在裂鞭废墟的海底。现在，这帮野蛮的克瓦迪尔族人竟然想把它放出来！\n\n他们占领了我们的城市，将我的同胞当作祭品，企图唤醒利维洛斯！在杀光了纳迦之后，他们转而屠杀海象人。我要克瓦迪尔为此付出惨痛的代价！\n\n复仇之路相当漫长，不过我会帮你对付他们。克瓦迪尔的首领拉格纳就在裂鞭废墟的东北角，夺取他手中那柄金色的三叉戟，把它带来给我！",dEN="Five hundred years ago, Azshara imprisoned a being named Leviroth in the waters below. Now these barbarians seek to undo our queen's work!\n\nThey took over our city and began to sacrifice my brethren to awaken him! When they ran out of naga, they began to take tuskarr. Their spirits will know no peace!\n\nI will help you, for it will go a long way towards quelling my vengeance. Their captain, Ragnar, dwells deep inside northeastern Riplash. He has in his possession a golden trident. Bring it to me!",o="裂鞭海岸的维赫亚要你转至裂鞭废墟的东北角，杀死拉格纳·德拉卡伦并取回纳兹亚的三叉戟。",oEN="Veehja in Riplash wants you to go to the far northeastern end of the Riplash Ruins. Once there slay Ragnar Drakkarlund and obtain the Trident of Naz'jan from him.",p="你拿到了三叉戟吗？",pEN="Do you have the trident?",c="太好了！我们可以杀死克瓦迪尔的野兽了！我会让那些畜生知道，绝对不要招惹纳迦女祭司！",cEN="Yesssssss! We will slay the Kvaldir's beast! I will show these brutes to never cross a priestess of the scale!"}
Q[11626]={d="利维洛斯被囚禁时，拉伊·纳兹亚还是统治裂鞭海岸的帝王。艾萨拉女王在他的三叉戟上施放了祝福，一旦那头野兽逃脱，就可以用这件武器结束它的性命。\n\n$r，三叉戟就在你手中，让那些野蛮的家伙尝尝复仇的怒火吧。\n\n带着三叉戟潜入裂鞭海岸的水底深处，你可以在北边的冰山下面找到利维洛斯。\n\n我要你将三叉戟掷向利维洛斯，除掉这头野兽！然后呢，你从哪儿来的就滚回哪儿去，别让我再见到你。",dEN="Raj Naz'jan was the emperor of Riplash when Leviroth was imprisoned. Azshara herself blessed his trident so it would slay the beast should it ever escape.\n\nNow you wield it, <race>. As much as it disgusts me, I will have my revenge on these barbaric giant-men.\n\nTake the trident to the depths beneath Riplash. You will find Leviroth below an iceberg closest to northern Riplash.\n\nDrive the trident into his flesh and slay him! Return to whomever sent you when you're done; I wish to see no more of you.",o="潜入裂鞭废墟北部的海面下，在一座冰山下面找到利维洛斯，使用纳兹亚的三叉戟杀死它，然后返回裂鞭海岸的北边，向卡鲁克复命。",oEN="Find Leviroth in the waters below the iceberg floating among the northern edge of Riplash Ruins. Use the Trident of Naz'jan to slay him and return to Karuk to the north of Riplash Strand.",c="我族人的灵魂能够安息了。你帮我的父亲找回了荣耀……或许有一天我能像你一样强。",cEN="My people's spirits can rest in peace. You've helped me honor my father... perhaps I will one day be as strong as you are."}
Q[11627]={d="啊，你渴望的是情报，更确切地说，是你那位\"先知\"的下落和状况。他没能看得够远，避免降临到自己头上的麻烦。\n\n不过，我会给你获取这些知识的途径。但首先，你得替我办几件事。\n\n你肯定见过南边水火之间的争斗。沸煮一直在烧灼查恩的水池，他们已经争斗了好几个世纪。\n\n去焦灼高地和无霜之池，说服他们各自放下分歧。",dEN="Ah, it is information that you crave: the whereabouts and condition of your 'farseer'. He did not see so far as to avoid the trouble which befell him.\n\nNevertheless, I will give you the means to acquire the knowledge. But first, you will do some things for me.\n\nNo doubt you have seen the war between fire and water to the south. Simmer keeps boiling Churn's pool, and the two have been battling for ages.\n\nGo to the Charred Rise and Blistering Pool, and convince each of them to stop their bickering.",o="因波莉安要你用武力让西米尔和卓恩握手言和，完成任务后返回埃德拉纳斯废墟向她复命。",oEN="Imperean wants you to beat Simmer and Churn into submission. Return to her at the Ruins of Eldra'nath when they have submitted.",c="我很高兴，虽然他们两个一定会继续争吵一段时间。\n\n然而，在你回去找你们的灵语者之前，你还有一件事情要完成。",cEN="I am pleased, though no doubt they will still continue to quarrel a bit longer.\n\nHowever, there is something else that you will need to accomplish before you can return to your spirit talker."}
Q[11628]={d="东北方的圣城恩其拉是天灾军团在北风苔原的基地。天灾军团的指挥官从那里派出蛛怪大军将我们层层包围。\n\n如果只是一味地采取守势，我们迟早难逃一劫。在这样的危急关头，偏偏顾问们在战略问题上无法达成一致的意见。杜尔姆主张直接攻入敌阵，而先知埃恩雷则认为应该采取秘密行动。\n\n天灾军团的势力范围仍在不断扩张，这一带的生灵惨遭屠戮。埃恩雷说利用天灾猛犸的毛皮或许可以制作一件伪装用的衣服，以此混入圣城恩其拉。",dEN="To the northeast looms the Temple City of En'kilah, the Scourge's seat in Borean Tundra. From behind its walls, the Scourge commander has sent his Nerubians to surround us.\n\nRemaining on the defensive would doom my people, but my advisors differ in their strategies. Durm would charge in blindly, while Sage Aeire favors stealth.\n\nThe Temple City has blighted the nearby lands and the native creatures. Aeire believes the pelts of the scourged mammoths can serve as a cloak that may hide an infiltrator.",o="将5张天灾猛犸的毛皮交给牦牛村的冬风酋长。",oEN="Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village wants you to bring him 5 Scourged Mammoth Pelts.",p="你带回了猛犸皮吗？",pEN="Have you brought the mammoth pelts?",c="尽管我讨厌把这些东西带回村子里来，但我们可以利用它来对付我们的敌人。\n\n<酋长对先知埃恩雷做了一个手势，然后挥挥手让人将猛犸皮拿下去。>\n\n在她处理毛皮的时候，我们还需要另一样东西来制成隐匿披风。",cEN="As much as I dislike bringing such disease-ridden things into the village, they may give us an advantage over our foes.\n\n<The chieftain gestures to Sage Aeire and waves dismissively at the pelts.>\n\nWhile she is preparing the pelts, there is one other element we need to create the cloak."}
Q[11629]={d="既然你遵照我的吩咐办完了事，我自然会兑现自己的诺言。\n\n将这团精华交给博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬。如果她够聪明的话，就该懂得如何利用它来执行某种仪式，获知你想要的信息。",dEN="You have done what was asked, and now I give you that which you desire.\n\nDeliver this primal to the spirit talker back at your Bor'gorok Outpost. If she is wise, she will know a ritual to gain you the information which you seek.",o="将因波莉安的原始精华交给博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬。",oEN="Deliver Imperean's Primal to Spirit Talker Snarlfang at Bor'gorok Outpost.",p="<name>，你回来了。你打听到什么了？\n\n那是什么声音？",pEN="<name>, you have returned. What did you learn?\n\nWhat is that sound?",c="因波莉安把她自己的元神精华给了你？我可以听到她的哭号的风声了！\n\n我知道一种仪式，可以好好利用它。在她的元神精华开始斑驳以前，我们得加快脚步！",cEN="Imperean gave you a primal essence of herself? I can hear its howling winds!\n\nI know a ritual we can make use of it in. We must hurry before her primal rips itself apart!"}
Q[11630]={d="贤者艾瑞相信，用神庙城外的枯萎土地鞣制兽皮，她就能做出一件斗篷，让大多数天灾军团的爪牙忽略你的存在。她说你应当能$gdesapercibido:desapercibida;地融入其中。\n\n她最好没说错。这是我们收集情报、策划反击的唯一机会。\n\n你应该能在堡垒南面和西面的区域找到她需要的泥土。采集够了就带回来给我。",dEN="By curing the hides with the blighted earth outside the Temple City, Sage Aeire believes she can create a cloak which will cause most of the Scourge minions to ignore your presence. You should blend right in, she says.\n\nShe'd best be correct. It's our only chance to gather information and plan our counterattack.\n\nYou should be able to find the earth she needs poking in the areas to the south and west of the fortress. Bring it to me when you've finished gathering it.",o="将8块疫病土壤交给牦牛村的冬风酋长。",oEN="Bring 8 clods of Scourged Earth to Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village.",p="你拿到了先知埃恩雷要用来制作披风的材料吗？",pEN="Do you have the earth Sage Aeire needs to complete the cloak?",c="<冬风酋长谨慎地收下你收集到的土壤。>\n\n我们要尽快把这些交到先知埃恩雷的手上。\n\n<酋长咕哝着，好像没有受到那些疫病土壤的干扰。>\n\n我们永远也不知道天灾军团的指挥官什么时候会对村子发动最后的攻击。",cEN="<Chieftain Wintergale gingerly accepts the clods of soil you gathered.>\n\nWe should get these into Sage Aeire's hands as soon as possible.\n\n<The chieftain grunts, pretending not to be disturbed by the tainted dirt.>\n\nWe can never know when the Scourge commander will launch the final assault on the village."}
Q[11631]={d="$n，我将这团原始精华与你进行了同调。\n\n接下来，你要站在空气图腾面前，集中精神，头脑中只想着先知格雷姆沃克。\n\n风之魂无所不在，它一定能帮你捕捉到远方的景象。",dEN="Here, <name>, I've attuned the primal to you.\n\nOpen your soul to it in the presence of my totem of air and concentrate upon the fate of Farseer Grimwalker.\n\nThe spirit of the wind touches all; with any luck you will be granted a vision.",o="对斯纳尔芬的图腾使用因波莉安的原始精华来执行仪式，获取先知格雷姆沃克的消息。\n\n完成仪式后，与博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬谈一谈。",oEN="Use Imperean's Primal to perform a ritual at Snarlfang's Totem at Bor'gorok Outpost to gain information concerning Farseer Grimwalker.\n\nAfterward, speak with Spirit Talker Snarlfang.",p="等你觉得你已经看得足够，将元神带回来给我。",pEN="When you feel that you have seen enough, return the primal to me.",c="他们束缚了他的灵魂。<name>，我们必须终结他的折磨！\n\n你必须深入玛格莫斯的腹地，找到释放他的办法！",cEN="They've shackled his spirit. <name>, we have to put an end to his torture!\n\nYou must descend into the bowels of Magmoth and find a way to free him!"}
Q[11632]={d="你拿起了收割者伊斯里克斯的甲壳碎片，并意识到这只是一个开始。即使是在此时此刻，你依然感到胜利是那么短暂。显然巫妖王还控制着成千上万像伊斯里克斯这样的野兽，随时准备向部落发动攻势。\n\n带着你的战利品去见战歌要塞的萨鲁法尔大王，他会对你战胜了这个强大的天灾首领的事感兴趣的。",dEN="You hold the carapace fragment of Ith'rix the Harvester and realize that this is only the beginning. Even now you sense that victory is fleeting. Surely the Lich King has a thousand more beasts like Ith'rix, waiting to be unleashed upon the Horde.\n\nTake your trophy and present it to High Overlord Saurfang, inside Warsong Hold. He should be notified of your victory over a powerful Scourge agent.",o="带着伊斯里克斯的甲壳去见战歌要塞的萨鲁法尔大王。",oEN="Take Ith'rix's Hardened Carapace to High Overlord Saurfang at Warsong Hold.",p="你拿的是什么？",pEN="What have you got there?",c="<萨鲁法尔咧嘴一笑。>\n\n看起来很眼熟……卡利姆多之力在希利苏斯的沙漠里踩死过上千只这样的虫子。\n\n这里是个不同的地方——不同的环境——但结果会是一样的。\n\n<萨鲁法尔上下打量你。>\n\n你会在诺森德为部落带来骄傲与荣耀，<name>。\n\n<萨鲁法尔点了点头。>",cEN="<Saurfang grins.>\n\nIt looks familiar... The Might of Kalimdor trampled a thousand bugs like this one in the desert of Silithus.\n\nThis is a different place - a different environment - but the result will be the same.\n\n<Saurfang looks you over.>\n\nYou will bring pride and honor to the Horde in Northrend, <name>.\n\n<Saurfang nods.>"}
Q[11633]={d="先知埃恩雷做好了披风，你带上它转至圣城恩其拉吧。进入敌方基地后就穿上披风，它可以蒙蔽大多数天灾军团的爪牙。这是收集敌人的防御部署情报以及首领信息的大好机会。\n\n你的任务是侦察圣城中的三座尖塔。记住，虽然大多数天灾军团爪牙难以察觉你的行踪，恩其拉憎恶却能识破这件伪装。",dEN="Sage Aeire has finished the shroud. Take it with you and travel to the Temple City of En'kilah. Don the cloak within the city's bounds to hide yourself from most of the Scourge there. This will be our best opportunity to gather information about the enemy's fortifications and leaders.\n\nWhile wearing the cloak, scout the three large spires on the grounds of the city. While the shroud will shield you from most of the Scourge, the En'kilah abominations will be able to find you if you get too close.",o="牦牛村的冬风酋长要你穿上魔法天灾外衣进入圣城恩其拉，侦察鲜血尖塔、苦痛尖塔和凋零尖塔。",oEN="Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village wants you to wear the Imbued Scourge Shroud in the Temple City of En'kilah and scout the Spire of Blood, the Spire of Pain, and the Spire of Decay.",p="你完成对恩其拉的侦查工作了吗？",pEN="Have you finished scouting the temples in the Scourge's fortress?",c="<冬风酋长倾听着你的汇报。>\n\n你所收集的情报对我们突袭圣城的计划很有帮助。我们得找出方法击败你发现的首脑并攻进大墓地。",cEN="<Chieftain Wintergale listens as your describe your observations.>\n\nThe information you've gathered will help us to plan our assault on the Temple City. We'll need to find a way to defeat the officers you identified and get into that necropolis."}
Q[11634]={d="$n，你非常强大，我认为你的才能可以在别处得到更大的施展空间，比如，你可以去解决这一系列见鬼问题的根源！\n\n<拉兹格尔指了指西边。>\n\n一千多天灾军团士兵，外加至少四座重装浮空城，谁知道还有什么其它见鬼玩意没有。\n\n但是，你要把它们都搞定……对，看我的口型，把它们都搞定。你要去把那群正在敲打城门的亡灵都给干掉。\n\n到战歌要塞顶楼去找驭风大师图波尔报到吧，他在等着你呢。",dEN="You're a tough mother, <name>. I think your talents are better suited elsewhere - like the root of the whole damn problem!\n\n<Razgor points to the west.>\n\nA thousand Scourge, at least four full sized floating death machines and who knows what else.\n\nBut you're gonna find out and then you're gonna handle it... That's right, you're gonna beat the hell out of the Scourge army that's currently beating down our door.\n\nGet to the top of Warsong Hold and report to Wind Master To'bor. He'll be expecting you.",o="向战歌要塞的驭风大师图波尔报到。",oEN="Report to Wind Master To'bor at Warsong Hold.",c="是，老兄。我正等着你。\n\n<托波尔指着西方。>\n\n看一眼。越过了那片冻土荒原就是死亡，老兄……死亡。",cEN="Ay, mon. I been expectin' you.\n\n<To'bor points west.>\n\nTake a peek. Across dat tundra be death, mon... death."}
Q[11635]={d="你必须转至东边的犸格莫斯。\n\n你必须深入猛犸人的洞穴。\n\n你必须与先知格雷姆沃克的灵魂交谈！",dEN="You must go to Magmoth to the east.\n\nYou must descend into the depths of their caverns.\n\nYou must speak with Farseer Grimwalker's spirit!",o="进入犸格莫斯，与先知格雷姆沃克的灵魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Farseer Grimwalker's Spirit inside of Magmoth.",c="谢谢你让我喘口气，<class>。要是我真正的自由也能这么容易得到就好了。",cEN="Thank you for the reprieve, <class>. If only my true freedom were so easy to attain."}
Q[11636]={d="坦克，$gmon:mon;。我说的是攻城机械！我们在西海岸的加尔鲁什登陆点驻扎了重型坦克。我们要把你送进坦克里，用坦克给天灾军团一点部落的正义！\n\n唯一麻烦的是怎么把你弄过去。用我们的御风者送你，门儿都没有。太冒险了。\n\n看到那边那个小精灵了吗？那个金发精灵？他叫亚尼，$gmon:mon;。他能安全地把你送到海岸。到了那里，去找食尸者加奇。",dEN="Tanks, mon. I be talkin' bout siege machines! We got heavy tanks stationed at Garrosh's Landing on da west coast. We gonna get you to da tank and you gonna use da tank to lay down some Horde justice on da Scourge!\n\nDa only tricky part be getting' you der. No way we be sendin' you on our wind riders. Too risky.\n\nYou see dat pixie o'er der? Dat blondie elf? Yanni be his name, mon. He can get you to da coast, safely. Once der, talk to Gorge da Corpsegrinder!",o="与战歌要塞的亚尼谈一谈，让他把你安全地送往海滩边。到达加尔鲁什码头后去找碾压者格尔基。",oEN="Talk to Yanni at Warsong Hold to arrange safe travel to the coast. Speak to Gorge the Corpsegrinder once you arrive at Garrosh's Landing.",c="对死者绝不留情！\n\n在地狱咆哮认定海岸\"已判死刑\"之后，没人有胆子留下来守卫我们光荣的坦克。这里大体上还算安静，因为天灾军团正在列队准备进攻战歌要塞。偶尔会有落单的僵尸或食尸鬼晃过来，但它们活不久。\n\n<加奇抚摸着斧头。>\n\n当然，还有那雾……\n\n<加奇打了个寒颤。>",cEN="NO MERCY FOR THE DEAD!\n\nNone of 'em had the guts to stay behind to defend our glorious tanks after Hellscream deemed the coast 'condemned.' It's mostly quiet here, seein' as how the Scourge are formin' up ranks to assault Warsong Hold. Sometimes I get a stray zombie or ghoul, but they don't last very long.\n\n<Gorge strokes his axe.>\n\n'Course, there's the mist...\n\n<Gorge shudders.>"}
Q[11637]={d="猛犸人杀掉我的随从后，就将我拖到洞穴中当作祭品杀害了。执行仪式的北地狗头人名叫卡加尼舒。\n\n虽然你消灭了他手下的萨满祭司，但是我的灵魂依然被禁锢在这里。卡加尼舒将我的躯体制成了物像，我的灵魂因此受到羁绊，无法获得自由。他还利用这尊物像窃取我所掌握的萨满祭司教义。\n\n你必须从他手中夺得物像，并对我的灵魂使用它。卡加尼舒就在附近的洞穴中。\n\n记住，只有这样我才能重获自由。",dEN="After my small force of grunts were killed, I was dragged down here and ritually murdered. The snobold who did this is known as Kaganishu.\n\nThough you have vanquished his shaman helpers, my spirit is still tethered to this place. After he slew me, he created a fetish from my body, which anchors me here. Kaganishu is using it to learn all that I know of shamanism.\n\nYou must retrieve the fetish from him and use it upon my spirit. Kaganishu is nearby in the caves.\n\nOnly then will I truly be free.",o="夺得卡加尼舒的神像，对先知格雷姆沃克的残骸使用它。\n\n然后将物像还给滞留在犸格莫斯内的先知格雷姆沃克的灵魂。",oEN="Retrieve Kaganishu's Fetish and use it upon Farseer Grimwalker's Remains.\n\nYou will need to give the fetish to Farseer Grimwalker's Spirit inside of Magmoth.",p="快点，<class>，趁还来得及，对我用那个神像。",pEN="Hurry, <class>, use the fetish upon me before it is too late.",c="我自由了。谢谢你，<name>。\n\n而现在，我还有一个最后的请求。",cEN="I am freed. Thank you, <name>.\n\nAnd now, I have one final request of you."}
Q[11638]={d="$n，我的灵魂已经重获自由，请你将我的遗体交给灵语者斯纳尔芬。喏，我的躯壳就躺在地上。\n\n我最后一次看见灵语者是在西边的博古洛克前哨站，我想她应该还在那里吧。",dEN="<name>, now that my spirit has been freed would you do me the honor of returning my remains to Spirit Talker Snarlfang? They lay upon the ground beneath me.\n\nI sense that the spirit talker is still at Bor'gorok Outpost to the west where last I saw her.",o="将先知格雷姆沃克的遗骸交给北风苔原博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬。",oEN="Deliver Farseer Grimwalker's Remains, which are resting below his spirit, to Spirit Talker Snarlfang at Bor'gorok Outpost.",p="你比我预期的还要早回来。你知晓了什么？",pEN="You return sooner than I expected. What did you learn?",c="感谢你从卡加尼舒手上解放了他的灵魂，并将他的遗骸拿回来。我们没有什么能奖赏你的，如果有什么你中意的就拿去吧。\n\n那么现在，我要将他回归到他所该去的地方。",cEN="Thank you for freeing his spirit from Kaganishu and returning with his remains. We have little to reward you with, but you may take whatever catches your eye.\n\nAnd now, I will return him to the living where he belongs."}
Q[11639]={d="大王禁止萨满祭司为我疗伤。他让我好好反省，从失败中吸取教训。\n\n但是，你愿意替我和那些葬身犸格莫斯的伙伴报仇吗？\n\n我听说你答应了灵语者的请求，正要去那里营救先知。\n\n犸格莫斯就在东边。$c，去吧……杀掉猛犸人和他们的狗头人仆从，为了博古洛克前哨站的荣耀而战！",dEN="The overlord refuses to allow the shaman to heal my wounds. He says that it will be a good lesson for me and give me time to reflect upon my failure.\n\nBut you could get revenge for me and the others who fell at Magmoth!\n\nI know that the spirit talker wants you to go in there to save the farseer.\n\nIt's just to the east. Go, <class>... go slay the magnataur and their snobold servants. Regain the outpost's honor!",o="杀死10个犸格莫斯萨满祭司、5个犸格莫斯劫掠者、3个犸格莫斯碾压者和3个犸格莫斯雷加的配偶。然后博古洛克前哨站，向奥尔托什复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Magmoth Shaman, 5 Magmoth Foragers, 3 Magmoth Crushers, and 3 Mates of Magmothregar. Then, return to Ortrosh at Bor'gorok Outpost.",p="Lok'tar，<class>。你不可能在这么短的时间里杀光玛格莫斯的所有东西！",pEN="Lok'tar, <class>. You could not possibly have slain everything at Magmoth in such a short time!",c="亡者因你的所作所为而得到荣耀，<name>。\n\n<El orco herido asiente y exhala lentamente>\n\n也许现在我能找回曾经的那个战士了。",cEN="The dead are honored by your actions, <name>.\n\n<The wounded orc nods and exhales slowly.>\n\nPerhaps now I can find my way back to being the warrior I once was."}
Q[11640]={d="从你收集到的情报来看，那些地位较高的军官，也就是所谓的高阶祭司，在三座尖塔中指挥着天灾军团的军事行动。他们手中肯定有进入浮空城、面见最高统领的通行证。\n\n如果不能一举消灭他们的首脑，天灾军团的爪牙就会源源不断地朝我们的村落涌来。尽管杜尔姆迫切地想要与敌人开战，但是我不能将村落的防御力量全部抽调走。$n，杀死高阶祭司的任务就交给你了，把他们的卷轴带回来给我。",dEN="Within the spires you described dwell the main lieutenants of the Scourge leader, the high priests. Not only do they command the Scourge forces, but they hold the key to the necropolis above, and their master.\n\nAn endless stream of Scourge minions will overrun us if we can't find and defeat their leader. I cannot leave my people defenseless, however much Durm might want to bring the fight to the enemy. It falls to you, <name>, to slay the high priests and take the scrolls they hold.",o="将高阶祭司纳菲塞特的卷轴、高阶祭司塔雷坎的卷轴和高阶祭司安多拉斯的卷轴交给牦牛村的冬风酋长。",oEN="Bring High Priest Naferset's Scroll, High Priest Talet-Kha's Scroll, and High Priest Andorath's Scroll to Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village.",p="如果我们要穿过天灾军团的领地，我们一定得进入圣城为村民清出一条路。",pEN="We must get into that necropolis if we're to break through the Scourge and clear a path for the villagers.",c="<El jefe Wintergale lee las palabras escritas en los pergaminos>\n\n「Shabtir bakh sokhen。」\n\n这是蛛魔使用的古老而粗粝的语言，而且用在这里恰如其分。\n\n「仆从向主人的权威低头。」这就是让你进入那座通灵塔的词句。",cEN="<Chieftain Wintergale reads the words written on the scrolls.>\n\n'Shabtir bakh sokhen.'\n\nWords of the ancient, harsh language used by the Nerubians, and apt ones at that.\n\n'The servant bows to the master's authority.' These are the words that will gain you entry into the necropolis."}
Q[11641]={d="从一开始我就建议冬风酋长召集一批骁勇善战的战士向敌人的基地发动猛攻，但是他根本听不进我的劝告。事实证明，他宁愿执行先知埃恩雷的计划，谨慎地采取行动。\n\n我决定不再苦苦空等了。如果冬风酋长这个懦弱的家伙不敢派兵上阵，或许你能让他明白直接开战就能取得胜利。$n，进入圣城恩其拉，杀掉所有胆敢阻挠你前进的敌人。",dEN="From the beginning, I've counseled that Chieftain Wintergale should assemble our mighty warriors and attack our enemy at their base. My advice has fallen on deaf ears and he has proven that he'd rather tip-toe around according to Sage Aeire's plans.\n\nI'll wait no longer. If Chieftain Wintergale is too cowardly to send our warriors into battle, perhaps you'd be willing to show him that a direct attack can succeed. Storm the Temple City of En'kilah and slay all in your path, <name>.",o="杀死15名恩其拉食尸鬼和5名恩其拉通灵师，然后返回牦牛村向杜尔姆·冰皮复命。",oEN="Slay 15 En'kilah Ghouls and 5 En'kilah Necromancers and report back to Durm Icehide at Taunka'le Village.",p="如果不是告诉我你成功了的话，就别来烦我。",pEN="Don't bother me unless you've come to report a successful mission.",c="你证明了你的无所畏惧。我相信你能成为一个很好的牦牛人盟友。我只希望酋长也能有同样的理解。\n\n幸好我们能有你这样一个盟友，能在天灾军团攻陷村庄之前撤离。",cEN="You have proven your fearlessness and demonstrated your prowess in combat. I believe you would make a fine taunka warrior. I only wish the chieftain had the same understanding.\n\nWe are fortunate to count you as an ally in our struggle to evacuate the village before it is overrun by the Scourge."}
Q[11642]={d="我们得让这些坦克重新运转起来！它们可不会自己修好。莫布会负责这些事。去问问他需要什么。也许你能在他终于把我逼得狂暴起来、把他那侏儒身板劈成两半之前，让他闭上嘴！\n\n我讨厌侏儒……",dEN="We need to get these tanks back up and runnin'! They ain't gonna fix themselves. Mobu's gonna be the one to handle that stuff. Talk to him and see what he needs. Maybe you can shut him up before he finally drives me into a berserker frenzy and I cleave his little gnome-sized frame in two!\n\nI hate gnomes...",o="与加尔鲁什码头的莫布谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Mobu at Garrosh's Landing.",c="你是新的坦克驾驶员吗，老兄？我觉得很好啊！我们只需要让这些东西重新动起来。是呀，你要是没开台坦克就上纳森平原去，我保证你马上死翘翘。",cEN="You're the new tank driver, buddy? Fine by me! We just need to get these things up and running again. Yea, you try to go out into the Plains of Nasam without a tank and you're as good as dead."}
Q[11643]={d="这些扳手没用，伙计。我需要我的气动坦克万能工具才能让这些东西运转起来！可惜我把它落在旧营地了，就在这个登陆点的另一边。就是马厩旁边那间破棚屋。你得去帮我取回来，因为我打死也不会靠近那雾。哦对了，小心那雾。就是那雾毁了这些海岸。|n",dEN="These wrenches are useless, buddy. I need my pneumatic tank transjigamarig to get these things up and running! Unfortunately, I left it at my old digs, on the other side of this landing. It's the beat down hut next to the stables. You're gonna have to go and get it for me, because I sure as hellfire am not going to go anywhere near the mist.\n\nOh yea, buddy, watch out for the mist. The mist is what tore up these shores.",o="北风苔原回音海岸的莫布要你取回他的气动坦克万能工具。|n",oEN="Mobu at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to recover his Pneumatic Tank Transjigamarig.",p="你找到了气动式坦克外钻模夹具吗？",pEN="Did you find the P.T.T.?",c="干得好，老兄！咦，我把备用零件放哪去了……",cEN="Great work, buddy! Now where'd I put those spare parts..."}
Q[11644]={d="我需要大量金属来修补坦克装甲上的损伤！从加尔鲁什码头到海湾底部，到处都散布着超高强度的金属板。\n\n不过，收集这些金属的时候你千万要小心。这片雾……嗯……它有攻击性！这片雾甚至摧毁了码头与附近的一处海象人小镇。可怜的海象人……",dEN="I need metal to patch these tanks up! Super strong metal plates can be found scattered about all across Garrosh's Landing and at the bottom of the bay.\n\nJust be careful when you're out there searching for plates. The mist is... um... AGGRESSIVE! The mist is what took out the landing and the adjoining tuskarr town. Poor little tuskarr...",o="回音海岸的莫布要求你收集10块超强度金属板。",oEN="Mobu at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to collect 10 Super Strong Metal Plates.",p="记住，迷雾不是好东西！",pEN="Remember, the mist is bad!",c="干得漂亮，兄弟！咦，我把气动式坦克外钻模夹具放哪去了。",cEN="Great work, buddy! Now where'd I put that pneumatic tank transjigamarig."}
Q[11645]={d="那些肮脏的北地狗头人……竟然偷光了我的补给箱！\n\n你没见过北地狗头人？他们长得跟狗头人似的，对猛犸人唯命是从，十足的奴才样。想想就恶心！\n\n有谁愿意帮帮我吗？我真是蠢到家了，竟然将补给箱随手堆在机场北边，还以为那里很安全。\n\n不如你往北边走一趟，如果你能从犸格莫斯取回我的补给箱，我就赏你一笔金子！",dEN="Those dirty, stinkin' snobolds... they stole all of my supplies!\n\nWhat's a snobold you ask? It's like a kobold, 'cept they serve the magnataur; kinda take care of them. I know, weird!\n\nAnywho, wanna help me out? I know the little creeps stole off with all of my stuff. Stupid me thinkin' that it'd be nice and safe, packed up on the north side of the airstrip.\n\nWhy don'tcha do me a favor and head north to their stupid Magmoth. There's a cash reward if you bring all my stuff back quick!",o="将10箱机灵鬼的货物交给菲兹兰克机场的机灵鬼沃比斯波基。",oEN="Retrieve 10 boxes of Crafty's Stuff and return them to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="我的东西都拿齐了吗，<class>？没有我全部的装备，我什么都干不了！",pEN="Ya got all of my supplies, <class>? I just can't do ANYTHING without all of my stuff!",c="哦，<name>，你最棒了！\n\n这是答应你的报酬。",cEN="Oh, <name>, you're just the best!\n\nHere's your coin as promised."}
Q[11646]={d="$n，别浪费时间，仔细听好了。\n\n囚犯很快就会在法师塔中接受审讯。如果他不肯合作的话，我们就需要你的帮助。\n\n转至囚禁他的法师塔，跟图书馆员诺曼提斯说，你是我派去的帮手。",dEN="Listen closely, <name>, for there is not a moment to spare.\n\nYour prisoner is being prepared for interrogation here in our tower. In the event that he is less than forthcoming, your assistance may be required.\n\nMake your way up to where he is being detained and tell Librarian Normantis that I've sent you to assist him.",o="多纳森要你帮助琥珀崖法师塔中的图书馆员诺曼提斯。",oEN="Donathan ordered you to offer your assistance to Librarian Normantis in the mage tower on Amber Ledge.",c="多纳森派你来是明智之举，<class>。\n\n事实证明，我需要一个肯瑞托之外的人。",cEN="It was wise of Donathan to send you, <class>.\n\nAs it turns out, I am in need of someone outside the Kirin Tor."}
Q[11647]={d="$n，圣城恩其拉中安置了几口瘟疫之锅，这件事让我很是担忧啊。冬风酋长对你收集到的情报以及对局势做出的判断深信不疑。既然你能帮助酋长执行他的计划，能不能也帮我解除瘟疫之锅的威胁呢？\n\n这根图腾可以起到中和瘟疫之锅的作用，你必须在锅的附近使用它。每摧毁一口瘟疫之锅，我们离胜利就更近了一步。",dEN="The presence of plague cauldrons within the Temple City of En'kilah worries me greatly, <name>. It's clear that Chieftain Wintergale trusts your judgment and your knowledge of our enemy. Would you help me deal with the cauldrons as you help the chieftain carry out his plans in the Temple City?\n\nI've prepared a totem which will attack and neutralize the contents of the cauldrons. All you must do is locate the cauldrons and use the totem near each. Each Scourge weapon we destroy brings us closer to victory.",o="牦牛村的先知埃恩雷要你利用她的图腾来中和圣城恩其拉中的东部瘟疫之锅、中部瘟疫之锅和西部瘟疫之锅。",oEN="Sage Aeire at Taunka'le Village wants you to use her totem to neutralize the East Cauldron, the Central Cauldron, and the West Cauldron in the Temple City of En'kilah.",p="你对每一个天灾之锅都使用了图腾吗？",pEN="Have you used the totem on all the plague cauldrons?",c="<先知埃恩雷从你手中接过图腾。>\n\n图腾有效吗？图腾上所使用的上古魔法，先知们已经有许多个世代不曾使用了，所以传承下来的知识只有一小部分。",cEN="<Sage Aeire accepts the totem from you.>\n\nDid the totem work? Its preparation required ancient magics the sages haven't used in generations. Of all the knowledge passed down, only a fraction of it remains in use today."}
Q[11648]={d="你在这里真是幸运，$r。\n\n你看，肯瑞托的行为准则不赞成采取某些\"极端\"手段——即使在这种危急时刻也一样。\n\n而你，作为外人，不受这些限制的$gobligado:obligada;，可以采取任何必要的手段来获取情报。\n\n放手去做吧。我们必须立刻查明伊瓦诺尔女士被关在哪里！\n\n我就忙着整理这些书架好了。哦，拿着，也许这件旧东西对你有用……",dEN="It is fortunate you're here, <race>.\n\nYou see, the Kirin Tor code of conduct frowns upon our taking certain 'extreme' measures - even in desperate times such as these.\n\nYou, however, as an outsider, are not bound by such restrictions and could take any steps necessary in the retrieval of information.\n\nDo what you must. We need to know where Lady Evanor is being held at once!\n\nI'll just busy myself organizing these shelves here. Oh, and here, perhaps you'll find this old thing useful....",o="琥珀崖的图书馆员诺曼提斯要你对被囚禁的蓝玉巫师使用催眠魔杖，查出艾瓦诺尔女士的下落。",oEN="Librarian Normantis on Amber Ledge wants you to use the Neural Needler on the Imprisoned Beryl Sorcerer until he reveals the location of Lady Evanor.",p="所以？你知道伊娃诺女士被关在哪里了吗？",pEN="Well? Do you know where Lady Evanor is being held?",c="太好了！收集到这份情报很要紧。\n\n做得好，朋友。",cEN="Excellent! It was crucial that we collect that intelligence.\n\nWell done, friend."}
Q[11649]={d="元素之间的争端总算平息下来，但是你和灵语者的问题就比较麻烦。\n\n你也瞧见了，火元素与水元素长期互不相让地死掐，我的仆从因此变得极为暴躁。虽然局势还要一段时间才能恢复正常，但对你来说倒是很有利的。\n\n我要你进入废墟，从风暴元素身上收集风暴微粒，我需要这些微粒才能帮你。",dEN="Now that their little squabble is dealt with, there is still the matter of helping you and your spirit talker.\n\nAs you can see, my vassals have been enraged by the ongoing war between fire and water. This will not change anytime soon, but it will serve to your advantage.\n\nIn order to assist you, what we need are their motes. Head further into the ruins and retrieve them from the tempests.",o="将5颗风暴微粒交给埃德拉纳斯废墟的因波莉安。",oEN="Obtain 5 Tempest Motes and deliver them to Imperean at the Ruins of Eldra'nath.",p="一旦你拿到了必要的微粒，我会用这些做成一份我的精华。到时候你就会拿到你所需要的。",pEN="Once you have the necessary motes, I will combine a portion of my essence with theirs. The result will get you what you need.",c="我替那些暴风的损失感到后悔，但我言出必行……即便是向你这样的凡人所许下的承诺。\n\n现在，让我们看看能否形成一些对你有用的东西。",cEN="I regret the loss of those tempests, but my word is my bond... even to a mortal such as yourself.\n\nNow, let us see if we can fashion something of use to you."}
Q[11650]={d="你可能已经注意到了，我们把简易机场建在了猛犸人巢穴的南端！\n\n<机灵鬼低声说了句菲兹克兰克的坏话。>\n\n老头子让我负责为这个情况找一个……呃……有创意的解决办法。要是我们不尽快处理掉他们，他们就会冲下来把我们一块块撕碎！\n\n这就需要你出马了。我要你把这份购物清单上的东西都弄来。拜托了。",dEN="As you may have noticed, we created the airstrip on the southern border of a magnataur den!\n\n<Crafty says something uncharitable about Fizzcrank under her breath.>\n\nThe old man has put me in charge of finding a... ahem... creative solution to this situation: if we don't deal with them soon, they'll come down here and tear us limb from limb!\n\nThat's where you come in. I want you to get me everything on this shopping list. Please.",o="收集机灵鬼的工具、一个超载电容器和一捧洛克纳尔的沙砾，把它们交给菲兹兰克机场的机灵鬼沃比斯波基。",oEN="Collect Crafty's Tools, an Overcharged Capacitor, and a Handful of Rocknar's Grit. Deliver them to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="为什么我不相信你已经收集到清单上的所有东西呢？",pEN="Why is it that I don't believe you've collected everything on my list?",c="很好，这才像话！现在我们该做的就是将这些东西组合在一起。\n\n没错，你即将帮我把那东西完成。\n\n拉住你的马匹，既然我都已经拿回我的工具了，这只需要一会儿就好了！",cEN="Alright, that's more like it! Now all we gots to do is put all this together.\n\nYeah, as if you're going to help me with that.\n\nHold your horses, this'll just take a second now that I've got my tools back!"}
Q[11651]={d="谢谢你的一切帮助，伙计。你可以去告诉加奇，坦克已经准备好行动了。希望你能把这个地方彻底清理干净！|n",dEN="Thanks for all your help, buddy. You can let Gorge know the tanks are ready for action. Hopefully you can clean up this place once and for all!",o="与回音海岸的碾压者格尔基谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Gorge the Corpsegrinder at the Coast of Echoes.",c="以我们当前的交通和航线状态来看，我们连运送一具该死的攻城机具来战歌都没有办法。当前我们手边的这些坦克是原来的远征队遗留下来的。既然东西还可以用，你就用它们来重创纳森平原的天灾军团进攻部队吧。",cEN="With the current state of our transports and shipping lanes, we haven't been able to get a damned siege engine to Warsong. These tanks are all that we have left from the original expedition. Now that they're operational, you're gonna use 'em to stomp the Scourge offensive at the Plains of Nasam."}
Q[11652]={d="等你$gpreparado:preparada;，跳进一辆坦克，把它开到东南方的纳萨姆平原。\n\n用坦克的武器库击溃天灾军团的军队。如果陷入困境，\"碎肉锤\"会把它们撕碎，地雷会给它们收尾！如果遇到我们的士兵，就把他们接上！最后一件事，战场上到处都有油箱。\n\n尽量靠近中央的那座建筑，看看那里发生了什么。\n\n如果你做完这一切还能活下来，就直接去找地狱咆哮！",dEN="Once you're ready, jump into one of the tanks and drive it out to the Plains of Nasam, southeast of here.\n\nUse the tank's weapon arsenal to take down the Scourge army. If you get in a jam, the \"Meatpounder\" will tear 'em up and the land mines will finish 'em off! If you find any of our soldiers, grab 'em! One last thing, fuel tanks can be found all over the field.\n\nTry to get close enough to that structure in the center and see what's going on.\n\nIf you do all of this and live, go to Hellscream!",o="在纳萨姆平原使用部落攻城坦克消灭100名天灾士兵，并营救出3名受伤的战歌士兵。同时你也必须鉴别出领导这次突袭行动的天灾军团指挥官。\n\n完成任务之后向战歌要塞的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮复命。",oEN="Use the Horde Siege Tank to destroy 100 Scourge Soldiers and rescue 3 Injured Warsong Soldiers on the Plains of Nasam. You must also discover the identity of the leader of the Scourge assault.\n\nReport to Garrosh Hellscream at Warsong Hold should you succeed.",p="嗯？发生了什么事？",pEN="Well? What happened?",c="克尔苏加德？那么这是真的——纳克萨玛斯回来了……\n\n也许我低估了你，<name>。你为部落立下了大功。大酋长会为你骄傲的！\n\n<加尔鲁什停下来思考。>\n\n如果克尔苏加德在控制这些天灾军团，那就不知道巫妖王还为我们准备了什么……我需要时间来消化这个新情报，<name>。你可以退下了。",cEN="Kel'Thuzad? So it's true - Naxxramas returns...\n\nPerhaps I underestimated you, <name>. You've done the Horde a great service. The Warchief would be proud!\n\n<Garrosh pauses to think.>\n\nIf Kel'Thuzad is controlling these Scourge, there's no telling what else the Lich King has in store for us... I'll need time to think through this new information, <name>. You are dismissed."}
Q[11653]={d="这就够了，$gjefe:jefa;！好吧，这是我要你做的事……\n\n带上我的缩小射线，往北去玛格莫斯。如果我们想有机会对付那些怪物，就得把它们变小……可以这么说。\n\n为了测试它的效果，我需要你在射线还作用于猛犸人身上时杀死它。任意一头粉碎者或它们的配偶都行，但别管那些幼崽……它们还太小，不用操心。",dEN="That'll do her, chief! So, here's what I want ya to do....\n\nTake my blaster and head north to Magmoth. If we're gonna have a chance at all against those monsters, we need to cut them down to size... so to speak.\n\nIn order to gauge its effectiveness, I need you to slay the magnataur while the blaster's effects are still on it. Any of the crushers or mates will do, but don't bother with the offspring... they're too small to worry about.",o="对5名犸格莫斯碾压者或犸格莫斯雷加的配偶使用超级缩小射线枪原型机进行测试。完成任务后返回菲兹兰克机场，向机灵鬼沃比斯波基汇报测试结果。",oEN="Test out Crafty's Ultra-Advanced Proto-Typical Shortening Blaster on 5 Magmoth Crushers or Mates of Magmothregar. After you have done so, return to her at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="你确定你在够多的丑陋怪物身上检测过光束枪了吗？",pEN="You sure that you tested the blaster on enough of those monstrous beasts?",c="你说没用是什么意思？！\n\n可是……可是……\n\n<沃比斯波基开始啜泣。>\n\n好吧，我们可以解决这个问题的。我是个大女孩了。该是跳脱既定想法的时候了！",cEN="Whadya mean it didn't work?!\n\nBut... but...\n\n<Crafty begins to sob.>\n\nOkay, we can deal with this. I'm a big girl. Time to think outside the box!"}
Q[11654]={d="你捡起这只装满血液的小瓶，发现它竟然是温热的。看来受害者可能是刚刚被放血，说不定还活着呢。\n\n天灾军团采集血液做什么？过去他们对活着的囚犯可没兴趣。如果能找到血液的来源，或许就能洞察天灾军团的阴谋。",dEN="As you inspect the captured blood vial, you realize its contents are still warm. The victim must have just been bled and may still be alive.\n\nWhat use would the Scourge have for blood? They've never shown an interest in live prisoners in the past. Perhaps if you can locate the source of the blood, you'll be able to discover what the Scourge is planning.",o="搜寻鲜血尖塔，找到这瓶新鲜血液的更多线索。",oEN="Search the Spire of Blood for more information about the Vial of Fresh Blood.",p="你……你怎么找到我的？",pEN="How... how did you find me?",c="<牦牛人的雪地追踪者显得十分虚弱，只能勉强回答你。>\n\n我已经……很久。或许……或许……你能够阻止他们……在……之前……",cEN="<The taunka snow tracker appears weak and barely responds to you.>\n\nI haven't... long. Maybe... maybe you can stop them... before..."}
Q[11655]={d="穿越迷雾往北走就是加尔鲁什码头，南面的废墟则是我昔日的家园帕尔依。不过现在，一支名叫克瓦迪尔的维库人部族已经将这两处地方洗劫一空。\n\n这些野蛮的渣滓残忍地杀害了我的同胞，将你的族人逐往内陆。\n\n他们还将帕尔依海象人世代相传的古器据为己有。虽然我们并不是复仇心重的种族，但是正义必须得到伸张！我必须夺回海象人的圣物。进入迷雾区找到它们……",dEN="Across the mist to the north you will find Garrosh's Landing. To the south are the ruins of my old home, Pal'ea. Both have been ransacked by an ancient force known as the Kvaldir.\n\nThese fearsome savages slew all of my people without mercy and drove your people inland.\n\nAll that remains of the tuskarr of Pal'ea are our personal effects, taken as relics by the Kvaldir. While we are not a vengeful race, justice must be served. The tuskarr relics must be returned to me. Enter the mist and find them...",o="北风苔原回音海岸的瓦托尔要你杀死克瓦迪尔成员，并取回8件海象人的圣物。",oEN="Waltor of Pal'ea at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill Kvaldir and recover 8 Tuskarr Relics.",p="以血与荣誉为誓……卡鲁亚克海民的遗物一定要拿回来。",pEN="By blood and honor you must serve... Return the tuskarr relics.",c="<瓦托尔无法抑制他的悲伤。>\n\n废墟……这就是他们苏醒后所留下的。他们一定要获得教训。",cEN="<Sadness overcomes Waltor.>\n\nRuin... That is all they leave in their wake. They must be taught a lesson."}
Q[11656]={d="海象人使用的魔法与萨满教的类似。虽然我们信奉元素的方式与你们不同，但是我们也能召唤出强大的力量。\n\n<瓦托尔朝你挥舞着一根火炬状的权杖。>\n\n带上这根海象人火炬返回迷雾区，烧毁克瓦迪尔的船只。有三艘船停泊在北边的加尔鲁什码头，另一艘在南边帕尔依的海岸边。烧毁它们！让那些维库人见识一下海象人的怒火！",dEN="Tuskarr magic is similar to what your people call shamanism. While we serve the elements differently than you, the power that we are able to call forth is formidable.\n\n<Waltor waves a torch-like baton in front of you.>\n\nWith this tuskarr torch I want you to return to the mist and strike at the Kvaldir vessels. You will find three of their vessels docked behind the mist at Garrosh's Landing, north of here, and one docked off the shores of Pal'ea, to the south. Burn their ships in effigy! For all to see!",o="北风苔原回音海岸帕尔埃亚的沃尔托要你用海象人火炬烧毁帕尔埃亚和加尔鲁什登陆点的克瓦迪尔船只。你必须摧毁以下船只：毒蛇之喉、库尔德拉卡、波尔之锤和波尔之砧。|n",oEN="Waltor of Pal'ea at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to use the Tuskarr Torch to burn the Kvaldir ships at Pal'ea and Garrosh's Landing. You must destroy the following ships: The Serpent's Maw, The Kur Drakkar, Bor's Hammer and Bor's Anvil.",p="完成了吗？那些船只都起火了吗？",pEN="Is it done? Are the ships ablaze?",c="对那些克瓦迪尔人所展开的抵抗，或许正是拯救我们其它营地的族人所需要的。如果那些克瓦迪尔相信会有报复攻击的话，他们或许会在采取行动前三思。",cEN="A show of resistance to the Kvaldir savages might be what is needed to save my people at the other encampments. Perhaps the Kvaldir will rethink their actions should they believe that retribution will come."}
Q[11658]={d="别慌啊！虽然射线枪不管用，但我们还有别的法子。\n\n<机灵鬼打了个响指。>\n\n比如说，转移猛犸人的注意力！这样的话，我们就得事先准备好一些东西。\n\n<她将你从头到脚地打量了一番。>\n\n几天前，钢腭的车队为了抄近路，竟然想穿过西边的牦牛人墓地，当然他们都被复活的幽灵杀死了。\n\n我要你从死去的兽人身上扒些衣服什么的回来。顺便搞一面旗帜，别忘了！",dEN="Okay, don't panic! The blaster might not've worked, but we still have options.\n\n<Crafty snaps her fingers.>\n\nWe're going to divert attention away from the airstrip! To make this work, we'll need a few things first.\n\n<Wobblesprocket looks you up and down appraisingly.>\n\nSteeljaw's caravan, just to the west, stupidly took a shortcut through a taunka graveyard and was destroyed by their risen spirits.\n\nHead over there and get some outfits off of the dead orcs. Pick up one of their banners, too!",o="收集10套战歌衣物和一面战歌旗帜，将它们交给菲兹兰克机场的机灵鬼沃比斯波基。",oEN="Collect 10 Warsong Outfits and a Warsong Banner. Bring them back to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="事情要成功的话，我们需要一大堆他们的衣服才行，我可不是女红……我们来找找有没有适合你的吧！\n\n然后，由我这样的工程学天才摸一下，吹口气，你看起来就像你要扮演的角色了。",pEN="We'll need lots of their clothes if this is going to work. I'm no seamstress... we'll just have to find something to fit you!\n\nAnd then I'll just add a touch of my engineer genius, and poof, you'll look the part you need to play.",c="很好，可是这些衣服臭死了！\n\n就我自己来说，杀了我也不要穿这些破布。但是，我们得从这些衣服里面挑出适合你的，呃……尺寸。",cEN="Nice, but those clothes reek!\n\nPersonally, you'd never catch me dead in such rags. But we're going to have to sort through them and find some that fit your, um... figure."}
Q[11659]={d="他们……从囚犯身上……采集血液……注入那些宝珠中。\n\n<戈鲁姆闭上双眼，脑袋往后扬。>\n\n血液……被送往浮空城……给血王子……\n\n<戈鲁姆的呼吸十分困难。>\n\n答，答应我……你要……摧毁……那些……鲜血宝珠……然后把……这里的情况……告诉尤内克。\n\n<踏雪者戈鲁姆咽下了最后一口气。>",dEN="They're... bleeding the prisoners... putting the blood... in those globes.\n\n<Grumm's eyes close momentarily and he leans his head back.>\n\nThe blood... taken up to necropolis... to feed blood prince...\n\n<Grumm gasps for breath.>\n\nP-promise... you'll... destroy blood... globes... bring word... to Junek.\n\n<The snow tracker collapses into unconsciousness.>",o="摧毁5颗鲜血宝珠，然后向牦牛村的踏雪者尤内克汇报情况。",oEN="Destroy 5 Blood Globes and report to Snow Tracker Junek at Taunka'le Village.",c="我担心他们可能抓走了格鲁姆，但从没想过他们会对他做出这么可怕的事。\n\n我从没见过有战士能在与天灾军团的败仗中活下来。\n\n谢谢你带来他下场的消息，<name>。他曾是个强大的战士，我们会这样记住他。",cEN="I feared they might've captured Grumm, but I never thought they'd do such horrific things to him. I've never seen a warrior survive a losing battle with the Scourge.\n\nThank you for bringing word of his fate, <name>. He was a mighty warrior and we will remember him as such."}
Q[11660]={d="指挥克瓦迪尔军队袭击帕尔依的维库人军官名叫奥拉布斯。在攻陷两座村落之后，他就消失在了迷雾中。\n\n听说奥拉布斯将一只号角送给了克瓦迪尔织雾者。只要吹响号角，他就会出现。\n\n如果我们能从克瓦迪尔织雾者手中夺得号角，召唤奥拉布斯并杀死他，这些野蛮人或许会撤退。\n\n转至南边的帕尔依寻找织雾者吧。",dEN="A Kvaldir lieutenant known as Orabus directed the initial incursion against my people at Pal'ea, He oversaw the destruction of both villages and then disappeared into the mist.\n\nIn those early days there was talk of a horn that Orabus gifted to the Kvaldir mistweavers. This horn could be used to summon him should the need arise.\n\nWe need to get that horn from the Kvaldir mistweavers and call forth Orabus. If he is destroyed, these savages might retreat.\n\nSeek out mistweavers at Pal'ea, to the south.",o="北风苔原回音海岸的瓦托尔要你夺得古代水手的号角。",oEN="Waltor of Pal'ea at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to bring him the Horn of the Ancient Mariner.",p="找到上古海员号角！",pEN="Find the Horn of the Ancient Mariner!",c="你一定得要使用这个上古海员号角来召唤欧拉布斯。",cEN="You must call for Orabus using the Horn of the Ancient Mariner."}
Q[11661]={d="带着这只号角转至西边的战歌防波堤。在防波堤尽头吹响号角，奥拉布斯就会出现。\n\n把他干掉之后再回来！",dEN="Take the horn and travel west to the Warsong Jetty. Make your way to the end of the jetty and blow into the horn. The sound should rouse Orabus.\n\nSlay the foul beast and return to me!",o="北风苔原回音海岸的瓦托尔要你利用古代水手的号角召唤舵手奥拉布斯并杀死他。",oEN="Waltor of Pal'ea at the Coast of Echoes in the Borean Tundra wants you to use the Horn of the Ancient Mariner to summon Orabus the Helmsman. Once summoned, slay Orabus the Helmsman.",p="欧拉布斯必须要被摧毁！",pEN="Orabus must be destroyed!",c="看来损失了他们的副官只造成了一点骚动。他们比之前更愤怒也更具有侵略性了！\n\n<瓦托尔叹息。>\n\n你尽力了，朋友。起码你减少了他们的数量，无论如何都应该要给你报酬。",cEN="It seems that the loss of their lieutenant has only stirred the nest. They are more angry and aggressive than before!\n\n<Waltor sighs.>\n\nYou've done what you can here, friend. At the very least you deserve some form of compensation for thinning their numbers."}
Q[11662]={d="有个名叫卡鲁克的帕尔依幸存者逃到了克瓦迪尔在北风苔原的主基地。那个地方在遥远的南部，曾经复盖着皑皑的白雪。他躲在一座可以俯瞰裂鞭海岸的悬崖上。\n\n找到卡鲁克，告诉他你在回音海岸为我们的同胞做过什么。\n\n我建议你从你们的要塞出发，沿着南面的道路转至裂鞭海岸，那条路线相对安全一些。",dEN="A fellow survivor of Pal'ea known as Karuk has made his way to the main base of the Kvaldir in the Borean Tundra - far to the south where the snow was once bountiful. Karuk hides along the bluffs overlooking Riplash Strand.\n\nSeek out Karuk and let him know what you did for my people here at the Coast of Echoes.\n\nThe safest route to Karuk is through your fortress. From Warsong Hold, take the road south and follow it around until you reach Riplash Strand.",o="转至裂鞭海岸寻找卡鲁克。",oEN="Seek out Karuk at Riplash Strand.",c="沃尔托派你来找我很明智，<race>。神明会眷顾那些伸张正义的人。你就是那个向邪恶降下惩罚的人！",cEN="Waltor was wise in sending you to me, <race>. The gods smile down upon those that mete justice. You will be he that doles out punishment to the wicked!"}
Q[11663]={d="$c，谢谢你！这条信息对肯瑞托而言至关重要。\n\n我们这就制定营救艾瓦诺尔女士的计划，请你立即返回多纳森那里。",dEN="Thank you, <class>! The information you've extracted is of vital importance to the Kirin Tor.\n\nReturn at once to Donathan as we make plans for the rescue of Lady Evanor.",o="诺曼提斯要你去向琥珀崖的图书馆员多纳森汇报情况。",oEN="Normantis has asked you to report to Librarian Donathan on Amber Ledge.",c="原谅我，<name>。我知道那是件令人不快的工作。\n\n要不是形势如此绝望，我绝不会请你用那种方式帮助我们。\n\n那么……你发现了什么？",cEN="Forgive me, <name>. I know that was unpleasant work.\n\nWere it not for the desperation of our circumstance I'd never have asked you to assist us in such a manner.\n\nSo... what have you discovered?"}
Q[11664]={d="我可以听见迷雾中有野兽活动的声音。它们的嚎叫声快把我逼疯了，可是我又不敢逃……再说我能逃到哪儿去呢？它们很快就会追上我，要了我的性命。\n\n陌生人，迷雾已经扩散到什么地方了？复盖了整片大陆吗？\n\n你愿意帮助我逃离这里吗？我应该能找到我的父亲。他就在附近，我能感受得到。",dEN="I can hear the mist creatures outside. Their yells are driving me mad, but I dare not try to escape. And where would I even go? How long would it be until they caught up with me and executed me like the others?\n\nI wonder, how far has the mist crept, stranger? Has it overtaken this whole continent?\n\nWould you be willing to help me try and escape the mist? I think I can lead us back toward my father. I still sense his life spirit. He is close.",o="护送小穆图逃离迷雾地带，然后与长者穆图谈一谈。",oEN="Follow Mootoo the Younger out of the mist. Speak to Elder Mootoo should you successfully save Mootoo the Younger.",c="它在风中低语着，朋友。你的姓名已为众元素所知。你今日帮了穆图很大的忙，你应当被奖励。",cEN="It is whispered in the winds, friend. Your name is known to the elements. You have done a great service to Mootoo on this day and you shall be rewarded."}
Q[11665]={d="你好，伙计。很高兴你能听听我这老家伙所说的话，并且帮我几个忙。\n\n最近有个旅行商人把许多小鳄鱼卖给了这里的孩子们。你要知道，鳄鱼可是一种很凶暴的东西，它们很快就逃光了，全都躲进了城市的下水道里。\n\n去找根最结实的鱼杆，拿一捆最结实的渔线，到暴风城和奥格瑞玛去开工吧，把它们都给我捉回来。我还听说有几只小鳄鱼跑到了别的城市去，但这条消息并不确定。",dEN="Hello <lad/lass>. I'm glad you've stopped by to talk to this old man--there's trouble back home.\n\nA traveling merchant recently sold a batch of baby crocolisks to some gullible children. Crocolisks are wild beasts, and many have escaped and now lurk in city waterways.\n\nGrab your strongest fishing pole and drop a line in Stormwind or Orgrimmar and bring one of the little devils back to me. I'm anxious to see one.",o="为老渔夫巴尔洛带回一只鳄鱼宝宝。你可以在沙塔斯城东北面的希尔米耶湖旁找到他。",oEN="Bring a Baby Crocolisk to Old Man Barlo. You can find him fishing northeast of Shattrath City by Silmyr Lake.",p="在下水道抓到任何的鳄鱼了吗？",pEN="Catch any crocs in the sewers yet?",c="多恶毒的小东西！我相信洛克一定可以拿它做点美味的料理出来。\n\n喔，我只是在开玩笑。\n\n<老人巴尔洛俏皮地眨眨眼睛。>",cEN="What a mean little creature! I'm sure the Rokk will make something tasty with him.\n\nI'm just kidding, of course.\n\n<Old Man Barlo winks slyly.>"}
Q[11666]={d="你知道不知道金镖鱼？这种鱼在泰罗卡森林的河流里很常见，对这里的祭司们来说是上等的精肴美馔。不过，黑鳞镖鲈呢？恐怕你就没有听说过了吧！\n\n这种鱼非常之聪明，非常之狡猾，非常之难以捕捉。你首先得非常非常有耐心，然后必须得在它咬钩的一瞬间拉线。稍微慢一点，你就会发现钩子上的饵被它们咬走了。\n\n总之，在泰罗卡森林那边的河流里钓钓看吧，让我这老家伙看看你技术怎么样。不要去湖边，因为黑鳞镖鲈只在流动的水中生活。",dEN="You probably know all about the golden darter--they're fairly common in the rivers of Terokkar Forest and a delicacy for priests. But here's one you haven't heard of: the blackfin darter.\n\nThe fish is notoriously crafty and difficult to catch. You have to pull your line at the last possible second, because they nibble at the bait before they take it.\n\nDrop your line in the rivers of Terokkar and bring me a blackfin darter. Avoid the lakes, as the blackfin only thrive in moving water.",o="为老渔夫巴尔洛带回一只黑鳞镖鲈。你可以在沙塔斯城东北面的希尔米耶湖旁找到他。",oEN="Bring a Blackfin Darter to Old Man Barlo. You can find him fishing northeast of Shattrath City by Silmyr Lake.",p="今天钓得怎么样，<lad/lass>？",pEN="How's the fishing today, <lad/lass>?",c="哎呀瞧瞧……你抓到这么大一条！这个老人今晚有得吃了。",cEN="Well look at that... you caught a big one! This old man is eating in style tonight."}
Q[11667]={d="菲格鲁斯特的泥鱼是一种速度惊人的底栖鱼，生活在纳格兰的水域中。它们一生都在生长，以善战闻名。\n\n多年前，我钓上过一条我确信是世界上最大的泥鱼……直到它扯断我的鱼线跑了。\n\n像你这样水准的$gUn pescador:Una pescadora;不需要别人教该怎么做——你的命运在纳格兰的湖泊中等着你。",dEN="Figluster's mudfish is a surprisingly quick bottom feeder found in the waters of Nagrand. They grow their entire lives and are well known as fighters.\n\nYears ago, I caught what I'm certain was the world's biggest mudfish... until it snapped my line and escaped.\n\nA fisherman of your caliber doesn't need to be told what to do--your destiny awaits in the lakes of Nagrand.",o="为老渔夫巴尔洛捕捉到世界上最大的泥鱼。你可以在沙塔斯城东北面的希尔米耶湖旁找到他。",oEN="Catch the World's Largest Mudfish and bring it to Old Man Barlo. You can find him fishing northeast of Shattrath City by Silmyr Lake.",p="告诉我你抓到它了。拜托你告诉我你抓住那只鱼崽子。",pEN="Tell me you caught him. Please tell me you caught that son of a carp.",c="就是它！我到哪里都认得出那个疤痕。\n\n老实说，我以为他应该……更大。很好，我想我应该放他走，然后改天再试试。",cEN="There he is! I'd know that scar anywhere.\n\nTo be completely honest, I thought he'd be... bigger. Well, I suppose I'll let him go and try again another day."}
Q[11668]={d="赞加沼泽的湖里有许多大鱼，你想知道这些大鱼是靠吃什么过活的吗？\n\n是虾！巨型淡水虾。巨石洛克曾教给过我几道用虾作材料的菜谱。\n\n但是呢，虾的体形太小，用鱼钩和鱼线来抓并不方便。所以我要教你一个绝招：你先钓一些刺鳃鲑鱼上来，然后找出那些看起来最肥、鱼腹最肿胀的，把它们的肚子剖开，就能找到几只虾啦。",dEN="There's a lot of big fish in the Zangarmarsh lakes. Ever wonder what they eat?\n\nShrimp. Giant freshwater shrimp. The Rokk tells me the dishes you can make with shrimp are nearly endless.\n\nBut shrimp are too small to catch with a fishing line. So here's the trick: cut open the bloated barbed gill trout and you'll find a shrimp or two if you're lucky.",o="为老渔夫巴尔洛带回10只巨型淡水虾。你可以在沙塔斯城东北面的希尔米耶湖旁找到他。",oEN="Bring 10 Giant Freshwater Shrimp to Old Man Barlo. You can find him fishing northeast of Shattrath City by Silmyr Lake.",p="今天的收获是什么，<lad/lass>？",pEN="What's the catch of the day, <lad/lass>?",c="你对于使用钩和刀都很熟悉了。把那些甜美的珍馐交出来，我就让你尝一口。",cEN="You are skilled with both the hook and knife. Hand those sweet tidbits over, and I'll let you have a taste."}
Q[11669]={d="嘿嘿，我这个老家伙马上又要出发去狩猎了。我的目标是一只在艾萨拉海域游弋的大鲨鱼。\n\n不过，问题是，我现在需要一些能够涂在渔叉上、并且即使是泡在水里也不会稀释的毒液。想要制作这种毒药呢，我就需要一些魔血鲷鱼的毒囊，这一种非常稀少的剧毒鱼。\n\n要想找到它，你恐怕只有去影月谷或是地狱火半岛上那些可怕的水域里看看了。给我带回来一条这种鱼吧，我这个老渔夫一定会非常高兴的。",dEN="This old man is going hunting soon. I'm gonna take down a mammoth shark off the coast of Azshara.\n\nThe thing is, I need a toxin that'll stay on a spear tip while it's underwater. To make that kind of stuff, I need the glands from a poisonous fish: the felblood snapper.\n\nSuch a vile fish only thrives in the waters of Hellfire Peninsula and Shadowmoon Valley. Bring me back a whopper and I'll be a happy old man.",o="为老渔夫巴尔洛带回一只巨型魔血鲷鱼。你可以在沙塔斯城东北面的希尔米耶湖旁找到他。",oEN="Bring a Monstrous Felblood Snapper to Old Man Barlo. You can find him fishing northeast of Shattrath City by Silmyr Lake.",p="魔化鲷鱼是演化中的奇迹。它能存活于任何的液体中，就算是熔岩也行，渔夫则是它唯一的自然克星。\n\n你的猎捕行动有任何成果吗？",pEN="The felblood is a marvel of evolution. It can survive in any water and even lava, and fishermen are its only natural predator.\n\nAny luck with your prey?",c="那是我见过最大、最丑陋的鱼了。我根本不敢想象你是用什么来诱捕它的。\n\n把那条野兽放地上就好，一旦我确认它真的死了，我就会去处理它了。",cEN="That is the biggest, ugliest fish I've seen. I can't even imagine what you used for bait.\n\nJust set the beast on the ground, and I'll deal with it once I'm sure it's dead."}
Q[11670]={d="我费了好大劲才将这些衣料拼凑成一件战歌兽人伪装。别担心，我在衣料中添加了去年万圣节剩下的好东西，它应该非常结实。啊，我真是个天才！\n\n喏，袋子里装着兽人伪装和你取回的那面旗帜。带上它转至犸格莫斯，杀死猛犸人的酋长犸格莫斯雷加。\n\n你必须在伪装状态下将旗帜插在犸格莫斯雷加的尸体上，令猛犸人的注意力转移到战歌兽人身上。",dEN="With all of those outfits you, er, recovered, I fashioned a Warsong orc disguise. I had the genius idea of combining it with some old stuff that I had left hanging around from last Hallows' End, so it should be foolproof!\n\nHere, in this sack is the disguise and the banner you recovered. Head down into the bowels of Magmoth and slay the magnataur chieftain, Magmothregar.\n\nIf you're going to convince them to turn their attention on the Warsong orcs, you'll need to plant the banner while disguised.",o="伪装成战歌兽人，将战歌旗帜插在犸格莫斯雷加的尸体上。完成任务后返回菲兹兰克机场，将伪装还给机灵鬼沃比斯波基。",oEN="While disguised as a Warsong orc, plant the Warsong Banner in the corpse of Magmothregar. Then, return with the disguise to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="都完成了吗？你做了那些“下流”的手段并且成功陷害博古洛克前哨的兽人吗？",pEN="It's all over then? You've done the dirty deed and framed the orcs at Bor'gorok Outpost?",c="天哪，你做到了！\n\n很好，现在那些讨厌的猛犸人和他们的雪地狗头人跟班应该会把注意力转向部落了。\n\n我该怎么报答你，<name>？",cEN="Holey moley, you did it!\n\nAlright, now those pesky magnataur and their snobold flunkies should turn their attentions on the Horde.\n\nHow can I ever repay you, <name>?"}
Q[11671]={d="这么说，艾瓦诺尔女士果然是被劫持了。\n\n$r，我们必须搭救她。\n\n我得待在这儿做好营救准备。那么，又要麻烦你帮我从莎尔兰德手中夺回牢笼的钥匙了。我们对莎尔兰德所知甚少，只知道如果她的魔法护盾完好无损，就可以免疫一切伤害。\n\n不过，这捆特殊的炸药应该能突破护盾，帮助你完成任务。夺得钥匙后就回来找我。\n\n$n，时间紧迫，艾瓦诺尔女士正在痛苦中煎熬！",dEN="So it's true. They have her.\n\nIt's clear what must be done, <race>. She WILL be saved.\n\nI must remain here and aid in the rescue preparations. I call upon you again; this time to collect the prison key. All we know of this Salrand figure is that she cannot be harmed so long as her shield is intact.\n\nWe've customized a special explosive that should strip her of this protection, allowing you to perform your duty. Return to me when you've collected the key.\n\nHurry, <name>. Lady Evanor is suffering!",o="琥珀崖的多纳森要你使用蓝玉护盾炸药摧毁蓝玉营地的魔法护盾，然后击败莎尔兰德，夺取她的钥匙。",oEN="Donathan on Amber Ledge has tasked you with using the Beryl Shield Detonator to bring down the shield at Beryl Point. You are then to defeat Salrand and collect the key she holds.",p="你取得莎尔兰德的钥匙了吗？",pEN="Have you collected Salrand's key?",c="坏了？\n\n让我看看……",cEN="Broken?\n\nLet me have a look...."}
Q[11672]={d="你是来应征入伍的，对吗？通常来说，你得跟其它新兵一起排队报名，但现在你暂时无法享受这种荣幸，因为我把新兵名册弄丢了。所以在拿到新的名册前，我无法招募任何人。\n\n你很幸运，$n，我听说过你在外域的一些事迹。老实说，你比这些可怜虫强很多。队列训练并不合适你。\n\n到兵营那里去找阿洛斯将军吧，他一定会非常高兴地接待你这样出色的士兵。",dEN="You've come to enlist, right? Normally you'd have to stand in line like the other recruits. Normally you'd be out of luck because the recruitment ledger's gone missing and I can't process anyone until the new books get here.\n\nFortunately for you, <name>, I've heard about you and what you did in Outland. To be honest, you're a cut above these poor saps. Lines aren't for you.\n\nGo to the barracks and speak to General Arlos. He'll be more than happy to meet with someone of your caliber.",o="到无畏要塞的兵营里去找阿洛斯将军。",oEN="Meet with General Arlos inside the barracks in Valiance Keep.",c="我们一直在等你的到来，<name>。欢迎来到诺森德。",cEN="We've been expecting your arrival, <name>. Welcome to Northrend."}
Q[11673]={d="我就知道他们迟早会派人来的……当然，结果还是迟了。\n\n我来这里是为了跟雪地狗头人谈判，可他们的大萨满卡加尼舒却决定让我成为玛格莫斯雷加的美味点心。\n\n等等……什么？！他们不是派你来的？！\n\n他们把我忘了？！\n\n好吧，你现在来了，这才是最重要的。\n\n你一打断这条锁链，我们就动身回简易机场。然后你就可以告诉菲兹克兰克我平安回来了。\n\n前提是他还记得我。",dEN="I knew they'd send someone for me sooner or later... turned out to be later, of course.\n\nI came in here to parlay with the snobolds, but their main shaman, Kaganishu, decided instead that I'd make a tasty snack for Magmothregar.\n\nWait... what?! They didn't send you?!\n\nDID THEY FORGET ABOUT ME?!\n\nOkay, you're here now and that's all that matters.\n\nAs soon as you break this chain we'll make our way back to the airstrip. Then you can tell Fizzcrank I'm safely back.\n\nIf he remembers me, that is.",o="护送托格沃特逃离犸格莫斯，然后返回菲兹兰克机场，向菲兹兰克·铁阀汇报情况。",oEN="Escort Bonker Togglevolt to safety and then report in with Fizzcrank Fullthrottle at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",c="啥？什么？\n\n哪个托格沃特？\n\n你根本不知道你说的是谁，不过我相信你的话。如果你从犸格莫斯的洞穴中救了一个家伙，我似乎应该要给你一些报酬。\n\n让我看看我手边有些什么……",cEN="Huh? What?\n\nBonker who?\n\nI've no idea who you're talking about, but I'll take your word for it. If you rescued him or her from the pit of Magmoth then I suppose you deserve a reward.\n\nLet me see what I've got lying around in here...."}
Q[11674]={d="最近在这块土地上出现了许多神秘的现象。先知赫米萨迫切地想要调查亡者之穴附近的异常状况，她只带了一名远行者就朝北方仓促出发了。\n\n你一定想问亡者之穴是什么地方吧？那里是猛犸人氏族的神圣陵墓。预感到生命即将结束的猛犸人都会走向亡者之穴，然后静静地死去。几天前，先知赫米萨说她看见有什么东西坠落到那附近了。\n\n如果你愿意与牦牛人成为朋友，我想请你帮忙寻找她的下落。她其实挺好相处的，应该不会拒绝你的帮助。",dEN="There are many new mysteries walking the lands now. One of our sages, Highmesa, has foolishly gone north with only one longrunner to investigate something strange near the Dens of Dying.\n\nWhat are the dens, you ask? They are a sacred place to the magnataur, where they go in their old age to die. She saw something fall from the sky near them a few days ago.\n\nIf you would be friend to the taunka, I would have you find and help her. She is not so stubborn that she will not accept your aid.",o="转至亡者之穴附近寻找先知赫米萨。",oEN="Find Sage Highmesa near the Dens of Dying.",c="祖母派你过来的？她一定对我很失望。\n\n但是当我看到这个从天而降的巨大物体时，我没法等待一整队的远行者和雪地追踪者陪同我——知识可是不等人的。",cEN="The greatmother sent you. She must be disappointed in me.\n\nBut when I saw the great object fall from the sky, I could not wait for a full group of longrunners and snow trackers to accompany me. Knowledge waits for no one."}
Q[11675]={d="亡者之穴的猛犸人感染了某种疫病。我们必须找到疾病的源头，但在那之前还是先拯救这些饱受折磨的生灵吧。\n\n$R，可怜的猛犸人拖着病躯在北边的斜坡上游荡，死亡对他们来说是最好的解脱。",dEN="The magnataur at the Dens of Dying have contracted a plague. We must find the cause, but first we must put them out of their misery.\n\n<race>, you must go north onto the slopes in front of us and destroy as many of the poor creatures as you can.",o="杀死10名天灾猛犸人，然后向亡者之穴以南的先知赫米萨复命。",oEN="Destroy 10 Plagued Magnataur and then return to Sage Highmesa south of The Dens of Dying.",c="我们除了帮他们脱离痛苦之外还能做什么？不管如何这都是命中注定的，不需要替他们哀悼，你给了他们一个有尊严的死。\n\n现在我们必须要让瘟疫结束蔓延。",cEN="What else can we do but ease their suffering? In any case, they came here to die, so do not mourn them. At least you have given them some dignity.\n\nNow we must put an end to that which is causing the plague."}
Q[11676]={d="没被杀死的士兵被关在散布于这片农田各处的笼子里。我们设法偷到了几把钥匙，但没法在不被攻击的情况下接近任何俘虏。\n\n我们需要你的\"才能\"来弄到那些钥匙，释放俘虏。砸开那些死灵领主和畸形怪物的脑袋，拿走它们的钥匙。用那些钥匙释放天灾军团的俘虏。",dEN="The soldiers that they didn't kill are being held in cages scattered across this farmland. Through some thievery we've managed to find a few keys, but we're unable to get close enough to any prisoners without being attacked.\n\nWe need your \"talents\" in securing those keys and freeing the prisoners. Bash in the brains of the necrolords and aberrations and take their keys. Use those keys to free Scourge prisoners.",o="战歌农场哨站的暗影密探卡纳留斯要你去释放5名天灾囚犯。",oEN="Shadowstalker Canarius at Warsong Farms Outpost wants you to free 5 Scourge Prisoners.",p="救救那些囚犯！",pEN="Save those prisoners!",c="每救出一名俘虏，我们要对付的亡灵畸形怪物就少一只，<name>。你为部落立下了大功。",cEN="Each prisoner saved is one less undead aberration that we have to deal with, <name>. You've done a great service for the Horde."}
Q[11677]={d="瘟疫的源头必定在亡者之穴中。\n\n$C，别小瞧这些不起眼的种子。它们曾保护我免受天灾军团的腐蚀，我隐约觉得它们也可以遏制洞穴中的异状。\n\n进入亡者之穴，将这些种子撒向瘟疫的源头。",dEN="I'm convinced that the plague is being caused by something in the caves up there.\n\n<class>, I want you to take these seeds. I normally use them as a ward against the Scourge, though perhaps they can be used to disrupt whatever foulness is happening in the dens.\n\nFind the source of the plague and throw them into it.",o="亡者之穴以南的先知赫米萨要你进入亡者之穴，对一口瘟疫之锅使用赫米萨的净化之种。",oEN="Sage Highmesa, standing just south of The Dens of Dying, has asked you to use Highmesa's Cleansing Seeds at a Den of Dying Plague Cauldron to neutralize it.",c="<先知低下头放心地叹了口气。>\n\n这是个好的开始。如果我们的问题就只有这么一个的话。",cEN="<The sage hangs her head and sighs in relief.>\n\nThis is a good start. If only that were our only problem."}
Q[11678]={d="按说萨安·钢角现在应该已经回来了。\n\n我们来这里的另一个目的就是调查西边那座从天而降的天灾军团建筑物。这家伙性格冲动，很可能是惹上什么麻烦事了。\n\n$n，请你帮我找到他的下落。",dEN="Bristlehorn should have returned by now.\n\nThe other reason why we came up here was to investigate that Scourge structure to the west, which fell from the sky. He's impetuous and has likely gotten himself into trouble.\n\n<name>, go to that place and find him, please.",o="进入塔尔拉玛斯寻找远行者萨安·钢角。",oEN="Find Longrunner Bristlehorn at Talramas.",c="我……在这个……世上……没多少时间了，小<race>。",cEN="I am... not... long for this... world, little <race>."}
Q[11679]={d="突发状况真是层出不穷……我们不能再耽搁时间了！\n\n我本来不愿意麻烦苏雷斯塔兹大人的，但他是我们营救艾瓦诺尔的唯一希望。\n\n将钥匙碎片交给他，希望他的心情不算太差。\n\n$c，时间紧迫。我们的突击队已经整装待发了。",dEN="Delays, delays... the one thing we cannot afford right now!\n\nAs much as I hate to disturb Lord Surristrasz, he's our only hope of saving our beloved Evanor.\n\nBring him the key fragments and hope that his mood is favorable.\n\nHurry, <class>, our assault team is waiting.",o="多纳森要你与琥珀崖的苏雷斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Donathan wants you to speak to Surristrasz on Amber Ledge.",p="你胆敢靠近我，凡人？\n\n为了你尚未出世的孩子，祈祷你的理由是值得的。",pEN="You dare approach me, mortal?\n\nFor the sake of your unborn children, pray that your cause is worthwhile.",c="你在这里耍的小把戏没有任何意义……\n\n你和你的达拉然盟友只在意那些琐碎的事情，却没有想过这个世界的未来即将要被撕碎。\n\n然而，这也许能提供我的龙群一些必要的消遣。\n\n把钥匙给我瞧瞧……",cEN="The frivolous games you play here are of no consequence....\n\nYou and your Dalaran allies pick at loose threads while the fabric of this world's future is being shredded.\n\nStill, this may provide my drakes some needed amusement.\n\nShow me this key...."}
Q[11680]={d="钥匙已经重新锻造好了。\n\n现在听我的忠告，$r：要么$gvictorioso:victoriosa;地完成这项任务，要么在尝试中死去，因为要是我的任何一条幼龙掉了一片鳞，我都会唯你是问。\n\n现在，去吧。",dEN="The key is forged anew.\n\nNow heed my counsel, <race>. Succeed in your endeavor or die trying, for if a single scale falls from one of my drakes I shall hold you personally accountable.\n\nNow, off with you.",o="当你$glisto:lista;准备释放伊瓦诺尔时，把萨兰德的钥匙交给战斗法师安兹姆。",oEN="Give Salrand's Key to Warmage Anzim when you are ready to free Evanor.",c="就是这个，这钥匙是我们的！",cEN="This is it, the key is ours!"}
Q[11681]={d="进攻的时机到了！\n\n清理掉平台上的敌人后，我就用钥匙打开牢笼。\n\n在那之后，你必须确保艾瓦诺尔女士的安全。\n\n赶快出发吧！",dEN="At last, we attack!\n\nOnce we've cleared the platform I'll use the key.\n\nYou are to ensure that Lady Evanor remains safe after her release.\n\nHurry now, let us be off!",o="琥珀崖的安斯姆要你和他手下的战斗法师飞往蓝玉营地，搭救艾瓦诺尔女士，然后返回琥珀崖的法师塔中，向艾瓦诺尔女士复命。",oEN="Anzim on Amber Ledge wants you to fly with his war mages to free Lady Evanor at Beryl Point. You are then to report to her in the mage tower on Amber Ledge.",c="你的英雄事迹不会被遗忘，<class>。	\n\n请带着我诚挚的感激收下这个。",cEN="Your heroic efforts shall not be forgotten, <class>.\n\nPlease, accept this with my sincere gratitude."}
Q[11682]={d="我听说了你最近在这一带的所作所为，$n，我$gde nuevo:de nuevo;感谢你。\n\n至于这个当地的威胁，我们已经从他们那里了解到需要知道的一切。他们很快就会被解决。现在来说更重要的事……\n\n艾泽拉斯需要你。此地以西的地区正处在一场紧急危机的中心。\n\n细节我会留给苏里斯特拉兹领主来说明。你必须立刻去见他。\n\n祝你好运，达拉然的朋友。",dEN="I am aware of your recent deeds here, <name>, and again I thank you.\n\nAs for this local menace, we've learned all we need to know from them. They'll be dealt with in short order. On now to more important issues....\n\nAzeroth needs you. The region just west of here is the center of an urgent crisis.\n\nI'll leave the details to Lord Surristrasz. You must speak with him at once.\n\nGood luck, friend of Dalaran.",o="艾瓦诺尔女士要你与琥珀崖的苏雷斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Lady Evanor has sent you to speak with Surristrasz on Amber Ledge.",c="那么，<race>，我们又交谈了。	\n\n等你听完我的话，也许你会希望我们没有谈过。",cEN="So, <race>, we speak again.\n\nWhen you've heard my words you may wish we had not."}
Q[11683]={d="西边那座坠落的浮空城中肯定有大批天灾军团的成员。\n\n$c，我要你杀入塔尔拉玛斯，消灭那些巫妖王的仆从。你可以在浮空城以及附近的池塘一带找到他们的踪迹。",dEN="The fallen necropolis to the west can only be assumed to still be filled with Scourge.\n\nWhile you are at Talramas, <class>, I would ask that you dispatch all of the Lich King's servants that you find within and in the surrounding pools where it fell.",o="在塔尔拉玛斯和溃烂之池杀死任意20名天灾军团成员，然后向亡者之穴以南的先知赫米萨复命。",oEN="Destroy 20 Scourge of any type at Talramas and the Festering Pools. Then, return to Sage Highmesa just to the south of The Dens of the Dying.",p="我想你不可能在这么短的时间之内就杀掉那么多的天灾军团渣滓吧？",pEN="Surely you could not have dispatched so many Scourge in such a short time?",c="谢谢你，<name>。\n\n巫妖王和他的天灾军团是诺森德的一大祸害。我们必须坚持下去，直到他们全部真正死去，直到他的存在彻底终结！",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nThe Lich King and his Scourge are a blight upon Northrend. We must not stop until they are all truly dead, and his existence is put to an end!"}
Q[11684]={d="你感觉到地表的震动了吗？\n\n天灾军团的蛛魔们正隐藏在我们脚下的深处。它们已经渗入了西南方的喷泉平原，并持续骚扰着冬风酋长派出的巡逻队。\n\n<这位牦牛人长老递给你一卷看起来非常古旧的地图。>\n\n或许巡逻队没能找到的东西，你这位冒险者可以独自找到。带上这张地图转至喷泉平原，将所有蛛魔虫孔的位置都标记出来。",dEN="Can you feel the tremors in the earth?\n\nThe Scourge's nerubians are on the move deep beneath the ground. They've emerged to the southwest in the Geyser Fields, and are harassing the patrols Chieftain Wintergale sent out.\n\n<The taunka elder offers you a worn map.>\n\nPerhaps a single person can succeed where the patrols have failed. Take this with you to the Geyser Fields and map out the locations of the Nerubian sinkholes.",o="牦牛村的玛罕宗父要求你使用喷泉平原地图标记出南部虫孔、西北部虫孔和东北部虫孔的位置。",oEN="Greatfather Mahan at Taunka'le Village wants you to use the Map of the Geyser Fields to mark the locations of the South Sinkhole, the Northwest Sinkhole, and the Northeast Sinkhole.",p="你记录下虫孔的位置了吗？",pEN="Have you marked the locations of the sinkholes?",c="<玛罕宗父接过地图，不过毫无检视的动作。>\n\n我们一旦准备好要实行计划，可以参考你的资讯。",cEN="<Greatfather Mahan accepts the map, but makes no move to examine it..>\n\nWe'll be able to use your information later, once we're prepared to carry out the plan."}
Q[11685]={d="那么，现在终于清楚这些蛛魔虫孔的位置了，我们应该立刻把它们全部封上，以阻止天灾军团的进犯。驯风者巴兰知道如何束缚元素、利用元素的力量摧毁那些地下通道，不过恐怕她需要你提供一些帮助。\n\n穿越村子附近东南方的冰冻平原，在海岸边有大量的冻土元素。我想，你在那里能采集到许多巴兰急需的元素之心。",dEN="Now that we know the exact locations of the nerubian sinkholes, we can collapse them to halt the Scourge offensive and cripple their force. Wind Tamer Barah knows a way to harness elementals to destroy the tunnels the Nerubians are using, but she will require your help.\n\nSoutheast of the village, near the coast beyond the Frozen Reach, you'll find an area dominated by frozen earth elementals. The hearts of these elements are exactly what Wind Tamer Barah will need.",o="将5份元素之心交给牦牛村的驯风者巴兰。",oEN="Bring 5 Elemental Hearts to Wind Tamer Barah at Taunka'le Village.",p="玛罕宗父告诉我你愿意去收集元素之心。",pEN="Greatfather Mahan tells me you have agreed to help collapse the tunnels.",c="这些应该足以创建一个强大的元素，不过只有石头可无法给予我的元素以生命。",cEN="These should be enough to form the core of a mighty elemental, but stone alone will not give my elemental life."}
Q[11686]={d="根据路德的笔记，天灾军团正把这里当作繁育场，养育你看到那些在地上爬行的怪物。\n\n<Ickoris se estremece>\n\n那些怪物曾经是兽人……牛头人……\n\n在制定计划之前，我们需要更多情报。我要你去调查三处天灾军团活动频繁的地点：此地西南方的战歌谷仓、正西方的托普农场，以及北边的旧战歌屠宰场。\n\n全部侦察完之后回来见我。",dEN="According to Luther's notes the Scourge is now using this place as a breeding ground for those monsters you see lumbering across the field.\n\n<Ickoris shudders.>\n\nThose monsters were once orcs... tauren...\n\nWe need more information before a plan can be devised. I want you to investigate three sites that are heavily trafficked by Scourge: the Warsong Granary, southwest of us, Torp's Farm, directly west of us, and the old Warsong Slaughterhouse, north of us.\n\nReturn to me once you've scouted 'em out.",o="战歌农场哨站的暗影密探伊克里斯要你去侦察战歌粮仓、托普的农场和战歌屠宰场的情况。",oEN="Shadowstalker Ickoris at Warsong Farms Outpost wants you to scout Warsong Granary, Torp's Farm, and Warsong Slaughterhouse.",p="你搜查过农场了吗？",pEN="Have you searched the farms?",c="这比路德日记里记载的还要糟糕得多。他们让天灾军团覆盖了这里，所触之处皆被感染。\n\n<Ickoris asiente>\n\n如果你能想象的话……情况还会更糟……",cEN="This is far worse than what was noted in Luther's journal. They've got this place covered in Scourge and are infecting everything they touch.\n\n<Ickoris nods.>\n\nIt gets worse - if you can imagine such a thing..."}
Q[11687]={d="他们俩……必须……除掉。\n\n博士……巫妖领主……就在浮空城里……上面。找到他们……杀……\n\n否则……一切……都晚了……",dEN="There are two... that must... be killed.\n\nThe doctor and... the lich-lord... are above. Find them... destroy them... before....\n\n...it is too... late....",o="杀死拉佐格林博士和巫妖领主基尔温特，然后向北风苔原亡者之穴以南的先知赫米萨复命。",oEN="Destroy Doctor Razorgrin and Lich-Lord Chillwinter. Then, return to Sage Highmesa just to the south of The Dens of Dying.",p="<name>，你回来了！",pEN="<name>, you return!",c="钢角死了？！\n\n我真不应该让他自己去那里的。",cEN="Bristlehorn is dead?!\n\nI should never have let him go there by himself."}
Q[11688]={d="看看吧，我漂亮的科多兽正在无助地挣扎，想要摆脱那些肮脏的死猪！帮我争取一些时间，$r。我想我可以治好科多兽的病，但你不能让这些死猪靠近它们，否则它们就再也不用治了！\n\n去把那些死猪送回坟墓——我是指永远地送回去！",dEN="Just look at 'em! My beautiful kodos are helpless to defend themselves against those filthy swine! I need you to buy me some time, <race>. I think I can cure the kodo of the sickness, but you need to keep the unliving swine off 'em, else there'll be nothin' left to cure!\n\nGet out there and send those swine to their graves - permanently!",o="战歌农场哨站的农夫托普要你杀死10只亡灵猪。",oEN="Farmer Torp at Warsong Farms Outpost wants you to kill 10 Unliving Swine.",p="我需要更多的时间！别让那些猪靠近我的科多兽！",pEN="I need more time! Keep those swine off my kodos!",c="我想我搞定了，<race>！",cEN="I think I've got it, <race>!"}
Q[11689]={d="$n，我们应该将这里发生的一切都告诉祖母。\n\n请你返回牦牛村，向祖母汇报情况。告诉她我随后就到。",dEN="The greatmother will need to know, <name>.\n\nWill you please return to Taunka'le? Tell her that I will be following shortly.",o="与牦牛村的塔迦祖母谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Greatmother Taiga at Taunka'le Village.",c="你从高山台地带来了什么消息？\n\n<你讲述了所知的情况，并把关于长跑者刺角的不幸消息告诉了祖母。>\n\n我的……我的孙子！\n\n<祖母努力控制着自己的情绪。>\n\n他像真正的牛头人一样光荣地战死了！\n\n你是最后一个陪在他身边的人，<name>，所以他将永远是你的一部分。谢谢你完成了他最后的遗愿。",cEN="What word do you bring from Highmesa?\n\n<You explain what you know and give the greatmother the bad news concerning Longrunner Bristlehorn.>\n\nMy... my grandson!\n\n<The greatmother fights to keep control of her emotions.>\n\nHe died an honorable death like a true taunka!\n\nYou were the last to be with him, <name>, so he shall always be a part of you. I give you my thanks for completing his last wishes."}
Q[11690]={d="拿着这副骑乘笼头，$n。你会注意到我在衔嘴里装了一个小小的药物投放器。科多兽一咬下去，那东西就能治好感染。等治好它们的病，你就得把它们骑回家。它们会很虚弱，所以你要慢慢地引导它们。\n\n把我的宝贝们带回来，$n！\n\n啊，最后一件事：你有十分钟！解毒剂在笼头里只能保持这么久的效力。",dEN="Take this riding snaffle, <name>. You'll notice that I've placed a tiny medicine dispenser in the mouthpiece. That thing will cure the infection as soon as a kodo bites down. Once you've cured the sick out of 'em, you'll need to ride 'em home. They'll be weak so you'll need to gently direct 'em here.\n\nBring my babies back, <name>!\n\nOne last thing, you've got ten minutes! That's how long the antidote will remain effective inside that snaffle.",o="战歌农场哨站的农夫托普要你帮忙解救8只被感染的科多兽。",oEN="Farmer Torp at Warsong Farms Outpost wants you to rescue 8 Infected Kodo Beasts.",p="帮它们逃出那些天灾军团受感染的田地！",pEN="Get them out of those Scourge infested fields!",c="你是个真正的英雄，<name>。没有你，我的科多兽早就死在外面了。我感谢你，所有将用这些科多兽加强我们在诺森德驻军的士兵和学徒们也感谢你！",cEN="You're a true hero, <name>. My kodos would have died out there without you. You have my thanks and the thanks of all the soldiers and journeymen that will use these kodos to strengthen our presence in Northrend!"}
Q[11691]={d="我和其它萨满祭司已经做好了与冰霜领主作战的准备。$n，你就是大地之母的先锋军。\n\n对着东北边的寒冰之石使用这根熔岩图腾。埃霍恩正在通过寒冰之石引导自身的能量，如果我们利用图腾打断这一过程，就有希望切断他与元素位面的联系。\n\n运气够好的话，我们或许还能击败他。\n\n$n，准备作战吧。一旦埃霍恩发现你扰乱了能量引导仪式，他必定会勃然大怒。",dEN="I and my Shamans have gathered our powers for the coming battle with the Lord of Frost. <name>, you will be the fist of the Earthmother.\n\nTake this magma totem. Use it against the Ice Stone, to the northeast. Ahune is channeling his power through this stone; it is our hope that the totem will disrupt him and cut off his link to the elemental planes.\n\nIf fortune is with us, then, perhaps, we can defeat him.\n\nPrepare yourself, <name>. If Ahune comes to face us, then his fury will be great.",o="将大地之环熔岩图腾带到寒冰之石旁边去。",oEN="Bring the Earthen Ring Magma Totem to the Ice Stone.",c="当熔岩图腾被带到冰石旁边时，突然爆发出三道分流的火焰。石头闪烁着，接着消失无踪……",cEN="The magma totem bursts into three separate flames as it is brought near the ice stone. The stone shimmers, then is gone..."}
Q[11692]={d="你已经证明自己是$gun gran héroe:una gran heroína;。我又遇到一个麻烦！\n\n我的老板汀奇和比克西·扳手一起往东去了，可我怎么也弄不好这玩意儿的输出装置！只有汀奇能修好它，而我们非常需要它百分之百正常运转。\n\n你觉得你能找到她们吗？比克西说过要跟着一头老猛犸人去一个叫垂死巢穴的地方。\n\n我猜你会在那里找到她们。\n\n跟跑道上的卡拉·三颗星谈谈，你就能搭个便车过去。",dEN="You're a proven <hero /heroine>. I have another problem!\n\nMy boss, Tinky, went east with Bixie Wrenchshanker and I CAN'T get the outgoing on this thing to work! Tinky's the only one that can fix it and we really need it working one-hundred percent.\n\nYou think you could find them? Bixie said something about following some old magnataur to a place called The Dens of Dying.\n\nI'm guessing that's where you'll find them.\n\nYou can catch a ride out there by talking with Kara Thricestar at the runway.",o="墨尔杜·旋轮要你转至亡者之穴以南寻找比希·钳柄。",oEN="Mordle Cogspinner has asked you to find Bixie Wrenchshanker to the south of The Dens of Dying.",c="你需要什么，<class>？",cEN="What do you need, <class>?"}
Q[11693]={d="我和丁奇一路跟踪几个年迈的猛犸人到了亡者之穴，这里显然是猛犸人氏族的陵墓。\n\n他们进入这片区域后，莫名其妙地感染上了天灾疫病。你说，怎么能让患病的生物随意走来走去呢，真是污染环境。\n\n在我计划下一步行动的时候，你能不能解决掉这些家伙？",dEN="Tinky and I came out here stalking some old magnataur. Apparently those caves up there are where they go to die.\n\nOf course, we had no idea that they were going to get plagued when they went in there. We can't have plagued things just roaming about; it's not healthy.\n\nSay, why don't you put down a number of those things while I figure out what our next step should be?",o="杀死10名天灾猛犸人，然后向亡者之穴以南的比希·钳柄复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Plagued Magnataur and then return to Bixie Wrenchshanker to the south of The Dens of Dying.",c="干得漂亮，不过我建议你下次有机会赶快洗个澡吧。\n\n现在，让我们真正来处理这里的问题。",cEN="Nice work, but I'd grab a shower the next chance you get.\n\nNow, let's really deal with the problem out here."}
Q[11694]={d="在你解决那些感染瘟疫的猛犸人时，我偷偷地观察了一下高处的洞穴。\n\n原来有诅咒教徒在里面散播瘟疫的种子！\n\n他们将某种有毒的混合物投入瘟疫之锅进行蒸煮。喏，这种粉尘具有抗毒的效用，我又往里面加了些别的料，它应该可以中和瘟疫之锅！\n\n将它撒入锅中，看看能不能生效吧。",dEN="So, while you were out taking care of those plagued beasts, I took a peek inside the caves up there.\n\nThere are cultists in there plaguing them!\n\nThey have some sort of noxious concoction brewing in a cauldron. I have a powder that I normally use as an anti-poison, and I mixed it up with some other stuff. I think it'll neutralize their brew!\n\nTake it up to one of those caves and see if it works.",o="亡者之穴以南的比希·钳柄要你进入亡者之穴，对一口瘟疫之锅使用比希的中和药粉。",oEN="Bixie Wrenchshanker, skulking just to the south of The Dens of Dying, has asked you to use Bixie's Inhibiting Powder at a Den of Dying Plague Cauldron to neutralize it.",c="我知道东西在你身上。现在我需要你去处理其它东西。",cEN="I knew you had it in you. Now there's something else that I need to ask you to take care of."}
Q[11695]={d="我可以用这些毫无生气的石块制造出类似元素生物的东西，不过为它赋予生命就比较麻烦了，所以我需要一点点运气和你的帮助。\n\n在牦牛人的传说中，有一件被称为元素愤怒号角的神器，伟大的牦牛人英雄一直在寻找它。喏，这就是写有那个传说的卷轴，你可以从中发现关于号角碎片的线索。我不知道这些线索是不是真的，但这时候了，也只好撞撞运气。如果传说是真的，那么号角的碎片可能在村子北边和西南边的洪荒平原上。",dEN="I can fashion the likeness of an elemental from these pieces of inanimate stone, but breathing life into it is different. For that, we'll need help and a bit of luck.\n\nLegend tells of an ancient artifact called the Horn of Elemental Fury, sought after by a great hero. I'll lend you a scroll with a copy of the tale. I don't know if the legend is true, but it's our best bet. If the legend is right, the parts of the horn may be in the Flood Plains surrounding the village to the north and southwest.",o="从布戈布咕酋长和咕戈布咕酋长手中夺得号角的上半截和号角的下半截，将它们交给牦牛村的驯风者巴兰。",oEN="Reclaim the Lower Horn Half and Upper Horn Half from Chieftain Burblegoggle and Chieftain Gurgleboggle and bring them to Wind Tamer Barah at Taunka'le Village.",p="你成功找到号角了吗？传说是真的吗？",pEN="Were you able to find the horn? Was the legend true?",c="<巴拉接过你手中的号角碎片，开始试着把它们拼起来。>\n\n风暴之蹄会为你骄傲的，<name>。也许等我们解决了天灾军团，我会带着这只号角去风暴之蹄的坟墓朝圣。",cEN="<Barah accepts the pieces of the horn from you and begins trying to fit them together.>\n\nStormhoof would be proud of you, <name>. Perhaps when we've dealt with the Scourge, I will take the horn with me on a pilgrimage to Stormhoof's tomb."}
Q[11696]={d="$n，你能来帮忙真是太好啦。埃霍恩就躲藏在盘牙水库的洞穴中养精蓄锐，准备大干一场。大地之环已经派出了先遣队，但是凭他们的力量绝不可能战胜埃霍恩。\n\n$n，找到大地之环的萨满祭司，与领队鲁玛·天母谈一谈。或许我们能在你的帮助下击败埃霍恩，拯救整个世界。",dEN="<name>, your presence is a blessing. Ahune lies within these caverns, gathering strength for his assault. Earthen Ring forces were sent ahead, but they alone cannot defeat him.\n\nExplore, <name>. Find our Earthen Ring Shamans and speak with their leader, Luma Skymother. Perhaps, with your added strength, we can beat Ahune before it's too late.",o="转至奴隶围栏，寻找鲁玛·天母的下落。",oEN="Find Luma Skymother in the Slave Pens.",c="阿胡恩的寒冷蔓延在这些洞穴中，<name>；那是一颗冰寒死亡的种子，一旦他恢复全部力量，就会等着我们。我感谢大地母亲派你前来。",cEN="The cold of Ahune spreads through these caverns, <name>; a seed of the frigid death that awaits us if he gains his full strength. I thank the Earthmother for sending you."}
Q[11697]={d="我叫汀奇别一个人去，可她非得亲自去看看西边那座坠毁的通灵塔。\n\n我百分之百确定那些教徒就是从那里出来的，也就是说我现在百分之百确定汀奇有麻烦了！\n\n她是简易机场的头号工程师。没有她我们就完了！\n\n我本想自己去找她，可还没来得及再次消失，就被那种东西在腿上抓了一把。$n，要是有人能救她出来，那就是你！",dEN="I told Tinky not to go off on her own, but she just HAD to check out that crashed necropolis to the west.\n\nI'm 100% certain that those cultists came from inside that thing, which means I'm now 100% certain that Tinky's in trouble!\n\nShe's the airstrip's number one engineer. Without her we're doomed!\n\nI'd find her myself, but one of those things got in a swipe on my leg before I could vanish again. <name>, if anyone can get her out, it's you!",o="进入塔尔拉玛斯寻找丁奇·火哨。",oEN="Find Tinky Wickwhistle inside Talramas.",c="嘿！你是谁啊？\n\n比希派你来的？太棒了，帮我逃出这里吧！",cEN="Hey there! Who are you?\n\nBixie sent you? Excellent, let's get me out of here!"}
Q[11698]={d="既然那些教徒都能安然无事地活下来，西边那座坠落的浮空城中肯定塞满了天灾军团的成员。浮空城前面的池塘说不定早就被他们占领了！\n\n$c，你有信心杀入塔尔拉玛斯，铲除巫妖王的仆从吗？",dEN="If the cultists up in those caves survived the crash, then that fallen necropolis to the west can only be assumed to still be filled with Scourge. There're probably lots of them out in front of it in the pools, too!\n\nWhile you're at Talramas, <class>, do you think you could dispatch all of the Lich King's flunkies that you find there?",o="在塔尔拉玛斯和溃烂之池杀死任意20名天灾军团成员，然后向亡者之穴以南的比希·钳柄复命。",oEN="Destroy 20 Scourge of any type at Talramas and the Festering Pools. Then, return to Bixie Wrenchshanker just to the south of The Dens of the Dying.",c="谢谢你，<name>。\n\n巫妖王和他的天灾军团确实很可怕，但在他们全都静静躺进新坟之前，我们不能停下！",cEN="Thanks, <name>.\n\nThe Lich King and his Scourge are really scary, but we can't stop until they are all lying still in new graves!"}
Q[11699]={d="那些教徒利用魔法诱使我踩入陷阱。瞧，这牢笼连个门都没有。幸好他们还不知道我是机场的首席传送工程师！\n\n只要你肯帮忙，我很快就能逃出来。当然，这件事稍微有点麻烦。\n\n你得从食尸鬼那里搞到引擎核心水晶，从某个博士手中夺得魔法陀螺仪，还要从顶层的巫妖领主那里抢到导航天灾石。\n\n将这三件零件交给我，我就可以制造一台传送装置，利用它返回机场。哼哼，这就是侏儒的逃跑方式！",dEN="The cultists magicked me into this cage and there's no door to it. Little did they know that I'm the chief transmatter engineer for the airstrip!\n\nWith your help, and a little elbow-grease, I won't be in here for long.\n\nI'm going to need an engine-core crystal from one of the ghouls in here, a magical gyroscope from their doctor, and a piloting scourgestone from the lich-lord up top.\n\nWith all of that stuff, I should be able to make a port device to get back to Fizzcrank's and escape the gnome way!",o="将引擎核心水晶、魔法陀螺仪和导航天灾石交给塔尔拉玛斯的丁奇·火哨。",oEN="Collect an Engine-Core Crystal, a Magical Gyroscope, and a Piloting Scourgestone. Deliver them to Tinky Wickwhistle at Talramas.",p="你拿到所有东西了吗？",pEN="You got all of that stuff?",c="太棒了！现在只要小小的调整一下这里，还有转一转那里……",cEN="Outstanding! Now just a little modification here, and a tweak there...."}
Q[11700]={d="我的邪恶双胞胎还在外面。\n\n我敢肯定她并没有返回机场。事实上，她现在待的地方比这里冷多了。不过我偶尔才能“感应”到她。\n\n哦，我打算改造这台设备，尽快传送回机场。你能不能去东边告诉比希，就说我等她回去碰面？\n\n$n，谢谢你！",dEN="My evil twin's out there somewhere now.\n\nI'm pretty sure that she's not back at the airstrip. In fact, wherever she ended up, it's colder there than here. But I could only 'feel' her for a moment.\n\nOh well, I'll reconfigure this thing and port myself back to the airstrip soon enough. In the meantime, do you think you could go east and let Bixie know that I'll meet her back there?\n\nThanks, <name>!",o="与亡者之穴以南的比希·钳柄谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bixie Wrenchshanker just south of The Dens of Dying.",c="丁奇有个不幸的双胞胎？！\n\n好吧，要是她说她可以的话，那她就有办法快速地将她自己带回简易机场，对我来说算好事。",cEN="Tinky's got an evil twin?!\n\nWell, if she says she's okay, and that she'll be able to get herself back to the airstrip soon, that's good enough for me."}
Q[11701]={d="那么，我也要启程返回机场了。你瞧，我的腿受伤了，看来路上要耽搁不少时间。\n\n你不如先回去向菲兹兰克·铁阀汇报好消息？我敢打赌他会赏你点什么。\n\n$n，谢谢你！",dEN="Okay, I think I'm going to start making my way back to the airstrip, too. Of course, I'm moving a little slower with this leg injury.\n\nSay, do you think you could get there ahead of me and pass on the good news to Ol' Fizzcrank? I bet anything that there'll be a reward in it for you.\n\nThanks, <name>!",o="与北风苔原菲兹兰克机场的菲兹兰克·铁阀谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Fizzcrank Fullthrottle at Fizzcrank Airstrip in Borean Tundra.",c="这真是段传奇故事，<name>。这里有这么多麻烦，简易机场还没被灭掉简直是个奇迹。\n\n不过多亏了你，少了一个需要担心的对手。\n\n我特意为这种场合留了些特别的东西。你何不挑一件呢？",cEN="That's quite a tale, <name>. With all of the problems out here, it's a wonder that the airstrip hasn't been wiped out already.\n\nBut, thanks to you, there's one less adversary to worry about.\n\nI put aside some special things for just such an occasion as this. Why don't you take your pick?"}
Q[11702]={d="这话说出来有点怪，$c，但有个鱼人在向我们求助！\n\n他叫姆嘎姆嘎国王，是冬鳍鱼人的首领。他和他的族人被赶出了村庄，他想让你去救他们。\n\n往西走，下到悬崖下面就能找到他。他在冬鳍避难所的南侧。",dEN="Dis is gonna sound weird, <class>, but dere be a murloc askin' for our help!\n\nHe goes by da name of King Mrgl-Mrgl, leader of da Winterfin murlocs. Him and his people been run outa dere village and wantin' you to come save dem.\n\nYou find him by headin' west and go down da cliffs. He hangin' out on da south side of da Winterfin Retreat.",o="与冬鳞避难所的国王姆嘎姆嘎谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with King Mrgl-Mrgl at Winterfin Retreat.",c="终于来人了，救命啊！看你的样子，你是部落。\n\n好极了……你们非常熟悉战斗的技术。我们未来将会很需要该种技巧。",cEN="Finally, help! And by the looks of you, Horde.\n\nThat's alright... your people are very skilled in the art of combat. We're going to need a lot of that."}
Q[11703]={d="天灾军团的一个通灵师正在绑架部落士兵，并将他们变成亡灵怪物。西北方的农场就是他的生产基地。暗影密探盖特莱已经在那里潜伏了一周，他收集到了一些非常重要的情报，可能会帮助我们解决这个威胁。\n\n去找到盖特莱并设法帮他摧毁这条天灾军团的生产线，你可以在农场西北边界的废弃塔楼里找到盖特莱。",dEN="The Scourge agent that's overseeing the abduction and transformation of Horde soldiers into undead monsters is using the northwest farm as a spawning glade. Shadowstalker Getry has been staking out that monster for the past week and has gathered some vital information that might allow us to end this menace.\n\nGet to Getry and see if you can help him put a stop to this Scourge assembly line. You'll find Getry at the abandoned tower on the northwest border of these farms.",o="在战歌农场中寻找暗影密探盖特莱。",oEN="Find Shadowstalker Getry at Warsong Farms.",c="<盖特莱仔细的看着你。>\n\n这就是伊克里斯所能派来的人？",cEN="<Getry looks you over.>\n\nThis is all Ickoris could send?"}
Q[11704]={d="这事有些古怪，$c，居然有个鱼人来向我们求救！\n\n他自称国王姆嘎姆嘎，是冬鳞鱼人的首领。他和他的人民好象被什么人从村子里赶了出来，需要有人去救他们。\n\n你就是那个能救他们命的人！\n\n往西方走，一直走到悬崖底下就能找到冬鳞避难所和那位国王大人了。他就在毒泡水池附近的水边等你。",dEN="This is the weirdest thing, <class>, but there's a murloc asking for our help!\n\nHe goes by the name of King Mrgl-Mrgl, leader of the Winterfin murlocs. It would seem that he and his people have been run out of their village and they want someone to come save them.\n\nThat someone is you!\n\nYou'll find Winterfin Retreat, and the king, by heading west down the road until you come to the cliffs. Head down to the water line near the Blistering Pool.",o="与冬鳞避难所的国王姆嘎姆嘎谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with King Mrgl-Mrgl at Winterfin Retreat.",c="终于来人了，救命啊！看你的样子，你是联盟。\n\n很好……你的人民非常熟习于战斗的艺术。我们未来将会很需要该种技巧。",cEN="Finally, help! And by the looks of you, Alliance.\n\nThat's good... your people are very skilled in the art of combat. We're going to need a lot of that."}
Q[11705]={d="这太疯狂了。他们怎么会指望我们对付一个天灾死灵领主和数目不明的爪牙？\n\n<格特瑞叹了口气。>\n\n如果是伊科里斯派你来的，那他一定认为你有能力成就大事。也许今天会有奇迹降临，嗯？\n\n等你$gpreparado:preparada;，我们就下去面对瓦里杜斯。\n\n如果我们能全身而退，就去战歌要塞向地狱咆哮汇报。",dEN="This is madness. How do they expect us to take on a Scourge necrolord and an unknown number of his minions?\n\n<Getry sighs.>\n\nIf Ickoris sent you he must think that you are capable of great feats. Perhaps you will call down a miracle today, eh?\n\nWhen you're ready we will descend and face Varidus.\n\nIf we make it out of this mess in one piece, report back to Hellscream in Warsong Hold.",o="帮助格特瑞在战歌农场击败剥皮者瓦里杜斯。\n\n若成功，向加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮汇报。|n",oEN="Help Getry defeat Varidus the Flenser at Warsong Farms.\n\nReport to Garrosh Hellscream should you succeed.",p="<地狱咆哮瞠目结舌地看着你。>\n\n我听到有关天灾通灵领主的消息是什么？",pEN="<Hellscream raises an eyebrow at you.>\n\nWhat's this I hear about a Scourge necrolord?",c="如同我想的一样，你凯旋归来了！我对萨鲁法尔说过你做得到的。\n\n<地狱咆哮故意咕哝着。>\n\n也许这可以让那个老家伙知道他并不总是对的，是吧？",cEN="And you returned victorious, just as I thought! I told Saurfang you'd be fine.\n\n<Hellscream grunts knowingly.>\n\nPerhaps this will show that old dog that he doesn't have all the answers, eh?"}
Q[11706]={d="我利用这只元素愤怒号角创造出了奥卢维斯，并将它束缚在了号角内。你带着它转至喷泉平原，在最南方的虫孔旁吹响这只号角，奥卢维斯就会响应你的召唤，出现在你的面前。\n\n奥卢维斯制造出的大地震足以使蛛魔的隧道体系彻底崩塌，并就此终止它们那没完没了的偷袭。不过，你要小心一点，那些蛛魔的头目很有可能在地震发生时出现在你面前。这也正好，如果地震还不能使它们停止进攻，那么再失去头目，它们恐怕就真的要大伤元气了。",dEN="I have created and bound Alluvius using the Horn of Elemental Fury. He will respond to the horn's call when you stand near the southernmost sinkhole in the Geyser Fields.\n\nThe quake Alluvius will unleash should collapse the Nerubian tunnels and put an end to their flanking attack. I wouldn't be surprised if the Nerubian commander showed himself after the quake. If the collapse of the tunnels doesn't break the back of their assault, the defeat of their leader surely will.",o="牦牛村的驯风者巴兰要求你使用元素愤怒号角将蛛魔的虫孔弄塌，并击败克里卡希斯。",oEN="Wind Tamer Barah at Taunka'le Village wants you to collapse the Nerubian sinkholes using the Horn of Elemental Fury and defeat Lord Kryxix.",p="你释放了奥卢维斯并摧毁蛛魔的攻击了吗？",pEN="Have you unleashed Alluvius and destroyed the Nerubian assault?",c="你对抗蛛魔的努力使我们暂时不受天灾军团的攻击。感谢你让我们可以无需担心来自西边的攻击从而可以进攻东北边的天灾堡垒。\n\n至于这个号角我将会保护它，一直到下次我们需要它的力量之时。雷蹄付出了他的生命来守护这个号角，我们无法承受它再一次遗失。",cEN="Your efforts against the Nerubians have given us a reprieve from the overwhelming Scourge assault. Thanks to your accomplishments, we can strike at the the Scourge fortress to the northeast without fear of attack from the west.\n\nAs for the horn, I will safeguard it until next we need its power. Stormhoof gave his life to secure the horn and we cannot suffer its loss again."}
Q[11707]={d="你是$n，对吧？\n\n北边的菲兹兰克机场需要你的帮助！猛犸人、天灾军团……还有泵站！\n\n情况糟透了，糟透了！\n\n我要你立即赶去那里，向菲兹兰克·铁阀报到！现在就出发！",dEN="Oh good, you're <name>, right?\n\nWe need your help up north at Fizzcrank Airstrip, like yesterday! The magnataur, and the Scourge... and the pumping station!\n\nIt's madness I tell you, madness!\n\nYou've got to head up there and talk to old man Fullthrottle a.s.a.p.!",o="与菲兹兰克机场的菲兹兰克·铁阀谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Fizzcrank Fullthrottle at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",c="看来跳天空的终于想起来派帮手了。而且来得一点都不早！\n\n欢迎，<brother /sister>，我们非常需要你的帮助！",cEN="I see that Skyhopper finally got around to sending help. And none too soon I might add!\n\nWelcome, <brother /sister>, we need your help badly!"}
Q[11708]={d="你既然来了，就先听我讲讲当前的情况。\n\n听完之后，去外面找副指挥官金吉·温纳特谈一谈。从现在起，她负责处理所有的事务。",dEN="Now that you're here, it's time for me to tell you the full story of what's going on.\n\nAfter you've heard my tale, go outside and find my second-in-command, Jinky Wingnut. She'll handle everything from here on out.",o="听菲兹兰克·铁阀讲诉当前的情况，然后与菲兹兰克机场的金吉·温纳特谈一谈。",oEN="Listen to Fizzcrank Fullthrottle's tale and then find Jinky Wingnut at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="嗨你好。",pEN="Hello there.",c="老头派你来找我，是吗？他跟你讲了发生的所有事情吗？\n\n很好……我们开始动手处理吧！",cEN="The old man sent you to me, huh? He tell you everything that's going on out here?\n\nGood... let's take care of business then!"}
Q[11709]={d="为了确保我们在这片冰冻的荒野上有一处立足之地，你付出了不懈的努力，但是阴影中依然危机四伏。我要你转至战歌要塞东南方的俘虏收容所，帮助典狱官诺克·血怒处理押送和交接囚犯的事务。\n\n$n，解散。",dEN="While you have done much to secure our foothold in these frozen wastes, other dangers still lurk in the shadows. I want you to assist Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy, stationed at the internment camp just outside and immediately southeast of Warsong Hold. Seek him out and offer your assistance for prisoner transport and exchange.\n\nYou are dismissed, <name>.",o="与北风苔原中战歌要塞的典狱官诺克·血怒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Warden Nork Bloodfrenzy at Warsong Hold in Borean Tundra.",c="<诺克嗤笑一声。>\n\n俘虏？这些可不是俘虏。他们是一群胆小鬼！看看他们。你知道吗，这些\"士兵\"无一例外，个个都是软骨头，跑到我们门口交出武器和盔甲？\n\n据我们了解，这些男男女女一旦被我们俘虏，就会被遣散送回老家。\n\n<诺克啐了一口。>\n\n真可悲……",cEN="<Nork scoffs.>\n\nPrisoners? These aren't prisoners. They're cowardly dogs! Just look at 'em. Did you know that without exception, every single one of these yellow-bellied \"soldiers\" came to our gates and surrendered their arms and armor?\n\nFrom what we've been able to gather, these men and women are discharged and sent back to their homes if captured by us.\n\n<Nork spits.>\n\nPathetic..."}
Q[11710]={d="备用零件散落在东边的滚烫熔池和喷泉平原……甚至连那座泵站附近都有。替我收集一些零件。我或许能利用它们修好这台设备的传出装置，另外还得调整传入装置。\n\n我实在不想再出什么事故了……",dEN="There're spare parts strewn all over to the east in the Scalding Pools, the Geyser Fields... heck, probably even up on the pumping station still, too. Bring back a whole bunch. Maybe then I'll be able to get outgoing teleport on this thing working, not to mention getting the incoming transmatter ports aligned.\n\nI'd hate to see another accident....",o="将15个菲兹兰克备用零件交给菲兹兰克机场的墨尔杜·旋轮。",oEN="Collect 15 Fizzcrank Spare Parts and deliver them to Mordle Cogspinner at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="要让这个玩意儿维持运作需要非常多备用零件。\n\n拜托你告诉我，你带了所有需要的东西回来。",pEN="It's going to take a lot of spare parts to keep this thing running.\n\nPlease tell me that you've returned with everything we need.",c="太好了，<class>！这些零件看起来还能用。\n\n现在只要我能弄清楚怎么修好这鬼东西就好了……",cEN="That's great, <class>! These parts look like they're in serviceable condition.\n\nNow if I could only figure out how to fix this blasted thing...."}
Q[11711]={d="每天都有更多逃兵出现在我们门口。我们实在没有足够的空间把那些蛆虫都关起来。尤其是如果我们还想让猪群满意的话。\n\n<诺克像猪一样哼哼着笑了。>\n\n我要你把其中一个胆小鬼押送到此地以东的十字路口，然后发射这支信号枪。他们的某位队长看到信号就会出现，把这个胆小鬼带走。\n\n交接完成后，去东路向斥候通戈克汇报。|n",dEN="We're seeing more deserters show up at our gates with each passing day. We simply do not have enough room to keep all of these maggots caged up. Especially not if we want to keep the pigs happy.\n\n<Nork snorts as he laughs.>\n\nI want you to escort one of these cowards to the crossroads east of here and fire this flare gun. One of their captains will show up when they see the flare and take the coward off your hands.\n\nReport to Scout Tungok on the east road once the delivery has been made.",o="将联盟逃兵押送到战歌要塞东边的十字路口，鸣响战歌信号枪通知联盟。\n\n顺利完成押送任务后向斥候图古克报到。",oEN="Take the Alliance Deserter to the crossroads east of Warsong Hold and fire your Warsong Flare Gun to signal the Alliance.\n\nReport to Scout Tungok once you have successfully delivered the Alliance Deserter to their destination.",p="<图古克嘀咕了几声。>\n\n你有好好照料那些逃兵吗？",pEN="<Tungok grunts.>\n\nDid you take care of the deserter?",c="干得好，<name>。又少了一个我们要养着的肮脏无用的联盟渣滓……\n\n如果你还想找活干，附近的牛头人和血精灵需要帮忙。\n\n当然，我们自己在这里也有一堆麻烦要处理……",cEN="Good job, <name>. That's one less filthy, useless, Alliance scum-bag that we'll have to provide for...\n\nIf you're lookin' for more work, the tauren and blood elf nearby need some help.\n\n'Course we've got our own set of problems to deal with out here as well..."}
Q[11712]={d="如果你听了那老头的话，你就知道外面有些侏儒被改造了。机械师梅卡佐德用一种逆转了\"血肉诅咒\"的东西感染了他们，现在他们成了机器人！\n\n我们认为有办法把他们重新诅咒回正常状态。我们要你带上这支复咏异物注射剂，用在任何你遇到的机械侏儒的尸体上。\n\n我们希望这东西能治好他们，让我们能锁定他们的位置，把他们传送出来。\n\n你说怎么样，$n？",dEN="If you listened to the old man, then you know that we have gnomes out there that were changed. Gearmaster Mechazod infected them with something that reversed the \"Curse of the Flesh\", and now they're robots!\n\nWe think we have a way to re-curse them back to normal. We want you to take this re-cursive transmatter injection and use it on the corpses of any mechagnomes you come across.\n\nWe're hoping that this stuff will cure them and allow us to lock onto them to port 'em out of there.\n\nWhaddya say, <name>?",o="菲兹兰克机场的金吉·温纳特要你对6名菲兹兰克机械侏儒使用物质转换注射器。",oEN="Jinky Wingnut at Fizzcrank Airstrip has asked you to use the Re-Cursive Transmatter Injection on 6 Fizzcrank Mechagnomes.",p="你成功把多少机械侏儒重新诅咒了，<class>？",pEN="How many mechagnomes did you manage to re-curse, <class>?",c="你办到了……这有效！\n\n我简直不敢相信你能救了这么多人。我们真幸运能有你帮忙！",cEN="You did it... it worked!\n\nI can't believe you were able to save so many. We're fortunate to have you around here!"}
Q[11713]={d="菲兹兰克早先派出了一支空中侦察部队去探察喷泉平原南部的虫孔位置，可他们一直没有回来。我们没有更多的时间来等待这些情报了，所以现在必须立刻派人徒步去找到那些虫孔。\n\n我知道这非常危险，所以我会付给你非常可观的报酬。拿上这张地图，到了平原上之后，将你遇到的每一个虫孔的所有重要信息都标在上面。",dEN="Fizzcrank sent out an aerial surveillance team to map the Nerubian sinkholes in the southern part of the Geyser Fields, but they haven't yet returned. I can't afford to wait any longer for their information, so I'm going to need someone to check out the sinkholes on foot.\n\nI understand the dangers involved, and I'll compensate you accordingly. Take this map with you and record the vital information about each of the sinkholes you encounter out there.",o="菲兹兰克机场的阿布尼·扭矩要求你使用喷泉平原地图标记出南部虫孔、西北部虫孔和东北部虫孔的位置。",oEN="Abner Fizzletorque at Fizzcrank Airstrip wants you to use the Map of the Geyser Fields to mark the locations of the South Sinkhole, the Northwest Sinkhole, and the Northeast Sinkhole.",p="你记录下虫孔的位置了吗？",pEN="Have you marked the locations of the sinkholes?",c="<阿布尼接过你手上的地图，然后仔细的检视。>\n\n太好了！这全都是我们即将着手的工作所需要的讯息。",cEN="<Abner accepts the map from you, then examines it closely.>\n\nGreat! This is all the information we need to begin the operation."}
Q[11714]={d="也许你有兴趣帮我清理这些田地？到处都是肮脏的小老鼠人！狗头人、雪地狗头人，随便你怎么叫，到处都是。光是那股臭味就把我的生活变成了地狱！\n\n替我收拾掉那些害虫，我会给你应有的报酬，$n。|n",dEN="Perhaps you'd be interested in helping me clean up these fields? They're littered with dirty little rat men! Kobolds, snobolds, whatever you wanna call 'em, they're all over the damned place. The stink alone is making my life hell!\n\nTake care of the vermin for me and I'll make it worth your while, <name>.",o="血孢平原的斥候图古克要你杀死8个血孢收割者、5个血孢点火者和2个血孢烘烤者。",oEN="Scout Tungok at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill 8 Bloodspore Harvesters, 5 Bloodspore Firestarters and 2 Bloodspore Roasters.",p="这个工作真臭……",pEN="This job stinks...",c="<name>，干得好！谢谢你！",cEN="A job well done, <name>! Thank you!"}
Q[11715]={d="我计划建造一台能制造出高频率高幅度地震的机器，用它来彻底震塌天灾蛛魔用于布置兵力的地下隧道网。当前，建造计划的最大难题在于燃料，我们的主钻井系统状态不太好，所以必须另想办法为它收集足够的燃料。\n\n外面喷泉平原的东南方地区有许多冒着泡的油塘，如果你能在那些油塘里采集到足够的油，我就可以从中提炼出适合这台机器的燃料。\n\n你只需要把这个收集器放近池边，它会自动将油吸进油箱的。",dEN="I plan to build a machine that will collapse the tunnels the Scourge is using to deploy their Nerubians, but with the main drilling rig out of order, we'll have to collect the fuel for the device some other way.\n\nOut in the Geyser Fields to the southeast, small pools of oil bubble up away from the main rig. If you can collect enough of the oil from those pools, I can make a crude fuel to power the machine.\n\nSimply deploy the collector near the rig, and it will pump and store the oil in its tank.",o="菲兹兰克机场的阿布尼·扭矩要求你利用移动采油器收集8桶油。",oEN="Abner Fizzletorque at Fizzcrank Airstrip wants you to collect 8 Barrels of Oil using the Portable Oil Collector.",p="你搞到石油了吗？",pEN="Do you have that fuel?",c="<阿布尼开始吸取收集器的油箱。>\n\n手工进行提取会搞得脏兮兮的，但我可以很快地拥有成品。在这段时间内，我们需要更多的原料来完成这个机器。",cEN="<Abner sets about draining the fuel tank of the collector.>\n\nDistilling this by hand is going to be messy, but I'll have it taken care of soon. In the meantime, we'll need one more material to complete the machine."}
Q[11716]={d="我们正在见证一件了不起的事，$r。一整个未知的生态系统就在离我们几步远的地方呼吸生长！我猜是覆盖这片土地的鲜血孢子植物造就了这一切。\n\n我从附近雄性鲜血孢子植物上采集了一些花粉，但还缺用于授粉的雌性受体。去给我摘一把鲜血孢子心皮来。你会在我们周围较大的植物附近找到它们。\n\n小心它们的守卫！狗头人可不会轻易让出它们！",dEN="We are witnessing something amazing here, <race>. A whole undiscovered ecology lives and breathes not more than a few paces from us! I surmise it is the bloodspore plant that sets this environment abuzz.\n\nI have collected some pollen from the nearby male species of bloodspore plant but still lack female receptors for pollination. Fetch me a bushel of the bloodspore carpels. You'll find them near the larger plants surrounding us.\n\nBe wary of their guardians! The kobolds won't give them up easily!",o="血孢平原的血法师劳莉丝要你收集10片血孢心皮。",oEN="Bloodmage Laurith at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra wants you to recover 10 Bloodspore Carpels.",p="测试一定得继续下去！",pEN="The tests must continue!",c="漂亮！真是漂亮！\n\n<劳莉丝对着一朵血孢心皮铺了一阵花粉雾，接着念出一段咒文。>\n\n呃……我不懂。除非……啊当然啦！",cEN="Lovely! Just lovely!\n\n<Laurith applies a sprinkling of pollen to one of the bloodspore carpels and then utters an incantation.>\n\nHrmph... I don't understand. Unless... Why of course!"}
Q[11717]={d="我就知道！这种植株是以北风苔原的血孢巨蛾为媒介完成授粉的。那么这些蛾子体内一定含有某种类似催化剂的物质吧。$n，我都想明白啦。难怪狗头人不杀这些蛾子，还大老远地跑来保护它们！这些小蠢货看来早就知道了这一点！\n\n那么，我们需要一些蛾子身上的花粉！怎么样？看在科学研究的份上，帮帮我吧！",dEN="It's obvious! The bloodspore moths are the entities responsible for pollination on these plains. It must be something that happens within the moth's internal system that acts as a catalyst for this pollen to work. It's all starting to make sense now, <name>. That's why the kobolds don't kill the moths and instead go to great lengths to protect them! Those stupid little rats have it all figured out!\n\nWell we'll just have to get our own moth pollen! What do you say? Fetch me some in the name of science?",o="北风苔原鲜血孢子平原的血法师劳瑞丝要你取回 5 份鲜血孢子蛾花粉。|n",oEN="Bloodmage Laurith at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra wants you to recover 5 Bloodspore Moth Pollen.",p="花粉就是关键！",pEN="The pollen is the key!",c="啊哈！\n\n<劳莉丝将血孢巨蛾花粉洒在血孢心皮上。>\n\n瞧！",cEN="A-ha!\n\n<Laurith sprinkles the moth pollen onto the bloodspore carpels.>\n\nLook at that!"}
Q[11718]={d="为了强化地震的幅度以保证弄塌那些隧道，我彻底地改装了机器人的基本骨架。不过，这样一来，整台机器也就过于精密和脆弱了，而且对于诺森德那寒冷的气候也比较敏感。\n\n我打算使用本地猛犸象的厚重皮毛包住机器人的外层装甲，起到保温和缓冲的作用。这些猛犸一般漫步在机场南部和喷泉平原临近的地区。给我带回它们的毛皮，这样机器就算是大功告成——那些蛛魔就要倒大霉啦！",dEN="I've reconfigured the skeleton of an old bot to create an earthquake large enough to collapse the tunnels, but the machinery is delicate and sensitive to Northrend's biting cold.\n\nI've devised a means of insulating it using the thickest hides of the native mammoths. They roam the plains south of the airstrip and adjacent to the Geyser Fields. Bring back enough of the hides for me to finish the machine and then we'll be able to unleash it on the Nerubians!",o="菲兹兰克机场的阿布尼·扭矩要求你为他带回6张厚猛犸皮。",oEN="Abner Fizzletorque at Fizzcrank Airstrip wants you to bring him 6 Thick Mammoth Hides.",p="尽快把毛皮带来给我！没有它们就没办法完成飞行器！",pEN="Bring those hides as quickly as possible! I won't be able to finish the machine without them!",c="<阿布尼检查那些毛皮，毛皮上的灰尘让他不停地咳嗽。>\n\n难道这些动物都不会想要保持干净吗？这些东西真的是超脏的。嗯，我想我最好开始清理它们。没有时间可以浪费了。",cEN="<Abner inspects the hides, coughing at all the dust rising from them.>\n\nDon't these animals even try to keep clean? Some of these are absolutely filthy. Well, I guess I'd better get started cleaning them. It's not like anyone's got spare time around here."}
Q[11719]={d="<劳莉丝打量着你，似乎在盘算着什么。>\n\n这株血孢已经授过粉了，我们得找个人来测试一下它的效果。我觉得你挺合适的……把它涂抹到皮肤上，让我观察一下吧。没事啦，涂一下又不会死。\n\n$n，别担心啊！来来来，在脸上抹一下。",dEN="<Laurith looks you over as if to size you up.>\n\nSo we've got this pollinated bloodspore flower and nobody to test its effects on. Say, would you perhaps be interested in rubbing this on your skin and letting me observe? What's the worst that could happen anyway?\n\nDon't you worry, <name>! Just take this sample and rub it all over your face.",o="血孢平原的血法师劳莉丝要你使用授过粉的血孢花，并让她观察效果。",oEN="Bloodmage Laurith at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra has asked that you use the Pollinated Bloodspore Flower and allow her to observe the results.",c="普雷玛应该会很开心！效果比我预期的还要好！\n\n或许该是告诉你事实了。",cEN="Primal Mighthorn will be delighted! This is better than even I expected!\n\nPerhaps it's time that I told you the truth."}
Q[11720]={d="加尔鲁什指派我和普雷玛·巨角率军转至战歌要塞的南部前线，剿灭猛犸人。虽然将士们个个英勇善战，却无法抵挡猛犸人巢穴守卫的猛烈反攻，首场战役就败下阵来。我们是为数不多的幸存者……\n\n我们既不是科学家也不是研究员。和你一样，我们都是部落的战士，肩负着不能失败的使命……\n\n我要你去跟普雷玛·巨角谈一谈。",dEN="Hellscream assigned Mighthorn and I with the daunting task of magnataur extermination on the southern front of Warsong Hold. With us came an entire platoon of seasoned Horde soldiers. Our initial foray into the nearby magnataur dens proved quite unsuccessful as our entire squad was wiped out by the lair defenders. We're the only ones left...\n\nWe aren't scientists or researchers. We're soldiers of the Horde, just like you. Soldiers on a mission that cannot fail...\n\nSpeak to Primal Mighthorn now.",o="与北风苔原鲜血孢子平原的原始者硬角交谈。|n",oEN="Speak to Primal Mighthorn at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra.",c="你所收集的东西足以给予我们对抗迦莫斯的猛犸人优势——当然，也离不开你的帮助。",cEN="The bloodspore that you collected might just be enough to give us an edge against the magnataurs of Gammoth - with your help, of course."}
Q[11721]={d="猛犸人和狮子一样，属于群居生物：一到两名雄性统治着族群中的所有雌性以及幼崽。西边那座名叫迦莫斯的巢穴中就盘踞着一群猛犸人，他们的首领就是迦莫斯拉。迦莫斯拉在族群繁衍后代的过程中扮演了重要的角色，因此我们必须除掉他。\n\n带上血孢花的粉末进入迦莫斯。利用它削弱迦莫斯拉的力量，然后杀死他！把他的像章带回来给我。",dEN="Magnataur live in prides, much like lions: one or two dominant males and several females along with their offspring. In the case of Gammoth, the magnataur den west of here, Gammothra is the leader. It is Gammothra that controls this magnataur population and therefore it is Gammothra that must be slain to prevent any type of magnataur uprising.\n\nTake this pouch of crushed bloodspore flower to Gammoth. Use the powder from the pouch to weaken Gammothra and then slay him! Return his head to me as proof.",o="杀死迦莫斯拉，将他的像章交给北风苔原血孢平原的普雷玛·巨角。",oEN="Slay Gammothra and return the Head of Gammothra to Primal Mighthorn at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra.",p="这种粉末可用来削弱所有的猛犸人。这就是为什么这地方的狗头人保护它的原因。",pEN="The powder can be used to weaken all magnataur. It is why the rat men of the area guard it so closely.",c="干得好，<name>！你愿意带上那头野兽的头颅，把它呈给地狱咆哮，让我和劳瑞丝沾点光吗？他会非常满意的。",cEN="A job well done, <name>! Would you honor Laurith and I by taking the head of the beast and presenting it to Hellscream? He will be extremely pleased."}
Q[11722]={d="$n，我们可不敢把功劳算在自己头上，部落能取得这样的胜利全得靠你呀。是你冒着生命危险测试血孢的效果，也是你除掉了迦莫斯拉。\n\n返回战歌要塞，将迦莫斯拉的徽记交给加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮吧。",dEN="We cannot take all of the credit for this Horde victory, <name>. It was you who risked your life to test the bloodspore and it was you who ultimately put an end to Gammothra.\n\nHonor us by returning to Warsong Hold and presenting the head of Gammothra to Lord Hellscream.",o="将迦莫斯拉的徽记交给战歌要塞的加尔鲁什·地狱咆哮。",oEN="Take the Head of Gammothra to Garrosh Hellscream in Warsong Hold.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back so soon?",c="<地狱咆哮单手举起加莫斯拉的头颅，朝它脸上啐了一口。>\n\n他们会明白的，<name>……他们都会明白的。部落不是好惹的……",cEN="<Hellscream picks up the head of Gammothra with one arm and spits in its face.>\n\nThey will learn, <name>... They will all learn. The Horde is not to be trifled with..."}
Q[11723]={d="小心点，这可是一台能把我们从蛛魔的威胁中拯救出来的机器！\n\n<阿布尼带着骄傲的神情向你展示着最终的成品机器人。>\n\n带上这个控制器，立刻到喷泉平原最南端的蛛魔虫孔附近去，使用遥控器启动地震器5000型，它会自动完成剩下的一切工作。\n\n如果它引起的震动把蛛魔的头目引来了，你也不要慌张。毕竟，杀掉它对我们彻底瓦解它们的攻势更有帮助。",dEN="Behold, the machine that will save us from the Nerubian threat!\n\n<Abner beams with pride as he presents the finished bot.>\n\nTake this remote control with you, and go out to the southernmost of the Nerubian sinkholes in the Geyser Fields. Use the remote to activate the Shake-n-Quake 5000. It will do the rest on its own.\n\nDon't be surprised if the quake it creates attracts the attention of a Nerubian leader. In fact, it would be a great opportunity to finish off the Nerubian offensive.",o="菲兹兰克机场的阿布尼·扭矩要求你使用地震器5000型将蛛魔的隧道网弄坍塌，并杀死克里卡希斯。",oEN="Abner Fizzletorque at Fizzcrank Airstrip wants you to use the Shake-n-Quake 5000 to collapse the Nerubian tunnels and defeat Lord Kryxix.",p="那么，你部署好地震器5000型了吗？",pEN="Well, have you deployed the Shake-n-Quake 5000 yet?",c="<阿布尼热切的聆听着你报告你和地震器5000型的成功。>\n\n铁阀将会很乐意听到这个讯息！而且谁知道，或许我们制作一个你的机械人也说不定！",cEN="<Abner listens eagerly as you report your success and the success of the Shake-n-Quake 5000.>\n\nFizzcrank will be delighted to hear the news! And who knows, perhaps we'll make a mechanic of you yet!"}
Q[11724]={d="这枚蛋似乎有着非同寻常的意义，附近横躺着的尸体就是证据。蛋壳上贴着的标签表明，收货人是血孢平原的血法师劳莉丝。血孢平原就在东边！\n\n将这枚蛋交给那位血法师吧。",dEN="This egg was obviously important to somebody, as the corpse nearby can attest. As you look the egg over you notice that it has already been tagged for shipment to the Bloodspore Plains, care of Bloodmage Laurith. That's just east of here!\n\nCollect the egg and take it to the expectant Bloodmage.",o="将发光的巨蛋交给血孢平原的血法师劳莉丝。",oEN="Take the Massive Glowing Egg to Bloodmage Laurith at the Bloodspore Plains in the Borean Tundra.",p="你好！",pEN="Greetings!",c="艾尔克尔死了，是吗？可怜……至于这颗蛋，对我们来说再也没有用途了。我们现在有更大的问题要处理。",cEN="Alkor is no more, eh? A pity... As for the egg, we have no real use for it anymore. We've got much bigger problems to deal with now."}
Q[11725]={d="哎……我真该亲自去飞这趟任务的。倒不是说我不信任尾旋，绝对不是。该死啊，他是最我队里最好的飞行员。\n\n哎……亲自带队执行这样重要的任务是我的责任……可我却逃避了。\n\n那时，我派尾旋带着我们最优秀的侦察小队去喷泉平原的中部侦察蛛魔的活动状况。\n\n我最后一次收到他们的报告时，他们在正南方的油塘区域附近，也就是蛛魔虫孔的西边。\n\n找到他，$n。",dEN="I should've flown the mission myself. It's not that I don't trust Tailspin. Far from it. Heck, he was the best wingman I ever flew with.\n\nNo, it's just that it's my responsibility to lead a mission of such import.\n\nI sent Tailspin out with our fastest recon squadron to gather information about the Nerubian infestation in the middle of the Geyser Fields.\n\nThe last report we received placed his squadron in the pools to the far south and just west of the Nerubian sinkholes.\n\nFind Tailspin, <name>.",o="在间歇泉平原找到伊吉\"尾旋\"科格托格。",oEN="Locate Iggy \"Tailspin\" Cogtoggle in the Geyser Fields.",c="感谢上苍。这真恐怖。\n\n那时候地上出现了一阵强烈的闪光，下一瞬间我就发觉整个中队的飞机正在坠毁！我受伤太重，没办法去搜索其它幸存者。\n\n<伊吉痛得皱起了脸。>\n\n你愿意帮我完成任务吗？",cEN="Thank goodness. It was terrible.\n\nThere was a bright flash on the ground, and then, the next thing I know, the squadron's going down! I'm hurt pretty badly, so I haven't had a chance to comb the site for other survivors, but something tells me I don't think there will be many.\n\n<Iggy grimaces in pain.>\n\nWill you help me complete my mission?"}
Q[11726]={d="那群狼被困在飞行器的残骸中好些天，恐怕它们已经饿得头昏眼花，将我们辛辛苦苦拍摄下来的微缩胶片都吞进肚里啦。\n\n我倒是有法子回收胶片，但我需要你的帮助。\n\n洪荒平原南边和东边居住着一种被称为鳄鱼人的生物。它们使用某种其辣无比的辣椒来烹制食物，其它生物若是吃下这种辣椒，就会引起严重的肠胃不适，然后……嗯嗯……你知道啦。如果你能从蒸汽鳄鱼人或游荡鳄鱼人身上收集到足够的辣椒袋，我就可以做出一顿“美味”给那些狼吃，然后……嗯嗯。",dEN="The wolves have been pawing through the wreckage ever since the crash and I'm afraid they consumed the microfilm from our mission in the process.\n\nI have a plan to recover that microfilm, but I need your help to make it work.\n\nTo the south and east, in the Flood Plains, live creatures called gorlocs. They prepare their foods with noxious spices, which would sicken any other creature. If you can gather enough of the spice pouches from gorloc steam belchers or gorloc waddlers, I can make the wolf bait.",o="灼热之池的伊吉\"尾旋\"科格托格要你收集 4 袋戈洛克香料袋。",oEN="Iggy \"Tailspin\" Cogtoggle in the Scalding Pools wants you to gather 4 Gorloc Spice Pouches.",p="你拿到那些辣椒袋了吗？",pEN="Do you have those spice pouches?",c="<伊吉掩住鼻子倒出那些香料，声音充满了鼻音。>\n\n现在我们有了必须的材料，可以用紧急口粮调配出给狼群的饵食。",cEN="<Iggy holds his nose as he empties the spice pouches and addresses you in a nasal voice.>\n\nNow that we have what we need, I'll combine it with my emergency rations to create a bait for the wolves."}
Q[11727]={d="很高兴$gUn placer:Un placer;你能加入我们，$n。我们都听说过你的事迹。\n\n如你所知，乌瑞恩国王正把大军调往诺森德，迎战阿尔萨斯的军队。但军队若没有真正的英雄来激励和引领，就什么都不是。\n\n我要你成为我手下人的那种英雄。与他们并肩作战，对抗围攻我们要塞的天灾军团。\n\n去向内堡外的哈默希尔中士报到。无畏要塞绝不能陷落。我们这场战役的未来就系于此。",dEN="It's good to have you among us, <name>. We've all heard of your past deeds.\n\nAs you know, King Wrynn is moving great armies into Northrend to meet those of Arthas. But armies are nothing without true heroes to inspire and lead them.\n\nI want you to be that hero for my men. Fight alongside them against the Scourge that lays siege to our stronghold.\n\nReport to Sergeant Hammerhill outside the inner hold. Valiance Keep cannot fall. The future of our campaign depends on it.",o="去向无畏要塞的哈默希尔中士报到。",oEN="Report to Sergeant Hammerhill at Valiance Keep.",c="麦格尼的胡须之名呀！看来重炮来了。",cEN="By Magni's beard! Looks like the heavy artillery's arriving."}
Q[11728]={d="你就算再饿，也别动那些饵。瞧见那群被困在油塘中的狼了吧？将饵食丢在它们附近就行了，这帮饥肠辘辘的野兽连胶卷都吃，一定抵挡不了饵食的诱惑。\n\n接下来就耐心等待吧。等到它们有了反应之后，你就开始仔细搜索那些……该怎么讲……包裹着胶片的东西。\n\n如果我特制的狼类遗留物搜查器在身边，本来可以借给你用的，可惜我把它丢在机场了。恐怕你必须……怎么讲……用一些传统方式来进行搜索了。",dEN="Whatever you do, don't eat this bait yourself. Just set it down in the vicinity of an oil-soaked wolf. If they're desperate enough to eat the microfilm, they'll come running when they smell the bait.\n\nSimply wait for nature to take its course and then all you need to do is search the, uh... byproduct for the film.\n\nI'd offer you my special lupus pupus scupus for the job, but I left it back at the airstrip. I'm afraid you'll have to conduct the... err... search the old-fashioned way.",o="灼热之池的伊吉\"尾旋\"科格托格要你给他带去 8 段缩微胶卷。",oEN="Iggy \"Tailspin\" Cogtoggle in the Scalding Pools wants you to bring him 8 pieces of Microfilm.",p="你找到胶片了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the microfilm?",c="<伊吉捏着鼻子收下微缩胶卷。>\n\n恶心，嗯，我们已经按照紧急情况守则的第8章第2节的第3段的规定行动，并且收回了胶卷。不过，紧急情况守则并没有说我有责任得清理胶卷。",cEN="<Iggy holds his nose as he accepts the microfilm from you.>\n\nYuck, well, we've complied with section 8.2, paragraph B of the emergency protocol here and recovered the film. Nothing in the protocol says I'm responsible for cleaning it, though."}
Q[11729]={d="你在机械侏儒体内发现了这件东西。\n\n它的结构看上去相当复杂……或许你应该将它交给机场的工程师看看——比如机灵鬼沃比斯波基？",dEN="The unit you just dismantled had this inside of its mechanical innards.\n\nIt looks pretty complicated... certainly someone back at the airstrip would want to take a look at it. Maybe Crafty Wobblesprocket?",o="将超声波螺丝刀带回菲兹兰克机场，交给机灵鬼沃比斯波基。",oEN="Deliver the Ultrasonic Screwdriver to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.",p="嗨！",pEN="Hey!",c="我的螺丝刀……你找到了我的螺丝刀！我还在想这东西丢到哪里去了。\n\n嗯，你说，你在他们的机器人体内找到它？这倒是给了我一个点子……",cEN="My screwdriver... you found my screwdriver! I'd been wondering where that thing got lost.\n\nHmm, you found it inside one of their robots, you say? That gives me an idea...."}
Q[11730]={d="超声波螺丝刀简直是万能工具，它可以用在所有的机械物体上！\n\n返回滚烫熔池，干掉一些麦卡佐德的机器人。你只需要对机器人的残骸使用螺丝刀，它们就会转而投靠我们——虽然这种友好状态只能持续很短的一段时间。\n\n不过这玩意儿对机械侏儒不管用，别去招惹他们。\n\n在使用螺丝刀之前，记得从机器人的尸体上捞一笔！",dEN="The Ultrasonic Screwdriver is the ultimate tool. It can do anything to mechanical stuff!\n\nHead back into the pools and dismantle a number of Mechazod's robots. Then all you have to do is use the screwdriver on their remains, and I'm betting that they'll turn to our side, for a short time anyway.\n\nI'm pretty sure it won't work on the mechagnomes, so don't even bother with them.\n\nOh, and if you want to take anything from the robot's insides, you'll want to do so before using the screwdriver!",o="使用超声波螺丝刀为15个机器人重新编程，然后将超声波螺丝刀带回菲兹兰克机场，还给机灵鬼沃比斯波基。\n\n在改编程序之前，记得从机器人的尸体上顺手捞点什么。",oEN="Use the Ultrasonic Screwdriver to reprogram 15 robots and then return to Crafty Wobblesprocket at Fizzcrank Airstrip.\n\nMake sure to loot the dead robot before you reprogram it.",p="你已经重设了几个机器人啊？",pEN="How many robots have you managed to reprogram?",c="哇喔！你还将螺丝刀原封不动的带回来了！\n\n重新设定那些机器人在对抗机甲专家麦卡佐德的战争中结果竟是有利于我们的强大优势。我想你从中学到了一点东西。",cEN="Woo hoo! And you brought back the screwdriver intact, too!\n\nReprogramming those robots is going to turn out to be a huge advantage in our favor in the fight against Gearmaster Mechazod. I think you've earned a little something for that."}
Q[11731]={d="你想成为一名玩火炬的艺人？你具备相应的素质吗？比如机敏？灵活？……勇气？如果你有信心的话，不妨来试试身手！\n\n带上火炬去篝火堆附近吧。当你看见某只火盆上方显现标记时，就将火炬扔过去。动作要快！在标记消失前扔出火炬才能得分！\n\n这是一项限时游戏，你要击中规定数量的带有标记的火盆，然后回到我这儿来……准备接受新的挑战。",dEN="So you want to be a fire juggler? Do you have what it takes? The dexterity? The reflexes? ...the courage? If you think so, then let's give you a little practice!\n\nTake these torches and run near the bonfire. You'll see braziers with markers flashing above them. Toss a torch at a marked brazier. Be quick! Do it before the mark fades if you want credit for the toss!\n\nHit enough marked braziers before the time limit, then come back here... for your next lession.",o="赢得一场扔火炬游戏，然后与吞火大师谈一谈。",oEN="Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Fire Eater.",c="做得好！你很快就可以成为一名火焰杂耍师了！下一次的考验就是来真的了……",cEN="Quick! There's no time to waste!"}
Q[11732]={c="亵渎这团火焰！",cEN="Desecrate the Alliance's Arathi Highlands bonfire!"}
Q[11733]={d="凡人，我一直关注着你的努力。别装出惊讶的样子，你肯定感觉到我的目光落在你身上。\n\n是时候揭开你心智中的一层黑暗了。有些残酷的真相，你已经成长到$gdispuesto:dispuesta;接受。\n\n在听这个故事之前，你应该亲眼看看我们面对的是什么。\n\n安排好你的事务，$c……",dEN="I've been mindful of your efforts, mortal. Do not feign surprise. Surely you've felt my eye upon you.\n\nThe time has come to peel back a layer of darkness from your mind. There are stark truths that you have grown ready to accept.\n\nBefore hearing the tale, you shall be shown firsthand what we face.\n\nPut your affairs in order, <class>....",o="苏雷斯塔兹要你转至考达拉，与大法师伯林纳德谈一谈。",oEN="Surristrasz wants you to travel to Coldarra. Once there, you are to speak with Archmage Berinand.",c="欢迎来到寒冷之息，<class>。\n\n在转换护盾之下，我们藏身在离 Nexus——伟大的守护巨龙玛里苟斯和他的蓝龙军团的要塞——只有一箭之遥的地方。\n\n请自便。",cEN="Welcome to Coldarra, <class>.\n\nUnder the Transitus Shield we lie hidden just a stone's throw from the Nexus, fortress of the great aspect Malygos and his blue dragonflight.\n\nDo make yourself comfortable."}
