Q[11864]={c="这个恶魔有许多的姓名，每一个名字曾经都有特殊意义。虽然细节有时候微不足道，但结局永远都是一样：死亡。\n\n但现在，在事情发生后快50年的现在，这些细节却可以找到恶魔并使他垮台。\n\n这次，我们有他……奈辛瓦里将无处可逃。\n\n诺森德将会成为我们的战场。猎人者将被猎杀！",cEN="The demon has many names and each name has held special meaning at one time or another. While the details were sometimes insignificant, the end result was always the same: death.\n\nBut it is now, nearly fifty years after it all began, that the details will find the devil and lead to his downfall.\n\nThis time, we have him... There will be no escape for Nesingwary.\n\nNorthrend will be the battleground for our war. The hunter will become the hunted!"}
Q[11865]={d="营地南边的那些驯鹿原本一直过着自由而悠闲的生活，甚至时不时地在营地周围散步。但是奈辛瓦里的出现改变了一切。现在这群驯鹿陷入了永久的恐慌与凶暴状态中。每日每夜，隐藏在原野上的猎户与陷阱都在不断夺走它们的生命。\n\n仅仅以死亡来惩戒那些奈辛瓦里的走狗是远远不够的！他们必须像那些可怜的驯鹿一样尝尝被折磨的滋味！\n\n带上这堆仿制的皮毛，把它放在那些猎户设置的陷阱附近作为诱饵，然后就找地方埋伏好，静静等待那些人渣踏进他们自己的陷阱吧！",dEN="Just south of us the caribou used to roam freely, peacefully. Then Nesingwary showed up and everything changed. Now the caribou are in a perpetual state of frenzy, always in a panic. They are stalked by the hunters and trappers hidden in the field.\n\nNesingwary's executioners are unfit for death. They must feel the torture that they put the caribou through!\n\nTake this pile of fake furs and lay it upon their caribou traps to the south. Watch as the hunters are caught in their own deadly traps!",o="北风苔原D.E.H.T.A.营地的扎扎要你使用那堆假毛皮诱捕8名奈辛瓦里捕猎者。|n",oEN="Zaza at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to use the Pile of Fake Furs to trap 8 Nesingwary Trappers.",p="不要怜悯他们，<race>。",pEN="Feel no pity for them, <race>.",c="<name>，你在为大地母亲效力，但不要在这场胜利中沉醉太久。我们已经发现了捕猎者头目的藏身处。",cEN="You do the Earth Mother's work, <name>, but do not revel in this victory for too long. We have discovered the hiding place of the trapper leader."}
Q[11866]={d="无论是寻宝者还是嗜血的荒原猎人，任何支持奈辛瓦里、胆敢伤害我们珍爱的野生动物的人，都将被视为D.E.H.T.A.的敌人。\n\n如果你能杀死这些奈辛瓦里的走狗，就带一件他们已死的凭证来见我，我会以D.E.H.T.A.德鲁伊的祝福作为奖赏。|n",dEN="Whether they be treasure seekers or bloodthirsty hunters of the wastes, any being that supports Nesingwary and dares to strike at our beloved wildlife shall be considered an enemy of D.E.H.T.A.\n\nShould you slay these filthy Nesingwary sympathizers, bring me proof of their demise and you shall be rewarded with a blessing from the druids of D.E.H.T.A.",o="仁德会营地的大德鲁伊拉索留斯许诺，若你能带回15只奈辛瓦里同党的耳环，他就会给予你丰厚的奖赏。",oEN="Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra has said that he will reward you should you bring him 15 Nesingwary Lackey Ears.",p="这些耳朵将会非常适合……",pEN="Ears will do quite nicely...",c="它们将会串成串挂在我的脖子上。从而聆听我们的训诫成为装载着我们真理的容器！",cEN="These will hang around my neck. Let them hear our message and let these ears be the vessels that carry our truths!"}
Q[11867]={d="无论是寻宝者还是偷猎者，任何试图支持奈辛瓦里并胆敢危害我们所珍爱的大自然的人，都是“仁慈对待野生动物德鲁伊协会”的敌人。\n\n如果你消灭了某个奈辛瓦里的同党，把他的死亡证据带回来，就可以赢得所有仁德会成员的奖励与祝福。",dEN="Whether they be treasure seekers or bloodthirsty hunters of the wastes, any being that supports Nessingwary and does dare strike at our beloved wildlife shall be considered an enemy of D.E.H.T.A. Should you slay these filthy Nesingwary sympathizers, bring me proof of their demise and you shall be rewarded with a blessing from the druids of D.E.H.T.A.",o="仁德会营地的大德鲁伊拉索留斯许诺，若你能带回15只奈辛瓦里同党的耳环，他就会给予你丰厚的奖赏。",oEN="Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Outpost in the Borean Tundra has said that he will reward you should you bring him 15 Nesingwary Lackey Ears.",p="无论他们是荒原的宝藏搜寻者或是嗜血猎人，任何援助奈辛瓦里且胆敢破坏我们珍爱的野生动物者都会被当作是D·E·H·T·A·的敌人。\n\n如果你杀了这些肮脏的奈辛瓦里支持者，就将他们的死亡证明带给我，你将会获得来自D·E·H·T·A·德鲁伊的祝福奖励。",pEN="Whether they be treasure seekers or bloodthirsty hunters of the wastes, any being that supports Nesingwary and dares to strike at our beloved wildlife shall be considered an enemy of D.E.H.T.A.\n\nShould you slay these filthy Nesingwary sympathizers, bring me proof of their demise and you shall be rewarded with a blessing from the druids of D.E.H.T.A.",c="它们将会串成串挂在我的脖子上。从而聆听我们的训诫成为装载着我们真理的容器！",cEN="These will hang around my neck. Let them hear our message and let these ears be the vessels that carry our truths!"}
Q[11868]={d="在这片峭壁的南端附近，你会找到那臭名昭著的驯鹿捕猎者头目。她比任何生物都更野蛮，拿被杀害的动物尸体取乐：饮其鲜血，对月长嚎！\n\n找到那个凶手，那个叫卡伦的家伙，终结她那可鄙的生命。\n\n好好$g准备:准备;吧，$n，驯鹿屠戮者卡伦一直在炫耀奈辛瓦里赏给她的财富！",dEN="Near the southern end of this bluff is where you will find the treacherous leader of the caribou trappers. She is a savage like no other, making a mockery out of the carcasses of the slain animals: drinking from their blood and howling to the moons!\n\nFind this murderer, Karen, and end her worthless existence.\n\nPrepare yourself properly, <name>. Karen the Culler has indulged in the riches that Nesingwary has lavished upon her! She will be well armed and guarded by lackeys.",o="仁德会营地的扎扎要求你除掉驯鹿杀手卡琳。",oEN="Zaza at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill Karen the Culler.",p="大自然需要正义！",pEN="Nature demands justice!",c="或许她的死将成为一个警告，让其他胆敢以消遣和谋财为目的而杀害动物的人引以为戒。",cEN="Perhaps her death will serve as an example to others that dare slay animals for sport and riches."}
Q[11869]={d="这里西边不远之处就是库姆亚湖。据我们所知，那里栖息着这世界上唯一的淡水巨蚌族群。\n\n当然，奈辛瓦里那帮卑贱的猎人也看上了这里，想从那些巨蚌中得到大粒的珍珠。必须阻止他们！必须好好给那些为了一己私欲就危害珍稀物种的家伙们上一课。\n\n立刻转至库姆亚湖，找到那些利欲熏心的潜水员，把他们都给干掉，即使让湖水变成红色也没有关系！完成任务之后回来找我。",dEN="To the west of us you will find Lake Kum'uya. It is, as far as we know, the only freshwater giant clam habitat in the world.\n\nOf course Nesingwary's lackeys are now using the lake as a giant pearl farm. They must be stopped! A lesson must be taught to those that would think to endanger an entire species.\n\nGo to Lake Kum'uya and locate the loot crazed divers. Slay them until the water runs red! Return to me when a proper example has been made!",o="仁德会营地的圣职者塞妮丝要求你杀死10名利欲熏心的潜水员。",oEN="Hierophant Cenius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill 10 Loot Crazed Divers.",p="我们干的是令人毛骨悚然的活儿，<name>。",pEN="It is gruesome work that we do, <name>.",c="现在让我们瞧瞧当他们看到同伴的下场后，还能有多镇定！",cEN="Now let us see how their nerve holds up when they see what became of their companions!"}
Q[11870]={d="我们刚从利安德拉那里得到消息，奈辛瓦里雇佣的佣兵正在把货物从海滩搬上奈辛瓦里的主货船。毫无疑问，他们打算靠这血腥买卖大发横财！\n\n她请求我们派人前往被遗弃的海岸——就在此处正南方，北风苔原的海滨。\n\n快去吧，利安德拉在那里等你！|n",dEN="We have just gotten word from Liandra that mercenaries hired by Nesingwary are moving goods off the beach and onto the main Nesingwary shipping vessel. No doubt they plan on making a fortune from their murderous trade!\n\nShe has asked that we send assistance to the Abandoned Reach, directly south of here on the beachfront of the Borean Tundra.\n\nMake haste, Liandra awaits you there!",o="转至遗弃海岸，寻找圣职者莉安德拉。",oEN="Seek out Hierophant Liandra at the Abandoned Reach.",c="塞妮丝派你来的？你来得正是时候！",cEN="Cenius sent you? Well you're not a moment too soon!"}
Q[11871]={d="在这片海岸上，在那些漂浮着的货物与残骸之间，无数的木箱与皮袋中满满地装着他们从动物身上残忍取下的东西。奈辛瓦里似乎和北海海盗勾结到了一起。这些肮脏的海盗们正在把所有堆积在海岸上的货物运回南方去。而且毫无疑问，他们背后的买主是艾泽拉斯那些毫无道德与廉耻可言、只知炫耀与奢华的富人们。\n\n必须阻止这一切。你立刻到海岸边去，把所有的货物都夺走，他们不配拥有这一切！",dEN="Strewn across this beach, amidst the flotsam and jetsam, are crates and sacks of animal parts. It would seem that Nesingwary is in cahoots with the Northsea Freebooters. Those dirty pirates are transporting the goods that Nesingwary's murderous lackeys gather offshore. No doubt they will end up in the homes and on the backs of wealthy, unscrupulous individuals across Azeroth.\n\nThis won't happen. Not on our watch. Bring me all shipments that you find upon this beach. They'll never have them!",o="遗弃海岸的圣职者莉安德拉要求你找回12个动物杂货箱。",oEN="Hierophant Liandra at the Abandoned Reach in the Borean Tundra wants you to recover 12 Shipments of Animal Parts.",p="我们将会好好地埋葬那些动物。",pEN="We will give those animals a proper burial.",c="干得好，<name>。现在我们去突袭海盗头目！",cEN="A job well done, <name>. Now we strike at the pirate leader!"}
Q[11872]={d="说真的，自封为\"蚌壳大师\"，仿佛自己掌控着海中所有生物，这实在可鄙。谁都没有这种资格！\n\n必须找到并杀死这个\"蚌壳大师\"。他最后一次被人看见是在被遗弃的海岸外海的那艘沉船处。找到他，杀了他。\n\n办完之后，回到此处北面D.E.H.T.A.营地的祭司塞尼乌斯那里，告诉她任务已经成功。",dEN="It's despicable, really, to anoint one's self as the \"Clam Master,\" as if they hold mastery over the creatures of the sea. None may make such claims!\n\nThis \"Clam Master\" must be found and slain. He was last seen at the wreckage just off the coast of the Abandoned Reach. Find him and kill him.\n\nOnce this is done, return to Hierophant Cenius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment, north of here, and let her know that the mission was a success.",o="杀死蚌壳大师K，然后回到D.E.H.T.A.营地的祭司塞尼乌斯那里。|n",oEN="Slay Clam Master K and return to Hierophant Cenius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment.",p="你有什么好消息通知我吗？",pEN="Do you bring me good news?",c="干得漂亮，<name>。我们正在逼近奈辛瓦里！",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. We are closing in on Nesingwary!"}
Q[11873]={d="你能先回到机场那边去吗？帮我告诉菲兹兰克，我稍后就会提交一份正式的报告。但现在，我得首先稍微处理一下我的飞行器。\n\n我敢肯定菲兹兰克在听说我还活着并且成功回收了全部菲林之后，一定会非常高兴的。\n\n现在我突然很想知道，那家伙若是跟我们一起飞的话，一切又会怎么样。唉……真怀念过去的日子啊。",dEN="Would you be willing to head back to the airstrip and let Fizzcrank know that I'll be along shortly to give my formal report? I've got to deal with the wreckage of my flying machine, and then I'll be on my way.\n\nI'll be certain that Fizzcrank knows that he has you to thank for my survival and the recovery effort.\n\nI only wonder what the old man would've done himself if he'd been flying with us. I miss those days.",o="回到菲兹兰克机场，与菲兹兰克·铁阀谈一谈。",oEN="Make your way back to Fizzcrank Airstrip and speak with Fizzcrank Fullthrottle.",c="<铁阀听取你的报告，看起来稍稍放心了。>\n\n我应该跟他们一起去的。我们可以有办法完成任务而不损失任何驾驶员。\n\n不过，尾旋是对的，我们得谢谢你的营救。你的努力可能会使对抗蛛魔的战斗产生变化。",cEN="<Fizzcrank listens to your report, looking somewhat relieved.>\n\nI should've gone with them. We might've been able to complete the mission without losing any pilots.\n\nTailspin is right, though, we have you to thank for what you've been able to salvage. Your efforts may just make the difference in the fight against the Nerubians."}
Q[11875]={d="破碎残阳的部队需要一切能够协助我们击败基尔加丹的东西。我在暴风城的同事发明出了一种魔法油，可以强化我们部队的武器和装备。\n\n虚空残渣是其中最重要的成份，它们遍及外域的各个角落。任何大师级的草药师、剥皮师和矿工都可以在日常的工作中发现它的踪迹。所有外域特有的草药、矿石和野兽都可能含有这种虚空残渣。",dEN="The troops of the Shattered Sun Offensive will need every advantage they can get to beat back the allies of Kil'Jaeden. My colleagues in Stormwind have created oils which will strengthen the blades and armor of our troops.\n\nThe key ingredient, nether residue, pervades Outland -- if you know where to look. Any master herbalist, skinner, or miner who knows the signs can gather it while plying <his/her> trade. Those herbs, ores, and beasts native to Outland may all bear the residue.",o="给沙塔斯城的摩尔丁特使带去8份虚空残渣。",oEN="Bring 8 Nether Residue to Emissary Mordin in Shattrath City.",p="你有任何的残渣要给我吗？",pEN="Have you any residue for me?",c="感谢你的帮助，<name>。对战争事业而言，任何贡献都不算微小。在这场战斗中，我们的人需要一切能取得的优势。",cEN="Thank you for your help, <name>. No contribution to the war effort is too small. Our men are going to need every advantage they can get in this battle."}
Q[11876]={d="它们是最尊贵的动物，难道不是吗？\n\n<拉索留斯指着北边一群缓缓走过苔原的猛犸巨象，喃喃地说。>\n\n可是，它们的族群数量却日益减少，一群自称为猎人的恶魔每天只是为了娱乐与发财而屠杀这种高贵的动物。\n\n<拉索留斯猛然转过头来，愤怒之情溢于言表。>\n\n它们的哀鸣已经快让我发疯了，$n。你也听听看，听啊，这风中传来的哀鸣。那些被困在猎人们罪恶陷阱中的小猛犸象正在呼唤我们的帮助。\n\n拿上这把锤子，毁掉那些陷阱，还它们以自由！",dEN="They're majestic beasts, aren't they?\n\n<Lathorius points towards the mammoths of the northern tundra.>\n\nWith each passing day their numbers diminish. Demons that call themselves hunters slay the beasts for sport and riches.\n\n<Lathorius' face contorts with anger.>\n\nIt's the whimpers that drive me to madness, <name>. You can hear them, carried by the wind. The mammoth calves, trapped in the hunters' vile traps, call out to us.\n\nTake this hammer and smash those traps. Free the calves!",o="仁德会营地的大德鲁伊拉索留斯要求你使用陷阱破坏锤释放8只猛犸幼崽。",oEN="Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to use the D.E.H.T.A. Trap Smasher to free 8 Mammoth Calves.",p="必须释放它们！",pEN="They must be freed!",c="<大德鲁伊拉索留斯擦干他的泪水。>\n\n他们从来没有希望。现在还失去了双亲，他们必定得孤独死去了。",cEN="<Arch Druid Lathorius wipes away his tears.>\n\nThey never stood a chance. Now orphaned, they will surely die on their own."}
Q[11877]={d="在我们向奎尔丹纳斯岛发动进攻时，我们发现凯尔萨斯的走狗们正在计划一次反击。他命令虚空风暴的日怒血精灵对我们部署在外域的部队发动攻击，希望这样可以牵制住我们的军队，并让我们的注意力远离太阳之井。\n\n我们必须阻止这样的事情，$n。所有人都要上前线！\n\n去虚空风暴夺取他们的攻击计划书。在那儿的任何血精灵都有可能带着计划书。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="As we press the offensive on Quel'Danas, we've discovered that Kael'thas' minions are planning a counterattack. By ordering the Sunfury blood elves, based in Netherstorm, to attack our operations in Outland, he hopes to draw troops and attention away from the Sunwell.\n\nWe must not allow this to happen, <name>. Each and every blade is needed on the front lines.\n\nGo to Netherstorm and capture their attack plans. Any of the Sunfury blood elves up there could be in possession of the plans. Good luck, <name>.",o="沙塔斯城的托沃斯男爵希望你能缴获日怒攻击计划。",oEN="Lord Torvos in Shattrath wants you to capture the Sunfury Attack Plans.",p="你连计划一起带回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with the plans?",c="<托尔沃斯领主接过图纸仔细查看。>\n\n你为这次攻势立下了大功，<name>，但我们不该就此歇息。我毫不怀疑我们的敌人正在谋划更多的阴谋。",cEN="<Lord Torvos accepts the plans and looks over them.>\n\nYou've done the offensive a great service, <name>, but we should not rest. I wouldn't put it beyond our foes to plan more mischief in the future."}
Q[11878]={d="尽管你已经英勇地站出来解救了无数的小猛犸象，但它们当中仍有许多会死去。要知道，得不到任何照顾的小猛犸象必须独自在荒野中觅食。\n\n不过，我们还有别的办法！希望总是存在的！\n\n在北方的猛犸平原上，滚烫熔池的旁边，居住着一头被称为巨兽库诺克的古老而睿智的猛犸象。带着这只小猛犸象孤儿去觐见他，他知道该怎么做。",dEN="Although you have acted valiantly in freeing the trapped calves, many of them will still die. You see, without a caretaker, these calves must fend for themselves in the wild.\n\nBut there is a way! Hope yet remains!\n\nNorth of here in the mammoth fields, bordering the Scalding Pools, you will find Khu'nok the Behemoth: a mammoth as wise as he is ancient. Take this mammoth orphan and present it to Khu'nok. He will know what to do.",o="将猛犸幼崽孤儿带到北风苔原的巨兽库诺克那里去。",oEN="Take the Orphaned Mammoth Calf to Khu'nok the Behemoth in the Borean Tundra.",c="<你脑海中响起一个声音。是库诺克。>\n\n你的名字已在呼啸的风中被传颂，<name>。你为我的族人做了一件了不起的事。因此我们将视你为盟友。可惜，若不流血杀戮，我们的苦难便无法终结。\n\n猛犸象获得和平的代价，将是卡乌之死……",cEN="<You hear a voice in your head. It is Khu'nok.>\n\nYour name has been heard in the whistling winds, <name>. You have done a great thing for my kin. For this we will consider you an ally. Alas, our torment cannot end without bloodshed and violence.\n\nThe price of peace for the mammoths will be the death of Kaw..."}
Q[11879]={d="你无法独自$g对付:对付;杀害我族人的凶手。苔原上的猛犸象会帮助你！\n\n前往平原找到一头猛犸公牛。他会允许你骑上他的背，控制他的行动。骑上他去找卡乌，就在此处北面的卡乌栖息地。你们将共同成为卡乌灭亡的导火索。\n\n摧毁卡乌的军队，从他手中夺走那柄令人垂涎的战争长戟。若你成功，就回到D.E.H.T.A.营地的拉索留斯那里。",dEN="You cannot defeat the being responsible for the slaughter of my kind by yourself. The mammoths of the tundra will help you!\n\nVenture forth to the plains and find a mammoth bull. He will allow you to mount him and control his movements and actions. Ride upon his back and find Kaw, north of here at Kaw's Roost. Together, you will be the instrument of Kaw's demise.\n\nDestroy Kaw's armies and take from Kaw his coveted war halberd. Return to Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment should you succeed.",o="杀死猛犸毁灭者卡奥，并夺取卡奥的战戟。将卡奥的战戟带回北风苔原的仁德会营地，交给大德鲁伊拉索留斯。",oEN="Kill Kaw the Mammoth Destroyer and recover Kaw's War Halberd. Deliver Kaw's War Halberd to Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra.",p="发生什么事？",pEN="What happened?",c="<伊拉索留斯从你手中接过战戟。>\n\n这就是我想的那个东西吗？\n\n<伊拉索留斯笑了。>\n\n太棒了！太杰出了！另一个奈辛瓦里的仆从被绳之以法了！",cEN="<Lathorius takes the halberd from you.>\n\nIs this what I think it is?\n\n<Lathorius grins.>\n\nSmashing! Outstanding! Another of Nesingwary's lackeys brought to justice!"}
Q[11880]={d="那个“侏儒发明家”一定是个疯子。他一直在嘟囔着说，纳格兰沃舒古附近的灵魂平原开始出现了一些暗色的云雾。\n\n按照他所说的，这些，多相……唔……什么光谱眼镜可以让佩戴者看到这些云雾，并能从中收集一些数据。他强调说上面记录的数据对我们在太阳之井的行动非常重要。我想他肯定是疯了，不过我需要任何可能对我们有帮助的东西。你不介意帮我去收集一些数据吧？",dEN="I'm sure that 'gnomish inventor' is a crackpot. He was babbling about some dark distortions that have begun to appear in the Spirit Fields around Oshu'gun in Nagrand.\n\nAccording to him, these, uh, multiphase... um, spectro-goggles will allow the wearer to see the distortions and take readings from them. He insisted that recording this data was fundamental to our campaign at the Sunwell. I think he's nuts, but I'm under orders to investigate anything that might help. Would you mind taking some readings?",o="沙塔斯城的先驱者哈隆奈姆希望你使用多相光谱护目镜去获取6份多相数据。",oEN="Harbinger Haronem in Shattrath City wants you to use the Multiphase Spectrographic Goggles to take 6 Multiphase Readings.",p="你取得那些读数了吗？要是我还不拿到他珍贵的资料，那个地精又要向我尖叫大吼了。",pEN="Did you get those readings? That gnome will scream at me again if I don't get his precious data.",c="感谢你的帮助。你不知道跟那边的\"华夫饼博士\"打交道是什么滋味。在他对我的进度做\"检查\"之余，他总忙着推销某个由他那些军用发明衍生出来的小玩意儿。",cEN="Thanks for your help. You don't know what it's like to have to deal with \"Doctor\" Wafflefry over there. In between his \"checkups\" on my progress, he's busy hawking some gadget or another derived from his military inventions."}
Q[11881]={d="你见过那些突突突冒着烟的飞行器吗？那就是号称侏儒科技的最高杰作。\n\n我一直想搞些能代表侏儒科技的东西研究研究，嘿，你瞧，现在机会来啦。前几天有一架侦察机在喷泉平原西南的滚烫熔池附近坠毁了。\n\n我要你找到那架飞行器的坠落点，然后吹响这枚哨子，我最忠实的伙伴——骡子珍妮就会到你身旁。她会一直跟着你，你可以把所有回收来的东西都放进她背上的口袋里。不过，你得保证她的安全。要是被攻击的话，她可能会甩掉货物。",dEN="Have you seen the flying machines buzzing around? That's gnomish innovation at its finest.\n\nI've long waited to get my hands on some of their technology and a perfect opportunity has presented itself. One of their recon wings crashed in the Scalding Pools, in the southwest part of the Geyser Fields.\n\nBlow this whistle near one of the crashed machines and my trusty mule, Jenny will answer. She'll follow you and carry the salvage, but you must keep her safe. She'll begin to drop the cargo if attacked.",o="帮助珍妮从坠毁点返回牦牛村的菲兹克斯·盖维斯特身边，并确保她驮载的货物完好无损。",oEN="Help Jenny make her way from the crash site to Fezzix Geartwist at Taunka'le Village without losing all her cargo.",p="别失败！我就指望你了。",pEN="Don't fail! I'm counting on you.",c="<菲兹克斯仔细地检查着货物。>\n\n珍妮有点被伤到，不过她会没事的。至于这些可利用的残骸，它有点……比我期望的还要零碎，但是我应该可以设法利用它。不过，你的工作还没结束。我们将要重新拼装这个东西。",cEN="<Fezzix looks over the salvage.>\n\nJenny's a little roughed up, but she'll be fine. As for the salvage, it's a bit more... piecemeal than I had hoped, but I should be able to find a use for it. You're not off the hook yet, though. We're going to rebuild this baby."}
Q[11882]={d="想学点新花招吗？\n\n不知道你能不能达到我这样的境界，不过如果你花点心思，也许真的能掌握一两个小花招哦。与任意联盟主城的吞火大师谈一谈，他们或许能帮上你的忙。",dEN="Are you interested in learning some hot new skills?\n\nI don't know if you'll ever be able to match my own considerable skill, but you can probably pick up a trick or two if you're an attentive student. Speak to a Master Fire Eater at any Alliance capital. They should be able to help you.",o="与任意联盟主城的吞火大师谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to a Master Fire Eater in any Alliance capital.",c="你好。你来学习操控火焰的新技巧吗？",cEN="Well met. You've come learn some new ways to handle fire?"}
Q[11884]={d="此处以西，库姆亚湖上方的高崖上，游荡着一个名叫奈达的可鄙家伙。这个自封的\"犀牛之王\"专门猎杀受伤或年幼、无力反抗他懦弱攻击的犀牛。更令人不齿的是，奈达还养了一头犀牛当坐骑兼保镖。\n\nD.E.H.T.A.竟然会要一头动物去死，这很罕见，但奈达那头被污染的犀牛必须除掉……把他们两个都杀了，然后回来见我。",dEN="West of here, on the high bluffs above Lake Kum'uya, roams a despicable being known as Nedar. The self proclaimed \"Lord of Rhinos\" hunts the wastes for the injured or young - rhinos unable to defend themselves against Ned's cowardly attacks. To add insult to injury, Ned has raised a rhino of his own to become his mount and bodyguard.\n\nIt is a rare thing that D.E.H.T.A. would ever call for the death of an animal, but Ned's tainted rhino must be disposed of... Kill them both and return to me.",o="北风苔原D.E.H.T.A.营地的巢穴守望者基林格要你杀死犀牛之王奈达和他的同伴\"饭盒\"。",oEN="Killinger the Den Watcher at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill Nedar, Lord of Rhinos and his companion, \"Lunchbox.\"",p="你打败他们了吗？",pEN="Have you put them down?",c="至少眼下，犀牛们可以安享太平了。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="At least for now the rhinos will know peace. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[11885]={d="这本书中列有斯克提斯爪之祭司所囚禁着的所有泰罗克的宿敌的后裔，包括猎手吉萨拉克、水晶巨人卡尔洛格，还有被贬为异端的黑暗尖啸者阿克卡莱和风怒者瓦克奇斯。必须要在泰罗克回到这个世界之前将他们全部杀死。\n\n你首先需要夺取一些迷失鸦人身上带着的卷轴，然后在斯克提斯的召唤法阵中烧掉卷轴，这样才能召唤并杀死它们。要知道，它们都是非常非常强大的存在，你最好带上几个朋友一起去。",dEN="The descendants held prisoner by the Skettis talonpriests are listed in this book: Gezzarak the Huntress, Karrog the crystal giant, the heretic known as Darkscreecher Akkarai and Vakkiz the Windrager. They will all need to be slain before Terokk returns to this world.\n\nYou will need the scrolls carried by the time-lost arakkoa to call them forth at the summoning circles in Skettis. These are powerful beings you will be facing; you would do well to bring friends.",o="在斯克提斯寻找召唤法阵中的徽记堆，用10张迷失卷轴召唤出一个泰罗克仇敌的后裔，并击败总共四个泰罗克仇敌的后裔。完成任务之后回去向黑风码头的哈吉克复命。",oEN="Find the Skull Piles in the middle of the summoning circles of Skettis. Summon and defeat each of the descendants by using 10 Time-Lost Scrolls at the Skull Pile. Return to Hazzik at Blackwind Landing.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <name>?",c="太好了！拿着这个。我把代表你击败的敌人的物品打包好了。它们能让你召唤泰罗克。\n\n小心，<name>。他是有史以来最强大的鸦人。别小看他！",cEN="Excellent! Take this. I've prepared this bundle with items symbolizing the foes you've defeated. They will allow you to summon Terokk.\n\nBeware, <name>. He is the most powerful arakkoa to ever exist. Do not underestimate him!"}
Q[11886]={d="$c，欢声笑语笼罩下的火焰节已是暗潮涌动。\n\n我们接到报告称，暮光教徒近来在佐拉姆海岸的黑暗深渊附近频繁活动。莫非这帮狂热份子也在庆祝节日？我看不像。转至黑暗深渊入口南边的废墟，暮光信徒在那里设有营地，去打探打探情报吧。收集到情报之后，用这个信标召唤一条幽灵狼。",dEN="While celebration has its place, <class>, some of us must look to graver matters.\n\nWhen the festival began, we received reports from Zoram Strand about a sharp increase in Twilight Cult activity. The origins of this holiday are steeped in the very powers those madmen revere; this cannot be coincidence. Go to the camp just south of the Blackfathom Deeps entrance, in the ruins, and see if the cultists will part with information - forcefully if need be. Use this beacon to summon a guide when you find it.",o="转至灰谷的佐拉姆海岸，在黑暗深渊入口以南寻找新建的暮光营地，从该处的暮光教徒身上搜寻暮光信件，然后使用图腾信标召唤大地之环幽灵狼。",oEN="Go to the new Twilight Camp south of the Blackfathom Deeps entrance on the Zoram Strand of Ashenvale and retrieve Twilight Correspondence from the cultists, then call upon the Earthen Ring Guide using the Totemic Beacon.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you uncovered?",c="这真令人担心，朋友。它暗示着一个更大的阴谋，除了当地火和水元素骚动外，这里需要更进一步的调查……",cEN="This is worrisome, friend. It hints at a much larger plot beyond simple agitation of the local fire and water elements, and something here bears investigation..."}
Q[11887]={d="你在侏儒的尸体上发现了一只小包裹，里面装满了军粮、工具以及一卷侏儒胶卷。这些东西说不定能帮助菲兹克斯·盖维斯特研究如何仿造侏儒飞行器。\n\n如果再拣几个飞行员背包回去，说不定菲兹克斯会赏你点什么呢。",dEN="Rifling through the dead gnome's possessions, you come across a small packet filled with rations, tools, and a handy roll of gnomish duct tape. The contents of these kits might prove helpful to Fezzix Geartwist when it comes time for him to reassemble the wreckage of the gnomish flying machines.\n\nBringing a few of these kits to Fezzix might just be worth a nice bonus.",o="从坠机的菲兹兰克侦察机飞行员尸体上收集7个侏儒应急工具包，将它们交给牦牛村的菲兹克斯·盖维斯特。",oEN="Collect 7 Gnomish Emergency Toolkits from the bodies of crashed Fizzcrank Recon Pilots and bring them to Fezzix Geartwist at Taunka'le Village.",p="你手里拿着什么？",pEN="What is it you have there?",c="侏儒应急工具包？给我的？这应该可以让修复飞行器变得更简单一些。",cEN="Gnomish tools? For me? These should make rebuilding that flying machine even easier than I expected."}
Q[11888]={d="$R，酋长让我耐心等待……可是牦牛村当前的局势不能再拖下去了！\n\n我听说你很有本事。与其继续央求加尔鲁什派出援军，不如请你前去帮助我的族人。\n\n牦牛村位于遥远的东北方，沿着要塞东侧的道路一直走，在交叉路口转向北，然后在下一个交叉路口往东，这条道路途经洪荒平原滚烫熔池的南部和东部，最终通往牦牛村。\n\n到达牦牛村之后与天空大地先知谈一谈吧。",dEN="<race>, the chieftain is making me wait... time that Taunka'le does not have!\n\nThere has been talk of your prowess. Rather than wait for Garrosh to send help, I ask you to go and help my people.\n\nTaunka'le village lies far to the northeast. Follow the road east out of the hold, turning north at the intersection. Not long after, you will come to another intersection. Follow the path east, passing south and then east of the great pools along the flood plains.\n\nSpeak with Sage Earth and Sky when you arrive.",o="与北风苔原牦牛村的天空大地先知谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Sage Earth and Sky at Taunka'le Village.",c="我并不意外兽人酋长没有时间听一听我们的困难。特使的努力有可能就像烟雾一样被风吹散。\n\n但现在你来，我们可以看看他派你前来的选择是否妥当。",cEN="It does not surprise me that the orc chieftain does not have time to hear of our troubles. The ambassador's efforts will likely be like so much mist blowing in the wind.\n\nBut you are here now. We shall see if he chose well in sending you."}
Q[11889]={d="一直以来，我们的防线都固若金汤，没有让这些虫子前进一步。但有些可恶的杂种会飞，这样它们就可以飞过外围防线，直接攻击我们的内部防御圈。\n\n我已经向民用船只征集了一些强化捕网。如果你的臂力足够的话，这些网能帮你扫清空中的敌人。去干掉一些虫子，让我们守住要塞。",dEN="We're doing a good job of holding the front lines against these bugs. Some of these cheeky fiends, however, can fly over the aforementioned front lines and are really beating down on our inner defenses.\n\nI've requisitioned reinforced fishing nets from our civilian ships. If you've got a good enough throwing arm, they'll help you knock the enemy out of the sky. Thin their numbers so that our defenses can hold the keep.",o="哈默希尔中士要你到无畏要塞外使用强化捕网捕捉并杀死6只天灾烈焰蛛。",oEN="Sergeant Hammerhill wants you to use the Reinforced Net to help you slay 6 Scourged Flamespitters outside of Valiance Keep.",p="你回来了。但愿是好消息？",pEN="You're back. Good news, hopefully?",c="它们从地上来我们会击败它们，它们从空中来我们也会给它们好看。如果那些没爹没娘的不死生物敢从海上来，我们绝对让它们没命回去。",cEN="We'll beat them if they come by land and we'll beat them if they come by air. If these motherless undead come by sea we're going to give them the beating of their lives."}
Q[11890]={d="西边那些水池一带的侏儒似乎遇到了麻烦。谁叫他们整天搞些乱七八糟的“发明”，真是活该。\n\n我要你转至他们的泵站调查情况，然后向我汇报结果。",dEN="The gnomes have run into some trouble in the pools to the west. It serves them right as they have been fouling up the land with their so-called inventions.\n\nI want you to go out to their pumping station and observe what has befallen them. Return to me after.",o="调查菲兹兰克泵站周围的区域，然后返回北风苔原的牦牛村，向天空大地先知汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the area surrounding the Fizzcrank Pumping Station. Then, return to Sage Earth and Sky at Taunka'le Village.",p="你发现了什么，<race>？",pEN="What did you find out, <race>?",c="真是个糟糕的消息。\n\n我的族人很快就要离开这个地方了。我们要冲破天灾军团的防线转至我们在龙骨荒野的家园——冰雾村。\n\n但在此之前，我们要解决侏儒的疯狂所造成的灾害。",cEN="Troubling news indeed.\n\nMy people are leaving this place soon. We are going to break through the Scourge lines to get to our capital, Icemist, in the Dragonblight.\n\nBut, before we do that, we must deal with what the gnomes in their insanity have wrought."}
Q[11891]={d="照这上面所说，佐拉姆海岸那场大集会的西北方似乎还有一处邪教徒营地，他们正在与一些……\"客人\"……交谈。\n\n我们或许能从这些谈话中得知许多事，$r。拿着这颗宝珠：它能让你变成海滩上那些爬行生物的模样。去西北营地偷听邪教徒与那些\"客人\"的谈话，成功后回来向我汇报。",dEN="According to this, it seems there is another encampment of the cultists to the northwest of the large gathering on the Zoram Strand, and they are speaking with... guests?\n\nMuch could be learned from listening to these proceedings, <race>. Take this orb; it will allow you to appear as one of the native crawlers on the beach. Spy on the conversation with these \"guests\" of the cultists at the northwestern camp and report back to me when you are successful.",o="在灰谷佐拉姆海岸的黑暗深渊入口以西寻找新建的暮光营地，使用螃蟹宝珠打探情报，然后使用图腾信标召唤大地之环幽灵狼。",oEN="Use the Orb of the Crawler to spy upon the new Twilight camp to the west of the Blackfathom Deeps entrance on the Zoram Strand in Ashenvale, then summon the Earthen Ring Guide using the Totemic Beacon.",p="你知道他们的秘密了吗？",pEN="Have you learned their secrets?",c="他们想召唤一个冰霜之王到我们的世界？不！他们不能破坏平衡！",cEN="They seek to summon a frost lord into our world? No! They cannot tip the balance!"}
Q[11892]={d="你为北风苔原的动物们做了这么多，$n……奈辛瓦里的走狗已被击退，也学到了一个他们不会很快忘记的教训。\n\n哈罗德·莱恩——纳格兰大屠杀的主要负责人——已被确认是苔原上奈辛瓦里行动的头目。他就驻在此处以西的库姆亚湖。\n\n<拉索留斯递给你一只雕刻精美的橡木号角。>\n\n找到莱恩，杀了他。如果需要我们的援助，就吹响这只号角。|n",dEN="You have done much for the animals of the Borean Tundra, <name>. Nesingwary's lackeys have been beaten back and taught a lesson that they will not soon forget.\n\nHarold Lane, the primary agent responsible for the mass slaughters in Nagrand, has been identified as the man in charge of Nesingwary operations in the tundra. He is stationed at Lake Kum'uya, west of here.\n\n<Lathorius hands you an intricately carved oak horn.>\n\nFind Lane and kill him. Use this horn should you require our aid.",o="仁德会营地的大德鲁伊拉索留斯要求你杀死哈罗德·兰恩。",oEN="Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Outpost in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill Harold Lane.",p="杀掉冻原屠夫了吗？",pEN="Is the Borean Butcher slain?",c="唉，奈辛瓦里走了，也许他从来就没在这里……\n\n<伊拉索留斯叹了口气。>\n\n这恶魔很狡猾，但是他的时日不多了。我们会把他揪出来的，一定会……",cEN="Alas, Nesingwary is gone. Perhaps he was never here to begin with...\n\n<Lathorius sighs.>\n\nThe demon is a slippery one, but his days are numbered. We will find him and when we do..."}
Q[11893]={d="我一直在提醒这个笨蛋地精，叫他别太相信那些破烂机器的稳定性。\n\n但是我所掌握的元素之力并不完整，等到修行结束后，我才能完全地运用这种能力。不过，我还是能帮菲兹克斯一些忙的。\n\n带上这个风魂图腾转至西边的村落，将它插在蒸汽狂怒者旁边，图腾会从死去的元素身上汲取能量。将充满能量的图腾带回来给我，接下来的事我自己会搞定的。",dEN="I kept trying to tell that silly goblin his machines are unreliable.\n\nBut the power of the elements; that is deep and abiding. When my apprenticeship is over, I will wield their full power. What I know now should be sufficient to help out our friend Fezzix, though.\n\nTake this windsoul totem and plant it near any of the steam ragers to the west of the village. The totem will gather up the energies of slain elementals. Return the fully charged totem to me and I'll do the rest.",o="牦牛村的多莱安·霜蹄要你利用风魂图腾收集10只蒸汽狂怒者的能量。",oEN="Dorain Frosthoof at Taunka'le Village wants you to use the Windsoul Totem to gather the energy of 10 Steam Ragers.",p="图腾充能完毕了吗？",pEN="Have you charged the totem?",c="<多莱安点点头。>\n\n很好，这样应该足以向菲兹克斯表达我一直想告诉他的事情。",cEN="<Dorain nods.>\n\nGood. This should be sufficient to show Fezzix exactly what I've been trying to tell him."}
Q[11894]={d="还记得前几天你带回来的那些侏儒胶带吗？\n\n嘿嘿，我终于知道那玩意儿是干嘛的了。你瞧，这台飞行器的机身严重受损，要让它飞起来的话就需要好好加固了。\n\n多莱安说牦牛人利用蒸汽处理驯鹿皮，然后将这种韧性极强的熟化驯鹿皮制成密封的容器。村子附近就生活着许多沼泽驯鹿，南边的洪荒平原也有它们的踪迹。我要你搞一些它们的皮，然后在蒸汽平原的蒸汽泉眼上处理一下。",dEN="Remember all that gnomish duct tape you brought me?\n\nWell, I've found a use for it. The body of this flying machine is so banged up in places, that I'm going to need to reinforce it if I ever hope to fly.\n\nDorain over there has been telling me that the taunka use steam cured caribou leather for making watertight containers. Marsh caribou live all around the village and in the Flood Plains to the south. Get the best hides you can find and cure them over the steam vents in the Geyser Fields.",o="牦牛村的菲兹克斯·盖维斯特要你给他带回5张蒸汽熟化鹿皮。",oEN="Fezzix Geartwist at Taunka'le Village wants you to bring him 5 Steam Cured Hides.",p="你带了蒸汽熟化鹿皮给我吗？",pEN="Did you get that cured caribou hide for me?",c="太好了！再给我一点时间，我就可以成为飞天地精啦！",cEN="Fantastic! A few more tweaks and I'll be an airborne goblin!"}
Q[11895]={d="照你的描述，那些金属造物应该很容易对付。但首先，你必须驾驭风暴。\n\n在我身后的棚屋里有一座图腾。当你$g准备好:准备好;时，将意志集中于它，风暴便会降临。你必须击败风暴，并借此将它的精华纳入己身。\n\n如果还有其他人在场，你们合力击败它即可。之后回来见我，$c。",dEN="From what you describe, the creatures of metal should be easy to deal with. But first, you must master the storm.\n\nBehind me in the lodge is a totem. When you are ready, focus your will upon it and the storm will come. You must defeat the storm and in so doing take its essence into yourself.\n\nIf others are there, it is enough that you all work together to defeat it. Return to me after, <class>.",o="击败狂乱风暴，然后向北风苔原牦牛村的天空大地先知复命。",oEN="Defeat the Storm Tempest and then return to Sage Earth and Sky at Taunka'le Village.",p="你驾驭了风暴吗？",pEN="Have you mastered the storm yet?",c="我感受到风暴之力在你体内奔涌！\n\n你已准备就绪，<name>。让我们开始吧。",cEN="I feel the power of the storm coursing through you!\n\nYou are ready, <name>. Let us begin."}
Q[11896]={d="你已经掌握了风暴的力量。我会教你如何运用这种力量来削弱西边滚烫熔池里的机器人。\n\n这是一根闪电魔杖，它可以帮你对付机械侏儒的创造物。就别在机械侏儒身上浪费时间了，塔迦祖母有别的法子对付他们。\n\n借助风暴的力量削弱机器人，然后彻底地摧毁它们！",dEN="You now have the power of the storm within you. I will give you the means to focus that power and weaken the robots in the pools.\n\nTake this lightning rod. Use it against the robotic creations of the mechagnomes you find within the greater pools area to the west. Do not worry about using it against the mechagnomes themselves; Greatmother Taiga has other plans for them.\n\nOnce the robots are weakened by the power of the storm, dismantle them utterly!",o="利用风暴的力量削弱并摧毁15名机器人（不包括那些机械侏儒）。你可以在菲兹兰克泵站周围的池塘中找到它们。\n\n完成任务后回到北风苔原的牦牛村，向天空大地先知复命。",oEN="While weakened by the Power of the Storm, destroy any 15 of the robotic units, except the mechagnomes, in the greater pools area surrounding the Fizzcrank Pumping Station.\n\nAfterward, return to Sage Earth and Sky at Taunka'le Village.",p="你解除了那些邪恶产物身上的风暴之力了吗？",pEN="Have you unleashed the power of the storm upon those unnatural creations?",c="随着他们的机器爪牙被解决，就该是我们进行更大牺牲的时候了。不幸的是，尽管如此，我还是能感觉到风暴之力在你体内逐渐散去。\n\n不过，这符合它的目的，我想就算没有这东西，你还是有办法进行下一步。",cEN="With their robotic minions dealt with, it is time for us to move on to bigger prey. Unfortunately, even now I feel the power of the storm waning from within you.\n\nNevertheless, it served its purpose, and I think that you're more than capable of taking the next step without it."}
Q[11897]={d="天灾军团还没有后撤的迹象，$n。都是那些该死的虫孔。据我们所知，这些虫孔直接通向冰冠冰川，而且巨大的亡灵虫子正在地下不知疲倦地拓展着虫孔。\n\n如果说我从多年的矿工工作中学到了什么的话，那就是如果没有支撑梁，只需要进行一次爆破，隧道就会非常容易崩塌。\n\n带上这些炸弹，把它们放在西边海滩那边的山脊上的虫孔入口处。炸掉那些虫孔后回来向我复命。",dEN="The Scourge are showing no sign of letting up, <name>. It's those blasted sinkholes; they connect to tunnels all the way to Icecrown for all we know. Giant undead worms burrow under the ground to create them.\n\nIf there's something years of mining has taught me it's that without support beams, tunnels will cave in easily after an explosion.\n\nTake these explosives and place them at the entrance to the sinkholes up on the ridge beyond the beach to the west. Come back after you've collapsed them.",o="哈默希尔中士要你使用火焰炸弹摧毁无畏要塞西南方和西北方的虫孔。",oEN="Sergeant Hammerhill wants you to use the Incendiary Explosives to collapse the sinkholes southwest and northwest of Valiance Keep.",p="你成功了吗，<name>？我们必须拖慢天灾军团，否则瓦加德堡垒就会被攻陷。",pEN="Did you succeed, <name>? We need to slow down the Scourge or Valiance Keep will be overrun.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。没有你，瓦加德堡垒或许就挡不住那些进攻者了。多亏你的帮助，我们才能活下来继续战斗。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Without you, Valiance Keep might've not held against the attackers. Thanks to your help we'll live to fight another day."}
Q[11898]={d="圣城恩其拉的最底层有一座笼罩在光芒之中的灰色祭坛。站在祭坛上，就可以进入那座可怕的浮空城——纳克萨纳尔。\n\n$n，千万小心。瓦拉纳王子拥有众多侍从，这帮走狗宁愿死也不会让你伤害他们的主子。\n\n你必须在浮空城中杀出一条血路，直抵王子的宝座。$n，如果你败在他手中，恐怕我的族人们就再也没有机会安全撤离到冰雾村了。",dEN="On the lowest tier of the Temple City, there is a gray altar bathed in light. Step into it to gain entry to the dread necropolis Naxxanar.\n\nBe cautious, <name>. Prince Valanar will certainly be defended by his personal retainers, who will give their lives to keep you from ascending to the top level of the necropolis.\n\nYou must find your way through the necropolis to the prince's seat. If you fail to defeat him, <name>, I fear my people will never know the safety Icemist offers.",o="击败瓦拉纳王子以及他手下的两名中尉，残忍的范瑟雷和邪恶的卢修恩，然后向牦牛村的冬风酋长复命。",oEN="Defeat Prince Valanar and his lieutenants, Vanthryn the Merciless and Luthion the Vile, then report to Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village.",p="你击败瓦拉纳王子了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated Prince Valanar?",c="王子既已败亡，天灾军团在北风苔原的存在便被击破了。我并不妄想他们会长期退避，因此我必须专注于培养杜尔姆，让他带领村民前往冰雾村。\n\n<酋长缓缓摇头。>\n\n尽管我与杜尔姆有过种种分歧，我仍信任他的判断与能力。我无法狠心放弃坦卡雷村，所以我会守卫它，直到战死。<El jefe sacude la cabeza lentamente>",cEN="With the prince defeated, the Scourge presence in Borean Tundra is broken. I have no illusions that they will stay away for long, which is why I must focus on preparing Durm to lead the villagers on their way to Icemist.\n\n<The chieftain shakes his head slowly.>\n\nFor all the disagreements I've had with Durm, I trust his judgment and his abilities. I cannot bring myself to abandon Taunka'le, so I will defend it until I am slain."}
Q[11899]={d="也不知道西边滚烫熔池的机械侏儒是从哪儿冒出来的。总之，在泵站作业的侏儒莫名其妙地消失之后，机械侏儒就出现了。\n\n天知道这些家伙会搞出什么事来，我们还是解决掉他们比较好。\n\n带上这个捕魂器，对机械侏儒的尸体使用它就能捕获他们的灵魂。然后我们可以释放他们的灵魂，了解这些侏儒究竟遭遇了什么。",dEN="The mechagnomes in the pools to the west are a great mystery to us. They appeared not long after the gnomes disappeared from their pumping station and its environs.\n\nThey are an unnatural danger and must be dealt with.\n\nTake this soulcatcher and use it on the remains of the mechagnomes to capture their souls. When you return, we will set them free so that we might find out what happened.",o="使用祖母的捕魂器捕获10个菲兹兰克机械侏儒的灵魂。完成任务后返回北风苔原的牦牛村，向塔迦祖母复命。",oEN="Use The Greatmother's Soulcatcher to capture the souls of 10 Fizzcrank mechagnomes. Then, return to Greatmother Taiga at Taunka'le Village once you have done so.",p="你的进展如何？",pEN="How fares your progress?",c="现在我们必须释放你抓住的这些灵魂。",cEN="Now we must free the souls that you have captured."}
Q[11900]={d="我原本还希望魔枢的影响仅仅限于这个地区。但最近从艾泽拉斯各地发来的大量分析报告指出，地质活动的不稳定程度正在以几何级数增长！\n\n在研究应对方法的同时，我需要魔枢的定期监测数据。\n\n我已经在考达拉四周安装了灵敏的监测仪器，并且把它们伪装成了玛里苟斯的占卜宝珠的样子。其中一台仪器在魔枢附近的壕沟里，另外三台藏在山谷边界的建筑物中。你去帮我查看一下，把仪器的监测数据给我带回来吧。",dEN="I had hoped that the Nexus' impact was limited to this region. Recently though, reports have flooded in from all over Azeroth suggesting that geologic instability is growing exponentially!\n\nI need the Nexus monitored regularly as I work to develop a solution.\n\nI've placed sensitive instruments around Coldarra, disguised as Malygos' scrying orbs. One lies in the trench near the Nexus, and three are hidden in the structures around the valley's perimeter. Visit each and return to me with their readings.",o="永生之盾的大法师伯林纳德要你去收集他安装在考达拉的监测仪器上的数据。",oEN="Archmage Berinand at the Transitus Shield has asked you to collect the readings from his instruments in Coldarra.",p="你看过所有仪器的读数了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you read all of my instruments, <class>?",c="这比我预期的还糟糕。\n\n玛里苟斯引导太多力量到这个地方了。如果再不阻止他，艾泽拉斯将会成为另一个外域！\n\n幸好，我相信我找到了一个临时的解决方法……",cEN="This is worse than I expected.\n\nMalygos is channeling too much power to this place. If he's not stopped, Azeroth will be the next Outlands!\n\nFortunately, I believe that I've engineered a temporary solution...."}
Q[11901]={d="到处都是天灾军团，$c。我们已经把农民和矿工编入了民兵团，但情况还是没有改善。\n\n无畏要塞曾经派了一队人去防守矿井，但我们已经好几天没收到他们的消息了！\n\n如果你真的想帮忙，不如到矿井去看看发生了什么事？也许我们能从他们那里得到一些增援。",dEN="There's Scourge everywhere, <class>. We've organized the farmers and miners into a militia, but this just won't cut it.\n\nThe one detachment of troops that Valiance Keep sent is defending the mine. We haven't heard from them in days!\n\nIf you really wish to help us, why don't you go to the mine and see what's going on? Maybe we can get them to send us some reinforcements.",o="致远郡的吉拉德·格林要你到北方的矿井去看看那里的守军发生了什么事。",oEN="Gerald Green in Farshire wants you to go into the mine to the north and find out what happened to the military detachment that was sent there.",c="在你靠近谷物的时候，你的胃感到一阵不适。那个气味几乎无法让人承受。",cEN="Your stomach feels uneasy as you approach the grain. The smell is nearly unbearable."}
Q[11902]={d="袋中的谷物发出的阵阵恶臭令你联想到了瘟疫。这可能就是造成矿井守军现状的原因。\n\n你最好把这个消息报告给吉拉德·格林。",dEN="The sacks of grain emanate the foul stench you've come to associate with the Plague. This probably explains what happened to the footmen defending the mine.\n\nYou'd best bring word back to Gerald Green.",o="回到致远郡，向吉拉德·格林复命。",oEN="Return to Gerald Green in Farshire.",c="那些可怜的小伙子……他们根本没有机会！\n\n这听起来就像是内奸干的。说不定是个诅咒教派的渗透者。那些疯子最好都下地狱去！",cEN="Those poor lads... they never had a chance!\n\nThis sure sounds like an inside job. Probably a Cult of the Damned infiltrator. Curse those madmen!"}
Q[11903]={d="你瞧，$n。致远郡的守军全部战死了，甚至更糟……所以我们只能靠自己打败天灾军团了。\n\n我们已经把致远郡里剩下的壮丁全部编入了民兵团，但如果没有你的帮助，他们胜利的希望会很渺茫。去帮他们一把……我和我的士兵们会守住这条路。绝对不能让天灾军团通过！",dEN="Well, <name>. With the last of our military in Farshire dead or worse, we can do but one thing: fight these Scourge ourselves.\n\nWe have deployed militia in what remains of Farshire. Without your help, they've but little hope of winning. Go and lend them a hand. Me and the lads will watch this path. We can't let the Scourge break through!",o="致远郡的吉拉德·格林要你去杀死14个天灾食腐者。",oEN="Gerald Green in Farshire wants you to kill 14 Plagued Scavengers.",p="你好好打击了那些食尸鬼吗？",pEN="You giving those ghouls a good beating, I hope?",c="你以天灾军团唯一的语言：暴力与死亡好好地和他们沟通了一番。只可惜他们却彷佛永远也杀不完！",cEN="You've communicated with the Scourge in the only language they understand: violence and death. Unfortunately they just keep coming!"}
Q[11904]={d="天灾军团还在不断涌来……但我们不能放弃！听着，$n。在矿井里有一车矿石，是联盟在这一地区所能采集到的最后一点矿石，因此非常珍贵。\n\n问题是矿石车被锁住了。军队开进矿井的时候，亚克布上尉征用了所有的重要设备，包括矿石车的钥匙。\n\n现在亚克布肯定也和矿井里的士兵一样被瘟疫感染了。你去从他那里拿回钥匙，把矿石带回来。",dEN="The Scourge just keeps coming... but we can't give up! Listen, <name>. Inside that mine there's a cart with the last of the ore the Alliance is going to see on this side of the continent for a long time.\n\nThe problem is the cart release is locked. When the military went in there, Captain Jacobs commandeered all the important equipment, including the cart release key.\n\nThe plague that affected the soldiers in the mine must also have affected Jacobs. Get the key from him and salvage the ore.",o="转至致远郡的矿井，从亚克布上尉身上夺取矿石车钥匙，并用它开启矿石车。完成任务后向致远郡的吉拉德·格林复命。",oEN="Go to the mine in Farshire, obtain the Cart Release Key from Captain Jacobs and use it to release the ore cart. Return to Gerald Green in Farshire when you've completed this task.",p="矿石安全吗，<name>？",pEN="The ore, <name>, is it safe?",c="谢谢你，<name>。在未来的日子里，这些矿石对联盟至关重要。我愿意相信今天我们改变了些什么。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. This ore will be of vital importance to the Alliance in the times to come. I'd like to think we've made a difference today."}
Q[11905]={d="艾泽拉斯的魔网能量正被引导流向魔枢。\n\n奥术能量的涌入正在维度之间撕开一道裂隙。\n\n我无法阻止它，但我找到了延缓它的办法。\n\n拿着这个，在正在形成的裂隙附近激活它。",dEN="I've determined the cause of the instability!\n\nAzeroth's ley lines are being redirected to the Nexus. It's fascinating! If only I could spend the remainder of my days studying this anomaly....\n\nSadly, I must focus on the immediate crisis. The influx of arcane energies is tearing a rift between dimensions.\n\nDeep inside the Nexus, the fabric of our universe is being weakened. I cannot stop it, but I've discovered a way to slow it down.\n\nTake this into the Nexus and activate it near the forming rift.",o="永生之盾的大法师伯林纳德要你在魔枢的裂隙附近使用交叉空间重塑器。",oEN="Archmage Berinand in the Transitus Shield wants you to use the Interdimensional Refabricator near the rift in the Nexus.",p="你到过魔枢的裂隙了吗？",pEN="Have you been to the rift in the Nexus?",c="干得漂亮，<name>。震动已经开始减弱了。\n\n但愿你的努力为我们争取到了足够的时间，去找到挫败玛里苟斯计划的办法。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. The tremors have already begun to subside.\n\nWith any luck, your efforts have granted us sufficient time to find a way to thwart Malygos' efforts."}
Q[11906]={d="<一滴泪珠从铁眼的脸颊滑落。>\n\n我听说你要回西边的熔池去。趁你在那边，我有件事交给你办，$r。\n\n那些侏儒毫不在意这片土地，用他们的机械污染了它。我要你捡起你遇到的所有散落零件。\n\n把它们带回这里给我。在我们永远离开这地方之前，我会把它们妥善处理掉。",dEN="<A single tear rolls down the face of Iron Eyes.>\n\nI have heard that you are heading back into the pools to the west. I have something for you to do while you are out there, <race>.\n\nThe gnomes, who care nothing for the land, have polluted it with their machinery. I want you to pick up any spare parts that you come across.\n\nReturn them to me here. I will see to it that they are properly disposed of before we leave this place for good.",o="将15个菲兹兰克备用零件交给北风苔原牦牛村的铁眼。",oEN="Collect 15 Fizzcrank Spare Parts and deliver them to Iron Eyes at Taunka'le Village.",p="如果我们无法照顾大地母亲，她也不会容忍我们长久生活于此的。",pEN="If we do not take care of the land, she will not suffer us to live for long.",c="在我们继续旅程之前，我们把土地复原，这就是牦牛人的传统。\n\n我们很快就要出发转至我们的首都——冰雾村。你的帮助让我们的速度提高了不少。\n\n感谢你。",cEN="It is the taunka way to leave the land pristine before we move on.\n\nWe will be traveling to our capital, Icemist, very soon. You have helped by allowing us to depart that much more quickly.\n\nThank you."}
Q[11907]={d="据说机甲专家麦卡佐德指派了四名副官来操纵滚烫熔池的机器人。\n\n必须消灭他们！\n\n根据我们的远行者和猎人的说法，你只需转至西部哨站、北部哨站、中部哨站和南部哨站，转动那些哨站的阀门以破坏设施，就可以让他们露面。\n\n你应该不难找到那些哨站，上面都安置着旋转灯呢。\n\n$n，抓紧时间！",dEN="It is known that Gearmaster Mechazod has four sub-chieftains that manage the robots in the pools.\n\nWe must put an end to them!\n\nOur longrunners and snow trackers say that if you were to turn the valves at the west point, north point, mid point and south point stations, each of his sub-chieftains would come quickly to prevent you from fouling their operations.\n\nThe stations are centered on the spinning lights in the pools surrounding the pumping station.\n\nHurry, <name>!",o="摧毁托奇、ED-210、麦克斯·布拉斯托和研磨者，然后返回北风苔原的牦牛村，向天空大地先知复命。",oEN="Defeat Twonky, ED-210, Max Blasto, and The Grinder, and then report back to Sage Earth and Sky at Taunka'le Village.",p="你解决了副手吗？",pEN="Are the sub-chieftains dealt with?",c="谢谢你，<name>。\n\n这些怪异生物既已消灭，处理剩下的熔池应该就简单了。\n\n我们欠你一份恩情。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nWith these odd creatures destroyed, dealing with the rest of the pools should now be a simple matter.\n\nWe owe you a debt of gratitude."}
Q[11908]={d="我原本是负责管理收割傀儡的——在天灾军团毁掉我们的大部分农场前，这可是个要紧活儿。但我想我们可以重新利用这些傀儡。\n\n我想重新组装这些傀儡，让它们帮忙抗击天灾军团。\n\n但我对此不是很精通，我需要查阅我的工作手册才行。问题是，我把它落在车间里了……就是矿井旁边那间着火的屋子。你能帮我把它拿回来吗？",dEN="I was in charge of the harvest golems - an important job until the Scourge destroyed most of our farmlands. I've an idea that would make the golems useful again, however.\n\nI think I can rewire the harvest collectors so they'll give us a hand fighting the Scourge.\n\nI'm not an expert at this just yet, so I'm going to need my manual. The problem is, I left it at the workshop... which happens to be that burning building next to the mine. Think you could go salvage it?",o="杰里迈亚·霍宁要你从法布里附近的矿场旁那栋着火的建筑里取回\"田野、工厂与作坊\"一书。",oEN="Jeremiah Hawning wants you to retrieve the book \"Fields, Factories and Workshops\" from the burning building next to the mine in Farshire.",p="你把我的书找回来了吗？",pEN="Did you get my book back?",c="太好了！我要的资料应该就在里面。",cEN="Excellent! The information I need should be in here."}
Q[11909]={d="这个名叫机甲专家麦卡佐德的家伙显然是疯了。如果他如法炮制地拿“永生”来蛊惑我们，那我们也会成为机械奴隶！必须阻止他！\n\n我听见来自风中的低语，这家伙就呆在西边滚烫熔池中央的泵站。\n\n他很可能还在泵站顶端的指挥室里发号施令呢。进去研究一下他究竟在干什么吧。\n\n$n，你必须击败机甲专家麦卡佐德，否则他迟早会害死我们！",dEN="Clearly this Gearmaster Mechazod creature is not in his right mind. If his offer of a cure and immortality means all of us becoming robotic slaves then he must be stopped!\n\nThe winds that guide me whisper that he's atop the pumping station out in the middle of the pools to the west.\n\nMost likely, he'll be found in the command hut on top of the structure. Go inside and research his works.\n\n<name>, you must confront Mechazod if we are to survive!",o="研究机甲专家的手册，并将机甲专家麦卡佐德的徽记带回北风苔原的牦牛村，向塔迦祖母汇报你获胜的消息。",oEN="Research the Gearmaster's Manual and return Mechazod's Head to Greatmother Taiga at Taunka'le Village.",p="结束了吗？机甲专家麦卡佐德的威胁已经解除了吗？",pEN="Is it over then? Has the threat of Gearmaster Mechazod been eliminated?",c="<大地母亲如释重负地长叹一口气。>\n\n那么事情终于结束了……你救了我们！如果你没有在这里阻止他，谁知道这些侏儒的过错会蔓延到何种地步？\n\n蓝龙的威胁、魔枢之战，更别提巫妖王了——我们最不需要的就是一具泰坦的疯狂造物在外面横行！\n\n谢谢你，<name>。<La Gran Madre exhala un profundo suspiro de alivio>",cEN="<The greatmother breathes a heavy sigh of relief.>\n\nIt is done then... you have saved us! If you hadn't stopped him here, then who knows how far this mistake of the gnomes would have spread?\n\nWith the threats from the blue dragons and the Nexus War, not to mention the Lich King, the last thing we need is a mad creation of the Titans running loose!\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[11910]={d="这一地区的不稳定显然已经影响到了当地的原生生物。\n\n我对冰川古树及其近期的适应变化特别感兴趣。我怀疑它们转变成为那些\"魔法束缚\"古树的过程，或许藏着解开我们当前困境的线索。\n\n为了我的研究，我需要两者的样本。请快一些……",dEN="It's become clear that the instability in the region has had an effect on its indigenous creatures.\n\nI've taken a particular interest in the Glacial Ancients and their recent adaptations. I suspect that their transformation into these 'Magic-bound' Ancients may hold clues to our predicament here.\n\nFor my studies, I'll need samples from both. Do hurry....",o="永生之盾的大法师伯林纳德要你从考达拉的古树身上收集3块冰川古树碎片和3块魔缚古树碎片。",oEN="Archmage Berinand in the Transitus Shield wants you to collect 3 Glacial Splinters and 3 Magic-Bound Splinters from the Ancients in Coldarra.",p="你收集到我需要的样本了吗？",pEN="Have you collected the samples I requested?",c="好，好。这些正合适。\n\n谢谢你，<race>。",cEN="Yes, yes. These shall do nicely.\n\nThank you, <race>."}
Q[11911]={d="我在这里短短一段时间里学到的东西，比数十年研究还要多。\n\n这些古树正暴露在难以置信的奥术能量之下。这确实正把它们转化成某种……不同的东西。\n\n我确信它们的蜕变还有下一个阶段。去取得它们最终形态的证据。",dEN="Though we may be witnessing the end of our existence, I can't help but marvel. I've learned more in my short time here than in decades of studies.\n\nThese Ancients are being exposed to incredible levels of arcane energy. It's literally transforming them into something... different.\n\nI'm confident that there's another stage in their metamorphosis. I'll need you to actually enter the Nexus, <name>, and find me some evidence of their final state.\n\nDo be careful....",o="永生之盾的大法师伯林纳德要你进入魔枢，并从晶化保卫者身上收集5块奥术古树碎片。",oEN="Archmage Berinand in the Transitus Shield wants you to enter the Nexus and collect 5 Arcane Splinters from Crystalline Protectors.",p="晶化保卫者……他们真的存在吗？",pEN="The Crystalline Ancients... Do they exist?",c="太迷人了！\n\n而且你说它们还带有攻击性。那就说明这场操纵背后存在某种智慧。这或许根本不是自然现象……\n\n<name>，请收下这个，作为我们对你付出的感谢。达拉然会得知你的功绩。",cEN="Fascinating!\n\nAnd they're aggressive too, you say. That would suggest that some intelligence is behind this manipulation. It may not be natural at all....\n\nPlease, <name>, accept this as a token of our gratitude for your efforts. Dalaran will hear of your service."}
Q[11912]={d="呀！能看到一张新面孔真是让我感到欣慰，我还以为我们已经被抛弃了呢。\n\n我们的补给线已经被切断好几天了，而当前的形势似乎有点——好吧，是非常糟糕。老实说，我觉得这完全是个自杀式的任务。\n\n可能我并没有应付这种暴力场面的天赋——更不要说这要命的冰天雪地了！我宁愿回达拉然去研究古代文献。\n\n现在的关键是，我们的食品储备已经快没了，请你帮我尽可能多地收集食物回来。",dEN="Oh! What a relief it is to see a fresh face. I was beginning to feel we had been forsaken.\n\nOur supply lines were cut off days ago, and things have been looking - well, bleak. To be honest, this was a suicide mission to begin with if you ask me.\n\nMaybe I'm simply not cut out for all of this violence - to say nothing of the bitter cold! I'd much rather be back in Dalaran studying ancient texts.\n\nTo the point, our food supply is nearly spent. Please, gather what you can and bring it to me.",o="永生之盾的图书馆员塞尔拉要你从考达拉的冰莓灌木丛上收集10份冰莓。",oEN="Librarian Serrah in the Transitus Shield wants you to gather 10 Frostberries from the Frostberry Bushes in Coldarra.",p="你找到任何食物了吗？",pEN="Have you been able to find any food?",c="嗯，这不太多，但应该够让我们撑过一天。\n\n我相信你应该会觉得以你的努力来说，这样的报酬很公平。",cEN="Well, it's not much, but it should keep us alive for another day.\n\nI believe you'll find this to be a fair price for your efforts."}
Q[11913]={d="我听到你和吉拉德的谈话了，而且我一点也不喜欢这个消息。如果那些狂热者们能在矿井的粮食里下毒，那对外面的粮食就更容易得手。\n\n我们没有时间去分辨粮食的好坏了，必须立即行动，把所有粮食都销毁。\n\n带上这支火把，把附近所有你能找到的粮食全部烧掉。如果我们从这场袭击中幸存下来，结果却死于瘟疫，那可真成大笑话了。",dEN="I heard what you told Gerald and I don't like it one bit. If cultists managed to poison the grain in the mines with their foul plague, they could've easily done the same with the grain outside.\n\nWe don't have time to sort the good grain from the bad. We must act quickly and burn it all.\n\nTake this torch and set fire to any sacks of grain you find out here. It would be a tragedy if we survived this attack only to succumb to the plague afterwards.",o="温蒂·达伦要你使用温蒂的火炬烧掉8袋致远郡谷物。",oEN="Wendy Darren wants you to use Wendy's Torch to burn 8 sacks of Farshire Grain.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。我可不愿看到法布里袭击的幸存者撞上被瘟疫污染的谷物。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. I would hate to see survivors of the attack on Farshire stumble upon plagued grain."}
Q[11914]={d="我们能在这里站稳脚跟，全得仰仗我们的隐蔽措施。一旦护盾消失，哪怕只是一小会儿，玛里苟斯的手下就会发现我们。\n\n我的职责之一就是维持巫师们的法力水平，以免护盾失效。由于补给线被切断，我必须自己想办法。\n\n我需要你的帮助，$n。\n\n在靠近魔枢的地方，有一些吸收了大量魔法能量的奥术浮蛇。它们在死亡的时候会释放出体内的法力精华来，我需要这些精华。",dEN="Our existence here depends entirely upon staying hidden. Should the shield fail, even for a moment, Malygos' minions would have us.\n\nOne of my responsibilities is to rejuvenate the warmages' mana levels so their focus doesn't falter. With our supply lines lost, I've been forced to improvise.\n\nI could use your help, <name>.\n\nVery near the Nexus, Arcane Serpents feast on the abundant magical energies. Once defeated, they will yield a mana essence that I can make use of.",o="永生之盾的图书馆员塞尔拉要你杀死魔枢附近的奥术浮蛇，并收集5份魔枢法力精华。",oEN="Librarian Serrah in the Transitus Shield needs you to kill Arcane Serpents near the Nexus and collect 5 Nexus Mana Essences from them.",p="你拿到我需要的法力精华了吗？",pEN="Do you have the mana essences I asked for?",c="你对达拉然的贡献不会被忽视，<race>。\n\n希望这份报酬让你满意。",cEN="Your service to Dalaran will not go unnoticed, <race>.\n\nI hope you find this payment sufficient."}
Q[11915]={d="想学点新花招吗？\n\n不知道你能不能达到我这样的境界，不过如果你花点心思，也许真的能掌握一两个小花招哦。与任意部落主城的食焰大师谈一谈，他们或许能帮上你的忙。",dEN="Are you interested in learning some hot new skills?\n\nI don't know if you'll ever be able to match my own considerable skill, but you can probably pick up a trick or two if you're an attentive student. Speak to a Master Flame Eater at any Horde capital. They should be able to help you.",o="与任意部落主城的食焰大师谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to a Master Flame Eater in any Horde capital.",c="你好。你来学习操控火焰的新技巧吗？",cEN="Greetings. You've come learn some new ways to handle fire?"}
Q[11916]={d="你勇敢地面对了各种挑战，并凭借自己的智慧战胜了困难。$n，多亏了你的帮助，部落才能在诺森德站稳脚跟。\n\n但是，新一轮的战斗才刚刚拉开序幕。我们的目标是攻下冰封王座！\n\n接下来，我要你转至东边的牦牛村。我们的盟友陷入了危机，急需我们的援助。兽栏管理员杜尔克特·狼兄会将你安全地送往目的地，到达牦牛村后请与冬风酋长谈一谈。",dEN="You have faced all challenges that have been set before you and squashed them beneath your boot heel. It is because of you, <name>, that the Horde is now firmly entrenched in Northrend.\n\nBut our work has only just begun. We must march to Icecrown and we must tear down its walls!\n\nYour next assignment begins to the east, at Taunka'le Village. Our taunka allies are in dire straits and require aid. Secure transport from the stable master, Durkot Wolfbrother, and seek out Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le.",o="转至牦牛村与冬风酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Seek out Chieftain Wintergale at Taunka'le Village.",c="我怕你来得太晚了，勇士。我们许多的兄弟姐妹已经抛弃了牦牛村，转至龙骨荒野，在遥远的东方寻找庇护。\n\n这里留下了许多等待完成的工作，却很少人愿意协助我们……",cEN="I fear that you may be too late, champion. Many of my brothers and sisters have already abandoned Taunka'le, seeking shelter in the Dragonblight, far to the east.\n\nThere is much work left to be done here and few willing to lend us their strength..."}
Q[11917]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n返回佐拉姆海岸的暮光营地。暮光教徒企图利用寒冰之石与元素交流，就跟他们在希利苏斯的做法一样。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nReturn to the camp on the Zoram Strand with the large ice stones. They use them to communicate with the elementals, as they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至灰谷的佐拉姆海岸，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的冰浪上尉，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Frostwave Lieutenant summoned from the Ice Stone located on Zoram Strand in Ashenvale, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11918]={d="凡人，这是战争，而我们是矛尖。\n\n你们为土地或钱财而起的小小争执，与这场冲突相比微不足道。我们面对的是守护巨龙玛里苟斯和他整个蓝龙军团。你只需知道：一旦他得逞，这个世界将不复存在。\n\n我们这里人少，却要对抗众多敌人。我们几乎必死无疑，而最终的成果不过是拖延敌人罢了。\n\n现在走吧。在我决定如何处置你之前，自己找点事做。$gocupado:ocupada;",dEN="This is war, mortal, and we are the tip of the spear.\n\nYour little spats over land or currency pale in comparison to this conflict. We face the aspect Malygos and his entire blue dragonflight. All you need to know is that if he is victorious, this world shall be no more.\n\nWe are but few here, and we fly against many. Our deaths are all but a certainty, and our ultimate success lies in merely delaying our enemy.\n\nGo now. Busy yourself while I decide what to do with you.",o="永生之盾的莱洛拉斯要你消灭10个考达拉织法者。",oEN="Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield wants you to slay 10 Coldarra Spellweavers.",p="你了解我们的敌人了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you acquainted yourself with our enemy, <class>?",c="很好，<class>，既然你已经熟悉了敌人，就该开始干活了。",cEN="Alright, <class>, now that you've become familiar with the enemy it's time for you to get to work."}
Q[11919]={d="蓝龙军团开始在他们的龙身上画满神秘的符文，我要知道他们的意图。\n\n<莱洛拉斯用一支长矛刺破了手指，矛尖沾上了他的血。>\n\n使用这只长矛去驯服一只龙。在它虚弱的时候制服它，并在法力消失前把它给我带回来。\n\n蓝龙的幼崽都放养在山谷的西北边界上。",dEN="The blues have begun to cover their drakes in mysterious runes. I must discover their significance.\n\n<Raelorasz pokes his hand with a spear and coats the tip with his blood.>\n\nTake this and use it on one of them. Wait for it to become subdued, then bring it here to me before it expires.\n\nTheir hatchlings feed around the northwest edge of the valley.",o="莱洛拉斯要你使用他的长矛驯服一只魔枢雏龙，并把它带回永生之盾交给他。",oEN="Raelorasz wants you to use Raelorasz's Spear to subdue a Nexus Drake Hatchling and return it to him at the Transitus Shield.",p="你抓到一只魔枢雏龙了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to capture one of the Nexus Drakes?",c="这些幼龙的下场不必让你良心不安，<race>。这全是玛里苟斯一人的责任。\n\n我在不眠不休地破解这些符文之谜。若非必要，我们不会再夺走任何生命。",cEN="The fate of these young drakes need not burden your conscience, <race>. Malygos alone is accountable for this.\n\nI am working ceaselessly to discover the secrets of these runes. We shall take no more lives than we must."}
Q[11920]={d="这座祭坛上画满了诅咒教派的符号。显然这些狂信徒们已经从主大陆渗透到了诺森德。你最好去通知船长。\n\n他也许在甲板上。",dEN="This altar bears all the markings of the Cult of the Damned. It appears fanatics from the mainland have made it into Northrend. It might be prudent to notify the captain of the ship.\n\nPerhaps he is to be found above deck.",o="去跟勇气要塞\"风暴破坏者”号上的\"左撇子”卢格塞尔船长谈谈。",oEN="Speak to Captain \"Lefty\" Lugsail above the Stormbreaker in Valiance Keep.",c="教徒？甲板下面？我真该把所有的船员都吊起来打！\n\n听着……为什么我们不让坎特蕾布莉上将处理这个……情况？",cEN="Cultists? Below deck? I ought to have my whole crew flogged!\n\nListen... why don't we have Admiral Cantlebree take care of this... situation?"}
Q[11921]={d="你好啊，玩火的小家伙！玩得开心吗，闹出火热的乱子了吗？这话我爱听！不过，你觉得自己已经是掷火把的老手了？那我可要考考你……\n\n规则你都懂：把火把掷向标记好的火盆。不过这次，你的时间少了一点，火盆却多了很多。\n\n$g准备好了:准备好了;吗？",dEN="Hello, fire juggler! Are you having fun and making fiery mayhem? That's what I like to hear! Now, do you think you're an expert at torch tossing? Then I have a test for you...\n\nYou know the rules: toss torches at the marked braziers. This time, however, you have a little more time and a LOT more braziers to hit.\n\nReady?",o="赢得一场扔火炬游戏，然后与吞火大师谈一谈。",oEN="Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Fire Eater.",p="快点！没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Quick! There's no time to waste!",c="哇喔，你做到了！你真棒！也许明年你可以在节庆上找到一份工作！",cEN="Well done! You'll be a fire juggler faster than the fuse on a ground flower! Now gird yourself! The next test is when things really heat up..."}
Q[11922]={d="你想成为一名玩火炬的艺人？你具备相应的素质吗？比如机敏？灵活？……勇气？如果你有信心的话，不妨来试试身手！\n\n带上火炬去篝火堆附近吧。当你看见某只火盆上方显现标记时，就将火炬扔过去。动作要快！在标记消失前扔出火炬才能得分！\n\n这是一项限时游戏，你要击中规定数量的带有标记的火盆，然后回到我这儿来……准备接受新的挑战。",dEN="So you want to be a fire juggler? Do you have what it takes? The dexterity? The reflexes? ...the courage? If you think so, then let's give you a little practice!\n\nTake these torches and run near the bonfire. You'll see braziers with markers flashing above them. Toss a torch at a marked brazier. Be quick! Do it before the mark fades if you want credit for the toss!\n\nHit enough marked braziers before the time limit, then come back here... for your next lession.",o="赢得一场扔火炬游戏，然后与食焰大师谈一谈。",oEN="Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Flame Eater.",p="快点！没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Quick! There's no time to waste!",c="做得好！你很快就可以成为一名火焰杂耍师了！下一次的考验就是来真的了……",cEN="Well done! You'll be a fire juggler faster than the fuse on a ground flower! Now gird yourself! The next test is when things really heat up..."}
Q[11926]={d="你好啊，玩火的小家伙！玩得开心吗，闹出火热的乱子了吗？这话我爱听！不过，你觉得自己已经是掷火把的老手了？那我可要考考你……\n\n规则你都懂：把火把掷向标记好的火盆。不过这次，你的时间少了一点，火盆却多了很多。\n\n$g准备好了:准备好了;吗？",dEN="Hello, fire juggler! Are you having fun and making fiery mayhem? That's what I like to hear! Now, do you think you're an expert at torch tossing? Then I have a test for you...\n\nYou know the rules: toss torches at the marked braziers. This time, however, you have a little more time and a LOT more braziers to hit.\n\nReady?",o="赢得一场扔火炬游戏，然后与食焰大师谈一谈。",oEN="Win the torch tossing game, then speak with the Master Flame Eater.",p="快点！没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Quick! There's no time to waste!",c="哇喔，你做到了！你真棒！也许明年你可以在节庆上找到一份工作！",cEN="Well done! You'll be a fire juggler faster than the fuse on a ground flower! Now gird yourself! The next test is when things really heat up..."}
Q[11927]={d="嘿，$n。旅馆那边有个姑娘在找你呢，她的名字叫莉蕾萨。\n\n我猜她应该不认识你，但她似乎非常需要帮助。听她说话的语气，似乎已经绝望透顶了。",dEN="Hey, <name>. There's a girl in the inn that's asking about you. Her name's Leryssa.\n\nI don't think she knows you, but she said she needed your help. She sounded really desperate.",o="在无畏要塞的旅店中找到莉蕾萨。",oEN="Find Leryssa at the inn in Valiance Keep",c="感谢你来见我。我不知道能找谁。",cEN="Thank you for coming to see me. I didn't know who else to contact."}
Q[11928]={d="我们应该能守住这里，$n。无畏要塞是按照能够承受比这更猛烈的攻击的标准建造的。但是我很担心致远郡的农场和矿井。\n\n在遭到袭击前，我们刚派了一队人去防守矿井——他们应该能保护那里的平民。\n\n吉拉德·格林负责管理那里的村民。沿着无畏要塞北墙的道路出去就能抵达致远郡。请你去看看他们的情况，并在需要的时候出手援助。",dEN="My lads should be able to take it from here, <name>. Valiance Keep is built to take a beating far worse than this. I worry about our farmlands and mine in Farshire, however.\n\nWe sent a full detachment to protect our mining operations right before the invasion - they should be able to defend the civilians.\n\nGerald Green's in charge of the villagers there. There's a passage out of the northern wall out of Valiance Keep; it'll take you straight to him. See what you can do to help them.",o="转至北风苔原的致远郡，与吉拉德·格林谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Farshire in Borean Tundra and speak to Gerald Green.",c="你来这里帮忙的？你真是场及时雨！",cEN="You're here to help? You're just in time then!"}
Q[11929]={d="$n，我们战败了。这里曾是我们世代生活的家园，如今却不再安全。村落中飘荡着死亡的气息……残存的只有对过去的美好回忆。\n\n我已经下令让所有的村民撤离了。幸存者必须立即离开，转至位于龙骨荒野的冰雾村。\n\n<冬风酋长指向东方。>\n\n$n，请你确保我的族人的安全。陶拉努克宗母就在村口等你。要快！天灾军团正在缩小他们的包围圈！",dEN="We are lost, <name>. This place has been our home for many generations, but it is no longer safe. There remains only death... Death and a memory of what used to be.\n\nI have called for the evacuation of Taunka'le. All remaining taunka must leave at once and make their way to our capital city, Icemist, located in the Dragonblight.\n\n<Wintergale points east.>\n\nYou must help get my people to safety, <name>. Mother Tauranook awaits you at the village gates. Hurry! The Scourge closes in from all sides!",o="与牦牛村外的陶拉努克宗母谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Mother Tauranook outside the gates of Taunka'le Village.",c="<陶拉努克宗母拭去她的眼泪。>\n\n以前，我可以漫步横越整座冻土荒原，视线所及尽是白雪。\n\n但是雪景离开了我们——这意味着我们在此的时光已经到了尽头。我们带着快乐的回忆，抛下牦牛村，以及北风苔原……\n\n<陶拉努克宗母呜咽着。>\n\n也许，未来会欢迎我们——以及雪景——一道回来这里。",cEN="<Mother Tauranook wipes her tears away.>\n\nThere was once a time when I could walk across this tundra and the snow would fill my view for as far as I could see.\n\nBut the snow has left us - signaling that our time here has come to an end. We leave behind Taunka'le Village and the Borean Tundra with many happy memories...\n\n<Mother Tauranook whimpers.>\n\nPerhaps the future will welcome our return - along with the snow."}
Q[11930]={d="想要转至龙骨荒野，唯一的办法是穿过横贯冰原。这片广袤的苔原危机四伏，你最好小心提防天灾军团，以及那些被天灾污染了的野生动物。甚至有传言说死去的牦牛人从墓穴中爬出来，攻击转至龙骨荒野的车队！你一定要保护好你的车队和难民！\n\n沃图克在通往龙骨荒野的桥梁那头等着你。",dEN="The path across Transborea, to the east, is the only way to reach the Dragonblight. Many perils await you as you make your journey across the tundra. Beware the Scourge and its influence upon the beasts of the land. Rumors have started to spread about our very own taunka brothers and sisters rising from the dead and attacking caravans on their way to the Dragonblight! Defend your caravan and get the evacuees to safety!\n\nWartook Iceborn waits for you across the bridge leading into the Dragonblight.",o="护送坦卡雷村的撤离者穿过横贯冰原，前往龙骨荒野边境上的瓦图克·冰裔那里。|n",oEN="Escort the Taunka'le Evacuees across Transborea to Wartook Iceborn on the border of the Dragonblight.",c="<沃图克严肃地看着你。>\n\n不再有冰雾村这个地方了……",cEN="<Wartook looks upon you grimly.>\n\nIcemist is no more..."}
Q[11931]={d="我感觉到这里的龙与我们有着明显的不同，但我依然无法破解它们身体上的符文。\n\n如果没有资料的话，我就需要花上更多的时间来破译它们，可我们没有那么多时间了。\n\n一个名叫卡勒拉斯的肯瑞托叛徒就在附近，他手里可能有我需要的文献，他的手下还有我进行破译工作所需的符文。\n\n快去吧，凡人。玛里苟斯正在变得越来越强大。",dEN="I sense a distinct peculiarity in the drakes here but the meaning of the runes that cover their bodies still eludes me.\n\nWithout a codex, it will take more time than we can afford for me to interpret them.\n\nNot far from here is a Kirin Tor traitor, Caleras, who is likely to have a copy of the tome I require. His underlings hold the runes I will need for my translation.\n\nHurry, mortal. Malygos gains strength with every passing moment.",o="永生之盾的莱洛拉斯要你从审讯者卡勒拉斯那里取得碧蓝书典，并从他手下的考达拉缚法者那里收集3枚闪烁的符文。",oEN="Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield wants you to get the Azure Codex from Inquisitor Caleras and collect 3 Shimmering Runes from his Coldarra Spellbinders.",p="动作快点，凡人。\n\n随着时间一分一秒过去，玛里苟斯的力量就愈加强大。",pEN="Hurry, mortal.\n\nMalygos gains strength with every passing moment.",c="你做得很好，<race>。\n\n但愿我们能找到可以用来对付玛里苟斯的线索。",cEN="You have done well, <race>.\n\nLet us hope for a clue that we can use against Malygos."}
Q[11932]={d="听着，$n。不是我说话不客气，但他们让萨萨里安负责执行的那个狗屁任务就是彻头彻尾的自杀。\n\n我们组了一支小分队去攻击那片地区内某个天灾军团的高等生物。疯了，全疯了，这派十几个人去攻击一座蛛魔城市外围的通灵塔……是人干出来的事吗？！所以，老子开溜了！\n\n什么，你还是去想找萨萨里安，好吧，我们本来是计划在东北边的卡斯卡拉跟一个叫阿泰卡的海象人接头，然后让他带我们向东去的。你去找他吧，祝你们好运，蠢货们。",dEN="Listen, <name>. No offense, but the operation they put Thassarian in charge of was pure suicide.\n\nA handful of our men were to launch an attack on the biggest Scourge presence in the area. Call me crazy, but storming a Scourge ziggurat outside a plagued Nerubian city with a dozen men ain't my idea of fun.\n\nIf you're still interested in finding Thassarian, we were supposed to arrange for passage east with a tuskarr by the name of Ataika in Kaskala to the northeast. Good luck with your fool's errand.",o="转至无畏要塞东北边的卡斯卡拉，与阿泰卡谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ataika in Kaskala, northeast of Valiance Keep.",c="我记得你说的那个人。他带着卡库特的印记。\n\n愿卡库特保护我们的逝者。",cEN="I remember the man you speak of. He bore the marks of Karkut.\n\nMay Karkut protect our fallen."}
Q[11933]={d="从埃索达偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是节日诗人或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from the heart of the Exodar itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...",o="将埃索达烈焰交给节日诗人。",oEN="Return the Flame of the Exodar to the Festival Talespinner.",p="你简直在发光啊，<race>。你手里那是什么？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="火焰看来很陌生……但，你说这是从埃索达来的？太惊人了！你竟然能进入那艘船中……当然，我会支付报酬的。如果你找到任何类似的东西，别忘了来找我谈谈。",cEN="This fire seems new... Yet, you say it came from the Exodar? Fascinating! To make your way into that ship... Of course, I'll pay you for this. If you find anything else like this, be sure to speak with me again."}
Q[11935]={d="从银月城偷来的烈焰令你感到异常的温暖。你对这种罕见的力量一无所知，但是博学者或许知道些什么……",dEN="This flame, stolen from Silvermoon, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...",o="将银月城烈焰交给节日博学者。",oEN="Return the Flame of Silvermoon to the Festival Loremaster.",p="你简直在发光啊，<race>。你手里那是什么？",pEN="You're practically glowing, <race>. What do you have there?",c="多荣耀的火焰！你说，你从银月城拿到这个的？太不可置信了！有了四座城市的火焰，谁知道我们能达成什么？",cEN="What a glorious fire! You received this from Silvermoon, you say? Unbelievable! With the flames of all four cities, who knows what we could accomplish?"}
Q[11936]={d="我们来这里的目的很简单：在不让玛里苟斯发现的前提下观察他的后裔，并尽可能阻挠他的行动。为了完成这个目标，我现在要交给你一项任务。\n\n蓝龙把他们的卵都藏在魔枢的底部。长期接受大量奥术能量的辐射显然会加快这些卵的孵化速度，而且会对幼龙的成长产生不可预见的影响。\n\n我没兴趣去研究这种影响。你现在就去杀掉一些龙人，用它们冰冷的斧头砸掉那些卵。",dEN="Our goals here are simple. We are to remain hidden from Malygos, observe his brood, and thwart his efforts wherever possible. To that end, I have a task for you.\n\nThe blues are laying their eggs at the base of the Nexus. Exposure to so much arcane energy will surely make them hatch sooner, and there's no telling what effect it will have on their spawn.\n\nI don't intend to find out. Slay the local wyrmkin and use their frozen axes to break the eggs.",o="永生之盾的莱洛拉斯要你杀死考达拉龙人，并用它们的冰霜战斧打碎5枚蓝龙卵。",oEN="Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield wants you to kill Coldarra Wyrmkin and use their frozen axes to break 5 blue dragon eggs.",p="你摧毁蓝龙的卵了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you destroyed the blues' eggs, <class>?",c="不管是不是敌人，摧毁龙蛋都令我很痛苦。\n\n希望这样的牺牲是有意义的……",cEN="It pains me to order the destruction of dragon eggs, enemy or no.\n\nMay the ends of this war justify the means...."}
Q[11938]={d="好了，现在有了护命匣，我应该可以得到我想知道的一切了。不过，圣城那边的天灾军团不可能对此一无所知，他们很快就会反应过来的。\n\n我们绝对无法抵御他们的全力攻击。或许我可以……算了，就当我没说。\n\n我希望你能到那边去，骚扰他们一下，给他们造成一些损失。希望这样可以耽搁他们足够久的时间，让这两个家伙把肠肠肚肚都给我吐出来……当然，这只是个比喻的说法。带上鲁瑞德，他肯定能助你一臂之力。",dEN="Now that we have this phylactery, I shouldn't have any problems getting the information I need. It won't take long for the Scourge in the Temple City to notice something's up, however.\n\nI won't be able to fend off a full scale attack here. Or maybe I would... but I'd rather not find out.\n\nI want you to head down there and inflict some casualties. Hopefully they'll be distracted long enough for these two to spill their guts... figuratively, of course. Take Lurid with you, he might be of aid.",o="悲叹通灵塔里的萨萨里安要求你杀进圣城恩其拉，消灭20名天灾军团士兵。如果你需要帮助，就使用鲁瑞德的骨头。",oEN="Thassarian at the Wailing Ziggurat in Borean Tundra wants you to inflict 20 casualties against the Scourge inside the Temple City of En'kilah. Use Lurid's Bones if you need assistance.",p="完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="这应该可以为我们争取一些时间。伊斯多鲁斯很合作，但我真的需要和这个巫妖单独相处一下。",cEN="That should buy us some time. Isidorus has been cooperative, but I really needed that alone time with the lich."}
Q[11940]={d="为了研究它们身上的符文，我需要更多的雏龙。\n\n你可以在山谷的西北边界找到它们……\n\n<莱洛拉斯用一支长矛刺破了手指，矛尖沾上了他的血。>\n\n使用这只长矛去驯服一只龙。在它虚弱的时候制服它，并在法力消失前把它给我带回来。",dEN="I need more drake hatchlings to continue researching the runes covering their bodies.\n\nThey can be found around the northwest edge of the valley....\n\n<Raelorasz pokes his hand with a spear and coats the tip with his blood.>\n\nTake this and use it on one of them. Wait for it to become subdued, then bring it here to me before it expires.",o="莱洛拉斯要你使用他的长矛驯服一只魔枢雏龙，并把它带回永生之盾交给他。",oEN="Raelorasz wants you to use the Blood-tipped Spear to subdue a Nexus Drake Hatchling and return it to him at the Transitus Shield.",p="你为我的研究找到雏龙了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered a drake hatchling for my studies?",c="这些幼龙的下场不必让你良心不安，<race>。这全是玛里苟斯一人的责任。\n\n我在不眠不休地破解这些符文之谜。\n\n请放心，若非必要，我们不会再夺走任何生命。",cEN="The fate of these young drakes need not burden your conscience, <race>. Malygos alone is accountable for this.\n\nI am working ceaselessly to discover the secrets of these runes.\n\nRest assured, we shall take no more lives than we must."}
Q[11941]={d="这块金属碎片的某些特性吸引了你，使你没有随手把它仍掉。\n\n莱洛拉斯也许能发现它的作用。",dEN="Something about this scrap of metal prevents you from casting it aside.\n\nPerhaps Raelorasz might be able to shed some light on its purpose.",o="把闪耀的碎片交给永生之盾的莱洛拉斯。",oEN="Bring the Scintillating Fragment to Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield.",p="你发现了什么，<class>？",pEN="What have you found, <class>?",c="你把这东西带给我，真是明智，<name>。\n\n<莱洛拉斯端详着碎片，缓缓点头。>\n\n如果你真的愿意不计风险为我们的行动出力，我就把它的含义告诉你。",cEN="It was wise of you to bring this to me, <name>.\n\n<Raelorasz eyes the fragment and slowly nods.>\n\nIf you truly desire to contribute to our efforts, no matter the risk, I shall share with you its meaning."}
Q[11942]={d="那只巫妖终于肯张嘴了，$n。恩其拉的高阶祭司们掌握着如何进入纳克萨纳尔的秘密。\n\n立刻转至鲜血尖塔、痛苦尖塔，和凋零尖塔，进去以后杀死里面的祭司。\n\n拿到他们身上的三张卷轴之后马上回来。",dEN="The lich has spoken, <name>. The high priests of En'kilah hold the secret to entering Naxxanar.\n\nGo to the Spire of Blood, the Spire of Pain and the Spire of Decay and slay each of the priests.\n\nReturn once you've obtained the three scrolls.",o="悲叹通灵塔里的萨萨里安要求你转至圣城恩其拉，在痛苦尖塔中夺取高阶祭司塔雷坎的卷轴，在凋零尖塔中夺取高阶祭司纳菲塞特的卷轴，在鲜血尖塔中夺取高阶祭司安多拉斯的卷轴。",oEN="Thassarian at the Wailing Ziggurat wants you to go to the Temple City of En'kilah and retrieve High Priest Talet-Kha's Scroll from the Spire of Pain, High Priest Naferset's Scroll from the Spire of Decay and High Priest Andorath's Scroll at the Spire of Blood.",p="慢慢来是吧？我可不知道我还能够困住这个巫妖多久。",pEN="Taking your time, are you? I don't know how much longer I can keep this lich restrained.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。现在还剩最后一点情报。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. Now for one last bit of information."}
Q[11943]={d="你发现的这块碎片是一种特殊牢笼的组成部分，$n。\n\n玛里苟斯的手下用这种牢笼关押他们俘虏的法师和其它奥术实体，但这只牢笼似乎是用来关押一种……更强大的生物。\n\n敌人的敌人很可能就是我们的朋友。你应该去搜索这只牢笼的其它碎片。\n\n它们很可能在玛里苟斯最亲信的下属手里。",dEN="You've discovered a fragment of a special prison, <name>.\n\nMalygos' minions use similar prisons to hold their captured mages and other arcane entities, but this prison was constructed to hold something... stronger.\n\nIn hopes that the enemy of our enemy will prove to be a friend, you must search for the prison's remaining fragments.\n\nThey are likely to be in the possession of Malygos' most trusted underlings.",o="永生之盾的莱洛拉斯要你从塞鲁利恩将军手里夺取牢笼外壳，从战争使者戈德拉克手里夺取能量核心。",oEN="Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield wants you to obtain the Prison Casing from General Cerulean and the Energy Core from Warbringer Goredrak.",p="你找到了牢笼的其它部分吗？",pEN="Have you discovered any other pieces to the prison?",c="<你所收集的部分在莱洛拉斯手上发出光芒。>\n\n成了。\n\n我感应到这个监牢中有个强大的存在。希望我们能找到一个盟友。",cEN="<The pieces you've collected begin to glow brightly in Raelorasz' hands.>\n\nIt is done.\n\nI sense a strong presence within this prison. Let us hope it proves to be an ally."}
Q[11944]={d="我们现在的情况很让人绝望。我们接到命令说，要凭借两只手都数得过来的兵力占领悲叹通灵塔。\n\n我们能守住这个地方跟天灾军团对峙就已经很不错了！现在，我们寡不敌众，伤痕累累，而且还找不到撤退路线。\n\n如果你能帮忙减轻一下压力，我们有就机会巩固防线了。把围在建筑周边的那些亡灵干掉一些吧，那样我们就能抵挡住他们的进攻了。",dEN="Our situation is nearly hopeless. We were ordered to take the Wailing Ziggurat with a handful of men.\n\nWe'll be lucky if we can hold this position against the Scourge. We're outnumbered, injured and have no escape route.\n\nIf you can take some of the pressure off of us, we might be able to solidify our position. Kill some of the undead circling the structure - we'll hold off their advance.",o="死亡营地的韦恩下士希望你消灭7名通灵塔防御者。",oEN="Corporal Venn at Death's Stand wants you to slay 7 Ziggurat Defenders.",p="你有任何进展吗？我们被困在这里。",pEN="Did you make any progress? We're in a bind here.",c="这应该能为我们争取一些时间，<name>。我们只能期盼瓦加德堡垒的援军了。",cEN="That should buy us some time, <name>. We'll hope against hope for reinforcements from Valiance Keep."}
Q[11945]={d="黑暗已经降临。卡库特的灵魂漫步在卡斯卡拉，召集死去的海象人的幽魂。\n\n潜伏在迷雾中的敌人杀害了我们许多的同胞。很快，卡斯卡拉就会沦为死亡一般寂静的废墟。\n\n但是，还有一线希望。部分族人开始往乌努比转移。我们竭尽全力地作战，为的是让他们安全撤离这里。\n\n他们急需食物补给，否则就会活活饿死，因为乌努比也没有足够的粮食。请你尽快替我们的族人收集到足够的食物。",dEN="Dark times are upon us. Karkut's spirit walks the earth and gathers the spirits of dead tuskarr.\n\nThe sons of the mist have taken many of our brethren. Soon dear Kaskala will be reduced to ashes.\n\nThere is hope yet. Not for us perhaps, but we've sent our families to Unu'pe. We fight here so there may be a future for them.\n\nThey will need supplies or they will starve. There's not enough food in Unu'pe. Salvage any supplies before it's too late for our families.",o="乌泰克要你在卡斯卡拉收集8份卡斯卡拉补给品。",oEN="Utaik wants you to gather 8 Kaskala Supplies in Kaskala.",p="你成功了吗，<name>？我们在乌努佩的亲人正指望你的努力。",pEN="Have you succeeded, <name>? Our relatives in Unu'pe are depending on your efforts.",c="谢谢你，<name>。这些补给能喂饱我们的表亲和孩子们。即便卡斯卡拉陷落，我们的部族也必须延续下去。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. These supplies will feed our cousins and children. Even if Kaskala falls, our tribes must carry on."}
Q[11946]={d="我……自由了？\n\n我本以为自己只能永远在那个空无一物的空间中游荡，但是现在……我得救了？你无法想象我是多么感激你，凡人。\n\n因为我拒绝臣服于玛里苟斯，他就把我关进了那只牢笼，并打碎了笼子，把碎片分布到各地。即使我的生命将是你的一百倍那么漫长，我也不会忘记你的帮助。\n\n也许以后我会想办法报答你。但现在，我们必须先对付玛里苟斯。我还很虚弱，而且我们还有很多事情要做。\n\n我需要你的帮助，$n。",dEN="I am... free?\n\nI was destined to spend an eternity roaming an empty abyss, and now am saved? You cannot fathom my gratitude, mortal.\n\nWhen I refused to bend to his will Malygos bound me to that prison, then shattered it and scattered the pieces. Should I live one hundred of your lifetimes, I shall not forget this kindness.\n\nPerhaps, in time, I will find ways to repay you. For now, though, we must focus our attention on Malygos. I am weak, and there is much to be done.\n\nI need your help, <name>.",o="克莉斯塔萨希望你在$g准备好:准备好;与玛里苟斯对抗时去跟她谈谈。\n\n如果你丢失了强化奥术牢笼，就去特兰斯图斯护盾找莱洛拉斯。",oEN="Keristrasza wants you to speak to her when you are ready to prepare for a confrontation with Malygos.\n\nIf you lose your Augmented Arcane Prison, speak to Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield.",c="我们不能在等我恢复力量了。\n\n我得倚靠你来完成准备……",cEN="We cannot wait for me to regain my strength.\n\nI must rely on you to make our preparations...."}
Q[11947]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n暮光教徒在凄凉之地西北方的艾瑟雷索创建了营地，企图利用寒冰之石与元素交流，就跟他们在希利苏斯的做法一样。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nThere is a camp located in the shadow of Ethel Rethor within northwestern Desolace. There, they use ice stones to communicate with the elementals, as they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至凄凉之地的艾瑟雷索，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的冰雹上尉，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Hailstone Lieutenant summoned from the Ice Stone located at Ethel Rethor in Desolace, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11948]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n荆棘谷西部有一座受猎潮者耐普图隆管辖的岛屿。暮光教徒已经转至那座岛屿，企图利用寒冰之石与猎潮者所在的世界交流，就跟他们在希利苏斯的做法一样。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nNeptulon has long had a base of operations on an island in western Stranglethorn. There, the Twilight Cult has set up ice stones to communicate with the Tidehunter's realm, much like they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至荆棘谷西部那座有水元素出没的岛屿，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的寒风上尉，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Chillwind Lieutenant summoned from the Ice Stone located on the water elemental's island in western Stranglethorn Vale, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11949]={d="卡斯卡拉对我们来说是圣地，$r。我们的祖先正是由塔尤特卡本人的灵魂引领到这里的。\n\n如今这些邪恶生物毫无理由地从迷雾中袭击我们。\n\n我们要让它们知道，我们的长矛不只是用来捕鲸的。和我们并肩作战吧，$g朋友:朋友;，也许将来我的族人会回报你这份恩情。",dEN="Kaskala is a sacred place for us, <race>. Our ancestors were guided here by the spirit of Tayutka herself.\n\nNow these foul creatures attack us from the mists without any provocation.\n\nWe will show them that our spears are not merely for whaling. Fight alongside us, friend. Perhaps my people might repay you some time in the future.",o="阿泰卡要你在卡斯卡拉杀死12名克瓦迪尔劫掠者。",oEN="Ataika wants you to slay 12 Kvaldir Raiders in Kaskala.",p="我们正在拼死苦战，<name>。我们不会把这些克瓦迪尔人让出一寸土地，除非让他们付出惨重代价。",pEN="We are fighting tooth and nail, <name>. We'll not give these Kvadir an inch without making them pay for it dearly.",c="谢谢你，<name>。如果我们能活着离开这里，我将深深感念你的恩情。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. I will be deeply in your debt if we ever make it out of here alive."}
Q[11950]={d="听着，$n。像我这样的战士并不是无可替换的。如果我死了，我的兄弟们会捡起我的长矛继续战斗。\n\n但是海象人氏族必须在睿智长者的指引下才能存活。我们最敬重的萨满祭司穆希特拒绝离开中央小岛的塔尤卡祭坛。如果他被那些怪物杀害的话，氏族必将遭受惨痛的损失。\n\n你是个外族人，或许他会听听你的建议。和他讲讲道理……请求他转至乌努比的安全地带避难吧。",dEN="Listen, <name>. Warriors like me are replaceable. If I fall, my brothers and cousins will pick up my spear and fight.\n\nMy people cannot survive without wise elders. Stubborn Muahit, our most venerable shaman, refuses to leave the altar to Tayutka in the central island. We would suffer a significant loss if he was slain by these monsters.\n\nYou are an outsider, maybe he'll listen to you. Show him reason... ask him to flee to the safety of Unu'pe before it's too late.",o="在卡斯卡拉找到长者穆希特。",oEN="Find Elder Muahit in Kaskala.",c="阿泰卡让你来的，对吧？我绝对不会动摇的。\n\n我们还没有失去一切。灵魂依旧与我们同在。",cEN="Ataika sent you, didn't he? I am not to be swayed.\n\nAll is not lost. The spirits are still with us."}
Q[11951]={d="我在被囚禁期间了解到很多玛里苟斯的情况。在命运的推动下，我们终于有机会用这些情报来对抗他。\n\n在魔枢的上方盘旋着一条强大的蓝龙，莎拉苟萨。她既是玛里苟斯的护卫，也是他的配偶。如果有严重的威胁逼近，她就会警告她的主人。\n\n我在被囚禁的日子里可没少吃莎拉苟萨的苦头，现在她的末日就要来临了。但首先，我们要准备一个绝妙的诱饵……",dEN="During my captivity I was able to learn much about Malygos. Fate now allows us to use this knowledge against him.\n\nThere is a great blue dragon, Saragosa, who circles high above the Nexus. She serves both as the aspect's guardian and as his consort. If any serious threats arise, she alerts her master of the danger.\n\nI suffered greatly at the hand of Saragosa during my captivity, and now her time to die has come. First, however, we must fashion the perfect bait....",o="克莉斯塔萨要你在考达拉一带收集10块晶化法力碎片。\n\n如果你把奥术牢笼弄丢了，可以去找永生之盾的莱洛拉斯。",oEN="Keristrasza has asked you to collect 10 Crystalized Mana Shards from around Coldarra.\n\nIf you lose your Augmented Arcane Prison, speak to Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield.",p="你收集到了我要求的法力裂片吗？",pEN="Have you gathered the mana shards I require?",c="谢谢你，<name>。\n\n囚禁的后遗症让我精疲力竭，力量正在极其缓慢地恢复。\n\n我会明智地使用这些水晶的力量。它们是玛里苟斯邪恶阴谋的副产品。但愿它们能在他的覆灭中发挥作用。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nI am drained from the effects of my confinement and my strength is returning ever so slowly.\n\nI shall use the power from these crystals wisely. They are a byproduct of Malygos' malevolent schemes. With luck, they will play a part in his undoing."}
Q[11952]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n暮光教徒在灼热峡谷的观火岭创建了营地，企图利用寒冰之石与猎潮者所在的世界交流，就跟他们在希利苏斯的做法一样。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nFirewatch Ridge in Searing Gorge is an established bastion of Twilight Cult activity. Recently, they have been using ice stones in the cave to communicate with the Tidehunter's realm, much like they do in Silithus. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至灼热峡谷西北部观火岭下的洞穴，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的严寒上尉，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Frigid Lieutenant summoned from the Ice Stone located in the cave underneath Firewatch Ridge in the northwest of Searing Gorge, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11953]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n希利苏斯是暮光教徒在艾泽拉斯世界的大本营，他们在希利苏斯北部利用寒冰之石与猎潮者所在的世界交流。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nSilithus is the Azerothian base of the Twilight Cult. In the north, they have been using new ice stones to communicate with the Tidehunter's realm. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's lieutenants and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至希利苏斯北部的暮光小径，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的冰川上尉，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Glacial Lieutenant summoned from the Ice Stone located at Twilight's Run in northern Silithus, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11954]={d="我们必须采取行动，维系平衡！时间非常紧迫。\n\n暮光教徒在德拉诺世界的黑暗之门附近创建了营地，利用寒冰之石与冰霜之王交流。虽然我很不情愿这样做，但是灵魂会理解的——你必须召唤并杀死埃霍恩手下的一员军官。或许这样就能阻止暮光教徒的阴谋……",dEN="We must act to preserve the balance! Time is against us.\n\nIn order to ensure Ahune's success, the cult has established a base near the Dark Portal itself in Draenor. They use ice stones to coordinate the frost lord's arrival. Much as I am loath to do this, the spirits will understand - you must summon one of this Ahune's templar protectors and destroy it. Perhaps this forestalling action will be enough...",o="转至地狱火半岛的黑暗之门，杀死从寒冰之石中召唤出来的冰川圣殿骑士，然后返回任意主城中的大地之环长者处复命。",oEN="Slay the Glacial Templar summoned from the Ice Stone located near the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.",p="你凯旋归来了吗？",pEN="You have returned victorious?",c="你做得很好。这也许看来是很小的一步，但对大局来说却可以做为战斗的支持。收下这个和我的祝福，稍晚点来也许我会有更多事要让你去做。",cEN="You have done well. It may seem a small act, but even this can aid the fight as a whole. Take this with my blessing, and return later, as I may have more for you to do."}
Q[11955]={d="我相信你有能力帮助我们解除迫在眉睫的危机。\n\n绝不能让暮光教徒与纳迦异教徒的阴谋得逞。为了艾泽拉斯世界和所有无辜的生灵，我们必须采取行动。前方的道路已经明朗，你要立即动身转至盘牙水库深处的奴隶围栏，与我们的萨满祭司会面。去吧，抓紧时间！",dEN="I believe you are strong enough for the ultimate task set before us.\n\nWe cannot allow the plot between the Twilight Cult and the naga heretics of Neptulon to come to fruition. For the sake of Azeroth and all life upon it, we must act. Our path is clear. You must journey to the Slave Pens deep within Coilfang Reservoir and meet with our shaman there. Go, and quickly!",o="转至赞加沼泽盘牙水库的奴隶围栏，与努玛·云女谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to the Slave Pens in Coilfang Reservoir within Zangarmarsh and speak with Numa Cloudsister.",c="感谢精灵你在这里！我们必须要尽快召唤埃霍恩，免得一切太迟……",cEN="Thank the spirits you're here! We must summon Ahune quickly before it's too late..."}
Q[11956]={d="没时间说别的了，$n。我被派来执行一项自杀式的任务，要我们占领这座通灵塔。我已经完成了作为一个士兵的义务，现在，我要去寻求一些答案。\n\n这只巫妖掌握着许多我希望知道的情报，但我却无法对他造成任何伤害。\n\n这只巫妖将他的灵魂封在了一个护命匣中，藏在了其它地方。只要找不到那个护命匣，我就拿他一点办法都没有。\n\n所以，你得立刻回到营地去，骑上我的战马“黄昏”，它会带你去找到护命匣，把它带回来给我。",dEN="No time for small talk, <name>. I was sent on what was to be a suicide mission to take this ziggurat. I've accomplished my duty as a soldier, now is the time to get some answers.\n\nThis lich has knowledge I seek, yet I cannot inflict pain to his physical body to obtain that knowledge.\n\nThe lich stored his soul in a phylactery, and while it remains hidden, I won't be able to pry the information from him.\n\nReturn to the camp and take my horse, Dusk, she will lead you to the phylactery. Bring it to me.",o="转至死亡营地，骑着黄昏找到塔纳沙尔藏匿护命匣的地方。将它找出来并带回悲叹通灵塔，交给萨萨里安。",oEN="Go to Death's Stand and ride Dusk to the location of Tanathal's Phylactery. Obtain it and bring it back to Thassarian inside the Wailing Ziggurat.",p="你回来了，<name>。你拿到命匣了吗？",pEN="You're back, <name>. Did you get the phylactery?",c="来得正是时候，<name>。要制住一个巫妖可不像看上去那么容易。",cEN="Just in time, <name>. Pinning down a lich is not as easy as it looks."}
Q[11957]={d="我用你带来的法力水晶制作了这个能量聚焦器。\n\n萨拉苟萨是个贪吃鬼，她抵不住这个诱饵。里面蕴含着能大幅削弱她力量的魔法。但愿她看不穿我的计谋……\n\n$n，做好准备，等你$g准备好:准备好;面对萨拉苟萨时再来跟我谈谈。|n",dEN="Using the mana crystals you provided, I have created this Power Focus.\n\nSaragosa is a glutton. She will be unable to resist its lure. Inside it lie magics that will greatly diminish her power. Let us hope she does not see through my ruse....\n\nPrepare yourself, <name>, and speak to me again when you are ready to face Saragosa.",o="克莉斯塔萨要你使用奥术能量源引出莎拉苟萨并打败她。",oEN="Keristrasza wants you to use the Power Focus to lure Saragosa, and then defeat her.",p="绝不能让莎拉苟萨活着！",pEN="Saragosa must not be allowed to live!",c="现在没有了莎拉苟萨，这个世界又改善了一些，但我们的工作还没有结束。\n\n现在是时候对付玛里苟斯本人了！",cEN="This world is a better place now that Saragosa is no more, but our work is not yet finished.\n\nThe time has come to strike at Malygos himself!"}
Q[11958]={d="狼獾人一直是我们的天敌。不过随着你们的人大量涌入龙骨荒野，他们已经被逼到了北面的一小块林地里。\n\n今早的地震过后，他们的攻击性变得更强了。到现在，他们已经劫走了我们好几批货物……那都是我们迁徙途中的必需品。\n\n为了证实你的善意和友好，请从飘雪林地的狼獾人那里夺回我们的货物。",dEN="The wolvar have always been our natural enemies. But the incursion of your peoples into the Great Dragonblight has forced them into a small space upon the glade to the north.\n\nCombined with the land's upheaval this morning, they have become even more aggressive than ever before. They have made several raids upon our goods... things that we'll need if we are to survive the trek from our home here.\n\nAs a sign of good faith and friendship, retrieve our goods from the Snowfall Glade wolvar.",o="从狼獾人手中夺回6份被偷走的莫亚基货物，把它们带回龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口，交给长者库纳尼。",oEN="Retrieve 6 Stolen Moa'ki Goods from the wolvar. Return them to Elder Ko'nani at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="最近，自然的平衡一再的被破坏。\n\n我希望你能帮助我们度过这场生命的剧变。",pEN="The natural balance has been tipped over and over of late.\n\nI hope that you will be able to help us survive the upheaval of our way of life.",c="拜托你为我们做这种事情很让我过意不去，但为了尽快完成我们的远行，这是我们唯一能做的。虽然要去哪里，我们现在还不知道。\n\n我的巫士们告诉我，你就是要从暗影行者手中拯救这片土地的人。\n\n我同样相信，你会拯救这片土地上的人们。",cEN="I will not say that I am pleased to ask you to do such things on our behalf. It is all we can do to prepare quickly for our departure, though we know not yet where we go.\n\nMy sorcerers tell me that you are here to save the land from He Who Walks in Shadow.\n\nI trust that you will save the peoples of the land as well."}
Q[11959]={d="事情已经越来越糟了。只有一个办法了……遗憾的是，洛古恩必须死！\n\n他是落雪林地部族的首领雄性，一头凶恶的狼獾人。但这是让我们暂时摆脱他们袭击和劫掠的唯一办法。\n\n你会在林地的北面高地上、他那间破屋前找到这位\"血肉撕裂者\"。他比其他的都大，不难认。杀了他，把它的血涂在自己身上，既显示你的威权，也表达你的敬意。",dEN="Already it goes from bad to worse. There is only one course to take... regrettably, Loguhn must die!\n\nHe's the alpha male of the Snowfall Glade tribe and one mean wolvar. But it's the only way to get a short break from their attacks and stealing forays.\n\nYou will find the \"Render of Flesh\" in front of his hovel upon the northern rise of the glade. It's larger than the others and hard to miss. Kill him and smear his blood upon yourself, both to show your dominance and respect.",o="将洛根的血抹在身上，然后回到龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口，向长者库纳尼复命。",oEN="Smear the Blood of Loguhn upon yourself and then return to Elder Ko'nani at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="那是洛古恩的血，还是你自己的，<race>？",pEN="Is that Loguhn's blood or your own, <race>?",c="洛根被杀掉，正是我的族人所需要的，而我们会令其它的狼獾人争夺他的位置。\n\n这样就足够了。",cEN="Loguhn's honorable sacrifice at your hands is exactly what my people need. Now we will make the most of the wolvar in-fighting for his place.\n\nIt will have to be enough."}
Q[11960]={d="如果我们想要生存下去，就必须对狼獾人采取果断行动了。但我担心我们的狂热会导致残酷的屠杀。\n\n飘雪林地的狼獾人和我们一样拥有生存的权利。我们要确保他们能得到生存下去的机会。\n\n就算长者库纳尼现在还没有提出，迟早他也会让你去解决他们的。当你转至北面的林地时，请你把他们的幼崽带回来。",dEN="We must move decisively against the wolvar if we're to have a chance of survival. However, I worry that in our zeal, too many of them will be slain.\n\nThe Snowfall Glade wolvar have as much right to exist as do we. You and I will see to it that they get that chance.\n\nIf Elder Ko'nani hasn't asked you already, he will ask you to deal with them. While you're upon the glade to the north, I'd like you to bag up their pups and bring them back to me.",o="找到12个飘雪林地幼崽，把他们带回莫亚基港口，交给猎手莫伊。",oEN="Collect 12 Snowfall Glade Pups. Deliver them to Trapper Mau'i at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="这么短的时间内，你能救多少幼崽呢？",pEN="How many pups could you have possibly saved in so short a time?",c="好吧，我猜你救下了不少。谢谢你，<race>。\n\n现在狼獾人有机会和我们一起活下去了。前提是我们自己能活下来，我是说。\n\n你觉得明天能再来一趟吗？这样我们就能救下更多幼崽。",cEN="Well, I guess you saved plenty of them. Thank you, <race>.\n\nNow the wolvar will have a chance of surviving along with us. If we survive at all, that is.\n\nDo you think that you could return tomorrow so that we can save more of the pups?"}
Q[11961]={d="拥有强大力量的灵魂守护着海象人的氏族，卡斯卡拉是不会沦陷的。\n\n伊斯利鲁克赐予我们勇气，塔尤卡为幸存的族人提供食物和避难所，卡库特则负责守护亡魂并确保他们不会迷失方向。\n\n眼下我们迫切需要伊斯利鲁克的指引。我本来派了我的侄子伊鲁克去取回伊斯利鲁克的图腾，但是他不幸被克瓦迪尔的长矛刺穿，倒在北边的海水中。$n，替我取回图腾。别让我的侄子就这么白白搭上一条性命。",dEN="Powerful spirits watch over my tribe -- Kaskala will not be lost.\n\nIssliruk will give us courage, Tayutka will make sure our survivors always have food and shelter and Karkut will watch over the fallen so they do not lose their way.\n\nIssliruk's guidance is the one we need the most right now. I asked my nephew, Iruk, to bring me Issliruk's totem, but the Kvaldir's spears struck him down and his body fell into the waters to the north. Bring me the totem, <name>. Don't let my nephew's death be in vain.",o="尼约德海湾的长者穆希特要你潜入水中找到伊鲁克的尸体，取回伊斯利鲁克的图腾。",oEN="Elder Muahit at Njord's Breath Bay wants you to find Iruk's corpse in the water and retrieve Issliruk's totem.",p="图腾呢，<race>。你拿到了吗？",pEN="The totem, <race>. Do you have it?",c="<name>，你能感觉到伊希鲁克的存在吗？他不愿自己的孩子死于雾行者之手。",cEN="Can you feel Issliruk's presence, <name>? He does not want his children to perish at the hand of the mist-walkers."}
Q[11962]={d="那么，有了你带回来的矿石，我们总算能凑齐足够的物资送往无畏要塞了。\n\n如果致远郡从艾泽拉斯的版图上消失，至少人们会记住，我们是第一批站出来保卫自己土地的人，也是最后一批倒下的人。\n\n把这些矿石交给希尔达·熔石——她是我的好朋友。让她用这些矿石制造一些精良的武器，我们很快就会需要大量武器了。",dEN="That's it then. With the last of the ore you salvaged we now have enough to send to Valiance Keep.\n\nIf Farshire is wiped off the face of Azeroth, then at least let us be remembered as the first ones to defend our land and the last ones to give up.\n\nTake this ore to Hilda Stoneforge - she is a good friend of mine. Tell her to make some good weapons with this ore. We'll need plenty of them in the days to come.",o="将一箱致远郡矿石交给无畏要塞里的希尔达·熔石。",oEN="Deliver the Crate of Farshire Ore to Hilda Stoneforge in Valiance Keep.",p="你带了些什么？",pEN="What do you have there?",c="从致远郡来的矿石？日程表上没有这次运送。发生什么事了吗？",cEN="Ore from Farshire? We weren't scheduled for a shipment just yet. Is something wrong?"}
Q[11963]={d="致远郡濒临陷落，而吉拉德只想着要把矿石给我送来？我发誓，他和我们在前线战斗的所有士兵一样勇敢。\n\n既然这些平民还有抵抗的勇气，我们就不能让他们失去自己的家园。也许我们无法派出军队支持，但可以支持他们一些武器。\n\n这些武器本来是为新兵们打造的，但有了你送来的矿石，我可以另外造一批补上。去告诉吉拉德，他的武器马上送到！",dEN="Farshire is overrun and all that Gerald can think of is to get me my ore shipment? I swear that man has as much heart as any of our soldiers on the frontlines.\n\nWe cannot let the civilians lose their lands if they're willing to fight for them. We might not have the troops to spare, but we can send them weapons.\n\nThese were earmarked for new recruits, but I'll be able to cover those with the ore you've brought me. Send word to Gerald that weapons are on the way.",o="回到致远郡，向吉拉德·格林复命。",oEN="Return to Gerald Green in Farshire.",c="希尔达要给我们送武器来？这消息太好了，<name>。我正打算叫弟兄们收拾东西呢。",cEN="Hilda's sending us weapons? That's excellent news, <name>. I was about ready to tell the lads to pack things up."}
Q[11964]={d="每座联盟营地外都设有节日篝火，你知道吗？护火者就驻扎在营地外的帐篷中，确保篝火熊熊燃烧，直到火焰节结束。\n\n每个护火者身边都会有一个夏季火元素，它是火元素之魂派来的使者。\n\n你想不想去祭拜一下这些夏季火元素呢，$n？拿着这把夏季焚香，把它交给任意一个夏季火元素。只要你对这些小家伙表示出足够的敬意，它就会奖赏你。",dEN="Did you know that our festival fires burn in every land with an Alliance settlement? Flame Wardens tend to them in camps outside of each town, ensuring the bonfires are bright and the celebrations continue.\n\nWith each Flame Warden is a summer scorchling -- an emissary to the elemental spirits of fire.\n\nWould you like to honor a scorchling, <name>? Take this summer incense and bring it to any summer scorchling. Appease the little fire spirit, and it may reward you.",o="节日博学者希望你带着夏季焚香转至任意联盟营地外的篝火旁，将焚香交给该处的夏季火元素。",oEN="The Festival Loremaster wants you to take Summer Incense to a Summer Scorchling outside any Alliance settlement.",p="向你致以火热的问候，尊敬的<class>。欢迎来到这片盛夏火焰节的圣地。",pEN="A fiery salutations to you, honored <class>. Welcome to this hallowed ground of the Midsummer Fire Festival.",c="啊，这是什么？多么美妙的香气！我敢肯定它烧起来会是纯净明亮的火焰！\n\n拿着这朵花，<name>。拿着它，别来打扰我……我得照料这珍贵的燃料……",cEN="Ah, and what is this? Such a delightful aroma! I am sure it will burn with a flame pure and bright!\n\nTake this blossom, <name>. Take it, and leave me be... I must attend to this precious fuel..."}
Q[11965]={d="现在致远郡有了放手一搏的能力，$n。你做到了我们甚至不敢奢望的事。\n\n现在我们必须集合起来发动进攻。我会让我的人把武器运到镇子的议事大厅里，请你去敲响议事厅里的钟，让所有的幸存者到那里集合。\n\n现在该让天灾军团看看我们的力量了。",dEN="Farshire has a fighting chance now, <name>. That's all we could've asked for and you've made it possible.\n\nAll we need now is a rallying point. I'll have my men deliver the weapons to our town hall. Go and ring the town hall bell so any survivors know to rally there.\n\nIt's time to show the Scourge what we're made of.",o="转至致远郡的议事大厅，敲响里面的钟。",oEN="Go to the town hall building in Farshire and ring the bell inside of it.",p="你把幸存者集结起来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you rallied the survivors, <name>?",c="再次感谢你的帮助，<name>。法布里的人们会永远记得你。",cEN="Thanks once again for aiding us, <name>. The people of Farshire will always remember you."}
Q[11966]={d="每座部落营地外都设有节日篝火，你知道吗？护焰者就驻扎在营地外的帐篷中，确保篝火熊熊燃烧，直到火焰节结束。\n\n每个护焰者身边都会有一个夏季火元素，它是火元素之魂派来的使者。\n\n你想不想去祭拜一下这些夏季火元素呢，$n？拿着这把夏季焚香，把它交给任意一个夏季火元素。只要你对这些小家伙表示出足够的敬意，它就会奖赏你。",dEN="Did you know that our festival fires burn in every land with a Horde settlement? Flame Keepers tend to them in camps outside of each town, ensuring the bonfires are bright and the celebrations continue.\n\nWith each Flame Keeper is a festival scorchling -- an emissary to the elemental spirits of fire.\n\nWould you like to honor a scorchling, <name>? Take this summer incense and bring it to any festival scorchling. Appease the little fire spirit, and it may reward you.",o="节日诗人希望你带着夏季焚香转至任意部落营地外的篝火旁，将焚香交给该处的夏季火元素。",oEN="The Festival Talespinner wants you to take Summer Incense to a Festival Scorchling outside any Horde settlement.",p="向你致以火热的问候，尊敬的<class>。欢迎来到这片盛夏火焰节的圣地。",pEN="A fiery salutations to you, honored <class>. Welcome to this hallowed ground of the Midsummer Fire Festival.",c="啊，这是什么？多么美妙的香气！我敢肯定它烧起来会是纯净明亮的火焰！\n\n拿着这朵花，<name>。拿着它，别来打扰我……我得照料这珍贵的燃料……",cEN="Ah, and what is this? Such a delightful aroma! I am sure it will burn with a flame pure and bright!\n\nTake this blossom, <name>. Take it, and leave me be... I must attend to this precious fuel..."}
Q[11967]={d="玛里苟斯肯定已经发现情况有些不对劲了。\n\n我了解他。他的精神很难集中。我敢肯定，如果他知道他那亲爱的莎拉苟萨出了什么事，肯定会不顾危险地从他的领地里冲出来。\n\n立刻带我去见莱洛拉斯，$n。他必须调集所有的龙来对抗玛里苟斯。",dEN="Malygos is certainly aware that something is amiss.\n\nI know him. His focus is fragmented. I am confident that I can lure him from the safety of his realm when he learns what has become of his precious Saragosa.\n\nTake me to Raelorasz at once, <name>. He must rouse every dragon he commands to face Malygos.",o="克莉斯塔萨要你带她去永生之盾会见莱洛拉斯。",oEN="Keristrasza has asked you to bring her to Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield.",p="你有消息要告诉我吗，<name>？",pEN="You have news for me, <name>?",c="我已经知道了克莉斯塔萨获救的消息。你很令人赞赏。\n\n我需要尽快和她谈谈。",cEN="Word of Keristrasza's rescue has reached my ears. You are to be commended.\n\nI am eager to speak with her again."}
Q[11968]={d="$n，神灵们听到了我们发出的呼喊，卡斯卡拉的局势也许会有所转机。\n\n趁着浓雾潜入尼约德海湾，除掉克瓦迪尔部族的首领。只要他一死，我们就能稳占上风。",dEN="The spirits have heard our cry for help, <name>. It's a sign that Kaskala might yet be saved.\n\nTake advantage of the confusion the weather has created and slay the Kvaldir leader. Your actions will sway the battle in our favor, I am sure of it.",o="长者穆希特要你去除掉尼约德海湾的可怕的赫迦尔。",oEN="Elder Muahit wants you to kill Heigarr the Horrible in Njord's Breath Bay.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="你帮了我们大忙，<race>。战斗尚未结束，但我的族人现在有了一线希望。",cEN="You've done us a great favor, <race>. The fight is not yet won, but my people now have a chance."}
Q[11969]={d="多亏了你的帮助，我们才能得到这个机会，$n。\n\n所以应该由你来发动对玛里苟斯的攻势。\n\n转至魔枢的西北入口处，用这种火花点燃那里的信号火焰。克莉斯塔萨会与你并肩作战的。",dEN="We owe this opportunity in great part to your efforts, <name>.\n\nIt is only fitting that you initiate the attack on Malygos.\n\nTake this spark and use it to light the signal fire northwest of the Nexus. Keristrasza will direct you from there.",o="莱洛拉斯要你在考达拉的信号火焰处使用莱洛拉斯的火花。",oEN="Raelorasz wants you to use Raelorasz' Spark at the signal fire in Coldarra.",p="你见到了克莉斯塔萨？",pEN="Did you meet with Keristrasza?",c="我们对玛里苟斯做出了一次打击，但代价很高昂。",cEN="We have dealt a blow to Malygos, but it has come at a high price."}
Q[11970]={d="火焰节是欢笑玩乐的时节，这固然没错，但是了解火焰节的历史也非常重要。对知识的渴求应该得到满足。\n\n联盟主城的节日博学者可以解答你的疑问。去拜访他吧。",dEN="The festival is a time for fun and laughter, there's no mistake. It's important, however, that you understand the origins of this holiday. Education should be sought out and savored.\n\nThe Festival Loremaster in the Alliance capitals can guide your way. Go now and learn.",o="与任意联盟主城的节日博学者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Festival Loremaster in any Alliance capital.",c="我很乐意告诉你我所知道的。",cEN="I'll be happy to tell you what I know."}
Q[11971]={d="火焰节是欢笑玩乐的时节，这固然没错，但是了解火焰节的历史也非常重要。对知识的渴求应该得到满足。\n\n部落主城的节日诗人可以解答你的疑问。去拜访他吧。",dEN="The festival is a time for fun and laughter, there's no mistake. It's important, however, that you understand the origins of this holiday. Education should be sought out and savored.\n\nThe Festival Talespinner in the Horde capitals can guide your way. Go now and learn.",o="与任意部落主城的节日诗人谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Festival Talespinner in any Horde capital.",c="我很乐意告诉你我所知道的。",cEN="I'll be happy to tell you what I know."}
Q[11972]={d="碎片跳动着，透露出不祥的征兆。难道其中蕴含着冰霜领主的精华？",dEN="These shards pulse with foreboding. Do they hold the last essence of the Frost Lord?",o="将寒冰碎片交给鲁玛·天母。",oEN="Bring the Ice Shards to Luma Skymother.",p="你好，<name>。你看上去忧心忡忡，但你该高兴才对。霜王已经被击败了！",pEN="Greetings, <name>. You look worried, but you shoud rejoice. The Frost Lord is defeated!",c="是的，这些碎片里残留着霜王在这片土地上的最后一点精华。我们会处理掉它们，把阿胡恩放逐到寒冷的深渊中去。\n\n谢谢你，<name>。你的名字将在大地之环的颂歌中回响，永无止境。请接受这件遗物，它是你与温暖和光明血脉相连的象征。",cEN="Yes, these shards hold the final essence of the Frost Lord in this land. We will dispose of them and banish Ahune to the nether regions of cold.\n\nThank you, <name>. Your name will echo in the chants of the Earthen Ring for days without end. Please honor us by accepting this vestige, a symbol of your kinship with warmth and light."}
Q[11973]={d="玛里苟斯抓走克莉斯塔萨，要她做他的配偶！\n\n我们不能让这种事发生。\n\n$R，你必须尽一切所能，阻止她遭受那样的命运。",dEN="Malygos has taken Keristrasza to serve as his consort!? Unthinkable!\n\nShe'll never cooperate willingly, but Malygos is a powerful aspect, and will eventually bend her will.\n\nThis cannot come to pass, <name>. I refuse to allow her to suffer this indignity.\n\nYou must enter the Nexus and do whatever is required to spare her this fate.",o="永生之盾的莱洛拉斯要你进入魔枢并释放克莉斯塔萨。",oEN="Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield wants you to enter the Nexus and release Keristrasza.",p="你找到了克莉斯塔萨吗？你有办法从控制她的束缚中解放她吗？",pEN="Have you located Keristrasza? Were you able to free her from her bonds?",c="那么，事情已经结束了……\n\n我们的族人永远不会忘记克莉斯塔萨为这个事业所做的牺牲。我们也不会忘记你所起的作用，<name>。\n\n愿这桩悲剧进一步坚定我们面对威胁的决心。\n\n谨代表红龙军团，请接受这份礼物，作为我们感激的象征。",cEN="So, it is done then....\n\nOur kind shall never forget the sacrifice Keristrasza has made for this cause. Nor shall we forget the part you have played, <name>.\n\nMay this tragic event serve to further steel our resolve against the threat we face.\n\nOn behalf of the Red Dragonflight, please accept this gift as a token of our gratitude."}
Q[11975]={d="也许我已经问过你了，但你在我这个年纪时，就知道自己长大后想当$g什么:什么;了吗？想当$c？\n\n我不确定自己想做什么。也许是个法师，或者术士，又或者像之前说的那样，当个血骑士……又或者……当个摇滚明星！就像精英牛头人酋长乐队里那个血精灵西格·尼希尔斯！\n\n我听说他们不巡演的时候就待在银月城！就坐在长者步道的一处阳台上，等人停下来跟他们说话。\n\n带我去那儿吧，求你了！！",dEN="Maybe I already asked you this, but when you were my age did you know that you wanted to be a <class> when you grew up?\n\nI'm not sure what I want to be. Maybe a mage or a warlock or a Blood Knight, like I said before? Or maybe... A rock star!! Like Sig Nicious, the blood elf, in the Elite Tauren Chieftain!\n\nI heard that when they aren't touring, they hang out in Silvermoon City! They just sit on a balcony in the Walk of Elders waiting for people to stop by.\n\nPlease take me there. Please!",o="带上孤儿萨兰蒂亚，转至银月城的长者步道拜访牛头人酋长乐队。如果你抵达时发现她不在身边，记得要先召唤她。",oEN="Take your orphan, Salandria, to see the Elite Tauren Chieftain in Silvermoon City's Walk of Elders. Make sure to call for her if she is not present when you arrive.",c="你看到了吗？他们为我欢呼！\n\n我现在知道他们不在舞台上唱歌的感觉了！我感觉到力量与能量！\n\n就像是他们歌曲中说的！\n\n我已经下定决心了，我长大要当个摇滚巨星！",cEN="Did you see that? They were cheering for me!!\n\nNow I know how they feel when they are up on stage singing! I felt the power and the energy!\n\nJust like they say in their song!\n\nMy mind is made up, I am going to be a rock star when I grow up!"}
Q[11977]={d="<沃图克指了指东北方。>\n\n你要知道，她很善良，待人宽厚。若不是她来到这里的缘故，我们这些活下来的难民早就失去继续活下去的希望了。尽管从血缘上讲，她不是一位真正的牦牛人，但我们部族将永远像对待我们的长老一样尊敬她，聆听她的指引。\n\n既然你与她同样来自所谓的部落，就赶紧进营地去见见她吧。她等你很久了。",dEN="<Wartook points northeast.>\n\nShe is quite kind, you know. If it were not for your emissary, the surviving refugees may have given up hope. While she may not be taunka by birthright, the tribe has taken to her as a village elder for the time being.\n\nIf you are who I think you are, please go and pay Emissary Brighthoof a visit inside the refugee camp. She has been waiting for you.",o="在西风避难营内找到特使艾米萨·闪蹄。",oEN="Seek out Emissary Brighthoof at the Westwind Refugee Camp.",c="你在这里看到的，就是北风苔原和龙骨荒野的坦卡族仅剩的一切。他们是一个破碎的民族……被天灾军团摧残得体无完肤，濒临灭绝。\n\n<明蹄摇了摇头。>\n\n现在只有部落能拯救他们。只有部落能修补他们破碎的灵魂。我们会照料他们，直到他们完全康复，而他们也会反过来壮大部落在诺森德的力量。<Brighthoof sacude la cabeza>",cEN="What you see here is all that remains of the taunka from the Borean Tundra and the Dragonblight. They are a broken people... battered and brought to the brink of extinction by the Scourge.\n\n<Brighthoof shakes her head.>\n\nOnly the Horde can save them now. Only the Horde can mend their broken spirits. We will nurse them back to full health and they will in turn strengthen the Horde in Northrend."}
Q[11978]={d="在正式将牦牛人引入部落之前，我们得先把附近森林里那些阿努巴尔蛛魔夺走的东西抢回来。昨天深夜里，阿格玛之锤过来的一支补给车队遭到了天灾军团的伏击，武器装备都被抢走了。\n\n去吧，进入西风避难营东边的森林，夺回我们的武器装备，$r。",dEN="Before we can officially bring these taunka into the Horde we must recover our armaments from the Anub'ar Nerubians that infest the nearby woods. The armaments were lost when a caravan from Agmar's Hammer was ambushed by the Scourge late last night.\n\nVenture out into the woods to the east of Westwind Refugee Camp and recover those armaments, <race>.",o="龙骨荒野西风避难营的特使艾米萨·闪蹄要求你找回10套部落军备。",oEN="Emissary Brighthoof at the Westwind Refugee Camp in the Dragonblight wants you to recover 10 Horde Armaments.",p="没有武器和盔甲我们的新成员在迁往阿格玛之锤的路上将毫无防御之力。",pEN="Without armor and weapons our newest members will be defenseless in their trek to Agmar's Hammer.",c="这正是我们需要的，<name>！挥舞部落的武器能振奋他们的精神，也能给予他们对抗天灾军团所需的庇护。\n\n你准备好参加入盟仪式了吗？\n\n<明蹄点了点头。>\n\n将由你来接纳我们的新盟友加入部落。",cEN="This is exactly what we need, <name>! Brandishing Horde arms will lift their spirits and give them the protection they need against the Scourge.\n\nAre you prepared for the ceremony of initiation?\n\n<Brighthoof nods.>\n\nYou will be the one to admit our new allies into the Horde."}
Q[11979]={d="牦牛人部族的首都冰雾村当前已经被天灾军团占领并控制了！所有躲过那次大屠杀、得以幸运逃出的牦牛人难民都在部落的保护之下，在龙骨荒野西部边界上的西风避难营避难。\n\n地狱咆哮大人坚信，这些牦牛人为了生存下去，一定会选择加入部落，他已经派出一名特使到西风避难营去巩固我们与牦牛人之间的关系了。立刻转至西风避难营，找到特使艾米萨·闪蹄。看看你能帮上她什么忙。",dEN="The Scourge have seized control of the capital city of the taunka, Icemist Village! All living taunka that escaped the massacre are being held in protective custody at the Westwind Refugee Camp on the western border of Dragonblight.\n\nLord Hellscream believes that the taunka must join the Horde if they are to survive and has sent a tauren emissary to Westwind to bolster our relationship with the winter tauren. Travel to Westwind Refugee Camp and seek out Emissary Brighthoof. You will assist her.",o="去西风难民营地寻找使者明蹄。|n",oEN="Seek out Emissary Brighthoof at the Westwind Refugee Camp.",c="你在这里看见的就是北风苔原和龙骨荒野所有幸存的牦牛人。他们是一群严重受创的民族……受尽苦难，被逼到灭绝的边缘。\n\n<闪蹄摇了摇头。>\n\n只剩部落可以拯救他们了。只有部落能够修补他们破碎的心灵。我们要尽力帮助他们恢复，而他们也将会强化我们部落在诺森德的力量。",cEN="What you see here is all that remains of the taunka from the Borean Tundra and the Dragonblight. They are a broken people... battered and brought to the brink of extinction.\n\n<Brighthoof shakes her head.>\n\nOnly the Horde can save them now. Only the Horde can mend their broken spirits. We will nurse them back to full health and they will in turn strengthen the Horde in Northrend."}
Q[11980]={d="我们的运输车队原本是要把大批武器装备运到这处营地来，而我是负责护送运输车队的卫兵之一。谁知道天灾军团毫无征兆地发动了一次闪电般的突袭。我们全力奋战，杀死了无数蛛魔，可最终还是被它们的数量完全压制。全队的卫兵，似乎只有我和托尔辛活了下来……\n\n若不是因为伤势太重，我们肯定会满森林地寻找那些该死的蛛魔，拼了命也要杀光它们。但现在……唉……你能帮我们夺回失去的荣耀吗？搜索这片森林的东部，找出所有的阿努巴尔蛛魔，灭绝它们！为了部落！",dEN="I was one of the guards chosen to escort the caravan carrying the armament shipment to this camp. The attack came fast and without warning. We fought and killed dozens of the beasts, but in the end there were simply too many. Tor'zin and I barely made it out alive...\n\nIf not for our injuries we would be out in the woods hunting down those fiends ourselves. Will you help us regain our lost pride? Search the woods east of here for Anub'ar Nerubians and kill them! For the Horde!",o="龙骨荒野西风难民营地的血卫士罗基尔要你杀死15名阿努巴尔伏击者。|n",oEN="Blood Guard Roh'kill at the Westwind Refugee Camp in the Dragonblight wants you to slay 15 Anub'ar Ambushers.",p="不要留情，<race>。杀光阿努巴尔！",pEN="Show no mercy, <race>. Slay the Anub'ar!",c="<罗基尔向你敬礼。>\n\n你维护了我们的荣誉，<name>。托尔金和我都感谢你这无私之举！",cEN="<Roh'kill salutes you.>\n\nYou have preserved our honor, <name>. Tor'zin and I both thank you for this selfless act!"}
Q[11981]={d="这名土灵战士的石质表面布满裂纹与凿痕。尽管他不会流血，你仍能感觉到他已奄奄一息。\n\n一个低沉沙哑的声音从垂死战士的口中逸出。\n\n\"找到……库伦……你必须找到……库伦。\"\n\n当你询问库伦究竟是谁、是什么时，他无助地望着你。\n\n\"我们的……领袖……他站在……俯瞰索尔莫丹的山丘上……指挥着我们。求你……告诉他……我们攻不下……那座城……\"",dEN="The Earthen warrior's stone surface is covered with cracks and gouges. Although it is incapable of bleeding, you can sense that the warrior is near death.\n\nA low, hoarse voice escapes from the dying warrior's mouth.\n\n\"Find... Kurun... you must find... Kurun.\"\n\nIt looks at you helplessly as you ask for any clues as to who or what Kurun might be.\n\n\"Our... leader... he stands on the... hill overlooking Thor Modan... commands us. Please... tell him... we cannot take... the city... \"",o="转至俯瞰索尔莫丹的丘陵地带，在那里找到库伦。",oEN="Speak with Kurun on the hill overlooking Thor Modan.",c="<你告诉了库伦死去土灵所要传达的消息。>\n\n他们勇敢地作战，但他是对的。我们无法在没有帮助的情况下打败索尔莫丹的铁矮人。我的巨人和土灵一直以来都在和铁矮人的邪恶对抗，但我们的力量却不足以赢得索尔莫丹的战斗。你愿意帮助我们吗？",cEN="<You tell Kurun about the message given to you by the fallen Earthen.>\n\nThey fight bravely, but he is right. We will not overcome the iron dwarves of Thor Modan without help. My giants and the Earthen have long struggled against iron's evil, but our forces are not numerous enough to win the battle for Thor Modan. Will you aid us?"}
Q[11982]={d="我们下方就是铁矮人自古以来的领地——索尔莫丹。几千年前，石巨人踏裂了大地，将那座地底城市的一部分永远掩埋在了坍塌的山石之下，另一部分则暴露出了地表，几近毁灭。\n\n然而，直到今天，那些铁矮人仍在试图夺回他们过去的王城，但我们绝不会允许。我手下的巨人们每天都在用巨岩与碎石填补着他们挖出来的沟壑，希望能阻止他们的进犯，让他们永远放弃这里。你也带上一些巨石到东北方的沟壑边去，帮助我们彻底毁灭敌人的顽抗吧。",dEN="Beneath us is iron's ancient bastion, Thor Modan. Thousands of years ago, the stone giants tore the land asunder, collapsing part of the city and exposing much of the rest.\n\nEven now, the iron dwarves attempt to reclaim their old capital, but we will not permit it. My giants fill the trench with boulders and debris, hoping to seal it off and kill the servants of iron as they work. Take up the boulders you see near the trench to the northeast, and help us put an end to their efforts.",o="在丘陵上俯瞰索尔莫丹的库伦要求你向索尔莫丹的露天区域投掷石块，以此骚扰铁矮人的挖掘工作。",oEN="Kurun on the hill overlooking Thor Modan wants you to disrupt the iron dwarves' work by throwing boulders into the exposed area of Thor Modan.",p="你想要什么回报？",pEN="What have you to report?",c="我们持续地填塞裂沟，铁矮人则是拼命地清理。我们从上方的袭击无法攻下整座城市，你必须要协助下面广场里的土灵。",cEN="As quickly as we're able to fill the trench, the iron dwarves keep clearing it. Our assault from above will not take the city alone. You must aid the earthen fighting in the plaza below."}
Q[11983]={d="他们已经准备好了，$n。这些牦牛人迫切地希望加入部落，并愿意倾尽全力向亡灵天灾复仇。\n\n<特使掏出了一封印有部落徽记的羊皮卷，郑重地递给了你。>\n\n这封卷轴上写着部落的血誓。根据我们古老而高贵的传统，牦牛人兄弟姐妹们将跟随着一位引导人念出卷轴上面所载的神圣誓言，从而完成加入部落的仪式。\n\n去吧，将这个卷轴交给他们，让牦牛人们宣誓加入部落，指挥官。完成你在仪式中的职责之后，再回来找我。",dEN="They are ready, <name>. These taunka will all willingly join the Horde and give all that they have to see the Scourge driven from this world.\n\n<Brighthoof hands you a scroll bearing the insignia of the Horde.>\n\nWithin this scroll you will find the blood oath of the Horde. Tradition dictates that our new taunka brothers and sisters utter the sacred words herein.\n\nTake the scroll and swear the taunka into the Horde, commander. Return the scroll to me when you have completed your duty.",o="与西风避难营的牛头人交谈，并收集5份他们对部落的效忠宣誓书。\n\n完成任务之后，带着部落的血誓向特使艾米萨·闪蹄复命。",oEN="Speak to the taunka at Westwind Refugee Camp and make 5 of them pledge their allegiance to the Horde.\n\nReturn the Blood Oath of the Horde to Emissary Brighthoof once you have completed this task.",p="他们会壮大部落的，指挥官。",pEN="They will strengthen the Horde, commander.",c="谢谢你这么做，指挥官<name>。他们已一无所有。你给了他们目标，而有目标就有希望……对崭新明天的希望……对新生活的希望。",cEN="Thank you for doing this, Commander <name>. They had nothing left. You have given them purpose and with purpose comes hope... Hope for a new tomorrow... for a new life."}
Q[11984]={d="巴德以前也风光过。\n\n不过从幽魂之地开始，他就对我们毫无用处。很多事情我们只好自己想办法去做，所以我们打算把冰巨魔卖给出价最高的人。\n\n幸运的是，我们最近发现又有地方可以用到巴德了。以他的“条件”，他可以很轻易地混在本地的巨魔之中，所以我们只要教他一点小把戏，他就能给我们带来一笔可观的收入。\n\n去和巴德谈谈，把他带去西南方的达克辛废墟，等他标记了某个巨魔之后就使用这只笼子。",dEN="'Ol Budd's seen better days.\n\nEver since our stay in Ghostlands he's been useless to us. We've had to find ways to make it on our own, and today that means sellin' trolls to the highest bidder.\n\nFortunately, we've recently found a use for Budd. Something about his condition allows him to mingle with the local trolls, so we taught him a little game that's turned us a tidy profit.\n\nSee for yourself. Talk to Budd, take him southwest to Drak' Zin Ruins and use this cage as soon as he tags a troll.",o="岩石之泉的萨米尔希望你对被巴德打昏的达卡莱巨魔使用赏金猎人的笼子。",oEN="Samir at Granite Springs wants you to use the Bounty Hunter's Cage on a drakkari troll that's been stunned by Budd.",p="你准备好抓住冰巨魔了吗？",pEN="Have you managed to cage an ice troll?",c="干得好，<class>。看来我们能多留巴德一阵子了。\n\n我们马上派人去接你的笼子。这是你那份赏金。\n\n哦，还有，欢迎来到营地。留下来吧，我肯定能找到用得上你的地方……",cEN="Great work, <class>. Looks like we'll be keepin' Budd around a little longer.\n\nWe'll have your cage picked up right away. Here's your share of the bounty.\n\nOh, and welcome to the camp. Stick around and I'm sure we'll find a use for ya...."}
Q[11985]={d="如果不能攻破索尔莫丹的外围防线，那么铁矮人就永远不会投降。土灵战士们正在勇敢地应对着那些钢铁之子造出来的机械，可这些机械的强大与坚韧彻底将他们阻拦在了城市之外。\n\n周围那些可以用于潜入的坑道却又太过狭窄，巨人们完全无法利用，所以，我们的选择很有限。你愿意潜入城市，帮我们除掉指挥防务的矮人军官吗？",dEN="If we can't overcome the defenders inside Thor Modan, the iron dwarves can hold out forever. The Earthen are bravely taking on the constructs built by the sons of iron, but they cannot break into the city.\n\nThe tunnels narrow too quickly for my fellow giants to be of use, so our options are few. Would you be willing to venture into the city and kill the dwarf commanding the resistance?",o="库伦要你杀死指挥官阿格鲁姆，然后返回鸟瞰索尔莫丹的小山坡向他复命。",oEN="Kurun on the hill overlooking Thor Modan wants you to kill Iron Thane Argrum.",p="你杀死指挥官了吗？",pEN="Were you able to kill the commander?",c="干得好，<name>。失去那名铁矮人指挥官，应该足以击垮剩余守军的意志。土灵们应该能应付那些残兵。",cEN="Well done, <name>. The loss of the iron dwarf commander should be enough to break the remaining defenders. The Earthen should be able to deal with the survivors."}
Q[11986]={d="你翻阅着这本污渍斑斑、残缺不全的日记，发现书页上排着密密麻麻的笔记，还配有图表和地图。\n\n作者的字迹有些眼熟，可一时之间你也想不起是谁，直到你看见一则笔记中留有布莱恩·铜须的名字。\n\n日记的后半部分被撕掉了，无法看到最新的笔记内容。书页散落在战场上，要想知道布莱恩究竟发现了什么，就必须复原这本日记。",dEN="This battered, mud-stained journal has seen better days. Leafing through the pages, you discover dozens of notes, diagrams, and maps.\n\nThe author's handwriting seems vaguely familiar, but you're unable to place it until you discover an entry signed with the name of Brann Bronzebeard.\n\nThe back half of the book, containing the most recent entries, has been torn away. Pages litter the battlefield, and it will be impossible to know what Brann discovered here until the book is whole again.",o="找到8张遗失的日记书页，将它们与不完整的日记拼凑起来，然后将日记交给月溪旅营地的托尔森·迪普迪格。",oEN="Recover 8 Missing Journal Pages, combine them with the Incomplete Journal, and return the completed journal to Torthen Deepdig at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="你找到了布莱恩的日记？不可思议！协会很久没有他的消息了，我们开始担心他被抓了或是被杀害。他在索尔莫丹中发现了什么？",cEN="You found Brann's journal? Incredible! The league hasn't gotten a report from him in some time, and we began to fear he may have been captured or killed. What did he discover inside Thor Modan?"}
Q[11988]={d="布莱恩在日记中提到，他利用符文钥石来破译雕刻在金属板上的符文。没有那玩意儿的话，我们根本无法参透金属板上的内容。\n\n最后一则笔记写道，铁矮人从布莱恩手中抢走了符文钥石，将它砸成若干块碎片，分别保存起来。我们必须夺回碎片，才能破译符文金属板。索尔莫丹以及附近的建筑物中到处都是矮人，他们可能携带着符文钥石碎片。",dEN="Brann's journal mentions that he used a runic keystone to illuminate the important runes on the plate he discovered. Without the keystone, the plate's contents would be little better than gibberish.\n\nAt the end of Brann's last entry, he describes the iron dwarf defenders seizing the keystone from him, shattering it, and dividing it among themselves. Before we can decipher the runed plate, we must hunt down the fragments. Any of the dwarves within Thor Modan or the buildings around it may carry fragments.",o="将5块符文钥石碎片交给月溪旅营地的托尔森·迪普迪格。",oEN="Bring 5 Runic Keystone Fragments to Torthen Deepdig at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="你收集到足够的碎片好重做钥石了吗？",pEN="Do you have enough of the fragments to reconstruct the keystone?",c="<托尔森迅速地重组你收集来的碎片。>\n\n这还不够完整，但应该足以让我们从金属板上取得大部分的资讯了。",cEN="<Torthen works quickly to assemble the fragments you retrieved.>\n\nThis is incomplete, but it should still allow us to get most of the information from the plate."}
Q[11989]={d="小心点，$g伙计:伙计;。\n\n德拉库鲁缩过的$r脑袋比我记得的还多……就算我记得清，我也数不过来。算你走运，我被关在这笼子里，不然名单上就又多一个了。\n\n不过事已至此，也许我们可以先把分歧放一放，嗯？\n\n德拉库鲁知道些事，些能帮你在这一带打仗的事。\n\n<德拉库鲁在自己的手掌上割了一刀，从笼栅间向你伸来。>\n\n怎么样，伙计？停战吗？",dEN="Watch yerself, mon.\n\nDrakuru shrunk more <race> heads than I can remember - and even if I could remember, I couldn't count that high. Lucky for you I be stuck in dis cage or I'd be addin' one more to da list.\n\nBut things bein' what they are, mebbe we be puttin' our differences aside fer a time, eh?\n\nDrakuru know things, mon. Things that will aid you in your struggle here.\n\n<Drakuru cuts the palm of his hand on one of his tusks and extends it through the cage.>\n\nSo, what you say, mon... truce?",o="岩石之泉的达库鲁希望你在他的笼子附近使用钝刻刀，然后和他对话。",oEN="Drakuru at Granite Springs wants you to use the Dull Carving Knife near his cage and then speak to him.",p="正确的选择，老兄。你不会活着后悔这件事情……",pEN="Good choice, mon. You won't be livin' to regret it....",c="成了！\n\n现在我们血脉相连了，伙计。这可是真正的情谊。\n\n仔细听德拉库鲁说，<race>。有很多事要做。",cEN="There!\n\nNow we be connected by blood, mon. A true bond we be havin'.\n\nYou lissen carefully to Drakuru, <race>. There be much to do."}
Q[11990]={d="先说最要紧的，$g伙计:伙计;。有些准备工作要做。\n\n我不知道他们还要把我关多久。你需要一瓶强效药剂，我们才能保持联络。\n\n算你走运，我正好知道该用什么！材料都在附近。\n\n我需要那边那个小巨魔的一瓶体液，此处北面湖里的一些水草，还有营地周围能找到的几片薄雾叶。\n\n快去，伙计，趁他们还没把我拖走。",dEN="First things first, mon. There be some preparatory work that need doin'.\n\nNo tellin' how long dey gunna keep me here. Ya be needin' a powerful elixir so we can be keepin' in touch.\n\nLucky for you, I know just the thing! And the ingredients all be close by.\n\nI need a vial from the pretty little troll over there, some waterweed from the lake just north of here, and a few haze leaves found around the camp here.\n\nHurry now, mon, before dey be haulin' me away.",o="岩石之泉的达库鲁希望你把一只灌魔之瓶、一片水草叶和3片薄雾叶交给他。",oEN="Drakuru at Granite Springs wants you to bring him an Imbued Vial, a Waterweed Frond, and 3 Haze Leaves.",p="你找到那些东西了吗，老兄？",pEN="You got da stuff, mon?",c="<达库鲁将材料熟练地混合在一起并且放入瓶中。>\n\n这样应该可以了，老兄。工作的时候到了。",cEN="<Drakuru takes the ingredients and deftly combines them in the vial.>\n\nThis should do it, mon. Now it be time to get to work."}
Q[11991]={d="一套传说中的神器，失落了数千年，据说能让达克萨隆要塞固若金汤。\n\n大多数人以为那只是传说，但德拉库鲁清楚得很……\n\n我差点就查出其中一件的下落了，可惜还没解读完那些象形文字就被抓了。你得把我的灵魂召唤到那儿去，好让我把剩下的读完！\n\n在达克辛废墟的火盆那里使用我的药剂，就在此处西南。药剂需要掺入一些冰封魔精才能生效。我不愿看到兄弟们倒下，但这是为了大局。|n",dEN="A legendary set of artifacts, lost for thousands of years, were created to make Drak'Tharon Keep impervious.\n\nMost think they be myth, but Drakuru knows better, mon!\n\nI nearly discovered where one be, but got captured while interpreting hieroglyphs. Ya gotta summon my soul back dere so I can finish readin' em!\n\nUse my elixir at da brazier on Drak'Zin Ruins, southwest of here. You'll hafta mix in da frozen mojo my bruddas be holdin'. I hate ta see my bruddas fall, but it be for the greater good.",o="达库鲁希望你从达克辛废墟的达卡莱巨魔身上获取5份冰冻魔精，然后在达库鲁的火盆处使用他的药剂。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to get 5 Frozen Mojo from the Drakkari Trolls at the Ruins of Drak'Zin and then use the elixir at Drakuru's Brazier there.",c="啊，是的。你做得很好，老兄。\n\n我可以从这片墙上开始读……",cEN="Ahh, yes. Ya done good, mon.\n\nI be readin' the walls just fine from here...."}
Q[11993]={d="时间宝贵！我们已经完全修复了符文钥石——呃，几乎是完全。不管怎么说，现在可以破译那些符文金属板啦，布莱恩在失踪前一直潜心研究金属板上面的内容。\n\n我们也不确定布莱恩是否能解读三块金属板上的所有文字，但是他应该会采用抽丝剥茧、逐一破译的思路。\n\n在三块金属板前分别使用钥石解读上面的内容。布莱恩的希望就寄托在我们身上了！",dEN="We've no time to lose! Now that we've reassembled the runic keystone -- well, most of it -- we can decipher the contents of those very same runic plates Brann was working on before he fled.\n\nWe have no way of knowing if he managed to read the contents of all three plates, but we'll have to assume he got enough information to determine his next destination.\n\nStand before each of the plates and use the keystone to determine the contents of each. Brann may be counting on us!",o="月溪旅营地的托尔森·迪普迪格要你破译3块符文金属板的内容。",oEN="Torthen Deepdig at the Westfall Brigade Encampment wants you to decipher the three Rune Plates.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What've you found out?",c="<托尔森听你解说符文板上的内容。>\n\n玛多兰的锤子啊，他找到了一个新的泰坦城市！\n\n石头与钢铁的发源地。\n\n“奥杜尔座落于风暴之中。”\n\n你知道那是什么意思吗？那里可能就是我们的起源故乡，在这么多年之后？\n\n我们得跟着他！我们得找到他！",cEN="<Torthen listens as you recount the contents of the runic plates.>\n\nBy Madoran's hammer, he's discovered a whole new titan city!\n\n'The cradle of stone and iron.'\n\n'Ulduar nestled in the storm.'\n\nWhat d'you suppose that means? Could it be where we come from, after all these years?\n\nWe have to follow him! We have to find him!"}
Q[11995]={d="$C，我知道这群海象人会让你帮他们忙这忙那的，但你必须尽快转至群星之墓。\n\n今天早晨在这片大陆所发生的剧变，一定造成了巨大的影响，而并不只是给当地人带来些麻烦这么简单。\n\n沿着港口北边的道路一直走，群星之墓就在十字路口的西面。大法师茉德拉在那里等着你！",dEN="<class>, I know these tuskarr will ask you to do many favors for them, but you must get to Stars' Rest with all due haste!\n\nThe upheaval in the land this morning is sure to have broader repercussions than just inconveniencing the natives.\n\nStars' Rest is westward past the intersection of the road leading north out of the harbor. There is an archmage there named Modera. She will be expecting you.",o="转至群星之墓，与大法师茉德拉的影像谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",c="我一直在等你，<class>。你我有很多事要做。",cEN="I've been expecting you, <class>. We have much work to do, you and I."}
Q[11996]={d="$C，我知道这群海象人会让你帮他们忙这忙那的，但你必须尽快转至阿格玛之锤。\n\n今天早晨在这片大陆所发生的剧变，一定造成了巨大的影响，而并不只是给当地人带来些麻烦这么简单。\n\n沿着港口北边的道路一直走，阿格玛之锤就在十字路口的西面。大法师艾萨斯·夺日者在那里等着你！",dEN="<class>, I know these tuskarr will ask you to do many favors for them, but you must get to Agmar's Hammer with all due haste!\n\nThe upheaval in the land this morning is sure to have broader repercussions than just inconveniencing the natives.\n\nThe Hammer is westward past the intersection of the road leading north out of the harbor. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver himself will be expecting you!",o="转至阿格玛之锤，与大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",c="你怎么去了这么久？时间只等守护巨龙，<race>。\n\n你我有很多事要做。",cEN="What took you so long? Time waits only for Aspects, <race>.\n\nWe have much work to do, you and I."}
Q[11998]={d="想让大部队迅速抵达冰冠冰川，最好的方法就是利用铁矮人的古老城邦——索尔莫丹的地下隧道系统。\n\n探险者协会的布鲁加尔·石剪和他手下的同伴多半不乐意这样做，但是军令如山，就由不得他啦。\n\n如果你能捎上一桶冰风月光酒，他或许会勉为其难地接受这项指令。沿着林地线往东南走，你可以从红木商栈的猎户休·格兰斯手中买到这种酒。\n\n那家伙的神经有点不正常，不过他卖的酒倒是绝无第二家的。",dEN="Our best bet for moving our forces quickly to Icecrown Glacier lies with the network of tunnels beneath the ancient iron dwarf city of Thor Modan.\n\nBrugar Stoneshear and his Explorers' League boys aren't going to be happy, but orders are orders.\n\nThe news might go over better if you brought him a cask of that moonshine sold by that trapper, Hugh Glass, down at Redwood Trading Post, southeast of here along the tree line.\n\nMan's not right in the head, but you won't find better moonshine out here.",o="将一桶冰风月光酒交给月溪旅营地的布鲁加尔·石剪。",oEN="Bring Brugar Stoneshear at the Westfall Brigade Encampment a cask of Howlin' Good Moonshine.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="让我把话说清楚——一个我不认识的<race>给我送来一桶这鬼森林里最好的酒。行吧，那你想要什么？",cEN="Let me get this straight -- a <race> I don't know brings me a cask of the finest booze in this miserable forest. Ok, then, what are you after?"}
Q[11999]={d="西南面的眠月花园以前曾经是一群高贵的上层精灵的最终安息地，那里同样是一个强大的魔网能量线枢纽。\n\n蓝龙军团利用一种被他们自己称为“湍流之针”的魔法设备摧毁了那个枢纽，释放了能量，将能量指引去他们想要的地方。\n\n我希望你能帮我寻找我想要的信息。\n\n在这片土地被摧毁之后，上层精灵的鬼魂开始复活并击败了一部分法师猎手成员。去他们的尸体上看看有什么有用的信息。",dEN="The Moonrest Gardens to the southwest were the final resting place of a group of Highborne elves. It was also a ley line nexus.\n\nThe blue dragonflight used a magical device they call a surge needle to destroy that nexus, freeing the power to redirect at their will.\n\nI want more information and you are going to get it for me!\n\nAfter the land was destroyed at the ruins, the ghosts of the Highborne rose up and decimated half of the mage hunters there. Go rifle their corpses for clues.",o="找到眠月花园计划书，然后返回阿格玛之锤，将它交给大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像。",oEN="Find the Moonrest Gardens Plans and return them to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你回来了。你发现了些什么？",pEN="You have returned. What did you uncover?",c="有意思，他们想要和虚灵复仇军合作。对于玛里苟斯和他的疯狂而言，虚灵确实是个强力的盟友。\n\n这样可不行！",cEN="Curious, they seek an accord with the Ethereum. The ethereals could prove a powerful ally for Malygos and his madness.\n\nThis will not do!"}
Q[12000]={d="西南面的眠月花园以前曾经是一群高贵的上层精灵的最终安息地，那里同样是一个强大的魔网能量线枢纽。\n\n蓝龙军团利用一种被他们自己称为“湍流之针”的魔法设备摧毁了那个枢纽，释放了能量，将能量指引去他们想要的地方。\n\n我希望你能帮我寻找我想要的信息。\n\n在这片土地被摧毁之后，上层精灵的鬼魂开始复活并击败了一部分法师猎手成员。去他们的尸体上看看有什么有用的信息。",dEN="The Moonrest Gardens to the southwest were the final resting place of a noble group of Highborne elves. It was also a powerful ley line nexus.\n\nThe blue dragonflight used a magical device they call a surge needle to destroy that nexus, freeing the power to redirect at their will.\n\nI need more information and I hope that you will get it for me.\n\nAfter the upheaval at the ruins, the ghosts of the Highborne rose up and decimated half of the mage hunters present. Go rifle their corpses for clues.",o="找到眠月花园计划书，然后返回群星之墓，将它交给大法师茉德拉的影像。",oEN="Find the Moonrest Gardens Plans and return them to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="你回来了。你发现了什么？",pEN="You have returned. What did you uncover?",c="有意思，他们想要和虚灵复仇军合作。对于玛里苟斯和他的疯狂而言，虚灵确实是个强力的盟友。\n\n这样可不行！",cEN="Curious, they seek an accord with the Ethereum. The ethereals could prove a powerful ally for Malygos and his madness.\n\nThis will not do!"}
Q[12002]={d="战争打响后，我就下令探险队撤离了索尔莫丹，格里安难道不知道？除非那里恢复和平，否则别想让我们挖掘地下隧道。\n\n你能赢得格里安·斯托曼的信任，看上去倒是个勇敢的家伙。\n\n索尔莫丹就在东北方，我们的同伴还在和那些该死的铁矮人作战呢。帮助他们赢得胜利，这样我才能着手部署详细的调查方案。",dEN="I hope Gryan knows I withdrew my men from Thor Modan when the battle began. There's no way we can excavate anything until that place settles down.\n\nYou seem like a brave sort, though, and you have Stoutmantle's trust.\n\nThor Modan is just to the northeast of us and the battle still rages between our Earthen brothers and the creations of those accursed iron dwarves. Help our brethren to even the odds and I'll start figuring out how we're going to accomplish this survey of Thor Modan.",o="消灭10台符文作战魔像，然后返回月溪旅营地向布鲁加尔·石剪复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Runic Battle Golems and return to Brugar Stoneshear at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="索尔莫丹的情况如何？",pEN="How are things at Thor Modan?",c="<布鲁加尔听着你的回报。>\n\n听起来事情似乎和缓了一些。我们会开始寻找进入铁矮人隧道系统的方法。",cEN="<Brugar listens to your report.>\n\nIt sounds like things may be calming down there a bit. We'll start looking for entrances to the iron dwarves' tunnel system."}
Q[12003]={d="我们打算从索尔莫丹边缘地带的建筑群开始搜寻，看看能不能发现地下隧道系统的入口。\n\n探险队撤离那里时，我留意到铁矮人防御者将建筑物作为掩体，所以你得当心点。\n\n隧道入口极有可能位于建筑物背面。格里安·斯托曼大概希望我们有所发现吧，不过我怀疑铁矮人会不会让我们轻易得手。",dEN="The first place we'll search for entrances to the Thor Modan tunnel system will be the outlying buildings.\n\nAs I left the site with my men, it looked like the iron dwarf defenders were taking refuge inside the buildings. Be careful as you explore them.\n\nAny tunnel entrances are likely to be toward the back of the buildings. I'm not sure what Stoutmantle thinks we're going to find down there, but I doubt the iron dwarves will make the search easy.",o="月溪旅营地的布鲁加尔·石剪要你前去侦查索尔莫丹的北部建筑物、东部建筑物和南部建筑物。",oEN="Brugar Stoneshear at the Westfall Brigade Encampment wants you to explore the North Building, the East Building, and the South Building of Thor Modan.",p="我很怀疑你有打算找到隧道，你有吗？",pEN="I don't suppose you managed to find the tunnels, did you?",c="<布鲁加尔啐了一声，以矮人语咒骂着。>\n\n没有入口？没有？\n\n不，这当然不可能太容易。嗯，看来想尽入城市是免不了一场战斗。我的手下再也没办法进行真正的工作。",cEN="<Brugar utters a stream of foul dwarven words.>\n\nNo entrances? None?\n\nNo, of course it couldn't be that easy. Well, I suppose there's no avoiding a foray into the city proper. My boys'll never get back to their real work."}
Q[12004]={d="现在我们需要做的就是一箭双雕，$c。\n\n你就是那支箭，而商人穆法赫和古拉莫什就是那两只雕。他们应该就在眠月花园的西半边，去那座两层楼的大房子里找找看。\n\n如果可以的话，我希望看到他们死亡的凭证。",dEN="We need to kill two birds with one stone here, <class>. You're the stone.\n\nOur two birds are Wind Trader Mu'fah and Goramosh. They should be somewhere in the western half of the Moonrest Gardens. Most likely they're in the larger two-story building overlooking the pit.\n\nI require proof of their demise, if you would be so kind.",o="将商人穆法赫的遗骸和古拉莫什的鳞片带回群星之墓，交给大法师茉德拉的影像。",oEN="Deliver Wind Trader Mu'fah's Remains and the Scales of Goramosh to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="你阻止蓝龙军团与复仇军的协议了吗？",pEN="Have you prevented the accord between the blue dragonflight and the Ethereum?",c="可惜古拉莫什指出协议已经达成了。\n\n但不管怎样，终究是少了两只需要烦心的虫子。让我们来进行更重要的事情吧。",cEN="Unfortunate that Goramosh indicated the accord had already been reached.\n\nNonetheless, that's two less worms we'll have to worry about. Let us get to more important business."}
Q[12005]={d="现在我们需要做的就是一箭双雕，$c。\n\n你就是那支箭，而商人穆法赫和古拉莫什就是那两只雕。他们应该就在眠月花园的西半边，去那座两层楼的大房子里找找看。\n\n如果可以的话，我希望看到他们死亡的凭证。",dEN="We need to kill two birds with one stone here, <class>. You're the stone.\n\nOur two birds are Wind Trader Mu'fah and Goramosh. They should be somewhere in the western half of the Moonrest Gardens. Most likely they're in the larger two-story building overlooking the pit.\n\nI require proof of their demise, if you would be so kind.",o="将商人穆法赫的遗骸和古拉莫什的鳞片带回阿格玛之锤，交给大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像。",oEN="Deliver Wind Trader Mu'fah's Remains and the Scales of Goramosh to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你阻止蓝龙军团与复仇军的协议了吗？",pEN="Have you prevented the accord between the blue dragonflight and the Ethereum?",c="没关系，<class>，就把它们放在那儿地上、阿格玛的王座前面好了。\n\n<大法师的影像上隐约可见一丝笑意。>\n\n可惜戈拉莫什说协议已经达成了。\n\n不过，这样我们就少了两条需要操心的虫子。来谈更重要的事吧。",cEN="That's alright, <class>, just put them down on the ground there in front of Agmar's throne.\n\n<The hint of a smile can be seen upon the archmage's image.>\n\nUnfortunate that Goramosh indicated the accord had already been reached.\n\nNonetheless, that's two less worms we'll have to worry about. Let us get on to more important business."}
Q[12006]={d="那些所谓的法师猎手毁了我们的安息之地。\n\n去为我们复仇，否则，我发誓——你们的基地会被亡者的怒火夷为平地！",dEN="These so-called mage hunters came here and destroyed our resting place.\n\nAvenge us, or I will see to it that your base of operations is overrun with the spirits of the dead!",o="击败龙骨荒野法师猎手、眠月魔犬、湍流之针巫师和魔法焦点巫师，总计15名。完成任务后返回眠月花园，向伊瑟尼安·月影复命。",oEN="Kill any combination of 15 Dragonblight Mage Hunters, Moonrest Stalkers, Surge Needle Sorcerers, and Focus Wizards. After you have done that, return to Ethenial Moonshadow at Moonrest Gardens.",p="我总觉得你还没杀够这些污染者！",pEN="Somehow I sense that you haven't quite killed enough of these defilers!",c="很好，你满足了我的要求，甚至不止于此。\n\n谢谢你，<race>。",cEN="Very well, you have satisfied my request if nothing more.\n\nThank you, <race>."}
Q[12007]={d="我明白了，朋友！\n\n在北边，塞布哈拉克的通灵塔上有个镶着红宝石眼睛的石头脑袋，其中一颗红宝石就是预言者之眼！你要把它拿到那里的火盆旁，然后喝下我的药剂。\n\n跟以前一样，你仍然需要一些特殊的魔精才能让我的药剂生效——这次是督军希姆波的。他就藏在塞布哈拉克的某个棚屋里。\n\n要杀死希姆波真的很可惜，但他发过血誓要保卫达克萨隆，最后却失败了。现在他的魔精能够帮助我们夺回达克萨隆。",dEN="I've got it, mon!\n\nTo da north, on da Ziggurat at Zeb'Halak be a stone head with ruby eyes. One o' dem be da Eye of the Prophets! Bring it to the brazier there and drink my elixir.\n\nAgain, ya be needing some mojo for my elixir to work - dis time from da warlord, Zim'bo. He be hidin' in one of da huts in Zeb'Halak.\n\nIt be a shame to kill Zim'bo, mon, but he swore da blood oath to defend Drak'Tharon and he done failed. Now at least his mojo be helpin' us to reclaim Drak'Tharon.",o="达库鲁希望你转至塞布哈拉克，找到他的火盆，并将预言者之眼交给他。\n\n你需要取得督军希姆波的魔精，才能在那里使用达库鲁的药剂。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to bring the Eye of the Prophets to him at Drakuru's Brazier in Zeb'Halak.\n\nYou will need to collect Zim'bo's Mojo to use Drakuru's Elixir there.",p="你拿到预言者之眼了吗，老兄？",pEN="You get da Eye of the Prophets, mon?",c="就是它，老兄！\n\n它比我期望的更珍贵。这肯定能在这样黑暗的时刻带给我的人民希望。\n\n现在，没有时间可以浪费了。让我们来瞧瞧下一个神器被藏在那里。",cEN="Dis be it, mon!\n\nIt be even more precious than I hoped. Dis be sure to bring mah people hope in dese dark times.\n\nNo time to waste, now. Let's be seein' where da next artifact be hidin'."}
Q[12008]={d="就在这个难民营地正东方矗立着阿格玛之锤——部落在龙骨荒野力量的象征。\n\n虽然我毫不怀疑部落的兄弟姐妹们已经看到了你争取坦卡族加入部落的成果，但我还是要你亲自把成功的消息带给霸主阿格玛。\n\n现在就去，$n！快如疾风！向东，去阿格玛之锤！|n",dEN="Directly east of this refugee camp stands Agmar's Hammer - testament to the Hordes' power in the Dragonblight.\n\nWhile I have no doubt that our Horde brothers and sisters are already seeing the result of your efforts to bring the taunka into the Horde, I want you to deliver news of your success to Overlord Agmar in person.\n\nGo now, <name>! Race the winds! East to Agmar's Hammer!",o="前往龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，与霸主阿格玛交谈。|n",oEN="Travel to Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight and speak to Overlord Agmar.",c="在你为了部落而战时，许多人也在为了扩张我们对诺森德的控制而努力。虽然艰难，不过迄今为止我们还是在这片荒芜旷野的冰冻地域上创建了许多基地。\n\n我们从各方面包围了天灾军团。当我们的部队在“天谴之门”安加萨集结时，我们的胜利也一步步靠近。很快我们将会打破那扇大门进入冰冠冰川。\n\n但还有很多工作没完成……\n\n首当其冲的就是我们要阻止蛛魔！",cEN="While you have undoubtedly championed the cause of the Horde elsewhere, many more have been working towards expanding our grasp deeper into Northrend. Even now we have forces establishing bases in the frozen reaches of this desolate wasteland.\n\nWe surround the Scourge on all sides. Victory nears as our armies amass at the foot of the Wrathgate, Angrathar. Soon we will tear down the gate and breach Icecrown.\n\nBut there is much work left to be done...\n\nFirst we stop the Nerubians!"}
Q[12009]={d="一片混乱之中，我和我的助手失散了。你能不能帮我个忙呢？\n\n我在港口的水下设了许多捉螃蟹的陷阱，你能帮我去把它们收回来吗？我太老了，干不了这种活，而且水下很危险。\n\n拿着这只气囊，它能帮你在水下呼吸。",dEN="With all of the troubles, I've lost my assistants. I was wondering if maybe you could help me?\n\nI have many crab traps under the waves of the harbor. Will you retrieve them for me? I'm too old for that sort of thing and the waters can be very dangerous.\n\nPlease, take this bladder. It will help you to breathe while you're down there.",o="收集8个图尔凯的螃蟹陷阱，然后把它们交给莫亚基港口的图尔凯。",oEN="Collect 8 of Tua'kea's Crab Traps and return them to him at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="你打算要抓多少只螃蟹？",pEN="How many crabs did you manage to retrieve?",c="我只是一个普通的猎人，这个世界突然间天翻地覆，一点征兆也没有。\n\n我希望你能导正这一切。",cEN="I'm a simple trapper. The world has turned upside-down all of a sudden. It doesn't make sense.\n\nI hope that you'll be able to set it right again."}
Q[12010]={d="我们开始挖掘这座城市时，我派勘测员奥隆德去检查索尔莫丹隧道的稳固性。战斗一开始我们撤退时，我没见他逃出来，我担心他还被困在城里。\n\n如果要派军队穿过索尔莫丹，我们就需要他收集的那些资料。要是隧道塌在哪个旅头上，斯托曼特尔和他的上级非扒了我的皮不可！",dEN="When we began excavating the city, I sent Surveyor Orlond to check the stability of the tunnels in Thor Modan. I didn't see him escape when we withdrew at the beginning of the battle, and I worry he may still be trapped inside the city.\n\nIf we're going to get an army through Thor Modan, we'll need the information he was collecting. Stoutmantle and his superiors would have my hide if the tunnels collapsed on one of their brigades!",o="转至索尔莫丹寻找勘查员奥尔隆德的下落。",oEN="Locate Surveyor Orlond within Thor Modan.",c="在快速地检查了尸体之后，你发现勘探员已经死了一些时候。检查了他的背包，你找到了奥尔隆德的手写笔记。",cEN="A quick examination of the body reveals that the surveyor has been dead for some time. Looking through his pack, you stumble upon Orlond's handwritten notes."}
Q[12011]={d="这个螃蟹陷阱被某种比附近的鲨鱼体型还要大的东西破坏了。\n\n也许莫亚基港口的渔夫图尔凯知道那是什么？",dEN="This crab trap appears to have been destroyed by something much larger than the nearby circling sharks.\n\nPerhaps Tua'kea, the fisherman at Moa'ki Harbor, should be told about this?",o="转至莫亚基港口，将螃蟹陷阱被破坏的事情告诉图尔凯。",oEN="Inform Tua'kea at Moa'ki Harbor about the wrecked crab trap.",c="这不是我想听到的消息，<race>。\n\n不，不……你告诉我这件事很好，但我担心我的老对头又回到了这片水域。",cEN="That's not the news I wanted to hear, <race>.\n\nNo, no... it's good that you told me, but I fear my old nemesis has returned to these waters."}
Q[12012]={d="必须立即把这条消息通知到大地之环的所有成员。我不知道要如何做到这一点，但是派你来执行这项任务的长者应该知道。请你立即返回长者身边，做好进行下一步任务的准备——我们必须立即做点什么！",dEN="This information must be spread to the entirety of the Earthen Ring. I'm not certain how to proceed, but the elder who set you on this task in the first place may. Please, return to the elder and seek the next course of action - we must do something!",o="返回任意主城，同大地之环长者交谈。",oEN="Travel to a capital city and speak to the Earthen Ring Elder.",p="有什么让你困扰吗，孩子？",pEN="What troubles you, my child?",c="这的确是个严重的消息。我们一定要竭尽全力来避免战争的发生。",cEN="This is grave news indeed. We must do everything in our power to stop this war from coming to pass."}
Q[12013]={d="我还要请你做最后一件事，$r$n。我要你去杀死阿坎尼姆斯！\n\n西面的那些巫师在空中部署的巨大装置……它在我们的安息之地里炸出一个大坑，也释放出了那个怪物！\n\n如果它只对凡人感兴趣，那我才懒得理它。但是阿坎尼姆斯专吃死者的灵魂。\n\n你必须立刻去终结它！",dEN="There is one last thing that I would have you do, <name> the <race>. I would have you destroy Arcanimus!\n\nThe sorcerers to the west used that giant device in the sky to bore a massive pit into our resting place. When they did that, they unleashed a monstrosity!\n\nI would not care if it were only a concern for mortals, but Arcanimus feeds upon the spirits of the dead.\n\nYou will put an end to it now!",o="摧毁阿坎尼姆斯，然后返回眠月花园向伊瑟尼安·月影复命。",oEN="Destroy Arcanimus and then return to Ethenial Moonshadow at Moonrest Gardens.",p="你以为我是傻子吗？阿卡尼姆斯还在吞噬我兄弟姐妹的灵魂，<class>！",pEN="Do you think me a fool? Arcanimus is still eating the souls of my brothers and sisters, <class>!",c="我万分感激你，<name>。\n\n如果你还没这么做，就该向上级警示蓝龙军团所引发的危险。他们炸毁了花园下方的魔网锚点，这威胁着要把我们全部毁灭！",cEN="You have my deepest gratitude, <name>.\n\nIf you haven't already, you should alert your betters to the danger that the blue dragonflight has unleashed. By blowing apart the ley line anchor underneath the gardens, they threaten to destroy us all!"}
Q[12014]={d="奥隆德的笔记表明他随身带着一件叫做便携式地震仪的仪器，但仪器却不见了踪影。\n\n勘测日志显示，奥隆德完成了索尔莫丹隧道里所有的读数，只有一处标着\"隧道暴露段东端\"的例外。\n\n日志的最后一条记录显示，奥隆德试图躲进水中，却遭到了地下鞭笞者的袭击，它们一定拿走了他的装备。你得把它找回来才能完成最后的读数。",dEN="Orlond's notes indicate that he brought a piece of equipment called a portable seismograph with him, but the device is nowhere to be seen.\n\nThe survey log shows that Orlond completed all his readings in the Thor Modan tunnel, save one labeled the 'east end of the exposed tunnel.'\n\nThe last entry in the log indicates Orlond tried to take refuge in the water and was attacked by subterranean threshers. They might've taken his equipment.You'll need to recover it before you can take the last reading.",o="夺回便携式测震仪，并用它记录索尔莫丹地下隧道的稳定性指数，然后返回月溪旅营地，向布鲁加尔·石剪复命。",oEN="Retreive the Portable Seismograph and use it to take stability readings in Thor Modan, then return to Brugar Stoneshear at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What did you find?",c="<布鲁加尔查看了报告。>\n\n这可不妙，就算我们能凿开挡住的坑道，也无法保证是否会再度崩塌。看起来这区域几个世代以来就已经没有人使用它了。我们必须把这个坏消息告诉格里安上尉。",cEN="<Brugar looks over the report.>\n\nThis isn't good at all. Even if we could excavate the tunnels behind the blockage, there's no guarantee they wouldn't collapse again. It looks like some of these areas haven't been used in generations. We'll have to give Captain Gryan the bad news."}
Q[12016]={d="我确信……我们古老的水中宿敌图乌古瓦，\"戏弄食物者\"，已经回来了。我们得给他设个陷阱，你和我。\n\n如果说图乌古瓦有什么弱点，那就是他的胃。有一种肉，他绝对无法抗拒。\n\n\"两只巨钳\"，万蟹之母基利乌阿，正在西南方水域她的小岛上徘徊。你得去拜访她，带回她的肉。",dEN="I'm sure of it... our ancient aquatic nemesis, Tu'u'gwar, \"He Who Plays With Food\", has returned. We must lay a trap for him, you and I.\n\nIf Tu'u'gwar has one weakness it's his stomach. There's one meat for certain that he'd never be able to pass up.\n\n\"Two Huge Pincers\", the mother of all crabs, Kili'ua, paces upon her island out in the waters to the southwest. You must pay her a visit and return with her meat.",o="取得\"两只巨钳\"的肉，把它交给莫亚基港口的图阿凯。",oEN="Obtain The Flesh of \"Two Huge Pincers\" and deliver it to Tua'kea at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="你带回基利瓦的肉了吗？",pEN="You return with the succulent flesh of Kili'ua?",c="你能够杀死基利瓦……或许也能对付图格瓦尔。\n\n也许不行。",cEN="You were able to slay Kili'ua... perhaps you'll be able to do the same to Tu'u'gwar.\n\nPerhaps not."}
Q[12017]={d="时候到了，$g朋友:朋友;，必须除掉图乌古瓦！\n\n我已经把肉处理好了；只要你在我放在水中的钩子上挂上饵，那畜生必定会来。顺着鱼线下去就能找到它。\n\n无论发生什么，都别让图乌古瓦把你$g整个:整个;吞下去，$n！",dEN="The time has come my friend: Tu'u'gwar must be dealt with!\n\nI've prepped the meat so that the beast is sure to come once you bait the hook I have out in the water. Just follow the fishing line here down to it.\n\nWhatever you do, don't let Tu'u'gwar swallow you whole, <name>!",o="杀死图格瓦尔，然后向莫亚基港口的图尔凯复命。",oEN="Slay Tu'u'gwar and then return to Tua'kea at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="我想我看到了一些翻滚的浪花……图格瓦尔死了吗？",pEN="I thought I might have spotted some thrashing... is Tu'u'gwar dead?",c="年轻的朋友啊，我们为你的成功欢声雷动！海水中满是我等敌人的血液！\n\n请你收下我这个老渔夫永恒的感谢，只要我将这个消息散布开来，还有所有的卡鲁亚克族人将同样万分感谢！\n\n请收下，我坚持，从中挑选你的奖赏。",cEN="We shall rejoice at your success, my young friend! There's blood in the water and it is our enemy's!\n\nYou have the eternal gratitude of this old fisherman, and most certainly of all the Kalu'ak once I spread the word!\n\nHere now, I insist, take something as a reward, please."}
Q[12019]={d="我之所以会在死后侍奉阿尔萨斯，是因为我别无选择。他曾经完完全全地控制我的意志与我的身体。而诅咒教派则不同，他们全体成员……都自愿地侍奉阿尔萨斯……\n\n现在，既然已经知道了进入纳克萨纳尔的咒语，我们就可以彻底消灭诅咒教派。立刻转至恩其拉，在浮空城的正下方寻找传送宝珠。\n\n找到之后，和我在上面会合。准备好你的一切武器与装备，鼓起你的勇气，我们或许……会永远倒在那里。",dEN="I served Arthas in death, because I had no choice. He had control over my will and my body. The Cult of the Damned serves Arthas in life... willingly.\n\nNow that we know the words of power to enter Naxxanar we can put an end to the cultist blight. Go to En'kilah and look for the teleportation orb beneath the floating citadel.\n\nWork your way up and meet me at the top. Arm yourself with what courage you can, we might not make it out of this alive.",o="进入圣城恩其拉，找到浮空城纳克萨纳尔下方的传送宝珠。使用它进入浮空城的顶部，然后帮助萨萨里安。",oEN="Go to the Temple City of En'kilah and find the teleportation orb beneath the floating Scourge citadel of Naxxanar. Use it to reach the top and help Thassarian there.",p="你好，<name>。",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="你做得很好，<name>。我本希望让我妹妹远离这一切。多亏了你，她安然无恙。\n\n我对国王和军队的义务已经尽到。显然我在同袍中已不再受欢迎。我只能走自己的路，不打任何不属于我的战争，不听任何不听从我内心的命令。\n\n也许我们还会再见，<class>。在那之前，请收下这个，作为我感激的表示。",cEN="You did well, <name>. I was hoping to leave my sister out of all this. Thanks to you she is alive and well.\n\nMy obligations to my king and my army have been fulfilled. It is clear I'm not welcome among my comrades anymore. I will have to find my own way, fighting no wars but my own and following no orders but my heart's.\n\nPerhaps we shall meet again, <class>. Until then, take this as a token of my gratitude."}
Q[12020]={d="黑铁矮人遭到了重创！在他们仓惶逃回黑铁酒吧时，有数架运输机坠毁了。更重要的是，今天……你成功地保卫了营地的安全。\n\n将你击退黑铁矮人的英雄事迹告诉波克希吧。",dEN="The Dark Irons took a beating! As they rushed back to the Grim Guzzler, a portion of their transport fell off. More importantly, you managed to keep the camp safe... today.\n\nHead over to Boxey and explain your heroic triumph over the Dark Iron dwarves.",o="与美酒节营地的波克希·博斯宾谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Boxey Boltspinner in the Brewfest camp.",c="这么说你阻止了黑铁矮人……而且还是醉着的时候？<class>，这才是真正的美酒节精神！我猜，本着美酒节的精神，你是来要领奖币的。\n\n谢谢你的帮助，<name>。好好享受剩下的美酒节吧。",cEN="So you managed to stop the Dark Irons... While drunk too? That, <class>, is truly the spirit of Brewfest! I guess in keeping with the spirit of Brewfest you want your prize tokens.\n\nThanks for your help, <name>. Enjoy the rest of Brewfest."}
Q[12022]={d="嗨！你看上去酒量不错。不过不知道你扔杯子的技术是不是也很棒？\n\n黑铁矮人实施了复仇计划，想要破坏我们的美酒节庆典。朝他们扔杯子就能阻止这帮家伙；但首先，你得试试能不能用酒杯击中掷杯训练器。\n\n很简单，拿起免费美酒节取样器喝上一口。然后朝着掷杯训练器抛过去就行啦，确保你要面向训练器哦。等你击中训练器5次后，再来找我谈谈。",dEN="Hey there! You look like you can handle your brew. But can you handle your brew mug?\n\nThe Dark Irons have come back with a vengeance to ruin our celebration. Tossing mugs at them is the best way to stop them, but first, let's see if you can toss one at old S.T.O.U.T. here.\n\nIt's easy, pick up a complimentary sampler and take a drink. Just make sure you're facing S.T.O.U.T. Talk to me after you've hit him 5 times.",o="用免费美酒节取样器击中掷杯训练器5次，然后与波克希·博斯宾谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Complimentary Brewfest Sampler to hit S.T.O.U.T. 5 times, then talk to Boxey Boltspinner.",p="一个往后丢，一个往前丢。S·T·O·U·T·撑得住，不然我造他出来干嘛。",pEN="Toss one back, then toss one forward. S.T.O.U.T. can take the abuse, it's why I built him.",c="你知道那是什么吗？侏儒工程的巅峰之作！S.T.O.U.T.像个冠军一样扛住了折腾！\n\n我想你现在已经$g准备好:准备好;对付再次出现的黑铁矮人了。",cEN="Do you know what that was? Gnomish engineering at its finest! S.T.O.U.T. took the abuse like a champ!\n\nI think you're ready now to take on the Dark Irons if they show up again."}
Q[12026]={d="你翻阅着这本污渍斑斑、残缺不全的日记，发现书页上排着密密麻麻的、以矮人语写下的笔记，还配有图表和地图。\n\n在某个角落中，你解读出了唯一一段你能理解的字句，这是一个姓名——布莱恩·铜须。\n\n日记的后半部分被撕掉了，无法看到最新的笔记内容。或许是有些人认为这上面所记载的内容过于机密，因此想要毁灭它。或许把失去的那几页找回来，你就能得到更多的线索。",dEN="This battered, mud-stained journal has seen better days. Leafing through the pages, you discover dozens of notes, diagrams, and maps in the dwarven language.\n\nThe only text you're able to decipher is the name of Brann Bronzebeard scrawled at the end of one of the entries.\n\nThe back half of the book, containing the most recent entries, has been torn away. Someone thought the notes important enough to attempt to destroy them. Perhaps gathering the missing pages from the battlefield will yield some clues.",o="收集8张遗失的日记书页，将它们与不完整的日记合并，然后将完整的日记交给欧尼瓦营地的先知帕鲁纳。",oEN="Recover 8 Missing Journal Pages, combine them with the Incomplete Journal, and return the completed journal to Sage Paluna at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="这个布莱恩·铜须是谁？铁矮人没理由要和他交涉，我也不知道为什么要对他写的文字感兴趣。",cEN="Who is this Brann Bronzebeard? The iron dwarves found no reason to treat with him, but I have no idea why we'd be interested in his writings."}
Q[12027]={d="对不起，$g先生:女士，请问您是否知道回军营的路呢？\n\n我和小毛球本来只是想在周围的树林里散散步的，我哥哥瓦尔特也想跟我们来的，可他又有一些侍从的工作要做。\n\n结果……结果呢，我和小毛球就……就迷路了。这森林里饿狼好多，还有许多其它可怕的东西，我……我们就只好躲到这座塔里来了。\n\n现在，狼虽然走了，可我们还迷着路呢。\n\n我问小毛球该怎么走，它也不知道如何回去。你能不能帮帮我们，带我们回去呢？拜托你了！",dEN="Excuse me, <Mister/Ma'am>, do you know the way back to the soldiers' camp?\n\nMr. Floppy and I decided to go for a walk in the woods, and my brother Walter was gonna come with us, but then he had squire things to do.\n\nSo Mr. Floppy and I went by ourselves, but we got lost, and there were a whole bunch of hungry wolves, but we found this tower.\n\nThe wolves went away, but we're still lost.\n\nI asked Mr. Floppy, and he doesn't know the way back. Would you help us? Please?",o="帮助艾米莉和小毛球逃回月溪旅营地，然后向侍从瓦尔特复命。",oEN="Help Emily and Mr. Floppy get back to the Westfall Brigade Encampment, then speak to Squire Walter.",c="感谢老天让你找到了艾米莉！当她一个人离开的时候，我就担心她会迷路了。\n\n我也很高兴知道小毛球安然无恙。",cEN="Thank goodness you found Emmy! When she left without me, I was worried she'd get lost.\n\nI'm glad to see Mr. Floppy's back safe and sound, too."}
Q[12028]={d="$R，自从上次大地震动并裂开以后，我们在因度雷村的同胞就没有任何消息了！\n\n你能帮我去看看吗？你连洛根都能杀死，我想你一定能胜任的。\n\n我会给你一种特殊的香料。把它洒在我的火盆里，然后深深吸入它的香气，你的灵魂就会浮到空中，看到因度雷村的情况。\n\n当你的灵魂在天空翱翔的时候，我就能透过你的眼睛看到一切。",dEN="<race>, we have not heard from our people at Indu'le Village since the ground shook and was torn apart!\n\nHave you ever been upon a vision quest? You've bested Loguhn, so you must be capable.\n\nI will give you a special incense to sprinkle into my brazier. Breathe deep from its vapors and your spirit will be sent aloft to view what has transpired at Indu'le.\n\nAs your spirit soars, I will be able to look through your eyes.",o="通过灵魂视界观察因度雷村，然后向莫亚基港口的秘法师图阿鲁汇报情况。",oEN="Speak with Toalu'u the Mystic at Moa'ki Harbor after you have attained your spiritual insight.",p="你在想什么？",pEN="What do you think?",c="亡魂？丧失了理智？这不可能！\n\n我们一定要找到更进一步的引导。",cEN="Ghosts and gibbering madness? This cannot be!\n\nWe must seek further guidance."}
Q[12029]={d="<Hip>……得把这些尸体烧掉，免得它们又到处乱走。\n\n老爸总说，比不得不杀一个巨魔更糟的，是不得不杀同一个巨魔两次。\n\n我说，<hip>……说到天灾军团，在把那些巨魔清理掉一些之前，我们进不了北边那座巨魔要塞。\n\n你要不要喝口我的烈酒，去把那些杂种送去见阎王？",dEN="... gotta burn these corpshes 'fore they shtart walkin' around again.\n\nPoppa always said, only thing worshe than havin' to kill a troll is havin' ta kill a troll twice.\n\nSay,... shpeakin' of Scourge, we can't get into tha' troll keep up north 'til we get them trolls thinned out a bit.\n\nHow 'bout ya take shome o my grog here and put them bashtards outta their misery?",o="岩石之泉的马克希望你在达克萨隆用他的烈酒净化20个饥饿的天灾巨魔。",oEN="Mack at Granite Springs wants you to use his grog to burn 20 Famished Scourge Trolls at Drak'Tharon.",p="你干完了吗，<name>？",pEN="Ya getter done, <name>?",c="干得好！\n\n<麦克歇斯底里地笑了一阵。>\n\n哎，别这样嘛。那挺好笑的……",cEN="Well done!\n\n<Mack laughs hysterically for a moment.>\n\nAww, come on now. That was funny...."}
Q[12030]={d="我的同胞们……\n\n<秘法师几乎崩溃了。>\n\n当你的灵魂飞过村子上空时，我感觉长者玛纳洛发现了你，$n，他想和你谈一谈。长者们的雕像是我们智慧的源泉，深受我们的尊敬。\n\n他一定是想要帮助我们。到村子的西北角去找他吧。",dEN="My people....\n\n<The mystic is on the verge of breaking down.>\n\nWhile your spirit was flying through the village, I sensed that Elder Mana'loa took notice of you. <name>, he wishes to speak with you. The stone elders are revered by us as fonts of ancient wisdom.\n\nThe elder must want to help. Seek him in the northwest corner of the village.",o="转至因度雷村，与长者玛纳洛的雕像谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the statue, Elder Mana'loa, at Indu'le Village.",c="我一直在等你，<race>。我看见你的灵魂飞过，也感觉到那位秘法师在你眼后注视。\n\n你的命运与卡鲁亚克人的命运，如今已紧紧相连。",cEN="I've been expecting you, <race>. I saw your spirit fly by and sensed the mystic watching behind your eyes.\n\nYour fate and that of the Kalu'ak are now tied together."}
Q[12031]={d="西面的精灵圣地已经崩裂，它们的魔法能量正在这片土地上流动，所到之处皆成废墟。\n\n由于蓝龙军团正试图控制这股法力，卡鲁亚克的亡魂们现在正处于极度的危险之中。\n\n湖中溢出的能量杀死了村中的大部分人，少数幸存下来的也都疯了。\n\n$n，你必须去释放那些灵魂，让他们离开。别去管那些发疯的人，他们也许会慢慢恢复理智的。",dEN="The sacred ground of the elves to the west has been torn asunder. Now their magic is moving through the land causing ruin where it flows.\n\nThe souls of the Kalu'ak are in danger as the blue dragons forces attempt to control the magic.\n\nThe power came up through the lake, instantly slaying most in the village. Those that survived were driven insane.\n\n<name>, you must release these spirits so that they may move on. Leave the deranged living alone; they may yet regain their sanity in time.",o="让15名因度雷海象人安息，渔夫、秘法师或是战士都行。完成任务后向因度雷村的长者玛纳洛复命。",oEN="Put to rest any combination of 15 Indu'le Fishermen, Mystics and Warriors, then return to Elder Mana'loa at Indu'le Village.",p="<长者马纳洛亚的视线穿透你，感觉到你还没完成他的任务。>",pEN="<Elder Mana'loa looks through you, sensing that you have not yet completed his task.>",c="这并不是什么讨喜的任务，但这是必要而仁慈的。\n\n现在，你注定要替卡鲁亚克完成另外一件事。",cEN="Not the most pleasant task, but necessary and merciful.\n\nAnd now there is something else that you are destined to do for the Kalu'ak."}
Q[12032]={d="我们必须去请求水之女神奥卡诺娅的指引；只有她知道卡鲁亚克的命运会怎样。而只有深海珍珠才能把她从黑暗的虚空中召唤出来。\n\n西南方的海岸上有一座被称为海洋之巅的山峰，那颗珍珠就在山顶的祭坛上。\n\n去祭坛上祈祷吧，奥卡诺娅一定会听到你的召唤。你一定要按照她的吩咐行事，以免激怒她，给所有海象人召来灾难。\n\n如果你成功了，就去向秘法师复命吧。",dEN="The watery goddess, Oacha'noa, must be consulted; only she will know what the destiny of the Kalu'ak is to be. And only The Pearl of the Depths can call her forth from the murky nether.\n\nOff the coast to the southwest rises The Briny Pinnacle. Atop it sits the altar upon which the pearl rests.\n\nCommune at the altar and Oacha'noa is certain to hear your call. Do as she says lest you incur her wrath and bring ruin upon all of the tuskarr.\n\nShould you survive, return to the mystic.",o="与深海珍珠进行沟通，按照海之女神奥卡诺娅的指示行动。\n\n通过考验后，回到龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口，向秘法师图阿鲁复命。",oEN="Commune with The Pearl of the Depths and do as the sea-goddess Oacha'noa instructs.\n\nShould you survive the ordeal, return to Toalu'u the Mystic at Moa'ki Harbor.",p="<name>，你回来了！",pEN="<name>, you have returned!",c="你和欧阿查诺阿谈过了？！\n\n如果她的意愿是让我们站在你的族人一边，那就如此吧。长者科纳尼会把这当作我们的命运，无论祸福。\n\n我的族人相信，所有灵魂都与这世界的魔法合一。我们必须阻止蓝龙控制魔法的企图，否则我们都将灭亡！\n\n我从没想过一个<race>会成为卡鲁亚克人的救星，但你证明我错了。谨代表我的族人向你致谢，<name>。\n\n愿众神对你微笑，护你平安。",cEN="You spoke with Oacha'noa?!\n\nIf it is her will that we stand with your people then so be it. Elder Ko'nani will accept this as our destiny, for weal or woe.\n\nMy people believe that all souls are one with the magic of the world. We must oppose the blue dragon attempts to controI the magic or we are all doomed!\n\nI never thought that a <race> would be the champion of the Kalu'ak, but you have proven me wrong. On behalf of my people, I give you thanks, <name>.\n\nMay the gods smile upon you and keep you safe."}
Q[12033]={d="<托弗斯一边与你握手，一边悄悄塞给你一只信封。>\n\n<托弗斯压低了声音对你说道。>\n\n假装什么事也没发生，$n。\n\n能在这里找到你真好，士兵！毫无疑问，地狱咆哮大人将最优秀的士兵派给了阿格玛大人！\n\n<托弗斯继续压低声音说道。>\n\n读了这封信之后就在我旁边的火盆上把它烧掉。",dEN="<Torvus shakes your hand, giving you a letter in the process.>\n\n<Torvus speaks under his breath.>\n\nJust play along, <name>.\n\nIt is good to see you here, soldier! Lord Hellscream has undoubtedly sent his strongest warriors to Lord Agmar!\n\n<Torvus speaks under his breath.>\n\nRead it and then destroy it in the fire pot next to me.",o="阅读萨鲁法尔给你的信，然后摧毁它。\n\n做完这件事情之后与信使托弗斯谈一谈。",oEN="Read the Letter from Saurfang and then destroy it.\n\nSpeak to Messenger Torvus once you have completed this task.",p="我们将会粉碎天灾军团！",pEN="We will crush the Scourge!",c="<托弗斯点点头。>\n\n都明白了？那么我将回去向大人回报，你已经接受了。",cEN="<Torvus nods at you.>\n\nSo we are understood? I will return to my lord and tell him that you have accepted."}
Q[12034]={d="当前这个地区内，对我们构成威胁的天灾军团基地只有两个。一个是东边漂浮在联盟要塞暮冬城上方的恐怖之城纳克萨玛斯，而另一个就是艾卓-尼鲁布的兵力输送点，纳尔苏深渊。前几天，正是从纳尔苏深渊中涌出的大量阿努巴尔蛛魔突袭了冰雾村，并几乎将那里夷为平地。\n\n现在，我们的目标就是彻底毁灭阿努巴尔蛛魔，并将纳尔苏深渊封锁起来。\n\n去向军士长祖托克报告，领取你的作战任务简报吧。",dEN="There remain only two primary threats that stand in our way. One is the dread citadel of Naxxramas, far to the east, above the Alliance fortress of Wintergarde and the other is the Pit of Narjun, exit point for the undead armies of Azjol'Nerub. It is from the Pit of Narjun that the Anub'ar Nerubians assaulted and ultimately razed the taunka village of Icemist.\n\nWe will destroy the Anub'ar and close off the Pit of Narjun.\n\nReport to Senior Sergeant Juktok for your mission orders.",o="与阿格玛之锤的军士长祖托克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Senior Sergeant Juktok at Agmar's Hammer.",c="陆空夹击，这就是我们对付阿努巴尔威胁的方法。",cEN="By land and by air, that's how we will end the Anub'ar threat."}
Q[12035]={d="好了，我想到了！重新接线有点复杂，但像你这样聪明的$c $g肯定:肯定;应付得来。\n\n拿上我的工具，让一些收割机停止运转。等它们停摆后，用工具把所有红线插进蓝色插座。这样它们就会进入自卫模式。快，$n。再拖下去就什么都保不住了。",dEN="Ok, I've got it! The rewiring is a little complicated, but nothing a clever <class> like you can't handle.\n\nTake my tools and put some of the harvest collectors out of commission. Once they're down use the tools to plug all the red wires into the blue sockets. That'll make them go into self-defense mode. Hurry, <name>. Before long there won't be anything left to save.",o="致远郡的耶雷米亚·霍宁要你打倒5个收割采集者，并使用耶雷米亚的工具重新组装它们。",oEN="Jeremiah Hawning at Farshire wants you to destroy 5 Harvest Collectors and then use Jeremiah's Tools to rewire them.",p="你干完了吗，<name>？",pEN="You done yet, <name>?",c="做得漂亮！我总算又觉得自己派上用场了……这可意义不凡。",cEN="Nice job! I finally feel useful again... and that's sayin' something."}
Q[12036]={d="袭击冰雾村的亡灵蛛魔来自一个叫做纳尔朱恩之坑的巨大天坑。如果放任不管，那些恶鬼无疑会包抄我们在愤怒之门的大军，断送我们走向胜利的进军。\n\n我需要有人实地侦察，$n。你往西去调查纳尔朱恩之坑。我们必须找到他们的主要出口并把它封死！把位置找出来。|n",dEN="The undead Nerubians that attacked Icemist Village came from a gigantic sinkhole known as the Pit of Narjun. If left alone, those fiends will no doubt flank our forces at the Wrathgate and end our march to victory.\n\nI need eyes on the ground, <name>. You are to head west and investigate the Pit of Narjun. We need to locate their primary exit point and seal it off! Find me that location.",o="探索纳尔苏深渊，并将你的发现汇报给阿格玛之锤的军士长祖托克。",oEN="Explore the Pit of Narjun and return with your findings to Senior Sergeant Juktok at Agmar's Hammer.",c="那个该死的深渊一定是直接通往艾卓-尼鲁布。这比我想得还糟糕。\n\n<祖托克停下来想了想。>\n\n搜寻并摧毁……这将会是下一步的行动。",cEN="That damned sinkhole must be directly connected to Azjol-Nerub. This is worse than I thought.\n\n<Juktok pauses to think for a moment.>\n\nSeek and destroy... That'll be the next course of action."}
Q[12037]={d="兽人娘们……就是不听劝……嗝！你知道我在说什么吧，？\n\n库泽尔跟着我们好几年了。你以为她早该摸清我们干活的规矩了。把那些傻瓜引进来干危险的活，等安全了再坐收报酬。这有什么难懂的？\n\n可她偏不……这没耐心的绿皮自己跑去单干了。说不定已经死了，但要是不去找她，我心里过意不去，而我这副样子也没法自己去，嗝。\n\n你说呢，伙计？",dEN="Orc women... they just don't lissen - hic. Know what I mean, <race>?\n\nKurzel's been with us fer years. You'd think she'd get a feel fer how we do things by now. Lure the fools in fer the dangerous work, then reap the rewards when it's safe. What's so hard to understand?\n\nNot her though... impatient green-skin goes off and takes matters into her own hands. Probably dead by now, but I'd feel horrible if we didn't follow after her, and I'm in no shape to do it myself - hic.\n\nSo whatdya say, pal?",o="岩石之泉的马克希望你转至达克萨隆，看看库塞尔到底出了什么事。",oEN="Mack at Granite Springs wants you to go into Drak'Tharon and find out what became of Kurzel.",c="我就知道！\n\n就算我闹失踪也不可能让那些没骨气的黄鼠狼出来找我。\n\n好吧，他们派了你。我想这也算是……\n\n嗯，拿着这个。我宁可把东西交给你，也不要给营地里的那些蠢蛋。",cEN="I knew it!\n\nEven my going missing wasn't enough to get those spineless weasels to come in here after me.\n\nWell, they sent you. I suppose that's something....\n\nHere, take this. I'd rather it go to you than to those dimwits back at the camp."}
Q[12038]={d="你还等什么，$c？那些被天灾感染的巨魔可不会自己把自己杀了！\n\n规矩你都懂。往北去达克萨隆……喝几口这玩意儿，从远处朝他们扔过去，比如这样……<hip>。然后就坐下来看他们烧吧。",dEN="Whatcha waitin' fer, <class>? Them shcourged trolls ain't gunna kill themselves!\n\nYou know the drill. Git up ta Drak'Tharon up north... Take some o thish here grog and hurl it at 'em from a distance.... Then jusht sit back an' watch 'em burn.",o="岩石之泉的马克希望你在达克萨隆用他的烈酒净化30个饥饿的天灾巨魔。",oEN="Mack at Granite Springs wants you to use his grog to burn 30 Famished Scourge Trolls.",p="你干完了吗，<name>？",pEN="Ya getter done, <name>?",c="干得好！\n\n<马克歇斯底里地笑了好一阵子。>\n\n哇哈哈，现在来吧。真的很好玩……嘻嘻。",cEN="Well done!\n\n<Mack laughs hysterically for a moment.>\n\nAww, come on now. That was funny...hic."}
Q[12039]={d="安加萨，愤怒之门……我亲眼看到固定大门的金属在搏动起伏，仿佛它是活的！五十年来我从没见过金属会\"呼吸\"。\n\n唯一知道点门道的是海象人。他们管它叫\"尤格萨隆的黑血\"，还叫我离远点。\n\n西边冰雾村外有个叫纳尔朱恩之坑的天坑。我听说那种天坑里这种奇异矿石很丰富。如果你往那边去，能不能帮我取些样本？",dEN="Angrathar, the Wrathgate... I watched as the metal holding the gate together pulsed and undulated as if it were alive! In 50 years I've never seen metal \"breathe.\"\n\nOnly ones who knew anything about it were the tuskarr. They called it the \"Black Blood of Yogg-Saron\" and told me to keep my distance.\n\nThere's a sinkhole outside Icemist Village to the west called the Pit of Narjun. I've heard of these sinkholes being rich with this strange ore. If you head that way, could you try and get me some samples?",o="阿格玛之锤的伯鲁斯·折铁要求你收集10份尤格萨伦黑血样本。",oEN="Borus Ironbender at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to recover 10 Black Blood of Yogg-Saron Samples.",p="没有冒险，生命怎么会有趣？",pEN="What's life without risks?",c="它太轻了……仿佛毫无重量！我需要时间分析这种金属，看看能拿它做什么！试验！我得做试验！\n\n我会跟你保持联系，<name>。要是有什么结果，你将是第一个知道的。",cEN="It's so light... As if it weighs nothing at all! I'll need time to analyze the metal and see if I can do anything with it! Tests! I need to run tests!\n\nI'll keep in contact, <name>. If anything comes of this, you'll be the first to know."}
Q[12040]={d="我们已经深陷内战的漩涡，无法自拔。在地下，我族中仅存的生者正在挣扎着避免逐渐迫近的灭绝厄运。巫妖王不惜一切代价想要彻底统治伟大的艾卓-尼拉布王国，所有拒绝侍奉巫妖王的人都将被天灾军团消灭。\n\n阿尔萨斯是我族与你们共同的敌人……\n\n帮助我们……帮助我们净化这里，净化阿努巴尔蛛魔的玷污！让阿努巴拉克听到它们死亡时的凄惨哀嚎吧！",dEN="We are in the midst of a civil war. At the heart of this world the last living members of my species defend themselves against total annihilation. The Lich King seeks to rule the kingdom of Azjol-Nerub at any cost. Those that do not acquiesce are branded enemies of the Scourge and marked for death.\n\nIn Arthas we both have an enemy...\n\nJoin our cause and rid this place of the taint of Anub'ar! Let Anub'arak himself hear the anguish of their death cries!",o="龙骨荒野纳尔朱恩之坑的 unraveler 基利克斯要你杀死6名阿努巴尔地底领主。|n",oEN="Kilix the Unraveler at the Pit of Narjun in the Dragonblight has asked that you slay 6 Anub'ar Underlords.",p="艾卓帝国将会再次复兴！",pEN="The Azjol Empire will rise again!",c="他们还有几千个，从诺森德的每个暗处裂缝蜂拥而出。孤身一人，你毫无胜机，但合作的话……或许……",cEN="There are thousands more and they spill out from every dark crevice in Northrend. Alone you stand no chance, but together... Maybe..."}
Q[12041]={d="你已经证明了自己愿意在阿兹欧帝国危难之时伸出援手，因此阿兹欧帝国也将援助部落。\n\n把这卷卷轴带回给你的领袖。上面记载了袭击冰雾村的蛛魔的强弱之处。就当这是一份善意的表示——一份愿意帮助你的族人的心意。用那些纸页上的知识去粉碎阿努巴尔，你就为我们所有人立下了功劳。\n\n后会有期，。|n",dEN="You have proven that you are willing to assist the Azjol Empire in its time of need and as such the Azjol Empire will assist the Horde.\n\nTake this scroll back to your leader. It documents the strengths and weaknesses of the Nerubians attacking Icemist Village. Consider it a gesture of good faith - a willingness to help your people. Use the knowledge on those pages to crush the Anub'ar and you will have done a service for us all.\n\nFarewell, <race>.",o="将基里克斯的作战计划带到东边的阿格玛之锤去，交给阿格玛大王。",oEN="Deliver Kilix's Battle Plan to Overlord Agmar at Agmar's Hammer to the east.",p="你拿的是什么？",pEN="What have you got there?",c="<霸主阿格玛审阅着文件。>\n\n这是我想的那东西吗？有了这些纸页上的情报，我们将粉碎阿努巴尔的进攻！\n\n你把这文件带给我，做得很好，<name>。也许你会获准观战，甚至参加安加萨的最终决战！LOK'TAR！",cEN="<Overlord Agmar looks over the document.>\n\nIs this what I think it is? With the information contained within these pages we will CRUSH the Anub'ar assault!\n\nYou have done well to bring this document to me, <name>. Perhaps you will be allowed to watch or even participate in the final battle at Angrathar! LOK'TAR!"}
Q[12042]={d="万古的秘密，现在向我显现吧！\n\n<德拉库鲁透过先知的眼瞳窥视。>\n\n啊，我的命运何其伟大，$n。你能认识我真是走运……\n\n在那儿！我看见了，伙计。远古之心。这也太容易了！\n\n你会在东边一具地精尸首附近找到那颗心，就在此处往东。他在一间石室里，旁边是一条断树之河。\n\n快去，伙计，别让别人先找到了！",dEN="Secrets of da ages, be revealed to me now!\n\n<Drakuru peers through the Eye of the Prophets.>\n\nAhh, great be mah destiny, <name>. You be lucky ta know me....\n\nThere! I be seein' it, mon. The Heart of the Ancients. Dis be too easy!\n\nYou gunna find da heart lyin' near da corpse of a goblin east of here. He be up in a chamber, near a river of broken trees.\n\nHurry, mon, before someone else be findin' it!",o="达库鲁希望你转至蓝天伐木场的最上层房间，在一个地精的尸体附近找到古树精华宝石。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to go to the uppermost chamber at Blue Sky Logging Ground and find the Heart of the Ancients.",c="那只倒霉的地精一定是在这个地区挖掘的时候挖出了这颗宝石。\n\n想必他完全不知道它的本质。\n\n你验证了它一定能横扫这个地区所笼罩的混沌。",cEN="This unfortunate goblin must have unearthed the Heart of the Ancients during his excavations in the region.\n\nIt's doubtless that he had no clue as to its nature.\n\nYou determine that it must have been overlooked in the chaos sweeping through the area."}
Q[12043]={d="你，$c！南边那些亡灵整天对我们骚扰不休，我们的工作受到了很大的影响。去把它们都干掉，行不行？",dEN="You, <class>! These undead south of us are being a constant nuisance to our work. Go clear them out, will ya?",o="在迦拉克隆之墓附近的挖掘站内杀死12个废土挖掘者和1个废土工头。完成任务之后向诺兹拉斯哨站的纳尔弗复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Wastes Diggers and 1 Wastes Taskmaster at the digs surrounding Galakrond's Rest. Return to Narf at Nozzlerust Post when the task is complete.",p="呃？你是谁？你想干嘛？",pEN="Huh? Who are you? What do you want?",c="哦！对，那些亡灵。给你钱，滚吧。",cEN="Oh! Yeah, the undead. Here's your coin, bugger off."}
Q[12044]={d="你好你好！南边的天灾军团正在挖某种古老的龙类玩意儿。老实说我并不关心他们在那儿干什么，可他们挖的过程中运出了一车车的复合矿石。\n\n去给我弄一大堆那种矿石来。那东西对部落正在打造的兵器来说能换不少钱。|n",dEN="Hello hello! The Scourge to the south are digging up some ancient dragon thing. I could care less why they're doing it, but they're pulling cartloads of composite ore in the process.\n\nGo lift me a bunch of that ore. That stuff should yield a pretty penny for all the weapons the Horde are crafting.",o="在迦拉克隆之墓附近的挖掘站内收集8堆合金矿石，把它们交给诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克。",oEN="Gather 8 bundles of Composite Ore from the digs surrounding Galakrond's Rest and bring them to Xink at Nozzlerust Post.",p="你拿到矿石了吗？我的搬运工很快就会回来——我们必须要在战斗持续进行时把这批货送出去！",pEN="Did you get the ore? My carrier will be back shortly - we need to get this shipment out while the fight's still going!",c="哈！这可不少哇！你的背还撑得住吧？",cEN="Hah! That's quite a load! Your back feeling alright?"}
Q[12045]={d="我从没见过你……你是“恶习”的新人？很高兴你来了，多一双手总是好的。\n\n你搞材料，我完成我的机器，然后我们就能把它卖给那些指挥官，一起回家发财。\n\n其实主要部件我大多都有了，只差做武器本身的一些材料。纳夫说北边那些元素生物身上锋利的冰碎片，正好给我的炸弹做弹片——去弄些来，行吗？|n$gnuevo:nueva;",dEN="I've never seen you before... are you new to the Vice? Glad to have you. I could always use some more hands.\n\nYou get the materials, I'll finish my machine, then we can sell it to those commander types and all go home rich.\n\nI actually have most of the primary components, so I just need some of the materials for the weapon itself. Narf said that jagged ice shards from those elementals to the north would make perfect shrapnel for my bombs - go nab some, will ya?",o="在北边的冰元素身上收集4块碎冰簇，把它们交给诺兹拉斯哨站的希弗里克斯。",oEN="Collect 4 Ice Shard Clusters from Ice Elementals in the north and bring them to Zivlix at Nozzlerust Post.",p="你拿到碎冰簇了吗？我几乎要完成主要冷冻零件了。",pEN="Do you have the shards? I'm almost finished with the main refrigeration unit.",c="太好了！比我想得更锐利。我要把它们埋进雪里，等到炸弹做好。\n\n让我们来瞧瞧……下一个是……",cEN="Excellent! They're even sharper than I expected them to be. I'll pack them in the snow until the bomb is ready.\n\nLet's see... what next..."}
Q[12046]={d="我要给破片炸弹换个新外壳。我手头的东西都太硬了，爆炸时弹片散不开。\n\n我们需要非常薄的兽皮。西边那些冰虫掘地者也许可以……又或者那些在龙骨间翻找的秃鹫。你能找到什么就带什么回来。|n",dEN="I need some new packaging for the shrapnel bombs. All the stuff I have is too hard and the shrapnel doesn't spread when it bursts.\n\nWhat we need is some really thin animal hide. Those jormungar tunnelers to the west might work... or perhaps the condors sifting through the dragon bones. Go get me whatever you can find.",o="从诺兹拉斯哨站附近的掘洞冰虫或龙骨秃鹫身上收集12张薄兽皮，把它们交给希弗里克斯。",oEN="Collect 12 Thin Animal Hides from the Jormungar Tunnelers or the Dragonbone Condors near Nozzlerust Post. Once you've located the hides, return them to Zivlix.",p="狩猎状况如何？拿到我要的皮革了吗？",pEN="How goes the hunt? Do you have my hides?",c="很好……很好……这些就够用了。炮弹几乎要完成了。\n\n等等……我的碎冰簇怎么了？纳尔弗告诉我说这些元素身上的裂片都附有魔法，可是它们就跟挂在他下巴上的碎冰一样融化了！",cEN="Good... good... these should do fine. The shrapnel bombs are almost finished.\n\nWait... what happened to my ice shards? Narf told me shards from those elementals should be enchanted, but they're melting just like the one's hanging from Narf's grumpy chin!"}
Q[12047]={d="不行不行不行！这些冰块完全不行！它们在爆炸之前就全融化成水了。见鬼，这是我最后一次上纳尔弗的当了。这意味着我们要完全另找一种材料来制作破片。\n\n嗯……啊……我知道了！我真是个天才！骨头的碎片就可以呀！\n\n这周围到处都是冰虫啃过的骨头，尺寸和形状都不错。你快去看看，给我找些骨头碎片回来。",dEN="No no no! Those ice shards didn't work at all! They'll melt before they even do any damage. That's the last time I'll trust Narf's word on materials. This means we need something else entirely for the shrapnel.\n\nI know! I'm brilliant. Bone splinters.\n\nThere are some bones all around here that the jormungar have been gnawing on pretty thoroughly. Go check them out and see if you can find me some splintered bone that I can use.",o="在诺兹拉斯哨站东边的巨龙骸骨堆里收集12块破碎的骨片。",oEN="Search the dragon bones east of Nozzlerust Post for 12 Splintered Bone Chunks.",p="你找到骨片了没？",pEN="Were there any splinters to be found?",c="太棒了！这大概会是我的新炸弹所需要测试的最后一样东西了。给我一点时间，我马上试试看！",cEN="Excellent! That should be the last thing I need to test out the new bombs. Just a moment and I'll try this out!"}
Q[12048]={d="这该死的天灾矿石，我完全想不出来该怎么搞。你看，它根本不熔化！而且，我费尽了力气，也没法让这些金属的外形改变一丁点！\n\n看来，我必须搞一些铸造好的天灾军团武器装备，好好分析研究一下，才能弄清楚这些东西到底是怎么造出来的。\n\n冰雾村里面现在盘踞着大量披盔带甲的蛛魔，它们身上的盔甲就是不错的样品，去帮我弄一些来！只要你肯出手帮忙，我没准可以从这些矿石里捣鼓出一些名堂来。\n\n冰雾村就在西边，快去吧。",dEN="I can't make a damned thing out of this ore. It simply will not hold together! Despite my best efforts the Scourge metal will not bend!\n\nPerhaps if I had some samples of some forged Scourge armaments I might be able to reverse engineer the process by which the items are created.\n\nIcemist Village is crawling with armored Scourge Nerubians. Go there and get me some Scourge armaments! With your help I might actually succeed in creating something from this ore.\n\nYou'll find Icemist to the west.",o="阿格玛之锤的伯鲁斯·折铁要求你给他带回8套天灾军备。",oEN="Borus Ironbender at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to bring him 8 Scourge Armaments.",p="<伯鲁斯把他的工具丢到地上。>\n\n这根本没用！",pEN="<Borus throws his tools down.>\n\nThese are useless!",c="这些保存得极好，<name>。我马上就动手。要是有什么结果，你将是第一个知道的！",cEN="These are in excellent condition, <name>. I'll get to work right away. If anything comes of this, you will be the first to know!"}
Q[12049]={d="那些部队肯定需要填饱肚子。\n\n我告诉你个小秘密，像你这样$g娇气:娇气;的$r绝对不会知道……那些冰虫吃起来跟鸡肉一个味儿。\n\n去东边挑衅一头那种巨大笨重的冰虫。你多半没法一下就把它打死，所以趁它张开大嘴时把这个扔进它喉咙里。能带多少块肉回来就带多少。",dEN="Those troops are sure to be needin' a hefty supply of food in their bellies.\n\nI'll let you in on a little secret that a squeamish <race> like you would never know... those jormungar worms taste just like chicken.\n\nGo provoke one of those giant hulking jormungar to the east. You're not likely to be able to kill one straight out, so just toss this down its throat when it opens its mouth wide. Bring me back as many of the slabs of meat as you can tote.",o="在诺兹拉斯哨站东面与巨大的冰虫作战，直到它张开嘴，然后将高能炸药扔进它的嘴里。爆炸之后，收集6块烧焦的冰虫肉，把它们交给辛克。",oEN="Battle a Hulking Jormungar east of Nozzlerust Post until it opens its mouth, then throw a Potent Explosive Charge into its throat. After it explodes, collect 6 slabs of Seared Jormungar Meat off of the ground and bring them back to Xink.",p="都拿到了吗？我闻得出来。",pEN="Did ya get it all? You certainly stink of it.",c="哈哈！有一片肉甚至飞到我这了！做得好！",cEN="Ha ha! One of those meat slabs landed clear over here! Nice work there!"}
Q[12050]={d="接下来，我们需要囤积一些木材，你看，联盟部队正在附近修建好几座哨塔，木材很是稀缺。不过，南边的树都太细了，只有北边那些被鹰身人占据了的树，才能制成符合哨塔结构要求的横梁或立柱。\n\n拿上这个，等你进入有鹰身人筑巢的森林之后，就用这个控制器操纵我的伐木机开始工作吧。采集的木材越多越好。如果那些鹰身人胆敢对你砍倒它们的窝有什么不满的话，就把它们也砍了好了。\n\n尽快开工吧！",dEN="Next up, we need to haul in some lumber for all the towers the Alliance are building. There are some thin trees to the south, but the trees the Harpies are nesting in to the north look much more fit for structures.\n\nTake this. When you get to the Harpy nesting area, use the control and one of my Shredders should come to you. Gather as much lumber as it can carry. The Harpies are sure to disagree with you chopping down their homes - just deal with them as necessary.\n\nHop to it!",o="转至北边的鹰身人巢穴，使用辛克的伐木机控制器召唤出一只伐木机器人。从该区域的树上收集50捆木材，然后把它们交给诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克。\n\n如果你弄丢了辛克的伐木机控制器，就去找诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克再要一个。",oEN="Use Xink's Shredder Control Device to call a Shredder once you reach the Harpy Nesting Grounds in the North. Gather 50 Bundles of Lumber from the trees in the area, and then return to Xink at Nozzlerust Post.\n\nShould you lose Xink's Shredder Control Device, speak to Xink at Nozzlerust Post to obtain a new one.",p="那个搬运工呢？希望巨大的冰虫没有逮到他。他那时候可是带了不少东西。",pEN="Where's that carrier? Hope the Jormungar didn't get him. He was carrying a good sized load that time.",c="如果一棵树在森林中倒下，而你却无法通过锯刃去采伐，多么痛苦的一件事啊！不过话说回来，伐木时的声音好听吗？",cEN="If a tree falls in the forest, and you can't hear it through the saw blade, does it really make a sound?"}
Q[12052]={d="$C，你看到那个鹰身人没有？就是它率领手下，对我们派去天灾之门的补给车队发动了袭击！我在冷风高地见过它！\n\n看来这些鸟人是不想活了！杀光它们！",dEN="<class>, did you see that? That's the harpy that's been leading the attack on our shipments to the gate! I've seen her in the back of Coldwind Heights before.\n\nThose harpies have slowed our profits long enough! Kill them all.",o="转至诺兹拉斯哨站西北方的山地中，杀死冷风女王和15个冷风女巫。完成任务之后向纳尔弗复命。\n\n如果你需要辛克的伐木机控制器，就去找诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克。",oEN="Kill the Mistress of the Coldwind and 15 Coldwind harpies in the mountains northwest of Nozzlerust Post. Return to Narf once the task is complete.\n\nShould you be in need of Xink's Shredder Control Device, speak to Xink at Nozzlerust Post.",p="我记得你。你没死，那么，那些鹰身人最好是死罗。",pEN="I remember you. You're not dead, so those harpy wretches better be.",c="这应该可以让那些丑家伙三思。拿去……拿了奖赏之后就滚开。",cEN="That should make those uglies think twice. Here... take your reward and get away with ya."}
Q[12053]={d="现在，牦牛人决定与我们并肩作战。我们必须体现出部落的团结与互助精神，为他们夺回冰雾村。\n\n冰雾村就在阿格玛之锤的西方，就在山脚下。立刻到那边去，对那里的阿努巴尔蛛魔发起攻击！你要把我们最高贵最神圣的部落旗帜插在冰雾村的土地上，并消灭一切试图亵渎它的敌人！\n\n让阿努巴尔蛛魔感受一下部落的真正力量吧！让我们的战旗成为它们死前见到的最后一样东西！",dEN="The taunka are now our brothers in arms. We must show our solidarity and retake Icemist Village.\n\nYou will find Icemist Village west of Agmar's Hammer, sitting at the foot of the mountains. Travel there and challenge the Anub'ar Nerubians! Plant our beloved Horde banner at Icemist Village and destroy all that dare come to tear it down!\n\nLet the Anub'ar feel the true might of the Horde! Let our battle standard be the last thing that they see before death!",o="阿格玛之锤的军士长祖托克要求你在冰雾村使用战歌军旗，并确保它免遭一切攻击。\n\n完成任务之后，将战歌军旗还给军士长祖托克。",oEN="Senior Sergeant Juktok at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to use the Warsong Battle Standard at Icemist Village and defend it against attackers.\n\nReturn the Warsong Battle Standard when you are finished.",p="这是个挑战，<name>！",pEN="It is a challenge, <name>!",c="我们在陆地上击溃了他们！要不了多久，也要在空中击溃他们！",cEN="We have crushed them by land! Soon we will crush them by air!"}
Q[12054]={d="沃塔肯是对的，绝不能让这个绝好的机会就这样从我们手边悄然溜走。\n\n幸亏我知道有个办法，能把这个布莱恩的日记翻译成我们可以理解的文字。\n\n红牙熊怪部族的萨满祭司聚集在我们营地西南方的心血神殿，他们平常会栽培一种被称为灵息草的药草，这种药草制成的熏香可以帮助他们寻求祖先的智慧和指引。\n\n去找到一个名叫格鲁巴德·独眼的萨满祭司，鉴于他对乌索克的虔诚，他很可能随身携带着这种草药。",dEN="Vor'takh is right -- we cannot allow this opportunity to slip through our fingers.\n\nFortunately, I think I know of a way to translate the journal of this Brann.\n\nThe shamans of the Redfang furbolgs, who congregate at the Heart's Blood Shrine south of the camp, grow an herb known as spiritsbreath. An experienced mystic can use incense made from it to seek wisdom from the spirits of the ancestors.\n\nSeek out the shaman known as Grumbald One-Eye. He should carry the herb for his devotions to Ursoc.",o="将一小株灵息草交给欧尼瓦营地的先知帕鲁纳。",oEN="Bring a sprig of Spiritsbreath to Sage Paluna at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你带了足够的草药回来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought sufficient quantities of the herb?",c="干得好，<name>。我会准备好熏香，然后我们就看看这位王族矮人离家这么远究竟在干什么。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I'll prepare the incense and then we'll see what exactly this royal dwarf was doing so far from home."}
Q[12055]={d="你拣起了这个奇怪的设备，并且立刻断定它充满着魔力。但它似乎并没有任何用处。\n\n也许眠月花园东面群星之墓那里的大法师略知一二？",dEN="Picking up this strange device, you are certain that it is magical in nature. Unfortunately, it doesn't seem to connote any other kind of use.\n\nPerhaps the archmage back at Stars' Rest to the east of the Moonrest Gardens would be able to tell what it's used for?",o="将古拉莫什的奇怪设备带回群星之墓，交给大法师茉德拉的影像。",oEN="Deliver Goramosh's Strange Device to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="你手上的是？",pEN="What do you have there?",c="<name>，如果我没弄错的话，你已经找到了让我们能确切辨明猎法者部队图谋的关键！",cEN="<name>, if I'm not mistaken, you've uncovered the key to allow us to discern exactly what the mage hunter forces are up to!"}
Q[12056]={d="我亲眼见证了他的背叛！那个叛徒率领阿努巴尔突袭了这座要塞，害死了我最好的几名士兵。\n\n<戈特摇了摇头。>\n\n他一直都在替天灾军团做事，我们却毫无察觉！像赞古斯这样的还有多少？我们会把他们全都找出来，等找到了……\n\n<戈特做了个抹脖子的手势。>\n\n名单上头一个就是赞古斯。斥候报告说他藏在西边的纳尔朱恩之坑。找到他，杀了他，把他的头带给我。|n",dEN="I witnessed his treachery with my own eyes! The traitor led an Anub'ar assault on this stronghold, taking out some of my best soldiers.\n\n<Gort shakes his head.>\n\nHe'd been working with the Scourge the whole time and we didn't have a clue! How many more like Zangus are there? We'll find 'em all and when we do...\n\n<Gort makes a cutting motion across his neck.>\n\nFirst on the list is Zangus. Our scouts report that he is hiding in The Pit of Narjun, west of here. Find him, kill him, bring me his head.",o="杀死高阶教徒扎古斯，并将高阶教徒扎古斯的徽记带回龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，交给高尔特上尉。",oEN="Kill High Cultist Zangus and return High Cultist Zangus's Head to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight.",p="你的背包里有砍下来的兽人头呢，或者说你只是很想见到我？",pEN="Is that a severed orc head in your pack or are you just happy to see me?",c="<戈特举起头颅，凝视着那双死去的眼睛。>\n\n我说过我们会抓到你的……\n\n这是你的报酬，<class>。我们又少了一桩头疼事。<Gort levanta la cabeza y mira fijamente sus ojos muertos>",cEN="<Gort holds the head up and stares into its dead eyes.>\n\nI told you we'd get you...\n\nHere's your reward, <class>. That's one less headache for us to worry about."}
Q[12057]={d="这本书似乎是以特殊的材料写成，历久弥新。仔细阅读之后，你发现书页上充斥着某种奇特符号。\n\n无论这本书里究竟写的是什么，它一定都是非常重要的内容。立刻把它带回冰雾村东边的阿格玛之锤，交给高尔特上尉。",dEN="The tome is bound in flesh and appears to be bleeding. Upon examination you discover page after page filled with strange symbols that appear to be written in blood.\n\nWhatever knowledge is held within the pages of this tome could be important. Return it to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer, east of Icemist Village.",o="将血之魔典交给阿格玛之锤的高尔特上尉。",oEN="Return the Flesh-bound Tome to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",p="<高尔特显得很惊讶。>",pEN="<Gort raises an eyebrow.>",c="<戈特从你手中接过书卷。>\n\n野蛮人……以<race>的血肉装订……这种语言……它的存在从未被证实过。这是死亡的语言……天灾军团的舌语。<Gort te quita el tomo>",cEN="<Gort takes the tome from you.>\n\nSavages... Bound in <race> flesh... This language... Its existence has never been proven. It is the language of death... The tongue of the Scourge."}
Q[12058]={d="布莱恩的日记里记载了一套解读铁矮人文字的方法。我已经把这些内容抄写在了一块钥石上，它可以帮助你弄清楚那些铁矮人的符文板上到底写了什么。\n\n此外，这本日记里还记述了布莱恩追寻矮人一族起源之谜的详情，包括他所发现的全部线索与证据。千万要留意他所提到的这些线索，这可以把我们导向他的藏身之处。\n\n好了，现在你立刻回到索尔莫丹，到那里的每一块巨型符文板前面，使用这块钥石解读上面的内容。我们绝不能让联盟先找到他。",dEN="Brann's journal also contained a guide to iron dwarf symbols. I've inscribed these on a keystone which will help you to understand the words inscribed on the rune plates.\n\nFrom the journal entries, it seems Brann may be chasing after clues to the origins of his people. Keep your eyes open for any clues as to his destination.\n\nReturn to Thor Modan, northeast of here, stand before each of the plates, and use the stone to determine the contents of each. We can't allow the Alliance to find him first.",o="欧尼瓦营地的先知帕鲁纳要求你解读出三块符文板上的文字。",oEN="Sage Paluna at Camp Oneqwah wants you to decipher the three Rune Plates.",p="你找出索尔莫丹的秘密了没？",pEN="Have you discovered Thor Modan's secrets?",c="<智者帕鲁娜听着你复述那些石板的译文。>\n\n所以布莱恩认为他发现了一座新的泰坦城市？\n\n“石头与钢铁的摇篮。”\n\n“静卧于风暴中的奥杜尔。”\n\n我会请酋长派长跑信使前往风暴峭壁。我的族人熟悉这片土地，最有可能追踪到那个走失的矮人。<Sage Paluna escucha mientras relatas las traducciones de las placas>",cEN="<Sage Paluna listens as you recall the translations of the plates.>\n\nSo Brann thinks he's discovered a new titan city?\n\n'The cradle of stone and iron.'\n\n'Ulduar nestled in the storm.'\n\nI will ask the chieftain to dispatch longrunners to the Storm Peaks. My people know these lands well and have the best chance of tracking down this wayward dwarf."}
Q[12059]={d="你拣起了这个奇怪的设备，并且立刻断定它充满着魔力。但它似乎并没有任何用处。\n\n也许眠月花园东北面阿格玛之锤那里的大法师略知一二？",dEN="Picking up this strange device, you are certain that it is magical in nature. Unfortunately, it doesn't seem to connote any other kind of use.\n\nPerhaps the archmage back at Agmar's Hammer to the northeast of the Moonrest Gardens would be able to tell what it's used for?",o="将古拉莫什的奇怪设备带回阿格玛之锤，交给大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像。",oEN="Deliver Goramosh's Strange Device to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你手上的是？",pEN="What do you have there?",c="<name>，如果我没弄错的话，你已经找到了让我们能确切辨明猎法者部队图谋的关键！",cEN="<name>, if I'm not mistaken, you've uncovered the key to allow us to discern exactly what the mage hunter forces are up to!"}
Q[12060]={d="这是一件传送装置。如果要我说的话，它多半通往漂浮在西面眠月花园上空的湍流之针平台。\n\n我打算派你去用它调查一下那里。这种设备似乎是双向的，这样你就不用从平台上跳下来了。\n\n我猜想等你传送到湍流之针后，会看到一些与之关联的设备。\n\n我觉得你应该能在眠月花园内的任何地方使用这件传送装置。",dEN="This is a teleportation device. If I had to guess, I'd say that it leads to the surge needle platform floating above the Moonrest Gardens to the west.\n\nI need you to use it to investigate what's up there. It appears that the device works both ways so you shouldn't have to jump off.\n\nI expect that once you teleport to the top of the surge needle, there will be some sort of apparatus on it to observe.\n\nYou should be able to use the teleporter from anywhere within the gardens.",o="靠近并观察漂浮在眠月花园上空的湍流之针上的物品。\n\n完成任务后返回群星之墓，向大法师茉德拉的影像汇报你的发现。",oEN="Get close to and observe the projection atop the Surge Needle floating above Moonrest Gardens.\n\nAfterward, return to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest with the information.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back so soon?",c="照你的描述……那是奥法之图投影！\n\n<大法师焦虑的神情马上就被他冷酷的外表给掩饰住了。>\n\n奥法之图是世界上所有魔网能量交汇点的地图。蓝龙军团利用它寻找并摧毁地脉“焦点”，以便把魔网能量送回魔枢。\n\n问题是，送回的路径应该是通往西方，但是为何是往东方呢？",cEN="What you're describing... that's a projection of the Arcanomicon!\n\n<The archmage's show of concern is quickly masked behind an impassive countenance.>\n\nThe Arcanomicon is a map of all of the magical ley line intersections in the world. The blue dragonflight has been using it to find and destroy ley line 'anchors' to send the magical power back to the Nexus.\n\nThe question is, why is the path of destruction leading east when it should be heading west instead?"}
Q[12061]={d="这是一件传送装置。如果要我说的话，它多半通往漂浮在西南方眠月花园上空的湍流之针平台。\n\n$n，我打算派你去用它调查一下那里。这种设备似乎是双向的，这样你就不用从平台上跳下来了。\n\n我猜想等你传送到湍流之针后，会看到一些与之关联的设备。\n\n我觉得你应该能在眠月花园内的任何地方使用这件传送装置。",dEN="This is a teleportation device. If I had to guess, I'd say that it leads to the surge needle platform floating above the Moonrest Gardens to the southwest.\n\n<name>, I need you to use it to investigate what's up there. It appears that the device works both ways so you shouldn't have to jump off.\n\nI expect that once you teleport up to the top of the surge needle, there will be some sort of apparatus on it to observe.\n\nYou should be able to use the teleporter from anywhere within the gardens.",o="靠近并观察漂浮在眠月花园上空的湍流之针上的物品。\n\n完成任务后返回阿格玛之锤，向大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像汇报你的发现。",oEN="Get close to and observe the projection atop the Surge Needle floating above Moonrest Gardens.\n\nAfterward, return to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer with the information.",p="这么快就回来了？",pEN="Back so soon?",c="照你的描述……那是奥法之图投影！\n\n<大法师焦虑的神情马上就被他冷酷的外表给掩饰住了。>\n\n奥法之图是世界上所有魔网能量交汇点的地图。蓝龙军团利用它寻找并摧毁地脉“焦点”，以便把魔网能量送回魔枢。\n\n问题是，送回的路径应该是通往西方，但是为何是往东方呢？",cEN="What you're describing... that's a projection of the Arcanomicon!\n\n<The archmage's show of concern is quickly masked behind an impassive countenance.>\n\nThe Arcanomicon is a map of all of the magical ley line intersections in the world. The blue dragonflight has been using it to find and destroy ley line 'anchors' to send the magical power back to the Nexus.\n\nThe question is, why is the path of destruction leading east when it should be heading west instead?"}
Q[12062]={d="科林·烈酒就在隔壁房间，煽动黑铁矮人对美酒节发动新一轮攻击。去击败他！\n\n你只需用言语挑衅他就行啦，比如告诉他他酿造的啤酒连猪都不愿意喝。\n\n做好战斗准备。上一个侮辱他的啤酒的家伙……被送去喂了野猪。",dEN="Coren Direbrew is in the next room, riling up Dark Iron dwarves for another attack on Brewfest. Defeat him!\n\nGo to Coren and pick a fight. Tell him his beer isn't fit for pigs.\n\nWhen you do that, be ready for a fight. The last person who insulted his brew... was fed to dire boars.",o="与科林·烈酒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Coren Direbrew.",c="什么？你说什么？你竟敢！我的啤酒扛得住美酒节上供的那些任何泔水！\n\n你会为这侮辱付出代价，<class>！\n相关",cEN="What? What did you say? How dare you! My beer can stand up to any of that rot they serve at Brewfest!\n\nYou'll pay for this insult, <class>!\nRelated"}
Q[12063]={d="<冰雾祖母躬身行礼。>\n\n很荣幸认识你，$g英雄:英雄;。如果我们中许多人如今还活着、还准备着对抗天灾军团，那都是因为有你。\n\n你为我们做了这么多，我实在羞愧于再次求你相助。尽管我苦苦哀求，我唯一的儿子班索克还是离开这里去找他的父亲——大酋长冰雾去了。最后一次有人看见他时，他正往西前往冰雾村。求你，找到班索克。我不知道要是失去儿子，我该怎么办。",dEN="<Greatmother Icemist bows.>\n\nIt is an honor to meet you, hero. It is because of your actions that many of us are here now, alive and ready for battle against the Scourge.\n\nYou have done so much for us that it shames me to ask you for your assistance once more. Despite my pleas, my only son, Banthok, left here to go in search of his father, High Chief Icemist. He was last seen heading west, towards Icemist Village. Please find Banthok. I do not know what I would do if I lost my son.",o="在冰雾村内找到班索克·冰雾。",oEN="Find Banthok Icemist at Icemist Village.",c="我父亲还活着！我们必须救他！我一个人做不到，<race>。你必须帮我！",cEN="My father still lives! We must save him! I cannot do it alone, <race>. You must help me!"}
Q[12064]={d="他们用魔法锁链构成的结界将我父亲囚禁在冰雾村的正中央。根据我所了解到的情报，这个囚笼被三名最强大的阿努巴尔法师控制着，他们每人拿着钥匙的一部分。\n\n请你在村里找到这三个大法师，杀死他们，并夺取他们手中的钥匙碎片。只要集齐了三块钥匙碎片，我的父亲就有救了。只要他能获得自由……\n\n复仇的时刻就将到来。",dEN="They have my father bound by magical chains in the middle of Icemist Village. From what I have been able to gather, the prison is controlled by three powerful Anub'ar magi - each holding a piece of the key.\n\nScour Icemist and locate the magi. Kill them and take their key fragments. With all three pieces we might be able to free my father. Once he is free...\n\nRetribution will come swiftly.",o="龙骨荒野冰雾村的班索克·冰雾要你给他带去阿诺克拉的钥匙碎片、提瓦克斯的钥匙碎片和西诺克的钥匙碎片。|n",oEN="Banthok Icemist at Icemist Village in the Dragonblight has asked that you bring him Anok'ra's Key Fragment, Tivax's Key Fragment and Sinok's Key Fragment.",p="把那些钥匙碎片拿给我！",pEN="Bring me those key fragments!",c="对，这样就能用。\n\n<班索克熟练地拼合着钥匙碎片。>\n\n成了，<class>。有了这把钥匙，我父亲就能从阿努巴尔的牢狱中解脱。",cEN="Yes, this will work.\n\n<Banthok expertly manipulates the key fragments.>\n\nHere it is, <class>. With this key, my father will be freed of the Anub'ar prison."}
Q[12065]={d="法师猎手部队正在眠月花园南面的灿烂海岸忙碌着。我想你应该可以在沙滩上看到被重兵防守着的魔法焦点和领头的指挥官。\n\n很显然，指挥官肯定会随身带着些什么控制设备。夺取控制器，然后在魔法焦点上使用它。\n\n如果足够幸运的话，我们可以获取更多有关他们真正目的的信息。",dEN="The mage hunter forces are active on the Glittering Strand to the south of Moonrest Gardens. My guess is that you'll find a heavily guarded focus on the beach and a captain who is in charge of it.\n\nNo doubt the captain will have some sort of controlling device on their person. Get the controller and use it on the focus.\n\nWith any luck, we'll be able to get some more information about what they're really up to out there.",o="夺取魔网能量焦点控制指环，用它从灿烂海岸的魔网能量线焦点中获取信息。\n\n然后返回群星之墓，向大法师茉德拉的影像复命。",oEN="Obtain the Ley Line Focus Control Ring and use it to gain information from the Ley Line Focus on the Glittering Strand.\n\nThen, return to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="你从海滩带来了什么消息，<class>？",pEN="What news do you bring from the beach, <class>?",c="这情报竟以魔法方式印在你身上，真是奇怪。\n\n这么说，我们不仅知道他们改变了月溪花园输出的能量流向，还知道这股能量正被有意以某种方式转化。他们究竟想用这些魔法干什么？\n\n我不喜欢这件事的走向，<name>，一点也不喜欢！",cEN="How very odd that it imprinted this information upon you magically.\n\nSo, not only do we know that they've redirected the flow of the power coming out of the Moonrest Gardens, but we now know that the power is being purposefully changed in some way. Just what are they up to with all of that magic?\n\nI don't like where this is leading, <name>, not one bit!"}
Q[12066]={d="法师猎手部队正在眠月花园南面的灿烂海岸忙碌着。我想你应该可以在沙滩上看到被重兵防守着的魔法焦点和领头的指挥官。\n\n很显然，指挥官肯定会随身带着些什么控制设备。夺取控制器，然后在魔法焦点上使用它。\n\n我们可以毫不费劲地获取更多有关他们真正目的的信息。",dEN="The mage hunter forces are active on the Glittering Strand to the south of Moonrest Gardens. My guess is that you'll find a heavily guarded focus on the beach and a captain who is in charge of it.\n\nNo doubt the captain of the force down there will have some sort of controlling device on their person. Get the controller and use it on the focus.\n\nWith any skill on your part, we'll be able to get some more information about what they're really up to out there.",o="夺取魔网能量焦点控制指环，用它从灿烂海岸的魔网能量线焦点中获取信息。\n\n然后返回阿格玛之锤，向大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像复命。",oEN="Obtain the Ley Line Focus Control Ring and use it to gain information from the Ley Line Focus on the Glittering Strand.\n\nThen, return to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你从海滩带来了什么消息，<class>？",pEN="What news do you bring from the beach, <class>?",c="这情报竟以魔法方式印在你身上，真是奇怪。\n\n这么说，我们不仅知道他们改变了月溪花园输出的能量流向，还知道这股能量正被有意以某种方式转化。他们想用这些魔法干什么？\n\n我不喜欢这件事的走向，<name>。",cEN="How very odd that it imprinted this information upon you magically.\n\nSo, not only do we know that they've redirected the flow of the power coming out of the Moonrest Gardens, but we now know that the power is being purposefully changed in some way. Just what are they up to with all of that magic?\n\nI don't like where this is leading, <name>."}
Q[12067]={d="你在她长袍衬里发现了一封藏起来的信。信上写道：\n\n\"父亲，\n\n很抱歉我不告而别。如果你正在读这封信，那说明我已经死了。\n\n他们威胁说如果我不从，就杀掉我们全家，我被迫为玛里苟斯的军队效力。我感到无比羞愧……\n\n如果你能做些什么来对抗他们，请别为我担心。我已经骗过了他们，正在内部搞破坏。\n\n我爱你，爸爸！\n\n艾姆\"\n\n指挥官萨娅·碧钢一定想看看这个！",dEN="You find a letter secreted in the lining of her robes. It reads:\n\n\"Father,\n\nI'm sorry for disappearing on you. If you're reading this letter, then I'm dead.\n\nI've been forced to work for Malygos's armies under threat that our family would be killed if I didn't. I feel so ashamed.\n\nIf there's anything that you can do to fight them, don't worry about me. I have them fooled and I'm sabotaging them from the inside.\n\nI love you, Daddy!\n\nEm\"\n\nCommander Saia Azuresteel will want to see this!",o="将艾米·马林的信交给群星之墓的指挥官塞雅·蓝钢。",oEN="Deliver Captain Malin's Letter to Commander Saia Azuresteel at Stars' Rest.",p="有封给我的信？\n\n<指挥官对你的脸端详片刻。>\n\n我想不是……必然是坏消息。",pEN="A letter for me?\n\n<The commander studies your face a moment.>\n\nI suppose not... must be bad news.",c="哦，不……而我们还派你去杀了她，是吗？\n\n<指挥官摇了摇头，叹了口气。>\n\n对不起。我会立刻安排把信送到她父亲、暴风城的大法师马林手中。别担心，不会牵连到你……这不是你的错。\n\n尽量别再去想它。你根本无从知晓，<name>。",cEN="Oh no... and we sent you down there to kill her, didn't we?\n\n<The commander shakes her head and sighs.>\n\nI'm sorry. I'll see to it that the letter is delivered to her father, Archmage Malin in Stormwind, right away. Don't worry, you won't be implicated... it wasn't your fault.\n\nTry to put it out of your mind. There was no way that you could have known, <name>."}
Q[12068]={d="<达库鲁把预言者之眼放在额前，然后把古树精华宝石放在胸口。>\n\n我们很接近了，朋友，非常接近了……\n\n达卡莱石板是我们要找的最后一件东西。没有人知道它有多古老，也没人知道石板上面写着什么，但有了预言者之眼和古树精华宝石，达库鲁就能读懂它们。你可以在东边达基尔金的墓穴深处找到它们。\n\n等你拿到石板后，从先知和保卫者身上收集一些神圣魔精，这样就可以召唤我了。为这样的目标牺牲，他们会感到自豪的。",dEN="<Drakuru places the Eye of the Prophets on his brow and the Heart of the Ancients on his chest.>\n\nWe be close, mon, very close!\n\nThe Drakkari Tablets be all dat remain ta be found. Nobody be knowin' how old dey be or what dey be sayin', but with the eye and the heart Drakuru can be readin' dem. Dey lie deep inside the crypt at Drakil'jin, due east of here.\n\nOnce ya got the tablets, get sacred mojo from the oracles and protectors so ya can summon me there. They'd be proud to be dyin' for such a cause.",o="达库鲁希望你在达基尔金废墟中找到达卡莱石板，并从达卡莱先知和达卡莱保卫者身上收集5份神圣魔精。然后在废墟中达库鲁的火盆上使用达库鲁的药剂，召唤出他的影像。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to collect the Drakkari Tablets from the Ruins of Drakil'jin and 5 Sacred Mojo from Drakkari Oracles and Protectors there. You are then to use Drakuru's Elixir at Drakuru's Brazier at the ruins to summon his image.",p="见到你真好，<name>。\n\n你找到那些石板了吗？",pEN="Good to be seein' ya, <name>.\n\nYou find da tablets?",c="我们成功了，<name>！\n\n举行净化仪式所需的全部材料，我们都有了。",cEN="We've done it, <name>!\n\nWe have all of the components we need to perform the cleansing ritual."}
Q[12069]={d="<班索克将钥匙交给你。>\n\n你必须尽快行动，$n。拿着这把钥匙，把我的父亲从阿努巴尔的囚笼中释放出来。一旦他获得了自由，就帮助他消灭阿努巴尔的头目——虫王阿努布耶坎。杀死它之后，把它甲壳上的碎片拿去交给阿格玛。让阿格玛之锤的部落成员们见识一下大酋长的力量吧！",dEN="<Banthok hands you the prison key.>\n\nYou must hurry, <name>. Take the key and use it to unchain my father from the Anub'ar prison. Once he is freed, assist him in destroying the Anub'ar leader, Under-king Anub'et'kan. When the Under-king is defeated, take from his chitinous carapace a fragment as a trophy to present to the Horde at Agmar's Hammer. Let Agmar see the might of the High Chief!",o="使用阿努巴尔牢笼钥匙放出冰雾部族的大酋长，并协助他击败虫王阿努布耶坎。\n\n取回一片阿努布耶坎的外壳碎片，把它带回龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，交给阿格玛大王。",oEN="Free High Chief Icemist using the Anub'ar Prison Key and assist him in defeating Under-king Anub'et'kan.\n\nRecover a Fragment of Anub'et'kan's Husk and return it to Overlord Agmar at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight.",p="什么事，<name>？我正忙得不可开交。",pEN="What is it, <name>? I am extremely busy.",c="你是个勇敢的<class>，<name>。你救出了大酋长，为部落立下了大功。",cEN="You are a brave <class>, <name>. You've done the Horde a great service by rescuing the High Chief."}
Q[12070]={d="那些钢铁之子利用他们的符文魔法束缚住了我们许多的兄弟，甚至奴役他们来解除索尔莫丹之围。我们真的非常希望不必去和那些可怜的兄弟们作战，但却别无选择。\n\n现在，我手下的巨人们就快要抵挡不住了，必须解决这个问题。\n\n这里有一块注入了祝福之力的土灵碎片，其中的魔法将会大大提振我军的战力与士气。带着它到北边巨石丘陵的前线去，使用它固化我族的身体，强化我族的信心。\n\n如果那里有任何铁矮人胆敢阻拦我们的军团，就赐予他死亡。",dEN="The sons of iron have used their runes to enthrall many of my brothers and are using them to break the siege on Thor Modan. I wish we did not have to fight them, but we have no choice.\n\nMy giants will not hold out long against them.\n\nI have imbued this earthen shard with a blessing that will aid our allies. Take it with you to the battle in the Boulder Hills to the north, and use it to reassure and fortify my brethren.\n\nKill any iron dwarves who would stand in your way.",o="使用大地碎片鼓舞巨石丘陵的灰熊丘陵巨人，杀死所有与你交战的铁矮人，然后回到俯瞰索尔莫丹的丘陵地带，向库伦复命。",oEN="Use the Shard of the Earth to rally the Grizzly Hills Giants fighting in the Boulder Hills, kill any iron dwarves who oppose you, then report to Kurun on the hill overlooking Thor Modan.",p="你将我的祝福传递给巨人们了吗？",pEN="Have you conveyed my blessing upon the giants?",c="你给了我们的盟友继续作战的力量，我为此感谢你。但尽管如此，我们依旧要开始展开计划，在我们被打倒之前结束这场战争。",cEN="You have given our allies the strength to fight on, and for that you have my thanks. Even so, we must begin planning a way to end this battle before we are overrun."}
Q[12071]={d="既然他们已经见识了部落在陆地上的威力，就该感受一下来自空中的力量！我要你立刻去向瓦诺克·怒风报到！他就在这里，阿格玛之锤。\n\n瓦诺克已经得知你的任务，正在等你。|n",dEN="They have seen the might of the Horde by land, now they must feel it from the air! I want you to report to Valnok Windrager at once! You will find him here, in Agmar's Hammer.\n\nValnok has already been briefed on your mission and is expecting you.",o="与阿格玛之锤的瓦诺克·风怒谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Valnok Windrager at Agmar's Hammer.",c="<瓦诺克向你敬礼。>\n\n你就是那个高手，嗯？",cEN="<Valnok salutes.>\n\nSo you're the hot shot, eh?"}
Q[12072]={d="我想你应该已经见过冰雾村里那些蛛魔们制造出的阿努巴尔荒芜兽大军了。阿努巴尔蛛魔计划将这些怪物送去天灾之门，消灭我们派驻在那里的守军。绝不能让这种事情发生！\n\n带上这把信号枪，立刻到西边的冰雾村去。在那边，你可以用它直接调用我的双足飞龙，并乘坐它飞上天空，消灭一切你能看见的荒芜兽！\n\n消灭了敌人的空中力量之后，回来找我领取报酬！",dEN="You've no doubt seen the army of Anub'ar blightbeasts that are being constructed at Icemist Village. The Anub'ar have plans to send those monsters against our soldiers at the Wrathgate. This cannot happen!\n\nVenture west to Icemist Village with this flare gun and use it to call down one of my war riders. Climb on its back and command it to destroy the blightbeasts that are out of reach from the ground!\n\nOnce you have decimated their aerial forces, return to me for your reward!",o="在冰雾村内使用瓦诺克的信号枪调用一只库卡隆作战双足飞龙，骑坐它杀死25只阿努巴尔荒芜兽！\n\n完成任务后返回阿格玛之锤向瓦诺克·风怒复命。",oEN="Use Valnok's Flare Gun to call down a Kor'kron War Rider at Icemist Village. Mount the Kor'kron War Rider and then use it to kill 25 Anub'ar Blightbeasts!\n\nReturn to Valnok Windrager at Agmar's Hammer should you complete this mission.",p="请注意，战斗坐骑只会在冰雾村范围进行战斗。你要是把它飞到别处，它可是会把你摔下来的。",pEN="Do note that the war riders are trained to only fight inside Icemist. Try to take them elsewhere and they will buck you off.",c="<瓦诺克向你敬礼。>\n\n他们被我们的空袭打的屁滚尿流！也许不久你就会被征召到安加萨去了，大英雄！",cEN="<Valnok salutes.>\n\nAnd now they have been crushed by air! Perhaps soon you will be called to Angrathar, hero!"}
Q[12073]={d="联盟并不是我们在灰熊丘陵唯一的敌人。铁矮人牢牢控制着东海岸，尽管东北方的索尔莫丹正被石巨人围困。\n\n高明的战士会利用敌人的弱点作为武器，忽视铁矮人在索尔莫丹的脆弱之处就是愚蠢。不要对铁矮人心慈手软。挡路者，一律杀之。\n\n这些\"钢铁之子\"会学会畏惧部落。",dEN="The Alliance isn't the only force opposing us in Grizzly Hills. The iron dwarves have firm control of the eastern coast, although Thor Modan, to the northeast, is besieged by stone giants.\n\nA skilled warrior uses an enemy's weakness against him and we would be fools to ignore the vulnerability of the iron dwarves at Thor Modan. Show the iron dwarves no mercy. Slay any and all who would stand in your way.\n\nThe 'sons of iron' will learn to fear the Horde.",o="杀死10名守卫索尔莫丹的铁矮人，然后向欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯复命。",oEN="Kill any 10 Iron Dwarves defending Thor Modan and report back to Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你把我交付的铁矮人赶走了吗？",pEN="Have you moved against the iron dwarves as I asked?",c="<斥候沃塔肯微笑着。>\n\n当前索尔莫丹面临崩溃的边缘了吧？\n\n很好。我们很快就能将注意转向丹厄古尔了。",cEN="<Scout Vor'takh smiles.>\n\nThor Modan is on the verge of collapse, then?\n\nVery well. We will soon turn our attention to Dun Argol."}
Q[12074]={d="东北方那座古老的铁矮人首都索尔莫丹，正遭到一伙神秘的石巨人与土灵的围攻。\n\n泰坦的造物为何彼此交战，我既无法理解，部落也不关心，但这里有个削弱共同敌人的机会。\n\n前往索尔莫丹，找到那个统领巨人和土灵的\"库伦\"。与他结成同盟，借他的军队碾碎铁矮人。",dEN="The old iron dwarf capital of Thor Modan, far to the northeast, is under siege by a mysterious band of stone giants and earthen.\n\nWhy the creations of the titans would war against each other is beyond my understanding and the Horde's interest, but there is an opportunity here to weaken a mutual enemy.\n\nTravel to Thor Modan and seek out this 'Kurun' who commands the giants and earthen. Make common cause with him and use his forces to crush the iron dwarves.",o="转至俯瞰索尔莫丹的丘陵地带，在那里找到库伦。",oEN="Speak with Kurun on the hill overlooking Thor Modan.",c="<你向库伦介绍了自己。>\n\n所以这些铁矮人同样是你们的敌人？\n\n我们将铁矮人困在他们的城市里动弹不得，但是我们希望加大进攻力度。你愿意帮助我们吗？",cEN="<You introduce yourself to Kurun.>\n\nSo the sons of iron are your enemies as well?\n\nMy forces have the iron dwarves pinned inside their city, but we could use help in pressing the attack. Will you aid us?"}
Q[12075]={d="这里够冷的，不是吗，$r？\n\n科查尔至今都不想与我见面。看来他只顾着想一些要紧事了——比如说，从地下突然冒出来袭击他们的那些冰虫。或许你能帮我说服科查尔，让他相信我是一个好人。\n\n话说，我在北边的洞穴口上看见有一个巨人被一群冰虫吃掉了……那些虫子能如此轻易地杀死那样一个庞然大物，这真让我感到惊诧。你去给我到那个巨人的尸体上采集一些伤口附近的样本回来，我要好好研究一下。",dEN="Cold out here, isn't it, <race>?\n\nKo'char has refused to meet with me. It seems he has more pressing things on his mind - namely, the jormungar that have been attacking them from the cavern below. Maybe you can help me convince Ko'char that I'm one of the good guys.\n\nI saw a giant being eaten by some of the worms at the entrance to the cavern north of here... I'm still puzzled as to how the worms are killing them so easily. Bring me a sample from one of his wounds.",o="转至佐特的北面，在水晶裂痕下面的洞穴入口处的冰巨人尸体上收集一份岩石躯体样本。完成收集工作之后把它交给峡谷中央的佐特。",oEN="Collect a sample of Rockflesh from the Ice Giant corpse at the cavern entrance in the Crystal Vice, north of Zort's location. After this task is complete, return to Zort near the center of the canyon.",p="你带着我的样本回来了吗？很高兴寒冷的天气没有夺走你的性命。",pEN="You've returned with my sample then? I'm glad the cold didn't claim you.",c="这太完美了。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="This is perfect. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[12076]={d="即便一眼看去，你带给我的样本也明显是某种腐蚀性唾液。很自然可以推断，这些虫子用来钻地的物质，也给了它们对付冰巨人的可怕武器。\n\n拿着这把刮刀，去挑衅那些虫子。它们朝你吐口水时，用刮刀把唾液刮下来带给我。\n\n给我弄两份样本，我得用它作为药剂的基础。",dEN="Even at first glance, the sample you brought me shows obvious signs of some kind of corrosive spit. It would be a natural assumption that the same substance these worms use to burrow through the ground has allowed them a formidable weapon against the Ice Giants.\n\nTake this scraper and pick a fight with some of the worms. When they spit on you, use the scraper to remove it and bring it back to me.\n\nGet me a couple samples - I'm going to have to use it as the base for an elixir.",o="对自己使用佐特的刮刀，并收集2瓶腐蚀性的唾液。将你收集到的东西交给水晶裂痕内的佐特。",oEN="Collect 2 Vials of Corrosive Spit from the Jormungar by using the scraper on yourself. Bring the vials back to Zort in the Crystal Vice when your task is complete.",p="你肩上好像还留着些唾液，<race>。小心点，不然它会烧穿你的护甲。",pEN="You seem to still have some spit on your shoulder there, <race>. Be careful or it will burn right through your armor.",c="还很新鲜。等我一下，我马上就把它跟准备好的药剂剩余部分混合在一起",cEN="Still fresh. Just a moment and I will mix this with the rest of the elixir that I have prepared."}
Q[12077]={d="这种药剂可以保护你免受它们唾液的威胁。帮我把它交给科查尔，行吗？告诉他，我这里还有足够的储备，只要他能“报答”我，要多少都行。",dEN="This elixir should protect against their spit. Offer it to Ko'char for me, will you? Tell him there's plenty more where that came from if he'll return the favor.",o="将佐特准备好的药剂交给坚不可摧的科查尔。",oEN="Offer the elixir that Zort has prepared to Ko'char the Unbreakable.",p="我猜那个小矮子想要我替他作战。这点小心思……",pEN="The runt wants us to fight for him I assume. This is my surprise face.",c="我就直说了小家伙——我不相信这个混合物，而且我也不会使用它。留着吧……如果你比我更信任那个绿矮子，也许你用的着它。",cEN="I will be blunt little one - I do not trust this mixture, and I will not use it. Keep it... if you find more trust in the green runt than I do, perhaps it will be of use to you."}
Q[12078]={d="随他便好了。如果巨人不能成为盟友，那我们就只好去利用那些虫子了。这一带的冰虫肯定都是由地洞深处的母虫繁殖出来的。带上这只盒子，去抓3只小虫来给我。\n\n既然外交手段失败，改用奴役或许也不错。",dEN="So be it. If the giants will not come to our aid, perhaps we can make use of these worms. There are sure to be some spawn with their brood mother in the cavern below. Take this box and capture 3 of their spawn and bring them to me.\n\nWhere diplomacy fails, enslaving is a perfectly viable alternative.",o="进入水晶裂痕下方的洞穴，使用盒子抓捕3只冷心冰虫幼体。记得在冷心冰虫幼体钻进盒子之后拿起盒子！\n\n将你抓获的冷心冰虫幼体带回水晶裂痕，交给佐特。",oEN="Enter the caverns in Crystal Vice and trap 3 Jormungar Spawn inside sturdy crates. Be sure to pick the crates up after the Jormungar Spawn are trapped inside!\n\nBring the captured Jormungar Spawn back to Zort in the Crystal Vice.",p="你回来了！你捉到那些猛兽的幼崽了吗？我得离开这里……我感觉科查尔在几分钟之前就想着要把我踩扁。",pEN="You've returned! Do you have the beasts? I need to get out of here... I'm pretty sure Ko'char tried to step on me a few minutes ago.",c="这些很适合。也许当我把它们养成成虫之后，我会带它们回来，私底下介绍它们和巨人认识。\n\n一堆没用的臭石头。哦天呐，可不能让他们听到。",cEN="These will do nicely. Perhaps after I grow these beasts to full size, I will bring them back and introduce them to the giants personally.\n\nBunch of useless rocks if you ask me."}
Q[12079]={d="你好啊，$g小家伙:小家伙;。我不知道是什么疯狂念头让你来到水晶峡谷，但我欢迎你。\n\n那些冰虫……那些冰虫盯上了我的兄弟。在这种战争年代，我怀疑你不会觉得我的族人和善，但如果你是为对付虫子而来，那我愿意听你说。\n\n如果我们想夺回洞穴，就得先清空峡谷里的冰虫觅食者。加入战斗吧，$r！",dEN="Greetings little one. I know not what madness has brought you to the Crystal Vice, but you are welcome in my presence.\n\nThese ice worms... these jormungar have taken a taste to eating my brothers. I doubt you will find my kind friendly by any terms during this time of battle, but if you are here to help with the worms, then you have my ear.\n\nIf we are to take the cavern back, we must first clear the canyon of these jormungar feeders. Join us in battle, <race>!",o="坚不可摧的科查尔要求你进入水晶裂痕北部末端的洞穴，杀死8条冷心冰虫喂食者。",oEN="Delve into the cavern at the north end of the Crystal Vice and kill 8 Ice Heart Jormungar Feeders for Ko'char the Unbreakable.",p="战斗还在继续中，如果没带好消息来就不要打扰我，小家伙。",pEN="The battle persists, come with good news or leave me, little one.",c="这是个令人满意的杀戮成果。",cEN="A satisfying display of slaughter."}
Q[12080]={d="冰虫的产卵母虫住在下面的洞穴里。我们叫她响骨——这名字是瘟疫之地的一位冒险者给她起的。我只瞥见过她一眼，那时我正抵挡他们的第一波猛攻：她大得足以把我一口吞下。不把她赶出去，这洞穴就不会属于我们。",dEN="The jormungar have a spawnmother in the caverns below. We call her Rattlebore - a name that was gifted to her by an adventurer from the Plaguelands. I saw her only briefly as I was fighting off their initial onslaught - she is large enough to make even my icy bones shiver. This cavern will not be ours until she is removed from it.\n\nGather your friends and end this.",o="进入水晶裂痕底部的洞穴并杀死钻雪虫。如果你手中还有佐特的防护药剂，记得使用它来避免受到冰虫酸液的伤害。\n\n完成任务之后回去向坚不可摧的科查尔复命。",oEN="Enter the Ice Heart Cavern and slay Rattlebore. If it is still in your possession, be sure to use Zort's Protective Elixir to protect you from the Jormungar's corrosive spit.\n\nReturn to Ko'char the Unbreakable in the Crystal Vice when the task is complete.",p="我希望你带来的是好消息，小家伙。",pEN="It is my hope that you bring good tidings, little one.",c="这么说她死了。理应如此。你的意图确实比那矮子高尚。\n\n穿过北面的峡谷，你会找到水晶之歌森林。那是个被诅咒的险恶之地，<race>。如果那是你的下一个目的地，务必小心。\n\n小家伙:小家伙;，收下这个作为你辛劳的报酬，带着我的祝福离开这片纷争之地吧。",cEN="So she is dead. As it should be. Your intentions do indeed prove nobler than those of the runt.\n\nThrough the north canyon you will find Crystal Song Woods. It is a cursed and dangerous place, <race>. Should that be your next destination, proceed with caution.\n\nTake this for your efforts, little one, and leave this conflicted land with my blessing."}
Q[12081]={d="没有你的帮助，我们恐怕永远也无法逆转索尔莫丹的战势。这座古老的城市沦为岩石与大地之间的战场已经太久了，我只希望这次胜利能够使这里获得永久的宁静与和平。\n\n不过，铁矮人仍在利用他们的魔法俘虏与奴役我的同胞们。加弗洛克正在想办法解放那些符文巨人，还他们以自由。到那座名叫泰塞斯废墟的岛屿群找他吧，就在南面东风海岸中部的对面。",dEN="Without your help, we wouldn't have been able to turn the tide of the battle for Thor Modan. This ancient city has long been a battlefield between the forces of earth and stone. I can only hope we have silenced it for the last time.\n\nThe iron dwarves can still use their magic to capture and enslave my brothers. Gavrock is searching for a way to free the runed giants. Look for him on a small cluster of islands, called the Ruins of Tethys, off the central part of the Eastwind Shore to the south.",o="与泰塞斯废墟内的加弗洛克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gavrock at the Ruins of Tethys.",c="我知道库伦对你赞不绝口——收复索尔莫丹对我们来说是一项伟大的成就，但仍然无法彻底解救我们的兄弟。",cEN="I know Kurun is glad for your help. The defeat of Thor Modan will be a great achievement for us, but it will not free our brothers."}
Q[12082]={d="听着，$g孩子:孩子;。这里不是你玩耍的地方。\n\n我正准备逃跑。跟着我，我带你出去。",dEN="Listen, kid. This is no place for you to be playin' around.\n\nI'm about to make a break for it. Stick with me and I'll get you outta here.",o="护送哈里森离开达基尔金废墟，然后与哈考尔营地的哈考尔谈一谈。",oEN="Escort Harrison from Drakil'jin Ruins, then speak with Harkor at Harkor's Camp.",c="你和我们的好朋友完成了一趟冒险，是吗？\n\n这件事本身就是足够的奖赏了，但是，拿去——我很慷慨的。",cEN="So, yah survived a little adventure with our good friend, did yah?\n\nThat should be reward enough in itself, but here - I'm feelin' generous."}
Q[12083]={d="我相信一定存在更多的魔法焦点，每一处魔法焦点都依次改变着魔网能量的流向——尽管我们仍然不知道他们到底会把这些能量用到哪里去。\n\n我猜想你可以在东南面的罗萨洛尔森林上空找到另一个。当然，你需要再次找到控制它的家伙，拿到他们携带的控制设备，我相信每一个魔法焦点都有自己的控制设备。\n\n小心，$n，那片森林非常危险。",dEN="I'm convinced that there must be more of those foci, each of them in-turn redirecting the ley line energies. We still don't know precisely what they're doing with all of that power, though.\n\nMy guess is that you'll find another one atop the Lothalor Woodlands to the southeast. Once again you'll need to find the person in charge and take whatever controlling device they have in their possession as I'm sure that each focus has its own.\n\nBe careful, <name>, those woods are very dangerous.",o="夺取魔网能量焦点控制护符，用它从罗萨洛尔森林的的魔网能量线焦点中获取信息。\n\n然后返回群星之墓，向大法师茉德拉的影像复命。",oEN="Obtain the Ley Line Focus Control Amulet and use it to gain information from the Ley Line Focus in the Lothalor Woodlands.\n\nThen, return to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="你在树林里有何发现？",pEN="What did you find up in the woods?",c="他们用节点来强化力量？不合理啊——法师猎手没有那么强！\n\n这一定表示他们只有在导引魔网能量终端处使用魔法。\n\n若是要揭露真相并同时阻止他们，我们会需要更多的信息！",cEN="They're empowering their forces with it? That doesn't make any sense; the mage hunters aren't that powerful.\n\nThis must mean that they're only using the magic at the terminus of wherever they've redirected the ley line to.\n\nWe're going to need more information if we're to have a chance at finding and stopping them!"}
Q[12084]={d="我相信一定存在更多的魔法焦点，每一处魔法焦点都依次改变着魔网能量的流向——尽管我们仍然不知道他们到底会把这些能量用到哪里去。\n\n我猜想你可以在南面的罗萨洛尔森林上空找到另一个。当然，你需要再次找到控制它的家伙，拿到他们携带的控制设备，我相信每一个魔法焦点都有自己的控制设备。\n\n快点，$c。我感觉时间不多了。",dEN="I'm convinced that there must be more of those foci, each of them in-turn redirecting the ley line energies. We still don't know precisely what they're doing with all of that power, though.\n\nMy guess is that you'll find another one atop the Lothalor Woodlands to the south. Once again you'll need to find the person in charge and take whatever controlling device they have in their possession as I'm sure that each focus has its own.\n\nBe quick about your business, <class>. I feel that time may be running out.",o="夺取魔网能量焦点控制护符，用它从罗萨洛尔森林的的魔网能量线焦点中获取信息。\n\n然后返回阿格玛之锤，向大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像复命。",oEN="Obtain the Ley Line Focus Control Amulet and use it to gain information from the Ley Line Focus in the Lothalor Woodlands.\n\nThen, return to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="那些林地上方有什么发现吗？",pEN="What did you find up in those woods?",c="他们用节点来强化力量？一点也不合理——法师猎手没有那么强！\n\n这一定表示他们只有在导引魔网能量终端处使用魔法。\n\n若是要研究出他们的对策，我们会需要更多的信息！",cEN="They're empowering their forces with it? That doesn't make any sense at all; the mage hunters aren't that powerful!\n\nThis must mean that they're only using the magic at the terminus of wherever they've redirected the ley line to.\n\nWe're going to need more information if I'm to devise a plan to stop them!"}
Q[12085]={d="你在他长袍衬里发现了一封藏起来的信。信上写道：\n\n\"戴诺，\n\n塔津尼很抱歉不告而别。如果你正在读这封信，那说明我已经死了。\n\n他们威胁说如果我不从，就杀掉我全家，我被迫为玛里苟斯的军队效力。塔津尼不能让他们得逞！\n\n别为我担心，照顾好你的孩子们就行。我已经骗过了他们，正在内部搞破坏。\n\n我爱你，姐妹！\n\n塔津尼\"\n\n霸主阿格玛一定想看看这个！",dEN="You find a letter secreted in the lining of his robes. It reads:\n\n\"Deino,\n\nTa'zinni sorry for disappearing on ya. If you're reading this letter, then I be dead.\n\nI been forced to work for Malygos's armies under threat that the family would be killed if I didn't. Ta'zinni wasn't gonna let that happen!\n\nDon't worry about me, just keep your kids safe. I have them fooled and I'm sabotaging them from the inside.\n\nI love you, sistah!\n\nTa'zinni\"\n\nOverlord Agmar is sure to want to see this!",o="将塔辛尼中尉的信交给阿格玛之锤的阿格玛大王。",oEN="Deliver Lieutenant Ta'zinni's Letter to Overlord Agmar at Agmar's Hammer.",p="这是什么？你以为你可以寄信吗？\n\n所有的信都必须先经过我才行，我们之中有间谍和叛徒！\n\n<霸主迅速的打量你一番，你担心他是不是马上要格杀你。>\n\n很好，快把信交给我。但是，如果我对我读到的东西不满意，我会把你拿去喂座狼。\n\n<阿格玛狞笑着，同时，加迈克和拉科吐克转过头看着你，似乎你就是它们的下一餐。>",pEN="What's this? You think you're going to mail a letter?\n\nAll mail goes through me first. There are spies and traitors amongst us!\n\n<The overlord gives you the once over and you wonder if he's going to have you killed on the spot.>\n\nVery well, be quick about it. But if I don't like what I read, I'm going to feed you to my worgs.\n\n<Agmar grins as both Gar'mak and Lak'tuk turn and look at you like you're their next meal.>",c="啊哈哈哈哈……呜呜，真感人。\n\n<霸主低沉笑声中的居高临下之意显而易见。>\n\n我说什么来着？叛徒！不过，我很久以前就认识戴诺。她至少是个有荣誉的巨魔！\n\n我会安排让她知道自己兄弟出了什么事。我甚至会忘记告诉她，杀他的人就是你。\n\n<阿格玛用算计的目光盯着你。>\n\n但现在你归我所有了，<class>！",cEN="Ahahahaha... boo hoo, how touching.\n\n<The condescension in the overlord's deep-throated laughter is palpable.>\n\nWhat did I say? Traitors! Still, I knew Deino once upon a time. She at least is a troll with honor!\n\nI'll see to it that she finds out what happened to her brother. I'll even forget to tell her that you're the one that killed him.\n\n<Agmar fixes you with a calculated stare.>\n\nBut I own you now, <class>!"}
Q[12086]={d="你要找的那个人一路向东去了，走了很远，一直到了乌努比东边的一处海边营地，那地方被称为死亡营地。\n\n如果你要去找他的话，可千万要小心，$n。他佩带着死者的守护之神卡库特的印记。",dEN="The man you seek went far to the east, to a place near the coast called Death's Stand, beyond Unu'pe.\n\nBe careful if you go in search of him, <name>. He bore the mark of Karkut... he who watches over the dead.",o="转至乌努比东边的死亡营地。",oEN="Go east to Death's Stand, just beyond Unu'pe.",c="萨萨里安？是的，他曾待过这里……你想知道什么？我们现在有个更紧迫的问题，我的朋友。",cEN="Thassarian? Yeah he was here... what of it? We have more pressing problems right now, my friend."}
Q[12088]={d="那么，$n，你帮了我们一个大忙……所谓滴水之恩当涌泉相报，我一定也得帮上你的忙，这才叫公平。\n\n你是在找萨萨里安吗？他今天早上就失踪了。我们猜他冲到北边的悲叹通灵塔去了。要不是我们曾经一起并肩作战过，我们真要把他当成叛徒了。\n\n知道么，他是个死亡骑士……呃，我知道他现在站在我们这边……但不久之前他们还是阿尔萨斯的仆从。\n\n不过……萨萨里安绝对是个好人。快去悲叹通灵塔吧，看看他怎么样了。",dEN="Well, <name>, you helped us out... so I figure it's only fair that we help you out as well.\n\nYou're looking for Thassarian? He disappeared this morning. We think he went off north to the Wailing Ziggurat. If we hadn't fought side by side by him we'd even think he was a traitor.\n\nSee, he's a Death Knight... and I know they're on our side and all... but it wasn't too long ago they were servants of Arthas.\n\nBut not Thassarian, he's a good guy. Go to the Wailing Ziggurat, see if he's doing okay.",o="进入死亡营地北方的悲叹通灵塔，寻找萨萨里安。",oEN="Look for Thassarian inside the Wailing Ziggurat, north of Death's Stand.",c="莱瑞莎……她在找我？你必须帮我，<name>。我们必须在她受伤之前了结这件事。",cEN="Leryssa... is looking for me? You must help me, <name>. We must finish this before she gets hurt."}
Q[12089]={d="阿格玛大王敕晓：\n\n通缉目标：魔导师凯尔多努斯\n\n罪名：通敌叛国\n\n状态：有效\n\n前阿格玛之锤的法师指挥官之一的魔导师凯尔多努斯，当前已被部落军事法庭判处死刑。即日起，任何发现他的人可以立即代执行。\n\n根据军方记录显示，凯尔多努斯最后一次被发现时，正向西南方的眠月花园逃窜并试图加入蓝龙军团。\n\n接近凯尔多努斯时请务必慎重，他是一名强大的施法者，切勿单独与之战斗。\n\n全部赏金将在阿格玛之锤的高尔特上尉处兑现。",dEN="By decree of Overlord Agmar:\n\nTarget: Magister Keldonus\n\nCrime: Treason\n\nStatus: Alive\n\nMagister Keldonus, once mage commander of Agmar's Hammer, is to be killed on sight in the name of the Horde.\n\nKeldonus was last seen traveling southwest towards Moonrest Gardens to join the Blue Dragonflight in their campaign against magic.\n\nApproach with caution as Keldonus is a powerful magus. Do not engage solo!\n\nAll bounties are paid out by Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",o="杀死魔导师凯尔多努斯，然后返回龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，向高尔特上尉复命。",oEN="Slay Magister Keldonus and return to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight.",p="你来领赏的吗？",pEN="Come to collect on a bounty?",c="他不是第一个背叛我们的娘娘腔法师，当然，他也不会是最后一个。但可耻的是……他是我们最厉害的法师。他可以召出一顿让你垂涎三尺回味再三的佳肴……\n\n啐！",cEN="He wasn't the first of those sissy spell casters to betray us, and he certainly won't be the last. Damned shame, too... He was one of our best mages. He'd summon a buffet that would make your mouth water and your heart jump for joy...\n\nBAH!"}
Q[12090]={d="奉霸主阿格玛之命：\n\n目标：巨兽人\n\n罪名：袭击部落；\"长得丑\"\n\n状态：存活\n\n猛犸领主巨兽人因多起袭击龙骨荒野部落士兵与设施的事件而被通缉。\n\n最后一次有人看见巨兽人在阿格玛之锤东南偏南的森林与道路上游荡。\n\n应视巨兽人为持有武器且极度危险。\n\n所有赏金均由阿格玛之锤的戈特上尉发放。",dEN="By decree of Overlord Agmar:\n\nTarget: Gigantaur\n\nCrime: Attacks upon the Horde; \"Bein' ugly\"\n\nStatus: Alive\n\nThe magnataur lord, Gigantaur, is wanted in relation to a number of attacks against Horde soldiers and installations in the Dragonblight.\n\nGigantaur was last seen wandering the woods and roads south by southeast of Agmar's Hammer.\n\nGigantaur should be considered armed and extremely dangerous. Do not engage solo!\n\nAll bounties are paid out by Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",o="杀死巨兽人，然后回到龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的戈特上尉那里。|n",oEN="Slay Gigantaur and return to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight.",p="你来领赏的吗？",pEN="Come to collect on a bounty?",c="你逮到那个丑八怪马脸了？啊……我们的士兵们在这片冰冻荒原上总算少一件麻烦事要应付了。",cEN="You got that ugly son-of-a-horse, eh? Well that's one less nuisance our soldiers will have to deal with out in the frozen wastes."}
Q[12091]={d="阿格玛大王敕晓：\n\n通缉目标：恐怖之爪\n\n罪名：袭击部落\n\n状态：有效\n\n恐怖之爪因涉嫌多次袭击部落往来于本地与怨毒镇之间的车队而被通缉。\n\n恐怖之爪当前在阿格玛之锤以东一处可以俯瞰到红玉巨龙圣地的地区筑有巢穴。它非常危险，接近时候务必谨慎小心，切勿单独与之战斗。\n\n全部赏金将在阿格玛之锤的高尔特上尉处兑现。",dEN="By decree of Overlord Agmar:\n\nTarget: Dreadtalon\n\nCrime: Attacks upon the Horde\n\nStatus: Alive\n\nDreadtalon is wanted for numerous attacks upon Horde caravans traveling to and from Venomspite.\n\nDreadtalon makes his home on a bluff overlooking the Ruby Dragonshrine, east of Agmar's Hammer. He should be approached with extreme caution. Do not engage solo!\n\nAll bounties are paid out by Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",o="杀死恐怖之爪，然后返回龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，向高尔特上尉复命。",oEN="Slay Dreadtalon and return to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight.",p="你来领赏的吗？",pEN="Come to collect on a bounty?",c="早该有人制止那头肮脏畜生的杀戮了！干得好，<name>。",cEN="About time someone put a stop to that filthy beast's killing spree! A job well done, <name>."}
Q[12092]={d="并不是只有$r才受到了蓝龙军团所作所为的影响，东南面罗萨洛尔森林中的古树也是受害者。\n\n其中有一些已经受到了感染——你无论如何也要避开它们——但大部分仍然还有救。不过，森林里的树人似乎没有被渗透在这片大陆上的魔力和随之而生的奥术浮龙所影响。\n\n去问树人要一些它们身上的树皮，把它交给古树。希望这样可以拯救它们。",dEN="It's not only the <race> race that has been impacted by what the blue dragonflight forces have done. The ancients of the Lothalor Woods to the southeast have been affected as well.\n\nSome have been corrupted-- avoid them at all costs--but most can still be saved. However, the treants of the woods seem to be immune to the magic seeping through the land and the arcane wyrms that have come with it.\n\nAsk the treants for their bark and feed it to the ancients. Hopefully that will be enough to save them.",o="使用树人的树皮让3个罗萨洛尔古树恢复力量，然后向群星之墓的萨蕾德亚娜复命。",oEN="Use the Bark of the Walkers to strengthen 3 Lothalor Ancients and then return to Sarendryana at Stars' Rest.",p="拯救古树的一个额外好处，或许是他们愿意考虑帮助联盟度过难关。无论如何，这都是正确的事。\n\n那么，你成功强化了多少棵，<class>？",pEN="An added benefit of saving the ancients may turn out that they will consider assisting the Alliance with its hardships. Regardless, it is the right thing to do.\n\nNow, how many were you able to strengthen, <class>?",c="谢谢你，<race>！我们已经失去太多了。你确保了我们不会失去诺森德最雄伟的子女。\n\n我很快就动身去和那些你救下的古树谈谈，看看他们是否愿意在我们危难之时相助。",cEN="Thank you, <race>! We've lost so much already. You've ensured that we won't lose the most majestic of Northrend's children.\n\nI'll soon leave to speak with the ancients you saved and see if they will help us in our time of need."}
Q[12093]={d="即使库伦攻下了索尔莫丹，那些铁矮人仍然可以用那种该死的符文魔法对付我们的兄弟。他们的做法是这样的，首先将我的兄弟们从泥土中召唤出来，接着趁他们懵懂之际直接通过符文进行束缚，然后逼迫他们与同为岩石之子的我们作战。\n\n他们用于召唤和束缚的压制符文就矗立在东风海岸沿岸，被奴役的兄弟们也是从那里被送向北边战场去的。\n\n找到这四处压制符文，杀死每个符文法阵周围全部的织魔者，这样这四处符文法阵的工头就会被你引诱出来。干掉他们。没有了工头，符文法阵就只是废物而已了。",dEN="Even as Kurun attacks Thor Modan, the iron dwarves work their magics against our brothers. Summoning our brothers from the earth, then binding them with runes, the sons of iron force them to war against the children of stone.\n\nAlong the Eastwind Shore, they use runes of compulsion to send enslaved giants to the battlefields of the north.\n\nFind the four runes of compulsion and force their overseers to appear by defeating the rune-weavers who man each rune. Without the overseers, the runes are useless.",o="泰塞斯废墟内的加弗洛克要求你通过击败工头多瓦尔、工头库尔甘、工头洛克里和工头布隆诺的方式中和全部四处压制符文。",oEN="Gavrock, at the Ruins of Tethys, wants you to neutralize the four Runes of Compulsion by defeating Overseer Durval, Overseer Korgan, Overseer Lochli, and Overseer Brunon.",p="你消除那些符文的效力了吗？",pEN="Have you neutralized the runes on the coast?",c="很好。现在我们要尽快行动，趁那些铁矮人还没发现他们符文已经被解除了。",cEN="Good. Now, we must act swiftly, before the sons of iron realize that their runes have been rendered harmless."}
Q[12094]={d="压制符文已经全部停止运转，我想，解放那些符文巨人的机会来了。\n\n拿着这块石头，朋友。它是在我诞生时从我身上分离出来的一部分，如果向石头中正确地灌入能量，它完全可以解放那些被束缚的巨人。\n\n我要你找到三块远古巨石，其中两块位于铁铸之路和林边哨站之间——用你们的语言来解释，就是所谓魔网能量线的交汇点。另一块位于这片废墟最南端的一座岛屿上，转至每一块巨石，为这块碎片充能吧。",dEN="While the runes of compulsion are dormant, there is a chance we can release the runed giants.\n\nI will give you a piece of stone that has been part of me since my creation. If properly imbued, it can be used to free the bound giants.\n\nTwo ancient stone markers sit atop places of power between the Path of Iron and the forest's edge -- locations your people would call the intersections of ley lines. The other is on an island at the southern end of these ruins. Charge the shard at each stone and return.",o="分别在第一块远古巨石、第二块远古巨石和第三块远古巨石为加弗洛克碎片充能，然后向泰塞斯废墟内的加弗洛克复命。",oEN="Charge the Shard of Gavrock at the First Ancient Stone, the Second Ancient Stone, and the Third Ancient Stone, then return to Gavrock at the Ruins of Tethys.",p="你找到远古巨石了吗？",pEN="Did you find the ancient stones?",c="我可以检测到你灌注在碎片中的能量，我希望这足以打破符文魔法。",cEN="I can detect the power you've imbued in the shard and I hope it will be enough to break the runic magic."}
Q[12095]={d="这里东边的龙骨荒野核心地带，是一片除了巨龙的骸骨与皑皑白雪之外什么都没有的真正“荒野”。天灾军团在这片苔原地带的中央设立了数个营地，而且还在那里复活冰霜巨龙，以袭击我们驻扎在天灾之门的军队。虽然洛坎和他的狩龙小队能够对付大多数的冰霜巨龙，但其中有一只最为强大的给他们造成了巨大的麻烦。\n\n立刻转至东北方的猎龙营地找到洛坎，帮助他和他的手下消灭萨拉斯塔。你将因此而获得巨额奖赏！",dEN="East of here, in the heart of the Dragonblight, is a field full of nothing but dragon bones and snow. The Scourge have set up multiple camps in the central tundra and are raising frostwyrms to send against our forces at the Wrathgate. While most of these frostwyrms are easily dealt with by Rokhan and his dragon hunters, one of them is proving to be a bit problematic.\n\nGo northeast and seek out Rokhan at Dragon's Fall. Help him and his men put down Sarathstra and you'll be rewarded handsomely!",o="转至龙骨荒野的猎龙营地，与洛坎谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Rokhan at Dragon's Fall in the Dragonblight.",c="你为什么觉得你可以做成洛坎都失败的事呢？",cEN="What make you tink dat you succeed where Rokhan fail?"}
Q[12096]={d="南面罗萨洛尔森林中的古树被奥术浮龙感染了……那里现在到处都是浮龙！\n\n已经被感染了的那些古树非常危险，而且对我们来说毫无用处，但大多数还有救。幸运的是，森林里的树人似乎没有受到任何不利影响。\n\n去问树人要一些它们身上的树皮，然后把树皮交给古树们。这应该能让它们恢复力量。\n\n快去吧！我还要盯着这些药剂师呢。",dEN="The ancients of the Lothalor Woods to the south are being corrupted by arcane wyrms... wyrms which have risen out of the ground!\n\nThose that are already corrupted are deadly and of no use to us, but most can still be saved. Luckily, the treants of the woods seem to be immune to everything happening up there.\n\nAsk the treants for their bark and when you get some, feed it to the ancients. This should strengthen them.\n\nNow leave me to my business! I have to keep an eye on these apothecaries.",o="使用树人的树皮让3个罗萨洛尔古树恢复力量，然后向阿格玛之锤的大地看守者格莱弗复命。",oEN="Use the Bark of the Walkers to strengthen 3 Lothalor Ancients and then return to Earthwarden Grife at Agmar's Hammer.",p="如果我们能赶在群星之墓的树妖和暗夜向导之前拯救这些古树，也许他们会愿意和部落结盟。\n\n起码在攻击我们之前会三思而行。\n\n你已经救了多少？",pEN="If we can save the ancients before the dryads and night elves of Stars' Rest, perhaps they will consider allying with the Horde.\n\nOr at least, perhaps they'll think twice about attacking us.\n\nNow, how many have you managed to save so far?",c="我感谢你，<class>。\n\n等我观察完这些恶心的药剂师在搞什么名堂，就前往森林，看能否说服这些古树站在我们这边。\n\n实在不行，我也要说服他们别攻击救了他们的人！",cEN="You have my thanks, <class>.\n\nAs soon as I am done observing what these disgusting apothecaries are up to, I'll head to the woods and see if I can convince these ancients to side with us.\n\nOr, if nothing else, I'll convince them not to attack those that saved them!"}
Q[12097]={d="我的猎手不是死了就是被冻住了，$n。你还想干这事吗？只要你说一声，我就再把那条龙叫来。\n\n如果你杀了它，就把那畜生的冰冻之心带回阿格玛之锤，交给戈特。他肯定会好好赏你，$g伙计:伙计;。",dEN="Me hunters be dead or frozen, <name>. Just you and whatever allies you bring wit ya is all da help you get. You still want to do dis? Just say da word and me call for da dragon once more.\n\nIf ya kill it, take da beast's frozen heart back to Agmar's Hammer and present it to Gort. He sure to reward you good, mon.",o="与猎龙营地的洛坎交谈，让他将冰霜巨龙萨拉斯塔召唤下来。\n\n杀死萨拉斯塔，并将萨拉斯塔的冰冻之心交给阿格玛之锤的高尔特上尉。",oEN="Speak with Rokhan to call down the frostwyrm, Sarathstra.\n\nKill Sarathstra and deliver Sarathstra's Frozen Heart to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",p="<高尔特似乎很惊讶。>\n\n这么快就回来了？",pEN="<Gort raises an eyebrow.>\n\nBack so soon?",c="哈！你做到了！愤怒之门的士兵们欠你一份人情，<name>！这肯定能让他们中的一些人再多活一天。",cEN="HA! You did it! The soldiers at the Wrathgate are indebted to you, <name>! This'll surely buy a few of them another day above ground."}
Q[12098]={d="我相信你一定可以在东南面的因度雷村的某处找到下一个魔法焦点。但问题是，我们完全没有收到任何关于那里是否存在魔法焦点的报告。\n\n如果你愿意的话，请转至因度雷村调查魔法焦点的痕迹，或者调查那个本地中的法师猎手部队和他们的指挥官。\n\n对了，如果有必要的话，不要忘记搜查一下湖底。",dEN="I'm certain that you'll find the next ley line focus somewhere in the remains of Indu'le Village to the southeast. The problem is, we've had absolutely no reports of there being one there.\n\nIf you would, please investigate the village for any signs of the focus or the mage hunters and their commander in the area.\n\nDon't forget to search in the lake if you have to.",o="在因度雷村和因度雷湖寻找法师猎手部队的指挥官。",oEN="Search for the commander of the mage hunter forces at Indu'le Village and Lake Indu'le.",c="你找到了法师猎手指挥官的尸体。\n\n根据外观以及他周围的士兵情状来判断，你猜他们并不是溺死的，而是，当他们召唤节点的时候，并没有料到元素会从湖床的裂缝袭击过来。\n\n看来法师猎手们亲手导致了自己的死亡。",cEN="You find the corpse of the mage hunter commander here.\n\nJudging by his appearance, and the condition of the forces around him, you would guess that they didn't drown. Rather, when they summoned the focus in, they didn't expect the elementals that arose from the rents in the lake bed to attack.\n\nIt would appear that the mage hunter forces were the architects of their own demise."}
Q[12099]={d="这块你充能过的岩石碎片应该足以打破那些束缚着兄弟们的符文魔法了。\n\n带上它，到东风海岸北边去寻找那些符文巨人，在他们面前释放出岩石中存储的能量，然后看看结果吧。\n\n如果确实有效的话，那些符文巨人应该会立刻恢复意识，并摆脱铁矮人的控制。如果没有用，巨人恐怕仍然会攻击你，不过他们的力量会被削弱许多。不过话说回来，如果真的无效，那时我们又该怎么办？总之，无论如何得先尝试一下，如果我们只是袖手旁观，他们就将永远被奴役在绝望之中。",dEN="The rock shard you imbued should be powerful enough to break the runic magic binding my brothers.\n\nTake it with you and find the runed giants walking north along the Eastwind Shore. Unleash the power stored in the stone and observe the results.\n\nIf it works, the runed giants should return to their senses and stop obeying the iron dwarves. If the stone fails to work, the giants may attack in a weakened state. But, what choice do we have? If we do not try, they will remain enslaved without hope.",o="使用加弗洛克的符文碎裂之石解救4名符文巨人，然后向泰塞斯废墟内的加弗洛克复命。",oEN="Use Gavrock's Runebreaker to free 4 Runed Giants, then return to Gavrock at the Ruins of Tethys.",p="你成功地解救我的兄弟了吗？",pEN="Were you able to free any of my brothers?",c="所以这事还说不准？我希望这不是碰运气的事，但至少我们走对了路。没有你的帮助，这根本不可能办到。如果你进一步了解到铁矮人的阴谋以及他们对石之子的图谋，就来找我们，我们会听你说，<name>。",cEN="So it's an uncertain thing? I wish it was not a matter of chance, but at least we're on the right path. Without your help, this wouldn't have ever been possible. Should you learn any more about the machinations of the iron dwarves and their plans toward the children of stone, seek us out and we will hear you, <name>."}
Q[12100]={d="伴随天灾军团而来还有死亡和疾病。在天灾军团肆虐之地，野生动物根本不能抵御蔓延的疾病，逐渐在腐烂中痛苦地死去。等我们察觉到事态的严重性时已经晚了。\n\n龙骨荒野的大多数动物都难逃此劫。它们被天灾军团带来的疾病所感染，体表开始溃烂，性子也变得格外暴躁。\n\n你必须转至西边的纳尔苏深渊，杀死已经被感染的野生动物。从它们的尸体上找到一个完好无损的器官，这样我们或许能研制出根治这场瘟疫的疫苗。",dEN="With Scourge comes death and disease. We often overlook that the wildlife of a Scourge infested area is ravaged and ultimately destroyed by rot and contagion.\n\nFor most of the indigenous beasts of the Dragonblight it is too late. The festering disease that the Scourge brings has already infected the beasts and they are now rabid and rotting.\n\nYou must venture west, towards the Pit of Narjun, and cull the infected wildlife. Check their corpses for a preserved organ as we need one to devise a vaccine.",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的索艾·鹰怒要你杀死15只被感染的野生动物，并取回一个防腐内脏。",oEN="Soar Hawkfury at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to kill 15 Infected Wildlife and recover a Rot Resistant Organ.",p="杀死那些野兽以防病情扩散，并带给我一份防腐内脏。",pEN="Kill the beasts to prevent the spread and bring me a rot resistant organ.",c="杀死动物对我来说很痛苦，但这是非得付出不可的努力。现在让我们进行下一个步骤:接种疫苗。",cEN="It pains me to put animals down, but it is a service that must be performed. Now we must move on to the next step: Inoculation."}
Q[12101]={d="被遗忘者指派了多名医术精湛的药剂师来到天灾之门，帮助我们抵御天灾军团。其中一位名叫辛塔尔·玛菲奥斯博士的药剂师对如何阻止天灾瘟疫散播很有研究。之前，我和他就野生动物疫苗的事情交谈过，他说配制疫苗需要一个未被感染的器官。\n\n将这个防腐内脏交给辛塔尔·玛菲奥斯博士，他会告诉你接下来该做什么的。",dEN="Our Forsaken allies have sent their apothecary core here to assist us in destroying the Scourge at the Wrathgate. One among them, Doctor Sintar Malefious, is well versed in the Scourge rot and methods of containing the spread. I had previously worked out a deal with him in regards to devising a vaccine for wildlife. He's since been waiting on the organ.\n\nDeliver this rot resistant organ to Dr. Malefious and let him know it's from me. He'll direct you on your next task.",o="把抗腐器官交给阿格玛之锤的辛塔尔·马勒菲乌斯医生。|n",oEN="Deliver the Rot Resistant Organ to Doctor Sintar Malefious at Agmar's Hammer.",p="干什么？",pEN="What now?",c="那个笨手笨脚的牛头人真的弄到了抗腐器官？可恶……我本以为那任务能让他那畸形的脑子忙到下一个千年。\n\n好吧，拿来吧，<boy/girl>。我有很多事要做，没工夫让你那些微不足道的需求碍事。",cEN="The oafish man-cow actually acquired a rot resistant organ? Curses... I was certain that task would keep his malformed mind occupied well into the next millennium.\n\nWell give it here, <boy/girl>. I have much to do without your feeble needs getting in the way."}
Q[12102]={d="红玉巨龙圣地就在东边，真是太幸运了。那里生长着一种名叫红玉丁香的植株。我需要它做药引来配制疫苗，使那些尚未被传染的野生动物免受瘟疫的滋扰。\n\n转至东边的红玉巨龙圣地寻找这种丁香花吧。\n\n记住：在这片被诅咒的冰封之地，所有的巨龙圣地都有天灾军团在肆虐。千万要当心，我们可不想让你变成灰烬之龙的腹中餐。\n\n<辛塔尔哈哈大笑。>",dEN="How fortuitous it is that the Ruby Dragonshrine lays just to the east. It is there that you will find a flower called the ruby lilac. This lifegiving plant is all that I need to concoct a vaccine for the untainted beasts of this region.\n\nTravel east and search the Ruby Dragonshrine for the lilac.\n\nJust one thing: The dragonshrine, like all the dragonshrines in this blasted wasteland, is beset by the Scourge. Watch your step. We wouldn't want you to be devoured by an emberwyrm.\n\n<Sintar laughs.>",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的辛塔尔·玛菲奥斯博士要你采集一株红玉丁香。",oEN="Doctor Sintar Malefious at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to collect 1 Ruby Lilac.",p="你拿到红玉丁香了吗？",pEN="Do you have the ruby lilac?",c="并不是那么难嘛，对不对？\n\n给我一点时间准备疫苗……",cEN="That wasn't so difficult, now was it?\n\nNow give me a moment to prepare the vaccine."}
Q[12104]={d="<玛菲奥斯将一瓶黑糊糊的液体递给你。>\n\n$r，就是它了。把它带回去交给那牛头人吧，告诉他我欠他的人情就算还清了。咱们“扯平”了。\n\n你可以走了，不然我就叫杰宁斯赶你。",dEN="<Doctor Malefious hands you a vial full of murky liquid.>\n\nHere you are then, <race>. Take this back to the cow and let him know that all debts have been paid. We are officially \"square.\"\n\nNow leave me before I set Jennings upon you.",o="将辛塔尔的疫苗交给阿格玛之锤的索艾·鹰怒。",oEN="Deliver Sintar's Vaccine to Soar Hawkfury at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你拿到疫苗了吗？",pEN="Have you got the vaccine?",c="<索艾把瓶子举向天空查看瓶子里的内容物。>\n\n现在只剩一件事要做。",cEN="<Soar holds the vial up to the sky and examines its contents.>\n\nOnly one thing left to do now."}
Q[12105]={d="这本日记出自银溪镇一位名叫米哈伊尔的居民之手。里面详细记载了一群名为\"狼教\"的暗影崇拜者的到来。\n\n起初，村民们不愿接纳这个教派，但镇民中逐渐有人成了同情者。\n\n米哈伊尔为此不安，在试图说服其他村民的同时，把女儿萨莎送离了银溪镇。\n\n米哈伊尔最后的记录提到，当地镇上的首领们为商讨空石矿坑中某些不明事件而召开了一次会议。",dEN="The journal was written by a denizen of Silverbrook named Mikhail. It details the arrival of a shadow-worshipping group called the \"wolfcult.\"\n\nThe villagers were reluctant to embrace the cult at first, but sympathizers sprung up gradually among town residents.\n\nUnsettled by this, Mikhail sent his daughter Sasha away from Silverbrook while he attempted to reason with the other villagers.\n\nMikhail's last entry mentions a meeting of local town leaders to discuss unspecified events in Hollowstone Mine.",o="将米克哈尔的日记交给琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉。",oEN="Bring Mikhail's Journal to Lieutenant Dumont in Amberpine Lodge.",p="你手上拿的是什么？",pEN="What's that you've got there?",c="我怀疑，这不只是一个单纯对我们抱有敌意的小镇。\n\n我们在空石矿洞布有人力，我们乐意去做些调查。",cEN="I imagined there would be more to this than just an isolated town of hostiles.\n\nWe have men near Hollowstone Mine, perhaps it would be in our interest to do a little research."}
Q[12106]={d="我相信你一定可以在东南面的因度雷村的某处找到下一个魔法焦点。但问题是，我们完全没有收到任何关于那里是否存在魔法焦点的报告。\n\n如果你愿意的话，请转至因度雷村调查魔法焦点的痕迹，或者调查那个本地中的法师猎手部队和他们的指挥官。\n\n对了，如果有必要的话，不要忘记搜查一下湖底。",dEN="I'm certain that you'll find the next ley line focus somewhere in the remains of Indu'le Village to the southeast. The problem is, I've had absolutely no reports of there being one there.\n\nI need you to go investigate the village for any signs of the focus or the mage hunters and their commander in the area.\n\nSearch in the lake if you have to!",o="在因度雷村和因度雷湖寻找法师猎手部队的指挥官。",oEN="Search for the commander of the mage hunter forces at Indu'le Village and Lake Indu'le.",c="你在这找到了法师猎手指挥官的尸体。\n\n从他的面容、以及他身边的力量研判，你猜他们并非溺毙，而是当他们向节点召唤时，他们没料到从湖床裂缝中生起的元素会向他们攻击。\n\n显然，法师猎手势力自取灭亡。",cEN="You find the corpse of the mage hunter commander here.\n\nJudging by his appearance, and the condition of the forces around him, you would guess that they didn't drown. Rather, when they summoned the focus in, they didn't expect the elementals that arose from the rents in the lake bed to attack.\n\nIt would appear that the mage hunter forces were the architects of their own demise."}
Q[12107]={d="你在他的法袍内发现了两件东西。\n\n一只护符，很明显这是一个魔网焦点控制设备。而另一件则是某个名叫希达苟斯的家伙发布的一组命令，看来这个希达苟斯应该是眠月花园事件的幕后主使。\n\n湿透的羊皮卷上写着，他正准备将所有的法师猎手部队转移到东面的碧蓝巨龙圣地去。\n\n也许你应该先从魔网焦点处收集一些信息，然后转至东面的碧蓝巨龙圣地，从西侧展开调查。",dEN="Within his robes you find two things of interest.\n\nOne is a talisman, which is clearly a focus controlling device. The other is a set of orders from someone named Sidragos, which were ultimately intended for the leader back at the Moonrest Gardens.\n\nThe water-soaked parchment informs Goramosh that he is to move all mage hunter forces east to the Azure Dragonshrine.\n\nPerhaps you should get what information you can from the focus and head east to observe the dragonshrine from its western ledge.",o="使用魔网能量焦点控制饰品从因度雷湖底的魔网能量焦点处收集信息。然后往东抵达龙骨荒野中南部的碧蓝巨龙圣地，从圣地西侧展开调查。\n\n完成任务后返回群星之墓，向大法师茉德拉的影像复命。",oEN="Use the Ley Line Focus Control Talisman to gain information from the Ley Line Focus under Lake Indu'le. Then, head east to the Azure Dragonshrine near south central Dragonblight and observe what is occurring there from the western ledge.\n\nAfterward, return to the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest.",p="什么事，<name>？你看起来满脸通红。\n\n歇一会儿，喘口气吧。",pEN="What is it, <name>? You look flushed.\n\nTake a moment to catch your breath.",c="什么？！\n\n<你眼前的影像扭曲了一会儿，大法师试图保持镇定。>\n\n当然，我们早该想到这是他们的企图。快，不要浪费时间。\n\n要有人去警告龙眠神殿！",cEN="WHAT?!\n\n<The image before you distorts for a moment as the archmage attempts to regain her composure.>\n\nOf course, we should have guessed that this was what they were up to all along. Quickly, there's no time to waste.\n\nWyrmrest must be warned!"}
Q[12109]={d="月溪旅的小伙子们一直在东边那里进行侦查，应该是在寻找北上的路。他们还有一个使命就是确保附近的战略资源不落入敌手，因此，我觉得他们肯定不会介意我们调查一下矿洞里的状况。\n\n立刻到东北方的月溪旅营地去找格里安·斯托曼。如果你在西部荒野呆过的话，也许还记得他吧。把我刚才跟你说的话一字不漏地转述给他。\n\n他肯定会非常高兴能把你派去回收这处仍有出产的矿洞。",dEN="The Westfall boys were sent east to look for a path into the northern territories. Their secondary objective is to secure strategic resource points, so I'm sure they wouldn't mind investigating a mine.\n\nLook for the Westfall Brigade encampment far to the northeast and seek out Gryan Stoutmantle. You might remember him if you ever spent any time in Westfall. Make sure to tell him I sent you.\n\nHe'll be more than happy to let you claim a functioning mine for the king.",o="与月溪旅营地的格里安·斯托曼谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Captain Gryan Stoutmantle at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",c="杜蒙特派你来的吗？很好，让我们见识一下你能帮我们什么忙。",cEN="Dumont sent you? Very well. Let's see what you can do for us."}
Q[12110]={d="你在他的法袍内发现了两件东西。\n\n一只护符，很明显这是一个魔网焦点控制设备。而另一件则是某个名叫希达苟斯的家伙发布的一组命令，看来这个希达苟斯应该是眠月花园事件的幕后主使。\n\n湿透的羊皮卷上写着，他正准备将所有的法师猎手部队转移到东面的碧蓝巨龙圣地去。\n\n也许你应该先从魔网焦点处收集一些信息，然后转至东面的碧蓝巨龙圣地，在它的西侧展开调查。",dEN="Within his robes you find two things of interest.\n\nOne is a talisman, which is clearly a focus controlling device. The other is a set of orders from someone named Sidragos, which were ultimately intended for the leader back at the Moonrest Gardens.\n\nThe fragile water-soaked parchment informs Goramosh that he is to move all mage hunter forces east to the Azure Dragonshrine.\n\nPerhaps you should get what information you can from the focus and head east to observe the dragonshrine from its western ledge.",o="使用魔网能量焦点控制饰品从因度雷湖底的魔网能量焦点处收集信息。然后向东走，转至龙骨荒野中南部本地的碧蓝巨龙圣地，在那里的西侧进行调查。\n\n完成调查之后，回到龙骨荒野的阿格玛之锤，向大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像复命。",oEN="Use the Ley Line Focus Control Talisman to gain information from the Ley Line Focus under Lake Indu'le. Then, head east to the Azure Dragonshrine near south central Dragonblight and observe what is occurring there from the western ledge\n\nAfterward, return to the Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer.",p="什么事，<name>？你看起来满脸通红。\n\n歇一会儿，喘口气吧。",pEN="What is it, <name>? You look flushed.\n\nTake a moment to catch your breath.",c="什么？！\n\n<你眼前的影像扭曲了一会儿，大法师试图保持镇定。>\n\n当然，我们早该想到这是他们的企图。快，不要浪费时间。\n\n要有人去警告龙眠神殿！",cEN="WHAT?!\n\n<The image before you distorts for a moment as the archmage attempts to regain her composure.>\n\nOf course, we should have guessed that this was what they were up to all along. Quickly, there's no time to waste.\n\nWyrmrest must be warned!"}
Q[12111]={d="这个包裹里有几瓶装着辛塔尔研制的疫苗的药瓶。现在我要你去附近的森林里寻找落雪麋鹿和北极灰熊。找到那些动物后，站到安全距离，朝它们的大致方向扔出一瓶。瓶子会碎裂，释放出细密的瓦斯，充当接种剂。那些野兽只要踏进瓦斯范围，就会接种疫苗，最终得救。\n\n尽可能多地给野兽接种，然后回来见我。|n",dEN="Inside this pack are several vials containing the vaccine that Sintar created. I now want you to search the nearby woods for Snowfall elk and arctic grizzlies. When you locate the animals, find a safe distance and throw a vial in their general direction. The vial will shatter and release a fine gas that will act as the inoculating agent. The beasts merely have to step inside the gas and they will be vaccinated - ultimately saved.\n\nInoculate as many of the beasts as you can and return to me.",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的索艾·鹰怒要你使用疫苗包为5头雪落麋鹿和5头极地灰熊接种疫苗。",oEN="Soar Hawkfury at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to use the Pack of Vaccine to vaccinate 5 Snowfall Elk and 5 Arctic Grizzlies.",c="你做了一件高尚的事，<name>。请选一件奖赏吧。",cEN="You have done an honorable thing, <name>. Please, choose a reward."}
Q[12112]={d="好吧，看来你终究还是有点用处。我见过的$r里，$g没几个:没几个;是这样的。\n\n这里用不着你了。去“恶习”那边，问问我兄弟佐特要不要帮手。他去想办法哄那些巨人自相残杀，省得我们动手。他向来不是家里最有脑子的那个。",dEN="Well it seems you were of a bit of use after all. It's not been my experience to meet many a <race> that are.\n\nWe don't have any more use for you here. Head into the Vice and see if my brother Zort could use a hand. He went to see if he could con the giants into laying down their lives so that we don't have to. He certainly wasn't known for having the brains in the family.",o="转至诺兹拉斯哨站的东北方，在水晶裂痕中部找到佐特。",oEN="Locate Zort in the center of the Crystal Vice, northeast of Nozzlerust Post.",c="让我想想我该怎么利用你，在这待一会儿。",cEN="I can think of some uses for you, go ahead and stay for a bit."}
Q[12113]={d="你好啊，$c！过来坐到我的篝火旁。\n\n我很想和你分享一份热呼呼的美食，只是我也没有。我要在这里等一个合伙人，所以走不开，否则我肯定会自己去解决这个问题啦。\n\n呃，你好像很闲，而且这附近到处都是肉。不如你帮我个忙，去弄些食物怎么样？",dEN="G'day to ya, <class>! Have yerself a seat by me fire, eh?\n\nI'd offer to share a nice hot meal, only I ain't got one. I'm stuck here waitin' on an associate, or I'd be out tryin' to remedy that situation meself.\n\nSay, you seem to have nuthin' but time on yer hands and there be plenty o' meat in these parts. What say ya lend a hand and round up some grub?",o="哈考尔营地的哈考尔希望你能帮他从暗嚎徘徊者身上收集10块多汁的座狼肉，从厚蹄食草鹿身上收集10块铲角肉排。",oEN="Harkor at Harkor's Camp wants you to collect 10 pieces of Fibrous Worg Meat from Duskhowl Prowlers and 10 Shovelhorn Steaks from Longhoof Grazers.",p="我肚子在咕咕叫，<race>。你弄到吃的了吗？",pEN="Me belly be rumblin, <race>. You manage to round up some food?",c="杰出！\n\n没有什么比大口吃肉更棒的了。",cEN="Outstanding!\n\nNuthin' better with a pint than a hot morsel of meat."}
Q[12114]={d="巨魔……我恨巨魔！<哈考尔吐了一口唾沫。>\n\n我曾经被那些混蛋抓住过……他们差点就把我的脑袋给揪下来了！\n\n我的朋友都劝我把这事忘了，可我就是做不到。\n\n知道怎么样才能让我舒服点吗，$r？只有一个方法，那就是让巨魔不舒服！如果你能做到的话，我会付给你金币的。",dEN="Trolls... me hates 'em all! <Harkor spits.>\n\nI once got meself captured by a band o' tha beasts... came this close ta gettin' me head shrunk!\n\nMe friends tell me to just move on and put it all behind me, but that just ain't sittin' right.\n\nWanna know what would make me feel better, <race>? Seein' a pile of their corpses so high it blots out the sun! I've got good gold to spend if ya can make that happen.",o="哈考尔营地的哈考尔要你在达基尔金废墟外面杀死10个达卡莱保卫者和10个达卡莱先知。",oEN="Harkor at Harkor's Camp wants you to kill 10 Drakkari Protectors and 10 Drakkari Oracles outside Drakil'jin Ruins.",p="巨魔猎杀的如何呀？",pEN="How goes the troll hunt?",c="谢谢你，<class>。\n\n等有空了，我就起身在附近转转。",cEN="Thankyeh, <class>.\n\nWhen time allows I'll git up and have meself a look around."}
Q[12115]={d="最近加入我们事业的人里，也许有人能破译这本书。一位名叫科尔提拉·织亡的死亡骑士暂时住在阿格玛之锤。他曾是阿尔萨斯的死亡骑士、天灾军团的一员，或许能翻译亡者之语。\n\n把这本血肉装订的书卷交给科尔提拉，请他翻译那些书页。|n",dEN="There is one who recently joined our cause that might be able to decipher this tome. An unbound death knight known as Koltira Deathweaver has temporarily taken residence here at Agmar's Hammer. As he was once a death knight of Arthas and member of the Scourge, he might be able to translate the language of the dead.\n\nTake the flesh-bound tome to Koltira and ask him to translate the pages.",o="将血之魔典交给库尔迪拉·织亡者。",oEN="Take the Flesh-Bound Tome to Koltira Deathweaver.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="What is it, <race>?",c="人世间只有两件事情我还有兴趣，步兵，而替你翻译天灾军团的书算不上其中任何一件。\n\n然而……也许我们可以找出对双方都有利的作法。\n\n<库尔迪拉抽出了他的武器。>\n\n这是我的符文剑：霜倚。霜倚渴求巫妖王与其手下的鲜血，但我得先刻上它的力量符文：冰霜、邪恶与邪能的符号。替我带来这些东西我就替你翻译这本书。",cEN="There are only two things in life that interest me, peon, and neither of them involve translating a Scourge tome for you.\n\nHowever... perhaps we could work something out that would benefit the both of us.\n\n<Koltira unsheathes his weapon.>\n\nThis is my runeblade, Byfrost. Byfrost thirsts for the blood of the Lich King and his minions, but first I must etch upon it runes of power: symbols of frost, blood, and shadow. Bring me suitable sources of power and I will translate your tome."}
Q[12116]={d="欢迎你，$c。感谢你愿意停下来听克拉斯说话。\n\n多年以来，克拉斯一直都在倾听灵魂的话语，完成他们的愿望。\n\n最近，这片废墟中有许多声音向克拉斯哭诉，说他们不能安息。\n\n如果你愿意帮助这些灵魂，就到这里的墓穴中去，把这些受难灵魂的遗物带出来。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. It is kind of you to stop and listen to Kraz's tale.\n\nFor many years Kraz has strained to hear the spirits and do their bidding.\n\nRecently, many voices have been crying to Kraz from these ruins. They seek for a peace they cannot find on their own.\n\nIf you would help the spirits of those who have come before, enter this crypt and collect something that once belonged to those tormented souls.",o="哈考尔营地的克拉斯要你进入达基尔金废墟，收集5只达卡莱之罐。",oEN="Kraz at Harkor's Camp wants you to enter Drakil'jin Ruins and collect 5 Drakkari Canopic Jars.",p="你在克拉兹的地穴里发现了什么，<class>？",pEN="What have you found in the crypt for Kraz, <class>?",c="内脏？有趣的选择，<race>。\n\n克拉兹看看能从中学到什么。谢谢你勇于探索那地方的深处。",cEN="Entrails? An interesting choice, <race>.\n\nKraz shall see what is to be learned from them. Thank you for braving the depths of that place."}
Q[12117]={d="$R，从莫亚基港口开来的船只带来了坏消息。今天早晨，那里发生了非常糟糕的事情！\n\n你在这儿已经帮了我们很多忙，那么你愿意乘坐从乌努比开来的船只到龙骨荒野去一趟吗？\n\n据我所知，长者库纳尼非常需要你的帮助。",dEN="<race>, word just arrived from Moa'ki Harbor. Something very bad happened over there this morning!\n\nYou've been very helpful to us here. Would you consider using the boat from Unu'pe to travel to the great Dragonblight?\n\nBy the sound of things, Elder Ko'nani could certainly use your assistance.",o="转至龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口，与长者库纳尼谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Moa'ki Harbor in the Dragonblight and speak with Elder Ko'nani.",c="你说什么，<race>？是霍塔瓦派你来的？\n\n好，好……有很多事要做。有多少帮手我们都不嫌多！",cEN="What's that you say, <race>? Hotawa sent you?\n\nGood, good... there's much to do. We can use all of the help that we can get!"}
Q[12118]={d="$R，从莫亚基港口来的船只带来了坏消息。今天早上，那里发生了非常可怕的事情！\n\n你帮了我们很多忙，能拜托你乘船去龙骨荒野一趟吗？\n\n长者库纳尼肯定非常需要你的帮助。",dEN="<race>, word just came in off the boat from Moa'ki Harbor. Something very bad happened over there this morning!\n\nYou've been very helpful to us here. Would you consider using the boat to travel to the great Dragonblight?\n\nBy the sound of things, Elder Ko'nani could certainly use your assistance.",o="转至龙骨荒野的莫亚基港口，与长者库纳尼谈一谈。",oEN="Travel to Moa'ki Harbor in the Dragonblight and speak with Elder Ko'nani.",c="你说什么，<race>？是安努尼亚克派你来的？\n\n好，好……有很多事要做。有多少帮手我们都不嫌多！",cEN="What's that you say, <race>? Anuniaq sent you?\n\nGood, good... there's much to do. We can use all of the help that we can get!"}
Q[12119]={d="$n，你必须尽快前往龙眠神殿，把这封信交给管事塔里奥斯特拉兹。\n\n神殿位于龙骨荒野中央。沿路向东走到尽头，然后穿过巨龙废土就能到达。\n\n我相信管事读完你的介绍信后，会安排你觐见阿莱克丝塔萨女王。我们只能期望还不算太迟。\n\n感谢你为我们所做的一切。一路平安！",dEN="<name>, you must travel as swiftly as you can to Wyrmrest Temple and present this letter to the steward, Tariolstrasz.\n\nThe temple sits in the center of the Dragonblight. Follow the road east until it ends, and then cross The Dragon Wastes to get to it.\n\nI'm sure that when the steward reads your introduction, he'll see to it that you gain an audience with Queen Alexstrasza. We can only hope that we're not too late.\n\nThank you for all that you have done on our behalf. Safe journeys!",o="转至龙眠神殿，将这封给龙眠神殿的介绍信交给塔里奥斯塔兹。",oEN="Deliver your Letter of Introduction to Wyrmrest Temple to Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",p="是的，我能为你做什么，<race>？",pEN="Yes, what can I do for you, <race>?",c="一封谒见红龙女王的介绍信函？让我看看。\n\n无论你的来意为何，我希望事关要紧。今日的天空满是蓝龙的攻击！",cEN="A letter of introduction to meet with the queen? Let me see that.\n\nWhatever your business is, I hope that it's important. The skies are full of attacking blues today!"}
Q[12120]={d="腐化的气息……\n\n你还没把这些罐子交给我的时候，我就已经能感觉到它们里面的腐化气息了。这种气息弥漫在充满忧虑的古代达卡莱幽魂周围，使它们不能安息。\n\n克拉斯从不说谎，$c。净化这个地方需要付出很大的牺牲，不过我们可以另找个时间来谈这个问题。\n\n在这里的活人中有一个家伙掌握着净化的关键。把它拿回来，克拉斯会告诉你更多的事情。",dEN="Corruption....\n\nEven before you delivered these jars, Kraz could sense it. This corruption fills the ancient Drakkari spirits with great angst and prevents them from entering the rest they seek.\n\nKraz will not lie, <class>. Cleansing this place will require great sacrifice, but we shall speak of that at another time.\n\nThere is one among the living here who holds the key to its cleansing. Seek out Drak'aguul and return to Kraz with the mallet he carries.",o="哈考尔营地的克拉斯希望你去杀死达基尔金废墟外的达卡古尔，然后把达基尔金之槌交给他。",oEN="Kraz at Harkor's Camp wants you to slay Drak'aguul outside Drakil'jin Ruins and return with the Drakil'jin Mallet.",p="你找到木槌了吗，<name>？",pEN="You find the mallet, <name>?",c="到目前为止你做得很好，<name>，但真正的考验现在才开始。",cEN="You have done well thus far, <name>, but now comes the true test."}
Q[12121]={d="这群达卡莱巨魔只会对你发起凶猛的攻击，所以你什么都不欠他们的。不过，你正好需要借助他们的手来完成克拉斯让你去做的事情。\n\n为了净化这个地方，让灵魂永远安息，你就必须和它们一样死去。\n\n有个人在墓穴里面——在另一个世界——等着你，他掌握着我们所要寻求的知识，$n。\n\n在锣前使用这柄槌。腐化这个地方的恶灵一定会“送”你进入灵魂世界。\n\n克拉斯等着你回来。",dEN="These Drakkari have met you with nothing but savage hostility. You owe them nothing. Few indeed would carry out the task that Kraz asks of you today.\n\nTo cleanse this place and send the spirits to their eternal rest, you must join them in death.\n\nThere is one inside the crypt who awaits you - on the other side. He holds the knowledge we seek, <name>.\n\nUse the mallet on the gongs. The spirit of he who corrupts this place will surely deliver you to the spirit world.\n\nKraz awaits your return.",o="哈科尔营地的克拉兹要你在达基尔金废墟外对铜锣使用达基尔金木槌。你被杀之后，要进入废墟，在$g死亡:死亡;状态下与甘乔的灵魂交谈。",oEN="Kraz at Harkor's Camp wants you to use the Drakil'jin Mallet on the gongs outside Drakil'jin Ruins. Once you have been slain, you are to enter the ruins and speak with the spirit of Gan'jo while you are dead.",c="有人预先通知过我你的造访，朋友。你能够过来真好。",cEN="Your coming has been foretold, friend. It was good of you to come."}
Q[12122]={d="$n，你必须尽快前往龙眠神殿，把这封信交给管事塔里奥斯特拉兹。\n\n神殿位于龙骨荒野中央。沿路向东走到尽头，然后穿过巨龙废土就能到达。\n\n我相信管事读完你的介绍信后，会安排你觐见阿莱克丝塔萨女王。我们只能期望还不算太迟。\n\n感谢你为我们所做的一切。一路平安！",dEN="<name>, you must travel as swiftly as you can to Wyrmrest Temple and present this letter to the steward, Tariolstrasz.\n\nThe temple sits in the center of the Dragonblight. Follow the road east until it ends, and then cross The Dragon Wastes to get to it.\n\nI'm sure that when the steward reads your introduction, he'll see to it that you gain an audience with Queen Alexstrasza. We can only hope that we're not too late.\n\nThank you for all that you have done on our behalf. Safe journeys!",o="转至龙眠神殿，将这封给龙眠神殿的介绍信交给塔里奥斯塔兹。",oEN="Deliver your Letter of Introduction to Wyrmrest Temple to Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",p="是的，我能为你做什么，<race>？",pEN="Yes, what can I do for you, <race>?",c="一封谒见红龙女王的介绍信函？让我看看。\n\n无论你的来意为何，我希望事关要紧。今日的天空满是蓝龙的攻击！",cEN="A letter of introduction to meet with the queen? Let me see that.\n\nWhatever your business is, I hope that it's important. The skies are full of attacking blues today!"}
Q[12123]={d="<巨龙管事从袖中抽出你的介绍信。>\n\n好……好，我想你现在可以觐见女王了。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;时，再来跟我说话，我会安排一条龙把你安全送到神殿顶端。你需要亲自把信呈给阿莱克丝塔萨女王。$gpreparado:preparada;",dEN="<The dragon steward pulls your letter of introduction out of his sleeve.>\n\nYes... yes, I think that you are ready to see the queen now.\n\nWhen you are ready, speak to me again and I will see to it that one of these drakes delivers you safely to the top of the temple. You will need to present your letter in person to Queen Alexstrasza.",o="转至龙眠神殿，将这封给龙眠神殿的介绍信交给阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Deliver your Letter of Introduction to Wyrmrest Temple to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple.",p="终于能当面见到你，真是太好了，<name>。早在你出生之前，我就认识你了。",pEN="It is good to finally meet you in person, <name>. I have known you since before you were born.",c="能将这个消息带给我们需要莫大的勇气。我一直在怀疑蓝龙军团为什么如此大胆地对神殿发动攻击。如今我知道了，他们大量使用那些原本蓝龙军团视为对造成艾泽拉斯巨大威胁的魔法。\n\n<红龙女王无可奈何地摇了摇头。>\n\n哎，但是不能任由它们胡来。如果玛里苟斯不能恢复理智，我们除了对他的进犯进行反击之外别无他法。",cEN="You are very courageous to bring us this information. I was beginning to wonder why the blue dragonflight had so boldly initiated an attack upon the temple itself. Now we know that they are using enormous amounts of the very magic they view as such a threat to Azeroth.\n\n<The queen shakes her head in seeming resignation.>\n\nHypocritical, but so be it. If Malygos will not come to his senses, we have no choice but to take action in response to their assault."}
Q[12124]={d="<巨龙管事从袖中抽出你的介绍信。>\n\n好……好，我想你现在可以觐见女王了。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;时，再来跟我说话，我会安排一条龙把你安全送到神殿顶端。你需要亲自把信呈给阿莱克丝塔萨女王。$gpreparado:preparada;",dEN="<The dragon steward pulls your letter of introduction out of his sleeve.>\n\nYes... yes, I think that you are ready to see the queen now.\n\nWhen you are ready, speak to me again and I will see to it that one of these drakes delivers you safely to the top of the temple. You will need to present your letter in person to Queen Alexstrasza.",o="转至龙眠神殿，将这封给龙眠神殿的介绍信交给阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Deliver your Letter of Introduction to Wyrmrest Temple to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple.",p="终于能当面见到你，真是太好了，<name>。早在你出生之前，我就认识你了。",pEN="It is good to finally meet you in person, <name>. I have known you since before you were born.",c="能将这个消息带给我们需要莫大的勇气。我一直在怀疑蓝龙军团为什么如此大胆地对神殿发动攻击。如今我知道了，他们大量使用那些原本蓝龙军团视为对造成艾泽拉斯巨大威胁的魔法。\n\n<红龙女王无可奈何地摇了摇头。>\n\n哎，但是不能任由它们胡来。如果玛里苟斯不能恢复理智，我们除了对他的进犯进行反击之外别无他法。",cEN="You are very courageous to bring us this information. I was beginning to wonder why the blue dragonflight had so boldly initiated an attack upon the temple itself. Now we know that they are using enormous amounts of the very magic they view as such a threat to Azeroth.\n\n<The queen shakes her head in seeming resignation.>\n\nHypocritical, but so be it. If Malygos will not come to his senses, we have no choice but to take action in response to their assault."}
Q[12125]={d="我们需要能令这把剑满足的祭品，可是部落的军令禁止我们用以往的形式完成充能。\n\n<库尔迪拉停下来思考了片刻。>\n\n是时候做出一些改变啦。在这里的南方的高崖之上，有一处叫作因度雷的海象人村落。这座村落最近被蓝龙军团的混乱魔法侵蚀了，村中所有的海象人都陷入疯狂。\n\n带上这颗能量宝石，对那些疯狂的村民使用它，抽取他们的精神能量。",dEN="The blood of innocents was once used to sate the thirst of the blade. Alas, such options are no longer available to me.\n\n<Koltira pauses to think.>\n\nWe must improvise. South of here, upon the high bluffs, is the tuskarr village of Indu'le. Having been recently overrun by the Blue Dragonflight's chaotic magic, the resident tuskarr of Indu'le have gone mad.\n\nTake this blood gem and use it on a deranged villager. If I cannot take the blood of innocents, I shall have the blood of the meek!",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要求你在一名疯狂的因度雷村民身上使用能量宝石，然后将充能的能量宝石还给他。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to use the Blood Gem on a Deranged Indu'le Villager and return to him with a Filled Blood Gem.",p="将羔羊精神能量带给我。",pEN="Bring the blood of the meek to me.",c="这只是给呆子做的简单工作。不出我所料，你完成了。",cEN="A simple task for a simpleton. You have performed within my expectations."}
Q[12126]={d="邪恶之力在我族人中备受觊觎。它构成了我们存在的根本，赐死那些胆敢嘲弄它的人！好在有一处源泉，可供我在需要时汲取。\n\n拿着这颗邪恶宝石，前往东边的红玉巨龙圣地。你会在那里找到阿尔萨斯的死亡骑士瓦伦哈尔公爵。在战斗中削弱他的意志，然后对他释放宝石的力量。这会了结他，并夺走他的邪恶能量！|n",dEN="The power of the unholy is coveted among my kind. It makes up the very fiber of our existence, granting death to those that dare make a mockery of it! Thankfully there is a font from which I may draw from in my time of need.\n\nTake this unholy gem and make your way to the Ruby Dragonshrine, east of here. It is there that you will find Duke Vallenhal, death knight of Arthas. Weaken his resolve in battle and unleash the power of the gem upon him. It will finish him off and steal his unholy energy!",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要求你对瓦伦哈尔公爵使用邪恶宝石，然后将充能的邪恶宝石还给他。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to use the Unholy Gem on Duke Vallenhal and return to him with a Filled Unholy Gem.",p="将邪恶之力装满宝石！",pEN="Fill the gem with the power of the unholy!",c="<库尔迪拉睁大了眼睛。>\n\n令人印象深刻，你击败了一名阿尔萨斯的死亡骑士！很显然你不是独力办到的……不过这仍是……奇迹……",cEN="<Koltira's eyes widen.>\n\nImpressive. You bested a deathknight of Arthas... Clearly you were not alone... but still..."}
Q[12127]={d="噬骨的冰霜之力永远在死亡骑士作战时保卫着他们。号令冰霜之力的死亡骑士就是混乱与毁灭的代名词！\n\n拿着这颗冰霜宝石，穿过龙骨荒野的苔原，到龙眠神殿以东的黎明之镜去。在那里，你将与湖面上的冰雪亡魂军团作战，并夺取他们的冰霜精华。在削弱它们以后，你就可以利用宝石的力量了，$n！",dEN="The biting cold protects the death knight while repelling his enemies. He that commands the power of frost can incite chaos and destruction!\n\nTake this frost gem and travel far across the open tundra of the Dragonblight until you come upon the Mirror of Dawn, east of Wyrmrest Temple. It is there that you are to battle the legions of ice revenants that dwell upon the lakes surface and take from them the essence of frost. Utilize the power of the gem when they are weak, <name>!",o="龙骨荒野阿格玛之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要求你对冰雪亡魂使用冰霜宝石，然后将充能的冰霜宝石还给他。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to use the Frost Gem on Ice Revenants and return to him with a Filled Frost Gem.",p="在诺森德，我们全为冰霜之力效命。",pEN="We are all in service of frost here in Northrend.",c="我已经能感觉到寒意流遍全身，<name>。",cEN="I can already feel the cold coursing through me, <name>."}
Q[12128]={d="瞧联盟军队穿越索尔莫丹这事儿把我激动得，差点就忘记关注勘探员哨站的情况了。\n\n我指派莱加尔带领他的助手以及一名巡山人去南部创建一座哨站，就在东风海岸南端的丹厄古尔附近。\n\n他们奉命调查在南部丘陵一带活动的铁矮人，但是我至今都没有收到任何报告。如果你刚好要往那个方向去的话，能帮我催催他们吗？",dEN="With all the excitement about the army trying to move through Thor Modan, I'd almost forgotten about Raegar's crew down at Prospector's Point.\n\nI sent Raegar and his assistants, along with a mountaineer friend, down to establish a small post near Dun Argol, at the southern end of the Eastwind Shore.\n\nThey were to investigate the iron dwarf presence in the southern hills, but I haven't received any reports yet. Could you check up on them if you're going down that way?",o="与勘探员哨站的莱加尔·断眉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",c="嗯……你看起来不像研究助理，这样其实正好。铁矮人看起来似乎在准备打仗，而且我的研究小组还没回来。我想我们用得着你。",cEN="Hmm... you don't look like a research assistant, which is just as well. The iron dwarves look to be preparing for war, and my research team hasn't returned. We could use some help around here."}
Q[12129]={d="铁矮人显然在进行战前准备。这帮家伙有石巨人、作战魔像和闪电元素来扩充兵力，相比之下月溪旅就处于劣势了。如果联盟没有及时找到往北挺进的路线，铁矮人很可能会出其不意地发动袭击。\n\n我们必须牵制铁矮人的行动，好在我已经想到办法啦。大批铁符文铸造师聚集在丹厄古尔制造作战魔像。他们狡猾地将设计图分成若干部分，分别保存起来。你必须收集到一份完整的设计图。",dEN="The iron dwarves are making no secret of the fact that they're preparing for war. With their giants, golems, and lightning elementals, they'd have a technological advantage against the Westfall Brigade. If they don't find passage north in time, the irons could take them by surprise.\n\nWe've got to tie them up here, and I've got just the way to do it. Dun Argol is full of rune-smiths churning out war golems. They carry plans for specific pieces, so you'll need to find and assemble all the parts.",o="将一份完整的作战魔像蓝图交给勘探员哨站的莱加尔·断眉。",oEN="Bring the completed War Golem Blueprint to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",p="你从铁符文铸造师那边弄到作战魔像蓝图了吗？",pEN="Were you able to get those plans from the rune-smiths?",c="你全都拿到了？太棒了！我都迫不及待想看他们见到魔像完成时脸上惊诧的表情了。",cEN="You got all of them? Brilliant! I can't wait to see the looks on their faces when the golem's done."}
Q[12130]={d="设计图是到手了，但是缺零件怎么搞啊！我们既没铸造工具，也没原材料，不过……应该能在丹厄古尔找到不少零件。\n\n你的任务？\n\n你的任务就是替我弄些回来啊。\n\n在铁符文铸造师工作的建筑物附近就散落着很多零件。当然，这属于偷窃他人的劳动成果，我可不敢保证那些铁矮人不会冲你发火。尽可能多弄些零件回来吧，这样我们才能制造作战魔像。",dEN="We've got the blueprints, but we can't do anything with them without parts! We don't have access to a foundry, much less materials, but there's a whole load of parts up in Dun Argol.\n\nYour job?\n\nGive them a new home.\n\nThey're likely to be scattered around any of the buildings where the iron rune-smiths are working, and I wouldn't blame the irons for being cranky when you try to filch their handiwork. The more parts you can bring, the better we can make this golem.",o="将8份作战魔像零件交给勘探员哨站的莱加尔·断眉。",oEN="Bring 8 War Golem Parts to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",p="嗯，看来你全身而退了。你有拿到零件吗？",pEN="I see you made it out in one piece. Do you have the parts?",c="<莱加尔用手背擦擦额头。>\n\n喔不，这比我想的还要困难。这些东西上面没有编号之类的东西对吧？\n\n当你需要侏儒的时候他们总是不在你身边……",cEN="<Raegar wipes his forehead with the back of his hand.>\n\nOh, no. This is going to be harder than I thought. These things don't have serial numbers or anything, do they?\n\nNever a gnome around when you need one..."}
Q[12131]={d="就快大功告成啦，不过作战魔像需要能量晶格做动力源。在被丹厄古尔的铁矮人发现之前，我们已经收集到了很多颇有价值的情报。符文铸造师杜拉尔和符文铸造师卡索恩身上就有能量晶格。\n\n我们得设法搞来这两块能量晶格。\n\n他们应该在丹厄古尔中层的两座车间里。",dEN="We're almost there, but the war golem won't run without power cells. From the information I was able to collect in Dun Argol before we were discovered, both Rune-Smith Durar and Rune-Smith Kathorn each create one power cell.\n\nWe'll need one power cell from each of the rune-smiths before our golem will work.\n\nYou should be able to find each rune-smith in his workshop on the central level of Dun Argol.",o="将杜拉尔的能量晶格和卡索恩的能量晶格交给勘探员哨站的莱加尔·断眉。",oEN="Bring Durar's Power Cell and Kathorn's Power Cell to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",p="嗯，你拿到那些能量晶格了吗？",pEN="Well, did you get those power cells?",c="<莱加尔从你手中取走了能量晶格。>\n\n太棒了，我们应该可以准备上路了。",cEN="<Raegar takes the batteries from you.>\n\nExcellent! We should be all ready to go."}
Q[12132]={d="尽管你已经帮了我很多忙，但根据约定，你还有最后一件事要做。\n\n与这个世界平行的还有另一个世界，那就是阴影界。有一些该死的恶魔从阴影界过来突袭了我。我自己无力面对这些源自我内心的恶魔，但你却可以帮我结束它们所带来的痛苦。你很强大，这一点我已经亲眼证实了。\n\n进入阴影界，挑战那些折磨着我的恶魔吧！\n\n只要你帮了我这个忙，我就会按照约定帮你翻译这本书。",dEN="While you have done much for me, one task remains.\n\nBeside the world you know exists another world. It is from that world, the world of shadows, that my tormentors assault me. While I am powerless to face my own demons, you could end their reign of terror. You have the strength, I have seen it with my own eyes.\n\nEnter the world of shadows and face the demons that torment me!\n\nDo this and I will translate the tome, as promised.",o="阿格玛之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要求你进入阴影界并击败6名暗影折磨者。\n\n如果需要再次进入阴影界，就去找库尔迪拉·织亡者帮忙。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver at Agmar's Hammer in the Dragonblight wants you to enter the world of shadows and defeat 6 Shadowy Tormentors.\n\nSpeak to Koltira Deathweaver should you need to re-enter the world of shadows.",c="我所掌握的力量代价巨大，<name>。在圣光之愿礼拜堂的最终决战中，许多骑士——无论光明还是黑暗——都丢了性命。前路看似黯淡，但至少现在我知道自己面对的是什么。巫妖王绝不会松开他的掌控，仅凭这一点，他就必须死！",cEN="The power I hold comes at a great cost, <name>. Many knights, light and dark alike, lost their lives in the final battle at Light's Hope. The prospect of the future looks grim, but at least now I know what I face. The Lich King will never release his grasp and for that alone he must die!"}
Q[12133]={d="村子中央放置着一盏巨大的南瓜灯。它闪烁着诡异的光芒，透露出难以捉摸的诡异气息。\n\n击碎南瓜灯后，你发现了一枚烧焦的神圣符记。",dEN="This large jack-o'-lantern rests in the middle of the village. It eyes those who look upon it, betraying a dark menace within.\n\nSmashing the pumpking reveals an old, scorched holy symbol.",o="将烧焦的神圣符记交给穿戏服的孤儿院长。",oEN="Give the Scorched Holy Symbol to the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="$n，怎么了吗？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你是在无头骑士的南瓜灯里找到这个的？这是圣光的古老象征。它一定曾属于骑士，在他被诅咒、变成如今这怪物之前。谢谢你，$n。这个象征理应与圣骑士们同在。我会确保他们收到。\n\n啊，差点忘了！你有一位秘密爱慕者……\n\n有个小姑娘想把这个送给你，但她太害羞了，不敢亲自给你。",cEN="You found this inside the Headless Horseman's jack-o-lantern? It is an old symbol of the Light. If must have been the Horseman's, before he was cursed and turned into the monster he is today. Thank you, <name>. This symbol deserves to be with paladins. I will make sure they get it.\n\nOh, and I almost forgot! You have a secret admirer...\n\nOne of the children wanted you to have this. She was too shy to give it to you herself."}
Q[12134]={d="这个东西……这个诅咒……它毁了银溪镇，它毁了冬至村……它将所有的人都变成了野兽。\n\n我的父亲曾试图警告他们，但他们已经完全沦落成了拜狼教的奴隶。\n\n他们已经无可挽救了，为了让他们的灵魂解脱……你必须去除掉他们。",dEN="This thing... this curse... that's affecting Silverbrook and Solstice Village... it makes beasts out of people.\n\nMy father tried to warn them, but they all listened to the wolfcult instead.\n\nThey're too far gone now, it's time to put them down... for their own sake.",o="萨莎要求你在冬至村中击败12名冬至村猎人。",oEN="Sasha wants you to kill 12 Solstice Hunters in Solstice Village.",p="你处理掉村里的猎人了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you taken care of the hunters in the village yet, <name>?",c="杀死这些怪物也不能换回我父亲……但这并不是重点，对吗？",cEN="Killing these monsters won't bring my father back... but that's not the point now, is it?"}
Q[12135]={d="你必须帮帮我们！无头骑士随时都有可能发动攻击！到时候村子里肯定火光连天！孤儿院的孩子性命堪忧！\n\n$n，你愿意熄灭无头骑士燃起的火焰吗？加入消防队吧。拿上水桶去灭火，或者把它递给更靠近火焰的伙伴。只有扑灭所有的火焰才能拯救我们！",dEN="You must help us! The Headless Horseman will attack the village at any moment! Fires will be everywhere! The children aren't safe!\n\nPlease, <name>, will you face the fires of the Headless Horseman? When he comes, you must join the fire brigade. Grab a bucket and toss it on the fires, or pass it to a friend who's closer to the blaze. If you put out all the fires then we may yet be saved!",o="穿戏服的孤儿院长希望你在无头骑士发动攻击时帮忙扑灭村子里的所有火焰。完成任务后与穿戏服的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="The Costumed Orphan Matron wants you to help put out all the village fires after the Headless Horseman lights them. When they are out, speak again to the Costumed Orphan Matron.",p="<name>，你答应过要救那些孩子的！",pEN="<name>, you promised to save the children!",c="哦，谢谢你！愿圣光祝福你的善行，善良的<sir/lady>。黑暗骑士的阴影仍在逼近，但至少眼下，村子免于他的烈焰了。",cEN="Oh, thank you! May the Light bless your good works, kind <sir/lady>. The shadow of the Dark Horseman yet looms, but at least, for now, the village is safe from his flames."}
Q[12136]={d="给你，$n。我已经把书卷上所有书页都翻译完了。里面有一份名单，列出了遍布整个大陆的天灾军团教派成员的名字。\n\n他们的间谍与行动网络至少可以说是令人惊叹。\n\n一路顺风，$g朋友:朋友;。愿这本书对你有用，对你的族人有用。",dEN="Here it is, <name>. I have translated everything printed upon the pages of the tome. Inside it you will find a list of the names of Cult of the Damned members spanning the entire continent.\n\nTheir network of spies and operatives is impressive, to say the least.\n\nFarewell, friend. May the book serve you and your people well.",o="将翻译过的血之魔典交给阿格玛之锤的高尔特上尉。",oEN="Deliver the Translated Flesh-bound Tome to Captain Gort at Agmar's Hammer.",p="总算回来了！你去哪儿了？",pEN="It's about time! Where have you been?",c="<戈特从你手中接过书卷，开始阅读。>\n\n什么！这不可能。这些兽人里有几个我认识好多年了！\n\n别管我了，<name>。我有很多事要做，有很多叛徒要处决。\n\n拿一件这些东西，算是补偿你的麻烦。你今日为部落立下了大功。",cEN="<Gort takes the tome from you and begins reading.>\n\nWHAT! This can't be right. I've known some of these orcs for years!\n\nLeave me, <name>. I have much work to do and many traitors to execute.\n\nTake one of these items for your trouble. You've done a great service for the Horde this day."}
Q[12137]={d="就如预言所说，伙计。一位 会来让我们的灵魂安息。我们已经等了很久了！\n\n达卡莱已经成了一个迷失的民族，凶残而野蛮。\n\n但在这里，我们受苦并非自己的过错，伙计。这地方需要净化，而只有活人才能做到。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;归回躯体时，来跟我说话。然后从我身旁箱子里的雪带上一些，让我的兄弟们入睡。\n\n把他们的遗骸带给你的灵魂向导。他知道下一步该怎么做。$c$gUn:Una:r;",dEN="It be as the prophecies said, mon. A <race> <class> be comin' to set our spirits to rest. We been waitin' for a long time now!\n\nThe Drakkari have become a lost people, fierce and savage.\n\nBut here we suffer by no fault of our own, mon. This place need cleansin' and only the living can do it.\n\nSpeak to me when ya be ready to rejoin your body. Then take the snow from the chest near me here and put my bruddas to sleep.\n\nTake their remnants to your spirit guide. He be knowin' what to do next.",o="甘休希望你能从他在达基尔金废墟的箱子里拿到永恒休眠之雪。\n\n对那里的上古阿卡莱幽魂使用永恒休眠之雪，然后把它们的达卡莱灵魂微粒交给哈考尔营地的克拉斯。",oEN="Gan'jo wants you to collect the Snow of Eternal Slumber from his chest in the Drakil'jin Ruins.\n\nYou are to use the Snow on the Ancient Drakkari Spirits there and take their Drakkari Spirit Particles back to Kraz at Harkor's Camp.",p="你完成地穴里的任务了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you completed your task in the crypt, <class>?",c="干得好。\n\n请坐，专心听我说。我们要好好讨论一些事情。",cEN="You have done well.\n\nPlease, sit and listen. There are many things we must discuss."}
Q[12138]={d="你以为这帮家伙会很厚道地给能量晶格充满电？事实上，他们留了一手防着我们呢。\n\n好吧，我们总是能想出办法的，虽然麻烦了点。这两块能量晶格的电力仅够维持作战魔像很短时间内的动力，要它作战是不可能的。\n\n你瞧，铁矮人将闪电斥候部署在丹厄古尔周围。杀死这些闪电斥候，就可以用作战魔像从它们的尸体上吸取能量了。",dEN="You'd think the guys making the power cells would've thought to power them up, but no, they've got to make it difficult for us.\n\nFine, we'll charge those cells the hard way. There's enough power in them to run the golem for a short time, but don't expect it to be any good in combat.\n\nYou see the lightning sentries that the irons have posted around the perimeter of Dun Argol? Bring the golem with you, take it close to them, and use the golem to absorb the power as the sentries die.",o="利用10个闪电斥候为你的作战魔像充能，然后将充能完毕的作战魔像交给勘探员哨站的莱加尔·断眉。",oEN="Charge your War Golem with the energy from 10 Lightning Sentries and return to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",c="终于，它准备好了。我只希望它能保持完整，直到工作完成为止。如果我们不把丹厄古尔的铁领主解决掉，格里安上尉就会陷入一场险恶的突袭之中。",cEN="Finally, it's ready. I only hope it holds together long enough to get the job done. If we don't take out the thane leading Dun Argol, Captain Gryan'll be in for a nasty surprise."}
Q[12139]={d="无头骑士随时都有可能发动攻击！到时候村子里肯定火光连天！\n\n$n，你愿意熄灭无头骑士燃起的火焰吗？加入消防队吧。拿上水桶去灭火，或者把它递给更靠近火焰的伙伴。只有扑灭所有的火焰才能拯救我们！",dEN="The Headless Horseman will attack the village at any moment! Fires will be everywhere!\n\n<name>, will you face the fires of the Headless Horseman? When he comes, you must join the fire brigade. Grab a bucket and toss it on the fires, or pass it to a friend who's closer to the blaze. If you put out all the fires then we may yet be saved!",o="戴面具的孤儿院长希望你在无头骑士发动攻击时帮忙扑灭村子里的所有火焰。完成任务后与戴面具的孤儿院长谈一谈。",oEN="The Masked Orphan Matron wants you to help put out all the village fires. When they are out, speak again to the Masked Orphan Matron in town.",c="火势被扑灭了！你和你的救火队胜利了！呀哈！\n\n无头骑士的攻击失败了，但除非他和他的头一起被消灭，他还会再回来的。\n\n在此之前，让我们好好享受你为这些孩子们带来的安全吧。我很荣幸能目睹你今天勇敢的行为。",cEN="The fires are out! You and your fire brigade were victorious! Hah!\n\nThe Headless Horseman's attack has failed, but until he and his head are destroyed together, he will return.\n\nUntil then, however, let's take comfort in the safety you brought our children. I am honored to have watched your brave work today."}
Q[12140]={d="和牛头人、被遗忘者、巨魔与血精灵一样，坦卡族也需要一位出自本族血脉的领袖。你在冰雾村救出的罗阿诺克，将成为这位领袖。\n\n<霸主阿格玛递给你一卷羊皮纸。>\n\n我给你一样熟悉的东西——部落的血誓。\n\n把这份誓言带给罗阿诺克·冰雾，以坦卡族领袖的身份引他加入部落。\n\n别让他久等。\n\n<阿格玛点了点头。>|n",dEN="Like the tauren, Forsaken, trolls and blood elves, so too do the taunka need a leader born of their own blood. The one you saved from Icemist, Roanauk, will be this leader.\n\n<Overlord Agmar hands you a parchment.>\n\nI give to you something familiar - the blood oath of the Horde.\n\nTake the oath to Roanauk Icemist and initiate him into the Horde as leader of the taunka.\n\nLet us not keep him waiting.\n\n<Agmar nods.>",o="在阿格玛之锤找到罗阿诺克·冰雾，引他成为部落军队的一员与领袖。\n\n完成任务后，带着部落的血誓回到霸主阿格玛那里。|n",oEN="Seek out Roanauk Icemist at Agmar's Hammer and initiate him as a member and leader of the Horde forces.\n\nReturn to Overlord Agmar with the Blood Oath of the Horde when you complete this task.",p="别浪费时间，<name>！安加萨在等着你！",pEN="Do not waste time, <name>. Angrathar awaits!",c="有了这么强悍的萨满协助，我们一定能够在天谴之门获得胜利！",cEN="With the aid of such a powerful shaman, we are sure to be victorious at the Wrathgate!"}
Q[12141]={d="看得出你一心想帮忙，$n。你大老远跑到诺森德来，可不是为了$g窝:窝;在城里！我正好有个任务给你……能让你离开这里远走高飞。\n\n我们一直想赢得诺森德原住民海象人的好感。最近有个年轻的海象人来这里求助，可当时我们帮不上忙。\n\n既然你来了，也许你能帮他一把。去此处西南的裂鞭海岸附近找卡鲁克，看看你能为他做些什么。",dEN="I see that you are very eager to help, <name>. You didn't come all the way to Northrend to stay holed up in a city! I've just the task for you... something that'll take you far away from here.\n\nWe've long sought to gain the favor of the tuskarr native to Northrend. Recently a young tuskarr came to us seeking help, something we couldn't offer at the time.\n\nNow that you're around, maybe you can lend him a hand. Look for Karuk near the Riplash Strand, southwest of here, and see what you can do to help.",o="转至无畏要塞西南方的裂鞭海岸，与卡鲁克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Karuk at Riplash Strand, southwest of Valiance Keep.",c="你是来帮我的吗？我感谢你，<name>。",cEN="You've come to my aid? I thank you, <name>."}
Q[12142]={d="啊！有只狗头人趁我们忙着对付龙族时跑进营地闹腾了一番。稍不留神，它们就来捣乱……我真是受够了！\n\n狗头人就待在南边的猛犸人营地里。去那里干掉它们。\n\n如果猛犸人打算替他们的奴隶出头，就连他们一起杀掉。",dEN="Ugh! One of those little snobold runts trashed our camp while we were busy with that last dragon. They've been plaguing us whenever we turn our backs... I've had enough!\n\nTo the south you'll find the snobolds hiding under the skirts of some of the local magnataur. Go slaughter them.\n\nIf the magnataur interfere on behalf of their slaves, kill them as well.",o="第七军团前线的杜埃尼希望你转至龙眠神殿周围的猛犸人营地，消灭10个雪原北地狗头人和3个龙骨荒野猛犸人。",oEN="Duane at the 7th Legion Front wants you to kill 10 Snowplain Snobolds and 3 Dragonblight Magnataur at the magnataur camps surrounding Wyrmrest.",p="你解决那些害虫了吗？",pEN="Did you finish off those pests?",c="杀得好。",cEN="Good riddance."}
Q[12143]={d="真不敢相信！另一群狗头人刚刚偷袭了我们的营地，抢走了一批补给品。他们朝北边的峡谷逃去了，追上这帮强盗，干掉他们的首领！",dEN="I can't believe this! Another band of those vermin just tried to take off with more of our supplies. They're scurrying off towards that north canyon, get after them and deal with whoever they're going to!",o="杜埃尼希望你在第七军团前线东北方向的峡谷中找到北地狗头人的踪迹，并干掉它们的领袖。",oEN="Duane wants you to chase the snobolds down the canyon northeast of 7th Legion Front and deal with their leader.",p="解决了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="寒牙，是吗？我以前听过他的名字。干得好，<class>。但愿我们现在能把注意力转回巨龙的威胁上。",cEN="Chilltusk, eh? I've heard his name before. That's some good work, <class>. Hopefully we can turn our attention back to the dragon menace now."}
Q[12144]={d="哟，伙计！有一些北地狗头人趁着上次冰霜巨龙突袭的时候把我们的营地搞了个底朝天。这帮混账老是跟在我们后面，让我们焦头烂额。受够啦，老子受够啦！\n\n去东边找找那些家伙的晦气，它们就躲在猛犸人营地的周围。把它们都给我杀光，要是猛犸人敢插手，就把他们也杀光！",dEN="Oi, mon! One of dose little snobold runts trashed our camp during da last dragon attack. Dey've been houndin us wheneva we turn our backs and I've had enough.\n\nTo da east you'll find da snobolds hiding under da skirts of some of da local magnataur. Go slaughter dem. If da magnataur interfere on behalf of deir slaves, kill dem as well.",o="猎龙营地的肯图卡尼斯要你转至龙眠神殿周围的猛犸人营地，消灭10个雪原北地狗头人和3个龙骨荒野猛犸人。",oEN="Kontokanis at Dragon's Fall wants you to kill 10 Snowplain Snobolds and 3 Dragonblight Magnataur at the magnataur camps surrounding Wyrmrest.",c="总算摆脱了，伙计。",cEN="Good riddance, mon."}
Q[12145]={d="开……开什么玩笑呀！又有一群见鬼的狗头人抢走了我们的补给物资。现在它们跑到那边的峡谷里去啦，你还发什么愣，追啊！追上去，不管它们是谁，让它们统统去死啊！",dEN="I can't believe dis! Another band of dose vermin just tried ta take off with more of our supplies. Dey're scurrying down da canyon now, get after dem and deal with whoever dey're going to!",o="肯图卡尼斯希望你在猎龙营地以南的峡谷中找到北地狗头人的踪迹，并干掉它们的领袖。",oEN="Kontokanis wants you to chase the snobolds down the canyon south of Dragon's Fall and deal with their leader.",p="你知道他们跑哪去了吗？",pEN="You not a real mon til you killed a dragon... mon.",c="冰拳，嗯？我听过这名字。做得好，英雄。希望暗矛巨魔现在可以把注意力转回巨龙的威胁上。",cEN="Icefist, eh? I've heard his name before. Dat's some good work, mon. Hopefully we Darkspear can turn our attention back to dat dragon menace now."}
Q[12146]={d="号角内侧装饰着一枚绘有铁锤与闪电的纹章。这显然不是猛犸人的东西。\n\n带上号角，沿着泰坦之路向南走，到龙眠神殿去看看有谁能解读其中的奥秘。",dEN="The underside of the horn boasts an emblazoned seal with a hammer and a lightning bolt. Something about the horn seems extremely out of place on a Magnataur.\n\nTake the horn south down the Path of the Titans to Wyrmrest and seek out someone who might be interested in these threatening implications.",o="带上精美的战斗号角转至龙眠神殿，看看那里有谁可以评估一下这潜在的威胁。",oEN="Bring the Emblazoned Battle Horn to Wyrmrest and seek out someone who might be interested in assessing the potential threat.",p="是的，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="猛犸人带着像这样的东西确实是很奇怪……而且很重要。我很高兴你把这样东西拿给我看。",cEN="It is indeed strange for any magnataur to carry an item such as this... and very concerning. I am glad that you have shown this to me."}
Q[12147]={d="这只号角的号管内侧印刻着一个非常漂亮的徽记，图案是一只铁锤和一束闪电。而号角的某些外形特征表明这只号角似乎是从猛犸人那里流出的。\n\n往东穿越巨龙废土，将这只号角带回龙眠神殿，看看是否有人能辨识出它的出现意味着什么样的威胁。",dEN="The underside of the horn boasts an emblazoned seal with a hammer and a lightning bolt. Something about the horn seems extremely out of place on a Magnataur.\n\nTake the horn east across the Dragon Wastes to Wyrmrest and seek out someone who might be interested in these threatening implications.",o="带上精美的战斗号角转至龙眠神殿，看看那里有谁可以评估一下这潜在的威胁。",oEN="Bring the Emblazoned Battle Horn to Wyrmrest and seek out someone who might be interested in assessing the potential threat.",p="是的，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="猛犸人带着像这样的东西确实是很奇怪……而且很重要。我很高兴你把这样东西拿给我看。",cEN="It is indeed strange for any magnataur to carry an item such as this... and very concerning. I am glad that you have shown this to me."}
Q[12148]={d="这在猛犸人当中是一个非常非常少见的标识……它代表着某种大规模集结的信号。\n\n猛犸人各部族之间很少会放弃争斗，联合行动。我认为他们很可能在策划洗劫某个大型定居点。\n\n我深刻怀疑这支号角是不是用来集结各个猛犸人部族的，不过希望你能证明我是错的，否则威胁可就太大了。在碧蓝巨龙圣地西北方的悬崖地带有一个名叫裂骨者的猛犸人。去挑战他吧，把任何能证实我的担忧的证据带回来。",dEN="Such a strange seal to see among magnataur... it suggests an unusual amount of organization.\n\nMagnataur rarely put aside their aggressive natures to cooperate with each other. I suspect they have their eyes set on raiding a large settlement.\n\nI very much doubt that this horn is unique, I need you to prove me wrong. In the canyon northwest of the Azure Dragonshrine you will find Bonesunder. Go challenge him and bring me back any evidence you find that might confirm my concerns.",o="在碧蓝巨龙圣地西北边的峡谷附近找到裂骨者，并杀死它。带着证据回去向龙眠神殿的奥拉斯塔萨复命。",oEN="Find and kill Bonesunder in or near the canyon northwest of the Azure Dragonshrine. Bring any evidence you find back to Aurastrasza at Wyrmrest Temple.",p="你找到什么了吗？",pEN="Did you find anything?",c="所以是真的了？他们真是选了个绝佳的时机来攻击……藏在天灾军团与蓝龙之间，而且还没有别人注意到。",cEN="So it is true. They could not have chosen better timing for such an attack... between the Scourge and the blue flight, it is unlikely that anyone else has noticed yet."}
Q[12149]={d="猛犸人生性凶残……一旦聚集起来，就免不了互相杀戮。这也是他们难以构成很大威胁的主要原因。但是近来，猛犸人氏族中涌现出一位强大的领袖。我们必须在猛犸人形成可怕的凝聚力之前除掉他。\n\n我会对此进行周密的调查。在此期间，我打算派你去骚扰他们。\n\n神殿东面有三支火炬，猛犸人氏族中最强大的三名头目就驻扎在火炬旁。去干掉他们，为我们争取足够的时间来收集那位领袖的信息。",dEN="Magnataur are hideously violent creatures... this is the main reason we rarely see them come together in any real numbers without killing each other. A powerful leader has stepped up somewhere among them and we need to hunt him down if we are to stop this threat.\n\nI will start asking around. I need you to disrupt them as much as possible in the meantime.\n\nEast of here there are 3 torches erected. Near them, there are 3 dominant Magnataur - put them down to buy us some time to hunt down this leader.",o="在龙眠神殿以东找到并杀死食血者、破冰者和德拉古尔。\n\n食血者盘踞在巨龙废土的东南角，就在翡翠巨龙圣地北面。裂冰者控制着黎明之镜的北部边界。德拉古尔则在青铜巨龙圣地的西部峭壁下来回巡视。\n\n杀死这三个猛犸人后返回龙眠神殿，向奥拉斯塔萨复命。",oEN="Hunt down and kill Bloodfeast, Iceshatter, and Drakegore east of Wyrmrest\n\nBloodfeast resides in the southeastern corner of the Dragon Wastes, just north of the Emerald Dragonshrine. Iceshatter patrols the northern edge of the Mirror of Dawn. Drakegore wanders at the bottom of the cliffs west of the Bronze Dragonshrine.\n\nReturn to Aurastrasza at Wyrmrest once the magnataur have been slain.",p="你击败猛犸人了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the magnataur?",c="做得好。没人能告诉我这个领袖到底是谁，不过我找出了一个家伙，他许知道我们要的答案。",cEN="Excellent work. No one could tell me who this leader might be, but I was able to uncover the name of someone who will have our answer."}
Q[12150]={d="德雷格玛尔·符印是一名猛犸人铭语师……罕见的头衔。他过着独居的生活，却与龙骨荒野上所有具备影响力的猛犸人头目保持着密切的联系。他应该知道这位脱颖而出的新任领袖是谁。\n\n在天灾军团和蓝龙军团的双重威胁之下，恐怕我们很难得到其它同僚的情报协助。因此，我命令你不惜一切代价，从德雷格玛尔口中问出这条信息。\n\n我听说他居住在俯瞰黎明之镜的悬崖地带。",dEN="Dregmar Runebrand is a magnataur runemaster... a rare breed. He's generally solitary, but has been known to associate with the more powerful and influential magnataur in Dragonblight for quite some time. He will know who this new leader is.\n\nIt is unlikely we will gain any aid with the increasing concerns with the Scourge and the blue flight, so I need you to procure the information from Dregmar by any means necessary.\n\nI was told he can be found amongst the cliffs overlooking the Mirror of the Dawn.",o="登上俯瞰黎明之镜的悬崖，在德雷格玛尔·符印栖身的洞穴附近找到他。向他发起挑战，用尽一切办法逼他说出猛犸人领袖的名字。完成任务后返回龙眠神殿，向奥拉斯塔萨复命。",oEN="Locate Dregmar Runebrand near his cave on the path to the cliffs overlooking the Mirror of the Dawn. Challenge him and uncover the name of the magnataur leader by any means necessary. Return to Aurastrasza at Wyrmrest once the information is obtained.",p="你知道名字了吗？你知道猛犸人的头儿是谁了吗？",pEN="Did you get the name? Do you know who the magnataur warlord is?",c="“雷霆使者”戈洛塔尔。很好。现在就让我们来解决猛犸人对此地造成的威胁。",cEN="Grom'thar the Thunderbringer. Good. Let's end any threat these magnataur might pose here and now."}
Q[12151]={d="没有必要怀疑达米娅所说的。无论是戈洛塔尔获胜还是你获胜，她都能置身事外。\n\n按她的指示去做吧……拿上这只号角，转至碧蓝巨龙圣地南边的火炬之环。吹响号角，向戈洛塔尔宣战。\n\n击败雷霆使者戈洛塔尔，将他的首级带回来给我。",dEN="There's no reason to suspect Dregmar's words are anything but true. Whether Grom'thar defeats you or is defeated by you, he can wash his hands of this.\n\nFollow his instructions... take the horn that you brought me earlier, travel to the ring of torches south of the Azure Dragonshrine, and blow it to announce your challenge.\n\nWhen Grom'thar the Thunderbringer arrives, kill him and bring me his head.",o="转至碧蓝巨龙圣地以南的火炬之环，吹响精美的战斗号角。击败雷霆使者戈洛塔尔，并将他的首级交给龙眠神殿的奥拉斯塔萨。",oEN="Travel to the ring of torches south of the Azure Dragonshrine and blow the Emblazoned Battle Horn. Defeat Grom'thar the Thunderbringer and bring his head back to Aurastrasza at Wyrmrest.",p="你彻底解决我们的威胁了吗？",pEN="Did you end this threat for good?",c="你果然名不虚传。\n\n雷霆使者格罗姆塔尔既已消失，我们就可以让残余的猛犸人自相残杀，把注意力转回更重大的威胁上。\n\n了不起的成就，<class>。",cEN="You are formidable indeed.\n\nWith Grom'thar the Thunderbringer gone, we can leave the remaining Magnataur to fight among themselves and turn our attentions back towards more prominent threats.\n\nImpressive work, <class>."}
Q[12152]={d="很高兴看到你能活着回来。很多去过亡者世界的人都没能回来。\n\n在你离开的时候，克拉斯看到一个幻象，并得知了接下来需要做什么。\n\n在墓穴内有一份神圣的供品。带上这些由你带来的残迹制成的灵魂之尘，把它撒在供品上。\n\n这样就可以了结那个堕落的督军，并释放出无数痛苦的灵魂。\n\n让灵魂引领你的行动吧，$n。",dEN="It is good to see you back among the living. Many who travel the path of the dead do not return to speak of it.\n\nWhile you were away, a vision appeared to Kraz revealing what remains to be done.\n\nA sacred offering lies somewhere inside the crypt. Take this spirit dust fashioned from the remnants you collected and use it on the offering.\n\nThe infused offering will bring an end to the corrupted warlord and will release the many tormented souls.\n\nMay the spirits guide your actions, <name>.",o="哈考尔营地的克拉斯希望你从达基尔金废墟收集神圣达卡莱供品，然后将达卡莱灵魂之尘撒在上面。你必须在达基尔金废墟的锣处使用灌注能量的达卡莱供品。",oEN="Kraz at Harkor's Camp wants you to collect the Sacred Drakkari Offering from the Drakil'jin Ruins and use the Drakkari Spirit Dust on it. You must use the Infused Drakkari Offering at the gongs outside of Drakil'jin Ruins.",p="金阿拉克被击败了吗，<name>？",pEN="Has Jin'arrak been defeated, <name>?",c="完成了。\n\n你的无私为许多灵魂带来了永恒的安宁，终结了万古的痛苦。\n\n愿此举让你自己的灵魂也得以轻松、负担减轻，因为我看到你还有许多危险要面对。\n\n再会，<name>。",cEN="It is done.\n\nYour selflessness has brought eternal peace to many souls, ending eons of misery.\n\nMay this act lighten your own soul and lessen your burdens, for I see that there are yet many perils you must face.\n\nFarewell, <name>."}
Q[12153]={d="作战魔像已经充电完毕，轮到它大展身手的时候啦。在丹厄古尔引导魔像，控制它开始作战。\n\n关于丹厄古尔的铁领主弗雷哈默尔，我们收集到的情报表明他有一名非常强力的护卫。\n\n这个名叫“铁砧”的构造体随时都跟在他身旁。只要摧毁构造体，弗雷哈默尔就容易对付了。\n\n铁领主通常呆在丹厄古尔顶层的大型设备间，监督铁矮人的生产线。",dEN="Now that you've charged up your war golem, we're going to put all that energy to good use. Activate the golem inside Dun Argol to take control of it.\n\nOur information about Dun Argol's leader, Iron Thane Furyhammer, suggests his bodyguard protects him from all harm.\n\nThat bodyguard is the construct he travels with, called The Anvil. Disable the construct, and his protection will disappear.\n\nThe thane stays in the building at the top of Dun Argol and supervises production from the bottom level.",o="驾驶作战魔像击败铁领主弗雷哈默尔，然后返回勘探员哨站向莱加尔·断眉复命。",oEN="Using the abilities of your War Golem, defeat Iron Thane Furyhammer, then return to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",p="你能突破铁族长的防卫吗？",pEN="Were you able to get past the iron thane's defenses?",c="成功了吗？\n\n<雷加尔清了清嗓子。>\n\n我是说……当然成功了！这太不可思议了！\n\n多年以后，探险者协会的新人都会听到雷加尔·断眉、<name>，还有一具破烂魔像是如何击败敦阿格尔的族长的！",cEN="It worked?\n\n<Raegar clears his throat.>\n\nI mean... of course it worked! This is incredible!\n\nYears from now, Explorers' League initiates will hear the story of how Raegar Breakbrow, <name>, and some hunk o' junk golem defeated the thane of Dun Argol!"}
Q[12154]={d="安置在丹厄古尔顶层大厅的能量源向整片本地提供电力。如果摧毁能量源，丹厄古尔就会暂时陷入瘫痪。\n\n如此一来，铁矮人就不能继续制造魔像和闪电元素之类的玩意了。\n\n本来呢，这些炸药是用于挖掘工事的。托铁领主弗雷哈默尔的福，我们的研究工作已经完全搁浅啦。不过，我们还是用得着这些炸药的。它是摧毁能量源的唯一手段。",dEN="The large hall at the top of Dun Argol houses the power source for the entire area. If you can destroy the power core, it will cripple Dun Argol for some time.\n\nNo power means no golems, no sentries, and no more lightning armaments.\n\nWhen we were sent up here, they told us these explosives were for excavation, but thanks to Iron Thane Furyhammer, the research has been scrapped. We may as well get some use out of them, though. They're the only thing we have on hand capable of destroying the power core.",o="使用莱加尔的炸药摧毁丹厄古尔的符文能量核心，然后返回勘探员哨站向莱加尔·断眉复命。",oEN="Use Raegar's Explosives to destroy the Runic Power Core at Dun Argol, then report to Raegar Breakbrow at Prospector's Point.",p="你断绝他们符文熔炉里面的能量来源了吗？",pEN="Have you disabled the power source for their runeforges?",c="<莱加尔·断眉表示同意的点点头。>\n\n我不能眼睁睁看着炸药被浪费掉，而这肯定可以拖慢敌人的脚步。",cEN="<Raegar nods approvingly.>\n\nI can't stand to see explosives go to waste and it'll set our enemies back for sure."}
Q[12155]={d="村子中央放置着一盏巨大的南瓜灯。它闪烁着诡异的光芒，透露出难以捉摸的诡异气息。\n\n击碎南瓜灯后，你发现了一枚烧焦的神圣符记。",dEN="This large jack-o'-lantern rests in the middle of the village. It eyes those who look upon it, betraying a dark menace within.\n\nSmashing the pumpking reveals an old, scorched holy symbol.",o="将烧焦的神圣符记交给戴面具的孤儿院长。",oEN="Give the Scorched Holy Symbol to the Masked Orphan Matron.",p="是的，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你是在无头骑士的南瓜灯里找到这个的？这是圣光的古老象征。它一定曾属于骑士，在他被诅咒、变成如今这怪物之前。谢谢你，<name>。这个象征理应与圣骑士们同在。我会确保他们收到。\n\n啊，差点忘了！你有一位秘密爱慕者……\n\n有个小姑娘想把这个送给你，但她太害羞了，不敢亲自给你。",cEN="You found this inside the Headless Horseman's jack-o-lantern? It is an old symbol of the Light. If must have been the Horseman's, before he was cursed and turned into the monster he is today. Thank you, <name>. This symbol deserves to be with paladins. I will make sure they get it.\n\nOh, and I almost forgot! You have a secret admirer...\n\nOne of the children wanted you to have this. She was too shy to give it to you herself."}
Q[12157]={d="我们能走到这一步真是幸运，$n。我们刚一登陆，天灾军团就伏击了我们。\n\n我们的人里有一个竟是天灾军团教派的间谍。看来萨萨里安掌握了更多邪教徒渗透的证据。显然，渗透已经深入到最高层。\n\n我派了我最好的信使之一前往我们在龙骨荒野西部的哨站，可他至今未归。我担心他已落入天灾军团之手。你愿意去龙骨荒野找他吗？他叫信使兰森。|n",dEN="We're lucky we made it this far, <name>. We were ambushed by Scourge as soon as we landed.\n\nOne of our men turned out to be a spy for the Cult of the Damned. Thassarian appears to have more evidence of cultist infiltration. Apparently it goes all the way to the top.\n\nI've sent one of my best couriers to our outpost in western Dragonblight, but he has not yet returned. I fear he may have fallen to the Scourge. Will you go to Dragonblight and search for him? Courier Lanson is his name.",o="与龙骨荒野群星之墓的信使兰森谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Courier Lanson at Star's Rest in Dragonblight.",c="当我通过桥进入龙骨荒野的时候，我被一小队的阿努巴尔虫族偷袭！我被团团围住！那些怪物知道我会来。遍体鳞伤的我差点逃不出来。我握有的这份名单一定要被送往暮冬要塞，可是，我伤得太重了，根本不能过去。",cEN="As I crossed the bridge into Dragonblight a small group of Anub'ar ambushed me! I was surrounded! Those monsters knew I was coming. I barely made it out of there with my flesh intact. This list I hold must be taken to Wintergarde Keep, but I am too badly injured to make the journey."}
Q[12158]={d="我其实很早就想派人去彻底调查一下空石矿洞了。可是一直没有适当的时机——毕竟，我这里的人仅仅是应付西边那群部落和东边那些铁矮人就够头疼的了。\n\n既然杜蒙特派你去调查矿洞，那么我想我至少得为你指明正确的方向。这也是我唯一能提供的帮助了，真是不好意思。\n\n你可以在西北方的不远处找到矿洞的入口。到了那边以后，记得评估一下那座矿洞的开采设备有没有被破坏，还有没有挽回的可能。在致远郡的矿洞重新投入生产之前，我们的确需要一些额外的资源。",dEN="I've been meaning to send some of our lads to check out Hollowstone Mine. Haven't had a chance to yet -- we've had our hands full between the Horde on the west and the iron dwarves to the east.\n\nIf Dumont sent you, though, the least I can do is point you in the right direction.\n\nYou'll find the mine entrance to the northwest, not far from here. See if you think operations there can be salvaged. We sure could use the additional resources until our mine in Farshire is operational again.",o="进入月溪旅营地西北方的空石矿洞寻找线索。",oEN="Look for clues inside Hollowstone Mine northwest of the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",c="你是来救我的吧，对吧！",cEN="You've come to help me, haven't you!"}
Q[12159]={d="<派特洛夫似乎是遭受到了某种沉重的打击，他的呼吸很沉重也很急促，双眼一直在扫视着矿洞内的一切。>\n\n我的同志们……我们必须让他们的灵魂得到安息！我一次又一次击败他们……可是……他们却一次又一次地站起来！\n\n我已经有了一个办法，但却不能下狠心去这么做。\n\n或许你可以帮我的忙？带着这盏灯，用里面的灯油净化他们的躯体，这样他们或许就再也不会站起来了……\n\n等下我会回答你所有的问题，先帮帮我的朋友们！",dEN="<Petrov looks deeply disturbed, breathing heavily and shifting his gaze nervously around the mine.>\n\nMy comrades... we must put their souls to rest! I kill them and kill them but.. they just come back!\n\nI've had an idea for a while but I just don't have the heart to do it myself.\n\nMaybe you can do this for me? Take this lantern and use its oil to burn their remains so they never get up again.\n\nI'll answer your questions later. Help my friends first!",o="空石矿洞的派特洛夫要求你使用矿工的灯笼净化8具空石矿工的躯体。",oEN="Petrov at Hollowstone Mine wants you to use the Miner's Lantern to burn the corpses of 8 Hollowstone Miners.",p="你把我的朋友们安葬了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you put my friends to rest yet, <name>?",c="安息吧我的朋友们！不要担心——我会告诉大家我们从没放弃过！",cEN="Rest in peace friends! Do not worry -- I will tell everyone that we never gave up!"}
Q[12160]={d="有效！太好了，有效！我的同志们终于可以得到安息了……\n\n我会留在这里完成其它的工作。我们这些空石矿工从不临阵脱逃，我们从不放弃！\n\n这恐怕也是阿鲁高视我们为眼中钉的原因，明白吗？我们死也不会加入他的拜狼教！",dEN="It worked! It worked! My comrades can finally enjoy their well-earned rest...\n\nI'll stay here and finish the job. We Hollowstone miners always finish the job -- we never give up!\n\nThat's why Arugal made an example of us. We wouldn't fall in line, you see? We wouldn't join his wolfcult!",o="向月溪旅营地的格里安·斯托曼复命。",oEN="Return to Captain Gryan Stoutmantle at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",c="运气真背。我们好不容易在山的这一面找到可以运作的矿洞，却满是天灾军团。\n\n没有恶意，我的朋友，但是你所发现的这些幸存者，因为失去朋友而发疯了。阿鲁高死很久了……我真的看过他的坟墓。",cEN="Curse our luck. We find the one functioning mine this side of the hills and it's full of Scourge.\n\nNo offense, friend. But that survivor you found sounds like he's been a little traumatized due to losing his friends. Arugal's been dead for years... I even saw his grave once."}
Q[12161]={d="你好。我刚才无意中听到你和中士的谈话，我刚好知道点什么，所以只想提醒你一下……诺森德的事情没有这么简单。\n\n某个人仅仅是死了的话，绝不会简单地退出历史的舞台，这里死而复生的事情你还见得少了吗？\n\n此地西南方，就在沃达希尔小径附近居住着一位名叫盲眼卢娜的女人。据说，这个女人可以与死者交谈，还能看见过去或未来的一些情景。\n\n虽然不太清楚你这里的情况，但我感觉她会对你有所帮助。",dEN="Hey there. I overheard what you were saying to the captain and I just want you to know... things aren't that simple in Northrend.\n\nJust because someone's dead it doesn't mean they're out of the picture.\n\nSouthwest of here, near Vordrassil Pass, lives a blind woman who goes by the name Ruuna the Blind. They say she speaks to the dead and has visions of the past and future.\n\nI haven't heard your whole story but it sounds like she'd be right up your alley.",o="转至沃达希尔小径附近的卢娜的营地，与盲眼卢娜谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ruuna the Blind at Ruuna's Camp near Vordrassil Pass.",c="你寻找你见识所及以外的知识，所以你跑来找我。陌生人，我得警告你，我提供的答案恐怕不是你所期待的。",cEN="You seek knowledge beyond your reach so you've come to me. I must warn you, stranger, the answers I provide might not be to your liking."}
Q[12164]={d="是时候了，$n。必须除掉阿鲁高。\n\n我们要集结一小队值得信赖的精锐冒险者转至海岸对面的血月岛，就在东边。\n\n我们必须组织一次快速的打击。先清除掉阿鲁高手下最忠心的几个守卫，等到你正式向他挑战时，我会及时赶来的。",dEN="It is time, then, <name>. Arugal must be defeated.\n\nGet a couple of people you can trust and head for Bloodmoon Isle. It's just off the coast, east of here.\n\nWe'll hit them fast. Take out Arugal's lieutenants -- I'll catch up with you when it's time to take out the monster himself.",o="白松商栈的萨莎要求你转至血月岛，杀死塞拉斯、瓦拉姆、污血之喉和阿鲁高之影。",oEN="Sasha at the White Pine Trading Post wants you to go to Bloodmoon Isle and slay Selas, Varlam, Goremaw and the Shade of Arugal.",p="见到你真好，<name>。",pEN="It's good to see you, <name>.",c="我们狠狠揍了他，<name>。但还不够狠。\n\n有一点可以肯定……我们不会在这一带再见到他了。",cEN="We got him good, <name>. But not good enough.\n\nOne thing's for sure... we won't be seeing him around these parts any longer."}
Q[12165]={d="勘测员罗卡尔决定帮我们。他想出了一条借铁矮人之力对付他们自己的计策。\n\n我得承认，我们这位新\"朋友\"比我先前以为的要精明。他说得对，我们人太少，无法正面强攻。\n\n前往东南方雪原上的敦阿格尔，从那里的铁符文铁匠手中夺取他们战争魔像蓝图的全部碎片。把拼合好的蓝图带给罗卡尔，我们再看看他的计划是否真有价值。",dEN="Prospector Rokar has decided to help us. He's concocted a plan to use the iron dwarves' strength against them.\n\nI must admit, our new 'friend' is more insightful than I'd given him credit for. He's correct in that our numbers are too few for a direct attack.\n\nTravel to Dun Argol, in the snowy regions to the southeast, and capture all the parts of their war golem blueprints from the iron rune-smiths there. Bring the assembled blueprint to Rokar and we'll see if his plan has any merit.",o="将完整的作战魔像蓝图交给欧尼瓦营地的勘探员罗卡尔。",oEN="Bring the completed War Golem Blueprints to Prospector Rokar at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你……你拿到我要的蓝图了吗？",pEN="Do... do you have those blueprints I asked for?",c="托尔玛克决定要采用这个计划了吗？我猜如果他否决了这个任务，他不会派你来的。\n\n噢，麻烦……我该怎么在这么大压力之下搞清楚要怎么把零件拼起来？",cEN="So Tormak's going to go ahead with the plan? I suppose he wouldn't have sent you if he didn't.\n\nOh, bother... Now how am I going to figure out how to put this together under all this pressure?"}
Q[12166]={d="$R，你愿意帮我吗？\n\n天灾军团已经推进到北边的冰雾村。他们所到之处散布污秽，大地上的生灵饱受折磨。\n\n拿着这瓶药剂，里面装满了取自月井的艾露恩液态之火。请用它净化你找到的被枯萎感染的野生动物尸体。",dEN="<race> will you assist me?\n\nThe Scourge have moved into Icemist to the north. Wherever they go, they spread their taint, and the creatures of the land suffer.\n\nTake this vial, which is filled with the liquid fire of Elune from the moonwell. Please, use the liquid to cleanse the corpses of the blighted wildlife that you find.",o="群星之墓的典狱官朱蒂·月歌要你使用艾露恩的火油净化6只天灾麋鹿的尸体和6只狂暴灰熊的尸体。",oEN="Warden Jodi Moonsong at Stars' Rest has asked you to use the Liquid Fire of Elune to cleanse the corpses of 6 Blighted Elk and 6 Rabid Grizzlies.",p="很惭愧的，我们不能在它们成为天灾军团的牺牲者时，治愈这些熊与麋鹿。\n\n至少我们可以阻止污染的蔓延。",pEN="It is a shame that we cannot heal the bears and elk that have fallen victim to the Scourge presence.\n\nAt least we can prevent the taint from spreading further.",c="我们已经对这片土地上的生物倾尽全力了，我们必须对造成这一切的幕后主使采取直接的手段！",cEN="We have done what we can for the creatures of the land. Now we must take direct action against those that have caused this!"}
Q[12167]={d="阿努巴尔教徒是间接造成动物们感染瘟疫的原因，因此我们必须阻止他们！\n\n他们衣服里冒出的毒雾会渗入那些接近过他们的生物体内，污染着环境。\n\n你必须到北面的冰雾村去杀了他们，把他们的衣服给我带来，我会妥善处理掉。",dEN="The Anub'ar cultists are indirectly responsible for the plaguing of the beasts, and we must put an end to it!\n\nThe fumes that emit from the cultists' suits seep into everything they come near, poisoning and corrupting their surroundings.\n\nYou must go north to Icemist Village and slay them. Bring back any of their suits that survive your assault and I will see to it that they are properly disposed of.",o="群星之墓的典狱官朱蒂·月歌要你收集5件教徒的衣物。",oEN="Collect 5 Functional Cultist Suits for Warden Jodi Moonsong at Stars' Rest.",p="这些教徒正在污染生物！",pEN="The cultists are a blight upon creation!",c="干得好。\n\n我会处理这些污秽的服装，投入月亮井中净化，并以女神之力摧毁它们。",cEN="Well done.\n\nI will dispose of these filthy garments by cleansing them in the moonwell and destroying them through the power of the goddess!"}
Q[12168]={d="这件信物的背面刻着一段铭文：\n\n\"给我最钟爱的学生：\n\n如果你继续展现出潜力，我会教你超乎想象的奇观。\n\n如果你不能，我就毁了你！\n\n一如既往，\n\n高阶邪教徒赞古斯\"\n\n群星之rest的守望者一定想看看这个。",dEN="An inscription on the back of the favor reads,\n\n\"To my favorite pupil,\n\nIf you continue to show promise, I will teach you wonders beyond your imaginings.\n\nIf you do not, I will have you destroyed!\n\nAs ever,\n\nHigh Cultist Zangus\"\n\nNo doubt the warden at Stars' Rest will want to see this.",o="将扎古斯的礼物交给群星之墓的典狱官朱蒂·月歌要。",oEN="Deliver the Favor of Zangus to Warden Jodi Moonsong at Stars' Rest.",p="我感觉到有污秽之物就在附近。\n\n它就在你身上！那是什么，<name>？",pEN="I sense something foul is near.\n\nIt is upon your person! What is it, <name>?",c="这么说，教徒首领已经现身了。我们知道了他的名字。\n\n虚荣和骄傲将会是他的致命伤！",cEN="So, the leader of the cultists has revealed himself. We have a name.\n\nVanity and pride will be his downfall!"}
Q[12169]={d="我曾经梦见过扎古斯，但如果没有你发现的这些文字，我就不可能理解那个梦意味着什么。你的发现让我明白了，这是女神给我的指示，而我们已经知道，他就在北面的纳尔苏深渊里。\n\n你知道该怎么做，$n。为了拯救这片土地，必须除掉这个高阶教徒！",dEN="I have dreamed of Zangus before but without the context that you have discovered, I knew not what it meant. You have brought clarity to the vision that the goddess has bestowed upon me, and now I know that he can be found within the Pit of Narjun to the north.\n\nYou know your target, <name>. If there's to be an end to the suffering of the land, the high cultist must die!",o="群星之墓的典狱官朱蒂·月歌要你杀死高阶教徒扎古斯。",oEN="Warden Jodi Moonsong at Stars' Rest has asked you to slay High Cultist Zangus.",p="我感觉到高阶邪教徒赞古斯还活着。\n\n有什么事吗，<name>？也许你需要先休息一下？",pEN="I sense that High Cultist Zangus yet lives.\n\nIs there something wrong, <name>? Perhaps you need to rest first?",c="[“高阶邪教徒既已消灭，他残余的势力便可逐一清除，这片土地和它的生灵也将恢复。\n\n谢谢你，<name>。愿月神照亮你的道路。”]",cEN="With the high cultist destroyed, the rest of his forces can be mopped up and the land and its creatures will recover.\n\nThank you, <name>. May the goddess illuminate your path."}
Q[12170]={d="我们在这里出现后不久，风险投资公司就放弃了他们在这里的工程。显然他们担心我们会对他们贪婪的小把戏有所行动。\n\n既然他们已经离开了，他们的伐木场也就属于公共财产了。我们的战争机器是一头饥饿的野兽……如果没有持续不断的补给，我们是不可能成功抵达冰冠冰川的。\n\n不过，联盟似乎和我们有着相同的想法，因此我们必须保证只有部落才是最终获胜的一方。向伐木场出发吧，帮我们对抗那些联盟狗。",dEN="The Venture Company abandoned operations shortly after we showed up. Clearly they were afraid of what we were going to do to their greedy little hides.\n\nWith them gone, their logging camps are up for grabs. Our war machine is a hungry beast... without renewing our supplies we won't make it to Icecrown.\n\nUnfortunately the Alliance seems to have the same idea and we must make sure we're the ones that prevail. Head into the logging camp and help us fight the Alliance scum.",o="骑兵队长克洛恩希望你在黑水伐木场击杀10名联盟士兵或者玩家。",oEN="Raider Captain Kronn wants you to slay 10 Alliance units or players at the Blackriver Logging Camp.",p="你把联盟狗宰光了吗？胜利是属于我们的！",pEN="Have you slain the Alliance dogs? Victory must be ours!",c="干得好，<name>。我们对伐木营地的控制也许还不完全，但多亏了你，我们离粉碎这些联盟虫子又近了一步。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Our control over the logging camp might not be complete yet, but thanks to you we're one step closer to smashing these Alliance worms."}
Q[12171]={d="你必须立即把我手里的这份名单交给高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。他指挥的第七军团就驻扎在龙骨荒野东部的暮冬要塞里。\n\n如果这份名单上的叛徒进入了暮冬要塞……那就太可怕了。\n\n赶快，$n。把这份文件给群星之墓这里的帕蕾娜·银云看看，向她解释你的任务性质。她会派最快的角鹰兽送你转至暮冬要塞！",dEN="The list I hold must be delivered to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. He commands the 7th Legion, stationed at Wintergarde Keep on the eastern borders of Dragonblight.\n\nIf any of the traitors on this list are stationed at Wintergarde... it could be catastrophic.\n\nHurry, <name>. Show the document to Palena Silvercloud here at Stars' Rest and explain the nature of your mission. She will put you on her fastest hippogryph to Wintergarde!",o="向群星之墓的帕蕾娜·银云出示联盟信函。",oEN="Show the Alliance Missive to Palena Silvercloud at Stars' Rest.",p="你好，<race>。",pEN="Hello, <race>.",c="<帕莱娜读完便条。>\n\n你骑我最快的角鹰兽去，<race>！这情报必须立刻送到高等指挥官温布雷德手中！",cEN="<Palena reads the note.>\n\nYou will take my fastest hippogryph, <race>! This information must be delivered to High Commander Wyrmbane at once!"}
Q[12172]={d="你好，$g法师:法师;。\n\n此刻你一定在想，达拉然在哪里，又该怎么去。我会帮你。\n\n但在我教你怎么传送到我们那座伟大城市之前，你必须先与诺森德的魔网调谐。否则，你可能会在过程中把自己毁掉。\n\n拿着这颗调谐水晶，在西边月溪花园那根涌动之针下方的坑里使用它。之后你就$g可以:可以;学习这个法术了。",dEN="Welcome, mage.\n\nBy now you must be wondering where Dalaran is and how to get there. I will help you.\n\nBut before I can teach you how to teleport to our great city, you must attune yourself to the ley lines of Northrend. Otherwise, you risk destroying yourself in the process.\n\nTake this attunement crystal and use it in the pit under the surge needle at the Moonrest Gardens to the west. Then you will be ready to learn the spell.",o="群星之墓的大法师茉德拉的影像要你与诺森德的魔网能量线进行调和。",oEN="The Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest has asked you to become Attuned to the Ley Lines of Northrend.",p="你调谐好了吗？这事可不能撒谎，<name>。\n\n如果你没有做好准备，而我把法术教给你，那你第一次施放它，就会是别人最后一次见到你！",pEN="Are you attuned? You mustn't lie about this, <name>.\n\nIf you fail to prepare yourself properly, and I teach you the spell, the first time that you cast it will be the last time anyone will ever see you!",c="很好。如果你准备好，那我也就准备好了。",cEN="Very well. If you are ready, then so am I."}
Q[12173]={d="你好，$g法师:法师;。\n\n此刻你一定在想，达拉然在哪里，又该怎么去。我会帮你。\n\n但在我教你怎么传送到我们那座伟大城市之前，你必须先与诺森德的魔网调谐。否则，你可能会在过程中把自己毁掉。\n\n拿着这颗调谐水晶，在西南方月溪花园那根涌动之针下方的坑里使用它。之后你就$g可以:可以;学习我要教你的东西了。",dEN="Hello, mage.\n\nBy now you must be wondering where Dalaran is and how to get there. I can help you with this if you can survive a simple test.\n\nBefore I teach you how to teleport to our great city, you must attune yourself to the ley lines of Northrend. Otherwise, you will destroy yourself in the process!\n\nTake this attunement crystal and use it in the pit under the surge needle at the Moonrest Gardens to the southwest. Then you will be ready to learn what I have to teach.",o="阿格玛之锤的大法师艾萨斯·夺日者的影像要你与诺森德的魔网能量线进行调和。",oEN="The Image of Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Agmar's Hammer has asked you to become Attuned to the Ley Lines of Northrend.",c="很好，如果你自认准备好了，那就别浪费时间了。",cEN="Very well. If you think you are ready, then let's not waste anymore of my time."}
Q[12174]={d="<帕莱娜把信函递还给你。>\n\n暴风雪会送你到冬境要塞，$n。我保证，这将是你坐过最快的一趟飞行。现在就去！|n",dEN="<Palena hands the missive back to you.>\n\nSnowstorm will take you to Wintergarde, <name>. I guarantee you that it will be the fastest flight you've ever taken. Go now!",o="把联盟信函送到龙骨荒野东部冬境要塞的高等指挥官哈福德·温布雷德手中。|n",oEN="Deliver the Alliance Missive to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in eastern Dragonblight.",p="士兵，你去过那里了吗？",pEN="What have you got there, soldier?",c="<高等指挥官读完信函，随后把它揉成一团。>\n\n你知道这名单上的人现在在哪儿吗？去外面正门前看看。他们就吊在那些拱门上。\n\n食尸鬼的饵料……<El Alto Comandante lee la misiva y luego la arruga>",cEN="<The High Commander reads the missive and then crumples it up.>\n\nDo you know where the people on this list are now? Take a look outside, near the front gate. They're the ones hanging from the arches.\n\nGhoul bait..."}
Q[12175]={d="我跟你说，$g老兄:妹子;。等你被派去给部落的军队置办行头，用掉的皮子可海了去了！\n\n征服者克蕾娜，就是管这地方的那头母狼，给我定了个很紧的期限。要是我到这周末还没把她的整个团装备好，她就要把我扔进坑里跟熊搏斗。\n\n帮我一把，我给你好价钱。我需要灰雾猎手的皮子。\n\n你会在北边一带找到它们，成群结队地猎鹿。记住，$g老兄:妹子;。好价钱！",dEN="Let me tell you something, mon. When you get put in charge of outfittin' the armies of the Horde, you go through a lot of hides!\n\nConqueror Krenna, the she-wolf runnin' this place, she gave me a tight deadline. If I don't outfit her whole regiment by week's end she's gonna have me wrestling bears in the pit.\n\nHelp me out and I'll pay you top price. I'll be needin' hides from graymist hunters.\n\nYou'll find them all around in pockets to the north, hunting stag. Remember, mon. Top price!",o="征服堡的皮货商人休尼克希望你能从北面森林的灰雾捕猎者身上获取3张灰色座狼皮。",oEN="Hidetrader Jun'ik in Conquest Hold wants you to get 3 Gray Worg Hides from Graymist Hunters in the woods to the north.",p="老兄，你拿到座狼皮了吗？",pEN="You get dose hides, mon?",c="你可是救命恩人，<brother/sister>。如果你还想接活，这样的东西还有的是。",cEN="You're a life saver, <brother/sister>. If you're interested in more work, there's more where that came from."}
Q[12176]={d="克蕾娜要给所有制服都用座狼皮。可她的军队根本凑不齐那么多，现在凑不齐，永远也凑不齐。\n\n那些座狼瘦得没什么皮，$g老兄:妹子;！我们这么办……前提是你嘴够严。\n\n沃尔德伦以东有肥得像食人魔的灰熊。我们就用那些大皮子！\n\n快点，$g伙计:伙计;，克蕾娜可没什么耐心。",dEN="Krenna, she be wantin' worg hides for all the outfits. There's not gonna be enough worg hides for her army, though. Not now, not ever.\n\nThose worgs -- they be skinny, mon! Here's what we're gonna do... if you can keep a secret that is.\n\nEast of Voldrune there be grizzly bears as fat as an ogre. Those large hides -- those we can use!\n\nHurry, <brother/sister>. Krenna's not known for her patience.",o="皮货商人休尼克希望你能交给他6张灰熊皮。",oEN="Hidetrader Jun'ik wants you to bring him 6 Grizzly Hides.",p="老兄，你拿到灰熊皮了吗？",pEN="You get those hides, mon?",c="我欠你的，伙计。拿这个当报酬吧。",cEN="I'm in your debt, mon. Take this as payment."}
Q[12177]={d="哎，我们有个小麻烦。灰熊皮……是棕色的，$g老兄:妹子;！\n\n想想……想想！\n\n有了，$g老兄:妹子;！你看，灰色是黑和白混出来的。你给我弄点煤和一些面粉，我把它们磨碎，撒在皮子上。谁都不会发现！\n\n铁匠卖冶炼用的煤，面粉可以找补给商买。",dEN="Ah, we have a small problem. Grizzly hides... they be brown, mon!\n\nThink... think!\n\nI got it, mon! Is like this: gray is black an' white all mixed up. You get me some coal an' some flour, I'll grind it all up and dust the hides with it. No one will know the better!\n\nBlacksmiths sell coal for smeltin' an' you can get flour from the provisioner.",o="将1份煤块和5份面粉交给灰熊丘陵征服堡的皮货商人休尼克。",oEN="Bring 1 piece of Coal and 5 Simple Flour to Hidetrader Jun'ik at Conquest Hold in Grizzly Hills.",p="东西拿来了吗，老兄？",pEN="You get the stuff, mon?",c="往好处想吧，伙计。",cEN="Hope for the best, mon."}
Q[12178]={d="就这么定了，$g老兄:妹子;。把这些皮子拿去给克蕾娜，看看能不能过关。\n\n我们俩最好都祈祷克蕾娜别看出什么来。",dEN="This is it, mon. Let's take these hides to Krenna and see if they pass the test.\n\nLet's hope for both our sakes Krenna doesn't notice anything.",o="将一捆兽皮交给征服堡的克雷娜。",oEN="Take the Bundle of Hides to Krenna in Conquest Hold.",p="你以为你在和谁说话？",pEN="Do you have any idea who you're talking to?",c="谁派你来的？这些毛皮闻起来跟面粉一样！\n\n这对部落而言是奇耻大辱！",cEN="Just who do you take me for? These hides smell of flour!\n\nThis is a complete insult to the Horde!"}
Q[12180]={d="莱加尔派了一队勘察员转至丹厄古尔寻找古器，顺便收集关于这座遗址的历史数据。他们未曾料到丹厄古尔竟是个有重兵把守的要塞。\n\n勘察小队被丹厄古尔的铁矮人囚禁起来了。我们暂时找不到接替他们的人手，而莱加尔整日里挖空心思地计划如何打败铁矮人，根本无暇顾及此事。\n\n$n，营救勘察员的重任就交给你啦。铁矮人或是他们的仆从身上可能携带着囚笼的钥匙。",dEN="Raegar sent a team of prospectors into Dun Argol to search for artifacts and information about the history of the settlement. Raegar's team never expected Dun Argol to be this heavily populated.\n\nThey're being held captive while the iron dwarves prepare for war. We haven't the men to charge in after them, and Raegar's too busy fantasizing about defeating the irons to be of much help.\n\nIt falls to you, <name>. Any of the irons or their servants could be carrying the keys to the cages holding our men.",o="营救勘探员甘恩、勘探员托尔根和勘探员瓦拉纳，然后返回勘探员哨站，向巡山人基连复命。",oEN="Free Prospector Gann, Prospector Torgan, and Prospector Varana, then return to Mountaineer Kilian at Prospector's Point.",p="你找到失踪的勘探员了吗？",pEN="Did you locate the missing prospectors?",c="<巡山人基连听你转述被俘的勘探员对你所说的内容。>\n\n他们提到了洛肯以及一场对抗石巨人的战争？你确定吗？\n\n那么莱加尔的直觉没有错。我们得想个办法潜进去，调查清楚他们的计划。",cEN="<Mountaineer Kilian listens as you relate what the captive prospectors told you.>\n\nThey mentioned Kronus and a war against stone giants? You're certain?\n\nSo Raegar's instincts were right. We have to find a way to get in there and learn more about their plans."}
Q[12181]={d="哎呀，哎呀，这都过了多久了？我们研究这该死的瘟疫研究多久了？终于，在无数次失败之后，我们被赐予了完美之作。这东西……甚至还连个正式名字都没有！这枯萎……对了，就叫枯萎！这枯萎将撕碎生命的根基！\n\n<哈里斯递给你一瓶药剂。>\n\n现在，找到蝙蝠管理员托比亚斯，把样本给他看。他会安排你前往怨毒镇。|n",dEN="My, my, how long has it been? How long have we been working on this damned plague? Finally, after an eternity of failure, we are blessed with perfection. This... It doesn't even have a proper name yet! This blight... That's it, BLIGHT! This blight will tear down the very fabric of life!\n\n<Harris hands you a vial.>\n\nNow, find the bat handler, Tobias, and show him the specimen. He'll get you on your way to Venomspite.",o="把枯萎样本给新阿加曼德的托比亚斯·萨克霍夫看。|n",oEN="Show the Blight Specimen to Tobias Sarkhoff at New Agamand.",p="要把凋零天灾样本送到怨毒镇？快上蝙蝠吧！",pEN="Highly lethal poisonous gas delivery to Venomspite? Step right up!",c="呃，是啊，你可以带着瓶子上去，我相信你。",cEN="Uh, yea, you can go ahead and hold on to that vial, friend. I trust you."}
Q[12182]={d="我为你准备了一只特别的蝙蝠，$g伙计:朋友;。是我这儿最快最稳的坐骑。它会直接把你送到怨毒镇……风风光光地送去。\n\n落地后把药剂交给首席瘟疫使者米德尔顿就行。",dEN="I got a special bat all lined up for you, buddy. Fastest and smoothest ride I've got. He'll take you right to Venomspite - in style.\n\nJust hand that vial over to Chief Plaguebringer Middleton once you land.",o="转至龙骨荒野东部的怨毒镇，将凋零药剂样本交给首席药剂师米德尔顿。",oEN="Deliver the Blight Specimen to Chief Plaguebringer Middleton at Venomspite in eastern Dragonblight.",p="你就是那个送货的<boy/girl>？",pEN="You are the delivery <boy/girl>?",c="好个愉悦的一天！看，往东北方去、越过山脉，有一大群的天灾军团等着我们来消灭！",cEN="Oh joyous day! And look, just beyond the mountain to the northeast creeps a whole field of Scourge for us to obliterate!"}
Q[12183]={d="如果正如勘测员瓦拉娜所说，只有某些铁矮人获准与那个叫洛肯的联系，那享有此特权的多半是监工。\n\n我们得把你送进去，看看这一切究竟是怎么回事，但这可不容易。第一步是给你弄一套像样的制服。\n\n然后，我们再操心给你化妆的事。\n\n去敦阿格尔找一个监工，杀了他，带回他的制服。要是沾上血，那$g只能怪:只能怪;你自己。",dEN="If, as Prospector Varana said, only certain irons are permitted to communicate with this Loken, it'll probably be the overseers who have the privilege.\n\nWe have to get you in there to see what all this is about, but it won't be easy. The first step will be to get a proper uniform for you.\n\nThen, we'll worry about doing your makeup.\n\nFind one of the overseers at Dun Argol, kill him, and bring back his uniform. If you get blood on it, you'll have only yourself to blame.",o="将一件监工的制服交给勘探员哨站的巡山人基连。",oEN="Bring an Overseer's Uniform to Mountaineer Kilian at Prospector's Point.",p="你拿到制服了吗？",pEN="Did you get the uniform?",c="<基利安从你手中接过制服。>\n\n这个应该行。我没时间再缝上一块绣着“<name>”的小补丁什么的了，但等我们把你打扮完，任何仔细打量你的人都应该会相信你是个监工。",cEN="<Kilian takes the uniform from you.>\n\nThis should do. I won't have time to sew on a little patch with '<name>' embroidered on it or anything, but anyone looking closely at you should be convinced that you're an overseer by the time we're done with you."}
Q[12184]={d="制服已经到手啦，不过我们需要更为详细的数据来完善伪装。\n\n这台相机是莱加尔用来记录探险队的发现的，不过它或许能派上别的用场。我要你带上它进入丹厄古尔，拍摄一些铁矮人的照片。\n\n当然，你的模特们很可能不是那么合作，如此一来呢，你就必须……嗯……制伏他们。完成任务后把相机和照片一同带回来给我。",dEN="Now that we've got the uniform, we've got to get enough information to complete your camouflage.\n\nRaegar brought along this camera to document the team's finds, but I have a different use in mind. I want you to take it with you to Dun Argol and use it to capture the images of iron dwarves.\n\nOf course, your models aren't going to be a cooperative lot, so you may have to, err... subdue them first. Bring back the camera and the images when you're done.",o="用基连的相机拍摄8张丹厄古尔铁矮人的照片，然后返回勘探员哨站，向巡山人基连复命。",oEN="Use Kilian's Camera to record the images of 8 Iron Dwarves in Dun Argol, then return to Mountaineer Kilian at Prospector's Point.",p="相片到手了吗？",pEN="Did you get those snapshots?",c="好，这些就派得上用场了。马上来做一个让你有办法让铁矮人信服的玩意儿。",cEN="Good, these should do. Now, to create a kit to pass you off as a convincing iron dwarf."}
Q[12185]={d="用你拍到的影像，我已经做好了监工伪装套装所需的一切。恕我自夸，你会是个像模像样的铁矮人。\n\n带着套装去敦阿格尔，用它伪装自己，然后前往城中宽阔中层最东边的那栋建筑。\n\n在那里，你应该会看到一个基座，族长和监工们就是从那里接受那个叫洛肯的命令。伪装状态下激活它，尽可能多打听些东西。$gdesapercibido:desapercibida;",dEN="Using the images you've captured, I've created everything you need for your overseer disguise kit. You'll make a fine iron dwarf, if I do say so myself.\n\nTake the kit with you to Dun Argol, use it to disguise yourself, then go to the easternmost building on the broad middle tier of the city.\n\nThere, you should see a pedestal where the thane and overseers receive their orders from this Loken. Activate it while disguised and learn all you can from the communication.",o="伪装成铁符文监工，截获洛肯的指令，然后返回勘探员哨站，向巡山人基连复命。",oEN="Disguise yourself as an Iron Rune Overseer, intercept the message from Loken, then report to Mountaineer Kilian at Prospector's Point.",p="伪装有用吗？",pEN="Did the disguise work?",c="难道克罗努斯其实并没有夸大其词？泰坦的石之子和铁之子为了争夺古城奥杜尔的控制权而互相残杀。这太疯狂了，<name>，这可能毁掉我们了解矮人真实历史的唯一机会！",cEN="Could it be that Kronus isn't really exaggerating? The titans' stone and iron sons fighting against each other for control of the ancient city of Ulduar. This is madness, <name> and it could destroy our only chance to learn the true history of dwarvenkind!"}
Q[12188]={d="凋零药剂的化学组成是怎样它如何生效如何发挥其功能等等，这些细节问题都完全不重要。你所需要知道的仅仅就是：它是否能按设计指标达成它的性能，这就足够了。我已经成功地把成分导入了休眠状态。\n\n<米德尔顿拔开一个试管的塞子，放在鼻子边上猛吸了一口。>\n\n看，完全没事，我的身体完全没变化。这种成分只要混入使它重新活化的催化剂，就能恢复威力。\n\n现在的课题就是找到催化剂最合理的成分。你可以在南边海滩上找到许多联盟士兵的鬼魂。把他们干掉，然后把他们身上的灵质残渣带回来给我。",dEN="The details behind the functionality of the blight are hardly important. All you need to know is that it does the job it was designed to do. I have managed to synthesize a strain of the blight that is inert.\n\n<Middleton uncorks a vial and inhales.>\n\nSee, my body is still, mostly, intact. Now mix this with a reactive agent and we'd all be turned to shapeless piles of goo.\n\nOn the beach south of here you will find pathetic specters of Alliance soldiers past. Slay them and bring me ectoplasmic residue.",o="怨毒镇的首席药剂师米德尔顿要求你给他带回10份灵质残渣。",oEN="Chief Plaguebringer Middleton at Venomspite in Dragonblight wants you to bring him 10 Ectoplasmic Residue.",p="灵质残渣可以用作引导凋零药剂的活性触媒！",pEN="The residue will be used as the reactive agent to activate the blight!",c="这些正合适，<name>。那些可怜的小崽子是反抗了，还是只顾着洒下满怀悲痛的幽灵之泪？\n\n啊，他们就是这么多愁善感……",cEN="This will do nicely, <name>. Did those pathetic whelps put up a fight or did they just shower you with ghostly tears of sorrow?\n\nAh, they get so emotional..."}
Q[12189]={d="新阿加曼德发出的货物本该上周就送到怨毒镇，经过几次简单的野外测试后就交到我手上。这是部落的紧要之事——是\"胜利拼图\"的最后一块。\n\n<辛塔尔叹了口气。>\n\n知道自己被白痴和无能蠢货包围，真让人泄气！\n\n你必须前往龙骨荒野东部边境附近的怨毒镇。找到那个小丑米德尔顿，告诉他我还在等那件包裹。",dEN="The shipment from New Agamand was to arrive at Venomspite last week and then be delivered to me after some simple field tests. It is a Horde imperative - the last piece of the \"victory puzzle.\"\n\n<Sintar sighs.>\n\nIt is quite disheartening to know that you are surrounded by imbeciles and incompetent boobs!\n\nYou must travel to Venomspite, near the eastern border of Dragonblight. Find that buffoon, Middleton, and let him know that I am waiting on the package.",o="前往龙骨荒野的怨毒镇，与首席瘟疫使者米德尔顿交谈。|n",oEN="Travel to Venomspite in Dragonblight and speak with Chief Plaguebringer Middleton.",c="我们遇到了一个小小的——微不足道的——问题。每个试着要碰凋零药剂的人都蒸发了。我们企图些微调整这个配方，好让你不会只是在路边看它一眼你就爆了。好消息是，我就快要想出来了！",cEN="We ran into a little - MINOR - problem. Everyone that tried handling the blight vaporized. We're working on adjusting the formula a tad so it doesn't instantly kill you for looking at it sideways. The good news is that I think I've almost got it!"}
Q[12190]={d="哈考尔肯定愿意用金砖来换这些精选的材料。你只需把东西都带给他就行啦。\n\n他就驻营在东部海岸的那些废墟附近——好像是叫达基尔金废墟什么的。\n\n你应该能在我处理掉这些尸体之前达到那里……除非，你情愿待在这里帮这些尸体涂上防腐剂？",dEN="Harkor's gunna drop a gold brick when he sees these choice ingredients. All that be left is gettin' them to him.\n\nHe's camped out on the eastern coast near dem haunted ruins - Drakil'jin, dey be called.\n\nYou'll likely be makin' it there before I can finish up with these corpses... unless, ya think you'd rather try your hand at embalming?",o="普雷蒙希望你将哈考尔的调料的交给哈考尔营地的哈考尔。",oEN="Prigmon wants you to bring Harkor's Ingredients to Harkor at Harkor's Camp.",p="我能为你做什么？",pEN="What can I do fer ya?",c="很好！好心的老普雷蒙让你把东西送来我这？\n\n有了这些，就能弄一顿好吃的啦。只要再来几样东西……",cEN="Well now! Good ol' Prigmon sent ya did he?\n\nThis should make fer some mighty fine eatin'. Needs just a couple things..."}
Q[12191]={d="讨厌的黑铁矮人发动了反击！你能在必须的时候保护自己吗？更重要的是，你能够保护我们的财产吗？我们最好得要考验一下你的实力。\n\n掷杯训练器已经准备就绪啦，来试试吧？拿起免费美酒节取样器喝上几口，然后将酒杯抛向训练器！击中目标5次后再来找我谈谈！",dEN="Those pesky Dark Irons are back! We need to make sure that you can defend yourself if needed. More importantly, we need to know that you can defend our property!\n\nS.T.O.U.T. here is ready for action, are you? Drink from the Complimentary Brewfest Samplers then throw the mug at S.T.O.U.T.! Hit the target 5 times then talk to me.",o="用免费美酒节取样器击中掷杯训练器5次，然后与比兹尔·奎利弗谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Complimentary Brewfest Sampler to hit S.T.O.U.T. 5 times, then talk to Bizzle Quicklift.",p="干了这一杯，打个嗝，然后拿酒杯丢S·T·O·U·T·。我想他承受得了这种攻击。要是他做不到，我干嘛把他给偷……呃……制造出来！",pEN="Chug from the mug, then chuck the mug at S.T.O.U.T. I think he can withstand the pounding. I wouldn't have stol.. er... built him if he couldn't!",c="哇……S·T·O·U·T·没有坏掉……嗯……谁想得到？\n\n我的意思是，嗯，你办到了！你的准头不赖，起码够保护这个营地了。我想你已经准备好对付那些黑铁矮人，要是他们胆敢再出现的话。",cEN="Wow... S.T.O.U.T. didn't break... Hmm... Who would have guessed?\n\nI mean, hey, you did it! Your aim is true, or at least true enough to help guard the camp. I think you're ready now to take on the Dark Irons if they show up again."}
Q[12192]={d="黑铁矮人遭到了重创！在他们仓惶逃回黑铁酒吧时，有数架运输机坠毁了。更重要的是，今天……你成功地保卫了营地的安全。\n\n将你击退黑铁矮人的英雄事迹告诉比兹尔吧。",dEN="The Dark Irons took a beating! As they rushed back to the Grim Guzzler, a portion of their transport fell off. More importantly, you managed to keep the camp safe... today.\n\nHead over to Bizzle and explain your heroic triumph over the Dark Iron dwarves.",o="与美酒节营地的比兹尔·奎利弗谈一谈。",oEN="Talk to Bizzle Quicklift in the Brewfest camp.",c="这么说你阻止了黑铁矮人……而且还是醉着的时候？<class>，这才是真正的美酒节精神！我猜，本着美酒节的精神，你是来要领奖币的。\n\n谢谢你的帮助，<name>。好好享受剩下的美酒节吧。",cEN="So you managed to stop the Dark Irons... While drunk too? That, <class>, is truly the spirit of Brewfest! I guess in keeping with the spirit of Brewfest you want your prize tokens.\n\nThanks for your help, <name>. Enjoy the rest of Brewfest."}
Q[12193]={d="美酒节除了赛羊会外，还有一项传统，那就是饮酒狂欢！如果你有时间的话，就将这张礼品券交给贝尔比吧。她就在美酒节营地的后面。要是你看不见她，没关系，她一定会看见你的。\n\n无论如何，将礼品券交给她，你就能免费领到一只美酒节酒杯。她还出售各种美酒哦。",dEN="Brewfest isn't just about racing rams, it's also about drinking! When you have a moment, take this voucher to Belbi Quikswitch. She's near the back of the Brewfest camp. If you can't see her, don't worry, she'll be sure to see you.\n\nIn any case, take this voucher to her to get your free Brewfest stein. She'll also be more than happy to handle any and all other Brewfest transactions.",o="在美酒节营地的贝尔比处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Belbi Quikswitch in the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="噢，只是张酒杯兑换券……说不定你还花了一番力气才弄来。好吧，这是你今年的酒杯。\n\n不过我猜我应该还会常常再看到你。无论如何，要是想兑换美酒节奖章，你找我就对了……\n\n或他找我……\n\n噢噢喔……或是他……",cEN="Aww, it's just a stein voucher... Maybe you're just playing hard to get. So here's this year's stein for you.\n\nBut I suspect I'll be seeing a lot more of you. After all, if you want any Brewfest tokens redeemed, I'm your girl...\n\nOr maybe I'm his girl...\n\nOooohhh... or his..."}
Q[12194]={d="我们不仅供应美酒，还独家出售啤酒杯呢！瞧这些漂亮的杯子，非常具有纪念意义哦！这是一张礼品券。\n\n与美酒节营地背后的布利克斯谈一谈。他是个古怪的家伙，总是带着一副护目镜。他负责兑换礼品券，以及出售各类美酒。",dEN="Not only are we supplying brew to everyone, we also have steins to give out! Beautiful, commemorative steins all obtained by the most legal of means! Here's a voucher for one.\n\nTalk to Blix near the back of the Brewfest camp. He's pretty strange, even more so now that he's always wearing those goggles. He'll handle the voucher for you, and any other Brewfest transaction.",o="在美酒节营地背后的布利克斯·菲克维特处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Blix Fixwidget in the back of the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="这是什么？酒杯兑换券？你喜欢喝酒吗？太棒了！我把酒杯给你以后，你就可以喝个痛快了！然后再多喝几杯。也许接着再多来几杯……跟着，重点来了，再回来找我。\n\n听着，我知道迟早你一定会再回来找我的。假如你想要兑换美酒节奖品章的话，你就要回来找我。\n\n总而言之，这是你的酒杯，记得以后有需要的话再来找我。",cEN="What's this? A stein voucher? So you like drinking? Great! After I give you this stein, go have a few drinks! Then a few more. Maybe have a few more after that... Then, now this is important, come see me.\n\nLook, I know you'll be back eventually. If you want your Brewfest tokens redeemed you have to see me.\n\nAnyways, here's the stein, and remember to talk to me later."}
Q[12195]={d="最近一次狩猎远征带回来的不只是猎物。\n\n他们遇到一个从铁矮人要塞敦阿格尔逃出来的受伤矮人。他或许知道些能用来打击我们老对手的情报，但在他能帮上忙之前，我们得先给他退烧。\n\n附近森林里吃草的银鬃雄鹿的角，一向被用来制作治疗药膏。如果你能给我弄来足够多的鹿角，我们就看看这药膏能不能让我们的\"客人\"苏醒过来。",dEN="A recent hunting expedition brought back more than just game.\n\nThey encountered a wounded dwarf fleeing the iron dwarf stronghold of Dun Argol. He may have information we can use to strike at our ancient enemy, but before he's of any use to us, we must bring down his fever.\n\nThe horns of the silvercoat stags, who roam the nearby forest, have long been used to make healing poultices. If you can bring enough of the horns to me, we'll see if the poultice can bring our 'guest' around.",o="将5根成熟的雄鹿角交给欧尼瓦营地的托尔玛克。",oEN="Bring 5 Mature Stag Horns to Tormak the Scarred at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你把角带来了吗？",pEN="Did you bring the horns?",c="这些应该够用了。让我们看看有没有效果吧。",cEN="These should serve. Now, let's see if it works."}
Q[12196]={d="我们没有足够的时间来让我亲自铸造零件，不过东南部的丹厄古尔中的铸造厂一直在日以继夜的制造着魔像零件。\n\n我觉得你应该回到那里去，帮我取回足够多的零件，让我能够根据这份蓝图制作出一台魔像。\n\n那些零件可能散落在任何铁符文锻造师的工作场所里。\n\n快一点，$n。托尔玛克好像正准备找个借口来对我发脾气呢！",dEN="We don't have enough time for me to forge the parts myself, but the foundries over at Dun Argol, to the southeast, are working day and night to churn out golem parts.\n\nI think you should go back there and pick up enough of them for me to make a golem from this blueprint.\n\nThey're probably scattered around any of the buildings where the iron rune-smiths are working.\n\nPlease hurry, <name>. That Tormak looks like he's just waiting for an excuse to carry out his threat!",o="将8个作战魔像零件交给欧尼瓦营地的勘探员罗卡尔。",oEN="Bring 8 War Golem Parts to Prospector Rokar at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你……你把……把魔像零件带回来没啊？",pEN="D-did you b-b-bring those golem parts?",c="<罗卡尔用手背擦了擦额头。>\n\n哦，感谢圣光。他威胁说你不回来就不给我饭吃。让我们翻翻这堆零件，看看能造出什么。<Rokar se limpia la frente con el dorso de la mano>",cEN="<Rokar wipes his forehead with the back of his hand.>\n\nOh, thank the Light. He was threatening not to feed me until you returned. Let's sort through this pile of parts and see what we can make."}
Q[12197]={d="那么，我们现在有了一台魔像，但这还远远不能让托尔玛克满足。他并不知道这玩意并不是只要这么组装起来就能神奇地开始工作的！我们需要用能量晶格来驱动它。\n\n我潜入丹厄古尔的时候，曾记得是由符文铸造师杜拉尔和符文铸造师卡索恩来制作晶格的。我们需要从他们那里各取一个能量晶格，这样才能引导我们的魔像。\n\n你应该可以在丹厄古尔的中层本地找到他们，那两个家伙一直在他们各自的工作间里忙活呢。",dEN="Well, we've got the shell of a golem, but that's not good enough for Tormak. He doesn't realize that these things don't just come together and miraculously start working! We're going to need power cells to animate it.\n\nWhen I was in Dun Argol, I noticed that Rune-Smith Durar and Rune-Smith Kathorn were the ones who manufactured the cells. We'll need one from each to power our golem.\n\nYou should be able to find each rune-smith in his workshop on the central level of Dun Argol.",o="将杜拉尔的能量晶格和卡索恩的能量晶格交给欧尼瓦营地的勘探员罗卡尔。",oEN="Bring Durar's Power Cell and Kathorn's Power Cell to Prospector Rokar at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你拿到能量晶格了吗？",pEN="Do you have those power cells?",c="<罗卡尔从你手中接过了能量晶格。>\n\n虽然能量不足，但只是用来引导魔像的话就足够了。虽然它离能够上战场打仗还有好长一段距离。",cEN="<Rokar takes the batteries from you.>\n\nThese are low, but they'll be enough to start up the golem. He's nowhere near ready for battle, though."}
Q[12198]={d="现在所剩的电量只能以最低标准来引导魔像，根本不能引导任何战斗系统。\n\n不过有个好消息，在丹厄古尔的周围有一些闪电斥候来回巡逻，我们应该可以利用它们的能量来给魔像的武器系统充电。\n\n带着魔像去干掉那些闪电斥候，在斥候被摧毁之后，魔像会吸收它们释放出来的能量。",dEN="The golem's cells have just enough power to run it at the lowest levels, but it can't power any of its combat systems.\n\nThe good news is that the perimeter of Dun Argol is patrolled by lightning sentries. We should be able to use their power to charge up the golem's weapon systems.\n\nBring the golem with you, take it close to them, it will absorb the power as the sentries die.",o="用10个闪电斥候身上的能量给你的作战魔像充电，然后向欧尼瓦营地的勘探员罗卡尔复命。",oEN="Charge your War Golem with the energy from 10 Lightning Sentries and return to Prospector Rokar at Camp Oneqwah.",c="哇，看托尔玛克还要抱怨什么，这宝贝就要准备好啦。\n\n在你利用这台魔像辗过丹厄古尔以后，那个过度生长肥牛就会放开我啦。",cEN="Well, now Tormak can't complain anymore. This baby's as ready as I can make it.\n\nAfter you tear your way through Dun Argol with it, that overgrown cow'll have to release me."}
Q[12199]={d="现在魔像的电量非常充足，可以用它来对付丹厄古尔的首领了。\n\n据我观察，丹厄古尔的铁领主弗雷哈默尔一直都由他的魔像保护，真可谓万无一失。\n\n他的魔像名叫“铁砧”，你可以通过破坏它来击破铁领主的防护罩——只要使用魔像的电磁脉冲能力释放能量流就行了。\n\n铁领主弗雷哈默尔通常都会待在丹厄古尔顶端的主车间内，监督着整个生产过程。",dEN="Now that the golem is fully charged, it can be used against the leader at Dun Argol.\n\nWhen I observed Iron Thane Furyhammer, he was always guarded by a personal golem that shielded him from all harm.\n\nThat construct called The Anvil, can be disrupted, causing him to drop the shield. Use your golem's EMP ability to do just that. You'll be able to activate and take control of your golem inside Dun Argol.\n\nThe thane is in the main plant at the top and supervises production from the bottom level.",o="使用你的作战魔像去打败铁领主弗雷哈默尔，然后向欧尼瓦营地的托尔玛克复命。",oEN="Using the abilities of your War Golem, defeat Iron Thane Furyhammer, then return to Tormak the Scarred at Camp Oneqwah.",p="希望你能告诉我，你成功了……",pEN="Please tell me it worked...",c="勘探员履行了他的承诺？很好。我开始好奇搜集来这铁块和偷来的建材是不是都能作成同样的东西。\n\n很遗憾，他对我们没有更多的用处了。",cEN="So the prospector made good on his promises? Good. I was beginning to wonder if all of this scrounging for bits of metal and stealing building materials would amount to anything.\n\nIt's a shame he's of no further use to us."}
Q[12200]={d="现在，能使凋零药剂进入惰性状态的催化剂已经研制成功了，触发设备也没问题，唯一剩下的课题就是找到一个合适的外壳来容纳这些危险的东西。\n\n在这里的西南方，龙骨荒野中部的海岸上有一处地方叫作翡翠巨龙圣地。你可以在那里找到由绿龙的眼泪凝结而成的固体结晶。虽然具体原理我不甚了解，但我知道这些龙在死前尤其喜欢掉眼泪，所以……采集方法你了解了吧。\n\n立刻转至翡翠巨龙圣地，收集那些龙的眼泪。",dEN="With an inert specimen of the blight compound complete and the activating agent in hand there only remains a need for a suitable shell to house the components.\n\nSouthwest of here, on the shores of central Dragonblight, is where you will find the Emerald Dragonshrine. Within the shrine you will find the hardened remnants of a green dragon's tear drop. I don't know the whole story, but apparently they cry a lot right before they die. Go figure.\n\nGo to the Emerald Dragonshrine and gather tears.",o="怨毒镇的首席药剂师米德尔顿要求你收集8份翡翠龙泪。",oEN="Chief Plaguebringer Middleton at Venomspite in Dragonblight wants you to collect 8 Emerald Dragon Tears.",p="很幸运，我们的附近有很多翡翠龙泪的残留，要不然我就要派你去菲拉斯了。",pEN="Fortunate it is that we have a location nearby holding a surplus of emerald dragon tears. I would have had to send you to Feralas otherwise.",c="我坚信凋零药剂可以进行实测了。巧合的是大墓地——纳克萨玛斯——也正在进攻暮冬要塞。它在暮冬要塞之上凌空而起，唤醒活死人，执行着克尔苏加德赋予的命令。\n\n真是可惜联盟军队兵力和火力都远远不及他们。死在暮冬陵园的人们被唤醒，渴望着新鲜的血肉！\n\n也许我们可以让他们尝一口凋零药剂，不错吧？",cEN="I do believe that the blight is now ready for a field test. Fortuitously, the dread citadel, Naxxramas, is laying siege to Wintergarde Keep. From beneath the very earth that Wintergarde was built upon rise the living dead, eager to do the bidding of Kel'Thuzad.\n\nThe Alliance are, of course, outmanned and outgunned. The people laid to rest in the Wintergarde Mausoleum awaken, hungering for flesh!\n\nPerhaps we shall give them a taste of the blight, yes?"}
Q[12201]={d="看来这个洛肯是铁矮人战争机器的幕后首脑。\n\n只有最高等级的铁矮人才可能见到他，所以我们得把你伪装成一个监工，以查明他们究竟在谋划些什么。\n\n我有一个计划，但你得给我弄一些东西回来。\n\n在东南方的丹厄古尔找到一名铁符文监工，干掉他，然后把他的制服带回来。",dEN="It sounds like this Loken is the mastermind behind the sudden preparations for war on the part of the iron dwarves.\n\nOnly the highest ranking irons are likely to have access to him, so we'll have to make you into an overseer to find out what's going on in there.\n\nI have a plan, for that, but we'll need some supplies.\n\nFind one of the iron rune overseers at Dun Argol, to the southeast, kill him, and bring back his uniform.",o="将监工的制服交给欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯。",oEN="Bring an Overseer's Uniform to Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你拿到制服了吗？",pEN="Did you get the uniform?",c="这应该有用，但是还有问题，你其它部分的伪装。就算是那些蠢翻天的金属矮人，也还是能发现只穿制服的冒充者。",cEN="This should work, but there's still the matter of the rest of your disguise. Even those dimwitted metal dwarves will recognize an impostor with a stolen suit."}
Q[12202]={d="现在我们要完善一下伪装，让你看上去跟那些铁矮人一样讨厌……\n\n最好的办法，就是按照真正的铁矮人那丑陋的容貌制作伪装。\n\n在托尔玛克的探险队发现那个勘探员时，他们拿走了他的照相机。我想现在我们有机会用到它了。\n\n带上这东西转至丹厄古尔，打倒一些铁矮人，趁他们不能行动的时候用这个照相机记录他们的外貌。等你有了足够的样本以后，把它拿回来给我。",dEN="Now we have to finish the job of making you as repulsive as those iron dwarves.\n\nThe best way to do that is to base your disguise on the ugly mugs of real iron dwarves.\n\nWhen Tormak's hunting party discovered that wayward prospector, they took the camera he carried. Now, I suppose, we'll get the chance to use it.\n\nTake it with you to Dun Argol, kill some iron dwarves, and record their likenesses in this device. Bring it back once you have enough examples.",o="转至丹厄古尔，使用罗卡尔的照相机拍摄8张铁矮人的照片，然后向欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯复命。",oEN="Use Rokar's Camera to record the images of 8 Iron Dwarves in Dun Argol, then return to Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你拿到照片了没？",pEN="Did you get those snapshots?",c="这些就够了，以加尔鲁什之名，这些家伙真是丑翻了。",cEN="These should serve. By Garrosh, these creatures are ugly."}
Q[12203]={d="你的监工伪装包已经准就绪当了。等你穿上它的时候，尽量不要恶心得呕吐出来。我努力地让它显得尽可能真实。\n\n带上伪装包转至东南方的丹厄古尔，用它来伪装你自己，然后前去城市中层最东面的建筑物。\n\n在那里，你应该可以找到铁领主和监工接收洛肯命令所用的设备。伪装之后激活它，截获一切你所听到的情报。",dEN="I've created everything else you'll need for your overseer disguise kit. Try not to retch when you put it on. I took pains to make it as true to reality as possible.\n\nTake the kit with you southeast to Dun Argol, use it to disguise yourself, then go to the easternmost building on the broad middle tier of the city.\n\nThere, you should see a pedestal where the thane and overseers receive their orders from this Loken. Activate it while disguised and learn all you can from the communication.",o="伪装成铁符文监工，从洛肯那里截获情报，然后向欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯复命。",oEN="Disguise yourself as an Iron Rune Overseer, intercept the message from Loken, then report to Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",p="你从洛肯那里知道了什么？",pEN="What did you learn of Loken?",c="他是说要挑起泰坦创生种族势力间的内战？为什么泰坦城市奥杜尔对他如此重要？我猜这就是库伦和他的巨人所希望阻止的。\n\n我想我们正好处在一个可以阻止巨人彼此征战的位置上，但我们也可以找出方法来利用这个情况。我得马上通知我们的首领。",cEN="So he means to foment civil war between the factions of the titans' creation? Why does this titan city of Ulduar mean so much to him? I suppose this is what Kurun and his giants are hoping to prevent.\n\nWell, I doubt we're in a position to keep the giants from fighting each other, but we can find a way to use this to our advantage. I must inform our leaders at once."}
Q[12204]={d="铁矮人是我们在诺森德最难缠和最讨厌的敌人之一。无论我们走到哪里，他们都以洛肯的名义来和我们交战。\n\n我们必须知道这个洛肯到底是谁？他们的目的是什么？我想也许这里的当地人能给我们答案。\n\n这里东北面的红木商栈中有个名叫休·格兰斯的人类商贩。再往东走，你可以在泰塞斯废墟找到一个名叫加弗洛克的石巨人。向他们询问关于这个洛肯的事情，他们应该知道一些有用的信息。",dEN="The iron dwarves stand as one of the fiercest and most coordinated foes in Northrend. Wherever we have traveled, they have battled us with the name of Loken on their lips.\n\nWe must learn who this Loken is and what he seeks. The locals may be of help.\n\nTo the northeast, at the Redwood Trading Post, a human named Hugh Glass peddles his wares. Further east, at the Ruins of Tethys, you'll find a stone giant named Gavrock. Ask them about this Loken. They've got to know something of use.",o="与休·格兰斯和加弗洛克谈谈有关洛肯的事情，然后把你的发现汇报给欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯。",oEN="Speak with Hugh Glass and Gavrock about Loken, then report your findings to Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqeah.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What did you find?",c="他是铁矮人的幕后主脑？我们要查出他究竟指使了丹厄古尔的铁矮人做了些什么。",cEN="So he is the mastermind behind the iron dwarves? We must find out what he has been ordering the iron dwarves of Dun Argol to do."}
Q[12205]={d="奉高等执行官罗思之命，所有名为血色突袭军的非法组织成员都应立即处死。\n\n不得留活口，执行本命令者须知：任何被人类俘虏的人都会落得生不如死，甚至更糟！\n\n用高等执行官的话说：\"用他们的血把雪地染红！\"",dEN="By order of High Executor Wroth all members of the illegal organization known as the Scarlet Onslaught are to be put to death immediately.\n\nNo quarter is to be offered, and those proceeding to action upon this decree should be aware that any who are captured by the humans will be left to die, or worse!\n\nIn the High Executor's words, \"Paint the snow red with their blood!\"",o="消灭20个血色先锋军的成员，然后向怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯汇报。",oEN="Kill 20 members of the Scarlet Onslaught and report to High Executor Wroth at Venomspite.",p="你是来浪费我时间的，<boy/girl>，还是已经完成了我对血色突袭军的复仇？",pEN="Are you here to waste my time, <boy/girl>, or did you fulfill my vendetta against the Scarlet Onslaught?",c="干得非常漂亮，<race>。我相信你杀他们时既聪明又狠毒吧？\n\n让我看看，我能从棺材……呃，抱歉，是从金库里给你拿出多少？",cEN="Very well done, <race>. I trust that you were cleverly vicious in your slaying?\n\nLet's see, how much I can offer you from the coffins... er, excuse me, coffers?"}
Q[12206]={d="你读过那张通缉令了吗？高等执行官到底在想什么？！\n\n<薇琪四下张望，继续压低声音说。>\n\n我们总不能任由那些血色突袭军的白痴被他们的牧师复活吧，更糟的是，变成天灾军团爬起来，对不对？\n\n不，我完全同意你的看法，我们得处理掉那些尸体。\n\n我正好有办法。拿着我们刚研制出的这瓶枯萎，就在这儿笼子里的囚犯身上试试。\n\n不脏不乱，敌人也不会回来。",dEN="Have you read the wanted poster? What is the high executor thinking?!\n\n<Vicky looks around and continues in hushed tones.>\n\nWe can't very well have those Scarlet Onslaught idiots being raised by their priests, or worse, rising as the Scourge, now can we?\n\nNo, I'm in total agreement with you, we have to do something about the corpses.\n\nI have just the thing. Take this blight that we just created and test it on the prisoner in the cage right here.\n\nNo muss, no fuss, no returning enemies.",o="怨毒镇的药剂师薇吉·莱文要你把药剂泼在血色先锋军士兵的身上。",oEN="Apothecary Vicky Levine at Venomspite has asked you to test the Flask of Blight upon the Scarlet Onslaught Prisoner.",p="你做到了吗？\n\n嘿，我忘了告诉你最好不要让那东西碰到你！那东西很麻烦，而且一旦碰到就洗不掉了，更别提你要花几辈子的时间治疗你身上那冒泡的疹子。",pEN="Did you do it?\n\nHey, I forgot to tell you that you probably shouldn't let any of that stuff get on you! It's nasty, and you'll never get the stains out, let alone have a hell of a time healing the bubbled-away fleshy bits.",c="什么？！这不可能！我们把瘟疫做到了完美。它的致死率是百分之百。\n\n<这位药剂师绞着双手，忧虑掠过她那张没有生气的脸。她显然很沮丧，用愤怒的语气接着说。>\n\n这真的很奇怪。把那个瓶子给我，<class>。我可不打算被人称作那个毁掉一切的药剂师！",cEN="WHAT?! That's impossible! We've perfected the blight. It has a one-hundred percent lethality.\n\n<The apothecary wrings her hands, concern crossing her unliving visage. Clearly frustrated, she continues in an angry tone.>\n\nThis is just really odd. Hand me that flask, <class>. I'm not going to be known as the apothecary that ruined everything!"}
Q[12207]={d="很久以前，强大的德鲁伊们在这里的东北方种下了一棵树。\n\n这棵树被称为沃达希尔，它曾是诺达希尔的继承者……一棵世界之树。但不知道为什么，等沃达希尔完全长成之后，德鲁伊们却决定要将它摧毁。\n\n$n，从我们来到这里开始，大地就在向我们倾诉，它的痛苦来自于沃达希尔的遗骸所在的位置。\n\n堕落的软泥怪在那些地方徘徊。去取一些软泥怪的样本回来给我，这样我们才可以开始治愈这片土地。",dEN="Long ago, powerful druids planted a tree to the northeast of here.\n\nIt was called Vordrassil and it was to be a world tree. It is not known why, but after the tree was fully grown, the druids decided it needed to be destroyed.\n\nEver since we arrived here, the earth has spoken to me, <name>. Its cries of pain come from the places where Vordrassil's remains fell on the ground.\n\nCorrupting ooze roams those places. Bring me samples of it so we may begin to heal the land.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你转至沃达希尔之臂、沃达希尔之心或沃达希尔之泪，从熵能软泥怪那里取回6份软泥怪样本。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to go to Vordrassil's Limb, Vordrassil's Heart or Vordrassil's Tears and obtain 6 Slime Samples from the Entropic Oozes.",p="你取到样本了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the samples, <name>?",c="这种软泥被一种远比其平凡形态所显示的更为古老的黑暗所污染。这片土地自存在之初就铭记着这邪恶。\n\n我们必须查明更多，<name>。",cEN="This slime is foul with a darkness far more ancient than their worldly forms would indicate. The land itself has a memory of this evil for as long as it has existed.\n\nWe must find out more, <name>."}
Q[12208]={d="一群混账！\n\n他们本来可以过好日子的。我们表达了和平的意愿，他们只需要给我们开放一条可以穿越达克萨隆要塞的道路就可以了，这样对大家都好。\n\n但是，这些高傲的冰巨魔偏偏要把简单的事情复杂化。现在好了，他们会被杀得连渣都不剩下，而我们终究还是可以穿越他们珍贵的要塞转至祖达克。\n\n我们已经联系了一群人来帮忙捕捉巨魔。如果你想参与行动的话，就去跟萨米尔谈谈。你可以在这里的西北面、达克萨隆要塞的正南面找到他。",dEN="Good for nothing wretches!\n\nThey could have had it easy. We extended our hand in peace. All they had to do was give us passage through Drak'Tharon and we'd have let them be.\n\nBut no, the prideful little ice trolls decided that they wanted it rough. Now they'll be destroyed and we'll pass through their precious keep to Zul'Drak anyway.\n\nWe've contracted a gang to deliver us captured trolls. Talk to Samir if you want in on the action. You can find him to the northwest of here, due south of Zeb'Halek.",o="苏尔肯中士希望你去跟岩石之泉的萨米尔谈一谈。",oEN="Sergeant Thurkin told you to speak to Samir at Granite Springs.",c="来做赏金任务的，嗯？",cEN="Here to get in on the bounty action, eh?"}
Q[12209]={d="啊，很好，新人。你想证明自己的能力吗，新人？\n\n血色先锋军，也就是血色十字军中最狂热的那些成员，就盘踞在我们的南面。如果我们想要跟他们一决高下，就需要大量的装备和武器，而我在短期内想必是打造不出这么多的。\n\n为什么我们不去夺取他们的武器装备呢？\n\n换句话说，为什么你不去呢？",dEN="Ah good, new meat. Do you wish to prove yourself, new meat?\n\nThe Scarlet Onslaught, the most zealous and racist of the Scarlet Crusade, are in our backyard to the south. If we're going to fight them, we'll need more armor and weapons than I can make in such a short time.\n\nWhy don't we take theirs?\n\nMore to the point, why don't YOU take theirs?",o="怨毒镇的军需官巴莱特要你去夺取8件血色先锋军护甲和8件血色先锋军武器。",oEN="Quartermaster Bartlett at Venomspite has asked you to steal 8 Scarlet Onslaught Armor and 8 Scarlet Onslaught Weapons.",p="新面孔，只要你偷得来铠甲和武器，我就全部收下。\n\n虽然这些装备的质量比不上我锻造的，总是聊胜于无。",pEN="I'll take what armor and weapons you can steal for me, new meat.\n\nThough they'll be of inferior quality to what I can make here, it's better than nothing.",c="你这块新肉闻起来没那么新鲜了。\n\n好吧，这些都用得上。我该怎么称呼你，<class>？",cEN="You do not smell so fresh now, new meat.\n\nVery well, all of this will do. By what name might I call you, <class>?"}
Q[12210]={d="你，$r！有活要干的时候，站在那儿发呆可没道理！\n\n前往祖达克最直接的路线就是达克萨隆要塞。我们必须夺取它，为联盟确保一条安全通道。但在我们有足够兵力发动强攻之前，只能满足于削弱冰巨魔并收集情报。\n\n为此，我们雇佣了一帮打手，让他们抓捕活巨魔带回来审问。往西北去，在花岗岩泉找萨米尔。他会告诉你更多。$gparado:parada;",dEN="You, <race>! No sense standing around here when there's work to be done!\n\nDrak'Theron Keep is the most direct route to Zul'Drak. We MUST capture it to ensure safe passage for the Alliance. But until we get the numbers to make an assault, we'll have to content ourselves in thinning out the ice trolls and collecting intel.\n\nTo that end, we've conscripted a gang of thugs to capture and deliver live trolls for interrogation. Travel northwest and speak with Samir at Granite Springs. He'll direct you further.",o="琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉希望你去跟岩石之泉的萨米尔谈一谈。",oEN="Lieutenant Dumont at Amberpine Lodge wants you to speak to Samir at Granite Springs.",c="来做赏金任务的，嗯？",cEN="Here to get in on the bounty action, eh?"}
Q[12211]={d="我真是搞不明白。凋零药剂明明应该有效的啊！\n\n不过现在也不是讨论这个的时候。\n\n<药剂师显得轻松了一些。>\n\n虽然由于奇怪的原因，它对血色先锋军不起作用，但是我们仍然要想办法阻止他们继续被牧师复活。\n\n我又想到一个办法，只要没有了佩戴的血色之印，他们就没法被牧师找到了。\n\n$n，带上一盒我的老鼠，把它们拿到新壁炉谷去，它们经过训练，可以准确地找出印记。",dEN="I don't understand it. The blight should have worked!\n\nNo sense worrying about it now.\n\n<The apothecary seems relieved for some reason.>\n\nThough it doesn't work on the Onslaught for some strange reason, we still need to keep their priests from raising them.\n\nI have another idea, one that their corpses shouldn't have any protection from.\n\n<name>, take a container of my rats and unleash them upon any Onslaught corpses you come across at New Hearthglen. I starve the vermin, so they should be voracious!",o="怨毒镇的药剂师薇吉·莱文要你转至新壁炉谷，在15个倒下的血色先锋军成员那里使用她的老鼠箱。",oEN="Apothecary Vicky Levine at Venomspite has asked you to use her Container of Rats to pick clean the corpses of 15 Scarlet Onslaught members at New Hearthglen.",p="嗯？我猜你搞定了？\n\n不要告诉我他们还有某种防护措施防止尸体被老鼠吃掉？！",pEN="Well? Success I assume?\n\nDon't tell me that they have some kind of protection against being eaten by rats?!",c="喔，甚好甚好！我一度还在考虑是不是应该先在某个家伙身上试试看这些老鼠究竟有没有效果。\n\n终究是有进展了！",cEN="Oh good! For a moment I thought I was going to have to test the rats out on someone to make sure that they weren't defective.\n\nProgress, finally!"}
Q[12212]={d="你好啊，$c。\n\n这里的长官说部落掠夺了我们的仓库，剩馀的食物储备已经岌岌可危了。\n\n毫无疑问，我们会让这群混蛋们付出代价，但首先得把我们的注意力集中在食物的重新储备上。我的手下正在尽全力补充食物，但如果我们想要避免一场危机的话，就需要每个人都身体力行地出一份力。\n\n依你的能力，去周围猎杀些鹿肉回来应该没什么问题吧。祝你狩猎愉快！",dEN="G'day, <class>.\n\nThe good lieutenant here says that there's been a Horde raid on our storehouse that's left our food supply dangerously low.\n\nNo doubt we'll make those cretins pay, but first we need to focus our attention on restocking. My men are doing all they can, but we're going to need every able body to contribute if we're to avert a crisis.\n\nYou should have no trouble harvesting venison from the local stag in these parts. Happy hunting!",o="琥珀松木营地的护林主管安德霍尔希望你能去猎杀耸角雄鹿，并收集8份肥美的鹿肉。",oEN="Master Woodsman Anderhol at Amberpine Lodge wants you to kill Tallhorn Stag and collect 8 Succulent Venison.",p="狩猎进展如何，<race>？",pEN="How goes the hunt, <race>?",c="这真是上等的肉哇！",cEN="These are some choice pieces of meat!"}
Q[12213]={d="沃达希尔被某些……黑暗的东西笼罩着。在德鲁伊决定摧毁它后，它的空壳依然在向地底深处扎根。\n\n我希望你能转至北方那三处树干破裂的位置，尽可能地深入地下。\n\n等你进入地下以后，使用这枚宝珠来读入该本地周围的能量特征。这样才能让我知道沃达希尔身上曾经发生过什么，以及为什么它没有成为一棵世界之树。",dEN="Something... dark... happened to the tree Vordrassil. After the druids decided to destroy it, its hollow remains grew roots deep into the ground.\n\nI want you to go to the three locations to the northeast where the tree's trunk shattered and go as far beneath the ground as you can.\n\nUse this orb once you get there to get an imprint of the energy surrounding the area. This might shed some light on what happened to Vordrassil and why it failed to become a world tree.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你转至沃达希尔之臂、沃达希尔之心和沃达希尔之泪，然后在地表之下使用地占师的宝珠。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to go to Vordrassil's Heart, Vordrassil's Tears and Vordrassil's Limb and use the Geomancer's Orb in the depths beneath the surface.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="这颗宝珠……被一种纯粹的邪恶力量……污染了。\n\n无论我能从这股力量中了解什么，有一件事情是可以确定的，我必须马上摧毁这颗宝珠。这腐化的力量太强大了。",cEN="This orb... it has been tainted by... a purely evil force.\n\nWhatever else I might learn from studying this energy, one thing is certain. I must destroy this orb as soon as possible. Its corrupting force is just too strong."}
Q[12214]={d="你好，我是汉塞尔，很高兴认识你，$g先生:女士;。\n\n高等执行官来找我说：\"汉塞尔，我要你给我们弄些新坐骑。\"\n\n他以为梦魇马是从地里长出来的？\n\n<低声说> 其实还真是，前提是你找得到一片马的墓地。\n\n可我们没有那种地方，所以你得往南去新壁炉谷，杀掉那些骑士，夺取他们的马鞭，偷走他们的战马。\n\n骑着马回来，把缰绳交给我，劳驾。<Susurrando>",dEN="Hello. I am Hansel. Pleased to meet you, <sir /ma'am>.\n\nThe high executor came to me and said, 'Hansel, I want you to get us new mounts.'\n\nWhere does he think dreadsteeds come from? The ground?\n\nActually, they do if you can find a horse graveyard.\n\nBut we don't have one of those, so what we need you to do is go south to New Hearthglen, kill the knights, take their riding crops, and steal their warhorses.\n\nRide the horse back to me here and hand over the reins, if you would.",o="怨毒镇的汉瑟·鲍尔要你牵回3匹血色先锋军战马，并将战马缰绳交给他。",oEN="Hansel Bauer at Venomspite has asked you to steal 3 Onslaught Warhorses and deliver them to him, handing over the reins when you do so.",p="我真的很高兴你回来了。但我想我得亲自到底下去凑齐那些牲口。",pEN="I'm sure glad that you came around. I was afraid that I was going to have to go down there and rustle them up myself.",c="啊，没什么比一件事干得漂亮更让我高兴的了。\n\n你弄到这些马，为怨毒镇立了大功，<class>。",cEN="Ah, nothing makes me happier than a job well done.\n\nYou've done Venomspite a great service in acquiring these horses, <class>."}
Q[12215]={d="所谓福无双至祸不单行……\n\n由于现在的食物危机，我们发现自己在跟当地的座狼争夺食物。情况也越来越严峻了，我担心如果我们不能马上解决这个问题的话，很快就没有东西可以去狩猎了。\n\n去森林里转转，$r。杀死你所找到的每一条灰雾座狼。最近有报告称它们在西边那条河流附近活动。",dEN="As if we didn't have enough to concern ourselves with....\n\nWith the present food crisis, we find ourselves competing for food with the local worgs. The situation is becoming more dire, and I fear that if we don't address the issue immediately we'll soon find ourselves with nothing to hunt.\n\nScour the forest, <race>. Kill any graymist you find. Recent reports have sighted a concentration of them on the other side of the river west of here.",o="琥珀松木营地的安德霍尔希望你能在灰熊丘陵找到并杀死6条灰雾捕猎者。",oEN="Anderhol at Amberpine Lodge wants you to find and kill 6 Graymist Hunters in Grizzly Hills.",p="我相信，森林里猎食的座狼少了一些，是吧？",pEN="A few less worgs hunting these forests, I trust?",c="干得好，<class>。\n\n这应该有助于确保这一带的野生动物最终去往它们该去的地方：在我们的篝火上烤着。",cEN="Good work, <class>.\n\nThis should help ensure that the wildlife in these parts ends up where it should - roasting over our fires."}
Q[12216]={d="通过所有人的辛勤努力，现在食物已经开始有所盈馀了，不过离我们的目标仍然很远。我们需要更多的肉，很明显仅靠当地的鹿肉是远远不够的。\n\n恐怕你需要把注意力放在更危险的猎物上……对，灰熊。这个地区因它们而得名。它们的数量非常多，而且被河里的鱼喂得膘肥体壮。\n\n多加小心，$c！",dEN="We've all been working hard and it's beginning to pay off, but we're still far from our goal. We need much more meat than we have and it's growing clear that the local stag population won't be enough by itself.\n\nI'm afraid we need you to turn your attention to more dangerous prey - the grizzlies that give this region its name. They're plentiful, and they're well fed from the abundant fish that swim in these streams.\n\nBe safe, <class>!",o="琥珀松木营地的安德霍尔希望你从灰熊丘陵的灰鬃熊身上收集8块灰鬃熊肋排。",oEN="Anderhol at Amberpine Lodge wants you to collect 8 Grizzly Flanks from the Grizzly Bears in Grizzly Hills.",p="强大的<class>回来了！",pEN="The mighty <class> has returned!",c="太棒了！\n\n我们的仓库现在几乎装满了。你已经尽到了你的职责，<name>。",cEN="Outstanding!\n\nOur stores are nearly replenished now. You've done your part, <name>."}
Q[12217]={d="好吧，$n，我们已经查明部落是如何找到我们隐藏的粮食储备的。\n\n原来他们把自己的视线与那些在树梢上盘旋、毫无戒心的鹰连结在一起。借助鹰的视野，他们能够有效地监视我们的一举一动。\n\n奉中尉之命，我们必须猎杀这些雄壮的鸟，以挫败我们的敌人。",dEN="Well, <name>, we've determined how the Horde was able to locate our hidden stores of food.\n\nIt turns out that they were binding their sight to the unsuspecting eagles that soar above the trees here. Using eagle vision, they were able to effectively spy on our every action.\n\nBy order of the lieutenant, we've got to hunt down these majestic birds in order to thwart our enemy.",o="琥珀松木营地的安德霍尔希望你去消灭5只白肩鹰，然后向他复命。",oEN="Anderhol in Amberpine Lodge wants you to kill 5 Imperial Eagles and then report back to him.",p="你完成任务了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you completed your task, <class>?",c="我懂，这是个令人哀伤的任务，但是，少了敌人在我们头上的眼线，我们终于能高枕无忧了。",cEN="A somber task, I know. But we can rest easier now knowing the enemy's eyes are no longer upon us."}
Q[12218]={d="在我让你带着好消息转至玛菲奥斯博士那里之前，你还得再去对这种凋零药剂执行一次简单的实地测试，看看我新做的调整到底效果怎样。\n\n暮冬城的旧城区中有无数不停涌出的亡灵，它们是最好的实验材料。你可以直接在东门那里征用一辆车，然后开着它一路向东北方沿着复仇小径冲过去，一直杀到暮冬城东南城墙边的双塔边上。然后呢，你把炸弹向里面那堆亡灵那里一丢，看看结果如何，直接向我汇报就可以了。",dEN="Before I can ship you off to Doctor Malefious with the good news, you will have to run a simple field test of the blight with the modifications I have made.\n\nThe hungering dead stream out from what remains of Old Wintergarde. Commandeer a vehicle from the east gate and drive it northeast through Vengeance Pass until you reach the twin towers at the southeastern edge of Wintergarde. Drop the blight bomb on the undead that cover the area. Report back to me with the results!",o="怨毒镇的首席药剂师米德尔顿要求你使用被遗忘者雕零战车上的雕零炸弹，在腐臭平原外围消灭30名饥饿的死尸。",oEN="Chief Plaguebringer Middleton at Venomspite in Dragonblight wants you to use the Forsaken Blight Spreader's Blight Bomb to destroy 30 Hungering Dead on the outskirts of the Carrion Fields.",p="这项测试将是这一系列实验中的最后一次，<name>。",pEN="This test will be the final experiment in the series, <name>.",c="投下炸弹也许帮助了联盟……这点让我有些生气，但我仍要宣布——实测任务终告成功！下一站：阿格玛之锤！",cEN="As much as it irritates me that we may have assisted the Alliance, I declare the field test a success! Next stop: Agmar's Hammer!"}
Q[12219]={d="很久以前，我的祖先在灰熊丘陵中部种下了一棵树。\n\n他们将它称为沃达希尔，它曾被认为是诺达希尔的继承者……一棵世界之树。\n\n不知道什么原因，在沃达希尔完全长成之后，他们却决定将它摧毁。它巨大的树干被劈成三段，躺在北边的森林里。\n\n树干接触到地面后开始腐烂，肮脏的软泥怪开始在那里蠕动。给我带些软泥怪的样本回来，这样才能开始我的工作，拯救痛苦的大地。",dEN="My ancestors once planted a tree in the middle of the Grizzly Hills.\n\nIt was called Vordrassil and it was to become a world tree.\n\nFor reasons long forgotten, after the tree was fully grown, they decided it needed to be destroyed. Its giant trunk splintered at three locations in the area to the north.\n\nWhere the tree touched the ground, foul ooze began to crawl the earth. Bring me slime samples so I can begin my work and the earth can be healed.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你转至沃达希尔之臂、沃达希尔之心或沃达希尔之泪，从熵能软泥怪那里取回6份软泥怪样本。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to go to Vordrassil's Limb, Vordrassil's Heart or Vordrassil's Tears and obtain 6 Slime Samples from the Entropic Oozes.",p="你收集到样本了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you gathered the samples, <name>?",c="这软泥并不自然，<name>。它的本质就是腐化而……邪恶的。\n\n我们必须查明更多真相。",cEN="The slime is not natural, <name>. Its very nature is corrupt and... evil.\n\nWe must find out more."}
Q[12220]={d="沃达希尔倒下之后，它的空壳仍然在向地底深处扎根。\n\n我希望你能转至北方那三处树干破裂的位置，尽可能地深入地下。它们就在灰喉堡的西边。\n\n等你进入地下以后，使用这枚宝珠来读入该本地周围的能量特征。如果我们要治愈这片土地，就必须首先查明这棵世界之树为什么会突然陨落。",dEN="When the tree Vordrassil fell, its hollow remains grew roots deep into the ground.\n\nI want you to go north of here to the three locations where the trunk shattered and go as far beneath the ground as you can. You'll find them west of Grizzlemaw.\n\nUse this orb once you get there to get an imprint of the energy surrounding the area. If we're to heal the land, we must first find out what caused Vordrassil to fail as a world tree all those years ago.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你转至沃达希尔之臂、沃达希尔之心和沃达希尔之泪，然后在地表之下使用地占师的宝珠。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to go to Vordrassil's Heart, Vordrassil's Tears and Vordrassil's Limb and use the Geomancer's Orb in the depths beneath the surface.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="宝珠里的能量……异常强大……\n\n一股黑暗的力量在沃达希尔残骸的附近污染了地面。我们需要更深入的调查。",cEN="The energy in the orb is... overpowering...\n\nA dark force has tainted the ground near Vordrassil's remains. We will need to investigate more."}
Q[12221]={d="我准备了一个包裹，必须送到阿格玛之锤的辛塔尔·玛雷菲斯博士那里。包裹里除了最终的天灾瘟疫样本，还附有配制说明和活化剂的样本。\n\n你会在龙骨荒野西部的阿格玛之锤找到他。只要去找那些黑色、参差不齐的金属兽人建筑……那就是阿格玛之锤。|n",dEN="I have prepared a package that must be delivered to Doctor Sintar Malefious at Agmar's Hammer. The contents of the package include the final blight specimen along with instructions on preparation and samples of the reactive agent.\n\nYou will find Agmar's Hammer in western Dragonblight. Just look for the black, jagged metal orc buildings - that will be Agmar's Hammer.",o="将被遗忘者的凋零药剂交给阿格玛之锤的辛塔尔·玛菲奥斯博士。",oEN="Deliver The Forsaken Blight to Doctor Sintar Malefious at Agmar's Hammer.",p="你总算来了！",pEN="About bloody time!",c="<玛雷菲斯博士翻看包裹里的东西。>\n\n太棒了！完全符合规格！\n\n这是你的报酬，<name>。不要把你看到和做过的事告诉任何人。这项工作全部是机密——只有需要知情的人才能获得这些信息。",cEN="<Doctor Malefious looks through the contents of the package.>\n\nGlorious! Exactly to specifications!\n\nHere is your payment, <name>. Keep what you've seen and done to yourself. This work is all classified - information is given out on a need to know basis."}
Q[12222]={d="就在我们跟部落僵持不下的时候，维库人的掠龙部族又不安分起来。他们在南边海岸旁的沃德伦村集结了大量的兵力。\n\n据说村里那些最强大的战士还被授予了一种灌入火焰能量的护符，这使得他们可以驾驭狂暴而凶残的始祖龙。如果这些始祖龙能被我们所用，那么我们就可以解决沃德伦方面逐渐加剧的威胁。\n\n负责为战士们制作这些护符的是掠龙缚焰者，杀死他们，把护符抢回来。",dEN="Even as we attempt to fight off the Horde, the Dragonflayer tribe musters in their village of Voldrune, near the coast to the south.\n\nThe most powerful warriors in the village are granted flame-imbued talismans that give them the ability to control powerful, savage proto-drakes. If we can gain control of one of these drakes, perhaps we can use it to neutralize the threat posed by Voldrune.\n\nThe Dragonflayer flamebinders create the talismans and imbue them with power. Kill them and take the talismans.",o="将3枚烈焰能量护符交给琥珀松木营地的伐木工德拉克。",oEN="Bring 3 Flame-Imbued Talismans to Woodsman Drake at Amberpine Lodge.",p="你收集好能量护符了吗？",pEN="Did you collect those talismans?",c="只要护符在手，始祖龙将无条件服从你。当族长发现你控制了他的始祖龙，我都等不及要看他脸上的表情了！",cEN="With the talismans in hand, the drake will have no choice but to obey you. I can't wait to see the look on the thane's face when he realizes you've commandeered his proto-drake."}
Q[12223]={d="最近南边的维库人村落沃德伦内似乎有着大量军事活动的迹象。托瓦德·埃里克森领主和他手下那群侍卫正在筹备战争，可我们的人大多数都疲于应付部落的背叛，无暇南望，琥珀松木营地危在旦夕。\n\n必须向那群掠龙维库人显示联盟的实力，让他们知道我们不是什么软柿子。\n\n立刻转至南边海岸上的沃德伦，杀死你看到的所有侍卫。这样一来，如果他们再想要趁我们和部落冲突之时渔利，也会先称称自己的分量。",dEN="There's a flurry of activity down in Voldrune village to the south. Thane Torvald Eriksson and his huscarls are preparing for war. With most of our men in the field dealing with the Horde's treachery, Amberpine will be vulnerable.\n\nTravel to Voldrune, which is near the southern coast, and show those Dragonflayers we're no soft target.\n\nSlay as many of the huscarls as you can find. Make them think twice about taking advantage of our conflict with the Horde.",o="消灭12个掠龙侍卫，然后向琥珀松木营地的伐木工德拉克复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Dragonflayer Huscarls and return to Woodsman Drake at Amberpine Lodge.",p="事情办妥了吗？",pEN="Have you done the deed?",c="干得好，<name>。现在，我们必须乘胜追击，把握住优势。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Now, we must follow through and press the advantage."}
Q[12224]={d="你做得很好，$g兄弟:姐妹;。你所面对的一切，都是以部落$g勇士:勇士;的身份完成的。阿兹欧-奈鲁布的天灾阿努巴尔虫人，被你踩在脚下！坦卡牛头人——部落勇敢而强大的新成员，正是因为有你！我们对抗天灾的超级武器，由你检验并完善！\n\n时候到了，就在此刻——愤怒之门我们精锐的士兵需要你。萨鲁法尔之子在库卡隆先锋营地等候你的到来。现在就出发，向东北方前往愤怒之门。",dEN="You have done well, <brother/sister>. All that you have faced, you have done as a champion of the Horde. The Scourged Anub'ar of Azjol-Nerub, crushed under your foot! The taunka, brave and powerful new members of the Horde, because of you! Our super-weapon against the Scourge, tested and perfected by you!\n\nThe time has come, the moment is now - our elite soldiers at the Wrathgate need you. The son of Saurfang awaits your arrival at the Kor'kron Vanguard. Go now, northeast to the Wrathgate.",o="转至库卡隆先锋营地，向小萨鲁法尔报到。",oEN="Report to Saurfang the Younger at the Kor'kron Vanguard.",c="Lok'tar ogar！我听说过许多关于你的事，<name>。你的战伤很深——这是你奉献与力量的证明！\n\n随着巫妖王在西面和东面的侧翼进攻都被粉碎，只剩下大门处的部队了。我们每天都在推进，很快就能突破这道墙，攻入冰冠堡垒！\n\n一旦我们挡住那些骷髅龙，弗塔根大王和我就会亲临战场。",cEN="Lok'tar ogar! I have heard much about you, <name>. Your battle scars run deep - a testament to your dedication and power!\n\nWith the flanking attacks of the Lich King crushed in both the west and east, only the forces at the gate remain. We gain ground each day, soon to break through this wall and into Icecrown!\n\nOnce we stop the skeletal dragons, Highlord Fordragon and I will take the field."}
Q[12225]={d="你的肚子咕咕作响，那饱满坚果的刺鼻香味把你的注意力吸引到那桶种子上。\n\n显然有某位好心人把这些免费的点心留在这里，好让疲惫的访客恢复精神。你心怀感激地拿起剩下的几颗，狼吞虎咽地吃了下去。\n\n这谷物并没有让你失望。你意犹未尽，于是决定去查明它们的来源…… $g感恩者:感恩者;",dEN="Your stomach growls as the pungent smell of hearty nuts draws your attention to the the bucket of seeds.\n\nSome thoughtful soul has obviously left these complimentary morsels here to rejuvenate weary visitors. Grateful, you take the remaining few and devour them.\n\nThe seeds do not disappoint. Finding yourself hungry for more, you set out to discover their origins....",o="与琥珀松木营地的护林主管安德霍尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Master Woodsman Anderhol in Amberpine Lodge.",c="你干了什么？！\n\n那些是琥珀种子！而且是整整一季的收成！\n\n那些魔法种子本来可能是我们粮食危机的解决办法。相信我，<name>，你得把这件事补救回来！",cEN="You did what!!!\n\nThose were Amberseeds! And that was an entire harvest's worth!\n\nThose magical seeds may have been the answer to our food crisis. Believe me when I tell you, <name>, you're going to make this right!"}
Q[12226]={d="我们必须赶快行动，$r！我们不能冒险让那些珍贵的种子被完全消化。它们必须出来，立刻！\n\n去西边的河岸采些黑根草，我会给你配一剂泻药，帮你把事情办妥。\n\n快点，跑起来！记住，这是你自己$g惹的祸:惹的祸;……",dEN="We must act quickly, <race>! We can't risk letting those precious seeds become fully digested. They need to come out, NOW.\n\nForage up some blackroot from the riverbank just west of here and I'll make you a purgative that should get things moving.\n\nHurry now! And remember, you brought this upon yourself....",o="琥珀松木营地的安德霍尔要你去收集5份黑根草杆。",oEN="Anderhol at Amberpine Lodge wants you to bring him 5 Blackroot Stalks.",p="你找到黑根草茎了吗？",pEN="Have you found the blackroot?",c="这些刚刚好……\n\n<安德霍尔灵巧地揉拧黑根草茎，并将黏滑的汁液收集进一个小瓶子里面。>\n\n好了，接下来要办正事了。",cEN="These should do just fine...\n\n<Anderhol deftly twists the stalks, collecting their slick fluids in a tiny vial.>\n\nThere we go, now it's time to get down to business."}
Q[12227]={d="好了，$r。这就是那药水。\n\n它立刻就会起效，所以等你安安稳稳地进了茅厕再用。\n\n现在去把那些种子给我弄回来！",dEN="Alright, <race>. Here's the juice.\n\nIt works immediately, so don't use it until you're safely inside the outhouse.\n\nNow go get me those seeds!",o="琥珀松木营地的安德霍尔希望你在附近的厕所里喝下安德霍尔的泻药，以此来取回还未消化掉的琥珀种子。",oEN="Anderhol in Amberpine Lodge wants you to take the Anderhol's Slider Cider and use the nearby outhouse to retrieve the Partially Processed Amberseeds.",p="那些种子给我弄到了吗，<race>？",pEN="Got those seeds for me yet, <race>?",c="怎么样，<name>？一切顺利吗？\n\n嗯，看来我们赶得正是时候……",cEN="Well, <name>? Everything come out okay?\n\nHmm, looks like we caught 'em just in time...."}
Q[12229]={d="不久以前，我们派了一支探险队前去东面调查，在那里他们受到了疯狂熊怪的袭击。一名幸存者向我们描述，那些被杀死的疯狂熊怪的尸体流出了一种黑暗的粘液物质。\n\n数千年以来，这个地区的熊怪一直崇尚和平。熊怪的异常行为很有可能和我们先前发现的黑暗能量有关系。\n\n给我带些熊怪的血样回来。你可以在东面的怒牙神殿和心血神殿找到它们。",dEN="Not long ago we sent an expedition to the east, where it was attacked by crazed furbolgs. One of the survivors described slaying one of them and its body expelling a dark slimy substance.\n\nFor thousands of years, the furbolgs in this region have been peaceful. It is possible that there is a link to the furbolgs' behavior and the dark energy we were able to detect earlier.\n\nBring me samples of the furbolgs' blood. You will find them to the east in the Rage Fang Shrine and the Heart's Blood Shrine.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角要你从心血神殿和怒牙神殿的熊怪身上收集8份疯狂熊怪的血液。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to obtain 8 Crazed Furbolg Blood from the Furbolgs at Heart's Blood Shrine and Rage Fang Shrine.",p="你拿到血样了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the blood samples, <name>?",c="这血液带着与你之前取得的软泥相同的污痕……这可不是好兆头，<name>。",cEN="This blood carries the same taint as the slime you obtained earlier... this does not bode well, <name>."}
Q[12230]={d="我被指派去摧毁血色先锋军的弩炮。但不幸地是，药剂师和我在资源分配问题上有分歧，所以我没有任何可用的东西！\n\n这里的东北方是腐臭平原。在那里的熔炉和绞肉车附近摆弄器械的天灾攻城锻造师简直就是破坏的代名词。\n\n对我们来说幸运的是，他们的爆炸品扔得满地都是。\n\n我希望你能帮我把它们拿回来，不管是地上还是从那些攻城锻造师身上。",dEN="I'm tasked with the destruction of the Scarlet Onslaught's ballistae. Unfortunately, the apothecaries and I are at odds on the use of our resources, so I've nothing to destroy them with!\n\nTo the northeast are the Carrion Fields. The Scourge siegesmiths there at their forge and meat wagons are demolition masters.\n\nLuckily for us, they also leave their bombs lying about.\n\nI want you to retrieve them for me, off of the ground or the siegesmiths, I don't care which.",o="怨毒镇的亡灵卫兵莫德尔要你收集6颗攻城锻造师的炸弹。",oEN="Deathguard Molder at Venomspite has asked you to retrieve 6 Siegesmith Bombs.",p="你以为他们让我利用凋零药剂散布者，也许填充进一些污秽的东西然后毁掉这些弩炮……\n\n才怪，他们告诉我凋零药剂散布者只能用于某些特别的任务。\n\n随他们怎么说！",pEN="You'd think that they'd let me make use of the blight spreaders... maybe load them up with something nasty to destroy the ballistae.\n\nBut no, they tell me that they're only for special missions.\n\nWhatever!",c="<亡灵卫兵莫尔德期待着你的到来，搓摩着他的双手。>\n\n非常好。他们的失败就是我的……我们的成功！\n\n你拿着这些东西一路上没有造成任何困扰吗？这些爆裂物有些看起来不太稳定，我虽然是不死生物，但是我把我的存在看得很重！",cEN="<The deathguard rubs his hands together in anticipation.>\n\nExcellent. Their loss is my... our gain!\n\nYou didn't have trouble with any of these along the way? Some of them look rather unstable. I may be undead, but I value my existence!"}
Q[12231]={d="很可能灰熊丘陵的熊怪和沃达希尔一样被污染了。在这么多年来的和平共处之后，它们之间爆发了部族战争。\n\n他们在东边守卫的神殿是乌索克子嗣的家园。\n\n虽然熊怪被污染了，但是乌索克的孩子——奥索恩和科蒂安有可能仍安然无恙。\n\n如果真是这样的话，去听听它们能告诉你些什么。",dEN="It is possible that the furbolg of Grizzly Hills have the same taint that plagued Vordrassil. They've been involved in a deadly tribal war recently after years of peaceful coexistence.\n\nThe shrines that they guard to the east are home to Ursoc's offspring.\n\nIf the corruption has affected the furbolg, it is possible that because of their lineage, Kodian and Orsonn have remained unharmed.\n\nIf that's the case, find them and listen to what they have to say.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你去跟怒牙神殿的奥索恩和心血神殿的科蒂安谈一谈。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to speak to Orsonn at the Ragefang Shrine and Kodian at the Heart's Blood Shrine.",p="你和乌索克之子谈过了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you spoken to Ursoc's children yet, <name>?",c="睿智的乌索克子嗣，他们的话语解释了当前我们所见的一切。",cEN="Ursoc's children are wise. Their words explain much of what we've seen so far."}
Q[12232]={d="终于，我们有机会去解决他们的攻城器械了！别把事情搞砸了，伙计。\n\n我在开玩笑呢。\n\n真的。\n\n$C，用这些炸弹去解决新壁炉谷的弩炮吧。\n\n我们要让皇家药剂师学会看看，我们是怎么以经典的方式来完成这一切的。根本不需要什么药剂！",dEN="At last, our chance to strike at their siege engines! Don't flub it.\n\nI kid.\n\nA little.\n\n<class>, bombard New Hearthglen's ballistae with these bombs.\n\nWe'll show the Royal Apothecary Society how it's done old style. No concoctions required!",o="怨毒镇的亡灵卫兵莫德尔要你转至新壁炉谷，利用攻城锻造师的炸弹炸毁5台新壁炉谷弩炮。",oEN="Deathguard Molder at Venomspite has asked you to use the Siegesmith Bombs to bombard 5 New Hearthglen Ballistae.",p="总有一天，我会成为亡灵卫兵之首的！\n\n总有一天……",pEN="Someday I'll be lead deathguard!\n\nSomeday....",c="快乐的一天！\n\n既没占用到药剂师的时间和资源，就完成了这项任务，我相信这吸引了指挥官的注意力！\n\n不按牌理出牌，这就是我的做事态度。对，对啦，你也帮了点忙。\n\n来，如果我给你一些东西，能保证绝口不提你有参与此事吗？",cEN="Oh happy day!\n\nBy not using the time and resources of the apothecaries to get the job done, I'm sure to attract the attention of the high executor!\n\nThinking outside the box, that's what I'm all about. Yes, yes, you had a hand in helping too.\n\nHere, if I give you something will you promise to not mention your part in all of this?"}
Q[12234]={d="我必须知道新壁炉谷在密谋什么。\n\n我要你去偷来他们的每日命令，这样我才能查明。\n\n向南走，潜入他们的修道院、兵营和海滩，把那些每日计划找出来！\n\n万一你有点$g搞不清方向:搞不清方向;，兵营就是铁匠铺旁边那栋大建筑。",dEN="I need to know what New Hearthglen is up to.\n\nI want you to steal their orders of the day so that I can find that out.\n\nHead south and in their abbey, in their barracks, and on their beach, find those daily plans!\n\nJust in case you're confused, the barracks is the large building right next to the smithy.",o="怨毒镇的间谍女王瑞贝娅要你收集血色先锋军日常命令：修道院、血色先锋军日常命令：兵营和血色先锋军日常命令：海滩。",oEN="Spy Mistress Repine at Venomspite has asked you to steal the Scarlet Onslaught Daily Orders: Abbey, Scarlet Onslaught Daily Orders: Barracks, and Scarlet Onslaught Daily Orders: Beach.",p="要是你花太长的时间，他们的每日计划就会不同，然后我们又得全部重来了。\n\n别花太长的时间！",pEN="If you take too long, their daily plans will change, and we may have to start over again.\n\nDon't take too long!",c="那你还在等什么，<race>？把它们交出来！",cEN="Well, what are you waiting for, <race>? Hand them over!"}
Q[12235]={d="弗塔根大王在愤怒之门对阿尔萨斯发动了一场毁灭性的突袭。为了报复这一挑衅，阿尔萨斯把纳克萨玛斯派来对付我们。当克尔苏加德躲在那座浮空堡垒中时，他的地面指挥官塞尔赞正围攻暮冬要塞。下城区已经基本失守，从废墟中救出幸存者的机会每分钟都在减少。\n\n我们必须迅速行动！立刻向狮鹫管理员乌瑞克报到！他会让你了解全部情况。\n\n去吧！|n",dEN="Lord Fordragon has led a crushing assault against Arthas at the Wrathgate. In response to this affront, Arthas has sent Naxxramas down upon us. While Kel'Thuzad hides in the floating citadel, his ground commander, Thel'zan, lays siege to Wintergarde Keep. The lower village is already lost and any chance of extracting survivors from the ruins diminishes by the minute.\n\nWe must act quickly! Report to Gryphon Commander Urik at the gryphon station at once! He'll get you up to speed.\n\nLeave me!",o="与暮冬要塞飞行点的狮鹫指挥官乌瑞克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gryphon Commander Urik at the gryphon station in Wintergarde Keep.",c="<乌瑞克指着一头狮鹫。>\n\n你有骑乘过狮鹫吗？朋友，这很简单的。只要跳上它的背，告诉它你要去哪。",cEN="<Urik points to a gryphon.>\n\nHave you ever ridden one of those? It's simple, friend. Just hop on and tell it where to go."}
Q[12236]={d="是时候了，$n。现在让我们来看看，我的努力是否能够帮助我们完成目标。\n\n拿上这些灰烬，去寻找科蒂安谈起的那个熊怪，图尔·怒爪，它就在乌索克的巢穴附近。你可以在灰喉堡的北面找到这座洞穴。\n\n说服图尔来帮助你，因为你需要一切你能找到的帮助。\n\n当你打败了熊神之后，在它的尸体上使用这些灰烬。\n\n即使它的肉身已经被摧毁，我们也必须拯救它的灵魂。",dEN="The time has come, <name>. Now we will learn whether our efforts will accomplish what we need or nothing at all.\n\nTake these ashes and seek the furbolg that Kodian told you about, Tur Ragepaw, near Ursoc's Den. You will find the den to the north of Grizzlemaw.\n\nConvince Tur to aid you, for you will need all the help you can get.\n\nOnce you've defeated the bear god, use these ashes over his body.\n\nEven if his worldly form is destroyed, his spirit must be saved.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你能在乌索克的巢穴的附近找到图尔·怒爪，在它的帮助下打败乌索克。然后在乌索克的尸体上使用净化过的沃达希尔的灰烬。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to find Tur Ragepaw near Ursoc's Den and defeat Ursoc with his help. Use the Purified Ashes of Vordrassil on Ursoc's Corpse when you've accomplished this.",p="你回来了。成功了吗？",pEN="You've returned. Did you succeed?",c="<眼前的德鲁伊听完你的讲述之后，脸色苍白，眼神空洞的望着你。她留下了一个包裹以表示对你的凯旋表示感谢。>",cEN="<The druid looks pale and her eyes stare blankly past you. She has left a package in anticipation of your return.>"}
Q[12237]={d="用这只哨子，你可以召唤一只暮冬狮鹫。骑上这头生物，前往暮冬村废墟——如今被称为腐尸平原，就在此地的东南方。到达平原后，睁大眼睛寻找无助的暮冬村民。一旦发现目标，就低飞过去，用狮鹫把他们接起来。把你救出的村民带回这里，带到狮鹫站。\n\n天灾无处不在，所以你得保持警觉，$g英雄:女英雄;。祝你好运！",dEN="With this whistle you can call down a Wintergarde gryphon. Mount the creature and head towards the ruins of Wintergarde Village, now known as the Carrion Fields, southeast of here. Once at the fields, keep your eyes peeled for helpless Wintergarde villagers. When you spot one, fly low and use the gryphon to pick them up. Return the rescued villager here, to the gryphon station.\n\nThere are Scourge all over the place so you'll need to keep your wits about you, hero. Good luck!",o="营救10名无助的暮冬城平民，然后向暮冬城的狮鹫指挥官乌瑞克复命。",oEN="Rescue 10 Helpless Wintergarde Villagers and return to Gryphon Commander Urik at Wintergarde Keep.",p="快，<name>！你必须救出那些无助的村民！",pEN="Hurry, <name>! You need to save the helpless villagers!",c="干得太出色了，<name>！既然我们的市民已经回来了，我们就能让这座要塞重新运转起来。",cEN="Outstanding work, <name>! We can get this keep back into working order now with the return of our citizens."}
Q[12238]={d="德拉克萨隆很快就会被清理干净，那些疯狂的亡灵再也别想待在那里，它会恢复其崇高的用途。作为你帮助的回报，堡垒中最珍贵的宝藏都将归你所有，伙计！\n\n等你爬到顶端，你必须最后再召唤我一次。保护我，伙计，我会执行仪式。\n\n唉，召唤我是有代价的。你必须从堡垒里的幸存者身上收集魔精。",dEN="The time be here at last, good friend.\n\nDrak'Tharon soon be cleansed of them foul undead and restored to her noble purpose. My soul will be havin' peace, and in return for your help, the keep's most valuable treasures be yours, mon!\n\nDa keep rises up into a sacred ziggurat. Once ya be reachin' its top, ya must summon me a final time, and I'll perform the ritual.\n\nAlas, mon, my summonin' will again be comin' at a cost. Ya must collect the mojo from the survivors in the keep,",o="达库鲁希望你转至达克萨隆，在那里找到他的火盆。使用达库鲁的药剂需要消耗5份耐久魔精。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to use Drakuru's Elixir at his brazier inside Drak'Tharon. Using Drakuru's Elixir there will require 5 Enduring Mojo.",c="老兄，我们做了一件伟大的事情！而这只是个开始而已……\n\n时候到了就来祖达克里面找我。\n\n有场战争等着我们去打赢，老兄！",cEN="We done a great thing, mon! And dis just be da beginning....\n\nSeek me out in Zul'Drak when da time be right.\n\nDere be a war to be won, mon!"}
Q[12239]={d="我在血色先锋军中安插了一个间谍。你把这些日常命令交给她，这样她就可以为我们策划下一步的攻击计划了。\n\n她的名字是斯古莉探员，她在魔法的作用下伪装成血色先锋军的墓地管理员。\n\n现在，快去把这些命令交给她，然后按照她的吩咐行事。墓地就在修道院旁边。",dEN="I have a spy within the ranks of the Scarlet Onslaught. I need you to deliver these daily orders to her so that she can plan the next phase of our assault.\n\nShe goes by the name of Agent Skully and she's under a magical guise to appear as the Onslaught's cemetery caretaker.\n\nHere, take these orders to her, and then do as she asks. You'll find the graveyard on the side of the abbey.",o="将血色先锋军日常命令交给新壁炉谷的斯古莉探员。",oEN="Deliver the Scarlet Onslaught Daily Orders to Agent Skully at New Hearthglen.",p="<探员上下打量着你，然后默默地招手让你过去。>\n\n别暴露我的身份，<class>！",pEN="<The agent eyes you up and down, and then silently motions you over.>\n\nDon't blow my cover, <class>!",c="你从女间谍那儿带来了口信？\n\n<探员四顾以确保无人监视之后，放下了铲子。>\n\n把计划交给我看。",cEN="You have word from the spy mistress?\n\n<The agent looks around to make sure that no one is watching as she puts down her shovel.>\n\nLet me see those plans."}
Q[12240]={d="上一批货物里，我妹妹从家乡的壁垒给我捎来了几桶白蚁。我想它们会派上用场，我正打算让你去做件事。\n\n新壁炉谷的伐木场运作给我们带来了一些麻烦，但到目前为止，我们还没能派人进去干掉他们的工头。\n\n我想，如果你把这些白蚁放到他那宝贝木料上，他肯定会跑出来。\n\n准备好把他解决掉了吗，$c？ $g准备好:准备好;",dEN="I received a few barrels of termites from my sister at the Bulwark back home in the last shipment. I think they're going to come in handy for something I have in mind for you.\n\nThe lumbermill operations at New Hearthglen are problematic for us, but so far we haven't been able to get anyone in there to take out their foreman.\n\nI think that if you were to unleash these termites on his precious woodworks, he'd be sure to come running.\n\nReady to take him out, <class>?",o="怨毒镇的药剂师薇吉·莱文要你利用莱温系列白蚁将工头卡列基引诱出来，然后杀死他。",oEN="Apothecary Vicky Levine at Venomspite has asked you to use the Levine Family Termites to lure Foreman Kaleiki out and kill him.",p="我想念我妹妹，<name>。我希望她一切安好。",pEN="I miss my sister, <name>. I hope she's well.",c="我就知道我妹妹不会让我们失望。\n\n干得好，<name>。血色先锋军的伐木场会停摆一段时间，这意味着他们不会有新的建筑或弩车。\n\n谢谢你帮我配得上家族的姓氏。",cEN="I knew my sister wouldn't let us down.\n\nWell done, <name>. The Onslaught's lumbermill will be out of commission for a while, which means no new construction or ballistae.\n\nThanks for helping me to live up to the family name."}
Q[12241]={d="熊怪们的所作所为必须被撤销，$n。当结果被如此强烈的腐化所污染时，再好的初衷也毫无意义。\n\n那棵幼苗必须被摧毁，因为它是这股黑暗影响的源头。拿起这支火把，用它点燃那棵被腐化的幼苗，然后把它的灰烬带给我。\n\n一旦经火焰净化，我会用我所能运用的力量来祛除他们身上的污秽。你需要这些灰烬来净化乌索克，驱除支配着他的邪恶力量。",dEN="The furbolgs' work must be undone, <name>. The best of intentions do not count for much when the result is tainted by such strong a corruption.\n\nThe sapling must be destroyed, for it is the source of this dark influence. Take this torch and use it to set fire to the corrupted sapling and bring me its ashes.\n\nOnce cleansed, by fire, I will use what power I can to remove the taint from them. You will need the ashes to purify Ursoc from the evil power that holds sway over him.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你用翠绿火炬去焚烧沃达希尔的树苗。将沃达希尔的灰烬带回去交给风之先知希尔·灰角。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to take the Verdant Torch and use it to burn Vordrassil's Sapling. Bring Vordrassil's Ashes back to Windseer Grayhorn.",p="你把灰烬带来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you brought me the ashes, <name>?",c="我不能向你保证什么，<name>。但我会尽力净化这些。",cEN="I can't make any promises, <name>. But I will try my best to purify these."}
Q[12242]={d="我们必须得保证沃达希尔永远都不会再生。熊怪们肯定收获了它的种子。\n\n转至灰熊丘陵中部的灰喉堡，把你能找到的种子都拿回来。我会保证把它们全部销毁。",dEN="We must make sure that Vordrassil is never regrown. The furbolg must have harvested its seed.\n\nGo to Grizzlemaw, in central Grizzly Hills, and obtain all the seeds that you can find. I will make sure they're properly destroyed.",o="征服堡的风之先知希尔·灰角希望你转至灰喉堡取回8颗沃达希尔的种子。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn in Conquest Hold wants you to go to Grizzlemaw and obtain 8 of Vordrassil's Seeds.",p="你拿到沃达希尔的种子了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained Vordrassil's seeds yet, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。这些我收下了。\n\n这些种子的腐化之力很危险。我必须立刻销毁它们。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I'll take those from you.\n\nThe corruptive power of these seeds is dangerous. I must destroy them right away."}
Q[12243]={d="我还有一项任务交给你。\n\n我设法把一部分天灾瘟疫改造成了我的世界闻名的燃烧之水。我要你带上它，把罪恶愚行的船帆点着！\n\n从码头上使用它。船帆一旦着火，甲板水手就会忙着扑火，你就可以溜到下层甲板去\"取回\"船长的航海日志。\n\n你会在新壁炉谷南面下方的十字军登陆点找到那艘船。船长的舱室在下面第一层甲板上，就在楼梯后面。",dEN="I have another mission for you.\n\nI was able to repurpose some of the blight to concoct my world-famous burning water. I want you to take it and set the sails of the Sinner's Folly ablaze!\n\nUse it from the dock. Once the sails are on fire, the deckhands will be busy putting them out, and you'll slip belowdecks to 'retrieve' the captain's rutters.\n\nYou'll find the ship on Crusader's Landing, below and south of New Hearthglen. Look for the captain's quarters on the first lower deck, behind the stairs.",o="龙骨荒野怨毒镇的药剂师薇吉·莱文要求你在罪人的愚行号的船帆上使用药剂师的燃烧液，将船帆点燃。\n\n在水手们忙着灭火的时候，转至下层甲板偷取舍雷船长的航海图。",oEN="Apothecary Vicky Levine at Venomspite has asked you to use her Apothecary's Burning Water to set the sails of the Sinner's Folly afire.\n\nWhile the deckhands are busy attempting to put the fires out, head belowdecks and retrieve Captain Shely's Rutters from the captain.",p="请你“别”告诉我船帆基于某种理由不能被燃烧之水点燃！\n\n我对于一再的测试感到厌烦了。",pEN="Please do NOT tell me that their sails were somehow protected from my burning water!\n\nI'd hate to have to test it out here again.",c="啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！\n\n没有了指针，看他们要往哪里跑？\n\n我看，血色先锋军就在还没开始之前，就已经结束了！多哀愁啊。\n\n哼哼。",cEN="Ahhahahahahahahahaha!\n\nWithout their rutters, they've got nowhere to run to now.\n\nLooks to me like the end of the Scarlet Onslaught, and just when they were getting started. How sad.\n\nHeh."}
Q[12244]={d="听着，伙计。你为什么不挽起袖子拿把扳手呢？还有活儿要干呢！他们需要把这些伐木机翻修好，运到风险湾去……而且是昨天就该干完的……\n\n没扳手？那你有什么用？还不如跟其他那些蠢货一起去找部落玩！\n\n你在那儿的时候，看看能不能把几台坏掉的伐木机开过来修理。小心点！它们状况很糟。 $g朋友:朋友;",dEN="Listen, pal. Why don't ya roll up your sleeves and grab a wrench? There's work to be done! They need these shredders refurbished and sent down to Venture Bay, and they need it done yesterday....\n\nNo wrench? Well what good are ya then? May as well go down with the rest of the lugheads and play with the Horde!\n\nWhile you're there, see if you can drive some of those broken-down shredders up here for repairs. Be careful! They're in pretty bad shape.",o="蓝天伐木场的塞尼普斯希望你将3台瘫痪的伐木机带回去交给他。",oEN="Synipus at Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to bring 3 Broken-down Shredders back to him.",p="没时间磨牙了，这些伐木机会是平衡联盟力量的关键！",pEN="No time for chit-chat. These shredders might tip the balance for the alliance!",c="<塞尼普斯吹起了口哨。>\n\n喔，她好美！我们会好好修理她的。\n\n如果你还缺活儿干，去跟戈尔顿讲，然后去风险湾，他们很缺人手。\n\n噢，当你到那达的时候，挑一台翻新伐木机，插上这把钥匙，然后就看看这些宝贝能手机多少东西吧！",cEN="<Synipus whistles.>\n\nOh, she's a beauty! We'll fix her up nice.\n\nIf you're short on things to do, go talk to Gordun and get a ride down to Venture Bay. They're sure to need a hand.\n\nOh, and while you're there, use these keys on a Refurbished Shredder. Wait 'til ya see what these babies can do when they're cleaned up!"}
Q[12245]={d="看样子，我们有更多蠢货需要派你去处理掉了。\n\n我的探子告诉我，我们有几个好市民被血色先锋军俘虏了。\n\n这可不行。\n\n回到新壁炉谷，干掉亡灵卫兵斯克尼德、首席抄写员巴里加、卫生设备工程师布尔克和司法官亚麦。\n\n从我所了解到的情报来看，他们分布在整个本地，但可以肯定的是，他们被关在笼子里面，等待着接受审问。\n\n去和他们谈谈，然后送他们上路！",dEN="We have more fools for you to kill.\n\nMy agents tell me that several of our good citizens have seen fit to fall into the hands of the Scarlet Onslaught.\n\nThis will not do.\n\nGo back to New Hearthglen and eliminate Deathguard Schneider, Senior Scrivener Barriga, Engineer Burke and Chancellor Amai.\n\nFrom what I hear, they're spread out throughout the area. No doubt they are being kept in cages awaiting torture.\n\nSpeak with them and then kill them!",o="间谍女王瑞贝娅要求你去杀死亡灵卫兵斯克尼德、首席抄写员巴里加、工程师布尔克和司法官亚麦。\n\n完成任务后，向怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯复命。",oEN="Spy Mistress Repine has asked you to slay Deathguard Schneider, Senior Scrivener Barriga, Engineer Burke, and Chancellor Amai.\n\nWhen you've accomplished this task, report your success to High Executor Wroth at Venomspite.",p="轻而易举不是？你被送去杀掉四个无能的蠢蛋，他们随时可能泄漏你的秘密，快去解决这件事情。\n\n<执行官乌洛斯露出了邪恶的笑容。>",pEN="It's simple really. You're sent out to kill four incompetent fools that are likely to blab all of our secrets anytime now, and you go out and do it.\n\n<The high executor puts on an unholy grin.>",c="什么？你还指望我们让你去救他们？\n\n他们本来就有被俘的前科，我们为什么要那么做？\n\n诺森德是个寒冷的地方，年轻的<name>。我建议你适应一下。",cEN="What? You were expecting us to have you rescue them?\n\nNow why would we do that when they have a proven track record of getting themselves captured in the first place?\n\nNorthrend is a cold place, young <name>. I suggest that you adjust to it."}
Q[12246]={d="居住在东边的熊怪比起我们曾经见过的熊怪来说更残忍、更具进攻性。我们的部队已经不止一次地受到它们的袭击，幸存者们无一例外地提到，有一股黑暗的液体从它们的尸体里流出。\n\n它们的情况可能与我们在沃达希尔遗骸找到的污染物有关。\n\n给我拿些熊怪的血样来。你可以在东面的怒牙神殿和心血神殿找到它们。",dEN="The furbolgs that live east of here are more aggressive and bestial than the ones we're used to. Our forces have squared off with them more than once, and the survivors always speak of a dark, slimy substance dripping from their corpses.\n\nTheir condition could be linked with the contaminants we found on Vordrassil's remains.\n\nBring me samples of the furbolgs' blood. You will find them in the Rage Fang Shrine and the Heart's Blood Shrine, far to the east.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩要你从心血神殿和怒牙神殿的熊怪身上收集8份疯狂熊怪的血液。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to obtain 8 Crazed Furbolg Blood from the Furbolgs at Heart's Blood Shrine and Rage Fang Shrine.",p="你拿到血样了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you obtained the blood samples, <name>?",c="血液中显现的腐化和软泥怪的腐化并无二致，对此我有不好的感觉。",cEN="The corruption present in this blood is identical to that of the slime. I don't have a good feeling about this."}
Q[12247]={d="可以确定的是，灰熊丘陵的熊怪身上含有某种污染物质。在这么多年来的和平共处之后，它们之间爆发了部族战争。\n\n不知道被他们视为神明的熊是否同样也受到了污染。\n\n乌索克的两个孩子，奥索恩和科蒂安就居住在怒牙神殿和心血神殿，这两处地方分别在灰喉堡的南边和东南边。\n\n看看它们是否会告诉你一些东西。",dEN="The furbolgs of Grizzly Hills carry with them a corruption of some kind, that is for sure. Tribal war has broken out amongst them after years of peaceful coexistence.\n\nWhat remains to be seen is whether the bears they worship as gods have also been tainted.\n\nUrsoc's two children, Orsonn and Kodian, dwell in the Heart's Blood Shrine and the Rage Fang Shrine, south and southeast of Grizzlemaw.\n\nSee if they will speak to you regarding what has happened here.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你去跟怒牙神殿的奥索恩和心血神殿的科蒂安谈一谈。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to speak to Orsonn at the Rage Fang Shrine and Kodian at the Heart's Blood Shrine.",p="你和奥索恩、科蒂安讲过话了吗？",pEN="Have you spoken to Orsonn and Kodian yet?",c="睿智的乌索克子嗣，他们的话语解释了当前我们所见的一切。",cEN="Ursoc's children are wise. Their words explain much of what we've seen so far."}
Q[12248]={d="古时的德鲁伊似乎有充分的理由来摧毁沃达希尔。我们不能允许这些熊怪让它再生。\n\n但另一方面，我们需要使用树苗所包含的魔力来拯救乌索克的灵魂。\n\n拿上这根火炬，用它去烧毁树苗。灰喉堡就坐落在沃达希尔的老树根中，你可以在城堡中央找到那棵树苗。\n\n把沃达希尔的灰烬带回来给我，我希望等你用火净化它之后，我们也许可以用它的魔力来清除乌索克灵魂中的黑暗污染。",dEN="The druids of old seem to have had good reasons for destroying Vordrassil. We cannot let the furbolgs regrow it.\n\nOn the other hand, saving Ursoc's spirit hinges on the magic contained by the sapling.\n\nTake this torch and use it to burn the tree. You will find it in the middle of Grizzlemaw, inside Vordrassil's old trunk.\n\nBring me Vordrassil's ashes. It is my hope that once purified by fire, we may use its magic to cleanse Ursoc's spirit of its dark taint.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你用翠绿火炬焚烧沃达希尔的树苗。将沃达希尔的灰烬带回去交给她。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen in Amberpine Lodge wants you to take the Verdant Torch and use it to burn Vordrassil's Sapling. Bring Vordrassil's Ashes back to Hierophant Thayreen.",p="你把灰烬带来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you brought me the ashes, <name>?",c="太好了！沃达希尔的魔力仍存留在这些灰烬里。也许乌索克还有希望。",cEN="Yes! Vordrassil's magic is still present in these ashes. There might be hope for Ursoc yet."}
Q[12249]={d="时候到了，$n。带上这些灰烬，去找科蒂安所说的那个熊怪。如果他去找乌索克了，他就会在灰喉堡以北的巢穴附近。\n\n你需要他的帮助。你无法$g独自:独自;击败乌索克。\n\n击败乌索克之后，用这些灰烬净化他的灵魂。只有这样，我们才能知道我们的努力是否白费。",dEN="It is time, <name>. Take these ashes and look for the furbolg that Kodian spoke of. If he went to seek Ursoc, he will be near his den, north of Grizzlemaw.\n\nYou will need his help. You won't be able to defeat Ursoc alone.\n\nOnce you've defeated Ursoc, use these ashes to purify his spirit. Only then will we know whether our efforts have been in vain or not.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你能在乌索克的巢穴的附近找到图尔·怒爪，在他的帮助下打败乌索克。然后在乌索克的尸体上使用净化过的沃达希尔的灰烬。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to find Tur Ragepaw near Ursoc's Den and defeat Ursoc with his help. Use the Purified Ashes of Vordrassil on Ursoc's Corpse when you've accomplished this.",p="你回来了。成功了吗？",pEN="You've returned. Did you succeed?",c="<眼前的德鲁伊听完你的讲述之后，脸色苍白，眼神空洞的望着你。她留下了一个包裹以表示对你的凯旋表示感谢。>",cEN="<The druid looks pale and her eyes stare blankly past you. She has left a package in anticipation of your return.>"}
Q[12250]={d="我们不能让沃达希尔重新生长起来。如果熊怪曾经成功地让它重新生长过，那么它们就有可能再这么做一次。\n\n转至灰熊丘陵中部的灰喉堡，拿些沃达希尔的种子回来。我会保证把它们全部销毁。",dEN="We cannot allow Vordrassil to grow again. If the furbolg regrew it once, they can do it again.\n\nGo to Grizzlemaw, in central Grizzly Hills, and obtain Vordrassil's seeds. I will make sure they're properly disposed of.",o="琥珀松木营地的圣职者塞瑞恩希望你转至灰喉堡取回8颗沃达希尔的种子。",oEN="Hierophant Thayreen at Amberpine Lodge wants you to go to Grizzlemaw and obtain 8 of Vordrassil's Seeds.",p="你拿到种子了吗，<name>？",pEN="Do you have the seeds, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。这些我收下了。\n\n这些种子的腐化之力很危险。我必须立刻销毁它们。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I'll take those from you.\n\nThe corruptive power of these seeds is dangerous. I must destroy them right away."}
Q[12251]={d="立刻去向高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩复命，$n。告诉他你已经顺利完成任务，幸存的平民已经获救，并重新开始工作了。",dEN="Return to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at once, <name>. Let him know that your mission was a success and that the few remaining villagers that were rescued are back to work.",o="转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，与高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",c="<哈尔弗向你行礼。>\n\n村人全都回去工作了？杰出的表现，士兵！我们很快的就可以重建并强化城镇的防守。我们很快的就可以准备好援军增援弗塔根领主在天谴之门的战斗。\n\n当然，这话说的有点早了，在我们送你去帮伯瓦尔之前还有很多事情要做。",cEN="<Halford salutes.>\n\nThe townsfolk are all back to work? Already? Outstanding, soldier! We'll get this town built back up and fortified in no time. Before long, reinforcements will be ready to join the fight with Lord Fordragon at the Wrathgate.\n\nI'm getting ahead of myself, of course, as there is much left to do here before we can even think about sending you to the aid of Bolvar."}
Q[12252]={d="够了！我要你终结我族人所遭受的折磨！\n\n血色先锋军的拷问者勒克莱夫，一直在从所有被那些恶棍抓到的人身上榨取情报！我需要知道他们掌握了什么。\n\n我的线人告诉我，他就驻扎在他们兵营的底层，就在铁匠铺旁边。\n\n我会把我私人的烙铁借给你，确保这件事办得妥帖。\n\n找到他，把那份情报弄到手。",dEN="Enough! I want you to put an end to the torture of my people!\n\nThe Onslaught's torturer, LeCraft, has been bleeding information out of everyone that gets caught by those fiends! I need to know what they know.\n\nMy sources tell me that he has set up shop in the basement of their barracks, which is right next to the smithy.\n\nI'll loan you my personal branding iron to see to it that the job is done right.\n\nFind him and get that information.",o="怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯要你对拷问者里克拉夫连续使用5次权杖，获得情报后回来报告。",oEN="High Executor Wroth at Venomspite wants you to use the branding iron 5 times on Torturer LeCraft to get the information out of him. After that, kill him.",p="你带回什么消息？成功了，没错吧？",pEN="What news do you bring? Success, no doubt?",c="他们知道了这么多？还有，他说的那个见鬼的海军上将韦斯温到底是谁？！\n\n<执行官嘟囔着着说他讨厌惊喜。>\n\n我们最好搞清楚，而不是在这里瞎猜。我希望你有留下你的……呃，我的印记。",cEN="They knew all of that? And who the hell is this Grand Admiral Westwind that he spoke of?!\n\n<The high executor grumbles to himself about hating surprises.>\n\nBetter that we know than have to guess. I hope that you left your... er, my mark."}
Q[12253]={d="沿着这条路走到尽头就是暮冬城的城镇广场。这里曾是暮冬市民熙熙攘攘的活动中心，如今却成了战场，到处是凶残的恶鬼，一心要向生者复仇。\n\n广场周围的建筑里困着我们必须救出的村民！我对你要求太高了，$n，但你是我$g唯一:唯一;能抽调的$g士兵:士兵;。解放我们的族人。沿着这条路下去到城镇广场，进入那些房子。杀掉任何挡路的东西！如果你能活下来，就回来见我。",dEN="Just down this path here is Wintergarde's town square. Once a hive of activity for the citizens of Wintergarde, now a warzone, filled with murderous geists hell-bent on vengeance towards the living.\n\nIn the buildings surrounding the town square are trapped villagers that must be rescued! I ask much of you, now, <name>, but you are the only soldier I can spare. Free our people. Take this path down into town square and enter those houses. Kill anything that gets in your way! Return to me should you survive.",o="暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩要求你救回6名被困的暮冬城平民。",oEN="High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to rescue 6 Trapped Wintergarde Villagers.",p="你救出了我们受困的村民了吗？",pEN="Have you rescued our trapped villagers?",c="<哈尔弗为逝者念了一段祷文。>\n\n你在行圣光之道，<name>。\n\n我担心我们的工作才刚刚开始。\n\n<哈尔弗举起一份文件。>",cEN="<Halford says a prayer for the deceased.>\n\nYou do the Light's work, <name>.\n\nI fear that our work has only just begun.\n\n<Halford holds up a document.>"}
Q[12254]={d="这些计划昭示着即将发生一些大事。如果我们想要确定究竟会发生什么事情的话，就得赶快行动。\n\n不过首先，这些先锋军部队都有着某种奇怪的魔法保护。如果怨毒镇想要彻底解决他们，首先要做的就是查明是谁在背后释放魔法保护，并消灭他们。\n\n我注意到在新壁炉谷的另一侧，也就是伐木场后面，有一座教堂，那里的主教正在加强他对血色先锋军士兵的祝福。杀死他，把他的祈祷之书偷走。\n\n也许那本书能给我们提供一些线索。",dEN="These plans indicate something imminent is being planned.\n\nBut first, there's the matter of this strange protection that the Onslaught forces have. If Venomspite is to deal with them once and for all, we must find out who's behind it and eliminate them.\n\nI've noticed that the bishop in the chapel on the far side of New Hearthglen, across from the lumbermill, has stepped up his blessing of the troops. Kill him and steal his prayer book.\n\nMaybe it will give us a clue.",o="新壁炉谷的斯古莉探员要求你去弄到斯崔特主教的祈祷之书。",oEN="Agent Skully at New Hearthglen has asked you to acquire Bishop Street's Prayer Book.",p="你拿到主教的祈祷书了吗？你在其中有发现任何不寻常之处吗？",pEN="You have the bishop's prayerbook? Did you find anything unusual in it?",c="你说书背上有个新写上去的祈祷文？\n\n<当你把最后一页翻出来的时候，探员越过你的肩头一瞥。>\n\n该死！那是高阶修士的笔迹！我敢拿你的命打赌。",cEN="A newly scribed blessing at the back of the book you say?\n\n<The agent glances over your shoulder as you flip to the page at the end.>\n\nDamn it all! That's the high abbot's handwriting! I'd stake your life on it."}
Q[12255]={d="很好。你不仅抢来了这么多的护符，还削弱了沃德伦的防御力量。现在，我们要对他们的领袖托瓦德·埃里克森领主下手。\n\n这个领主有一只他宠爱到极点的座骑，是头名叫烈焰使者的始祖龙，它一直被领主的手下用非常粗重的铁链锁在村子的西面。有了这些护符，你就可以长时间地控制它，利用它对付托瓦德·埃里克森领主。\n\n嗯，确认你控制了烈焰使者以后，在沃德伦的那些塔楼顶层寻找领主，不要对他手下留情。",dEN="Now that you've captured the flame-imbued talismans and weakened Voldrune's defenses, we can strike at its leader, Thane Torvald Eriksson.\n\nThe thane's favorite mount is an unruly proto-drake he calls Flamebringer. It is kept bound in chains in the western part of Voldrune, but with the talismans, you should be able to control it long enough to use it against the thane.\n\nOnce you have Flamebringer under your control, search the tops of the towers of Voldrune for the thane and show him no mercy.",o="利用烈焰使者击败托瓦德·埃里克森领主，然后向琥珀松木营地的伐木工德拉克复命。",oEN="Use Flamebringer to defeat Thane Torvald Eriksson and report to Woodsman Drake at Amberpine Lodge.",p="你击倒族长了吗？我们不能冒险让他继续掌权。",pEN="Have you overcome the thane? We cannot risk leaving him in power.",c="干得好，<name>。我怀疑那些伐木工里没人愿意去招惹那头始祖龙，但我们不能任由斩龙部族在灰熊丘陵建立起势力根基。要是部落也能这么容易解决就好了……",cEN="Good work, <name>. I doubt any of the woodsmen would've wanted to take a crack at the proto-drake, but we couldn't afford to let the Dragonflayers build a base of power in Grizzly Hills. If only the Horde was so easily dealt with..."}
Q[12256]={d="就在那群胆小如鼠的联盟杂碎向我们的阵地发动进攻时，东南面的维库人前哨站——沃德伦的掠龙氏族已经做好了战争的准备。虽然维库人不是我们在这里所面对的最强大的敌人，但我们必须要在他们能对我们造成真正的威胁之前消灭他们。\n\n他们最强大的战士能够骑着半驯服的始祖龙进行战斗，为了控制这种野兽，他们的缚焰者制造了强大的护符。你必须杀死他们并抢到护符，这样我们才能进行下一步的计划。",dEN="Even as the Alliance cowards attack our positions, the Dragonflayer vrykul outpost of Voldrune, to the southeast, prepares for war. The vrykul are far from the strongest enemy we face here, but we must eliminate them before they can truly threaten us.\n\nTheir most powerful warriors are permitted to ride half-trained proto-drakes into battle. To control the beasts, their flamebinders create powerful talismans. You'll need to slay them and take the talismans if our plan is to work.",o="将3枚烈焰能量护符交给征服堡的纳兹格利姆中士。",oEN="Bring 3 Flame-Imbued Talismans to Sergeant Nazgrim at Conquest Hold.",p="能量护符你收集妥当了吗？",pEN="Did you collect those talismans?",c="有了这些护符的力量，这些始祖龙将不得不臣服于你的命令之下，缚焰者领主死期不远了。",cEN="With the power of the talismans, the drake has no choice but to obey your commands. The thane's fate is sealed."}
Q[12257]={d="东南方的维库村落沃德伦正在备战。他们的领主召集不起大军，但我们的兵力如此分散，仍然面临风险。\n\n我们不能给他们进攻的机会，所以必须主动出击。如果你真是部落的$g<勇士>:<勇士>;，就会乐于抓住这个机会展示我们的力量。\n\n砍倒那些侍卫，让斩龙部族明白部落不容轻侮！$c",dEN="Preparations for war are underway in the vrykul village of Voldrune to the southeast. Voldrune's thane cannot field a large army, but with our forces spread thin, we are still at risk.\n\nWe cannot risk giving the thane and his men an opportunity to attack, so we must take the battle to them. If you are truly a <class> of the Horde, you will relish the chance to demonstrate our strength.\n\nCut down the huscarls and prove to this Dragonflayer clan that the Horde is not to be trifled with!",o="消灭12个掠龙侍卫，然后向征服堡的纳兹格利姆中士复命。",oEN="Kill 12 Dragonflayer Huscarls and return to Sergeant Nazgrim at Conquest Hold.",p="你完成行动了没？",pEN="Have you done the deed?",c="你完全做到了我要求的事，我们迫使掠龙者采取守势，很快就是对付他们的领袖的时候了。",cEN="You have done exactly as I asked. We've got the Dragonflayers on the defensive and it'll soon be time to deal with their leader."}
Q[12258]={d="这条路走到尽头就是城镇广场，但那里已经完全被暮冬城平民的亡灵占据了！我们自己的墓地现在反而为天灾军团提供了无尽的士兵资源。别再有任何的仁慈了，$n。他们曾经身为人类时所拥有的一切情感与思想，恐怕都随着他们的生命一起消逝了，现在他们只是一群凶残狂暴的亡灵生物而已，存在的目的也只有一个：毁灭我们。\n\n你的任务就是立刻转至城镇广场，将那些妄图复仇的亡灵彻底毁灭。让他们安息吧。",dEN="The town square, down this path, is overrun with the undead citizens of Wintergarde! Our own crypt provides a seemingly endless supply of soldiers for the Scourge to throw at us. Take no pity on them, though, <name>. While they were once mortal, capable of compassion and thought, they are now ravaging undead with only one purpose: our destruction.\n\nVenture forth to the town square and deliver the vengeful geists to their maker. Give them peace.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的指挥官莱诺尔·风击要你杀死 15 个复仇恶鬼。|n",oEN="Commander Lynore Windstryke at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to kill 15 Vengeful Geists.",p="让他们解脱吧，<name>。",pEN="Put them out of their misery, <name>.",c="如今他们也许能够安息，灵魂也将回归圣光。\n\n如今，我的悬念和祈祷转向了天谴之门的弗塔根大人。我们必须坚守这里，以争取更多的时间以击败巫妖王。暮冬要塞牢不可破！",cEN="Perhaps now they will rest easy, their spirits free to ascend to the Light.\n\nMy thoughts and prayers now turn to Lord Fordragon and our forces at the Wrathgate. We must persevere here, if only to buy them enough time to defeat the Lich King. Wintergarde cannot fall."}
Q[12259]={d="有了这些烈焰能量护符，我们终于可以挑战领主了。\n\n他有一只宠爱到极点的座骑，是头名叫烈焰使者的始祖龙，它一直被领主的手下用非常粗重的铁链锁在村子的西面。有了这些护符，你就可以长时间地控制它，利用它对付托瓦德·埃里克森领主。\n\n嗯，确认你控制了烈焰使者以后，在沃德伦的那些塔楼顶层寻找领主并消灭他。",dEN="With the flame-imbued talismans, we can finally challenge the thane.\n\nHis favorite mount is a ferocious proto-drake called Flamebringer. It is kept bound in chains in the western part of Voldrune, but with the power of the talismans, you should be able to bend it to your will and use it against the thane.\n\nOnce you have Flamebringer under your control, search the tops of the towers of Voldrune for the thane and use Flamebringer to destroy him.",o="利用烈焰使者击败托瓦德·埃里克森领主，然后向征服堡的纳兹格利姆中士复命。",oEN="Use Flamebringer to defeat Thane Torvald Eriksson and report to Sergeant Nazgrim at Conquest Hold.",p="你击倒领主了吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the thane?",c="残存的掠龙族人在你击败领主之后就再没胆挑战我们了。对敌人毫不容情——这就是部落的手段。",cEN="The few remaining Dragonflayers dare not challenge us after your battle with the thane. Show no mercy to our enemies - that is the way of the Horde."}
Q[12260]={d="你一定在想我是如何维持这副伪装的。我用的是间谍大师借给我的一面魔镜。\n\n它本身的能量有限，但我想足够$g我们俩:我们俩;用。来，拿着。我要你用假扮成血色先锋军的一名鸦人祭司。\n\n动作$g快点:快点;……你拿着镜子的时候，我不知道我的幻象还能维持多久。\n\n要知道你不会立刻变得完美$g伪装:伪装;，所以在有机会帮你之前，别指望它能万无一失。",dEN="You may wonder how I can maintain this guise; I use a magic mirror that was loaned to me by the spy mistress.\n\nIt only has so much power in it, but I think there's enough for the both of us. Here, take it. I want you to use it to impersonate one of the Onslaught raven priests.\n\nBe quick about it... I have no idea how long my glamour will last while you have the mirror.\n\nRealize that you won't immediately be perfectly disguised, so don't count on it being foolproof until I've had a chance to help you.",o="新壁炉谷的斯古莉探员要求你去窃取先锋军黑鸦祭司的影像。完成任务之后，把女妖的魔镜还给她。",oEN="Agent Skully at New Hearthglen has asked you steal the image of a Onslaught Raven Priest. Return the Banshee's Magic Mirror to her when you have done so.",p="你没打破镜子吧？！",pEN="Please tell me that you didn't break the mirror?!",c="不错，<class>。既然那位祭司的形象已经困在镜子里了，我还有别的事要做。",cEN="Not bad, <class>. Now that the priest's image is trapped within the mirror, I have something else that needs doing."}
Q[12261]={d="他们正在从我死去的兄弟们的骸骨中汲取能量……\n\n我不喜欢这个教派，可他们的肮脏行径更让我怒不可遏。我绝对不会对他们手下留情……不过话说回来，我一向也没对谁手下留情过。\n\n你要确保他们一个都跑不了。把这个毁灭结界放在圣地出口的尽头。在它完成充能之前，你要保护好它。",dEN="They're drawing power from the bones of my dead brothers...\n\nI have no love for the cult, but I'm baffled by their audacity. There will be no mercy shown for them... not that I ever would have anyway.\n\nEnsure that they have no place to flee when the slaughter starts. Place a destructive ward at the end of the path leading out of the shrine... where the road starts to give way to snow. Defend it until it is fully charged.",o="将毁灭结界放在黑曜石巨龙圣地出口的尽头，雪花开始复盖道路的地方。保护它完成充能，然后向瑟里纳尔复命。",oEN="Place a Destructive Ward at the end of the path leading out of Obsidian Dragonshrine, where the road starts to give way to snow. Protect the ward until it is fully charged, then return to Serinar.",p="你放好御符了没有？",pEN="Have you placed the ward?",c="很好。当他们因恐惧而逃跑的时候，那结界就会在那里温柔地让他们与世长辞。",cEN="Excellent. When they begin to flee in fear, the ward shall be there to wish them a fond farewell."}
Q[12262]={d="一个也不能放过。\n\n外面那些下等的通灵侍僧和他们的骷髅仆从正在玷污我的土地。让他们从这片圣地上消失。",dEN="We will spare no one.\n\nOutside, lowly necrolytes and their skeletal servants shame my land with their presence. Slaughter them all.",o="到黑曜石巨龙圣地外面击败6个燃烧深渊通灵侍僧和10个冒烟的骷髅。完成任务后向瑟里纳尔复命。",oEN="Kill 6 Burning Depths Necrolytes and 10 Smoldering Skeletons outside of the Obsidian Dragonshrine. Return to Serinar once the task is complete.",p="我看见你手上的血迹……那么，解决了吗？",pEN="I see the blood on your hands... it is done then?",c="他们有没有可悲地求饶？软弱的东西。",cEN="Did they beg for their miserable lives? Weaklings."}
Q[12263]={d="诅咒教派显然不会是仅仅为了汲取死龙的力量而来的。我大概知道他们想要什么，但我还是希望你去证实一下。\n\n我会把你变成这个死掉的通灵侍僧的模样，你要到洞穴深处中去确认他们闯入这处圣地的意图。我可以通过你的眼睛看到一切。\n\n你要小心，$n，哪怕受到一点儿伤害都会破除这个脆弱的伪装。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned has not come just to extract power from dead dragons. I suspect I know what they are up to, but I need you to prove me correct.\n\nI will grant you the guise of this dead necrolyte. Proceed to the back of the cave and confirm their intentions for being in this sacred place. I will watch through your eyes.\n\nBe cautious <name>, any damage done to you is likely to break the fragile illusion.",o="等待瑟里纳尔将你变成燃烧深渊通灵侍僧，然后到奈萨里奥之喉深处去打探诅咒教派的意图。完成任务后向瑟里纳尔复命。",oEN="Wait for Serinar to administer the disguise of a Burning Depths Necrolyte, then proceed to the back of the Maw of Neltharion to uncover what the Cult of the Damned is doing there. Return to Serinar with details regarding their purpose.",p="我厌倦这场瘟疫。",pEN="I tire of this pestilence.",c="我们是黑龙军团。几千年来，我们在艾泽拉斯的土地上散布死亡。破败的诅咒教派崇信死亡，我们很乐意答应他们的请求。",cEN="We are the Black Dragonflight. We have rained destruction on the lands of Azeroth for thousands of years. The decrepit Cult of the Damned worships death and we shall be glad to oblige."}
Q[12264]={d="那个洞穴里挤满了诅咒教派的暴徒。对这种生物只有一个解决办法……你知道该怎么做的。",dEN="The cave beyond was swarming with Cult atrocities. There is only one way to deal with such creatures... you know what to do.",o="转至奈萨里奥之喉，杀死3个燃烧深渊通灵师、6个冒烟的构造体和6个冒烟的恶鬼，然后向瑟里纳尔复命。",oEN="Kill 3 Burning Depths Necromancers, 6 Smoldering Constructs, and 6 Smoldering Geist in the Maw of Neltharion, and then return to Serinar.",p="我忍不住想了解，他们究竟是太天真所以觉得我会容忍他们，抑或他们纯粹只是活腻了。",pEN="I cannot help but wonder whether they are naive enough to think that I will abide this or if they are simply suicidal.",c="听着他们的惨叫……看着最后一丝生命从他们可悲的躯体中消逝……真是令人振奋，你不觉得吗？\n\n我很享受。",cEN="Hearing their screams... watching the last life fade from their wretched bodies... it's invigorating, is it not?\n\nI relish it."}
Q[12265]={d="在你去洞穴侦察的时候，我感觉到那些符文里蕴藏着巨大的魔法能量。我不会让你去冒险抽出那些法力的……最直接的办法往往才是最有效的办法。\n\n去毁掉那些符文……把它们砸碎，绝对不能让诅咒教派的人得到里面存储的能量。",dEN="I sensed a large accumulation of magic in the runes that we witnessed when you were scouting the cave. I will not have you toy with extracting the magic... often the most straight forward solution is the most effective one.\n\nDestroy the runes... stamp them out and ensure that the Cult will not have access to whatever power that they've accumulated there.",o="进入奈萨里奥之喉，找到并砸碎8枚通灵符文。完成任务后向瑟里纳尔复命。",oEN="Locate and stamp out 8 Necromantic Runes that have been drawn on the floor inside the Maw of Neltharion. Return to Serinar once the task is complete.",p="能量都浪费在弱小和无用的人身上。\n\n除非找一个够资格拥有上天赋予生命和魔法的生物给我，否则在灭绝所有生物以前别跟我谈什么叫浪费。\n\n不过，别担心，我会等着。",pEN="Power wasted on the weak and useless.\n\nShow me a being worth of the life and magic they have been gifted, and then perhaps we can talk of waste before extinguishing their presence.\n\nDon't worry, I'll wait.",c="很好，还有很多事情要做。",cEN="Good. There is more to be done."}
Q[12266]={d="你现在可以走了，$r。\n\n去告诉纳莉丝，她错过了一个好杀手。",dEN="You can leave now, <race>.\n\nGo tell Nalice she missed out on a good slaughter.",o="返回龙眠神殿，告诉纳莉丝你已经完成了瑟里纳尔的任务。",oEN="Travel back to Wyrmrest and let Nalice know that Serinar's task is complete.",c="噢，是你啊。\n\n我还希望瑟里纳尔完成任务以后能亲自回来呢……我想他一定又为了别的杀戮分心了吧。完全迷失在荣耀的混战中了！\n\n你还在啊？没你的事了，一边去吧。",cEN="Oh, it's you.\n\nI had hoped Serinar would simply return himself once the task was done... I suppose he's distracted by something or another to kill. He's missing out on a gloriously messy battle!\n\nAre you still here? I'm done with you."}
Q[12267]={d="既然我们已经削减了教徒的数量，并瓦解了他们的力量，现在我们要做的就是摧毁堕落的源头。\n\n腐烂者洛森就在洞穴深处，他正试图把死去的黑龙复活成熔岩之龙。你必须转至召唤大厅，去净化黑龙的遗骨。防止它们再被人复活的唯一办法就是……用火。\n\n烧毁遗骨自然会引起腐烂者洛森的注意，你要确保他也被彻底消灭。\n\n这瓶药剂会帮你完成任务的。",dEN="With the cult's ranks thinned and some of their power stripped, it's time to strike at the source of the corruption.\n\nRothin the Decaying is resurrecting black dragons as magmawyrms in the back of the cave. Go to the summoning chamber and cleanse the remaining bones in the only way that will ensure that they will never be toyed with again... with flame.\n\nBurning the bones will surely gain Rothin's attention, see to it that he is destroyed as well.\n\nThe magic in this vial should see the task done.",o="进入奈萨里奥之喉深处，使用奈萨里奥的烈焰净化召唤本地。当你吸引到腐烂者洛森的注意力之后，杀掉他，然后把瓶子还给洞穴外的瑟里纳尔。",oEN="Use Neltharion's Flame to douse the summoning area in the back of the Maw of Neltharion. Once you get the attention of Rothin the Decaying, kill him, then return to Serinar at the front of the cave.",p="你是一件相当好用的工具，<class>。感谢你参与这场清洗。",pEN="You are quite an effective tool, <class>. Your hand in this purging is appreciated.",c="我子嗣的遗骨已经不再受到侮辱。你为我做了很多，就此而言，你应得到适当的奖赏。",cEN="The bones of my brood have been spared this filth. You have served me well, and as such, you shall be awarded appropriately."}
Q[12268]={d="啊啊啊！这东西简直就是一堆垃圾啊！\n\n地精工程师留下了一大堆需要解决的问题，你不信吗？看看这个就知道了！要让这东西正常运转简直就是个奇迹。\n\n来帮我一把，怎么样？为了让这东西能动起来，我必须替换一些齿轮、链齿和弹簧。你应该可以很轻松地在木材切割场附近找到这些东西。",dEN="Ack! This thing's a mess!\n\nGoblin engineering leaves a great deal to be desired, believe you me. Just look at this! It's a wonder it ever worked to begin with.\n\nGive me a hand, will ya? To get this even close to operable specifications I'll need to replace a few cogs, sprockets, and springs. You should have no trouble finding them down around the sawmill.",o="蓝天伐木场的皮普斯维克希望你去收集4个凹槽齿轮、3个刻缺链条和2个高压弹簧。",oEN="Pipthwack in Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to collect 4 Grooved Cogs, 3 Notched Sprockets, and 2 High Tension Springs.",p="那些零件给我弄到了吗，<class>？",pEN="Got those parts for me, <class>?",c="没错，就是这样。这些应该够用了……\n\n好了。又多了一台可以上阵的伐木机。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Yes indeed. These should do the trick...\n\nThere. One more shredder ready for the fight. Thanks, <name>."}
Q[12269]={d="那些该死的亡灵偷袭了我们！暮冬矿洞沦陷了。更糟的是，克尔苏加德的信徒把死难的矿工变成了天灾亡灵，并让他们用我们的矿石给他们提供原料！\n\n我们必须切断这条补给线，让死难的兄弟们得到安息。\n\n你现在就到东北方的腐臭平原去，进入暮冬矿洞，干掉那些矿工丧尸。把他们的矿工工作证带回来给我，以便我登记死难者。",dEN="That blasted necropolis blindsided us! In the wake of its destruction Wintergarde Mine was lost. Worse yet, Kel'Thuzad's acolytes have raised the slain miners as Scourge and are using them to supply their siegesmiths with materials from our mine!\n\nThe supply line must be halted and our lost brothers must be put to rest.\n\nTravel to Wintergarde Mine, northeast of here in the Carrion Fields, and destroy the risen miners. Return to me with their miner cards so that I may put their passing in our registry.",o="龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞里的李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵要你带回10张暮冬矿工的工作证。",oEN="Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to recover 10 Wintergarde Miner's Cards.",p="你取回他们的工作证了吗？",pEN="Did you recover their cards?",c="<李奥瑞克接过了工作证。>\n\n我会把这些交给我们的纪录员，并且通知他们家人这个不幸的消息。\n\n如果我们要在这里，以及天谴之门获取终极的胜利，还有很多事情等着我们去完成。弗塔根大人需要我们的支持。",cEN="<Leoric takes the cards from you.>\n\nI will get these to our recorder and deliver the grim news to the families of the miners.\n\nThere is still much to be done if we are to succeed here and ultimately at the Wrathgate. Lord Fordragon is depending on us."}
Q[12270]={d="看我的口型，$c——我需要那些伐木机！重要的是——我需要让它们远离联盟的控制！\n\n他们正在重新翻修伐木机，用来对我们在风险湾的弟兄们。现在我们要让他们自食其果！\n\n如果你看到伐木机，就帮我把它开回来！如果你看到伐木机上面有联盟狗，就干掉他们，然后把伐木机开回来！\n\n出发吧！",dEN="Read my lips, <class> - I need those shredders! Just as important - I need to keep them out of the hands of the Alliance!\n\nThey've been refurbishing the shredders and using them against our brothers in Venture Bay. Now we're going to give them a taste of their own medicine!\n\nYou see a shredder out there, grab it! You see one of the Alliance scum on one, kill 'em and then grab it! Once you have one, drive it back here to me and we'll get to work on it.\n\nDismissed!",o="蓝天伐木场的格利克希望你夺取3台伐木机，然后把它们交给他。",oEN="Grekk at Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to acquire 3 shredders and return to him with them.",p="那些伐木机给我弄来了吗，<class>？",pEN="Get me those shredders yet, <class>?",c="做得好，士兵！\n\n现在拿着这把钥匙去冒险海湾。这可以让你开动一台翻新的伐木机对我们的敌人造成大混乱。\n\n喔对了，如果你想要抄捷径的话就跟达尔洛克谈谈！",cEN="Good work, soldier!\n\nNow take this key and get yourself down to Venture Bay. It'll let you use one of the refurbished shredders to unleash chaos on our enemies.\n\nOh yes, and talk to Darrok if you want to take the shortcut!"}
Q[12271]={d="里克拉夫手中的一根魔棒掉了下来。魔棒周身布满了魔法符文。\n\n是不是因为这个才让他在拷问囚犯的时候无往而不利？\n\n最好还是让高级执行官看一看这个。",dEN="A rod drops from LeCraft's dead hand. There are pulsing magical runes along its length.\n\nCould this be how he was getting his confessions?\n\nBetter let the high executor have a look at it.",o="将拷问者的魔棒交给怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯。",oEN="Deliver the Torturer's Rod to High Executor Wroth at Venomspite.",p="你从他们的拷问者手中拿到那个魔棒了吗？",pEN="Did you get that rod from their torturer?",c="你说里克拉夫持有这个魔棒？那么事情就说得通了。\n\n我认得它——我年轻的时候在泰瑞纳斯国王的旧洛丹伦宫廷里担任拷问官——它被称做强制魔棒。\n\n<执行官将双手绞在一起仿佛在思索着什么邪恶的计划。>\n\n我有个主意，我们可以好好地利用魔棒！",cEN="LeCraft had it you say? That makes sense.\n\nI recognize it from my youthful days as a torturer in the court of King Terenas of fallen Lordaeron. It's known as a rod of compulsion.\n\n<The high executor wrings his hands together in evil anticipation of what's to come.>\n\nI have an idea for how we can make good use of it!"}
Q[12272]={d="在纳克萨玛斯入侵前不久，一名矿工发现了一块会流出粘稠液体的黑色矿脉。在疏散矿井人员的时候，因为场面混乱，我们不小心遗失了这种矿石的样品。现在天灾军团正在勘探这种矿石，想要把它应用到他们的死亡机器上去。\n\n暮冬矿洞就在东北方的腐臭平原，你必须返回那里，夺得这种未知矿石——这对我们的胜利至关重要！",dEN="Hours before the Naxxramas invasion, one of the miners stumbled upon a dark ore that was oozing a viscous fluid. In the chaos that occurred during the evacuation of the mine, we lost the samples taken from the alien node. Now the Scourge prospects the ore for use in their machines of death.\n\nYou must get back to Wintergarde Mine, due northeast of here in the Carrion Fields, and recover the strange ore. It is imperative to our mission's success!",o="龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的攻城技师夸特弗拉什要你转至暮冬矿洞，取回10份奇怪的矿石的样品。",oEN="Siege Engineer Quarterflash at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to recover 10 samples of Strange Ore from Wintergarde Mine.",p="你回收完奇怪的矿石样本了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered samples of the strange ore?",c="这可能就是那个时刻，那一秒，战局对天灾军团逆转的瞬间。你已经证明自己是联盟的英雄，至少在我眼里是这样，<name>。\n\n现在，如果你能行行好，给我留点空间。我需要更多时间来研究这种矿石，好分离出杂质和弱点。\n\n继续吧，盟友。一有消息我就会联系你。",cEN="This might be the moment, the very second, that the tide turns against the Scourge. You have proven yourself as a hero of the Alliance, at least in my eyes, <name>.\n\nNow if you would be so kind as to give me some space. I will require additional time to study this ore in order to isolate impurities and weakness.\n\nCarry on, ally. I will contact you once I have an update."}
Q[12273]={d="是时候彻底挫败血色先锋军的士气了！\n\n我希望你带上这根魔棒，对他们的四个领导者使用——兵营楼上的指挥官乔丹，沙滩东南方斜坡上的炮兵队长泽尔哈特，铁匠铺里的铁匠古德曼，以及马厩里的兽栏管理员默希尔。\n\n让他们在魔棒的作用下公开谴责血色先锋军，然后干掉他们！",dEN="It's time for us to utterly demoralize the Onslaught forces!\n\nI want you to take the rod and use it on four of their leaders: Commander Jordan upstairs at the barracks, Lead Cannoneer Zierhut down the southeast ramp overlooking the beach, Blacksmith Goodman at the smithy, and Stable Master Mercer at the stables.\n\nPlace them under the rod's compulsion, concentrate on making them denounce the Onslaught, and then kill them!",o="怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯要你对指挥官乔丹、炮兵队长泽尔哈特、铁匠古德曼和兽栏管理员默希尔使用强制魔棒。\n\n等他们在魔棒的作用下公开谴责血色先锋军后就杀掉他们。",oEN="High Executor Wroth at Venomspite has tasked you with using the Rod of Compulsion on Commander Jordan, Lead Cannoneer Zierhut, Blacksmith Goodman, and Stable Master Mercer.\n\nOnce the rod has been used on them, kill each to exact a denouncement of the Scarlet Onslaught as their final words.",p="怎么样？！",pEN="Well?!",c="<你仿佛看到一丝笑意掠过沃斯的脸上，随即迅速消失。>\n\n你现在是我最喜欢的<class>了，<name>。如果你有兴趣，我希望你考虑作为军官加入复仇之手。\n\n我们可以先让你当死亡卫兵，几十年之后，我想你就有资格成为初级执行者了！\n\n不想？别急着拒绝……慢慢来，好好想想。",cEN="<You think you see just the hint of a smile cross Wroth's face before quickly disappearing.>\n\nYou're now my favorite <class>, <name>. If you have a mind to, I'd like you to think about joining up as an officer in the Hand of Vengeance.\n\nWe can start you out as a deathguard, and in a few decades I think you have what it takes to make junior executor!\n\nNo? Well don't be too hasty... take your time and mull it over."}
Q[12274]={d="我需要从高阶修士那里获取更多的情报，而且我们现在已经有了黑暗祭司的伪装，可以让你大摇大摆地与他谈话了。\n\n不幸的是，我们必须想办法让他和他的卫兵分开，否则你永远都不可能从他嘴里套出任何情报。\n\n<探员靠在她的铁铲上，思考了片刻。>\n\n我有办法了。当你在伪装状态下时，去修道院的顶端鸣响钟声。那样应该可以让修士的卫兵们跑出去集合，这样你就可以去下面和他谈谈了。",dEN="We need more information from the high abbot, and now that we have the visage of one of the raven priests, I think we can get you close to talk with him.\n\nUnfortunately, we need to separate him from his bodyguards or you'll never get any information out of him.\n\n<The agent leans on her shovel and thinks a moment.>\n\nI think I've got it! While in disguise, go to the top of the abbey and ring the bell. That should bring the abbot's bodyguards running and you can then head down to speak with him.",o="新壁炉谷的斯古莉探员要求你转至修道院鸣钟，然后去和那里的高阶修士谈话，从他嘴里套出情报。",oEN="Agent Skully at New Hearthglen has asked you to ring the bell in the abbey and then go speak with the high abbot and get information out of him.",p="你找出什么了吗？你到底跟他说过话了没有？",pEN="What did you find out? Have you even talked with him yet?",c="<La agente te mira con ojos entrecerrados>这到底是怎么回事？！\n\n他自己跳下去的？你确定不是你推的？\n\n<探员眯起眼睛看着你>\n\n好吧。显然这里发生的事情远比我们最初想的要多得多。",cEN="What the hell is going on here?!\n\nHe jumped on his own? You're certain that you didn't push him?\n\n<The agent narrows her eyes at you.>\n\nFine. Clearly there's much more going on in this place than we first thought."}
Q[12275]={d="夸特弗拉什前几天要我派一个职业探子去侦察一下暮冬矿洞，结果我派了我的副手斯林奇去帮他。我天真地以为他完成了夸特弗拉什的任务后可以顺手把那地方炸了，确保我们在与天灾军团的战争中再次获得胜利。\n\n现在已经过去整整一天了，可斯林奇还没回来。我要知道原因！你现在就去和攻城技师夸特弗拉什谈一谈，把我失踪的手下找回来！",dEN="Quarterflash recently requisitioned my group for a specialist that he could send on a reconnaissance mission to the Wintergarde Mine. To that end, I sent him Slinkin, my demolitionist. I foolishly thought that he could close off that pit of damnation after his mission for Quarterflash was complete, securing another victory for us against the Scourge.\n\nAn entire day has now passed and Slinkin has not returned. I want answers! Speak with Siege Engineer Quarterflash and track down my missing agent!",o="转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，与攻城技师夸特弗拉什谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Siege Engineer Quarterflash at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",c="我觉得事情很糟糕，我的朋友。我担心在我急切地想要从暮冬矿洞里回收那种奇怪矿石的过程中，我可能害死了斯林奇。",cEN="I feel terrible about this, friend. I fear that in my haste to recover the strange ore from Wintergarde Mine I may have doomed agent Slinkin."}
Q[12276]={d="虽然我没有斯林金的消息，也不知道他遭遇了什么，但也许我能帮忙找到他。\n\n<夸特弗莱什举起一个机械小玩具。>\n\n这不是玩具，新来的同胞。事实上，这是我最新的机械造物。这台机器被创造出来的唯一目的就是寻找失落之物。眼下的情形很遗憾，但这台机器是你找到斯林金的最佳机会。\n\n当你$g准备好:准备好;开始搜寻时，把机器人放在我旁边的地上。",dEN="While I have not heard from Slinkin or know what fate has befallen him, perhaps I can assist in finding him.\n\n<Quarterflash holds up a tiny mechanical toy.>\n\nThis is not a toy, newfound compatriot. It is, in fact, my latest mechanical creation. The machine was created with the sole purpose of finding that which has been lost. These are unfortunate circumstances, but the machine is your best chance at finding Slinkin.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin your search, place the bot on the ground next to me.",o="转至暮冬矿洞寻找破坏专家斯林奇。你可以使用夸特弗拉什的导航机器人来帮忙寻找矿洞。",oEN="Find Slinkin the Demo-gnome in Wintergarde Mine. Use Quarterflash's Homing Bot if you need help finding the mine.",c="<斯林金紧握的手中有一张字条。>\n\n被追进了死胡同。暂时藏了起来，但他们知道我在。他们找到我不会太久。\n\n矿工们不知疲倦地挖掘那种驱动天灾战争机器的奇怪矿石。他们说了很多闲话。死亡的语言让我困惑，但我已经能辨认出一些常说的音节和短语。\"尤格-萨隆\"这个词被带着极大的轻蔑说出，通常后面跟着大声的叫嚷。他们称那种矿石为\"萨隆邪铁\"。什么意思？",cEN="<There is a note in Slinkin's death grip.>\n\nChased into a dead end. Hidden for now, but they know I'm here. It won't be long until they find me.\n\nThe miners work tirelessly to unearth the strange ore that fuels the Scourge war machines. There is much banter. The language of death confounds me, but I have been able to identify commonly uttered sounds and phrases. The word \"Yogg-Saron\" is said with great contempt and is usually followed by loud outbursts. They refer to the ore as \"saronite.\" Meaning?"}
Q[12277]={d="如果你的心脏还能承受得了，思路也还清晰的话，就读下去吧。\n\n在矿井里，靠近工头的脚手架的地方，有一大堆炸药。你现在就去弄几捆炸药，然后到矿井的入口处去把它炸了。记住一定要把暮冬矿洞的上层入口和下层入口都炸掉。\n\n你不能给那些亡灵留下任何机会，绝对不能让里面的邪恶逃出来。圣光与你同在。",dEN="If there is good in your heart and your conscience is clear, read on.\n\nIn this mine, near the foreman's scaffold, rests a hefty cargo of dynamite. Go there and pick up several bundles of the explosive and make your way towards the entrance of the mine. Once there, set the dynamite and blow up the entrance. Remember to do this for the upper and lower entry points of Wintergarde Mine.\n\nYou must leave nothing to chance. The evil that exists here must never be allowed out. Light guide you.",o="找到暮冬矿洞炸弹，并用它把暮冬矿洞的上层入口和暮冬矿洞的下层入口炸掉。完成任务后，转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向攻城技师夸特弗拉什复命。",oEN="Retrieve a Wintergarde Mine Bomb and use it to blow up the Upper Wintergarde Mine Shaft and the Lower Wintergarde Mine Shaft. Report back to Siege Engineer Quarterflash at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight when you have completed this task.",p="<夸特弗拉什点了点头。>\n\n他是个伟大的侏儒，我们之中最优秀的。永远怀念斯林奇。",pEN="<Quarterflash nods.>\n\nHe was a good gnome, one of our best. Slinkin will be missed.",c="朋友，他的死不会白费。斯林奇因为这个消息送命，而这个消息却将成为击溃巫妖王的利器。我向你保证，我们会成功的。",cEN="His death will not have been in vain, friend. The information that Slinkin died for will be instrumental in defeating the Lich King. I promise you that we will make this right."}
Q[12278]={d="会员自有其特权。成为\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部的成员，就意味着知道去哪里弄到最新最好的酒。\n\n把你的\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给铁炉堡石火旅店的拉尔金·雷酒。",dEN="Membership has its privileges. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing where to get the latest and greatest brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",o="把\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给铁炉堡石火旅店的拉尔金·雷酒。",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do you have your membership forms filled out?",c="你的文件看起来没问题。欢迎加入俱乐部，<name>！\n\n你可以在每个月初收到我们的邮件。如果你喜欢收到的酒，随时过来，我们可以再卖给你一些。这就是一个不断奉献的俱乐部。",cEN="Your paperwork looks to be in order. Welcome to the club, <name>!\n\nYou can expect to get our mail at the start of every month. If you like what you got, stop by and we can sell you some more. This is the club that keeps on giving."}
Q[12279]={d="幸好你回来了，$g瘸腿:瘸腿;！我还担心格里塞尔达和我要孤零零地待着了。\n\n我正在给我们做点吃的，但格里塞尔达什么都不肯吃。\n\n她喜欢东风海岸近海的鱼，就在东边。我自己受不了那味道，可她一向挑食。六条个头不错的鱼应该能让她高兴一阵子。\n\n现在快跑……呃……快瘸着走吧，乔。你不想让那姑娘等着，对吧？",dEN="Thank goodness you're back, Limpy! I worried that Griselda and I were going to be all alone.\n\nI'm cooking up some food here for us, but Griselda'll have none of it.\n\nShe's fond of the fish that live off the coast of the Eastwind Shore, to the east. Can't stand them myself, but she's always been a picky eater. Six good-sized fish ought to keep her happy for a while.\n\nNow, run... err... limp along, Joe. Wouldn't want to keep the girl waiting, would ya?",o="给红木商栈的休·格兰斯带去6条北地鲑鱼。",oEN="Bring 6 Northern Salmon to Hugh Glass at the Redwood Trading Post.",p="如果你不快点，就不只她的肚子会咕噜噜的叫了……",pEN="If you don't hurry, it'll be more than just her stomach growling...",c="你！你不是“瘸子”乔伊！",cEN="You! You're not Limpy Joe!"}
Q[12280]={d="明天中午之前要完成二十台伐木机！\n\n这个进度表是谁定的？都没人可以把这些废纸篓组装起来，别说是……\n\n如果我想要达成指标的话，就必须找个帮手。来帮我一下吧，我会和你分享我的酬劳……如何？\n\n我需要齿轮、链条和弹簧. 它们就散落在伐木机周围的地面上。",dEN="Twenty shredders by noon tomorrow!\n\nWho makes these schedules, anyway? No one who ever put one of these garbage cans back together, that's who....\n\nIf I'm going to hit my quota, I'll need a hand. Help me out and I'll share my commission with you - fair enough?\n\nI need cogs, sprockets and springs. They're littered across the ground down by the shredders.",o="蓝天伐木场的鲁尔兹希望你去收集4个凹槽齿轮、3个刻缺链条和2个高压弹簧。",oEN="Lurz at Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to collect 4 Grooved Cogs, 3 Notched Sprockets, and 2 High Tension Springs.",p="你把零件拿来给我了吗？",pEN="Ya fetch those parts for me yet?",c="谢谢你，<name>。这些应该够我用一阵子了——至少能撑到明天……\n\n这是我答应给你的钱。",cEN="Thanks, <name>. That should keep me going - at least until tomorrow....\n\nHere's the cash I promised."}
Q[12281]={d="虽然斯林奇的死令人伤心，但他的牺牲换来了更大的回报。我们应该为此感到欣慰。他的发现和你在矿井中的英勇表现，以及你带回来的矿石样本使我们进一步了解了天灾军团的战争机器。\n\n请把这个包裹交给高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。里面有未知矿石的样本和我的分析报告。",dEN="We must take solace in the fact that Slinkin's death, while tragic, was for the greater good. His discovery coupled with your heroics in the mine and the samples you returned brings us one step closer to understanding the Scourge war machine.\n\nTake this package to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. It holds a sample of the strange ore and my analysis.",o="把夸特弗拉什的包裹交给暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。",oEN="Deliver Quarterflash's Package to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep.",p="我听说了你在矿里的英勇表现，<name>。",pEN="I heard about your bravery in the mine, <name>.",c="<哈尔弗打开包裹，读着分析报告。>\n\n我完全不是什么科学家，<name>，所以你得多包涵我对这些文字粗浅的理解。现在，根据这份分析——假设我至少有一个学童的脑力——我们对天灾战争机器仍然一无所知。我们唯一知道的是，天灾军团用这种污秽的金属来制造攻城器械、护甲和武器。\n\n<哈尔弗长叹一口气。>",cEN="<Halford opens the package and reads the analysis.>\n\nI am by no means a scientist, <name>, so you'll have to forgive my plebian understanding of what has been written. Now, according to this analysis - assuming I have the brain power of at least an adolescent school boy - we still don't know jack squat about the Scourge war machine. The only thing we do know is that the Scourge uses this foul metal to craft its siege engines, armor and weaponry.\n\n<Halford lets loose a long sigh.>"}
Q[12282]={d="往日的记忆一直盘踞在这片土地之上，$n。每晚，我似乎都能听到那些死者的哀号在诺森德回响，好像在召唤着我。\n\n阿尔萨斯在他所碰触过的一切事物上都留下了恐怖的烙印。在这里，只有枯萎与凋零能够留存于世。虽然挖掘那些往日的记忆是件很可怕的事，但这却很重要，因为我们只有深入研究过去发生的事，才能更清楚地了解我们所面对的敌人。现在已经到了让这些隐藏在深处的真相浮出水面、帮助我们取得胜利的时候了！\n\n首先，你必须从镇中的议事大厅里为我取回水晶球，$n。离开这座塔以后，直接向左转，然后沿路走到底，就可以抵达镇广场了。",dEN="The memories of the past haunt this land, <name>. I hear the cries of the fallen echo across Northrend - calling to me.\n\nArthas left a terrible imprint on everything he touched. Only wither and decay remains in his wake. It is important, then, for us to study the past so that we may better know our enemy. Perhaps untold truths shall surface that could help in our campaign.\n\nFirst, you must recover my scrying orb from the town hall, <name>. Exit this tower and turn left down the path to reach the town square.",o="暮冬要塞的幻象师瑟里格要求你帮忙找回他的占卜宝珠。",oEN="Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to recover his Scrying Orb.",p="你找回我的占卜宝珠了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered my scrying orb?",c="干得好，<name>。正如命运所预言，你将是带领我们度过这些艰难时日的人。漫长的旅程现在开始了。",cEN="Well done, <name>. As fate foretold, you will be the one to carry us through these hard times. Now the long journey begins."}
Q[12283]={d="我们需要查明到底这里究竟发生了什么。我需要将军的日记。\n\n我相信你一定能在她的房子楼上的床头柜里找到它。就是教堂旁边那幢房子，穿过马厩和伐木场就到了。\n\n等你拿到了日记以后，把它交给怨毒镇的高级执行官。\n\n你只能以最直接的手段来做这件事，因为镜子的能量快要耗尽，只够供我使用了。\n\n<探员对你微笑着。>",dEN="We have to figure out what's going on here. We need the general's diary!\n\nI'm pretty sure that you'll find it on her nightstand upstairs at her house. It's the one next to church, across from the stables and the lumbermill.\n\nOnce you acquire the diary, take it to the high executor back at Venomspite.\n\nYou'll have to do this the old-fashioned way; the power of the mirror is low and there's only enough left for me.\n\n<The agent smirks.>",o="斯古莉探员要求你去获取阿比迪斯将军的日记，然后将它交给怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯。",oEN="Agent Skully has asked you to acquire The Diary of High General Abbendis and to deliver it to High Executor Wroth at Venomspite.",p="你可算回来了，<name>！是什么耽搁了你？",pEN="It's about time, <name>! What's been keeping you?",c="该死的！为什么就不能带给我一些好消息呢？",cEN="Damn it all! Why couldn't you have come to me with good news?!"}
Q[12284]={d="我们在这里遭受了严重的人员伤亡，$r。\n\n唯一值得庆幸的是，他们的情况和我们差不多。我需要更多的部队，但我们的大部队被困在风险湾，所以我们现在多半只能靠自己了。\n\n不管情况变得多么糟糕，我们必须坚守阵地。这一本地珍贵的资源是部落在诺森德最终获胜的关键。\n\n我们必须在援军到达之前紧跟联盟的步伐。不要待在这里，去给他们点颜色看看。",dEN="We've suffered heavy casualties here, <race>.\n\nThe only good news is that we've given as much as we've taken. I've requested more troops, but the bulk of our forces are bogged down in Venture Bay. It looks like we're on our own for now.\n\nNo matter how bad it gets, we MUST stand our ground! The precious resources of this region are essential to the Horde's long-term success in Northrend.\n\nWe've got to keep the Alliance on their heels until help arrives. Get out there and give 'em something to think about.",o="指挥官巴尔格克希望你在蓝天伐木场消灭15个联盟士兵或者联盟玩家。",oEN="Commander Bargok wants you to kill 15 Alliance units or players in Blue Sky Logging Ground.",p="你武器上的是联盟的血吗，<race>？",pEN="Is that Alliance blood on your weapon, <race>?",c="干掉了十五个，是吗？听到这个消息很好，<class>。\n\n至少你为我们争取了一点时间——按我的估算，至少一天。\n\n这是你的报酬。",cEN="Fifteen down, eh? Good to hear it, <class>.\n\nIf nothing else you've bought us a bit of time - at least a day by my figuring.\n\nHere's your pay."}
Q[12285]={d="他们随时会大举进犯，$c。我命令你杀进去，取下阿比迪斯将军的首级！\n\n这并不是个简单的活儿……阿比迪斯周围肯定有很多卫兵。我推荐你带上几个伙伴一同转至。\n\n把她的徽记给我带回来，我会为了表彰你拯救怨毒镇的功劳，给你最完美的奖励。\n\n如果失败的话，就没必要再回来了！",dEN="Their attack is imminent, <class>. I need you to get in there and sever the head of the Scarlet Onslaught, literally!\n\nIt's not going to be easy... Abbendis is sure to be surrounded by a great many of her men. I suggest that you take at least a couple of friends along.\n\nBring back her head and I'll see to it that you're properly rewarded for saving Venomspite.\n\nFail and don't even bother to return!",o="怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯命令你将阿比迪斯将军的徽记交给他。",oEN="High Executor Wroth at Venomspite has ordered you to return with The Head of the High General.",p="我该告诉我的部队开始转至阿格玛之锤吗？\n\n还是你准备好杀掉大将军了？",pEN="Should I tell my forces to begin making our way toward Agmar's Hammer?\n\nOr did you manage kill the high general?",c="让我们看看他们能不能把她无头复活！<La risa del alto ejecutor atrae varias miradas furtivas>\n\n<高级执行者的大笑引来不少鬼鬼祟祟的侧目>\n\n我有点担心你放跑了那位大上将，但你依然是今天的英雄，<name>！\n\n挑你想要的吧……这是你应得的！",cEN="Let's see them bring her back to life without her head!\n\n<The high executor's laugh draws a number of furtive glances.>\n\nI'm a little concerned that you let this grand admiral get away, but you're still the hero of the day, <name>!\n\nTake your pick... you've earned it!"}
Q[12286]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12287]={d="我一直在凝视着这枚水晶球，$n。我在其中看见了你必须要经历的旅程。\n\n数年前，在龙骨荒野的海岸边发生了一起骇人听闻的暴行。尽管那件事情仍然隐藏在黑暗之中，但我想，你的命运的确就在南边，在遗忘海岸的废墟中。\n\n沿着路一直走过东南方那片支离破碎的广场，到达黎明河滩前不要停下。在那边，你会遇到我的老朋友欧瑞克·图哈特，他正在那里等待着你。",dEN="I have gazed upon the orb and seen the path that you must walk, <name>.\n\nMany years ago an atrocity was committed upon the shores of Dragonblight. The act itself remains shrouded in darkness, but I am certain that your destiny lies south, amidst the ruins of the Forgotten Shore.\n\nTake the road southeast through the ravaged town square. Follow the trail until you arrive at Dawn's Reach. You will meet an old friend of mine there known as Orik Trueheart. He will be expecting you.",o="转至龙骨荒野的黎明河滩，寻求欧瑞克·图哈特的帮助。",oEN="Seek out the assistance of Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight.",c="朋友，瑟里格捎来了消息，我们一直期待你的到来。\n\n我是欧瑞克·图哈特，银色北伐军的圣骑士。站在营火对面的那位牧师是蒂尔达·达拉森。我们在此代表了银色北伐军——被派遣来镇压那些企图从暮冬要塞逃脱的不幸灵魂。",cEN="Zelig sent word, friend. We have been expecting you.\n\nI am Orik Trueheart, paladin of the Argent Crusade. The priestess standing across the campfire from me is Tilda Darathan. We are here on behalf of the Argent Crusade - sent to quell the unfortunate damned souls attempting to escape Wintergarde."}
Q[12288]={d="喂，$c！过来帮帮我！\n\n我们许多英勇的战士正在渐渐死去。如果不能及时让他们得到治疗，我们可能会连灰熊丘陵都一起失去！\n\n拿上这根止血带，在战场上的伤者身上使用它。\n\n赶快，$n！他们快要死了！",dEN="You there, <class>! Help me!\n\nWe're losing valuable lives! There are simply too many wounded for me to tend to alone. If we can't get our soldiers healed we could be run out of Grizzly Hills altogether!\n\nTake this tourniquet and use it on the wounded down on the battlefield.\n\nHurry, <name>! They're dyyying!!",o="蓝天伐木场的奥曼娜希望你在10名受伤的散兵身上使用急救止血带。",oEN="Aumana at Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to use the Renewing Tourniquet on 10 Wounded Skirmishers.",p="你治好我们的伤员了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you healed our wounded yet, <name>?",c="喔！谢谢，谢谢你。\n\n你帮助我们捱过了另一天，也许还有一丝希望。",cEN="Oh, thank you, thank you.\n\nYou've helped us to live another day. Perhaps there's hope yet."}
Q[12289]={d="对于联盟来说，这真是个黑暗的日子。许多优秀的士兵阵亡，还有不少身负重伤的人已经奄奄一息了。我们唯一的安慰就是他们英勇奋战，消灭了大量敌人。\n\n由于大部队都在风险湾作战，我们只能独立迎敌。这一地区的资源对于联盟来说非常重要，它也许会决定我们与部落交战的成败。我们一定不能失败！！\n\n去吧，$n。在他们舔舐伤口的时候狠狠地打击他们。为你倒下的弟兄们报仇，让我们仍然能看到希望！",dEN="It is a dark day for the Alliance. Many good men lay dead or dying here. Our only consolation is that they fought well and brought down many of the enemy with them.\n\nWith the bulk of our forces committed to Venture Bay we stand alone to weather this storm. The resources in this region are vital to the Alliance and may well make the difference in our struggle against the Horde. We must not fail!\n\nGo, <name>. Strike at them while they lick their wounds. Avenge your fallen brothers and keep our hopes alive!",o="哈斯曼中士希望你在蓝天伐木场消灭15个部落成员。",oEN="Sergeant Hartsman wants you to defeat 15 Horde units or players in Blue Sky Logging Grounds.",p="战斗进行得怎么样，<name>？",pEN="How goes the fight, <name>?",c="干得好，<name>。\n\n你为我们争取了一些时间，虽然大概不超过一天。尽管如此，联盟感谢你的努力。",cEN="Well done, <name>.\n\nYou've bought us some time here, though likely no more than a day. Nevertheless, the Alliance is grateful for your efforts."}
Q[12290]={d="这片海滩上游荡着成百上千个被诅咒的鬼魂。在生前，他们都是勇敢而高贵的联盟士兵，可死后，他们却遭受到了某种神秘的诅咒。在这诅咒的作用之下，他们被永久禁锢在这个世界中。或许，直到世界毁灭，他们才能得以解脱。必须要将自由还给他们！为此，我们首先得找到令他们如此痛苦的根源。\n\n你现在立刻转至东南方的埃尔德齐断崖，寻找一种名叫黑暗草的稀有草药。我可以用这种草药调配出一种药剂，它能使你暂时进入那个被遗忘的世界。快去采集吧。",dEN="The spirits of the damned haunt the coast. In life they were brave and noble soldiers of the Alliance, but in death they are cursed - bound to this world until the end of days. We must discover the source of their anguish if we are to free them!\n\nTo the southeast, on the Eldritch Heights, you will find a rare herb known as murkweed. It is murkweed that I will use to concoct an elixir that will allow you temporary entry into the world of the forgotten. Go now and gather the weed.",o="黎明河滩上的欧瑞克·图哈特要求你从埃尔德齐断崖上收集5株黑暗草。",oEN="Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight wants you to recover 5 Murkweed from the Eldritch Heights.",p="找回黑暗草了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the murkweed?",c="<奥瑞克拿起那株浊草，开始调配药剂。>\n\n不会太久了，<name>。",cEN="<Orik takes the murkweed and begins mixing an elixir.>\n\nIt won't be much longer, <name>."}
Q[12291]={d="黑暗草药剂中的毒性会让你的意识变得朦胧，然后逐渐失去意识。这种毒性的强大力量甚至会欺骗你的灵魂，允许你短暂地进入死者的世界。\n\n成为灵魂之后，你必须立刻与遗忘海岸一带的鬼魂交谈，从他们那里问出令他们如此不安与愤怒的原因，然后回来告诉我。\n\n记住，$n，这些鬼魂都曾是联盟的士兵，你必须尊重他们，绝不可玷污他们的荣耀与尊严。\n\n拿着药剂，尽快转至南方的遗忘海岸吧。",dEN="The toxins in the murkweed elixir will render you unconscious. So powerful is the effect of the murkweed that even your spirit will be fooled, allowing you to temporarily enter the world of the dead.\n\nOnce a spirit, you must speak to the ghostly denizens of the Forgotten Shore. Seek out the cause of their anguish and return to me.\n\nRemember, <name>, these spirits were once Alliance soldiers. Treat them with respect, honor and dignity.\n\nNow, with elixir in hand, venture south to the Forgotten Shore.",o="黎明河滩上的欧瑞克·图哈特要求你听取被遗忘的农夫、被遗忘的火枪手、被遗忘的骑士和被遗忘的步兵所讲述的故事。",oEN="Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight wants you to hear the tales of a Forgotten Peasant, Forgotten Rifleman, Forgotten Knight and Forgotten Footman.",p="我有足够的浊草来配制更多药剂，<name>。",pEN="I have enough murkweed to make more elixirs, <name>.",c="<奥瑞克的眼中满是泪水。>\n\n他们不知道。他们谁都不知道！他们以为阿尔萨斯是什么大英雄，而事实上正是阿尔萨斯下令烧毁船只的。正是阿尔萨斯把我们所有人丢在这片冰封荒原上等死！\n\n<奥瑞克哭泣。>\n\n王子的舰队并非所有士兵都死在了那场严寒的冬天。当年我只是个少年，得到了与天灾军团作战的机会……把我们的家园从必然的毁灭中拯救出来。我抓住了那个机会，<name>。",cEN="<Orik's eyes fill with tears.>\n\nThey don't know. None of them know! They think Arthas to be some great hero, when in truth it was Arthas who ordered the ships to be burned. It was Arthas who left us all for dead in this frozen wasteland!\n\n<Orik weeps.>\n\nNot all of the soldiers from the Prince's fleet perished in the freezing winter. I was only a lad when I was given the chance to battle the Scourge... to save our home from certain destruction. I took that chance, <name>."}
Q[12292]={d="我们在灰熊丘陵与部落陷入了僵局。双方兵力几乎相当，到目前为止一切迹象都指向僵持。\n\n直到今天早上。当地的捕猎者请求我们帮忙。看来部落拿走了一件属于他们的东西……某种圣物。\n\n我们帮他们拿回来，他们就会给我们所需的优势。前往征服堡以西的长青商栈，找一只雪松木箱。",dEN="We've reached a deadlock with the Horde in Grizzly Hills. Our forces are just about evenly matched and all signs so far have pointed to a stalemate.\n\nUntil this morning, that is. The local trappers have requested our help. Apparently the Horde took something that belongs to them... a relic of some sort.\n\nWe get this back for them and they'll give us the edge we need. Head to the Evergreen Trading Post, west of Conquest Hold and look for a cedar chest.",o="琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉要你转至常青商栈夺回雪松木箱。",oEN="Lieutenant Dumont at Amberpine Lodge wants you to go to Evergreen Trading Post and obtain the Cedar Chest.",p="你把那只箱子带来了吗，<name>？",pEN="You bring me that box, <name>?",c="锁住了，是吧？这看起来挺普通的。\n\n<杜蒙特中尉摇了摇箱子，发出一阵嘎嘎作响的木头声。>\n\n我猜应该不要紧——如果这里装的是能够帮我们对付部落的刀剑，我甚至不在乎里面装的会不会是瘟疫的解药。",cEN="It's locked, isn't it? It looks pretty ordinary.\n\n<Lieutenant Dumont Shakes the chest, producing a rattling wooden sound.>\n\nNo matter, I suppose. If this gets us the edge we need against the Horde, then I could care less if the cure for the Plague was in there."}
Q[12293]={d="现在我们有了那些猎人想要的东西。是时候把他们全部拉到我们这边了。\n\n带着这只箱子到北边的白杨商栈，找一个名叫伊凡的猎人。\n\n如果一切顺利，那么这群猎人很快就将成为我们最好的斥候，为国王陛下的军队效力。",dEN="We have what the trappers want. Now it's up to us to sign them up with our side.\n\nTake the chest to a trapper named Ivan at the Aspen Grove Post, just north of here.\n\nIf all goes well, we'll have local woodsmen serving as scouts for the king's army in no time.",o="将雪松木箱交给白杨商栈的伊凡。",oEN="Bring the Cedar Chest to Ivan at Aspen Grove Post.",p="你有东西要给我们？",pEN="You've brought something for us?",c="你成功了！你找回了那只箱……你找回了部落从我们这里偷走的那只箱子。我们感谢你，<name>。",cEN="You did it! You recovered the Sc... you recovered the chest that the Horde stole from us. We thank you, <name>."}
Q[12294]={d="很好，$n。你们信守了高贵的和约。\n\n那么，告诉杜蒙特，我们也将信守诺言。",dEN="Very well, <name>. Your people kept their end of the bargain.\n\nTell Dumont that we'll honor the deal.",o="向琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉复命。",oEN="Return to Lieutenant Dumont in Amberpine Lodge.",c="好消息，<name>。有了当地人的帮助，我们就能获得所需的补给支援，在这一地区比部落更灵活地调动。\n\n如果你有兴趣，我还有更多的任务交给你。",cEN="Excellent news, <name>. With the locals' help we'll have the logistical support we need to outmaneuver the Horde in this region.\n\nI have further tasks for you if you're interested."}
Q[12295]={d="我们尝试跟那群猎人交涉已经持续了好几周了，可是在你找到那只该死的箱子之前都没有任何进展可言。\n\n这对我们派去银溪镇的特使来说一定是个好消息。我们一周前派了杜卡尔去那边守护，他在上一封公文里说那边交涉的进展也不是很理想。\n\n到银溪镇去帮助他开展外交工作吧。从这里一路向西北方向前进，穿过几座桥之后，就能找到银溪镇了。",dEN="We'd been trying to negotiate with the trappers for weeks, but we'd gotten nowhere until you found that blasted chest of theirs.\n\nThis should be good news to our envoy in Silverbrook. We sent Ducal there about a week ago and his last letter indicated he'd been making little progress.\n\nGo to Silverbrook and aid him in his diplomatic efforts. Take the roads heading northwest of here and you should find it after crossing a couple of bridges.",o="与银溪镇的杜卡尔特使谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Envoy Ducal in Silverbrook.",c="终于见到你真高兴，<name>！我们这边早就听说过你。欢迎来到银溪镇。\n\n这些捕猎者是群很棒的小伙子和姑娘。他们很坚韧，对这片地形了如指掌。你会发现他们终于站到我们这边是件大好事。",cEN="It's good to finally meet you, <name>! We'd heard about you up here. Welcome to Silverbrook.\n\nThese trappers are a great bunch of lads and lasses. Hardy people, they know the lay of the land really well. You'll find it's a great thing that we finally won them over to our side."}
Q[12296]={d="唉，真是血流成河……\n\n我经历过许多场战斗，$c。而这次战斗比我所见过的都要惨烈得多。我们与部落的战争比以往更加激烈了，在诺森德，我们之间只有你死我活的杀戮。\n\n如果我们要在这里多生存一天的话，就必须尽量治疗我们的伤者。对我来说，要一个人救治这么多人实在是太困难了。\n\n如果你愿意帮助我的话，我已经准备好了特殊的绷带。拿上绷带，去治疗那些尚未彻底倒下的同伴吧。",dEN="Oh, the carnage....\n\nI've been through many battles, <class>, and this one was more brutal than any I've seen. Our fight with the Horde has become more intense than ever. It's them or us here in Northrend - life or death.\n\nIf we are to survive here another day we'll need to mend our wounded. There are too many for me to rescue alone.\n\nI've prepared special bandages that will enable you to assist me. Take one and tend to those who have not yet succumbed to their wounds.",o="蓝天伐木场的蕾安娜要你对10名受伤的月溪旅步兵使用恢复绷带。",oEN="Rheanna at Blue Sky Logging Grounds wants you to use the Renewing Bandage on 10 Wounded Westfall Infantry units.",c="太好了！\n\n因为你的努力，联盟可以再撑过一天。\n\n请接受我的道谢，朋友。",cEN="Wonderful!\n\nThe alliance shall live to see another day, in part due to your diligence.\n\nPlease accept my thanks, friend."}
Q[12297]={d="你必须立即把我手里的这份名单交给高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。他指挥的第七军团就驻扎在龙骨荒野东部的暮冬要塞里。\n\n如果这份名单上的叛徒进入了暮冬要塞……那就太可怕了。\n\n赶快，$n。把这份文件给西部卫戍要塞这里的格雷尔·岩锤看看，向他解释你的任务性质。他会派最快的狮鹫送你转至暮冬要塞！",dEN="The list I hold must be delivered to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. He commands the 7th Legion, stationed at Wintergarde Keep on the eastern borders of the Great Dragonblight.\n\nIf any of the traitors on this list are stationed at Wintergarde... it could be catastrophic.\n\nHurry, <name>. Show the document to Greer Orehammer here at Westguard Keep and explain the nature of your mission. He'll put you on his fastest gryphon to Wintergarde!",o="亚当斯上尉要你向西部卫戍要塞的格雷尔·岩锤出示联盟信函。",oEN="Captain Adams has asked you to show the Alliance Missive to Greer Orehammer at Westguard Keep.",p="你好，<class>。",pEN="Hello, <class>.",c="<格锐尔把眼镜推到头顶然后详读文件，读完之后好奇的看着你。>\n\n我会让你骑我最快的狮鹫过去！这个消息一定要立刻送到高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩手中！",cEN="<Greer lifts his glasses onto the top of his head and reads the note, looking back up at you curiously when he's done.>\n\nYou will have my fastest gryphon! This information must be delivered to High Commander Wyrmbane at once!"}
Q[12298]={d="<格里尔把信交还给你。>\n\n空歌会送你去暮冬要塞，$n。我保证那是你一生中最快的一次飞行。现在就去吧！|n",dEN="<Greer hands the missive back to you.>\n\nSkysong will take you to Wintergarde, <name>. I guarantee you that it will be the fastest flight you've ever taken. Go now!",o="把联盟密信送到龙骨荒野东部暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩手中。|n",oEN="Deliver the Alliance Missive to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in eastern Dragonblight.",p="你手上拿着什么，士兵？",pEN="What have you got there, soldier?",c="<El Alto Comandante lee la misiva y luego la arruga><高级指挥官读完密信，然后把它揉成一团>\n\n你知道这份名单上的人现在在哪里吗？到外面大门口附近看看。就是那些吊在拱门上的。\n\n食尸鬼的诱饵……",cEN="<The High Commander reads the missive and then crumples it up.>\n\nDo you know where the people on this list are now? Take a look outside, near the front gate. They're the ones hanging from the arches.\n\nGhoul bait..."}
Q[12299]={d="很高兴见到你。传统而富有娱乐性的“消灭部落成员”活动让你们和我们达成了许多一致，这真是可喜可贺。\n\n其实这个镇子西边也有许多来自征服堡的劫掠者。不如你冲出去像对付野兽一样把他们清扫一遍？\n\n让我们看看我们的新盟友能做出多少实际行动来支持谈判桌上的努力。",dEN="It's good to meet you. Let us celebrate our pact by partaking in some good old fashioned Horde-killing.\n\nYou'll find marauders from Conquest Hold just outside our town, west of here. Why don't you head out there and hunt them like the filthy animals they are?\n\nLet's see if our new allies can back all their talk with some action.",o="银溪镇的瑟尔基要你杀死8名征服堡劫掠者。",oEN="Sergei at Silverbrook wants you to slay 8 Conquest Hold Marauders.",p="你解决那些部落混蛋了吗？",pEN="You done with those Horde cretins yet?",c="不错，不错。你可能不像其它的家伙一样软弱。",cEN="Not bad, not bad. You might not be as soft as some of the others."}
Q[12300]={d="好吧，$g朋友:朋友;。你帮过我们一两次忙，但那并不是真正考验一个人勇气的方式。\n\n在这地方，你不把猎物的皮穿在身上，就不算真正的猎人。\n\n<谢尔盖拔出剥皮小刀，递给你。>\n\n那些袭击我们镇子的该死兽人的首领叫碎骨。你会在西边更远处的一个营地找到他。\n\n没错。你要去剥了那怪物的皮。",dEN="Alright, friend. You've done us a favor or two, but that's not the true test of a person's courage.\n\nAround these parts, you're not a real hunter unless you wear your prey's skin.\n\n<Sergei unsheathes his skinning knife and hands it to you.>\n\nThe leader of those motherless orcs attacking our town is called Bonesnap; you'll find him at a camp further northwest.\n\nThat's right. You're going to skin the monster.",o="在银溪镇西北边找到博斯纳普中士，以此通过勇气的试炼。",oEN="Find Sergeant Bonesnap northwest of Silverbrook and pass the Test of Mettle.",p="银溪镇的居民……并非你表面看见的那样。",pEN="The people in Silverbrook... they're not what they seem.",c="别这么做，<name>。派你来这里的人……你不该信任他们。",cEN="Don't do it, <name>. The people that sent you here.... you shouldn't trust them."}
Q[12301]={d="这颗水晶球是好几年以前瑟里格送给我的，他还特别嘱咐过它的使用方法。五年以来，每当我因这里所发生的事情而感到愤怒、焦躁或是悲伤时，我就会全神贯注地凝视这颗水晶球，以获得心灵上的平静与安宁。\n\n现在，我终于可以理解瑟里格将它送给我的真意了。\n\n带上水晶球，到遗忘海岸去，在海滩上找到曾经是我们基地的那片废墟，然后将这颗水晶球放在基地的中央。让那些被遗忘的鬼魂们也能通过我的内心与灵魂，重新审视这个世界吧。",dEN="Zelig gave this crystal ball to me years ago with specific instruction on its use. For five years - whenever I would feel anger, anxiety, or sorrow over the events that transpired here - I was to focus my thoughts upon the orb.\n\nI now understand why Zelig gave this crystal to me.\n\nTake my crystalline orb to the Forgotten Shore. Find the ruins of my old base on the upper reaches of the beach and place the orb in the center of town. Let the forgotten see the world through my heart and soul.",o="龙骨荒野黎明河滩的欧瑞克·图哈特要你在遗忘海岸的废墟中使用欧瑞克的水晶球，以拯救那些被遗忘的灵魂。",oEN="Orik Trueheart at Dawn's Reach in Dragonblight wants you to use Orik's Crystalline Orb in the ruins located at the Forgotten Shore to redeem the Forgotten.",c="<奥瑞克朝你露出微笑。>\n\n你今天做了一件好事，<name>。数以百计的迷失灵魂因为你而得到了救赎。",cEN="<Orik beams a smile at you.>\n\nYou did a good thing this day, <name>. Hundreds of lost souls are now redeemed, thanks to you."}
Q[12302]={d="谢谢你帮我，$n。我叫萨莎。听着，我得离开这鬼地方。\n\n派你来这里的人……我的族人……他们变了。他们失去了善良，还想把你变成他们中的一员……\n\n他们让你经历的这场\"考验\"只是个开始。\n\n前往银溪镇的西北端。你会发现一些让你感兴趣的东西。\n\n祝你好运……别相信任何人。",dEN="Thanks for helping me, <name>. My name's Sasha. Listen, I have to get the hell out of here.\n\nThe people that sent you here... my people... they've changed. They're not good people anymore... and they want to turn you into one of... one of them.\n\nThis... 'test' they sent you on is just the beginning.\n\nHead to the northwestern end of Silverbrook. You'll find something of interest to you.\n\nGood luck... and trust no one.",o="转至银溪镇的西北角。",oEN="Go to the northwestern end of Silverbrook.",c="谁在那里？你是来杀我的吗？\n\n拜托！你没有必要这么做！",cEN="Who's there? Are you here to kill me?\n\nPlease! You don't have to do this!"}
Q[12303]={d="<军需官低沉下声音轻声对你说。>\n\n$C，我需要你的帮助。我们的保险箱已经空了，因为天灾之门的库卡隆先锋营地拿走了我们的所有金币，以支持他们在那边进行的战事。\n\n不过，我听到传言说，东南面遗忘海岸一带的失事船只残骸中有着大量的宝藏。\n\n我们得马上行动，否则就没法对付那些血色先锋军了。你要知道，战争可并不便宜！",dEN="<The quartermaster lowers his voice and whispers to you.>\n\n<class>, I need your help; our coffers are empty. The Kor'kron Vanguard at the Wrath Gate has taken all of our coin for the fight there.\n\nBut, I've heard whispers that there's treasure to be had amongst the wrecks on the Forgotten Shore to the southeast.\n\nWe have to do something soon, or we won't be able to continue the fight against the Scarlet Onslaught. War isn't cheap, you know!",o="怨毒镇的军需官巴莱特要求你去取回6份被遗忘的宝藏。",oEN="Quartermaster Bartlett at Venomspite has asked you to recover 6 Forgotten Treasure.",p="你弄到了多少联盟的财宝？",pEN="How much of that Alliance treasure did you manage to get your hands on?",c="<军需官倒抽了一口凉气，随即眯细了眼睛打量你。>\n\n我相信你应该没有私藏任何财宝吧？在怨毒镇存亡危急的时刻你不会这么自私吧？\n\n好了，我会分你一小部分的财宝。虽然不多，但在这种时候我们都得要做出牺牲。",cEN="<The quartermaster gasps, but then his eyes narrow as he studies you for a moment.>\n\nI trust that you didn't stash any of this on the side for yourself? You wouldn't be that selfish when the fate of Venomspite is at stake?\n\nBesides, I'm going to reward you with a percentage of the take. It's not much, but in times like this, we all have to make sacrifices."}
Q[12304]={d="是时候扩张怨毒镇了！\n\n很快，我们就会解决血色先锋军，不过我希望你先去一个被称为遗忘海岸的地方跑一趟。那里有着巨大的发展潜力，而且，你有没有注意到那里的风景？\n\n不幸的是，那里遍地都是人类的幽灵，都是些失事船只的船员，以及没有认识到自己已经死了的家伙。\n\n清理海滩和岸边的水域吧。也许不久以后我们就可以畅想在那里建造一座舒适安逸的坟墓了。",dEN="It's time for Venomspite to expand!\n\nWe'll take care of the Onslaught in due time, but I want you to spearhead our efforts on the Forgotten Shore. The property value has outstanding potential and just look at that view!\n\nUnfortunately, there's an infestation of human ghosts, shipwrecked crews and the like who haven't quite realized that they're dead.\n\nClear the beach and the waters off the shore, and maybe you and I will talk about building a cozy, new mausoleum down there soon.",o="测量员汉森要求你转至南面的遗忘海岸，击杀20个被遗忘的幽灵。",oEN="Surveyor Hansen, just north of the Forgotten Shore, has asked you to slay 20 Forgotten ghosts.",c="你难道还看不出来吗，<class>？这里会成为诺森德的度假胜地！\n\n你觉得\"汉森湾\"这个名字怎么样，或者叫\"<name>湾\"？挺朗朗上口的，你不觉得吗？",cEN="Can't you just see it now, <class>? It'll be the vacation spot of Northrend!\n\nWhat do you think of the name, \"Hansen's Cove\", or maybe \"<name> Bay\"? Kind of catchy, don't you think?"}
Q[12305]={d="你给予了我荣誉，也给予了数百名联盟老兵的记忆以荣誉，$n。泽利格派你来这里是明智的。请你回到他那里，代我向他致谢。他听到遗忘海岸发生的事情会很高兴的。\n\n我没有泽利格那样的预见天赋，但我确信伟大的事在等着你，$g朋友:朋友;。\n\n再见。|n",dEN="You have honored me and honored the memory of hundreds of Alliance veterans, <name>. Zelig was wise in sending you here. Please return to him and give him my thanks. He will be happy to hear of the events that transpired at the Forgotten Shore.\n\nI do not have the gift of foresight like Zelig, but I am certain that great things await you, friend.\n\nFarewell.",o="回到龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向幻象师瑟里格复命。",oEN="Return to Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",c="<瑟里格微笑着。>\n\n我欠你一个人情，英雄。欧瑞克对我来说如兄如父，你改变了他的命运，并将无数的其它人重新点燃了希望。",cEN="<Zelig smiles.>\n\nIt is I who owe you a debt of gratitude, hero. Orik is like a brother to me. You have changed his life and given renewed hope to countless others."}
Q[12306]={d="人多力量大，$n。成为\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部的成员，就意味着你和你的同胞总能弄到最好的酒。\n\n把你的\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给奥格瑞玛的雷玛。",dEN="There is strength in numbers, <name>. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing you and your brethren will always have access to the best brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",o="把\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给奥格瑞玛的雷玛。",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do ya have your membership forms filled out?",c="这么说你要加入我们的行列了，<name>？我们这儿待你不错。加入这个俱乐部，你得到的只会是最好的！\n\n我们会在每个月初给你寄酒。如果你喜欢收到的酒还想要更多，就回到这儿来。我们保证让你拿到更多你喜欢的酒。",cEN="So you be joinin' our ranks, <name>? We treat ya nice here. You only get the best when you part of dis club!\n\nWe be sendin' out brew to you at da start of every month. If you like what you got, and you be wantin' more, head back over here. We make sure you get more of da brew you like."}
Q[12307]={d="你有没有听说过一种名叫破狼草的植物？这种草非常非常可怕……它强大的繁殖与抢夺养分的能力会使我们所有的庄稼都绝收。\n\n我们上星期花了一整周的时间将这种草除光，可它们的根当前仍然还在土壤里，似乎又开始恢复生长了。\n\n虽然不是很急迫的事情，可这样一种顽强的植物生长在田地里实在是……灾难。村子附近到处都是残馀的草根，你是否能帮我们除掉它们呢？",dEN="Have you heard of the wolfsbane plant? It is a horrible weed... it destroys our farmable crops.\n\nWe spent all of last week cutting them down, but the roots are beginning to sprout again.\n\nIt might not seem like an urgent matter, but a resurgence of the plant could be a real... disaster. Do you think you could help us by uprooting them where you find them near the village?",o="银溪镇的卡娅要求你拔出8株破狼草根。",oEN="Katja in Silverbrook wants you to uproot 8 Wolfsbane Roots.",p="怎么了，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="<卡佳紧张地向后退开。>\n\n谢谢你，<name>。你身上没沾上乌头草吧？我有这些……时不时会发作的过敏症。",cEN="<Katja reels away from you nervously.>\n\nThank you, <name>. You didn't get any wolfsbane on you, did you? I've got these... allergies that act up once in a while."}
Q[12308]={d="你……你不是他们中的$g一员:一员;？快！放我出去！\n\n我们必须立刻赶到琥珀松木营地！一旦杜蒙特中尉查明这些人真正的身份，这座镇子就会被夷为平地！",dEN="You... you're not one of them? Quick! Let me out!\n\nWe have to get to Amberpine Lodge immediately! Once Lieutenant Dumont finds out who these people really are, this town will be reduced to rubble!",o="打开木笼，帮助联盟斥候逃出银溪镇。抵达琥珀松木营地后向杜蒙特中尉汇报情况。",oEN="Open the Wooden Cage and help the Freed Alliance Scout escape from Silverbrook. Report to Lieutenant Dumont when you reach Amberpine Lodge.",p="你回来了。我一直在担心你，<name>。",pEN="You made it back. I was a worried about you, <name>.",c="狼人。被诅咒的、见不得光的污秽狼人。\n\n是时候告诉这些当地人，我们文明人是怎么对付他们这种野兽的了。",cEN="Worgen. Blasted, Light-forsaken, filth-ridden worgen.\n\nIt's time we showed the locals what us civilized folk do with beasts like them."}
Q[12309]={d="天灾军团突破南部城墙之后，我就立刻命令骑兵杜尔库去调查市公墓的情况。不久之前，我收到了他的报告。\n\n报告显示，当前这群天灾军团的部队主要有两个来源，首先是暮冬城的废墟，那里已经成为天灾军团的畜牧场了，而另一个来源……竟然是我们自己的公墓！他们居然派遣一名通灵领主趁乱潜入了公墓，并执行了数个邪恶的计划。\n\n在报告中，杜尔库也请求了增援。那么你就将是他的增援，立刻去找到他，帮助他，$n。公墓就在城镇广场的西侧。",dEN="After the Scourge breached the south wall, I ordered Cavalier Durkon to investigate the town crypt. Moments ago I was handed his report.\n\nThe undead that plague us are coming from two sources: the ruins of Wintergarde, now a breeding ground for Scourge, and our very own town crypt! Amidst the chaos and confusion the Scourge managed to get a necrolord inside the crypt.\n\nIn his message, Durkon requested assistance. You will find him and help him, <name>. The crypt is on the western border of the town square.",o="前往龙骨荒野暮冬地穴寻找骑兵杜尔库。|n",oEN="Seek out Cavalier Durkon at the Wintergarde Crypt in Dragonblight.",c="哦，兄弟，那下面简直是一团糟！上次我勉强逃了出来——正因如此我才向高级指挥官提出了请求。\n\n<杜尔库上下打量着你。>\n\n你眼里有那种疯狂的眼神，<race>。幸好，要做我马上要请你做的事，你还真得疯一点。",cEN="Oh brother, it's a mess down there! I barely made it out last time - which is what prompted my request to the High Commander.\n\n<Durkon looks you up and down.>\n\nYou got that crazy look in your eyes, <race>. Thankfully, you're gonna need to be crazy to do what I'm about to ask of you."}
Q[12310]={d="我们必须立刻对此作出反应与决断。我们一定要让那些野蛮人知道，绝对别想与我们为敌。\n\n斥候们已经找到了残馀的银溪镇猎人的位置……不过你要知道，这群家伙也绝对不愿意坐以待毙。他们当前十分高调地封锁了通向东南方的路……看来是想包围我们了。\n\n立刻转至林边哨站，处理掉他们。他们的头目据说是个叫弗拉德克的家伙……马上去搞定他。",dEN="Our response must be immediate. Decisive. We must teach these savages not to cross us.\n\nOur scouts have located what's left of the Silverbrook trappers... you know, the ones you didn't get to douse in flames. Apparently they're blockading the road to the southeast... perhaps they're trying to box us in.\n\nHead to the Forest's Edge post and take care of them. Their leader's reported to be a man named Vladek... make sure he's dealt with.",o="杜蒙特中尉要你转至林边哨站，杀死弗拉德克以及7名银溪镇猎人。",oEN="Lieutenant Dumont wants you to go to Forest's Edge Post and slay Vladek and 7 Silverbrook Hunters.",p="完成了吗，%N？",pEN="Is it done, %N?",c="这些猎人的下场很令人遗憾……折磨至死。我们本来能有更多可供战斗的人手的。\n\n希望这些可怜的混蛋安息。",cEN="It's a shame those trappers turned out to be... afflicted. We sure could've used a few more fighting men.\n\nMay the poor souls rest in peace."}
Q[12311]={d="在这座地穴冰冷的石墙之内，安息着在诺森德逝去的贵族和要人的遗骸。而在它的最深处，如今坐着一个死灵领主，他把尸体唤起，充当天灾军团的仆从。\n\n你必须一路走到暮冬地穴的最底层，杀死死灵领主阿玛里昂。只有这样，来自内部的侵袭才会停止！\n\n还有，$n，留意阿玛里昂所在房间里可能留下的任何情报。|n",dEN="Held within the cold stone walls of this crypt are the remains of the nobles and dignitaries that died in Northrend. At its very core now sits a necrolord who raises the corpses as servants of the Scourge.\n\nYou must make your way to the bottom of the Wintergarde Crypt and kill Necrolord Amarion. Only then will the assault from within cease!\n\nAnd <name>, be on the lookout for any information that might be laying about inside the room where Amarion resides.",o="暮冬要塞的骑兵杜尔库要求你杀死通灵领主阿玛里恩。",oEN="Cavalier Durkon at Wintergarde Keep wants you to slay Necrolord Amarion.",p="艾玛利恩死了吗？",pEN="Is Amarion dead?",c="如果我们能阻挡外面天灾军团的进攻，我们就能将援军送往弗塔根领主所在的天谴之门。",cEN="Now if we could stop the Scourge attacks coming from outside the keep we might be able to send help to Lord Fordragon at the Wrathgate."}
Q[12312]={d="这本长达数百页的魔典的每一页上，都用刀刻着一些奇怪的符号，还辅以数幅诡秘的图形。你完全看不明白这上面刻的是什么，但你的直觉告诉你：这一定是非常重要的情报。\n\n将这本书拿去给暮冬地穴外的骑兵杜尔库看看吧，他或许会对此有所了解。",dEN="Scrawled across the flesh-bound chapters of this tome are strange symbols and shapes that seem to have been scraped into the pages with a blade. You have no idea what is written, but you are certain that whatever it is, it must be important.\n\nDeliver the tome to Cavalier Durkon standing guard topside at Wintergarde Crypt.",o="将血之魔典交给龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的骑兵杜尔库。",oEN="Deliver the Flesh-bound Tome to Cavalier Durkon at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",p="一本天灾军团的书？",pEN="A Scourge tome?",c="不论这本书里藏有什么样的情报都是事关重大！我能够听见你逃跑时墓穴里传来的悲鸣哀嚎声！\n\n我们必须通知高级指挥官！",cEN="Whatever information is held in this book must be of great importance! I could hear the howls and wails echoing through the crypt as you made your escape!\n\nThe High Commander must be notified!"}
Q[12314]={d="部落已经做好了战前准备，如果我们不立即反击，他们就会突破防线，夺得风险湾的控制权。佐娜船长统领着驻扎在港口的部落军队，她的船只就停泊在海湾的另一侧。\n\n只要击败她，削弱部落的防御势力，我们或许就能抓住这个机会占领港口。$n，小心，佐娜是个凶暴好斗的家伙。我估计要好几个人才能制服她，有机会的话你可以利用那台修好的伐木机。",dEN="The Horde's forces are poised to break through our lines and complete their conquest of Venture Bay if we do not act. The Horde's forces in the port are commanded by Captain Zorna, near the ship on the far side of the bay.\n\nIf you can defeat her, the Horde's offensive will falter and we can seize the chance to capture the port. Beware, <name>, for Zorna is a fierce fighter. It may take several people to defeat her, or if you have access to a repaired shredder, you might try using it to your advantage.",o="杀死佐娜船长，然后向风险湾的弗里曼男爵复命。",oEN="Slay Captain Zorna and report to Baron Freeman at Venture Bay.",p="杀死佐娜船长了吗？",pEN="Have you slain Captain Zorna?",c="干得好，<name>！没有了首领，部落就变得虚弱而混乱。我会命令我们的人推进。",cEN="Well done, <name>! Without their leader, the Horde is weak and disorganized. I will order our men forward."}
Q[12315]={d="我们每前进一步，就会遭遇联盟新的增援。好像他们的指挥官能预知我的每一步行动一样！\n\n是时候解决布莱沃特船长了，那家伙在远处港湾中的联盟驱逐舰上指挥着他的部队。\n\n这场战斗并不轻松，$n。带上几个可以信赖的伙伴，或者搞到那些修理过的伐木机的钥匙，用它们去消灭布莱沃特船长！不管你用什么方法，他必须得死！",dEN="With every advance, our men are met by fresh Alliance reinforcements. It's almost as though their commander anticipates my every move!\n\nThe time has come for good Captain Brightwater to meet his end. He commands his troops from aboard an Alliance destroyer at the far end of the bay.\n\nThis will be no easy fight, <name>. Take along a couple of trusted friends, or if you have a key to one of those repaired shredders, use it to disembowel Brightwater! Either way, he must fall!",o="杀死布莱沃特船长，然后向风险湾的卡兹加尔将军复命。",oEN="Slay Captain Brightwater and report to General Khazgar at Venture Bay.",p="你消灭敌人的队长了没？",pEN="Have you eliminated the enemy captain?",c="你是真正的部落士兵，<name>。你的勇气会激励我的人走向胜利！",cEN="You are a true soldier of the Horde, <name>. Your bravery will inspire my men to victory!"}
Q[12316]={d="我们绝不能允许部落占领风险湾，它对我们在灰熊丘陵一带的军事行动起着至关重要的作用。\n\n斯托曼上尉率领月溪旅的其它士兵去东边寻找穿越山岭的道路，我们已经没有援军可用了。\n\n$n，深入敌阵收割征服堡狂战士吧，联盟必须夺得港口的控制权！",dEN="We cannot permit the Horde to control Venture Bay. The port is essential to our operations in Grizzly Hills and beyond.\n\nCaptain Stoutmantle has taken the rest of the Westfall Brigade east in search of a passage through the mountains, so we'll have no reinforcements.\n\nGo into the field, <name>, and kill the Conquest Hold berserkers the Horde has sent against us. Cut them down until none remain standing. The Alliance must have this port!",o="杀死10名部落成员，然后返回风险湾向斯图亚特中尉复命。",oEN="Defeat 10 Horde units or players in Venture Bay and return to Lieutenant Stuart.",p="你有什么事要报告？",pEN="What have you to report?",c="你的勇气激励了月溪旅的士兵。他们现在能够更勇猛的作战。港口很快就会落入我们手中了。",cEN="Your bravery has inspired the men of the Westfall Brigade. Even now they fight with greater ferocity. The port will soon be ours."}
Q[12317]={d="这个混账月溪旅是一个比我们想象中更强硬的对手。尽管人数不多，但他们战斗起来非常英勇和凶猛，但是我们不能就这么和他们耗着。\n\n征服者克雷娜命令我们要尽快占领港口。你必须打破现在的僵持局面，$n。找到敌人的陆战队员，消灭他们，直到他们停止抵抗。只有这样，我们才能夺取港口的所有权。\n\n快去，我们可不想让克雷娜等太久。",dEN="This wretched Westfall Brigade is proving a tougher opponent than we'd thought. Though few in number, they fight well and bravely, but we cannot afford to wait them out.\n\nConqueror Krenna's orders were to capture the port quickly. You must break the stalemate, <name>. Find the enemy's marines and slaughter them until the resistance ceases. Only then will we be able to claim ownership of the port.\n\nGo quickly. We don't want to keep Conqueror Krenna waiting.",o="杀死10名联盟成员，然后返回风险湾向百夫长卡格鲁姆复命。",oEN="Defeat 10 Alliance units or players in Venture Bay and return to Centurion Kaggrum.",p="你执行命令了吗？",pEN="Have you done as ordered?",c="港口很快就会落入我们手中。你今天干得很好，<name>。",cEN="The port will soon fall to us. You have done well this day, <name>."}
Q[12319]={d="这究竟是什么，$n？那个秽恶的巫妖在你身上降下的诅咒看来绝不一般！\n\n<杜尔库飞速地翻阅这本恐怖的书籍，希望能查出什么内容。>\n\n啊，不行，这书完全我不能理解，我甚至根本不知道该往哪里看。我们必须另想办法查出这本书中的有用信息！\n\n<杜尔库把书交还给你。>\n\n高级指挥官应该知道要怎么做。带上这本血之魔典去找他，记得先详细描述一下这里所发生的一切。",dEN="What can it be, <name>? That was certainly no ordinary curse that the blasted lich put on you!\n\n<Durkon flips through the grisly pages of the tome.>\n\nI don't even know if I'm looking at it the right way. We must find out what information is held within this tome!\n\n<Durkon hands the book back to you.>\n\nThe High Commander will know what to do. Take the flesh-bound tome to him and tell him exactly what happened here.",o="将血之魔典交给龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。",oEN="Take the Flesh-bound Tome to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",p="通灵领主死了吗？",pEN="The necrolord is no more?",c="<哈尔弗的眼睛睁大了。>\n\n命运今天向我们微笑，<name>。我恰好知道谁能处理这本魔典。",cEN="<Halford's eyes widen.>\n\nThe fates smile down upon us on this day, <name>. I know just the person to see about this tome."}
Q[12320]={d="拿上书，沿门口的路一直走到兵营。进入兵营以后直接从楼梯下楼，到兵营内的监狱去。你可以在那边找到审讯员哈尔拉德，还有我们以前的市长高弗雷，我想高弗雷或许就是我们面前这张谜图中没有拼上的那一块，而哈尔拉德就是能把这块拼图拼上去的人。\n\n快去吧！",dEN="Take the book and follow the path leading up to the barracks. Once inside the barracks take the staircase down to the prison. At the prison you will find Inquisitor Hallard and our mayor, Godfrey. I believe Godfrey might be the missing piece of this puzzle and Hallard the man to put it all together.\n\nGo now!",o="将血之魔典交给龙骨荒野暮冬要塞监狱内的审讯员哈尔拉德。",oEN="Take the Flesh-bound Tome to Inquisitor Hallard at the Wintergarde Keep prison.",p="你是从高级指挥部来的吗，我的<儿子/女儿>？",pEN="You come from high command, my <son/girl>?",c="也许靠着一点适当的鼓励，高弗雷就会告诉我们关于这本书的事情。\n\n<哈尔拉德转向高弗雷市长。>\n\n不是吗，市长？",cEN="Perhaps, with proper motivation, Godfrey will tell us what he knows about the tome.\n\n<Hallard turns to Mayor Godfrey.>\n\nIsn't that right, mayor?"}
Q[12321]={d="高弗雷·古塔德，他曾是暮冬城的市长，一位正义之士，但是现在却沦为了天灾军团的仆从。他从人类向亡灵食尸鬼转化的过程异常缓慢，用了很长的时间。现在，他听从了巫妖王的召唤，只为侍奉他的新主人而活下去。\n\n但是和其它天灾军团的爪牙一样，他通晓亡者的语言，只要给予适当的“刺激”，他就会把他对那本书的全部理解都告诉我们。\n\n那么，你听到想要知道的消息以后，就立刻回到前线那边去向高级指挥官复命。我会负责这里的善后工作。",dEN="Godfrey Goodard, once a righteous man and mayor of Wintergarde, is now an agent of the Scourge. His transformation from man to undying ghoul has taken place slowly, over time. He hears the call of the Lich King now and lives only to serve his master.\n\nBut as with all Scourge, Godfrey knows the language of death and with proper motivation, will tell us what we need to know about the tome.\n\nOnce you hear what you need to hear, return to the High Commander at the front lines. I'll clean up here as needed.",o="等待审讯员哈尔拉德完成他的正义审讯，然后带着你获得的情报回到暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩那里复命。",oEN="Wait for Inquisitor Hallard to finish his Righteous Sermon and return to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight with the information you uncover.",c="我们早该知道问题是那个该死的陵园了。可笑至极！奥古斯特公爵和阿姆博·卡什将会被派遣至前线，对我们下一次的进攻做准备。\n\n既然你已清空了矿洞，我会派遣你至索尔森岗哨处，接着我们便能开始对纳克萨玛斯的天灾军团进行攻击！\n\n你获得的信息将会由我军最健壮的狮鹫的双翼，送抵天谴之门的弗塔根领主之处。",cEN="We should have known about the damned mausoleum. This is preposterous! Duke August Foehammer and Ambo Cash will be dispatched to the front lines in preparation for our next assault.\n\nOnce you have cleared the mines I will send you to Foehammer so that we may begin our attack against the Scourge of Naxxramas!\n\nThe information you have garnered thus far will be sent to Lord Fordragon at the Wrathgate upon the wings of our most able gryphon!"}
Q[12323]={d="风险投资公司的那些胆小鬼还有几拨人藏在风险湾中心的一些建筑里。我需要把所有能抽调的人都派出去对抗部落，但我们也不能让那些风险投资公司的掉队者搭窝在那几栋楼里。\n\n也许我们可以\"说服\"他们回自己的船上去。拿上这枚烟雾弹，用它把那些掉队者从工棚、锯木场或马厩里的藏身处熏出来。不过别靠太近，它们很可能会咬人。",dEN="There are still pockets of cowardly Venture Company men holed up in some of the buildings at the center of Venture Bay. I need every man I can spare out there fighting against the Horde, but we can't allow those Venture Company stragglers to camp out in those buildings, either.\n\nMaybe we can \"convince\" them to make for their ship. Take this smoke bomb and use it to smoke out the stragglers from their places in the bunkhouse, sawmill, or stables. Don't get too close, though; they probably bite.",o="利用烟雾炸弹迫使20名风险投资公司游荡者逃出他们的藏身之地，然后向杜内恩中士复命。",oEN="Use the Smoke Bomb to drive 20 Venture Company Stragglers from their buildings and then report to Sergeant Downey.",p="你把风险投资公司的人都逼走了没？",pEN="Have you smoked out the last of the Venture Company guys yet?",c="做得好，士兵！现在其它人就可以把精力集中在部落身上了。",cEN="Well done, soldier! Now the rest of the men can focus their efforts on the Horde."}
Q[12324]={d="这个港口不仅到处都是哭哭啼啼的联盟懦夫，更糟的是，还有一些风险投资公司的雇员躲在几栋建筑里。他们不值得花时间去杀，我也抽不出战士来对付他们。\n\n也许我们可以\"说服\"他们回自己的船上去。拿上这枚烟雾弹，用它把那些掉队者从工棚、锯木场或马厩里的藏身处熏出来。不过别靠太近，天知道他们身上带着什么病。",dEN="Not only is this port infested with sniveling Alliance cowards, but to make matters worse, there are still Venture Company employees holed up in some of the buildings. They're not worth the time it takes to kill and I can't spare the warriors anyway.\n\nMaybe we can \"convince\" them to make for their ship. Take this smoke bomb and use it to smoke out the stragglers from their places in the bunkhouse, sawmill, or stables. Don't get too close, though; there's no telling what diseases they're carrying.",o="利用烟雾炸弹迫使20名风险投资公司游荡者逃出他们的藏身之地，然后向石头守卫诺卡·怒火图腾复命。",oEN="Use the Smoke Bomb to drive 20 Venture Company Stragglers from their buildings and then report to Stone Guard Ragetotem.",p="你把风险投资公司的害虫们都熏走了吗？",pEN="Have you smoked out the last of the Venture Company vermin yet?",c="将军会很高兴听到你解决了风险投资公司的问题的。现在，我们可以专心在击退联盟上了。",cEN="The general will be pleased that you've dealt with the Venture Company problem. Now, the men can focus on beating back the Alliance."}
Q[12325]={d="你为推进我们对抗天灾军团的事业做了很多，$n。事实上，所有与你接触过的人士气都在高涨！这就是你对暮冬要塞军民的影响力，$g盟友:盟友;。\n\n正因为有你，我们现在已经准备好发起攻势！你要向奥古斯特·马丁尼米格斯公爵报到，他就在腐尸平原对面、此地以东的索尔森营地。狮鹫站的狮鹫管理员乌瑞克已经准备好了一只特殊的狮鹫，把你送到敌人后方。去吧！",dEN="You have done much to advance our efforts against the Scourge, <name>. In fact, the morale of all those who have come into contact with you soars! Such is your influence over the soldiers and citizenry of Wintergarde, ally.\n\nAnd because of you we are now prepared to go on the offensive! You are to report to Duke August Foehammer, across the Carrion Fields at Thorson's Post, east of here. Gryphon Commander Urik at the gryphon station has prepared a special gryphon to drop you behind enemy lines. Go now!",o="与狮鹫管理员乌瑞克交谈，预约前往索尔森营地的行程。抵达龙骨荒野的索尔森营地后，向奥古斯特·马丁尼米格斯公爵报到。|n",oEN="Speak with Gryphon Commander Urik to secure a ride to Thorson's Post. Report to Duke August Foehammer when you arrive at Thorson's Post in Dragonblight.",c="啊，尊贵的英雄来了。欢迎来到核心地带，<name>。让我给你介绍一下最新情况！\n\n塞尔赞最强大的部队已经打进了暮冬陵墓。他们在深处搜寻尸体和灵魂，好把它们派去攻打暮冬要塞，同时纳克萨玛斯倾泻下可怕的天灾瘟疫机器，想把我们困住！\n\n我们必须立刻出击，并指望弗塔根大王能在愤怒之门再坚守一会儿。",cEN="Ah, the distinguished hero arrives. Welcome to ground zero, <name>. Allow me to bring you up to speed!\n\nThel'zan's most powerful forces have made their way into the Wintergarde Mausoleum. They plumb its depths in search of corpses and souls to send against Wintergarde while Naxxramas rains down terrible Scourge plague machines, set to hold us at bay!\n\nWe must strike now and hope that Lord Fordragon is able to hold out at the Wrathgate for just a little longer."}
Q[12326]={d="本次行动的核心内容是搜索与消灭。你将驾驶一辆坦克直接进入腐臭平原，摧毁一切天灾军团的天灾战车。此外，跟随你进入敌占区的还有三名隶属于第七军团的士兵，若想任务成功，你必须保证他们的存活！\n\n执行任务时，你只需要将坦克开近敌人的天灾战车，派出车上的工兵，掩护他们完成爆破作业，然后转至下一辆天灾战车旁即可。消灭战场上的全部天灾战车以后，你要直接将坦克开往要塞废墟前的陵园，将车组成员送到那里去。之后，进入陵园，与阿姆博·卡什会面。",dEN="This is a seek and destroy mission. You'll be driving a tank into the Carrion Fields to dismantle Scourge plague wagons. With the tank comes a crew of three 7th Legion soldiers. All must survive if this mission is to succeed!\n\nYou'll need to get in close to a plague wagon to unleash your engineer. Let them do their deed and move on to the next one. When the field is clear of plague wagons, head to the mausoleum in front of the ruined keep and drop off the rest of your crew. Meet with Ambo Cash inside.",o="使用联盟蒸汽坦克摧毁6台天灾战车，并将第七军团精英送入暮冬陵园。成功之后与暮冬陵园里的阿姆博·卡什谈一谈。",oEN="Use an Alliance Steam Tank to destroy 6 Plague Wagons and deliver the 7th Legion Elites to Wintergarde Mausoleum. Speak with Ambo Cash inside the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight should you succeed.",p="我叫卡什。阿姆博·卡什。很荣幸认识你。",pEN="Name's Cash. Ambo Cash. And the pleasure is all yours.",c="我为什么没穿裤子并不重要。这样说吧，我中了几发天灾军团的炮弹碎片，这样行吧？\n\n所以你说你把外头的天灾战车都清光了，还安全地把我的士兵送来这里。很好。你是第一个做得这么好的，朋友。很遗憾你必须立刻回到腐臭平原上。没错，我们遭遇了一点挫折。",cEN="Why I'm not wearing any pants isn't important. Let's just say I took some Scourge shrapnel in the wrong place and leave it at that, ok?\n\nSo you wiped out those plague wagons up in the fields and got my soldiers here in one piece. Impressive. You're one of the first to make it this far, friend. Too bad you gotta go right back out into the Carrion Fields. Yep, we've had a bit of a setback."}
Q[12327]={d="啊，你寻求过去的景象。你是个明智的$r。\n\n每次有人来这里求问，似乎总是问未来。等你到了我这个年纪就会明白，窥视过去往往更有用。\n\n喝下这瓶药水，仔细凝视我的水晶球内部。看看我们能获得什么信息。 $g:;",dEN="Ah, you seek a vision of the past. You're a wise <race>.\n\nEvery time someone drops by for a reading, they seem to always ask about the future. When you get to be my age, you learn that scrying the past, more often than not, is more useful.\n\nDrink this potion and peer into my crystal ball. Let us see what knowledge we can obtain.",o="在卢娜的水晶球旁饮下幻境药水，见证过去的景象。",oEN="Drink the Gossamer Potion near Ruuna's Crystal Ball and witness the Vision from the Past.",p="怎么了，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你从你要的幻象中得知了什么？你在出神状态下提到了冬至村——这是今天第二次有人提到这个地名了。",cEN="Did you learn anything from your vision? You mentioned Solstice Village during your trance -- which marks the second time someone has spoken the place's name today."}
Q[12328]={d="我不会向你收取任何费用，因为我清晰地感觉到，你的一举一动对所有人的命运都非常重要，而今天的预言则将大大推动你的进展。\n\n不过，你得帮我带回一种占卜所必需的材料。到东北边那些食蕨蛾身上收集一些幻境粉尘，我可以用它们调制出一种药水，喝下它之后，你就将在梦境中转至正确的时间与地点去见证你需要见证的一切。",dEN="I will not charge you gold for my services, for I can foresee that your actions are necessary and much hinges on what you learn today.\n\nI will, however, ask you to collect a reagent for me. Obtain gossamer dust from the fern feeder moths northeast of here. Do this and I will prepare a potion that will take you to the time and place where the events took place that you need to witness.",o="盲眼卢娜要你收集4堆幻境粉尘。",oEN="Ruuna the Blind wants you to obtain 4 handfuls of Gossamer Dust.",p="你拿到粉尘了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you obtain the dust, <name>?",c="很好。这些刚好够用。\n\n我会立刻准备好给你的药剂。",cEN="Good. These will do just fine.\n\nI will have the potion ready for you in no time at all."}
Q[12329]={d="这个世界上的人分成两类，$n，相信巧合的，与不相信的。\n\n在我失去了双眼的那一天，上天赐予了我另一件礼物，这件礼物让我重新能看到一些东西，过去与未来的东西。我想，你应该可以猜到我属于哪类人了。\n\n不久之前，一个名叫萨莎的年轻女孩看到了与你一样的的东西，或许你愿意和她谈谈。\n\n她就在东边的白松商栈，通向冬至村的路旁。",dEN="There are two types of people in this world, <name>. Those who believe in coincidence and those who don't.\n\nOn the day I lost my eyesight I was given the gift of clairvoyance. I suppose you can guess what sort of person I am.\n\nEarlier today, a young woman named Sasha was granted the same vision you were. You will want to talk to her.\n\nYou'll find her directly east of here at the White Pine Trading Post, on the way to Solstice Village.",o="与白松商栈的萨莎谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Sasha at the White Pine Trading Post.",c="我正在想你什么时候才会来。能帮我一个忙吗？",cEN="I was wondering when you'd turn up. Think you can give me a hand here?"}
Q[12330]={d="我的妹妹应该被困在这个村子里，但囚禁她的那个混蛋不愿意跟我谈判。\n\n他似乎完全不关心自己的幸福。不过我有个计划。早在拜狼教到来之前，我就认识了阿纳托雷的妻子塔特亚娜，她是个驯马师。\n\n拿上这根麻醉飞镖，她看到就知道是我派你去的，我想请她来好好谈一谈，看她能不能帮忙说服阿纳托雷。\n\n只要我们一救出我的妹妹，我一定会帮你找出这一切的幕后黑手。",dEN="My sister is here somewhere, and I can't seem to get this monster to talk.\n\nHe doesn't seem to care about his own well-being, but I've an idea. I knew Anatoly's wife, Tatjana, from before the wolfcult arrived -- she was a horse-handler.\n\nTake this tranquillizer dart. Bring her back alive, we're going to need her if we're to have any leverage with Anatoly.\n\nI will help you find the person behind all this once we save my sister.",o="白松商栈的萨莎要你进入冬至村，对塔特亚娜使用麻醉飞镖。然后将塔特亚娜带回白松商栈。",oEN="Sasha at the White Pine Trading Post wants you to take the Tranquilizer Dart and use it on Tatjana in Solstice Village. Bring Tatjana back to the White Pine Trading Post.",p="庆幸你毫发无伤。",pEN="I'm glad to see you in one piece.",c="千……千钧一发。\n\n我们必需马上救出安娅！",cEN="That... that was close.\n\nWe need to save Anya. Now!"}
