Q[12372]={d="蓝龙军团受到碧蓝巨龙圣地中流动的过剩法力的鼓舞，居然胆敢来攻击龙眠神殿！\n\n请你骑上龙眠神殿防御者加入战斗，消灭蓝龙和他们的幼龙。你还要攻击碧蓝巨龙圣地喷发出来的魔网能量，使它变得不稳定。\n\n龙眠神殿防御者就在东面和西面的平台上。与其中一头防御者交谈，他就会载你一起战斗。\n\n如果没有你的帮助，$n，我们一定会输掉这场战争。",dEN="Emboldened by the overabundance of magic now flowing through the Azure Dragonshrine, the blue dragonflight has dared to attack Wyrmrest Temple itself!\n\nI ask that you ride one of our defenders into battle to slay their dragons and drakes, and to attack the eruption of ley line energies at the dragonshrine itself in order to destabilize it.\n\nOutside on the east and west terraces are wyrmrest defenders. Speak with one to ride it into battle.\n\nWithout your help, <name>, we will surely lose.",o="龙眠神殿的阿弗拉沙斯塔兹要你骑着龙眠神殿防御者加入战斗，杀死3条碧蓝巨龙和5条碧蓝幼龙，并破坏碧蓝巨龙圣地。",oEN="Afrasastrasz at Wyrmrest Temple has asked you to slay 3 Azure Dragons, slay 5 Azure Drakes, and to destabilize the Azure Dragonshrine while riding a Wyrmrest Defender into battle.",p="战况如何？我们阻止他们的进攻了吗？",pEN="How fares the fight? Are we pushing them back?",c="不可思议！请容我这么说，你们这种年幼的种族十分可靠，这也同时再再令我感到惊喜。\n\n我们欠你很多很多，明日还能借用你的力量吗？",cEN="Incredible! Let me just say that I continue to be amazed by what you younger races seem capable of.\n\nWe are indebted to you. Will you come back and help us again tomorrow?"}
