Q[12411]={d="求求你了，$n。我知道你在寻找阿鲁高的踪迹。我以我父亲的名义发誓，一定会帮助你杀掉他。\n\n但……但我必须先求求你，安娅是无辜的，我们不能把她留在这群野兽身旁。\n\n请你先帮我救出妹妹，之后我一定会全力帮助你对付阿鲁高的。\n\n我知道阿纳托雷所说的那个洞穴在哪里，我们从山的另一侧爬上去就能找到。快走吧，我妹妹现在很危险。",dEN="Please, <name>. I know it is Arugal you're after. I swear on my father's memory I will help you take him down.\n\nBut I must beg you... Anya is completely innocent, we cannot leave her with these savages.\n\nHelp me rescue my sister and you'll have me at your side when you face Arugal.\n\nI know the den Anatoly spoke of. We'll find it on the other side of this hill. Let's go, my sister's in danger.",o="在冬至村附近的暗嚎兽穴中寻找安娅。",oEN="Look for Anya in the Duskhowl Den near Solstice Village.",c="我再也不敢来这里了，这些狼人好坏喔。",cEN="I don't want to be here anymore. The worgen-men are mean."}
Q[12412]={d="如果只能向你脑袋里灌输一件事的话，那么我一定会说：必须把联盟从灰熊丘陵彻底赶出去。\n\n这里太重要了，无数的木材，矿石，还有战略缓冲地，这个地方简直是寸土寸金。\n\n当前我们的行动还算成功……但是现在发生了一件事，可能会让胜利的天平略微倒向敌人那边。\n\n遥远的东边有一处林边哨站，那里的猎户竟然想加入联盟。击败他们，不要给他们提供任何威胁到我们的机会。",dEN="If there is one thing I can get through your head, let it be this: the Alliance will be crushed in the Grizzly Hills.\n\nThere is far too much lumber, ore, game and strategic territory for us to give up on any single battlefront here.\n\nSo far we've been successful... but there's something that could tip the scales in our enemy's favor.\n\nFar to the east of here, at the Forest Edge's Post, local trappers seek to join the Alliance. Slaughter them before they have the chance to do so.",o="征服堡的征服者克雷娜要你转至林边哨站，击败8名银溪镇猎人及他们的领袖弗拉德克。",oEN="Conqueror Krenna in Conquest Hold wants you to slay 8 Silverbrook Hunters and their leader, Vladek, at the Forest's Edge Post.",p="任务完成了吗？如果没有的话，那你还待在这儿干嘛？",pEN="Did you complete your task? If not, what are you doing here?",c="你活着回来了。\n\n狼人又做了什么蠢事？",cEN="You're back. And you're alive.\n\nNow what's this nonsense about worgen?"}
Q[12413]={d="几个小时以前，那群猎户还只不过是一群整天威胁说要加入联盟那边的乡巴佬而已。\n\n可现在，他们变成了某种……某种神秘的东西。我不喜欢神秘主义，不喜欢装神弄鬼。我要你转至灰熊丘陵北部的银溪镇，他们就聚集在镇子外面的丘陵上，帮助我的人把他们都清除掉。",dEN="A few hours ago, the trappers were nothing but peasants threatening to add their number to the Alliance's.\n\nNow they've become something else... an uncertainty. I do not like uncertainties. Go to the hills outside their main town in northern Grizzly Hills, Silverbrook, and help my men crush them.",o="征服堡的征服者克雷娜要你转至银溪丘陵，杀死8名银溪镇防御者。",oEN="Conqueror Krenna at Conquest Hold wants you to slay 8 Silverbrook Defenders in the Silverbrook Hills.",p="你的任务完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you completed your task yet, <name>?",c="不错，<name>。你可能比我最初以为的稍微有用一点。",cEN="Not bad, <name>. You might be slightly more useful than I initially thought."}
Q[12414]={d="斯托曼上尉一直不让我们这些骑……骑兵……好吧……养马的去参加风险湾一带的战斗。\n\n无所事事的我们只好把营地扎到了这处好地方，你看，周围漫山遍野都是高地野马在跑来跑去，从巨石丘陵到东北边，全都是！队长要我负责抓几只野马来补充坐骑。\n\n你愿意帮个忙吗？你看，绳子和棍子都有了，营地周围的土里还长满了野生胡萝卜。你只要拔上几根胡萝卜然后把它用绳子捆在棍子上，一路把野马引回到这里来，就搞定啦，轻松愉快！",dEN="Cap'n Stoutmantle left most of our calvary... cavlary... uh, horsemen at the fight for Venture Bay.\n\nWe chose a good place to put the camp 'cause there are tons of highland mustangs running around near here and in the Boulder Hills to the northeast. The Cap'n put me in charge of capturing some of 'em.\n\nWill you help? I've got a stick and some string, and there are loads of wild carrots growing near the camp. Pick the carrots and use them with the stick to lure in the mustang, then ride it back here.",o="驱赶5匹高地野马回到月溪旅营地的侍从皮尔斯那里。",oEN="Ride 5 Highland Mustangs back to Squire Percy at the Westfall Brigade Encampment.",p="你把我们要的野马抓起来了没？",pEN="Did you get all the mustangs we'll need?",c="哇呜！真是好马！我想上尉知道我们的成果一定会很开心的。",cEN="Wow! These sure are good horses! I think the Cap'n will be real pleased with our work."}
Q[12415]={d="联盟的\"西fall旅\"驻扎在很远的北方，靠近索尔莫丹。他们愚蠢地分散兵力来争夺我们对风险湾的控制，结果失去了骑兵。\n\n现在他们正试图捕捉和驯服在西部荒野旅营地与乱石丘一带游荡的野生高地野马。我们必须在他们补足损失的战马之前阻止他们。拿着这个，扔到马匹附近把它们赶走。",dEN="The Alliance's 'Westfall Brigade' is camped far to the north, near Thor Modan. They have foolishly divided their forces to contest our control of Venture Bay, and they have been left without cavalry.\n\nThey're now trying to capture and tame the wild highland mustangs that roam the area around the Westfall Brigade Encampment and Boulder Hills. We must stop them before they're able to replace their lost mounts. Take this and throw it near the horses to drive them away.",o="惊吓15匹高地野马，然后向欧尼瓦营地的索鲁克·雷怒复命。",oEN="Scare 15 Highland Mustangs and return to Soulok Stormfury at Camp Oneqwah.",c="<索洛克赞许地点了点头。>\n\n干得好，<name>。我们绝不能让联盟获得任何优势。",cEN="<Soulok nods in approval.>\n\nWell done, <name>. We must not let the Alliance gain any kind of advantage."}
Q[12416]={d="天灾军团已经占领了圣殿。圣殿的守护者达莉亚·抚阳不知所踪。那些曾在保卫圣殿时倒下的红龙，如今以扭曲的骷髅余烬龙形态向我们袭来。情况十分危急，$r。\n\n伊斯坎达尔上尉率领一队你的同族，阻止天灾军团从圣殿涌出。\n\n去支援他……但请务必待在他的人马后面。天灾军团源源不绝，我可不想让你死在某条伤痕累累的峡谷里。",dEN="The Scourge have overrun the shrine. The shrine's keeper, Dahlia Suntouch, is nowhere to be found. The red wyrms that fell in the shrine's defense now beset us in the form of twisted skeletal emberwyrms. The situation is dire, <race>.\n\nCaptain Iskandar leads a group of your kind in stemming the flow of the Scourge out of the shrine.\n\nGo to his aid... but please stay behind his men. The flow of Scourge is endless and I don't want to lose you in one of those scarred canyons.",o="协助伊斯坎达尔上尉守住峡谷，参与杀死 12 名寒冷食尸鬼侵袭者、8 名寒冷恶鬼侵袭者和 1 名寒冷憎恶侵袭者。\n\n完成这项任务后回到瑟里斯特拉兹那里。",oEN="Aid Captain Iskandar in holding the canyons by participating in the death of 12 Frigid Ghoul Attackers, 8 Frigid Geist Attackers, and 1 Frigid Abomination Attacker.\n\nReturn to Ceristrasz once you have finished this task.",p="很高兴你还在我们身边，<race>。",pEN="I'm glad you're still with us, <race>.",c="这个任务令人作呕，但我为你的付出表示感激。\n\n天灾军团不能向龙眠神殿推进任何一步，否则我们一定会失守的。",cEN="It is a disgusting task, but I thank you dearly for doing it.\n\nThe Scourge cannot be permitted to push any further towards Wyrmrest or we are sure to lose it."}
Q[12417]={d="还有件事要交给你办。我有很多兄弟都在激烈的空战中阵亡了。如果我们不赶快行动的话，他们就会加入灰烬之龙的队伍。\n\n请你从南面或北面的小路进入圣地……那里的天灾军团应该比较少。\n\n在圣地里寻找从树上掉下来的红玉橡果，然后把它们种在我死去的同胞们的尸体旁。这样他们就能获得新生……这是红龙氏族的高贵宿命。",dEN="I have another task that needs attention. I have brothers who are falling in the battle overhead and if we do not act quickly, they will only bolster the emberwyrm ranks.\n\nGet into the shrine through one of the other passes to the south or north... the Scourge presence should be lighter there.\n\nSearch the shrine for ruby acorns that have fallen from the tree and plant them near the bodies of my fallen brood. Through this, they can give new life... a proud fate for any of my kind.",o="从南面或北面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地并寻找红玉橡果。对死去的红龙使用红玉橡果，让他们的尸体回归大地。完成任务后向塞雷斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through one of the northern or southern passes and search for Ruby Acorns. Use the Ruby Acorns on the fallen red dragons to return their bodies to the earth. Return to Ceristrasz once the task is complete.",p="我都已经开始担心龙殿里的天灾军团夺走了你。你还活着真好。",pEN="I started to worry that the Scourge in the shrine had claimed you. It is good that you yet live.",c="在大地之中，我的兄弟们可以再赐予生命。你把它们从比死亡更糟的命运中救了出来。\n\n你的语言里没有一个词能表达这对我的族群意味着什么。谢谢你，<race>。",cEN="In the earth, my brothers can grant life anew. You have saved them from a fate far worse than death.\n\nI don't know a word in your tongue that could express how much this means to my kind. Thank you, <race>."}
Q[12418]={d="我还有最后一个任务要给你，$r……一个足以扭转战局的任务。\n\n请你回到圣地，去杀死那些指挥战斗的通灵师。只要他们死了，我们就能击退天灾的军队，并慢慢夺回圣地。\n\n我还要你去找到圣地下面的堕落之源并摧毁它。\n\n我知道我要你做的事情太多了，但如果你能做到的话，我们就可以赢得这场战斗。",dEN="I have one final task for you, <race>... one that should turn the tide of this fight.\n\nReturn to the shrine and kill the necromancers that are fueling this onslaught. With them dead, we should be able to beat these forces back and eventually retake the shrine.\n\nI also need you to find the source of the corruption under the shrine and put an end to it.\n\nI know I have asked a lot of you, but if you do this for me, we will win this battle.",o="从南面或北面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地，杀死6个冰冷通灵师并摧毁圣地下面的堕落之源。完成任务后向塞雷斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through one of the northern or southern passes, then kill 6 Frigid Necromancers and eliminate the source of the corruption under the shrine. Return to Ceristrasz once the task is complete.",p="你回来了！你完成了我要求的事情吗？",pEN="You've returned! Have you don as I've asked of you?",c="达莉亚……他们把她转化了？\n\n达莉亚对我们忠诚了非常久……如果连她这样虔诚的存在都能被腐化，那对其余的年轻种族可不是好兆头。谢谢你解救了她。我希望她找到了些许安宁。\n\n你今天以无私的援助给予我们荣誉，<race>。我会把你们一族在此的成就传信给议会。带着我们的祝福去吧。",cEN="Dahlia... they turned her?\n\nDahlia has been loyal to us for a very long time... if they can corrupt a being of her devotion, it does not bode well for the rest of the young races. Thank you for freeing her. I hope she has found some peace.\n\nYou have honored us with your selfless assistance today, <race>. I will send word to the council of what your kind have accomplished here. Go with our blessing."}
Q[12419]={d="你捡起这只胸针之后，发现它所发出的微弱光芒又黯淡了一些。\n\n克拉苏斯一定很关心达莉亚的命运。把这只胸针带回龙眠神殿交给他吧。",dEN="As you pick up the brooch, its faint glow brightens slightly.\n\nKrasus will want to know of Dahlia's fate. Take the brooch to him at Wyrmrest.",o="将达莉亚的红玉胸针带回龙眠神殿的议会大厅交给克拉苏斯，并将她的命运告诉他。",oEN="Bring Dahlia Suntouch's Ruby Brooch to Krasus in the Ruling Council Chamber at Wyrmrest and inform him of Dahlia's fate.",p="你好，<race>。我感应到我的红玉胸针就在附近。把它给我。\n\n达莉亚怎么样了？",pEN="Hello, <race>. I sense the presence of my Ruby Brooch. Hand it here.\n\nWhat has become of Dahlia?",c="达莉亚陷落于天灾军团之手？对我们所有人来说，这真是悲伤的一天。\n\n我们夺回龙眠神殿之后我会重新找一个看守者。感谢你的努力……红玉巨龙圣地对我们来说是个圣地，你们族类所做的努力不会轻易地被遗忘的。\n\n知道还有像你这样的英雄真好——将来有一天我会召唤你来。直到那天到来，祝你冒险顺利、成果丰硕。",cEN="Dahlia was taken by the Scourge? This is a sad day for all of us.\n\nI will look to finding a new keeper once the shrine is retaken. Thank you for your efforts... the Ruby Dragonshrine is a sacred place to us, and the sacrifices your kind have made will not be easily forgotten.\n\nIt is good to know there are still heroes such as you - I will call upon you one day. Until that day comes, may your adventures be fruitful."}
Q[12420]={d="会员自有其特权。成为\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部的成员，就意味着知道去哪里弄到最新最好的酒。\n\n把你的\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给铁炉堡石火旅店的拉尔金·雷酒。",dEN="Membership has its privileges. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing where to get the latest and greatest brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",o="把\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给铁炉堡石火旅店的拉尔金·雷酒。",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Larkin Thunderbrew in the Stonefire Tavern in Ironforge.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do you have your membership forms filled out?",c="你的文件看起来没问题。欢迎加入俱乐部，<name>！\n\n你可以在每个月初收到我们的邮件。如果你喜欢收到的酒，随时过来，我们可以再卖给你一些。这就是一个不断奉献的俱乐部。",cEN="Your paperwork looks to be in order. Welcome to the club, <name>!\n\nYou can expect to get our mail at the start of every month. If you like what you got, stop by and we can sell you some more. This is the club that keeps on giving."}
Q[12421]={d="人多力量大，$n。成为\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部的成员，就意味着你和你的同胞总能弄到最好的酒。\n\n把你的\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给奥格瑞玛的雷玛。",dEN="There is strength in numbers, <name>. Being part of the \"Brew of the Month\" club means knowing you and your brethren will always have access to the best brew.\n\nBring your \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",o="把\"本月佳酿\"俱乐部会员表格带给奥格瑞玛的雷玛。",oEN="Bring the \"Brew of the Month\" club membership form to Ray'ma in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.",p="你填妥会员表格了吗？",pEN="Do ya have your membership forms filled out?",c="这么说你要加入我们的行列了，<name>？我们这儿待你不错。加入这个俱乐部，你得到的只会是最好的！\n\n我们会在每个月初给你寄酒。如果你喜欢收到的酒还想要更多，就回到这儿来。我们保证让你拿到更多你喜欢的酒。",cEN="So you be joinin' our ranks, <name>? We treat ya nice here. You only get the best when you part of dis club!\n\nWe be sendin' out brew to you at da start of every month. If you like what you got, and you be wantin' more, head back over here. We make sure you get more of da brew you like."}
Q[12422]={d="听着，$n。我要求你立刻前去执行一项需要高度判断力与效率的任务。\n\n克雷娜手下的一位高级士官在银溪镇外围获取了一名猎户流亡者。如果按照他们以往的方式来行事，那么这名战俘将在日落之前被处死。\n\n但我们不能让他们这么简单地把她处决掉。你看，这名战俘看起来跟米克哈尔日记中所描述的长女非常相似。\n\n如果我们放了她，并暗地跟踪她的话，就可以轻松地找到控制着那些猎户的真正幕后黑手。快，带着这封信去找她。",dEN="Listen, <name>. I need you to act with discretion and speed.\n\nOne of Krenna's top sergeants has captured a trapper outcast outside of Silverbrook. Now, if things turn out the way they usually do, the prisoner is going to be executed before the day is over.\n\nWe can't let that happen. You see, the prisoner matches the description of Mikhail's older daughter in his diary.\n\nIf we set her loose and follow her closely, she'll lead us to whoever's controlling the trappers. Take this letter to her.",o="带着特赦信转至银溪丘陵，将信交给被囚禁的猎户。",oEN="Deliver the Letter of Amnesty to the Captured Trapper in Silverbrook Hills.",p="你是来杀我的吗？",pEN="Are you here to kill me?",c="你是来放我走的……就这样？听着，我不想跟你有任何瓜葛……这些浑球杀了我的父亲，带走了我的姊姊。我现在有别的事要操心。",cEN="You're going to let me go... just like that? Listen, I don't want any trouble with you... these monsters killed my father and took my sister. I have other things on my mind right now."}
Q[12423]={d="根据你所掌握的情况，你认为这本日记是一个名叫米克哈尔的银溪镇居民写下的。\n\n他想必使用了人类通用语的某种变体或是方言，以防被人读懂其中的内容。或许你应该将这本书交给征服者克雷娜。",dEN="From what you can gather, this journal was written by a denizen of Silverbrook named Mikhail.\n\nIt is written in some variant of the common human tongue. Perhaps you should bring this back to Conqueror Krenna.",o="将米克哈尔的日记交给征服堡的征服者克雷娜。",oEN="Bring Mikhail's Journal to Conqueror Krenna in Conquest Hold.",p="你手上拿着什么？",pEN="What's that you've got there?",c="哈！这是某种笑话吗？\n\n我能读得懂的书几乎都对我没什么用。",cEN="Hah! Is this some sort of joke?\n\nI barely have any use for books I can actually understand."}
Q[12424]={d="嗯，没错，这日记的确是人类所用的猪一般的语言写成的。直接烧了吧，没什么价值。\n\n把它交给我妹妹高戈娜，别浪费我的时间了。",dEN="This book is written in the pig-tongue the humans use. It needs to be burned immediately.\n\nHand it to my sister Gorgonna and do not waste my time.",o="将米克哈尔的日记交给征服堡的高戈娜。",oEN="Bring Mikhail's Journal to Gorgonna in Conquest Hold.",p="你有东西要给我看？",pEN="You have something to show me?",c="有可能是吗？写这本日记的人担心女儿们的性命，所以把她们送离了银溪镇。\n\n我们刚在镇子外围抓到一个流浪者，年龄和那个大女儿相仿。\n\n听着，<name>。这里发生的事情比表面看到的要多……我们不能就这么把日记烧掉。",cEN="Could it be? The man who wrote this journal feared for his daughters' lives so he sent them away from Silverbrook.\n\nWe just captured an outcast in the outskirts of town about the same age as the eldest daughter.\n\nListen, <name>. There's more happening here than meets the eye... we can't just burn this diary."}
Q[12425]={d="看来那帮猎户的事闹得比我们之前所估计的更严重了。\n\n如果没有和联盟勾搭上的话，这很有可能意味着他们投靠了天灾军团，那可就更麻烦了。\n\n不过，我们的努力也没有白费。我们发现之前放走的那个战俘跑去和一名占卜师碰面了，可惜我们把她给跟丢了。\n\n我敢肯定她可以让我们重新找到敌人的领袖，但前提是我们必须先找到她。去拜访那个盲眼卢娜，看看能了解到什么消息。",dEN="This trapper business has the potential to be more important than we've accounted for.\n\nIf they're not with the Alliance, there's a good chance they're with the Scourge, which could mean trouble.\n\nOur previous efforts might've paid off, though. We spotted our former captive meeting with a fortune teller of some sort before we lost track of her.\n\nI'm almost certain now that she will take us to their leader if we can find her again. Find Ruuna the Blind and see what you can find out.",o="转至沃达希尔小径附近的卢娜的营地，与盲眼卢娜谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Ruuna the Blind at Ruuna's Camp near Vordrassil Pass.",c="你寻求你所接触不到的知识，所以你来找我。我必须警告你，陌生人，我给的答案也许你不会喜欢。",cEN="You seek knowledge beyond your reach so you've come to me. I must warn you, stranger, the answers I provide might not be to your liking."}
Q[12427]={d="所以你对角斗感兴趣，是吗？呃，克雷娜已经禁止所有在编战斗人员参加坑中角斗了。但你，$g我:我;的$g朋友:朋友;，严格来说是个$g自由人:自由人;，这条禁令不包括你。\n\n好一个法律漏洞，对吧？\n\n总之，如果你有兴趣，我可以让你从简单的开始，一只小熊。我甚至允许你带上朋友！",dEN="So you're interested in the fights, eh? Well, Krenna has outlawed pit-fighting for all enlisted combatants. But you, my friend, are technically a free agent and are not included in this prohibition.\n\nNice loophole, eh?\n\nAnyway, if you're interested I can start you off with something easy, a measly bear. I'll even let you bring friends along!",o="击败征服斗兽场内的铁皮，然后找赌徒维尔金领取奖赏。",oEN="Defeat Ironhide inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",p="直到你跟这头熊其中一个倒下以后才算结束，朋友！",pEN="It's not over until you or the bear tips over, friend!",c="做得好，老兄！这是你的份。",cEN="Nice work, mon! Here's your cut."}
Q[12428]={d="你不错嘛。相当不错嘛。\n\n不过，你敢弄翻一头熊怪吗？敢吗？诺森德本地的超大体型熊怪哦？\n\n好，很好，非常好，来，叫上你的伙伴，进竞技场吧。让那些观众们好好高兴高兴……没准我们等下就能赚一笔啦。",dEN="You're not bad. Not bad at all.\n\nThink you can take a furbolg? What about one of those extra-large crazed Northrend furbolgs?\n\nGood, good. Get your crew together, and head to the ring. Let's give these folks a show... maybe we can earn some more coin while we're at it.",o="在征服斗坑中击败托格·雷图腾，然后与赌注经纪人维尔金交谈领取奖励。|n",oEN="Defeat Torgg Thundertotem inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="真是犀利的动作，朋友！很多人赌你输，这真是个利多的好消息！",cEN="Those were some sharp moves, friend! Lots of bets against you, which is good news cash-wise!"}
Q[12429]={d="这地方能有个真正的$g斗士:女斗士;真好……过去几周我们只有囚犯和关在笼子里的野兽。大家都会腻的，你懂吧？\n\n那么，你下一个挑战是一具从索尔莫丹深处偷来的正宗铁魔像……你觉得你能应付吗？",dEN="It's nice to have a real fighter around these parts... we'd only had prisoners and caged beasts for the past few weeks. The people get bored, ya know?\n\nAnyhow, your next challenge is a genuine iron golem stolen from the depths of Thor Modan... think you can swing it?",o="在征服斗坑中击败锈血，然后与赌注经纪人维尔金交谈领取奖励。|n",oEN="Defeat Rustblood inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="我的心跳几乎都漏了一拍！还以为那堆铁要把你放倒了呢，老兄！",cEN="My heart nearly skipped a beat there! Thought that mound of metal was gonna get ya, mon!"}
Q[12430]={d="我跟你直说吧，$g小子:丫头;。下一个挑战者是个杀人犯。\n\n字面意义上的。\n\n他本应在上一周被处决，但他用左手勒死了刽子手，所以克雷娜的卫兵就把他让给我了。\n\n这一场你要是想跳过，我能理解。我不会怪你。",dEN="I'm gonna shoot straight with ya, kid. This next contender's a murderer.\n\nLiterally.\n\nHe was to be executed last week, but he strangled the hangman with his left hand, so Krenna's guards sort of let me have him.\n\nFeel free to pass on this one. I wouldn't blame ya.",o="在征服斗坑中击败霍格伦·地狱劈砍者，然后与赌注经纪人维尔金交谈领取奖励。|n",oEN="Defeat Horgrenn Hellcleave inside the Conquest Pit and speak to Bookie Vel'jen for a reward.",c="花俏的步法，花俏的步法。你真的很快就解决掉那个疯兽人了，朋友。\n\n赌你输的赔率是七赔一我可真是赚了不少！",cEN="Fancy footwork, fancy footwork. You really made quick work of that crazy orc, friend.\n\nOdds were against you seven-to-one; made some nice coin on that one!"}
Q[12431]={d="你这下肯定把克雷娜给惹怒啦。她跟高戈娜吵了一架，而且要求你立刻去那里面应战。\n\n有传闻说，这次要打，那可是至死方休！对你来说绝对是个坏消息，但对我们的商业利益来说可再好不过啦！\n\n怎么说呢……你的确是太背运了点……好了好了，赶紧进去吧，挺过去就没事了。",dEN="You must've really upset Krenna. She and Gorgonna have had a spat and you're wanted in the pit immediately.\n\nThere are some wild rumors that it's a fight to the death! That would be bad news for you, but great news for our business venture!\n\nAt any rate, you can't run away from fate... best get in there on the quick and get it over with.",o="击败征服斗兽场内的克雷娜，然后找高戈娜领取奖赏。",oEN="Defeat Krenna in the Conquest Pit and speak to Gorgonna for a reward.",c="\"今天发生的事……是必然要发生的。但这不意味着我就得为此高兴。\n\n我把我的族人从暴君手中解放了出来，但我也失去了一个姐妹。我感谢你的帮助，<name>。现在我想独自待一会儿。\"",cEN="What happened today... had to happen. It doesn't mean I have to be happy about it.\n\nI've freed my people from a tyrant, but I've also lost a sister. I thank you for your help, <name>. I wish to be alone now."}
Q[12432]={d="喂，你，$r！把你那副没用的皮囊挪过来！\n\n联盟有一批木材已经准备好从这儿往东北方运送。既然我们没法把那批木材抢到手，那就只有一件事可做——毁掉它！\n\n码头尽头那个地精已经准备好了几枚鱼雷。他把所有燃料都存放在北边停靠的地精船上。\n\n去弄些燃料，征用一枚鱼雷，驾着它撞进他们的船里。\n\n解散！",dEN="You there, <race>! Get your lousy carcass over here!\n\nThe Alliance have a shipment of lumber all ready for transport just northeast of here. Since getting our hands on that wood is out of the question, there's only one thing to do - destroy it!\n\nThe goblin at the end of the dock here has some torpedoes all ready to go. He's got all the fuel for them on the docked goblin ship to the north.\n\nGet some fuel, then commandeer one of the torpedoes and ride it into their ship.\n\nDismissed!",o="风险湾灯塔的高洛克将军希望你去摧毁联盟的木材运输船。\n\n只有在部落占领灯塔的时候，高洛克将军才会出现。",oEN="General Gorlok at the lighthouse in Venture Bay wants you to destroy the Alliance Lumber Boat.\n\nGeneral Gorlok will only be present at the lighthouse when the Horde has it in their possession.",p="那批联盟木材烧掉了吗，<class>？",pEN="Has that Alliance lumber been burned yet, <class>?",c="哈哈！好一趟旅程，对吧 <class>？\n\n如果我们控制不了这里的资源，那谁也别想控制！\n\n那些弱小的联盟害虫什么时候才能明白，他们根本不是部落力量的对手？",cEN="Ha hah! What a ride, eh <class>?\n\nIf we can't control the resources here, then no one can!\n\nWhen will those puny Alliance pests realize that they are no match for the might of the Horde?"}
Q[12433]={d="不会吧！又坏了一个垫圈……\n\n每次有垫圈坏掉，润滑剂都会流得到处都是。如果没有溶解剂的话，就得折腾好几个小时才能清理干净。\n\n我跟你说啊，在风险投资公司闯入的那个港口里有一种奇特的火箭燃料——我想他们把它称为“115号元素”。那东西可是很猛的溶解剂哦。\n\n帮我弄些过来，我不会让你白辛苦的。",dEN="Gah! Not again. Another blown gasket....\n\nEvery time one of these goes, lubricant gums up all of the gears. Without solvent, it takes hours to clean.\n\nTell ya what, <race>. There's some fancy rocket fuel on the Venture Company barge in the dock there - element 115 I think they call it. That stuff makes for a great solvent.\n\nGet me one of those and I'll make it worth your trouble.",o="风险湾部落基地的古图尔要你取回一罐115号元素。",oEN="Gurtor at the Venture Bay Horde base wants you to bring him a canister of Element 115.",p="你弄到那种 115 号元素了吗，<name>？",pEN="You got some of that element 115, <name>?",c="啊，没错，可以替我节省下许多时间了。\n\n收下这个，当作我麻烦你的回报，朋友。帮我多找一些115号元素来，你找到多少我收多少。",cEN="Ahh yes. That'll save me hours.\n\nTake this for your trouble, friend. And keep an eye out for more element 115. I'll take all you can find."}
Q[12435]={d="我讨厌生命的消逝……任何生命都一样。但我不会放弃抵抗，我不会让玛里苟斯杀死我们并玷污神殿！\n\n我已经指派阿弗拉沙斯塔兹全权负责龙眠神殿的防御事宜。\n\n去找托拉斯塔萨谈谈，让他派一条幼龙载你去找阿弗拉沙斯塔兹吧。\n\n请你帮助他，$n。你是守卫龙眠神殿、挫败蓝龙军团的关键。",dEN="I abhor the loss of life... any life. But I will not stand idly by and allow Malygos to kill us and defile the temple!\n\nI have appointed Lord Afrasastrasz as the commander of Wyrmrest's defenses.\n\nSpeak with Torastrasza to ride a drake down to him.\n\nPlease lend him your aid, <name>. Your involvement with the defense of Wyrmrest will be critical to us prevailing against the blue dragonflight.",o="与龙眠神殿的阿弗拉沙斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lord Afrasastrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="你一定是<name>。女王通知过我你会来。\n\n如果你愿意，我们非常需要你的帮助。",cEN="You must be <name>. The queen informed me that you would be coming.\n\nIf you are willing, we are in great need of your assistance."}
Q[12436]={d="向你致敬，$c。不知道你有没有发现，在征服堡这个地方，一切都在克蕾娜的控制之下，我们买克蕾娜让我们买的，卖克蕾娜让我们卖的，连价格都是克蕾娜规定好的。\n\n这一些都在让这里的经济死亡！我决定偷偷赚一笔小钱，顺便让步兵小伙子们饱点口福。你不如去猎几头鹿，然后给我弄点鹿肉回来，怎么样？\n\n这附近的鹿可真是漫山遍野，所以呢，你必须只挑选最好的肉。",dEN="Hail, <class>. You'll find that here at Conquest Hold, we buy and sell what Krenna wants us to buy and sell... at the price that Krenna wants us to buy and sell.\n\nAll this is stifling business. I'm hoping to make a little bit of coin on the side and feed our grunts at the same time. Why don't you go hunt down some stag and bring me the venison?\n\nThey're numerous in the area, so bring me only the best meat.",o="征服堡的粮食商人洛克兰要求你从附近的耸角雄鹿身上采集5块肥美的鹿肉。",oEN="Provisioner Lorkran at Conquest Hold wants you to obtain 5 Succulent Venison from the nearby Tallhorn Stag.",p="你弄到那头鹿了吗，<name>？",pEN="You get that venison yet, <name>?",c="干得好，<name>。这些每份够喂饱两三个苦工。不错。",cEN="Nice job, <name>. These will feed two or three grunts each. Not bad."}
Q[12437]={d="听着，$n。这场战斗说穿了无非就是在比谁的资源多。\n\n我有一个计划，可以让我们对部落占有更大的优势。\n\n在码头尽头停泊着一些鱼雷，我们可以利用它们击毁部落停泊在西北面的木材运输船。\n\n你去北边港口里的地精船只那里弄些燃料，然后骑在一枚鱼雷上，直接冲进他们的运输船里去！",dEN="Listen, <name>. This battle is as much over resources as tactical supremacy.\n\nI have a mission that could turn the tide in our struggle against the Horde here.\n\nThere are torpedoes at the end of the dock that we can use to take down the Horde's lumber ship to the northwest.\n\nYou'll need to get some of the fuel that's stored on the docked goblin ship just north of here, then ride one of the torpedoes into their transport!",o="风险湾灯塔的霍瑟尔司令希望你去摧毁部落的木材运输船。\n\n只有在联盟占领灯塔的时候，霍瑟尔司令才会出现。",oEN="Commander Howser at the lighthouse in Venture Bay wants you to destroy the Horde lumber shipment.\n\nCommander Howser will only be present at the lighthouse when the Alliance has it in their possession.",p="部落那艘木材船烧掉了吗，<name>？",pEN="Has that Horde lumber ship been burned yet, <name>?",c="很高兴看到你在那次撞击中活了下来。真是场大爆炸！\n\n我们不能让部落把那些木材全都运走。\n\n干得好，<class>。",cEN="Good to see that you survived that impact. Quite the explosion!\n\nWe can't afford for the Horde to make off with all that lumber.\n\nWell done, <class>."}
Q[12438]={d="悬赏发布人伊露希亚·卢恩\n\n一个名叫克留格·碎誓者的天灾军团血肉巨人杀死了我的丈夫、孩子和我最好的朋友，韦斯帕尔一家。敢于揭下这张布告的勇士可以在腐臭平原东南边的海岸附近找到克留格。\n\n我要为死者讨回公道！去杀死克留格·碎誓者！\n\n杀死克留格的勇士可以去向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取金钱和物品奖赏。\n\n请为我们伸张正义！",dEN="Posted by: Illusia Lune\n\nThe Scourge flesh giant known as Kreug Oathbreaker was responsible for the deaths of my husband, children and my dear friends, the Whisperveils. Those brave enough to take on this bounty will find Kreug in the southeastern reaches of the Carrion Fields.\n\nI demand justice! Kill Kreug Oathbreaker!\n\nIn the event that Kreug is slain, I have pooled money and items together and given them to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to give out as a reward.\n\nPlease vindicate us!",o="杀死克留格·碎誓者，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取奖赏。",oEN="Kill Kreug Oathbreaker and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="你是来领赏的吗，盟友？",pEN="Are you here to collect a bounty, ally?",c="干得好，<name>。我会通知伊露希亚，有一位英雄听到了她的求助，挺身而出迎接挑战！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I will notify Illusia that a hero has heard her call for help and risen to meet the challenge! Here is your reward."}
Q[12439]={d="有一股力量正在试图毁灭我们所珍惜的一切，$n。你必须转至西方的群星之墓。大法师茉德拉感觉到我们这个世界的魔法基础正在动摇，我们必须立刻解决这个问题！\n\n现在就出发吧，$n！去和暮冬要塞狮鹫站的罗尼·威尔士谈一谈，把你的任务告诉他。他会让最快的狮鹫送你转至群星之墓。到达目的地以后，去找大法师茉德拉谈一谈。",dEN="Another force threatens to destroy all that we have worked for, <name>. You must head westward to Stars' Rest. Archmage Modera has sensed a great disturbance in the magical ley lines of our world that must be dealt with immediately!\n\nGo now, <name>! Speak to Rodney Wells at the gryphon station here in Wintergarde and let him know the nature of your mission. He will place you on his fastest gryphon to deliver you to Stars' Rest. Speak with Archmage Modera when you arrive.",o="去和暮冬要塞的罗尼·威尔士谈一谈，向他要一头坐骑，转至龙骨荒野西部的群星之墓。",oEN="Speak to Rodney Wells at Wintergarde Keep to secure a ride to Stars' Rest in western Dragonblight.",c="我们绝对不能承受另一次分裂了，朋友。我会尽我一切努力帮助你完成任务。",cEN="We definitely don't want another sundering, friend. I'll do all that I can to help you on your mission."}
Q[12440]={d="当你$g准备好:准备好;，我会把你送上我最快的狮鹫前往群星之眠。到了那里，就去寻找大法师莫德拉。\n\n祝你好运，$g盟友:盟友;！",dEN="When you are ready I will place you on my fastest gryphon to Stars' Rest. Once you get there, find and speak with Archmage Modera.\n\nGood luck, ally!",o="与龙骨荒野西部群星之眠的大法师莫德拉的影像交谈。|n",oEN="Speak with the Image of Archmage Modera at Stars' Rest in western Dragonblight.",c="瓦思听见我的哀号了吗？即使是一瞬间也好，朋友。",cEN="Vas heard my distress call then, eh? Not a moment too soon, friend."}
Q[12441]={d="悬赏发布人：德洛菲\n\n我和我的表亲，斯克罗提和布鲁特，在埃尔德齐断崖遭到了一群邪恶的血爪氏族狼獾人的袭击。我们逃走了，但斯克罗提和布鲁特恐怕被他们抓住了。\n\n我要报仇雪恨！在此招募无畏的勇士转至龙骨荒野东南部的埃尔德齐断崖，杀死高阶萨满祭司德金·血爪和他的爪牙。\n\n杀死这个恶棍的勇士可以向李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取大笔赏金！",dEN="Posted by: Drolfy\n\nWhile out in the Eldritch Heights with my cousins, Skrotee and Brote, a vicious band of wolvar from the Bloodpaw tribe attacked us. We attempted to flee, but I fear they got Skrotee and Brote.\n\nI demand retribution! Is there someone brave enough to venture to the southeastern reaches of Dragonblight, to the Eldritch Heights, and kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and his cronies?\n\nI have given a hefty sum of gold to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig to disperse to anyone that claims this bounty!",o="杀死高阶萨满祭司德金·血爪，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，找李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格公爵领取奖赏。",oEN="Kill High Shaman Bloodpaw and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="你解决血掌了吗？",pEN="Have you faced Bloodpaw?",c="干得太出色了，<name>！我会通知德洛菲，有一位英雄挺身迎接他的挑战，残忍的血爪已经不复存在了！",cEN="Outstanding work, <name>! I will notify Drolfy that a hero did rise to meet his challenge and that the cruel Bloodpaw is no more!"}
Q[12442]={d="发布者：大领主李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格\n\n在暮冬要塞东北方的路上，第七军团的一个营遭到血色先锋军指挥官尤斯图斯和一整支血色先锋军无脑狂热者军队的伏击并被杀害。这种冷酷而蓄意的行径必须以武力回应！\n\n暮冬要塞要求正义！去东北方的先锋军营地寻找先锋军指挥官尤斯图斯，终结他那可悲的性命。\n\n任何敢于接下这项任务的人，我都会给予奖励！|n",dEN="Posted by: Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig\n\nUpon the northeastern path from Wintergarde a battalion of 7th Legion were ambushed and slain by Onslaught Commander Iustus and an army of mindless Scarlet Onslaught zealots. Such cold and calculated actions must be met with force!\n\nWintergarde demands justice! Seek out Onslaught Commander Iustus at Onslaught Base Camp to the northeast and end his miserable existence.\n\nI will hand out the reward for this bounty to any who would dare take up the task!",o="杀死先锋军指挥官尤斯图斯，然后回到龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的大领主李奥瑞克·冯·泽尔迪格那里领取奖励。|n",oEN="Kill Onslaught Commander Iustus and return to Highlord Leoric Von Zeldig at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight to collect your reward.",p="<李奥瑞克咬牙切齿说道。>\n\n那个自负的蠢蛋死了没？",pEN="<Leoric grits his teeth.>\n\nIs that pompous fool dead?",c="至少就目前而言，血色先锋军的邪恶计划受到了挫折。你为暮冬要塞立下了大功，<name>。",cEN="At least for now the Scarlet Onslaught suffers a setback in their nefarious plans. You have done Wintergarde a great service, <name>."}
Q[12443]={d="不会吧！又坏了一个垫圈……\n\n每次有垫圈坏掉，润滑剂都会流得到处都是。如果没有溶解剂的话，就得折腾好几个小时才能清理干净。\n\n我跟你说啊，在风险投资公司闯入的那个港口里有一种奇特的火箭燃料——我想他们把它称为“115号元素”。那东西可是很猛的溶解剂哦。\n\n帮我弄些过来，我不会让你白辛苦的。",dEN="Gah! Not again. Another blown gasket....\n\nEvery time one of these goes, lubricant gums up all of the gears. Without solvent, it takes hours to clean.\n\nTell ya what, <race>. There's some fancy rocket fuel on the Venture Company barge in the dock there - element 115 I think they call it. That stuff makes for a great solvent.\n\nGet me one of those and I'll make it worth your trouble.",o="风险湾联盟基地的巴布芬克要你取回一罐115号元素。",oEN="Barblefink at the Alliance base in Venture Bay wants you to bring him a canister of Element 115.",p="你弄到那种 115 号元素了吗，<name>？",pEN="You got some of that element 115, <name>?",c="啊，没错，可以替我节省下许多时间了。\n\n收下这个，当作我麻烦你的回报，朋友。帮我多找一些115号元素来，你找到多少我收多少。",cEN="Ahh yes. That'll save me hours.\n\nTake this for your trouble, friend. And keep an eye out for more element 115. I'll take all you can find."}
Q[12444]={d="风险投资公司正在撤离灰熊丘陵。他们以前在这里运作着木材生意，但眼下的形势对他们来说有点太危险了。\n\n他们放弃的伐木场现在很容易就能占领，我们肯定不能让部落占领它们。\n\n黑水伐木场是这一地区的三处伐木场中最小的一个，但我们仍然需要它。你的任务就是去赶走部落的部队，他们从这里获得的任何木材都将是在别处对抗我们的武器。",dEN="The Venture Company's on its way out of Grizzly Hills. They used to run logging operations here, but things got a little too dangerous for them.\n\nTheir abandoned sites are up for grabs and we sure as hell can't let the Horde get their hands on them.\n\nThe Blackriver Logging Camp is the smallest of the three logging sites in this zone, but we still need it. Do your part and fend off the Horde forces. Any lumber they get here will be made into weapons to be used against us elsewhere.",o="斥候队长卡特尔希望你在黑水伐木场击杀10名部落士兵或者玩家。",oEN="Scout Captain Carter wants you to kill 10 Horde units or players in the Blackriver Logging Camp.",p="狩猎情形如何？",pEN="How's the hunt going?",c="干得好，<name>。我们这儿正需要更多像你这样的人。我们可以好好让部落知道别来惹我们。",cEN="Nice work, <name>. We could use a few more folks like you up here. We could really show the Horde not to mess with us."}
Q[12447]={d="天灾军团来了。克拉苏斯号召他的盟友，徒劳地想要拯救他们的红玉巨龙圣地，但红龙军团的好意似乎并不延伸到拯救其他军团的圣地。\n\n$g吃惊:吃惊;？我并不。\n\n我族中的另一条龙已经前往清理我们的黑曜石巨龙圣地，那里如今满是亡灵害虫。要证明你比阿莱克丝塔萨更高尚正直，只需快跑去那里挥几下刀刃。\n\n我觉得很有趣。",dEN="The Scourge come. Korialstrasz calls upon his allies in a futile attempt to save their Ruby Dragonshrine, but it seems the good graces of the red flight don't extend to saving the shrines of the other flights.\n\nSurprised? I'm not.\n\nThere is another of my brood who has left to clear our Obsidian Dragonshrine of the undead vermin that now infest it. All it would take to prove yourself more noble and righteous than Alexstrasza herself is a quick jaunt over there and a few swings of a blade.\n\nI'm amused.",o="转至位于龙眠神殿西北方、天灾之门正西方的黑曜石巨龙圣地，找到瑟里纳尔并帮助他。",oEN="Travel to the Obsidian Dragonshrine Northwest of Wymrest and just West of the Wrath Gate. Locate Serinar inside of the shrine and offer him your aid.",c="我得想想哪件事让我比较讶异……是你真的愿意来帮助一只黑龙呢，还是你跟纳莉丝说完话之后居然还能活着。\n\n她连讲话都会滴出毒液，但是我猜龙眠神殿可能可以抑制我们。\n\n也许只是因为红龙军团环伺在她四周罢了。",cEN="I'm trying to decide at which I'm more surprised... that you actually came to the aid of a Black Dragon or that you're still in one piece after speaking with Nalice.\n\nHer words drip venom, but I suppose Wyrmrest can keep even our kind in check sometimes.\n\nOr perhaps it's just the armies of the red dragonflight that are massed around her."}
Q[12448]={d="天灾军团占领了圣地。圣地的守护者达莉亚已经失踪了。在守卫圣地时阵亡的红龙都变成了扭曲的灰烬之龙，转头攻击我们。情况非常危急，$r。\n\n天灾军团如今源源不断地从神殿中涌来，德雷森上尉带着一队你们的人去阻止他们了。\n\n去帮助他……但请你一定要站在士兵身后。我可不希望你抵抗不住潮水般的敌军，牺牲在那些烧焦的峡谷里。",dEN="The Scourge have overrun the shrine. The shrine's keeper, Dahlia Suntouch, is nowhere to be found. The red wyrms that fell in the shrine's defense now beset us in the form of twisted skeletal emberwyrms. The situation is dire, <race>.\n\nCaptain Drayzen leads a group of your kind in stemming the flow of the Scourge out of the shrine.\n\nGo to his aid... but please stay behind his men. The flow of Scourge is endless and I don't want to lose you in one of those scarred canyons.",o="协助德雷森上尉守住峡谷，参与杀死 12 名寒冷食尸鬼侵袭者、8 名寒冷恶鬼侵袭者和 1 名寒冷憎恶侵袭者。\n\n完成这项任务后回到瓦加斯塔兹那里。",oEN="Aid Captain Drayzen in holding the canyons by participating in the death of 12 Frigid Ghoul Attackers, 8 Frigid Geist Attackers, and 1 Frigid Abomination Attacker.\n\nReturn to Vargastrasz once you have finished this task.",c="这个任务令人作呕，但我为你的付出表示感激。\n\n天灾军团不能向龙殿外推进任何一步，否则这片大地都将失守。",cEN="It is a disgusting task, but I thank you for doing it.\n\nThe Scourge cannot be permitted to push any further out of the shrine lest all of these lands be overrun."}
Q[12449]={d="我要交给你另一个任务。我有很多兄弟都在激烈的空战中阵亡了。如果我们不赶快行动的话，他们就会加入灰烬之龙的队伍。\n\n请你从南面的小路进入圣地……那里的天灾军团应该比较少。\n\n在圣地里寻找从树上掉下来的红玉橡果，然后把它们种在我死去的同胞们的尸体旁。这样他们就能获得新生……这是红龙氏族的高贵宿命。",dEN="I have another task that needs attention. I have brothers who are falling in the battle overhead and if we do not act quickly, they will only bolster the emberwyrm ranks.\n\nGet into the shrine through the pass in the south... the Scourge presence should be lighter there.\n\nSearch the shrine for ruby acorns that have fallen from the tree and plant them near the bodies of my fallen brood. Through this, they can give new life... a proud fate for any of my kind.",o="从南面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地并寻找红玉橡果。对死去的红龙使用红玉橡果，让他们的尸体回归大地。完成任务后向瓦加斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through the southern pass and search for Ruby Acorns. Use the Ruby Acorns on the fallen red dragons to return their bodies to the earth. Return to Vargastrasz once the task is complete.",c="在大地之中，我的兄弟们可以再赐予生命。你把它们从比死亡更糟的命运中救了出来。\n\n你的语言里没有一个词能表达这对我的族群意味着什么。谢谢你，<race>。",cEN="In the earth, my brothers can grant life anew. You have saved them from a fate far worse than death.\n\nI don't know a word in your tongue that could express how much this means to my kind. Thank you, <race>."}
Q[12450]={d="我还有最后一个任务要给你，$r……一个足以扭转战局的任务。\n\n请你回到圣地，去杀死那些指挥战斗的通灵师。只要他们死了，我们就能击退天灾的军队，并慢慢夺回圣地。\n\n我还要你去找到圣地下面的堕落之源并摧毁它。\n\n我知道我要你做的事情太多了，但如果你能做到的话，我们就可以赢得这场战斗。",dEN="I have one final task for you, <race>... one that should turn the tide of this fight.\n\nReturn to the shrine and kill the necromancers that are fueling this onslaught. With them dead, we should be able to beat these forces back and eventually retake the shrine.\n\nI also need you to find the source of the corruption under the shrine and put an end to it.\n\nI know I have asked a lot of you, but if you do this for me, we will win this battle.",o="从南面的小路进入红玉巨龙圣地，杀死6个冰冷通灵师并摧毁圣地下面的堕落之源。完成任务后向瓦加斯塔兹复命。",oEN="Enter the Ruby Dragonshrine through the southern pass, then kill 6 Frigid Necromancers and eliminate the source of the corruption under the shrine. Return to Vargastrasz once the task is complete.",p="你回来了！你完成我的要求了吗？",pEN="You've returned! Have you done as I've asked of you?",c="达莉亚……他们把她转化了？\n\n达莉亚对我们忠诚了非常久……如果连她这样虔诚的存在都能被腐化，那对其余的年轻种族可不是好兆头。谢谢你解救了她。我希望她找到了些许安宁。\n\n你今天以无私的援助给予我们荣誉，<race>。也许并非所有部落成员都承袭着他们祖先的黑心。我会把你们一族在此的成就传信给议会。",cEN="Dahlia... they turned her?\n\nDahlia has been loyal to us for a very long time... if they can corrupt a being of her devotion, it does not bode well for the rest of the young races. Thank you for freeing her. I hope she has found some peace.\n\nYou have honored us with your selfless assistance today, <race>. Perhaps not all of the Horde bear the black hearts of their ancestors. I will send word to the council of what your kind have accomplished here."}
Q[12451]={d="在我们建造征服堡的时候，我派了斥候沃塔肯去与东面我们的同盟牦牛人进行联络。欧尼瓦营地是他们的根据地，就在灰熊丘陵的最东面，灰喉堡的另一边。\n\n去那里走一趟，听一听沃塔肯的报告，给当地的酋长提供一切可能的帮助。你在征服堡所做的贡献可以算是这里的典范了，我想沃塔肯会对你的协助表示感激的。",dEN="While we build Conquest Hold, I sent Scout Vor'takh to make contact with our taunka allies in the east. They're based in Camp Oneqwah, which is in the easternmost part of Grizzly Hills, beyond Grizzlemaw.\n\nMake the journey there, hear Vor'takh's report and offer your assistance with anything he and the local chieftain may need. Your contributions to Conquest Hold have been exemplary and I know Vor'takh will be grateful for the assistance.",o="与欧尼瓦营地的斥候沃塔肯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Scout Vor'takh at Camp Oneqwah.",c="<一段简短的自我介绍解释了纳兹格林将军派你来的原因。>\n\n啊，所以你就是所谓的援军了，很好。\n\n托尔玛克和他的手下会需要你的刀剑的。",cEN="<You offer a short introduction, explaining you were sent by Sergeant Nazgrim.>\n\nAh, so you're something in the way of reinforcements, then. Good.\n\nTormak and his men have need of your blade."}
Q[12453]={d="他们一直要我帮忙对抗联盟。现在我们的军队正在和对手僵持，我们必须尽可能获得优势。\n\n在这片山脉和森林中翱翔的白肩鹰可以成为我们最好的探子。带上这片银色羽毛，用它让我的视界和它们的视界结合。\n\n能够看到敌人的活动无疑会给我们带来巨大的优势。你可以在东面的山中找到大量的白肩鹰。",dEN="I've been asked to lend my support to our efforts against the Alliance. At the moment our military forces are about evenly matched and we're looking for ways to find an edge.\n\nThe imperial eagles that fly over the mountains and trees in this area would make excellent scouts for us. Take this silver feather and use it to bind my sight to that of them.\n\nBeing able to see our enemy's movements will grant us the strategic advantage we need. You'll find abundant eagles in the mountains to the east.",o="风之先知希尔·灰角希望你在灰熊丘陵的6只白肩鹰身上使用银色羽毛。",oEN="Windseer Grayhorn wants you to use the Silver Feather on 6 Imperial Eagles in Grizzly Hills.",p="我交代你的事办好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you done what I asked of you, <name>?",c="我感谢你，<name>。感谢你的帮助。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. Your help is appreciated."}
Q[12454]={d="伊瑟拉在翡翠梦境中沉睡，守护着梦境世界和艾泽拉斯。但是可怕的噩梦入侵了梦境世界，这使得我担心伊瑟拉也受到了影响。\n\n最近，我请求她帮助我们对抗天灾军团——那些亡灵正在各个巨龙圣地中制造冰霜巨龙。可是她误解了我的请求。\n\n她命令我们这个巨龙圣地的守卫攻击所有非绿龙军团的人。\n\n我要你去杀死一些天爪枭，以此来恢复圣地的平衡。",dEN="Ysera sleeps in the Emerald Dream, watching over both the Dream and Azeroth. But a horrible nightmare has taken hold in the Dream, and now I fear that Ysera is being affected by it.\n\nRecently, I asked her to aid in the fight against the Scourge that are raising frostwyrms at the other dragonshrines. She misunderstood.\n\nInstead, she told our dragonshrine's defenders to treat those not of the green dragonflight as enemies.\n\nI need you to slay some of the skytalons. The shrine must regain its balance.",o="翡翠巨龙圣地的护园者尼瑟拉要你去杀死5只翡翠天爪枭。",oEN="Nishera the Garden Keeper at the Emerald Dragonshrine has asked you to slay 5 Emerald Skytalons.",p="越快解决翡翠天爪，越快能将翡翠巨龙圣地的自然平衡恢复。",pEN="The sooner that the ermerald skytalons can be dealt with, the sooner the Emerald Dragonshrine can be returned to its natural balance.",c="不要后悔你在生命的循环中所扮演的角色。出生、死亡、重生都是自然规律中的一部分。",cEN="Do not regret the part that you played in the cycle of life. Birth, death, and rebirth are all part of the natural order."}
Q[12455]={d="弹药空投出了岔子，$g朋友:朋友;。从西卫堡运来的弹药被那些在头顶盘旋的霜龙截住了。飞行器几秒钟内就被撕成碎片，货物随风散落。大部分还在上面——就在腐尸平原上。\n\n我需要你回到上面，把散落在那鬼地方各处的弹药箱收回来。\n\n动作快点！没有枪炮和弹药，我们没法发起这场攻势，$g伙计:小妞;！",dEN="The munitions drop went badly, friend. The shipment of ammo from Westguard Keep was intercepted by the frostwyrms circling overhead. The flying machines were torn apart in a matter of seconds and their cargo was scattered to the wind. Most of it is still topside - on the Carrion Fields.\n\nI'm gonna need you to go back up and recover the munitions crates that are scattered all over this damned place.\n\nHurry it up! We can't start this offensive without guns and ammo, <buddy/missy>!",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你取回8箱暮冬军需品。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to recover 8 Wintergarde Munitions.",p="我的弹药在哪儿，<伙计/女士>？",pEN="Where are my munitions, <fella/lady>?",c="还来得及！我的部分士兵热血冲昏了头，决定朝东西两边的墓穴猛攻。不用说，他们很快地就被这些无脑的食尸鬼给击溃了。我们得抢救生还者！",cEN="Just in time! Some of my soldiers got a little overzealous and decided to wade into the crypts directly to the east and west of us. Needless to say, they were quickly overwhelmed by those mindless ghouls. We need to rescue the survivors!"}
Q[12456]={d="我能感觉到圣地并没有完全恢复平衡。翠羽守护者已经被我们的行动激怒了，我预感它不会听我们解释的。\n\n奥雷托斯是一头巨大的天爪枭，它栖息在翡翠巨龙圣地的最南部，控制着整个巨龙圣地的空中防御。恐怕我们也得让它进入轮回了。\n\n把这些天爪枭的绒毛放在它能看见的地方，它就会出现。把它的羽毛给我带来。",dEN="I can feel that the shrine is not completely back in balance. The verdant keeper has been angered by our actions, and I sense that he will not listen to reason.\n\nAlystros is an immense skytalon who perches at the south end of the Emerald Dragonshrine. It is he who is in charge of the dragonshrine's aerial defenses. I fear that we will have to deal with him.\n\nTake these skytalon molts and place them on the ground where he can see them. He will come. Bring me his plume.",o="翡翠巨龙圣地的护园者尼瑟拉要你取得奥雷托斯的羽毛。",oEN="Nishera the Garden Keeper at the Emerald Dragonshrine has asked you to acquire The Plume of Alystros.",p="你准备对付奥雷托斯了吗？要记得向你的朋友求助。\n\n事实上，翠羽守护者很强大，我推荐你结伴而行！",pEN="Have you managed to deal with Alystros? Do not be afraid to ask your friends for assistance.\n\nIn fact, given that the verdant keeper is very powerful, I recommend it!",c="别为奥雷托斯哭泣。他将其永恒的生命奉献给了保卫翡翠巨龙圣地，它即将重生。\n\n但愿当它重返我们身边的时候，不会因为梦境之龙所控制的翡翠梦魇而陷入迷惘。",cEN="Do not weep for Alystros. He has dedicated his eternal life to the defense of the Emerald Dragonshrine and will be reborn.\n\nHopefully when he returns to us, he will not be gripped with the confusion of the Emerald Nightmare that seems to have taken hold of The Dreamer."}
Q[12457]={d="我们在正东和正西都架好了机枪和路障。我们受伤的士兵藏在两个房间里，尽量不让那些没脑子的食尸鬼发现他们的存在。\n\n既然我们有弹药了，我需要你操作其中一挺机枪，用它为我们的士兵轰出一条通路！等你$g就位:就位;，就喊一名士兵从藏身处出来，然后猛烈开火，别让天灾军团碰到他！\n\n快动手！",dEN="We've set up chain guns and barricades directly to the east and to the west. Our injured soldiers are hiding in both rooms - trying their best to not alert the mindless ghouls to their presence.\n\nNow that we have ammo, I need you to man one of the chain guns and use it to blast a path clear for our soldiers! Once you're on board, call a soldier out from hiding and then lay down heavy fire to keep the Scourge off him!\n\nGet a move on!",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你营救8名受伤的第七军团士兵。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to save 8 Injured 7th Legion Soldiers.",p="你救出我们受伤的士兵了吗？",pEN="Have you rescued our injured soldiers?",c="<name>，自希利苏斯以来我还没见过这样的英雄壮举！\n\n我一定会确保那些士兵每一个都向弗塔根大王推荐提拔你！\n\n现在，说更紧要的事。我们的斥候回报，塞尔赞就在附近。",cEN="<name>, I haven't seen heroics like that since Silithus!\n\nI'll be sure that each and every one of those soldiers puts in a recommendation to Lord Fordragon that you be promoted!\n\nNow, on to more pressing matters. We've gotten reports back from our scouts that Thel'zan is close."}
Q[12458]={d="我们需要更多对抗天灾军团的武器。东南方的翡翠巨龙圣地也许就是我们要寻找的答案。\n\n所有的亡灵生物——除了希尔瓦娜斯手下的那些——只要踏入圣地就会化为尘土。\n\n我需要你的帮助来完成一个试验，年轻的$r。请你到翡翠巨龙圣地去，拿一些翡翠鞭笞者的种子回来。",dEN="We need more weapons in the fight against the Scourge. The natural properties of the Emerald Dragonshrine to the southeast may be the answer.\n\nAny unliving creature, save those that Sylvanas has redeemed, that steps foot in the dragonshrine falls to dust.\n\nI want to test a theory, and I want you to be my instrument in doing so, young <race>. Go to the Emerald Dragonshrine and take the seeds from the emerald lashers therein.",o="龙眠神殿顶层的伊萨里奥斯勋爵要你去收集3份鞭笞者的种子。",oEN="Lord Itharius at the top of Wyrmrest Temple has asked you to return with 3 Lasher Seeds.",p="截至当前你已经拿到多少颗种子了呢？",pEN="And just how many seeds have you managed to acquire thus far?",c="哪怕是现在，我依然能感受到种子中自然的脉动。\n\n我们一定要善加利用这些种子！",cEN="Even now I can feel the pulse of nature from within these seeds.\n\nWe must put them to good use!"}
Q[12459]={d="既然我们只有三颗种子，就必须把它们用在最合适的地方。\n\n你的目标是：在北方加拉隆安息处附近游荡的一条复生霜龙、东面腐尸平原毁坏兵营里的污秽者图尔吉德，以及遥远东北方金萨卡拉尔的监工死亡凝视。\n\n这些种子固然能直接消灭一个较弱的天灾成员，但它们也会大大削弱这三个目标。事实上，削弱到足够你$g独自:独自;应付的程度。",dEN="Since we only have three seeds, we must put them to the best possible use.\n\nYour targets are one of the reanimated frost wyrms circling to the north near Galakrond's Rest, Turgid the Vile in the ruined barracks at the Carrion Fields to the east, and Overseer Deathgaze at Jintha'kalar far to the northeast.\n\nWhile the seeds would outright destroy one of the lesser Scourge, they will greatly weaken these three. Enough so, in fact, that you should be able to handle them on your own.",o="龙眠神殿顶层的伊萨里奥斯勋爵要你去杀死一头被削弱的冰霜巨龙、被削弱的图尔基德和被削弱的监工戴瑟盖斯。",oEN="Lord Itharius at the top of Wyrmrest Temple has asked you to destroy a Weakened Reanimated Frost Wyrm, Weakened Turgid the Vile, and Weakened Overseer Deathgaze.",p="结果如何？毁掉他们了吗？\n\n我需要答案！",pEN="What were the results? Are they destroyed?\n\nI need answers!",c="很好。正如我一直怀疑的那样。我得试着联系伊瑟拉，看看她是否认可。\n\n当然，如果她能被人从噩梦中劝出来的话。\n\n谢谢你，<name>。你功不可没。",cEN="Excellent. Just as I suspected all along. I shall have to attempt to contact Ysera and see if she approves.\n\nIf she can be coaxed from her nightmare, of course.\n\nThank you, <name>. You have been indispensable."}
Q[12460]={d="我们需要你到红玉巨龙圣地去。\n\n巨龙们到处都受到蓝龙军团和天灾军团的侵扰……他们的处境并不比我们好。情况看起来很严峻，但这给了我们一个建立宝贵同盟的难得机会。\n\n我调集了一个团去红玉巨龙圣地支援红龙军团对抗天灾军团。如果你$g身上:身上;还有斗志，就去找圣地东面山脊上的瑟里斯特拉兹，尽你所能帮助他。",dEN="We need you at the Ruby Dragonshrine.\n\nThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. The situation seems dire, but this affords us a rare opportunity to establish a valuable alliance.\n\nI secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. If you have a fight in you, please go find Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the shrine and help him in any way that you can.",o="转至红玉巨龙圣地东面的山脊，向塞雷斯塔兹报到。红玉巨龙圣地就在龙眠神殿以西。",oEN="Report to Ceristrasz on the ridge east of the Ruby Dragonshrine, west of Wyrmrest.",c="劳莉耶尔大使派你来的？\n\n如果你再见到她的话，请向她说我非常感激她的协助。我们有太多的战线要维持了。",cEN="Ambassador Lauriel sent you?\n\nIf you talk to her again, please let her know that we are very appreciative of her aid. We are fighting battles on far too many fronts."}
Q[12461]={d="你必须立即转至红玉巨龙圣地。这是命令。\n\n龙族已经完全被蓝龙军团和天灾军团压制住了……他们的情况一点儿也不比我们好。这个机会非常难得，可以让我们为祖先的过错赎罪。\n\n我已经派了一个团的将士转至红玉巨龙圣地，帮助红龙对抗天灾军团。去加入他们吧，把天灾军团踩在脚下！\n\n为了部落！",dEN="You are leaving to the Ruby Dragonshrine. This is not a request.\n\nThe dragons are beset on all sides by the blue flight and the scourge... they're in no better a state than we are. It is not often we are afforded the opportunity to redeem ourselves for the transgressions of our ancestors.\n\nI have secured a regiment to aid the red dragonflight against the Scourge at the Ruby Dragonshrine. Join them and crush the Scourge beneath your boots!\n\nFor the Horde!",o="转至阿格玛之锤以东的红玉巨龙圣地，向圣地外面山脊上的瓦加斯塔兹报到。",oEN="Report to Vargastrasz on a ridge outside of the Ruby Dragonshrine, just east of Agmar's Hammer.",c="葛拉克大使派你来的？\n\n如果你再见到他的话，请向他说我非常感激他的协助。我们有太多的战线要维持了。",cEN="Ambassador Golluck sent you?\n\nIf you talk to him again, please let him know that we are very appreciative of his aid. We are fighting battles on far too many fronts."}
Q[12462]={d="沿着台阶往下走，就是通往被诅咒的地宫的大门：那里聚集着数都数不清的天灾军团士兵，而且他们的数量还在不断增长。我们费尽心思收集到的情报表明，天灾军团的两名通灵领主正在前两座地穴里努力制造新的士兵。在我们攻入塞尔赞所在的核心密室之前，必须除掉这两个家伙和他们手下的天灾军团渣滓。\n\n进入暮冬陵园，杀死通灵领主、纳克萨玛斯恐怖卫士和纳克萨玛斯之影。",dEN="Just down the steps lies the gateway to damnation: Scourge as far as the eye can see and getting thicker with each passing moment. What little intelligence we've been able to gather indicates that two Scourge necrolords are furiously working at emptying the first two crypts down below. Before we can breach the inner chamber to Thel'zan, we'll need to take care of those two clowns and their Naxxramas cronies.\n\nGo down into the mausoleum and take out the necrolords and the Naxxramas dreadguards and shades.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵墓的约德·\"灾星\"·冰须要你杀死死灵领主克萨维乌斯、死灵领主荷鲁斯和 15 名纳克萨玛斯天灾成员。|n",oEN="Yord \"Calamity\" Icebeard at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to kill Necrolord X'avius, Necrolord Horus, and 15 Naxxramas Scourge.",p="你搞定了吗？",pEN="Did you break yourself off a piece?",c="这样应该替阿姆博争取了一点处理事情的时间。",cEN="That oughta buy Ambo a little bit of time to get things situated."}
Q[12463]={d="有传言说天灾军团挖了一条隧道，把陵墓的防腐处理室与那些巨大的墓穴连接起来，如今塞尔赞和他的爪牙已经把这些墓穴挖开了。我最近派了我最好的盗贼普兰德比尔德去寻找答案，但还没有他的消息。要是我是个爱打赌的人，我会说他已经完蛋了。\n\n我要你走下那些台阶，直接穿过防腐处理室，找到普兰德比尔德。不管他是死是活，他都会有答案。|n",dEN="There's been talk of a tunnel dug by Scourge that connects the embalming chambers of the mausoleum with the large crypts, now unearthed by Thel'zan and his minions. I recently sent my best rogue, Plunderbeard, in search of answers, but have yet to hear back from him. If I were a betting man I'd wager that he's a goner.\n\nI want you to go down those steps and head straight through the embalming chamber and look for Plunderbeard. Dead or alive, he'll have answers.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什要你寻找普兰比尔德的下落。",oEN="Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight wants you to find Plunderbeard.",c="<你在普兰德比尔德的尸体上发现了一本日记。>\n\n第一条：\n\n他们拖着尸体穿过隧道送到防腐处理室做实验。这座陵墓里的供应无穷无尽。凡不能被复活的，就被做成某种骨制构造体。\n\n第二条：\n\n我担心这个巫妖，塞尔赞，藏着黑暗的秘密。他是谁？他曾经……是我们中的一员吗？\n\n第三条：我发现了巫妖的命匣所在。它……\n\n<其余的纸页都被撕掉了。>",cEN="<You discover a journal on Plunderbeard's corpse.>\n\nEntry One:\n\nThey drag corpses through the tunnel to the embalming room for experimentation. There is an endless supply in this mausoleum. Whatever cannot be reanimated is turned into a bone construct of one kind or another.\n\nEntry Two:\n\nI fear that this lich, Thel'zan, hides a dark secret. Who is he? Was he once... one of us?\n\nEntry Three: I have discovered the location of the lich's phylactery. It is...\n\n<The rest of the pages are torn out.>"}
Q[12464]={d="我的老对手，阿比迪斯将军也来到了诺森德。\n\n她在我们对提尔之手的进攻中逃了出来，带着一小队残兵向北逃窜，在这里的南部创建了新壁炉谷。\n\n虽然他们对付天灾军团也很积极，但阿比迪斯太狡猾了，我们不能让这样的敌人继续活着。相信我，如果我们不干掉她，她的剑会在尘埃落定前架上我们的脖子。\n\n所以我们要干掉他们的首领，然后再做自己的事。把她的徽记给我带来。",dEN="My old enemy, High General Abbendis, has come to Northrend.\n\nSomehow she survived the attacks upon Tyr's Hand and brought a small force north. They've established New Hearthglen to the south.\n\nWhile they could prove useful in fighting the Scourge, Abbendis herself is far too shrewd an opponent to let live. Trust me, if we let them stand, she will be at our throats before the dust settles.\n\nSo, we'll deprive them of their leadership and go about our business. Bring me her head as proof.",o="把阿比迪斯将军的徽记交给暮冬要塞的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者。",oEN="Deliver The High General's Head to Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Wintergarde Keep.",p="那么，任务完成了？",pEN="It is done then?",c="对付阿比迪斯是个不幸，但必要的任务。很久很久以前，我曾想象过和她一起并肩作战的可能性。\n\n<指挥官的声音渐止，沉浸在思绪中片刻，然后才继续说。>\n\n我有点在意你口中的这个海军上将。你说的是巴瑞恩·韦斯温？我不敢相信他竟然还活着。他一定年纪很大了。不过，我们晚点再来对付他。\n\n现在，我想你赢得了奖赏和休息时间。",cEN="An unfortunate, but necessary action that we had to take in dealing with Abbendis. In another lifetime, I think I could have imagined fighting side-by-side with her.\n\n<The commander's voice trails off as he reflects a moment before proceeding.>\n\nI'm a little concerned about this grand admiral you describe. Barean Westwind you say? I can't believe that he's still alive. He must be ancient. We'll have to deal with him later, however.\n\nIn the meantime, I think you've earned a reward and a little R & R."}
Q[12465]={d="看来必须找到日记中缺失的书页。袭击普兰比尔德的家伙或许就躲在隧道另一侧的房间中。一定是他们撕掉了后面的书页！\n\n一旦你找到缺失的书页，就把它们交给暮冬陵园入口处的阿姆博·卡什。",dEN="Whatever was written on the remaining pages of Plunderbeard's journal must be recovered. Search the chambers located on the other side of this tunnel for Plunderbeard's assailants. They must be the ones who tore the journal apart!\n\nShould you recover the missing pages, return them to Ambo Cash at the entrance of the Wintergarde Mausoleum.",o="将普兰比尔德的日记的第4页、第5页、第6页和第7页交给龙骨荒野暮冬陵园的阿姆博·卡什。",oEN="Recover Page 4 of Plunderbeard's Journal, Page 5 of Plunderbeard's Journal, Page 6 of Plunderbeard's Journal, and Page 7 of Plunderbeard's Journal and return them to Ambo Cash at the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight.",p="我当然不觉得自己像个赢家……",pEN="I certainly don't feel like a winner...",c="<阿姆博读完恢复完本的日记。>\n\n有些好消息，也有些坏消息。你想先听哪一个？\n\n啊，该死的，干嘛给你选呢？好消息是：如果我们能弄到塞尔赞的护命匣，我们就能摧毁他；坏消息是：护命匣是在一条相当大的冰霜巨龙身上。",cEN="<Ambo reads through the recovered journal pages.>\n\nThere's some good news and there's some bad news. Which do you want first?\n\nAh hell, why give you a choice? The good news is that if we can get Thel'zan's phylactery, we can destroy him. The bad news is that the phylactery is on a rather large frostwyrm."}
Q[12466]={d="你必须北上，转至龙骨荒野的第七军团前线。返回暮冬要塞，沿着北边的道路离开要塞。在交叉路口往左转，抵达雪线后继续朝西走，直到你踏上泰坦之路。沿着泰坦之路继续北上就是第七军团前线了。\n\n抵达那里之后，与军团司令泰拉里安谈一谈。他一直盼着你呢。\n\n$n，和你相处很愉快。再见。",dEN="You need to get to the 7th Legion Front in northern Dragonblight. Return to Wintergarde Keep and take the north gate out of town. Keep north until you hit a road. Take a left on that road and follow it until you reach the snowline. Once at the snowline keep heading west until you hit the Path of the Titans. Follow that north and it'll lead you right into the 7th Legion Front.\n\nOnce there, speak with Legion Commander Tyralion. He'll be expecting you.\n\nAnd <name> - it has been a pleasure. Farewell.",o="转至龙骨荒野中部的第七军团前线，向军团司令泰拉里安报到。",oEN="Report to Legion Commander Tyralion at the 7th Legion Front in central Dragonblight.",c="现在你知道为什么这里叫做龙骨荒野了吧。视线所及的范围内到处都遍布着这些野兽的骨骸。\n\n我们大概解决了十几只冰霜巨龙，但它们仍旧满布山野。靠着地上这些骨头，天灾军团有源源不绝的原料可用。\n\n<泰拉里安清了清喉咙。>\n\n我不想用细节烦你，英雄。我们有好好盯着你在找的那条龙。",cEN="Now you know why they call this the Dragon Wastes. Bones of the beasts are strewn about as far as the eye can see.\n\nWe've probably taken down a dozen or more frostwyrms and there's still no end in sight. The Scourge's got fuel for ten-thousand more what with all the bones laying about.\n\n<Tyralion clears his throat.>\n\nI don't mean to bore you with the details, hero. We've got the wyrm you're looking for locked in our sights."}
Q[12467]={d="你的霜龙就在那边。\n\n<泰拉里昂指向西方。>\n\n而且是个大家伙！\n\n当你$g准备好:准备好;战斗时，去和\"诱饵龙\"谈谈。他会把她\"引\"来。等冰暴靠近到足够距离，我们就把它锁在地上，了结它！希望有你的帮助，我们能干掉它，让你拿到那件命匣。\n\n拿到命匣之后，回到暮冬要塞，向高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩报到。他一直在为与塞尔赞的最终对决做准备。",dEN="Your frostwyrm is out there.\n\n<Tyralion points west.>\n\nAnd it's a big one!\n\nWhen you're ready to fight, go speak with \"Wyrmbait.\" He'll \"fetch\" her. Once Icestorm is close enough we'll chain her to the ground and finish her off! Hopefully, with your help, we'll be able to take her down and get you that phylactery.\n\nOnce you've got the phylactery, return to Wintergarde Keep and report to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane. He's been making preparations for the final showdown with Thel'zan.",o="从冰暴身上取回塞尔赞的命匣，把它交给暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。|n",oEN="Recover Thel'zan's Phylactery from Icestorm and return it to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep.",p="你拿到塞尔赞的护命匣了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered Thel'zan's phylactery?",c="塞尔赞那个混蛋害我们失去了很多好士兵。我真希望当你在他面前粉碎他的护命匣，终结他的性命的时候我能够在场。",cEN="We've lost so many good soldiers to that monster, Thel'zan. I wish I could be there to see you crush his phylactery in front of him and end his existence."}
Q[12468]={d="部落就是一部宏伟的战争机器，而你只是其中的一颗小齿轮。\n\n我在确保着这部机器有足够的燃料供应。如果我失败了，那么机器就会发生故障。\n\n木材，矿石，水……我们需要这里的一切。当然联盟也一样。\n\n在我们能够对抗这些人类垃圾之前，必须得巩固我们对西部本地的控制。\n\n去跟纳兹格利姆中士谈谈消灭沃德伦的维库人的事情，然后——如果你能成功完成任务的话——我们会指派更多的任务给你。",dEN="The Horde is a magnificent war machine and you are nothing but a cog.\n\nI am in charge of securing fuel for this machine. If I fail, the machine fails.\n\nLumber, ore, water... it's all here and we want it. And so does the Alliance.\n\nBefore we can move against the human scum, we need to solidify our control over the western region.\n\nSpeak to Sergeant Nazgrim about eradicating the vrykul in Voldrune and then maybe - if you turn out to not be a complete failure - we'll send you on further tasks.",o="与征服堡的纳兹格利姆中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Sergeant Nazgrim in Conquest Hold.",c="所以说克雷娜派你来找我？她一定不是很喜欢你，不过，她又喜欢过谁呢？\n\n进攻这个维库人据点会是个很难很难的工作。",cEN="So Krenna sent you to me? She must've not liked you very much, but then again who does she like?\n\nCracking this vrykul outpost is going to be a tough, tough job."}
Q[12469]={d="经过进一步的调查，那个地精似乎是想要穿越荒地，把一大堆炸药运过去。半埋在附近雪地里的鹰身人羽毛让我们可以猜想他遇到了怎样的悲惨命运。\n\n那地精应该是从东面的某个地方出发，把炸药运向天灾之门。最谨慎的做法就是沿着山脊回到东面，向寄件人通报他们的送货员的遭遇。",dEN="Upon closer examination, the goblin appears to have been running a pack full of explosives across the wastes for delivery. The harpy feathers half-buried in the snow nearby suggest how he met his ill fate.\n\nIt appears that the goblin was bringing the explosives towards the Wrath Gate from somewhere to the east. It seems most prudent to follow the ridge back to the east and inform the sender of their runner's fate.",o="沿着山脊向东面走，将炸药包交给龙骨荒野北部诺兹拉斯哨站的辛克。",oEN="Follow the ridge to the east and deliver the pack of explosives to Xink at Nozzlerust Post in northern Dragonblight.",p="你好啊！",pEN="Hello there!",c="啊？！又损失了一个人，唉，鹰身人真的是越来越烦。\n\n不过无论如何！工作得完成才行。帮个忙怎么样？",cEN="Hah! We lost another one, eh? Those harpies are becoming a real nuisance.\n\nNo matter! There's work to be done. Lend a hand around here, will ya?"}
Q[12470]={d="东北方的青铜巨龙圣地周围的时间风暴会阻止任何永生者进入其中。\n\n永恒之龙正在里面和守卫战斗，试图夺取巨龙圣地的控制权。我们必须利用这个机会获取一些情报。\n\n你不是永生者，因此你可以进入巨龙圣地并使用永恒沙漏。你要保护好这个沙漏，直到永恒之龙的首领显身。\n\n你要小心，永恒之龙会试图阻止你！",dEN="A time storm at the Bronze Dragonshrine to the northeast is keeping immortals from entering.\n\nThe Infinite Dragonflight are in a fight inside with the defenders to wrest control of the dragonshrine. We must take this opportunity to gain information.\n\nYou are not immortal. You can cross into the dragonshrine and use the Hourglass of Eternity. Protect the hourglass for long enough and the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight should be revealed.\n\nBe warned, the Infinite Dragonflight will try to stop you!",o="克罗米要你进入青铜巨龙圣地，将永恒沙漏放在地上。\n\n保护沙漏，直到你获得克罗米想要的情报。完成任务后返回龙眠神殿顶层向她复命。",oEN="Chromie, at the top of Wyrmrest Temple, has asked you to travel to the Bronze Dragonshrine. Once inside, place the Hourglass of Eternity on the ground.\n\nProtect the hourglass for as long as it lasts and then return to her with whatever information you gain.",p="你带来了什么消息？青铜巨龙圣地中发生了什么事情？\n\n你发现永恒之龙的领导者是谁了吗？",pEN="What news do you bring? What happened at the Bronze Dragonshrine?\n\nDid you find out who the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight is?",c="你见到诺兹多姆了？这完全说不通。\n\n<克罗米思忖了一会儿你说的话。>\n\n其实，这是大好消息！我们完全不知道时间之王去了哪里、去了何时。我们只知道他消失去处理非常重要的事务了。\n\n所以，虽然无限龙军团的首领身份仍未揭晓，但你已经发现诺兹多姆还活着，而且正在反击他们！\n\n谢谢你，<name>。我们很快就会再见！",cEN="You saw Nozdormu? That doesn't make any sense.\n\n<Chromie thinks a moment about what you've said.>\n\nActually, that's great news! We had no idea of where or when the Lord of Time had gone to. We just knew that he had disappeared to deal with very important matters.\n\nSo, even though the leader of the Infinite Dragonflight wasn't revealed, you've discovered that Nozdormu is alive and well, and fighting back against them!\n\nThank you, <name>. I'll be seeing you soon!"}
Q[12471]={d="$n，谢谢你救了我。这帮克瓦迪尔的禽兽！\n\n他们强迫我们与其它囚犯角斗，并以此为乐。还不如将我们一刀捅死算了！\n\n年轻的卡鲁克还活着，我见过他。请转告他，他的父亲战斗到了生命的最后一刻。",dEN="I thank you for saving me, <name>. The kvaldir are animals!\n\nThey made us fight the other prisoners. It would've been more merciful to just kill us all.\n\nThe youngling Karuk is still alive -- I noticed him arrive here. Tell him his father fought until the end.",o="将海象人囚犯的情况告诉卡鲁克。",oEN="Speak to Karuk about the Captured Tuskarr Prisoner.",c="我感谢你，<name>。你向我的氏族展现了极大的善意。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. You've shown a great deal of goodwill towards my clan."}
Q[12472]={d="非常感谢你的义举，弗塔根大人已经下令对塞尔赞发动全面攻击了。第七军团已经开进了陵园的召唤大厅，现在正驻扎在一条仿佛通往地狱的走廊外。现在就缺你一个了。\n\n带着这只护命匣去暮冬陵园那里，向军团司令尤瑞克报到吧。\n\n要塞外面有一条天灾军团挖出的隧道，你可以从那里抄近路。现在就去，$n！带领我们走向胜利吧！",dEN="Thanks to your heroics, Lord Fordragon has given the command to launch a full assault against Thel'zan. 7th Legion have made their way into the summoning chamber of the mausoleum and located what appears to be a gateway to hell. The only piece that's missing now is you.\n\nTake the phylactery and report to Legion Commander Yorik inside the Wintergarde Mausoleum.\n\nThere is a tunnel that the Scourge dug out just outside the keep that you can take to get to Yorik quickly. Go now, <name>! Lead us to victory!",o="带着塞尔赞的护命匣转至龙骨荒野的暮冬陵园，向军团司令尤瑞克报到。",oEN="Take Thel'zan's Phylactery to Legion Commander Yorik inside the Wintergarde Mausoleum in Dragonblight.",p="<尤里克松了一口气。>\n\n我们还以为你不会出现了，<name>。",pEN="<Yorik lets out a sigh of relief.>\n\nWe thought you might not show up, <name>.",c="等你准备好以后，我会将护命匣放在门前召唤塞尔赞出来。",cEN="When you're ready I'll place the phylactery out in front of the gateway and call forth Thel'zan."}
Q[12473]={d="每个好故事都有开头和结尾，$n。虽然你的故事远未结束，但如果它还没有变成传说，那我真是见鬼了！等这一切结束，无论我们遭遇什么，你在暮冬要塞所做的一切都会被传颂多年。\n\n现在，$g朋友:朋友;，你什么时候说一声，我就用命匣把塞尔赞从他的藏身处引出来。\n\n如果我们成功了，就把胜利的消息报告给暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。",dEN="Every good story has a beginning and an ending, <name>. While your story is far from over, I'll be damned if it's not already turning out to be the stuff of legend! No matter what happens to us when this is all over, what you've done at Wintergarde will be a tale told for years to come.\n\nNow, ally, when you are ready I will use the phylactery to coax Thel'zan out of hiding.\n\nShould we somehow succeed, report the victory to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep.",o="击败塞尔赞，然后转至龙骨荒野的暮冬要塞，向高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩报告。",oEN="Defeat Thel'zan the Duskbringer and report to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",c="暮冬要塞因为你而得救了，<name>。想到一个<男人/女人>竟能如此迅速地扭转战局，大多数人难以理解；然而我们就在这里——胜利了！你重建了这些人的信心，也赢得了上级军官的尊敬。\n\n<哈尔弗敬礼。>\n\n弗塔根大王已经回到安格拉萨，为摧毁愤怒之门做准备，并请求你前去与他会合！这份工作我推荐不出更好的士兵了，<name>。",cEN="Wintergarde is saved because of you, <name>. To think that one <man/woman> could so swiftly turn the tides of battle is hard for most to comprehend; yet here we are - victorious! You have managed to restore the faith of these people and earned the respect of your commanding officers.\n\n<Halford salutes.>\n\nLord Fordragon has returned to Angrathar to prepare our forces for the destruction of the Wrathgate and has requested that you join him! I couldn't recommend a better soldier for the job, <name>."}
Q[12474]={d="随着纳克萨玛斯战争机器的哑火，现在你要去天灾之门安加萨援助我们的部队。我们的指挥部——弗塔根要塞就坐落在龙骨荒野北部的群山环抱之中。弗塔根大人正在那里等着你！立刻就动身吧，$n！\n\n从镇子的北门出去，向西北方向进发。\n\n圣光与你同在！",dEN="With the Naxxramas war machine stopped dead in its tracks the time has come for you to help our forces at Angrathar, the Wrathgate. Nestled against the mountain in northern Dragonblight is our base of operations, Fordragon Hold. It is there that Lord Fordragon awaits your arrival! Go now, <name>!\n\nTake the north gate out of town and travel north by northwest until you arrive at your destination.\n\nLight protect you!",o="前往龙骨荒野的弗塔根要塞，与大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根交谈。|n",oEN="Venture to Fordragon Hold in Dragonblight and speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.",c="这项嘉奖只授予那些以联盟之名超越职责要求的人。我亲手颁发这枚勋章的次数一只手都数得过来，<name>，而没有人比你更配得上它！恭喜你！\n\n现在，让我们看看愤怒之门。它看着眼熟吗？应该眼熟。你在暮冬矿洞找到的那种奇怪矿石，正是愤怒之门的构成材料。我们会找到它的弱点并公之于众！不过首先……",cEN="This commendation is only given to those that have gone above and beyond the call of duty in the name of the Alliance. I could count the number of times I've handed this one out on one hand, <name>, and never has anyone been more deserving than you! Congratulations!\n\nNow, let us look upon the Wrathgate. Does it look familiar? It should. That strange ore you found at the Wintergarde Mine is exactly what the Wrathgate is made from. We will find its weakness and expose it for all to see! First, though..."}
Q[12475]={d="自从在遗忘海岸叛变之后，阿尔萨斯王子就开始寻找霜之哀伤，而穆拉丁一直陪着他。藏有霜之哀伤的洞穴会不会就在附近呢？它隐藏着怎样的秘密呢？虽然水晶球不能给我答案，但它确实告诉了我一些信息。\n\n在暮冬要塞的东北方有一座血色先锋军的堡垒，那里面的某处收藏着一份地图。水晶球告诉我，这份地图会给我们提供很大的帮助。\n\n去把它拿来！",dEN="After the betrayal at the Forgotten Shore, Prince Arthas - with Muradin in tow - began his quest for Frostmourne. Could the location of the cavern where Frostmourne was found be near? What secrets could it hold? While the orb has no answers for these questions, it does show me something.\n\nTo the northeast of Wintergarde Keep is an outpost built by the Scarlet Onslaught. Somewhere within that outpost is a map. The orb tells me that this map will be of great use to us.\n\nRetrieve it!",o="暮冬要塞的幻象师瑟里格要你去找到先锋军地图。",oEN="Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to find the Onslaught Map and return it to him.",p="你找到先锋军地图了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the Onslaught map?",c="一个洞窟？有可能吗？这没有任何关联性啊！",cEN="A cave? Could it be? There can be no other correlation!"}
Q[12476]={d="暮冬要塞东北方有一个新建的营地，是血色十字军搭建的——或者不如说是血色先锋军，他们现在这样自称。虽然我们不确定他们为何来到诺森德，但他们肯定和以前一样危险。事实上，从昨晚到现在，血色先锋军已经杀死了我们十二名士兵。必须给他们一个教训，$n。\n\n前往先锋军营地，削减他们的人数。 |n",dEN="To the northeast of Wintergarde Keep is a newly built encampment, set up by the Scarlet Crusade - or rather - the Scarlet Onslaught as they now call themselves. While we are unsure as to why they are in Northrend, they are certainly no less dangerous than they were before. As of last night the Scarlet Onslaught has killed twelve of our soldiers. They must be taught a lesson, <name>.\n\nGo to Onslaught Base Camp and thin them out.",o="暮冬要塞的指挥官莱诺尔·风矛要你转至先锋军营地，消灭20个血色先锋军成员。",oEN="Commander Lynore Windstryke at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to kill 20 Scarlet Onslaught at the Onslaught Base Camp.",p="清剿先锋军营地，<name>。",pEN="Clear out the Onslaught Base Camp, <name>.",c="希望对这些先锋军来说，我们的表达的消息已经很清楚了。我希望这些攻击行动足以让他们怀疑是否要继续加入那个组织。",cEN="Hopefully the message is now clear to the Onslaught. I hope it was enough of a beating to make them doubt their affiliations."}
Q[12477]={d="\"救赎之路\"，听说过吗？据说那是一本记载着血色先锋军高阶将军阿比迪斯预言式呓语的日志。在那本书里可以找到血色狂热者的动机和目标——更别提一大堆疯言疯语。\n\n前往暮冬要塞东北方的先锋军营地，从一名先锋军士兵身上取回一本《救赎之路》。\"\"",dEN="\"The Path of Redemption,\" ever heard of it? It is allegedly a journal that holds the prophetic ramblings of High General Abbendis of the Scarlet Onslaught. Within that book can be found the motivations and goals of the Scarlet zealots - not to mention a whole lot of insanity.\n\nVenture to Onslaught Base Camp, northeast of Wintergarde Keep, and recover a copy of \"The Path of Redemption\" from one of the Onslaught soldiers.",o="把《救赎之路》交还给龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的高级指挥官哈尔弗·维姆班恩。\"\"",oEN="Return \"The Path of Redemption\" to High Commander Halford Wyrmbane at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight.",p="你找到书了吗？",pEN="Did you find a copy?",c="<哈尔弗读着日记。>\n\n阿比迪斯已经彻底疯了。现在圣光跟她说话了？\n\n尽管这些呓语荒谬可笑，但这本日记让我们得以窥见血色狂热者的内心世界，这是前所未有的。这是个重大发现，<name>。弗塔根大王会很高兴的。",cEN="<Halford reads the journal.>\n\nAbbendis has gone off the deep end. The Light speaks to her now?\n\nDespite the inane ramblings, this journal gives us a never before seen look into the mind of the Scarlet zealots. This was a great find, <name>. Lord Fordragon will be pleased."}
Q[12478]={d="他们把这处山洞称为霜之哀伤洞穴。我们还不知道为什么血色先锋军会对此感兴趣，但据我们所知，该地区周围都有重兵把守。无论如何，我们必须勇往直前！\n\n带着这颗水晶球从镇子北方出去，然后转至西北方的血色哨站。你要进入洞穴并一直杀到最深处去。到那里以后，使用水晶球，然后回来把你的发现都告诉我。",dEN="They have labeled the cave as Frostmourne Cavern. Why the Scarlet Onslaught is interested in such things is unknown, but by the look of things, the area surrounding the cave is heavily guarded. Nonetheless, we must proceed!\n\nTake this scrying orb and travel north out of town and then northwest towards Scarlet Point. Make your way into the cave and battle your way to the bottom. Once there, use the orb. Return here with what you discover.",o="龙骨荒野暮冬要塞的幻象师瑟里格要你在霜之哀伤洞穴深处使用瑟里格的占卜宝珠，解开尘封的秘密！",oEN="Zelig the Visionary at Wintergarde Keep in Dragonblight wants you to use Zelig's Scrying Orb at the bottom of Frostmourne Cavern. Unlock the secrets of the past!",p="搜过霜之哀伤洞窟了吗？",pEN="Have you searched Frostmourne Cavern?",c="穆拉丁还活着？怎么可能？我得马上通知铜须国王！\n\n我得再检查宝珠，一定还有其它的情报——就在某处！",cEN="Muradin lives? Could it be? I must nofity King Bronzebeard at once!\n\nI need to consult the orb. There must be more information - somewhere!"}
Q[12481]={d="维库人在这事上确实处理得很聪明，幸好我还有其它办法。\n\n他们的首领布约恩非常暴躁。我们用他们的语言拼出了几句脏话，好像提到了他的母亲和大型家畜之类的……我们自己也不是很明白。\n\n把这张纸上内容给他念一念。一旦他追过来，你就把他引到这里来。我们绝对不能让他再活着回去。",dEN="The vrykul are being clever about this. Fortunately I've a trick up my sleeve.\n\nThis leader of theirs, Bjorn, is a real hothead. We've pieced together enough of their language to fashion what we think is a good insult. Something involving his mother and large barnyard animals... we're not quite sure.\n\nTake this piece of paper and read it to him. Once he starts chasing you, lure him back here. We'll make sure he doesn't make it out alive.",o="在拜尔海姆对布约恩·哈古德森朗读维库人的脏话，然后把他引到林德尔的伏击点，帮助林德尔杀了他。",oEN="Read the Vrykul Insult to Bjorn Halgurdsson in Baleheim, then lead him back to Lydell's Ambush and help slay him.",p="刺杀工作其实并不像看起来的那样迷人。",pEN="Assassination work isn't as glamorous as it's made out to be.",c="干的好。那个可怜的呆子完全没发现。",cEN="Nice work. That poor sap never saw it coming."}
Q[12482]={d="我们迫切希望复仇港派来增援，帮助我们对抗尼弗莱瓦。如果我们能够尽早夺得那里的控制权，就能在与联盟的对抗中取得巨大的优势。\n\n去尼弗莱瓦看看你能做点什么吧。",dEN="We await reinforcements from Vengeance Landing to move against Nifflevar. If we were to capture it earlier, though, it would provide us with a great advantage over the Alliance.\n\nHead into town and see if you can put a dent in their numbers.",o="游侠队长艾蕾尔要你转至尼弗莱瓦，杀死5名掠龙战士、4名掠龙符文法师和4条掠龙猎犬。",oEN="Ranger Captain Areiel wants you to go to Nifflevar and slay 5 Dragonflayer Warriors, 4 Dragonflayer Rune-Seers and 4 Dragonflayer Hunting Hounds.",p="你好，<name>。",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="干得太出色了，<name>。等我们来自复仇港的部队抵达，就能处理掉任何残留的维库人了。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. When our forces from Vengeance Landing arrive, we'll be able to take care of any vrykul that are left."}
Q[12483]={d="嘿，你既然在这儿，不如帮老普里格蒙做点小事怎么样？我有个朋友能炖一手好汤——你从没尝过的那种！\n\n不过他还需要几样这附近就有的材料。它们在西南方的废墟里，还有正北边那个营地里。\n\n怎么样，$g伙计:小姑娘;？",dEN="Say, while yer here, how bout ya help ol' Prigmon with a little chore? I got a friend who can make a mean stew - one like ya never tasted before!\n\nThere be a few ingredients found in these parts that he be needin'. They be in ruins to the southwest and the camp just north o' here.\n\nWhatd'ya say, mon?",o="岩石之泉的普雷蒙要你在达克辛废墟中收集5份幽光雪菇和5份冰蛇之眼，再到塞布哈拉克去收集5份甜根茎。",oEN="Prigmon in Granite Springs wants you to collect 5 Shimmering Snowcaps and 5 Ice Serpent Eyes from Drak'Zin Ruins and 5 Sweetroot from Zeb'Halak.",p="你给老普里格蒙弄到那些材料了吗，<name>？",pEN="You get those ingredients for 'ol Prigmon, <name>?",c="哦，老兄——炖幽光雪菇！我好像都尝到它的味道了……",cEN="Oh, mon - shimmercap stew! I can almost taste it already...."}
Q[12484]={d="呃。\n\n要把这些可怜的巨魔清理掉让我很心疼，但不如我的背疼！\n\n帮老普雷蒙一个忙，把这拖到马克那里去。\n\n如果我们不把它们清理掉，它们很快又会变得活蹦乱跳了。",dEN="Ugh.\n\nWrappin' up these unfortunate trolls be makin' my heart ache, but not so much as my back!\n\nHelp ol' Prigmon out and haul one of these carcasses over to Mack.\n\nIf we don't burn 'em they be walkin' again in no time.",o="岩石之泉的普雷蒙要你把一具僵化的巨魔尸体拖到马克·菲尔森那里，并把它用高温处理掉。",oEN="Prigmon at Granite Springs wants you to bring a Mummified Troll Carcass to Mack Fearsen and place it in the fire.",p="你那儿是什么东西，<race>？",pEN="Whatcha got there, <race>?",c="没什么比看着那些天灾烧起来更痛快的了……\n\n我为此写了首小曲。想听听吗？开始了……",cEN="Nothin' better than watchin' them shcourge burn... .\n\nWrote a little shong about it. Wanna hear it? Here goes...."}
Q[12486]={d="你感觉到了吗？\n\n<萨乌拉诺克突然开始胡乱地在自己的胸口上乱抓，直到抓出了一道道血痕。>\n\n我刚感觉到……在我的老朋友格雷姆沃克身上发生了一些可怕的事情。\n\n他的一个学生与他一起转至北方，去帮助酋长在索拉查盆地的边缘创建前哨站。\n\n她名叫斯纳尔芬，是个灵语者。\n\n或许她知道发生了些什么事情，至少她能帮你找出原因。",dEN="Did you feel it?\n\n<Sauranok momentarily clutches his chest in confusion. His hand comes away trailing red-hot steam.>\n\nSomething terrible has happened to my old friend, Farseer Grimwalker. I just sensed it.\n\nHe had a pupil that he took with him when he went north. They were going to help the overlord establish an outpost on the edge of Sholazar Basin.\n\nHer name is Snarlfang. She is a spirit talker.\n\nPerhaps she will know what happened. Or, at least, she can help you to find out.",o="与博古洛克前哨站的灵语者斯纳尔芬谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Spirit Talker Snarlfang at Bor'gorok Outpost.",c="秘法师知道了？你说他感觉到有可怕的事情发生在先知厉行者身上？\n\n喔，这正是我所害怕的！",cEN="The mystic knows? You say he felt that something horrible happened to Farseer Grimwalker?\n\nIt is as I feared!"}
Q[12487]={d="我收到了一封来自灰熊丘陵的寻求帮助的信，所以我决定派你去见见征服者克雷娜。\n\n<高级执行官挥舞着一捆羊皮纸，似乎他并不在乎上面写了些什么。>\n\n她正试图保护所有天然资源之类的东西。不过在她周围的时候要小心点，据说即使是对待兽人，她也是毫不客气。\n\n沿着这条路向东走，然后转向东南。跨过龙脊草河上的桥之后，从常青商栈往东走就到了。",dEN="I've received a request for help from our base in the Grizzly Hills. I'm sending you to see Conqueror Krenna.\n\n<The high executor waves a sheaf of parchment in the air as if he could care less what is written on it.>\n\nShe's attempting to secure all of the natural resources or somesuch. Just watch your back around her. The word is that she's aggressive even for an orc.\n\nFollow the road east and then southeast. Cross the bridge at the Dragonspine Tributary and go east from the Evergreen Trading Post.",o="转至灰熊丘陵的征服堡，向征服者克雷娜介绍你自己。",oEN="Present yourself to Conqueror Krenna at Conquest Hold in the Grizzly Hills.",c="你是谁？\n\n告诉我为什么我不该当场把你劈成两半？",cEN="Who are you?\n\nTell me why I shouldn't split you in two where you stand!"}
Q[12488]={d="幸运的是，在这封请求信交到阿格玛大王手上之前，我从高级执行官乌洛斯这里把它截获了下来。乌洛斯在想什么？\n\n<中士把他手里的信件撕得粉碎。>\n\n$C，去看看高级执行官需要些什么。\n\n沿着这条路往东，穿过巨龙废土。你可以在东南边找到一条走出荒地的道路，亡灵城镇怨毒镇就矗立在山脉的南面。",dEN="It's a good thing that I intercepted this request from High Executor Wroth before it got to Overlord Agmar. What is Wroth thinking?\n\n<The sergeant rips up the letter that he's holding.>\n\n<class>, go see what it is that the high executor wants.\n\nFollow the road east and pass through The Dragon Wastes. You'll find a path leading up out of the wastes on the southeast side, and the Forsaken town, Venomspite, will stand before you on the south side of the mountain.",o="与龙骨荒野怨毒镇的高级执行官乌洛斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with High Executor Wroth at Venomspite in Dragonblight.",c="阿格玛之锤那边派你来的？正是时候！\n\n不，我不需要帮忙。我只是腾不出人手了，但你刚好派得上用场。",cEN="You were sent from Agmar's Hammer? It's about time!\n\nNo, the help is not for me. I simply have no one else to spare, but you'll do."}
Q[12489]={d="那么，你是从哪儿来的？该不会是那些白痴大法师把你派到这里来的吧？\n\n听我说，$g小子:小丫头，你现在还没缺胳膊少腿的可真是个奇迹，绝对的奇迹！\n\n这片丛林是块非常非常危险的地方，特别是在风险投资公司掺和进来以后。\n\n不如你去见见我们老大吧，他会安排你的工作的。营地就在西北边道路的尽头。\n\n还不快去！",dEN="So, where did you come from? I don't suppose that fool of an archmage sent you, too?\n\nYou're lucky to be in one piece, <laddie/lass>! They nearly blew you up!\n\nThe jungle here's a darned dangerous place, 'specially with the Venture Company about.\n\nGit you! Go see the boss... he'll sort you out. The camp's at the end of that path to the northwest.\n\nNow, git!",o="沿着西北方的道路转至蒙特提到的营地。",oEN="Follow the path to the northwest to reach the camp that Monte mentioned.",c="哈！在丛林深处遇到一个完全陌生的人可不常见。你是那些被派来\"阻止我和我邪恶行径\"的德鲁伊走狗之一吗？是啊，祝你好运！\n\n<Hemet suelta una carcajada y da una palmada a su arma>\n\n<赫米特放声大笑，拍了拍他的枪>\n\n我想也不是！等我们收拾完那些风险投资公司的狗东西，非常欢迎你加入我们的狩猎。到时候够大家分的。",cEN="Hah! It's not often you run into a complete stranger in the middle of the jungle.\n\nYou one those druid lackeys sent to \"stop me and my evil ways?\" Yeah, good luck with that one!\n\n<Hemet lets out a hearty laugh and pats his gun.>\n\nDidn't think so! You're more than welcome to join us in the hunt, soon as we've dealt with those Venture Company dogs. There'll be plenty to go around."}
Q[12491]={d="断气的科林·烈酒手中还紧紧抓着一只小酒桶。这大概就是他所酿造的臭名昭着的烈酒吧！",dEN="Coren Direbrew's corpse clutched this small cask tightly to its gut. This must be his infamous Dire Brew!",o="将科林的烈酒交给铁炉堡附近美酒节营地的埃菲库格·铁桶。",oEN="Give Direbrew's Dire Brew to Ipfelkofer Ironkeg at the Brewfest camp near Ironforge.",p="<name>，你脸色阴沉。是带来坏消息了吗？",pEN="<name>, your face has a grim set to it. Do you have dire news?",c="这就是寇仁·恐酒的饮料？他急着想要在美酒节提交的酒？哎，官方无法认可这次的提交，不过出于对一位逝去酿酒者的尊敬，也许我会尝一尝……",cEN="This is the Coren Direbrew's drink? The brew he wanted more than anything to submit at Brewfest? Well, officially we can't recognize this submission, but out of respect for a fallen brewer, perhaps I'll have a taste..."}
Q[12492]={d="断气的科林·烈酒手中还紧紧抓着一只小酒桶。这大概就是他所酿造的臭名昭着的烈酒吧！",dEN="Coren Direbrew's corpse clutched this small cask tightly to its gut. This must be his infamous Dire Brew!",o="将科林的烈酒交给奥格瑞玛附近美酒节营地的塔波尔·斯威雷格。",oEN="Give Direbrew's Dire Brew to Tapper Swindlekeg at the Brewfest camp near Orgrimmar.",p="嘿，<name>，你脸上全是黑灰！你去过黑石深渊了？",pEN="Hey <name>, your face is all smudged! Have you been to Blackrock Depths?",c="啊，所以恐酒最后还是提交了他的酒。真是可惜，他得以性命来完成提交……\n\n喔，这个嘛。干杯吧，嗯？",cEN="Ah, so Direbrew finally submitted his brew. What a pity he had to die to do it...\n\nOh, well. Bottoms up, eh?"}
Q[12495]={d="我们对安加萨的进攻让天灾军团乱了阵脚，但仍然没有露出什么破绽。他们派出了冰霜巨龙向我们狂轰滥炸，使得我们在天灾之门不能再前进半步。我们必须阻止冰霜巨龙的攻击，不过在我们解决这些古代巨龙的骨架之前，必须获得他们女王的许可。\n\n去东南方的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨女王。告诉她我们必须这么做，并寻求她的指引。\n\n去吧，$n！",dEN="Our assault against Angrathar has staggered the Scourge, but they remain unrelenting. From overhead they send their frost wyrms to strafe the field of battle, making an advance upon the gate itself impossible. The frost wyrm attacks must be stopped, but before we defile the bones of ancient dragons, we must gain permission from their queen.\n\nTravel southeast to Wyrmrest Temple and seek out Queen Alexstrasza. Tell her what we must do and ask her for guidance.\n\nGo now, <name>!",o="在龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Seek out Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="你来寻求我的指示，凡人。我知道这点，但你知不知道自己在面对什么呢？\n\n<阿莱克丝塔萨指向北方。>\n\n此地的北方是迦拉克隆之墓……它是龙族的先祖。泰坦们就是依照迦拉克隆造出了守护巨龙，我们是不是就不难想象迦拉克隆的力量了？他的体型比所有的守护巨龙加起来还要大！现在试着理解天灾军团在广袤的龙骨荒野所做的一切。\n\n冰霜巨龙——凡人——并不是你最该关心的问题。",cEN="You have come seeking my council, mortal. This I know, but do you know what it is that you face?\n\n<Alexstrasza points northward.>\n\nNorth of here are the dying grounds of Galakrond - progenitor of dragonkind. It is from Galakrond that the Titans created the Aspects. Imagine, then, the power of Galakrond. His size alone was greater than all of the Aspects combined! Now attempt to understand what the Scourge do in the Great Dragonblight.\n\nFrost wyrms, mortal, should be the least of your concerns."}
Q[12496]={d="尽管我知道你很希望能立即消灭在天灾之门顽抗的天灾士兵，但我们必须首先解决掉盘旋在头顶的威胁。如果冰霜巨龙的轰炸不停止，我们就根本不能前进半步。\n\n不过在我们把那些骨头龙给打下来之前，必须先得到他们女王的许可。现在就转至龙族的圣地——龙眠神殿。等你到了那里之后，找到阿莱克丝塔萨女王。\n\n现在就出发吧，$n！向着东南方的龙眠神殿前进！",dEN="Though I know you hunger to destroy the Scourge that stand before us at the Wrath Gate, we must first deal with the threat that looms overhead. Until the strafing assaults of the frost wyrms are halted, we cannot move forward.\n\nBut before we assault the dying grounds of dragons, we must first be granted permission. Venture now to the hallowed halls of dragonkind: Wyrmrest Temple. Once there, seek out Queen Alexstrasza.\n\nRide now, <name>! Southeast, to Wyrmrest!",o="在龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿寻找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Seek out Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="你来寻求我的指示，凡人。我知道这点，但你知不知道自己在面对什么呢？\n\n<阿莱克丝塔萨指向北方。>\n\n此地的北方是迦拉克隆之墓……它是龙族的先祖。泰坦们就是依照迦拉克隆造出了守护巨龙，我们是不是就不难想象迦拉克隆的力量了？他的体型比所有的守护巨龙加起来还要大！现在试着理解天灾军团在广袤的龙骨荒野所做的一切。\n\n冰霜巨龙——凡人——并不是你最该关心的问题。",cEN="You have come seeking my council, mortal. This I know, but do you know what it is that you face?\n\n<Alexstrasza points northward.>\n\nNorth of here are the dying grounds of Galakrond - progenitor of dragonkind. It is from Galakrond that the Titans created the Aspects. Imagine, then, the power of Galakrond. His size alone was greater than all of the Aspects combined! Now attempt to understand what the Scourge do in the Great Dragonblight.\n\nFrost wyrms, mortal, should be the least of your concerns."}
Q[12497]={d="在邪恶之旋的顶端，天灾军团的通灵主宰安提沃克正坐在经他改造过的风暴巨人之王——西亚斯的肩膀上，指挥着亡灵日以继夜地挖掘迦拉克隆的巨大骨架。如果他们成功地复活了迦拉克隆，你们所有的努力都将化为乌有。\n\n虽然我不能调动红龙的全部力量来帮助你，但我会将我的祝福赐予你。出发吧，去和我的总管托拉斯塔萨谈谈。",dEN="Atop the Wicked Coil, the Grand Necrolord of the Scourge, Antiok, sits upon the shoulders of the reconstructed storm giant lord, Thiassi. From there he commands the armies of undead to work day and night to unearth Galakrond's massive bones. Should they succeed in raising Galakrond, all of your efforts will have been for naught.\n\nWhile I cannot call down the full fury of the Red Dragonflight to assist you in your journey, I will grant you my blessing. Go now and speak with my majordomo, Torastrasza.",o="与龙骨荒野龙眠神殿的托拉斯塔萨谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Torastrasza at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight.",c="凡人的勇气总是使我震惊。死亡冰冷地凝视着你们，而你们却起身挑战它！这也是为什么你们这些种族是如此的被深爱着……也被痛恨着。\n\n虽然红龙军团与玛里苟斯的战事胶着，我们还是可以提供一些帮助。",cEN="The bravery of mortals never fails to astound me. Death affixes its cold stare upon you and in return you rise to challenge its assertion! It is why your kind is so loved... and so hated.\n\nEven though the Red Dragonflight is entrenched in a war with Malygos, there is something that we can do to help."}
Q[12498]={d="用这支信标召唤一名龙眠联军征服者。爬上它的背，向北飞到加拉隆安息处。到了那里，命令巨龙消灭那些正在挖掘加拉隆的天灾食腐者。清空该区域后，飞到俯瞰加拉隆安息处的邪恶盘绕，杀死大死灵领主安提沃克，取回他用来控制那些龙的镰刀。\n\n做完这些，回到阿莱克丝塔萨女王那里领取$g英雄:英雄;的奖励！\n\n$n，小心该地区游荡的腐烂风暴巨人！",dEN="Use this beacon to signal a Wyrmrest vanquisher. Climb upon its back and fly north to Galakrond's Rest. Once there, command the dragon to destroy the Scourge scavengers that work to unearth Galakrond. Once the area has been cleansed, fly to the Wicked Coil, overlooking Galakrond's Rest, to destroy Grand Necrolord Antiok and recover the scythe that he uses to control the wyrms.\n\nDo this and return to Queen Alexstrasza for a hero's reward!\n\n<name>, beware the rotting storm giants that wander the area!",o="消灭30个废土挖掘者并夺取安提沃克的镰刀。完成这个任务之后，回到龙眠神殿去找阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Destroy 30 Wastes Scavengers and recover the Scythe of Antiok. Return to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple should you complete this task.",p="在事情还不是太迟之前消灭迦拉克隆之墓的天灾军团！",pEN="Destroy the Scourge at Galakrond's Rest before it is too late!",c="我就知道你会回来，<name>。你为龙眠联军效力，把你的人民从必死之中救了出来。让所有人都知道这件事，并把它记载下来传给后世！",cEN="I knew that you would return, <name>. You have served the Wyrmrest Accord and saved your people from certain death. Let it be known to all and let it be recorded for posterity!"}
Q[12499]={d="安提沃克已被杀死，镰刀也在我们手中，霜龙对你们在安格拉萨部队的袭击将会停止。留在龙骨荒野的那些龙将被猎杀殆尽，它们的骸骨将回归大地。\n\n做最后决战的时刻到了，$n。回到弗塔根要塞，通知大领主弗塔根。|n",dEN="With Antiok slain and the scythe in our possession, the frost wyrm assaults upon your forces at Angrathar will halt. The wyrms that remain in the Dragonblight will be hunted and destroyed, their bones returning to the earth.\n\nThe time to make your final stand is now, <name>. Return to Fordragon Hold and notify Highlord Fordragon.",o="与弗塔根要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根交谈，向他讲述你战胜天灾军团的经过。|n",oEN="Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon at Fordragon Hold and tell him of your victory over the Scourge.",c="记住：你所做的所有事情成就了现在。没有你的努力，我们可能已经被消灭了！现在，当我进入战场并准备终结这一切时，保持警戒！",cEN="Know this: all that you have done has led to this moment. Without your efforts, we would have been finished! Now, stand guard as I take to the field and end this!"}
Q[12500]={d="随着安提沃克被消灭，镰刀也在我们的手中，在安加萨攻击你们的冰霜巨龙也会消停一段时间。龙骨荒野残存的冰霜巨龙将被消灭，他们的骸骨将重归泥土之中。\n\n现在是发动最后一战的时刻了，$n。回到库卡隆先锋营地，向小萨鲁法尔报告吧。",dEN="With Antiok slain and the scythe in our possession, the frost wyrm assaults upon your forces at Angrathar will halt. The wyrms that remain in the Dragonblight will be hunted and destroyed, their bones returning to the earth.\n\nThe time to make your final stand is now, <name>. Return to the Kor'kron Vanguard and notify Saurfang the Younger.",o="回到库卡隆先锋营地，向小萨鲁法尔汇报你对天灾军团取得的胜利。",oEN="Speak with Saurfang the Younger at the Kor'kron Vangaurd and tell him of your victory over the Scourge.",c="我父亲说得对，<name>。他说的一切都应验了——只剩最后一项职责尚未完成。现在我要率领库卡隆前往前线。终结这场战争的时刻到了。巫妖王的暴政今天就结束！\n\n现在接替我的岗位，<name>，替我看守我们的部队。",cEN="My father was right about you, <name>. Everything that he said has come to pass - only one final duty remains unfulfilled. I will now lead the Kor'kron to the front line. The time to end this war is at hand. The Lich King's tyranny ends today!\n\nTake my post now, <name>, and stand guard over our forces."}
Q[12501]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="银色前沿的昆兹指挥官要你拜访银色北伐军的四处岗哨，执行他们上尉的命令，然后回来向他汇报。\n\n布兰登上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在达克索塔，格隆德尔上尉驻扎在达克阿加尔，炼金师芬克尔斯坦驻扎在赫布瓦洛克。",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok.",p="我们的岗哨有什么消息吗，<race>？",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="好吧，<name>，至少你完好无损地回来了。我想这多少还算有点价值……",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12502]={d="听着，$c。我们是银色北伐军。我们的部队会战斗到最后一刻，而且无论环境多么恶劣，我们也不会抱怨。\n\n也就是说，我们在这次的行动中遭受了相当严重的损失。而且这几个月里我们一直在拼命战斗，几乎没有合过眼。无论我们承认与否，这些都会对士气造成打击。\n\n虽然效果可能不是很明显，但能看到我们的旗帜在战场上飘扬，还是会让战士们感到安慰的。拿着这些旗帜，把它们挂到达克索塔的支架上去。",dEN="Listen, <class>. This is the Argent Crusade. Our men will fight to the end and never complain no matter what the conditions.\n\nThat said, we've taken some heavy casualties in this campaign and we've been hitting it hard with little or no sleep for months. That all takes a toll on morale, whether we admit it or not.\n\nIt may not seem like much, but seeing our standard raised over the battlefield is of considerable comfort to a soldier. Take these banners and raise them at the pedestals in Drak'Sotra.",o="布兰顿上尉要你将银色北伐军战旗挂在达克索塔的达卡莱支架上。",oEN="Captain Brandon wants you to place the Argent Crusade Banner in the Drakkari Pedestals at Drak'Sotra.",c="干得好，朋友。\n\n一面旗帜在战场中的效果是很惊人的。\n\n你的下一站是去找鲁伯特上尉。他就驻守在东北边的城墙那。",cEN="Good work, friend.\n\nAmazing what a little of one's colors do for a battleground.\n\nYou'll want to head on over to Captain Rupert next. He's stationed at the wall, just northeast of here."}
Q[12503]={d="尽管我们在祖达克下三分之一地区取得了重大胜利，我们仍然要面对天灾军团的攻势。在这个冰冷地狱里就是这样。\n\n攻击从未停歇，但我的人需要休息。如果你$g愿意:愿意;，可以帮我们增援他们。\n\n下面院子里战斗永无止境。以你所能鼓起的全部热情去那里消灭天灾军团吧，$c。",dEN="Despite our substantial successes in the lower third of Zul'Drak, we must still face the onslaught of the Scourge. Such is the way in this frigid hell.\n\nThe attacks are unrelenting, yet my men need rest. If you are willing, we could use your aid in reinforcing them.\n\nBelow in the courtyard you'll find no end to the fighting. Dispatch the Scourge there with all the zeal you can muster, <class>.",o="指挥官法斯塔夫要你到银色前沿的庭院中去，消灭任意10个天灾军团士兵。",oEN="Commander Falstaav has tasked you with the destruction of any 10 Scourge in the courtyard at The Argent Stand.",p="或许你可以再多杀一点？",pEN="Perhaps you could destroy a few more?",c="非常感谢你对这件事的帮助。如果没有你的努力，我们可能很难抵抗住那些不死生物的进攻。",cEN="Your assistance in this matter is greatly appreciated. Were it not for your efforts, we would have difficulty in holding the unliving back from our steps."}
Q[12504]={d="<中士很快读完了你交给他的命令，皱起了眉。>\n\n你看，$g小伙子:小姐，我是很愿意卷铺盖走人的，但请你到外面去看看。我的人都在战斗。\n\n我跟你说，既然你已经来了，能帮我一个小忙，把我的士兵聚集起来好吗？\n\n告诉他们说，中士要他们立刻回来复命。如果你愿意的话，可以顺便帮帮他们。",dEN="<The sergeant quickly reads through the orders you've handed him, a frown coming over his face.>\n\nLook, <lad /lass>, I'd love to just up and leave, but take a look out there. All of my people are fighting.\n\nTell you what, you've come this far, you think you're up to doing me a small favor? Head out there and round up my soldiers?\n\nTell 'em that the sergeant orders them to report back immediately. Lend them a hand if you will.",o="西莱图斯祭坛的斯塔哈默中士要你和10个银色士兵交谈，让他们回去向他复命。",oEN="Sergeant Stackhammer at the Altar of Sseratus wants you to speak with 10 of his Argent Soldiers and tell them to report back to him.",p="我需要更多的士兵回来回报。",pEN="I'll need more of them to report back in than that.",c="太好了。我们已经集合剩下的人并准备回到银色前沿。\n\n真是丢脸，我们必须这么快就离开这里。我一点都不觉得在这里的工作已经完成了，坦白的说，我觉得祭坛前的先知将会是个大麻烦！",cEN="Alright then. We'll collect up the rest and head back to the stand.\n\nIt's a shame that we have to leave so soon. Doesn't quite feel like the job's done here, and quite frankly, I get the feeling that prophet in front of the altar is going to be big trouble!"}
Q[12505]={d="$C，你是来帮忙的，对吗？我对部署在北方达卡莱祭坛的部队有新的指示。\n\n那地方很容易找，只要沿着大路走就到了。到那边之后就去找斯塔哈默中士。",dEN="<class>, you're here to help, right? I've got new orders for our forces that are currently deployed at the Drakkari altar to the north.\n\nYou can't miss it. Just head straight up the avenue. Sergeant Stackhammer shouldn't be hard to find.",o="指挥官库恩斯要你把调度命令交给西莱图斯祭坛的斯塔哈默中士。",oEN="Commander Kunz has asked you to deliver the New Deployment Orders to Sergeant Stackhammer at the Altar of Sseratus.",p="这里面是什么？",pEN="What's this all about?",c="<矮人中士警惕地打量着你手里的命令。>\n\n这些是给我的新命令吗，<先生/女士>？",cEN="<The dwarf sergeant warily eyes the orders in your hand.>\n\nAre those new orders for me, <mister /miss>?"}
Q[12506]={d="蛇神的祭坛那里有些麻烦。\n\n天灾军团的出现削弱了这片土地，$r。而这也削弱了那些原始神灵。\n\n我们知道那些达卡莱巨魔正在利用这个机会对这些神灵做某种邪恶的事。\n\n我要你充当我的耳目。西莱图斯祭坛就在通往北边的大路尽头。你要从背面潜入祭坛的主建筑里去看一眼。\n\n无论你怎么做，一定要避开那个先知！",dEN="There's trouble at the altar of the snake god.\n\nThe presence of the Scourge has weakened the land, <race>. This in turn has weakened the wild gods.\n\nWe know that the Drakkari are taking advantage of this to do evil things to the gods.\n\nI need you to be my eyes and ears. The Altar of Sseratus is at the end of the avenue to the north. Sneak around the back and get a look inside of the main altar building.\n\nWhatever you do, avoid the prophet at all costs!",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要你去调查西莱图斯祭坛的主建筑。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand has asked you to investigate the main altar building at the Altar of Sseratus.",p="你看到了什么，<race>？",pEN="What did you see, <race>?",c="亡灵？\n\n<妖术师的神态明显被你所带来的消息而影响。>\n\n他们杀掉了西莱图斯，并喝了了他的魔精——尤其是先知！\n\n我们必须想出一个方法来除掉他，以免他再喝掉更多的魔精！",cEN="Dead?\n\n<The hexxer's spirit is visibly lowered at the news you bring.>\n\nThey've killed Sseratus and drunk deeply of his mojo; the prophet especially!\n\nWe must figure out a way to put an end to him before he drinks too much more!"}
Q[12507]={d="这瓶奇怪的魔精也许可以解释这里所发生的一切。\n\n银色前沿的赞达拉巨魔——妖术师乌布戈可能会对这东西感兴趣。",dEN="This bottle of strange mojo may be the key to what is truly going on here.\n\nThe Zandalari troll Hexxer Ubungo, back at The Argent Stand, may want to take a look at it.",o="把奇怪的魔精交给银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈。",oEN="Deliver the Strange Mojo to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="你找到了什么？",pEN="What's that you have there?",c="那是荒野诸神的魔精，<class>！\n\n这可不好！",cEN="That's the mojo of the wild gods, <class>!\n\nThis is not good!"}
Q[12508]={d="很抱歉我听到了你和中士的谈话。虽然上面来了命令，但我们在这里仍然有事情要做。\n\n你出去的时候，能帮我们把一些西莱图斯的追随者从痛苦中解放出来吗？",dEN="I couldn't help but overhear what you were talking to the sergeant about. That doesn't change the fact that we still have a job to do here.\n\nWhile you're out there, do you think you could help us to put some of those followers of Sseratus out of their misery?",o="西莱图斯祭坛的玛加下士要你杀死任意10个西莱图斯勇士、西莱图斯祭司或达卡莱驯蛇者。",oEN="Corporal Maga at the Altar of Sseratus wants you to kill any combination of 10 Champions of Sseratus, Priests of Sseratus, or Drakkari Snake Handlers.",p="考虑再多杀一点吗？",pEN="How about killing a few more?",c="谢谢你，<class>。我本来会很不甘心就这样离开，没能完成我们最初来这里要做的事。",cEN="Thanks, <class>. I'd have hated to leave without accomplishing what we came out here for in the first place."}
Q[12509]={d="巡逻员总算来了！\n\n情况是这样的，$r。我们已经在这次行动中损失了许多最精锐的士兵，因此不得不让新兵来填充缺额。\n\n我们刚刚打完了截至当前为止最惨烈的一场战斗，许多新兵当场就吓破了胆。但是将来必然还会有更多战斗，我希望他们届时能做好厮杀的准备。\n\n我最不能容忍的就是懦弱。也许你能帮他们重拾勇气，继续战斗。",dEN="Finally, the patrol arrives!\n\nHere's the situation, <race>. We've lost many of our finest soldiers in this campaign and have had to call upon our recruits to fill in the gaps.\n\nWe've just fought one of our fiercest battles and many of the recruits were simply not prepared to face this enemy. There are more fights ahead, and I need them ready to follow orders.\n\nIf there's one thing I can't stomach, it's cowardice. Perhaps you can help them find the courage to continue.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉要你去让那些恐惧的北伐军新兵重新振作起来。",oEN="Captain Rupert in Drak'Sotra wants you to restore courage to the cowering Crusade Recruits.",c="干得好，<class>。而且来得正是时候。我收到消息说反击即将开始。\n\n你该上路了。下一个岗哨在东北方，竞技场附近。格隆德尔上尉应该在那里等你。",cEN="Well done, <class>. And not a moment too soon. I've received word that a counter-attack is imminent.\n\nYou should be on your way. The next post is to the northeast, near the coliseum. Captain Grondel should be waiting for you there."}
Q[12510]={d="<妖术师仔细研究了装着魔精的瓶子。>\n\n我知道怎么对付西莱图斯的先知了。但首先，我们需要一些东西。\n\n达克索塔农田就在正南方。由于天灾军团入侵和原始神灵的死亡，诸界间的藩篱已经越来越脆弱了，许多元素生物借此机会涌了进来。\n\n我们要从它们的首领身上弄一些珍贵的元素液体来。如果你能把那些元素生物身上的三条锁链连在一起，它们的某个首领就会出现。",dEN="<The hexxer examines the decanter of mojo.>\n\nI have an idea for how to deal with the prophet of Sseratus. But first, we're going to need some things.\n\nThe Drak'Sotra Fields are directly to the south. Because of the stresses on the land from the Scourge and the deaths of gods, the wall between worlds has weakened and the elementals are flooding in.\n\nWe need the precious fluids of their lords. If you combine three links from the elementals a tether will be made, and one of their lords can be summoned.",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要你收集3份珍贵的元素液体。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand wants you to acquire 3 Precious Elemental Fluids.",p="你拿到珍贵的元素液体了吗？",pEN="Do you have the precious fluids?",c="太好了。和魔精结合的话，这液体可以稀释魔精的效果却又不会完全消灭它。\n\n现在，还有一件事要做。",cEN="Excellent. When combined with the mojo, these fluids will dilute the effectiveness of the mojo without completely eliminating it.\n\nNow, one more thing."}
Q[12511]={d="在我们把所有的注意力都放在坚守暮冬要塞、处理天灾之门一带的状况时，月溪旅正在努力穿越茂密的森林，与灰熊丘陵的那些不友好的居民进行战斗。他们希望能找到另一条通往冰冠冰川的道路。\n\n驻扎在琥珀松木营地的杜蒙特中尉正在征募无畏的强壮冒险者去探索未知的野外。你愿意去接受这份挑战吗？",dEN="While we focus to hold our ground at Wintergarde and deal with the unfolding events of the Wrathgate, battalions from as far away as Westfall battle their way through the dense foliage and inhospitable denizens of Grizzly Hills. All in hopes of finding an alternate route into Icecrown.\n\nLieutenant Dumont, stationed at Amberpine Lodge, has enlisted the aid of able bodied citizens willing to risk life and limb in the uncharted wilds. Will you rise to meet this challenge?",o="向灰熊丘陵西部的琥珀松木营地杜蒙特中尉报到。|n",oEN="Report to Lieutenant Dumont at Amberpine Lodge in western Grizzly Hills.",c="你差点被击落，是吧？野蛮的怪物——那些部落。\n\n他们做的事会有报应的。至少这一点你可以指望，<class>。\n\n现在，该让你干活了。",cEN="You were almost shot down, eh? Savage monsters - those Horde.\n\nPayback will come for what they've done. You can count on at least that much, <class>.\n\nNow, it's time to put you to work."}
Q[12512]={d="啊，太好了。他们终于派人来了。\n\n听着，$r。我们需要帮助。我们的部队被击退了，达克索塔已经落入了天灾军团手里。没人知道他们是从哪里冒出来的……\n\n关键是，我们需要一切可以找到的人手，但我们最棒的几个士兵还没有从战场上回来。\n\n我要你立刻进入废墟中去，找到那些伤员，帮他们包扎好，然后把他们带回来。他们都是老兵，所以可能会隐蔽起来。找不到他们就别回来见我！\n\n就在达克索塔一带找！他们应该走不远。",dEN="Ahh, good. They sent someone.\n\nListen, <race>. We need a hand here. Our forces were pushed back and we've lost Drak'Sotra to the Scourge. Where they came from is anyone's guess....\n\nThe point is, we need every man we can get here, and some of our best have yet to return from battle.\n\nI need you to enter the ruins now that the fighting has died down and find our wounded, patch them up, and bring them here to me.\n\nScour Drak'Sotra! They couldn't have gone far.",o="达克索塔的罗杰斯博士要你找到北伐军战士拉莫夫、北伐军战士乔纳森和北伐军战士约瑟芬。对他们使用北伐军的绷带，并护送他们安全回来。",oEN="Dr. Rogers at Drak'Sotra wants you to find Crusader Lamoof, Crusader Jonathan, and Crusader Josephine. Use the Crusader's Bandage on them, and escort them safely back to him.",p="你救出我们的老兵了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you rescued our veterans, <name>?",c="全都救回来了，是吗？真厉害！\n\n或许你会想要在岗哨这待下来？我们肯定用得到像你这样的人才……",cEN="Saved them all, did you? Outstanding!\n\nMaybe you'd consider sticking around the post here? We could sure use someone like you...."}
Q[12513]={d="我的帽子？是啊，那顶帽子的款式非同寻常，很早以前的事儿啦……如今可没几个裁缝知道怎么缝制。\n\n年少轻狂的时候，我将它当作身份的象征。很多人想要击败我，赢得那顶帽子……可惜没人成功。\n\n啊，这些都是陈芝麻烂谷子的事了。我已经老了，每天喝喝酒，钓钓鱼，早就不与人决斗啦。",dEN="My hat? Yes, it's an unusual style, I know, from far away... few tailors here know how to make them.\n\nWhen I was young and hot-blooded, I wore it as a standing challenge. Many came seeking to defeat me and win it for themselves... but no one ever did.\n\nAh, but those days are long past. I'm an old man, now: I drink, I fish, but I no longer duel.",o="卡洛斯要你进入旧希尔斯布莱德，击败年轻时候的卡洛斯。然后将他的帽子交给塔纳利斯的卡洛斯。",oEN="Don Carlos has inadvertently challenged you to defeat his younger self in Old Hillsbrad. Afterwards, bring Don Carlos' Hat to him in Tanaris as proof.",p="那时候，我是无人可敌的……如此的骄傲，太骄傲了。从来没有任何挑战者赢得这顶精美的帽子……",pEN="I was unbeatable, in those days... proud, and rightly so. No challenger ever won this fine hat...",c="我……我的帽子！那么……那个人就是你。我就知道。你靠近我的时候，旧疤就隐隐作痛，但是……太年轻了！你一点都没变！\n\n好吧……所以现在你知道我的秘密了。我“曾经”被打败了……来吧，拿着这顶帽子，作为我的酬谢。它本来就是你的。",cEN="My... my hat! But... how did you...?\n\nWell... no matter. So, now you know my secret. I WAS beaten... once. Here: take this hat, in return for mine. You've earned it."}
Q[12514]={d="现在我们要找一种东西，把它混入魔精，让先知喝了它以后非但不会变强，而且被大大削弱。\n\n东边的达克迦尔生长着一种蘑菇，当地的原住民称之为混乱毒菇。我想这就是我们要找的东西。\n\n帮我多采一些混乱毒菇回来，等我们把这些蘑菇混入魔精里面后，喝了它的人就会变得糊里糊涂的。",dEN="Now what we need is something to spike the mojo with. Something that'll make it so that when the prophet drinks it, he'll become less powerful.\n\nDrak'Agal lies to the east. There's a mushroom there that the natives call muddlecap fungus. I think it's exactly what we need.\n\nBring back lots of them. When we mix them into the mojo, the mind of anyone who drinks it will become muddled.",o="收集10份混乱毒菇，将它们交给银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈。",oEN="Collect 10 Muddlecap Fungus and deliver them to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="你取得所有的蘑菇了吗？\n\n喔，还有，小心潜伏在那里的蜥蜴。",pEN="Do you have all of the fungus?\n\nOh, and watch out for the basilisks lurking over there.",c="<妖术师点头赞许。>\n\n把那个蘑菇交给我，我会将它混进魔精和元素领主的液体之中。",cEN="<The hexxer nods his approval.>\n\nHand that fungus over and I'll mix it up with the mojo and elemental lord fluids."}
Q[12516]={d="喏，我已经重新调配过这瓶魔精了。现在先知只要喝下它，就会失去一部分力量，而且还会变得昏头昏脑。\n\n至少理论上是这样的。\n\n至于说如何能让他喝下这玩意，我想也许你只需把魔精扔给他就行了？根据他在祭坛上表现出来的傲慢态度来看，他肯定会直接喝下去的。\n\n除非你能杀了他，$c，否则你们的银色北伐军一定会落得无比悲惨的下场。",dEN="There. I've modified the mojo. Now when the prophet drinks it, not only will he lose some of his power, his mind will also be addled by the effects of the fungus.\n\nAt least that's the theory.\n\nAs for how to get him to drink it, might I suggest you simply throw it at him? No doubt he'll catch and drink it given the arrogance that he's displayed at the altar.\n\nUnless you can kill him, <class>, your Argent Crusade is about to come to a terrible end.",o="杀死混乱的西莱图斯先知，然后向银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈复命。",oEN="Slay the Muddled Prophet of Sseratus and then return to Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand.",p="结束了吗？\n\n调整过的魔精有效吗？\n\n你杀掉西莱图斯的预言者替他报仇了吗？",pEN="Is it over?\n\nDid the modified mojo work?\n\nDid you deliver vengeance for Sseratus by slaying his prophet?",c="太惊人了！你拯救了你的人民和诺森德其余的人免于他的疯狂荼毒。\n\n不幸的是，在祖达克更高处仍有更多这类型的疯子存在。",cEN="Amazing! You've saved your people and the rest of Northrend from his madness.\n\nUnfortunately there's more of this insanity occurring up in the higher tiers of Zul'Drak."}
Q[12517]={d="你现在已经收集到了盗贼套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Rogue cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone or something.",o="使用盗贼套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Rogues Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你弄到了整套的盗贼套牌！令人印象深刻。",pEN="I see that you have managed to inscribe a deck of Rogues! I'm impressed.",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your skill with the quill is already starting to manifest, young scribe. The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12518]={d="你现在已经收集到了法师套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Mage cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone or something.",o="使用法师套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Mages Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你已集满全套的法师套牌！恭喜！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Mages! Congratulations!",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your skill is most impressive! The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12519]={d="看看我，$r。我像是有时间填报告的人吗？光是让这岗哨不被该死天灾军团攻陷就够我忙的了，他们还想让我处理文书！\n\n<suspiro>\n\n<叹气>抱怨也没用。我得给指挥官交一份上次小规模战斗的杀敌数。\n\n你想帮忙？去把这附近死掉的巨魔身上能找到的勋章都给我弄来。那也只好凑合了。",dEN="Look at me, <race>. Do I look like I have time fer fillin' out reports?\n\nIt be all I can do to keep this post free o' the bloody Scourge, and they want me to mess with paperwork!\n\nNo sense in complainin'. I need to get the commander some kinda kill count from the last skirmish.\n\nYou wanna be helpful? Go and get me all the medals you can find from the dead trolls around here. That'll hafta be close enough.",o="斗兽场外面的格隆迪尔上尉要你从附近的达卡莱尸体上收集7枚达卡莱勋章。",oEN="Captain Grondel outside the Coliseum wants you to gather 7 Drakkari Medallions from the nearby Drakkari Corpses.",p="你能给我弄到那些勋章吗，<race>？",pEN="You get those medals for me, <race>?",c="哎呀，瞧瞧！\n\n你可给我省了不少活儿，<小伙子/小姑娘>。我很感激。我会确保在报告里提到你。\n\n现在走吧。芬克尔斯坦多半在这西边一点等着你呢。",cEN="Well, now!\n\nYa saved me a fair bit o' work there <lad/lass>. I'm grateful. I'll be sure ta make mention of ya in me report.\n\nOff with yeh now. Finklestein'll likely be waitin fer ya a bit west o' here."}
Q[12520]={d="一次硬着陆可阻止不了老赫米特征服索拉查所能提供的最大猎物。在营地西北的荒野里，丛林由强大的碎角犀牛统治着。向这支探险队证明你的价值吧，$g小子:丫头;，让我看看你$g够不够强悍:够不够强悍;，能不能放倒那些强大的野兽。",dEN="No rough landing is going to stop ol' Hemet from mastering the largest game Sholazar has to offer. In the wilds northwest of the camp, the jungles are ruled by the mighty shardhorn rhino. You can prove your worth to the expedition, <lad/lass>, by showing me that you're tough enough to face down those powerful beasts.",o="杀死15头碎角犀牛，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向赫米特·奈辛瓦里复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Shardhorn Rhinos and return to Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你制服了犀牛吗，还是你丢毛巾投降了？",pEN="Did you master the rhinos, or are you throwing in the towel?",c="不错，不错，不错，看来你从犀牛角下活了下来，毕竟你看起来还身体完整。不过犀牛狩猎可不只是当犀牛往你冲的时候死盯着它，然后祈祷自己瞄得够准。不，要制服传说中居住在丛林里的犀牛之王，你还需要更多技巧。",cEN="Well, well, well, it looks like you've survived the rhinos, after all, and in pretty good shape if I do say so myself. But there's more to rhino hunting than just staring down the beast as it charges you and hoping your aim is true. No, you'll need more than that to take on the rhino patriarch that's rumored to dwell in the jungle."}
Q[12521]={d="当我听说传奇的赫米特·奈辛瓦里要扬帆前往索拉查盆地时，我主动提出资助他的探险。我们对索拉查知之甚少，但据说它是这片冰封大陆中的一处葱郁天堂。\n\n赫米特同意送回异域植物、材料和晶体的样本。可他一直没有消息。蒙特·枪口本该给他们送去补给，但也没有回来。如果你愿意去查查出了什么事，我就用我的飞行器送你过去。 $g愿意:愿意;",dEN="When I heard that the legendary Hemet Nesingwary was setting sail for the Sholazar Basin, I offered to help fund his expedition. We know little of Sholazar, but it's said to be a lush paradise in the midst of this frozen continent.\n\nHemet has agreed to send back samples of exotic plants, reagents, and crystals. There hasn't been any word from him. Monte Muzzleshot was supposed to be bringing them supplies, but he hasn't returned, either. If you'll look into it, I'll send you in my flying machine.",o="当你$g准备好:准备好;前往索拉查盆地时，与大法师彭塔鲁斯交谈。抵达后，与索拉查盆地蛮藤谷的蒙特·枪口交谈。",oEN="Talk to Archmage Pentarus when you're ready to leave for Sholazar Basin. When you arrive, speak with Monte Muzzleshot in the Wildgrowth Mangal of Sholazar Basin.",c="没错，赫米特在这儿。他就在营地里，只要往西北方朝河边走，很快就能看到。看在圣光的份上，<小伙子/小姑娘>，让他派个人来把我放下来！",cEN="Aye, Hemet's here. He's at the camp, just go northwest toward the river and you'll soon see it. And for the love of the Light, <lad/lass>, have him send someone to cut me down!"}
Q[12522]={d="毁了……全毁了！我早就提醒过船长，让她小心运送精密的仪器，她怎么就不把我的话当回事呢！\n\n由于她的疏忽，导致我的飞行器“诺莫瑞根之魂”在这艘船触礁搁浅时被撞坏了。这下完蛋了吧，我们连报告都没法送出去了！\n\n不过，天无绝人之路！风险投资公司的地精或许能帮上我们。前些日子，他们击落了另一架飞行器。喏，残骸就落在东边的沼泽地里，也就是蒙特跳伞着陆的地方。我要你去回收它的引擎，这很可能是我们唯一的希望了。",dEN="She's ruined... ruined! I told that captain to be careful with such a precious cargo, but would she listen to me? No!\n\nWhen the ship ran aground, it damaged my flying machine, the Spirit of Gnomeregan. Now, we're left without any means to send our reports!\n\nThere is a chance, though, that the Venture Company's antics may work in our favor. They shot down another flying machine right about where Monte parachuted into the swamp to the east. Go there and retrieve the engine. It may be our only hope.",o="奈辛瓦里营地的维斯雷·扭钳要你帮他找到一台飞行器引擎。",oEN="Weslex Quickwrench at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to bring him a Flying Machine Engine.",p="哎，你有办法拿到引擎吗？我只知道资助远征队的大法师要紧张了。",pEN="Well, were you able to get the engine? I just know that archmage who funded the expedition is getting nervous.",c="那……把东西放那就好了。小心点！如果你弄坏了这一部，我们就有大麻烦了。现在，看看我能够做些什么。",cEN="There... just set it down there. Be careful! If you ruin this one, we're in big trouble. Now, let's see what I can do."}
Q[12523]={d="很好，我们有了一台能用的引擎。接下来嘛，只要替换飞行器的部分零件，就能让她正常运转啦。别担心，我知道自己在做什么。\n\n优秀的机械师可以使用最烂的材料修复他的发明创造！不过，如果能找到合适的材料，那自然是再好不过啦。\n\n风险投资公司在斯温迪格林挖掘场中作业，那里到处散落着采矿设备的备用零件。喏，挖掘场就在东北方那根黄色水晶柱的另一端。替我弄一些零件回来吧。",dEN="Great, now that we've got an engine, we're going to need an assortment of other parts to get her back in flying condition. Don't worry, I know what I'm doing.\n\nA good mechanic can hold his creations together with anything, but we're better off if it doesn't come to that.\n\nAnyway, those Venture Company dullards have plenty of spare parts for their mining equipment all over Swindlegrin's Dig on the far side of that yellow crystal pillar to the northeast. Scoop up a few and bring them back here.",o="将7份风险投资公司备用零件交给奈辛瓦里营地的维斯雷·扭钳。",oEN="Bring 7 Venture Co. Spare Parts to Weslex Quickwrench at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你拿到零件了吗？",pEN="Did you get those parts?",c="只要小小的调整，应该就能用了。我可怜的飞行器可能到最后看起来会像一台风险投资公司的伐木机。可怜的小女孩，看来得等我们回到达拉然，才有办法变回它应有的样子了。",cEN="With a little work, these should suffice. My poor flying machine might end up looking more like a Venture Company shredder, though. Poor girl will have to wait until we get back to Dalaran to be restored to her rightful form."}
Q[12524]={d="自打我们来到这里，风险投资公司就一直在给我们制造麻烦，营地的安全受到威胁，调查工作更是难以开展。本来呢，我们也不想招惹是非，但是他们竟然袭击我们的斥候，还击落了运送补给物资的飞行器。\n\n我们绝不能容忍这样的侮辱。赫米特·奈辛瓦里的探险队是来这里狩猎的，他们也将成为我们的猎物！\n\n转至东北方的那根水晶柱的另一端，消灭那些在斯温迪格林挖掘场中作业的风险投资公司雇员！",dEN="Ever since we arrived, the Venture Company has hampered our efforts to secure our campsite and survey the area. Normally, we wouldn't care what they were up to, but they've started antagonizing our scouts and shooting down supply flights.\n\nWe can't allow this insult to stand. Hemet Nesingwary's expedition came here to hunt, and hunt it shall.\n\nGo to Swindlegrin's Dig, on the far side of the crystal pillar to the northeast, and kill any Venture Company employee you see!",o="奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔要你去杀死15名风险投资公司雇员，风险投资公司无赖或是风险投资公司挖掘者都可以。",oEN="Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to kill 15 Venture Company members. You may kill either Venture Co. Ruffians or Venture Co. Excavators.",c="这样应该足以震慑他们了，但我担心工头会带更多的工人来。我们要趁着还来得及的时候，完成我们的工作。",cEN="That should hamper their operations, but I worry that the foreman will try to bring in more workers. We have to complete the job while we can."}
Q[12525]={d="我们必须干掉工头斯温迪格林，才能彻底让他们的矿洞完蛋。但这家伙随身带着一个名叫“肉饼”的食人魔保镖。看来不经过一番激烈的搏斗，你是见不着工头的。\n\n他们很可能呆在高处的平台，监视着风险投资公司在斯温迪格林挖掘场的工作进展。\n\n挖掘场就在东北方的日灼之柱的另一端。祝你好运，$n。",dEN="We must send Foreman Swindlegrin packing if we're going to shut down his mine permanently, but be careful. His bodyguard, Meatpie, is a large, mean ogre, and isn't likely to let you see the foreman without a fight.\n\nThe two probably occupy a platform that would let them look out over the entire Venture Company operation at Swindlegrin's Dig.\n\nRemember, the dig is on the far side of the Suntouched Pillar to the northeast. Good luck, <name>.",o="杀死工头斯温迪格林和肉饼，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向蒂巴尔复命。",oEN="Kill Foreman Swindlegrin and Meatpie and return to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你解决了诈咧与他的保镖吗？",pEN="Have you dealt with Swindlegrin and his bodyguard?",c="听到风险投资公司不会再妨碍我们，可真叫人松了一口气。你处理了这个问题，我和赫米特都很感谢你。一个猎人可不能在举起枪对着别人的时候，还有什么良心之类的问题。",cEN="What a relief to hear that the Venture Company will trouble us no more. You have my thanks, and that of Hemet for dealing with this problem. A game hunter cannot, in good conscience, lift her weapon against another person."}
Q[12526]={d="呃，就这么办吧。我们得找这位土着先知好好谈谈。他多半不会心甘情愿地为我们效劳。\n\n据说他住在诺兹隆之骨附近的一间小屋里，就在南边河流的对岸。找到他之后先做个自我介绍吧，然后问问他要怎么样才肯帮助我们跟踪那头犀牛之王。",dEN="Well, that's settled then. We'll seek out this native sage and have a word with him. He's not likely to volunteer his services, though.\n\nI'm told he keeps a small lean-to near the Bones of Nozronn, just across the river to the south. Seek him out, introduce yourself, and ask what he requires to help us track down this patriarch of the rhinos.",o="与诺兹隆之骨的神谕者索乌拉姆谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Oracle Soo-rahm at the Bones of Nozronn.",c="你为何来到索乌拉姆的圣坛？",cEN="What brings you to Rahm's shrine?"}
Q[12527]={d="我的主人菲肯斯坦正在西北方的赫布瓦罗制作一种真言药剂，他需要大量的石化蜥蜴水晶作为材料。赫布瓦罗就在这条通往北边的西莱图斯祭坛的大道西侧。\n\n幸运的是，东边的达克迦尔就潜伏着不少蜥蜴。\n\n如果你能抓一些祖达克老鼠，把它们扔给蜥蜴吃的话，那些蜥蜴在吃掉五只老鼠以后就会变得很温顺。然后你就可以安全地从它们身上取走水晶了。\n\n杀死蜥蜴是没有用的……那样只会把水晶弄碎。",dEN="My master, Finklestein, is in the shrine at Heb'Valok to the northwest preparing a truth serum, and he needs basilisk crystals. Heb'Valok is on the west side of the road leading north before the Altar of Sseratus.\n\nThere are basilisks to the east at Drak'Agal.\n\nIf you grab the Zul'Drak rats and throw them at the basilisk, they will become gorged and docile after eating five. Then you'll be able to take their crystals.\n\nKilling the basilisk won't do you any good. That'd just break its crystals!",o="将5块石化蜥蜴水晶交给赫布瓦罗神殿的炼金师菲肯斯坦。",oEN="Deliver 5 Basilisk Crystals to Alchemist Finklestein in the shrine at Heb'Valok.",p="这些是什么？\n\n你有看到我那个没路用的学徒匹斯波特吗？\n\n我派他去办点事情，他搞了半天还不回来！",pEN="What's all this?\n\nBy any chance have you seen my no-good apprentice, Pestlepot?\n\nI sent him on an errand quite some time ago and he has yet to return!",c="喔，太棒了！感谢你。水晶看起来的状况很不错！\n\n我一点也不怀疑匹斯波特让你替他做了他的工作。不过，你的协助还是非常有价值！",cEN="Oh, most excellent! Thank you. The crystals appear to be in fine condition!\n\nI have no doubt that Pestlepot put you up to doing his chores for him. Nevertheless, your assistance in this matter is greatly appreciated!"}
Q[12528]={d="我的猎物！你抢了我的猎物！\n\n<格克格用长矛戳你>\n\n你真$g蠢:蠢;，$r。现在你欠格克格$g一笔:一笔;了！你是狂心氏的奴隶。你要为狂心氏杀更多的野兽。\n\n你去东北方的狂心岭，告诉高阶萨满拉克杰克你是新来的奴隶。\n\n快去，$r！快去，不然我再戳你一次！\n\n<格克格威胁地挥舞着长矛>",dEN="My kill! You take my kill!\n\n<Gekgek taunts you with his spear.>\n\nYou dumb, <race>. Now you owe Gekgek! You be Frenzyheart slave. You slay many more beasts for Frenzyheart.\n\nYou go Frenzyheart Hill to northeast - you tell High-Shaman Rakjak you the new slave.\n\nGo, <race>! Go or I taunt you a second time!\n\n<Gekgek waves his spear around menacingly.>",o="以$g新\"\"\"\"“奴隶”:新“奴隶”;的身份向狂心岭的高阶萨满拉克杰克报到。",oEN="Report to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill as the new \"slave.\"",c="你是新来的奴隶？\n\n很好，因为我们的奴隶快没了。",cEN="You the new slave?\n\nGood. We running out."}
Q[12529]={d="你以为自己是很厉害的$g猎人:女猎人;，嗯？你不是狂心氏，你不懂$g狩猎:狩猎;。\n\n戈雷格克是伟大的猿猴猎手。他杀的猿猴多得你用爪子都数不过来。\n\n你跟戈雷格克去东边猎杀硬指猿。你是奴隶，$r。戈雷格克让你做什么你就做什么。",dEN="You think you so great hunter, eh? You no Frenzyheart, you not know of hunt.\n\nGoregek is great ape hunter. He slay so many ape you can't count on claws.\n\nYou go with Goregek and hunt hardknuckles to east. You the slave, <race>. You do what Goregek tell you.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你去杀死8只硬皮抢夺者和6只硬皮冲锋者。\n\n如果你弄丢了格拉克伊克的镣铐，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Kill 8 Hardknuckle Foragers and 6 Hardknuckle Chargers for High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Goregek's Shackles, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你还活着！硬皮猩猩还没把你吃了？\n\n也许他们晚点会把你吃了。",pEN="You still alive! Hardknuckles not eat you yet?\n\nMaybe they eat you later.",c="戈雷格克会教这个傻<race>奴隶怎么做。",cEN="Goregek show silly <race> slave how it done."}
Q[12530]={d="嘿！奴隶！\n\n拉克亚克要我带上你外出狩猎硬皮猩猩，换了平常我才不乐意呢。不过今天我的心情很好，所以打算也让你过过瘾。但是，你最好别给我惹麻烦！\n\n拉克亚克还不知道吧，其实我早就想对那只坏坏的雌性硬皮猩猩下手了。我们去东边的硬皮旷野，对软皮猩猩使用软皮木棍，这样就能迫使她显身啦！\n\n<格拉克伊克兴奋地摩挲着双手。>",dEN="Slave thing!\n\nRakjak want me to babysit you while I kill hardknuckles. I feeling generous today, so I let you kill some too, but don't get in Goregek's way!\n\nRakjak not know yet, but Goregek has eye on big bad hardknuckle mama. We go to Hardknuckle Clearing to east and poke softknuckles with poker and she sure to come yelling!\n\n<Goregek rubs his hands together gleefully.>",o="对软皮猩猩使用格拉克伊克给你的软皮木棍，将雌性硬皮猩猩引出来。击败雌性硬皮猩猩，然后向狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克汇报情况。\n\n如果你弄丢了格拉克伊克的镣铐，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Goregek has given you a Softknuckle Poker for use on Softknuckles to draw the Hardknuckle Matriarch out of hiding. Slay the Hardknuckle Matriarch and report her death to High-Shaman Rajak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Goregek's Shackles, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你要做什么，奴隶？",pEN="What you want, slave?",c="格拉克伊克带你去杀死了雌性硬皮猩猩，嗯？你很幸运！\n\n那些愚蠢的软皮猩猩一定大声尖叫！\n\n<拉克亚克大声尖啸，然后突然大笑起来。>",cEN="Goregek take you to kill big mom of hardknuckles, eh? You lucky!\n\nDumb softknuckles squeal good!\n\n<Rakjak squeals loudly and breaks out laughing.>"}
Q[12531]={d="$g猎狮者:猎狮者;、$g追鸡者:追鸡者;、狂心氏的新$g奴隶:奴隶;……\n\n我知道你不想继续$g当奴隶:当奴隶;，所以我告诉你该怎么做。表现出你比其他狂心猎手更强，拉克杰克就会尊重你。\n\n南边河流的沙地下有一头野兽，它杀黄蜂、猿猴，甚至狼獾人。它叫瑟菲克斯。把瑟菲克斯的爪子带给拉克杰克，也许他就会解除你的奴籍。\n\n希望达吉克教得够好，这样瑟菲克斯就好对付了。",dEN="Lion killer, chicken chaser, new Frenzyheart slave...\n\nI know you no want to stay slave, so I tell you what to do. Show you better than the other Frenzyheart hunters and then Rakjak respect you.\n\nUnder sands of south river there a beast that kills wasp, apes, and even wolvar. He called Serfex. You bring claw of Serfex to Rakjak and maybe he release you from slaveness.\n\nHope Dajik teaching you good so Serfex be easy stuff.",o="转至南部河流的沙滩，找到并杀死瑟菲克斯，将他的爪子交给狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Locate Serfex under the sands of the southern river, slay him, and bring his claw to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="我没问你，<race>。你想干什么？",pEN="I not ask for you, <race>. What you want?",c="你杀死了瑟菲克斯？我打赌你一定跟踪一只杀死瑟菲克斯的强大狼獾人，然后偷走了爪子。\n\n爪子现在是我的了。",cEN="You kill Serfex? I bet you follow mighty wolvar that kill Serfex and take claw.\n\nMy claw now."}
Q[12532]={d="格利基克没头没脑地闯入鸡舍，结果鸡们受到惊吓，全都逃掉了！\n\n它们就在附近——替我把它们抓回来！\n\n<长者哈尔卡克发出嘘声，催你赶紧去抓鸡。>",dEN="Dumb Goregek stumble into chicken house and let all the chickens go!\n\nThey all around hill - go get chickens back!\n\n<Elder Harkek shoos you away.>",o="捕捉12只逃走的小鸡，然后向长者哈尔卡克复命。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Capture 12 Chicken Escapees for Elder Harkek.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你抓到鸡了吗？",pEN="You catch chickens?",c="好！我正担心食物呢。我已经很饿了。\n\n谢谢你，<race>。",cEN="Good! I was worried about foodstuffs. I already pretty hungry.\n\nThank you, <race>."}
Q[12533]={d="拉克杰克不笨。也许你$g擅长:擅长;杀戮。也许狂心氏能把你变成$g真正的:真正的;猎人。\n\n达吉克猎杀巨型黄蜂比所有狼獾人都强。跟达吉克去东南方的蓝玉蜂巢，或者南边的河里，学着狩猎。",dEN="Rakjak not dumb. Maybe you good at killing things. Maybe Frenzyheart can make you into real hunter.\n\nDajik hunts giant wasp things better than all wolvar. Go with Dajik to Sapphire Hive to southeast or to river in south and learn the hunt.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你杀死6只蓝玉虫巢巨蜂和9只蓝玉虫巢雄蜂。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Kill 6 Sapphire Hive Wasps and 9 Sapphire Hive Drones for High-Shaman Rakjak in Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你学会狩猎了没有？",pEN="You learn the hunt?",c="我们杀很多蓝蜂。\n\n拉克亚克觉得它们杀不完。",cEN="We kill many many wasps.\n\nRakjak don't think they run out."}
Q[12534]={d="钢刺野猪虽然颇具威胁，但它们大多生活在远离狼獾人的本地。蓝蜂就不同了，这种可怕的巨型蜂接连杀死了狂心氏族的好几名猎手……\n\n拉克亚克一直想除掉蜂后，可是最厉害的猎手也没有勇气踏足她的巢穴。我要你进入东南方的蓝玉虫巢杀死那里的蜂后，然后把她的钉刺交给拉克亚克。我敢打赌拉克亚克会欣喜若狂的。",dEN="Bristlepine can be dangerous, but most stay far away from wolvar. Wasps on other hand not fear the Frenzyheart... they even kill some of our hunters.\n\nI know Rakjak want wasp queen dead, but no wolvar want to go into her hive. You go kill wasp queen in Sapphire Hive to southeast and get stinger for Rakjak. Me bet Rakjak like that.",o="将蓝玉虫巢蜂后的钉刺交给狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克。\n\n如果你弄丢了达伊克的旧粉笔，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Bring the Stinger of the Sapphire Queen to High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.\n\nIf you lose Dajik's Worn Chalk, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你闻起来很像蓝蜂之类的。",pEN="You smell like wasp things.",c="你杀掉蜂后了！你比拉克亚克还强。\n\n也许现在蓝蜂会走开，停止攻击狂心猎人。",cEN="You killed queen wasp! You stronger than Rakjak thought.\n\nMaybe wasps go away now and stop attacking Frenzyheart hunters."}
Q[12535]={d="你是$g好猎人:好猎人;，但狂心氏能让你更强。哈尔克觉得也许你$g准备好:准备好;做更重要的事了。\n\n在拉克杰克派你去做重要任务之前，你需要为拉克杰克收集东西。沿着南边的河一带有很多蓝色水晶。拉克杰克需要很多蓝色水晶。\n\n你现在就去采水晶。",dEN="You good hunter, but Frenzyheart can make you stronger. Harkek think maybe you ready for something more important.\n\nBefore Rakjak send you on important mission, you need gather things for Rakjak. All along river to south are blue crystals. Rakjak need lots of blue crystals.\n\nYou go get crystals now.",o="狂心岭的高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克要你去收集8块通天水晶簇。",oEN="High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill wants 8 Skyreach Crystal Clusters.",p="差不多准备好长途旅行了。我们刚刚带了一条鳄鱼回来了。",pEN="Almost ready for long journey. Gekgek come back with crocolisk just moment ago.",c="好<race>！好，都准备好了。",cEN="Good <race>! Okay, all ready."}
Q[12536]={d="瑟匹克是狂心氏族最优秀的猎手。他擅长狩猎大舌头怪……嗯，就是沼泽地里那群什么东西都要偷的丑八怪。\n\n瑟匹克打算出趟远门，摧毁大舌头怪的祭坛，把它们统统吓跑。我们要把这些家伙赶出这片土地。\n\n狂心岭的东北边锁着一只鳄鱼，就在大树旁——你和瑟匹克一起去，照他说的做就是了。",dEN="Zepik is best hunter of the Frenzyheart. Zepik hunts big-tongues... ugly things near swamps that try to steal all stuff they can find.\n\nZepik going on long trek to break big-tongue shrine and try to scare them away. We no want big-tongues in this land anymore.\n\nThere a crocolisk chained on northeast side of hill, next to tree - go with Zepik and do what Zepik tell you.",o="骑上被俘虏的鳄鱼转至雾语村，向瑟匹克寻求下一步的指示。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Ride the captive crocolisk to Mistwhisper Refuge and then speak to Zepik for further instructions.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="他们跟瑟匹克说不以狂心族人标准来看的话，你是个好猎人。",pEN="They tell Zepik you good hunter for not being Frenzyheart.",c="我们到了！一定要快。\n\n小心大舌头。",cEN="We here! Must work fast.\n\nWatch out for big-tongues."}
Q[12537]={d="嗯，说到水晶……\n\n大舌头怪使用水晶为天气祭坛充能。瑟匹克并不清楚其中的原理，但是一旦它们用错了水晶，就会风雨大作！\n\n原本呢，瑟匹克打算悄悄地潜入一座祭坛，结果却并不顺利。所以啊，还是拉上你一起去比较好！\n\n把这些水晶放在祭坛附近，然后击碎它们，释放其中的能量。瑟匹克也不确定会发生什么事，打破水晶之后你最好躲远点。",dEN="Okay, the crystal things...\n\nThe big-tongues use the crystals to power their rain shrines. Zepik not know quite how it works, but Zepik does know that if they use wrong crystals, the clouds and the rain go crazy!\n\nZepik tried to sneak in at one of their other rain shrines, but it not go so well. It sure to go much better with two!\n\nTake crystals, place at big stone pillar shrine thing, then smash them to release power. Zepik not sure what will happen, so might want to step back after.",o="瑟匹克要你在雾语天气祭坛前敲碎通天水晶簇。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Zepik wants you to smash the Skyreach Crystal Clusters in front of the Mistwhisper weather shrine.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="瑟匹克觉得有同伴一起顺利多了。以不是狂心族人来说你很强。",pEN="Zepik think this go much better with partner. You strong for not Frenzyheart.",c="真有效！\n\n你看到闪电打中那个神谕者了吗？真棒！\n\n<瑟匹克摩擦着他的双手并且狂乱的笑着。>",cEN="It work so good!\n\nYou see lightning smash that oracle guy? So good!\n\n<Zepik rubs his hands together and chuckles maniacally.>"}
Q[12538]={d="杀些猩猩和蓝蜂有什么意思啊！狩猎大舌头怪才好玩呢！\n\n在我们破坏天气祭坛的同时，不如趁机多杀几只大舌头怪。这样它们就不敢再来我们的地盘惹事啦。\n\n<瑟匹克自信地点了点头。>",dEN="Gorillas and wasps are boring! Big-tongues the only thing fun to hunt.\n\nWhile we mess up rain shrine, we kill lots of mist big-tongues. That sure to make them not want to come back to village thing.\n\n<Zepik nods to himself confidently.>",o="瑟匹克要你去杀死12个雾语鳄鱼人。\n\n如果你弄丢了瑟匹克的狩猎号角，就去找狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克。",oEN="Zepik wants you to kill 12 Mistwhisper Gorlocs.\n\nIf you lose Zepik's Hunting Horn, speak to Elder Harkek in Frenzyheart Hill.",p="我们是盆地最棒的猎人！",pEN="We best hunters of basin!",c="我狠狠的戳了那些大舌头一顿。\n\n我想你做的还可以。\n\n不，我只是开玩笑！你是好猎人。我很高兴跟你打猎。",cEN="I stab those big-tongues good.\n\nYou did okay I guess.\n\nNo, I just kidding! You good hunter. I glad to hunt with you."}
Q[12539]={d="搞定啦！我们回去吧，不过这次没有鳄鱼骑了。唉，如果猎人也能像鳄鱼那样划水划得哗哗响，那我们就能自己游回去啦。\n\n这样吧，我们沿着山脊一路往东走，应该就能返回狂心岭。\n\n要是我们不小心偏离了山脊，很可能会撞上那些大舌头怪。瑟匹克觉得它们现在肯定不会善罢甘休。",dEN="Okay, we done! Time to go back. No crocolisk to ride this time though.\n\nIf we go east and stay near ridge, it should lead all the way back near hill.\n\nNeed to be careful not to go far below ridge though or we might go right into big-tongue tree village thing. Zepik not think they like us right now.",o="返回狂心岭，与高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克谈一谈。",oEN="Find your way back to Frenzyheart Hill and speak to High-Shaman Rakjak.",c="被闪电炸翻？\n\n<拉克亚克大笑了一阵。>\n\n你是个好猎人。拉克亚克喜欢你。也许有一天你可以成为光荣的狂心族人！\n\n只是也许啦！",cEN="Blown up by lightning?\n\n<Rakjak breaks out laughing for a moment.>\n\nYou good hunter. Rakjak like you. Maybe one day you can be honorary Frenzyheart!\n\nOnly maybe though!"}
Q[12540]={d="好吧，$g家伙:女士;，拉克杰克有个非常重要的活儿。你去抓住追踪者在北边河边发现的那头受伤的大舌头。\n\n这次别带猎人，因为他们可能只想杀掉它。我想把它藏起来，好戳它、让它告诉我事情。\n\n你去把大舌头战利品给我带回来。",dEN="Okay <guy/lady>, Rakjak have very important job. You go capture injured big-tongue that tracker spotted at river to north.\n\nNot bring hunter this time because they maybe want to just kill it. I want to hide it so that I can poke it and make it tell me things.\n\nGo you and bring me big-tongue prize thing.",o="为狂心岭的高阶萨满拉克杰克找到一名受伤的唤雨者神谕者。|n",oEN="Locate an Injured Rainspeaker Oracle for High-Shaman Rakjak at Frenzyheart Hill.",c="拜托不要杀我！我们只是在找鱼。我们不想死。",cEN="No kill me please! We was just looking for fish. We not want to die."}
Q[12541]={d="啊，你一定是那支说好的巡逻队。你来得再及时不过了。我急需多一双手。\n\n我们有一个达卡莱俘虏被送来接受审问。在开始审讯之前，我需要协助配制一种吐真剂。\n\n配制吐真剂是件棘手的事，需要敏锐的直觉、完美的时机和随时随机应变。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;就告诉我，$r。记住，时机就是一切！|n",dEN="Ahh, you must be the promised patrol. Your timing couldn't be better. I have urgent need of an extra pair of hands.\n\nWe have a Drakkari prisoner who's been sent here to undergo questioning. Before the interrogation begins, I require assistance in the creation of a truth serum.\n\nCreating a truth serum is tricky business, demanding keen instincts, perfect timing, and improvisation at every step.\n\nLet me know when you're ready, <race>. And remember, timing is everything!",o="赫布瓦洛克的炼金师芬克尔斯坦要你协助他配制吐真剂。\n\n当你$g准备好:准备好;开始时，与他交谈并遵照他的指示。",oEN="Alchemist Finklestein at Heb'Valok wants you to assist him in the creation of a truth serum.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin, you are to speak to him and follow his instructions.",p="你看，<name>，真正的炼金术远不止把几种材料混在一起……",pEN="You see, <name>, there is far more to true alchemy than mixing a few ingredients....",c="你成功了！\n\n从那个<race>身上收集到的情报无疑会非常有价值。我一定会向指挥官汇报时提到你的努力。\n\n谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="You've done it!\n\nThe intelligence gathered from that <race> will undoubtedly be of great value. I'll be certain to make mention of your efforts in my report to the commander.\n\nThank you, <name>."}
Q[12542]={d="$C！银色北伐军正在寻找身强力壮、愿意放下分歧、联手对抗巫妖王军队的士兵。你愿意投身我们的事业吗？\n\n如果你$g有兴趣:有兴趣;，就往北前往圣光之望，与十字军战士瓦鲁斯交谈。\n\n你会在被洗劫的巨魔城市金萨卡拉的废墟中找到圣光之望——它就与祖达克接壤。\n\n再会。",dEN="<class>! The Argent Crusade is looking for able bodied soldiers that are willing to set aside their differences and join forces to battle the forces of the Lich King. Will you take up our cause?\n\nShould you be interested, venture north to Light's Trust and speak with Crusader Valus.\n\nYou will find Light's Trust amidst the ruins of the sacked troll city of Jintha'kalar - bordering Zul'Drak.\n\nFarewell.",o="向龙骨荒野圣光之望的十字军战士瓦鲁斯报到。|n",oEN="Report to Crusader Valus at Light's Trust in Dragonblight.",c="此地不仅只是达卡莱帝国的遗迹。\n\n<瓦鲁斯指向东方。>\n\n几千年来达卡莱保持孤立，隐匿在他们连绵的神殿都市与通灵塔之中。碰上这样的失事对他们而言是件非常令人惊讶的事情。而在通往祖达克内部的阶梯之前，横亘着遗迹中的达克萨隆要塞。祖达克的第一层，被摧毁了……\n\n为什么天灾军团要等到这一刻才攻击呢？",cEN="Mere footsteps from here lies the Drakkari empire.\n\n<Valus points east.>\n\nFor thousands of years the Drakkari remained isolated, preferring to keep within the boundaries of their sprawling temple cities and ziggurats. It was surprising then, to come upon this wreckage. Further up, beyond the foreboding stairs leading into Zul'Drak, Drak'Tharon Keep lies in ruin. The entire first tier of Zul'Drak, destroyed...\n\nWhy has the Scourge waited until now to attack?"}
Q[12543]={d="我们不认识你，$g外乡人:外乡人;，但我们知道你想要些什么。\n\n我们会替你向诺兹隆之骨传话，但你必须带供品来。我们需要强大的帝王眼镜蛇毒牙来完成神谕者的项链。\n\n去我们小屋东北方的蛮藤谷，找到眼镜蛇，把最好的毒牙带回来。然后，我们就让骨头跟你说话。",dEN="We not know you, stranger, but we know you want something.\n\nWe will talk to Bones of Nozronn for you, but you must bring us offerings. We need powerful emperor cobra fangs to complete our oracle's necklace.\n\nGo to the Wildgrowth Mangal, northeast of our hut, find cobras and bring back best fangs. Then we make bones speak to you.",o="将5颗完整的眼镜蛇牙交给诺兹隆之骨附近的神谕者索乌拉姆。",oEN="Bring 5 Intact Cobra Fangs to Oracle Soo-rahm, near the Bones of Nozronn.",p="我们得知道——你带牙齿来了吗？",pEN="We must know -- do you bring fangs?",c="<神谕者检查着毒牙。>\n\n我们认可了！诺兹隆之骨会和<name>说话！",cEN="<The oracle inspects the fangs.>\n\nWe approve! Bones of Nozronn will speak to <name>!"}
Q[12544]={d="诺兹隆之骨，神谕者苏-拉姆派$n来找你！\n\n我们为你准备好了熏香。点燃它，放在诺兹隆的头骨附近，你就会听到他的声音。\n\n<$g困惑:困惑;，你告诉苏-拉姆你甚至还没说出你的问题。>\n\n没错，我们不知道，但伟大的诺兹隆知道。不要怀疑。诺兹隆会回答你心中的疑问。\n\n去吧。诺兹隆不会等太久。",dEN="Bones of Nozronn, Oracle Soo-rahm sends <name> to you!\n\nWe have prepared incense for you. Light it and place it near Nozronn's head and you will hear his voice.\n\n<Confused, you tell Soo-rahm that you haven't even told him your question.>\n\nTrue, we not know, but mighty Nozronn does. Do not doubt. Nozronn will answer your heart's question.\n\nGo. Nozronn not wait long.",o="在诺兹隆之骨附近使用索乌拉姆的熏香，然后返回奈辛瓦里营地，向赫米特·奈辛瓦里汇报你得到的情报。",oEN="Use Soo-rahm's Incense near the Bones of Nozronn, then return to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Base Camp with the information you learned.",p="嗯，你询问过当地的神谕者了吗？",pEN="Well, have you consulted the native oracle?",c="<赫米特听着你描述你所了解到的情况。>\n\n干得好，<小伙子/小姑娘>。没有什么死犀牛能告诉赫米特·奈辛瓦里该去哪打猎、打什么猎。我们就让那堆骨头瞧瞧。",cEN="<Hemet listens as you describe what you learned.>\n\nWay to go, <lad/lass>. No dead rhino tells Hemet Nesingwary where and what he can hunt. We'll show that heap o' bones."}
Q[12545]={d="我们从一群天灾侵略者手中夺回了这座古老的达卡莱神殿。不到一百码以外，就是金萨卡拉城的废墟。天灾通灵师在那里大肆杀戮，将活着的达卡莱巨魔转变为巫妖王的奴仆。\n\n所有的一切都不再属于圣光了，因此所有的一切都必须得到净化。\n\n<瓦鲁斯无情地看着你。>\n\n所有的一切。",dEN="We wrested this ancient Drakkari temple from a swarm of invading Scourge. Not more than one-hundred paces from where we stand is the ruined city of Jintha'kalar. Scourge necromancers run amok, turning the living Drakkari trolls that remain into servants of the Lich King.\n\nAll are now lost to the Light. All must be purged.\n\n<Valus looks upon you sternly.>\n\nAll.",o="龙骨荒野圣光之望礼拜堂的北伐军战士瓦鲁斯要求你去消灭15个金萨卡拉天灾成员。",oEN="Crusader Valus at Light's Trust in Dragonblight has asked you to slay 15 Jintha'kalar Scourge.",p="不要留下任何东西给巫妖王复活！",pEN="Leave nothing for the Lich King to resurrect!",c="如你所见，天灾的战争机器仍在推进，而部落和联盟的军队依然分裂，成了容易得手的猎物。正因如此，我们必须团结一致。\n\n<瓦鲁斯陷入片刻沉思。>\n\n银色北伐军用得上你这样的<男人/女人>。也许你有兴趣加入我们的事业？与灰烬使者并肩作战、并肩赴死？",cEN="As you can see, the Scourge war machine presses onward, yet the armies of the Horde and the Alliance remain divided, making for easy prey. It is for this reason that we must remain united.\n\n<Valus is lost in contemplation for a moment.>\n\nThe Argent Crusade has use for a <man/woman> like you. Perhaps you would be interested in joining our cause? To battle and die at the side of the Ashbringer?"}
Q[12546]={d="时机成熟了，$n。源生石像是泰坦的诸类造物中杀伤力最强的武器之一，我本不愿在这片圣洁的土地上释放他的力量。\n\n但是，我别无选择。入侵者已经将我逼入绝境，就让泰坦的怒火将他们烧得一干二净吧。",dEN="It is time, <name>. The Etymidian is one of the most destructive forces ever created by the titans and I am loathe to unleash him in my lands.\n\nThere is little choice, however. Our enemies have forced my hand and the fury of the titans will cleanse all.",o="前往索拉查盆地的雪崩之地，使用欧米加符文部署埃提米迪安。用他杀死 200 名天灾爪牙、塑肉者拜修斯、千墓者乌尔格雷斯和冰雹之怒。\n\n完成任务后，与索拉查盆地的弗蕾亚化身交谈。",oEN="Go to the Avalanche in Sholazar Basin and use the Omega Rune to deploy Etymidian. Use him to slay 200 Scourge Minions, Bythius the Flesh-Shaper, Urgreth of the Thousand Tombs and Hailscorn.\n\nSpeak to the Avatar of Freya in Sholazar Basin when you've completed this task.",p="威胁生命的家伙们……你已经解决他们了吗？",pEN="Those who would threaten life... have they been dealt with?",c="我感谢你的帮助，<name>。守望这些土地以及栖息其上的一切生命是我的职责。\n\n多亏了你，在死亡势力蹂躏边境地区之时，这些生命仍将继续繁盛。\n\n我不会忘记你的作为。",cEN="I am grateful for your help, <name>. It is my duty to watch over these lands and all life that dwells on them.\n\nThanks to you, that life will continue to thrive while the forces of death wage in the bordering regions.\n\nYour actions will not be forgotten."}
Q[12547]={d="这尊巨大的石像仿佛陷入了沉睡。你注意到它的胸前有一块符文形状的凹槽。\n\n或许你可以在附近找到那块失踪的符文。",dEN="This colossal being appears to be inactive. You notice an empty rune-shaped slot on its chest.\n\nPerhaps you might be able to find the missing rune inside the nearby overlook.",o="在塑造者之台内找到欧米伽符文，将它带至源生石像身边。",oEN="Obtain the Omega Rune inside the Shaper's Terrace and bring it to The Etymidian.",p="<源生石像胸口的符文状凹槽似乎闪动着微弱的能量光芒。>",pEN="<The rune-shaped slot on The Etymidian's chest appears to glow with faint power.>",c="<当源生石像活动起来的时候你听见石头的摩擦声。>\n\n有哪里需要我吗？",cEN="<You hear the rumbling sound of stone grinding as The Etymidian's limbs come to life.>\n\nI am needed somewhere?"}
Q[12548]={d="时机成熟了，$n。封闭了七个世纪之久的界门已经打开。穿越界门，去寻找我们最后的希望。\n\n将那些企图玷污这片神圣土地的渣滓送入地狱。让我们释放源生石像的力量吧！",dEN="It is time, <name>. The Waygate has been activated for the first time in seven centuries. Use it to travel to where our final hope lies.\n\nLet us put an end to those who would seek to bring the taint of undeath to this pristine land. Let us unleash the Etymidian.",o="穿越索拉查盆地南端的界门，在另一侧寻找那件被称为源生石像的武器。",oEN="Go through the Waygate in the southern end of Sholazar Basin and look for the weapon known as the Etymidian on the other side.",c="<当你读过这座石巨像身上的铭文，你了解到这就是弗蕾亚所说的武器。这就是源生石像。>",cEN="<As you read the engravings on this stone colossus, you realize that this is the weapon that Freya spoke of. This is the Etymidian.>"}
Q[12549]={d="如果你和赫米特一起打过猎的话，就该知道他能轻而易举地应付多种大型猫科动物。但是索拉查盆地的恶刃豹却不然，这种凶残而敏捷的野兽比我见过的所有猫科动物都要凶狠。只有真正的猎手，才能征服这样的猎物。\n\n如果你愿意接受挑战，就勇敢地面对恶刃豹吧。营地四周的荒野以及河流南岸都有它们的踪迹。",dEN="If you've hunted with Hemet before, you know that he's tested his skill against many large cats, but the dreadsabers here in Sholazar are different. They're able to bring down larger game than I've ever seen a cat hunt. To overcome and kill such a predator is the mark of a true hunter.\n\nIf you seek to prove you're up to the challenge, test yourself against the dreadsabers. They live in the wilderness surrounding the camp and south of the river.",o="杀死15只恶刃豹，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Dreadsabers and return to Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你在恶刃豹身上测试过你的技巧了吗？",pEN="Have you tested your skills against the dreadsabers?",c="嗯，你已经证明了你是个能干的猎人，但你跟踪的本领又如何呢？",cEN="Well, you've proven yourself a capable hunter, but how are you as a tracker?"}
Q[12550]={d="我听说当地人流传着一头名叫杉苟的可怕巨型刃豹的故事。我没有见过杉苟存在的任何证据，但我的伤让我无法离开营地。\n\n如果你自认$g是:是;个不错的追踪者，也许你能查明杉苟的真相。德巴尔说她上次外出时看到了一些巨大的足迹。从营地往北去苦潮湖，在南岸寻找那些脚印。",dEN="I have heard that the natives tell stories of a large dreadsaber they call Shango. I haven't seen any evidence of this Shango's existence, but my injuries have kept me from venturing outside the camp.\n\nIf you fancy yourself something of a tracker, you might be able to find out the truth about Shango. Debaar said she saw some large tracks on her last outing. Go north from the camp toward Bittertide Lake, and search its southern shore for the prints.",o="奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔要你从苦潮湖附近的恶刃豹足迹中鉴别出3条杉苟的足迹。",oEN="Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp wants you to identify 3 Shango Tracks from the Dreadsaber Tracks near Bittertide Lake.",p="跟踪进行的如何了？",pEN="How goes the tracking?",c="我想你可能已经找到了我们需要的关于杉苟的证据。而且我想我知道该去哪里找它了。",cEN="I think you may have found the proof we need for this Shango. And I think I have an idea as to where we can find him."}
Q[12551]={d="我警告你，$g陌生人:陌生人;，不要对飞船坠毁这件事发表任何评论。探险队其他人说的话我已经受够了。\n\n不过，如果你想试试自己的狩猎本事，就该去挑战那些狡猾的沼泽鳄鱼。它们住在南边的河沿岸，以及东边的蛮藤谷。证明你能应付它们，我们再谈，$g猎人:女猎人;。",dEN="I warn you, stranger -- do not make any comments about crashing the ship. I already get enough of it from the rest of the expedition.\n\nIf you're looking to try your hand at hunting, though, you should test your skills against the wily mangal crocolisks. They live all along the river to the south, and in the Wildgrowth Mangal to the east. Prove you can hold your own against them and we'll talk again, hunter.",o="杀死15条蛮藤谷鳄鱼，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔复命。",oEN="Kill 15 Mangal Crocolisks and return to Debaar at the Nesingwary Encampment.",p="你杀了足够数量了吗？",pEN="Did you make the kills?",c="令人印象深刻，<class>。你确定你不是探险队的成员？\n\n不，我确定。这里面本该有个坠机笑话的。",cEN="Impressive, <class>. Are you certain you're not a member of the expedition?\n\nNo, I'm certain of it. There would've been a crash joke in there somewhere."}
Q[12552]={d="当巨魔们推倒科尔拉玛斯的时候，它就倒在我们的东南面。不幸的时候，当它倒塌的时候，里面的天灾军团并没有死绝。\n\n现在他们正在复活我们的士兵，并用他们来对付我们！\n\n我们必须阻止这种事。你一定要杀死他们的通灵师！明白了吗？",dEN="When the trolls brought down Kolramas, it crashed next to us to the southeast. Unfortunately the crash did not destroy all of the Scourge within.\n\nNow they're raising our men from the dead and using them against us!\n\nThis will not be allowed to continue. You will see to it that their necromagi are slaughtered! Do we understand each other?",o="达克索塔的穆尔沙·月影中士要你去杀死8个哈沙尔通灵师。",oEN="Sergeant Moonshard at Drak'Sotra has asked you to destroy 8 Hath'ar Necromagi.",p="不，<class>，你还没做完。我确切地知道科尔拉玛斯附近还有通灵法师在游荡。",pEN="No, <class>, you're not quite done. I know for a fact that there are still necromagi walking around at Kolramas.",c="这还远远不够！\n\n<中士的声音因为同伴的消亡而哀嚎粗哑。>\n\n我们必须采取更多行动来才能祭奠那些同伴！",cEN="It's not enough!\n\n<The sergeant's voice cracks as he mourns the corruption of his fallen comrades.>\n\nWe must do more to show respect for the memories of those men!"}
Q[12553]={d="为什么最棘手的任务总是派给我？\n\n科尔拉玛斯的天灾军团已经把药剂喷射器派到了离我们很近的地方，这是非常危险的。你不能想象如果他们朝这里来的话，会发生什么事！\n\n我有一个办法可以解决他们，但首先我们需要一些材料……要从天灾军团那里去弄。\n\n哈沙尔撒网者可以织出一种非常坚韧的网，正好为我们所用。给我带一些完整的喷丝头回来。",dEN="Why do I always get the tough tasks to tackle?\n\nThe Scourge at Kolramas have plague sprayers that are getting dangerously close. You don't want to know what's going to happen if they start heading this way!\n\nI've got an idea for how we might bring them down, but first we're going to need something... something from their own creatures.\n\nThe Hath'ar skimmers can spin a very strong web that we can put to good use. Bring back some of their spinnerets.",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要你去收集5个完整的撒网者喷丝头。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to collect 5 Intact Skimmer Spinnerets.",p="如果我要组装一个设备给你用的话，非得要用完整的丝囊不可。",pEN="Those spinnerets have to be intact if I'm going to be able to put them together into a device that you can use.",c="这些派的上用场！\n\n现在我们还需要一些原料来替你组装发射设备。",cEN="Those'll do!\n\nNow we're going to need some raw parts so that I can put the launching device together for you."}
Q[12554]={d="$n，去召集一些同伴，至少一个吧，再去科尔拉玛斯走一趟！\n\n科尔拉玛斯的首领，腐蚀者玛拉斯正在浮空城的顶端耀武扬威。\n\n去杀了他，把他的徽记给我带回来！",dEN="<name>, gather at least one other person and head back down there!\n\nYou'll find the leader of Kolramas, Malas the Corrupter, gloating from atop the crashed necropolis.\n\nKill him and bring me his head!",o="达克索塔的穆尔沙·月影中士要你带回腐蚀者的徽记。",oEN="Sergeant Moonshard at Drak'Sotra insists that you return with the Head of the Corrupter.",p="我期待着要把他的头挂在杆子上。让我们看看他这样还能不能复活！",pEN="I look forward to mounting his head on a pike. Let's see him come back from that!",c="你现在是风云人物了，<name>。\n\n<月影一脚把那个脑袋踢开。>\n\n你配得上我们最深的敬意，我想还不止这些。",cEN="You're the hero of the hour, <name>.\n\n<Moonshard kicks the head away from him.>\n\nYou deserve our deepest respect, and something more I think."}
Q[12555]={d="好了！投网器已经完成，你可以用它去摧毁那些药剂喷射器了。\n\n你只需要瞄准并按下发射键，蛛网就会扰乱它们的浮空法术，直到那些喷雾器像科尔拉玛斯一样坠毁。\n\n多有诗意啊。我喜欢！",dEN="There! One tangled skein thrower ready and waiting for you to take those plague sprayers down.\n\nYou just aim and let loose. The webbing should foul up their hover spells long enough to cause them to crash to the ground just like Kolramas.\n\nKind of poetic. I like that!",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要你使用缠绕投网器摧毁5台药剂喷射器。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to use the Tangled Skein Thrower in order to cause the destruction of 5 Plague Sprayers.",p="你确定你击坠够多了吗？我看起来像是很想要瘟疫的样子吗？",pEN="You sure you brought down enough of those things? Do I look like I want the plague?!",c="耶！你最棒了，<name>！\n\n我可一点都不想被天灾军团的东西喷一身，这是肯定的！我猜那些蠢蜘蛛现在要散播邪恶就难了！\n\n要不我给你点小礼物，谢谢你救了我一命？",cEN="Yay! You're the best, <name>!\n\nI wasn't looking forward to being sprayed with Scourge stuff, that's for sure! I guess it's going to be hard for those stupid nerubians to spread their evil now!\n\nHow about I give you a little something for saving my skin?"}
Q[12556]={d="既然我们知道该去哪里找法鲁恩了，剩下的就只有与那巨兽一战了。你$g准备:准备;好对付这头犀牛了吗，$n？尽管那灵魂在吹嘘，但我确信它说的关于这野兽力量的话是真的。\n\n当你$g准备:准备;好面对它时，往北越过抚阳之柱，在苦潮湖东北岸寻找法鲁恩。它甚至可能游荡到微光之柱附近。把它的角带回来，作为你猎杀的纪念。",dEN="Now that we know where to find Farunn, all that remains is the battle against the great beast. Are you ready to take on this rhino, <name>? For all the spirit's blustering, I'm certain it was telling the truth about the beast's strength.\n\nWhen you're ready to face him, head north past the Suntouched Pillar and look for Farunn on the northeast shore of the Bittertide Lake. It may even venture near the Glimmering Pillar. Bring back its horn to commemorate your kill.",o="将法鲁恩的犄角交给奈辛瓦里营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里。",oEN="Bring Farunn's Horn to Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你杀死那头野兽了吗？",pEN="Did you kill the beast?",c="<赫米特检查着那只角。>\n\n一头了不起的动物身上取下的惊人战利品！<name>，我一直听到传闻说盆地北端有更大、更凶猛的猎物，我希望你能帮我们追踪到它。",cEN="<Hemet examines the horn.>\n\nAn astounding trophy from an amazing animal! <name>, I've been hearing rumors of even bigger, more ferocious game in the northern reaches of the basin and I'd like you to help us track it down."}
Q[12557]={d="我猜，你也是个想成功跻身我的学徒行列的年轻$r吧。\n\n很好，年轻人很有志气……\n\n但是我是否会接受你的申请，取决于你到底都能为我做什么，能在我的实验室里帮到什么忙了。你看，这里面有无数的材料，有些备料充足，有些就短缺了。\n\n那么，$c，你得花点时间帮我找点东西。我要一只泥潭蛆虫、一片干瘪的蝙蝠翼、一粒琥珀种子和一些冰冷的毒蛇粘液。\n\n都找到的话，我就认真考虑你的请求。",dEN="I assume by your interruption that you wish to be numbered among those I am considering for apprenticeship.\n\nA worthy aspiration...\n\nShould I someday choose to accept your petition, I must be confident that you can find your way around my laboratory. I have many ingredients here; some plentiful, and others in short supply.\n\nTake your time, <class>. Find a muddy mire maggot, a withered batwing, an amberseed, and some chilled serpent mucus.\n\nSucceed, and I'll know to take your request seriously.",o="赫布瓦罗的炼金师菲肯斯坦要求你在他的实验室内找到一只泥潭蛆虫、一片干瘪的蝙蝠翼、一粒琥珀种子和一些冰冷的毒蛇粘液。",oEN="Alchemist Finklestein at Heb'Valok wants you to find a Muddy Mire Maggot, a Withered Batwing, an Amberseed, and some Chilled Serpent Mucus from within his laboratory.",p="你习惯我的实验室了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you become accustomed to my laboratory, <class>?",c="是的，是的，这是个不错的开始。\n\n如果我要请你帮忙配一剂真正的配方，你就得及时找到材料。\n\n记住这一点，<class>。\n\n再见。",cEN="Yes, yes, that's a good start.\n\nShould I call upon you to help me with an actual recipe, you'll need to locate ingredients in a timely manner.\n\nKeep that in mind, <class>.\n\nFarewell."}
Q[12558]={d="$n，杉苟在等着你呢。只要你的跟踪技术够娴熟，它就不会发现你，这样你就可以取得先手了。\n\n与索拉查盆地的其它恶刃豹相比，杉苟的体型应该更大，性情也更加凶残。往北走，你可以在苦潮湖西岸的瀑布附近找到杉苟的踪迹，向它发起挑战吧。如果你获胜了，就把它的毛皮给我带回来。",dEN="Shango awaits, <name>. If you have succeeded in your tracking, he will not know that you stalk him, and you will need the advantage.\n\nHe is supposed to be bigger, stronger, and more ferocious than the other dreadsabers of the basin. Travel north, to the western shore of Bittertide Lake and near the falls that feed it, do battle with Shango. If you succeed, return with his pelt.",o="将杉苟的毛皮交给奈辛瓦里营地的巴克·坎维尔。",oEN="Bring Shango's Pelt to Buck Cantwell at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你解决杉苟了吗？",pEN="Have you taken on Shango?",c="多么高贵动物的绝美毛皮！看到关于杉苟的传闻果然是真的，我很欣慰，<name>。你对这头生物的追踪完美无缺。你是真正的猎人。",cEN="What an exquisite pelt from such a noble animal! It heartens me to see that the rumors about Shango were indeed true, <name>. Your pursuit of the creature has been flawless. You are a true huntsman."}
Q[12559]={d="是时候了。让我们来引导界门吧。\n\n界门的第一道开关就在盆地西部边界的造物者之座内。\n\n千万小心，$n。那里是泰坦监视诸类造物的地方，如今仍然有许多石质魔像留守。",dEN="It is time then. Let us activate the waygate.\n\nYou will find the first switch inside the Maker's Perch in the western edge of the basin.\n\nBeware, <name>. The titans used the perch to watch over their creations. Many of their stone servants still guard the place.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要你转至造物者之座，引导界门开关 - 伽玛。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to go to the Maker's Perch and use the Activation Switch Gamma.",p="你回来了，小家伙。我都开始担心你的安危了。",pEN="You're back, little one. I was beginning to worry about your well-being.",c="我们已经走了一半，<name>。在取回埃提米迪安之前，还需要再激活一个开关。",cEN="We're halfway there, <name>. One more switch needs to be activated before we can retrieve the Etymidian."}
Q[12560]={d="蛮藤谷鳄鱼擅长偷袭猎物，我打算以牙还牙，就用这招来对付它们。因此，我们得为你制作一件完美的伪装。材料嘛，最好用生长在河边湖畔沙地上的沙蕨。\n\n它非常适合制作伪装。喏，南边的碎浪河，北边的苦潮湖和苦潮瀑布，以及东边的河流之心，这些河流或是湖泊附近的沙地上就有这种植物。",dEN="The mangal crocolisk is a master of the ambush, and I intend to beat the best at his game. To do that, we'll need to construct a convincing camouflage for you. We'll use plants that grow in the sandy soil of the riverbanks and lake beaches.\n\nThe sandfern is best for this purpose. It grows in the sandy areas near the shores of the Seabreach Flow, just to the south, Bittertide Lake and Bittertide Falls, to the north, and the edges of River's Heart, the large lake beyond the mangal to the east.",o="将5片沙蕨叶交给奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔。",oEN="Bring 5 Sandfern fronds to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你把我们需要的沙蕨叶带来了吗？",pEN="Did you bring all the ferns we'll need?",c="<蒂巴尔接过沙蕨叶然后开始把它们绑在你身上。>\n\n嗯，这样应该可以了。站好别动！我们会把你弄成一丛草！",cEN="<Debaar accepts the sandfern fronds from you and starts bending them around your body.>\n\nYes, this should work. Stand still! We'll make a bush of you yet."}
Q[12561]={d="这一切本不该发生的。亡灵大军如风暴般席卷了这处生命的摇篮！\n\n如果你的来意不是铲除巫妖王的爪牙，就请立即离开。若是再打扰我，必将招致我的愤怒与憎恶。",dEN="This should never have happened. The forces of undeath storm the very cradle of life!\n\nIf you're not here to destroy the minions of the Lich King, then leave at once. Do not incur my wrath by distracting me from my duties.",o="进入迷失之地，消灭6个毁坏的天灾怪和10个骨镰劫掠者，以此获得弗蕾亚的信任。",oEN="Obtain Freya's trust by destroying 6 Blighted Corpses and 10 Bonescythe Ravagers in the Lost Lands.",p="不要浪费我的时间，凡人。泰坦的创作一定得好好守护！",pEN="Do not waste my time, mortal. The titans' creations must be defended!",c="很好，<race>。我很满意你不是巫妖王的爪牙……也许毕竟还有些事你能为我们做。",cEN="Very well, <race>. I am satisfied that you're not one of the Lich King's minions... perhaps there is something you can do for us after all."}
Q[12562]={d="情报显示，自从那些水元素出现在达克索塔农田之后，不少达卡莱萨满从祖达克的上层下来控制它们。\n\n我必须强调，$g先生:女士;，那会有多危险。我们不希望他们拥有可供驱使的水元素。\n\n指挥官已经下令处死那些达卡莱缚水者。等你$g准备好:准备好;就往南去。",dEN="Intelligence reports that ever since those water elementals appeared in the Drak'Sotra Fields, a number of Drakkari shaman have come down from the upper tiers of Zul'Drak to take control of them.\n\nI cannot stress enough, <sir /ma'am>, how dangerous that could prove. We do not want them to have water elementals at their disposal.\n\nThe commander has ordered that these Drakkari water binders are to be put to the sword. Head south when you're ready.",o="银色前沿的亚克斯中尉要求你去消灭10名达卡莱缚水者。",oEN="Sub-Lieutenant Jax at The Argent Stand has asked you to kill 10 Drakkari Water Binders.",p="如果要我说的话，你应该再多对付几个达卡莱缚水者。",pEN="If I may suggest, you might want to take care of a few more of those Drakkari water binders.",c="干得太出色了，<先生/女士>！\n\n我会确保指挥官得知你这次任务的结果。",cEN="Excellent work, <sir /ma'am>!\n\nI'll see to it that the commander is apprised of your mission results."}
Q[12563]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你拜访四座银色北伐军的岗哨，并完成那里的上尉交给你的任务，然后回去向他复命。\n\n布兰顿上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在达克索塔。格隆迪尔上尉驻扎在达克迦尔。炼金师菲肯斯坦驻扎在赫布瓦罗。",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok.",p="我们的岗哨有什么消息吗，<race>？",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="好吧，<name>，至少你完好无损地回来了。我想这多少还算有点价值……",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12564]={d="我的弟兄们虽然坚韧勇猛，但他们毕竟是血肉之躯。\n\n受伤和疼痛削弱了他们完成任务的能力，没有什么训练或者诀窍可以改变这一点。\n\n值得欣慰的是，我们的炼金师发明了一种药膏，与我们的绷带一起使用的话，可以大大缓解士兵的疼痛。\n\n药膏需要用到一种特殊的罂粟，正好这里的巨魔在西边的达克索塔农田中种了不少。去采一些罂粟回来，以保证我们的库存充足。",dEN="Gritty as my men are, they're still mortal.\n\nWounds and pain diminish their ability to perform their missions. No amount of training changes that simple fact of life.\n\nThankfully, one of our alchemists has developed a recipe for a salve that binds to our bandages and greatly reduces the pain our soldiers experience.\n\nThe salve requires a special poppy these trolls cultivate just west of here. Go to Drak'Sotra Fields and harvest some of them to keep our stockpiles from running out.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你从达克索塔农田采集5份成熟的水罂粟。",oEN="Captain Brandon at Drak'Sotra wants you to collect 5 Mature Water-Poppies from Drak'Sotra Fields.",p="你采集到水罂粟了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you collected the water-poppies, <name>?",c="标本很好，<name>。\n\n我代表我的士兵们，感谢你今天的付出。\n\n鲁伯特上尉很可能是你巡逻的下一站。他就驻扎在这东边的城墙上。",cEN="Fine specimens, <name>.\n\nOn behalf of my soldiers, I thank you for your efforts today.\n\nCaptain Rupert is likely the next stop on your patrol. He's stationed at the wall just east of here."}
Q[12565]={d="你们的银色北伐军在消灭天灾这件事情上表现出了极大的热诚，这让我非常感动，$r。我很愿意助你们一臂之力。\n\n达卡莱巨魔曾经在这座盛极一时的城市中定期供奉他们的神灵，而现在他们非但对神灵毫无敬意，甚至表现得更糟糕了。\n\n如果你去供奉神灵的话，他们一定会对你表示感谢的。\n\n希姆埃巴的雕像就在这里的西南面，强大的希姆埃巴会接受你供奉的达卡莱圣物，作为你正在保护祖达克的证明。",dEN="I am heartened to see the zeal with which your Argent Crusade is dealing with the Scourge, <race>. I would like to help with your efforts.\n\nThe Drakkari trolls of this once-great city used to make regular offerings to their gods, but now neglect them, or worse.\n\nIf you were to make offerings to the gods, they would show their appreciation in return.\n\nZim'Abwa's statue is just to the southwest. Zim'Abwa would gladly accept your offerings of Drakkari artifacts as a sign that you are protecting Zul'Drak.",o="银色前沿的妖术师乌布戈要求你在希姆埃巴的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Hexxer Ubungo at The Argent Stand wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Abwa.",p="<希姆埃巴深邃地凝望着北方与南方。>",pEN="<Zim'Abwa stares inscrutably to the north and the south.>",c="<如果希姆埃巴的脸部能动的话，他会对你露出一个凶恶的笑容。>",cEN="<If Zim'Abwa could move his face, Zim'Abwa would make a vicious grin.>"}
Q[12566]={d="我是坦卡牛头人的信使纳尼克，受冬蹄营地酋长之命，为对抗维库人的战斗寻找盟友。他们聚集在我们村子的西面和南面，虽然我们每损失一人就能杀死他们十个，但我们再也支撑不住了。\n\n药剂师西利斯答应会派勇敢的$c到西北方来援助我们。你愿意帮助我们的人民击退维库人的侵袭吗？\n\n沿着那条向西北越过河流、深入山麓的道路，就能到达冬蹄营地。 $g有兴趣:有兴趣;",dEN="I am Longrunner Nanik of the Taunka, sent by the chieftain of Camp Winterhoof to seek out allies in the fight against the vrykul. They mass to the west and south of our village, and though we slay 10 of them for every one of our dead, we cannot hold.\n\nApothecary Scyllis has promised to send brave <class>s northwest to our aid. Will you help my people fend off the vrykul assaults?\n\nFollow the road far to the northwest, across the river, and into the foothills of the mountains to reach Camp Winterhoof.",o="与冬蹄营地的灰烬图腾酋长谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Chieftain Ashtotem at Camp Winterhoof.",c="那么，纳尼克真的找到帮手了？告诉我，<name>，没有他你是怎么到这里的？没有人比坦卡牛头人更了解这片土地。",cEN="So, Nanik did find help then? Tell me, <name>, how is it you made it here without him? None know this land better than the Taunka."}
Q[12567]={p="<希姆埃巴的视线穿透了你的灵魂。\n\n你取悦了希姆埃巴，但是他还想要你给他更多达卡莱供品来表达你的感激与尊敬。\n\n他会好好奖励你的。>",pEN="<Zim'Abwa's stony visage pierces your soul.\n\nZim'Abwa is pleased, but wants you to show more appreciation and respect by giving him more Drakkari offerings.\n\nHe will reward you in kind.>",c="<你感觉到希姆埃巴的赞许。不知怎么，你知道希姆埃巴还想要更多的贡品！>",cEN="<You sense Zim'Abwa's approval. Somehow you know that Zim'Abwa wants more tribute!>"}
Q[12568]={d="相信我，$r，我知道……\n\n焚烧尸体的味道让我，一个被遗忘者，都感到恶心。不过，确保我们的战友永远不会成为天灾的伙伴，这是我们庄严的职责。\n\n把这种焚化油倒在我们倒下的同伴身上，确保他们不会在战场上与我们互相残杀。",dEN="Trust me, <race>. I know....\n\nThe smell of burnt flesh has become sickening to even me, a Forsaken. Nevertheless, it is our solemn duty to ensure that our brethren never walk with the Scourge.\n\nPour this oil on the corpses of our fallen to ensure that we never face them on the battlefield as enemies.",o="鲁伯特上尉希望你转至达克索塔，在5名战死的银色步兵身上使用焚化油。",oEN="Captain Rupert wants you to use the Incinerating Oil on 5 Defeated Argent Footmen in Drak'Sotra.",c="谢谢你，<name>。\n\n这不是战场上最光荣的工作，但必须有人做。我会在报告里记下你的贡献。\n\n格隆德尔上尉很可能在东北方、竞技场外面等着你。",cEN="Thank you, <name>.\n\nIt's not the most glorious job on the battlefield, but it must be done. I'll make note of your service in my report.\n\nCaptain Grondel is likely waiting for you to the northeast, just outside the amphitheater."}
Q[12569]={d="盆地中最大的鳄鱼，因为擅长伏击而被当地人称为\"伏击者\"，喜欢在河流之心的浅水里晒太阳。那是盆地中央的大湖，在我们营地以东。\n\n我要你带上我准备好的伪装，藏在河流之心的西岸，等伏击者现身时伏击它。如果你能打败它，就把它那有力的下颚带回来。",dEN="The largest crocolisk in the basin, known around here as \"Bushwhacker\" for his ambush prowess, likes to sun himself in the shallow waters of River's Heart. It's the large lake at the basin's center, and is to the east of our camp.\n\nI want you to take the camouflage I've prepared and hide on the western beach of River's Heart and ambush Bushwhacker when he shows himself. Bring back his mighty jaws if you are able to overcome him.",o="将丛林霸王的颚骨交给奈辛瓦里营地的蒂巴尔。",oEN="Bring Bushwhacker's Jaw to Debaar at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="我们的计划成功了吗？",pEN="Did our plan work?",c="<蒂巴尔听你描述了伪装的失败。>\n\n你是说，我们的计划不如预期中的有效？\n\n好吧，至少听你说起来你还是成功杀掉它了。看看这颚骨的尺寸！赫米特会为我们的成果感到骄傲的——这条鳄鱼真是只怪兽。",cEN="<Debaar listens as you describe the failure of the disguise.>\n\nWhat do you mean, our plan didn't work as intended?\n\nWell, you did manage to get the kill, to your credit. Look at the size of this jaw! Hemet will be proud of our efforts. This crocolisk was truly a monster."}
Q[12570]={d="对不起！我不是故意给你惹麻烦的！\n\n<受伤的神谕者茫然地盯着你好一会儿。>\n\n你救了我！我们谢谢你。我们现在要回村子去了。你也来吧……你可以和我们待在一起！小狗人本来就不太好。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;出发时告诉我，好吗？",dEN="I sorry! I not mean to get you in trouble!\n\n<The injured oracle stares at you blankly for a long while.>\n\nYou save me! We thank you. We going to go back to village now. You come too... you can stay with us! Puppy-men kind of mean anyway.\n\nLet me know when you ready to go, okay?",o="护送受伤的雨声神谕者返回雨声树屋，然后与高阶神谕者索乌塞谈一谈。",oEN="Escort the Injured Rainspeaker Oracle to Rainspaker Canopy and speak to High-Oracle Soo-say.",p="你是谁？你闻起来跟小狗人一样臭。",pEN="Who you? You stink of puppy-men.",c="你帮我们？那我们欢迎你，<name>。",cEN="You help us? You welcome then, <name>."}
Q[12571]={d="在小狗人来之前我们就在这里了。这地方非常神圣。我们不会离开。\n\n你看起来也许$g是好人:是好人;，但为以防万一，拉芙会跟着你。我们想你能理解。\n\n有蛇想吃了我们的幼崽。跟拉芙一起去让它们停下，好吗？尤其是东北方瀑布附近那条大的。",dEN="We were here long before the puppy-men came. This is very sacred place - we will not leave.\n\nYou seem like maybe you good, but we have Lafoo stay with you just in case. You understand we think.\n\nThere snakes thing that keeps trying to eat our hatchlings. Go with Lafoo and make them stop, okay? Especially big one near waterfall to northeast.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你杀死毒尖和10条帝王眼镜蛇。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to kill Venomtip and 10 Emperor Cobras.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="<高阶神谕者索乌塞的视线似乎直直穿过你。>",pEN="<High-Oracle Soo-say seems to stare right through you.>",c="蛇走了吗？\n\n好<race>。我们谢谢你。",cEN="Snake gone?\n\nGood <race>. We thank you."}
Q[12572]={d="苏-平斯坦派我们跟着你。你要乖一点，好吗？\n\n哦，哦！我们知道了！如果我们给神殿带回更多供品，苏-平斯坦会高兴的！我们不用走远，村子周围总有东西可挖……只要找土里闪闪发光的东西就行！\n\n走吧！走吧！给神殿更多供品！ $g乖:乖;",dEN="Soo-say said we go with you. You be nice, okay?\n\nOoh, ooh! We know! We can make Soo-say happy if we bring back more offerings for shrine! We not need to go far, there's always stuffs to dig up around village... just look for sparkles in dirt!\n\nLet's go! Let's go! More offerings for shrine!",o="收集6份拉弗乌从土堆里挖出的闪闪发亮的宝贝，将它们交给雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Collect 6 of the treasures that Lafoo digs up and bring them to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="嗨，干燥皮肤的朋友。你跟拉弗乌相处的好吗？",pEN="Hello dryskin. You get along with Lafoo good?",c="给伟大神祇的亮晶晶！好！很好！\n\n我们立刻把这些献祭。拉弗乌想到的是吗？他是个很聪明的神谕者。",cEN="Shinies for the Great Rain Stone! Good! Good!\n\nWe offer these right away. Lafoo thought of this, yes? He a very smart Rainspeaker."}
Q[12573]={d="我们有个好主意。你以前是小狗人的$g朋友:朋友;，他们也许会听你的。\n\n我们想让你给萨满维吉克送一份供品。他在西南方，河流变成瀑布的地方。告诉小狗人我们不想打架。告诉他我们很友善。\n\n你是$g好:好;。我们相信你能办好。",dEN="We have great idea. You were friends with puppy-men, they maybe listen to you.\n\nWe want you to go give offering to Shaman Vekjik. He southwest where river turns into waterfall. Tell puppy-man we no want fight. Tell him we play nice.\n\nYou good <race>. We trust you do this right.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你将雨声议和礼物交给萨满祭司维克伊克，然后转达他的响应。\n\n如果你弄丢了拉弗乌的虫袋，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to give a peace offering to Shaman Vekjik and then return with his response.\n\nIf you lose Lafoo's Bug Bag, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="小狗人好相处吗？",pEN="Puppy-men play nice now?",c="好坏！我们一直好他们一直坏。\n\n他们还想找迷雾巨石麻烦……也许他们不知道迷雾巨石是神圣的。",cEN="So mean! We only be nice and they only be mean.\n\nThey keep messing with great stones... maybe they not know great stones are sacred."}
Q[12574]={d="<高阶神谕者索乌塞盯着你的额头看了好一会儿才开口讲话。>\n\n索乌甘需要帮助。他们可能再次遭到了狗狗人的袭击。\n\n我们决定派你和亚鲁乌特去帮忙……沿着河流一直往西就能抵达雾语村。服从索乌甘的指令……把狗狗人的鼻子都揍歪，看他们以后还敢不敢惹事。\n\n<在你离开前，高阶神谕者索乌塞再次凝视着你的额头。>",dEN="<High-Oracle Soo-say stares at your forehead for a while before speaking.>\n\nSoo-gan ask for help. We think they might have been attacked by puppy-men again.\n\nWe sending you and Jaloot to help... follow west river up to Mistwhisper Refuge. Do what Soo-gan says... hit the puppy-men on the nose if they being mean, they don't like that.\n\n<High-Oracle Soo-say goes back to staring at your forehead as you leave.>",o="转至雾语村，与唤雾者索乌甘谈一谈。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Travel to Mistwhisper Refuge and speak to Mistcaller Soo-gan.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",c="我们觉得我们看过你。你曾经来过雾语村？\n\n索乌塞说你好。索乌塞很聪明，所以我们也相信你。\n\n<唤雾者索乌甘露出了一个笨拙的笑容。>",cEN="We think we seen you before. You visit Mistwhisper village sometime already?\n\nSoo-say said you good. Soo-say smart, so we trust you too.\n\n<Mistcaller Soo-gan offers an awkwardly large smile.>"}
Q[12575]={d="狗狗人又来迷雾巨石捣乱了，他们敲碎了蓝色水晶！你瞧这又是暴雨又是闪电的……不能在迷雾巨石使用蓝色水晶啊！狗狗人真该死！\n\n他们还趁乱偷走了我们在大湖中找到的宝藏。我们本来是要将它供奉给迷雾巨石的！迷雾巨石很生气，后果很严重！\n\n就是被那个塔特尔……呃，好像是塔塔克……不对不对……哦，是塔尔特克。哼，就是被塔尔特克偷走的！他逃到北边的营地去了。抢回我们的宝贝！",dEN="So some puppy-men come and smash blue crystals at Great Mist Stone! Lots of rain and lightning and badness... blue is wrong crystal for Great Mist Stone! Dumb puppy-men.\n\nAfter lightning, puppy-men stole big treasure we found in the sea-lake. We need treasure back to give to Great Mist Stone! Mist Stone is angry after what the puppy-men did!\n\nOne who took it named Tarter... no, Tiktak... no, no... Tartek. That it, Tartek! He went to the camp thing to north. Go get treasure back!",o="雾语村的唤雾者索乌甘要你杀死督军塔尔特克，并取回雾语宝物。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Kill Warlord Tartek and retrieve the Mistwhisper Treasure for Mistcaller Soo-gan at Mistwhisper Refuge.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="那些笨小狗贼，哼。",pEN="Dumb puppy-thieves.",c="你办到了！你又强又好！真是雾语村的好朋友！\n\n<唤雾者索乌甘露齿大笑。>",cEN="You did it! You strong and nice! Good friend of Mistwhispers!\n\n<Mistcaller Soo-gan lets loose a big toothy grin.>"}
Q[12576]={d="自从狗狗人来到这里，我们就一直想和他们保持友好关系，但是他们却不领情。\n\n本来嘛，狗狗人傻乎乎的，倒不至于造成什么麻烦。可现在他们竟然想打祭坛的主意。神圣的祭坛不容他们侵犯！这些巨石是伟大的造物主在创世的时候为我们竖立在这里的。\n\n要是迷雾巨石被破坏的话，我们该怎么办呀。去北边的狗狗人营地，阻止他们！",dEN="We try to be nice to puppy-men ever since they came, but they nothing but mean.\n\nWe okay with them being dumb - they not do much harm. Now they mess with sacred shrines though. Sacred shrines not for messing with. The Great Stones are here from all the way back when the Great Ones made us.\n\nWe wouldn't know what to do if the Great Mist Stone were hurt. Go to their camp to north... make puppy-men stop and not come back!",o="雾语村的唤雾者索乌甘要你杀死8个狂心持矛者和6个狂心清除者。\n\n如果你弄丢了亚鲁乌特的宝贝水晶，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Kill 8 Frenzyheart Spearbearers and 6 Frenzyheart Scavengers for Mistcaller Soo-gan at Mistwhisper Refuge.\n\nIf you lose Jaloot's Favorite Crystal, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="他们总是想打架！我们不想打架，但我们要保护宝物。",pEN="They always want fight! We no want fight, but we need to protect sacred stuffs.",c="你打得好。谢谢你的帮忙。",cEN="You squash good. Thank you for help."}
Q[12577]={d="你是$g好:好;干皮……雾语安全了，宝物安全了，小狗人现在肯定会放过我们。\n\n你回唤雨者树冠去，告诉苏-平斯坦你干得很好。",dEN="You're a good dryskin. Mistwhisper safe, treasure safe, and puppy-men sure to leave us alone now.\n\nYou go back to Rainspeaker Canopy and tell Soo-say you done good.",o="返回雨声树屋。",oEN="Return to Rainspeaker Canopy.",c="你好快就回来了！\n\n那么，很顺利咯？",cEN="You back so soon!\n\nWent good then, yeah?"}
Q[12578]={d="我以为你没这么快回来呢，看来是我错了。我正打算派莫乌德去警告附近苔行村的朋友们，叫他们别过来祭坛这边。苔行村在东边，就在倒塌的大石柱的东北方。\n\n你也一起去吧！莫乌德很聪明……听他的没错啦。",dEN="I not think you be back in time to go out again, but I wrong. I sending Moodle to nearby Mosswalker friends to bop silly Mosswalkers for not coming see shrine. Their village is east, up ridge, northeast of broken pillar.\n\nYou go with Moodle! He extra smart Rainspeaker... you listen to him good-like.",o="抵达苔行村后与莫乌德谈一谈。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Travel to Mosswalker Village and speak to Moodle once you've arrived.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="苏-说说话有点结巴，但他不笨。不过我觉得他太宽容了……小狗人不会停手，也不会放过我们。阻止他们的唯一办法就是杀掉他们……根本没有\"和平\"。\n\n<穆德挺起胸膛，指着自己。>\n\n这个我很擅长。",pEN="Soo-say fumbles a bit, but he's not dumb. I do think he's been far too forgiving though... the puppy-men are not going to stop or leave us alone. The only way to stop them is to kill them... there is no \"peace.\"\n\n<Moodle puffs up his chest and points to himself.>\n\nThat I am good at.",c="在你开口说话之前，不要以为我跟你见过的神谕者一样愚蠢。我曾经去世界各地旅行过，也学会了你们的语言，而我并不好骗。\n\n我们来之前我就知道苔行鳄鱼人已经死了，但我并不知道背后的原因是不死生物。\n\n他们应该不能进入这块地方的……一定是源血之柱的毁灭让他们跑了进来。我们必须把他们赶走。",cEN="Before you say anything, do not assume me as foolish as most of the Oracles you've met. I've been into the world a bit, I've learned your language, and I'm not easily duped.\n\nI knew the Mosswalkers were dead before we ever came, though I didn't know that the undead were behind it.\n\nThey are not supposed to be able to enter this land... the destruction of the Lifeblood Pillar must have allowed them in somehow. We must see to it that they leave."}
Q[12579]={d="我早就猜测那些大石柱是导致气候异常温暖的原因，也正是它们的力量替我们抵挡了亡灵的入侵……看来我的观点得到了初步的验证。\n\n不久前，源血之柱在巨大的爆炸声中轰然倒塌。紧接着苔行村就遭遇了不幸，气候也随即突变……转眼之间就有雪花飘落，我们从来没有见过这样的天气。\n\n苔行村的居民为苔藓巨石供奉大量的源血水晶，这才阻止了降雪。如果我们也这么做的话，说不定能抵御亡灵的进犯。",dEN="I've always suspected that the pillars have been the main reason for our weather and seclusion from the undead... this confirms it a bit.\n\nNot terribly long ago, there was a sound of a great explosion when the Lifeblood Pillar fell. The weather changed for the mosswalkers almost immediately... it began to snow, something we never see.\n\nThey were able to stop the snow by bringing more lifeblood crystals to the Great Moss Stone. Perhaps if we can do the same, it will help ward off the undead as well.",o="莫乌德要你去收集10块源血碎片，但是你最好不要进入石柱中的洞穴。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Moodle wants you to collect 10 Lifeblood Shards, but stay away from the cave inside of the pillar itself.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="苔行鳄鱼人都是好人……他们不该碰上这样的事情。",pEN="The Mosswalkers were good people... they did not deserve this.",c="我们要以碎片来改变现状也许晚了一点，然而我们的选择实在不多。",cEN="We might be too late for the shards to make a difference, but our options are somewhat limited."}
Q[12580]={d="说不定苔行村中还有幸存者……我们不能眼睁睁地看着他们都沦为亡魂。\n\n我们要揪出这场惨剧的主谋，替他们报仇，顺便看看还有没有幸存者。",dEN="There's some small chance that the Mosswalkers are not all dead yet... and at the very least, they deserve to not be butchered like this.\n\nLet's find some revenge for this slaughter and see if there are any to be saved in the process.",o="莫乌德要你转至苔行村搭救6名苔行村受害者。也许有些鳄鱼人已经命在旦夕，难以挽救了。\n\n如果你弄丢了莫乌德的皮球，就去找雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞。",oEN="Moodle wants you to rescue 6 of the Mosswalker Victims in Mosswalker Village, though some of them may no longer be alive to save.\n\nIf you lose Moodle's Stress Ball, speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy.",p="我真希望我早一点知道柱子和石头之间的联系……也许我就能预防这一切。",pEN="I wish I had known how key the pillars and the stones were much earlier... perhaps I could have prevented this.",c="我很高兴我们幸运地救到了几个苔行鳄鱼人。他们会平安的回到雨声树屋的。",cEN="I'm very glad there were some to be saved... with luck, they'll make it back to Rainspeaker Canopy safely."}
Q[12581]={d="或许水晶真的可以逐渐恢复抵御亡灵的能力，但有件事还是要我们尽快去处理的。\n\n只有除掉这群亡灵的首领，才能确保我们不会再受侵害。如果我没猜错的话，他应该躲在倒塌的大石柱中……很可能就在崩裂碎片一带。\n\n那附近留有尸体拖拽过的痕迹，足以暗示他的行踪。\n\n我要去供奉水晶碎片，然后向索乌塞汇报消息……所以亡灵首领就交给你对付了，不过你可能需要朋友的帮助。",dEN="Perhaps the crystals will ward off the undead gradually, but there is one more thing that must be done.\n\nWe need to find the leader of these undead and kill him to ensure there's no one to push the wretches back upon us. If my suspicions are correct, he will be somewhere inside the fallen pillar... the Sundered Shard.\n\nThe corpses being dragged there would suggest as much anyway.\n\nI'll place the shards and bring the news to Soo-say... you will need to find other help in the meantime.",o="杀死残忍的阿图里斯。\n\n莫乌德不能陪你执行这项任务，因此你最好召集其它伙伴帮忙。",oEN="Kill Artruis the Heartless.\n\nWhile securing the aid of friends is highly recommended, Moodle will not be able to accompany you on this task.",p="<护命匣掉落在阿图里斯的尸体旁边。>",pEN="<The phylactery rests ominously on the ground next to Artruis's dead form.>",c="<阿图里斯的护命匣里面看起来像是一团无尽的虚空……你觉得你听见了里面远远传来了尖叫声。>\n\n<在你即将离开的时候，你看到一个物体漂浮在虚空中，就在你伸手可触的地方。>",cEN="<Inside Artruis's Phylactery you see what seems like an endless void... and you think you hear screaming in the distance from somewhere inside.>\n\n<As you're about to leave, you see an object floating in the void, just barely in reach.>"}
Q[12582]={c="我知道你不像其它人说的一样是个叛徒。我们一起打过猎……我比他们都了解你。谢谢你救了我。\n\n听起来可能很好笑……我虽然不喜欢大舌头……但看着大舌头那样死去我也觉得有点难过……公平的战斗要好的多。\n\n你想再次跟狂心氏族当好朋友？我想我可以说服他们说你救了我，而且狠狠的打了大舌头。不过我可不想让你把我搞得很愚蠢似的，所以你确定不跟大舌头当朋友了吗？",cEN="I know you weren't traitor thing like others said. We hunt together... I know you better than all of them. Thank you for saving me.\n\nMay sound funny... I not a big fan of big-tongues... but even I feel little bad for big-tongue dying like that though... fair fight much better... they fight good enough they deserve fair fight.\n\nYou want to be friends with Frenzyheart again? I think I can convince them that you save me and got the big-tongues good. I no want you to make me look dumb though, so you sure?"}
Q[12583]={d="我听说有一台药剂喷射器坠毁在西边的达克索塔一带。\n\n你为什么不去试试，看能不能找到它？我可以使用这台喷射器的零件制造一件设备，击落其它的喷射器！",dEN="I know that one of those plague sprayers crashed somewhere within Drak'Sotra to the west of us.\n\nWhy don't you see if you can find it. I can use the parts from the sprayer to create the device that's going to bring those things down!",o="达克索塔的专家考格维尔要求你去收集药剂喷射器零件。",oEN="Specialist Cogwheel at Drak'Sotra has asked you to collect Plague Sprayer Parts.",p="你拿到零件了吗？嗯？拿到没？",pEN="Do you have the parts? Huh? Do you?",c="<你把零件拿给专家看的时候他退后了一点。>\n\n呃，这些东西还真恶心！\n\n好吧，好吧，把东西交给我，我来看看我能做些什么。也许我该叫你先拿去找牧师净化一下再拿来的。",cEN="<The specialist steps back a bit when presented with the parts.>\n\nEw, those things are totally gross!\n\nOkay, okay, hand them over and I'll see what I can do. I probably should have had you take them to a priest first for purification."}
Q[12584]={d="情报指出，被巨魔击坠在东南方的浮空城科尔拉玛斯里面有大量的萨隆邪铁矿石。\n\n我的斥候告诉我，很多矿石就散落在那座要塞的内部。\n\n银色前沿的伊崔格和他的朋友希望能弄到一些萨隆邪铁，以便对它进行研究。\n\n我希望你去跑一趟，看看能否收集到足够多的样本。",dEN="We know that Kolramas, the crashed necropolis to the southeast, was carrying a large amount of an ore known as saronite when the trolls shot it down.\n\nMy scouts tell me that much of the saronite is strewn about within the innards of that thing.\n\nEitrigg and his friends back at The Argent Stand want a bunch of the stuff so that they can study it.\n\nI want you to head in there and see if you can collect enough for them.",o="鲁伯特上尉要求你收集10份大块的萨隆邪铁，并将它们交给银色前沿的伊崔格。",oEN="Captain Rupert has asked you to collect 10 Chunks of Saronite and deliver them to Eitrigg at The Argent Stand.",p="怎么了，<class>？\n\n拜托，告诉我你拿到了我们请鲁伯特上尉去弄的萨隆邪铁？",pEN="Yes, <class>?\n\nPlease tell me that you have the saronite that we requested Captain Rupert to acquire?",c="你没感觉到这东西的纯粹邪恶吗？\n\n我们得利用手头上的专家和魔法，然后结合圣光的力量，才能穿透这缠绕着污秽矿石的邪恶帷幕。我们得确定它的来源。\n\n快，把萨隆邪铁矿石交给我！",cEN="Can you not feel the pure evil of the stuff?\n\nWe must use the expertise and magics at our disposal, combined with the power of the Holy Light, to pierce the veil of iniquity surrounding this tainted ore. We must determine its origins.\n\nQuickly, hand the saronite to me!"}
Q[12585]={d="好吧，这事可能不怎么有趣，但总要有人去做。\n\n我的部队已经在没膝的死水里连续激战数天了。这样对身体可不好。\n\n他们需要的一堆温暖的篝火，不但能把他们自己烤干，还可以鼓舞士气。\n\n这座城市整天都湿漉漉的，但这些荆木树的枯根却有抗潮的能力。\n\n请帮我们收集一些点火的燃料来，我们会非常感谢你的。",dEN="Well, it ain't glamorous, but it needs doin'.\n\nMy troops have been fightin' their hearts out while knee-deep in stagnant water for days on end. That just can't be good fer ya.\n\nWhat they need is a nice fire to dry 'em out and lighten their spirits.\n\nThis part of the city's soaked, but the dead roots of these thornwood trees have a way of resistin' the moisture.\n\nRound us up some fuel for burnin' and we'll be mighty grateful.",o="达克迦尔的格隆迪尔上尉要你为他收集20份枯死的荆木。",oEN="Captain Grondel at Drak'Agal wants you to bring him 20 pieces of Dead Thornwood.",p="你弄到生火的木柴了吗，<race>？",pEN="Ya got the wood fer a fire, <race>?",c="你真是太好了，<name>。真的太好了。\n\n现在你会发现阿纳斯船长就在这西边、小丘那边。",cEN="Mighty kind of ya, <name>. Mighty kind indeed.\n\nNow you'll be findin' Cap'n Arnath due west o' here, just over the rise."}
Q[12587]={d="拔出你的武器，$r。巡逻的时候到了！\n\n我们要拼死保住手中的四座岗哨，这对我们取得胜利有着关键性的意义。我要你去逐一巡查这几处岗哨，并向他们提供帮助。\n\n你可以从东南方的布兰顿上尉那里开始。等你完成他指派的任务后，他就会指引你去下一座岗哨。\n\n巡查完所有四座岗哨后再回来向我复命。记住——你回来得越快，报酬就越丰厚！所以给我动作麻利一点！\n\n解散！",dEN="Unsheathe that weapon, <race>. It's time to go on patrol!\n\nI've got four posts under my command and it's crucial to our success that they remain in our control. I'm ordering you to visit each of them and offer your assistance.\n\nYou can begin with Captain Brandon southeast of here. He'll direct you to the next post when he's finished with you.\n\nReport back to me once you've assisted each of my men. And remember, you'll be more richly rewarded for returning to me quickly - so double-time it!\n\nDismissed!",o="银色前沿的昆兹指挥官要你拜访银色北伐军的四处岗哨，执行他们上尉的命令，然后回来向他汇报。\n\n布兰登上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在达克索塔，格隆德尔上尉驻扎在达克阿加尔，炼金师芬克尔斯坦驻扎在赫布瓦洛克。",oEN="Commander Kunz at the Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their captain's orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Captain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, and Alchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'valok.",p="我们的岗哨有什么消息吗，<race>？",pEN="What news from our posts, <race>?",c="好吧，<name>，至少你完好无损地回来了。我想这多少还算有点价值……",cEN="Well, <name>, at least you've made it back in one piece. I suppose that's worth something...."}
Q[12588]={d="我们的一个士兵在上次进攻时发现了一张古老的藏宝图。如果这玩意是真的，那么在这附近应该埋藏着极其珍贵的巨魔圣物。\n\n我的部队正在达卡莱巨魔和天灾军团的夹击下忙得不可开交，所以只好派你去把这事情查清楚。\n\n拿上这把铲子，在西南面的松土堆上挖挖看，在你完成了一次认真的调查之后回来向我报告。",dEN="One of our troops came across an old treasure map during our last offensive. If what it shows is true, then there are priceless troll artifacts nearby.\n\nMy soldiers have their hands full, pressed between the Drakkari and the Scourge. I need you to follow up on this intelligence.\n\nTake this shovel and use it at the loose dirt mounds to the southwest. Return to me after a diligent search has been conducted.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你转至附近的上古土堆附近，使用钢铲寻找上古达卡莱圣物。",oEN="Captain Brandon in Drak'Sotra wants you to use the Steel Spade on the nearby Ancient Dirt Mounds to recover the Ancient Drakkari Relic.",c="谢谢你替我调查这件事，<name>。我会在报告里提到你的贡献。\n\n你接下来大概想去拜访鲁伯特上尉。他就驻扎在这东边的城墙上。",cEN="Thank you for looking into this for me, <name>. I'll make mention of your service in my report.\n\nYou'll likely want to visit Captain Rupert next. He's stationed at the wall due east of here."}
Q[12589]={d="你以为你会开枪？\n\n那好，我们试试看。来，先从简单温和的开始。别担心，它一点后坐力都没有。记住，不打算开枪就别把枪口对着任何东西。\n\n好，等你$g准备好:准备好;，就瞄准老幸运的威廉头上那个苹果，扣下扳机！",dEN="So you think you can shoot?\n\nWell, let's give it a try. Here, we'll start you out with something nice and gentle. Don't worry, it's got no kick to it at all. Remember, don't point that gun at anything you don't intend to fire at.\n\nNow, when you're ready, just take aim at that apple on top o' old Lucky Wilhelm's head and let 'er fly!",o="使用RJR步枪击中幸运的威尔海姆头顶的苹果，然后与德洛斯坦谈一谈。",oEN="Using the RJR Rifle, shoot the apple on top of Lucky Wilhelm's head, then speak with Drostan.",p="结果满意吗？",pEN="Satisfied with the results?",c="你不是个菜鸡射手，不过你还得多练习才能进步。你想要来赌一把吗？",cEN="You're not a bad shot, but you'll get better with practice. How would you like to make a little wager?"}
Q[12591]={d="真聪明啊……\n\n就在我们自以为已经控制了局面的时候，他们悄悄地在我们脚下挖出隧道，占领了圣殿！\n\n现在我们被两支蛛魔部队夹在中间，而且情况还在迅速恶化。\n\n我们的第一步行动是阻止他们的增援，封闭他们的隧道。\n\n拿着这些手雷，把它们扔到西北方的蛛魔隧道里去。",dEN="Clever...\n\nJust when it seemed we were getting things under control, they tunneled right underneath us and secured the shrine!\n\nNow we're caught between two nethurbian armies and our predicament is worsening by the minute.\n\nAs our first course of action, we must stop them from reinforcing. Their tunnels must be sealed.\n\nTake these grenades and throw them down their craters to the northwest.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉希望你在5个蛛魔隧道附近使用高能冲击手雷。",oEN="Captain Rupert at Drak'Sotra wants you to use High Impact Grenades near 5 Nethurbian Craters.",c="我们还没有完全脱险，但你的努力帮助拖慢了敌人。\n\n达克阿加尔那边的格隆德尔上尉很可能需要你的帮助。\n\n再见，<name>。",cEN="We're not out of the woods by any means, but your efforts have helped to slow the enemy down.\n\nCaptain Grondel up in Drak'Agal will likely have need of you.\n\nFarewell, <name>."}
Q[12592]={d="看来你确实有点$g猎人:女猎人;的本能。你的枪法不差，赫米特也没把你赶走，所以他一定打算让你参与狩猎。\n\n你和我来场比赛怎么样？\n\n赫米特和其他人会请你帮忙完成他们的狩猎。一路上，你和我各自计算我们为他们的目标贡献的猎物数。不过，这不是眨眼间就能赢的事，你会发现自己要杀掉许多不同种类的生物。祝你好运！",dEN="So y'have something of a hunter's instinct. You're not a bad shot, and Hemet hasn't driven you out, so he must be planning on including you in the hunt.\n\nHow'd you like to have a bit of a competition, just me and you?\n\nHemet and the others will ask you to help in their hunting. Along the way, you and I will count up the kills we contribute to their goals. Now, this isn't something you can win in the blink of an eye, and you'll find yourself killing many different kinds of creatures. Good luck!",o="在协助赫米特和探险队其它成员狩猎的过程中，杀死60只猎物。在你达成60个的击杀目标后，回到奈辛瓦里营地，与德洛斯坦比较猎物数量。",oEN="Kill 60 Game Animals while you aid Hemet and his companions in their hunting. When you've killed your 60, return to Drostan at the Nesingwary Base Camp to compare numbers.",p="要来算一算吗？",pEN="Care to count 'em up?",c="这么说你是来认输了？\n\n<当你告诉德罗斯坦你已完成全部猎杀指标时，他惊得下巴都掉了。>\n\n不可能！你在艾泽拉斯到底是怎么做到的？我才刚完成第 58 个。就差一点！\n\n但公平就是公平。我低估了你，<name>，但这场胜利是你光明正大赢来的。",cEN="So, you've come to concede already?\n\n<Drostan's jaw drops as you tell him you've already made all your kills.>\n\nNo way! How in Azeroth did you do that? I just made my 58th. So close!\n\nBut fair's fair. I underestimated you, <name>, but you've earned this victory fair and square."}
Q[12593]={d="我将我拥有的一切——愤怒，力量，意志——全部赐予你，我精心挑选的骑士。我赐予了你生命，使你肩负着为天灾军团创造一个崭新的黑暗时代而战的使命。\n\n凝视我们脚下的这片土地。血色十字军破坏着我所创造的事业，与此同时圣光之愿礼拜堂也在目中无人地对抗我们——这让瘟疫之地上出现了一丝瑕疵。他们必须为这种藐视付出代价。\n\n你将成为我复仇的使者，你所经之处，厄运必然降临。出发吧，去创造你的命运，死亡骑士。",dEN="All that I am: anger, cruelty, vengeance - I bestow upon you, my chosen knight. I have granted you immortality so that you may herald in a new, dark age for the Scourge.\n\nGaze now upon the lands below us. The Scarlet Crusade scurries to undo my work, while Light's Hope stands defiantly against us - a blemish upon these Plaguelands. They must all be shown the price of their defiance.\n\nYou will become my force of retribution. Where you tread, doom will follow. Go now and claim your destiny, death knight.",o="向阿彻鲁斯之心的教官拉祖维乌斯报到。|n",oEN="Report to Instructor Razuvious in the Heart of Acherus.",c="你听见了巫妖王的召唤，死亡骑士。现在正是你响应你主人的时刻。",cEN="You have heard the call of the Lich King, death knight. Now is the time to answer your master."}
Q[12594]={d="遍地都是我们的岗哨，他们却偏偏把我派到了这里。\n\n这里到处流淌着腐臭的死水，污秽的元素生物还以此为家！\n\n我不知道它们到底是什么东西，又为什么来到这里，而且老实说我也不在乎。我只知道它们把我的辖区搅得一团糟！这些肮脏的家伙整天在附近游来荡去，让我怎么开展军事行动？\n\n你现在就到外面去，$c，到我的辖区去清理掉一些元素生物！",dEN="Of all the posts, they throw me in this one.\n\nThe place is flooded with putrid, stagnant water and now it's host to sewage elementals!\n\nI don't really know what they are or why they're here, and frankly I couldn't care less. What I do know is they're making a mess of my sector! How am I supposed to conduct any dignified military operations with those foul things roaming around?\n\nGet out there, <class>, and don't come back 'til you've cleared your share of 'em off of my battlefield!",o="格隆迪尔上尉要你转至达克迦尔，消灭7只青苔狂暴者。",oEN="Captain Grondel wants you to kill 7 Mossy Rampagers in Drak'Agal.",c="你确定吗，<race>？\n\n在我看来，现在外面的那些东西比你开始时可多多了！",cEN="You sure about that, <race>?\n\nSeems to me like there are more of them things out there now than when you started!"}
Q[12595]={d="好吧，$n，你已经证明了自己作为$g猎人:女猎人;的价值——各种动物：犀牛、猫科和鳄鱼。对探险队的某些成员来说，这些生物足以考验他们的狩猎技巧，但另一些人，比如我，渴望更大的挑战。\n\n多里安·屠龙者去了北方，越过苦潮湖，在那里建立了营地。他听说了关于巨型始祖龙兽的传闻。想象一下那会是多好的猎物！去找多里安看看他运气如何。",dEN="Well, <name>, you've certainly proven your mettle as a hunter of all kinds of game animals -- rhinos, cats, and crocolisks. For some members of the expedition, these creatures are sufficient to test their hunting skills, but others, like myself, crave larger challenges.\n\nDorian Drakestalker went north, across Bittertide Lake and established a camp there. He's heard rumors of gigantic primordial drakes. Just imagine what a quarry they would be! Go check up on Dorian and see if he's had any luck.",o="与索拉查盆地中多里安营地的多里安·达克斯托谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost in Sholazar Basin.",c="所以老赫米特总算没把我给忘了。我猜他是打算等我把所有困难的工作都完成之后，再来参加这场狩猎。别担心，这里还有一大堆飞龙四处游荡。赫米特会得到他想要的。",cEN="So old Hemet didn't forget about me, after all. I suppose he's going to want to participate in the hunt once we've done all the hard work. Don't worry, there are plenty of drakes to go around. Hemet will get his wish."}
Q[12596]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到银色前沿，新兵。我是昆兹指挥官，但你——你可以叫我……指挥官。\n\n别以为你能在我的辖区里闲逛，挑挑拣拣参加哪些任务，不用向任何人交代。\n\n在这里，你向我汇报，一字不差地执行我的命令。明白了吗？！\n\n首先，你要熟悉我的人马，以及交给我们清理的这片区域。\n\n向他们每个人报到，按他们的要求去做。巡逻完成后回来见我。",dEN="Welcome to The Argent Stand, scrub. I am Commander Kunz, but you - you can call me... Commander.\n\nDon't think you're going to just cruise through my region, picking which missions you're going to participate in, answering to no one.\n\nHere, you report to me and you follow my orders to the letter. Understood?!\n\nFirst, you're going to get familiar with my men and the region we're charged with clearing.\n\nReport to each of them and do as they ask. Return to me when your patrol is done.",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你拜访四座银色北伐军的岗哨，并完成那里的上尉交给你的任务，然后回去向他复命。\n\n布兰顿上尉和鲁伯特上尉驻扎在东南面的达克索塔。\n\n格隆迪尔上尉驻扎在正东边的达克迦尔。\n\n炼金师菲肯斯坦驻扎在北边的赫布瓦罗。",oEN="Commander Kunz at The Argent Stand wants you to visit the four Argent Crusade posts, follow their leaders' orders, and then return and report to him.\n\nCaptain Brandon and Captain Rupert are posted at Drak'Sotra, Southeast of here.\n\nCaptain Grondel is posted in Drak'Agal, due east.\n\nAlchemist Finklestein is posted in Heb'Valok, to the north.",p="你和我的每位上尉都见过面了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you met with each of my captains, <race>?",c="你可算把你这条命带回来了！我们还以为天灾军团把你收走了——倒也不是什么大损失……\n\n如果你要继续为北伐军效力，最好拿出更亮眼的表现。\n\n记好了，<race>！你今后的巡逻将根据你的准时程度获得奖励。\n\n解散。",cEN="It's about time you got your carcass back here! Thought we'd lost ya to the Scourge - not that it would've been a great loss....\n\nIf you're going to continue to serve the Crusade, you'd best make a more impressive showing.\n\nTake note, <race>! Your future patrols will be rewarded based on your timeliness.\n\nDismissed."}
Q[12597]={d="我的弟兄们虽然坚韧勇猛，但他们毕竟是血肉之躯。\n\n受伤和疼痛削弱了他们完成任务的能力，没有什么训练或者诀窍可以改变这一点。\n\n值得欣慰的是，我们的炼金师发明了一种药膏，与我们的绷带一起使用的话，可以大大缓解士兵的疼痛。\n\n药膏需要用到一种特殊的罂粟，正好这里的巨魔在西边的达克索塔农田中种了不少。去采一些罂粟回来，以保证我们的库存充足。",dEN="Gritty as my men are, they're still mortal.\n\nWounds and pain diminish their ability to perform their missions. No amount of training changes that simple fact of life.\n\nThankfully, one of our alchemists has developed a recipe for a salve that binds to our bandages and greatly reduces the pain our soldiers experience.\n\nThe salve requires a special poppy these trolls cultivate just west of here. Go to Drak'Sotra Fields and harvest some of them to keep our stockpiles from running out.",o="达克索塔的布兰顿上尉希望你从达克索塔农田采集5份成熟的水罂粟。",oEN="Captain Brandon at Drak'Sotra wants you to collect 5 Mature Water-Poppies from Drak'Sotra Fields.",p="你采集到水罂粟了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you collected the water-poppies, <name>?",c="标本很好，<name>。\n\n我代表我的士兵们，感谢你今天的付出。\n\n鲁伯特上尉很可能是你巡逻的下一站。他就驻扎在这东边的城墙上。",cEN="Fine specimens, <name>.\n\nOn behalf of my soldiers, I thank you for your efforts today.\n\nCaptain Rupert is likely the next stop on your patrol. He's stationed at the wall just east of here."}
Q[12598]={d="真聪明啊……\n\n就在我们自以为已经控制了局面的时候，他们悄悄地在我们脚下挖出隧道，占领了圣殿！\n\n现在我们被两支蛛魔部队夹在中间，而且情况还在迅速恶化。\n\n我们的第一步行动是阻止他们的增援，封闭他们的隧道。\n\n拿着这些手雷，把它们扔到西北方的蛛魔隧道里去。",dEN="Clever...\n\nJust when it seemed we were getting things under control, they tunneled right underneath us and secured the shrine!\n\nNow we're caught between two Nerubian armies and our predicament is worsening by the minute.\n\nAs our first course of action, we must stop them from reinforcing. Their tunnels must be sealed.\n\nTake these grenades and throw them down their craters to the northwest.",o="达克索塔的鲁伯特上尉希望你在5个蛛魔隧道附近使用高能冲击手雷。",oEN="Captain Rupert at Drak'Sotra wants you to use High Impact Grenades near 5 Nerubian Craters.",p="你封住那些蛛魔隧道了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you sealed the nerubian tunnels, <name>?",c="我们还没有完全脱险，但你的努力帮助拖慢了敌人。\n\n达克阿加尔那边的格隆德尔上尉很可能需要你的帮助。\n\n再见，<name>。",cEN="We're not out of the woods by any means, but your efforts have helped to slow the enemy down.\n\nCaptain Grondel up in Drak'Agal will likely have need of you.\n\nFarewell, <name>."}
Q[12599]={d="好吧，这事可能不怎么有趣，但总要有人去做。\n\n我的部队已经在没膝的死水里连续激战数天了。这样对身体可不好。\n\n他们需要的一堆温暖的篝火，不但能把他们自己烤干，还可以鼓舞士气。\n\n这座城市整天都湿漉漉的，但这些荆木树的枯根却有抗潮的能力。\n\n请帮我们收集一些点火的燃料来，我们会非常感谢你的。",dEN="Well, it ain't glamorous, but it needs doin'.\n\nMy troops have been fightin' their hearts out while knee-deep in stagnant water for days on end. That just can't be good fer ya.\n\nWhat they need is a nice fire to dry 'em out and lighten their spirits.\n\nThis part of the city's soaked, but the dead roots of these thornwood trees have a way of resistin' the moisture.\n\nRound us up some fuel for burnin' and we'll be mighty grateful.",o="达克迦尔的格隆迪尔上尉要你为他收集20份枯死的荆木。",oEN="Captain Grondel at Drak'Agal wants you to bring him 20 pieces of Dead Thornwood.",p="你弄到生火的木柴了吗，<race>？",pEN="Ya got the wood fer a fire, <race>?",c="你真是太好了，<name>。真的太好了。\n\n现在你会发现老芬克尔斯坦就在这西边、小丘那边。",cEN="Mighty kind of ya, <name>. Mighty kind indeed.\n\nNow you'll be findin' ol' Finklestein due west o' here, just over the rise."}
Q[12603]={d="始生龙占据了北边和东边的大片本地，我甚至在这么远的距离都能感受到它们喷吐出的灼热气息。在挑战最强大的始祖龙之前，我们最好拿族群中较弱的成员来试试手。\n\n即便如此，你也不能放松警惕，毕竟它们可以轻易地吞噬你的躯体。等你熟练掌握与始祖龙搏斗的技巧后，再回来找我吧，我会指示你下一步该怎么做。",dEN="The primordial drakes occupy most of the area to the north and east, and I can feel the heat of their breath even at this distance. Before we can challenge the mightiest among the drakes, we must test our skills against the lesser creatures.\n\nStill, don't let your guard down; any one of these beasts can devour a man whole. Once you've familiarized yourself with the combat tactics of these drakes, return and I will tell you our next step.",o="杀死6只始生幼龙，然后与多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克谈一谈。",oEN="Kill 6 Primordial Drakes and then speak with Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你测试了你的技巧吗？",pEN="Have you tested your skills?",c="我可以听出你言语中的自信。很好，这些经验将有助于我们对付母龙斯利维娜。",cEN="I can hear the confidence in your words. Good, the experience will come in handy when we face the queen of the drakes."}
Q[12604]={c="你那次巡逻用时非常出色。看来毕竟你还是能派上用场的。\n\n正如我承诺的，这是给你的额外小费。\n\n继续保持，<name>。\n\n退下。",cEN="You made excellent time on that patrol. It appears that you may be of use to us after all.\n\nAs promised, here's a little something extra for your efforts.\n\nKeep up the good work, <name>.\n\nDismissed."}
Q[12605]={d="我觉得吧，像傻瓜一样手舞足蹈是不可能吸引母龙斯利维娜的注意的。我们应该耍个花招，尽快诱使她与我们作战。这样的话，我们还能为后期计划积攒一些……呃……资源。\n\n<多里安瞥了苏特菲兹一眼。>\n\n暂且不用考虑那么远啦。去营地东边和东北边寻找始生龙卵吧。我要你敲碎蛋壳，把幼龙掳走！等母龙察觉情况有异时，肯定会怒气冲冲地向我们开战。",dEN="We're not likely to get Broodmother Slivina's attention waving our arms around like fools, but if we're smart, we can bait her into fighting us. We'll also secure more, uh, fodder for my little project.\n\n<Dorian glances over at Zootfizzle.>\n\nBut don't worry about that for now. Just look for the primordial drake eggs in the area east and northeast of the camp. Burst them open and scoop up the hatchlings that come out. When the broodmother realizes what we've done, she'll have no choice but to face us.",o="将6只始生龙幼崽交给多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克。",oEN="Bring 6 Primordial Hatchlings to Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你弄到用来引诱母龙的饵了吗？",pEN="Have you secured the bait we'll need to get the broodmother's attention?",c="喔，干得好。拿一些龙崽给苏特菲兹！",cEN="Ah, well done. Plenty of little hatchlings for Zootfizzle over there!"}
Q[12606]={d="既然那些隧道已经被封闭了，我们接下来就要关注那些落入敌人手里的同伴。\n\n幸运的是，我们的一些士兵还活着，只是被困在蛛魔的茧子里，情况还不算很糟糕。\n\n去把他们救出来，$c，不然就来不及了！",dEN="Now that the tunnels have been sealed, our next concern is recovering those who have fallen to the enemy.\n\nWith any luck, several of our soldiers are still alive and relatively well inside the nerubian cocoons.\n\nFree them, <class>, while you still can!",o="鲁伯特上尉要你打开达克索塔的蛛魔之茧，释放3个被俘虏的步兵，然后回去向他复命。",oEN="Captain Rupert wants you to open the Nerubian Cocoons in Drak'Sotra and return to him once you have freed 3 Captive Footmen.",p="你把我们的士兵从蛛魔虫族的魔爪中解救出来了吗？",pEN="Have you freed our soldiers from the clutches of the nerubians?",c="这些蛛魔造成了沉重的伤亡，<class>。\n\n尽管如此，我感谢你的努力。",cEN="These nerubians have taken a heavy toll, <class>.\n\nNevertheless, I am grateful for your efforts."}
Q[12607]={d="在你前去挑战母龙斯利维娜之前，我必须指出，多里安认为你和赫米特最好能骑上猛犸象作战。\n\n营地周围到处都是裂牙猛犸，你只需用这条缰绳套住一头猛犸象的脖子就行啦。我可提醒你，别打公象的主意，它们的性情异常狂野，难以驯服。所以你要挑选一头合适的猛犸象，并将它带回营地。",dEN="Before you go off challenging Broodmother Slivina, Dorian thought it might be a good idea for you and Hemet to coordinate your efforts by riding into battle on the back of a mammoth.\n\nThe area around the camp is full of them. Just take this bridle and skip it over the head of a shattertusk mammoth. Be careful of the bulls, though. They won't tolerate the harness at all. Bring the mammoth back here when you've found a suitable one.",o="将一头裂牙猛犸交给多里安哨站的苏特菲兹。",oEN="Bring a Shattertusk Mammoth to Zootfizzle at Dorian's Outpost.",p="事情都办好了吗？",pEN="Everything taken care of?",c="太完美了！现在，现在我们只要给赫米特找个梯子……",cEN="Perfect! Now, all we need to do is get Hemet a stepladder..."}
Q[12608]={d="<弗蕾亚的推断没错。若不是源血之柱倒塌，亡灵根本不能踏足索拉查盆地——因此，天灾军团派出了诅咒教派的信徒来搞破坏。>\n\n<你最好立即向弗蕾亚的化身汇报，说盆地内有巫妖王的信徒出没。>",dEN="<It appears the Avatar of Freya was right. The undead were not able to enter Sholazar Basin before the Lifeblood Pillar was brought down -- they used their living agents from the Cult of the Damned instead.>\n\n<You'd best warn her about the Lich King's living agents within Sholazar Basin.>",o="转至雨声河，与弗蕾亚的化身谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to the Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids.",c="活人……会自愿侍奉巫妖王？\n\n这么长时间以来，我一直在寻找错误的敌人，<race>。我们赶快行动，把这些邪教徒从这片土地上连根拔起。",cEN="The living... willingly serve the Lich King?\n\nAll this time I've been searching for the wrong enemy, <race>. Let us make haste and uproot these cultists from these lands."}
Q[12609]={d="听着，$c。我知道这个要求有点高……\n\n新鲜的蜘蛛腐液多少有些难找，即使是在这个遍地蜘蛛的地区也是如此。但菲肯斯坦说他至少需要二十份，而且要尽快拿到。\n\n我会让我的士兵继续到野外去收集材料，但他们还需要一些帮助才能赶上炼金师规定的时间。\n\n当你在祖达克的野外冒险时，请留意那些暗门爬行者，把你能找到的所有腐液都拿回来给我。",dEN="Listen, <class>. I realize that it's a lot to ask....\n\nFresh spider ichor is somewhat hard to come by, even in these heavily infested regions. But Finklestein said he'd settle for no less than a vat of it, and that he needs it soon.\n\nI'll keep my men out in the field collecting reagents, but if the alchemist's order is going to be filled in time, they'll require some assistance.\n\nAs you roam the fields of Zul'Drak, keep your eyes peeled for trapdoor crawlers and bring me all of the ichor you can find.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要你从祖达克的暗门爬行者身上收集7份新鲜的蜘蛛腐液。",oEN="Captain Arnath in Heb'Valok asked you to collect 7 units of Fresh Spider Ichor from the Trapdoor Crawlers in Zul'Drak.",p="你收集到我需要的试剂了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you collected the reagents I need, <class>?",c="这些看起来是极好的样本，<name>。\n\n谢谢你的协助。",cEN="These look to be excellent samples, <name>.\n\nThank you for your assistance."}
Q[12610]={d="自从菲肯斯坦来了以后，我已经沦为专门为他的实验和配方收集各种材料的下手了。\n\n我会遵守参军时的誓言，无条件执行一切命令。但我毕竟是个老兵，参加过许多战斗。我更愿意上前线去，直接为北伐军做贡献。\n\n帮帮我，$r。为我收集一些蝙蝠翅膀来，这样或许我很快就能回到真正的战斗中去了。",dEN="Ever since Finklestein's arrival, I've been relegated to collecting various ingredients for his experiments and recipes.\n\nI'll follow my orders as I've vowed to do, but I'm a seasoned veteran. I've taken part in dozens of conflicts. I'd much rather be on the front lines, having a more direct impact on the Crusade's outcome here.\n\nHelp me, <race>. Collect some bat wings for me so that I might get back to the real action sooner.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要你从祖达克蝙蝠身上收集7对完美的蝙蝠翅膀。",oEN="Captain Arnath in Heb'Valok has asked you to collect 7 Unblemished Bat Wings from Zul'Drak Bats.",p="你替菲肯斯坦收集完那些蝙蝠翅膀没？",pEN="Have you finished collecting those bat wings for Finklestein?",c="干得太出色了，<name>。\n\n感谢你的协助。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>.\n\nI thank you for your assistance."}
Q[12611]={d="生命的源力在这片土地上涌动，巫妖王手下那些愚蠢的走狗却胆敢贸然入侵。他们造成的所有伤害，我都要七倍地奉还。\n\n指挥天灾军团腐蚀大地的罪魁祸首就是沙格兰·凋零使者，你可以在此地以北找到他。带上这个结界，使用它反射沙格兰的死亡能量。让天灾军团见识一下生命之力的伟大吧。",dEN="The agents of the Lich King have foolishly trespassed upon these lands where the power of life rules supreme. All harm they inflict will be returned to them sevenfold.\n\nThe monster directly responsible for corrupting the land is known as Thalgran Blightbringer; you will find him just to the north of here. Take this ward and use it to reflect the power of death upon him. Show the Scourge that the power of life prevails above all.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要你使用弗蕾亚的结界将沙格兰·凋零使者的死亡之箭以7倍伤害返还，以此击败他。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you defeat Thalgran Blightbringer by using Freya's Ward to reflect his Deathbolts back to him sevenfold.",p="完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Is it done, <name>?",c="你不断证明自己的价值，<name>。也许我当初评判你太草率了。\n\n我本以为你和最近被困在我土地上的那些偷猎者是一伙的，但也许你已经准备好把那些抛在身后了。",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Perhaps I was too quick to judge you.\n\nI had assumed you were here with the poachers who were recently stranded in my lands, but perhaps you're ready to put that behind you."}
Q[12612]={d="上古时代，泰坦在这里塑造出所有的生命体，并培育万物茁壮成长。\n\n环绕索拉查盆地的五根擎天水晶柱散发着持久的生命之力，使得天灾军团的势力不能渗透这片土地。但是，有一根柱子突然倒塌了。\n\n我要你转至源血之柱，调查一下到底发生了什么事。亡灵是没可能靠近石柱的，恐怕你需要将注意力放在那些有生命的入侵者身上。倒塌的石柱就在此地的正南方。",dEN="The titans shaped entire life forms here, fostering their unfettered growth.\n\nThe five crystal pillars that surround the basin emanate pure lifeforce. The Scourge should've never been able to penetrate the basin, but one of the pillars was destroyed.\n\nGo to the Lifeblood Pillar and see if you can find out what happened. No undead would've been able to approach the pillar, so keep your eyes out for living intruders. You'll find what remains of the pillar directly south of here.",o="转至源血之柱，寻找石柱倒塌的原因。",oEN="Travel to the Lifeblood Pillar and look for clues to its destruction.",c="<尸体严重地烧毁。附近还散落着一些火药桶的残骸。>",cEN="<The corpse is badly burnt. There appear to be the remains of several powder kegs in the vicinity.>"}
Q[12613]={d="我们不能半途而废，$r。第一道开关已经引导，还需要引导另一道开关才行。\n\n泰坦们在盆地中还有另一处用于监视诸类造物的制高点，就在东部的群山之中。\n\n转至造物者悬台，引导界门开关 - 泰塔，即可打开界门。",dEN="We cannot stop now, <race>. You've triggered the first switch, but one remains.\n\nThe titans constructed a second vantage point where they oversaw their creations. You'll find it to the east, high in the mountains.\n\nPull the activation switch theta inside the overlook and the waygate will open.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要你转至索拉查盆地东部的造物者悬台，引导界门开关 - 泰塔。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to head to the Maker's Overlook in eastern Sholazar Basin and use the Activation Switch Theta.",c="传送门已经激活，<name>。时候到了！",cEN="The waygate is active, <name>. It is time!"}
Q[12614]={d="母巢守护者斯利维娜很可能是一团嘶吼的牙齿、尖刺和利爪。你偷走了她的孩子，没有母亲会对此善罢甘休。\n\n它们确实是从蛋里孵出来的，但她爱那些小野兽，就像你母亲爱你一样。\n\n她会既绝望又凶猛，正是赫米特最喜欢的猎物类型。你和他，再加上那头猛犸象，应该能与她一战。\n\n她就在野蛮灌木丛北缘的栖木上，渴望复仇。",dEN="Broodmother Slivina's likely to be a snarling ball of teeth, spikes, and talons. You've gone and stolen her children away and no mother takes kindly to that.\n\n'Tis true they hatched from eggs, but she loves the little beasts no less than your mother loves you.\n\nShe'll be desperate and fierce in equal measures, everything Hemet loves in a target. You and he, along with that mammoth, should be a match for her.\n\nShe's on her perch at the northern edge of the Savage Thicket and hungers for revenge.",o="杀死母龙斯利维娜，然后向多里安哨站的多里安·达克斯托克复命。",oEN="Kill Broodmother Slivina and return to Dorian Drakestalker at Dorian's Outpost.",p="嗯，你还活着。你做的怎么样？",pEN="Well, you're alive. How did you fare?",c="嗯，我准备了一整篇的演说，不过那个老家伙有些话想亲自对你说。",cEN="Well, I had a whole speech prepared, but the old man himself has some words he wants to say to you."}
Q[12615]={d="妖术师乌布戈或许曾告诉过你有关如何向祖达克的诸神献上供品的事。希姆埃巴并不是唯一被达卡莱巨魔们所遗忘的神。\n\n我们逃到了这里，在繁荣之母希姆托加的身边寻求庇佑。与希姆埃巴一样，如果你愿意向她献上供品的话，她也将很乐意祝福你。",dEN="Hexxer Ubungo probably told you about making offerings to the gods of Zul'Drak. Zim'Abwa is not the only god that stands forgotten by the Drakkari.\n\nWe have taken refuge within the presence of Zim'Torga, the Mother of Prosperity. As with Zim'Abwa, if you were to give offerings of the Drakkari to her, she is sure to give you her blessing.",o="巫医库弗要求你在希姆托加的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Torga.",p="<你能感觉到丰饶之母的目光落在你身上。她在想，像你这样的<race>站在她面前做什么。>",pEN="<You can feel the eyes of the Mother of Prosperity upon you. She is wondering what a <race> such as yourself is doing standing before her.>",c="<希姆托加的思绪渗透进入了你。她感应到你献给她的祭品，并且显得很开心。>\n\n<她告诉你，你将会获得合适的回报。>",cEN="<Zim'Torga's thoughts pervade your own. She senses the offerings you are about give to her and is pleased.>\n\n<She conveys that you will be appropriately rewarded.>"}
Q[12616]={d="太好了，一位有经验的冒险者。正是我们需要的。\n\n守卫麦迪文之塔的肯瑞托成员说卡拉赞出了状况。有一种新的力量潜伏其中，它既不回应守护者的魔法，也不回应军团的魔法。据他们侦察，那似乎是一位名叫泰尼斯·暗血的血精灵王子，而且有理由相信他效力于天灾军团。\n\n去吧，$g我的朋友:我的朋友;，调查暗血的房间，把你找到的任何文件带回来。",dEN="Excellent, an experienced adventurer. Precisely what we need.\n\nThere has been talk from the Kirin Tor guarding Medivh's tower that something is amiss with Karazhan. There is a new power lurking within, one that answers neither to the Guardian's magic nor the Legion. From what they've scouted, it appears it is an elven prince called Tenris Mirkblood, and there is reason to believe he serves the Scourge.\n\nGo, my friend, investigate Mirkblood's chamber, and return with any information you might find.",o="银色特使要你进入卡拉赞的仆役宿舍，在特里斯·黯血王子的房间中寻找线索。",oEN="The Argent Dawn Emissary wants you to search the chamber of Tenris Mirkblood within the Servant's Quarters of Karazhan.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="如果你看到的命令属实，你报告的消息确实很糟糕。我们只能希望他的任务被及时阻止，没让敌人过多了解我们的实力。\n\n谢谢你，<name>。愿你在这些黑暗的日子里安然无恙。",cEN="The information you report is dire indeed if the orders you saw are legitimate. We can only hope that his mission was stopped early enough to prevent the enemy from knowing too much about our strengths.\n\nThank you, <name>. May you remain safe in these dark times."}
Q[12617]={d="我是泰坦之女弗蕾亚的化身之一。作为生命的守护者，我肩负着保卫这片土地的重任，要确保它不被天灾军团染指。\n\n我未曾料到巫妖王竟然派遣生者破坏了水晶柱的防御结界。\n\n虽然我轻易就能捏碎那些教徒，但是我必须留在这里维持结界，阻止天灾军团的势力继续侵入索拉查盆地。去吧，$n。让那些傲慢的入侵者感受到我的愤怒。",dEN="I am an embodiment of but one aspect of Freya, daughter of the titans. I am the Lifewarden -- I was left here to protect this land against the threat of the Scourge.\n\nI never anticipated the Lich King would send willing living servants to do his work.\n\nI could easily crush these cultists myself, but I am all that stands between the undead armies and the rest of the basin. Go, <name>. Deliver my wrath to these insolent trespassers.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至西北方的死亡之手营地，消灭8名诅咒教派入侵者。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to go to the Death's Hand Encampment to the northwest and slay 8 Cultist Infiltrators.",p="你消灭那些入侵者了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you destroyed the trespassers, <name>?",c="你所言属实。营地的入侵者已经得到了清楚……但我担心这已经太迟了。",cEN="You speak the truth. The intruders at the camp were dealt with... but I'm afraid it might have been too late."}
Q[12618]={p="<希姆托加冷漠地看着你。她怀疑你是否能贡献更多达卡莱供品来继续获得她的祝福。>",pEN="<Zim'Torga looks on impassively. She wonders if you seek her continued blessings by presenting more Drakkari offerings to honor her.>",c="<希姆托加对你表示赞许。>",cEN="<The Mother of Prosperity beams her approval down upon you.>"}
Q[12619]={d="对于一名死亡骑士来说，最重要的装备无疑就是他的符文之剑。只有通过符文之剑，死亡骑士才能号令冰霜、鲜血与邪恶之力为他战斗。而且，符文之剑也像一尊水瓶一样为死亡骑士存储着他的符文之力。\n\n现在是时候让你去铸造属于自己的第一把符文之剑了。去周围的武器架上找一把破旧的长剑来。找到以后马上拿去符文熔炉旁，将它在熔炉里重新锻造成一把符文之剑。",dEN="The single most important piece of equipment to a death knight is the runeblade. It is through the runeblade that a death knight commands the powers of frost, blood and the unholy. The runeblade also acts as a vessel to store the death knight's runic power.\n\nThe time has come to create your first runeblade. Search the weapon racks on this floor and locate a battle-worn sword. Once found, take the sword to a nearby runeforge and use it to create a runeblade.",o="在黑锋要塞内的武器架上找一把破旧的长剑，并以它为基础，在符文熔炉内锻造出一把符文之剑。\n\n带着你的符文之剑去向黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯报告。",oEN="Search the weapon racks in Ebon Hold for a Battle-worn Sword and then use it on a runeforge to craft a Runebladed Sword.\n\nReturn the Runebladed Sword to Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold.",p="符文之剑是你自身能力的延伸。一个死亡骑士作战时不能没有符文之剑。",pEN="The runeblade is an extension of your being. A death knight cannot battle without a runeblade.",c="干得好，$N。你成功地制造了你第一把的符文之剑。你将会播下混沌与毁灭的种子！你将会在溢满鲜血、布满那些胆敢反抗天灾军团的家伙残尸的战场上苏醒。",cEN="Well done, <name>. You have successfully created your first runebladed weapon. With it you will sow the seeds of chaos and destruction! In your wake will be a bloodied field of battle, littered with the corpses of all that would dare oppose the Scourge."}
Q[12620]={d="$n，我们还是晚了一步。那些肮脏的教徒已经抵达光芒之柱，正在为摧毁这根水晶柱做准备。我可以感觉到空气中涌动的异样。\n\n我们的时间不多了。我要你登上光芒之柱的顶端，吹响这只号角，将我的力量导入水晶。\n\n让这帮渣滓尝尝玷污泰坦造物的后果吧。",dEN="We were not quick enough, <name>. The cultist scum have arrived at the Glimmering Pillar and are making preparations to destroy it, I can sense them.\n\nWe don't have much time. Blow upon this horn atop the Glimmering Pillar to channel my power through the crystal.\n\nWe shall show this scum to not trifle with the titans' creations.",o="雨声河的弗蕾亚的化身要求你登上光芒之柱的顶端，吹响弗蕾亚的号角。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids wants you to use Freya's Horn atop of the Glimmering Pillar.",p="你处理掉那些邪教徒了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you taken care of the cultists, <name>?",c="印象深刻。我没有预期到一个小小的凡人能够像你一样证明自己是个很有价值的盟友。\n\n然而，我担心我们的付出还不够。天灾军团并没有停手的迹象。",cEN="Impressive. I wasn't expecting a mere mortal to prove as worthy an ally as you.\n\nI fear our efforts have not been sufficient, however. The Scourge shows no signs of stopping."}
Q[12621]={d="虽然你消灭了那些教徒，但天灾军团并未停下入侵的脚步。$n，局势愈发严峻了。\n\n我不得不使出最后的绝招。在我向你透露更多秘密之前，你必须博得我毫无保留的信任。",dEN="The cultists have been taken care of, but the Scourge's invasion has not slowed down. The situation is becoming desperate, <name>.\n\nThere exists a last resort. Before I reveal any more, however, I must be sure I have your absolute trust.",o="聆听弗蕾亚的化身的话语。",oEN="Listen to what the Avatar of Freya has to say.",p="我们时间有限。天灾军团正在准备最后一次攻击。",pEN="We have little time. The Scourge is preparing for a final push.",c="现在已经没办法回头了。如果你同意要帮我的话，你应该不要再迟疑。",cEN="There is no turning back now. If you agree to help me, you will do so without hesitation."}
Q[12622]={d="你跟阿胡奈想的一样吗，$g伙计:小姑娘;？\n\n一些达卡莱巨魔聚集在西南方的金阿莱水池。我们需要把他们的首领引出来，而阿胡奈知道该怎么做！\n\n去那里杀掉那些巨魔。等你杀够了，他们的首领就会出现。\n\n他们出现时，一定要拿到库图贝萨、加瓦尼尔和疯子楚洛的宝藏，$g伙计:小姑娘;。",dEN="You thinkin' what Ahunae thinkin', mon?\n\nSome of the Drakkari trolls have gathered at the Pools of Jin'Alai to the southwest. We be needin' to draw out their leaders, and Ahunae knows just how you be doin' it, too!\n\nGo in there and kill those trolls. When you kill enough, their leaders show up.\n\nWhen they show up next to their totems, you make sure to be gettin' the treasure of Kutube'sa, Gawanil, and Chulo the Mad, mon.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你收集库图比萨的宝藏、疯子克乌罗的宝藏和加瓦尼尔的宝藏。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga has asked you to retrieve the Treasure of Kutube'sa, the Treasure of Gawanil, and the Treasure of Chulo the Mad.",p="那位<class>一定是回来找阿胡奈说话了，因为那位<class>拿到了所有宝藏。",pEN="The <class> must be back talkin' to Ahunae because the <class> has all that treasure.",c="剥皮者以为你是他喜欢的那种<race>！\n\n这些糖棒怎么会在这里？我们拿这个干什么，伙计？\n\n阿胡奈说你可以把它们拿回去！",cEN="The scalper thinkin' that you be his kind of <race>!\n\nWhat's these candybars doin' in here? What we do with this, mon?\n\nAhunae say that you can have them back!"}
Q[12623]={d="我们赞达拉部族需要你的帮助，$n。我们必须阻止达卡莱巨魔对他们的神灵犯下的恶行！\n\n到东北方去，步上那宏伟的阶梯，进入祖达克的第二层，你会找到一处名叫希姆托加的地方。那里有另一尊神祗的雕像，并且，还有一座小小的避难所，我的族人正在绝望地守卫着它。\n\n我真心希望你能去那里伸出援手。去与巫医库弗谈谈吧，不过路上千万要小心，那个地方一直在被达卡莱巨魔围攻。",dEN="We Zandalari could use your help, <name>. We must put an end to what the Drakkari are doing to their gods!\n\nTo the northeast, up the great steps that lead to the next tier of Zul'Drak, lies Zim'Torga. It is the home to another of the god statues and a refuge that my people are desparately attempting to defend.\n\nI would like for you to travel there and speak to Witch Doctor Khufu. Be warned though, the place is under constant attack from the Drakkari.",o="与希姆托加的巫医库弗谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",c="向你致意，<class>。很高兴听说乌本戈找到了可以信任的人。\n\n欢迎来到辛托加。",cEN="Greetings to you, <class>. I am glad to hear that Ubungo found someone that he could trust.\n\nWelcome to Zim'Torga."}
Q[12624]={d="当我得知波利安小姐打算随奈辛瓦里的探险队转至索拉查盆地时，二话不说就去报了名，甘愿成为一名飞艇船员。我追求她好几个月啦，做梦都想娶她！\n\n我早已计划好了一切。飞艇坠毁那晚，我本来要向她求婚的……可现在戒指搞丢了。我到处都找遍了，却一无所获！\n\n你可以不相信我的直觉，但是我知道那枚戒指就在盆地的某处。如果不是被风险投资公司的雇员给偷去了，就是被野兽什么的给吞下了肚。肯定是这样……我知道的！",dEN="When I found out that Miss Boulian was helping Nesingwary with his expedition, I signed up as a deckhand immediately. You see, I'd been meaning to marry her for months!\n\nI had it all planned out. I was going to propose the very night of the shipwreck... but now the ring is gone. I've searched everywhere!\n\nI know it might sound crazy, but I know the engagement ring is in the Basin. If some Venture Company didn't steal it, maybe a wild creature ate it. But it's here somewhere... I just know it!",o="在索拉查盆地的生物身上寻找金色订婚戒指。",oEN="Look for a Golden Engagement Ring on the various creatures in Sholazar Basin.",p="那枚戒指，<name>！求你了……告诉我你找到了！",pEN="The ring, <name>! Please... tell me you've found it!",c="你办到了！你真的找到它了！\n\n我不知道……我不知道我该怎么感谢你！",cEN="You did it! You actually found it!\n\nI don't know... I don't know how to thank you!"}
Q[12627]={d="我一直在想办法与众神取得直接的沟通。但是，金亚莱之池周围那些正在举行某种仪式的巫医给我造成了很大的麻烦。\n\n看来，排除他们的阻挠已经是迫在眉睫了。如果你能进入西南方的沼泽地域，你一定可以把他们那些不知熬着什么的锅全部掀翻。\n\n总之，把那些锅都处理掉，阻断他们那些仪式，为我扫清障碍。",dEN="I have been trying to commune with the gods. However, the medicine men at the Pools of Jin'Alai are performing rituals that are interfering with my attempts.\n\nIt is imperative that we break through their obtrusion. If you were to head southwest into the pools area, I am certain that you would come across the cauldrons they are using for their magic.\n\nDisturb each of the cauldrons to bring down their ritual that is blocking me.",o="希姆托加的巫医库弗要求你破坏蓝色大锅、绿色大锅、紫色大锅和红色大锅。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga has asked you to disturb the Blue Cauldron, Green Cauldron, Purple Cauldron, and Red Cauldron.",p="我还是没有办法创建联系。那些咒医的仪式还是很完整。\n\n请回去扰乱他们的每个锅子。",pEN="I am still unable to make contact. The ritual of the medicine men is still intact.\n\nPlease go back there and disturb each of their cauldrons.",c="是的，我已经可以感受到差异了。谢谢你。\n\n让我们看看现在是否可以和诸神创建联系。",cEN="Yes, I can already feel the difference. Thank you.\n\nLet us see if we can make contact with the gods now."}
Q[12628]={d="我们都已经听到了众神的指示，$n，现在你要做的事已经很清楚了。\n\n你必须立刻转至东南边的哈克娅祭坛，并与猎豹女神交谈。",dEN="The gods have spoken, <name>. We now know what you must do.\n\nYou must now go to the Altar of Har'koa to the southeast and speak with the leopard goddess.",o="与哈克娅祭坛的哈克娅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Har'koa at the Altar of Har'koa.",c="仔细听，小<race>。时间紧迫。",cEN="Listen closely, little <race>. Time is of the essence."}
Q[12629]={d="一旦天灾军团盯上某个目标，他们就会不惜一切代价得到它。\n\n你注定要作为一具行尸走肉，过着毫无意义的存在……\n\n<斯特凡的脸扭成一个残忍的笑容。>\n\n……除非我们能利用他们的欲望来对付他们。\n\n我稍后再解释。我要准备的魔法很复杂，需要某些材料成分。\n\n往东前往苦痛圣物库。杀死那里的憎恶，收集你会在那里找到的食尸鬼唾液。然后把它们的残骸带回来给我。 $g注定:注定;",dEN="Once the Scourge have a target in their sights, they'll stop at nothing to acquire it.\n\nYou're doomed to a mindless existence as a walking corpse....\n\n<Stefan's face twists into a cruel grin.>\n\n... unless we can use their desires against them.\n\nI'll explain later. I have complex magic to prepare which requires certain material components.\n\nTravel due east of here to the Reliquary of Agony. Slay abominations and gather the ghoul drool you'll find there then return to me with their remnants.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你到折磨之匣下面去，从腐烂憎恶身上收集5份腐烂憎恶之物，并收集5份黏稠的食尸鬼口水。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch asked you to go to the Reliquary of Agony to collect 5 Putrid Abomination Guts from the Putrid Abominations and 5 Gooey Ghoul Drools.",p="你把我要求的材料带来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you brought me the components I asked for, <name>?",c="<斯特凡翻检着那些恶心的材料。>\n\n好吧，远谈不上完美，但只能凑合了。现在准备好，<class>。接下来才是精彩的部分……",cEN="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nWell, it's far from perfect, but it'll have to do. Now brace yourself, <class>. This is where it gets good...."}
Q[12630]={d="在你去见纳斯之前，有些事情我必须告诉你。\n\n纳斯曾经感染过一丁点瘟疫，所以他现在又聋又瞎，而且基本没有知觉。\n\n但这也不全是坏事。现在他已经对瘟疫之类的玩意完全免疫了，所以能够胜任某些特殊的任务——比如我将要交给你的这个任务。\n\n附近有一些刚刚感染天灾瘟疫的巨魔，我们需要研究一下瘟疫对他们造成的影响。带上纳斯和这只靴子。当你杀死一个巨魔后，就狠狠踢他一脚，这样他就会去收集毛发样本了。",dEN="Before you meet Nass, there's something you should know.\n\nHe got a toxic dose of blight back in the day, and now he's deaf, blind, and mostly numb.\n\nIt's not all bad, though. He's virtually immune to the stuff now, which makes him perfect for certain tasks - like the one I'm about to give you.\n\nThere are many freshly scourged trolls nearby and we need to study the blight's effect on them. Take Nass, and this boot. When you've slain a troll, give him a good kick and he'll know to take a hair sample.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你使用纳斯从干瘪的巨魔身上收集10份毛发样本。\n\n如果你把纳斯弄丢了，就回到斯特凡那里去找他。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch wants you to use Nass to collect 10 hair samples from Withered Trolls.\n\nIf you lose Nass, return to Stefan to recover him.",p="那只靴子还好用吗，<race>？",pEN="How's that boot holding up, <race>?",c="你知道吗，你让我想起我的纳斯。\n\n也许是因为鼻子……",cEN="You know, you remind me an awful lot of my Nass.\n\nMaybe it's just the nose..."}
Q[12631]={d="这条项圈的设计非常复杂。\n\n你盯着它的时候，脑中出现了一个危险的念头——这个念头企图迫使你戴上它。你抑制住了这种冲动，决定把它带回黑锋哨站去。\n\n那里的死亡骑士应该对这种东西有所了解……",dEN="Crafted of bone and dripping with blood, this choker is of intricate and deliberate design.\n\nGazing upon it overwhelms you with an ominous presence - one that compels you to wear it. You fight the urge, and resolve to bring it back to Ebon Watch.\n\nIf anyone can explain this, a death knight can....",o="将尸灵项圈交给黑锋哨站的斯特凡。",oEN="Take the Unliving Choker to Stefan at Ebon Watch.",c="我确实熟悉这类物品。\n\n<斯特凡直视你的眼睛。>\n\n看来，<name>，你被……选中了。",cEN="I am indeed familiar with items such as this.\n\n<Stefan looks you in the eye.>\n\nIt would seem, <name>, that you have been... chosen."}
Q[12632]={d="我是所有神祗中最后一个被降伏的，因此我们得先让其它的神祗重获自由。但是，由于身上的魔法束缚，我不能亲自去探察他们的情况。\n\n首先，我需要你帮我一个忙。当前达卡莱巨魔已将我的力量转过来对付我，他们还将我的后裔全部变成了畸形的怪物。\n\n带上一根我的胡须，将我那些被折磨被虐待的孩子们杀死，然后利用胡须上的魔法解放它们的灵魂，并赐予它们新的生命。",dEN="I am the last of the gods to be subdued, so we must first attempt to free the others. Bound by the magics of my subduers, I am unable to discern their fates.\n\nBut first, I would ask that you do me a kindness. Already the Drakkari turn my magic against me. They have transformed my offspring into monstrosities.\n\nTake one of my whiskers. Slay my tortured children and use the magic of it to release them from their nightmare, and bring them back to life.",o="哈克娅要求你对她的孩子们的尸体使用她的胡须，解放并复活它们。完成任务之后回到哈克娅祭坛去向她复命。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to use her whisker on the corpses of her children to free and resurrect them. Return to her at the Altar of Har'koa when you are done.",p="还有很多我的子嗣身陷折磨之中，你必须解救他们！",pEN="There are more of my offspring that you must free from their torment!",c="谢谢你，<name>。我永远不会忘记你所做的一切。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I will never forget what you have done."}
Q[12633]={d="这条仍在滴血的项链是用骨头制成的，设计非常复杂。\n\n你盯着它的时候，脑中出现了一个危险的念头——这个念头企图迫使你戴上它。你抑制住了这种冲动，决定把它带回黑锋哨站去。\n\n那里的死亡骑士应该对这种东西有所了解……",dEN="Crafted of bone and dripping with blood, this choker is of intricate and deliberate design.\n\nGazing upon it overwhelms you with an ominous presence - one that compels you to wear it. You fight the urge, and resolve to bring it back to Ebon Watch.\n\nIf anyone can explain this, a death knight can....",o="将扭曲项圈交给黑锋哨站的斯特凡。",oEN="Take the Writhing Choker to Stefan in Ebon Watch.",c="我确实熟悉这类物品。\n\n<斯特凡直视你的眼睛。>\n\n看来，<name>，你被……选中了。",cEN="I am indeed familiar with items such as this.\n\n<Stefan looks you in the eye.>\n\nIt would seem, <name>, that you have been... chosen."}
Q[12634]={d="命运丢给我一颗宛如柠檬般酸涩的苦果！当我们的船横冲直撞地撞毁在这片丛林中时，酒桶全被震裂了，我辛辛苦苦酿出的美酒洒得一干二净！现在只剩下几瓶朗姆酒了，这些怎么能满足嗜酒如命的探险队呢！\n\n我必须尽快酿点什么来给他们喝！\n\n东边的蛮藤谷中生长着许多果树。如今正是果实成熟的季节，可惜我够不着高高的树干。不如你去跑一趟，从树上摇一些果子下来！有什么我就要什么。",dEN="Life's tossed me a cartload of lemons this time! When the ship ran aground, the kegs carrying my best brew burst! All we have now are a few bottles of rum, and it won't sustain a thirsty expedition!\n\nWe need to get some booze cooking, and fast!!\n\nThe trees in the Wildgrowth Mangal, to the east, seem laden with fruit, but it's too high for me to reach. Look for good, strong vines, see if you can use it to shake some of that fruit out of the trees. Bring me whatever you can find.",o="将1颗橙子、2串香蕉和1颗木瓜交给奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒。",oEN="Bring 1 Orange, 2 Banana Bunches, and 1 Papaya to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="运气怎样，你有没有从那些又高又烦人的树上弄下水果来？",pEN="Did you have luck winning any of that fruit from those darn tall and stingy trees?",c="嗯，比我从这地方预想的品种要好一些。那么，重要的问题是：我们能把它蒸馏成可以喝的东西吗？最好马上开始。",cEN="Well, that's a better assortment than I would've expected from this place. Now, for the important question: can we distill it into anything drinkable? We'd better get started."}
Q[12635]={d="我无意中听说你要前去为哈克娅的安宁而奋斗。祝你好运。\n\n不过，既然你要在那座祭坛周围活动的话，能不能顺便帮我收集几件他们的圣物回来呢？祭坛就在东南边不远的地方，我也不需要很多件圣物的。\n\n你看怎么样啊？",dEN="I overheard that you are going to see to the well-being of Har'koa. Good luck to you.\n\nI am wondering if while you are in the vicinity of the altar, you would be willing to recover their relics? I do not require many, and it is only a short trip to the southeast.\n\nWhat do you say?",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你收集10件哈克娅圣物。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to recover 10 Har'koan Relics.",p="达卡莱巨魔这是在忙着毁灭自己，如果让这些历史意义重大的东西像他们的帝国一样消逝的话真是太可惜了。",pEN="The Drakkari are so busy destroying themselves, it would be a shame if the historical significance of their empire were to be likewise lost.",c="噢，最高级的样本！\n\n你可以看出这个分离形成了象征学的根基。真是杰出。\n\n这些冰巨魔决定自我毁灭真是令人遗憾。\n\n举例来说，你知道吗，达卡莱巨魔是因为他们极度的暴力而被其它的巨魔国家流放？\n\n这是真的！不然你以为巨魔是怎么会跑来这个气候这么严苛的地方呢？",cEN="Aw, prime specimens!\n\nYou can see there the divergence from the root symbology. Quite extraordinary.\n\nWhat a pity that the ice trolls are determined to bring about their own demise.\n\nDid you know, for instance, that the Drakkari were exiled from the rest of the troll nations for their extremely violent ways?\n\nIt's true! How did you think trolls ended up in such a harsh climate as this?"}
Q[12636]={d="看哪，阿彻鲁斯，伟大的死亡堡垒！这世上没有能与之匹敌的！就连强大的纳克萨玛斯也抵挡不住黑锋要塞的正面强攻。高悬在浮空城正面上方的，是阿彻鲁斯无所不见之眼。借助它，主人能看清敌方领土的极远处。眼睛所见的，巫妖王都能看见，而现在，轮到你透过那只眼睛去看了！巫妖王在召唤你，$n。\n\n现在就出发！好好受着，$g兄弟:姐妹;……|n",dEN="Behold, Acherus, the grand citadel of death! It has no equal in this world! Not even the mighty Naxxramas could withstand a direct assault from the Ebon Hold. Looming above the face of the necropolis is the all-seeing eye of Acherus. From it the master is able to see great distances into the territories held by our enemies. What the eye sees, the Lich King sees, and now the time has come for you to peer through the eye! The Lich King has called for you, <name>.\n\nGo now! Suffer well, <brother/sister>...",o="向黑锋要塞的巫妖王报到。",oEN="Report to the Lich King in Ebon Hold.",c="让敌人血流成河的时刻近了。在战斗之前，你必须先了解你要摧毁的目标是什么。这就是一位死亡骑士与一只无脑的食尸鬼的差别。\n\n我会赐予你超乎一切视觉之上的视觉，我的勇士。你将使用阿彻鲁斯之眼来窥探目标的秘密。",cEN="The time to spill the blood of our enemies approaches. You must first learn what it is that you seek to destroy, before rushing headlong into battle. It is what separates a death knight from a mindless ghoul.\n\nI will grant you sight beyond sight, my champion. You will use the eye of Acherus to steal our enemies' secrets."}
Q[12637]={d="无论是智慧还是运气，总有东西让你没有戴上这条项圈，$r。\n\n不管怎样，你得到它绝非偶然。你已经被某人或某物盯上了……\n\n把项圈拿到血玫那里去。让她向你展示命运差点给你安排了什么。 $g选中:选中;",dEN="It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, <race>.\n\nEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurance. You've been targeted by someone, or something....\n\nTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你将尸灵项圈交给血玫瑰达图拉。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to take the Unliving Choker to Bloodrose Datura.",p="怎么了，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="现在你目睹了原本要落在你身上的命运。\n\n就像我先前所说的，这完全不是巧合。制作这样的一件物品是很复杂的，而且所需的资源并不会随便浪费在某一个目标上。\n\n这是个简单的事实：天灾军团想要得到你……",cEN="Now you've observed the fate that was meant to befall you.\n\nAs I mentioned before, this was no coincidence. The creation of such a device is very involved, and the required resources would not be squandered on a random target.\n\nThe simple truth of the matter is this; You're wanted by the Scourge...."}
Q[12638]={d="无论是智慧还是运气，总有东西让你没有戴上这条项圈，$r。\n\n不管怎样，你得到它绝非偶然。你已经被某人或某物盯上了……\n\n把项圈拿到血玫那里去。让她看看命运差点给你安排了什么。 $g选中:选中;",dEN="It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, <race>.\n\nEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurence. You've been targeted by someone, or something....\n\nTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你将扭曲项圈交给血玫瑰达图拉。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to take the Writhing Choker to Bloodrose Datura.",p="怎么了，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="刚才你看到的是原本会属于你的下场。\n\n就像我先前所说的，这并非偶发的攻击，因为制作这样一件物品的过程非常繁琐，想必你引起了天灾军团领导阶层的注意。\n\n问题并不是怎么引起的、为何引起、甚或到底引起了谁的注意……而是我们该怎么做？",cEN="Now you've observed the fate that was meant to befall you.\n\nAs I mentioned before, this was no random act. The creation of such a device is very involved. You've somehow caught the attention of the Scourge leadership.\n\nThe question is not how, why, or even who... but what will we do about it?"}
Q[12639]={d="我们获取了附近的许多元素生物，并将其驯化成了我的卫兵，这样才保证了这里拥有足够的守卫力量。但是，想要让它们保持足够的战力以应付强敌的话，则需要消耗许多能量。\n\n西北方达克玛瓦的冻土中有着大量我所需要的物质。要想让这些元素卫兵继续活动下去的话，我就需要更多的冻土精华。",dEN="We captured these elementals from nearby, and I have plenty of defenders now. But, it takes a great deal of power to make them strong enough to stand up to our enemies.\n\nThe frozen earth at Drak'Mabwa to the northwest have what I need to maintain our defenses. I'll need more of their essence if I'm to keep this up.",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你收集7块冻土精华。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga wants you to collect 7 Essence of the Frozen Earth.",p="我希望你有带回足够的数量。达克玛瓦的攻势在你做了那些事之后会越来越凶猛的。",pEN="I hope that you've returned with enough. The attacks from the Pools of Jin'Alai have become more desperate after what you did to them.",c="谢谢你，<class>。那些精华应该足够支撑我施法相当长一段时间了。",cEN="Thank you, <class>. Those essences should be enough to fuel my casting for quite some time."}
Q[12640]={d="德苟达肯定还会派你去西北方的达克玛瓦，替她和她手下的卫兵拿回更多的东西。\n\n那么，埃霍奈希望你也能顺便帮忙摧毁那些不断有元素生物跑出来的空间裂隙。这可以让我们彻底避免继续遭受它们的攻击！\n\n总之，你千万要小心，冻土中的凶猛生物会在你尝试封印裂隙的时候突然出现并袭击你。",dEN="Dagoda gonna be sendin' you northwest to Drak'Mabwa to get her more stuff for her defenders if she didn't already.\n\nWhile you up there, Ahunae be wantin' you to destroy the rifts those elementals pourin' out of. The last thing we needin' is for them to attack us!\n\nJust watch out, more of those frozen earth'll show up when you try to seal the rifts.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你封印7处元素裂隙。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga has asked you to seal 7 Elemental Rifts.",p="在我们再次交谈之前，你还有几个裂隙要封印，<name>。",pEN="You have a few more of those rifts to seal before we be talkin' again, <name>.",c="埃霍奈希望德苟达得到了她想要的防御。现在那些裂隙关闭了，她现在应该比以前安全多了。",cEN="Ahunae hopin' that Dagoda got all of the defenders she wantin'. With those rifts sealed, it's not likely she'll be gettin' any more."}
Q[12641]={d="阿彻鲁斯之眼就放在这个平台的正中央。你可以用它召唤出一只探测之眼，用以侦察分析新阿瓦隆内的血色十字军部署和动向。阿彻鲁斯之眼拥有一些独特的能力，可以让你的情报收集工作更轻松一些。\n\n好好利用它的虹吸技能，侦查敌人的熔炉、市政厅、城堡，以及礼拜堂。平台的周围有数个阿彻鲁斯之眼的控制台，不要浪费时间了，$n。\n\n天灾军团必将全面占领新阿瓦隆。这是巫妖王的命令！",dEN="Towering above this platform is the eye of Acherus. From it you will call forth a probe that you will then use to analyze Scarlet Crusade fortifications at New Avalon. The eye has a host of powers that should make the acquisition of this data simple.\n\nUse the eye's siphon to analyze the forge, town hall, hold, and chapel. The eye's control mechanisms are located on either side of this platform. Waste no more time, <name>.\n\nThe Scourge will have this place. The Lich King commands it!",o="巫妖王命令你使用阿彻鲁斯之眼，侦察并分析血色城堡、新阿瓦隆熔炉、新阿瓦隆市政厅和赤色烈焰礼拜堂的情况。\n\n使用阿彻鲁斯之眼的控制台来控制阿彻鲁斯之眼。",oEN="The Lich King commands you to use the Eye of Acherus to analyze the Scarlet Hold, New Avalon Forge, New Avalon Town Hall and the Chapel of the Crimson Flame.\n\nControl the Eye of Acherus by using the Eye of Acherus Control Mechanism.",p="我们对血色十字军发动的突袭将会成为传奇。",pEN="Our assault upon the Scarlet Crusade will become legend.",c="他们正在准备着战斗，正如我所料，但不过如此。我感觉到一个宿敌的存在——一个我很久以前就已经毁掉的敌人……\n\n不过不重要了。我们会在他们撤离家园并开始防御之前就以天灾军团的全部军力展开攻击。",cEN="They prepare for battle - as expected - but there is something else. I sense an old enemy. An enemy that I destroyed long ago...\n\nIt matters not. We will send the full might of the Scourge against them before they have a chance to evacuate their homes and put in place their defenses."}
Q[12642]={d="我可以清晰地感觉到，伦诺克的时间已经不多了。\n\n这位极地熊神的灵魂已经离开了他虚弱的身躯。你必须与他的灵魂沟通。\n\n他的祭坛就在西北方，达克玛瓦的另一端。",dEN="My feelings tell me that Rhunok doesn't have much time.\n\nI can tell that the arctic bear god's spirit has already separated from his weakened body. It is his spirit with which you must commune.\n\nHis altar lies to the northwest beyond Drak'Mabwa.",o="与伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with the Spirit of Rhunok at the Altar of Rhunok.",c="我只能勉强撑着。你必须迅速行动，否则一切都是空谈。",cEN="I am barely hanging on. You must work quickly or all will be lost."}
Q[12643]={d="一旦天灾军团盯上某个目标，他们就会不惜一切代价得到它。\n\n你注定要作为一具行尸走肉，过着毫无意义的存在……\n\n<斯特凡的脸扭成一个残忍的笑容。>\n\n……除非我们能利用他们的欲望来对付他们。\n\n我稍后再解释。我要准备的魔法很复杂，需要某些材料成分。\n\n往东前往苦痛圣物库下方的土地。杀死你在那里遇到的食尸鬼和憎恶，把它们的残骸带回来给我。 $g注定:注定;",dEN="Once the Scourge have a target in their sights, they'll stop at nothing to acquire it.\n\nYou're doomed to a mindless existence as a walking corpse....\n\n<Stefan's face twists into a cruel grin.>\n\n... unless we can use their desires against them.\n\nI'll explain later. I have complex magic to prepare which requires certain material components.\n\nTravel due east of here to the land beneath the Reliquary of Agony. Slay the ghouls and abominations you'll find there and return to me with their remnants.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你到折磨之匣下面去，从腐烂憎恶身上收集5份腐烂憎恶之物，并收集5份黏稠的食尸鬼口水。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch asked you to go to the Reliquary of Agony to collect 5 Putrid Abomination Guts from the Putrid Abominations and 5 Gooey Ghoul Drools.",p="你把我要求的材料带来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you brought the components I asked for, <name>?",c="<斯特凡翻检着那些恶心的材料。>\n\n好吧，远谈不上完美，但只能凑合了。\n\n现在准备好，<class>。接下来才是精彩的部分……",cEN="<Stefan sifts through the foul components.>\n\nWell, it's far from perfect, but it'll have to do.\n\nNow brace yourself, <class>. This is where it gets good...."}
Q[12644]={d="既然我们有了原料，我已经让助手准备好蒸馏器了。他会监督整个过程，但我要你帮忙让一切保持在控制之中。你可能会以为我们只要把东西全倒进蒸馏器里等着就行，那你就错了。\n\n原料要在特定时刻加入，温度和压力要在特定时刻调节。你最多只有 10 秒的时间反应。等你$g准备好:准备好;开始蒸馏时，去和\"醉醺醺\"的麦克马纳斯谈谈。",dEN="Now that we've got the raw materials, I've had my assistant ready the still. He'll oversee the process, but I want you to help keep everything under control. You might be tempted to think that we just throw everything into the still and let it sit, but you're wrong.\n\nIngredients and heat need to be added at certain times, and the pressure regulated at others. You'll have no more than 10 seconds to react to a situation. Speak with \"Tipsy\" McManus when you're ready to start distilling.",o="成功完成蒸馏作业，然后将雷酒的丛林佳酿交给奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒。",oEN="Successfully complete the distillation process and bring the completed Thunderbrew's Jungle Punch to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="嗯，结果怎么样？",pEN="Well, how did it turn out?",c="<葛瑞姆摇了摇桶。>\n\n这里面有了东西，但最最重要的问题是，这能不能喝呢？你哪儿都别去——你也得负责监督样本测试啊。",cEN="<Grimbooze gives the cask a shake.>\n\nThere's something in here, but the million gold question is, can you drink it? Don't you go anywhere; you'll be responsible for overseeing the sampling of the product, too."}
Q[12645]={d="现在就来揭晓真相吧！\n\n<葛瑞姆轻声地笑了。>\n\n我总是很期待这样的时刻。通常我会举办宴会供大家试饮，但是我们身处丛林，就别那么讲究啦。\n\n一切从简吧，给几位好朋友尝尝就行。让我想想，我得听听赫米特·奈辛瓦里的意见。呃，给哈迪乌斯·哈洛维也送一份。他们俩就在这座营地里。对啦，你最好去跑一趟湖边着陆场，那地方就在索拉查盆地的中央，让塔玛拉也试试。",dEN="And now for the moment of truth!\n\n<Grimbooze chuckles.>\n\nI've always wanted to say that. Normally, I'd debut a new drink at a banquet, but we can't have one in the middle of the jungle.\n\nInstead, just take samples to a few trusted friends and return with their comments. Let's see, we'll definitely want Hemet Nesingwary's opinion, and Hadrius Harlowe's, too. They're here in camp. You'll want to head over to Lakeside Landing, near the center of the Basin and offer Tamara Wobblesprocket a taste.",o="将雷酒的丛林佳酿的酒样交给赫米特·奈辛瓦里、哈迪乌斯·哈洛维和塔玛拉·摇链品尝，然后向奈辛瓦里营地的葛瑞姆·雷酒复命。",oEN="Offer a sample of Thunderbrew's Jungle Punch to Hemet Nesingwary, Hadrius Harlowe, and Tamara Wobblesprocket, then return to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="别让我等，<name>。结果如何？",pEN="Don't keep me waiting, <name>. What are the results?",c="三个里面有两个同意，嗯？以第一次试喝来讲还不赖，真的不赖。我想我得要弄点什么东西向塔玛拉表达歉意才行。\n\n现在……我们应该怎么称呼这种酒呢？",cEN="Two out of three drinkers agree, eh? Not bad for a first try. Not bad at all. I suppose I'll have to whip up something else for Tamara by way of apology.\n\nNow... what should we call this creation?"}
Q[12646]={d="我的先知当初从我身上吸取了太多的力量，而且过程也太快，结果把自己给毁灭了。现在在达克玛瓦南边留下的那处灌满雨水的巨坑就是当时爆炸产生的结果。\n\n在那以后，祭司们又将这位先知复活了，试图让他继续完成未尽的计划。他们将我的力量又重新导向了先知，很快，他就将再次醒来。\n\n趁一切还来得及，你必须去真正终结他的生命，并将我的魔精带回来。",dEN="My prophet absorbed too much of my power too quickly, and subsequently killed himself. You can see the results at the water-filled crater to the south in Drak'Mabwa.\n\nMy former priests have already resurrected him so that he can finish the job. They're channeling my power back into him, and it will not be long now before he reawakens.\n\nYou must put an end to him and return with my mojo before it is too late.",o="伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂要求你找回他的极地熊神魔精。",oEN="The Spirit of Rhunok at the Altar of Rhunok has asked you to acquire his Arctic Bear God Mojo.",p="快，<race>，我的魔精拿到了吗？",pEN="Quickly, <race>, do you have my mojo?",c="你办到了。\n\n但现在我还需要你帮我做一件事。",cEN="You did it.\n\nBut now there is one other thing that I need you to do."}
Q[12647]={d="我的身躯已经不能挽回了，$n。那些祭司迟早会再选出一个新的先知，很快他们又将重新开始执行罪恶的计划。\n\n我将把身上最后的一些力量赐予你。那个折磨我、囚禁我的人当前正躲在祭坛的内部，他身上有一坛熏香，可以唤醒我的身躯，并让它变得不再无懈可击。\n\n请你利用这坛熏香帮我一个忙，结束我痛苦的生命吧。\n\n我要为可能会出现的反抗道歉。即使只是没有灵魂的身躯，它依然留存着极强的生存欲望。",dEN="My body is too far gone now, <name>. It is only a matter of time before a new prophet is elevated and finishes what the other began.\n\nI am going to imbue you with the last of my power. The tormentor inside the altar building carries incense, which will awaken my body and make it vulnerable.\n\nUse the incense and do me the kindness of putting an end to my suffering.\n\nI apologize if I fight back. Even for me, the will to survive is strong.",o="伦诺克祭坛的伦诺克之魂要求你对他的身躯使用折磨者的熏香，使之被唤醒。然后，你要使用伦诺克灌注在你身体内的能量杀死他。\n\n如果你不小心失去了伦诺克魔精光环的影响，可以回到伦诺克之魂那里再次寻求帮助。",oEN="The Spirit of Rhunok has asked you to use the Tormentor's Incense to awaken his body. You are then to slay Rhunok using the power that his spirit has imbued you with.\n\nIf for some reason you lose the Mojo of Rhunok aura, you can return to the Spirit of Rhunok to have it reapplied.",p="如果你不尽快终结我的痛苦，<name>，一切可能都会失去。",pEN="If you do not put an end to my suffering soon, <name>, all may be lost.",c="你做了必须做的事，并在这个过程中给予了我荣誉。\n\n我向你致以最深的感谢，<name>。我只希望你和哈克娅能帮助其他人。",cEN="You've done what had to be done and honored me in the process.\n\nI give you my deepest thanks, <name>. I only hope that you and Har'koa will be able to help the others."}
Q[12648]={d="好了……我制作了一种伪装，它可以把你变成天灾军团的成员，而且不易被发现。\n\n只要伪装还没有失效，你就可以在天灾军团中自由行动。只有荒芜卫士能看穿我制造的这种幻象，你要小心它们！\n\n你要注意的另一个问题就是，这个伪装不太稳定，随时可能失效，所以你一定要保持警惕。\n\n现在让我们来测试一下效果吧。你使用项圈激活伪装，到东边去找天灾军团的商人，给我买一瓶苦痛浆液回来。",dEN="There... I've created a disguise that should make you indistinguishable from the Scourge.\n\nYou'll be free to walk among them as long as the disguise holds. Only the blightguards will be able to see through my illusion. Watch out for them!\n\nAnother thing you must know is that the disguise is unstable and may drop unexpectedly, so stay alert.\n\nLet's test it out. Use the choker and visit the Scourge merchant just east of here. Return to me with a bottle of bitter plasma.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你使用迷惑项圈激活天灾伪装。\n\n在天灾形态下，到骨肠那里去购买苦痛浆液。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to use the Ensorceled Choker to apply the Scourge disguise.\n\nWhile in Scourge form, you are to purchase Bitter Plasma from Gristlegut.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="怎么样，<name>？\n\n你买到那瓶药水了吗？",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nDid you purchase that flask?",c="所以你还喜欢你的天灾生活吗？\n\n相信我，并不像看起来的那么美好……",cEN="So? How are you enjoying scourge life?\n\nBelieve me, it's not all it's cracked up to be...."}
Q[12649]={d="好了……我制作了一种伪装，它可以把你变成天灾军团的成员，而且不易被发现。\n\n只要伪装还没有失效，你就可以在天灾军团中自由行动。只有荒芜卫士能看穿我制造的这种幻象，你要小心它们！\n\n你要注意的另一个问题就是，这个伪装不太稳定，随时可能失效，所以你一定要保持警惕。\n\n现在让我们来测试一下效果吧。你使用项圈激活伪装，到东边去找天灾军团的商人，给我买一瓶苦痛浆液回来。",dEN="There... I've created a disguise that should make you indistinguishable from the Scourge.\n\nYou'll be free to walk among them as long as the disguise holds. Only the blightguards will be able to see through my illusion. Watch out for them!\n\nAnother thing you must know is that the disguise is unstable and may drop unexpectedly, so stay alert.\n\nLet's test it out. Use the choker and visit the Scourge vendor just east of here. Return to me with a bottle of bitter plasma.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你使用迷惑项圈激活天灾伪装。\n\n在天灾形态下，到骨肠那里去购买苦痛浆液。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to use the Ensorcelled Choker to apply the Scourge disguise.\n\nWhile in Scourge form, you are to purchase Bitter Plasma from Gristlegut.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="怎么样，<name>？\n\n你买到那瓶药水了吗？",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nDid you purchase that flask?",c="所以你还喜欢你的天灾生活吗？\n\n相信我，并不像看起来的那么美好……",cEN="So? How are you enjoying Scourge life?\n\nBelieve me, it's not all it's cracked up to be...."}
Q[12650]={d="附近还有一处祭坛中放置有大量理应得到拯救与保护的圣物。\n\n西北边的达克玛瓦苔原另一边有一座伦诺克祭坛，据说那里的达卡莱巨魔发生了暴动，竟然毁灭了自己的圣地，将那里变成了一片焦土。\n\n$C，如果你能从那些卑贱而无知的巨魔手中救回那些圣物，我将感激不尽。",dEN="There is another altar nearby where there are artifacts to be saved.\n\nIt is said that the Drakkari at the Altar of Rhunok to the northwest, beyond the broken tundra of Drak'Mabwa, have already plundered their own holy site.\n\n<class>, I would be appreciative if you could rescue those artifacts from their undeserving hands.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你收集7件伦诺克圣物。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to recover 7 Rhunokian Artifacts.",p="我们是没有办法理解达卡莱巨魔的。他们是凶残的野蛮人，而且已经到了一个新的低谷。",pEN="There is no comprehending the Drakkari. They are brutal savages who have sunk to a new low.",c="让我看看那些东西。\n\n<编年史家检查着你取回的文物。>\n\n哼，我得说，幸好你在那个时候把它们解放了出来，<class>。\n\n真有意思。这件文物描绘的是大分裂的事件。曾经有一段时间，诺森德是卡利姆多最北端的部分。\n\n但大分裂之后，那片土地断裂开来，最终成为了诺森德。\n\n当然，这就是为什么我们在南方大陆也能看到达卡莱巨魔，而不只是在这里。",cEN="Let me look at those.\n\n<The chronicler examines the artifacts that you have recovered.>\n\nHmph, I'd say that we're lucky you liberated these when you did, <class>.\n\nHow very interesting. This artifact here depicts the events of the Sundering. There was a time when Northrend was the far northern portion of Kalimdor.\n\nBut after the Sundering, the land broke off, eventually becoming Northrend.\n\nThis, of course, is why we see Drakkari in the southern continents as well as here."}
Q[12651]={d="风险投资公司刚开始找我们的麻烦时，我就让玛尔文·摇链和他的老婆塔玛拉搭乘飞行器去了东边的河流之心。我让他在那里搭建一座小营地，作为补给中转站以及侦查该地区的前哨站。\n\n不出意外的话，他们现在应该已经开始修筑营地了吧。河流之心位于索拉查盆地的中央位置，顾名思义，就是数条河流的交汇点啦。沿着东北边的河岸寻找湖边着陆场吧。玛尔文说他挑了一处地势最好的位置。",dEN="When the trouble with the Venture Company started, I asked Marvin Wobblesprocket and his wife, Tamara, to take their flying machines east to River's Heart. I asked them to setup a small camp there so that we could use them as a relay to fly in supplies and survey the area.\n\nThey should have arrived by now and started setting up. River's Heart is near the center of the basin where the rivers converge. Search for Lakeshore Landing on the northeast shore. Marvin mentioned it would be the best spot.",o="与湖边着陆场的塔玛拉·摇链谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tamara Wobblesprocket at Lakeside Landing.",c="所以说是赫米特派你来的咯？我们正打算通知他我们这边已经开始运作了。如果我丈夫忽视你的话，请见谅，因为他完全专注在工作上。",cEN="So, Hemet sent you? We were just about to let him know that we've gotten things up and running here. Please forgive Marvin if he seems to be ignoring you, but he gets very absorbed in his work."}
Q[12652]={d="嘿嘿嘿！你，食尸鬼！对！我是在跟你讲话。\n\n现在是开饭时间了。去把饭拿给那些食尸鬼！\n\n今天可是特别加大餐！看看，各种杂碎……嗯，嗯，真鲜美。\n\n去把这些装满了饭的碗丢到那些食尸鬼面前。喂饭是个交朋友的好办法。\n\n想交个食尸鬼朋友吗？啊哈哈哈哈！",dEN="Git o'er heer, gool! Yeh, I talkin' to yoo.\n\nIt feedin' time now. Gotta git da grub ta all da gools!\n\nSpeshal grub dis time! Bowels an' brainz bowl... num, num, num.\n\nJus drop da bowl nexta da gool. Gud way ta make frenz.\n\nYoo got goolfrenz? Ha, ha, hah!",o="折磨之匣的骨肠要求你在10只腐烂的食尸鬼附近使用杂碎大餐。",oEN="Gristlegut at the Reliquary of Agony wants you to use Bowels and Brains Bowl next to 10 Decaying Ghouls.",p="你还没喂食尸鬼？",pEN="Yoo dun feed da goolz?",c="好吃好吃！",cEN="Num num!"}
Q[12653]={d="是时候让你回到猎豹女神的身边了。我预计她还有许多计划要委派给你去执行。\n\n请转告她，无论这世界怎样变化，我们都是永恒不灭的。",dEN="And now it is time for you to return to the leopard goddess. Somehow I sense that she has other plans for you.\n\nTell her that no matter what, we are eternal.",o="与哈克娅祭坛的哈克娅谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Har'koa at the Altar of Har'koa.",c="<猎豹女神痛苦的嚎叫。>\n\n我的灵魂因为再度失去一个朋友而哀嚎。但是不要害怕，他会回来，并且它的灵魂将永生不朽。",cEN="<The cat goddess howls in pain.>\n\nMy spirit cries out in grief at the loss of another friend. But fear not, he will return and his spirit will live on forever."}
Q[12654]={d="当赫米特让我陪同玛尔文来这里搭建营地时，我还以为能在修理飞行器或是修筑营地之馀练习一下狩猎技巧呢，哪知道根本忙得脱不开身！\n\n我很想干掉那头名叫匹奇的狮子。据说它就生活在这里的南边，通天之柱北面和蛮藤谷交界的地方。如果你能找到它的话，不如把你干掉它的证据给我带回来？如果小道消息确凿的话，这件战利品肯定可以让赫米特瞠目结舌！",dEN="When Hemet asked me to accompany Marvin out here, I hoped that I might have the opportunity to work on my own hunting skills in between repairing the flying machines and setting up the camp.\n\nI wanted to take down a ferocious lion named Pitch. He's said to make his home south of here, near where the Wildgrowth Mangal meets the northern face of the Skyreach Pillar. If you can find the beast, would you bring back his remains? If the rumors are true, they'd make a trophy even Hemet will respect!",o="将匹奇的遗体交给湖边着陆场的塔玛拉·摇链。",oEN="Bring Pitch's Remains to Tamara Wobblesprocket at Lakeside Landing.",p="你找到匹奇了吗？",pEN="Did you find Pitch?",c="你拿到了！现在我只要把它做成战利品就可以了。这才是最难的部分——找出方法保存它，这样赫米特才不会嘲笑我费的功夫。",cEN="You got it! Now all I have to do is make a trophy out of it. That'll be the hard part -- finding a way to preserve it so that Hemet doesn't have a good laugh at my expense."}
Q[12655]={d="祖达克还有一位被冷落的神。\n\n辛鲁克的雕像就在正北方。被称为\"智者\"的辛鲁克也非常守护自己的领地。他麾下的守卫对那些没有足够机灵绕过他们的人极为严厉。\n\n避开守卫，把达卡莱供品献给辛鲁克，这样你就能得到他的祝福。",dEN="There is another god of Zul'Drak that is being neglected.\n\nZim'Rhuk's statue lies directly to the north. Known as \"The Wise One\", Zim'Rhuk is also known to be very protective of his domain. He maintains guardians that deal harshly with anyone that does not have the wits to slip past them.\n\nAvoid the guardians and give the Drakkari offerings to Zim'Rhuk so that you will benefit from his blessing.",o="巫医库弗要求你在希姆鲁克的雕像前奉上10份达卡莱供品。",oEN="Witch Doctor Khufu wants you to present 10 Drakkari Offerings to the statue of Zim'Rhuk.",p="<你感觉到希姆鲁克并不相信你。他正打算要召唤一个守卫。>",pEN="<You sense that Zim'Rhuk does not trust you. He is attempting to call out to one of his guardians.>",c="<希姆鲁克认同了你放在他面前的供品，即便他知道那是从别人的尸体上取来的。>\n\n<如果你将供品献给他，他勉强同意赐予你祝福。>",cEN="<Zim'Rhuk acknowledges the offerings you intend to place before him, though he knows that you took them from the corpses of others.>\n\n<If you give the offerings to him, he reluctantly agrees to grant you his blessing.>"}
Q[12656]={p="<希姆鲁克对你再次躲过他的守卫感到印象深刻又泄气——至少现在是这样。>\n\n<把供品放在他面前，然后他就会再次赐予你祝福。>",pEN="<Zim'Rhuk is impressed and frustrated that once more you seem to have dodged his guardians. At least for now.>\n\n<Place the offerings before him and he will grant you his blessing again.>",c="<希姆鲁克在你心中灌入一个影像，他的守卫将你踩碎在脚底下。也许你该试着用更多祭品来讨好希姆鲁克。>",cEN="<Zim'Rhuk forces an image into your mind of one of his guardians squishing you beneath its foot. Perhaps you should attempt to appease Zim'Rhuk with more offerings.>"}
Q[12657]={d="听好了，死亡骑士，因为我给你的这些话将开启一场战争。我的最终判决已经下达：死。亡。降。临。所有。没有人能如此大胆地对抗天灾军团的力量而不遭报复！\n\n既然你在第一个任务中为我效力出色，在下一个任务中也要如此。把我的判决带给阿彻鲁斯指挥岗的大领主莫格莱尼，就在一层。告诉他开始进攻。\n\n等我们处理完十字军，就顺手了结银色黎明。|n",dEN="Listen well, death knight, for I give to you the words that will start a war. My final judgment has been passed: Death. To. All. None shall stand so boldly against the might of the Scourge without reprisal!\n\nAs you have served me well in your first task, so too shall you serve me in your next task. Take my judgment to Highlord Mograine at the command post of Acherus, found on the first floor. Tell him to begin the assault.\n\nAnd when the Crusade has been dealt with, we will finish off the Argent Dawn.",o="巫妖王要你带着他的命令去找黑锋要塞内的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。\n\n使用巫妖王身后的传送器，转至大领主达里安·莫格莱尼所在的命令大厅。",oEN="The Lich King commands you to carry his orders to Highlord Darion Mograine at Ebon Hold.\n\nUse the glowing transporter behind the Lich King to reach Highlord Darion Mograine in the Hall of Command.",c="战争的号角将会迅速响彻整片大地，唤醒亡魂，召来天灾战争机器。让胆敢阻挡我们的敌人悲叹吧！\n\n你和你的同袍将领导这场冲锋，$N。当我再次俯视血色领地的时候，我的视野将被阿彻鲁斯的军团所掩盖。现在立刻开始向新阿瓦隆进军。",cEN="The horns of war will soon echo across this land, waking the dead and calling forth the Scourge war machine. Woe unto those that would stand in our way!\n\nYou and your brethren will lead the charge, <name>. When next I look upon the Scarlet lands, my sight will be obscured by the legions of Acherus. The march upon New Avalon begins now."}
Q[12658]={d="多里安将抓来的始祖幼龙交给我训练和喂养，这让我有了新的想法。嗯，我要拥有自己的宠物！\n\n不，我当然不要龙崽子。它们能一口咬断我的胳膊，才不要这样的宠物！\n\n往东北方走，穿过始祖龙的栖息地就是埋骨地了，那里生活着大群的血爪大鹏。我可不指望能驯化成年的大鹏，所以我要你从血爪大鹏的巢穴中偷些蛋回来，等这些小家伙破壳而出时，我就开始调教它们。",dEN="Dorian's had me training and feeding the baby drakes he captures, and it has gotten me thinking. I want a pet of my own!\n\nNo, not a juvenile drake. I don't want a pet capable of biting my hand off!\n\nHowever, in the Bonefields to the northeast of the camp, beyond the area dominated by the drakes, there's a large population of goretalon rocs. The grown ones are beyond hope of domesticating, but if you bring me the eggs from their nests, I can raise them from the time they hatch.",o="将7枚大鹏卵交给多里安哨站的苏特菲兹。",oEN="Bring 7 Roc Eggs to Zootfizzle at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你拿到那些蛋了吗？",pEN="Do you have those eggs?",c="噢，这些很棒！我已经厌倦了跟机械松鼠以及机械小鸡作伴了。如果有只关节不用上油的宠物一定很棒！",cEN="Oh, these are very nice! I've gotten so tired of robotic squirrels and chickens for company. It'll be wonderful to have a pet whose joints won't require oiling!"}
Q[12659]={d="行动现在开始，伙计！\n\n东北边赫布达卡的那帮巨魔就是不错的目标。他们养的破蝙蝠每天晚上都要骚扰我们，这下他们该尝尝报应啦！\n\n拿着，埃霍奈把他的宝贝小刀也借给你，千万要好好干哟。",dEN="I thinkin' it be time to do some scalpin', mon!\n\nThe trolls at Heb'Drakkar to the northeast should do nicely. With their fancy bats and attackin' us, they got it comin'!\n\nAhunae even give you his own knife so that you do the job right.",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈要求你使用埃霍奈的小刀拆下10名赫布达卡巨魔的巫毒头饰。\n\n他还提醒你，要先搜索过他们的 躯体之后再拆卸巫毒头饰。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga wants you to use Ahunae's Knife to scalp 10 Heb'Drakkar trolls.\n\nThe scalper reminds you that you should loot them first.",p="阿胡奈知道<name>不可能那么快剥下那么多赫布达卡巨魔的皮。",pEN="Ahunae know there be no way that <name> scalp that many of the Heb'Drakkar so quickly.",c="唉，我也觉得那太好笑了。\n\n<name>正是我喜欢的那种<race>！\n\n你还拿着我的刀吗？",cEN="Aw, me thinkin' that too funny.\n\n<name> is my kind of <race>!\n\nYou still got my knife?"}
Q[12660]={d="巫妖王的爪牙竟敢将毁灭性的武器带进我的领地，我绝不能容忍这样的行径。\n\n我要你立即转至北方的天灾军团据点，摧毁他们带来的武器。我们不能让天灾军团在这片神圣的土地上再前进哪怕一步！",dEN="The Lich King's lackeys have dared to bring weapons of destruction into my domain. I will not stand for this.\n\nGo to their outpost to the north and destroy the weapons they would use against the land. We cannot let the Scourge taint another inch of these sacred lands.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至西北方的死亡之手营地，销毁4车不稳定的炸药。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to go to the Death's Hand Encampment to the northwest and destroy 4 Unstable Explosives.",p="完成了吗，<name>？",pEN="Is it done, <name>?",c="我感谢你，<race>。你正证明自己是个值得信赖的盟友。",cEN="I thank you, <race>. You're proving to be a worthy ally."}
Q[12661]={d="到现在你大概已经猜到我计划的内容了。\n\n我们要利用天灾军团对你的兴趣来反制他们。你要$g伪装:伪装;潜入。我知道这多半等于判死刑，但如果我们什么都不做，你的死就是必然的。\n\n往东北方前往苦痛圣物库，戴着你的伪装站在平台上。一旦进入沃尔塔鲁斯，你必须赢得天灾指挥官的信任。\n\n任务完成后，吹响这只号角，我会飞到你的位置听取你的报告。",dEN="By now you've probably guessed the details of my plan.\n\nWe're using the Scourge's interest in you against them. You're going undercover. I know it's likely a death sentence, but if we do nothing your death is a certainty.\n\nTravel northeast to Reliquary of Pain and stand on the platform while wearing your disguise. Once inside Voltarus, you must earn the trust of the Scourge commander.\n\nWhen you've completed your mission, blow this horn and I'll fly to your location to receive your report.",o="斯特凡你要你使用迷惑项圈进入沃尔塔鲁斯，并按照天灾军团指挥官的命令行动。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan wants you to use your Ensorcelled Choker to get into Voltarus and do whatever the Scourge leader there asks of you.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="你赢得他们指挥官的信任了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you earned their commander's trust, <name>?",c="那么，现在……我必须承认，看到你我相当意外，<name>。\n\n告诉我你了解到了什么。",cEN="Well, now... I must admit I'm more than a little surprised to see you, <name>.\n\nTell me what you've learned."}
Q[12662]={d="<达戈达看着阿胡奈，叹了口气。>\n\n你真的想处理赫布达卡？光收集头皮可办不成事。你必须干掉他们的首领赫布金。\n\n问题是，他在上面的蝙蝠巢穴里督促部下集结。\n\n敲响他的鼓，我保证他会飞下来。那就是你杀掉他的时候。\n\n你可以拿走这面网，是从他的一个猎头者身上弄来的。等他的蝙蝠落地时用它把蝙蝠困住。这样你就不必同时对付他们两个了。|n",dEN="<Dagoda looks at Ahunae and sighs.>\n\nYou want to really deal with Heb'Drakkar? Collecting scalps isn't going to get the job done. You have to take out their leader, Heb'Jin.\n\nThe problem is, he's up on the bat rookery goading his forces on.\n\nBang his drum and I guarantee that he'll fly down. That's when you kill him.\n\nYou can take this net we got from one of his headhunters. Use it to trap his bat when he lands. That way you won't have to fight both of them.",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你去杀死赫布金。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga wants you to kill Heb'Jin.",p="他还没死。我从这里就听的见他在那里嚷嚷！",pEN="He's not dead. I can still hear him yelling from here!",c="你成功了！\n\n<达戈达在你脸颊上重重亲了一口。>\n\n你不知道这让我多松一口气！四面受敌地抵御巨魔真让我们吃不消。更别提他那没完没了的吼叫了。\n\n请吧，<name>，从我们提供的东西里任选你想要的。",cEN="You did it!\n\n<Dagoda gives you a big kiss on the cheek.>\n\nYou have no idea how much of a relief that is to me! Defending against trolls on all sides is really putting a strain on us. Not to mention his incessant yelling.\n\nPlease, <name>, take your pick of what we have to offer."}
Q[12663]={d="$n！\n\n你一定是收到我的礼物了吧！转个身，让我好好看看，伙计，让我仔细看看你……啊，你真令我自豪。\n\n我们历经千辛万苦才走到这一步，现在，你和我，都已经是巫妖王麾下最优秀的仆从了。\n\n你一定要紧跟着我的脚步，还有无数伟大的计划在前面等着我们呢，伙计。嗯，伟大的计划……但首先，我得给你好好补些课，对，补些课。要知道，自我们上次一别之后，发生了许多变故。\n\n去找高尔巴格，让他先带你在祖达克好好逛一圈吧。等你逛完回来之后，我就会把你该知道的所有事情都告诉你的。",dEN="<name>!\n\nYa musta received mah gift! Turn around, mon, lemme get a good look at ya... Ahh, ya make me proud.\n\nWe come such a long way, you and I, and now we be servin' da Lich King together.\n\nStick with me and big things be comin, mon. Big things... but first, we need to be gettin' ya caught up. So much been happenin' since I saw ya last.\n\nGo speak ta Gorebag for a tour of Zul'Drak. Listen for me and I'll tell ya all ya be needin' ta know.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你与高尔巴格交谈，并游览祖达克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to speak to Gorebag and take the tour of Zul'Drak.",p="你跟我将会拿下古达克，老兄。",pEN="You an' me gunna take Gundrak, mon.",c="现在你知道我们要对付的是什么啦，老兄。\n\n下去花点时间研究这个地方，然后准备点战术。\n\n我很快就会派任务给你啦。",cEN="So, now ya be seein' what we be up against, mon.\n\nGo down, take some time ta learn da land, prepare some strategy.\n\nI'll be havin' some tasks for ya soon."}
Q[12664]={d="啊，又一个响应巫妖王召唤的$g乞求者:乞求者;。\n\n<达库鲁嗅了嗅你>\n\n刚被瘟疫感染，嗯？你身上还有活人的味道！\n\n寻求巫妖王祝福的人排成长队。你必须在众人中脱颖而出，证明你$g配得上:配得上;掌握$g真正的:真正的;力量。\n\n从祖达克上方俯瞰，我感应到你有潜力。是我下令给你——发出邀请的。\n\n剩下的就看你自己了……\n\n去和血袋谈谈，让他带你游览祖达克。如果你想对我有点价值，还有很多事要做。",dEN="Ahh, another supplicant answerin' da Lich King's call.\n\n<Drakuru sniffs you.>\n\nFreshly scourged, eh? Ya still be reekin' of da living!\n\nLong be da line of dem who seek da Lich King's blessings. Ya must rise above da masses and prove yerself worthy of wieldin' true power.\n\nLookin' down over Zul'Drak, I sensed potential in ya. I ordered your - invitation.\n\nDa rest be up ta you....\n\nGo an' speak ta Gorebag for a tour of Zul'Drak. Dere be much ta do if you're to be of any worth to me.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你与高尔巴格交谈，并游览祖达克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to speak to Gorebag and take the tour of Zul'Drak.",p="你上过战场没啊，老兄？",pEN="Have ya taken in da battlefield yet, mon?",c="现在你知道我们要对付的是什么了，老兄。\n\n我要你下去，研究这地方，跟你的同胞混熟。准备好……\n\n很快就有很多事要你去做。不要令我失望！",cEN="So, now ya be seein' what we be up against, mon.\n\nI want ya ta go down, learn da land, mingle with yer bretheren. Prepare yourself...\n\nSoon, dere be much for ya to do. Don't ya be disappointin' me!"}
Q[12665]={d="风蛇女神奎丝鲁恩出了状况。具体是什么我感应不到，但我确实知道她的祭坛已经被强大的生物占据了。\n\n我会派你骑上我救下的一个孩子前往那里。你们两个要迅速而隐秘地行动，查明奎丝鲁恩遭遇了什么。\n\n我的孩子会$g安全地:安全地;把你带回来。你只要睁大眼睛就行。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;，就说一声，我会为你召唤一个孩子。",dEN="There's something wrong with Quetz'lun, the wind serpent goddess. What it is exactly I cannot sense, but I do know that her altar has been overrun with powerful creatures.\n\nI'm going to send you there on the back of one of my children, which you saved. The two of you will move swiftly and with great stealth to uncover what has become of Quetz'lun.\n\nMy child will see you safely back to me. Just keep your eyes open.\n\nWhen you are ready, ask and I will call one of my kittens for you.",o="哈克娅要求你去查明奎丝鲁恩的状况。你可以与哈克娅交谈，乘在她孩子的背上悄悄潜入奎丝鲁恩祭坛。\n\n完成侦察任务之后，回到哈克娅祭坛向她报告。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to determine what has happened to Quetz'lun. Speak to her to be able to ride one of her children stealthily into the Altar of Quetz'lun.\n\nReturn to her at the Altar of Har'koa once you have done so.",p="为什么耽搁了，<name>？",pEN="What seems to be the delay, <name>?",c="谢谢你把我的小猫平安的带回来。\n\n其实我心中早就知道了，只是不想不愿去面对，但你的眼睛已经揭示了真相。\n\n然而，我还感觉到什么别的东西。事情并不是表面看起来的那样。",cEN="Thank you for bringing my kitten back safely.\n\nDeep down I knew it. I wanted to deny it, but your eyes have revealed the truth.\n\nNevertheless, I sense something else. All is not as it seems."}
Q[12666]={d="奎丝鲁恩恐怕已经死了，不过我可以感觉到，她的灵魂仍在祭坛周围的灵界中游荡着。我们必须找到一个可以让你和她直接沟通的办法。\n\n幸运的是，那些曾经负责供奉我的祭司身上带有一些神圣符印，这些符印可以帮助我们做到这一点。当然，事到如今，那些家伙已经不再崇拜我，即使你去把他们全都干掉，我也不会有丝毫的怜悯。\n\n将他们身上的神圣符印抢回来给我，我可以抽出其中的能量，协助你进入奎丝鲁恩那梦魇般的灵界。",dEN="Quetz'lun may be dead, but I can still feel her spirit lingering in the underworld at the altar. We have to find a way to get you to her.\n\nLuckily for us, I just happen to have a supply of former supplicants at hand who are no longer in need of their sacred adornments. Both my subduers and claws are likely to still be wearing them.\n\nBring the adornments to me and I'll draw upon their energy to enable you to cross over into Quetz'lun's underworld nightmare.",o="哈克娅要求你收集8枚神圣符印，并把它们带回哈克娅祭坛交给她。",oEN="Har'koa wants you to collect 8 Sacred Adornments. Deliver them to her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="我从未想过事情会变成这样。达卡莱巨魔已经彻底迷失了。",pEN="I never imagined that it would come to this. The Drakkari are truly lost.",c="<当你把收集好的符印带到她面前的时候，猎豹女神看起来有些哀伤。>\n\n从前有段时光，这些东西都曾颇具意义……现在，让我们看看能不能把它们用在更好的用途上吧。",cEN="<The leopard goddess looks saddened at the collection of holy symbols that you have brought before her.>\n\nThere was a time when these meant something. Let's see if we can put them to better use."}
Q[12667]={d="你已经$g准备好了:准备好了;，但我不确定你是否$g准备好:准备好;面对即将到来的东西。\n\n当你穿过奎丝鲁恩祭坛区域时，你会进入亡者的领域。就我的感应而言，那不会愉快。\n\n尽量不要被你在那里看到的东西分心。直接走向祭坛建筑，寻找奎丝鲁恩的灵魂。",dEN="You are prepared, but I'm not certain that you're ready for what is to come.\n\nWhen you cross back over into Quetz'lun's altar area, you will enter the realm of the dead. From what I can feel of it, it's not going to be pleasant.\n\nTry not to be distracted by what you see in there. Simply head for the altar building and seek out Quetz'lun's Spirit.",o="转至奎丝鲁恩祭坛，寻找奎丝鲁恩之魂。",oEN="Seek Quetz'lun's Spirit at the Altar of Quetz'lun.",c="<race>虫子。告诉我，我为什么不该当场把你消灭？",cEN="<race> worm. Tell me why I should not annihilate you where you stand?"}
Q[12668]={d="我已经为我亲爱的高阶祭司们准备了特别的惊喜。但首先你要证明一下自己，为我的复仇打好基础。\n\n你还是想活命的，对不对？\n\n如你所见，我的信徒们非常喜欢待在这里，但现在他们该做出最后的补偿了。\n\n如果你愿意的话，请帮我一个小小的忙，$n。把他们引诱到我的灵魂之泉附近来，然后结果他们的性命。\n\n他们是如此美味，而且我向你保证，他们不会白白牺牲的。",dEN="I have something special planned for my favorite high priests. But first you get to prove yourself in laying the foundation for my revenge.\n\nYou do still want to live, yes?\n\nAs you have seen, my devotees are enjoying their stay here, but now it's time for them to make final restitution.\n\nDo me the smallest of favors if you would, <name>. Lure them near my soul fonts and then put an end to their existences.\n\nThey taste so delicious, and their sacrifice will not go in vain, I can assure you.",o="奎丝鲁恩之魂要你在她的灵魂之泉附近杀死12个巨魔，奎丝鲁恩崇拜者或蛇灵狂暴者都可以。\n\n完成任务之后回到奎丝鲁恩祭坛向她复命。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit has tasked you with the destruction of 12 trolls, either Quetz'lun Worshippers or Serpent-Touched Berserkers, near her Soul Fonts.\n\nOnly after you have accomplished this should you return to her at the Altar of Quetz'lun.",p="任务还没完成，你为什么回来？你难道不知道我一个念头就能毁灭你吗？\n\n现在就去，小<race>。完成我命令你做的事！",pEN="Why do you return when your task is not yet complete? Do you not realize that I can destroy you with but a thought?\n\nGo now, little <race>. Complete that which I commanded of you!",c="非常好。也许你真的有点用处。",cEN="Exquisite. Perhaps you will be of some use after all."}
Q[12669]={d="你报告的一切都与我们已知的情况一致。了解达库鲁并赢得他的信任，将为你今后的任务打下基础。\n\n回到他那里，按他说的做。尽你所能表现得$g真诚:真诚;，$n。你的表现关系重大。\n\n这次我再加一项任务：你在外行动时，把这个添加剂倒进他们的天灾瘟疫大锅。它应该能中和瘟疫剂，让那一炉彻底失效。",dEN="Everything you've reported is consistent with what we know. Learning of Drakuru and earning his trust will lay the groundwork for your future missions.\n\nReturn to him and do as he says. Do whatever you must to appear sincere, <name>. A great deal is riding upon your performance.\n\nThis time I'm adding an additional assignment: While you're in the field, pour this additive into their blight cauldrons. It should neutralize the scourging agent and render the batch useless.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你回到达库鲁身边并听从他的指挥。\n\n在痛苦之匣一带对5只瘟疫之锅使用稀释药剂。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to return to Drakuru and complete any tasks he has for you.\n\nWhile at the Reliquary of Pain, you are to use the Diluting Additive on 5 Blight Cauldrons.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="拜托，<name>，告诉我你没有暴露身份……",pEN="Please, <name>, tell me you haven't blown your cover....",c="干得好，<name>！\n\n稀释那些大锅不仅能拯救生命，还能减缓天灾军团在这一地区的扩张。\n\n现在过来，告诉我你了解到达库鲁在祖达克的什么战略。",cEN="Nice work, <name>!\n\nDiluting those cauldrons will not only save lives, it will slow the growth of the Scourge in this region.\n\nNow come, tell me what you've learned of Drakuru's strategy in Zul'Drak."}
Q[12670]={d="阿彻鲁斯的下方就是死亡裂口，我们对血色十字军作战的前沿基地。在这个平台上随便找一头天灾狮鹫，骑着它去向瓦拉纳王子报到。听从他的指挥，这样你或许能活着看到我们征服这片土地。",dEN="Below Acherus stands Death's Breach, the staging point for our assault upon the Scarlet Crusade. You are to ride one of my Scourge gryphons, located on either side of this platform, and report to Prince Valanar. Do as he says and you may live to see these lands fall before us.",o="转至死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。",oEN="Report to Prince Valanar at Death's Breach.",c="你闻到了吗？\n\n<瓦拉纳王子嗅了嗅空气。>\n\n新鲜的肉……血色十字军的香味随风飘来。\n\n<瓦拉纳流下了口水。>\n\n抱歉，死亡骑士，我想你对我的美食观念一定不感兴趣。你是来工作的！来领导冲锋的！是的……我知道。巫妖王已经把我该知道的都告诉我了，$N。\n\n让他们血溅沙场的时刻已经到了。",cEN="Do you smell it?\n\n<Valanar sniffs at the air.>\n\nFresh meat... The scent of Scarlet Crusader wafts through the air.\n\n<Valanar salivates.>\n\nApologies, death knight, I'm sure you're not interested in my choice of fine cuisine. You are here to work! To lead the charge! Yes... I know. The Lich King has told me all that I need to know about you, <name>.\n\nThe time for bloodshed is now."}
Q[12671]={d="这地方也该有飞机飞起来了。教授一直要我去查看东北方来的奇怪天气模式。\n\n问题是，如果我们要进入未知领域，我就需要一个副驾驶。我一个人绝不往那边飞。\n\n你说呢，$g硬汉:辣妹;？也许你能学到一两手。一旦你学会应付北方的气流……你就能想去哪飞哪了。",dEN="It's about time we had planes up and running in this place. The professor's been asking me to check out a strange weather pattern coming from the northeast.\n\nThing is, I'm going to need a co-pilot if we're going into uncharted territory. No way in hell I'm heading out there alone.\n\nWhat do you say, <tough-guy /hotshot>? You might learn a thing or two. And once you learn to deal with the northern winds... you can pretty much fly anywhere.",o="帮助飞行员维克完成侦察飞行。",oEN="Help Pilot Vic complete the Reconnaissance Flight.",p="怎么了，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你在上头救了我一命啊，伙计。飞得好！",cEN="You saved my life up there, buddy. Nice flying!"}
Q[12672]={d="我可以给你一个活命的机会。\n\n祭坛周围的地上散落着许多能量碎片，它们是用来支撑我身上的诅咒的。我要你帮我去收集一些碎片来。不需要太多，否则我身上的诅咒就会消散了。只要正好让我可以向我的先知复仇就行了。\n\n去吧，爬虫。在我改变主意前，马上去执行我的命令。",dEN="I will give you a chance at continued existence.\n\nThere are fragments of the power that fueled my curse scattered about the altar grounds. It is my desire that you collect some of them for me. Not so many that the curse will be lifted, but enough that I will be able to eventually make use of them to exact revenge upon my prophet.\n\nGo, insect. Run and do my bidding before I change my mind about letting you live.",o="奎丝鲁恩之魂要你收集10块灵界能量碎片。完成任务后返回奎丝鲁恩祭坛向她复命。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit has demanded that you collect 10 Underworld Power Fragments. Return to her at the Altar of Quetz'lun only when you have done so.",p="可惜哈克娅没早点派你来。\n\n不过话说回来，她和我从来就合不来。\n\n她大概故意拖住你的援助，刚好拖到这件事发生。",pEN="What a shame that Har'koa didn't send you along sooner. Then again, she and I never did get along.\n\nShe probably held back your help just long enough for this to happen.",c="这些行了。其实我也根本不需要用到它们。\n\n不过看着你听我命令跑来跑去也挺有趣的。",cEN="They'll do. Likely I won't even need them.\n\nBut it was fun watching you run around at my command."}
Q[12673]={d="如果你想$g配得上:配得上;巫妖王的赐福，就得学会当个$g伟大的:伟大的;领袖——一个能赢得尊敬的人！\n\n我有个任务能磨练你的指挥技巧，伙计……\n\n我的一些仆从受训在下面那片土地上收割瘟疫晶体，但他们又懒又慢。你来管他们，伙计。\n\n拿上这根权杖，教他们怎么把活干完。等他们受你控制，就让他们去采晶体！",dEN="If ya ever gonna be worthy of da Lich King's gifts, ya must learn ta be a great leader - one who be commandin' respect!\n\nI got a task dat gonna refine your command skills, mon....\n\nSumma my minions be trained ta harvest blight crystals from da land below, but dey be lazy and slow. You gonna be in charge o' dem, mon.\n\nTake dis scepter and teach 'em how to get da job done. When dey be under your control, make 'em harvest dem crystals!",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的指挥官达库鲁要你对荒芜恶鬼使用暗示节杖，并指挥它们采集7颗荒芜水晶。",oEN="Overlord Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to use the Scepter of Suggestion on the Blight Geists and then order them to harvest 7 Blight Crystals.",p="你把我那些手下调教好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Ya got my underlings whipped into shape, <name>?",c="晶体堆积的速度前所未有！\n\n继续保持，<name>。我很快会有更多任务给你。",cEN="Da crystals be pilin' up like never before!\n\nYou keep up da good work, <name>. I got more tasks for ya real soon."}
Q[12674]={d="现在你该去惩罚我那三个高阶祭司了，他们分别是穆弗努、图亚图亚和哈文尼。你可以在祭坛周围找到他们。\n\n带上这根妖术棒。我已经在里面灌注了我的怒火，它肯定会非常有用的。\n\n你只要使用它，然后去毁灭他们就行了。妖术会处理剩下的事。\n\n<奎丝鲁恩露齿一笑。>\n\n成功以后，我或许会放你走。如果你失败了，那就去死吧。",dEN="It is now time for you to punish my three high priests: Mu'funu, Tua-Tua, and Hawinni. You'll find them spread around the altar grounds.\n\nTake this hexxing stick. I've empowered it with my rage and indignation. I'm sure that it will prove potent.\n\nJust use it and proceed to destroy them. The hex will take care of the rest.\n\n<Quetz'lun displays a toothy grin.>\n\nSucceed and I may let you go. Fail and die.",o="奎丝鲁恩祭坛的奎丝鲁恩之魂要你对高阶祭司穆弗努、高阶祭司图亚图亚和高阶祭司哈文尼使用奎丝鲁恩的妖术棒，然后杀死他们。",oEN="Quetz'lun's Spirit at the Altar of Quetz'lun wants you to use Quetz'lun's Hexxing Stick upon High Priest Mu'funu, High Priestess Tua-Tua, and High Priest Hawinni. Once you have done this, slay them.",p="你以为我是个蠢蛋吗？\n\n他们还没有死！",pEN="DO YOU THINK THAT I'M A FOOL?\n\nTHEY'RE NOT DEAD!",c="<你面前的恐怖灵魂发出了一阵令人脊背发冷的笑声。>\n\n他们自找的。我还会再让他们体验同样的事，一次又一次又一次又一次……",cEN="<The terrible spirit before you lets loose a blood-chilling cackle.>\n\nThey had it coming. And I'll give them more of the same again and again and again...."}
Q[12675]={d="还差最后一步，就可以实施我的复仇大计了。你必须为这些能量碎片注入某位仍然健在的神灵的精魄，才能令它们发挥威力。我推荐你请求哈克娅的帮助。\n\n如果你能成功的话，那么当你返回这里时，就不会再进入灵界，而是返回我的祭坛所在的物质世界。我的子嗣和守卫者不会再攻击你，这样你就可以轻而易举地接近我的先知。",dEN="There is one last thing that is needed to enact the final revenge against my prophet. The power fragments you collected must be imbued with a portion of a living gods' spirit. You're going to need to beseech Har'koa for some of hers.\n\nOnce you've done that, when you return here, you will not come to the underworld. Instead, you will return to the physical world of my altar. My children and guardians will no longer attack you, and you'll be able to get to my prophet without having to worry about them.",o="转至哈克娅祭坛，请求哈克娅在灵界能量碎片中注入一丝她的精魄。",oEN="Deliver the Underworld Power Fragments to Har'koa and beseech her for a portion of her spirit. You will still find her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="<name>，你回来了。",pEN="You've returned, <name>.",c="我的部分精魄？\n\n<猎豹女神停下来想了一想。>\n\n这是非常过分的要求，尤其是为了复仇这样的目的，况且我已经因为我的镇压者而变的非常虚弱。\n\n不过，我也许知道一个方法。",cEN="A portion of my spirit?\n\n<The snow leopard goddess pauses a moment to consider.>\n\nThat's quite an expensive gift considering that this is for revenge and I'm already greatly weakened by the actions of my subduers.\n\nStill, I may know a way."}
Q[12676]={d="我们一直在尝试解开水晶之谜，因此你必须返回沃尔塔鲁斯，执行达库鲁的命令。\n\n每当你成功地完成一项使命，他对你的信任就增加一分，我们也就更容易揣摩他的心思。\n\n呃，我还有一项任务要交给你。达库鲁的天灾车给我们造成了不小的威胁，我要你炸毁它们。\n\n你要设法靠近那些天灾车，然后引爆炸弹。记得迅速撤离！不然很可能伤到你自己。",dEN="While we're working to discover the purpose of these crystals, we need you back in Voltarus doing Drakuru's bidding.\n\nEvery task you perform successfully gets you closer to him, and brings us that much nearer to knowing his mind.\n\nWhile you're there, I have another mission for you. Drakuru's Scourgewagons pose a significant threat. We need them destroyed.\n\nMake your way to the wagons and activate these charges. Once they're set, get clear! The explosion will expose you if you're too close.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你再去为达库鲁执行一项任务。\n\n除此之外，他还要你转至痛苦之匣，使用炸药束摧毁5辆天灾车。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to perform another task for Drakuru.\n\nAdditionally, you are to use the Explosive Charges on 5 Scourgewagons at the Reliquary of Pain.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="你成功清理掉那些天灾战车了吗，<name>？",pEN="Were you successful in clearing those scourgewagons, <name>?",c="太好了！\n\n你的卧底工作确实很有价值，<name>。\n\n现在让我们看看那根权杖……",cEN="Excellent!\n\nYour undercover work has truly paid off, <name>.\n\nNow let's have a look at that scepter...."}
Q[12677]={d="瘟疫晶体？！达库鲁这个混蛋到底在搞什么？显然他在做一件大事。\n\n继续执行他的命令，也许等他更熟悉你之后，会透露他的计划。与此同时，我们得看看这些晶体。\n\n你在沃尔塔鲁斯时，趁没人注意，试着取一些收获晶体的样本。\n\n保持警惕！接触那些晶体可能会让你的伪装失效。 $g警觉:警觉;",dEN="Blight crystals?! What could this scumbag Drakuru be up to? Clearly, he's working on something significant.\n\nContinue to do his bidding and perhaps once he's more familiar with you he'll reveal his plans. In the meantime, we need to have a look at these crystals.\n\nWhile you're in Voltarus, try to get some samples of the harvested crystals when no one's looking.\n\nBe alert! Handling those crystals can trigger your disguise to fail.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要你转至沃尔塔鲁斯,并完成达库鲁给予的任务。你还要从那里偷取5块采集到的荒芜水晶。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan at Ebon Watch wants you to go to Voltarus and complete any tasks Drakuru has for you. While there, you are to steal 5 Harvested Blight Crystals.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="欢迎回来，<name>。\n\n你偷到达库鲁的晶体样本了吗？",pEN="Welcome back, <name>.\n\nWere you able to steal any samples of Drakuru's crystals?",c="真有意思！\n\n我们会立刻研究这些晶体的性质。\n\n现在告诉我，<name>，这个叫达库鲁的家伙最新有什么动向？",cEN="Fascinating!\n\nWe'll look into the properties of these crystals right away.\n\nNow tell me, <name>, what is the latest with this Drakuru fellow?"}
Q[12678]={d="现在他们准备在死亡裂口外面背水一战，徒劳地想要挽救他们的马匹、矿洞、木材和平民。\n\n你将在天灾军团中学到第一堂军事课：恐惧！\n\n到南方的前线去，击败那些血色十字军。我们可以在死亡远征时用到他们。\n\n但最重要的是：要击败那些胆小如鼠的、假扮成普通人和农夫的预备兵，他们伪装成平民来偷取我们的萨隆邪铁箭矢。在他们弄坏这些宝贵的箭矢之前击败他们，并把恐惧深深埋入那些人的心底。",dEN="They make their stand now, outside of Death's Breach, futilely attempting to push us back in hopes of saving their horses, mines, lumber and citizens.\n\nThis will be your first lesson in Scourge warfare: TERROR!\n\nGo to the front lines, south of here, and destroy Scarlet Crusaders. Leave their corpses so that we may utilize them for the death march.\n\nBut most importantly: kill the fleeing villagers. Soldiers dying are an affordance, but villagers? That is what strikes fear into the hearts of man.",o="死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子命令你击败10个血色十字军战士或血色农夫，以及10个海文郡预备兵。",oEN="Prince Valanar at Death's Breach commands you to slay 10 Scarlet Crusaders or Scarlet Peasants and 10 Citizens of Havenshire.",p="这是开场奏鸣曲，<class>。天灾的死亡进行曲将从根除前线开始。",pEN="This is the opening sonata, <class>. The Scourge death march begins with the eradication of the front lines.",c="你感觉到了吗，$N？那种感觉，就是在你体内流动的全新力量。凡人是体会不到这种感觉的。\n\n前线现在已经崩解了，魂尸将会完成剩下的工作，并且替拉苏维奥斯准备好场地。我们则把注意力转移到更具战术性的目标上。",cEN="Do you feel it, <name>? That sensation is raw power coursing through your body. Such a thing cannot exist for mortals.\n\nThe front lines are now dismantled. The geist will finish the job and prepare the grounds for Razuvious. We turn our attention now to more tactical targets."}
Q[12679]={d="遮天者都是无意识的构造体，它们唯一的用途就是：战斗！\n\n不过眼下有一个小问题……它们使用的是射程极远杀伤力极大的萨隆邪铁箭矢。但萨隆矿石只有诺森德才出产，而且产量非常有限！去帮我回收一些箭矢，我会好好奖赏你的。",dEN="The Sky Darkeners are mindless constructs with one purpose: KILL! Specifically, they are aiming to kill any man or woman that they see fleeing Havenshire for the safety of New Avalon. We certainly can't allow those cowards to make it to safety and then take up arms against us!\n\nThere is one slight problem. They use saronite arrows for maximum range and damage. Saronite, however, is a metal only found in Northrend, so supplies are limited! Retrieve those arrows for me and I will reward you handsomely.",o="死亡裂口的遮天者奥里索斯要你去回收15支萨隆邪铁箭矢。",oEN="Orithos the Sky Darkener at Death's Breach wants you to recover 15 Saronite Arrows.",p="他们发射的射角应该会让大多数的箭枝落在南边的海文郡农场那一带。",pEN="The trajectories they are firing at would have most of the arrows land at or near the Havenshire Farm, south of us.",c="做得好，死亡骑士！你的所作所为替天灾战争机器补给了弹药！\n\n啊，对了，你的奖赏——我答应过的。",cEN="Well done, death knight! You feed the Scourge war machine with your deeds!\n\nAh yes, your reward - as promised."}
Q[12680]={d="真是巧，离这处岗哨仅一箭之遥的地方就有一座十字军的马厩，里面有许多马匹。虽然他们守卫严密，但一个年轻勇敢的死亡骑士完全可以突破他们的防线，带走自己想要的东西！\n\n你从海文郡马厩选到一匹好马后就骑上它回来找我，我会想办法把它转化成死亡战马的。\n\n记住，$n，如果你被制伏了，就要想办法再回去弄一匹。记得当心那个管理员，基特里克！",dEN="How fortuitous it is that the Crusade has a stable full of horses a mere stone's throw from this post. Though they guard it tenaciously, an enterprising young death knight could break through their defenses and take what is rightfully <his/hers>!\n\nOnce you acquire a horse from the Havenshire Stables, return it to me and I will see what can be done about transforming it into a proper deathcharger.\n\nRemember, <name>, it's only stealing if you're caught. Watch out for that deranged stable master, Kitrik!",o="骑手萨拉纳尔要你从海文郡马厩中骑上一匹血色战马，然后回到死亡裂口，把马交给他。",oEN="Salanar the Horseman asks that you steal a horse from the Havenshire Stables and return it to him at Death's Breach.",p="你不想一直徒步行走，对吧？",pEN="You don't want to walk forever, do you?",c="接下来才是真正的试炼。你能够对一头不羁的战骑展现出多少驾驭的本事，然后用蛮力夺取你最想要的东西呢？",cEN="Now for the true test. Can you show mastery over an unbound charger and brutally overtake the thing that you desire most?"}
Q[12681]={d="达拉然的大法师伯塔鲁斯希望我们给他带回各种材料和辟邪物。索拉查盆地的原住民似乎特别迷信动物的肢体，取自血爪大鹏的扭曲的大鹏爪是他们的最爱。\n\n我没有资格评论关于这件辟邪物的传言是否属实，不过这里头总归是有些缘由的。\n\n血爪大鹏生活在东北方的埋骨地，以猛犸象的尸体为食。你能帮我收集一些爪子供大法师研究吗？",dEN="That Archmage Pentarus, back in Dalaran, will be expecting us to return with all kinds of reagents and talismans. It seems the locals are fond of animal parts. Twisted claws from the goretalon rocs are among their favorite.\n\nIt's not my place to say whether the rumors are true or not, but I've a feeling there's something here.\n\nThe rocs live in the Bonefields off to the northeast, where they feed on the corpses of old mammoths. Will you help me gather talons for the archmage's research?",o="将5只扭曲的大鹏爪交给多里安哨站的考尔文·诺灵顿。",oEN="Bring 5 Twisted Roc Claws to Colvin Norrington at Dorian's Outpost.",p="你有找到扭曲的大鹏爪吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any of the twisted talons?",c="<考尔文一脸钦佩地看着你带来的爪子。>\n\n这样就够了。伯塔鲁斯的说法是爪子越扭曲多节，法力就越强。我想大法师为这个营地付出的金币收回票价了。",cEN="<Colvin looks admiringly at the talons you've brought back.>\n\nThese will more than suffice. The gorlocs have a saying that the more gnarled the talon, the more power it holds. I'm sure the archmage will get his money's worth from this expedition."}
Q[12683]={d="整个盆地里剩下的腐蚀性材料，就属苦潮九头蛇的唾液了。我有专门的容器来采集这种东西，供大法师彭塔鲁斯研究。现在我只缺一位勇敢的，呃……采集者。\n\n你看起来像$g个:个;强健又爱冒险的$g:$c;。想不想一边赚点钱，一边为达拉然的事业出力？\n\n你只需要带上这个容器去西南方的苦潮湖。挑衅一头九头蛇，用它喷你身上的唾液取样。",dEN="There's no more caustic material in all of the basin than bittertide hydra sputum. I've got special containers to collect just such a thing for Archmage Pentarus' studies. Now all I need is a brave, um... collector.\n\nYou look like a hardy, adventurous <class>. How'd you like to make a bit of money and aid Dalaran's cause at the same time?\n\nAll you need to do is take this container with you to Bittertide Lake, to the southwest. Engage the hydra and use the container to sample the sputum they shower you with.",o="多里安哨站的考尔文·诺灵顿要你收集5份多头蛇唾液样本并杀死5只苦潮多头蛇。",oEN="Colvin Norrington at Dorian's Outpost wants you to take 5 Hydra Sputum Samples and kill 5 Bittertide Hydra.",p="你拿到样本了吗？",pEN="Did you get those samples?",c="太棒了！这是说好的报酬。还有，呃，一点建议：要是那种\"灼烧感\"一直不退，接下来几天你也许想多泡几个热水澡。",cEN="Wonderful! Here's your payment, as agreed. And, uh, a bit of advice: you might want to enjoy long, hot baths the next few days if that 'burning sensation' persists."}
Q[12684]={d="猛犸之神犸托斯前些日子亲手毁灭了自己，并将他那伟大的神殿也摧毁了。他宁可死，也不愿意让达卡莱巨魔窃取他一丝一毫的力量。\n\n现在我需要牺牲自己的一部分灵魂，因此需要一些外来的能量以支撑自身的延续。\n\n犸托斯自我毁灭的地方就在东北方，奎丝鲁恩祭坛的正北边不远。他的自爆在那里留下了一个巨大的坑洞，里面满是他的血液。\n\n给我带一些他的血液回来。",dEN="Mam'toth, the god of the mammoths, destroyed himself, and took much of his temple with him, rather than allowing his trolls to gain his power.\n\nIf I'm to sacrifice a portion of my spirit, I will need something with which to bolster myself.\n\nMam'toth left behind an enormous crater to the northeast, just north of the Altar of Quetz'lun. Within the crater his blood yet lives.\n\nBring it to me.",o="哈克娅要求你收集7份犸托斯之血，并把它们带回哈克娅祭坛交给她。",oEN="Har'koa has asked you to collect 7 Blood of Mam'toth. Return them to her at the Altar of Har'koa.",p="我希望有什么方法可以把犸托斯带回这个世界，但很可惜这种方法并不存在。\n\n我们只能持续对抗达卡莱巨魔，以纪念他和他所做的牺牲。",pEN="I wish that there were something that we could do to bring Mam'toth back to life, but there isn't.\n\nWe can honor him and his sacrifice by continuing the fight against the Drakkari.",c="非常好，让我们看看这是否有用……",cEN="Very well. Let us see if this works...."}
Q[12685]={d="复仇……复仇的时候终于到来了。\n\n<哈克娅低沉地叹了一口气。>\n\n把这只包裹里的东西带到奎丝鲁恩的尸体旁去，在她的祭坛上打开包裹，引导仪式。如果一切正常，她的灵魂将被重新拉回物质界，这样一来，她就可以从那个卑贱的先知手中夺回自己的力量。\n\n之后的一切就都指望你了，$n。你一定要在先知失去力量之后立刻杀死他，结束风蛇女神的梦魇。",dEN="This is what it has come down to... revenge.\n\n<Har'koa sighs.>\n\nTake this ritual kit and enact it near Quetz'lun's corpse upon her altar. If everything works properly, her spirit should be drawn into the material world where she will be able to reclaim her power from the prophet.\n\nThe rest will be up to you, <name>. You must slay the prophet in his drained state.",o="杀死虚弱的奎丝鲁恩先知，然后通知希姆托加的巫医库弗。",oEN="Slay the Drained Prophet of Quetz'lun and then inform Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",p="是什么让你回来找我，<name>？",pEN="What brings you back to me, <name>?",c="<巫医不可置信地摇了摇头。>\n\n听起来你十分惊险地从奎丝鲁恩的灵魂界生还了。\n\n我很高兴你去进行这个工作——我不知道我自己有没有勇气面对那种状况！",cEN="<The witch doctor shakes his head in disbelief.>\n\nIt sounds like you barely escaped Quetz'lun's underworld alive.\n\nI'm glad that it's you out there. I don't know if I would have had the courage to deal with that situation!"}
Q[12686]={d="白痴！蠢货！这是不能容忍的！整整一批的瘟疫菌株居然都变成了废物！\n\n达穆克那个混帐！饭桶！他本应负责保养好那些瘟疫菌株的，太令我失望了！\n\n这对你来说也是个不错的教训，$n。失败往往会像传染病一样迅速传播。发生第一次失败之后，你必须立刻抓住它，消灭它，否则，它就会反过来使得你被别人消灭！\n\n拿上这根能使我们天灾巨魔更加强大的节杖。你要用它杀死达穆克。那混蛋应该就躲在南边的什么地方。\n\n就让那条败狗用自己的性命给所有人提个醒吧。让达库鲁失望，就等于死！",dEN="Ignorance! Dis be intolerable, mon! My entire batch of blight be useless!\n\nDat mongrel, Darmuk! He be responsible for watchin over da blight. He failed me, mon!\n\nDis be a good lesson for ya, <name>. Failure be like a disease dat spreads. Ya gotta catch it and kill it early, before it be killin' you!\n\nTake dis scepter. It make my scourged trolls stronger. Use dem ta kill Darmuk. He be lurkin' down below just to da south.\n\nLet dat be an example to all, mon. Don't be failin' Drakuru!",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你转至痛苦之匣，对一名达库鲁的仆从使用强化节杖，然后使用它的技能击败达穆克。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to go to the Reliquary of Pain and use the Scepter of Empowerment on a Servant of Drakuru. You are then to use its abilities to defeat Darmuk.",p="达穆克为他的失败付出代价了吗，<name>？",pEN="Has Darmuk paid for his failure, <name>?",c="你干得不错，<name>。你学得比我预想的快。\n\n现在去吧，休息一下。很快我会给你更大的考验！",cEN="Ya done good, <name>. You be learnin' faster than I had hoped.\n\nGo now, get ya some rest. Soon I be givin' ya an even greater test!"}
Q[12687]={d="你送来的战马已经被送往暗影界。我的黑暗骑士将在那里训练它，然后把它强化成为一匹死亡战马。你觉得自己有足够的勇气进入暗影界去夺取亡灵战马吗？\n\n如果你愿意的话，我可以把你传送到暗影界，等你到了那里之后，去我们南面的空地上寻找黑暗骑士。为了得到你自己的死亡战马，你必须击败他，夺取他的死亡战马，然后回到死亡裂口来。成功之后，就使用骑手的召唤。",dEN="The horse you stole has been taken to the Realm of Shadows. It is there that my dark rider will slay the beast and raise it as a deathcharger. Do you think yourself brave enough to enter the Realm of Shadows in pursuit of the deathcharger?\n\nIf you accept, I will transport you to the shadow world. Once there, seek out a dark rider in the open fields south of us. To emerge victorious you must slay him, overtake his deathcharger and return it to Death's Breach. Issue the Horseman's Call should you succeed.",o="死亡裂口的骑手萨拉纳尔要求你去消灭阿彻鲁斯黑暗骑士，并夺走他的阿彻鲁斯死亡战马。\n\n如果你成功地将阿彻鲁斯死亡战马带回死亡裂口，就使用“骑手的召唤”技能召唤萨拉纳尔。",oEN="Salanar the Horseman at Death's Breach has challenged you to slay the Dark Rider of Acherus and take his Acherus Deathcharger.\n\nShould you succeed, return the Acherus Deathcharger to Death's Breach and use the Horseman's Call to summon Salanar.",p="你必须用武力夺取死亡战马，<class>！",pEN="You must take the deathcharger by force, <class>!",c="你做到了大多数新兵做不到的事，$N。为此你会得到丰厚的奖赏。",cEN="You have succeeded where most initiates fail, <name>. For that you will be rewarded handsomely.\n\n<Salanar bows.>"}
Q[12688]={d="这群愚蠢的地精和他们的狗奴才竟然将这根水晶柱视为已有。我原本是来勘探水晶的，可就在我采集样本时，他们冲出来打倒了我，并拒绝让我返回营地。\n\n带我逃离这里吧，我们还可以顺路好好收拾一下这些暴徒！",dEN="These goblin goons and their minions have decided that they own this pillar and its crystals. I came here to explore the crystals and take samples, but they overpowered me and won't let me return to the camp.\n\nIf you'll help me fight our way out of here, we can teach these thugs a lesson they'll never forget!",o="护送工程师赫莉丝逃离斯温迪格林挖掘场，然后与奈辛瓦里营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里谈一谈。",oEN="Help Engineer Helice escape from Swindlegrin's Dig, then speak with Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",c="谢谢你救了赫莉丝，还陪她回来。她外出找水晶一直没有回来，我们实在很担心。",cEN="Thank you for freeing Helice and seeing to her safe return. We all started to get worried when she didn't return from her crystal hunting trip."}
Q[12689]={c="嗨！很高兴再见到你！\n\n我知道我们是朋友。我就知道！你是好朋友。不只是我们的，也是所有神谕者的。\n\n我看到你跟那些小狗人很要好！不死的东西说你以前是他的朋友？我不知道。不过你跟小狗人绝交了，对吧？现在只跟神谕者当好朋友吧？\n\n等等！别随便同意——你确定你不要跟小狗人当朋友了？",cEN="Hi! Really glad see you again!\n\nI knew we friends. I knew it! You good friend. Not just for us, but for all Oracles.\n\nI saw you bonk that puppy-man good! Undead thing said he your friend before? I not know that. You done with puppy-men though, yeah? Just Oracle friend now?\n\nI know you choose right! Thank you for saving us! Thank you, thank you!"}
Q[12690]={d="是时候进军古达克了，朋友。是时候让你去教训教训那些不知好歹的巨魔了！\n\n那群混蛋前几天攻破了我们的城墙，还将一整支军队驻扎在了北面。\n\n哈哈哈哈！\n\n简直是给天灾之火上面浇了一把油！我要把他们的酋长都抓起来，至于其它的蝼蚁……都无关紧要了！这将是我的宏伟计划中最重要的一环……\n\n拿着这根节杖，用它来号令我的憎恶。嗯，你可以带上所有的憎恶转至那群达卡莱巨魔的营地，把他们全部击败！等他们的酋长出现以后，我的宠物岩翼会把他们全部抓回来。",dEN="It be time we start our march to Gundrak, mon. It be time for me ta turn ya loose on dem trolls!\n\nDey breached our wall and put a whole army just north of us.\n\nHahaha!\n\nDey be fuel for da fire, mon! We gunna take da chieftiains an' kill da rest! It all be part of my master plan....\n\nYou take dis scepter and go command my abominations. Bring 'em to da Drakkari army and kill em all! When da chieftains come, my pet Shalewing gunna snatch 'em up and bring 'em here to me.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你对浮肿的憎恶使用命令节杖，然后利用它们的能力在冰冷裂口击败60名达卡莱裂颅者，并将3名达卡莱酋长引诱出来。\n\n只要击败足够数量的达卡莱裂颅者，酋长们就会出现。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to use the Scepter of Command on Bloated Abominations and then use their abilities at the Frigid Breach to kill 60 Drakkari Skullcrushers and lure out 3 Drakkari Chieftains.\n\nChieftains will appear when enough Skullcrushers have been slain.",p="你把那些巨魔砸扁了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did ya smash da trolls, <name>?",c="做得好，老兄！\n\n我把酋长全都关起来了，而你带领着我的憎恶打败了他们的军队。\n\n该去庆祝一下了，老兄！",cEN="We done it, mon!\n\nI got da chieftains all caged up and you led my abominations to victory over their armies.\n\nIt be time ta celebrate, mon!"}
Q[12691]={d="这个石箱似乎被锁住了，看来要在锁眼中插入相配的钥匙才能打开它。\n\n那些石头卫士身上或许带有这把钥匙。",dEN="The stone coffer appears to be locked. It appears that a key fits inside a large stone keyhole.\n\nPerhaps one of the guardians in the vicinity has this key in its possession.",o="从索拉查卫士身上取得巨型石钥匙，用它打开造物者悬台上的古旧石箱。",oEN="Obtain a Huge Stone Key from the nearby Sholazar Guardians and bring it to the Timeworn Coffer at the Maker's Overlook.",p="这个石箱纹丝不动。",pEN="The stone coffer does not budge.",c="巨型石钥匙发出了一声低沉的喀擦声，然后石箱的盖子打开来，显露出里面隐藏的财宝。",cEN="The huge stone key turns with a deep grunt as the coffer lid opens up to reveal hidden treasure inside."}
Q[12692]={d="好，我回狂心岭去，确保所有狂心氏都知道你为狼獾人和泽皮克做了什么。你是伟大的$g猎人:女猎人;，他们真傻，居然不这么想。\n\n你回山上去，和老哈尔克谈谈……我会确保在任何其他狂心氏之前，让他知道你$g不是:不是;叛徒。\n\n谢谢你，$g猎巫:猎巫;者。",dEN="Okay, I going back to Frenzyheart Hill to make sure all Frenzyheart know what you done for wolvar and for Zepik. You great hunter and they dumb to think you not.\n\nGo back to hill and talk to Elder Harkek... I make sure he knows you not traitor before any other Frenzyheart.\n\nThank you, Lich Hunter.",o="返回狂心岭，与长者哈尔卡克谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Frenzyheart Hill and speak to Elder Harkek.",c="再次见到你真好。我知道你不是叛徒，我很高兴瑟匹克证明了我是对的。\n\n我听说你现在是巫妖猎手了——真棒！你让哈尔卡克觉得很骄傲。",cEN="It good to see you again. I knew you not a traitor, I glad Zepik prove me right.\n\nI hear you Lich Hunter now - that pretty good! You make Harkek proud."}
Q[12695]={d="啊呀！索乌塞很可能在担心我们！你应该回去向他报个平安，好吗？嗯，告诉索乌塞所有的事情。\n\n我要在巫妖的尸体上找个东西——咱们回去再碰面吧！去吧去吧！回去再和你碰面！",dEN="Yay! Soo-say probably worrying about us! Maybe you go back to town and tell him everything okay? Yeah, go tell Soo-say.\n\nI going grab shiny ball thing from dead lich guy - I meet you there! Go go! I meet you there!",o="返回雨声树屋，与高阶神谕者索乌塞谈一谈。",oEN="Return to Rainspeaker Canopy and speak to High-Oracle Soo-say.",c="很高兴又见到你！当你没有马上回来的时候我们有点担心。\n\n亚鲁乌特抢在你之前回来了——他精力充沛，跑得很快。他告诉我你从那个巫妖手中救了他。莫乌德也告诉我你怎么拯救了苔行村。你真是个好人。\n\n我希望你在我们这儿待上一会儿。总是有事情要做。",cEN="Good to see you again! We worried when you not come back right away.\n\nJaloot beat you back - lot of energy in Jaloot, he pretty fast. He told me how you save him from lich thing. Moodle told me how you save mosswalkers too. You really nice.\n\nI hope you stay with us for while. Always something need doing."}
Q[12696]={d="谢谢你帮维斯雷修好了那架飞行器。\n\n你愿意再帮我们一个忙吗？西北方有一股不寻常的气流袭来。我已经指派了飞行员维克去侦察情况，不过他恐怕还需要一名副驾驶员。\n\n如果你觉得自己能胜任的话，就飞往湖边着陆场去找他吧。哦，记得告诉他，是我派你去的。",dEN="You did a good job helping Wes with getting that flying machine back up and running.\n\nIf you'd like to help us further, there is an unusual weather pattern coming in from the northeast. I have a pilot ready to work for me, but I'm afraid he needs a copilot.\n\nIf you think you're up to it, you can take the flight to Lakeside Landing. Tell Vic I sent you.",o="卡尔维特教授要你飞往湖边着陆场，与飞行员维克谈一谈。",oEN="Professor Calvert wants you to take the flight to Lakeside Landing and speak with Pilot Vic there.",c="教授派你来找我？好吧。",cEN="The professor sent you my way? All right."}
Q[12697]={d="一片混乱，$n！血色十字军陷入了疯狂。他们调动了新阿瓦隆外围的所有部队，在东面的圣光哨站设置了封锁。他们正不顾一切地掠夺海文郡矿洞中的所有资源，并把它们运送到停泊在海岸旁的护卫舰上。\n\n我们也去凑凑热闹如何？收割者戈提克——巫妖王的首席通灵师——已经来到了我们中间。他有一件礼物想要送给血色十字军，你去找他吧。",dEN="CHAOS, <name>! The Crusade is in a frenzy. They have diverted all forces outside of New Avalon to set up a blockade at Light's Point, east of here. They are desperately trying to strip the Havenshire Mine of all resources and load the cargo aboard the frigates they have docked on the coast.\n\nLet's stir things up a bit, shall we? Gothik the Harvester, grand necromancer of the Lich King, has graced us with his presence. He has a gift he'd like to bestow upon the Scarlet Crusade. Seek him out.",o="与死亡裂口的收割者戈提克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Gothik the Harvester at Death's Breach.",c="虽然你们经历了千难万险才来到收割者的领域……等等。\n\n<戈提克看了看他的笔记。>\n\n抱歉，$r。老习惯很难改。\n\n那么，是瓦拉纳派你来的咯？我相信你一定相当能干。\n\n我确实有份礼物要给血色的杂种。这一定能让他们加快在矿洞的工作。",cEN="You have fought hard to invade the realm of the harvester... Wait.\n\n<Gothik looks at his notes.>\n\nMy apologies, <race>. Old habits die hard.\n\nValanar sent you, then? I trust you are somewhat competent.\n\nI do have a gift for the Scarlet dogs. One that is sure to speed up their work in the mines."}
Q[12698]={d="我从冰冷的纳克萨玛斯来到这里，以享受灵魂的盛宴，给我们的仇敌带来痛苦的打击——不过我的灵魂储备已经耗尽了。\n\n来，带上我给你的见面礼，把它带到东面的海文郡矿洞去，放在血色矿工干活的地方。用它将矿工变成被控制的矿工，等你手里有了一支小军队后回到我这里来。我给他们在灵魂容器里留了一块特别的地方！",dEN="I have come from the frozen heart of Naxxramas to feast on souls and deliver a vicious thrashing upon our sworn enemies - and I'm all out of souls.\n\nThis device I am about to give to you is a portable plague spreader. Take it east, to the Havenshire Mines, and unleash it near the Scarlet miners working inside. Use it to turn the miners into ghouls and return to me when you have a small army at your side. I have saved a special place for them in the vacuum cleaner of souls!",o="死亡裂口的收割者戈提克让你对血色矿工使用收割者的礼物，制造出5个被控制的血色矿工之后向戈提克复命。",oEN="Gothik the Harvester at Death's Breach has given you the Gift of the Harvester to use on Scarlet Miners. Create 5 Scarlet Ghouls with the device and return the ghouls to Gothik.",p="一点小提醒：矿工不是每次都会变成食尸鬼。有时候他们会变成想要杀了你的愤怒灵魂。",pEN="One small note: miners don't always become ghouls. Sometimes they turn into enraged spirits, hell-bent on killing you.",c="他们现在知道矿洞不再安全了。他们会很快撤出，把弱点暴露出来！",cEN="They now know that the mines are no longer safe. They will double their efforts in retreating, leaving their backs open to us!"}
Q[12699]={d="出发之前，还有个小问题要解决。你看，我怎么都找不到飞行器的钥匙。\n\n除了湖里面，我哪儿都翻遍了……就是没有见着。你能帮我个忙吗？替我去湖里找找钥匙吧。\n\n我可以把我的氧气筒借给你啊。虽然里面的氧气不多，但足够你用的了。",dEN="There's one little problem we have to solve before we head out. You see, I can't seem to find the keys to my flying machine.\n\nI've looked pretty much everywhere for them... maybe you can give me a hand. Only place I haven't looked yet is inside the lake.\n\nI'll even give you my very own air tank. It's almost empty, but it's got a couple of hits left.",o="在河流之心的湖泊中寻找维克的钥匙。",oEN="Look for Vic's Keys inside the lake at River's Heart.",p="你找到什么了吗，<name>？",pEN="You find anything yet, <name>?",c="太棒了！",cEN="Excellent!"}
Q[12700]={d="看样子只有新阿瓦隆和圣光哨站的十字军部队能够算得上是威胁了！进攻圣光哨站的血色舰队的时机已经成熟。\n\n矿洞那边发生的事情使得他们的士兵乱作一团。他们正在疯狂般清理那个地方，并撤回他们的战舰上。\n\n时机成熟了！瓦拉纳王子正想利用这次机会一举干掉血色舰队。马上去向他报到！",dEN="Only the Scarlet forces at New Avalon and Light's Point challenge us! The time to attack the Scarlet fleet at Light's Point has come.\n\nThe diversion at the mine has caused chaos amidst their ranks. They are frantically working to clear the area and return to their ships.\n\nThe time is ripe! Prince Valanar is seizing this opportunity to finish off the Scarlet fleet. Report to him at once!",o="与死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Prince Valanar at Death's Breach.",c="你做得很好，死亡骑士。你的同袍在对那些血色入侵者发起的第一波攻势中只有少数活了下来。只有像你这样最强的人才得以幸存。\n\n<瓦拉纳王子点了点头。>\n\n在我们的东边，过了海文郡矿洞，就是被血色十字军称为圣光哨站的海岸。有一千名士兵挡在我们和他们的船舰之间。很难完成？这不是重点……",cEN="You have served us well, death knight. Few of your brethren have survived our initial attack upon the Scarlet interlopers. You remain as one of the strongest.\n\n<Prince Valanar nods.>\n\nEast of us, past the Havenshire Mine, is the coast - called Light's Point by the Scarlet Crusade. A thousand soldiers stand between us and their ships. Insurmountable? Hardly the point..."}
Q[12701]={d="匆忙之中，十字军会犯下一个致命错误：忘记检查矿车。\n\n你要回到此地以东的避难所矿洞，找到我的爪牙放在茅厕附近的矿车。爬进矿车，一名血色矿工会毫不知情地把你安全送到敌人后方。\n\n一旦登上他们的一艘船，就用船上的火炮对付他们！把他们全部杀光！\n\n等你$g准备:准备;返回时，从火炮那里召唤天灾狮鹫。",dEN="In their haste the Crusade will make one fatal error: forgetting to check the mine cars.\n\nYou are to return to Havenshire Mine, east of here, and locate the mine car that my minions have planted near the outhouse. Climb inside the mine car and a Scarlet miner will unwittingly see to it that you are placed safely behind enemy lines.\n\nOnce aboard one of their ships, use the cannons against them! SLAUGHTER THEM ALL!\n\nCall the Scourge gryphon from the cannon when you are ready to return.",o="死亡裂口的瓦拉纳王子命令你去打倒100个血色防御者。",oEN="Prince Valanar at Death's Breach has commanded you to slaughter 100 Scarlet Defenders.",p="死亡骑士无所畏惧！",pEN="Death knights know no fear!",c="几分钟之内就把整个血色舰队扫平！我将会因此得到巫妖王的嘉奖！现在整个血色十字军只剩下新阿瓦隆的居民了。\n\n我会立刻把恶鬼和通灵法师派去海文郡。你负责把我的报告拿去给大领主！",cEN="The entire Scarlet fleet wiped out in a matter of minutes! I will receive a commendation from the Lich King for this! All that remains of the Scarlet Crusade now are the denizens of New Avalon.\n\nI'll set the fire starters and necromancers upon Havenshire immediately. You will carry my report to the Highlord!"}
Q[12702]={d="我打赌你猜不到又出了什么状况。\n\n错啦，和格利基克无关，也不是鸡舍的事。\n\n好吧，我骗你的。就是格利基克！鸡们又被他吓得跑掉了。愚蠢的格利基克！我的肚子已经饿得咕咕叫了。\n\n如果你需要其它猎手的帮助，告诉我一声就是了……鸡们就躲在附近。",dEN="I bet you not guess what happen again.\n\nNope, not Goregek or chickens.\n\nOkay, I lie. Goregek let chickens out again. Dumb Goregek and rumbly belly.\n\nLet me know if you need help from any of the hunters... they around here somewhere.",o="狂心岭的长者哈尔卡克要你去捕捉12只逃走的小鸡。",oEN="Capture 12 Chicken Escapees for Elder Harkek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="通常鸡都不会跑太远……如果蓝蜂不会吃掉他们的话，也许下次干脆就让它们呆在外面好了。",pEN="Chickens not get far usually... if wasps not eat them, maybe we just let them stay on field next time.",c="你真擅长这个。\n\n也许我们哪天干脆把格拉克伊克丢进水里，你就不用再做这种事了。",cEN="You good at this.\n\nMaybe someday we just dump Goregek in river so you not have to do this no more."}
Q[12703]={d="你是伟大的$g猎巫:猎巫;者，嗯？有个这么强的狂心氏盟友作战真好。也许你强得足以召唤卡尔塔克了。\n\n西南方的卡尔塔克堡垒有场大战。去杀火花的巨舌们，直到你收集到足够的先知之血。把血带到卡尔塔克堡垒的祭坛，召唤卡尔塔克来享用一顿美味的巨舌盛宴。\n\n如果你$g配得上:配得上;，卡尔塔克会附上你的身……有了卡尔塔克的力量，你能杀掉的巨舌比你最好的梦里还多。\n\n去吧，多杀一些，$g猎人:女猎人;！",dEN="You the great Lich Hunter, eh? Good to have such strong Frenzyheart ally for battle. Maybe you strong enough to call Kartak even.\n\nBig battle at Kartak's Hold to southwest. Go kill spark big-tongues until you get good bit of Oracle Blood. Bring blood to altar in Kartak's Hold to call Kartak for delicious feast of big-tongue.\n\nKartak take your body if you worthy... with Kartak's powers, you slaughter more big-tongues than even best dreams.\n\nGo kill lots, hunter!",o="将1份纯净的神谕者的血带去卡塔克的祭坛，召唤出卡塔克。借助他的力量在祭坛附近杀死50个灵鳍鳄鱼人，然后向卡塔克要塞的萨满祭司亚克耶克复命。",oEN="Bring a pure sample of Oracle Blood to the Altar of Kartak to summon Kartak. With the aid of Kartak's shared powers, slaughter 50 of the nearby Sparktouched Gorlocs for Shaman Jakjek in Kartak's Hold.",p="好多大舌头可以杀！好好玩啊，嗯？",pEN="So many big-tongues to kill! So fun, eh?",c="仪式对你来说还真容易！\n\n你之后再回来多杀一点，好吗？",cEN="Ritual went so easy for you!\n\nYou come back later for more killing someday, okay?"}
Q[12704]={d="苔行村遭到攻击，我担心这是我们对雨水巨石不够好的缘故……或许是我们太贪心了吧。我们要向祭坛供奉更多的祭品！\n\n你还记得吗，就是上次要你找的那些闪闪发亮的宝贝……你能再帮我们弄些回来吗？如果你需要某个鳄鱼人帮忙的话，告诉我一声就是了。",dEN="Since mosswalker been attacked I worried maybe we not good to Great Rain Stone... we maybe too greedy. We need more treasures to offer!\n\nYou good at finding shinies last time... maybe you go look more around village for shinies? You maybe need one of good Rainspeakers for help. Just tell us who.",o="雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞要你带上一名同伴，挖掘并收集6份闪闪发亮的宝贝。\n\n记得与雨声树屋的高阶神谕者索乌塞谈谈关于帮手的事。",oEN="High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to take a companion to dig up and collect 6 Shiny Treasures.\n\nBe sure to speak to High-Oracle Soo-say in Rainspeaker Canopy about securing the aid of one of your previous companions.",p="亮晶晶永远不够……雨水巨石对我们很好，我们也要对雨水巨石很好。",pEN="Never enough shinies... Great Rain Stone good to us, we need be good to Great Rain Stone.",c="好多好多亮晶晶！你很擅长这个。\n\n晚点再来收集更多，好吗？",cEN="So many good shinies! You good at this.\n\nCome back for more again later, yes?"}
Q[12705]={d="小狗人一直在攻击火花的……我们必须战斗，否则他们也会攻击其他神谕者。\n\n你一直是我们的$g好朋友:好朋友;，所以我们也许给你特别的荣誉。伟大的存在很久以前离开守卫去神殿了……它还在这里，但除非神殿被扰乱，它不知道出了什么问题。\n\n下面那些小狗人有制造麻烦的坏水晶……把一颗坏水晶带到闪电神殿，让苏-霍鲁知道怎么帮忙。\n\n如果苏-霍鲁借用你的身体，别害怕……他非常强大，会保护好你。",dEN="Puppy-men been attacking Sparktouched... we need fight or they just attack other Oracles too.\n\nYou been good friend to us, so maybe we allow you special honor. Great Ones left protector long time ago for shrines... it here still, but it not know something wrong til shrines messed with.\n\nPuppy-men down there have bad crystals for making trouble... bring a bad crystal to Lightning Shrine so Soo-holu know to help.\n\nDon't be scared if Soo-holu take your body... he very powerful, so he keep you safe.",o="从灵鳍湾附近的狼獾人身上取得1块被污染的水晶，将它带去闪电巨石处，召唤出索乌霍鲁。借助他的力量在神祠附近杀死50个狂心狼獾人，然后向灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特复命。",oEN="Obtain a Tainted Crystal from the wolvar near Sparktouched Haven and bring it to the Great Lightning Stone to call Soo-holu. With the aid of Soo-holu's shared powers, kill 50 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar, then return to Lightningcaller Soo-met near the Great Lightning Stone.",p="谢谢干燥皮肤朋友的帮忙。你对我们很好。",pEN="Thank you for help dryskin. You very good to us.",c="索乌霍鲁很强，对吧？我很高兴他接受你跟他分享身体作战。\n\n他比较相信他遇过的人，所以也许你还可以再回来帮忙，对吧？",cEN="Soo-holu strong, huh? I very glad he accept you to share his body for fight.\n\nHe more trusting of people he met before, so maybe come back another time to help more, yes?"}
Q[12706]={d="<瓦拉纳王子交给你一份封起来的卷轴。>\n\n这是我们在死亡裂口获胜的全面报告。你去把这份报告交给莫格莱尼大人——他就在阿彻鲁斯里面。我已经把你的英雄事迹也写在了报告中。莫格莱尼肯定会好好奖励你的，$n。\n\n现在，出发吧！",dEN="<Prince Valanar hands you a sealed scroll.>\n\nThis is the full report of our victory at Death's Breach. You are to deliver this to Highlord Mograine - inside Acherus. I have made sure to include your heroics in the report. Mograine will undoubtedly reward you greatly for this victory, <name>.\n\nGo now!",o="将瓦拉纳王子的报告交给黑锋要塞阿彻鲁斯的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。",oEN="Deliver Prince Valanar's Report to Highlord Darion Mograine in Acherus: The Ebon Hold.",p="当我派你出去的时候我很确信你不能活着回来，死亡骑士。也许你比我起初估计的更有潜力。",pEN="I was certain you wouldn't make it back here in one piece, death knight. Perhaps there is more to you than I first surmised.",c="<大领主莫格莱尼读完了报告。>\n\n整个血色舰队？\n\n<大领主莫格莱尼点了点头。>\n\n如此强大的力量，$n……我已经好几年没有看到这样英勇的表现……自从我的父亲手持……\n\n<大领主莫格莱尼摇了摇头。>\n\n这不重要……\n\n哦对了，你的奖赏，差点忘了。",cEN="<Highlord Mograine reads over the report.>\n\nThe ENTIRE Scarlet fleet?\n\n<Highlord Mograine nods.>\n\nSuch power, <name>... I have not seen such a display of domination in years... Since my father wielded...\n\n<Highlord Mograine shakes his head.>\n\nIt's not important...\n\nYes, your commendation, lest I forget."}
Q[12707]={d="埃霍奈听说你已经去过犸托斯巨坑了，朋友。犸托斯的子嗣们被激怒了，迫切地想要讨回公道！\n\n沿着东北这条路往上走到祖达克的更高一层，你可以在右边找到犸托斯祭坛的残馀部分。\n\n等你到了那里之后，在一头狂暴的猛犸象眼前晃一晃这枚犸托斯勋章，它就会冷静一段时间，这样你就可以骑到它的背上了。\n\n骑上它，用它去践踏那些犸托斯信徒吧！",dEN="Ahunae hear about your trip to Mam'toth Crater, mon. The children of Mam'toth are enraged and cry out for justice!\n\nFollow the avenue northeast up the steps to the next tier of Zul'Drak. On your right you will find what's left of the Altar of Mam'toth.\n\nWhen you get there, flash this Medallion of Mam'toth in front of the eyes of one of the enraged mammoths. It'll calm down for a little while, letting you hop on its back.\n\nRide it around, trampling all of the Mam'toth disciples that you can find!",o="希姆托加的剥皮师埃霍奈希望你使用犸托斯勋章让被激怒的猛犸象冷静下来，然后骑乘它去消灭12个犸托斯信徒。",oEN="Scalper Ahunae at Zim'Torga wants you to use the Medallion of Mam'toth to calm and ride an Enraged Mammoth. You are then to trample 12 Mam'toth Disciples to death.",p="什么？你已经完成了？\n\n你已经对那些可悲的冰巨魔展现毛茸茸的正义了吗？",pEN="What? You done already?\n\nDid you enact wooly justice upon those sorry ice trolls?",c="我们替受害者报了一箭之仇，老兄！",cEN="Score one for the victims, mon!"}
Q[12708]={d="我知道你正要转至东北方的佐尔玛兹要塞，$c。你到了那边以后，顺便帮我个忙，干掉督军手下的那些特殊守卫。\n\n那些被称为魔化蒂基面具战士的家伙，正如其名，具备强大的实力，对我们构成了显着的威胁。如果达卡莱巨魔能够大量生产出这种战士，恐怕我们很快就只能举白旗投降了。\n\n让我们来共同证明这种战士不堪一击，根本不值得大批量生产吧，怎么样？",dEN="I know that you're headed up to the Zol'Maz Stronghold to the northeast, <class>. While you're there, I need you to deal with the warlord's special guardians.\n\nThe enchanted tiki warriors, as they're called, represent a very real threat. If the Drakkari were to mass produce them, we'd quickly be overrun.\n\nLet's you and I demonstrate that they're not worth the effort to create, shall we?",o="希姆托加的元素驯服者德苟达要求你消灭12名魔化蒂基面具战士。",oEN="Element-Tamer Dagoda at Zim'Torga has asked you to destroy 12 Enchanted Tiki Warriors.",p="想必你不可能那么快就解决了全部的魔化蒂基面具战士吧？",pEN="Surely you couldn't have dealt with all of the enchanted tiki warriors so quickly?",c="这样应该可以让他们掂量一下要不要量产这种东西了。想象一下，如果和那玩意组成的军队作战真叫人发抖。\n\n<元素驯服者沉思了片刻。>\n\n我猜应该就跟对付无尽的天灾军团一样。",cEN="That should make them think twice about making more of those things. I shudder to think what it would be like to have to fight an army of those things.\n\n<The element-tamer is thoughtful for a moment.>\n\nI guess it would be just like fighting the endless waves of the Scourge."}
Q[12709]={d="很抱歉打扰你，$n。我听说你可能会转至东北边的佐尔玛兹要塞。对我们来说，你的这趟冒险也许是一个收集达卡莱巨魔文物的大好机会。\n\n据我所知，那个达卡莱督军十分多疑，因此，他用妖术保护着要塞里面所有保存着重要东西的箱子。不过，据说他手下的那些蒂基面具战士身上带有可以解除妖术的物品，但我也不太确定这一点。\n\n如果你有时间帮我弄几只箱子回来，我一定会好好酬谢你的。",dEN="Pardon me, <name>. I'm given to understand that you might be heading northeast up to the Zol'Maz Stronghold. Such a trip presents a great opportunity for us to conclude our Drakkari goods gathering.\n\nAs I have come to know, the Drakkari warlord is extremely paranoid. He's had all of his caches at the stronghold hexed with dire magic. Rumor has it that his tiki warriors carry the cure, but who can say?\n\nIf you could find the time to acquire some of those goods, I would be most appreciative.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼要求你为他夺取12只佐尔玛兹要塞宝箱。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga has asked you to acquire 12 Zol'Maz Stronghold Caches.",p="也许在我们谈话的此刻你的包裹里就装着宝箱？",pEN="Perhaps you carry the caches within your pack even as we speak?",c="看看那一切！\n\n看这里，<name>。你取回的这件东西生动地说明，达卡莱巨魔意识到了天灾军团的存在使大地衰弱。\n\n督军觉得必须抓住这个机会。他逼迫先知们杀死自己的神明，以便掌控那股力量，反击巫妖王的军队。\n\n无论如何，他们注定要毁灭。他们不知不觉地选择成为自我毁灭的工具！",cEN="Just look at all of that!\n\nSee here, <name>. This piece you recovered vividly illustrates that the Drakkari became aware of the weakening of the land that the Scourge caused by their presence.\n\nThe warlord felt compelled to take the opportunity this presented. He pushed the prophets to kill their gods in an effort to control the power and fight back against the Lich King's forces.\n\nEither way they were doomed. They inadvertently chose to be the instrument of their own destruction!"}
Q[12710]={d="干得很不错，$n。\n\n你再次证明了我没有看走眼！现在，你也明白为什么我能获得巫妖王陛下的祝福了，因为我很少看走眼……\n\n现在，是时候把主人的计划全盘告诉你啦，朋友。\n\n你将看着我们是如何一步步将蝗虫一般的达卡莱巨魔扫出这一地区，并在古达克内获取属于我们自己的地位。\n\n带上这根权杖，它代表着我对你的信任。有了它，你就可以不受任何限制地进入上面的密室，哦……对了，别忘了好好观赏一下我们的秘密武器。",dEN="Ya doin' well, <name>.\n\nYou be provin' dat I got an eye for talent! Now ya see why da Lich King gave me his blessing....\n\nDa time has come for me to reveal my master plan to ya, mon.\n\nNow you be seein' how we gunna sweep through da swarms of Drakkari trolls to take our rightful place in da great palace of Gundrak.\n\nTake dis scepter, mon. It be a token of my trust in ya. With it, you be able ta access my upper chamber and witness for yourself our secret weapons.",o="沃尔塔鲁斯的达库鲁要求你通过传送器转至他的上层密室。",oEN="Drakuru in Voltarus wants you to take the teleporter to his upper chamber.",p="你去看过我的造物了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have ya gone ta witness my creations, <name>?",c="那么，就是这样了，伙计。\n\n我们要打造一支侍奉巫妖王的终极天灾军队。他会非常满意的！\n\n权杖你留着，<name>。你指挥我的军队作战时会需要它……\n\n很快！",cEN="So, there ya have it, mon.\n\nWe be makin' da ultimate scourge army ta serve da Lich King. He gunna be most pleased!\n\nYou keep da scepter, <name>. You gunna be needin' it ta command my army in battle....\n\nSoon!"}
Q[12711]={c="信箱上面放着几封难以辨认的信件和卷轴。没人要……\n\n也许你该看看里面写了什么？",cEN="Atop the mailbox are several illegible letters and scrolls. Useless...\n\nPerhaps you should check inside?"}
Q[12712]={d="$n，现在我们需要找到那把钥匙，才能解开束缚着犀牛之神阿卡里的锁链。他现在状况非常危险，随时都有可能被巨魔们击败并夺走全身的神力。\n\n那把钥匙，应该就在达卡莱巨魔的督军佐尔玛兹手中。他听说了你的事情之后，已经和他的手下躲进了东北方阶梯之上的要塞里。\n\n这名督军非常强大，你或许需要一些协助才能将其击败。若你能先击败他的手下，并将他们的蒂基面具、剑和巫术这三者融合起来的话，就可以在挑战他本人时召唤到所需的助力。",dEN="<name>, we need a key to unlock the chains of the rhino god, Akali. Even now he is being prepared for the slaughter.\n\nThe Drakkari warlord, Zol'Maz, carries the key. Hearing of your exploits, he has secluded himself and his family at their stronghold up the steps to the northeast.\n\nThe warlord is strong and you will need help. If you were to combine the tiki, sword and incantation of his family members, you would be able to summon such help as you challenge him before his home's gate.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要求你去夺取督军佐尔玛兹的钥匙。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to acquire the Key of Warlord Zol'Maz.",p="你要不计代价取得督军的钥匙，这件事的重要性我不想一而再再而三的强调了。",pEN="I cannot stress how important it is that you acquire the warlord's key no matter the cost.",c="如果我没有让你把钥匙带回来，就这么直接转至古达克的话就更好了。\n\n然而，我想你最好还是先听听我要告诉你的话。",cEN="It might have been better if I hadn't asked you to bring it back here instead of heading directly to Gundrak.\n\nHowever, I think that it's best that you hear what else I have to say first."}
Q[12713]={d="好了，间谍游戏也该到此结束了，$n。\n\n你带来的情报具备非常重要的价值，现在，我们必须趁达库鲁全面展开计划之前阻止他，并将他杀死，以绝后患。\n\n你手里的这根节杖已经被我们全面改造过了。等到时机合适的时候，你就对达库鲁的瘟血巨魔释放出这根节杖中的能量。这也是你可以击败他的唯一方式。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="The time has come to end this charade, <name>.\n\nAs valuable as your information has been, we must bring Drakuru down and bring his project to an end before his freaks are unleashed.\n\nWe've modified your scepter for the job. When the time is right, you will be able to use it on Drakuru's Blightbloods and turn them against him. It's your only hope of defeating him.\n\nFight well.",o="黑锋哨站的斯特凡要求你击败达库鲁。\n\n如果你丢失了迷惑项圈，可以返回黑锋哨站的斯特凡那里去再要一个。",oEN="Stefan in Ebon Watch wants you to defeat Drakuru.\n\nIf you lose your Ensorcelled Choker, return to Stefan at Ebon Watch to get another.",p="你和达库鲁交战过了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you faced Drakuru in battle, <name>?",c="所以，我们成功了。\n\n我们还有很多事要做，但是此地的工作会因为你的努力而轻松许多。\n\n请收下这个象征我们谢意的礼物。",cEN="So, it is done.\n\nWe still have much to do, but our work here will be much more manageable thanks to your efforts.\n\nPlease accept this as a token of our gratitude."}
Q[12714]={d="是巫妖王的意志在驱使我们前进，$n。没有谁比死亡骑士更清楚这一点了。本质上，我们是依靠他的意志而存在的。你肯定听到过他对你说话，侵入你的思想……\n\n你现在能听到吗？也许对你来说还为时过早。\n\n<莫格莱尼闭上了双眼，对某个你看不见的人点了点头。>\n\n遵命，我的主人。\n\n$n，你现在必须回到死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。这是巫妖王的命令！",dEN="It is the will of the Lich King that drives us onward, <name>. None are more aware of this than death knights. Our very existence is intrinsically tied to his consciousness. Surely you have heard him speak to you - invading your thoughts...\n\nCan you hear him now? Perhaps it is too early for you.\n\n<Mograine closes his eyes and nods to an unseen host.>\n\nYes, my lord. It will be done.\n\n<name>, you are to return to Death's Breach and report to Prince Valanar. The Lich King commands it!",o="回到死亡裂口，向瓦拉纳王子报到。",oEN="Return to Death's Breach and report to Prince Valanar.",c="海文郡是我们的了！成千的尸首散布在地上，耐心地等候着新生。我们现在要以觉醒的天灾之力打击我们的敌人！\n\n食尸鬼已经开始攻击新阿瓦隆了。我们的军队已经移到它们的后方，并占领了追忆墓穴。",cEN="Havenshire is ours! A thousand corpses litter the ground, patiently awaiting rebirth. We strike now at our enemy with the awakened strength of the Scourge!\n\nThe ghouls have already begun their assault upon New Avalon. Our forces have moved in behind them and taken the Crypt of Remembrance."}
Q[12715]={d="我们已经开始向血色十字军的最后堡垒发动了进攻。在我们努力加固新的前线基地——追忆墓穴的同时，我们的食尸鬼正在消耗着十字军的外围防线。\n\n勇敢地向南面进发，在新阿瓦隆附近找到那座墓穴，然后向我亲爱的兄弟凯雷塞斯王子报到吧。\n\n他对你的到来充满着期待。\n\n做好准备，$n，也许你即将目睹天灾军团下一阶段的攻势：征服！\n\n出发吧，死亡骑士！",dEN="The attacks upon the gates of the last Scarlet bastion have begun. Our ghouls are wearing the Crusade's front lines down while we labor to fortify our new forward base, the Crypt of Remembrance.\n\nVenture south to the crypt, which borders New Avalon, and report to my dear brother, Prince Keleseth.\n\nHe will be expecting you.\n\nPrepare yourself, <name>, for you are about to witness the next stage of Scourge warfare: DOMINATION!\n\nRide now, death knight!",o="向追忆墓穴的凯雷塞斯王子报到。",oEN="Report to Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance.",c="向你问好，死亡骑士。我是凯雷塞斯王子，诺森德东南支队的领导者。巫妖王要利用我的能力来终结这些挑战天灾军团的凡人。就像巫妖王要求我的所有事情一样，我很乐意遵从。当然，能满足我饥渴的无尽灵魂也使得这份工作更加甜美，你不这么认为吗？",cEN="Hail, death knight. I am the blood lord, Keleseth, ruler of the southeastern reaches of Northrend. The Lich King has sought to utilize my talents in ending this mortal affront to the Scourge. As with all things the Lich King asks of me, I am happy to oblige. Of course, a sea of endless souls to sate my thirst certainly sweetened the deal, don't you think?"}
Q[12716]={d="看看这片南瓜地！注意到少了什么吗？你当然没注意到，因为你是个$g白痴:白痴;……！你的脑子大概是你身上最先死掉的东西。\n\n<诺斯叹了口气。>\n\n我奉命组装一口瘟疫大锅。你要帮我。\n\n新阿瓦隆大门进去就是旅店。进旅店偷一口空锅。然后去同样靠近大门的锻造坊，偷几条铁链。把这些连同 10 个十字军头骨一起带回来给我。还需要我告诉你去哪儿弄头骨吗？",dEN="Look at this pumpkin patch! Notice anything missing? Of course you don't, because you're a moron! Your brain was probably the first thing to die.\n\n<Noth sighs.>\n\nI have been commanded to put together a plague cauldron. You will help me.\n\nDirectly inside the gate of New Avalon is the inn. Enter the inn and steal an empty cauldron. Then go to the forge, also near the gate, and steal some iron chains. Bring those back to me along with 10 Crusader skulls. Do I need to tell you where to get those too?",o="药剂师诺斯要求你交给他一口空锅、一条铁链和10块十字军徽记。",oEN="Noth the Plaguebringer has requested that you bring him 1 Empty Cauldron, 1 Iron Chain and 10 Crusader Skulls.",p="你收集到我要的材料没有？",pEN="Have you gathered the materials I requested?",c="太完美了！现在给我一点时间把东西架设好。",cEN="Perfect! Now give me a moment to get things set up."}
Q[12717]={d="天灾之锅已经准备就绪，随时都可以使用！\n\n死亡骑士，现在让我简短地介绍一下天灾之锅。锅中散发出的气体对于活人来说是致命的，不过对于天灾来说正好相反：他们从死亡中获取力量，因此浸染在天灾之锅中的时间越长，就会变得越强大。\n\n拿上这些十字军徽记，把它们扔进锅里。你会对它的结果感到满意的。",dEN="The cauldron is ready to begin spewing its foul corruption across the land!\n\nNow, death knight, a brief lesson in plague cauldrons. The gas that the cauldron emits is deadly to the living, but empowers Scourge. As with all Scourge creations, it feeds off of death and grows stronger the longer it feeds.\n\nTake these Crusader skulls and drop them in the cauldron. You will be quite happy with the results.",o="将一堆十字军徽记放入天灾之锅。",oEN="Place the Pile of Crusader Skulls inside the Plague Cauldron.",p="天灾之锅一动也不动。",pEN="The plague cauldron stands idle.",c="当你把颅骨放进去的时候，天灾之锅突然跳动了起来。\n\n稍后几瓶装着黑色液体的小药瓶浮了上来。",cEN="The plague cauldron jumps to life when the skulls are placed inside.\n\nAfter a few seconds some vials of dark liquid float to the top."}
Q[12718]={p="天灾之锅不断的冒泡翻搅着有毒的液体，朝四周喷洒着浓浊的气体。\n\n你还有更多的十字军颅骨可以放进去吗？",pEN="The plague cauldron bubbles and churns its toxic brew, spewing a thick gas all around.\n\nDo you have more Crusader skulls to place inside?",c="当你把颅骨放进去的时候，天灾之锅突然跳动了起来。\n\n稍后几瓶装着黑色液体的小药瓶浮了上来。",cEN="The plague cauldron jumps to life when the skulls are placed inside.\n\nAfter a few seconds, the plague cauldron grants you the dark and frothy splendor of Noth's Special Brew."}
Q[12719]={d="没有什么能比完全歼灭敌人更令人满足的了，$n。不过想要做到这点，只靠几百个无脑怪物进攻新阿瓦隆的前门是远远不够的。我们必须渗入内部，除掉他们的官员。必须得让他们知道：没人可以逃出天灾的掌心！\n\n转至西南面的新阿瓦隆市政厅，击败在那里发号施令的家伙。在市政厅里找到户籍册，把它带回来交给我。",dEN="Nothing less than total annihilation will suffice, <name>. To that end, a few hundred mindless ghouls assaulting the front gate of New Avalon will not do. We must infiltrate the inner sanctum and dispose of their officials. They must be shown that no one can escape the Scourge's grasp!\n\nMake your way to the New Avalon Town Hall, southwest of here, and assassinate the mayor. Search the building for the New Avalon registry and bring it to me.",o="追忆墓穴的凯雷塞斯王子命令你去击败奎比镇长，并找到新阿瓦隆户籍册。",oEN="Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance has ordered you to kill Mayor Quimby and recover the New Avalon Registry.",p="让他们无处可逃！",pEN="There is nowhere to run!",c="户籍册会告诉我们很多关于那些血色虫子的情况。\n\n<凯雷塞斯翻阅着户籍册的页面。>\n\n死亡率、出生，但最重要的是——动向。\n\n看这里，$n，他们已经派出了三艘船出海。让我看看……它们开往哪里？\n\n什么？这不可能。它们驶向诺森德！\n\n在坐标旁边写着：\"赤红黎明\"。",cEN="The registry will tell us many things about the Scarlet insects.\n\n<Keleseth flips through the pages of the registry.>\n\nDeath rates, births, but most importantly, movement.\n\nLook here, <name>, they have already sent three vessels abroad. Let me see here... Where are they headed?\n\n<Keleseth mutters something about latitude and longitude under his breath as he calculates the route.>\n\nWHAT? This is impossible. They sail to Northrend!\n\nBeside the coordinates are the words: \"Crimson Dawn.\""}
Q[12720]={d="在环游世界的旅途中，我发现了不少有趣的东西。比如，你知道吗，只要有恰当的\"鼓励”，一个人敢于隐藏的所有真相都能被榨出来？运气不错，我手头正好有些\"鼓励”。\n\n<凯雷塞斯从一个镶满珠宝的华丽盒子里取出什么东西。>\n\n这些是我的\"劝说者”。装备上它们，上战场去，死亡骑士。把尖的那头用在\"新阿瓦隆”的士兵身上。查明这个“赤红黎明”的真相。",dEN="In my travels across this world I have made several interesting discoveries. For instance, did you know that with the proper amount of encouragement one can extract all the truths that a man dares hide? As luck would have it, I happen to have some encouragement on hand.\n\n<Keleseth pulls something out of an ornately jeweled box.>\n\nThese are my \"persuaders.\" Equip them and take to the field, death knight. Apply the pointy ends to the soldiers of New Avalon. Discover the truth about this \"Crimson Dawn.\"",o="回忆之穴的凯雷塞斯王子命令你查明\"赤红黎明\"的真相。\n\n从华丽珠宝盒中取出凯雷塞斯的劝说者，用它们\"劝说\"血色十字军开口。",oEN="Prince Keleseth at the Crypt of Remembrance has ordered you to discover the truth about the \"Crimson Dawn.\"\n\nRemove Keleseth's Persuaders from the Ornately Jeweled Box and use them to \"persuade\" the Scarlet Crusade into talking.",p="对血色十字军使用说服者吧。他们之中总有人会……说溜嘴。",pEN="Use the persuaders on Scarlet Crusaders. One of them will eventually... crack.",c="觉醒？你在胡说什么，<小子/丫头>！什么样的傻瓜会把自己的人民送进冰封荒原的最深处？不过，也许这个信使知道答案。",cEN="An awakening? What nonsense do you speak, <boy/girl>! What kind of fool would deliver their people into the very heart of the frozen wastes? Perhaps, though, this courier holds the answer."}
Q[12721]={d="$n，我们已经没有时间了。你必须带上这把钥匙，用它释放阿卡里。\n\n他就被关在古达克前面的田野上——那地方是祖达克的首都。阿卡里身上的锁链被四个锚点固定着。你必须打开所有的锚点，才能释放这位犀牛之神。\n\n古达克里面到处都是冰巨魔。但我相信，你只要够小心的话，就可以有惊无险地潜入那里。\n\n成功之后，请把这个消息告知巫医。",dEN="<name>, there is no time left. You must take the key and use it to unlock Akali.\n\nHe is being held in the courtyard in front of Gundrak, the capital of Zul'Drak. Akali's chains are secured by four anchor points. You must unlock each of them to set the rhino god free.\n\nGundrak is teeming with ice trolls. However, I believe that if you're careful, you should be able to slip in without too much danger.\n\nOnce you're done, please inform the witch doctor.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要你去释放阿卡里，并将这个消息通知巫医库弗。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to free Akali and then to inform Witch Doctor Khufu at Zim'Torga.",p="发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened?",c="不！\n\n又一位神明被毁灭，力量被窃取。而现在阿卡利的先知直接威胁了我们。\n\n他来的时候，会冲着哈克娅来。我们不能让他也夺走她的力量。\n\n我们必须再一次请教诸神，<name>。他们会告诉我们该怎么做。",cEN="No!\n\nAnother god destroyed, its power stolen. And now the prophet of Akali has threatened us directly.\n\nWhen he comes, he will come for Har'koa. We cannot allow him to take her power too.\n\nWe must consult the gods once more, <name>. They will tell us what must be done."}
Q[12722]={d="当天灾军团的浮空城出现时，大部分人类都会吓得四处逃散。血色十字军却不会这样！\n\n我必须承认——我有点享受跟十字军之间的交流。这么多年来，天灾与他们之间的战争在人类历史上增添了几件最悲惨的事件。而现在我们又一次在战场上一决胜负！\n\n我们怎么能拒绝他们永久侍奉巫妖王的愿望呢！去新阿瓦隆帮助他们达成心愿吧。",dEN="Most humans would have fled the moment a Scourge necropolis took up residence in their air space. Not the Scarlet Crusade!\n\nI must confess - I rather enjoy our exchanges with the Crusade. Through the years, Scourge battles against them have resulted in several of the most tragic events in human history. Yet here we stand - AGAIN - locked in battle!\n\nWe shan't deny them the pleasures of eternal servitude to the Lich King! Enter New Avalon and fulfill their death wish. Leave no survivors.",o="追忆墓穴的瑞文戴尔男爵命令你去消灭10个血色十字军士兵和15个新阿瓦隆预备兵。",oEN="Baron Rivendare at the Crypt of Remembrance has commanded you to slay 10 Scarlet Crusade Soldiers and 15 Citizens of New Avalon.",p="就像待宰的羔羊一样……",pEN="Like lambs to the slaughter...",c="你剑法不错，$n。如果巫妖王允许的话，也许你会有兴趣当我的手下？斯坦索姆需要一个新的市长。",cEN="You are quite effective with that blade, <name>. Perhaps, Lich King permitting, you would be interested in becoming one of my minions? Stratholme is looking for a new mayor."}
Q[12723]={d="我已经派奥巴兹、萨萨里安和科尔提拉潜入敌人后方寻找那名信使。他们在新阿瓦隆最南端的血色旅店建立了行动基地。旅店藏在两座果园后面，紧邻赤红烈焰礼拜堂。你要一路杀到旅店，向奥巴兹·血祸报到。他会向你说明他们的处境。|n",dEN="I have sent Orbaz, Thassarian and Koltira behind enemy lines to search for the courier. They have set up a base of operations at the Scarlet Tavern, located at the southern end of New Avalon. The tavern is tucked away behind the two orchards, adjacent to the Chapel of the Crimson Flame. You are to make your way to the tavern and report to Orbaz Bloodbane. He will update you on their situation.",o="转至新阿瓦隆，向血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒报到。",oEN="Report to Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",c="看来最近似乎什么人都可以加入我们的黑锋骑士团啊。在我获得巫妖王垂青的时候，事情可不是这样的，那时候可严苛多了！\n\n至于那个信差……",cEN="Looks like we'll let anyone into the dark order these days. When I was given the gift, things were different. Much different!\n\nAs to this courier..."}
Q[12724]={d="我们迄今为止还没有得到任何与这个信使相关的线索，根本不知道他会在什么时候、什么地点出现。这些人类同样也一无所知。\n\n<奥尔巴兹指了指躺在地上的血色十字军尸体。>\n\n不过我从一个家伙口中得到了一些有用的情报。他们在血色城堡里面保存着一份所有巡逻路线的日程表。我希望你能闯入城堡，拿走日程表。\n\n这座城堡是新阿瓦隆里面最大的建筑物——就在这里的东北边。",dEN="We haven't got a damned clue about when or where this courier is supposed to show up. None of these humans had an answer either.\n\n<Orbaz points to the Scarlet corpses strewn across the floor.>\n\nI did manage to beat something useful out of the last one. Inside Scarlet Hold they keep a schedule of all patrol routes. I want you to break into the hold and steal the schedule.\n\nThe hold is the largest building in New Avalon - northeast of here.",o="血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒命令你进入血色城堡，偷取新阿瓦隆巡逻日程表。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon has ordered you to steal the New Avalon Patrol Schedule from the Scarlet Hold.",p="摧毁那座城堡吧！日程表就在那里！",pEN="Tear the hold apart! The schedule is there!",c="<奥尔巴兹翻阅了日程表。>\n\n这些没用的废物可真忙！北巡路线、南巡路线、西巡路线、东巡路线，但就是没提到信差的路线。等等。这是什么？看起来像是一条从西瘟疫之地过来的西巡逻路线？这个巡逻员今天就会经过这里！我需要时间来好好计划计划。",cEN="<Orbaz flips through the schedule.>\n\nThese worthless cretins have been busy! Northern patrol routes, southern patrol routes, western patrol routes, eastern patrol routes, but nothing about their couriers' routes. Wait a minute. What's this? It looks like a western patrol route, coming out of Western Plaguelands? This patrol will path through here today! I'm going to need time to plan."}
Q[12725]={d="突破血色十字军的防线并不是一个简单的任务。我们在攻击中蒙受了大量的人员伤亡，我们的一位最强大的死亡骑士，库尔迪拉·织亡者，也跟我们失去了联系。我不知道他是否还活着，但是如果我们就这样不去寻找他的话，我会受到诅咒的。\n\n我最后一次看到他被囚禁着运往这里东北方的血色城堡。去踏平那座城堡，死亡骑士。把库尔迪拉找回来！",dEN="Breaking through the Scarlet lines was no easy task. We suffered many casualties during the assault and lost one of our best death knights, Koltira Deathweaver. I don't know whether he's dead or alive, but I'll be damned if we don't search for him.\n\nI last saw him being bound in irons and dragged away to the Scarlet Hold, northeast of here. Tear that keep asunder, death knight. Find Koltira!",o="在血色城堡内寻找库尔迪拉·织亡者。",oEN="Search for Koltira Deathweaver in the Scarlet Hold.",c="你来找我是愚蠢的。我失败了。你本该把我就当成死人。现在我们两个都可能被杀。<Koltira sacude la cabeza>\n\n<科尔提拉摇了摇头>\n\n我们是天灾军团的死亡骑士。这违背了我们黑暗兄弟会的誓约。\n\n萨萨里安，你这该死的蠢货！",cEN="You were foolish in coming after me. I failed. I should have been left for dead - now two of us might be killed.\n\n<Koltira shakes his head.>\n\nWe are death knights of the Scourge. This flies in the face of the dark brotherhood's covenants.\n\nThassarian, you blasted fool!"}
Q[12726]={d="聆听风暴的呼啸吧。雷暴台地回荡着远古的歌声……那是风与水之歌。\n\n雷雨之王吞噬台风与暴风的子嗣。带上这只鼓……奏响海波恩之歌。\n\n帮助他吞噬狂风与清水，让雷雨持续下去。",dEN="Listen to storm, yes? The Stormwright's Shelf echoes with ancient song.... the Song of Wind and Water.\n\nThe great tempest devours the sons of typhoons and storms. Take this drum and play his song... play Haiphoon's song.\n\nHelp him feed on wind and water so tempest can continue.",o="索乌尼要你在雷暴台地使用雷雨之鼓，帮助海波恩吞噬3个风暴亡魂和3个流水之魂。",oEN="Soo-nee wants you to use the Tempest Drums at the Stormwright's Shelf and help Haiphoon devour 3 Storm Revenants and 3 Aqueous Spirits.",c="我感谢你，<name>。多亏了你，大风暴会眷顾我们的。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. The great tempest will look upon us favorably thanks to you."}
Q[12727]={d="警报已经响了。高级审判官和他的侍从们很快就会到。我伤得太重，帮不上什么大忙，但我会尽我所能。\n\n杀掉高级审判官和他的亲信。砍下他的头，带回给萨萨里安。复仇会安抚他那狂野的灵魂。\n\n还有一件事，$n。如果你能活着脱身并回到萨萨里安那里，告诉他他们正在礼拜堂处决囚犯。也许他会派你去那里再当一回英雄。",dEN="The alarms have been sounded. The High Inquisitor and his acolytes will be here soon. I'm too badly injured to be of much use, but I'll do what little I can to help.\n\nSlay the High Inquisitor and his cronies. Tear off his head and return with it to Thassarian. Vengeance will soothe his savage soul.\n\nOne more thing, <name>. If you do manage to survive and make it back to Thassarian, tell him that they're executing prisoners at the chapel. Perhaps he'll send you there to play the hero once more.",o="击败大检查官瓦洛斯，并把瓦洛斯的徽记带回新阿瓦隆的血色旅店，交给萨萨里安。",oEN="Slay High Inquisitor Valroth and take Valroth's Head to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",p="库尔迪拉怎么样了？",pEN="What of Koltira?",c="我要把这个混帐的脑袋拿去喂食尸鬼！\n\n<萨萨里安把头颅丢到房间的角落去。>\n\n库尔迪拉有逃出来吗？\n\n<萨萨里安停了一会。>\n\n我相信他一定逃出来了。那些墙壁关不住他的。\n\n现在该来偿债了。",cEN="I'll feed this monster's head to the ghouls!\n\n<Thassarian tosses the head into the back room.>\n\nDid Koltira make it out?\n\n<Thassarian pauses.>\n\nI'm certain he did. Those walls can't hold him.\n\nTime for some payback."}
Q[12728]={d="我要整理一下笔记，准备在达拉然的同僚面前进行演讲。\n\n在我做准备的时候，还得请你去一趟北方的冬鳞洞穴。在洞口处使用奥术测量器。\n\n得到数据后请立即回来找我。没有这些数据，我的文件就是不完整的。",dEN="I need to compile my notes and prepare a presentation for my colleagues in Dalaran.\n\nWhile I do, I must ask that you visit the Winterfin Cavern to the north. You must use the Arcanometer while standing in the mouth of the cavern.\n\nReturn to me at once when you have the data. My documentation will be incomplete without it.",o="琥珀崖的盖伦要你在冬鳞洞穴处使用奥术测量器。",oEN="Librarian Garren at Amber Ledge wants you to use the Arcanometer at Winterfin Caverns.",p="你从冬鳞洞穴收集到数据了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you collected the data from Winterfin Caverns yet, <name>?",c="太好了，这让我的报告完整了。\n\n我一定会向议会提到你的善意，<name>。",cEN="Excellent, this completes my report.\n\nI'll be sure to mention your kindness to the council, <name>."}
Q[12729]={d="诸神已经开口，我们必须遵从他们的智慧。\n\n往北前往辛鲁克，消灭那里的守卫，直到他们交出无瑕之心。然后往东前往奎丝鲁恩祭坛，搅乱祭坛守卫，直到你取得他们的大风精华。\n\n把两样东西都交给哈克娅，她会把它们合成一件能迫使已故的阿卡利先知现身的物品。",dEN="The gods have spoken and we must heed their wisdom.\n\nGather friends to your side, <name>. Take them north to Zim'Rhuk to destroy guardians there until they yield the unblemished heart. Take them east to the Altar of Quetz'lun and disrupt the altar wardens until you recover their gusty essence.\n\nDeliver both to Har'koa and she will combine them into that which will compel late Akali's prophet to appear.",o="将完美的守卫者精华和充满活力的典狱官精华交给希姆托加的哈克娅。",oEN="Deliver the Unblemished Heart of the Guardian and the Gusty Essence of the Warden to Har'koa at Zim'Torga.",p="你拿到需要的东西了吗，<name>？",pEN="Do you have that which is required, <name>?",c="你的勇气似乎无穷无尽，<name>。\n\n请把心和精华交给我，我会把它们制成能迫使那先知出现在你面前的物品。",cEN="Your bravery seems boundless, <name>.\n\nPlease hand me the heart and the essence, and I will fashion them into that which will compel the prophet to appear before you."}
Q[12730]={d="你和你的朋友必须带着这件召唤设备，转至古达克南面的佐尔赫布。\n\n你会在那里发现一个能量法阵，使用召唤设备就可以强行召唤出阿卡里的先知。\n\n我的心与你同在，$n。我们一起经历过许多艰难险阻，你已经竭尽全力来拯救我，以及其它那些已经被达卡莱巨魔毁灭的神灵。\n\n但我担心这次分别后，我们就只能在死后再相见了。",dEN="You and your friends must take this instrument of convocation - of summoning - to Zol'Heb just south of Gundrak.\n\nTherein you will find a circle of power. Use the convocation to force the prophet of Akali to appear.\n\nMy heart goes out to you, <name>. We have been through much together, and you have done all that you can to not only save my life, but those of the other gods the Drakkari have destroyed.\n\nBut I fear this time we may not see each other again until the afterlife.",o="希姆托加的哈克娅要求你杀死阿卡里先知。",oEN="Har'koa at Zim'Torga has asked you to slay the Prophet of Akali.",p="我只能够给你温暖的话语，以及言语中带来的勇气。\n\n磨利你的武器做好准备吧，但我恳求你，不要花太多的时间，否则预言者可能会直接袭击我们。",pEN="I can only offer you the warmth of my words and the encouragement that comes with them.\n\nTake what time you need to steel and prepare yourself, but I implore you not to take too long or the prophet will surely descend upon us.",c="你成功了！<name>，你是祖达克的英雄！\n\n我们永远无法偿还欠你的债，但赞达拉人托我保管了一些他们认为你可能会感兴趣的东西。\n\n请收下，这是我们的一点心意，但要快。我感到了另一件紧急的事！",cEN="You did it! <name>, you are the champion of Zul'Drak!\n\nWe will never be able to repay the debt that we owe to you, but the Zandalari have given into my trust a number of objects they believe you might have an interest in.\n\nPlease, I want you to have a token of our appreciation, but hurry. I sense another issue of urgency!"}
Q[12732]={d="总有一天，雷耶克会强壮起来成为伟大的战士，你很快就会看到这一天。\n\n这个瓶子给你，你带上它去遥远的西方，到日灼之柱的顶端，把那里的水装进瓶子。\n\n接着你要去盆地的北部边境，到埋骨地以北的台地去。找到并击败血爪鹏王。\n\n取得它的精华元素后拿回来给雷耶克。",dEN="One day, Rejek will be mighty warrior. Blood and skyfire will make Rejek strong. You see soon.\n\nRejek give you vial, you take to very top of Suntouched Pillar, far to west. Put waters there in vial.\n\nThen go to north edge of basin, to ledge north of Bonefields. You find and kill goretalon matriarch. Take heartblood.\n\nYou combine heartblood and water, bring to Rejek. Rejek drink, make strong.",o="将一瓶日灼精华交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Bring a vial of Suntouched Heartblood to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你给雷耶克带礼物来了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek gift?",c="雷耶克谢谢你。雷耶克喝下去，长得强壮，永远记得强大的<name>的礼物。",cEN="Rejek thanks you. Rejek drink, grow strong, always remember mighty <name>'s gift."}
Q[12733]={d="死亡挑战诞生于巫妖王在冰封荒原深处击败伊利丹·怒风的那一战，是所有死亡骑士都必须经历的成人礼。\n\n去寻找阿彻鲁斯的其他死亡骑士，向他们发起决斗挑战。他们必须接受，并战至一方胜出！\n\n现在就去，$n！为了天灾的胜利！巫妖王万岁！|n",dEN="Born of the Lich King's victory over Illidan Stormrage in the heart of the frozen wastes, Death's Challenge is a rite of passage that all death knights must undergo.\n\nSeek out other death knights of Acherus and challenge them to a duel. They must accept and fight until a victor emerges!\n\nGo now, <name>! Victory for the Scourge! Glory to the Lich King!",o="战斗召唤者奥尔伦命令你在决斗中战胜5名死亡骑士。\n\n你可以选择死亡骑士新兵或玩家作为对手。",oEN="Olrun the Battlecaller has ordered you to win 5 duels against other death knights.\n\nYou may choose to battle death knight initiates or players.",p="你完成死亡挑战了吗？",pEN="Have you completed Death's Challenge?",c="荣耀归于胜者，死亡骑士！做得好！巫妖王今天特别眷顾着你。",cEN="To the victor goes the glory, death knight! Well done! The Lich King looks favorably upon you on this day."}
Q[12734]={d="雷耶克刚刚成为狂心氏族中最年轻的战士。父亲交给雷耶克一柄剑，要用它打败我们的敌人。根据传统，使用前必须首先举行一个仪式。你愿意帮雷耶克吗？\n\n我要你将这柄剑插在被击败的敌人面前。你也知道，狂心氏族的敌人很多，比如西南方的巨蜂和硬皮猩猩还有那些讨厌的大舌头怪。就去找雾语氏族吧，它们生活在遥远的西北方，就在苦潮湖附近。",dEN="Rejek just became youngest warrior in all of Frenzyheart tribe. Father gave Rejek a mighty sword to defeat Frenzyheart enemies, but old tradition say sword need to be blooded first. Older warrior usually do that. You do this honor for Rejek?\n\nTake blade, put in corpses of all Frenzyheart foes: wasps and hardknuckles to southwest, and the big-tongues. Maybe blood blade on Mistwhispers, far to northwest near Bittertide Lake.",o="击败1只蓝玉虫巢巨蜂、1只硬皮冲锋者和3名雾语氏族的成员，完成雷耶克的仪式。你可以选择击败雾语神谕者或是雾语战士。完成任务后，向狂心岭的雷耶克复命。",oEN="Blood Rejek's Blade on the corpses of a Sapphire Hive Wasp, a Hardknuckle Charger, and 3 members of the Mistwhisper Tribe. You may blood the sword on either Mistwhisper Oracles or Mistwhisper Warriors. Return to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill when your task is complete.",p="你用血来清洗雷耶克的剑了吗？",pEN="You blood Rejek's blade?",c="雷耶克看到敌人的血迹沾在剑刃上了。现在雷耶克有了一把配的上伟大战士雷耶克的武器了！",cEN="Rejek sees the stains of the blood of his enemies on the blade. Now Rejek has a mighty weapon for the mighty warrior he will be!"}
Q[12735]={d="索拉查盆地的土地是纯洁的。几个世纪以来，这些柱子一直保护着这片土地。\n\n但这里的水就不那么纯洁了，因为它们来自盆地以外……来自那些海洋、湖泊和河流。有时，水会带来邪恶的灵魂——这时就要净化它。\n\n请你带上这只钟，在苦潮湖、冬拥河和河流之心敲响它。这会激怒邪恶的灵魂……然后你必须杀死它。",dEN="Earth in Sholazar is pure. The pillars have protected the land for centuries.\n\nWater, not as pure, it comes from outside Sholazar.... from oceans, from lakes, from rivers. Water sometimes bring bad spirits - need to be cleansed.\n\nYou take this chime and play at Bittertide Lake, Wintergrasp River and River's Heart. It make bad spirit angry... and then you must kill it.",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你在苦潮湖、冬拥河和河流之心敲响净化之钟，杀死污染水源的邪灵。",oEN="Soo-nee, at the Rainspeaker Canopy, wants you to play the Cleansing Chime at Bittertide Lake, Wintergrasp River and River's Heart and slay the evil spirits that plague the waters there.",p="你奏响净化之歌了吗，<name>？",pEN="You play cleansing song yet, <name>?",c="水域……已被净化。是的。一切都好。\n\n你理解了我们的方式，<name>。",cEN="Waters... cleansed. Yes. All is well.\n\nYou understand our way, <name>."}
Q[12736]={d="显然你不如鳄鱼人聪明！你只是个头脑简单的$r。\n\n但你还是有点希望的！你显示出了学习的能力。或许水晶能让你聪明起来，就像它能让我们变聪明一样！\n\n我会教你演奏乐曲，让你头脑清晰起来。你要用水晶来演奏乐曲，它能让你的脑子变得好使……虽然比不上鳄鱼人那样聪明，但肯定比你现在强。源血之柱已经倒塌，但其它的柱子还是完好的！",dEN="Of course you not as smart as gorloc! You just simple <race>.\n\nYou not without hope, though! You show you can learn. Maybe crystals make you smart like crystals make us smart!\n\nI teach you to play song to clear your mind. You play song by crystals then crystals make your mind better... not as good as gorloc's but better than you have now. Lifeblood Pillar is broken, but other pillars still good!",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你在光芒之柱、日灼之柱、苔光之柱和通天之柱的顶端吹响沉思乐管。",oEN="Soo-nee at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to use the Didgeridoo of Contemplation at the top of the Glimmering Pillar, the Suntouched Pillar, the Mosslight Pillar and the Skyreach Pillar.",p="你觉得自己变聪明了吗，<race>？",pEN="You feel smart yet, <race>?",c="看吧？我看的出来你已经变聪明了。如果没更聪明……至少……更快乐！",cEN="You see? I can tell you smarter already. And if not smarter... then... happier!"}
Q[12737]={d="暴风雨是一种破坏性的力量。它会刮倒树木，淹没房屋。\n\n但如果你知道正确的曲子，就可以将暴风雨化为生命的力量。你可以在造物者之座上方的雷暴台地发现一些小土堆。它们的土壤非常肥沃——里面埋着强大的种子。它们所等待的，就是一支正确的曲子。\n\n你就带上这只号角，为它们吹奏曲子吧。",dEN="The storm is a destructive force. Storm burns trees. Storm floods houses.\n\nBut storm can also be life force if you know right song. In Stormwright Shelf, above Maker's Perch, you can find small dirt mounds. They very fertile -- they carry inside a strong seed. All they wait for is the right song.\n\nYou take this horn and play song for them.",o="雨声树屋的索乌尼要你转至造物者之座西北方的雷暴台地，在8堆肥沃的土堆附近吹响丰饶号角。",oEN="Soo-nee at Rainspeaker Canopy wants you to go to the Stormwright's Shelf, northwest of the Maker's Perch, and play the Horn of Fecundity near 8 piles Soaked Fertile Dirt.",c="<name>，你学得很快。那首歌你学得很好。也许下次我教你一首不同的歌。",cEN="You learn fast, <name>. You learn that song well. Maybe next time I teach you different song."}
Q[12738]={d="必须有人听到这复仇的呐喊，$n。指挥官普雷菲斯特和一队死亡骑士已经出发去烧毁赤色烈焰礼拜堂了。如果礼拜堂里关有死亡骑士，普雷菲斯特会把他们救出来。\n\n也许你速度够快的话还可以赶上他们。礼拜堂就在正西方。",dEN="The cry for vengeance must be heard, <name>. Commander Plaguefist and a company of death knights are on their way to raze the Chapel of the Crimson Flame. If there are any death knights imprisoned at the chapel, Plaguefist will get them out.\n\nYou can still catch up to them if you hurry. The chapel is due west of here.",o="到赤色烈焰礼拜堂去，向骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特报到。",oEN="Report to Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame.",c="他们只不过由血肉和骨头所构成——敌不过天灾军团。\n\n我们没有找到任何的弟兄，不过倒是碰上了意外的惊喜。",cEN="They're only flesh and bone - no match for the Scourge.\n\nWe didn't find any of our brothers, but we did stumble upon something special."}
Q[12739]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个牛头人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty tauren in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，玛拉尔·勇角，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Malar Bravehorn, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12740]={d="这些飞在空中的怪物正在残杀我的士兵！被摔死是一个非常可怕的结局。\n\n$C，你必须把这些降落伞分发给我的士兵，这样他们至少有一次挣扎求生的机会。",dEN="Those sky terrors are destroying my men and women! Dying from falling is a horrible way to go.\n\n<class>, you have to get these parachutes out to them! At least then they'll have a fighting chance to survive.",o="银色前沿的指挥官法斯塔夫要你为庭院里的10名银色北伐军战士或银色持盾战士配备降落伞。",oEN="Commander Falstaav at The Argent Stand has asked you to equip 10 Argent Crusaders or Argent Shieldmen out in the courtyard with parachutes.",p="如果你是完成任务后回来跟我汇报的话，为什么我还会看到我的手下摔死呢？",pEN="If you're back here talking to me why do I still see my people falling to their deaths?",c="你是个好<男人/女人>，<name>。我们很幸运你恰好路过。\n\n多待一阵子吧。我相信有很多事，像你这样能干的<class>都能做。",cEN="You're a good <man /woman>, <name>. We're fortunate that you happened to stop by.\n\nStick around a while. I'm sure that we have much that a capable <class> such as yourself can do."}
Q[12741]={d="傻巨舌们以为对着云唱歌就能获得力量。雷耶克要教巨舌们怎么靠夺取来获得力量！\n\n在遥远的西北方，有一大片平坦的地方，巨舌们称之为\"风暴铸造者之台”。雷耶克确信只能像鸟一样飞才能到那里。\n\n雷耶克听说那台地上有强大的风与水的力量。因为它们坏，所以杀掉它们，然后把力量带到台地西侧的巨舌\"风暴神殿”。雷耶克等你带着终极力量回来。",dEN="Silly big-tongues think singing to the clouds give them power. Rejek show big-tongues how to get power by taking it!\n\nFar to northwest, there is large, flat area the big-tongues call 'Stormwright's Shelf.' Rejek is sure you can only get there by flying like bird.\n\nOn this shelf, Rejek has heard of mighty forces of wind and water. Kill them for their badness, then take it to the big-tongue 'Shrine of the Tempest' at shelf's western side. Rejek will await your return with ultimate power.",o="收集3份季风精华和3份风暴精华，将它们带到雷雨祭坛去。然后将真正的雷雨之力交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Gather 3 Essences of the Monsoon and 3 Essences of the Storm and take them to the Shrine of the Tempest. Return to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill with the True Power of the Tempest.",p="你把元素的真正力量带回来给雷耶克了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek true power of elements?",c="雷耶克来给大舌头瞧瞧什么才是真正的使用元素！",cEN="Now Rejek show cowardly big-tongues how to really use elements!"}
Q[12742]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个人类，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty human in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，艾琳·斯坦布雷，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Ellen Stanbridge, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12743]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个暗夜向导，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束她的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty night elf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，亚米娜·橡刺，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Yazmina Oakenthorn, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
