Q[12745]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个侏儒，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty gnome in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，戈比·雷管，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Goby Blastenheimer, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12746]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个德莱尼人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty draenei in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，正义的瓦洛克，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Valok the Righteous, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12747]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个血向导，她感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束她的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty blood elf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，艾欧妮丝女士，并结束她的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Lady Eonys, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12748]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个兽人，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty orc in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，库格·铁腭，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Kug Ironjaw, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12749]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个巨魔，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty troll in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，伊吉·暗齿，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Iggy Darktusk, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12750]={d="我们来到这里，将这个地方夷为平地，然后向牢房走去。在那里看到的一切完全出乎我们的意料，$n。看来血色十字军真是很忙碌。那里塞满了银色黎明的俘虏，当我们到达的时候，其中的大部分人都已经感染瘟疫死去了，但少数人还有呼吸。\n\n里面有一个被遗忘者，他感染了瘟疫，已经活不长了。去结束他的痛苦吧。",dEN="We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's a real feisty Forsaken in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",o="赤色烈焰礼拜堂的骑士团指挥官普雷菲斯特希望你去探视牢房里的银色黎明俘虏，安东尼·布拉克，并结束他的痛苦。",oEN="Knight Commander Plaguefist at the Chapel of the Crimson Flame has ordered you to execute Antoine Brack, an Argent Dawn prisoner inside the nearby prison house.",p="你现在感觉如何？",pEN="How does it feel?",c="感觉不错，对吧？你不再是他们中的一员了，<name>。你是天灾。你是我们中的一员。永远……",cEN="Felt good, didn't it? You're not one of them anymore, <name>. You're Scourge. You're one of us. Forever..."}
Q[12751]={d="回到血色旅店的萨萨里安那里，告诉他科尔提拉的复仇呐喊已经得到了回应。赤红烈焰礼拜堂将在几小时内化为一堆灰烬。\n\n你真是个冷血的怪物，$n。我向你致敬，$g兄弟:姐妹;。",dEN="Return to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern and let him know that Koltira's cry for vengeance has been answered. The Chapel of the Crimson Flame will be a pile of ashes in a matter of hours.\n\nYou're one cold-blooded monster, <name>. I salute you, <brother/sister>.",o="向新阿瓦隆血色旅店的萨萨里安汇报你胜利的消息。",oEN="Return to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon with news of your victory.",c="天灾军团又一次获胜！这些血色的狗杂碎已经无处可逃了。剩下的只是时间上的问题……",cEN="Another Scourge victory! These Scarlet dogs have nowhere left to run and hide. It's only a matter of time now..."}
Q[12754]={d="在你忙着焚烧礼拜堂、清理杂鱼的时候，我制订出了一套新的作战计划。\n\n血色十字军的信使每天都会定期经过血色悬崖，差不多就是这个时候。悬崖周围的道路都非常宽阔，视野很好，而且散布着无数的十字军士兵。等你到了血色悬崖之后，就用这套伪装工具把自己藏起来，准备伏击血色信使。当他走到你附近时，你就冲出来，以最短的时间结束战斗！击败他以后，带着他身上所有的东西回来——包括他的衣服！\n\n血色悬崖就在东边，离这里大概两百步远的地方。",dEN="While you were out burning churches and murdering vermin, I've been busy formulating a plan.\n\nThe Scarlet courier is scheduled to pass by the Scarlet Overlook within the hour. The roads by the overlook are wide open and swarming with Crusaders. Use this makeshift cover to hide at the overlook and wait for the Scarlet Courier to pass. When he's close enough, strike with all your fury! Cut him down and take his belongings - including his clothes!\n\nThe overlook is 200 paces east of here.",o="新阿瓦隆血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒要求你击败血色信使，并收集血色信使的衣物和血色信使的信件。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon has ordered you to kill the Scarlet Courier and retrieve the Scarlet Courier's Belongings and the Scarlet Courier's Message.",p="你要是错过了信差，那样我就不得不杀了你。虽说是不得不，不过我也会很高兴了结你的性命。\n\n动作快！",pEN="You're going to miss the courier and then I'm going to be forced to kill you. By forced I mean I will take great pleasure in ending your life.\n\nHURRY UP!",c="<奥尔巴兹阅读了信息。>\n\n壁炉谷和提瑞斯法的军队将会掉入大屠杀的陷阱之中。\n\n<奥尔巴兹微微一笑。>\n\n现在轮到计划的第二部分了。你要把这个信息送到大将军阿比迪斯的手中。这就是那些衣服的用途……",cEN="<Orbaz reads the message.>\n\nThe armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal will be marching into a massacre.\n\n<Orbaz smiles.>\n\nNow for the second part of the plan. You're going to deliver this message right into the hands of High General Abbendis. That's what the clothes are for..."}
Q[12755]={d="这份信息必须送到阿比迪斯手上。我们不想引起他们的怀疑。他们必须继续以为一切都在按计划进行。\n\n你将穿上血色信使的衣服，再借助一些黑暗魔法，连他的外貌也一并取得。\n\n阿比迪斯在国王港，位于血色哨塔东南方。放下信息，尽可能从她那里套出情报。她会告诉我们关于\"赤红黎明\"我们需要知道的事。",dEN="This message must reach Abbendis. We do not want to draw their suspicion. They must continue under the assumption that everything is going as they planned.\n\nYou will don the Scarlet courier's clothes and with the help of some dark magic, take on the form of the courier.\n\nAbbendis is at King's Harbor, southeast of the Scarlet Overlook. Drop off the message and get as much information out of her as you can. She will tell us what we need to know about the \"Crimson Dawn.\"",o="奥尔巴兹·血毒命令你将血色信使的信件交给国王港的阿比迪斯将军。",oEN="Orbaz Bloodbane has commanded you to deliver the Scarlet Courier's Message to High General Abbendis at King's Harbor.",p="你上哪去了？你迟了整整两小时。我们正要派信差去找高级指挥官。",pEN="Where have you been? You are two hours late. We were about to send a courier out to the High Commander.",c="<大将军阿比迪斯读了信。>\n\n该死！壁炉谷和提瑞斯法的军队绝不能到新阿瓦隆去！天灾军团会把他们给屠杀殆尽的。",cEN="<High General Abbendis reads the message.>\n\nDamn it! The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal must not reach New Avalon! The Scourge will slaughter them all."}
Q[12756]={d="听好了，信使。血色领地已经失守。新阿瓦隆和避难所已被天灾军团占领。死亡的阴影笼罩在头顶，随时可能吞没我们。\n\n带这个消息回去给加尔瓦：\n\n\"调转你的军队，备好船只前往冰封荒原。下次见面，我们就在诺森德了。\"\n\n把这个交给加尔瓦。\n\n<阿比迪斯递给你一本日记。>\n\n它会解释一切。\n\n血色十字军已不复存在。血色先锋军万岁！",dEN="Listen well, courier. The Scarlet lands are lost. New Avalon and Havenshire are overrun by Scourge. The specter of death looms overhead and threatens to overtake us at any moment.\n\nReturn to Galvar with this message:\n\n\"Turn your armies around and prepare your ships for travel to the frozen wastes. When next we meet it will be in Northrend.\"\n\nGive this to Galvar.\n\n<Abbendis hands you a journal.>\n\nIt will explain everything.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade is no more. Long live the Scarlet Onslaught!",o="将《救赎之路》交给新阿瓦隆血色旅店内的奥尔巴兹·血毒。",oEN="Deliver The Path of Redemption to Orbaz Bloodbane at the Scarlet Tavern in New Avalon.",p="<欧贝兹笑了笑。>\n\n这是什么？某个小孩的绘画簿吗？",pEN="<Orbaz laughs.>\n\nWhat is this? Some child's coloring book?",c="<奥巴兹翻阅着日记。>\n\n什么垃圾！这就是\"赤红黎明\"？\n\n他们是在驶向自己的死亡！让我们把注意力转向逼近的军队。",cEN="<Orbaz flips through the journal.>\n\nWhat rubbish! This is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"\n\nThey sail to their deaths! Let us turn our focus to the encroaching armies."}
Q[12757]={d="我们必须为入侵的军队做准备，$n。你要立刻把你发现的情况带给大领主莫格莱尼！我会打开一道直通阿彻鲁斯的传送门。走进去，它就会把你传送过去。\n\n也把阿比迪斯的日记交给大领主莫格莱尼。也许他会觉得有用。|n",dEN="We must prepare for the encroaching armies, <name>. You will take what you have discovered to Highlord Mograine at once! I will open a portal directly to Acherus. Step inside and it will transport you.\n\nGive Highlord Mograine Abbendis' journal as well. Perhaps he'll find it useful.",o="将《救赎之路》交给黑锋要塞阿彻鲁斯内的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼。",oEN="Deliver The Path of Redemption to Highlord Darion Mograine at Acherus: The Ebon Hold.",p="你做了什么？",pEN="You did what?",c="你成长为了一台杀戮机器，死亡骑士！我们将会肆意蹂躏这支向我们逼近的军队，然后将他们复活成我们的亡灵军队！",cEN="You have become an instrument of doom, death knight! We will ravage these approaching armies and raise the dead as our own!"}
Q[12758]={d="雷耶克听说过在遥远的雷暴台地有金属巨人出没。沿着西北方前进，越过盆地边缘就到了。\n\n想象一下，如果能戴上金属巨人的头盔，雷耶克将是不可战胜的！雷耶克将变得无比强大！\n\n你帮雷耶克弄个金属头盔好不好啊？但是金属巨人的头盔不容易得到，所以你要先去日灼之柱附近的斯温迪格林挖掘场，从小绿人和他们的朋友那里偷来一些炸弹。这样，你就可以用炸弹来弄到金属巨人的头盔，然后把它拿来交给雷耶克了。",dEN="Rejek hears tales of giant metal men on faraway Stormwright's Shelf. Far to northwest, outside basin's lip, you will find it.\n\nImagine Rejek using heads of giant metal men as helmet. Make Rejek unstoppable! Make Rejek mighty!\n\nYou get for Rejek, but metal head might not come off metal body easy. Maybe steal bombs from little green men and their friends at Swindlegrin's Dig near Suntouched Pillar? Use bombs to get head off metal body, then bring to Rejek.",o="转至斯温迪格林挖掘场，从风险投资公司的驻地搞到风险投资公司炸药，然后使用它们获得风暴看守的头盔。将风暴看守的头盔交给狂心岭的雷耶克。",oEN="Get Venture Co. Explosives from any of the Venture Company units at Swindlegrin's Dig and use them to obtain a Stormwatcher's Head. Bring the Stomwatcher's Head to Rejek at Frenzyheart Hill.",p="你带了雷耶克的新头盔来了吗？",pEN="You bring Rejek's new helmet?",c="雷耶克知道你成功了！现在雷耶克要试试新的头盔！",cEN="Rejek sees you were successful! Now Rejek try on new war helmet."}
Q[12759]={d="我听瑟匹克说，你是他见过的最好的鳄鱼人猎手……当然，是除了瑟匹克之外最好的猎手。西南方仍然有大规模的战斗——你要去帮忙。\n\n瑟匹克在卡塔克要塞藏了很多厉害的陷阱……告诉维克加，让他利用这些陷阱作战。你也可以挑选自己喜欢的陷阱，用它们多杀些大舌头怪。\n\n越多越好！",dEN="Zepik tell me that you maybe the best gorloc hunter he met... other than Zepik. Still big battle to southwest - you go help.\n\nZepik keeps some of biggest, baddest traps in his stash at Kartak's Hold... told Vekgar to use them for battle, so you use them too. Go pick out any traps you want and kill lots of big-tongues.\n\nLots and lots!",o="转至卡塔克要塞，取出被瑟匹克藏起来的陷阱。利用它们杀死50个灵鳍鳄鱼人，然后向卡塔克要塞的萨满祭司亚克耶克复命。",oEN="Retrieve some of Zepik's traps from his stash in Kartak's Hold. Using the traps, slaughter 50 of the nearby Sparktouched Gorlocs, and then return to Shaman Jakjek in Kartak's Hold.",p="真是一团乱啊！但还是很好玩。",pEN="Kind of messy! But still so fun.",c="你对那些陷阱的使用几乎就像瑟匹克一样棒！",cEN="You almost as good with those traps as Zepik!"}
Q[12760]={d="卡塔克要塞的战斗仍在继续……是时候告诉你狂心氏族的大秘密了。\n\n我们保存着一种浆果，是从我们的故乡带来的……它本身没有什么特别之处，不过一旦与酒精饮料混合饮用，就可以让狂心狼獾人变得非常强壮。现在你也是氏族的一员了……你也要变强。\n\n我给你一些饮料，喝了之后你就会变得强壮，然后就可以碾碎所有的大舌头怪。",dEN="Battle still going at Kartak hold... I think it time for you to learn big secret of Frenzyheart.\n\nWe have berries we keep from other lands we came from... they not so special on their own, but mix them with drunk drinks and they make Frenzyheart super strong. You a Frenzyheart now... it time you get to be strong too.\n\nI give some drink, then you be super strong and you go smash all the spark big-tongues.",o="喝下神秘的狂心氏族饮料，然后在卡塔克要塞附近消灭30个灵鳍鳄鱼人。",oEN="Using the secret Frenzyheart drink, slaughter 30 of the Sparktouched Gorlocs around Kartak's Hold.",p="维克加教了你这个超级秘密，嗯？只有最强的狂心族人才能知道这个秘密。",pEN="Vekgar teach you super secret, eh? Only strongest Frenzyheart get to know secret.",c="你是个凶猛的战士……明天再来进行更多战斗吧。好架永远打不够！",cEN="You a fierce fighter... come back for more battle soon. Never enough good battle!"}
Q[12761]={d="狗狗人并未停止对灵鳍湾的攻击……如果我们不加阻拦的话，他们是不会罢手的。我们有秘密武器……我们把它交给了索乌米特，让他保护所有的鳄鱼人。\n\n秘密武器是伟大的造物主留下的……我们在神圣的造物主祭坛中找到了这些闪闪发光的水晶。你要当心……别弄碎了。\n\n水晶就放在西南方灵鳍湾神殿附近的箱子里。你要用水晶帮助索乌米特打败狗狗人。",dEN="Sparktouched are still being attacked by puppy-men... we think they maybe not stop if we not make them stop. We have secret weapon though... we sent it out to Soo-met so he can use to protect all Oracles.\n\nSecret weapon is from Great Ones themselves... extra shiny crystals found inside sacred Great One temples. Be very careful... no break them.\n\nCrystals are in chest near shrine at Sparktouched Haven, in far southwest. You go use crystals to help Soo-met beat the puppy-men.",o="拿到灵鳍湾的防御水晶，借助水晶的力量杀死附近的50个狂心狼獾人。完成任务后向灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特复命。",oEN="Retrieve the crystal defenses at Sparktouched Haven and use them to kill 50 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar. When these tasks are complete, return to Lightningcaller Soo-met in Sparktouched Haven.",p="非常的强大。小狗人不知道伟大诸神的力量。呆呆小狗人。",pEN="Very powerful. Puppy-men not know about power of Great Ones. Dumb puppy-men.",c="感谢你，干燥皮肤的朋友。\n\n我会在这里用水晶继续保护我们的安全。或许你可以明天来再帮忙我们一些。",cEN="Thank you, dryskin.\n\nI hold onto these crystals here to keep us safe. Maybe you come back soon and help us more."}
Q[12762]={d="狗狗人并未停止对灵鳍湾的攻击，我们必须采取一些措施。亚鲁乌特将他在河流之心发现的特殊水晶交给了我……之前我们只见到过一次类似的东西。\n\n这块水晶现在还没有能量，但是如果你将它带到离源血之柱足够近的地方，石柱的能量应该可以传导到水晶中。完成充能之后，就转至西南方的灵鳍湾，使用水晶让你变得强大起来。\n\n接下来，就该好好教训一下狗狗人了。",dEN="We need to do something to stop puppy-men attacking Sparktouched Haven. Jaloot brought me very special crystal that he found in River's Heart... we seen only one like it before.\n\nThe crystal not have power now, but the opened up lifeblood pillar should have energy to recharge it if you just bring it close. Once the crystal is charged, go to Sparktouched Haven in far southwest and let the crystal's energy make you big and strong.\n\nThen it time to kick some puppy-men butt.",o="在源血之柱的暴露部分附近为休眠的无瑕水晶充能。转至灵鳍湾，使用水晶的能量杀死附近的30个狂心狼獾人，然后与灵鳍湾的唤雷者索乌米特谈一谈。",oEN="Charge the Dormant Polished Crystal at the exposed Lifeblood Pillar. Travel to Sparktouched Haven and use the power the crystal bestows to slaughter 30 of the nearby Frenzyheart wolvar, and then speak to Lightningcaller Soo-met in Sparktouched Haven.",p="有你在这里帮我们真好。不知道战斗还要持续多久。",pEN="Good to have you here to help us. Long fight.",c="你身上的能量真强……你充满了造物者的力量！\n\n我没说谎……我只是有点嫉妒。",cEN="So much energy in you... you full of the power of the Great Ones!\n\nI not lie, I little bit jealous."}
Q[12763]={d="尽管我们这里的需要很紧迫，但北方传来的消息不容忽视。\n\n我刚收到银色北伐军的消息。看来天灾军团的部队正在那里集结，威胁要攻占祖达克。\n\n不用说，$n，如果那真的发生，我们在这里的奋斗就毫无意义了。你必须去那里，帮助十字军击退巫妖王的军队。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;出发时，与玛基交谈。",dEN="As pressing as our needs are here, there's news from the lands to the north that cannot be ignored.\n\nI've just received a message from the Argent Crusade. It seems that scourge forces are gathering there and are threatening to overrun Zul'drak.\n\nNeedless to say, <name>, if that were to happen our struggle here would be meaningless. You must go there and aid the Crusaders in beating back the Lich King's armies.\n\nSpeak to Makki when you are ready to travel.",o="斥候沃塔肯要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n欧尼瓦营地的玛吉·冬风会提供转至圣光据点的交通工具。",oEN="Scout Vor'takh wants you to travel to Zul'Drak and report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach.\n\nMakki Wintergale in Camp Onequah will provide you transportation.",c="圣光会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12766]={d="<向导形态下的巨龙接过你递上去的推荐信，仔细阅读了良久，然后整齐地折叠好，塞进了宽大的袖子中。>\n\n看来一切都在循序渐进。不过，若你不以为扰，我希望你能与你们阵营派来神殿里的大使相谈片刻。\n\n在你得到觐见女王的资格之前，正好可以帮她处理一些棘手的事。\n\n<他轻轻拍了拍那只藏有那封推荐信的袖子。>\n\n放心，在你回来之前，我会妥善保管你这封信的。",dEN="<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the temple.\n\nShe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this safe for you until your return.",o="与龙眠神殿的劳莉耶尔·图布雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Lauriel Trueblade at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="你一定是<name>。有人告诉我你会来。\n\n有件事我认为只有你能胜任，做了它，你就能赢得这里巨龙们的好感。",cEN="You must be <name>. I was told you'd be coming.\n\nI have something that I think you're uniquely qualified to take care of and by doing it, you'll be ingratiating yourself with the dragons here."}
Q[12767]={d="<向导形态下的巨龙接过你递上去的推荐信，仔细阅读了良久，然后整齐地折叠好，塞进了宽大的袖子中。>\n\n看来一切都在循序渐进。不过，若你不以为扰，我希望你能与你们阵营派来神殿里的大使相谈片刻。\n\n在你得到觐见女王的资格之前，正好可以帮他处理一些棘手的事。\n\n<他轻轻拍了拍那只藏有那封推荐信的袖子。>\n\n放心，在你回来之前，我会妥善保管你这封信的。",dEN="<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the temple.\n\nHe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this safe for you until your return.",o="与龙眠神殿的古拉克·石拳谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Golluck Rockfist at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="你一定是<name>。有人告诉我你会来。\n\n\n\n有件事我想让你处理。如果你做了，就能向这里的巨龙证明你自己。\n",cEN="You must be <name>. I was told you'd be coming.\n\n\n\nI have something that I want you to take care of. If you do, you'll prove yourself to the dragons here."}
Q[12768]={d="你已经证明了自己有资格获得更多的信任。\n\n现在立刻返回龙眠神殿去，再一次与塔里奥斯塔兹执事谈谈吧，亲爱的$n。",dEN="You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",o="与龙眠神殿的塔里奥斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="这么快就回来了，<name>？\n\n瑟里斯特拉兹在你抵达前就送了信来。感谢你在红玉巨龙圣地所做的一切。",cEN="Back so soon, <name>?\n\nCeristrasz sent word ahead of you. Thank you for what you did at the Ruby Dragonshrine."}
Q[12769]={d="你已经证明了自己有资格获得更多的信任。\n\n现在立刻返回龙眠神殿去，再一次与塔里奥斯塔兹执事谈谈吧，亲爱的$n。",dEN="You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",o="与龙眠神殿的塔里奥斯塔兹谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Tariolstrasz at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="这么快就回来了，<name>？\n\n瓦加斯塔兹在你抵达前就送了信来。感谢你在红玉巨龙圣地所做的一切。",cEN="Back so soon, <name>?\n\nVargastrasz sent word ahead of you. Thank you for what you did at the Ruby Dragonshrine."}
Q[12770]={d="听着，！\n\n你在这里的日子屈指可数了。尽管我们队伍里需要能干的$g$c:$c;，但北边出的乱子让我们这些麻烦看起来就像暴风城的仲夏游行。\n\n原来天灾军团正在集中力量——大举进攻要拿下祖达克。如果让他们得逞，我们还不如卷铺盖走人。\n\n你可以先了结这里的事务，但之后就得动身去圣光之歇了。如果需要交通工具，就找塞缪尔。\n\n解散。",dEN="Listen up, <class>!\n\nYour days here are numbered. As much as we need capable <class>s in our ranks, there's trouble up north that makes our problems look like a mid-summer Stormwind parade.\n\nTurns out the Scourge are concentrating their efforts - making a big push to take over Zul'Drak. If that happens, we may as well pack it in.\n\nYou're free to finish any business here, but then it's off to Light's Breach with you. Speak to Samuel if you need transportation.\n\nDismissed.",o="格里安·斯托曼要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n萨缪尔·克莱布克会提供转至圣光据点的交通工具。",oEN="Gryan Stoutmantle wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.\n\nYou may speak to Samuel Clearbook for transportation to Light's Breach.",c="圣光将会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12778]={d="陷阱已经触发，死亡骑士。壁炉谷和提瑞斯法的军队已经到了，正好赶上看他们的据点燃起大火！如果他们现在掉头，就是背对着我们作战。\n\n<莫格莱尼摇了摇头。>\n\n不，他们只有一个选择，而这个选择只有一个结果：天启！\n\n就在我们说话的时候，他们正准备做最后一搏。\n\n巫妖王在等你回来，$g勇士:勇士;。他就在我们下方，死亡之痕那里守望。",dEN="The trap has been sprung, death knight. The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal have arrived, just in time to see their enclave in flames! If they turn back now, they fight us with their backs turned.\n\n<Mograine shakes his head.>\n\nNo, they have only one option, which has only one outcome: APOCALYPSE!\n\nAs we speak, they prepare to make one final stand.\n\nThe Lich King awaits your return, champion. He stands watch below us, at Death's Breach.",o="在死亡裂口找到巫妖王。",oEN="Seek out the Lich King at Death's Breach.",c="你为我效力得很好，<name>。天灾的印记已经烙进这些血色土地。你一路所到之处，收获死亡与毁灭，并把血色军队的残部交到了我手上。\n\n<巫妖王指向避难所的废墟和燃烧的新阿瓦隆城。>\n\n现在是时候了结你开始的一切了。",cEN="You have served me well, <name>. The mark of the Scourge has been burned into these Scarlet lands. You have reaped death and destruction for as far as the eye can see and delivered to me the last of the Scarlet armies.\n\n<The Lich King points to the ruins of Havenshire and the burning city of New Avalon.>\n\nIt is now time to finish what you started."}
Q[12779]={d="虽然击败的血色十字军士兵早已不计其数，但你那黑暗之心仍渴求更多的胜利。你对战斗的渴望无穷无尽，$n。\n\n<巫妖王顿了一顿。>\n\n万物皆有始终，我的死亡骑士。血色十字军的部队也将面对他们的宿命。他们无论如何也不能逃脱即将到来的厄运。也因此，他们将如同狂暴的困兽一般，挣扎到最后一刻，而你将见证这一切。\n\n使用这只号角召唤我麾下的冰霜巨龙，爬上它的背脊，并号令它进行战斗，去迎接你的再一次胜利吧。",dEN="You have slaughtered legions beyond number and still your dark heart craves more. Your hunger knows no end, <name>.\n\n<The Lich King pauses.>\n\nThere must come an end to all things, death knight. The Scarlet armies make their final stand against us. For them, there is no escape... no choice. And for this reason they will fight with a ferocity that you have yet to witness.\n\nUse this horn to call forth one of my wyrms. Climb upon its back and command it into battle. With it you will end the Scarlet Crusade.",o="巫妖王命令你消灭血色十字军。\n\n使用冰霜巨龙号角召唤出一条冰霜征服者，和它一起击败150名血色十字军士兵，并摧毁10台血色弩车。灵活地飞出他们的射程，免得自己被乱箭射穿！",oEN="The Lich King has commanded you to eradicate the Scarlet Crusade.\n\nUse the Horn of the Frostbrood to call forth a Frostbrood Vanquisher and with it slay 150 Scarlet Soldiers and destroy 10 Scarlet Ballistas. Avoid incoming projectiles by moving out of their line of fire!",p="把他们全杀光……",pEN="Kill them all...",c="跪下，勇士。我把这顶头盔戴在你头上，让你那骇人的形象得以完整。任何敢于直视你那黑暗面容的人都会知道，死亡降临了。不要让任何人如此大胆地对抗你的王，以至于面对你无情的怒火，<name>。\n\n只剩下最后一项任务……\n\n<巫妖王望向西方。>\n\n圣光之愿礼拜堂。",cEN="Kneel, champion. I place this helm upon your head to complete your terrifying visage. Any that dare look upon your dark countenance will know that death comes. Let none stand so boldly against your king so as to face your merciless wrath, <name>.\n\nThere remains only one final task...\n\n<The Lich King looks west.>\n\nLight's Hope Chapel."}
Q[12781]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到《魔兽世界》！\n\n为了特别感谢你购买《魔兽世界》典藏版，请把这张礼品券交给黑锋要塞的女妖苏西。之后你会得到一份礼物：一个小小伙伴，它会在你追寻冒险与荣耀的路上陪伴你。\n\n再次感谢，祝你在《魔兽世界》中过得愉快！|n",dEN="Welcome to the World of Warcraft!\n\nAs special thanks for purchasing the World of Warcraft Collector's Edition, turn in this gift voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold. You'll then be given a gift: a little companion to join you on your quest for adventure and glory.\n\nThanks again, and enjoy your stay in the World of Warcraft!",o="将黑锋要塞礼品券交给黑锋要塞的女妖希奥克丝。",oEN="Bring the Ebon Hold Gift Voucher to Siouxsie the Banshee in Ebon Hold.",p="我看到您手里拿着一张特殊的礼品券，把它交给我，您就可以得到一件特殊的礼品。",pEN="I see you have a special voucher. Give it to me and I will offer you something in exchange.",c="我们欢迎您来到艾泽拉斯的世界，并从下列独特礼品中供您挑选一样。",cEN="We welcome you to the world of Azeroth, and offer you one of these unique gifts."}
Q[12789]={d="做好准备，$c。我要派你到东北方的圣光据点去。\n\n我得到消息说，天灾军团正在准备大举进攻祖达克。\n\n<瓦鲁斯紧紧盯着你的眼睛。>\n\n我们不能让那些杂种得逞。\n\n你一定要去全力消灭那里的天灾军团。这是圣光的意愿。\n\n解散。",dEN="Ready yourself, <class>. I'm dispatching you to Light's Breach, northeast of here.\n\nI've received word that the Scourge are making a push to take over Zul'Drak.\n\n<Valus stares you dead in the eyes.>\n\nThis will not come to pass.\n\nSee to it that you assist in the destruction of the Scourge there. The light demands it.\n\nDismissed.",o="圣光之望礼拜堂的北伐军战士瓦鲁斯要你转至祖达克的圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。",oEN="Crusader Valus at Light's Trust wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",c="很好。瓦鲁斯一定收到我的报告了。\n\n开始干活吧，<race>。",cEN="Excellent. Valus must have received my report.\n\nLet's get to work, <race>."}
Q[12790]={d="有件事不知道你是否了解，是这样，你可以利用我身后平台上的那块水晶，从达拉然传送到下面的晶歌森林废墟中。\n\n当然，你也可以在废墟里找到同样的水晶，然后用它传送回达拉然来，终点就在我上面的那间传送室里。\n\n我推荐你去试一下。",dEN="Just in case you don't already know, you can use the crystal on the platform behind me to teleport to the Violet Stand in Crystalsong Forest beneath Dalaran.\n\nCorrespondingly, you can use the crystal at the stand below to return to the chamber above me.\n\nI would like for you to do this now.",o="达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉要求你使用通向达拉然下方废墟的传送水晶和通向达拉然的传送水晶。",oEN="Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran wants you to use the Teleport to Violet Stand Crystal and the Teleport to Dalaran Crystal.",p="我感觉到你还没测试那两颗传送水晶。\n\n没关系，慢慢来。",pEN="I sense that you haven't yet tested out both of the teleport crystals.\n\nThat's alright, take your time.",c="很好，<class>。现在你知道怎么下到晶歌森林，也知道怎么回来了。",cEN="Excellent, <class>. Now you know the way to get down to Crystalsong Forest and also how to return."}
Q[12791]={d="你好，$n。你可能已经注意到了，我们肯瑞托已经把城市搬到了诺森德这里。\n\n达拉然不再坐落在洛丹米尔湖岸的防护穹顶之下。现在这座城市魔法般地悬浮在晶歌森林上空。\n\n我们相信你已经准备好前往那座城市了。再和我交谈一次，我就会施放传送法术把你送过去。\n\n到达之后，去寻找大法师塞琳德拉，把我的印戒交给她，作为我们交谈过的凭证。 $g准备好:准备好了;",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="向你致意，<class>。",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12792]={d="听着，$r！\n\n这一地区已经完全陷入了危机，到处都需要帮助。\n\n<库恩斯直视着你的眼睛。>\n\n现在最需要你的人是莉安娜。天灾军团已经切断了我们的联系，把她和她的部队孤立了起来。\n\n莉安娜驻守在圣光据点，就在西南方。",dEN="Listen up, <race>!\n\nThis entire region is full of crises. Everywhere you look you'll find those who could use your assistance.\n\n<Kunz looks you squarely in the eye.>\n\nNo one needs your help right now more than Riannah. The scourge have forced their way between us, leaving her and those she commands isolated.\n\nLight's Breach, where her forces are holding out, lies just southwest of here.",o="银色前沿的指挥官库恩斯要你转至圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。",oEN="Commander Kunz at Argent Stand wants you to report to Sergeant Riannah at Light's Breach.",c="看来我的报告一定有送库恩斯的手中。\n\n很高兴知道他还健在。",cEN="My report must have made it through to Kunz.\n\nIt is good to know that he is well."}
Q[12793]={d="你听到了吗，$r？\n\n遥远的西方传来的战斗喧嚣一直传到这里，甚至盖过了我们自己厮杀的响声。\n\n天灾军团威胁要突破那些自称\"银色北伐军\"的防线。阻止这件事是整个地区最紧迫的事。\n\n前往圣光之歇，加入他们的战斗。与玛卡交谈，他会为你提供安全的通路。",dEN="You hear that, <race>?\n\nThe clamor of battle far to the west reaches us here, even over the din of our own struggle.\n\nThe Scourge are threatening to break through the lines of those calling themselves the Argent Crusade. Preventing this is as urgent as anything in the region.\n\nTravel to Light's Breach and join in their struggle. Speak to Maaka and he will provide you safe passage.",o="希姆托加的巫医库弗要你转至圣光据点，向莉安娜中士报到。\n\n玛尔卡会向你提供必需的交通工具。",oEN="Khufu in Zim'Torga wants you to travel to Light's Breach and report to Sergeant Riannah there.\n\nMaaka will provide you with transportation there.",c="圣光会战胜一切！",cEN="The Light shall prevail!"}
Q[12794]={d="你好，$n。你可能已经注意到了，我们肯瑞托已经把城市搬到了诺森德这里。\n\n达拉然不再坐落在洛丹米尔湖岸的防护穹顶之下。现在这座城市魔法般地悬浮在晶歌森林上空。\n\n我们相信你已经准备好前往那座城市了。再和我交谈一次，我就会施放传送法术把你送过去。\n\n到达之后，去寻找大法师塞琳德拉，把我的印戒交给她，作为我们交谈过的凭证。 $g准备好:准备好了;",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at the Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="向你致意，<class>。",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12795]={d="就在不久之前，我突然看见东边的树林另一边突然升起了一发信号弹的火光。\n\n这一定表示银色前沿那里的十字军成员遭遇到了什么麻烦。\n\n但我现在不能离开我们的岗哨，$r，得依靠你了。只要时间允许，你立刻过去寻找指挥官法斯塔夫，并且看看他们那边是否有需要你帮助的地方。",dEN="A few moments ago I spotted a signal flare over the treeline to the east.\n\nThat can only mean that things are not going smoothly for the Crusaders at Argent Stand.\n\nI cannot leave our post here, <race>, but you can. When time permits, make your way up to Commander Falstaav and see if there's anything you can do to lighten their burden.",o="黑锋哨站的血玫瑰达图拉要求你去跟银色前沿的指挥官法斯塔夫谈一谈。",oEN="Bloodrose Datura at Ebon Watch wants you to speak with Commander Falstaav at The Argent Stand.",c="其实还真有件事你可以帮忙，<class>。",cEN="As it happens there is something you can do to be of assistance, <class>."}
Q[12796]={d="你好，$n。你可能已经注意到了，我们肯瑞托已经把城市搬到了诺森德这里。\n\n达拉然不再坐落在洛丹米尔湖岸的防护穹顶之下。现在这座城市魔法般地悬浮在晶歌森林上空。\n\n我们相信你已经准备好前往那座城市了。再和我交谈一次，我就会施放传送法术把你送过去。\n\n到达之后，去寻找大法师塞琳德拉，把我的印戒交给她，作为我们交谈过的凭证。 $g准备好:准备好了;",dEN="Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",o="将肯瑞托徽记之戒交给达拉然紫罗兰之门的大法师塞琳德拉。",oEN="Deliver the Kirin Tor Signet to Archmage Celindra at The Violet Gate in Dalaran.",p="向你致意，<class>。",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="欢迎来到达拉然。\n\n我会确认戒指已经归还。",cEN="Welcome to Dalaran.\n\nI'll see to it that the ring is returned."}
Q[12797]={d="你说得没错，$r。我可以清晰地感觉到索拉查盆地的能量正在被亡灵天灾腐蚀。\n\n我已经将自己封印在了这枚符文中，$r。将这枚符文交给派你前来的守卫者——只有得到她的允许，我才能踏入她的领地。",dEN="You speak the truth, <race>. I can sense the very essence of Sholazar Basin begin to fray by the blight of undeath even as we speak.\n\nI've bound my being into the rune, <race>. Deliver it to she who sent you here -- for only her power can grant me passage to her lands.",o="将欧米伽符文带回索拉查盆地的雨声河，交给弗蕾亚的化身。",oEN="Bring the Omega Rune to the Avatar of Freya at the Rainspeaker Rapids in Sholazar Basin.",p="<name>，你回来了。",pEN="You've returned, <name>.",c="你做得很好。\n\n对我们的敌人降下灾难。对服侍巫妖王而威胁泰坦创造物的人降下灾难——源生石像就是为此而来。",cEN="You've done well.\n\nWoe unto our enemies. Woe unto those who serve the Lich King and threaten the titans' creations -- for the Etymidian is here."}
Q[12798]={d="你现在已经收集到了长剑套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Swords cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone.",o="使用长剑套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Swords Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你已集满全套的长剑套牌。太好了。",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Swords. Excellent.",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫，立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西，来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="Your inscription ability has grown, scribe. The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[12799]={d="他们说我该高兴他要来。他们说你享受他的陪伴……\n\n其实我根本没得选。芬克尔斯坦是北伐军最好的炼金师。他选中我的岗哨来开店，我本该感到荣幸。但自从他来了以后，我就被打发去收集各种炼金材料。\n\n我说，$r，你愿意帮我一把吗？这南边有些水池，被古代巨魔的灵魂缠着。替我收集它们的灵质。",dEN="You should be happy he's coming, they said. You'll enjoy his company, they said....\n\nWell it's not as if I had a choice in the matter. Finklestein is the Crusade's best alchemist. I suppose I should be honored that he's chosen my post to set up shop. But ever since he's arrived, I've been relegated to collecting various alchemical ingredients.\n\nSay, <race>, how about you give me a hand? Just south of here are some pools that are haunted by spirits of ancient trolls. Collect their ectoplasm for me.",o="赫布瓦罗的阿纳斯上尉要求你转至扎尔金之池，从迷失的达卡莱灵魂身上收集5份上古灵质。",oEN="Captain Arnath at Heb'Valok wants you to collect 5 Ancient Ectoplasms from the Lost Drakkari Spirits at the Pools of Zha'Jin.",p="日安，<race>。\n\n你收集到芬克尔斯坦要的灵质了吗？",pEN="Good day, <race>.\n\nHave you collected the ectoplasm Finklestein asked for?",c="谢谢你，<class>。\n\n这应该能让我的部下省下不少宝贵的时间。",cEN="Thank you, <class>.\n\nThis should save my men some precious time."}
Q[12800]={d="血色十字军在这里的领地已经被连根拔除，我们将在诺森德消灭他们的残部。\n\n现在，我军的重点攻击方向将转到圣光之愿礼拜堂。你们的君王决不允许这枚眼中钉继续存在下去！\n\n我已经下达了最后的命令。天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔正在布洛米尔外围等着你。转至西北方，穿过洞穴之后进入剧毒林地，然后沿着边缘的小路转至布洛米尔。\n\n不要让我失望，$n。",dEN="The Scarlet Enclave is no more. What remains of the Crusade will be dealt with in Northrend.\n\nWe now turn all of our efforts to Light's Hope Chapel. No longer will this affront to your master be allowed to exist!\n\nI have issued my final command. Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the edge of Browman Mill. Go northwest, through the cave, into the Noxious Glade and take the path leading out of the glade to the mill.\n\nDo not fail me, <name>.",o="向布洛米尔的天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔报到。",oEN="Report to Scourge Commander Thalanor at Browman Mill.",c="大领主与其它的死亡骑士正在准备进攻！我们将会把此地残留的最后一点生气给榨干。",cEN="The Highlord and the other death knights are preparing to strike! We will squeeze the last remnants of life out of this place."}
Q[12801]={d="银色黎明在圣光之愿礼拜堂公然对抗我们。他们竟敢反抗天灾军团，仅凭这一点，他们就必须被消灭！\n\n随着瘟疫之地的最终决战临近，巫妖王强大的军队已准备就绪。今天，我们将升入天灾英雄的不朽国度！\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;战斗，向大领主达里安·莫格莱尼报到。将由大领主下达最后的进军命令，并在圣光之愿礼拜堂指挥我们的军队。",dEN="The Argent Dawn stands defiantly against us at Light's Hope Chapel. They dare oppose the Scourge and for that reason alone they must be destroyed!\n\nThe mighty armies of the Lich King stand at the ready as the final battle for the Plaguelands approaches. Today we ascend into the immortal realm of Scourge heroes!\n\nWhen you are ready for battle, report to Highlord Darion Mograine. It is the highlord who will issue the final march orders and command our armies at Light's Hope Chapel.",o="击败银色黎明的部队，揭开黎明之光的秘密。\n\n如果你活着从战场上归来，就去向大领主达里安·莫格莱尼复命。",oEN="Defeat the forces of the Argent Dawn and uncover the Light of Dawn.\n\nReport to Highlord Darion Mograine should you survive.",p="<大领主莫格莱尼点了点头。>",pEN="<Highlord Mograine nods.>",c="我们不会得到救赎，<name>。我们永远被诅咒，以怪物的身份在大地上游荡。虽然巫妖王可能已松开对我们的掌控，但我们过往的幽灵将永远萦绕在记忆里。\n\n我们必须以唯一懂得的方式来弥补：死亡……\n\n我现在请你加入我在阿彻鲁斯的行列，成为黑锋之刃骑士。我们将一同摧毁巫妖王，终结天灾军团。",cEN="There will be no atonement for us, <name>. We are forever damned to walk the earth as monsters. While the Lich King may have loosed his grip upon us, the specters of our past will forever haunt our memories.\n\nWe must make amends in the only way we know how: Death...\n\nI ask you now to join me in Acherus as a Knight of the Ebon Blade. Together we will destroy the Lich King and end the Scourge."}
Q[12802]={d="<达库鲁的声音充满你的脑海。>\n\n嘿，$g伙计:小姑娘;！这先知的眼球真好用！我一直用它看着你，我看到你拿到那颗心了！不错……\n\n现在你只要把它带到我德拉克阿塔尔通道的火盆那里，就在你东边不远。\n\n你必须在基座上喝下我的药剂，才能把我召唤过去。这次你得掺进一些那里守卫的绝望魔精才管用。",dEN="<Drakuru's voice fills your mind.>\n\nHey, mon! Dis eye of da prophets be great! I been usin' it to watch ya and I see ya got da heart now! Not bad....\n\nNow ya just gotta bring it to my brazier at Drak'atal Passage, a short walk east of ya.\n\nYa must drink my elixir at da pedestal to summon me there. This time, ya need ta mix in some desperate mojo from the defenders there for it ta be workin'.",o="达克阿塔小径的达库鲁要求你将古树精华宝石交给他。\n\n你还需要收集5份绝望魔精，才能在那里使用药剂。",oEN="Drakuru wants you to bring the Heart of the Ancients to him at Drak'atal Passage.\n\nYou will need to collect 5 Desperate Mojo to use the elixir there.",c="让人印象深刻，老兄！命运让我们相遇真是一件好事。\n\n很快，我就能净化达克萨隆，替我的弟兄们复仇，你也会得到达克萨隆的财宝当作奖赏。",cEN="Impressive, mon! Fate be kind in bringin' us together.\n\nSoon I be avengin' me bruddas by cleansin' Drak'Tharon, and you be awarded Drak'Tharon's greatest treasure."}
Q[12803]={d="我不太确定我向东北方飞的时候看到了什么，但在我看来，那是个巨大的女人在痛揍天灾军团。\n\n我听教授提起过一位由泰坦任命、守望索拉查的\"生命守护者\"。我不算什么泰坦史学家，但听起来就是她。\n\n我还知道，如果天灾军团越过迷失之地与索拉查其余部分之间的边界，我们的探险队就死定了。你去找到她、搭把手怎么样？",dEN="I'm not sure about what I saw while flying to the northeast, but to me it looked like a gigantic woman kicking some Scourge butt.\n\nI'd heard the professor talk about a certain \"lifewarden\" appointed by the titans to look over Sholazar. I might not be a titan historian, but it sounds like she fits the bill.\n\nI also know that if the Scourge cross the border between the Lost Lands and the rest of Sholazar, our expedition's as good as dead. What do you say you go look for her and lend a hand?",o="转至索拉查盆地的荒芜边界，寻找弗蕾亚的化身。荒芜边界就在雨声河与迷失之地的交界处。",oEN="Travel to the Blight Line, between Rainspeaker Rapids and the Lost Lands in Sholazar Basin and seek the Avatar of Freya.",c="你不属于这片大地。但你也不是和天灾军团一伙的。\n\n我该拿你怎么办呢？",cEN="You are not of this land. But you also are not with the Scourge.\n\nWhat should I make of you?"}
Q[12804]={d="有些时候呢，最糟糕的事情莫过于有一整个营地的猎人每天出去捕猎，杀死各类大型飞禽走兽，回头来却发现它们的肉都是又干又硬根本难以入口。一整天疲倦的狩猎之后，你回到营地却发现只能吃这些东西，恐怕想死的心都有了。\n\n好在附近不远的地方就有柔软多汁的上等好肉。在河流和营地的南边有不少活蹦乱跳的长颈鹿，这些家伙能给饥肠辘辘的猎人们提供最完美的肉食。去吧，从它们身上切几块最好的肉排回来，让我好好犒劳一下这里的同志们。",dEN="Sometimes, there's nothing worse than a camp full of hunters. They're all so busy taking down prey animals that the only meat I get is tough and stringy. That's hardly the kind of thing you want to come home to after a long day on the hunt.\n\nLucky for us, though, there is a source of tender, succulent meat nearby. To the south of the river and the camp live longneck grazers. They're a perfect source of meat for our hungry hunters. Bring me back the best cuts of meat and we'll properly toast our comrades.",o="将5份食草长颈鹿肉排交给奈辛瓦里营地的菜刀库尔格。",oEN="Bring 5 Longneck Grazer Steaks to Korg the Cleaver at the Nesingwary Base Camp.",p="你弄到那些肉排了吗？",pEN="Did you get those steaks?",c="这才叫一顿饭！如果说这场海难有什么好处，那就是我们接下来一个月不用只吃咸牛肉了！再次感谢你，<name>。",cEN="Now that's a meal! If anything good came of the shipwreck, it's got to be that we've been spared eating nothing but salt beef for the next month! Thank you again, <name>."}
Q[12805]={d="源血之柱崩塌时，巨大的冲击力使大地受到了重创。\n\n那些原本支撑着巨柱运转的生命能量，现在已经沾染到了崩裂碎片周围的那些元素生物身上。我不能就这样眼看着这些能量白白流失，要知道，我们只剩下四根巨柱了。\n\n你现在立刻转至东南方的崩裂碎片，并寻找那些源血元素。\n\n找到它们之后，先将其杀死，然后对它们的残骸使用这颗宝钻，回收它们释放出来的能量。在一切都结束之后，我们还要用这些能量来抚平大地的创伤。",dEN="The Lifeblood Pillar was toppled over with great force, sending the very earth into an upheaval.\n\nThe elementals that wander the sundered shard carry with them the very life essence that gave the pillar its strength. I cannot allow this energy to be wasted, for only four pillars remain.\n\nHead to the sundered shard, to the southeast, and seek the lifeblood elementals.\n\nUse this gem on their remains to recover their rampant energy. We'll need the energy to heal the land when all this is over.",o="弗蕾亚的化身要求你转至东南方的崩裂碎片，消灭8只源血元素，然后对它们的躯体使用源血宝钻。",oEN="The Avatar of Freya wants you to go to the Sundered Shard to the southeast and use the Lifeforce Gem on 8 destroyed Lifeblood Elementals.",p="你回收那些元素的能量了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you recovered the elementals' energy, <name>?",c="我感谢你，<name>。那根巨柱倒塌实在可惜，但我们必须尽力抢救一切。",cEN="I thank you, <name>. It is a shame that the pillar has fallen, but we must salvage what we can."}
Q[12806]={d="有些人或许会说，我们最重要的使命并不是消灭巫妖王，而是彻底毁灭血色先锋军。我对此的评论是：十分愚蠢，可惜我却无力决定或改变这些。\n\n这里西南方，有一处可以俯瞰大海的悬崖，叫作死亡高地。你立刻去那里找到高级指挥官埃雷特，那家伙全权负责消灭先锋军的行动。\n\n<男爵清了清嗓子。>\n\n你要立刻全速赶到那边，并向他报到。他特地点名要求你去协助他。",dEN="Some would say that our most critical mission lies not with the Lich King, but with the utter destruction of the Scarlet Onslaught. I would say that is foolish, but who am I to judge?\n\nDeath's Rise is far to the southwest, overlooking the sea along the cliff wall. There you will find Lord-Commander Arete personally overseeing the Onslaught's destruction himself.\n\n<The baron clears his throat.>\n\nDo see to it that you report to him with all due haste. He asked for you personally.",o="向死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特报到。",oEN="Report to Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise in Icecrown.",c="该死的，也差不多是时候了吧！想必斯利文男爵一定是慢吞吞的派你过来找我。\n\n我真该把他肩膀上的空白军徽给拔掉！",cEN="It's about damned time! No doubt that Baron Sliver took his sweet time in sending you to me.\n\nI should have that empty space above his shoulders removed!"}
Q[12807]={d="我们有很多事要做，但首先我想温习一下旧事会不错。\n\n我们死亡骑士和我们的血色朋友有着一段色彩斑斓的过往。那些白痴就舒舒服服地待在我们西北方下面的港口里。\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;听一段长篇大论，再来和我谈谈，我会为你指点迷津。",dEN="We have much to do, but first I believe a short refresher is in order.\n\nWe death knights have a colorful past with our Scarlet friends who idiotically rest comfortably in the harbor below us to the northwest.\n\nWhen you are ready for an earful, speak with me again and I shall provide enlightenment.",o="聆听死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特讲述的故事。",oEN="Listen to Lord-Commander Arete's tale at Death's Rise.",c="银色北伐军愚蠢地忽视血色先锋军的存在——我们可不会这么做的。\n\n我们不指望他们能否在对抗巫妖王的战争中派上用场，我们不相信他们有资格存在。我们将会是他们的末日，将他们一次解决！",cEN="In their folly, the Argent Crusade has chosen to turn a blind eye upon the presence of the Scarlet Onslaught. We will not.\n\nWe do not care if they might assist in the battle against the Lich King. We do not believe them worthy of existence. We will be their end, once and for all!"}
Q[12810]={d="先锋军港口的狮鹫骑士严密地掩护着他们的地面部队，你需要一匹飞行座骑才能把他们都打下来。不过首先，我们得收集到足够的材料来引导仪式，制造出你所需的飞行座骑。\n\n这个仪式必须要用到大量的鲜血。\n\n<说着，指挥官向西北方指了指。>\n\n若是说血的话，那边的港口里难道不就有无数吗……我是指鲨鱼。在把这个气泡装满它们的血之前不要回来。",dEN="The forces at Onslaught Harbor are heavily reinforced by gryphon riders. You need a mount that will enable you to put them down. But first, we need the components for the ritual that is going to make it all happen.\n\nA great deal of blood is necessary for the ritual to be undertaken.\n\n<The lord-commander points down and to the northwest.>\n\nThere is a readily available supply down there in the harbor... sharks. Do not return to me until you've filled this bladder with their blood.",o="死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特要求你用10只饥饿的巨鲨的血装满血囊。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise wants you to fill the Gore Bladder with the blood of 10 Ravenous Jaws.",p="这活儿不光鲜，但必须有人做。\n\n那么，你还没做完，为什么我们又说起话来了，<class>？",pEN="It's not glamorous work, but it is necessary.\n\nNow why is it that we are talking again before you are done, <class>?",c="干得好。稍待一下，等你身上的海水干了我们再继续。",cEN="Well done. Take a moment to let the saltwater dry from your skin before we continue."}
Q[12813]={d="我们的指挥官大人真是太善良……太慷慨了。相比于人见人爱花见花开、到处撒播阳光的他，我的内心深处充满了阴暗的东西，比如仇恨什么的。\n\n在我看来，光是终结他们那悲惨的生命是不够的，远远不够！我还要让他们承受无尽的屈辱！\n\n你想想，有什么能比沦落成你最仇恨最厌恶的事物更令人难以忍受的呢？你的一生都是为了消灭某些东西而存在，可到头来你却变成了它们？\n\n多可悲啊。\n\n带着这些药剂转至西北方的先锋军港口，把它倒在先锋军士兵的尸体上，看看有什么效果。不过，注意避开大教堂。",dEN="How kind... how generous our lord-commander is. Where he is flowers and sunshine, I am filled only with hatred.\n\nIt is not enough to end their miserable lives... I want them humiliated... debased!\n\nWhat could be more unspeakable than to be turned into that which you hate? To dedicate your existence to eradicating a thing, and then in the end to become it?\n\nHow sad.\n\nTake this tincture northwest to Onslaught Harbor. Apply it to their still corpses and watch what happens, but avoid the cathedral.",o="死亡高地的希塔尔·达克门德给了你一份达克门德的药剂，并要求你对先锋军港口一带的任意10具血色先锋军成员的尸体使用它。",oEN="Setaal Darkmender at Death's Rise has given you the Darkmender's Tincture. Apply it to the corpses of 10 of any of the Scarlet Onslaught units found at Onslaught Harbor.",p="想必你没那么快完成吧？",pEN="Surely you're not done so soon?",c="<德莱尼死亡骑士用冰冷的眼神盯着你看。她的眼神和墓穴一样死气沉沉。一丝狡猾的微笑爬上她的脸颊。>\n\n我明天还会准备好更多的药剂。在那之前，好好保重吧。",cEN="<The draenei death knight fixes you with a cold stare, her eyes dead as the grave. A sly grin creeps across her features.>\n\nI'll have more of the tincture prepared tomorrow. Until then, be well."}
Q[12814]={d="你说，能有什么事比起利用他们自己的狮鹫来对付他们更加令人愉快呢？立刻前往先锋军港口，随便干掉哪个倒霉的狮鹫骑士，从他手中抢过狮鹫的缰绳。\n\n然后，你直接回到这里来，把狮鹫交给乌佐·唤亡者。他会妥善地将那只狮鹫做一些改变，并让你骑着它执行下一步任务。",dEN="What could be more fitting than to take one of their own gryphons to use against them? Go to Onslaught Harbor and take the reins to one of their gryphons from the dead clutches of its rider.\n\nReturn with the gryphon, delivering it to Uzo Deathcaller. He will see to its proper transformation and provide you with further instructions.",o="将一只先锋军狮鹫交给死亡高地的乌佐·唤亡者。",oEN="Deliver an Onslaught Gryphon to Uzo Deathcaller at Death's Rise.",p="为什么花了那么久？他们的狮鹫速度很慢吗？我们可得想点办法才行！",pEN="What took so long? Are their gryphons slow? We'll have to do something about that.",c="喔，太好了，这一定很棒！\n\n往后面站……我要举行重塑狮鹫的仪式了！",cEN="Oh yeah this is gonna be good!\n\nStand back... I'm gonna call down the wrath of the blood ritual!"}
Q[12815]={d="既然你有了自己的骨制狮鹫，我要你每天带它回到下面，在先锋军港口上空建立一个禁飞区。\n\n我得承认，伙计，我不太在乎你用不用骨制狮鹫去杀那些狮鹫骑士。不过我猜如果你用了，接近他们会容易得多。\n\n此外，它还有不少很棒的招数可以用。 $g承认:承认;",dEN="Now that you got your bone gryphon, I wantcha to take it back down there everyday and make a no fly zone over Onslaught Harbor.\n\nI gotta admit, mon, I don't really care if you use the bone gryphon to kill them gryphon riders or not. But I'm guessin' that if you do, you'll find it much easier to get to 'em.\n\nBesides, it's got lots of neat tricks you can use.",o="死亡高地的乌佐·唤亡者要求你杀死10名先锋军狮鹫骑士。",oEN="Uzo Deathcaller at Death's Rise wants you to kill 10 Onslaught Gryphon Riders.",p="你这么快回来做什么？我还看到那些先锋军的小子在下面飞来飞去哪！",pEN="What you back so soon for? I know I can still see those Onslaught boys still flyin' around down there!",c="这就对了！而且你要知道，我们每天都需要有人做这项工作。\n\n希望你明天还会回来。你的白骨狮鹫会等着你。",cEN="That's the spirit! And you know, I need this done everyday that we're here.\n\nI hope you'll come back again tomorrow. Your bone gryphon will be waitin'."}
Q[12816]={d="巫妖王的部队已经在我们鼻子底下扎了营，我们可不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫银月城的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend Silvermoon from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从银月城外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查天灾营地附近的发光符文法阵。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside Silvermoon and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment.",p="你调查过入侵行动了吗？没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Have you investigated the invasion yet? There's no time for dawdling!",c="嗯。从你告诉我的事情，法阵里的声音……它们一定是被用来做为某种沟通的工具。我一想到那些邪恶的脑袋会通过这样的魔法联系就不寒而栗。无论如何，你看起来还是很健全很清醒。银色黎明感谢你的努力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[12817]={d="巫妖王的部队已经在我们鼻子底下扎了营，我们可不能坐以待毙！你会拿起武器跟这些可憎的入侵者作战，保卫埃索达的吧？\n\n城外出现了奇怪的符文法阵，它散发着神秘的能量，亡灵和悬浮在半空的浮空城也被同样的能量环绕着。我想这个符文法阵对天灾士兵们必然有着重要的意义，因此想让你调查此事。去和城外的亡灵作战吧，带回你杀死他们的证据，以及你的调查结果，我会奖励你的。去吧！",dEN="The Lich King has sent his undead upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend the Exodar from these accursed invaders?\n\nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you. Go!",o="从埃索达外面的天灾士兵身上收集3块暗淡的死灵石，并调查天灾营地附近的发光符文法阵。然后向克雷格尔上尉复命。",oEN="Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside the Exodar and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment. Then return to Lieutenant Kregor.",p="你调查过入侵行动了吗？没有时间可以浪费了！",pEN="Have you investigated the invasion yet? There's no time for dawdling!",c="嗯。从你告诉我的事情，法阵里的声音……它们一定是被用来做为某种沟通的工具。我一想到那些邪恶的脑袋会通过这样的魔法联系就不寒而栗。无论如何，你看起来还是很健全很清醒。银色黎明感谢你的努力。",cEN="Hmm. From what you've told me, the voices within the circles... they must be used for communication of some kind. I shudder to think what unnatural minds are contacted through such magic. Regardless, you seem to have emerged whole and sane. The Argent Dawn appreciates your service."}
Q[12818]={d="我们还是来谈正事吧……莉吉特要我组装一些威力更大的地雷，但我手里的零件不多了。\n\n镇子的西边有一堆火箭车的残骸，那是我们最后一辆火箭车……莉吉特在给它加油的时候有点过于激动了，不过我觉得我似乎不应该把喷嘴直接装在排气设备上。所以说活到老学到老，不是吗？\n\n在撞坏的火箭车周围肯定散落着大量零件……你不如去把那些杂七杂八的麻烦鬼赶走，给我收集一些零件回来？",dEN="To the point... Ricket's asked me to put together some stronger land mines, but I'm running low on parts.\n\nJust west of town, you'll find the remains of our last rocket sled... Ricket got a little excited when she was fueling it, but I probably should have thought to not put the nozzle right over the exhaust. Live and learn, eh?\n\nThere should be a good stock of spare parts scattered around the destroyed sled... why don't you go ahead and chase off those scavengers and nab me some of that wreckage?",o="K3的基尔·斯巴索克需要10份烧焦的零件。",oEN="Jeer Sparksocket at K3 would like 10 pieces of Charred Wreckage.",p="我们需要一些可以用来加热引擎来对抗这酷寒的东西……快想啊基尔，快想！\n\n哦嗨！你替我找到残骸上的零件了吗？",pEN="We have to have something we can use to insulate our engines against this cold... think, Jeer, think!\n\nOh hey! Did you get some of that wreckage for me?",c="这些就可以了，谢啦！\n\n你有在那里看到迪姆吗？我之前派了他过去，但他再也没回来过。我希望他没事。\n\n说到这个……我很好奇詹克斯到哪去了……",cEN="These will do nicely, thanks!\n\nDid you happen to see Dim out there? I sent him out a long while back and he never came back. I hope he's alright.\n\nSpeaking of which... I wonder where Janks is..."}
Q[12819]={d="该死的！我的工具呢？刚才还放在这儿的。\n\n噢！我可能在安放地雷的时候把它们忘在西边了。这可有点麻烦。如果你能帮我把它们拿回来，我会非常感激你的。但你可能需要留神脚下……你应该可以沿着我离开的路进去。\n\n哦，不要试图飞进去……我当时灵机一动，在那里安装了专门对付飞行物体的炮台，而且它们是不能辨别目标的。",dEN="Blast it! Where are my tools? I had them here just a moment ago.\n\nOh! I probably forgot them when I was setting up that minefield in the west. That's mildly inconvenient. I'd be quite appreciative if you could go get them for me. You'll need to watch your step though... you should be able to use the same path that I did to get out.\n\nOh, and don't try to fly in... I had the presence of mind to set up turrets to shoot down anything that might fly, and they aren't very discerning in who they target.",o="K3的基尔·斯巴索克要你进入雷区，取回斯巴索克的工具。",oEN="Jeer Sparksocket at K3 would like Sparksocket's Tools retrieved from his minefield.",p="如果詹克斯在这儿的话，我只要派他去跑这腿就好了。噢……再想一想……我也不太确定我告诉他安全的路径怎么走了。\n\n幸亏有很多你们这种冒险者在这附近，嗯？",pEN="If Janks were here, I could have just sent him on this errand. Oh... on second thought... I'm not sure I told him where the safe path is anyway.\n\nGood thing I have you resourceful adventure types around, eh?",c="哈哈！就是它！真谢谢你。我希望你在穿越雷区的时候不算太困扰。",cEN="Ha ha! These are them! Thank you kindly. I hope you didn't have too much trouble traversing the field."}
Q[12820]={d="我等这些地雷已经等了一万年了！好吧，至少有好几天了。他怎么花了这么长时间？\n\n这个地方非常下等……到处都是恶心的猛犸人——你知道啦，他们体格很大，毛茸茸的，还非常丑陋——而且他们似乎非常狂热地想要霸占K3。\n\n但这是不可能的。\n\n我们已经在东北方的必经之路上设置了防御工事。可惜的是，我们的激光炮台能量供应有限……所以就要用到这些地雷了！去把他们都炸上天！",dEN="I've been waiting an eternity for these mines! Well, a few days at least. What took him so long?\n\nHere's the low down, compadre... there's this nasty bunch of magnataur--you know, big, hairy, and extremely ugly--and they seem pretty keen on taking K3 for themselves.\n\nNot going to happen.\n\nWe've got some defenses set up in their path, northeast of here. Sadly, our laser turrets have pretty limited power supplies... that's where these mines come in! Get over there and blow them up good!",o="K3的莉吉特要求你转至加姆雷区，使用改进型地雷杀死12个从加姆方向冲过来的敌人。加姆入侵者和雪盲追随者都算数。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to use Improved Land Mines at Garm's Bane to fend off 12 attackers from Garm. Both Garm Invaders and Snowblind Followers will count towards this goal.",p="我希望你也有顺便宰掉一些恶心的小狗头人，嗯？",pEN="You got some of their gross little snobold buddies too I hope?",c="于是……我就坐在这里，沉浸在我自己的伟大之中，然后我听到远方传来一声——啪！然后又一声——轰！再十几声！然后想到那些热切奔向死亡的猛玛象和狗头人，我的脸上就浮现了一丝微笑。\n\n那是不是很精彩呀？",cEN="So... here I sat, basking in the awesomeness that is me, and in the distance, I hear a pop! Then another! Then a dozen more! And a smile crept onto my face at the thought of all those magnataur and snobolds eagerly rushing to their own deaths.\n\nWas it glorious?"}
Q[12821]={d="爆破小队已经就绪！意思是该找点乐子了，$g亲爱的:亲爱的;！\n\n只有一件事妨碍我们对加尔姆发动全面进攻！我派了一名传令兵在加尔姆后方架设传送器——顺便说一句，很成功——他回来取传送器运行所需的能量电池。可它还没运作……也就是说能量电池没送到。\n\n我需要你穿过加尔姆之祸，找到那块能量电池。用它激活加尔姆那边、加尔姆高地的传送器。",dEN="The sapper squad is ready. That means it's fun time, my dear!\n\nThere's only one thing holding us up from our full-scale assault on Garm! I sent a runner to set a teleporter up behind Garm--successfully I might add--and he returned to get the power cell it needs to function. It isn't working yet... which means the power cell didn't get there.\n\nI need you to look just on the other side of Garm's Bane for the power cell. When you find it, bring it farther east to Garm's Rise and activate the teleporter.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去找到传送器能量晶格，并用它引导加姆高地的传送器。",oEN="Ricket at K3 would like you to locate the Transporter Power Cell and use it to activate the Transportation Pad at Garm's Rise.",p="就算是猛犸人也该知道不要惹地精。",pEN="Even magnataur should know not to mess with goblins.",c="太棒了！\n\n<莉吉特脸上浮现一副凶狠的笑容。>\n\n让毁灭降临吧！",cEN="Excellent!\n\n<A fierce grin creeps onto Ricket's face.>\n\nLet the destruction begin!"}
Q[12822]={d="既然传送器已经打开，我的计划相当复杂……它有好几个阶段，需要完美的配合。还要筹集补给！还要招募部队！而且多半得花上好几周的苦工！\n\n哈哈，有那么一瞬间你真信了，对吧？这事儿归你了，$g小子:丫头;。穿过传送器，把战斗带到他们那里去！我们的爆破手会支援你……他们无处可逃。",dEN="Now that we have the teleporter open, my plan is quite complex... it has several facets and will take impeccable coordination. And there are supplies to be gathered! And troops to recruit! Likely, weeks of hard labor as well!\n\nHahah, I had you going there for a moment, didn't I? You've got this, kid. Hop through the teleporter and take the fight to them! Our sappers will back you up... they won't have anywhere to run.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去杀死6个加姆观察者和8个雪盲信徒。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to kill 6 Garm Watchers and 8 Snowblind Devotees.",p="没有什么比地精工兵更能直接对敌人造成恐慌的啦！",pEN="Nothing strikes fear into the enemy quite like a goblin sapper!",c="哈哈！这可给那些浪费我们时间的笨蛋上了一课。从今天开始，绿色的皮肤会让所有的猛犸人打从心底恐惧！",cEN="Haha! That'll teach those brutes to waste our time. From this day forth, green skin will strike fear into the hearts of all magnataur!"}
Q[12823]={d="嘿，你！我猜你是来参加战斗的吧？\n\n我要交给你一项特殊任务……我们要把整个洞穴炸塌！到他们的洞穴顶部去，你可以找到霜胆的祭坛。悄悄靠近祭坛，把这只重磅炸药包放在祭坛附近。\n\n放好炸弹之后，你就在一边等着，确定塔尔玛·霜胆碰到炸弹之后再迅速离开！没人知道那玩意爆炸以后，这座洞穴还能支撑多久！",dEN="Hey there! Joining us for the assault I assume?\n\nI've got a special task for you... we're going to bring the whole cave down on their heads! Towards the back of their cave, you should find Frostgut's Altar. Sneak up and plant this hardpacked explosive bundle somewhere close to it.\n\nOnce the charge is placed, stick around just long enough to make sure Frostgut bites it, then get out quickly! There's no knowing how long the cave will last once that thing goes off!",o="加姆高地的吉诺要你把重磅炸药包偷偷放到霜胆的祭坛附近，炸死塔尔玛·霜胆，然后在洞穴坍塌前逃出来。",oEN="Gino at Garm's Rise wants you to plant the Hardpacked Explosive Bundle near Frostgut's Altar, kill Tormar Frostgut, and then escape the cave before it collapses on you.",p="这个盒装爆裂物可是我的宝贝……花了我好几周的时间才做到完美。好几周！\n\n那可是很长一段时间……好吧。",pEN="That explosive bundle is my baby... it took me weeks to perfect it. WEEKS!\n\nThat's a long time... okay.",c="整座山都在摇晃！一定很灿烂吧？我想一定是！怎么可能不灿烂呢？\n\n发明家协会还说我的东西都只会爆炸。该死的，他们还真说对了！哈！",cEN="The whole mountain shook! Was it gorgeous? I bet it was! How could it not be?\n\nAnd the Inventor's League tells me all of my inventions just blow up. Darn right they do! Hah!"}
Q[12824]={d="你腿脚真快，$g小子:丫头;！谢谢你帮我们处理炸药……我早就想好好试试那项发明了！\n\n去告诉里基特，猛犸人那边应该已经搞定了……剩下的坏蛋我的爆破手会清理掉。\n\n再次感谢！",dEN="You've got some swift feet on you sonny! Thanks for lending a hand with those explosives... I've been waiting to give that invention a good test run for a while!\n\nGo ahead and tell Ricket we should be covered on the magnataur front now... my sappers will clean up any of the remaining baddies.\n\nThanks again!",o="回K3向莉吉特复命。",oEN="Return to Ricket at K3.",c="你把那地方全炸了？干得好！我打赌里奥看了会乐不可支。\n\n我们真的很感激你给我们的一切帮助，<name>。来点纪念品犒劳你的辛苦怎么样？",cEN="You blew the whole place up? Way to go! I bet Rio got a kick out of that.\n\nWe really appreciate all of the help you've lent us, <name>. How bout a souvenir for your troubles?"}
Q[12826]={d="看着真不错！\n\n不，不是说你——是我的新地雷。你有点$g自以为是:自以为是;，不是吗？而我呢，我可是绝对的天才！我的才智无人能及。\n\n我们刚才在说什么？哦对了，我的新地雷！全新升级版……随时可用于里基特想出的任何卑劣用途。\n\n做个$g好小伙:好姑娘;，把它们交给里基特，好吗？她就在那边……我保证这段旅程相当史诗。不过小心点，她有点疯疯癫癫的。",dEN="Looking good!\n\nNo, not you - my new mines. You're just a little full of yourself, aren't you? I, on the other hand, am absolutely brilliant! My intellect cannot be matched.\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes, my new mines! New and improved... ready for whatever devious use Ricket has concocted.\n\nBe a <good lad/doll> and go hand them off to Ricket, will you? She's right over there... it should be quite the epic journey, I'm sure. Be careful though, she's a little loopy.",o="把基尔的改进型地雷交给K3的莉吉特。",oEN="Deliver Jeer's Improved Land Mines to Ricket in K3.",p="基尔做好地雷了？好家伙。",pEN="Jeer finished the mines? Dandy.",c="嗯，你不觉得这是你看过的最可爱的毁灭包裹吗？",cEN="Well, aren't these just the cutest little packets of destruction you've ever seen?!"}
Q[12827]={d="嘿！你是张新面孔！愿意帮里基特一把吗？\n\n我们遇到个有点意外的问题——食物短缺。我知道，我知道……我们本该预见到的，你不明白。我们这儿有爆破小队什么的，周转一向很快，所以通常不用担心长期口粮。可咱们的老 K3 现在出名了。\n\n方便的解决办法？西边有豺狼人营地，还有些豺狼人像它们一贯那样散落在各处翻垃圾。去抢些他们的口粮回来怎么样？ $g小子:丫头;",dEN="Hey hey! You're a new face! Care to lend Ricket a hand?\n\nWe have a somewhat unexpected problem - food shortage. I know, I know... we should have seen that coming, but you don't get it. We tend to have somewhat of a quick turn-around here with our sapper squad and all, so usually we don't have to worry about long term eats. Good old K3's gotten popular though.\n\nConvenient solution? There are gnoll camps to the west and some gnolls scattered, scavenging as gnolls do. Care to go nab some of their rations?",o="K3的莉吉特想让你从附近的野蛮岭豺狼人那里夺取16份豺狼人的干粮。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to repossess 16 Dried Gnoll Rations from the nearby Savage Hill Gnolls.",p="嘿你又来啦！我肚子在叫……进行的如何？",pEN="Hey there again! My belly's rumbling... how'd it go?",c="我希望他们分享财富的时候能少点犹豫。我们至今对他们捡垃圾的行为都很容忍。",cEN="I hope they weren't too hesitant to share the wealth. We've been pretty forgiving with them picking through our leftovers thus far."}
Q[12828]={d="哇！真恶心。且不说豺狼人的口味如何，但我还以为它们的东西至少应该是……可以吃的东西吧。\n\n我们得想一些更有创意的点子。\n\n这样，托莉在镇子北边部署了一台炸弹储备机……离那个大洞穴的入口不远，你一定不会找不到的。我估计她是想要用炸药进行挖掘工作之类的，但我有一个更好的主意。\n\n你去拿一颗炸弹，把它扔向附近的某一头猛犸象……它们大部分都在西边活动。把它们的肉给我拿回来。",dEN="Wow! That stuff is nasty. Not to account for gnoll taste or anything, but I figured whatever they had would at least be... edible?\n\nLet's get more creative.\n\nTore's got an explosive dispenser north of town... not far from the big cavern entrance, can't miss it. I'm sure she intends them for mining purposes of some sort, but I've got a better idea.\n\nGrab one of those things and rush it to one of the nearby mammoths... most of them are to the west. Collect the meat, bring it back.",o="K3的莉吉特要你去拿取一颗D16限时炸弹，用它炸翻一头猛犸象，然后收集8块巨大的猛犸肉。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to retrieve a U.D.E.D, use it to blow up a mammoth, and retrieve 8 Hearty Mammoth Meat.",p="我知道我的计划很棒。别担心啦。\n\n跟大人物相处的感觉怎么样？蛮刺激的对吧？",pEN="I know my plan was brilliant. Don't even worry about it.\n\nDoes it feel good to be in the presence of greatness? A little tingly maybe?",c="都已经全熟啦！我自己改天也来做做看。\n\n谢啦，朋友！",cEN="And it's already well-done! I outdo myself sometimes.\n\nThanks much, friend!"}
Q[12829]={d="你好呀！我叫托莉，是K3的矿业部门的负责人……或者说很快就是了！\n\n这个洞穴里到处都是恶心的蜘蛛。我觉得，在我们进去之前，应该先除掉一些蜘蛛，你说呢？",dEN="Hiya! The name's Tore. I head up the mining operation here at K3... or I will shortly anyway!\n\nThis here cave is full of creepy-crawlies. I think we could do with a few less spiders before we move in - what'd you think?",o="水晶蛛网洞穴外的托莉·兰波维奇要你杀死12只水晶蛛网蜘蛛。",oEN="Tore Rumblewrench outside of Crystalweb Cavern wants you to kill 12 Crystalweb Spiders.",p="小心那些炸弹配给器！那些东西很危险的。",pEN="Be careful near that dispenser! Those things are dangerous.",c="哈哈！很高兴看到你负责处理这些烂工作。\n\n感谢你啊，伙计！",cEN="Ha ha! Good to see you're up for some dirty work.\n\nMuch appreciated there, pal!"}
Q[12830]={d="可以进去啦！\n\n我们刚刚抵达这里的时候，洞里有一些狗头人……但它们在挖矿的时候似乎遇到了某些不幸的事。不过影响不大，我们很快就控制了局面。\n\n我派了几个矿工进去找一些矿石样本，好让我可以调整机器继续前进，但他们一直都没回来。\n\n你能进去帮我拿些样本回来吗？里面的狗头人可能随身带着矿石，不过我猜它们差不多都死光了。",dEN="We're moving in!\n\nThere were some snobolds here when we arrived... their mining operation seems to have met some unfortunate happenings though. Doesn't much matter - we were taking over soon anyway.\n\nI sent some of our miners in there to get me some ore samples that I can use to calibrate our machines for processing, but they haven't come back.\n\nMind going in there and nabbing some samples for me in their stead? The snobolds probably have some on them, though I'd expect most of them are dead by now.",o="水晶蛛网洞穴外的托莉·兰波维奇要你去收集5份不纯的萨隆邪铁矿石。",oEN="Tore Rumblewrench outside of Crystalweb Cavern would like you to retrieve 5 samples of Impure Saronite Ore.",p="你替我弄到矿石没？",pEN="Ya have some ore for me?",c="喔！可真是臭啊！你不得已杀了些极地狗头人对吧？\n\n不过我倒是真的很感激你！",cEN="Woo! That's a ripe stench right there! You had to get hands-on with some of those snobolds, didn't ya?\n\nI do appreciate it though!"}
Q[12831]={d="呕……我的胃里好象装了个螺旋桨。\n\n我应该还能走动，但我被洞穴深处的什么东西给咬了，现在浑身都不舒服。那东西比其它蜘蛛都大……而且色彩非常鲜艳。\n\n莉吉特没准能帮我做出解毒剂来，但她肯定要用到咬我的那个东西身上的毒囊。你能帮我找到毒囊吗？我想托莉是不会进来的。\n\n我会在这里装死，希望它们别来碰我。",dEN="Oi... it's like there's a propeller in my stomach.\n\nI think I can walk, but I got something nasty in my system when I got bit by something in the back of the cave. It was bigger than the other spiders... and brightly colored.\n\nRicket can probably make me an antidote, but she'd need the venom sac from whatever bit me. Would you mind finding it for me? I don't think Tore's coming.\n\nI'll just pretend I'm dead here and hopefully they'll leave me alone.",o="水晶蛛网洞穴里的受伤的地精矿工希望你从冰尖爬行者身上找到一个冰尖毒囊。",oEN="An Injured Goblin Miner in Crystalweb Cavern wants you to bring back an Icetip Venom Sac from an Icetip Crawler.",p="<受伤的地精矿工痛苦地扭曲身子。>",pEN="<The Injured Goblin Miner writhes in pain.>",c="这应该行了……我希望莉吉特能替我调出点东西来。那么，准备好要离开这里了吗？",cEN="That should cut it... I hope Ricket can put something together for me. Ready to get out of there, then?"}
Q[12832]={d="呼，谢谢你！我还以为我肯定要成蜘蛛的点心了。不过也许我说得太早了——我们赶紧离开这鬼地方！\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;要走就马上告诉我……快点。",dEN="Oi - thank you! I thought for sure I'd just be a spider snack. Perhaps I'm speaking a bit soon though - let's get the heck out of here!\n\nLet me know as soon as you're ready to go... make it quick.",o="护送受伤的地精矿工离开水晶蛛网洞穴，然后与K3的莉吉特谈一谈。",oEN="Escort the Injured Goblin Miner out of Crystalweb Cavern and then speak to Ricket at K3.",p="我想洞窟里状况还不错吧？托尔对你好不好？",pEN="I take it that things went well at the cavern? Was Tore decent to you?",c="谢谢你帮忙救出我们的矿工，<name>！我应该能顺利配出解药。\n\n如果你再碰到托尔，替我告诉她，她是个混蛋，好吗？",cEN="Thanks for helping out our miner back there, <name>! I should be able to put together an antidote no problem.\n\nIf you stumble into Tore again, tell her that she's a jerk for me, will ya?"}
Q[12833]={d="嘿，你好啊！你怎么没有像其它冒险家那样逃走啊？嘿，你真是个讨人喜欢的家伙！我还以为自己身上有什么奇怪的味道呢！\n\n我们仍然需要你的帮忙，而你又正好有着丰富的经验。记得那些猛犸人吗？很显然，山洞并没有完全坍塌……仍然有很多猛犸人活了下来。还有很多需要我们操心的，是不是啊？\n\n幸运的是，基尔制作了足够多的地雷。就靠你了！",dEN="Hey there again! You didn't run off like all the other adventurers did? Well, you're just a peach, aren't ya? I was beginning to think I smelled funny or something!\n\nWe could still use a bit of a hand around here, and you have just the right experience. Remember those magnataur? Well apparently the cave didn't completely collapse... there are still quite a few left. So much for Gino taking care of them, eh?\n\nFortunately, Jeer made way more than enough mines. You've got this!",o="K3的莉吉特要求你转至加姆雷区，使用改进型地雷杀死12个从加姆方向冲过来的敌人。加姆入侵者和雪盲追随者都算数。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to use Improved Land Mines at Garm's Bane to fend off the attackers from Garm. Both Garm Invaders and Snowblind Followers will count towards this goal.",p="磅！哈哈！",pEN="Boom! Ha ha!",c="我喜欢你。老实说，你酷毙了！\n\n为你欢呼！",cEN="I like you. In fact, you rock!\n\nYay for you!"}
Q[12836]={d="我知道正适合$g一个:一个;热心新手的活儿！我们有个豺狼人问题。你甚至可以说是一场豺狼人灾！那些讨厌的东西。它们越聚越多，现在还跑到我们门口偷零件！简直不可思议。\n\n这一切的根源就是它们那个狂妄的首领，扭皮。我要你解决那个\"根源\"。去西边雪盲丘陵他的营地拜访他一下。\n\n我说\"拜访他一下”，其实是\"痛苦地杀掉他”的委婉说法。行吗？行！",dEN="I know just the job for an eager newcomer! We've got a gnoll problem. You might even call it a gnoll infestation! Pesky things. They keep creeping up more and more, and now they're on our doorstep, stealing our parts! Inconceivable.\n\nIt all begins and ends with their uppity leader, Gnarlhide. I want you to see to that \"ends\" part. Go pay him a visit at his camp all the way to the west, in Snowblind Hills.\n\nAnd when I say \"pay him a visit,\" that's a euphemism for \"kill him painfully.\" Kay? Kay!",o="K3的莉吉特要你去杀死瘤皮。",oEN="Ricket at K3 wants you to kill Gnarlhide.",p="我喜欢莉吉特因为她这个人很妙！\n\n噢，你好啊，又见面了！你的害虫管控做的怎么样了？",pEN="I like Ricket cause she's sooo delicious!\n\nOh, hey there again! How goes the pest control?",c="太棒了！你就是我喜欢的那种<race>。",cEN="Groovy! You're my kind of <race>."}
Q[12838]={d="我希望能知道血色先锋军今天的行动计划，而你将是我达成此目标的工具。\n\n立刻飞到先锋军港口去，在他们的辎重箱里找到我要的文档。箱子应该是上了锁的，所以你要采取任何必需的手段，从血色先锋军成员身上抢到钥匙。",dEN="I need to know what the Scarlet Onslaught is planning today. You will be my instrument in this task.\n\nFly to Onslaught Harbor and rifle through their baggage trunks for documents. The trunks will be locked, so you'll have to take the keys from the Scarlet Onslaught members by whatever means.",o="死亡高地的奥卢克斯·邪鬃要求你去收集5份先锋军情报文档。",oEN="Aurochs Grimbane at Death's Rise wants you to collect 5 Onslaught Intel Documents.",p="你替我弄到那些情报了吗？",pEN="You have information for me?",c="交给我吧。我会筛检掉没用的情报，如果找出任何需要采取行动的数据，我会召唤你。\n\n无论如何，明天再过来一趟。他们是以每天改变行动方针闻名的。",cEN="Hand them over. I will sift through the useless ones and if there's anything actionable, I will call upon you.\n\nEither way, return tomorrow. It is well known that they change their plans on a daily basis."}
Q[12839]={d="一开始你以为这封信与其它的情报没什么不同。但在简略地阅览之后，你彻底打消了之前的想法，重视起这封信来。\n\n这封信中指出，巴利·韦斯温元帅当前就躲在这座岛屿上的某个地方，不过，他完全避开其它人，谨慎地掩饰着自己的行踪。他宣称，血色先锋军在不远的将来会消灭巫妖王，进而征服整个世界，让艾泽拉斯重获秩序。\n\n高级指挥官一定会对此很感兴趣。",dEN="At first this note looks like any of the other intel that you've been looking for. However, a quick perusal of its contents disabuses you of this notion.\n\nThe letter conveys that Grand Admiral Westwind is present somewhere on the island, but that he is keeping himself secluded for now. He speaks of a glorious day that is coming soon in which the Scarlet Onslaught will wash over first the Lich King and then the rest of world to finally bring order to Azeroth.\n\nThe lord-commander will want to see this!",o="将韦斯温元帅的便笺交给死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特。",oEN="Deliver the Note from the Grand Admiral to Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise.",p="血色先锋军情报应该要送去给奥卢克斯才对。\n\n<高级指挥官用一种想打发你走的表情看着你。>",pEN="Scarlet Onslaught intel is to be delivered to Aurochs Grimbane.\n\n<The lord-commander gives you an expectant look by way of a dismissal.>",c="韦斯温写的信笺？你为什么不早讲呢？\n\n<埃雷特从你手中把信抢去阅读。>\n\n这个蠢蛋！他真的在这儿？！\n\n<高级指挥官大笑。>\n\n这是全新的情报。我很好奇他是如何幻想要在打倒巫妖王之后征服世界的呢？就算是他，也没办法在自己脑中完成这两个疯狂想象的任何一个吧。",cEN="A note written by Westwind? Why didn't you say so?\n\n<Arete tears the letter from your hand to read it.>\n\nThe fool! He's actually here?!\n\n<The lord-commander laughs.>\n\nThis is new information. I wonder how he imagines that he's going to conquer the world once he's taken down the Lich King? Not that he could accomplish either task in his wildest imaginings."}
Q[12840]={d="先锋军港口内停泊着不少血色先锋军的战舰，这些战舰的船长们恐怕是最了解元帅行踪的人。\n\n<高级指挥官搓了搓双手，继续推理着。>\n\n在我印象中，那两个船长……是叫维辛顿和哈弗德吧。去拷打他们，逼问出这条重要的情报，然后结束他们那悲惨的生命。\n\n我必须弄清楚这个韦斯温元帅到底躲在哪儿！",dEN="If anyone knows where the admiral is, then surely it must be his captains on the ships in Onslaught Harbor.\n\n<The lord-commander rubs his hands together.>\n\nWelsington and Hartford are their names if memory serves. Go beat the information out of them and then end their miserable lives.\n\nI want to know where the grand admiral is hidden!",o="死亡高地的高级指挥官埃雷特要求你拷打维辛顿船长和哈弗德船长，并从他们口中得到情报。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete at Death's Rise wants you to beat information out of Captains Welsington and Hartford.",p="海军上将韦斯温在哪？",pEN="Where is Grand Admiral Westwind?",c="他们把兰德雷复活了？兰德雷就是知道海军元帅所在之处的人！",cEN="They resurrected Landgren? He's the one that will know where the grand admiral is then!"}
Q[12841]={d="是的，你一定是在找那个绿皮肤囚犯……也许我们可以互相帮助。\n\n你没法用武力把那个地精弄出去。至少活的弄不出去。\n\n在我的族人中，我被称为伊尔克文，一名幻象师。如你所见，海德尼尔人把我变成了囚犯。\n\n如果我的符文还在，我就能让你在他们中间$g不被发现:不被发现;。往里面走，在矿场巡逻的，你会找到一位叫希拉的监工。我的符文在她那里。取回来，我们再谈。",dEN="Yes, it must be the green-skinned prisoner you're after... We might be able to help each other.\n\nYou're not going to get the goblin out of here by force. Not alive, anyway.\n\nAmong my people I am known as a Yrkvinn, a practitioner of illusions. As you can see, the Hyldnir have made me their prisoner.\n\nIf I had my runes, I could make you go unnoticed among them. Further inside, patrolling the mines, you'll find an overseer named Syra. She has my runes. Retrieve them and we'll talk some more.",o="荒弃矿洞的女巫洛莉拉要求你从监督者希尔拉手中夺回伊克芬符文。",oEN="Lok'lira the Crone inside the Forlorn Mine wants you to retrieve the Runes of the Yrkvinn from Overseer Syra.",p="我的符文，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="My runes, <name>? Do you have them?",c="我以为你回不来了。我不敢去想象如果我再待下去会怎样。",cEN="I wasn't sure you were coming back. I dread to think what will happen to me if I stay here for much longer."}
Q[12842]={d="战争的烙印早已不可磨灭地蚀刻在了你灵魂的深处，死亡骑士。现在你已经学会了符文熔铸这项高深的黑暗艺术，有了它，你就可以把令人敬畏而恐惧的符文之力封印在武器中。\n\n现在我们必须立刻开始进行战争的准备了。回到阿彻鲁斯之心的符文熔炉边上去，利用符文熔铸技能，为你的武器附着符文之力！\n\n当你的利刃上真正流淌起黑暗的力量时，回来向我复命！",dEN="The mark of war is etched indelibly upon your soul, death knight. You have learned the dark art of runeforging and with it you will engrave runes of power upon your weaponry.\n\nPreparations for battle must be made. Return to one of the runeforges, here in the Heart of Acherus, and use the power of runeforging to emblazon your weapon with a rune of power!\n\nReturn to me when your blade glows with dark energy!",o="黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯命令你使用“符文熔铸”能力为你的符文之剑附上任意一种由你选择的符文。\n\n只要在符文熔炉旁，你就可以随意替换附着在武器上的符文种类，无需消耗任何材料。",oEN="Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold has commanded you to use your Runeforging ability to engrave a rune [of your choosing] upon your Runed Soulblade.\n\nYou may freely replace the engraving upon your weapon at any time, so long as you are near a Runeforge.",p="别浪费时间，<name>。我们已经处在天启的边缘了！",pEN="Do not waste time, <name>. We are on the brink of apocalypse!",c="记住这些话，死亡骑士：符文熔炉是天灾军团的工具。它只存在于阿彻鲁斯、纳克萨玛斯和冰冠堡垒的核心！你只能在符文熔炉上为武器铭刻符文。\n\n经常回来，为你的所有武器铭刻符文。死亡骑士必须为一切敢于对抗<他/她>的事物做好准备！",cEN="Remember these words, death knight: The Runeforge is a Scourge instrument. It exists only in Acherus, Naxxramas and the heart of Icecrown! You may only emblazon your weaponry at a Runeforge.\n\nReturn often and emblazon all of your weapons. A death knight must be prepared for all that would dare oppose <him/her>!"}
Q[12843]={d="你一定要帮帮我们！我们受到袭击时正在往山里走，想要在山里建设一座中继塔。\n\n那些人看起来像维库人，但皮肤是蓝色的，上面还结着一层霜……而且都是女性！她们把队伍里的男子都抓走了，把我们这些女性都放了。求求你，$n！他们应该都被关在那个名叫希弗列尔达的村子里了，就在K3的上面。",dEN="You have to help us! We were in the middle of an expedition into the mountains to set up a transmission tower when we were attacked.\n\nThey looked like vrykul, except their skin was blue and layered with frost.... and they were all female! They took all the men in the expedition and let us women go. Please, <name>! We think they're being held in Sifreldar, the village overlooking K3.",o="格莱奇·菲兹巴克要你转至希弗列尔达村，救出5名地精囚犯。",oEN="Gretchen Fizzlespark wants you to go to Sifreldar Village and rescue 5 Goblin Prisoners.",p="你找到我们的人了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you find our men, <name>?",c="你办到了！我们的男孩子们都回来了！",cEN="You did it! Our boys are back!"}
Q[12844]={d="请你帮帮忙，$n。海德尼尔人在抓走队里的男子时，还把我们所有的设备都抢走了。当然，人能回来是最重要的，但是如果你能找到我们的设备，请顺便把它们拿回来，我们都会非常感激你的。\n\n她们的村子就在我们北边的高山上。",dEN="Please, <name>. When the Hyldnir took our men, they also took all our equipment. Of course, it's more important that we get our boys back, but if you run into any of our equipment, I'd really appreciate it if you brought it back to us.\n\nYou'll find their village just above us, to the north.",o="格莱奇·菲兹巴克要你转至K3北方的希弗列尔达村，找回8件K3设备。",oEN="Gretchen Fizzlespark wants you to obtain 8 pieces of K3 Equipment in Sifreldar Village north of K3.",p="我们的装备有消息了吗，<name>？",pEN="Any luck with our equipment, <name>?",c="谢谢你，<name>！我们看看能做些什么来修复这些零件！",cEN="Thanks, <name>! We'll see what we can do to salvage these parts!"}
Q[12846]={d="男孩子们都回来了……谢谢你，$n！好吧……其实还有一个没回来。\n\n按照其它人的说法，我的兄弟西弗仍然被困在那里。她们似乎是在强迫囚犯去什么矿洞里面干活。请你去那里看看能否发现什么线索。",dEN="All of our boys are back... thanks to you, <name>! Well... all but one.\n\nMy brother Zeev is still up there according to the others. Apparently they have some sort of mine where they make their prisoners work. Go in there and see if you can find out anything.",o="转至希弗列尔达村的北部，找到荒弃矿洞的入口，并寻找西弗·菲兹巴克的下落。",oEN="Find the entrance to the Forlorn Mine in northern Sifreldar Village and look for clues for Zeev Fizzlespark's whereabouts.",c="你一定不是跟海德尼尔一伙的……那么……你是来做什么的？啊……你一定是在找那个新囚犯！",cEN="You're definitely not with the Hyldnir... so what are you here for? Ah... you must be looking for the new prisoner!"}
Q[12847]={d="我的确听说过在他们的大教堂内有一位大主教，但我怎样也不会想到，他们竟然复活并晋升了兰德雷，这位大主教竟然就是他！大教堂有重兵守卫，而且只有一个入口，所以你需要一些帮助。\n\n我们现在仍然迫切地需要得知韦斯温元帅的位置，但我们要力求稳妥，不能有一丝冒险投机的心理！\n\n带上这个设备，它可以打开一道传送门，让我在你杀死大主教之后转至现场。\n\n到时候，我会亲自从他那卑微而懦弱的灵魂身上找到我想要的答案！我们一定会找到巴利·韦斯温元帅！",dEN="I'd heard they have an archbishop in their cathedral, but I had no idea that they'd resurrected and promoted Landgren! The Crimson Cathedral is heavily guarded with only one entrance, so you'll need help.\n\nWe still need to know where the grand admiral is, but this time we're not taking any chances!\n\nTake this device. It can be used to summon a gate for me to step through once you've killed the archbishop.\n\nI'll have my answers directly from his compelled soul! We will find Grand Admiral Westwind!",o="杀死大主教兰德雷，并在他的尸体旁召唤出埃雷特之门。等高级指挥官埃雷特从大主教的灵魂那里拷问出情报以后，在赤色大教堂内与他谈一谈。",oEN="Kill Archbishop Landgren and then summon Arete's Gate in the presence of his corpse. Speak with Lord-Commander Arete inside The Crimson Cathedral once he's completed his questioning of the archbishop's spirit.",p="嗯？",pEN="Yes?",c="海岛南面的隐藏洞窟。真是有趣。\n\n好吧，至少我现在知道我那些失踪的间谍都哪儿去了。",cEN="Hidden caves on the backside of the island. How very interesting.\n\nWell, at least now I know where all of my missing spies are."}
Q[12848]={d="无尽的痛苦很快就将占据你的身心，$c。你唯一的选择只有服从我的命令。\n\n现在我授予你救赎的钥匙。\n\n你看见那些被锁链锁在阿彻鲁斯之心的叛徒了吗？拿着这把钥匙，去释放一个叛徒，然后将其击败。胜利，将终结你的痛苦；失败，你将永远在痛苦中煎熬。\n\n选择权完全属于你。",dEN="The endless hunger will soon take hold of you, <class>. When it does, you will feel pain immeasurable. There is only one remedy for the suffering: the hunger must be sated.\n\nI give you the key to your salvation.\n\nChained to the Heart of Acherus are those deemed unworthy of the dark brotherhood. Use the key to free an unworthy initiate. Allow them to equip their gear and battle you for their freedom. Kill and the pain will cease. Fail and suffer for eternity.\n\nLive or die - the choice is yours to make.",o="黑锋要塞的教官拉苏维奥斯命令你释放一名黑锋叛徒，并击败他。\n\n不成功，则成仁。",oEN="Instructor Razuvious in Ebon Hold has commanded you to free an Unworthy Initiate and then kill the Unworthy Initiate in cold blood!\n\nIt's your life or theirs!",p="两条命，一把钥匙……别让我失望，<name>。",pEN="Two lives, one key... Do not fail me, <name>.",c="如我所料，我所选定的骑士凯旋归来！你已经准备好了，$N。",cEN="As expected, my chosen knight has triumphed! You are ready, <name>."}
Q[12849]={c="在指挥大厅里，你会找到血魄、冰霜、与秽邪的学院。每个学院都有一个训练师会提供你各种黑暗技艺的知识。\n\n我，索瓦尔领主，乃是血魄学院的院长。雅莉丝翠女士统领着秽邪学院，而大巫妖艾默萨札德，则支配着冰霜学院。\n\n当你获得力量之后必得立刻回来这里接受训练！",cEN="Within the Hall of Command you will find the schools of blood, frost and unholy. Each school has a trainer that can provide you with knowledge in the various dark arts.\n\nI, Lord Thorval, am the headmaster of the school of blood. Lady Alistra reigns over unholy and the arch-lich, Amal'thazad, holds dominion over frost.\n\nYou must return here whenever you gain power and train!"}
Q[12850]={d="天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔就在我们东南边的夹层上等着你。立刻去向他报到，并申请让他用天灾狮鹫将你送到下面的死亡裂口去。\n\n瓦拉纳王子应该在那里等着你呢。\n\n好好忍受你的痛苦吧，我的$g兄弟:姐妹！",dEN="Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the overhang located directly southeast of our current position. Report to Thalanor and requisition a Scourge gryphon to deliver you to Death's Breach.\n\nPrince Valanar will be waiting for you down below.\n\nSuffer well, <brother/sister>!",o="向黑锋要塞第一层展望台上的天灾指挥官萨拉诺尔报到。",oEN="Report to Scourge Commander Thalanor at the balcony on the first floor of Ebon Hold.",c="战争已经开始了，死亡骑士！我将让你搭乘我最好的狮鹫，并把你送往死亡裂口。混沌、死亡、毁灭！你将会成为这一切的先锋！",cEN="The war has begun, death knight! I shall place you upon my finest gryphon and deliver you to Death's Breach. Chaos, death, destruction! You will herald in all of this and more!"}
Q[12851]={d="真正的试炼在等着你，女人！\n\n你是想成为战士中的女王呢，还是想做一个拖着鼻涕的缝衣女工？\n\n只要尝试一下战斗的滋味，你就能知道答案了。\n\n或许你可以欺骗你的母亲、姐妹，甚至欺骗你自己，但战场总能让一个人的本性暴露无疑。\n\n一旦你做好准备，就骑上冰牙去参加战斗吧。你必须骑在它的背上，将死亡之雨倾泻到我们敌人的头上。",dEN="The test awaits, woman!\n\nDo you have the heart of a warrior queen? Or that of a sniveling seamstress?\n\nOne taste of war and you'll know the answer.\n\nYou might lie to your mother, your sisters, and even yourself, but the battlefield always exposes one's true nature.\n\nWhen you've made your preparations, mount Icefang and ride into battle. From her back, you must rain down a shower of death upon our enemy.",o="布伦希尔达村的布莉亚娜要求你骑着冰牙转至上古寒冬山谷，在那里射击7头冰霜座狼和15个冰霜巨人。",oEN="Brijana at Brunnhildar Village wants you to mount Icefang and shoot 7 Frostworgs and 15 Frost Giants in the Valley of Ancient Winters.",p="你在战斗中活下来了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you survived the battle, <name>?",c="也许你的确具备战士之心。\n\n时间将证明一切……",cEN="Perhaps you do have the heart of a warrior.\n\nTime will tell..."}
Q[12852]={d="阿比迪斯将军战死在新壁炉谷的时候，巴利·韦斯温元帅利用一种不能渗透的魔法屏障顺利地逃走了。\n\n我特别擅长让魔法失效。\n\n拿上这个，到隐蔽山洞去对付他。在他使用魔法屏障的时候使用这个东西。真希望能亲自去看看他届时会有什么表情啊……\n\n快去解决掉他之后。",dEN="When High General Abbendis was confronted at New Hearthglen, the grand admiral protected himself within an impenetrable sphere of magic before making his escape.\n\nI am particularly adept at nullifying magic.\n\nTake this to use against him inside The Hidden Hollow when he puts the sphere up. I wish that I could be there to see the look on his face when you do it.\n\nDeal with him.",o="高级指挥官埃雷特希望你去除掉巴利·韦斯温元帅。等你完成任务之后，回到死亡高地向他复命。",oEN="Lord-Commander Arete wants you to deal with Grand Admiral Westwind. Return to the lord-commander upon Death's Rise after you have done so.",c="玛尔加尼斯？！\n\n<大领主放声大笑。>\n\n那些蠢货又一次被恶魔骗了，如今他们已经完蛋了！\n\n我相信我最喜欢的<class>会多留一阵，帮我们了结剩下的那些吧？也许这些中的一件能说服你？",cEN="MAL'GANIS?!!\n\n<The lord-commander laughs with abandon.>\n\nThe fools were taken in by the demons yet again and now they are destroyed!\n\nI trust that my favorite <class> will stick around long enough to help us finish off the rest of them? Perhaps one of these would convince you?"}
Q[12853]={d="嘿，$g朋友:朋友;！\n\n你喜欢刺激和爆炸吗？！谁不喜欢呢？我知道一个正适合你的地方。在豪华的 K3，他们总是搞出新发明，找出让东西爆炸的全新方法！听着就很刺激，对吧？如果你想加入这场乐子，今天就去和杰尔·火花塞谈谈！\n\n强制免责声明：参与上述\"刺激\"可能需要体力劳动。",dEN="Hey there, pal!\n\nDo you like excitement and explosions?! Who doesn't? I know just the place for you. Down at luxurious K3, they're always making innovative inventions and finding all-new ways to make things blow up! Sounds thrilling, doesn't it? If you want to be part of the fun, head on down today and speak to Jeer Sparksocket!\n\nMandatory disclaimer: manual labor may be required to partake in previously indicated \"excitement.\"",o="转至风暴峭壁的K3，与基尔·斯巴索克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Jeer Sparksocket at K3 in the Storm Peaks.",c="欢迎来到 K3！\n\n我们来这里是为了打通前往那些山峰的路，分到那些了不起的泰坦机械的一份。不过这方面的进展相当有限。豺狼人、雪地狗头人、猛犸人……这里的麻烦源源不断……更别说我们似乎没法让任何飞行器在空中不冻住引擎。\n\n不过还有很多活要干——来搭把手？",cEN="Welcome to K3!\n\nWe came here to make our way into those peaks and get our fair share of some of those amazing titan machines. Progress on that end has been somewhat minimal, though. Gnolls, snobolds, magnataur... there's no shortage of trouble to go around... not to mention, we can't seem to keep any fliers in the air without their motors freezing.\n\nThere's plenty of work to be done though - lend a hand, eh?"}
Q[12854]={d="自从我们在灰熊丘陵发现布莱恩的日记之后，就很少得到与布莱恩相关的消息了。不过最近，在铁炉堡的探险者协会总部发现了一张神秘的便笺，谁也不知道这东西究竟是怎么来的。上面只是写着，我们必须转至布莱恩的营地与他碰面，并帮助他寻找某样东西。\n\n据我所知，他的营地应该就在这里的东北方，伯尔之息河的对面，泰坦之路的废墟附近。",dEN="After the discovery of Brann's journal in Grizzly Hills, we've only had one other communication from Brann. A mysterious note found its way to Explorers' League headquarters in Ironforge, with no indication of where it came from. All it said was that we're to meet Brann at his camp and help him with his search.\n\nFrom what I can tell, the camp should be located northeast of here, across the Bor's Breath River and at the foot of some ruins from the Path of the Titans.",o="在布莱恩的营地中找到用麻布裹起来的便笺，把它交给冰霜堡的考古学家安多林。",oEN="Retrieve the Burlap-Wrapped Note from Brann's camp and return it to Archaeologist Andorin at Frosthold.",p="你找到布莱恩的踪迹没？",pEN="Did you find Brann's camp?",c="<考古学家安多林满怀期望的看着你。>\n\n你应该要带布莱恩一起回来的，而不是只带张纸回来。发生了什么事？",cEN="<Archaeologist Andorin looks at you expectantly.>\n\nYou were supposed to come back with Brann, not a piece of paper. What's going on here?"}
Q[12855]={d="布莱恩在日记中暗示道，他将一包东西连同这本日记一起埋了起来。这些就是你能找到的所有线索吗？\n\n这样吧，霜脉矮人利用嗅觉敏锐的冰霜猎犬来跟踪猎物。我同意让你带上一只猎犬转至那座被毁坏的营地，让它闻闻布莱恩的气味。\n\n至少它能带你找到那些失踪的物品。如果运气够好的话，说不定还能找到布莱恩本人呢。",dEN="The tone of Brann's note suggests he meant to bury something with the note, maybe a pack of some kind. You're sure this was all you found?\n\nOkay, I'm going to have you take one of these frosthounds with you. The frostborn use them for tracking. Bring it to the destroyed camp and let it get Brann's scent.\n\nIt should at least lead you to the location of those missing possessions, and if we're lucky, Brann himself.",o="在被遗弃的营地使用冰霜猎犬的项圈，查明是谁偷走了布莱恩的物品。找到这些东西之后，使用通讯设备与你所联系到的人进行交流。",oEN="Use the Frosthound Collar at the Abandoned Camp to track down whoever took Brann's possessions. When you recover them, use the communication device and speak to whoever you can contact.",p="你是谁？",pEN="Who are you?",c="你……你不是探险者协会的一员，至少不是我记得的人。但是，如果你已经找回了通讯器，那么一定是他们派你来的。很好，我几乎就是在期望这样的情形。",cEN="You... you're not a member of the Explorers' League, at least not one I remember. But, if you recovered the communicator, they must've sent you. Good, that's almost what I was hoping for."}
Q[12856]={d="能战死沙场是我们的光荣，好姐妹。但是被冻成冰块并遭受无休止的耻笑并不光荣。\n\n你要飞往上古寒冬山谷的东边，进入冰霜巨人的城市——丹尼芬雷，解救一条被获取的始祖幼龙。有了它的帮助，你就可以把我们的姐妹从冰块里解救出来，并把她们安全地带回家。\n\n你要小心那些巨人的棍棒，免得自己也变成俘虏中的一员。",dEN="To be slain honorably on the field of battle brings us all glory. To be frozen in a block of ice and endlessly taunted does not....\n\nYou are to fly to the frost giant city of Dun Niffelem, just east of the Valley of Ancient Winters, and liberate a captive proto-drake. With her, you will be able to free our sisters from their frozen bonds and carry three of them safely home.\n\nBeware the giants' clubs, sister, lest you find yourself numbered among the captives.",o="布伦希尔达村东边的布莉亚娜要你飞往丹尼芬雷，解救3头被俘虏的始祖幼龙，然后解救9名布伦希尔达囚犯。",oEN="Brijana, just east of Brunnhildar Village, wants you to fly to Dun Niffelem, then free 3 Captured Proto-Drakes and rescue 9 Brunnhildar Prisoners.",p="你的任务成功了吗，姐妹？",pEN="Was your mission successful, <brother/sister>?",c="你的任务似乎成功了，姐妹。\n\n你为布伦希尔达带来了荣耀！",cEN="Your efforts appear to have been successful, sister.\n\nYou have brought glory to the Brunnhildar!"}
Q[12857]={d="由怒爪酋长发布：\n\n怒爪酋长忠实的海狮，怒鬃，咬了喂他的手。怒爪说怒鬃不再好了，都怪坏达库鲁巨魔。怒爪酋长很伤心地请求杀掉怒鬃，并把怒鬃的鳍带回给酋长作证。\n\n你会在东南方的怒爪湖找到怒鬃。\n\n怒爪酋长字写得不好，抱歉。第一次用这种东西；再说，怒爪酋长是狼獾人，不是人。|n",dEN="Posted by Chief Rageclaw:\n\nChief Rageclaw trusty lion seal, Ragemane, bite hand that feed him. Rageclaw say Ragemane no more good because of bad Drakuru trolls. Chief Rageclaw very sad to ask that Ragemane be killeded and Ragemane flipper be returned to chief as proof.\n\nYou find Ragemane to southeast, at Rageclaw Lake.\n\nChief Rageclaw sorry for bad writing. First time use one of these things; plus, Chief Rageclaw is wolvar, not person.",o="得到怒鬃的鳍肢，将它交给圣光据点的怒爪酋长。",oEN="Recover Ragemane's Flipper and return it to Chief Rageclaw at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",p="可怜的怒鬃。它可是我舅舅送我的。",pEN="Poor Ragemane. He was gift from brother-in-law.",c="<怒爪酋长哭了。>\n\n我从小把它养大。真是伤心的一天——先是巨魔攻击怒爪部族，然后巨魔害的怒鬃变坏。怒爪再也不跟巨魔做生意了！",cEN="<Chief Rageclaw cries.>\n\nHad Ragemane since pup. Sad day for Rageclaw. First troll attack Rageclaw, then troll make Ragemane bad. Rageclaw never trade with troll again!"}
Q[12858]={d="感谢圣光，总算有人看懂了我留下的消息。我已经逃出了铁矮人的魔掌，现在很安全。不过我需要你的帮助。解封奥杜尔文件的关键就是诺甘农的钥石，但是泰坦将它分成了两截，分别藏了起来。\n\n其中一截叫做诺甘农之壳，它被藏在奥杜尔以南，位于北部海岸的创世者的图书馆内。首先，你要从图书馆的守卫者手中取得一张圆盘的碎片。",dEN="Thank the Light that someone got my message. Now that I'm safe from the iron dwarves, I need to ask your help with something. I've got a lead on Norgannon's keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's guardians.",o="收集6块创世者的圆盘碎片，将它们组合成创世者的圆盘。",oEN="Gather 6 Inventor's Disk Fragments and use them to assemble the Inventor's Disk.",p="你把圆盘拿到手了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the disk?",c="太棒了！既然我们有了圆盘，那你一定要用它打开发明者的宝库！",cEN="Wonderful! Now that we have the disk, you must use it to open the Inventor's vault!"}
Q[12859]={d="巨魔攻击了怒爪巢穴，把怒爪狼獾人赶了出来！更糟的是，巨魔正在焚烧怒爪狼獾人的村庄，他们都是坏人！酋长让最厉害的萨满祭司莫奇去灭火，但是很奇怪！火还是很热，会烧掉一切。\n\n你能帮怒爪狼獾人去灭火吗？莫奇会给你怒爪狼獾人的特殊灭火器，去扑灭东南方怒爪巢穴里的火焰。有时候要喷很多下才能灭火，不过灭火器总是有足够的水！这就是厉害的怒爪魔法！",dEN="Trolls attack Rageclaw Den and kick Rageclaw out! It get worse. Trolls now burning village! This very bad. Chief make top Rageclaw shaman, Moky, do study on fire. Results very surprising! Fire still hot and can burn things.\n\nWill you help Rageclaw and put fire out? Moky has special Rageclaw fire extinguisher for you. Use special fire extinguisher to put out fire at Rageclaw Den to southeast. Sometimes take many sprays to douse fire, but extinguisher always have water! Rageclaw magic strong!",o="祖达克圣光之歇的长者萨满莫奇要你使用怒爪灭火器扑灭怒爪巢穴中 15 处小屋火焰。|n",oEN="Elder Shaman Moky at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak wants you to use the Rageclaw Fire Extinguisher to douse 15 hut fires at Rageclaw Den.",p="嗯，灭火了？",pEN="Hrm, put fires out?",c="很奇怪，我明知道你把火灭了，但火还是在燃烧。也许这东西没用，呃？不过，莫奇还是会回报你所作的事情！希望巨魔也烧起来！",cEN="It strange because I know you put fire out, but fire still burning. Maybe this thing not so good after all, eh? Still, Moky pay you for what you do! Hopefully troll burn too!"}
Q[12860]={d="你拼出来的那个圆盘……是空的！米米尔这个狡猾的鬼东西肯定把信息藏到了别的什么地方。去调查一下创世者的图书馆，看看里面有没有数据库之类的东西。\n\n或许这张圆盘就是干这个用的，到数据库附近去使用它看看吧。它可能就是用来读入和存储数据库信息的。试过以后再联络我，把你的发现告诉我。同时，我要开始着手寻找钥匙的另一半了。",dEN="That disk you assembled... it's blank! That crafty Mimir must've hidden the information somewhere else. Look around the Inventor's Library; do you see any databanks there?\n\nThat might be what you need to do with the disk. Try using it near some of those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. After you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've found. Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",o="使用创世者的圆盘，从数据库中获得7条秘密数据。",oEN="Use the Inventor's Disk to retrieve 7 pieces of Hidden Data from the Databanks.",p="你有没有试着读取数据库？可有什么发现？",pEN="Did you try using the disk? What did you find?",c="<Brann mira el disco mientras lo sostienes><布莱恩看着你举起的圆盘>\n\n我看不出里面有没有存东西！你得告诉我发生了什么。\n\n<你描述了数据读取的过程>\n\n所以成功了？至少我们可以指望米米尔做事有条理。就我最近听到的，其他那些守护者可不好说……",cEN="<Brann looks at the disk as you hold it up.>\n\nI can't tell if there's anything stored there or not! You have to tell me what happened.\n\n<You describe the data retrieval process.>\n\nSo it worked? At least we can count on Mimir to be systematic. Can't say that for the rest of these Keepers from what I've been hearing..."}
Q[12861]={d="达库鲁……你知道他是谁吗？我觉得坏巨魔们被达库鲁控制了。他们称自己是达库鲁巨魔——所以我就知道了。现在你知道为什么我能成为怒爪氏族的头儿了吗？因为我是最最聪明的狼獾人！\n\n不过这跟我现在找你的原因没有关系。坏巨魔把怒爪氏族赶出了巢穴，没来得及逃走的怒爪狼獾人都被囚禁在村子里面了。你去东南方的怒爪巢穴解救被俘虏的怒爪狼獾人吧。钥匙就在巨魔身上，也许你需要干掉很多巨魔才能拿到足够多的钥匙。",dEN="Drakuru... You know who this troll is? I think bad troll are controlled by the Drakuru troll. They call themself Drakuru trolls - that how I know. Now you see why I am chief of Rageclaw. Smartest of all wolvar!\n\nBut that not why I talk to you now. Bad troll come and kick Rageclaw out of den. Rageclaw that no run away held as prisoner in village. You go to Rageclaw Den, southeast, and free captured Rageclaw. Kill troll for lock opener. You maybe kill many troll for many lock opener.",o="祖达克圣光之歇的怒爪酋长要你使用从各种达库鲁巨魔身上找到的达库鲁\"开锁器\"解救 8 名被俘的怒爪成员。",oEN="Chief Rageclaw at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak wants you to use the Drakuru \"Lock Openers\" found on various Drakuru trolls to free 8 Captured Rageclaw.",p="你救出怒爪？",pEN="You rescue Rageclaw?",c="怒爪谢谢你，<name>。虽然怒爪巢穴大概永远失去了，巨魔和怒爪的友谊也永远失去了……而且现在我想起来，怒鬃也永远失去了。他还是我小舅子。他走了。嗯，你见过酋长的伴侣吗？我想她也走了。\n\n也许你现在走吧。酋长有点沮丧。",cEN="Rageclaw thank you, <name>. Though Rageclaw Den probably lost forever and troll-Rageclaw friendship also lost forever... and also now I think of it, Ragemane lost forever too. Also brother-in-law. He gone. Hrm, have you seen Chief's mate? I think she gone too.\n\nMaybe you go now. Chief a little depressed."}
Q[12862]={d="看来……看来我们是别想在这层层叠叠的群山中找到一个合适的定居点了。\n\n相信我，我不是那种轻言放弃的人……但是被冻住的引擎、讨厌的维库女人、飞来飞去的恶龙和乱七八糟的其它怪物，换了是你，你能怎么办？\n\n不过，不要慌张！我只是说我们找不到一个合适的定居点，但这并不意味着我们不能送你一程……单线旅行总是很简单的。\n\n<莉吉特指了指附近的火箭。>",dEN="So... so I don't think we're going to be getting a good foothold in those mountains.\n\nTrust me, I'm not one to give up easily... but between freezing engines, nasty vrykul women, territorial dragon want-to-bes and the half a dozen other nasties settled in the area, this just ain't happening.\n\nDon't let that dissuade you though! Just because we can't get a foothold doesn't mean we won't get you there... one-way trips are pretty simple when you get down to it.\n\n<Ricket nods at some nearby rockets.>",o="与莉吉特谈一谈，使用她的D16推进运载器进入风暴峭壁的深处。",oEN="Speak to Ricket to make use of Ricket's D16 Propelled Delivery Device to enter further into Storm Peaks.",c="哎哟！那看着就疼。不过那真是个相当气派的登场，小伙子！\n\n欢迎来到霜堡！你是来帮我们找一条通往冰冠冰川的路的吗？",cEN="Ow! That looked painful. It was a pretty grand entrance though, lad!\n\nWelcome to Frosthold! Are ya here to help us find a path into Icecrown?"}
Q[12863]={d="啊！谢谢你上来，$g小伙子:小姑娘;。\n\n看你瞪大的眼睛和发抖的双手，我猜你来这儿没多久。那么看来你该去见见我们好客的主人！\n\n我们有一些多余的医疗补给……说实话，我们没想到能安顿得这么舒服。把这箱东西交给那边的格洛萨尔，如果方便的话也帮他们一把。我们不想让他们觉得我们不感激他们的热情款待。",dEN="Ah! Thanks for coming up here, <lad/lass>.\n\nJudging by your wide eyes and shivering hands, I'd venture a guess that you're somewhat new. Sounds like it would be good for you to meet our gracious hosts then!\n\nWe've got some extra medical supplies... to be honest, we weren't expecting to have such a comfortable setup. Go ahead and give this crate to Glorthal over there, and lend them a hand if you would too. We don't want them to think we're ungrateful for how welcoming they've been.",o="将医疗物资箱交给冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须。",oEN="Bring the crate of medical supplies to Glorthal Stiffbeard in Frosthold.",p="嗨。",pEN="Hello.",c="医疗物资箱？谢谢你！不过现在暂时还不确定要怎么用它，但是想必会派上用场。\n\n很高兴见到你……你们的人可真是拥有丰富的多样性啊。这地方不太常有访客？有些新伙伴的感觉挺不错的。",cEN="Medical supplies? Thank you! Not exactly sure what to do with them to be honest, but I'm sure they'll be useful.\n\nIt's good to meet you... there's such a colorful variety among your peoples. We're not used to having visitors up this way very often - it's good to have some fresh company."}
Q[12864]={d="现在我有一些事情需要你帮忙。\n\n我们有几个斥候至今还没有回来。虽然风暴峭壁的环境很恶劣……但这些孩子知道他们该做些什么。\n\n到东边去……沿着伯尔之息山谷，去伯尔瀑布附近看看……他们应该就在那个方向。如果你找到他们中的任何一个，就赶快回来告诉我。有几个敌人对我们虎视眈眈很久了——如果他们之中有人开始变得不安分，我们就该早作准备。",dEN="There is something that I could use a hand with now that I have you.\n\nWe have a few scouts that are extremely late in returning. The peaks are harsh... but these boys know what they're doing.\n\nHead to the east... along the Bor's Breath valley and near Bor's Fall... they should be out that direction. If you find any sign of one of them, bring me back news immediately. We have a few enemies in the area - if any of them are getting a bit uppity, the more warning the better.",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨要求你转至伯尔之息山谷和伯尔瀑布，寻找失踪的霜脉斥候的踪迹。",oEN="Glorthal in Frosthold has requested a search of the Bor's Breath valley and Bor's Fall for any sign of the missing Frostborn Scouts.",c="当一个斥候这么久还没有回来的时候……差不多就该预料到是这种结果了，所以是鹰身人？\n\n雷心国王这几年很努力的训练我们……把我们训练成很棒的战士。如今我了解必要性何在了。在我族中，他是我见过最睿智也最强悍的领导者……别被他桃红色的皮肤给骗了。",cEN="When a scout doesn't come back for this long... that's about the expected result. The harpies then?\n\nKing Stormheart has us train hard year round... he's turned us into amazing fighters. At times like this, I understand why it's necessary. He's the wisest and strongest leader I've yet seen among our people... don't let his peachy skin fool ya."}
Q[12865]={d="新来的！很高兴认识你！如果你有时间的话，我想找你帮个忙。\n\n东边就是山底平原……环境非常恶劣的一片土地，不过有相当多的犀牛在那里生活。我们的猎鹰非常喜欢吃犀牛肉，不过平原上还有许多始祖龙，让它们去那里狩猎始终是件非常危险的事情。\n\n如果你愿意的话，不如去弄些犀牛肉回来，然后回到这里上面的峭壁，喂食居住在那里的猎鹰。",dEN="Fresh blood! Good to meet ya! I've got some work if you've got some time.\n\nOff to the east are the Foot Steppes... pretty hard land, but there's quite a group of rhino that graze there. Our birds have a taste for that rhino meat, but it's always a bit dangerous for them to go hunting with all of the proto-drakes that nest around there.\n\nIf you're keen, head over that way and get some rhino meat, bring it back to the peaks above here, and then use it to feed some of the eagles that nest there.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉希望你收集8块新鲜的冰犀牛肉，然后将它们喂食给小镇上方的雷羽鹰。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to obtain 8 slabs of Fresh Ice Rhino Meat and use them to feed the Stormcrest Eagles above town.",p="这些雄鹰已被我们驯化已久……一切进展得还不错。",pEN="These birds have been loyal to us for a long time... we get on pretty well.",c="由衷地感谢你……我想它们一定也充满感激之情。它们是坚定而强大的盟友——若你在我们的阵营里，你会因为它们的协助大大受益。",cEN="Thank you, kindly... and I'm sure they're quite appreciative too. They make powerful allies; you'll be well off being on this side of their graces."}
Q[12866]={d="该死的鹰身人，我已经记不得教训它们多少次了……每次被打得落花流水之后，它们总会消停一段时间。这次，我还以为它们已经得到足够的教训了。\n\n显然没有。\n\n它们的记忆力可能很差劲，不过如果它们的数量不足的话，我想它们自己也会收敛一些。到北面和东面的山谷里去，帮我们消灭一些鹰身人吧，怎么样？",dEN="Damn harpies. We've beat that bunch into submission more times than I can remember... and they stay quiet for a time after each bout. This time, I'd thought that maybe it sunk in.\n\nApparently not.\n\nTheir memory may be a bit short, but if their numbers are thinned enough, they'll keep to themselves. Head into the valleys in the north and east and clear out a fair chunk of them for me, will ya?",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须希望你去杀死8个霜羽尖啸者和8个霜羽女巫。",oEN="Glorthal Stiffbeard at Frosthold wants you to kill 8 Frostfeather Screechers and 8 Frostfeather Witches.",p="顽强的畜生……好像永远都摆脱不了他们。他们繁殖的跟兔子一样快。",pEN="Persistent buggers... can't ever seem to rid ourselves of all of them. They breed like rabbits.",c="这不是什么好工作，我懂，但是我们很感谢你的帮忙。你说斥候提到的那个名字是什么……希尔拉娜？",cEN="It's dirty work, I know, but we appreciate it. Now what was the name the scout mentioned... Sirana?"}
Q[12867]={d="几周前，只要你抬头仰望，就可以随时看到一群群漂亮的猎鹰在天空中翱翔。现在呢？就算有，也就只剩下那么几只了。由于鹰身人一直在偷取猎鹰的卵，它们只好整天守在巢里。\n\n鹰身人对鹰肉越来越感兴趣了，似乎……这群变态的家伙想把卵中的小鹰孵化出来，然后好好地美餐一顿。去把鹰卵夺回来交给我，我会负责把它们送回鸟巢里去的。",dEN="A few weeks ago, if you looked up, you'd see dozens of those beautiful eagles soaring the skies. Now, only a few if any. They've taken to staying with their nests nearly all the time now because the harpies have been stealing their eggs.\n\nThe harpies have grown a taste for eagle flesh, it seems... the sick wretches are caring for the eggs long enough to feast on the hatchlings. Go into the valleys to the north or the east and find the eggs... bring them back here, and I'll take them back to the nests.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉希望你交给他15枚雷羽鹰卵。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold would like you to bring back 15 Stormcrest Eagle Eggs.",p="我们会把这些鹰身人处理好的……这些雷羽鹰很快就可以再度盘旋于天空中了。",pEN="We'll get this harpy problem taken care of... the eagles will be free to soar the skies again soon.",c="干得好，<小伙子/小姑娘>。你交朋友很快。\n\n如果你很快再回来，我相信我们能找到一头愿意让你骑的……它们现在应该知道你是可信的了。",cEN="Good stuff, <lad/lass>. You're making fast friends.\n\nIf you stop back by soon, I'm sure we can find one that will let you ride... they should know that you're trustworthy now."}
Q[12868]={d="似乎这个希尔拉娜·冰啸就是煽动鹰身人的幕后主使。如果我们干掉她，也许它们的进攻就会很快消停下来。\n\n我们的一位风暴骑士声称，发现她在西北方的峭壁附近徘徊。去把她找出来，消灭她。",dEN="This Sirana Iceshriek sounds like the one that's spurring the harpies to be more aggressive. If we kill her, I suspect their attacks won't last long afterwards.\n\nOne of our stormriders claims to have spotted her circling the peak directly northwest of here. Go find the wench and put her down. Let's see this done.",o="冰霜堡的格罗萨·硬须要求你去杀死希尔拉娜·冰啸。",oEN="Glorthal Stiffbeard at Frosthold wants you to kill Sirana Iceshriek.",p="这里太冷了，没有一般常见的害虫……幸亏我们还有鹰身人。真幸运。",pEN="It's too cold here the usual pests... we get harpies. Lucky us.",c="那么就解决了。谢谢你。\n\n我跟弗亚林·霜眉谈过了——他说他的手下会负责对付鹰身人。只要我们不放松防备，他们就没胆攻击我们的人。\n\n我知道这不是什么愉快的工作——请把这个当作是谢礼收下吧。",cEN="It's done then. Thank you.\n\nI've spoken with Fjorlin - he said that his men will take charge of keeping the harpies down a bit. As long as we don't let up again, they won't find the courage to think they can attack our people.\n\nI know this wasn't the most tasteful work - take this as a token of my appreciation."}
Q[12869]={d="你知道洛肯这个混账吧？铁矮人抓走了始祖龙的首领维拉努斯，搞得那些始祖龙极度沮丧……而且变得极具进攻性。\n\n它们开始闯入雷羽峰一带，而山上的雷羽鹰则倾巢而出，与它们交战。雷羽鹰一直对我们忠心耿耿，现在我们该报答这些朋友了。我们正准备转至山底平原，剿灭一些始祖幼龙。\n\n约尔格·雷心国王陛下将这柄战锤传给了我——要好好使用它，用完了还给我。",dEN="You were there with Loken, weren't you? The iron dwarves captured Veranus, the brood mother of the proto-drakes. The drakes don't seem even a little bit happy about the situation... they've gotten very aggressive.\n\nThey've pushed into stormcrest territory and the eagles have taken to an all out fight with them. It's time to return the favor. We're riding to the Foot Steppes and slaughtering them there.\n\nKing Stormheart left this hammer to me - make good use and see to it that I get it back.",o="弗亚林·霜眉要你骑上雷羽鹰转至山底平原，杀死16条风暴峭壁巨龙。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to ride with a Stormcrest Eagle and kill 16 Stormpeak Wyrms in the Foot Steppes.",p="局面简直一发不可收拾。",pEN="This is completely out of control.",c="我不认为这些始祖龙会这么轻易放弃。如果你还有时间帮忙的话，明天记得再回来。",cEN="I don't see the drakes being dissuaded so easily. Stop back by tomorrow if you think you can spare more time to help."}
Q[12870]={d="哎呀，你好啊！\n\n在你出发去做你那宏大的任务和冒险之前，能不能求你帮个小忙，$g小伙子:小姑娘;？\n\n这些山里满是珍贵的遗物和小玩意儿……这地方对协会来说简直是梦想成真。如果你能把偶然发现的这类宝物带回来给我，我会非常感激。你甚至还能分到我的麦酒！相信我，$g小伙子:小姑娘;，这可是笔划算的买卖！",dEN="Why hello thar!\n\nBefore you be headin' off to do your grand questin' and adventure, might I beg a wee favor of ya, <lad/lass>?\n\nThese mountains be packed full'a precious relics and baubles... this place be a dream come true for tha league. I'd be much obliged if ya could bring any such treasures you stumble upon back ta me. You can even share in me ale for tha trouble! Trust me <lad/lass>, that's a rich deal!",o="将10件奥杜尔的圣物交给冰霜堡的洛尔克·锐须。",oEN="Return 10 Relics of Ulduar to Rork Sharpchin in Frosthold.",p="你有替我找到圣物吗？",pEN="Did ya find some o' dem relics for me?",c="赞！你真是个好家伙。\n\n跟我一起干一杯吧！让我们庆祝这伟大的发现！",cEN="Beaut! Yer a good one you are.\n\nTilt one back wi' me! Let us celebrae' this glorious find!"}
Q[12871]={d="有意思。我没有在诺甘农之壳上发现任何锁定设备，也许仅仅是找到另一半钥石可能还不够。\n\n把诺甘农之壳交给冰霜堡的探险队长拉格努斯吧。只要他能克服自己对“泰坦造物”的敬畏之心，或许就能通过诺甘农之壳推测出它的核心部分应该是什么样子。没准他们还能说服冰霜矮人帮忙寻找它呢。\n\n我要去研究一下怎么把这两半东西拼合起来，等我们都有了进展之后再联络吧。",dEN="Interesting. I don't see any locking mechanisms on the shell. That suggests to me that it may take more than just finding the other piece to combine the keystone.\n\nTake the shell back to the expedition leader, Lagnus, at Frosthold. Once he gets over his awe, he should be able to glean what the core looks like based on the shell, and maybe they can get the Frost Dwarves to help find it.\n\nI'm going to see if I can find out how to combine the two pieces. We'll catch up once we've both made some progress.",o="将诺甘农之壳交给冰霜堡的拉格努斯。",oEN="Take Norgannon's Shell to Lagnus at Frosthold.",p="你好啊！",pEN="Hello there!",c="穆拉丁的胡子啊！这是我想的那个东西吗？布莱恩这次真的超越自我了……还有你也是！家乡那些孩子们一定不会相信的。",cEN="By Muradin's beard! Is that what I think it is?! Brann's really outdone himself this time... and you too for that matter! The boys back home are never going to believe this."}
Q[12872]={d="正在为创世者的圆盘充能。\n\n已完成充能。\n\n准备引导紧急协议：伽玛。\n\n紧急协议已加载。请使用已充能的圆盘激活诺甘农之壳的守护者，文件员麦卡顿。在确认了你的身份之后，文件员会交出诺甘农之壳。\n\n祝你愉快一千年。",dEN="Charging inventor's disk.\n\nDisk charging completed.\n\nPreparing emergency protocol gamma.\n\nEmergency protocol loaded. Please use the charged disk to activate the guardian of Norgannon's shell, Archivist Mechaton. The archivist will release the shell once your identity has been verified.\n\nPlease have a pleasant millennium.",o="从文件员麦卡顿那里拿到诺甘农之壳。",oEN="Recover Norgannon's Shell from Archivist Mechaton.",p="好啦，别傻站在那儿了，让我看看诺甘农之壳！",pEN="Well, don't just stand there, show me the shell!",c="就是这样！这就是诺甘农钥石的前一半。干得好，<name>。等我回到铁炉堡，我会让他们把你引荐为探险者协会的荣誉成员！",cEN="That's it! That's the first half of Norgannon's keystone. Well done, <name>. When I get back to Ironforge, I'm going to have you inducted as an honorary member in the Explorers' League!"}
Q[12873]={d="嗯……我已经可以精确地描绘出核心部分的样子了。只要霜脉部族中的矮人见过它，他们就一定可以认出我所描述的东西。\n\n时间已经不多了，我们直接谈重点吧。你要去跟约尔格·雷心国王谈一谈，请求他的帮助……他一定知道谁能帮我们找到核心部分。哦，记得要对他表现出足够的尊重——他可是非常德高望重的领袖。",dEN="Definitely... I can see exactly what the core must look like. If any of the frostborn have seen it, they'll be sure to recognize the description.\n\nThere's no time to waste, let's get straight to business. Go talk to King Stormheart and request his aid... he's sure to know someone who can help us find the core. And be nice about it will you - he's very respected around here.",o="与冰霜堡的约尔格·雷心谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Yorg Stormheart in Frosthold.",c="诺甘农之核？没听过。不过我也许知道谁有听说过。",cEN="Norgannon's Core? Never heard of it. I might well know someone that has though."}
Q[12874]={d="我非常乐意为旅行者提供庇护所，但我不会强迫族人插手你们的事情。\n\n我跟你说啊……我的族人都是战士，性格非常直爽，而且很真诚。当一个霜脉矮人成长为男子汉的时候，他就必须通过战斗来证明自己。他必须向所有族人证明，他会在战场上勇往直前，毫不退缩。\n\n如果你能向我证明，你和我的族人一样强壮勇敢，那么我就允许他们帮助你。去和悬崖那边的弗亚林·霜眉谈一谈，他会为你安排试炼的。",dEN="I be more than willing ta lend my shelter and home ta travelers in need, but I'm nae too keen ta force my people inte yer affairs.\n\nI'll tell ye what... my people are warriors, straight and true. On the day a frostborn becomes a man, he has ta prove himself in battle. He has ta show us that he'll not let size hold'm back.\n\nShow me yer as strong and fierce as one of my men, and I'll have them lend ye an ear or a blade. Speak ta Fjorlin over by the cliff to the south there and he'll put ye ta the test.",o="冰霜堡的约尔格·雷心要你去和弗亚林·霜眉谈一谈，从他那里获得一匹坐骑，并迎接挑战。",oEN="Yorg Stormheart at Frosthold has requested that you speak to Fjorlin Frostbrow to secure a ride and face your challenge.",p="你回来了。你是凯旋而归的吗？",pEN="Ye've come back to me. Have ye come back to me victorious?",c="哈！好故事，小伙子……也许你身上真有点霜脉矮人的血，嗯？至少你不只是嘴上说说，而这正是我需要听到的。",cEN="Ha! Grand tale lad... perhaps ye have a bit of frostborn blood in ye, eh? Yer not just talk anyway, and that's what I needed to hear."}
Q[12875]={d="我不知道这个核心藏在哪里，这你应该早就预料到了。不过我说了会帮忙，就一定会帮忙。\n\n北边的一处山洞里有一位名叫德鲁姆·霜握的隐士……就在山谷里面。我们的生活方式早已与泰坦没有太多联系了，保留下来的有关知识也很少。但是德鲁姆仍然过着传统的生活……他一直在关注着一些重要的泰坦遗迹，还经常和守护者克莱特乌斯谈话。\n\n你可以在他的山洞里面找到他……告诉他是我让你去的，他肯定会向你伸出援手。",dEN="I don't know where this core is hiding, but ye knew that. I said I'd help though, and that I shall.\n\nThere's a hermit by the name of Drom Frostgrip who lives in a cave north of here... down in tha valley. We've strayed away from the titans a bit ourselves being that there are so few about, but Drom's loyal to the old ways... he keeps an eye on their most precious places and speaks te the keeper Creteus often.\n\nYer sure to find him in the back of his cave... tell'm I sent ye and he'll help ye.",o="找到德鲁姆·霜握。",oEN="Locate Drom Frostgrip.",c="<德鲁姆咳出了一点血。>\n\n诺甘农之核，嗯？我自己花了许多时间想要找出关于它的线索，但它似乎是至今仍旧受到保护的圣物之一。我想这是有理由的。\n\n如果是雷心国王派你来的，他一定是感受到了你身上高贵的特质……此外，我也不会拒绝国王的命令。",cEN="<Drom coughts up a bit of blood.>\n\nNorgannon's Core, eh? I've spent a fair number of days trying to find anything I could about it myself, but it seems to be one of the relics that's still guarded. With reason I suppose.\n\nIf King Stormheart sent you, he surely must see something noble in ye... and I'm not one to refuse my king."}
Q[12876]={d="我们的斥候在北边的山谷里发现了铁矮人。听说国王陛下让你去拜访德鲁姆，我有点担心他的安全。\n\n如果你在路上碰到铁矮人，能帮我干掉他们吗？我想他们还不知道我们的具体位置，以及抵达这里的路线，而我希望这种情况能继续保持下去。",dEN="Our scouts have spotted iron dwarves in the valley north of here. I overheard King Stormheart sending you to visit Drom and I'm admittedly a bit worried about'm.\n\nIf you find any iron dwarves when you head down there, put'm down hard and fast for me, eh? I dun think they know exactly where we are or how to get here just yet, and I'd prefer to keep it that way.",o="冰霜堡的弗亚林·霜眉要你杀死10个雷铸铁矮人入侵者。",oEN="Fjorlin Frostbrow at Frosthold wants you to kill 10 Stormforged Invaders.",p="斥候说的是正确的吗？下头有很多矮人吗？",pEN="Were the scouts right? Were there dwarves down there?",c="坏消息，小伙子。那些铁矮人似乎在增多……我们在群山里到处都能看到他们。我嗅到战争正在逼近。\n\n谢谢你处理掉这一批……又多买到了一点时间。",cEN="Grim news, lad. Those Iron Dwarves seem to be increasing in numbers... we've been seeing them all over the mountains. I smell war coming.\n\nThank you for dealing with this bunch... a little more time bought."}
Q[12877]={d="我从来没找到过核心……但我经常和守护者克莱特乌斯谈话，他曾因为疏忽透露了一些信息给我。你可以在山底平原东部的山上找到克莱特乌斯，他一直在守护着造物者引擎。核心可能就在那里，但你必须获得克莱特乌斯的支持。\n\n铁矮人正在这一带寻找某些东西……可能就是在找核心。他们拿走了我的戒指，去找到他们的首领，拿回戒指。只要把戒指拿给克莱特乌斯看，他就会知道是我让你去的。",dEN="I never found the core... but I've often spoken to the keeper Creteus, and his omissions give him away. You'll find Creteus over the mountains to the east, in the Foot Steppes, keeping watch on the Engine of the Makers. The core might well be in there, but you'll need to win Creteus's favor.\n\nThe iron dwarves were here looking for something... it might well be the core. They took my ring. Find their leader, get the ring back, and show it to Creteus so that he knows I sent you.",o="从一个铁矮人监督者手中夺回德鲁姆·霜握的徽记之戒，并把它交给山底平原的克莱特乌斯。",oEN="Recover Frostgrip's Signet Ring from an Iron Dwarf Monitor and then bring it to Creteus in the Foot Steppes.",p="你好，<race>。\n\n我很高兴你在结识我时选择用舌头而不是刀刃。我发现近来这在你们一族中越来越罕见了。",pEN="Hello, <race>.\n\nI am pleased that you have opted to utilize your tongue over your blade when making my acquaintance. I have found that a more and more rare quality among your kind of late.",c="德鲁姆的戒指？我想他没有亲自介绍你给我认识，那么他现状一定不是很好，我很遗憾。德鲁姆是一位高贵的矮人，虽然有些好问。\n\n那么，你是为了什么事情来的？",cEN="Drom's ring? I am to assume Drom is not well if he did not introduce you directly. I am sorry to hear of that. Drom is a noble dwarf, if an inquisitive one.\n\nOn what business have you come then?"}
Q[12878]={d="你不在的时候，我有幸和矮人布莱恩·铜须交谈过。这位矮人展示了他找到钥石的决心，他的动机符合获得钥石的条件，这一点令我非常高兴……我相信钥石就是为他而生的。\n\n诺甘农之核就在东南方的严寒墓穴里。古代的冰雪生物守卫着那里，它们肯定不会对你笑脸相迎。带着我的祝福去击败那些守卫，取得钥石吧，$r。",dEN="During your absence, I was privileged enough to parley with the dwarf Brann Bronzebeard. This dwarf indicated his purpose for seeking the keystone, and I am satisfied that it is for satisfactory intent... I believe this dwarf may be the entity for which the keystone was created.\n\nNorgannon's Core is located in the Frigid Tomb to the southeast. Its guardians are ancient beings of ice, and they will not welcome your presence. Best these guardians and retrieve the keystone with my blessing, <race>.",o="山底平原的克莱特乌斯已经把诺甘农之核的位置告诉了你。",oEN="Creteus in the Foot Steppes has provided you with the information to locate Norgannon's Core.",c="<当箱子打开的时候，空气从里面流泄而出，使室内充满了漫长时光所累积的霉味。诺甘农之核就躺在箱子的底部，丝毫不带一点岁月的痕迹。>",cEN="<As the chest opens, air rushes out into the chamber, carrying with it the musty smell of something that has been here for countless years. Norgannon's Core rests in the bottom of the chest, undisturbed by the ages.>"}
Q[12879]={d="<当你从箱子里取出诺甘农之核时，你听到从走廊里传来了沉重的脚步声，正在一步步向你逼近。远处则隐隐传来战斗的声音。>",dEN="<As you retrieve the core from the chest, you hear the thumping of heavy footsteps rushing towards you from the corridor. There is the faint sound of battle in the distance.>",o="将诺甘农之核交给山底平原的克莱特乌斯。",oEN="Bring Norgannon's Core back to Creteus in the Foot Steppes.",c="有人在用意志熔炉制造这支军队……奥杜尔不再安全了。\n\n<race>，我很高兴你比这些可憎之物先一步到达了核心。",cEN="Someone is using the Forge of Wills to create this army... Ulduar is no longer safe.\n\n<race>, I am pleased that you were able to reach the core before these abominations were."}
Q[12880]={d="组合钥石需要用到诺甘农的拼合器……这个设备就在造物者引擎里，也就是我们旁边这个大坑。布莱恩已经带着另一半钥石到下面去了，我已经把使用这个设备的方法都告诉了他。他正在等着你。\n\n我会尽量拖住那些铁矮人，但恐怕不能阻挡他们太久。约尔格·雷心国王很快就要带着他的一部分属下回去防守冰霜堡了，你要快一点，$r。",dEN="Combining the keystone will require Norgannon's Binding - a device located in the Engine of the Makers, the large pit beside us. Brann should be down there with the other half of the keystone now. I have instructed him on the use of the device. He awaits your presence.\n\nI will do what I can to keep the iron dwarves occupied, but I do not have confidence that I will hold them for long. King Stormheart is returning to the defense of Frosthold with some of his men shortly. Please hurry, <race>.",o="将诺甘农之核交给造物者引擎里的布莱恩·铜须。",oEN="Bring Norgannon's Core to Brann Bronzebeard in the Engine of the Makers.",p="嘿，<小伙子/小姑娘>！很高兴见到你本人。你找到了吗？",pEN="Hey there, <lad/lass>! Good to meet ya in person. Did you find it?",c="你真聪明，小伙子！聪明！今天真会是个光荣的日子。\n\n快，趁那些铁矮人还没下到这里，把核心递给我。",cEN="You're brilliant, lad! Brilliant! This will be a glorious day indeed.\n\nQuickly, hand me the core before those iron dwarves make their way down here."}
Q[12881]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[12882]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到群峰。\n\n在你出发去做你那宏大的远行之前，我有个小小的请求。这些山里散落着古代奥杜尔的遗物和宝物。它们大多多半落在居住在此的各智慧种族手中。\n\n把你找到的任何一件带回来给我，我会给你相应的报酬。也许我还会让你尝尝我那些烈性麦酒。",dEN="Welcome to the peaks.\n\nI have a simple request before you head off on whatever grand jaunt you have planned. There are relics and treasures of ancient Ulduar scattered through these mountains. Most are likely in possession of the various sentient races.\n\nReturn any that you find to me, and I will reward you in kind. Perhaps I'll even let you partake on my many potent ales.",o="将10件奥杜尔的圣物交给格罗玛什坠毁点的奥鲁特·埃雷古。",oEN="Return 10 Relics of Ulduar to Olut Alegut at the Grom'arsh Crash-site.",p="你有找到我说的圣物吗？",pEN="Were you able to find the relics of which I spoke?",c="这些真是太棒了！我很感激你，同你的烦恼忧愁喝一杯如何？",cEN="These will do nicely! I am much obliged. Perhaps a drink for your troubles?"}
Q[12883]={d="小的们，听从主人的号令！巫妖王派我来全权管理祖达克的天灾部队。我们要做的就是消灭一切。\n\n消灭一切！！！\n\n我们正在死亡旷野对所有的尸体进行处理，然后把它们派去泽尔拉玛斯的纳瓦留斯王子手下，加强天灾军团的实力。在达库鲁的管理下，什么都不会浪费的！\n\n很快我们就将变得前所未有的强大！不久之后，祖达克和古达克就将属于天灾军团！",dEN="Minions be hearin' da call of your masta! Da Lich King be givin' Drakuru full control of da armies of da Scourge in Zul'Drak. We be commanded ta kill everyting.\n\nEVERYTING MUST DIE!\n\nWe be processin' all da corpses in da Dead Fields and sendin' em up ta Prince Navarius' crew in Zeramas for Scourgin'! Notin' goes ta waste on Drakuru's watch!\n\nSoon we be drinkin' da blood of da prophets ta become stronger dan eva before! Zul'Drak and Gundrak gonna fall to da Scourge!",o="将达库鲁的命令交给祖达克圣光据点的北伐军领主兰迪加。",oEN="Return the Orders From Drakuru to Crusader Lord Lantinga at Light's Breach in Zul'Drak.",p="达库鲁，呃？我听过这个名字……",pEN="Drakuru, eh? I've heard the name before...",c="要是这跟达克萨隆要塞的达库鲁是同一个的话，我们就会需要……支援。\n\n阿彻鲁斯的死亡骑士就在附近驻扎，毫无疑问跟我们银色北伐军一样，都是追寻着天灾军团的破坏痕迹而来。我们一半的军力都在银色前沿跟疯狂的达卡莱巨魔奋战，我们得跟黑锋骑士团会合。\n\n<兰迪加低声地抱怨了几句。>\n\n我本来想着能不用再看到那些混蛋的，圣光在上呀。",cEN="If this is the same Drakuru from Drak'Tharon Keep we are going to need... outside assistance.\n\nDeath knights of Acherus are stationed nearby, undoubtedly following the same trail of Scourge destruction that lead the Argent Crusade here. As half of our army is tied up at the Argent Stand, battling crazed Drakkari trolls, we will have to join forces with the Knights of the Ebon Blade.\n\n<Lantinga mutters under his breath.>\n\nI was hoping I'd never have to see those scoundrels again after Light's Hope..."}
Q[12884]={d="这里的西面，穿过荒废的道路和建筑之后，就是死亡骑士的营地——黑锋哨站。\n\n<北伐军领主兰迪加卷起达库鲁的命令。>\n\n把这些命令交给斯特凡·瓦杜，他是黑锋哨站死亡骑士的指挥官。告诉他，银色北伐军会对付纳瓦留斯王子，他们要做的就是解决达库鲁。\n\n对了，多加小心，$n。转至黑锋哨站的路上到处都是天灾军团。",dEN="West of here, across the ruined roads and structures, is the death knight encampment of Ebon Watch.\n\n<Crusader Lord Lantinga rolls up Drakuru's orders.>\n\nTake these orders and deliver them to Stefan Vadu. He is the death knight in command at Ebon Watch. Let him know that the Argent Crusade will deal with Prince Navarius. They'll have to handle Drakuru.\n\nBe careful, <name>. The way to Ebon Watch is teeming with Scourge.",o="将达库鲁的命令交给祖达克黑锋哨站的斯特凡·瓦杜。",oEN="Deliver the Orders From Drakuru to Stefan Vadu at Ebon Watch in Zul'Drak.",p="你那儿是什么东西，<race>？",pEN="What have you got there, <race>?",c="<斯特凡读了信，将它撕成碎片，丢入火中。>\n\n老掉牙的消息了。银色北伐军又一次晚了一步。我们从灰熊丘陵就在注意达库鲁了——他已经在我们的死亡名单上了。",cEN="<Stefan reads the missive, then crumples it up and tosses it into the fire.>\n\nOld news. The Argent Crusade is - once again - late to the party. We've been tracking Drakuru since Grizzly Hills. He is slated for eradication."}
Q[12885]={d="风暴峭壁是个充满吸引力的地方，这里不仅仅只有泰坦遗迹。居住在这里的人民遭受着由洛肯和他的部下带来的巨大威胁。\n\n他派出了他的亲信——铁矮人，残忍地向所有的岩石生物发动进攻。他把土灵赶出了奥杜尔，迫使他们只能在创世者的图书馆西面的山上避难，也就是那处被称为布德克拉格庇护所的地方。布德克拉格和他的同胞被铁矮人围困在那里。去找到他们，帮助他们，$n。",dEN="The Storm Peaks are an intriguing place, but there's far more here than titan ruins. The peoples who live here face a dire threat in Loken and his minions.\n\nHe sent his favorite servants, the iron dwarves, on a brutal campaign against all the creatures of stone. He expelled the earthen from Ulduar, forcing them to take shelter at Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the Inventor's Library. Bouldercrag and his brethren are beset by the iron dwarves there. Find and help them, <name>.",o="与布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",c="所以说你认识布莱恩·铜须了？他是我们在血肉之躯的生物中最亲近的盟友。我们像兄弟一样的对抗洛肯与他的手下，像兄弟一样的在奥杜尔奋战。",cEN="So you know Brann Bronzebeard, then? He is our closest ally among those of the flesh. We are as brothers in the struggle against Loken and his followers, in the struggle for Ulduar."}
Q[12886]={d="时机已经成熟。你通过了海德比武会的绝大多数试炼……如今只剩下最后一项。在过去的战斗中，你逐渐跻身最强大最凶残的女武士之列。\n\n最后的试炼即将开始——驭龙赛，海德比武会的价值与尚武精神的完美体现。我要你骑上幼龙，使用鱼叉击败所有竞争者。\n\n不要仁慈。没有谁会对你手下留情的。",dEN="This is it. You've passed all the tests of the Hyldsmeet... all but one. You've risen among our sisters' best and fiercest.\n\nThe final test is at hand. The Drakkensryd - the true test of a Hyldnir's worth and warrior spirit. It'll be you, your riding drake, a chained harpoon and a score of your sisters vying for dominance.\n\nShow no quarter. None will be expected.",o="使用海德尼尔鱼叉，在风暴神殿击败10名海德比武会龙骑士。获胜后对装饰石柱使用海德尼尔鱼叉以完成驭龙赛，然后与托里姆谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Hyldnir Harpoon to defeat 10 Hyldsmeet Drakeriders at the Temple of Storms. Use the Hyldnir Harpoon on a Column Ornament to exit the Drakkensryd and speak to Thorim when you've succeeded.",p="走开！",pEN="Begone!",c="西芙……是你吗？",cEN="Sif... is that you?"}
Q[12887]={d="黑锋之刃骑士团想拿下西北方那个叫暗影穹顶的天灾基地。我在他们当中有一个联系人，他请求帮助。\n\n第一步是弄瞎巫妖王。他用一件叫\"眼魔”的神器监视这一区域，它漂浮在穹顶的尖塔上方。\n\n我们的矮人为你造了对付它的东西。那只\"眼睛”被摧毁后，就在穹顶场地内找到斯莱弗男爵。他正假装仍受巫妖王意志的支配。",dEN="The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur dwarves have created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's will.",o="摧毁魔眼，然后向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报告。",oEN="Destroy The Ocular and then report to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",p="魔眼依然完好无损！萨萨里安会相信你真是一件蠢事。\n\n不管你是谁，在摧毁魔眼之前不要再来找我。我在这里的身份一定要保密！",pEN="The Ocular still stands! Thassarian was a fool to trust you.\n\nWhoever you are, don't return again until it is destroyed. My position here must not be compromised!",c="也许我们终于能做点什么了。不过不要被蒙蔽了，巫妖王还是能通过天灾军团的爪牙“监视”。\n\n那就是你来此的理由。",cEN="Perhaps now we can really get something done. Don't be fooled though, the Lich King can still 'see' through his Scourge minions.\n\nThat's why you're here."}
Q[12888]={d="这张卡片可以让用户进入名为“E型检修员”的机器人的控制面板，对机器人进行维护或重新编写机器人的指令。\n\nE型检修员似乎被指派进入创世者的图书馆内部工作。这张卡片上列出了已损坏的部件和瘫痪的系统，只要有合适的零件，机器人就能恢复到正常的工作状态。",dEN="This card allows the user to access the control panel of the scrapbot designated SCRAP-E, in order to perform maintenance and reprogram the bot's directives.\n\nSCRAP-E appears to be assigned to the interior of the building at The Inventor's Library. The card displays a list of the bot's broken components and failing systems. With the proper parts, the bot can be restored to working condition.",o="将E型检修员控制卡、4份钴螺丝和5份过载电容器交给创世者的图书馆中的E型检修员。",oEN="Bring the SCRAP-E Access Card along with 4 Handfuls of Cobalt Bolts and 5 Overcharged Capacitors to SCRAP-E at The Inventor's Library.",p="<你打开了E型检修员的控制面板。>",pEN="<You open SCRAP-E's access panel.>",c="<你开始依照操作卡片上面的数据修复机器人。当修复完成时，你关了操作面板，打开开关。>",cEN="<You begin performing the repairs indicated by the access card. When the repairs are complete, you close the access panel and throw the power switch.>"}
Q[12889]={d="名称：E型检修员。\n\n任务：在守护者米米尔离开时维护创世者的图书馆中的控制台和数据库。\n\n距离上一次维护时间：489天。\n\n结构图数据状态：未知。\n\n当前任务：修理原型机控制台。",dEN="Designation SCRAP-E.\n\nDirective: Maintain consoles and databases of Inventor's Library in Keeper Mimir's absences.\n\nTime since last maintenance cycle: 489 days.\n\nStatus of schematic data: unknown.\n\nCurrent tasks: Repair prototype console.",o="使用创世者的图书馆中的原型机控制台。",oEN="Interact with the Prototype Console in The Inventor's Library.",c="你检查了修复以后的原型机控制台的外观。起码有一张米米尔隆的图样仍在这台机器许久没保养的情况下存留下来。从图样上的图表和指示中，你知道你可以把那只机械侏儒给修复。",cEN="You examine the display on the repaired prototype console. At least one of Mimir's schematics seems to have survived the long period between maintenance cycles. From the diagrams and instructions displayed in the schematic's file, you could easily construct the mechagnome shown."}
Q[12891]={d="在我为巫妖王——啊咳——效力的时候，我们经常使用一种“统治魔棒”控制一些比较聪明的天灾成员。\n\n我要你帮忙制作一根新的统治魔棒。\n\n你很幸运，所需的材料都在附近：一根教徒的魔棒、一根憎恶的弯钩、一条恶鬼的绳子，外加一些天灾精华。\n\n这应该不难，$c。",dEN="When I was in the - ahem - employ of the Lich King, we would often use a device known as a sovereign rod to keep some of the more intelligent Scourge in line.\n\nI require that you assist me in the construction of a new one.\n\nLuckily for you, all of the necessary components are at hand: a cultist rod, an abomination hook, a geist rope, and a handful of Scourge essences.\n\nThis should not be difficult, <class>.",o="暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵要求你去收集一根教徒的魔棒、一根憎恶的弯钩、一条恶鬼的绳子和5份天灾精华。",oEN="Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault has asked you to collect a Cultist Rod, an Abomination Hook, a Geist Rope, and 5 Scourge Essences.",p="当你收集好我交代给你的材料，我就可以开始制作，加上一点我们所需的小小改造，就可以工作了。",pEN="When you've managed to acquire that which I have asked of you, I will fashion the device, with a few modifications for our purposes, and we'll be on with our business.",c="快，把他们交给我，离开我的视线！\n\n魔棒、弯钩、绳子都不用再加工。不过组成之后，我还得附上精华的浓缩，这样我们还可以再进行下一步。\n\n看起来很组成很简单，功能却很特别！",cEN="Quickly, hand them to me and stay out of sight!\n\nThe rod, the hook, and the rope are all very self-evident in their usage when combined. I just need to infuse the result with the essences and we'll be ready to proceed.\n\nIt's all very mundane in its composition, but extraordinary in its application!"}
Q[12892]={d="黑锋之刃骑士团想拿下西北方那个叫暗影穹顶的天灾基地。我在他们当中有一个联系人，他请求帮助。\n\n第一步是弄瞎巫妖王。他用一件叫\"眼魔”的神器监视这一区域，它漂浮在穹顶的尖塔上方。\n\n我们的地精为你造了对付它的东西。那只\"眼睛”被摧毁后，就在穹顶场地内找到斯莱弗男爵。他正假装仍受巫妖王意志的支配。",dEN="The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur goblins have created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's will.",o="摧毁魔眼，然后向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报告。",oEN="Destroy The Ocular and then report to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",p="魔眼依然完好无损！库尔迪拉会相信你真是一件蠢事。\n\n不管你是谁，在摧毁魔眼之前不要再来找我。我在这里的身份一定要保密！",pEN="The Ocular still stands! Koltira was a fool to trust you.\n\nWhoever you are, don't return again until it is destroyed. My position here must not be compromised!",c="也许我们终于能做点什么了。不过不要被蒙蔽了，巫妖王还是能通过天灾军团的爪牙“监视”。\n\n那就是你来此的理由。",cEN="Perhaps now we can really get something done. Don't be fooled though, the Lich King can still 'see' through his Scourge minions.\n\nThat's why you're here."}
Q[12893]={d="维尔、夜木女士和跳跃者如果能被从巫妖王的意志中解放出来，会成为对抗他的绝佳武器。至高权杖就是为此而设的。\n\n你会在穹顶东西两侧的突出平台上，以及我们上方穹顶的中层找到他们。权杖要用在这三者的尸体上。\n\n快飞去吧。他们将成为我们的人！",dEN="Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper would make excellent weapons in the fight against the Lich King if they can be broken from his will. That is what the Sovereign Rod is for.\n\nYou'll find them on the ledges to the east and west of the vault, as well as on the mid-tier of the vault above us. The rod is to be used upon the corpses of the three.\n\nFly now. We will have them as our own!",o="暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵希望你在劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者的尸体上使用统治魔棒。",oEN="Baron Sliver at the Shadow Vault wants you to use the Sovereign Rod on the corpses of Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper.",p="你还没有转化他们。别侮辱我的智商，<class>！",pEN="You have NOT turned them yet. Do not insult my intelligence, <class>!",c="当我们拿下暗影拱顶以后，我们会好好的利用他们三个的。\n\n说到这个……",cEN="We will put those three to good use once we finally take the vault.\n\nSpeaking of which...."}
Q[12894]={d="几天前，北伐军战士达加斯、马克拉尔、工程师里德、双胞胎戈尔克和布尔被派往死亡旷野创建前沿阵地。我最后一次同他们通信时，他们已经在西北方死亡旷野的边界上创建起了一座营地。\n\n根据这份新近发现的与达库鲁和纳瓦留斯王子相关的情报来看，我想我们必须马上派人转至北伐军前线营地。\n\n做好准备，$n。现在就出发！",dEN="Crusader Dargath, Crusader MacKellar, Engineer Reed and the twins, Gerk and Burr, were sent to the Dead Fields to establish a battle front days ago. As of my last correspondence with them, they had successfully established a camp on the border of the Dead Fields, northwest of here.\n\nIn light of this newfound information about Drakuru and Prince Navarius I think it would be prudent to send someone to the Crusader Forward Camp post-haste.\n\nPack up your belongings, <name>. You must leave at once!",o="在祖达克的北伐军前线营地寻找北伐军战士马克拉尔。",oEN="Seek out Crusader MacKellar at the Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak.",c="在天灾军团发动攻击之前，事情都进行得很顺利。他们抓走了达加斯、戈尔克和布尔，而且也毁掉了我们的坦克车。猜猜是谁领导这波攻击的？\n\n<马克拉尔拉点了点头。>\n\n纳瓦留斯……\n\n这整个地方似乎是天灾军团的某种工厂。而我们正处在天杀的天灾雷区正中央！",cEN="Everything was fine until the Scourge attacked. They took off with Dargath, Gerk and Burr and they also destroyed our ride. Guess who led that attack?\n\n<MacKellar nods.>\n\nNavarius...\n\nSeems this whole area is some type of factory for Scourge. We're in the middle of a damned undead mine field!"}
Q[12895]={d="在动身出发之前，我曾经收到斥候沃塔肯翻译整理的有关布莱恩·铜须的文件。从布莱恩的日记和灰熊丘陵的发现来看，布莱恩肯定已经动身转至风暴峭壁了。在我们坠机之前，我发现在这里南边的山底平原对面有个露营地，俯瞰着冻结的伯尔之息河。\n\n如果布莱恩不在那里的话，就在营地一带找找，看那个该死的矮人有没有留下什么线索。如果你找到任何线索的话，把它带回来给我。",dEN="Before we left, I received the file Scout Vor'takh compiled on this Brann Bronzebeard. There can be no doubt that Brann was headed for the Storm Peaks from his journal entries and findings in Grizzly Hills. Before we crashed, I caught sight of a campsite south of here, across the Foot Steppes, and overlooking the frozen Bor's Breath River.\n\nIf Brann isn't there, search the camp and its environs for any clues as to where that blasted dwarf might've gone. Bring back anything you find.",o="在布莱恩的营地中找到用麻布裹起来的便笺，把它交给格罗玛什坠毁点的伯克塔·血怒。",oEN="Retrieve the Burlap-Wrapped Note from Brann's camp and return it to Boktar Bloodfury at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你在铜须的营地找到什么吗？",pEN="Did you have any luck finding Bronzebeard's camp?",c="当然以我们的运气来说，我早就预料到了。嗯，我们不会让他这么简单地就跑走。让我们看看信笺上写些什么。",cEN="Of course, with our luck, I probably could've predicted this. Well, we're not going to let him get away that easily. Let's see what that note says."}
Q[12896]={d="除非是最特别的情况下，像莱斯班恩将军这样强大的死亡骑士，都被巫妖王紧紧地控制着，根本不能转化。\n\n莱斯班恩将军在拱顶内部监督着新武器的制作流程。我向你保证，只要弄乱北部熔炉那里的武器架，他一定会冲过来的。我会派劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者去帮助你。\n\n如果我们想得到暗影拱顶，就必须干掉莱斯班恩将军！",dEN="Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",o="击败莱斯班恩将军，然后向联盟飞行战舰上的萨萨里安报捷。",oEN="Defeat General Lightsbane and then report your success back to Thassarian aboard the gunship, The Skybreaker.",p="我问你，<name>，如果莱斯班恩将军还活着，我们为什么又会说起话来？",pEN="I ask you, <name>, why would we be speaking again if General Lightsbane yet exists?",c="莱斯班恩将军和他的部队都被击败了？暗影拱顶已经陷落了？",cEN="General Lightsbane and his forces are defeated? The Shadow Vault is taken?"}
Q[12897]={d="除非是最特别的情况下，像莱斯班恩将军这样强大的死亡骑士，都被巫妖王紧紧地控制着，根本不能转化。\n\n莱斯班恩将军在拱顶内部监督着新武器的制作流程。我向你保证，只要弄乱北部熔炉那里的武器架，他一定会冲过来的。我会派劣尸维尔、奈丝伍德夫人和跳线者去帮助你。\n\n如果我们想得到暗影拱顶，就必须干掉莱斯班恩将军！",dEN="Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",o="击败莱斯班恩将军，然后向部落飞行战舰上的库尔迪拉·织亡者报捷。",oEN="Defeat General Lightsbane and then report your success back to Koltira Deathweaver aboard the gunship, Orgrim's Hammer.",c="莱斯班恩将军和他的部队都被击败了？暗影拱顶已经陷落了？",cEN="General Lightsbane and his forces are defeated? The Shadow Vault is taken?"}
Q[12898]={d="你干得非常好。而且你还为黑锋骑士团赢得了三位非常重要的伙伴。\n\n<萨萨里安注视着远方的地平线。>\n\n你应该回去了。现在，斯利文男爵和其它的死亡骑士正在为了保卫暗影拱顶，与天灾军团进行着激烈的战斗。\n\n我相信他们需要你的帮助。",dEN="It sounds like you did extremely well. And you secured three very important allies for the Knights of the Ebon Blade in the process.\n\n<Thassarian gazes out over the horizon.>\n\nYou should head back. By now, Baron Sliver and the other death knights will be fighting tooth and nail to hold The Shadow Vault against the might of the Scourge.\n\nI'm sure they'll need your help.",o="向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报到。",oEN="Report back to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",c="你回来了，做得好。如你所见，我们在这里忙到无暇分身。",cEN="Good of you to return. As you can see, we have our hands full here."}
Q[12899]={d="你干得非常好。而且你还为黑锋骑士团赢得了三位非常重要的伙伴。\n\n<库尔迪拉注视着远方的地平线。>\n\n你应该回去了。现在，斯利文男爵和其它的死亡骑士正在为了保卫暗影拱顶，与天灾军团进行着激烈的战斗。\n\n我相信他们需要你的帮助。",dEN="It sounds like you did extremely well. And you secured three very important allies for the Knights of the Ebon Blade in the process.\n\n<Koltira gazes down at the map on the floor.>\n\nYou should head back. By now, Baron Sliver and the other death knights will be fighting tooth and nail to hold The Shadow Vault against the might of the Scourge.\n\nI'm sure they'll need your help.",o="向暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵报到。",oEN="Report back to Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",c="你回来了，做得好。如你所见，我们在这里忙到无暇分身。",cEN="Good of you to return. As you can see, we have our hands full here."}
Q[12900]={d="这么说你想骑熊咯？好吧，既然你已经到了这一步，那么你肯定得去海德比武会试一试了。\n\n先做重要的事，我们要给你制作一副挽具。\n\n你可以在南面的峭壁上找到三五成群的雪人。它们的毛皮非常坚韧，而且厚度也正合适。帮我拿些毛皮回来，我们开始朝着让你骑上熊的目标努力吧。",dEN="So you want to ride? Well, if you've made it this far someone must think you've got a shot at the Hyldsmeet.\n\nFirst things first; we'll have to make you a harness.\n\nIn the cliffs to the south, you'll find scattered groups of yeti. Their hides are tough and just the right thickness. Bring me some and we'll get you started on the path of the bear-rider.",o="布伦希尔达村的艾丝崔·约利塔尔希望你交给她3张冰鬃雪人的毛皮。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar in Brunnhildar Village wants you to obtain 3 Icemane Yeti Hides.",p="你找到毛皮了没？你可以在下方的山丘找到雪人。",pEN="Did you find the hides yet? You'll find yeti in the hills below.",c="这些毛皮很不错。我立刻就会为你准备好挽具。",cEN="These will do nicely. I'll have the harness ready for you in no time."}
Q[12901]={d="我们一定要阻止纳瓦留斯王子。不能让天灾继续把这个地方当作他们的僵尸制造场。如果我们能让坦克运转起来的话，也许还有机会。现在，我需要一些配件来修补坦克。\n\n在这里的西北方，有个被称为塞穆之末的地方，天灾军团把那里当作基地。基地周围散布着它们到来之后留下的废料，零碎的天灾金属被扔得到处都是。帮我拿些天灾金属废料回来，我会让它们物尽其用的。",dEN="Prince Navarius must be stopped. We can't let the Scourge continue to use this area as a zombie factory. If we can get the tank operational we might stand a chance. What I need right now are spare parts.\n\nNorthwest of here is an area called Thrym's End. The Scourge armies are using the area as a base of sorts. Spread out across the base is the wreckage from their arrival. Bits and pieces of Scourge scrap metal litter the landscape. Get that stuff to me and I'll try and put it to good use.",o="北伐军前线营地的工程师里德要求你收集10块天灾金属废料。",oEN="Engineer Reed at Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak has asked that you recover 10 pieces of Scourge Scrap Metal.",p="<name>，我真的不知道这个计划行不行得通。你只要把废金属带给我，我尽力而为。",pEN="I really don't know if this plan will work, <name>. Just bring me the scrap metal and I'll do what I can.",c="这个垃圾到底是什么！啊，全都去死吧！这没有用。天灾金属没办法利用。我们到底该怎么办？",cEN="What is this junk! Ah, damn it all! It's useless. Scourge metal isn't gonna do the trick. What are we going to do?"}
Q[12902]={d="这群可怜的家伙是仅存的幸存者。\n\n按照他们酋长话来说，达卡莱巨魔同怒爪狼獾人已经结盟几千年了。他们世世代代同巨魔一起生活在这里，完全没有注意到周围发生的变化。对于怒爪狼獾人来说，巨魔依然是原来的巨魔，所以当巨魔向他们的巢穴发动进攻时，狼獾人完全吓傻了。\n\n我们需要答案，$n。去东南方的狼獾人村庄寻找线索，找出是谁该为这件事情负责。",dEN="These poor creatures are the only survivors.\n\nAccording to their chief, the Drakkari trolls and Rageclaw wolvar have been allies for thousands of years. They've been living here, alongside the trolls, for generations, completely unaware of the ever changing world around them. To the Rageclaw, a troll is a troll, so the troll attack upon their den took them by surprise.\n\nWe need some answers, <name>. Scour their village - southeast of here - for clues as to who or what is in charge of these attacks.",o="转至怒爪巢穴寻找线索，查出向怒爪狼獾人发动进攻的幕后主使。",oEN="Search Rageclaw Den for a clue about who or what initiated the attacks against the Rageclaw Wolvar.",c="在这座奇怪的祭坛上方漂浮着一个卷轴。这一定就是北伐军领主兰迪加要找的东西！",cEN="There is a scroll floating in the air above the strange altar. This must be what Crusader Lord Lantinga is looking for!"}
Q[12903]={d="我们遭到了纳瓦留斯王子和至少一打天灾军团的袭击。我叫达加斯和那对双胞胎待在坦克里，但他们不听。达加斯直视着我的眼睛说：\"如果没人从这辆坦克里出去，他们就会把我们全杀了。\"然后他让里德关掉引擎，冲了出去。那是我一生中见过最英勇的事。\n\n我听到王子对那群怪物吼着命令。听起来他正在把它们带往此地西北方的塞穆之末。我们必须救出我们的朋友。你能去找他们吗？",dEN="We were attacked by Prince Navarius and at least a dozen Scourge. I told Dargath and the twins to stay inside the tank, but they wouldn't listen. Dargath looked me in the eyes and said, \"If somebody doesn't get out of this tank, they'll kill us all.\" He then made Reed cut the engine and charged. Most heroic thing I've ever seen.\n\nI heard the Prince barking orders to the monsters. Sounded like he was taking them to Thrym's End, northwest of here. We have to rescue our friends. Will you go look for them?",o="北伐军前线营地的北伐军战士马克拉尔要求你找到北伐军战士达加斯、戈尔克和布尔。",oEN="Crusader MacKellar at Crusader Forward Camp has asked that you find Crusader Dargath, Gerk and Burr.",c="他们三个做出了伟大的牺牲，我们不会忘记的。他们的死亡不会白费。我们终将获胜！",cEN="It was a great sacrifice that those three made and it won't soon be forgotten. Their passing will not be in vain. We will be victorious!"}
Q[12904]={d="他们……他们杀死了我的兄弟。\n\n<戈尔克强忍着泪水。>\n\n他们……他们就像宰杀动物一样把他杀死了。现在他们还把我的兄弟放在营地另一端的石板上，准备进行实验。达加斯也死了。这位圣骑士在东北方的废墟中英勇抵抗，但瓦古维库人的首领奥贾尔实在是太强大了。\n\n我是唯一的幸存者，但我也支撑不了多久了。我……我快要不行了。\n\n如果圣光不能为我复仇，或许你可以，$c。把他们全部消灭。",dEN="They... They killed my brother.\n\n<Gerk fights back tears.>\n\nSlaughtered him like he was some sort of animal. Now they got him laid out on one of their tables on the other side of the camp, ready for their grizzly experiments. Dargath's dead too. The paladin made a heroic stand at the ruins to the northeast, but the leader of the Vargul, Algar, was too strong.\n\nI'm all that's left and I'll be dead soon too. I... I'm turning.\n\nIf the Light won't grant me vengeance, maybe you will, <class>. Kill them all.",o="祖达克塞穆之末的戈尔克要你杀死 15 名瓦古。|n",oEN="Gerk at Thrym's End in Zul'Drak wants you to kill 15 Vargul.",p="你是在帮这世界的忙，朋友。一定得阻止这些怪物！",pEN="You're doing the world a favor, friend. These monsters must be stopped!",c="<戈尔克濒死，并断断续续对你说着话。>\n\n他……他们说这些瓦古是……是巫妖王觉得没用的家伙们。你……你能想……想象吗？想想……想想那些有……用的家伙会有多强……\n\n我会在另一个世界为你祈祷，英雄……愿你永远也不会面对他们。",cEN="<Gerk is dying.>\n\nTh... They say these Vargul are the... the ones that weren't found worthy by the Lich King. Can... Can you im... imagine it? Just th... think how powerful the... the... worthy must be...\n\nI'll say a prayer for you in the hereafter, hero... May you never have to face them in number."}
Q[12905]={d="那就说定了，$n。你帮我摆脱这些锁链，我就帮你找到你那个绿皮肤小朋友。\n\n管理这座矿场的海德尼尔人叫残酷的米尔德里德——名副其实。\n\n告诉她你是被派来矿场帮忙的。照她要求的做，直到她放心把打开我镣铐的钥匙交给你。",dEN="Our deal is made then, <name>. You help me get out of these chains and I'll help you find your little green friend.\n\nThe Hyldnir who runs this mine is known as Mildred the Cruel -- and with good reason.\n\nTell her you've been sent to lend a hand with the mines. Do whatever she asks until she trusts you with the keys to my shackles.",o="在荒弃矿洞内与残酷的米尔德蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Mildred the Cruel inside the Forlorn Mine.",c="我正期待有人能来替换我的其中一个监工。你也差不多该出现了。\n\n来吧，让我们替你安排一些工作。",cEN="I was expecting a replacement for one of my overseers. It's about time you showed up.\n\nLet's put you to work."}
Q[12906]={d="我就直接了当地说吧。在矿洞里为我们工作的男性维库人都不是心甘情愿的……他们只是暂时屈服而已。\n\n每隔一段时间，他们中总是会有几个人失去动力。找到那些不合作的维库人，用这根训诫之杖好好吓唬一下他们。\n\n他们也该清醒清醒了。",dEN="Let's start you off with something straightforward. The male vrykul that work the mines for us do so against their will... purely out of fear of our blades.\n\nOnce in a while, one of them will lose their motivation. Find any uncooperative vrykul and put them in their place.\n\nTake this disciplining rod. You'll want to inflict pain, not death. Well, most of the time anyway.",o="荒弃矿洞中的残酷的米尔德蕾要求你使用训诫之杖威吓6个筋疲力尽的维库人。",oEN="Mildred the Cruel at the Forlorn Mine wants you to use the Disciplining Rod on 6 Exhausted Vrykul.",p="完成了吗？我希望你没有杀掉太多维库杂种。我们还需要人手。",pEN="Is it done? I hope you didn't slay too many of the mongrels. We need the manpower.",c="对一个新任监工来说还算不错了。如果你还有足够的勇气，我还有另一项任务要给你。",cEN="Not bad for a new overseer. I've another task for you if you're feeling brave today."}
Q[12907]={d="任何事情都会有两面性，我的姐妹。维库人已经不能再忍受高压了，他们逐渐开始有了反抗的念头。\n\n带头的家伙名叫加哈尔。为了进一步证明你的忠诚，去把他干掉……记得一定要当众下手，好好警告一下那些维库人。",dEN="For every action there is an opposite reaction, sister. In the case of us applying pressure on the males, this has meant newly spread rumors of insurrection.\n\nThe bearded pig behind this rabble-rousing is called Garhal. Put an end to him... and make sure the other males see his demise. They must learn that insubordination will not be tolerated.",o="荒弃矿洞内的残酷的米尔德蕾命令你去处死加哈尔。",oEN="Mildred the Cruel at the Forlorn Mine wants you to slay Garhal.",p="你回来了。你有没有杀死那头不听话的猪？",pEN="You're back. Did you kill the insubordinate pig?",c="如果说你刚来的时候我对你的能力有任何存疑，那么现在都烟消云散了——只要再努力一点，你就能够成为我的永久成员。",cEN="If I had any reservations regarding your commitment when you first arrived, I no longer have any. With just a little more effort you could be a permanent member of my operation."}
Q[12908]={d="你真是心狠手辣啊，不错，我相信你会表现得非常好。\n\n我还有一个任务要交给你。有一个女性维库人囚犯越来越让我不能容忍了。\n\n她竟敢宣称要有参加海德比武会的权利，那可是我们最神圣的格斗比赛！\n\n这是打开她枷锁的钥匙。下手快一点，让她少吃点苦。尽管她不是我们的人，但她毕竟是个女性。",dEN="You are without mercy. You will do well around these parts.\n\nI have another task to ask of you. There is a female vrykul prisoner that's become more of a liability than I had anticipated.\n\nShe had the gall to claim the right to take part in the Hyldsmeet, our sacred competition of strength and fighting prowess.\n\nHere's the key to her shackles. Make it as painless as possible. She's a female after all, even if not one of us.",o="把米尔德蕾的钥匙交给荒弃矿洞的女巫洛莉拉。",oEN="Take Mildred's Key to Lok'lira the Crone in the Forlorn Mine.",p="时间也差不多了。",pEN="It's about time.",c="我就知道你会回来！快把这些镣铐弄掉，我就会帮你找到那个地精。",cEN="I knew you'd be back! Get me out of these shackles and I'll help you find the goblin."}
Q[12909]={d="我们必须依赖嗅觉敏锐而且跟踪能力超强的动物才有可能找到布莱恩。虽然地精飞艇上没有猎犬，但是也并非只有猎犬才能承担起这样的任务。\n\n飞艇坠毁后，我派凯尔莉丝去东边的山里打猎了。她那只名叫霜齿的小豹子是很擅长雪地狩猎的，你不如和她谈谈，让她把宠物借给你一用。就算没有霜齿，她也能获取猎物。但是对我们来说，想要寻找布莱恩·铜须，这是唯一的办法。",dEN="In order to track down Brann, we're going to need a creature with a keen sense of smell and a good tracking ability. There weren't any hounds on the zeppelin, but I think I have a substitute.\n\nAfter the crash, I sent Khaliisi down the east face of the mountain to start hunting for food. Her cat, Frostbite, excels at tracking prey in the snow. Tell her that she'll have to part with her companion for a while, at least. She can hunt on her own, but we have no other way of catching up to Brann Bronzebeard.",o="转至格罗玛什坠毁点以东的山麓，与凯尔莉丝谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Khaliisi at the foot of the mountain east of the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",c="所以说伯克塔给霜齿派了份任务？好吧，这最好是特别重要的任务——他应该知道宠物跟猎人是不能分开的！",cEN="So Boktar has volunteered Frostbite for an errand, eh? Well, this had better be important. He knows better than to try to separate a hunter from her pet!"}
Q[12910]={d="这次博克塔可以如愿了，但我指望他补偿我。别那样看着我。博克塔也许是指挥官，但没人能指挥猎人该做什么。\n\n“把那头野兽收起来，”他说。“让它别吼了。”\n\n可一旦对他有利，他马上就改主意。下次他再抱怨，霜咬就轻轻咬他一口。别担心，她会非常出色地追踪你的猎物。等她找到目标后，对付铁矮人、布莱恩，或者不管你遇到什么，就全靠你自己了。 $g霜咬:霜咬;",dEN="Boktar can have his way this time, but I'll expect him to make it up to me. Don't look at me like that. Boktar may be in command, but no one tells a hunter what to do.\n\n'Put that beast away,' he says. 'Make it stop growling.'\n\nAll of a sudden he changes his mind when it suits him. Next time he complains, Frostbite'll just nip him a bit. Don't worry, she'll do an admirable job tracking your prey. After she locates her target, you're on your own to deal with iron dwarves, or Brann, or whatever you find.",o="骑上霜齿，让它带你寻找布莱恩的便笺上的气味的源头。然后找到布莱恩的通讯器，使用它与布莱恩·铜须取得联系。",oEN="Mount Frostbite and ride her to the source of the scent from Brann's note. Then, recover Brann's Communicator and use it to make contact with Brann Bronzebeard.",p="你……你是谁？",pEN="Who... who're you?",c="<当你引导了通讯器之后一个矮人的影像浮现出来。他一定就是布莱恩·铜须。>\n\n<从他脸上的表情看来，布莱恩看到你似乎很震惊，然后他开始狂乱的比划手势。>",cEN="<An image of a dwarf appears as you activate the communicator. It can only be Brann Bronzebeard.>\n\n<From the look on his face, Brann seems shocked to see you and begins gesturing furiously.>"}
Q[12912]={d="你和别人不一样，$g小家伙:小家伙;。你身上没有那种远古死亡的气息。也许你可以被信任。\n\n我是基梅尔，风暴巨人之王。我被我的兄弟提亚西引到这里——他如今是巫妖王的亡灵仆从。等我意识到他的求助是个陷阱时，已经太迟了。我现在是天灾军团的囚徒，恐怕很快就将遭受和其他许多风暴巨人相同的命运。\n\n想办法把我从这牢笼中释放出来，我会尽我所能帮助你。",dEN="You are not like the others, little one. You do not reek of the ancient death. Perhaps you can be trusted.\n\nI am Gymer, king of the storm giants. I was lured here by my brother, Thiassi, now an undead servant of the Lich King. By the time I realized that his cry for help was a trap, it was too late. I am now a prisoner of the Scourge and I fear that soon I will suffer the same fate as many of the other storm giants.\n\nFind a way to release me from this cage and I will aid you to the best of my ability.",o="风暴巨人之王盖米尔要求你想办法把他从笼子里面救出来。与北伐军前线营地的工程师里德谈谈该怎么办。",oEN="Gymer, King of Storm Giants, has asked you to find a way to release him from his cage. Speak with Engineer Reed at the Crusader Forward Camp.",c="一头……一头风暴巨人？我不确定这事，<name>。听起来很冒险。另一方面，我想我们也没有太多别的选择。\n\n如果我这么做，你得向我保证，让你那位巨人朋友帮我们对付纳瓦留斯和他的亲信。",cEN="A... A storm giant? I don't know about this, <name>. That sounds risky. On the other hand, I don't think we have too many other options.\n\nIf I do this you have to promise me that you will get your giant friend to help us deal with Navarius and his cronies."}
Q[12913]={d="<布莱恩手上比划着，用他的母语说道。>\n\nRuk MogOth red a mogoth ta eft Thros-garE Haldir。\n\nKha gor ruk khaz ta ke ruk hrim eft thros-am-kha ruk kost-um havar go kost。\n\nA modoss hine ruk bergum eft thros-am-kha ga eft Haldir ke loch Thon we lo gefrunon ta mitta。\n\nGar Ruk dagUm loch angor-magi ta har ruk！\n\n<过了一会儿，你意识到这种谈话根本不会有任何结果。或许格罗玛什坠毁点的萨满祭司莫塔哈·风魂知道该怎么办。>",dEN="<Brann begins gesticulating wildly and rambling in his native language.>\n\nRuk MogOth red a mogoth ta eft Thros-garE Haldir.\n\nKha gor ruk khaz ta ke ruk hrim eft thros-am-kha ruk kost-um havar go kost.\n\nA modoss hine ruk bergum eft thros-am-kha ga eft Haldir ke loch Thon we lo gefrunon ta mitta.\n\nGar Ruk dagUm loch angor-magi ta har ruk!\n\n<After a few moments, you realize the conversation is going nowhere. Perhaps the shaman, Moteha Windborn, at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site will know what to do.>",o="与格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",c="你没找到布莱恩，伯克塔一定会不高兴的。不过起码你不是空手而回。现在，让我们来看看该如何处理这个唠唠叨叨的矮人。",cEN="Bartok will not be happy that you didn't find Brann, but at least you didn't come back empty-handed. Now, let's see what we can do about this babbling dwarf."}
Q[12914]={d="你说他被锁在了一只100尺高的笼子里？\n\n如果我的计算无误的话，我们至少应该能让笼子的转轴变得不那么坚固，这样巨人就可以逃出来了。\n\n如果想要实施这个计划，我就需要一些增塑剂和稳定剂。\n\n女妖精华应该是很好的增塑剂，你可以到东北边的死亡旷野去，从那里的女妖身上得到它们。西南方黑锋哨站附近的大地狂怒者身上有我要的稳定剂。\n\n开始行动吧！",dEN="Now you say that he's locked up in a 100 foot tall cage, eh?\n\nIf my calculations are correct, we should be able to at least weaken the hinges on the cage, giving the giant enough leeway to break out.\n\nIf this is going to work I'm going to need some plasticizers and stabilizers.\n\nBanshee essence should do nicely for the plasticizer. You can get that from the banshees in the Dead Fields, northeast of us. The stabilizer can be found on the earthragers to the southwest, near Ebon Watch.\n\nGet a move on!",o="北伐军前线营地的工程师里德希望你交给他6份女妖精华和6份硅藻土。",oEN="Engineer Reed at Crusader Forward Camp in Zul'Drak wants you to bring him 6 Banshee Essence and 6 Diatomaceous Earth.",p="没有塑化剂与稳定剂的话我永远不能做出能够破坏囚牢的炸药。",pEN="Without the plasticizers and stabilizers I'll never be able to make the explosives necessary to break your friend out of jail.",c="幸亏我们并不缺炸药。有了你带来的材料要组装出超超超大爆盐炸药就很简单。",cEN="Thankfully we weren't in short supply of explosives. Putting together the jumbo seaforium charge should be no problem with the materials you brought me."}
Q[12915]={d="如果要从我兄弟手中夺到造物者圣台的控制权，我就必须先想办法修复与旧日盟友之间的关系。\n\n或许我与冰霜巨人可以通过对抗共同的敌人，开始着手恢复彼此的友谊。\n\n弗约恩正在率领铁巨人围攻丹尼芬雷。你必须在东边的弗约恩之砧击败他，并痛击他的部队，帮助霍迪尔之子赢得胜利。\n\n带上这枚符咒吧，$n。你可以用它召唤我的土灵助阵。",dEN="If I hope to wrest control of the Temple of the Makers from my brother, I must make amends with my old allies.\n\nPerhaps by eliminating a common enemy, we may at least take a step towards renewing my friendship with the frost giants.\n\nFjorn has besieged Dun Niffelem with giants of iron. You must defeat him at Fjorn's Anvil, far to the east of here, and weaken his forces sufficiently for the Sons of Hodir to emerge victorious.\n\nTake this charm, <name>. Use it to summon my earthen to your aid.",o="风暴神殿的托里姆要你转至丹尼芬雷东边的弗约恩之砧，杀死弗约恩和5名雷铸铁巨人。\n\n你可以使用托里姆的大地符咒召唤他的土灵助战。必须借助弗约恩之砧附近的花岗岩石块才能使用这枚符咒。",oEN="Thorim at the Temple of Storms wants you to Kill Fjorn and 5 Stormforged Iron Giants at Fjorn's Anvil, east of Dun Niffelem.\n\nUsing Thorim's Charm of Earth will summon his Earthen to fight by your side. The charm requires a Granite Boulder from nearby Fjorn's Anvil.",p="弗约恩还活着吗，<class>？",pEN="Does Fjorn still live, <class>?",c="所以，你已经完成了任务。\n\n希望这样足够了。",cEN="So, it is done then.\n\nLet us hope it is enough."}
Q[12916]={d="我要给你的东西被称为爆盐炸弹，它是使用特殊材料制成的强力炸药。由于它的可塑性，你可以把它塞进牢笼的转轴结合处，以寻求最大的爆炸威力。\n\n去你朋友那里，用这枚巨型爆盐炸弹把他救出来吧。\n\n希望他是个守信的家伙。他是我们唯一的希望了。",dEN="What I'm about to give you is called seaforium. It is a highly volatile explosive with some unique properties. Due to its malleable nature, you will be able to fill in the hinges and cracks of the cage for maximum damage.\n\nReturn to your friend and use the jumbo seaforium charge to set him free.\n\nLet's hope he honors the bargain. He's our only hope.",o="在祖达克的塞穆之末使用巨型爆盐炸弹，打开囚禁着盖米尔的天灾围栏，然后与盖米尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Gymer at Thrym's End in Zul'Drak once you have used the Jumbo Seaforium Charge to open the Scourge Enclosure that is holding him prisoner.",p="我是个信守诺言的巨人，小家伙。",pEN="I am a giant of my word, little one.",c="自由！\n\n不要害怕，小家伙。盖米尔是值得敬重的巨人。就像你与你的人民一样，我也希望看到天灾军团被逐出这块土地，也希望看到巫妖王被消灭。我会尽我所能地帮助你，就像我答应过你的一样。",cEN="FREEDOM!\n\nDo not be afraid, little one. Gymer is an honorable giant. Like you and your people, I too wish to see the Scourge driven away from this land and the Lich King destroyed. I will help you, as promised, to the best of my ability."}
Q[12917]={d="如果不是运气够好的话，我们恐怕不能这么轻易地找到布莱恩。如果我们能知道布莱恩在说些什么，你就能劝他说出自己的位置了。\n\n附近群山中的风力很强，这对我们而言是件好事。一个知识渊博的萨满祭司可以通过风的声音理解全世界所有的语言。\n\n我要你到西北方的雪流平原去，寻找由风构成的生物——风暴骑士。去捕捉它们的声音，把那声音带回来给我。",dEN="I suppose we shouldn't have expected to find Brann so easily, not with our luck. If we can make sense of what Brann is saying, you can persuade him to give up his location.\n\nThe power of the wind is strong in these mountains, and it may prove a great boon to us. A knowledgeable shaman can hear the sound of all the world's tongues on the wind.\n\nTo the northwest, on the Snowdrift Plains, you will find beings made of wind, the stormriders. Capture their voices and bring them to me.",o="将5份寒风之声交给格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂。",oEN="Bring 5 Voices of the Wind to Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你把寒风之声带来了吗？",pEN="Have you brought the wind's voices?",c="现在你应该能与矮人沟通了，去问问伯克塔对你有什么要求。我们不能再浪费时间了。",cEN="You should be able to communicate with the dwarf now. Ask Boktar what he requires of you. There is little time to lose."}
Q[12918]={d="看来刺骨的寒风已经吹到这里来了？现在不仅仅是缺少欣赏我手艺的顾客，而且我也没有库存的宝石可以出售了！如果你能弄些未切割的宝石来补充我的库存，我可以教你切割完美宝石的技术。切割完美宝石能让你在切割诺森德地区出产的优秀质量宝石时，有机会切割出一颗具有更高属性的完美宝石。",dEN="It has the cold of the Icewyrm's breath up here does it not? Not only do I lack customers for my crafting skills, but I also lack stock of gems to sell! If you can bring me several uncut gems to replenish my stocks, I can teach you the skill of gem perfection. This will allow you to sometimes cut a perfect gem with increased bonuses when cutting a uncommon quality gem from Northrend.",o="将茶晶石、黑玉和暗影水晶各两颗交给瓦加德的恩霍罗。",oEN="Return two Huge Citrines, two Dark Jade and two Shadow Crystals to Ounhulo in Valgarde.",p="你真大方。我会教你如何切割完美宝石作为回报的。",pEN="You are most generous. The least I can do is to teach you the skills of gem perfection.",c="这些用来补充我的货架再适合不过了。我不仅要教你如何切割完美宝石，我也会帮你把这些宝石的其中一颗切成完美宝石当作对你的回报。",cEN="These are perfect for replenishing my stock. Not only will I teach you the art of gemcutting perfection, but I cut one of them gems into its perfect form which you may have as a reward."}
Q[12919]={d="我的人民被巫妖王屠戮殆尽。如今天灾军团用风暴巨人的尸体制造没有心智的血肉巨人，或者更糟——像塞穆那样拼凑而成的畸形怪物。\n\n不把他们全部赶出这个世界，我绝不罢休。我们将携手摧毁威胁祖达克的天灾军团。\n\n我们要把他们全杀掉：纳瓦留斯、阿尔加和塞穆！\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;，告诉我，我们就开始这场毁灭之旅。",dEN="My people have been decimated by the Lich King. The Scourge now use the corpses of storm giants to create mindless flesh giants, or worse, stitched together aberrations like Thrym.\n\nI will stop at nothing to see them all driven from this world. We will work together to destroy the Scourge that threaten Zul'Drak.\n\nWe will kill them all: Navarius, Algar and Thrym!\n\nWhen you are ready, let me know and we will begin our destructive journey.",o="与盖米尔交谈以开始行动。\n\n骑着盖米尔去消灭100个天灾士兵，并消灭天选者奥贾尔、塞穆和纳瓦留斯王子。成功之后，向北伐军前线营地的北伐军战士马克拉尔报告。",oEN="Speak with Gymer to begin.\n\nWhile riding Gymer, destroy 100 Scourge and kill Algar the Chosen, Thrym and Prince Navarius. Report to Crusader MacKellar at Crusader Forward Camp should you succeed.",p="怎么样了？我们的敌人全死了吗？",pEN="What is going on? Are our enemies dead?",c="难以置信！这会成为流传千古的故事，<name>！一个人骑在风暴巨人之王的头上，歼灭了一整支天灾军队！\n\n而我在现场目睹了这一切……",cEN="Unbelievable! This will be a story for the ages, <name>! One man rode upon the head of the king of storm giants and decimated an entire Scourge army!\n\nAnd I was there to see it all happen..."}
Q[12920]={d="你还在等什么？多亏了莫塔哈的帮助，语言障碍已经解决了。去联络布莱恩·铜须吧，找出他的藏身之所，问问他究竟在跟踪什么。\n\n或许我们还能在这场灾难中挽救一点什么。",dEN="What are you waiting for? The language barrier has been broken, thanks to Moteha. Contact Brann Bronzebeard and find out anything you can about where he's hiding and what he's chasing after.\n\nMaybe we can still salvage something from this disaster.",o="使用布莱恩的通讯器与布莱恩·铜须联络并与他交谈，然后与格罗玛什坠毁的伯克塔·血怒谈一谈。\n\n如果你遗失了布莱恩的通讯器，可以找格罗玛什坠毁点的莫塔哈·风魂再要一个。",oEN="Use Brann's Communicator to contact Brann Bronzebeard and speak with him, then speak to Boktar Bloodfury at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.\n\nIf you lose Brann's Communicator, speak with Moteha Windborn at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What did you find out?",c="<伯克塔聆听你叙述与布莱恩的对话。>\n\n矮人说的是真的，沃塔肯的计划不是部落的手法。如果布莱恩·铜须知道阻止铁矮人和他们幕后黑手的方法，那么帮助他对我们来说也很有利。",cEN="<Boktar listens as you describe your conversation with Brann.>\n\nThere's truth to the dwarf's words. Vor'takh's plan is not the way of the Horde. If Brann Bronzebeard knows of a way to stop these iron dwarves and their patron, it serves us to help him."}
Q[12921]={d="好极了。矿井的东面尽头处有一个通向布伦希尔达村的出口。沿着这条路走，我们在村子里汇合。\n\n不能让别人看见我们在一起，这样就不会有人怀疑你在帮我了。我会用魔法给自己加上伪装。别担心，$r——我们很快就能找到你的朋友了。",dEN="Excellent. There's an exit in the eastern end of the mine that leads to Brunnhildar Village. Follow it and I'll meet you there.\n\nWe must not be seen together so no one suspects you of aiding me. I'll use my magic to disguise my appearance. Do not worry, <race> -- we'll find your friend in no time.",o="到布伦希尔达村与女巫洛莉拉汇合。",oEN="Reconvene with Lok'lira the Crone in Brunnhildar Village.",c="你来了——很好。我想我知道你的地精在哪里了。",cEN="You're here -- good. I think I know where your goblin is."}
Q[12922]={d="在这多孔的外表之下，这块金属闪烁着一种神秘的品质。\n\n你觉得最稳妥的做法是在弗约恩之砧上烧掉这些浮渣。\n\n当你思索在这片冰封荒原上哪里能找到足够高温的东西时，一个火焰亡魂挡在了你的路上……|n",dEN="Beneath its porous exterior, this hunk of metal gleams with a mysterious quality.\n\nYou feel it would only be prudent to burn off the slag at Fjorn's Anvil.\n\nAs you ponder where in this frozen waste you might find something hot enough for the job, a fire revenant crosses your path...",o="从霜原湖的火热的亡魂身上收集10份狂怒火花，然后转至弗约恩之砧，使用那里的铁砧。",oEN="You must collect 10 Furious Sparks from the Seething Revenants at Frostfield Lake and then use the anvil at Fjorn's Anvil.",p="铁砧的表面十分灼热，与周遭寒冷的空气形成强烈对比。",pEN="The surface of the anvil is scalding, in sharp contrast with the wintry air.",c="你把金属放在铁砧上，当你一把火花加进去，立刻猛烈的与矿石作用。\n\n当它们终于烧完了以后，你带着一大块发着光芒的金属离开。",cEN="You place the metal on the anvil and immediately upon adding the sparks they work the ore furiously.\n\nWhen at last they burn out, you are left with a large piece of metal that gleams with a light of its own."}
Q[12924]={d="<托里姆微笑起来，这是你第一次见到他笑。>\n\n终于，命运向我伸出了手，$r。\n\n你发现的这块金属，原本是我的盔甲的一部分。很久以前，我在极度的悲伤中脱下了它，并把它丢给了那些元素生物。\n\n只有霍迪尔的子孙才能修复它，因为它本来就是他们锻造出来的。\n\n或许你的行动已经减轻了他们对我的仇恨。去找到他们的国王，约库姆。如果他还活着，就请他帮忙吧。",dEN="<Thorim, for the first time since your meeting him, smiles.>\n\nThis is all beginning to have the smell of fate's hand, <race>.\n\nYour discovery is what remains of my armor, long ago cast off in a fit of grief and left to the elements. Only the sons of Hodir are capable of its reforging, for they are its original creators.\n\nPerhaps you've done enough to soften their hatred of me. Seek out their king, Jokkum, if he still breathes.\n\nFind your way into his good graces and plead for his assistance.",o="转至丹尼芬雷，请求约库姆国王帮忙重铸托里姆的护甲。完成约库姆交付的任务之后，与丹尼芬雷的亚米尔德谈一谈。",oEN="You are to go to Dun Niffelem and ask King Jokkum to allow Thorim's armor to be reforged. After completing Jokkum's task, you are to speak with Njormeld in Dun Niffelem.",c="看来我的技术似乎精进不少。不然就是这个铁砧的传说是真的。\n\n这套盔甲比以前更精良，而且所用的材料更少。\n\n用这些剩下的材料，我可以替你铸造一件装备作为你的酬劳。",cEN="It would seem that I have refined my technique considerably. That, or the legends surrounding this anvil are true.\n\nThis suit of armor is superior to the last, and took less material to create.\n\nWith the excess, I was able to fashion you a little something as payment for your assistance."}
Q[12925]={d="巫妖王已经派密使来找过我们三次了，每次都被我们当场拒绝。\n\n但是瓦基里安的那些姐妹们却不那么忠于传统，她们接受了巫妖王的诱惑。现在，她们不再从野外捕捉幼龙，转而用瘟疫和天灾军团的邪恶力量培育龙卵。\n\n从瓦基里安的海德尼尔人身上夺取冰霜油膏，把那些已经感染了瘟疫的龙卵冻僵。据说那些龙卵都放在一个发臭的瘟疫池塘里。",dEN="The Lich King sent emissaries to us on three different occasions. All three were promptly dismembered.\n\nOur sisters in Valkyrion were not as dedicated to our traditions and accepted the Scourge's advances. Now instead of capturing their drakes from the wild, they raise them from the blight and filth that the Scourge wallow in.\n\nTake the frost oil that the Valkyrion Hyldnir carry on them and use it to freeze any blighted eggs you find. Rumors speak of a fetid pool of blight where the eggs are kept.",o="布伦希尔达村的塞拉·克文沙尔要你转至瓦基里安，从瓦基里安候选者身上夺取冰霜油膏，并用冰霜油膏摧毁30枚瘟疫始祖龙卵。",oEN="Thyra Kvinnshal in Brunnhildar Village wants you to go to Valkyrion and obtain Vials of Frost Oil from the Valkyrion Aspirants. Use the Vials of Frost Oil to destroy 30 Plagued Proto-Drake Eggs.",p="你摧毁那些染疫的蛋了没？",pEN="Did you destroy the blighted eggs?",c="我们感谢你，姐妹。我们不能让英勇的传统遭受腐化。",cEN="You have our thanks, sister. We cannot allow our valiant traditions to be corrupted."}
Q[12926]={d="我们发现铁矮人和他们控制的构造体正在与某种石头生物及其巨人盟友作战。布莱恩将这种石头生物称为土灵。我希望你能联络一下布莱恩，尽可能地帮助他。记住，他的调查结果或许能帮助我们击败铁矮人和他们的主子。",dEN="We've seen the iron dwarves and their constructs making war on the creatures of stone that Brann calls the earthen, along with their giant allies. Contact him and aid him in any way you can, and remember that anything we can learn from his search may aid us in fighting against the iron dwarves and their master.",o="使用布莱恩的通讯器联络布莱恩·铜须，并了解下一步的行动计划。",oEN="Use Brann's Communicator to contact Brann Bronzebeard and find out what to do next.",p="你完成圆盘了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the disk?",c="动作真快！现在我们有了圆盘，该找出如何用它来解开数据库钥匙的前半部了。",cEN="That was quick! Now that we have the disk, we have to find out how to use it to unlock the first half of the archive key."}
Q[12927]={d="你拼出来的那个圆盘……是空的！建造这个图书馆的守护者米米尔肯定把信息藏到了别的什么地方。去调查一下创世者的图书馆，看看里面有没有数据库之类的东西。\n\n或许这张圆盘就是干这个用的，到数据库附近去使用它看看吧。它可能就是用来读入和存储数据库信息的。试过以后再联络我，把你的发现告诉我。同时，我要开始着手寻找钥匙的另一半了。",dEN="That disk you assembled... it's blank! Keeper Mimir, the tinker who built this library, must've hidden the information elsewhere. Look around the Inventor's Library; do you see any databanks there?\n\nThat might be the disk's purpose. Try using it near some of those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. After you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've found. Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",o="使用创世者的圆盘，从数据库中获得7条秘密数据。",oEN="Use the Inventor's Disk to retrieve 7 pieces of Hidden Data from the Databanks.",p="你有没有试着使用这个圆盘？你发现了什么？",pEN="Did you try using the disk? What did you find?",c="<布莱恩看着你高举起的圆盘。>\n\n我看不出里面有没有存东西，小伙子。你得告诉我发生了什么。\n\n<你描述了数据读取的过程。>\n\n所以成功了？至少我们可以指望守护者米米尔做事有条理。",cEN="<Brann looks at the disk as you hold it up.>\n\nI can't tell if there's anything stored there or not, lad. You'll have to tell me what happened.\n\n<You describe the data retrieval process.>\n\nSo it worked? At least we can count on Keeper Mimir to be systematic."}
Q[12928]={d="正在为创世者的圆盘充能。\n\n已完成充能。\n\n准备引导紧急协议：伽玛。\n\n紧急协议已加载。请使用已充能的圆盘激活诺甘农之壳的守护者，文件员麦卡顿。在确认了你的身份之后，文件员会交出诺甘农之壳。\n\n祝你愉快一千年。",dEN="Charging inventor's disk.\n\nDisk charging completed.\n\nPreparing emergency protocol gamma.\n\nEmergency protocol loaded. Please use the charged disk to activate the guardian of Norgannon's shell, Archivist Mechaton. The archivist will release the shell once your identity has been verified.\n\nPlease have a pleasant millennium.",o="从文件员麦卡顿那里拿到诺甘农之壳。",oEN="Recover Norgannon's Shell from Archivist Mechaton.",p="你发现诺甘农之壳了吗？",pEN="Did you find Noragannon's shell?",c="就是这样！这就是诺甘农钥石的前一半。干得好，<name>。我让考古学家安多林寻找那个外壳的下落已经很久了。等我告诉他找到它的是个无畏的<race>，他绝不会相信。",cEN="That's it! That's the first half of Norgannon's keystone. Well done, <name>. I've had Archaeologist Andorin on the lookout for clues to the shell's whereabouts for a long time. He's never going to believe me when I tell him it was an intrepid <race> who found it instead."}
Q[12929]={d="土灵建造了奥杜尔，并在那里快乐地生活着。直到有一天，洛肯占领整座城市，把他们赶出了家园。从那时起，他的铁矮人随从们就一直在无情地向流亡的土灵发动攻击。\n\n他们现在躲藏在创世者的图书馆西面的山坡上，以古老的泰坦建筑为家，他们把那里称为布德克拉格庇护所。布德克拉格和他的同胞英勇地抵挡着妄图侵入庇护所的铁矮人，不过他们这样坚持不了多久的。去找到他们，帮助他们，$n。",dEN="The earthen who once inhabited, built, and maintained Ulduar were ousted from their home when Loken took over the city. Since then, his iron dwarf followers have relentlessly attacked the exiles.\n\nThey have taken refuge in an old titan building, which they now call Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the Inventor's Library. Bouldercrag and his brethren fight to keep the irons from overrunning their haven, but they cannot hold their ground long. Find and help them, <name>.",o="与布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",c="所以说你认识布莱恩·铜须咯？他是我们在血肉之躯的生物中最亲近的盟友。我们像兄弟一样的对抗洛肯与他的手下，为了奥杜尔一同奋战。",cEN="So you know Brann Bronzebeard, then? He is our closest ally among those of the flesh. We are as brothers in the struggle against Loken and his followers, in the struggle for Ulduar."}
Q[12930]={d="一直以来，这些锤子只被用来敲击石头，而不是敲击铁矮人。被驱逐出奥杜尔之后，我们亲眼目睹了柔弱的伙伴一个个地死去，而我们最强壮的工匠作为战士重生。\n\n当铁矮人逼得我们节节败退时，即使最强壮的战士也无力回天。\n\n我们对伤者毫无办法，除非能有一些魔化土壤的储备。我们以前一直都是在西北方的峭壁表面上采集它们，但持续不断的战争让我们根本没有机会补充储备。你能帮助我们吗？",dEN="It seems so long ago that these hammers pounded and hewed stone instead of iron. Our expulsion from Ulduar saw the weakest of us dead and the strongest of our craftsmen reborn as warriors.\n\nAs the irons beat us back, even the strongest find themselves failing.\n\nWe can do little for the wounded, save when we have a stock of enchanted earth. We used to mine it from the deposits on the sheer cliff face to the northwest, but the constant battle has prevented us from replenishing our stock. Would you help?",o="使用土灵采矿锄收集7块魔化土壤。将这些土壤和5张霜纹布交给布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格。",oEN="Use the Earthen Mining Pick to mine 7 clumps of Enchanted Earth. Bring the earth and 5 Frostweave Cloth to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你有找到土壤吗？",pEN="Were you able to find any of the earth?",c="这能让我们修补更多倒下的同伴。谢谢你，<name>，我代表所有守卫避难所的人感谢你。",cEN="This will allow us to patch up more of the fallen. Thank you, <name>, on behalf of all who defend the refuge."}
Q[12931]={d="庇护所的卫兵已经尽了最大的努力来抵挡铁矮人的攻击，但是我们仍然在节节败退。我的部下非常勇敢，但他们并非不知疲倦。如果没有增援的话，我们全面溃败恐怕只是个时间问题而已。\n\n你愿意帮我们保卫庇护所吗？这样可以会大大提升卫兵的士气，并给他们——还有我——带来发动反击的希望。\n\n消灭庇护所外面的铁矮人，以及他们的创造物。",dEN="The refuge's defenders have done their best to blunt the iron dwarves' attacks, but we keep losing ground inch by inch. My men are hardy, but not tireless. Without reinforcements, it's only a matter of time until we will be overrun.\n\nWould you lend your skills to the refuge's defense? It would greatly improve the morale of the defenders and give them -- and me -- hope of mounting a counterattack.\n\nKill any of the stormforged or their creations you encounter outside the refuge.",o="塑石者布德克拉格希望你杀死总计10名雷铸袭击者或雷铸掠夺者，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所向他复命。",oEN="Bouldercrag the Rockshaper wants you to slay 10 Stormforged Attackers and return to him at Bouldercrag's Refuge. You may kill either Stormforged Raiders or Stormforged Reavers.",p="战况如何？",pEN="How goes the battle?",c="你带来了令防御者欢欣鼓舞的消息。看到敌人被手刃使他们再度振作起来，也激励了他们的勇气。",cEN="You've given the defenders something to cheer about. Seeing the enemy fall by your hand has reinvigorated them and bolstered their courage."}
Q[12932]={d="我跟你说，伙计，这地方跟纳格兰的丘陵可差远了。这些巨魔比食人魔还脏；不过嘿，钱在哪儿我就去哪儿！所以欢迎来到祖达克，$g伙计:伙计;。\n\n你是这行的$g新手:新手;，让我给你说清楚。我是角斗经纪人，我旁边这个暴躁的巨魔是沃丁，我的保镖。你是表演者。你想打的时候告诉我，我来安排比赛。\n\n如果你$g准备:准备;好了，还带了一群朋友，我们就可以开始！你说呢？|n",dEN="I'll tell you what, buddy, this place is a far cry from the rolling plains of Nagrand. These trolls are dirtier than ogres; but hey, I go where the gold's at! So welcome to Zul'Drak, pal.\n\nYou're new to this racket, so let me set you straight. I'm the fight promoter and this feisty troll next to me is Wodin, my bodyguard. You're the entertainment. When you wanna fight, let me know and I'll set up the match.\n\nIf you're ready and got a group of friends with you, we can start! What do you say?",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败伊戈达斯！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Yggdras! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="嘿！我认识你。人们讨论你在嘲颅竞技场的胜利讨论了好几个月！因为没有出场打卫冕赛而输掉你的勇士头衔真是太可惜了！来的快，去的也快，嗯？至少你还活着。",cEN="Not bad, friend. You might make some gold out here - if you manage to stay alive."}
Q[12933]={d="下一场比赛很棘手，$g朋友:朋友;！显然有头来自龙骨荒野的猛犸人想来凑个热闹。你以前跟那种东西打过吗？我只能告诉你，往高处打！\n\n你一句话，我们就开party。",dEN="This next match is a doozy, buddy! Apparently some magnataur from the Dragonblight wants a piece of the action. You ever fought one of those before? All I can tell you is to aim high!\n\nWe'll get this party started when you give me the word.",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败恶臭之须！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Stinkbeard! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="哇！当我刚看见恶臭之须的时候，我还以为你死定了！打得好！",cEN="Wow! When I first saw Stinkbeard, I thought you were done for! Nice work!"}
Q[12934]={d="$g朋友:朋友;，我不骗你。这场你可能会有点吃亏。下一个来自元素位面！我甚至不知道竞技场里会出现什么东西！\n\n如果你觉得自己$g准备好了:准备好了;，就进场狠狠教训他们！",dEN="I'm not gonna lie to you, pal. You might be overmatched here. This next one is a being from the elemental planes! I don't even know what's gonna show up in that arena!\n\nIf you think you're up to it, get in there and give 'em hell!",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败一位元素领主！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat one of the elemental lords! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="难以置信！当它出现的时候我还以为整个场地都要炸了！你可真是主宰了这个场子啊！",cEN="Unbelievable! I thought this whole place was going to explode when it first appeared! You really dominated that round!"}
Q[12935]={d="下一个来自一个黑暗的地方，$g小子:丫头;。那种只有当你曾经站在另一边才会有的黑暗。他饥肠辘辘，为了赢什么都做得出来。小心点！我听说他拿雪人练摔跤！\n\n等你$g准备好:准备好;我们就开始。",dEN="This next one's fightin' from a dark place, kid. The kind of dark that can only happen when you've been on the flip-side. He's hungry and willing to do whatever it takes to win. Watch yourself! I've heard he wrestles yetis for exercise!\n\nWe'll start when you're ready.",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败奥里努克·碎牙！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Orinoko Tuskbreaker! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="有一阵子我很担心，<name>。当他破开封印、放出那些企鹅的时候……嗯，说实话，我不知道该怎么想。看起来真是荒唐透顶。",cEN="I was worried for a while there, <name>. When he busted out the seals and penguins... Well, I didn't know what to think to be honest. It looked pretty damn ridiculous."}
Q[12936]={d="$g老兄:大姐;，你不会相信的。你下一场要对阵血怒者科尔拉克！看来达卡莱巨魔要动真格了！而且我告诉你，$g朋友:朋友;，他一直在喝动物之神的果汁。他状态正好，准备把你砸进地里。\n\n你$g准备好:准备好;了吗？",dEN="You're not gonna believe this, pal. Your next fight is against Korrak the Bloodrager! Looks like the Drakkari trolls are pulling a power play! And let me tell you, buddy, he's been sippin' the animal god juice. He's good and ready to pound you into the ground.\n\nAre you ready?",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败血怒者科尔拉克！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Korrak the Bloodrager! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="该死，我还记得年轻时为霜狼氏族效力时的科尔拉克。他从来不肯闭嘴！我想你刚刚为这个世界做了件大好事，<name>。",cEN="Damn, I remember Korrak from way back in my younger days when I used to work for the Frostwolf Clan. He would never shut up! I think you just did the world a great service, <name>."}
Q[12937]={d="庇护所的卫兵非常勇敢，但他们也抵挡不住铁矮人无休止的冲击。\n\n有了你找来的土壤，我可以制造绷带来治疗受伤的卫兵。被我们救治的卫兵越多，我们所能坚持的时间就越久。\n\n拿上这些药膏，用它们去治疗庇护所外面受伤的卫兵，尽可能多救几个人回来，$n。每一个卫兵的伤亡都是我们的重大损失。",dEN="The refuge's defenders fight bravely, but they cannot keep up with the iron onslaught.\n\nWith the earth you collected, I can make bandages to help heal the wounds of some of the fallen. The more defenders we can patch up, the longer we'll last out there.\n\nTake these poultices and use them to heal the wounds of the fallen defenders outside the refuge. Get as many back into the battle as possible, <name>. Every casualty is one too many.",o="使用土质药膏治疗8名倒下的土灵防御者，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Use the Telluric Poultice to heal 8 Fallen Earthen Defenders, then return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你救治了倒下的防卫者吗？",pEN="Have you healed the fallen defenders?",c="你所治愈的战士将能帮我们把防线支撑更久一点。如果我们真的要完全摆脱铁矮人的威胁，我们就得想个方法越过战线打击他们。",cEN="The warriors that you've healed will aid us in holding the line even longer. If we are to truly be free of the iron threat, we must find a way to strike at them behind the lines."}
Q[12938]={d="我们需要你$g专注:专注;，$n。我们守住暗影穹顶已经很勉强了。如你所见，我们把巫妖王惹得很火。\n\n<男爵轻笑。>\n\n我需要你去和兰克拉尔公爵谈谈。现在是他在管事。你会在穹顶建筑里面找到他。\n\n换作是我，我可不会让他等。",dEN="We need you focused, <name>. We're barely holding The Shadow Vault as it is. As you can see, we've greatly angered the Lich King.\n\n<The baron chuckles.>\n\nI need you to speak with Duke Lankral. He's in charge here now. You'll find him inside the vault building proper.\n\nWere I you, I would not keep him waiting.",o="与暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault.",c="终于见到你很高兴，<name>。我们欠你很多，但我们还没用完你。\n\n西边山那边有一座维库城市，叫尤顿海姆。\n\n那里的维库人不断在挑战中求\"飞升\"。胜者前往伊米海姆，成为巫妖王的精锐战士阶层伊米亚，败者则沦为天灾瓦古。\n\n你将成为我的工具，确保产生更多瓦古而不是伊米亚。",cEN="It's a pleasure to finally meet you, <name>. We owe you a great deal, but we're not done with you yet.\n\nThere is a vrykul city just over the mountains to the west, a place called Jotunheim.\n\nThe vrykul there are in a constant state of challenge to 'ascend'. The winners go to Ymirheim to serve as the Lich King's elite warrior caste, the Ymirjar, and the losers are reduced to Scourged Vargul.\n\nYou are going to be my instrument to see to it that more Vargul than Ymirjar emerge."}
Q[12939]={d="我们第一步要去尤顿海姆一个叫野蛮之台的地方。就在西边山那边。\n\n在那台地上，维库战士总是在对练，由他们领主的部下教授战斗的精妙技艺。\n\n我要你带上这面旗帜，向他们中的一些人发起挑战。让我们用一个$g$r:$r;\"区区\"的技艺来挫挫他们的士气，怎么样？\n<El duque sonríe y sus dientes podridos brillan a la oscura luz de la cámara.>\n<公爵咧嘴一笑，腐烂的牙齿在穹顶昏暗的光线下闪着光>",dEN="The first step we're going to take is at a place in Jotunheim called the Savage Ledge. It's just over the mountains to the west.\n\nOn the ledge the vrykul warriors are always sparring, being instructed in the finer arts of battle by their thane's men.\n\nI want you to take this flag and issue a challenge to a number of them. Let's demoralize them with the 'mere' skills of a <race>, shall we?\n\n<The duke grins, his rotting teeth flashing in the dim light of the vault.>",o="暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵要你使用挑战之旗向6名尤尔丁格斗者发起挑战，并击败他们。",oEN="Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault has asked you to use the Challenge Flag to challenge and defeat 6 Mjordin Combatants.",p="也许你可以回去再多挑战几个人？",pEN="Perhaps you could go back and challenge a few more?",c="我已经收到你在野蛮之台展露身手的报告了。太好了，<name>……太好了！\n\n\n\n现在我想是时候向那些被你轻易击败的维库人领主颁布一道敕令了。",cEN="Already I'm hearing reports of the prowess you displayed on the Savage Ledge. Excellent, <name>... excellent!\n\n\n\nAnd now I think it's time to issue a decree to the thane of those vrykul that you so easily defeated."}
Q[12940]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12941]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12942]={d="叛徒。我们海德尼尔人绝对不会怜悯这种渣滓。\n\n瓦基里安的那帮家伙已经逍遥法外太久了。我们依然忠于托里姆，而她们却成了巫妖王的走狗！\n\n她们把那些接受了巫妖王恩典的人称为“瓦格里”。她们长着羽翼，就像鹰身人一样。\n\n瓦基里安就在遥远的西北方，比风暴神殿更遥远的地方。去杀死那些长着翅膀的母狼吧，姐妹。杀了她们，我会奖励你一件我最珍贵的宝物。",dEN="Traitors. We Hyldnir have little love for them.\n\nThe dwellers of Valkyrion have gone unpunished for far too long. While we remained loyal to Thorim, they became the Lich King's lapdogs!\n\nThey call the ones who receive his gift val'kyr. They fly on feathered wings, like the harpies they are.\n\nYou will find Valkyrion far to the northwest, beyond the Temple of Storms. Slay these winged she-wolves, sister. Slay them and I will reward you with one of my most prized possessions.",o="布伦希尔达村的复仇者伊芬要你去瓦基里安杀死12个初生的瓦格里。",oEN="Iva the Vengeful in Brunnhildar Village wants you to go to Valkyrion and slay 12 Nascent Val'kyr.",p="你有没有好好惩罚我们偏离正道的同胞？",pEN="Did you punish our wayward brethren?",c="瓦格里不过是巫妖王的走狗。我们会像杀死野狗一样地杀死她们。她们自己做出了决定，现在就要自己承担后果。",cEN="The val'kyr are nothing but the Lich King's lapdogs. They will be put down like the scum they are. They've made their choice, now they have to live with the consequences."}
Q[12943]={d="强大的乌弗朗领主就坐在野蛮之台旁边的大厅里。我研究过他的数据，这是一个极具耐心和战略头脑的维库人。他喜欢等待时机速战速决，不喜欢搞持久战斗。\n\n我要除掉他！\n\n我已经写好了他的裁决令，去当着他的面大声宣读吧。\n\n<公爵开心地扬起了眉毛。>\n\n至少……这样可以让他失去勇气。",dEN="Thane Ufrang the Mighty sits within his hall overlooking the Savage Ledge. I've studied him. The thane is a patient vrykul, with a head for strategy and warfare. He's also shown a penchant for biding his time and not wanting to overplay his hand in the ongoing battle.\n\nI need him dead!\n\nI've written a decree. Stand before the thane and read it aloud.\n\n<The duke arches his eyebrow in amusement.>\n\nIt should... unnerve him at the least.",o="暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵命令你向强大的乌弗朗领主宣读暗影拱顶裁决令，然后杀死他。",oEN="Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault has ordered you to read the Shadow Vault Decree in the presence of Thane Ufrang the Mighty, and then to slay him.",p="我的斥候报告乌弗朗还活着。\n\n你难道不识字吗，<race>？",pEN="My scouts inform me that Ufrang yet lives.\n\nDo you not know how to read, <race>?",c="<兰克拉尔公爵对你的报告点头表示满意。>\n\n我们面对的对手远比我们壮大，不只是在身材上，在数量上也是如此。如果我们在冰冠冰川的战斗想要获胜的话，我们就得想的比他们多！\n\n现在乌弗朗死了，我们对尤顿海姆的进攻就有了优势。一定要好好利用这个机会。",cEN="<Duke Lankral nods his approval at your report of success.>\n\nWe face a foe that dwarfs us, not only in stature, but also numerically. If we are to win the battle for Icecrown, we must outthink them!\n\nWith Ufrang dead, that gives us an advantage in Jotunheim. Let us see if we can capitalize on it."}
