Q[12948]={d="这就到头了，$g我:我;的$g朋友:朋友;！你最后一个对手将是你最大的挑战。他是来自冰冠冰川草原的维库勇士，他要见血！击败他，你就会被加冕为$g苦痛竞技场的:苦痛竞技场的;$g冠军:冠军;！这场比赛会让我们俩都发财！\n\n当你$g准备:准备;好时，$g告诉我:告诉我;，我们就开始。",dEN="This is the end, my friend! Your last opponent is going to be your greatest challenge. He's a vrykul champion from the steppes of Icecrown and he's out for blood! Defeat him and you'll be crowned the champion of the Amphitheater of Anguish! This fight is going to make us both rich!\n\nLet me know when you're ready and we'll start.",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败屠夫乌拉多弗！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Vladof the Butcher! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",c="你做到了，<name>！那是迄今为止最激动人心的一场比赛！你打算拿你的奖金做什么？我吗？我要去达拉然，在底下城区把它全花光。那儿可有的是热闹事！",cEN="You did it, <name>! That was the most exciting fight yet! What are you going to do with your winnings? Me? I'm going to Dalaran and blowing it all in the Underbelly. Lot of hot action going on down there!"}
Q[12949]={d="$C，解开这副枷锁的钥匙就挂在教官霍加尔的脖子上，他就在外面。\n\n你能去把钥匙拿过来给我吗？",dEN="<class>, the key to my shackles is hanging around the neck of Instructor Hroegar outside.\n\nPerhaps you could retrieve it by separating his head from his shoulders?",o="乌弗朗之厅里面的被折磨的维林要求你去夺取维林的锁链钥匙。",oEN="Vaelen the Flayed at Ufrang's Hall has asked you to retrieve the Key to Vaelen's Chains.",p="你拿到了吗？",pEN="Do you have it?",c="谢谢你，<race>。把钥匙给我就行，我自己来处理。",cEN="Thank you, <race>. Just hand me the key, I'll take care of it myself."}
Q[12950]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[12951]={d="你现在最重要的任务就是返回暗影拱顶，把我失败的消息告诉斯利文男爵。\n\n你看到了，这些维库恶棍抓住的不止我一个人。我的整个死亡骑士小队都被抓了。\n\n我本该在陷阱发动前就发现异常的，但现在后悔也来不及了。\n\n快跑吧，别像我们一样被抓住了！",dEN="The most important thing that you can do right now is to return to The Shadow Vault and let Baron Sliver know that I've failed.\n\nYou see, I wasn't the only one captured by these vrykul devils. My entire contingent of death knights was also taken.\n\nI should have seen the trap before it was sprung, but there's no use crying over spilled milk now is there?\n\nGo on before you get captured, too! I'll see you back at the vault.",o="与暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault.",c="什么？！我们甚至一个死亡骑士都不能失去，更别说是整个分队了！",cEN="What?! We can ill-afford to lose one death knight, let alone an entire contingent!!!"}
Q[12952]={d="在这个鸟不生蛋的地方，我的手艺都会被荒废的。我花了很多年来学习怎么把宝石切割成完美的形态，现在却英雄无用武之地！你看上去就像是能帮我找些宝石来的那类人，如果你愿意帮忙的话，我可以教你切割完美宝石的技术。切割完美宝石能让你在切割诺森德地区出产的优秀质量宝石时，有机会切割出一颗具有更高属性的完美宝石。",dEN="My skills are going to waste in this wretched place. I spent many years learning to cut gems into their perfect form and have nothing to work on! You look like the type who may be able to find me some gems and if you do I can teach you the skill of gem perfection. This will allow you to sometimes cut a perfect gem with increased bonuses when cutting a uncommon quality gem from Northrend.",o="将茶晶石、黑玉和暗影水晶各两颗交给复仇港的卡特尔·迪芬斯。",oEN="Return two Huge Citrines, two Dark Jade and two Shadow Crystals to Carter Tiffens in Vengeance Landing.",p="这些就可以了。我可以教你如何切割完美宝石作为回报。",pEN="These will do. I shall teach you the skills of gem perfection.",c="这些一定可以。我会教你宝石切割的完美技艺，同时为了证明我的技巧，我也会给你一颗完美的宝石。",cEN="These will have to do. I can teach you the art of gemcutting perfection, and give you proof of my skills as well."}
Q[12953]={d="箱子里都是纵火用的鱼叉，你想起了外面的那些鱼叉炮和干草垛。\n\n也许伊芬会感谢你的额外贡献，并好好地奖励你。",dEN="The crate is filled with incendiary harpoons. You recall seeing harpoon guns and dry stacks of hay outside.\n\nPerhaps Iva will appreciate the extra effort and reward you appropriately.",o="用瓦基里安鱼叉炮点燃6堆干草垛。",oEN="Use the Valkyrion Harpoon Guns to burn 6 Dry Haystacks.",p="嗯？",pEN="Yes?",c="这才叫献身嘛！那些叛徒现在也许有了个新主人，但是他们永远不会忘记姐妹们送的临别礼物！",cEN="Now that is what I call dedication! Those traitors might have a new master now, but they'll never forget their sisters' parting gift."}
Q[12954]={d="我还在想你到底什么时候会出现，$n！能有一位血环竞技场的前$g冠军:冠军;在这里可是大噱头！我们要发财了，$g伙计:伙计;！发财！\n\n顺便说一句，这个垃圾堆就是祖达克。好像所有冰巨魔都把它当厕所用。我不知道，你要问我，这鬼地方整个都不正常！不过谁在乎呢，对吧？我们是来赚金的！\n\n你懂规矩的，$n。当你$g准备:准备;好时告诉我，我们这就开演！|n",dEN="I was wondering when you'd show up, <name>! Having a past champion of the Ring of Blood here will be a huge draw! We're gonna be rich, buddy! RICH!\n\nAnyway, this dump is Zul'Drak. All the ice trolls seem to use it as a toilet. I dunno, the whole place is off its rocker if you ask me! Who cares, though, right? We're here to make some gold!\n\nYou know the drill, <name>. When you're ready let me know and we'll get this show on the road!",o="进入痛苦斗兽场，击败伊戈达斯！回到巨魔仆从伍迪那里领取你的奖励。",oEN="Get in the arena at the Amphitheater of Anguish and defeat Yggdras! Return to Wodin the Troll-Servant to redeem your reward.",p="比赛结束前没有报酬，<男人/女人>。",pEN="No payout until the fight's over, <man/woman>.",c="嘿！我认识你。人们讨论你在血色竞技场的胜利讨论了好几个月！因为没有出场打卫冕赛而输掉你的勇士头衔真是太可惜了！来的快，去的也快，嗯？至少你还活着。",cEN="Hey! I know you. Your victory at the Ring of Blood was talked about for months! Too bad you forfeited the championship when you failed to show up to defend your title! Easy come, easy go, eh? At least you're still alive."}
Q[12955]={d="咕啦呜哇……\n\n<跳线者清了清喉咙。>\n\n很抱歉，有时候别人很难听懂我在说什么，你知道是怎么回事啦。\n\n我要说的是，如果你打算转至西边山上的野蛮之台，请你顺便除掉那里的几个对手。\n\n准确地说，我想要你在维库人面前挑战齐格莉德·冰魂、虔诚者埃弗雷姆、奥努森和丁奇·火哨，并把他们打得落花流水。",dEN="Mrrfrmrfrrmrrr...\n\n<The Leaper clears his throat.>\n\nSorry about that. It can sometimes be hard to understand what I'm saying. You know how it is.\n\nI wanted to make sure that if you find yourself at the Savage Ledge, over the mountains to the west, that you make sure to eliminate the competition there.\n\nSpecifically, I'd like you to challenge to duels and humiliate Sigrid Iceborn, Efrem the Faithful, Onu'zun, and Tinky Wickwhistle in front of the vrykul.",o="暗影拱顶的跳线者要求你与齐格莉德·冰魂、虔诚者埃弗雷姆、奥努森和丁奇·火哨决斗，并击败他们。",oEN="The Leaper at The Shadow Vault wants you to duel and defeat Sigrid Iceborn, Efrem the Faithful, Onu'zun and Tinky Wickwhistle.",p="你为什么在这里？\n\n快去羞辱他们！",pEN="Why are you here?\n\nGo and humiliate them!",c="那很重要，<name>。把他们赶走，你就防止了他们干扰我们需要你在那边做的任何事。",cEN="That was important, <name>. By driving them off, you're keeping them from interfering with whatever we need you to do over there."}
Q[12956]={d="显然，这不是一块普通的金属。\n\n这块矿石与你见过的任何一种都不同，它的质地非常坚硬，但并不易碎，分量也比看上去要轻得多，即使冷却下来也会放出光芒。\n\n靠近观察时，你发现金属的表面下有一枚托里姆的符文在闪烁……",dEN="Clearly, this is more than an ordinary hunk of metal.\n\nUnlike any ore you're familiar with, it is hard but not brittle, far lighter than it looks, and glows even when cool.\n\nLooking closer, you can make out one of Thorim's runes shining beneath the surface....",o="将精炼闪光矿石交给风暴神殿的托里姆。",oEN="You are to bring the Refined Gleaming Ore to Thorim in the Temple of Storms.",p="你手上拿着什么，小家伙？",pEN="What have you there, little one?",c="当你将矿石拿出来的时候，你注意到托里姆严肃的表情因为认出它而笑颜逐开。",cEN="You notice Thorim's stern countenance brighten with recognition as you present the ore."}
Q[12957]={d="在这里的西南方，雪流平原的西面，铁矮人在山坡上掘出了一个矿洞。在那里，它们利用米米尔的仆从——被俘虏的机械侏儒来采集矿石。\n\n我不知道这些机械侏儒是哪来的，也不知道解救它们之后会怎么样，但或许它们愿意帮助我们呢？\n\n到冰霜矿洞去，$n，让这些机械侏儒恢复自由。问问它们是否愿意站在我们这边，对抗铁矮人的暴行。",dEN="To the southwest, on the western side of the Snowdrift Plains, the iron dwarves have dug a mine into the hillside. There, they use captive mechagnomes, servants of Keeper Mimir, to mine ore.\n\nI don't know where these mechagnomes came from, nor what they would do with their freedom, but perhaps we can win their help.\n\nGo to the Frozen Mine, <name>, and set these creatures free from their bondage. Ask if they would fight alongside us against iron dwarf tyranny.",o="布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格希望你去解救6名机械侏儒俘虏，并杀死3名雷铸工头。",oEN="Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge wants you to free 6 Captive Mechagnomes and kill 3 Stormforged Taskmasters.",p="你解救了雷铸的奴隶没？",pEN="Have you freed the slaves of the stormforged?",c="我本来希望有更多奴隶加入我们的，但我不会责怪他们。自愿加入的盟友很少，而且彼此相差甚远，我们很感激你愿意为了我们而挥剑。",cEN="I had hoped that more of the captives would choose to join us, but I do not blame them. Willing allies are few and far between, and we are thankful that you have lent your blade to our cause."}
Q[12958]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批血玉护符，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Blood Jade Amulets to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1枚维库护身符、1颗黑玉和1颗血石制造出一件血玉护符，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意维库人身上找到维库护身符。",oEN="Combine a Vrykul Amulet, a Dark Jade and a Bloodstone to make a Blood Jade Amulet and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find a Vrykul Amulet on any Northrend Vrykul.",p="你有带来血玉护符，好让我交付安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have a Blood Jade Amulet for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12959]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批发光的象牙雕像，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Glowing Ivory Figurines to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1根诺森德鹿牙、1颗玉髓石和1颗暗影水晶制造出一件炽热鹿牙雕像，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意种类的铲齿鹿或猛犸身上找到这种东西。",oEN="Combine Northern Ivory, a Chalcedony and a Shadow Crystal to create a Glowing Ivory Figurine and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find a Northern Ivory on any Shoveltusk or Mammoth in Northrend.",p="你有带来炽热鹿牙雕像，好让我完成安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have a Glowing Ivory Figurine for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12960]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批邪恶日纹胸针，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Wicked Sun Brooches to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1枚铁矮人胸针、1颗茶晶石和1颗太阳水晶制造出一件邪恶太阳胸针，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意铁矮人身上找到铁矮人胸针。",oEN="Combine an Iron Dwarf Brooch, a Huge Citrine and a Sun Crystal to create a Wicked Sun Brooch and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find an Iron Dwarf Brooch on any Northrend Iron Dwarf.",p="你有带来邪恶太阳胸针，好让我交付安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have a Wicked Sun Brooch for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12961]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批精巧的骨制雕像，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Intricate Bone Figurines to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1根始祖龙骨、1颗太阳水晶和1颗黑玉制造出一件精致龙骨雕像，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意始祖龙身上找到始祖龙骨。",oEN="Combine a Proto Dragon Bone, a Sun Crystal and a Dark Jade to craft an Intricate Bone Figurine and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find a Proto Dragon Bone on any Northrend Proto Dragon.",p="你有带来精致龙骨雕像刻像，好让我完成安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have an Intricate Bone Figurine for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12962]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批明亮的护甲遗物，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Bright Armor Relics to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1块元素护甲片、1颗血石和1颗茶晶石制造出一件光芒护甲圣物，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意亡魂身上找到元素护甲片。",oEN="Combine an Elemental Armor Scrap, a Bloodstone and a Huge Citrine to craft a Bright Armor Relic and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find an Elemental Armor Scrap on any Northrend Revenant.",p="你有带来光芒护甲圣物，好让我完成安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have a Bright Armor Relic for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12963]={d="一位富有的航运商订购了一批变幻日光的珍玩，要在安德麦出售。如果你能带一件给我，我就用一枚达拉然珠宝匠徽记作为报酬。|n",dEN="A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Shifting Sun Curios to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token.",o="使用1件天灾古物、1颗太阳水晶和1颗暗影水晶制造出一件迅捷烈日古器，把它交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。\n\n你可以在诺森德的任意天灾成员身上找到天灾古物。",oEN="Combine a Scourge Curio, a Sun Crystal and a Shadow Crystal to make a Shifting Sun Curio and bring it to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.\n\nYou can find a Scourge Curio on any Northrend Scourge.",p="你有带来迅捷烈日古器，好让我完成安德麦的订单吗？",pEN="Do you have a Shifting Sun Curio for my Undermine shipment?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。明天再来找我，我肯定还会需要其他东西的！",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. Come back tomorrow and I am sure I will have another item I need from you!"}
Q[12964]={d="在雪流平原西部的冰霜矿洞里，雷铸铁矮人驱使奴隶日夜不停地劳作。\n\n那里戒备森严，所以我们对里面的情况所知不多。但我的斥候报告说，他们从里面运出了许多黑暗而诡异的矿石。",dEN="At the Frozen Mine in the western part of the Snowdrift Plains, the stormforged iron dwarves have constructed a mine manned by slaves.\n\nIt's well behind the lines, so we haven't been able to find out much about what's going on there, but my scouts have reported seeing them remove cartloads of dark, sickly looking ore.",o="为布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格带回5份黑暗的矿石样本。",oEN="Bring 5 Ore Samples to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="关于矿石，你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered about the ore?",c="<布德克拉格伸手想接矿石，但随即缩手。>\n\n这种矿石……我没办法碰它——它翻涌着非自然的能量——没有任何石头生物能够触摸它。他们想要用这个来做什么？",cEN="<Bouldercrag reaches out to take the ore, but then recoils.>\n\nThat ore... I can't touch it. It seethes with unnatural energy. No creature of stone can handle it. What do they mean to do with this?"}
Q[12965]={d="指挥雷铸铁矮人的是一个名叫瓦杜兰的家伙。虽然我从来没见过他们，但据说他的主人，控制着奥杜尔的守护者洛肯，给了瓦杜兰一些强大的泰坦圣物。\n\n这或许就能解释我的人在雷铸战士身上发现的那种强大而狂暴的力量。\n\n瓦杜兰的基地——尼达维里尔就在雪流平原的西南方。到那里去吧，$n，去削弱他的力量。摧毁洛肯送给他的礼物，并帮助我们消灭他的追随者。",dEN="The one who commands the stormforged iron dwarves is called Runeseer Valduran. Although I have never seen them, it is said that his master, Keeper Loken, who took over Ulduar, has given Valduran powerful titan artifacts.\n\nIt could explain the strength and ferocity my men see in the stormforged warriors.\n\nValduran's base, Nidavelir, lies to the southwest, across the Snowdrift Plains. Go there, <name>, and neutralize his power. Destroy these gifts of Loken's and help us to sap the strength of his followers.",o="摧毁洛肯之怒、洛肯之力和洛肯之赐，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Destroy Loken's Fury, Loken's Power, and Loken's Favor, and return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="真的吗？瓦杜兰真的拥有强大的泰坦神器？你把它们破坏掉了吗？",pEN="Is it true? Does Valduran possess powerful relics of the titans? Did you destroy them?",c="<布德克拉格面色阴沉地点点头。>\n\n你削弱了雷铸矮人，但他们还是在持续作战。死伤对他们来说不算什么，但我们的卫兵却不断的倒下。就算死了一百个，甚至一千个铁矮人，他们也会一直作战下去，直到我们都被碾成粉末。",cEN="<Bouldercrag nods grimly.>\n\nYou've weakened the stormforged considerably, but they'll keep fighting. Their casualties matter nothing to them, while our defenders continue to fall. Even if it costs them a hundred or a thousand iron corpses, they'll keep fighting until we've been pounded to gravel."}
Q[12966]={d="<约库姆耐心地听取了你的请求，在仔细思考之后才开口作答。>\n\n这么说，弗约恩之死全是你的功劳。\n\n虽然你确实在我们最需要的时候帮助了我们，但要修复我们同托里姆的关系，这还远远不够。\n\n现在开始，我会让亚米尔德修复那套我们在许多个世纪之前送给风暴之王的铠甲，就当是你帮我们解决弗约恩的报酬吧。\n\n我派亚米尔德去收复弗约恩之砧了。你可以去那里找他。",dEN="<Jokkum listens patiently to your request, then ponders it carefully before responding.>\n\nSo it is you we have to thank for Fjorn's demise?\n\nWhile it's true that you have aided us in our time of need, there is still much that must be done to repair our relations with Thorim.\n\nFor now, I shall allow Njormeld to reforge the armor we gifted to the Stormlord so many ages ago. Consider it payment for your assistance against Fjorn.\n\nNjormeld was sent to recover Fjorn's anvil. You should find him there.",o="丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王要你转至弗约恩之砧，找到找亚米尔德。",oEN="King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem wants you to find Njormeld at Fjorn's Anvil.",c="重铸托里姆的盔甲？办得到。\n\n不过首先，得先处理这铁砧……",cEN="Reforging Thorim's armor? It can be done.\n\nFirst though, there's the matter of the anvil..."}
Q[12967]={d="曾几何时，斯诺里是我们民族的骄傲。他是位强大的战士，许多敌人倒在他的大棒之下。\n\n我们敬重他，尽管他已不复当年。岁月留下了代价，钝化了他的感官，抽走了他的力量。但他依旧像从前一样骄傲，从不放过任何上战场的机会。\n\n说到战斗，我们正在冷却弗约恩之砧，好把它运回家。剩下的火焰亡魂带来了一些麻烦。帮斯诺里重温他的光荣岁月吧，$r。指引他对付这个敌人。",dEN="Snorri was once the pride of our nation. A mighty warrior, many an enemy fell to his club.\n\nWe honor him, though he's no longer what he once was. Age has taken its toll, dulling his senses and sapping his strength. Still, he remains as proud as ever, never missing an opportunity to join a battle.\n\nSpeaking of battle, we're cooling Fjorn's anvil so it can be taken home. The remaining fire revenants are putting up some resistance. Help Snorri relive his glory days, <race>. Guide him against this enemy.",o="亚米尔德要求你陪伴斯诺雷转至弗约恩之砧，并帮助他杀死10个火热的亡魂。",oEN="Njormeld wants you to accompany Snorri to Fjorn's anvil and help him kill 10 Seething Revenants.",p="你带斯诺里又赢了一场吗，<class>？",pEN="Were you able to lead Snorri to another victory, <class>?",c="<race>，这是一场可敬的表现。我会向国王禀报你的协助。\n\n铁砧已经快冷却到可以了。我们很快在丹尼芬雷见。",cEN="An honorable performance, <race>. I shall inform the king of your assistance.\n\nThe anvil is nearly cool enough. I shall see you in Dun Niffelem soon."}
Q[12968]={d="那个造成一系列恶果的巫婆，风暴语者伊尔达，来到我们的村子中，一边污蔑我们高贵的传统，一边大肆宣扬什么“巫妖王将赐下力量”之类的肮脏诺言。\n\n她本该被一剑刺个透心凉，但是她的魔法非常强大，居然设法逃跑了。\n\n到瓦基里安的那座最大的建筑物里找到她，让她知道我们可不是好惹的。",dEN="The witch that started it all, Yulda the Stormspeaker came to our very village. She dared to insult our noble traditions and spouted the Lich King's venomous promises of power.\n\nShe ought to have left with a sword through her, but her magic was strong and she managed to escape.\n\nSeek her in Valkyrion inside the largest dwelling and show her that we are not to be trifled with.",o="布伦希尔达村的复仇者伊芬要你进入瓦基里安，杀死风暴语者伊尔达。",oEN="Iva the Vengeful at Brunnhildar Village wants you to slay Yulda the Stormspeaker in Valkyrion.",p="你有找到伊尔达吗？",pEN="Did you find Yulda?",c="伊尔达是自找的。没有人侮辱了海德比武会之后还可以全身而退。就算是我们自己人都不行。",cEN="Yulda had it coming. No one gets away with insulting the Hyldsmeet. Not even one of our own."}
Q[12969]={d="我想那个绿色的小个子就是你要找的人了。如果我是你，我会在那个海德尼尔人把他撕成两半之前救他出来。\n\n你身处海德比武会的比武场中，所以只要你发起挑战，对方就必须接受。没有人会阻止你救出你的绿皮朋友。",dEN="I trust that's the green little one you've been looking for. If I were you I'd step in before that Hyldnir splits him in half.\n\nYou've arrived in the middle of the Hyldsmeet, so all challenges must be accepted by participants. There's nothing to stop you from taking your green friend's place.",o="向安格妮塔·泰斯多达尔发起挑战，救出西弗·菲兹巴克。成功之后，向布伦希尔达村的女巫洛莉拉复命。",oEN="Challenge Agnetta Tyrsdottar in order to save Zeev Fizzlespark. Return to Lok'lira the Crone in Brunnhildar Village after you've succeeded.",p="你回来了。",pEN="You're back.",c="做得好，年轻人。看来我们的约定对双方来说都已经圆满履行了。",cEN="Well done, young one. It looks like our deal has been satisfied on both our ends."}
Q[12970]={d="无论你是否注意到，当你第一次在格斗中战胜海德尼尔人时，你就已经参加了海德比武会——海德尼尔人通过这种竞赛，决定由谁来代表托里姆进行统治。\n\n海德比武会就是我被囚禁的原因，因为我想参加比赛，但我太老太虚弱了，海德尼尔人看不起我。\n\n如果你不介意的话，我倒有个提议。",dEN="Whether you've noticed or not, by defeating your first Hyldnir in hand-to-hand combat, you've entered the Hyldsmeet -- the great competition of Hyldnir against Hyldnir to determine who will rule by Thorim's side.\n\nThe Hyldsmeet is the reason why I was imprisoned, for I sought to partake in the competition but was far too old and frail to be a match for the Hyldnir.\n\nIf you're willing to listen, I've a proposal for you.",o="听取女巫洛莉拉的提议。",oEN="Listen to Lok'lira the Crone's proposal.",p="压低身子，其它人会起疑的。",pEN="Keep it down, the others might start getting suspicious.",c="一切都安排妥当了。在我的协助下，你会在海德比武会中大放异彩，并使伟大的托里姆重返荣耀。",cEN="It's settled then. You will compete in the Hyldsmeet and with my help you'll restore great Thorim to his rightful place."}
Q[12971]={d="现在我来为你介绍一下情况。好消息是，在打败安格妮塔以后，你已经进入了下一轮的比赛。\n\n坏消息是，你所有的对手也都是在第一轮中获胜的强者，所以你就别指望能挑软柿子捏了。",dEN="Let's get you started. The good news is that by defeating Agnetta, you've earned yourself a spot in the next round of matches.\n\nThe bad news is that all your opponents will also have defeated someone in the first round. Do not expect pushovers.",o="布伦希尔达村的女巫洛莉拉要你去打败6名获胜的挑战者。",oEN="Lok'lira the Crone in Brunnhildar Village wants you to defeat 6 Victorious Challengers.",p="怎么了，<name>？",pEN="Yes, <name>?",c="你做到了，<name>。你击败了海德尼尔族所能提供的一些最凶猛的斗士。",cEN="You've done it, <name>. You've bested some of the fiercest fighters the Hyldnir race has to offer."}
Q[12972]={d="你已经成功地从海德比武会的第一轮中脱颖而出了。要想继续晋级的话，你就必须获得一头属于自己的战熊。\n\n不幸的是，海德尼尔人不会随便把战熊送给别人。你必须在真正的战斗中获得胜利，而不只是格斗比赛而已。\n\n布伦希尔达村的海德尼尔人正在和霍迪尔之子——也就是托里姆曾经的盟友——交战，你可以去村外找布莉亚娜谈一谈，看看你能帮她们什么忙。",dEN="You've succeeded in the first rounds of the Hyldsmeet. To advance further, you're going to need a warbear of your own.\n\nUnfortunately, the Hyldnir don't give them out to just anyone. You'll have to emerge victorious from true battle, not just gladiatorial combat.\n\nThe Hyldnir of Brunnhildar are currently involved in a feud against the Sons of Hodir, Thorim's former allies. Speak to Brijana just outside the village and see how you can help them and prove yourself in the process.",o="与布伦希尔达村外的布莉亚娜谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Brijana outside Brunnhildar Village.",c="想要一头那样的熊吗？你得做点什么证明自己，好让我们给得心服口服。\n\n别太高估你自己，你只不过打败寥寥几个海德比武会的挑战者罢了。",cEN="Think we'll give you your own bear just like that? You'll have to prove yourself before you get anything from us.\n\nDo not think too highly of yourself just because you bested a few challengers in the Hyldsmeet."}
Q[12973]={d="终于……终于拿到钥石了！它真是太漂亮了！我曾多次环游世界，自以为见多识广，但它让我又一次激动地浑身发抖了。不过呢，现在不是停下来欣赏的时候，我们必须赶快离开这里。\n\n跳到我的飞行器上面来，你要帮我除掉那些挡路的铁矮人！",dEN="That does it! We finally have the keystone... It's beautiful! I've been around the world more than once, but this thing's got me all jittery with excitement again. I suppose now's not the time to stop and admire though, we need to get the heck out of here.\n\nHop on my flying machine and help keep us covered from those iron dwarves on the way out!",o="与布莱恩·铜须及其飞行器一起返回冰霜堡。",oEN="Accompany Brann Bronzebeard and his flying machine to Frosthold.",p="抱歉，<小伙子/小姑娘>！我太投入了，完全把你忽略了。",pEN="My pardons, <lad/lass>! I got all caught up in tha moment and I neglected ye entirely.",c="雷心国王由衷地感谢你，让他与他的兄弟重逢。他似乎已动身为将临的大战作准备——也许你会在阿尔萨斯的大门前和他再次碰头。",cEN="King Stormheart sends his most sincere thanks for reuniting him with his brothers. It seems he's off to settle a score now - perhaps you'll meet with him again on Arthas's doorstep."}
Q[12974]={d="呸，这下面发生的事根本算不上打斗。就是几个人围着一面旗子跳舞。\n\n你在找真正的刺激吗，$g朋友:朋友;？因为如果是，我这儿有全城最抢手的门票。\n\n听说过古尔索克和沃丁吗？就是当年在外域办血环竞技场的那个地精和巨魔？他们现在在诺森德，在祖达克开了个全新的角斗俱乐部。如果你有兴趣，就去祖达克，在晶歌森林以东。他们就在中央那座大竞技场里。告诉他们是我弗蒂派你去的！",dEN="Pfft, what happens down here ain't fightin'. It's a couple of guys dancin' around a flag.\n\nYou lookin' for some real action, buddy? 'Cause if you are I got the hottest ticket in town.\n\nEver heard of Gurgthock and Wodin? Goblin and troll who ran the Ring of Blood back in Outland? Well they're here in Northrend and they've started up a whole new fight club over in Zul'Drak. If you're interested go to Zul'Drak, east of Crystalsong. They're at the big arena in the center. Tell 'em Shifty sent ya!",o="转至祖达克的痛苦斗兽场，寻找古尔戈索克。",oEN="Seek out Gurgthock at the Amphitheater of Anguish in Zul'Drak.",c="维克斯派你来的，嗯？",cEN="Shifty sent you, eh?"}
Q[12975]={d="托里姆肯定跟你提起过那场造成我们分裂的悲剧。\n\n一切都发生在东北方的落雷谷。那里遍布着冰冻的化石，它们既是那个黑暗之日的纪念，也是萦绕在那里的幽灵。\n\n如果要我的族人原谅托里姆，就必须用某些东西替代那些化石。我们必须修建一座纪念碑，以求得心灵上的宁静。\n\n霍迪尔的号角就是在那一天破碎的，去收集它的碎片吧，$r。",dEN="Surely Thorim has told you of the tragedy that divides us.\n\nIt was in Thunderfall, northeast of here, that these events unfolded. The frozen fossils there are a reminder of that dark day, as are the spirits that haunt that place.\n\nIf my people are to forgive Thorim, something must take the place of those images. A memorial must be constructed to bring our hearts peace.\n\nGo there, <race>. Collect the fragments of Hodir's Horn that was shattered that day.",o="丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王要求你前往落雷谷，收集8块号角碎片。",oEN="King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem wants you to collect 8 Horn Fragments from Thunderfall.",p="你找到霍迪尔号角的碎片了吗？",pEN="Have you found the pieces of Hodir's Horn?",c="<class>，你又以托里姆之名做了一件好事。\n\n这会帮助我的人民对他放下心防。",cEN="Another good deed you have done on Thorim's behalf, <class>.\n\nThis will help to soften the hearts of my people towards him."}
Q[12976]={d="把这些碎片交给亚米尔德。他会用这件圣物的碎片建造一座雄伟的纪念碑。\n\n希望它能够抚慰我的族人多年来的伤痛。\n\n希望它的建成能够开创一个新的时代，让我们在光荣的战斗中再次与托里姆并肩作战。\n\n现在就去吧，$c。亚米尔德在等着你。",dEN="Bring these fragments to Njormeld. He will use the pieces of that sacred relic in the construction of a mighty monument.\n\nMay it soothe the pains and heal the scars my people have borne these many years.\n\nMay its presence help to bring about a new age that sees us once again in glorious battle at Thorim's side.\n\nGo now, <class>. Njormeld awaits you.",o="约库姆国王要求你将号角碎片交给丹尼芬雷的亚米尔德。",oEN="King Jokkum wants you to bring Hodir's Horn Fragments to Njormeld in Dun Niffelem.",p="你把霍迪尔之角的碎片带来了吗，<race>？",pEN="You have brought the fragments of Hodir's Horn, <race>?",c="<约梅尔德把袋里的东西倒在铁砧上时，眼睛明显湿润了。>\n\n霍迪尔之角……\n\n这是霍迪尔亲手赐予我们人民的神圣礼物，<race>。对我们而言，这是一件极其重要的圣物。\n\n等你下次回到我们的要塞，你就会看到你辛劳的成果。\n\n再见。",cEN="<Njormeld's eyes become noticeably moist as he pours the contents of the bag onto the anvil.>\n\nThe Horn of Hodir....\n\nThis was a sacred gift to our people from Hodir himself, <race>. It is a relic of great importance to us.\n\nWhen you next return to our stronghold you shall see the fruits of your labor.\n\nFarewell."}
Q[12978]={d="和巨石岩一样，我也曾在奥杜尔作为工匠侍奉守护者，但在洛肯背叛之后，我把锤头转向了我们的新敌人。\n\n只要还能抽出$g人手:人手;，我就率领突袭尼达维里尔，以减轻我们守军的压力，但我们的防线已接近崩溃。\n\n你已经证明自己是个$g有能力的:有能力的;战士、$g坚定的:坚定的;盟友。也许你愿意举起我们的旗帜，把战斗带到西南方、越过雪原平原的尼达维里尔——铁矮人的要塞。",dEN="Like Bouldercrag, I once served the keepers as a craftsman in Ulduar, but with Loken's betrayal, I turned my hammer toward our new foes.\n\nWhen we could spare the men, I led raids on Nidavelir to relieve the pressure on our defenders, but our lines are near collapse.\n\nYou've proven yourself a capable combatant and a staunch ally. Perhaps you'd be willing to take up our banner and take the fight to Nidavelir, the iron dwarf stronghold to the southwest, across the Snowdrift Plains.",o="布德克拉格庇护所的布鲁沃·斩铁要你转至尼达维里尔，杀死10个雷铸铁矮人的士兵。雷铸勇士、雷铸大法师或雷铸作战魔像都可以。",oEN="Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag's Refuge wants you to kill 10 Nidavelir Stormforged. You may kill Stormforged Champions, Stormforged Magi, or Stormforged War Golems.",p="你有好好地锤打亚米尔德的那些铁块了吗？",pEN="Have you taken the hammer to the irons at Nidavelir?",c="也许还有胜利的希望，<name>。我们从来没能对风暴铸造者维持一次进攻，但有了你的努力，瓦杜兰或许会倒下！",cEN="There may be hope for victory, <name>. We have never been able to sustain an attack on the stormforged, but with your efforts, Valduran may yet fall!"}
Q[12979]={d="与这只魔像身上的其它护具相比，这片护甲板特别厚重。你迅速检查了一下魔像的尸体，发现这块大家伙似乎是后来才焊接上的，或是匆匆升级的产物。\n\n铁矮人为什么要给作战魔像装上这种多馀的、不匹配的护甲呢？\n\n如果能把雷铸作战魔像身上的这种护甲板拿给布鲁沃·斩铁检查一下的话，或许能发现些什么。",dEN="This armor plate is thick and oversized compared to the rest of the golem's defenses. A quick examination of the golem's corpse reveals that this heavier plate seems to have been bolted on as an afterthought or a crude upgrade.\n\nWhy would the iron dwarves have added this redundant and mismatched armor to their war golems?\n\nPerhaps Bruor Ironbane would know if he had the chance to examine several of these plates from stormforged war golems.",o="将4份黑暗护甲板样品交给布德克拉格庇护所的布鲁沃·斩铁。",oEN="Bring 4 Dark Armor Samples to Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你手上拿着的是什么？",pEN="What is it you have there?",c="现在小心。把那块护甲板尽可能放得离我远一点。仅仅是待在它附近就足以造成痛苦。\n\n但你说得对，<name>，对于正常尺寸的作战魔像来说，这些护甲板太巨大了。风暴铸造者拿它们做什么？只有一种办法能查明。",cEN="Careful, now. Keep that plate as far away from me as you can. Even being in its presence is enough to inflict pain.\n\nBut you're right, <name>, these are gigantic armor plates for a war golem of normal size. What would the stormforged be doing with them? There's only one way to find out."}
Q[12980]={d="这些护甲板的出现让人感到迷惑，但我们要尽量发掘出其中的秘密。这可能是瓦杜兰的诸多阴谋中的一部分。\n\n他正在以超乎寻常的热情来开采、精炼、锻造和测试这种金属。\n\n在东边，北方群山的南麓上有一座建筑物，名叫米米尔的车间。它已经停用了一段时间，但如果我们足够幸运的话，里面或许还有一些工作人员在活动。带着护甲板到那里去，尽量找出其中的秘密。",dEN="The presence of that armor plate is disorienting, but we need to find out all we can from it. It could be part of one of Valduran's schemes.\n\nHe's dedicated an extraordinary amount of effort to mining, refining, smithing, and testing this metal.\n\nTo the east, along the northern mountain face, is a building called Mimir's Workshop. It hasn't been used in quite some time, but if we're lucky, some of its attendants are still functional. Take your armor plate there and learn what you can from it.",o="把黑暗护甲板带到米米尔的车间去，让随从托克检查它。完成任务后，向布德克拉格庇护所的布鲁沃·斩铁复命。",oEN="Take the Dark Armor Plate to Mimir's Workshop and ask Attendant Tock to examine it. When you're finished, return to Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你知道了什么？",pEN="What did you learn?",c="<布鲁沃听你描述在车间的发现。>\n\n瓦杜兰的主人给了他这种金属要他建造一座巨大的武器？这一定是要用来对我们做最后一击的！我们必须在他完成这个武器对我们使用之前快点阻止他！",cEN="<Bruor listens as you describe what you learned in the workshop.>\n\nSo Valduran's master has given him this sinister metal to construct a giant weapon? That must be what he intends to use for the final strike against us! We need to stop him before he's able to complete it and unleash this weapon."}
Q[12982]={d="既然我已经回来了，我想男爵一定会让我去寻找我的部下。显然，我们已经有点撑不住了。巫妖王的部队源源不断地涌来，没有我的死亡骑士，防线被攻破只是时间问题而已。\n\n你可以再帮我个忙吗，$n？\n\n回到尤顿海姆，把他们从牢笼里救出来。我不管你用什么手段，打开那些该死的锁就行了——维库人身上或许会有钥匙。\n\n把我的部下救出来！",dEN="Now that I'm back, I'm certain that the baron will want me to recover my men. I can see that we're barely hanging on here. The Lich King's forces are about to break through and we won't be able to hold without my captured death knights.\n\nCan you assist me once more, <name>?\n\nGo back to Jotunheim and let them out of those cages. Break the damn locks, I don't care what you have to do. The vrykul likely have the keys.\n\nJust get my men free!",o="暗影拱顶的被折磨的维林要求你去解救8位黑锋囚犯。你可以在尤顿海姆地区的各个牢笼里找到他们。",oEN="Vaelen the Flayed at The Shadow Vault wants you to free 8 Ebon Blade Prisoners. They can be found in the cages throughout the greater Jotunheim region.",p="一定还有更多我手下的死亡骑士，等着被放出笼子吧？！",pEN="Certainly there are more of my death knights to be loosed from their cages?!",c="谢谢你，<class>。有了你解放的那些死亡骑士，我们就能守住防线……暂时。",cEN="Thank you, <class>. With the death knights that you freed, we'll be able to hold the line... for now."}
Q[12983]={d="根据我的记忆，我们最好的熊都是从东边的冬眠洞穴里抓来的。\n\n那些好日子或许已经一去不返了。现在冬眠洞穴已经被饥饿的冰虫占据，野熊几乎绝种。\n\n不过，如果你能找到一头幸存的母熊，我敢保证她的战斗力会远远超越这些圈养的熊。\n\n带着这副挽具转至冬眠洞穴，去拯救那里幸存的母熊吧。希望你找到一头母熊，祝你好运。",dEN="For as long as I can remember, we've obtained our best bears from the Hibernal Cave to the east.\n\nThose times might finally be gone. The cave has been overrun by ravenous jormungar and the wild bears are all but extinct.\n\nIf you were to find a surviving matriarch, however, I would guarantee you that she would fight better than any of these bears born in captivity.\n\nTake this harness to the Hibernal Cave and rescue a surviving matriarch. Good luck finding one.",o="布伦希尔达村的艾丝崔·约利塔尔要你去冬眠洞穴解救一头冰喉母熊。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar in Brunnhildar Village wants you to rescue an Icemaw Matriarch in the Hibernal Cavern.",p="你有找到族母吗？",pEN="Did you find a matriarch?",c="令人印象深刻。我从未想过能够再见到一头冰喉母熊——更遑论这样的尺寸。",cEN="I'm impressed. I never thought I would see an icemaw matriarch again. Especially not one this size."}
Q[12984]={d="我们别无选择，$n。你在米米尔工坊里了解到的情况意味着，我们必须在瓦杜兰完成并使用他的新武器之前行动。\n\n即便现在，避难所的守军仍在奋战，为我们争取对付瓦杜兰·风暴之子（风暴降生者）的时间。\n\n你必须前往尼达维里尔，越过西南方的雪原平原，找到并面对瓦杜兰。但你不是$g孤身一人:孤身一人;。带上这只战争号角，在你准备迎战我们敌人的首领时吹响它。布鲁尔和我会在这场战斗中助你一臂之力。",dEN="We have no choice, <name>. What you learned in Mimir's Workshop means that we must act before Valduran can complete and unleash his new weapon.\n\nEven now, the refuge's defenders fight to buy us time to deal with Valduran the Stormborn.\n\nYou must go to Nidavelir, across the Snowdrift Plains to the southwest, and then find and face Valduran. But you will not be alone. Bring this war horn with you and sound it as you prepare to face the leader of our enemies. Bruor and I will aid you in this battle.",o="当你发现风暴之子瓦杜兰时，使用布德克拉格的作战号角。击败风暴之子瓦杜兰，然后回到布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Use Bouldercrag's War Horn when you have found Valduran the Stormborn. Defeat Valduran the Stormborn and return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="在避难所陷落之前我们一定得对付瓦杜兰。",pEN="Valduran must be dealt with before the refuge falls.",c="瓦杜兰终于死了，雷铸矮人的攻势也消退下去了，但若他的自吹自擂并非虚言，我们就得继续和雷铸矮人战斗，即使他已不在。他们正建造的这件武器，也许将给我们带来末日。",cEN="At last, Valduran is dead, and the stormforged are weakened, but if his boasting is true, we must continue fighting the stormforged in his absence. This weapon they're building could be the end of us."}
Q[12985]={d="你好，$r。\n\n我有个任务，约库姆国王认为你$g适合:适合;去做，前提是你仍想赢得我族人的好感。\n\n我为另一件神器设计了图纸，它能为我们的要塞带来霍迪尔的守护祝福。建造它所需的东西我几乎都齐了。只差收集我们倒下敌人的眼睛。\n\n拿上这件工具，从遍布我们原野的铁巨人尸体上采集眼睛。",dEN="Greetings, <race>.\n\nI have a task that King Jokkum felt you would be suited for, assuming you still strive to gain favor with our people.\n\nI have developed plans for another artifact, one that will grant Hodir's blessing of protection to our stronghold. I have nearly all that I require for its construction. All that remains to collect are the very eyes of our fallen enemies.\n\nTake this tool, and gather the eyes from the iron giant corpses that litter our fields.",o="丹尼芬雷的亚米尔德要求你转至霜原湖，对那一带的死亡的铁巨人使用钻石尖锄，收集8枚雷铸徽记，然后回去向他复命。",oEN="Njormeld in Dun Niffelem needs you to use the Diamond Tipped Pick on the Dead Iron Giants at Frostfield Lake and return to him when you have collected 8 Stormforged Eyes.",p="你收集到我寻找的最后几样材料了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you collected the final components I seek, <race>?",c="就快完成了。\n\n有了这个神器，丹尼芬雷应该可以在危险逼近之前就先得到警告。",cEN="It is nearly done.\n\nWith this artifact in place, Dun Niffelem shall be warned of impending dangers before they are upon us."}
Q[12986]={d="诺甘农之核不在这里。我不知道你为什么要找它，$r，同样我也不知道你是否明白它的意义。\n\n如果你愿意帮我一个忙，那么我就可以向你提供帮助。最近我得知了守护者托里姆的事情。他的宝座岌岌可危，他的命运扑朔迷离。这让我感到困扰，因为我不知道其它守护者的近况。带着这个数据库，到东北方的神殿去探查一番，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="Norgannon's Core is not at this location. I am not sure why you seek it, <race>, and I am equally unsure if you truly know the purpose of that which you seek.\n\nI would like you to aid me before I consider extending my assistance. I have recently encountered knowledge of the watcher, Thorim. His seat of power is contested, and his fate remains to be seen. This troubles me, for I do not know of the other watchers. Utilize this databank to examine their temples to the northeast and return the knowledge to me.",o="山底平原的克莱特乌斯要求你转至创世神殿、寒冬神殿、生命神殿和秩序神殿，并使用数据库探查这些本地。",oEN="Creteus in the Foot Steppes has requested that you travel to the Temple of Invention, the Temple of Winter, the Temple of Life, and the Temple of Order and utilize the databank to examine each area.",p="你带着我寻求的知识回来了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you returned with the knowledge that I seek, <race>?",c="你所带来的消息确实很严重。我不知道其他的守护者下场如何，但是他们的失踪象征着艾泽拉斯全境的黑暗时代。\n\n我将会检查你带回来的信息，进行现状评估。不过我相信我手头上有个你认为更重要的信息，所以我会先与你分享。",cEN="The news you bear forth is grave indeed. I do not know the fate of the remaining watchers, but their absence spells dark times for all of the lands of Azeroth.\n\nI shall examine the knowledge contained in the databank that you have returned and attempt to fully assess the situation. I believe I am in possession of knowledge that you deem more pertinent at this moment however, so I shall allow you to partake in said wisdom first."}
Q[12987]={d="头盔已经锻造完成。\n\n你的努力没有被忽视，$g小家伙:小家伙;。虽然还有很多事要做，但霍迪尔之子感谢你的成就。\n\n作为回报，我给你一个机会，把霍迪尔之盔呈献给我们的国王和族人。\n\n飞到我面前那根小冰刺闪亮的顶端，向我们的族人宣读这块石板上的内容。\n\n享受这份特权吧，$c。从来没有外乡人获得过这样的荣耀！",dEN="The helm is forged.\n\nYour efforts have not gone unnoticed, small one. Though there remains much to do, we sons of Hodir are grateful for your accomplishments.\n\nIn return, I offer you the opportunity to present Hodir's helm to our king and our brethren.\n\nFly to the sparkling tip of the small ice spike in front of me and read to our people from this tablet.\n\nEnjoy the privilege, <class>. Never before has an outsider been given such an honor!",o="亚米尔德要求你飞到丹尼芬雷北边的冰柱顶端，并在那里使用宣告石板。",oEN="Njormeld wants you to fly to the tip of the northern ice spike in Dun Niffelem and use the Tablets of Pronouncement.",p="你戴上霍迪尔之盔了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you mounted Hodirs Helm, <race>?",c="<约梅尔德抬头望着霍迪尔之盔，明显动容。>\n\n这就够了，小<race>。\n\n这就够了……",cEN="<Njormeld gazes up at Hodir's Helm, visibly moved.>\n\nThat will do, little <race>.\n\nThat will do...."}
Q[12988]={d="我当初愚蠢地以为，瓦杜兰在纳维尔摇篮——南边一大片建造区——的工程，不过是献给\"守护者\"洛肯残暴的一座怪诞纪念碑。\n\n现在我们知道了真相：它将被用作对付我们和我们盟友的武器。我们绝不能让这座钢铁巨像完工，$n，否则避难所就完蛋了。\n\n前往纳维尔摇篮，找到风暴铸造者工匠使用的闪电熔炉，破坏它们。",dEN="In my folly, I'd thought Valduran's project at Narvir's Cradle, a large construction area to the south, no more than a grotesque monument to \"Keeper\" Loken's cruelty.\n\nNow we know the truth, that it was meant to be used as a weapon against us and our allies. We must not allow this iron colossus to reach completion, <name>, for it will mean the end of the refuge.\n\nGo to Narvir's Cradle, find the lightning forges the stormforged artisans use, and sabotage them.",o="使用布德克拉格的炸弹摧毁北部闪电熔炉、中部闪电熔炉和南部闪电熔炉，然后回到布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Destroy the North Lightning Forge, the Central Lightning Forge, and the South Lightning Forge with Bouldercrag's Bombs, then return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你有成功地破坏熔炉，妨碍他们吗？",pEN="Were you able to hamper them by sabotaging the forges?",c="做得好！噢，这不能阻止那些铁矮人，但是会使他们花上很多时间重建熔炉。我敢说我们现在占了优势。",cEN="Excellent work! Oh, it won't stop the iron dwarves, but it'll take them valuable time to rebuild those forges. I daresay we've gained the advantage."}
Q[12989]={d="恶心的冰虫几乎占领了整个冬眠洞穴。这些下等的生物……它们都是托里姆那个不争气的兄弟洛肯的后代。\n\n作为托里姆的仆人，我们应该尽力消灭这些渣滓。那个山洞就在村子的东边。",dEN="The vile jormungar have taken over most of the Hibernal Cavern. They are despicable beings... children of Loken, Thorim's scumsucker of a brother.\n\nAs Thorim's servants we owe it to ourselves to kill these scum where we find them. You'll find the cavern just east of here, outside the village.",o="艾丝崔·约利塔尔要你到布伦希尔达村东边的冬眠洞穴去，杀死8条饥饿的冰虫。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar wants you to slay 8 Ravenous Jormungar in the Hibernal Cavern east of Brunnhildar Village.",p="你回来了！",pEN="You've returned!",c="巨大的冰虫是邪恶的生物。摧毁他们是一件好事。",cEN="The jormungar are vile creatures. You did well in destroying them."}
Q[12991]={d="布德克拉格已经想到了一个很棒的计划，可以扰乱铁矮人在纳维尔支架的工作，而我自己也有个点子。如果没有技师的话，那个钢铁巨像的建造工作就寸步难行了。\n\n纳维尔支架就在遮挡这座庇护所的山岭南面。到那里去，把你一路上看到的雷铸技师都给干掉。他们也许和以前的我们没有什么不同，但他们正在制造一件对我们所有人都产生了威胁的武器。",dEN="Bouldercrag's got a good plan to stymie the efforts of the iron dwarves at Narvir's Cradle, and I've got an idea of my own. Work on the iron colossus will come to a halt without any artisans.\n\nNarvir's Cradle is on the south side of the hill sheltering Bouldercrag's Refuge. Go there and slay any stormforged artificers in your path. They may be no different from what we once were, but they build a weapon that threatens us all.",o="杀死10名雷铸技师，然后返回布德克拉格庇护所，向布鲁沃·斩铁复命。",oEN="Kill 10 Stormforged Artificers and return to Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你杀死那些生产铁巨像的工匠了吗？",pEN="Have you decimated the iron colossus' workforce?",c="以前我绝对不会开口要求别人做你做过的这些事，但在与铁矮人的交战中已经消弭了那种感觉。我们为抵挡敌人进犯争取到了宝贵的时间。",cEN="There were days when I could never ask someone to do what you did, but my experience with the iron dwarves has extinguished those feelings. We have bought time against the enemy's advance."}
Q[12992]={d="必须干掉尤顿海姆的维库人！\n\n$n好好教训他们！",dEN="Dem vrykuls at the Jotunheim needs to be crushed!\n\n<name> crush dems good!",o="暗影拱顶的劣尸维尔希望你在尤顿海姆地区消灭15个维库人。",oEN="Vile at The Shadow Vault wants you to slay any 15 vrykul in the greater Jotunheim region.",p="臭维库人还没死光！",pEN="Dems vrykuls not killed!",c="<name>是我最棒的小<race>！",cEN="<name> is my bestest little <race>!"}
Q[12993]={d="你成功地延缓了钢铁巨像的建造工作，非常好。不过我担心，这样只会让雷铸铁矮人更加坚定地完成武器的建造工作。\n\n即便在现在，他们仍然在不停地派入新的劳工，而他们的工头也在不断逼迫他们日以继夜地工作。我们或许不能阻止他们建成钢铁巨像了。因此，我们必须知道我们将要面对的是什么。回到南面的纳维尔支架，寻找描述巨像进攻和防御能力的相关文档。它们应该在帐篷和底层的熔炉附近。",dEN="You've done an excellent job of delaying the work on the iron colossus, but I fear we've only made the stormforged more determined to complete the weapon.\n\nEven now, they're bringing in new laborers and the overseers push them to the limit. We may not be able to keep them from bringing the colossus online, after all. Return to Narvir's Cradle, to the south and find the documents detailing the colossus' offensive and defensive abilities. They should be near the tents and forges on the bottom level.",o="找到巨像攻击规范说明书和巨像防御规范说明书，并把它们交给布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格。",oEN="Retrieve the Colossus Attack Specs and Colossus Defense Specs and bring them to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你找到我们要的那些文件了吗？",pEN="Did you find the documents we're looking for?",c="<布德克拉格开始查看文件，然后睁大了眼睛。>\n\n我可真不知道那些铁家伙们能做到这种事！如果这个巨大怪兽完成了，我们的手下连一点机会也没有。幸好，他们似乎缺少一个关键零件。",cEN="<Bouldercrag begins to look over the documents, his eyes wide.>\n\nI had no idea the irons were capable of this! Our men will have no chance against this behemoth if it's completed. Fortunately, it looks like they're still lacking a key part."}
Q[12994]={d="你和丹尼芬雷的居民之间创建起来的友谊给你带来了一些意外的发现。\n\n比如，你似乎能听懂冰霜座狼母兽的低吼和尖叫声——至少你觉得自己理解了。\n\n她似乎感受到了要塞外的威胁，要你采取防范措施。\n\n她用前爪取下脖子上的锁链，将它丢在你的脚边。当你捡起锁链时，发现上面系着一枚古老的牙齿……",dEN="The rapport you've developed with the inhabitants of Dun Niffelem has yielded some unexpected discoveries.\n\nFor example, you somehow find yourself able to understand the denmother's guttural growls and sharp quips - at least you think you do.\n\nIt would seem that she senses danger outside the stronghold and wants you to do something about it.\n\nWith her forepaw, she removes the chain from around her neck and lets it drop at your feet. As you pick it up you notice an aged fang attached to it....",o="击败上古寒冬山谷中的3名雷铸间谍。\n\n对座狼的尸体使用灵体座狼之牙，召唤出一只灵体冰霜座狼，帮助你找出隐藏的敌人。完成任务之后向丹尼芬雷的冰霜座狼母兽复命。",oEN="You must defeat 3 Stormforged Spies in the Valley of Ancient Winters.\n\nUsing the Ethereal Worg's Fang at the Corpse of the Fallen Worg will summon an Ethereal Frostworg, which will expose hidden enemies. You are to return to the Frostworg Denmother in Dun Niffelem when the valley has been cleansed of spies.",p="冰霜座狼兽母好奇地看着你。",pEN="The frostworg denmother looks at you curiously.",c="当你把项链套回母兽脖子上的时候，她赞许地舔了舔你的脸。",cEN="As you slide the chain back around the denmother's neck she licks your face approvingly."}
Q[12995]={d="我们必须从各个方面向尤顿海姆的维库人发动攻击。虽然有时候蛮力还是很有用的，不过我偏向于使用更睿智的手段。\n\n我希望你能去挫败他们的士气。\n\n我的手下为你制作了许多旗帜。我希望你能带上它们，将它们竖在维库人的尸体旁。\n\n用旗帜让他们明白：他们面对的是比巫妖王之怒更加直接的威胁。",dEN="We must attack the vrykul of Jotunheim on many levels. Brute force, of course, is good, but I prefer a more cerebral approach.\n\nI want you to demoralize them.\n\nMy men here have forged a number of banners for you. I would like for you to take and plant them near the corpses of fallen vrykul.\n\nLet the banners serve as a constant reminder to them that they face a more immediate threat than the wrath of the Lich King.",o="暗影拱顶的斯利文男爵希望你转至尤顿海姆地区，将黑锋旗帜插在15具维库人的尸体附近。",oEN="Baron Sliver at The Shadow Vault wishes you to plant 15 Ebon Blade Banners near the corpses of vrykul found within the greater Jotunheim region.",p="哦，<name>，我看你还没做完呢。",pEN="Oh now, <name>, I don't think you're quite done yet.",c="干得好，<name>。让他们看看倒下同伴被亵渎的尸体，再想想要不要袭击我们！\n\n如果你明天再来，我一定会为你准备更多旗帜。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Let them see the desecrated corpses of their fallen comrades and think twice about striking at us!\n\nIf you come back tomorrow, I will make certain to have more banners prepared for you."}
Q[12996]={d="你非常幸运，我的姐妹。我们已经很多年没有见过这种母熊了。\n\n不过，如果没有优秀的骑术，再好的熊也是没有用武之地的。\n\n我要你骑着母熊去挑战基加拉格。动手的时候要小心一点，基加拉格是我们抓到过的体形最大的雪人。如果你撑不住了，就及时跑开，不要逞强……我们给他套上枷锁是有原因的。",dEN="You've been very fortunate, sister. This is a matriarch the likes of which hasn't been seen in years.\n\nA good bear won't do you much good without the skill to ride it.\n\nI'm going to have you practice some moves on Kirgaraak. He's the largest yeti we've ever managed to capture so be careful. Don't be afraid to walk away if he gives you a beating... there's a reason why we keep him chained.",o="布伦希尔达村的艾丝崔·约利塔尔要你使用冰喉母熊的缰绳打败基加拉格。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar in Brunnhildar Village wants you to use the Reins of the Warbear Matriarch to defeat Kirgaraak.",p="雪人那边进行的如何？",pEN="How did it go with the yeti?",c="不错。我还有点期待基加拉格能折断你的脖子，这样我就能得到你的熊了。\n\n只是开个玩笑，姐妹。好吧……有一半是在开玩笑。你的熊真的很不赖。",cEN="Not bad. I was hoping Kirgaraak would snap your neck so I could keep your bear.\n\nJust joking, sister. Well... half-joking. That's a really nice bear you've got."}
Q[12997]={d="打败一个套着枷锁的对手是一回事，与其它骑熊的对手公平对战又是另一回事了。\n\n到利齿之坑去吧，用你学到的技巧去击败对手。祝你好运，我的姐妹。\n\n如果你获胜了，就可以获得崇高的荣誉。",dEN="Besting a tethered opponent is one thing. Fighting other bear riders on equal footing is another.\n\nHead into the Pit of the Fang and use what you've learned to defeat your opponents. Good luck, sister.\n\nGlory awaits, should you succeed.",o="布伦希尔达村的艾丝崔·约利塔尔要你在利齿之坑里使用冰喉母熊的缰绳，并打败6头海德比武会战熊。",oEN="Astrid Bjornrittar, in Brunnhildar Village, wants you to use the Reins of the Warbear Matriarch inside the Pit of the Fang and defeat 6 Hyldsmeet Warbears.",p="好啊！我的姐妹。",pEN="Hail, <brother/sister>.",c="你真的办到了！你完好无缺地回来了。真希望你的熊也是这样。\n\n她需要一点时间来恢复元气。不过也幸亏你暂时用不着她。",cEN="You really did it! You made it out with your health. Wish we could say the same for your bear.\n\nIt's going to take a while for her to recover. Fortunately you won't need her for a while."}
Q[12998]={d="按照你从纳维尔支架得到的文档来看，这台钢铁巨像已经基本完成了，只缺一个关键的要素——风暴之心。\n\n没有风暴之心的话，它将会比设计中弱很多。如果我们能阻止督工纳维尔得到风暴之心，就可以击败这台钢铁巨像。\n\n从文档中的注释来看，风暴之心就在奥迪斯，那是一座地处南面远方的泰坦设施。它的入口就在俯视伯尔之息河的高山的南面。",dEN="According to the documents you captured at Narvir's Cradle, the iron colossus is complete except for one key component -- the Heart of the Storm.\n\nWithout it, the iron colossus' weapons would be much weaker than the design predicts. If we can deny Overseer Narvir the heart, we could defeat the colossus!\n\nNotes on the documents you found say that the heart is in Uldis, a titan facility far to the south. Its entrance is on the south side of a tall mountain overlooking the Bor's Breath River.",o="布德克拉格庇护所的塑石者布德克拉格希望你转至奥迪斯，尝试阻止纳维尔获取风暴之心。",oEN="Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge wants you to travel to Uldis and try to prevent Overseer Narvir from obtaining the Heart of the Storm.",p="告诉我风暴之芯没有落入敌人的手里。",pEN="Tell me that the heart didn't fall into enemy hands.",c="风暴之心落入了纳维尔手中，那么巨像就会拥有完全的力量！我们别无选择，只能与它作战了。",cEN="With the heart in the hands of Narvir, the colossus will achieve its full power! We'll have no choice but to fight it."}
Q[12999]={d="你还记得夜木女士吧？她可记得你。当你把维尔和我从巫妖王的支配中解放出来时，也\"救\"了她，而她是个悲痛又极度愤怒的女妖。\n\n这位女士已经进入尤顿海姆，附身在他们的骨巫身上。她打算从内部给维库人制造混乱。\n\n她请求你去找她。你会在尤顿海姆西南方、尼约恩达尔村南侧的洞穴里找到她。",dEN="You remember Lady Nightswood, don't you? She certainly remembers you. She's the forlorn and very angry banshee that you 'saved' when you also broke Vile and myself out from under the Lich King's dominion.\n\nThe lady has gone into Jotunheim and possessed their bone witch. She intends to wreak havoc upon the vrykul from within.\n\nShe has asked that you seek her out. You'll find her in the cave on the south side of Njorndar Village to the southwest within Jotunheim.",o="转至约尔达村附近的洞穴，与白骨女巫谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with The Bone Witch within the cave at Njorndar Village.",c="<name>，你来了。\n\n我已经听说了你在野蛮之台的活动。这很好。我很高兴你似乎愿意帮忙削弱尤顿海姆这里的维库人。\n\n\n你和我会跟他们玩得很开心的！",cEN="<name>, you came.\n\nAlready I have heard of your activities on the Savage Ledge. This is good. I am glad that you seem willing to help with undermining the vrykul here at Jotunheim.\n\n\n\nYou and I are going to have a great deal of fun with them!"}
Q[13000]={d="这片山区非常寒冷，而且飞艇残骸里的木头只够我们烧一到两天的。\n\n我们发现正东方的山洞里有一些座狼。我要你去找到那个山洞，弄些毛皮回来。这听起来似乎没有多大作用，不过一张毛皮可能就决定了我们是被冻死还是多活一天。\n\n座狼都是集体出动的，所以我把这枚照明弹给你。万一你被它们包围了，这东西可以为你争取一些逃命的时间。",dEN="The cold in these mountains is brutal. We have a day or two before we burn up all the wood from the wreckage.\n\nWe spotted worgs inside a cave directly east of here. I need you to find the cave and obtain some furs. It might not sound like much, but it might be the difference between freezing to death and living another day.\n\nWorgs don't hunt alone, so I'm giving you a flare. It should buy you some time if you find yourself outnumbered.",o="血卫士洛尔加要你转至东边的基莫拉克之巢，收集6张座狼的毛皮。",oEN="Bloodguard Lorga wants you to go to the Gimorak's Den to the east and obtain 6 Worg Furs.",p="你把毛皮给带来了吗？",pEN="Did you bring the furs?",c="这些毛皮还真是……大。我可不想碰上你对付的那些座狼。\n\n我们都很感激你，毕竟气温都已经开始下降了。",cEN="These furs are rather... large. I'd hate to see the worgs you had to face off with.\n\nWe're all very thankful. The temperature is starting to drop already."}
Q[13001]={d="时候到了，$g小家伙:小家伙;。群星预言了这一天。\n\n我得到了伟大的霍迪尔亲自赐予的幻象，向我揭示了创造一件伟大神器的秘密。\n\n我们必须遵从！如果我们没能得到这份礼物，毁灭必然降临。\n\n我请求你协助我完成这项神圣的事业。\n\n去山谷对面，深入冬眠洞穴，从那里的冰封坑洞中采集永霜碎片，然后从洞穴外的猛犸象身上收集毛皮。$c",dEN="The time has come, little <class>. The stars have foretold of this day.\n\nI have received a vision from mighty Hodir himself, revealing the secret to the creation of a great artifact.\n\nWe must obey! Were we to fail in receiving this gift, doom would surely follow.\n\nI call upon you to assist me in this sacred undertaking.\n\nGo across the valley, deep into the Hibernal Cavern and gather everfrost shards from the icy crater there, then collect hides from the mammoths outside the cavern.",o="丹尼芬雷的博学者兰德维尔要求你转至冬眠洞穴收集3块永冻碎片，并从上古寒冬山谷的坚韧猛犸象身上收集3块坚韧猛犸象的毛皮。",oEN="Lorekeeper Randvir in Dun Niffelem wants you to collect 3 Everfrost Shards from the depths of Hibernal Cavern and 3 Stoic Mammoth Hides from the Stoic Mammoths in the Valley of Ancient Winters.",p="你为那支长矛收集好材料了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you gathered the materials for the spear, <race>?",c="退后，<race>，见证一个预言的实现！",cEN="Stand back, <race>, and behold the fulfilling of a prophecy!"}
Q[13002]={d="$g欢迎:欢迎;来到这寒冷的地方，$g伙计:小姑娘;。这地方也许不太适合给我这把老骨头保暖，不过我学会了怎么切出完美宝石。我只需要一些宝石来动手。\n\n这会让你在切割诺森德的不常见品质宝石时，有时能切出一颗附带更高加成的完美宝石。",dEN="Welcome to de cold, mon. Dis place may not be so good for keepin' me bones warm, but I have learned how to cut me de perfect gem. All I be needin' is some gems to do me work on.\n\nBring me some gems and I be teachin' you the skill of gem perfection. Dis will allow you to sometimes cut a perfect gem with increased bonuses when cuttin' an uncommon quality gem from Northrend.",o="将茶晶石、黑玉和暗影水晶各两颗交给战歌要塞的格巴里。",oEN="Return two Huge Citrines, two Dark Jade and two Shadow Crystals to Geba'li in Warsong Hold.",p="这就是我想要的。现在我要教你如何切割完美宝石啦。",pEN="Dis is what I been lookin' for. Now I be learnin' you Gem Perfection.",c="这真是完美啊老兄。来，这就是如何切割完美宝石的奥秘。",cEN="Dey be perfect mon'. Here is the art of gemcutting perfection for ya."}
Q[13004]={d="战争一触即发，我们都要竭尽所能！我的长处在于切割宝石，而且不是普通的宝石，是完美的宝石！如果你能弄些未切割的宝石来给我，我也可以教你学会这种技术。切割完美宝石能让你在切割诺森德地区出产的优秀质量宝石时，有机会切割出一颗具有更高属性的完美宝石。",dEN="There's a war going on and we each must do our part! Mine is cutting gems and not only can I cut normal gems but I have the skill to cut perfect gems as well. If you can bring me several uncut gems to contribute to the cause, I can teach you gem perfection as well. This will allow you to sometimes cut a perfect gem with increased bonuses when cutting a uncommon quality gem from Northrend.",o="将茶晶石、黑玉和暗影水晶各两颗交给无畏要塞的奥雷斯托斯。",oEN="Return two Huge Citrines, two Dark Jade and two Shadow Crystals to Alestros in Valiance Keep.",p="感谢你的奉献。让我来教你如何切割完美宝石吧。",pEN="Your donation is much appreciated. Let me teach you of gem perfection.",c="谢谢。我会教你如何切割完美宝石，并且送你一颗切好的完美宝石。",cEN="Thank you. I shall teach you of gemcutting perfection and in addition give you a perfect gem that I have cut."}
Q[13005]={d="多年以来，我一直没能履行自己的职责，整日沉浸在挫败和自责之中。\n\n但勇敢的土灵没有放弃。他们遵守了要用生命来守卫造物者圣台的誓言。\n\n直到现在，他们仍然在英勇地对抗堕落的铁矮人，期待着战局扭转的那一刻。\n\n就是现在！我们必须召集剩馀的土灵守护者，带领他们赢得光荣的胜利。吹响峭壁号角吧，把他们召集到你的身边，带领他们打败敌人，夺回造物者圣台。",dEN="For years I neglected my duties, giving into defeat and self-pity.\n\nNot the brave earthen, however. Their oath to protect these grounds with their lives has gone unbroken.\n\nEven now, they fight the corruption of iron with selflessness, waiting for the moment in which the tides turn.\n\nThat moment has arrived. We must rally what remains of the earthen defenders and lead them into a glorious victory. Sound the Horn of the Peaks to call them to your side and take back the Terrace of the Makers.",o="造物者圣台的托里姆要求你使用峭壁号角召集土灵，并打败20个铁矮人和7个铁哨兵。",oEN="Thorim, at the Terrace of the Makers, wants you to use the Horn of the Peaks and call on the Earthen to defeat 20 Iron Dwarves and 7 Iron Sentinels.",p="你好，<name>！你带来什么消息？",pEN="Hail, <name>! What news do you bring?",c="这是个好的开始。但是我哥哥的部队花不了多少时间就会重组。我们必须取得决定性的胜利。",cEN="It's a good start. But my brother's forces will not take long to regroup. We must make our victory a decisive one."}
Q[13006]={d="当你走近那头盔时，你注意到严寒的环境已经开始侵蚀这件神器的表面。如今只是一层薄冰，日后必然会增长到将它完全包裹。\n\n你不愿让自己辛苦的成果就此付诸东流，于是决定走遍这一地区寻找解决办法。\n\n就在你准备出发时，头盔的双眼闪过光芒，附近冬眠洞穴的影像出现在你脑海中。 $g决定:决定;",dEN="As you draw near the helm, you notice that the frigid environment is already taking its toll on the artifact's surface. What is now just a thin layer of ice will surely grow to envelop it entirely.\n\nNot about to let your hard efforts go to waste, you resolve to scour the region in search of a solution.\n\nJust as you set off, the eyes of the helm flash and an image of the nearby Hibernal Cavern enters your mind.",o="进入丹尼芬雷以西的冬眠洞穴，从粘性油污身上收集5份粘性油。\n\n然后返回丹尼芬雷，将油涂在霍迪尔的头盔上。",oEN="You are to enter Hibernal Cavern west of Dun Niffelem and collect 5 units of Viscous Oil from the Viscous Oils there.\n\nYou are then to return to Dun Niffelem and apply the oil to Hodir's Helm.",p="当你看着头盔的同时，霜雪在上面越积越厚，边缘也开始垂下冰柱……",pEN="Frost is thickening on the helm as you watch, and icicles are beginning to form around its edges...",c="当你在头盔上抹上一层油的时候，上面的霜雪褪去，头盔表面微微闪烁着光芒。",cEN="As you coat the helm with a thin layer of oil, the frost falls away and the surface gleams."}
Q[13007]={d="我们未能阻止钢铁巨像的建成，$n。这就意味着我们除了和它战斗之外别无选择。\n\n布鲁沃针对钢铁巨像唯一的弱点想出了一个计划。\n\n不管它的护甲有多么坚固，它仍然容易受到酸液的腐蚀。在雪流平原的北方边缘使用宝珠控制冰虫，然后在雪流平原上寻找钢铁巨像，用冰虫来对付它。如果你需要有人帮助你控制冰虫，就和旁边的那些驭手们聊聊吧。",dEN="We have failed to prevent the completion of the iron colossus, <name>, which means we have no choice but to face it in battle.\n\nBruor has devised a plan to exploit the colossus' only weakness.\n\nNo matter how tough the colossus' armor is, it is still vulnerable to a jormungar's acid. Take control of one using the orbs along the northern edge of the Snowdrift Plains, then use it to fight the Iron Colossus on the Snowdrift Plains. If you need help controlling the creature, speak to one of the nearby handlers.",o="使用被驯服的冰虫击败钢铁巨像，然后回到布德克拉格庇护所，向塑石者布德克拉格复命。",oEN="Use a Tamed Jormungar to defeat the Iron Colossus and return to Bouldercrag the Rockshaper at Bouldercrag's Refuge.",p="你击败巨像，避免避难所的毁灭了吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the iron colossus and spared the refuge from destruction?",c="我们成功了，我们真的成功了！庇护所得救了，雷铸矮人被打败了！我们一定得在洛肯试图重建他的军队之前先警告布莱恩。要维持今日的胜利唯一的方法，就是进入奥杜尔，一劳永逸地把洛肯击败！",cEN="We've done it, we've really done it! The refuge is spared and the stormforged are defeated! We must warn Brann before Loken gets it in his mind to try to rebuild his forces. The only way to secure the victory you have won today is to go into Ulduar and defeat Loken for all time!"}
Q[13008]={d="我们用了一个奇招，在山的这一边炸开了一个大洞，然后杀进了天灾城。结果呢，天灾军团的防线可谓固若金汤，很快它们就凭数量优势把我们打退了回来。我们撤回了山谷，开始对那些追杀过来的的天灾士兵进行炮击。这一招暂时延缓了它们的攻势，直到……直到那群怪物开始把北伐军士兵当作肉盾。我们只好停止炮击，不然就会杀死我们自己的士兵。\n\n去把那些被困在战场上的北伐军士兵救回来，$c！",dEN="We had the element of surprise on our side! We blew a hole in the side of the mountain and charged into Scourgeholme. Scourge opposition was fierce and it wasn't long until we were overwhelmed. We fell back to the valley and began raining artillery down on the Scourge that followed. This held them back for awhile until... Those monsters began using crusaders as living shields. We had to stop shelling for fear of killing our own soldiers.\n\nFree our crusaders trapped on the field outside the base, <class>!",o="冰冠冰川银色前线基地的北伐军指挥官恩塔里要求你去解救8名被网住的北伐军士兵。",oEN="Crusade Commander Entari at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown has asked that you free 8 Webbed Crusaders.",p="你解救了被网住的北伐军吗？",pEN="Have you freed the webbed crusaders?",c="那片战场上和天灾城里还有许多银色北伐军的士兵，<name>。虽然我们感谢你的帮助，但还有很多事要做。",cEN="There are still many Argent Crusade soldiers out on that field and in Scourgeholme, <name>. While your help is appreciated, there is still much left to be done."}
Q[13009]={d="我们的族人是否能再次接纳托里姆，这还是个未知数。\n\n希望这套铠甲可以让他回忆起那段久远的岁月，那段我们充满荣耀地并肩作战、无坚不摧的岁月。",dEN="It remains uncertain whether or not our people can ever rekindle the affection we once held for Thorim.\n\nMay this armor, if nothing else, remind him of the days when we stood together in honor, invincible.",o="亚米尔德要求你将重铸的风暴之王铠甲交给风暴神殿的托里姆。",oEN="Njormeld wants you to take the Reforged Armor to Thorim at the Temple of Storms.",p="你的进展如何，<class>？",pEN="How have your efforts fared, <class>?",c="<当你把重铸的铠甲呈给托里姆时，他明显被它的华美所震撼。>\n\n你做得很好，<race>，但还有很多事要做。",cEN="<As you present Thorim with the reforged suit of armor, he is visibly stricken by its splendor.>\n\nYou have done well, <race>, but there remains much to be done."}
Q[13010]={d="为了夺回我在造物者圣台的家园，我们还要再做一件事。\n\n我们必须找到科洛米尔。\n\n在那个命运审判之日，我将全身心的怒气和力量灌入那柄战锤中，并将它掷向了地面，然后就发生了巨大的爆炸。\n\n这么多年来，我一直以为它已经遗失了，不过现在我必须确认这一点。\n\n请你回去问问约库姆国王，看他是否知道任何有关我的战锤的消息。",dEN="One task remains before I can reclaim my home at the Terrace of the Makers.\n\nKrolmir must be found.\n\nOn that fateful day, I threw it to the earth with all the power and rage I possessed. A mighty explosion followed.\n\nI've thought it lost for these many years, but now I must be certain.\n\nReturn to King Jokkum and discover what, if anything, he knows of my hammer's fate.",o="托里姆要你与丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王谈一谈，向他打听科洛米尔的消息。",oEN="Thorim wants you to talk to King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem and discover what he knows of Krolmir.",p="又回来了，小<race>？",pEN="Back again, little <race>?",c="言语无法表达我的感激，<class>。\n\n你光荣地为我效力。请收下这份谢意。",cEN="Words cannot express my gratitude, <class>.\n\nYou have served me honorably. Please accept this token of my gratitude."}
Q[13011]={d="我有一项任务要交给你，这可以让你赢得我的族人们的认同，对你是有好处的。\n\n冰虫是一种讨厌的生物，繁殖非常快。只要给它们一点喘息之机，它们就会像兔子一样飞快地繁殖，像野火一样蔓延开来。\n\n西南方的冬眠洞穴里已经出现了冰虫的踪迹。如果不尽快杀掉那条冰虫女王，它们就会在我们的地盘上扎根了。\n\n它绝对不能抵抗食物的诱惑。带上这把刀，在它们的洞穴里随便找一头熊的尸体，割一块腰肉下来。把肉放在冰虫女王的巢穴附近，趁它进食的时候除掉它。",dEN="I have an opportunity that will help you to gain approval with my people, provided you prevail.\n\nThe jormungar are a nuisance best dealt with quickly. If given any quarter, they breed like hares and spread like fire.\n\nThey have appeared southwest of here, in the Hibernal Cavern. If their spawnmother is not slain soon, they will gain a foothold in our region.\n\nShe cannot refuse food. Take this knife and get the flank of a bear corpse from their cave. Place it near her crater and kill her as she feeds.",o="丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王要求你转至冬眠洞穴，杀死尤姆塔尔。",oEN="King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem wants you to slay Jormuttar in Hibernal Cavern.",p="你杀死尤姆塔尔了吗？",pEN="Have you slain Jormuttar?",c="那就这么办吧。\n\n我们听到约穆塔的惨叫在山谷对面回荡。\n\n你今天为我们的人民做了一件好事，小<race>。",cEN="So it is done.\n\nWe have heard the screams of Jormuttar as they echoed from across the valley.\n\nYou have done our people a service this day, little <race>."}
Q[13012]={c="很高兴知道这片土地的人们仍然向古老种族致敬。我祝你好运，<name>，并送你这枚徽记……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
