Q[13034]={d="踏上诺森德的征程后，我在北风苔原首次遇到了牦牛人。驯风者巴兰向我讲诉了雷蹄的传说，以及他对抗牦牛人部族的宿敌“北风”的英勇事迹。\n\n于是我来到风暴峭壁，想要了解更多有关这位英雄的故事。奇怪的是，唐卡洛营地的居民似乎对他一无所知。\n\n或许我们能从营地的档案中找到一些重要的线索。我要你去寻找并阅读营地中的历史书卷，然后告诉我你从中了解到了什么。",dEN="When I began my travels in Northrend, I visited the Borean Tundra and met the taunka for the first time. There, Wind Tamer Barah told me the tale of Stormhoof and his battle against the North Wind, their people's ancient enemy.\n\nI set out for the Storm Peaks to learn more of this hero, but strangely, the people of Tunka'lo seem to know nothing of him.\n\nPerhaps the camp's own records will give us greater insight. Find and read the history scrolls kept throughout the camp, then tell me what you learned.",o="唐卡洛营地的夏拉托尔希望你去阅读第一份历史卷轴、第二份历史卷轴和第三份历史卷轴。",oEN="Xarantaur, at Camp Tunka'lo, wants you to read the First History Scroll, the Second History Scroll, and the Third History Scroll.",p="你从唐卡洛营地的档案里查出了些什么？",pEN="What have you learned from the records of Camp Tunka'lo?",c="这可奇怪了……听起来跟驯风者巴兰告诉我的故事不一样。",cEN="How peculiar... that doesn't sound like the story Wind Tamer Barah told me."}
Q[13035]={d="洛肯早就策划好了对造物者圣台的进攻策略。他派出了铁矮人军团以及几名最得力的副官。\n\n使用峭壁号角召唤土灵，在他们的帮助下击败洛肯的仆从。\n\n你可以在北面的塑造者之厅找到巨人伊森法斯，然后沿着西北方的台阶进入造物者圣台，击杀其馀的副官。",dEN="The attack on the Terrace of the Makers was not a half-hearted move on my brother's behalf. He sent a legion of iron dwarves and some of his most powerful lieutenants.\n\nUse the Horn of the Peaks to call the earthen to your side and defeat Loken's servants.\n\nYou'll find the giant, Eisenfaust, inside the Hall of the Shaper to the north. You'll find the others deeper inside the Terrace of the Makers, beyond the stairs to the northwest.",o="托里姆要你杀死塑造者之厅的伊森法斯、造物者圣台的风之哈勒弗尼尔和符文巨人杜洛恩。",oEN="Thorim wants you to slay Eisenfaust inside the Hall of the Shaper and Halefnir the Windborn and Duronn the Runeforged in the Terrace of the Makers.",p="很高兴再见到你，<name>。",pEN="It's good to see you again, <name>.",c="一个接着一个，我兄弟的仆人都倒下了。洛肯的叛乱很快就将终结。",cEN="One by one, my brother's servants have fallen. Loken's insurrection will soon come to an end."}
Q[13036]={d="年轻的$c，自从我们走上漫长的救赎之路，一路征战，历尽艰辛，终于来到了这里。现在我们将面对最艰巨的挑战：消灭巫妖王和他的天灾军团。\n\n唉，我们只能独自迎接这场战争。部落和联盟互相打得不可开交，无法向我们提供任务援助。我们必须坚定信念，对胜利充满信心！毕竟，我们难道还有别的选择吗？\n\n那么，你愿意加入我们的行列吗？用你的力量来助我们一臂之力吧，$c！我的指挥官恩塔里在他的岗位上等待着你。",dEN="Long has been the path to our salvation, young <class>. We have fought across continents, worlds even, to reach this point. Now we face our greatest challenge: the destruction of the Lich King and his Scourge.\n\nAlas, we fight this battle divided. The Horde and Alliance are in the throes of war and will lend us no support. We must remain unyielding in our cause! For what choice have we to do otherwise?\n\nDo you join the cause? Lend us your strength, <class>! My commander, Entari, awaits you at his post.",o="向冰冠冰川银色前线基地的北伐军指挥官恩塔里报到。",oEN="Report to Crusade Commander Entari at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",c="在联盟与部落双双失败之处，银色北伐军却成功了。然而，这份成功，却维持不了多久。我们对冰冠冰川的突破很快地就被强行阻止了。\n\n巫妖王的反击来的既快且狠。现在我们被迫采取守势。",cEN="Where both the Alliance and the Horde failed, the Argent Crusade succeeded. The success, however, was short lived. Our breach into Icecrown was quickly - and with force - rebuffed.\n\nThe Lich King's retaliatory strike was immediate and brutal. Now we are on the defensive."}
Q[13037]={d="青铜龙族赐予我永生并指派我为历史的见证者，诺兹多姆也将知识之锤交给我保管。\n\n从知识之锤的反应来看，这里的时间流出现了偏差，而我们的职责就是让它恢复正常。\n\n我们必须找到错误的时间流节点。这里的西北方就是浮冰深渊，那里是唐卡洛战士的安息之地。我要你找到雷蹄的兄弟，迅矛酋长的灵魂。问问他还记不记得雷蹄与北风交战的场景。",dEN="When the bronze dragonflight gifted me with immortality and set me on the path of the witness, Nozdormu entrusted me with the Lorehammer.\n\nThe hammer's reaction to your findings means that time has gone awry here and it is our duty to restore the true timeline.\n\nWe must find it. To the northwest is Frostfloe Deep, ancient burial cave of the warriors of Tunka'lo. Seek out the spirit of Chieftain Swiftspear, Stormhoof's brother. Ask him what he remembers of his brother's battle against the North Wind.",o="与浮冰深渊的迅矛酋长谈一谈，然后返回唐卡洛营地，向夏拉托尔复命。",oEN="Speak with Chieftain Swiftspear in Frostfloe Deep, then return to Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",c="甚至连酋长都开始失去他的回忆了？历史就在我们的眼前被篡改，如果我们无法找出幕后的黑手，雷蹄所流传下来的一切都会永远消失。",cEN="Even the chieftain is beginning to lose his memories? The past is being rewritten before our eyes and if we do not find out who is behind this, the entire legacy of Stormhoof could be lost forever."}
Q[13038]={d="这里，唐卡洛战士的墓地，本来是一块远离元素侵扰的安宁之地。\n\n如今，浮冰深渊却被一股诡异的力量侵袭，正是这种异状打扰了安息的灵魂，令我的记忆变得模糊不清。\n\n我们的事迹与记忆开始逐渐从历史中消散。\n\n我活着的时候，这根图腾是我身份的象征。在我死后，它则是连接我和生者世界最后的媒介。我要你借助它的力量恢复墓地的宁静，然后将它带回唐卡洛营地。",dEN="This, the tomb of Tunka'lo's warriors, is supposed to be a serene place, free from the terror of the elements.\n\nFrostfloe Deep has been invaded by a strange force, one that disturbs the spirits of the fallen and blurs my memories of my own life.\n\nIt's as though our deeds and memories are being erased from history.\n\nIn life, this totem was a symbol of my authority. It is the last true link I have to this world. Take it, use it to restore calm to the tomb, and then return it to Camp Tunka'lo.",o="使用酋长的图腾封闭4道浮冰裂隙，然后将图腾还给唐卡洛营地的夏拉托尔。",oEN="Use the Chieftain's Totem to close 4 Frostfloe Rifts, then bring the totem to Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",p="你从陵墓里带回了什么？",pEN="What is it you have brought from the tomb?",c="酋长的魂魄要你带给我这个？\n\n<夏拉托尔检查着图腾。>\n\n啊，我了解他的意图了。他要你用图腾封闭深渊里的时间裂隙，是为了让我们了解时间线发生了什么事。多么睿智的迅矛酋长——即使在死后，仍然考虑着他的子民。",cEN="The chieftain's spirit told you to bring this to me?\n\n<Xarantaur examines the totem.>\n\nAh, I see what he intended. By telling you to use this totem to close the rifts in the deep, he has given us a clue as to what's happening to the timeline. A wise chieftain, this Swiftspear, watching over his people even in death."}
Q[13039]={d="$g小子:丫头;，我们撑不住这个节奏了。缺口一炸开，闸门就全开了。天灾军团从那以后就源源不断地涌出来，看不到尽头！\n\n我们需要每个身强力壮的人来帮忙挡住这邪恶的洪流。出去尽你的一份力，$g朋友:朋友;。能杀多少那些怪物就杀多少！",dEN="We can't keep this pace up, <lad/lass>. Once the breach was blown, the floodgates opened up. The Scourge have been pourin' through ever since with no end in sight!\n\nWe need every able bodied man and woman to help keep the tide of evil at bay. Get out there and do yer share, friend. Kill as many of those monsters as ye can!",o="冰冠冰川银色前线基地的北伐军领主达尔弗斯要求你杀死15只遗忘深渊蛛魔。",oEN="Crusader Lord Dalfors at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown has asked that you kill 15 Forgotten Depths Nerubians.",p="别放弃，<name>！",pEN="Don't give up, <name>!",c="它们究竟有多少啊？我们杀掉的敌人已经足以填满十个墓地了，但他们还是一直出现。情况看来相当险峻，我的朋友。",cEN="How many of them could there possibly be? We've killed enough to fill ten graveyards and still they come. The situation looks grim, friend."}
Q[13040]={d="受伤士兵的数字一天天地增加，他们都受到了某种我们从未见过的毒素的侵袭。不管这些蛛魔的毒液是如何构成的，总之，它们非常致命，简直可以说是毫无清除的可能！就现在来说，我们唯一能做的只是减缓毒素在受害者体内的蔓延速度。但是我们一定要想出一个治疗办法来！\n\n转至西北方，到前线基地外的山谷中去，干掉一些遗忘深渊蛛魔，把它们的毒囊给我拿回来。",dEN="The number of injured soldiers rises with each passing day. They are being stricken by some type of toxin that we have never before seen. Whatever it is that these Nerubians hold within their venom glands is lethal and incurable! So far we've only been able to slow down the poison flowing through the victim's bodies. We must devise a cure!\n\nVenture northwest to the valley outside of the Vanguard and slay the Forgotten Depths Nerubians. Recover their venom glands and bring them to me.",o="冰冠冰川银色前线基地的古斯塔夫神父要求你交给他10个遗忘深渊毒囊。",oEN="Father Gustav at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown has asked that you bring him 10 Forgotten Depths Venom Sacs.",p="你回收那些毒液腺了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you recovered the venom glands, <race>?",c="谢谢你，<name>。我会立刻用这些样本开始试验。希望能很快找到解药。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I will begin the tests on these samples immediately. It is my hope that a cure will be found soon."}
Q[13041]={d="真高兴见到你！我必须尽快将一批炽热鹿牙雕像送到安德麦去，但是恰好缺少一颗玉髓石来完成最后一尊雕像的眼睛。\n\n给我弄一颗宝石来，这枚达拉然珠宝匠硬币就是你的了。",dEN="I'm glad you showed up! A shipment of Glowing Ivory Figurines needs to go out to Undermine right now, and I am still short a Chalcedony to complete an eye for the last one.\n\nBring me one and a Dalaran Jeweler's token will be yours.",o="将一颗玉髓石交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。",oEN="Bring a Chalcedony to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.",p="你弄到玉髓石没？",pEN="Do you have the Chalcedony yet?",c="这是我答应要给你的达拉然珠宝匠硬币。我总是有订单要交，所以别忘了常来看看我缺些什么东西。",cEN="Here is your Dalaran Jewelcrafter's Token as promised. I have new shipments going out all the time, check by from time to time to see what I need."}
Q[13042]={d="在东北方的地下大厅深处，有一个名叫恐怖博士的科学怪人，他正在秘密策划一项与他的名字相符的行动。\n\n如你所知，那些战死沙场、而且没有利用价值的维库人都会变成“瓦古”。恐怖博士正是奉了巫妖王之命，对这种被称为“瓦古”的天灾士兵进行实验。\n\n我们必须阻止他的研究工作，可是我的占卜术却无法探明他的下落。好在恐怖博士有一名助手。\n\n我要你去调查他的学徒，并获取必要的情报。如果他有所察觉，你就打败他之后赶紧回来。",dEN="Deep in the bowels of The Underhalls to the northeast, a mad scientist known as Dr. Terrible is up to something befitting his name.\n\nThe doctor has been given dispensation by the Lich King to perform experiments upon the vargul -- the vrykul who fall in battle and are found unworthy, and then turned into Scourge.\n\nWe must put an end to his work, but my auguries have been unable to find him. He does, however, have an assistant.\n\nBeat the information out of his apprentice, and then dispose of the body.",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你调查学徒奥斯特基格，弄清楚恐怖博士的计划。\n\n事成之后，击败学徒奥斯特基格，并回来向女巫汇报。",oEN="The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village has asked you to beat information out of Apprentice Osterkilgr concerning what Dr. Terrible is truly up to.\n\nYou are then to slay the apprentice.",p="你还没完成我交付的工作。\n\n没完成之前别回来，否则有你好受！",pEN="You have not finished what I asked of you.\n\nPlease leave and do not return until you have done so or I will be very cross.",c="真有趣。听起来你干得不错。让我惊讶的是，恐怖博士那家伙竟然让一个实验用的瓦古当他的助手。",cEN="Very interesting. It sounds to me that you handled that perfectly. I'm surprised that the doctor was using a vargul as an assistant given what he was working on."}
Q[13043]={d="打开这本魔典，你会看到各种各样令人作呕的插图，全都关于制造博士所谓的\"终极武器\"！\n\n很明显，那座矗立在恐怖大厅尽头、巨大的血肉巨人内尔格尔德就是原型。\n\n如果造出一支由这种东西组成的军队，那就全完了。确保这不会发生的唯一办法就是杀掉泰瑞博博士！\n\n也许如果你夺取那座构造体的控制权，博士就会现身？",dEN="Opening the tome, you notice all manner of disgusting illustrations concerning the construction of what the doctor refers to as \"the ultimate weapon\"!\n\nClearly the prototype, Nergeld, is the massive flesh giant standing still at the end of the nearby Hall of Horrors.\n\nIf an army of those things were to be constructed, then it would mean doom. The only way to ensure that doesn't happen is to slay Dr. Terrible!\n\nPerhaps if you were to take control of the construct, the doctor would reveal himself?",o="登上尼尔盖德并控制它。抵御来自恐惧大厅的居民的攻击，直到恐怖博士现身。\n\n操纵尼尔盖德杀死恐怖博士，然后返回约尔达村，向白骨女巫复命。",oEN="Mount and take control of Nergeld. Defend it from the denizens of the Hall of Horrors until Dr. Terrible shows himself.\n\nUse Nergeld to slay the doctor, and then return to The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village.",p="你找到了博士的书，但是你没有用血肉巨人把他杀掉？\n\n在事情太迟之前快回去把他给杀掉！",pEN="You recovered the doctor's tome, but you didn't finish him off using the flesh giant?\n\nGet back in there and kill him before it's too late!",c="你发现了博士的阴谋，并且制止了他。\n\n<被女妖所控制的女巫笑了笑，轻轻的把手放在你的肩膀上。>\n\n你狠狠地戳了巫妖王一记，但是我想我们还能做得更好。",cEN="You discovered and put an end to the doctor's machinations.\n\n<The banshee-controlled witch smiles and places a large hand gently upon your shoulder.>\n\nThat's a fine poke in the eye for the Lich King, but I think we can do better."}
Q[13044]={d="穿越西面的回音谷和突破口，就是冰冠冰川的第一个天灾营地——天灾城。我们与天灾军团在那里进行了一场恶战，尽管消灭了大量的天灾士兵，但我们最终还是寡不敌众，被迫撤退。有许多士兵没能赶上大部队，落在了后面，至今生死不明。\n\n如果还有人活着的话，我们就必须想办法把他们救出来。青铜龙军团派来的盟友，始祖龙管理员本诺比奥斯就在这条通往东南方的道路的尽头。去找到他，寻求他的帮助。",dEN="Across the Valley of Echoes, west of here, and through the Breach, is the first Scourge encampment in Icecrown known as Scourgeholme. We fought a good fight at Scourgeholme and killed many Scourge, but in the end we were forced to retreat. Many soldiers were left behind - their fate unknown.\n\nIf there are survivors, we must attempt a rescue. Directly down this southeastern path is Penumbrius, ally of the bronze dragonflight and caretaker of the proto-brood. Seek him out and ask for his assistance.",o="与冰冠冰川银色前线基地的本诺比奥斯谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Penumbrius at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",c="<本诺比奥斯点点头。>\n\n我会助你一臂之力。我们将并肩作战，对抗巫妖王与他的天灾军团。",cEN="<Penumbrius nods.>\n\nMy kin will help. Together we will battle the Lich King and his undead legions."}
Q[13045]={d="我们会尽全力协助你，$n。始祖龙愿意载你飞越突破口，把你送到天灾城里。尽你的全力营救每一位被困的北伐军士兵，然后立即把他们送回位于基地中央的前线基地医护所。\n\n从我身后的围栏里挑选一头银色天爪龙，马上出发吧！\n\n天灾城就在西北边，穿过回音谷和突破口就到了。",dEN="We will do all that we can to assist you, <name>. The proto-brood have volunteered to fly you across the Breach and into Scourgeholme. Rescue any captured Argent Crusaders that you find. Return them immediately to the Vanguard Infirmary, located at the center of this base.\n\nChoose one of the Argent Skytalons in the pen behind me and go!\n\nScourgeholme is located northwest, across the Valley of Echoes, through the great Breach.",o="从天灾城营救3名被俘虏的银色北伐军士兵，把他们送往银色前线基地中心的医护所。完成任务之后，向大领主提里奥·弗丁复命。",oEN="Rescue 3 Captured Argent Crusaders from Scourgeholme and drop them off at the Vanguard Infirmary at the center of the Argent Vanguard. Report to Highlord Tirion Fordring should you succeed.",p="他们生还的机会正随着时间一点一滴地流逝。",pEN="With each minute that passes their chance of survival decreases.",c="阿尔萨斯……他进攻得鲁莽，毫不在意、毫无戒心。我们打了他个措手不及。\n\n<大领主提里奥·弗丁停顿了一下，一时陷入沉思。>\n\n我们会加固防御，挺过这场风暴。\n\n你炮术怎么样，<name>？",cEN="Arthas... He strikes recklessly - without care or caution. We have caught him off guard.\n\n<Highlord Tirion Fordring pauses, lost in thought for a moment.>\n\nWe will bolster our defenses and weather the storm.\n\nHow good are you with a cannon, <name>?"}
Q[13047]={d="洛肯杀害了我的妻子，让我的拥护者转而与我为敌。他夺走了我的一切，但是今天……一切都将改变。\n\n今天，我们将夺回曾经的圣地。今天……就是洛肯的死期。\n\n转至奥杜尔西南方的智慧神殿，到神殿附近的桥上与我碰面。无论如何，我要和洛肯做个了断。\n\n我要你见证这场复仇之战。你不要插手——这是私人恩怨。\n\n请你向冰霜巨人之王约库姆汇报战斗的结果。他是我的好朋友，他知道该怎么做。",dEN="Loken killed my wife, turned my followers and me against each other. He took away everything I had, but today... that changes.\n\nToday we reclaim our sacred grounds. Today... Loken dies.\n\nMeet me on the bridge near the Temple of Wisdom, just southwest of Ulduar. I will finish this one way or the other.\n\nI need you there as a witness. You will not aid me -- this is personal.\n\nAfter it's done, send word to Jokkum, King of the Frost Giants. He's a good friend and will know what to do.",o="转至智慧神殿附近与托里姆碰面。然后向丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王汇报战斗的结果。",oEN="Meet Thorim near the Temple of Wisdom. Report the outcome of the fight to King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem.",p="啊，<name>！见到你真好，小家伙。",pEN="Ach, <name>! It's good to see you, little one.",c="不……这不可能……\n\n没人能在决斗中击败托里姆。巨人不能，野兽也不能……不可能有人！更不可能是他那个懦夫哥哥！\n\n我以先祖之名起誓……\n\n洛肯将为此付出代价！",cEN="No... it cannot be...\n\nNo one can defeat Thorim in single combat. Not a giant, nor a beast... no one! Especially not that coward of a brother of his.\n\nOn my forefathers' names, this I swear...\n\nLoken will pay for this!"}
Q[13048]={d="我们可以使用知识之锤修复损坏的时间流，但是必须首先找到历史是从哪儿开始被破坏的。\n\n从迅矛酋长提供的信息以及你在浮冰深渊的发现来看，时间流是在雷蹄死亡的时刻发生改变的。\n\n我要你转至营地北边的凛风洞窟，进入已经被北风的侍从破坏的墓地。知识之锤将与雷蹄时代的圣物产生反应，实现与正确时间流的同调。",dEN="The Lorehammer can help us correct the damage to the timeline, but only if we can discover where the history was originally corrupted.\n\nFrom Chieftain Swiftspear and your findings at Frostfloe Deep, we know that the change happened around the time of Stormhoof's death.\n\nNow, you must go to the Howling Hollow, north of the camp, and inspect the gravesites the North Wind's minions have already destroyed. The Lorehammer will react to artifacts from Stormhoof's era and attune itself to the proper time.",o="对牦牛人的圣物使用知识之锤，让它与雷蹄生活的时间流实现同调。等它与6件雷蹄时代的圣物完成同调之后，回去向唐卡洛营地的夏拉托尔复命。",oEN="Use the Lorehammer on Taunka Relics to attune it to the time of Stormhoof. Once it has been attuned to 6 relics from the time of Stormhoof, return to Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",p="你将知识之锤同调至雷蹄的时代了吗？",pEN="Have you attuned the Lorehammer to the time period of Stormhoof?",c="<夏拉托尔收下了你手上的知识之锤。>\n\n我们终于在历史上正确标定了雷蹄的年代。根据这点，我们可以恢复时间线的历史了。",cEN="<Xarantaur accepts the Lorehammer from you.>\n\nAt last, we've pinpointed the time of Stormhoof in history. With this knowledge, we can restore the timeline."}
Q[13049]={d="并不是营地中的所有记录都遭到了破坏。我的手下帮我找到了那些能够反映真实时间流的记录。\n\n这些证据表明，雷蹄和村落中的长者一样，被埋葬在北边的凛风洞窟底层。\n\n北风的侍从早已将墓地破坏殆尽，还夺走了墓穴主人的陪葬品。我要你转至凛风洞窟，看看能否从那些强盗手中夺回雷蹄的武器和盔甲。",dEN="Not all of the camp's records have yet been corrupted. My staff has helped me to find those records which reflect the true timeline.\n\nThey agree that Stormhoof was given a burial of honor among the village elders on the bottom level of the Howling Hollow, to the north.\n\nMost of the graves there have already been destroyed, their contents taken as trophies by the North Wind's subjects. Go to the hollow and see if you can recover Stormhoof's spear and armor from the scions of storm who have claimed them.",o="将雷蹄的长矛和雷蹄的锁甲交给唐卡洛营地的夏拉托尔。",oEN="Recover Stormhoof's Spear and Stormhoof's Mail and return them to Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",p="你找到雷蹄的长矛与锁甲了吗？",pEN="Have you found Stormhoof's weapon and armor?",c="幸好你把它们完好无损地找回来了，<name>。有了它们，我就能用学识之锤把你送回过去，送到北风开始腐化真实时间线的那一刻。这是我们恢复此地真实历史的唯一办法。",cEN="We are fortunate that you have recovered these intact, <name>. With them, I can use the Lorehammer to send you back in time, to where the North Wind started to corrupt the true timeline. It's the only way we can restore the true history of this place."}
Q[13050]={d="要想对洛肯的军队发动攻击，我就必须找到可以让我灵活行动的方法。\n\n多年前，我将飞龙坐骑维拉努斯放归了大自然。她曾伴我征战四方，如今早已重登族群女王的宝座。\n\n我觉得我们很难找到她，不过有个法子或许能奏效。维拉努斯早已过了繁殖的年龄，但是她依然待在空空如也的巢穴里。这位名义上的族群女王以此维系着她高贵的尊严。\n\n从布伦希尔达村附近的其它巢穴中取回一些小龙卵，我再告诉你接下来要怎么做。",dEN="If I'm to launch an attack against my brother's army, I'm going to need some way to get around.\n\nI released my riding drake back into the wild years ago. Veranus was magnificent. The leader of her own brood -- to whom she has now returned.\n\nFinding her will be hard, but perhaps there's a way. She keeps her old empty nest out of pure pride. She's a broodmother in name only, for she is beyond the age of breeding.\n\nBring me small eggs from the other nests near Brunnhildar. I think I've an idea.",o="风暴神殿的托里姆要你从布伦希尔达村附近的峭壁上取回5枚规模始祖龙卵。",oEN="Thorim, at the Temple of Storms, wants you to obtain 5 Small Proto-Drake Eggs from the peaks near Brunnhildar Village.",p="你拿到那些蛋了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you obtain the eggs, <name>?",c="是的……这些可以。希望我的计划能奏效，<name>。\n\n维拉努斯是一头伟大的龙。我可不愿退而求其次。",cEN="Yes... these will do. Let us hope my plan works, <name>.\n\nVeranus is a great drake. I'd hate to have to settle for a lesser one."}
Q[13051]={d="维拉努斯是我见过的最高傲的野兽。她仍然待在旧时的巢穴里，确保它不被年轻的始祖龙霸占。\n\n将你取回的龙卵放入她的巢穴。喏，就在东南方的那座小山峰上。\n\n维拉努斯见到这样的场景一定会勃然大怒，希望我能在她杀死你之前控制住她。希望如此吧。",dEN="Veranus is proud like no other beast I've known. She still keeps her old nest and makes sure none of the younger proto-drakes takes it over.\n\nTake the eggs you've collected and place them on her nest. You'll find it atop a small peak, directly southeast of here.\n\nI should be able to get control of her before she kills you in a fit of rage. Hopefully.",o="将偷来的始祖龙卵放置在母龙之巢的顶部，然后返回风暴神殿向托里姆复命。",oEN="Place the Stolen Proto-Dragon Eggs on top of the Broodmother's Nest and return to Thorim at the Temple of Storms.",c="很高兴看到你回来。这表示我已经开始转运了……这都要归功于你，我的朋友。",cEN="It's good to have my old friend back. It appears that my luck is finally starting to change... and it's all thanks to you, little friend."}
Q[13054]={d="如果我把你派去独闯狼穴，但是不告诉你我们上次派去的人至今未归的话，我会为此感到良心不安的。\n\n我们已经做了最坏的打算，不过没准他还活着呢？如果你能把他带回来的话，我们会非常感激——猎户瓦尔兹是我们的最后一名猎人了。",dEN="I can't in good conscience send you to the worg cave without warning you that the previous person we sent there hasn't returned.\n\nWe're prepared for the worst, but perhaps there's a chance that he's alive. We'd appreciate it if you helped him return -- Tracker Val'zij is one of the only hunters we have.",o="转至格罗玛什坠毁点东南边的基莫拉克之巢，寻找猎户瓦尔兹。",oEN="Look for Tracker Val'zij inside Gimorak's Den, southeast of the Grom'arsh Crash Site.",c="我伤得如此重，老兄。不知道熬不熬得过去？",cEN="This hurts bad, mon. Don't know if I'm gonna make it."}
Q[13055]={d="很高兴见到一张友善的脸。也许是我见到的最后一张了。\n\n我还没来得及逃走，就被那些冰虫中的一条注入了某种毒素。我能感觉到全身都在发麻，伙计。\n\n我需要一个毒素腺来配制解药。我还需要一些这里长的洞穴蘑菇……它们能减缓毒素。\n\n快，拜托，我时间不多了。 $g需要:需要;",dEN="It's good to see a friendly face. Might be the last one I see.\n\nOne of those jormungar stung me with some sort of toxin before I managed to get away. I can feel my whole body getting numb, mon.\n\nI'm going to need a toxin gland to make an antidote. I will also need some of the cave mushrooms that grow here... they'll slow the toxin down.\n\nHurry, please. I don't have much time.",o="基莫拉克之巢的猎户瓦尔兹希望你去收集1个冰虫毒腺和8只洞穴蘑菇。",oEN="Tracker Val'zij, at Gimorak's Den, wants you to obtain 1 Jormungar Toxin Gland and 8 Cave Mushrooms.",p="你……回来了，朋友？",pEN="You back, mon?",c="感谢你，我的朋友。我可以见到明天的太阳了。",cEN="I thank you, mon. I might live another day now."}
Q[13056]={d="我应该坚持得住，$n。不过，我还需要你帮我一个忙。\n\n如果我的风蛇希尔莎没有被那头极其凶残的座狼杀死，我是绝对不会被这些虫子暗算的。\n\n不用担心我，如果你能除掉那头座狼，我会感觉更好的。你可以在洞穴深处找到它。",dEN="I should manage for now, <name>. There is one favor I'd like to ask, though.\n\nI would never had fallen to one of these worms, but my wind serpent, Heesha, was killed by the meanest worg I've seen in some time.\n\nDon't worry about me now, I'll feel better when that worg is breathing no more. You should find him deeper in the cave.",o="猎户瓦尔兹要求你去杀死基莫拉克之巢里的基莫拉克。",oEN="Tracker Val'zij wants you to slay Gimorak inside Gimorak's Den.",c="我感觉好多了，不知道是因为解药，还是因为那个畜生得到报应的消息。",cEN="I'm already feeling much better, mon. Not sure if it's the antidote or the news of that filthy worg getting what he deserved."}
Q[13057]={d="是时候了，$n！我已经做好了与洛肯正面交锋的准备。\n\n让我们向造物者圣台前进，迎战我兄弟的部队。那个蠢货会后悔的！",dEN="It is time, <name>. I am prepared to face Loken now.\n\nLet us make our way to the Terrace of the Makers and face my brother's forces. The fool will regret ever crossing me.",o="转至丹尼芬雷西北方的造物者圣台，在该区域的东南部边缘寻找托里姆。",oEN="Find Thorim at the southeastern edge of the Terrace of the Makers, just northwest of Dun Niffelem.",c="我们到了，<name>。我兄弟的部队今天就会知道失败是什么意思。",cEN="We're here, <name>. My brother's forces will learn the meaning of defeat today."}
Q[13058]={d="万事俱备，我们可以纠正北风和他的侍从犯下的错误了。你已经将知识之锤与雷蹄以及他生活的时间流实现了同调。\n\n现在，我要你带上它转至西北方的平原上的生命神殿，在那里使用知识之锤，以雷蹄的身份挑战北风。你要记住，为了让时间流恢复正常，雷蹄必须在北风变得虚弱时死去。\n\n接着，你要找到并使用元素愤怒号角，消灭北风。",dEN="At last, we have all that we need to right the wrongs of the North Wind and its followers. You have attuned the Lorehammer to Stormhoof's time and his persona.\n\nTake the hammer again, head to the Temple of Life in the plains to the northwest. Use the hammer to assume the role of Stormhoof. Face the North Wind as Stormhoof, but realize that for the timeline to be restored, Stormhoof must die as the North Wind weakens.\n\nThen, you must find and use the Horn of Elemental Fury to destroy the North Wind.",o="使用知识之锤回到过去，以雷蹄的身份挑战北风。雷蹄倒下之后会掉落元素愤怒号角，届时你必须使用元素愤怒号角击败北风，然后返回唐卡洛营地，向夏拉托尔复命。",oEN="Use the Lorehammer to travel back in time and face the North Wind as Stormhoof. When Stormhoof falls and drops the Horn of Elemental Fury, use it to finish off the North Wind, and then return to Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",p="你完成任务了吗？时间线回复原状了吗？",pEN="Have you done it? Is the true timeline restored?",c="你今天的所作所为将使雷蹄与其事迹永载青史。同时你也让自己留名于于艾泽拉斯史册之中。我会记住你并记载你不朽的成就。",cEN="What you have done today will ensure that Stormhoof and his story will never be forgotten. As well, you have written yourself into the pages of Azeroth's history. I will remember and record your accomplishments for all eternity."}
Q[13059]={d="我一直在向剑之女士祈祷，希望有人来打倒我的敌人。伊尔斯卡领主必须为他对我做的事付出代价！\n\n我曾是乌弗朗·强横领主麾下的勇士。当我在瓦哈拉斯为飞升而战时，伊尔斯卡用黑暗魔法破坏了我，害我落败，沦为现在这副模样。\n\n你可以在下面苦痛之环找到那位领主和他的勇士们。以我的名义挑战他。击败他。\n\n让他尝尝我所承受的痛苦！",dEN="I've been praying to The Lady of the Sword for one to come and strike down my enemy. Thane Illskar must pay for what he did to me!\n\nI was the champion of Thane Ufrang the Mighty. During my fight for ascendance in Valhalas, Illskar sabotaged me with dark magic, causing me to lose and be reduced to this.\n\nThe thane and his champions can be found below in The Circle of Suffering. Challenge him on my behalf. Defeat him.\n\nMake him know the suffering that I know!",o="地下大厅的贝索德·菲格要你扔出他的剑，在受难之环中挑战并杀死伊尔斯卡领主。",oEN="Bethod Feigr in The Underhalls wants you to throw down his sword to challenge Thane Illskar and then kill him in The Circle of Suffering.",p="我感觉到你尚未击败伊尔斯卡领主，有什么困难吗？",pEN="I sense that you haven't yet defeated Thane Illska. Does something stay your hand?",c="谢谢你，<class>……谢谢你！\n\n你给了我一份慰藉，让我知道那个把我变成这副模样的懦夫将和我一样，永远在地狱里腐烂。\n\n现在走吧，趁我还没失控把你砍倒。",cEN="Thank you, <class>... thank you!\n\nYou've given me the satisfaction of knowing that the coward who made me into this will rot for all eternity as surely as I will.\n\nNow leave before I lose control of myself and cut you down."}
Q[13060]={d="看来……看来我们是别想在这层层叠叠的群山中找到一个合适的定居点了。\n\n相信我，我不是那种轻言放弃的人……但是被冻住的引擎、讨厌的维库女人、飞来飞去的恶龙和乱七八糟的其它怪物，换了是你，你能怎么办？\n\n不过，不要慌张！我只是说我们找不到一个合适的定居点，但这并不意味着我们不能送你一程……单线旅行总是很简单的。\n\n<莉吉特指了指附近的火箭。>",dEN="So... so I don't think we're going to be getting a good foothold in those mountains.\n\nTrust me, I'm not one to give up easily... but between freezing engines, nasty vrykul women, territorial dragon want-to-bes and the half a dozen other nasties settled in the area, this just ain't happening.\n\nDon't let that dissuade you though! Just because we can't get a foothold doesn't mean we won't get you there... one-way trips are pretty simple when you get down to it.\n\n<Ricket nods at some nearby rockets.>",o="与莉吉特谈一谈，使用她的D16推进运载器进入风暴峭壁的深处。",oEN="Speak to Ricket to make use of Ricket's D16 Propelled Delivery Device to enter further into Storm Peaks.",c="<欧拉特眨了眨眼。>\n\n那看起来还真痛。不过可真是华丽的登场。\n\n你是要来帮我们找条路进入冰冠冰川的吗？如你所见，我们首趟旅途下场并不太好。我想我们最好快点离开这个地方，好另建据点。",cEN="<Olut winces.>\n\nThat looked painful. It was a pretty grand entrance though.\n\nAre you here to help us find a path into Icecrown? As you can see, our first foray in that direction didn't end too admirably. I'm thinking we might be better off breaching the place from another side."}
Q[13061]={d="那就这样吧。你的熊我会照看，你不再需要她了。你下一个挑战是宏大的德拉肯斯里德。\n\n跟你的朋友道别，把事务安排妥当，因为你会$g凯旋:凯旋;……或者根本回不来。",dEN="This is it then. I'll take care of your bear now, you won't be needing her. The great Drakkensryd will be your next challenge.\n\nSay goodbye to your friends and leave your affairs in order, for you will return victorious... or you won't return at all.",o="与布伦希尔达村的女巫洛莉拉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Lok'lira the Crone in Brunnhildar Village.",c="你居然一路走到了这里。我真的没想到你会在海德尼尔中晋升得如此之快。",cEN="You've really made it this far. Never would I have thought you'd progress so quickly among the hyldnir."}
Q[13062]={d="你一直是个$g好:好;盟友，$n。现在$g真正的:真正的;考验来了。你需要技巧、勇气和一点运气。\n\n<洛克里拉把她的一缕细发系在你的头发上>\n\n现在你不能失败了，姐妹。去和仲裁者格蕾塔谈谈。你会在路上遇到她。",dEN="You've been a great ally, <name>. Now comes your true test. You will need skill, courage and a little luck.\n\n<Lok'lira attaches a thin strand of hair to yours.>\n\nYou cannot fail now sister. Speak to Gretta the Arbiter. She'll see you on your way.",o="与布伦希尔达村的仲裁者格蕾塔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Gretta the Arbiter in Brunnhildar Village.",c="你准备好要出发了吗，姐妹？出发了便无路可退。",cEN="Are you ready to ride, sister? There is no coming back."}
Q[13063]={d="你成功通过了许多人都无法通过的考验。这究竟是你的力量、勇气还是运气的缘故，我们不得而知。\n\n返回村庄，去找艾丝崔·约利塔尔。把你所取得的成就告诉她。不过我必须提醒你，她并不是那么容易亲近的。",dEN="You have succeeded where many have failed, sister. Whether it be by strength and courage or mere luck remains to be seen.\n\nGo back to the village and seek out Astrid Bjornrittar. Tell her of your accomplishments. But be warned. She is not easily impressed.",o="布莉亚娜希望你转至布伦希尔达村，与艾丝崔·约利塔尔谈一谈。",oEN="Brijana wants you to go to Brunnhildar Village and speak with Astrid Bjornrittar.",c="所以，我的姐妹，你认为完成几件再平常不过的杂活，就能成为女中豪杰？\n\n你该知道……",cEN="So, sister, you think that completing a few simple chores makes you a heroine?\n\nYou shall learn...."}
Q[13064]={d="希芙？真的是你吗？\n\n不是？$g一位:一位;$r？但有一瞬间……\n\n够了！我那位希芙的幻象折磨我太久了。是时候为她复仇，为她的记忆带来荣誉了。\n\n我的兄弟必须付出代价！",dEN="Sif? Is it truly you?\n\nNo? A <race>? But for a moment....\n\nEnough of this! The visions of my Sif have tormented me for far too long. It is time for me to avenge her, and to bring honor to her memory.\n\nMy brother must pay!",o="托里姆希望你能倾听他的故事。",oEN="Thorim wants you to listen to his story.",p="听我说，<race>。",pEN="Hear my words, <race>.",c="你如今已了解这片土地……我的土地的一小段历史。\n\n我请求你协助我纠正这些错误。",cEN="You now know a bit of the history of this land... my land.\n\nI call upon you to assist me in setting these wrongs to right."}
Q[13065]={c="很高兴知道这片土地的人们仍然向古老种族致敬。我祝你好运，<name>，并送你这枚徽记……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[13066]={c="很高兴知道这片土地的人们仍然向古老种族致敬。我祝你好运，<name>，并送你这枚徽记……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[13067]={c="很高兴知道这片土地的人们仍然向古老种族致敬。我祝你好运，<name>，并送你这枚徽记……",cEN="It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, <name>, and offer you this token..."}
Q[13068]={d="也许你听说过对我们那位失踪英雄的赞誉？\n\n北伐军战士布理登布莱正在破碎前线协助进攻天灾军团，亡灵大军突然扑向他们。那支联军中的许多人四散奔逃，唯有布理登布莱独自折返，在屠戮中一个接一个地把十几个人拖到了安全地带。\n\n$C，他此后再未归来。有人看见他朝遥远的东北方、静默哨所的方向去了。把他带回来交给我，好让我为他的英勇表彰他。",dEN="Perhaps you've heard the praises for our missing hero?\n\nCrusader Bridenbrad was in the Broken Front aiding the attack against the Scourge when the undead army came down upon them. The many men of that allied force scattered, but Bridenbrad alone returned and dragged more than a dozen men to safety, one by one through the carnage.\n\n<class>, he has not returned since. He was spotted heading to the far northeast, towards the Silent Vigil. Bring him back to me that I might honor him for his valor.",o="北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁要你转至冰冠冰川东北部的沉默墓地，寻找战斗英雄布雷登布莱德的下落。从空中向下看去，他的篝火堆应该是最显眼的指示物。",oEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle has requested that you locate the hero, Crusader Bridenbrad at the Silent Vigil, in northeast Icecrown. His fire pit will likely be the most obvious indication of his location from the air.",c="退后！小心点！我已经被瘟疫给控制了，但是我不会让它传染到你身上的。",cEN="Back! Careful! The plague has gripped me and I'll not see it spread to you nor anyone else."}
Q[13069]={d="约顿海姆拥有空中防御，既有始祖幼龙骑手，也有鱼叉炮。他们把防御集中在最易受攻击的北面和西面。\n\n让我们用他们的防御来对付他们！\n\n<El Saltador te atraviesa con la mirada de su único ojo y sonríe como un maníaco.>\n\n去西南方瓦哈拉斯两侧悬崖上方的平台上，夺取一门鱼叉炮的控制权。干掉那些始祖幼龙和它们的骑手。把它们打个稀巴烂！",dEN="Jotunheim has aerial defenses, both in terms of proto-drake riders and harpoon guns. They've concentrated these on their northern and western facings where they are most vulnerable.\n\nLet's use their defenses against them!\n\n<The Leaper pierces you with his single eye and cackles maniacally.>\n\nTake control of a harpoon gun on the platforms that overhang the cliffs on either side of Valhalas to the southwest. Take out the proto-drakes and their riders. Shoot 'em up!",o="暗影拱顶的跳跃者要你使用尤顿海姆速射鱼叉炮，击落15头尤顿海姆始祖龙以及它们的骑手。",oEN="The Leaper at The Shadow Vault wants you to use a Jotunheim Rapid-Fire Harpoon to shoot down 15 Jotunheim Proto-Drakes and their riders.",p="啧啧……你还没射下今天应有的配额！",pEN="Tsk, tsk... you haven't shot down your fair share of proto-drakes today!",c="你真是这项事业的真正勇士，<name>！\n\n你明天能不能再来跟我说说话？我敢肯定还会有更多讨厌的始祖幼龙等着被射下来。",cEN="You are a true champion for the cause, <name>!\n\nWon't you please come speak to me again tomorrow? I'm certain that there will be more of those nasty proto-drakes to shoot down."}
Q[13070]={d="死亡的寒意在西方翻腾，意图将我们的心和灵魂都冻结在这片荒野之中，要我们臣服于那黑暗的君主。我们要反抗到底！\n\n备战工作已经展开。到前门向攻城大师菲斯克报告，接受他指派给你的任务吧。",dEN="The chill of death stirs in the west, threatening to freeze our hearts and souls to this wasteland and bind us to its dark master. We will stand and we will fight!\n\nThe preparations have begun. Report to Siegemaster Fezzik at the front gate for your assignment.",o="转至冰冠冰川的银色前线基地，向攻城大师菲斯克报到。",oEN="Report to Siegemaster Fezzik at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",c="我们必须抓紧时间，否则就会被天灾军团追上！真的没时间讲解了，<race>。你只能跳进去，祈求好运了。",cEN="We must be quick or face being overtaken by the Scourge! There's really no time for instructions, <race>. You're just going to have to jump in and hope for the best."}
Q[13071]={d="维尔喜欢火焰！维尔喜欢始祖龙！\n\n<这个憎恶兴奋地拍着双手。>\n\n$n，你去尤顿海姆，从约尔达村偷一条漂亮的始祖龙吧。让始祖龙喷出的烈焰在尤顿海姆燃起大火！",dEN="Vile like fire! Vile like proto-drakes!\n\n<The abomination claps its hands excitedly.>\n\nLittle <name> go to Jotunheim and steal a pretty proto-drake in Njorndar Village. Make proto-drake make pretty fires on Jotunheim buildings!",o="暗影拱顶的劣尸维尔要你偷得一头约尔达始祖龙，用它焚毁尤顿海姆的8幢维库人建筑物。\n\n不过，你无法焚毁坚固的巴拉加德堡垒。",oEN="Vile at The Shadow Vault wants you to steal a Njorndar Proto-Drake and use it to set fire to 8 vrykul buildings in the greater Jotunheim region.\n\nBalargarde Fortress, due to its nature, cannot be set ablaze.",p="什么？维勒没看到好多火！！！\n\n<name>，回去再放更多的火！",pEN="What? Vile not see lots of fire!!!\n\n<name>, go back and make more fire!",c="耶，耶！<name>是最棒的始祖幼龙偷窃者。\n\n你明天再来，我们放更多的火！！！",cEN="Yay, yay! <name> is best proto-drake stealer.\n\nYou come back tomorrow and we make more fire!!!"}
Q[13072]={d="我知道你为什么而来……他们派你来带我回去，但那不可能。我身染亡灵瘟疫，$C，我不会把这样的命运带给我身边的人。不，我要留在这里。\n\n我唯一的遗憾是我被死亡攫住后会变成什么。我并不惧怕死亡本身，但一想到要侍奉叛徒阿尔萨斯，我就深恶痛绝。\n\n离开我吧……并确保不再有别人来找我。如果你让任何人接触到我携带的瘟疫，那就是对我极大的伤害。",dEN="I know why you've come... they've sent you to bring me back, but that cannot happen. I carry the plague of undeath, <class>, and I'll not share my fate with those near me. No, I shall stay here.\n\nMy only regret lies in what I may become when death grips me. I do not fear death itself, but I loathe to consider serving the traitor, Arthas.\n\nLeave me... and see to it that no one else comes looking. You would do me a great disservice if you were to expose anyone to the plague that I carry.",o="返回北伐军之峰，将北伐军战士布雷登布莱德的情况告诉大领主提里奥·弗丁。",oEN="Bring news of Crusader Bridenbrad's fate to Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle.",c="布雷登布莱德染上了瘟疫？我简直不能想象，对一个终身奉献给圣光之途的英雄来说，还有什么比这更悲惨的命运。更糟的是我们竟然无计可施，只能眼睁睁地看他死去。\n\n不，亡灵不是他的归途。我们应该想办法拯救他。",cEN="Bridenbrad has contracted the plague? I cannot imagine a worse fate for one who has devoted his life to the ways of light, nor can I fathom leaving him to die without lifting a finger to help.\n\nNo, undeath shall not be his fate. We shall find a way to aid this hero."}
Q[13073]={d="在这个世界上有一种存在，他们不受肉体凡胎的限制，能控制各种能量——恢复的能量、生命的能量和圣光的能量。布雷登布莱德绝不是普通人……他身上闪耀着勇气和忠诚的光辉。我们只能希望有这样的存在来帮助他，将他从比死亡更可怕的命运中拯救出来。\n\n去找银色前线基地中的大德鲁伊莉琳德拉谈一谈……请她送你去月光林地，向守护者雷姆洛斯求助吧。",dEN="There are those of this world that tap into power unrestricted by the bounds of our mortal frames - powers of restoration, powers of life, and powers of light. And Bridenbrad, this is no ordinary man... his valor and devotion shine through. We can only hope that one of these beings will intervene and bring this hero back from a fate worse than death.\n\nGo now and speak to Arch Druid Lilliandra in the Argent Vanguard... request passage to Moonglade and seek the aid of Keeper Remulos.",o="北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁要你去和大德鲁伊莉琳德拉谈一谈，请她送你去月光林地。抵达月光林地后，与守护者雷姆洛斯谈一谈。",oEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle has requested that you secure passage from Arch Druid Lilliandra and speak to Keeper Remulos in Moonglade.",c="你好，孩子。\n\n我明白提里奥的请求，也相信他的判断，我们来看看能为这位北伐军战士布理登布莱做些什么。你所求的绝非易事——天灾军团不属于这个世界，多年来许多人都试图剥离他们的腐化，却都失败了。\n\n对于一个高贵而光明的生命，一切并非毫无希望。",cEN="Hello child.\n\nI understand Tirion's request and trust in his judgment, we will see what we can do for this Crusader Bridenbrad. What you ask is no simple task - the Scourge are not of this world, and many have failed in attempting to strip their corruption over the years.\n\nIn a being of nobility and light, all is not without hope."}
Q[13074]={d="我们需要的东西只存在于翡翠梦境之中……那是注入了强大恢复魔法的橡实。这片圣地中的许多地方都与梦境紧密相连，我的神龛便是其中之一。\n\n我会把你送入梦境去取回一些橡实。不过要做好准备，$c，这种进入梦境的方式很危险，你极有可能遭到梦魇的侵扰。\n\n迅速取回几颗橡实，然后离开我的神龛，或者掐自己一下回到我们的世界。",dEN="What we need exists only in the emerald dream... acorns that are infused with a powerful restorative magic. Many places in this sacred glade are closely tied with the dream, and my shrine is among them.\n\nI will send you into the dream to recover some of these acorns. Be prepared though <class>, for this method of entering the dream is dangerous, and it is very likely you will be beset by nightmares.\n\nRecover a few acorns quickly, and then depart from my shrine or pinch yourself to return to our world.",o="月光林地的守护者雷姆洛斯要你进入翡翠梦境，获取3枚翡翠橡果。\n\n跨出雷姆洛斯神殿的范围就可以回到艾泽拉斯世界。",oEN="Keeper Remulos at Moonglade has instructed you to enter the emerald dream and recover 3 Emerald Acorns.\n\nLeave the vicinity of the Shrine of Remulos to return to Azeroth.",p="见到你安然无恙真好。你取得翡翠橡果了吗？",pEN="It is good to see that you are safe. Have you recovered the acorns?",c="干得好，年轻人。",cEN="Excellent work, young one."}
Q[13075]={d="我会打开传送门，将你送回冰冠冰川的大德鲁伊身边。我祝福你和那位北伐军圣骑士，希望这颗橡果可以净化他，将他从瘟疫中解救出来。\n\n再见，$r。",dEN="I shall open a portal to take you back to the druid that brought you here. You and your crusader have my well wishes. I hope that this acorn is able to purify your crusader and save him from the wretched fate of the plague.\n\nFarewell, <race>.",o="将翡翠橡果交给冰冠冰川沉默墓地的北伐军战士布雷登布莱德。",oEN="Return to Crusader Bridenbrad at the Silent Vigil in Icecrown with the Emerald Acorn.",p="幸会，<class>。我就知道尽管我警告过你，你还是会回来，但我很高兴你听从了我的意愿，没有让其他人来冒险。\n\n你为什么又回来找我？",pEN="Well met, <class>. I knew that you would return, despite my warnings, but I'm pleased that you heeded my desire to not risk anyone else.\n\nWhy have you come back to me?",c="提里奥派你去找雷姆洛斯？我……我简直感动得不能自己。凡人实在不值得获得如此强大的协助，无论是多么尊贵，多么无私的人。你真是个好人，为了我跋涉了那么长的距离。请接受我由衷地谢意。\n\n植下翡翠橡果吧—— 我准备好了。",cEN="Tirion sent you to Remulos? I'm... I'm flattered. One does not call favors in with beings of such power idly, no matter how noble or altruistic they might be. You too are kind to have gone to such lengths on my behalf. You have my thanks.\n\nPlant the seed - I am ready."}
Q[13076]={d="我感受到了新生的力量……但是瘟疫还残留在我体内。别担心，我永远感激你为我付出的努力，陌生人。不管怎样，你为我争取到了宝贵的时间，让我不致于很快化身亡灵，祸害世界。\n\n谢谢你，$c。请你向提里奥转达我的谢意。告诉提里奥，能为他效劳是我的荣幸。",dEN="I feel refreshed... renewed... but the plague still grips me. Not to worry, I am still eternally grateful that you went to such lengths for me, a complete stranger. If nothing else, you've bought me a few more precious hours not plaguing the world as a hideous undead.\n\nThank you, <class>. Please extend my thanks to Tirion as well, and let him know that it has been an honor to serve beside him.",o="向北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁汇报翡翠橡果的效果。",oEN="Return to Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle with news of Emerald Acorn's effects.",c="翡翠橡果不具功效的消息，令我感到悲伤。不过我们没有时间沉浸在悲伤里，我必须继续寻求其它可能的帮助。",cEN="It saddens me to hear that it did not work. No reason to fret though, I have met other beings of good that may still be of aid to us."}
Q[13077]={d="红龙女王阿莱克丝塔萨掌握着生命的魔法。她曾经用烈焰焚毁亡灵，并让新的生命从它们的灰烬中诞生。她的力量或许能够拯救布雷登布莱德。\n\n阿莱克丝塔萨就住在龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿——请你去见她，代表我谦卑地请求她的帮助。",dEN="The dragon-queen, Alexstrasza, possesses magics over all life. In the past, she has used great fire to incinerate undead and rebirth fresh new life in their place. Perhaps her powers might be able to save our Bridenbrad as well.\n\nAlexstrasza makes her home at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight - please go to her and humbly request her aid on my behalf.",o="向龙眠神殿的阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者请求帮助。",oEN="Request the aid of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple.",c="向你致意，<race>。\n\n你脸上的忧虑显而易见。请告诉我是什么困扰着你。",cEN="Greetings to you, <race>.\n\nThe concern is clear on your face. Please tell me what troubles you."}
Q[13078]={d="在这黑暗的时代，我绝不能抛弃圣光的勇士。\n\n我们需要一些神圣的对象，才有可能拯救布雷登布莱德……唯有感染过亡灵瘟疫，并且已经重获新生的虔诚生灵才具备免疫这种侵蚀的能力。\n\n我要你进入红玉巨龙圣地。我的红玉看守者曾以烈焰灼烧过那片被亡灵踏足的土地，你会发现新的生命已经开始生长。将那些正在茁壮生长的达莉亚之泪带回来给我。",dEN="In this dark time, I'll not be the one to abandon a champion of the Light.\n\nWe will need something sacred for this to have a hope of saving your Bridenbrad... a remnant of a devout being that fell victim to this very same plague.\n\nGo now to the sacred soil of the passages outside my Ruby Dragonshrine where the battle is joined. As my Ruby Keepers fly down and set flame to the ground beneath undead feet, you will witness new life grow forth. Among that life are Dahlia's Tears - bring them to me.",o="龙眠神殿的阿莱克丝塔萨要你从被红玉看守者的烈焰净化过的土壤里取得达莉亚之泪。",oEN="Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at Wyrmrest Temple has requested that you recover Dahlia's Tears from soil freshly cleansed by a Ruby Keeper's flames.",p="啊，亲爱的达莉亚。我多么地想念你。",pEN="Ah, dear Dahlia. I do miss you so.",c="有了达莉亚之泪和古老的魔法，我可以赋予你拯救伟大北伐军战士的一丝希望。",cEN="With Dahlia's Tears and ancient magic, I fashion you some small amount of hope for your great crusader."}
Q[13079]={d="你必须明白，年轻的$r，我的能力仅限于净化躯体以促成新生……要在不影响肉体的前提下解除亡灵瘟疫，却已经超越了我的能力范围。\n\n如果布雷登布莱德真的像你所说的那样虔诚，他或许能通过净化的考验，获得新生。但是，我不确定这是否就是你所寻找的救赎之道。带着它和我的祝福上路吧。",dEN="You must understand, young <race>, that cleansing the body in favor of life anew is something well within my grasp... removing the plague of undeath without affecting the body, however, is beyond the scope of the powers that I control.\n\nIf this Bridenbrad is the beacon of light that you profess him to be, perhaps he will endure such a cleansing and thrive, but I cannot state with confidence that this is the salvation that you seek. Take it and go with all of my blessings.",o="将阿莱克丝塔萨之息交给冰冠冰川沉默墓地的北伐军战士布雷登布莱德。",oEN="Bring the Breath of Alexstrasza to Crusader Bridenbrad at the Silent Vigil in Icecrown.",p="你又回来了，<class>。你为什么要这样冒险？",pEN="You have returned yet again, <class>. Why do you risk yourself so?",c="阿莱克丝塔萨的气息……你去找了龙后本人？我万分感激。\n\n我明白这种净化所伴随的风险，我已做好准备。来吧，<class>。",cEN="The breath of Alexstrasza... you have gone to the dragon-queen herself? I'm extremely grateful.\n\nI understand the risks of such cleansing and I am prepared. Proceed, <class>."}
Q[13080]={d="<布雷登布莱德屏住呼吸，向你扬了扬手。>\n\n净化过程的确异常痛苦，但是我能感受到体内的堕落气息被烈焰吞噬了。可惜亡灵的瘟疫似乎很难彻底清除。\n\n$C，谢谢你为我所做的一切。你的无私行动让我重新燃起了希望，这个世界还是存在着像你这样的好心人——即便我离开了，黑暗也终将被战胜。现在我终于可以安心了。\n\n走吧，不必再心存遗憾了。",dEN="<Bridenbrad raises a hand to you as he catches his breath.>\n\nIt was nearly as painful as it looked, but it was as if I could feel some of the corruption being burnt away from within my body. It seems the plague is not so readily bested though.\n\n<class>, thank you for everything that you have done. Your selfless actions have renewed my hope that there is yet great good left within this world - I can depart without fear that darkness will prevail in my absence.\n\nGo now, go with no regrets.",o="向北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁汇报阿莱克丝塔萨之息的效果。",oEN="Return to Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle with news of the effects of the Breath of Alexstrasza.",c="天灾瘟疫的确是非常的棘手——这从阿莱克丝塔萨的话中不难理解，要从如此无情的命运中拯救布雷登布莱德也许不太乐观，但我不会如此轻易地放弃他。\n\n仍然还有一线光明，还有一个存在或许能扭转他的悲惨命运。",cEN="The Scourge plague is no simple foe to defeat. Alexstrasza's words suggest that perhaps we can yet save our Bridenbrad from the unimaginable fate of the unliving should he fall, but I will not give him up so easily.\n\nThere is yet one more path of light I would like to pursue. One more being who might avert this horrible fate."}
Q[13081]={d="非常感谢你为我们所做的一切，$n。还有最后一件差事要麻烦你……我们愿意付出任何代价来拯救这位圣骑士，如今我们也只剩最后一丝希望了。\n\n我要你转至沙塔斯城，与纳鲁阿达尔谈一谈。长久以来，他一直是圣光的象征，是圣骑士强大的盟友。将布雷登布莱德的事迹告诉他，恳求他给予帮助。\n\n请你赶快行动，时间就是生命——我担心他在这个世界的时日已经不多了。",dEN="I appreciate everything that you have done for us, <name>. I have one last errand for you... one last gleaming hope for a paladin who deserves any salvation that we can extend.\n\nGo now to Shattrath and speak to the naaru, A'dal. He has long been a beacon of light and powerful ally to devout paladins. Impart Bridenbrad's story and seek any aid that he might have to offer.\n\nI cannot impress how important it is that you move quickly - I fear our crusader does not have much more time in this world.",o="向沙塔斯城的阿达尔求助。",oEN="Request the aid of A'dal at Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest.",c="<Un suave tintineo llena tu cabeza al acercarte al naaru>\n\n我知道你为什么而来。",cEN="<A gentle ringing fills your head as you approach the naaru.>\n\nI know why you have come."}
Q[13082]={d="我很高兴你能来找我，$n。我已经知晓了北伐军战士布雷登布莱德的事迹，也知道你正在为了救他而四处奔波。布雷登布莱德的英勇激发了你的慷慨无私，这本身就是一个奇迹。\n\n圣光有自愈的能力。我会祝福布雷登布莱德，使他不会遭受亡灵的腐蚀。我要把你送回达拉然，而你要快点回去见他。记住，我与你同在。",dEN="I am pleased that you have come to me, <name>. I know of Crusader Bridenbrad, and of your travels in hope of saving him. Bridenbrad's valor has sparked remarkable selflessness in you, and this is a miracle unto itself.\n\nThe Light will take care of its own. I will extend my blessing to Bridenbrad and he shall not endure the corruption of undeath. I shall return you to Dalaran, and you shall return to him. Know that I remain with you.",o="返回冰冠冰川，在沉默墓地找到北伐军战士布雷登布莱德。",oEN="Return to Crusader Bridenbrad at the Silent Vigil in Icecrown.",c="<Al acercarte al Cruzado Bridenbrad, no puedes evitar notar que su piel ha adquirido un tono pálido y su respiración es superficial. Está claro que le queda poco tiempo.>\n\n你回到我身边了，<class>。我必须承认……很高兴再见到你……你的面容让我重新燃起希望，相信这片土地终有一日会摆脱阿尔萨斯的掌控。我很荣幸能遇见你……\n\n<Las palabras de Bridenbrad se desvanecen, con una tenue sonrisa en su rostro. Mientras la vida parece escapársele, un suave tintineo llena tus oídos.>",cEN="<As you approach Crusader Bridenbrad, you cannot help but notice that his skin has taken on a pale hue and his breaths are shallow. It is clear that he has little time left.>\n\nYou have returned to me, <class>. I must admit... it is good to see you again... your face renews my hope that this land will be free of Arthas's grasp one day soon. I'm proud to have met you...\n\n<Bridenbrad's words trail off, a dim smile on his face. As life seems to slip from him, a gentle ringing fills your ears.>"}
Q[13083]={d="<北伐军战士布雷登布莱德的战袍放在箱子底部。呼啸的寒风掠过时，战袍微微拂动起来。>\n\n提里奥一定很希望留下这位伟大的北伐军圣骑士最后的遗物。",dEN="<Crusader Bridenbrad's tabard rests in the bottom of the chest, shifting slightly as the howling wind finds its way in.>\n\nTirion will desire this last remnant of the great crusader.",o="将布雷登布莱德的战袍交给北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁。",oEN="Bring Crusader Bridenbrad's Tabard to Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle.",p="他已逝去，是吗？我感觉到这块大陆上的光明又黯淡了一些。",pEN="He has departed, hasn't he? I felt a small bit of light leave the land.",c="我很高兴你拯救了他，让他不致成为不死邪物。有了阿达尔的祝福，他知道在他死后，邪恶的阴影将无法如影随行。\n\n我们会牢记他的精神，还有你无私的义行。再一次感谢你，为了你所做一切。",cEN="I am glad you were able to save him from undeath. With A'dal's blessing, he will know no evil in his afterlife.\n\nWe shall take heart in his shining example and in your selflessness. Thank you for all that you have done."}
Q[13084]={d="我们来瞧瞧能否进一步打击维库人的信心，$n。\n\n我希望你每天都去尤顿海姆跑一趟，烧毁他们的旗帜。这虽说是件小事，但是维库人很快就会发现，他们的世袭之地每天都在遭到破坏和侮辱。我相信这比肉体伤害来得更痛苦，一定能狠狠地打击他们的士气。\n\n至少……你也没什么损失嘛。",dEN="Let us see if we can further weaken the resolve of the vrykul, <name>.\n\nEach day I wish you to travel to Jotunheim and put their banners to the torch. It may seem a trivial thing, but to see their ancestral home vandalized on a daily basis will demoralize them more than any physical punishment you can inflict.\n\nAt least... it can't hurt.",o="暗影拱顶的兰克拉尔公爵要你烧毁10面维库人旗帜。",oEN="Duke Lankral at The Shadow Vault wants you to burn 10 Vrykul Banners.",p="你有更多活得干罗。",pEN="You have more work to do.",c="<公爵盯着你一会，然后点了点头。>\n\n你给尤顿海姆的维库人带来了可怕的心理创伤。尤顿海姆对他们而言是无与伦比的地方，其重要性仅次于伊米海姆。\n\n你应该继续对此处施加压力，而我要守住这座穹殿抵抗巫妖王的攻势。",cEN="<The duke looks at you a moment and nods.>\n\nYou're inflicting horrible mental trauma on the Jotunheim vrykul. This is where they were first reawakened. It is a place of significant importance to them, second only to Ymirheim.\n\nYou must keep up the pressure there while I hold the vault from the assault of the Lich King."}
Q[13085]={d="我看见被折磨的维林偷偷溜进了暗影拱顶。这个无能的蠢货！\n\n我想知道他有没有悔过自新，还打不打算将我的死亡骑士还给我！这件事就交给你来办吧。",dEN="I just saw that incompetent fool, Vaelen the Flayed, sneak into the vault building.\n\nGo see to it that he rectifies his mistake and returns my death knights to me!",o="与暗影拱顶内被折磨的维林谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Vaelen the Flayed at The Shadow Vault.",c="我想我能猜到你为什么在这儿，<name>。",cEN="I think I can guess why you're here, <name>."}
Q[13086]={d="前线基地已经启动防御方案，$c！基地中的四座塔楼顶层分别安置着一门可伸缩的银色北伐军火炮，它们都得到过古斯塔夫神父的祝福。我要你飞到塔楼顶层去操纵火炮，用它摧毁巫妖王麾下的天灾军团部队。\n\n你只需注意一点：天灾军团肯定会派出冰霜巨龙来围攻塔楼，你必须击落这些野兽！如果巨龙摧毁了基地的城墙和塔楼，我们就完蛋了！",dEN="I've triggered the base's defenses, <class>! Atop each of the Vanguard's four towers is a retractable Argent Crusade cannon, blessed by Father Gustav himself. You'll need to fly up to one of those towers and man a cannon. Use it to destroy the Scourge onslaught that the Lich King has deployed.\n\nJust one warning, the Scourge will undoubtedly send their frost wyrms to lay siege to the towers. Shoot them out of the sky! If they destroy the walls and towers of this base, we're done for!",o="使用银色火炮消灭100名天灾军团攻击者和3条霜巢毁灭者。\n\n完成任务后向攻城大师菲斯克复命。",oEN="Use an Argent Cannon to destroy 100 Scourge attackers. You must also kill 3 Frostbrood Destroyers.\n\nReturn to Siegemaster Fezzik should you succeed.",p="那些垂死的嘶吼老是令我不快！给他们个痛快！",pEN="The screams of the dying will haunt me forever! Help them!",c="你操作大炮的技术简直就像个地精炮手，我的朋友。你拯救了前线基地和银色北伐军——如同大领主本人就在战场上一般！真惊人！",cEN="You handled the cannon like a goblin gunner, friend. You've saved the Vanguard and the Argent Crusade - all the while backing the Highlord himself up on the field of battle! Amazing!"}
Q[13087]={d="你有东西吃吗？我快饿死了！至少给我弄点冰冷的肉来吧，这样我就能自己做些诺森德炖肉了！如果你能帮我弄来一些冰冷的肉，我就教你怎么做炖肉，这样你也能自己炖肉吃。现在就去给我弄些肉来！",dEN="So what are ya doin' if you dinna have any stew for me. I got me a HUNGER! At least bring me some chilled meat so I kin cook me own stew! If ya do, I kin give ya the recipe so you kin make it for yourself. NOW GO GET ME SOME MEAT!",o="将4块冰冷的肉交给瓦加德的布罗姆。你可以在诺森德的任意野兽身上找到冰冷的肉。",oEN="Bring four chilled meat to Brom Brewbaster at Valgarde. Chilled meat can be found on any Northrend beast.",p="我的肉在哪！",pEN="WHERE IS MY MEAT!",c="你给我弄来了肉！食谱拿去，我得煮饭了！",cEN="Ya gots me meat! Here is your recipe, I gots cookin to do!"}
Q[13088]={d="我们这里来了很多新兵，这些家伙都还饿着肚子呢！如果你能去帮我弄些冰冷的肉，我就可以做一些诺森德炖肉了，当然，我也可以教你炖肉的方法。",dEN="We got a lot of new recruits here and these lads are hungry! If you could go out and get me some chilled meat for stew, I could teach you how to make it for yourself.",o="将4块冰冷的肉交给无畏要塞的罗里克·玛克雷尔。你可以在诺森德的任意野兽身上找到冰冷的肉。",oEN="Bring four chilled meat to Rollick Mackreel at Valiance Keep. Chilled meat can be found on any Northrend beast.",p="这些孩子们需要煮诺森德炖肉的肉块。",pEN="The lads need meat for their stew.",c="这下可以喂饱咱们的新兵了！来，这是烹调的方法。",cEN="That will keep our recruits fed! Here's how you cook it."}
Q[13089]={d="没有什么能比用新鲜的肉烹制而成的诺森德炖肉更能让你感到暖和了。从那些凶猛的野兽身上弄些冰冷的肉来，我会教你怎样做出热腾腾的诺森德炖肉。",dEN="Nothing like a stew made from the living to warm your bones. Bring me some of the chilled meat that can be found on the wretched beasts of this place, and I shall teach you to make a warm stew.",o="将4块冰冷的肉交给复仇港的托马斯·克里奇。你可以在诺森德的任意野兽身上找到冰冷的肉。",oEN="Bring four chilled meat to Thomas Kolichio at Vengeance Landing. Chilled meat can be found on any Northrend beast.",p="都在等着炖肉呢……",pEN="The stew awaits...",c="我们立刻就能把这堆生肉变成香喷喷的炖肉。",cEN="We can quickly turn this flesh into stew."}
Q[13090]={d="战歌要塞的士兵需要吃饱喝足才能保持充沛的体力。如果你能从犀牛或者其它野兽身上收集一些冰冷的肉，我就可以给他们做些诺森德炖肉。而且，如果你乐意的话，我也很愿意教你学会烹制这道菜的方法。",dEN="The warriors of the Warsong Offensive need food in their bellies to keep their strength up. If you could bring some chilled meats from the Rhinos or other beasts, I could make them some stew. I would be willing to teach you the recipe if you were willing.",o="将4块冰冷的肉交给战歌要塞的奥恩·嫩蹄。你可以在诺森德的任意野兽身上找到冰冷的肉。",oEN="Bring four chilled meat to Orn Tenderhoof at Warsong Hold. Chilled meat can be found on any Northrend beast.",p="只要有肉块，诺森德炖肉就准备好了。",pEN="When the meat is present, the stew will be prepared.",c="我向你致谢。",cEN="I give my thanks to you."}
Q[13091]={d="洞穴外面的水牢里塞满了尚未被维库人法师驯服的元素生物。我可以教你一个办法，让你在短时间内控制这些生物，接着你就可以利用它们破坏尤顿海姆！\n\n<被女妖附身的维库人从空气中汲取魔法，然后将她硕大的手指点在你的前额。>\n\n去吧，打开水牢。控制一只恐怖之水，利用它消灭我们的敌人！",dEN="The water lock outside my cave is teeming with elementals that the vrykul magi have yet to tame. I am going to teach you a trick for possessing these creatures for a short time, and you will use them to wreak havoc upon Jotunheim!\n\n<The banshee-infested vrykul draws magic in the air and touches a large finger to your forehead.>\n\nGo now and open the gate to the lock. A water terror will rush out and you will possess it to destroy our enemies!",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你控制一个恐怖之水，利用它杀死尤顿海姆地区的10名维库人。\n\n尤顿海姆休眠看守者、尤顿海姆战士、尤尔丁控水师、约尔达女矛手和瓦哈拉斯行尸都符合要求。",oEN="The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village wants you to possess a Water Terror and use it to slay 10 vrykul in the greater Jotunheim region.\n\nQualifying vrykul are Jotunheim Sleep-Watchers, Jotunheim Warriors, Mjordin Water Magi, Njorndar Spear-Sisters, and Valhalas Vargul.",p="我对骸骨的解读显示，你还没完成你的工作。",pEN="My reading of the bones tells me that you're not quite done.",c="我从未在维库人的眼中看到如此的恐惧。他们以为可以掌握他们自己的小世界。\n\n我们这就要证明他们错了——错得离谱。",cEN="I have never seen such terror in the eyes of a vrykul. They think themselves masters of their world.\n\nYou and I are going to prove them wrong. Very wrong."}
Q[13092]={d="占据这名维库人的好处之一就是，我可以使用她的全部力量。作为一名女巫和符文解读者，她可以通过抛掷徽记来决定别人的命运。\n\n<女巫露出得意的笑容。>\n\n幸运的是，我有能力左右占卜的结果。\n\n我要你去尤顿海姆干掉一些维库人，把他们的徽记带回来给我。我可以抛掷徽记，让你决定自己的命运。",dEN="One of the benefits of possessing this creature is that I have access to all of her powers. As a bone witch and rune reader, she has the power to throw the bones and determine one's fate.\n\n<The Bone Witch smirks.>\n\nLucky for you and I that I have it within my power to influence those readings.\n\nBring me the bones of the vrykul that you kill here in Jotunheim and I will toss them to allow you to determine your own fate.",o="约尔达村的女巫要你去收集15个维库人的徽记。",oEN="The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village has instructed you to collect 15 Vrykul Bones.",p="我有个有趣的发现，这支族群当他们使用如此原始的魔法时曾经支配过整个世界。",pEN="I find it remarkable that these beings ever held sway over the world when they utilized such primitive magic.",c="现在，我们就来看看你的未来会怎样。\n\n<La Bruja de los Huesos lanza los huesos sobre la alfombra frente a ella.>\n\n选择你的命运吧，<class>。",cEN="And now we shall see what the future holds for you.\n\n<The Bone Witch casts the bones upon the rug in front of her.>\n\nChoose your fate, <class>."}
Q[13093]={p="带给我更多的维库骸骨，我们就能依你首选，操控你的命运。",pEN="Bring me more vrykul bones and we will influence the fates in your favor.",c="选择你的命运吧，<name>。",cEN="Choose your fate, <name>."}
Q[13094]={d="大法师伯林纳德是肯瑞托研究玛里苟斯的第一权威。他一生都在研究这位守护巨龙及其行为。\n\n最近，他把关于阿卡诺秘典的研究借给了我，那似乎是玛里苟斯试图拼凑起来的一张地图。我错在当着一些来此补货的部落冒险者的面谈论它——现在它不见了！\n\n一定是他们干的，。求你了，跟着他们进入枢纽，在伯林纳德来取回这本书之前把它找回来。",dEN="Archmage Berinand is the Kirin Tor's foremost authority on Malygos. He's spent his life studying the aspect and his behaviors.\n\nRecently, he loaned me his research on the Arcanomicron, some sort of map that Malygos is trying to assemble. I made the mistake of discussing it with a group of Horde adventurers while they were restocking their goods here - and now it's gone!\n\nIt must have been them, <class>. Please, follow them into the nexus and recover the book before Berinand comes to recover it.",o="图书馆员塞尔拉希望你进入魔枢，找回伯林纳德的研究笔记。",oEN="Librarian Serrah wants you to enter the Nexus and recover Berinand's Research.",p="求你了，<name>，告诉我你找到了伯林纳德的研究……",pEN="Please, <name>, tell me you've found Berinand's research....",c="你找到了！？哦是的，东西都在这儿了。\n\n请容我表达谢意。如果可以的话，伯林纳德最好别知道这件事。",cEN="You found it!? Yes, yes, it's all here.\n\nPlease, take this with my gratitude. And if it's not too much to ask, it would be better for me if Berinand never learned of this."}
Q[13095]={d="大法师伯林纳德是肯瑞托研究玛里苟斯的第一权威。他一生都在研究这位守护巨龙及其行为。\n\n最近，他把关于阿卡诺秘典的研究借给了我，那似乎是玛里苟斯试图拼凑起来的一张地图。我错在当着一些来此补货的联盟冒险者的面谈论它——现在它不见了！\n\n一定是他们干的，。求你了，跟着他们进入枢纽，在伯林纳德来找我要回这本书之前把它找到。",dEN="Archmage Berinand is the Kirin Tor's foremost authority on Malygos. He's spent his life studying the aspect and his behaviors.\n\nRecently, he loaned me his research on the Arcanomicron, some sort of map that Malygos is trying to assemble. I made the mistake of discussing it with a group of Alliance adventurers while they were restocking their goods here - and now it's gone!\n\nIt must have been them, <class>. Please, follow them into the nexus and find the book before Berinand comes to recover it from me.",o="图书馆员塞尔拉希望你进入魔枢，找回伯林纳德的研究笔记。",oEN="Librarian Serrah wants you to enter the Nexus and recover Berinand's Research.",p="求你了，<name>，告诉我你找到了伯林纳德的研究……",pEN="Please, <name>, tell me you've found Berinand's research....",c="你找到了！？哦是的，东西都在这儿了。\n\n请容我表达谢意。如果可以的话，伯林纳德最好别知道这件事。",cEN="You found it!? Yes, yes, it's all here.\n\nPlease, take this with my gratitude. And if it's not too much to ask, it would be better for me if Berinand never learned of this."}
Q[13096]={d="你看见了吗，$gtron:titi;？\n\n那一定是我这辈子见过最可怕的事。伟大的阿卡里——就在我眼前被杀了。太可怕了……\n\n我发过誓不插手这里的事。我的职责只是观察。但这绝不能容忍！加尔德拉必须付出代价！\n\n进入古达克去找他。阿卡里的死得到报复之后，回来见我，$gtron:titi;。",dEN="Did ya see it, mon?\n\nIt musta been da most awful thing I ever seen. Da great Akali - slain right before my eyes. Horrible...\n\nI done took an oath not ta be gettin' involved here. My job be to observe only. But dis cannot stand! Gal'darah must pay!\n\nGo into Gundrak and seek him out. Come back to me when Akali's death been avenged, mon.",o="杜布拉金的托玛尔要你杀死古达克的迦尔达拉。",oEN="Tol'mar at Dubra'Jin wants you to slay Gal'darah in Gundrak.",p="阿卡里的死得到报复了吗，<race>？",pEN="Has Akali's death been avenged, <race>?",c="你成功了？！迦尔达拉死透了？\n\n拿去吧，老兄。把这个当作你制裁那个废物的奖赏。",cEN="Ya done it?! Gal'darah be no more?\n\nHere ya go, mon. Take dis gift for bringin' justice to that wretch."}
Q[13097]={d="虽然阿卡里先知确实不会再祸害这个世界了，但我们还有一些事情要做。\n\n阿卡里的大部分血液都落入了另一个人手中，他才是真正的威胁。\n\n$n，快到古达克北边的杜布拉金去，和托玛尔谈一谈。他会给你进一步的指引。",dEN="While it is true that the Prophet of Akali will trouble this world no more, there yet remains work to be done.\n\nThe greater part of Akali's blood has empowered another, and it is in him that the true danger lies.\n\nQuickly, <name>, make your way north of Gundrak to Dubra'Jin and speak with Tol'mar. He will be able to direct you further in this cause.",o="哈克娅要你去跟杜布拉金的托玛尔谈一谈。",oEN="Har'koa wants you to speak with Tol'mar at Dubra'jin.",c="听着，老兄。有项危险的任务要做！",cEN="Lissen up, mon. Dere be dangerous work ta be done!"}
Q[13098]={d="古达克注定要灭亡了，老兄。$gtron:titi;{None}\n历史正在我们眼前重演。当巨魔背叛自己的神明时，结局就已注定。这只是时间问题。\n\n也许如果我们能把事件清楚地记录下来，就能阻止后世走上同样的道路。\n\n如果你有勇气，就进入古达克，寻找究竟是什么把达卡莱帝国推向这般结局的线索。\n",dEN="Gundrak be doomed, mon.\n\nHistory be repeatin' itself before our eyes. When trolls be turnin' on their own gods, the end be certain. It just be a matter of time.\n\nPerhaps if we can record the events clearly, we might prevent future generations from traveling down da same path.\n\nIf you be havin' the courage, enter Gundrak and search for clues to what brought the Drakkari Empire to such an end as dis.",o="杜布拉金的记载者拜基妮要你进入古达克，收集6份达卡莱历史石板。",oEN="Chronicler Bah'Kini at Dubra'Jin wants you to enter Gundrak and collect 6 Drakkari History Tablets.",p="你找到达卡莱历史石板了吗，老兄？",pEN="You find da Drakkari history tablets, mon?",c="<Bah'Kini examina las tablillas grabadas por un momento y luego vuelve a centrar su atención en ti.>\n\n这些是真的，<race>。我会把它们放到收藏中合适的位置。\n\n也许我们终于能给这种行为画上句号了。",cEN="<Bah'Kini scans the engraved tablets for a moment, then turns her attention back to you.>\n\nDese be authentic, <race>. I'll be placin' dem in their proper place in my collection.\n\nPerhaps we can finally be puttin' an end to dis behavior."}
Q[13099]={d="古达克的深处回荡着恐怖的声音，而且越来越响，越来越频繁了。\n\n我有一个相处多年的学生一直在古达克北面的哨站里记录那里发生的事情。你能抽空去找她核实一下情况吗？",dEN="There have been fearsome sounds echoing from Gundrak. They have been increasing in volume and frequency of late.\n\nMy long-time student is currently recording events from her post just west of Gundrak. Perhaps you could find the time to check in on her for me?",o="记载者图基尼要你去和杜布拉金的拜基妮谈一谈。",oEN="To'kini wants you to speak to Bah'kini at Dubra'Jin.",c="相处多年的学生？哈哈！\n\n如果相处多年指的是“一辈子”的话，那你就说对了。\n\n图基尼是我胆小的父亲——没种靠近古达克……所以他才会派我来这里！",cEN="Long-time student? Hah!\n\nIf by long-time ya mean my whole life, den I suppose dat be accurate.\n\nTo'kini be my cowardly father - too fearful to take up a position so near Gundrak... so he sent me!"}
Q[13100]={d="我们手上有一份重要的订单！摩尔珍品店的奥尔顿·本内特点了一份蘑菇肉片。\n\n到达拉然下水道里去，采集几枚魔法蘑菇，然后把它们跟一些冰冷的肉放在一起烘烤，做好之后立即把它给奥尔顿送去。",dEN="We have an important order that needs to go out! Orton Bennet in Curiosities & Moore needs a mushroom meatloaf.\n\nGet some infused mushrooms found in the Dalaran sewers, chilled meat, and cook them in this meatloaf pan. When you're done, deliver the cooked meatloaf to Orton.",o="将2块冰冷的肉和采自达拉然下水道的4枚魔法蘑菇放在你的煎肉锅中，烹制成一份魔法蘑菇肉片，然后将其带到达拉然的鲁因广场，交给摩尔珍品店中的奥尔顿·本内特。",oEN="Use your Meatloaf Pan to cook 4 Infused Mushrooms and 2 Chilled Meats and bring the finished Mushroom Meatloaf to Orton Bennet in Curiosities & Moore, located in Runeweaver Square in Dalaran.",p="你给我带了什么吃的吗？\n\n我从没能离开过这个商店，哪怕一分钟。",pEN="Do you have any food for me?\n\nI never seem to be able to get away from the shop, even for a minute.",c="这看起来真不错！谢谢！",cEN="This looks great! Thanks!"}
Q[13101]={d="魔术旅馆的阿瑞尔·蔚视将迎来一场会议，急需一场盛宴！\n\n你需要提供一些北方炖肉，以及一壶来自达拉然中部奶酪店\"再来一杯\"的葡萄酒。奶酪店老板欠我这些酒，你应该能在店铺附近找到。\n\n把酒和炖肉带给阿瑞尔。",dEN="Arille Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge has a convention coming in and needs a feast pronto!\n\nYou need to provide some Northern Stew and a Jug of Wine from the cheese shop \"One More Glass\" in central Dalaran. The owner of the cheese shop owes me the wine and you should find it somewhere around the shop.\n\nBring the wine and stews to Arille.",o="将4份诺森德炖肉和从一壶达拉然的奶酪店中取来的葡萄酒带到达拉然的鲁因广场，交给魔术旅馆中的埃里雷。",oEN="Bring 4 Northern Stew that you use your cooking skill to make and a Jug of Wine from the cheese shop in Dalaran to Arille Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge found in Runeweaver Square in Dalaran.",p="我的餐点来了吗，会议的参加者随时都会到啊！",pEN="Where is my food, I will have conventioneers here any minute!",c="对每个人而言，这样的份量都算是丰盛的大餐吧！我想他们会满意的。",cEN="This is plenty of food for everyone! I am sure the customers will be pleased."}
Q[13102]={d="达拉然下水道的旅店中食物短缺，该店的老板埃因·格林需要一份萝卜炖肉来款待他的顾客。\n\n到晶歌森林去采集4根晶歌胡萝卜，把它们和4块冰冷的肉一起炖了。\n\n你可以通过鲁因广场东边的传送间转至晶歌森林。\n\n等你准备好了萝卜炖肉之后，就把它交给埃因。",dEN="Ajay Green the innkeeper in the Dalaran sewers needs a vegetable stew for his customers as they are running low on food down there.\n\nCollect 4 Crystalsong Carrots from the Crystalsong Forest and cook them together with 4 Chilled Meat.\n\nYou can get to the Crystalsong Forest from the portal chamber in the eastern corner of Runeweaver Square.\n\nOnce the vegetable stew is ready, bring it to Ajay.",o="将4根采自晶歌森林的晶歌胡萝卜与4块冰冷的肉放在炖肉锅里进行烹饪。\n\n炖好之后，将萝卜炖肉交给达拉然下水道的旅店老板埃因·格林。",oEN="Cook 4 Crystalsong Carrots from Crystalsong Forest with 4 Chilled Meat in the Cookpot.\n\nOnce it is ready bring the Vegetable Stew to the Dalaran sewers Innkeeper Ajay Green.",p="你最好给我个准话：这次的炖肉里没有任何和地精有关的东西！",pEN="I've got hungry people down here! We need some stew.",c="这些转眼就会被吃光！多谢！",cEN="This will be consumed in no time! Thanks!"}
Q[13103]={d="达拉然制皮店里的拉尼德·金辉突然很想吃葡萄酒配奶酪。\n\n去达拉然中部的\"再来一杯\"货架上取奶酪，再收集城中各处的桌子上找到的半杯葡萄酒。把酒倒进一个瓶子里，连同奶酪一起端给拉尼德。\n\n我们认为他尝不出差别。",dEN="Ranid Glowergold in the Leatherworkers shop in Dalaran has had a sudden craving for wine and cheese.\n\nCollect cheese which is on the shelf at \"One More Glass\" in central Dalaran and half full wine glasses found on tables all over the city. Pour the wine together into a bottle and serve it with the cheese to Ranid.\n\nWe don't think he will know the difference.",o="把空奶酪盘与来自奶酪店\"再来一杯\"的陈年达拉然林堡奶酪，以及达拉然各处桌子上找到的 6 只半杯达拉然葡萄酒组合起来。\n\n把葡萄酒与奶酪拼盘带给魔法商业区的制皮店里的拉尼德·金辉。",oEN="Combine the empty cheese platter with Aged Dalaran Limburger from the cheese shop \"One More Glass\" and with 6 Half Full Dalaran Wine Glasses found on tables around Dalaran.\n\nBring the Wine and Cheese platter to Ranid Glowergold at the Leatherworkers in the Magus Commerce Exchange.",p="你有看到应该给我送来奶酪和美酒的外送小弟吗？我超饿的！",pEN="Have you seen a servant with my wine and cheese platter. I am quite peckish!",c="这酒超正点的！我一定要知道它是哪来的。",cEN="Aha, this appears to be a fine vintage!"}
Q[13104]={d="先锋营地已经安全了，盟友。我们夺回了回音谷，并拆除了堵住裂口入口的蛛网墙。现在是时候突袭天灾城，在冰冠冰川内部站稳脚跟了。战线正在推进！$galiado:aliada;{None}\n我已请求黑锋观察者协助我们进攻天灾城。他对天灾军团的深入了解对我们的行动将极其宝贵。\n\n去吧，到裂口外西北方的帐篷处向他报到。\n",dEN="The Vanguard is secure, ally. We have reclaimed the Valley of Echoes and taken down the web walls blocking entry to the Breach. Now is the time to strike at Scourgeholme and establish our presence inside Icecrown. The battlefront moves on!\n\nI have asked the Ebon Watcher for his assistance with our assault upon Scourgeholme. His intimate knowledge of the Scourge will be invaluable in our effort.\n\nGo now and report to him at the tent outside of the Breach, northwest of here.",o="转至回音谷，向突破口外面的黑锋观察者报到。",oEN="Report to the Ebon Watcher in the Valley of Echoes just outside the Breach.",c="我对天灾军团战术的了解无人能及。\n\n<The Ebon Watcher te observa de reojo.>\n\n在圣光之愿礼拜堂之战以前，我和我的骑士们曾效力于巫妖王——他冰冷的掌控操纵着我们的一举一动。黎明的光芒改变了一切……",cEN="My knowledge of Scourge tactics is without equal.\n\n<The Ebon Watcher peers at you.>\n\nBefore the battle for Light's Hope Chapel, my knights and I served under the Lich King - his icy grasp controlling our every action. The light of dawn changed everything..."}
Q[13106]={d="天灾军团设立了一处名叫缝合场的大型实验地，专门用来制造憎恶和血肉巨人。如果我们摧毁了缝合场，巫妖王的军队数量就能锐减。\n\n我已经派黑暗骑士阿尔蕾去了那里。她在科雷萨以西一处俯瞰缝合场的山脊上创建了一座小营地，黑色观察站。据说银色北伐军也派了专员去那里协调事务，但是黑暗骑士知道该怎么做。去找她吧。",dEN="The Scourge has a large facility called the Fleshwerks, dedicated to producing abominations and flesh giants. If we can shut it down, we can deprive the Lich King of a large component of his armies.\n\nI've sent Darkrider Arly to the area. She has a small base, Blackwatch, on a ridge overlooking the Fleshwerks and to the west of Corp'rethar. I'm told the Argent Crusade is sending someone to coordinate their efforts there, but the darkrider will know what to do. Find and assist her.",o="转至黑色观察站，与黑暗骑士阿尔蕾谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch in Icecrown.",c="很好。我们需要一切可得的帮助。这位是欧尔拉金——银色北伐军派来参与破坏行动的人。我们就废话不多说，直接下去干活，让天灾军团中不再有血肉巨人。",cEN="Good. We'll need all the help we can get. Olakin here is the Argent Crusade's contribution to our effort. Let's cut the chatter and get down to the business of denying the Scourge their armies of the flesh."}
Q[13107]={d="大法师伯塔鲁斯正准备去观看他最喜爱的战球比赛，不过他需要一些供旅途中享用的食物。\n\n你要准备4份犀牛热狗，然后从达拉然的草地上摘4片野荠菜，把它们放进他的午餐篮里。\n\n把午餐篮交给他，这样他就可以出发去观看精彩的比赛了。",dEN="Archmage Pentarus likes to watch the occasional game of battle ball and is preparing to go, but needs food for the trip.\n\nYou need to fill his picnic basket with 4 rhino dogs that you cook and then 4 wild mustard that are found in grassy areas of the city.\n\nBring him his picnic basket so he can be ready to go see the big game.",o="在空午餐篮里装入你烹制的4份犀牛热狗，外加你在达拉然草地上找到的4片野芥菜。\n\n将芥菜热狗篮交给达拉然城克拉苏斯平台的大法师伯塔鲁斯。",oEN="Fill the Empty Picnic Basket with 4 Rhino Dogs that you cook with your cooking skill and 4 Wild Mustard that you find in the grassy areas of Dalaran.\n\nBring the Picnic Basket to Archmage Pentarus at Krasus' Landing in Dalaran.",p="我几乎准备好要出发了，只差我和我家人的午餐……呃……我的法师同事来了。",pEN="I am almost ready to go, I just need the food and for my mates... er... my fellow mages to arrive.",c="太棒了！现在我只希望，能看到达拉然破坏者队赢球！",cEN="Perfect! I just hope the Dalaran Destroyers finally win one!"}
Q[13108]={d="无论如何，洛肯一定要死。\n\n如果我不得不亲手撕碎他，那么他很快就会为自己的恶行付出代价。\n\n若是你碰巧赶在我前面遇到他，击败他的荣耀就全归你了。\n\n把他的信物带给我，我会祝福并感谢你的。",dEN="One way or another, Loken shall fall.\n\nIf I have to rip him limb from limb myself, he soon shall pay for his wretched deeds.\n\nShould you meet with him before I do, the honor and glory of his defeat shall be yours.\n\nReturn to me with his lying tongue, and earn my blessing and gratitude.",o="丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王要你进入闪电大厅并击败洛肯，然后将洛肯的信物带回去给他。",oEN="King Jokkum in Dun Niffelem wants you to enter the Halls of Lightning and defeat Loken. You are then to return to King Jokkum with Loken's Tongue.",p="洛肯得到正义的制裁了吗？",pEN="Has justice been brought to Loken?",c="那条卑劣的虫子死了？\n\n你已证明自己是我族人的巨大福星，小小的<race>。\n\n请收下这份礼物，作为你忠诚友谊的回报。",cEN="That vile worm is dead?\n\nYou have turned out to be a great boon to my people, little <race>.\n\nPlease accept this gift in return for your loyal friendship."}
Q[13109]={d="我就直说了，小小的$gpequeño:pequeña;。自从我们与托里姆的关系断绝之后，我的族人就不再是原来的样子了。\n\n作为他们的领袖，我只希望他们的心能得到治愈，希望我们与风暴之王的情谊能够恢复。你击败了菲约恩，已经在那条路上迈出了一步。我要你再带我们迈进一步……\n\n在闪电大厅中，有一个比菲约恩更强大的存在，与我们的生存为敌。沃尔坎不看到我们或他自己消亡，是不会罢休的。",dEN="I shall speak plainly to you, little <race>. My people have not been the same since our ties with Thorim were severed.\n\nAs their leader, I wish nothing more than for their hearts to be mended and our friendship with the Stormlord to be renewed. In your defeat of Fjorn, a step has been taken down that path. I would have you bring us a step further...\n\nIn the Halls of Lightning, one even greater than Fjorn sits in opposition to our existence. Volkhan will not rest until either he, or we, are no more.",o="丹尼芬雷的约库姆国王要你进入闪电大厅，击败沃尔坎。",oEN="King Jokkum at Dun Niffelem wants you to enter the Halls of Lightning and defeat Volkhan.",p="沃尔坎被消灭了吗，小小的<race>？",pEN="Has Volkhan been extinguished, little <race>?",c="沃尔坎再也不会在我族人的梦中作祟了。\n\n继续努力吧，小小的<race>。假以时日，我相信我的族人会渐渐原谅托里姆。",cEN="Volkhan shall haunt the dreams of my people no more.\n\nContinue your efforts, little <race>. In time, I am certain my people will grow to forgive Thorim."}
Q[13110]={d="并非所有的北伐军战士都活着走出了天灾城。很多人被杀害了，变成了扭曲的怪物。这就是天灾军团的行事方法。被诅咒的灵魂永远也无法享受安宁，除非我们想办法让他们安息。\n\n穿过突破口，进入天灾城，杀死那些被天灾军团复活的北伐军战士。然后将圣水撒在他们的骸骨上，以此解放他们的灵魂。",dEN="Not all of our soldiers made it out of Scourgeholme. Many were slain and turned into twisted reflections of their former selves. Such is the way of the Scourge. For those damned souls, there is no eternal peace. We must provide their souls rest.\n\nTravel through the Breach into Scourgeholme and slay the skeletal reanimated crusaders. Sprinkle this holy water on their bones so that their spirits may be freed.",o="冰冠冰川回音谷的古斯塔夫神父要你对复活的北伐军战士的尸体使用圣水，解放10个永不安息的灵魂。",oEN="Father Gustav at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to use Holy Water on the corpses of Reanimated Crusaders to free 10 restless souls.",p="这是件残酷的任务，<name>，但必须有人去做。",pEN="It is a grim task, <name>, but it must be done.",c="对这些正直的十字军而言，他们的路途上充满了不公与邪恶。杀戮是对他们唯一的救赎。你今天做到了，而且拯救了比我预期的更多人。",cEN="The path of the righteous crusader is one beset by inequity and evil. To cut through the middle is the only salvation. You have done that on this day and much more."}
Q[13111]={d="听着，$gtron:titi;。\n\n乍一看，这里像是老一套的故事——巨魔摧毁了本应敬拜的存在，以获取禁忌的力量。\n\n虽然这话不假，但这些达卡莱有些特别之处。如果我了解到的情况属实，那么在古达克内部有一个特别的傀儡——一个前所未有过的造物！\n\n想要冒险吗，$gtron:titi;？进入古达克，从那傀儡身上带一块碎片回来给我研究。",dEN="Lissen, mon.\n\nAt first glance, it be lookin' like da same old story here - trolls tappin' into forbidden powah by destroyin' da very beings dey should be worshippin'.\n\nWhile dis be true, dere be somethin' special about dese Drakkari. If what I learned be true, den inside Gundrak dere be a special golem - one like nuthin' created before!\n\nYa want adventure, mon? Go inside Gundrak and bring me back a piece from dat golem ta study.",o="杜布拉金的记载者拜基妮要你进入古达克，获取一块达卡莱巨像的碎片。",oEN="Chronicler Bah'Kini at Dubra'Jin wants you to enter Gundrak and recover a piece of the Drakkari Colossus.",p="你帮我弄回那魔像的碎片了吗，老兄？",pEN="You get me a piece of dat golem, mon?",c="啊呀我的妈！那就是我要的。\n\n喏，随你拿吧，拿点什么去解决你的麻烦。",cEN="Ahh, yeah mon! Dat be what I'm lookin' for.\n\nHere ya go - take somethin' nice for your troubles."}
Q[13112]={d="摩尔珍品店的奥尔顿·本内特点了一份蘑菇肉片。\n\n到达拉然下水道里去，采集几枚魔法蘑菇，然后把它们跟一些冰冷的肉放在一起烘烤，做好之后立即把它给奥尔顿送去。\n\n如果议会允许我供应侏儒特色菜的话，我一定要让他们看看什么才是真正的美味！",dEN="Orton Bennet in Curiosities & Moore be needin' a mushroom meatloaf.\n\nGet ya some infused mushrooms found in the Dalaran sewers, chilled meat, and cook 'em in the meatloaf pan. When ye be done, bring that meatloaf to Orton.\n\nIf only de council would let me serve me gnome specialty, I would show dem a real treat!",o="将2块冰冷的肉和采自达拉然下水道的4枚魔法蘑菇放在你的煎肉锅中，烹制成一份魔法蘑菇肉片，然后将其带到达拉然的鲁因广场，交给摩尔珍品店中的奥尔顿·本内特。",oEN="Use your Meatloaf Pan to cook 4 Infused Mushrooms and 2 Chilled Meats and bring the finished Mushroom Meatloaf to Orton Bennet in Curiosities & Moore, located in Runeweaver Square in Dalaran.",p="你有什么要给我的吗？我很少能离开我的店铺。",pEN="Do you have something for me? I so rarely get away from my shop.",c="这是埃维罗做的？你能保证里面没藏着侏儒吗？",cEN="Is this food from Awilo? Can you promise me there isn't any gnome in it?"}
Q[13113]={d="你能相信吗，部落竟然禁止了食人……我跟你说，这太不像话了！我想以后有订单要完成的时候，我得专心干活才行。\n\n魔术旅馆的阿瑞尔·蔚视会有很多客人上门，老兄。你得给他备些北方炖肉，还有一壶来自达拉然中部奶酪店的葡萄酒。$gtron:titi;{None}\n把酒和炖肉带给阿瑞尔。\n",dEN="Can you believe da horde has outlawed cannibalism...it just ain't right I tell ya! I guess I should keep me mind on me work when we gots an order to fill.\n\nArille Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge has many a guest a'comin to his place, mon. You gots to be providin' some Northern Stew and a Jug of Wine from the cheese shop in central Dalaran.\n\nBring the wine and stew to Arille.",o="将4份诺森德炖肉和从一壶达拉然的奶酪店中取来的葡萄酒带到达拉然的鲁因广场，交给魔术旅馆中的埃里雷。",oEN="Bring 4 Northern Stews and a Jug of Wine from the cheese shop in Dalaran to Arille Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge found in Runeweaver Square in Dalaran.",p="我的食物在哪里？客人马上就要来了！",pEN="Where is my food? My guests will be here soon!",c="我的客人应该还可以接受。只要别告诉他们是阿维罗做的就行。",cEN="My guests should find this acceptable. Just don't tell them it came from Awilo."}
Q[13114]={d="我们又有一份订单要完成。达拉然下水道的旅店老板需要一份蔬菜炖肉，因为他那些客人没什么可吃的，老兄。$gtron:titi;{None}\n他点名要蔬菜炖肉，因为他不喜欢我上次送去的炖肉里那个侏儒。去晶歌森林采 4 根晶歌胡萝卜，和 4 块冰鲜肉一起煮好，然后带给阿杰。\n\n你可以从符文编织者广场东角的传送门房间前往那片森林。\n",dEN="We be havin' another order to fill. Da innkeeper in da Dalaran sewers needs a vegetable stew as his customers dey don't have so much to eat, mon.\n\nHe asked for a vegetable stew as he didn't appreciate da gnome that was in the last stew I sent. Get 4 Crystalsong Carrots from the Crystalsong Forest and cook them together with 4 Chilled Meat and bring it to Ajay.\n\nYou can be gettin' to da Forest from da portal chamber in da eastern corner of Runeweaver Square.",o="将4根采自晶歌森林的晶歌胡萝卜与4块冰冷的肉放在炖肉锅里进行烹饪。\n\n炖好之后，将萝卜炖肉交给达拉然下水道的旅店老板埃因·格林。",oEN="Cook 4 Crystalsong Carrots from Crystalsong Forest with 4 Chilled Meat in the Cookpot.\n\nThen bring the Vegetable Stew to the Dalaran sewers Innkeeper Ajay Green.",p="你最好给我个准话：这次的炖肉里没有任何和地精有关的东西！",pEN="Make sure there isn't any gnome in the stew this time!",c="炖肉看起来不错。谢谢你的帮忙。",cEN="Stew looks good. Thanks for your help."}
Q[13115]={d="制皮店里的拉尼德·金辉需要葡萄酒和奶酪。我真不明白他为什么不要一只美味的侏儒。\n\n去达拉然中部的奶酪店取奶酪，再收集城中各处桌子上找到的半杯葡萄酒。把酒带来，连同奶酪一起端给拉尼德。\n\n你可以管这酒叫混合葡萄酒，老兄。$gtron:titi;",dEN="Ranid Glowergold in da Leatherworkers shop be havin' a need for wine and cheese. Why he don't want some tasty gnome is beyond me.\n\nCollect da cheese from da cheese shop in central Dalaran and da half full wine glasses found on tables around da city. Bring da wine and serve it with the cheese to Ranid.\n\nYou can call da wine a Wine Medley, mon'.",o="把空奶酪盘与来自奶酪店\"再来一杯\"的陈年达拉然林堡奶酪，以及达拉然各处桌子上找到的 6 只半杯达拉然葡萄酒组合起来。\n\n把葡萄酒与奶酪拼盘带给魔法商业区的制皮店里的拉尼德·金辉。",oEN="Combine the empty cheese platter with Aged Dalaran Limburger from the cheese shop \"One More Glass\" and with 6 Half Full Dalaran Wine Glasses found on tables around Dalaran.\n\nBring the Wine and Cheese platter to Ranid Glowergold at the Leatherworkers in the Magus Commerce Exchange.",p="你有看到应该给我送来奶酪和美酒的外送小弟吗？我超饿的！",pEN="Have you seen a servant with my wine and cheese platter. I am quite peckish!",c="这酒超正点的！我一定要知道它是哪来的。",cEN="This wine is quite amazing! I must know where it's from."}
Q[13116]={d="大法师潘塔鲁斯喜欢看他那疯狂的战球比赛，但他需要一些看比赛时吃的食物。\n\n你得往他的野餐篮里装满 4 份烤犀牛肉肠，再加上 4 份在城中草地角落能找到的野芥末。\n\n给他的篮子装满美味的芥末肉肠吧，老兄。$gtron:titi;",dEN="Da Archmage Pentarus likes to be watchin' his crazy battle ball game, but he be needin' some food for da game.\n\nYou be needin' to fill his picnic basket with 4 cooked rhino dogs and then 4 wild mustard that are found in da grassy corners of de city.\n\nFill up his basket with the mustard dog goodies, mon'.",o="在空午餐篮里装入你烹制的4份犀牛热狗，外加你在达拉然草地上找到的4片野芥菜。\n\n将芥菜热狗篮交给达拉然城克拉苏斯平台的大法师伯塔鲁斯。",oEN="Fill the Empty Picnic Basket with 4 Rhino Dogs that you be cookin' with your skill and 4 Wild Mustard that you find in the grassy areas of Dalaran.\n\nBring the Picnic Basket to Archmage Pentarus at Krasus' Landing in Dalaran.",p="我几乎准备好要出发了，只差我和我家人的午餐……呃……我的法师同事来了。",pEN="Make sure the wild mustard dogs are 100% rhino and have no Gnome in them!",c="太棒了！现在我只希望，能看到达拉然破坏者队赢球！",cEN="Perfect! I just hope the Dalaran Destroyers finally win one!"}
Q[13117]={d="下面的缝合场里聚集了大群巫妖王的爪牙，这帮不知疲倦的怪物正在夜以继日地制造憎恶和血肉巨人。\n\n不仅如此，骷髅构造体的数量也越来越多，大大加快了制造的速度。\n\n如果我们不能查明它们的来历以及高效作业的缘由，那么我们很快就会落败，连采取行动的机会都没有。我要你去东南方调查这些骷髅的来历。",dEN="The Lich King's tireless minions labor away night and day to assemble scores of abominations and flesh giants down there in the Fleshwerks.\n\nYet, that is not enough. More and more skeletal constructors keep appearing to increase the pace of work.\n\nIf we do not discover where they're coming from and how they're able to work so quickly, we'll be overrun before we can act in force. Search to the southeast and see if you can find the source of these skeletons.",o="调查缝合场东部的召唤祭坛，然后返回黑色观察站，向黑暗骑士阿尔蕾汇报情况。",oEN="Investigate a Summoning Altar in the eastern part of the Fleshwerks, then report back to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch.",p="你找到那些骷髅的来源了吗？",pEN="Have you found the source of the skeletons?",c="<你将你在召唤祭坛的发现告诉了黑暗骑士。>\n\n我老早就开始怀疑了。我们不能让这情况继续下去。我们的首要工作是摧毁那些召唤祭坛，然后才是处理天灾军团在这里引起的混乱。",cEN="<You tell the darkrider about your discoveries at the summoning altar.>\n\nI suspected such. We can't let this continue. Our first priority is to destroy those summoning altars and then deal with the mess the Scourge has already created here."}
Q[13118]={d="天灾军团派大军进攻银色北伐军，但已被击退。他们现在干的事叫做\"焦土政策\"。他们关押在天灾城的所有囚犯都会被处决，然后被复活成巫妖王的仆从。\n\n银色北伐军无疑会请求你让他们的士兵得到体面的告别。我不会提这种要求。要取得胜利，我们必须毫不留情地杀戮天灾军团。\n\n前往裂口西北方的天灾城，摧毁一切挡在你面前的东西。",dEN="The Scourge have sent their armies at the Argent Crusade and have been repelled. What they do now is called a 'slash and burn.' All prisoners that they hold at Scourgeholme will be executed and raised as servants of the Lich King.\n\nUndoubtedly the Argent Crusade will request that you give their soldiers a proper farewell. I'll ask no such thing of you. To succeed we must kill Scourge indiscriminately.\n\nVenture to Scourgeholme, northwest through the Breach, and lay waste to all that stand in your way.",o="冰冠冰川回音谷的黑锋观察者要你去杀死3名遗忘深渊高阶祭司、3只遗忘深渊虫王和8名复活的北伐军战士。",oEN="The Ebon Watcher at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to kill 3 Forgotten Depths High Priests, 3 Forgotten Depths Underkings, and 8 Reanimated Crusaders.",p="别浪费时间，<name>。",pEN="Do not waste time, <name>.",c="你做得很好，<name>。压制他们的数量能为银色北伐军争取到建立基地所需的时间。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. Keeping their numbers down will give the Argent Crusade the time that they need to set a foundation."}
Q[13119]={d="这么说，他们在祭坛中召唤劳工和战士？\n\n我们必须先解决这件事。召唤大师手中应该有一根法杖，用来激活传送门。如果你能杀死他并夺取那根法杖，就可以利用它使传送门过载，最终摧毁祭坛。\n\n把四座召唤祭坛都搞定，然后回来向我复命。",dEN="So they're summoning in their workers and warriors at those altars?\n\nThey'll need to be the first thing to go. The master summoner should have a staff which allows him to activate the portal. If you kill the master summoner and take the staff, you can use it to overload the summoning portal and destroy its altar.\n\nDo this at all four of the altars and return to me once they've been destroyed.",o="杀死召唤大师扎洛德，用他的法杖摧毁第一座、第二座、第三座和第四座召唤祭坛。完成任务后返回黑色观察站，向黑暗骑士阿尔蕾复命。",oEN="Kill Master Summoner Zarod and use his Summoning Stave to destroy the First, Second, Third, and Fourth Summoning Altars. When you've completed this task, report to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch.",p="召唤祭坛都被摧毁了吗？",pEN="Are the summoning altars in ruins?",c="<黑暗骑士阿尔蕾点点头，表示认同。>\n\n很好。现在，我们可以专注于破坏缝合场的其它部分。",cEN="<Darkrider Arly nods in approval.>\n\nGood. Now, we can focus our efforts on shutting down the rest of the Fleshwerks."}
Q[13120]={d="缝合场是一处庞大的工地，我们很难对所有情况一览无馀，不过好在我已经想到了一个办法。\n\n<阿尔蕾从斗篷里取出一枚宝珠。>\n\n这是死亡凝视宝珠。有了它，我们就可以观察天灾军团的动向，寻找最佳的进攻时机。\n\n将这些宝珠放置在缝合场三处关键位置的支架上——西南方的憎恶装配台和血肉巨人装配台，以及西方那口巨大的绿色瘟疫之锅附近。",dEN="The Fleshwerks is a vast operation, and it will be difficult to keep an eye on all that transpires there. Fortunately, I have a plan.\n\n<Arly produces an orb from the folds of her cloak and shows it to you.>\n\nThis is a death's gaze orb. With it, we can observe the Scourge's actions and decide how best to strike.\n\nPlace these orbs on the stands at three crucial areas -- the abomination lab and the flesh giant lab to the southwest, along with the area surrounding the green cauldron far to the west.",o="使用死亡凝视宝珠，将宝珠放置在憎恶装配台宝珠支架、血肉巨人装配台宝珠支架和瘟疫之锅区域宝珠支架上，然后返回黑色观察站，向黑暗骑士阿尔蕾复命。",oEN="Use the Death's Gaze Orb to place orbs on the Abomination Lab Orb Stand, the Flesh Giant Lab Orb Stand, and the Cauldron Area Orb Stand, then return to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch.",p="你将宝珠都安置好了吗？",pEN="Have you placed those orbs?",c="<黑暗骑士阿尔蕾闭上双眼，似乎正凝神于某件遥远的事物上。>\n\n通过死亡之眼，我看到了我们的敌人。有了这些情报，我们将彻底地毁灭他们。",cEN="<Darkrider Arly closes her eyes and seems to focus on something far away.>\n\nWith the eyes of death itself, I watch our enemy. With this knowledge, we will utterly destroy them."}
Q[13121]={d="接下来，我们必须借助巫妖王的工具才能制定出对付他的下一步计划。\n\n越过西南方的山岭，就能抵达库尔加拉要塞。那里居住着尤顿海姆的神谕者，他们执行着主人的命令并通过巫妖王之眼监视他人。\n\n你必须设法靠近巫妖王之眼。虽然它不能穿透冰冠堡垒，但是我相信你能获取到有用的信息，这样我们就能制订出最佳的策略了。",dEN="We must use the Lich King's tools against him if we are to decide our next step.\n\nOver the mountain to the southwest lies Kul'galar Keep. Within it reside the oracles of Jotunheim who receive orders from their master and scry upon others through the Eye of the Lich King.\n\nIt is the eye that you must fight your way to. While it cannot be used to pierce the veil within Icecrown Citadel, you should be able to use it to discern something of value so that we will know how best to proceed.",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你使用巫妖王之眼获取情报。",oEN="The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village has tasked you with using the Eye of the Lich King to gain information.",p="你竟然空手而归！我帮助了你和黑锋骑士团，这就是你回报的方式吗？\n\n离开我的视线，没弄到我要的情报就别回来！",pEN="You return with no information at all! Is this how you repay my help to you and the Knights of the Ebon Blade?\n\nBegone and do not return until you have the knowledge which I seek!",c="非常好！原来远古英雄伊斯卡德尔的谣言是真的。而瓦尔德玛达本人正要前去挑战他！\n\n如果我们想要抢先一步找到他的话，我们最好快一点！",cEN="Perfect! It's true that Iskalder is rumored to have been the finest vrykul warrior ever to live. And Vardmadra herself is going to come her to judge him!\n\nWe must move quickly if we are to get to this ancient hero before they do!"}
Q[13122]={d="天灾军团的成员在诞生或是被创造出来时，都会得到一块天灾石。它可以增强持有者的力量，更重要的是，军团的头目可以用它观测到所有作战单位的位置和行动。\n\n只要有足够多的天灾石，我们就能掌握天灾军团在冰冠冰川的一举一动。\n\n当你在天灾城中杀敌时，顺便收集一些天灾石吧。装满你的背包，然后再回来找我。",dEN="A Scourgestone is an item given to all Scourge upon birth or creation. It provides certain benefits to the holder, but more importantly it allows Scourge leaders visibility into the location and movement of all of their units.\n\nWith enough Scourgestones, I might be able to track the movement of other Scourge units across Icecrown.\n\nAs you slaughter Scourge in Scourgeholme, gather all of the Scourgestones that you find. Return to me when your bags are full.",o="将15块天灾石交给冰冠冰川回音谷的黑锋观察者。",oEN="The Ebon Watcher at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to bring him 15 Scourgestones.",p="天灾石能协助我们找到敌人。",pEN="Scourgestones will help us find our enemy.",c="现在，让我看看，是不是能利用这些石头看到更多情报。",cEN="Now let me see if there's something that I can do with these stones to give us a little bit of insight."}
Q[13124]={d="战斗仍在继续，。不知怎的，我们一直没被发现，还在继续设法挫败玛里苟斯的阴谋。不过，好消息到此为止，坏消息从这里开始。\n\n我们竭尽全力的行动收效甚微，甚至毫无效果。玛里苟斯和他的爪牙一天比一天强大。而现在，我们最新的一支突击队被俘，正被关押在魔枢之中。我们必须尝试营救！贝尔加里斯特拉斯和他的同伴对我们的事业无比宝贵。我们能指望你吗，？",dEN="The battle goes on, <name>. Somehow we have managed to avoid detection and continue our attempts to frustrate Malygos' schemes. This, though, is where the good news ends and the bad begins.\n\nOur best efforts have had little or no effect. Malygos and his underlings grow stronger in power with each passing day. And now, our latest assault team has been captured and is being held in the Oculus.\n\nWe must attempt a rescue! Belgaristrasz and his companions are invaluable to our cause. Can we count on you, <name>?",o="莱洛拉斯希望你进入魔环，营救贝加里斯塔兹与他的同伴。",oEN="Raelorasz wants you to enter the Oculus and rescue Belgaristrasz and his companions.",c="听好了，<race>。\n\n你在这里的工作才刚刚开始！",cEN="Listen well, <race>.\n\nYour work here has just begun!"}
Q[13125]={d="想要将这片土地从天灾军团手中拯救出来，就必须击败天灾城中的几位领主。\n\n撕裂者萨兰纳克斯驻守在天灾城第一层的神殿中，高阶祭司亚萨尔蒙就在第二层的灵魂塔里布道，而虫王塔洛诺克斯则负责管辖北边的邪魔之坑。\n\n他们非常强大，你必须小心应付。如果你需要帮助，就吹响这只号角。阿彻鲁斯的死亡骑士将闻声而来。",dEN="You must defeat the lords of Scourgeholme if this place is to be free of the Scourge's grasp.\n\nSalranax the Flesh Render lords over the temple on the first tier of Scourgeholme. Nearby Salranax you'll find High Priest Yath'amon preaching at the spirit tower on the second tier. Underking Talonox holds court at the Pit of Fiends, up the high road.\n\nThese are formidable opponents and must be approached with caution. Use this war horn should you require aid. The death knights of Acherus will come.",o="冰冠冰川回音谷的黑锋观察者要你去杀死撕裂者萨兰纳克斯、虫王塔洛诺克斯和高阶祭司亚萨尔蒙。",oEN="The Ebon Watcher at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to kill Salranax the Flesh Render, Underking Talonox and High Priest Yath'amon.",p="解决他们，<name>！",pEN="Finish them, <name>!",c="一场苦战换来的胜利，<name>！那几个领主会被替换掉，但至少今天，天灾城上空归于平静。",cEN="A hard fought victory, <name>! The lieutenants will be replaced, but at least for today the air about Scourgeholme stands still."}
Q[13126]={d="请接受我们的谢意，。\n\n你和你朋友们在我们失败的地方取得了成功——你们击败了德拉库斯。不过从这里开始，就需要我们齐心协力才能继续前进了。\n\n在我们上方，瓦罗斯躲在一道无法穿透的护盾之后。要触及他，你必须击败为那道护盾供能的离心构造体。这正是我和我的朋友们能派上用场的地方……我们各自都能为你提供来自我们各自军团的幼龙。只有借助这些幼龙的帮助，你才能让瓦罗斯现出身形。",dEN="Please accept our gratitude, <race>.\n\nYou and your friends have succeeded where we had failed - you have bested Drakos. From here, however, it will take our combined efforts to proceed.\n\nAbove us, Varos hides behind an impenetrable shield. To reach him, you must defeat the Centrifuge Constructs that power his shield. That is where my friends and I come in....\n\nWe each can provide you with drakes from our respective flights. Only with the help of these drakes will you be able to expose Varos.",o="贝加里斯塔兹要求你摧毁10台离心构造体，以此关闭瓦尔洛斯的护盾。然后击败瓦尔洛斯·云击。",oEN="Belgaristrasz wants you to destroy 10 Centrifuge Constructs to bring down Varos' shield. You then must defeat Varos Cloudstrider.",p="嗯，结束了！",pEN="So, it is done!",c="正如我所希望的那样，<race>。我们配合得很好。\n\n愿我们持续的合作足以克服前方尚未到来的挑战！",cEN="It is as I had hoped, <race>. We work well together.\n\nMay our continued cooperation be enough to overcome the challenges that yet await!"}
Q[13127]={d="在我们和这里的最终目标之间，只剩下一个障碍了。他叫乌罗姆。\n\n就在我们上方，守卫着第三环，他在等着我们。小心他强大的法术，朋友。他是个可怕的对手，肯定会考验你的实力。$gamigo:amiga;{None}\n把他打下来。让他为背叛投敌付出代价！\n",dEN="Only one obstacle stands between us and our ultimate goal here, <class>. His name is Urom.\n\nAbove us, guarding the third ring, he awaits us. Beware his powerful conjurings, friend. He is a frightful opponent, certain to challenge your prowess.\n\nBring him down. Make him pay for his treacherous allegiance to the enemy!",o="贝加里斯塔兹要求你击败魔环的法师领主伊洛姆。",oEN="Belgaristrasz wants you to defeat Mage-Lord Urom in the Oculus.",p="你解决法师领主伊洛姆了吗？",pEN="Has Mage-Lord Urom been dealt with?",c="胜利近在咫尺，朋友。\n\n集中心神，因为真正的考验现在才开始。",cEN="Victory is in reach, friend.\n\nFocus, for now comes the true test."}
Q[13128]={d="面对埃雷苟斯的时刻到了，朋友。\n\n他狡诈而强大。作为玛里苟斯最信任的爪牙之一，他从自己受命守护的能量中汲取力量——甚至从伟大的守护巨龙本人的井中饮水。\n\n这绝不会轻松……不过，击败法师领主让我们得以解锁幼龙的全部力量。它们的技能将听你调遣。善加利用，埃雷苟斯必将倒下。如果你成功了，就回去向雷洛拉兹报告我们的胜利。",dEN="The time has come to face Eregos, friend.\n\nHe is cunning and strong. One of Malygos' most trusted minions, he draws strength from the energies he is charged with defending - sipping from the well of the great aspect himself.\n\nThis shall not be easy....\n\nHowever, defeating the Mage-Lord has allowed us to unlock the full power of our drakes. Their skills shall be at your command. Use them wisely and Eregos shall surely fall.\n\nShould you succeed, return to Raelorasz and inform him of our victory.",o="贝加里斯塔兹要求你击败魔环的埃雷苟斯，然后回到考达拉的永生之盾，向莱洛拉斯复命。",oEN="Belgaristrasz wants you to kill Eregos in the Oculus and then report to Raelorasz at the Transitus Shield in Coldarra.",p="你带来了关于贝加瑞斯塔兹的消息吗？",pEN="Do you bring news of Belgaristrasz?",c="<Raelorasz escucha atentamente tu informe.>\n\n<name>，这真是再好不过的消息。\n\n自这场冲突爆发以来，我们还从未对魔法领主造成过如此沉重的打击。\n\n朋友，请接受我们联合龙族的谢意。",cEN="<Raelorasz listens intently to your report.>\n\n<name>, this is most welcome news.\n\nNot since the onset of this conflict have we dealt a blow of this magnitude to the Lord of Magic.\n\nPlease, friend, accept the gratitude of our unified dragonflights."}
Q[13129]={d="他们太懒了，活该……等等！我知道怎么教训他们了！<Kurzel se arranca una larga tira de tela de su blusa y te la da.>来，，拿着这个。把它浸到那边那个讨厌的巫妖的残骸里，然后带回营地交给麦克。\n\n等这帮小子在愧疚里煎熬一阵子，我再现身，放他们一马。\n\n他们会知道不该让一位女士独自乱跑的！",dEN="Too lazy for their own good.... Wait! I know how to teach 'em!\n\n<Kurzel rips a long strip of material from her blouse and hands it to you.>\n\nHere, <race>, take this. Dip it in the remains of that annoying lich over there and return it to Mack back at the camp.\n\nOnce the boys have stewed in their guilt for a while I'll show up and let them off the hook.\n\nThey'll learn not to let a lady wander off alone!",o="库塞尔希望你对达克萨隆要塞的召唤者诺沃斯的尸体使用库尔基的布片。然后把沾满腐液的布片交给灰熊丘陵岩石之泉的马克。",oEN="Kurzel wants you to use Kurzel's Blouse Scrap at the corpse of Novos the Summoner, then take the Ichor-Stained Cloth to Mack.",p="你那儿拿着什么，伙计？",pEN="Whutcha got there, pal?",c="\n\n哎呀，不……她为什么非得跑出去，让人把自己害死？\n\n你知道吗，我该为她写首小曲。那应该能让我开心点！",cEN="<Mack looks at you and laughs uncontrollably.>\n\nAww noo... Why'd she hafta run off an' git 'ershelf killed?\n\nYa know, I should write a lil shong about 'er. That should cheer me up!"}
Q[13130]={d="你现在看天灾城，也许只看到一潭腐烂发臭的污水坑，但总有一天它会成为荣耀与荣誉之地。大领主弗丁已将它命名为\"正义要塞\"。\n\n唉，就连冰冠堡垒那样坚不可摧的要塞，也是从一块石头开始的。于是我们开始寻找那块开启革命之石。\n\n前往此地向南的晶歌，寻找东边的荒芜灌木丛。到了那里，从灌木丛地面上采集水晶之心木，再从沙达拉废墟采集精灵石料。",dEN="You may look at Scourgeholme now and see a rancid pit of decay, but one day it will be a place of glory and honor. Highlord Fordring has deemed it \"Justice Keep.\"\n\nAlas, even an impregnable fortress like Icecrown Citadel began with but a single stone. So begins our search for the stone to start a revolution.\n\nTravel to Crystalsong, south of here, and seek out the Unbound Thicket in the east. Once there gather crystalline heartwood from the thicket floor and elven masonry from the Ruins of Shandaral.",o="冰冠冰川回音谷的北伐军建筑师西拉斯要你去收集10根水晶心木和10块古代精灵石砖。",oEN="Crusade Architect Silas at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to retrieve 10 Trunks of Crystalline Heartwood and 10 pieces of Ancient Elven Masonry.",p="你迷路了吗？",pEN="Are you lost?",c="心木天生能抵御疾病、腐朽和瘟疫。这些心木的确是有极强的抵抗力才能长得这么好！这些石砖，受到灌木林影响，也有同样的效果。\n\n我们很快就能破土动工了。",cEN="Heartwood by nature is resistant to disease, rot and plague. This heartwood, however, goes so far as to repel such things! The masonry, affected by the fallout of the Unbound Thicket, will work in much the same way.\n\nSoon we will break ground."}
Q[13131]={d="你瞧瞧！我的箱子还从没这么空过。本来早该装满十倍了！\n\n我那些伙计一看到那么多财宝就扑了上去，现在瞧瞧他们！只剩一堆嘎啦作响的骨头了！\n\n就像我娘以前常跟我说的——比没有财宝更糟的，只有被诅咒的财宝。\n\n话说回来，里面深处还有不少好东西，我打赌不是被诅咒的那种。这些醉鬼根本用不着——对他们来说那就是垃圾。$Gcompañero:compañera;替我取回来，我会重重赏你，伙计。|n",dEN="Just look at it! Me trunk never been so empty. Shoulda been filled ten times over by now!\n\nMe mates jumped at the sight o' all that booty, and now look at 'em! Rattlin' bones, they be!\n\nIt be like me mammy use 'ta tell me - only thing worse than no treasure be cursed treasure.\n\nSay, thar be plenty o' loot farther in, an' not the cursed kind I'll wager. These sots not be needin' it - it just be junk ta them.\n\nFetch it fer me an' I'll be rewardin' ya handsomely, matey.",o="乌特加德之巅的布雷格要你帮他收集5块失去光泽的银锭、3枚闪亮的饰物、2只黄金酒杯和1座碧玉雕像。",oEN="Brigg in Utgarde Pinnacle wants you to find 5 Untarnished Silver Bars, 3 Shiny Baubles, 2 Golden Goblets, and a Jade Statue.",p="你在里面收获如何，<matey/ma>？",pEN="How'd yeh fare in thar, <matey/ma>?",c="太棒了！你真把它办成了，伙计。\n\n现在我可以放心地去见船长了，不用再担心性命，这都多亏了你和你的伙伴们。\n\n这儿有份小小的战利品，算是给你的回报。",cEN="Brilliant! Ye've gone and done it, matey.\n\nNow I can show me face to the Cap'n without fearin' fer me life, thanks be ta you and yer mates.\n\nHere's a little booty fer you in return."}
Q[13132]={d="哎！这可怪不了他们，。换谁不会那样做？\n\n他们一头扑向那堆金子——还以为挖到了主矿脉呢。是啊……可现在看看他们。连一枚金币都捡不起来的无脑仆从。\n\n只有运气让我免于同样的命运。混乱中我被撞倒在地——本来就已经有点醉了。抬头一看，正好看见他们中第一个开始转变……做个好，找出这里管事的那家伙，教教他们别诅咒我的伙伴。",dEN="Och! They cannae be blamed, <lad/lass>. Who'da done different?\n\nThey hurled themselves at them piles o' gold - thought they'd hit the mother lode, they did. Aye... But look at 'em now. Mindless servants unable to pick up a single doubloon.\n\nOnly luck spared me from the same fate. In the scurry I got knocked down - was a wee bit tipsy to begin with. Looked up ta see the first of 'em turn...\n\nBe a good <lad/lass> and find the one in charge here and teach 'em not ta be cursin' me mates.",o="乌特加德之巅的布雷格要你去杀死伊米隆国王。",oEN="Brigg in Utgarde Pinnacle wants you to kill King Ymiron.",p="你找到这里管事的那家伙了吗，<race>？你让他们受够罪了吗？",pEN="Ya find the one in charge here, <race>? Did ya make 'em suffer?",c="太好了！也许现在我的伙伴们能安息了。\n\n拿着吧，小伙子。别让人说老布里格对善待他的人不够大方。\n\n跟你做生意很愉快。",cEN="Splendid! Mebbe now me mateys be able ta rest in peace.\n\nHere ya go, lad.Don't let it be said that ol' Brigg weren't generous ta those who showed 'im a kindness.\n\nGood doin' business wit yeh."}
Q[13133]={d="$n，我要你立即转至西南方的先祖大厅！\n\n你可以在那里找到休眠的尤尔丁人。将他们逐个叫醒，直到你找到伊斯卡德尔为止。然后你要对他使用这枚护符，将他带回来见我。\n\n快去吧，时间非常紧迫！",dEN="Quickly, <name>, head southwest to the Halls of the Ancestors!\n\nWithin you will find slumbering mjordin. Wake them until you find Iskalder. When you do, use this amulet upon him and bring him back to me.\n\nNow go. There is no time to waste!",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你将伊斯卡德尔带回来。",oEN="The Bone Witch at Njorndar Village wants you to return with Iskalder.",p="远古英雄在哪里？\n\n我可没闲工夫陪你扯淡。快去先祖大厅把他带回来，否则就太迟了！",pEN="Where is the ancient hero?\n\nWe do not have time to chat. Go to the Halls of the Ancestors and find him before it is too late!",c="他是个很好的样品，而且将为我们所用。\n\n现在，我们得好好运用他，以诱捕瓦尔德玛达！",cEN="He's a fine specimen and will serve us well.\n\nNow, we have to make sure to use him properly to trap Vardmadra!"}
Q[13134]={d="要制造血肉怪物，天灾军团就必须用到大量的血液以及防腐剂，这样才能保存肢体，并确保其机能正常。如果破坏这些材料，它们的血肉怪兽就会四分五裂，那样我们就能轻松地摧毁它们了。\n\n在天灾军团装配血肉巨人和憎恶的台子周围，你可以找到装有防腐剂的大桶以及盛满鲜血的球体。摧毁这些材料，如果有谁敢阻拦你，就将它们一并除掉！",dEN="The Scourge cannot create their flesh monsters without blood and embalming fluid to preserve the parts and keep them functioning. If we can deny them these materials, their army will fall apart and we can easily destroy their creations.\n\nThroughout the labs where the flesh giants and abominations are cobbled together, you will find vats of embalming fluid and large orbs filled with blood. Destroy these, and bring death to any who would stop you!",o="黑色观察站的黑暗骑士阿尔蕾要你去摧毁5桶防腐液和5枚鲜血宝珠。",oEN="Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch wants you to destroy 5 vats of Embalming Fluid and 5 Blood Orbs.",p="你完成我要求的工作了吗？",pEN="Have you done as I asked?",c="<Una risa oscura y hueca te recibe al informarle al jinete oscuro.>\n\n你浑身散发着胜利的气息，<name>，这确实是个好消息。",cEN="<A dark, hollow laugh greets you as you report to the darkrider.>\n\nYou reek of victory, <name>, and that is good news, indeed."}
Q[13135]={d="此地东南方，就在晶歌森林的东部边缘，有一处名叫自由之林的地方，里面生活着各种生物。受自由之林的影响，这些生物有一个共同点，就是它们对魔法能量的亲和力。它们体内拥有纯净的晶化能量，这种能量一旦爆发，其威力足以杀死我们所有人！\n\n转至自由之林猎杀这些生物，从它们身上获取结晶能量。我们需要燃料，而它们需要死亡，我们管这个叫“双赢”。",dEN="Southeast of here, at the eastern reaches of Crystalsong Forest, is an area known as the Unbound Thicket. Within that thicket creeps all manner of life. One thing all of the affected creatures of the thicket share in common is their affinity for magical energy. Each of them holds pure, crystallized energy. Enough to kill us all should it ever destabilize!\n\nTravel to the Unbound Thicket and kill its denizens for crystallized energy. We need fuel and they need to die. We call that a \"win-win.\"",o="冰冠冰川回音谷的北伐军技师斯比帕提克要你去收集8块结晶能量。",oEN="Crusade Engineer Spitzpatrick at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown wants you to retrieve 8 pieces of Crystallized Energy.",p="你得到结晶能量了吗？",pEN="Did you get the crystallized energy?",c="啊，太棒了。是轰炸机该出动的时刻了，我们的时间不多。",cEN="Ah, this is perfect. The bomber should be up and running in no time."}
Q[13136]={d="你从食尸鬼的尸体上拔出了一块不规则的黑色金属碎片。它的边缘凹凸不平，说明锻造者的技术很差，又或者这是某个机械大件上的碎片。\n\n你突然想起，缝合场的食尸鬼尸体上都能找到相似的碎片。你很好奇，为什么它们的制造者要不厌其烦地加入金属碎片呢？如果你能多收集一些这种碎片的话，或许北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯知道些什么。",dEN="You pulled this jagged, dark brittle shard from the body of a ghoul. The metal blade lacks a smooth edge, suggesting it was forged by an unskilled hand, or was broken from a larger piece.\n\nYou recall seeing similar shards embedded in the bodies of all the ghouls you've encountered at the Fleshwerks, leading you to wonder why their creators bothered to include the metal at all. Perhaps Crusader Olakin Sainrith would have some insight if you brought him the shards from several ghouls.",o="将10块粗糙的碎片交给黑色观察站的北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯。",oEN="Bring 10 Jagged Shards to Crusader Olakin Sainrith at Blackwatch.",p="那肮脏的玩意是什么？",pEN="What is that vile thing?",c="<欧尔拉金谨慎地检视这些金属裂片。>\n\n你在这下面的每个食尸鬼身上，都有找到这些玩意吗？我倒是不曾在任何与天灾军团的战斗中，见到类似的东西。",cEN="<Olakin handles the shards of metal gingerly.>\n\nYou saw these on all of the ghouls down there? I've never seen anything like this in all my battles against the Scourge."}
Q[13137]={d="在西南方俯瞰约顿海姆的最高山峰上，矗立着战痕尖塔。那是维库人的崇敬之地，就他们偏好进行荣誉战斗的场所而言，仅次于瓦哈拉斯。\n\n我们要在那上面进行一场不太荣誉的战斗。\n\n召集你的伙伴，飞往尖塔。当你准备好时，点燃信号火，我就会以伊斯卡尔德的身躯现身。$glisto:lista;{None}\n我们会交手，你会获胜，而瓦德玛德拉一定会来观战！\n",dEN="Atop the tallest peak to the southwest overlooking Jotunheim is Battlescar Spire. It is a place of reverence for the vrykul, second only to Valhalas in terms of where they prefer to do honorable combat.\n\nWe shall visit not-so-honorable combat upon it.\n\nGather your companions and fly to the spire. When you are ready, light the signal fire and I will appear within the body of Iskalder.\n\nWe will fight, you will win, and Vardmadra is sure to come to witness the battle!",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你在战痕尖塔击败伊斯卡德尔。",oEN="The Bone Witch in Njorndar Village wants you to defeat Iskalder upon Battlescar Spire.",p="你还没击败那远古英雄！",pEN="You have yet to defeat the ancient hero!",c="瓦尔德玛达当前在某个安全的地方。我暂时放她一马，直到我们可以上演最后复仇的戏码为止！",cEN="I've put Vardmadra aside for the moment. She's someplace safe until we can enact our final revenge!"}
Q[13138]={d="<欧尔拉金将碎片放在掌心翻转，听着它与铠甲护手的碰撞声。>\n\n如果力道足够的话，这些碎片足以刺穿护甲。我们必须搞清楚它们的成分以及巫妖王制作它们的意图。\n\n此地以东是玛雷卡里斯，就在冰冠堡垒旁边。根据我们获得的一点点情报，那里到处都是熔炼和锻造设备。将这些碎片带去那里，在玛雷卡里斯底层的熔炉附近熔化并进行重铸，这样我们就能对其成分进行分析了。",dEN="<Olakin turns one of the shards over in an armored fist.>\n\nThese could pierce armor with enough force. We have to find out what they're made of and what the Lich King intends to do with them.\n\nTo the east, nestled next to Icecrown Citadel itself, lies Malykriss. From the few reports we have, it's full of smelting and smithing equipment. Bring these shards there, and smelt them in one of the open furnaces on the bottom level of Malykriss. Once the metal has been reformed, we can identify it.",o="在玛雷卡里斯底层的熔炉附近使用一包粗糙的碎片。将熔炼过的金属锭交给黑色观察站的北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯。",oEN="Use the Bag of Jagged Shards near one of the bottom level Malykriss furnaces. Return to Crusader Olakin Sainrith at Blackwatch with the Smelted Metal Bar.",p="你熔炼那些碎片了吗？",pEN="Have you smelted those fragments yet?",c="毋庸置疑，这是源生萨隆邪铁。我们曾经看过，它被用来制造巫妖王军队的武器，但这是第一次被用在其它人的武器中。开矿的规模应该很大。",cEN="There is no doubt, this is raw saronite. We've seen weapons made from it in the hands of the Lich King's chosen before, but this is the first time it's been used to arm anything else. The scale of that mining operation must be huge."}
Q[13139]={d="塞拉斯和斯皮茨帕特里克已经批准了开始建造正义要塞所需的材料和燃料。多亏了你和黑锋骑士团，天灾城内的天灾军团已被大幅消灭，他们的领主也被击败。\n\n我已选好了我们破土动工的地点，但首先你必须把我的报告交给大领主提里奥·弗丁。只要他一声令下，我们就开始向冰冠进军。|n",dEN="Silas and Spitzpatrick have signed off on the materials and fuel needed to begin construction of Justice Keep. Thanks to you and the Ebon Blade the Scourge presence within Scourgeholme has been decimated and their lieutenants have been defeated.\n\nI have chosen the site at which we will break ground, but first you must deliver my report to Highlord Tirion Fordring. We will begin our march into Icecrown on his command.",o="把古斯塔夫神父的报告交给冰冠冰川银色先锋营地的大领主提里奥·弗丁。|n",oEN="Deliver Father Gustav's Report to Highlord Tirion Fordring at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",p="稍息，<name>。你有什么要报告的？",pEN="Stand easy, <name>. What have you to report?",c="你的协助对稳固前线至关重要。这场战争第一场真正的胜利近在眼前——正因如此，我们的下一步才最为关键。\n\n放心，<name>，天灾军团绝不会不战而降。最艰难挑战正等着你。",cEN="Your assistance has been integral in securing the front. The first true victory of this war is close at hand - which is why our next step is the most crucial.\n\nRest assured, <name>, the Scourge will not give up without a fight. Your most difficult challenge awaits."}
Q[13140]={d="你发现的那些碎片只可能来自玛雷卡里斯。那里是巫妖王的冶金基地，就在恐惧之门科雷萨以东。\n\n但是无论是缝合到憎恶和血肉巨人，还是召唤骷髅仆从，都用不到萨隆邪铁啊。杀入玛雷卡里斯底层，找到那些骷髅符文锻造师，夺取它们正在加工的金属板。我们必须查明缝合场为什么需要用到这种金属。",dEN="Those shards you recovered can only have come from one place, Malykriss. It's the seat of the Lich King's metalworking operations, to the east of Corp'rethar.\n\nWhat's puzzling is that metal isn't needed to stitch together abominations or flesh giants, or to summon skeletal servants. Find the skeletal runesmiths working on the bottom level of Malykriss and capture the plates they're working on. We need to find out why this metal is finding its way to the Fleshwerks.",o="将5块符文萨隆邪铁板交给黑色观察站的北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯。",oEN="Bring 5 Runed Saronite Plates to Crusader Olakin Sainrith at Blackwatch.",p="你有拿到那些符文萨隆邪铁板吗？",pEN="Were you able to capture those rune plates?",c="这些金属板与那些碎片几乎完全吻合。他们一定是用碎片切下的部分来\"强化\"这里生产的食尸鬼。看来天灾军团已经走投无路到什么都拿来当武器了。这更说明我们该加快摧毁这个可恶的地方！",cEN="These plates match the shards almost exactly. They must be using cuttings from them to \"enhance\" the ghouls produced here. The Scourge is desperate enough to make a weapon of anything, it seems. All the more reason to hasten our destruction of this abominable place!"}
Q[13141]={d="<大领主弗丁手持银色北伐军的旗帜。>\n\n这面旗帜与众不同，$n。它拥有神圣的力量，可以净化大片被污染的土地。\n\n带上它往西北方走，穿过突破口，就能抵达此行的目的地——北伐军之峰。那里有一个北伐军的祭坛，将这面旗帜插在祭坛上，并抵御天灾军团的攻击，直到北伐军之峰得到净化。完成任务后就向古斯塔夫神父复命吧。\n\n出发，$n，不要心怀恐惧。",dEN="<Highlord Fordring holds a banner of the Argent Crusade.>\n\nThis banner is like no other, <name>. It carries with it a powerful blessing, able to sanctify large tracts of blighted land.\n\nYou must take it northwest, through the Breach, to an area the Scourge have mockingly named Crusaders' Pinnacle. Plant the banner atop the skulls of our fallen brethren at Crusaders' Pinnacle and defend it against attack. Once the land is sanctified, return to Father Gustav.\n\nGo now, <name>. Hold no fear in your heart.",o="转至北伐军之峰，在北伐军祭坛上使用北伐军的神圣军旗。保护旗帜，直到北伐军之峰得到净化，然后向冰冠冰川回音谷的古斯塔夫神父复命。",oEN="Venture to Crusaders' Pinnacle and use the Blessed Banner of the Crusade atop the Pile of Crusader Skulls. Defend the banner against Scourge attack until the land atop the pinnacle is sanctified and then return to Father Gustav at the Valley of Echoes in Icecrown.",c="圣光保佑！我们占领了顶峰！正义要塞终于可以动工了。大领主弗丁和骑士们已经在前往我们新基地的路上。你必须到那里与他们汇合，<name>！",cEN="Blessed Light! We have taken the pinnacle! Finally, construction of Justice Keep can begin. Highlord Fordring and the knights are already en route to our new base. You must meet them there, <name>!"}
Q[13142]={d="时机已经成熟，$n。你和你的朋友必须向大领主巴拉加德发起挑战，他既是巴拉加德堡垒的领主，也是尤顿海姆的统治者。\n\n巴拉加德堡垒位于尤顿海姆的西南边缘，在堡垒顶部有一支号角。你要吹响它，让挑战的号角响彻这片土地。\n\n如此一来，巴拉加德就必须接受你的挑战了。而我……不，瓦尔德玛达将仲裁这场战斗。\n\n<被女妖附身的维库人发出恐怖的笑声。>",dEN="The time has come, <name>. You and your friends must challenge the lord of Balargarde Fortress, the master of Jotunheim, Overthane Balargarde.\n\nAtop the fortress, which is on the southwestern edge of Jotunheim, you will find a horn. Blow into it. Allow your challenge to resound throughout the steadfast.\n\nBalargarde will have no choice but to face you. And I... excuse me, Vardmadra will be there to adjudicate the challenge.\n\n<The banshee-possessed vrykul lets out a bellowing cackle.>",o="约尔达村的白骨女巫要你挑战并击败大领主巴拉加德，为她复仇。",oEN="The Bone Witch at Njorndar Village has asked you to exact her revenge by challenging and defeating Overthane Balargarde.",p="大领主巴拉加德还没死。你对寻找堡垒这件事，有任何疑问吗？",pEN="Overthane Balargarde is not dead. Did you have problems finding his fortress?",c="语言无法形容我此刻的感受，<name>。我的复仇已经完成，我再无他事可做。\n\n要是巫妖王最终被击败时我能在场就好了。\n\n不过别自欺欺人，约顿海姆离\"解决\"还差得远。在维库人不再构成威胁之前，我会继续看管这个女巫。\n\n四处看看吧，这个洞穴里有很多值钱的东西。随便挑。",cEN="Words cannot describe what I'm feeling at the moment, <name>. My revenge is complete and there is naught else for me to do.\n\nIf only I could be there when the Lich King is finally taken down.\n\nDon't fool yourself though, Jotunheim is far from 'dealt' with. I will remain in possession of this witch until such time as the vrykul are no longer a threat.\n\nLook around, there are many items of value in this cave. Take your pick."}
Q[13143]={d="重要的事情优先解决吧。我在东边的城墙上发现了一些轻盈追迹者，在我们和阿尔萨斯彻底决裂之前，那些家伙曾是我们的仆从，而且堪比世界上最优秀的斥候……只要通过统御之眼控制它们就可以运用它们的能力为我们做事。\n\n我要你飞上城墙，稍微教训一下某个轻盈追迹者，然后使用这枚黑锋魔印强迫它臣服于你，它一定还认得这东西。接着，你就把它带回此地东北方的岩石上，它自己就能回到我身边来。",dEN="First things first. I saw some Lithe Stalkers on the ramparts just east of us. They used to serve us before we broke with Arthas, and they're about as perfect a scout as you can get... with a little prodding from an eye of dominion.\n\nFly up, find one of the stalkers, beat it down a bit, and then use this Sigil of the Ebon Blade to command its obedience. It will recognize the sigil, guaranteed. Lead it back to the top of the rocks northeast of here and it will find its way to me.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你驯服一只轻盈追迹者，然后把它带到苦难高地东北方的岩石上。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning on the Rise of Suffering has requested that you bring a subdued Lithe Stalker to the top of the rocks northeast of the Rise of Suffering.",p="我相信它们的新主人让它们过得不太好，但是没有其它方法。这些家伙很快就会忘记，我们才鞭笞过的教训。只要它们还在这块大陆上蠕动，就会害怕这些符印的。",pEN="I'm sure their masters don't go easy on them, but there's no way these things would forget the lessons we lashed into their skins. They'll fear those sigils for as long as they crawl this land.",c="我已经将小坏蛋拴在那边的柱上了，我也会继续抓更多的追迹者。\n\n我们好好利用一下它们能力吧。",cEN="I've chained the wretch to the post over there and I'll look into getting my hands on more of them.\n\nNow let's make some use of that eye."}
Q[13144]={d="缝合场的憎恶装配台那里已经制造出了大量的成品。现在，这些怪物都被锁在装配台附近的柱子上。如果我们还不采取行动，它们就要随着巫妖王的部队出征了。\n\n缝合场的白骨堆里有一些骷髅手臂在扭动，这些手臂的原主呢，就是那些可以操纵火焰的骷髅。你要去找到并释放那些骷髅，把它们带到缝合完毕的憎恶附近，然后就等着看好戏吧！",dEN="The workers in the Fleshwerks abomination lab have already completed a number of their creations. For now, the creatures are chained to the pillars around the edge of the lab, but if we do not act, they will march with the Lich King's armies.\n\nGrasping arms reach out of the bone piles spread throughout the Fleshwerks. These arms belong to skeletons enchanted with the power of fire. Find and free these skeletons, then take them near the completed abominations and watch the show!",o="黑色观察站的黑暗骑士阿尔蕾要你借助燃烧的骷髅消灭3只被锁住的憎恶。",oEN="Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch wants you to destroy 3 Chained Abominations with Burning Skeletons.",p="你摧毁那些憎恶的成品了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed the completed abominations?",c="啊，很好。早晨的血肉焦臭味是什么都比不上的。那是战胜天灾军团的胜利气味啊。",cEN="Ah, good. There's nothing like the smell of roasted putrid flesh in the morning. That's the smell of victory over the Scourge."}
Q[13145]={d="首先，我们需要搞清楚敌人的底细。\n\n使用统御之眼控制一只轻盈追迹者，对这一地区进行侦察。我在飞来这里的路上留意到几处特别的地方，希望你能重点调查一下：东北方的高地、东南方的工作区、中央的大熔炉以及西南方的祭祀场。\n\n追迹者拥有惊人的跳跃能力，从高处摔落也不会受伤——你可以利用这一点，在城墙间上跳下窜。",dEN="We need to know what we're up against.\n\nUse the eye of dominion to assume control of a lithe stalker and scout out the area. There are a few spots in particular I saw when flying in that I want you to get a closer look at: the overlook in the northeast, the work area in the southeast, the large forge near the center, and the ritual area in the southwest.\n\nThe stalker can leap far and won't be hurt by large falls - use that to your advantage to get up and down from those ramparts.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你使用轻盈追迹者的能力，侦察玛雷卡里斯。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning at the Rise of Suffering has requested that you use a Lithe Stalker to scout out Malykriss.",p="飞行或许更优雅一些，但是我们没办法像潜猎者一样靠得那么近又不被发现。",pEN="Flying may be a bit more graceful, but there's no way we could get in as close as the stalker without being detected.",c="干得好。看来向阿尔萨斯效忠的死亡骑士比我原先预想的多。\n\n他一点也没有隐藏取代阿彻鲁斯的意图。一座纯萨隆邪铁造的城塞确实很难摧毁，不过我们没有必要摧毁它……我们可以阻止它的建造并且解决这些死亡骑士的领袖——就在此时此地，在他们成为真正的威胁之前。\n\n最重要的是，我们必须在他们中间引起够大的混乱，令那些死亡骑士远离他们的头儿，好让我们能发起成功的袭击。",cEN="Excellent work. It seems more death knights remained loyal to Arthas than I initially thought.\n\nHe certainly is sparing nothing in his attempt to replace Acherus. A pure saronite citadel would be hard to destroy indeed. There's no need to destroy it though... we can halt production and put down these death knight leaders here and now, before they become a real threat.\n\nMost importantly, we need to disrupt them enough to get those death knights away from from the leaders so that we can make our strike."}
Q[13146]={d="我们要制造一些麻烦……只要能让这些死亡骑士离开他们的头目身边就行了。如果能设法干掉他们手下的那些爪牙，他们就不得不投入大量精力去监督玛雷卡里斯的工作进展。\n\n憎恶是这次行动的完美猎物——它们行动迟缓、头脑简单，而且相当相当地愚蠢。利用它们对追迹者的信任，将散落在工地上的天灾炸弹拖到它们身边去。在它们反应过来之前，你有足够的时间跑到远处，然后引爆炸弹。",dEN="We need to cause some disruption... anything to bring those death knights away from their leaders. If we lay waste to their minions below, I suspect they'll have to devote more attention to keeping a close eye on operations.\n\nAbominations are easy prey - slow, predictable, and most importantly, stupid. Take advantage of their trust of the stalkers to drag them some of the Scourge bombs scattered throughout the construction area. You'll be able light the bombs far before they figure out what's going on.",o="狡诈者维雷斯要你使用轻盈追迹者的铁链，将天灾炸弹拖到玛雷卡里斯的4个笨拙的凶尸身边。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning wants you to use the Lithe Stalker's Iron Chain to drag Scourge Bombs to 4 Lumbering Atrocities inside Malykriss.",p="他们有察觉到你对他们下手吗？",pEN="Did they even see it coming?",c="他们甚至没有怀疑到你，不是吗？至少他们很好预测。",cEN="They didn't even think to lay a hand on you, did they? At least they're predictable."}
Q[13147]={d="瓦古和低级亡灵奴仆的最大差别在于，瓦古还保留着一定的自主意识，这表现在它们依然非常蔑视体力劳动，不愿和骷髅或是食尸鬼一起工作。\n\n我们可以利用这种天生的抵触情绪，在玛雷卡里斯的阴暗蛮徒和其它亡灵之间挑起争端。这可以减缓它们的工作进度，让那些死亡骑士下来收拾局面。\n\n很简单——只要在阴暗蛮徒靠近低级亡灵时对蛮徒投掷石块就行了。",dEN="The major difference between vargul and lesser undead minions is that vargul still possess enough of their minds to despise being used for labor. Never will a vargul be pleased to be working aside skeletons or ghouls.\n\nLets take advantage of this inevitable animosity and start some fights between the umbral brutes and the other undead in Malykriss. That should serve to slow production and bring the death knights down to babysit.\n\nShould be simple - throw rocks at the brutes as they near lesser undead.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你趁阴暗蛮徒靠近低级亡灵时，利用轻盈追迹者向阴暗蛮徒投掷石块。挑起5起争端之后回去复命。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning at the Rise of Suffering wants you to use a Lithe Stalker to throw rocks at Umbral Brutes as they near lesser undead in Malykriss. Return after you've started 5 fights.",p="容易被摸透的蠢蛋。",pEN="Predictable louts.",c="他们这么容易玩弄，根本不需要牺牲我们自己人，是吧？",cEN="No need to sacrifice our own men when they are this easily manipulated, eh?"}
Q[13148]={d="这条破损的项链附着一张单据，上面写着\"蒂莫西·琼斯之物——卡地亚珠宝公司——魔法商业区——达拉然\"。也许你该把它修好，还给他。|n",dEN="This damaged necklace has an invoice with it that reads \"Property of Timothy Jones - Cartier and Co Fine Jewelry - Magus Commerce Exhange - Dalaran\".\n\nPerhaps you should repair it and return it to him.",o="用一颗玉髓石对项链进行修补，然后把它还给达拉然魔法商业区珠宝店的提莫斯·琼斯。",oEN="Repair the necklace with a single Chalcedony and return it to Timothy Jones in at the Jewelcrafters Shop in the Magus Commerce Exchange in Dalaran.",p="你带了什么来？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="你在哪里找到它的？几星期前的一次交货中，不少这样的项链被劫走了！让我送你这个珠宝匠硬币作为回报。",cEN="How did you find this! Many of these necklaces were looted from one of my shipments a few weeks ago! Let me repay you with this Jewelcrafter's Token."}
Q[13149]={d="总是有人多管闲事……\n\n永恒龙军团企图欺骗阿尔萨斯王子，从而扰乱我们所熟知的历史。\n\n如果他们能让他相信这里的粮食都没有携带瘟疫，他就永远不会做出屠城斯坦索姆的那个重大决定。这绝不能发生。对你发现的任何可疑的粮箱使用这个奥术干扰器，让它们现出真面目。事情办完后，到此处北面斯坦索姆入口附近与我碰面。",dEN="Always meddling...\n\nThe Infinite Dragonflight seek to disrupt history as we have come to know it by deceiving Prince Arthas.\n\nIf they can convince him that none of the grain here carries the plague, then he'll never have to make the fateful decision to cull Stratholme.\n\nThis must not come to pass.\n\nUse this Arcane Disruptor on any suspicious crates of grain you find to reveal them for what they are. Meet me near Stratholme's entrance, north of this place, when the work is done.",o="克罗米要你对往日的斯坦索姆内的可疑箱子使用奥术干扰器，然后到斯坦索姆的入口附近去见她。",oEN="Chromie wants you to use the Arcane Disruptor on the suspicious crates in Stratholme Past, then speak to her near the entrance to Stratholme.",c="你干得真好，朋友。阿尔萨斯的部队已经暴露在染疫的谷物之中。\n\n好好听着，我们还有很多工作没做完。",cEN="You have done well, friend. The plagued grain was exposed to Arthas' troops.\n\nListen carefully, now. There remains more to be done."}
Q[13151]={d="永恒龙军团不太可能就这么轻易放弃。我无法确定他们在谋划什么，但有种感觉告诉我，今天的事还没完。\n\n再过一会儿，阿尔萨斯将面临一个绝望的两难境地，并做出一个重大的决定。\n\n现在别分心，。不用我提醒你赌注有多大。我必须请求你陪同王子完成斯坦索姆的清洗行动。阿尔萨斯必须活着穿过斯坦索姆，而你必须确保他击败玛尔加尼斯！",dEN="The Infinite Dragonflight are not likely to give up so easily. I cannot be certain of what they're up to, but something tells me we haven't seen the last of them today.\n\nIn just a moment, Arthas will face a desperate dilemma, and make a momentous decision.\n\nDon't lose focus now, <name>. I needn't remind you how much is at stake. I must call upon you to accompany the prince in his culling of Stratholme.\n\nArthas must make it through Stratholme alive and you must see to it that he defeats Mal'Ganis!",o="克罗米要你在阿尔萨斯净化斯坦索姆时陪在他身边。击败玛尔加尼斯后再去见她。",oEN="Chromie has asked you to accompany Arthas in the Culling of Stratholme. You are to speak with her again after Mal'Ganis is defeated.",c="你做得很好，<name>。\n\n永恒龙军团已被挫败，这条历史线索依然完整。\n\n我感谢你宝贵的协助，整个青铜龙军团也是如此。",cEN="You have done well, <name>.\n\nThe Infinites have been foiled and this thread of history remains intact.\n\nI thank you for your invaluable assistance, as does the entire Bronze Dragonflight."}
Q[13152]={d="这么说来，它们在复生密室里将邪铁碎片植入食尸鬼体内？我们必须阻止它们，不能让这些新型食尸鬼变成天灾军团对付我们的利器。\n\n转至缝合场，在血肉巨人装配台一带找到复生密室的入口。食尸鬼的首脑萨布诺克博士将他最可怕的造物“补丁”关押在那里。解开“补丁”的锁链，这对你控制天灾生物是非常有用的。",dEN="So they've been embedding these ghouls with broken shards of saronite down in the Sanctum of Reanimation? We must put a stop to this, before these ghouls can be deployed against our troops.\n\nFind the entrance to the Sanctum of Reanimation in the flesh giant lab area of the Fleshwerks. There, the ghoul mastermind, Doctor Sabnok, keeps the most fearsome of his creations, Patches. Free Patches from his chains and help him take his revenge on the doctor. Let his own creation be his undoing.",o="黑色观察站的黑暗骑士阿尔蕾要你进入复生密室，摧毁囚禁“补丁”的金属桩，并且帮助它击败萨布诺克博士。",oEN="Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch wants you to destroy the Metal Stake imprisoning Patches in the Sanctum of Reanimation and help him get his revenge on Doctor Sabnok.",p="你解开博士作品的束缚，好让他自食恶果了吗？",pEN="Have you unleashed the doctor's creation against him?",c="<Dakrider Arly echa la cabeza hacia atrás y ríe oscuramente>\n\n对那位\"好\"医生来说，这结局再合适不过了，你不觉得吗？",cEN="<Dakrider Arly throws her head back and laughs darkly.>\n\nA fitting end for the 'good' doctor, wouldn't you say?"}
Q[13153]={d="很高兴见到你，$n。虽然战斗暂时告一段落了，但是我们必须立即开始准备足够的军用物资。经过调查，我发现死在冰川瀑布附近的士兵身上的护甲都因为当地的特殊环境的关系，被附上了巨大的能量。部落已经在那里收集这种护甲了。\n\n到冰川瀑布去，杀死你所遇到的部落成员。把他们手中那些灌魔的护甲拿来给我。\n\n如果你找不到部落的士兵，也许可以在那里的元素生物身上发现被它们杀死的冒险者的护甲。",dEN="<name>, good to see you. While the battle has subsided for now, we must hurry and replenish our stocks. My research indicates that the armor of soldiers recently slain in the Glacial Falls becomes imbued with an incredible amount of energy. The Horde has been seen collecting armor in the area.\n\nHead to the Glacial Falls and slay any of the Horde you find there. Return their imbued armor to me.\n\nIf you cannot find any of the Horde, you might find the armor of an adventurer slain by the elementals.",o="冬拥堡垒的女巫凯兰娜要你转至冰川瀑布，从部落玩家身上收集10套灌魔的部落护甲。",oEN="Sorceress Kaylana at Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 sets of Imbued Horde Armor from Horde players at the Glacial Falls.",p="嗯，你有找到护甲吗？",pEN="So, did you find the armor?",c="噢。它还在滴水耶。你就不能先把它弄干吗？",cEN="Augh. It's still dripping. Couldn't you have at least dried it off first?"}
Q[13154]={d="龙这种生物真是个奇迹！好吧，至少它们的骨头是个奇迹！我给弓箭手们配备了龙骨制作的箭头。可惜，自从安加萨发生大屠杀以后，就很难从龙骨荒野弄到龙骨了。\n\n不过冬拥湖西边的阴影森林里也有不少龙骨，足够我们用的了。\n\n你现在就到阴影森林去，把你能找到的所有骨片都拿回来！\n\n有人看见部落也在那个地区收集骨片。去杀了那些部落渣滓！",dEN="Dragons are incredible! Well, their bones at least! I've been equipping our archers with arrowheads made of Dragonbone. Unfortunately, since the massacre at Angrathar, it has become almost impossible to get bone from Dragonblight.\n\nHowever, the Forest of Shadows on the western edge of Wintergrasp has enough bones to tide us over.\n\nHead to the Forest of Shadows and bring back any bone splinters you can find!\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting bone splinters in the area. Slay them!",o="冬拥堡垒的制弓师兰多尔弗要你转至阴影森林，从部落玩家那里抢夺10支龙骨箭。",oEN="Bowyer Randolph at Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 Quivers of Dragonbone Arrows from Horde players at the Forest of Shadows.",p="狩猎的结果如何？我听到一些谣言说那里闹鬼，虽然我不曾亲自去那里冒险。",pEN="How was the hunting? I've heard rumors the place is haunted, though I never venture out there myself.",c="非常好！这将有助我们，在不久就会到来的战斗中燃起熊熊的战争烈焰。",cEN="Excellent! This will help fuel the flames of war for days to come."}
Q[13155]={d="我听到了一些关于玛雷卡里斯和阿尔萨斯组建新的死亡骑士团的传闻，我曾以为他不过是想填补黑锋骑士团的损失而已。但是各种数据都表明，阿尔萨斯想要发展壮大这支新的骑士团。\n\n不久之前，我们派了狡诈者维雷斯转至玛雷卡里斯探查敌情。你可以在玛雷卡里斯以西，白骨之庭内的苦难高地找到他。\n\n你去的时候，尽量不要引起别人的注意。",dEN="I've already heard some rumors regarding Malykriss and Arthas's new death knight order, but I assumed it nothing more than filling the void. These numbers suggest he's trying to take it up a notch though.\n\nWe dispatched one of our best to Malykriss not long ago - Vereth the Cunning. You should be able to find him on the Rise of Suffering, just west of Malykriss, and inside the Court of Bones.\n\nTry not to draw too much attention on your way in.",o="向苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯报到。",oEN="Report to Vereth the Cunning on the Rise of Suffering in Icecrown.",c="邪恶城堡……这是看看阿尔萨斯有多痛恨失败的好机会。让我们把这刀刺得更深一点。",cEN="The Vile Hold... a testament to how much Arthas hates losing. Let's drive the blade deep."}
Q[13156]={d="天啊，这里可真冷！让我想起了阿古斯上的风雪交加的凯因努斯雪山。在这冰天雪地中，我们的士兵很容易感冒。\n\n到冬拥湖西南方的生命草原去，帮我弄10株生长在那里的红色植物来，我会把它们制成抵御寒气的药物。\n\n有人看见部落也在那一地区收集草药。尽管杀了他们，把草药抢过来！",dEN="My, it its quite chilly up here! Reminds me of the stormy peaks of Kaarinos on Argus. However, with all of this snow and ice, our soldiers can easily catch cold.\n\nHead to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp, and bring me back 10 of the Horde herb pouches you find. I will grind them into a medicine to help protect against the cold.\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting them from the plant life in the area. Do not hesitate to slay them and retrieve the herbs!",o="冬拥堡垒的学者特尔萨要你转至生命草原，收集10只部落草药包。",oEN="Anchorite Tessa in Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 Horde Herb Pouches from Horde players in the Steppe of Life.",p="我希望你没有不小心惹到任何鞭笞者！上星期它们让我们的士兵吃了好一顿鞭子。",pEN="I hope you didn't pull up any of the lashers by mistake! They gave Private Doane quite a whipping last week.",c="太棒了！这将能协助我们的部队对抗严寒。",cEN="Excellent! This will help protect our troops against the cold."}
Q[13157]={d="自豪地记住，是你帮助银色北伐军在冰冠冰川的城墙内站稳了脚跟，$gorgulloso:orgullosa;{None}。北伐军顶峰如今公然矗立在巫妖王和他扭曲的爪牙面前。$n\n大领主弗丁和幸存的北伐军战士们在北伐军顶峰等候你的到来。再次穿过裂口，去寻找那位大领主吧！\n",dEN="Stand proud in knowing that it was you who helped establish the Argent Crusade inside the walls of Icecrown, <name>. The Crusaders' Pinnacle now stands in direct defiance of the Lich King and his twisted minions.\n\nHighlord Fordring and the crusaders who survived await your arrival at Crusaders' Pinnacle. Travel once more through the Breach and seek out the highlord!",o="转至冰冠冰川的北伐军之峰，寻找大领主提里奥·弗丁。",oEN="Seek out Highlord Tirion Fordring at Crusaders' Pinnacle in Icecrown.",c="在抵达冰冠堡垒的大门前，等着我们的，仍是漫长而艰难的旅途。我和银色北伐军的所有士兵，想对你所做的一切表达谢意。知道你将和我们一起在这块诅咒之地上奋斗，我们便心安不少。\n\n<大领主提里奥·弗丁向你致敬。>",cEN="A long and arduous journey awaits us as we make our way to the gates of Icecrown Citadel. I, and the soldiers of the Argent Crusade, wish to thank you for all that you have done. We rest easier knowing that you will fight alongside us in this cursed place.\n\n<Highlord Tirion Fordring salutes.>"}
Q[13158]={d="听我说，$r。\n\n紫罗兰监狱最近发生了一起事变，这引起了我的注意。似乎蓝龙军团正准备对达拉然发动一次全面的进攻！\n\n我要你立即转至监狱，去找典狱官奥图拉斯。他会告诉你整个事件的细节。\n\n还有，你要尽可能谨慎地处理这件事。不到万不得已的情况下，我并不想让这件事引起达拉然居民的恐慌。我说得够清楚了吧？\n\n好了，现在就出发吧！",dEN="Listen to me, <race>.\n\nIt's just been brought to my attention that there's been an incident at the Violet Hold. It would appear that the blues are launching a full scale invasion of Dalaran!\n\nI need you to get to the prison and speak with Warden Alturas at once. He'll give you the details.\n\nThat is not all. I need this handled with utmost discretion. We mustn't alarm the citizens of Dalaran if it can possibly be avoided. Do I make myself clear?\n\nVery well. Now, go!",o="罗宁希望你转至达拉然的紫罗兰监狱，与典狱官奥图拉斯谈一谈。",oEN="Rhonin wants you to go to the Violet Hold in Dalaran and speak with Warden Alturas.",c="来得正是时候。\n\n你准备好保卫达拉然了吗，<class>？",cEN="Not a moment too soon.\n\nAre you prepared to defend Dalaran, <class>?"}
Q[13159]={d="这是监狱的钥匙。\n\n我和我的人会留在这里作为最后一道防线，以防你无法击退这次进攻。\n\n一定要和辛克莱中尉谈谈。她会为你开放监狱的防御设施。\n\n快点，。时间不多了。我留在里面的那几个人撑不了多久，需要你的帮助。入侵部队被成功解决之后，回来向我报告。",dEN="Here is the prison key.\n\nMy men and I will stay here as a last line of defense in the event that you are unable to overcome the assault.\n\nBe sure to speak with Lieutenant Sinclari. She'll provide you with access to the prison's defenses.\n\nHurry, <race>. There is little time. The few I left inside won't last long without your help. Report back to me once the invasion forces have been successfully dealt with.",o="典狱官奥图拉斯希望你进入紫罗兰监狱，消灭入侵的蓝龙军团。杀死塞安妮苟萨之后向他复命。",oEN="Warden Alturas wants you to enter the Violet Hold and put and end to the blue dragon invasion force. You are to report back to him once Cyanigosa is slain.",p="结束了吗？你应付得了攻势吗？",pEN="Is it over? Were you able to withstand the assault?",c="危机过去了？\n\n这的确是个好消息。我会将这个消息上报给罗宁。\n\n请收下这个，代表达拉然的谢意。",cEN="The crisis is averted, then?\n\nThat is good news indeed. I will forward the news on to Rhonin.\n\nPlease, accept this with the gratitude of Dalaran."}
Q[13160]={d="石像鬼是高效的侦察兵，如果任由它们从空中倾泻攻击，也会十分致命，但它们有一个非常明显的弱点。它们中的大多数都必须长时间化作石像休息，以维持沉重身躯在空中飞行所需的能量。\n\n当我透过你使用的那只眼睛观察时，我注意到里面有几十个冰肤哨兵正在东墙和南墙上休息。用那只潜行者跳上他们的壁架，趁他们睡觉时把他们彻底解决。",dEN="Gargoyles make effective scouts and can be deadly if left to rain attacks from the air, but they have a very obvious weakness. Most of them have to go through long periods resting as stone to maintain the energy they need to carry their heavy bodies through the air.\n\nAs I peered through the eye you were using, I noticed dozens of iceskin sentries resting on the eastern and southern walls inside. Use the stalker to leap up to their ledges and devastate them while they sleep.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你使用轻盈追迹者的跳跃能力，杀死12只熟睡的冰肤斥候。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning at the Rise of Suffering wants you to use a Lithe Stalker's heave ability to destroy 12 sleeping Iceskin Sentries.",p="简直易如反掌。",pEN="Almost too easy.",c="他们睡觉的时候可没什么威胁性。",cEN="Not so much of a threat when they're sleeping."}
Q[13161]={d="我们该去拿走这些野兽的徽记了。\n\n我曾在洛基尔身边侍卫许久。他运用邪恶灵气的能力比我见过的其它死亡骑士要高出许多，而且他还是个非常残忍的家伙。\n\n当你在洛基尔的地盘上与他交战时，他的力量会发挥到极限。悲哀的是，我们没有办法避开这种不利局面，不过只要你躲开他的亡灵爪牙，获胜也不是不可能。\n\n要保持灵活，$c。不要有丝毫的轻敌之念。",dEN="It's time that we start cutting off the heads of the beast.\n\nI served beside Rokir for quite some time. He knows the unholy arts better than most any other death knight I've met and he's equally as ruthless.\n\nRokir's strengths are most apparent when you are fighting him on his own ground. Sadly, we don't have much option in those regards, but stay on your feet to avoid his undead minions and you should come out victorious.\n\nBe nimble, <class>, and do not take him lightly.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你杀死洛基尔，邪恶骑士。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning on the Rise of Suffering wants you to kill Rokir, the Rider of the Unholy.",p="完成了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="没有了洛基尔，这世界会变得更美好——相信我。",cEN="The world will be a much better place without Rokir in it - trust me."}
Q[13162]={d="萨芙……这位死亡骑士和别人不同。她会对你花言巧语，让你相信她的本性并不邪恶，但是转眼之间，她就会微笑着杀了你。\n\n我相信你要战胜她并非难事，但是千万不要掉以轻心。她的危险之处在于，她会让敌人相信自己胜券在握，然后放松警惕，然后发动迅猛的冰霜攻击将其击溃。\n\n所以，你要注意保持警惕，并且不要低估了她。",dEN="Sapph... Sapph's a death knight like no other. She'll shower you with sweet words and you'll swear that she has no evil within her heart, and then she'll run you through without even breaking her smile.\n\nI have no fear that you'll be able to best Sapph, but do not grow overconfident. Her strength lies in lulling her victims into a false ease, shortly before shattering them with a fierce barrage of frost attacks.\n\nDo not let your guard down, and do not underestimate her.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你杀死萨芙，冰霜骑士。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning on the Rise of Suffering wants you to kill Sapph, the Rider of Frost.",p="我们除掉她了吗？",pEN="Are we rid of her?",c="不能否认地，我会怀念她的笑声……以及她杀人的那一刻脸上挂着的笑容。不过，我不需要再时时注意背后的杀机，所以我想也没有什么好抱怨的。",cEN="I can't deny, I'll miss her laugh... and that smile that would creep onto her face just before she killed someone. A little less need to watch my back though, so I suppose I can't complain."}
Q[13163]={d="贝洛克是极少数逐步晋级上来的维库人，他的地位完全是靠血淋淋的战功累积而来的。如果你死在他手下，那也算不得是一件遗憾的事情。\n\n当你和他交战的时候，记得与同伴们保持彼此之间的距离，并尽可能远离贝洛克。他会毫不犹豫地榨干你们的生命能量，将其据为己有，所以你要有意识地阻止他使用这种能力。\n\n我对你有信心。去干掉他。",dEN="Baelok is one of the few vrykul that I've ever seen rise through the ranks, and that was mostly accomplished through sheer brutality. If your competition ends up dead, there's far less to compete against.\n\nWhen you join battle with him, spread out from your companions and keep your distance as much as you reasonably can. He will not hesitate to steal your life force for himself, so you will need to hinder his ability to do so as much as possible.\n\nYou have my confidence. See to it that he dies.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你杀死贝洛克，鲜血骑士。",oEN="Vereth the Cunning on the Rise of Suffering wants you to kill Baelok, the Rider of Blood.",p="他死了吗？",pEN="Is he dead?",c="所以他终于死了？真是好消息。",cEN="So he finally lost? Good to hear."}
Q[13164]={d="杀死苦难之主骑士团的几个头目之后，我们就要去对付他们真正的首领——奥尔巴兹·血毒。\n\n在你外出执行任务的时候，莫格莱尼来找过我，他将奥尔巴兹的藏身之处告诉了我。在冰冠堡垒的地下，有一座巨大的深渊——你可以在深渊的边缘找到奥尔巴兹。\n\n我们已经派出了最精锐的黑锋骑士协助你战斗。奥尔巴兹的末日已经到了。",dEN="With the riders of the Host of Suffering dead, now is the time to put an end to their true leader: Orbaz Bloodbane.\n\nMograine caught up with me while you were off and told me that he found where Orbaz is hiding. Under Icecrown Citadel itself, there is an immense pit - you will find Orbaz just outside its lip.\n\nSome of the Ebon Blade's strongest agents have already been dispatched - gather aid and join the fight. It is time for Bloodbane to die.",o="苦难高地的狡诈者维雷斯要你杀死奥尔巴兹·血毒。",oEN="Vereth on the Rise of Suffering has dispatched you to kill Orbaz Bloodbane.",p="我们终于摆脱了那个崇拜阿尔萨斯的家伙了吗？",pEN="Are we finally free of that Arthas want-to-be?",c="莫格莱尼亲自来看这件事办成了？我猜那两人之间有仇——他想分那可怜虫一杯羹，也不奇怪。\n\n你干得极其出色，<race>，你会得到相应的奖赏。黑锋骑士团感谢你。",cEN="Morgraine himself arrived to see the deed done then? I imagine there was some ill blood between those two - no surprise that he wanted a piece of the wretch.\n\nYou've done exceedingly well, <race>, and you shall be awarded appropriately. The Ebon Blade thanks you."}
Q[13165]={d="迷雾已经散去。就像那天我将灰烬使者插进自己的心脏，以此解除父亲那被诅咒的灵魂时一样，我感到非常清醒。那也是我作为自由之身所保留的最后一丝记忆了。\n\n为了在这个新的世界中继续生存下去，我们必须把阿彻鲁斯从天灾军团手中夺回来。我已经教你学会召唤黑锋之门的方法了。你可以通过黑锋之门返回阿彻鲁斯，$n。现在就打开黑锋之门，到阿彻鲁斯去找我。黑锋骑士团的第一场战斗正在激烈地进行着！让天灾军团去死吧！",dEN="The haze has been lifted. I can see as clearly now as the day that I plunged the Ashbringer into my own heart to free my father's cursed soul: my last memory as a free man.\n\nWe must take back Acherus from the Scourge if our order is to survive in this new world. I have taught you how to call forth a death gate. The death gate will return you to Acherus when you call upon it, <name>. Use it now and meet me at Acherus. The first battle of the Knights of the Ebon Blade is underway! Death to the Scourge!",o="使用你的黑锋之门法术返回阿彻鲁斯：黑锋要塞。抵达阿彻鲁斯之后，向大领主达里安·莫格莱尼报到。",oEN="Use your Death Gate spell to return to Acherus: The Ebon Hold. Report to Highlord Darion Mograine once you arrive.",c="巫妖王被灰烬使者所伤，已经返回了诺森德，但是他最后的军队仍然占据着二楼。",cEN="The Lich King has returned to Northrend, wounded by the Ashbringer, but the second floor still holds the last of his armies."}
Q[13166]={d="命令大厅已经被我们占领了，但是巫妖王在阿彻鲁斯之心给我们留下了一点小礼物。那个可怕的缝合怪物——帕奇维克和一群憎恶占领了第二层。\n\n使用传送器转至第二层，消灭剩馀的天灾部队。不要试图独自挑战帕奇维克！你必须协同阿彻鲁斯的其它死亡骑士，一起攻击那个怪物！\n\n出发吧，$n。我的力量与你同在！",dEN="The Hall of Command has been secured, but the Lich King has left us a little present in the Heart of Acherus. The stitched terror, Patchwerk, and a horde of abominations have taken over the second floor.\n\nUse the teleporter to get to the second floor and destroy the Scourge forces that remain. Do not engage Patchwerk alone! You must fight the monstrosity with other death knights of Acherus!\n\nGo, <name>. You have my strength to carry you!",o="杀死10个天灾亡灵，并参与消灭帕奇维克的战斗。成功之后，回去向大领主达里安·莫格莱尼复命。",oEN="Slay 10 Scourge and help kill Patchwerk. Return to Highlord Darion Mograine should you succeed.",p="阿彻鲁斯是我们的！",pEN="Acherus will be ours!",c="干得好，死亡骑士。天灾军团的余孽很快就会被清除，而重建的工作也将展开。\n\n我有最后一份工作得麻烦你。",cEN="Well done, death knight. The remaining Scourge will be dealt with in short order and the rebuilding process will begin anew.\n\nI have but one last task for you."}
Q[13167]={d="那个背叛我们族人的所谓国王，阿努巴拉克，当前居住在曾经荣耀一时的地下王国艾卓-尼鲁布。\n\n由于他的背叛，我们的家园变成了现在这幅肮脏凄惨的模样。他所统治的亡灵蛛魔军团如同它们的首领一样向巫妖王起誓，效忠于他。\n\n去终结叛徒国王的统治吧，$c。这样对我们和你来说都能算是一件大好事。\n\n要是你能取得成功的话，把阿努巴拉克的甲壳带回来给我。",dEN="Anub'arak, the traitor king, makes his home in the once proud underland of Azjol-Nerub.\n\nSince his betrayal, he has twisted and perverted our homeland into the wretched squalor it is today. He rules over an army of undead nerubians who, like their leader, have pledged themselves to serving the Lich King.\n\nBring an end to the traitor king's reign, <class>. You will be doing a great service to both of our peoples.\n\nIf you manage to succeed where all others have failed, bring me the husk of Anub'arak.",o="纳尔苏深渊的拆解者基里克斯要你去击败艾卓-尼鲁布的阿努巴拉克，并将阿努巴拉克的破损甲壳交给基里克斯。",oEN="Kilix the Unraveler in the Pit of Narjun has tasked you with defeating Anub'arak in Azjol-Nerub. You are to return to Kilix with Anub'arak's Broken Husk.",p="办好了吗，<class>？那个叛徒国王终于走到尽头了吗？",pEN="Is it done, <class>? Has the traitor king finally met his end?",c="<Un brillo feroz emana de todos los ojos de Kilix mientras mira fijamente al cascarón.>\n\n办成了！\n\n<race>！你的名字将被载入我族的历史。\n\n我欠你一份人情……",cEN="<A fierce glow emanantes from all of Kilix's eyes as he stares at the husk.>\n\nIt is DONE!\n\n<race>! Your name shall be recorded in the history of our people.\n\nI am in your debt...."}
Q[13168]={d="瞧瞧……统御之眼。诅咒教派通常会不遗馀力地保护这种东西，不过大概是在自家老巢被血洗时，他们实在无暇他顾。\n\n通过统御之眼，任何拥有相关力量的生物都可以精确地控制某个亡灵奴仆的行动。你可以想象得到，这对你控制食尸鬼或是骷髅是非常有用的。\n\n想试试吗？喏，拿那边的影魔练练手吧。",dEN="Look what we have here... eyes of dominion. The Cult normally goes to great lengths to keep these things safe, but I suppose their options for retreat are few when we're slaughtering them in their own home.\n\nThe eyes allow a being of any relative power to control an undead minion's actions precisely. As you can imagine, this can be extremely useful when it comes to your typical clumsy ghoul or skeleton.\n\nCare to try your hand at it? Use one of the eyes to control a captured shade.",o="暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃要你使用统御之眼控制一只被捕获的幻象观察者。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault wants you to use an Eye of Dominion to take control of a captured Eidolon Watcher.",p="使用支配之眼以掩饰行动的好处是显而易见的。这会是非常好用的工具。",pEN="The options of subterfuge made available to us with the eyes are obvious. These will be very useful tools.",c="没什么大不了的，是吧？任何有智慧的生物控制次级亡灵应该都不太难。我猜只有真正的死灵法师之流，才能用它们夺取那些更强大的亡灵的控制权。不过那不成问题——我已经能想到各种各样用哪怕最微不足道的爪牙也能造成的破坏了。\n\n那我们开始吧？",cEN="Nothing to it, eh? Any intelligent being should have little trouble controlling lesser undead. I suspect only the likes of a true necromancer could use these to sieze control of any of the more powerful undead. That won't be a problem though - I can already think of quite a variety of destruction we can wreak with even the most paltry minions.\n\nShall we have at it then?"}
Q[13169]={d="按照惯例，西南方萨隆邪铁矿场的亡灵会让瘟疫犬挨饿，好让它们变得格外凶暴。用暗影贴近它们，喂几只猎犬。我向你保证，它们会乐意放过你，甚至可能站到喂它们的那只手一边。$gtranquilo:tranquila;{None}\n不过在喂饱它们之前，别靠那些家伙太近。它们的鼻子可不会被你暗影的飘忽所蒙骗。\n",dEN="As is usual practice, the undead at the saronite quarry to the southwest starve plaguehounds to keep them extra aggressive. Use the shade to get up close and feed some of those hounds and I promise you they'll be content to leave you alone, if not side with the hand that fed them.\n\nDon't get too close to those things until you've fed them though. Their noses don't fall victim to your shade's elusiveness.",o="暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃要你使用幻象观察者给18条饥饿的瘟疫恶犬喂食。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault wants you to use the Eidolon Watcher to feed 18 Hungering Plaguehounds.",p="别浪费太多饲料——那些狗只要有得吃就会听话。",pEN="No need to be wasteful - those hounds will serve whoever bothers to feed them.",c="它们这会儿可都睡着了，不是吗？",cEN="Put them right to sleep, didn't it?"}
Q[13170]={d="食尸鬼是非常脆弱的东西，西南边萨隆邪铁采掘场里的那些守卫也不例外。我可以肯定，你只消控制一只影魔，就可以潜入那里，悄无声息地放倒那些守卫。\n\n你要用最短的时间干掉最多的守卫……我们要在发动总攻前尽量削减它们的数量。",dEN="Ghouls are fragile things when it comes down to it, and the lookouts at the saronite quarry down the path to the southwest are no exception. Using one of the shades, I have no doubt that you can sneak up and put down their lookouts without making a sound.\n\nClear out as many lookouts as you can reach in a reasonable amount of time... we'll want their ranks thinned for our assault to come.",o="暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃要你去刺杀20名永不休息的斥候。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault would like you to assassinate 20 Restless Lookouts.",p="要察觉看不见的东西是很困难的。",pEN="Hard to lookout for what can't be seen.",c="根本用不着弄脏你自己的手。",cEN="Without even getting your hands dirty."}
Q[13171]={d="我最关心的是西南方的萨隆邪铁采掘场，他们正从那里源源不断地运出大量矿石。我想知道他们到底想要造出什么东西来。所以呢，我们要从削弱他们的防御力量开始入手。\n\n我注意到采掘场中散布着一些水晶，估计那是某种类似通灵塔的防御装置。你要利用幻象观察者去摧毁那些水晶。",dEN="My main concern is the saronite quarry down the path to the southwest. They are pulling up immense amounts of ore from that quarry and I'd like to know what they're building with it. To that end, we'll start by weakening their defenses.\n\nI noticed a series of crystals scattered throughout the base and I assume they are defensive structures of some sort, not unlike ziggurats. Use the eidolon watcher to destroy any of those crystals that you find.",o="暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃要你去摧毁10枚天灾污染水晶。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault has sent you to banish 10 Scourge Containment Crystals.",p="那些水晶都排除掉了吗？我可不希望我的狮鹫遇上意想不到的惊喜。",pEN="Are those crystals out of the way? I don't want them to prove a nasty surprise for my gryphons.",c="做得好。现在我们在空中就不受威胁了。",cEN="Excellent work. We should have little threat in the air then."}
Q[13172]={d="很有效的工具，你不觉得吗？你削弱他们防御的工作做得非常出色，$c。现在我们可以发动主攻了。\n\n这里的计划很简单——摧毁一切会动的东西，趁混乱潜入其中窃取一些情报。\n\n你准备好了就告诉我，我会给你安排一头骷髅狮鹫。$glisto:lista;",dEN="Effective tool, is it not? Excellent job weakening their defenses, <class>. Now we can push the main assault.\n\nThe plan here is straight-foward - we're looking to destroy anything moving, and get in there and steal some information amidst the confusion.\n\nLet me know when you're ready and I'll set you up with a skeletal gryphon.",o="暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃要你转至哭泣采掘场，杀死80个亡灵。与他对话就可以获得进攻用的骷髅狮鹫。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault has dispatched you to slaughter 80 undead in the Weeping Quarry. Speak to him to secure a skeletal gryphon for the assault.",p="好玩吗，嗯？",pEN="Have some fun of it, eh?",c="算得上是毫无防备。没什么比这个更简单的。",cEN="Practically defenseless. It doesn't get much easier than that."}
Q[13174]={d="终止他们的运作只是计划的一部分，我们的另一个重要目标是找出萨隆邪铁的去向。我们已经知道了一部分矿石的流向，但其巨大的产量说明，敌人正在酝酿着一个更大的计划。\n\n你进入采掘场以后要注意搜集他们的文件。如果你是坐着狮鹫去进行突袭的，可以在完成任务后降落。",dEN="Shutting down their operation is just half of the plan. The other important goal here is to find out where all that saronite is being sent. We know of a few places it's been ending up, but the amount they're pulling out suggests to me that there's a bigger project in the works.\n\nOnce you're inside the quarry, get your hands on any of their documents that you can find. If you're assaulting the place with one of the gryphons, you can drop down from it as soon as the wetwork is done.",o="将哭泣采掘场文档、哭泣采掘场账目、哭泣采掘场地图和哭泣采掘场进度表交给暗影拱顶的克里托斯·血刃。",oEN="Keritose Bloodblade at the Shadow Vault has requested a Weeping Quarry Document, a Weeping Quarry Ledger, a Weeping Quarry Map, and a Weeping Quarry Schedule.",p="你有带回我要的东西吗？",pEN="Did you bring back what I requested?",c="让我看看……我们有什么……\n\n<克里托斯埋首于文件堆中好一会儿，从他的神情看来，似乎没有什么新发现。忽然他发现了他要找的东西……>\n\n玛雷卡里斯！邪恶城堡。看来失去他的死亡骑士，给阿尔萨斯很大的打击……我不是很确定他拿那些萨隆邪铁做什么，但是我隐约觉得他会好好“回报”我们什么。\n\n那小子实在是输不起啊。",cEN="Let's see here... what do we have...\n\n<Keritose buries his head in the papers for a bit, seemingly gleaning little that he did not already know. Suddenly he finds what he is looking for...>\n\nMalykriss! The Vile Hold. It seems Arthas did not take the loss of his death knights so well... I'm not exactly sure what he's doing with all of that saronite, but I have a feeling he might be overcompensating for something.\n\nThat boy is not used to losing."}
Q[13177]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;来到冬拥堡垒，$n。你的任务很简单。击败十名部落的精锐。现在，去吧！为联盟带来胜利！",dEN="Welcome to the Wintergrasp Fortress, <name>. Your mission is simple. Defeat ten of the Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!",o="冬拥堡垒的指挥官萨纳斯要你去杀死10个部落玩家。",oEN="Commander Zanneth in Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to slay 10 members of the Horde.",p="嗯，你完成你的任务了吗？",pEN="Well, have you completed your mission?",c="光荣无比！真的，你是联盟的精英。",cEN="Glorious! Truly, you are among the champions of the Alliance."}
end)(AscensionCN.QuestData)
;(function(Q)
Q[13178]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;来到冬拥堡垒，$n。督军加罗什只要求一件事：把他们全部杀光！\n\n当十名联盟最强的成员死去后，回来见我。",dEN="Welcome to the Wintergrasp Fortress, <name>. Warlord Garrosh demands one thing: Slay them all!\n\nReturn to me when ten of the strongest members of the Alliance are dead.",o="冬拥堡垒的指挥官达尔多什要你去杀死10个联盟玩家。",oEN="Commander Dardosh in Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to slay 10 members of the Alliance.",p="嗯，你完成你的任务了吗？",pEN="Well, have you completed your mission?",c="为了部落！部落必胜！",cEN="Lok'tar! Victory for the Horde!"}
Q[13179]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;来到冬拥，$n。你的任务很简单。击败十名部落的精锐。现在，去吧！为联盟带来胜利！",dEN="Welcome to the Wintergrasp, <name>. Your mission is simple. Defeat ten of the Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!",o="冬拥湖的指挥官萨纳斯要你去杀死10个部落士兵。",oEN="Commander Zanneth in Wintergrasp wants you to slay 10 members of the Horde.",p="嗯，你完成你的任务了吗？",pEN="Well, have you completed your mission?",c="光荣无比！真的，你是联盟的精英。",cEN="Glorious! Truly, you are among the champions of the Alliance."}
Q[13180]={d="$gBienvenido:Bienvenida;来到冬拥，$n。督军加罗什想请你办一件事：把他们全部杀光！\n\n当十名联盟最强的成员死去后，回到这里来。",dEN="Welcome to the Wintergrasp, <name>. Warlord Garrosh demands one thing: Slay them all!\n\nReturn to me when ten of the strongest members of the Alliance are dead.",o="冬拥湖的指挥官达尔多什要你去杀死10个联盟玩家。",oEN="Commander Dardosh in Wintergrasp wants you to slay 10 members of the Alliance.",p="嗯，你完成你的任务了吗？",pEN="Well, have you completed your mission?",c="为了部落！部落必胜！",cEN="Lok'tar! Victory for the Horde!"}
Q[13181]={d="如果你能让指挥官萨纳斯看到一大堆部落士兵的尸体，他或许会感到满意，但是对于无畏远征军而言，控制冬拥湖才是最重要的目标。你一定要保证我们拥有对这个地区的控制权。\n\n但是，不要以为你只需要躲在一边发呆，让你的盟友去冲锋陷阵就行了。如果你在战斗结束的时候没有达到至少第二级的军衔，就别回来见我。",dEN="Commander Zanneth might be satisfied with a pile of Horde corpses at his feet, but controlling Wintergrasp is of the utmost importance to the Valiance Expedition. Make sure it remains in our control.\n\nHowever, don't think we'll just let you stand around while your allies do your dirty work for you. If you're not at least a second level recruit by the end of the battle, don't come back.",o="取得一场冬拥湖战斗的胜利，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官安布拉米斯复命。你必须亲自参与战斗，才能获得胜利后的奖励。",oEN="Win a Wintergrasp battleground match and return to Tactical Officer Abrahmis in Wintergrasp. You must have participated in the battle to be credited for the victory.",p="你带来胜利的消息吗？",pEN="Do you bring word of victory?",c="正是我想听到的！冬拥湖的大胜——即使是暂时的——对于我们对抗部落的全盘战略都十分重要。",cEN="Just what I wanted to hear! A victory in Lake Wintergrasp - even a temporary one - is crucial to our overall strategy against the Horde."}
Q[13182]={d="艾卓-尼鲁布里面布满了天灾蛛魔细心呵护的卵，它们很快就会孵化，进一步扩充天灾蛛魔的规模。\n\n就算我们把洞中的亡灵都干掉，但是倘若留着那些蛛卵的话，等它们孵化出来之后，一切又将会到老样子。\n\n当你去艾卓-尼鲁布探险时，记得清理掉你在我们那座古老的家园中找到的所有天灾蛛魔之卵。",dEN="Throughout Azjol-Nerub, the scourged nerubians carefully nurture eggs that will soon hatch, providing them even greater numbers.\n\nIt would do little good for the caverns to be cleansed of the undead that stain them if these fouled eggs were left to hatch and take their place.\n\nAs you explore the expanse that was once Azjol-Nerub, be sure to clear our ancient home of any scourge eggs you find.",o="纳尔苏深渊的拆解者基里克斯希望你转至艾卓-尼鲁布，摧毁6枚天灾蛛魔之卵。",oEN="Kilix the Unraveler in the Pit of Narjun wants you to enter Azjol-Nerub and destroy 6 Nerubian Scourge Eggs.",p="你有清除掉那些天灾蛋吗？",pEN="Were you able to rid our home of the scourged eggs?",c="家乡沦落至此境地，令我感到悲伤不已。如果我们能回到曾一度辉煌帝国时代……",cEN="It saddens me to see that things have come to this. If only we could return our great empire to what it once was..."}
Q[13183]={d="虽然只要你能不断杀敌，达尔多什就会感到满意，但是对于我们来说，控制冬拥堡垒才是最重要的目标。你一定要保证我们拥有对这个地区的控制权。\n\n但是，不要以为你只需要躲在一边发呆，让你的盟友去冲锋陷阵就行了。如果你在战斗结束的时候没有达到至少第二级的军衔，就别回来见我。",dEN="While Dardosh might be content with slaying our foes, it is of the utmost importance that we control Wintergrasp Fortress. Do whatever it takes to ensure Wintergrasp is ours.\n\nHowever, don't think we'll just let you stand around while your allies do your dirty work for you. If you're not at least a second level recruit by the end of the battle, don't come back.",o="赢得一场冬拥湖战斗的胜利，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官基尔拉斯复命。你必须亲自参与战斗，才能获得胜利后的奖励。",oEN="Win a Wintergrasp battleground match and return to Tactical Officer Kilrath in Wintergrasp. You must have participated in the battle to gain credit for the victory.",p="你带来什么消息？",pEN="What news do you bring?",c="你今日的成就是真正的功勋。你的牺牲将会被永载史册！",cEN="It is a truly great thing you have accomplished this day. Be recognized for your sacrifice!"}
Q[13185]={d="我听见了！联盟很快就要来了。去摧毁三辆联盟攻城器械，然后回来向莫普复命。",dEN="I hears dem! The Alliance come soon. Destroy three Alliance siege devices and come back to Murp.",o="冬拥堡垒的莫普中尉要你摧毁3辆联盟攻城器械。",oEN="Lieutenant Murp in Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to destroy 3 Alliance siege machines.",p="你摧毁他们的攻城载具了吗？",pEN="Have you destroyed their siege vehicles?",c="干得好。莫普也希望能在场帮忙。",cEN="Good job. Murp wish he was there to help."}
Q[13186]={d="部落迟早会开始对这座堡垒发动攻势的。去摧毁他们的三辆攻城器械，然后回来向我复命。",dEN="It is only a matter of time before this castle is besieged by the forces of the Horde. Destroy three of their siege devices and return to me.",o="冬拥堡垒的资深攻城技师雷格索要你摧毁3辆部落攻城器械。",oEN="Senior Demolitionist Legoso in Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to destroy 3 Horde siege machines.",p="没有时间可以浪费了，你摧毁他们的攻城载具了吗？",pEN="There is no time to waste, have you destroyed their siege vehicles?",c="很好。这会迟滞他们的攻势。",cEN="Excellent. That should slow down their assault."}
Q[13187]={d="在与亡灵势力的斗争中，我的族人节节败退，越挖越深。绝望之中，他们挖得太深了。\n\n我们无意中揭开了一位上古之神意志的一根触须，它以那些只被称为无面者的生物显现。\n\n最终，我们无法同时对抗两个如此强大的敌人。这场不幸让我们输掉了对抗亡灵的战争，最终也失去了家园。\n\n进入安卡赫特，，把我们昔日的家园从这些无面的暴行中净化干净。",dEN="In my peoples' struggle against the forces of the undead, they dug deeper as they lost ground. In desperation, they dug too deep.\n\nWe inadvertently exposed a tendril of the old god's will, which was made manifest in the creatures known only as the Faceless.\n\nIn the end, we could not fight on two fronts against such powerful enemies. Our misfortune cost us the war against the undead, and ultimately, our home.\n\nEnter Ahn'kahet, <class>, and cleanse our former home of these Faceless atrocities.",o="纳尔苏深渊的拆解者基里克斯要你去杀死安卡赫特的传令官沃拉兹和他身边的3个被遗忘的无面者。",oEN="Kilix the Unraveler in the Pit of Narjun wants you to kill Herald Volazj and the three Forgotten Ones that accompany him in Ahn'Kahet.",p="你战胜那些无面者了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you overcome the faceless ones, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n愿你的功绩为我族人重燃希望，让我们有朝一日能夺回祖先的城市。",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nMay your deeds renew hope for our people, that someday we may reclaim the city of our ancestors."}
Q[13188]={d="你现在是，将来也永远是黑锋骑士团的一名骑士，$gun:una;{None}，但你要知道：你曾是联盟的英雄。$n$gun héroe:una heroína;{None}\n\n<Darion te mira fijamente.>这个骑士团若要存续，就必须为自己建立盟友。你必须代表黑锋骑士团与联盟交涉。\n\n在我东南方的平台上，有一道通往暴风城的传送门。拿着这封信——弗丁大人为你说项而交给我的——把它呈给瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王。使用那道传送门。\n\n",dEN="You are now, and forever will be, a Knight of the Ebon Blade, <name>, but know this: you were once a hero of the Alliance.\n\n<Darion stares at you.>\n\nThis order must establish allies for itself if it is to survive. You must represent the Knights of the Ebon Blade to the Alliance.\n\nOn the platform, southeast of me, is a portal to Stormwind City. Take this letter, given to me on your behalf by Lord Fordring, and deliver it to King Varian Wrynn. Use the portal.",o="转至暴风城的暴风要塞，将信交给联盟的瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王。",oEN="Deliver the letter to King Varian Wrynn of the Alliance at Stormwind Keep in Stormwind City.",p="你只有几秒钟的时间可活。",pEN="You have mere moments to live.",c="<瓦里安望向远方。>\n\n真正的老友……鲜血与荣耀。\n\n<瓦里安的目光转向你。>\n\n要不是提里奥的这封信，你现在已经成了地板上的一滩血迹。只有史上最伟大圣骑士的推荐信才能确保你的性命。\n\n我们……我们将会同心协力对抗天灾军团。对抗巫妖王！\n\n荣耀归于联盟！",cEN="<Varian stares off into the distance.>\n\nIndeed old friend... Blood and honor.\n\n<Varian affixes his gaze upon you.>\n\nWere it not for this letter from Tirion, you would be a stain upon my floor. Only an endorsement from one of the greatest paladins to ever live could have ensured your survival.\n\nWe... We will work together against the Scourge. Against the Lich King!\n\nGLORY TO THE ALLIANCE!"}
Q[13189]={d="你现在是，将来也永远是黑锋骑士团的一名骑士，$gun:una;{None}，但你要知道：你曾是部落的英雄。$n$gun héroe:una heroína;{None}\n\n<Darion te mira fijamente.>这个骑士团若要存续，就必须为自己建立盟友。你必须代表黑锋骑士团与部落交涉。\n\n在我东南方的平台上，有一道通往奥格瑞玛的传送门。拿着这封信——弗丁大人为你说项而交给我的——把它呈给大酋长。使用那道传送门。\n\n",dEN="You are now, and forever will be, a Knight of the Ebon Blade, <name>, but know this: you were once a hero of the Horde.\n\n<Darion stares at you.>\n\nThis order must establish allies for itself if it is to survive. You must represent the Knights of the Ebon Blade to the Horde.\n\nOn the platform, southeast of me, is a portal to Orgrimmar. Take this letter, given to me on your behalf by Lord Fordring, and deliver it to Thrall. Use the portal.",o="转至奥格瑞玛，将信交给部落的萨尔酋长。",oEN="Deliver the letter to Thrall, Warchief of the Horde at Orgrimmar.",p="事情发生了有趣的转变。",pEN="An interesting turn of events.",c="伊崔格能活下来，全靠这位圣骑士。若不是弗丁大人把他从斯坦索姆救出来，他早就被处决了。\n\n提里奥·弗丁，为了救一个兽人而牺牲一切……我只认识另一位做出如此牺牲的人类。\n\n<Thrall parpadea para contener una lágrima>\n\n你永远在我心里，塔蕾莎。\n\n是的。为了提里奥·弗丁，也为了伊崔格！我们接受你为部落的一员，也接受你的骑士团为盟友。\n\n鲜血与荣耀！为了部落！",cEN="Eitrigg is alive because of this paladin. He would have been executed had Lord Fordring not broken him out of Stratholme.\n\nTirion Fordring, to have sacrificed everything to save the life of an orc... I have ever only known one other human to make such a sacrifice.\n\n<Thrall blinks back a tear.>\n\nYou will be in my heart always, Taretha.\n\nYes. For Tirion Fordring and for Eitrigg! We will accept you as a member of the Horde and your order as allies.\n\nBlood and honor! For the Horde!"}
Q[13190]={d="安卡赫特，我们的起源之地……\n\n我梦想着有一天可以战胜那些笼罩着我们古老家园的死亡和黑暗的力量。为了让我的梦想变为现实，我想到一个计划，可以动摇敌人的军心。\n\n我们要烧死他们那珍贵的看守者！\n\n在城市深处的火盆上焚烧他们的尸体，让那种味道在空气中弥漫，让我们的敌人知道其实他们是如此的不堪一击。\n\n记住，$c！那些亡灵的尸体非常易碎，而且会很快腐坏。",dEN="Ahn'kahet, from whence we came...\n\nOne day, I dream, we shall overcome the death and darkness that hold our ancient home in their grip. To that end, I have a plan to weaken the resolve of our enemies.\n\nTheir precious Watchers must burn!\n\nTake their corpses and place them upon the brazier deep within the city. The scent of their burnt remains will linger in the air, reminding our enemy of their weakness.\n\nBe mindful, <class>! Their undead corpses are most fragile and will deteriorate rapidly.",o="纳尔苏深渊的拆解者基里克斯希望你弄到一具安卡哈看守者的尸体，将其放在安卡赫特的安卡赫特火盆上焚烧。\n\n这个任务只能在英雄难度下完成。",oEN="Kilix the Unraveler in the Pit of Narjun wants you to obtain an Ahn'kahar Watcher's Corpse and place it upon the Ahn'kahet Brazier in Ahn'kahet.\n\nThis quest can only be completed on Heroic Difficulty.",p="你烧掉一具看守者的尸体了吗，<race>？",pEN="Were you able to burn a Watcher's corpse, <race>?",c="啊哈！\n\n愿失败那嘲讽的气味啃噬他们空虚的灵魂！\n\n谢谢你，<class>。今天，你给那些亡灵狠狠地一击。",cEN="Ahah!\n\nMay the mocking scent of failure eat at their empty souls!\n\nThank you, <class>. Today, you have struck a blow against the unliving."}
Q[13191]={d="Lok'tar，$n！虽然战事暂时平息了，但我们必须为抵御联盟的攻击做好准备！到冬拥湖东南方的烈焰之坑去，弄一些永恒灰烬回来。\n\n这种灰烬里含有煤炭，可以充当攻城车辆的燃料。\n\n我们得到情报，联盟的猪猡整天都在收集这种灰烬。杀了他们，把他们手里的灰烬抢过来！如果他们撤出了那个地区，你就去干掉一些火元素，夺取灰烬！",dEN="Lok'tar, <name>! While the battle may be over, we must prepare for the Alliance's next assault! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in south eastern Wintergrasp and retrieve ten eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to fuel the Demolishers and Siege Engines.\n\nWe've heard reports of Alliance pigs collecting the embers all day. Slay them and take their embers! If they have already abandoned the area, then be prepared to fight the fire elementals there until you find some!",o="冬拥堡垒的攻城技师斯托霍夫要你转至烈焰之坑，收集10份永恒灰烬。",oEN="Siegesmith Stronghoof at Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 Eternal Embers from Alliance players in the Cauldron of Flames.",p="嗯哼？你是不是被联盟打败，余烬被抢走了，只能蹲在路边哭？",pEN="Well? Did you manage to find the embers or did the Alliance beat you to it and leave you crying?",c="很好！这会让我们在不久就会到来的战斗中，击败联盟！",cEN="Excellent! This will help us defeat the Alliance in the battles to come!"}
Q[13192]={d="嘿，老兄。这地方让我浑身发毛，你知道吗？\n\n太多亡魂在这地方游荡了。我想立几道巫毒结界，可我需要一些灵魂，老兄。不过不是什么灵魂都行，得是强大战士的灵魂才能成事。\n\n冬拥东部的冰川瀑布有提取灵魂的特殊属性。在那里杀掉联盟，也许他们身上就有我们要的东西。\n\n把被杀者的护甲带回来。要是没有联盟，也许元素生物身上也有，老兄。$gtron:titi;",dEN="Hey 'mon. This place be givin' me dah heebie jeebies, don't cha know?\n\nWay too many spirits haunting dis place. I want ta be placing hoodoo wards up, but I be needin' some souls, mon. Not any soul though, only da soul of a strong warrior could do da job.\n\nThe Glacial Falls in east Wintergrasp be havin' dem special properties to extract da soul. Slay the Alliance there, mebbe they be havin' the stuff we need.\n\nBring back da armor of the slain. If there be no Alliance maybe da elementals got 'em, mon.",o="冬拥堡垒的邪咒师弗尔金要你转至冰川瀑布，收集10套灌魔的联盟护甲。",oEN="Hoodoo Master Fu'jin at Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 Enchanted Alliance Breastplates at the Glacial Falls.",p="你带回护甲了的吗，老兄？",pEN="Did ya bring da armor, mon?",c="噢，你弄回来我的东西的啦，老兄！",cEN="Ooh, ya dats da stuff, mon!"}
Q[13193]={d="他们干嘛非要派我来武装弓箭手呢？我是个吟游诗人，不是游侠！唉，抱怨是没有用的。$n，我需要一些制作箭头用的龙骨。\n\n你可以到冬拥湖西边的阴影森林去找。自从上次战斗过后，联盟就在那里搜集龙骨。杀了他们，夺走他们手中的龙骨。\n\n如果这招不管用，你或许可以从那里的幽灵身上得到一些。我听说他们喜欢用龙骨把猎物穿起来。",dEN="Why would they set me to the task of arming our archers? I was a poet, not a ranger! Well, no use complaining. <name>, I am in need of dragon bone for our arrowheads.\n\nTravel to the Forest of Shadows on the western side of Wintergrasp. Ever since the last skirmish, the Alliance have been scavenging dragon bones in the area. Slay them and take the bones.\n\nIf that fails, you might be lucky and get one from the spirits in the area. I hear they love to impale their living victims on the bones as they die.",o="冬拥堡垒的维尔隆·火羽要你转至阴影森林，从联盟玩家那里抢夺10支龙骨箭。",oEN="Lieutenant Vieron Blazefeather at Wintergrasp Fortress wants you to retrieve 10 Quivers of Dragonbone Arrows from Alliance players in the Forest of Shadows.",p="这么快就回来了？可恶，我才想要休息一下的。",pEN="Back so soon? Drat, I was hoping to catch a moment's rest.",c="嗯哼，我猜又是一个削骨头的夜晚了。为什么我不要像我哥一样待在银月城呢？",cEN="Well, I guess its another night of sharpening bones for me. Why didn't I stay in Silvemoon City like my brother?"}
Q[13194]={d="在战斗的间隙中，人们或许仍会相信和平终究会降临这片土地。可惜的是，我们注定无法享受和平的生活。\n\n请你到冬拥湖西南部的生命草原去一趟。我需要那里生长的一种玫瑰，它可以用来制作疗伤药膏。\n\n但是，由于联盟的频繁采摘，这种玫瑰已经非常稀有了。杀死生命草原上的联盟成员，从他们身上夺取草药。\n\n如果这不管用，那么你或许还可以找那里的鞭笞者碰碰运气。",dEN="Between the battles, one might almost believe that there was hope for peace in this land. Sadly, that is not to be our fate.\n\nTravel to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp. I have need of the roses that grow there for salve to treat the wounded.\n\nSadly, the rose has become scarce due to the Alliance harvesting it too rapidly. Slay them on the Steppe of Life and retrieve their herb pouches from the bodies.\n\nIf that fails, perhaps a lasher or two might have one.",o="指挥官莫弗尔特要你转至生命草原，收集10只联盟草药包。",oEN="Primalist Mulfort wants you to retrieve 10 Alliance Herb Pouches from Alliance players at the Steppe of Life.",p="你有采回药草吗？伤兵与病人又增加了。",pEN="Were you able to recover the herbs? The sick and wounded increase by the hour.",c="感谢你，这对治疗我们士兵的伤口有很大助益。",cEN="Thank you, this will go far to treat our soldier's wounds."}
Q[13195]={d="天啊，这里可真冷！让我想起了阿古斯上的风雪交加的凯因努斯雪山。在这冰天雪地中，我们的士兵很容易感冒。\n\n到冬拥湖西南方的生命草原去，帮我从部落的成员手中抢10个部落草药包来，我会把它们制成抵御寒气的药物。\n\n有人看见部落也在那一地区收集草药。尽管杀了他们，把草药抢过来！\n\n那里的鞭笞者身上可能也有这东西。",dEN="My, it is quite chilly up here! Reminds me of the stormy peaks of Kaarinos on Argus. However, with all of this snow and ice, our soldiers can easily catch cold.\n\nHead to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp, and bring me back 10 Horde Herb Pouches. I will grind the herbs into a medicine to protect against the cold.\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting them from the plant life in the area. Do not hesitate to slay them and retrieve the herbs!\n\nYou may also find one on a lasher in the area.",o="冬拥湖的学者特尔萨要你转至生命草原，收集10只部落草药包。",oEN="Anchorite Tessa in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Horde Herb Pouches from Horde players in the Steppe of Life.",p="我希望你没有不小心惹到任何鞭笞者！上星期它们让我们的士兵吃了好一顿鞭子。",pEN="I hope you didn't pull up any of the lashers by mistake! They gave Private Doane quite a whipping last week.",c="太棒了！这将能协助我们的部队对抗严寒。",cEN="Excellent! This will help protect our troops against the cold."}
Q[13196]={d="龙这种生物真是个奇迹！好吧，至少它们的骨头是个奇迹！我给弓箭手们配备了龙骨制作的箭头。可惜，自从安加萨发生大屠杀以后，就很难从龙骨荒野弄到龙骨了。\n\n不过冬拥湖西边的阴影森林里也有不少龙骨，足够我们用的了。\n\n你现在就到阴影森林去，把你能找到的所有骨片都拿回来！\n\n有人看见部落也在那个地区收集骨片。去杀了那些部落渣滓！",dEN="Dragons are incredible! Well, their bones at least! I've been equipping our archers with arrowheads made of Dragonbone. Unfortunately, since the massacre at Angrathar, it has become almost impossible to get bone from Dragonblight.\n\nHowever, the Forest of Shadows on the western edge of Wintergrasp has enough bones to tide us over.\n\nHead to the Forest of Shadows and bring back any bone splinters you can find!\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting bone splinters in the area. Slay them!",o="冬拥湖的制弓师兰多尔弗要你转至阴影森林，从部落玩家那里抢夺10支龙骨箭。",oEN="Bowyer Randolph in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Quivers of Dragonbone Arrows from Horde players at the Forest of Shadows.",p="狩猎的结果如何？我听到一些谣言，说那里闹鬼，虽然我不曾亲自去那里冒险。",pEN="How was the hunting? I've heard rumors the place is haunted, though I never venture out there myself.",c="非常好！这将有助我们，在不久就会到来的战斗中，燃起熊熊的战争烈焰。",cEN="Excellent! This will help fuel the flames of war for days to come."}
Q[13197]={d="$n！你总算来了。虽然我们在上一场战斗中失利了，但还是应该为下一场战斗做好准备！到冬拥湖东南方的烈焰之坑去，弄一些永恒灰烬回来。\n\n这种灰烬里含有煤炭，可以充当攻城车辆的燃料。\n\n哦，对了，如果你在烈焰之坑遇到部落的渣滓，尽管杀了他们，把他们手里的灰烬抢过来。绝对不能让他们占据堡垒！",dEN="<name>! About time you showed up. While we may have lost the last battle, we should prepare for the next! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in southeastern Wintergrasp and retrieve several eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to fuel the Demolisher and Siege Engines.\n\nOh, and if you happen to see some of the Horde in the Cauldron, don't hesitate to slay them and take their embers. We must prevent them from holding the keep!",o="冬拥湖的攻城大师斯托汉德要你转至烈焰之坑，收集10份永恒灰烬。",oEN="Siegesmith Stouthandle in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Eternal Embers from Horde players at the Cauldron of Flames.",p="嗯哼？你是不是被部落打败，余烬被抢走了，只能蹲在路边哭？",pEN="Well? Did you manage to find the embers or did the Horde beat you to it and leave you crying?",c="非常好！这将有助我们，在不久就会到来的战斗中，燃起熊熊的战争烈焰。",cEN="Excellent! This will help fuel the flames of war for days to come."}
Q[13198]={d="很高兴见到你，$n。我们必须为下一波攻势做好准备。经过调查，我发现死在冰川瀑布附近的士兵身上的护甲都因为当地的特殊环境的关系，被附上了巨大的能量。部落已经在那里收集这种护甲了。\n\n到冰川瀑布去，杀死你所遇到的部落成员。把他们手中那些灌魔的护甲拿来给我。\n\n如果你找不到部落的士兵，也许可以在那里的元素生物身上发现被它们杀死的冒险者的护甲。",dEN="<name>, good to see you. We must prepare for our next assault on the fortress. My research indicates that the armor of soldiers recently slain in the Glacial Falls becomes imbued with an incredible amount of energy. The Horde has been collecting armor in the area.\n\nHead to the Glacial Falls and slay any of the Horde you find there. Return their imbued armor to me.\n\nIf you cannot find any of the Horde, you might find the armor of an adventurer slain by the elementals.",o="冬拥湖的女巫凯兰娜要你要你转至冰川瀑布，收集10套灌魔的部落护甲。",oEN="Sorceress Kaylana in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 sets of Imbued Horde Armor at the Glacial Falls.",p="嗯，你有找到护甲吗？",pEN="So, did you find the armor?",c="噢。它还在滴水耶。你就不能先把它弄干吗？",cEN="Augh. It's still dripping. Couldn't you have at least dried it off first?"}
Q[13199]={d="他们干嘛非要派我来武装弓箭手呢？我是个吟游诗人，不是游侠！唉，抱怨是没有用的。$n，我需要一些制作箭头用的龙骨。\n\n你可以到冬拥湖西边的阴影森林去找。自从上次战斗过后，联盟就在那里搜集龙骨。杀了他们，夺走他们手中的龙骨。\n\n如果这招不管用，你或许可以从那里的幽灵身上得到一些。我听说他们喜欢用龙骨把猎物穿起来。",dEN="Why would they set me to the task of arming our archers? I was a poet, not a ranger! Well, no use complaining. <name>, I am in need of dragon bone for our arrowheads.\n\nTravel to the Forest of Shadows on the western side of Wintergrasp. Ever since the last skirmish, the Alliance have been scavenging dragon bones in the area. Slay them and take the bones.\n\nIf that fails, you might be lucky and get one from the spirits in the area. I hear they love to impale their living victims on the bones as they die.",o="冬拥湖的维尔隆·火羽要你转至阴影森林，从联盟玩家那里抢夺10支龙骨箭。",oEN="Lieutenant Vieron Blazefeather in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Quivers of Dragonbone Arrows from Alliance players at the Forest of Shadows.",p="这么快就回来了？可恶，我才想要休息一下的。",pEN="Back so soon? Drat, I was hoping to catch a moment's rest.",c="嗯哼，我猜又是一个削尖骨头的夜晚了。为什么我不要像我哥一样待在银月城呢？",cEN="Well, I guess its another night of sharpening bones for me. Why didn't I stay in Silvemoon City like my brother?"}
Q[13200]={d="Lok'tar，$n！虽然战事暂时平息了，但我们必须为夺回堡垒做好准备！到冬拥湖东南方的烈焰之坑去，弄一些永恒灰烬回来。\n\n这种灰烬里含有煤炭，可以充当攻城车辆的燃料。\n\n我们得到情报，联盟的猪猡整天都在收集这种灰烬。杀了他们，把他们手里的灰烬抢过来！如果他们撤出了那个地区，你就去干掉一些火元素，夺取灰烬！",dEN="Lok'tar, <name>! While the battle may have subsided, we must prepare to retake the fortress! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in south eastern Wintergrasp and retrieve ten eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to fuel the Demolishers and Siege Engines.\n\nWe've heard reports of Alliance pigs collecting the embers all day. Slay them and take their embers! If they have already abandoned the area, then be prepared to fight the fire elementals there until you find some!",o="冬拥湖的攻城技师斯托霍夫要你转至烈焰之坑，收集10份永恒灰烬。",oEN="Siegesmith Stronghoof in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Eternal Embers from Alliance players at the Cauldron of Flames.",p="嗯哼？你是不是被联盟打败，余烬被抢走了，只能蹲在路边哭？",pEN="Well? Did you manage to find the embers or did the Alliance beat you to it and leave you crying?",c="太棒了！那一定会让他们的战争机器寸步难行！",cEN="Excellent! That should put a dent in their war machines!"}
Q[13201]={d="在战斗中，我们损失了许多勇士。但是如果缺医少药，我们还会失去更多的同胞。\n\n请你到冬拥湖西南部的生命草原去一趟。我需要那里生长的一种玫瑰，它可以用来制作疗伤药膏。\n\n但是，由于联盟的频繁采摘，这种玫瑰已经非常稀有了。杀死生命草原上的联盟成员，从他们身上夺取草药包。\n\n如果这不管用，那么你或许还可以找那里的鞭笞者碰碰运气。",dEN="So many of our braves were lost during the battle, but even more shall die if left untreated.\n\nTravel to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp. I have need of the roses that grow there for salve to treat the wounded.\n\nSadly, the rose has become scarce due to the Alliance harvesting it too rapidly. Slay them on the Steppe of Life and retrieve their herb pouches from the bodies.\n\nIf that fails, perhaps a lasher or two might be in bloom.",o="冬拥湖的指挥官莫弗尔特要你转至生命草原，收集10只联盟草药包。",oEN="Primalist Mulfort in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Alliance Herb Pouches from Alliance players at the Steppe of Life.",p="你有采回药草吗？伤兵与病人又增加了。",pEN="Were you able to recover the herbs? The sick and wounded increase by the hour.",c="感谢你，这对治疗我们士兵的伤口有很大助益。",cEN="Thank you, this will go far to treat our soldiers' wounds."}
Q[13202]={d="嘿，$gtron:titi;。看见那些舒舒服服待在要塞里的联盟了吗？\n\n我觉得他们太舒服了点，是吧？我想给那地方下个咒，可我需要一些灵魂，$gtron:titi;。不过不是什么灵魂都行，我需要一个强大战士的灵魂才能成事。\n\n冬拥东部的冰川瀑布有提取这些灵魂的特殊属性。杀掉那里的联盟，他们身上就有我们要的东西。\n\n把死者的护甲带给我。要是没有联盟成员，也许能从元素生物身上弄到，$gtío:tía;。",dEN="Hey 'mon. See dem Alliance sitting comfy in their keep?\n\nI think they be a bit too comfy, ya? I want ta be jinxing the place, but I be needin' some souls, mon. Not any soul though, only da soul of a strong warrior could do da job.\n\nThe Glacial Falls in east Wintergrasp be havin' dem special properties to extract da soul. Slay the Alliance there, they be havin' the stuff we need.\n\nBring back da armor of the slain. If there be no Alliance maybe da elementals got 'em, mon.",o="冬拥湖的邪咒师弗尔金要你转至冰川瀑布，从联盟玩家那里收集10套灌魔的联盟护甲。",oEN="Hoodoo Master Fu'jin in Wintergrasp wants you to retrieve 10 Enchanted Alliance Breastplates from Alliance players at the Glacial Falls.",p="你带回护甲了的吗，老兄？",pEN="Did ya bring da armor, mon?",c="噢，你弄回来我的东西的啦，老兄！",cEN="Ooh, ya dats da stuff, mon!"}
Q[13204]={d="一只奇形怪状的蘑菇状的真菌从一块散发着强烈异味、被软泥包裹的洞穴兽的肉上掉了下来。在检查这只蘑菇的时候，你被它散发出的恶臭熏得晕头转向。\n\n你不由得猜想，也许这是蛛魔们首选的某种美食？你决定找出这块有机物的真相，于是把它放在了包裹里。",dEN="A misshapen piece of mushroom-like fungus falls from a particularly smelly, ooze-covered patch of the cave beast's flesh. Examining it, you are violently repulsed by its overwhelming stench.\n\nYou wonder to yourself if this is the kind of thing that the nerubians might find appetizing. Placing the sticky organism in your pack, you determine to find out...",o="从安卡赫特的野蛮洞穴兽那里收集6只奇异的蘑菇，然后把它们交给纳尔苏深渊的拆解者基里克斯。",oEN="You are to collect 6 Grotesque Fungus from Savage Cave Beasts in Ahn'kahet and deliver them to Kilix the Unraveler in The Pit of Narjun.",p="这些是什么鬼东西？！",pEN="What in creation are these?!",c="你知道自己一直在搬弄什么吗，<class>？\n\n你采集的那些洞穴野兽没有传统的排泄方式。你也许该去洗洗手……\n\n谢谢你的好意，但如果你再碰到这种东西，请留给自己吧。",cEN="Do you have any idea what you've been carrying around, <class>?\n\nThe cave beasts you've been harvesting have no traditional method of excreting their waste. You might want to wash your hands...\n\nThank you for the thought, but if you come across any more of these please keep them for yourself."}
Q[13205]={d="相信我，$g小伙子:姑娘，维库人的武器是非常致命的！\n\n我尝过他们武器的厉害，那简直是鬼斧神工。完美的设计，锋利的利刃——非常致命。\n\n如果你没有其它事可做的话，到他们的城堡里面去偷一些武器出来如何？或许我们可以从他们的武器设计中学到些什么。\n\n就算学不到什么东西，让他们少几把斧子用，总是好的。",dEN="Take it from me, <lad/lass>, them vrykul weapons be downright nasty!\n\nI've felt their edge personally, and there be somethin' unnatural about 'em. Deceptively well-balanced, wickedly sharp - just plain deadly.\n\nGet into their stronghold and if nuthin' else, pilfer some o' them weapons! Mebbe we can learn us a thing 'er two about 'em, mebbe not.\n\nBottom line - the fewer axes they be swingin' around, the better.",o="防御者墨尔顿要你进入乌特加德城堡，偷取5把维库武器。",oEN="Defender Mordun wants you to enter Utgarde Keep and steal 5 Vrykul Weapons",p="你弄来些维库武器了吗？",pEN="You pinch a load a' them vrykul axes?",c="<墨尔顿压低声音。>\n\n瞧瞧它们一眼？真不可思议。\n\n我期待那些原始人从此只能挥舞木棒和丢掷石头。\n\n不过还是别做白日梦了……",cEN="<Mordun whistles.>\n\nWill ya just look at 'em? Incredible.\n\nI half expected these neanderthals to be swingin' around clubs and throwin' rock.\n\nNo such luck..."}
Q[13206]={d="我们必须弄清这些野蛮人的武器有什么秘密！\n\n要是你见过它们多么轻易地刺穿我的同伴，你就会明白我为什么这么急。要是你怀疑我的话，就去看看他们的锻造炉。\n\n搜遍这个地方。把你能搬动的武器全都收集起来，带给安塞尔姆检查。别让我们失望，。你能从这地方带出的每一件武器，都是我们在战场上要少面对的一件。",dEN="We must discover the secret to these savages' weapons!\n\nIf you'd have seen how easily they cut through my companions, you'd understand my sense of urgency. Just have a look at their forge if you doubt my words.\n\nScour the place. Gather all of their arms that you can carry and bring them to Anselm for his inspection.\n\nDo not fail us, <class>. Every weapon you are able to bring out of this place is one less that we must face in the field.",o="黑暗游侠玛尔拉要你从乌特加德城堡中偷出5把维库武器，并把它们交给复仇港的高级执行官安希尔姆。",oEN="Dark Ranger Marrah wants you to steal 5 Vrykul Weapons from Utgarde Keep and bring them to High Executor Anselm in Vengeance Landing.",p="你那儿拿着什么，<class>？",pEN="What have you got there, <class>?",c="玛拉已经告诉我们维库人的武器更为优越。我们来看看这些，看有没有什么可学的。\n\n拿上这个，算是给你的辛苦费，<class>。",cEN="Marrah has informed us of the superiority of the Vrykul's weaponry. We'll have a look at these and see if there's anything to learn.\n\nTake this for your trouble, <class>."}
Q[13207]={d="哦，真没想到会在这种地方遇到别的冒险者！说来也巧，前面的路我正需要个伴儿。\n\n如果我对这些厅堂的研究没错，这里还有重大的发现等着被揭开！\n\n只要我能指望你帮我看着背后，欢迎你同行。怎么样，？愿意跟我一起吗？",dEN="Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as this! It so happens that I could use a bit o' company for what lies ahead.\n\nIf my research on these halls is accurate, there be monumental discoveries to be made here!\n\nAssumin' I can count on ya to watch my back, you're welcome to tag along. So, what'dya say, <class>? Care ta join me?",o="布莱恩·铜须希望你能与他结伴而行，揭开岩石大厅的秘密。",oEN="Brann Bronzebeard wants you to accompany him as he uncovers the secrets that lie in the Halls of Stone.",p="嗯哼，现在，我们能互相作伴也算是一件好事啦。",pEN="Well, now, it turned out ta be a good thing we ran into each other after all.",c="问题总是比答案多，是吧，<lad/lass>？",cEN="Always more questions than answers, eh, <lad/lass>?"}
Q[13211]={d="天灾军团利用阵亡的北伐军战士对付我们。他们将死者复活成食尸鬼和骷髅，或者将他们的残肢缝合成憎恶。必须阻止他们的这种恶行！\n\n阵亡的战士都是为了保护生者而牺牲的，他们都是英雄，不应该遭遇如此可怕的命运。而且我们也不忍心在战场上面对昔日的战友，与他们兵戎相见。请你带着这支火把转至缝合场，烧毁复生密室和憎恶装配台一带的尸体。",dEN="The Scourge uses our own fallen against us, by raising them as ghouls or skeletons, or by dismembering their corpses and using the parts to make abominations. This must stop!\n\nThe dead are heroes who fell in defense of all the living, and they cannot be confined to so grisly a fate. Moreover, we cannot afford to face them again on the field, used as weapons against us. Take this torch with you to the Fleshwerks, and burn any of the corpses you find in the Sanctum of Reanimation or the abomination lab.",o="黑色观察站的北伐军战士欧尔拉金·萨利斯要你使用欧尔拉金的火炬烧毁7具腐烂的尸体。",oEN="Crusader Olakin Sainrith at Blackwatch wants you to burn 7 Festering Corpses using Olakin's Torch.",p="你处理掉天灾军团受害者的躯体了吗？",pEN="Have you disposed of the corpses of the Scourge's victims?",c="<Crusader Olakin Sainrith escucha solemnemente tu informe.>\n\n这不是他们应得的葬礼，但总比什么都没有好，对活着的人也更好。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="<Crusader Olakin Sainrith listens solemnly to your report.>\n\nIt is not the burial they deserved, but it is better than nothing, and better for those who yet live. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13212]={d="北伐军战士欧尔拉金被劫持后，银色北伐军就没有指挥官可以负责对缝合场的总攻了。虽然所有的北伐军战士对我来说都是一样的，但是银色北伐军不会这么认为。\n\n我讨厌把时间浪费在这种事情上，可是眼下也别无选择了。我们这位英勇的北伐军战士可能已经被肢解，他的残肢多半是被送去制造憎恶了。请你到缝合场去，干掉那些臃肿的怪物，夺回欧尔拉金的遗体。",dEN="With the abduction of Crusader Olakin, the Argent Crusade's forces will have no commander in the final assault on the Fleshwerks. While one crusader is the same as any other to me, the argents won't see it that way.\n\nI hate to see us waste time chasing after this, but I have no choice. Our gallant crusader has likely been dismembered by now, and his remains used to construct abominations. Go down into the Fleshwerks, kill the corpulent horrors fighting our forces, and recover Olakin's body parts.",o="夺回欧尔拉金的躯干、欧尔拉金的腿、欧尔拉金的左臂和欧尔拉金的右臂，将它们交给黑色观察站的黑暗骑士阿尔蕾。",oEN="Recover Olakin's Torso, Olakin's Legs, Olakin's Left Arm, and Olakin's Right Arm and bring them to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch.",p="你找回……额……欧尔拉金的躯体吗？",pEN="Have you recovered the, uh, remains of Crusader Olakin?",c="好吧，我想我们\"找回\"了那位北伐军战士，算是件好事，尽管我怀疑他的同伴们可不是这么想的。我们来看看怎么让他重新站起来，好让我们结束这场闹剧，完成这里的任务。",cEN="Well, I suppose it's good that we've \"recovered\" the crusader, though I doubt his comrades had this in mind. Let's see what we can do to get him back on his feet so we can get this charade over with and complete our mission here."}
Q[13213]={d="我耳闻目睹了许多事，$n。在你击败大领主巴拉加德后，发生了另一件重要的事：瓦哈拉斯要求你去参加决斗！\n\n决斗场就在北面。约上你的朋友，和基尔莉芙谈一谈。她会为你们安排瓦哈拉斯决斗场的对手，你必须借助朋友的力量才有可能获得胜利。\n\n祝你好运。",dEN="I see and hear many things, <name>, and something very important has happened since your defeat of Overthane Balargarde: you are wanted for battle in Valhalas!\n\nYou will find the battle pit to the north. Go now with your friends and speak with Geirrvif the val'kyr. The challengers that she will offer you within Valhalas are sure to require their help.\n\nGood luck.",o="与瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Geirrvif in Valhalas.",c="你击败了我们最精锐的战士。你的名字已广为人知，<name>。\n\n也许你以为这与我有关：并没有。如果他们能败在你手上，那他们就不配，只该是低贱的瓦古。\n\n不过也许我能给你和你的朋友们换个花样。瓦哈拉斯也是进行各种战斗、面对各种敌人的地方。\n\n等你和你的朋友们准备好继续时，再来跟我说话。我们来看看你们是否真的配得上。",cEN="You have bested our finest warriors. Your name is renowned, <name>.\n\nPerhaps you think that this concerns me: it does not. If they can fall to you then they are not worthy and should be nothing but lowly vargul!\n\nBut perhaps I can give you and your friends different sport. Valhalas is also a place for combat of all types with many different kinds of foes.\n\nSpeak to me again when you and your friends are ready to proceed. We shall see if you are truly worthy."}
Q[13214]={d="如果你们准备好了，我就为你们安排一场热身比赛。\n\n喏，另一群外来者曾经以为他们有足够的能耐迎接瓦哈拉斯的残酷战斗。他们非常傲慢，但是最终他们也像其它人一样，可耻地败下阵来。\n\n如果你们坚信自己与众不同——如果你们觉得自己有能力面对这些身经百战的勇士，那么就请接受挑战吧！",dEN="If you believe yourself ready to begin then I have just the match for you to cut your teeth on.\n\nAnother group of outsiders thought themselves prepared for the rigors of Valhalas. They had much hubris, but in the end they fell like all of the others.\n\nIf you think yourselves so different -- if you think that you have the skill and experience to fight here amongst such storied warriors -- then please accept the challenge.",o="瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙要你在一场战斗中击败6名堕落英雄：埃德里斯、基纳斯·半魂、哈达斯、玛苏德、雷希和塔尔拉。\n\n获胜之后到瓦哈拉斯南部场外去，与残忍的亚纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to, in a single combat, defeat all six of the fallen heroes: Eldreth, Geness Half-Soul, Jhadras, Masud, Rith, and Talla.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="新手。\n\n<维库死亡骑士在你脚边吐了一口痰。>\n\n你以为你已经有在这里战斗的资格了。\n\n但你在维库人和天灾军团面前什么也不是！\n\n不过，你能打败六个手无缚鸡之力的死人，也还算是有两把刷子。但是别妄想这样就能挑战下一场决斗。",cEN="New blood.\n\n<The vrykul death knight spits on the ground at your feet.>\n\nYou all think that you have what it takes to fight here.\n\nYou are nothing before the might of the vrykul and the Scourge!\n\nStill, you did manage to defeat six incompetent corpses, so you must have some skill in you. Not likely enough for the next challenge though."}
Q[13215]={d="世界各地的各种生物都想在瓦哈拉斯证明自己的实力，其中甚至包括来自地下世界的挑战者。\n\n比如黑暗主宰西塔利克斯。\n\n西塔利克斯来自疯狂的地下世界，他希望在竞技场中挑战真正有价值的强者。你将成为他的对手。\n\n你敢面对这只噩梦般的蛛魔吗，$r？",dEN="A variety of beings travel the world to prove themselves within Valhalas. Some even come from under the world.\n\nKhit'rix the Dark Master is one such.\n\nHailing from deep within the ground where insanity reigns, Khit'rix has asked for someone exotic to face in the ring. You will do.\n\nDare you face this Nerubian nightmare, <race>?",o="瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙要你击败黑暗主宰西塔利克斯。\n\n获胜之后到瓦哈拉斯南部场外去，与残忍的亚纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to defeat Khit'rix the Dark Master.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="你希望我对你刮目相看，只因为你和你朋友撂倒了只身战斗的蛛魔牧师？\n\n在我召唤我的食尸鬼对付你之前，快滚出我的视线！",cEN="You want me to be impressed by the fact that you and your friends were able to bring down a lone Nerubian priest?\n\nGet out of my sight before I summon my ghouls upon you!"}
Q[13216]={d="你的宿敌齐格莉德·冰魂回来了。你在野蛮之台的战斗中击败了她，还记得吗？\n\n这并不重要，她记得你就是了。齐格莉德坚持要利用这次机会再次证明自己的实力。\n\n我觉得吧，这更像是一场复仇之战，不过瓦哈拉斯接受这样的比赛。\n\n好好考虑吧，$n。你愿意再次面对齐格莉德·冰魂吗？",dEN="An old foe of yours has returned: Sigrid Iceborn. Perhaps you remember besting her in a duel upon the Savage Ledge?\n\nNo matter, she certainly remembers you. She's insisting upon a chance to prove herself once more.\n\nPersonally, I think it's more a chance for revenge, but that too can be useful in this place.\n\nI leave it up to you, <name>. Will you face Sigrid Iceborn once more?",o="瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙要你击败齐格莉德·冰魂。\n\n获胜之后到瓦哈拉斯南部场外去，与残忍的亚纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to defeat Sigrid Iceborn.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="击败一名海德尼尔确实略令人印象深刻，<race>，但你有朋友相助。\n\n算你走运，她的幼龙没有插手。",cEN="The defeat of one of the hyldnir is mildly impressive, <race>, but you did have the help of your friends.\n\nYou're lucky that her drake didn't get involved."}
Q[13217]={d="到目前为止你一直很成功，$n，但要想继续在瓦哈拉斯战斗，你现在必须面对一个超乎想象的恐怖怪物。\n\n我必须警告你现在就转身离开。卡内基是由巫妖王麾下最扭曲的心智拼造而成的一座血肉之山。\n\n我看不出你和你的朋友怎么可能击败它。不过，选择权在你们。",dEN="You've been successful up to this point, <name>, but what you must face to continue to battle within Valhalas is a gigantic horror beyond imagining.\n\nI must warn you to turn away now. Carnage is a mountain of flesh constructed by the Lich King's most fiendish minds.\n\nI do not see how you and your friends will defeat it. However, the choice is yours.",o="瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙要你击败卡纳基。\n\n获胜之后到瓦哈拉斯南部场外去，与残忍的亚纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to defeat Carnage.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="我开始佩服你在竞技场里的本事了，<name>。现在我是真的讨厌你了。\n\n我倒宁愿看到你和你的朋友们粘在那个血肉巨人的脚底上！",cEN="I'm starting to respect your prowess in the ring, <name>. Now I really don't like you.\n\nI would much rather have preferred to see you and your friends stuck to the bottom of that flesh giant's foot!"}
Q[13218]={d="你的本领没能逃过约顿海姆维库人的眼睛，$n。领主巴纳霍格亲自对你产生了兴趣，并坚持要做你的下一个对手。\n\n如果你觉得卡内基已经够糟了，那你现在也许该回家了。领主巴纳霍格的绰号是\"死亡一击\"。我想你能猜到他是怎么得来的。\n\n你接受这位领主的挑战吗？",dEN="Your skills have not gone unnoticed by the vrykul of Jotunheim, <name>. Thane Banahogg has taken a personal interest in you and has insisted that he be your next match.\n\nIf you thought Carnage was bad, then you might want to go home now. Thane Banahogg's nickname is The Deathblow. I think you can guess how he earned it.\n\nDo you accept the thane's challenge?",o="瓦哈拉斯的盖尔维芙向你发起挑战，要你击败领主巴纳霍格，那位\"死亡一击\"。\n\n如果你成功了，就去与俯瞰瓦哈拉斯南缘的无情者格约纳谈谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to defeat Thane Banahogg, the Deathblow.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="我不知道你用了什么花招打倒那位领主——从这个角度我看不清——但我可以向你保证，你活不过下一场比赛。\n\n是的，我知道那是谁。跑吧，小小的<race>。逃到世界的天涯海角去吧。\n\n或者留下来送死。对我来说都无所谓。",cEN="I don't know what trickery it was that you used to bring down the thane -- I couldn't see it from this angle -- but I can assure you that you will not survive your next match.\n\nYes, I know who it is. Run, little <race>. Flee to the far corners of the world.\n\nOr stay and die. It matters little to me."}
Q[13219]={d="我担心你的成功会毁了你，$n。\n\n<基尔莉芙露出紧张的神情，你觉得她的身体似乎愈发惨白起来。>\n\n你获胜的消息传到了冰冠堡垒深处，惊动了一位大人物。相信我，你一定不想和他碰面的。\n\n萨杜瓦尔王子正在赶往瓦哈拉斯的途中。亚纳尔警告过你，建议你立即逃走，我也是这个意思。\n\n你打算怎么办？他很快就到了。你愿意在最后一场战斗中面对血王子吗？",dEN="I'm afraid that your success is going to be your undoing, <name>.\n\n<If the val'kyr could turn more white, she would.>\n\nWord of your success in Valhalas has reached deep into Icecrown Citadel, stirring one whom you have no desire to meet.\n\nPrince Sandoval himself is on his way at this very moment. Gjonner warned you that you should run and I cannot disagree.\n\nWhat will you do? He's on his way. Will you face the blood prince in final battle?",o="瓦哈拉斯的基尔莉芙要你击败萨杜瓦尔王子。\n\n获胜之后到瓦哈拉斯南部场外去，与残忍的亚纳尔谈一谈。",oEN="Geirrvif at Valhalas has challenged you to defeat Prince Sandoval.\n\nShould you succeed, speak with Gjonner the Merciless overlooking the southern lip of Valhalas.",c="你击败萨纳多尔王子让我恶心。像你这样没洗过澡的乡巴佬，本该仅仅为了有机会见他一面、跪在他脚边，就心甘情愿献出性命。\n\n你已经挣到了你那该死的奖赏。快点挑吧。",cEN="Your defeat of Prince Sandoval sickens me. An unwashed peasant such as yourself should have willingly given over <his /her> life simply for the chance to meet him and kneel at his feet.\n\nYou've earned your damned reward. Be quick about your choosing."}
Q[13220]={d="我们必须尽快将欧尔拉金拼接起来。幸运的是，天灾军团为我们提供了一处绝妙的缝合场所。\n\n缝合场的血肉巨人装配台附近有一座复生密室。去那里寻找一团缝合线以及博士的屠刀，然后将欧尔拉金的残肢放在密室中央的平台上进行缝合吧。",dEN="We can't afford to waste any time putting Olakin back together. Fortunately, the Scourge has provided a perfect place for you to stitch him back together.\n\nNear the Fleshwerks' flesh giant lab is the Sanctum of Reanimation. Search the area for a spool of thread and the doctor's cleaver. Then, take Olakin's remains to the large slab in the middle of the sanctum and get to work.",o="找到一卷缝合线和博士的屠刀，带上它们进入复生密室，将欧尔拉金的残骸缝合起来，看看能不能让他复活。完成任务后返回黑色观察站，向黑暗骑士阿尔蕾复命。",oEN="Obtain a Spool of Thread and the Doctor's Cleaver, then take them to the Sanctum of Reanimation Slab and use Olakin's remains to attempt to reanimate the crusader. Return to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch when this task is complete.",p="你带回我们勇敢的北伐军了吗？",pEN="Have you put our brave crusader back together?",c="欧尔拉金应该为他自己感到庆幸。从未有人能从天灾军团的魔掌中被救出来——从来没有。这点我要他牢牢记着。",cEN="Olakin should consider himself fortunate. No one is rescued from the Scourge, no one. No amount of thread and heroism will save him a second time. I'll make certain he remembers it."}
Q[13221]={d="圣光眷顾着我。我还没在这场活生生的噩梦中死去，但如果我逃不出去，天灾军团就会杀了我，把我的身体撕碎，用于他们在这里的\"活计\"。\n\n我独自一人办不到，我的孩子，但有你的帮助，我也许还能活下去，再次与天灾军团作战。$ghijo mío:hija mía;{None}\n你愿意在天灾军团的屠夫来结果我之前，帮我逃出去吗？\n",dEN="The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, my child, but with your help, I may yet live to fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's butchers come to finish me off?",o="护送卡玛洛斯神父逃离险境，然后向破天号上的虔诚的阿布萨兰报告。",oEN="Escort Father Kamaros to safety and then report to Absalan the Pious aboard the Skybreaker.",c="感谢圣光。我以为卡玛洛斯神父已经死了——甚至更糟……多亏你的勇气与怜悯，你救回了银色北伐军的一个重要盟友，我和所有的十字军向你致上谢意。",cEN="Thank the Light. I'd thought Father Kamaros dead, or worse. Through your bravery and compassion, you have restored a great ally to the Argent Crusade. You have my thanks and those of the crusade."}
Q[13222]={d="注意，$n！我们正准备开始攻打冬拥堡垒。那些部落的野兽以为自己可以像懦夫一样躲在城墙后面，而我不这么认为！我们要让那帮蠢货见识一下侏儒科技的威力，把他们的城墙轰至渣！\n\n不过呢，即便是最强大的攻城器械也不可能自己开到前线去。你的任务就是驾驶或者保护我们的某一辆攻城器械，直到它摧毁三座部落建筑物。",dEN="Front and center, <name>! We're beginning our assault on Wintergrasp Fortress. Those Horde animals think they can hide cowardly behind their walls? Well, I think not! We'll show them the power of Gnomish technology and smash their walls to bits!\n\nHowever, even the most powerful siege device is helpless without a crew. Pilot or protect one of our siege vehicles as it destroys three of the Horde structures.",o="冬拥湖的资深攻城技师雷格索要你驾驶或保护一辆攻城器械，摧毁3座部落建筑物。\n\n列兵军衔及更高军衔的玩家可以在地精车间中建造攻城器械。",oEN="Senior Demolitionist Legoso in Wintergrasp wants you to pilot or protect a siege device as it destroys three structures.\n\nPlayers of private rank or higher can build siege devices at Goblin Workshops.",p="没有时间好浪费了，你摧毁堡垒了吗？",pEN="There is no time to waste, have you destroyed the Fortress?",c="他们应该见识到侏儒工艺的威力了！",cEN="That should show them the power of Gnomish invention!"}
Q[13223]={d="联盟不可能守住那座堡垒太久。莫普可以砸穿城墙，但是莫普必须留在营地里。莫普希望干掉那些想要攻击部落攻城车辆的联盟。\n\n你，$n！就是你！你去替莫普上阵。保护三辆攻城车，直到它们摧毁联盟的建筑物。联盟不会想到你要去保护攻城车的，莫普真聪明！",dEN="Dem Alliance won't be long to hold that keep. Murp would smash walls, but Murp has to stay in camp. Murp wish he could smash Alliance who want to hurt Horde demolishers.\n\nYou, <name>! You go in Murp's place. Protect 3 siege vehicles while they smash Alliance buildings. Alliance not expect you to defend demolisher. Show Alliance how smart Murp is!",o="冬拥湖的莫普中尉要你驾驶或保护一辆攻城器械，摧毁3座联盟建筑物。\n\n拥有军衔的部落玩家可以在地精车间中建造攻城器械。",oEN="Lieutenant Murp in Wintergrasp wants you to defend or pilot a siege vehicle while they destroy three Alliance structures.\n\nSiege devices can be built by ranked Horde players at the Goblin Workshops.",p="你保护那攻城器械了吗？",pEN="You protect da siege machines?",c="很好很好。莫普希望他也能在那里帮上忙。",cEN="Good job. Murp wish he was there to help."}
Q[13224]={d="银色北伐军把我残破的身躯从破碎前线拖了回来。多么辉煌的一战，。我的斧头在砍倒联盟渣滓和天灾军团时放声歌唱。\n\n我的时辰到了。这会是一场好死。替我带个口信，士兵。\n\n我们的基地飞在天灾军团够不着的地方——就在莫德雷萨和奥杜尔萨之间上空。它叫\"奥格瑞姆之锤\"。\n\n<Hork intenta saludar inútilmente.>\n\n高飞吧，避开联盟的巨型战舰破天者号。告诉科姆……告诉他我是……战死的……为了部落。",dEN="The Argent Crusade pulled my ravaged body from the Broken Front. What a glorious battle, <race>. My axe sang as it cut down Alliance filth and Scourge alike.\n\nMy time is over. It will be a good death. Carry a message for me, soldier.\n\nOur base flies out of reach of Scourge - overhead between Mord'rethar and Aldur'thar. It is called \"Orgrim's Hammer.\"\n\n<Hork futilely attempts to salute.>\n\nFly high and avoid the Alliance juggernaut, Skybreaker. Tell Korm... tell him I died... fighting... For the Horde.",o="转至冰冠冰川上空的奥格瑞姆之锤，找到掠天者考尔姆·黑痕。",oEN="Seek out Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar aboard Orgrim's Hammer flying above Icecrown.",c="<考尔姆向你敬礼。>\n\n该死的天灾军团，该死的联盟！贺克是我们之中的精英。我们会报仇的。为了地狱咆哮，也为了部落！",cEN="<Korm salutes.>\n\nDamn the Scourge and damn the Alliance! Hork was one of our best. We will have our revenge. For Hellscream and for the Horde!"}
Q[13225]={d="我们当时深陷天灾军团和部落的重围。垂死者的尖叫覆盖了整片战场。那是折磨……无休无止！\n\n不知什么时候，我的身体撑不住了。我倒下了，却被银色北伐军唤醒。他们把我从破碎前线拖了出来，带到这里。我撑不下去了。满足一个垂死士兵最后一个愿望吧，？我们的基地，破天者号，高高飞在冰冠冰川上空。在那里你会找到我的指挥官，高级队长巴特利特。告诉他，我是作为一名联盟士兵死去的。",dEN="We were neck deep in Scourge and Horde. The screams of the dying covered that field. It was torturous... unrelenting!\n\nAt some point my body gave out. I fell, only to be awoken by the Argent Crusade. They pulled me out of the Broken Front and brought me here. I'm not going to make it. Grant a dying soldier one last wish, <race>? Our base, the Skybreaker, flies high above Icecrown. It is there that you'll find my commanding officer, High Captain Bartlett. Tell him that I died a soldier of the Alliance.",o="在冰冠冰川上空的破天号上找到高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特。",oEN="Seek out High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker flying above Icecrown.",c="<巴雷特指挥官敬了个礼。>\n\n他是一个好士兵。该死的部落，该死的天灾军团！",cEN="<Captain Bartlett salutes.>\n\nHe was a damn fine soldier. Damn the Horde and damn the Scourge!"}
Q[13226]={d="光靠我们自己是抵挡不了巫妖王的。分裂只会让我们全部灭亡！\n\n我请求你响应这个号召，我的$g兄弟:姐妹。银色北伐军接受所有愿意对天灾军团作战的勇士。大领主提里奥·弗丁正在银色前线基地等待着你！跨上你的坐骑，火速飞往冰冠冰川的东南边界吧。你可以在那里找到弗丁大人和银色北伐军的部队。\n\n现在就出发吧，$c，审判日就要降临了！",dEN="We cannot defeat the Lich King on our own. Divided we shall all fall!\n\nI implore you to answer the call, <brother/sister>. The Argent Crusade accepts all who would volunteer to aid in the war effort. Highlord Tirion Fordring himself awaits you at the Argent Vanguard! Get upon your mount and fly to the southeastern reaches of Icecrown. It is there that you will find Lord Fordring and the soldiers of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo now, <class>, for judgment day comes!",o="转至冰冠冰川的银色前线基地，向大领主提里奥·弗丁报到。",oEN="Report to Highlord Tirion Fordring at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",c="我忠诚的骑士们始终尽忠职守。看来他们搜罗到了一位英雄！",cEN="My faithful knights have served me well. It seems that their recruitment efforts have yielded a hero!"}
Q[13227]={d="光靠我们自己是抵挡不了巫妖王的。分裂只会让我们全部灭亡！\n\n我请求你响应这个号召，我的$g兄弟:姐妹。银色北伐军接受所有愿意对天灾军团作战的勇士。大领主提里奥·弗丁正在银色前线基地等待着你！跨上你的坐骑，火速飞往冰冠冰川的东南边界吧。你可以在那里找到弗丁大人和银色北伐军的部队。\n\n现在就出发吧，$c，审判日就要降临了！",dEN="We cannot defeat the Lich King on our own. Divided we shall all fall!\n\nI implore you answer the call, <brother/sister>. The Argent Crusade accepts all that would volunteer to aid in the war effort. Highlord Tirion Fordring himself awaits you at the Argent Vanguard! Get upon your mount and fly to the southeastern reaches of Icecrown. It is there that you will find Lord Fordring and the soldiers of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo now, <class>, for judgment day comes!",o="转至冰冠冰川的银色前线基地，向大领主提里奥·弗丁报到。",oEN="Report to Highlord Tirion Fordring at the Argent Vanguard in Icecrown.",c="我忠诚的骑士们始终尽忠职守。看来他们搜罗到了一位英雄！",cEN="My faithful knights have served me well. It seems that their recruitment efforts have yielded a hero!"}
Q[13228]={d="什么战斗？！那些部队是在执行侦察任务！\n\n还有，说什么联盟——你确定他说的是联盟？$gseguro:segura;{None}\n听我说，\n！我需要知道到底发生了什么，而且是现在！$n\n你自己下去，给我弄点答案回来！搜遍战场，找幸存者——找线索——什么都行！\n",dEN="What battle?! Those troops were on a recon mission!\n\nAnd what's this talk of Alliance - you're sure he said Alliance?\n\nListen to me, <name>! I need to know what's going on and I need to know NOW!\n\nGet yourself down there and get me some answers! Scour the battlefield and look for survivors - clues - anything!",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的考尔姆·黑痕要你转至破碎前线，询问一名濒死的狂战士，然后向他汇报你收集到的情报。",oEN="Korm Blackscar on Orgrim's Hammer wants you to go to The Broken Front and question a Dying Berserker to discover what happened there.",p="怎么样，<name>？\n\n有新消息给我吗？",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nHave you got new information for me?",c="他们看见联盟在攻击大门，于是从背后袭击了他们……\n\n<Tras una breve pausa, Korm estalla en carcajadas.>\n\n这才叫部落！\n\n要不是他们，联盟那些蛆虫很可能已经守住那道门了！\n\n他们的胆识为我们争取到了宝贵的时间。",cEN="They saw the Alliance assaulting the gate and they attacked them from behind...\n\n<After a brief pause, Korm bursts into laughter.>\n\nTHAT is what it means to be HORDE!\n\nWere it not for them, the Alliance maggots would likely be holding that gate!\n\nTheir boldness has bought us precious time."}
Q[13229]={d="圣光眷顾着我。我还没在这场活生生的噩梦中死去，但如果我逃不出去，天灾军团就会杀了我，把我的身体撕碎，用于他们在这里的\"活计\"。\n\n我独自一人办不到，$c，但有你的帮助，我也许还能活下去，再次与天灾军团作战。\n\n你愿意在天灾军团的屠夫来结果我之前，帮我逃出去吗？",dEN="The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, <class>, but with your help, I may yet live to fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's butchers come to finish me off?",o="护送卡玛洛斯神父逃离险境，然后向奥格瑞姆之锤的凯尔坦修士报告。",oEN="Escort Father Kamaros to safety and then report to Brother Keltan aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="你做得很好。我们以为卡玛洛斯神父已经死了，几乎可以确定。你的英勇，将成为所有对抗天灾军团人们的榜样。",cEN="You have done well. We thought Father Kamaros lost, for certain. Your bravery will serve as an example to all those who oppose the Scourge."}
Q[13230]={d="我听见他们了，$ghermano:hermana;……\n\n受伤联盟的呻吟……他们在嘲弄我……\n\n了结我们在这里开始的事，$c。不要留情……别让他们任何人活下来。\n\n为了……部落……",dEN="I hear them, <brother/sister>....\n\nThe moans of the wounded Alliance... they taunt me...\n\nFinish what we have begun here, <class>. Show no mercy... let none of them survive.\n\nFor... the Horde...",o="破碎前线上的一名濒死的狂战士要你杀死5名濒死的士兵。完成任务后返回奥格瑞姆之锤，向掠天者考尔姆·黑痕报到。",oEN="A Dying Berserker has asked that you slay 5 Dying Soldiers at the Broken Front. Report to Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar on Orgrim's Hammer when it is done.",p="怎么了，<class>？",pEN="What is it, <class>?",c="容忍联盟的时代已经过去了，<name>。\n\n他们已经挣得了我们的仇恨！他们要活在部落的恐惧之中，直到他们不再污染我们的世界！",cEN="The time of tolerance for the Alliance has passed, <name>.\n\nThey have earned our hatred! They shall live in fear of the Horde until they no longer pollute our world!"}
Q[13231]={d="什么？！这怎么可能！\n\n为了确保此次攻击行动的机密性，我们费了好大的一番工夫。部落究竟是怎么知道的？我们投入的资源……军队……全军复没？难以置信！\n\n冰冠冰川作战计划的关键在于抢在部落前面占领死亡之门。我们必须尽快恢复元气，准备发动下一次攻击。\n\n去战场上寻找幸存者，看看能不能收集到与这场惨剧有关的情报。\n\n$n，做好准备，我们要打一场双线作战的硬仗了……",dEN="What?! Noooo!\n\nWe went to such great pains to keep this attack secret. How could the Horde have known? The resources... the men... all lost? Inconceivable!\n\nOur plans here in Icecrown hinged upon our taking that gate before the Horde could. We must recover quickly and prepare to mount another offensive.\n\nVisit the battlefield and search for any survivors. See if there's anything to be learned from this tragedy.\n\nAnd prepare yourself, <name>, for a war - on two fronts...",o="破天号的高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特要你转至破碎前线，询问一名濒死的士兵，然后向他汇报你收集到的情报。",oEN="High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker wants you to go to the Broken Front and question a Dying Soldier, then report back to him.",p="怎么样，<name>？\n\n你查明什么了？",pEN="Well, <name>?\n\nWhat have you learned?",c="所以……这是一场溃败——全军覆没。这事不会被忘记。\n\n记住我的话，<class>。部落会为此付出代价……绝不留情！",cEN="So... It was a rout - a total loss. This shall not be forgotten.\n\nMark my words, <class>. The Horde shall pay for this... there will be no mercy!"}
Q[13232]={d="他们在嘲弄我们——哪怕已经躺在这里奄奄一息……\n\n求你了，$ghermano:hermana;……别让他们的嘲笑成为我最后听到的声音……\n\n了结我……把我从这折磨中解脱……送入……圣光。\n\n去找我的同伴……给他们同样的仁慈。\n\n别给天灾军团留下任何可复活的东西！\n\n我求你了……",dEN="They taunt us - even as they lie dying here...\n\nPlease, <brother/miss>... Don't allow their mocking to be the last sounds I hear...\n\nFinish me... deliver me from this torment... into... the Light.\n\nSeek out my companions... offer them the same mercy.\n\nLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!\n\nI beg you...",o="破碎前线上的一名濒死的士兵要你杀死其它5名濒死的士兵。完成任务后返回破天号，向高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特报到。",oEN="A Dying Soldier in the Broken Front wants you to kill 5 Dying Soldiers and report to High Captain Justin Bartlett on the Skybreaker.",p="怎么了，<class>？",pEN="What is it, <class>?",c="你做的事很艰难，<class>。但那是正确的。\n\n别让你所作所为的记忆纠缠你。把那份悲伤与痛苦化为力量！把它对准造成这一切的人。\n\n部落必须付出代价！",cEN="That was a difficult thing you did, <class>. But it was the right thing.\n\nDon't allow the memory of your actions to haunt you. Harness that sorrow and pain you feel! Direct it at those who caused it.\n\nThe Horde must pay!"}
Q[13233]={d="你还记得我撂下的狠话吧，我可以告诉你，这绝不是一时气愤讲出的大话。\n\n部落一次又一次地亵渎我们珍重的事物，肆意践踏圣光的尊严，我要让他们付出生命的代价！\n\n所有的部落。\n\n想象一下没有他们的世界，$n。联盟的孩子将拥有无忧无虑的生活，他们会永远铭记你的英勇事迹，感谢你为他们带来的幸福生活。\n\n去吧，让这美好的想象成为现实吧！",dEN="It is as I told you. They were not merely idle words spoken in a fit of anger.\n\nTime and again, the Horde have demonstrated their disdain for everything we hold dear and holy. They must pay with their lives for their transgressions against the light.\n\nAll of them.\n\nJust imagine a world free of their stain, <name>. Envision the joy our children will know. Think of the reverence your descendants will have for your memory, knowing they owe their happiness to you.\n\nNow go, and make that vision a reality!",o="破天号的高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特要你在冰冠冰川地区杀死15名部落玩家。",oEN="High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker wants you to kill 15 Horde Players in Icecrown.",p="我相信你已经用我们敌人的血染红了雪地，<name>。",pEN="I trust that you have stained the snow with the blood of our enemies, <name>.",c="干得好，<name>！\n\n追猎他们，让他们付出代价！",cEN="Well done, <name>!\n\nHunt them down and make them pay!"}
Q[13234]={d="是时候了！\n\n这帮自以为是的联盟令我们忍无可忍！世界因为他们的存在而变得脆弱而绝望，是时候清理这些渣滓了。\n\n让我们为部落曾经蒙受的耻辱划上句号！让他们知道什么才是真正的恐惧！荣耀属于部落！\n\n就在这里，就在冰冠冰川，我们将要铲除所有联盟！\n\n去吧，$c。击溃他们的意志，终结他们的生命！",dEN="The time has come!\n\nToo long have we suffered the company of the self-righteous Alliance! Too long have we stayed our hand from cleansing our world of the weak and the desperate.\n\nNow, we bring an end to our humiliation! Now, we show them the true meaning of fear! Now, we bring honor to the Horde!\n\nHere, at Icecrown, we break the Alliance!\n\nGo, <class>. Hunt them down. Break them. Take their will to live!",o="掠天者考尔姆·黑痕要你在冰冠冰川地区杀死15名联盟玩家。",oEN="Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar wants you to kill 15 Alliance Players in Icecrown.",p="你给联盟带去痛苦了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you brought suffering to the Alliance, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n很快，联盟就会恐惧地躲着你，部落将颂扬你的名字！",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nSoon, the Alliance shall run from you in fear and the Horde shall honor your name!"}
Q[13235]={d="你在摧毁血肉作坊、屠戮巫妖王的仆从方面干得很出色。现在，只剩下击败血肉作坊最伟大的杰作——那个被称为莫尔比杜斯的血肉巨人了。\n\n这不会是场轻松的战斗，但暗影穹顶已派出达卡尔侯爵带援军前来。到血肉作坊西端最高处与他会合。告诉他你准备何时开始进攻，他就会命令他的部队投入战斗。$glisto:lista;",dEN="You've done well in destroying the Fleshwerks and slaughtering the Lich King's servants. Now, all that remains is to defeat the Fleshwerks' greatest accomplishment -- the flesh giant known as Morbidus.\n\nIt will not be an easy fight, but the Shadow Vault has dispatched Margrave Dhakar with some reinforcements. Meet up with him at the highest point at the western end of the Fleshwerks. Tell him when you're ready to begin the attack and he'll order his forces into battle.",o="与缝合场西端的玛格拉弗·塔卡尔交谈，然后参加对摩比乌斯的战斗。击败摩比乌斯之后，返回黑色观察站，向黑暗骑士阿尔蕾复命。",oEN="Speak with Margrave Dhakar at the western end of the Fleshworks to engage Morbidus. After you have defeated Morbidus, report to Darkrider Arly at Blackwatch.",p="你解决巫妖王引以为傲的血肉巨人了吗？",pEN="Have you finished off the Lich King's prized flesh giant?",c="随着巫妖王血肉巨人的倒下，他应该也了解了：他其余的鹰犬也都是不堪一击的。有你在我们阵中，我们将给巫妖王再上一课——关于恐惧真实意义的一课。",cEN="With the Lich King's flesh giant champion defeated, he must know that the rest of his forces are vulnerable as well. With you by our side, we will teach the Lich King the meaning of fear once more."}
Q[13236]={d="你可能觉得自己已经很强大了，足以横扫这些亡灵，驾驶你的战争机器轻易地击败它们。\n\n但是创造出这些亡灵生物的力量更为强大，与之相比，你的力量不值一提。\n\n我见过那位王子本人这样做过。我可以营造一个幻境，向你演示他是怎么做到这一点的……如果你愿意领略一下的话。",dEN="You probably think you're quite strong -- fighting these undead and crushing their bones beneath your war machines.\n\nThat is nothing compared to the strength it took to create them.\n\nI saw the prince do it himself. I can show you how it happened... if you'd like.",o="第一军团前线营地的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要在幻境中向你演示巫妖王如何召唤一支由100个食尸鬼奴仆组成的部队。",oEN="Matthias Lehner at the First Legion Forward Camp wants you to raise an army of 100 Ghoulish Minions.",p="你看到了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you see, <name>?",c="王子他真正的力量并非在于从尸海中唤起军队……那很容易。\n\n而是让与他并肩作战多次的战士成为尸体……他真正的力量，就是能不择手段完成需要完成的事。",cEN="The prince's true power wasn't his ability to make armies out of corpses... that was easy\n\nBut killing his own men, with whom he'd shared many battles... the prince's true power was his ability to do what had to be done."}
Q[13237]={d="在你的指挥官将注意力转移到联盟与部落之间的冲突时，我仍然在高度关注着真正的敌人——巫妖王和他的仆从。\n\n要想攻陷冰冠堡垒，部落就必须首先占领每一座大门。\n\n就从第一座大门着手吧。返回破碎前线，向那里的天灾军团驻军发起挑战，寻找它们的弱点。\n\n我等你汇报消息，$c。",dEN="While your commander has his focus diluted by his loathing of your Alliance rivals, you can depend on me to direct my attention squarely on the real enemy here - the Lich King and his minions.\n\nIn order to hold any hope of conquering him at the citadel, your people must take and hold each gate.\n\nFor now, let us focus on the first. Return to the front and prod their defenses. Look for any sign of weakness that we might exploit.\n\nI'll await your report, <class>.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你转至破碎前线，杀死5名笨重的憎恶、5名邪恶通灵师和5名暗影专家。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to go the Broken Front and defeat 5 Hulking Abominations, 5 Malefic Necromancers, and 5 Shadow Adepts.",p="怎么样，<race>？\n\n你查明什么了？",pEN="Well, <race>?\n\nWhat have you learned?",c="真的吗，<class>？\n\n没什么值得报告的事？\n\n\n\n我可不敢苟同……",cEN="Really, <class>?\n\nNothing notable to report?\n\n\n\nI beg to differ..."}
Q[13238]={d="地精！聒噪忙碌的小矮子……\n\n听着，$n。首席技师考伯克拉是奥格瑞姆之锤的常驻技师，他反复强调自己设计出了一件有用的玩意儿。\n\n我哪有心情听他喋喋不休。上次我认可他的产品之后，他竟然拉着我叽叽喳喳地说一个小时。我差点没把这家伙一脚踢到辛达苟萨之墓去！\n\n你替我测试一下考伯克拉的杰作吧。我倒要看看他是不是真有那么厉害。",dEN="Goblins! Hyper little busy-bodies...\n\nListen, <name>. Copperclaw, our resident engineer, is insisting that he's got something useful to show me.\n\nI'm in no mood to endure his squeaky nagging. The last time I acknowledged him, he chirped on for an hour straight. It was all I could do to keep from drop-kicking him into Sindragosa's Fall!\n\nYou go in my place and humor him. Let me know if indeed he's on to anything.",o="掠天者考尔姆·黑痕要你与奥格瑞姆之锤的首席技师考伯克拉谈一谈。",oEN="Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar wants you to speak with Chief Engineer Copperclaw aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="太忙？呸！这条船又不是靠他在飞的！\n\n不管了。你也成……",cEN="Too busy? Phooey! This baby flies herself!\n\nNevermind that. You'll do..."}
Q[13239]={d="从哪儿说起呢……嗯，你必须知道，作为这艘船的总工程师，我能接触到所有的情报报告——是的，是的，这是真的，而且我最近对你们报告在南边看到的那些霜龙特别感兴趣，我确实觉得自己想出了一个说不定能对付它们的计划……这需要你跑跑腿，但基本上就是：用护甲做一个假人，给它涂上一层这个溶液，然后赶紧找地方躲起来！\n\n……你还在这儿吗，？",dEN="Where to begin... well, you must know that as chief engineer of this vessel I have access to all of the intelligence reports - yes, yes, it's true, and I've recently taken a particular interest in the frostwyrms you reported seeing to the south, and I do believe I've developed a plan that just might work against them... now it'll take a little legwork on your part, but essentially, you build a dummy out of armor and coat it with a splash of this solution, then run for cover!\n\n...You still here, <race>?",o="首席技师考伯克拉要你在破碎前线使用考伯克拉的爆炸油吸引3只霜巢天爪龙。\n\n你需要收集被丢弃的头盔、被丢弃的护甲和一堆白骨才能使用爆炸油，这些材料都可以在破碎前线找到。",oEN="Chief Engineer Copperclaw wants you to use Copperclaw's Volatile Oil at the Broken Front to attract 3 Frostbrood Skytalons.\n\nTo use the oil, you must collect a Pile of Bones, an Abandoned Helm, and Abandoned Armor from the battlefield there.",p="你把那些龙烤熟了吗，<class>？",pEN="You toast them wyrms, <class>?",c="哇呼！我从这里就可以看见它们着了火乱窜！我取得了另一个成功，并且要开始量产这玩意以应付进攻了——当然，如果你有兴趣的话，这会多做些测试的……",cEN="Wahooo! I saw them light up all the way from here! I'll just chalk that up as another success and begin bottling this stuff up for the invasion - of course it might need a little more testing as we go if you're at all interested...."}
Q[13240]={d="你必须到飘浮在考达拉上空的魔环里去一趟，$n。\n\n我已经预见到，你必须去摧毁魔环里的离心构造体。我敢保证，如果你不先行消灭这些魔法生物，你和你的朋友们就难逃失败的命运。\n\n这就是我的预测，也是你必须做的事。",dEN="It is into the Oculus floating above Coldarra that you must travel, <name>.\n\nI have foreseen a situation in which you must destroy the centrifuge constructs therein. I can assure you that if you do not first eliminate these magical creations, you and your friends will fail.\n\nThus I have seen, thus you must do.",o="根据达拉然的大法师提迈尔的预言，你必须去消灭10台离心构造体。",oEN="Archmage Timear in Dalaran has foreseen that you must destroy 10 Centrifuge Constructs.",p="你发现你还没有摧毁所有的傀儡。",pEN="I sense that you have yet to destroy all of the constructs.",c="<El archimago asiente incluso antes de que digas una palabra.>\n\n我知道。你如我所预见的那样摧毁了构造体，随后才能继续去对付瓦罗斯·云行者。\n\n干得漂亮，<name>！",cEN="<The archmage nods even before you say a word.>\n\nI know. You destroyed the constructs as I foresaw and were then able to go on to fight Varos Cloudstrider.\n\nExcellently done, <name>!"}
Q[13241]={d="你离胜利只剩一步之遥了。伊米隆国王麾下的勇士们是你唯一的阻碍。\n\n你要深入嚎风峡湾的森林，进入那座名为乌特加德之巅的堡垒。你和你的伙伴必须消灭那些伊米亚狂战士，这对你们至关重要。\n\n如果这次行动失败了，那你们就死定了，$n！",dEN="King Ymiron's champions stand between you and victory in the not-too-distant future.\n\nYou will travel to the fortress known as Utgarde Pinnacle nestled deep within the woods of the Howling Fjord. I cannot stress how important it is that you and your traveling companions deal with the Ymirjar berserkers therein.\n\nFailure to do so may very well doom you, <name>!",o="达拉然的大法师提迈尔要你去杀死7个伊米亚狂战士。",oEN="Archmage Timear in Dalaran wants you to slay 7 Ymirjar Berserkers.",p="<El archimago se presiona las sienes con los dedos y se concentra.>\n\n那些狂战士还没有被杀死。听我的警告，<name>。你必须办成这件事！",pEN="<The archmage presses his fingers to his temples and concentrates.>\n\nThe berserkers have not yet been slain. Heed my warning, <name>. You must do this thing!",c="出色的工作，<name>。\n\n要不是这样，那些幸存的狂战士肯定会在你与国王交战时蜂拥而上。",cEN="Outstanding work, <name>.\n\nWithout having done so, the surviving berserkers would surely have swarmed you during your fight with the king."}
Q[13242]={d="黑暗的力量在骚动，$n。一场只有时空之王才可能预见的悲剧发生了。很快，悲伤与仇恨将笼罩着你的同胞。战争迫在眉睫。\n\n红龙军团已经尽了最大的努力，接下来就要靠艾泽拉斯的凡人种族了。\n\n很遗憾，你的旅程将由这场悲剧开头。就在今天，一位父亲永远地失去了他心爱的孩子。你必须将这个悲伤的消息告诉他。找回小萨鲁法尔的战甲，将它交给萨鲁法尔吧。",dEN="Darkness stirs, <name>. A tragic event has transpired that none but the Timeless One could have foreseen. Soon your people will be gripped by anger and hatred. War is on the horizon.\n\nThe red dragonflight has done all that it can. What happens next is in the hands of the mortal races of Azeroth.\n\nRegrettably, your journey begins with anguish. A father has lost a child today. You must bear the grim news. Gather the armaments of Saurfang and return them to the elder Saurfang.",o="在战场上收集萨鲁法尔的战甲，然后转至北风苔原的战歌要塞，将它交给萨鲁法尔大王。",oEN="Gather Saurfang's Battle Armor from the field of battle and return it to High Overlord Saurfang at Warsong Hold in Borean Tundra.",p="<萨鲁法尔的表情变得扭曲起来。>\n\n我的爱子……我的军队……",pEN="<Saurfang's face contorts.>\n\nMy heart... my strength...",c="<Saurfang mira a los cielos>\n\n和布洛克斯一样，我的儿子也是英雄般地死去。别为他哀悼，<name>。对一个兽人来说，没有比这更好的结局！没有比这更大的荣耀！此刻，我的心满是骄傲。\n\n感谢你把我们的战甲送回来。它将安放在纳格兰先祖之地的柴堆上。\n\n我们必须把全部注意力转向更紧迫的事务。",cEN="<Saurfang looks to the heavens.>\n\nLike Brox, my son died a hero. Do not mourn him, <name>. For an orc, there could be no better end! No greater honor! At this moment, my heart swells with pride.\n\nI thank you for returning our battle armor. It will be placed upon his pyre at the Ancestral Grounds of Nagrand.\n\nWe must turn our full attention to more pressing matters."}
Q[13243]={d="永永恒之龙已经威胁到了时间流。如果你再不介入的话，我们的历史就会变得一团糟！\n\n你必须进入时光之穴，介入净化斯坦索姆这段历史。\n\n光是尝试探索各种历史的可能性，已经让我头痛不已。但我可以肯定，你一定要去杀掉那些永恒密探。\n\n只有除掉那些破坏份子，我们才能保住真正的历史，防止现在和未来被篡改！",dEN="The timeline is in danger from the Infinite dragonflight. Without your intervention, all of time will unravel!\n\nYou must travel to a point in time known as the Culling of Stratholme within the Caverns of Time.\n\nIt gives me a migraine just to attempt to see into all of the possible pasts, but I do know that it is crucial for you to kill the Infinite agents.\n\nOnly by slaying them will the true past be preserved and the present and future kept from being undone forever!",o="根据达拉然的大法师提迈尔的预言，你必须去杀死4个永恒密探。",oEN="Archmage Timear in Dalaran has foreseen that you must slay 4 Infinite Agents.",p="时间永远是宝贵的资源，但在这种情况下更是如此，<name>。请在这些永恒龙的特工造成无法挽回的后果之前解决他们！",pEN="Time is always a precious resource, but even more so in this case, <name>. Please deal with the Infinite agents before it is too late!",c="我们暂时得救了。谢谢你。\n\n不幸的是，由于他们干扰的性质，永恒龙军团几乎有无限的机会再次动手。\n\n我能看清的是，在未来，你正处在阻止他们的斗争核心，<name>！",cEN="We are saved for now. Thank you.\n\nUnfortunately due to the nature of their interference, the Infinite's will have almost unlimited opportunity to do so again.\n\nWhat I can discern is that in the future, you are at the heart of the struggle to stop them, <name>!"}
Q[13244]={d="整个艾泽拉斯都处在危险之中。疯狂的神灵洛肯已经具备了毁灭世界的能力！\n\n在闪电大厅的大地了望塔里，那些泰坦神铁先锋正在有条不紊地执行着洛肯的疯狂计划，无数生灵即将成为他们的牺牲品。\n\n我已经预见到了，$n。你就是阻止这个疯狂计划的人！",dEN="The entirety of Azeroth is in peril. The mad god Loken has it within his power to put an end to everything!\n\nWithin the Terrestrial Watchtower at the Halls of Lightning, the titanium vanguards stand poised to execute Loken's dread will upon countless unknowing victims.\n\nI have looked into the future, <name>. You are the one to see that this does not come to pass!",o="根据达拉然的大法师提迈尔的预言，你必须去杀死7个泰坦神铁先锋。",oEN="Archmage Timear in Dalaran has foreseen that you must slay 7 Titanium Vanguards.",p="我实在猜不透你为什么还在这儿叨叨不休，你都没有排除泰坦神铁先锋的威胁好不好？",pEN="Even I cannot discern why it is that we are standing here speaking when you have yet to eliminate the threat of the titanium vanguards.",c="我们都欠你一份情，<name>。\n\n如果说有一件事我确信无疑，那就是你从未让我们失望，将来也不会！",cEN="We are all in your debt, <name>.\n\nIf I am certain of anything, it is that you have not failed us, nor will you in the future!"}
Q[13257]={d="大酋长需要你，勇士。奥格瑞玛正处于军事管制状态。大酋长正在为一场不可避免的冲突做准备，所有商人和服务都已关闭。$gcampeón:campeona;{None}\n我不能再多说什么了——现在不行。不能在这个地方。\n\n大酋长命令我们最强的勇士前往他的王座厅报到。现在就去，\n！乘传送门回奥格瑞玛，去找萨尔。$n",dEN="The Warchief needs you, champion. Orgrimmar is in a state of martial law. All merchants and services have been shut down as the Warchief prepares for an unavoidable conflict.\n\nI cannot tell you much more - not now. Not in this place.\n\nThe Warchief commands that our strongest champions report to his throne room. Go now, <name>! Take the portal back to Orgrimmar and seek out Thrall.",o="转至奥格瑞玛的格罗玛什堡垒，向萨尔报到。",oEN="Report to Thrall at Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar.",c="恶魔领主瓦里玛萨斯和被遗忘者大药剂师普特雷斯是这次叛变的主谋。\n\n<萨尔点了点头。>\n\n对，就是这个普特雷斯，也负责为最近爆发的天灾瘟疫寻找解药。\n\n不和他们站在同一阵线的人都被处决或流放了。\n\n部落已经失去了幽暗城。奥格瑞玛会接纳被遗忘者的难民，直到危机落幕为止。现在我们处于戒严状态。",cEN="The demon lord, Varimathras, and the Forsaken's chief apothecary, Putress, are responsible for this betrayal.\n\n<Thrall nods.>\n\nYes, the same Putress responsible for discovering the cure for the recent Scourge plague outbreak.\n\nThose that would not side with their regime have been executed or banished. Sylvanas was nearly killed in the coup.\n\nThe Horde has lost the Undercity. Orgrimmar will take on the Forsaken refugees until there is a resolution to this crisis. For now we are under martial law."}
Q[13258]={d="最近，我们设法搞到了冰冠堡垒的建筑图纸，并从中发现了一处弱点。堡垒的防御圈上有一处缺口——无论是从字面意思还是象征意义上来讲都可以这么说。\n\n这些图纸上标明了一个深达数百尺的洞。我们还不清楚它的用途，但是据斥候回报，天灾军团非常重视这处洞口。\n\n去和冰冠堡垒下面的克蕾迦中士谈一谈，她负责此次进攻计划。",dEN="We recently came upon schematics that indicate a weakness in Icecrown Citadel. An opening in its defenses, both figuratively and literally.\n\nThe captured diagrams show an orifice leading several hundred feet into the ground. We're unsure of its purpose, but our scouting has revealed it to be of high importance to the Scourge.\n\nSpeak to Sergeant Kregga below Icecrown Citadel, she's leading the attack on the site.",o="与冰冠堡垒下面的克蕾迦中士谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Sergeant Kregga below Icecrown Citadel.",c="来得正是时候，<name>。科尔提拉对你评价很高。也许你能让天平向我们这边倾斜。",cEN="Just in time, <name>. Koltira spoke highly of you. Perhaps you'll be able to push the scales in our favor."}
Q[13259]={d="我们只有一次机会对那个地方造成打击——务必一次成功。\n\n我们弄到了几枚威力强大的、天灾军团制造的萨隆邪铁炸弹。但我们必须先控制这片区域，才能引爆它们。\n\n我们需要在援军到来之前迅速压制天灾军团的防御。\n\n帮帮我的人，等你准备好放烟花时再回来。$glisto:lista;",dEN="We've one shot at dealing some damage to this place -- let's make sure we get it right.\n\nWe've acquired potent, Scourge-made, saronite bombs. But we must secure this area before we can set them off.\n\nWe're going to need to get the Scourge defenses under control quickly, before reinforcements arrive.\n\nHelp my men out and come back when you're ready for some fireworks.",o="冰冠堡垒的克蕾迦中士要你去杀死10只笨重的恐尸。",oEN="Sergeant Kregga at Icecrown Citadel wants you to slay 10 Hulking Horrors.",c="你很快就解决了天灾军团，<name>。让我们把来这里要做的事做完吧。",cEN="You made quick work of the Scourge, <name>. Let's finish what we came to do here."}
Q[13260]={d="虽然我们绝不该放过任何打击联盟的机会，但也不能忘了天灾军团。\n\n我们在这里的兵力，几周之内都不足以在冰川发动一场像样的进攻，但这并不妨碍我们尽可能摸清他们的防御。\n\n我已请我们驻守的死亡骑士在这方面为你提供建议。毕竟，还有谁比他们更了解这个敌人呢？\n\n请允许我介绍科尔提拉·织亡者。|n",dEN="While we should never miss an opportunity to strike out against the Alliance, we mustn't forget about the Scourge.\n\nWe won't have the numbers here to make a proper assault in the glacier for weeks, but that won't keep us from learning all we can know about their defenses.\n\nI have asked our resident death knight to advise you in this effort. After all, who better knows this enemy than they?\n\nAllow me to introduce Koltira Deathweaver.",o="掠天者考尔姆要你与奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者谈一谈。",oEN="Sky-Reaver Korm wants you to speak to Koltira Deathweaver on Orgrim's Hammer.",c="\n\n但愿你能胜任这件事，<class>。",cEN="<Koltira looks you up and down.>\n\nI hope for your sake that you're up to this, <class>."}
Q[13261]={d="啊哈！成功啦！我并不怀疑自己的发明，只是不确定具体的爆炸效果嘛——你瞧，你的眉毛完好无损，这点就很令我欣慰。只需让考尔姆看看冰霜巨龙被点燃的惨状，他就会把我提升到……呃……仅次于首席技师的职位！来吧，你再带上一瓶液体去破碎前线，我去找考尔姆来……\n\n好啦！出发！",dEN="Wahooo! It works! Not that I had any doubts in my supernatural ingenuity, only that I wasn't quite sure what kind of explosion to expect - let's just say I'm glad to see that you didn't get your eyebrows singed off. So now I just need to show ol' Korm how ya thaw out one 'a them wyrms. He'll hafta promote me to... to... to whatever comes after Chief Engineer! Here, you take another batch of the stuff and head back out to the front and I'll go get Korm...\n\nWell? Move out!",o="首席技师考伯克拉要你在破碎前线使用考伯克拉的爆炸油吸引3只霜巢天爪龙。\n\n你需要收集被丢弃的头盔、被丢弃的护甲和一堆白骨才能使用爆炸油，这些材料都可以在破碎前线找到。",oEN="Chief Engineer Copperclaw wants you to use Copperclaw's Volatile Oil at the Broken Front to attract 3 Frostbrood Skytalons.\n\nTo use the oil, you must collect a Pile of Bones, an Abandoned Helm, and Abandoned Armor from the battlefield there.",p="你把那些龙烤熟了吗，<race>？",pEN="You toast them wyrms, <race>?",c="不是很好！\n\n考尔姆老是推托他太忙，我今天好不容易把他拖上来看了一会，结果你把油用光了。现在他对我很不爽，而且不准我今天再出现在他面前……\n\n回去吧，我们再试试看！",cEN="No good!\n\nKorm kept telling me he was too busy and when I finally got him to come topside and have a look, you had already used the last of the oil. Now he's ticked at me and won't even allow me in his presence again until tomorrow...\n\nCome back then and we'll try again!"}
Q[13262]={d="照当前的情况看，局势已经得到了有效的控制。动手吧，$n。\n\n得派个人去点燃引线，你看来就是最佳人选。",dEN="This is probably as under-control as this situation is going to get. Let's do this, <name>.\n\nI need someone to light the fuse on those bombs and it looks like you're the one to do it.",o="转至附近的萨隆邪铁炸弹堆旁边，点燃引线。",oEN="Go to the nearby Saronite Bomb Stack to light the fuse.",c="这些炸弹看来满猛的。它们应该可以在周遭的建筑上留下一个大洞。",cEN="These bombs look pretty potent. They should at least put a dent in the surrounding structure."}
Q[13263]={d="在你点燃引线的时候，你发现它的燃烧速度比你想象中的要快了许多。\n\n炸弹就要爆炸了，只有马上跳进深坑，并且不被炸下来的杂物砸到，你才有可能活下来。",dEN="As you light the fuse, you notice that it is consumed by fire far quicker than you would expect.\n\nThe bombs are about to go off and your best chance at surviving is to lean towards the pit and hope the fall doesn't kill you.",o="在你被杂物砸中的地方寻找线索。",oEN="Look for clues wherever the fall takes you.",c="一个物体被厚厚的一层冰复盖着，并且振动着。它在水下闪着奇异的微光。",cEN="This pulsing object is covered in a thick layer of ice. It shimmers strangely beneath the water."}
Q[13264]={d="憎恶……\n\n可怕的敌人。我不止一次目睹它们迅速地扭转了战局。事实上，它们也可以成为有用的伙伴，这一点倒是鲜为人知。\n\n憎恶并不聪明。只要你了解制造憎恶的秘密，就可以对它们发出简单的指令。相信我，它们会毫不犹豫地执行你的命令。\n\n你很幸运，我恰好知晓其中的奥秘。\n\n对憎恶的残骸使用这个工具包，将其复活。接下来你就可以利用它对付驻守在死亡之门的天灾军团了。",dEN="Abominations...\n\nThey can be a very capable enemy. I've seen them turn the tide of battle more than once. What few realize, is that they can also be very capable friends.\n\nThey are not deep thinkers. If you know the secrets of their creation, you can issue them basic orders that they will not question.\n\nFortunately for you, I know these secrets.\n\nThis kit will reanimate the remains of the abominations you defeat. Take it, and learn to use them against the Scourge on the death gate.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你使用憎恶复活工具包制造一名复活的憎恶，然后利用它杀死15只冰寒食尸鬼、15只残忍的恶鬼和15名复活的联盟士兵。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver on Orgrim's Hammer wants you to use the Abomination Reanimation Kit to create a Reanimated Abomination, which you are to use to kill 15 Icy Ghouls, 15 Vicious Geists, and 15 Risen Alliance Soldiers.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="看到了吗，<class>？\n\n面对看似不可战胜的敌人时，巧思有时也能扭转局势。",cEN="You see, <class>?\n\nIngenuity can sometimes even the odds against a seemingly overwhelming enemy."}
Q[13265]={p="北方大陆的人形生物穿着可以转化成布料的衣物，只要你知道方法。\n\n只要几个金币，我就愿意教你布料回收的技艺，让你从北裂境杀死的人形生物身上获得额外的霜纹布。",pEN="The humanoids of the northern lands wear garments that can be converted into cloth if you know how.\n\nFor a few gold I am willing to teach you the art of Cloth Scavenging that will give you additional frostweave cloth from the humanoids of Northrend that you slay.",c="把你找到的多余布料做成看起来很了不起的东西吧！",cEN="Turn that extra cloth you find into something that looks marvelous!"}
Q[13266]={d="当我的生命走到尽头时，我希望自己能够毫无遗憾地离开这个世界。那些因此悲伤的人会明白，作为部落的酋长，我做出的决定都是有利于我的子民的。\n\n但是瓦里玛萨斯和普特雷斯的叛变……令我们过去的努力全都付之东流。\n\n<萨尔沉重地叹了口气。>\n\n正义必须得到伸张。\n\n转至幽暗城的传送门马上就会开启，沃金正在等你，我稍后也会过去和你们碰面。我们要一起挽回残局，$n。",dEN="On the day of my death I wish to be able to say that I lived a life without regret. Those who mourn my passing will know that I was a Warchief who made decisions that best served his people.\n\nBut this betrayal by Varimathras and Putress... All that we have worked for is for nothing.\n\n<Thrall's chest heaves with a heavy sigh.>\n\nJustice must be served.\n\nPortals to Undercity will be active momentarily. Vol'jin will be waiting for you. I will meet you there soon. Together we will make it right, <name>.",o="穿过格罗玛什堡垒内的传送门，转至幽暗城，向沃金报到。",oEN="Take the portal to Undercity located in Grommash Hold and report to Vol'jin.",c="让我给你说明一下情况，<name>。\n\n幽暗城现在是战区。普特雷斯的药剂师和瓦里玛萨斯的恶魔已经夺取了控制权。他们在里面占据了防御阵地，还用那该死的瘟疫对付我们的部队。",cEN="Let me get you up to speed, <name>.\n\nUndercity is a war-zone. Putress' apothecaries and Varimathras' demons have seized control. They've taken a defensive position inside and are using that damned blight against our troops."}
Q[13267]={d="整个幽暗城都被瓦里玛萨斯控制着。我们的士兵已准备就绪，等候大酋长下达进攻命令。\n\n帮助部落夺回幽暗城，在我们最伟大的勇士中赢得一席之地！如果你在进攻中幸存下来，就向萨尔报告。\n\n准备好开始时，去向大酋长报到。$glisto:lista;",dEN="The entirety of the Undercity is controlled by Varimathras. Our soldiers stand ready, waiting for the Warchief to give the attack orders.\n\nHelp the Horde take back the Undercity and earn your place among our greatest champions! Should you survive the assault, report to Thrall.\n\nCheck in with the Warchief when you are ready to begin.",o="帮助萨尔和希尔瓦娜斯为部落夺回幽暗城。\n\n完成任务后向萨尔复命。",oEN="Assist Thrall and Sylvanas in retaking the Undercity for the Horde.\n\nReport to Thrall should you succeed.",c="明天带来的是未知。联盟与部落为共同敌人并肩作战的日子已经过去。新的战斗即将来临，<name>——一场没有胜利者的战斗。\n\n但我们必须继续向冰冠进军。这件事我们别无选择。我们的救赎寄托在你这样的英雄身上，<name>。部落的未来——世界的未来——都取决于你。\n\n我们回奥格瑞玛吧。你必须立刻返回北裂境。",cEN="Tomorrow brings with it uncertainty. Gone are the days of Alliance and Horde battling alongside each other in pursuit of a common enemy. A new battle dawns, <name> - a battle in which there can be no victor.\n\nBut we must continue our march towards Icecrown. We have no choice in that matter. Our salvation lies with heroes like you, <name>. The future of the Horde - of the world - depends on you.\n\nLet us return to Orgrimmar. You must return to Northrend at once."}
Q[13268]={p="你衣角的碎片告诉我你是一名裁缝，应该可以轻松学会我要教你的技术。\n\n诺森德的人型生物所穿着的衣服可以很容易地转化成布料——如果你知道诀窍的话。\n\n只需一点点费用，我就教你布料搜寻的技巧，这样你就可以从诺森德的人型生物那儿搜寻到布料了。",pEN="You look like someone who knows their way around a needle and thread so maybe I can help you.\n\nThe northern humanoids wear clothes that can quickly be converted into cloth if you know how.\n\nFor a few gold I am willing to teach you the art of Cloth Scavenging that will give you additional cloth from the humanoids of Northrend.",c="把你搜刮来的布料，做成些让你看来与众不同的玩意！",cEN="Come back when you have the skill and I can provide all of your tailoring training."}
Q[13269]={p="北方大陆的人形生物穿着可以转化成布料的衣物，只要你知道方法。\n\n只要几个金币，我就愿意教你布料回收的技艺，让你从北裂境杀死的人形生物身上获得额外的霜纹布。",pEN="The humanoids of the northern lands wear garments that can be converted into cloth if you know how.\n\nFor a few gold I am willing to teach you the art of Cloth Scavenging that will give you additional frostweave cloth from the humanoids of Northrend that you slay.",c="愿你杀死许多人形生物并取得他们的布料。",cEN="May you slay many humanoids and take their cloth."}
Q[13270]={p="北方大陆的人形生物穿着可以转化成布料的衣物，只要你知道方法。\n\n只要几个金币，我就愿意教你布料回收的技艺，让你从北裂境杀死的人形生物身上获得额外的霜纹布。",pEN="The humanoids of the northern lands wear garments that can be converted into cloth if you know how.\n\nFor a few gold I am willing to teach you the art of Cloth Scavenging that will give you additional frostweave cloth from the humanoids of Northrend that you slay.",c="感谢你的惠顾。",cEN="I be appreciatin' your business."}
Q[13271]={d="这件东西根本不是水晶，而是某种器官，被冰封着。\n\n当你触碰它时，你的手因剧痛而猛地缩回。你感觉自己的手像是被割开了，却看不到任何伤口。\n\n当你定下神来，你听到附近有个小男孩的声音。\n\n\"你真不该那么做的。\"",dEN="The object is not a crystal at all, but some form of organ, encased in ice.\n\nAs you touch it, your hand reels in horrible pain. You feel as if your hand has been cut, yet there is no visible wound.\n\nAs you collect your thoughts, you hear a young boy's voice nearby.\n\n\"You really shouldn't have done that.\"",o="在纳扎纳克：遗忘深渊里调查这个声音的来源。",oEN="Investigate the nearby voice in Naz'anak, the Forgotten Depths.",c="我看到他丢掉了这个，你知道吗？他从上面一丢，直直地掉到这儿。\n\n他说他不再需要这玩意了。说这让他变的软弱。",cEN="I saw him get rid of it, you know? He threw it all the way down here.\n\nSaid he wouldn't need it anymore. Said it made him weak."}
Q[13272]={p="北方大陆的人形生物穿着可以转化成布料的衣物，只要你知道方法。\n\n只要几个金币，我就愿意教你布料回收的技艺，让你从北裂境杀死的人形生物身上获得额外的霜纹布。",pEN="The humanoids of the northern lands wear garments that can be converted into cloth if you know how.\n\nFor a few gold I am willing to teach you the art of Cloth Scavenging that will give you additional frostweave cloth from the humanoids of Northrend that you slay.",c="我想你会发现这项技能在你通往裁缝大师之路上大有帮助！",cEN="I think you will find this skill helps you a great deal on your path to tailoring greatness!"}
Q[13273]={d="既然我们已经拿到了诺甘农之壳，现在就只需要寻找另一半钥匙了。幸运的是，我已经让探险者协会的伙计们四处查探，找到了诺甘农之核的所在之处。\n\n在创世者的图书馆东南方的远端，丹尼芬雷北面的斜坡上，有一处以我的名字命名的营地。探险者协会正在那里寻找另外一半钥匙。帮我把他们整理好的地图和信息带回来，我们应该可以找到另外一半钥匙。",dEN="With Norgannon's Shell in hand, only half of the archive key remains to be found. Luckily, I've had the Explorers' League hard at work chasing down leads about the whereabouts of Norgannon's Core.\n\nFar to the southeast of the Inventor's Library, on the slopes to the north of Dun Niffelem, is a camp bearing my name. The Explorers' League representatives seeking the second half of the key are based there. Bring me the maps and the notes they've made and we should be able to track down the other key half.",o="在布莱恩的营地寻找勘探员克罗娜的便笺和勘探员索雷的地图。",oEN="Find Prospector Khrona's Notes and Prospector Soren's Maps at Brann's Base-Camp.",p="你取回那些便笺和地图了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered those notes?",c="被毁了？这是什么意思？营地被毁了？\n\n<布莱恩愤怒地握紧了拳头，>\n\n那些铁矮人会因此付出代价！但我们当前还束手无策，况且我们必须先把焦点放在完成钥匙上，一旦我踏进奥杜尔的大厅，我会要那些烂铁块和他们的老大对他们所做所为给个交代！",cEN="Ruined? What d'you mean, the camp's been ruined?\n\n<Brann clenches his fists in anger.>\n\nThose iron dwarves will pay for this! There's little we can do now, and we have to focus on finishing the key. But once I get into the halls of Ulduar, the irons and their masters will answer for what they've done!"}
Q[13274]={d="勘探者索伦的笔记说，诺甘农的核心由一位名叫阿萨恩的哨兵保管，那是米米尔的作品之一。\n\n索伦说，阿萨恩所在的宝库如今被称为\"洛肯的交易\"。\n\n洛肯，嗯？土灵们提到过他。\n\n据说那座宝库在废弃的探险者协会营地西南方，入口是圆形，开在俯瞰远古之冬山谷的山腰上。\n\n找到这个阿萨恩，从他手里拿到核心，不过要是少不了一场打斗，我也不会意外。",dEN="Prospector Soren's notes say that Norgannon's Core is in the keeping of a sentinel named Athan, one of Mimir's creations.\n\nSoren says the vault where Athan resides is called \"Loken's Bargain\" these days.\n\nLoken, eh? The earthen have mentioned him.\n\nThe vault is said to be southwest of the ruined Explorers' League camp, with a round entrance on a mountainside overlooking the Valley of Ancient Winters.\n\nFind this Athan and get the core from him, but I wouldn't be surprised if you were in for a fight.",o="拿到诺甘农之核。",oEN="Obtain Norgannon's Core.",p="勘探员索雷是对的吗？你终于找到诺甘农之核了吗？",pEN="Was Prospector Soren right? Did you finally find Norgannon's Core?",c="这次错不了！钥匙就要到手了。现在我们要做的就是找出将诺甘农之壳诺甘农之核组合成钥匙的方法。让我们来看看勘探员索雷还说了些什么……",cEN="This is really it! The key is almost within our grasp. All we need now is a way to combine the shell and the core into a single key. Let's see what Prospector Soren had to say about this..."}
Q[13275]={d="你不该碰它的。但你已经碰过了，他很快就会来找你。\n\n他一定会找到你，除非你能躲藏起来，不让他发现。\n\n如果你还想活下去，就去弄一些无面者的鲜血回来！",dEN="You shouldn't have touched it. But now that you did, he's going to come looking for you.\n\nAnd he'll find you. Unless you hide yourself from him.\n\nBring me blood from the faceless ones if you want to live!",o="米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你收集3份无面者之血。",oEN="Matthias Lehner wants you to obtain 3 Faceless One's Blood.",p="你拿到血了吗？",pEN="Did you get the blood?",c="你还等什么？快擦在身子上！\n\n快呀！不然他就要看到你了！",cEN="What are you waiting for? You have to rub it on you!\n\nQuick! Or he'll see you!"}
Q[13276]={d="你知道该怎么做吧，$c。\n\n对憎恶的残骸使用这个工具包，制造一只听命于你的憎恶，然后命令它去攻击驻守在死亡之门的敌人。\n\n在我们对死亡之门发动攻击之前，你可以好好地熟悉一下这种战术。",dEN="You know what to do, <class>.\n\nTake this kit and use the guts from their abominations to create one of your own, then command it to attack the enemy forces at the gate.\n\nYou would do well to refine this tactic for when we make our assault on the gate.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你使用憎恶复活工具包制造一名复活的憎恶，然后利用它杀死15只冰寒食尸鬼、15只残忍的恶鬼和15名复活的联盟士兵。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver on Orgrim's Hammer wants you to use the Abomination Reanimation Kit to create a Reanimated Abomination, which you are to use to kill 15 Icy Ghouls, 15 Vicious Geists, and 15 Risen Alliance Soldiers.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="我能够看出你操纵憎恶的技术有不错的成长。\n\n努力点，我的朋友，很快的死亡之门就会属于部落。",cEN="I see your skills with the abominations are developing nicely.\n\nBe diligent, friend, and soon the gate will belong to the Horde."}
Q[13277]={d="尽管击败地面上的天灾士兵至关重要，但我们也不能疏忽了死亡之门的威胁。\n\n城墙上的血肉巨人可以投掷巨大的石块和冰块，对下面的部队造成毁灭性的伤害。\n\n集合一支队伍去干掉那些巨人。我们必须要对敌人有足够的了解。\n\n啊，对了……把它们的脊骨给我带回来。如果我没记错的话，那东西有一些特别的用处。",dEN="While it's going to be crucial to defeat the Scourge on the ground, we mustn't neglect the gate itself.\n\nThe flesh giants on the ramparts are capable of hurling massive boulders and chunks of ice, inflicting devastating damage to enemy infantry below.\n\nMuster a force and defeat these giants. We need to know just what we're up against in terms of their strength.\n\nOh... and bring me their spines. If memory serves, there's a little trick I can share with you.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你转至莫德雷萨，从血肉巨人身上取回5根奇特的脊骨给他。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver on Orgrim's Hammer wants you to bring him 5 Pustulant Spines from the Pustulant Horrors on Mord'rethar.",p="对付那些巨人有什么进展吗，<race>？",pEN="Any success against the giants, <race>?",c="非常好，这些看来是可行的样本，\n\n以彼之矛，攻彼之盾的时候到了……",cEN="Excellent. These look to be usable samples.\n\nTime again to use the enemy's strength against them...."}
Q[13278]={d="有报告指出死亡之门有一只非常强大的僵尸，$c。\n\n我们必须设法解除它带来的潜在威胁。如果你能亲自与它交手，应该可以了解到更多的有价值的情报。\n\n转至死亡之门西面的大厅，向这只怪物发起挑战，找出它的弱点。",dEN="Reports of a powerful zombie at the death gate have reached my ears, <class>.\n\nWe cannot allow a potential threat such as this to go unchallenged. Any information you are able to glean from engaging it will be better than what we know now.\n\nGo to the western chamber of the gate and find this creature. Fight him, and find a weakness we might exploit.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你转至莫德雷萨，杀死污染者科普洛斯。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to kill Coprous the Defiled at Mord'rethar.",p="你找到那个僵尸了吗，<class>？",pEN="Were you able to find the zombie, <class>?",c="干得好，<class>。\n\n也许经过一番调查，我们能弄清他们是怎么造出这样一个生物的。",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nPerhaps with some investigation, we can discover how they are bringing such a creature into existence."}
Q[13279]={d="<库尔迪拉取过脊骨，把里面的脓液倒进瓶子里。>\n\n我们对血肉巨人的特性有一点点了解……\n\n它们的脊骨脓液可以以一种非常有趣的方式与瘟疫病菌溶合，将瘟疫转换成一种腐蚀剂。\n\n虽然说从高高的城墙上泼下腐蚀剂会让下面的士兵非常郁闷，但至少受害者不会变成天灾军团的爪牙。\n\n把这只瓶子里的东西倒进死亡之门西面大厅内的瘟疫之锅里去。",dEN="<Koltira takes the pustulant spines and drains their fluid into a flask.>\n\nA little-known quality of the flesh giants...\n\nTheir spinal fluid interacts with the plague in a very interesting way, turning it into a corrosive acid.\n\nPoured from the towering ramparts, acid may not be a welcome sight to the troops below, but at least the victims won't rise up and add to the enemy's numbers.\n\nPour the contents of this flask into one of the plague cauldrons in the western chamber of the death gate.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者希望你转至莫德雷萨，将脊骨脓液倒进那里的瘟疫之锅。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to use Pustulant Spinal Fluid on a plague cauldron at Mord'rethar.",p="你中和掉一批瘟疫了吗，<class>？",pEN="Were you able to neutralize a batch of plague, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n等我们的军队抵达并向堡垒进军时，我们就会有夺取死亡之门的可靠计划了。",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nWhen our armies arrive to march on the Citadel, we will have a solid plan in place for taking the death gate."}
Q[13280]={d="瞧见伊米海姆西北方那座陡峭的山峰了么，你只要驾驶我的跳跃机器人尽快爬上山顶就行啦，$n！\n\n布拉斯·炸雷是个懦弱的坏蛋，他正在摆弄自己的破烂机器人呢，大概马上就要完工了吧。我们正在比赛，看谁能抢先占领那座山头！\n\n等你跳上去之后，将我们的军旗插到徽记堆里。让大家知道，联盟才是最棒的！我的工程学技术才是最棒的！",dEN="You've just got to get my jumpbot to the tippy top of the mountain to the northwest here at Ymirheim pronto, <name>!\n\nThat dastardly, no-good Blast Thunderbomb is working on his own bot, and I'm afraid he almost has it completed. We're in a race to see who's gonna be king of the mountain!\n\nOnce you jump up there, plant our battle standard in the pile of bones and show everyone that the Alliance, and my engineering skills, are the best!",o="伊米海姆的弗拉索·磨轮要你使用弗拉索的跳跃机器人，将联盟军旗插到山顶的徽记堆上。",oEN="Frazzle Geargrinder in Ymirheim wants you to use her Geargrinder's Jumpbot to plant the Alliance Battle Standard in the skulls at the top of the mountain.",p="等等……你还没插上战旗吗！\n\n还在等什么？",pEN="Hold on a second... you haven't planted our battle standard yet!\n\nWhat's the hold up?",c="你做到了！你做到了！\n\n<Frazzle salta y te da un gran abrazo.>\n\n哦，你是我最喜欢的英雄！\n\n你觉得明天能再来一次吗？",cEN="YOU DID IT! YOU DID IT!\n\n<Frazzle jumps and gives you a big hug.>\n\nOh, you're just my favorite hero ever!\n\nYou think you could come back again tomorrow?"}
Q[13281]={d="没有我的帮助，你也可以中和敌人的瘟疫之锅了，$r。\n\n去消灭死亡之门一带的血肉巨人，用它们脊骨中的脓液中和瘟疫。\n\n你所打击的是敌军最重要的核心部分。这是一个重要的任务——对我们的事业而言生死攸关的任务。只要时间允许，就应该尽力去完成。\n\n记住，你可以在莫德雷萨找到血肉巨人和瘟疫之锅。",dEN="You no longer need my assistance in neutralizing the enemy's plague cauldrons, <race>.\n\nHunt down the flesh giants at the death gate and use the fluid from their spines to render batches of the plague ineffective.\n\nYou are striking at the heart of the enemy's strategy. This is an important mission - vital to our cause, and should be carried out whenever time permits.\n\nRemember, the giants and the plague cauldrons can be found on Mord'rethar.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者希望你转至莫德雷萨，将脊骨脓液倒进那里的瘟疫之锅。\n\n你可以使用从起脓的血肉巨人身上收集而来的脊骨制造脓液。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you use Pustulant Spinal Fluid on a blight cauldron at Mord'rethar.\n\nYou can create Pustulant Spinal Fluid by using a Giant Spine collected from a Pustulant Horror.",p="你好，<class>。\n\n我可以报告说我们又让一个瘟疫之锅失效了吗？",pEN="Greetings, <class>.\n\nCan I report that we've rendered another plague cauldron useless?",c="战争的号角响起时我们将又少一个天灾之锅要对付。\n\n你的指挥官会很高兴。",cEN="One less plague cauldron to account for when the battle commences.\n\nYour commander will be pleased."}
Q[13282]={d="现在你该走了。我身后有一道传送门，它可以把你送到地面上去。\n\n我们还会见面的。他会来找你。\n\n他迟早会找到你。",dEN="You should leave now. You'll find a portal behind me. It'll take you to the surface.\n\nWe'll meet again. He'll be looking for you.\n\nIt's only a matter of time until he finds you.",o="返回奥格瑞姆之锤，向库尔迪拉·织亡者复命。",oEN="Return to Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="<name>！我们还以为你死了！\n\n那次爆炸让我们损失了几个人……但我们确实给了天灾军团沉重的打击。他们正慌忙把部队撤回堡垒，防御上留下了很大的缺口。是时候推进了。",cEN="<name>! We thought you were dead!\n\nWe lost a few men in that explosion... but we sure put a hurt on the Scourge. They're scrambling their forces back to the citadel and leaving big gaps in their defenses. It's time to push forward."}
Q[13283]={d="嘿，你好啊，$n。跟昨天一样，我要你驾驶跳跃机器人尽快爬上伊米海姆东南方那座山峰的顶部！\n\n弗拉索·磨轮这个自以为是的家伙，她老是说她的跳跃机器人比我的好！呸！我们正在比赛，看谁能抢先占领那座山头！\n\n等你跳上去之后，将我们的军旗插到徽记堆里。让大家知道，部落才是最棒的！我的工程学技术才是最棒的！",dEN="Yo, <name>, I need you to get my jumpbot to the top of this mountain to the southeast, like yesterday!\n\nThat girly, self-righteous Frazzle Geargrinder thinks that her jumpbot's better than mine. Hah! We're in a race to see who's gonna be king of the mountain!\n\nOnce you jump up there, plant our battle standard in the pile of bones and show everyone that the Horde, and my mad engineering skills, are the best!",o="伊米海姆的布拉斯·炸雷要你使用布拉斯的跳跃机器人，将部落军旗插到山顶的徽记堆上。",oEN="Blast Thunderbomb in Ymirheim wants you to use his Thunderbomb's Jumpbot to plant the Horde Battle Standard in the skulls at the top of the mountain.",c="我就知道你是干这活的合适<race>！\n\n\n\n我得承认，现在你是我有史以来最喜欢的<class>！\n\n明天再来一次怎么样？我会让你不虚此行的！",cEN="I knew you were the right <race> for the job!\n\n\n\nI gotta admit that right now you're my favorite <class> of all time!\n\nWhat do you say to a repeat performance again tomorrow? I can make it worth your while!"}
Q[13284]={d="你好，$c。\n\n最近我们一直在对伊米海姆发动猛攻，但是这些维库人比我们之前遇到过的要凶残得多。每次部队试图向伊米海姆推进时都会遭到伏击，我们的人员损失非常惨重。\n\n如果你愿意参战，帮助我的小分队安全抵达伊米海姆的大门，我们会好好奖励你的。抵达大门之后，我们就会挖掘壕沟，等待后援部队。",dEN="Greetings <class>.\n\nOur troops have been attempting to storm Ymirheim for some time, but these vrykul are far more vicious than any we've faced before. They've been ambushing us repeatedly as we try to make it up the pass, and we've lost a lot of men.\n\nIf you want to lend yourself to the battle and help get my squad to the gates of Ymirheim safely, we will gladly reward you for your efforts. Once at the gates, we'll dig in and wait for reinforcements to catch up to us.",o="护送破天号部队抵达伊米海姆的门口。完成任务后返回伊米海姆东面的冰川边缘，向地面指挥官库普复命。",oEN="Escort the Skybreaker troops to the gates of Ymirheim. Return to Ground Commander Koup at the edge of the glacier east of Ymirheim for compensation after the task is complete.",p="你让我那些弟兄安全抵达了吗？",pEN="Did you get some of my men up safely?",c="请接受我的感谢。\n\n我承认这是个残忍的作战，但话说回来我们也别无选择——他们比起我们这一连串的突袭其实也丝毫不逊色，我们必须驱逐这些维库人才能进压冰冠冰川。\n\n我们应该还会需要更多的援助。请再借助你的力量并且在战场上证明你的价值。",cEN="You have my thanks.\n\nThis has been a brutal operation, but we haven't had any great options otherwise - they're being equally as unforgiving to our aerial assault. We need to rout these vrykul if we're going to stand any chance of pressing on in Icecrown.\n\nWe're likely to need more help later. Please lend yourself to the battle again should the chance present itself."}
Q[13285]={d="哈哈！就在这里：创世神殿，守护者米米尔的大本营！当然，你得在那里把钥匙的两部分组合起来。\n\n根据勘探员的便笺所记载的内容，创世神殿就在造物者圣台西边的最高点。这就是说，它大概在你们那个格罗玛什坠毁点的东面。\n\n我会和你在神殿碰头，然后我们一起把它们组合起来。",dEN="Aha! Here it is: the Temple of Invention, the seat of Keeper Mimir himself! Of course, that's where one would go to join the two parts of the key.\n\nAccording to the prospector's notes, the Temple of Invention is one of the highest points on the western side of the Terrace of the Makers. That means it should be roughly east of your Grom'arsh Crash Site.\n\nI'll meet you at the temple and we'll combine the parts together.",o="布莱恩·铜须希望你和他在创世神殿碰头，帮助他把诺甘农之壳和诺甘农之核组合起来。等你完成了帮助布莱恩的使命之后，回到格罗玛什坠毁点，向伯克塔·血怒复命。",oEN="Brann Bronzebeard wants you to meet him at the Temple of Invention and help him combine Norgannon's Shell and Norgannon's Core. Once you have helped Brann, report back to Boktar Bloodfury at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site.",c="<当你告诉他伯克塔协助布莱恩找回圆盘的事时，伯克塔·血怒赞许地点点头。>\n\n借由发现奥杜尔事件的真相，布莱恩已经证明了他正是我们需要的盟友。你也做得非常好，我们需要一切援助来对抗洛肯与他的铁矮人爪牙。",cEN="<Boktar nods in approval as you tell him how you helped Brann recover the pieces of the keystone and combine them.>\n\nBrann may prove to be just the ally we need to discover what is truly happening in Ulduar. You've done well in aiding him. We need all the help we can get against this Loken and his iron dwarf minions."}
Q[13286]={d="时局令人绝望，$c……\n\n我感到异常焦虑，打算接受一切可能的帮助——包括这里的死亡骑士驻军。\n\n和萨萨里安谈一谈吧。看看他能否帮助我们改良对抗天灾军团的战术，确保我们一旦组织起足够的人手，就能够一击而胜。\n\n我们已经走到了这一步……绝对不能功败垂成！",dEN="Desperate times, <class>...\n\nAs uncomfortable as it makes me, I'm prepared to accept assistance from anyone - including our resident death knight.\n\nGo to Thassarian and see if he can help us develop tactics against the Scourge that will ensure victory once we are able to mount another offensive.\n\nWe have come so far... we must not fail here!",o="破天号的高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特要你与萨萨里安谈一谈。",oEN="High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker wants you to speak to Thassarian.",c="巴雷特指挥官遣你来是明智的。\n\n当他操心着让你对抗部落的事时，总得有人专注于真正的任务——冰冠堡垒的进军。\n\n有谁能比前任巫妖王的随从更能将你的努力指引向正确的方向？",cEN="It was wise of Captain Bartlett to send you.\n\nWhile he frets over your conflict with the Horde, someone must remain exclusively focused on the real mission here - the march on Icecrown Citadel.\n\nWho better to direct your efforts than a former servant of the Lich King?"}
Q[13287]={d="像你这样拥有丰富作战经验的英雄必定了解这一点：没有什么途径比亲自与敌人交手更能摸清对方底细了。\n\n虽然你渴望获得攻占冰冠堡垒的荣耀，但是我们必须首先突破巫妖王的每一扇大门。所谓知己知彼，百战百胜……\n\n我要你返回破碎前线，与敌人交战。寻找他们的弱点，然后向我汇报详细的情况。",dEN="As someone of your experience must surely know, there's no better way to familiarize one's self with their enemy than by confronting them in combat.\n\nWhile you no doubt lust for the glory of taking Icecrown Citadel, that cannot happen without taking each of the Lich King's gates first. For now, you must focus your efforts on the first of these...\n\nReturn to the Broken Front. Engage the enemy in battle. Search for a weakness we might exploit and return to me with a detailed report.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你转至破碎前线，杀死5名笨重的憎恶、5名邪恶通灵师和5名暗影专家。",oEN="Thassarian on the Alliance gunship, Skybreaker, wants you to kill 5 Hulking Abominations, 5 Malefic Necromancers, and 5 Shadow Adepts at the Broken Front.",p="你回来了，<class>……\n\n有什么要报告的吗？",pEN="You've returned, <class>...\n\nAnything to report?",c="真的吗，<class>？\n\n没什么值得报告的事？\n\n<Thassarian nota que la abominación sigue salpicada por tu ropa y sonríe.>\n\n我可不敢苟同……",cEN="Really, <class>?\n\nNothing notable to report?\n\n<Thassarian notices the abomination remains splattered across your clothes and smiles.>\n\nI beg to differ..."}
Q[13288]={d="憎恶……\n\n可怕的敌人。我不止一次目睹它们迅速地扭转了战局。事实上，它们也可以成为有用的伙伴，这一点倒是鲜为人知。\n\n憎恶并不聪明。只要你了解制造憎恶的秘密，就可以对它们发出简单的指令。相信我，它们会毫不犹豫地执行你的命令。\n\n你很幸运，我恰好知晓其中的奥秘。\n\n对憎恶的残骸使用这个工具包，将其复活。接下来你就可以利用它对付驻守在死亡之门的天灾军团了。",dEN="Abominations...\n\nThey can be a very capable enemy. I've seen them turn the tide of battle more than once. What few realize, is that they can also be very capable friends.\n\nThey are not deep thinkers. If you know the secrets of their creation, you can issue them basic orders that they will not question.\n\nFortunately for you, I know these secrets.\n\nThis kit will reanimate the remains of the abominations you defeat. Take it, and learn to use them against the Scourge on the death gate.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你使用憎恶复活工具包制造一名复活的憎恶，然后利用它杀死15只冰寒食尸鬼、15只残忍的恶鬼和15名复活的联盟士兵。",oEN="Thassarian on the Skybreaker wants you to use the Abomination Reanimation Kit to create a Reanimated Abomination, which you are to use to kill 15 Icy Ghouls, 15 Vicious Geists, and 15 Risen Alliance Soldiers.",p="怎么样，<race>？\n\n你那些憎恶朋友起作用了吗？",pEN="Well, <race>?\n\nDid your abomination friends prove effective?",c="看到了吗，<class>？\n\n面对看似不可战胜的敌人时，巧思有时也能扭转局势。",cEN="You see, <class>?\n\nIngenuity can sometimes even the odds against a seemingly overwhelming enemy."}
Q[13289]={d="你知道该怎么做吧，$c。\n\n对憎恶的残骸使用这个工具包，制造一只听命于你的憎恶，然后命令它去攻击驻守在死亡之门的敌人。\n\n在我们对死亡之门再次发动攻击之前，你可以好好地熟悉一下这种战术。",dEN="You know what to do, <class>.\n\nTake this kit and use the guts from their abominations to create one of your own, then command it to attack the enemy forces at the gate.\n\nYou would do well to refine this tactic for when we make another assault on the gate.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你使用憎恶复活工具包制造一名复活的憎恶，然后利用它杀死15只冰寒食尸鬼、15只残忍的恶鬼和15名复活的联盟士兵。",oEN="Thassarian on the Skybreaker wants you to use the Abomination Reanimation Kit to create a Reanimated Abomination, which you are to use to kill 15 Icy Ghouls, 15 Vicious Geists, and 15 Risen Alliance Soldiers.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="我看得出来，你操控憎恶的本事进步得很顺利。\n\n勤勉些，朋友，很快死亡之门就会属于联盟了。",cEN="I see your skills with the abominations are developing nicely.\n\nBe diligent, friend, and soon the death gate will belong to the Alliance."}
Q[13290]={d="在斩雷号任职期间，首席技师波尔维克凭借卓越的表现赢得了大家的喝彩。如今，他也是破天号不可或缺的关键人物。若不是他，我们的战舰早就被轰成碎片，散落在这片冰原上了。\n\n不过这家伙有个毛病，他喜欢与大家分享所有细微的发明或是发现——而其中大部分都超出了我的理解范围。\n\n我必须集中注意力对抗敌军，不能为这种事分心。\n\n请代我去跟他谈一谈，$n。如果可以的话，最好帮帮他。他就在船舱里。",dEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench has proven invaluable in his service aboard the Stormbreaker. Were it not for his ingenuity, we'd be sprinkled across half of the glacier several times over by now.\n\nThe thing is, he feels he must share his every miniscule invention or discovery - most of which I don't even understand.\n\nMy focus must be squarely on our enemies right now. I cannot afford any distractions.\n\nPlease visit him in my stead, <name>. And if you can, assist him. You'll find him belowdecks.",o="高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特要你与破天号的首席技师波尔维克谈一谈。",oEN="High Captain Bartlett wants you to speak with Chief Engineer Boltwrench in the Skybreaker.",c="卡皮派你代他来了，是吧？\n\n很好，<class>。卷起袖子……该干活了！",cEN="Cappy sent you in his place, did he?\n\nVery well, <class>. Roll up those sleeves... time to get to work!"}
Q[13291]={d="我懂，我懂。卡皮太忙，没空亲自来看。那是他的损失！\n\n你看，我从敌人手里\"弄到\"了一批溶液。虽然我很讨厌摆弄地精的劣质技术，但这次我打算破个例。\n\n拿着这个样本。我需要你去跑几次实地测试，证明它有用，同时我试着做点逆向工程，复制出它的制造过程。\n\n去前线收集制作诱饵的材料，然后使用这个油。",dEN="I get it, I get it. Cappy's too busy to see this for himself. His loss!\n\nSee, I've managed to 'acquire' a certain shipment of solution from the enemy. And as much as I hate tinkerin' with inferior goblin technology, I'm inclined to make an exception here.\n\nTake this sample. I'll need you to run a few field tests, just to prove its usefulness, while I try to do a little reverse engineering to duplicate the creation process.\n\nGo to the front and gather the materials to make a decoy, then use the oil.",o="破天号上的首席技师波尔维克要你在破碎前线使用偷来的液体。\n\n你需要收集被丢弃的头盔、被丢弃的护甲和一堆白骨才能召唤假人，这些材料都可以在破碎前线找到。",oEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench aboard the Skybreaker wants you to use the Smuggled Solution at the Broken Front.\n\nUsing the solution will require an Abandoned Helm, Abandoned Armor, and Pile of Bones, all found at the Broken Front.",p="怎么样，进行得如何，<race>？",pEN="Well, how'd it go, <race>?",c="好消息！\n\n我已经找出办法重制这些溶剂——虽然称不上什么大成就。\n\n我怀疑在我的有生之年，大概看不见有啥东西是地精能做而侏儒在梦游的时候做不出来的东西！",cEN="Good news!\n\nI've managed to reproduce the solution - hardly an accomplishment, of course.\n\nDoubt I'll live to see the day those neanderthal goblins cook up somethin' a gnome can't recreate in his sleep!"}
Q[13292]={d="嗯，嗯，再来一次怎么样？训练总是不嫌多的。\n\n我们已经找到了对付冰霜巨龙的法子。\n\n$r，继续削减它们的数量吧。你干掉的冰霜巨龙越多，我们在进攻冰冠堡垒时遇到的阻扰就越少。\n\n祝你好运。记得将没用完的液体带回来给我。",dEN="Oh, yes, yes. Back again, are we? Never enough practice, I suppose.\n\nHere we are, the solution to that pesky frostwyrm problem.\n\nMake them scarce, <race>. The more you take out now, the less we face when we are again ready to attempt our march on the citadel.\n\nBest of luck, now. And do bring back whatever you don't use.",o="破天号上的首席技师波尔维克要你在破碎前线使用偷来的液体。\n\n你需要收集被丢弃的头盔、被丢弃的护甲和一堆白骨才能召唤假人，这些材料都可以在破碎前线找到。",oEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench aboard the Skybreaker wants you to use the Smuggled Solution at the Broken Front.\n\nUsing the solution will require an Abandoned Helm, Abandoned Armor, and Pile of Bones, all found at the Broken Front.",p="什么事，朋友？",pEN="Yes, friend?",c="好一场秀！太好了！杀龙已经变成你日常生活的琐事了！\n\n哪天你想再把他们数量减少一点时，记得回来找我。",cEN="Good show! Good show indeed. You're turning into a regular wyrmslayer!\n\nCome back when you're ready to thin their numbers even further."}
Q[13293]={d="伊米海姆坐落在冰冠冰川的中心地带，我要你潜入这座冰霜维库人的大型城市。\n\n布拉斯·炸雷已经抵达城市西侧，代表战歌远征军与联盟展开了竞赛。他要使用跳跃机器人与对方进行抢占山头的比赛！\n\n别让我们失望，$n。地精工程学的尊严就靠你来维护了！此外，这里的士兵都指望着你呢。\n\n我们都下了注，赌你一定能胜过那些蠢货！",dEN="You need to get down to Ymirheim, that big frost vrykul town in the middle of Icecrown.\n\nOur boy, Blast Thunderbomb, is down there on the west side of town representing the Warsong Offensive in a competition against the Alliance. It's his jumpbot versus theirs in a king of the mountain contest!\n\nDon't let us down, <name>. Goblin engineering pride is on the line! Besides, all the boys here in the hold are counting on you.\n\nThat and we've got money riding on it that you can kick those cowards in the pants!",o="与伊米海姆的布拉斯·炸雷谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Blast Thunderbomb in Ymirheim.",c="嘿朋友，我还真高兴看到你！奥格瑞姆之锤上的老大差你来的吗？",cEN="Oh man, am I glad to see you! Did the chief send you down from the Hammer?"}
Q[13294]={d="尽管击败地面上的天灾士兵至关重要，但我们也不能疏忽了死亡之门的威胁。\n\n城墙上的血肉巨人可以投掷巨大的石块和冰块，对下面的部队造成毁灭性的伤害。\n\n集合一支队伍去干掉那些巨人。我们必须要对敌人有足够的了解。\n\n啊，对了……把它们的脊骨给我带回来。如果我没记错的话，那东西有一些特别的用处。",dEN="While it's going to be crucial to defeat the Scourge on the ground, we mustn't neglect the gate itself.\n\nThe flesh giants on the ramparts are capable of hurling massive boulders and chunks of ice, inflicting devastating damage to enemy infantry below.\n\nMuster a force and defeat these giants. We need to know just what we're up against in terms of their strength.\n\nOh... and bring me their spines. If memory serves, there's a little trick I can share with you.",o="破天者号上的萨萨里安要你从莫德雷萨的脓疮恐魔身上给他带 5 根脓疮之刺。|n",oEN="Thassarian on the Skybreaker wants you to bring him 5 Pustulant Spines from the Pustulant Horrors on Mord'rethar.",p="对付那些巨人有什么进展吗，<race>？",pEN="Any success against the giants, <race>?",c="非常好，这些看来是可行的样本，\n\n以彼之矛，攻彼之盾的时候到了……",cEN="Excellent. These look to be usable samples.\n\nTime again to use the enemy's strength against them...."}
Q[13295]={d="<萨萨里安取过脊骨，把里面的脓液倒进瓶子里。>\n\n我们对血肉巨人的特性有一点点了解……\n\n它们的脊骨脓液可以以一种非常有趣的方式与瘟疫病菌溶合，将瘟疫转换成一种腐蚀剂。\n\n虽然说从高高的城墙上泼下腐蚀剂会让下面的士兵非常郁闷，但至少受害者不会变成天灾军团的爪牙。\n\n把这只瓶子里的东西倒进死亡之门西面大厅内的瘟疫之锅里去。",dEN="<Thassarian takes the pustulant spines and drains their fluid into a flask.>\n\nA little-known quality of the flesh giants...\n\nTheir spinal fluid interacts with the plague in a very interesting way, turning it into a corrosive acid.\n\nPoured from the towering ramparts, acid may not be a welcome sight to the troops below, but at least the victims won't rise up and add to the enemy's numbers.\n\nPour the contents of this flask into one of the plague cauldrons in the western chamber of the death gate.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你转至莫德雷萨，将脊骨脓液倒进那里的瘟疫之锅。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you to use Pustulant Spinal Fluid on a plague cauldron at Mord'rethar.",p="你中和掉一批瘟疫了吗，<class>？",pEN="Were you able to neutralize a batch of plague, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n等我们的军队抵达并向堡垒进军时，我们就会有夺取死亡之门的可靠计划了。",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nWhen our armies arrive to march on the Citadel, we will have a solid plan in place for taking the death gate."}
Q[13296]={d="伊米海姆坐落在冰冠冰川的中心地带，我要你潜入这座冰霜维库人的大型城市。\n\n弗拉索·磨轮已经抵达城市南侧，代表无畏远征军与部落展开了竞赛。她要使用跳跃机器人与对方进行抢占山头的比赛！\n\n别让我们失望，$n。侏儒工程学的尊严就靠你来维护了！此外，这里的士兵都指望着你呢。\n\n我们都下了注，赌你一定能胜过那些蠢货！",dEN="I need you down in Ymirheim, that big frost vrykul town in the middle of Icecrown.\n\nFrazzle Geargrinder is down there on the south side of town representing the Valiance Expedition in a competition against the Horde scum. It's her jumpbot versus theirs in a king of the mountain contest!\n\nDon't let us down, <name>. Gnomish engineering pride is on the line! Besides, all the boys here in the hold are counting on you.\n\nThat and we've got money riding on it that you can kick those idiots in the pants!",o="与伊米海姆的弗拉索·磨轮谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Frazzle Geargrinder in Ymriheim.",c="是头儿派你从破天号来的吗？这可真是贴心呢！",cEN="Did the chief send you down from the Skybreaker? Isn't that thing sweet?!"}
Q[13297]={d="没有我的帮助，你也可以中和敌人的瘟疫之锅了，$r。\n\n去消灭死亡之门一带的血肉巨人，用它们脊骨中的脓液中和瘟疫。\n\n你所打击的是敌军最重要的核心部分。这是一个重要的任务——对我们的事业而言生死攸关的任务。只要时间允许，就应该尽力去完成。\n\n记住，你可以在莫德雷萨找到血肉巨人和瘟疫之锅。",dEN="You no longer need my assistance in neutralizing the enemy's plague cauldrons, <race>.\n\nHunt down the flesh giants at the death gate and use the fluid from their spines to render batches of the plague ineffective.\n\nYou are striking at the heart of the enemy's strategy. This is an important mission - vital to our cause, and should be carried out whenever time permits.\n\nRemember, the giants and the plague cauldrons can be found on Mord'rethar.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你转至莫德雷萨，将脊骨脓液倒进那里的瘟疫之锅。\n\n你可以使用从起脓的血肉巨人身上收集而来的脊骨制造脓液。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you use Pustulant Spinal Fluid on a plague cauldron at Mord'rethar.\n\nYou can create Pustulant Spinal Fluid by using a Giant Spine collected from a Pustulant Horror.",p="你好，<class>。\n\n我可以报告说我们又让一个瘟疫之锅失效了吗？",pEN="Greetings, <class>.\n\nCan I report that we've rendered another plague cauldron useless?",c="战争的号角响起时我们将又少一个天灾之锅要对付。\n\n你的总督会感到相当高兴。",cEN="One less plague cauldron to account for when the battle commences.\n\nYour captain will be highly pleased."}
Q[13298]={d="有报告指出死亡之门有一只非常强大的僵尸，$c。\n\n我们必须设法解除它带来的潜在威胁。如果你能亲自与它交手，应该可以了解到更多的有价值的情报。\n\n转至死亡之门西面的大厅，向这只怪物发起挑战，找出它的弱点。",dEN="Reports of a powerful zombie at the death gate have reached my ears, <class>.\n\nWe cannot allow a potential threat such as this to go unchallenged. Any information you are able to glean from engaging it will be better than what we know now.\n\nGo to the western chamber of the gate and find this creature. Fight him, and find a weakness we might exploit.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你转至莫德雷萨，杀死污染者科普洛斯。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you to kill Coprous the Defiled at Mord'rethar.",p="你找到那个僵尸了吗，<class>？",pEN="Were you able to find the zombie, <class>?",c="干得好，<class>。\n\n也许经过一番调查，我们能弄清他们是怎么造出这样一个生物的。",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nPerhaps with some investigation, we can discover how they are bringing such a creature into existence."}
Q[13300]={d="维库人将他们的俘虏送去位于冰冠冰川中心的伊米海姆，迫使他们进入那座城市的萨隆邪铁矿洞做苦工。巫妖王命令他们日夜不停地挖掘这种邪恶的矿石。\n\n我答应过弗丁大人，一定要将他们活着救出来。这就是我们眼下的任务。\n\n但是作为无畏远征军的使者，我不得不奉命待在这艘飞艇上。你能替我去救他们吗，$n？",dEN="Our people are being captured and put to work as slaves in the saronite mines of Ymirheim, the vrykul stronghold in the middle of Icecrown. The Lich King has them mining that unholy ore day and night.\n\nI made a promise to Highlord Fordring that we would get those wretches out of there alive, and that's exactly what we will do.\n\nUnfortunately, I've been ordered to stay on this gunship and serve as an ambassador to the Valiance Expedition. Will you please rescue them in my stead, <name>?",o="破天号上的虔诚的阿布萨兰要你去营救10名萨隆邪铁矿洞奴隶。",oEN="Absalan the Pious aboard the Skybreaker wants you to rescue 10 Saronite Mine Slaves.",p="我仍然未收到任何有关我的人民抵达银白先锋的消息。\n\n你确定你已经在伊米海姆还给他们自由了吗？",pEN="I haven't received many reports of our men returning to the Argent Vanguard.\n\nAre you sure you've been to Ymirheim to free them?",c="他们被逼疯了？脑子里有声音？\n\n你脑子里也有声音？！\n\n我要你把那地方渗进你脑中的污秽清干净，<boy /girl>。\n\n等你休息好了，我们明天再试着把剩下的人救出来。",cEN="They're being driven insane? Voices in their heads?\n\nVoices in your head?!\n\nI want you to clear your mind of the taint that has crept into that place, <boy /girl>.\n\nWe'll try to get the remainder of them out of there again tomorrow when you've had a chance to rest."}
Q[13301]={d="你好，$c。\n\n最近我们一直在对伊米海姆发动猛攻，但是这些维库人比我们之前遇到过的要凶残得多。每次部队试图向伊米海姆推进时都会遭到伏击，我们的人员损失非常惨重。\n\n如果你愿意参战，帮助我的小分队安全抵达伊米海姆的大门，我们会好好奖励你的。抵达大门之后，我们就会挖掘壕沟，等待后援部队。",dEN="Greetings <class>.\n\nOur troops have been attempting to storm Ymirheim for some time, but these vrykul are far more vicious than any we've faced before. They've been ambushing us repeatedly as we try to make it up the pass, and we've lost a lot of men.\n\nIf you want to lend yourself to the battle and help get my squad to the gates of Ymirheim safely, we will gladly reward you for your efforts. Once at the gates, we'll dig in and wait for reinforcements to catch up to us.",o="护送库卡隆部队抵达伊米海姆的大门。完成任务后返回伊米海姆北面的冰川边缘，向地面指挥官科特亚复命。",oEN="Escort the Kor'kron troops to the gates of Ymirheim. Return to Ground Commander Xutjja at the edge of the glacier north of Ymirheim for compensation after the task is complete.",p="你让我那些弟兄安全抵达了吗？",pEN="Did you get some of my men up safely?",c="请接受我的感谢。\n\n我承认这是个残忍的作战，但话说回来我们也别无选择——他们比起我们这一连串的突袭其实也丝毫不逊色，我们必须驱逐这些维库人才能进压冰冠冰川。\n\n我们应该还会需要更多的援助。请再借助你的力量并且在战场上证明你的价值。",cEN="You have my thanks.\n\nThis has been a brutal operation, but we haven't had any great options otherwise - they're being equally as unforgiving to our aerial assault. We need to route these vrykul if we're going to stand any chance of pressing on in Icecrown.\n\nWe're likely to need more help later. Please lend yourself to the battle again should the chance present itself."}
Q[13302]={d="维库人将他们的俘虏送去位于冰冠冰川中心的伊米海姆，迫使他们进入那座城市的萨隆邪铁矿洞做苦工。巫妖王命令他们日夜不停地挖掘这种邪恶的矿石。\n\n我答应过弗丁大人，一定要将他们活着救出来。这就是我们眼下的任务。\n\n但是作为战歌远征军的使者，我不得不奉命待在这艘飞艇上。你能替我去救他们吗，$n？",dEN="Our people are being captured and put to work as slaves in the saronite mines of Ymirheim, the vrykul stronghold in the middle of Icecrown. The Lich King has them mining that unholy ore day and night.\n\nI made a promise to Highlord Fordring that we would get those wretches out of there alive, and that's exactly what we will do.\n\nUnfortunately, I've been ordered to stay on this gunship and serve as an ambassador to the Warsong Offensive. Will you please rescue them in my stead, <name>?",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的凯尔坦修士要你去营救10名萨隆邪铁矿洞奴隶。",oEN="Brother Keltan aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to rescue 10 Saronite Mine Slaves.",p="我仍然未收到任何有关我的人民抵达银白先锋的消息。\n\n你确定你已经在伊米海姆还给他们自由了吗？",pEN="I haven't received many reports of our men returning to the Argent Vanguard.\n\nAre you sure you've been to Ymirheim to free them?",c="他们被逼疯了？脑子里有声音？\n\n你脑子里有声音？！\n\n我要你把那地方渗进你脑中的污秽清干净，小子。等你休息好了，我们明天再试着把剩下的人救出来。",cEN="Their being driven insane? Voices in their heads?\n\nVoices in your head?!\n\nI want you to clear your mind of the taint that has crept into that place, boy.\n\nWe'll try to get the remainder of them out of there again tomorrow when you've had a chance to rest."}
Q[13304]={d="天灾军团还没有从我们的这次攻势中缓过气来，$n。你顺利地完成了引爆任务，极大地鼓舞了大家的士气，我们要一鼓作气，继续战斗。\n\n位于我们下方的开阔山谷是一处战略要地。我们在失落希望之谷的东南角发现了一辆瘫痪的攻城车，似乎还可以使用。\n\n如果你能从食腐的恶鬼手里抢回丢失的零件，或许能让它重新运转起来。一辆攻城车就足以对敌人的地面单位造成重创了。",dEN="The Scourge is still reeling from our attack, <name>. Now is the time to capitalize on our momentum.\n\nThe strategically important valley below us is wide open. We've located a disassembled demolisher vehicle in what we believe is working condition in the southeastern corner of the Valley of Lost Hope area.\n\nIf you can get the remaining parts from the Scourge scavengers, you should be able to get it running again. A single working demolisher can wreak havoc on the enemy's ground units.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者从食腐的恶鬼身上收集5块攻城车零件，然后将它们带去失落希望之谷的损毁的攻城车旁。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to collect 5 Demolisher Parts from the Scavenging Geists in the Valley of Lost Hope and take them to the Wrecked Demolisher.",p="那辆攻城车受损的情况不太乐观。",pEN="The demolisher has suffered much damage.",c="攻城车以前的状况比现在好的太多，不过总算整体结构没有受到永久性的伤害。你取得的零件应该足以让它再次运转，至少暂时性地。",cEN="The Demolisher has seen better days, but the structure hasn't suffered any permanent damage. The parts you obtained should be enough to get it running again, at least temporarily."}
Q[13305]={d="你要用这台机器去对付天灾军团？你这样是无法胜过他们的。\n\n你或许可以消灭几百个敌人……甚至几千个，但你无法取得胜利。这样不行。\n\n等你摆弄够了这台机器，可以到北边来找我。那里有一座旧军营。我会让你认识到，你要面对的是怎样的敌人。",dEN="You're going to use this machine against the Scourge? You're not going to win against them like that.\n\nYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them. But you won't win. Not out here.\n\nWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the north. There is an old army encampment. What I will show you will teach you a little bit about who you're up against.",o="使用整修过的攻城车，在失落希望之谷里消灭150只腐朽的食尸鬼、20个霜颅大法师和2个白骨巨人。完成任务之后转至第一军团前线营地，与米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Refurbished Demolisher to destroy 150 Decomposed Ghouls, 20 Frostskull Mages and 2 Bone Giants in the Valley of Lost Hope. Speak to Matthias Lehner at the First Legion Forward Camp when you've completed this task.",p="玩完了你的战争机器了吗？",pEN="Are you done playing with your war machines?",c="看到了吗？你杀的那份数量不少，可你每消灭一个，就有另一个从泥土里爬起来顶替它。\n\n你不知道自己在面对什么，<name>。让我给你看看。",cEN="You see? You killed your fair share, but for every one you destroyed, another rose from the dirt to take its place\n\nYou don't know what you're up against, <name>. Let me show you."}
Q[13306]={d="一旦我们的部队开始动身穿越奥尔杜萨，他们就很容易遭到来自铁墙壁垒和广袤的冰川平原地区的攻击。\n\n我们没有时间和资源去建造防御工事，但可以搭建一些临时性的路障，抵御天灾军团的远程火力和突击，以保护我们的士兵。\n\n带着这只工具箱到奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷去。按照我在那里做好的记号，用这只工具箱制造一些路障。",dEN="When our forces begin to move beyond Aldur'thar, they will be vulnerable to attack from the Ironwall Rampart and the broad glacier below.\n\nWe have neither the time nor the materials to build fortifications, but we can put up some barricades to shield our men from fire and break up Scourge charges.\n\nTake this barricade kit to the Valley of Fallen Heroes, on the west side of Aldur'thar. Locate the markers I've placed there and use this kit to construct your barricades there.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你使用路障搭设工具建造8处路障。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to construct 8 Barricades using your Barricade Construction Kit.",p="路障都设立好了吗？",pEN="Have you constructed those barricades?",c="<Koltira asiente secamente>\n\n很好。这不算是多大的保护，但总比没有强。要是天灾军团的指挥官懂行，那道门依然是最完美的瓶颈。我们必须尽可能控制周边区域。",cEN="<Koltira nods curtly.>\n\nGood. It's not much protection, but it's better than nothing. That gate is still the perfect choke point if the Scourge commanders know what they're doing. We must gain control of as much of the surrounding area as possible."}
Q[13307]={d="天灾军团正在奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷和冰冠冰川里搜寻死者，想要用他们来对付我们。天灾军团的军官已经复活了山谷中的一些死者，并赋予了他们可怕的力量和狂热的忠诚。天灾军团首领所携带的旗帜是这种力量的源泉，去杀死那些旗手，以此减少他们所控制的被转化英雄的数量。\n\n你必须帮我们除去这个障碍，并且在大部队开拔之前帮助我们削弱天灾军团的抵抗力度。",dEN="In the Valley of Fallen Heroes and Icecrown Glacier, to the west of Aldur'thar, the Scourge seeks to use the fallen against us. Scourge lieutenants have woken the valley's dead and imbued them with fearsome strength and fervor. The banners carried by the Scourge leaders in the glacier area are the source of these powers. Kill the banner-bearers, and you will weaken the converted heroes they lead.\n\nIt falls to you to rid us of this obstacle, and thin the resistance before the main body can advance.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你去杀死5个天灾旗手、5个天灾转化者和20个被转化的英雄。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to kill 5 Scourge Banner-Bearers, 5 Scourge Converters, and 20 Converted Heroes.",p="你杀掉执旗者并阻止它们一再尝试利用逝往的英魂来对付我们了吗？",pEN="Have you killed the banner-bearers and stopped their attempt to use the fallen against us?",c="你除掉了天灾旗手与它们的爪牙？很好，我们的战斗准备必须要做点改变了。",cEN="You have removed the Scourge banner-bearers and their minions? Good. Our preparations must continue."}
Q[13308]={d="<你的脑海中响起了这个怪物的声音，它似乎在痛苦中挣扎，显得格外诡异。>\n\n$R，我需要你的帮助。和你那些被俘虏的朋友一样，我也被巫妖王手下的巨人给抓起来的。我从地下世界一路往上，想要调查从这座洞穴中传来的噪音，结果就被他们抓住并囚禁了起来。\n\n你愿意帮我吗？镣铐的钥匙就在矿洞中的工头身上。杀死他！\n\n<你感到一股压力冲击着你的思维，似乎这个怪物正在迫使你执行它的命令。>",dEN="<The creature speaks directly into your mind, its thoughts painful and strange.>\n\n<race>-thing, I am in need of your assistance. Like your enslaved friends, I am a victim of the Lich King's ymirjar and their avarice. When I rose from below to investigate the noises coming from this cavern they captured and chained me.\n\nWill you please help me? The foreman of these mines holds the key to my chains. Kill him!\n\n<You can feel a pushing against your mind as if the creature is trying to coerce you.>",o="萨隆邪铁矿洞的黑暗低语者阿克希姆要你去找到工头的钥匙，帮它打开镣铐。",oEN="Darkspeaker R'khem in the Saronite Mines wants you to recover the Foreman's Key to his chains.",p="我会大大地奖励你的侍奉。\n\n<暗语者投射一种令人放松的情绪到你心里。>\n\n你不会后悔释放我的。",pEN="You will be richly rewarded for your service to me.\n\n<The darkspeaker projects soothing feelings into your mind.>\n\nYou will not regret unfettering me.",c="<当你试图接近这生物，另一股兴奋，混夹着些许痛苦袭上你的内心。>\n\n好……很好！现在你知道我尝试着公平些，我将会依约地奖赏你。\n\n然后你便会自愿地交给我钥匙。",cEN="<Another wave of euphoria, mixed with some pain, crashes through your mind as you approach the creature.>\n\nGood... good! So that you know I am being fair, I will first give you your reward as promised.\n\nAnd then you will willingly hand me the key."}
Q[13309]={d="我已经选出了合适的士兵，准备将他们送进伊米海姆。你的任务就是保证他们的安全。\n\n维库人在围墙内设置了一些自动矛枪，已经打下我们好几架运兵机了。我们的工程师建造了一座压制炮台，可以让那些矛枪哑火。只要向矛枪周围扫射一通，炮弹产生的烟雾就可以挡住它的视线，阻塞它的机关。\n\n跳上这座炮台吧，保证我的士兵们都能安全着陆。",dEN="I've got some boys suited and ready for their drops inside of Ymirheim. I could use you to see them there safely.\n\nInside the walls, the vrykul have set up some kind of automated spear guns that have been tearing up our transports. We had our engineers install a Suppression Turret to shut down those spear guns - just fire a round near any gun and the smoke should block its sight and clog its gears.\n\nHop on the turret and see to it that all my boys make it to their drops in one piece.",o="伊米海姆以东冰川边缘的地面指挥官库普命令你使用破天者压制炮塔，让破天者运兵船撑到完成所有空投。|n",oEN="Ground Commander Koup at the edge of the glacier east of Ymirheim has ordered you to use the Skybreaker Suppression Turret to keep the Skybreaker Troop Transport alive long enough to make all of its drops.",p="你让我的弟兄们闯进去了没？",pEN="Did you get my boys inside?",c="非常好，士兵。我们这很需要像你这样的人才——改天若行动尚未终止记得再过来一趟。",cEN="Excellent work, soldier. We could use more able bodies like you around here - stop by another day if the operation hasn't wrapped up."}
Q[13310]={d="好吧，$greplegado:replegada;，我有点事能让你不至于完全是个废物。\n\n一支训练有素的渗透小队已经准备好空降到伊米海姆城内。里面的维库人有自动矛枪，一直在把我们的运输船撕成碎片，所以我们让奥格瑞姆之锤上的工程师赶制了一座压制炮塔。\n\n你就是$gel cañonero:la cañonera;。朝他们的矛枪开火，遮住他们的视线，堵住他们的齿轮。务必让我的人全部完成空投，让运输船保持完好。",dEN="Alright scrub, I've got something to keep you from being a complete waste.\n\nA unit of highly trained infiltrators is ready to be dropped inside of Ymirheim. The vrykul inside have automated spear guns that have been ripping our transports to shreds, so we had the engineers on Orgrim's Hammer whip us up a suppression turret.\n\nYou're the gunner. Launch rounds at their spear guns to obscure their vision and clog their gears. See to it that my men all make their drops and the transport stays in one piece.",o="伊米海姆北面冰川边缘的地面指挥官科特亚命令你使用库卡隆压制炮台，保证库卡隆运兵机安全降落并卸下所有部队。",oEN="Ground Commander Xutjja at the edge of the glacier north of Ymirheim has ordered you to use the Kor'kron Suppression Turret to keep the Kor'kron Troop Transport alive long enough to make all of its drops.",p="搞定了没？",pEN="Get the job done?",c="看来你还不是全然地没用，做得好。",cEN="Only partly useless then. Good work."}
Q[13311]={d="你现在已经收集到了恶魔套牌的所有卡片，一张新的卡片神秘地出现在你手中。卡面上描绘着一位占卜师，无论你把卡片转动到何种角度，占卜师似乎都在盯着你。\n\n你觉得似乎可以用这张卡片来联络某些人，或某些事物。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Demon cards together into a deck, another card appears on top. It depicts a fortune teller that seems to stare at you no matter how you hold the card.\n\nYou feel the card could be used to communicate with someone or something.",o="使用恶魔套牌召唤一位暗月占卜师，并把套牌交给占卜师。",oEN="Use the Demons Deck to summon a Darkmoon Fortune Teller and give the deck to them.",p="看来你已集满全套的恶魔套牌！恭喜！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Demons! Congratulations!",c="暗月马戏团对这些塔罗牌很有兴趣，如果你收集到更多的卡片，不要犹豫，立刻呼唤我们。我们也有自己的商人，所以请让我提供一些东西，来与你交换这些卡片。",cEN="You are quickly becoming a master of the quill. The tarot cards are of great interest to the Darkmoon Faire, so do not hesitate to call upon us if you manage to create more. We are not without our own skilled tradesmen, so please allow us to offer something in trade for the cards."}
Q[13312]={d="铁墙壁垒位于奥尔杜萨的西面，俯瞰陨落英雄之谷。它可以全方位控制下方的开阔地区。如果不攻下铁墙壁垒，我们就没办法继续前进，但是邪恶的格姆克尔和他所率领的诅咒教派信徒控制着壁垒。\n\n如果你能削弱格姆克尔的力量，我们的部队在开进那一地区时就可以应付突发状况了。带上这枚扭曲符文，到铁墙壁垒的最深处去，在格姆克尔的宝珠附近使用它，把那个通灵师引出来。",dEN="The Ironwall Rampart overlooks the Valley of Fallen Heroes, west of Aldur'thar. The rampart dominates the fields below on all sides. We will not be able to advance if the rampart cannot be taken, but it is held by Grimkor the Wicked and his Cult of the Damned disciples.\n\nIf you can weaken Grimkor, our forces know what to expect as we advance. Take this rune of distortion. Unleashing its power near Grimkor's orb at the end of the rampart should be enough to get the necromancer's attention.",o="击败邪恶的格姆克尔，然后向奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者复命。",oEN="Defeat Grimkor the Wicked and return to Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",p="你完成了你的任务了吗？",pEN="Have you completed your mission?",c="格姆克尔已经栽在你手上了？很好。少了他的妨碍，我们夺下壁垒的机会大大的提升了。",cEN="So Grimkor has fallen by your hand? Excellent work. With him out of the way, our chances of taking and holding the rampart during the assault are greatly improved."}
Q[13313]={d="联盟已经向位于奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷和冰冠冰川上空派出了一支侦察部队。\n\n这场战争绝对不能由他们来主导。首席技师考伯克拉向我提供了一种武器，可以完美解决这个威胁。他管这种新导弹叫做SGM-3。他向我保证，这种导弹肯定能一举打下联盟的飞行器。去用这种新式武器帮我们取得领先吧。",dEN="The Alliance has somehow managed to field a squadron of recon vehicles over the Valley of Fallen Heroes and Icecrown Glacier, the broad areas west of Aldur'thar.\n\nThey cannot be permitted to take the lead in this fight. Chief Engineer Copperclaw has supplied me with the perfect weapon to deal with this threat -- he calls his new missile the SGM-3. I have his assurances that it will take out the Alliance flying machines in a single hit. Go and use this weapon to give us the upper hand.",o="使用SGM-3摧毁6架破天号侦查机，然后向奥格瑞姆之锤的掠天者考尔姆·黑痕复命。",oEN="Use the SGM-3 to destroy 6 Skybreaker Recon Fighters, then report back to Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="很好，再有联盟鼠辈敢阻碍我们，我们就让他们见识一下什么才是真正的战士。",cEN="Good. Fewer Alliance pests to stand in our way. We'll show them what true warriors look like."}
Q[13314]={d="部落最近表现得很活跃，我讨厌这样。自从破碎前线的那次行动以后，他们已经开始变得越来越猖狂了。联盟必须阻止他们。\n\n他们在冰冠冰川的上空、奥尔杜萨和铁墙壁垒的西面有频繁的活动，斥候和传令兵骑着龙鹰进进出出，不断传递情报和命令。带上这把镖枪，用它去干掉那些奥格瑞姆之锤斥候。如果你也骑着飞行坐骑的话，这个任务应该更容易完成。",dEN="The Horde is up to something and I don't like it. After the stunt they pulled on the Broken Front, they're capable of anything, and it's up to us to stop it.\n\nThere's been a flurry of activity in the skies over the Icecrown Glacier, to the west of Aldur'thar and the Ironwall Rampart. Horde scouts and messengers streak in and out on dragonhawks, carrying reports and orders. Take this dart gun and use it to kill the Orgrim's Hammer Scouts. It'll probably work best if you're flying, too.",o="从奥格瑞姆之锤斥候身上截获6份奥格瑞姆之锤急件，把它们交给破天号上的高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特。",oEN="Capture 6 Orgrim's Hammer Dispatches from Orgrim's Hammer Scouts and bring them to High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker.",p="你成功拦截那些急件了吗？",pEN="Have you intercepted those dispatches?",c="有个能干的人来执行任务真好，<name>。要是我们有一支像你这样的<class>大军，就能让部落见识见识我们的本事了。这些缴获的报告会帮我们在这场战斗中保持上风。我们也许处于劣势，但远未出局。",cEN="It's good to have someone competent running missions, <name>. If only we had an army of <class>s like you, we could show the Horde what we're made of. These captured reports will help us to maintain the upper hand in this fight. We may be down, but we're far from out."}
Q[13315]={d="事情有了一些进展。我们已经想到了一个很有希望成功的战术，可以让我们获得死亡之门的控制权。巨大的人员伤亡是不可避免的，但我们应该能够取得最终的胜利——只要那些你成天嚷嚷着要去收拾掉的部落不给我们造成什么麻烦的话。\n\n不管怎样，荒凉之门奥尔杜萨将是我们的下一个目标。飞去那里去熟悉一下地形，了解敌人的兵力部署。\n\n等你回来之后，我会交给你一些任务去办。",dEN="Progress is being made. We have a promising array of tactics that should gain us control of the death gate. There will doubtlessly be many casualties, but in the end, we should be able to prevail - barring any interference from those Horde you insist on contending with...\n\nAt any rate, our next focus will be the gate of desolation. Fly down and become familiar with it and with the enemies posted there.\n\nWhen you return, I will have your missions prepared.",o="破天号的萨萨里安希望你飞往荒凉之门，调查荒凉之门的南部、中部、北部和西北部。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to fly down to the gate of desolation, visiting the south, central, north, and northwest regions of the gate.",p="你侦察过荒凉之门了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you scouted the gate of desolation, <class>?",c="很好，<class>。\n\n既然你亲眼看到了我们要面对的是什么，该动手了……",cEN="Well and good, <class>.\n\nNow that you've seen firsthand what we're up against, it's time to get to work..."}
Q[13316]={d="科雷萨又被称为恐惧之门，它是挡在我们与冰冠堡垒之间的最后一道屏障。它位于铁墙壁垒的南方，要越过冰川和战火平原才能抵达。当我们的部队开进那里以后，他们可能会遭到严重减员，甚至更糟。\n\n我们一定要削弱科雷萨的防御力量，不然我们的部队只会在它的城墙上撞得头破血流。\n\n科雷萨的城头上布署着巫妖王手下最凶狠、最狂热的仆从。你要尽量消灭这些守卫，希望这么做能有点用。",dEN="Corp'rethar, called the Horror Gate. It is the last barrier between us and the Icecrown Citadel. It waits to the south of the Ironwall Rampart, beyond the glacier and the Conflagration. By the time our troops reach it, they will be exhausted and worse.\n\nWe must weaken its defenses, or our army's strength will break upon its walls.\n\nIts battlements are manned by some of the Lich King's fiercest and most zealous servants. Do all you can to destroy these guardians and hope it is enough.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你去杀死5个恐惧先驱和5个科雷萨守卫者。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to kill 5 Harbingers of Horror and 5 Corp'rethar Guardians.",p="科雷萨的防御已经被你削弱了吗？",pEN="Have you crippled Corp'rethar's defenders?",c="我希望你在科雷萨的战功是一个预兆。这下子我们进攻他的城堡时巫妖王恐怕不能再袖手旁观了。",cEN="I hope your success at Corp'rethar will prove an omen of the battle ahead. The Lich King cannot sit idly by as we march to the very gates of his stronghold."}
Q[13318]={d="诅咒神教把守着荒凉之门，是吧？一点也不意外。\n\n该找点乐子了。你说在荒凉之门的南端，有新教徒正在受训。他们几乎肯定带着一件发给所有新入教者的特殊物品——一枚幻象宝珠。\n\n这些法器用来伪装教派成员，让他们得以安全通行、潜入，或者干脆混进敌人之中。\n\n杀掉那些蠢货，直到找到一个，$c，然后把它用在征服者身上。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned hold the gate of desolation, eh? No surprise there.\n\nTime to have a little fun. At the southern end of the gate, you mentioned there were new cultists being trained. They're almost certain to be holding a special item given to all initiates - an Orb of Illusion.\n\nThese artifacts are used to disguise a cult member, allowing them to gain safe passage, infiltrate, or simply blend in with an enemy.\n\nKill the fools until you find one, <class>, then use it on a subjugator.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你从奥尔杜萨的苦痛新兵身上夺取幻象宝珠，然后对那里的3名黑暗压制者使用。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect Orbs of Illusion from Bitter Initiates at Aldur'thar and use them on 3 Dark Subjugators there.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="就当前情况而言，是件很有效的工具，你不觉得吗？\n\n这一招永远不会过时……",cEN="An effective tool, given the circumstances, wouldn't you say?\n\nThat one never gets old...."}
Q[13319]={d="根据你的报告以及我对诅咒教派的认识，他们在荒凉之门一带的每座营地中都会有一个工头负责管理各项事务。\n\n虽然干掉他们的首领只会让他们暂时受挫，但至少这样可以拖延他们的工作进度，并让他们应接不暇。而且就当前来说，这也是一个足够有价值的成果了。\n\n去找到那些工头，消灭他们之后回来向我报告。",dEN="Based on your report, and my knowledge of the Cult, they have an overseer managing the operation of each encampment on the gate.\n\nWhile taking their leaders down will only be a temporary setback, it will at least slow them down and keep them off-balance. And that, <race>, is a worthy enough goal for now.\n\nSeek out these overseers and return to me when they have been dispatched.",o="破天号的萨萨里安要你转至荒凉之门奥尔杜萨，击败工头法埃迪斯、工头沙维尔、工头维拉恩和工头夏克尔。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you to go to Aldur'thar and defeat Overseer Faedris, Overseer Savryn, Overseer Veraj, and Overseer Jhaeqon.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="干得好，<race>。不过别高兴得把自己的胳膊拍断了。他们很快就会找人补上那些监督者……",cEN="Well done, <race>. But don't break your arm patting yourself on the back. They'll have those overseers replaced in no time..."}
Q[13320]={d="我在这里都闻到了他们的大锅散发出的气味，不过锅里煮的并不是瘟疫病菌。\n\n所有宣誓为诅咒教派效力的人都必须饮下一种可以夺走他们的意愿、使他们永远效忠巫妖王的药剂。\n\n有人说，这种药剂中封存着那些受到残酷折磨、并被无情屠杀的生物的扭曲之魂，不过我从来就没能成功地复制过这种药水……\n\n从荒凉之门西北区域的三处大锅里各采集一些样本，装进这只瓶子里，然后把它交给首席技师波尔维克。",dEN="I smell their cauldrons from here, but that's not plague they're cooking.\n\nPledges to the cult are forced to drink a concoction that steals their will and enslaves them forever to the Lich King.\n\nSome say the potion contains the twisted soul of a being who was tormented before being mercilessly slaughtered, but I've never been able to reproduce it...\n\nFill this flask with a sample from each of the three cauldrons in the northwest region of the gate and bring it to Chief Engineer Boltwrench.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你转至荒凉之门奥尔杜萨，在那里的3处诅咒教徒的大锅中使用分离的药瓶，然后将其交给首席技师波尔维克。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you to use the Partitioned Flask at each of the 3 Cultists' Cauldrons at Aldur'thar, then bring it to Chief Engineer Boltwrench.",p="你那儿拿着什么，<race>？",pEN="Whatdya got there, <race>?",c="<首席技师波克维尔将瓶子内的液体倒入四水分子分析仪。>\n\n现在你所看到的情况只是单纯的分子聚合失败。",cEN="<Boltwrench pours the contents of the flask into his tetrahydroparticle analyzer.>\n\nWhat we have here is a simple failure to conglomerate..."}
Q[13321]={d="这法子应该有效！\n\n那些扭曲的诅咒教徒想要把别人的灵魂放进他们的饮料里？那么让我们来帮他们一把吧！\n\n把这东西喝下去——不用担心，我已经对它进行了稀释……现在它唯一的作用只是让在你干掉诅咒教徒时可以发现他们的精华。\n\n等你收集到一些精华之后，把那些充满扭曲灵魂怨念的沸腾魔质扔进他们的瘟疫之锅里。\n\n看看他们尝到自己的药剂之后会怎样！",dEN="This should do the trick!\n\nThose twisted hooligans are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then I say we help 'em out a bit!\n\nTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... I'm almost positive that its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence once you've defeated them.\n\nWhen you've collected a bunch of them, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls into any of their cauldrons.\n\nLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!",o="破天号上的首席技师波尔维克希望你把沸腾的魔质扔进奥尔杜萨的瘟疫之锅里。",oEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench aboard the Skybreaker wants you to throw a Writhing Mass into a cauldron at Aldur'thar.",p="怎么样，<class>？\n\n我们要操心的教徒少了一些吗？",pEN="Well, <class>?\n\nWe have a few less cultists to worry about?",c="哇呼！\n\n这可给了他们点教训！",cEN="Wahoo!\n\nThat'll teach 'em!"}
Q[13322]={d="那些扭曲的诅咒教徒想要把别人的灵魂放进他们的饮料里？那么让我们来帮他们一把吧！\n\n把这东西喝下去——不用担心，我已经对它进行了稀释……现在它唯一的作用只是让在你干掉诅咒教徒时可以发现他们的精华。\n\n等你收集到一些精华之后，把那些充满扭曲灵魂怨念的沸腾魔质扔进他们的瘟疫之锅里。\n\n看看他们尝到自己的药剂之后会怎样！",dEN="Those twisted cultists are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then let's help 'em out a bit!\n\nTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... I'm almost positive that its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence.\n\nOnce you've collected a bunch of 'em, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls in one of their cauldrons.\n\nLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!",o="破天号上的首席技师波尔维克希望你喝下稀释过的诅咒教徒滋补剂，杀死奥尔杜萨一带的任意诅咒教徒，从他们身上收集被污染的精华。然后将10份被污染的精华组合成沸腾的魔质，把它扔进奥尔杜萨的瘟疫之锅里。",oEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench aboard the Skybreaker wants you to drink the Diluted Cult Tonic, kill any Cultists at Aldur'thar and take their Tainted Essences. You are then to combine 10 of the essences into a Writhing Mass and throw it into any of their cauldrons.",p="怎么样，<class>？\n\n我们要操心的教徒少了一些吗？",pEN="Well, <class>?\n\nWe have a few less cultists to worry about?",c="哇呼！\n\n这可给了他们点教训！",cEN="Wahoo!\n\nThat'll teach 'em!"}
Q[13323]={d="看来那些新教徒的数量又增加了。你知道该怎么做吧……\n\n新来的教徒在荒凉之门的南端接受训练。他们之中的绝大部分人应该都持有一件特殊的物品——幻象宝珠。\n\n这种宝珠可以用来伪装诅咒教徒，使他们能够安全地自由行动，渗透或是完全伪装成敌人的模样。\n\n去干掉那些蠢货，从他们身上收集幻象宝珠，然后对黑暗压制者使用它。",dEN="Looks like those initiates are increasing in number again. You know what to do...\n\nAt the southern portion of the gate, the new cultists are being trained. They're certain to be holding a special item given to all initiates - an Orb of Illusion.\n\nThese artifacts are used to disguise a cult member, allowing them to gain safe passage, infiltrate, or simply blend in with an enemy.\n\nSlay the fools until you find some, then use them on the subjugators there.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你从奥尔杜萨的苦痛新兵身上夺取幻象宝珠，然后对那里的3名黑暗压制者使用。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect Orbs of Illusion from Bitter Initiates at Aldur'thar and use them on 3 Dark Subjugators there.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="就当前情况而言，是件很有效的工具，你不觉得吗？\n\n这一招永远不会过时……",cEN="An effective tool, given the circumstances, wouldn't you say?\n\nThat one never gets old...."}
Q[13324]={d="当你把所有的棱镜卡收集成一副牌后，第九张卡神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张卡上写着：\"把这些卡交还暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。\"你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Prism cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把棱镜套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Prisms Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的棱镜套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Prisms! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套棱镜套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Prisms. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[13325]={d="当你把所有的混乱卡收集成一副牌后，第九张卡神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张卡上写着：\"把这些卡交还暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。\"你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Chaos cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把混乱套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Chaos Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",c="现在你已经集满了整套混乱套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Chaos. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[13326]={d="当你把所有的贵族卡收集成一副牌后，第九张卡神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张卡上写着：\"把这些卡交还暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。\"你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Nobles cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把高尚套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Nobles Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",p="看来你已集满全套的高尚套牌！恭喜你！",pEN="I see that you have managed to complete a deck of Nobles! Congratulations!",c="现在你已经集满了整套高尚套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Nobles. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[13327]={d="当你把所有的亡灵卡收集成一副牌后，第九张卡神秘地出现了，背面与前面八张一模一样。这张卡上写着：\"把这些卡交还暗月马戏团，即可获得奖励。\"你听说这个马戏团每隔几个月就在莫高雷和闪金镇轮流停留，所以你只能等他们下次来这里。",dEN="Now that you have gathered all of the Undeath cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.",o="当暗月马戏团来到镇上的时候，把死灵套牌交给他们。",oEN="Return the Undeath Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.",c="现在你已经集满了整套死灵套牌。把它交还给我们，你就会和暗月马戏团建立起牢固的联系。请允许我将一张更强大的暗月卡片送你作为酬谢。",cEN="So you have put together a deck of Undeath. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation."}
Q[13328]={d="巫妖王的手下在科雷萨的墙头安装了三种水晶，分别是绝望碎片、恐惧碎片和苦难碎片。一旦我们的部队抵达科雷萨城下，他就会使用这三种水晶进行攻击。\n\n如果让这些水晶完全发动，士兵们的精神就会被痛苦和恐惧压垮。这样一来，天灾军团就可以轻易消灭他们。\n\n去找到那些碎片，摧毁它们，把水晶给我带回来。我们不能让这些武器留在巫妖王手里！",dEN="Atop the battlements of Corp'rethar, the Lich King's minions have erected three crystals, the shards of horror, despair, and suffering. Should our men reach the walls of Corp'rethar, he will unleash these weapons on our army.\n\nIn full effect, the crystals will afflict the minds of our men with paralyzing pain and fear. Then, the Scourge will be able to slaughter them at will.\n\nFind these shards, destroy them, and bring me their broken remains. We cannot allow the Lich King to deploy these weapons!",o="将破损的绝望碎片、破损的恐惧碎片和破损的苦难碎片交给奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者。",oEN="Bring the Broken Shard of Horror, the Broken Shard of Despair, and the Broken Shard of Suffering to Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",p="你已经击碎了巫妖王的新武器吗？",pEN="Have you shattered the Lich King's new weapons?",c="<库尔迪拉从你手中接过水晶碎片，口中念念有词。>\n\n我想我记得这些玩意……\n\n意志稍微不坚定的人们很容易就会被水晶之力影响，从而被一网打尽。你成功地阻止了这威胁。",cEN="<Koltira takes the crystal shards from you and speaks in a quiet voice.>\n\nI remember these...\n\nLesser men would easily crumble beneath their assault. You have done well in removing their threat."}
Q[13329]={d="战火平原位于科雷萨的前方，铁墙堡垒的南方。巫妖王在这里布置了精锐部队以守卫冰冠堡垒。\n\n一队死亡骑士率领着大群的冰冠劫掠者守住了道路。我担心就算我们打倒了这些劫掠者，天灾军团也能复活它们，并把它们再次投入战场。\n\n我已经有了一个解决方案，不过尚不知道能否奏效。带着这瓶溶液，用它去溶解那些冰冠劫掠者的残骸。",dEN="The Conflagration, the ground before Corp'rethar, south of the Ironwall Rampart, is where the Lich King's elite soldiers have formed up to defend the citadel.\n\nLed by a contingent of death knights, a legion of skeletal reavers bars the way. I fear that even when these reavers fall, the Scourge will simply reconstitute them and send them back at us.\n\nI've come up with a plan to stop this, but I have no way of knowing if it will work. Take this solution and use it to dissolve the remains of the reavers.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你使用强酸溶解6具冰冠劫掠者的尸体。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to use the Volatile Acid to dissolve the remains of 6 Skeletal Reavers.",c="<库尔迪拉倾听着你的简报。>\n\n很好。我会让工程师们在我们准备进攻科雷萨之前，尽可能地制作更多的酸液。",cEN="<Koltira listens to your report.>\n\nGood. I'll have the engineers mix up as much of that acid as they can before we prepare to assault Corp'rethar with the main force."}
Q[13330]={d="那些得到巫妖王青睐的维库人自称伊米亚。他们居住在冰冠冰川中部的一座城市里。在进攻冰冠堡垒之前，我们有许多准备工作要做，而眼下摆在我们面前的这一项，就是消灭巫妖王这些所谓的\"天选者\"。\n\n去他们的城市伊米海姆，在他们的家中屠杀他们。要让所有人都毫不怀疑，谁才是这里更强的战士。",dEN="Those vrykul that have gained the favor of the Lich King call themselves the Ymirjar. They inhabit a city in the center of Icecrown. We have a lot of preparations to make before we assault Icecrown Citadel, and the one that stands before us now is routing these so-called \"Chosen\" of the Lich King.\n\nGo to their city, Ymirheim, and slaughter them in their home. Let there be no questions as to who the stronger combatants are here.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的战争使者达沃斯·里赫要你进入伊米海姆，杀死20个维库人。",oEN="Warbringer Davos Rioht on Orgrim's Hammer has sent you to kill 20 vrykul in Ymirheim.",p="你完成了我交代的事了？",pEN="Have you done what I've asked of you?",c="看来，也不过如此，巫妖王马上就得尝尝同样的苦头。",cEN="Not so strong after all, it seems. The Lich King will get what's coming to him."}
Q[13331]={d="联盟真是百折不挠，有骨气！但是如果他们想要阻止我们的话，就要付出更大的代价。带上这套SGM-3，再去打下来几架破天号侦查机。\n\n我很怀疑他们那可怜的头脑够不够用，不过足够的导弹应该可以清楚地表达我们的立场了。到奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷去，找到他们的侦察机。不把它们打下来，就别回来见我。",dEN="The Alliance is tenacious, I'll give them that, but it'll take more than that to stop us. Take this SGM-3 with you and shoot down the Skybreaker's recon fighters once again.\n\nI doubt the message will get through their thick skulls, but there are enough missiles to keep trying to get our point across. Go and find their fighters flying above the Valley of Fallen Heroes, west of Aldur'thar, and don't come back until you've made wreckage of them.",o="使用SGM-3摧毁6架破天号侦查机，然后向奥格瑞姆之锤的掠天者考尔姆·黑痕复命。",oEN="Use the SGM-3 to destroy 6 Skybreaker Recon Fighters, then report back to Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="很好，再次地，你确保了部落的优势，至少在那些令人作恶的联盟决定再次尝试之前……",cEN="Well done, once again. Horde superiority is assured, at least until those Alliance pukes decide to challenge us again."}
Q[13332]={d="一旦我们的部队开始动身穿越奥尔杜萨，他们就很容易遭到来自铁墙壁垒和广袤的冰川平原地区的攻击。\n\n我们没有时间和资源去建造防御工事，但可以搭建一些临时性的路障，抵御天灾军团的远程火力和突击，以保护我们的士兵。\n\n带着这只工具箱到奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷去。按照我在那里做好的记号，用这只工具箱制造一些路障。",dEN="When our forces begin to move beyond Aldur'thar, they will be vulnerable to attack from the Ironwall Rampart and the broad glacier below.\n\nWe have neither the time nor the materials to build fortifications, but we can put up some barricades to shield our men from fire and break up Scourge charges.\n\nTake this barricade kit to the Valley of Fallen Heroes, on the west side of Aldur'thar. Locate the markers I've placed there and use this kit to construct your barricades there.",o="破天号的萨萨里安要你使用路障搭设工具建造8处路障。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to construct 8 Barricades using your Barricade Construction Kit.",p="路障都设立好了吗？",pEN="Have you constructed those barricades?",c="<萨萨里安赞许地点了点头。>\n\n很好虽称不上铜墙铁壁，但总比没有的好。但如果天灾军团的指挥官还有点脑袋，那座门就仍然是个困扰。我们还是必须尽可能的占领周遭区域才行。",cEN="<Thassarian nods.>\n\nGood. It's not much protection, but it's better than nothing. That gate is still the perfect choke point if the Scourge commanders know what they're doing. We must gain control of as much of the surrounding area as possible."}
Q[13333]={d="不仅我们在努力，部落也在不断向铁墙壁垒和奥尔杜萨西面的冰冠冰川派出斥候。\n\n不能让部落通过这种方法领先我们。再带上这把镖枪，不要对那些奥格瑞姆之锤斥候手软！把你截获的急件都给我带回来。\n\n部落的损失就是我们的成果。",dEN="Despite our efforts, the Horde continues to send scouts to the area of the Icecrown Glacier, to the west of the Ironwall Rampart and Aldur'thar.\n\nWe can't afford to let the Horde gain the upper hand with this scouting operation. Take the dart gun with you again and show the Orgrim's Hammer scouts no mercy! Bring the captured dispatches to me.\n\nThe Horde's wasted efforts will be our gain.",o="从奥格瑞姆之锤斥候身上截获6份奥格瑞姆之锤急件，把它们交给破天号上的高级指挥官加斯汀·巴雷特。",oEN="Capture 6 Orgrim's Hammer Dispatches from Orgrim's Hammer Scouts and bring them to High Captain Justin Bartlett aboard the Skybreaker.",p="你拦截了那些急件了吗？",pEN="Have you intercepted those dispatches?",c="<提督接过信件。>\n\n这正是我们需要的。连部落也不会笨到盲目地进攻天灾军团。有了这些信件，我们将会有所准备。",cEN="<The high captain accepts the dispatches.>\n\nThis is just what we need. Not even the Horde is so stupid as to charge in blindly against the Scourge. With their reports in hand, we'll be well prepared."}
Q[13334]={d="天灾军团正在奥尔杜萨西面的陨落英雄之谷和冰冠冰川里搜寻死者，想要用他们来对付我们。天灾军团的军官已经复活了山谷中的一些死者，并赋予了他们可怕的力量和狂热的忠诚。天灾军团首领所携带的旗帜是这种力量的源泉，去杀死那些旗手，以此减少他们所控制的被转化英雄的数量。\n\n你必须帮我们除去这个障碍，并且在大部队开拔之前帮助我们试探一下天灾军团的抵抗力度。",dEN="In the Valley of Fallen Heroes and Icecrown Glacier, to the west of Aldur'thar, the Scourge seeks to use the fallen against us. Scourge lieutenants have woken the valley's dead and imbued them with fearsome strength and fervor. The banners carried by the Scourge leaders in the glacier area are the source of these powers. Kill the banner-bearers, and you will weaken the converted heroes they lead.\n\nIt falls to you to rid us of this obstacle, and test the resistance before the main body can advance.",o="破天号的萨萨里安要你去杀死5个天灾旗手、5个天灾转化者和20个被转化的英雄。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to kill 5 Scourge Banner-Bearers, 5 Scourge Converters, and 20 Converted Heroes.",p="你杀掉执旗者并阻止它们一再尝试利用逝往的英魂来对付我们了吗？",pEN="You have removed the Scourge banner-bearers and their minions? Good. Our preparations must continue.",c="你除掉了天灾旗手与它们的爪牙？很好，我们的战斗准备必须要做点改变了。",cEN="You have removed the Scourge banner-bearers and their minions? Good. Our preparations must continue."}
Q[13335]={d="战火平原位于科雷萨的前方，铁墙堡垒的南方。巫妖王在这里布置了精锐部队以守卫冰冠堡垒。\n\n一队死亡骑士率领着大群的冰冠劫掠者守住了道路。我担心就算我们打倒了这些劫掠者，天灾军团也能复活它们，并把它们再次投入战场。\n\n我已经有了一个解决方案，不过尚不知道能否奏效。带着这瓶溶液，用它去溶解那些冰冠劫掠者的残骸。",dEN="The Conflagration, the ground before Corp'rethar, south of the Ironwall Rampart, is where the Lich King's elite soldiers have formed up to defend the citadel.\n\nLed by a contingent of death knights, a legion of skeletal reavers bars the way. I fear that even when these reavers fall, the Scourge will simply reconstitute them and send them back at us.\n\nI've come up with a plan to stop this, but I have no way of knowing if it will work. Take this solution and use it to dissolve the remains of the reavers.",o="破天号的萨萨里安要你使用强酸溶解6具冰冠劫掠者的尸体。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to use the Volatile Acid to dissolve the corpses of 6 Skeletal Reavers.",p="你在机甲身上试过那些溶剂了？",pEN="Have you tested the solution out on the reavers?",c="<萨萨里安听着你的测试成果。>\n\n所以这些酸液发挥了作用？很好。当军队正面与掠食者交锋时我们将会需要这些。",cEN="<Thassarian listens as you describe your successful tests.>\n\nSo the acid worked? Good. We'll need it when the army goes up against the reavers in force."}
Q[13336]={d="那些得到巫妖王青睐的维库人自称伊米亚。他们居住在冰冠冰川中部的一座城市里。在进攻冰冠堡垒之前，我们有许多准备工作要做，而眼下摆在我们面前的这一项，就是消灭巫妖王这些所谓的\"天选者\"。\n\n去他们的城市伊米海姆，在他们的家中屠杀他们。要让所有人都毫不怀疑，谁才是这里更强的战士。",dEN="Those vrykul that have gained the favor of the Lich King call themselves the Ymirjar. They inhabit a city in the center of Icecrown. We have a lot of preparations to make before we assault Icecrown Citadel, and the one that stands before us now is routing these so-called \"Chosen\" of the Lich King.\n\nGo to their city, Ymirheim, and slaughter them in their home. Let there be no questions as to who the stronger combatants are here.",o="破天号的骑士队长德洛斯彻要你转至伊米海姆，杀死20个维库人。",oEN="Knight-Captain Drosche on the Skybreaker has sent you to kill 20 vrykul in Ymirheim.",c="巫妖王的大限已至。这点毋庸置疑。",cEN="The traitor king will fall. Of that I have no doubt."}
Q[13337]={d="铁墙壁垒位于奥尔杜萨的西面，俯瞰陨落英雄之谷。它可以全方位控制下方的开阔地区。如果不攻下铁墙壁垒，我们就没办法继续前进，但是邪恶的格姆克尔和他所率领的诅咒教派信徒控制着壁垒。\n\n如果你能削弱格姆克尔的力量，我们的部队在开进那一地区时就可以应付突发状况了。带上这枚扭曲符文，到铁墙壁垒的最深处去，在格姆克尔的宝珠附近使用它，把那个通灵师引出来。",dEN="The Ironwall Rampart overlooks the Valley of Fallen Heroes, west of Aldur'thar. The rampart dominates the fields below on all sides. We will not be able to advance if the rampart cannot be taken, but it is held by Grimkor the Wicked and his Cult of the Damned disciples.\n\nIf you can weaken Grimkor, our forces will know what to expect as we advance. Take this rune of distortion. Unleashing its power near Grimkor's orb at the end of the rampart should be enough to get the necromancer's attention.",o="击败邪恶的格姆克尔，然后向破天号的萨萨里安复命。",oEN="Defeat Grimkor the Wicked and return to Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker.",p="你完成了你的任务了吗？",pEN="Have you completed your mission?",c="格姆克尔已经栽在你手上了？很好。少了他的妨碍，我们夺下壁垒的机会大大的提升了。",cEN="So Grimkor has fallen by your hand? Excellent work. With him out of the way, our chances of taking and holding the rampart during the assault are greatly improved."}
Q[13338]={d="科雷萨又被称为恐惧之门，它是挡在我们与冰冠堡垒之间的最后一道屏障。它位于铁墙壁垒的南方，要越过冰川和战火平原才能抵达。当我们的部队开进那里以后，他们可能会遭到严重减员，甚至更糟。\n\n我们一定要削弱科雷萨的防御力量，不然我们的部队只会在它的城墙上撞得头破血流。\n\n科雷萨的城头上布署着巫妖王手下最凶狠、最狂热的仆从。你要尽量消灭这些守卫，希望这么做能有点用。",dEN="Corp'rethar, called the Horror Gate. It is the last barrier between us and the Icecrown Citadel. It waits to the south of the Ironwall Rampart, beyond the glacier and the Conflagration. By the time our troops reach it, they will be exhausted and worse.\n\nWe must weaken its defenses, or our army's strength will break upon its walls.\n\nIts battlements are manned by some of the Lich King's fiercest and most zealous servants. Do all you can to destroy these guardians and hope it is enough.",o="破天号的萨萨里安要你去杀死5个恐惧先驱和5个科雷萨守卫者。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to kill 5 Harbingers of Horror and 5 Corp'rethar Guardians.",c="我希望你在科雷萨的战功是一个预兆。这下子我们进攻他的城堡时巫妖王恐怕不能再袖手旁观了。",cEN="I hope your success at Corp'rethar will prove an omen of the battle ahead. The Lich King cannot sit idly by as we march to the very gates of his stronghold."}
Q[13339]={d="巫妖王的手下在科雷萨的墙头安装了三种水晶，分别是绝望碎片、恐惧碎片和苦难碎片。一旦我们的部队抵达科雷萨城下，他就会使用这三种水晶进行攻击。\n\n如果让这些水晶完全发动，士兵们的精神就会被痛苦和恐惧压垮。这样一来，天灾军团就可以轻易消灭他们。\n\n去找到那些碎片，摧毁它们，把水晶给我带回来。我们不能让这些武器留在巫妖王手里！",dEN="Atop the battlements of Corp'rethar, the Lich King's minions have erected three crystals, the shards of horror, despair, and suffering. Should our men reach the walls of Corp'rethar, he will unleash these weapons on our army.\n\nIn full effect, the crystals will afflict the minds of our men with paralyzing pain and fear. Then, the Scourge will be able to slaughter them at will.\n\nFind these shards, destroy them, and bring me their broken remains. We cannot allow the Lich King to deploy these weapons!",o="将破损的绝望碎片、破损的恐惧碎片和破损的苦难碎片交给破天号的萨萨里安。",oEN="Bring the Broken Shard of Horror, the Broken Shard of Despair, and the Broken Shard of Suffering to Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker.",p="你已经击碎了巫妖王的新武器吗？",pEN="Have you shattered the Lich King's new weapons?",c="<Thassarian te quita los fragmentos de cristal y habla en voz baja>\n\n我记得这些……\n\n意志薄弱的人很容易在他们的攻击下崩溃。你清除了他们的威胁，做得很好。",cEN="<Thassarian takes the crystal shards from you and speaks in a quiet voice.>\n\nI remember these...\n\nLesser men would easily crumble beneath their assault. You have done well in removing their threat."}
Q[13340]={d="我们需要更多人手来执行针对伊米海姆的作战计划。\n\n凡是有点脑子的战士都会告诉你，维库人非常凶猛，不可轻视。伊米亚更是维库人中的佼佼者。伊米亚会不遗馀力地向我们证明，为什么巫妖王更加看重他们。\n\n伊米海姆位于冰冠冰川的中心，这场战斗由地面指挥官科特亚负责。他的部队就驻扎在伊米海姆北面，靠近冰川边缘一带。",dEN="We need more men to join the main assault on Ymirheim.\n\nAny warrior with half a brain can tell you that vrykul are fierce fighters and should not be taken lightly. That goes two-fold for the Ymirjar. They have shown us no restraint in proving why the Lich King deemed them worthy.\n\nGround Commander Xutjja is overseeing the assault. The city itself is located in the center of Icecrown - Xutjja's troops are positioned near the edge of the glacier, north of the city.",o="向伊米海姆北面冰川边缘的地面指挥官科特亚报到。",oEN="Report to Ground Commander Xutjja at the edge of the glacier north of Ymirheim.",c="又来了个炮灰。欢迎来到人间炼狱，士兵。\n\n我的人手正在率领攻势由这端进攻大门。同时我们也准备空投渗透兵进城——陆空的前线作战都需要更多人手。我看这场战斗会持续一阵子。",cEN="More meat for the grinder. Welcome to hell, soldier.\n\nMy men are leading the assault on the gate from this position, and we're dropping some infiltrators in the city via air - we need more people on both fronts. I have a feeling that this attack will be going on for some time."}
Q[13341]={d="我们需要更多人手来参加对伊米海姆的进攻。\n\n凡是有点脑子的战士，都会告诉你维库人是凶猛的战士，不可轻侮。伊米亚战士更是如此。他们总是不遗馀力地向我们证明，为什么巫妖王更看重他们。\n\n这场战斗由地面指挥官库普指挥。伊米海姆位于冰冠冰川的中心，库普的部队就驻扎在城市东面，靠近冰川的边缘的地方。",dEN="We need more men to join the main assault on Ymirheim.\n\nAny warrior with half a brain can tell you that vrykul are fierce fighters and should not be taken lightly. That goes two-fold for the Ymirjar. They have shown no restraint in proving to us why the Lich King deemed them worthy.\n\nGround Commander Koup is overseeing the assault. The city itself is located in the center of Icecrown - Koup's troops are positioned near the edge of the glacier, east of the city.",o="向伊米海姆东面冰川上的地面指挥官库普报道。",oEN="Report to Ground Commander Koup at the edge of the glacier east of Ymirheim.",c="欢迎来到人间炼狱，士兵。\n\n我的人手正在率领攻势由这端进攻大门。同时我们也准备空投渗透兵进城——陆空的前线作战都需要更多人手。我看这场战斗会持续一阵子。",cEN="Welcome to hell, soldier.\n\nMy men are leading the assault on the gate from this position, and we're dropping some infiltrators in the city via air - we need more people on both fronts. I have a feeling that this attack will be going on for some time."}
Q[13342]={d="好了，，该安置一只虫子了。\n\n放松，确切地说不是虫子，但它能为我们所用。\n\n在奥杜尔萨北部，教派的虚空召唤者奴役着恶魔爪牙。用这根法杖从这些被奴役爪牙的尸体中吸取暗物质，然后用他们的召唤水晶把我们的小间谍唤出来。\n\n在被发现之前，这个信使就是我们的眼睛和耳朵，暗中监视敌人的行动。",dEN="Alright, <friend/missy>, time to plant a bug.\n\nRelax, it's not a bug exactly, but it'll serve our purposes.\n\nIn the northern portion of Aldur'thar the cult's void summoners enslave demonic minions. Use this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of these enslaved minions, and then use their summoning crystal to bring our little spy into being.\n\nUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你去收集5份黑暗物质，然后在奥尔杜萨召唤出一名黑暗信使。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect 5 Dark Matters and summon a Dark Messenger at Aldur'thar.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n那个信使已经带回了一些有价值的情报。",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nThe messenger has already turned up some valuable information."}
Q[13343]={d="你来了！呃，刚刚我是不是已经和你谈过了？\n\n<克罗米思考着时间流的可能性。>\n\n不管这些啦，永恒之龙正在追杀你！别紧张，不是现在的你。他们正在追踪过去的你，就在你保卫永恒沙漏的那个时间流里。你还记得这件事吧？\n\n那是过去的你，当然也是现在的你。哎呀，这不重要。你必须返回青铜巨龙圣地，抵御他们的攻击，保护你自己，当然还有保护永恒沙漏，不然你就会从历史上消失！",dEN="There you are! Or, were we just talking?\n\n<Chromie muses over the temporal possibilities.>\n\nAnyway, the Infinites are after you! Well, not you per-se. Rather, they're after the past version of you that defended the Hourglass of Eternity. You remember, right?\n\nThat was you back then, except it's you now too. Wait, that's not important. What is important is that you head back to the Bronze Dragonshrine and defend yourself and the hourglass from their attacks before you get erased from history!",o="龙眠神殿顶层的克罗米要你再次返回青铜巨龙圣地。\n\n进入圣地后，将永恒沙漏放在地上，和过去的你一起保护沙漏，令它免遭永恒之龙的破坏。",oEN="Chromie, at the top of Wyrmrest Temple, has asked you to travel once more to the Bronze Dragonshrine.\n\nOnce inside, place the Hourglass of Eternity on the ground and help your Past Self to protect it from the forces of the Infinite Dragonflight.",p="<克罗米以奇怪的眼光看着你。>\n\n我认识你吗？我从你身上感应到一种微妙的磁场，或者你被卡在时间的循环里。\n\n无论如何你最好赶快解决，否则你的存在岌岌可危。",pEN="<Chromie looks at you strangely.>\n\nDo I know you? I sense an aura about you as if your very existence is in flux. Either that or you're stuck in a time loop.\n\nWhatever the reason, you'd better fix it fast or you won't exist for very long at all!",c="我的天，你成功了！我本来还不敢确定。\n\n战斗中有一瞬间，你在时间流里忽明忽暗！我还以为我们肯定失去你了！\n\n但你安然无恙地到了这里，救出了过去的自己，走出了你所在的那个时间循环。\n\n你真是位了不起的时空<hero /heroine>，<name>！",cEN="Oh my goodness, you made it! I was uncertain.\n\nYou flickered in and out of the time stream there for a moment during the fight! I thought for sure that we'd lost you!\n\nBut here you are safe and sound, with your past self rescued, on the other side of the time loop you were in.\n\nYou're quite the temporal <hero /heroine>, <name>!"}
Q[13344]={d="教徒们已经发现了你上次召唤出来的信使，$r。\n\n虽然我们已经得到了大量的情报，但是能够监控诅咒教派的每一步行动对我们非常重要。\n\n转至奥尔杜萨，用这根魔棒从那些被奴役的爪牙的尸体上吸取一些黑暗物质，然后使用诅咒教派的召唤水晶，再帮我们召唤出一个黑暗信使。\n\n在黑暗信使被发现之前，它将一直作为我们的耳目，小心地观察敌人的行动。",dEN="The cultists have discovered the last messenger you summoned, <race>.\n\nWhile it was quite informative, it's important that we continue to monitor their every move.\n\nUse this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of enslaved minions at Aldur'thar. Then use their summoning crystal to bring another dark messenger into being.\n\nUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你去收集5份黑暗物质，然后在奥尔杜萨召唤出一名黑暗信使。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect 5 Dark Matters and summon a Dark Messenger at Aldur'thar.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="干得好，朋友。$gamigo:amiga;{None}\n就在我们说话的这会儿，信使已经在报告了。\n",cEN="Well done, friend.\n\nThe messenger is up and reporting in as we speak."}
Q[13345]={d="诅咒教派一直都是以喜欢制订庞大的计划但最终鲜有成功而声明狼藉，但我这次感觉有些不一样……\n\n也许是由于接近巫妖王，提高了他们的热情。不管怎样，它们似乎比以往任何时候都更有信心了。我们必须了解是什么让他们感到自信，并想办法夺走他们的自信！\n\n我相信关键就在他们的研究员身上。去搞清楚他们正在干些什么，然后向我报告具体的细节。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned are notorious for concocting grandiose plans that in the end, rarely succeed. But something feels different this time....\n\nPerhaps it's the proximity to the Lich King that has their fervor heightened. Whatever it is, they appear to be more confident than ever. We must know what feeds this bravado and then find a way to strip them of it!\n\nI believe the key lies with their researchers. Find out what they're up to and report back to me with the details.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你从奥尔杜萨的诅咒教派研究员身上收集3页诅咒教派研究笔记，然后将它们组合成诅咒教派论文。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect the 3 pages of Cultists' Research from the Cult Researchers at Aldur'thar and use them to create the Cult of the Damned Thesis.",p="你查明他们的研究员在搞什么名堂了吗，<race>？",pEN="Have you determined what their researchers are up to, <race>?",c="的确，事态似乎有点严重……",cEN="This is alarming, indeed...."}
Q[13346]={d="那些蠢货居然碰巧找到了可以对我们造成真正威胁的办法！\n\n这一教区的首领奥鲁麦斯在仪式中牺牲了自己，现在他的手下正在把能量导入他的灵魂中。\n\n如果让他继续这样不受干扰地吸收能量，他很快就会变成一个强大的对手。\n\n在他的大厅附近找到他的精华、徽记、节杖和长袍，将它们组合起来，然后在那里的水晶上面使用他的残骸。\n\n快一点，$r！在他变得更加强大之前消灭他！",dEN="These fools have actually stumbled upon something that could pose a serious threat to our plans!\n\nThe leader of this particular sect, Alumeth, has ritualistically sacrificed himself and now his underlings are channeling power to his soul.\n\nIf he's allowed to rest, their efforts will soon transform him into a mighty adversary.\n\nCombine his heart, skull, scepter and robes from around their chamber and use his remains on the crystal there.\n\nHurry, <race>! Destroy him before he becomes any more powerful!",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你转至奥尔杜萨，杀死晋升者奥鲁麦斯。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to defeat Alumeth the Ascended at Aldur'thar.",p="如何，朋友？你击败奥鲁麦斯了吗？",pEN="Well, friend? Were you successful against Alumeth?",c="奥鲁麦斯确实被击败了，然而我却似乎还能感应到他的魂魄尚在某处盘旋……",cEN="Alumeth has suffered a sound defeat, but I sense that his spirit still lingers..."}
Q[13347]={d="我们的命运在出生时就已刻在灵魂之上。伯瓦尔的陨落虽然悲惨，却不可避免。\n\n你现在唯一能做的，就是纪念你的英雄，$n。从战场上取回伯瓦尔的盾牌，把它带回给你的国王。当你把盾牌呈给瓦里安时，告诉他：\"一切并未失去。从陨落者的灰烬中，将崛起一支力量，它将团结诸国，清除这世上的邪恶。\"\n\n他绝不能失去信念。去吧，$n。你的人民需要一位英雄。他们需要你。$gun héroe:una heroína;",dEN="Our fate is emblazoned upon our souls at birth. Bolvar's fall, while tragic, was unavoidable.\n\nAll that you can do now is honor your hero, <name>. Collect Bolvar's shield from the field of battle and return it to your king. When you present the shield to Varian, tell him this: \"All is not lost. From the ashes of the fallen will rise a force that will unite nations and purge the evil from this world.\"\n\nHe mustn't lose faith. Go now, <name>. Your people need a hero. They need you.",o="从天灾之门安加萨的战场上取回弗塔根之盾，把它交给暴风城要塞中的瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王。",oEN="Gather Fordragon's Shield from the field of battle at Angrathar the Wrath Gate and return it to King Varian Wrynn at Stormwind Keep in Stormwind City.",p="<乌瑞恩国王拭去了眼泪。>\n\n<乌瑞恩国王点了点头。>\n\n这都是我的错……",pEN="<King Wrynn brushes away a tear.>\n\n<King Wrynn nods.>\n\nThis is my fault.",c="龙后说得对，<name>。一切并未失去。我将成为那支从灰烬中崛起的力量，我将把这世上部落的邪恶清除干净。我们兄弟姐妹的死不会白费。",cEN="The Dragon Queen is right, <name>. All is not lost. I will be the force that rises from the ashes and I will purge the evil of the Horde from this world. The deaths of our brothers and sisters will not have been in vain."}
Q[13348]={d="你现在明白了吗？派你的人去对抗王子的军队，只会让他们的数量更加膨胀。\n\n我不指望你能理解……你大概也只会落得和其他人一样的下场。你最好回到派你来的人那里去。他们也许会担心。",dEN="Do you see now? Sending your men against the prince's armies just swells their numbers.\n\nI don't expect you to understand... you'll probably just end up like the others. You'd best return to whoever sent you. They might be worried.",o="返回奥格瑞姆之锤，向库尔迪拉·织亡者复命。",oEN="Return to Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="你回来了。山谷的工作做得不错。从这看下去都能明显看到成果。\n\n你还好吧？你看起来好像见了鬼似的。",cEN="There you are. Nice work down in the valley. The carnage was visible all the way up here.\n\nAre you ok? You look like you've seen a ghost."}
Q[13349]={d="我们得保持势头。别给天灾军团任何喘息的机会。\n\n辛达苟萨之陨就在东边，刚过失落希望之谷。诅咒神教在那里活动，处于巫妖王亡灵维库走狗的严密监视之下。\n\n那是个蕴含强大力量的地方，可能是蓝龙军团的墓地。可怕的霜巢龙就是从蓝龙的尸骨中在那里被复生的。\n\n一次袭击将严重影响敌人获取霜龙的能力。你干得了吗，$glisto:lista;{None}？$n",dEN="We need to keep our momentum going. Let's not give the Scourge forces any respite.\n\nSindragosa's Fall lies east just beyond the Valley of Lost Hope. The Cult of the Damned operate there, under close supervision of the Lich King's undead vrykul lackeys.\n\nIt is a place of great power, possibly a blue dragonflight graveyard. The feared frostbrood are raised there from the bones of blue dragons.\n\nAn attack there would have great impact on the enemy's access to frost wyrms. Are you up to it, <name>?",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉·织亡者要你转至辛达苟萨之墓，杀死5个巨龙复活者、8个诅咒教派腐蚀者和3个维库通灵领主。",oEN="Koltira Deathweaver aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to slay 5 Wyrm Reanimators, 8 Cultist Corrupters and 3 Vrykul Necrolords at Sindragosa's Fall.",p="你好，<name>。",pEN="Hail, <name>.",c="你做得很好，<name>。你也许该休息一会儿。你看起来有点苍白。",cEN="You've done well, <name>. You might want to rest for a while. You look a little pale."}
Q[13350]={d="是奥鲁麦斯……他的力量又开始增强了，我能感觉到。现在他的手下正在把能量导入他的灵魂中。\n\n如果让他继续这样不受干扰地吸收能量，他很快就会变成一个强大的对手。\n\n回到奥尔杜萨的北部，在他的大厅中将他的精华、徽记、节杖和长袍组合起来，然后在那里的水晶上面使用他的残骸。\n\n快一点，$r！在他变得更加强大之前消灭他！",dEN="It's Alumeth... He's growing in power again. I can sense it. Again his underlings are channeling power to his soul.\n\nIf he's allowed to rest, their efforts will soon transform him into a mighty adversary.\n\nReturn to his chamber in the north portion of Aldur'thar. Combine his heart, skull, scepter and robes, then use his remains on the crystal there.\n\nHurry, <race>! Destroy him before he becomes any more powerful!",o="破天号上的萨萨里安希望你转至奥尔杜萨，杀死晋升者奥鲁麦斯。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to defeat Alumeth the Ascended at Aldur'thar.",p="如何，朋友？你击败奥鲁麦斯了吗？",pEN="Well, friend? Were you successful against Alumeth?",c="奥鲁麦斯确实被击败了，然而我却似乎还能感应到他的魂魄尚在某处盘旋……",cEN="Alumeth has suffered a sound defeat, but I sense that his spirit still lingers..."}
Q[13351]={d="事情有了一些进展。我们已经想到了一个很有希望成功的战术，可以让我们获得死亡之门的控制权。巨大的人员伤亡是不可避免的，但我们应该能够取得最终的胜利——只要那些你成天嚷嚷着要去收拾掉的联盟不给我们造成什么麻烦的话。\n\n不管怎样，荒凉之门奥尔杜萨将是我们的下一个目标。飞去那里去熟悉一下地形，了解敌人的兵力部署。\n\n等你回来之后，我会交给你一些任务去办。",dEN="Progress is being made. We have a promising array of tactics that should gain us control of the death gate. There will doubtlessly be many casualties, but in the end, we should be able to prevail - barring any interference from the Alliance.\n\nOur next focus will be Aldur'thar, the gate of desolation. Fly down and become familiar with it and with the enemies posted there.\n\nWhen you return, I will have your missions prepared.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你飞往荒凉之门，调查荒凉之门的南部、中部、北部和西北部。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to fly down to the gate of desolation, visiting the south, central, north, and northwest regions of the gate.",p="你侦察过荒凉之门了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you scouted the gate of desolation, <class>?",c="很好，<class>。\n\n既然你亲眼看到了我们要面对的是什么，该动手了……",cEN="Well and good, <class>.\n\nNow that you've seen firsthand what we're up against, it's time to get to work..."}
Q[13352]={d="诅咒神教把守着荒凉之门，是吧？一点也不意外。\n\n该找点乐子了。你说在荒凉之门的南端，有新教徒正在受训。他们几乎肯定带着一件发给所有新入教者的特殊物品——一枚幻象宝珠。\n\n这些法器用来伪装教派成员，让他们得以安全通行、潜入，或者干脆混进敌人之中。\n\n杀掉那些蠢货，直到找到一个，$c，然后把它用在征服者身上。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned hold the gate of desolation, eh? No surprise there.\n\nTime to have a little fun. At the southern end of the gate, you mentioned there were new cultists being trained. They're almost certain to be holding a special item given to all initiates - an Orb of Illusion.\n\nThese artifacts are used to disguise a cult member, allowing them to gain safe passage, infiltrate, or simply blend in with an enemy.\n\nKill the fools until you find one, <class>, then use it on a subjugator.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你从奥尔杜萨的苦痛新兵身上夺取幻象宝珠，然后对那里的3名黑暗压制者使用。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to collect Orbs of Illusion from Bitter Initiates at Aldur'thar and use them on 3 Dark Subjugators there.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="就当前情况而言，是件很有效的工具，你不觉得吗？\n\n这一招永远不会过时……",cEN="An effective tool, given the circumstances, wouldn't you say?\n\nThat one never gets old...."}
Q[13353]={d="看来那些新教徒的数量又增加了。你知道该怎么做吧……\n\n新来的教徒在荒凉之门的南端接受训练。他们之中的绝大部分人应该都持有一件特殊的物品——幻象宝珠。\n\n这种宝珠可以用来伪装诅咒教徒，使他们能够安全地自由行动，渗透或是完全伪装成敌人的模样。\n\n去干掉那些蠢货，从他们身上收集幻象宝珠，然后对黑暗压制者使用它。",dEN="Looks like those initiates are increasing in number again. You know what to do...\n\nAt the southern portion of the gate, the new cultists are being trained. They're certain to be holding a special item given to all initiates - an Orb of Illusion.\n\nThese artifacts are used to disguise a cult member, allowing them to gain safe passage, infiltrate, or simply blend in with an enemy.\n\nSlay the fools until you find some, then use them on the subjugators there.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你从奥尔杜萨的苦痛新兵身上夺取幻象宝珠，然后对那里的3名黑暗压制者使用。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to collect Orbs of Illusion from Bitter Initiates at Aldur'thar and use them on 3 Dark Subjugators there.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="就当前情况而言，是件很有效的工具，你不觉得吗？\n\n这一招永远不会过时……",cEN="An effective tool, given the circumstances, wouldn't you say?\n\nThat one never gets old...."}
Q[13354]={d="根据你的报告以及我对诅咒教派的认识，他们在荒凉之门一带的每座营地中都会有一个工头负责管理各项事务。\n\n虽然干掉他们的首领只会让他们暂时受挫，但至少这样可以拖延他们的工作进度，并让他们应接不暇。而且就当前来说，这也是一个足够有价值的成果了。\n\n去找到那些工头，消灭他们之后回来向我报告。",dEN="Based on your report, and my knowledge of the Cult, they have an overseer managing the operation of each encampment on the gate.\n\nWhile taking their leaders down will only be a temporary setback, it will at least slow them down and keep them off-balance. And that, <race>, is a worthy enough goal for now.\n\nSeek out these overseers and return to me when they have been dispatched.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉要你转至荒凉之门奥尔杜萨，击败工头法埃迪斯、工头沙维尔、工头维拉恩和工头夏克尔。",oEN="Koltira aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to go to Aldur'thar and defeat Overseer Faedris, Overseer Savryn, Overseer Veraj, and Overseer Jhaeqon.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="干得好，<race>。不过别高兴得把自己的胳膊拍断了。他们很快就会找人补上那些监督者……",cEN="Well done, <race>. But don't break your arm patting yourself on the back. They'll have those overseers replaced in no time..."}
Q[13355]={d="我在这里都闻到了他们的大锅散发出的气味，不过锅里煮的并不是瘟疫病菌。\n\n所有宣誓为诅咒教派效力的人都必须饮下一种可以夺走他们的意愿、使他们永远效忠巫妖王的药剂。\n\n有人说，这种药剂中封存着那些受到残酷折磨、并被无情屠杀的生物的扭曲之魂，不过我从来就没能成功地复制过这种药水……\n\n从荒凉之门西北本地的三处大锅里各采集一些样本，装进这只瓶子里，然后把它交给首席技师考伯克拉。",dEN="I smell their cauldrons from here, but that's not plague they're cooking.\n\nPledges to the cult are forced to drink a concoction that steals their will and enslaves them forever to the Lich King.\n\nSome say the potion contains the twisted soul of a being who was tormented before being mercilessly slaughtered, but I've never been able to reproduce it...\n\nFill this flask with a sample from each of the three cauldrons in the northwest region of the gate and bring it to Chief Engineer Copperclaw.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你转至荒凉之门奥尔杜萨，在那里的3处诅咒教徒的大锅中使用分离的药瓶，然后将其交给首席技师考伯克拉。",oEN="Koltira aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to use the Partitioned Flask at each of the 3 Cultists' Cauldrons at Aldur'thar, then bring it to Chief Engineer Copperclaw.",p="你那儿拿着什么，<class>？",pEN="Whatdya got there, <class>?",c="<铜爪将瓶内的液体蹈入他的分子分析仪。>\n\n啊……我知道这玩意！",cEN="<Copperclaw pours the contents of the flask into his particle analyzer.>\n\nAhh... I know just the thing!"}
Q[13356]={d="这法子应该有效！\n\n那些扭曲的诅咒教徒想要把别人的灵魂放进他们的饮料里？那么让我们来帮他们一把吧！\n\n把这东西喝下去——不用担心，我已经对它进行了稀释……现在它唯一的作用只是让在你干掉诅咒教徒时可以发现他们的精华。\n\n等你收集到一些精华之后，把那些充满扭曲灵魂怨念的沸腾魔质扔进他们的瘟疫之锅里。\n\n看看他们尝到自己的药剂之后会怎样！",dEN="This should do the trick!\n\nThose twisted hooligans are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then I say we help 'em out a bit!\n\nTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... Its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence once you've defeated them.\n\nWhen you've collected a bunch of essences, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls into any of their cauldrons.\n\nLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的首席技师考伯克拉希望你把沸腾的魔质扔进奥尔杜萨的瘟疫之锅里。",oEN="Chief Engineer Copperclaw aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to throw a Writhing Mass into a cauldron at Aldur'thar.",c="哇呼！\n\n这可给了他们点教训！",cEN="Wahoo!\n\nThat'll teach 'em!"}
Q[13357]={d="那些扭曲的诅咒教徒想要把别人的灵魂放进他们的饮料里？那么让我们来帮他们一把吧！\n\n把这东西喝下去——不用担心，我已经对它进行了稀释……现在它唯一的作用只是让在你干掉诅咒教徒时可以发现他们的精华。\n\n等你收集到一些精华之后，把那些充满扭曲灵魂怨念的沸腾魔质扔进他们的瘟疫之锅里。\n\n看看他们尝到自己的药剂之后会怎样！",dEN="Those twisted cultists are looking for souls to put in their crazy-juice? Then let's help 'em out a bit!\n\nTake a swig of this - don't worry, I've diluted it plenty... I'm almost positive that its only effect will be to detect any cultist's essence.\n\nOnce you've collected a bunch of 'em, throw the writhing mass of twisted souls in one of their cauldrons.\n\nLet's see how they like a taste of their own medicine!",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的首席技师考伯克拉希望你把沸腾的魔质扔进奥尔杜萨的瘟疫之锅里。",oEN="Chief Engineer Copperclaw aboard Orgrim's Hammer wants you to throw a Writhing Mass into a cauldron at Aldur'thar.",p="如何？结果怎样？",pEN="Well? How'd it turn out?",c="哇呼！\n\n这可给了他们点教训！",cEN="Wahoo!\n\nThat'll teach 'em!"}
Q[13358]={d="好了，，该安置一只虫子了。\n\n放松，确切地说不是虫子，但它能为我们所用。\n\n在奥杜尔萨北部，教派的虚空召唤者奴役着恶魔爪牙。用这根法杖从这些被奴役爪牙的尸体中吸取暗物质，然后用他们的召唤水晶把我们的小间谍唤出来。\n\n在被发现之前，这个信使就是我们的眼睛和耳朵，暗中监视敌人的行动。",dEN="Alright, <friend/missy>, time to plant a bug.\n\nRelax, it's not a bug exactly, but it'll serve our purposes.\n\nIn the northern portion of Aldur'thar, the cult's void summoners enslave demonic minions. Use this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of these enslaved minions, and then use the cultists' summoning crystal to bring our little spy into being.\n\nUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你去收集5份黑暗物质，然后在奥尔杜萨召唤出一名黑暗信使。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to collect 5 Dark Matters and summon a Dark Messenger at Aldur'thar.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="你做得很好，<class>。\n\n那个信使已经带回了一些有价值的情报。",cEN="You have done well, <class>.\n\nThe messenger has already turned up some valuable information."}
Q[13359]={d="曾经有一群蓝色的巨龙死在这里。现在，他的仆从正在逐个复活它们。\n\n他亲自复活了其中最大的一条龙。给我从雏龙身上弄一些骨灰下来，我会向你展示他是如何复活那条龙的。",dEN="A whole brood of blue dragons fell here. And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.\n\nHe raised the biggest of them all himself. Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it.",o="辛达苟萨之墓的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你收集6份雏龙的骨灰。",oEN="Matthias Lehner at Sindragosa's Fall wants you to obtain 6 Whelp Bone Dusts.",p="你拿到那些尘土了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you get the dust, <name>?",c="连最强大的龙族都必须响应他的召唤。像你这样脆弱的凡人要如何抵抗他？",cEN="Even the mighty wyrms had to heed his call. How is a simple mortal like you going to resist him?"}
Q[13360]={d="你的问题真多，$n。只有你能看见我，是因为你摸过一件曾经属于他的东西……你不记得了吗？$gel único:la única;{None}\n你不知道那是什么？嗯，我不能直接告诉你……那会让他非常生气的。他不再只是个王子了……他是国王！\n\n到冰冠堡垒北面的白骨庭院来找我，你就能亲眼看到了。\n",dEN="You have a lot of questions, <name>. You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?\n\nYou don't know what it is? Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad. He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!\n\nMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself.",o="转至白骨之庭，与米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Matthias Lehner at the Court of Bones.",c="你在这儿。我还以为你不来了。",cEN="There you are. I started to wonder whether you'd show up."}
Q[13361]={d="在王子成为国王之前，他经历过很多战斗……但其中只有一场战斗使他差点丢掉性命。\n\n那场战斗就发生在这里。等你看过我向你展示的场景以后，你就都明白了。\n\n从地上拣起一块染血的石头，然后你就可以看到当时的情景了。",dEN="Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.\n\nIt was fought right here. After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.\n\nFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor. You'll see what happened.",o="白骨之庭的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你去寻找一块染血的石头，并目睹王子的命运。",oEN="Matthias Lehner in the Court of Bones wants you to look for a Bloodstained Stone and complete the Prince's Destiny.",p="你看到了吗，<name>？看到了吗？",pEN="Did you see, <name>? Did you?",c="那场战斗之后，王子意识到，束缚他的是他仍然还是人类……他仍然能感受……他仍然会流血。他还有一颗心。\n\n他成为国王后做的第一件事，就是把这颗心从自己身上除去。他把它扔进了我们初次相遇的那个深坑。而你，<name>，是此后第一个触碰它的人。",cEN="After that fight, the prince realized what was holding him back was that he was still human... he could still feel... he could still bleed. He still had a heart.\n\nThe first thing he did when he became king was to rid of himself of it. He threw it down the pit where we first met. And you, <name>, were the first person to touch it since."}
Q[13362]={d="现在你该明白自己面对的是怎样的敌人了，$n。他不会感到痛苦……悔恨……他完全没有人性。他为达目的，不择手段。\n\n这颗心就是他的弱点，现在他已经知道你发现了它。\n\n如果你要回去找那颗心，最好带一些帮手去。他不会再任由它全不设防地躺在那里了。",dEN="Now you know what you're up against, <name>. An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity. An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.\n\nThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.\n\nIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help. He will not leave it unguarded again.",o="向奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉复命。",oEN="Report back to Koltira aboard Orgrim's Hammer.",c="什么小孩子的鬼魂……什么阿尔萨斯的心……你得说慢一点……我头都晕了。",cEN="Little kid's ghost... Arthas's heart... you'd better slow down... you're making my head spin."}
Q[13363]={d="以前，死亡骑士们一直把你说的这些事当作故事来讲，而我总觉得它并不仅仅是一个象征性的故事那么简单……果不其然。\n\n我们必须警告其它人，但你我必须分头行动。一旦巫妖王知晓了我们的计划，他就会把那颗心转移到其它地方去——那样一来，我们就再也等不到这么好的机会了。\n\n诅咒教派已经渗透了部落和联盟，黑锋骑士团和天灾军团的关系又太过密切。\n\n我们要去和提里奥·弗丁及他的银色北伐军谈一谈。",dEN="There were rumors about the events you speak of among the death knights. I always expected the story to be more... symbolic.\n\nWe must warn others, but we must be discreet. As soon as the Lich King knows we're making our move, he'll move the location of the heart -- we'll never get a chance like this again.\n\nThe Horde and the Alliance have been infiltrated by the Cult of the Damned before. The Ebon Blade operates too close to the Scourge.\n\nWe have to speak to Tirion Fordring and his Argent Crusade.",o="与北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Highlord Tirion Fordring at the Crusader's Pinnacle.",c="话说得很重，<name>。要是换个人说这些话，我多半会认为他疯了。",cEN="Heavy words, <name>. If it were somebody else saying them, I'd be likely to judge them insane."}
Q[13364]={d="就在今天早上，我的斥候报告说，有一队诅咒教派的教徒带着一样东西离开冰冠堡垒，转至黑暗大教堂了。\n\n现在我明白了，那恐怕就是阿尔萨斯的心脏……里面残留着他的最后一点尚未泯灭的人性。\n\n这是圣光的启示。只要这颗心脏仍然存在，阿尔萨斯·米奈希尔就有可能变回人类！\n\n我们到大教堂的入口处汇合吧。记得带一件教徒的兜帽来，我们要乔装混进去。",dEN="Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.\n\nAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.\n\nThis is a sign of the Light. As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!\n\nMeet me at the cathedral's entrance. Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito.",o="北伐军之峰的提里奥·弗丁要你想办法获取一件诅咒教徒的兜帽，穿上它，然后转至冰冠堡垒西北方的黑暗大教堂入口处与他汇合。",oEN="Tirion Fordring, at the Crusader's Pinnacle, wants you to obtain and wear a Cultist Acolyte's Hood and meet him at the entrance of the Cathedral of Darkness, northwest of Icecrown Citadel.",p="愿圣光与你同在，<name>。",pEN="Light be with you, <name>.",c="我不认为我们刚刚经历的一切是失败，<name>……恰恰相反。\n\n你让我窥见他的内心，从而让我确认了我需要知道的事。阿尔萨斯·米奈希尔已经不存在了——只剩下巫妖王。",cEN="I do not view what we just went through as a failure, <name>... quite the opposite.\n\nBy allowing me to peer into his heart, you allowed me to confirm what I needed to know. There is no Arthas Menethil anymore -- there is only the Lich King."}
Q[13365]={d="教徒们已经发现了你上次召唤出来的信使，$r。\n\n虽然我们已经得到了大量的情报，但是能够监控诅咒教派的每一步行动对我们非常重要。\n\n转至奥尔杜萨，用这根魔棒从那些被奴役的爪牙的尸体上吸取一些黑暗物质，然后使用诅咒教派的召唤水晶，再帮我们召唤出一个黑暗信使。\n\n在黑暗信使被发现之前，它将一直作为我们的耳目，小心地观察敌人的行动。",dEN="The cultists have discovered the last messenger you summoned, <race>.\n\nWhile it was quite informative, it's important that we continue to monitor the cult's every move.\n\nUse this rod to siphon the dark matter from the corpses of enslaved minions at Aldur'thar. Then use their summoning crystal to bring another dark messenger into being.\n\nUntil it is discovered, the messenger will serve as our eyes and ears, discreetly observing the actions of our enemy.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你去收集5份黑暗物质，然后在奥尔杜萨召唤出一名黑暗信使。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to collect 5 Dark Matters and summon a Dark Messenger at Aldur'thar.",p="什么事，<class>？",pEN="Yes, <class>?",c="干得好，朋友。$gamigo:amiga;{None}\n就在我们说话的这会儿，信使已经在报告了。\n",cEN="Well done, friend.\n\nThe messenger is up and reporting in as we speak."}
Q[13366]={d="诅咒教派一直都是以喜欢制订庞大的计划但最终鲜有成功而声明狼藉，但我这次感觉有些不一样……\n\n也许是由于接近巫妖王，提高了他们的热情。不管怎样，它们似乎比以往任何时候都更有信心了。我们必须了解是什么让他们感到自信，并想办法夺走他们的自信！\n\n我相信关键就在他们的研究员身上。去搞清楚他们正在干些什么，然后向我报告具体的细节。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned are notorious for concocting grandiose plans that in the end, rarely succeed. But something feels different this time....\n\nPerhaps it's the proximity to the Lich King that has their fervor heightened. Whatever it is, they appear to be more confident than ever. We must know what feeds this bravado and then find a way to strip them of it!\n\nI believe the key lies with their researchers. Find out what they're up to and report back to me with the details.",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望你从奥尔杜萨的诅咒教派研究员身上收集3页诅咒教派研究笔记，然后将它们组合成诅咒教派论文。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to collect the 3 pages of Cultists' Research from the Cult Researchers at Aldur'thar and use them to create the Cult of the Damned Thesis.",p="你发现他们的研究员在搞什么名堂了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you discovered what their researchers are up to, <class>?",c="的确，事态似乎有点严重……",cEN="This is alarming, indeed...."}
Q[13367]={d="那些蠢货居然碰巧找到了可以对我们造成真正威胁的办法！\n\n这一教区的首领奥鲁麦斯在仪式中牺牲了自己，现在他的手下正在把能量导入他的灵魂中。\n\n如果让他继续这样不受干扰地吸收能量，他很快就会变成一个强大的对手。\n\n在他的大厅附近找到他的精华、徽记、节杖和长袍，将它们组合起来，然后在那里的水晶上面使用他的残骸。\n\n快一点，$r！在他变得更加强大之前消灭他！",dEN="These fools have actually stumbled upon something that could pose a serious threat to our plans!\n\nThe leader of this particular sect, Alumeth, has ritualistically sacrificed himself and now his underlings are channeling power to his soul.\n\nIf he's allowed to rest, their efforts will soon transform him into a mighty adversary.\n\nCombine his heart, skull, scepter and robes from around their chamber and use his remains on the crystal there.\n\nHurry, <race>! Destroy him before he becomes any more powerful!",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望转至奥尔杜萨，杀死晋升者奥鲁麦斯。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to slay Alumeth the Ascended at Aldur'thar.",p="怎么样，<race>？你阻止阿鲁梅斯了吗？",pEN="Well, <race>? Were you able to stop Alumeth?",c="奥鲁麦斯确实被击败了，然而我却似乎还能感应到他的魂魄尚在某处盘旋……",cEN="Alumeth has suffered a sound defeat, but I sense that his spirit still lingers..."}
Q[13368]={d="是奥鲁麦斯……他的力量又开始增强了，我能感觉到。现在他的手下正在把能量导入他的灵魂中。\n\n如果让他继续这样不受干扰地吸收能量，他很快就会变成一个强大的对手。\n\n回到奥尔杜萨的北部，在他的大厅中将他的精华、徽记、节杖和长袍组合起来，然后在那里的水晶上面使用他的残骸。\n\n快一点，$r！在他变得更加强大之前消灭他！",dEN="It's Alumeth... He's growing in power again. I can sense it. Again his underlings are channeling power to his soul.\n\nIf he's allowed to rest, their efforts will soon transform him into a mighty adversary.\n\nReturn to his chamber in the north portion of Aldur'thar. Combine his heart, skull, scepter and robes, then use his remains on the crystal there.\n\nHurry, <race>! Destroy him while there's still time!",o="奥格瑞姆之锤的库尔迪拉希望转至奥尔杜萨，杀死晋升者奥鲁麦斯。",oEN="Koltira, aboard Orgrim's Hammer, wants you to slay Alumeth the Ascended at Aldur'thar.",p="如何，朋友？你击败奥鲁麦斯了吗？",pEN="Well, friend? Were you successful against Alumeth?",c="奥鲁麦斯确实被击败了，然而我却似乎还能感应到他的魂魄尚在某处盘旋……",cEN="Alumeth has suffered a sound defeat, but I sense that his spirit still lingers..."}
Q[13369]={d="应普罗德摩尔女士之请，我将允许一支外交使团前往奥格瑞玛，质询部落的大酋长萨尔。你要在这趟行程中协助她，并保护她免受伤害。带着奥格瑞玛的消息回来见我。\n\n准备好出发时，去和吉安娜谈谈。$glisto:lista;",dEN="At the behest of Lady Proudmoore, I will allow a diplomatic mission to Orgrimmar to question the Horde's Warchief, Thrall. You will assist her in this journey and keep her safe from harm. Return to me with news from Orgrimmar.\n\nSpeak to Jaina when you are ready to leave.",o="陪同吉安娜·普罗德摩尔转至卡利姆多大陆的奥格瑞玛，与部落的萨尔酋长交谈。",oEN="Assist Lady Jaina Proudmoore in Orgrimmar. Speak to the Warchief of the Horde, Thrall, at Orgrimmar on the continent of Kalimdor.",c="部落不想要战争，<race>。听好了……",cEN="The Horde does not want war, <race>. Listen well..."}
Q[13370]={d="你们的勇士伯瓦尔为保卫我们这个世界而牺牲了。我们部落同样为了失去这样一位伟大的英雄而感到悲伤，但部落并不应该为普特雷斯在天灾之门发动的偷袭而负责。我们也因为这次背叛失去了一位伟大的英雄。\n\n告诉你的国王，我们会尽一切努力将这次事件的主谋绳之以法。我们也会尽全力避免与联盟发生冲突，不过如果我们受到挑衅，部落也会毫不犹豫地进行自卫。",dEN="Your champion, Bolvar, died in defense of our world. The Horde is saddened by the loss of such a great hero, but the Horde was not responsible for the cowardly attacks made by Putress at the Wrath Gate. We have also lost mighty heroes because of this betrayal.\n\nTell your king that we will do everything in our power to bring the perpetrators of this cowardly act to justice. We will do all that we can to avoid conflict with the Alliance, but we will not hesitate to defend ourselves if provoked.",o="使用格罗玛什堡垒中的传送门返回暴风要塞，把萨尔的消息转达给瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王。",oEN="Use the portal in Grommash Hold to return to Stormwind Keep and deliver Thrall's message to King Varian Wrynn.",c="他们失去了幽暗城？那正是发动攻击的大好时机。我们自己处理掉普特雷斯，并为联盟一举夺回洛丹伦废墟。",cEN="They have lost the Undercity? Then the time to strike is now. We will deal with Putress ourselves and retake the Ruins of Lordaeron for the Alliance!"}
Q[13371]={d="在你从奥格瑞玛回来之前，我就派了布罗尔和瓦莉拉转至幽暗城。事实上，他们现在已经驻扎在通往废墟的下水道入口外面，等待着我的命令。\n\n普罗德摩尔女士会打开一道传送门，穿过它就可以直达幽暗城外，与我们的部队汇合。去向布罗尔和瓦莉拉报到吧，我稍后就到。",dEN="I sent Broll and Valeera to the Undercity before you left for Orgrimmar. In fact, they're now stationed outside the sewer entrance to the ruins, awaiting orders.\n\nLady Proudmoore will open a portal to our forces outside the Undercity. Go there and report to Broll. Jaina and I will be close behind.",o="使用暴风要塞内的通往幽暗城的传送门转至幽暗城。到达目的地之后，向布罗尔·熊皮报到。",oEN="Use the Portal to the Undercity inside Stormwind Keep to teleport to the Undercity. Report to Broll Bearmantle when you arrive at your destination.",c="你是哪位？瓦里安还说他会派几个英雄过来。",cEN="Who are you supposed to be? Varian said he'd send heroes."}
Q[13372]={d="从萨菲隆的爪中掉下了一枚眼球形状的珠宝，里面发出了魔法能量的震荡，你可以听到并感觉到这种声音。对凡人的耳朵来说，这块石头发出的声音甚至可以说是令人感到痛楚难当的。\n\n如此重要的物品显然只能交给红龙女王阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。转至龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿去请求她的指点吧。",dEN="A potent thrumming of magical nature can be heard and felt emanating from the eye-shaped jewel dropped from Sapphiron's clutches. To mortal ears it is nearly painful to be in the presence of the stone.\n\nSurely such a powerful item of import can only be taken to the queen of the dragons, Alexstrasza the Life-Binder. Seek her counsel atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",o="转至龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿，将聚焦之虹的钥匙交给阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Deliver the Key to the Focusing Iris to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",p="<name>，你已经接触到了聚焦之虹的一把钥匙！你身上带着它吗？\n\n\n\n你是怎么得到它的？哦，萨菲隆还留着它？",pEN="<name>, you have come into contact with a key to the focusing iris! Do you have it upon your person?\n\n\n\nHow did you ever come into its possession? Oh, Sapphiron still had his?",c="这些聚焦之虹钥匙原属于最古老的一些蓝龙们看护着，也只有他们受到蓝龙之王玛里苟斯的信任。\n\n这就是我们一直等待着打击魔法之王的时机。\n\n<红龙女王快速地打量了以下你>\n\n你还不能使用这个钥匙来进入聚焦之虹，但我想能分给你一点我的力量，让你足够将它打开一点裂口。\n\n这足以引起玛里苟斯的注意了！",cEN="These keys are held by the most ancient members of the blue dragonflight. Only they are entrusted with them by their master, Malygos.\n\nThis is the break that we've been waiting for to strike at the Aspect of Magic!\n\n<The queen of dragons studies you for a brief moment.>\n\nYou are not able to use the key as-is to access the Focusing Iris, but I can imbue you with a portion of my power; enough to enable you to use it to open the iris a fraction.\n\nIt will be enough to draw Malygos's ire!"}
Q[13373]={d="我在征用来的轰炸机上安装了绿外线设备，它可以在你进入敌占区执行任务时保护你！去向莉兹·拉齐维格要一架轰炸机，然后飞向轰炸场！\n\n我们会给你配备轰炸机、火箭和护盾。你要保持护盾处于激活状态，并用炸弹攻击轰炸场中的天灾军团。击中目标后立即回来，这里还有很路复用作等着你呢。",dEN="I installed our infra-green technology into commandeered bombers; it'll protect you on your first mission into enemy territory! Speak with Rizzy Ratchwiggle to get a bomber, then fly into The Bombardment!\n\nYou'll have bombs and rockets and shields. Keep the shields charged and use bombs on the ground Scourge at The Bombardment. Come back after you hit your targets, and more work will await you.",o="边缘技师塔兹拉要你去杀死40个轰炸场步兵、80个轰炸场军官和15只石像鬼伏击者。",oEN="Fringe Engineer Tezzla wants you to kill 40 Bombardment Infantry, 8 Bombardment Captains and 15 Gargoyle Ambushers.",p="你还没达到目标配额，<name>。是轰炸机太难操控了吗？",pEN="You haven't reached your target quota, <name>. Are the bombers too hard to handle?",c="哈，你成功了！喜不喜欢飞轰炸机呢？我希望你已经适应了，因为我手头上还有些任务要给你……",cEN="Hah, you got them! How did you like the bomber? I hope you got the hang of it, because I have more missions for you..."}
Q[13374]={d="$n，你将要在仅有绿内光保护的情况下，深入敌占区。只有最好的飞行员才能接到这种任务！\n\n去向里兹尔再要一架轰炸机。你要驾驶它飞过失落希望之谷。这次的任务要同时对付空中和地面目标，所以你一定要注意观察，并保证护盾充满能量！\n\n祝你好运！",dEN="<name>, only our best pilots are given a mission like this, one deep, deep into enemy territory with only the power of infra-green technology to protect you!\n\nRequest another bomber from Rizzle, and this time fly it through the Valley of Lost Hope. You have both air and ground targets on this mission, so keep your eyes open and your shields at full!\n\nGood luck!",o="边缘技师塔兹拉要你杀死轰炸场步兵、石像鬼伏击者、霜巢斥候，并摧毁天灾战车。",oEN="Fringe Engineer Tezzla wants you to kill Bombardment Infantry, Gargoyle Ambushers, Frostbrood Sentries and Scourge War Machines.",c="你成功了，你成功了！你这炮手真不错，还顺带证实了我的绿外线科技果然是滴水不漏。",cEN="You did it, you did it! You're a great gunner, and you compliment my infra-green technology like grease on a hydro-gasket!"}
Q[13375]={d="从萨菲隆的爪中掉下了一枚眼球形状的珠宝，里面发出了魔法能量的震荡，你可以听到并感觉到这种声音。对凡人的耳朵来说，这块石头发出的声音甚至可以说是令人感到痛楚难当的。\n\n如此重要的物品显然只能交给红龙女王阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。转至龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿去请求她的指点吧。",dEN="A potent thrumming of magical nature can be heard and felt emanating from the eye-shaped jewel dropped from Sapphiron's clutches. To mortal ears it is nearly painful to be in the presence of the stone.\n\nSurely such a powerful item of import can only be taken to the queen of the dragons, Alexstrasza the Life-Binder. Seek her counsel atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",o="转至龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿，将英雄聚焦之虹的钥匙交给阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者。",oEN="Deliver the Heroic Key to the Focusing Iris to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",p="<name>，你已经接触到了聚焦之虹的一把钥匙！你身上带着它吗？\n\n\n\n你是怎么得到它的？哦，萨菲隆还留着它？",pEN="<name>, you have come into contact with a key to the iris! Do you have it upon your person?\n\n\n\nHow did you ever come into its possession? Oh, Sapphiron still had his?",c="这些聚焦之虹钥匙原属于最古老的一些蓝龙们看护着，也只有他们受到蓝龙之王玛里苟斯的信任。\n\n这就是我们一直等待着打击魔法之王的时机。\n\n<红龙女王快速地打量了一下你>\n\n你还不能使用这个钥匙来进入聚焦之虹，但我想能分给你一点我的力量，让你足够将它打开一点裂口。\n\n这足以引起玛里苟斯的注意了！",cEN="These keys are held by the most ancient members of the blue dragonflight. Only they are entrusted with them by their master, Malygos.\n\nThis is the break that we've been waiting for to strike at the Aspect of Magic!\n\n<The queen of dragons studies you for a brief moment.>\n\nYou are not able to use the key as-is to access the Focusing Iris, but I can imbue you with a portion of my power; enough to enable you to use it to open the iris a fraction.\n\nIt will be enough to draw Malygos's ire!"}
Q[13376]={d="$n，战争还在继续。幸运的是，我们存储了充足的炸弹和火箭！新一轮的轰炸又要开始了——这次轰炸任务的航线很长，你要飞过轰炸场，进入失落希望之谷。再去领一架绿外线轰炸机，把那些天灾军团炸成碎片吧！",dEN="<name>, the struggle continues. Lucky for us, we're stocked up on bombs and rockets! Time for another bombing mission -- this one's a long one, through the Bombardment and into the Valley of Lost Hope. Head back out with an infra-green bomber and blow those Scourge into little scourge-lets!",o="边缘技师塔兹拉要你去杀死50个轰炸场步兵、20只石像鬼伏击者和12条霜巢斥候，并摧毁12架天灾战车。",oEN="Fringe Engineer Tezzla wants you to kill 50 Bombardment Infantry, 20 Gargoyle Ambushers, 12 Frostbrood Sentries and 12 Scourge War Machines.",p="你还在等什么？万事俱备就欠你这东风。",pEN="What are you waiting for? We have the hardware and the ordinance... we just need brave gunners like you to apply them.",c="干得好，<name>。你出任务的时候，我听见别的炮手在谈论你……我觉得你在空中攻势方面前途无量！",cEN="Great work, <name>. While you were out, I heard other gunners talking about you... I think you have a real future in air offense!"}
Q[13377]={d="在幽暗城幽深的腹地，藏着那个对伯瓦尔和我们怒之门英勇士兵之死负有责任的刺客。\n\n瓦里安已带着联盟的全部力量前来协助围捕。加入他和普罗德摩尔女士的追捕行动，在$glos grandes campeones:las grandes campeonas;中赢得一席之地！\n\n准备好时，去和瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王谈谈，$glisto:lista;。",dEN="Deep inside the bowels of the Undercity hides the assassin responsible for the deaths of Bolvar and our brave soldiers at the Wrath Gate.\n\nVarian has brought the full might of the Alliance with him to assist in the take down. Join him and Lady Proudmoore in the manhunt and earn your place among the greatest champions of the Alliance!\n\nSpeak to King Varian Wrynn when you are ready.",o="协助瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王和吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士将大药剂师普特雷斯绳之以法！如果你成功了，就向瓦里安·乌瑞恩国王报告。",oEN="Assist King Varian Wrynn and Lady Jaina Proudmoore in bringing Grand Apothecary Putress to justice! Report to King Varian Wrynn should you succeed.",c="部落已经太久无人约束了。我们允许他们的领地繁荣发展，而作为对我们慷慨的回报，他们却在谋划我们的灭亡。\n\n和平？毫无用处……它没给我们带来任何好处。我们因为\"和平\"失去了几位最伟大的英雄。让我们看看战斗能带来什么……\n\n回北裂境去，<name>。为你的国王征服它——为了联盟！",cEN="For too long have the Horde been left unchecked. We allowed their territories to prosper and in return for our generosity they plotted and planned our demise.\n\nPeace? Useless... It's gotten us nowhere. We have lost some of our greatest heroes to \"peace.\" Let us see what battle brings...\n\nReturn to Northrend, <name>. Conquer it for your king - FOR THE ALLIANCE!"}
Q[13379]={d="你要见的是泰兹拉，没错就是她……她掌握了一种新的波长——红外绿，并用它把自己藏在天灾军团附近！近到足以轰炸他们！\n\n我会给你红外绿视觉，这样你就能找到藏在荒凉之门奥杜尔萨上方的她。去吧，去吧……我知道她有任务交给渴望轰炸的勇敢英雄！我是说……渴望轰炸天灾军团的英雄！$ghéroes:heroínas;{None}$glistos:listas;{None}还有，$Glistos:listas;{None}，联盟偷了我们的技术，在附近也有他们自己的隐藏机场。避开那个插着联盟旗帜的圆顶！\n\n$n",dEN="Tezzla is the one you want to meet, yes she is... she mastered a new wavelength, infra-green, and used it to hide herself near the Scourge! Near enough to bomb them!\n\nI'll give you infra-green vision so you can find her hiding above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate. Go, go... I know she has work for brave heroes eager to blow up! I mean... eager to blow up the Scourge!\n\nAnd <name>, the Alliance has stolen our technology and has their own hidden airport nearby. Avoid the dome with the Alliance banners!",o="与边缘技师塔兹拉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Fringe Engineer Tezzla.",c="好耶，好耶！你找到我了！来的正好！",cEN="Yes, yes! You found me! And just in time!"}
Q[13380]={d="绿外线技术可以让我们在天灾军团的鼻子底下大摇大摆地行动！而且，我们把这种技术应用到了专门制造的轰炸机上……但不是为了隐藏它们，完全不是那么回事！我们用绿外线技术来保护它们！\n\n去向卡伦·诺尔要一架轰炸机，然后飞到轰炸场上空……用它的护盾和炮台保护自己，并使用投弹器攻击天灾军团。好好练习一下，然后再回来找我。我还有很多更重要的任务要交给你呢！",dEN="Infra-green technology allows us to stay hidden here, right over the Scourge's nose! What's more, we installed infra-green in specially constructed bombers... but not to hide them, no! We use infra-green tech to shield them!\n\nSpeak with Karen No and request a bomber. Fly it over the Bombardment... use its shields and turret to protect yourself, and use the bomb launcher to hit Scourge targets. Practice well, then return to me and I'll have an even more vital mission for you!",o="吉普利·基罗赫斯要你去杀死40个轰炸场步兵、8个轰炸场军官和15只石像鬼伏击者。",oEN="Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill 40 Bombardment Infantry, 8 Bombardment Captains and 15 Gargoyle Ambushers.",p="<name>，轰炸机很难操控，但如果我们想在与天灾军团的斗争中取胜，你必须掌握它们。",pEN="<name>, the bombers are difficult to use, but you must master them if we're to win our struggles against the Scourge.",c="我在这儿都能听到你的爆炸声，<name>。护盾效果如何？保住你的轰炸机了吗？\n\n希望保住了，因为现在我有更多任务交给你……",cEN="I could hear your explosions from here, <name>. How did the shields work? Did they keep your bomber intact?\n\nI hope they did, because now I have more missions for you...."}
Q[13382]={d="战斗仍在继续！你的新命令到了，要执行一次远程轰炸任务，穿过轰击区进入失落希望之谷——等你准备好，就找卡伦要一架轰炸机，把炸弹和火箭倾泻到天灾军团头上！$glisto:lista;",dEN="The fight goes on! Your new orders arrived for a long-range bombing mission through the Bombardment and into the Valley of Lost Hope -- when you're ready, ask Karen for a bomber and pour those bombs and rockets onto the Scourge!",o="吉普利·基罗赫斯要你去杀死50个轰炸场步兵、20只石像鬼伏击者和12条霜巢斥候，并摧毁12架天灾战车。",oEN="Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill 50 Bombardment Infantry, 20 Gargoyle Ambushers, 12 Frostbrood Sentries and 12 Scourge War Machines.",p="继续加油，<name>。空战不会自己打赢！",pEN="Keep at the, <name>. The air battle won't win itself!",c="欢迎回来，<name>。战斗怎么样？很刺激吧？先休息一下。等你有新命令时再回来。\n\n为了联盟！",cEN="Welcome back, <name>. How was the battle? Exciting? Take a rest for now. But come back when you have fresh orders.\n\nFor the Alliance!"}
Q[13383]={d="地精们幸运地发现了一种新能量。他们管这种能量叫“绿外线”。怎么说呢……如果这些疯子发现了一种新的金子，而它居然不是绿的，那我都能变成独眼食人魔了。\n\n我要你去找吉普利·基罗赫斯。他在荒凉之门奥尔杜萨上空的一座规模隐形联盟机场上，领导着绿外线的逆向工程研究。我会给你绿外线视界，这样你就可以找到他了。到插着联盟旗帜的那座圆顶上去吧——但是如果你飞到部落的机场附近的话，你就会遇到大麻烦了，而且还是绿色的麻烦。",dEN="The goblins got lucky and found a new energy. They call it infra-green, and I'll be a one-eyed ogre if those psychos didn't strike green gold.\n\nGo find Kibli Killohertz. He's leading the reverse engineering efforts of infra-green, at a small, hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate. I'll give you infra-green vision to help you find it. Go to the dome with our Alliance banners -- if you fly near the Horde airport then you'll be in a load of green trouble.",o="首席技师波尔维克要你转至荒凉之门奥尔杜萨上空的联盟隐形机场，并与吉普利·基罗赫斯谈一谈。",oEN="Chief Engineer Boltwrench wants you to find Kibli Killohertz at the hidden Alliance airport above Aldur'thar, the Desolation Gate.",c="好耶，好耶，好耶！你好！",cEN="Yes, yes, yes! A thousand times, hello!"}
Q[13384]={d="是时候使用聚焦之虹的钥匙了。\n\n虽然我很希望玛里苟斯能够悬崖勒马，但是当前看来这是不可能的事。局势相当严峻，其它守护巨龙一致认为应该击败织法者。\n\n<克拉苏斯的语调中带着一丝惊惶。>\n\n$n，请你进入永恒之眼，击败玛里苟斯，把魔法之心带回来。",dEN="Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.\n\nAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.\n\n<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>\n\n<name>, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic.",o="龙眠神殿顶端的克拉苏斯要你把魔法之心带回去。\n\n",oEN="Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.",p="只有玛里苟斯拥有魔法之心。这也是他最大的力量来源。",pEN="Only Malygos carries the Heart of Magic. It is his most prized possession.",c="这是非常悲伤的一天，不仅对龙族而言，对艾泽拉斯所有生灵也是如此。我们失去了一位最深思熟虑、最睿智、最古老的朋友。魔法如今没有了它的守护者。\n\n让我们希望这是个明智的决定，<name>。地平线上风暴仍在酝酿，而我们现在失去了一位最强大的守护者。",cEN="This is a very sad day, not only for dragonkind, but for all of the living creatures of Azeroth. We have lost one of our most thoughtful, intelligent and ancient friends. Magic is now without its guardian.\n\nLet us hope that this was a wise decision in the coming years, <name>. A storm is still brewing on the horizon and now we are without one of our most powerful defenders."}
Q[13385]={d="是时候使用聚焦之虹的钥匙了。\n\n虽然我很希望玛里苟斯能够悬崖勒马，但是当前看来这是不可能的事。局势相当严峻，其它守护巨龙一致认为应该击败织法者。\n\n<克拉苏斯的语调中带着一丝惊惶。>\n\n$n，请你进入永恒之眼，击败玛里苟斯，把魔法之心带回来。",dEN="Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.\n\nAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.\n\n<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>\n\n<name>, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic.",o="龙骨荒野龙眠神殿的克拉苏斯要你取回魔法之心。\n\n该任务必须在英雄模式下的25人永恒之眼中完成。",oEN="Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.\n\nThis quest is for the Heroic mode, 25-person version of The Eye of Eternity.",p="只有玛里苟斯拥有魔法之心。这也是他最大的力量来源。",pEN="Only Malygos carries the Heart of Magic. It is his most prized possession.",c="这是非常悲伤的一天，不仅对龙族而言，对艾泽拉斯所有生灵也是如此。我们失去了一位最深思熟虑、最睿智、最古老的朋友。魔法如今没有了它的守护者。\n\n让我们希望这是个明智的决定，<name>。地平线上风暴仍在酝酿，而我们现在失去了一位最强大的守护者。",cEN="This is a very sad day, not only for dragonkind, but for all of the living creatures of Azeroth. We have lost one of our most thoughtful, intelligent and ancient friends. Magic is now without its guardian.\n\nLet us hope that this was a wise decision in the coming years, <name>. A storm is still brewing on the horizon and now we are without one of our most powerful defenders."}
Q[13386]={d="我有个有趣的差事交给你，$n。前提是你愿意接受挑战。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n我们收到线报，说冰冠堡垒下方有一个缺口。我们的工程师研究了那里的布局，认定那是一处结构弱点。\n\n我们已经派了一些人带着几枚\n借来的\"萨隆邪铁炸弹过去。他们由肯德尔队长指挥。\"\n只要稍加协助，我们就能给天灾军团的部队一次重创。你说呢，\n？$n",dEN="I've got an interesting assignment for you, <name>. If you're up for a challenge, that is.\n\nWe've been tipped off about an opening below Icecrown Citadel. Our engineers have studied the layout and have decided it's a structural weakness.\n\nWe've sent some men there along with some \"borrowed\" saronite bombs. They're under Captain Kendall's command.\n\nWith a little help we could deal a huge blow to the forces of the Scourge. What do you say, <name>?",o="与冰冠堡垒下面的肯达尔上尉谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Captain Kendall below Icecrown Citadel.",c="你好，<name>。萨萨里安提过你会来。萨萨里安的朋友就是我的朋友。嗯，我是说萨萨里安活着的朋友……他确实交往些奇怪的同伴。",cEN="Hail, <name>. Thassarian mentioned you'd be dropping by. Any friend of Thassarian's is my friend. Well, any living friend of Thassarian, that is... He does keep odd company."}
Q[13387]={d="萨隆邪铁炸弹已经安装完毕，$n。但是我们只有一次机会，千万别搞砸了。\n\n为了确保安全爆破，我们必须夺得这片本地的临时控制权。先去削减天灾士兵的数量吧。",dEN="The saronite bombs are in place, <name>. We're only going to get one shot at this, however. Let's make it count.\n\nWe need temporary control of the area for a safe detonation. Let's try to put a dent in the Scourge's numbers.",o="冰冠堡垒的肯达尔上尉要你去杀死10只笨重的恐尸。",oEN="Captain Kendall at Icecrown Citadel wants you to slay 10 Hulking Horrors.",p="为了联盟！",pEN="For the Alliance!",c="你就跟萨萨里安说的一样优秀。做得好！",cEN="You're as good as Thassarian said. Good job!"}
Q[13388]={d="事情进展得非常顺利，准备引爆炸弹吧。\n\n它们就堆在深坑附近。我这就开始疏散人员。",dEN="Things are looking good. Let's do this.\n\nThe stack of bombs is right near the pit. I'll start to evacuate the men.",o="冰冠堡垒下面的肯达尔上尉要你转至附近的萨隆邪铁炸弹堆旁边，点燃引线。",oEN="Captain Kendall, below Icecrown Citadel, wants you to go to the nearby Saronite Bomb Stack to light the fuse.",c="这些炸弹看起来威力十分强大。应该至少能够使周遭的建筑结构塌陷。",cEN="These bombs look pretty potent. They should at least put a dent in the surrounding structure."}
Q[13389]={d="在你点燃引线的时候，你发现它的燃烧速度比你想象中的要快了许多。\n\n炸弹就要爆炸了，只有马上跳进深坑，并且不被炸下来的杂物砸到，你才有可能活下来。",dEN="As you light the fuse, you notice that it is consumed by fire far quicker than you would expect.\n\nThe bombs are about to go off and your best chance at surviving is to lean towards the pit and hope the fall doesn't kill you.",o="在你被杂物砸中的地方寻找线索。",oEN="Look for clues wherever the fall takes you.",c="这个脉动的东西被一层厚重的冰所包围。它在水面下闪动着奇异的光芒。",cEN="This pulsing object is covered in a thick layer of ice. It shimmers strangely beneath the water."}
Q[13390]={d="这件东西根本不是水晶，而是某种器官，被冰封着。\n\n当你触碰它时，你的手因剧痛而猛地缩回。你感觉自己的手像是被割开了，却看不到任何伤口。\n\n当你定下神来，你听到附近有个小男孩的声音。\n\n\"你真不该那么做的。\"",dEN="The object is not a crystal at all, but some form of organ, encased in ice.\n\nAs you touch it, your hand reels in horrible pain. You feel as if your hand has been cut, yet there is no visible wound.\n\nAs you collect your thoughts, you hear a young boy's voice nearby.\n\n\"You really shouldn't have done that.\"",o="在纳扎纳克：遗忘深渊里调查这个声音的来源。",oEN="Investigate the nearby voice in Naz'anak, the Forgotten Depths.",c="我看到他丢掉了这个，你知道吗？他从上面一丢，直直地掉到这儿。\n\n他说他不再需要这玩意了，说这让他变的软弱。",cEN="I saw him get rid of it, you know? He threw it all the way down here.\n\nSaid he wouldn't need it anymore. Said it made him weak."}
Q[13391]={d="你不该碰它的。但你已经碰过了，他很快就会来找你。\n\n他一定会找到你，除非你能躲藏起来，不让他发现。\n\n如果你还想活下去，就去弄一些无面者的鲜血回来！",dEN="You shouldn't have touched it. But now that you did, he's going to come looking for you.\n\nAnd he'll find you. Unless you hide yourself from him.\n\nBring me blood from the faceless ones if you want to live!",o="米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你收集3份无面者之血。",oEN="Matthias Lehner wants you to obtain 3 Faceless One's Blood.",p="你拿到血了吗？",pEN="Did you get the blood?",c="你还等什么？快擦在身子上！\n\n快呀！不然他就要看到你了！",cEN="What are you waiting for? You have to rub it on you!\n\nQuick! Or he'll see you!"}
Q[13392]={d="现在你该走了。我身后有一道传送门，它可以把你送到地面上去。\n\n我们还会见面的。他会来找你。\n\n他迟早会找到你。",dEN="You should leave now. You'll find a portal behind me. It'll take you to the surface.\n\nWe'll meet again. He'll be looking for you.\n\nIt's only a matter of time until he finds you.",o="返回破天号，向萨萨里安复命。",oEN="Return to Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker.",c="是你，<name>！我们还以为你完蛋了。\n\n你那场爆炸给天灾军团造成了不小的伤害。顺带差点把肯德尔队长的眉毛炸掉……",cEN="It's you, <name>! We thought you were a goner.\n\nThat explosion of yours put quite a bit of hurt on the Scourge. Nearly took Captain's Kendall's eyebrows off in the process..."}
Q[13393]={d="好吧，现在还不到庆功的时候。你顺利地完成了引爆任务，极大地鼓舞了部队的士气，我们要一鼓作气，继续战斗。\n\n士兵们在下面的旷野中发现了一架部落的大型攻城车，似乎还可以使用。恶鬼们好像正在拆卸它的零件。\n\n如果能将它重新组装起来，我们一定能重创山谷里的天灾军团。\n\n当然，你可以要面对为数众多的敌人，但是我对你有信心！",dEN="All right. Let's not celebrate just yet. We need to capitalize on the momentum we've gathered with our little bombing mission.\n\nWe've spotted a workable Horde demolisher-class catapult in the field below. The geist seem to be taking it apart.\n\nIf you can put it back together, we'll be able to do some serious damage to the Scourge's armies in the Valley.\n\nSure, you'll be a little outnumbered, but I've a lot of faith in you!",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你从食腐的恶鬼身上收集5块攻城车零件，然后将它们带去失落希望之谷的毁坏的攻城车旁。",oEN="Thassarian, aboard the Skybreaker, wants you to collect 5 Demolisher Parts from the Scavenging Geists and take them to the Wrecked Demolisher in the Valley of Lost Hope.",p="那辆攻城车受损的情况不太乐观。",pEN="The demolisher has suffered much damage.",c="这台攻城车已经饱经风霜，不过总算整体结构没有受到永久性的伤害。你取得的零件应该足以让它再次运转，至少暂时性地。",cEN="The demolisher has seen better days, but the structure hasn't suffered any permanent damage. The parts you obtained should be enough to get it running again, at least temporarily."}
Q[13394]={d="你要用这台机器去对付天灾军团？你这样是不能胜过他们的。\n\n你或许可以消灭几百个敌人……甚至几千个，但你不能取得胜利。这样不行。\n\n等你摆弄够了这台机器，可以到北边来找我。那里有一座旧军营。我会让你认识到，你要面对的是怎样的敌人。",dEN="You're going to use this machine against the Scourge? You're not going to win against them like that.\n\nYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them. But you won't win. Not out here.\n\nWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the north. There is an old army encampment. What I will show you will teach you a little bit about who you're up against.",o="使用整修过的攻城车，在失落希望之谷里消灭150只腐朽的食尸鬼、20个霜颅大法师和2个白骨巨人。完成任务之后转至第一军团前线营地，与米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Use the Refurbished Demolisher to destroy 150 Decomposed Ghouls, 20 Frostskull Mages and 2 Bone Giants in the Valley of Lost Hope. Speak to Matthias Lehner at the First Legion Forward Camp when you've completed this task.",p="玩完了你的战争机器了吗？",pEN="Are you done playing with your war machines?",c="看到了吗？你杀的那份数量不少，可你每消灭一个，就有另一个从泥土里爬起来顶替它。\n\n你不知道自己在面对什么，<name>。让我给你看看。",cEN="You see? You killed your fair share, but for every one you destroyed, another rose from the dirt to take its place.\n\nYou don't know what you're up against, <name>. Let me show you."}
Q[13395]={d="你可能觉得自己已经很强大了，足以横扫这些亡灵，驾驶你的战争机器轻易地击败它们。\n\n但是创造出这些亡灵生物的力量更为强大，与之相比，你的力量不值一提。\n\n我见过那位王子本人这样做过。我可以营造一个幻境，向你演示他是怎么做到这一点的……如果你愿意领略一下的话。",dEN="You probably think you're quite strong -- fighting these undead and crushing their bones beneath your war machines.\n\nThat is nothing compared to the strength it took to create them.\n\nI saw the prince do it himself. I can show you how it happened... if you'd like.",o="第一军团前线营地的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要在幻境中向你演示巫妖王如何召唤一支由101个食尸鬼奴仆组成的部队。",oEN="Matthias Lehner at the First Legion Forward Camp wants you to raise an army of 100 Ghoulish Minions.",p="你看到了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you see, <name>?",c="王子他真正的力量并非在于从尸海中唤起军队……那很容易。\n\n而是让与他并肩作战多次的战士成为尸体……他真正的力量，就是能不择手段完成需要完成的事。",cEN="The prince's true power wasn't his ability to make armies out of corpses... that was easy.\n\nBut killing his own men, with whom he'd shared many battles... the prince's true power was his ability to do what had to be done."}
Q[13396]={d="现在你明白了吗？派你们的人去对付王子的部队，只会让他们获得更多的士兵。\n\n我也不指望你能明白……你的下场或许会和其它人一样。你还是回到派你来的人身边去吧，他们可能在担心你了。",dEN="Do you see now? Sending your men against the prince's armies just swells their numbers.\n\nI don't expect you to understand... you'll probably just end up like the others. You'd best return to whoever sent you. They might be worried.",o="返回破天号，向萨萨里安复命。",oEN="Return to Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker.",c="射得漂亮，<name>。天灾军团根本没有机会。\n\n你还好吗？你看起来像是见了鬼。仔细一想，在这地方这倒也不算什么稀奇事。",cEN="Nice shooting, <name>. The Scourge never had a chance.\n\nAre you feeling okay? You look like you've seen a ghost. Not that it would be an unusual thing around these parts, now that I think about it."}
Q[13397]={d="你真是一颗耀眼的新星，$n。你瞧，我派别的士兵去执行任务时，他们成功的几率是对半开，而他们活着回来的几率……那可就更低了。\n\n但是你每次都能顺利地完成任务，就像侏儒制造的钟表一样精确！\n\n好啦，我还有一项任务要交给你。山谷东边就是辛达苟萨之墓，最近，诅咒教徒在那里的活动愈发猖獗起来，比如搞些复活冰霜巨龙之类的勾当。我要你去狠狠地教训他们一顿。\n\n我讨厌诅咒教徒。",dEN="You're a real star, <name>. See, when I give one of these other soldiers an assignment, the odds of them getting it done are about fifty-fifty. The odds of them coming back... well, slightly worse.\n\nBut with you, it's always a guaranteed thing. Like gnomish clockwork!\n\nAnyway, I have another one for you. Sindragosa's Fall, east of the valley. There is some serious cultist activity, including and not limited to, the raising of frost wyrms. I need you to go kick their teeth in.\n\nI hate cultists.",o="破天号上的萨萨里安要你转至辛达苟萨之墓，杀死5个巨龙复活者、8个诅咒教派腐蚀者和3个维库通灵领主。",oEN="Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker wants you to slay 5 Wyrm Reanimators, 8 Cultist Corrupters and 3 Vrykul Necrolords at Sindragosa's Fall.",p="<name>，你回来了！",pEN="<name>, you're back!",c="干得好，<name>。你让我们其他人都显得差劲了！",cEN="Nice job, <name>. You make the rest of us look bad!"}
Q[13398]={d="曾经有一群蓝色的巨龙死在这里。现在，他的仆从正在逐个复活它们。\n\n他亲自复活了其中最大的一条龙。给我从雏龙身上弄一些骨灰下来，我会向你展示他是如何复活那条龙的。",dEN="A whole brood of blue dragons fell here. And now, one by one, they're being raised by his servants.\n\nHe raised the biggest of them all himself. Bring me some bone dust from the whelps and I'll show you exactly how he did it.",o="辛达苟萨之墓的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你收集6份雏龙的骨灰。",oEN="Matthias Lehner at Sindragosa's Fall wants you to obtain 6 Whelp Bone Dusts.",p="你拿到那些尘土了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you get the dust, <name>?",c="连最强大的龙族都必须响应他的召唤。像你这样脆弱的凡人要如何抵抗他？",cEN="Even the mighty wyrms had to heed his call. How is a simple mortal like you going to resist him?"}
Q[13399]={d="你的问题真多，$n。只有你能看见我，是因为你摸过一件曾经属于他的东西……你不记得了吗？$gel único:la única;{None}\n你不知道那是什么？嗯，我不能直接告诉你……那会让他非常生气的。他不再只是个王子了……他是国王！\n\n到冰冠堡垒北面的白骨庭院来找我，你就能亲眼看到了。\n",dEN="You have a lot of questions, <name>. You're the only one who can see me because you touched something that once belonged to him... don't you remember?\n\nYou don't know what it is? Well I can't just tell you... that would make him really mad. He's not just a prince anymore... he's the king!\n\nMeet me at the Court of Bones, north of Icecrown Citadel and you can see for yourself.",o="转至白骨之庭，与米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Matthias Lehner at the Court of Bones.",c="你在这儿。我还以为你不来了。",cEN="There you are. I started to wonder whether you'd show up."}
Q[13400]={d="在王子成为国王之前，他经历过很多战斗……但其中只有一场战斗使他差点丢掉性命。\n\n那场战斗就发生在这里。等你看过我向你展示的场景以后，你就都明白了。\n\n从地上拣起一块染血的石头，然后你就可以看到当时的情景了。",dEN="Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where he came close to dying.\n\nIt was fought right here. After you let me show you what happened, you'll understand everything.\n\nFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from the floor. You'll see what happened.",o="白骨之庭的米斯希尔萨·阿奈尔要你去寻找一块染血的石头，并目睹王子的命运。",oEN="Matthias Lehner in the Court of Bones wants you to look for a Bloodstained Stone and complete the Prince's Destiny.",p="你看到了吗，<name>？看到了吗？",pEN="Did you see, <name>? Did you?",c="那场战斗之后，王子意识到，束缚他的是他仍然还是人类……他仍然能感受……他仍然会流血。他还有一颗心。\n\n他成为国王后做的第一件事，就是把这颗心从自己身上除去。他把它扔进了我们初次相遇的那个深坑。而你，<name>，是此后第一个触碰它的人。",cEN="After that fight, the prince realized what was holding him back was that he was still human... he could still feel... he could still bleed. He still had a heart.\n\nThe first thing he did when he became king was to rid of himself of it. He threw it down the pit where we first met. And you, <name>, were the first person to touch it since."}
Q[13401]={d="现在你该明白自己面对的是怎样的敌人了，$n。他不会感到痛苦……悔恨……他完全没有人性。他为达目的，不择手段。\n\n这颗心就是他的弱点，现在他已经知道你发现了它。\n\n如果你要回去找那颗心，最好带一些帮手去。他不会再任由它全不设防地躺在那里了。",dEN="Now you know what you're up against, <name>. An opponent who no longer knows pain... remorse... or humanity. An opponent who will do anything to get what he wants.\n\nThe heart was his weakness and now he knows you've found it.\n\nIf you're going to go back for it, you'd best bring help. He will not leave it unguarded again.",o="向破天号上的萨萨里安复命。",oEN="Report back to Thassarian aboard the Skybreaker.",c="慢点，<name>。你何不从头……再说一遍？",cEN="Slow down, <name>. Why don't you start again... from the beginning?"}
Q[13402]={d="阿尔萨斯和他的心脏……这个故事我已经听过不知道多少遍了……但我总以为那是编出来吓唬我们的。\n\n我们必须立即采取行动。不幸的是，只能是秘密行动。\n\n阿尔萨斯的密探无处不在，如果让他有所察觉，我们的计划就要付之东流了。\n\n我们要把这个消息告诉银色北伐军。那支部队里的每一名圣骑士都是提里奥亲自挑选的，如果说还有什么组织能够避免被诅咒教派渗透，那就只能是银色北伐军了。",dEN="It's not the first time I've heard that story about Arthas and his heart... always thought it was some made-up tale to impress the rank and file.\n\nWe must act on this information immediately. Unfortunately, we must do so in secret.\n\nArthas's agents are everywhere and if he finds out, our plan is dead in the water.\n\nWe need to take this to the Argent Crusade. Every single paladin in that order was hand-picked by Tirion himself. If there's anyone free of cultist infiltration, it's those guys.",o="与北伐军之峰的大领主提里奥·弗丁谈一谈。",oEN="Speak to Highlord Tirion Fordring at the Crusader's Pinnacle.",c="话说得很重，<name>。要是换个人说这些话，我多半会认为他疯了。",cEN="Heavy words, <name>. If it were somebody else saying them, I'd be likely to judge them insane."}
Q[13403]={d="就在今天早上，我的斥候报告说，有一队诅咒教派的教徒带着一样东西离开冰冠堡垒，转至黑暗大教堂了。\n\n现在我明白了，那恐怕就是阿尔萨斯的心脏……里面残留着他的最后一点尚未泯灭的人性。\n\n这是圣光的启示。只要这颗心脏仍然存在，阿尔萨斯·米奈希尔就有可能变回人类！\n\n我们到大教堂的入口处汇合吧。记得带一件教徒的兜帽来，我们要乔装混进去。",dEN="Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.\n\nAnd now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of his remaining humanity.\n\nThis is a sign of the Light. As long as such an artifact exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!\n\nMeet me at the cathedral's entrance. Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito.",o="北伐军之峰的提里奥·弗丁要你想办法获取一件诅咒教徒的兜帽，穿上它，然后转至冰冠堡垒西北方的黑暗大教堂入口处与他汇合。",oEN="Tirion Fordring, at the Crusader's Pinnacle, wants you to obtain and wear a Cultist Acolyte's Hood and meet him at the entrance of the Cathedral of Darkness, northwest of Icecrown Citadel.",p="愿圣光与你同在，<name>。",pEN="Light be with you, <name>.",c="我不认为我们刚刚经历的一切是失败，<name>……恰恰相反。\n\n你让我窥见他的内心，从而让我确认了我需要知道的事。阿尔萨斯·米奈希尔已经不存在了——只剩下巫妖王。",cEN="I do not view what we just went through as a failure, <name>... quite the opposite.\n\nBy allowing me to peer into his heart, you allowed me to confirm what I needed to know. There is no Arthas Menethil anymore -- there is only the Lich King."}
Q[13404]={d="这是一次短程任务，在轰击区上空进行。正好热身。准备好了吗？$gListo:Lista;",dEN="This is a short-ranged mission, over The Bombardment. A good warm up. Ready?",o="吉普利·基罗赫斯要你去杀死50个轰炸场步兵、10个轰炸场军官和20只石像鬼伏击者。",oEN="Kibli Killohertz wants you to kill 50 Bombardment Infantry, 10 Bombardment Captains and 20 Gargoyle Ambushers.",p="继续加油，<name>。空战不会自己打赢！",pEN="Keep at the, <name>. The air battle won't win itself!",c="欢迎回来，<name>。任务不长，但让人精神振奋，是吧？先休息一下。等你有新命令时再回来。",cEN="Welcome back, <name>. A short mission, but invigorating, yes? Take a rest for now. But come back when you have fresh orders."}
Q[13406]={d="准备好用一次短程轰炸任务热热身了吗？你有你的命令，我们的轰炸机也已装填完毕、随时待命。$gPreparado:Preparada;",dEN="Ready to warm up with a short bombing mission? You have your orders, and we have our bombers stocked and ready.",o="边缘技师塔兹拉要你去杀死50个轰炸场步兵、10个轰炸场军官和20只石像鬼伏击者。",oEN="Fringe Engineer Tezzla wants you to kill 50 Bombardment Infantry, 10 Bombardment Captains and 20 Gargoyle Ambushers.",p="你还没达到目标配额，<name>。出去把东西炸个稀巴烂！",pEN="You haven't reached your target quota, <name>. Get out there and blow stuff up!",c="哈，你成功了！我老远就听的到那些天灾碎片撞上山壁的破裂声。做得好。我还有任务要再给你……",cEN="Hah, you got them! I could hear their scourge parts clatter off the mountain walls. Good work. We'll have more for you soon..."}
Q[13408]={d="地狱火堡垒与我们的军队一直有着小规模的冲突与交战。当前，我们自己的领地大多守备稳固，但一直没能对他们发动真正的进攻。为了筹备进攻，我们要首先占领地狱火堡垒外围的战略要地。\n\n我们的斥候当前确定了三处互成犄角之势的工事，希望你能协助这三处的防守。占领所有工事之后回来向我报告。\n\n愿你能在接下来的战斗中有好运气，$n，毫无疑问，你得面对部落的威胁，他们也同样想占领这三处重要的工事。",dEN="The Hellfire Citadel wages constant battles with our forces. We are holding our own so far, but we can't yet launch a real offensive against them. To do that, we need forward staging areas.\n\nOur scouts identified three fortifications near Hellfire Citadel. We want you to help secure these forts. Capture each fort, and then report back to me.\n\nMay fortune shine upon you in the conflicts ahead, <name>, for you will no doubt clash with Horde forces eager to gain these same fortifications.",o="占领了望台、竞赛场和碎石岭，然后向地狱火半岛上荣耀堡内的委任官翠希·普罗维尔复命。",oEN="Capture the Overlook, the Stadium and Broken Hill, then return to Warrant Officer Tracy Proudwell in Honor Hold in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="$n，一旦你已在夺取各个堡垒的行动中建功，回来向我回报！",pEN="<name>, return to me when you have aided in the capture of each of the forts!",c="干得好，$n。你的行动，对我们在地狱火半岛上的战事，有相当的助益。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Your actions in the field are instrumental in our battle for Hellfire Peninsula."}
Q[13409]={d="在我们的故乡肆虐的所有地狱火堡垒邪兽人都必须要消灭干净！但要想攻击地狱火堡垒，我们必须首先占领堡垒外围的几处战略要地。\n\n巡逻队发现有三处工事正好适合我们的目的。但联盟竟与我们不谋而合，现在已经派出部队占领了那里！\n\n我要求你立刻阻止联盟的行动，并占领这些工事。协助我军占领工事之后，立刻回来向我报告。\n\n为了部落！",dEN="The fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel must be scoured from our birthland! To attack them, we must first secure forward staging points near the Citadel.\n\nOur outrunners found three fortifications that will suit this purpose, but the Alliance has the same idea and even now sends forces to take them!\n\nWe want you to stop the Alliance and capture these forts. Aid in the capture of each fort and then return to me.\n\nFor the Horde!",o="占领了望台、竞赛场和碎石岭，然后向地狱火半岛上萨尔玛的传令官布莱肯·黑眼复命。",oEN="Capture the Overlook, the Stadium and Broken Hill, then return to Battlecryer Blackeye in Thrallmar.",p="协助占领各处堡垒后再来见我！",pEN="Return to me after you have helped capture each fort!",c="干得好，$n。我几乎可以听见在那些堡垒中进行的战事。我真希望我在现场观看！",cEN="Nice work, <name>. I could almost hear the battles waged at those forts. I wish I was there to see them!"}
Q[13412]={d="你好，$c。能请你帮个忙吗？\n\n红龙莱洛拉斯负责驻守这座岗哨，他有个妹妹叫作科拉丝塔萨。科拉丝塔萨不顾莱洛拉斯的反对，到魔枢上层侦察蓝龙的活动去了。\n\n他虽然嘴上不说，但是心里还是很牵挂自己的妹妹。如果能得到科拉丝塔萨的消息，他肯定会很高兴的。\n\n请你去找到她，叫她放下自尊，给她的兄弟捎个消息回来。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. Might I impose on you for a favor?\n\nCorastrasza is the sister of Raelorasz - the red dragon in charge of our outpost here. Against his will, she has ascended to one of the upper rings of the Nexus to observe some frighteningly powerful blue drakes.\n\nThough he will never say it, he worries about her, and would welcome any news of her well-being.\n\nPlease seek her out. Ask her to put her pride aside and send word to her brother.",o="图书馆员塞尔拉要你去跟考达拉的科拉斯塔萨谈一谈。",oEN="Librarian Serrah wants you to speak to Corastrasza in Coldarra.",c="你插手一条巨龙私人的事，未免太自以为是了，你不觉得吗，<race>？\n\n除此之外，不让我兄弟知道我很安好，那就是我的不对了。你可以告诉那位爱管闲事的朋友，我会让我兄弟随时了解我的动向。",cEN="It's quite presumptuous of you to interfere in the personal affairs of a dragon, don't you think, <race>?\n\nThat aside, it would be wrong of me not to let my brother know that I am well. You may tell your meddling friend that I will keep my brother abreast of my actions."}
Q[13413]={d="凡人，你居然有勇气靠近玛里苟斯的巢穴？还是说你只是因为无知才闯进这里的？答案很快就可以揭晓了……\n\n我是一名经验丰富的训练师，专门为红龙军团训练优雅的幼龙。我来这里研究敌人的作战手段，并向我珍爱的宠物们传授有效的御敌手段，以便将来能对付蓝龙军团的主子。\n\n为了让你有机会证明自己的勇气和实力，我可以让你骑着我的幼龙去对付敌人的爪牙。\n\n只要你开口，就可以得到这个宝贵的机会……",dEN="You possess the courage to draw so near to Malygos' lair, mortal? Or is it simply ignorance? Soon we shall know....\n\nI am a seasoned trainer of the graceful drakes of the red dragonflight. My business here is to study the enemy and teach my precious pets the tactics that will be most effective when we face the master of the blues.\n\nTo demonstrate your nerve and ability, I will allow you to ride one of my drakes against the enemy's minions.\n\nThe opportunity is yours for the asking...",o="考达拉魔枢上层的科拉丝塔萨要你骑着她的幼龙杀死5名鳞誓精英。",oEN="Corastrasza on the upper ring of the Nexus in Coldarra wants you to ride her drake and kill 5 Scalesworn Elites.",p="是，$r？",pEN="Well, mortal, what do you think of my pets?",c="我的幼龙告诉我，只要加以练习，你也许能成为一名有实力的战士。\n\n那好吧。为了我们对玛里苟斯的战争，我允许你随时与我的宠物们练习。\n\n做好准备，<race>，因为他是个凶猛而无情的对手。",cEN="My drake tells me that with practice, you might become a capable combatant.\n\nVery well, then. In the interest of our war on Malygos, I shall allow you to practice with my pets at your leisure.\n\nMake ready, <race>, for he is a fierce and unforgiving opponent."}
Q[13414]={d="我们又见面了，$r。我要承认，我对你越来越感兴趣了。\n\n如果我没猜错的话，你是来练习空战技巧的吧？\n\n像平时一样，我的宠物已经做好准备，随时可以去消灭敌人。\n\n只要你开口，就可以随意调遣它们。",dEN="Again we meet, <race>. I confess, your presence is beginning to grow on me.\n\nAm I correct in assuming that you've come to hone your aerial combat skills?\n\nAs always, my pets stand ready to bring fiery destruction to the enemy.\n\nSpeak, and they shall be at your disposal.",o="考达拉魔枢上层的科拉丝塔萨要你骑着她的幼龙杀死5名鳞誓精英。",oEN="Corastrasza on the upper ring of the Nexus in Coldarra wants you to ride her drake and kill 5 Scalesworn Elites.",p="什么事，<race>？",pEN="Yes, <race>?",c="我注意到你今天有所进步，<class>。有那么几个瞬间，你仿佛与幼龙融为一体。\n\n欢迎你随时与我珍爱的宠物们练习。",cEN="I noticed some improvement today, <class>. At moments, it was as if you were one with the drake.\n\nYou are welcome to practice with my precious pets at your leisure."}
Q[13415]={d="$n，诺甘农之壳近在咫尺，唾手可得。拿上创世者的圆盘转至图书馆的内部，你应该可以在那里找到一个用来激活圆盘的控制台。我想米米尔存储在那里的东西远比诺甘农之壳更多，甚至可能包括能让铁炉堡的工程师们忙上许多年的结构图！\n\n不管怎样，用圆盘来恢复诺甘农之壳。希望米米尔没有给我们设置什么棘手的障碍。",dEN="Norgannon's shell is within our reach, <name>. Take the inventor's disk into the library's interior. There should be a console there that you can activate with the disk. I imagine Mimir stored more there than just Norgannon's shell. There are probably enough schematics stored there to keep Ironforge's engineers occupied for years!\n\nAnyway, use the disk to recover the shell. Hopefully, Mimir hasn't decided to put any more obstacles in our way.",o="拿着创世者的圆盘，转至创世者的图书馆内的控制台。",oEN="Take the Inventor's Disk to the Inventor's Library Console inside the Inventor's Library.",p="控制台上出现了可以置入创世者的圆盘的开关。",pEN="The console appears to have an opening for the inventor's disk.",c="<你将圆盘置入了控制台。忽然面板上透出光芒，一条计算机的仿真语音传了出来。>\n\n创世者的圆盘已确认。欢迎回来，守护者米米尔。",cEN="<You insert the disk into the console. Suddenly, lights on its surface illuminate and a mechanical voice speaks.>\n\nInventor's disk authenticated. Welcome back, Keeper Mimir."}
Q[13416]={d="$n，诺甘农之壳近在咫尺，唾手可得。拿上创世者的圆盘转至图书馆的内部，你应该可以在那里找到一个用来激活圆盘的控制台。我想米米尔存储在那里的东西远比诺甘农之壳更多，甚至可能包括能让铁炉堡的工程师们忙上许多年的结构图！\n\n不管怎样，用圆盘来恢复诺甘农之壳。希望米米尔没有给我们设置什么棘手的障碍。",dEN="Norgannon's shell is within our reach, <name>. Take the inventor's disk into the library's interior. There should be a console there that you can activate with the disk. I imagine Mimir stored more there than just Norgannon's shell. There are probably enough schematics stored there to keep Ironforge's engineers occupied for years!\n\nAnyway, bring the disk to the console. Hopefully, Mimir hasn't decided to put any more obstacles in our way.",o="拿着创世者的圆盘，转至创世者的图书馆内的控制台。",oEN="Take the Inventor's Disk to the Inventor's Library Console inside the Inventor's Library.",p="控制台上出现了可以置入创世者的圆盘的开关。",pEN="The console appears to have an opening for the inventor's disk.",c="<你将圆盘置入了控制台。忽然面板上透出光芒，一跳计算机的仿真语音传了出来。>\n\n创世者的圆盘已确认。欢迎回来，守护者米米尔。",cEN="<You insert the disk into the console. Suddenly, lights on its surface illuminate and a mechanical voice speaks.>\n\nInventor's disk authenticated. Welcome back, Keeper Mimir."}
Q[13420]={d="这块冰已经在巨大的压力下剥离，暴露在来自地底深处的自然魔法中。这两种力量结合在一起，已经损伤了这块永不融化的坚冰。\n\n你对这种东西一无所知，但是你决定带一块样品到丹尼芬雷去，那里肯定有人熟悉它的特性。",dEN="This piece of ice has been submitted to immense pressures and exposed to natural magics from deep beneath the world's surface. In combination, these effects have yielded an ice that will never melt.\n\nKnowing little of these things, you resolve to bring the sample back to Dun Niffelem. Someone there is bound to be familiar with its properties.",o="返回丹尼芬雷，向卡尔德询问关于永冻之冰的事。",oEN="You are to return to Dun Niffelem and ask Calder about the piece of Everfrost.",c="<卡德尔高举起永冻薄片，反光映在卡德尔的眼中闪闪发亮。>\n\n哈，永冻薄片。我们的人民长久来的内心象征……\n\n永冻薄片曾经遍布这附近，随着岁月流逝，巨大的冰虫几乎吞噬了大部分。现在对我们的人民而言，每一块永冻薄片都显得格外珍贵。\n\n当你探索这块土地时，请留意是否还有更多的永冻薄片，然后带回来，我们会非常地感激你。",cEN="<The reflection of the everfrost sparkles in Calder's eye as he holds it aloft.>\n\nAhh, everfrost. The symbol of the heart of our people...\n\nEverfrost was once plentiful in this region. Over the ages, though, the Jormungar have devoured nearly all of it. It is now very rare and very precious to my people.\n\nAs you roam these lands, keep a lookout for more pieces of Everfrost. Return to me with any that you find. and we will me most grateful."}
Q[13422]={d="你完成了别人做不到的壮举。但是你不能满足于眼前的荣耀。\n\n一定要向别人展示力量与责任的真谛。\n\n荒弃矿洞里那些不听话的苦工又该受到教训了。让他们明白……不听话的下场。",dEN="You've succeeded where others have failed. Yet you cannot rest on your laurels.\n\nYou must show others what strength and commitment really mean.\n\nThe male insubordinates inside the Forlorn Mine need to be disciplined once again. Show them sister... show them what it means to disobey us.",o="布伦希尔达村的仲裁者格蕾塔要你进入荒弃矿洞，对6名筋疲力尽的维库人使用训诫之杖。",oEN="Gretta the Arbiter in Brunnhildar Village wants you to use the Disciplining Rod on 6 Exhausted Vrykul inside the Forlorn Mine.",p="万岁，我的姐妹。",pEN="Hail, <brother/sister>.",c="你依然是我们效法的榜样。我们仰慕你，姐妹。",cEN="You continue to lead by example. We look up to you, <brother/sister>."}
Q[13423]={d="你的表现令大家印象深刻，好姐妹。但是不要放松警惕——那些狂妄的挑战者随时都想要摘取你这海德比武会冠军的头衔。\n\n让这些井底之蛙见识一下你的实力吧。",dEN="Everyone's impressed by your performance, sister. But do not let your guard down -- every new challenger with delusions of grandeur is going to come out swinging for your title of Hyldskvinnar.\n\nShow these upstarts what you're made of.",o="布伦希尔达村的仲裁者格蕾塔要你击败6个获胜的挑战者。",oEN="Gretta the Arbiter in Brunnhildar Village wants you to defeat 6 Victorious Challengers.",c="你依旧地展现你的风范。你的到来使我们非常光荣。",cEN="You continue to prove yourself worthy. We are honored by your presence."}
Q[13424]={d="为了保持巅峰状态，每天你都必须与别的海德尼尔人战斗，以此磨练自己。\n\n请你返回利齿之坑，向她们展示一下你的力量。能被你这样出色的战士击败，是她们的荣幸。",dEN="To truly stay in your best riding shape you'll want to test yourself against the other Hyldnir every day.\n\nHead back into the Pit of the Fang and show them what you're capable of. They'll appreciate suffering defeat to one as skilled as yourself.",o="布伦希尔达村的仲裁者格蕾塔要你在利齿之坑内使用雌性战熊的缰绳，击败6头海德比武会战熊。",oEN="Gretta the Arbiter, in Brunnhildar Village, wants you to use the Reins of the Warbear Matriarch inside the Pit of the Fang and defeat 6 Hyldsmeet Warbears.",c="你一如以往地展现出你非凡的本领。你的姐妹依旧对你保持尊敬。",cEN="You continue to demonstrate your prowess. Your sisters have not lost their respect for you."}
Q[13425]={d="向你的同胞展示力量还不够。你还去要和我们的敌人作战，好姐妹。\n\n瓦基里安叛徒仍然在培养瘟疫始祖幼龙，侮辱我们高贵的骑龙传统。\n\n请你去夺取她们身上的冰霜油膏，并用它冰冻那些讨厌的瘟疫龙蛋。",dEN="It is not enough to demonstrate your prowess among your peers. You must also fight our enemies, dear sister.\n\nThe Valkyrion traitors continue to mock our noble drake-riding traditions by rearing plagued proto-drakes.\n\nSeize the frost oil they wield and use it to freeze their abominable plagued eggs.",o="布伦希尔达村的仲裁者格蕾塔要你转至瓦基里安，从瓦基里安候选者身上夺取冰霜油膏，并用冰霜油膏摧毁30枚瘟疫始祖龙卵。",oEN="Gretta the Arbiter in Brunnhildar Village wants you to go to Valkyrion and obtain Vials of Frost Oil from the Valkyrion Aspirants. Use the Vials of Frost Oil to destroy 30 Plagued Proto-Drake Eggs.",p="你摧毁那些染疫的蛋了吗？",pEN="Did you destroy the blighted eggs?",c="你在许多方面都出类拔萃。我们感谢你，姐妹。",cEN="A leader in more ways than one. We thank you, <brother/sister>."}
Q[13426]={d="看来我们不是这片区域唯一的访客。一名信使转来了一位名叫夏兰托的牛头人的消息，他说自己正在拜访一个叫坦卡罗营地的坦卡族村庄。这张便条有些隐晦，但这位夏兰托似乎是来风暴峭壁了解一位坦卡族传说的历史的。\n\n去和他碰个面，$n。看看他掌握的情况能否对我们有所帮助。按他的描述，坦卡罗营地在很远的东边，过了造物者平台，在尼费莱姆北面。",dEN="It seems we're not the only visitors to this area. A courier relayed a message from a tauren named Xarantaur, who said he was visiting a taunka village called Camp Tunka'lo. The note was somewhat cryptic, but it seems this Xarantaur has come to Storm Peaks to learn the history of a taunka legend.\n\nMeet up with him, <name>. See if what he knows can help us in any way. From his description, Camp Tunka'lo is far to the east, beyond the Terrace of the Makers and north of Dun Niffelem.",o="与唐卡洛营地的夏拉托尔谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Xarantaur at Camp Tunka'lo.",c="伯克塔收到我的信了？真是个好消息。先前我还怀疑送信的牦牛人远行者能不能找得到任何人。",cEN="So Boktar received my note? That's excellent news. I doubted the taunka longrummer who carried it would reach anyone."}
Q[13429]={d="<克希利身上发出阵阵淡泊的光芒，而他身边的奥尔多和占星者军队也响应着他的命令。克希利的军团已经完全准备好了，随时可以将伊利丹的军队压制住，并为阿卡玛吸引敌人的注意力。现在，这位纳鲁正等待着你给出进攻开始的信号。>",dEN="<Xi'ri pulses with lights as the Aldor and Scryer forces around him respond to his orders. Xi'ri's army is ready to push Illidan's forces back and create a distraction for Akama. The naaru awaits your request to begin the attack.>",o="在克希利的军队发动佯攻之后，保护阿卡玛和玛维进入影月谷内的黑暗神殿。",oEN="Ensure that Akama and Maiev enter the Black Temple in Shadowmoon Valley after Xi'ri's forces create a distraction."}
Q[13430]={d="在纳鲁认定你配得上之前，你必须通过四项试炼。$gdigno:digna;{None}\n凡人，只剩下最后一个障碍了。集结一支军队，前往地狱火堡垒深处的玛瑟里顿巢穴。一路杀到大厅中心，摧毁那个污秽的腐蚀者！\n",dEN="Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.\n\nOnly one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the foul corrupter!",o="沙塔斯城的阿达尔要求你杀死玛瑟里顿。",oEN="A'dal in Shattrath City wants you to slay Magtheridon.",c="你已经证明了你是拥有强大力量的人。纳鲁认同你……",cEN="You have proven yourself as a being of great power. The naaru approve..."}
Q[13431]={d="把那个木槌所需的元素徽记带给我！\n\n土灵徽记由屠龙者格鲁尔持有。格鲁尔可以在刀锋山他的巢穴里找到。\n\n第二枚徽记是一种叫夜之魇的生物炽热的心脏。据说这头神话般的野兽栖息在先知麦迪文的神圣殿堂中。\n\n动作快点！|n",dEN="Bring me the elemental signets that the cudgel requires!\n\nThe earthen signet is held by Gruul the Dragonkiller. Gruul can be found inside his lair in the Blade's Edge Mountains.\n\nThe second signet is the blazing heart of a creature known as Nightbane. This mythical beast is said to reside in the hallowed halls of the prophet, Medivh.\n\nMake haste!",o="将土灵徽记和灿烂徽记交给盘牙水库奴隶围栏的异教徒斯卡希斯。",oEN="Skar'this the Heretic in the heroic Slave Pens of Coilfang Reservoir wants you to bring him the Earthen Signet and the Blazing Signet.",p="用这根重组过的斗棍，我将挣脱我的束缚并且返回毒蛇神殿向瓦许和她的爪牙报仇！",pEN="With the cudgel reformed, I shall break free of my bonds and return to Serpentshrine to exact vengeance on Vashj and her minions!",c="终于！\n\n挣脱了这些束缚，斗棍也重回我的身边，我就可以把那个深海女巫送回冰冷的深渊去……",cEN="At last!\n\nWith these bonds broken and the cudgel in my possession I shall send the sea witch back to the icy depths..."}
Q[13432]={d="伊利丹从永恒之井中取出了七瓶水。他将其中三瓶倒入海加尔山颠的湖泊中，由此形成了第二口永恒之井。岁月流逝，剩下的四瓶水已不知去向。\n\n黑暗之门打开后，我们得知伊利丹将两瓶水交给了他的副官凯尔萨斯和瓦丝琪。取回残馀的永恒之水，我们可以利用它打开通往近代或是远古时期的海加尔山的时光通道。我们必须维持海加尔圣战的事件不被改变。",dEN="Seven vials were drawn from the Well of Eternity by Illidan. He poured three into the lake on top of Mount Hyjal and a second Well of Eternity was created. For years the rest were believed lost.\n\nWith the opening of the Dark Portal, we've come to know that he gave one each to his lieutenants Kael'thas and Vashj. Retrieve what remains of them; we will need them as foci to open a gateway to any events tied to Mount Hyjal, recent or ancient. The outcome of the Battle of Mount Hyjal must be preserved.",o="时光之穴的索莉多米要你从盘牙水库的瓦丝琪那里取回瓦丝琪的水瓶残馀，并从风暴要塞的凯尔萨斯·逐日者那里取回凯尔萨斯的水瓶残馀。",oEN="Soridormi at Caverns of Time wants you to retrieve Vashj's Vial Remnant from Lady Vashj at Coilfang Reservoir and Kael's Vial Remnant from Kael'thas Sunstrider at Tempest Keep.",p="我要求你做的事几乎是不可能办到的，但我仍然希望你可以成功。全靠你了。",pEN="I've asked the impossible of you, yet I expect you to succeed. Much depends on it.",c="即使是这么少量的永恒之井水也包含了不可思议的能量。\n\n我可以清楚的看到与海加尔相关的每个时空……第二个永恒之井的诞生，伊利丹的监禁，世界之树的附魔，还有……没错！海加尔山战役。\n\n我们必须加快脚步，时间线并不稳定。",cEN="The power contained even in this small amount of water from the Well of Eternity is incredible.\n\nI can see clearly into every moment in time linked to Hyjal... the creation of the second Well of Eternity, Illidan's imprisonment, the enchantment of the World Tree and... yes! The Battle of Mount Hyjal.\n\nWe must make haste, the timeline is not safe."}
