Q[13497]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Grizzly Hills flame!"}
Q[13498]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Storm Peaks flame!"}
Q[13499]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Crystalsong Forest flame!"}
Q[13500]={c="祭拜这团火焰！",cEN="Honor the Zul'Drak flame!"}
Q[13501]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[13502]={d="给你……拿着这只彩蛋篮，去寻找鲜艳的彩蛋吧。找到十块复活节巧克力以后，带着篮子回来找我。",dEN="Here... take this Egg Basket and go hunting for Brightly Colored Eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden Chocolates.",o="复活节小贩要你收集10块复活节巧克力，将它们和彩蛋篮一起带回来。",oEN="The Noblegarden Vendor wants you to collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Egg Basket.",p="你拿到10个复活节巧克力了吗？",pEN="Do you have the ten Noblegarden Chocolates?",c="干得好！喔，拜托……请拿好你的篮子！\n\n记住你总是可以带着更多的复活节巧克力回来交换额外的物品。",cEN="Well done! And here, please... keep the basket!\n\nRemember, you can always return with more Noblegarden Chocolates to trade for additional items."}
Q[13503]={d="给你……拿着这只彩蛋篮，去寻找鲜艳的彩蛋吧。找到十块复活节巧克力以后，带着篮子回来找我。",dEN="Here... take this Egg Basket and go hunting for Brightly Colored Eggs. Return to me with the basket when you've found ten Noblegarden Chocolates.",o="复活节商人要你收集10块复活节巧克力，将它们和彩蛋篮一起带回来。",oEN="The Noblegarden Merchant wants you to collect 10 Noblegarden Chocolates and return them along with the Egg Basket.",p="你拿到10个复活节巧克力了吗？",pEN="Do you have the ten Noblegarden Chocolates?",c="干得好！喔，拜托……请拿好你的篮子！\n\n记住你总是可以带着更多的复活节巧克力回来交换额外的物品。",cEN="Well done! And here, please... keep the basket!\n\nRemember, you can always return with more Noblegarden Chocolates to trade for additional items."}
Q[13538]={d="冬拥河南边的三座塔楼正在从堡垒中吸取能量！\n\n去摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后回来向我报告。记住，只有攻城车辆可以对塔楼造成伤害，所以你要保护好我们的攻城车，别让部落把它们给拆了！",dEN="The three towers south of the Wintergrasp river are draining power from the Fortress!\n\nDestroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower, then return to me. Remember, only siege vehicles can damage a tower, so make sure to protect them from the Horde!",o="摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官安布拉米斯复命。",oEN="Destroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower or Winter's Edge Tower and return to Tactical Officer Ahbramis in Wintergrasp.",p="你带来了南方的消息吗？",pEN="Do you bring word from the south?",c="我从这里就可以听到爆炸声！太出色了——我们已经将能量重新导向泰坦圣物，让它强化我们的力量。",cEN="I heard the explosion from here! Excellent job - we've already begun rerouting the power into the Titan relic to super-charge our own forces."}
Q[13539]={d="联盟也许正在猛敲我们的大门，但真正的战术家会看得更远。\n\n\"攻其无备，出其不意。\"\n\n$n，我需要你越过冬拥河，摧毁南边的三座塔之一。我们的术士报告说，那些塔正在抽走本可以用来增强我们自己部队的力量。\n\n摧毁一座塔后就回来见我。",dEN="While the Alliance may be pounding on our doors, a true tactician looks beyond the obvious.\n\n\"Attack him where he is unprepared, appear where you are not expected.\"\n\n<name>, I need you to travel across the Wintergrasp River and destroy one of the three towers to the south. Our Warlocks report that the towers are draining power we could use to bolster our own troops.\n\nReturn to me once you've destroyed a tower.",o="摧毁影目塔楼、火光塔楼或冬缘塔楼，然后向冬拥湖的参谋官基尔拉斯复命。",oEN="Destroy Shadowsight Tower, Flamewatch Tower, or Winter's Edge Tower and return to Tactical Officer Kilrath in Wintergrasp.",p="我对术士的嫌弃几乎快跟我对不死生物的憎恨差不多了。不过，他们在某些时候总还是派得上用场。",pEN="My disgust for Warlocks is only exceeded by my hate for the undead. However, they can both prove useful at times.",c="要杀光我们的敌人，我们的士兵必须要愤怒激昂，而击败敌人刚好能提供这些优势，一定要好好奖励他们。我希望这些能配得上你对部落的贡献。",cEN="Now in order to kill the enemy, our men must be roused to anger; that there may be advantage from defeating the enemy, they must have their rewards. I hope that these are sufficient for your service to the Horde."}
Q[13548]={c="这种糖果桶在各地的旅店都有。来吧……拿点糖果！",cEN="Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!"}
Q[13549]={d="除了达卡莱巨魔的古物之外，我还打算带一些祖达克地区的野生动物回到赞达拉去。我收集了一些雄性冰霜豹和冰爪熊，但是没有雌性怎么行呢？\n\n糟糕的是，我的猎人在一次不幸的事故中死亡了。也许你愿意替换他的位置？\n\n使用这支吹管催眠冰霜豹和冰爪熊，然后拎起它们的尾巴检查一下，如果是雌性的，就把它们带回这里。你可以在伦诺克、奎丝鲁恩和哈克娅的祭坛周围找到它们。",dEN="Along with the Drakkari artifacts, I'm interested in returning to Zandalar with some of the Zul'Drak wildlife. I have males of both the frost leopards and icepaw bears, but I need females!\n\nToo bad that my trapper was killed in a most unfortunate accident. Perhaps you would be willing to fill in for him?\n\nPut the leopards and bears to sleep with this blowgun then lift their tails and return with some females if you would be so kind. They can be found near the Altars of Rhunok, Quetz'lun, and Har'koa.",o="希姆托加的记载者图基尼希望你对冰霜豹和冰爪熊使用麻醉飞镖，并给他带回三头雌性冰霜豹和三头雌性冰爪熊。",oEN="Chronicler To'kini at Zim'Torga wants you to use To'kini's Blowgun on Frost Leopards and Icepaw Bears. Return to him with 3 females of each.",p="不，这样不行。拜托你带着三只雌豹和三只雌熊回来，好让我带着它们踏上艰难的归乡之路。",pEN="No, that just won't do. Please return when you have the female leopards and bears that I'll need for the arduous journey back home.",c="确实是极好的样本，<name>！这些肯定能让我家乡的同事们好奇地讨论上好几个小时。",cEN="Very fine specimens indeed, <name>! These are sure to provide many hours of curious speculation amongst my colleagues back home."}
Q[13556]={d="你好吗，老兄？想不想帮我个忙？巴金尼需要很多迅猛龙蛋来献给杜布拉金。$gtron:titi;{None}\n你觉得我们至今还没被达卡莱踏平是为什么？是杜布拉金在帮助我们！\n\n我们需要你去古达克外面这一带的树周围收集迅猛龙蛋。有时候迅猛龙也会把蛋带在身边保暖。\n",dEN="How ya doin', mon? Thinkin' ya might be helpin' me out? Bah'Kini be needin' lots o' the raptor eggs to be sacrificin' to Dubra'Jin.\n\nHow ya thinkin' we not be overrun yet by the Drakkari? Dubra'Jin be lendin' us his aid!\n\nWe need ya to gather up the raptor eggs from around the trees outside here in Gundrak. Sometimes the raptors carry 'em to keep 'em warm, too.",o="杜布拉金的哈瓦纳希望你去收集12枚古达克迅猛龙卵。",oEN="Ha'wana at Dubra'Jin needs you to collect 12 Gundrak Raptor Eggs.",p="谁会想到伟大的杜布拉金要这么多的蛋？他又要拿它们做什么咧？",pEN="Who woulda thought the great Dubra'Jin be wantin' so many eggs? What he gonna do with them anyway?",c="一，二，三……嘿嘿，还真是多啊，老兄！这下我们可以高枕无忧一段时间啦！",cEN="One, two, three,... hehe, that be a good number o' them, mon! Now we be safe for quite some time!"}
Q[13559]={p="当伟大的霍迪尔行走在霜巨人之间时，普通的贡品根本配不上他。\n\n他也许已经不在我们身边了，但我们保留着向他力量与智慧献上贡品的传统。参与这项传统会大大提升你的声望，小小的<class>。",pEN="No ordinary tributes were good enough for the great Hodir when he walked among the frost giants.\n\nHe might not be with us anymore, but we've kept the tradition of offering tribute to his strength and wisdom. It would do much for your renown to partake in this tradition, small <class>.",c="霍迪尔之子接受你的献礼，小朋友。你在许多方面都证明了自己身为盟友的价值。",cEN="The Sons of Hodir accept your tribute, small one. You continue to prove your worth as an ally in more ways than one."}
Q[13592]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的马库斯·巴洛爵士要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Sir Marcus Barlowe at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="训练回来了，<name>。哪怕我们正在为比赛练习，也别忘提醒自己，天灾军团还在外面。",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13593]={d="欢迎，$gCampeón:Campeona;。你战斗本领的名声已经传到我耳朵里了。你想加入暴风城的锦标赛代表团吗？\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在暴风城被授予$gCampeón:Campeona;之名后，你的侍从就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Do you seek to join Stormwind's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Stormwind, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为暴风城的勇士，就再去找雅各布·阿勒里乌斯元帅谈谈。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Marshal Jacob Alerius again if you wish to become a valiant of Stormwind.",c="我们很荣幸能有你的加入，也很期待你为我们争光。",cEN="We are proud that you have agreed to train with us and compete on our behalf."}
Q[13600]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<元帅从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<The marshal accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13603]={d="善良、诚实、磨得锋利的钢铁也许赢不了这一天。其他参赛者都在用附魔之刃，我发现自己处于劣势，但还没有全盘皆输。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说唯一能破除诅咒的，是一个自愿献出的吻。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n。否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些传说是真的？这真是把好剑，我毫不怀疑它在锦标赛中会大有用处。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13604]={d="这张白金圆盘对称得令人惊讶，没有任何划痕或瑕疵。边缘刻着粗犷的符文，拼出\"ARCHIVUM\"这个词。\n\n奥杜尔里面一定有某种装置能读取这张圆盘。",dEN="This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word \"ARCHIVUM.\"\n\nThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc.",o="将文件馆数据圆盘带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Archivum Data Disc to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="当控制台的圆形插座打开时，能量在控制台中呼啸流窜。",pEN="The console whirrs with energy as the round receptacle opens.",c="白金圆盘完美无缺地勘合进控制台中。它开始旋转而白色的光束扫过圆盘。",cEN="The platinum disc fits perfectly inside the console. It begins to spin as its contents are scanned by white beams of light."}
Q[13606]={d="我想弗蕾亚的徽记可能是最难得到的一块。\n\n根据文件馆的数据，徽记与弗蕾亚身边的三位古树仆从密切关联，它们是明叶长老、铁枝长老和石树长老。一旦它们之中有任何一位受到伤害，徽记的完整性就不能保障了。\n\n然而，如果你们对这三位长老手下留情，弗蕾亚的力量就会变得更加强大。\n\n我又能说什么呢，$n，我们现在真是进退维谷。",dEN="Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.\n\nAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark. Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.\n\nSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.\n\nWhat can I say, <name>. We're stuck between a rock and hard place.",o="将弗蕾亚的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得弗蕾亚的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="弗蕾亚的符记，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="Freya's sigil, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="干得漂亮，<name>。我们离拯救艾泽拉斯又近了一步！",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. We're one step closer to saving Azeroth!"}
Q[13607]={d="听着，$g小伙子:小姑娘，艾泽拉斯的命运危在旦夕。\n\n我们唯一的机会是到天文台去，找到奥尔加隆，阻止他向他的泰坦主人发送信息。\n\n赶快找到天文台。如果你发现了任何有价值的信息，就立即回来向我报告。奥尔加隆抵达之前，我们还有一些时间可以准备。",dEN="Listen, <lad/lass>! Azeroth's fate is at stake here.\n\nOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.\n\nLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get. We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival.",o="奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦要你找到天文台的入口。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to locate the entrance to the Celestial Planetarium.",c="锁住了？意料之中！\n\n让我们来瞧瞧能从这堆垃圾里面找到什么数据……",cEN="It's locked? Figures!\n\nLet's see what information this junk heap can give us..."}
Q[13609]={d="要拿到霍迪尔的徽记可不容易。你不但要击败霍迪尔，而且必须抢在他打碎装着徽记的箱子之前击败他！\n\n如果你想了解更多信息的话，可以去查查文件馆的控制台。那里面的知识比世界上所有的图书馆加在一起还要多！",dEN="Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain. Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!\n\nCheck the Archivum console if you need more information. That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!",o="将霍迪尔的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得霍迪尔的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console.",p="你拿到符记了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did ye obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="你办到了！我不知道你怎么做到的，但你居然成功了！",cEN="Ye did it! I don't know how, but ye did!"}
Q[13610]={d="托里姆已经失去了自我，$n。一股黑暗的力量正在影响着他。\n\n某个邪恶的家伙假扮成他死去的妻子西芙，蒙蔽了他的心智。\n\n你要阻止那个冒牌货控制托里姆。如果托里姆被这股力量征服，我们就永远都不能找到他的徽记了！\n\n你要让他清醒过来，越快越好！\n\n和以往一样，文件馆的控制台会给你提供所有必要的消息……包括那些你不喜欢听到的消息。",dEN="Thorim's not himself, <name>. He's come under a dark influence.\n\nAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.\n\nYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell. If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!\n\nYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.\n\nAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like.",o="将托里姆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得托里姆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="怎么样，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="Well, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="你总是让我惊叹，<name>。\n\n等这一切结束后，你和我一定要一起喝一杯，听到了吗？",cEN="Ye never cease to impress, <name>.\n\nYe and me are having a pint together after all this is done, ye hear me?"}
Q[13611]={d="米米尔隆是个聪明的家伙，他给自己的地盘装上了一套自毁设备。\n\n很不幸，如果你想要拿到徽记，就必须争分夺秒。如果你需要了解什么详细的数据，可以去文件馆控制台那里查询。",dEN="Mimiron's a clever one. His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.\n\nUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil. Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them.",o="将米米尔隆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员多尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得米米尔隆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Doren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="你拿到符记了吗，<name>？",pEN="Were you able to obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="我不得不佩服你，<name>。我们的胜算也许不算大，但有你在帮忙，我感觉好多了。",cEN="I've got to hand it to you, <name>. Our odds might not be the best, but I feel a lot better with you lending a hand."}
Q[13614]={d="你成功了，$n。把这些徽记拿到文件馆的控制台那里去，看看你能否进入天文台。\n\n你最好快一点，$g伙计:小丫头，时间紧迫。",dEN="You really did it, <name>. Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.\n\nYou best hurry, <lad/lass>. Time is of the essence.",o="将守护者的徽记带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Sigils of the Watchers to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="控制台的亮光迅速地扫过玻璃的表面，似乎在等待某些输入。",pEN="The console's bright lights scan the glass surface repeatedly, as if awaiting some form of input.",c="准备确认。\n\n准许进入星穹浑天仪。请取出你的钥匙。",cEN="Stand by for verification.\n\nAccess to the Celestial Planetarium granted. Please retrieve your key."}
Q[13616]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅。",oEN="Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13622]={d="这些碎片组合在一起，拼成了一把华丽的战锤。从构造上来看，它至少有一部分是由泰坦制造的。\n\n也许你可以在文件馆的控制台那里找到更多关于这把古代神器的消息。",dEN="The pieces fit together to form an elegant hammer. Its construction appears to be at least partially Titan in nature.\n\nThe console inside the Archivum might have some information regarding this artifact.\nRelated",o="将瓦兰奈尔的碎片拿到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台那里去。",oEN="Bring the Shattered Fragments of Val'anyr to the Archivum Console in the Archivum in Ulduar."}
Q[13625]={d="锦标赛中的大部分项目都要求参赛者熟练掌握骑乘战斗的技巧。为了让大家熟悉一边驾驭坐骑一边战斗的方式，我们在赛场北部布置了一些训练用的假人。\n\n到大帐外面的兽栏中去，拿起你的长枪，跨上奎尔多雷战马吧。你可以熟悉一下骑乘战斗中能够使用的战术，然后击败三种不同种类的训练假人。",dEN="Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Quel'dorei steed. Familiarize yourself with the tactics available to you and use them to defeat the three different kinds of training dummies.",o="使用刺击技能攻击一个近战目标5次，使用碎盾技能攻击2个脆弱的远程目标，使用冲锋技能攻击2个脆弱的冲锋目标，然后回到银色比武场，向斥候沙琳蒂亚复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Strike a Melee Target with Thrust 5 times, use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, use Charge on 2 vulnerable Charge Targets and then return to Scout Shalyndria at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="骑乘战斗练习得如何了？",pEN="How goes the mounted combat practice?",c="干得好，<name>。对于习惯步战的人来说，骑乘战斗往往很难上手。我毫不怀疑你会通过练习不断提高，这一点我可不敢说某些战士也能做到。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Mounted combat is often hard to pick up for those accustomed to fighting on foot. I have no doubt that you'll continue to improve with practice, which is more than I can say for some warriors."}
Q[13629]={d="根据文件馆控制台的提示，也许这个办法可以将瓦兰奈尔的碎片重新组合起来：你要把碎片放入尤格萨伦的体内。\n\n这方案听起来风险极大，不过为了这柄强大的上古神器，冒多大的风险都是值得的。",dEN="The Archivum Console has hinted at a possible way to rebind the fragments of Val'anyr: you must get the fragments inside the physical form of the being known as Yogg-Saron.\n\nIt sounds like a long shot, but for an artifact of such power you think the risk might just be worth it.",o="在尤格萨伦发出震耳咆哮时，将瓦兰奈尔的碎片投入尤格萨伦张开的嘴中，然后击败尤格萨伦，获得重铸的远古王者之锤。\n\n只能在英雄模式下完成，且至少需要有一位奥杜尔的守护者没有协助你。",oEN="Throw the Shattered Pieces of Val'anyr into Yogg-Saron's maw while he's casting Deafening Roar and defeat Yogg-Saron and recover the Reforged Hammer of Ancient Kings.\n\nThis can only be completed in Heroic mode and only if at least one Ulduar Watcher is not assisting you."}
Q[13631]={d="我们必须抓紧时间，$n。必须回到达拉然，在那里把恢复代码发射出去。\n\n带着它去找罗宁吧，我会在那里等你。",dEN="We'd best hurry now, <name>. We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.\n\nTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there.",o="将恢复代码阿尔法交给达拉然的罗宁。",oEN="Take the Reply-Code Alpha to Rhonin in Dalaran.",c="你在这儿。希望这样行得通吧。我们全都靠它了。",cEN="You're here. Let us hope this works. For all our sakes."}
Q[13633]={d="最近有不少关于那个被称为“黑骑士”的选手的传闻，你肯定也听说了吧？据说凡是将要与他对阵竞技的骑士都会惨遭横死。\n\n当然了，我们手里还没有确切的证据，不过调查一下他的后台总不会错的。\n\n他自称来自西部荒野的库珀系列。你能不能到西部荒野的月溪镇去一趟，在镇子里的西部本地调查一下这个系列的住所？看看你能不能查出些什么线索。",dEN="No doubt you've heard the disturbing rumors about the contestant the others are calling the Black Knight. It's said that any rider who was scheduled to face him in combat has met an untimely end.\n\nOf course, we have no definitive proof of anything, but it wouldn't hurt to look into this knight's background.\n\nHe claims to be descended from the Cooper family of Westfall. Would you visit their residence in the western part of Moonbrook in Westfall? See if you can find any proof of his story.",o="调查黑骑士的身世是否属实，然后回到银色比武场，向北伐军战士莱达拉汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the Black Knight's claims and return to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds with your findings.",p="你有找到任何东西能证实黑骑士的身份吗？",pEN="Have you found anything related to the Black Knight's story?",c="所以你是说这位骑士的故事是假的？非常可疑。往轻了说是无耻，往重了说是谋杀。不过，在确定他是否卷入这些谋杀之前，我们还不能与他对质。\n\n别做任何会引起他怀疑的事，<name>。在我们继续调查期间，谨慎对我们有利。",cEN="So you're saying this knight's story is a sham? Most suspicious. Dishonorable at the least, and murderous at the worst. Still, we can't confront him until we know for certain whether he was involved in these murders.\n\nDo nothing to arouse his suspicions, <name>. Discretion will serve us well as we continue to investigate."}
Q[13634]={d="最近有不少关于那个被称为“黑骑士”的选手的传闻，你肯定也听说了吧？据说凡是将要与他对阵竞技的骑士都会惨遭横死。\n\n当然了，我们手里还没有确切的证据，不过调查一下他的后台总不会错的。\n\n他自称出生于银松森林的瓦尔甘农场。这个小农场就坐落在洛丹米尔湖的西岸。你能否到农场去调查一下，看看他说的是不是实话？",dEN="No doubt you've heard the disturbing rumors about the contestant the others are calling the Black Knight. It's said that any rider who was scheduled to face him in combat has met an untimely end.\n\nOf course, we have no definitive proof of anything, but it wouldn't hurt to look into this knight's background.\n\nHe claims to hail from Valgan's Field in Silverpine Forest. It's a small farm on the western shore of Lordamere Lake. Would you visit the farm and let me know if there's any truth to his story?",o="调查黑骑士的身世是否属实，然后回到银色比武场，向北伐军战士莱达拉汇报你的发现。",oEN="Investigate the Black Knight's claims and return to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds with your findings.",p="你有找到任何东西能证实黑骑士的身份吗？",pEN="Have you found anything related to the Black Knight's story?",c="所以你是说这位骑士的故事是假的？非常可疑。往轻了说是无耻，往重了说是谋杀。不过，在确定他是否卷入这些谋杀之前，我们还不能与他对质。\n\n别做任何会引起他怀疑的事，<name>。在我们继续调查期间，谨慎对我们有利。",cEN="So you're saying this knight's story is a sham? Most suspicious. Dishonorable at the least, and murderous at the worst. Still, we can't confront him until we know for certain whether he was involved in these murders.\n\nDo nothing to arouse his suspicions, <name>. Discretion will serve us well as we continue to investigate."}
Q[13641]={d="既然我们知道黑骑士的故事全是假的，就必须找到办法把他和被谋杀的骑士们联系起来。\n\n我知道一种查明他们真正死因的方法，但需要一种稀有材料。我们必须弄到一块先知水晶，它只生长在凄凉森林中暗夜精灵废墟附近以及晶歌森林中部地区聚集的萨特身上。找到这样一位先知，$n，把他持有的水晶带给我。",dEN="Now that we know there's no truth to the Black Knight's stories, we must find a way to connect him to the murdered knights.\n\nI know a way to reveal the truth about how they died, but it requires a rare material. We must gain a seer's crystal, found only among the unbound seers who congregate near night elf ruins in the Forlorn Woods in the central part of Crystalsong Forest. Find one of these seers, <name>, and bring me the crystal it holds.",o="将一块先知的水晶交给银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Bring a Seer's Crystal to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你找到先知的水晶了吗？",pEN="Have you located a seer's crystal?",c="嗯，这块就够用了。现在只需要将圣光之力灌注其中，赋予它揭露真相的能力。",cEN="This one will do nicely. All that remains is to imbue it with the power of the Light, giving it the ability to find truth amid deception."}
Q[13643]={d="这块水晶将揭开那三名选手的死亡真相。把它带到比赛场东边的墓地里去，并在温德尔·巴尔弗爵士、洛林·阳焰和康纳尔·铁拳的墓前使用它。\n\n如果他们真的是被谋杀的，那我们必须在黑骑士再次行动前抓住他的把柄。你要仔细观察水晶所展示的东西，$n，我们必须确证这些死亡不是巧合。",dEN="The crystal will reveal the truth about how three of the tournament's combatants died. Take it with you to the graveyard east of the Tournament Grounds and use it before the graves of Sir Wendell Balfour, Lorien Sunblaze, and Conall Irongrip.\n\nIf indeed these men were murdered, then we must find a way to tie it to the Black Knight before he strikes again. Look closely at what the crystal tells you, <name>, for we must be certain these deaths were not accidental.",o="在温德尔·巴尔弗爵士、洛林·阳焰和康纳尔·铁拳的坟墓前使用先知的水晶，查出他们死亡的真相，然后将结果报告给北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Use the Seer's Crystal at the graves of Sir Wendell Balfour, Lorien Sunblaze, and Conall Irongrip to determine how they died, then return to Crusader Rhydalla.",p="你去造访那些被杀害参赛者的墓地了吗？",pEN="Have you visisted the graves of the slain combatants?",c="所以你说洛林·阳焰是死于中毒，而温德尔·巴尔弗爵士被活活烧死？真是可怕的死法，两个人都是。只有康纳尔·铁拳是被刀剑所杀，而照你所说那是胆小鬼的偷袭——他死于一场不光彩的战斗。\n\n这三个人原本都排定要和黑骑士竞技——这可不是巧合。现在我们一定要找出方法来证明这是黑骑士所为。",cEN="So you say Lorien Sunblaze was done in by poison and Sir Wendell was burnt alive? Dreadful ways to die, both of them. Only Conall was killed by cold steel, and from your description, it was a coward's strike, not honorable combat that laid him in his grave.\n\nAll three sparred with and were scheduled to fight the Black Knight. This cannot be a coincidence. Now, we must find a way to prove it was the Black Knight's work."}
Q[13654]={d="每天，黑骑士的侍从玛洛里克都会扛着斧子，大摇大摆地离开营地，转至晶歌森林。他必然是想让我们相信他是出去砍柴了，但每次他都只带回几根小树枝。\n\n他经常到暮色之镜西南方的废墟去。也许他的骑士领主的确是让他去办什么事情，但即使如此，他在那里待的时间也太长了些。\n\n想点什么办法吸引他的注意力，或者把他打昏，然后搜搜他身上的东西。如果他真的在打什么鬼主意，我们可不能蒙在鼓里。",dEN="Every day, the Black Knight's squire, Maloric, makes a big show of heading to Crystalsong Forest with his axe over his shoulder. He wants us to believe he's chopping wood, but he never returns with more than a few twigs.\n\nHe usually goes toward the ruins southwest of the Mirror of Twilight. He spends a lot of time out there, even for a squire with responsibilities to his knight.\n\nFind a way to distract or incapacitate him and search him. If he's up to something, we'll know it.",o="从一个骷髅伐木工身上取下一根大腿骨，用它打昏玛洛里克。在玛洛里克身上搜查一番，找到证据后向银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉报告。",oEN="Obtain a Large Femur from a Skeletal Woodcutter and use it to incapacitate Maloric. Search Maloric for evidence, then report back to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="侍从的举止有透露出什么线索吗？",pEN="Did the squire's behavior yield any clues?",c="<Crusader Rhydalla examina el contenido de la bolsa con una expresión de disgusto en su rostro.>\n\n全都在这里，<name>：毒死罗瑞恩的毒药，还有一堆刀、火把和油。在这里，没有人有理由拥有这些东西，也没有哪个侍从会在没有主君命令的情况下这么做。我们找到凶手了，<name>，但他为谁效力？",cEN="<Crusader Rhydalla examines the bag's contents with a look of disgust on her face.>\n\nIt's all here, <name>: the poison that killed Lorien, a collection of knives, torches, and oil. No man has cause to possess these things here and no squire would do so without orders from his knightly master. We've found our murderer, <name>, but who is he working for?"}
Q[13662]={p="你在兄弟会内部的公司等级中晋升了，<race>。我们开始对你刮目相看了。这可不简单！\n\n如果你有兴趣接更多活，在我们中间赢得更多尊重，那就听着。\n\n我们可以往混合物里加入一种简单的黑铁残渣，来精炼炽热之流。黑铁残渣可以在黑石深渊找到。\n\n把你找到的黑铁残渣全都带给我！",pEN="You've worked your way up through the Brotherhood's corporate hierarchy, <race>. We have begun to look favorably upon you. Quite an accomplishment!\n\nIf you're interested in more work and earning more respect amongst us, listen up.\n\nWe can refine the fiery flux by adding a simple Dark Iron residue to the mix. The Dark Iron residue can be found in Blackrock Depths.\n\nBring me all the Dark Iron residue you find!",c="继续拿残油来！",cEN="Keep the residue pouring in!"}
Q[13663]={d="我们必须调查清楚，是谁把这个黑骑士派到锦标赛上来的，杀死这些参赛者又会给他的主人带来什么好处。\n\n肯瑞托的代表愿意帮助我们调查这件事情，他为我们提供了一件必要的工具。\n\n拿着这条魔法缰绳，到比武场东侧的黑骑士营地去，用它控制黑骑士的狮鹫。缰绳上的魔法会强迫狮鹫把你带到它主人的家里去。调查那个地方，然后回来向我报告。",dEN="We must discover who sent the Black Knight to the tournament and what his master hopes to gain by killing the competitors.\n\nThe Kirin Tor has offered to help in this matter and provided us with something to help our search.\n\nTake this enchanted bridle to the Black Knight's camp on the eastern edge of the tournament grounds and use it to gain control over the Black Knight's gryphon. The bridle's magic will force the gryphon to take you to his master's home. Search it and return with anything you find.",o="使用魔法缰绳控制黑骑士的狮鹫，骑着它飞到目的地，然后找到被偷走的锦标赛邀请函和黑骑士的命令，并把它们带回银色比武场，交给北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Use the Enchanted Bridle to gain control of the Black Knight's Gryphon and ride it to its destination. Once you have arrived, recover the Stolen Tournament Invitation and the Black Knight's Orders and bring them to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你有何发现？",pEN="What did you discover?",c="<El rostro de la Crusader Rhydalla palidece al leer las órdenes.>\n\n这只能意味着一件事，<name>。黑骑士是诅咒神教的成员，是阿尔萨斯派来破坏锦标赛的！\n\n黑骑士已被证明是个可怕的对手，如果你想与他交手，就得同样出色。等你成为冠军后，回来找我，我们会想办法确保他败亡。",cEN="<Crusader Rhydalla's face pales as she reads the orders.>\n\nThis can only mean one thing, <name>. The Black Knight is a member of the Cult of the Damned and has been sent by Arthas to disrupt the tournament!\n\nThe Black Knight has proven himself a fearsome combatant, and you will need to be every bit as good if you wish to face him. When you are a champion, return to me and we'll find a way to ensure his defeat."}
Q[13664]={d="我们必须阻止黑骑士的计划，并且让我们的敌人知道，我们不会就这样坐视不管，听任他们杀害我们的勇士。\n\n现在，他应该已经开始怀疑有人在跟踪他了。$n，你必须在光天化日、众目睽睽之下挑战他，这样他就没法拒绝应战，也不能借着夜色的掩护搞些谋杀之类的勾当。\n\n骑着我的银色军马去作战吧，它就在兽栏中休息。\n\n与冠军赛场中的侍从加文谈一谈，他会把黑骑士叫来参加战斗，而你要让他为自己的罪行付出代价。",dEN="We must put an end to the Black Knight's scheming, and show those who oppose us that we will not stand by and allow our champions to be murdered.\n\nBy now, he will suspect that someone is on his trail. Challenge him in the light of day, where he cannot refuse or murder in the dark, <name>.\n\nUse my argent charger for the battle. It's housed in the stables.\n\nSpeak to Squire Cavin at the Ring of Champions. The squire will call the Black Knight to battle, but you will make him answer for his crimes.",o="击败黑骑士，然后向银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉复命。",oEN="Defeat the Black Knight and then speak to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="随着黑骑士的死亡，锦标赛可以再次发挥它的作用了。部落与联盟的冠军们可以展示他们的武艺，为阿尔萨斯和他的爪牙不再威胁我们的那一天而训练。\n\n你得到了银色北伐军的感谢，<name>，也得到所有响应我们号召之人的感谢。",cEN="With the death of the Black Knight, the tournament may once again serve its purpose. The champions of the Horde and Alliance may demonstrate their skill at arms and train for the day when Arthas and his minions will no longer threaten us.\n\nYou have the thanks of the Argent Crusade, <name>, and that of all who have answered our call."}
Q[13665]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。暴风城的人民热爱他们的骑士，期待看到我们获胜。为此，他们一直在与其他勇士较量磨练技艺。\n\n我建议你也这么做。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上艾尔文战马，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的联盟勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of Stormwind adore their knights and are looking forward to seeing us win the melee. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the other valiants.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Elwynn steed, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Alliance Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的约瑟夫·霍雷上尉。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Captain Joseph Holley at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让暴风城感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make Stormwind proud, <name>."}
Q[13666]={d="有些冠军相信一件源自北裂境的古老武器会在锦标赛中给他们带来好运。我已同意帮他们寻找那件武器。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Some of the champions believe an ancient weapon born of Northrend will bring them luck in the tourney. I have agreed to help them search for these weapons.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些古老的传说确有几分真实？看来它们没有说谎，这把剑的品质确实出众。干得好，<name>。挥舞它的冠军一定会是个幸运的人。",cEN="So there is some truth to those old tales? It seems they did not lie about the quality of the blade. Well done, <name>. The champion who wields it will be a lucky man, indeed."}
Q[13667]={d="我们诚挚地邀请你参加银色锦标赛，与那些英勇抗击天灾军团的战士们共同磨练作战技巧与勇气。我们之间有许多分歧，然而现在，英雄们，我们必须团结在同一面旗帜下，考验彼此的战斗能力，准备对抗我们共同的敌人。\n\n奥术师泰利斯是银色盟约派驻锦标赛的代表，他会将你的名字登记在名单上，安排你开始训练。你可以在场地东北方的联盟大帐中找到他。",dEN="We have invited you here to test your skill and valor against others who have bravely opposed the Scourge. Many have been our divisions, but the time has come for heroes fighting under all banners to test their blades against one another in preparation for facing our mutual enemy.\n\nArcanist Taelis is the Silver Covenant's representative to the tournament and he'll enter your name into the rolls and begin your training. Seek him out inside the large Alliance tent in the northeastern part of the grounds.",o="与银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯谈一谈，报名参加锦标赛。",oEN="Speak with Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament grounds to enroll in the tournament.",c="我已把你的名字登记在名册上，<name>。作为参赛者，你将与其他想参加锦标赛的人一起训练，磨练你的骑乘战斗技巧。一旦你证明了自己，就获准以你首都的名义进入最低级别的比赛。",cEN="I have entered your name in the rolls, <name>. As an aspirant you will train with others who wish to compete in the tournament and hone your mounted combat skills. Once you have proven yourself, you will be allowed to enter the lowest rank of competition on behalf of your capital city."}
Q[13668]={d="我们诚挚地邀请你参加银色锦标赛，与那些英勇抗击天灾军团的战士们共同磨练作战技巧与勇气。我们之间有许多分歧，然而现在，英雄们，我们必须团结在同一面旗帜下，考验彼此的战斗能力，准备对抗我们共同的敌人。\n\n魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷是夺日者派驻锦标赛的代表，他会将你的名字登记在名单上，安排你开始训练。你可以在场地东南方的部落大帐中找到他。",dEN="We have invited you here to test your skill and valor against others who have bravely opposed the Scourge. Many have been our divisions, but the time has come for heroes fighting under all banners to test their blades against one another in preparation for facing our mutual enemy.\n\nMagister Edien Sunhollow is the Sunreaver representative to the tournament and he'll enter your name into the rolls and begin your training. Seek him out inside the large Horde tent in the southeastern part of the grounds.",o="与银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷谈一谈，报名参加锦标赛。",oEN="Speak with Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament grounds to enroll in the tournament.",c="我已把你的名字登记在名册上，<name>。作为参赛者，你将与其他想参加锦标赛的人一起训练，磨练你的骑乘战斗技巧。一旦你证明了自己，就获准以你首都的名义进入最低级别的比赛。",cEN="I have entered your name in the rolls, <name>. As an aspirant you will train with others who wish to compete in the tournament and hone your mounted combat skills. Once you have proven yourself, you will be allowed to enter the lowest rank of competition on behalf of your capital city."}
Q[13669]={d="我们的勇士对诺森德出产的古代武器都很有兴趣。\n\n一位吟游诗人告诉我，如果哪位旅人能给一位孤独的女士带去几朵冬水仙，就可以获得她的礼物。那些花只生长在铁墙大坝下游的浮冰上，就在晶歌森林的西北部，与冰冠冰川交界的地方。去摘些这种花，然后把花带到龙骨荒野东北部的达克玛尔湖去，就在该地区与祖达克、灰熊丘陵的交界处。",dEN="Our champions have taken a liking to ancient weapons produced here in Northrend.\n\nI've heard the bards telling tales of travelers offering winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to the circle of lamps in Drak'Mar Lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills. Ask the lonely maiden for a worthy blade.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这把剑刃的精致的质量与平衡度是无可挑剔的。现在我知道为何联盟的勇士们如此渴求这些武器。",cEN="There's no doubt that this is a blade of exquisite quality and balance. Now I understand why these weapons are so coveted among the champions of the Alliance."}
Q[13670]={d="铁炉堡大冠军的侍从给我讲了一个有趣的故事。\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="The Ironforge grand champion's squire told me an intriguing story.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯。",oEN="Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑真的跟侍从说得一样好，但是他怎么知道这件事的？不管他了，它一定能让新的持有者大显神威。或许铁炉堡的冠军正是适合的人。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the squire said it would be, but where did he find out about it? No matter; it will serve its new owner well. Perhaps it's only fair that Ironforge's grand champion be the one to wield it."}
Q[13671]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。虽然你已经学会了骑乘作战的要领，也不要把这么多年来积累的战斗技巧都给抛到脑后去。我们需要你用实际行动证明，你可以充满荣誉与勇气地面对天灾军团，这样你才有资格参加我们的锦标赛。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，把你在那里遇到的所有天灾军团成员都给干掉。不过你要离轰炸场远一些，那里的敌人实在是太多了。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you learn to master mounted combat, do not forget to practice the skills that have served you well all these years. Show us that you can face the Scourge with honor and bravery, and you will earn your right to compete in this tournament.\n\nTravel to Icecrown and slay any Scourge you see there, but stay clear of the Bombardment, where you would be overwhelmed.",o="银色比武场的阿瓦雷斯·迅击要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭8名天灾军团士兵。除了轰炸场之外，在冰冠冰川的任何地方遇到的天灾都可以。",oEN="Avareth Swiftstrike at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 8 Icecrown Scourge. You may kill Scourge in any part of Icecrown except the Bombardment.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="你已证明自己是一名能干的战士，<name>，你将成为其他渴望代表联盟参赛的参赛者的榜样。",cEN="You have shown yourself a capable combatant, <name> and you will serve as an example to the rest of the aspirants who clamor to compete on behalf of the Alliance."}
Q[13672]={d="当你掌握了参赛者的技能后，就可以选择接受参赛者的挑战。这项挑战将考验你的骑乘战斗技巧，并评估你是否准备好获得$gValeroso:Valerosa;的称号。如果你通过了，就能以$gValeroso:Valerosa;的身份加入你首都的代表团。\n\n准备好接受挑战时，来找我。$glisto:lista;",dEN="When you have mastered the skills of the aspirant, you may choose to take the aspirant's challenge. The challenge will test your mounted combat skills and assess whether or not you're prepared to become a valiant. Should you pass, you will be able to join your capital city's delegation as a valiant.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin the challenge, return to me.",o="将15枚候选者的徽记交给银色比武场的奥术师泰利斯，证明你已经准备好迎接候选者的挑战了。",oEN="Present Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament with 15 Aspirant's Seals to signify you're ready to undergo the aspirant's challenge.",p="你想要接受勇士的挑战吗？",pEN="Do you wish to take the aspirant's challenge?",c="很好，让我安排一下。",cEN="Very well, I will make the arrangements."}
Q[13673]={d="有些冠军相信一件源自北裂境的古老武器会在锦标赛中给他们带来好运。我已同意帮他们寻找那件武器。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Some of the champions believe an ancient weapon born of Northrend will bring them luck in the tourney. I have agreed to help them search for these weapons.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些古老的传说确有几分真实？看来它们没有说谎，这把剑的品质确实出众。干得好，<name>。挥舞它的冠军一定会是个幸运的人。",cEN="So there is some truth to those old tales? It seems they did not lie about the quality of the blade. Well done, <name>. The champion who wields it will be a lucky man, indeed."}
Q[13674]={d="我们的勇士对诺森德出产的古代武器都很有兴趣。\n\n一位吟游诗人告诉我，如果哪位旅人能给一位孤独的女士带去一朵冬水仙，就可以获得她的礼物。那些花只生长在铁墙大坝下游的浮冰上，就在晶歌森林的西北部，与冰冠冰川交界的地方。去摘些这种花，然后把花带到龙骨荒野东北部的达克玛尔湖去，就在该地区与祖达克、灰熊丘陵的交界处。在一圈明灯中找到那位女士。你可以找她要一把珍贵的宝剑。",dEN="Our champions have taken a liking to ancient weapons produced here in Northrend.\n\nI've heard the bards telling tales of travelers offering winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to the circle of lamps in Drak'Mar Lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills. Ask the lonely maiden for a worthy blade.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这把剑刃的精致的质量与平衡度是无可挑剔的。现在我知道为何联盟的勇士们如此渴求这些武器。",cEN="There's no doubt that this is a blade of exquisite quality and balance. Now I understand why these weapons are so coveted among the champions of the Alliance."}
Q[13675]={d="有一位来自奥格瑞玛的勇士给我讲了一个有趣的故事。\n\n转至晶歌森林的南部，你可以在水晶裂痕的出口上方找到恒焰领主。杀死他，拿到他身上的恒焰灰烬。\n\n带着恒焰灰烬转至嚎风峡湾北部的冬息湖中心，解救一位被寒冰困在那里的女士。她守护着一把古代宝剑，能够解救她的人就可以获得那把宝剑作为奖励。\n\n证明你的能力，拿到她守护了许久的宝剑吧，$n。",dEN="I heard an interesting story from one of the Ogrimmar valiants.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷。",oEN="Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑真的跟骁士说得一样好，但是他怎么知道这件事的？不管他了，它一定能让新的持有者大显神威。或许奥格瑞玛的冠军正是适合的人。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the valiant said it would be, but where did he find out about it? No matter; it will serve its new owner well. Perhaps it's only fair that Orgrimmar's grand champion be the one to wield it."}
Q[13676]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。虽然你已经学会了骑乘作战的要领，也不要把这么多年来积累的战斗技巧都给抛到脑后去。我们需要你用实际行动证明，你可以充满荣誉与勇气地面对天灾军团，这样你才有资格参加我们的锦标赛。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，把你在那里遇到的所有天灾军团成员都给干掉。不过你要离轰炸场远一些，那里的敌人实在是太多了。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you learn to master mounted combat, do not forget to practice the skills that have served you well all these years. Show us that you can face the Scourge with honor and bravery, and you will earn your right to compete in this tournament.\n\nTravel to Icecrown and slay any Scourge you see there, but stay clear of the Bombardment, where you would be overwhelmed.",o="银色比武场的阿玛里尔·火盟要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭8名天灾军团士兵。除了轰炸场之外，在冰冠冰川的任何地方遇到的天灾都可以。",oEN="Amariel Sunsworn at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 8 Icecrown Scourge. You may kill Scourge in any part of Icecrown except the Bombardment.",c="你已证明自己是一名能干的战士，<name>，你将成为其他渴望代表部落参赛的参赛者的榜样。",cEN="You have shown yourself a capable combatant, <name> and you will serve as an example to the rest of the aspirants who clamor to compete on behalf of the Horde."}
Q[13677]={d="锦标赛的大多数比赛都要求参赛者精通骑乘作战。为了让你熟悉骑乘战斗，我们在锦标赛场地北部立了训练假人。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上一只森金迅猛龙……哦不，是骑上一只血精灵陆行鸟。熟悉你的坐骑，用它的技能击败三种训练假人。|n",dEN="Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Sunreaver hawkstrider. Familiarize yourself with the mount and use its abilities to defeat the three different kinds of training dummies.",o="使用刺击技能攻击一个近战目标5次，使用碎盾技能攻击2个脆弱的远程目标，使用冲锋技能攻击2个脆弱的冲锋目标，然后回到银色比武场，向加拉希亚·晨光复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Strike a Melee Target with Thrust 5 times, use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, use Charge on 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, and then return to Galathia Brightdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or the Sunreaver Pavilion.",c="干得好，<name>。对于习惯步战的人来说，骑乘战斗往往很难上手。我毫不怀疑你会通过练习不断提高，这一点我可不敢说某些战士也能做到。",cEN="Well done, <name>. Mounted combat is often hard to pick up for those accustomed to fighting on foot. I have no doubt that you'll continue to improve with practice, which is more than I can say for some warriors."}
Q[13678]={d="当你掌握了参赛者的技能后，就可以选择接受参赛者的挑战。这项挑战将考验你的骑乘战斗技巧，并评估你是否准备好获得$gValeroso:Valerosa;的称号。如果你通过了，就能以$gValeroso:Valerosa;的身份加入你首都的代表团。\n\n准备好接受挑战时，来找我。$glisto:lista;",dEN="When you have mastered the skills of the aspirant, you may choose to take the aspirant's challenge. The challenge will test your mounted combat skills and assess whether or not you're prepared to become a valiant. Should you pass, you will be able to join your capital city's delegation as a valiant.\n\nWhen you are ready to begin the challenge, return to me.",o="将15枚候选者的徽记交给银色比武场的魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷，证明你已经准备好迎接候选者的挑战了。",oEN="Present Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament with 15 Aspirant's Seals to signify you're ready to undergo the aspirant's challenge.",p="你想要接受勇士的挑战吗？",pEN="Do you wish to take the aspirant's challenge?",c="很好，让我安排一下。",cEN="Very well, I will make the arrangements."}
Q[13679]={d="作为参赛者，你训练得很刻苦，$n，现在是时候在一名娴熟的对手面前检验你的骑乘战斗技巧了。\n\n装备你的长枪，然后去凉亭外的马厩，骑上备好的奎尔多雷战马。\n\n在锦标赛场地北部的参赛者比武场，你会遇到一位名叫大卫的年轻人类侍从。他会问你准备好了没有，然后叫出你的对手。$glisto:lista;{None}\n祝你好运，\n。愿你坐骑稳当，愿你枪法精准，$n。",dEN="You have trained hard as an aspirant, <name>, and now the time has come to test your mounted combat skills against a skilled opponent.\n\nEquip your lance, then go to the stables outside the pavilion and mount up on the stabled Quel'dorei steed.\n\nAt the Aspirants' Ring on the northern side of the tournament grounds, you'll find Squire David. He'll make certain that you're ready for the fight and call out your opponent.\n\nGood luck, <name>. May your horse be steady and your aim true.",o="和侍从大卫谈一谈，召唤你的对手。击败银色勇士之后回到银色比武场，向奥术师泰利斯复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你面对了你的挑战吗？",pEN="Have you faced your challenge?",c="该向你道贺了，<name>。你战胜了对手，赢得了晋升为勇士的资格。",cEN="Congratulations are in order, <name>. You have bested your challenger and earned the right to advance to the rank of valiant."}
Q[13680]={d="作为参赛者，你训练得很刻苦，$n，现在是时候在一名经验丰富的对手面前检验你的骑乘战斗技巧了。\n\n装备你的长枪，然后去凉亭外的马厩，骑上血精灵陆行鸟。\n\n在锦标赛场地北部的参赛者比武场，你会遇到一位名叫大卫的年轻人类侍从。他会问你准备好了没有，然后叫出你的对手。$glisto:lista;{None}\n祝你好运，\n。愿你坐骑稳当，愿你枪法精准，$n。",dEN="You have trained hard as an aspirant, <name>, and now the time has come to test your mounted combat skills against an experienced opponent.\n\nEquip your lance, then go to the stables outside the pavilion and mount the Sunreaver hawkstrider.\n\nAt the Aspirants' Ring on the northern side of the tournament grounds, you'll find a human child called Squire David. He'll ask if you're ready for the fight and call out your opponent.\n\nGood luck, <name>. May your mount be steady and your aim true.",o="和侍从大卫谈一谈，召唤你的对手。击败银色勇士之后回到银色比武场，向魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷复命。",oEN="Speak with Squire David to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Valiant, return to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你面对了你的挑战吗？",pEN="Have you faced your challenge?",c="该向你道贺了，<name>。你战胜了对手，赢得了晋升为勇士的资格。",cEN="Congratulations are in order, <name>. You have bested your challenger and earned the right to advance to the rank of valiant."}
Q[13682]={d="在你找出诅咒教派的间谍以后，大领主提里奥·弗丁安排了双倍的卫兵。弗丁大人认为诅咒教派不会仅仅因为失去一个黑骑士就善罢甘休。\n\n根据天爪龙斥候的报告，有一支诅咒教派的部队正准备袭击我们，他们的首领是一条名叫冰喉的冰霜巨龙。如果不阻止他们的话，赛场就会受到攻击。斥候们说，冰喉就盘旋在我们的西南方向，铁墙大坝和奥尔杜萨交界的地方。",dEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring has doubled the guard since your exposure of the Cult of the Damned's infiltrator. He doesn't believe that they will stop just because their Black Knight has been defeated.\n\nOur skytalon scouts have reported sighting a frost wyrm named Chillmaw leading a cult raiding party. If we don't intercept them, the tournament will come under attack. The scouts reporting seeing Chillmaw to the southwest, flying over the area between the Ironwall Rampart and Aldur'thar.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要你消灭3名诅咒教派投弹手，并击败冰喉。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament wants you to defeat Chillmaw and 3 Cultist Bombardiers.",p="你击败了诅咒教派的突袭队吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the Cult of the Damned raiding party?",c="<name>，你和你的盟友让锦标赛免遭一场毁灭性的袭击。我们的天爪骑手虽然勇敢，但要维持锦标赛场地的安宁已经够他们忙的了，要抵御教派的空中进攻会很吃力。你得到了银色北伐军的感谢，也得到所有聚集于此参赛之人的感谢。",cEN="<name>, you and your allies have spared the tournament from a devastating attack. Though our skytalon riders are brave, they have their hands full keeping the peace on the tournament grounds and would be hard-pressed to defend the skies against the cult's attack. You have the thanks of the Argent Crusade and all who have gathered here to compete."}
Q[13684]={d="你已证明自己配得上在暴风城的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，你应该去拜见领导暴风城代表团的雅各布·阿勒里乌斯元帅。作为暴风城的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Stormwind, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Marshal Jacob Alerius, who leads the Stormwind delegation. As Stormwind's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与雅各布·阿勒里乌斯元帅谈谈，成为暴风城的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Stormwind.",c="那么欢迎加入，勇士<name>。暴风城代表团很荣幸能把你算作其中一员。",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Stormwind delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13685]={d="你已证明自己配得上在铁炉堡的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，你应该去拜见领导铁炉堡代表团的拉娜·硬锤。作为铁炉堡的大冠军，她会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Ironforge, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Lana Stouthammer, who leads the Ironforge delegation. As Ironforge's grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与拉娜·硬锤谈谈，成为铁炉堡的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Ironforge.",c="很高兴见到你，勇士。铁炉堡需要像你这样的参赛者好在联赛中获胜。",cEN="It's good to meet you, valiant. Ironforge needs competitors like you to prevail in the tournament."}
Q[13688]={d="你已证明自己配得上在诺莫瑞根的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，你应该去拜见领导诺莫瑞根代表团的安布罗斯·闪爆。作为侏儒的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Gnomeregan, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Ambrose Boltspark, who leads the Gnomeregan delegation. As the gnomish grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与安布罗斯·闪爆谈谈，成为诺莫瑞根的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Gnomeregan.",c="那么欢迎加入，勇士<name>。诺莫瑞根代表团很荣幸能把你算作其中一员。",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Gnomeregan delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13689]={d="你已证明自己配得上在达纳苏斯的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，你应该去拜见领导达纳苏斯代表团的耶琳·夜歌。作为暗夜精灵的大冠军，她会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Darnassus, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Jaelyne Evensong, who leads the Darnassus delegation. As the night elf grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与耶琳·夜歌谈谈，成为达纳苏斯的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Darnassus.",c="欢迎加入达纳苏斯的锦标赛代表团，<name>。能与你一起训练和比赛将是件愉快的事。",cEN="Welcome to the Darnassus tournament delegation, <name>. It will be a pleasure to train and compete alongside you."}
Q[13690]={d="你已证明自己配得上在埃索达的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，你应该去拜见领导埃索达代表团的克罗索斯。作为德莱尼的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of the Exodar, <name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Colosos, who leads the Exodar delegation. As the draenei grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与克罗索斯谈谈，成为埃索达的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of the Exodar.",c="那么欢迎加入，勇士<name>。埃索达代表团很荣幸能把你算作其中一员。",cEN="Welcome aboard then, Valiant <name>. The Exodar's delegation is proud to count you among its members."}
Q[13691]={d="你已证明自己配得上在奥格瑞玛的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，去和领导奥格瑞玛参赛者的碎颅者莫克拉谈谈。作为奥格瑞玛的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Orgrimmar, <name>. Now, you should speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher, who leads Orgrimmar's competitors. As Orgrimmar's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与碎颅者莫克拉谈谈，成为奥格瑞玛的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Orgrimmar.",c="你想要替奥格瑞玛参赛？别以为你打赢了几个假人就觉得自己赢了，不过你将会和最精英的高手一起接受训练。",cEN="So you want to compete for Orgrimmar? Just because you've beaten up a few dummies doesn't mean you'll win, but you'll be training with the best from now on."}
Q[13693]={d="你已证明自己配得上在森金的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，去和领导森金战士的祖尔托谈谈。作为巨魔的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Sen'jin, <name>. Now, you should speak with Zul'tore who leads Sen'jin's warriors. As the troll grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与祖尔托谈谈，成为森金的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Sen'jin.",c="你觉得自己能够替森金出赛？我想我们很快就知道。",cEN="You think you have what it takes to compete for Sen'jin? I think we'll be finding out."}
Q[13694]={d="你已证明自己配得上在雷霆崖的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，去和领导雷霆崖参赛者的鲁诺克·蛮鬃谈谈。作为雷霆崖的大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Thunder Bluff, <name>. Now, you should speak with Runok Wildmane, who leads Thunder Bluff's competitors. As Thunder Bluff's grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与鲁诺克·蛮鬃谈谈，成为雷霆崖的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Thunder Bluff.",c="我代表雷霆崖和它的战士们欢迎你，<name>。永远在我们的旗帜下光荣而勇敢地战斗吧。",cEN="On behalf of Thunder Bluff and its warriors, I welcome you, <name>. Always fight honorably and bravely beneath our banner."}
Q[13695]={d="你已证明自己配得上在幽暗城的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，去和领导幽暗城代表团的死亡猎手维瑟里谈谈。作为大冠军，他会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of the Undercity, <name>. Now, you should speak with Deathstalker Visceri, who leads the Undercity delegation. As grand champion, he will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与死亡猎手维瑟里谈谈，成为幽暗城的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of the Undercity.",c="欢迎加入幽暗城代表团，<name>。作为勇士，你将与我们一同训练，为最高级别的比赛做好准备。",cEN="Welcome to the Undercity delegation. <name>. As a valiant, you'll train with us to prepare you for the highest level of competition."}
Q[13696]={d="你已证明自己配得上在银月城的旗帜下参赛，$gdigno:digna;{None}。现在，去和领导银月城代表团的埃雷西亚·晨歌谈谈。作为银月城的大冠军，她会以城市的名义为你报名参赛，监督你的训练，并考验你是否能成为勇士。$n$gValeroso:Valerosa;{None}与你共事是我的荣幸，\n，祝你在前方的比赛中好运。\n$n",dEN="You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Silvermoon, <name>. Now, you should speak with Eressea Dawnsinger, who leads the Silvermoon delegation. As Silvermoon's grand champion, she will enter you into the tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",o="去银色锦标赛场地与埃雷西亚·晨歌谈谈，成为银月城的勇士。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds to become a valiant of Silvermoon.",c="所以你要为银月城参赛？很好。我会把你加入名单中，你可以立刻开始跟其它骁士一起活动。",cEN="So you want to compete for Silvermoon? Very well. I'll add you to the rolls and you may begin working with the other valiants immediately."}
Q[13697]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13699]={d="你差不多准备好代表暴风城参加大混战了。要证明你配得上以我们城市的名义进入名册，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Stormwind in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向雅克布·奥勒留斯元帅复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Marshal Jacob Alerius at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将代表暴风城参加最高级别的比赛，手持武器、背披我们强大的战旗，驰骋于大混战之中。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Stormwind, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13702]={d="恭喜你，$n。你已精通多种战斗方式，克服了你面对的所有挑战。毫无疑问，你已准备好与聚集在这场锦标赛上的最优秀战士、与各首都城市的冠军一较高下。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入联盟另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13703]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。我已经听说了你的战斗本领。你想加入铁炉堡的锦标赛代表团吗？\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在铁炉堡被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的侍从就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Do you seek to join Ironforge's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Ironforge, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为铁炉堡的勇士，就再去找拉娜·硬锤谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Lana Stouthammer again if you wish to become a valiant of Ironforge.",c="你决定加入我们让我倍感骄傲，我知道你一定会在战场上大放异彩。",cEN="We are proud that you have decided to join us and I know you will shine on the field."}
Q[13704]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。我已经听说了你的战斗本领。诺莫瑞根代表团真的能受益于像你这样的$gun:una;$c。\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在诺莫瑞根被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的侍从就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Gnomeregan's delegation could really benefit from a <class> like you.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Gnomeregan, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为诺莫瑞根的勇士，就再去找安布罗斯·闪爆谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Ambrose Boltspark again if you wish to become a valiant of Gnomeregan.",c="我们很自豪能把你算作我们中的一员，<name>，我们期待与你一起训练。",cEN="We're proud to count you among us, <name>, and we look forward to training with you."}
Q[13705]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。我已经听说了你的事迹。你想加入埃索达的锦标赛代表团吗？\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在埃索达被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的侍从就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. Word of your deeds has already reached my ears. Do you wish to join the Exodar's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of the Exodar, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为埃索达的勇士，就再去找克罗索斯谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Colosos again if you wish to become a valiant of the Exodar.",c="有你在我们队里真好，<name>。我们都会从与你一起训练中受益。",cEN="It's good to have you on our team, <name>. We will all benefit from training with you."}
Q[13706]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。我已听说了你的成就，如果你愿意加入达纳苏斯的代表团，我们将不胜荣幸。\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在达纳苏斯被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的侍从就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. I have heard of your accomplishments and we would be honored if you would join the delegation from Darnassus.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Darnassus, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为达纳苏斯的勇士，就再去找耶琳·夜歌谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Jaelyne Eveonsong again if you wish to become a valiant of Darnassus.",c="达纳苏斯的勇士将很荣幸与你并肩战斗与训练。",cEN="The warriors of Darnassus are honored to fight and train beside you."}
Q[13707]={d="那么，你现在是$gun Campeón:una Campeona;了？那你已证明自己是一名配得上的战士，我很自豪地欢迎你加入我们奥格瑞玛的代表团。$gun combatiente digno:una combatiente digna;\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在奥格瑞玛被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的蛮兵就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Orgrimmar's delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Orgrimmar, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为奥格瑞玛的勇士，就再去找碎颅者莫克拉谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher again if you wish to become a valiant of Orgrimmar.",c="那么欢迎你，<name>。我期待看你与我的手下一起训练。",cEN="Welcome, then, <name>. I look forward to watching you train with my men."}
Q[13708]={d="向你致意，$gCampeón:Campeona;。如果你愿意，我欢迎你加入森金的锦标赛代表团。\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在森金被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的蛮兵就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Greetings, champion. If you are willing, I would welcome you into Sen'jin's tournament delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Sen'jin, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为森金的勇士，就再去找祖尔托谈谈。$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Zul'tore again if you wish to become a valiant of Sen'jin.",c="我很高兴你决定加入我们，很期待你的表现。",cEN="I am glad that you have decided to join us and look forward to seeing you in action."}
Q[13709]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。作为雷霆崖代表团的大冠军，如果你愿意，我将很荣幸地欢迎你加入我们的行列。\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在雷霆崖被授予$gCampeón:Campeona;之名后，你的蛮兵就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. As grand champion of the Thunder Bluff delegation, I would be honored to welcome you into our ranks, if you are willing.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Thunder Bluff, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为雷霆崖的勇士，就再去找鲁诺克·蛮鬃谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Runok Wildmane again if you wish to become a valiant of Thunder Bluff.",c="我很荣幸你选择加入我们的代表团。我知道你会让我们感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="I am honored that you have chosen to join our delegation. I know you will make us proud, <name>."}
Q[13710]={d="欢迎你，$gCampeón:Campeona;。被遗忘者代表团总能用得上像你这样的$gun:una;$c。你愿意加入我们吗？\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在幽暗城被授予$go Campeón:a Campeona;之名后，你的蛮兵就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="Welcome, champion. The Forsaken delegation could always use more <class>s like you. Would you join us?\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of the Undecity, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想要成为幽暗城的勇士，就再找死亡猎手维瑟里谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Deathstalker Visceri again if you wish to become a valiant of the Undercity.",c="你选择得很明智，<name>。我们双方都会从这项安排中受益。",cEN="You have chosen wisely, <name>. Both of us will benefit from this arrangement."}
Q[13711]={d="那么，你现在是$gun Campeón:una Campeona;了？那你已证明自己是一名配得上的战士，我很自豪地欢迎你加入我们银月城的代表团。$gun combatiente digno:una combatiente digna;\n\n你将像以前一样训练并逐级晋升，但当你在银月城被授予$gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona;之名后，你的蛮兵就可以选择把我们的战旗带进战场。",dEN="So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Silvermoon's delegation.\n\nYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Silvermoon, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",o="如果你想成为银月城的勇士，就再去找埃雷西亚·晨歌谈谈。$gValeroso:Valerosa;",oEN="Speak with Eressea Dawnsinger again if you wish to become a valiant of Silvermoon.",c="能与你一起训练和比赛将是我的荣幸，<name>。",cEN="It will be an honor training and competing with you, <name>."}
Q[13713]={d="你差不多准备好代表铁炉堡参加大混战了。要证明你配得上以我们城市的名义进入名册，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Ironforge in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向兰娜·硬锤复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将代表铁炉堡参加最高级别的比赛，手持武器、背披我们强大的战旗，驰骋于大混战之中。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Ironforge, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13714]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的兰娜·硬锤。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13715]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的阿姆布罗斯·电光。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13716]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的科鲁索斯。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
