Q[13720]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的鲁诺克·蛮鬃。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13721]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的死亡猎手维瑟里。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13722]={d="作为$gValeroso:Valerosa;的训练中，你将有机会与其他城市代表的勇士一较高下。虽然$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;之间的战斗并非比赛的正式部分，但你会从中学到关于对手战斗风格与弱点的宝贵经验。\n\n勇士们都是争强好胜之人，为荣誉与名声而互相竞争。\n\n以$gun Valeroso:una Valerosa;的身份训练，直到你确信自己有能力击败任何与你交手的人。然后把赢得的徽记带给我。",dEN="In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have earned.",o="将25枚勇士的徽记交给银色比武场的伊蕾希亚·晨歌。",oEN="Bring 25 Valiant's Seals to Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你准备好要证明你为成为勇士而磨练的技巧了？",pEN="Are you ready to demonstrate your mastery of the valiant's skills?",c="令人印象深刻，勇士。我会尽快安排你的考验。",cEN="Impressive, valiant. I will make the arrangements for your test immediately."}
Q[13723]={d="你差不多准备好代表诺莫瑞根参加大混战了。要证明你配得上以我们城市的名义进入名册，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;{None}\n\n|n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Gnomeregan in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向阿姆布罗斯·电光复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将代表诺莫瑞根参加最高级别的比赛，手持武器、背披我们强大的战旗，驰骋于大混战之中。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Gnomeregan, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13724]={d="你差不多准备好代表埃索达参加大混战了。要证明你配得上以我们城市的名义进入名册，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;{None}\n\n|n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of the Exodar in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向科鲁索斯复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将代表埃索达参加最高级别的比赛，手持武器、背披我们强大的战旗，驰骋于大混战之中。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of the Exodar, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13725]={d="你差不多准备好代表达纳苏斯参加大混战了。要证明你配得上以我们城市的名义进入名册，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete on behalf of Darnassus in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy to enter the lists on behalf of our city, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向亚琳·永歌复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将代表达纳苏斯参加最高级别的比赛，手持武器、背披我们强大的战旗，驰骋于大混战之中。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level on behalf of Darnassus, riding in the grand melee with your weapon at the ready and our mighty pennant at your back."}
Q[13726]={d="你差不多准备好参加大混战了。要证明你配得上这份荣耀，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向碎颅者莫克拉复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将参加最高级别的比赛，在奥格瑞玛的旗帜下驰骋于大混战之中，碾碎对手。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level, riding in the grand melee and crushing the competition under the banner of Orgrimmar."}
