Q[13728]={d="你差不多准备好参加大混战了。要证明你配得上这份荣耀，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向鲁诺克·蛮鬃复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将参加最高级别的比赛，在雷霆崖的旗帜下驰骋于大混战之中，碾碎对手。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level, riding in the grand melee and crushing the competition under the banner of the Thunder Bluff."}
Q[13729]={d="你差不多准备好参加大混战了。要证明你配得上这份荣耀，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向死亡猎手维瑟里复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将参加最高级别的比赛，在幽暗城的旗帜下驰骋于大混战之中，碾碎对手。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level, riding in the grand melee and crushing the competition under the banner of the Undercity."}
Q[13731]={d="你差不多准备好参加大混战了。要证明你配得上这份荣耀，你必须击败一名银色北伐军的冠军。$glisto:lista;{None}$gdigno:digna;{None}去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪并上马。与场地最西端银色勇士比武场的侍从丹尼谈谈。你准备好时，侍从会叫出你的对手。\n\n战斗结束后，我们再来谈结果。$glisto:lista;\n\n",dEN="You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the outcome.",o="与侍从丹尼谈一谈，他会为你安排对手。击败银色冠军之后，回到银色比武场，向伊蕾希亚·晨歌复命。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Speak with Squire Danny to summon your opponent. Once you have defeated the Argent Champion, return to Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你打败了银白勇士吗？",pEN="Have you overcome the Argent champion?",c="你已证明自己配得上冠军的称号，<name>。你将参加最高级别的比赛，在银月城的旗帜下驰骋于大混战之中，碾碎对手。",cEN="You have proven yourself worthy of the title of champion, <name>. You will compete at the tournament's highest level, riding in the grand melee and crushing the competition under the banner of Silvermoon."}
Q[13732]={d="恭喜你，$n。你已精通多种战斗方式，克服了你面对的所有挑战。毫无疑问，你已准备好与聚集在这场锦标赛上的最优秀战士、与各首都城市的冠军一较高下。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入大混战。$n",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入联盟另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13733]={d="恭喜你，$n。你已精通多种战斗方式，克服了你面对的所有挑战。毫无疑问，你已准备好与聚集在这场锦标赛上的最优秀战士、与各首都城市的冠军一较高下。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入大混战。$n",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入联盟另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13734]={d="恭喜你，$n。你已精通多种战斗方式，克服了你面对的所有挑战。毫无疑问，你已准备好与聚集在这场锦标赛上的最优秀战士、与各首都城市的冠军一较高下。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入大混战。$n",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入联盟另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13735]={d="恭喜你，$n。你已精通多种战斗方式，克服了你面对的所有挑战。毫无疑问，你已准备好与聚集在这场锦标赛上的最优秀战士、与各首都城市的冠军一较高下。$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入联盟另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Alliance city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13736]={d="你赢得了我和同伴们的尊敬。你击败了所有向你挑战的人，精通了锦标赛的战斗方式。我毫不怀疑你已准备好为奥格瑞玛的荣耀迎战其他城市的冠军！$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Orgrimmar!\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入部落另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Horde city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13737]={d="你赢得了我和同伴们的尊敬。你击败了所有向你挑战的人，精通了锦标赛的战斗方式。我毫不怀疑你已准备好为暗矛的荣耀迎战其他城市的冠军！$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of the Darkspear!\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入部落另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Horde city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13738]={d="你赢得了我和同伴们的尊敬。你击败了所有向你挑战的人，精通了锦标赛的战斗方式。我毫不怀疑你已准备好为雷霆崖的荣耀迎战其他城市的冠军！$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of the Thunder Bluff!\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入部落另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Horde city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13739]={d="你赢得了我和同伴们的尊敬。你击败了所有向你挑战的人，精通了锦标赛的战斗方式。我毫不怀疑你已准备好为被遗忘者的荣耀迎战其他城市的冠军！$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of the Forsaken!\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入部落另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Horde city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13740]={d="你赢得了我和同伴们的尊敬。你击败了所有向你挑战的人，精通了锦标赛的战斗方式。我毫不怀疑你已准备好为银月城的荣耀迎战其他城市的冠军！$gpreparado:preparada;{None}\n审判者玛丽尔·真心请求与你交谈，\n，并正式引你进入冠军们的大混战。$n",dEN="You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Silvermoon!\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",o="与银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="我欢迎你成为本次锦标赛的冠军，<name>。作为冠军，你将能角逐锦标赛的大冠军头衔。你也可以选择加入部落另一座城市的代表团成为勇士，并假以时日成为那座城市的冠军。\n\n所有冠军都需要一名侍从协助，<name>，你也不例外。请允许我指派我们中的一位随你上阵。他会自豪地高举任何授予你冠军之名的城市的战旗。",cEN="I welcome you as a champion of the tournament, <name>. As a champion, you will be able to compete for the grand championship of the tournament. You may also choose to become a valiant with another Horde city's delegation and in time, a champion for that city as well.\n\nAll champions must have the assistance of a squire, <name>, and you are no exception. Allow me to appoint one of ours to accompany you in battle. He will proudly carry the banner of any city that has named you a champion."}
Q[13741]={d="善良、诚实、磨得锋利的钢铁也许赢不了这一天。其他参赛者都在用附魔之刃，我发现自己处于劣势，但还没有全盘皆输。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说唯一能破除诅咒的，是一个自愿献出的吻。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n。否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的兰娜·硬锤。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些传说是真的？这真是把好剑，我毫不怀疑它在锦标赛中会大有用处。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13742]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的兰娜·硬锤。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<勇士从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<The grand champion accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13743]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的兰娜·硬锤。",oEN="Lana Stouthammer at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring her Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13744]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的鲁洛·强击要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Rollo Sureshot at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",c="训练回来了，<name>。哪怕我们正在为比赛练习，也别忘提醒自己，天灾军团还在外面。",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13745]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。铁炉堡的人民期待听到我们成功的消息。为此，他们一直在与代表联盟其他首都的勇士切磋磨练技艺。\n\n我建议你也这么做。勇士们就在我们帐篷外的比武场训练。装备你的长枪，去凉亭外的马厩，骑上备好的铁炉堡山羊，向其他联盟勇士发起挑战。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of Ironforge are looking forward to hearing of our success. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the valiants representing the other Alliance capitals.\n\nI suggest you do the same. The valiants practice in the ring just outside our tent. Equip your lance, go to the stables outside the pavilion and mount the stabled Ironforge ram, then challenge other Alliance valiants.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的克拉拉·沸酒。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Clara Tumblebrew at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让铁炉堡感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make Ironforge proud, <name>."}
Q[13746]={d="善良、诚实、磨得锋利的钢铁也许赢不了这一天。其他参赛者都在用附魔之刃，我发现自己处于劣势，但还没有全盘皆输。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说唯一能破除诅咒的，是一个自愿献出的吻。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n。否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的阿姆布罗斯·电光。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些传说是真的？这真是把好剑，我毫不怀疑它在锦标赛中会大有用处。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13747]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的阿姆布罗斯·电光。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<安布罗斯从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<Ambrose accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13748]={d="这是我最后一次和死亡骑士切磋了。\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是一把古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。$gor:ora;{None}\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，\n。$n|n",dEN="That's the last time I ever spar with a death knight.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的阿姆布罗斯·电光。",oEN="Ambrose Boltspark at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13749]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的提克·扳钳要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Tickin Gearspanner at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="训练回来了，<name>。我相信比赛开始时你会让我们感到骄傲的。",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. I'm confident that you will make us proud when the competition starts."}
Q[13750]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。我们知道大家都期待听到我们成功的消息。为此，我们一直在与代表联盟其他首都的勇士切磋磨练技艺。\n\n我建议你也这么做。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上备好的涡轮陆行鸟，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的联盟勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. We know everyone's looking forward to seeing us in the competition. To that end, we've been honing our skills against the valiants representing the other Alliance capitals.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled turbostrider, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Alliance Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的弗林克·扳钳。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Flickin Gearspanner at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让我们感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make us proud, <name>."}
Q[13752]={d="善良、诚实、磨得锋利的钢铁也许赢不了这一天。其他参赛者都在用附魔之刃，我发现自己处于劣势，但还没有全盘皆输。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说唯一能破除诅咒的，是一个自愿献出的吻。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n。否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的科鲁索斯。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些传说是真的？这真是把好剑，我毫不怀疑它在锦标赛中会大有用处。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13753]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的科鲁索斯。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<勇士从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<The grand champion accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13754]={d="这是我最后一次和死亡骑士切磋了。\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是一把古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。$gor:ora;{None}\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，\n。$n",dEN="That's the last time I ever spar with a death knight.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的科鲁索斯。",oEN="Colosos at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13755]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的萨安度斯要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Saandos at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",c="训练回来了，<name>。哪怕我们正在为比赛练习，也别忘提醒自己，天灾军团还在外面。",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13756]={d="总决赛是锦标赛中最重要的一场比赛。埃索达的人民期待着我们能获得这场比赛的胜利。为了这个目标，我们要不断地与其它的勇士们比武练习，提升自己的战斗能力。\n\n我推荐你也参加。\n\n到大帐外面的兽栏中去，拿起你的长枪，骑上兽栏中的秘蓝岛雷象，去挑战其它的勇士吧。联盟勇士的练习场就在我们的帐篷外面，他们在那里等待你的挑战。",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of the Exodar are looking forward to seeing us win the melee. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the valiants representing the other Alliance capitals.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Azuremyst elekk, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Alliance Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的兰妮。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Ranii at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让我们感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make us proud, <name>."}
Q[13757]={d="善良、诚实、磨得锋利的钢铁也许赢不了这一天。其他参赛者都在用附魔之刃，我发现自己处于劣势，但还没有全盘皆输。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说唯一能破除诅咒的，是一个自愿献出的吻。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n。否则你会长疣的。",dEN="Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的亚琳·永歌。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以那些传说是真的？这真是把好剑，我毫不怀疑它在锦标赛中会大有用处。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="So the tales were true? This is a fine blade and I have no doubt that it will serve me well in the tournament. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13758]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！我的剑不见了！\n\n我听诗人讲过旅人向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子以换取礼物的故事。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖的光环处。向那位孤独的少女求取一把配得上的剑。|n",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的亚琳·永歌。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="<洁琳从你手上接过达克玛尔之剑。>\n\n真是一把好剑，完美的平衡性。这一定能让我在下一场比赛好好发挥。",cEN="<Jaelyne accepts the Blade of Drak'Mar from you.>\n\nA fine weapon, and perfectly balanced. It will serve me well in the next match."}
Q[13759]={d="这是我最后一次和死亡骑士切磋了。\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是一把古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。$gor:ora;{None}\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，\n。$n",dEN="That's the last time I ever spar with a death knight.\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的亚琳·永歌。",oEN="Jaelyne Evensong at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring her Winter's Edge.",p="你拿到我要找的剑了吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade I seek?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13760]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的伊蕾丝蒂亚·刃歌要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Illestria Bladesinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="训练回来了，<name>。哪怕我们正在为比赛练习，也别忘提醒自己，天灾军团还在外面。",cEN="Welcome back from your exercises, <name>. Even while we practice for the competition, it's good to remind ourselves that the Scourge is still out there."}
Q[13761]={d="总决赛是锦标赛中最重要的一场比赛。达纳苏斯的人民期待着我们获得这场比赛的胜利。为了这个目标，我们要不断地与其它的勇士们比武练习，提升自己的战斗能力。\n\n我推荐你也参加。\n\n到大帐外面的兽栏中去，拿起你的长枪，骑上兽栏中的达纳苏斯雾刃豹，去挑战其它的勇士吧。联盟勇士的练习场就在我们的帐篷外面，他们在那里等待你的挑战。",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. The people of Darnassus are looking forward to seeing us win the melee. To that end, they've been honing their skills against the valiants representing the other Alliance capitals.\n\nI suggest you do the same.\n\nThe Alliance Valiants' Ring is just outside our tent. Go to the stables on the outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Darnassian mistsaber, and challenge the valiants.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的艾莱·觅星。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Airae Starseeker at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让达纳苏斯感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make Darnassus proud, <name>."}
Q[13762]={d="我听说联盟的冠军们在为他们的战士寻找古老之剑。我们不能让他们获得那样的优势。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13763]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之剑不见了！我听诗人讲过旅人向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子以换取礼物的故事。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖的光环处。向那位孤独的少女求取一把配得上的剑。|n",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这是把好武器，能帮我碾碎对手。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13764]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的碎颅者莫克拉。",oEN="Mokra the Skullcrusher at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13765]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的埃基诺斯要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Akinos at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13767]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。胜利不会轻松，但我相信我们会赢。你必须与坐骑一起练习，直到你们合为一体。\n\n这会帮你为锦标赛中严酷的战斗做好准备。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上备好的奥格瑞玛战狼，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的部落勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Orgrimmar wolf, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的茉拉·狼女。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Morah Worgsister at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="和其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13768]={d="我听说联盟的冠军们在为他们的战士寻找古老之剑。我们不能让他们获得那样的优势。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的祖尔托。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13769]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的祖尔托。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这是把好武器，能帮我碾碎对手。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13770]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的祖尔托。",oEN="Zul'tore at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13771]={d="锦标赛是与同侪较量技艺的时刻，但我们不能忘记真正的敌人——天灾军团——不会坐等。你在与他人切磋技艺的同时，也该保持与敌人战斗的锋芒。\n\n前往失落希望之谷西南、科雷萨以北的区域。在那里，天灾军团正把死去的英雄复活，转而对付我们。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，告慰我们的盟友，为战斗做好准备。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的暗影猎手梅兹克雷要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Shadow Hunter Mezil-kree at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13772]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。胜利不会轻松，但我相信我们会赢。你必须与坐骑一起练习，直到你们合为一体。\n\n这会帮你为锦标赛中严酷的战斗做好准备。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上备好的暗矛迅猛龙，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的部落勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Darkspear raptor, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的加尔祖。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Gahju at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="其他勇士彼此对战训练是最快让你明白如何击败对手的方法。只要持续练习，你绝对能在竞赛中击败他们。",cEN="Training against other valiants will quickly teach you what you need to know to best them. Keep it up and you'll have no trouble defeating them in competition."}
Q[13773]={d="我听说联盟的冠军们在为他们的战士寻找古老之剑。我们不能让他们获得那样的优势。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给带给银色比武场的鲁诺克·蛮鬃。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13774]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之剑不见了！我听诗人讲过旅人向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子以换取礼物的故事。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖的光环处。向那位孤独的少女求取一把配得上的剑。|n",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的鲁诺克·蛮鬃。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这是把好武器，能帮我碾碎对手。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13775]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的鲁诺克·蛮鬃。",oEN="Runok Wildmane at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13776]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的德恩·暴怒图腾要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Dern Ragetotem at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13777]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。胜利不会轻松，但我相信我们会赢。你必须与坐骑一起练习，直到你们合为一体。\n\n这会帮你为锦标赛中严酷的战斗做好准备。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上备好的莫高雷科多兽，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的部落勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Mulgore kodo, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的安卡·爪蹄。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Anka Clawhoof at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="和其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13778]={d="我听说联盟的冠军们在为他们的战士寻找古老之剑。我们不能让他们获得那样的优势。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给带给银色比武场的死亡猎手维瑟里。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13779]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的死亡猎手维瑟里。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Deathsalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这是把好武器，能帮我碾碎对手。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13780]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是一把古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。$gor:ora;{None}\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，\n。$n|n",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的死亡猎手维瑟里。",oEN="Deathstalker Visceri at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13781]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的莎拉·查尔克要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Sarah Chalke at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13782]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。胜利不会轻松，但我相信我们会赢。你必须与坐骑一起练习，直到你们合为一体。\n\n这会帮你为锦标赛中严酷的战斗做好准备。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上被遗忘者战马，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的部落勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Forsaken warhorse, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的马夫德雷奇。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Handler Dretch at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13783]={d="我听说联盟的冠军们在为他们的战士寻找古老之剑。我们不能让他们获得那样的优势。\n\n灰熊丘陵有个古老的传说，讲的是一位被诅咒成青蛙形态的少女，为的是守护她长久以来看守的那把剑。她住在灰木湖岸边的湖蛙之间，就在灰木哨站以东。据说只有自愿献出的吻才能破除诅咒。在亲吻任何东西之前先涂上这种药膏，$n，否则你会长疣的。",dEN="I've heard that the Alliance champions are seeking after ancient blades for their warriors. We can't afford to let them have that kind of advantage.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, you'll catch warts.",o="找到灰木之剑，把它交给银色比武场的伊蕾希亚·晨歌。",oEN="Retrieve the Ashwood Brand and bring it to Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能拿到那柄剑吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover the blade?",c="所以传说是真的？这柄剑足以胜过所有联盟参赛者的配剑。",cEN="So the tales were true? This blade should be enough to best anything those Alliance entrants can come up with."}
Q[13784]={d="偏偏在这种时候运气这么差！\n\n我的锦标赛之刃不见了，而今天下午还有一场比赛要用它。一位诗人告诉我，过去旅人会向一位孤独的少女献上冬风信子，以换取礼物。那些风信子只生长在铁墙水坝流下的冰层上，位于晶歌森林与冰冠冰川交界的西北边缘。采集这些花，把它们带到龙眠荒野东北部、靠近祖达克和灰熊丘陵交界的德拉科玛尔湖。",dEN="Of all the times to have such rotten luck!\n\nMy tournament blade has gone missing and I need it for a match this afternoon.\n\nOne of the bards tells me that travelers used to present winter hyacinths to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather the flowers and take them to Drak'Mar lake in northeastern Dragonblight, near its border with Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills.",o="将达克玛尔之剑交给银色比武场的伊蕾希亚·晨歌。",oEN="Bring the Blade of Drak'Mar to Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="吟游诗人的传说是真的吗？你拿到剑了没？",pEN="Were the wandering bard's tales true? Have you brought a blade?",c="这是把好武器，能帮我碾碎对手。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="This is a fine weapon that will help me crush the competition. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[13785]={d="那个死亡骑士弄断了我的剑，真该死！\n\n在晶歌森林南部，俯瞰水晶之痕出口的地方，你会找到永恒烈焰领主。杀了他，从他尸体上取下永燃余烬。\n\n把它带到北风苔原北部冬息湖的中央，用它释放被封在冰中的少女。她是$gor:ora;古老之剑的守护者，会报答解救她的人。\n\n证明你的价值，赢得她长久守护的那把剑，$n。",dEN="Curse that death knight for breaking my sword!\n\nIn southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, <name>.",o="将冬之利刃交给银色比武场的伊蕾希亚·晨歌。",oEN="Eressea Dawnsinger at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring her Winter's Edge.",p="你赢得了那把剑吗？",pEN="Did you win the blade?",c="这把剑正如传说中那般精良。看来我没有必要再修好我那把惯用的剑了。冬之刃要优越得多，我会继续带着它。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="The blade is as fine as the stories say. It would seem there's little reason to complete the repairs on my customary blade. Winter's Edge is far superior and I will continue to carry it. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[13786]={d="在锦标赛上，你可以和你的战友们一起练习技术，但是时刻都不要忘记，我们真正的敌人——天灾军团绝不会坐等灭亡。你不但要和队友切磋，还要在与敌人的战斗中磨砺自己的刀锋。\n\n到位于陨落英雄之谷西南和恐惧之门科雷萨以北的那个地区去。天灾军团正在那里复活死亡的英雄们，并将他们变成我们的敌人。击败那些天灾军团的爪牙，让我们的勇士得到安息，并在那里磨砺你的战斗技艺。",dEN="The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you hone your skills against others, so should you maintain your edge in combat against the enemy.\n\nTravel to the area southwest of the Valley of Fallen Heroes and north of Corp'rethar. There, the Scourge raises dead heroes and turns them against us. Defeat these minions of the Scourge, do honor to our allies, and keep yourself prepared for combat.",o="银色比武场的克希尔·炎枪要你消灭10名被转化的英雄。",oEN="Kethiel Sunlance at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Converted Heroes.",p="你有在对抗天灾军团的战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up.",c="一整天的训练没什么害处。很高兴看见你持续锻炼。",cEN="A good day of training will never hurt anyone. It's good to see you keeping up."}
Q[13787]={d="大混战是锦标赛最重要的比赛。胜利不会轻松，但我相信我们会赢。你必须与坐骑一起练习，直到你们合为一体。\n\n这会帮你为锦标赛中严酷的战斗做好准备。\n\n去凉亭外的马厩，装备你的长枪，骑上备好的银月城陆行鸟，向勇士们发起挑战。他们就在我们帐篷外的部落勇士比武场等着。|n",dEN="The grand melee is the most important of the tournament's competitions. Victory will not be easy, but I am confident that we will win. You must practice with your mount until the two of you work as one.\n\nIt will help prepare you for the rigors of tournament combat.\n\nGo to the stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, mount the stabled Silvermoon hawkstrider, and challenge the valiants. They wait in the Horde Valiants' Ring just outside our tent.",o="将三枚勇士的印记交给银色比武场的安妮拉·索隆。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在银色盟约大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 3 Marks of the Valiant to Aneera Thuron at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了技击大赛的训练吗？",pEN="Have you completed your training for the grand melee?",c="和其他勇士彼此对战训练将能磨利你的爪子，锻炼你的战斗直觉。等到竞赛开始时，你将会做好准备。",cEN="Training against the other valiants will sharpen your claws and hone your battle insticts. When the competition begins, you will be ready."}
Q[13789]={d="这座竞技场坐落在在世界上最危险的地方，$n。为了把这块土地从天灾军团手中夺过来，我们历经苦难，付出了极其沉重的代价。然而敌人仍然在持续不断地向我们发动攻击，仿佛他们有着无穷无尽的后备队。\n\n到冰冠冰川去，干掉你遇到的所有天灾士兵。",dEN="The coliseum is perched in the most dangerous part of the world, <name>. The territory we've taken from the Scourge has been paid for in blood and misery, yet the enemy continues to strike back with a seemingly limitless army. To make matters worse, this undead army is supported and assisted by mortal sympathizers, the Cult of the Damned.\n\nGo forth into Icecrown and slay any cultists you encounter.",o="银色比武场的塞利安·碎日要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭15名诅咒教派成员。你可以在冰冠冰川的任何地方消灭这些诅咒教派的成员。",oEN="Cellian Daybreak at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 members of the Cult of the Damned. You may kill Cult of the Damned members in any part of Icecrown.",p="你有在战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="你是真正的冠军，<name>，无论在场内还是场上。我们都必须警惕天灾军团，你是我们同胞和你自己人民的好榜样。",cEN="You are a true champion, <name>, both inside the ring and on the field. We must all be vigilant against the Scourge and you are a great example to our brethren and your own people."}
Q[13790]={d="作为冠军，你已精通骑乘战斗的技艺，击败了各个级别的挑战者。锦标赛开始后，那些败在你手下的人会加倍努力，渴望向你复仇。$gón:ona;{None}\n继续在冠军比武场与候场的对手切磋技艺会是明智之举。装备你的长枪，去场地南边的马厩，然后骑上任何你能使用的坐骑，迎战那些冠军。\n",dEN="As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, besting challengers of all levels. When the tournament begins, those you have defeated will have redoubled their efforts and will seek to avenge their losses to you.\n\nIt would be wise to continue practicing your skills against the combatants waiting in the Ring of Champions. Equip your lance, go to the stables on the southern side of the grounds. then mount up on any mount you're permitted to use, and face the champions.",o="把 4 枚勇士徽记带给银色锦标赛场地的卢瑞。\n\n如果你弄丢了长枪，可以从马厩附近或银色盟约凉亭里的任何枪架上再取一把。|n",oEN="Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Luuri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Silver Covenant Pavilion.",p="你完成了和其它勇士的练习吗？",pEN="Have you finished training with the other champions?",c="干得好。与其它冠军对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让联盟感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other champions is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make the Alliance proud, <name>."}
Q[13794]={d="在我的提议下，银色北伐军的兄弟和新晋的冠军展开了紧密的合作。北伐军的总冠军——纯洁者耶德瑞克——负责帮助来自各个城市的冠军进行训练，为锦标赛的总决赛做好准备。\n\n去找他做个自我介绍吧，他肯定已经急着要见你，帮助你进行训练，准备与艾泽拉斯世界最伟大的冠军同台竞技。",dEN="I have asked my brothers of the Argent Crusade to work closely with those who rise to the rank of champion. Eadric the Pure, our brotherhood's grand champion, helps oversee training exercises for champions from all cities and helps them make their final preparations for tournament competition.\n\nPlease go and introduce yourself to him. I know he'll be eager to meet you and work with you on your way to competing against Azeroth's greatest champions.",o="与银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="很高兴终于见到你，勇士。大领主要我负责协助各勇士的一同练习与努力，必且强化联赛场地的防御。",cEN="It's good to finally meet you, champion. The highlord has asked me to help coordinate the efforts of all champions to train together and bolster the defenses of the tournament grounds."}
Q[13795]={d="黑锋骑士代表团的领袖要和你谈谈，$c。科罗克·斩亡者是一位令人胆寒的斗士，他肯定有很多话要和你说。\n\n黑锋骑士团在比武场的北部扎了营，就在联盟代表团的大帐西边。",dEN="The leader of the Knights of the Ebon Blade delegation has asked to speak you, <class>. Crok Scourgebane is as fearsome a combatant as they come and I have no doubt he'll have much to ask of you.\n\nThe Knights of the Ebon Blade have made camp on the north side of the tournament grounds, west of the tent housing the Alliance delegations.",o="与银色比武场的科罗克·斩亡者谈一谈。",oEN="Speak with Crok Scourgebane at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="那么你成为冠军了，<name>。我毫不怀疑这会发生。我们骑士是在战火中受训的，不是在木头假人面前。让我们向那些圣骑士和他们的客人展示战斗把我们铸就成了什么。",cEN="So you have become a champion, <name>. I had no doubt that it would happen. We knights have been trained in the heat of battle, not in front of wooden dummies. Let's show the paladins and their guests what battle has made us."}
Q[13809]={d="在你找出诅咒教派的间谍以后，大领主提里奥·弗丁安排了双倍的卫兵。弗丁大人认为诅咒教派不会仅仅因为失去一个黑骑士就善罢甘休。\n\n根据天爪龙斥候的报告，有一支诅咒教派的部队正准备袭击我们，他们的首领是一条名叫冰喉的冰霜巨龙。如果不阻止他们的话，赛场就会受到攻击。斥候们说，冰喉就盘旋在我们的西南方向，铁墙大坝和奥尔杜萨交界的地方。",dEN="Highlord Tirion Fordring has doubled the guard since your exposure of the Cult of the Damned's infiltrator. He doesn't believe that they will stop just because their Black Knight has been defeated.\n\nOur skytalon scouts have reported sighting a frost wyrm named Chillmaw leading a cult raiding party. If we don't intercept them, the tournament will come under attack. The scouts reporting seeing Chillmaw to the southwest, flying over the area between the Ironwall Rampart and Aldur'thar.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要你消灭3名诅咒教派投弹手，并击败冰喉。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament wants you to defeat Chillmaw and 3 Cultist Bombardiers.",p="你击败了诅咒教派的突袭队吗？",pEN="Have you defeated the Cult of the Damned raiding party?",c="<name>，你和你的盟友让锦标赛免遭一场毁灭性的袭击。我们的天爪骑手虽然勇敢，但要维持锦标赛场地的安宁已经够他们忙的了，要抵御教派的空中进攻会很吃力。你得到了银色北伐军的感谢，也得到所有聚集于此参赛之人的感谢。",cEN="<name>, you and your allies have spared the tournament from a devastating attack. Though our skytalon riders are brave, they have their hands full keeping the peace on the tournament grounds and would be hard-pressed to defend the skies against the cult's attack. You have the thanks of the Argent Crusade and all who have gathered here to compete."}
Q[13810]={d="竞技场坐落在世界上最危险的地方，$n。我们从天灾军团手中夺来的领土是用鲜血与苦难换来的，但敌人仍在以看似无穷无尽的军队反击。更糟的是，这支亡灵军队还有凡人的同情者——诅咒神教——的支持与协助。\n\n深入冰冠冰川，消灭你能找到的教徒。",dEN="The coliseum is perched in the most dangerous part of the world, <name>. The territory we've taken from the Scourge has been paid for in blood and misery, yet the enemy continues to strike back with a seemingly limitless army. To make matters worse, this undead army is supported and assisted by mortal sympathizers, the Cult of the Damned.\n\nGo forth into Icecrown and slay any cultists you encounter.",o="银色比武场的塞利安·碎日要你在冰冠冰川地区消灭15名诅咒教派成员。你可以在冰冠冰川的任何地方消灭这些诅咒教派的成员。",oEN="Cellian Daybreak at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 members of the Cult of the Damned. You may kill cultists in any part of Icecrown.",p="你有在战斗中自我磨练吗？",pEN="Have you tested yourself in combat against the Scourge?",c="你是真正的冠军，<name>，无论在场内还是场上。我们都必须警惕天灾军团，你是我们同胞和你自己人民的好榜样。",cEN="You are a true champion, <name>, both inside the ring and on the field. We must all be vigilant against the Scourge and you are a great example to our brethren and your own people."}
Q[13811]={d="作为冠军，你已精通骑乘战斗的技艺，击败了各个级别的挑战者。锦标赛开始后，那些败在你手下的人会加倍努力，渴望向你复仇。$gón:ona;{None}\n继续磨练技艺、多了解你的对手会是明智之举。代表各座城市的冠军都在冠军比武场训练。装备你的长枪，在马厩骑上任何你能使用的坐骑，迎战那些冠军。\n",dEN="As a champion, you have mastered the art of mounted combat, besting challengers of all levels. When the tournament begins, those you have defeated will have redoubled their efforts and will seek to avenge their losses.\n\nIt would be wise to continue honing your own skills and learning from your opponents. Champions representing all cities practice in the Ring of Champions. Equip your lance, mount up on any mount you're entitled to use at the stables, and face the champions.",o="将四枚冠军的印记交给银色比武场的鲁莉。\n\n如果你丢失了长枪，可以在夺日者大帐或者兽栏附近的长枪架上再拿一根。",oEN="Bring 4 Marks of the Champion to Luuri at the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\nIf you lose your lance, you can get another from any of the Lance Racks near the stables or in the Sunreaver Pavilion.",p="你完成了和其它勇士的练习吗？",pEN="Have you finished training with the other champions?",c="干得好。与其它勇士对战训练，是为锦标赛做准备的最佳方式之一。我知道你会让部落感到骄傲的，<name>。",cEN="Well done. Training against the other valiants is one of the best ways to prepare yourself for tournament competition. I know you'll make the Horde proud, <name>."}
Q[13816]={d="听着，$g小伙子:小姑娘，艾泽拉斯的命运危在旦夕。\n\n我们唯一的机会是到天文台去，找到奥尔加隆，阻止他向他的泰坦主人发送信息。\n\n赶快找到天文台。如果你发现了任何有价值的信息，就立即回来向我报告。奥尔加隆抵达之前，我们还有一些时间可以准备。",dEN="Listen, <lad/lass>! Azeroth's fate is at stake here.\n\nOur only chance is to get to the Celestial Planetarium in time to find this Algalon and stop him from beaming back any messages to his Titan masters.\n\nLocate the Celestial Planetarium and come back with any information you get. We might still have some time to prepare for Algalon's arrival.",o="奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦要你找到天文台的入口。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to locate the entrance to the Celestial Planetarium.",c="锁住了？意料之中！\n\n我会通知布莱恩……或许他能从大数据库里找出点什么。",cEN="It's locked? Figures!\n\nI'll let Brann know... maybe he can uncover something in the Archivum."}
Q[13817]={d="这张白金圆盘对称得令人惊讶，没有任何划痕或瑕疵。边缘刻着粗犷的符文，拼出\"ARCHIVUM\"这个词。\n\n奥杜尔里面一定有某种装置能读取这张圆盘。",dEN="This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word \"ARCHIVUM.\"\n\nThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc.",o="将文件馆数据圆盘带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Archivum Data Disc to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="当控制台的圆形插座打开时，能量在控制台中呼啸流窜。",pEN="The console whirrs with energy as the round receptacle opens.",c="白金圆盘完美无缺地勘合进控制台中。它开始旋转而白色的光束扫过圆盘。",cEN="The platinum disc fits perfectly inside the console. It begins to spin as its contents are scanned by white beams of light."}
Q[13818]={d="你成功了，$n。把这些徽记拿到文件馆的控制台那里去，看看你能否进入天文台。\n\n你最好快一点，$g伙计:小丫头，时间紧迫。",dEN="You really did it, <name>. Take the sigils to the Archivum Console and see if you can gain access to the Celestial Planetarium.\n\nYou best hurry, <lad/lass>. Time is of the essence.",o="将守护者的徽记带到奥杜尔的文件馆控制台前。",oEN="Bring the Sigils of the Watchers to the Archivum Console in Ulduar.",p="控制台的亮光迅速地扫过玻璃的表面，似乎在等待某些输入。",pEN="The console's bright lights scan the glass surface repeatedly, as if awaiting some form of input.",c="准备确认。\n\n准许进入星穹浑天仪。请取出你的钥匙。",cEN="Stand by for verification.\n\nAccess to the Celestial Planetarium granted. Please retrieve your key."}
Q[13819]={d="我们必须抓紧时间，$n。必须回到达拉然，在那里把恢复代码发射出去。\n\n带着它去找罗宁吧，我会在那里等你。",dEN="We'd best hurry now, <name>. We're going to have to transmit the reply-code from Dalaran.\n\nTake it to Rhonin, I will meet you there.",o="将恢复代码阿尔法交给达拉然的罗宁。",oEN="Take the Reply-Code Alpha to Rhonin in Dalaran.",c="你在这儿。希望这样行得通吧。我们全都靠它了。",cEN="You're here. Let us hope this works. For all our sakes."}
Q[13821]={d="我想弗蕾亚的徽记可能是最难得到的一块。\n\n根据文件馆的数据，徽记与弗蕾亚身边的三位古树仆从密切关联，它们是明叶长老、铁枝长老和石树长老。一旦它们之中有任何一位受到伤害，徽记的完整性就不能保障了。\n\n然而，如果你们对这三位长老手下留情，弗蕾亚的力量就会变得更加强大。\n\n我又能说什么呢，$n，我们现在真是进退维谷。",dEN="Freya's Sigil is going to be one of the tougher ones, I reckon.\n\nAccording to the Archivum, the essence of the Sigil is tied to her three elder servants, Brightleaf, Ironbranch and Stonebark. Should any of the elders be harmed, the Sigil's integrity will be compromised.\n\nSparing the elders, however, means that Freya will be more powerful when you face her.\n\nWhat can I say, <name>. We're stuck between a rock and hard place.",o="将弗蕾亚的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得弗蕾亚的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Freya's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Freya's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="弗蕾亚的符记，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="Freya's sigil, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="干得漂亮，<name>。我们离拯救艾泽拉斯又近了一步！",cEN="Excellent job, <name>. We're one step closer to saving Azeroth!"}
Q[13822]={d="要拿到霍迪尔的徽记可不容易。你不但要击败霍迪尔，而且必须抢在他打碎装着徽记的箱子之前击败他！\n\n如果你想了解更多信息的话，可以去查查文件馆的控制台。那里面的知识比世界上所有的图书馆加在一起还要多！",dEN="Hodir's Sigil won't be easy to obtain. Not only are ye going to have to defeat Hodir himself, but yer going to have to do it before he destroys the chest that contains it!\n\nCheck the Archivum console if you need more information. That thing contains more knowledge than all of the world's libraries put together!",o="将霍迪尔的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得霍迪尔的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Hodir's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Hodir's Sigil, consult the Archivum Console.",p="你拿到符记了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did ye obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="你办到了！我不知道你怎么做到的，但你居然成功了！",cEN="Ye did it! I don't know how, but ye did!"}
Q[13823]={d="托里姆已经失去了自我，$n。一股黑暗的力量正在影响着他。\n\n某个邪恶的家伙假扮成他死去的妻子西芙，蒙蔽了他的心智。\n\n你要阻止那个冒牌货控制托里姆。如果托里姆被这股力量征服，我们就永远都不能找到他的徽记了！\n\n你要让他清醒过来，越快越好！\n\n和以往一样，文件馆的控制台会给你提供所有必要的消息……包括那些你不喜欢听到的消息。",dEN="Thorim's not himself, <name>. He's come under a dark influence.\n\nAn evil presence under the guise of an illusion pretends to be his lost wife, Sif.\n\nYe can't let him be overcome by this impostor's spell. If he does, the location of his sigil might forever be lost!\n\nYer going to have to beat some sense into him and yer going to have to do it quick.\n\nAs always, the Archivum Console will give ye all the gory details... even the ones ye don't like.",o="将托里姆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得托里姆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Archivum in Ulduar wants you to obtain Thorim's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Thorim's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="怎么样，<name>？你拿到了吗？",pEN="Well, <name>? Do ye have it?",c="你总是让我惊叹，<name>。\n\n等这一切结束后，你和我一定要一起喝一杯，听到了吗？",cEN="Ye never cease to impress, <name>.\n\nYe and me are having a pint together after all this is done, ye hear me?"}
Q[13824]={d="米米尔隆是个聪明的家伙，他给自己的地盘装上了一套自毁设备。\n\n很不幸，如果你想要拿到徽记，就必须争分夺秒。如果你需要了解什么详细的数据，可以去文件馆控制台那里查询。",dEN="Mimiron's a clever one. His entire abode is rigged with some sort of self-destruction mechanism.\n\nUnfortunately yer gonna have to race against it if ye want to get his sigil. Check the Archivum Console for more details if ye need them.",o="将米米尔隆的徽记交给奥杜尔文件馆中的勘探员罗尔伦。\n\n你可以向文件馆控制台查询如何获得米米尔隆的徽记。",oEN="Prospector Loren at the Ulduar Archivum wants you to obtain Mimiron's Sigil.\n\nFor more information on obtaining Mimiron's Sigil consult the Archivum Console.",p="你拿到符记了吗，<name>？",pEN="Were you able to obtain the sigil, <name>?",c="我不得不佩服你，<name>。我们的胜算也许不算大，但有你在帮忙，我感觉好多了。",cEN="I've got to hand it to you, <name>. Our odds might not be the best, but I feel a lot better with you lending a hand."}
Q[13828]={d="锦标赛比赛的核心是骑乘近战。拿起这支长枪，骑上凉亭外备好的奎尔多雷战马。\n\n上马后，去找杰兰·洛克伍德。他在锦标赛场地北缘、参赛者比武场以东的训练区。杰兰会教你如何运用防御，让你在近距离攻击近战目标时保持安全。$gprotegido:protegida;",dEN="The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和耶兰·洛克伍德谈一谈，然后对一个近战目标使用5次刺击。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向奥术师泰利斯复命。",oEN="Equip your lance, then mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Jeran Lockwood and use Thrust 5 times on a Melee Target, then return to Arcanist Taelis at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你和耶兰·洛克伍德谈过了吗？练习了近距骑乘战斗？",pEN="Did you speak to Jeran Lockwood and practice close range mounted melee?",c="在你和那些假人训练时，牢记大师的教导。",cEN="Keep the words of the master in mind as you practice with the training dummies."}
Q[13829]={d="锦标赛比赛的核心是骑乘近战。拿起这支长枪，骑上凉亭外备好的血精灵陆行鸟。\n\n上马后，去找杰兰·洛克伍德。他在锦标赛场地北缘、参赛者比武场以东的训练区。杰兰会教你如何运用防御，让你在近距离攻击近战目标时保持安全。$gprotegido:protegida;",dEN="The heart of tournament competition is mounted melee combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Jeran Lockwood. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Jeran will instruct you on how to use your defenses to keep you safe while attacking a melee target at close range.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和耶兰·洛克伍德谈一谈，然后对一个近战目标使用5次刺击。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向魔导师埃迪恩·炎谷复命。",oEN="Equip your lance, then mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider outside the pavilion. Speak to Jeran Lockwood and use Thrust 5 times on a Melee Target, then return to Magister Edien Sunhollow at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你学会如何利用近战标靶训练了吗？",pEN="Did you speak to Jeran Lockwood and practice close range mounted melee?",c="在你和那些假人训练时，牢记大师的教导。",cEN="Keep the words of the master in mind as you practice with the training dummies."}
Q[13830]={d="任何有几分本事的北裂境垂钓者都知道侏儒吸盘鱼。它不能吃，但有时对炼金术士有用。$gr:ra;{None}\n不过，在索拉查盆地河流之心的吸盘鱼群中，藏着一种隐秘的鱼。那就是幻影幽灵鱼。离开水面后，它会变得越来越透明，直到完全消失。有人推测它们会回到索拉查，另一些人则更……迷信。\n\n我要你钓到这种鱼，并不惜一切代价弄清它的秘密！\n",dEN="Any Northrend angler worth <his/her> salt knows about the pygmy suckerfish. It's not edible, but sometimes useful to alchemists.\n\nThere is, however, a stealthy fish that hides among the suckerfish in the River's Heart of Sholazar Basin. The phantom ghostfish. When out of water, they become increasingly translucent until they fade away completely. Some hypothesize they return to Sholazar, and others are more... superstitious.\n\nI want you to catch this fish and discover its secret by any means!",o="达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯希望你去揭开幽灵鱼的秘密。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to discover the mystery of the Phantom Ghostfish.",p="你发现了幽灵鱼的秘密了吗？\n\n<玛西娅目不转睛地盯着你。>",pEN="Is the ghostfish haunting your best efforts?\n\n<Marcia looks particularly proud of herself for her pun.>",c="所以吃了它会让你隐形……这条聪明的鱼进化出了多么奇怪的防御手段。\n\n我想把这件事好好消化一下。我不是在玩双关，<name>。真的。你何不明天再来找我？",cEN="So eating it makes you invisible... what a strange defense this clever fish has developed.\n\nI'd like to digest this for a bit. Pun not intended, <name>. Really. Why don't you come see me tomorrow?"}
Q[13832]={d="我真不敢相信，有那么多人去达拉然下水道钓鱼，只为几只大老鼠或是变异鱼。难道他们不知道，有许多伤心欲绝的傻子、走投无路的窃贼和心不在焉的醉汉，把数不清的无价之宝扔到了下水道里吗？\n\n在那里钓鱼的秘诀是把鱼钩沉到水底去，如果钓到了什么东西，就缓缓地把线收上来。去试试吧，$n，我会用我收藏的宝贝和你钓上来的东西交换的。",dEN="Hard to believe that most people fish in the Dalaran Sewers for giant rats and mutated fish. Especially when those waters are filled with priceless jewelry - discarded by broken hearted fools, thieves, and careless drunks.\n\nThe trick is to let your hook drag the bottom and don't pull up too hard when you get something. Try it out, <name>. I'd be willing to trade whatever you find for a few trinkets of my own.",o="将一块被腐蚀的珠宝交给达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her a piece of Corroded Jewelry.",p="运气如何？",pEN="Any luck?",c="很好，这看起来挺有价值的。但是在清理完毕和估价前很难知道值多少，不过我还是愿意跟你交易。",cEN="Well now, that looks like it could be valuable. Difficult to know until it's cleaned up and appraised, but I'm still willing to make the trade if you are."}
Q[13833]={d="血牙鱼是一种好动的小鱼，用于治疗感染伤口的配方。如果你愿意，我们能用上几条。$gdispuesto:dispuesta;{None}\n正如名字所示，它们嗜血。据我所知，钓这些小恶魔的唯一办法就是造一个血池，在里面垂钓。\n\n让自己沾满鲜血——在北风苔原随便宰一头野兽——然后跳进水里。血会溶入水中，造出完美的垂钓地点。\n",dEN="The bloodtooth is a feisty little fish used in a recipe to cure infected wounds. We could use some of them, if you're up to it.\n\nAs the name suggests, they've a hunger for blood. The only way I know how to catch the little devils is by creating a blood pool and fishing in it.\n\nGet yourself covered in blood - just slaughter a beast in the Borean Tundra - and then jump in the water. It'll wash right off and create the perfect fishing spot.",o="达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯希望你为她带去5条血齿狂鱼。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her 5 Bloodtooth Frenzies.",p="钓到血齿狂鱼了吗？别忘了我教你的制造血池的办法。",pEN="Any luck with the bloodtooth? Don't forget what I told you about making blood pools.",c="你很勇敢，<name>。希望你在找钓点时没丢掉什么肢体。如果你还对钓鱼上瘾，明天再来，我们接着聊。",cEN="You are a brave one, <name>. I hope you didn't lose any extremities making your fishing spot. If you've still got the fishing bug, come back tomorrow and we'll talk some more."}
Q[13834]={d="最好的钓鱼地点总是最危险的。冬拥湖里有无数的战利品等待着大胆的垂钓者。\n\n事实上，只有在冬拥湖才能钓到传说中最危险也最美味的恐怖鱼。给我带些这种鱼来，然后我们再好好聊聊。",dEN="The best fishing is often the most dangerous. Wintergrasp boasts a bountiful catch for the brazen.\n\nIn fact, it's the only place to catch the fabled Terrorfish - a fish both lethal and delicious. Bring me some, and we'll have something to discuss.",o="将10条恐怖鱼交给达拉然城中的玛西娅·切斯。",oEN="Marcia Chase in Dalaran City wants you to bring her 10 Terrorfish.",p="在你追踪恐怖鱼时要小心戒备。",pEN="Be on your guard when you're after the Terrorfish.",c="喔喔喔！你抓到恐怖鱼了。唉，这可让我想起过去……\n\n<玛西娅开始叨絮大串的冒险与钓鱼故事，似乎只要你愿意听，她就能没完没了地讲下去。>",cEN="My, my, my! You've caught yourself some Terrorfish. Why, that reminds me of the time...\n\n<Marcia regales you with stories of adventure and fishing for as long as you're willing to listen.>"}
Q[13835]={d="想要在骑乘战斗中获得胜利，你就必须先学会如何突破对手的防御。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上奎尔多雷战马吧。\n\n骑上战马以后，去找瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。瓦利斯会向你传授使用远程武器击破对手盾牌的基础技巧，这样就可以更容易地击败你的目标。",dEN="You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈，然后对两个脆弱的远程目标使用碎盾技能。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向斥候沙琳蒂亚复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Valis Windchaser and use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, then return to Scout Shalyndria at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你练习使用破盾了吗？",pEN="Have you practiced using your shield-breaker?",c="记住瓦利斯的教训，<name>。这将决定你骑乘战斗的胜负。",cEN="Commit Valis's lesson to memory, <name>. It will mean the difference between winning and losing your mounted combat matches."}
Q[13836]={d="我得到消息，在达拉然监狱发生了一桩非常不幸的意外。一名卫兵的胳膊被一个邪恶的囚犯砍断，又被扔进了水里。\n\n我们的急救医生说，如果能找回那条胳膊，他们就能为那名卫兵接好断肢。\n\n你在那座监狱外面的水域去垂钓一下。我用我最好的鱼竿打赌，只要你用的时间足够长，就一定能找到那条胳膊。然后你把它带回达拉然来，交给善良的欧莉萨拉。她知道该怎么做。",dEN="I've received word of an unfortunate accident at the Dalaran prison; a guard had his arm severed and thrown into the water by a particularly vicious inmate.\n\nOur first aid clinic promises they can reattach the arm if we bring it back.\n\nYou fish long enough in the water outside the prison, and I'd bet my favorite fishing pole that arm will surface. Find that arm, and bring it to Olisarra the Kind here in Dalaran. She'll know what to do.",o="将断臂交给达拉然城中的善良的欧莉萨拉。",oEN="Olisarra the Kind in Dalaran City wants you to return the Severed Arm to her.",p="你好啊，你有什么东西要带给我吗？",pEN="Hi there. Do you have something for me?",c="哦，你好，<name>。玛西娅说你会带着那个可怜人缺失的手臂过来。\n\n她还给了我这个袋子，作为给你的奖励。它臭得要命，如果你不介意，我急着完成这笔交易。",cEN="Oh, hello there <name>. Marcia said you'd be coming by with that poor man's missing arm.\n\nShe also gave me this bag to give you as a reward. It smells horrible, and I'm anxious to make the trade if you don't mind."}
Q[13837]={d="在骑乘战斗中，冲锋是最强大的攻击方式。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上奎尔多雷战马吧。\n\n骑上战马之后，去和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。卢格安会告诉你如何使用这项强大的技能，还会教你一些其它的基本战术。",dEN="Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Quel'dorei steed just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的奎尔多雷战马。和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈，然后向两个脆弱的冲锋目标发动冲锋。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向阿瓦雷斯·迅击复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Quel'dorei Steed outside the pavilion. Speak to Rugan Steelbelly and Charge 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, then return to Avareth Swiftstrike at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你精通于冲锋的使用了吗？",pEN="Have you mastered the use of the charge?",c="有了阿瓦雷斯这样的老师，你很快就会成为骑乘战斗的专家。",cEN="With a teacher like Rugan, you'll be an expert at mounted combat in no time."}
Q[13838]={d="想要在骑乘战斗中获得胜利，你就必须先学会如何突破对手的防御。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上夺日者陆行鸟吧。\n\n骑上陆行鸟以后，去找瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。瓦利斯会向你传授使用远程武器击破对手盾牌的基础技巧，这样就可以更容易地击败你的目标。",dEN="You'll need to learn how to break through an opponent's defenses to succeed in mounted combat. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, seek out Valis Windchaser. He'll be on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Valis will teach you the basics of using a ranged shield breaker attack to make a ranged target vulnerable.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和瓦利斯·逐风者谈一谈，然后对两个脆弱的远程目标使用碎盾技能。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向加拉希亚·晨光复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider. Speak to Valis Windchaser and use Shield-Breaker on 2 vulnerable Ranged Targets, then return to Galathia Brightdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你完成了破盾的训练吗？",pEN="Have you practiced using your shield-breaker?",c="记住瓦利斯的教训，<name>。这将决定你骑乘战斗的胜负。",cEN="Commit Valis's lesson to memory, <name>. It will mean the difference between winning and losing your mounted combat matches."}
Q[13839]={d="在骑乘战斗中，冲锋是最强大的攻击方式。拿上这杆长枪，到大帐外面的兽栏中去，骑上夺日者陆行鸟吧。\n\n骑上陆行鸟之后，去和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈。他就在比武场的北部，候选者赛场东面的训练场地里。卢格安会告诉你如何使用这项强大的技能，还会教你一些其它的基本战术。",dEN="Your strongest attack in mounted combat is undoubtedly the charge. Take this lance and mount the stabled Sunreaver hawkstrider just outside the pavilion.\n\nOnce you're mounted, speak with Rugan Steelbelly. He's on the northern edge of the tournament grounds at the training area east of the Aspirants' Ring. Rugan will tell you how to use this powerful ability and teach you some basic strategies.",o="装备上你的长枪，到大帐外面骑上兽栏中的夺日者陆行鸟。和卢格安·钢胃谈一谈，然后向两个脆弱的冲锋目标发动冲锋。完成训练后回到银色比武场，向阿玛里尔·火盟复命。",oEN="Equip your lance and mount the Stabled Sunreaver Hawkstrider outside the pavilion. Speak to Rugan Steelbelly and Charge 2 vulnerable Charge Targets, then return to Amariel Sunsworn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",c="通过经验与练习，你可以让你的冲锋非常致命。",cEN="With experience and practice, you will become deadly with the charge."}
Q[13845]={d="这只装着毒药的小瓶子看上去很危险。也许达拉然城中的某人会对它感兴趣。",dEN="This vial of poison looks particularly dangerous. Perhaps someone in Dalaran might be interested in it.",o="将密封的毒药瓶交给达拉然下水道的炼金师辛奈斯拉。",oEN="Bring the Seal Vial of Poison to Alchemist Cinesra in the Dalaran Sewers.",p="那是我想的那东西吗，<class>？",pEN="Is that what I think it is, <class>?",c="把这东西带过来的你真是勇敢。只要这东西摔破并碰到你的皮肤，你就会在痛苦中死去。\n\n让我买下它……我能够让毒药发挥意料之外的效果。",cEN="You are brave to have carried this. If even one drop were to touch your skin, you'd have died an agonizing death.\n\nAllow me to pay you for it... I can always use venom of exceptional potency."}
Q[13846]={d="最优秀的冠军们每天都来礼拜堂，聆听银色神官的演讲。\n\n你应该看看她给予了这些人多大的鼓舞，$n。他们不仅坚定了为银色北伐军作战的信心，还向我的捐赠篮中放入了大把的金币。\n\n你要不要也捐赠一点？",dEN="The bestest of the champions come to the chapel to hear the argent confessor speak every day.\n\nYou should see how much she inspires them, <name>. Not only do they fight for the Argent Crusade, but they put a lot of money into the collection basket when I take it around.\n\nMaybe you'd like to contribute too?",o="与侍从亚迪再次交谈，为银色北伐军的事业捐献10枚金币。",oEN="Speak with Squire Artie to contribute 10 gold to the Argent Crusade's cause.",p="你想要捐款吗？",pEN="Do you want to contribute?",c="谢谢你。北伐军会好好运用这笔钱的！",cEN="Thank you. I just know the crusade will put it to good use!"}
Q[13847]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的约瑟夫·霍雷上尉要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Captain Joseph Holley at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明了一件众所皆知的事——我们的战士绝不仅只是节庆游行的装饰品而已。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders what they already knew -- that our warriors are more than just parade ground decorations."}
Q[13850]={d="你想骑毒皮暴掠龙吗？恐怕我有些坏消息要告诉你。\n\n毒皮暴掠龙全身都是毒，从血液到唾沫，连皮肤表面都有毒素。你要是爬上去，不出几个小时就会中毒而死。\n\n在我卖给你毒皮龙之前，你必须先获得抵抗毒素的能力，这要花很长的时间，非常长……你需要去在战斗中沐浴毒血，要洗许多次。如果你真的对此感兴趣，那么你要知道，毒皮暴掠龙经常会出现在沼泽地的北部本地，你一直向西北方走，就能找到那里了。",dEN="You want to ride a Venomhide? Then I've got bad news for you.\n\nThe Venomhide Ravasaurs, they're all poison: Poison blood, poison spit, poison skin. You climb on one, you fall off dead in a few hours.\n\nYou'd have to build up a resistance to their toxins before I sold you one, and that takes a long, LONG time... you'd need to be splashed with poisonous blood while fighting one numerous times. If you're really interested, the venomhides prefer the northern area of of the Marshlands, northwest of here.",o="安戈洛环形山的莫维克说，如果你能被毒皮暴掠龙的血染上20次毒，就可以安全地骑它了。攻击毒皮魔暴龙，有一定几率会中毒。",oEN="Mor'vek in Un'goro Crater claims that if you were poisoned by Venomhide Ravasaur blood 20 times, you could ride one without dying. Attack Venomhide Ravasaurs for a chance to be poisoned.",p="还没免疫？放弃吧。那太累了！",pEN="Still not immune, eh? Give up. It takes too long!",c="你做到了？你真的做到了？！\n\n喔呵！你跟我太太一样固执。",cEN="You did it? You actually did it?!\n\nHo ho! Stubborn as my wife, you are."}
Q[13851]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的克拉拉·沸酒要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Clara Tumblebrew at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明和我们是值得的盟军。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are worthy allies."}
Q[13852]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的弗林克·扳钳要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Flickin Gearspanner at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们是他们的战友。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the that we are a match for the Argent Crusade's own."}
Q[13854]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的兰妮要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Ranii at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明了一件众所皆知的事——我们的战士绝不仅只是节庆游行的装饰品而已。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders what they already knew -- that our warriors are more than just parade ground decorations."}
Q[13855]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的艾莱·觅星要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Airae Starseeker at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们在对抗巫妖王的战斗中是足以依赖的。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that they can rely on us in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13856]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的茉拉·狼女要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Morah Worgsister at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, and 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明了一件众所皆知的事——我们是艾泽拉斯最好的战士。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders what they already knew -- that our warriors are the best in Azeroth."}
Q[13857]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的加尔祖要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Gahju at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们在面对巫妖王的爪牙时毫无畏惧。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are fearless in the face of the Lich King's minions."}
Q[13858]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的安卡·爪蹄要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Anka Clawhoof at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们在对抗巫妖王的战斗中是坚定的盟军。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are steadfast allies in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13859]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的安妮拉·索隆要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Aneera Thuron at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="你在战场上的英勇已经向北伐军证明我们已准备好面对任何敌人。",cEN="Your bravery on the field has shown the crusaders that we are ready to face any enemy."}
Q[13860]={d="就在我们为锦标赛做准备的同时，银色北伐军的部队正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的爪牙。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as we ready for the tournament, Argent Crusade forces prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's minions.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的马夫德雷奇要求你消灭15名白骨卫士步兵、10名白骨卫士斥候和3名白骨卫士军官。",oEN="Handler Dretch at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 15 Boneguard Footmen, 10 Boneguard Scouts, 3 Boneguard Lieutenants.",p="你和白骨之廷的北伐军并肩作战了吗？",pEN="Have served alongside the crusaders in the Court of Bones?",c="银色北伐军看到了我们的决心并且知道我们的战士将会看着这一切直到结束。",cEN="The Argent Crusade has seen our resolve and they know that our warriors will see this through to the end."}
Q[13861]={d="就在我们中的一些人为锦标赛忙碌的同时，我们的弟兄正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的战马，然后消灭巫妖王的指挥官。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as some of us labor on the tournament, our brothers prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled campaign charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's commanders.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要求你消灭3名白骨卫士指挥官。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 3 Boneguard Commanders.",p="你对抗白骨之廷的敌人了吗？",pEN="Have you fought against the enemy in the Court of Bones?",c="银色北伐军很高兴能有像你这样的<class>与我们并肩对抗巫妖王。",cEN="The Argent Crusade is heartened to have <class>s like you fighting alongside us in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13862]={d="就在我们中的一些人为锦标赛忙碌的同时，我们的弟兄正在为进攻敌人的要塞——冰冠堡垒——铺平道路。\n\n在冰冠冰川西南部的白骨庭院，几位勇敢的北伐军战士在科雷萨南侧建立了前哨营地。装备你的长枪，骑上营地中备好的银色战马，然后消灭巫妖王的指挥官。\n\n别害怕那些骨卫仆从的乌合之众，$n，你能用马蹄轻易地把他们踩在脚下。",dEN="Even as some of us labor on the tournament, our brothers prepare the way for an assault on the enemy's stronghold of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the Court of Bones in southwestern Icecrown, a few brave crusaders have set up a forward camp on the southern side of Corp'rethar. Equip your lance and mount the stabled argent charger at the camp, then destroy the Lich King's commanders.\n\nDo not fear the masses of boneguard footmen, <name>, for they can easily be trampled under your horse's hooves.",o="银色比武场的纯洁者耶德瑞克要求你消灭3名白骨卫士指挥官。",oEN="Eadric the Pure at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 3 Boneguard Commanders.",p="你对抗白骨之廷的敌人了吗？",pEN="Have you fought against the enemy in the Court of Bones?",c="银色北伐军很高兴能有像你这样的<class>与我们并肩对抗巫妖王。",cEN="The Argent Crusade is heartened to have <class>s like you fighting alongside us in the battle against the Lich King."}
Q[13887]={d="现在你对毒皮暴掠龙的毒素已经有了免疫力，可以安全地对付这种猛兽和它们的蛋了。毒皮暴掠龙极为凶猛。如果要驯化它们，就必须从它们刚出生时开始。\n\n如果你想要骑上一头毒皮暴掠龙，你就需要先找到一颗尚未孵化的毒皮暴掠龙蛋。在沼泽地各处分布着一些暴掠龙巢。你应该在那些巢里寻找颜色较浅的龙蛋。那些才是能孵化出毒皮暴掠龙的蛋。\n\n如果你能带给我几颗那种蛋。我会让你自己保留一颗，并指导你用它孵化出毒皮暴掠龙崽。",dEN="Now that you've built up an immunity to venomhide toxin, you can safely handle the animals and their eggs. Venomhides are vicious and must be trained from the moment they hatch.\n\nIf you want to ride one, you'll need an unhatched egg. Scattered throughout the Marshlands are a number of ravasaur nests. Look for the eggs with lighter colored shells -- those are the ones that will hatch venomhides.\n\nIf you bring me several of the eggs, I'll allow you to keep one and raise its hatchling, with my guidance.",o="把4枚毒皮暴掠龙蛋带给位于沼泽地东南的莫维克。",oEN="Bring 4 Venomhide Ravasaur Eggs to Mor'vek in the southeast part of the Marshlands.",p="你找到那些蛋了吗？",pEN="Did you find those eggs?",c="做得好。老实说我有点讶异，你竟然能找到这么多颗蛋，因为每窝蛋的数量并不多。\n\n我会让你抚养一只刚孵出来的毒皮暴掠龙。它可不会客气的对你提出它的需求。",cEN="Good work. Honestly, I'm amazed you were able to find this many. With each clutch, they seem fewer in number.\n\nI'll let you raise one of the freshly-hatched venomhides. It shouldn't be shy about letting you know what it needs."}
Q[13889]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案都很粗糙，不过你还是能依稀从里面看出双帆龙，剑龙和翼手龙的形象。这只龙崽画完之后，又向你抬起了头，还露出了牙齿，做了一个咬的动作。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽一定是想要吃这些恐龙的肉了。你要在安戈洛环形山找到并猎杀这些双帆龙、剑龙和翼手龙，取得恐龙肉，喂饱你饥饿的龙崽。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe drawings are rough, but you can make out the shapes of diemetradons, stegodons, and pterrordaxes. As the raptor finishes the sketch, it looks up at you, bares its teeth, and makes a biting motion.\n\nYour venomhide hatchling must be craving fresh meat from these animals. Find and kill any type of diematradon, stegodon, or pterrordax in Un'Goro Crater and feed its meat to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它15片鲜嫩的恐龙肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 15 pieces of Fresh Dinosaur Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔嘴唇并将头偏向一边。",pEN="The hatchling cocks its head and looks at you.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽似乎很满足你提供的大餐，但不知道何时它又会饿。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling seems satisfied with the giant meal you've provided, but there's no way of telling when it will be hungry again."}
Q[13903]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案所表现的似乎是一些大型昆虫，一些格里什异种蝎。龙崽画完以后，就用前臂指指图画，凭空猛咬了一口，又舔舔嘴唇。\n\n它一定是想让你去位于安戈洛环形山南部中心处的巨痕谷，在那里收集一些异种蝎肉。得到异种蝎肉之后，就用它来喂养你饥饿的龙崽吧。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe hatchling's drawings seem to resemble various types of large insects, perhaps the gorishi silithids. The hatchling finishes his picture, then gestures at it with one short arm, snaps its jaws, and licks its lips.\n\nIt must want you to go to the Slithering Scar, in center of the southern part of Un'Goro Crater, and gather silithid meat. When you have the meat, feed it to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它10块异种蝎肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 10 Silithid Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽歪着头看着你。",pEN="The hatchling cocks its head and looks at you.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽对着你露齿微笑并开始休憩打盹。",cEN="Your venomhide hatchling flashes you a toothy smile and then settles in for a nap."}
Q[13904]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙崽的肚皮发出“咕咕”的响声。它挥舞胳膊，引起了你的注意。然后它在土地上画出一些异种蝎，又在蝎子下面画了一些小的椭圆形。\n\n那一定是异种蝎的卵。你可以到位于塔纳利斯西部，靠近安戈洛环形山边界的腐化之巢去。那里可是一个收集异种蝎卵的好地方。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling's stomach growls as it gestures to get your attention. It begins scratching pictures of silithids into the dirt, adding small ovals underneath them. It looks at you hopefully and gestures at the circles.\n\nThey can only mean silithid eggs. The Noxious Lair, in western Tanaris and near the border with Un'Goro Crater, would probably be a great place to find the eggs your little hatchling wants.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它12枚异种蝎卵。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 12 Silithid Eggs.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽看着你。",pEN="The hatchling looks at you.",c="在吞完异种虫蛋大餐后，你的暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔它的嘴唇。有一瞬间，你觉得它似乎对已经结束的用餐时间感到失望。",cEN="Your hatchling licks its lips after devouring the meal of silithid eggs. For a moment, you think it seems disappointed that feeding time has come to an end."}
Q[13905]={d="这只幼崽一直在看着你，仿佛正在考虑你是否能明白它的意思。它在土地上用爪子画出两根羽毛的图案，然后又指了指绑在它臂肘和膝盖上的东西。\n\n它看上去并不饿，那么它要羽毛干什么？\n\n它一定是想用羽毛做装饰，就像你在其它暴掠龙身上见到过的那样。炎鹏身上的羽毛是所有羽毛之中最大的。这种猛禽生活在塔纳利斯西部，灌木谷的东北方。它们总喜欢聚集在巨大野兽的尸骨周围。",dEN="The hatchling looks at you for a moment, almost as if wondering whether you'll understand. It scrawls a picture of a pair of feathers in the dirt, then points with one claw to the bindings at its elbows and knees.\n\nIt doesn't seem hungry, but what could the feathers be for?\n\nIt must want them for adornments like the ones you've seen on other raptors. The largest feathers come from the searing rocs that congregate around the bones of large creatures in western Tanaris, northeast of Thistleshrub Valley.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你给它弄来5根炎鹏的羽毛。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to get 5 pieces of Searing Roc Plumage.",p="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽期待地看着你。",pEN="Your venomhide hatchling looks at you with anticipation.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽收下这些羽毛，开始打量着它们，并且把羽毛装饰在它的臂环上。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling accepts the feathers and begins looking them over, holding several up to its armbands."}
Q[13906]={d="在你的悉心照料和喂养下，你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽长大得很快。它的乳齿很快就会被成年暴掠龙的牙齿取代了。如果你注意保留你的龙崽在成长过程中脱落的牙齿，那么你就能明确地判断它在何时成长到了可以被训练成坐骑的程度。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙会让你知道它需要什么。所以，你要密切注意它的一举一动。等到它的全部乳齿都已脱落的时候，就带着它和制作龙鞍的材料回来见我。我会帮你完成其馀的事情。",dEN="With your expert feeding and care, your venomhide hatchling will grow quickly. As they grow, their hatchling teeth will be replaced by adult teeth. If you keep the teeth shed by your hatchling as it grows, you'll have an easy way to tell when it's mature enough to be trained as a mount.\n\nYour venomhide will let you know what it needs, so pay close attention. When it has shed all of its baby teeth, return to me with your venomhide and the materials for your saddle and I'll do the rest.",o="将20枚毒皮暴掠幼龙牙齿、你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽，还有20块符文布、20块硬甲皮和80金币交给位于安戈洛环形山沼泽地东南的莫维克。",oEN="Return 20 Venomhide Baby Teeth, the Venomhide Hatchling, 20 Runecloth, 20 Rugged Leather, and 80 gold to Mor'vek in the southeastern part of the Marshlands in Un'Goro Crater.",p="你有好好照顾那只迅猛龙吗？",pEN="Have you been taking good care of that raptor?",c="看来你们一同成长，也没有害死对方。\n\n那么，事情都办妥了。我已经帮你把毒皮暴掠龙给训练好，它已经学会顺从你的哨音了。\n\n很少人能像你这么有毅力，愿意亲手饲养与照料一头毒皮暴掠龙，但你的努力非常值得。",cEN="It looks like both of you have managed to do some growing without killing one another.\n\nThere, everything's finished. I've trained your venomhide ravasaur to respond when you blow this whistle.\n\nFew have the dedication to hand-feed and raise a venomhide, but they're well worth the effort."}
Q[13908]={d="你的毒皮暴掠龙强壮而又健康。看来你的确是有了一个好战友。等我给你做好了鞍子和缰绳，你就要准备骑上它了。就像你一样，这些骑乘用具必须进行特殊加工，好让它们能够承受毒皮暴掠龙所产生的剧毒。\n\n你要给我拿来一些硬甲皮，符文布，以及一些用来购买其它必需物品的资金。这样我立刻就能给你作出毒皮暴掠龙鞍了。",dEN="Your venomhide is strong and healthy and you've developed quite a bond. You'll be ready to ride him once I've completed your saddle and bridle. Just like you, they have to be specially conditioned to stand up to the toxins the raptor produces.\n\nAll you'll need to do is bring me some rugged leather, runecloth, and money to buy the rest of the supplies and I'll have that saddle for you in no time.",o="给位于安戈洛环形山沼泽地东南的莫维克带去20块硬甲皮、20张符文布和80金币。",oEN="Bring 20 Rugged Leather, 20 Runecloth, and 80 gold to Mor'vek in the southeast part of the Marshlands in Un'Goro Crater."}
Q[13914]={d="这只幼崽一直在看着你，仿佛正在考虑你是否能明白它的意思。它在土地上用爪子画出两根羽毛的图案，然后又指了指绑在它臂肘和膝盖上的东西。\n\n它看上去并不饿，那么它要羽毛干什么？\n\n它一定是想用羽毛做装饰，就像你在其它暴掠龙身上见到过的那样。炎鹏身上的羽毛是所有羽毛之中最大的。这种猛禽生活在塔纳利斯西部，灌木谷的东北方。它们总喜欢聚集在巨大野兽的尸骨周围。",dEN="The hatchling looks at you for a moment, almost as if wondering whether you'll understand. It scrawls a picture of a pair of feathers in the dirt, then points with one claw to the bindings at its elbows and knees.\n\nIt doesn't seem hungry, but what could the feathers be for?\n\nIt must want them for adornments like the ones you've seen on other raptors. The largest feathers come from the searing rocs that congregate around the bones of large creatures in western Tanaris, northeast of Thistleshrub Valley.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你给它弄来5根炎鹏的羽毛。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to get 5 pieces of Searing Roc Plumage.",p="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽期待地看着你。",pEN="Your venomhide hatchling looks at you with anticipation.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽收下这些羽毛，开始打量着它们，并且把羽毛装饰在它的臂环上。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling accepts the feathers and begins looking them over, holding several up to its armbands."}
Q[13915]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案都很粗糙，不过你还是能依稀从里面看出双帆龙，剑龙和翼手龙的形象。这只龙崽画完之后，又向你抬起了头，还露出了牙齿，做了一个咬的动作。\n\n你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽一定是想要吃这些恐龙的肉了。你要在安戈洛环形山找到并猎杀这些双帆龙、剑龙和翼手龙，取得恐龙肉，喂饱你饥饿的龙崽。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe drawings are rough, but you can make out the shapes of diemetradons, stegodons, and pterrordaxes. As the raptor finishes the sketch, it looks up at you, bares its teeth, and makes a biting motion.\n\nYour venomhide hatchling must be craving fresh meat from these animals. Find and kill any type of diematradon, stegodon, or pterrordax in Un'Goro Crater and feed its meat to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它15片鲜嫩的恐龙肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 15 pieces of Fresh Dinosaur Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔嘴唇并将头偏向一边。",pEN="The venomhide hatchling licks its lips and tilts its head to the side.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽似乎很满足你提供的大餐，但不知道何时它又会饿。",cEN="The venomhide hatchling seems satisfied with the giant meal you've provided, but there's no way of telling when it will be hungry again."}
Q[13916]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙崽的肚皮发出“咕咕”的响声。它挥舞胳膊，引起了你的注意。然后它在土地上画出一些异种蝎，又在蝎子下面画了一些小的椭圆形。\n\n那一定是异种蝎的卵。你可以到位于塔纳利斯西部，靠近安戈洛环形山边界的腐化之巢去。那里可是一个收集异种蝎卵的好地方。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling's stomach growls as it gestures to get your attention. It begins scratching pictures of silithids into the dirt, adding small ovals underneath them. It looks at you hopefully and gestures at the circles.\n\nThey can only mean silithid eggs. The Noxious Lair, in western Tanaris and near the border with Un'Goro Crater, would probably be a great place to find the eggs your little hatchling wants.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它12枚异种蝎卵。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 12 Silithid Eggs.",c="在吞完异种虫蛋大餐后，你的暴掠龙幼崽舔了舔它的嘴唇。有一瞬间，你觉得它似乎对已经结束的用餐时间感到失望。",cEN="Your hatchling licks its lips after devouring the meal of silithid eggs. For a moment, you think it seems disappointed that feeding time has come to an end."}
Q[13917]={d="这只毒皮暴掠龙幼崽用期待的眼神看着你，然后又在土地上画出了一些图案。\n\n这些图案所表现的似乎是一些大型昆虫，一些格里什异种蝎。龙崽画完以后，就用前臂指指图画，凭空猛咬了一口，又舔舔嘴唇。\n\n它一定是想让你去位于安戈洛环形山南部中心处的巨痕谷，在那里收集一些异种蝎肉。得到异种蝎肉之后，就用它来喂养你饥饿的龙崽吧。",dEN="The venomhide hatchling looks at you expectantly, then begins to scrawl a pictogram into the dirt.\n\nThe hatchling's drawings seem to resemble various types of large insects, perhaps the gorishi silithids. The hatchling finishes his picture, then gestures at it with one short arm, snaps its jaws, and licks its lips.\n\nIt must want you to go to the Slithering Scar, in center of the southern part of Un'Goro Crater, and gather silithid meat. When you have the meat, feed it to your hungry hatchling.",o="你的毒皮暴掠龙幼崽想要你喂它10块异种蝎肉。",oEN="Your Venomhide Hatchling wants you to feed it 10 Silithid Meat.",p="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽歪着头看着你。",pEN="The hatchling cocks its head and looks at you.",c="毒皮暴掠龙幼崽对着你露齿微笑并开始休憩打盹。",cEN="Your venomhide hatchling flashes you a toothy smile and then settles in for a nap."}
Q[13926]={d="孤儿们一直都很期待能有像你这样的朋友，$n。我非常高兴你能答应照顾他们其中的一个。\n\n带上这只哨子。有了它，你随时都能召唤受你照顾的孤儿。你不需要照顾他太久——大概也就是儿童周这段时间。\n\n好了，$n，请召唤你的孤儿吧。他一定会非常喜欢你的。你们一定会在诺森德各处渡过不少愉快的旅程。",dEN="The orphans have been looking forward to the opportunity to meet friends like you, <name>. It's wonderful that you've agreed to take one into your care.\n\nTake this whistle. With it, you will be able to call for the orphan you have agreed to sponsor. It will only last for a limited time - not much longer than Children's Week itself, in fact.\n\nPlease, <name>, call upon your orphan. He will be excited to meet you and see the sights of Northrend with you.",o="同孤儿监护员艾蕊娅交谈，然后使用神谕者孤儿哨召唤你要在儿童周照顾的孤儿。",oEN="Speak to Orphan Matron Aria, then use the Oracle Orphan Whistle to call the orphan you will be taking care of during Children's Week.",p="你照顾我们？",pEN="You taking care of us?",c="你会让我们远离小小狗人吗？太好了。我们开始喜欢上你了。坏心的小小狗人抢走了所有我们心爱的玩具。",cEN="You take us away from puppy-men hatchlings? Good. We like you already. Mean puppy-men hatchlings took all our favorite toys away."}
Q[13927]={d="孤儿们一直都很期待能有像你这样的朋友，$n。我非常高兴你能答应照顾他们其中的一个。\n\n带上这只哨子。有了它，你随时都能召唤受你照顾的孤儿。你不需要照顾他太久——大概也就是儿童周这段时间。\n\n好了，$n，请召唤你的孤儿吧。他一定会非常喜欢你的。你们一定会在诺森德各处渡过不少愉快的旅程。",dEN="The orphans have been looking forward to the opportunity to meet friends like you, <name>. It's wonderful that you've agreed to take one into your care.\n\nTake this whistle. With it, you will be able to call for the orphan you have agreed to sponsor. It will only last for a limited time - not much longer than Children's Week itself, in fact.\n\nPlease, <name>, call upon your orphan. He will be excited to meet you and see the sights of Northrend with you.",o="同孤儿监护员艾蕊娅交谈，然后使用狼獾人孤儿哨召唤你要在儿童周照顾的孤儿。",oEN="Speak to Orphan Matron Aria, then use the Wolvar Orphan Whistle to call the orphan you will be taking care of during Children's Week.",p="孤儿监护员说科科跟你走。",pEN="Orphan lady say Kekek go with you.",c="你带科科去打猎？能够离开那个不让科科去打猎的坏心孤儿院老女士真是太好了。",cEN="You take Kekek hunting? Good to get away from mean old orphan lady who doesn't let Kekek hunt."}
Q[13929]={d="在大战爆发，我们离开自己的村庄之前，索乌塞和我们讲过历史上最巨大的树！\n\n索乌塞管那棵树叫灰喉堡。索乌塞告诉我们，它就在灰熊丘陵的中央。不，等等，这不是索乌塞说的。索乌塞说的是灰熊丘陵。肯定没错！那棵好大的树就在灰熊丘陵的中央。绝对没有错！\n\n你带我们去那里好不好？我们要好好看看那棵大树。索乌塞告诉我们，有许多大熊怪就住在那棵树里。也许我们还能看见他们呢。",dEN="Before there was a big war and we left the village, we remember Soo-say telling us all about the biggest tree ever!\n\nSoo-say call it Grizzlemaw or something. Soo-say tell us it in the middle Grizzle Hills. No, wait, that not what Soo-say say. Soo-say say Grizzly Hills. Now we remember! Tree is big and right in middle of Grizzly Hills. Can't miss!\n\nYou take us there, oki? We see inside of giant tree? Soo-say tell us big bear men live in tree too. Maybe we see them.",o="带着你的孤儿鲁鲁转至灰喉堡。当你进入到那棵大树的树干里时，如果他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Roo, to visit Grizzlemaw. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you enter the trunk of the great tree.",p="我们可以看倒下的大树吗？可以吗？",pEN="Can we see the big tree? Can we?",c="我们从不知道树可以长那么大！从不。也许造物主对这树有特别的计划？",cEN="We never knew trees got that big! Nope. Maybe Great Ones had special plan for it?"}
Q[13930]={d="高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克总是向我们讲强大武士的故事。其中有些故事发生在很远的地方。有时候，他会讲巨大的熊怪为了保卫树城而英勇战斗的故事。\n\n也许你能带科科到那里去，去看看那些大树，还有那里的战场！高阶萨满祭司拉克亚克告诉科科，那座巨大的树城灰喉堡就矗立在灰熊丘陵的正中心。\n\n科科在遇到监护员之前从没有见过一座城市。但这座城市里没有战士，只有穿着紫袍子的人。科科想去看看真正的战士为了真正的城市作战的样子！",dEN="High Shaman Rakjak always tell stories of mighty warriors, even ones far away. Sometimes he tell stories about giant bear-men fighting great battle for tree-city.\n\nMaybe you take Kekek there, see tree, see battle! High Shaman Rakjak tell Kekek that giant tree-city Grizzlemaw stand in the middle of Grizzly Hills.\n\nKekek never see a city before meeting orphan lady, but this city have no warriors, only men in purple dresses. Kekek want to see real warriors fight for real city.",o="带着你的孤儿科科转至灰喉堡。当你进入那棵巨树的树干时，如果他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Kekek, to visit Grizzlemaw. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you enter the trunk of the great tree.",p="科科想去参观倒下的世界之树。我们走吧。",pEN="Kekek want to visit bear-men tree. We go.",c="这是科科心目中理想的城市。熊怪跟狂心者一样为了家园而奋战。孤儿院的女士告诉科科不要和其它小孩打架，但科科仍旧照打。",cEN="This is Kekek's kind of city. Bear-men fight for home just like Frenzyheart do. Orphan lady tell Kekek not to fight with other pups, but Kekek fight anyway."}
Q[13931]={d="我们不仅供应美酒，还独家出售啤酒杯呢！瞧这些漂亮的杯子，非常具有纪念意义哦！这是一张礼品券。\n\n与美酒节营地背后的布利克斯谈一谈。他是个古怪的家伙，总是带着一副护目镜。他负责兑换礼品券，以及出售各类美酒。",dEN="Not only are we supplying brew to everyone, we also have steins to give out! Beautiful, commemorative steins all obtained by the most legal of means! Here's a voucher for one.\n\nTalk to Blix near the back of the Brewfest camp. He's pretty strange, even more so now that he's always wearing those goggles. He'll handle the voucher for you, and any other Brewfest transaction.",o="在美酒节营地背后的布利克斯·菲克维特处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Blix Fixwidget in the back of the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="这是什么？酒杯兑换券？你喜欢喝酒吗？太棒了！我把酒杯给你以后，你就可以喝个痛快了！然后再多喝几杯。也许接着再多来几杯……跟着，重点来了，再回来找我。\n\n听着，我知道迟早你一定会再回来找我的。假如你想要兑换美酒节奖品章的话，你就要回来找我。\n\n总而言之，这是你的酒杯，记得晚点再来和我谈谈。",cEN="What's this? A stein voucher? So you like drinking? Great! After I give you this stein, go have a few drinks! Then a few more. Maybe have a few more after that... Then, now this is important, come see me.\n\nLook, I know you'll be back eventually. If you want your Brewfest tokens redeemed you have to see me.\n\nAnyways, here's the stein, and remember to talk to me later."}
Q[13932]={d="美酒节除了赛羊会外，还有一项传统，那就是饮酒狂欢！如果你有时间的话，就将这张礼品券交给贝尔比吧。她就在美酒节营地的后面。要是你看不见她，没关系，她一定会看见你的。\n\n无论如何，将礼品券交给她，你就能免费领到一只美酒节酒杯。她还出售各种美酒哦。",dEN="Brewfest isn't just about racing rams, it's also about drinking! When you have a moment, take this voucher to Belbi Quikswitch. She's near the back of the Brewfest camp. If you can't see her, don't worry, she'll be sure to see you.\n\nIn any case, take this voucher to her to get your free Brewfest stein. She'll also be more than happy to handle any and all other Brewfest transactions.",o="在美酒节营地的贝尔比处兑换礼品券。",oEN="Redeem the Brewfest Stein Voucher with Belbi Quikswitch in the Brewfest camp.",p="怎么啦宝贝？有东西要给我？",pEN="What's happening hot stuff? Got something for me?",c="噢，只是张酒杯兑换券……说不定你还花了一番力气才弄来。好吧，这是你今年的酒杯。\n\n不过我猜我应该还会常常再看到你。无论如何，要是想兑换美酒节奖章，你找我就对了……\n\n或他找我……\n\n噢噢喔……或是他……",cEN="Aww, it's just a stein voucher... Maybe you're just playing hard to get. So here's this year's stein for you.\n\nBut I suspect I'll be seeing a lot more of you. After all, if you want any Brewfest tokens redeemed, I'm your girl...\n\nOr maybe I'm his girl...\n\nOooohhh... or his..."}
Q[13933]={d="有时候，高阶神谕者索乌塞会讲一些关于一座巨龙祭坛的故事。那和雨水巨石可不一样。索乌塞告诉我们，也许我们能在那里看到我们自己，只不过不会像我们现在这样闪光光。索乌塞的意思是说，我们能在那里看到自己许多年以后的样子。\n\n你要带我们去那里？我们记得青铜巨龙圣地是在一个叫龙骨荒野的地方。索乌塞说，雨水巨石让他知道，那个圣地就在龙眠神殿的东北方，或者是暮冬要塞的西北方。我们现在出发吗？",dEN="Sometimes High-Oracle Soo-say tell stories about a shrine to dragon-things, not like great rain stone, but different. Soo-say tell us maybe we see ourselves there, but not like in a shiny. Soo-say mean we could see what we are like many years from now.\n\nYou take us there? We remember shrine to bronze dragon-things in place called Dragonblight. Soo-say say great rain stone show him shrine to northeast of Wyrmrest Temple, or northwest of place dryskins call Wintergarde Keep. We go?",o="带上你的孤儿鲁鲁转至青铜巨龙圣地。如果当你到达那里的时候，他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Roo, to visit the Bronze Dragonshrine. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="我们要去参观青铜巨龙圣地吗？",pEN="We visit shrine to dragon-things?",c="我们很高兴你把我们带到这里来，<name>。我们一直担心，当孤儿监护人在索拉查发现我们时，我们会怎么样。",cEN="We very glad you brought us here, <name>. We always worried what would happen to us when the orphan matron found us in Sholazar."}
Q[13934]={d="当科科还是小孩子的时候，他经常会听长者们说起一个遥远的圣地。有时候，长者们会说，在青铜巨龙圣地能知道关于未来的一切事情。\n\n科科要告诉你，他要成为强大的战士。所以我们现在就要到那里去看看。青铜巨龙圣地就在龙骨荒野，在一个被称作龙眠神殿的东北方，一座被称为暮冬要塞的人类城镇的西北方。\n\n我们要到那里去，看看未来。我要让监护员知道，她是错的。科科是战士，不是傻瓜。",dEN="When Kekek was a pup, he sometimes heard elders talking about a far-off shrine. Sometimes they say that bronze dragon-things there know all about future.\n\nKekek tell you he be great warrior, now we go see. Bronze dragon-thing shrine somewhere in Dragonblight, northeast of dragon-thing temple called Wyrmrest, also northwest of man-town called Wintergarde.\n\nWe go there, see future. Prove orphan-lady wrong about Kekek. Kekek warrior, not bully.",o="带上你的孤儿科科转至青铜巨龙圣地。如果当你到达那里的时候，他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Kekek, to visit the Bronze Dragonshrine. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="科科想去参观龙眠圣殿。",pEN="Kekek want to visit dragonshrine.",c="看到了吧？凯凯克从不厌倦说：\"凯凯克早就告诉过你了。\"\n\n也许现在你会相信凯凯克说的其他事，比如天空是绿色的。",cEN="See? Kekek never get tired of saying, \"Kekek tell you so.\"\n\nMaybe now you believe other things Kekek tell you, like how sky is green."}
Q[13937]={d="我们还有时间去最后一个地方吗？我们听说达拉然有家玩具店，可我们从来去不了。孤儿院长说太多孤儿会把店里挤满。也许我们可以去，就我们几个？\n\n能给我们一个小纸飞艇吗？我想达拉然的惊奇之作店里有卖。我们一直想玩一个。能扔一个给我们吗？",dEN="We have time for one more stop? We heard Dalaran has toy store, but we never get to go there. Orphan mistress says too many orphans would crowd the store. Maybe we can go, just us?\n\nWe can have a small paper zeppelin? We think they have those at Wonderworks in Dalaran. We always wanted to play with one. Maybe you throw one to us?",o="在奇妙玩具店购买一只规模纸飞艇，然后把它掷给你的孤儿鲁鲁。",oEN="Purchase a Small Paper Zeppelin at the Wonderworks and then throw it to your orphan, Roo.",p="我们会去奇妙玩具店吗？",pEN="We go to the Wonderworks?",c="真有趣！我们喜欢玩具店。也许孤儿监护员改天能带我们去。我们会拜托她的。或许你也能跟她说一声？",cEN="That was fun! We like toy store. Maybe orphan matron take us sometimes. We ask. Maybe you tell her too?"}
Q[13938]={d="你还要带科科去另一个地方？监护员说达拉然有一个奇妙玩具店。但科科从没有去过那里。保姆说，如果有一个孤儿去了，她就必须带所有孤儿都去那里了。你能带科科去那里吗？\n\n科科看到过其它孩子玩折纸飞艇。科科听说那些飞艇都是从奇妙玩具店里飞出来的。也许你能在那里弄到一只折纸飞艇，然后和科科一起玩？",dEN="You take Kekek one more place? Orphan lady say Dalaran have toy store called Wonderworks, but Kekek never seen it. She say that if one orphan go, she have to take everyone. Maybe you take Kekek?\n\nKekek seen other children playing with small paper zeppelin? Kekek hear those come from Wonderworks. Maybe you get one and throw it around with Kekek?",o="在奇妙玩具店购买一只规模纸飞艇，再将小飞艇丢给你的孤儿科科。",oEN="Purchase a Small Paper Zeppelin at the Wonderworks and then throw it to your orphan, Kekek.",p="到玩具店了吗？",pEN="This toy store yet?",c="科科喜欢玩纸飞艇。虽然没有像打猎一样好玩，但至少让我在孤儿院无聊时有事可做。",cEN="Kekek like playing with paper zeppelin. Not as good as hunting, but give something to do when bored at orphanage."}
Q[13950]={d="你要知道，孤儿们都是很孤独的。有时候，我们很想去别的地方看看，结交一些新的朋友。\n\n也许你能带我们去闯一闯？我们听说有一个叫冬鳞避难所的地方。那就在北风苔原里面。要去那里，我们应该向西北方前进，走到靠近考达拉岛边缘的地方。\n\n监护员说有一个勇敢的人也在那里养育着一群孤儿。他们一定也很孤单，一定也需要朋友。你愿意带我们去那里吗？",dEN="Orphanage gets real lonely, you know? Sometimes we want to go places, meet new friends.\n\nMaybe you can take us somewheres with other hatchlings? We heard about a place called Winterfin Retreat, in the big Borean Tundra. We think it's way in the northwest, near the edge of the Coldarra-island.\n\nThe orphan lady say someone brave save a bunch of hatchlings there. We think they lonely, too. We think they need friends. You take us there?",o="带领你的孤儿鲁鲁前去拜访冬鳞避难所。当你到达那里的时候，如果他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Roo, to visit Winterfin Retreat. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="你要带我们去冬鳞避难所？也许还能认识新朋友？",pEN="You take us to Winterfin Retreat? Meet new friends maybe?",c="那真好玩！我们下次再来？我等不及要再次看到我们的新朋友了！",cEN="That was fun! We go again sometime? We can't wait to see our new friend again!"}
Q[13951]={d="除了监护员照顾的小孩子，科科还想有别的朋友。也许我们能去一些别的地方？\n\n科科知道有一个部落居住在龙骨荒野。他们住的地方叫做飘雪林地。你知道吗？飘雪林地在莫亚基港口的北边和红玉巨龙圣地的南边。\n\n<提到海象人的时候，科科的脸上现出一副生气的表情。>\n\n你带科科去那里。去拜访那里的村子。也许我们能遇到新的狼獾人，让他们知道，狂心氏族有多厉害！",dEN="Kekek think there not enough other pups living with orphan-lady. Maybe we go visit some others?\n\nKekek know a tribe that lives in Dragonblight, at place called Snowfall Glade. You know? Snowfall Glade north of walrus-men town of Mo'aki Harbor and south of Ruby Dragonshrine.\n\n<Kekek scowls at the mention of the tuskarr.>\n\nYou take Kekek there, to some of the villages there. Maybe we meet new wolvar, show them how fierce Frenzyheart are!",o="带着你的孤儿科科转至飘雪林地。当你到达那里的时候，如果他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Kekek, to visit Snowfall Glade. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="你现在能带科科去飘雪林地？",pEN="You take Kekek to Snowfall Glade now?",c="科科喜欢飘雪林地的新朋友，或许下次有机会一起打猎。说不定我们能在海象人睡觉的时候把他们翻得肚子朝天。",cEN="Kekek like new Snowfall friends, maybe come back and go hunting together sometime. Maybe we go tip over walrus-men when they sleeping."}
Q[13952]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给暴风城墓地的欢快的人类灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Human Spirit in Stormwind's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[13954]={d="高阶神谕者索乌塞有一个故事，说的是造物主造出了所有的龙和一位统驭所有巨龙的女王。我们想看一看那位女王！你能带我们去龙眠神殿的最高处吗？索乌塞告诉我过我们，那个神庙就在龙骨荒野的中心。\n\n我们真的很想见到红龙女王。她一定又大又美丽。也许她能帮助我们找到新的爸爸妈妈。\n\n你会带我们去吗？",dEN="One of High-Oracle Soo-say's stories says Great Ones made all the dragons and a queen for the dragons, too. We want to see her! Would you take us to the top of Wyrmrest Temple? We remember Soo-say telling us the temple-thing was in the middle of Dragonblight.\n\nWe really want to meet dragon queen. She must be so big and pretty. Maybe she help us find new parents.\n\nYou take us?",o="带上你的孤儿鲁鲁去拜访阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者，她就在龙眠神殿的顶端。如果当你到达那里的时候，他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Roo, to visit Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at the top of Wyrmrest Temple. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",c="你觉得她之前看过神谕者吗？我们可能是第一个见过红龙女王的神谕者耶！我们觉得她喜欢我们，不过不太确定。她没有讲太多话。不过，这真好玩！",cEN="Do you think she ever saw an oracle before? We might be the first one ever to meet her! We thinks she liked us, but we're not sure. She doesn't talk a lot. Nope. But that was fun!"}
Q[13955]={d="科科一直都很喜欢巨龙。科科一直都想有一条龙。但监护员不让科科这样做。不过她说了，你可以带科科去看看红龙女王。\n\n科科终于听监护员说了一句也有道理的话。你愿意带科科去龙骨荒野中心的龙眠神殿吗？我们一同飞到那座神庙顶上，去看看红龙女王。她一定非常非常巨大。这样她才能成为所有巨龙的女王。科科已经等不及想要见她了！",dEN="Kekek always liked dragons. Always wanted to be one, but orphan-lady said no. But she did say maybe you take Kekek to meet dragon queen.\n\nKekek think orphan-lady have good idea for once. You take Kekek to Wyrmrest Temple in the middle of Dragonblight? Fly all the way to top to meet dragon queen. She must be really big, to be queen of all dragons. Kekek can't wait to see!",o="带上你的孤儿科科去拜访阿莱克丝塔萨，生命的缚誓者，她就在龙眠神殿的顶端。如果当你到达那里的时候，他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Kekek, to visit Alexstrasza the Life-Binder at the top of Wyrmrest Temple. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="我们要去看红龙女王了吗？",pEN="We go see dragon queen now?",c="红龙女王长的跟科科想的不一样，但科科知道原因。如果她一直变成大龙，那会把访客压个稀巴烂！总有一天我要看看她的庐山真面目。",cEN="Queen not what Kekek expected, but Kekek understand why. Queen's visitors get crushed if she was always big dragon! Still want to see someday."}
Q[13956]={d="高阶神谕者索乌塞总是告诉我们，造物主如何建起圣地，而我们则让它们发光。但他从没有见过一位造物主。没有人见过造物主。不过，也许你能找到一位造物主？\n\n索乌塞告诉我们，造物主建造了一座界门，并把它安放在索拉查南部的正中心。索乌塞没有说它会通向哪里。但也许我们能借助它走到一位造物主的面前！带我们走进那道界门，让我们看看门的另一边到底有些什么吧，$n。",dEN="High-Oracle Soo-say always tell us about how Great Ones built shrines and we give them shinies, but he never see Great Ones. No one see Great Ones, but maybe you know how to find one?\n\nSoo-say told us the Great Ones made a waygate and put it in the center of the southern part of Sholazar. Soo-say not say where it goes, but maybe it take us to a Great One! Take us through that waygate and let's find out, <name>.",o="带着你的孤儿鲁鲁转至塑造者之台的源生石像那里。当你到达那里的时候，如果他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Roo, to visit the Etymidian at the Shaper's Terrace. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",p="你知道如何找到一位造物主吗？我们以前从来没看过造物主。",pEN="Do you know how to find a Great One? We've never seen one before.",c="我们见到了一位造物主！可惜是在他的午睡时间，但我们了解。我们也喜欢打瞌睡！也许我们是跟造物主学到了如何打瞌睡，就像我们学到了圣坛及亮晶晶！\n\n我们可以在他醒来时再来拜访他吗？",cEN="We got to meet a Great One! Too bad it was during his nap time, but we understand. We like naps, too! Maybe we learn naps from Great Ones like we learn about shrines and shinies!\n\nCan we come back and visit the Great One again when not sleeping?"}
Q[13957]={d="你知道科科一直想要见到的人是谁吗？赫米特·奈辛瓦里。\n\n也许你能带科科去见他？长者哈尔卡克把他的所有事情都告诉我们了。他来到索拉查就是为了猎捕当地最大的怪物！就连狂心氏族的长老们也尊敬赫米特·奈辛瓦里，称他为伟大的猎人。\n\n长者哈尔卡克告诉科科，奈辛瓦里营地就在索拉查西侧的中部，碎浪河附近。我们去那里拜访他，学习如何像赫米特那样狩猎好不好？",dEN="Know who Kekek always wanted to meet? Hemet Nesingwary.\n\nMaybe you take Kekek to see him? Elder Harkek tell us all about him. He come to Sholazar to hunt biggest creatures anywhere! Even Frenzyheart elders respect Hemet Nesingwary as great hunter.\n\nElder Harkek tell Kekek that Nesingwary Base Camp in the middle of west side of Sholazar, right on river called Seabreach Flow. We go visit and learn how to hunt like Hemet?",o="带着你的孤儿科科去拜访赫米特·奈辛瓦里。他就在奈辛瓦里营地。如果当你到达那里的时候，他不在你身边，一定要召唤他过来。",oEN="Take your orphan, Kekek, to visit Hemet Nesingwary at the Nesingwary Base Camp. Make sure to call for him if he is not present when you get there.",c="你能帮科科读他那本书吗？然后科科要跟赫米特·奈辛瓦里一起打猎！",cEN="You help Kekek learn him a book? Then, Kekek hunt with Hemet Nesingwary!"}
Q[13959]={d="我们和你一起渡过了一段最美好的时光$n。真希望你会是我们的$g爸爸:妈妈。但你现在必须带我回达拉然的孤儿院里。\n\n也许你什么时候能再来看我们？我们喜欢去看冬鳞小鱼人和红龙女王。绝不会有人相信，我们竟然见到了造物主！\n\n我们会想念你的，$n。一定要给我们写信，我们也会给你写信的，好吗？",dEN="We had the best time with you, <name>. We wish you could be our <daddy /mama> now, but you have to take us back to Orphan Matron Aria in Dalaran.\n\nMaybe you could come visit us again sometime? We loved meeting Winterfin hatchlings and getting to see the dragon queen. No one will believe us when we say we met a Great One!\n\nWe going to miss you, <name>. We promise to write letter sometime, oki?",o="将你的监护对象送回到达拉然孤儿院，把神谕者孤儿哨交给达拉然的孤儿监护员艾蕊娅。",oEN="Return your ward to the Dalaran orphanage by handing in the Oracle Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Aria in Dalaran.",p="我们一定得回去吗？我们想要留在你身边。",pEN="Do we have to go back? We want to stay with you.",c="听起来小鲁鲁过了一周的快乐时光。他在孤儿院时是极度的孤单并渴望交到一些新朋友。非常感谢你愿意看顾他。",cEN="It sounds like little Roo had a great time this week. I know he was getting awfully lonely in the orphanage and was eager to make some new friends. Thank you so much for agreeing to look after him."}
Q[13960]={d="你知道吗？你不是个坏人，$n。你带着科科去了许多有趣的地方。科科遇到了不少新朋友，还经历了一些其它孩子根本想象不到的事情。\n\n你与赫米特·奈辛瓦里和飘雪林地的小孩全都成了科科最好的朋友。也许你能把那本绿色山丘书带给科科？科科答应了要不时给你写一些东西，让你知道他的情况。也许，作为一个大舌头怪的孩子也是有些好处的。\n\n科科现在要回到孤儿监护员艾蕊娅那里去了，要回到紫色人的城市去了。",dEN="Know what? You not so bad after all, <name>. You take Kekek a lot of fun places. Kekek meet a lot of new friends and do things no other pup get to do.\n\nYou, and Hemet Nesingwary, and Snowfall Glade pups all new best friends. Maybe sometime you bring Kekek that green hills book? Kekek promise to write sometimes, too, tell you how things go. Maybe even be nice to big-tongue kids sometimes.\n\nKekek gotta go back to orphan-lady Aria now, back in purple human city.",o="将你的监护对象送回到达拉然孤儿院，把狼獾人孤儿哨交给达拉然的孤儿监护员艾蕊娅。",oEN="Return your ward to the Dalaran orphanage by handing in the Wolvar Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Aria in Dalaran.",p="凯凯克不想走。凯凯克想和乔希一起多看些北裂境的风景。",pEN="Kekek not want to go. Kekek want to see more of Northrend with Jeursey.",c="感谢你这周愿意照顾科科。我知道他很麻烦，但我认为多一点的个别照料及多一点朋友，他会改善很多。无疑的，他这几周内会一直念着那些和你一起经历的冒险故事。",cEN="Thank you for agreeing to care for Kekek this week. I know he can be a handful, but I think that with more individual attention and a few more friends, he'll do a lot better. No doubt he's going to be telling stories of his adventures with you for weeks."}
Q[13986]={d="$c，相信你已经知道，这里的战斗相当艰苦。我们还能守住战线，但我们的战士已死伤惨重。\n\n我们的一个名叫奥伯妮·亮鬃的战士手臂上的伤口感染了。她被送回到雷霆崖进行急救。不过，她在混乱中把盾牌遗失在了这里。你能把这面盾牌连同我们的祝福一起给她带过去么？我们非常想念她的微笑。\n\n你可以在雷霆崖的长者高地那里找到她。",dEN="The fight's been hard up here, <class>, as I'm sure you know. We're holding out, but not everyone has gone unscathed.\n\nA warrior in our band, Aponi Brightmane, was taken ill by an infected wound in her arm. She's been taken back to Thunder Bluff for recuperation. It seems she left her shield here at the front in the confusion, however - could you take it to her, along with our well-wishes? Her smile is missed around here.\n\nYou can find her on Elder Rise on the Bluff.",o="将破旧的部族护盾交给奥伯妮·亮鬃。她就在雷霆崖里的长者高地。",oEN="Take the Battered Tribal Shield to Aponi Brightmane on Elder Rise within Thunder Bluff.",p="喔！你好。我想我应该没看过你；有什么可以为你效劳的吗？",pEN="Oh! Hello there. I don't think we've met; is there something I can do for you?",c="喔，我的盾！我想我暂时没办法用它了，但还是谢谢你。我讨厌只能没用的坐在这里而不能去前线出力，但我这条手臂就算上战场也帮不了任何人。\n\n请自己多保重。",cEN="Oh, my shield! I won't be using it anytime soon, but thank you. I hate that I'm sitting here useless when I could be helping on the front, but fighting with my arm like this won't help anyone.\n\nTake care out there, won't you?"}
Q[14016]={d="在你取得胜利之后，我本想从比武场彻底清除掉黑骑士的痕迹，但神官帕尔崔丝坚持说应该给他一个体面的葬礼。从那时开始，一个黑色的影子就一直在墓地中出没，让人们全都不敢去那里悼念逝者了。\n\n你能去墓地看看，查清楚那里发生了什么事吗？",dEN="I wanted to remove the Black Knight's remains from the tournament grounds after your victory, but Confessor Paletress insisted that he receive a decent burial. Ever since, a dark presence has lingered in the cemetery and people are afraid to go there to visit the fallen.\n\nWould you visit the cemetery just past the eastern end of the tournament grounds and see if you can discover what's happening?",o="银色比武场的北伐军战士莱达拉希望你去调查一下黑骑士之墓。",oEN="Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to investigate the Black Knight's Grave.",c="<北伐军莱达拉眉头紧皱。>\n\n你觉得他们是早就计划好的吗？我想那不是重点，但这之后事情的进展我不喜欢，因为我有种被他们玩弄于股掌之间的感觉。无论那边发生了什么事，我们都必须阻止它。",cEN="<Crusader Rhydalla frowns.>\n\nDo you think they've been planning this? I suppose it doesn't matter, but I don't like the implication that we've been playing into their hands. Whatever is going on, we have to stop it."}
Q[14017]={d="那具尸体被异教徒们偷走了？他们只有可能把它运到一个地方－－亡语者岗哨，那就是他们在比武场西边山脊上的营地。\n\n无论异教徒们要做些什么，我们必须阻止他们的阴谋。看来，我听到的传闻是真的。那个臭名昭着的科勒博士一定也在那群异教徒中间施行他的邪术。你要找到一个能俯瞰那座异教徒营地的高地或祭坛，消灭那个家伙，寻找他的计划，并以你能做到的任何方法来阻止他的阴谋。",dEN="You said the body was taken by cultists? I can only think of one place they would have gone, Deathspeaker's Watch, the encampment on the rise west of the tournament grounds.\n\nWhatever the cultists are doing must be stopped. The rumors I've heard can only be true, then. The infamous Doctor Kohler must be among the cultists, practicing his arts. Look for a rise or an altar overlooking the cultist camp, slay the doctor, and look for proof of his plans. Slow down his work in any other way you can.",o="在亡语者岗哨取得科勒博士的计划，然后返回银色比武场，去见北伐军战士莱达拉。",oEN="Capture Doctor Kolher's Orders at Deathspeaker's Watch, then return to Crusader Rhydalla at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你知道他们对黑骑士的遗体做了什么了吗？",pEN="Did you find out what they're doing with the Black Knight's remains?",c="科勒博士不会有时间完成他的工作的，但他的计划已经开始执行。从你的报告中可以推知，巫妖王的仆从复生并重铸了黑骑士，但我们还不知道骑士的主人是谁。感谢你发现了这个线索，我会告诉高阶北伐军艾德拉德你的发现并同时警告联赛的参与者。",cEN="The doctor will not have time to complete his work, but his plan is already in motion. From what you've reported, the Lich King's servants have reanimated and empowered the Black Knight and there's no telling what the knight's master has in mind. You have done well in uncovering this plot. I will tell High Crusader Adelard of your findings and together, we will alert the tournament's participants."}
Q[14022]={d="$n，难道你不想和我们一起庆祝感恩节吗？在这个时刻，你可以回忆以前的旅行趣事和各种收获，同朋友们分享各种美食和故事。\n\n你可以参加精彩的感恩节盛宴。这些宴会都被安排在每一座主城的附近。你可以坐在那里的宴会桌旁，尽情享用桌上的美食。\n\n如果你有兴趣学习如何烹调传统的感恩节美食，那么就去找格雷戈里·塔波吧。你可以在暴风城的大门外找到他。",dEN="Won't you celebrate Pilgrim's Bounty with us, <name>? It's a time for reflecting on your journeys and your good fortune, sharing plentiful food and stories with friends.\n\nYou can partake of wonderful Pilgrim's Bounty feasts near major towns by sitting at a bountiful table and serving the foods you find there.\n\nIf you're interested in learning how to cook the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty foods, seek out Gregory Tabor. You will find him just outside Stormwind's gates.",o="同暴风城大门外的格雷戈里·塔波交谈。",oEN="Speak with Gregory Tabor just outside the city gates of Stormwind.",c="如果你想学习如何烹饪感恩节的食物，我可以帮你。如果你还不是位厨师，去找训练师后你立刻就可以烹制食物了！",cEN="If you'd like to learn to cook Pilgrim's Bounty foods, I can help. If you're not already a cook, all you have to do is train and you'll be cooking in no time!"}
Q[14023]={d="我们的香料面包填料是感恩节餐桌的基石。这道配方一直是暴风城的最爱，如今它在丰盛食谱中占有一席之地。\n\n如果你已经是厨师，就去拜访一位感恩节商人，领取你的丰盛食谱以及准备节日菜肴所需的全部本地食材。如果你还不是厨师，现在正是学习的好时机。$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}等你做好填料，把它带给桌旁的贾斯珀·摩尔。\n\n",dEN="Our spice bread stuffing is the cornerstone of the Pilgrim's Bounty table. The recipe has always been a favorite in Stormwind and now it has taken its place in the bountiful cookbook.\n\nIf you are already a cook, pay a visit to the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor to get your copy of the cookbook and all the local ingredients you'll need to prepare holiday fare. And if you're not yet a cook, there's no better time to start!\n\nOnce you've made the stuffing, bring it to Jasper Moore over near the tables.",o="制作5份玉米馅料，把它们交给加斯帕·摩尔，他就在暴风城大门外的宴会区。",oEN="Cook 5 servings of Spice Bread Stuffing and then bring them to Jasper Moore at the feasting area just outside Stormwind's gates.",p="我们需要更多美味的香料面包馅料。它们太受好评了。",pEN="We can always use more of that delicious spice bread stuffing. It's very popular.",c="太好了。这正是我们需要的。在桌上堆满新鲜的食物已经变成了例行事项，不过还是值得这么做。",cEN="Excellent. This is just what we needed. It's going to be a chore keeping all the tables stocked with fresh food, but it's well worth it."}
Q[14024]={d="你做的玉米馅料闻起来真是香极了，但如果没有一块南瓜馅饼，那么感恩节就永远都不会完整。那是我们在暴风城最喜欢的另外一道菜。因为艾尔文南瓜只会生长在这里。\n\n如果你还不知道该如何制作南瓜馅饼，那么你现在就可以在你的盛宴食谱上找到这道菜的做法了。\n\n你是否愿意制作一些南瓜馅饼，并把它们交给铁炉堡外的爱德华·文斯洛？现在他的南瓜馅饼一定已经不够了。",dEN="That spice bread stuffing you made smells delicious, but no Pilgrim's Bounty feast is complete without a slice of pumpkin pie. It's another one of our favorite dishes here in Stormwind, since it uses ripe Elwynn pumpkins that only grow here.\n\nIf you don't know how to make pumpkin pie already, there's a recipe in your bountiful cookbook.\n\nWould you mind cooking up a few slices and bringing them to Edward Winslow outside Ironforge? He's bound to be running low by now.",o="制作5份南瓜馅饼，将它们交给铁炉堡外宴会区的爱德华·文斯洛。",oEN="Make 5 slices of Pumpkin Pie and bring them to Edward Winslow at the feasting area right outside Ironforge.",p="更多的南瓜馅饼？来的正好。",pEN="More pumpkin pie? Just in time.",c="南瓜馅饼超受欢迎的。我从未见到矮人对蔬菜做的食物这么兴奋过。",cEN="The pumpkin pie's been a big hit up here. I've never seen a dwarf get so excited about anything made from a vegetable."}
Q[14028]={d="如果你还没有试过酸果蔓酱，那么你的人生肯定还不完整。它是用味道最清新的湿地酸果蔓制作的。如果你想要尝试自己制作酸果蔓酱，那就找感恩节商人吧。\n\n做这道菜的方法应该就在你的盛宴食谱中。\n\n如果你有空，能不能制作一些酸果蔓酱，并把它们送到暴风城外的加斯帕·摩尔那里去？我答应过他，会给他一些东西以作为你带过来的那些馅饼的交换。",dEN="If you haven't tried the cranberry chutney yet, you're in for a treat. It's made with the freshest tangy Wetlands cranberries. Just pick some up from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor if you want to try your hand at making chutney.\n\nThe recipe should be in your bountiful cookbook.\n\nIf you've got some extra time on your hands, would you mind making some of the chutney and bringing it down to Jasper Moore outside Stormwind? I promised him I'd trade some for the pie you brought.",o="制作5份酸果蔓酱，并把它们送到暴风城外宴会区的加斯帕·摩尔那里去。",oEN="Make 5 servings of Cranberry Chutney and bring them to Jasper Moore at the feasting area outside Stormwind.",p="我闻到了酸果蔓酱的味道咯？",pEN="Is that cranberry chutney I smell?",c="说好要送来的酸果蔓酱终于到了。你不会相信这些庆祝者扫掉这些食物的速度有多快。",cEN="Finally, the cranberry chutney I was promised. You wouldn't believe how fast the celebrants go through the stuff here."}
Q[14030]={d="感谢你带来了酸果蔓酱。这里要做的烹调工作太多了，我几乎没有时间去想别的事情。而现在对我来说，最重要的一件事就是达纳苏斯的艾萨克·奥勒登几乎已经把一切物资都用光了。你愿意帮我们一个忙，给那里送去一些玉米馅料和南瓜馅饼吗？你可以那边的商人手中购得你所需要的一切原料。\n\n你可以在达纳苏斯入口附近的宴会区找到艾萨克·奥勒登。那里就在战士区的外面。",dEN="Thanks for bringing the cranberry chutney. There's so much cooking to do, I hardly have time to think of anything else. And on top of my responsibilities here, Isaac Allerton in Darnassus is out of almost everything. I don't suppose you'd be willing to step in and whip up some more spice bread stuffing and pumpkin pie? The vendor should have all the ingredients you need\n\nYou should be able to find him near the feasting tables near the entrance to Darnassus just beyond the Warrior's Terrace.",o="将5份玉米馅料和5份南瓜馅饼送给达纳苏斯入口处附近的艾萨克·奥勒登。",oEN="Bring 5 servings of Spice Bread Stuffing and 5 Pumpkin Pies to Isaac Allerton near the entrance to Darnassus.",p="你是来参加感恩节餐会的吗？",pEN="Have you come to partake of the Pilgrim's Bounty feast?",c="谢谢你带来的东西。这下子我可以安心了。\n\n既然你已经来了，那就试试你的手艺来做些糖心甜土豆吧。",cEN="Thanks for bringing everything. I was starting to get worried.\n\nWhile you're here, you should try your hand at making some candied sweet potatoes."}
Q[14033]={d="既然你在这里，也许你可以弄一些泰达希尔甜土豆来。它们可以被做成世界上最好吃的糖心甜土豆。\n\n如果你不相信我，就看看你的盛宴食谱，然后试着做出这道菜尝一尝吧。如果你能多做一些，你可以把它们交给暴风城外面宴会区的格雷戈里·塔波。糖心甜土豆是他最喜欢的菜品之一。不过，他好像没什么不喜欢的菜。",dEN="While you're here, you might want to stock up on Teldrassil sweet potatoes. They're used to make the most delicious candied sweet potatoes you've ever tasted.\n\nIf you don't believe me, look up the recipe in your bountiful cookbook and give it a try. And if there are any extras, you might want to share them with Gregory Tabor at the feasting area just outside Stormwind. They're one of his favorites, but to hear him tell it, everything's his favorite!",o="制作5份糖心甜土豆，把它们交给暴风城外面宴会区的格雷戈里·塔波。",oEN="Make 5 servings of Candied Sweet Potatoes and bring them to Gregory Tabor just outside the gates of Stormwind.",p="<name>，很高兴又见到你。",pEN="<name>, it's good to see you again.",c="啊，糖心甜土豆！我的最爱！是艾萨克·奥雷顿告诉你的吗？",cEN="Ah, candied sweet potatoes! My favorite! Did Isaac tell you?"}
Q[14035]={d="每一场感恩节盛宴都需要一个精彩的核心主题，我说的可不是丰收之角。盛宴的核心应该是令人垂涎欲滴的慢烤火鸡。\n\n你的盛宴食谱中已经有了这道菜的烹调配方，为什么不去猎捕一些野生火鸡，做出这道菜？艾尔文森林中到处都能找到火鸡，所以猎捕它们绝对不是困难的事。\n\n火鸡烤好之后，请把它们交给达纳苏斯大门旁边的艾萨克·奥勒登好吗？",dEN="Every Pilgrim's Bounty feast requires a magnificent centerpiece, and I'm not talking about a decorative horn of plenty, either. No, the focus of the meal is a magnificent roast turkey.\n\nThere's a good recipe for it in your bountiful cookbook. Why not hunt some wild turkeys and prepare a few? The turkeys wander all over Elwynn Forest, so you shouldn't have a problem finding one.\n\nOnce you're done roasting them, will you bring them to Isaac Allerton near the gates of Darnassus?",o="制作5份慢烤火鸡，将它们交给达纳苏斯大门旁边的艾萨克·奥勒登。",oEN="Make 5 Slow-Roasted Turkeys and bring them to Isaac Allerton near the gates of Darnassus.",p="是什么让你回到达纳苏斯，<name>？",pEN="What brings you back to Darnassus, <name>?",c="这些很漂亮，正好及时喂饱饥饿的宾客。谢谢你，<name>。你确实精通了传统朝圣者恩赐大餐的所有菜肴。",cEN="These are beautiful and just in time to feed hungry feasters. Thank you, <name>. You've truly mastered all the courses of a traditional Pilgrim's Bounty meal."}
Q[14036]={d="你来到这里是为了和我们一起庆祝感恩节吗？我们总需要一段这样的时光，来回想自己的旅程与幸运，与朋友们分享美食，并举行其它各种庆祝活动。\n\n你能在大型城镇附近参加感恩节宴会。只要你找到了宴席餐桌，就可以坐在它旁边享用美食了。\n\n如果你想学习如何烹调传统的感恩节大餐，那么就去幽暗城寻找米尔斯·斯坦迪什吧。你可以在幽暗城上面的庭院里找到他。",dEN="Are you here to celebrate Pilgrim's Bounty with us? It was once a time for reflecting on your journeys and your good fortune while sharing a meal with friends. Many still mark the occasion.\n\nYou can partake of Pilgrim's Bounty feasts near major towns by sitting at a bountiful table and serving the foods you find there.\n\nIf you're interested in learning how to cook the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty foods, seek out Miles Standish. You will find him in the courtyard above Undercity.",o="同幽暗城庭院里的米尔斯·斯坦迪什谈谈。",oEN="Speak with Miles Standish in the courtyard above Undercity.",c="如果你想学习如何烹饪感恩节的食物，我可以帮你。如果你还不是位厨师，去找训练师后你立刻就可以烹制食物了！",cEN="If you'd like to learn to cook Pilgrim's Bounty foods, I can help. If you're not already a cook, all you have to do is train and you'll be cooking in no time."}
Q[14037]={d="我们的香料面包填料是感恩节餐桌的基石。这道配方源自洛丹伦更好的年代，如今它在传统大餐中占有一席之地。\n\n如果你已经是厨师，就去拜访一位感恩节商人，领取你的丰盛食谱以及准备节日菜肴所需的全部本地食材。如果你还不是厨师，现在正是学习的好时机。$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}等你做好填料，把它带给桌旁的威廉·马林斯。\n\n",dEN="Our spice bread stuffing is the cornerstone of the Pilgrim's Bounty table. The recipe dates from better times in Lordaeron and now it has taken its place in the traditional meal.\n\nIf you are already a cook, pay a visit to the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor to get your copy of the bountiful cookbook and all the local ingredients you'll need to prepare holiday fare. And if you're not yet a cook, there's no better time to start!\n\nOnce you've made the stuffing, bring it to William Mullins over near the tables.",o="制作5份玉米馅料，把它们交给威廉·穆林，他就在幽暗城上方庭院的宴会区里。",oEN="Cook 5 servings of Spice Bread Stuffing and then bring them to William Mullins at the feasting area in the courtyard above the Undercity.",p="桌上需要更多美味的香料面包馅料。",pEN="The tables could really use more of that spice bread stuffing.",c="让这些桌子都摆满食物真是件苦差事。仔细想想，我们其实已经不需要吃东西了，还这么费心，真是奇怪。",cEN="It's a chore keeping all these tables stocked. If you stop and think about it, it's strange going to so much trouble when we needn't eat anymore."}
Q[14040]={d="你制作的玉米馅料已经成为了这次宴会的亮点。但如果没有南瓜馅饼，那任何感恩节都不会是完整的。就如同玉米馅料一样，南瓜馅饼也是我们的传统菜式之一。只有在我们这里才能收获到甘美的提瑞斯法南瓜。\n\n如果你还不知道该如何制作南瓜馅饼，那么你可以在你的盛宴食谱上找到制作它的配方。\n\n你愿意制作一些南瓜馅饼，并把它们带到奥格瑞玛外面的弗朗西斯·伊顿那里去吗？现在他急需更多的南瓜馅饼。",dEN="That spice bread stuffing you made is a hit, but no Pilgrim's Bounty feast is complete without a slice of pumpkin pie. It's another traditional local dish, since it uses ripe Tirisfal pumpkins that only grow around here.\n\nIf you don't know how to make pumpkin pie already, there's a recipe in your bountiful cookbook.\n\nWould you mind cooking up a few slices and bringing them to Francis Eaton outside Orgrimmar? He's bound to be running low by now.",o="制作5份南瓜馅饼，将它们交给奥格瑞玛外面宴会区的弗朗西斯·伊顿。",oEN="Make 5 slices of Pumpkin Pie and bring them to Francis Eaton at the feasting area right outside Orgrimmar.",p="我们需要更多的南瓜馅饼。",pEN="We can always use more pumpkin pie.",c="南瓜馅饼总是最快被吃完的。我想大家一定都跳过正餐而直接吃甜点。你尝过一片没？",cEN="The pie always goes first. I think people must be skipping the meal and going directly for the dessert. Have you given it a try yet?"}
Q[14041]={d="你试过酸果蔓酱吗？它是用最新鲜浓烈的南国之怒酸果蔓制作的。如果你想要亲手制作一些酸果蔓酱，那么你可以从感恩节商人的手中购买一些原料。\n\n而制作酸果蔓酱的配方已经记录在你的盛宴食谱里面了。\n\n如果你有空，能不能制作一些酸果蔓酱，并把它们送到雷霆崖西侧升降梯底层的多金·辽原那里去。",dEN="Have you tried the cranberry chutney yet? It's made with fresh tangy Southfury cranberries. Just pick some up from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor if you want to try your hand at making chutney.\n\nThe recipe should be in your bountiful cookbook.\n\nIf you've got some extra time on your hands, would you mind making some of the chutney and bringing it to Dokin Farplain at the base of the elevator on the western side of Thunder Bluff.",o="制作5份酸果蔓酱，并把它们交给雷霆崖西侧升降梯底层的多金·辽原。",oEN="Make 5 servings of Cranberry Chutney and bring them to Dokin Farplain at the base of the elevator on the western side of Thunder Bluff.",p="你觉得朝圣者恩赐怎么样，<class>？",pEN="How are you enjoying Pilgrim's Bounty, <class>?",c="啊，更多的酸果蔓酱！你不会相信这些庆祝者扫掉这些食物的速度有多快。",cEN="Ah, more cranberry chutney! You wouldn't believe how fast the celebrants go through it."}
Q[14043]={d="既然你在这里，也许你可以弄一些泰达希尔甜土豆来。它们可以被做成世界上最好吃的糖心甜土豆。那也是我在感恩节上非常喜爱的一道菜。\n\n如果你不相信我，就看看你的盛宴食谱，然后试着做出这道菜尝一尝吧。如果你要去奥格瑞玛，请将一些糖心甜土豆交给城外宴会区的弗朗西斯·伊顿。我一直在努力维持对那里的食品供应，但所有食品的消耗速度都太快了。",dEN="While you're here, you might want to stock up on Mulgore sweet potatoes. They're used to make delicious candied sweet potatoes, my favorite part of the Pilgrim's Bounty meal.\n\nIf you don't believe me, look up the recipe in your bountiful cookbook and give it a try. If you're headed back to Orgrimmar, bring them to Francis Eaton at the feasting area just outside the city. I've been trying to keep him supplied, but everything goes so fast over there.",o="制作5份糖心甜土豆，并将它们交给奥格瑞玛外面的弗朗西斯·伊顿。",oEN="Make 5 servings of Candied Sweet Potatoes and bring them to Francis Eaton just outside of Orgrimmar.",p="欢迎回来，<name>。",pEN="Welcome back, <name>.",c="是杜金派你送糖心甜土豆来支持的？\n\n<法兰西斯微笑。>\n\n这也是他唯一能做的。谢谢你送这些来。",cEN="So Dokin drafted you to help with the candied sweet potatoes?\n\n<Francis smiles.>\n\nIt's the only way he can keep up. Thanks for bringing these."}
Q[14044]={d="感谢你带来的糖心甜土豆。我要做的烹饪工作实在是太繁重了，让我几乎不能应付。现在，米尔斯又送信给我们说，他的玉米馅料和酸果蔓酱都差不多快用光了。你能为他提供一些这两种食物吗？这里的商人应该有你所需要的一切原料。\n\n你应该能在幽暗城上方废墟庭院的宴会区里找到米尔斯·斯坦迪什。",dEN="Thanks for bringing the candied sweet potatoes. There's so much cooking to do, I can hardly keep up. And then, Miles sends me a note saying he's on the verge of running out of stuffing and cranberry chutney. I don't suppose you'd be willing to step in and whip up some more of each? The vendor should have all the ingredients you need.\n\nYou should be able to find Miles Standish near the feasting tables in the courtyard in the ruins above Undercity.",o="将5份玉米馅料和5份酸果蔓酱交给幽暗城入口附近的米尔斯·斯坦迪什。",oEN="Bring 5 servings of Spice Bread Stuffing and 5 servings of Cranberry Chutney to Miles Standish near the entrance to Undercity.",p="很高兴又见到你，<name>。",pEN="It's good to see you again. <name>.",c="谢谢你带来的东西。有些桌子上的盘子已经开始空了起来。",cEN="Thanks for bringing everything. Some of the tables were starting to look a little bereft of serving dishes."}
Q[14047]={d="每一场感恩节盛宴都需要一个精彩的核心主题。对于我们而言，这个主题就是慢火烤野生火鸡。我相信，没有任何菜肴能比它更适合成为一场宴会的主菜。\n\n你的盛宴食谱里已经有了制作这道菜的方法。为什么不去猎捕一些野生火鸡，把这道菜做出来？提瑞斯法林地到处都有野生火鸡，要找到它们绝对不是难事。\n\n把火鸡烤好之后，就请将它们交给奥格瑞玛城外的弗朗西斯·伊顿。",dEN="Every Pilgrim's Bounty feast requires a centerpiece, and for us, that's a slow-roasted wild turkey. I can't think of anything better to bring the meal together.\n\nThere's a good recipe for it in your bountiful cookbook. Why not hunt some wild turkeys and prepare a few? The turkeys wander all over Tirisfal Glades, so you shouldn't have a problem finding any.\n\nOnce you're done roasting them, will you bring them to Francis Eaton outside Orgrimmar?",o="制作5份慢烤火鸡，并将它们交给奥格瑞玛大门附近的弗朗西斯·伊顿。",oEN="Make 5 Slow-Roasted Turkeys and bring them to Francis Eaton near the gates of Orgrimmar.",p="是什么让你回到奥格瑞玛，<name>？",pEN="What brings you back to Orgrimmar, <name>?",c="这些看起来完美。谢谢你，<name>。你确实精通了传统朝圣者恩赐大餐的所有菜肴。",cEN="These look perfect. Thank you, <name>. You've truly mastered all the courses of a traditional Pilgrim's Bounty meal."}
Q[14048]={d="从这次节日一开始，我就在毫不停歇地烹调菜肴。但我提供的食品还是不能满足大家的需要。你愿意帮我一把么？\n\n这里的火鸡供应量远远不够。所以，如果你能做一些慢烤火鸡，那你可是帮了我一个大忙。如果你愿意的话，你可以在艾尔文森林各地猎捕野生火鸡。同时感恩节商人会向你出售烹调这道菜所需要的一切材料。",dEN="I've been cooking nonstop since before the start of the holiday, and I still can't keep up with the demand. I don't suppose I could persuade you to help with one of the dishes, could I?\n\nTurkey is hard to come by here, so if you could supply some slow-roasted turkeys, it would be a big help. If you intend to prepare them yourself, you can hunt fresh wild turkeys anywhere in Elwynn Forest. You should be able to buy everything else you need from any of the Pilgrim's Bounty vendors.",o="将20份慢烤火鸡交给铁炉堡外面的凯特琳·铁壶。",oEN="Bring 20 Slow-Roasted Turkeys to Caitrin Ironkettle outside Ironforge.",p="你有设法去弄到那些火鸡吗？",pEN="Did you manage to find those turkeys?",c="这些正是我需要的。谢谢你，<name>。你救了我一命。",cEN="These are just what I need. Thanks, <name>. You're a lifesaver."}
Q[14051]={d="在这些宴席桌上摆满美食实在是一个能累死人的工作！我在制作酸果蔓酱的时候还在盯着那些甜味土豆，又要保证那些馅饼不被烤糊。\n\n看样子，我已经把所有东西都准备好了。不，等等，我还忘了一样东西。玉米馅料！哦，不。我已经没有时间再去准备玉米馅料了。你愿意帮我一个忙吗？这并不难，你只需要在这里购买一些原料，就能制作出香喷喷的玉米馅料了。",dEN="Keeping these tables stocked can be overwhelming! I've got to make the cranberry chutney while keeping my eye on the sweet potatoes, and making sure the pies don't burn.\n\nI think I've got everything covered. No, wait, I'm forgetting something. The stuffing! Oh, no. There won't be time to get another batch of stuffing started before everything else is done. Would you be willing to help me out? It shouldn't take long to buy or make some stuffing and you can buy the ingredients right here.",o="将20份玉米馅料交给凯特琳·铁壶。 他就在铁炉堡宴会区外面。",oEN="Bring 20 Spice Bread Stuffing to Caitrin Ironkettle at the feasting area outside Ironforge.",p="你能取得那些馅料吗？",pEN="Were you able to get that stuffing?",c="感谢老天！没有香料面包馅料的话我根本不能款待餐会来宾。",cEN="Thank goodness! I wouldn't be able to serve the feast without spice bread stuffing."}
Q[14053]={d="我丈夫贾斯珀本来要做更多的蔓越莓酸辣酱，但看样子他正忙着确保有足够的蜜汁红薯给所有客人。你愿意帮忙吗？如果你是厨师，可以在铁炉堡外的感恩节商人那里买到所需的湿地酸蔓越莓。$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}\n如果你不想下厨，也可以请别人帮你做酸辣酱。\n",dEN="My husband, Jasper, was going to make more cranberry chutney, but it looks like he's busy trying to make sure there's enough candied sweet potatoes for all the guests. Would you be willing to help? If you're a cook, you can get the tangy Wetlands cranberries you'll need from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor outside Ironforge.\n\nIf you don't feel up to cooking, you could always ask someone else to make the chutney, too.",o="将20份酸果蔓酱交给暴风城外宴会区的艾伦·摩尔。",oEN="Bring 20 servings of Cranberry Chutney to Ellen Moore at the feasting area outside Stormwind.",p="你能取得酸果蔓酱吗？",pEN="Were you able to get your hands on any cranberry chutney?",c="谢啦。这看起来很棒，而且你的动作比贾斯伯还要快上一些，不过别告诉他我这么说。",cEN="Thanks. This looks great, and you're a fair bit faster than Jasper, but don't tell him I said so."}
Q[14054]={d="艾萨克一直努力帮助庆祝者了解传统的朝圣者恩赐盛宴，以及如何用我们每年这个时候采集的各种食材做菜。我一直尽量让桌上摆满尽可能多的菜肴，但艾萨克最喜欢的一道——南瓜派——快用完了。\n\n你能帮我们弄一些来吗？如果你想自己$gmismo:misma;做派，需要向暴风城的感恩节商人购买成熟的艾尔文南瓜。",dEN="Isaac's been hard at work helping celebrants learn about the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty feast and how to make dishes out of all the ingredients we harvest at this time of year. I've been trying to keep the tables stocked with as many of the dishes as I can, but we're running out of one of Isaac's favorites, pumpkin pie.\n\nWould you be able to get some for us? If you want to make the pies yourself, you'll need to buy ripe Elwynn pumpkins from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor outside Stormwind.",o="将20份南瓜馅饼交给达纳苏斯大门附近宴会区的玛丽·奥勒登。",oEN="Bring 20 pieces of Pumpkin Pie to Mary Allerton at the feasting area near the gates of Darnassus.",p="那些派进展如何？",pEN="How are those pies coming along?",c="这些真是太完美了。艾萨克和其它人都会爱上它们的！",cEN="These are perfect. Isaac, and everyone else, will love them!"}
Q[14055]={d="我妻子艾伦让我帮忙让桌上不断供，可她自己拿不定主意。我一开始在做南瓜派，现在她改了主意，想要蜜汁红薯。\n\n派我已经做上了，所以也许你能帮我一起把蜜汁红薯弄出来。如果我们能把她要的都备齐，她会非常惊喜的。\n\n如果你要自己$gmismo:misma;做蜜汁红薯，就得向达纳苏斯的感恩节商人购买。谢谢你，$n。",dEN="My wife Ellen has enlisted my help in keeping the tables stocked, but she can't make up her mind. First I was making pumpkin pie, but now she's changed her mind and she wants candied sweet potatoes.\n\nWell, I've already started on the pie, so maybe you can help me whip up those sweet potatoes. She'll be pleasantly surprised if we can get everything she's asked for.\n\nIf you're going to cook the sweet potatoes yourself, you'll have to buy them from the Pilgrim's Bounty merchant in Darnassus. Thanks, <name>.",o="将20份糖心甜土豆交给暴风城外面宴会区的加斯帕·摩尔。",oEN="Bring 20 Candied Sweet Potatoes to Jasper Moore at the feasting area outside of Stormwind.",p="你有糖心甜土豆吗？",pEN="Do you have those candied sweet potatoes?",c="这些很完美。谢谢你帮我这个忙，<name>。饭菜会按时上桌，艾伦会高兴的。",cEN="These are perfect. Thanks for helping me with this, <name>. The meal will get served on time and Ellen will be happy."}
Q[14058]={d="罗伯塔·卡特请我帮忙准备一道宴席菜——蜜汁红薯。换作平时，我很乐意帮忙，但我答应过女主人帮她照看桌子。\n\n如果你能帮我弄到那些蜜汁红薯，我会非常感激。我要是让罗伯塔失望，她永远不会原谅我。\n\n如果你要自己$gmismo:misma;做蜜汁红薯，就得向雷霆崖的感恩节商人购买。谢谢你，$n。",dEN="Roberta Carter has recruited me to help prepare one of the feast dishes, candied sweet potatoes. Normally, I'd love to help, but I've promised the hostess that I'd help her watch the tables.\n\nI'd really appreciate it if you would help me come up with those candied sweet potatoes. Roberta would never forgive me if I let her down.\n\nIf you're going to cook the sweet potatoes yourself, you'll have to buy them from the Pilgrim's Bounty merchant in Thunder Bluff. Thanks, <name>.",o="将20份糖心甜土豆交给幽暗城上方宴会区里的威廉·穆林。",oEN="Bring 20 Candied Sweet Potatoes to William Mullins at the feasting area above Undercity.",p="你有糖心甜土豆吗？",pEN="Do you have those candied sweet potatoes?",c="谢谢你，<name>。现在我可以帮女主人的忙，同时又不违背对罗伯塔的承诺了。",cEN="Thanks, <name>. Now, I can help the hostess out and still keep my word to Roberta."}
Q[14059]={d="我真想知道蔓越莓酸辣酱为什么消耗得这么快。有时候我觉得，我一不注意，他们就拿它去喂憎恶了。你愿意帮我做一批新的吗？如果你是厨师，可以在奥格瑞玛外的感恩节商人那里买到所需的南怒酸蔓越莓。$gcocinero:cocinera;{None}\n如果你不想下厨，也可以请别人帮你做酸辣酱。\n",dEN="I wish I knew why we're going through cranberry chutney so fast. Sometimes, I think they're feeding it to the abominations when I'm not looking. Would you be willing to help me make up a new batch? If you're a cook, you can get the tangy Southfury cranberries you'll need from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor outside Orgrimmar.\n\nIf you don't feel up to cooking, you could always ask someone else to make the chutney, too.",o="将20份酸果蔓酱交给幽暗城庭院上方宴会区的罗贝塔·卡特。",oEN="Bring 20 servings of Cranberry Chutney to Roberta Carter at the feasting area in the courtyard above Undercity.",p="你能取得酸果蔓酱吗？",pEN="Were you able to get your hands on any cranberry chutney?",c="感谢你的帮忙，如果你弄清楚消失的酸甜酱事件的真相，请务必让我知道。",cEN="Thanks for your help, and let me know if you ever get to the bottom of the case of the disappearing chutney."}
Q[14060]={d="多金和拉哈一直努力帮助庆祝者了解传统的朝圣者恩赐盛宴，以及如何用我们每年这个时候采集的各种食材做菜。我一直尽量让桌上摆满尽可能多的菜肴，但南瓜派快用完了。\n\n你能帮我们弄一些来吗？如果你想自己$gmismo:misma;做派，需要向幽暗城外的感恩节商人购买成熟的提瑞斯法南瓜。",dEN="Dokin and Laha have been hard at work helping celebrants learn about the traditional Pilgrim's Bounty feast and how to make dishes out of all the ingredients we harvest at this time of year. I've been trying to keep the tables stocked with as many of the dishes as I can, but we're running low on pumpkin pie.\n\nWould you be able to get some for us? If you want to make the pies yourself, you'll need to buy ripe Tirisfal pumpkins from the Pilgrim's Bounty vendor outside the Undercity.",o="将20份南瓜馅饼交给雷霆崖外宴会区的玛哈拉·金穗。",oEN="Bring 20 pieces of Pumpkin Pie to Marhara Goldwheat at the feasting area outside Thunder Bluff.",p="那些派进展如何？",pEN="How are those pies coming along?",c="这些太棒了！谢谢你的帮忙，<name>。",cEN="These are great! Thank you for helping, <name>."}
Q[14061]={d="从这次节日一开始，我就在毫不停歇地烹调菜肴。但我提供的食品还是不能满足大家的需要。你愿意帮我一把么？\n\n这里的火鸡供应量远远不够。所以，如果你能做一些慢烤火鸡，我会非常非常感激你的。如果你愿意的话，你可以在提瑞斯法林地各地猎捕野生火鸡。同时感恩节商人会向你出售烹调这道菜所需要的一切材料。",dEN="I've been cooking nonstop since before the start of the holiday, and I still can't keep up with the demand. I don't suppose I could persuade you to help with one of the dishes, could I?\n\nTurkey is hard to come by here, so if you could supply some slow-roasted turkeys, it would be a big help. If you intend to prepare them yourself, you can hunt fresh wild turkeys anywhere in the Tirisfal Glades. You should be able to buy everything else you need from any of the Pilgrim's Bounty vendors.",o="将20份慢烤火鸡交给奥格瑞玛外面的昂丹尼。",oEN="Bring 20 Slow-Roasted Turkeys to Ondani Greatmill outside Orgrimmar.",p="你火鸡猎得怎样？",pEN="How's your turkey hunt going?",c="这些火鸡就是我要的。感谢你在我忙不过来的时候帮我一把。",cEN="These turkeys are exactly what I needed. Thanks for helping me out of a tough situation."}
Q[14062]={d="在这些宴席桌上摆满美食实在是一个能累死人的工作！我在制作酸果蔓酱的时候还在盯着那些甜味土豆，又要保证那些馅饼不被烤糊。\n\n看样子，我已经把所有东西都准备好了。不，等等，我还忘了一样东西。玉米馅料！哦，不。我已经没有时间再去准备玉米馅料了。你愿意帮我一个忙吗？这并不难，你只需要在这里购买一些原料，就能制作出香喷喷的玉米馅料了。",dEN="Keeping these tables stocked can be overwhelming! I've got to make the cranberry chutney while keeping my eye on the sweet potatoes, and making sure the pies don't burn.\n\nI think I've got everything covered. No, wait, I'm forgetting something. The stuffing! Oh, no. There won't be time to get another batch of stuffing started before everything else is done. Would you be willing to help me out? It shouldn't take long to buy or make some stuffing and you can buy the ingredients right here.",o="将20份玉米馅料交给奥格瑞玛外面的昂丹尼。",oEN="Bring 20 Spice Bread Stuffing to Ondani Greatmill outside Orgrimmar.",p="你能取得那些馅料吗？",pEN="Were you able to get that stuffing?",c="来得正好！没有香料面包馅料的话我根本不能款待餐会来宾。",cEN="Perfect timing! I wouldn't be able to serve the feast without spice bread stuffing."}
Q[14064]={d="如果不在盛宴餐桌旁吃个痛快，就绝对不算是庆祝过感恩节。\n\n请坐下来尽情享用这里的美食吧！如果想品尝不同的菜肴，你可以从一个座位上移动到另一个座位上，或者请求宴会桌旁的其它人将他们面前的菜式传递给你。\n\n当你吃过桌上的所有美食之后，你的体内就会充满分享之魂。",dEN="You've not celebrated Pilgrim's Bounty properly until you've eaten your fill at a Bountiful Table.\n\nPlease, sit down, feast, and try everything! You can move from chair to chair yourself, or ask others at the table to pass you some of their food.\n\nOnce you eat enough of every dish, you'll be infused with the Spirit of Sharing.",o="在盛宴餐桌旁将每一种食物都吃过五份，以此获得分享之魂。",oEN="Eat five helpings of every food at a Bountiful Table until you gain the Spirit of Sharing.",c="多棒的一顿飨宴，嗯？\n\n我很高兴你能和我们一起庆祝感恩节的精神。",cEN="What a feast, hmmm?\n\nI'm so glad you could celebrate the spirit of Pilgrim's Bounty with us."}
Q[14065]={d="如果不在盛宴餐桌旁吃个痛快，就绝对不算是庆祝过感恩节。\n\n请坐下来尽情享用这里的美食吧！如果想品尝不同的菜肴，你可以从一个座位上移动到另一个座位上，或者请求宴会桌旁的其它人将他们面前的菜式传递给你。\n\n当你吃过桌上的所有美食之后，你的体内就会充满分享之魂。",dEN="You've not celebrated Pilgrim's Bounty properly until you've eaten your fill at a Bountiful Table.\n\nPlease, sit down, feast, and try everything! You can move from chair to chair yourself, or ask others at the table to pass you some of their food.\n\nOnce you eat enough of every dish, you'll be infused with the Spirit of Sharing.",o="在盛宴餐桌旁将每一种食物都吃过五份，以此获得分享之魂。",oEN="Eat five helpings of every food at a Bountiful Table until you gain the Spirit of Sharing.",c="多棒的一顿飨宴，嗯？\n\n我很高兴你能和我们一起庆祝感恩节的精神。",cEN="What a feast, hmmm?\n\nI'm so glad you could celebrate the spirit of Pilgrim's Bounty with us."}
Q[14074]={d="银色北伐军派遣了一艘装满美味肉食和其它给养品的快船前来比武场援助我们，但那艘船永远也不能到达了。我们的巡逻兵说曾发现那艘船遭到了克瓦迪尔的攻击。那些恐怖的维库人强盗已经在海上犯下了无数罪行。\n\n他们杀死了那艘船的船员，将船上的货物抢到了一座被称为洛斯加尔登陆点的岛上。如果你向北方眺望，你就能看到那座岛屿被笼罩在迷雾中的影子。你愿意帮助我们夺回那些被抢走的物资吗？如果没有那些陆行鸟腿作为我们的食物补充，我们很快就会饿肚子了。",dEN="The Argent Crusade dispatched a fast ship carrying tallstrider meat and other supplies for us here at the tournament grounds, but it never arrived. Scouts reported seeing it attacked by the kvaldir, fearsome vrykul raiders who roam the seas.\n\nThey've slain the crew and taken the cargo to an island called Hrothgar's Landing. If you look to the north, you can see it shrouded in the mist. Would you help us in recovering the stolen supplies? Without those tallstrider legs, we'll soon be out of food.",o="夺回10条被偷走的陆行鸟腿，交给银色比武场的纳莱丝·晨雪。",oEN="Recover 10 Stolen Tallstrider Legs for Narasi Snowdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能取回失窃的补给品吗？",pEN="Were you able to recover any of the missing supplies?",c="这些腿看来有点损伤，但还可以吃。北伐军知道我们取回了些船上的货物一定会很高兴的。",cEN="These look a little worse for wear, but they're still edible. The crusaders will be glad to hear that we've managed to recover some of the ship's cargo."}
Q[14076]={d="现在，演武场已经完成，银色北伐军请求我们帮忙照看那些将要和勇士们作战的怪兽。\n\n这其中，巨大冰虫的饲料也许是最奇怪的。如果喂它们吃同类的卵，他们就会变得更强大，而最优质的卵来自于深土冰虫。\n\n带上这只鼓，到风暴峭壁中心处的山底平原去，在那里的雪堆附近把鼓敲响，唤醒深土冰虫，然后消灭它们，并收集它们的卵鞘。",dEN="Now that the coliseum is complete, the Argent Crusade has asked us to help look after the creatures that champions will be fighting.\n\nThe giant jormungar have perhaps the strangest diet; they grow strong by eating the eggs of their own kind and the best eggs come from deep jormungar.\n\nTake this drum to the Foot Steppes in central Storm Peaks and play them near the snow mounds you see there. Rouse the deep jormungar, kill them, and gather their egg sacs.",o="取得4只冰虫的卵鞘，将它们交给银色比武场的萨雯妮娅·慧歌。",oEN="Acquire 4 Jormungar Egg Sacs and bring them to Savinia Loresong at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你取回那些虫卵了吗？如果不再快点喂食，它们就会开始吃训练员了。",pEN="Were you able to get those eggs? Those worms will start eating their handlers if they're not fed soon.",c="干得好，<name>。我马上把这些送给银色北伐军的看守者。他们将不得不承认，为了让竞技场顺利运转，我们做的远比夺日者多得多。",cEN="Well done, <name>. I'll take these to the Argent Crusade's keepers right away. They'll have no choice but to acknowledge that we're doing far more than the Sunreavers to keep the coliseum running smoothly."}
Q[14077]={d="我听神官帕尔崔丝讲过了。我要告诉你，她的话让我深思良久。与十字军并肩战斗是不够的，我们必须担负起他们的任务。\n\n在北方海岸的洛斯加尔登陆点发生了一桩血案。克瓦迪尔海盗们攻入一处古老的海象人居民区，将那里的村民屠杀殆尽。带上这本书，在那些村民的尸体旁边诵读书中的悼文。这样能让他们的灵魂离开那座被迷雾环绕的岛屿，得到最后的安息。",dEN="I've been listening to Confessor Paletress speak, and I must tell you, her words have given me much to consider. It is not enough to fight beside the crusaders; we must take up their mission.\n\nOff the north coast is Hrothgar's Landing, where the seagoing Kvaldir have overrun an old tuskarr settlement and slain the villagers. Take this book and read the rites for the dead near the corpses of the villagers. It will allow their spirits to escape the mists engulfing the island and find peace.",o="使用神官的祈祷书，为8位被屠戮的图亚里克村民举行追悼仪式，然后返回银色比武场，去见纳莱丝·晨雪。",oEN="Use the Confessor's Prayer Book to perform last rites for 8 Slain Tualiq Villagers and then return to Narasi Snowdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你安抚了被杀的图亚里克村民的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Have you seen to the spirits of the slain Tualiq villagers?",c="<纳莱丝从你那接过祈祷书。>\n\n谢谢你。这本书是银色神官帕尔崔丝的礼物。她会很欣慰地知道你用这本书让死者获得安息。",cEN="<Narasi accepts the prayer book from you.>\n\nThank you. The book was a gift from Confessor Paletress herself. She would be honored to know that you have used it to bring tranquility to the slain."}
Q[14079]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由兰达尔·亨特派发出来的。\n\n你可以在艾尔文森林的东谷伐木场找到他，那里就在暴风城向东大道的路旁。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Randal Hunter.\n\nRandal can be found at Elwynn Forest's Eastvale Logging Camp, along the road east out of Stormwind.",o="将这本小册子交还给艾尔文森林东谷伐木场的兰达尔·亨特。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Randal Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14080]={d="那些恐怖的维库人强盗克瓦迪尔袭击我们的运输队，又对一座北方岛屿上的海象人居民进行了屠杀，并把那座岛重新命名为洛斯加尔登陆点。如果让他们在那里站稳脚跟，我们无疑会成为他们的下一个目标。\n\n北伐军为了抵抗天灾军团已经倾尽全力。而我们必须守住比武场。一直向北飞行，到达那座岛屿，消灭那里的克瓦迪尔，不要让他们将那里的一切尽数毁灭。",dEN="The Kvaldir, fearsome vrykul raiders, have disrupted our shipments and murdered the tuskarr inhabitants of an island to the north, renaming it Hrothgar's Landing. If they are allowed to get a foothold there, there is no doubt that we will be their next target.\n\nThe crusade's forces have their hands full dealing with the Scourge, and we must defend the tournament grounds. Fly north from the grounds until you reach the island and take on the Kvaldir before they can destroy anything else.",o="银色比武场的纳莱丝·晨雪想让你消灭10名克瓦迪尔。",oEN="Narasi Snowdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Kvaldir.",p="你向克瓦迪尔展现绝不受他们威胁的决心了吗？",pEN="Have you shown the Kvaldir that we will not let them threaten us?",c="当夺日者还在忙于磨亮他们的宝剑时，你的行动展现了我们是银色北伐军的最佳伙伴。",cEN="Your actions have shown that we stand as one with the Argent Crusade, while the Sunreavers are too busy preening to take up their blades."}
Q[14081]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由佩拉斯卡米派发出来的。\n\n你可以在苏伦的养殖场找到佩拉斯卡米。那里就在银月城的牧羊人之门东南方向。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Perascamin.\n\nPerascamin can be found at Thuron's Livery, southeast of the Shepherd's Gate leaving Silvermoon City.",o="将这本小册子交还给银月城苏伦的养殖场的佩拉斯卡米。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Perascamin at Thuron's Livery in Silvermoon City.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14082]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由埃亚伦派发出来的。\n\n你可以在秘蓝岛转至埃索达的入口处找到埃亚伦。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Aalun.\n\nAalun can be found at the entrance to the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",o="将这本小册子交给秘蓝岛上的埃亚伦。",oEN="Return this pamphlet to Aalun outside the Exodar on Azuremyst Isle.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14083]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由奥萨姆·铁角派发出来的。\n\n你可以在丹莫罗的冻石农场找到奥萨姆。那里就在铁炉堡向东的大道旁边。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Ultham Ironhorn.\n\nUltham can be found at the Amberstill Ranch in Dun Morogh, found along the road east out of Ironforge.",o="将这本小册子交给丹莫罗冻石农场的奥萨姆·铁角。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Ultham Ironhorn at Amberstill Ranch in Dun Morogh.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14084]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由宾吉·羽哨派发出来的。\n\n你可以在钢架补给站找到宾吉，那里就在丹莫罗的卡拉诺斯东北方。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Binjy Featherwhistle.\n\nBinjy can be found at Steelgrill's Depot, just northeast of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",o="将这本小册子交给丹莫罗钢架补给站的宾吉·羽哨。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Binjy Featherwhistle at Steelgrill's Depot in Dun Morogh.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14085]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由贾萨姆派发出来的。\n\n你可以在达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥区找到贾萨姆。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Jartsam.\n\nJartsam can be found at the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus.",o="将这本小册子交给达纳苏斯塞纳里奥区的贾萨姆。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Jartsam at the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14086]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由基尔达派发出来的。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷找到基尔达。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Kildar.\n\nKildar can be found in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.",o="将这本小册子交给奥格瑞玛荣耀谷的基尔达。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14087]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由卡尔·雷歌派发出来的。\n\n你可以在莫高雷的血蹄村找到卡尔·雷歌。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Kar Stormsinger.\n\nKar can be found in Mulgore's Bloodhoof Village.",o="将这本小册子交给莫高雷血蹄村的卡尔·雷歌。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Kar Stormsinger at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14088]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由克萨尔迪派发出来的。\n\n你可以在南杜隆塔尔的森金村找到克萨尔迪。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Xar'Ti.\n\nXar'Ti can be found at Sen'jin Village in southern Durotar.",o="将这本小册子交还给杜隆塔尔南面森金村的克萨尔迪。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Xar'Ti at Sen'jin Village in southern Durotar.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14089]={d="这本关于骑乘训练和坐骑购买的广告小册子是由维尔玛·瓦纳姆派发出来的。\n\n你可以在提瑞斯法林地的布瑞尔找到他。",dEN="This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Velma Warnam.\n\nVelma can be found at Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",o="将这本小册子交给提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔的维尔玛。",oEN="Return the pamphlet to Velma Warnam at Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="啊，你收到了我的信？很好。",pEN="Ah, you received my letter? Good.",c="我们可以开始你的初级骑术训练了吗？",cEN="So, shall we begin your Apprentice Riding training?"}
Q[14090]={d="我的两名部下在抓捕猛犸人穿刺者戈莫克的行动中丧生了。而那头怪物还在四处横行。他连续几个小时高声嗥叫，只是因为它找不到他喜欢的那个狗头人。\n\n如果银色北伐军不想在演武场中使用这头怪物，我会亲手把它杀了。不过，现在我们也许应该先给它找些玩具。拿上这张网，到风暴峭壁东南方的加姆雷区去。那里就在K3的东北方。在那里抓住一些狗头人。圣光保佑，但愿你能找到那头怪物喜欢的狗头人。",dEN="Two of my men have already been killed trying to confine the magnataur called Gormok the Impaler, yet the creature still rages. It howls for hours about being without its favorite snobold.\n\nIf the Argent Crusade didn't wish to use this monster in the coliseum, I'd slay it myself. Perhaps it's time to bring the beast its playthings. Take this net and travel to Garm's Bane in southeast Storm Peaks. It's just northeast of K3. Capture some of those snobolds and pray to the Light you've found the right one.",o="使用强化渔网抓住8个雪盲追随者，并把它们交给银色比武场的萨雯妮娅·慧歌。",oEN="Use the Weighted Net to capture 8 Snowblind Followers and bring them to Savinia Loresong at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你捕捉到那些极地狗头人了吗？戈莫克的怒气丝毫未减",pEN="Have you managed to round up those snobolds yet? Gormok's anger shows no signs of lessening.",c="快把这些臭东西从我的眼前拿走并丢进笼子里，省得我心烦。我希望银色北伐军把照顾这些生物的差事丢给夺日者。他们长得太像了，应当能轻易的了解彼此。",cEN="The sooner we get these stinking things out of my sight and into their cage, the faster my mood will improve. I wish the Argent Crusade had given the Sunreavers the care of this creature. They're enough alike that they ought to be able to understand each other."}
Q[14092]={d="现在，演武场已经完成，银色北伐军请求我们帮忙照看那些将要和勇士们作战的怪兽。\n\n这其中，巨大冰虫的饲料也许是最奇怪的。如果喂它们吃同族的卵，他们就会变得更强大，而最优质的卵来自于深土冰虫。\n\n带上这只鼓，到风暴峭壁中心处的山底平原去，在那里的雪堆附近把鼓敲响，鼓声会唤醒深土冰虫。消灭它们，并收集它们的卵鞘。然后再回到比武场来。",dEN="Now that the coliseum is complete, the Argent Crusade has asked us to help look after the creatures that champions will be fighting.\n\nThe giant jormungar have perhaps the strangest diet; they grow strong by eating the eggs of their own kind and the best eggs come from deep jormungar.\n\nTake this drum to the Foot Steppes in central Storm Peaks and play them near the snow mounds you see there. The sound will rouse the deep jormungar. Kill them, collect their egg sacs, and return to the tournament grounds.",o="取得4只冰虫的卵鞘，将它们交给银色比武场的泰罗斯·晨行者。",oEN="Acquire 4 Jormungar Egg Sacs and bring them to Tylos Dawnrunner at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你取回那些虫卵了吗？没有喂食的巨大的冰虫会变得很暴躁。",pEN="Were you able to get those eggs? The jormungar are going to get nasty if they don't get fed.",c="我会让北伐军知道当银色盟约还在枯坐时，你已经带回了一批新鲜的食物了。",cEN="I'll let the crusaders know that you've just returned with a fresh load of food while the Silver Covenant was sitting on its heels."}
Q[14095]={d="从死亡的海怪身上找到的一颗完整的牙齿，这实在是一个稀有的发现。北伐军战士希瓦多恩一定会想要看看它的。",dEN="A whole tooth from a dead Kraken is a rare find indeed. Crusader Silverdawn will want to see this.",o="带上海怪的牙齿作为你胜利的证明，去见北伐军战士希瓦多恩。",oEN="Take the Kraken Tooth to Crusader Silverdawn as proof of your victory.",c="我就知道海怪不是你的对手。没有海怪拦截船只后，那些克瓦迪尔就只剩撤退这条路了。勇士，做得好！",cEN="I knew that Kraken was not a match for the likes of you. Without that Kraken disrupting those boats, those Kvaldir will have no choice but to retreat. Great job, Champion!"}
Q[14096]={d="北伐军战士库尔又一次陷入了麻烦，只是这次遇到麻烦的不止他一个人。当他看到那些异教徒在比武场西边的亡语者岗哨扎下营地的时候，他就召集了一批候选者，向那里发动了突击。\n\n但他们很快就陷入了孤立无援的状态，成为异教徒的俘虏。如果我们不能尽快把他们救出来，异教徒肯定会把他们献祭给他们的邪神。任何一名异教徒都有可能带着他们的黑色牢笼钥匙。找到他们身上的钥匙，救出库尔和我们被俘虏的候选者。",dEN="Crusader Kul has gone and gotten himself into trouble again, only this time he's not alone. When he saw the cultists making camp at Deathspeaker's Watch, west of the tournament grounds, Kul gathered the aspirants for an assault.\n\nWithout reinforcements, Kul and his followers were easily captured. I have no doubt that the cult will sacrifice the prisoners unless we can mount a rescue. Any of those cultists could carry keys to the black cages. Find the keys and free Kul and the captive aspirants.",o="在亡语者岗哨援救鲁莽的库尔和4名被俘虏的候选者，然后返回银色比武场，去见纳莱丝·晨雪。",oEN="Rescue Kul the Reckless and 4 Captive Aspirants from Deathspeaker's Watch and return to Narasi Snowdawn at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你救出库尔和那些没指望的参赛者了吗？",pEN="Did you free Kul and those hopeless aspirants?",c="感谢你，让库尔和勇士们活着回到对抗天灾军团的行列。第一次救出库尔已经是很久以前的事了。我只希望北伐军能为他的热忱找到一个发泄渠道，好过于让他把他的坏习惯传给那些容易受影响的年轻勇士。",cEN="Thanks to you, Kul and the aspirants will live fight the Scourge again. That's far from the first time someone's had to save Kul from himself. My only hope is that the crusaders can find a better outlet for his enthusiasm than allowing him to impart all of his bad habits to impressionable young aspirants."}
Q[14101]={d="那些在海上横行霸道的维库人，也就是那些克瓦迪尔们四处抢劫船只，袭击沿海居民地。他们刚刚袭击了北方海峡对面的一座海象人岛屿。率领他们的是一个叫德罗丁·洛斯加尔的惯匪，他正图谋控制这片海域。\n\n只要有他存在，我们的船货和运输队就永远也不会安全。那样，我们就会被困死在这里，只能寄希望于巫妖王的”仁慈“了。\n\n带上这支被我们缴获的克瓦迪尔战斗号角，到洛斯加尔登陆点东北部的海象人雕像阵去，用它向那名克瓦迪尔首领发起挑战。",dEN="The kvaldir, seafaring vrykul who raid ships and coastal settlements, have overrun a tuskarr island across the strait to the north. Their leader is a veteran raider, Drottinn Hrothgar, who seeks to control these seas.\n\nWith him in power, our shipments and troop transports will never be safe. We will be stranded here at the Lich King's mercy.\n\nTake this captured kvaldir war horn to the circle of tuskarr statues on the northeastern part of Hrothgar's Landing and use it to challenge the kvaldir leader.",o="银色比武场的高阶十字军艾德拉德希望你去击败德罗丁·洛斯加尔。",oEN="High Crusader Adelard at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to defeat Drottinn Hrothgar.",c="多廷的败亡将会使克瓦迪尔群龙无首，这给了我们时间来善用我们的优势。北伐军和联赛欠你一次，勇士。",cEN="The defeat of the drottinn will set the kvaldir to fighting amongst themselves, buying us time to use our advantage. The crusade and the tournament are in your debt, champion."}
Q[14102]={d="克瓦迪尔已经回到了诺森德的海岸，如果对他们的行动不加以阻止，他们一定会夺走我们的辎重给养，阻挠我们的援军及时到达。在他们之中有一个名叫唤雾者伊戈瓦尔的正驻扎在洛斯加尔登陆点西侧的一座岩洞里。在那里，他操纵海雾来隐藏克瓦迪尔和其手下的海兽。\n\n带上这个符咒，穿过比武场北部海滩转至洛斯加尔登陆点。寻找唤雾者的洞穴，使用这个符咒使他现身。",dEN="The Kvaldir have returned to the coasts of Northrend and if left unchecked, they will prevent our supplies and reinforcements from arriving. One of them, known as Mistcaller Yngvar, has taken up residence in a cave on the western side of Hrothgar's Landing. There, he manipulates the mists to conceal the Kvaldir and the sea beasts they command.\n\nTake this charm and travel across the strait north of the tournament grounds, to Hrothgar's Landing. Find the mistcaller's cave and use the charm to reveal him.",o="银色比武场的高阶十字军艾德拉德希望你能消灭唤雾者伊戈瓦尔。",oEN="High Crusader Adelard at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill Mistcaller Yngvar.",c="你替我们争取到了宝贵的时间来对抗克瓦迪尔并从这些害虫的手中解放这片海域。银色北伐军又欠了你一次。",cEN="You have bought us valuable time to move against the Kvaldir and free the seas of these pests. Once again, the Argent Crusade is in your debt."}
Q[14104]={d="疤面者奥诺夫是一个可怕的强盗。在克瓦迪尔一族之中，他以善于袭击和劫掠船只而着称。他和他的爪牙乘着伯尔之怒号不断地攻击我们的船只，偷窃我们的物资。\n\n另外，奥诺夫还参与了克瓦迪尔对北方一座海象人岛屿的大屠杀。他们在杀光了岛上的居民以后，还把那座岛重新命名为洛斯加尔登陆点。现在他的船就停泊在那座岛屿港口的最东端。带上这面被我们缴获来的旗帜，将它在他的船上打开，这样就能引诱他出来和你正面交战了。",dEN="Ornolf the Scarred is a fearsome raider renowned among his Kvaldir brethren for raiding and capturing ships. From aboard Bor's Fury, he and his crew attack our ships and steal our goods.\n\nOrnolf and his men are among those who slaughtered the inhabitants of a tuskarr island to the north and renamed it Hrothgar's Landing. His ship sits at anchor at the eastern end of the island's harbor. Take this captured banner and display it on his ship to provoke him into facing you in battle.",o="银色比武场的高阶十字军艾德拉德希望你能消灭疤面者奥诺夫。",oEN="High Crusader Adelard at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill Ornolf the Scarred.",c="奥诺夫的船员一定会为他们的船长报仇，但失去了奥诺夫，他们将不堪一击。我们得继续完成任务，以目睹冰冠冰川从天灾军团及其它的邪恶势力中解放。",cEN="Ornolf's crew will want to avenge their leader, but without him, they will be easier to defeat. We must live to carry out our mission, to see Icecrown rid of the Scourge and other evils."}
Q[14105]={d="诅咒教派大幅度加强了对我们的攻击力量，誓要置我们于死地。他们的行动也随之越来越猖獗了。现在，他们将力量集中在了位于比武场西侧山脊上的亡语者岗哨。\n\n残酷的亡语者卡罗斯命令他的部下在那里筑起坚固的工事，准备以他们的全部力量对我们发动突击。\n\n我的战士们已经做好了浴血奋战，保卫这片土地的准备，但我更需要像你这样的勇士，$n。你要领导我们的防御战斗。你的任务是找到亡语者卡罗斯，并消灭他。",dEN="The Cult of the Damned has redoubled its efforts to see us destroyed. They have grown bold and are massing their strength at Deathspeaker's Watch on the ridge west of the tournament grounds.\n\nThe ruthless Deathspeaker Kharos has his men fortifying their positions, preparing to unleash all of the cult's weapons.\n\nMy men are preparing themselves and the valiants to defend the grounds, but I want champions like you, <name>, to lead our efforts to blunt the attack. Find Deathspeaker Kharos and slay him.",o="银色比武场的高阶十字军艾德拉德想让你消灭亡语者卡罗斯。",oEN="High Crusader Adelard at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants to you kill Deathspeaker Kharos.",c="你真是所有聚集在我们旗帜下之人的榜样，<name>。我们将一起向天灾军团证明，我们绝不会被打败。",cEN="You are truly an example to all who have gathered beneath our banner, <name>. Together, we will show the Scourge that we will not be defeated."}
Q[14107]={d="银色北伐军正在冰冠冰川艰苦地与巫妖王作战。我们的敌人却图谋利用死者的力量攻击我们。\n\n那些灵魂在比武场西南方，奥尔杜萨和铁墙壁垒之间的陨落英雄之谷游荡。那里散布着被丢弃的灵魂水晶。收集那些灵魂水晶，用这件受到圣光祝福的圣物给予那些灵魂最终的安息。他们不应该再遭受折磨了。",dEN="The Argent Crusade is hardly the first force to challenge the Lich King. Our enemy turns spirits of the fallen against us.\n\nTheir spirits wander the Valley of Fallen Heroes, southwest of the grounds and between Aldur'thar and the Ironwall Rampart. The area is littered with discarded soul crystals, used by the Scourge to control the spirits. Gather those soul crystals and use them with this Light-blessed relic to bestow the blessing of peace upon the spirits. They have more than earned their rest.",o="北伐军战士希瓦多恩希望你让6位死去英雄的灵魂得到安息。",oEN="Crusader Silverdawn wants you to bring peace to 6 Fallen Hero's Spirits.",p="你让那些阵亡英雄之灵获得安息了吗？",pEN="Have you brought peace to the spirits of the fallen heroes?",c="你为我们倒下的同胞做了件大好事，也免得我们再次在战场上面对他们。随着我们对抗天灾军团的战役推进，我不禁思考起自己的命运。\n\n如果我倒下了，<name>，我希望有个像你这样的人为我做你今天为阵亡者灵魂所做的一切。我无法忍受逼迫自己的弟兄一次又一次杀死我的念头。",cEN="You have done our fallen brethren a great service and spared us the need to face them again on the field of battle. As our campaign against the Scourge progresses, I find myself thinking about my own fate.\n\nShould I fall, <name>, I would want someone like you to do for me what you have done for the spirits of the fallen this day. I could not bear the thought of forcing my own brothers to slay me again and again."}
Q[14108]={d="夺日者和银色盟约派船北上，在赫罗斯加登陆点迎战克瓦迪尔，却被一艘克瓦迪尔劫掠船拦截扣留。更糟的是，克瓦迪尔找到了召唤潜伏在北海之下的可怕海怪的方法。如果船上有人要活着出来，就必须赶走那只海怪，并打断克瓦迪尔的召唤仪式。\n\n$gCruzado:Cruzada;，拿起这些长枪，一只银色角鹰兽会带你投入战斗。",dEN="The Sunreavers and Silver Covenant sent ships north to engage the Kvaldir at Hrothgar's Landing, but were intercepted and detained by a Kvaldir Raiding vessel. To make matters worse, the Kvaldir have found a way to call forth the dreaded Kraken that lives beneath the North Sea. If anyone on board is to get out alive, that Kraken must be driven away and the Kvaldir's summoning ritual ... disrupted.\n\nCrusader, take these spears and an Argent Hippogryph will take you to the battle.",o="北伐军战士希瓦多恩想让你骑乘一头银色角鹰兽，向北海海怪投射6根烈焰长矛，并除掉3个克瓦迪尔深渊呼唤者。\n\n你可以在比武场的银色北伐军大帐外找到那头银色角鹰兽。",oEN="Crusader Silverdawn wants you to mount an Argent Hippogryph, throw 6 Flaming Spears at the North Sea Kraken and take out 3 Vrykul Deepcallers.\n\nYou can find the Argent Hippogryphs right outside the Argent Crusade tent at the Tournament Grounds.",p="你驱退海怪没？快点，北伐军！我们没有多少时间。",pEN="Have you driven away the Kraken yet? Hurry, Crusader! There isn't much time.",c="北伐军，你替那些水手争取到了逃生的时间。也许下次银色盟约和夺日者在冲向敌人前会先听从命令。",cEN="Crusader, you may have bought those sailors just enough time to escape, Maybe next time, those Silver Covenant and Sunreavers will listen before running head first at the enemy."}
Q[14112]={d="北伐军抓住了一头雪人，他们称那头雪人为冰吼。那头雪人将参与演武场的战斗。而我们的任务就是训练并喂养他。\n\n我推荐十字军应该把一些过剩的夺日者喂给雪人吃，但北伐军对此丝毫不感兴趣。这头怪兽喜欢鲨鱼肉。所以我希望你能够飞行到银锋号。它就漂浮在北方的那道海峡里。从那艘船上的桶中取得一些新鲜的鱼饵，然后把鱼饵撒进海中，把鲨鱼引出来。",dEN="The crusaders have captured a yeti that they're calling Icehowl. He's to be a participant in the coliseum battles and we've been asked to help with his training and upkeep.\n\nThe crusaders weren't fond of my suggestion that we feed the beast surplus Sunreavers. The creature has a predilection for shark meat, so I want you to fly down to the Silver Blade, floating in the strait to the north. Get some fresh chum from one of the buckets on the boat, then spread it in the water to attract sharks.",o="银色比武场的萨雯妮娅·慧歌想让你带给她3块北海鲨鱼肉。",oEN="Savinia Loresong at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring her 3 pieces of North Sea Shark Meat.",p="我希望你有东西能喂冰吼，要不然我真的得去带几个夺日者去他的牢笼。",pEN="I hope you have something to feed Icehowl, otherwise I really will start bringing Sunreavers down to his cage.",c="我很高兴我们终于解决了这件事。这不是这世界上最光荣的事，但在我们成为银色北伐军的伙伴时，我们承诺绝不抱怨的完成他们的要求。当然，相同的承诺不可能由夺日者的口中说出。",cEN="I'm glad we've gotten that done. It's not the most glorious task in the world, but when we partnered with the Argent Crusade, we promised to do all they asked of us without complaint. Of course, the same cannot be said of the Sunreavers."}
Q[14136]={d="克瓦迪尔人在北方小岛洛斯加尔登陆点创建了营地。我们派遣了船长埃尔萨斯·炎鹰转至那一地区。但他的船却遇到了一群正在向比武场进军的克瓦迪尔海盗！现在炎鹰号正遭受到远多于他数倍的敌人进攻。赶快到那里去，让克瓦迪尔人知道，攻击夺日者是多么愚蠢的行为。\n\n炎鹰号就在破海者航道的西侧，也就是北方的洛斯加尔登陆点和比武场之间。",dEN="The Kvaldir have set up camp at Hrothgar's Landing, the small island to the North. We sent Captain Aerthas Firehawk to the area, but they ran into a Kvaldir Raiding party heading to the Tournament Grounds! The Firehawk is now under attack by the raiders and is vastly outnumbered. Get out there and show those Kvaldir why attacking the Sunreavers is a poor plan indeed.\n\nThe Firehawk is between Hrothgar's Landing to the north and the Tournament Grounds, on the western side of The Sea Reaver's Run.",o="银色比武场的身经百战的吉莱娜要你在炎鹰号上消灭8名克瓦迪尔狂暴者和3名克瓦迪尔持戟者。",oEN="Girana the Blooded at the Argent Tournament Grounds would like you to kill 8 Kvaldir Berserkers and 3 Kvaldir Harpooners aboard The Firehawk.",p="你成功守住火鹰号了吗？",pEN="Have you helped fend off the Kvaldir attack?",c="做得好，勇士。战斗仍未结束，但现在克瓦迪尔学到了我们绝不宽恕这种袭击。",cEN="Great job, Champion. The fight continues, but now the Kvaldir know that we do not tolerate such attacks."}
Q[14140]={d="那些恐怖的维库人强盗克瓦迪尔袭击我们的运输队，又对一座北方岛屿上的海象人居民进行了屠杀，并把那座岛重新命名为洛斯加尔登陆点。如果让他们在那里站稳脚跟，我们无疑会成为他们的下一个目标。\n\n北伐军为了抵抗天灾军团已经倾尽全力。而我们必须守住比武场。一直向北飞行，到达那座岛屿，消灭那里的克瓦迪尔，不要让他们将那里的一切尽数毁灭。",dEN="The Kvaldir, fearsome vrykul raiders, have disrupted our shipments and murdered the tuskarr inhabitants of an island to the north, renaming it Hrothgar's Landing. If they are allowed to get a foothold there, there is no doubt that we will be their next target.\n\nThe crusade's forces have their hands full dealing with the Scourge, and we must defend the tournament grounds. Fly north from the grounds until you reach the island and take on the Kvaldir before they can destroy anything else.",o="银色比武场的身经百战的吉莱娜想让你消灭10名克瓦迪尔。",oEN="Giranan the Blooded at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to kill 10 Kvaldir.",p="你向克瓦迪尔展现绝不让他们威胁到我们的决心了吗？",pEN="Have you shown the Kvaldir that we will not let them threaten us?",c="你的行动展现了我们夺日者对银色北伐军而言是远比银色盟约还要好的同盟，而那是我们的荣幸。",cEN="Your actions have shown that we Sunreavers are far better allies to the Argent Crusade than the Silver Covenant and it is we who will be triumphant."}
Q[14141]={d="我的两名部下在抓捕猛犸人穿刺者戈莫克的行动中丧生了。而那头怪物还在四处横行。他连续几个小时高声嗥叫，只是因为它找不到他喜欢的那个狗头人。\n\n如果银色北伐军不想在演武场中使用这头怪物，我会亲手把它杀了。不过，现在我们也许应该先给它找些玩具。拿上这张网，到风暴峭壁东南方的加姆雷区去。那里就在K3的东北方。在那里抓住一些狗头人。圣光保佑，但愿你能找到那头怪物喜欢的狗头人。",dEN="Two of my men have already been killed trying to confine the magnataur called Gormok the Impaler, yet the creature still rages. It howls for hours about being without its favorite snobold.\n\nIf the Argent Crusade didn't wish to use this monster in the coliseum, I'd slay it myself. Perhaps it's time to bring the beast its playthings. Take this net and travel to Garm's Bane in southeast Storm Peaks. It's just northeast of K3. Capture some of those snobolds and pray to the Light you've found the right one.",o="使用强化渔网抓住8个雪盲追随者，并把它们交给银色比武场的泰罗斯·晨行者。",oEN="Use the Weighted Net to capture 8 Snowblind Followers and bring them to Tylos Dawnrunner at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你捕捉到那些极地狗头人了吗？戈莫克的怒气丝毫未减。",pEN="Have you managed to round up those snobolds yet? Gormok's anger shows no signs of lessening.",c="快把这些臭东西从我的眼前拿走并丢进笼子里，省得我心烦。我希望银色北伐军把照顾这些生物的差事丢给银色盟约。当冰冠堡垒的战斗开始后他们将会证明自己只是个外强中干的装饰品而只配做这种下贱的小事。",cEN="The sooner we get these stinking things out of my sight and into their cage, the faster my mood will improve. I wish the Argent Crusade had given the Silver Covenant the care of this creature. They're going to have to get their hands dirty when the battle for Icecrown Citadel starts and I have a feeling they'll prove fragile and fussy allies."}
Q[14142]={d="北伐军战士库尔又给自己惹上麻烦了，只不过这次他不是一个人。当他看到教徒们在锦标赛场地以西的亡语者哨站扎营时，库尔召集参赛者们发起了进攻。\n\n他们轻易就被俘虏了，如今库尔在营地平台上的笼子里腐烂。我毫不怀疑，如果我们不去营救，教派会把这些俘虏献祭。那些教徒中任何一个都可能带着打开黑色笼子的钥匙。找到钥匙，释放库尔和被俘的参赛者。|n",dEN="Crusader Kul has gone and gotten himself into trouble again, only this time he's not alone. When he saw the cultists making camp at Deathspeaker's Watch, west of the tourney grounds, Kul gathered the aspirants for an attack.\n\nThey were easily captured, and now Kul languishes in a cage on the platform in the camp. I am sure that the cult will sacrifice the prisoners unless we can rescue them. Any of those cultists could carry keys to the black cages. Find the keys and free Kul and the captive aspirants.",o="在亡语者岗哨援救鲁莽的库尔和4名被俘虏的候选者，然后返回银色比武场，去见身经百战的吉莱娜。",oEN="Rescue Kul the Reckless and 4 Captive Aspirants from Deathspeaker's Watch and return to Girana the Blooded at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你救出库尔和那些没指望的参赛者了吗？",pEN="Did you free Kul and those hopeless aspirants?",c="库尔又再次的让自己丢脸了。某人第一次救出库尔已经是很久以前的事了。就是有像他这样的人，也难怪大部分的银色盟约勇士都是这种习性。",cEN="Kul will live to embarrass himself again. That's far from the first time someone's had to save Kul from himself. With examples like him, it's no wonder most of the aspirants are taking up the habits of the Silver Covenant."}
Q[14143]={d="银色北伐军派遣了一艘装满美味肉食和其它给养品的快船前来比武场援助我们，但那艘船永远也不能到达了。我们的巡逻兵说曾发现那艘船遭到了克瓦迪尔的攻击。那些恐怖的维库人强盗已经在海上犯下了无数罪行。\n\n他们杀死了那艘船的船员，将船上的货物抢到了一座被称为洛斯加尔登陆点的岛上。如果你向北方眺望，你就能看到那座岛屿被笼罩在迷雾中的影子。你愿意帮助我们夺回那些被抢走的物资吗？如果没有那些陆行鸟腿作为我们的食物补充，我们很快就会饿肚子了。",dEN="The Argent Crusade dispatched a fast ship carrying tallstrider meat and other supplies for us here at the tournament grounds, but it never arrived. Scouts reported seeing it attacked by the kvaldir, fearsome vrykul raiders who roam the seas.\n\nThey've slain the crew and taken the cargo to an island called Hrothgar's Landing. If you look to the north, you can see it shrouded in the mist. Would you help us in recovering the stolen supplies? Without those tallstrider legs, we'll soon be out of food.",o="夺回10条被偷走的陆行鸟腿，交给银色比武场的身经百战的吉莱娜。",oEN="Recover 10 Stolen Tallstrider Legs for Girana the Blooded at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你能取回失窃的补给品吗。",pEN="Were you able to recover any of the missing supplies?",c="这些腿看来有点损伤，但还可以吃。北伐军知道我们成功取回部分货物一定会很高兴的。也许我们可以把这些已经吃一半的食物拿给银色盟约。那会让我心情愉快一整天。",cEN="These look a little worse for wear, but they're still edible. The crusaders will be glad to hear that we've had some success. Maybe we can give the half-eaten ones to the Silver Covenant. That would make my day."}
Q[14144]={d="我听神官帕尔崔丝讲过了。我要告诉你，她的话让我深思良久。与十字军并肩战斗是不够的，我们必须担负起他们的任务。\n\n在北方海岸的洛斯加尔登陆点发生了一桩血案。克瓦迪尔海盗们攻入一处古老的海象人居民区，将那里的村民屠杀殆尽。带上这本书，在那些村民的尸体旁边诵读书中的悼文。这样能让他们的灵魂离开那座被迷雾环绕的岛屿，得到最后的安息。",dEN="I've been listening to Confessor Paletress speak, and I must tell you, her words have made me think. We fight beside the crusaders, but we can learn from them, too.\n\nOff the north coast is Hrothgar's Landing, where the seagoing Kvaldir have overrun an old tuskarr settlement and slain the villagers. Take this book and read the rites for the dead near the corpses of the villagers. It will allow their spirits to escape the mists engulfing the island and find peace.",o="使用神官的祈祷书，为8位被屠戮的图亚里克村民举行追悼仪式，然后返回银色比武场，去见身经百战的吉莱娜。",oEN="Use the Confessor's Prayer Book to perform last rites for 8 Slain Tualiq Villagers and then return to Girana the Blooded at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你安抚了被杀的图亚里克村民的灵魂了吗？",pEN="Have you seen to the spirits of the slain Tualiq villagers?",c="<吉拉纳从你那接过祈祷书。>\n\n谢谢你。我们并不是每件事都与北伐军取得共识，但这些日子我向银色神官帕尔崔丝学了很多。",cEN="<Girana accepts the prayer book from you.>\n\nThank you. We don't always see eye-to-eye with the crusaders, but I've learned a lot from Confessor Paletress in my time here."}
Q[14145]={d="北伐军抓住了一头雪人，他们称那头雪人为冰吼。那头雪人将参与演武场的战斗。而我们的任务就是训练并喂养他。\n\n我推荐十字军应该把一些银色盟约的成员喂给雪人吃，但北伐军对此丝毫不感兴趣。这头怪兽喜欢鲨鱼肉。所以我希望你能够飞行到血色黎明号。它就漂浮在北方的那道海峡里。从那艘船上的桶中取得一些新鲜的鱼饵，然后把鱼饵撒进海中，把鲨鱼引出来。",dEN="The crusaders have captured a yeti that they're calling Icehowl. He's to be a participant in the coliseum battles and we've been asked to help with his training and upkeep.\n\nThe crusaders weren't fond of my suggestion that we feed some Silver Covenant members to the beast. The creature prefers shark meat, so I want you to fly down to the Crimson Dawn, floating in the strait to the north. Get some fresh chum from one of the buckets on the boat, then spread it in the water to attract sharks.",o="银色比武场的泰罗斯·晨行者想让你带给她3块北海鲨鱼肉。",oEN="Tylos Dawnrunner at the Argent Tournament Grounds wants you to bring him 3 pieces of North Sea Shark Meat.",p="我希望你有东西能喂冰吼，要不然我真的得去带几个银色盟约成员去他的牢笼。",pEN="I hope you have something to feed Icehowl, otherwise I really will start bringing Silver Covenant members down to his cage.",c="我很高兴我们终于解决了这件事。这不是这世界上最光荣的事，但在我们成为银色北伐军的伙伴时，我们承诺绝不抱怨的完成他们的要求。当然，相同的承诺不可能由银色盟约的口中说出。",cEN="I'm glad we've gotten that done. It's not the most glorious task in the world, but when we partnered with the Argent Crusade, we promised to do all they asked of us without complaint. Of course, the same cannot be said of the Silver Covenant."}
Q[14151]={d="据说赤红红宝石是整个北裂境最好的宝石。它在阳光下闪耀如水晶玫瑰。\n\n在我教你这道转化配方之前，我要求你进行五次史诗宝石转化，以做好准备。你可以做任何你喜欢的转化，甚至把同一种反复做很多次。\n\n等你真正准备好时，再来找我。$gpreparado:preparada;",dEN="The Cardinal Ruby is said to be the finest gem in all of Northrend. It sparkles like a crystal rose under the sun.\n\nBefore I teach you this recipe, I ask that you perform five epic gem transmutes to prepare your mind. You can do any you like, and even do the same transmute many times.\n\nReturn to me when you are truly ready.",o="达拉然的林奇·黑箭想让你以你的炼金术技能成功地转化5种史诗宝石。这五种史诗宝石是：紫黄晶、祖尔之眼、恐惧石、王者琥珀和巨锆石。",oEN="Linzy Blackbolt in Dalaran wants you to successfully transmute 5 epic gems with your alchemy skill. Acceptable transmutes include Ametrine, Eye of Zul, Dreadstone, King's Amber, and Majestic Zircon."}
Q[14152]={d="$gCampeón:Campeona;，波浪之冠号和她的船长被派往北边，去扰乱赫罗斯加登陆点的克瓦迪尔，途中被一支前往锦标赛场地的克瓦迪尔突击队拦截。不幸的是，克瓦迪尔的人数远超船上船员，正在一点点夺取这艘船。\n\n我们需要你北上，前往锦标赛场地与赫罗斯加登陆点之间碎浪海峡上的波浪之冠号，帮助船员击退进攻。你应该会在峡谷东侧看到那艘船。",dEN="Champion, Captain Wavecrest and her ship were sent north to disrupt the Kvaldir in Hrothgar's Landing when they were intercepted by a Kvaldir raiding party headed to the Tournament Grounds. Unfortunately, the Kvaldir far outnumber the crew on board and are slowly taking over the ship.\n\nWe need you to go north to The Wavecrest in The Sea Reaver's Run, between the Tournament Grounds and Hrothgar's Landing and help the crew fend off the attack. You should see the ship on the east side of the pass.",o="转至北海，消灭攻击浪巅号的8个克瓦迪尔狂暴者和3个克瓦迪尔持戟者。",oEN="Head out to The North Sea and kill 8 Vrykul Berserkers and 3 Vrykul Harpooners attacking The Wavecrest.",p="你协助击退克瓦迪尔人的攻击了吗？",pEN="Have you helped fend off the Kvaldir attack?",c="看来事情比我们一开始想象的还糟。但你仍旧做出了英勇的贡献并拯救了许多浪峰号船员的生命。",cEN="It seems things are worse than we initially thought. You still made a valiant effort and saved many of The Wavecrest's crew's lives."}
Q[14160]={d="这张精致的羊皮纸上列出了$n在珠宝行业里取得的诸多成就。\n\n你要将这份文件交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯，他一定会给你一份不错的酬劳。",dEN="This fine parchment lists a great many accomplishments, achieved by <name>, in the tradition of jewelcrafting.\n\nReturn this writ to Timothy Jones in Dalaran for a proper reward.",o="将功勋状交给达拉然的提莫斯·琼斯。",oEN="Deliver the Writ of Merit to Timothy Jones in Dalaran.",p="你好，<name>。你那儿拿着什么？",pEN="Good day, <name>. What have you got there?",c="这是一份相当出色的功绩清单，<name>！你会因这些成就得到丰厚的奖励。",cEN="This is a fine list of deeds, <name>! You are to be rewarded handsomely for your accomplishments."}
Q[14166]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给达拉然墓地的欢快的达拉然灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Dalaran Spirit in Dalaran's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14167]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给铁炉堡墓地的欢快的矮人灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Dwarf Spirit in Ironforge's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
