Q[14171]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给银月城墓地的欢快的血向导灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Blood Elf Spirit in Silvermoon City's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14172]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给沙塔斯墓地的欢快的奥尔多灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Aldor Spirit in Shattrath's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14173]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给沙塔斯墓地的欢快的占星者灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Scryer Spirit in Shattrath's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14174]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给幽暗城墓地的欢快的被遗忘者灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Forsaken Spirit in Undercity's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14175]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给奥格瑞玛墓地的欢快的兽人灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Orc Spirit in Orgrimmar's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14176]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给雷霆崖墓地的欢快的牛头人灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Tauren Spirit in Thunder Bluff's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14177]={d="真高兴能再次见到朋友和亲人，不过也许我做得有些太夸张了……我已经吃光了他们为我准备的一切！\n\n能不能帮我一个忙，再给我拿来一些那种美味的悼念糕饼？我会非常感激你的……\n\n我想，那边的查普曼正在出售食谱。",dEN="It's good to visit with friends and family again, though I may have overdone it... I've already eaten everything they made for me!\n\nMight I trouble you for some more of that delicious Bread of the Dead? I'd be most grateful...\n\nChapman there sells the recipe, I think.",o="弄到悼念糕饼，并把它交给奥格瑞玛墓地的欢快的巨魔灵魂。\n\n你必须使用一朵橙菊，才能看到那个隐形的灵魂。",oEN="Acquire some Bread of the Dead and give it to the Cheerful Troll Spirit in Orgrimmar's graveyard.\n\nUse an Orange Marigold to see the otherwise invisible spirit.",p="你有悼念糕饼吗？",pEN="You don't have any Bread of the Dead, do you?",c="喔，更多美味的悼念糕饼，感谢你！\n\n请收下这个当作回报……一点节日的小娱乐。",cEN="Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!\n\nPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday."}
Q[14203]={d="看起来，这张被水浸透的纸上应该是记录着一种烈性酒的酿造配方。也许达拉然“再来一杯”的店主会对这个感兴趣……",dEN="This appears to be the remains of a mixture for potent wine. Perhaps the proprietor of One More Glass in Dalaran would be interested in it....",o="将被浸透的配方交给达拉然城中的克莉丝蒂·斯多克顿。",oEN="Bring the Waterlogged Recipe to Christi Stockton in the Dalaran city.",p="正如我所说的，美酒只配识货的人。",pEN="Wine is only as fine as the person drinking it, I always say.",c="这真是件了不起的发现。我不能让你把它卖给别人，所以我愿意出个大价钱。",cEN="This is quite a find, . I can't have you selling this to anyone else, so I'm willing to offer generously."}
Q[14204]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往西部荒野哨兵岭向格莱恩·斯托曼报到。\n\n你可以从艾尔文森林向西前往，找到格莱恩·斯托曼。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.\n\nYou can reach Gryan Stoutmantle by traveling west from Elwynn Forest.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往西部荒野哨兵岭向格莱恩·斯托曼报到。",oEN="Report to Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14205]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往北荆棘谷的叛军营地向上士尤华报到。\n\n从暮色森林向南行进，进入丛林后沿路向西，即可抵达叛军营地。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp in Northern Stranglethorn.\n\nTravel south from Duskwood and follow the road west after crossing into the jungle to reach the Rebel Camp.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往北荆棘谷的叛军营地向上士尤华报到。",oEN="Report to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp in Northern Stranglethorn.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14206]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往藏宝海湾向克兰克·菲兹尔巴布报到。\n\n从荆棘谷北部山谷向南行进，沿路前往繁华的地精港口城市藏宝海湾。你可以在码头附近找到克兰克·菲兹尔巴布，他正为维持荆棘谷权力平衡的关键任务寻求帮助。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay.\n\nTravel south from Northern Stranglethorn Vale and follow the road to the bustling goblin port city of Booty Bay. Crank Fizzlebub can be found near the docks, seeking assistance with tasks vital to maintaining the balance of power in Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往南荆棘谷的藏宝海湾向克兰克·菲兹尔巴布报到。",oEN="Report to Crank Fizzlebub at Booty Bay in Southern Stranglethorn.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14207]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往守望堡向军需官伦格茨报到。\n\n守望堡的守军急需你在诅咒之地的帮助！从悲伤沼泽向南行进，沿路向东即可抵达守望堡。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Quartermaster Lungertz at Nethergarde Keep.\n\nNethergarde's garrison urgently needs your help into the Blasted Lands! Travel south from the Swamp of Sorrows and follow the road east to reach Nethergarde Keep.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往守望堡向军需官伦格茨报到。",oEN="Report to Quartermaster Lungertz at Nethergarde Keep.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14208]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往夜色镇向指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克报到。\n\n你可以沿艾尔文森林与赤脊山脉交界处的道路向南行进，抵达暮色森林中的夜色镇。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to Commander Althea Ebonlocke in Darkshire.\n\nYou can reach Darkshire in Duskwood by following the road south at the border between Elwynn Forest and the Redridge Mountains.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往暮色森林的夜色镇向指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克报到。",oEN="Report to Commander Althea Ebonlocke at Darkshire in Duskwood.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14209]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往赤脊山脉的湖畔镇向卫兵豪尔报到。\n\n从艾尔文森林边界向东行进，进入赤脊山脉的三岔口地区，即可抵达湖畔镇。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Guard Howe at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.\n\nTravel east from the border of Elwynn Forest and into the Three Corners area of Redridge to reach Lakeshire.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往赤脊山脉的湖畔镇向卫兵豪尔报到。",oEN="Report to Guard Howe at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14210]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往燃烧平原的摩根的岗哨向奥拉留斯报到。\n\n急需你的帮助来终结黑石兽人的威胁！你可以从灼热峡谷向南，穿过黑石山，抵达燃烧平原。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Oralius at Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes.\n\nYour aid is urgently needed to put an end to the Blackrock orc menace! You can reach the Burning Steppes by traveling south from the Searing Gorge through Blackrock Mountain.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往燃烧平原的摩根的岗哨向奥拉留斯报到。",oEN="Report to Oralius at Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14211]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往灼热峡谷的瑟银哨塔向汉塞尔·重手报到。\n\n重手报告说，灼热峡谷的黑铁矮人似乎在准备发动进攻。你的职责是尽可能查明他们的计划并加以终结。你可以从荒芜之地沿路向西抵达灼热峡谷。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Hansel Heavyhands at Thorium Point in the Searing Gorge.\n\nHeavyhands reports that the Dark Iron dwarves of the Searing Gorge seem to be preparing to attack. Your duty is to learn all you can about their scheming and put a halt to it. You can reach the Searing Gorge by following the road west from the Badlands.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往灼热峡谷的瑟银哨塔向汉塞尔·重手报到。",oEN="Report to Hansel Heavyhands at Thorium Point in the Searing Gorge.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14212]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往洛克莫丹的塞尔萨玛向法官钝鼻报到。\n\n狗头人和穴居人的再度崛起已让巡山人们疲于奔命。急需增援！从丹莫罗东部穿过南门小径向东行进，即可抵达塞尔萨玛。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Magistrate Bluntnose at Thelsamar in Loch Modan..\n\nThe resurgence of the kobolds and troggs has the mountaineers stretched thin. Reinforcements are desperately needed! Travel east through South Gate Pass from eastern Dun Morogh to reach Thelsamar.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往洛克莫丹的塞尔萨玛向法官钝鼻报到。",oEN="Report to Magistrate Bluntnose at Thelsamar in Loch Modan.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14213]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往米奈希尔港向瓦尔斯塔格·铁颚报到。\n\n湿地已被野兽、兽人劫掠者和野蛮的豺狼人占据！要抵达湿地，你必须从洛克莫丹向北，穿过矮人要塞丹奥加兹。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Valstag Ironjaw at Menethil Keep.\n\nWetlands has become overrun with wild beasts, orcish raiders, and savage gnolls! To reach the Wetlands, you must travel north from Loch Modan through the dwarven hold of Dun Algaz.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往湿地的米奈希尔港向瓦尔斯塔格·铁颚报到。",oEN="Report to Valstag Ironjaw at Menethil Keep in the Wetlands.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14214]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往避难谷地向奈尔斯队长报到。\n\n古老激流堡的荣誉必须得到洗刷！食人魔和罪犯玷污它的街道太久了。从湿地向北行进，穿过萨多尔大桥抵达阿拉希。沿路前往避难谷地，向队长报到。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Captain Nials at Refuge Pointe.\n\nAncient Stromgarde's honor must be redeemed! Too long have ogres and criminals sullied its streets. Travel north from the Wetlands and cross the Than'dol Span to reach Arathi. Follow the road to Refuge Pointe and present yourself to the captain.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往阿拉希高地的避难谷地向奈尔斯队长报到。",oEN="Report to Captain Nials at Refuge Pointe in Arathi Highlands.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14215]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往南海镇向雷德帕斯元帅报到。\n\n从银松森林繁忙的商路向南，穿过希尔斯布莱德起伏的田野，前往南海镇的联盟设防前哨。雷德帕斯元帅和他的部队正警惕着部落日益增多的侵扰以及肆虐该地区的黑暗势力。\n\n需要你的勇气与力量来扭转洛丹伦这一关键地区的局势。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Marshal Redpath at Southshore.\n\nTravel south from the bustling trade routes of Silverpine Forest, through the rolling fields of Hillsbrad, and make your way to the fortified Alliance outpost of Southshore. Marshal Redpath and his forces stand vigilant against the growing Horde incursions and the dark forces that plague the region.\n\nYour courage and strength are needed to turn the tide in this vital region of Lordaeron.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇向雷德帕斯元帅报到。",oEN="Report to Marshal Redpath at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14216]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往鹰巢山向狮鹫管理员塔隆艾克斯报到。\n\n我们在联盟中的新弟兄需要你的帮助，抵御威胁他们挚爱家园的种种危险。从阿拉希高地向北行进，穿过矮人山道，沿路向西北前往鹰巢山。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Gryphon Master Talonaxe at Aerie Peak.\n\nOur new brothers in the Alliance need your help to fend off the threats endangering their beloved homeland. Travel north from the Arathi Highlands, through the dwarven mountain pass and follow the road northwest to Aerie Peak.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往辛特兰的鹰巢山向狮鹫管理员塔隆艾克斯报到。",oEN="Report to Gryphon Master Talonaxe at Aerie Peak in The Hinterlands.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14217]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往南海镇向雷德帕斯元帅报到。\n\n从银松森林繁忙的商路向南，穿过希尔斯布莱德起伏的田野，前往南海镇的联盟设防前哨。雷德帕斯元帅和他的部队正警惕着部落日益增多的侵扰以及肆虐该地区的黑暗势力。\n\n需要你的勇气与力量来扭转洛丹伦这一关键地区的局势。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Marshal Redpath at Southshore..\n\nTravel south from the bustling trade routes of Silverpine Forest, through the rolling fields of Hillsbrad, and make your way to the fortified Alliance outpost of Southshore. Marshal Redpath and his forces stand vigilant against the growing Horde incursions and the dark forces that plague the region.\n\nYour courage and strength are needed to turn the tide in this vital region of Lordaeron.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵的南海镇向雷德帕斯元帅报到。",oEN="Report to Marshal Redpath at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14218]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往西瘟疫之地向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到。需要你的帮助来击退天灾军团，夺回沦陷的安多哈尔。\n\n要抵达冰风营地，请向北穿过希尔斯布莱德丘陵，沿路前往冰风营地。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Western Plaguelands. Your help is needed to beat back the Scourge and reclaim lost Andorhal.\n\nTo reach Chillwind Camp, travel north through the Hillsbrad Foothills and follow the road towards the camp of Chillwind Camp.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往西瘟疫之地的冰风营地向指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特报到。",oEN="Report to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14219]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往东瘟疫之地向大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯报到。银色北伐军需要你的帮助，从瘟疫之爪中夺回东瘟疫之地。\n\n要在东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂找到安吉拉·多桑托斯，请向东北行进，经过考林路口抵达礼拜堂——荒芜中的一处庇护所。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Archmage Angela Dosantos in Eastern Plaguelands. The Argent Crusade needs your help to win back the Eastern Plaguelands from the grasp of the Scourge.\n\nTo find Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands, head northeast past Corin's Crossing to the chapel, a sanctuary amid the desolation.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往东瘟疫之地的圣光之愿礼拜堂向大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯报到。",oEN="Report to Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14220]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往黑海岸向格沙拉·夜语报到。\n\n从灰谷沿海岸道路向北行进，直到抵达宁静而古老的黑海岸。坐落在海岸边的奥伯丁是联盟在这一地区的据点。奥伯丁的人民请求你帮助守护这片土地的美丽与平衡。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore..\n\nTravel north from Ashenvale along the coastal road until you reach the serene and ancient lands of Darkshore. Auberdine, nestled along the coast, serves as the Alliance's foothold in this region. The people of Auberdine call for your aid to preserve the beauty and balance of these lands.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往黑海岸的奥伯丁向格沙拉·夜语报到。",oEN="Report to Gershala Nightwhisper at Auberdine in Darkshore.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14221]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往冬泉谷向哈洛·维格斯沃斯报到。\n\n他需要你的帮助来化解冬泉熊怪的威胁。要抵达冬泉谷，你必须从费伍德森林北部向东行进，穿过木喉要塞。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Harlo Wigglesworth in Winterspring.\n\nHe requires your help to overcome the threat of the Winterfall furbolg. To reach Winterspring, you must travel east from northern Felwood and traverse Timbermaw Hold.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往冬泉谷的永望镇向哈洛·维格斯沃斯报到。",oEN="Report to Harlo Wigglesworth at Everlook in Winterspring.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14222]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往灰谷向辛德瑞尔·迅火报到。\n\n绝不能让部落对灰谷的侵略继续下去！需要你的帮助来击退入侵者，恢复这片神圣的森林。向南穿过黑海岸的暮色谷，即可抵达灰谷森林。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Shindrell Swiftfire in Ashenvale..\n\nThe Horde's aggression in Ashenvale cannot be allowed to stand! Your help is needed to repel the invaders and restore the sacred forest. Head south through the Twilight Vale in Darkshore to reach the forest of Ashenvale.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往灰谷的阿斯特兰纳向辛德瑞尔·迅火报到。",oEN="Report to Shindrell Swiftfire at Astranaar in Ashenvale.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14223]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往凄凉之地向下士梅尔金斯报到。\n\n尼耶尔前哨站的勇敢士兵正遭受恶魔和部落军队的围攻，他们需要你的帮助。要抵达凄凉之地，请从石爪山脉的焦炭谷沿路向南行进。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Corporal Melkins in Desolace..\n\nThe brave soldiers of Nijel's Point are beset by demons and the armies of the Horde and they need your help. To reach Desolace, travel south on the road from the Charred Vale in the Stonetalon Mountains.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往凄凉之地的尼耶尔前哨站向下士梅尔金斯报到。",oEN="Report to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14224]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往菲拉斯向珊蒂斯·羽月报到。\n\n联盟需要你的帮助来战胜我们的敌人——部落和恐怖图腾。你可以从凄凉之地向南进入菲拉斯，找到珊蒂斯·羽月。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Shandris Feathermoon in Feralas.\n\nThe Alliance needs your help to overcome our enemies, the Horde and the Grimtotems. You can reach Shandris Feathermoon by traveling south from Desolace into Feralas.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往菲拉斯的羽月要塞向珊蒂斯·羽月报到。",oEN="Report to Shandris Feathermoon at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14225]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往尘泥沼泽向阿登中尉报到。\n\n你必须协助阿登中尉查明塞拉摩面临的威胁，无论是城内的还是城墙之外的。你可以从米奈希尔港乘船抵达塞拉摩岛，或从南贫瘠之地穿过沼泽前往。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Lieutenant Aden in Dustwallow Marsh.\n\nYou must aid Lieutenant Aden in uncovering the threats to Theramore, both within the city and beyond its walls. You can reach Theramore Isle by taking the boat from Menethil or traveling across the marsh from the Southern Barrens.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩岛向阿登中尉报到。",oEN="Report to Lieutenant Aden at Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14226]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往塔纳利斯向总工程师比格维兹报到。\n\n联盟需要你的帮助，从当地男爵那里争取特许权，并获得该地区无价资源的开采权。你可以从千针石林的风光深谷向南行进，抵达加基森。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris.\n\nThe Alliance needs your help to win concessions from the local baron and access to the area's priceless resources. You can reach Gadgetzan by traveling south from the Shimmering Deep in Thousand Needles.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往塔纳利斯的加基森向总工程师比格维兹报到。",oEN="Report to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14227]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往安戈洛环形山的马绍尔营地向维里登·马绍尔报到。\n\n联盟需要你为马绍尔探险队提供支援，帮助他们揭开安戈洛环形山远古野兽、独特植物和强大水晶的秘密。你可以从塔纳利斯西部出发，沿路前往马绍尔哨站，抵达环形山。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Williden Marshal at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater..\n\nThe Alliance needs you to provide support to the Marshal Expeditions as they uncover the secrets of Un'Goro Crater's ancient beasts, unique flora, and powerful crystals. You can reach the crater by departing western Tanaris and following the road all the way to Marshal's Stand.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往安戈洛环形山的马绍尔营地向维里登·马绍尔报到。",oEN="Report to Williden Marshal at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14228]={d="奉国王陛下之命，所有有能力的联盟公民都应前往希利苏斯向唤风者普罗德霍恩报到。\n\n我们塞纳里奥议会的盟友需要你的协助，击退暮光之锤的猛攻。你可以从安戈洛环形山走西北方向的道路抵达希利苏斯。\n\n为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",dEN="By order of his royal highness, all able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Windcaller Proudhorn in Silithus.\n\nOur Cenarion Circle allies require your assistance to fight back against the Twilight's Hammer onslaught. You can reach Silithus by taking the northwestern road out of the Un'Goro Crater.\n\nFor the glory and honor of the Alliance!",o="前往希利苏斯的塞纳里奥要塞向唤风者普罗德霍恩报到。",oEN="Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",c="为了联盟的荣耀与荣誉！",cEN="For the glory and honor of the Alliance!"}
Q[14229]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往冬泉谷向哈洛·维格斯沃斯报到。\n\n他需要你的帮助来化解冬泉熊怪的威胁。要抵达冬泉谷，你必须从费伍德森林北部向东行进，穿过木喉要塞。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Harlo Wigglesworth in Winterspring.\n\nHe requires your help to overcome the threat of the Winterfall furbolg. To reach Winterspring, you must travel east from northern Felwood and traverse Timbermaw Hold.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往冬泉谷的永望镇向哈洛·维格斯沃斯报到。",oEN="Report to Harlo Wigglesworth at Everlook in Winterspring.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14230]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往费伍德森林向格蕾塔·苔蹄报到。\n\n塞纳里奥议会需要你的帮助，把费伍德森林从恶魔和其他腐化生物的控制中夺回来！要抵达翡翠圣地，请从灰谷向北行进，沿路直到抵达圣地。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.\n\nThe Cenarion Circle requires your help to wrest Felwood from the control of demons and other corrupt creatures! To reach the Emerald Sanctuary, travel north from Ashenvale and follow the road until you reach the sanctuary.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往费伍德森林的翡翠圣地向格蕾塔·苔蹄报到。",oEN="Report to Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14231]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往灰谷向米苏瓦报到。\n\n她需要你协助保卫我们的土地，抵御暗夜精灵及其盟友的入侵。要抵达灰谷，你必须从北贫瘠之地的十字路口沿黄金之路向北行进。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Mitsuwa in Ashenvale.\n\nShe requires your aid in defending our lands against the encroaching Night Elves and their allies. To reach Ashenvale, you must take the Gold Road north from Crossroads in the Northern Barrens.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往灰谷的佐拉姆加前哨站向米苏瓦报到。",oEN="Report to Mitsuwa at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14232]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往贫瘠之地的十字路口向塞格拉·暗棘报到。\n\n她需要你协助保卫这座重要前哨，抵御野猪人、半人马和联盟部队的威胁。要抵达十字路口，请从杜隆塔尔向南，或从莫高雷向北行进。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Sergra Darkthorn at The Crossroads in the Barrens.\n\nShe requires your assistance in defending this vital outpost against the threats of the quilboar, centaur, and Alliance forces. To reach the Crossroads, travel south from Durotar or north from Mulgore.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往贫瘠之地的十字路口向塞格拉·暗棘报到。",oEN="Report to Sergra Darkthorn at The Crossroads in the Barrens.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14233]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往贫瘠之地的棘齿城向梅博克·米兹里克斯报到。\n\n要抵达棘齿城，请从十字路口向东行进，或从南边沿海岸前行。地精们承诺给予公平的报酬和充足的机会，给那些愿意为这项事业献上刀剑、法术或头脑的人。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Mebok Mizzyrix at Ratchet in the Barrens.\n\nTo reach Ratchet, travel east from The Crossroads or follow the coast from the south. The goblins promise fair pay and ample opportunities for those willing to lend their blades, spells, or wits to the cause.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往贫瘠之地的棘齿城向梅博克·米兹里克斯报到。",oEN="Report to Mebok Mizzyrix at Ratchet in the Barrens.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14234]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往石爪山脉的烈日石居向马格兰·缚地者报到。\n\n石爪山脉正受到威胁！血怒部族的野蛮鹰身女妖正在袭击我们的补给线、恐吓我们的盟友，而风险投资公司那些背信弃义的地精则在掠夺这片土地的资源，全然不顾留下的破坏。\n\n要抵达烈日石居，请从贫瘠之地向西南行进。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Maggran Earthbinder at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains..\n\nThe Stonetalon Mountains are under threat! The savage harpies of the Bloodfury tribe are raiding our supply lines and terrorizing our allies, while the treacherous goblins of the Venture Co. exploit the land's resources, heedless of the destruction they leave in their wake.\n\nTo reach Sun Rock Retreat, travel southwest from The Barrens.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往石爪山脉的烈日石居向马格兰·缚地者报到。",oEN="Report to Maggran Earthbinder at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14235]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往凄凉之地的鬼雾岗哨向塔卡塔·钢刃报到。\n\n凄凉之地勇敢的部落战士需要你的帮助，击退联盟的军队和远古恶魔。\n\n要找到塔卡塔·钢刃，请从石爪山脉的焦炭谷向南行进。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Takata Steelblade at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace.\n\nThe brave Horde warriors of Desolace need your help to beat back the armies of the Alliance and ancient demons.\n\nTo reach Takata Steelblade, travel south from the Charred Vale in the Stonetalon Mountains.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往凄凉之地的鬼雾岗哨向塔卡塔·钢刃报到。",oEN="Report to Takata Steelblade at Ghost Walker Post in Desolace.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14236]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往尘泥沼泽的蕨墙村向克罗格报到。\n\n这片沼泽充斥着各种敌人，那里的联盟部队强大得危险。\n\n要抵达尘泥沼泽，请从南贫瘠之地东部沿路前往蕨墙村。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Krog at Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh.\n\nThe marsh is overrun with enemies of many kinds and the Alliance forces there are dangerously strong.\n\nTo reach Dustwallow Marsh, follow the path from the eastern part of the Southern Barrens toward Brackenwall Village.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往尘泥沼泽的蕨墙村向克罗格报到。",oEN="Report to Krog at Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14237]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地向巫医乌泽尔报到。帮助部落守住这片大森林，抵御联盟和恐怖图腾。\n\n你可以从凄凉之地向南进入菲拉斯，抵达阿塔亚营地。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Witch Doctor Uzer'i at Camp Mojache in Feralas. Help the Horde secure the great forest against the Alliance and the Grimtotems.\n\nYou can reach Camp Ataya by traveling south from Desolace and into Feralas.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地向巫医乌泽尔报到。",oEN="Report to Witch Doctor Uzer'i at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14238]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往千针石林的自由之风岗哨向哈加尔·雷蹄报到。\n\n部落必须加强在千针石林这片干旱土地上的存在，抵御联盟和敌对半人马部族步步紧逼的威胁。\n\n要抵达自由之风岗哨，请从贫瘠之地向南行进，沿蜿蜒的道路深入千针石林腹地。高耸的石针与辽阔的峡谷正等待着你的到来。\n\n命运在召唤你！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Hagar Lightninghoof at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.\n\nThe Horde must strengthen its presence in the arid lands of Thousand Needles and defend against the encroaching threats from the Alliance and the hostile Centaur tribes.\n\nTo reach Freewind Post, travel south from the Barrens and follow the winding paths into the heart of Thousand Needles. The towering spires and vast canyons await your arrival.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往千针石林的自由之风岗哨向哈加尔·雷蹄报到。",oEN="Report to Hagar Lightninghoof at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14239]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往塔纳利斯向总工程师比格维兹报到。\n\n部落需要你协助从当地男爵那里争取特许权，并获得该地区无价资源的开采权。你们可以从千针石林的风光深谷向南行进，抵达加基森。\n\n命运在召唤你们！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris.\n\nThe Horde needs your help to win concessions from the local baron and access to the area's priceless resources. You can reach Gadgetzan by traveling south from the Shimmering Deep in Thousand Needles.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="前往塔纳利斯的加基森向总工程师比格维兹报到。",oEN="Report to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14240]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往安戈洛环形山马绍尔营地的维利登·马绍尔处报到。\n\n部落需要你们支援马绍尔远征队，他们正在揭开安戈洛环形山远古野兽、独特植物与强大水晶的秘密。你们可以从塔纳利斯西部出发，沿着道路一直前行至马绍尔哨站，即可抵达环形山。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Williden Marshal at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater.\n\nThe Horde needs you to provide support to the Marshal Expeditions as they uncover the secrets of Un'Goro Crater's ancient beasts, unique flora, and powerful crystals. You can reach the crater by departing western Tanaris and following the road all the way to Marshal's Stand.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向安戈洛环形山马绍尔营地的维利登·马绍尔报到。",oEN="Report to Williden Marshal at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14241]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往希利苏斯的风唤者普罗德霍恩处报到。\n\n我们的塞纳里奥议会盟友需要你们的协助，以抗击暮光之锤的猛攻。你们可以从安戈洛环形山出发，沿西北方的道路前行，即可抵达希利苏斯。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Windcaller Proudhorn in Silithus.\n\nOur Cenarion Circle allies require your assistance to fight back against the Twilight's Hammer onslaught. You can reach Silithus by taking the northwestern road out of the Un'Goro Crater.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的风唤者普罗德霍恩报到。",oEN="Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14242]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往银松森林的瑟伯切尔，向达拉尔·道恩维沃报到。\n\n如今比以往任何时候都更需要你们的帮助，以铲除盘踞此地的敌患，以及潜伏于暗影中的凶猛狼人。\n\n要前往银松森林，请从提瑞斯法林地出发，穿过洛丹伦废墟向南行进。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Dalar Dawnweaver at The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.\n\nNow, more than ever, your help is needed in routing the enemy infestation of the region and the savage worgen prowling the shadows.\n\nTo reach Silverpine Forest, travel south from Tirisfal Glades through the Ruins of Lordaeron.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向银松森林瑟伯切尔的达拉尔·道恩维沃报到。",oEN="Report to Dalar Dawnweaver at The Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14243]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵的塔伦米尔，向死亡守卫萨姆萨报到。\n\n联盟正在侵犯我们的土地，而辛迪加也一天比一天更加嚣张。需要你们的力量来巩固我们的据点，击退这些威胁。\n\n要抵达塔伦米尔，你们必须沿道路向南穿过银松森林，走东边的岔路进入希尔斯布莱德丘陵。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Deathguard Samsa at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.\n\nThe Alliance encroaches upon our lands, and the Syndicate grows bolder with each passing day. Your strength is needed to secure our foothold and push back these threats.\n\nTo reach Tarren Mill you must follow the road south through Silverpine Forest and take the east fork leading into Hillsbrad Foothills.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向希尔斯布莱德丘陵塔伦米尔的死亡守卫萨姆萨报到。",oEN="Report to Deathguard Samsa at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14244]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往阿拉希高地的落锤镇，向托尔甘报到。\n\n激流堡的军队蠢蠢欲动，辛迪加的背叛威胁着我们的行动。需要你们的勇气来巩固我们的据点，粉碎这些敌人。\n\n要前往阿拉希高地，请从希尔斯布莱德丘陵向东行进，沿着道路穿过索拉丁之墙。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Tor'gan at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.\n\nThe Stromgarde forces grow restless, and the Syndicate's treachery threatens our operations. Your courage is needed to secure our position and crush these enemies.\n\nTo reach the Arathi Highlands, travel east from Hillsbrad Foothills and follow the road past Thoradin's Wall.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向阿拉希高地落锤镇的托尔甘报到。",oEN="Report to Tor'gan at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14245]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往 Hinterlands 的恶齿村，向莫吉科报到。\n\n邪恶枝杈巨魔野蛮嗜血，加剧了对我们盟友的袭击，并亵渎了辛特兰的神圣土地。他们的黑暗仪式与无情的侵略再也无法容忍。我们必须以狂怒反击，将这些腐化从这片土地上清除。\n\n要抵达恶齿村，请从希尔斯布莱德丘陵东部的山口进入辛特兰，然后前往东海岸。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.\n\nThe Vilebranch trolls, savage and bloodthirsty, have intensified their attacks on our allies and defiled the sacred lands of the Hinterlands. Their dark rituals and relentless aggression cannot be tolerated any longer. We must strike back with fury and rid these lands of their corruption.\n\nTo reach Revanktusk Village, cross into the Hinterlands from the mountain pass in eastern Hillsbrad Foothills and make your way to the eastern coast.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向辛特兰恶齿村的奥索·莫吉科报到。",oEN="Report to Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14246]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往西瘟疫之地的亡灵壁垒，向高阶执行官德灵顿报到。需要你们的帮助来击退天灾军团，夺回沦陷的安多哈尔。\n\n要抵达亡灵壁垒，请从幽暗城出发，穿过提瑞斯法林地一路向南。沿道路前行至东部边界，亡灵壁垒便矗立在那里。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark in Western Plaguelands. Your help is needed to beat back the Scourge and reclaim lost Andorhal.\n\nTo reach the Bulwark, travel south from Undercity through Tirisfal Glades. Follow the road to the eastern border, where the Bulwark stands guard.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向西瘟疫之地亡灵壁垒的高阶执行官德灵顿报到。",oEN="Report to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark in Western Plaguelands.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14247]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往东瘟疫之地，向大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯报到。银色十字军需要你们的帮助，从天灾军团手中夺回东瘟疫之地。\n\n要找到东瘟疫之地光明希望教堂的安吉拉·多桑托斯，请向东北方前行，经过柯林十字路口抵达教堂——那是荒芜中的一处圣所。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Archmage Angela Dosantos in Eastern Plaguelands. The Argent Crusade needs your help to win back the Eastern Plaguelands from the grasp of the Scourge.\n\nTo find Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands, head northeast past Corin's Crossing to the chapel, a sanctuary amid the desolation.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向东瘟疫之地光明希望教堂的大法师安吉拉·多桑托斯报到。",oEN="Report to Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14248]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往灼热峡谷的瑟银哨塔，向汉塞尔·重手报到。\n\n重手报告说，灼热峡谷的黑铁矮人似乎正准备发动进攻。你们的任务是尽可能了解他们的阴谋并加以阻止。你们可以从荒芜之地沿道路向西行进，抵达灼热峡谷。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Hansel Heavyhands at Thorium Point in the Searing Gorge.\n\nHeavyhands reports that the Dark Iron dwarves of the Searing Gorge seem to be preparing to attack. Your duty is to learn all you can about their scheming and put a halt to it. You can reach the Searing Gorge by following the road west from the Badlands.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向灼热峡谷瑟银哨塔的汉塞尔·重手报到。",oEN="Report to Hansel Heavyhands at Thorium Point in the Searing Gorge.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14249]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往荒芜之地的卡加斯，向戈恩报到。\n\n有人目睹黑铁矮人的盟友暗炉矮人在荒芜之地集结兵力。他们的存在威胁着我们盟友的安全以及该地区的稳定。你们的任务是猎杀并消灭这些暗炉矮人，确保他们的计划在发动袭击之前就被挫败。\n\n从灼热峡谷向东行进即可抵达荒芜之地。卡加斯是我们在此地的要塞，将作为你们的行动基地。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Gorn at Kargath in Badlands.\n\nThe Shadowforge dwarves, allies of the Dark Iron clan, have been spotted amassing forces in the Badlands. Their presence threatens the safety of our allies and the stability of the region. Your mission is to hunt down and eliminate these Shadowforge dwarves, ensuring their plans are thwarted before they can strike.\n\nThe Badlands can be reached by traveling east from Searing Gorge. Kargath, our stronghold in the region, will serve as your base of operations.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向荒芜之地卡加斯的戈恩报到。",oEN="Report to Gorn at Kargath in Badlands.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14250]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往悲伤沼泽的斯通纳德，向达尔报到。\n\n从诅咒之地向南行进即可抵达悲伤沼泽。斯通纳德是我们在此地区的前哨站，将作为你们的行动基地。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Dar at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.\n\nThe Swamp of Sorrows can be reached by traveling south from the Blasted Lands. Stonard, our outpost in the region, will serve as your base of operations.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的达尔报到。",oEN="Report to Dar at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14251]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往格罗姆高营地，向指挥官阿格罗戈什报到。指挥官需要你们的帮助，以保持补给线畅通，不受当地居民和麻烦的联盟干扰。\n\n要抵达格罗姆高，你们可以搭乘奥格瑞玛城外塔楼或幽暗城附近的飞艇。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Commander Aggro'gosh at Grom'gol Base Camp. The commander requires your aid to keep the supply routes open and free of interference from the local inhabitants and the troublesome Alliance.\n\nTo reach Grom'gol, you can take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar or the one near Undercity.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向北荆棘谷格罗姆高营地的指挥官阿格罗戈什报到。",oEN="Report to Commander Aggro'gosh at Grom'gol Base Camp in the Northern Stranglethorn Vale.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14252]={d="兹命令所有有能力的部落成员前往藏宝海湾，向克兰克·菲兹尔布布报到。\n\n从北荆棘谷向南行进，沿着道路前往地精的繁华港口城市藏宝海湾。你们可以在码头附近找到克兰克·菲兹尔布布，他正在寻求帮助，以完成维持荆棘谷势力均衡的关键任务。\n\n命运在召唤！",dEN="All able bodied members of the Horde are hereby ordered to report to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay.\n\nTravel south from Northern Stranglethorn Vale and follow the road to the bustling goblin port city of Booty Bay. Crank Fizzlebub can be found near the docks, seeking assistance with tasks vital to maintaining the balance of power in Stranglethorn Vale.\n\nDestiny calls!",o="向南荆棘谷藏宝海湾的克兰克·菲兹尔布布报到。",oEN="Report to Crank Fizzlebub at Booty Bay in Southern Stranglethorn.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!"}
Q[14253]={d="圣骑士的忠诚不会止于<su>剑锋之外，<name>。骑士团对其成员的要求不止于操练与战斗。真正的骑士会为骑士团的一切事务贡献力量，即便那些乍看之下并不光彩的任务。\n\n这第一项任务既不侧重战斗，也谈不上光荣，但若没有这样的贡献，骑士团便会分崩离析。我会给你一份清单，列出我所需的物品，用以保证我们有充足的光能以施展法术。",dEN="A Paladin's loyalty does not stop at the end of <his/her> blade, <name>. The order asks more of its members than mere drilling and combat. A true knight contributes to all of the order's activities, even the ones that may not seem glorious on the surface.\n\nThis first task is neither combat intensive, nor glorious, but without such contributions, the order would fall apart. I will give you a list of items i require to keep us supplied with Light energy for our magics.",o="将40块符文布、6块奥金锭、10株太阳草、5枚黑暗符文和150金币交给幽暗城的公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影。",oEN="Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Sungrass, 5 Dark Runes, and 150 Gold to Justicar Malric Dawnshroud in Undercity.",c="很好，看来东西都在这里了。\n\n别担心。我保证，你的下一项任务会有很多重新挥舞武器的机会。\n\n我会让一名新兵把这些都送到法师阿斯塔洛尔那里。既然有更重要的事情要做，就没必要派你去做这种琐碎的跑腿差事。",cEN="Excellent. It appears everything is here.\n\nDon't worry. your next task will include plenty of opportunities to wield your weapon again, I promise.\n\nI'll have an initiate bring it all to Magister Astalor. There's no need to send you on such a trivial errand when there are more important things to be done."}
Q[14254]={d="我们圣骑士有义务守卫自己的殿堂，<name>。这是你训练的核心部分。我们的敌人凶猛而毫不留情。幽暗城和它的人民之所以还能享有自由，靠的是我们的努力与盟友的支持。\n\n我收到了一些令人不安的报告，说在东瘟疫之地边境的东南方重新出现了天灾军团。一队天灾攻城工程师和他们的装备似乎正在为进攻幽魂之地做准备。绝不能让他们得逞。",dEN="We Paladins are bound to defend our halls, <name>. This is a central part of your training. Our enemies are fierce and unrelenting. Undercity and its people remain free by our efforts and the support of our allies.\n\nI have received some disturbing reports of a renewed Scourge presence to the southeast of our border with the Eastern Plaguelands. A company of Scourge siege engineers and their equipment appear to be staging for an attack on the Ghostlands. They must not be permitted to succeed.",o="幽暗城的公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影要你杀死15名天灾攻城工程师。",oEN="Justicar Malric Dawnshroud in Undercity wants you to kill 15 Scourge Siege Engineers.",c="你很好地证明了自己对祖国的忠诚，以及对骑士团需要的奉献，<name>。在你得以称大师之名以前，我还有最后一项任务交给你。",cEN="You have done well in demonstrating your loyalty to your homeland and dedication to the needs of the order, <name>. I have one last task for you before you may lay claim to the title of master."}
Q[14255]={d="圣骑士大师掌握着操纵与编织圣光的惊人技艺。但这并不妨碍他们因我们释放了圣光的真正潜能而鄙视我们。\n\n我们必须给他们传个信，让他们知道我们不是可以随意轻慢的。我心中所想的这件事既不简短也不轻松，但如果你下定决心，第一步就是潜入提尔之手修道院的图书馆侧翼，取得一瓶提尔之手圣水。",dEN="A Paladin master possesses incredible skill at wielding and weaving the Light. It doesn't stop them from despising us for unleashing the Light's true potential.\n\nWe must send them a message and show them that we are not to be trifled with. What I have in mind will be neither brief nor easy, but if you are committed, the first step will be to infiltrate the library wing of the Tyr's Hand Abbey and procure a vial of Tyr's Hand holy water.",o="幽暗城的公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影要你带给他一瓶提尔之手圣水。",oEN="Justicar Malric Dawnshroud in Undercity wants you to bring him a vial of Tyr's Hand Holy Water.",c="嗯……这分量相当少，但只要我们小心使用，应该足够了。你看，血色十字军自认为献身于圣光。我想，从某种扭曲的意义上说他们确实如此，而这正是我想要加以利用的地方。\n\n他们那被误导的狂热甚至污染了诵念在这水上的祝福，使它成了我目的的理想材料。",cEN="Hmm... this is a rather small amount. but if we're careful. it should be sufficient. You see. the Scarlet Crusade believes itself dedicated to the Light. I suppose they still are, in a twisted sort of way, and that's exactly what I'm hoping to capitalize on.\n\nTheir misguided zeal has even tainted the blessing spoken over this water, making it ideal for my purpose."}
Q[14256]={d="既然水已经到手，我们还需要若干精确分量的试剂。其中有些物质稀有而昂贵，<name>，不过我已经找到了其中两种的来源。\n\n你应该可以从哈格鲁斯那里买到一些奥术催化剂，他是龙息区某家店铺里的试剂商人。雷库尔是龙息区盗贼训练师附近的毒药商人，他那里有黄昏之尘的存货。\n\n为了配齐我的混合剂，我还需要一颗艾泽拉斯钻石和一颗原始黑钻石。",dEN="Now that we have the water, we're going to need a number of reagents in precise quantities. Some of these substances are rare and expensive, <name>, but I have located sources for two.\n\nYou should be able to purchase some arcane catalyst from Hagrus, the reagent vendor in one of the shops found in the drag. Rekkul, the poison merchant near the rogue trainers also in the drag, stocks crepuscular powder.\n\nTo complete my mixture, I'll also need an azerothian diamond and a pristine black diamond.",o="幽暗城的公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影要你带给他1份奥术催化剂、1份黄昏之尘、1颗艾泽拉斯钻石和1颗原始黑钻石。",oEN="Justicar Malric Dawnshroud in Undercity wants you to bring him 1 Arcane Catalyst, 1 Crepuscular Powder, 1 Azerothian Diamond, and 1 Pristine Black Diamond.",c="既然试剂都齐了，我就可以调配混合剂了。\n\n<Una lenta sonrisa se extiende por el rostro de Lady Liadrin>\n\n一切都在完美地推进，<name>。等这件事完成后，我会把接下来要做的事详细告诉你。",cEN="Now that we have all the reagents, I can prepare the mixture.\n\n<A slow smile spreads across Lady Liadrin's face.>\n\nIt's all coming together perfectly, <name>. When this is finished, I'll give you the details about what remains to be done."}
Q[14257]={d="我们这条路才是运用圣光的正道，<name>。为了让那些自称\"圣骑士\"的人看清他们行径的愚昧，我打算送出一个明确无误的信号。\n\n阿隆索斯礼拜堂是白银之手骑士团创立之地，似乎未受斯坦索姆毁灭的影响。礼拜堂的永恒之焰赋予了它圣光的庇护，但当你用这瓶混合剂熄灭那火焰时，这份庇护便将不复存在。它会燃烧起来，而我们对圣光的统治权将向世人证明。",dEN="Ours is the true way of utilizing the Light, <name>. To show others that would call themselves 'paladins' the folly of their ways, I intend to send an unmistakable message.\n\nThe Alonsus Chapel, where the Order of the Silver Hand was founded, seems immune to the destruction of Stratholme. The chapel's eternal flame affords it the Light's protection, but when you use this mixture to extinguish the flame, that protection will be no more. It will burn, and our dominion over the Light will be proven to the world.",o="在阿隆索斯礼拜堂的永恒之焰附近使用灭火混合剂，以解除圣光的庇护。做好战斗准备，迎击任何试图保卫礼拜堂的人。",oEN="Use the Extinguishing Mixture near the eternal flame in the Alonsus Chapel to remove the Light's protection. Be prepared to fight anyone who may attempt to defend the chapel.",c="干得好，<name>。所有与我们为敌的人都最好留意你送去的警告。我们的敌人应当知道他们已身处险境，从最低微的步兵到最强大的<英雄>。\n\n你已在大师之列赢得了自己的位置。你的奉献与本领是所有血骑士的榜样。作为你新身份的象征，我赐予你召唤并号令萨拉斯战马的能力。",cEN="Well done, <name>. All who would oppose us would do well to heed the warning you delivered. Our foes should know that they are in peril, from the lowest foot soldier to the mightiest <hero/heroine>.\n\nYou have earned your place in the ranks of the masters. Your dedication and prowess serve as an example for all Blood Knights. As a symbol of your new status, I grant you the ability to summon and command the thalassian charger."}
Q[14258]={d="你在为骑士团效力的过程中表现出众，<name>。你运用公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影所授圣光能量的本领，已证明你有资格获得一种全新的知识。\n\n圣光听凭你号令，你便有可能召唤一匹令人生畏的战马，作为你忠实的坐骑。\n\n继续怀着奉献与荣誉效力吧，<name>，更大的恩赐还在等着你。",dEN="You have distinguished yourself in the service of the order, <name>. Your skill in wielding the Light energies granted by Justicar Malric Dawnshroud has proven you worthy to receive a new kind of knowledge.\n\nWith the Light at your command, it is possible to summon a fearsome warhorse that will serve as your faithful mount.\n\nContinue to serve with dedication and honor, <name>, and even greater boons await you.",o="与公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影交谈，学习如何召唤你的亡灵战马。",oEN="Talk to Justicar Malric Dawnshroud to learn how to summon your Undead Warhorse."}
Q[14259]={d="你为骑士团付出的努力并未被忽视，勇士。\n\n到我这里来报到，我会因你至今的效力而赏赐你一匹战马。",dEN="Your efforts for the order have not gone unnoticed champion.\n\nReport to me and I shall reward you with a Warhorse for your services so far.",o="与公正者玛尔里克·黎明之影交谈。",oEN="Talk to Justice Malric Dawnshroud.",c="你为世界、为骑士团、为部落所做的贡献已经得到了认可，圣骑士。\n相关",cEN="Your contributions to the world, to the order and to the horde have been recognized Paladin.\nRelated"}
Q[14350]={d="我们不能直接攻击血色十字军的指挥官，他们身边的防御力量太强大了。不过，抓住猫的办法并不只一个。如果没有了军队，他们也就没有了作恶的力量。\n\n亡灵哨兵们一直在搜索那些十字军在斯坦索姆外围进行活动的情报。每天都有一份报告从他们的指挥中心被送往提尔之手。$r,那些报告就是我们取胜的关键！找到红衣信使，取得那份报告。将它交给纳萨诺斯。",dEN="We cannot attack the Scarlet Crusade's command directly; they are too well defended. But there's more than one way to skin a cat. They'll be nothing without their main force.\n\nThe Deathstalkers have been collecting data on the activity of the Crusade outside of Stratholme. Each day, a report is sent from their central command to Tyr's Hand. This report is the key, <race>! Find the Crimson Courier and recover that report. Bring it to Nathanos.",o="返回东瘟疫之地，找到并杀死红衣信使，拿到大十字军的命令。\n\n把命令交给纳萨诺斯·凋零者，并等待进一步的指示。",oEN="Return to Eastern Plaguelands and track down the Crimson Courier. Kill the Courier and recover the Grand Crusader's Command.\n\nTake the command to Nathanos Blightcaller for further instruction.",p="现在就取得成功，你便几乎赢得了我的尊敬，$n。",pEN="Succeed now and you will have almost earned my respect, <class>.",c="<纳萨诺斯大笑了起来。>\n\n太好了！我终于等到了一个可以消灭血色十字军神谕者的机会！",cEN="<Nathanos laughs.>\n\nExcellent! Finally! An opportunity to destroy the Scarlet Oracle!"}
Q[14356]={d="仔细听着， $c。\n\n也许你还不知道，奥格瑞玛现在有了麻烦。在怒焰裂谷深处，一个名为燃刃的阴影议会氏族正在做着各种邪恶的事情。他们主要由兽人组成，我不相信那些连话都说不清楚的粗笨家伙能够妥善利用宝贵的知识。所以你要到那里去，把他们解决掉。\n\n他们应该有两本书。不能让那两本书继续留在燃刃氏族的手里，也不能让它们落尽被遗忘者的手中。你要把它们直接交给我。",dEN="Listen up, <class>.\n\nYou may not know this, but Orgrimmar's got a problem. Deep in Ragefire Chasm, a sect of the Shadow Council called the Searing Blade performs their sinister work. They're mainly orcs, and I can't trust sensitive information in the hands of the grunts there. That's where you come in.\n\nThey should have two books in their possession. I want them kept out of the hands of the Searing Blade and the Forsaken alike. Bring them to me directly.",o="将《暗影法术研究》和《扭曲虚空的魔法》这两本书交给幽暗城的布拉贡·血拳。",oEN="Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Bragor Bloodfist in Undercity.",p="书都妥善保管好了吗？它们必须远离那些不该拿到它们的人。",pEN="Did you secure the books? They need to be kept out of the wrong hands.",c="很好，<class>。你做得不错。我会把这些东西妥善保存，不让旁人窥探；我们最不希望看到的就是一个强大的暗影议会再度崛起。\n\n以后再来找我；看样子这地方总有事要做，我或许还需要另一个能干活的人手。",cEN="Good, <class>. You've done well. I'll keep these safe from prying eyes; the last thing we need is a strong Shadow Council rising up again.\n\nCheck back with me in the future; there's always something that needs doing around here, apparently, and I might need another able body."}
Q[14409]={d="占用你一点时间，$c。\n\n世事无常。我们又一次被迫离开了埃雷萨拉斯废墟，走入外面的世界。我是来研究这座城市的，我不想走远，但是也许你会对这个差事感兴趣。\n\n我的同事准备转至达纳苏斯去找那里的高阶祭司谈谈，希望能借此与他们达成共识。带上这本日记去找神殿中的莫丹特·永影。这东西也许会对他的外交任务有帮助。",dEN="A moment of your time, <class>.\n\nChange is coming. It has drawn us out of the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and into the wide world once more. I have come to research this city and cannot stray from it, but if you are inclined, I have an errand for you.\n\nMy colleague set out for Darnassus to speak with the High Priestess there, that we might come to an understanding. Take this journal to Mordent Evenshade in the temple. It may help in his diplomacy mission.",o="将达罗斯的日记带给身处达纳苏斯的莫丹特·永影。",oEN="Bring Daros' Journal to Mordent Evenshade in Darnassus.",p="看来我可以跟你谈谈。有什么事吗？",pEN="It seems I have time to talk. What is this regarding?",c="啊，达罗斯的著作。他追踪进度一向一丝不苟。他的话或许有助于说明我们走了多远。\n\n感谢你把这些带给我，<race>。一旦人们明白我们并无恶意，或许我们会更常相见。",cEN="Ah, the writings of Daros. He always was meticulous about tracking progress. His words may aid in explaining how far we've come.\n\nYou have my thanks for bringing this to me, <race>. Perhaps we will see more of each other once it is understood we mean no harm."}
Q[14418]={d="辛迪加？我万万想不到。看来奥特兰克的贵族们在背叛之后的这些年里堕落得不轻。\n\n霍金斯会乐意得知此事。既然你在这项发现中起了如此关键的作用，由你把它交给他才最合适。\n\n啊，差点忘了。\n\n$g欢迎你:欢迎你;加入死亡猎手。",dEN="The Syndicate? I would never have suspected. It seems the lords of Alterac have fallen far in the years since their betrayal.\n\nHawkins will be pleased to learn of this, and as you were so instrumental in this discovery, it would be fitting if you were the one to deliver it to him.\n\nAh, and how could I forget?\n\nWelcome to the Deathstalkers.",o="将安德隆的账本交给幽暗城黑暗女王大厅的阿莱里克·霍金斯。",oEN="Deliver Andron's Ledger to Varimathras in the Hall of the Dark Lady in the Undercity."}
Q[14419]={d="这封介绍信应该足以让安德隆相信你就是他一直在等的$g信使:信使;。我见过安德隆，他脑子还没灵光到会那么多疑。\n\n我们的首领怀疑安德隆一直在资助另一个组织。他想知道那是哪个组织，并且需要证据。\n\n我要你去和安德隆谈谈，把情报弄到手。你会在炼金房附近的他的店铺里找到他。",dEN="The letter of introduction should be enough to convince Andron that you are the messenger he's been waiting for. I've met Andron before, he doesn't quite have the mental capacity to be that suspicious.\n\nOur leader suspects that Andron has been providing aid to some other group. He wishes to know what organization this is and requires proof of it.\n\nI want you to speak with Andron, and obtain this information. You'll find him at his shop near the Apothecarium.",o="与幽暗城的安德隆·甘特交谈。",oEN="Speak with Andron Gant in the Undercity."}
Q[14420]={d="想加入黑暗女王的精英卫队——亡灵哨兵的话，你首先必须证明自己的价值。\n\n坦城地说吧，$n，你很可能在这种证明自己价值的任务中丧命，所以我劝你最好三思而行。\n\n现在，我有一个任务要你去完成。有一位来往于银松森林与幽暗城之间的信使，他叫阿斯托·哈德恩，由于特殊的公务需要，我必须得到他身上的一些私人物品。至于采用怎样的策略去得到这些物品，那是你的事情，不要问我。\n\n如果你的好奇心能小一点，不那么关心这些物品的用途的话，你会过得更自在一些。完成这个任务之后，我会再和你谈的。",dEN="If you wish to join the Deathstalkers, the Dark Lady's elite guard, you will have to prove your worth.\n\nI will not lie to you, <name>, this task could mean your death.\n\nI have some things that need attending to. I require the personal effects of Astor Hadren, a messenger who travels between Silverpine and the Undercity. I will leave the method of procurement to your discretion.\n\nIt will be better for you if you know less of the nature of this business. Succeed and I shall tell you more.",o="得到阿斯托的介绍信，并将其交给盗贼区的米奈特·卡加德。",oEN="Get Astor's Letter of Introduction and return it to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter."}
Q[14421]={d="你在我背后的书架上就可以找到记有你的主子最需要的信息的账本。把它交给他们，记得代我问他们好。哦，还有，告诉他们，如果他们觉得与我合作确实不错，并且还打算按日程继续合作下去的话，他们最好还是派你来。",dEN="You'll find the ledger with the information your employers seek on the bookshelf behind me. Deliver it with my regards, and tell them that I would prefer it if they sent you, if they find enough value that they should wish to continue our arrangement.",o="将阿斯托的账本交给幽暗城盗贼区的米奈特·卡加德。",oEN="Bring Andron's Ledger to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of Undercity."}
Q[14443]={d="这把残破的剑柄也有过好日子。当它的剑刃还没有折断的时候，它应该是代表着高超铸造工艺的一件杰出作品。\n\n它上面的精致雕刻和奇异宝石表明这件武器可能属于一个非常强大的人。银色盟约一定会对它感兴趣的。去找到他们在奎尔德拉之冢的代表人。他应该就在银色比武场的南边。",dEN="This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.\n\nThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Silver Covenant members would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representative at Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",o="将残破的剑柄交给奎尔德拉之冢的卡莱迪斯·亮矛。他就在银色比武场的南边。",oEN="Bring the Battered Hilt to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你手上拿的是什么？",pEN="What is it that you have there?",c="<卡莱迪斯从你手中接过剑柄拿在手中缓缓地转动，目不转睛地看了一会。>\n\n它看起来有些熟悉，我应该知道它的来历。你是说你从堡垒里得到的？真有意思。\n\n很少有人能锻造出这样的利刃。也许他们能告诉我们更多你发现东西的信息。",cEN="<Caladis takes the hilt from you and slowly turns it over in his hands.>\n\nThis seems somehow familiar, as though I should know its origins. You say you recovered this in the citadel? Most intriguing.\n\nThere are few who possess the ability to make such a blade. Perhaps they can tell us something about your find."}
Q[14444]={d="肯定错不了——这把剑柄曾经是一件古老强大的武器。但具体情况我就不清楚了。我从没有见过或听说过有这种花纹标记的剑。但这不代表没有人认识它。\n\n克里奥斯塔兹，他更广为人知的名字是克拉苏斯。他一直都是奎尔多雷和肯瑞托的朋友，并拥有广博无边的知识学养。对此他一定知道些什么。到龙眠神殿的顶端，向他询问一下这件事。然后向达拉然银色领地的奥术师泰拜林报告。",dEN="There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recall seeing or hearing of a sword with these markings, but that doesn't mean that all is lost.\n\nKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Arcanist Tybalin inside the Silver Enclave in Dalaran.",o="同龙眠神殿顶端的克拉苏斯交谈。",oEN="Speak to Krasus at the top of Wyrmrest Temple.",c="我们不能将那本书留在夺日者手里。如果我们想识别出那把剑并且将它变成我们的优势我们就必须想一种方法夺回克拉苏斯借给他们的书。",cEN="We can't let that book remain in Sunreaver hands. If we hope to identify the sword and use it to our advantage, we have to find a way to capture the book Krasus lent them."}
Q[14457]={d="我在达拉然下水道的一个线人发现一名夺日者密探正在从黑市的一名商人手里购买药剂。夺日者通常不会出现在那些下水道里。他们在那里一定有着某种不可告人的计划。\n\n到达拉然下水道去，找到那名夺日者密探，把他处理掉，然后在他身上寻找一切有用的情报。也许我们能从他身上知道那部龙眠宝典的所在位置。我们绝不能让夺日者的人把它带回到冰冠冰川去。",dEN="One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Sunreaver agent buying reagents from a dealer in the Black Market area. The Sunreavers normally aren't known for their interest in what goes on down in the sewers, so that's a big indication that they're planning something.\n\nHead into the Underbelly, find this Sunreaver agent, and take care of him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let them get it back to Icecrown first.",o="取得夺日者命令。",oEN="Obtain the Sunreaver Orders.",p="你在密探身上找到有用的东西了吗？",pEN="Did you find anything of use on that agent?",c="<大法师泰巴林检视着缴获的命令>。\n\n你截获的那名特工本应在与逐日者圣殿的法师哈索瑞尔会面后，把龙眠宝典运往冰冠冰川。我们必须拿到那本书，<name>，而这就是我们的机会。不过这可不会轻松。",cEN="<Arcanist Tybalin examines the captured orders.>\n\n\nThe agent you intercepted was supposed to transport the Wyrmrest Tome to Icecrown, after meeting with one Magister Hathorel in Sunreaver's Sanctuary. We have to get that book, <name>, and this is our chance. It's not going to be easy, though."}
Q[14483]={d="这张卡片里面记录了一个疯狂而详细的计划。其目的是感染艾泽拉斯的全部生物。你应该立刻把它交给热砂集团的一名调查员！",dEN="The inside of the card is scribbled with mad, detailed plans to infect most of Azeroth. You should show this to one of Steamwheedle's investigators immediately!",o="将褪色的情人节卡片交给奥格瑞玛的侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Bring the Faded Lovely Greeting Card to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你“照顾”那些恶棍了吗？",pEN="Did you take care of those no-good scheming villains?",c="你手上是什么？\n\n哦，嘿，这可是大事。天大的事。那么多疯狂的细节全都装在这一个小包裹里。多谢——你真帮我们把这些全都收拢了起来。跟你合作很愉快。",cEN="What've you got there?\n\nOh hey, this is big. Real big. Most of the crazy details in one little package. Thanks - you really helped us reel this all in. Good working with ya."}
Q[14488]={d="你做到了？太好了。我一直在等待你来帮忙。现在你就需要去跑一趟了。\n\n穿上这个，然后去找那个药剂公司的头领汉摩尔。这套服装里的纸能够保护你免受他们化学药剂的伤害。记得及时使用这种中和剂，明白吗？",dEN="You made it, huh? Good. I've been waiting for help. No time like the present to act, right?\n\nTake this kit and head deeper inside to serve papers to the leader of that scumbag chemical company, Hummel. The paper's inside. So's a little something to protect you from any chemical tricks they might pull. Use one of the neutralizers when the time comes, all right?",o="将法庭传票送给影牙城堡的药剂师汉摩尔。",oEN="Serve the Court Subpoena to Apothecary Hummel in Shadowfang Keep.",p="我不记得我有订购清洁服务啊，你问为什么？我可是药剂师汉摩尔。\n\n等等……这是什么意思？你认为这张毫无意义的东西能阻止我？哈哈！",pEN="I don't remember ordering a cleaning service... why yes, I am Apothecary Hummel.\n\n...wait, what is the meaning of this? You think these meaningless papers can stop me? Hah!",c="我们在这里做什么不关你的事……",cEN="What we do here is none of your business..."}
Q[14500]={d="隐藏在焰王的阴影之后；\n我长眠于一座邪恶的祭坛之上。",dEN="Hidden behind the shadow of the Firelord;\nUpon an unholy altar I lie dormant.",o="找到第一条线索。",oEN="Find the first clue.",c="当你望向神秘宝珠时，感觉自己陷入了恍惚。无论你如何努力，都无法将目光从宝珠上移开。你注意到它的表面浮现出字迹。\n\n\"啊，看来你已经走到这一步了。现在挑战才真正开始。如果你想继续旅程，去寻找那必然等待着你的宝藏，就仔细听好。\n\n'向西行至白骨之地，\n再向西行，毒蛇游荡之处。\n我居于僻静小岛近旁，\n深锚于潮水之下。'\n\n祝你好运，勇士。\"",cEN="As you look into the Mysterious Orb you feel yourself enter a trance. As hard as you try you cannot stray your gaze from the orb. You notice letters form on its surface.\n\n\"Ah, so you've made it this far. Now the challenge really begins. Listen closely if you wish to continue upon your journey and seek the treasure which lies inevitably for you.\n\n'Travel west to a land of bones,\nThen west again where serpents roam.\nNear secluded isle I do reside,\nAnchored away beneath the tide.'\n\nBest of luck, Champion.\""}
Q[14501]={d="写在宝珠上的话语仿佛刻在了你的记忆中。\n\n‘向西行至白骨之地，\n再向西行，毒蛇游荡之处。\n我居于僻静小岛近旁，\n深锚于潮水之下。’\n\n你确信这将引领你找到第二条线索。",dEN="The words written on the orb seem etched into your memory.\n\n'Travel west to a land of bones,\nThen west again where serpents roam.\nNear secluded isle I do reside,\nAnchored away beneath the tide.'\n\nYou feel confident that this will lead you to the second clue.",o="找到第二条线索。",oEN="Find the second clue.",c="你再次感到一阵迷雾笼罩全身。\n\n\"啊，你做得很好，勇士！你只需再完成最后一项任务，就能证明自己配得上这份馈赠。现在，再仔细听一次。\n\n'我如此渴望被人发现，\n可我的呼喊却沉寂于地下。\n在我上方，我隐约听见雷声轰鸣，\n却被我所憎恶的恶魔咆哮淹没。'\n\n快些，勇士！我怕我的时间正在耗尽。\"",cEN="Once again you feel a haze wash over you.\n\n\"Ah, you've done well champion! You need only complete one final task before you prove you are worthy. Now, listen closely once again.\n\n'I desire so furiously to be found,\nBut my cries fall quiet underground.\nAbove me faintly I hear the thunder roar,\nDrowned out by snarls of demon I abhor.'\n\nQuickly champion! I fear my time may be running out.\""}
Q[14502]={d="写在宝珠上的话语仿佛刻在了你的记忆中。\n\n‘我如此渴望被人发现，\n可我的呼喊却沉寂于地下。\n在我上方，我隐约听见雷声轰鸣，\n却被我所憎恶的恶魔咆哮淹没。’\n\n你确信这将引领你找到第三条线索。",dEN="The words written on the orb seem etched into your memory.\n\n'I desire so furiously to be found,\nBut my cries fall quiet underground.\nAbove me faintly I hear the thunder roar,\nDrowned out by snarls of demon I abhor.'\n\nYou feel confident that this will lead you to the third clue.",o="找到第三条线索。",oEN="Find the third clue.",c="你注意到这一次宝珠比以往任何时候都更加炽烈地闪耀着，同时它再一次攫住了你。\n\n\"勇士，哦我的勇士！你已经证明自己确实配得上我的馈赠！我只剩最后一项考验，那就是解救我，好让我把如此渴望又理应得到的力量赐予你。现在最后仔细听一次，因为细节决定成败。\n\n'被放逐到亡者自由游荡之地，\n那里徘徊着一个持有钥匙的人。\n他居于废墟之间，\n在一处庇护所中畏缩躲藏。\n他会恳求你走上一条正义之路，\n但要提防他所编造的欺瞒。\n他的血必须流淌，钥匙必须由你夺取，\n如此我便能逃离我的牢笼。\n此事办成、你手握我所需之物后，\n前往冬天永不消退之地。\n去往一处隐秘而鲜有人知的圣地，\n解开你渴望知晓的秘密。'\n\n我对你抱有最大的信心，我高贵的勇士。速去，在这最后一项任务中切勿动摇！\"",cEN="You notice the orb glowing more fervently than ever this time as it takes ahold of you once more.\n\n\"Champion, oh my champion! You have proven you are in fact worthy of my gift! I have but one final test, and that is to free me so that I may give you the power you so long for and deserve. Now listen closely one final time as the devil is in the details.\n\n'Exiled to a land where the dead roam free,\nThere wanders a man who holds the key.\nAmongst the ruins he does reside,\nWithin a shelter he cowers and hides.\nA path of righteousness he will implore you to take,\nBut be wary of the deceit he makes.\nHis blood must flow and the key you must take,\nFor then from my prison will I espcape.\nOnce the deed is done and you hold what I need,\nTravel to where winter never recedes.\nTo a place that's hidden and sacred to few,\nAnd unlock the secrets you wish you knew.'\n\nI have the utmost faith in you my noble champion. Make haste and do not falter in this final task!\""}
Q[14503]={d="写在宝珠上的话语仿佛刻在了你的记忆中。\n\n‘被放逐到亡者自由游荡之地，\n那里徘徊着一个持有钥匙的人。\n他居于废墟之间，\n在一处庇护所中畏缩躲藏。\n他会恳求你走上一条正义之路，\n但要提防他所编造的欺瞒。\n他的血必须流淌，钥匙必须由你夺取，\n如此我便能逃离我的牢笼。\n此事办成、你手握我所需之物后，\n前往冬天永不消退之地。\n去往一处隐秘而鲜有人知的圣地，\n解开你渴望知晓的秘密。’\n\n你心中充满了决心。",dEN="The words written on the orb seem etched into your memory.\n\n'Exiled to a land where the dead roam free,\nThere wanders a man who holds the key.\nAmongst the ruins he does reside,\nWithin a shelter he cowers and hides.\nA path of righteousness he will implore you to take,\nBut be wary of the deceit he makes.\nHis blood must flow and the key you must take,\nFor then from my prison will I escape.\nOnce the deed is done and you hold what I need,\nTravel to where winter never recedes.\nTo a place that's hidden and sacred to few,\nAnd unlock the secrets you wish you knew.'\n\nYou are filled with determination.",o="找到钥匙，解救囚徒。",oEN="Find the key and save the prisoner.",p="我的勇士，你拿到钥匙了吗？",pEN="My Champion, do you have the key?",c="当你走近那个你猜想是困于你体内的存在最后牢狱的地方时，你体会到一种全新的感觉。不再是话语掠过宝珠，此刻你看见一双漆黑的眼睛凝视着你，听见一个声音进入你的脑海，尽管你并不确定它从何而来。\n\n\"是的，是的，我的勇士。你做到了！从与你接触的那一刻起，我就知道你配得上我的馈赠。现在，把符文放在宝珠上，好让我重获自由，与你分享我无穷无尽的力量！\"",cEN="As you approach what you presume to be the final prison of the being trapped within you experience a new sensation. Instead of words whisping across the orb you see now a pair dark eyes stairing at you and you hear a voice enter your mind, though you are not sure from where it originates.\n\n\"Yes, yes my champion. You have done it! I knew from the moment I made contact with you that you were worthy of my gift. Now, place the rune upon the orb so that I can be free and share with you my limitless power!\""}
Q[14504]={d="你从德瑟罗克化身的尸体上取得了一张神秘的字条。也许其中有些线索，能说明我接下来该做什么。",dEN="You have received a Mysterious Note on the corpse of the Avatar of Detheroc. Perhaps it will hold some clues as to what I'm meant to do next.",o="交出灵魂石。",oEN="Deliver the Soulstone.",p="啊，英雄！我看你已经收到了我的口信。那么，你究竟在找……英雄，你是从哪里、怎么弄到这种东西的？！求你了，你必须立刻把灵魂石交给我，好让我把它送往达拉然妥善封印，使它不再造成更多危害。",pEN="Ah, Hero! I see you have received my message. Now, what is it that you fou - Hero, Where and how did you come in possession of such a thing?! Please, you must immediately relinquish the soulstone to me so that I may send it off to Dalaran to have it properly sealed away so that it may cause no further harm.",c="你的功绩不应被忽视，也不应得不到奖赏。拿着这枚徽记，作为你将艾泽拉斯从难以言说的邪恶中拯救出来的谢礼。",cEN="Your deeds should not go unnoticed or unrewarded. Here, take this token as a thanks for saving Azeroth from unspeakable evils."}
Q[14505]={d="对自然行使权威是一项令人钦佩的本领。作为猎人，你必须努力学会运用你所选择的任何生物所固有的力量与能力。\n\n掌控一只动物并非易事；这是一项你必须以极大决心去完成的工作。\n\n作为你的第一项任务，拿着这根驯服棒，用它驯服一只衰弱的黑暗猎犬。你可以在布瑞尔附近相当近的地方找到它们。带着黑暗猎犬并肩作战，磨练你的技能，然后回到我这里来。",dEN="It is an admirable skill to command one's authority over nature. As a hunter, you must strive to learn to use the force and power inherent to any creature of your choosing.\n\nGaining control of an animal is not an easy feat; it is a task that you must undertake with much determination.\n\nFor your first assignment, take this taming rod and use it to tame a Decrepit Darkhound. You can find them quite close to Brill. Practice your skills in battle with the Darkhound at your side, then return to me.",o="使用驯服棒驯服一只衰弱的黑暗猎犬。磨练你的技能，然后把驯服棒交还给布瑞尔的维拉·断骨者。",oEN="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Decrepit Darkhound. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Vera Bonecaller in Brill.",p="祝你好运，<class>。",pEN="Good luck <class>.",c="你做得不错，<name>。我相信你已经准备好接受下一项任务了。",cEN="You have done well, <name>. I believe you are ready for your next task."}
Q[14506]={d="你需要驯服的最后一头生物，是一种你应当努力效仿的存在：巨型暮色蝙蝠。掌控这样的力量，正是你身为猎人的宿命。",dEN="The final creature you need to tame is one you should strive to emulate; the Greater Duskbat. To control a force such as this is your fate as a hunter.",o="使用驯服棒驯服一只巨型暮色蝙蝠。磨练你的技能，然后把驯服棒交还给布瑞尔的维拉·断骨者。",oEN="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Greater Duskbat. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Vera Bonecaller in Brill.",p="祝你好运，<class>。",pEN="Good luckg <class>.",c="<name>，你学得很快。你做得不错。",cEN="You are a swift learner, <name>. You have done well."}
Q[14507]={d="现在你已经拥有驯服宠物的能力，但你还必须掌握训练它的技能。\n\n前往幽暗城。在那里你必须与我们最受敬重的猎人之一加雷斯·断骨者交谈。他会赋予你训练新宠物的能力。你会在军事区找到他。\n\n祝你好运，<name>。",dEN="You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it.\n\nTravel to Undercity. There you must speak to one of our most revered hunters, Gareth Bonehunter. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. You will find him in the War Quarter.\n\nGood luck, <name>.",o="与幽暗城的加雷斯·断骨者交谈。",oEN="Speak with Gareth Bonehunter in Undercity.",p="祝你好运，<class>。",pEN="Good luck <class>.",c="一位年轻的<class>，我明白了。没错，我会赐予你训练和引导宠物所需的技能。你不仅能教会宠物新技能，如今还能喂养它，并在它战死时将其复活。\n\n现在，去吧，<class>。我们改日再谈。",cEN="A young <class>, I see. Yes, I will grant you the skills you need to train and guide your pet. Not only will you be able to teach your pet new abilities, you will now be able to feed your pet, as well as revive it, should it fall in battle.\n\nNow, go, <class>. We will speak again, at a later date."}
Q[14508]={d="你好，年轻的猎人。在我看来，你已经足够熟练，可以驾驭一头野兽并将它训练成你的伙伴。\n\n你必须去见布瑞尔的维拉·断骨者。她能引导你走上获得属于自己宠物的道路。",dEN="Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.\n\nYou must see Vera Bonecaller at Brill. She can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own.",o="与提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔的维拉·断骨者交谈。",oEN="Speak with Vera Bonecaller at Brill in Tirisfal.",c="是的，是时候开始你的训练了。",cEN="Yes, it is time for you to begin your training."}
Q[16062]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="寻找认识亚历山德罗斯·莫格莱尼的人。",oEN="Find someone who knew Alexandros Mograine."}
Q[16063]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="血色指挥官莫格莱尼要你去和高阶审判官费尔班克斯谈谈",oEN="Scarlet Commander Mograine wants you to talk to High Inquisitor Fairbanks"}
Q[16064]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="高阶审判官费尔班克斯要你手持堕落灰烬使者，从世上\"净化\"1000个\"邪恶\"。",oEN="High Inquisitor Fairbanks wants you to \"purge\" 1000 \"Evils\" from the face of the world while wielding the Corrupted Ashbringer."}
Q[16065]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="高阶审判官费尔班克斯要你找到并杀死潮汐使者姆格伦。",oEN="High Inquisitor Fairbanks wants you to find and slay Mrgrlgnh the Tidebringer."}
Q[16066]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="高阶审判官费尔班克斯要你带给他40瓶斯坦索姆圣水。",oEN="High Inquisitor Fairbanks wants you to bring him 40 Stratholme Holy Water."}
Q[16067]={d="一些东西。",dEN="Something something.",o="高阶审判官费尔班克斯要你带给他40瓶斯坦索姆圣水。",oEN="High Inquisitor Fairbanks wants you to bring him 40 Stratholme Holy Water."}
Q[16500]={d="我的解脱就在沙德拉阿尔周围的三座祭坛之上。\n\n我子嗣中最强大的那一只很快就会孵化，将这些疯狂异教徒的内脏吞食殆尽。\n\n然而，达金巴已经得知了它们的所在，并已求援。\n\n那只小蚊虫打算一举将我和我的全部子嗣一并毁灭。\n\n如果你能拖住哈卡莱的军队足够久，让我的子嗣孵化，胜利就属于我们。\n\n当你进入沙德拉阿尔时，我已授予你使用其古老防御设施的权利。\n\n利用祭坛的防御击退哈卡莱的军队。战术、策略与周密的计划将是关键。\n\n记住，三颗卵都必须存活，我们才能获胜。",dEN="My liberation lies atop the three altars surrounding Shadra'Alor.\n\nThe most powerful of my brood will soon spawn and feast upon the innards of these crazed heretics.\n\nHowever, Dajemba has learned of their presence and has sent for reinforcements.\n\nThe little gnat intends to destroy both me and my entire brood in one fell swoop.\n\nIf you can hold the Hakkari forces off long enough for my brood to hatch, victory shall be ours.\n\nWhen you entered Shadra'Alor, I granted you access to its ancient defenses.\n\nUse the altars' defenses to repel the Hakkari forces. Tactics, strategy and meticulous planning will be key.\n\nRemember, all three eggs must survive in order for us to triumph.",o="守护沙德拉的卵簇，直到它孵化。",oEN="Defend Shadra's brood until it hatches."}
Q[16502]={d="你完成了不可能的事。黑龙军团的孵化母巢已倒在你脚下。取下她的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="将奥妮克希亚的头颅交给你的对应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to your respective leader.",p="这真的是吗？奥妮克希亚的头颅？",pEN="Is this really it? Onyxia's head?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在与黑龙军团的战斗中，无数生命逝去。如今我们终于给了他们关键一击。没有孵化母巢，就不会再有新的龙卵。\n\n干得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. Now we finally struck a crucial blow against them. No broodmother means no new eggs.\n\nWell done."}
Q[16503]={d="你想要奖赏？除掉孵化母巢难道还不算足够的奖赏吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Broodmother not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="与藏宝海湾的雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这蠢货。你本不该把我自己的信带回给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖赏。好吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[16504]={d="你想要奖赏？除掉孵化母巢难道还不算足够的奖赏吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Broodmother not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="与藏宝海湾的雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",c="我猜你想要奖赏。好吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[16505]={c="一位屠龙者，还是一位经验丰富的制皮师？你总是让我惊叹，英雄。我深感荣幸。\n\n请接受我即将教给你的东西。如果你想摧毁黑龍军团残留的一切，这些知识将无比珍贵。\n\n用母龙的鳞片制作这件披风。它会保护你和你的盟友，抵御黑石之王……奈法利安的烈焰吐息。",cEN="A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.\n\nPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.\n\nCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian."}
Q[17000]={d="该死的迪菲亚闯进来洗劫了我们的补给！我们到底对他们做过什么？当然，除了在他们决定反咬我们之前还喂饱过他们。哼，我可不会容忍！\n\n你可以在离这里不远的东边、迦罗娜登陆点找到他们的营地。狠狠教训他们，然后把补给带回来，我会确保你得到应有的报酬。",dEN="Damn Defias have come through and ransacked our supplies! What did we ever do to them? Other than feed them before they decided to turn on us of course. Well I won't stand for it!\n\nYou can find their encampent not far East of here at Jarod's Landing. Give them hell and then return those supplies and I'll see you compensated appropriately.",o="将失窃的补给交还给帕·麦克卢尔。",oEN="Return the Stolen Supplies to Pa Maclure.",p="搜查得怎么样了？迪菲亚没给你添太多麻烦吧？",pEN="How is your search going? The Defias haven't given you too much trouble, have they?",c="赞美吾王！我还担心再也见不到那些补给了。真不知道没有你我们该怎么办，英雄。",cEN="Praise the King! I was worried we may never see those supplies again. I don't know what we would have done without you, Hero."}
Q[17001]={d="啊，英雄，能耽误你一会儿吗？你看，我碰上了一个大好的商机，正需要你的专长。我最近收到报告说，碧玉矿坑里闹起了蜘蛛——恶心东西。对狗头人来说是坏消息，对我们来说却是大好机会！\n\n据说这些蜘蛛会产出一种非常独特、非常珍贵的丝——镶宝石的蜘蛛丝！我推测这和它们以矿坑内外的狗头人矿工为食有关，不过这只是推测。总之，如果你能给我带回来4份这种镶宝石的蜘蛛丝，我会重重酬谢你！",dEN="Ah, Hero, may I have a moment? You see, I've come across a grand business opportunity and could use your expertise. I've gotten recent reports of a spider infestation—disgusting things—in the Jasperlode Mines. Bad news for the Kobolds, but a great opportunity for us!\n\nApparently the spiders produce a very unique, and very valuable type of silk—Gem Encrusted Spider Silk! I've hypothesized it has something to do with feasting on the kobold miners located in and around the mine, but it's just a theory. Anyway, if you could bring me 4 of these Gem Encrusted Spider Silks I could reward you handsomely!",o="将4份镶宝石的蜘蛛丝交还给萨里恩·鲍登。",oEN="Return 4 Gem Encrusted Spider Silk to Tharynn Bouden.",p="那么，英雄，你闯荡碧玉矿坑的进展如何？",pEN="So, Hero, how goes your foray into the Jasperlode Mine?",c="让我看看你找到了什么——哇！我是说，咳，跟我预想的完全一样。你干得很好，英雄。拿着这个，作为你相助的丰厚报酬。",cEN="Let's see what you've found He—Wow! I mean, ehrm, it's just as I expected. You've done well, Hero. Here, take this as generous payment for your assistance."}
Q[17002]={d="你好！我刚被分配去协助一个研究项目，我想这可能是我向导师证明自己已能承担更多责任的大好机会。\n\n我们正在研究魔力枯竭，为此需要枯竭奥术物质的样本。我想你可以从石槌湖附近的迪菲亚窃贼法师那里收集到。他们很危险，但我听说他们最近施法时常常过度灌注法力，这正合我们所需。\n\n你愿意带回来十颗他们的枯竭法力宝石吗？我会确保你得到报酬。如果这事办成了……说不定我就能试着施展比法师护甲更厉害的法术了！",dEN="Hi there! I just got assigned to help with a research project, and I think this might be my big chance to show the master I am ready for more responsibility.\n\nWe are studying magical depletion, and for that, we need samples of spent arcane matter. I think you can collect them from the Defias Rogue Wizards near Stone Cairn Lake. They're dangerous, but I heard they've been overcasting their spells lately, which makes them perfect for what we need.\n\nWould you be willing to bring back ten of their Depleted Mana Gems? I'll make sure you're rewarded. And if this goes well... maybe I'll get to try casting something bigger than Mage Armor!",o="收集10颗枯竭法力宝石，然后返回阿祖拉之塔。",oEN="Recover 10 Depleted Mana Gems and return to the Tower of Azora.",p="哦！你找到宝石了吗？我连桌上都清出一块地方了，什么都准备好了！",pEN="Oh! Did you find any of the gems? I’ve got a spot cleared on the desk and everything!",c="你拿到了！你真的拿到了！我迫不及待想拿给导师看。我一定会让他知道，这一切都是你促成的。",cEN="You got them! You actually got them! I can't wait to show the master. I’ll make sure he knows you were the one who made it all happen."}
Q[17003]={d="你好！如果这话听着有点奇怪，我很抱歉，不过你愿意帮忙完成一项研究任务吗？\n\n导师开始研究……呃，唾液中的魔法残留。确切地说，是鱼人的唾液。他想看看残留的奥术能量在生物材料中会如何反应。我知道，有点恶心，但也很有趣，对吧？\n\n东谷伐木场营地附近有鱼人潜伏者和觅食者，湖的北面和南面都有。如果你能收集十份它们的唾液样本带回来，我会确保你得到应有的报酬。我甚至准备了一个采集用的瓶子。",dEN="Hi! Sorry if this sounds a little strange, but would you be willing to help with a research assignment?\n\nThe master has begun to study magical residue in... well, spit. Murloc spit, to be precise. He wants to see how lingering arcane energy reacts in biological material. I know, kind of gross, but fascinating, right?\n\nThere are Murloc Lurkers and Foragers near Eastvale Lodging Camp, both north and south of the lake. If you can gather ten samples of their spittle and bring them back, I will make sure you're properly rewarded. I even prepared a vial for collection.",o="取回10份黏稠的鱼人唾液样本，然后返回阿祖拉之塔。",oEN="Retrieve 10 Slimy Murloc Spittle Samples and return to the Tower of Azora.",p="你设法完成了要求的任务吗？",pEN="Did you manage to complete the task requested?",c="谢谢你，<race>。导师会很高兴的。",cEN="Thank you, <race>. The Master will be pleased."}
Q[17004]={d="好像鱼人成灾还不够糟糕似的，我们还有豺狼人在啃咬我们的边境。不是这个麻烦，就是那个麻烦！\n\n为王国和艾尔文森林的人民伸张正义，在这威胁有机会变成真正的问题之前就解除它。给我带回来6把豺狼人幼崽的豺狼人利刃和10把豺狼人先遣者的豺狼人手斧。\n\n你可以沿石槌湖的北端和西北端找到他们的营地。如果你办成了，暴风城军队一定会给你相应的奖赏。",dEN="As if the murloc infestation weren't bad enough, we also have gnolls gnawing at our borders. If it's not one problem, it's another!\n\nDo the kingdom and the people of Elwynn justice and disarm this threat before it even has a chance to become a real problem. Bring me 6 Gnoll Blades from the gnoll runts and 10 Gnoll Axes from their outrunners.\n\nYou can find their encampment along the North and Northwestern ends of Stone Cairn Lake. If you do this, the Stormwind Army will be sure to reward you accordingly.",o="取回6把豺狼人利刃和10把豺狼人手斧，然后返回艾尔文森林东桥的守卫托马斯那里。",oEN="Retrieve 6 Gnoll Blades and 10 Gnoll Axes and return to Guard Thomas at the east Elwynn bridge.",p="那么，豺狼人处理掉了吗？",pEN="So, have the gnolls been dealt with?",c="我和艾尔文森林的人民又少了一件要操心的事。谢谢你，<name>。你为我们所做的一切让我们十分感激。",cEN="That's one less problem I, and the people of Elwynn, need to worry about. Thank you, <name>. What you've done for us is greatly appreciated."}
Q[17005]={d="\"我最亲爱的伊梅尔达。纵然你已迁居暴风城，我希望你知道，任何距离都无法将我们分开。我对你的爱如同无尽燃烧的太阳。你将永远拥有我心中的一角。永远不要忘记。\n\n-伊森\"\n\n我应该试着把这张字条交还给伊梅尔达。她大概会想知道伊森的感受。",dEN="\"My dearest Imelda. Even though you have moved to Stormwind, I hope you know that no distance could ever keep us apart. My love for you is that of infinite burning suns. You shall forever own a piece of my heart. Never forget.\n\n-Ethan\"\n\nI should attempt to return this note to Imelda. She will probably want to know how Ethan felt.",o="把弄脏的字条交还给暴风城的伊梅尔达。",oEN="Return the Smudged Note to Imelda in Stormwind.",p="那是什么？你有东西要给我吗，<name>？",pEN="What's that? You have something for me, <name>?",c="哦，天哪。以圣光之名，<name>！那个伊森总是这么爱演！\n\n我发誓，要是那小子把幻想的一半时间用来真正做点事。唉，这么说吧，他本可以成为一个有成就的人。可他反倒整天坐着生闷气，抱怨事情本可以怎样。\n\n别为伊森担心，<name>。他已经往我这儿送过好多次口信，说他待在一个远离艾尔文的地方，那里「恶魔肆虐大地，野蛮的红色兽人四处游荡，还有裹着绷带的奇怪生物在为太空货物讨价还价」。呸，说得跟真的一样！\n\n总之，谢谢你把这个带给我。我知道你是好意。这点东西算是给你的辛苦费。",cEN="Oh, my, goodness. By the Holy Light, <name>! That Ethan is always so dramatic!\n\nI swear, if that boy spent half the time actually doing something as he does fantasizing. Well, let's just say he could be an accomplished individual. Instead he sits around and sulks and moans about how things could be.\n\nDon't worry about Ethan, <name>. He's had messages delivered to me plenty of times now saying he's in a place far from Elwynn where, 'demons ravage the lands, savage red orcs roam, and strange creatures wrapped in bandges haggle for space goods.' Pffft, as if!\n\nAnyway, thanks for bringing this to me. I know you meant well. Here's for your troubles."}
Q[17006]={d="英雄，我遇到麻烦了。我们的斥候报告说，一支运往湖畔镇的货物被迪菲亚截走了。我需要你夺回那批货物，并让迪菲亚得到应有的下场。\n\n我相信他们还没来得及把货物转移到他们的某个据点。似乎有一小股迪菲亚就在此地以东看守着货物。\n\n遗憾的是我抽不出人手，但如果你杀死8名迪菲亚匪徒，并把货物带回来给我，我会确保你得到相应的报酬。",dEN="Hero, I've got a problem. Our scouts have reported that a shipment that was en route to Lakeshire was intercepted by the Defias. I need you to retrieve that shipment and give the Defias what's coming to them.\n\nI don't believe they've yet had time to move the shipment to one of their safehouses. It seems a small band of Defias is guarding the shipment just East of here.\n\nI unfortunately can't spare the men, but if you kill 8 Defias bandits and return to me with the shipment I will make sure you are compensated appropriately.",o="杀死8名迪菲亚匪徒，并将补给箱交还给山脊角塔的守卫雅各布。",oEN="Slay 8 Defias Bandits and return the Supply Cache to Guard Jacob at Ridgepoint Tower.",p="迪菲亚解决了吗？",pEN="Have the Defias been taken care of?",c="啊，感谢圣光，也感谢你，英雄。你今天为国王立下了大功。要是我现在能抽出一队人手把这批东西送出去就好了。",cEN="Ah, thank the light and thank you, Hero. You've done the King a great service this day. Now if only I could spare a contingent of men to deliver this."}
Q[17007]={d="呃，等一下，英雄。听着，我实在不愿再请你帮个忙，可眼下我确实抽不出任何人手。能否劳烦你大发善心，把这批补给箱送到湖畔镇去？\n\n我想所罗门治安官会很想听听你为他的人民做了什么，我相信他会给你应得的奖赏。",dEN="Uh, one moment, Hero. Listen, I hate to ask another favor of you, but I simply can't spare any men at the moment. Could you be so generous as to deliver this supply cache to Lakeshire.\n\nI think Magistrate Solomon will want to hear of what you did for his people and I'm sure he'll see you rewarded for your good deeds.",o="将补给箱交给湖畔镇的特所罗门治安官。",oEN="Deliver the Supply Cache to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire.",p="这是什么，英雄？",pEN="What's this, Hero?",c="哦，我还在纳闷我们上一支商队到哪儿去了！谢谢你，英雄。你今天为我和湖畔镇的人民立下了大功。要是我能收到国王的回音就好了。",cEN="Oh, I was wondering where our last caravan had gotten off to! Thank you, Hero. You've done me, and the people of Lakeshire, a great service this day. Now if only I could get word back from the King."}
Q[17008]={d="真可惜，<name>。迪菲亚占据了明镜湖果园，正在劫掠<race>的收成。\n\n我们必须夺回他们抢走的东西，免得那些靠这片土地过活的人挨饿。",dEN="It's a shame, <name>. The Defias have overrun the Mirror Lake Orchard and are hijacking the harvest. I remember my mother making her famous Mirror Lake apple pie for me when I was a child. It's something I wish I could share with the rest of the men here at the garrison.\n\nSay, you look like a well traveled <race>. Do you think you could venture to the Mirror Lake Orchard to the northeast of the garrison and gather enough apples there for me to make some pies? I'll even whip a few up for you! Oh, and feel free to give the Defias our regards.",o="取回8个明镜湖苹果，交给西泉要塞的德弗里斯中士。",oEN="Retrieve 8 Mirror Lake Apples and return them to Sergeant De Vries in Westbrook Garrison.",p="你设法夺回一部分收成了吗？",pEN="Did you manage to reclaim some of the harvest?",c="好家伙，<name>，你做到了！请收下这个，作为你善举的报酬。\n\n哦，我迫不及待想看看我把做出来的东西拿给要塞里那些人时他们脸上的笑容！",cEN="Hot darn <name>, you've done it! Please take this as payment for your kindness.\n\nOh, I can't wait to the smiling faces around the garrison when I show them what I've made!"}
Q[17009]={d="地图被海藻和污垢弄得模糊不清。幸好靠下的地方似乎有一些潦草的字迹，你勉强能辨认出来。\n\n\"真不敢相信我们竟然活着从那些可怕的鱼形\\'东西\\'手里逃了出来，而且还顺手带走了它们的财宝！我在图上做了标记，免得忘了把战利品藏在哪儿。要是走了这么远却忘了把箱子扔在哪条船上，那可就太丢人了。我一定会把这张地图放在某个安全的地方，让好奇的眼睛想不到去翻找。\"似乎还有更多潦草的字迹，但你辨认不出。\n\n可依据的线索不多，但看来这张地图所说的宝藏就藏在海浪之下的一处沉船里。",dEN="The map is i smudged with seaweed and dirt. Fortunately there seems to be some text scribbled towards the bottom which you can barely make out.\n\n\"I can't believe we managed to escape those horrendous fish 'things' with our lives, but we somehow made it out with their treasure too! I've marked the map so as not to forget where I've hidden the booty. Would be a shame to come this far only to forget which ship I've thrown the chest in. I'll be sure leave this map someplace safe where prying eye won't think to look.\" There seems to be more scribbled down, but you can't make it out.\n\nThere's not much to go off of, but it would seem the treasure this map speaks of is hidden beneath the waves in one of the shipwrecks.",o="在西部荒野外海寻找浸水的箱子。",oEN="Find the Waterlogged Trunk off the coast of Westfall.",p="这一定就是地图上说的那个箱子！",pEN="This must be the chest spoken of from the map!",c="这……看起来不像宝藏。不过，再想想……也许探险者协会的人会了解更多。",cEN="This... doesn't look like treasure. Then again... perhaps someone from the Explorers' League would know more about this."}
Q[17010]={d="这尊神像看上去是对鱼人的理想化诠释，牙齿和眼睛都格外大。但愿这东西对某人来说值点钱。\n\n如果说有人会对另一个文明的艺术品感兴趣，那一定是铁炉堡的探险者协会。也许他们能给出答案。",dEN="The idol looks like an idealized interpretation of a murloc, with very large teeth and eyes. Hopefully this will be worth something to somebody.\n\nSurely if anyone would be interested in a artifact from another civilization it would be the Explorers' League in Ironforge. Perhaps they have the answers.",o="将雕刻的鱼人神像带到铁炉堡的探险者协会",oEN="Bring the Carved Murloc Idol to the Explorers' League in Ironforge",p="这是什么，<name>？你有东西要给我吗？",pEN="What's this, <name>? Have you got something for me?",c="哎呀，这可真有意思！人们对鱼人知之甚少，对它们的研究更是少之又少，但这件独特的饰品或许能引起我几位同僚的兴趣。\n\n报酬不多，因为我们大部分经费都投入到冰雪北境的探索中去了，但还是请代表探险者协会收下这个吧。",cEN="Why, this is quite interesting indeed! There's not much known about the murlocs, and there's even less research being done on them, but this unique trinket will perhaps spark the interest of some of my fellow members.\n\nIt's not much, as most of our funds are being funneled in exploring the frozen North, but please take this on behalf of the Explorers' League."}
Q[17011]={d="真见鬼，<name>，看看我的农场！倒不是说如今还有什么可看的。起初也没多少东西，可我有抱负！现在……现在我什么都没有了，全都是因为那些该死的豺狼人！\n\n听着，<name>，我没多少东西，但请给一个可怜农夫他应得的东西——复仇！我要你出去，把你能找到的豺狼人一个不剩地杀光。一个。都。不。留。\n\n在你至少解决掉8名河爪蛮兵、12只河爪恶犬和10名河爪草药师之后，回到我这里领取奖赏。你应该能在西边找到这些豺狼人，再往北、与海岸平行的地方还有更多。还有，<name>，你要是过一会儿就数不清了，我也不介意，你懂我的意思。",dEN="Confoundit, <name>, look at my farm! Not that there's much to look at nowadays. It wasn't much to begin with, but I had ambition! Now... now I have nothing, and it's all because of those damn gnolls!\n\nListen <name>, I don't have much, but give a poor farmer what's owed to him—revenge! I want you to go out there and slay every last gnoll you find. Every. Last. One.\n\nOnce you've dealt with at least 8 Riverpaw Brutes, 12 Riverpaw Mongrels, and 10 Riverpaw Herbalists then return here to me for your reward. You should be able to find these gnolls to the West and then more to the North, parallel to the coast. And <name>, I wouldn't mind if you lost count after a while, if you know what I mean.",o="杀死8名河爪蛮兵、12只河爪恶犬和10名河爪草药师。",oEN="Slay 8 Riverpaw Brutes, 12 Riverpaw Mongrels, and 10 Riverpaw Herbalists.",p="你做到了吗，<name>？豺狼人都死光了吗？",pEN="Have you done it, <name>? Are the gnolls all dead?",c="<name>，你帮了很大的忙，减轻了这可怜老农夫的痛苦。就像我说的，东西不多，但请收下我剩下的这点作为报酬。",cEN="You've done a lot to help ease the pain of this poor ole' farmer, <name>. Like I said, it's not much, but please take what I have left as payment."}
Q[17012]={d="你已经帮了一个可怜农夫大忙，<name>，但我的复仇还没有得到满足。只要还有活着的豺狼人在喘气就不算完。\n\n我知道东边还有另一个豺狼人营地。我要他们死！至少杀死12名河爪强盗、10名河爪监工和8名河爪秘法师，也许到那时我终于能安息了。至少是一个希望和梦想都摆在眼前的人所能有的那份安宁。",dEN="You've already done a poor farmer a great service, <name>, but my revenge is not yet sated. Not while there are still gnolls alive a drawing breath.\n\nI know there's another encampment of gnolls to the East. I want them dead! Slay at least 12 Riverpaw Bandits, 10 Riverpaw Taskmasters and 8 Riverpaw Mystics, and maybe then I can finally be at peace. At least as much peace as one can be with his hope and dreams laid bare before him.",o="杀死12名河爪强盗、10名河爪监工和8名河爪秘法师。",oEN="Slay 12 Riverpaw Bandits, 10 Riverpaw Taskmasters, and 8 Riverpaw Mystics.",p="我倒想想象你杀死的每一只豺狼人的惨叫。到现在你杀了多少了？",pEN="I'd like to picture the screams of every gnoll you slay. How many have you slain so far?",c="哈！我希望那些豺狼人永远都缓不过你今天给他们的这记重击！再说一次，东西不多，但请收下我这点微薄的谢礼，作为你为我所做一切的报酬。",cEN="Hah, I hope those gnolls never recover from the blow that you've dealt them this day! Again, it's not much, but please accept my humble offer as payment for what you've done for me."}
Q[17013]={d="这似乎是迪菲亚与风险投资公司之间某种有利可图的协议，但你不确定它意味着什么。你确信有职权的人会对这份文件感兴趣。也许是格里安·斯托曼？",dEN="This appears to be some sort of lucrative arrangment between the Defias and Venture Co., but you're not sure what it implies. You're certain someone of authority would be interested in this document. Gryan Stoutmantle perhaps?",o="将迪菲亚贸易协议交还给哨兵岭的格里安·斯托曼。",oEN="Return the Defias Trade Agreement to Gyan Stoutmantle in Sentinel Hill.",p="怎么了，英雄？你有什么要给我？",pEN="Yes, Hero? What is it you have for me?",c="我不清楚这份文件究竟意味着什么，英雄，但我想可以肯定地说，这不是好事。我会派一名信使把它呈给国王。\n\n谢谢你，英雄，感谢你对我们对抗迪菲亚行动的一贯支持。为了联盟！",cEN="I don't know exactly what this document implies, Hero, but I think it's safe to say it's not good. I'll have a runner deliver this to the King.\n\nThank you, Hero, for your continued support in our campaign against the Defias. For the Alliance!"}
Q[17014]={d="<name>，见识过你的本事之后，我想我还有一笔交易要和你谈。你看，收割守望者并不是唯一占据这些昔日肥沃农田的东西。\n\n从这里往东南方，就是如今被称作死亡之地的所在。在那里你会找到收割收割者。它们和收割守望者一样，只是更凶恶，不过我想这对你来说不成问题。\n\n等你杀掉15只之后回来找我，我会确保你的时间没有白费。",dEN="<name>, after seeing what you're capable of I think I have another offer to make. You see, the Harvest Watchers aren't the only things that have claimed these once fertile farmlands.\n\nTo the Southeast of here is what they now call the Dead Acre. There you will find Harvest Reapers. They're just like the Harvest Watchers only meaner, but I don't think that will be a problem for you.\n\nCome back to me once you've slain 15 of 'em and I'll make sure it's worth your time.",o="农夫萨丁要你杀死15只收割收割者。",oEN="Farmer Saldean wants you to kill 15 Harvest Reapers.",p="你处理掉那些收割收割者了吗，<name>？",pEN="Have you dealth with the Harvest Reapers, <name>?",c="他人的善意总是让我惊叹，<name>。以你这种尽职尽责的作风，我想你一定会为联盟做出伟大的事。",cEN="The kindness of others never ceases to amaze me, <name>. With your call to duty, I imagine you will go on to do great things for the Alliance."}
Q[17838]={d="英雄，邪恶的血槌食人魔已经侵占了刀锋山的南部地区！他们残暴的战士和凶猛的恐狼威胁着该地区的稳定。我谦卑地请求你协助削减他们的数量。向南进发，杀死那些在这片土地上出没的血槌蛮兵、苦工、酿酒师和恐狼。如此一来，你将削弱血槌的钳制，让这片土地对所有人都更安全。",dEN="Hero, the vile Bloodmaul ogres have overrun the southern reaches of Blade's Edge! Their brutal warriors and ferocious dire wolves threaten the stability of the region. I humbly request your aid in thinning their numbers. Journey south and slay the Bloodmaul brutes, drudgers, brewmasters, and dire wolves that stalk the land. Doing so will weaken the Bloodmaul's stranglehold and make the land safer for all.",o="杀死刀锋山南部的血槌食人魔和恐狼。",oEN="Slay Bloodmaul ogres and wolves in Southern Blade's Edge Mountains.",c="你今天立下了大功，英雄。多亏你的努力，血槌的威胁已经减弱。纳格兰如今更安全了，为此我向你致以最深的谢意。",cEN="You have done a great service this day, Hero. The Bloodmaul threat has been reduced thanks to your efforts. Nagrand is now safer, and for that you have my deepest gratitude."}
Q[17839]={d="刃拳食人魔变得胆大妄为，如今威胁着刀锋山的安全。他们的萨满与黑暗力量沟通，而他们的战士和迅猛龙则恐吓着这片土地。我请求你削减他们的数量——杀死他们的萨满、蛮兵、迅猛龙和防御者。如此一来，你将削弱他们对这一地区的掌控，让它对所有人都更安全。",dEN="Bladespire ogres have become emboldened and now threaten the security of Blade's Edge Mountains. Their shamans commune with dark powers while their warriors and raptors terrorize the land. I ask that you thin their numbers - slay their shamans, brutes, raptors, and defenders. Doing so will weaken their hold over the region and make it safer for all.",o="杀死刀锋山的刃拳食人魔。",oEN="Slay Bladespire ogres in Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17840]={d="刀锋山的食人魔今晚打算举办一场盛大的宴会。他们的麦酒储备满得快要溢出来。我有个提议：我们就在他们眼皮底下把麦酒偷走！在他们哨站周围找到空酒杯和酒桶，用食人魔的储备把它们装满。据我们报告，他们把大部分新酿的麦酒都存在哨站某处的一个大酒桶里。\n\n带着偷来的麦酒回来，我们就有足够的酒供全村畅饮了。你说呢？你愿意执行这次大胆的偷酒行动吗？",dEN="Ogres of Blade's Edge are planning a grand feast tonight. Their ale stores are overflowing with drink. I have a proposition for you - let us steal their ale right from under their noses! Find their empty steins and kegs around their outpost, and fill them from the ogre's reserves. According to our reports, they're storing most of the newly made ale in a large keg somewhere in the outpost.\n\nReturn with the pilfered ale, and we'll have drink aplenty for the village. What say you? Will you conduct this daring ale raid?",o="从刀锋山的食人魔那里偷取麦酒。",oEN="Steal ale from the ogres of Blade's Edge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17841]={d="我有令人不安的消息——血槌食人魔打算用恐狼獠牙作原料，开始大批量酿造一种邪恶的饮品。这种混合物必定会增强他们的力量和凶性。我需要你去阻挠他们的行动。深入刀锋山，杀死恐狼并收集它们的獠牙。此外，潜入血槌营地，没收他们的蒸馏手册。这样做将打乱他们的行动，防止更大的危害。你能接下这项任务吗？",dEN="I have troubling news - the Bloodmaul ogres plan to begin mass production of a vile brew using dire wolf fangs as an ingredient. This concoction is sure to increase their strength and viciousness. I need you to hamper their efforts. Venture into Blade's Edge Mountains, slay dire wolves and collect their fangs. Also, infiltrate Bloodmaul camps and confiscate their distillation manuals. Doing so will disrupt their operations and prevent further harm. Can you handle this task?",o="在刀锋山收集恐狼獠牙和血槌蒸馏手册。",oEN="Collect Dire Wolf Fangs and Bloodmaul Distillation Manuals in Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17842]={d="锯齿山脊锋利的山峰上满是雷神恐狼和刃翼放血者。它们的嚎叫与尖啸日夜回荡在这些山脉之间。我恳求你前往锯齿山脊，削减它们的数量。杀死那些在这片土地上肆虐的野蛮恐狼和嗜血放血者。如此一来，此地将重归安宁平静。",dEN="The razor-sharp peaks of Jagged Ridge are overrun by Thunderlord Direwolves and Bladewing Bloodletters. Their howls and shrieks echo day and night across these mountains. I beseech you, venture to Jagged Ridge and cull their numbers. Slay the savage direwolves and bloodthirsty bloodletters that ravage the land. Doing so will restore peace and quiet to this place.",o="杀死锯齿山脊的雷神恐狼和刃翼放血者。",oEN="Slay Thunderlord Direwolves and Bladewing Bloodletters in Jagged Ridge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17844]={d="恶魔已在死亡之门设立据点，用他们邪恶的阴谋亵渎着这座神圣的山谷。他们的士兵、领主和技术人员不停地工作，腐化着这片土地。我恳求你深入死亡之门，大批歼灭盘踞在那里的恶魔。杀死他们的士兵、领主和技术人员，打乱他们的黑暗计划。",dEN="Demons have set up operations in Death's Door, defiling the sacred valley with their wicked machinations. Their soldiers, overlords, and technicians work ceaselessly to corrupt these lands. I beseech you, venture into Death's Door and decimate the Demons that reside there. Slay their soldiers, overlords, and technicians to disrupt their dark plans.",o="杀死死亡之门的邪恶恶魔。",oEN="Slay the vile demons at Death's Door.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17845]={d="鳞翼岩架的木台上爬满了各种爬行动物。它们的数量已失控增长，打破了岩架生态系统的微妙平衡。我请求你削减它们的数量——杀死那些侵占鳞翼岩架的毒蛇、鞭尾和潜伏者，好让平衡得以恢复。",dEN="The ledges of Scalewing Shelf crawl with all manner of reptiles. Their numbers have grown out of control, disrupting the delicate balance of the shelf's ecosystem. I ask that you thin their population - slay the serpents, lashtails, and stalkers that have overrun Scalewing Shelf, so that equilibrium may be restored.",o="杀死鳞翼岩架的鳞翼毒蛇、匕首颚鞭尾和脊刺潜伏者。",oEN="Slay Scalewing Serpents, Daggermaw Lashtails, and Ridgespine Stalkers on Scalewing Shelf.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17846]={d="维克尼尔氏族的鸦人已经醉心于力量，用黑暗魔法征服其他氏族。他们的唤风者扭曲元素，而死亡猎鹰和锐眼则从空中制造恐慌。我请求你协助将他们从高处掀翻。前往维卡尔哨站，杀死他们的唤风者、死亡猎鹰和锐眼。如此一来，你将削弱他们的力量，打破他们对这一地区的掌控。",dEN="The arakkoa of the Vekh'nir clan have become drunk with power, using dark magics to subjugate the other clans. Their stromcallers bend the elements, while deathhawks and keeneyes terrorize from above. I ask that you help topple them from their perch. Venture to Vekhaar Stand and slay their stromcallers, deathhawks, and keeneyes. Doing so will weaken their forces and break their hold over the region.",o="杀死维卡尔哨站的维克尼尔鸦人。",oEN="Slay Vekh'nir Arakkoa at Vekhaar Stand."}
Q[17848]={d="<name>，刀锋山的野蛮格隆长期以来既恐吓着当地的食人魔，也恐吓着兽人。但特罗格玛领地出现了一个新的威胁——维克尼尔，一个掌握致命虚空魔法的鸦人放逐者氏族。\n\n他们的暗影魔法使他们能在不被察觉的情况下跟踪猎物，直到为时已晚。许多无辜者已经死于他们怯懦的伏击。但今天我们将是猎人，而不是猎物。帮我从特罗格玛领地清除这些虚空生物，好让兽人和食人魔都能不再惧怕维克尼尔的诅咒。杀死他们的战士、斥候和秘法师——只有这样，特罗格玛领地才能重归安全。",dEN="<name>, the savage gronn of Blade's Edge Mountain have long terrorized the indigenous ogres and orcs alike. But a new threat has emerged in Trogma's Claim - the Vekh'nir, a clan of arakkoa outcasts wielding deadly void magic.\n\nTheir shadowy magic allows them to stalk their prey undetected, until it is too late. Many innocents have already fallen to their cowardly ambushes. But today we will be the hunters, not the hunted. Help me purge these void creatures from Trogma's Claim so that orcs and ogres alike may live without fear of the Vekh'nir's curses. Slay their warriors, their scouts, and their mystics alike - only then will Trogma's Claim be safe once more.",o="杀死特罗格玛领地的维克尼尔，以消除维克尼尔虚空召唤者氏族的威胁。",oEN="Slay Vekh'nir in Trogma's Claim to remove the threat of the Vekh'nir voidcaller clan.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17849]={d="<name>，鸣唱山脊崖壁上点缀的古老水晶回荡着强大的元素魔力。我正在研究如何为正义驾驭它们的能量，但需要样本才能继续研究。前往山脊，收集3块与流水调和的蓝色水晶、3块与火焰调和的红色水晶和3块与大地调和的黄色水晶。有了这些样本，我将在研究中开辟新的道路，这可能对我们的目标大有裨益。搜寻时务必小心，英雄——鸣唱山脊的野兽十分凶猛，会誓死守卫自己的领地。",dEN="<name>, the ancient crystals that dot the cliffs of Singing Ridge resonate with powerful elemental magic. I am studying ways to harness their energies for good, but require samples to continue my research. Venture to the ridge and gather 3 blue crystals attuned to water, 3 red crystals attuned to fire, and 3 yellow crystals attuned to earth. With these samples I will unlock new paths in my studies that could greatly benefit our cause. Tread carefully in your search, hero - the wildlife of Singing Ridge is fierce and will protect their domain.",o="在鸣唱山脊收集水晶，用于元素研究。",oEN="Gather Crystals in Singing Ridge for elemental research.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17850]={d="<name>，我们对维克尼尔的攻势进展顺利——他们在特罗格玛领地的数量正在减少。但新问题出现了：他们的巢穴仍散布在山间，每一处都装满成打的卵。若放任不管，他们迟早会补充兵力。我不能容许这种情况发生。前往他们的筑巢地，英雄，收集他们的卵。带给我，好让我妥善处理掉。",dEN="<name>, our campaign against the Vekh'nir has gone well - their numbers are dwindling in Trogma's Claim. But a new problem has emerged - their nests still dot the mountains, each filled with dozens of eggs. If left alone, they will replenish their ranks in time. I cannot allow that. Venture into their nesting grounds, hero, and gather their eggs. Bring them to me so I may properly dispose of them. The Vekh'nir must not rise again in Trogma's Claim. tread wary, hero, the remaining Vekh'nir will defend their nests fiercely. But this is a task that must be done for the safety of all.",o="在特罗格玛领地收集维克尼尔的卵，以阻止这个邪恶鸦人氏族重生。",oEN="Gather Vekh'nir Eggs in Trogma's Claim to prevent the rebirth of the sinister arakkoa clan.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17851]={d="<name>，在斯卡尔德周围游荡的元素生物和被火焰扭曲的生物已经变得极其危险，因为它们赖以生存的热泉受到扰动而变得不稳定。它们正在袭击所有靠近的人，扰乱我们的行动。我请求你前往刀锋山的斯卡尔德附近，杀死灼热元素、灼烧小鬼和烫伤蜥蜴。铲除这些威胁，让我们得以继续安全作业。",dEN="<name>, the elementals and fire-twisted creatures around Skald have become dangerously aggressive as of late. Their flames threaten to consume our outpost. I need someone to thin their numbers and remind them this is our territory. Seek out the Searing Elementals, Scorch Imps and Scalded Basilisks infesting the area and extinguish six of each. Show them that Skald will not tolerate their fiery intrusion. With fewer fire creatures skulking about, our outpost will be safer. I know I can count on a champion like yourself to get the job done, hero. Make haste - we cannot afford to let their numbers grow.",o="杀死刀锋山斯卡尔德附近的灼热元素、灼烧小鬼和烫伤蜥蜴。",oEN="Slay Searing Elementals, Scorch Imps and Scalded Basilisks around Skald in Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17852]={d="<name>，巴什尔登陆点的邪恶虚灵已成为刀锋山的一大祸害。他们的奥术师、窃法者和袭击者袭击旅人，掠夺资源，毫无顾忌。我请求你前往巴什尔登陆点消灭他们。削弱他们的势力，让这片土地能摆脱他们的掠夺。",dEN="<name>, the sinister ethereals of Bash'ir Landing have become a scourge across Blade's Edge Mountains. Their raiders attack caravans, their arcanists steal powerful relics, and their spell-thieves siphon magic from the land. I need someone to break their power so that other innocents do not suffer their depravations. Venture to Bash'ir Landing and slay eight of their raiders, spell-thieves and arcanists each. Show them there is a steep price for their villainy. This will not end their threat completely, but it will give them pause and provide some measure of justice. I know you are up to the task, champion. Make haste, before they can inflict more harm.",o="杀死刀锋山巴什尔登陆点的巴什尔奥术师、巴什尔窃法者和巴什尔袭击者。",oEN="Slay Bash'ir Arcanists, Bash'ir Spell-Thieves and Bash'ir Raiders at Bash'ir Landing in Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17853]={d="<name>，鲁安林地的拜龙教是一大持续威胁，他们致命的箭矢从暗影中飞来，让所有经过的人心惊胆战。我们必须削弱他们的战力。前往鲁安林地，找回他们丢失的箭矢供我们分析。了解他们的箭矢构造，也许就能找到克制他们的办法。",dEN="<name>, the wyrmcult of Ruuan Weald are a constant threat, their deadly arrows flying from the shadows. But many of their ambushes are thwarted by brave defenders, and the cultists are forced to flee, abandoning their weapons. Venture into the weald and recover 8 of their lost arrows. Do not engage the cultists directly - discretion is the better part of valor. With these recovered arrows, we can analyze their enchantments and devise stronger protections. The wyrmcult will rue the day they provoked our wrath. Make haste - the weald is vast and scattered with ruins where the arrows may lie.",o="在鲁安林地找回拜龙教丢失的箭矢，以供后续分析。",oEN="Recover Wyrmcult Lost Arrows in Ruuan Weald for later analysis.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17854]={d="<name>，邪恶的鲁安诺克支配着鲁安林地的生物，迫使它们服从自己的命令。他们的天怒者、鸦卫、云眼和蜥蜴威胁着这片土地上的所有人。我们必须打破他们的控制。前往鲁安林地，杀死他们的天怒者、鸦卫、云眼和鲁安林地蜥蜴。解放这些生物，让它们重归自然秩序。",dEN="<name>, the vile Ruuan'ok hold sway over the creatures of Ruuan Weald, forcing them to do their bidding through dark magic. Their matriarchs lead grim rituals, their ravenguards enforce their will, and their cloudgazers spy from afar. We must end their corrupt rule if there is to be peace. Venture into the weald and slay three of their skyfurys, ravenguards and cloudgazers each. Also slay three of their enthralled basilisks to free them from the Ruuan'ok's control. It will be dangerous, but I know you have the strength to succeed. Go now and deliver the Ruuan Weald from their wicked grasp!",o="杀死鲁安林地的鲁安诺克天怒者、鸦卫、云眼和鲁安林地蜥蜴。",oEN="Slay Ruuan'ok Skyfurys, Ravenguards, Cloudgazers and Ruuan Weald Basilisks in Ruuan Weald.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17856]={d="<name>，鲁安林地的拜龙教用致命的斧头和受诅咒的弓恐吓着这片土地。如果我们不加以制止，他们还会继续制造混乱。我请求你收集他们的武器——偷猎者之弓和砍伐者之斧。剥夺他们的武装，我们就能削弱他们的力量。",dEN="<name>, the wyrmcult of Ruuan Weald terrorize the land with their deadly axes and cursed bows. If we are to drive them back, we must separate them from their vile weapons. Venture into their camps and relieve five of their poachers of their spiteful bows. Also, take the hewer axes from 5 of their lumberers to break their supply chains. Bring these weapons to me so they may never again draw blood. The wyrmcult's reign ends today, hero. Make haste, and be wary - even disarmed, they remain dangerous foes.",o="在鲁安林地收集拜龙教偷猎者之弓和拜龙教砍伐者之斧。",oEN="Collect Wyrmcult Poacher Bows and Wyrmcult Hewer Axes in Ruuan Weald.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17857]={d="<name>，此地的野蛮巨砾莫克食人魔变得越来越敌对，袭击旅人、劫掠商队。他们的蛮兵和萨满正带头作乱。我们必须予以回击。前往巨砾莫克，杀死他们的蛮兵和萨满。削弱他们的力量，让这片土地恢复安全。",dEN="<name>, the savage Boulder'mok ogres of this region have become increasingly hostile, attacking travelers and settlements alike in their brutal raids. I need someone to break their power and remind them that such actions will not be tolerated. Venture into their camps and slay six of their ferocious brutes as well as four of their barbaric shamans. Show them that there are consequences for their savagery. This will not end their threat for good, but it will make them think twice before mindlessly attacking innocents again. I know you have the fortitude to take on this task. Go now, and teach the Boulder'mok a lesson in civility they won't soon forget!",o="杀死巨砾莫克的巨砾莫克蛮兵和萨满。",oEN="Slay Boulder'mok Brutes and Shamans in Boulder'mok.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17858]={d="英雄，格里什纳斯的渡鸦林已经变得阴暗而充满敌意。远古树人以及恶毒的生物在其中游荡，让这片森林变成了危险之地。我们必须恢复此地的平衡。前往格里什纳斯，杀死渡鸦林的叶须者、恐怖渡鸦和渡鸦林石皮者。清除腐化，让森林得以复苏。",dEN="The forest of Raven's Wood in Grishnath has become dark and hostile, hero. Ancient treants and vicious ravens alike attack any who wander beneath its eaves. I believe dark magics are at work, twisting the creatures against their nature. Please, venture into the wood and slay 6 of the corrupted Leafbeard treants and six of the frenzied Dire Ravens. Also, seek out and destroy the elder treant Stonebark - he must be the source of the forest's blight. With his destruction, balance may be restored to Raven's Wood. Tread wary, hero - the creatures may appear benign but will show no mercy. For the good of the land, the forest must be cleansed.",o="杀死格里什纳斯渡鸦林的渡鸦林叶须者、恐怖渡鸦和渡鸦林石皮者。",oEN="Slay Raven's Wood Leafbeards, Dire Ravens and Raven's Wood Stonebark in Grishnath.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17859]={d="刀锋山的格里什纳鸦人长期以来一直威胁着外域的 innocent 生物。但近来，他们的袭击比以往更加大胆、更加残暴。斥候报告说，格里什纳正在聚集黑暗魔法，准备发动全面进攻。必须在这些邪恶的鸟人将邪恶散播到整个大地之前阻止他们！\n\n英雄，外域的人民需要你的帮助。前往格里什纳的鸦人村庄格里什纳斯，终结他们邪恶的计划。找出他们的战士——格里什纳蔑鸦者、先驱者等等——在他们发动攻击之前将其击败。外域的存亡取决于你，勇士。绝不要让黑暗得逞！",dEN="The Grishna arakoa of Blade's Edge Mountains have long been a threat to the innocent creatures of Outland. But lately, their attacks have grown bolder and more brutal than ever before. Scouts report that the Grishna are gathering dark magics and preparing for an all-out assault. These sinister bird-men must be stopped before their evil spreads across the land!\n\nHero, the people of Outland need your help. Journey to the Grishna village of Grishnath and put an end to their vile plans. Seek out their warriors - the Grishna Scorncrows, Harbingers and more - and vanquish them before they can carry out their attack. The survival of Outland depends on you, champion. Do not let the darkness prevail!",o="调查格里什纳斯，杀死格里什纳鸦人，以挫败他们对外域即将发动的进攻。",oEN="Investigate Grishnath and slay Grishna arakoa to thwart their impending attack on Outland.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17860]={o="在渡鸦林收集木柴，交给希尔瓦纳的治疗者。",oEN="Gather Wooden Logs in Raven's Wood for the healers of Sylvanaar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17861]={d="格里什纳斯的鸦人是一个骄傲而古老的种族，但他们的历史笼罩在谜团之中。学者们相信，隐藏在村庄废墟中的远古遗物或许能揭开格里什纳过去的秘密。这些知识对付我们这些长羽毛的敌人可能价值连城。",dEN="The arakoa of Grishnath are a proud and ancient race, but their history is shrouded in mystery. Scholars believe ancient relics hidden amongst the ruins of their village could unlock the secrets of the Grishna past. This knowledge could prove invaluable against our feathered foe.",o="在格里什纳斯废墟中发现遗失的格里什纳遗物，以研究他们的起源。",oEN="Discover lost Grishna relics in the ruins of Grishnath for researching their origins.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17862]={d="熔炉营地：愤怒长期以来一直是军团在刀锋山势力的堡垒。如今，我们的斥候报告说，由于许多老兵被调往别处作战，该营地已变得易于攻击。这是我们给军团致命一击、消除他们在此地区立足点的大好机会。\n\n英雄，带头进攻熔炉营地：愤怒。杀死他们残余的防御者——愤怒猎犬、熔炉守卫、腐蚀者和代言者。一旦清空营地，我们就能将其据为己有。这是一个不容错失的关键机会。立刻出发，为外域的无辜民众赢得胜利！",dEN="Forge Camp: Wrath has long served as a bastion of Legion power in Blade's Edge Mountains. Now, our scouts report the camp is vulnerable to attack, with many veteran warriors called away to battle elsewhere. This is our chance to deal a crushing blow to the Legion and remove their foothold from this region.\n\nHero, lead the charge against Forge Camp: Wrath. Slay their remaining defenders - the Wrath Hounds, Furnace Guards, Corruptors and Speakers. With the camp cleared, we can claim it for our own forces. This is a vital opportunity we cannot waste. Ride out now and secure victory for the innocent peoples of Outland!",o="趁营地兵力空虚时突袭熔炉营地：愤怒，消灭其残余部队。",oEN="Assault Forge Camp: Wrath and eliminate their remaining forces while the camp is vulnerable.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17863]={d="不祥的传言围绕着可憎的熔炉营地：恐惧。我们的斥候报告说，盘踞在那里的恶魔正策划对刀锋山无辜生物的大屠杀。这些残忍的存在活着只为散播混乱与毁灭。绝不能让他们的滔天阴谋得逞！\n\n英雄，需要你的本领在这场屠杀开始之前将其阻止。前往熔炉营地：恐惧，消灭他们的部队——深渊燃焰者、邪恶火魂和恐惧恶鬼。对这些邪恶的恶魔不要手软。外域的善良人民正指望你阻止这场即将来临的流血。愿你的刀刃施以迅速的正义！",dEN="Dark rumors swirl around the vile Forge Camp: Terror. Our scouts report the demons that dwell there are planning a murderous rampage against the innocent creatures of Blade's Edge. These cruel beings live only to sow chaos and destruction. They cannot be allowed to carry out their heinous designs!\n\nHero, your skills are needed to stop this massacre before it begins. Journey to Forge Camp: Terror and eliminate their forces - the Abyssal Flamebringers, Vile Fire-Souls and Fear Fiends. Show no mercy to these wicked demons. The good people of Outland are depending on you to halt this impending bloodshed. May your blades deal swift justice!",o="阻止熔炉营地：恐惧的恶魔即将发动的屠杀。",oEN="Stop an impending massacre by the demons of Forge Camp: Terror.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17864]={d="在旋涡尖塔的生物身上发现了奇特的晶体异常。当地的野生动物，如碎皮野猪、以太鳐和埃匹希斯剥皮者，似乎都被闪耀的棱光水晶所灌注。必须在现象加剧之前查明这些变异的来源。",dEN="Strange crystalline anomalies have been spotted amongst the creatures of the Vortex Pinnacle. Local wildlife like the Shard-Hide Boars, Aether Rays and Apexis Flayers appear infused with shimmering prismatic crystals. The source of these mutations must be determined before the phenomenon escalates.",o="杀死旋涡尖塔中被水晶变异的生物。",oEN="Slay Vortex Pinnacle creatures mutated by crystals.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17865]={d="人们在刀锋山发现了一座古老的埃匹希斯纪念碑，但它的力量仍处于休眠状态。传说有四块水晶能够唤醒纪念碑的魔法。若能善加利用，这股力量将大大有助于我们对抗如今威胁外域的黑暗。\n\n英雄，我们必须设法激活这座纪念碑！前往附近充满水晶的区域，收集不同的水晶——一块红色、一块绿色、一块黄色、一块蓝色。这一地区的命运也许就取决于你今天揭开的秘密！",dEN="An ancient Apexis monument has been discovered in Blade's Edge Mountains, but its power remains dormant. Legends speak of four crystals that can awaken the monument's magic. If harnessed, this power could aid our cause greatly against the darkness now threatening Outland.\n\nHero, we must attempt to activate this monument! Venture into the crystal-infused areas nearby and gather the different crystals - one red, one green, one yellow, one blue. The fate of the region may well depend on the secrets you uncover today!",o="收集埃匹希斯水晶以激活一座古老纪念碑。",oEN="Gather Apexis Crystals to activate an ancient monument.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17866]={d="熔炉营地：恐惧的恶魔正利用不稳定的核心来强化他们的黑暗火焰魔法。如果我们能收集一批这样的不稳定核心，我们自己的奥术师就能加以研究，找出敌人火系法术的弱点。这些知识可能让我们在对抗他们的火焰法术时取得关键优势。\n\n英雄，我请求你深入熔炉营地：恐惧，从他们的唤火恶魔身上尽可能多地收集不稳定火焰核心。有了这些核心，我们的法师就能揭开敌人火系巫术的秘密。你今日的成功可能拯救外域各地无数的生命。尽可能多收集——无辜者的命运就在此一举！",dEN="The demons at Forge Camp: Terror are utilizing volatile cores to power their dark fire magic. If we can gather a stockpile of these unstable cores, our own arcanists could study them to discover weaknesses in the enemy's pyromancy. This knowledge could give us a critical advantage against their flame spells.\n\nHero, I ask you to venture into Forge Camp: Terror and collect as many Unstable Fire Cores as you can find off their flamecalling demons. With these cores, our mages can unravel the secrets of the enemy's fiery sorcery. Your success today could save countless lives across Outland. Gather all you can - the fate of the innocent depends on it!",o="从熔炉营地：恐惧的恶魔身上收集不稳定火焰核心。",oEN="Gather Unstable Fire Cores from demons at Forge Camp: Terror.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17867]={d="邪恶的基尔索邪教徒已经侵扰纳格兰太久了。他们的黑暗魔法与仪式扭曲着大地的灵魂，必须加以制止。报告显示，他们正聚集在基尔索堡垒准备一场不祥的仪式。我们绝不能让他们巩固对这一地区的邪恶控制！\n\n英雄，需要你的本领在基尔索的势力壮大之前将其摧毁。趁他们聚集在堡垒时立刻出击。消灭他们的部队——将邪教徒、缚法者和死亡誓约者尽数铲除。一个活口都不要留。只有消灭这些扭曲的灵魂，我们才能恢复纳格兰的平衡。去吧，伸张正义！",dEN="The vile Kil'sorrow cultists have infested Nagrand for too long. Their dark magics and rituals twist the spirits of the land and must be stopped. Reports indicate they are gathering at Kil'sorrow Fortress for an ominous ritual. We cannot allow them to cement their foul hold on this region!\n\nHero, your skills are needed to dismantle the Kil'sorrow before their power grows. Strike now while they gather at the fortress. Destroy their forces - lay waste to cultists, spellbinders and deathsworn. Leave no one standing. Only by eliminating these twisted souls can we restore balance to Nagrand. Go forth and serve justice!",o="在基尔索堡垒击败基尔索的部队。",oEN="Defeat Kil'sorrow forces at Kil'sorrow Fortress.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17869]={d="纳格兰的巨石拳食人魔以蛮力和奥术魔法威胁着这片土地。若不加制止，他们的数量将会膨胀，进而统治整个地区。报告显示，燃烧之刃废墟是该氏族的一处关键营地。在此处下手，我们就能粉碎他们的士气，打断他们的立足点。\n\n英雄，需要你的力量来瓦解废墟中的巨石拳部队。在他们的力量进一步壮大之前消灭他们的粉碎者和秘法师。这些食人魔被击败后，纳格兰的无辜民众就能安心了。现在就去，释放你的怒火——为了荣耀，为了胜利！",dEN="The Boulderfist ogres of Nagrand threaten the land with their brute strength and arcane magics. If left unchecked, their numbers will swell and they will dominate the entire region. Reports indicate the Burning Blade Ruins are a key encampment for the clan. By striking here, we can crush their spirits and break their foothold.\n\nHero, your might is needed to dismantle the Boulderfist forces at the ruins. Eliminate their crushers and mystics before their power grows further. With these ogres defeated, the innocent peoples of Nagrand can rest easy. Go now and unleash your fury - for honor and for victory!",o="在燃烧之刃废墟击败巨石拳食人魔。",oEN="Defeat Boulderfist ogres at the Burning Blade Ruins.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17870]={d="纳格兰的荒野遍布壮丽的野兽，但近来它们的数量过于稠密。塔布羊、裂蹄牛和风鹏为争夺食物与领地而更加激烈地冲突。这种失衡威胁着该地区脆弱的生态。必须下令进行一场扑杀，以恢复大地的稳定。\n\n勇士，我需要你娴熟的双手来削减当地野生动物的数量。杀死过剩的塔布雄鹿、裂蹄牛和风鹏。确保没有任何物种主宰这片土地，让纳格兰重归平衡。不要心软——这项严酷的任务对居住于此的所有生灵的共同福祉而言是必要的。愿你的箭无虚发。",dEN="The wilds of Nagrand teem with magnificent beasts, but their numbers have grown too dense as of late. Talbuk, clefthoof and windroc clash more fiercely over food and territory. This imbalance threatens the delicate ecology of the region. A culling must be ordered to restore stability to the land.\n\nChampion, I require your able hand in thinning local wildlife populations. Slay the overabundant talbuk stags, clefthoof and windroc. Bring balance back to Nagrand by ensuring no species dominates the landscape. Stay your heart - this harsh task is necessary for the greater good of all who dwell here. May your aim be true.",o="扑杀纳格兰数量过剩的塔布羊、裂蹄牛和风鹏。",oEN="Cull overpopulated Talbuk, Clefthoof and Windroc in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17871]={d="风苇村的野蛮破碎者以无情的袭击威胁着我们在纳格兰的立足点。若任其继续，他们可能会强大到足以统治整个地区。我们必须给予决定性一击，摧毁他们的补给，使他们无法维持其凶残的战争机器。\n\n英雄，潜入风苇村，没收他们囤积的食物、工具和物资。剥夺他们维持好战所需的补给。资源减少后，他们的嗜血欲望便会消退。现在就去，借此行动我们就能平息一大祸患，保护无辜者。",dEN="The savage Broken of Windyreed Village threaten our standing in Nagrand with their relentless attacks. If allowed to continue, they may grow strong enough to dominate the entire region. We must strike a decisive blow and dismantle their supplies, so they cannot sustain their vicious war machine.\n\nHero, infiltrate Windyreed and confiscate their stockpiles of food, tools and materials. Deprive them of the supplies they need to fuel their warmongering. With their resources diminished, their bloodlust will wane. Go now, and through this act we can pacify a great evil and protect the innocent.",o="从风苇村窃取补给，以削弱野蛮的破碎者。",oEN="Steal supplies from Windyreed Village to weaken the savage Broken.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17872]={d="风苇村的破碎者流亡者通过世代相传的仪式项链紧紧抓住往昔的残迹。如果我们能收集一批他们的祖传项链，我们的学者或许能洞悉这些部落弃民的传统。这些知识可能是理解并战胜我们野蛮敌人的关键。\n\n英雄，我委派你潜入风苇村，从倒下的敌人身上夺取他们的祖传项链作为战利品。手握这些流亡者历史的碎片，我们就能揭开他们的秘密。你今日的成功将使我们离击败这些凶残的破碎者更近一步。现在就去，为我们的目标赢得胜利！",dEN="The Broken exiles of Windyreed cling to the remnants of their past through ritual necklaces passed down through generations. If we can gather a stock of their ancestral necklaces, our scholars may gain insight into the traditions of these tribal outcasts. This knowledge could be key to understanding and overcoming our savage foe.\n\nHero, I task you with infiltrating Windyreed and claiming their ancestral necklaces as trophies from fallen enemies. With these Fragments of the Exiles' history in hand, we can unlock their secrets. Your success today will bring us steps closer to defeating these vicious Broken. Go now and seize a victory for our cause!",o="从倒下的破碎者流亡者身上收集风苇村祖传项链。",oEN="Collect ancestral Windyreed necklaces from fallen Broken exiles.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17873]={d="来自奥舒冈的噩耗——基尔索已经占据了这座圣山，进行黑暗仪式，将其能量扭曲以服务于他们邪恶的意志。这片土地在痛苦中扭动，因为这些污秽的魔法正毒害着纳格兰的灵魂。我们必须在损害变得不可挽回之前终止他们亵渎的行径！\n\n英雄，需要你的本领来打断这些邪恶的仪式。前往奥舒冈，消灭那些引导这些黑暗仪式的基尔索——在他们的仪式师和恐怖守卫爪牙将纳格兰拖入暗影之前将其斩杀。这片土地的命运悬于一线——现在就去，成为它的救星！",dEN="Dire news from Oshu'gun - the Kil'sorrow have overtaken the sacred mountain to perform dark rituals, bending its energies to their vile will. The land writhes in agony as these foul magics poison the spirits of Nagrand. We must put an end to their profane acts before the damage becomes irreversible!\n\nHero, your skills are needed to disrupt these wicked rituals. Journey to Oshu'gun and eliminate the Kil'sorrow channeling these dark rites - cut down their ritualists and terrorguard minions before they sink Nagrand into shadow. The fate of the land hangs in the balance - go now and be its salvation!",o="打断基尔索在奥舒冈的仪式。",oEN="Disrupt Kil'sorrow rituals at Oshu'gun.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17874]={d="纳格兰的灵魂之田正在滋生一股黑暗的扰动。破碎的隆鸣者、虚空孽生体和活体旋风四处狂奔，被侵入此地的邪恶力量所扭曲。若不加制止，它们不断增长的数量将涌出并吞没这片土地。必须在暗影扎根之前让这些受折磨的生物安息。\n\n英雄，我需要你前往灵魂之田，驱散这些显现之物——了结在那里游荡的隆鸣者、旋风和孽生体。将它们从诅咒中解放，让这片神圣的土地重归平衡。纳格兰的和谐取决于你的成功。现在就去，成为它治愈之手！",dEN="A dark disturbance festers within the Spirit Fields of Nagrand. Shattered rumblers, voidspawn and living cyclones run amok, warped by fell powers that have invaded this place. If left unchecked, their swelling numbers will pour forth and engulf the land. These afflicted creatures must be put to rest before the shadow takes root.\n\nHero, I need you to journey to the Spirit Fields and dispel these manifestations - put down the rumblers, cyclones and spawn who wander there. Free them from the curse and bring balance back to this sacred ground. Nagrand's harmony depends on your success. Go now and be its healing hand!",o="驱散在灵魂之田游荡的受诅咒生物。",oEN="Dispel cursed creatures wandering the Spirit Fields.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17875]={d="邪恶的维尔阿尼精灵侵入灵魂之田，企图夺取其强大的地脉能量以用于他们亵渎的魔法。若他们得逞，其力量将不受遏制地增长，整个纳格兰都将感受到他们残酷的手段。我们绝不能容许这种事发生！\n\n英雄，需要你的本领在他们巩固对灵魂之田的控制之前瓦解维尔阿尼的部队。前往那里，消灭他们的袭击者和奥术师。不要留下任何幸存者。只有他们的存在被抹去，这片圣地才能恢复平衡。趁还来得及立刻出击——纳格兰的命运掌握在你手中！",dEN="The sinister Vir'aani elves encroach upon the Spirit Fields, seeking to overtake its potent ley energies for their profane magic. If they succeed, their power will grow unchecked, and all of Nagrand will feel their cruel hand. We cannot allow this to pass!\n\nHero, your skills are needed to dismantle the Vir'aani forces before they cement their control of the Spirit Fields. Journey there and eliminate their raiders and arcanists. Leave no survivor. Only once their presence is erased can balance be restored to this sacred place. Strike now before it is too late - Nagrand's fate rests in your hands!",o="在灵魂之田击败维尔阿尼的部队。",oEN="Defeat Vir'aani forces in the Spirit Fields.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17876]={d="灵魂之田保存着纳格兰久已废弃的古老兽人文化遗存。刻有古老符文的石碑散落在平原各处，是那个失落时代的遗物。我们的学者渴望研究这些石碑，以了解曾在此繁荣的兽人氏族。\n\n英雄，我需要你前往灵魂之田，找回这些兽人祖传石板。研究它们或许能揭示被遗忘的智慧。小心行事，此地仍游荡着不安的亡魂。带回来尽可能多的石板，我们将大有收获。",dEN="The Spirit Fields hold remnants of ancient orcish culture long abandoned in Nagrand. Stone tablets engraved with traditions, folklore and more yet dot the landscape. If recovered, these treasures could provide invaluable insight into the orcs' history in Draenor before their corruption.\n\nHero, we must preserve what fragile pieces of orcish heritage remain. Venture into the Spirit Fields seeking ancestral tablets left behind in the ruins. Retrieve these Cultural Insights so our scholars can study them and preserve the legacy of our past. Go now and reclaim what knowledge you can before it is forever lost!",o="在灵魂之田找到并取回兽人祖传石板。",oEN="Locate and recover Orc Ancestral Tablets in the Spirit Fields.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17877]={d="英雄，奥舒冈蕴藏着等待被解开的远古谜团。虚空孽生体、维尔阿尼水晶以及这座山中回荡的怪异能量，都是我们学者极感兴趣的对象。若能取得样本，我们或许能揭开它的秘密，并找到对付日益增长的虚空腐化的办法。我请求你前往纳格兰的奥舒冈，从那里采集虚空样本。务必小心——此山危机四伏，许多人在此失踪。你带回来的知识可能价值连城。",dEN="Hero, Oshu'gun holds ancient mysteries waiting to be unlocked. The voidspawn, vir'aani crystals, and terrorguards all radiate its strange energies. If we could collect samples - void energies, crystals, and terrorguard blood - our allies believe they could piece together Oshu'gun's secrets. Venture to the sacred mountain, obtain these specimens, and bring them to me for study. The knowledge gained could prove invaluable against the void.",o="在纳格兰的奥舒冈采集虚空样本。",oEN="Gather void samples from Oshu'gun in Nagrand",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17878]={d="南风裂谷的巨石拳食人魔实力日渐增长，如今竟大胆地对附近的定居点发动袭击。若任其发展，他们很快就会统治整个地区。必须立刻制止他们。\n\n英雄，前往南风裂谷，铲除那里的巨石拳食人魔部队。杀死他们的蛮兵和秘法师，削弱他们的力量。如此我们才能保障这一地区的安全，保护无辜者免遭他们的暴行。",dEN="The Boulderfist ogres of Southwind Cleft grow in strength, now boldly launching attacks against nearby settlements. If left unchecked, these brutes will dominate the entire region. We cannot allow their kind to gain further foothold in Nagrand. They must be erased from this land!\n\nHero, the time has come for decisive action against the Boulderfist threat. Journey to Southwind Cleft and lay waste to their forces - cut down their warriors and mages without mercy. Drive the ogres from this place through extermination. Only when the last of their number falls can there be safety and stability in Nagrand once more. Go now and enact retribution!",o="从南风裂谷铲除巨石拳食人魔的部队。",oEN="Eradicate Boulderfist ogre forces from Southwind Cleft.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17879]={d="一股敌对生物的浪潮正从地底和水下威胁着哈兰尼盆地。新出现的碎岩者和涌出的生物正在蹂躏这片土地，危及所有途经此地的人。必须在它们扩散之前将其消灭。\n\n英雄，前往哈兰尼盆地，铲除这些新出现的碎岩者和涌出的生物。清除威胁，让盆地重归安全。此地的居民指望你了。",dEN="A surge of hostile creatures threatens Halaani Basin from below the earth and beneath the waters. Enraged rock flayers, vile muck spawn, and vicious lake surgers have been emerging in droves, driven to destroy all in their path. If left unchecked, these beasts will surely overrun the entire region. They must be eradicated at once!\n\nHero, we need you to journey to Halaani Basin and stem the tide - eliminate the enraged crushers, muck spawn and lake surgers before their numbers swell further. Drive these creatures back so balance can be restored. The future of the Basin depends on you culling this threat. Strike now and let not a single beast remain!",o="铲除哈兰尼盆地中新出现的碎岩者和涌出的生物。",oEN="Eradicate emerging rock crushers and surging creatures in Halaani Basin.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17880]={d="邪恶的暗血部族以无情的袭击和黑暗魔法威胁着日泉岗哨。我们的侦察兵报告说，他们正在策划一场大规模进攻。必须在他们发动之前阻止他们。\n\n英雄，前往日泉岗哨附近，消灭聚集在那里的暗血部队。打乱他们计划的进攻，保卫岗哨。许多生命就指望你及时出手了。",dEN="The vile Murkblood tribe threatens Sunspring Post with their relentless attacks and dark magic. Our scouts report they are planning an all-out assault to raze the outpost completely. We cannot allow these cruel beings to carry out their heinous designs!\n\nHero, your skills are needed to stop this massacre before it begins. Journey to Sunspring Post and eliminate the Murkblood forces - cut down their putrifiers, scavengers and raiders without mercy. Leave no survivor. Only when their blood stains the earth can our people rest easy. Go now and serve swift justice!",o="阻止暗血部族对日泉岗哨策划的进攻。",oEN="Halt a planned Murkblood attack on Sunspring Post.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17881]={d="南风裂谷的巨石拳食人魔计划对哈兰尼盆地发动又一次进攻。若他们成功，盆地中的人民将被屠杀。我们必须在他们动手之前削弱其力量。\n\n英雄，潜入巨石拳氏族的营地，窃取他们的战争补给。剥夺他们的武器、盔甲和物资，他们便无法发动进攻。如此便可避免一场屠杀。",dEN="The Boulderfist ogres of Southwind Cleft plan to launch another assault against Halaani Basin. If they succeed, countless innocents will perish. We must act preemptively to prevent this massacre before it occurs.\n\nHero, infiltrate Southwind Cleft and confiscate the Boulderfist's stockpiled war supplies. Deprive them of the materials they need to carry out their attack. With their resources diminished, the ogres will have no choice but to abandon their campaign of destruction against the Basin. Go now and through this act spare Halaani from merciless slaughter!",o="从巨石拳氏族窃取战争补给，以防止哈兰尼盆地发生屠杀。",oEN="Steal war supplies from the Boulderfist clan to prevent a massacre in Halaani Basin.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17882]={d="英雄，哈兰尼盆地的水域中藏着尚未被揭开的秘密。我们的盟友希望研究这些水域，以更好地理解这一地区的魔法特性。但此地充满危险，采集样本绝非易事。我请求你前往纳格兰的哈兰尼盆地，从水中采集样本。务必小心——水域并不像看上去那样平静。你带回的知识可能对我们大有裨益。",dEN="Hero, the waters of the Halaani Basin hold untapped secrets waiting to be uncovered. Our allies seek samples - vials of the water itself, as well as the acidic essences found within - to study their unique properties and harness their potential. I ask you to venture into the basin, gather water globes and acidic extracts, and bring them to me for analysis. Your efforts will arm our scholars with the knowledge to make wondrous discoveries.",o="从纳格兰的哈兰尼盆地采集水样。",oEN="Gather water samples from the Halaani Basin in Nagrand",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17883]={d="英雄，战槌山的战槌食人魔日益强大、日益大胆。在他们的好战酋长率领下，这些蛮兵和他们的术士主子若不加制止，恐怕会侵占整个纳格兰。玛格汉向你发出号召，勇士，协助扭转对抗战槌的战局。前往战槌山，杀死战槌术士和战槌蛮兵。绝不要给这些邪恶食人魔喘息之机。只有让战槌的鲜血流成河，才能阻止他们的野心。为了纳格兰的未来，血腥的战争今天就该降临战槌！",dEN="Hero, the Warmaul ogres at Warmaul Hill grow in strength and boldness by the day. Led by their warring chieftains, these brutes and their warlock masters threaten to overrun all of Nagrand if left unchecked. The Mag'har call upon you, champion, to help turn the tide against the Warmaul. Venture to Warmaul Hill and slay Warmaul warlocks and Warmaul brutes. Give no quarter to these vile ogres. Only by spilling rivers of Warmaul blood can their ambitions be stopped. For the future of Nagrand, bloody war must come to Warmaul this day!",o="在纳格兰的战槌山杀死战槌术士和战槌蛮兵。",oEN="Slay Warmaul warlocks and Warmaul brutes at Warmaul Hill in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17884]={d="英雄，笑骷髅废墟的战槌食人魔以其黑暗魔法和肆无忌惮的侵略威胁着整个纳格兰。在他们的邪恶萨满和嗜血劫掠者带领下，战槌人日益嚣张。我们召唤你，勇士，前往废墟削减他们的氏族。杀死他们的萨满和劫掠者，驱散这些蛮兵。他们必须明白纳格兰不属于他们。为了这片土地和人民的安全，这些食人魔必须被毫不留情地消灭。",dEN="Hero, the Warmaul ogres at Laughing Skull Ruins threaten all of Nagrand with their dark magics and wanton aggression. Led by their vile shamans and bloodthirsty reavers, the Warmaul grow bolder by the day. We call upon you, champion, to venture to the ruins and cull their clan. Slay their Shamans and Reavers, and drive these brutes back. They must be made to understand that Nagrand does not belong to them. For the safety of the land and its people, these ogres must be culled without mercy.",o="在纳格兰的笑骷髅废墟杀死战槌萨满和战槌劫掠者。",oEN="Slay Warmaul Shamans and Warmaul Reavers at the Laughing Skull Ruins in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17885]={d="英雄，笑骷髅废墟中保存着一个昔日强大食人魔帝国的遗存，它曾由暴君巫王玛尔戈克统治。虽然玛尔戈克早已死去，他邪恶的遗毒却依然存续。我们得知战槌食人魔如今盘踞在这片废墟中，并持有刻有玛尔戈克可憎形象的徽记。我们委派你前往废墟，解放这些不洁的遗物。从战槌人身上收集玛尔戈克徽记，好让我们清除其中的黑暗。只有消灭这些残迹，往昔的鬼魂才能终于安息。你愿意帮助古帝国暴政下的受害者获得他们应得的安息吗？",dEN="Hero, the Laughing Skull Ruins contain remnants of a once mighty ogre empire ruled by the tyrannical sorcerer king Mar'gok. Though Mar'gok is long dead, his evil legacy endures. We have learned that the Warmaul ogres now dwell in these ruins, and they possess insignia bearing Mar'gok's accursed image. We task you with venturing into the ruins and liberating these foul relics. Collect Insignia of Mar'gok from the Warmaul so that we may cleanse them of their darkness. Only by removing these remnants can the ghosts of the past finally be laid to rest. Will you help grant the old imperator's victims the peace they deserve?",o="在纳格兰的笑骷髅废墟从战槌食人魔身上收集12枚玛尔戈克徽记。",oEN="Collect 12 Insignia of Mar'gok from the Warmaul ogres at the Laughing Skull Ruins in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17886]={d="英雄，纳格兰的玛格汉深受战槌食人魔袭击之苦。许多战士在战槌山的牢狱中憔悴，力量正逐渐消逝。我恳求你：前往战槌山，把这些骄傲的兽人从枷锁中解救出来！在不引起怀疑的前提下尽可能多地释放玛格汉囚徒。恢复他们的希望，好让他们有朝一日能重新拿起武器对抗食人魔。仁慈之举能重新点燃抵抗之火。玛格汉的精神就寄托在你这样的英雄身上，勇士！",dEN="Hero, the Mag'har of Nagrand suffer greatly from the Warmaul ogres' raids. Many warriors languish in Warmaul Hill's prison, their strength fading. I beseech you - travel to Warmaul Hill and release these proud orcs from their chains! Free as many Mag'har prisoners as you can without raising alarms. Restore their hope so one day they may again take up arms against the ogres. Acts of mercy can reignite the flames of resistance. The Mag'har's spirit depends on heroes like you, champion!",o="在战槌山解救6名玛格汉囚徒。",oEN="Release 6 Mag’har Prisoners at Warmaul Hill.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17887]={d="英雄，赫米特·奈辛瓦里的灵魂似乎附上了纳格兰的野兽。风鹏、塔布羊和裂蹄牛近来变得更加好斗。仿佛奈辛瓦里的狩猎之欲也蔓延到了它们身上。为了恢复平衡，我们请你接下奈辛瓦里的衣钵，杀死巨型风鹏、刺棘塔布羊和裂蹄公牛。让这些生物明白，奈辛瓦里并非唯一能猎杀它们的人。只有这样，野兽才会恢复平和的习性。",dEN="Hero, the spirit of Hemet Nesingwary seems to have possessed the beasts of Nagrand. The windrocs, talbucks, and clefthoofs have become more aggressive as of late. It is as if Nesingwary's lust for the hunt has spread to them as well. To restore balance, we ask that you take up Nesingwary's mantle and slay greater windrocs, talbuk thorngrazers, and clefthoof bulls. Show these creatures that Nesingwary is not the only one capable of slaying them. Only then will the beasts return to their peaceful ways.",o="在纳格兰杀死巨型风鹏、刺棘塔布羊和裂蹄公牛。",oEN="Slay greater windrocs, talbuk thorngrazers, and clefthoof bulls in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17888]={d="勇士，来自熔炉营地：憎恨的噩耗。恶魔卫士军团士兵、甘尔葛工匠和莫尔葛工程师正在狂热地备战。他们黑暗的阴谋必须在为时已晚之前被打断！我需要你深入熔炉营地，瓦解他们的行动。消灭军团士兵，破坏工匠的作业，摧毁工程师建造的地狱构造体。让他们的努力陷入混乱，使他们无法再威胁纳格兰。",dEN="Champion, dire news from Forge Camp: Hate. Felguard legionnaires, gan'arg tinkers and mo'arg engineers feverishly prepare for war. Their dark machinations must be disrupted before it's too late! I need you to venture to the Forge Camp and dismantle their operations. Eliminate the legionnaires, sabotage the tinkers' work, and destroy the engineers' infernal constructs. Leave their efforts in chaos so they cannot threaten Nagrand.",o="深入熔炉营地：憎恨，扰乱集结在那里的燃烧军团部队。",oEN="Venture to Forge Camp: Hate and disrupt the Burning Legion forces gathered there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17889]={d="英雄，暮光岭传来黑暗的消息。邪恶的死亡阴影教派正在集结，以他们亵渎的魔法威胁纳格兰。执政官、术士和一位君王统领着他们，随时准备发动攻击。我们必须行动！我需要你前往山岭，瓦解死亡阴影的部队。消灭他们的执政官，破除术士的诅咒，并在那位君王的力量壮大之前将其杀死。让他们溃散四方，好让纳格兰得以安宁。",dEN="Hero, dark tidings from the Twilight Ridge. The vile Deathshadow cult gathers, threatening Nagrand with their profane magics. Archons, warlocks, and an overlord lead them, poised to strike. We must act! I need you to journey to the Ridge and dismantle the Deathshadow forces. Eliminate their archons, end the warlocks' curses, and slay the overlord before their power grows. Leave them scattered so that Nagrand may know peace.",o="深入暮光岭，瓦解集结在那里的死亡阴影部队。",oEN="Venture to the Twilight Ridge and dismantle the gathered Deathshadow forces.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17890]={d="勇士，纳格兰的天空与暗影中遍布危险野兽。凶猛的雀鹰和幽暗的暮光蛇如今在整个地区威胁着旅人。我需要一位像你这样经验丰富的猎人来削减这些入侵物种，以免它们淹没这片土地。杀死野生雀鹰和暮光蛇，让我们的道路重归安全。你的行动将有助于恢复纳格兰生态系统的平衡。",dEN="Champion, the skies and shadows of Nagrand teem with dangerous beasts. Vicious sparrowhawks and shadowy twilight serpents now threaten travelers throughout the region. I need an expert hunter like yourself to cull these invasive species before they overwhelm the land. Slay the wild sparrowhawks and twilight serpents so that our roads may again know safety. Your actions will help restore balance to Nagrand's ecosystems.",o="消灭纳格兰入侵的雀鹰和威胁旅人的暮光蛇。",oEN="Cull the invasive sparrowhawks and twilight serpents threatening travelers in Nagrand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17891]={d="英雄，我们在沙塔斯城的盟友希望更好地了解德莱尼……不，是德拉诺本土的神秘蛇类。然而它们的秘密依然难以捉摸。我认为研究当地蛇类的卵或许能带来线索。请前往纳格兰，尽可能多地收集蛇卵。将它们安全地运送给我们的盟友，好让它们的谜团得以揭开。",dEN="Hero, our allies in Shattrath seek to better understand the mysterious serpents native to Outland. However, their secrets remain elusive. I believe studying eggs from the local serpentine species may provide insight. Please, venture into Nagrand and gather as many serpent eggs as you can find. Transport them safely to our allies so their mysteries may be unlocked.",o="在纳格兰各处收集蛇卵，供我们的盟友研究。",oEN="Gather serpent eggs from throughout Nagrand for our allies to study.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17892]={d="勇士，邪能能量浸透了熔炉营地：憎恨、熔炉营地：恐惧和暮光岭，并凝结成不稳定的能量球。如果我们能安全地保存它们，研究这些能量球或许能揭示军团魔法中的弱点。我需要你深入这些危险之地，收集任何你能搬运的邪能能量球。小心不要直接触碰它们！尽可能多地带给我，好让我们的盟友解开其中的秘密。这些知识或许能扭转对抗暗影的战局。",dEN="Champion, fel energies permeate Forge Camp: Hate, Forge Camp: Fear, and Twilight Ridge, condensed into volatile orbs. If we could safely contain them, studying these orbs may reveal weaknesses in the Legion's magics. I need you to venture into these dangerous places and collect any fel orbs you can transport. Take care not to touch them directly! Bring me as many as you can so our allies can unlock their secrets. This knowledge could turn the tide against the shadow",o="深入被邪能腐蚀的区域，收集不稳定的邪能能量球以供研究。",oEN="Venture into fel-corrupted areas and collect unstable fel orbs for study.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17893]={d="勇士，虚空风暴中军团的熔炉基地若不加控制，将构成严重威胁。盖内纳和湮灭之地的赛博怒焰熔炉领主和甘尔葛机甲工匠日夜制造黑暗军械。我们必须摧毁他们的行动！我需要你前往这些熔炉，终结他们邪恶的工业生产。消灭监督生产的熔炉领主，破坏维持机械运转的机甲工匠。让他们的熔炉冷却，陷入沉寂。",dEN="Champion, the Legion's forge bases in Netherstorm pose a grave threat if left unchecked. Cyber-rage forgelords and gan'arg mekgineers at Gehenna and Oblivion produce dark armaments day and night. We must dismantle their operations! I need you to travel to the forges and put an end to their malignant industry. Eliminate the forgelords overseeing production, and sabotage the mekgineers maintaining the machinery. Leave their fiery forges cold and silent.",o="深入军团的熔炉基地，杀死操作熔炉的莫尔葛",oEN="Venture into the Legion's forge bases and slay the mo'args operating their forges",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17894]={d="英雄，崩裂废土传来令人担忧的消息。混乱的元素生物——扭曲怪物和碎裂雷鸣者——已失控繁衍，眼看就要淹没这一地区。它们原始的怒火必须在造成更多破坏之前被遏制！我需要你前往废土，削减这些凶猛元素生物的数量。消灭扭曲怪物，击倒碎裂雷鸣者，好让平衡得以恢复。",dEN="Hero, troubling news from The Crumbling Waste. Chaotic elementals - warp monstrosities and sundered thunderers - have proliferated unchecked, threatening to overwhelm the region. Their primal fury must be contained before more damage is done! I need you to travel to The Waste and cull these ferocious elementals. Eliminate the monstrosities and ground the thunderers so balance can be restored.",o="前往崩裂废土，消灭入侵该地区的混乱元素生物。",oEN="Journey to The Crumbling Waste and cull the chaotic elementals overrunning the region.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17895]={d="英雄，出没于盖内纳和湮灭之地的军团机械中，含有我们的盟友迫切需要的关键部件。那些被邪能魔法污染的零件与碎片，或许能提供知识，用以强化我们自己对抗他们的技术。我请你出战，直面这些金属怪物：取回它们的机械零件，好让我们的发明家加以研究。你的发现或许能为我们装备上战胜这些敌人的新知识。",dEN="Hero, the Legion machines that haunt the Gehenna and Oblivion bases contain components our allies desperately need. Their fel-tainted bits and pieces could provide insights that empower our own technologies against them. I ask you to sally forth and battle these metal monstrosities - salvage their machine bits so our tinkers can study them. Your fetchings could arm us with new knowledge to overcome these foes.",o="在虚空风暴收集盖内纳和湮灭之地的邪能机械零件。",oEN="Gather fel machine bits from Gehenna and Oblivion in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17896]={d="英雄，盖内纳和湮灭之地的恶魔与邪能元素正给整个虚空风暴带来难以言喻的混乱。如果我们能收集它们携带的不洁器物——颅骨、弹药、混乱能量——我们的盟友相信这些可以被净化并用于正义。我请你与这些生物作战，夺取它们黑暗的遗物并交给我。用敌人自己的邪恶工具对付他们，我们就能取得胜利。",dEN="Hero, the demons and fel elementals of Gehenna and Oblivion are sowing untold havoc across Netherstorm. If we could gather the foul artifacts they carry - skulls, munitions, chaotic energy - our allies believe they could be purified and used for good. I ask you to battle these creatures, claim their dark relics, and bring them to me. By turning our enemies' vile tools against them, we may achieve victory.",o="在虚空风暴收集盖内纳和湮灭之地的恶魔遗物。",oEN="Gather demonic relics from Gehenna and Oblivion in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17897]={d="英雄，恶魔库鲁萨斯以铁腕掌控着法兰伦废墟，统率着一支邪恶的野兽军团。他的眼魔潜伏在暗影中，凶猛的恶犬则不停地游荡。若不加控制，它们的数量将会增长。我请你前往废墟，削减库鲁萨斯的族群：杀死他的眼魔和恶犬，削弱他的力量。",dEN="Hero, the demon Culuthas holds the Ruins of Farahlon in an iron grip, commanding legions of sinister beasts. His Eyes stalk the shadows, while savage Hounds roam relentlessly. If left unchecked, their numbers will surge. I ask you to venture to the ruins and cull Culuthas's horde - slay his Eyes and Hounds so his forces are weakened.",o="在虚空风暴的法兰伦废墟消灭库鲁萨斯的爪牙。",oEN="Slay Culuthas's minions in the Ruins of Farahlon in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17898]={d="英雄，以太族的集结地满是他们扭曲的造物。刺客潜伏于暗影，突击兵全副武装，节点潜伏者则把现实本身扭曲为武器。若不加控制，他们的部队将走出集结地，威胁整个虚空风暴。我请你净化他们：前往并杀死他们的刺客、突击兵和节点潜伏者。削减他们的数量，使他们无法再扩散那邪恶的技术。",dEN="Hero, the Ethereum's staging ground swarms with their twisted creations. Assassins lurk in shadows, shocktroopers bristle with armaments, and nexus-stalkers warp reality itself as a weapon. Left unchecked, their forces will surge out of the staging grounds and threaten all of Netherstorm. I ask you to purge them - venture forth and slay their assassins, shocktroopers, and nexus-stalkers. Thin their numbers so they cannot spread their sinister tech further.",o="在虚空风暴的以太族集结地消灭以太族的部队。",oEN="Slay Ethereum forces at the Ethereum Staging Grounds in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17899]={d="英雄，以太族掌握着危险的知识，可能反过来助长我们对抗他们的斗争。他们的典籍、虚空残渣和血肉样本中藏着等待被发现的秘密。我请你前往试验场和法力熔炉乌提斯与他们的部队作战，收集这些器物并交给我。研究敌人的知识，我们就多一分击败他们的优势。你今日的努力或许能提供我们所需要的关键。",dEN="Hero, the Ethereum hold dangerous knowledge that could empower our fight against them. Their tomes, void residues, and flesh samples contain secrets waiting to be unlocked. I ask you to battle their forces at the Staging Grounds and Manaforge Ultris, gather these artifacts, and bring them to me. By studying our enemies' knowledge, we gain an advantage in defeating them. Your efforts today could provide the key insights we need.",o="在虚空风暴的集结地和法力熔炉乌提斯收集以太族器物。",oEN="Gather Ethereum artifacts from the Staging Grounds and Manaforge Ultris in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17900]={d="英雄，魔法器物的残骸散落在虚空风暴各处，浸透着奥术能量。水晶、符文、魔法典籍……若能收集起来，我们的盟友便可研究它们，解锁其力量并加以逆向工程。我请你前往那里，与扭曲的居民作战，并收集你能找到的魔法器物。把它们带给我，让其中的秘密壮大我们的事业。",dEN="Hero, remnants of magical artifacts litter Netherstorm, soaked in arcane energies. Crystals, runestones, magical texts - if gathered, these could be studied by our allies to unlock their power and reverse engineer them for good. I ask you venture there, battle its twisted denizens, and scavenge what magical artifacts you can find. Bring them to me so their secrets may empower our cause.",o="在虚空风暴的法力熔炉乌提斯搜寻奥术器物。",oEN="Scavenge arcane artifacts from Manaforge Ultris in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17901]={d="英雄，凯尔萨斯的部队大举占据着法力熔炉杜罗。晨怒弓箭手从远处倾泻死亡之雨，百夫长则守住阵线。咒术师用毁灭性的魔法强化他们所有人。若我们不尽快应对，这座法力熔炉必将失守。我请你前往那里，直面晨怒：毫不留情地杀死他们的弓箭手、百夫长和咒术师。这场战斗会很危险，但你今日的行动或许能对他们掌控这座法力熔炉造成毁灭性打击。",dEN="Hero, Kael'thas' forces occupy Manaforge Duro in force. Sunfury bowmen rain death from afar as centurions hold the line. Conjurers empower them all with destructive magics. If we do not confront them soon, the manaforge will be lost. I ask you to venture there and face the Sunfury head on - slay their bowmen, centurions and conjurers without mercy. The battle will be perilous, but your actions today could deal a devastating blow to their command of the manaforge.",o="在虚空风暴的法力熔炉杜罗打断晨怒的行动。",oEN="Disrupt Sunfury operations at Manaforge Duro in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17902]={d="英雄，虚空风暴的野生生物变得越来越好斗、越来越危险。成群的掠法者袭击旅人，相位追猎者忽隐忽现地伏击疏于防备者。凶猛的碾碎鸟不停地在空中盘旋。若放任不管，它们的数量将失控增长。我请你削减这些野兽的数量：杀死掠法者、相位追猎者和碾碎鸟，让整个虚空风暴重归平衡。",dEN="Hero, the wild creatures of Netherstorm have become increasingly aggressive and dangerous. Mana snapper packs attack travelers, while warp chasers phase in and out to ambush the unwary. Vicious shredder birds circle endlessly overhead. If left alone, their numbers will surge out of control. I ask you to cull these beasts - slay the mana snappers, warp chasers, and shredder birds so that balance is restored across Netherstorm.",o="消灭虚空风暴中富有攻击性的野生动物。",oEN="Cull aggressive wildlife in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17903]={d="英雄，虚空风暴各处散布着强大的奥术水晶，散发着魔法。血精灵、恶魔乃至当地的野兽都用这些水晶强化自身。如果我们能收集一批晨怒、莫尔葛和虚空风暴的水晶样本，我们的盟友相信便能为正义驾驭其中的能量。前往那里，与这些势力作战，收集他们的水晶，让其中的力量反过来对付他们。",dEN="Hero, powerful arcane crystals can be found scattered across Netherstorm, radiating magic. The blood elves, demons, and even beasts of the region utilize these crystals to empower their forces. If we could gather a sampling - Sunfury, Moarg, and Netherwarped crystals - our allies believe they could tap into their energies for good. Venture out, battle these factions, and collect their crystals so their power may be harnessed against them.",o="在虚空风暴收集奥术水晶。",oEN="Gather arcane crystals in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17904]={d="英雄，入侵点：毁灭者的军团废料场中满是他们扭曲的工程师，正在制造邪恶的战争机器。甘尔葛工程师不知疲倦地劳作，莫尔葛命运铁匠则监督着他们的工作。若任由他们的阴谋继续，虚空风暴中将释放出难以想象的恐怖。我请你突袭废料场，终结他们的行动：杀死工程师和命运铁匠，让他们的邪恶造物永不见天日。",dEN="Hero, the Legion's scrapyard at Invasion Point: Destroyer teems with their twisted engineers, crafting fiendish machines of war. Gan'arg engineers work tirelessly as Mo'arg doomssmiths oversee their efforts. If we allow their machinations to continue, horrors beyond imagining will be unleashed upon Netherstorm. I ask you to attack the scrapyard and put an end to their efforts - slay the engineers and doomssmiths so their evil creations never see the light of day.",o="在虚空风暴的入侵点：毁灭者打断军团的废料场作业。",oEN="Disrupt the Legion scrapyard at Invasion Point: Destroyer in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17905]={d="英雄，中界生态穹顶的翠绿藤蔓结出珍贵的果实与资源，但许多长得太高，无法触及。把藤蔓拉下来以便采摘，你就能提供极大有益于我们盟友的食物和材料。我请你前往中界，抓住藤蔓并把它们拉到可采集的范围内。把它们拉到伸手可及之处，就能收获一筐筐珍贵的水果和蔬菜，供养我们的人民。",dEN="Hero, the verdant vines in Eco-Dome Midrealm produce valuable fruits and resources, but many grow out of reach. By pulling the vines down where they can be harvested, you would provide sustenance and materials greatly benefiting our allies. I ask you to visit Midrealm, take hold of the vines, and draw them within gathering range. Bringing them within reach will yield bushels of precious fruits and vegetables to nourish our people.",o="在虚空风暴的中界生态穹顶把翠绿藤蔓拉到可采集范围内。",oEN="Pull verdant vines within gathering range in Eco-Dome Midrealm in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17906]={d="英雄，凯尔萨斯的血精灵大举占据着晨怒堡，这是虚空风暴心脏地带的一处毒瘤。他们的弓箭手骚扰所有经过之人，烈焰守卫则散播毁灭性的魔法。若不加控制，他们的力量与日俱增。我请你前往晨怒堡，用晨怒的鲜血把他们的土地染红：毫不留情地杀死他们的弓箭手和烈焰守卫。你的行动或许能对他们在这里的行动造成毁灭性打击。",dEN="Hero, Kael'thas' blood elves occupy Sunfury Hold in force, a festering threat in the heart of Netherstorm. Their archers harass all who pass by, while flamekeepers spread destructive magic. Left unchecked, their power grows daily. I ask you to venture to Sunfury Hold and paint its earth red with Sunfury blood - slay their archers and flamekeepers without mercy. Your actions could deal a devastating blow to their operations here.",o="在虚空风暴的晨怒堡杀死晨怒血精灵。",oEN="Slay Sunfury blood elves at Sunfury Hold in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17907]={d="英雄，凯尔萨斯的部队在法力熔炉科鲁进行着邪恶的研究。他们的奥术师汲取混乱能量，研究员则钻研黑暗魔法。晨怒卫兵守护着他们所有人。若任由他们的工作继续，虚空风暴将遭受难以想象的恐怖。我请你突袭法力熔炉科鲁，终结他们危险的研究：毫不留情地杀死他们的奥术师、研究员和卫兵。",dEN="Hero, Kael'thas' forces conduct sinister research at Manaforge Coruu. Their arcanists tap chaotic energies, while researchers study dark magics. Sunfury guards defend them all. If we allow their work to continue, they will unleash untold horrors upon Netherstorm. I ask you to attack Manaforge Coruu, and put an end to their dangerous research - slay their arcanists, researchers, and guardsmen without mercy.",o="在虚空风暴的法力熔炉科鲁打断晨怒的行动。",oEN="Disrupt Sunfury operations at Manaforge Coruu in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17908]={d="英雄，基尔瓦村已陷入混乱与废墟。掠法者游荡在街道上吸取一切魔法，法师猎手则追猎奥术的研习者。若不加控制，这些邪恶的存在将消灭村庄剩余的守卫并巩固其控制。我请你挺身而出，直面混乱：杀死掠法者和法师猎手，好让村庄得以开始疗愈。你今日的行动或许能帮助永远夺回这片土地。",dEN="Hero, Kirin'Var Village has fallen into chaos and ruin. Mana seekers roam the streets absorbing all magics, while mageslayers hunt practitioners of the arcane. Left unchecked, these sinister beings will eradicate the remaining village defenders and solidify their hold. I ask you to sally forth and face the chaos - slay the mana seekers and mageslayers so the village can begin to heal. Your actions today could help reclaim this land for good.",o="在虚空风暴的基尔瓦村消灭混乱的存在。",oEN="Slay chaotic beings in Kirin'Var Village in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17909]={d="英雄，晨怒精灵衣着讲究，会制作注入奥术能量的精致围巾。我们的盟友相信这些时髦的配饰中也藏着等待被解开的秘密。我请你前往晨怒堡和法力熔炉科鲁，与这些精灵作战并夺取他们华丽的围巾。把这些精致的样本带给我，好让其中的魔法奥秘被解开，用于强化我们自己的附魔。",dEN="Hero, the fashionable Sunfury elves craft intricate scarves imbued with arcane energy. Our allies believe these stylish accessories also contain secrets waiting to be unlocked. I ask you to venture to Sunfury Hold and Manaforge Coruu, battle the elves, and confiscate their ornate scarves. Bring these stylish specimens to me so their magical mysteries may be unraveled and used to empower our own enchantments.",o="在虚空风暴的晨怒堡和法力熔炉科鲁收集晨怒围巾。",oEN="Collect Sunfury scarves from Sunfury Hold and Manaforge Coruu in Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17910]={d="英雄，基尔瓦村周围的防护图腾已失去活性，使该地区变得脆弱。若能重新激活，它们将加固村庄的防御，让村民得以安全地开始重建。我请你前往基尔瓦，为他们的保护水晶塔重新注入能量；恢复其防护魔法，好让村民能在无惧中开始重建家园。你今日的行动或许能帮助迈出复兴这片土地的第一步。",dEN="Hero, the protective wards around Kirin'Var Village have fallen inert, leaving the area vulnerable. If we reactivated them, it would bolster the village's defenses and allow them to begin rebuilding in safety. I ask you to travel to Kirin'Var and repower their ward pylons - restore their protective magics so the villagers can start reclaiming their home without fear. Your actions today could help the first steps of this land's restoration.",o="在虚空风暴的基尔瓦村重新激活防护图腾。",oEN="Reactivate protective wards in Kirin'Var Village, Netherstorm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17911]={d="勇士，一片黑暗笼罩了恩卡特废墟。堕落的德莱尼执政官与守备官的受诅咒灵魂四处游荡，被痛苦吞噬。他们已无法得救，但我们仍能通过遗忘赐予他们安宁。我请你前往废墟，让这些灵魂安息。杀死执政官和守备官，好让他们从永恒的痛苦中获得解脱。这是一项阴郁的任务，但只有你才有完成它所需的慈悲与力量。愿他们在死亡中再次被圣光拥抱。",dEN="Champion, a darkness has settled over the Ruins of Enkaat. The cursed spirits of fallen draenei exarchs and vindicators wander aimlessly, consumed with torment. They are beyond saving, but we may still offer them peace through oblivion. I ask that you travel to the Ruins and put these souls to rest. Slay the exarchs and vindicators so they may find release from their eternal suffering. It is a grim task, but one that only you have the compassion and strength to complete. In death, may the Light embrace them once more.",o="前往恩卡特废墟，净化在那里徘徊的无实体灵魂。",oEN="Journey to the Ruins of Enkaat and purge the disembodied spirits that linger there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17912]={d="英雄，军团在阿克隆废墟的存在日益壮大。邪刃末日守卫和神器搜寻者如今在瓦砾间爬行，无疑是在寻觅力量。绝不能让他们得逞！我需要你立刻前往废墟，瓦解他们的部队。在他们的力量壮大之前消灭末日守卫，并阻止搜寻者挖出危险之物。让他们的野心化为废墟。",dEN="Hero, the Legion's presence grows at the Arklon Ruins. Felblade doomguards and artifact seekers now crawl amongst the debris, no doubt searching for power. We cannot allow them to succeed! I need you to travel to the Ruins immediately and dismantle their forces. Eliminate the doomguards before their might grows, and stop the seekers from unearthing anything dangerous. Leave their ambitions in ruin.",o="前往阿克隆废墟，瓦解集结在那里的恶魔部队。",oEN="Journey to the Arklon Ruins and dismantle the demonic forces gathered there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17913]={d="勇士，扎克斯希斯虚灵正在肆虐堆积之地，无节制地吞噬其原始能量。他们的潜伏者和袭击者不停进食，数量增长得令人警觉。我们必须在虫害扩散之前立刻行动！我需要你前往堆积之地，削减扎克斯希斯的数量。消灭他们狡猾的潜伏者，摧毁贪婪的袭击者。只有你这样本领高强的勇士才能完成这项关键任务。铲除这片笼罩虚空风暴的祸患，好让平衡得以恢复！",dEN="Champion, the Zaxxis Ethereals overwhelm The Heap, consuming its primal energies unchecked. Their stalkers and raiders feed ceaselessly, growing alarmingly in number. We must act now before the infestation spreads! I need you to travel to The Heap and cull the Zaxxis. Eliminate their cunning stalkers, and destroy the voracious raiders. Only a champion of your skill can accomplish this vital task. Remove this plague upon Netherstorm so that balance may be restored!",o="前往堆积之地，消灭扎克斯希斯寄生虫的侵扰。",oEN="Journey to The Heap and eliminate the parasitic Zaxxis infestation.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17914]={d="勇士，阿克隆废墟中散落着纳鲁神圣水晶的残骸，已被邪能能量扭曲。若加以净化，这些水晶或许仍能恢复神圣的光芒。我需要你深入废墟，尽可能多地收集你能安全搬运的受污染水晶。把它们带到这里，让我们的盟友尝试恢复其纯净。本被用于邪恶之物，也能重新用于正当的目的。你今日的行动或许能帮助天平向圣光倾斜。勇敢前行吧，英雄！",dEN="Champion, remnants of sacred naaru crystals litter the Arklon Ruins, warped by fel energies. If cleansed, these crystals may yet recover their holy light. I need you to venture into the Ruins and gather as many corrupted crystals as you can safely carry. Bring them here, where our allies can attempt to restore their purity. What was meant for evil, may be turned to good purpose once more. Your actions today may help tip the balance toward the Light. Go forth boldly, hero!",o="从阿克隆废墟取回受污染的纳鲁水晶，以供净化。",oEN="Recover corrupted naaru crystals from the Arklon Ruins for cleansing.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17915]={d="英雄，我们盟友的粉碎机需要充能，才能在虚空风暴恶劣的环境中安全运作。此地丰富的元素能量若使用得当，足以提供充足的动力。我需要你把找到的任何闲置粉碎机连接到附近的魔法地脉上。将纯净的奥术之流导入它们的电池，直到完全充能。这些机器重新运转，将大大有助于我们在此地区的行动。",dEN="Hero, our allies' shredder machinery requires charging before it can be safely operated in Netherstorm's harsh conditions. The abundant elemental energies here should provide ample power if utilized properly. I need you to connect any inactive shredders you find to the nearby magical ley lines. Channel the raw arcane currents into their batteries until fully charged. Having these machines running again will greatly aid our efforts in the region.",o="为一台闲置的粉碎机充能",oEN="Recharge an Inactive Shredder",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17916]={d="英雄，军团的要塞军团要塞中满是我们的敌人。暗影议会的术士施展黑暗魔法，恐惧魔王则召集令人毛骨悚然的部队。愤怒行者与莫尔葛锻造着邪恶的军械，为其战争机器供能。我请你前往军团要塞，正面迎击军团：终结他们的部队与首领，让军团要塞陷入混乱。你今日的行动或许能对他们的战役造成毁灭性打击。",dEN="Hero, the Legion's stronghold of Legion Hold teems with our enemies. Shadow Council warlocks work dark magics while terrormasters rally gruesome troops. Wrathwalkers and mo'arg forge fiendish armaments to fuel their war machine. I ask you to venture to Legion Hold and face the Legion head-on - slay their forces and leadership to throw Legion Hold into disarray. Your actions today could deal a devastating blow to their campaign.",o="在影月谷的军团要塞瓦解军团的部队",oEN="Disrupt the Legion forces at Legion Hold in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17917]={d="英雄，军团的死亡熔炉生产出的邪恶战争机器在影月谷各地肆虐。守卫保护着这里，召唤者则呼唤援军。发明家在内部设计着怪物。我请你突袭死亡熔炉，动摇他们的运作：杀死他们的守卫、召唤者和发明家，让他们的工作陷入停顿。若能摧毁他们的产能，我们就能从他们的恐怖中获得一丝喘息。",dEN="Hero, the Legion's Deathforge churns out fiendish war machines that wreak havoc across Shadowmoon. Guardians protect the site as summoners call forth reinforcements. Tinkerers engineer monstrosities within. I ask you attack the Deathforge and destabilize their operations - slay their guardians, summoners and tinkerers so their work is disrupted. If we can shatter their productivity, it will grant us a reprieve from their horrors.",o="在影月谷的死亡熔炉打断军团的部队",oEN="Disrupt the Legion forces at the Deathforge in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17918]={d="英雄，影月谷的野兽被恶魔的影响腐化，变得日益凶残。邪能野猪一见旅人便发动攻击，而邪能火蜥蜴则喷吐液态烈焰。若不加控制，它们的数量将失控增长。我请你深入山谷，了结这些生物：在土地被侵占之前杀死邪能野猪和火蜥蜴。只有你这样本领高强的勇士才能对抗这些凶猛的野兽。",dEN="Hero, the demonically-tainted beasts of Shadowmoon Valley have become increasingly vicious. Felboars attack travelers on sight while felfire diemetradons spew liquid flame. If left unchecked, their numbers will surge out of control. I ask you to venture across the valley putting these creatures down - slay the felboars and diemetradons before the land is overrun. Only a champion of your skill can face these fell beasts.",o="在影月谷杀死军团野兽",oEN="Slay fel beasts in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17919]={d="平定军团",dEN="Quelling Legions",o="平定军团",oEN="Quelling Legions"}
Q[17920]={d="英雄，影月谷的恶魔野兽拥有注入邪能能量的毛皮。我们的盟友相信，若加以采集与净化，这些毛皮可被制成抵御黑暗魔法的护甲。我请你与山谷各处的邪能生物作战：收集它们的毛皮，好让制甲师将其制成抵御它们同类的护具。恶魔自身的毛皮同样足以完成这项任务。把毛皮带给我，好让这项研究得以展开。",dEN="Hero, the demonic beasts across Shadowmoon Valley possess hides imbued with fel energy. Our allies believe if collected and purified, these hides could be forged into armors resistant to dark magics. I ask you to battle fel creatures across the valley - harvest their hides so that armorers may craft them into protection against their ilk. The hides of demons themselves would suffice equally well for this task. Bring me the hides so this research can begin.",o="在影月谷从恶魔和受军团腐蚀的野兽身上收集邪能毛皮",oEN="Collect fel hides from demons and fel corrupted beasts in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17921]={d="英雄，凯尔萨斯的部队聚集在日蚀岗，正准备发动攻击。日蚀百夫长列阵集结，大法师编织着毁灭性魔法。龙鹰布满天空。若我们不尽快应对，他们的下一波攻势可能摧毁影月谷。我请你前往日蚀岗，击退他们的部队：同样消灭百夫长、大法师和龙鹰。打乱他们的阵列，让他们的毁灭战役以失败告终。",dEN="Hero, Kael'thas' forces swarm Eclipse Point, preparing to strike. Eclipsion centurions assemble ranks while archmages weave destructive magics. Dragonhawks fill the skies. If we do not confront them soon, their next onslaught could ravage Shadowmoon. I ask you to venture to Eclipse Point and repel their forces - slay centurions, archmages, and dragonhawks alike. Break their ranks so their campaign of destruction fails.",o="在影月谷的日蚀岗动摇凯尔萨斯的部队",oEN="Disrupt Kael'thas' forces at Eclipse Point in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17922]={d="动摇死亡熔炉",dEN="Destabilising the Deathforge",o="动摇死亡熔炉",oEN="Destabilising the Deathforge"}
Q[17925]={d="勇士，巨大的黑暗正在法力熔炉乌提斯滋生。虚空怨灵不停地尖叫，吞噬所触及的一切，而邪恶的渗透软泥正从暗影中失控涌出。若不加阻止，它们将彻底吞噬熔炉的能量！我需要你前往法力熔炉乌提斯，在为时已晚之前净化这些虚空生物。消灭虚空怨灵，让它们的尖叫归于沉寂，并摧毁蔓延的软泥。剥夺虚空的 power，好让圣光重新闪耀。这会很危险，但我对你有信心。",dEN="Champion, a great darkness festers at Manaforge Ultris. Voidwraiths shriek endlessly, consuming all they touch, while vile seeping sludge emerges unchecked from the shadows. Left unchecked, they will devour the forge's energies entirely! I need you to travel to Manaforge Ultris and purge these void creatures before it is too late. Eliminate the voidwraiths, silence their shrieking, and destroy the spreading sludge. Strip the void of its power so that the Light may shine again. This will be dangerous, but I have faith in you.",o="前往法力熔炉乌提斯，净化那些威胁将其吞噬的虚空生物。",oEN="Journey to Manaforge Ultris and purge the void creatures threatening to consume it.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17926]={d="英雄，冬泉谷的宁静正受到威胁！寒爪部族一直在饮用一种神秘的烈酒，这使他们陷入疯狂与好斗。他们的探路者和图腾一直在这片雪原上肆虐，破坏自然的平衡，威胁着此地的居民。我们不能容许这种情况继续。我恳请你的力量与勇气，终结他们鲁莽的行径。削减他们的数量，帮助冬泉谷重归和平。",dEN="Hero, the tranquility of Winterspring is under threat! The Winterfall tribe has been consuming a mysterious firewater, driving them to madness and aggression. Their Pathfinders and Totemics have been causing havoc across these snowy plains, disrupting the balance of nature and threatening the residents of this region. We cannot let this continue. I call upon your strength and courage to put an end to their reckless acts. Thin their numbers and help restore the peace in Winterspring.",o="在冬泉谷击败6名寒爪探路者和6个寒爪图腾师。",oEN="Defeat 6 Winterfall Pathfinders and 6 Winterfall Totemics in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17927]={d="英雄，随着寒爪部族的侵略在冬泉谷不断蔓延，我们发现他们的新力量与所持的某些图腾之间存在关联。那并非普通的图腾，而是木喉熊怪的古老遗物，据信蕴含着强大的力量。我们怀疑寒爪部族一直在腐化这些图腾以服务于他们自己的黑暗目的。我们需要你取回木喉的滋养图腾、力量图腾和威能图腾。这些图腾落入正确的人手中，我们或许就能恢复此地的平衡与和平。",dEN="Hero, as the Winterfall tribe's aggression continues to spread throughout Winterspring, we've discovered a link between their newfound power and certain totems they possess. These are not just any ordinary totems, but ancient Timbermaw relics believed to hold significant power. We suspect the Winterfall have been corrupting these totems for their own dark purposes. We need you to recover the Timbermaw Totems of Nourishment, Might, and Power. With these totems in the right hands, we might be able to restore balance and peace to the region.",o="在冬泉谷收集木喉滋养图腾、木喉威能图腾和木喉力量图腾。",oEN="Collect the Timbermaw Totem of Nourishment, Timbermaw Totem of Might, and Timbermaw Totem of Power in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17928]={d="英雄，一桩严重的暴行已经发生。寒爪部族在疯狂与好斗中杀害了我们许多木喉同胞，并把他们的爪子当作暴行的战利品。这些爪子不仅是我们力量与团结的象征，对我们的人民也有着精神上的意义。失去它们是寒爪部族残忍行径带来的痛苦提醒。我们恳求你，勇敢的灵魂，取回这些木喉之爪，好让我们能祭奠逝者，并举行必要的仪式引导他们的灵魂安息。",dEN="Hero, a grave injustice has been done. The Winterfall tribe, in their madness and aggression, have slain many of our Timbermaw brethren and taken their paws as trophies of their heinous acts. These paws are not just symbols of our strength and unity, but they also hold spiritual significance to our people. Their loss is a painful reminder of the Winterfall tribe's ruthlessness. We implore you, brave soul, to retrieve these Timbermaw Paws so we may honor our fallen and perform the necessary rites to guide their spirits to rest.",o="在冬泉谷取回木喉之爪。",oEN="Recover Timbermaw Paws in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17929]={d="英雄，在冬泉谷，火与冰之间的平衡向来微妙。这一地区的本质就凝聚在稀有的霜火硫磺之中。这种独特的元素只存在于这片冰封之地的温泉里，其特性对许多神圣仪式和古老疗法都至关重要。\n\n然而近来，这种珍贵的资源一直在减少。我们需要你前往温泉，取得一份读数。有你的帮助，我们就能确保传统的延续与冬泉谷的平衡。",dEN="Hero, the balance between fire and ice has always been a delicate one in Winterspring. The very essence of this region is captured in the rare Frostfire Sulphur. Found only in the hot springs of this icy land, this unique element possesses properties that are vital for many sacred rituals and ancient remedies.\n\nHowever, recently, this precious resource has been diminishing. We need you to scour the hot spring and get a reading. With your aid, we can ensure the continued traditions and balance of Winterspring.",o="在冬泉谷的温泉取得一份读数。",oEN="Gather a reading from the hot spring in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17930]={d="勇士，冬泉谷潜藏着一大严重威胁。臭名昭著的冰霜元素科鲁恩——霜之暴君——已经现身，企图夺取霜火温泉。科鲁恩冰冷的钳制正扼杀这片土地上的生命，它的力量每时每刻都在增长。我需要我们最强大的英雄立刻前往温泉，直面这一威胁。在科鲁恩的冰封诅咒进一步蔓延冬泉谷之前杀死它。",dEN="Champion, a grave threat looms in Winterspring. The notorious frost elemental Collune, Tyrant of Frost, has emerged to lay claim to the Frostfire Hotsprings. Already, Collune's icy grip chokes the life from the land, and its powers grow with each passing moment. I need our mightiest hero to travel to the Hotsprings immediately and confront this menace. Slay Collune before its freezing curse spreads further across Winterspring.",o="杀死科鲁恩",oEN="Slay Collune",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17931]={d=".",dEN=".",o=".",oEN="."}
Q[17933]={d="毒刺纳迦大批来到埃达拉斯废墟，似乎打算夺取曾居住此地的上层精灵留下的神器。他们的数量太多，我们无法独自接近废墟。消灭毒刺纳迦，削弱他们对废墟的控制，或许我们就能抢先收集一些神器，而不是任其落入纳迦之手。",dEN="The Spitelash naga have come to the Ruins of Eldarath in force, seemingly intent on claiming the artifacts of the Highborne that once inhabited the area. Their numbers are too great to get anywhere near the ruins for ourselves. Cull the Spitelash's numbers and weaken their hold on the ruins, and we might be able to gather some of the artifacts instead of allowing them to fall into the hands of the naga.",o="在埃达拉斯废墟附近杀死毒刺纳迦",oEN="Slay Spitelash Naga near the Ruins of Eldarath",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17934]={d="我们正试图前往埃德拉斯废墟，寻找上层精灵留下的遗物，但毒刺纳迦处处阻挠我们的行动。他们的尖啸者和战士组成了一道几乎无法突破的前线，使我们难以抵达废墟。我们需要你前去，尽可能多地击败尖啸者和战士，打破他们的前线，好让我们得以推进。",dEN="We're trying to get through to the Ruins of Eldrath to find relics left behind by the Highborne, but the Spitelash Naga block our efforts at every turn. Their Screamers and Warriors have formed a front line that has proven almost impossible to get past so we can reach the ruins. We need you to go through and defeat as many of their Screamers and Warriors as you can find to break their front line so we can push through.",o="杀死封锁通往埃德拉斯废墟之路的毒刺纳迦",oEN="Slay Spitelash Naga barring the path to the Ruins of Eldrath",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17935]={d="我们并不完全清楚是什么让纳迦如此热衷于夺取埃德拉斯，但我们怀疑除了上层精灵神器的力量之外，还有别的缘故。我们已在纳迦佩戴的吊坠和武器上看到一些雕刻，似乎与废墟中的若干刻纹相符。然而我们需要更近距离的观察才能得出更多结论，而纳迦并不愿放弃任何一样。我们请你强行夺取纳迦的武器和吊坠并带到这里，好让我们开始研究它们与这些废墟可能存在何种联系。",dEN="We aren't entirely sure what makes the naga so interested in claiming Eldrath, but we suspect there is more than just the power of Highborne artifacts at play. We've spotted engravings on the pendants and weapons carried by the naga which seem to match several of the carvings found at the ruins. We need a closer look to be able to draw any further conclusions though, and the naga are far from willing to part with either. We would ask you to take the weapons and pendants of the naga by force and bring them back here so we can begin to study what their connection to these ruins might be.",o="从毒刺纳迦身上收集三叉戟和吊坠",oEN="Collect Tridents and Pendants from the Spitelash Naga",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[17936]={d="我和朋友们要在藏宝海湾举办一场庆典，这是难得一见的盛会，联盟与部落的成员都能暂时摆脱阵营的束缚聚在一起。大家都指望我那道著名的——好吧，算小有名气的——蛤蜊大餐。我本打算今天就开始备菜，却发现有海盗把我所有的食材都偷走了。\n\n我用的是只有在艾萨拉才能找到的特定海藻和蛤蜊，可庆典就在明天，我没时间再去采集了。我需要有人去艾萨拉收集蛤蜊肉和海藻，否则整场活动就要变成一场灾难了。",dEN="My friends and I are hosting a celebration at Booty Bay, a rare event where members of both the Alliance and Horde can come together, free of the ties of their factions, at least for a time. Everyone is counting on my famous, well, somewhat famous clam bake. I had planned to start making the dish today, but I discovered all my ingredients were stolen by pirates.\n\nI use a specific variety of seaweed and clams found only in Azshara, but the celebration is tomorrow, and I don't have time to gather more. I need someone to gather clam meat and seaweed from Azshara, or this whole event will be a calamity.",o="在艾萨拉收集海藻和蛤蜊肉",oEN="Collect Seaweed and Clam Meat in Azshara",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18000]={d="英雄，冬泉谷的忧虑日益加深。霜刃豹曾是这片冰封之地上高贵的生物，如今却变得越来越好斗。据信有一种未知的力量正在腐化它们的本质，使它们违背天性与居民为敌。为避免更多伤害并恢复此地区的平衡，我们必须削减它们的数量。前往霜刃石——这些壮丽生物熟知的栖居地，在为时已晚之前平息它们日益增长的威胁。",dEN="Hero, there's a growing concern in Winterspring. The Frostsabers, once noble creatures of this frozen land, have grown increasingly aggressive. It's believed that an unknown force is tainting their very essence, causing them to act out against both nature and its inhabitants. To prevent further harm and restore the balance of this region, we must thin their numbers. Journey to the Frostsaber Rock, a known haven of these magnificent creatures, and quell their growing threat before it's too late.",o="在冬泉谷的霜刃石杀死6只霜刃豹幼崽、6只霜刃豹雌虎和5只霜刃豹潜伏者。",oEN="Slay 6 Frostsaber Cubs, 6 Frostsaber Huntresses, and 5 Frostsaber Stalkers at Frostsaber Rock in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18001]={d="英雄，冬泉谷的本质正处于混乱之中。曾在这片雪原上平静游荡的生物，如今表现出前所未有的攻击性。寒风蹂躏者、远古碎牙者和冬泉尖啸者都属于构成重大威胁的一类。它们不可预测的行为不仅令人担忧自然的平衡，也危及冬泉谷所有生灵的安全。作为和平与平衡的守护者，我们需要你介入并处理这一紧迫问题。深入荒野，削减它们充满威胁的存在。",dEN="Hero, the very essence of Winterspring is in turmoil. Creatures that once peacefully roamed these snowy plains are now acting with unprecedented aggression. The Chillwind Ravagers, Elder Shardtooths, and Winterspring Screechers are among those posing a significant threat. Their unpredictable behaviors have become a concern not only for the balance of nature but for the safety of all beings in Winterspring. As a guardian of peace and balance, we need you to step in and address this pressing issue. Venture into the wild and reduce their menacing presence.",o="在冬泉谷杀死6只寒风蹂躏者、6只远古碎牙者和6只冬泉尖啸者。",oEN="Slay 6 Chillwind Ravagers, 6 Elder Shardtooths, and 6 Winterspring Screechers in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18002]={d="英雄，冬泉谷原始的寂静正被一种不寻常的威胁打破。枭兽，尤其是月华枭兽和狂乱枭兽，正从隐秘的巢穴中涌出，给这一地区带来混乱与动荡。关于它们令人不安的尖叫和失控攻击性的传闻已不胫而走。这些天性孤僻的生物如今威胁着冬泉谷的安宁。我们需要你直面这些长羽毛的恶魔，确保我们土地的宁静得以维系。",dEN="Hero, the pristine silence of Winterspring is being shattered by an unusual menace. The Owlbeasts, particularly the Moontouched and Berserk breeds, are emerging from their hidden lairs, bringing chaos and disruption to the region. Tales of their haunting cries and unbridled aggression have spread like wildfire. These creatures, usually reclusive by nature, now threaten the peace of Winterspring. We need you to confront these feathered fiends and ensure the tranquility of our land is preserved.",o="在冬泉谷杀死8只月华枭兽和8只狂乱枭兽。",oEN="Slay 8 Moontouched Owlbeasts and 8 Berserk Owlbeasts in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18004]={d="英雄，冬泉谷的灵魂凝聚在其独特的动植物之中。随着这一地区的动荡加剧，愈发需要借助大地的力量来恢复平衡。据说枭兽羽毛、霜刃豹之牙和寒风利爪中都灌注着冬泉谷纯粹的精华。这些物品若结合起来，或许能帮助我们制作一个足够强大的图腾，以平息不安、让这片冰原重归和谐。需要你的本领与勇气来收集这些关键材料。",dEN="Hero, the spirit of Winterspring is enshrined in its unique flora and fauna. As the disturbances in the region grow, there is an increasing need to harness the power of the land to restore balance. The Owlbeast Feathers, Frostsaber Teeth, and Chillwind Claws are said to be imbued with the raw essence of Winterspring. These items, when combined, could help us craft a totem potent enough to quell the unrest and bring harmony back to these icy plains. Your expertise and courage are needed to gather these essential components.",o="在冬泉谷收集枭兽羽毛、霜刃豹之牙和寒风利爪。",oEN="Collect Owlbeast Feathers, Frostsaber Teeth, and Chillwind Claws in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18005]={d="英雄，一头名为图雷肯的邪恶奇美拉盘踞在冬泉谷冰冷的峰顶，无情地捕食永望镇周边的生灵。这头野蛮的野兽日益可怖，若不加控制，图雷肯将成为这片土地上无法阻挡的祸患。永望镇的地精们愿意为任何终结图雷肯恐怖统治的人奉上一笔可观的财富。",dEN="Hero, a vile chimera named Turekkon stalks the frigid peaks of Winterspring, preying mercilessly upon the outskirts of Everlook. This savage beast grows more fearsome by the day, and if left unchecked, Turekkon will become an unstoppable scourge upon the land. The goblins of Everlook are willing to offer a small fortune to anyone who would put an end to Turekkon's reign of terror.",o="杀死图雷肯",oEN="Slay Turekkon",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18006]={d="英雄，上层精灵的古老灵魂仍徘徊在冬泉谷，尤其是那片寂静得令人不安的凯尔塞里尔湖周围。这些曾高贵骄傲的灵魂，如今以饱受折磨的往昔回响之姿显现：痛苦的上层精灵与苦闷的上层精灵。他们不安的灵魂给这片土地带来痛苦与动荡。赐予他们安宁的时刻到了。前往凯尔塞里尔湖，将这些灵魂从折磨中解放，让他们终于获得被剥夺了数千年的安息。",dEN="Hero, the ancient spirits of the Highborne still linger in Winterspring, particularly around the hauntingly serene Lake Kel'Theril. These spirits, once noble and proud, now manifest as tormented echoes of their past - the Suffering and Anguished Highborne. Their restless souls bring sorrow and disturbance to the land. The time has come to grant them peace. Journey to Lake Kel'Theril and release these spirits from their torment, allowing them to finally find the rest they've been denied for millennia.",o="在冬泉谷的凯尔塞里尔湖杀死6名痛苦的上层精灵和6名苦闷的上层精灵。",oEN="Slay 6 Suffering Highborne and 6 Anguished Highborne at Lake Kel'Theril in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18007]={d="钴蓝龙族曾备受尊崇、强大无比，如今却堕入黑暗的沉沦，肆虐大地、威胁居民。英雄，平衡必须恢复。迎战钴蓝雏龙、钴蓝法师织者与钴蓝鳞甲鞭笞者，阻止他们日益增长的邪恶。",dEN="The Cobalt dragons, once revered and powerful, have now fallen into a dark descent, plaguing the lands and threatening its inhabitants. Hero, the balance must be restored. Face the Cobalt Broodlings, Mageweavers, and Scalebanes to halt their growing malevolence.",o="击败钴蓝雏龙、钴蓝法师织者和钴蓝鳞甲鞭笞者，以阻止他们黑暗影响的蔓延。",oEN="Defeat Cobalt Broodlings, Cobalt Mageweavers, and Cobalt Scalebanes to stem the tide of their dark influence.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18008]={d="寒爪熊怪曾是冬泉谷平和的居民，如今却变得越来越好斗，威胁着这一地区微妙的平衡。令人不安的传言暗示，某种黑暗影响已攫住了他们。英雄，该由你去迎战寒爪巢穴守卫、寒爪熊怪和萨满，终结他们堕落的统治。",dEN="The Winterfall furbolgs, once peaceful inhabitants of Winterspring, have grown increasingly aggressive, threatening the delicate balance of the region. Disturbed rumors suggest a dark influence has taken hold. Hero, it's upon you to confront the Winterfall Den Watchers, Ursa, and Shamans, and bring an end to their tainted reign.",o="在冬泉谷消灭寒爪巢穴守卫、寒爪熊怪和寒爪萨满。",oEN="Eliminate the Winterfall Den Watcher, Winterfall Ursa, and Winterfall Shaman in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18009]={d="在冬泉谷的雪原之间，散落着远古存在的强大遗物。钴蓝龙鳞闪烁着与奥术共鸣的力量；上层精灵精华中蕴藏着久已遗忘的过去的低语；而熊怪毛皮则见证着冬泉谷本地居民的强韧与坚毅。英雄，收集这些物品，好让我们理解并守护这片冰封国度的微妙平衡。",dEN="Amidst the snowy expanses of Winterspring lie potent relics from beings of old. The Cobalt Dragon Scales shimmer with a power that resonates with the arcane; the Highborne Essences contain whispers of a past long forgotten; and the Furbolg Furs are testament to the strength and endurance of Winterspring's native denizens. Hero, gather these items so that we may understand and protect the delicate balance of this icy realm.",o="在冬泉谷收集钴蓝龙鳞、上层精灵精华和熊怪毛皮。",oEN="Collect Cobalt Dragon Scales, Highborne Essences, and Furbolg Furs in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18011]={d="勇士，一头名为冰吼的野蛮雪人潜伏在冰蓟丘陵的洞穴中，伺机伏击旅人，在整片土地上散播混乱。若不加控制，冰吼的攻击性只会愈演愈烈，危及所有穿越冬泉谷的人。我需要一位传奇猎人深入冰吼冰冷的巢穴，一劳永逸地终结这头雪人的恐怖统治。在这头野兽的嗜血欲望夺走更多无辜生命之前杀死冰吼。",dEN="Champion, a savage yeti named Icewhomp lurks in the caves of Ice Thistle Hills, emerging to ambush travelers and spread havoc across the land. Left unchecked, Icewhomp's aggression will only worsen, endangering all who cross Winterspring. I need a legendary hunter to venture into Icewhomp's frigid den and end the yeti's reign of terror once and for all. Slay Icewhomp before the beast's bloodlust claims more innocent lives.",o="杀死冰吼",oEN="Slay Icewhomp",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18012]={d="强大的霜槌巨人在冬泉谷幽深的冰封洞穴中沉睡了许久，如今已经苏醒。它们的狂怒威胁着这一地区脆弱的生态与居民。英雄，需要你的力量与勇气。迎战这些巨人，确保冬泉谷的安全。",dEN="The mighty Frostmaul Giants, once dormant in the deep icy caverns of Winterspring, have awakened. Their rampages threaten the delicate ecosystem and the inhabitants of the region. Hero, your strength and courage are needed. Face these behemoths and ensure the safety of Winterspring.",o="在冬泉谷杀死6名霜槌巨人，以阻止他们破坏性的推进。",oEN="Slay 6 Frostmaul Giants in Winterspring to halt their destructive advance.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18013]={d="冬泉谷宁静的土地已被其夜行居民日益增长的好斗所扰乱。疯狂的枭兽、月华枭兽和可怕的狂暴枭熊如今威胁着这一地区的平衡。英雄，深入雪原平息它们的怒火，确保和平重回这片冰封国度。",dEN="The serene lands of Winterspring have been disrupted by the heightened aggression of its nocturnal inhabitants. Crazed Owlbeasts, Moontouched Owlbeasts, and the fearsome Berserk Owlbears now threaten the balance of the region. Hero, venture into the snowy expanses and quell their rage, ensuring peace returns to the frosty realm.",o="在冬泉谷消灭6只疯狂枭兽、6只月华枭兽和2只狂暴枭熊。",oEN="Eliminate 6 Crazed Owlbeasts, 6 Moontouched Owlbeasts, and 2 Berserk Owlbears in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18014]={d="低语峡谷回荡着赫达林恶魔的恶毒能量。他们的存在是冬泉谷的一大祸害，黑暗魔法渗入大地的本质之中。英雄，必须在赫达林的黑暗影响吞噬一切之前阻止他们。迎战他们的杀戮者、新兵和危险的追法者，击退这一迫近的威胁。",dEN="Darkwhisper Gorge echoes with the malevolent energy of the Hederine demons. Their presence is a blight upon Winterspring, their dark magics seeping into the very essence of the land. Hero, these Hederine must be halted before their dark influence engulfs all. Confront the Slayers, Initiates, and the dangerous Manastalkers to push back this looming threat.",o="在低语峡谷击败8名赫达林杀戮者、8名赫达林新兵和5名赫达林追法者。",oEN="Vanquish 8 Hederine Slayers, 8 Hederine Initiates, and 5 Hederine Manastalkers in Darkwhisper Gorge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18015]={d="在冬泉谷的冰封辽阔之地，强大的元素静静潜伏，每一件都承载着这一地区本质的一部分。霜槌碎片是远古巨人的残迹，回荡着大地持久的力量。枭兽羽毛轻如雪花却坚韧如狂风，诉说着天空的秘密。最后，赫达林之心以某种黑暗而未知的力量搏动着，或许能揭开更深层的谜团。英雄，收集这些物品，帮助我们查明冬泉谷力量真正的本质。",dEN="In the frostbitten expanse of Winterspring, powerful elements lie hidden, each holding a piece of the region's essence. The Frostmaul Fragments, remnants of the ancient giants, resonate with the land's enduring strength. The Owlbeast Feathers, light as snowflakes yet strong as the fierce winds, speak of the sky's secrets. Lastly, the Hederine Hearts, pulsing with a dark, unknown power, could unlock deeper mysteries. Gather these items, Hero, and help us uncover the true nature of Winterspring's power.",o="在冬泉谷收集霜槌碎片、枭兽羽毛和赫达林之心。",oEN="Collect Frostmaul Fragments, Owlbeast Feathers and Hederine Hearts in Winterspring.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18016]={d="低语峡谷的恶魔由一位名为赫达林的狡诈魅魔统领。我们始终无法追踪到赫达林本人，但赫达林的追随者被一位名叫阿卡里尔的艾瑞达所约束。\n\n一些报告表明，阿卡里尔在赫达林眼中不只是普通的副官；除了击败一名强敌之外，阿卡里尔之死或许还有助于把赫达林女士从藏身处引出来。趁我们还知道阿卡里尔的位置，迅速出击。",dEN="The demons in Darkwhisper Gorge are led by an ellusive succubus known as Hederine. We've been unable to track down Hederine herself, but Hederine's loyalists are kept in line by an Eredar by the name of Akaariel.\n\nSome reports suggest that Akaariel is regarded as more than simply a lieutenant by Hederine, and it is hoped that, in addition to defeating a powerful adversary, Akaariel's death may help to lure Lady Hederine out of hiding. Strike quickly, while we still know Akariel's location.",o="杀死阿卡里尔",oEN="Slay Akaariel",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18017]={d="费伍德，这片曾经生机勃勃的森林，如今已被恶魔的腐化所污染。死木部族在这种邪恶影响下散播混乱，加深了森林的腐化。死木萨满、死木复仇者以及他们的巢穴守卫正是这场混乱背后的驱动力。英雄，需要你的刀刃与决心来遏制这个堕落部族的浪潮，为费伍德带回希望。",dEN="Felwood, a once-vibrant forest now tainted with demonic corruption. The Deadwood tribe, under this malefic influence, wreak havoc and deepen the woods' corruption. The Deadwood Shamans, Avengers, and their vigilant Den Watchers are the driving force behind this chaos. Hero, your blade and determination are needed to stem the tide of this darkened tribe and bring hope back to Felwood.",o="在费伍德森林消灭6名死木萨满、6名死木复仇者和4名死木巢穴守卫。",oEN="Eliminate 6 Deadwood Shamans, 6 Deadwood Avengers, and 4 Deadwood Den Watchers in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18018]={d="费伍德的森林正受到威胁。铁木践踏者曾是森林的守护者，如今却践踏着森林的本质，而剧毒恐魔则毒害着这一区域的灵魂。英雄，大地在呼救。前往那里直面这些威胁，帮助恢复费伍德一部分自然之美。",dEN="The forests of Felwood are under threat. Irontree Stompers, once guardians of the woodland, now trample its very essence, while the Toxic Horrors poison the lifeblood of the region. Hero, the land cries out for aid. Venture forth and confront these menaces, and help restore some of Felwood's natural beauty.",o="杀死6只铁木践踏者和6只剧毒恐魔。",oEN="Slay 6 Irontree Stompers and 6 Toxic Horrors.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18019]={d="邪恶的碧火萨特是受诅咒过往的残存者，他们在整个费伍德森林散播背叛与黑暗魔法。唤火者主导黑暗仪式，背叛者播撒纷争，欺诈者蒙骗无辜，他们的统治威胁着将森林拖入无法逆转的黑暗。英雄，全凭你出手干预。驱除碧火的威胁，为这片受污染的森林带来一丝喘息。",dEN="The malevolent Jadefire satyrs, remnants of a cursed past, spread their treachery and dark magic throughout Felwood. With their Hellcallers leading dark rituals, Betrayers sowing discord, and Tricksters deceiving the innocent, their reign threatens to plunge the forest into irreversible darkness. Hero, it is upon you to intervene. Exorcise the Jadefire threat and bring respite to the tainted woods.",o="在费伍德森林消灭6名碧火唤火者、6名碧火背叛者和6名碧火欺诈者。",oEN="Exterminate 6 Jadefire Hellcallers, 6 Jadefire Betrayers, and 6 Jadefire Tricksters in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18020]={d="费伍德，这片受腐化污染的土地，藏着或有助于其恢复的秘密。死木熊怪携带着注入其扭曲能量的图腾，铁木古树拥有能抵御大地瘟疫的独特树皮，而碧火萨特则长着充满恶毒魔法的角。英雄，收集这些物品以供研究，也许我们就能找到办法逆转这片曾经繁茂的森林所遭受的伤害。",dEN="Felwood, a land tainted by corruption, holds secrets that may aid in its restoration. The Deadwood Furbolgs carry totems imbued with their twisted energies, the Irontree ancients bear unique barks resistant to the land's blight, and the Jadefire Satyrs possess horns brimming with malevolent magic. Hero, gather these items for study, and perhaps we can find a way to reverse the damage done to this once-thriving forest.",o="收集死木图腾、铁木树皮和碧火之角。",oEN="Collect Deadwood Totems, Irontree Barks, and Jadefire Horns.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18021]={d="英雄，碧火小径传来噩耗。一位名叫扎祖尔'乌的邪恶萨特在费伍德各地率领凶残的突袭，所过之处只留下废墟。若不加阻止，这个恶棍及其追随者将劫掠一切所及之物。我需要一位传奇勇士前往碧火小径，在这位萨特的腐化进一步蔓延大地之前杀死扎祖尔'乌。",dEN="Hero, dire news from Jadefire Run. A sinister satyr named Zazzuth'ul leads vicious raids across Felwood, leaving only ruin in his wake. If left unchecked, this rogue and his followers will despoil all they touch. I need a legendary champion to venture to Jadefire Run and slay Zazzuth'ul, before the satyr's corruption spreads further across the land.",o="杀死扎祖尔'乌",oEN="Slay Zazzuth’ul",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18022]={d="在费伍德深处，死木部族继续着他们的毁灭之路：战士带头冲锋，探路者引领突袭，园丁则用每一次触碰污染着花草。这些堕落的熊怪不仅威胁着当地居民，还加剧了土地上已有的腐化。英雄，你的力量与决心再次被召唤。击退死木的攻势，为费伍德的暗影带回一线希望。",dEN="Deep within Felwood, the Deadwood tribe continues its destructive path, with Warriors leading the charge, Pathfinders navigating their raids, and Gardeners tainting the flora with every touch. These corrupted furbolgs not only pose a threat to the inhabitants but also exacerbate the land's existing corruption. Hero, your might and resolve are called upon once again. Push back the Deadwood onslaught and restore a glimmer of hope to the shadows of Felwood.",o="在费伍德森林击败6名死木战士、4名死木探路者和6名死木园丁。",oEN="Defeat 6 Deadwood Warriors, 4 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 6 Deadwood Gardeners in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18023]={d="随着黑暗能量在费伍德深处愈发强烈地搏动，碧火萨特及其恶魔猎手亲族正加紧他们邪恶的仪式，囚禁着森林居民的灵魂本身。被囚禁的恶魔灵魂正是他们不洁力量的来源。英雄，你的干预至关重要。击倒萨特与恶魔猎手，夺回被囚的灵魂，在费伍德的本质被永远吞噬之前将其恢复。",dEN="As the dark energies pulsate deeper into Felwood, the Jadefire Satyrs and their Felsworn kin intensify their wicked rituals, ensnaring the very souls of the forest's inhabitants. The trapped Demon Souls serve as a source of their unholy power. Hero, your intervention is critical. Strike down the Satyrs and Felsworn, reclaim the ensnared souls, and restore the essence of Felwood before it's forever consumed.",o="在费伍德森林消灭6名碧火萨特、6名碧火恶魔猎手并夺回6个恶魔灵魂。",oEN="Eliminate 6 Jadefire Satyrs, 6 Jadefire Felsworn and recover 6 Demon Souls in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18024]={d="费伍德的野生动物曾是自然和谐的象征，如今却显示出邪恶变异的迹象。邪爪食腐者劫掠大地，而强大的怒爪熊和怒爪粉碎者则以无比的凶残施行统治。这种反常行为不仅威胁着居民，也威胁着费伍德的本质本身。英雄，挺身而出，平息这疯狂的威胁，守护森林微妙的平衡。",dEN="The wildlife of Felwood, once symbols of nature's harmony, now show signs of a malevolent transformation. Felpaw Scavengers ransack the land, while the mighty Angerclaw Bears and Maulers exert dominance with unparalleled ferocity. This aberrant behavior threatens not just the inhabitants, but the very essence of Felwood. Hero, step forth and quell this frenzied menace to preserve the delicate balance of the forest.",o="在费伍德森林压制6只邪爪食腐者、6只怒爪熊和6只怒爪粉碎者。",oEN="Neutralize 6 Felpaw Scavengers, 6 Angerclaw Bears, and 6 Angerclaw Maulers in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18026]={d="在费伍德深处，邪恶的加德纳尔飞地藏匿着黑暗的秘密。守卫保持着警觉，保护着推动教派黑暗目的的邪教徒，而信徒则精进着他们被禁止的魔法。费伍德的心脏本身在他们黑暗的仪式之后颤抖。英雄，如今比以往任何时候都更需要你的勇气。深入加德纳尔，扑灭这些企图吞噬整个费伍德的暗影。",dEN="Deep within Felwood, the malevolent enclave of Jaedenar harbors dark secrets. The Guardians stand vigilant, protecting the Cultists who further the cult's dark aims, while the Adepts hone their forbidden magics. The very heart of Felwood quivers in the wake of their dark rituals. Hero, your valor is needed now more than ever. Delve into Jaedenar and extinguish these shadows that seek to consume all of Felwood.",o="在费伍德森林深处击败7名加德纳尔守卫、7名加德纳尔邪教徒和6名加德纳尔信徒。",oEN="Vanquish 7 Jaedenar Guardians, 7 Jaedenar Cultists, and 6 Jaedenar Adepts in the depths of Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18027]={d="勇士，欺诈者神殿传来噩耗。邪恶的兽人术士达穆格正在举行亵渎的仪式，将恶魔爪牙束缚于自己的意志。若不加阻止，达穆格的力量恐将失控。我需要你立刻潜入神殿，在达穆格的邪恶扩散之前将其杀死。",dEN="Champion, dire news from the Shrine of the Deceiver. The vile orc warlock Damugg performs profane rituals, binding demonic minions to his will. Left unchecked, Damugg's power threatens to surge out of control. I need you to infiltrate the Shrine immediately and slay Damugg before his evil spreads.",o="杀死达穆格",oEN="Slay Damugg",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18028]={d="剧毒林间空地曾是自然之美的圣所，如今却被一种强效的瘟疫所污染，扭曲并腐化着其范围内的一切生命。这种污秽的传染源自如今栖息于此的生物的本质本身。英雄，接过交给你的这瓶圣水。从受影响的居民身上收集剧毒精华，并用这瓶圣水的净化之力清理林间空地，让和平与生机重回这片土地。",dEN="The Noxious Glade, once a sanctuary of natural beauty, now lies tainted with a potent plague that twists and corrupts all life within its bounds. This foul contagion emits from the very essence of the creatures that now dwell there. Hero, take this sacred vial given to you. Collect the Noxious Essences from the plagued inhabitants and use the vial's purifying powers to cleanse the glade, restoring peace and vitality to the land.",o="从剧毒林间空地的生物身上收集剧毒精华。",oEN="Gather Noxious Essences from the creatures in the Noxious Glade.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18029]={d="剥苔者曾是一个和谐的部族，如今却屈服于某种黑暗影响，被推向好斗与邪恶。斥候在周边游荡，被感染的剥苔者散播着黑暗的苦难，而暗影猎手则将黑暗混入他们的仪式，在大地上投下阴影。英雄，需要你的本领。迎战这些剥苔者，平息他们的叛乱，以免这一地区及其居民遭受更多伤害。",dEN="The Mossflayers, once a tribe of harmony, have succumbed to a dark influence that drives them to aggression and malevolence. Scouts prowl the perimeter, Infected Mossflayers spread the dark affliction, and the Shadowhunters meld darkness with their rituals, casting a shadow over the land. Hero, your prowess is needed. Confront these Mossflayers and quell their uprising to prevent further harm to the region and its inhabitants.",o="处置6名剥苔者斥候、6名被感染的剥苔者和6名剥苔者暗影猎手。",oEN="Dispatch 6 Mossflayer Scouts, 6 Infected Mossflayers, and 6 Mossflayer Shadowhunters.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18030]={d="这一地区目睹了本土生物之间可怕的变异，它们变成了昔日模样的怪物版本。狂乱瘟疫猎犬带着无厌的饥渴在大地上游荡，腐尸吞噬者啃食尸体、散播腐朽，而巨大的瘟疫蝙蝠则让天空蒙上阴影，从高处带来恐惧。这些祸害加剧了已有的瘟疫，构成迫在眉睫的威胁。英雄，该由你去消灭这些生物，减轻瘟疫的重压。",dEN="The region has witnessed a horrifying mutation amongst its native creatures, turning them into monstrous versions of their former selves. Frenzied Plaguehounds roam the grounds with an insatiable hunger, Carrion Devourers scavenge and spread decay, and the skies darken with the Monstrous Plaguebats that bring terror from above. These pests exacerbate the existing plague and pose an imminent threat. Hero, it falls upon you to cull these creatures and lessen the plague's stranglehold.",o="消灭4只狂乱瘟疫猎犬、6只腐尸吞噬者和6只巨型瘟疫蝙蝠。",oEN="Eliminate 4 Frenzied Plaguehounds, 6 Carrion Devourers, and 6 Monstrous Plaguebats.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18031]={d="天灾军团在无情的统治追逐中派出攻城工程师，以强化其攻势。这些工程师正在囤积攻城机械零件，用以组装足以击破最坚固防御的致命战争机器。英雄，时间至关重要。击倒这些工程师并夺取他们收集的零件。只有摧毁他们的攻城能力，我们才有望挫败天灾军团即将发动的进攻。",dEN="The Scourge, in their relentless pursuit of dominion, have deployed Siege Engineers to fortify their offensive. These engineers are amassing Siege Engine Parts to assemble deadly war machines capable of breaching even the strongest defenses. Hero, time is of the essence. Strike down these engineers and seize the parts they've gathered. Only by dismantling their siege capabilities can we hope to thwart the Scourge's impending onslaught.",o="击败天灾攻城工程师并取得攻城机械零件。",oEN="Vanquish Scourge Siege Engineers and procure Siege Engine Parts.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18033]={d="一位强大的巫妖已经控制了祖尔玛沙的巨魔。巫妖本身被认为过于危险，即便以你的本领也难以应对，但它利用了一位很久以前死去的战士扎尔'奈的尸体作为武器，攻击我们在该地区的部队。\n\n我们希望你在祖尔玛沙摧毁扎尔'奈。小心，我们的攻击对扎尔'奈完全无效。在杀死扎尔'奈之前，你或许需要想办法破除巫妖的保护。",dEN="A powerful lich has seized its hold over the trolls of Zul'Mashar. The lich itself has been deemed far too dangerous even for your abilities, but it has used the corpse of a long-dead warrior called Zar'nai as a weapon to attack our forces in the area.\n\nWe would like you to destroy Zar'nai at Zul'Mashar. Be warned, our attacks have proven entirely ineffective against Zar'nai. You may need to find a way to break the lich's protections before you can slay Zar'nai.",o="杀死扎尔'奈",oEN="Slay Zar’nai",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18034]={d="血色十字军曾是备受尊崇的圣骑士与牧师，如今却迷失了道路，怀抱狂热的理念，威胁着他们声称要保护的土地本身。在其行列中，血色守卫、血色附魔师和血色牧师握有相当大的力量与影响力，推动着他们狂热的志业。英雄，该由你去迎战这些关键人物，遏止血色十字军的力量。前往他们的领地，直面他们的力量与魔法，确保受他们威胁的无辜者的安全。",dEN="The Scarlet Crusade, once revered paladins and priests, have lost their way, now harboring fanatical ideals that threaten the very lands they claim to protect. Among their ranks, the Scarlet Warders, Enchanters, and Clerics wield significant power and influence, advancing their zealous cause. It falls upon you, Hero, to confront these key figures and curb the Scarlet Crusade's strength. Head into their territory, confront their might and magic, and ensure the safety of the innocents they threaten.",o="消灭6名血色守卫、6名血色附魔师和6名血色牧师。",oEN="Eliminate 6 Scarlet Warders, 6 Scarlet Enchanters, and 6 Scarlet Clerics.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18035]={d="提尔之手是血色十字军狂热的堡垒，傲然矗立，其大教堂象征着他们被误导的狂热。为了挑战他们的统治并传达明确的抵抗信号，我们制作了一面凝聚这片土地真正精神的旗帜。英雄，你的任务不仅是把这面旗帜插在大教堂前，还要抵挡任何企图将其推倒的人。如此一来，我们将击中他们信仰的核心，并为受其压迫者点燃希望。",dEN="Tyr's Hand, a bastion of the Scarlet Crusade's fanaticism, stands defiantly, with its cathedral representing their misguided zeal. To challenge their dominion and send a clear message of resistance, we've crafted a flag that embodies the true spirit of the land. Hero, your mission is not just to place this flag outside the cathedral but to defend it against any who would see it torn down. By doing so, we strike at the very heart of their faith and inspire hope in those they oppress.",o="将挑战旗帜插在提尔之手的大教堂外，并抵御血色十字军攻击者的进攻。",oEN="Place the challenge flag outside the cathedral in Tyr's Hand and defend it against Scarlet Crusade attackers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18036]={d="血色十字军的力量不仅在于人数，更在于其精英的能力。血色禁卫军是他们志业可畏的守护者；血色助理牧师是灌注狂热的灵魂指引者；血色大法师则是怀有狂热虔诚的奥术大师。这些人物构成了他们教团的支柱。英雄，要让和平在这片多难的土地上有一线机会，就必须迎战这些精英并消除其威胁。深入他们统治的核心，打破其枷锁。",dEN="The strength of the Scarlet Crusade lies not just in their numbers, but in the capabilities of their elite. The Scarlet Praetorians, formidable guardians of their cause; the Scarlet Curates, spiritual guides steeped in zealotry; and the Scarlet Archmages, masters of arcane with fanatical devotion. These figures represent the backbone of their order. Hero, for peace to stand a chance in these troubled lands, these elites must be confronted and their threat neutralized. Venture into the heart of their domain and break the chains of their dominance.",o="击败6名血色禁卫军、6名血色助理牧师和6名血色大法师。",oEN="Defeat 6 Scarlet Praetorians, 6 Scarlet Curates, and 6 Scarlet Archmages.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18037]={d="血色十字军以其不屈的狂热佩戴着代表教团与志业的徽记。这些徽记常由提尔之手的成员随身携带，不仅是忠诚的标识，也包含着关乎其行动的关键情报与计划。收集这些徽记，我们就能破译他们的策略，取得优势。英雄，深入提尔之手的心脏，取回这些血色徽记。其中的秘密将是我们瓦解他们行动的关键。",dEN="The Scarlet Crusade, in their unyielding fanaticism, bears emblems representing their order and cause. These symbols, often worn by their members in Tyr's Hand, not only serve as a badge of allegiance but also carry information and plans crucial to their operations. By gathering these emblems, we can decode their strategies and gain the upper hand. Hero, venture into the heart of Tyr's Hand and retrieve these Scarlet Emblems. Their secrets will be our key to dismantling their efforts.",o="在提尔之手从血色十字军成员身上收集血色徽记。",oEN="Collect Scarlet Emblems from members of the Scarlet Crusade in Tyr's Hand.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18038]={d="勇士，一项阴郁的任务在提尔之手等着你。狂热的圣骑士泽拉特·弗兰切娜在那里领导着血腥的征伐，把血色十字军聚集在她周围。必须阻止弗兰切娜，但她的信仰驱使她走向狂热。我把终结这位圣骑士统治的重担交给你，不择手段。一路奋战穿过提尔之手，杀死泽拉特·弗兰切娜。",dEN="Champion, a grim task awaits in Tyr's Hand. The fanatical paladin Zealot Francena leads bloody crusades from there, rallying the Scarlet Crusade around her. Francena must be stopped, but her faith drives her to zealotry. I am entrusting you with the burden of ending the paladin's reign by any means necessary. Fight your way through Tyr's Hand and slay Zealot Francena.",o="杀死狂热的弗兰切娜",oEN="Slay Zealot Francena",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18039]={d="在瘟疫之地的心脏深处，扭曲的死灵法师柯林指导下的黑暗实验造就了怪异的畸变体。仇恨尖啸者以其恐怖的尖叫散播绝望。喋喋不休的食尸鬼曾是无辜的灵魂，如今化作邪恶的存在，在大地上潜行。邪恶导师是禁忌魔法的大师，企图进一步散播瘟疫。英雄，这些生物不仅威胁着生者，更是对生命本身的嘲弄。踏上你的旅程，终结柯林的腐化。让动荡的土地重归平衡。",dEN="Deep in the heart of the Plaguelands, dark experiments under the guidance of the twisted necromancer Corin have led to the creation of monstrous aberrations. The Hate Shriekers, with their terrifying screams, spread despair. The Gibbering Ghouls, once innocent souls, now turned to malevolent entities, haunt the land. The Vile Tutors, masters of forbidden magics, seek to spread the plague further. Hero, these creatures are not only a threat to the living but a mockery of life itself. Journey forth and put an end to Corin's Corruptions. Restore balance to the disturbed lands.",o="消灭6只仇恨尖啸者、6只喋喋不休的食尸鬼和4名邪恶导师。",oEN="Eliminate 6 Hate Shriekers, 6 Gibbering Ghouls, and 4 Vile Tutors.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18040]={d="瘟疫之地长期以来一直是天灾军团扭曲造物的温床。瘟疫蝙蝠从天空俯冲而下，每一次振翅都散播疾病。腐尸幼虫是腐朽的造物，腐蚀着它们滑行而过的土地，而瘟疫猎犬幼崽则四处游荡，饥渴于无辜者的血肉。这些生物不仅是瘟疫的症状，更是其蔓延的催化剂。英雄，是时候应对这股来自陆地与海洋的腐化浪潮了。铲除这些威胁，为这片饱受蹂躏的地区带回一线希望。",dEN="The Plaguelands have long been a breeding ground for the Scourge's twisted creations. From the skies, Plaguebats swoop down, spreading disease with every flap of their wings. Carrion Grubs, creatures of decay, corrupt the very soil they slither upon, while the Plaguehound Runts roam, hungry for the flesh of the innocent. These creatures are not just symptoms of the plague but catalysts for its spread. Hero, the time has come to push back against this surge of corruption both on land and from the sea. Eradicate these threats and bring a glimmer of hope back to this blighted region.",o="杀死6只瘟疫蝙蝠、6只腐尸幼虫和6只瘟疫猎犬幼崽。",oEN="Slay 6 Plaguebats, 6 Carrion Grubs, and 6 Plaguehound Runts.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18041]={d="柯林十字路口与真菌谷周围的土地低语着被窃灵魂的故事与大自然的痛苦。柯林以其黑暗魔法囚禁了无数灵魂，它们的本质漫无目的地飘荡，等待被解放。与此同时，真菌谷因真菌瘟疫而躁动，那是大地病痛的阴郁提醒。英雄，该由你夺回这些被窃的灵魂并收集真菌瘟疫。如此一来，我们便能研究它们，找到治愈瘟疫之地并解放被柯林邪恶所困的灵魂的方法。",dEN="The land around Corin's Crossing and the Fungal Vale whispers tales of stolen souls and nature's anguish. Corin, with his dark magic, has trapped countless souls, their essence floating aimlessly, awaiting release. Concurrently, the Fungal Vale churns with Fungal Plaguei, a grim reminder of the land's sickness. Hero, it falls upon you to retrieve these stolen souls and gather the Fungal Plaguei. By doing so, we can study them to find a way to heal the Plaguelands and free the spirits entrapped by Corin's wickedness.",o="杀死真菌谷的居民。",oEN="Slay the Inhabitants of the Fungal Vale.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18042]={d="柯林十字路口与真菌谷周围的土地低语着被窃灵魂的故事与大自然的痛苦。柯林以其黑暗魔法囚禁了无数灵魂，它们的本质漫无目的地飘荡，等待被解放。与此同时，真菌谷因真菌瘟疫而躁动，那是大地病痛的阴郁提醒。英雄，该由你夺回这些被窃的灵魂并收集真菌瘟疫。如此一来，我们便能研究它们，找到治愈瘟疫之地并解放被柯林邪恶所困的灵魂的方法。",dEN="The land around Corin's Crossing and the Fungal Vale whispers tales of stolen souls and nature's anguish. Corin, with his dark magic, has trapped countless souls, their essence floating aimlessly, awaiting release. Concurrently, the Fungal Vale churns with Fungal Plaguei, a grim reminder of the land's sickness. Hero, it falls upon you to retrieve these stolen souls and gather the Fungal Plaguei. By doing so, we can study them to find a way to heal the Plaguelands and free the spirits entrapped by Corin's wickedness.",o="收集柯林窃取的灵魂，并从真菌谷和柯林十字路口采集真菌孢子。",oEN="Gather Corin's Stolen Souls and collect Fungal Spores from the Fungal Vale and Corin's Crossing.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18043]={d="英雄，邪恶的死灵法师阴郁者卡萨冯已现身真菌谷，唤醒亡者的灵魂以维持天灾军团对该地区的控制。他的黑暗魔法散播着疾病与苦难，他的亡灵爪牙则攻击一切挡路之人。我恳求你，勇敢的英雄，猎杀这个孽物，终结他的恐怖统治。深入山谷，直面卡萨冯。",dEN="Hero, the vile necromancer Kasavon the Bleak has surfaced in the Fungal Vale, raising the spirits of the dead to hold the Scourge's control over the area. His dark magic spreads sickness and suffering, while his undead minions attack all who cross their path. I beseech you, brave hero, to hunt down this fiend and end his reign of terror. Venture into the vale and face Kasavon.",o="杀死阴郁者卡萨冯",oEN="Slay Kasavon the Bleak",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18044]={d="奎尔利森小屋位于东瘟疫之地的北部边陲，曾是精灵文明的一座灯塔。那里的居民主要是伐木工、游侠和游径者，他们和睦相处，守护着精灵领地的边界。然而近来，一种莫名的敌意在他们心中扎根。他们对来者的攻击性威胁着我们在瘟疫之地建立的脆弱和平。英雄，前往奎尔利森小屋，平息这些精灵的攻击性，好让我们查明他们骤变的根源。",dEN="Quel'Lithien Lodge, situated in the northern reaches of the Eastern Plaguelands, was once a beacon of elven civilization. Its denizens, primarily Woodsmen, Rangers, and Pathstriders, lived harmoniously, safeguarding the borders of the elven territories. However, in recent times, a strange animosity has taken root within them. Their aggression towards outsiders threatens the fragile peace we've established in the Plaguelands. Hero, journey to the Quel'Lithien Lodge and quell the aggression of these elves, so that we might uncover the root of their sudden change.",o="前往奎尔利森小屋，杀死8名伐木工、8名游侠和4名游径者。",oEN="Travel to Quel'Lithien Lodge and slay 8 Woodsmen, 8 Rangers, and 4 Pathstriders.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18045]={d="东瘟疫之地遍布众多威胁，其中最突出的是从散布各地的地穴与陵墓中涌出的邪恶生物。地穴恶魔、地穴行者和地穴恐魔都是畸变体，据信是那些不幸沦为天灾军团邪恶影响受害者的冒险者与村民的残骸。这些生物如今在大地上游荡，散播恐惧与黑暗。英雄，是时候迎战这些亡灵威胁，终结它们的恐怖了。",dEN="The Eastern Plaguelands are riddled with numerous threats, not the least of which are the vile creatures that emerge from the crypts and mausoleums scattered across the land. The Crypt Fiends, Walkers, and Horrors are abominations that are believed to be the remnants of adventurers and villagers who were unfortunate enough to fall victim to the Scourge's malevolent influence. These creatures now roam the lands, spreading fear and darkness. Hero, the time has come to confront these undead menaces and put an end to their terror.",o="踏遍东瘟疫之地，杀死6只地穴恶魔、6只地穴行者和4只地穴恐魔。",oEN="Venture across the Eastern Plaguelands and slay 6 Crypt Fiends, 6 Crypt Walkers, and 4 Crypt Horrors.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18046]={d="瘟疫之地曾是一片繁茂的地区，如今却成了噩梦与痛苦之地。在游荡于这些受诅咒土地的无数畸变体中，有缝合恐魔——黑暗死灵法术的造物，有食人食尸鬼，还有受诅咒的法师——手握扭曲魔法的受罚灵魂。它们对生者无厌的饥渴威胁着我们好不容易建立的少数避难所。英雄，我们必须确保这些庇护所的安全。深入瘟疫之地的心脏，平息这些受诅咒生物的饥渴。",dEN="The Plaguelands, once a lush region, is now a land of nightmares and sorrow. Among the countless abominations that roam these cursed grounds are the Stitched Horrors, creations of dark necromancy, the ravenous Cannibal Ghouls, and the Cursed Mages, damned souls that wield twisted magics. Their unending hunger for the living threatens the few sanctuaries we have managed to establish. Hero, we must ensure the safety of these havens. Venture into the heart of the Plaguelands and quell the hunger of these damned creatures.",o="在东瘟疫之地搜寻并杀死6只缝合恐魔、6只食人食尸鬼和4名受诅咒的法师。",oEN="Seek out and slay 6 Stitched Horrors, 6 Cannibal Ghouls, and 4 Cursed Mages in the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18047]={d="天灾军团的蹂躏之后，这片土地的许多珍宝与器物都已失落，如今落入了游荡在瘟疫之地的邪恶生物手中。精灵小饰物是昔日辉煌文明的残迹，地穴布帛上带有铭文，或许是理解亡灵的关键，而瘟疫血浆则含有我们的学者渴望研究的强大能量。英雄，在与这片土地的畸变体作战时，留心这些物品。取回它们对于理解并对抗潜伏于此的黑暗力量可能至关重要。",dEN="In the wake of the Scourge's devastation, many of the land's treasures and artifacts were lost, now lying in the grasp of the vile creatures that roam the Plaguelands. The Elvish Trinkets are remnants of a once-great civilization, Crypt Cloths bear inscriptions that could be key to understanding the undead, and the Plagued Plasma holds potent energies that our scholars are keen to study. Hero, as you confront the abominations of this land, keep an eye out for these items. Their retrieval could be essential in understanding and combating the dark powers that linger here.",o="从东瘟疫之地的亡灵身上收集精灵小饰物、地穴布帛和瘟疫血浆。",oEN="Gather Elvish Trinkets, Crypt Cloths, and Plagued Plasmas from the undead of the Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18048]={d="堕落者的骸骨残躯如今游荡在西瘟疫之地，被诅咒永远在天灾军团邪恶的掌控下为奴。这些畸变体——骷髅剥皮者、垂涎食尸鬼和骷髅巫师——不断提醒着这片土地曾遭受的悲剧，以及那些被剥夺永恒安息的灵魂。我们必须再次赐予他们安息。英雄，需要你的本领。穿越这片饱受瘟疫摧残的土地，让这些不安的灵魂安息，确保他们不会再站起来折磨生者。",dEN="The skeletal remains of the fallen now roam the Western Plaguelands, cursed to an eternity of servitude under the malevolent grip of the Scourge. These abominations – the Skeletal Flayers, Slavering Ghouls, and Skeletal Sorcerers – serve as a constant reminder of the tragedy that befell this land and the souls who were robbed of their eternal rest. We must put them to rest once more. Hero, your prowess is needed. Traverse the plagued land and lay these restless spirits to rest, ensuring they do not rise to torment the living.",o="深入西瘟疫之地，杀死6名骷髅剥皮者、6只垂涎食尸鬼和4名骷髅巫师。",oEN="Venture into the Western Plaguelands and slay 6 Skeletal Flayers, 6 Slavering Ghouls, and 4 Skeletal Sorcerers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18050]={d="安多哈尔废墟是一处受诅咒之地，土壤本身都被天灾军团的存在所污染。在昔日伟大城市的残破遗迹之间，不安的亡灵继续散播混乱，使任何复兴或重建的希望都无法实现。无魂食尸鬼、骷髅刽子手和骷髅侍僧是持续破坏的罪魁祸首。英雄，我们需要你迎战这些邪恶的存在，终结他们的恐怖统治。只有这样，我们才有望夺回安多哈尔，为他们饱受折磨的灵魂带来安宁。",dEN="The Ruins of Andorhal are a cursed place, the very ground tainted by the Scourge's presence. Among the shattered remnants of this once great city, restless undead continue to wreak havoc, preventing any hope of restoration or recovery. Soulless Ghouls, Skeletal Executioners, and Skeletal Acolytes are the primary culprits behind the ongoing devastation. Hero, we need you to face these malevolent beings and put an end to their reign of terror. Only then can we hope to reclaim Andorhal and bring peace to its tormented spirits.",o="深入安多哈尔废墟，杀死8只无魂食尸鬼、8名骷髅刽子手和6名骷髅侍僧。",oEN="Venture into the Ruins of Andorhal and slay 8 Soulless Ghouls, 8 Skeletal Executioners, and 6 Skeletal Acolytes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18051]={d="安多哈尔废墟不仅是天灾军团力量的证明，也是无数曾以此地为家的灵魂的墓地。这些散落在废墟间的骨骸碎片是逝者的遗存，是因天灾军团之怒而失去的生命的象征。收集这些碎片不仅能帮助我们理解毁灭的规模，也是一种敬意与纪念的姿态。英雄，我们恳求你取回这些碎片，好让我们祭奠逝者，并借此清除安多哈尔令人不安的过往。",dEN="The Ruins of Andorhal are not just a testament to the Scourge's might, but also a burial ground for countless souls who once called this place home. These Bone Fragments, scattered amidst the ruins, are remnants of the fallen, tokens of lives lost to the Scourge's wrath. Collecting these fragments will not only help us in understanding the magnitude of the destruction, but also serve as a gesture of respect and remembrance. Hero, we beseech you to recover these fragments so that we may honor the fallen and, in doing so, cleanse Andorhal of its haunting past.",o="从安多哈尔废墟的亡灵身上取回骨骸碎片。",oEN="Recover Bone Fragments from the undead in the Ruins of Andorhal.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18052]={d="英雄，死灵法师冰冷者阿科尔扎尔已在安多哈尔废墟现身，唤醒成群的亡灵。他的冰封魔法只带来死亡与痛苦，壮大了天灾军团。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，猎杀这个怪物，终结他的恐怖统治。",dEN="Hero, the necromancer Akorzal the Cold has emerged in the Ruins of Andorhal, raising legions of undead. His freezing magics bring only death and sorrow, empowering the Scourge. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this monster and end his reign of terror.",o="杀死冰冷者阿科尔扎尔",oEN="Slay Akorzal the Cold",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18053]={d="西瘟疫之地不安的灵魂漫无目的地游荡，陷于痛苦与折磨之中。他们被束缚在骸骨形态里，无法获得彼岸的安宁。随着黑暗持续浸透这片土地，阵亡士兵受困的灵魂变得愈发不安。英雄，赐予他们苦苦寻求的解脱是我们的责任。使用这张以太之网，收集迷失者的灵魂并带给我。如此一来，你不仅能将他们从无尽的痛苦中解放，也能沉重打击那些企图让这片土地永远陷于黑暗的势力。",dEN="The restless spirits of the Western Plaguelands wander aimlessly, trapped in a state of anguish and torment. Bound to their skeletal forms, they are denied the peace of the afterlife. As the darkness continues to pervade these lands, the trapped souls of the fallen soldiers grow more restless. It is our duty, Hero, to grant them the respite they so desperately seek. Using this ethereal net, gather the souls of the lost and bring them to me. By doing so, you not only free them from their ceaseless suffering but also strike a blow against the forces that seek to keep this land in eternal darkness.",o="在西瘟疫之地收集骷髅灵魂。",oEN="Gather Skeleton Souls in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18054]={d="西瘟疫之地已成为那些在大战中丧生者不安灵魂的温床。令人不安的幻影、哀嚎亡魂和饥渴幽灵在大地上游荡；它们的哀鸣见证着生时遭受的痛苦与死后承受的折磨。英雄，这些灵魂理应得到安宁，但只要他们仍被瘟疫之地的黑暗魔法束缚，就会继续散播苦难与绝望。深入其中，了结这些受折磨的灵魂，赐予他们长久以来被剥夺的解脱。",dEN="The Western Plaguelands have become a breeding ground for the restless spirits of those who perished during the great wars. Haunting Visions, Wailing Deaths, and Hungering Wraiths wander the land, their mournful cries a testament to the anguish they suffered in life and the torment they now endure in death. Hero, these spirits deserve peace, but as long as they are bound by the dark magic of the Plaguelands, they'll continue to sow misery and despair. Venture forth and put an end to these tormented souls, granting them the release they've been denied for so long.",o="在西瘟疫之地杀死6只哀嚎亡魂、6只饥渴幽灵和6个萦绕幻影。",oEN="Slay 6 Wailing Deaths, 6 Hungering Wraiths, and 6 Haunting Visions in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18055]={d="西瘟疫之地的土地被巫妖王的恶意腐化，已成为噩梦般亡灵的居所，他们仍在四处潜伏。腐烂的尸体、感染的僵尸和骷髅恐魔是曾居住在这片土地上的士兵与市民的亡灵残骸。这些可怜的灵魂如今化作畸变体，在无尽的折磨中游荡，对任何路过的生者构成迫在眉睫的威胁。英雄，你的职责很明确。深入这片受诅咒土地的心脏，击败这些生物。这是恢复些许和平、确保敢于踏足此地之人安全的唯一办法。",dEN="The lands of the Western Plaguelands, tainted by the Lich King's malevolence, have become home to the nightmarish undead that continue to haunt its every corner. The Rotting Cadavers, Blighted Zombies, and Skeletal Terrors are the undead remnants of soldiers and citizens who once lived in these lands. These poor souls, now turned abominations, wander in constant torment and pose an imminent threat to any living being that crosses their path. Hero, your duty is clear. Venture into the heart of this damned land and vanquish these creatures. It is the only way to restore some semblance of peace and ensure the safety of those who dare tread here.",o="在西瘟疫之地杀死6具腐烂的尸体、6只枯萎的僵尸和6只骷髅恐魔。",oEN="Slay 6 Rotting Cadavers, 6 Blighted Zombies, and 6 Skeletal Terrors in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18056]={d="哀嚎洞穴曾是静谧沉思与自然之美的所在，如今却弥漫着绝望与衰败的气息。这场变化源于入侵此地的软泥与史莱姆，它们是仍盘踞在西瘟疫之地的天灾瘟疫的产物。其中，吞食软泥怪、腐烂巨兽与邪恶史莱姆最为强大，它们沿途留下腐化的痕迹，危及我们力求恢复的脆弱平衡。英雄，你的任务就是进入洞穴，清除这些可憎的存在。净化洞穴，让自然的治愈之手再次开始它的工作。",dEN="The Weeping Cave, once a place of quiet reflection and natural beauty, now emanates an aura of despair and decay. This transformation is the work of the oozes and slimes that have overrun it, products of the plague that still lingers in the Western Plaguelands. Among them, the Devouring Ooze, Rotting Behemoth, and Vile Slime are the most potent, leaving trails of corruption in their wake and jeopardizing the fragile balance that we seek to restore. Hero, you are tasked with entering the cave and ridding it of these loathsome entities. Purge the cave and allow nature's healing touch to begin its work once more.",o="杀死西瘟疫之地哀嚎洞穴中的 6 只吞食软泥怪、6 只腐烂巨兽和 6 只邪恶史莱姆。",oEN="Slay 6 Devouring Oozes, 6 Rotting Behemoths, and 6 Vile Slimes in The Weeping Cave of the Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18057]={d="英雄，邪恶的死灵法师黑暗的凯斯瑞文现身于被诅咒的村庄加隆的凋零。他不洁的魔法召唤出成群的暗影，蹂躏大地，攻击一切活物。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，猎杀这个恶徒，在他的邪恶蔓延之前将其终结。前往加隆的凋零，抵抗他的黑暗力量，杀死他，让他的黑暗统治就此终结。",dEN="Hero, the vile necromancer Kethrevon the Dark has surfaced at the cursed village called Gahrron's Withering. His foul magics raise legions of shadows, plaguing the land and attacking all living things. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this villain and end his evil before it spreads. Venture to Gahrron's Withering, withstand his dark powers, and slay him so his reign of darkness ceases.",o="杀死黑暗的凯斯瑞文",oEN="Slay Kethrevon the Dark",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18058]={d="血色十字军始终是那些在西瘟疫之地寻求和平之人心头的一根刺。尤其是他们的伐木工与骑士，已经建立起压倒性的存在，无情地砍伐神圣的森林，并把错误的信仰强加给任何遇到的人。有报告称，这些人随身携带着特殊的血色徽记，那是他们身份与对事业忠诚的象征。英雄，你的任务有两重：削减这些顽固敌人的数量，并取回这些徽记，作为他们力量日渐衰弱的证明。只有遏制了他们的影响力，我们才有希望在这片饱受折磨的土地上看到一丝和平的影子。",dEN="The Scarlet Crusade continues to be a thorn in the side of all who seek peace in the Western Plaguelands. Particularly, their Lumberjacks and Knights have established a dominating presence, relentlessly cutting down the sacred woods and enforcing their misguided beliefs upon any they encounter. Reports have come in that these individuals carry with them special Scarlet Tokens, symbols of their rank and commitment to their cause. Hero, your mission is twofold: to thin the numbers of these persistent foes and to retrieve these tokens as proof of their diminishing strength. Only with their influence curtailed can we hope for a semblance of peace in this tortured land.",o="杀死西瘟疫之地的 6 名血色伐木工和 6 名血色骑士。",oEN="Slay 6 Scarlet Lumberjacks and 6 Scarlet Knights in the Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18059]={d="英雄，瘟疫之地昔日的神圣土地如今充斥着血色十字军的邪恶成员。这些狂热分子盲目追随着根除异己的信条，对任何被他们视为受污染者毫不留情。尤其是他们的巫师，从黑暗源头汲取力量，扬言要以奥术之威壮大自身。在我们削弱他们人数的同时，这一带还有一座被他们据为瞭望点的战略高塔。我们必须确保将它从他们的控制中夺回。将我们的旗帜插上塔顶，宣告他们在此地的统治即将终结。",dEN="Hero, the once sacred lands of the Plaguelands are now teeming with the malevolent members of the Scarlet Crusade. These zealots blindly follow a cause of eradication, showing no mercy to any they deem tainted. Their sorcerers, in particular, draw power from dark sources and threaten to bolster their forces with their arcane might. While we weaken their numbers, there's a strategic tower in the area that they've claimed as a lookout point. We need to ensure it is wrested from their control. Place our flag atop this tower as a declaration that their reign here is coming to an end.",o="击败血色复仇者、血色法师和血色缚法者。",oEN="Defeat Scarlet Avengers, Scarlet Mages and Scarlet Spellbinders.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18060]={d="壁炉谷曾是希望与繁荣的灯塔，如今却成为血色十字军错误狂热的堡垒。这座昔日的贵族之城已被他们对新世界的狂热与残暴构想所玷污。工人们每日加固防御，圣骑士在街道上巡逻，确保无人反抗他们的统治。哨兵们站岗放哨，注视着、等待着任何反抗的迹象。英雄，是时候削弱他们对壁炉谷的掌控，并发出明确的讯息了：他们的暴政不会长久。",dEN="Hearthglen, once a beacon of hope and prosperity, now stands as a stronghold for the Scarlet Crusade's misguided zealotry. This former city of nobility has been tainted with their fervent and brutal vision for a new world. The workers fortify their defenses daily, while paladins patrol its streets, ensuring none oppose their reign. The sentinels stand guard, watching and waiting for any sign of resistance. Hero, it is time to weaken their grip on Hearthglen and send a clear message: their tyranny will not stand.",o="消灭壁炉谷中的血色工人、血色圣骑士和血色哨兵。",oEN="Eliminate Scarlet Workers, Scarlet Paladins, and Scarlet Sentinels in Hearthglen.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18061]={d="壁炉谷曾是瘟疫之地希望的灯塔，如今却被狂热的血色十字军腐化。这些误入歧途的灵魂在扭曲的使命中夺走了无数生命。我们必须扭转局势，向他们发出讯息：他们恐怖的统治就此终结。英雄，当你与他们交战时，收集血色狂热者的头颅。让它成为他们命运的见证，也成为任何胆敢效仿他们之人的警告。",dEN="Hearthglen, once a beacon of hope in these Plaguelands, is now corrupted by the zealous Scarlet Crusade. These misguided souls, in their twisted mission, have claimed many lives. The tide must be turned against them, and a message sent that their reign of terror ends now. As you engage them, Hero, collect the skulls of the Scarlet zealots. Let it be a testament to their fate and a warning for any who dare follow in their path.",o="在壁炉谷从阵亡的血色十字军成员身上收集血色头颅。",oEN="Collect Scarlet Skulls from the fallen members of the Scarlet Crusade in Hearthglen.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18062]={d="英雄，狂热的圣骑士狂热者安塞姆在壁炉谷指挥着血色十字军的杀戮行动。他自诩正义的怒火只留下死亡与毁灭，他下令消灭所有异教徒。我恳求你，勇士，潜入壁炉谷，终结安塞姆残忍的狂热。",dEN="Hero, the fanatical paladin Zealot Anselm leads the Scarlet Crusade's murderous efforts from Hearthglen. His righteous fury leaves only death and destruction, as he orders the elimination of all non-believers. I beseech you, champion, to infiltrate Hearthglen and end Anselm's cruel zealotry.",o="杀死狂热者安塞姆",oEN="Slay Zealot Anselm",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18063]={d="拉卡利油沼一直是安戈洛环形山中神秘的一角。近来，这些油沼比往常更加活跃，涌出奇怪的焦油生物，侵入周边地区。这些由油沼本体精华形成的生物，正威胁着附近脆弱的生态系统。作为这片古老土地上的英雄，你的职责十分明确：你必须前往拉卡利油沼，压制这股新兴的威胁。终结这些焦油怪物，确保安戈洛居民的安全。",dEN="The Lakkari Tar Pits have always been a mysterious part of Un'Goro Crater. Recently, the pits have become more active than usual, churning out bizarre tar creatures that are encroaching upon the surrounding territories. These creatures, formed from the very essence of the pits themselves, threaten the fragile ecosystems nearby. As a hero in this ancient land, your duty is clear: you must venture to the Lakkari Tar Pits and suppress the emerging threat. Put a stop to these tar monstrosities and ensure the safety of Un'Goro's inhabitants.",o="消灭从拉卡利油沼中涌出的焦油潜伏者、焦油领主、焦油爬行者和焦油野兽。",oEN="Eliminate the Tar Lurkers, Tar Lords, Tar Creepers, and Tar Beasts emerging from the Lakkari Tar Pits.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18064]={d="安戈洛环形山是一片充满蓬勃生机、独特能量与无数谜团的土地。一些当地居民与探险者都曾谈及这片土地上某些特有材料之间的协同作用。他们相信，拉卡利油沼的焦油、富有攻击性的血瓣花之叶，以及安戈洛猩猩坚韧的皮毛，可以结合起来用于神秘、甚至强大的用途。我们需要一位勇敢的人来收集这些材料，以便进一步研究。站出来吧，英雄，收集这些物品，让我们得以揭开安戈洛的又一个谜团。",dEN="Un'Goro Crater is a land of vibrant life, unique energies, and countless mysteries. Some of the indigenous residents and explorers alike have spoken of the synergy between certain materials native to this land. They believe that the tar from Lakkari Tar Pits, leaves of the aggressive Bloodpetal plant, and the tough hide of Un'Goro gorillas can be combined for mysterious, perhaps even powerful purposes. We need a brave soul to gather these materials for further study. Step forth, Hero, and collect these items so we can unravel another of Un'Goro's enigmas.",o="在安戈洛环形山一带收集焦油、血瓣花之叶和猩猩皮。",oEN="Collect Tar, Bloodpetal Leaves, and Gorilla Hides from around Un'Goro Crater.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18065]={d="真菌岩的猩猩变得日益凶暴，对试图探索安戈洛环形山奥秘的探险者与研究者构成威胁。它们突然的好斗不仅危及我们的行动，也扰乱了这片史前之地的微妙平衡。英雄，前往真菌岩，削减它们的数量。我们必须确保深入环形山之人的安全，并让这处圣地重归平衡。",dEN="The Gorillas at Fungal Rock have grown increasingly aggressive, posing a threat to explorers and researchers seeking to understand the mysteries of Un'Goro Crater. Their sudden belligerence not only jeopardizes our operations but has also disturbed the delicate balance of this prehistoric land. Hero, venture to Fungal Rock and reduce their numbers. We must ensure safety for those venturing into the Crater and restore equilibrium to this sacred place.",o="杀死安戈洛雷霆者、安戈洛猩猩和安戈洛践踏者，削减真菌岩的猩猩数量。",oEN="Thin out the Gorilla population at Fungal Rock by slaying Un’Goro Thunderers, Un’Goro Gorillas, and Un’Goro Stompers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18066]={d="安戈洛环形山的植物群一向既奇妙又危险。近来，血瓣花植物生物变得更具攻击性，侵占小径，恐吓旅人。这些曾经被动的生物如今见人就攻击，使任何穿越安戈洛的旅程都变得凶险万分。我们不能让它们横行环形山。英雄，削减它们的数量就落在你肩上了。",dEN="The flora of Un'Goro Crater has always been as wondrous as it is perilous. Recently, the Bloodpetal plant creatures have become more aggressive, encroaching upon the pathways and terrorizing travelers. These once passive creatures are now attacking on sight, making any journey through Un'Goro treacherous. We can't let them overrun the Crater. Hero, it falls to you to venture into the heart of their territory and thin their numbers.",o="消灭血瓣花鞭笞者、血瓣花抽击者和血瓣花捕猎者，削减安戈洛环形山中富有攻击性的血瓣花数量。",oEN="Cull the aggressive Bloodpetal population in Un'Goro Crater by eliminating Bloodpetal Threshers, Bloodpetal Lashers, and Bloodpetal Trappers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18067]={d="安戈洛的大多数能量水晶都无害，只是为附近的能量塔提供能源。然而其中一颗似乎吸收了远超应有的能量，它的力量不断向四周爆发，将任何靠近者化为灰烬。这颗水晶的力量似乎还在增长，我们担心若不加以控制，它可能摧毁附近区域。我们需要一位有足够力量承受其威力的人，在它达到那一步之前将其摧毁。",dEN="Most of the power crystals in Un'Goro are harmless, providing only a power source for the nearby pylons. One of them, however, seems to have absorbed far more energy than it should, and its power has been lashing out around it, disintegrating anyone who comes near. This crystal seems to be growing in power, and we fear it could destroy the nearby area if left unchecked. We need someone with the strength to endure its power to destroy it before it reaches that point.",o="摧毁不稳定的能量水晶",oEN="Destroy the Unstable Power Crystal",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18068]={d="在安戈洛环形山植被茂密的丛林深处，刺喉龙以其凶猛的存在感称霸一方。拥有致命毒液的毒皮刺喉龙与狡诈的刺喉龙猎人，对试图揭开这片土地之谜的冒险者与研究者构成巨大威胁。随着袭击报告不断增加，显然它们一天比一天更加大胆。英雄，我们必须在它们的数量增长过多、冲出惯常领地之前采取行动。",dEN="Deep within the overgrown jungles of Un'Goro Crater, the Ravasaurs dominate with their fierce presence. The Venomhide Ravasaurs, with their deadly poison, and the cunning Ravasaur Hunters, pose an enormous threat to the adventurers and researchers trying to uncover the mysteries of the land. With reports of attacks increasing, it's clear that they're growing bolder with each passing day. Hero, we must act before their numbers grow too strong, and they push out of their usual territory.",o="击败毒皮刺喉龙和刺喉龙猎人，铲除安戈洛环形山的刺喉龙威胁。",oEN="Cull the Ravasaur threat in Un'Goro Crater by taking down Venomhide Ravasaurs and Ravasaur Hunters.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18069]={d="安戈洛环形山虽以茂密的植被和奇异的生物闻名，却也充斥着游荡于这片土地的火元素所带来的酷热。近来，灼热元素与活体烈焰一直在肆虐，点燃大地，危及居民。这不能再继续下去了。英雄，我们需要你的本领。深入那片炽热的领地，平息这些火焰之敌。让我们确保安戈洛仍是自然的乐园，而非燃烧的炼狱。",dEN="Un'Goro Crater, while renowned for its lush greenery and exotic creatures, also possesses the intense heat of fire elementals that roam the land. As of late, the Scorching Elementals and Living Blazes have been wreaking havoc, setting the land aflame and endangering its inhabitants. This cannot continue. Hero, we need your expertise. Venture into the fiery territories and quell these fiery foes. Let's ensure Un'Goro remains a paradise of nature, not a burning inferno.",o="击败灼热元素和活体烈焰，抗击安戈洛的火元素威胁。",oEN="Combat the fire elemental threat in Un'Goro by defeating Scorching Elementals and Living Blazes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18070]={d="在安戈洛环形山的中心，自然的平衡一直得以维持。然而近来，某些掠食者的数量不断增长，正在打破这份微妙的均衡。双帆龙、刺喉龙，以及它们迅捷的近亲刺喉龙奔跑者，如今对其他生物、甚至对你这样的旅人都构成了相当大的威胁。作为平衡的捍卫者，英雄，我们需要你的本领。削减它们的数量，让和平得以重归安戈洛。",dEN="In the heart of Un'Goro Crater, a balance of nature has always been maintained. However, recently, certain predators have been growing in numbers and disrupting this delicate equilibrium. The Diemetradons, Ravasaurs, and their swift counterparts, the Ravasaur Runners, are now posing a considerable threat to other creatures and even travellers like you. As a defender of the balance, Hero, we need your skills. Thin their numbers so that peace can be restored to Un'Goro.",o="削减安戈洛优势掠食者的数量：双帆龙、刺喉龙和刺喉龙奔跑者。",oEN="Reduce the population of the dominant predators in Un'Goro: Diemetradons, Ravasaurs, and Ravasaur Runners.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18071]={d="有了这些关键成分，我们离理解安戈洛生命错综复杂的平衡又近了一步。你的努力确保了仪式得以进行，为此我们深怀感激。通过理解并尊崇这些生物的力量，我们希望能保护并保存安戈洛环形山这份奇迹。英雄，你的名字将在古老的颂歌中被传唱。",dEN="With these essential components, we are one step closer to understanding the intricate balance of life in Un'Goro. Your efforts have ensured that the ritual can proceed, and for that, we are deeply grateful. By understanding and honoring the strengths of these creatures, we aim to protect and preserve the wonder that is the Un'Goro Crater. Your name will be sung in the ancient chants, Hero.",o="为仪式收集刺喉龙爪、元素身上的火焰之核以及刺喉龙之心。",oEN="Collect Ravasaur Claws, Fire Cores from the elementals, and Ravasaur Hearts for the ritual.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18072]={d="英雄， 巨型火元素因塞拉塔斯盘踞在火羽山，喷吐的烈焰在大地上留下疮疤。它灼热的魔法将一切生命焚为灰烬，较弱的元素则在它的号令下蜂拥而至。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，猎杀这个地狱暴君。前往山脊，抵挡因塞拉塔斯的炽烈怒火，在它的烈焰冲击吞没安戈洛之前将它杀死。",dEN="Hero, the monstrous fire elemental Inceratas haunts Fire Plume Ridge, spewing flames that scar the land. Its searing magics incinerate all life, while lesser elementals swarm at its command. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this infernal tyrant. Journey to the ridge, withstand Inceratas' fiery rage, and slay it before its blazing onslaught consumes Un'Goro.",o="杀死因塞拉塔斯",oEN="Slay Inceratas",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18073]={d="在安戈洛环形山的深处，格里什昆虫建起了一座庞大而蔓延的巢穴，每一种种姓的昆虫都在其社会中扮演着独特的角色。然而近来，它们的攻击性行为有所增强，危及附近的栖息地与旅人。英雄，我们需要你深入格里什虫巢，削减它们的数量。通过打击劫掠者、工蜂和黄蜂，我们希望能暂时阻止它们侵略性的扩张。",dEN="Deep within the bowels of Un'Goro Crater, the Gorishi insects have formed a vast, sprawling hive, with each caste of insect playing its unique role in their society. However, recently, their aggressive behavior has increased, endangering nearby habitats and travelers alike. Hero, we need you to venture into the Gorishi hive and cull their numbers. By targeting the Reavers, Workers, and Wasps, we hope to bring a temporary halt to their aggressive expansion.",o="杀死格里什劫掠者、工蜂和黄蜂，遏制安戈洛的昆虫威胁。",oEN="Slay Gorishi Reavers, Workers, and Wasps to curb the insect threat in Un'Goro.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18074]={d="英雄，安戈洛环形山和谐的平衡再次受到威胁。天空中，狂乱的翼手龙正制造浩劫，袭击较小的生物，在许多人心头播下恐惧。地面上，远古双帆龙——史前时代的遗存——正对小生物宣示统治，挑战自然秩序。我们请求你介入，通过对付这些强大的敌人来恢复平衡。",dEN="The harmonious balance of Un'Goro Crater is under threat once again, Hero. Soaring above, the Frenzied Pterrordaxes are creating havoc, targeting smaller creatures and striking fear into the hearts of many. On the ground, the Elder Diemetradons, remnants of a prehistoric age, are asserting their dominance over smaller creatures and challenging the natural order. We ask you to step in and restore balance by dealing with these formidable foes.",o="制服天空中的狂乱翼手龙，迎战地面上的远古双帆龙。",oEN="Subdue the Frenzied Pterrordaxes in the skies and confront the Elder Diemetradons on the ground.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18075]={d="安戈洛环形山著名的温泉确实是艾泽拉斯的一大自然奇观。灼热的泉水中蕴藏着来自大地深处的强大元素能量。这些力量通常处于休眠状态，近来却躁动起来，使泉水翻腾沸腾。\n\n冒险者，我有一项重要任务交给你。前往温泉，记录它们当前元素活动的读数。这种自然平衡的扰动令我担忧。必须在元素力量的涌升引发剧变之前让温泉平复下来。\n\n用这个热异常侦测器监测温泉周围的温度、气体成分与奥术波动。",dEN="Un'Goro Crater's renowned hot springs are truly a natural wonder of Azeroth. The heated waters harbor potent elemental energies from deep within the earth. Usually dormant, lately these forces have stirred, causing the springs to seethe and roil.\n\nAdventurer, I have an important task for you. Journey to the springs and take readings of their current elemental activity. This disturbance in the natural balance concerns me. The springs must be calmed before the upwelling of elemental power triggers something drastic.\n\nUse this Thermal Anomaly Detector to monitor the temperature, gas composition, and arcane fluctuations around at the spring.",o="从安戈洛的温泉中采集一份读数。",oEN="Collect a reading from Un'Goro's hot springs.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18076]={d="在安戈洛环形山的中心，动植物都跳动着原始而纯粹的能量。要真正理解此地本质，就必须收集其生命的具象象征。从格里什昆虫坚硬的甲壳，到翼手龙结实的骨骼，再到活体剑龙的厚皮，收集这些将让你洞察驱动安戈洛的生命之力。英雄，你能否为我带来这些信物？",dEN="In the heart of Un'Goro Crater, the flora and fauna vibrate with raw, primordial energy. To truly understand the essence of this place, one must gather tangible symbols of its life. From the tough husk of the Gorishi insects to the sturdy bones of the Pterrodax, and the thick hide of the living Stegadons, collecting these will give insight into the life force that drives Un'Goro. Can you bring me these tokens, Hero?",o="从安戈洛环形山的生物身上收集格里什甲壳、恐龙骨骼和剑龙皮。",oEN="Collect Gorishi Husks, Dinosaur Bones, and Stegadon Hides from the creatures of Un'Goro Crater.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18077]={d="英雄，被称为瓦沙克王的巨型魔暴龙仅凭蛮力就统治着安戈洛环形山。这头可怕的野兽击倒所有挡路者，而较弱的魔暴龙则服从它野蛮的命令。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，猎杀这个祸害。",dEN="Hero, the colossal devilsaur known as King Vashak dominates Un'Goro Crater through brute strength alone. This terrifying beast batters all who cross its path, while lesser devilsaurs obey its savage commands. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this menace.",o="杀死瓦沙克王",oEN="Slay King Vashak",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18078]={d="恐惧谷岩是燃烧平原中一座高耸的堡垒，长期以来一直是火腹食人魔的避难所。这群暴徒由强大的火腹食人魔、更强壮的火腹蛮兵以及阴暗的食人魔法师组成，他们已在这块巨岩上确立了统治，并对附近的定居点与毫无戒心的旅人构成日益严重的威胁。他们对黑暗魔法日益增长的亲和与不断增强的力量不容忽视。英雄，我们必须正面应对这一局面。深入恐惧谷岩，削减他们的数量。我们必须迅速行动，确保他们无法进一步巩固据点。",dEN="Dreadmaul Rock, a towering bastion within the Burning Steppes, has long been the refuge of the Firegut Ogres. This horde of brutes, consisting of the powerful Firegut Ogres, their even stronger Brute brethren, and the shadowy Ogre Mages, have asserted dominion over the rock and pose a growing threat to nearby settlements and unsuspecting travelers. Their increasing affinity for dark magics and mounting strength cannot be overlooked. Hero, it's imperative we tackle this situation head-on. Delve deep into Dreadmaul Rock and thin their numbers. We must act swiftly, ensuring they do not cement their stronghold further.",o="进入燃烧平原的恐惧谷岩，杀死火腹食人魔、火腹蛮兵和火腹食人魔法师。",oEN="Enter Dreadmaul Rock in the Burning Steppes and slay Firegut Ogres, Firegut Brutes, and Firegut Ogre Mages.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18079]={d="英雄，出现了令人不安的动向。黑龙军团加强了他们在燃烧平原的存在。报告显示，黑龙人、幼龙与龙裔正大批涌现在该地区，而他们的意图从不纯洁。历史上，这些龙类聚集之处，黑龙军团必在谋划险恶之事。我们必须在他们的计划得逞之前斩断蛇头。袭击这些龙类，削减他们的数量；我们绝不能容许黑龙军团在这些地方站稳脚跟。",dEN="Hero, a disturbing development is afoot. The Black Dragonflight has fortified its presence within the Burning Steppes. Reports suggest Black Wyrmkin, Broodlings, and Dragonspawn swarming the region in large numbers, and their intentions are never pure. Historically, where these dragonkin convene, the Black Dragonflight is scheming something dire. We must cut the head from the snake before their plans reach fruition. Engage these dragonkin and cull their numbers; we cannot afford the Black Dragonflight gaining a foothold in these parts.",o="杀死燃烧平原的黑龙人、黑色幼龙和黑龙裔。",oEN="Slay Black Wyrmkin, Black Broodlings, and Black Dragonspawn in the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18080]={d="索瑞森废墟不仅是昔日伟大矮人帝国的残迹，也是效忠邪恶索瑞森血统的黑铁矮人活动猖獗的蜂巢。这些矮人连同他们庞大的构造体，对我们在燃烧平原的行动构成严重威胁。战争掠夺者尤其令人担忧，他们的力量在我方步兵中无人能敌。为确保我们的据点稳固，我们需要你击倒他们，并在索瑞森的队列中散播混乱。",dEN="The ruins of Thaurissan are not just remnants of the once-great dwarven empire; they are also a hive of activity for Dark Iron Dwarves loyal to the nefarious Thaurissan lineage. These dwarves, along with their monstrous constructs, pose a grave threat to our operations in the Burning Steppes. The War Reavers are particularly concerning, as their strength is unmatched by any of our foot soldiers. To ensure our foothold remains strong, we need you to strike them down and sow chaos among the Thaurissan ranks.",o="攻击并消灭索瑞森废墟一带的战争掠夺者、索瑞森间谍和索瑞森踏火者。",oEN="Engage and eliminate the War Reavers, Thaurissan Spies, and Thaurissan Firewalkers around the ruins of Thaurissan.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18081]={d="燃烧平原是一片遍布昔日战斗遗物的土地。虽然大多数人只把它们当作纪念品，我们的研究者却相信这些器物讲述着这片土地的故事，讲述着食人魔、龙类与黑铁矮人之间的冲突。取回这些物品，让我们得以拼凑出这片凶险之地更清晰的历史。",dEN="The Burning Steppes are a land rich with remnants from past battles. While most consider them mere souvenirs, our researchers believe these artifacts tell the stories of the land, of the clashes between ogres, dragonkin, and the Dark Iron dwarves. Retrieve these items so we can piece together a clearer history of this treacherous land.",o="收集食人魔头颅、龙类鳞片和矮人怀表。",oEN="Collect Ogre Skulls, Dragonkin Scales, and Dwarven Pocket Watches.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18082]={d="英雄，食人魔酋长维尔卡什以铁腕统治着恐惧谷岩的火腹食人魔。他的残暴无人能及，残酷地碾碎一切挑战他统治的人。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，潜入恐惧谷岩，终结维尔卡什的暴政。找到他，抵挡他，杀死这个酋长，让他的残暴不再蔓延。",dEN="Hero, the ogre chieftain Vel'kash rules over the Firegut ogres of Dreadmaul Rock with an iron fist. His savagery is unmatched, as he brutally crushes all challengers to his reign. I beseech you, brave champion, to infiltrate Dreadmaul Rock and end Vel'kash's tyranny. Seek him out, withstand and slay the chieftain so his brutality spreads no further.",o="杀死维尔卡什",oEN="Slay Vel’kash",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18083]={d="在燃烧平原烟雾缭绕的中心，黑石氏族投下恐惧与统治的阴影。巫师编织着邪恶魔法，杀戮者巡逻着要道，战争大师调度着他们的军力，氏族的掌控日益收紧。这片土地呼唤着一位英雄来打破这铁一般的桎梏。你的战斗与谋略本领，对于击退这些势力、维持地区平衡、确保平原不彻底陷入黑暗至关重要。",dEN="In the smoldering heart of the Burning Steppes, the Blackrock clan exerts a shadow of fear and domination. With sorcerers weaving nefarious magics, slayers patrolling vital paths, and battlemasters orchestrating their forces, the clan's grip tightens by the day. The land cries out for a hero to disrupt this iron hold. Your prowess in combat and strategy is crucial to push back these forces, maintain the region's balance, and ensure the Steppes do not fall completely into darkness.",o="击败燃烧平原的黑石巫师、黑石杀戮者和黑石战争大师。",oEN="Defeat Blackrock Sorcerers, Blackrock Slayers, and Blackrock Battlemasters in the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18084]={d="英雄，燃烧平原早已焦枯荒芜，但焰鳞龙族却想再添一层毁灭。这些邪恶的龙类崇拜无情的太阳，从灼人的日光中汲取力量。焰鳞龙裔与龙人扬言要让这片土地上肆虐的炼狱更加猛烈。压制他们的图谋、维持平衡至关重要。你可愿迎接挑战，终结他们以太阳为燃料的狂乱？",dEN="Hero, the Burning Steppes is already scorched and barren, but the Flamescale brood seeks to add a new level of devastation. These malevolent dragonkin worship the relentless sun, drawing power from its blistering rays. The Flamescale Dragonspawn and Wyrmkin threaten to intensify the inferno that already blights this land. It's crucial to suppress their efforts and keep the balance. Will you rise to the challenge and put an end to their solar-fueled frenzy?",o="击败燃烧平原的焰鳞龙裔和焰鳞龙人。",oEN="Defeat Flamescale Dragonspawn and Flamescale Wyrmkin in the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18085]={d="英雄，黑石要塞是凶悍黑石氏族的纪念碑，这个群体长期以来以无情的战术和权力的野心蹂躏着燃烧平原的土地。挑战他们统治、在他们的要塞正中插上反抗标志的时刻已经到来。\n\n你的任务是潜入黑石要塞，插下我们的旗帜，并击退任何企图将其摧毁的人。这是大胆之举，必将被铭记为我们不容轻侮的标志。坚守阵地，确保我们的旗帜在他们堡垒上空高高飘扬！",dEN="Hero, the Blackrock Stronghold stands as a monument to the fierce Blackrock clan, a group that has long plagued the lands of the Burning Steppes with their ruthless tactics and ambition for power. The time has come to challenge their dominance and plant a symbol of defiance right in their stronghold.\n\nYour task is to infiltrate the Blackrock Stronghold, plant our flag, and defend it from any who seek to tear it down. It's a bold move, and one that will surely be remembered as a sign that we are not to be trifled with. Stand strong, and ensure our banner flies high above their fortress!",o="守住插在燃烧平原黑石要塞的旗帜。",oEN="Defend the flag planted at Blackrock Stronghold in the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18086]={d="英雄，燃烧平原是一片冲突频仍的土地。在熔岩丘陵与烟雾窒息的天空之间，黑石氏族在每个角落展示旗帜以炫耀其统治。但他们的狂妄不止于此；他们一直在偷窃龙类的蛋，企图驾驭其力量。此外，这片土地的炽热精华——熔岩精华本身——也被囤积用于邪恶目的。你必须取回这些被盗物品，挫败他们的计划。你拆下的每一面旗帜、找回的每一颗蛋、收集的每一份精华，都会削弱他们对这片土地的掌控。",dEN="The Burning Steppes is a land rife with conflict, Hero. Among its molten hills and smoke-choked skies, the Blackrock clan flaunt their dominance by displaying their banners at every corner. But their arrogance doesn't end there; they've been stealing dragonkin eggs, hoping to harness their power. Furthermore, the fiery essence of this land, the very Lava Essence, is being hoarded for nefarious purposes. You must retrieve these stolen items and thwart their plans. For every banner you tear down, every egg you recover, and every essence you collect, their grip on this land weakens.",o="在燃烧平原一带取回黑石旗帜、龙类的蛋和熔岩精华。",oEN="Retrieve Blackrock Banners, Dragonkin Eggs, and Lava Essence from around the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18087]={d="有人在燃烧平原发现了暮光之锤的使者，正在索瑞森废墟督导黑石部队。这位使者德拉加·影灼是一名强大的暮光之锤巫师。他是个危险的对手，但这可能是我们击败德拉加、削弱暮光之锤的唯一机会。",dEN="A Twilight Hammer emissary has been spotted in the Burning Steppes, overseeing Blackrock forces in the Ruins of Thaurassian. The emissary, Drahga Shadowburner, is a powerful sorcerer of the Twilight Hammer. He is a dangerous opponent, but this may be our only opportunity to defeat Drahga and weaken the Twilight Hammer.",o="杀死德拉加·影灼",oEN="Slay Drahga Shadowburner",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18089]={d="英雄，在艾萨拉蔚蓝的海水深处，强大的阿库罗克的追随者开始聚集。这些被称为阿库拉人的信徒曾一度蛰伏，但近来奥术地脉的扰动重新唤醒了他们对这位古老海巨人的效忠。他们日益壮大的存在与忠诚，对艾萨拉的势力平衡构成重大威胁。需要你的力量与本领，在这些虔诚的追随者完全执行其主人的意志之前迎击并制服他们。",dEN="Hero, deep beneath the azure waters of Azshara, followers of the mighty Arkkoroc have begun to amass. These disciples, known as the Arkoran, were once dormant, but recent disturbances in the arcane leylines have reawakened their fealty to the ancient sea giant. Their growing presence and allegiance pose a significant threat to the balance of power within Azshara. Your strength and expertise are required to confront and quell these devout followers before they can fully execute their master's will.",o="杀死艾萨拉沉没区域的 6 名阿库拉人响钳者、6 名阿库拉人泥居者和 6 名阿库拉人神谕者。",oEN="Slay 6 Arkoran Clackers, 6 Arkoran Muckdwellers, and 6 Arkoran Oracles in the submerged regions of Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18090]={o="杀死艾萨拉森林地带的 6 名雷加什萨特、6 名雷加什地狱呼者和 6 名雷加什恶棍。",oEN="Slay 6 Legashi Satyrs, 6 Legashi Hellcallers, and 6 Legashi Rogues in the forested areas of Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18091]={d="英雄，新的威胁已踏入艾萨拉。有人发现血精灵勘测员与回收者试图从这片土地中抽取奥术能量与古老遗物。他们对艾萨拉珍宝的插手不仅扰乱平衡，还可能唤醒沉睡的危险。我们不能袖手旁观，任由他们掠夺并抽干此地的魔法精华。挺身而出，阻止他们的推进，确保艾萨拉的奥术圣洁完好无损。",dEN="Hero, a new threat has set foot in Azshara. Blood Elf Surveyors and Reclaimers have been spotted trying to extract arcane energy and ancient relics from the land. Their meddling with Azshara's treasures not only disrupts the balance but risks awakening dormant dangers. We cannot stand by as they pillage and drain the magical essence of this place. Venture forth and halt their advances, ensuring the arcane sanctity of Azshara remains intact.",o="杀死艾萨拉的 6 名血精灵勘测员和 6 名血精灵回收者。",oEN="Slay 6 Blood Elf Surveyors and 6 Blood Elf Reclaimers in Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18092]={d="英雄，艾萨拉广袤的土地上藏有蕴含巨大力量与历史意义的遗物与器物。近来，我们得知了三件特别值得关注的物品：来自勘测员之手的血精灵器物、来自阿库拉人栖居深渊的阿库拉遗物，以及被雷加什萨特持有的黑暗典籍雷加什魔典。每一件都承载着艾萨拉历史与潜在力量的一部分。必须确保这些器物得到妥善保管与研究，以免落入错误之手。",dEN="Hero, the vast expanses of Azshara hold relics and artifacts of immense power and historical significance. Recently, we've learned of three particular items of interest: the Blood Elf Artefact from their surveyors, the Arkkoran Relic from the depths where the Arkoran reside, and the Legashi Grimoire, a dark tome held by the Legashi satyrs. Each holds a piece of Azshara's history and potential power. It's imperative that these artifacts be secured and studied to ensure they do not fall into the wrong hands.",o="在艾萨拉血精灵出没的地点收集血精灵器物，在阿库拉人区域取得阿库拉遗物，并在雷加什萨特栖息之地取得雷加什魔典。",oEN="Gather the Blood Elf Artifacts from Blood Elf locations, the Arkkoran Relic from Arkoran regions, and the Legashi Grimoire from areas where the Legashi satyrs dwell in Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18093]={d="传说很久以前，阿库罗克与他的兄弟阿卡莱什一同统治着海洋，但阿卡莱什被深海传来的黑暗低语所诱惑，企图杀死自己的兄弟。由于他的行为，他被放逐到深海之中。\n\n这些传说无从证实，但一个自称阿卡莱什的海巨人出现在阿库罗克神庙附近，试图煽动阿库罗克的信徒背叛他们的神。",dEN="Legends say that long ago, Arkkoran ruled the seas alongside his brother, Arkkalash, but Arkkalash was lured by dark whispers from the depths of the sea, and tried to slay his brother. For his actions he was banished to the depths of the sea.\n\nIt is impossible to confirm these legends, but a sea giant claiming to be Arkkalash has appeared around the Temple of Arkkoran, trying to sway Arkkoran's disciples against their god.",o="杀死阿卡莱什",oEN="Slay Arkkalash",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18094]={d="英雄，令人不安的波涛在艾萨拉海岸荡漾，带来刺脊纳迦动作频频的低语。刺脊战争大师与刺脊女巫一直在集结部队，似乎正准备大举向内陆推进。我们绝不能容许他们在艾萨拉获得更稳固的立足点。潜入深处，迎战这些蛇形敌人，确保海岸不落入他们手中。",dEN="Hero, troubling waves ripple across the shores of Azshara, carrying whispers of the Spitelash Naga's aggressive movements. The Spitelash Battlemasters and Enchantresses have been rallying their forces, seemingly preparing for a significant push inland. We must not allow them to gain a stronger foothold in Azshara. Dive into the depths and confront these serpentine foes, ensuring the shores remain free from their grasp.",o="杀死艾萨拉海岸地区的 6 名刺脊战争大师和 6 名刺脊女巫。",oEN="Slay 6 Spitelash Battlemasters and 6 Spitelash Enchantresses in the coastal regions of Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18095]={d="英雄，奥术充盈的艾萨拉土地正引来不速之客的目光。龙族织法者与蓝龙裔——昔日高贵蓝龙军团的成员——已开始汇聚，并汲取这片土地潜藏的能量。他们的插手可能破坏艾萨拉奥术魔法的脆弱平衡。他们的意图仍然隐秘，但必须迎击他们，确保该地区的奥术圣洁不受侵扰。",dEN="Hero, the arcane-rich lands of Azshara are drawing unwanted attention. The Draconic Mageweavers and Blue Dragonspawn, members of the once-noble Blue Dragonflight, have begun to converge and tap into the land's latent energies. Their meddling threatens to disrupt the fragile balance of arcane magic in Azshara. Their intentions remain veiled, but it's crucial to confront them and ensure the arcane sanctity of the region remains undisturbed.",o="杀死艾萨拉的 6 名龙族织法者和 6 名蓝龙裔。",oEN="Slay 6 Draconic Mageweavers and 6 Blue Dragonspawn in Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18096]={d="英雄，艾萨拉高耸的悬崖回响着那些被称为断崖者、崖行者和崖雷鸣者的强大巨人的脚步。这些庞然大物虽然通常独居，却变得越来越具攻击性，威胁着穿行该地区之人的安全。它们突然表现出的协同行为令人警觉，亟需立即干预。前往悬崖，迎战这些泰坦般的威胁，确保所有人穿越艾萨拉的安全通道。",dEN="Hero, the towering cliffs of Azshara reverberate with the stomping of the formidable giants known as the Cliff Breakers, Cliff Walkers, and Cliff Thunderers. These behemoths, while typically solitary, have become increasingly aggressive, threatening the safety of those traversing the region. Their sudden coordinated behavior is alarming and demands immediate intervention. Venture to the cliffs and confront these titanic threats, ensuring safe passage for all through Azshara.",o="杀死艾萨拉悬崖地区的 4 名断崖者、4 名崖行者和 4 名崖雷鸣者。",oEN="Slay 4 Cliff Breakers, 4 Cliff Walkers, and 4 Cliff Thunderers in the cliff regions of Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18097]={d="英雄，苔蹄奔行者虽然雄伟，却已在艾萨拉迅速繁殖，导致该地区生态系统失衡。虽然捕杀这些美丽生灵令我们痛心，但为了这片土地的福祉必须如此。在迎战它们时，务必收集它们的皮。苔蹄空灵的毛皮以防护与奥术特性著称，我们可以用它加固防御，抵御更大的威胁。",dEN="Hero, the Mosshoof Coursers, majestic as they are, have started to multiply rapidly in Azshara, leading to an imbalance in the region's ecosystem. While it pains us to cull these beautiful creatures, it's necessary for the good of the land. As you confront them, be sure to collect their hides. The Mosshoof's ethereal pelt is known for its protective and arcane properties, and we could use them to reinforce our defenses against greater threats.",o="在艾萨拉杀死苔蹄奔行者并取回苔蹄皮。",oEN="Slay Mosshoof Coursers and recover Mosshoof Hides in Azshara.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18098]={d="英雄，邪恶的萨特瓦尔克沙斯出没于雷文凯斯纪念碑周围的森林，用暗影之刃伏击旅人。他已远离雷加什营地，似乎意图从附近的龙族那里窃取某件器物。这是我们趁他独自一人时伏击他的机会。他的暗杀行径在散播混乱的同时，也让附近的村民心生恐惧。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，猎杀这个恶魔。",dEN="Hero, the sinister satyr Val'xas stalks the forests surrounding Ravencrest Monument, ambushing travelers with shadowy blades. He has ventured quite far from Legash Encampment, seemingly intent on stealing some artifact from the dragons nearby. This is our chance to ambush him while he's alone. His assassination efforts sew chaos while striking fear into villagers nearby. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this fiend.",o="杀死瓦尔克沙斯",oEN="Slay Val’xas",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18099]={d="英雄，希利苏斯干旱的广阔土地长久以来将秘密掩埋在黄沙之下。阿什虫巢的异种虫以我们前所未见的狂热涌出地表。这些地底居民以它们的防御者、蜂群者和沙行者为先锋，威胁着沙漠脆弱的平衡。希利苏斯绝不能沦为异种虫无节制扩张的牺牲品。深入它们的领地，阻止它们的推进。",dEN="Hero, the arid expanse of Silithus has long concealed secrets beneath its sands. The Hive'Ashi silithid have emerged with a fervor we've not seen before. These subterranean dwellers, with their Defenders, Swarmers, and Sandstalkers at the forefront, are a menace to the delicate balance of the desert. Silithus cannot fall prey to the silithid's unchecked expansion. Delve deep into their territory and halt their advance.",o="杀死希利苏斯异种虫侵染区域的 6 名阿什虫巢防御者、6 名阿什虫巢蜂群者和 4 名阿什虫巢沙行者。",oEN="Slay 6 Hive’Ashi Defenders, 6 Hive’Ashi Swarmers, and 4 Hive’Ashi Sandstalkers in the silithid-infested areas of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18100]={d="英雄，希利苏斯的沙漠之风带来的不只是沙砾，还带来了尘暴者与沙漠轰鸣者的怒吼。这些元素生物是原始自然之怒的化身，正在整个地区制造骚动。它们不受约束的怒火扰乱了希利苏斯的能量流动，威胁着这片土地及其居民。你必须迎战这些风暴般的对手，恢复沙漠的平衡。",dEN="Hero, the desert winds of Silithus carry more than just sand; they bring with them the tumultuous roars of the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers. These elemental beings, manifestations of raw nature's fury, are causing disturbances across the region. Their unchecked rage disrupts the flow of energies in Silithus, threatening both the land and its inhabitants. You must confront these stormy adversaries and restore balance to the desert.",o="杀死希利苏斯元素侵染区域的 6 名尘暴者和 6 名沙漠轰鸣者。",oEN="Slay 6 Dust Stormers and 6 Desert Rumblers in the elemental-infested regions of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18101]={d="英雄，希利苏斯的黄沙本身已被暮光之锤教派的邪恶低语所污染。他们的地领主、复仇者和唤石者举行黑暗仪式，引导邪恶力量推进其末日目标。教派的活动已开始扭曲并改变这片土地。你必须深入他们的营地腹地，迎战这些混沌的信徒，阻止教派的邪恶计划。",dEN="Hero, the very sands of Silithus are tainted with the malevolent whispers of the Twilight's Hammer cult. Their Geolords, Avengers, and Stonecallers perform dark rituals, channeling sinister forces to further their apocalyptic goals. The cult's activities have already begun to twist and warp the land. You must venture into the heart of their encampments, confront these devotees of chaos, and halt the cult's nefarious plans.",o="杀死希利苏斯暮光之锤营地的 6 名暮光地领主、6 名暮光复仇者和 4 名暮光唤石者。",oEN="Slay 6 Twilight Geolords, 6 Twilight Avengers, and 4 Twilight Stonecallers in the Twilight's Hammer encampments of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18102]={d="英雄，希利苏斯的沙漠不仅受到奥术与邪恶教派的挑战，也受到它自己居民的挑战。沙行蝎、疏浚打击者和石鞭蝎等生物变得异常凶暴，既捕食冒险者，也捕食本地动物。这种反常的攻击性扰乱了生态系统，使希利苏斯的平衡岌岌可危。深入沙漠，迎战这些生物，恢复沙海的和谐。",dEN="Hero, the desert of Silithus is not only challenged by the arcane and the malevolent cults but also by its very own inhabitants. Creatures like the Sand Skitterers, Dredge Strikers, and Stonelash Scorpids have become unusually aggressive, preying on both adventurers and native fauna alike. This unnatural aggression disrupts the ecosystem, placing the balance of Silithus at risk. Dive deep into the desert, confront these creatures, and restore harmony to the sands.",o="杀死希利苏斯沙丘与绿洲中的 5 只沙行蝎、5 只疏浚打击者和 5 只石鞭蝎。",oEN="Slay 5 Sand Skitterers, 5 Dredge Strikers, and 5 Stonelash Scorpids in the dunes and oases of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18103]={d="英雄，土之亡魂雷克西迪乌斯出没于水晶谷，以扭曲的存在腐化着这片土地。这个生物似乎受暮光之锤的束缚，被他们用作控制该地区其他土元素的手段。摧毁它，我们就能削弱暮光之锤对这一带的掌控。",dEN="Hero, the earth revenant Rexidius stalks the Crystal Vale, corrupting the land with its twisted presence. The creature seems to be bound by the Twilight Hammer, which are using it as a means of controlling the other earth elementals in the area. Destroy it, and we can weaken the Twilight Hammer's hold over the area.",o="杀死雷克西迪乌斯",oEN="Slay Rexidius",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18104]={d="英雄，希利苏斯不断变幻的沙海之下，隐藏着佐拉虫巢异种虫庞大的网络。虫巢的劫掠者、黄蜂和姐妹已开始大批涌出，它们侵略性的扩张威胁着整个地区。它们虫群意志的深层意图尚不明确，但可以肯定的是它们带来的危险。前往它们的领地，迎战这些异种虫，阻止它们穿越沙漠的进军。",dEN="Hero, the ever-shifting sands of Silithus conceal beneath them the vast networks of the Hive'Zora silithid. Reavers, Wasps, and Sisters from the hive have begun to spill out in numbers, their aggressive expansion threatening the region. The undercurrents of their hive mind's intentions are still unclear, but what's certain is the danger they pose. Journey into their territory, confront these silithid, and halt their march across the desert.",o="杀死希利苏斯异种虫侵染区域的 4 名佐拉虫巢劫掠者、8 只佐拉虫巢黄蜂和 6 名佐拉虫巢姐妹。",oEN="Slay 4 Hive’Zora Reavers, 8 Hive’Zora Wasps, and 6 Hive’Zora Sisters in the silithid-infested regions of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18105]={d="英雄，暮光之锤教派继续在希利苏斯进行黑暗阴谋，利用沙漠潜藏的力量实现他们灾难性的图景。他们行列中的地领主、复仇者与唤石者是这些仪式的关键，抽取着足以瓦解世界本身的能量。你必须介入，穿透暮光营地的帷幕，在他们的可怕计划得逞之前终结他们的野心。",dEN="Hero, the Twilight's Hammer cult continues its dark machinations in Silithus, harnessing the desert's latent powers for their catastrophic visions. The Geolords, Avengers, and Stonecallers among their ranks are instrumental in these rituals, drawing forth energies that could unmake the world itself. You must intervene, piercing the veil of the Twilight's camps, and put an end to their ambitions before they realize their dire plans.",o="杀死散布在希利苏斯各处的暮光营地中的 6 名暮光地领主、6 名暮光复仇者和 4 名暮光唤石者。",oEN="Slay 6 Twilight Geolords, 6 Twilight Avengers, and 4 Twilight Stonecallers in the Twilight encampments scattered throughout Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18106]={d="英雄，希利苏斯对许多人而言是不毛的荒地，却繁衍着适应其严酷条件的生命。但其中一些居民，如岩石潜伏者、疏浚碾压者和石鞭钳虫，已变得越来越具敌意，扰乱自然平衡，捕食较弱的生物。这不能容忍。深入烈日炙烤的广阔土地，遏制这些沙漠掠食者的威胁。",dEN="Hero, Silithus, while a barren wasteland to many, teems with life adapted to its harsh conditions. But some of its inhabitants, such as the Rock Stalkers, Dredge Crushers, and Stonelash Pincers, have grown increasingly hostile, disrupting the natural balance and preying on the weaker creatures. This cannot stand. Venture out into the sun-baked expanse and curb the threat of these desert predators.",o="杀死希利苏斯干旱平原上的 5 只岩石潜伏者、5 只疏浚碾压者和 5 只石鞭钳虫。",oEN="Slay 5 Rock Stalkers, 5 Dredge Crushers, and 5 Stonelash Pincers in the arid plains of Silithus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18107]={d="在希利苏斯灼热的沙丘与古老的巨石之间，散落着浸透神秘与力量的材质。佐拉异种虫的甲壳坚韧而精巧，有太多可供揭示之处。同样，神秘居民所穿的暗织布料或许能解开禁忌仪式的秘密。而散布沙漠各处的闪耀希利苏斯水晶，跳动着原始的能量。英雄，收集这些物品，帮助我们揭开沙漠的谜团。",dEN="Amidst the burning dunes and ancient monoliths of Silithus lie materials steeped in mystery and power. The husks of the Zora silithid, resilient and intricate, have much to reveal. Similarly, the dark-woven cloth worn by mysterious denizens might unlock secrets of forbidden rites. And scattered across the desert are shimmering Silithus crystals, pulsating with raw energy. Gather these items, Hero, and help us unravel the desert's enigmas.",o="收集佐拉甲壳和暮光布料。",oEN="Collect Zora Husks and Twilight Cloth.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18108]={d="暮光之锤在希利苏斯的势力由其最虔诚的成员之一——高阶女祭司阿兹尔督导。传言称，她是少数在与教派所侍奉的诡异主宰 交融后幸存下来的人之一；尽管她的理智几近崩溃，她却激励着麾下的信徒以主人之名自我牺牲。击败她将是对暮光之锤的关键打击。",dEN="The Twilight Hammer forces in Silithus are overseen by one of their most devoted members, High Priestess Azil. Rumors suggest she is one of the few to survive communing with the eldritch masters the cult serves, though her sanity was all but broken, she inspires the cultists under her oversight to sacrifice themselves in the name of their masters. Her defeat would be a crucial blow to the Twilight Hammer.",o="杀死高阶女祭司阿兹尔",oEN="Slay High Priestess Azil",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18109]={d="英雄，雷加尔虫巢的异种虫已变得越来越具攻击性，它们的扩张威胁着希利苏斯的平衡。其中，喷火者、虫巢领主和奴隶制造者尤其棘手，它们领导并协调着虫群的活动。我们必须打击这些关键目标，阻止异种虫的推进，保住沙漠脆弱的均衡。",dEN="Hero, the Hive'Regal silithid have become increasingly aggressive and their expansion threatens the balance of Silithus. Among them, the Spitfires, Hive Lords, and Slave Makers are particularly troublesome, leading and coordinating their brood's activities. We must strike at these key targets to halt the silithid's advance and preserve the fragile equilibrium of the desert.",o="杀死 6 名雷加尔虫巢喷火者、6 名雷加尔虫巢虫巢领主和 4 名雷加尔虫巢奴隶制造者。",oEN="Slay 6 Hive’Regal Spitfires, 6 Hive’Rega Hive Lords, and 4 Hive’Rega Slave Makers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18110]={d="英雄，暮光之锤教派继续在希利苏斯进行黑暗阴谋，利用沙漠潜藏的力量实现他们灾难性的图景。他们行列中的地领主、复仇者与唤石者是这些仪式的关键，抽取着足以瓦解世界本身的能量。你必须介入，穿透暮光营地的帷幕，在他们的可怕计划得逞之前终结他们的野心。",dEN="Hero, the Twilight's Hammer cult continues its dark machinations in Silithus, harnessing the desert's latent powers for their catastrophic visions. The Geolords, Avengers, and Stonecallers among their ranks are instrumental in these rituals, drawing forth energies that could unmake the world itself. You must intervene, piercing the veil of the Twilight's camps, and put an end to their ambitions before they realize their dire plans.",o="杀死 6 名暮光烈焰地领主、6 名暮光烈焰复仇者和 4 名暮光烈焰唤石者。",oEN="Slay 6 Twilight Geolords, 6 Twilight Avengers, and 4 Twilight Stonecallers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18111]={d="在希利苏斯深处，一种难以名状的邪恶攫住了这片土地的守护者。曾是自然保护者的哨兵与德鲁伊，如今在折磨中游荡。英雄，这是一项令人心碎的任务，但必须将他们从这扭曲的存在中解放出来。让他们安息，或许这片土地也能寻得一丝宁静。",dEN="In the depths of Silithus, an unspeakable evil has taken hold of the land's guardians. Sentinels and druids, once protectors of nature, now roam in torment. Hero, it's a heart-wrenching task, but they must be freed from this twisted existence. Lay them to rest, and perhaps the land might find some peace.",o="杀死 6 名受折磨的哨兵和 6 名受折磨的德鲁伊。",oEN="Slay 6 Tortured Sentinels and 6 Tortured Druids.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18112]={d="希利苏斯的大地被黑暗能量污染，但腐化之中仍存在某些元素，能帮助我们理解并对抗这股日益增长的威胁。受折磨者的灵魂、强大异种虫巢的残骸，以及暮光之锤的禁忌石板，都是一幅更大拼图的碎片。英雄，收集它们并带给我们。只有理解暗影，我们才有望将其击退。",dEN="The land of Silithus is tainted with dark energy, yet within the corruption, elements exist that could help us understand and combat this growing threat. Souls of the tortured, remnants from the mighty silithid hives, and forbidden tablets from the Twilight's Hammer are all pieces of a larger puzzle. Gather them, Hero, and bring them to us. Only by understanding the shadows can we hope to push them back.",o="收集受折磨的灵魂、虫巢甲壳和暮光石板。",oEN="Collect Tortured Souls, Hive Husks, and Twilight Tablets.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18113]={d="英雄，被称为低语者库兰的其拉先知居于雷加尔虫巢之外，为异种虫群注入力量。他邪恶的魔法助长了它们无情的攻击，他的声音则集结起它们的昆虫军团。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，潜入虫巢，让低语者永远沉默。",dEN="Hero, the Qiraji prophet known as The Speaker Kuuran resides outside the hive of Hive'Regal, empowering the Silithid swarm. His vile magics enable their relentless attacks, while his voice rallies their insectoid legions. I beseech you, brave champion, to infiltrate the hive and silence The Speaker.",o="杀死低语者库兰",oEN="Slay The Speaker Kuuran",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[18114]={d="英雄，邪恶的死灵法师腐蚀者萨斯里瓦在瘟疫林深处修习黑暗魔法，召唤成群的亡灵。他不洁的力量散播疾病与衰败，扭曲着周遭环境。我恳求你，勇敢的勇士，追猎这个恶徒。穿越瘟疫林腐朽的森林，找到死灵法师的巢穴并杀死他，让他的邪恶不再蔓延。",dEN="Hero, the vile necromancer Sathrivar the Corruptor practices dark magic deep within Plaguewood, raising legions of undead. His foul powers spread sickness and decay, warping the environment. I beseech you, brave champion, to hunt down this villain. Journey into Plaguewood's rotted forests, find the necromancer's lair, and slay him so his evil spreads no further.",o="杀死腐蚀者萨斯里瓦",oEN="Slay Sathrivar the Corruptor",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
