Q[18174]={d="湖里的蛇颈鱼正在渔网上啃出窟窿，还吓跑了好鱼。要是不削减这些幼崽的数量，就没什么值得夸耀的收成了。\n\n到水边去，在幼年蛇颈鱼长得太大、难以对付之前清除它们。办完事后回来报信。",dEN="The threshadons in the Loch are gnawin' holes through the nets and scarin' off the good fish. If we don't thin the young ones, there won't be any catch worth braggin' about.\n\nHead down to the water and cull the Young Threshadons before they grow too big to handle. Bring word back once it's done.",o="卡兹里克·深掘要你清除湖中的幼年蛇颈鱼。杀死 8 只幼年蛇颈鱼。",oEN="Kazrik Deepdelve wants you to cull the Young Threshadons in the Loch. Slay 8 Young Threshadons.",p="那些蛇颈鱼还在啃我们的渔线吗？把它们赶远点，好让我们继续捕鱼！",pEN="Those threshadons still chompin' our lines? Push 'em back a bit so we can keep fishin'!",c="干得好！\n\n把这些畜生削减一些，收成还能多撑一阵子。\n\n这是你那份，要是渔网保持完好，说不定我们真能有点赚头。",cEN="Good work!\n\nThe catch will hold for a while longer with those beasties thinned out.\n\nHere's your share, and if the nets stay whole, maybe we'll have real profit yet."}
Q[18175]={d="那个该死的狡猾甲壳货！\n\n老螯钳已经扯断渔线、偷走鱼饵好几个星期了！有那只在浅滩里鬼鬼祟祟的巨无霸螃蟹在，我们一天几乎捕不到什么。小伙子们都束手无策，我也是。\n\n帮我们个忙，行吗？叫上几个壮实的小伙子，把老螯钳和他偷鱼饵的勾当一并了结。",dEN="That blasted conniving crustacean!\n\nOld Scuttles has been snapping lines, and stealing bait for weeks now! We can scarce make a day’s catch with that overgrown crab lurkin’ in the shallows. The lads are at their wits’ end, and so am I.\n\nDo us a favor, will ye? Gather a few stout lads and put an end to Old Scuttles and his bait-nabbin’ mischief.",o="沃格·深水要你们在洛克湖猎杀老螯钳。组一支小队，击败老螯钳。",oEN="Warg Deepwater wants you to hunt down Old Scuttles in the Loch. Gather a small group and defeat Old Scuttles.",p="老螯钳还在外面吗？我得让那个偷线的家伙消失，好让我们安心捕鱼！",pEN="Old Scuttles still out there? I need that line-thief gone so we can fish in peace!",c="哈！那个脏兮兮的小偷再也不会给我们添麻烦了。太感谢了！",cEN="Ha! That crusty thief won't be causin' us any more grief, Many thanks!"}
Q[18176]={d="我的补给快用完了，索格伦还欠我一个人情。把这张便条送到飞行塔给他；他知道该回送什么。\n\n别弄丢了！下一次收成之前我需要那批货。",dEN="I'm running low on supplies, and Thorgrum owes me a favor. Take this note to him at the flight tower—he'll know what to send back.\n\nDon't lose it! I need those goods before the next catch.",o="蕾玛要你把她的便条带给洛克莫丹的索格伦·博雷尔森。",oEN="Lemma needs you to take her note to Thorgrum Borrelson in Loch Modan.",p="蕾玛的便条，是吗？哈！我就知道这份人情迟早要还。让我看看……\"快用完了\"，她说。嗯，听着就像她。下次见到她，告诉她我希望这份人情这次就算还清了。",pEN="A note from Lemma, is it? Hah! Knew that favor would come due sooner or later. Let’s see… “running low,” she says. Aye, that sounds like her. Next time you see her tell her I expect that favor marked paid this time.",c="拿到了？很好。",cEN="Got it? Good."}
Q[18177]={d="蕾玛需要那张便条送到铁炉堡，而你正好往那边去。把它带给工匠区的齿轮切割者·科格斯平纳，好让她把补给调运起来。\n\n别在飞行途中弄丢了。",dEN="Lemma needs that note in Ironforge and you're heading that way. Take this to Gearcutter Cogspinner in Tinker Town so she can get the supplies moving.\n\nDon't lose it on the flight.",o="索格伦要你把蕾玛的便条带给铁炉堡的齿轮切割者·科格斯平纳。",oEN="Thorgrum wants you to carry Lemma's note to Gearcutter Cogspinner in Ironforge.",p="蕾玛有便条给我？有意思……",pEN="Lemma's has a note for me? Interesting..",c="啊，蕾玛需要补给！我会确保她货源充足、安顿妥当。我这就把一切打包好准备飞行。",cEN="Ah, Lemma is in need of supplies! I'll make sure she's stocked and settled. I'll pack everything up for the flight."}
Q[18178]={d="蕾玛的货物已经打包好了！把它们送回狮鹫站的格里斯·瑟登那里，好让他们载你飞往塞尔萨玛。\n\n别弄丢包裹！",dEN="Lemma's goods are packed! Get them back to Gryth Thurden at the gryphon post so they can fly you to Thelsamar.\n\nDon't lose the package!",o="齿轮切割者要你把蕾玛的包裹送回给格里斯·瑟登。",oEN="Gearcutter wants you to carry Lemma's package back to Gryth Thurden.",p="蕾玛需要送个包裹？\n\n别担心，我正好有合适的狮鹫给你！",pEN="Lemma needs a package delivered?\n\nNot to worry, I got just the right gryphon for ye!",c="快如山风，只在饿的时候才咬人。尽量别看起来像午餐。\n\n还有，务必抓牢那个包裹！这些山峰周围的风对松散的货物可没什么耐心，我打赌蕾玛也是。",cEN="Fast as the mountain wind and only bites when he’s hungry. Try not to look like lunch.\n\nAnd see that ye hold on tight to that package! The winds around these peaks don’t care much for loose cargo, and neither does Lemma, I’d wager."}
Q[18179]={d="快上狮鹫！\n\n把蕾玛的包裹送回塞尔萨玛旁营地里的她手中。",dEN="Get on the gryphon already!\n\nTake Lemma's package back to her at the camp by Thelsamar.",o="格里斯要你把蕾玛的包裹带回洛克莫丹的蕾玛·铜齿。",oEN="Gryth wants you to take Lemma's package back to Lemma Brasscog in Loch Modan.",p="你把它完好无损地带回来了？很好！",pEN="You kept it intact? Good!",c="正好赶上。这肯定能让船员们高兴。这是你那份。",cEN="Right on time. This'll surely make the crew happy. Here's your cut."}
Q[18180]={d="将你当前的戒指换成更强、与熔火之心调和的版本。",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Molten Core attuned version.",o="交出你当前的戒指和 200g，升级为熔火之心版本。",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Molten Core version."}
Q[18181]={d="将你当前的戒指换成更强、与黑翼之巢调和的版本。",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Blackwing Lair attuned version.",o="交出你当前的戒指和 200g，升级为黑翼之巢版本。",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Blackwing Lair version."}
Q[18182]={d="将你当前的戒指换成更强的安其拉调和版本。",dEN="Exchange your current ring for a stronger Ahn'Qiraj attuned version.",o="交出你当前的戒指和 200g，升级为安其拉版本。",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Ahn'Qiraj version."}
Q[18183]={d="将你当前的戒指换成最终的纳克萨玛斯调和版本。",dEN="Exchange your current ring for the final Naxxramas attuned version.",o="交出你当前的戒指和 200g，升级为纳克萨玛斯版本。",oEN="Hand in your current ring and 200g to upgrade to the Naxxramas version."}
Q[20438]={d="要让你进入夺日者圣殿，可比看上去要难。只有持有夺日者外袍的人才被允许进入圣所。如果我们能弄到一件，剩下的交给一道简单的附魔就行。\n\n在命运丝线上方的阳台上，你会找到山迪·格洛斯格利姆。我过去帮过他几次，所以他欠我一个人情。他为城里形形色色的人洗衣服。也许他能想办法\"借\"你一件外袍用一阵子。",dEN="Getting you inside the Sunreaver's Sanctuary will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Sunreaver tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.\n\nOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while.",o="从山迪·格罗斯那里取得“借来的战袍”。",oEN="Obtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam.",p="山迪帮你弄到件夺日者战袍了吗？",pEN="Was Shandy able to help you get a Sunreaver tabard?",c="我就知道山迪肯定会帮我们这个忙的。让我给它附魔一下方便你使用。你越快穿上这件战袍，我们就能越快还给山迪，毕竟万一丢了，它的主人可接受不了。",cEN="I knew Shandy would find a way to come through for us. Let me get this enchanted and ready for you to use. The sooner you get done with the tabard, the sooner we can get it back to Shandy and the better the chances that its owner will never have missed it."}
Q[20439]={d="我已经在这件衣服上施加了魔法。你穿上它，就能在短时间内进入夺日者圣殿的防御。你应该有足够的时间找路进入那里的一座建筑：“肮脏的野兽”，与夺日者的联系人见面。那个人是魔导师哈瑟尔。\n\n你要借助伪装取得上古龙铸之刃的抄本。那是魔导师哈瑟尔的部下从龙眠神殿借来的。取得那本书以后，就把它交给我。",dEN="I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Sunreaver Sanctuary's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way into The Filthy Animal and meet up with the Sunreaver contact there, one Magister Hathorel.\n\nObtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest while your disguise holds, and return it to me.",o="从魔导师哈瑟尔那里取得上古龙铸之刃典籍。",oEN="Retrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Magister Hathorel.",p="你拿回那本书了吗？",pEN="Have you recovered that book?",c="干得漂亮。既然东西已在我们手中，我们必须尽快把它交给卡莱迪斯·亮矛。我们不能冒险让这本书重新落回夺日者手中。\n\n我会确保山迪·格洛斯格利姆毫发无损地拿回他的外袍，外加一笔丰厚的酬谢。",cEN="Excellent work. Now that this is in our hands, we must get it to Caladis Brightspear as soon as possible. We can't risk the book falling back into Sunreaver hands.\n\nI'll ensure that Shandy Glossgleam gets his tabard back without incident, along with a healthy reward for his help."}
Q[24428]={d="你完成了真正不可能完成的事。黑龙军团的族母就倒在你脚下。割下她的头颅，把它交给黑爪的扎尔迪斯。",dEN="You have accomplished the truly impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Seize her head and deliver it to Zardeth of the Black Claw or Neeru Fireblade.",o="把奥妮克希亚的头颅交给暴风城屠宰羔羊酒馆地下室里黑爪的扎尔迪斯。",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to Zardeth of the Black Claw in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind or to Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="以诺兹多姆之牙的名义！",pEN="By Nozdormu's teeth!",c="什么？你是从哪弄到手的？她不是……算了，我想这并不重要。你应当为此获得一些奖赏，这点毋庸置疑。",cEN="What? How did you get this? Isn't she... Never mind the details, I suppose. You'll be wanting one of these baubles as recompense, no doubt."}
Q[24429]={d="你完成了真正不可能完成的事。黑龙军团的族母就倒在你脚下。割下她的头颅，把它交给尼尔鲁·火刃。",dEN="You have accomplished the truly impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Seize her head and deliver it to Zardeth of the Black Claw or Neeru Fireblade.",o="把奥妮克希亚的头颅交给奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的尼尔鲁·火刃。",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to Zardeth of the Black Claw in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb in Stormwind or to Neeru Fireblade in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.",p="你带来的该不会是……？！",pEN="What is the meaning of this?!",c="你带来的头颅是属于……。不，我想我还是别想太多。你的英勇行径应当获得奖赏，这点毋庸置疑。",cEN="You've brought me the head of someone who is... No, best not to think about it too hard. You'll be wanting recompense for your heroic deeds, no doubt."}
Q[24431]={d="看起来，这张被水浸透的纸上应该是记录着一种烈性酒的酿造配方。也许达拉然“再来一杯”的店主会对这个感兴趣……",dEN="This appears to be the remains of a mixture for potent wine. Perhaps the proprietor of One More Glass in Dalaran would be interested in it....",o="将被浸透的配方交给达拉然城中的克莉丝蒂·斯多克顿。",oEN="Bring the Waterlogged Recipe to Christi Stockton in the Dalaran city.",p="正如我所说的，美酒只配识货的人。",pEN="Wine is only as fine as the person drinking it, I always say.",c="这真是个了不起的发现，<name>。我不能让你把它卖给别人，所以我愿意出个慷慨的价钱。",cEN="This is quite a find, <name>. I can't have you selling this to anyone else, so I'm willing to offer generously."}
Q[24442]={d="翻阅缴获的进攻计划，你看到一张标有若干大型定居点的东部王国与卡利姆多地图。细读命令后，你得知克瓦迪尔船长们已拟定了系列毁灭性突袭的计划。\n\n根据命令，进攻将在唤雾者英瓦尔\"请教迷雾之心\"之后开始。也许你可以夺取赫斯格拉登陆点西侧唤雾者洞穴中的预兆之物，并通知正义者玛丽尔·真心，从而拖延这些进攻。",dEN="Looking over the captured attack plans, you find a map of the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor with major settlements marked. Reading over the orders, you learn that Kvaldir captains have drafted plans for a series of devastating raids.\n\nAccording to the orders, the attacks are to begin after Mistcaller Yngvar \"consults the Heart of the Mists.\" Perhaps you could delay the attacks by capturing the omen from the Mistcaller's Cave on the western side of Hrothgar's Landing and notify Justicar Mariel Trueheart.",o="取得迷雾之心，将它和克瓦迪尔进攻计划一同交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Recover the Heart of the Mists and bring it and the Kvaldir Attack Plans to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你发现了什么，<name>？",pEN="What is it that you've found, <name>?",c="<玛丽尔接过命令与缴获的视界水晶，仔细查看两样东西。>\n\n干得好，<name>，脑筋也转得快。我敢肯定，偷走这件小玩意不会让他们停滞太久，但我认为你为我们争取到了时间，好去警告部落与联盟的领袖们即将到来的进攻。",cEN="<Mariel accepts the orders and the captured seeing crystal and examines both.>\n\nGood work, <name>, and quick thinking. I'm sure the theft of this trinket won't slow them down for long, but I think you've bought us time to warn the leaders of the Horde and Alliance about the impending attacks."}
Q[24451]={d="我已经在这件衣服上施加了魔法。你穿上它，就能在短时间内进入银色领地的防御。你应该有足够的时间找路进入那里的一座建筑：“英雄之家”，与银色盟约的联系人见面。那个人是奥术师泰拜林。\n\n你要借助伪装取得上古龙铸之刃的抄本。那是奥术师泰拜林的部下从龙眠神殿借来的。取得那本书以后，就把它交给我。",dEN="I've placed an enchantment on the tabard that should allow you to slip past the Silver Enclave's defenses for a short period of time. You should have enough time to find your way up to the top level of the Silver Enclave and meet up with the Silver Covenant's man there, known as Arcanist Tybalin.\n\nWhile disguised, obtain the copy of Ancient Dragonforged Blades that his men borrowed from Wyrmrest, and return the book to me.",o="从奥术师泰拜林那里取得上古龙铸之刃典籍。",oEN="Retrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Arcanist Tybalin.",p="你从龙眠神殿取回那本书了吗？",pEN="Did you recover the book from Wyrmrest?",c="干得漂亮。现在宝典重回我手，我们必须尽快把它交给麦雷昂·阳炎，绝不能再让它被银色盟约抢走了。\n\n我确信山迪·格罗斯已经拿回了战袍，这是给你的奖励。",cEN="Excellent work. Now that this is in our hands, we must get it to Myralion Sunblaze as soon as possible. We can't risk the Silver Covenant taking the book from us again.\n\nI'll get that tabard back to Shandy and see that he's well compensated for his assistance. Once the book is in Myralion's hands, the Silver Covenant won't be a threat anymore."}
Q[24454]={d="我们必须立刻将这本书交给卡莱迪斯·亮矛。你能帮我这个忙吗？你已经证明自己有足够的实力击败夺日者，除了你以外，我不能信任其它人能够完成这个任务。\n\n带着这本书转至奎尔德拉之冢。它就在冰冠冰川银色比武场的南边。卡莱迪斯和那把剑都会等着你。我们越早鉴别出这件武器，我们就能越早拥有它。",dEN="We must get this book to Caladis Brightspear immediately. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at keeping the Sunreavers at bay.\n\nTake it with you to Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Caladis and the sword will be waiting. The sooner we can identify the blade, the sooner we can claim it.",o="将上古龙铸之刃交给奎尔德拉之冢的卡莱迪斯·亮矛。",oEN="Bring Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",p="我们猜到你还回来的。你拿着什么？",pEN="We've been expecting your return. What has kept you?",c="<Caladis acepta el pesado libro y empieza a hojearlo>\n\n我就知道剑刃上的符号很眼熟。这件武器必定是龙族锻造并赠予某个凡人种族的，但这是哪把剑，又怎么会流落到冰冠冰川？",cEN="<Caladis accepts the heavy book and begins leafing through it.>\n\nI knew the symbols on the blade were familiar. The weapon was most certainly forged by the dragons and gifted to one of the mortal races, but which blade is this, and how did it come to rest in Icecrown?"}
Q[24461]={d="我们不能让奎尔德拉就这样只是一堆耻辱的碎片。带上这把剑的残片和你发现的剑柄，到冰冠堡垒的萨隆矿坑去。\n\n巫妖王强迫许多奴隶在那里采掘熔炼萨隆邪铁矿石。我们要用萨隆邪铁重铸奎尔德拉。\n\n你必须取得注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的大锤，然后用它们在熔炉之主的铁砧上重铸这把剑。",dEN="We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.\n\nYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword.",o="取得5块注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的巨锤，用它们重铸奎尔德拉。",oEN="Obtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer and use them to make the Reforged Quel'Delar.",p="你重铸奎尔德拉了吗？",pEN="Were you able to reconstruct Quel'Delar?",c="你已重铸了奎尔德拉之剑，尽管鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔说我们无法办到！这把剑必须继续淬火，不过她和她的主人可不会站在我们这边！",cEN="You have remade the blade of Quel'Delar, although Blood-Queen Lana'thel proclaimed we could not! The blade must still be tempered, but she and her master will not stand in our way!"}
Q[24476]={d="破碎的奎尔德拉终于完整如初了，但如果不经过适当的锻打，你还不能使用它作战。它参差不齐的萨隆邪铁边缘仍然脆弱易碎。\n\n你可以在冰冠堡垒深处的灵魂洪炉对它进行深度锻造。把奎尔德拉带到噬魂者的住所去，找到那里的坩埚。将这把剑放进坩埚里，对它进行锻造，然后再回来见我。我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.\n\nDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me in The Frozen Halls.",o="在灵魂坩锅锻造已经重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Temper the Reforged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls.",p="在它被再次锻造之前，它无法发挥作用。",pEN="Until the sword is tempered, it will be useless.",c="我……我简直不敢相信，需要回到锻造它的诞生地修复这把剑。发生了什么？",cEN="I... I don't understand. Tempering the sword should've restored the blade to its original condition. What has happened here?"}
Q[24480]={d="你已经重铸了这把剑，并对它进行了锻造，但它仍然只是静静地躺在剑鞘里，丝毫没有显示出它应有的力量。你说这把剑在吸引你，就好象它拥有自己的意志？\n\n你敢把它带到它想去的地方吗？这把剑不应该如此沉默，但如果你不把它带去那个地方，也许我们将永远不知道这是为什么。把它带进冰冠堡垒的映像大厅。在那里一定要万分小心！我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="You have reforged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, showing no signs of the power it should possess. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?\n\nDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It's not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Take it into Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard! I'll be waiting for you in The Frozen Halls.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉带到映像大厅里面的剑冢去。",oEN="Bring your Tempered Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.",p="映像大厅里发生什么事了？",pEN="What happened inside the Halls of Reflection?",c="我原以为邪恶不可能寄宿在这样一把剑中，但我想是我太天真了。如果龙族最伟大的造物都能被腐化并反过来对付他们，一把普通的剑又为何不能？\n\n乌瑟尔的忠告很明智，<name>，我劝你尽快听从。",cEN="I had not thought it possible for evil to take hold in such a sword, but I suppose it was naive of me. If the greatest of dragonkind's creations could be corrupted and turned against them, why not a mere sword?\n\nUther's advice is wise, <name>, and I would urge you to heed it quickly."}
Q[24487]={d="听好了，老兄。邦桑迪会在他的国度里等着你拜访，所以快点！关于你的请求，我有要紧事要跟你谈。别让我等太久，老邦桑迪可没什么耐心，哈哈！回到灵魂国度，我会跟你谈谈你来求的事。你我之间还有笔交易要谈成。所以到我的国度里来找我，我们把事情办妥！",dEN="Listen here, mon. Bwonsamdi be expectin' your visit in his realm, so make haste! I got important matters to discuss witcha about your request. Don't be makin' me wait too long now - ol' Bwonsamdi not known for his patience, haha! Return to the spirit realm, and I gonna talk witcha 'bout what ya came for. We got a deal to be makin', you and me. So find me in me realm, and we take care of business!",o="在灵魂国度与邦桑迪会面。",oEN="Meet Bwonsamdi in the spirit realm.",c="哟，瞧瞧你，英雄！你站在我面前，把男爵的祝福当作荣誉徽章一样佩戴。这说明你有资格。\n\n现在是时候了，老兄，让我把你所学的一切汇聚起来，向他证明你配得上这份祝福。你已让两位神灵赐予你祝福，我也会赐予我的；有了它，你将永远成为赞达拉的一员。所以自豪地带着这份祝福吧，让它指引你的道路，成为一名真正的驭风者。",cEN="Well, look at ya, Hero! Ya stand before me, wearin' da Baron's blessin' like a badge of honor. Dat means ya're worthy.\n\nNow it's time, mon, for me to bring all ya've learned togetha an' show 'im dat ya be worthy of dis blessin'. Ya've managed to make two Loas give ya their blessin', an' I'll give ya mine, with this ya can be part of da Zandalari forevah. So carry dis blessin' wit' pride, let it guide yer path as a true Windreavah."}
Q[24490]={d="席里， 原初纳鲁，德莱尼人民圣光的灯塔，察觉到了严重的扰动。一块引导她神圣能量的神圣碎片被虚空的邪恶爪牙偷走了！\n\n失去这块碎片，席里与圣光的连接便受到威胁，德莱尼人也将暴露在步步逼近的黑暗之下。她恳求你，在她的光辉熄灭之前，取回这件被邪恶虚空生物夺走的珍贵器物。\n\n深入扭曲虚空行者的阴暗巢穴，在席里的光芒黯淡之前夺回碎片！只有恢复纳鲁的圣光灯塔，才能让德莱尼人重归平衡，维持席里的守护警戒。\n\n碎片的命运，以及席里的指引，如今都掌握在你手中，勇士！恢复这件神圣遗物，让席里对德莱尼人的恩泽长存，抵御那些企图熄灭她圣光的黑暗势力！",dEN="Xi'ri, prime naaru and beacon of the Light for the Draenei people, has sensed a grave disturbance. One of the sacred Shards channeling her holy energies has been stolen by sinister agents of the Void!\n\nWithout this missing Shard, Xi'ri's connection to the Light is threatened, leaving the Draenei vulnerable to the encroaching darkness. She implores you to recover this precious artifact taken by sinister void creatures before her radiance is extinguished.\n\nVenture into the shadowy lairs of the void-twisted netherwalkers to reclaim the Shard before Xi'ri's light dims! Only by restoring the naaru's beacon of the Light can balance be returned to the Draenei and Xi'ri's protective vigil be maintained.\n\nThe fate of the Shard, and Xi'ri's guidance, now rests in your hands, champion! Restore this holy relic so Xi'ri's benevolence over the Draenei endures against the dark forces that seek to extinguish her Light!",o="将失窃的圣光碎片交还席里",oEN="Return The Stolen Shard of Light to Xi'ri",p="你找到失窃的碎片了吗？",pEN="Did you find the Stolen Shard?",c="令人印象深刻，<name>……失窃的圣光碎片想必来之不易！看到你带着圣光碎片平安归来，我松了一口气。它的光辉是我们事业的希望之光，但若落入错误之手，也是巨大的危险。你已证明了自己的勇气与本领，将它从军团的掌控中解放出来。",cEN="Most impressive, <name>... the Stolen Shard of Light could not have been easy to get! I am relieved to see you have returned safely with the Shard of Light. Its radiance signals hope for our cause, yet also grave danger should it fall into the wrong hands. You have proven your courage and skill in liberating it from the Legion's grasp."}
Q[24491]={d="可怕的格鲁尔之子终于被斩首。这个麻袋中装着的他们被割下的头颅，是你在外域人民面前英雄事迹的证明。\n\n格鲁尔培育后代时既狡诈又残暴，但他们数个世纪的残酷统治已经终结。他们独眼身形投在大地上的可怖阴影再也不会延伸了。\n\n把这袋割下的头颅带给背叛者格朗斯托克。他会知道该举行哪些净化仪式，以清除格鲁尔之子身上可能携带的恶魔腐化残余。所有自由之民的感激与你同在。",dEN="The dreaded Sons of Gruul have been decapitated at last. Their severed heads contained in this sack are evidence of your heroic deeds on behalf of the people of Outland.\n\nGruul bred his progeny to be as cunning as they were brutal, but their centuries of cruel dominion have been brought to an end. The fearful shadows cast across the land by their cyclopean forms will stretch no longer.\n\nTake the sack of severed heads to Betrayer Grondstok. He will know what cleansing rituals must be done to purification against any vestiges of demonic corruption the Sons carried. The gratitude of all free people goes with you.",o="把沉重的头颅袋交给背叛者格朗斯托克",oEN="Take the Heavy Sack of Heads to Betrayer Grondstok",p="你拿到头颅了吗？",pEN="Do you have the heads?",c="对！你是强壮的战士，勇敢的战士，比食人魔更强，比戈隆更强！有了头颅，食人魔就会听格朗斯托克的。格朗斯托克命令食人魔转而对付格鲁尔，别去碰 <name> 的人民。头颅有力量，格鲁尔之子的强大力量，石头、山脉与戈隆的力量！把头颅给格朗斯托克，这力量就归我们！\n\n<name>……我看到你完成了收集格鲁尔之子头颅的壮举。我不能否认你在这项任务中展现的技巧与勇气。很少有人敢面对格鲁尔后裔的怒火。若你如约把头颅交给背叛者，丰厚的奖赏或许就会降临于你。",cEN="YES! You are strong warrior, brave warrior, stronger than ogre, stronger than gronn! With heads, ogres listen to Grondstok. Grondstok command ogres to turn on Gruul, leave <name>'s people alone. Heads have power, mighty power of Gruul's son's, of stone and mountain and gronn! Give Grondstok heads, and this power become ours!\n\n\n<name>..., I see you have accomplished the monumental feat of gathering the severed heads of the Sons of Gruul. I cannot deny the skill and bravery you showed in this task. Few would dare face the rage of Gruul's offspring. Should you give the heads to the betrayer as promised, great rewards may come your way."}
Q[24492]={d="强大的食人魔居住在附近的山中，是忠于其主人的野蛮暴徒。背叛者希望削弱这位主人，却缺乏正面迎战这些食人魔的力量。",dEN="Powerful ogres dwell in the mountains nearby, savage brutes loyal to their master. The betrayer wishes to undermine this master but lacks the strength to face these ogres directly.",o="背叛者已着手一项骇人的任务。你并不知道这仪式为的是何种阴森目的，但背叛者承诺，完成这场血腥的收割将有重赏。",oEN="The betrayer has set out on a gruesome task. You know not what grim ritual they are meant for, but the betrayer promises great reward for completing this gory harvest."}
Q[24493]={d="格鲁尔控制着食人魔，在洞穴里，太强了，没有军队打不过。格鲁尔之子第二强，但也只是第二。他们仍比格朗斯托克强，可格朗斯托克知道夺走他们力量的办法，把它变成自己的。不，变成我们的。格朗斯托克不想和德莱尼人开战，不想侍奉格鲁尔。有了格鲁尔之子的头颅，我们就能发动叛乱。\n\n儿子们太强，所以格朗斯托克等待，但你找来帮手，杀死儿子们，格朗斯托克就赐你戈隆之力。",dEN="Gruul control ogres, in cave, too strong to fight without army. Gruul's sons second strongest, but only second. Still stronger than Grondstok, but Grondstok know ways to take their strength, make it his. No, make it ours. Grondstok not want war with Draenei, not want serve Gruul. With heads of Gruul sons, we start rebellion.\n\nSons too strong, so Grondstok waits, but you get help, slay sons, and Grondstok give you strength of gronn.",o="背叛者已着手一项骇人的任务。你并不知道这仪式为的是何种阴森目的，但背叛者承诺，完成这场血腥的收割将有重赏。",oEN="The betrayer has set out on a gruesome task. You know not what grim ritual they are meant for, but the betrayer promises great reward for completing this gory harvest."}
Q[24494]={d="对邪能之血特性的研究进展缓慢，正如预料。关于它与其他兽人所受标准邪能腐化之间的关系，已有一些进展。有几种物质可能有助于理解邪能之血的特性。\n\n- 玛诺洛斯之血：大部分似乎已被兽人饮尽，而任何接触恶魔玛诺洛斯的方法都被证明不可行。\n\n- 深渊领主之血：可能来自被囚禁在此地的恶魔玛瑟里顿，用于理解玛诺洛斯之血的特定特性。\n\n除此之外，邪能部落似乎还制造了几种人工物质。也许其中一些成功复制了恶魔之血的特性，前提是它们并非\n\n- 深渊药剂：似乎是一种为强化兽人而调制的药水。\n\n- 军团之血：除了邪能兽人含糊的命名之外，它是否能提供不同的特性以供研究？\n\n- 恶魔药剂：可能与深渊药剂相似，不过邪能兽人似乎把它描述为另一种物质。\n\n遗憾的是，我无力突破邪能兽人的阻挠去取得其中任何一种，除了这些囚犯之外，我也未能为自己的研究争取到更多支援。地狱火堡垒上的这座平台似乎至少仍与外界隔绝，我希望在可预见的将来它能保持安全。",dEN="Research into the properties of the fel blood is progressing slowly as expected. Some progress has been made regarding how it relates to the standard fel corruption other orcs experience. Several substances may potentially aid in understanding the properties of fel blood.\n\n- The Blood of Mannoroth, most seems to have been consumed by the orcs already, and no method of reaching the demon Mannoroth has proven feasible.\n\n- Pit Lord's Blood, potentially from the demon Magtheridon imprisoned in this area, for understanding properties specific to Mannoroth's blood.\n\nBesides these, there seem to be several artificial substances created by the Fel Horde. Perhaps some of these have managed to replicate properties of demon blood, provided they are not\n\n- Abyssal Elxir, seems to be a potion created to empower the orcs.\n\n- Blood of the Legions, besides the Fel Orc's vague naming, may provide different properties to study?\n\n- Demonic Elixir, possibly similar to Abyssal Elixir, Fel Orcs seem to describe it as a separate substance though.\n\nUnfortunately I lack the means of fighting past the Fel Orcs to obtain any of these, and have not been able to procure additional support in my research besides these prisoners. This platform on Hellfire Citadel seems to remain isolated at least and it is my hope that it remains secure for the foreseeable future.",o="把你收集到的血液样本带给萨卡里，好让我们研究深渊领主生命力的特性，更好地理解邪能之血真正的力量与危险。",oEN="Bring your gathered blood samples to Sakari so that we may study the properties of pit lord vitae and better understand the true power and danger of fel blood.",p="你好，需要什么吗？",pEN="Hello, do you need something?",c="你找到样本了？那份清单在接触到邪能之血后我就放弃了，没想到真会有人去找这些东西……\n\n好吧，谢谢你。我大半辈子都在试图理解邪能腐化的特性，更重要的是，如何将它从我的族人身上彻底清除。也许我曾经找到过一种办法……好吧，那是一种我暂时无法再尝试的办法。我来这里，是希望此地邪能兽人更强烈的腐化能帮我更好地理解它。\n\n有了这些，也许我真能取得一些进展。",cEN="You found the samples? I'd abandoned that manifest after it was exposed to the fel blood, I didn't expect anyone to actually go looking for these...\n\nWell, thank you. I've spent most of my life trying to understand the properties of fel corruption, and more importantly, how to fully remove it from my people. I may have found a way once...well, it's not one I can try again for a while yet. I came here hoping that the more intense corruption of the fel orcs here might help me understand it better.\n\nWith these, maybe I can actually make some progress."}
Q[24495]={d="既然你来了，我还有一件事想请你帮忙，当然，如果你愿意的话。我也许找到了彻底逆转其中一名邪能兽人腐化的办法。虽然我相信这应该可行，但我只是部分逆转了他们身上的邪能影响，这并没让他们对卡加斯的忠诚减少分毫。\n\n我不太擅长战斗，也没能找到擅长战斗的人。如果你能在我释放那名兽人尝试这个办法时稍作停留，我将不胜感激。以防我无法将它妥善麻醉，而它又想动手。",dEN="While you're here, I could use some help with one more thing, if you're willing of course. I may have found a way to fully revert the corruption of one of these fel orcs. While I believe it should work, the fact that I've partially reverted the fel influence on them doesn't make them any less loyal to Kargath.\n\nI'm not much of a fighter, and I haven't been able to secure anyone who is. If you could stay for a moment while I release the orc to try this, it would be much appreciated. If I'm not able to sedate it properly and it tries something.",o="萨卡里有一个可以测试邪能之血解药的实验对象。她相信研究其效果能带来强大的力量，但警告结果可能难以预料。",oEN="Sakari has a subject to test the fel blood antidote on. She believes studying its effects could yield great power, but cautions the results may be unpredictable.",p="这完全没起作用！",pEN="This didn't work at all!",c="好吧，那……那没成功……\n\n抱歉，我……嗯，通常，如果我对魔法特性进行逆向工程，我就能把它们反转过来。显然我对这东西的了解并不像我以为的那么深。看来还需要更多时间和研究。先是那只鹰身女妖，然后是这个……不过话说回来，如果解决办法很容易，早就有人找到了。我迟早会解决的。\n\n不过，你救了我的命。我确实弄清楚了\"军团之血\"是什么，作为一种更可控的邪能腐化形式，它相当耐人寻味。根据我观察到的特性，这是一种控制得更好的邪能腐化。它不会损害你的心智与身体……好吧，没那么严重。\n\n说清楚一点，考虑到……最近发生的事，我仍然不建议使用这类力量，也不建议相信我在这个问题上的判断。但我认为它对我的研究没什么用，而我至少欠你些什么，所以这瓶药剂归你了。你可以随意使用。只是要小心。",cEN="Well, that...that didn't work...\n\nI'm sorry, I...well, usually, if I reverse engineer magical properties I can invert them. Clearly I don't understand this as well as I believed. More time and more research, I suppose. First that harpy and then this...then again, if a solution was easy, someone would have found one by now. I'll solve it, eventually.\n\nStill, you saved my life. I did manage to figure out what \"Blood of Legions\", it's actually rather intriguing as a more controlled form of fel corruption. One that, based on the properties I'm observing, is a much more controlled form of fel corruption. One that won't damage your mind and body...well, as much.\n\nTo be clear, I still don't suggest using this sort of power, or trusting my judgement on it considering...recent events. But I don't believe it's much use to my research, and I do owe you something at least, so the elixir is yours. You can use it how you wish. Just be careful."}
Q[24496]={d="占位符",dEN="placeholder",o="占位符",oEN="placeholder"}
Q[24497]={d="BRUCE",dEN="BRUCE",o="BRUCE",oEN="BRUCE"}
Q[24498]={d="他们把被俘的士兵赶到采石场做工了！\n\n杀死看守，释放他们，$g英雄:女英雄;。当我们面对天灾领主泰兰努斯时，需要他们的助力。",dEN="They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry! Kill their captors and set them free, hero, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",o="解救15名联盟奴隶，消灭熔炉领主加弗斯特。",oEN="Free 15 Alliance Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",c="你今天做的很好。随着士兵们被解救和熔炉入口的打开，不用多久我就可以协助大家一起打败天灾领主泰兰努斯以及通过这个肮脏的矿洞了。",cEN="You've done well this day. With many of the slaves freed and now with access to the forges, it will not be long before I have a strong force to aid in delivering us from Scourgelord Tyrannus and this foul pit."}
Q[24499]={d="我们人手严重不足，冒险进入堡垒风险极大，但这样的机会实在太少，不能错过。\n\n打通通往另一侧的道路，确保通往萨隆矿道的通路。我们必须守住它，才能把人员进一步送入堡垒。",dEN="I cannot thank you enough for coming. We're severely undermanned to be risking a venture into the citadel, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.\n\nI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the citadel.\n\nPlease hurry, <name>. We're counting on you.",o="消灭布隆亚姆和噬魂者，夺取萨隆矿坑的入口。",oEN="Kill Bronjahm and the Devourer of Souls to secure access to the Pit of Saron."}
Q[24500]={d="乌瑟尔知道该如何击败阿尔萨斯。很难相信，最有可能击败阿尔萨斯的地方恰恰就是在他王座前的阶梯上。如果阿尔萨斯倒下，谁又会戴上巫妖王的王冠？\n\n有许多问题还悬而未决，但你发现的答案对于击败阿尔萨斯也许会起到关键性的作用。你需要找到吉安娜，并逃过巫妖王的攻击。",dEN="Uther knew a great deal about how Arthas might be defeated. It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?\n\nMany questions remain, but the answers that you've uncovered may be critical to ensuring Arthas' defeat. You need to find Jaina and escape the Lich King while there's still time.",o="找到吉安娜·普罗德摩尔，并逃出映像大厅。",oEN="Find Lady Jaina Proudmoore and escape the Halls of Reflection",p="我们要把这个消息带给联盟，它可能是击败阿尔萨斯的关键。",pEN="We need to get this information to the Alliance! It may well be the key to Arthas' defeat.",c="<吉安娜微微地喘息。>\n\n难以相信我们还活着。追随过他是我最大的愚行，我犯过太多错误了。你呢……你宁愿鲁莽地选择为我断后，也不愿先逃走把消息传出去……但是……嗯……谢谢。你是个真正的英雄。\n\n有了乌瑟尔的指导，我们有希望打败阿尔萨斯。绝不能让今天的战士白白牺牲。",cEN="<Jaina is still catching her breath.>\n\nI can barely believe we're still alive. It was foolish of me to follow him. I've made that mistake too many times. And you... it was reckless of you to come after me instead of escaping with the information! But... well... thank you. You truly are a hero.\n\nWith Uther's guidance, we may stand a chance at defeating Arthas. All the lives lost today were not in vain."}
