e power and danger of fel blood.",p="你好，需要什么吗？",pEN="Hello, do you need something?",c="你找到样本了？那份清单在接触到邪能之血后我就放弃了，没想到真会有人去找这些东西……\n\n好吧，谢谢你。我大半辈子都在试图理解邪能腐化的特性，更重要的是，如何将它从我的族人身上彻底清除。也许我曾经找到过一种办法……好吧，那是一种我暂时无法再尝试的办法。我来这里，是希望此地邪能兽人更强烈的腐化能帮我更好地理解它。\n\n有了这些，也许我真能取得一些进展。",cEN="You found the samples? I'd abandoned that manifest after it was exposed to the fel blood, I didn't expect anyone to actually go looking for these...\n\nWell, thank you. I've spent most of my life trying to understand the properties of fel corruption, and more importantly, how to fully remove it from my people. I may have found a way once...well, it's not one I can try again for a while yet. I came here hoping that the more intense corruption of the fel orcs here might help me understand it better.\n\nWith these, maybe I can actually make some progress."}
Q[24502]={d="<name>……途经荣耀堡附近的旅人报告说，一座被称为狮鹫石的石头狮鹫雕像传出奇怪的声响。有人担心这个构造体可能被黑暗魔法附身，对城镇构成威胁。我们需要你与狮鹫石交战，在控制它的邪恶力量伤害荣耀堡之前将其阻止。",dEN="<name>...travelers passing near Honor Hold have reported strange noises emanating from a stone gryphon statue known as the Grypholith. There are concerns that this construct may be possessed by dark magic and could pose a threat to the town. We need you to engage the Grypholith in combat to stop whatever malevolent force controls it before it can harm Honor Hold.",o="调查狮鹫石雕像传出的奇怪声响。",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Grypholith statue.",c="你摧毁狮鹫石，立下了大功，<name>。无论附身那座雕像的是何种黑暗存在，它的力量都因你而破碎。请允许我为你保护荣耀堡的英勇之举给予奖赏。",cEN="You've done a great service destroying the Grypholith, <name>. Whatever dark presence had possessed that statue, its power is broken thanks to you. Please, allow me to reward your valor in protecting Honor Hold."}
Q[24503]={d="<name>……造访沙塔斯城的冒险者报告说，玛格汉岗哨附近一座被称为泰拉利斯的石头双足飞龙雕像传出奇怪的声响。有人担心这个构造体可能被不稳定的元素魔法附身，对我们的城市构成威胁。我们需要你调查这些报告，并消除任何潜在威胁。在你控制住此事后，回到沙塔斯向卡德加报告你的发现。",dEN="<name>...adventurers visiting Shattrath City have reported strange noises coming from a stone wyvern statue known as the Teralis around Mag'har Post. There are concerns that this construct may have become possessed by unstable elemental magic and could pose a threat to our city. We need you to investigate these reports and eliminate any potential threat. Once you have contained this issue, return to Khadgar in Shattrath to report your findings.",o="调查泰拉利斯雕像传出的奇怪声响。",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Teralis statue.",c="你阻止了玛格汉岗哨的威胁，立下了大功，<name>。无论附身那座雕像的是何种元素存在，它的力量都因你而破碎。请允许我为你保护沙塔斯的英勇之举给予奖赏。",cEN="You've done a great service preventing the threat at Mag'har post, <name>. Whatever elemental presence had possessed that statue, its power is broken thanks to you. Please, allow me to reward your valor in protecting Shattrath."}
Q[24504]={d="<name>……途经荣耀堡附近的旅人报告说，一座被称为狮鹫石的石头狮鹫雕像传出奇怪的声响。有人担心这个构造体可能被黑暗魔法附身，对城镇构成威胁。我们需要你与狮鹫石交战，在控制它的邪恶力量伤害荣耀堡之前将其阻止。",dEN="<name>...travelers passing near Honor Hold have reported strange noises emanating from a stone gryphon statue known as the Grypholith. There are concerns that this construct may be possessed by dark magic and could pose a threat to the town. We need you to engage the Grypholith in combat to stop whatever malevolent force controls it before it can harm Honor Hold.",o="调查狮鹫石雕像传出的奇怪声响。",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Grypholith statue."}
Q[24505]={d="<name>……造访沙塔斯城的冒险者报告说，玛格汉岗哨附近一座被称为泰拉利斯的石头双足飞龙雕像传出奇怪的声响。有人担心这个构造体可能被不稳定的元素魔法附身，对我们的城市构成威胁。我们需要你调查这些报告，并消除任何潜在威胁。在你控制住此事后，回到沙塔斯向卡德加报告你的发现。",dEN="<name>...adventurers visiting Shattrath City have reported strange noises coming from a stone wyvern statue known as the Teralis around Mag'har Post. There are concerns that this construct may have become possessed by unstable elemental magic and could pose a threat to our city. We need you to investigate these reports and eliminate any potential threat. Once you have contained this issue, return to Khadgar in Shattrath to report your findings.",o="调查泰拉利斯雕像传出的奇怪声响。",oEN="Investigate the strange noises coming from the Teralis statue."}
Q[24506]={d="！$C！快过来，我有话要跟你说！\n\n我的女王，希尔瓦娜斯·风行者女士，在冰冠堡垒的防御中发现了一处缺口。她提到那个地方叫\"灵魂洪炉\"。她离开前传话给我，让我派些凶猛的战士过去……我觉得你正合适。\n\n到洪炉入口处与她会合，$c。",dEN="<class>! Come close quickly, I must have a word!\n\nMy queen, the Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as \"The Forge of Souls.\" She sent word before she left for me to find fierce fighters to send her way. I think you'll do.\n\nGo to her within the entrance to the forge, <class>.",o="从冰冠堡垒一侧进入到灵魂洪炉，在那里找到希尔瓦娜斯·风行者女王。",oEN="Enter The Forge of Souls from the side of Icecrown Citadel and locate Lady Sylvanas Windrunner.",c="好。<name>，我知道你。你非常适合这些任务。\n\n我们得到了一个深入冰冠堡垒的难得机会，但若要避开阿尔萨斯的注意，我们必须迅速行动。",cEN="Good. <name>, I know of you. You'll be perfect for these tasks.\n\nWe've been afforded a rare chance to delve into Icecrown Citadel, but we must move quickly if we're to avoid Arthas' notice."}
Q[24507]={d="他们把被俘的士兵赶到采石场做工了。\n\n杀死看守，释放他们，$c，动作要快。当我们面对天灾领主泰兰努斯时，需要他们的助力。",dEN="They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry. Kill their captors and set them free, <class>, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",o="解救15名部落奴隶，消灭熔炉领主加弗斯特。",oEN="Free 15 Horde Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",c="你今天做的很好。随着士兵们被解救和熔炉入口的打开，不用多久我就可以协助大家一起打败天灾领主泰兰努斯以及通过这个肮脏的矿洞了。",cEN="You've done well this day. With many of the slaves freed and now with access to the forges, it will not be long before I have a strong force to aid in delivering us from Scourgelord Tyrannus and this foul pit."}
Q[24510]={d="！$C！快过来，我有话要跟你说！\n\n我的上司，吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士，在冰冠堡垒的防御中发现了一处缺口。她提到那个地方叫\"灵魂洪炉\"。她离开前传话给我，让我尽可能寻求助力……嗯，我希望能是你。\n\n请尽快到那里与她会合。",dEN="<class>! Come close quickly, I must have a word!\n\nMy patron, the Lady Jaina Proudmoore, has uncovered a hole in the defenses of Icecrown Citadel into a place she referred to as \"The Forge of Souls.\" She sent word before she left for me to find any help that I could... and, well, I was hoping that might be you.\n\nPlease, find her there as soon as you can.",o="从冰冠堡垒一侧进入到灵魂洪炉，在那里找到吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士。",oEN="Enter The Forge of Souls from the side of Icecrown Citadel and find Lady Jaina Proudmoore."}
Q[24511]={d="带着这么少的人手进入堡垒，往好里说也是冒险，但这样的机会实在太少，不能错过。\n\n打通通往另一侧的道路，确保通往萨隆矿道的通路。我们必须守住它，才能把人员进一步送入堡垒。",dEN="I'm glad we have someone capable to aid us in this. Delving into the citadel with so few is risky at best, but opportunities like this are too rare to pass up.\n\nI'm awaiting the arrival of champions from the coliseum, but if your reputation holds true, you should be more than equipped to fight through the forge yourself. Clear the way to the far side and secure the passage to the Pit of Saron. We will need to hold it to move our men further into the Citadel.\n\nBe quick about it, <name>. Time is short.",o="消灭布隆亚姆和噬魂者，夺取萨隆矿坑的入口。",oEN="Kill Bronjahm and the Devourer of Souls to secure access to the Pit of Saron.",c="干得好，<class>！\n\n萨隆矿道就在前方，如果我们的斥候所言不差，再往前就是倒影大厅。阿尔萨斯会在那里放松警惕，我们希望能在那儿找到他弱点的线索……以及一条迟来的复仇之路。",cEN="Well timed, <class>!\n\nThe Pit of Saron lies ahead, and if our scouts are correct, past that will be the Halls of Reflection. It is there that Arthas lets his guard down, and it is there that we hope to find a clue to his weakness... and a route to vengeance long overdue."}
Q[24522]={d="尽快将奎尔德拉带到太阳之井，$n。要相信乌瑟尔的话，他说过，当这把剑受到巫妖王邪恶力量的影响时，你不能彻底控制它。你必须转至奎尔丹纳斯岛，在那里，设法进入太阳之井，只有在那你才能净化这把剑。\n\n太阳之井的守卫不会轻易放行的，所以你必须找到哈杜伦·明翼，他会在那里巡视那些守卫。",dEN="Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, <name>. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.\n\nThe guardians of the Sunwell will not simply allow you to walk in, so you must find Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there.",o="在奎尔丹纳斯岛，太阳之井高地入口处同哈杜伦·明翼交谈。",oEN="Speak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.",p="什么风把你吹来了？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="允许你进入太阳之井？不可能！太阳之井对于我的人民来说是最神秘、最神圣、最重要之地。我们最近才在破碎残阳的帮助下重夺太阳之井。它可不是随随便便一个游客就能进的地方。",cEN="Admit you to the Sunwell? That's impossible! The Sunwell is the most sacred and important site of our people. We have only recently reclaimed it with the help of the Shattered Sun Offensive. It is not a place for tourists or travelers."}
Q[24535]={d="$n，如果你真的拥有奎尔德拉，我也许可以让你进入太阳之井。也许你知道这把剑的历史，知道萨洛瑞安·寻晨者曾经挥舞它对抗天灾军团，守卫太阳之井。他牺牲的地方就是今天的死亡之痕。正是因为他舍身血战，才为他的族人赢得了进行战争准备的时间。你可以在这座岛的死亡之痕南端找到他的遗迹。去那里看看，如果他的灵魂赐予你祝福，我就会让你进入太阳之井。",dEN="If you truly bear Quel'Delar, <name>, I might be able to admit you to the Sunwell. If you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell.",o="访问萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体，获得他的祝福，以使用奎尔德拉。",oEN="Visit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.",p="怎么样？你找到萨洛瑞安的遗体了吗？",pEN="Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?",c="我承认我真没想到萨洛瑞安的灵魂会认为你能胜任奎尔德拉的继承人，不过我相信他的选择。你可以进入太阳之井，但是我提醒你你作为我们最神圣之地的客人，你可要注意你的行为举止。",cEN="I confess that I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to recognize you as the heir to Quel'Delar, but I defer to his judgment. You may enter the Sunwell, but I remind you that you are a guest in our most sacred of precincts, and you should act accordingly."}
Q[24536]={d="瞧瞧这些家伙！热砂港打理节庆生意这么多年，突然之间，这帮人闯进了市场。他们不是热砂港的人，所以财团雇我来查个水落石出。这里有股怪味，而且不只是香水味。rnrn带上我带来的这个装置，去分析卫兵周围的香水云雾。我想知道他们在那种东西里加了什么。这可不自然。",dEN="Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.\n\nTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural.",o="使用滑栓的空气分析器测试6位带有浓郁香气的卫兵周围的空气，然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Use Snagglebolt's Air Analyzer to test the air around 6 heavily perfumed guards, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你分析过那股气息吗，孩子？",pEN="You analyze that reek yet, kid?",c="嘿谢谢，孩子。拿过来让我看看。\n\n<他从你手中拿走了设备，来回摆弄。>\n\n哦，这看起来可不太妙。",cEN="Hey, thanks, kid. Give it over, let's take a look.\n\n<He takes the device from you and fiddles with it.>\n\nOh, that ain't good."}
Q[24541]={d="我就知道他们没安好心！这里面有某种影响心智的化学化合物，但样本太小，我没法把它分离出来。我要真货。rnrn你可别直接过去买！我不想你给那些混蛋一个铜板。不，我要你从源头弄到手，低调一点。rnrn我会把你伪装成送包裹的。我看到城门外有一堆由他们打手看守的板条箱。跑过去，千万别停下，否则他们会抓住你！他们会扔给你一个箱子。把它带回来给我。",dEN="I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.\n\nDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.\n\nI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here.",o="当你 $g伪装成:伪装成; 送包裹的人时，前往奥格瑞玛城门外皇冠化学公司的板条箱堆，然后把你被扔过来的包裹带回来，交给奥格瑞玛的侦探斯纳普·钳栓。",oEN="While disguised as a package-runner, go to the Crown Chemical Company's stockpile outside the gates of Orgrimmar, then return the package they toss you to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgimmar.",p="他们怎么处理的？",pEN="Did they toss ya a crate to deliver?",c="你拿到了，嗯？干得好，小子。一流。看看我们这儿有什么。",cEN="You got it, huh? Good job, kid. Top notch. Let's see what we what we got here."}
Q[24545]={d="$r，我其实不该把这个任务交给你，也许这会导致你的毁灭。\n\n不要理会我的这些话了，听听我要你去完成的任务吧。我会为你提供足够的信息和资源帮助你完成这个任务。\n\n你必须返回霜之哀伤洞穴，取得圣光的复仇——那把被阿尔萨斯丢弃的锤子。用萨隆邪铁重新铸炼它，在它上面用巫妖王奴仆的酸性血液雕刻符文。它会成为我们实行计划的基础。",dEN="It is against my judgment that I present you this errand, <race>, as it will likely end in your undoing.\n\nIgnore my counsel and embark on the endeavor, and I shall provide you with the knowledge and resources to see it through.\n\nYou must return to Frostmourne Cavern and recover Light's Vengeance, Arthas' discarded hammer. Reforged with saronite and etched with the acidic blood of the Lich King's abominations, it will provide the foundation for our work.",o="将圣光的复仇、25块源生萨隆邪铁、腐面的酸性血液和烂肠的酸性血液放进冰冠堡垒大领主莫格莱尼的符文熔炉中。\n\n腐面的酸性血液和烂肠的酸性血液只能在25人模式的冰冠堡垒中获得。",oEN="Place Light's Vengeance, 25 Primordial Saronite, Rotface's Acidic Blood, and Festergut's Acidic Blood in Highlord Mograine's runeforge in Icecrown Citadel.\n\nRotface's Acidic Blood and Festergut's Acidic Blood may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting of Icecrown Citadel.",p="伴随着你的出现，熔炉里的火焰似乎烧的更凶残了……",pEN="As you draw near, the forge's flame seems to burn even more ravenously..."}
Q[24547]={d="暗影之锋是一名 $gun:个; $c 所能企求的最强武器之一。\n\n你对力量的渴望得到满足了吗，$r？\n\n<你感到莫格莱尼锐利的目光。>\n\n我想没有。那么，最后一次警告……\n\n你现在踏上了任务中最凶险的一段。收敛你的野心，因为若你的目的是不纯的，你的生命、你的灵魂，都将不复存在。\n\n你手中的武器不过是一具空壳，仅仅是它可能成为之物的影子。只有吞噬一千个灵魂，它真正的潜能才会被释放。",dEN="Shadow's Edge is among the greatest weapons a <class> could hope to obtain.\n\nIs your lust for power sated, <race>?\n\n<You feel Mograine's penetrating gaze.>\n\nI thought not. A final warning then...\n\nYou now embark on the most treacherous leg of your quest. Bridle your aspirations, for if your aims are impure then your life, your very soul, is forfeit.\n\nThe weapon you hold is but an empty husk, a mere shadow of what it may become. Only by devouring a thousand souls shall its true potential be unlocked.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼希望你用影锋在冰冠堡垒消灭1000个巫妖王的爪牙。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to use Shadow's Edge to slay 1000 of the Lich King's minions in Icecrown Citadel. Souls can be obtained in 10 or 25 person difficulty.",c="<大领主莫格莱尼沉默地注视你片刻。>\n\n看来你相当出色地经受住了这一阶段的考验，<race>。\n\n祈祷命运在你的征途中继续眷顾你吧……",cEN="<Highlord Mograine eyes you in silence for a moment.>\n\nYou seem to have endured this leg of your trial admirably, <race>.\n\nPray that fate continues to smile upon you in your endeavor..."}
Q[24548]={d="巫妖王的王座再一次成为了他的牢狱。它是基尔加丹亲手从扭曲的下层位面中雕刻出来的冰晶容器。制作它的唯一目的就是封锢耐奥祖的灵魂。\n\n当阿尔萨斯用霜之哀伤击中这块冰晶的时候，他就释放了耐奥祖的灵魂，并让这个充满仇恨的灵魂和他融为一体。而这次打击所迸出的冰封王座碎片也散落在冰冠堡垒各处。\n\n我需要用这些碎片封印你的剑刃中蕴含的力量。而这些碎片都在巫妖王最强大的仆人手中。",dEN="The Lich King's throne once served as his prison. Kil'jaeden himself crafted the vessel of icy crystals from the twisting nether, its sole purpose to hold Ner'zhul's vengeful spirit.\n\nWhen Arthas struck the crystal with Frostmourne, he released Ner'zhul's soul, allowing it to merge with his own. Splinters from that impact are now scattered throughout the citadel.\n\nI shall require those shards, held only by the Lich King's most powerful servants, to seal the power contained in your blade.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你收集50块影霜碎片。\n\n影霜碎片只能在25人英雄难度模式下获得。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to collect 50 Shadowfrost Shards.\n\nShadowfrost Shards may only be obtained in the 25 person difficulty setting.",c="<class>，这些应该够了。\n\n当暗影之锋被充分强化后与我交谈，我会尝试将它完成。",cEN="These should suffice, <class>.\n\nSpeak to me when Shadow's Edge has been thoroughly empowered and I will attempt its completion."}
Q[24549]={o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼想要你将影锋带给他。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to bring him Shadow's Edge.",c="恭喜，<class>。\n\n在难以逾越的险境中，你经受住了风暴。\n\n我相信你的奖赏将与你的信念相称……",cEN="Congratulations, <class>.\n\nAgainst insurmountable odds, you have weathered the storm.\n\nI trust that you shall find your reward proportionate to your conviction..."}
Q[24553]={d="我承认，我一直怀疑你不可能重铸奎尔德拉，也不相信萨洛瑞安的灵魂会赐予你祝福。你不可能明白，奎尔德拉的重生对于我们一族意味着什么。\n\n我会履行诺言，让你进入太阳之井。你将在那里找到银月的领导者。将这把剑浸入到太阳之井中。当这把剑恢复了力量的时候，如果你举起它，就像萨洛瑞安说的那样，它就会与你绑缚在一起。",dEN="I admit, I was skeptical that you had actually re-forged Quel'Delar and I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to reveal itself to you. You cannot understand what it means to me and to the rest of my people that Quel'Delar has been recovered.\n\nAs promised, I will admit you to the Sunwell and you will find the leaders of Silvermoon within. Carry the sword to the chamber of the Sunwell and immerse it. The blade will bond to you. When that happens, carry it to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你在太阳之井里发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened during your time in the Sunwell?",c="难以置信，<name>。你真的做到了！所有奎尔多雷都听说过萨洛瑞安·寻晨者和奎尔德拉，但从没人想过这把剑能被修复。",cEN="This is unbelievable, <name>. You've really done it! All of the quel'dorei have heard of Thalorien Dawnseeker and Quel'Delar, but no one ever thought the sword would be restored."}
Q[24554]={d="这把残破的剑柄也有过好日子。当它的剑刃还没有折断的时候，它应该是代表着高超铸造工艺的一件杰出作品。\n\n它上面的精致雕刻和奇异宝石表明这件武器可能属于一个非常强大的人。夺日者一定会对它感兴趣的。去找到他们在奎尔德拉之冢的代表人。他应该就在银色比武场的南边。",dEN="This battered old sword hilt has seen better days. Before the hilt was snapped from the blade, it must've been a magnificent example of the blacksmith's art.\n\nThe graceful symbols and exotic gemstones decorating the hilt suggest that the weapon may have belonged to a powerful person. Surely, the Sunreavers would be interested in hearing about the recovery of such an artifact. Seek out their representatives at Quel'Delar's Rest, to the south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",o="将残破的剑柄交给奎尔德拉之冢的麦雷昂·阳炎。他就在银色比武场的南边。",oEN="Bring the Battered Hilt to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你发现了什么？",pEN="What have you discovered?",c="<麦雷昂从你手中接过剑柄，仔细观察了它一会。>\n\n它来自堡垒里？它怎么会在那里？这东西肯定不是天灾军团能造出来的。\n\n这种质量的兵器只能由极少数的艾泽拉斯的生物制造。我们必须去问问他们，看看他们是否能认出它。",cEN="<Myralion takes the hilt from you and scrutinizes the artifact.>\n\nThis came from the citadel? What was it doing there? This blade is certainly not of Scourge manufacture.\n\nWeapons of this quality can only be crafted by a few of Azeroth's creatures. We will have to consult them and see if they can help us identify it."}
Q[24555]={d="肯定错不了——这把剑柄曾经是一件古老强大的武器。但具体情况我就不清楚了。我从没有见过或听说过有这种花纹标记的剑。但这不代表没有人认识它。\n\n克里奥斯塔兹，他更广为人知的名字是克拉苏斯。他一直都是奎尔多雷和肯瑞托的朋友，并拥有广博无边的知识学养。对此他一定知道些什么。到龙眠神殿的顶端，向他询问一下这件事。然后向达拉然夺日者圣殿的魔导师哈瑟尔报告。",dEN="There's no mistaking it - this hilt comes from a powerful, ancient weapon, but which one? I do not recognize these particular markings, but we haven't hit a dead end yet.\n\nKorialstrasz, better known as Krasus, has long been a friend to the quel'dorei and the Kirin Tor. With his vast knowledge and resources, he's certain to know something. Travel to the top of Wyrmrest Temple and seek his counsel, then report to Magister Hathorel inside Sunreaver's Sanctuary in Dalaran.",o="同龙眠神殿顶端的克拉苏斯交谈。",oEN="Speak to Krasus at the top of Wyrmrest Temple.",c="我们必须从银色盟约受众夺回那本书。没有来自克拉苏斯的那本书，我们就不能解开来自冰冠堡垒的那把剑的秘密，并且没法解封它的力量。",cEN="We must recover that book from the Silver Covenant. Without that book from Krasus, we stand little chance of solving the mystery of the sword in Icecrown or unlocking its power."}
Q[24556]={d="要让你进入银色领地，可比看上去要难。只有持有银色盟约外袍的人才被允许进入圣所。如果我们能弄到一件，剩下的交给一道简单的附魔就行。\n\n在命运丝线上方的阳台上，你会找到山迪·格洛斯格利姆。我过去帮过他几次，所以他欠我一个人情。他为城里形形色色的人洗衣服。也许他能想办法\"借\"你一件外袍用一阵子。",dEN="Getting you inside the Silver Enclave will be tougher than it appears. Only those who possess Silver Covenant tabards are permitted entry to sanctuary. If we can get our hands on one, a simple enchantment will do the rest of the work.\n\nOn the balcony above Threads of Fate, you'll find Shandy Glossgleam. I've helped him a few times in the past, so he owes me a favor. He handles laundry for a wide variety of people in the city. Maybe he can find a way to 'lend' you a tabard for a while.",o="从山迪·格罗斯那里取得“借来的战袍”。",oEN="Obtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam.",p="山迪有没有帮你弄到一件银色盟约战袍呢？",pEN="Was Shandy able to help you get a Silver Covenant tabard?",c="我就知道山迪能帮我们。我会对它施法让你穿上它。运气好的话，它的主人甚至都不知道我们用过——毕竟山迪也会帮我们处理掉一些痕迹的。",cEN="I knew Shandy would find a way to make it work. Let me get this enchanted and ready for you to use. With any luck, the tabard's owner won't even know it's missing and Shandy will cover the rest of our tracks."}
Q[24557]={d="我在达拉然下水道的一个线人发现一名银色盟约密探正在咒语和乌鸦旅店收集情报。银色盟约通常不会出现在那些下水道里。他们在那里一定有着某种不可告人的计划。\n\n到达拉然下水道去，找到那名银色盟约密探，把他处理掉，然后在他身上寻找一切有用的情报。也许我们能从他身上知道那部龙眠宝典的所在位置。我们绝不能让银色盟约的人把它带回到冰冠冰川去。",dEN="One of my contacts in the Underbelly caught sight of a Silver Covenant agent gathering information at the Cantrips and Crows Tavern. Silver Covenant members aren't normally found in the sewers, so they must be plotting something.\n\nGo into the Underbelly, find this Silver Covenant agent, and eliminate him. Search the body for any information that might give us a lead on the location of that tome from Wyrmrest. We can't let those simpering Silver Covenant weaklings get it back to Icecrown before we do.",o="取得银色盟约命令。",oEN="Capture the Silver Covenant Orders.",p="你从密探身上发现什么有用的信息了吗？",pEN="Did you find anything of use on that agent?",c="<法师哈瑟尔阅读缴获的命令。>\n\n你截获的那名特工本应在与银色领地内一位名叫奥术师泰拜林的人会面后，把龙眠神殿的典籍送到冰冠冰川。我们必须夺回那本书，<name>，而且在它离开这座城市之前我们只有一次机会。我们必须行动迅速。",cEN="<Magister Hathorel reads the captured orders.>\n\nThe agent you intercepted was supposed to deliver the Wyrmrest tome to Icecrown, after meeting with one Arcanist Tybalin inside the Silver Enclave. We have to reclaim that book, <name>, and we only have one chance before it leaves the city. We have to work quickly."}
Q[24558]={d="我们必须立刻将这本书交给麦雷昂·阳炎。你能帮我这个忙吗？你已经证明自己有足够的实力击败银色盟约，除了你以外，我不能信任其它人能够完成这个任务。\n\n带着这本书转至奎尔德拉之冢。它就在冰冠冰川银色比武场的南边。麦雷昂会等着你。如果他能鉴别出这把剑，我们就能以艾萨斯·夺日者的名义拥有它，让达拉然和联盟都明白，进攻巫妖王的冲锋将由我们来统率。",dEN="We must get this book to Myralion Sunblade. Would you bring it to him? I cannot rely on anyone else to transport the book and you have proven adept at evading the Silver Covenant's men.\n\nTake it with you to Quel'Delar's Rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds in Icecrown. Myralion will be waiting for you. If he can identify that blade, we may be able to claim it in the name of Aethas Sunreaver and show Dalaran and the Alliance that we will lead the charge against the Lich King.",o="将上古龙铸之刃交给奎尔德拉之冢的麦雷昂·阳炎。",oEN="Bring Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.",p="我们已经预料到你的归来，你拿的什么？",pEN="We've been expecting your return. What has kept you?",c="<Myralion acepta el pesado libro y empieza a hojearlo>\n\n剑刃上的那些符号似曾相识，如今也不难明白为什么了。这无疑是一把龙族之剑，赠予了某个凡人种族，但这是哪把剑，又怎么会流落到冰冠冰川？",cEN="<Myralion accepts the heavy book and begins leafing through it.>\n\nThose symbols on the blade seemed familiar and now there's little wonder why. This is certainly a dragon blade, gifted to one of the mortal races, but which blade is this, and how did it come to rest in Icecrown?"}
Q[24559]={d="我们不能让奎尔德拉就这样只是一堆耻辱的碎片。带上这把剑的残片和你发现的剑柄，到冰冠堡垒的萨隆矿坑去。\n\n巫妖王强迫许多奴隶在那里采掘熔炼萨隆邪铁矿石。我们要用萨隆邪铁重铸奎尔德拉。\n\n你必须取得注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的大锤，然后用它们在熔炉之主的铁砧上重铸这把剑。",dEN="We cannot allow Quel'Delar to remain broken and disgraced. Take the remnants of the sword, along with the battered hilt you discovered, and venture into the Pit of Saron within Icecrown Citadel.\n\nIn the pit, the Lich King uses slaves to mine, process, and transform saronite ore. This infused saronite is what we will use to rebuild Quel'Delar.\n\nYou must gather bars of infused saronite and capture the forgemaster's hammer, then bring them to the forgemaster's anvil and reforge the sword.",o="取得5块注能的萨隆邪铁锭和熔炉之主的巨锤，将它们和奎尔德拉的残片融为一体，制造出重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Obtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer, then combine them with the Remnants of Quel'Delar to create the Reforged Quel'Delar.",p="你已重铸奎尔德拉了吗？",pEN="Were you able to reconstruct Quel'Delar?",c="尽管鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔说我们没法重铸奎尔德拉，不过我们做到了！现在这把剑必须要完成淬火，我们要让她知道她的言行有多么愚蠢。",cEN="You have remade the blade of Quel'Delar in defiance of that Blood-Queen Lana'thel's pronouncement! Now, the blade must be tempered before we can show her the folly of her words."}
Q[24560]={d="破碎的奎尔德拉终于完整如初了，但如果不经过适当的锻打，你还不能使用它作战。它参差不齐的萨隆邪铁边缘仍然脆弱易碎。\n\n你可以在冰冠堡垒深处的灵魂洪炉对它进行深度锻造。把奎尔德拉带到噬魂者的住所去，找到那里的坩埚。将这把剑放进坩埚里，对它进行锻造，然后再回来见我。我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="At last, the pieces of Quel'Delar are rejoined and the blade is whole, but it cannot see battle until you have tempered it. That jagged saronite edge is brittle and will shatter the moment it strikes anything.\n\nDeep in Icecrown Citadel's Forge of Souls is a place where the blade can safely be tempered. Take Quel'Delar with you to the abode of the Devourer of Souls and look for the crucible. Plunge the blade into the crucible to temper it and bring it back to me. I'll be waiting in The Frozen Halls.",o="在灵魂坩锅锻造已经重铸的奎尔德拉。",oEN="Temper the Re-forged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls.",p="它在被重铸之前无法发挥出任何作用。",pEN="Until the sword is tempered, it will be useless.",c="重铸这把剑需要修复，这是怎么回事？",cEN="Tempering the sword should've restored the blade. Why hasn't it worked?"}
Q[24561]={d="你已经重铸了这把剑，并对它进行了锻造，但它仍然只是静静地躺在剑鞘里，丝毫没有显示出它应有的力量。你说这把剑在吸引你，就好象它拥有自己的意志？\n\n你敢把它带到它想去的地方吗？这把剑不应该如此沉默，但如果你不把它带去那个地方，也许我们将永远不知道这是为什么。把它带进冰冠堡垒的映像大厅。在那里一定要万分小心！我会在冰封大殿等你。",dEN="You have re-forged and tempered the sword, yet it sits quietly in its sheath, little different from a mundane blade. You say the sword pulls you, as though it possesses a will?\n\nDare you bring it where it wishes to go? It is not right that the sword should be this silent and this insistent, yet I fear that if you do not take the sword to its destination, we will never learn why. Bear it with you to Icecrown Citadel's Halls of Reflection, but be on your guard. I will wait for you in The Frozen Halls.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉带到映像大厅里面的剑冢去。",oEN="Bring Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.",p="映像大厅里发生什么事了？",pEN="What happened inside the Halls of Reflection?",c="邪恶怎能在这把剑中扎根？若不是证据就在我眼前，我绝不会认为这是可能的。如果龙族最伟大的造物都能被腐化并反过来对付他们，一把普通的剑又为何不能？\n\n我相信乌瑟尔是对的。你必须尽快听从他的忠告，<name>。",cEN="How can evil take root in such a sword? I would not have thought it possible if the evidence wasn't here before my eyes. If the greatest of dragonkind's creations could be corrupted and turned against them, why not a mere sword?\n\nI believe Uther is right. You must heed his advice quickly, <name>."}
Q[24562]={d="尽快将奎尔德拉带到太阳之井，$n。要相信乌瑟尔的话，他说过，当这把剑受到巫妖王邪恶力量的影响时，你不能彻底控制它。你必须转至奎尔丹纳斯岛，在那里，设法进入太阳之井，只有在那你才能净化这把剑。\n\n太阳之井的守卫会阻拦你转至太阳井高地，所以你必须找到哈杜伦·明翼，他会在那里巡视那些守卫。",dEN="Take Quel'Delar to the Sunwell as quickly as possible, <name>. Trust in Uther's words when he says that you will not always be able to control the blade while it is subject to the evil of the Lich King's influence. You must travel to the Isle of Quel'Danas, and there, seek entry to the Sunwell itself, where you can cleanse the sword.\n\nThe guardians will try to stop you from entering the Sunwell Plateau, but make yourself known to Halduron Brightwing, who will be inspecting the guards there.",o="在奎尔丹纳斯岛，太阳之井高地入口处同哈杜伦·明翼交谈。",oEN="Speak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.",p="你怎么来了？",pEN="What brings you here?",c="我希望你明白，我不能就这么放你进太阳之井，<name>。这是辛多雷所知最神圣的地方，而我们重获对它的控制还没多久。\n\n你要用奎尔德拉的传说点燃我们族人的希望？没有证据证明你的说法属实，我看不出有什么理由相信你。",cEN="I hope you understand that I can't just admit you to the Sunwell, <name>. This is the most sacred place known to the sin'dorei and we have only recently regained control over it.\n\nYou would raise the hopes of our people with tales of Quel'Delar? Without proof of the truth of your claims, I see no reason to take you at your word."}
Q[24563]={d="你就是与麦雷昂·阳炎合作的 $gel:那个人:那个人;，对吧？我知道一个能检验这把剑的办法。\n\n如果你了解这把剑的历史，就会记得它由萨洛瑞安·寻晨者在抵御天灾、保卫太阳之井时持有。他倒在了如今被称为死亡之痕的地方，为部下争取准备时间。你会在本岛死亡之痕南端附近找到他的遗骸。去拜访那里，若他的灵魂赐予你祝福，我就允许你进入太阳之井。",dEN="You are the one working with Myralion Sunblaze, arent you? I know of a way we can test the sword.\n\nIf you know the blade's history, you recall that it was borne by Thalorien Dawnseeker in defense of the Sunwell against the Scourge. He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations. You will find his remains near the southern end of the Dead Scar on this isle. Visit them, and if his spirit gives you its blessing, I will allow you to enter the Sunwell.",o="访问萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的遗体，获得他的祝福，以使用奎尔德拉。",oEN="Visit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.",p="你去过萨洛瑞安为保卫太阳之井而倒下的地方了吗？",pEN="Did you visit the ground where Thalorien fell defending the Sunwell?",c="你真的带着奎尔德拉。这对整个奎尔萨拉斯和所有辛多雷来说都是伟大的一天。我准许你进入太阳之井，完成这把剑的修复。昂起头来，<name>。银月之子们已经梦想这一天很多年了。",cEN="You truly do carry Quel'Delar. This is a great day for all of Quel'Thalas and the sin'dorei. You have my leave to enter the Sunwell and finish the sword's restoration. Keep your head high, <name>. The children of Silvermoon have dreamt of this day for years."}
Q[24564]={d="太阳之井与奎尔德拉流放生涯的终点在等着你，$n。\n\n在里面你会见到奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆和大法师罗曼斯。要小心他们，别让他们把你卷入政治阴谋。\n\n专注于你的任务。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。将重塑后的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井，完成它的修复。之后，把剑展示给奎尔德拉之憩的麦雷昂·阳炎。",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Afterward, show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="太阳之井平台里发生了什么事？",pEN="What happened inside the Sunwell?",c="我眼前真的是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器吗？这对夺日者和所有辛多雷来说都是美妙的一天！",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24576]={d="<你向洛卡讲述为什么要追查斯内维尔。洛卡的脸上露出厌恶的表情。>\n\n你是说，我们一直被一名炼金师的法术控制着？真是不能相信，我竟然会蒙受这样的欺骗！如果我抓住那个奸诈的小地精，我一定会将它撕碎！\n\n如果他已经完成了使命，那么他现在应该正赶往奥格瑞玛大门东边的飞艇塔！$n，绝对不能让他登上飞艇逃跑！\n\n赶快到飞艇塔去！",dEN="<Roka listens with disgust as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>\n\nYou mean I've been under the spell of an alchemist all this time? I can't believe I fell for that fraud! If I ever get my hands on that conniving little goblin, I'll tear him apart!\n\nIf he's finished his errands, he's on his way down to the zeppelin tower east of Orgrimmar's gates! Whatever you do, <name>, you can't let him board that zeppelin and get away with all this!\n\nHurry to the zeppelin tower before you miss him!",o="转至奥格瑞玛城外的飞艇塔，向斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特询问关于供给物资的事情。然后带着他给你的证据回去。",oEN="Go to the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar and question Snivel Rustrocket about the supplies. Return with any evidence he gives you.",p="你找到那家伙了吗，他是不是在石头下面瑟瑟发抖呢？",pEN="Did you find the guy, or did he crawl under a rock?",c="<name>，你拿到他的账本了吗？真的？太好了。这里头大概有不少有用的情报。",cEN="You got his ledger? Really? That's great, <name>. There's probably loads of good information in here."}
Q[24579]={d="黑岩守护者萨塔里奥正在看守着暮光巨龙的卵。他就在龙眠神殿下方龙神之厅的黑曜石圣殿里。\n\n六人议会已经决定要消灭萨塔里奥！",dEN="Sartharion, the Onyx Guardian, watches over the eggs of the Twilight Dragonflight. He rests within the Obsidian Sanctum in the Chamber of the Aspects underneath Wyrmrest Temple.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Sartharion must die!",o="消灭萨塔里奥。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Sartharion.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="萨塔里奥已死，死亡之翼与希奈丝特拉的计划想必已被拖延。",cEN="With Sartharion slain, surely Deathwing and Sinestra's plans are now stalled."}
Q[24580]={d="阿努布雷坎曾经是尼拉布帝国强大的蜘蛛君王。而现在，巫妖王夺取了他的帝国，并将那里变成亡灵之地。\n\n现在阿努布雷坎变成了一个坟墓君王，盘踞在纳克萨玛斯的蜘蛛区，为克尔苏加德经营着各种阴谋。\n\n六人议会已经做出决定，必须消灭阿努布雷坎。",dEN="Anub'Rekhan, once-mighty Spider Lord of the nerubian empire, has been taken by the Lich King and corrupted into a state of undeath.\n\nNow a crypt lord, he sits in his parlor in the Arachnid Quarter of Naxxramas, spinning strategies for Kel'Thuzad.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Anub'Rekhan must die!",o="消灭阿努布雷坎。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度或者任何规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Anub'Rekhan.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="你成功的消息已先你一步传来，<class>。阿努布雷坎不复存在。你帮了他大忙，<name>。",cEN="Word of your success precedes you, <class>. Anub'Rekhan is no more. You did him a great service, <name>."}
Q[24581]={d="药剂师诺斯是一个懦夫和叛徒！他所犯下的罪行仅次于巫妖王！\n\n赶快到纳克萨玛斯去。他就在瘟疫区，躲在他的亡灵爪牙后面。\n\n一定要消灭他！这是六人议会做出的决定！",dEN="Noth the Plaguebringer, traitor and coward! Second only to the Lich King himself for the number of souls that have been Scourged!\n\nMake haste to Naxxramas. You will find him within the Plague Quarter hiding behind his undead minions.\n\nDestroy him! The Council of Six has decreed that Noth must die!",o="消灭药剂师诺斯。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Noth the Plaguebringer.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="我们身上又少了一根刺。诺斯被摧毁后，天灾在改良亡灵制造手段方面的研究将戛然而止。",cEN="That's one less thorn in our side. With Noth destroyed, Scourge research into refining the means of creating the undead will grind to a halt."}
Q[24582]={d="教官拉苏维奥斯昂首阔步地走在纳克萨玛斯军事区，一副自鸣得意的样子。据说，只有他亲自训练出来的死亡骑士才可能有机会抵挡住他的剑威。\n\n你和你的队员将去推翻这一说法。\n\n六人议会已经下令除掉拉苏维奥斯！",dEN="Instructor Razuvious smugly struts about the Military Quarter of Naxxramas. It is said that only a death knight personally trained by him could possibly even withstand the prowess of his blade.\n\nYou and your group are going to prove everyone wrong.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Razuvious must die!",o="消灭教官拉苏维奥斯。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Instructor Razuvious.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="干得好，<class>。拉苏维奥斯一死，纳克萨玛斯的天灾军事指挥便陷入混乱。",cEN="Well done, <class>. The Scourge military command out of Naxxramas has been thrown into disarray by Razuvious's demise."}
Q[24583]={d="所谓\"战争化身\"帕奇维克是终极的憎恶。它还在龙眠荒野大量消耗我们的兵力。\n\n我要你召集同伴，进入纳克萨玛斯的构造区。把这个构造体拆掉。\n\n六人议会已下令：帕奇维克必须死！",dEN="The so-called \"avatar of war\", Patchwerk is the ultimate abomination. It is also taking a heavy toll upon on our forces in the Dragonblight.\n\nI want you to assemble your companions and enter the Construct Quarter of Naxxramas. Disassemble the construct.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Patchwerk must die!",o="消灭帕奇维克。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Patchwerk.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="得知帕奇维克不复存在，各地的孩子都能睡得更安稳了。",cEN="Children everywhere will sleep easier knowing that Patchwerk is no more."}
Q[24584]={d="我们的资源相当紧张。织法者玛里苟斯正在将这个世界的全部魔法力量吸干，灌入永恒之眼里。如果没有了魔法，我们只有死路一条。\n\n$C，魔枢战争必须结束。六人议会已经做出决定，玛里苟斯必须被消灭！",dEN="Our resources are strained. Malygos, the Spell-Weaver, is draining all of the magic out of the world, consolidating it in the Eye of Eternity. Without magic, we are doomed.\n\n<class>, the Nexus War must be brought to an end. The Council of Six has decreed that Malygos must die!",o="消灭玛里苟斯。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Malygos.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="玛里苟斯被击败后，魔枢战争应该很快就会结束。你赢得了肯瑞托的感激，<name>。",cEN="With Malygos defeated, the Nexus War should come to a swift conclusion. You have the gratitude of the Kirin Tor, <name>."}
Q[24585]={d="在练兵场中坐落着奥杜尔的第一道防线：烈焰巨兽。\n\n肯瑞托得到的情报表明，这些守护者制造的机器即将被送往一处秘密地方，它们将对艾泽拉斯的生灵造成灾难性的破坏。\n\n必须阻止这一切的发生。六人议会已经宣布了烈焰巨兽必须死！",dEN="Within the Formation Grounds sits Ulduar's first line of defense: Flame Leviathan.\n\nThe Kirin Tor have been provided with information suggesting that this Keeper-created machine is soon to be transported to an undisclosed location and let loose to wreak havoc upon the mortals of Azeroth.\n\nThis must not come to pass. The Council of Six has decreed that Flame Leviathan must die!",o="消灭烈焰巨兽。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度或规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Flame Leviathan.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="我对通过使用这些技术制造的怪兽一向感到惊奇。",cEN="I never cease to be amazed by the horrors that can be created through the use of technology."}
Q[24586]={d="锋鳞通常都待在奥杜尔巨人熔炉附近她的巢穴中。但最近，她经常出现在那片巨型建筑群以外横行肆虐。\n\n虽然这头母龙有自己悲伤的故事，但她现在对于整个诺森德都是一个严重的威胁。六人议会已经下达命令，锋鳞必须被消灭！",dEN="Razorscale normally keeps to her aerie near the Colossal Forge in Ulduar. Of late, however, she has been spotted reigning fire down upon lands outside of the titan complex.\n\nThough the broodmother's is a sad tale, she poses an imminent threat to all of Northrend. The Council of Six has decreed that Razorscale must die!",o="消灭锋鳞。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Razorscale.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="维拉努斯终于可以安息了。",cEN="Now Veranus can finally rest in peace."}
Q[24587]={d="巨大的火焰巨人——掌炉者伊格尼斯在奥杜尔的巨人熔炉奋力工作。依照洛肯的命令，伊格尼斯打造了充斥着他们那可怕力量的武器。\n\n六人议会已下令除掉伊格尼斯！",dEN="The great fire giant, Ignis the Furnace Master toils away inside of Ulduar's Colossal Forge. Under orders from Loken, Ignis creates weapons that are terrifying in their power.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Ignis must die!",o="消灭掌炉者伊格尼斯。\n\n这个任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Ignis the Furnace Master.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="我只希望你当时没碰到太多他的钢铁爪牙吧。",cEN="I trust that you did not have to face too many of his iron construct assistants?"}
Q[24588]={d="米米尔隆的怪异制造物还有一个，实际上，XT-002拆解者一直认为自己是米米尔隆的儿子。不要被它伪装的天真所欺骗。那可是一部致命的机器！\n\n你会在Ulduar's Scrapyard找到那部拆解者。六人议会已经决定，必须消灭XT-002拆解者！",dEN="Yet another strange construct of Mimiron, the XT-002 Deconstructor actually thinks that it is the keeper's son. Do not be fooled by its feigned innocence. It is a deadly machine!\n\nYou will find the Deconstructor within Ulduar's Scrapyard. The Council of Six has decreed that XT-002 Deconstructor must die!",o="消灭XT-002拆解者。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill XT-002 Deconstructor.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="奥杜尔的最大弱点就是它的主人盲目地信任那些发明能很好地保护他。",cEN="The greatest weakness of Ulduar is its masters' blind faith in their inventions to protect it."}
Q[24589]={d="大法师提迈尔预见到了一件可怕的事情。一名愚蠢的侏儒术士将无意中召唤一个燃烧军团的艾瑞达君主进入到十字军的试炼之中。\n\n在这件事发生的时候，你必须赶到，$c。如果加拉克苏斯大王逃脱了，他就会打开传送门，让燃烧军团再一次涌入我们的世界。\n\n六人议会已经做出决定，必须消灭加拉克苏斯大王！",dEN="Archmage Timear has foreseen a horrible event, which is about to transpire. A foolish gnome warlock is about to accidentally summon an Eredar lord of the Burning Legion into the middle of the Trial of the Crusader.\n\nYou must be there when it happens, <class>. If Lord Jaraxxus escapes, he will open a portal and the Burning Legion will spill forth into our world once more.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Jaraxxus must die!",o="消灭加拉克苏斯大王。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Lord Jaraxxus.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="艾泽拉斯的所有人民都应该庆幸大法师提迈尔预见了艾瑞达领主的到来，而你也及时赶到击败了他。",cEN="All of Azeroth is fortunate that Timear foresaw the Eredar lord's arrival and that you were there in time to slay him."}
Q[24590]={d="玛洛加尔领主是冰冠尖塔内部的冰封王座守卫。巫妖王用一千名冒险者的骨殖将他拼凑而成，并让他能够操纵寒冰王座本身的力量。\n\n如果不消灭这头怪物，我们就绝无可能占领冰冠堡垒。\n\n六人议会已经决定将他彻底消灭！",dEN="Lord Marrowgar is the guardian of the Frozen Throne within the Spire Chamber. Pieced together by the Lich King from the bones of a thousand vanquished adventurers, Marrowgar wields the power of the throne itself.\n\nWithout the destruction of this bone wraith, there is no hope of taking Icecrown Citadel.\n\nThe Council of Six has decreed that Lord Marrowgar must die!",o="消灭玛洛加尔领主ar。\n\n这一任务可以在任何难度和规模的团队副本中完成。",oEN="Kill Lord Marrowgar.\n\nThis quest can be completed with any difficulty or size raid.",c="多亏有你，现在冰封王座没有了守门人。我们与巫妖王战斗的胜算又多了几分。",cEN="The Frozen Throne is without its chief guardian thanks to you. Our attacks upon the Lich King's forces will be all the more successful now."}
Q[24594]={d="$n，你的面前就是太阳之井和奎尔德拉流亡的终点。\n\n你会在太阳之井中找到奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆和大法师罗曼斯。一定要对他们保持警惕，不要掉进他们的政治陷阱中。\n\n但你主要的精力必须集中在你的任务上。当你准备进入太阳之井高地时，就和一名太阳之井守卫谈谈。将新的奎尔德拉放进太阳之井中，完成这把神剑的重生。如果你举起它，就像萨洛瑞安说的那样，它就会与你绑缚在一起。",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell to enter the Sunwell Plateau. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the restoration. Show the blade to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest once it is restored.",o="将腐化的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井回来了？",pEN="You have returned from the Sunwell?",c="我简直不敢相信我的眼睛，这居然是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器？今天对于夺日者来说，对所有的辛多雷来说简直是不可思议的一天！",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24595]={d="我承认，我一直怀疑你不可能重铸奎尔德拉，也不相信萨洛瑞安的灵魂会赐予你祝福。你不可能明白，奎尔德拉的重生对于我们一族意味着什么。\n\n我会履行诺言，让你进入太阳之井。你将在那里找到银月的领导者。将这把剑浸入到太阳之井中。你最好将这件武器托付给银色十字军，它将成为反抗巫妖王的力量团结一致的标志。",dEN="I admit, I was skeptical that you had actually re-forged Quel'Delar and I did not expect Thalorien's spirit to reveal itself to you. You cannot understand what it means to my people that Quel'Delar has been recovered.\n\nAs promised, I will admit you to the Sunwell and you will find the leaders of Silvermoon within. Carry the sword to the chamber of the Sunwell and immerse it. Once the blade is restored, return with it to Caladis Brightspear at Quel'Delar's Rest.",o="将腐化的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="告诉我太阳之井里发生了什么，<name>。",pEN="Tell me of what happened in the Sunwell, <name>.",c="难以置信，<name>。你真的做到了！所有奎尔多雷都听说过萨洛瑞安·寻晨者和奎尔德拉，但从没人想过这把剑能被修复。",cEN="This is unbelievable, <name>. You've really done it! All of the quel'dorei have heard of Thalorien Dawnseeker and Quel'Delar, but no one ever thought the sword would be restored."}
Q[24596]={d="太阳之井与奎尔德拉流放生涯的终点在等着你，$n。\n\n在里面你会见到奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆和大法师罗曼斯。要小心他们，别让他们把你卷入政治阴谋。\n\n专注于你的任务。将重塑后的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井，完成它的修复，然后与奎尔德拉之憩的麦雷昂·阳炎交谈。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete the its restoration, then speak with Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",o="将腐化的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井平台带回了什么消息？",pEN="What happened during your visit to the Sunwell?",c="我眼前真的是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器吗？这对夺日者和所有辛多雷来说都是美妙的一天！",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24597]={d="你想要为暴风城之王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the king of Stormwind? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="将一枚可爱的护符手镯赠予暴风城的安度因·乌瑞恩王子。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Prince Anduin Wrynn in Stormwind."}
Q[24598]={d="太阳之井与奎尔德拉流放生涯的终点在等着你，$n。\n\n在里面你会见到奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王洛瑟玛·塞隆和大法师罗曼斯。要小心他们，别让他们把你卷入政治阴谋。\n\n专注于你的任务。将重塑后的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井，完成它的修复，然后把它展示给奎尔德拉之憩的麦雷昂·阳炎。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",dEN="The Sunwell and the end of Quel'Delar's exile await, <name>.\n\nYou will find Lor'themar Theron, the regent of Quel'Thalas, and Grand Magister Rommath standing within. Be wary of them and do not allow them to entrap you in their political scheming.\n\nInstead, remain focused on your task here. Immerse the reformed Quel'Delar in the Sunwell to complete its restoration, then show it to Myralio Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",o="将淬火的奎尔德拉浸入太阳之井。当你 $g准备好:准备好; 进入太阳之井高地时，与太阳之井守卫交谈。",oEN="Immerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau.",p="你从太阳之井平台带回了什么消息？",pEN="What news do you bring from the Sunwell?",c="我眼前真的是萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器吗？这对夺日者和所有辛多雷来说都是美妙的一天！",cEN="Am I truly laying my eyes upon the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker? This is a wondrous day for the Sunreavers and for all sin'dorei!"}
Q[24605]={d="听好了，你这航海的老魂灵！这一带的流言说，纳尔克在藏宝海湾开了自己的地盘，教授驯鸟的精妙技艺。像你这样经验丰富的冒险者，想必渴望让这些威严的翼伴之一加入你的行列。",dEN="Listen up, ye sea-faring soul! The whispers 'round these parts tell tales of Narkk establishin' his own haunt in Booty Bay, teachin' the fine art of bird-handlin'. A seasoned adventurer like yerself surely yearns to have one of these majestic winged companions joinin' yer ranks.",o="前往藏宝海湾拜访纳尔克",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="听好了，冒险者！谨慎前行，明智选择，因为只有一位翼伴能在这场伟大旅程中陪伴你。",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24606]={d="听好了，你这航海的老魂灵！这一带的流言说，纳尔克在藏宝海湾开了自己的地盘，教授驯鸟的精妙技艺。像你这样经验丰富的冒险者，想必渴望让这些威严的翼伴之一加入你的行列。",dEN="Listen up, ye sea-faring soul! The whispers 'round these parts tell tales of Narkk establishin' his own haunt in Booty Bay, teachin' the fine art of bird-handlin'. A seasoned adventurer like yerself surely yearns to have one of these majestic winged companions joinin' yer ranks.",o="前往藏宝海湾拜访纳尔克",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="听好了，冒险者！谨慎前行，明智选择，因为只有一位翼伴能在这场伟大旅程中陪伴你。",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24607]={d="我听说纳尔克在藏宝海湾扩大了他的供应，要孵化这颗神秘的蛋！",dEN="Word has reached me that the Narkk has expanded his offerings in Booty Bay to unhatch this mysterious egg!",o="前往藏宝海湾拜访纳尔克",oEN="Visit Narkk in Booty Bay",c="听好了，冒险者！谨慎前行，明智选择，因为只有一位翼伴能在这场伟大旅程中陪伴你。",cEN="Listen close, adventurer! Tread carefully and pick wisely, for only one winged ally can join ye on this grand voyage."}
Q[24609]={d="你想要为铁炉堡国王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Lord of Ironforge? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向铁炉堡的国王麦格尼·铜须献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge.",p="你准备好可爱的护符手镯了吗？等你有了配得上国王的礼物再回来。",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the King.",c="多么贴心！一枚可爱的护符手镯。\n\n你慷慨的礼物让所有以铁炉堡为家的人都精神一振。",cEN="How thoughtful! A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nYour generous gift has brightened the spirits of all who call Ironforge home."}
Q[24610]={d="你想要为艾露恩的高阶祭司制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信她一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the High Priestess of Elune? I'm sure she'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向达纳苏斯的泰兰德·语风献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",p="你准备好可爱的护符手镯了吗？等你有了配得上高阶女祭司的礼物再回来。",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the High Priestess.",c="多么贴心！一枚可爱的护符手镯。\n\n艾露恩眷顾那些与他人分享善意的人。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="How thoughtful! A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nElune smiles upon those who share their kindness with others. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[24611]={d="你想要为埃索达先知制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Prophet of the Exodar? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向埃索达的先知维伦献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Prophet Velen in the Exodar."}
Q[24612]={d="你想要为酋长制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Warchief? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向奥格瑞玛的萨尔献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",p="你准备好可爱的护符手镯了吗？等你有了配得上大酋长的礼物再回来。",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the Warchief.",c="礼物？给我的？\n\n你的举动为部落增光，<name>。在这艰难的时代，这样的善意之举让我们想起自己为何而战。",cEN="A gift? For me?\n\nYour gesture honors the Horde, <name>. In these troubled times, such acts of goodwill remind us of what we fight to protect."}
Q[24613]={d="你想要为黑暗女王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信她一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Banshee Queen? I'm sure she'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向幽暗城中的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者女王献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Lady Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity.",p="你准备好可爱的护符手镯了吗？等你有了配得上黑暗女士的礼物再回来。",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the Dark Lady.",c="多么……出乎意料。一枚可爱的护符手镯。\n\n我想即便是女妖之王也能欣赏这种……感情之举。别养成习惯。",cEN="How... unexpected. A Lovely Charm Bracelet.\n\nI suppose even the Banshee Queen can appreciate a gesture of... sentiment. Do not make a habit of it."}
Q[24614]={d="你想要为大酋长制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the High Chieftain? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向雷霆崖的凯恩·血蹄酋长献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="你准备好可爱的护符手镯了吗？等你有了配得上大酋长的礼物再回来。",pEN="Have you prepared the Lovely Charm Bracelet? Return when you have a gift worthy of the High Chieftain.",c="发自内心的礼物比任何财宝都珍贵，年轻的 <class>。大地母亲为你的善意而微笑。",cEN="A gift from the heart is worth more than any treasure, young <class>. The Earth Mother smiles upon your kindness."}
Q[24615]={d="你想要为奎尔萨拉斯的摄政王制作一款可爱的情人符手镯吗？我相信他一定会非常喜欢这样的礼物。\n\n你已经有可爱的情人符工具箱了吗？",dEN="Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Regent Lord of Quel'Thalas? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.\n\nDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?",o="向银月城的洛瑟玛·塞隆献上一件可爱的情人符手镯。",oEN="Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City."}
Q[24629]={d="你看起来 $g是个十足的实干家:是个十足的实干家;，$c。我们何不来个双赢的小方案？\n\n皇冠公司想向尽可能多的潜在客户提供我们最新节日主题产品的样品。帮我们传播爱意，我们就给你一些皇冠精品商品的折扣！\n\n你的时间，我们的钱，$g朋友:朋友;。你觉得怎么样？",dEN="You look like a real go-getter, <class>. How about we work out a little win-win scenario?\n\nCrown's looking to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as possible. Help us share the love, and we'll give you discounts on some great Crown merchandise!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. What do you say?",o="用皇冠古龙水瓶向10个人喷洒古龙水。",oEN="Spray 10 people with the Crown Perfume Sprayer.",p="香水可不会自动喷，你懂吧？\n\n继续吧！",pEN="That perfume's not going to spray itself, you know.\n\nGet going!",c="干得好，<name>！既然人们有机会体验皇冠香水的奇妙，他们一定会争相购买。\n\n这是感谢你帮忙的一点心意。",cEN="Great work, <name>! People will come running to buy Crown perfumes now that they've had a chance to sample their wonders.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24635]={d="你看起来 $g是个有事业心的人:是个有事业心的人;，$c。我们做笔交易如何？\n\n皇冠公司想向尽可能多的潜在客户提供我们最新节日主题产品的样品。帮我们传播爱意，同时赢取一些绝妙的皇冠商品！\n\n你的时间，我们的钱，$g朋友:朋友;。你怎么看？",dEN="You seem the enterprising sort, <class>. How about we make a little deal?\n\nCrown wants to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as we can. Help us share the love while earning some fantastic Crown merchandise!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. What do you think?",o="用皇冠古龙水瓶向10个人喷洒古龙水。",oEN="Spray 10 people with the Crown Cologne Sprayer.",p="香水可不会自动喷，你懂吧？\n\n继续吧！",pEN="The cologne isn't going to give itself out, you know.\n\nGet spraying!",c="干得好，<name>！既然人们有机会试用，他们一定会成箱购买皇冠古龙水。\n\n这是感谢你帮忙的一点心意。",cEN="Nice work, <name>! People will be buying Crown colognes by the crate-load now that they've had a chance to try them.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24636]={d="看得出你很有眼光，$c。我们何不一起赚点小钱？\n\n皇冠公司需要向城里每一位潜在客户推广我们最新节日主题产品的样品。帮我们传播爱意，我们也会与你分享一些绝妙的皇冠商品！\n\n你的时间，我们的钱，$g朋友:朋友;。成交吗？",dEN="I can see you've got an eye for opportunity, <class>. What do you say we make a little coin together?\n\nCrown needs to push samples of our latest holiday-themed products to every potential customer in the city. Help us share the love, and we'll share some of that amazing Crown merchandise with you!\n\nYour time, our money, friend. We got a deal?",o="将皇冠巧克力样品抛掷给10个人。",oEN="Toss 10 people samples from the Crown Chocolate Sampler.",p="巧克力可不会自动分给人们的。\n\n你需要继续工作！",pEN="You know, those chocolates aren't going to fling themselves at people.\n\nYou need to get to work!",c="干得太棒了，<name>！既然人们有机会品尝那些甜美浪漫的美味，他们一定会争相抢购皇冠巧克力。\n\n这是感谢你帮忙的一点心意。",cEN="Lovely work, <name>! People will be tripping over one another to get Crown chocolates now that they've had a chance to taste those sweet, romantic treats.\n\nHere's a little something for helping us out."}
Q[24638]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在奥格瑞玛城门外，西边。那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's right outside Orgrimmar's gates, to the west! That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠仆从，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在杜隆塔尔的奥格瑞玛大门西方的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Lackeys and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to damage one Chemical Wagon just west of Orgrimmar's gates in Durotar, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24645]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在银松森林的安伯米尔城外。那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside Ambermill in Silverpine Forest. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠暴徒，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁银松森林中安伯米尔外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Thugs and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Ambermill in Silverpine Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24647]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在希尔斯布莱德村外，没错，你猜对了，希尔斯布莱德丘陵。那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside the village of Hillsbrad in -- you guessed it -- Hillsbrad Foothills. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠清洁者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁希尔斯布莱德村镇外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Dusters and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon just outside of Hillsbrad Village in Hillsbrad Foothills, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24648]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在尘泥沼泽塞拉摩城外。别那样看我，行吗？这对我们也是个麻烦。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's near Sentry Point, just outside Theramore in Dustwallow. Don't give me that look, okay? This is a problem for us, too. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠恶霸，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁尘泥沼泽塞拉摩外面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Hoodlums and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Theramore in Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24649]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在辛特兰鹰巢山的东边。别那样看我，行吗？这对部落也是个麻烦。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's to the east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands. Don't give me that look, okay? This is a problem for the Horde, too. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠密探，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁辛特兰鹰巢山的东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Agents and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24650]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：在冬泉谷，就在永望镇的东边。哦，这下可算是私仇了。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's in Winterspring, just east of Everlook. Oh, now this is personal. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠洒水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁冬泉谷永望镇东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprinklers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Everlook in Winterspring, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24651]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：看起来就在沙塔斯东边，泰罗卡森林里。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's just east of Shattrath, in Terokkar Forest. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠杂兵，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁泰罗卡森林沙塔斯城东面的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Underlings and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24652]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：看起来在水晶之歌森林的荒弃林地，暮光之镜的西北方。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong, northwest of the Mirror of Twilight. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠喷水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁晶歌森林绝望之林中的一台药剂车。然后返回奥格瑞玛，去见侦探斯奈普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprayers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong Forest, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24655]={d="瞧瞧这些家伙！热砂港打理节庆生意这么多年，突然之间，这帮人闯进了市场。他们不是热砂港的人，所以财团雇我来查个水落石出。这里有股怪味，而且不只是香水味。rnrn带上我带来的这个装置，去分析卫兵周围的香水云雾。我想知道他们在那种东西里加了什么。这可不自然。",dEN="Get a load of these guys, would ya? Steamwheedle's been handling the business of holidays for years, and all of a sudden, these guys bust into the market. They're not Steamwheedle; the cartel hired me to get to the bottom of this. Something stinks here and it ain't just perfume.\n\nTake this device I brought and go analyze the perfume clouds around the guards. I want to know what they're putting in that stuff. Things ain't natural.",o="使用滑栓的空气分析器测试6位带有浓郁香气的卫兵周围的空气，然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Use Snagglebolt's Air Analyzer to test the air around 6 heavily perfumed guards, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="测试完那些臭气了吗，孩子？",pEN="You analyze that reek yet, kid?",c="嘿，谢谢，孩子。拿来让我看看。\n\n<他拿着设备摆弄着>\n\n哦，情况不对啊。",cEN="Hey, thanks, kid. Give it over, let's take a look.\n\n<He takes the device from you and fiddles with it.>\n\nOh, that ain't good."}
Q[24656]={d="我就知道他们没安好心！这里面有某种影响心智的化学化合物，但样本太小，我没法把它分离出来。我要真货。rnrn你可别直接过去买！我不想你给那些混蛋一个铜板。不，我要你从源头弄到手，低调一点。rnrn我会把你伪装成送包裹的。我看到城门外有一堆由他们打手看守的板条箱。跑过去，千万别停下，否则他们会抓住你！他们会扔给你一个箱子。把它带回来给我。",dEN="I knew they were up to no good! There's some sort of mind-affecting chemical in here, but I can't get a handle on it with such a small sample. I need the real stuff.\n\nDon't just go over there and buy it! I don't want you giving these scumbags one copper. Nah, you gotta get it from the source, discreet-like.\n\nI'll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON'T stop, or they'll make you! They'll toss you a crate. Bring it back here.",o="当你 $g伪装成:伪装成; 送包裹的人时，前往暴风城城门外皇冠化学公司的板条箱堆，然后把你被扔过来的包裹带回来，交给暴风城的检察官斯尼普·钳栓。",oEN="While disguised as a package-runner, go to the Crown Chemical Company's stockpile outside the gates of Stormwind, then return the package they toss you to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="他们有没有扔给你一个包裹？",pEN="Did they toss ya a crate to deliver?",c="你拿到了，嗯？干得好，小子。一流。看看我们这儿有什么。",cEN="You got it, huh? Good job, kid. Top notch. Let's see what we what we got here."}
Q[24657]={d="<你向玛丽恩讲述追查斯内维尔的原因，玛丽恩的脸上露出惊恐的表情。>\n\n你是说，他很可能给我下了药？哦！我竟然受到这样的欺骗，真是难以置信！\n\n如果他已经完成了使命，那么他应该正赶往码头，想要搭上转至南海的船只！$n，绝不能让他逃走。\n\n赶快到暴风城港口去！",dEN="<Marion listens with horror as you tell her why you're trying to track down Snivel.>\n\nYou mean, he might've used some kind of chemical on me? Ew! I can't believe I fell for that fraud!\n\nIf he's finished all of his errands, he's on his way down to the docks to catch a ship to the South Seas! Whatever you do, <name>, you can't let him get away with this.\n\nHurry down to Stormwind Harbor before you miss him!",o="转至暴风城港口，向斯内维尔·拉斯罗凯特询问关于供给物资的事情。然后带着他给你的证据回去。",oEN="Go to Stormwind Harbor and question Snivel Rustrocket about the supplies. Return with any evidence he gives you.",p="你找到那家伙了吗，或者他正躲在哪块石头下面？",pEN="Did you find the guy, or did he crawl under a rock?",c="<name>，你拿到他的账本了吗？真的？太好了。这里头大概有不少有用的情报。",cEN="You got his ledger? Really? That's great, <name>. There's probably loads of good information in here."}
Q[24658]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：在艾尔文森林西泉要塞的东北方！那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's northeast of Westbrook Garrison right outside in Elwynn! That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠仆从，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁艾尔文森林西泉要塞东北方的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Lackeys and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to damage one Chemical Wagon northeast of Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24659]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在黑海岸古树之林的南边。那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just south of the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠暴徒，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁黑海岸古树之林南面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Thugs and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon south of the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24660]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在暮色森林暗色村的东南方。那可不妙。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's just outside the village of Hillsbrad in -- you guessed it -- Hillsbrad Foothills. That can't be good. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠清洁者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁希尔斯布莱德村镇外面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Dusters and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon just outside of Hillsbrad Village in Hillsbrad Foothills, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24662]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：在尘泥沼泽塞拉摩城外，哨兵岭附近。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's near Sentry Point, just outside Theramore in Dustwallow. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠恶霸，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁位于尘泥沼泽的塞拉摩外面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Hoodlums and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon outside of Theramore in Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24663]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：就在辛特兰鹰巢山的东边。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's to the east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠密探，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在辛特兰鹰巢山东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Agents and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24664]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：在冬泉谷，就在永望镇的东边。哦，这下可算是私仇了。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's in Winterspring, just east of Everlook. Oh, now this is personal. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠洒水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在冬泉谷永望镇东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprinklers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Everlook in Winterspring, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24665]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：看起来就在沙塔斯东边，泰罗卡森林里。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's just east of Shattrath, in Terokkar Forest. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠杂兵，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在泰罗卡森林沙塔斯城东面的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Underlings and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24666]={d="这本账本里全是地点，我需要你去调查并采取行动，$g朋友:朋友;。这事拖得够久了。\n\n这是我要你去查的一条记录：看起来在水晶之歌森林的荒弃林地，暮光之镜的西北方。去那儿教训他们一顿。\n\n哦，如果你看到什么又大又危险、必须摧毁的东西，就把这颗炸弹扔给它。",dEN="This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.\n\nHere's an entry I want you to check out: it looks like it's in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong, northwest of the Mirror of Twilight. Get out there and rough 'em up.\n\nOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it.",o="消灭5个皇冠喷水者，并使用滑栓的氪金炸弹摧毁在晶歌森林绝望之林的一台药剂车。然后返回暴风城，去见探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Kill 5 Crown Sprayers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon in the Forlorn Woods of Crystalsong Forest, then return to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你教他们如何做人了吗？",pEN="Did you teach 'em a lesson?",c="干得好，小子。你该得点小意思。还有，有空明天再来；说不定我有活儿给你。",cEN="Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya."}
Q[24682]={d="赶快行动，穿过这道传送门！我会在传送门的另一边与你汇合。",dEN="Quickly, through the portal! I'll find you on the other side.",o="在萨隆矿坑和希尔瓦娜斯·风行者见面。",oEN="Meet Lady Sylvanas Windrunner inside the entrace to the Pit of Saron.",c="真是一群无能的蠢货。我开始怀疑通过试炼的是不是都是傻瓜。但愿你能证明是我错了。",cEN="Incapable fools. I begin to wonder if any of these louts from the tournament will be of any use at all. Perhaps you'll prove me wrong."}
Q[24683]={d="赶快行动，穿过这道传送门！我会在传送门的另一边与你汇合。",dEN="Quickly, through the portal! I'll meet you on the other side.",o="在萨隆矿坑和吉安娜·普罗德摩尔见面。",oEN="Meet Lady Jaina Proudmoore just inside the Pit of Saron.",c="是我低估了天灾领主，我的人为此付出了代价。就在我因为阿尔萨斯的背叛感到愧疚到不可自拔时，他又一次证明我错了。\n\n我们必须振作起来，绝不能让战士们白白牺牲。",cEN="I underestimated this Scourgelord, and it's my men that paid for it. When I think that my guilt over Arthas' betrayal cannot go any deeper, he proves me wrong yet again.\n\nWe have to press on. We cannot let their sacrifice be meaningless."}
Q[24710]={d="我们得沿主路前进，穿过洞穴到泰兰努斯的高地。\n\n他会被迫在那里迎战我们，否则我们就会直入堡垒腹地。\n\n去吧，$c。与泰兰努斯的对决开始时，我和我的部下会在你身边。",dEN="We need to make our way up the main path and through the cave to Tyrannus' rise. There, he will be forced to confront us there lest we make our way into the citadel proper.\n\nGo now, <class>. My men and I will be there to stand by you when the confrontation with Tyrannus comes.",o="杀死天灾领主泰兰努斯。",oEN="Kill Scourgelord Tyrannus.",c="多么无谓的浪费！阿尔萨斯太过分了！我只能希望我们在倒影大厅找到的东西能让这一切多少有些价值。\n\n如果那个卑鄙的地精所言可信，霜之哀伤应该就在那里，随之而来的还有面对阿尔萨斯的答案。",cEN="Such a senseless waste! Arthas goes too far! I can only hope what we find in the Halls of Reflection makes this somehow worth it.\n\nIf what that vile gnome said is to be trusted, Frostmourne should be there, and with it, answers to confronting Arthas."}
Q[24711]={d="我们必须继续前进，$g英雄:女英雄;。我们已经走了这么远……目标近在咫尺。\n\n我得耽搁片刻，把埃兰德拉送回飞船。损失了这么多人、剩下这么点人守住道路，我不确定我们该如何撤离。\n\n继续前进。我会在倒影大厅与你会合。",dEN="We must press on, hero. We've come so far... we're so close to our goal. I must delay a moment to send Elandra back to the airship. I'm uncertain how we're going to escape with so many men lost and so few to keep our path in secure - we will need any help they can send.\n\nContinue on. I will meet you in the Halls of Reflection.",o="在映像大厅的入口与吉安娜女士汇合。",oEN="Meet Lady Jaina Proudmoore at the entrance to the Halls of Reflection.",c="倒影大厅。终于到了。\n\n你准备好时告诉我。阿尔萨斯也许不在这里，但若以为他会完全不给霜之哀伤设防，那就太天真了。",cEN="The Halls of Reflection. Finally.\n\nLet me know when you are ready. Arthas may not be here, but it would be naive to think that he would leave Frostmourne unguarded entirely."}
Q[24712]={d="我们得沿主路前进，穿过洞穴到泰兰努斯的高地。\n\n他会被迫在那里迎战我们，以免我们直入堡垒。\n\n去吧，$c。与泰兰努斯的对决开始时，我和我的部下会在你身边。",dEN="We need to make our way up the main path and through the cave to Tyrannus' rise. There, he will be forced to confront us there lest we make our way into the citadel proper.\n\nGo now, <class>. My men and I will be there to stand by you when the confrontation with Tyrannus comes.",o="杀死天灾领主泰兰努斯。",oEN="Kill Scourgelord Tyrannus.",c="映像大厅就在前面了。假如那个卑鄙的侏儒的话可信，霜之哀伤就该也在那了，对抗阿尔萨斯的关健也在那里。",cEN="The Halls of Reflection lie ahead. If what that vile gnome said is to be trusted, Frostmourne should be there, and with it, answers to confronting Arthas."}
Q[24713]={d="继续前进，霜之哀伤就近在咫尺了。\n\n我需要耽误一会送我的一名黑暗游侠回到飞艇上。在损失这么多战友之后，我不会再执行准备不足的行动——我们需要他们的鼎力帮助。\n\n去吧。我会在映像大厅与你汇合。",dEN="Keep moving, the sword is close.\n\nI need a moment to send one of my Dark Rangers back to the airship. With all of our fodder gone, I will not be caught unprepared - we will need any help they can send.\n\nGo. I will meet you in the Halls of Reflection.",o="在映像大厅的入口与希尔瓦娜斯汇合。",oEN="Meet Lady Sylvanas Windrunner inside the entrance to the Halls of Reflection.",c="倒影大厅。终于到了。\n\n你准备好时告诉我，<class>。我不会天真到以为阿尔萨斯会完全不给他的宝剑设防。",cEN="The Halls of Reflection. Finally.\n\nLet me know when you are ready, <class>. I will not be so naive as to think that Arthas left his precious sword entirely unguarded."}
Q[24745]={d="这张卡片里面记录了一个疯狂而详细的计划。其目的是感染艾泽拉斯的全部生物。你应该立刻把它交给热砂集团的一名调查员！",dEN="The inside of the card is scribbled with mad, detailed plans to infect most of Azeroth. You should show this to one of Steamwheedle's investigators immediately!",o="将褪色的情人节卡片交给暴风城的探员斯尼普·滑栓。",oEN="Bring the Faded Lovely Greeting Card to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",p="你有没有“照顾”好那些不怀好意的恶棍？",pEN="Did you take care of those no-good scheming villains?",c="你手上是什么？\n\n哦，嘿，这可是大事。天大的事。那么多疯狂的细节全都装在这一个小包裹里。多谢——你真帮我们把这些全都收拢了起来。跟你合作很愉快。",cEN="What've you got there?\n\nOh hey, this is big. Real big. Most of the crazy details in one little package. Thanks - you really helped us reel this all in. Good working with ya."}
Q[24748]={d="影之哀伤，这件武器刚刚问世不久，却已经改写了这个世界的历史。它初生便背负着无与伦比的命运。\n\n手握这件武器的你同样背负着巨大的责任，而且现在就是你履行这一责任的时候。\n\n举起这件传奇武器，向敌人发起冲锋吧。为我们牺牲的无数英雄复仇，让他们饱受折磨的灵魂得到安息。\n\n坚定你的意志，$c，引领影之哀伤去实现它的命运吧。",dEN="Shadowmourne; a newly forged weapon already steeped in this world's history, reborn into an unrivaled destiny.\n\nWith this weapon you bear a solemn responsibility, and the time to carry out that charge is at hand.\n\nTake this weapon of myth and legend and march on the enemy. Avenge the countless heroes lost in his merciless campaign. Bring rest to their tortured souls.\n\nSteel yourself, <class>, and guide Shadowmourne to fulfill the purpose of its creation.",o="冰冠堡垒中的大领主达里安·莫格莱尼希望你去消灭巫妖王。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel wants you to kill the Lich King.",c="终于，我们做到了。\n\n愿艾泽拉斯的人民永远铭记我们在这里的事迹，愿如此多的牺牲能像熊熊火焰一样在他们的心中燃烧，愿他们在面对恶魔时永远不会怯懦和退缩。",cEN="So, at last it is done.\n\nMay the people of Azeroth remember our deeds here forevermore. May the sacrifices of so many burn in their hearts eternally. May they never fail to risk mortal peril in the face of great evil."}
Q[24749]={d="你的武器必须注入足够的力量，才能发挥出它真正的潜力。第一种要注入的力量就是邪恶。\n\n你必须找到并击败那个名叫普崔塞德教授的人。但消灭他并非你唯一的目标。你还要利用他的力量来对抗他。\n\n想办法吸收他的变异粘液。使用那种邪恶的物质为你的武器注入邪恶力量。然后我会指示你下一步的任务。",dEN="Before your weapon can reach its full potential it must be endowed with its signature powers. First among them is unholiness.\n\nYou must seek out and defeat the one called Professor Putricide, but his death is not your only goal. You must use his resources against him.\n\nFind a way to absorb his mutated slime. Use the foul substance to infuse your weapon with the power of the unholy. Only when this has been done shall I reveal your next task.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你用邪恶能量灌注影锋，并杀死普崔塞德教授。\n\n该任务只能在冰冠堡垒25人英雄难度模式下完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to infuse Shadow's Edge with Unholy power and slay Professor Putricide.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="干得好，<class>。\n\n我们工作的终点临近了。",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nThe completion of our work draws near."}
Q[24756]={d="你的武器已准备好被赋予鲜血之力。\n\n你必须在战斗中面对兰娜瑟尔女王，并接受她的鲜血之镜。这股力量将使暗影之锋饮下最近活人的鲜血。$g那个:那个;活人就是你，$r。\n\n待剑刃如此苏醒之后，任由女王的狂乱嗜血控制你，三次喂饱剑刃以满足它，然后赐予女王一场耻辱的死亡。\n\n愿她的尖叫刺穿等待命运的巫妖王的耳朵。",dEN="Your weapon is ready to be endowed with the power of blood.\n\nYou must face Queen Lana'thel in battle and subject yourself to her Blood Mirror. This will cause Shadow's Edge to drink the blood of the nearest living being. That being would be you, <race>.\n\nOnce the blade has been thus awakened, allow the Queen's Frenzied Bloodthirst to take hold of you, feed the blade thrice to sate it, and then give the queen an ignominious death.\n\nMay her screams pierce the ears of the Lich King as he awaits his fate.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼要你使用鲜血灌注影锋，并击败鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔。\n\n该任务只能在25人难度的冰冠堡垒中完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine wants you to infuse Shadow's Edge with blood and defeat Queen Lana'thel.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="干得好，<class>。\n\n影之哀伤几乎已在掌握之中。",cEN="Well done, <class>.\n\nShadowmourne is nearly within reach."}
Q[24757]={d="影锋已经准好要接收其最终的力量灌注了。\n\n辛达苟萨，敌人的坐骑，必须死。但是在杀死她之前，你必须要在不死的情况下经受住她的四次冰霜气息。\n\n没有了他的龙之后，在你和巫妖王之间就不再有真正意义上的对手了。",dEN="Shadow's Edge is prepared to receive its final infusion of power.\n\nSindragosa, the enemy's own mount, must fall. But before she is brought down, you must sustain four of her frozen breath attacks without tasting death.\n\nWithout his dragon, nothing shall stand between you and the Lich King.",o="大领主达里安·莫格莱尼对你做出了指示，他要你在使用影锋与辛达苟萨战斗时，经受住辛达苟萨的四次气息攻击，然后再杀死她。\n\n该任务只能在25人难度的冰冠堡垒中完成。",oEN="Highlord Darion Mograine has instructed you to slay Sindragosa after subjecting yourself to 4 of her breath attacks while wielding Shadow's Edge.\n\nThis quest may only be completed in 25 person difficulty of Icecrown Citadel.",c="斧头已饮至饱足，<race>，熔炉几乎已为铸造影之哀伤做好准备……",cEN="The axe has drunk its fill, <race>, and the forge is nearly ready for the creation of Shadowmourne..."}
Q[24792]={d="看样子你有足够的智慧和力量完成我的任务。这本帐簿的内容表明他正待在影牙城堡。所以我现在要派你去那里。\n\n我们已经向那里派了一个人，但他还没有取得任何进展。赶快行动。我们的侦查员会在那里和你碰头。记得带上你的朋友一起过去。",dEN="You look like you're fit enough to take on the mastermind behind this operation. The ledger says he's holed up in Shadowfang Keep, so that's where I'm sending you.\n\nWe have a man there already but he's not fit to take down an operation by himself. Head on in; the investigator will meet you there. And bring friends.",o="向影牙城堡的调查员费岑·布莱斯塔克报告。",oEN="Report to Investigator Fezzen Brasstacks in Shadowfang Keep.",c="太好了。帮助正是我需要的。",cEN="Fantastic. Help is exactly what I need."}
Q[24793]={d="看样子你有足够的智慧和力量完成我的任务。这本帐簿的内容表明他正待在影牙城堡。所以我现在要派你去那里。\n\n我们已经向那里派了一个人，但他还没有取得任何进展。赶快行动。我们的侦查员会在那里和你碰头。记得带上你的朋友一起过去。",dEN="You look like you're fit enough to take on the mastermind behind this operation. The ledger says he's holed up in Shadowfang Keep, so that's where I'm sending you.\n\nWe have a man there already but he's not fit to take down an operation by himself. Head on in; the investigator will meet you there. And bring friends.",o="向影牙城堡的调查员费岑·布莱斯塔克报告。",oEN="Report to Investigator Fezzen Brasstacks in Shadowfang Keep.",c="太好了。帮助正是我需要的。",cEN="Fantastic. Help is exactly what I need."}
Q[24795]={d="在鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔自吹自擂的时候，而你，$n，却已经取得了奎尔德拉。\n\n银色盟约和全体奎尔多雷都对你心怀感激。\n\n奎尔德拉似乎知道你是一名$c，不能使用它。那么它的下一个主人该是谁？也许银色十字军能为它找到新主人。到北边的银色比武场去，代表银色盟约将这把剑交给裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",dEN="In spite of Queen Lana'thel's boasting, you have restored Quel'Delar, <name>. Long have we dreamt of reclaiming Quel'Delar.\n\nThe Silver Covenant, and indeed all quel'dorei owe you a debt of gratitude.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? Perhaps the Argent Crusade can find one. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Silver Covenant.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="一件如此强大的武器从邪恶的魔爪中被救赎，在这样的时代是个好兆头，<name>。有奎尔德拉和银色盟约的坚定盟友在我们身边，巫妖王有充分的理由畏惧。\n\n十字军为最强的盟友保管着一批卓越的武器。请允许我让你从中挑选一件，作为把奎尔德拉托付给我们照管的回报。",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Silver Covenant allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24796]={d="在鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔自吹自擂的时候，而你，$n，却已经取得了奎尔德拉。\n\n银色盟约和全体奎尔多雷都对你心怀感激。\n\n银色盟约的领袖温蕾萨·风行者希望你从太阳之井返回以后能去见她一面。请带着奎尔德拉转至达拉然的紫罗兰城堡，她正在那里等你，$n。",dEN="In spite of Queen Lana'thel's boasting, you have restored Quel'Delar, <name>. Long have we dreamt of reclaiming Quel'Delar.\n\nThe Silver Covenant, and indeed all quel'dorei owe you a debt of gratitude.\n\nVereesa Windrunner, the leader of the Silver Covenant, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Take Quel'Delar with you and go to Dalaran's Violet Citadel where she waits, <name>.",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡中的温蕾萨·风行者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Vereesa Windrunner at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="这简直是了不起的成就，<name>。萨洛瑞安与安纳斯特里安陨落的那天，也是奎尔德拉失落的那天，是我一生中最黑暗的日子之一。看到奎尔德拉重获新生……实在难以言表。\n\n毫无疑问，你注定是这把剑刃真正的持有者。奎尔德拉的魔法已经在让剑刃适应你的技艺与长处。",cEN="This is nothing short of an amazing accomplishment, <name>. The day that Thalorien and Anasterian fell, the same day that Quel'Delar was lost, was one of the darkest of my life. To see Quel'Delar restored... it is beyond words.\n\nWithout a doubt, you are meant to be the true bearer of the blade. Quel'Delar's magic is already adapting the blade to your skills and your strengths."}
Q[24798]={d="终于，奎尔德拉为夺日者与辛多雷的荣耀而重获新生！\n\n整个银月城都将称颂你为 $g英雄:女英雄;，$n。\n\n作为 $c，这把剑似乎知道你没有驾驭它的训练，因而未与你绑定。那么它的下一位主人会来自何处？还没有出现配得上的辛多雷。让我们寻求银色十字军的建议。向北前往银色比武场，代表夺日者把剑呈交给正义者玛丽尔·真心。",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the sin'dorei!\n\nAll of Silvermoon will celebrate you as a hero, <name>.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? No worthy sin'dorei has come forward. Let us seek the Argent Crusade's counsel. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Sunreavers.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="一件如此强大的武器从邪恶的魔爪中被救赎，在这样的时代是个好兆头，<name>。有奎尔德拉和夺日者的坚定盟友在我们身边，巫妖王有充分的理由畏惧。\n\n十字军为最强的盟友保管着一批卓越的武器。请允许我让你从中挑选一件，作为把奎尔德拉托付给我们照管的回报。",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Sunreaver allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24799]={d="终于，奎尔德拉为夺日者的荣耀而重获新生！\n\n整个部落都将称颂你为 $g英雄:女英雄;，$n。\n\n作为 $c，这把剑似乎知道你没有驾驭它的训练，因而未与你绑定。那么它的下一位主人会来自何处？我不会掩饰自己的失望；我本希望是位配得上的辛多雷。让我们寻求银色十字军的建议。向北前往银色比武场，代表夺日者把剑呈交给正义者玛丽尔·真心。",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers!\n\nAll the Horde will celebrate you as a hero, <name>.\n\nAs a <class>, the sword seems to know you lack the training to wield it and hasn't bonded to you. Where, then, will its next master come from? I will not conceal my disappointment; I had hoped it would be a worthy sin'dorei. Let us seek the Argent Crusade's counsel. Go north to the Argent Tournament Grounds and present the sword to Justicar Mariel Trueheart on behalf of the Sunreavers.",o="将奎尔德拉交给银色比武场的裁决者玛蕾尔·图哈特。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="一件如此强大的武器从邪恶的魔爪中被救赎，在这样的时代是个好兆头，<name>。有奎尔德拉和夺日者的坚定盟友在我们身边，巫妖王有充分的理由畏惧。\n\n十字军为最强的盟友保管着一批卓越的武器。请允许我让你从中挑选一件，作为把奎尔德拉托付给我们照管的回报。",cEN="That a weapon of such power has been redeemed from the clutches of evil is a great omen in these times, <name>. With Quel'Delar and staunch Sunreaver allies at our side, the Lich King will have good reason to fear.\n\nThe crusade maintains an arsenal of exceptional weapons for our strongest allies. Allow me to offer you your choice from among them in return for entrusting us with the care of Quel'Delar."}
Q[24800]={d="终于，奎尔德拉为夺日者与辛多雷的荣耀而重获新生！整个银月城和整个部落都将宣告你为 $g英雄:女英雄;。\n\n夺日者的领袖大法师艾萨斯·夺日者请求在你从太阳之井归来后见你。尽快前往达拉然的紫罗兰城堡，$n，带上奎尔德拉。大法师想亲自向你道贺！",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the sin'dorei! All of Silvermoon will proclaim you a hero, as will all of the Horde.\n\nArchmage Aethas Sunreaver, the leader of the Sunreavers, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Travel to the Violet Citadel in Dalaran as soon as you can, <name> and bring Quel'Delar with you. The archmage wishes to congratulate you personally!",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡的大法师艾萨斯·夺日者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="奎尔德拉再度崛起，正如我们辛多雷从失败与背叛的灰烬中站起。萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的心与武器都与你同在，<name>。\n\n我看到剑刃已开始适应你的长处，<name>。昂起头来，永远把奎尔德拉带在身边。",cEN="Quel'Delar rises again, as we sin'dorei have risen from the ashes of defeat and betrayal. The heart and the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker are both with you, <name>.\n\nI see the blade has already started adapting itself to your strengths, <name>. Hold your head high and always keep Quel'Delar at your side."}
Q[24801]={d="奎尔德拉终于回到了我们的手中，这是夺日者和部落的光荣！也是这场对抗巫妖王的战争中我们得到的祝福。\n\n夺日者的领袖，大法师艾萨斯·夺日者希望你从太阳之井回来以后去见他一面。$n，带着奎尔德拉转至达拉然的紫罗兰城堡。大法师要亲自向你祝贺胜利！",dEN="At last, Quel'Delar is restored for the glory of the Sunreavers and the Horde! This is a blessing for our efforts against the Lich King.\n\nArchmage Aethas Sunreaver, the leader of the Sunreavers, asked to see you after you returned from the Sunwell. Travel to the Violet Citadel in Dalaran as soon as you can, <name> and bring Quel'Delar with you. The archmage wishes to congratulate you personally!",o="将奎尔德拉交给达拉然紫罗兰城堡的大法师艾萨斯·夺日者。",oEN="Bring the Restored Quel'Delar to Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.",p="你真的复原了奎尔德拉？",pEN="Is it true that you have restored Quel'Delar?",c="奎尔德拉再度崛起，正如辛多雷从失败与背叛的灰烬中站起。然而不知何故，萨洛瑞安·寻晨者的武器却选择侍奉一个外乡人。\n\n放轻松，<name>。我无意贬低你的成就，因为你做到了我的兄弟们都做不到的事，尽管我不明白为什么。显然你注定是它的持有者；剑刃已在适应你的能力。自豪地挥舞奎尔德拉，对抗我们共同的敌人。",cEN="Quel'Delar rises again, as the sin'dorei have risen from the ashes of defeat and betrayal. Yet, somehow, the weapon of Thalorien Dawnseeker has chosen to serve an outsider.\n\nBe at ease, <name>. I do not mean to diminish your accomplishment, for you have done what none of my brothers could, although I do not know why. You are clearly meant to be its bearer; the blade is already adapting itself to your abilities. Wield Quel'Delar proudly against our common foes."}
Q[24802]={d="乌瑟尔知道该如何击败阿尔萨斯。很难相信，最有可能击败阿尔萨斯的地方恰恰就是在他王座前的阶梯上。如果阿尔萨斯倒下，谁又会戴上巫妖王的王冠？\n\n有许多问题还悬而未决，但你发现的答案对于击败阿尔萨斯也许会起到关键性的作用。你需要找到希尔瓦娜斯，并逃过巫妖王的攻击。",dEN="Uther knew a great deal about how Arthas might be defeated. It's hard to believe that there is much hope of defeating Arthas upon the steps of his own throne. And who will take up the crown of Lich King if it comes to that?\n\nMany questions remain, but the answers that you've uncovered may be critical to ensuring Arthas' defeat. You need to find Sylvanas and escape the Lich King while there's still time.",o="找到希尔瓦娜斯·风行者，并逃出映像大厅。",oEN="Find Lady Sylvanas Windrunner and escape the Halls of Reflection",c="复仇又一次从我手中溜走。很难相信他变得这么强。\n\n你来找我是愚蠢之举，但知道部落中还有些不是无用懦夫的勇士，这是好事。乌瑟尔给我们的情报很可能就是最终杀死阿尔萨斯的关键，尽管越来越清楚的是，部落无法独自完成此事。\n\n去吧，<class>。我预计很快又会需要你的本领。",cEN="Yet again, vengeance slips through my grasp. It's hard to believe how much stronger he's gotten.\n\nIt was foolish of you to come for me, but it's good to know that there are still some champions of the Horde that aren't useless cowards. The information Uther gave us may well be key to finally killing Arthas, though it is becoming more and more clear that the Horde will not be able to accomplish this on their own.\n\nGo, <class>. I expect your prowess may be needed again very soon."}
Q[24803]={p="卡鲁亚克通过每周举办大赛一直在延续钓鱼的传统。\n\n奖杯会颁给第一个钓到黑鳍鲨的人，这家伙将会成为诺森德最出名的钓手……额，至少出名几天吧。\n\n黑鳍鲨最喜欢吃侏儒亚口鱼了，所以通常情况就是你总钓到侏儒亚口鱼而不是黑鳍鲨。",pEN="The Kalu'ak have a long tradition of honing our fishing skills by putting them to the the test every week.\n\nThe first person to catch and bring a blacktip shark to me will be rewarded handsomely, and be known as the greatest fisherman of the north... for a couple days at least.\n\nThe blacktip shark's favorite food is the pygmy suckerfish. Try fishing for the blacktip wherever you would normally catch the suckerfish.",c="别傻站着！把鱼给我，我会宣布你是获胜者！",cEN="Don't just stand there! Give me the shark and I'll declare you the winner!"}
Q[24804]={d="皇冠药剂公司有些不对劲的地方。热砂集团已经开始注意他们了。我们要对此采取行动。\n\n如果你有兴趣帮助我们，就请到暴风城去。探员斯尼普·滑栓正在那里进行调查，他很需要你的帮助。",dEN="Something's not right about this Crown Chemical Company. Steamwheedle's got eyes on 'em, and we could use a few more.\n\nHead to Stormwind if you're interested in helping us out. Inspector Snip Snagglebolt is heading up the investigation there, and he can use all the help he can get.",o="向暴风城的探员斯尼普·滑栓报告。",oEN="Report to Inspector Snip Snagglebolt in Stormwind.",c="嘿，你有时间吗？我这有点事情想交给你办。",cEN="Hey. You got some time on your hands? I could use someone like you."}
Q[24805]={d="皇冠药剂公司有些不对劲的地方。热砂集团已经开始注意他们了。我们要对此采取行动。\n\n如果你有兴趣帮助我们，就请到奥格瑞玛去。侦探斯奈普·滑栓正在那里进行调查，他很需要你的帮助。",dEN="Something's not right about this Crown Chemical Company. Steamwheedle's got eyes on 'em, and we could use a few more.\n\nHead to Orgrimmar if you're interested in helping us out. Detective Snap Snagglebolt is heading up the investigation there, and he can use all the help he can get.",o="向奥格瑞玛的侦探斯奈普·滑栓报告。",oEN="Report to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar.",c="嘿，你有时间吗？我这有点事情想交给你办。",cEN="Hey. You got some time on your hands? I could use someone like you."}
Q[24806]={p="恐怕今天我们已经有一位赢家了，年轻的 <name>。不过，如果你带来一条鲨鱼，我会确保它被放回水中，说不定我还会有点什么给你……",pEN="I'm afraid we've already had a winner for today, young <name>. However, if you bring a shark, I'll see that it's released back into the waters, and I might just have a little something for you...",c="嗯，你尝试过总是好的，<race>。我不想让你觉得自己的努力白费了，所以我给你准备了点东西。",cEN="Well, it's nice that you tried <race>. I don't want you to think your efforts were wasted, so I've got something for you."}
Q[24815]={c="为了赎清我作为巫妖王死亡骑士所犯下的罪孽，我致力于打造强大的戒指，供兄弟姐妹们在战斗中佩戴。\n\n你已经证明自己是抗击天灾的宝贵盟友，<name>。随着你的付出继续，我将能够改进戒指的原始设计。\n\n谨慎选择你的道路。改变心意是有代价的。",cEN="To atone for the sins I committed as one of the Lich King's Death Knights, I've dedicated myself to creating rings of great power for our brothers and sisters to use in the struggle.\n\nYou've proven yourself as a valuable ally in the fight against the Scourge, <name>. As your dedication continues I can improve on the ring's original design.\n\nChoose your path carefully. A change of heart will come at a price."}
Q[24819]={p="你想改变你所走的道路吗，<name>？",pEN="You seek to change the path you walk, <name>?",c="愿你找到你所追寻之物，<brother/sister>。",cEN="May you find what you're looking for, <brother/sister>."}
Q[24823]={p="你愿在毁灭之路上走下去吗？",pEN="You seek to continue down the path of destruction?",c="你不断证明自己的价值，<name>。收下这个，不是作为礼物，而是作为抗击天灾的工具。",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge."}
Q[24828]={p="你愿在毁灭之路上走下去吗？",pEN="You seek to continue down the path of destruction?",c="你不断证明自己的价值，<name>。收下这个，不是作为礼物，而是作为抗击天灾的工具。",cEN="You continue to prove yourself, <name>. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge."}
