Q[26049]={d="英雄，我们需要你的帮助！\n\n我们的士兵急需提振士气！于是我想到，也许可以用一顿丰盛的饭菜让他们精神一振！\n\n收集 10 份炖鳟鱼。当然，你的援助会得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers are in desperate need of a morale boost! And then, I got to thinking, maybe we could raise their spirits with a hearty meal!\n\nCollect 10 Stewed Trout. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 份炖鳟鱼",oEN="Collect 10 Stewed Trout",p="食品柜还是空的。带回所需的菜肴来完成这份订单。",pEN="The pantry is still bare. Return with the required dishes to complete this order.",c="多么丰盛的一桌！今晚厨房要忙了。你的烹饪贡献深受赞赏，英雄。",cEN="What a fine spread! The kitchens will be busy tonight. Your culinary contributions are most appreciated, Hero."}
