Q[26053]={d="英雄，我们需要你的帮助！\n\n我们的熔炉正忙于应付刚接到的一大笔订单！\n\n收集 15 块魔铁锭。当然，你的援助会得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur smelters are having trouble keeping up with a big order we just got!\n\nCollect 15 Fel Iron Bar. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 15 块魔铁锭",oEN="Collect 15 Fel Iron Bar",p="熔炉需要更多材料。带回这份订单上所列的锭料。",pEN="The forge requires more materials. Return with the bars listed on this order.",c="上好的材料！熔炉烧得正旺，你的贡献会得到很好的利用。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Fine materials! The forge burns hot and your contributions will be put to good use. Well done, Hero."}
Q[26054]={d="英雄，我们需要你的帮助！\n\n我们的熔炉正忙于应付刚接到的一大笔订单！\n\n收集 10 块精金锭。当然，你的援助会得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur smelters are having trouble keeping up with a big order we just got!\n\nCollect 10 Adamantite Bar. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 块精金锭",oEN="Collect 10 Adamantite Bar",p="熔炉需要更多材料。带回这份订单上所列的锭料。",pEN="The forge requires more materials. Return with the bars listed on this order.",c="上好的材料！熔炉烧得正旺，你的贡献会得到很好的利用。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Fine materials! The forge burns hot and your contributions will be put to good use. Well done, Hero."}
