Q[26059]={d="英雄，我们需要你的帮助！\n\n我们的熔炉正忙于应付刚接到的一大笔订单！\n\n收集 2 块硬化氪金。当然，你的援助会得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur smelters are having trouble keeping up with a big order we just got!\n\nCollect 2 Hardened Khorium. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 块硬化氪金",oEN="Collect 2 Hardened Khorium",p="熔炉需要更多材料。带回这份订单上所列的锭料。",pEN="The forge requires more materials. Return with the bars listed on this order.",c="上好的材料！熔炉烧得正旺，你的贡献会得到很好的利用。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Fine materials! The forge burns hot and your contributions will be put to good use. Well done, Hero."}
Q[26100]={d="你好，<class>。很高兴你过来跟老头子我聊聊——老家那边有麻烦了。\n\n一个旅行商人最近把一批小鳄鱼卖给了几个天真的孩子。鳄鱼是野兽，许多都逃走了，如今潜伏在城里的水道中。\n\n拿起你最结实的鱼竿，在任意主城下钩，把其中一只小恶魔带回来给我。我急着想见见。",dEN="Hello <class>. I'm glad you've stopped by to talk to this old man -- there's trouble back home.\n\nA traveling merchant recently sold a batch of baby crocolisks to some gullible children. Crocolisks are wild beasts, and many have escaped and now lurk in city waterways.\n\nGrab your strongest fishin' pole, drop a line in any capital city, and bring one of the little devils back to me. I'm anxious to see one.",o="在奥格瑞玛捕捉一只小鳄鱼，然后回到艾萨拉黑颚村的老人巴洛那里。",oEN="Collect a Baby Crocolisk from within Orgrimmar and return to Old Man Barlo at Blackmaw Village in Azshara.",p="给我带鱼？我要鱼。",pEN="Bring me fish? I want fish.",c="让我看看。是好鱼吗？哇！非常好的鱼。",cEN="Let me see. Is good fish? Wow! Very good fish."}
Q[26993]={d="看看这些土地成了什么样子！该死的迪菲亚兄弟会，他们的地精制造机械怪物，把它们放到这些田地里！我们这些农夫根本不想要这些。这些魔像在这儿，我拿什么养活家人和可怜的老布兰奇？\n\n你能帮忙除掉附近的魔像吗？你在这附近就能找到它们，还有西边，我的南瓜农场旁。求你帮帮我们！暴风城已经放弃我们了。",dEN="Look at the state of these lands! Curse the Defias Brotherhood, with their goblins making mechanical terrors and sending them out on these fields! We farmers didn't want any of this. How am I to feed my family and poor Old Blanchy if these golems are here?\n\nCan you help get rid of the golems nearby? You can find them just around here, and over west, by my pumpkin farm. Please help us! Stormwind has given up on us.",o="杀死 10 只生锈的收获魔像，然后回到詹森农场的农夫法尔布罗那里。",oEN="Slay 10 Rusty Harvest Golems and return to Farmer Furlbrow at The Jansen Stead.",p="我的农场安全了吗？",pEN="Is my farm safe?",c="太感谢你了，<name>！你觉得你也能帮我一个朋友解决他的魔像问题吗？",cEN="Thank you so much <name>! Do you think you could help a friend of mine with their golem problem, too?"}
Q[26994]={d="你把这一带的魔像收拾得不错，但应付这事的可不止我一个。我的好朋友萨尔迪恩也跟我说魔像在毁掉他的农场。你觉得你能帮帮他吗？他的农场就在这儿南边。",dEN="You've made good work of the golems around here, but I'm not the only one dealing with this. My good friend, Saldean, also told me the golems are destroying his farm. Do you think you could assist him? You'll find his farm just south of here.",o="与萨尔迪恩农场的农夫萨尔迪恩交谈。",oEN="Speak to Farmer Saldean at Saldean's Farm.",c="是法尔布罗派你来的？赞美大地，我这儿正需要帮手！",cEN="Furlbrow sent you? Bless the lands, I could use a hand around here!"}
Q[26995]={d="很高兴看到有人来这儿帮忙。这些魔像吓跑了我们的市民，如果不尽快解决，我担心西部荒野会被迪菲亚兄弟会侵占。总之，出去杀些魔像吧！这个农场里就有一些，或者去西边的莫尔森农场。",dEN="I'm glad to see someone helping out around here. These golems are frightening off our citizens, and if we don't get this sorted out soon, I fear Westfall will be overrun and taken by The Defias Brotherhood. Anyways, get out there and kill some golems! You can find some right on this farm, or at the Molsen Farm over to the west.",o="杀死 10 只收获魔像，然后回到萨尔迪恩农场的农夫萨尔迪恩那里。",oEN="Slay 10 Harvest Golems and return to Farmer Saldean at Saldean's Farm.",p="还有魔像要杀！西部荒野急需帮助。",pEN="There are golems to be killed! Westfall is in dire need of help.",c="啊，干得漂亮。每死一个魔像，就离自由更近一步！",cEN="Ah, excellent work. Each golem dead is a step towards freedom!"}
Q[26996]={d="你之前杀的那些魔像并不是唯一在破坏我们土地的！我的一位农夫声称在黄金海岸采石场附近的亚历克斯顿农庄又看到了一些。如果你不介意再多杀一些魔像，我们将非常感激你的帮助。",dEN="Those golems you killed earlier aren't the only ones damaging our lands! One of my farmers claims he saw some more out by The Alexston Farmstead, near the Gold Coast Quarry. If you wouldn't mind killing some more golems, your assistance would be most appreciated.",o="杀死 10 只收获看守，然后回到萨尔迪恩农场的农夫萨尔迪恩那里。",oEN="Slay 10 Harvest Watchers and return to Farmer Saldean at Saldean's Farm.",p="你把魔像杀了吗？",pEN="Have you killed the golems?",c="我们的农场离重新归西部荒野市民所有又近了一步。只剩一座农场待收复！",cEN="Our farms are one step closer to being the property of Westfall's citizens again. There is just one farm left to reclaim!"}
Q[26997]={d="我们的大部分农场已经收复，但还有一座农场需要争夺。从这里往南很远，过了哨兵岭，你会找到亡者之地，那里游荡着最强大的魔像，灼烧着大地。我曾想带几个工人过去，但魔像把我们赶了回来！我希望你能胜任，<name>，这些魔像可不是闹着玩的！",dEN="Most of our farms have been reclaimed, but there is one farm left to fight for. Far south of here, past Sentinel Hill, you will find The Dead Acre, where the most powerful golems roam and scorch the land. I tried to bring a few workers there, but the golems chased us away! I hope you're up to the task <name>, these golems are no joke!",o="杀死 10 只收获收割者，然后回到萨尔迪恩农场的农夫萨尔迪恩那里。",oEN="Slay 10 Harvest Reapers and return to Farmer Saldean at Saldean's Farm.",p="我们的农场收复了吗？",pEN="Are our farms reclaimed?",c="<农夫萨尔迪恩欢呼。>\n\n西部荒野又自由了！魔像消失了，农场重新属于我们！感谢你的帮助，<name>，如果你需要什么，随时过来。",cEN="<Farmer Saldean cheers.>\n\nWestfall is free again! The golems are gone and our farms are ours again! Thanks for your assistance <name>, and if you ever need anything, don't hesitate to stop by."}
Q[27000]={d="真是一团糟，<name>！我一直在等一批从其拉帝国腹地走私来的稀有货物，但已经太久没有我……采购团队的消息了！\n\n我毫不怀疑暮光之锤一定与这次延误有关。你能去处理他们吗？我会为你的努力给予丰厚报酬，<race>。",dEN="What a mess <name>! I've been expecting a shipment of rare goods smuggled from the heart of the Qiraji Kingdom, but I haven't heard back from my... procurement team in far too long!\n\nI have no doubt the Twilight Hammer must be involved in this delay. Could you see to them? I'll reward you handsomely for your efforts, <race>.",o="从暮光之锤窃贼那里夺回阿克桑托斯被偷的货物。他们可以在希利苏斯的沙漠中找到。",oEN="Bring Axanhtos back his stolen good from the Twilight Hammer thieves. They can be found in the deserts of Silithus.",p="我只能想象如果暮光之锤氏族拿到那批货会发生什么。光是想想就几乎值了。几乎。",pEN="I can only imagine what could happen if the Twilight Hammer clan gets ahold of that shipment. It would almost be worth it just to see. Almost.",c="啊，你干得不错，<name>。我相信你没有把这件事告诉任何人吧？",cEN="Ah, you've done well, <name>. I trust you informed no one of this matter?"}
Q[27586]={d="一个初出茅庐的炼金师，我看出来了！也许你能帮我一把。我手头的工作多得忙不过来，而闪金镇的达西护士长一直在为受伤的矿工索要一些次级治疗药水。我有一些重要工作要交给暴风城卫兵完成，但如果你愿意帮忙，就制作五瓶那种药水，交给达西护士长。",dEN="A budding alchemist, I see! Perhaps you can help me out. I have more work than I can handle right now and Matron Darcy down in Goldshire has been asking for some Minor Healing Potions for injured miners. I have some important work for the Stormwind Guard to finish, but if you'd like to help out, craft five of those potions and deliver them to Matron Darcy.",o="炼金师马洛里希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级治疗药水，并把订单送到艾尔文森林闪金镇的达西护士长那里。",oEN="Alchemist Mallory wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Healing Potion and take the order to Matron Darcy at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",p="我们这儿有很多伤员，<class>。",pEN="We have many injured here, <class>.",c="哦，愿圣光保佑你，炼金师！你回应了我的祈祷。请让我给你一些我收集的补给。",cEN="Oh, Light bless you, alchemist! You've answered my prayers. Please let me give you some supplies I've collected."}
Q[27587]={d="还有一份委托我也需要帮手——非常简单，只需最基本的技能。\n\n沿着大路往东走，你会看到一些驻扎在东谷伐木场附近的卫兵。其中一位叫托马斯卫兵的，报告说林中卫兵失踪的问题，并请求一些炼金物品来帮忙。虽然我无法阻止他们迷路，但一些次级防御药剂也许能给他们所需的优势。你愿意接受这份委托吗？",dEN="There's another commission I could use help with -- very simple, requires only the most basic of skill.\n\nDown the road to the east you'll find some guards stationed near Eastvale Logging Camp. One of them, a Guard Thomas, reported problems with guards disappearing in the woods and requested something alchemical to help. While I can't stop them getting lost, some Elixirs of Minor Defense might give them the edge they need. Are you willing to take this commission?",o="炼金师马洛里希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级防御药剂，并把订单交给艾尔文森林东谷伐木场的托马斯卫兵。",oEN="Alchemist Mallory wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Minor Defense and take the order to Guard Thomas at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="我能帮你什么，市民？",pEN="How can I help you, citizen?",c="这些药剂无法替代我们失踪的卫兵，但也许能帮我们其余人熬过这一周。谢谢你，炼金师。",cEN="These elixirs won't replace our missing guards but they might help the rest of us survive the week. Thank you, alchemist."}
Q[27588]={d="哦，你好！从你盔甲上的宁神花渍，我就能看出你是位炼金师！也许你能帮帮我？\n\n我在这儿帮这些侏儒处理他们实验室里层出不穷的意外，但有时我会法力不足。如果你能为我制作一些次级法力药水，我很乐意付钱给你，还会附赠一些补给！",dEN="Oh hi! I can tell by the peacebloom stains on your armor that you're an alchemist! Maybe you can help me?\n\nI'm here to help these other gnomes with the many mishaps that occur in their lab but sometimes I find myself low on mana. If you could craft me some Minor Mana Potions, I'd be happy to pay you for them and throw in some supplies as well!",o="医士麦莉希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级法力药水，并把订单送到丹莫罗卡兹诺斯的医士麦莉那里。",oEN="Medic Myli wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Mana Potion and take the order to Medic Myli at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="你简直不会相信普通侏儒实验室里会发生多少小意外。",pEN="You wouldn't believe how many minor accidents happen in the average gnome laboratory.",c="好耶！你有天赋，<name>。请收下这些补给，聊表谢意。愿圣光保佑你！",cEN="Yippee! You've got talent, <name>. Please take these supplies, with my thanks. May the Light bless you!"}
Q[27589]={d="你知道，如果你有兴趣多接些活儿，这一带的炼金师生意可不少。\n\n卡兹诺斯南边的矮人迫击炮小队也有很多……小意外。甚至不值得用治疗药水，但我打赌他们会对一些弱效巨魔之血药水感兴趣，如果你愿意接这份委托的话。",dEN="You know, there's a lot of work for an alchemist around here, if you're interested in doing more.\n\nThe dwarven mortar team south of Kharanos also has a lot of... small mishaps. Not even something worth using a healing potion on -- but I bet they'd be interested in some Weak Troll's Blood potions, if you're interested in a commission.",o="医士麦莉希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶弱效巨魔之血药剂，并把订单送到丹莫罗卡兹诺斯南边营地的安格斯那里。",oEN="Medic Myli wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Weak Troll's Blood Elixir and take the order to Angus at his camp south of Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="当心迫击炮，<class>！",pEN="Watch the mortars, <class>!",c="是啊，这能帮我们不少忙。下次进城我得谢谢麦莉。也谢谢你送来的东西。让我给你些补给。",cEN="Aye, this'll help us out quite a bit. I'll hafta thank Myli next time I'm in town. And thanks to ye too, fer this. Let me give ye some supplies."}
Q[27590]={d="抱歉，我忍不住注意到你是位炼金师。辛德拉被各种请求压得喘不过气，又太善良，不忍拒绝任何人。也许你不介意替她接几份订单？\n\n月之女祭司阿玛拉为她的游侠订购了五瓶狮王之力药剂。如果你能制作这些药剂，你会在通往达纳苏斯西边的路上某处找到她。",dEN="Pardon me, but I couldn't help notice that you are an alchemist. Cyndra is besieged with requests and she is too kind to turn anyone down. Perhaps you wouldn't mind taking a few of her orders?\n\nMoon Priestess Amara requisitioned five Elixir of Lion's Strength for her outriders. If you can craft these elixirs, you'll find her somewhere on the road west to Darnassus.",o="马洛尼·刃叶希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶狮王之力药剂，并把订单送到泰达希尔通往达纳苏斯西边道路上的月之女祭司阿玛拉那里。",oEN="Malorne Bladeleaf wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Lion's Strength and take the order to Moon Priestess Amara at the road leading west to Darnassus in Teldrassil.",p="Ishnu'allah（精灵语问候），<class>。",pEN="Ishnu'allah, <class>.",c="感谢你和你的手艺为我带来这些药剂。我已备好一些补给，作为额外的报酬让你带走。",cEN="My thanks to you and your crafting skills for bringing me these elixirs. I have prepared some supplies for you to take as additional payment."}
Q[27591]={d="我希望辛德拉能告诉别人她太忙了，但我理解她想帮助每个来找她的人。云隙哨兵有一份高优先级的请求，她独自一人守在神谕林地。如果你能制作一些次级活力药水并送过去，会帮辛德拉大忙。",dEN="I wish Cyndra would tell someone that she is too busy, but I understand her desire to help all who approach. There is a high priority request from Sentinel Cloudsbreak, who is all alone at the Oracle Glade. If you could craft some Minor Rejuvenation Potions and deliver them, it would help Cyndra greatly.",o="马洛尼·刃叶希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级活力药水，并把订单送到泰达希尔神谕林地的哨兵阿妮娅·云隙那里。",oEN="Malorne Bladeleaf wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Rejuvenation Potion and take the order to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the Oracle Glade in Teldrassil.",p="Ishnu'allah（精灵语问候），<class>。",pEN="Ishnu'allah, <class>.",c="感谢你和你的手艺为我带来这些药水。我已备好一些补给，作为额外的报酬让你带走。",cEN="My thanks to you and your crafting skills for bringing me these potions. I have prepared some supplies for you to take as additional payment."}
Q[27592]={d="我只是个普通商人，没有制作药剂药水的手艺，但我希望能帮助西部荒野的同胞。农夫萨尔迪恩在对付他农场里横行的机器时受了些轻伤。如果你能制作一些次级治疗药水并送到萨尔迪恩农场，我会因为无法为他多做些什么而感到宽慰一些。",dEN="I'm a simple merchant, with no talent for crafting elixirs and potions, but I wish to help my fellow citizens of Westfall. Farmer Saldean has sustained some minor wounds while dealing with the machines running rampant on his farm. If you could craft some Lesser Healing Potions and deliver them to the Saldean farm, it would ease my conscience that I can't do more to help him.",o="吉娜·麦格雷戈希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级治疗药水，并把订单送到西部荒野萨尔迪恩农场的农夫萨尔迪恩那里。",oEN="Gina MacGregor wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Healing Potion and take the order to Farmer Saldean at Saldean's Farm in Westfall.",p="什么风把你吹来了，陌生人？",pEN="What brings you by, stranger?",c="吉娜从小就是个这么有爱心的姑娘。我感谢你的关心。请收下一些我们为不时之需储存的补给。",cEN="Gina was always such a caring lady, even as a little girl. I appreciate your concern. Please take some of these supplies we have stored for a rainy day."}
Q[27593]={d="说到帮忙……还有一个人在寻求炼金师的帮助。你可以在匕首岭的一处营地找到格林布兹·雷酒。他一直在找人帮他制作几瓶黑口鱼油。如果你有兴趣，我确信他会付钱给你。",dEN="Speaking of helping out... there is someone else who has been seeking assistance from an alchemist. You can find Grimbooze Thunderbrew at a camp up in the Dagger Hills. He's been looking for someone to make him several vials of Blackmouth Oil. If you're interested, I'm certain he'd pay you.",o="吉娜·麦格雷戈希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶黑口鱼油，并把订单送到西部荒野匕首岭的格林布兹·雷酒那里。",oEN="Gina MacGregor wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Blackmouth Oil and take the order to Grimbooze Thunderbrew at the Dagger Hills in Westfall.",p="什么风把你吹来了，陌生人？",pEN="What brings you by, stranger?",c="啊，这正是我需要的。用鱼味麦酒做实验的时候到了！哦，收下这个，作为我感谢你帮忙的心意。",cEN="Aye, this is what I needed. The time for experimentin' with fish-flavored ale is upon us! Oh, and take this as my thanks for your help."}
Q[27594]={d="每隔几个月就有朝圣者前往古树之林向奥努求教。他的智慧有时难以理解，所以我想储备一些智慧药剂，以防能帮朝圣者读懂奥努的话。如果你能制作一些并带给我，我很乐意用一些有用的补给酬谢你。",dEN="Every few months there are pilgrims who travel to the Grove of the Ancients to consult with Onu. His wisdom can sometimes be difficult to understand, so I'd like to stock some Elixirs of Wisdom in case that helps the pilgrims make sense of Onu's words. If you could craft and deliver some to me, I would be happy to reward you with some useful supplies.",o="乌兰娜希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶智慧药剂，并把订单送到黑海岸古树之林的乌兰娜那里。",oEN="Ullanna wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Wisdom and take the order to Ullanna at the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore.",p="你做好药剂了吗？",pEN="Have you crafted the elixirs?",c="谢谢你，<name>。现在你是我最喜欢的炼金师了。请收下这些补给，愿艾露恩的光芒照耀你。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You are now my favorite alchemist. Please take these supplies, and may Elune's light shine upon you."}
Q[27595]={d="最近有一群矮人经过这里。他们正前往一处被称为雷姆旅行挖掘场的挖掘地点。我听说他们在魔像上遇到了些麻烦，不知道他们能不能用上一些次级坚韧药剂来应对。值得去看看，你不觉得吗？",dEN="A group of dwarves came by recently. They were making their way to an excavation site, known as Remtravel's Excavation. I've heard they're having some problems with golems and I wonder if they could use some Elixirs of Minor Fortitude to help them deal with the problem. It's worth checking out, don't you think?",o="乌兰娜希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级坚韧药剂，并把订单送到黑海岸雷姆旅行挖掘场的考古学家埃弗里特那里。",oEN="Ullanna wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Minor Fortitude and take the order to Archaeologist Everit at Remtravel's Excavation in Darkshore.",p="我希望你不是来这儿想着挖掘的，<class>。",pEN="I hope you're not here hoping to dig, <class>.",c="是啊，你这么做可真够意思。幸好我还有些你可能用得上的补给。来，拿去吧。",cEN="Aye, this is right decent o' ye. Fortunately, I even have some supplies ye might find useful. Here, take 'em."}
Q[27596]={d="你好，<class>……或者我该说，炼金师 <name>？\n\n我这儿的请求堆到耳朵根了。也许你不介意调几瓶药水帮我一把？\n\n湖畔的沃格·深水需要一批水息药剂。我听说他想去湖里钓鱼。真是再古怪不过了……总之，你愿意帮的忙都会受到感激。",dEN="Hail <class>... or should I say, Alchemist <name>?\n\nI'm up to my ears in requests here. Mayhaps you wouldn't mind brewin' a few potions to help me out?\n\nWarg Deepwater down by the loch is in need of a parcel o' Elixir of Water Breathin'. Wants to go fishin' IN the loch, I hear. It's the darndest thing... anywho, any help yer willin' to give would be appreciated.",o="加克·治伤者希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶水息药剂，并把订单送到洛克莫丹湖畔的沃格·深水那里。",oEN="Ghak Healtouch wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Water Breathing and take the order to Warg Deepwater at the Loch's shore in Loch Modan.",p="今天鱼上钩得欢，<class>！",pEN="Fish are bitin' today, <class>!",c="哦！是的！我确实在找些药剂。为了在水下钓鱼？那算什么蠢主意？不，我只是钓鱼时弄丢了怀表，想游来游去找到它。谢谢你！",cEN="Oh! Yes! I was lookin' for some elixirs, indeed. To fish underwater? What kinda daft idea is that? Nae, I just lost my watch while fishin' and I'd like to swim around until I find it. Thank ye!"}
Q[27597]={d="远行者营地的马雷克·铁心向我索要一些游速药水。他自认是个鳄鱼猎人，想要些药水好在水里跟上那些畜生，我猜。有兴趣接下这单吗？",dEN="I have a request for some Swim Speed Potions from Marek Ironheart up at Farstrider Lodge. Fancies himself a crocolisk hunter, and wants some potions to keep up with them beasties in the water, I reckon. Interested in taking this one off my hands?",o="加克·治伤者希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶游速药水，并把订单送到洛克莫丹远行者营地的马雷克·铁心那里。",oEN="Ghak Healtouch wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Swim Speed Potion and take the order to Marek Ironheart at Farstrider Lodge in Loch Modan.",p="啊，狩猎的快感！",pEN="Ah, the thrill of the hunt!",c="有了这些药水，鳄鱼再也逃不出我的手掌心了。收下一些补给，作为我的谢意！",cEN="With these potions, the crocs won't be getting away from me anymore. Take some supplies as my thanks!"}
Q[27598]={d="<class>，有人告诉我你也是炼金师。我想代表守夜人订购一些治疗药水。请把它们送到我们位于暮色森林中部的营地的守望者多兹那里。你能办到吗？",dEN="<class>, I was told that you are also an alchemist. I would like to place an order on behalf of the Night's Watch for some Healing Potions. Please deliver them to Watcher Dodds at our encampment in central Duskwood. Can you handle that?",o="指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶治疗药水，并把订单送到暮色森林中部守夜人营地的守望者多兹那里。",oEN="Commander Althea Ebonlocke wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Healing Potion and take the order to Watcher Dodds at the Night's Watch encampment in central Duskwood.",p="在这些森林里小心点，<class>。天黑后不安全……其他时候也一样。",pEN="Be careful in these woods, <class>. It isn't safe after dark... or any other time.",c="谢谢。我会让埃伯洛克指挥官知道你完成了契约。我获准向你提供这些补给。",cEN="Thank you. I will let Commander Ebonlocke know that you completed your contract. I am authorized to provide you with these supplies."}
Q[27599]={d="哦……一位炼金师。我想你会欣赏我对毒药的兴趣。毕竟，这跟炼金术也没那么不同。\n\n实际上，我正需要你的服务。我想制作一种带火焰底色的毒药……要能造成一点灼烧。如果你能为我制作一些火焰之油，我可以提供一些有用的材料供你日后制作。",dEN="Oh... an alchemist. I think you'll appreciate my interest in poisons. It's not such a different art as alchemy, after all.\n\nActually, I could use your services. I want to make a poison with a fiery undertone... something that causes a bit of burning. If you could craft me some Fire Oil, I can provide you with some useful reagents for your future crafts.",o="杰拉德·克劳利希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶火焰之油，并把订单送到赤脊山湖畔镇的杰拉德·克劳利那里。",oEN="Gerald Crawley wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Fire Oil and take the order to Gerald Crawley at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="要是我能想出点什么让人发痒的东西就好了……",pEN="If only I could think of something that would cause itching....",c="对，正是我要找的东西。说好的交易就是交易，<name>。这是你的补给。",cEN="Yes, just what I was looking for. A deal's a deal, <name>. Here are your supplies."}
Q[27600]={d="很高兴在这里见到同行炼金师。银翼哨兵的订单我已经拖后了，正需要多一双手。\n\n你能制作五瓶强效巨魔之血药水，送到灰谷银翼林的哨兵法尔桑那里吗？我们必须确保哨兵们为战歌峡谷的战事得到充足的补给。",dEN="I am glad to see a fellow alchemist here. I am behind on orders for the Silverwing Sentinels, and I could use an extra pair of hands.\n\nCould you make five Strong Troll's Blood potions and deliver them to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove? We must make sure our Sentinels are well supplied for the war over Warsong Gulch.",o="凯拉娜希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶强效巨魔之血药剂，并把订单送到灰谷银翼林的哨兵法尔桑那里。",oEN="Kylanna wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Strong Troll's Blood Elixir and take the order to Sentinel Farsong at Silverwing Grove in Ashenvale.",p="愿艾露恩指引你，<class>。",pEN="May Elune guide you, <class>.",c="谢谢你完成这份订单，<class>。我获准向你发放一些补给，连同我们的谢意。",cEN="Thank you for fulfilling this order, <class>. I am authorized to issue you some supplies along with our gratitude."}
Q[27601]={d="我不是炼金师……算不上。但你也看到了我身后冒泡的药瓶，我喜欢摆弄药水和药剂。\n\n我用初级法力药水作大多数混合物的基底，可我已经用光了！如果你愿意再为我做些，我很乐意与你分享我的一些补给。",dEN="I'm not an alchemist... not really. But, as you can see from my bubbling vials behind me, I like to tinker with potions and elixirs.\n\nI use Lesser Mana Potions as the base for most of my mixtures, but I'm all out! If you'd be willing to craft me some more, I'd happily share some of my supplies with you.",o="凯特琳·格拉斯曼希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级法力药水，并把订单送到湿地米奈希尔港的凯特琳·格拉斯曼那里。",oEN="Caitlin Grassman wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Mana Potion and take the order to Caitlin Grassman at Menethil Harbor in Wetlands.",p="没有什么比药剂熬煮时的气味更让我喜欢的了。",pEN="There's nothing I like more than the smell of a potion brewing.",c="哦，太棒了！现在我可以回去干活了。这是分给你的那部分补给！",cEN="Oh, fantastic! Now I can get back to work. Here's your portion of these supplies!"}
Q[27602]={d="只要库尔森上校还有他的巫医制作的药剂和药水，我们这场仗就打不赢。虽然我已经有任务去切断那些补给，但我们也需要自己的优势。\n\n我想委托你制作一些精准药剂并送到我这里。有了这些，我们就能压过库尔森的丛林战士一头。",dEN="We're fighting a losing battle against Colonel Kurzen as long as he has the elixirs and potions made by his medicine men. While I've already got a task to interrupt the flow of those supplies, we could use our own edge too.\n\nI'd like to commission you to craft some Elixirs of Accuracy and deliver them to me here. With those on hand, we can get an edge over Kurzen's jungle fighters.",o="约瓦中士希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶精准药剂，并把订单送到荆棘谷反抗军营地的约瓦中士那里。",oEN="Sergeant Yohwa wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Accuracy and take the order to Sergeant Yohwa at Rebel Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="希望你已经拿到那些药剂了。库尔森的手下可毫不留情。",pEN="I hope you have those elixirs. Kurzen's men are ruthless.",c="干得漂亮，<name>。这些补给也有助于提振士气。说到补给，收下这些材料吧，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Excellent work, <name>. These supplies will also help morale. Speaking of supplies, take these reagents with my thanks."}
Q[27603]={d="哦——一位有本事的炼金师！我需要你的帮助！\n\n沼泽里住着一位深居简出的女士，名叫塔贝莎。她派信使来告诉我，她急需初级隐形药水，可我既没有存货，也不知道该怎么制作！你能帮我做些并给她送过去吗？",dEN="Oh -- an alchemist of skill! I need your help!\n\nThere's a reclusive lady who lives out in the marsh named Tabetha. She sent a messenger to tell me that she is in desperate need of Lesser Invisibility Potions, but I don't have any in stock and I don't know how to make them! Could you help me out by crafting some and delivering them to her?",o="乌玛·巴图姆希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级隐形药水，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽塔贝莎农场的塔贝莎那里。",oEN="Uma Bartulm wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Invisibility Potion and take the order to Tabetha at Tabetha's Farm in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="什么风把你吹来了，<class>？",pEN="What brings you here, <class>?",c="啊，对，我的订单。与真正的魔法相比，炼金术只是入门，但它自有其用。给，一些额外的补给，算是谢意。",cEN="Ah yes, my order. Alchemy is rudimentary compared to real magic, but it has it's uses. Here, some extra supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27604]={d="我奉塞纳里奥议会之命来此执行一项重要任务，但这片土地让我很不安。我的关节疼痛，附近恶魔的邪能污染让我毛骨悚然。\n\n我注意到你是个有本事的炼金师。如果你能为我制作一批坚韧药剂，就能帮我抵御这片土地的污秽，直到我的任务完成。你觉得如何？",dEN="I am here at the behest of the Cenarion Circle on an important mission, but this land does not sit easily with me. My joints ache, and the fel taint of the nearby demons makes my hide crawl.\n\nI note that you are a skilled alchemist. If you could craft me a supply of Elixirs of Fortitude, it would help me withstand the foulness of this land until my mission is complete. What say you?",o="守护者玛兰迪斯希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶坚韧药剂，并把订单送到凄凉之地尼耶尔前哨站的守护者玛兰迪斯那里。",oEN="Keeper Marandis wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Fortitude and take the order to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",p="你找到制作那些药剂所需的材料了吗，<race>？",pEN="Were you able to find the materials to make those elixirs, <race>?",c="我代表塞纳里奥议会感谢你。善行必有回报。请收下这些补给，作为你酬劳之外的额外谢礼。",cEN="I thank you on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. No good deed goes unrewarded. Please accept these supplies in addition to your fee."}
Q[27605]={d="辛迪加越来越大胆了，<name>。他们甚至刺杀了南海镇的前任地方官！\n\n要是我能制作些猫眼药剂，让我们的卫兵看穿那些潜行的盗贼就好了，可我的技艺还不够。\n\n你似乎会！我能否请你去行个善，把一些猫眼药剂送到镇上的雷德帕斯元帅那里？",dEN="The Syndicate have been bold, <name>. They even assassinated the former magistrate of Southshore!\n\nIf only I could make some Catseye Elixirs so that our guards could see those stealthy rogues, but I don't yet have the skill.\n\nYou seem to though! Could I persuade you to do a good deed and deliver some Catseye Elixirs to Marshal Redpath here in town?",o="学徒霍尼韦尔希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶猫眼药剂，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南海镇的雷德帕斯元帅那里。",oEN="Apprentice Honeywell wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Catseye Elixir and take the order to Marshal Redpath at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="有什么能帮你的吗，公民？",pEN="How can I help you, citizen?",c="学徒霍尼韦尔很善于观察——多亏了你，我们的卫兵现在也一样了。让我从我们的储备中拨一些补给给你，作为对这桩善举的谢意。",cEN="Apprentice Honeywell is very observant -- and, thanks to you, now our guards will be as well. Let me grant you some supplies from our stores as my thanks for this good deed."}
Q[27606]={d="不久前，两名联盟斥候前往戈舍克农场侦察部落在那里的活动。他们一直没有回来，我担心他们遇上了麻烦。\n\n我的背包里没有多余的特效治疗药水，但我看得出你熟悉炼金实验室。如果你能制作一些并送到基内洛瑞那里，我就能安心了。",dEN="Awhile ago two Alliance scouts headed out to Go'Shek Farm to observe the activities of the Horde there. They haven't come back and I'm worried they may have encountered some trouble.\n\nI don't have any extra Greater Healing Potions in my inventory but I can see you know your way around an alchemy lab. If you could craft some and deliver them to Kinelory, it would put my mind at ease.",o="德罗夫纳·铁酿希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效治疗药水，并把订单送到阿拉希高地戈舍克农场的基内洛瑞那里。",oEN="Drovnar Strongbrew wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Greater Healing Potion and take the order to Kinelory at Go'Shek Farm in Arathi Highlands.",p="小声点——附近有很多部落成员！",pEN="Quiet -- there are many Horde nearby!",c="德罗夫纳真是好心，但你也看到了，我们在这个观察点没什么危险。不过为麻烦做好准备总没坏处。\n\n我从部落那里搜刮了一些补给。请自己拿一些吧。",cEN="That was kind of Drovnar, but as you can see we're in little danger at this vantage point. It never hurts to be prepared for trouble though.\n\nI scavenged some supplies from the Horde. Please, take some for yourself."}
Q[27607]={d="我不信任地精，所以当那个在大陆海岸扎营的地精向我求购特效水下呼吸药剂时，我没理他。\n\n但我心里确实过意不去，<class>。我看不出那些药剂能造成什么危害。可我还是没法亲自去送。如果你有兴趣赚点钱，我请你去满足他的请求。",dEN="I don't trust goblins, so when a goblin who is camping on the mainland shore requested some Elixirs of Greater Water Breathing, I ignored him.\n\nBut I do feel bad, <class>. I don't see what harm those elixirs could do. Still, I can't bring myself to deliver them. If you're interested in making some coin, I invite you to fulfill his request.",o="洛加纳斯希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效水下呼吸药剂，并把订单送到菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸、祖尔宾·范达佐营地的祖尔宾·范达佐那里。",oEN="Logannas wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Greater Water Breathing and take the order to Zorbin Fandazzle at his camp on the Forgotten Coast in Feralas.",p="嘿哟！我是不是在你护甲上闻到了金棘草的味道？",pEN="Hey-o! Is that the smell of goldthorn I detect on your armor?",c="哎呀，谢谢你，<race>！我不知道那个暗夜精灵为什么拖了这么久才完成这份订单，但我很高兴拿到这些药剂。给，一点额外的小费，连同你的报酬。",cEN="Gee, thanks <race>! I don't know what took that night elf so long to fill this order, but I'm happy to have these elixirs. Here, a little bonus to go with your payment."}
Q[27608]={d="啊，同行炼金师。我大部分时间都在这里研究天灾瘟疫的影响，如果我能分辨出亡灵在哪些区域游荡、哪些区域没有，效率会高得多。唉，我好像把侦测亡灵药剂的配方笔记放丢了。如果你愿意好心为我酿制五瓶，我很乐意在我的研究补给中分一些给你，作为酬劳之外的谢礼。",dEN="Ah, a fellow alchemist. I've spent most of my time here researching the effects of the Scourge plague and I could be more effective if I could tell what areas the undead roam and which they don't. Alas, I seem to have misplaced my notes on the formula for Elixir of Detect Undead. If you'd be kind enough to brew me five elixirs, I'd be happy to provide some supplies from my research in addition to your fee.",o="炼金师阿宾顿希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶侦测亡灵药剂，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地冰风营地的炼金师阿宾顿那里。",oEN="Alchemist Arbington wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Detect Undead and take the order to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="骷髅和食尸鬼的潜行本事出人意料地好。",pEN="Skeletons and ghouls can be surprisingly stealthy.",c="制作得很精良，<name>——请原谅我这挑剔的眼光。认识另一位同行总是件好事。这是我答应你的补给。谢谢！",cEN="Finely crafted, <name>, if you'll excuse my critical eye. Always nice to meet another practitioner of the craft. And here are the supplies I promised. Thank you!"}
Q[27609]={d="哦，一位炼金师。我不懂那门学问，但我尊重它！\n\n其实，我能请你帮个忙吗？我有时会弄丢一两件工具，掉到这座悬崖下面去。我可以用我的传送器下去再回来，但驱动它的能量很宝贵。如果我有一些特效敏捷药剂，就能改从崖壁爬下去，把电池留到真正需要的时候。有兴趣帮忙吗？",dEN="Ooh, an alchemist. I don't understand that particular brand of science but I do respect it!\n\nActually, could I ask you a favor? Sometimes I lose a tool or three over the edge of this cliff here. I can pop down and back with my teleporter here, but the energy to run it is precious. If I had some Elixirs of Greater Agility, I could scale the cliff instead, and save the battery for when we really need it. Interested in helping out?",o="威尔伯·摇晃史密斯希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效敏捷药剂，并把订单送到艾萨拉摇晃谷的威尔伯·摇晃史密斯那里。",oEN="Wilbur Wobblesmith wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Greater Agility and take the order to Wilbur Wobblesmith at Wobble Hollow in Azshara.",p="那些药剂有消息吗？我可能把我第二喜欢的陀螺仪微调器弄掉了，它滚到悬崖边去了……",pEN="Any word about those elixirs? I may have dropped my second favorite gyromatic micro-adjuster and it rolled over the edge....",c="啊！我很期待把理论付诸实践。结果我刚才发现那个微调器被我踢到架子底下了，但我知道这些药剂很快就派得上用场！",cEN="Ah! I am excited to put my theory into practice. Turns out I just kicked that micro-adjuster under a shelf, but I know I'll have use for these soon!"}
Q[27610]={d="在这片森林待久了，它的污染会钻进你的脑子，<class>。我真正需要的是一两晚安稳的睡眠。\n\n不过，哦……你是炼金师，对吧？也许你愿意为我制作一些无梦睡眠药水？如果我再不好好睡一觉，我怕自己会屈服于邪能疯狂的诱惑！",dEN="The taint of these woods gets into your mind after a time, <class>. What I could really use is a night or two of uninterrupted sleep.\n\nBut, oh... you're an alchemist aren't you? Perhaps you'd be willing to craft me some Dreamless Sleep Potions? If I don't have a good night's sleep soon, I fear I might succumb to the lure of fel madness!",o="埃里丹·蓝风希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶无梦睡眠药水，并把订单送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的埃里丹·蓝风那里。",oEN="Eridan Bluewind wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Dreamless Sleep Potion and take the order to Eridan Bluewind at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="那些药剂有消息吗？我可能做了个醒着的噩梦。",pEN="Any word about those elixirs? I may have had a waking nightmare.",c="你救了一条命，至少救了一个脑子，<class>。我向你致以最诚挚的谢意。",cEN="You're a life-saver, or at least a mind-saver, <class>. You have my sincerest thanks."}
Q[27611]={d="原来是个新手炼金师！也许你能帮我。我手上的活儿多得忙不过来，奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的工头欣克一直在要初级治疗药水，给受伤的工人用。我正在为这里的苦工做一件要紧事，不过如果你愿意帮忙，就做五瓶那种药水给欣克送去。",dEN="A buddin' alchemist, I see! Perhaps ya can help me out. I got more work than I can handle right now and Supervisor Hink up at de zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar has been askin' for some Minor Healing Potions for injured workers. I be workin' on somethin' important work for de grunts, but if ya'd like to help out, craft five of dose potions and deliver 'em to Hink.",o="米奥赞希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级治疗药水，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的工头欣克那里。",oEN="Miao'zan wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Healing Potion and take the order to Supervisor Hink at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar in Durotar.",p="该死的蝎子。我妈就警告过我不要在荒地里干活！",pEN="Damn these scorpids. My ma warned me not to work in a wasteland!",c="哦，太好了。这样工人被蝎子蜇了，我们至少能硬把他们救回来。让我给你一些我收集的补给。",cEN="Oh, good. Now when the workers get stung by the scorpids we can at least force them back to health. Let me give you some supplies I've collected."}
Q[27612]={d="这里还有一份委托，我也需要人帮忙——非常简单，只要最基础的技艺就行。\n\n沿路往东走，你会找到剃刀岭。加索克指挥着这一带的苦工，他就驻扎在那里。他手下的人需要一些初级防御药剂。你愿意接下这份委托吗？",dEN="Dere's another commission I could use help with -- very simple, requires only de most basic of skill.\n\nDown de road to de east you'll find Razor Hill. Gar'Thok commands de grunts in dis area and dat's where he's stationed. He wants some Elixirs of Minor Defense for his men. Are you willin' to take dis commission?",o="米奥赞希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级防御药剂，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭的加索克那里。",oEN="Miao'zan wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Minor Defense and take the order to Gar'Thok at Razor Hill in Durotar.",p="Lok'tar，<race>。愿胜利属于你。",pEN="Lok'tar, <race>.",c="这些药剂换不回我们失踪的苦工，但也许能帮我们剩下的人熬过这个星期。谢谢你，炼金师。",cEN="These elixirs won't replace our missing grunts but they might help the rest of us survive the week. Thank you, alchemist."}
Q[27613]={d="从你护甲上的宁神花汁渍我就看得出你是炼金师！也许你能帮我？\n\n我的学业已经落下，订单却越积越多，我一个人做不完。如果你能帮把手，我就能回去学习，好在实验室里派上更大用场。如果你愿意帮忙，就制作一些初级法力药水，送到东边红岩地的贤者雨图腾那里。",dEN="I can tell by the peacebloom stains on your armor that you're an alchemist! Maybe you can help me?\n\nI'm behind on my studies and we have orders piling up that I can't fill. If you could help out, I could get back to studying so I can be more useful in the lab. If you want to help, craft some Minor Mana Potions, and deliver them to Sage Raintotem at Red Rocks to the east.",o="克雷希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级法力药水，并把订单送到莫高雷红岩地的博学者雨图腾那里。",oEN="Kray wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Mana Potion and take the order to Lorekeeper Raintotem at Red Rocks in Mulgore.",p="这里是圣地，<race>。",pEN="This is a sacred place, <race>.",c="谢谢你，<name>。我在仪式中使用这些药水。请收下这些补给，连同我的谢意。愿大地母亲保佑你！",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I use these potions in my ceremonies. Please take these supplies, with my thanks. May the Earthmother bless you!"}
Q[27614]={d="你知道，这附近对炼金师来说活儿很多，如果你有兴趣多接一些的话。\n\n莫林·云行者巡逻着通往贫瘠之地的南边大路，他经常遇上……小意外。甚至不值得动用一瓶治疗药水——但我敢说他会对一些弱效巨魔之血药水感兴趣。如果你有兴趣接这份委托，就制作五瓶弱效巨魔之血药水给他送去。",dEN="You know, there's a lot of work for an alchemist around here, if you're interested in doing more.\n\nMorin Cloudstalker patrols the road south that leads to the Barrens and he often experiences... small mishaps. Not even something worth using a healing potion on -- but I bet he'd be interested in some Weak Troll's Blood potions. If you're interested in a commission, craft five Weak Troll's Blood potions and deliver them to him.",o="克雷希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶弱效巨魔之血药剂，并把订单送到莫高雷血蹄村南边大路上的莫林·云行者那里。",oEN="Kray wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Weak Troll's Blood Elixir and take the order to Morin Cloudstalker at the road south of Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="一想到风险投资公司为了利润竟愿意对我们犯下种种暴行，我就怒火中烧。",pEN="I seethe with anger at the thought of the atrocities the Venture Co. is willing to perpetrate against us in the name of profit.",c="这对我有帮助，<class>。谢谢你制作这些药剂。让我给你一些我们从风险投资公司那里缴获的补给。",cEN="This will help me, <class>. My thanks to you for crafting these elixirs. Let me give you some of the supplies we recovered from the Venture Co."}
Q[27615]={d="我忍不住注意到你是个炼金师。我被各种请求围得团团转，其中一些优先级低的根本不值得我花时间。如果你想要练手，也许不介意接下其中几份订单？\n\n死亡守卫为那个笨手笨脚的戈尔 multiples 申请了五瓶狮之力药剂。如果你能制作这些药剂，可以在布瑞尔西边的大路上找到他。",dEN="I can't help but notice that you are an alchemist. I am besieged with requests and some of these low priority ones aren't worth my time. If you'd like the practice perhaps you wouldn't mind taking a few of these orders?\n\nThe Deathguards requisitioned five Elixir of Lion's Strength for that lumbering oaf Gordo. If you can craft these elixirs, you'll find him somewhere on the road west of Brill.",o="药剂师乔汉希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶狮之力药剂，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔西边大路上的戈尔 multiples。",oEN="Apothecary Johaan wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Lion's Strength and take the order to Gordo at the road leading west of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你带了什么？",pEN="What you got?",c="这个让戈尔 multiples 变壮？戈尔 multiples 喜欢壮。戈尔 multiples 给霍兰德主人采植物。你拿植物。",cEN="This make Gordo strong? Gordo like strong. Gordo pick plants for Master Holland. You take plants."}
Q[27616]={d="在我收到的所有琐碎请求里，这一件最重要。梅里尔·温迪尔经常处理天灾石，那东西似乎在消耗她的身心。如果你能制作一些初级回复药水送过去，对梅里尔会是很大的帮助。你可以在附近的墓地找到她。",dEN="Of all the trivial requests I receive, this is the most important. Merril Wendyl handles Scourgestones on a regular basis, which seem to sap her body and mind. If you could craft some Minor Rejuvenation Potions and deliver them, it would help Merril greatly. You'll find her in the nearby graveyard.",o="药剂师乔汉希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级回复药水，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔墓地的梅里尔·温迪尔那里。",oEN="Apothecary Johaan wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Minor Rejuvenation Potion and take the order to Merril Wendyl at the Brill Cemetery in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你好……？",pEN="Hello...?",c="天灾石会留下印记。感谢你和你的手艺给我带来这些药水。我有一些补给，你拿去作为额外的报酬吧。",cEN="Scourgestones leave a mark. My thanks to you and your crafting skills for bringing me these potions. I have some supplies for you to take as additional payment."}
Q[27617]={d="我是个忙人，时间要花在远比制作药剂药水更重要的事情上。但我仍想帮助我的被遗忘者同胞。我听说墓室北边的路上出了事故。如果你能制作一些次级治疗药水，送到事故现场的死亡守卫基萨佩尔那里，我这颗无法多帮他的心安一些。",dEN="I'm a busy man, with much more important demands on my time than crafting elixirs and potions. Still, I wish to help my fellow Forsaken. I heard there was an accident on the road north of the Sepulcher. If you could craft some Lesser Healing Potions and deliver them to Deathguard Kitsapell at the crash site, it would ease my conscience that I can't do more to help him.",o="药剂师雷弗拉尔希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶次级治疗药水，并把订单送到银松森林墓室北边大路上的死亡守卫基萨佩尔那里。",oEN="Apothecary Renferrel wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Healing Potion and take the order to Deathguard Kitsapell at the road north of the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="什么风把你吹来了？",pEN="What brings you by?",c="雷弗拉尔肯定又想跟我要什么了。也许他回幽暗城的时候又得我替他喂猫。\n\n算了，谢谢你送来的药水。我们商队带的补给，你自己拿一些吧。",cEN="Renferrel must want something from me. Perhaps I need to feed his cat while he's in the Undercity again.\n\nNo matter, I appreciate the potions. Help yourself to some of the supplies we were carrying in the caravan."}
Q[27618]={d="说到帮忙……还有一个人一直在找炼金师帮忙。你可以在北流海岸、穿过窸窣黑暗之后的营地里找到基利安·萨纳萨。他一直在找人给他做几瓶黑嘴鱼油，呃，我可能把他给我的鱼用在别处了。如果你有兴趣，我相信他会付你钱。",dEN="Speaking of helping out... there is someone else who has been seeking assistance from an alchemist. You can find Killian Sanatha at a camp up the coast in North Tide's Run, past the Skittering Dark. He's been looking for someone to make him several vials of Blackmouth Oil, and, uh, I may have used the fish he gave me for something else. If you're interested, I'm certain he'd pay you.",o="药剂师雷弗拉尔希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶黑嘴鱼油，并把订单送到银松森林北流海岸的基利安·萨纳萨那里。",oEN="Apothecary Renferrel wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Blackmouth Oil and take the order to Killian Sanatha at North Tide's Run in Silverpine Forest.",p="什么风把你吹来了，陌生人？",pEN="What brings you by, stranger?",c="这正是我要的。品尝鱼味麦酒的时机到了！哦，收下这个，算是谢你帮忙。",cEN="This is what I needed. The time for experimenting with fish-flavored ale is upon us! Oh, and take this as my thanks for your help."}
Q[27619]={d="每隔几个月就有朝圣者前往拜访一位住在哀嚎洞穴顶上的隐居牛头人。她的智慧有时很难理解，所以我想备一些智慧药剂送给她。如果你能制作并送去一些，她会很乐意用一些有用的补给酬谢你。",dEN="Every few months there are pilgrims who travel to visit with a reclusive tauren who lives atop Wailing Caverns. Her wisdom can sometimes be difficult to understand, so I'd like to stock some Elixirs of Wisdom to give to her. If you could craft and deliver some, she would be happy to reward you with some useful supplies.",o="药剂师赫尔布林希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶智慧药剂，并把订单送到贫瘠之地哀嚎洞穴顶上她家中的法拉·贤风那里。",oEN="Apothecary Helbrim wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Wisdom and take the order to Falla Sagewind at her home on top of Wailing Caverns in the Barrens.",p="有什么能帮你的吗，陌生人？",pEN="How can I help you, stranger?",c="谢谢你，<name>。现在你是我最喜欢的炼金师了。请收下这些补给，愿大地母亲保佑你。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. You are now my favorite alchemist. Please take these supplies, and may the Earthmother bless you."}
Q[27620]={d="在这片大陆上所有奇怪的生物里，我觉得巨魔最讨人厌。他们身上有味，又不欣赏优秀文学……总之，有个叫辛齐尔的巨魔跟我要一些初级坚韧药剂。如果你能替我把这单接走，我不会抱怨。",dEN="Of all the strange creatures that live on this continent, I find trolls to be the most disagreeable. They smell, they don't enjoy fine literature... anyway, I have a request from a troll named Shin'Zil for some Elixirs of Minor Fortitude. If you could take this one off my hands, I wouldn't complain.",o="药剂师赫尔布林希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级坚韧药剂，并把订单送到贫瘠之地十字路口以北他家里的辛齐尔那里。",oEN="Apothecary Helbrim wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Minor Fortitude and take the order to Shin'Zil at his home north of the Crossroads in the Barrens..",p="希望你带来的是好消息，<class>。",pEN="I hope you're bringin' good news, <class>.",c="谢谢你，老兄。幸好我有些补给你说不定用得上。给，拿去吧。",cEN="Thank ye, mon. Fortunately, I have some supplies ya might find useful. Here, take 'em."}
Q[27621]={d="你好，<class>……或者我该说，炼金师 <name>？你知道，酿造麦酒和炼金术其实没多大区别。\n\n我在旅途中、在遇到的生物身上学到了很多酿造麦酒的知识，但还有一种原料来源我没探索过：大海。为此，我需要一些水下呼吸药剂。这个你能帮我吗？",dEN="Hail <class>... or should I say, Alchemist <name>? You know, ale brewing and alchemy isn't that different.\n\nI've learned much about brewing ale from my travels and the creatures I've encountered, but there is one source of ingredients I haven't explored: the sea. To that end, I could use some Elixirs of Water Breathing. Is that something you could help me out with?",o="酿酒大师德罗恩希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶水下呼吸药剂，并把订单送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的酿酒大师德罗恩那里。",oEN="Brewmaster Drohn wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Water Breathing and take the order to Brewmaster Drohn at Ratchet in the Barrens.",p="今天鱼很上钩，<class>！",pEN="Fish are bitin' today, <class>!",c="哦！对！谢谢你！",cEN="Oh! Yes! Thank you!"}
Q[27622]={d="我想去海里探索，找些能用于酿造的原料，但我可不傻。我知道浪底下可能潜伏着鲨鱼和其他危险。所以，要是我也能弄到一些游速药水就太好了，这样必要时我就能跑——游——离危险！",dEN="I want to explore the sea for ingredients I can use in my brewing, but I'm not foolish. I know sharks and other dangers can lurk beneath the waves. So, I'd appreciate it if I could also get some Swim Speed Potions, so I can run --swim-- away from danger if necessary!",o="酿酒大师德罗恩希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶游速药水，并把订单送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的酿酒大师德罗恩那里。",oEN="Brewmaster Drohn wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Swim Speed Potion and take the order to Brewmaster Drohn at Ratchet in the Barrens.",p="啊，狩猎的刺激！",pEN="Ah, the thrill of the hunt!",c="有了这些药水，没有鲨鱼能拿我当美餐了。收下一些补给，算是谢意！",cEN="With these potions, no sharks will be making a meal out of me. Take some supplies as my thanks!"}
Q[27623]={d="<class>，有人告诉我你也是炼金师。大酋长派我来整顿这个岗哨，而情况比我想的更糟。我们每天都在联盟手里损失更多苦工，我想委托你制作一些治疗药水，分发给弟兄们。你能办到吗？",dEN="<class>, I was told that you are also an alchemist. The warchief has sent me here to get this post in order and the situation is worse than I expected. We are losing more grunts to the Alliance every day and I'd like to commission you to craft some Healing Potions to distribute to the men. Can you handle that?",o="希里丝希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶治疗药水，并把订单送到灰谷碎木岗哨的洛克·奥卡尔那里。",oEN="Xirith wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Healing Potion and take the order to Locke Okarr at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="在这片森林里小心点，<class>。天黑后不安全……其他时候也一样。",pEN="Be careful in these woods, <class>. It isn't safe after dark... or any other time.",c="谢谢。我会告诉希里丝你完成了契约……虽然她让我浑身发毛！我获准向你提供这些补给。",cEN="Thank you. I will let Xirith know that you completed your contract... even though she gives me the creeps! I am authorized to provide you with these supplies."}
Q[27624]={d="哦……一位炼金师。我想你会欣赏我对毒药的兴趣。毕竟，那门手艺和炼金术也没多大区别。\n\n其实，我正需要你的服务。我想为希尔斯布莱德再调一份药剂……一种带灼烧底色的毒药……能造成一点灼烧效果的东西。如果你能为我制作一些火焰之油，我就能给你一些有用的材料，供你日后制作之用。",dEN="Oh... an alchemist. I think you'll appreciate my interest in poisons. It's not such a different art as alchemy, after all.\n\nActually, I could use your services. I want to make another concoction for Hillsbrad... a poison with a fiery undertone... something that causes a bit of burning. If you could craft me some Fire Oil, I can provide you with some useful reagents for your future crafts.",o="药剂师利顿希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶火焰之油，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵塔伦米尔的药剂师利顿那里。",oEN="Apothecary Lydon wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Fire Oil and take the order to Apothecary Lydon at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="要是我能想出点什么让人发痒的东西就好了……",pEN="If only I could think of something that would cause itching....",c="对，正是我要找的东西。说好的交易就是交易，<name>。这是你的补给。",cEN="Yes, just what I was looking for. A deal's a deal, <name>. Here are your supplies."}
Q[27625]={d="很高兴在这里见到一位炼金师。我正在照料几只受伤的双足飞龙幼崽，需要一组强效巨魔之血药水来温和地清洗并治愈它们的伤口。这个你能帮我吗？",dEN="I am glad to see an alchemist here. I am working with some wounded wyvern pups and I could use a stack of Strong Troll's Blood Potions to gently cleanse and heal their wounds. Is that something you could help me with?",o="伊露希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶强效巨魔之血药剂，并把订单送到千针石林乱风岗的伊露那里。",oEN="Elu wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Strong Troll's Blood Elixir and take the order to Elu at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",p="愿大地母亲指引你，<class>。",pEN="May the Earthmother guide you, <class>.",c="谢谢你完成这份订单，<class>。我有些训练双足飞龙时收集的额外补给。请收下它们，连同我们的谢意。",cEN="Thank you for fulfilling this order, <class>. I have some extra supplies I collected while out training the wyverns. Please take them along with our gratitude."}
Q[27626]={d="我不是炼金师……算不上。但我的师父，巫医金吉尔，似乎觉得我能凭空变出药水来。\n\n我需要一些初级法力药水给巫医。也许你能帮我？做几瓶送到玛拉卡金的金吉尔那里。也许这样他就能让我安心念书了。",dEN="I'm not an alchemist... not really. But, my master, Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, seems to think that I can conjure up potions out of thin air.\n\nI need some Lesser Mana Potions for the Witch Doctor. Maybe you could help me? Just craft a few and deliver them to Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin. Maybe then he'll leave me to my studies.",o="吉达希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级法力药水，并把订单送到石爪山脉玛拉卡金的巫医金吉尔那里。",oEN="Jeeda wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Mana Potion and take the order to Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="没有什么比药剂熬煮时的气味更让我喜欢的了。",pEN="There's nothin' I like more than the smell of a potion brewin'.",c="谢谢你，老兄！现在我可以回去干活了。这里有些补给，算是谢意！",cEN="Thank ya, mon! Now I can get back to work. Here's some supplies as thanks!"}
Q[27627]={d="只要其他森林巨魔和丛林巨魔还有他们的巫医，我们这场仗就打不赢。我们也需要自己的优势。\n\n我想委托你制作一些精准药剂并送到我这里。有了这些，我们就能压过其他巨魔一头。",dEN="We're fighting a losing battle against the other forest and jungle trolls as long as they have their witch doctors. We could use our own edge too.\n\nI'd like to commission you to craft some Elixirs of Accuracy and deliver them to me here. With those on hand, we can get an edge over the other trolls.",o="宁博亚希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶精准药剂，并把订单送到荆棘谷格罗姆高的宁博亚那里。",oEN="Nimboya wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Accuracy and take the order to Nimboya at Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="希望你已经拿到那些药剂了。碎颅者可不是善茬。",pEN="I hope you have those elixirs. The Skullsplitter are ruthless.",c="干得好，<name>。这些补给也有助于提振士气。说到补给，收下这些材料吧，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Good work, <name>. These supplies will also help morale. Speaking of supplies, take these reagents with my thanks."}
Q[27628]={d="哦——一位有本事的炼金师！我需要你的帮助！\n\n沼泽里住着一位深居简出的女士，名叫塔贝莎。她派信使来告诉我们，她急需初级隐形药水，可我们这里没人会做这种东西！你能帮我做些并给她送过去吗？我不想招来她的怒火。我们已经受够了。",dEN="Oh -- an alchemist of skill! I need your help!\n\nThere's a reclusive lady who lives out in the marsh named Tabetha. She sent a messenger to tell us that she is in desperate need of Lesser Invisibility Potions, but we have noone capable of crafting such a thing here! Could you help me out by crafting some and delivering them to her? I don't want to incur her wrath. We have suffered enough.",o="德拉兹齐尔布希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶初级隐形药水，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽塔贝莎农场的塔贝莎那里。",oEN="Draz'Zilb wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Lesser Invisibility Potion and take the order to Tabetha at Tabetha's Farm in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="什么风把你吹来了，<class>？",pEN="What brings you here, <class>?",c="啊，对，我的订单。与真正的魔法相比，炼金术只是入门，但它自有其用。给，一些额外的补给，算是谢意。",cEN="Ah yes, my order. Alchemy is rudimentary compared to real magic, but it has it's uses. Here, some extra supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27629]={d="我奉皇家药剂师协会之命来此执行一项重要任务，但跟着部落来这里的那些乌合之众似乎觉得我随时可以应付各种鸡毛蒜皮的请求。\n\n塔卡塔·钢刃是个兽人战士之类的东西，声称自己关节疼，附近恶魔的邪能污染让他皮肤发麻。既然你是个水平还过得去的炼金师，我要你为他制作一些坚韧药剂，把这桩请求从我手上拿走。",dEN="I am here at the behest of the Royal Apothecary Society on an important mission, but the riff-raff that accompanied the Horde here seem to think I'm available for every little request.\n\nTakata Steelblade is some kind of orc warrior who claims his joints ache, and the fel taint of the nearby demons makes his skin crawl. Since you are a moderately skilled alchemist, I want you to craft him some Elixirs of Fortitude and get this request off my hands.",o="玛尔文·尖啸愿望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶坚韧药剂，并把订单送到凄凉之地鬼行岗哨的塔卡塔·钢刃那里。",oEN="Marwin Shrillwill wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Fortitude and take the order to Takata Steelblade at Ghostwalker Post in Desolace.",p="你是炼金师吗？",pEN="Are you an alchemist?",c="我代表大酋长感谢你。善行必有回报。请收下这些补给，作为你酬劳之外的额外谢礼。",cEN="I thank you on behalf of the Warchief. No good deed goes unrewarded. Please accept these supplies in addition to your fee."}
Q[27630]={d="荒芜之地的大猫很嚣张，<class>。我们已经有不止一名斥候死在它们的捕猎之下。问题在于它们的潜行。我们需要能提前看到它们的东西。\n\n我自己也是炼金师，但我是自学成才，不知道猫眼药剂的配方。可如果你知道，制作一些会大大帮助这里的苦工。",dEN="The big cats of the Badlands are bold, <class>. We've lost more than one scout to their predations. The problem is their stealth. We need something that will let us see them coming.\n\nI'm an alchemist myself but I'm self-taught and I don't know the formula for Catseye Elixirs. But if you do, crafting a few would help the grunts here immensely.",o="贾卡尔·苔藓融合希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶猫眼药剂，并把订单送到荒芜之地卡加斯的雷心那里。",oEN="Jarkal Mossmeld wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Catseye Elixir and take the order to Thunderheart at Kargath in Badlands.",p="有什么能帮你的吗，<class>？",pEN="How can I help you, <class>?",c="贾卡尔·苔藓融合很善于观察——多亏了你，我们的卫兵现在也一样了。让我从我们的储备中拨一些补给给你，作为对这桩善举的谢意。",cEN="Jarkal Mossmeld is very observant -- and, thanks to you, now our guards will be as well. Let me grant you some supplies from our stores as my thanks for this good deed."}
Q[27631]={d="这个营地里的兽人被回忆压垮了——他们想起在这地方，他们的兄弟姐妹遭遇的种种惨事。我可以用元素之力提振一些人的精神，但另一些人更需要老式的炼金术。\n\n就拿鼓·费尔来说。他隐藏着在人类手中受过的伤。为他制作一些特效治疗药水，你就会看到一股新的领袖气度浮现出来。",dEN="The orcs in this camp are beaten down by the memories of terrible deeds that befell their bruddas and sistahs in this place. I can use the power of the elements to raise some of their spirits, but others would benefit from some old-fashioned alchemy.\n\nTake Drum Fel, for example. He hides the wounds he has suffered at the hands of the humans. Craft some Greater Healing Potions for him, and you will see a new sense of leadership emerge.",o="托尔甘希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效治疗药水，并把订单送到阿拉希高地落锤镇的鼓·费尔那里。",oEN="Tor'gan wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Greater Healing Potion and take the order to Drum Fel at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",p="我们要让人类为我们的遭遇付出代价。",pEN="We will make the humans pay for what we suffered.",c="我……我不需要这些药水！我壮得像头科多兽！不过……我也不会无礼到拒绝一份礼物。当然不会！\n\n谢谢你的谨慎，<class>。请收下这些补给，作为你保密的交换。",cEN="I... I have no need of these potions! I'm fit as a kodo! But... I wouldn't be so rude as to turn down a gift. Of course not!\n\nThank you for your discretion, <class>. Please, take some of these supplies in exchange for your silence."}
Q[27632]={d="我觉得巨魔和他们那些愚蠢的洛阿神灵可笑极了！就拿阿基哈来说。\"鲨鱼神\"？多荒谬的念头！\n\n如果那个格拉尔真的存在，为什么不制作一些特效水下呼吸药剂，去打个招呼？其实，既然你是炼金师，何不就去干这件事？",dEN="I think the trolls and their silly loa spirits are ridiculous! Look at Akiha, for example. A \"shark god\"? What a ridiculous notion!\n\nIf this Graal really existed, why not make some Elixirs of Greater Water Breathing and go say hello? In fact, since you're an alchemist, why don't you go do that very thing?",o="杜蒙·空泣希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效水下呼吸药剂，并把订单送到塔纳利斯安杰瓦萨的阿基哈那里。",oEN="Dumont Hollowcry wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Greater Water Breathing and take the order to Akiha at Anje'watha in Tanaris.",p="我是不是在你护甲上闻到了金棘草的味道？",pEN="Is dat de smell of goldthorn I detect on your armor?",c="<阿基哈笑了。>那个蠢亡灵根本不懂洛阿。没关系。反正我会用上这份礼物。让我为你的……周到，酬谢你一番？",cEN="<Akiha laughs.> Dat silly undead does not understand de loa. No matter. I will make use of dis gift anyway. Let me reward you for your... thoughtfulness?"}
Q[27633]={d="啊，一位炼金师。我的朋友托尔格觉得他没死。我想知道是不是还有别的死人在这附近转悠，也许这就是托尔格觉得死了还在这儿晃荡也没关系的原因。你能做一种让我看见死人的饮料吗？",dEN="Ah, an alchemist. My friend Torg think he not dead. Me wonder if other not dead hang around here, and maybe that's why Torg think it ok to hang around while dead. You make drink that lets me see dead people?",o="杰拉尔希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶侦测亡灵药剂，并把订单送到菲拉斯格鲁克营地的杰拉尔那里。",oEN="Jrall wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Detect Undead and take the order to Jrall at Gluk's Compound in Feralas.",p="我没听见别的鬼。我没看见别的鬼。我闻到奇怪的东西。",pEN="Me no hear other ghost. Me no see other ghost. Me smell funny things.",c="啊，好。我现在能看见鬼了。你拿植物去，换更多饮料。",cEN="Ah good. Me see ghosts now. You take plants for more drinks."}
Q[27634]={d="啊，一位炼金师。我不懂那门学问，但我尊重它。\n\n其实，我需要一些特效敏捷药剂。弥漫在这片森林里的邪能魔法渗进我的骨头，让我浑身僵硬。那些药剂能让我关节重新活动起来。你能帮忙吗？",dEN="Ah, an alchemist. I don't understand that particular brand of science but I do respect it.\n\nActually, I could use some Elixirs of Greater Agility. The fel magic permeating these woods creeps into my bones and makes me stiff all over. Those elixirs would get my joints moving again. Can you help?",o="特鲁尔·堕泪希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶特效敏捷药剂，并把订单送到费伍德森林血毒岗哨的特鲁尔·堕泪那里。",oEN="Trull Failbane wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Elixir of Greater Agility and take the order to Trull Failbane at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.",p="那些药剂有消息吗？",pEN="Any word about those elixirs?",c="我会把理论付诸实践。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="I will put my theory into practice. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[27635]={d="里安德大师是炼金术界的天才，但他把我们使唤得筋疲力尽——这可不是亡灵的玩笑。我觉得自己好几个月没睡个好觉了。\n\n我手头的私人项目停不下来，但如果你愿意为我制作几瓶无梦睡眠药水，我就能真的站着睡觉，效率也更高。你能帮忙吗？",dEN="Master Leander is a genius of the alchemical arts but he works us to the bone -- and that's not an undeath joke. I feel like I haven't had a good night's sleep in months.\n\nI can't stop what I'm working on for a personal project but if you'd be willing to craft me a few Dreamless Sleep Potions, I could literally sleep on my feet and be more productive. Can you help?",o="学徒萨丽娜希望你运用炼金术制作 5 瓶无梦睡眠药水，并把订单送到艾萨拉瓦罗莫克的学徒萨丽娜那里。",oEN="Apprentice Sarina wants you to use your alchemy skill to craft 5 Dreamless Sleep Potion and take the order to Apprentice Sarina at Valormok in Azshara.",p="那些药剂有消息吗？我感觉自己又要倒下了……累的。",pEN="Any word about those elixirs? I feel like I'll drop dead again... of exhaustion.",c="你救了一条命，<class>。呃，勉强算是吧。给，请收下我的一些私人补给。",cEN="You're a life-saver, <class>. Well, such as it is. Here, please take some of my personal supplies."}
Q[27636]={d="你好，<class>。我认得出同行铁匠的手。你愿意替我接下一份委托吗？\n\n东谷伐木场的哈加德元帅订了一对符文铜护腿和一对符文铜护手。如果你有兴趣，自己制作这些物品并送过去就行。\n\n伐木场在闪金镇以东。",dEN="Hail, <class>. I recognize the hands of a fellow blacksmith. How would you like to take one of my commissions for yourself?\n\nMarshal Haggard over at the Eastvale Logging Camp requested a pair of Runed Copper Pants and a pair of Runed Copper Gauntlets. If you're interested, simply craft the items yourself and deliver them.\n\nYou'll find the logging camp east of Goldshire.",o="铁匠阿古斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 条符文铜护腿和 1 副符文铜护手，并把订单送到艾尔文森林东谷伐木场的哈加德元帅那里。",oEN="Smith Argus wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Pants and 1 Runed Copper Gauntlets and take the order to Marshal Haggard at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="你好，公民。你找我有事吗？",pEN="Hail, citizen. Do you have business with me?",c="啊，我的委托。这些看起来做得不错。几周前跟一个黑石斥候遭遇之后，我正需要新装备。谢谢你，铁匠。这是你的报酬。",cEN="Ah my commission. These look well crafted. I was in need of new equipment after a run-in with a Blackrock scout a few weeks ago. Thank you, smith. Here is your payment."}
Q[27637]={d="你好，<class>。我需要人帮忙把这些委托多送出去一些。雷纳副官为他的部队申请了一些铜质战斧。\n\n如果你有兴趣接下这份委托，可以把斧子送到西边韦斯特布鲁克要塞的副官那里。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I could use some help getting some more of these commissions out the door. Deputy Rainer has requisitioned some Copper Battleaxes for his troops.\n\nIf you're interested in filling this commission, you can deliver the axes to the Deputy at Westbrook Garrison, west of here.",o="铁匠阿古斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把铜质战斧，并把订单送到艾尔文森林韦斯特布鲁克要塞的雷纳副官那里。",oEN="Smith Argus wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Copper Battle Axe and take the order to Deputy Rainer at Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest.",p="你好，公民。你找我有事吗？",pEN="Hail, citizen. Do you have business with me?",c="终于，我申请的斧子到了。有了新武器，我们也许有机会对付那些劫掠的豺狼人。\n\n这是我们为你准备的补给，作为报酬。",cEN="Finally, the axes I requisitioned. With new weapons, we might stand a chance against the marauding gnolls.\n\nHere are some supplies we prepared for you, as payment."}
Q[27638]={d="你好，<class>。我看得出你是同行铁匠。有兴趣把锤子借给我们这堆积如山的订单吗？\n\n我需要有人制作一大批粗糙磨石，送到西边布伦纳尔村的雷约德·大麦酒那里。他正用这些东西弄他的新酒。你有兴趣吗？",dEN="Hail, <class>. I see yer a fellow smith. Got any interest in lendin' yer hammer to our backlog o' orders here?\n\nI need someone to craft and bring a whole mess o' Rough Grindin' Stones over to Rejold Barleybrew at Brewnall Village to the west. He's usin' 'em in somethin' to do with his new brew. Are ye interested?",o="科根·锻石希望你运用锻造技能制作 10 块粗糙磨石，并把订单送到丹莫罗布伦纳尔村的雷约德·大麦酒那里。",oEN="Kogan Forgestone wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 10 Rough Grinding Stone and take the order to Rejold Barleybrew at Brewnall Village in Dun Morogh.",p="欢迎来到布伦纳尔村，<class>。有什么能帮你的吗？",pEN="Welcome to Brewnall Village, <class>. How can I help you?",c="谢谢你，<name>。有了这些磨石，我们就能继续打磨酒桶了。收下这些补给作为报酬。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. We can get back to smoothing down our kegs now that we have these grinding stones. Take these supplies as payment."}
Q[27639]={d="咱们铁匠之间说，我手上的活儿总是干不完。如果你愿意帮忙，东边戈博拉采石场的采石场主塞斯顿订了一批铜质钉锤。你觉得能替我制作吗？",dEN="Between us smiths, I have more work than I can get to at any given time. If ye'd like to help out, I've got a commission for some Copper Maces from Quarrymaster Thesten down at the Gol'Bolar Quarry to the east. Think ye can handle craftin' those for me?",o="科根·锻石希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 把铜质钉锤，并把订单送到丹莫罗戈博拉采石场的采石场主塞斯顿那里。",oEN="Kogan Forgestone wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Copper Mace and take the order to Quarrymaster Thesten at Gol'Bolar Quarry in Dun Morogh.",p="小心，公民！有一大群穴居怪在附近乱窜！",pEN="Watch out, citizen! There's a mess o' troggs afoot!",c="很高兴看到这些，<class>。我们需要它们把穴居怪打回去。给，从矿里出的货拿一些作为报酬。",cEN="Glad to see these, <class>. We need 'em to beat the troggs back. Here, take some o' the product from the mine as your payment."}
Q[27640]={d="Ishnu'adore，<class>。恐怕我没时间聊天——自从我们开了这间工坊，订单就源源不断地涌来，我已经拖后了。\n\n我说——你似乎也有使铁砧的本事。如果你愿意帮我，可以制作一面重型铜盾和一件铜链甲背心，送到多兰纳尔的护甲商梅丽·铁织那里。",dEN="Ishnu'adore, <class>. I'm afraid I don't have time to talk -- I'm behind on the many orders that have come pouring in since we opened this workshop.\n\nSay -- you seem to have talent with the anvil yourself. If you'd care to assist me, you can craft and deliver a Heavy Copper Shield and a Copper Chain Vest to Meri Ironweave, the armor merchant in Dolanaar.",o="雷尼·橡熔希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 面重型铜盾和 1 件铜链甲背心，并把订单送到泰达希尔多兰纳尔的梅丽·铁织那里。",oEN="Rayni Oaksmelter wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Heavy Copper Shield and 1 Copper Chain Vest and take the order to Meri Ironweave at Dolanaar in Teldrassil.",p="你在找护甲吗，<class>？",pEN="Are you looking for armor, <class>?",c="谢谢你送来这些，<class>。请收下这些补给，作为你工作的报酬。",cEN="Thank you for this delivery, <class>. Please take these supplies as my payment for your work."}
Q[27641]={d="我这里有一份埃雷拉斯·琥珀天的订单，你也许有兴趣替我完成。他在找一对符文铜戒指。做好之后，你可以在泰达希尔山脚下的鲁瑟兰村找到他。穿过银行后面的传送门就能到那里。",dEN="I have an order here from Erelas Ambersky that you may be interested in fulfilling on my behalf. He is looking for a pair of Runed Copper Rings. You can find him down in Rut'theran Village at the foot of Teldrassil once you are done crafting them. Just pass through the portal behind the bank to travel there.",o="雷尼·橡熔希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 枚符文铜戒指，并把订单送到泰达希尔鲁瑟兰村的埃雷拉斯·琥珀天那里。",oEN="Rayni Oaksmelter wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Runed Copper Ring and take the order to Erelas Ambersky at Rut'theran Village in Teldrassil.",p="你好，<class>。",pEN="Greetings, <class>.",c="太好了。这些戒指相当精致。我想把这些补给送给你，作为谢意。",cEN="Excellent. These rings are quite fine. I'd like to give you these supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27642]={d="你好，<class>。很高兴在镇上见到铁匠。我需要一批新的粗糙磨石，让我们的武器和护甲不生锈、不沾污。如果你能制作五块送给我，我会很感激。",dEN="Hail, <class>. Good to see a blacksmith in town. I require a new supply of Coarse Grinding Stones to keep our weapons and armor free of rust and grime. If you could craft and delivery five of them to me, I would be grateful.",o="军需官刘易斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 5 块粗糙磨石，并把订单送到西部荒野哨兵岭的军需官刘易斯那里。",oEN="Quartermaster Lewis wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 5 Coarse Grinding Stone and take the order to Quartermaster Lewis at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="你拿到那些磨石了吗？",pEN="Do you have those grinding stones?",c="海风对锁甲很伤，所以民兵们会很感激用上这些磨石。让我用我们多余的一些补给酬谢你的工作。",cEN="The sea air is tough on chain so the militia will appreciate using these stones. Let me reward your work with some of our surplus supplies."}
Q[27643]={d="如果你在找更多活干，我听说西部荒野民兵队的一名新成员需要一件符文铜胸甲和一副符文铜护腕，好凑齐她的护甲。如果你能制作这些物品，可以送到保护者伊万杰琳那里。她巡逻哨兵岭以南的大路。",dEN="If you're looking for more work, I've heard one of the new members of the Westfall militia needs a Runed Copper Breastplate and Runed Copper Bracers to complete her armor. If you're able to craft these items, you can deliver them to Protector Evangeline. She patrols the road south of Sentinel Hill.",o="军需官刘易斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 件符文铜胸甲和 1 副符文铜护腕，并把订单送到西部荒野南边大路上的保护者伊万杰琳那里。",oEN="Quartermaster Lewis wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Breastplate and 1 Runed Copper Bracers and take the order to Protector Evangeline at the southern road in Westfall.",p="当心这条路上的迪菲亚强盗和豺狼人，旅行者。",pEN="Watch out for Defias bandits and gnolls on this road, traveler.",c="你亲自送来这些真是太好了！我会好好利用它们——希望这些补给对你也有用。",cEN="How kind of you to deliver these personally! I will make good use of them -- I hope you can make good use of these supplies."}
Q[27644]={d="啊，一英里外我就能认出一个铁匠！说到一英里外，远在古树之林的乌兰娜捎信来，要更多磨刀石和配重石。我一直没时间去处理她的订单，不过如果你愿意在镇上施展手艺，我很乐意把这份委托交给你。",dEN="Ah, I can spot a fellow blacksmith a mile away! Speakin' of a mile away, Ullanna down at the Grove of the Ancients sent a note asking for more sharpening stones and weightstones. I haven't had time to attend to her order, but if yer willin' to ply a craft while in town, I'd be happy to have ye take this commission off me hands.",o="德尔弗鲁姆·燧石胡希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 块粗糙磨刀石和 3 块粗糙配重石，并把订单送到黑海岸南边古树之林的乌兰娜那里。",oEN="Delfrum Flintbeard wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Coarse Sharpening Stone and 3 Coarse Weightstone and take the order to Ullanna at Grove of the Ancients to the south in Darkshore.",p="有什么能帮你的吗，<class>？",pEN="How can I help you, <class>?",c="我承认向一个矮人下订单时我还有些顾虑，但一切都和我要求的一样。这是德尔弗鲁姆给的补给，作为报酬。",cEN="I admit I was wary of placing an order with a dwarf, but everything is just as I asked for. Here are the supplies Delfrum requested as payment."}
Q[27645]={d="对像你这样有进取心的年轻铁匠来说，黑海岸乃至更远的地方活儿多得很。我这儿就有一份来自洛南·金叶的订单——他是个隐居者，住在南边很远、紧挨灰谷边界的大路旁。如果你能制作一枚暗影石坠饰和一条调谐铜护腿来完成这份订单，那就是替我省了一大桩心事。",dEN="There's plenty of work in Darkshore and beyond for an enterprising young smith like yerself. Why, I have an open order here from Lornan Goldleaf, a recluse who lives off the road far to the south, right on the border of Ashenvale. If ye can craft a Shadowgem Pendant and Attuned Copper Leggings to fill this order, that'd be a weight off me shoulders.",o="德尔弗鲁姆·燧石胡希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 枚暗影石坠饰和 1 条调谐铜护腿，并把订单送到灰谷边界的金叶静居的洛南·金叶那里。",oEN="Delfrum Flintbeard wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Shadowgem Pendant and 1 Attuned Copper Leggings and take the order to Lornan Goldleaf at Goldleaf Retreat on the border of Ashenvale.",p="Elune-adore。什么风把你吹到我这简陋的居所来了？",pEN="Elune-adore. What brings you to my humble abode?",c="啊，对。我一直在等这些物品。做得很好。请收下这些补给作为报酬。",cEN="Ah, yes. I have been waiting for these items. A fine job has been done in crafting them. Please take these supplies as payment."}
Q[27646]={d="你好，冒险者……而且还是位铁匠！我需要你的服务。\n\n我们国王谷前哨站的索尔瓦德·深炉最近发现了一批旧锁箱的藏货，但他不想用蛮力撬开。如果你能为他制作一些白银万能钥匙，我相信他会酬谢你的工作。",dEN="Hail adventurer... and a blacksmith tae boot! I have need of your services.\n\nThorvald Deepforge down at our outpost in the Valley of Kings recently found a stash o' old lockboxes but he doesnae want tae use brute force tae open them. If ye could craft some Silver Skeleton Keys for him, I'm sure he'd reward yer work.",o="莫尔汉·铜舌希望你运用锻造技能制作 4 把白银万能钥匙，并把订单送到洛克莫丹西南部国王谷的索尔瓦德·深炉那里。",oEN="Morhan Coppertongue wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 4 Silver Skeleton Key and take the order to Thorvald Deepforge at the Valley of Kings in southwestern Loch Modan.",p="我没时间玩游戏，<lad/lass>。",pEN="I've no time fer games <lad/lass>.",c="万能钥匙？你怎么不早说。这正是我要的。为表谢意，请收下我多余的一些补给。",cEN="Skeleton keys? Well why didn't ye say so. That's just what I need. To show my appreciation, please take some of my surplus supplies."}
Q[27647]={d="想接一份委托，为洛克莫丹这一带最有名的登山者之一效力吗？阿尔加兹哨站的登山者石矛需要几把斧子给他的新兵。如果你能制作两把厚重战斧送过去，他会非常满意。",dEN="Fancy takin' on a commission for one of the most renowned mountaineers this side o' Loch Modan? Mountaineer Stormpike up at Algaz Station is in need of a couple axes fer his new recruits. If ye can craft two Thick War Axes and deliver them, he'll be mighty pleased.",o="莫尔汉·铜舌希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把厚重战斧，并把订单送到洛克莫丹北部阿尔加兹哨站的登山者石矛那里。",oEN="Morhan Coppertongue wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Thick War Axe and take the order to Mountaineer Stormpike at Algaz Station in northern Loch Modan.",p="麻烦要来了。我能从骨头里感觉到。",pEN="Trouble's coming. I can feel it in my bones.",c="很高兴拿到这些斧子，<name>。有狗头人、穴居怪和黑铁矮人在，我们得料到这些天里会有一场袭击。\n\n请让我给你一些补给作为交换。",cEN="I'm glad to get these axes, <name>. Between kobolds, troggs, and the Dark Iron, we must expect an attack will come one of these days.\n\nPlease, let me give you some supplies in exchange."}
Q[27648]={d="嘿，你是镇上新来的铁匠吗？守夜人的订单把我压得喘不过气，所以一直没空处理这份来自平民的订单。如果你愿意帮我，就制作一把重型青铜钉锤和两块重型配重石，送到鸦木山去。下订单的人一直在那上面转悠。",dEN="Hey, you a new blacksmith in town? I'm backed up on orders for the Night's Watch, so I haven't been able to get to this one from a civilian. If you're willing to help me out, just craft a Heavy Bronze Mace and a couple of Heavy Weightstones, and take them up to Raven Hill. The man who placed the order has been hanging around up there.",o="加文·瘤木希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 把重型青铜钉锤和 2 块重型配重石，并把订单送到暮色森林西部鸦木山的吉特斯那里。",oEN="Gavin Gnarltree wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Heavy Bronze Mace and 2 Heavy Weightstone and take the order to Jitters at Raven Hill in western Duskwood.",p="啊！鬼、鬼、鬼、鬼、鬼！\n\n哦，抱歉。我刚才没看见你。",pEN="Ahh! G-G-G-G-Ghost!\n\nOh, sorry. I didn't see you there.",c="谢谢！我想要一把钉锤，因为它砸骷髅很好使，而这附近骷髅很多。要是再等久一点，我就打算自己做武器了，所以请收下我收集的这些材料作为报酬。",cEN="Thanks! I wanted a mace because its good for bashing skeletons and there's a lot of them nearby. I was going to try making my own weapon if I'd had to wait much longer, so please take these materials I gathered as payment."}
Q[27649]={d="你不会正好是铁匠吧？哦，你真是！我需要你的帮助。\n\n兽人搬进来之后，我们上一位铁匠就一走了之，我们的卫兵只能用剩下的破烂凑合。我想为卫兵帕克委托一面纯银盾牌，可我一直得从闪金镇调护甲，运来要很久。如果你能替我制作并送去这面盾牌，我会确保帕克能给你一些补给作为交换。",dEN="You wouldn't happen to be a Blacksmith, would you? Oh, you are! I need your help.\n\nOur last smith up and left when the orcs moved in and our guards are making do with leftover scraps. I'd like to commission a Pure Silver Shield for Guard Parker but I've had to request armor from Goldshire and it takes a long time to arrive. If you could craft and deliver the shield for me, I'll make sure Parker can provide you with supplies in exchange.",o="维尔纳·奥斯古德希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 面纯银盾牌，并把订单送到赤脊山山脉西部三岔口的卫兵帕克那里。",oEN="Verner Osgood wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Pure Silver Shield and take the order to Guard Parker at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains.",p="在路上小心，公民。这附近有豺狼人。",pEN="Be careful on the roads, citizen. There are gnolls about.",c="这比我现在的盾牌好多了。我会告诉维尔纳你完成了委托。这是他提到的补给。",cEN="This is much nicer than my current shield. I'll let Verner know you fulfilled your commission. Here are the supplies he mentioned."}
Q[27650]={d="啊，一位铁匠！也许你能帮我——银风避难所的乌尔萨恩一直缠着我问有没有新到的刀子。看来他想要能切剑齿虎排的东西。我做的东西他一件都看不上，不过我听说技艺高超的铁匠能打造速制青铜匕首，正合乌尔萨恩的用途。如果你能制作一对送过去，也许他终于能放过我了！",dEN="Ah, a blacksmith! Perhaps you can assist me -- Ulthaan at Silverwind Refuge has been pestering me about any new knives that come in. Apparently he wants something fit for carving saber steaks. Nothing I have crafted suits him, but I've heard a skilled blacksmith can make Quick Bronze Daggers, which would suit Ulthaan's purpose. If you can craft a pair of them and deliver them, maybe he will finally leave me alone!",o="夏伊安德希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把速制青铜匕首，并把订单送到灰谷中部银风避难所的乌尔萨恩那里。",oEN="Xai'ander wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Quick Bronze Dagger and take the order to Ulthaan at Silverwind Refuge in central Ashenvale.",p="你需要些肉吗，<class>？我这儿有灰谷最新鲜的猎物。",pEN="Do you need some meat, <class>? I carry the freshest game in Ashenvale.",c="这些刀刃正合我用。我得专程去拜访夏伊安德，向他问好！至于你，请收下这些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="These blades are suited to my needs. I'll have to make a special visit to Xai'ander and give him my regards! As for you, please take these supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27651]={d="我的表弟长辫是丹莫德一支民兵队的成员，他们在那里抵御黑铁矮人。他为他的人订了三副镀银青铜护手，可铁炉堡那边订单不断，我一直没时间制作。你看起来是个能干的铁匠——如果你能完成这份订单并送过去，我会亲自向你道谢。",dEN="My cousin Longbraid is part of a band of militia holdin' out against the Dark Iron up at Dun Modr. He requested a trio of Silvered Bronze Gauntlets fer his men, but I've had nae time to craft them with all the orders comin' in from Theramore. You seem like a capable smith -- if ye could fill this order and deliver it, ye'd have my personal thanks.",o="布拉玛尔希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 副镀银青铜护手，并把订单送到湿地北部丹莫德的长辫·葛林那里。",oEN="Brahnmar wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets and take the order to Longbraid the Grim at Dun Modr in northern Wetlands.",p="我在黑铁矮人手里折了不少人，<class>。你要是往北走，务必小心。",pEN="I've lost many men to the Dark Iron, <class>. Be wary if you're travelling north.",c="黑铁矮人打来的时候，我们要是有这样的好护甲就好了。至少现在我们有机会组织防御了。我这儿没有钱，但撤离前我从我们的仓库里抢出了一些补给。请收下吧。",cEN="If only we'd had proper armor like this when the Dark Iron attacked. At least we have a chance to mount a defense now. I don't have any coin here, but I salvaged some supplies from our storehouses before we had to evacuate. Please, take them."}
Q[27652]={d="很高兴在这里见到铁匠。你也看到了，我们还没建立起什么补给线，也没有自己的铁匠铺来打造武器。如果我能委托你制作一把青铜战斧、一把青铜巨剑和一把青铜战锤，我很乐意提供补给，支持你今后的锻造工作。",dEN="I'm glad to see a blacksmith here. As you can see, we haven't set up much in the way of a supply line yet. Nor do we have our own smithy to churn out arms. If I could commission you to craft me a Bronze Battle Axe, Bronze Greatsword, and Bronze Warhammer, I'll be happy to furnish supplies towards your further smithing efforts.",o="多伦中尉希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 把青铜战斧、1 把青铜巨剑和 1 把青铜战锤，并把订单送到荆棘谷北部反抗军营地的多伦中尉那里。",oEN="Lieutenant Doren wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Bronze Battle Axe and 1 Bronze Greatsword and 1 Bronze Warhammer and take the order to Lieutenant Doren at Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn.",p="你制作出我要的武器了吗？",pEN="Were you able to craft the weapons I requested?",c="这些分量扎实、配重也好，<name>。我的部下会很高兴用上新武器。给，如约付给你的补给。",cEN="These have solid heft and good balance, <name>. My men will appreciate using some new arms. Here, as promised, are some supplies in payment."}
Q[27653]={d="你好，冒险者——或者我该说，同行铁匠？\n\n我们为塞拉摩卫队忙得不可开交，可北点哨塔的达瑞尔队长送来一份特别委托。我不想为了处理这一单而放下其他订单的进度。你有兴趣从我手上接过去吗？他需要一顶绿铁头盔、一条绿铁护腿和一副绿铁护腕。",dEN="Hail, adventurer -- or should I say, fellow blacksmith?\n\nWe are swamped with work for the Theramore guard but a special commission came in from Captain Darill up at North Point. I'd hate to lose the progress I've made on the other orders to tend to this one. Would you be interested in taking it off my hands? He needs a Green Iron Helm, Green Iron Leggings, and Green Iron Bracers.",o="玛丽·霍尔斯顿希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 顶绿铁头盔、1 副绿铁护腕和 1 条绿铁护腿，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽北点哨塔的达瑞尔队长那里。",oEN="Marie Holdston wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Green Iron Helm and 1 Green Iron Bracers and 1 Green Iron Leggings and take the order to Captain Darill at North Point Tower in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="我代表联盟向你致意，<class>。",pEN="I greet you on behalf of the Alliance, <class>.",c="我很高兴霍尔斯顿女士把活儿转交给你，才这么快做好。你的手艺不输给她。\n\n我手头没有现钱付你，但请收下这些补给，助你精进技艺。",cEN="I am pleased Ms. Holdston was able to get these crafted quickly by deferring to you. Your skill rivals hers.\n\nWhile I do not have ready coin to pay you, please take these supplies to further your crafting."}
Q[27654]={d="欢迎来到这片荒地，铁匠。为了让这个小前哨站护甲武器充足，我真是拼了命，尤其门口还有那么多恶魔！\n\n斯奎格科德前哨站的地精也开始下订单了，可我一直没时间去处理。如果你愿意帮个忙，制作两把闪钢匕首，送到那边的莫特利·重铜那里。",dEN="Welcome to the wasteland, blacksmith. I've worked my fingers to the bone to keep this tiny outpost well supplied with armor and weapons, especially with all those demons at our doorstep!\n\nThe gnomes over at Squigglecord Outpost have started placing orders as well but I just haven't had time to get to them. If you're willing to do a favor, craft a couple of Glinting Steel Daggers and deliver them to Motley Heavybrass over there.",o="马克斯顿·斯特兰希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把闪钢匕首，并把订单送到凄凉之地斯奎格科德前哨站的莫特利·重铜那里。",oEN="Maxton Strang wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Glinting Steel Dagger and take the order to Motley Heavybrass at Squigglecord Outpost in Desolace.",p="铁匠？看看我的货物吧——说不定有你需要的东西。",pEN="A blacksmith? Check out my inventory -- I may have something you're interested in.",c="很高兴认识你，<name>。谢谢你出力为我制作这些匕首。这里有些补给，作为你的报酬！",cEN="Pleased to meet you, <name>. I appreciate you pitching in to craft these daggers for me. Here's some supplies as your payment!"}
Q[27655]={d="这里没有铁匠，想弄到新马蹄铁很难，但我更替南海镇的卫兵难过。他们还在用多年前的护甲和武器凑合。\n\n你是铁匠？那好，如果你有兴趣帮忙，赫尔姆斯沃西少校正需要一件新的绿铁锁甲。他自己绝不会开口，但我们必须让他穿好护甲。要是失去少校，我真不知道下一次部落来袭时我们该怎么守！",dEN="It's tough to get new horseshoes since we have no smith here, but I feel even worse for the Southshore guard. They're making do with years-old armor and weapons.\n\nYou're a blacksmith? Well, if you're interested in helping, Major Helmsworthy could use a new Green Iron Hauberk. He'd never ask himself but we need to keep him well armored. If we lost the major, I don't know how we'd defend against the next Horde attack!",o="达伦·马尔沃希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 件绿铁锁甲，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南海镇附近塔楼的赫尔姆斯沃西少校那里。",oEN="Darren Malvew wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Green Iron Hauberk and take the order to Major Helmsworthy at a tower near Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="有什么能帮你的吗，公民？",pEN="How can I help you, citizen?",c="我很感激这份礼物，<name>。你在没有报酬承诺的情况下还来关照我的需要，真是好心，但我坚持要你从我们的储备里收下这些补给作为补偿。为了联盟！",cEN="I am thankful for this gift, <name>. It is kind of you to attend to my needs with no promise of payment, but I insist you take these supplies from our stockpile as compensation. For the Alliance!"}
Q[27656]={d="你也许注意到了，我们有座熔炉却没有铁匠在用。如果你愿意改变这一点，管理员阿拉里克送来一份委托，要一枚新的敏捷黄水晶护符。做好之后，你可以送到激流堡地穴里的阿拉里克那里。小心附近潜伏的部落！",dEN="You may have noticed we have a forge but no smith working it. If you're willing to change that, Caretaker Alaric sent over a commission for a new Agile Citrine Amulet. Once you craft it, you can deliver it to Alaric in the Crypt of Stromgarde. Watch out for Horde lurking nearby!",o="斯库尔托希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 枚敏捷黄水晶护符，并把订单送到阿拉希高地激流堡内地穴的管理员阿拉里克那里。",oEN="Skuerto wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Agile Citrine Amulet and take the order to Caretaker Alaric at the Crypt inside Stromgarde in Arathi Highlands.",p="愿圣光对你微笑，孩子。",pEN="Light smile upon you, child.",c="说真的，你今天的作品蒙受祝福，<class>。我没什么钱，但有这些从废墟里捡来的补给。请收下，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Truly, your work is blessed this day, <class>. I have little coin but I do have these supplies scavenged from the ruins. Please take them, with my thanks."}
Q[27657]={d="我们哨兵队伍里没几个工匠，所以需要你的服务，铁匠。我想委托你为哨兵新兵制作六件钢质胸甲。做好之后请送到我这里来。",dEN="The Sentinels have few crafters in our ranks, so I could use your services, blacksmith. I'd like to commission you to make six Steel Breastplates for new Sentinel recruits. Please bring them to me once you have completed them.",o="珊蒂斯·羽月希望你运用锻造技能制作 6 件钢质胸甲，并把订单送到菲拉斯羽月要塞的珊蒂斯·羽月那里。",oEN="Shandris Feathermoon wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 6 Steel Breastplate and take the order to Shandris Feathermoon at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="愿艾露恩保佑你，<class>。",pEN="May Elune bless you, <class>.",c="太好了。以后我可能还需要锻造的活儿。请再来一趟。这里有些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="Excellent. I may need more smithing in the future. Please visit again. Here are some supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27658]={d="啊，一位铁匠。我需要你的手艺。\n\n虽然天灾已被击退，我们仍需要新武器继续作战。我听说过一种巨型黑锤，对付亡灵是极好的武器。如果你能制作一对带来给我试试，我们就看看关于它威力的传闻是否属实。",dEN="Ah, a blacksmith. I have need of your skills.\n\nThough the Scourge have been driven back, we need new weapons to continue the fight. I've heard of a Big Black Mace that is an excellent weapon against the undead. If you could craft and bring me a pair to try out, we shall see if the rumors of their efficacy are true.",o="指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把巨型黑锤，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地冰风营地的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特那里。",oEN="Commander Ashlam Valorfist wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Big Black Mace and take the order to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="你把那些钉锤做好了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you crafted those maces, <class>?",c="我期待着用这些砸碎几个头骨——当然，是出于职业需要。请收下这箱补给作为报酬。",cEN="I look forward to smashing a few skulls with these -- in a professional capacity of course. Please take this box of supplies as payment."}
Q[27659]={d="嘿！你是铁匠，对吧？\n\n我一直在想送点什么好东西给那些黑喉熊怪，当作象征性的礼物，表明我们没有威胁。我想到了正合适的：几把真银万能钥匙。你知道，就是「友谊之钥」之类的意思？我需要铁匠帮忙制作，并代表我们把钥匙送去。有兴趣吗？",dEN="Hey! You're a blacksmith, aren't you?\n\nI've been trying to think of something nice that would be a symbolic gift to give to those Blackmaw furbolgs to show them we're not a threat. I think I've got just the thing: some Truesilver Skeleton Keys. You know, the key to friendship and all that? I need a blacksmith's help to craft and deliver the keys on our behalf. Interested?",o="温迪·摇晃史密斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 4 把真银万能钥匙，并把订单送到艾萨拉北部黑喉村的大酋长乌恩加尔那里。",oEN="Wendy Wobblesmith wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 4 Truesilver Skeleton Key and take the order to High Chief Ungarl at Blackmaw Village in northern Azshara.",p="什么风把你吹到黑喉村来了？",pEN="What bring you to Blackmaw?",c="这是小个子生物送来的奇怪礼物，但我们黑喉熊怪即使觉得奇怪也欢迎礼物。不过没有礼物是不求回报的，所以把这个当作我们送你的礼物。",cEN="This strange gift from tiny creatures, but we Blackmaw appreciate gifts even if strange. No gift goes unrewarded though, so take this as our gift to you."}
Q[27660]={d="你好，<class>。我感觉得出你也是位老练的铁匠。费伍德森林的邪能蒸气把我上一套护甲蚀穿了。我需要一条新的秘银鳞片护腿和一顶新的秘银头盔。如果你能制作，我愿意用我的一些补给换你的手艺。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I sense you are also a seasoned blacksmith. The fel vapors of Felwood ate right through my last set of armor. I could use a new pair of Mithril Scale Pants and a new Mithril Coif. If you're able to craft those, I would exchange some of my supplies for your work.",o="麦利尼·霜月希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 顶秘银头盔和 1 条秘银鳞片护腿，并把订单送到费伍德森林爪枝空地的麦利尼·霜月那里。",oEN="Mylini Frostmoon wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Mithril Coif and 1 Mithril Scale Pants and take the order to Mylini Frostmoon at Talonbranch Glade in Felwood.",p="这片森林里的空气都弥漫着浓重的邪能魔法。",pEN="The very air is thick with fel magic in these woods.",c="做得非常好，<name>。我真希望这套能比上一套撑得久一些，不过我也不会再穿着它跳进血毒河了。不会再有第二次。\n\n收下这些补给，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Very good work, <name>. I do hope these last longer than my last pair, but I also won't be diving into Bloodvenom River with them on. Again.\n\nTake these supplies with my gratitude."}
Q[27661]={d="你好，<class>。我认得出同行铁匠的手。你愿意替我接下一份委托吗？\n\n森金村的拉尔·潜行獠牙订了一对符文铜护腿和一对符文铜护手。如果你有兴趣，自己制作这些物品并送过去就行。\n\n村子在剃刀岭以南——你来的时候一定路过过。",dEN="Hail, <class>. I recognize the hands of a fellow blacksmith. How would you like to take one of my commissions for yourself?\n\nLar Prowltusk down at Sen'jin Village requested a pair of Runed Copper Pants and a pair of Runed Copper Gauntlets. If you're interested, simply craft the items yourself and deliver them.\n\nYou'll find the village south of Razor Hill -- you must have passed it on your way here.",o="瓦尔克希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 条符文铜护腿和 1 副符文铜护手，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔森金村的拉尔·潜行獠牙那里。",oEN="Wuark wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Pants and 1 Runed Copper Gauntlets and take the order to Lar Prowltusk at Sen'jin Village in Durotar.",p="小声点，<class>。半人马就在附近。",pEN="Quiet, <class>. The centaur are nearby.",c="啊，我的委托。这些看起来做得不错。几周前跟一个科卡尔斥候遭遇之后，我正需要新装备。谢谢你，铁匠。这是你的报酬。",cEN="Ah my commission. These look well crafted. I was in need of new equipment after a run-in with a Kolkar scout a few weeks ago. Thank you, smith. Here is your payment."}
Q[27662]={d="你好，<class>。我需要人帮忙把这些委托多送出去一些。工头欣克申请了一些铜质战斧，给他的工人用来驱赶飞艇塔附近的蝎子。\n\n如果你有兴趣接下这份委托，可以把斧子送到北边奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的工头那里。",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I could use some help getting some more of these commissions out the door. Supervisor Hink has requisitioned some Copper Battleaxes for his workers to use for keeping scorpids away from the zeppelin tower.\n\nIf you're interested in filling this commission, you can deliver the axes to the Supervisor at the zeppelin tower outside of Orgrimmar, north of here.",o="瓦尔克希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把铜质战斧，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的工头欣克那里。",oEN="Wuark wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Copper Battle Axe and take the order to Supervisor Hink at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar in Durotar.",p="嗯，<class>，你想要什么？",pEN="Yeah <class>, what'dya want?",c="终于，我申请的斧子到了。有了新武器，我的工人就能对付那些劫掠的蝎子了。\n\n这是我们为你准备的补给，作为报酬。",cEN="Finally, the axes I requisitioned. With new weapons, my workers will stand a chance against the marauding scorpids.\n\nHere are some supplies we prepared for you, as payment."}
Q[27663]={d="你好，<class>。我看得出你是铁匠。不知你能否帮忙完成一位博学者交给我的请求？\n\n我需要有人制作一批粗糙磨石，送到东北方红岩地的贤者雨图腾那里。他用这些石头举行我们为死者做的神圣仪式，可我这儿的存货已经用完了。你有兴趣帮忙吗？",dEN="Hail, <class>. I see you are a blacksmith. I wonder if you could help fulfill a request I received from one of the Lorespeakers?\n\nI need someone to craft and deliver a quantity of Rough Grinding Stones to Sage Raintotem at Red Rocks to the northeast. He uses them in our sacred rites for the dead, but I'm all out of stock on them at the moment. Are you interested in assisting?",o="马诺特·粗伤希望你运用锻造技能制作 10 块粗糙磨石，并把订单送到莫高雷东北部红岩地的博学者雨图腾那里。",oEN="Mahnott Roughwound wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 10 Rough Grinding Stone and take the order to Lorekeeper Raintotem at Red Rocks in northeast Mulgore.",p="这里是圣地，<race>。",pEN="This is a sacred place, <race>.",c="谢谢你，<name>。有了这些磨石，我可以回去干活了。请收下这些补给，作为谢意。愿大地母亲保佑你。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I can get back to work now that I have these grinding stones. Please, take these supplies as my thanks. May the Earthmother bless you."}
Q[27664]={d="伊安·鹰爪不久前刚来过，想找一些铜质钉锤，评估作为他兄弟即将举行仪式的礼物。他想订三把，可我没有存货，雷霆崖的铁匠又忙得赶不及制作。如果你能尽快处理这份订单，我知道他会很感激。",dEN="Eyahn Eagletalon was here not long ago, looking for some Copper Maces to evaluate as gifts for his brother's upcoming ceremony. He wanted to commission three of them but I didn't have any in stock and the smiths in Thunder Bluff were too busy to craft them in time. If you can handle this order quickly, I know he would appreciate it.",o="马诺特·粗伤希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 把铜质钉锤，并把订单送到莫高雷雷霆崖的伊安·鹰爪那里。",oEN="Mahnott Roughwound wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Copper Mace and take the order to Eyahn Eagletalon at Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="我兄弟的仪式快到了，我还有很多事要做。",pEN="My brother's ceremony is soon and I still have so much to do.",c="很高兴看到这些，<class>。等我的兄弟们各自完成仪式，我会一人送他们一把。给，请收下这些补给，连同你的报酬。",cEN="Glad to see these, <class>. I'll be gifting them to each of my brothers as they complete their own ceremonies. Here, please accept these supplies with your payment."}
Q[27665]={d="恐怕我没时间聊天——自从血色十字军加紧行动，订单就源源不断地涌来，我已经拖后了。\n\n我说——你似乎也有使铁砧的本事。如果你愿意帮我，可以制作一面重型铜盾和一件铜链甲背心，送到丧钟镇入口外驻守的死亡守卫西默那里。",dEN="I'm afraid I don't have time to talk -- I'm behind on the many orders that have come pouring in since the Scarlet Crusade stepped up their operations.\n\nSay -- you seem to have talent with the anvil yourself. If you'd care to assist me, you can craft and deliver a Heavy Copper Shield and a Copper Chain Vest to Deathguard Simmer, who is stationed outside the entrance to Deathknell.",o="阿贝·温特斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 面重型铜盾和 1 件铜链甲背心，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地丧钟镇入口的死亡守卫西默那里。",oEN="Abe Winters wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Heavy Copper Shield and 1 Copper Chain Vest and take the order to Deathguard Simmer at the entrance to Deathknell in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你找我吗，<class>？",pEN="Are you looking me, <class>?",c="谢谢你送来这些，<class>。请收下这些补给，作为你工作的报酬。愿黑暗女士看顾你。",cEN="Thank you for this delivery, <class>. Please take these supplies as my payment for your work. Dark Lady watch over you."}
Q[27666]={d="我这里有一份死亡守卫琳妮亚的订单，你也许有兴趣替我完成。她在找一对符文铜戒指。做好之后，你可以沿布瑞尔出去的大路往东找到她。要是你走到基萨佩尔矿场，就是走过头了。",dEN="I have an order here from Deathguard Linnea that you may be interested in fulfilling on my behalf. She is looking for a pair of Runed Copper Rings. You can find her to the east down the road out of Brill once you are done crafting them. If you hit the Kitsapell Mine, you've gone too far.",o="阿贝·温特斯希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 枚符文铜戒指，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔东边大路上营地的死亡守卫琳妮亚那里。",oEN="Abe Winters wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Runed Copper Ring and take the order to Deathguard Linnea at a camp on the road east of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你好，<class>。",pEN="Hello, <class>.",c="太好了。这些戒指相当精致。请收下这些补给，作为谢意。愿黑暗女士看顾你。",cEN="Excellent. These rings are quite fine. Please take these supplies as my thanks. Dark Lady watch over you."}
Q[27667]={d="你好，<class>。很高兴在镇上见到铁匠。我需要一批新的粗糙磨石，让我们的武器和护甲不生锈、不沾污。如果你能制作五块送给我，我会很感激。",dEN="Hail, <class>. Good to see a blacksmith in town. I require a new supply of Coarse Grinding Stones to keep our weapons and armor free of rust and grime. If you could craft and deliver five of them to me, I would be grateful.",o="塞巴斯蒂安·梅洛奇希望你运用锻造技能制作 5 块粗糙磨石，并把订单送到银松森林墓室的塞巴斯蒂安·梅洛奇那里。",oEN="Sebastian Meloche wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 5 Coarse Grinding Stone and take the order to Sebastian Meloche at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="你拿到那些磨石了吗？",pEN="Do you have those grinding stones?",c="海风对锁甲很伤，所以死亡守卫们会很感激用上这些磨石。让我用我们多余的一些补给酬谢你的工作。",cEN="The sea air is tough on chain so the deathguards will appreciate using these stones. Let me reward your work with some of our surplus supplies."}
Q[27668]={d="如果你在找更多活干，伊瓦农场的雷恩·约里克需要一件符文铜胸甲和一副符文铜护腕，好替换她兄弟损坏的护甲。如果你能制作这些物品，可以送到那里的雷恩手中。伊瓦农场在墓室以北。",dEN="If you're looking for more work, Rane Yorick up at the Ivar Patch needs a Runed Copper Breastplate and Runed Copper Bracers to replace her brother's damaged armor. If you're able to craft these items, you can deliver them to Rane there. The Ivar Patch is north of the Sepulcher.",o="塞巴斯蒂安·梅洛奇希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 件符文铜胸甲和 1 副符文铜护腕，并把订单送到银松森林伊瓦农场的雷恩·约里克那里。",oEN="Sebastian Meloche wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Breastplate and 1 Runed Copper Bracers and take the order to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch in Silverpine Forest.",p="当心食尸鬼和野狼……还有更糟的东西，旅行者。",pEN="Watch out for ghouls and wolves... and worse, traveler.",c="你亲自送来这些真是太好了！奎因康复后会好好利用它们——希望这些补给对你也有用。",cEN="How kind of you to deliver these personally! Quinn will make good use of them when he recovers -- I hope you can make good use of these supplies."}
Q[27669]={d="啊，一英里外我就能认出一个铁匠！说到一英里外，远望岗哨的乌泽克捎信来，要更多磨刀石和配重石。我一直没时间去处理他的订单，不过如果你愿意在镇上练练手艺，我很乐意把这份委托交给你。",dEN="Ah, I can spot a fellow blacksmith a mile away! Speaking of a mile away, Uzzek at the Far Watch Post sent a note asking for more sharpening stones and weightstones. I haven't had time to attend to his order, but if you're willing to practice your craft while in town, I'd be happy to give you this commission.",o="特劳格希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 块粗糙磨刀石和 3 块粗糙配重石，并把订单送到贫瘠之地东北部远望岗哨的乌泽克那里。",oEN="Traugh wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Coarse Sharpening Stone and 3 Coarse Weightstone and take the order to Uzzek at Far Watch Post to the northeast in the Barrens.",p="幸会，<class>。",pEN="Well met, <class>.",c="一切都和我要求的一样。这是特劳格给的补给，作为报酬。愿荣誉与荣耀归于你！",cEN="Everything is just as I asked for. Here are the supplies Traugh requested as payment. Honor and glory to you!"}
Q[27670]={d="对像你这样有进取心的年轻铁匠来说，十字路口乃至更远的地方活儿多得很。我这儿有一份来自克拉纳尔·菲斯的订单——他是个隐居者，住在北边大路旁，离灰谷边界不远。如果你能制作一枚暗影石坠饰和一条调谐铜护腿来完成这份订单，那就是替我省了一大桩心事。",dEN="There's plenty of work in the Crossroads and beyond for an enterprising young smith like yourself. I have an open order here from Kranal Fiss, a recluse who lives off the road to the north, not far from the border of Ashenvale. If you can craft a Shadowgem Pendant and Attuned Copper Leggings to fill this order, that'd be a weight off my shoulders.",o="特劳格希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 枚暗影石坠饰和 1 条调谐铜护腿，并把订单送到贫瘠之地格罗多姆农场的克拉纳尔·菲斯那里。",oEN="Traugh wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Shadowgem Pendant and 1 Attuned Copper Leggings and take the order to Kranal Fiss at Grol'dom Farm in the Barrens.",p="Lok'tar，<race>。什么风把你吹到我这简陋的居所来了？",pEN="Lok'tar, <race>. What brings you to my humble abode?",c="啊，对。我一直在等这些物品。做得很好。请收下这些补给作为报酬。",cEN="Ah, yes. I have been waiting for these items. A fine job has been done in crafting them. Please take these supplies as payment."}
Q[27671]={d="你好，冒险者……而且还是位铁匠！我需要你的服务。\n\n一位名叫布莱恩的隐居萨满请我制作一些白银万能钥匙，可我的白银用光了。如果你能弄到一些并完成她的订单，我就能专心处理大酋长要的这些新武器。",dEN="Hail adventurer... and a blacksmith as well! I have need of your services.\n\nA reclusive shaman named Brine requested that I craft some Silver Skeleton Keys for you, but I am all out of silver. If you could acquire some and fill her order, that would allow me to focus on these new weapons the warchief requested.",o="塔特纳克·钢锻希望你运用锻造技能制作 4 把白银万能钥匙，并把订单送到贫瘠之地南部黑棘山脊顶上的布莱恩那里。",oEN="Tatternack Steelforge wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 4 Silver Skeleton Key and take the order to Brine at the top of Blackthorn Ridge in the southern Barrens.",p="野猪人有很多秘密，<class>。",pEN="The quilboar have many secrets, <class>.",c="万能钥匙？确实，我正需要。谢谢你亲自送来，请务必收下这些补给，连同你的报酬。",cEN="Skeleton keys? Indeed, I have need of them. I thank you for delivering them personally and insist you take these supplies with your payment."}
Q[27672]={d="自从野猪人袭击了那支商队，有个牛头人就一直在南部黄金之路上往来。我敬佩他的坚韧，但装备好一些他能撑得更久。\n\n我一直没时间为他制作两把厚重战斧，但我鼓励你去做。做好之后，你可以在南边的大路上找到他巡逻。",dEN="One of the tauren has taken up traveling the Southern Gold Road ever since the quilboar attacked that caravan. I admire his tenacity but he'll last longer if he's better armed.\n\nI haven't had time to craft a couple Thick War Axes for him, but I encourage you to do so. You can find him patrolling along the road to the south when you are done.",o="塔特纳克·钢锻希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把厚重战斧，并把订单送到贫瘠之地南部黄金之路的加恩·石塔那里。",oEN="Tatternack Steelforge wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Thick War Axe and take the order to Gann Stonespire at the Southern Gold Road in the Barrens.",p="麻烦要来了。我能从角里感觉到。",pEN="Trouble's coming. I can feel it in my horns.",c="很高兴拿到这些斧子，<name>。有野猪人、探险者协会和联盟在，我们得料到这些天里会有一场袭击。\n\n请让我给你一些补给作为交换。",cEN="I'm glad to get these axes, <name>. Between quilboar, the Explorer's League, and the Alliance, we must expect an attack will come one of these days.\n\nPlease, let me give you some supplies in exchange."}
Q[27673]={d="嘿，你是镇上新来的铁匠吗？战歌的订单把我压得喘不过气，而且我手上还有一份优先委托。如果你愿意帮我，就制作一把重型青铜钉锤和两块重型配重石，送到银翼岗哨附近山丘上的托雷克那里。他正带着小队在那里准备一次突袭。",dEN="Hey, you a new blacksmith in town? I'm backed up on orders for the Warsong and I have a priority commission. If you're willing to help me out, just craft a Heavy Bronze Mace and a couple of Heavy Weightstones, and take them up to Torek in the hills near Silverwing Outpost. He's preparing for an assult with his squad up there.",o="工头巴兰希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 把重型青铜钉锤和 2 块重型配重石，并把订单送到灰谷银翼岗哨以东山丘的托雷克那里。",oEN="Taskmaster Baran wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Heavy Bronze Mace and 2 Heavy Weightstone and take the order to Torek at a hill east of Silverwing Outpost in Ashenvale.",p="我很忙，<race>。",pEN="I'm quite busy, <race>.",c="巴兰总算把东西送来了。请收下这些我从暗夜精灵那里收集的材料，作为补充报酬。",cEN="Baran finally came through. Please take these materials I gathered from the night elves as supplemental payment."}
Q[27674]={d="你不会正好是铁匠吧？哦，你真是！我需要你的帮助。\n\n塔伦米尔上一任铁匠死在了第三次大战里，我们一些卫兵只能用剩下的破烂凑合。我想为死亡猎手莱什委托一面纯银盾牌，可我一直得从幽暗城一路调护甲，运来要很久。如果你能替我制作并送去这面盾牌，我会确保莱什能给你一些补给作为交换。",dEN="You wouldn't happen to be a Blacksmith, would you? Oh, you are! I need your help.\n\nTarren Mill's last smith died during the Third War and some of our guards are making do with leftover scraps. I'd like to commission a Pure Silver Shield for Deathstalker Lesh but I've had to request armor all the way from the Undercity and it takes a long time to arrive. If you could craft and deliver the shield for me, I'll make sure Lesh can provide you with supplies in exchange.",o="奥特希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 面纯银盾牌，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵西南部南点塔的死亡猎手莱什那里。",oEN="Ott wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Pure Silver Shield and take the order to Deathstalker Lesh at Southpoint Tower in southwestern Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="路上小心，<race>。这附近有人类出没。",pEN="Be careful on the roads, <race>. There are humans about.",c="这比我现在的盾牌好多了。我会告诉奥特你完成了委托。这是他提到的补给。",cEN="This is much nicer than my current shield. I'll let Ott know you fulfilled your commission. Here are the supplies he mentioned."}
Q[27675]={d="啊，一位铁匠！也许你能帮我——万一商队再遭袭击，我得做好准备，为此我想要两把好匕首。要快的那种，你知道的。又亮又快。你能办到吗？",dEN="Ah, a blacksmith! Perhaps you can assist me -- I've gotta be prepared if the caravan gets attacked again, and to that end, I'd like a couple of nice daggers. Something quick, ya know. Shiny, and quick. Can you handle that?",o="维兹洛·轴承光亮者希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把速制青铜匕首，并把订单送到千针石林白崖岗哨的维兹洛·轴承光亮者那里。",oEN="Wizlo Bearingshiner wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Quick Bronze Dagger and take the order to Wizlo Bearingshiner at Whitereach Post in Thousand Needles.",p="我离开科赞的时候，从没想过会跟有知觉的牛待上这么久。",pEN="When I left Kezan, I never imagined I'd be spending so much time with sentient cows.",c="这些刀刃正合我用。那些半人马最好当心点！\n\n至于你，请收下这些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="These blades are suited to my needs. Those centaur better watch out!\n\nAs for you, please take these supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27676]={d="嘿，你是铁匠吗？有个兽人在熔炉上留了张字条，说凡是路过的铁匠都可以接——他要找三副镀银青铜护手。如果你有兴趣，做好之后送到玛拉卡金的达恩·利爪那里。",dEN="Hey, you a blacksmith? This orc left a note on the forge for any smith who came by that he's lookin' for three pairs of Silvered Bronze Gauntlets. If'n you're interested, craft 'em and take 'em down to Darn Talongrip at Malaka'jin.",o="迪齐·泉涌希望你运用锻造技能制作 3 副镀银青铜护手，并把订单送到石爪山脉南部玛拉卡金的达恩·利爪那里。",oEN="Ditsy Springsocket wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 3 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets and take the order to Darn Talongrip at Malaka'jin in southern Stonetalon Mountains.",p="我在风险投资公司手里折了不少人，<class>。你要是去风剪峭壁，务必小心。",pEN="I've lost men to the Venture Company, <class>. Be wary if you're travelling to Windshear Crag.",c="风险投资公司打来的时候，我们要是有这样的好护甲就好了。至少现在我有机会组织反击了。请收下这些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="If only we'd had proper armor like this when the Venture Company attacked. At least I have a chance to mount a counterattack now. Please, take these supplies as thanks."}
Q[27677]={d="很高兴在这里见到另一位铁匠。那位矮人猎人赫米特·奈辛瓦里有一份制作委托。我猜联盟还没建立起补给线，所以没法帮他解决武器需求。\n\n我自己不太愿意冒险靠近联盟的地盘，所以如果我能委托你替我制作一把青铜战斧、一把青铜巨剑和一把青铜战锤，送到他营地的赫米特那里，我会很感激。",dEN="I'm glad to see another blacksmith here. I have a crafting request from that dwarf hunter, Hemet Nesingwary. I guess the Alliance haven't set up a supply line yet, so they can't help him out with his weapon needs.\n\nI'd rather not venture that close to Alliance territory myself, so if I could commission you to craft a Bronze Battle Axe, Bronze Greatsword, and Bronze Warhammer in my place, and deliver them to Hemet at his camp, I'd appreciate it.",o="瓦尔希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 把青铜战斧、1 把青铜巨剑和 1 把青铜战锤，并把订单送到荆棘谷北部奈辛瓦里远征营地的赫米特·奈辛瓦里那里。",oEN="Vharr wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Bronze Battle Axe and 1 Bronze Greatsword and 1 Bronze Warhammer and take the order to Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Expedition in northern Stranglethorn.",p="你制作出我要的武器了吗？",pEN="Were you able to craft the weapons I requested?",c="这些分量扎实、配重也好，<name>。我的猎人们会很高兴用上新武器。给，如约付给你的补给。",cEN="These have solid heft and good balance, <name>. My hunters will appreciate using some new arms. Here, as promised, are some supplies in payment."}
Q[27678]={d="你，打铁？\n\n人类要护甲，但我不知道怎么做人类合身。只会武器。他需要绿铁头盔、绿铁护腿和绿铁护腕。你要是打铁的，送到女巫山的沼泽之眼那里。",dEN="You metal pounder?\n\nHuman ask for armor but me not know how make human fit. Only weapon. He need Green Iron Helm, Green Iron Leggings, and Green Iron Bracers. If you pound metal, take to Swamp Eye at Witch Hill.",o="\"\n祖尔格希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 顶绿铁头盔、1 副绿铁护腕和 1 条绿铁护腿，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽沼泽之光庄园的\"沼泽之眼\"贾尔那里。",oEN="Zulrg wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Green Iron Helm and 1 Green Iron Bracers and 1 Green Iron Leggings and take the order to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at Swamplight Manor in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="我代表联盟向你致意，<class>。",pEN="I greet you on behalf of the Alliance, <class>.",c="我喜欢这套护甲。谢谢，<name>。\n\n我手头没有多少现钱付你，但请收下这些补给，助你精进技艺。",cEN="I like this armor. Thanks, <name>.\n\nWhile I do not have much ready coin to pay you, please take these supplies to further your crafting."}
Q[27679]={d="欢迎来到这片荒地，铁匠。我哥哥也是铁匠，我真希望他的本事能跟我一起来这儿。幽暗城来的一个药剂师想买几把匕首，可暗影猎谷的巨魔主要做斧子。如果你有本事制作闪钢匕首，暗影猎谷的安妮·格林会对你的服务感兴趣。",dEN="Welcome to the wasteland, blacksmith. My brother is a blacksmith and I wish I had his skills with me here. One of those apothecaries from the Undercity was trying to buy some daggers, but the trolls in Shadowprey mainly deal in axes. If you've got the skill to craft some Glinting Steel Daggers, Annie Grim in Shadowprey would be interested in your services.",o="塔卡塔·钢刃希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把闪钢匕首，并把订单送到凄凉之地暗影猎谷村的安妮·格林那里。",oEN="Takata Steelblade wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Glinting Steel Dagger and take the order to Annie Grim at Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="铁匠？哦！我想买几把匕首用于……个人防护。绝对不是什么邪恶的事或者献祭之类的。我发誓，要是有……呃……你有吗？",pEN="A blacksmith? Oh! I'm interested in buying some daggers for... personal protection. Definitely nothing evil or sacrifices, or anything like that. Cross my heart and hope to... well... do you have any?",c="谢谢你出力为我制作这些匕首。这里有些补给，作为你的报酬！可不许退货！",cEN="I appreciate you pitching in to craft these daggers for me. Here's some supplies as your payment! And no take-backsies or anything!"}
Q[27680]={d="这里没有铁匠，想弄到新护甲很难，但我更替葛恩这样的游骑兵难过。他还在用从德拉诺带来的护甲和武器凑合！\n\n你是铁匠？那好，如果你有兴趣帮忙，葛恩正需要一件新的绿铁锁甲。他自己绝不会开口，但我们必须让他穿好护甲。要是失去游骑兵，我真不知道下一次联盟来袭时我们该怎么守！",dEN="It's tough to get new armor since we have no smith here, but I feel even worse for the outriders like Gorn. He's making do with armor and weapons he brought from Draenor!\n\nYou're a blacksmith? Well, if you're interested in helping, Gorn could use a new Green Iron Hauberk. He'd never ask himself but we need to keep him well armored. If we lose our outriders, I don't know how we'll defend against the next Alliance attack!",o="妮卡·血痕希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 件绿铁锁甲，并把订单送到荒芜之地卡加斯的葛恩那里。",oEN="Neeka Bloodscar wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Green Iron Hauberk and take the order to Gorn at Kargath in Badlands.",p="有什么能帮你的吗？",pEN="How can I help you?",c="我很感激这份礼物，<name>。你在没有报酬承诺的情况下还来关照我的需要，真是好心，但我坚持要你从我们的储备里收下这些补给作为补偿。为了部落！",cEN="I am thankful for this gift, <name>. It is kind of you to attend to my needs with no promise of payment, but I insist you take these supplies from our stockpile as compensation. For the Horde!"}
Q[27681]={d="我干的是铁匠这一行，可这些天我发现自己没多少心思去打理熔炉。\n\n钢胆船长往落锤镇捎了封信，问有没有人能制作一枚敏捷黄水晶护符，作为送给他妻子的礼物——算是为长期在外致歉。我不想对他的请求置之不理，所以如果你能替我完成，可以在法迪尔海湾找到他，他正停泊在那里。",dEN="I am a smith by trade but I find I have little will to work the forge these days.\n\nCaptain Steelgut sent a note to Hammerfall asking if someone could make an Agile Citrine Amulet as a gift for his wife -- an apology of sorts for being away for so long. I do not wish to ignore his request, so if you could fulfill it for me, you'll find him anchored at Faldir's Cove.",o="戈穆尔希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 枚敏捷黄水晶护符，并把订单送到阿拉希高地南部法迪尔海湾的钢胆船长那里。",oEN="Gor'mul wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Agile Citrine Amulet and take the order to Captain Steelgut at Faldir's Cove in southern Arathi Highlands.",p="风平浪静的海面最是难熬。",pEN="Becalmed seas are the devil.",c="说真的，你这次可救了我，<class>。我有些从海上截获的劫掠者那里搜来的补给。请收下，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Truly, you've bailed me out this time, <class>. I have some supplies looted from raiders we took at sea. Please take them, with my thanks."}
Q[27682]={d="我们在莫沙彻营地队伍里没几个工匠，所以需要你的服务，铁匠。我想委托你为新兵制作六件钢质胸甲。做好之后请送到我这里来。",dEN="We have few crafters in our ranks at Camp Mojache, so I could use your services, blacksmith. I'd like to commission you to make six Steel Breastplates for new recruits. Please bring them to me once you have completed them.",o="洛克·奥汉希望你运用锻造技能制作 6 件钢质胸甲，并把订单送到菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的洛克·奥汉那里。",oEN="Rok Orhan wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 6 Steel Breastplate and take the order to Rok Orhan at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="这里的森林幽暗深邃，<class>。",pEN="The woods are dark and deep here, <class>.",c="太好了。以后我可能还需要锻造的活儿。请再来一趟。这里有些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="Excellent. I may need more smithing in the future. Please visit again. Here are some supplies as my thanks."}
Q[27683]={d="啊，一位铁匠。我需要你的手艺。\n\n虽然异种虫已被击退，我们仍需要新武器继续作战。我听说过一种巨型黑锤，对付这类生物是极好的武器。如果你能制作一对带来给我试试，我们就看看关于它威力的传闻是否属实。",dEN="Ah, a blacksmith. I have need of your skills.\n\nThough the Silithid have been driven back, we need new weapons to continue the fight. I've heard of a Big Black Mace that is an excellent weapon against the creatures. If you could craft and bring me a pair to try out, we shall see if the rumors of their efficacy are true.",o="努恩特格·双弯希望你运用锻造技能制作 2 把巨型黑锤，并把订单送到塔纳利斯安杰瓦萨的努恩特格·双弯那里。",oEN="Nuntege Twobend wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 2 Big Black Mace and take the order to Nuntege Twobend at Anje'watha in Tanaris.",p="你把那些钉锤做好了吗，<class>？",pEN="Have you crafted those maces, <class>?",c="我期待着用这些砸碎几个头骨——当然，是出于职业需要。请收下这箱补给作为报酬。",cEN="I look forward to smashing a few skulls with these -- in a professional capacity of course. Please take this box of supplies as payment."}
Q[27684]={d="Lok'tar！你是铁匠，对吧？\n\n艾萨拉的海岸常有各种箱子货柜被冲上来，都是被这片海域的凶猛风暴打沉的船留下的。我想撬开其中一些，为此需要几把真银万能钥匙。如果你能制作一些送过来，我就能帮着补给基地——还能让那批财宝不落到联盟手里。",dEN="Lok'tar! You're a blacksmith, aren't you?\n\nMany crates and boxes wash up on the shore of Azshara from various shipwrecks in the dangerous storms that pound these waters. I'd like to open some of them up, and for that I'll need some Truesilver Skeleton Keys. If you could craft and deliver some here, I could help with supplying the base -- and keep that treasure out of Alliance hands.",o="格鲁尔·黑刃希望你运用锻造技能制作 4 把真银万能钥匙，并把订单送到艾萨拉瓦罗莫克的格鲁尔·黑刃那里。",oEN="Gruul Darkblade wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 4 Truesilver Skeleton Key and take the order to Gruul Darkblade at Valormok in Azshara.",p="你拿到钥匙了吗？",pEN="Do you have the keys?",c="这能帮上艾萨拉的部落。没有白干的活儿，所以把这个当作我们送你的礼物。",cEN="This will help the Horde in Azshara. No work goes unrewarded, so take this as our gift to you."}
Q[27685]={d="铁匠？我正需要你的本领。\n\n如今得知丈夫的死讯，我受到激励，要追随他的脚步，斩杀恶魔，努力让这片土地更安全。要做到他所做的一半，我需要护甲。给我带来一顶秘银头盔和一条秘银鳞片护腿，我会酬谢你。",dEN="A blacksmith? I could use your talents.\n\nNow that I have learned of my husband's death, I am inspired to follow in his footsteps, slaying demons and trying to make this land safer. To accomplish even half of what he did, I need armor. Bring me a Mithril Coif and Mithril Scale Pants, I will reward you.",o="德蕾卡苏尔希望你运用锻造技能制作 1 顶秘银头盔和 1 条秘银鳞片护腿，并把订单送到费伍德森林血毒岗哨的德蕾卡苏尔那里。",oEN="Dreka'Sur wants you to use your blacksmithing skill to craft 1 Mithril Coif and 1 Mithril Scale Pants and take the order to Dreka'Sur at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.",p="这片森林里的空气都弥漫着浓重的邪能魔法。",pEN="The very air is thick with fel magic in these woods.",c="做得非常好，<name>。我真希望这套能撑得够久，让我杀死和我丈夫一样多的恶魔。\n\n收下这些补给，连同我的谢意。",cEN="Very good work, <name>. I do hope these last long enough for me to slay as many demons as my husband did.\n\nTake these supplies with my gratitude."}
Q[28062]={d="嘿，<name>！是来客栈吃顿饱饭、喝杯麦酒的吗？那我可有个坏消息——我们今天特供的香料狼肉排卖光了。\n\n我说，你自己是不是也懂点厨艺？如果你愿意搭把手，做上一些今天的特供，我很乐意给你一份跟你体重差不多的生肉！听起来像笔交易吗？",dEN="Hey there, <name>! Come to get a hearty meal and tankard of ale at the inn? Well, I've bad news for ye -- we're all out of our special of the day, Spiced Wolf Meat.\n\nSay, aren't ye a bit o' a cook yourself? If yer willin' to give me a hand and cook up some of today's special, I'll be happy to give ye yer weight in raw meat! Sound like a deal?",o="格雷姆洛克·皮尔斯诺希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份香料狼肉排，并把订单送到丹莫罗卡拉诺斯的格雷姆洛克·皮尔斯诺那里。",oEN="Gremlock Pilsnor wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Spiced Wolf Meat and take the order to Gremlock Pilsnor at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="你还没做完菜吗？我们有一大群饿着肚子的客人等着呢！",pEN="Are ye done cookin' yet? We've got a mess o' hungry diners waitin'!",c="啊，对了！这正合口味，对吧，<name>？想喝杯冰啤酒随时过来！",cEN="Ah, right! That hits the spot, don't it, <name>? Feel free to stop by any time ye want a cold brew!"}
Q[28063]={d="呼！今天忙得不可开交，我在炉边站了太久，自己一口东西都没吃。\n\n也许你能帮上忙？你用平底锅也挺在行，我很想来一大堆煮好的美味小鱼。如果你能办到，我就拿一些我特制的生食烹饪材料跟你换。成交吗？",dEN="Whew! It's been a most busy day and I've been so long at the hearth that I haven't had a bite to eat myself.\n\nMaybe you could help? You're a fair hand with a frying pan yourself and I'd love a mess of cooked Brilliant Smallfish. If you could handle that, then I'll trade you some of my special raw cooking materials. Do we have a deal?",o="托马斯希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条美味小鱼，并把订单送到艾尔文森林闪金镇的托马斯那里。",oEN="Tomas wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Brilliant Smallfish and take the order to Tomas at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",p="不，那不是兽人火炮……只是我的肚子在咕咕叫。",pEN="No, that wasn't orcish artillery... just my stomach growling.",c="太感谢了，<name>！我欠你一份人情……就装在这些补给袋里。",cEN="Thanks a bunch, <name>! I owe you one... of these bags of supplies."}
Q[28064]={d="还有什么事比钓鱼更让人饿吗？那些烹饪和料理鱼的种种美味做法让我的肚子直叫。\n\n可大海提供的美味可不只是会游的。你吃过水煮蚌肉吗，<name>？我现在就非常想来一些。如果你愿意为我做些，我不会让你白忙。",dEN="Does anything make you hungrier than fishing? All those delicious ways to cook and prepare fish has my stomach rumbling.\n\nBut the sea offers more delicacies than just the swimming kind. You ever have Boiled Clams, <name>? I could sure go for some of those right now. If you'd be willing to make some for me, I'll make it worth your while.",o="古博·布拉普希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份水煮蚌肉，并把订单送到黑海岸奥伯丁的古博·布拉普那里。",oEN="Gubber Blump wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Boiled Clams and take the order to Gubber Blump at Auberdine in Darkshore.",p="辣味蚌肉……蚌肉惊喜……蚌肉浓汤……蚌肉的做法可真多！",pEN="Deviled clams... clam surprise... clam gumbo... so many ways to make clams!",c="哎呀，你真是个可爱的 <class>！我没想到这么快就有这样的美味。正合口味！",cEN="Well, aren't you a dear <class>! I wasn't expecting a treat like this so quickly. That hits the spot!"}
Q[28065]={d="Ishnu'alah，<class>。这座前哨很偏远，人手又少，却要应付许多事务，好让我们的部队在风险投资公司来袭时保持戒备……或者，愿艾露恩阻止，部落来袭时也是如此。\n\n我需要一位厨师的协助。你能为驻扎在这里的哨兵准备一些彩鳍金枪鱼吗？一顿热腾腾的健康鱼餐，比起鹿肉和双足飞龙蛋，会是种不错的调剂。",dEN="Ishnu'alah, <class>. This outpost is remote and we have few hands to help with the many tasks that keep our troops ready in case of an attack by the Venture Company... or, Elune forbid, the Horde.\n\nI could use the assistance of a cook. Could you prepare some Rainbow Fin Albacore for the Sentinels stationed here? A good, hot meal of healthy fish would be a nice change of pace from stag meat and wyvern eggs.",o="迈内拉队长希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条彩鳍金枪鱼，并把订单送到石爪山脉石爪林地迈内拉队长那里。",oEN="Captain Mynera wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Rainbow Fin Albacore and take the order to Captain Mynera at Stonetalon Grove in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="你带着我们部队的口粮回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with our troops' rations?",c="谢谢你，<class>。愿你行走在艾露恩的光芒之中。",cEN="I thank you, <class>. May you walk in Elune's light."}
Q[28066]={d="Ishnu-dal-dieb，<class>。大海的馈赠近在咫尺，却又远在天边。你看，我得在这里等我的朋友，他随时都会到。可我实在太想吃美味的蟹肉蛋糕了！\n\n如果你能为我做一些，那真是好心，但你要是太忙，我也理解。我就在这儿。等着……",dEN="Ishnu-dal-dieb, <class>. The bounty of the sea is so close, but yet so far away. You see, I must wait here for my friend who is due to arrive at any moment. But I am so hungry for some delicious Crab Cakes!\n\nIt would be a kindness if you could make some for me, but I understand if you are too busy. I'll just be here. Waiting....",o="莉拉迪丝·月河希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份蟹肉蛋糕，并把订单送到灰谷迈斯特拉岗哨的莉拉迪丝·月河那里。",oEN="Liladris Moonriver wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Crab Cake and take the order to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",p="科罗尼安怎么这么久？",pEN="What is taking Kerlonian so long?",c="蟹肉蛋糕！有了这份礼物，我的等待会好受得多。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Crab Cakes! You will make my wait much more bearable with this gift. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[28067]={d="啊，<name>！今天天气不是很好吗？太阳照着，鱼儿上钩，我正想来点干烤猪肋排！\n\n怎么，你以为我还想要鱼？我天天都能吃鱼，也常常吃。不，今天我想来点不一样的。你愿意帮帮一个老头子吗？",dEN="Ah, <name>! Isn't it a lovely day? The sun is shinin', the fish are bitin', and I could sure go for some Dry Pork Ribs!\n\nWhat, you thought I'd want more fish? I can have fish every day, and often do. No, today I'd like something a little bit different. Think you could help an old man out?",o="瓦格·深水希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份干烤猪肋排，并把订单送到洛克莫丹湖泊区的瓦格·深水那里。",oEN="Warg Deepwater wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Dry Pork Ribs and take the order to Warg Deepwater at the Loch in Loch Modan.",p="嗯，嗯，嗯，想想看。很快我们就能吮上多汁的猪肋排了。",pEN="Mmm, mmm, mmm, just think. Soon we'll be suckin' on juicy pork ribs.",c="就该这样，$glad:lass！给，作为谢意，一些我自己的存货，给你的厨房用。",cEN="That's the ticket, $glad:lass,! And here, as thanks, some of my own stock for your kitchen."}
Q[28068]={d="看看这海，<name>。海这么近，鱼这么多。可船一艘接一艘地进港，我永远没时间去钓鱼，更别说下厨了。\n\n你愿意帮我个忙吗？我想吃点热腾腾的、美味的刚鬃鲶鱼。你似乎有些灶台上的本事。我很乐意付你报酬。",dEN="Look at it, <name>. The sea is so near, and so full of fish. But I'll never have time to catch anything, let alone cook it up, with all these ships coming in.\n\nAre you willing to do me a favor? I'd like some nice hot Bristle Whisker Catfish cooked up. You seem to have some skill at the cookfire. I'd be happy to pay you for your services.",o="卡尔·波兰希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条刚鬃鲶鱼，并把订单送到湿地米奈希尔港的卡尔·波兰那里。",oEN="Karl Boran wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Bristle Whisker Catfish and take the order to Karl Boran at Menethil Harbor in Wetlands.",p="不知你能不能一边做菜一边钓鱼？",pEN="I wonder if you can cook and fish at the same time?",c="太好了，<name>。真的很感谢你抽时间来帮我。既然活儿干完了，让我来帮你吧。",cEN="This is great, <name>. I really appreciate you taking the time to help me. Now that the job's done, let me help you."}
Q[28069]={d="我来凄凉之地，是因为圣光召唤我来探访这座神圣的废墟，可我想家了。具体来说，我想念家乡所有最好的食物，比如一份热腾腾、多汁的大熊排。\n\n我知道凄凉之地没有熊，但如果你能运些熊肉来，给我煎几份肉排，我会由衷地感激你。",dEN="I came to Desolace because I was called by the Light to visit this sacred ruin, but I miss home. Specifically, I miss eating all the best foods from home, like a nice hot, juicy, Big Bear Steak.\n\nI know there's no bears in Desolace but if you could import some bear meat and cook me some steaks, you would have my sincere gratitude.",o="马克·扎普希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份大熊排，并把订单送到凄凉之地埃塞尔·雷瑟的马克·扎普那里。",oEN="Mac Zappe wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Big Bear Steak and take the order to Mac Zappe at Ethel Rethor in Desolace.",p="圣光召唤之处，我必须前往。",pEN="Where the Light calls, I must follow.",c="愿圣光因这份善意保佑你，<class>。我会一边品尝这顿饭，一边怀着温情回想家乡。",cEN="The Light bless you for this kindness, <class>. I will savor this meal as I think fondly of home."}
Q[28070]={d="欢迎来到我这简陋的家，<class>。没什么看头，但它是我的。\n\n我以前常年在海上，发现自己很想念那边的菜肴。自家园子做的家常菜自有其魅力，但为了一盘地精辣味蚌肉，我几乎什么都愿意给。如果你会做，给我带一些来，我不会让你白忙！",dEN="Welcome to my simple home, <class>. It's not much to look at but it's mine.\n\nI used to spend a lot of time on the sea and I find I miss the cuisine. Homecooked meals from your own garden have charm, but there's not much I wouldn't give for a plate of Goblin Deviled Clams. If you know how to cook them, I'd make it worth your while to bring me some!",o="乔丹·斯特维尔希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份地精辣味蚌肉，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵西部他家里的乔丹·斯特维尔那里。",oEN="Jordan Stewel wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Goblin Deviled Clams and take the order to Jordan Stewel at his home in western Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="海浪不再像从前那样呼唤我，但蚌肉还会！",pEN="The waves don't call to me like they once did, but the clams still do!",c="啊……香料放得刚刚好。第一口真够劲。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ahh... the spices are just right. That initial bite is a real kick to the tongue. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28071]={d="搞这些发明可是件苦差事，<class>！摆弄这些创造物，我的胃口都上来了。问题是我不太会做饭。做实验那一套，用在真想吃的食物上一般行不通。\n\n你厨艺好吗？如果好的话，你可以帮我做上一些美味又营养的长嘴泥鳅。你拿新鲜泥鳅来，我厨房里有什么你就拿什么！",dEN="All this inventing is hard work, <class>! I've sure worked up an appetite working through all these creations. Problem is, I'm not much of a cook. Experimentation generally doesn't go as well with food you actually want to eat.\n\nYou any good at cooking? If so, you could help me out by whipping up some delicious and nutritious Longjaw Mud Snapper. I'll give you whatever I've got lying around my kitchen for some fresh snapper!",o="梅博克·米兹里克斯希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条长嘴泥鳅，并把订单送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的梅博克·米兹里克斯那里。",oEN="Mebok Mizzyrix wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Longjaw Mud Snapper and take the order to Mebok Mizzyrix at Ratchet in the Barrens.",p="别担心，小鼻头们，你们不会进锅的。今天不会。",pEN="Don't worry little snufflenoses, you're not going in the pot. Today.",c="谢谢，<name>。就跟我贝蒂塔姨妈以前做的一样。",cEN="Thanks, <name>. Just like my Auntie Bertita used to make."}
Q[28072]={d="我们驶进这个小海湾，是想短暂上岸休整，<name>，可现在船员们不肯再出海，除非确认黑石船队没在这片水域出没。这期间补给有点吃紧，我需要你帮忙。\n\n我听说高地到处都是迅猛龙，迅猛龙会下蛋。可我们是水手，不是猎人，所以我需要你去弄到那些蛋，再给我们做出来。如果你能给我的船员端上一大堆神秘肉排，我们就欠你一份情。",dEN="We sailed into this little cove for a quick shore leave, <name>, but now my crew doesn't want to take to the sea again until we know that Blackstone's fleet isn't prowling these waters. In the meantime, supplies are running a little bit low and I could use your help.\n\nI hear that the Highlands are full of raptors, and raptors lay eggs. Now, we're sailors, not hunters, so I'm going to need you to get those eggs and cook them up for us. But if you can deliver my crew a mess of Curiously Tasty Omelets, we'll be in your debt.",o="钢胆船长希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份神秘肉排，并把订单送到阿拉希高地法迪尔海湾的钢胆船长那里。",oEN="Captain Steelgut wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Curiously Tasty Omelet and take the order to Captain Steelgut at Faldir's Cove in Arathi Highlands.",p="要是再不弄点吃的来，我手下的船员怕是要哗变了。",pEN="I might have a mutiny on my hands if we don't get some grub soon.",c="谢谢，<name>。这足够压住饥饿，撑到我们重回海上。",cEN="Thanks, <name>. This'll stave off the hunger pains long enough to get back on the sea."}
Q[28073]={d="我遇上麻烦了，<class>。我不光把船长的弯刀输给了那个怪物内格拉什，还答应过船员，等我们一靠上藏宝海湾就给他们做顿特别的。这个承诺我一直没能兑现，船员们开始不安分了。\n\n如果你愿意帮我，我需要一大堆巨蚌肉块。这正是海盗出海前吊胃口的好东西！",dEN="I'm in trouble here, <class>. Not only did I lose my captain's cutlass to that monster Negolash, but I promised my crew a special meal once we put into Booty Bay. I haven't been able to deliver on that promise and the crew is getting restless.\n\nIf you're willing to help me out, I could use a whole mess of Giant Clam Scorcho. That's just the thing to whet a pirate's appetite before he heads back out to sea!",o="赫克尔伯里·斯莫茨船长希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份巨蚌肉块，并把订单送到荆棘谷藏宝海湾的赫克尔伯里·斯莫茨船长那里。",oEN="Captain Hecklebury Smotts wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Giant Clam Scorcho and take the order to Captain Hecklebury Smotts at Booty Bay in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="要是再不给他们弄点吃的，我手下的船员怕是要哗变了。",pEN="I might have a mutiny on my hands if I don't get their grub soon.",c="谢谢，<name>。这足够压住饥饿，撑到我们重回海上。",cEN="Thanks, <name>. This'll stave off the hunger pains long enough to get back on the sea."}
Q[28074]={d="啊，一位访客！你觉得地精们在海岸边建起的这座漂亮城市如何，嗯？热砂港真是发展起来了！我还记得它只是码头边几间小屋的时候。感觉像是上辈子的事了……总之，你不是来听我追忆过去的。你是来给我做美味的秘银鳕鱼的，对吧？我总是知道每个人接下来要做什么！",dEN="Ah, a visitor! What do you think of this fine city the goblins have built on the shore, hmm? Steamwheedle has really grown! I remember when it was just a couple huts next to a pier. Feels like another lifetime ago... anyway, you're not here to listen to me ruminate about the past. You're here to cook me some delicious Mithril Head Trout, aren't you? I always know what everyone is about to do!",o="纳瑞安·讯息之愿希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条秘银鳕鱼，并把订单送到塔纳利斯热砂港附近他家里的纳瑞安·讯息之愿那里。",oEN="Narain Soothfancy wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Mithril Head Trout and take the order to Narain Soothfancy at his home near Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="为什么我总觉得少了点什么……某种目的？嗯。",pEN="Why do I feel like I'm missing something... some purpose? Hmm.",c="我的胃缺的就是这条鱼，<name>，这没错。给，收下我的一些零碎杂物吧。",cEN="My stomach was missing this fish, <name>, that's for sure. And here, take some of my odds and ends."}
Q[28075]={d="我发现东部王国急需我的本事，所以我很感激能来到这里。我只希望这里的饭菜更……可口一些。我渴望鼠尾鱼的美味那种清淡细腻的滋味，就像我在阿斯特兰纳常吃的那样。\n\n我想你大概不太擅长灶火吧？如果擅长，我很乐意用一些刚做好的鼠尾鱼酬谢你。",dEN="I've found the Eastern Kingdoms to be sorely in need of my skills, so I am grateful to be here. I only wish that the fare was more... palatable. I long for the light and delicate flavor of Sagefish Delight, like I used to have back in Astranaar.\n\nI don't suppose you're proficient with a hearthfire, are you? If so, I would be happy to reward you for some fresh cooked Sagefish.",o="西蒙妮·坎特瑞尔希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份美味鼠尾鱼，并把订单送到奥特兰克山脉拉文霍德庄园的西蒙妮·坎特瑞尔那里。",oEN="Simone Cantrell wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Sagefish Delight and take the order to Simone Cantrell at Ravenholdt Manor in Alterac Mountains.",p="我真心希望你在烹饪之前把这些鱼的刺都剔干净了。",pEN="I do hope you've properly deboned all of these before you cooked them.",c="在异乡能尝到一点家乡的味道总是令人感激。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="A little taste of home is always appreciated in a foreign land. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[28076]={d="我很喜欢青蛙腿，但总不能一辈子只吃青蛙腿吧。嗯，也许我可以。你能吗？\n\n不管怎样，我想吃点青蛙以外的东西。我不太喜欢蜘蛛，但它们的肉相当美味。给我带些蜘蛛香肠来，好吗？",dEN="I like frog legs a lot, but you can't eat only frog legs forever. Well, maybe I can. Could you?\n\nEither way, I'd like something more than frog to eat. I don't like spiders much but their meat is pretty tasty. Bring me some Spider Sausage, will you?",o="\"「沼泽之眼」贾尔希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份蜘蛛香肠，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽沼泽之光庄园的\"「沼泽之眼」贾尔\"那里。\"",oEN="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Spider Sausage and take the order to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at Swamplight Manor in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="蜘蛛香肠配青蛙腿，还有比这更好的搭配吗？面包和黄油？不。",pEN="Spider Sausage and frog legs, what could be a better combination? Bread and butter? Nah.",c="这正是我要的，<name>。谢谢。",cEN="This is what I asked for, <name>. Thank you."}
Q[28077]={d="你好啊。你是厨师吗？我看到你外袍上的油火渍，就猜是这样。\n\n东边有一大群龙，那些龙有时会喷火。我真羡慕！不过这事有办法解决。\n\n龙息红椒。听说过吗？给我做一些，让我也能像龙一样喷火，我就是个快活的地精了。",dEN="Yo there. You a cook? I saw the greasefire stains on your tunic and I assumed that was the case.\n\nOut east there's a whole bunch of dragons and those dragons sometimes breathe fire. I'm jealous! But there is something that can be done about it.\n\nDragonbreath Chili. Ever heard of it? Make me some so I can breathe fire like a dragon, and I'll be a happy goblin.",o="德克·风响希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份龙息红椒，并把订单送到荒芜之地泉涌矿洞的德克·风响那里。",oEN="Dirk Windrattle wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Dragonbreath Chili and take the order to Dirk Windrattle at Springsocket in Badlands.",p="红椒最棒的地方就在于我可以从两头喷火。",pEN="The best part about Chili is that I get to breathe fire from BOTH ends.",c="辣！辣！但这正是我点的。给，收下一些补给，算是谢意。",cEN="Hot! Hot! But that's what I ordered. Here, take some supplies as my thanks."}
Q[28078]={d="你好，<name>！既然你对烹饪表现出了兴趣，我正需要你帮忙。这些天血蹄村里有很多饿着肚子的受训者，而我的香料狼肉排已经喂完了。如果你愿意搭把手再多做一些，我很乐意给你一些补给，对练习厨艺很有用！你能帮忙吗？",dEN="Hail, <name>! Since you have shown an interest in Cooking, I could use your help. We have many hungry trainees in Bloodhoof Village these days and I am all out of Spiced Wolf Meat to feed them. If you are willing to give me a hand and cook up some more, I'll be happy to give you some supplies you will find useful in practicing your cooking! Can you assist?",o="皮尔·静踏希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份香料狼肉排，并把订单送到莫高雷血蹄村的皮尔·静踏那里。",oEN="Pyall Silentstride wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Spiced Wolf Meat and take the order to Pyall Silentstride at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="那些狼肉做好了吗？我们可有相当多饿着肚子的 <class> 在等着。",pEN="Have you cooked that wolf meat yet? We have quite a few hungry <class>s waiting.",c="谢谢你，年轻人。愿你的烹饪之路从这里继续延伸！",cEN="Thank you, young one. May your culinary journey continue from here!"}
Q[28079]={d="呼！今天忙得不可开交，我在炉边站了太久，自己一口东西都没吃。\n\n也许你能帮上忙？你用平底锅挺在行，我很想来一大堆煮好的美味小鱼。如果你能办到，我就拿一些我特制的生食烹饪材料跟你换。成交吗？",dEN="Whew! It's been a most busy day and I've been so long at the hearth that I haven't had a bite to eat myself.\n\nMaybe you could help? You're a fair hand with a frying pan and I'd love a mess of cooked Brilliant Smallfish. If you could handle that, then I'll trade you some of my special raw cooking materials. Do we have a deal?",o="格纳尔·伯奇希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条美味小鱼，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔客栈的格纳尔·伯奇那里。",oEN="Gernal Burch wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Brilliant Smallfish and take the order to Gernal Burch at the inn in Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="不，那不是血色火炮……只是我的肚子在咕咕叫。",pEN="No, that wasn't Scarlet artillery... just my stomach growling.",c="太感谢了，<name>！我欠你一份人情……就装在这些补给袋里。",cEN="Thanks a bunch, <name>! I owe you one... of these bags of supplies."}
Q[28080]={d="还有什么事比照看吧台更让人饿吗？那些美味的饮品让我的肚子直叫。\n\n附近的大海提供的美味我数都数不过来。你吃过水煮蚌肉吗，<name>？我现在就非常想来一些。如果你愿意为我做些，我不会让你白忙。",dEN="Does anything make you hungrier than tending bar? All those delicious drinks has my stomach rumbling.\n\nThe nearby sea offers more delicacies than I can name. You ever have Boiled Clams, <name>? I could sure go for some of those right now. If you'd be willing to make some for me, I'll make it worth your while.",o="拉尔卡希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份水煮蚌肉，并把订单送到贫瘠之地十字路口的拉尔卡那里。",oEN="Larhka wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Boiled Clams and take the order to Larhka at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",p="辣味蚌肉……蚌肉惊喜……蚌肉浓汤……蚌肉的做法可真多！",pEN="Deviled clams... clam surprise... clam gumbo... so many ways to make clams!",c="哎呀，你可真是只急切的迅猛龙，<class>！我没想到这么快就有这样的美味。正合口味！",cEN="Well, aren't you an eager raptor, <class>! I wasn't expecting a treat like this so quickly. That hits the spot!"}
Q[28081]={d="你好，<class>。这座前哨很偏远，人手又少，却要应付许多事务，好让我们的部队在风险投资公司来袭时保持戒备……或者，愿大地母亲阻止，联盟来袭时也是如此。\n\n我需要一位厨师的协助。你能为驻扎在这里的苦工准备一些彩鳍金枪鱼吗？一顿热腾腾的健康鱼餐，比起鹿肉和双足飞龙蛋，会是种不错的调剂。",dEN="Hail, <class>. This outpost is remote and we have few hands to help with the many tasks that keep our troops ready in case of an attack by the Venture Company... or, Earthmother forbid, the Alliance.\n\nI could use the assistance of a cook. Could you prepare some Rainbow Fin Albacore for the Grunts stationed here? A good, hot meal of healthy fish would be a nice change of pace from stag meat and wyvern eggs.",o="马格兰·缚地者希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条彩鳍金枪鱼，并把订单送到石爪山脉烈日石居的马格兰·缚地者那里。",oEN="Maggran Earthbinder wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Rainbow Fin Albacore and take the order to Maggran Earthbinder at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="你带着我们部队的口粮回来了吗？",pEN="Have you returned with our troops' rations?",c="谢谢你，<class>。愿你行走在安希的光芒之中。",cEN="I thank you, <class>. May you walk in Anshe's light."}
Q[28082]={d="欢迎来到佐拉姆海岸，<class>。大海的馈赠近在咫尺，却又远在天边。你看，我被派来指挥这座小前哨，光是调度部队应对四周的各种威胁就占满了我全部时间。可我实在太想吃美味的蟹肉蛋糕了！\n\n如果你能为我做一些，那真是好心，但你要是太忙，我也理解。我就在这儿。等着……",dEN="Welcome to the Zoram Strand, <class>. The bounty of the sea is so close, but yet so far away. You see, I have been assigned to command this small outpost and it takes up all my time directing our forces to face the various threats that surround us. But I am so hungry for some delicious Crab Cakes!\n\nIt would be a kindness if you could make some for me, but I understand if you are too busy. I'll just be here. Waiting....",o="卡兰·阿玛卡尔希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份蟹肉蛋糕，并把订单送到灰谷佐拉姆加前哨站的卡兰·阿玛卡尔那里。",oEN="Karang Amakkar wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Crab Cake and take the order to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",p="你怎么这么慢？海就在那儿！",pEN="What is taking you so long? The sea is RIGHT THERE.",c="抱歉，我刚才有点饿急了。\n\n蟹肉蛋糕！有了这份礼物，我的指挥工作会好受得多。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Sorry, I was a bit hangry for a moment there.\n\nCrab Cakes! You will make my command much more bearable with this gift. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[28083]={d="啊，<name>！今天天气不是很好吗？太阳照着，云高高的，我正想来点干烤猪肋排！\n\n怎么，你以为我想要牛排？那多恶心！\n\n南边的野猪人灌木丛里养着不少猪。你愿意帮帮一个老牛头人吗？",dEN="Ah, <name>! Isn't it a lovely day? The sun is shining, the clouds are high, and I could sure go for some Dry Pork Ribs!\n\nWhat, you thought I'd want some steak? That's disgusting!\n\nThe quilboar to the south keep plenty of swine in their thickets. Think you could help an old tauren out?",o="基尔格·斯特恩霍恩希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份干烤猪肋排，并把订单送到贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的基尔格·斯特恩霍恩那里。",oEN="Kirge Sternhorn wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Dry Pork Ribs and take the order to Kirge Sternhorn at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",p="嗯，嗯，嗯，想想看。很快我们就能吮上多汁的猪肋排了。",pEN="Mmm, mmm, mmm, just think. Soon we'll be sucking on juicy pork ribs.",c="就是这个！给，作为谢意，一些我自己的存货，给你的厨房用。",cEN="That's the stuff! And here, as thanks, some of my own stock for your kitchen."}
Q[28084]={d="你好，<name>。海那么远，我又那么想吃鱼。可我在这儿有职责在身，永远没时间去，凭我那点可怜的厨艺更做不出什么。\n\n你愿意帮我个忙吗？我想吃点热腾腾的美味刚鬃鲶鱼。你似乎有些灶台上的本事。我很乐意付你报酬。",dEN="Hail, <name>. The sea is so far, and I'm so hungry for fish. But I'll never have time to travel with my responsibilities here, let alone cook anything with my meager skills.\n\nAre you willing to do me a favor? I'd like some nice hot Bristle Whisker Catfish cooked up. You seem to have some skill at the cookfire. I'd be happy to pay you for your services.",o="多恩·平原行者希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 条刚鬃鲶鱼，并把订单送到千针石林风裂峡谷风化角落的多恩·平原行者那里。",oEN="Dorn Plainstalker wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Bristle Whisker Catfish and take the order to Dorn Plainstalker at the Weathered Nook in Windbreak Canyon in Thousand Needles.",p="不知你能不能一边做菜一边钓鱼？",pEN="I wonder if you can cook and fish at the same time?",c="这太棒了，<name>。真的很感谢你抽时间来帮我。既然活儿干完了，让我来帮你吧。",cEN="This is excellent, <name>. I really appreciate you taking the time to help me. Now that the job's done, let me help you."}
Q[28085]={d="我来凄凉之地，是因为皇家药剂师协会派我来做一项重要研究，可我想家了。具体来说，我想念家乡所有最好的食物，比如一份热腾腾、多汁的大熊排。\n\n我知道凄凉之地没有熊，但如果你能运些熊肉来，给我煎几份肉排，就能让这片地狱般的荒地稍微好受一些。",dEN="I came to Desolace because I was tasked by the Royal Apothecary Society for important research, but I miss home. Specifically, I miss eating all the best foods from home, like a nice hot, juicy, Big Bear Steak.\n\nI know there's no bears in Desolace but if you could import some bear meat and cook me some steaks, you would make this infernal wasteland a bit more bearable.",o="玛尔文·尖啸愿望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份大熊排，并把订单送到凄凉之地暗影猎谷村的玛尔文·尖啸望那里。",oEN="Marwin Shrillwill wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Big Bear Steak and take the order to Marwin Shrillwill at Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="皇家药剂师协会召唤之处，我必须前往。",pEN="Where the Royal Apothecary Society calls, I must follow.",c="愿黑暗女士因这份善意眷顾你，<class>。我会一边品尝这顿饭，一边想着家乡。",cEN="The Dark Lady look fondly upon you for this kindness, <class>. I will savor this meal as I think of home."}
Q[28086]={d="欢迎来到部落最糟的驻地，<class>：南点塔。没什么看头，但它是我的。\n\n在我活着的那些年月里，我常年在海边，发现自己很想念那边的菜肴。幽暗城配发的口粮毫无魅力，为了一盘地精辣味蚌肉，我几乎什么都愿意给。如果你会做，给我带一些来，我不会让你白忙！",dEN="Welcome to the worst posting in the Horde, <class>: Southpoint Tower. It's not much to look at, but it's mine.\n\nIn my former life, I used to spend a lot of time near the sea and I find I miss the cuisine. Undercity-issued rations have little charm, and there's not much I wouldn't give for a plate of Goblin Deviled Clams. If you know how to cook them, I'd make it worth your while to bring me some!",o="死亡猎手莱什希望你运用烹饪技能制作 10 份地精辣味蚌肉，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南点塔的死亡猎手莱什那里。",oEN="Deathstalker Lesh wants you to use your cooking skill to craft 10 Goblin Deviled Clams and take the order to Deathstalker Lesh at Southpoint Tower in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="海浪不再像从前那样呼唤我，但蚌肉还会！",pEN="The waves don't call to me like they once did, but the clams still do!",c="啊……香料放得刚刚好。第一口真够劲。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ahh... the spices are just right. That initial bite is a real kick to the tongue. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28087]={d="嗯，一个新手附魔师？让我们看看你进展如何。为我制作一根符文铜棒，带来给我检查。如果你做得好，我想等你技艺更进一步之后，我们还会再见。",dEN="Hmm, a novice enchanter? Let's see how your progress is coming. Craft a Runed Copper Rod for me and bring it to me to examine. If you do this well, then I think I may see you again once you've developed your skills more.",o="基塔·火风希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文铜棒，并把订单送到艾尔文森林阿祖拉之塔的基塔·火风那里。",oEN="Kitta Firewind wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Rod and take the order to Kitta Firewind at the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest.",p="别耽搁！我有很多活要干。",pEN="Don't delay! I have much work to do.",c="好极了！你很有前途，<name>。",cEN="Splendid! You show real promise, <name>."}
Q[28375]={d="暴风城卫兵中有很多人能从我们的服务中受益，但幻尘不够分。给，把这只卫兵胸甲附上胸甲 - 初级生命，做成附魔卫兵胸甲，然后送到韦斯特布鲁克要塞的雷纳副官那里。",dEN="There are many members of the Stormwind Guard who would benefit from our services but there's not enough dust to go around. Here, take this Guard Chest to Deputy Rainer at Westbrook Garrison after you've enchanted it with Chest - Minor Health to make it an Enchanted Guard Chest.",o="基塔·火风希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 只卫兵胸甲附上附魔胸甲 - 初级生命，并把订单送到艾尔文森林韦斯特布鲁克要塞的雷纳副官那里。",oEN="Kitta Firewind wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Guard's Chest with Enchant Chest - Minor Health and take the order to Deputy Rainer at Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest.",p="你好，公民。",pEN="Hail, citizen.",c="我的新胸甲！太感谢你了，公民。像这样的附魔，在这里可能就是生与死的差别。",cEN="My new chestplate! Thank you kindly citizen, enchantments like this can be the difference between life and death out here."}
Q[28376]={d="我需要人帮忙处理几份订单。这一份是给南门岗哨的登山者大麦酒的。他把守护者护腕落下了，想在上面附些耐力。请把附魔后的护腕送给他。",dEN="I could use a hand with a few orders. This one's for Mountaineer Barleybrew at Southgate Outpost. He left his Guardian's Bracers and wants some Stamina enchanted on them. Deliver the enchanted bracers to him please.",o="蒂莉·蓟绒希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 副守护者护腕附上附魔护腕 - 初级耐力，并把订单送到丹莫罗南门岗哨的登山者大麦酒那里。",oEN="Tilli Thistlefuzz wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Guardian's Bracers with Enchant Bracer - Minor Stamina and take the order to Mountaineer Barleybrew at Southgate Outpost in Dun Morogh.",p="啊，清爽的冷空气。让我……觉得冷。",pEN="Ah the refreshing cold air. It makes me... cold.",c="哦，我刚才没看见你，而且我看到你拿着我的护腕！谢谢！这是答应给你的委托报酬。",cEN="Oh I didn't see you there, and I see you have my bracers! Thank you! Here is your commission as promised."}
Q[28377]={d="可不能让一位议员久等。他正在视察戈博拉采石场，那边出了些麻烦。他要几件新的附上初级吸收的演说者长袍。我想这份你能应付？",dEN="Don't want to keep a Senator waiting. He's inspecting Gol'Bolar Quarry, there's some trouble there. Requested some new Speaker's Robes enchanted with Minor Absorption. I think you can handle this one?",o="蒂莉·蓟绒希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 件演说者长袍附上附魔胸甲 - 初级吸收，并把订单送到丹莫罗戈博拉采石场的议员梅尔·石厅那里。",oEN="Tilli Thistlefuzz wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Speaker's Robes with Enchant Chest - Minor Absorption and take the order to Senator Mehr Stonehallow at Gol'Bolar Quarry in Dun Morogh.",p="我这会儿相当忙，<class>。",pEN="I'm rather busy at the moment, <class>.",c="啊，谢谢。身为议员，我总要提防那些想把我赶下位子的无赖。希望这道附魔用不上，但谁也说不准。这是你的报酬。",cEN="Ah thank you, as a senator I am always wary of scoundrels seeking to empty my seat, I hope this enchantment won't be needed, but you never know. Here is your payment."}
Q[28378]={d="Ishnu，好心的附魔师，你对一份委托有兴趣吗？多兰纳尔的科里思拉斯·月怒一等他的法衣做好，就要离开岗位加入祭司行列。他需要一根配得上他艾露恩祭司新身份的魔杖。如果你制作一根次级魔法杖送给他，他会非常感激，当然你也会得到报酬。",dEN="Ishnu, kindly enchanter, are you interested in a commission? Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar will be leaving his post to join the priesthood as soon as his vestments are made. He needs a wand that befits his new station as a Priest of Elune. If you make a Lesser Magic Wand and deliver it to him, he would be greatly appreciative and of course you will be paid.",o="阿兰娜·黑眼希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根次级魔法杖，并把订单送到泰达希尔多兰纳尔的科里思拉斯·月怒那里。",oEN="Alanna Raveneye wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Magic Wand and take the order to Corithras Moonrage at Dolanaar in Teldrassil.",p="如果我没认错，是位附魔师吧？我猜是阿兰娜派你来的？",pEN="An enchanter if I am not mistaken? I take it Alanna sent you?",c="谢谢你，我确实需要一根魔杖。这是你的报酬，如果你再见到阿兰娜，请代我谢谢她。",cEN="Thank you, it is true that I was in need of a wand. Here is your payment, and if you see Alanna again please thank her for me."}
Q[28379]={d="月之女祭司们守护着道路，阿玛拉请我为她的女祭司斗篷附上初级抗性。你看起来正需要些练习，何不接下这一单？她巡逻着从多兰纳尔到达纳苏斯的大路。当然，我会代你支付你的辛劳，反正我今天本来就想休息一下。",dEN="The Moon Priestesses guard the roads and Amara requested I enchant her Priestess's Cloak with Minor Resistance. You look like you'd benefit from some practice so why don't you take this one? She patrols the road from Dolanaar to Darnassus. Of course you'll be reimbursed for your efforts in my stead, I was hoping to take a break today anyway.",o="阿兰娜·黑眼希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 件女祭司斗篷附上附魔披风 - 初级抗性，并把订单送到多兰纳尔与达纳苏斯之间大路上的月之女祭司阿玛拉那里。",oEN="Alanna Raveneye wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Priestess's Cloak with Enchant Cloak - Minor Resistance and take the order to Moon Priestess Amara at the road between Dolanaar and Darnassus.",p="你自己当心，<class>。这些路近来没往常那么安全。",pEN="Watch yourself, <class>. These roads haven't been as safe as they usually are.",c="阿兰娜呢？练习？我明白了。嗯，看来你的附魔完成得有些问题，不过这样也行。这是你的报酬，注意安全。",cEN="Where's Alanna? Practice? I see. Well it seems that you completed the enchantment with issues, so this works for me. Here is your payment, be safe."}
Q[28380]={d="我匆匆离开了我的……上一处工作的地方，忘了几样东西。你是附魔师，对吧？能不能给我一个小块微光碎片？我当然会付你钱！",dEN="I left in a hurry from my... previous place of employment and I forgot a few things. You're an enchanter, right? Could you spare a Small Glimmering Shard for me? I'll pay you of course!",o="雷维尔·科斯特希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 个小块微光碎片，并把订单送到西部荒野哨兵岭的雷维尔·科斯特那里。",oEN="Revil Kost wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Small Glimmering Shard and take the order to Revil Kost at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="所以，你有吗？",pEN="So do you have one?",c="真是救了我的命！谢谢你，附魔师，这是你的报酬。",cEN="A true lifesaver! Thank you Enchanter, here's your payment."}
Q[28381]={d="人们似乎觉得我有大把空闲时间帮他们处理神神叨叨的杂事，可我没有。给，保护者加里尔请我给这些民兵护腕附上初级敏捷，我转交给你了。你看起来更像那种爱做好事的人。你办完之后，她在哨兵岭的大塔楼那里。",dEN="People seem to think I have all the free time in the world to help them with mystical chores, but I don't. Here, Protector Gariel asked me to enchant these Militia Bracers with Minor Agility but I'm handing it off to you. You seem like more of the do-gooder type. She's at the big tower in Sentinel Hill when you're done.",o="雷维尔·科斯特希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 副民兵护腕附上附魔护腕 - 初级敏捷，并把订单送到西部荒野哨兵岭的保护者加里尔那里。",oEN="Revil Kost wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Militia Bracers with Enchant Bracer - Minor Agility and take the order to Protector Gariel at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="你需要什么吗？",pEN="Need something?",c="我已经觉得自己更敏捷了！那些强盗根本不知道被什么打中了，给你。",cEN="I feel more agile already! Those bandits won't know what hit them, here you go."}
Q[28382]={d="既然我已在黑海岸察觉到腐化的迹象，采取些预防措施是明智的。我的表妹乌兰娜在很南边的古树之林经营一个贸易补给摊位。你把这条绒毛披风附上初级防护之后带给她。她离镇子很远，我希望她安全。",dEN="Since I've noticed signs of corruption in Darkshore, it is wise to take precautions. My cousin Ullanna runs a trade supply stand down far south at the Grove of the Ancients. Take this Downy Cloak to her after you've enchanted it with Minor Protection. She is far from town and I want her to be safe.",o="泰伦希斯希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 条绒毛披风附上附魔披风 - 初级防护，并把订单送到黑海岸古树之林的乌兰娜那里。",oEN="Terenthis wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Downy Cloak with Enchant Cloak - Minor Protection and take the order to Ullanna at Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore.",p="在这些地方要当心，<class>。",pEN="Be wary in these parts, <class>.",c="泰伦希斯派你来的？他担心得太多了，不过还是谢谢你。我想我该给你些小费，酬谢你花的时间。",cEN="Terenthis sent you? He worries too much, but my thanks regardless. I suppose I should tip you for your time."}
Q[28383]={d="也许这是迷信，但我听说白银能有效驱退腐化。如果你愿意，给我做一根符文银棒，附魔师。附有魔力的铭文想必多少能帮上我的忙。",dEN="Perhaps its superstitious but I hear silver is effective at repelling corruption. Craft me a Runed Silver Rod if you will, Enchanter. The enchanted inscriptions will surely help somehow in my efforts.",o="泰伦希斯希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文银棒，并把订单送到黑海岸奥伯丁的泰伦希斯那里。",oEN="Terenthis wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Silver Rod and take the order to Terenthis at Auberdine in Darkshore.",p="白银常因与月亮的颜色相近而被与艾露恩联系在一起。也许正是艾露恩借着白银驱退腐化？",pEN="Silver is often used in association with Elune due to its similarity to the color of the moon. Maybe it is Elune who repels corruption through silver?",c="确实是根漂亮的棒子。但愿这能管用。啊，对了，你的报酬。",cEN="A beautiful rod indeed. Let us hope this helps. Ah right, your payment."}
Q[28384]={d="你是附魔师吗？也许你能解决我一个心病。铁环挖掘场的奥德伦·科登顶多算个草莽法师，可他老是抱怨说要是有一根更好的魔杖，他的魔法就会更强。给他做一根强效魔法杖，好让他别再念叨了。",dEN="You an enchanter? Maybe you can solve a thorn in my side. Aldren Corden out at Ironband's Excavation is a hedge mage at best but he keeps whining about how if he had a better wand he'd be better at magic. Craft him a Greater Magic Wand so he'll shut up about it.",o="法官钝鼻希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根强效魔法杖，并把订单送到洛克莫丹铁环挖掘场的奥德伦·科登那里。",oEN="Magistrate Bluntnose wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Greater Magic Wand and take the order to Aldren Cordon at Ironband's Excavation in Loch Modan.",p="要是我有一根更好的魔杖就好了……",pEN="If only I had a better wand...",c="你怎么知道我想要一根更好的魔杖？其实我不在乎，把我的钱拿去吧！",cEN="How did you know I wanted a better wand? Actually, I don't care, take my money!"}
Q[28385]={d="我说，既然你进城了，我能不能请你去帮帮洛克莫丹的好心人？远行者的马雷克·铁心打猎时正需要点运气，而你也能趁机练练附魔！\n\n把这把猎人的斧子带给他，考虑给它附上初级打击，说不定这些天他真能打到点什么。哈哈！\n\n别担心，<name>，他只需要他的斧子。你可以给任何东西附上初级打击，尽管试试——但无论如何，别忘了把斧子带给马雷克！",dEN="Say, while you're in town can I persuade you to help out the good folk of Loch Modan? Marek Ironheart at Farstrider Lodge could use some luck with his hunting and you can get some practice with enchanting in the process!\n\nTake this Hunter's Axe to him and consider enchanting it with Minor Striking and maybe he'll actually catch something one of these days. Haha!\n\nDon't worry, <name>, he just needs his axe. You can enchant anything with Minor Striking, just give it a try - but either way don't forget to bring Marek his axe!",o="法官钝鼻希望你运用附魔技能为一件武器附上附魔武器 - 初级打击，并把订单送到洛克莫丹远行者营地的马雷克·铁心那里。你可以给他那把猎人的斧子附魔，也可以选任意其他武器。",oEN="Magistrate Bluntnose wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant a weapon with Enchant Weapon - Minor Striking and take the order to Marek Ironheart at Farstrider's Lodge in Loch Modan. You can enchant the Hunter's Axe he gave you or another weapon of your choice.",p="怎么了，<class>？",pEN="What's up <class>?",c="哦，得了吧，钝鼻老是干这种事。现在我得付你钱，不然就太失礼了。",cEN="Oh come on, Bluntnose is always doing things like this. Now I have to pay you otherwise it would be rude."}
Q[28386]={d="对，对，好心的小附魔师。帮帮这个住在破棚屋里的老头，做一根符文金棒吧，对我和我的工作会很有用。他们——我是说，我，会付钱的。",dEN="Yes, yes, nice little enchanter. Help this old man in a shack by crafting a Runed Golden Rod, it would be so useful for me and my work. They-- I mean I, will pay.",o="阿伯克隆比希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文金棒，并把订单送到暮色森林鸦木山墓地附近棚屋的阿伯克隆比那里。",oEN="Abercrombie wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Golden Rod and take the order to Abercrombie at a shack near Raven Hill Cemetery in Duskwood.",p="嗯嗯，是啊……",pEN="Hmmm yes...",c="太好了，太好了。我会用它做很多事。",cEN="Wonderful, wonderful. I will do much with this."}
Q[28387]={d="你是附魔师，对吧？显然我一时半会儿哪儿也去不了，但我需要一个大块微光碎片，好替西奥克里特斯增强我的侦查能力。对这份委托有兴趣吗？",dEN="You're an enchanter aren't you? Obviously I'm not going anywhere for awhile but I could use a Large Glimmering Shard to enhance my spying capabilities on behalf of Theocritus. Interested in that commission?",o="被俘的阿祖拉仆从希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 个大块微光碎片，并把订单送到赤脊山伦德山谷的被俘的阿祖拉仆从那里。",oEN="Captured Servant of Azora wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Large Glimmering Shard and take the order to Captured Servant of Azora at Render's Valley in Redridge Mountains.",p="哦，不，拜托，我不需要救援，但还是谢谢你。",pEN="Oh no please I don't need a rescue, but thank you.",c="太好了！我会向西奥克里特斯提起你的，<name>。",cEN="Marvelous! I will tell Theocritus about you, <name>."}
Q[28388]={d="哦，一位附魔师，如果我没认错的话？林歌神殿的凯尼斯·静风在找一根共鸣法杖，可城里没有附魔师。如果你愿意帮忙，我相信他不会让你白忙。",dEN="Oh an enchanter, unless I am mistaken? Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song was looking for a Staff of Affinity but there's no enchanter in town. If you're willing to help out I'm sure he'll make it worth your while.",o="达尔莉亚希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根共鸣法杖，并把订单送到灰谷林歌神殿的凯尼斯·静风那里。",oEN="Dalria wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Staff of Affinity and take the order to Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="哦，不，你也是附魔师？",pEN="Oh no, are you another enchanter?",c="呃，这就尴尬了……你看，已经有另外 3 位附魔师给我送来共鸣法杖了。我到处问过，想必有人记得，就把附魔师一个个打发了过来。那么，呃，这是你的报酬。我总会想办法用上这些的。",cEN="Well this is awkward... You see, I have already had 3 other enchanters deliver a Staff of Affinity to me. I was asking around and I suppose people remembered and sent enchanters my way. Well uh, here is your payment. I will find a use for these somehow."}
Q[28389]={d="我不是附魔师，可人们看到我这儿的实验室，就以为我懂那一行。比如日落沼泽的温娜·丝须。她留下这件梦幻者长袍，附了张字条请我给它附上法力，可我根本不会！但你会！",dEN="I'm no enchanter but folks see my lab here and think I know something about it. Like Wenna Silkbeard out in Sundown Marsh. She dropped off this Dreamer's Robe with a note asking I enchant it with Mana but I don't know how to do that! But you do!",o="凯特琳·格拉斯曼希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 件梦幻者长袍附上附魔胸甲 - 法力，并把订单送到湿地日落沼泽的温娜·丝须那里。",oEN="Caitlin Grassman wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Dreamer's Robe with Enchant Chest - Mana and take the order to Wenna Silkbeard at Sundown Marsh in Wetlands.",p="嗯？你不是凯特琳。",pEN="Hm? You're not Caitlin.",c="他们不是附魔师？是我弄错了，谢谢你替他们附魔！",cEN="They're not an enchanter? My mistake, thank you for enchanting it on their behalf!"}
Q[28390]={d="反抗军营地的约瓦中士订了这把高能冲击锤，但她要求附上魔，而我平常找的人出城了。你认识谁能帮忙吗？我会付他丰厚的报酬。",dEN="Sergeant Yohwa down at the Rebel camp ordered this High Impact Mace but she wanted it enchanted and my normal guy's out of town. Do you know anyone who could help out? I will pay them handsomely.",o="麦加文希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 把高能冲击锤附上附魔双手武器 - 初级冲击，并把订单送到荆棘谷反抗军营地的约瓦中士那里。",oEN="McGavan wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 High Impact Mace with Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Impact and take the order to Sergeant Yohwa at Rebel Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="欢迎，冒险者，需要点什么吗？",pEN="Welcome adventurer, need something?",c="我的锤子！我还以为得自己去取，谢谢你。",cEN="My mace! I thought I was going to need to pick it up myself, thank you."}
Q[28391]={d="一位同行法师需要一根新魔杖。为住在沼泽农场的塔贝莎制作一根次级秘法魔杖。这请求挺出人意料，但我不会拒绝。也许这是送给别人的礼物，她还会用某种方式加以强化。",dEN="A fellow mage is in need of a new wand. Craft a Lesser Mystic Wand for Tabetha at her farm out in the marsh. A surprising request but one I will not turn down. Perhaps its a gift for another and she'll enhance it in some way.",o="大法师特沃什希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根次级秘法魔杖，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽泥沼某处房屋的塔贝莎那里。",oEN="Archmage Tervosh wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Mystic Wand and take the order to Tabetha at a house somewhere in the Quagmire in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="附魔师我一眼就认得出来，幸会。",pEN="I recognize an enchanter when I see one, well met.",c="谢谢，这根魔杖是给别人做的，我还会用自己的方法进一步强化它，可我从来都不擅长制作魔杖坯体。这是应付给你的委托报酬。",cEN="Thank you, this wand is for another and I will be enhancing it further with my own methods, but I have never been great at creating the base wand. Here is your commission due."}
Q[28392]={d="真是粗心，我们收拾行装准备踏上旅程来这里时，我把魔杖忘在阿斯特兰纳了。也可能是在深爪小径弄丢的。不管怎样，请给我做一根强效秘法魔杖。",dEN="How careless, I forgot my wand in Astranaar when we were packing up to make our journey here. Or perhaps I lost it on the Talondeep Path. Either way, craft me a Greater Mystic Wand please.",o="奈莱·天月希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根强效秘法魔杖，并把订单送到凄凉之地斯奎格科德前哨站的奈莱·天月那里。",oEN="Nelae Skymoon wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Greater Mystic Wand and take the order to Nelae Skymoon at Squigglecord Outpost in Desolace.",p="也许是我看见远处那头大熊时把它掉了……",pEN="Maybe I dropped it when I saw that big bear in the distance...",c="哦，太奇妙了，这根魔杖比我上一根还好！请收下这个。",cEN="Oh how wondrous, this wand is better than my last! Please, take this."}
Q[28393]={d="人们没意识到我是炼金学的学徒，不是附魔的。法官马格雷布想让我为南海镇防御部队的新指挥官赫尔姆斯沃西少校附魔这把少校之刃，可我做不到。你能帮忙并把它送到附近塔楼的他手里吗？",dEN="People don't realize I'm an apprentice in Alchemy not Enchanting. Magistrate Magreb wanted me to enchant this Major's Blade for the new head of the Southshore defenses, Major Helmsworthy, but I can't. Can you help and deliver it to him in the nearby tower?",o="学徒霍尼韦尔希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 把少校之刃附上附魔武器 - 打击，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南海镇的赫尔姆斯沃西少校那里。",oEN="Apprentice Honeywell wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Major's Blade with Enchant Weapon - Striking and take the order to Major Helmsworthy at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="幸会，公民。",pEN="Well met, citizen.",c="啊，谢谢，没了惯用的剑我觉得像没穿衣服一样。这道附魔会派上大用场。",cEN="Ah thank you, I felt naked without my usual sword. This enchantment will be put to good use."}
Q[28394]={d="我从大地的低语中听得出来，你是位附魔师。你愿意为我的萨满之盾附上精神吗？我会非常感激！哦，我会付你钱的。",dEN="I can tell by the whispers of the earth that you're an enchanter. Would you enchant my Shaman's Shield with Spirit? I would be greatly appreciative! Oh, and I will pay you.",o="洛娜·石印希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 面萨满之盾附上附魔盾牌 - 精神，并把订单送到菲拉斯与千针石林交界处萨兰纳尔一带的洛娜·石印那里。",oEN="Lorna Stonebrand wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Shaman's Shield with Enchant Shield - Spirit and take the order to Lorna Stonebrand at the area around Thalanaar on the border between Feralas and Thousand Needles.",p="准备好了吗？",pEN="Is it ready?",c="啊，涌动其中的力量，谢谢你。",cEN="Ah the power that courses through it, thank you."}
Q[28395]={d="这些天海上补给船少得可怜，战后重建、风暴还有海盗都是原因。我的大块辐光碎片用完了，研究正需要一块，如果你有兴趣给我带一块来的话。",dEN="Supply ships are few and far between on the seas these days what with rebuilding after the war, storms, and pirates. I am out of Large Radiant Shards and I could use one for my research, if you are interested in bringing me one.",o="特罗亚斯·月风希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 个大块辐光碎片，并把订单送到菲拉斯羽月要塞的特罗亚斯·月风那里。",oEN="Troyas Moonbreeze wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Large Radiant Shard and take the order to Troyas Moonbreeze at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="我们的达纳苏斯蓝纹奶酪也快没了……",pEN="We are also low on Darnassian Bleu...",c="多谢，附魔师。请收下这份报酬。",cEN="My thanks, enchanter. Please take this payment."}
Q[28396]={d="我们一直在研发能抵御黑暗之门邪能污染——那污染已经毁坏了这片土地——的护甲和武器。其中特别有用的一样东西是附魔皮革。我相信你是附魔师，对吧？如果你给我带一些来，我会付你钱。",dEN="We have been working on developing armor and weapons that can withstand the fel taint from the Dark Portal that has damaged this land. One item that has been particularly useful is Enchanted Leather. I believe you are an enchanter correct? If you bring me some I will pay you.",o="守望者玛哈尔·巴希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 张附魔皮革，并把订单送到诅咒之地守望堡的守望者玛哈尔·巴那里。",oEN="Watcher Mahar Ba wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Enchanted Leather and take the order to Watcher Mahar Ba at Nethergarde Keep in Blasted Lands.",p="你给皮革附魔了吗？",pEN="Have you enchanted some leather yet?",c="品质上乘，这正合用。这是应付给你的报酬。",cEN="Fine quality, this will do nicely. Here is your due pay."}
Q[28397]={d="要让摇晃谷运转起来，我们还需要大量补给。具体来说，我需要一些附魔瑟银锭，用来建一间什么都能做的厨房，好烹制我们在这里找到的任何东西。你有兴趣供货吗？",dEN="We still need a lot of supplies to get Wobble Hollow up and running. Specifically I could use some Enchanted Thorium Bars for a kitchen that can cook anything we find out here. You interested in providing?",o="威廉敏娜·摇晃史密斯希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 块附魔瑟银锭，并把订单送到艾萨拉摇晃谷的威廉敏娜·摇晃史密斯那里。",oEN="Wilhelmina Wobblesmith wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Enchanted Thorium Bar and take the order to Wilhelmina Wobblesmith at Wobble Hollow in Azshara.",p="不知附魔瑟银做平底锅效果如何。有没有一种叫 \"附魔厨具 - 不粘\" 的附魔？没有？为什么没有？？",pEN="I wonder how well enchanted thorium would work for a frying pan. Is there an enchantment named \"Enchant Cooking Utensil - Non Stick\"? No? Why not??",c="太棒了，角鹰兽又能上菜单了！哦，呃，我想我们西边的盟友可能不太喜欢。不管怎样，这是你的报酬。",cEN="Fantastic, hippogryph is back on the menu! Oh uh, I suppose our allies to the west might not like that. Regardless here is your pay."}
Q[28398]={d="我的……魔杖……在打恶魔时丢了。需要……一根替代品……等我恢复过来……我就去收拾它们。",dEN="Lost my... wand... fighting demons. Need... replacement... I'll get them... when I recover.",o="索罗斯·暗月希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根次级虚空法杖，并把订单送到费伍德森林爪枝空地的索罗斯·暗月那里。",oEN="Soros Darkcrescent wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Nether Wand and take the order to Soros Darkcrescent at Talonbranch Glade in Felwood.",p="你……呃……慢慢来。",pEN="Take... urgh... your time.",c="报酬……在袋子里……去杀些恶魔吧……<class>。",cEN="Payment... in pouch... go kill some demon... <class>."}
Q[28399]={d="你和我一样是附魔师吗？我需要人帮我完善我的符文铜棒。你能做一根，好让我跟我的对比，看看我哪里做错了吗？事成之后我会给你小费作为答谢！",dEN="Are you an enchanter like me? I need help perfecting my Runed Copper Rod. Can you craft one so I can compare mine and see what I'm doing wrong? I'll give you a tip afterwards for helping!",o="贾格希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文铜棒，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭的贾格那里。",oEN="Jhag wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Copper Rod and take the order to Jhag at Razor Hill in Durotar.",p="是两份奇异之尘配一份次级魔法精华，还是……",pEN="Was it 2 parts strange dust 1 part lesser magic essence or...",c="我明白了！谢谢你，现在我知道自己错在哪儿了，收下这个。",cEN="I see! Thank you, I understand where I went wrong now, here take this."}
Q[28400]={d="有人请我为剃刀岭的战士训练师塔绍·锯齿疤附魔这只卫兵胸甲，可我特别怕他。他戴着眼罩，据说他以前是个冷酷嗜血的海盗！拜托，替我做了并送过去吧。",dEN="I've been asked to enchant this Guard's Chest for Tarshaw Jaggedscar, the warrior trainer in Razor Hill, but I'm terrified of him. He's got an eyepatch and they say he used to be a ruthless, bloodthirsty pirate! Please, do this for me and deliver it.",o="贾格希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 只卫兵胸甲附上附魔胸甲 - 初级生命，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭的塔绍·锯齿疤那里。",oEN="Jhag wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Guard's Chest with Enchant Chest - Minor Health and take the order to Tarshaw Jaggedscar at Razor Hill in Durotar.",p="你需要什么吗？",pEN="Need something?",c="哈哈！！这是我见过最好的一件胸甲。多谢你，附魔师。",cEN="Haha!! A fine chestplate if I've ever seen one. You have my thanks, enchanter."}
Q[28401]={d="我需要人帮忙处理几份订单，附魔师。这一份是给红岩地的贤者雨图腾的。他把守护者护腕落下了，想在上面附些耐力。请把附魔后的护腕送给他，你会得到报酬。",dEN="I could use a hand with a few orders, enchanter. This one's for Sage Raintotem at Red Rocks. He left his Guardian's Bracers and wants some Stamina enchanted on them. Deliver the enchanted bracers to him please, you will be compensated.",o="莫特·晨行者希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 副守护者护腕附上附魔护腕 - 初级耐力，并把订单送到莫高雷红岩地的博学者雨图腾那里。",oEN="Mot Dawnstrider wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Guardian's Bracers with Enchant Bracer - Minor Stamina and take the order to Lorekeeper Raintotem at Red Rocks in Mulgore.",p="真是一团糟……",pEN="What a mess...",c="哦，我刚才没看见你，而且我看到你拿着我的护腕。太感谢你了。这是给你的委托报酬，想必有人答应过你。",cEN="Oh I didn't see you there, and I see you have my bracers. Thank you kindly. Here is your commission as you were no doubt promised."}
Q[28402]={d="嘿，附魔师，我不想让一位长老久等，你不介意帮我一下吧。雷霆崖的玛加萨·恐怖图腾要几件新的附上初级吸收的演说者长袍。我想这份你能应付？",dEN="Hey there enchanter, I don't want to keep an Elder waiting if you wouldn't mind helping me. Magatha Grimtotem over in Thunder Bluff requested some new Speaker's Robes enchanted with Minor Absorption. I think you can handle this one?",o="莫特·晨行者希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 件演说者长袍附上附魔胸甲 - 初级吸收，并把订单送到雷霆崖长者高地的玛加萨·恐怖图腾那里。",oEN="Mot Dawnstrider wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Speaker's Robes with Enchant Chest - Minor Absorption and take the order to Magatha Grimtotem at Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff.",p="我这会儿相当忙，<class>。",pEN="I'm rather busy at the moment, <class>.",c="啊，谢谢你，年轻人。尽管凯恩允许我留在城中，我仍不受欢迎，必须时刻有人看守。希望这道附魔用不上，但谁也说不准。这是你的报酬。",cEN="Ah thank you young one, despite Cairne allowing me to stay within the city I am still not well liked and must be guarded at all times, I hope this enchantment won't be needed, but you never know. Here is your payment."}
Q[28403]={d="嗯，你似乎是位附魔师，我说得对吗？冷炉庄园的布里斯波瓦斯一家报告说，他们的田里冒出了一小股天灾。制作一根次级魔法杖给康斯坦丝送去，好让他们能自卫。这当然是一份委托。",dEN="Hm, you seem to be an enchanter, am I right? The Brisboise's at Cold Hearth Manor report some minor scourge rising in their fields. Craft a Lesser Magic Wand and take it to Constance so they can defend themselves. This is a commission of course.",o="万斯·幽暗希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根次级魔法杖，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔以西冷炉庄园的康斯坦丝·布里斯波瓦斯那里。",oEN="Vance Undergloom wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Magic Wand and take the order to Constance Brisboise at Cold Hearth Manor west of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你是来帮忙对付天灾的吗？",pEN="Are you here to help with the scourge?",c="一根好魔杖，愿黑暗女士看顾你。我猜你也想要钱，这些够吗？",cEN="A fine wand, Dark Lady watch over you. I suppose you want money too, will this do?"}
Q[28404]={d="附魔师，如果你愿意，有份委托给你。布瑞尔墓地的梅里尔替圣骑士们处理天灾石。我不知道那些傻瓜为什么还非要当圣骑士，但我们至少能提供些防污染的保护。给这件女祭司斗篷附上初级抗性，给他们送去。",dEN="Enchanter, a commission for you if you will. Merryl over in the Brill Cemetery handles scourgestones for the paladins. I don't know why those fools even try to remain paladins, but the least we can do is offer some protection from the taint. Enchant this Priestess's Cloak with Minor Resistance and take it to them.",o="万斯·幽暗希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 件女祭司斗篷附上附魔披风 - 初级抗性，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔墓地的梅里尔·温迪尔那里。",oEN="Vance Undergloom wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Priestess's Cloak with Enchant Cloak - Minor Resistance and take the order to Merril Wendyl at the cemetery of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="自从我从一座坟里爬出来，坟地给我的感觉就再也不同了……",pEN="Graves have never felt the same since crawling out of one...",c="万斯派你来的？他可真有心，谢谢你。这里没多少人在意我的工作，但我们都抱着同一个目标——把天灾从我们的土地上清除出去。请收下这个。",cEN="Vance sent you? How thoughtful of him, thank you. Few care about my work here, but we all share the same goals in ridding the scourge from our lands. Please, take this."}
Q[28405]={d="等等，<class>，你也是附魔师吗？里奥总把材料借给我用，我老觉得欠他这份人情。你能帮我给他带一个小块微光碎片吗？我当然会付你钱。",dEN="Hold <class>, are you also an enchanter? Leo's always letting me borrow his materials and I feel bad I don't repay the favor. Could you help me out and take him a Small Glimmering Shard? I will pay you of course.",o="莉莉希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 个小块微光碎片，并把订单送到格雷迈恩之墙东北山丘帐篷里的里奥·萨恩那里。",oEN="Lilly wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Small Glimmering Shard and take the order to Leo Sarn at a tent in the hills north-east of Greymane's Wall.",p="你需要什么，<class>？",pEN="What do you need, <class>?",c="莉莉派你来的？真有心。谢谢你，附魔师。",cEN="Lilly sent you? How thoughtful. Thank you, enchanter."}
Q[28406]={d="我不知道为什么，但里奥把这些民兵护腕送来让我附魔。我不是附魔师，我只是喜欢囤些东西转手卖掉。漂亮的、亮闪闪的东西。所以你把它们附上初级敏捷，再带回去给他，我们会补偿你的辛劳。",dEN="I don't know why but Leo sent these Militia Bracers to me to enchant. I'm not an enchanter, I just like to keep the stuff around and sell it. Pretty, shiny things. So you enchant them with Minor Agility and take them back to him, we'll reimburse you for the effort.",o="里奥·萨恩希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 副民兵护腕附上附魔护腕 - 初级敏捷，并把订单送到格雷迈恩之墙东北山丘帐篷里的里奥·萨恩那里。",oEN="Leo Sarn wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Militia Bracers with Enchant Bracer - Minor Agility and take the order to Leo Sarn at a tent in the hills north-east of Greymane's Wall.",p="你需要什么吗？",pEN="Need something?",c="我已经觉得自己更敏捷了。其实这副护腕是给我自己的；这些狼人大多时候不招惹我，但也不是总如此……谢谢你。",cEN="I feel more agile already. These bracers are for me actually, these worgen leave me alone for the most part, but not always... Thank you."}
Q[28407]={d="既然我已在贫瘠之地察觉到燃刃氏族的腐化迹象，采取些预防措施是明智的。辛齐尔在往北的大路边有间小屋。你把这条绒毛披风附上初级防护之后带给他。他住得离恐惧之峰太近，让我不放心。",dEN="Since I've noticed signs of Burning Blade corruption in the Barrens, it is wise to take precautions. Shin'zil has a hut on the road to the north. Take this Downy Cloak to him after you've enchanted it with Minor Protection. He lives too close to Dreadmist Peak for my comfort.",o="索克希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 条绒毛披风附上附魔披风 - 初级防护，并把订单送到十字路口以北一座塔附近小屋里的辛齐尔那里。",oEN="Thork wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Downy Cloak with Enchant Cloak - Minor Protection and take the order to Shin'Zil at a small hut near a tower north of The Crossroads.",p="在这些地方要当心，<class>。",pEN="Be wary in these parts, <class>.",c="唉，老索克就是担心太多。不过还是谢谢你。给，收下这个。",cEN="Ah ol' Thork be worryin' too much. My thanks though. Here, take this."}
Q[28408]={d="也许这是迷信，但我听说白银能有效驱退腐化，说不定对我们的恶魔敌人和他们的爪牙也有用。给我做一根符文银棒。附有魔力的铭文想必多少能帮上忙。",dEN="Perhaps its superstitious but I hear silver is effective at repelling corruption, maybe it will help against our demon foes and their allies. Craft me a Runed Silver Rod. The enchanted inscriptions will surely help somehow.",o="索克希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文银棒，并把订单送到贫瘠之地十字路口的索克那里。",oEN="Thork wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Silver Rod and take the order to Thork at The Crossroads in The Barrens.",p="我不记得这些迷信是从哪儿来的，也许是来自北边那些暗夜精灵敌人？他们似乎常用白银，跟恶魔作战的时间也比我们更久。也许其中的门道比我们想的多。",pEN="I don't remember where these superstitions came from, perhaps from our night elf enemies up north? They seem to use silver often, and have been fighting demons even longer than we. Maybe there is more to it than we realize.",c="确实是根漂亮的棒子，对我来说有点太讲究了。但愿这能管用。啊，对了，你的报酬。",cEN="A beautiful rod indeed, a bit too much for my tastes. Let us hope this helps. Ah right, your payment."}
Q[28409]={d="你是附魔师吗？也许你能解决我一个心病。贤者麋蹄是位博学者祭司，就在镇上，需要一根魔杖。给他做一根强效魔法杖，好让他别再唠叨这事。叫他付你钱，我回头再来还他，不然他连这个也要抱怨。",dEN="You an enchanter? Maybe you can solve a thorn in my side. Sage Elkhoof is a Lorespeaker priest in need of a wand here in town. Craft him a Great Magic Wand so he'll shut up about it. Tell him to pay you and I will come repay him later, otherwise he will complain about that too.",o="基尔格·斯特恩霍恩希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根强效魔法杖，并把订单送到贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的贤者麋蹄那里。",oEN="Kirge Sternhorn wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Greater Magic Wand and take the order to Sage Elkhoof at Camp Taurajo in The Barrens.",p="要是我有一根更好的魔杖就好了……",pEN="If only I had a better wand...",c="你怎么知道我想要一根更好的魔杖？等等，你该不会只是想卖我一根吧？\n\n<你解释了情况。>\n\n我明白了，谢谢你。那这是钱。",cEN="How did you know I wanted a better wand? Wait, are you just offering to sell me one?\n\n<You explain the situation.>\n\nI see, thank you. Here is the money then."}
Q[28410]={d="我说，既然你进城了，我能不能请你去帮帮南贫瘠之地的好心人？加恩·石塔独自巡逻着南方的黄金之路，我很担心他的安全。给这把猎人的斧子附上初级打击，给他送去，好让他平安。",dEN="Say, while you're in town can I persuade you to help out the good folk of the Southern Barrens? Gann Stonespire patrols the southern gold road alone and I worry for his safety. Enchant this Hunter's Axe with Minor Striking and take it to him so he will be safe.",o="基尔格·斯特恩霍恩希望你运用附魔技能为提供的 1 把猎人的斧子附上附魔武器 - 初级打击，并把订单送到贫瘠之地黄金之路上陶拉祖营地以南的加恩·石塔那里。",oEN="Kirge Sternhorn wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Hunter's Axe with Enchant Weapon - Minor Striking and take the order to Gann Stonespire at a location south of Camp Taurajo on the Gold Road in The Barrens.",p="啊，一位旅人？",pEN="Ah a traveler?",c="多好的一把斧子，还有一道强劲的附魔。谢谢你，附魔师。我身上没带多少东西，但希望这份报酬够用。",cEN="What a well made axe, and a potent enchantment. Thank you, enchanter. I don't carry much on me, but I hope this payment is enough."}
Q[28411]={d="哦——一位可爱的小附魔师。我说，你能帮我做一根符文金棒吗？别问是干什么用的，地精的生意！哦，不过我会付你钱。",dEN="Oooh a nice little enchanter. Say, could you help me out and craft me a Runed Golden Rod? Don't ask what it's for, goblin business! Oh but I will pay you.",o="皮克索希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 根符文金棒，并把订单送到灰谷碎木岗哨的皮克索那里。",oEN="Pixel wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Runed Golden Rod and take the order to Pixel at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="也许我该改行做附魔棒的生意……",pEN="Maybe I should get into the enchanting rods business...",c="哦，你回来了。我看品质不错，给你。跟你做生意很愉快，附魔师。",cEN="Oh you're back. Seems quality to me, here you go. Nice doing business with you, enchanter."}
Q[28412]={d="附魔师我一眼就认得出来。我没有赫尔库拉当年那么强，但我需要一个大块微光碎片来精进我的魔法研究，好像赫尔库拉那样更好地为部落效力。你能给我弄一个吗？我会付你钱。",dEN="I know an enchanter when I see one. I'm not as powerful as Helcular was, but I could use a Large Glimmering Shard to enhance my magical studies and better serve the Horde as Helcular would have. Could you get me one? I will pay you.",o="学徒塞万德希望你运用附魔技能制作 1 个大块微光碎片，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵塔伦米尔的学徒塞万德那里。",oEN="Novice Thaivand wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Large Glimmering Shard and take the order to Novice Thaivand at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我是不是该把这碎片吃掉……不，大概不行……",pEN="Am I supposed to eat this shard... no probably not...",c="太棒了！我总会想办法好好利用它的。",cEN="Marvelous! I will put this to good use, somehow."}
Q[28413]={d="你好，你是附魔师吗？Freewind Post 的 Hagar Lightninghoof 在找一根亲和法杖，但镇上没有附魔师。如果你愿意帮忙，我相信他会给你相应的报酬。",dEN="Hail, are you an enchanter? Hagar Lightninghoof at Freewind Post was looking for a Staff of Affinity but there's no enchanter in town. If you're willing to help out I'm sure he'll make it worth your while.",o="Brave Moonhorn 要你用附魔技能制作 1 根亲和法杖，并把订单送到千针石林 Freewind Post 的 Hagar Lightninghoof 那里。",oEN="Brave Moonhorn wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Staff of Affinity and take the order to Hagar Lightninghoof at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",p="哦不，你也是附魔师？",pEN="Oh no, are you another enchanter?",c="呃，这有点尴尬……你看，我已经有另外 3 位附魔师给我送来亲和法杖了。我四处打听，估计大家记着这事，就把附魔师都打发到我这儿来了。那么，呃，这是你的报酬。我总会给这些东西找到用处的。",cEN="Well this is awkward... You see, I have already had 3 other enchanters deliver a Staff of Affinity to me. I was asking around and I suppose people remembered and sent enchanters my way. Well uh, here is your payment. I will find a use for these somehow."}
Q[28414]={d="你的附魔技能进步得不错。想找点东西练练手吗？巫医 Jin'Zil 想给这件逐梦者长袍附上法力。完成后把它送到 Malaka'jin，沿着这条路往南走就是。",dEN="Your enchanting skills are coming along nicely. Want something to practice with? Witch Doctor Jin'Zil wants this Dreamer's Robe enchanted with Mana. Drop it off in Malaka'jin when you are finished, its just to the south here if you follow the path.",o="Hgarth 要你用附魔技能为提供的 1 件逐梦者长袍附上附魔胸甲 - 法力，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Malaka'jin 的巫医 Jin'Zil 那里。",oEN="Hgarth wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Dreamer's Robe with Enchant Chest - Mana and take the order to Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="你需要什么？",pEN="What'cha need?",c="你是谁？啊，我明白了，练手好，好。你干得不错。",cEN="Who you be? Ah I understand, practice be good, good. Ya done well."}
Q[28415]={d="Grom'gol 营地里的 Commander Aggro'gosh 订了这把强力冲击钉锤，但他想要附魔，而我常用的那位又出城了。你认识能帮忙的人吗？报酬会很丰厚。",dEN="Commander Aggro'gosh up at Grom'gol Base Camp ordered this High Impact Mace but he wanted it enchanted and my normal guy's out of town. Do you know anyone who could help out? They'd be paid handsomely.",o="McGavan 要你用附魔技能为提供的 1 把强力冲击钉锤附上附魔双手武器 - 次级冲击，并把订单送到荆棘谷 Grom'gol 营地的 Commander Aggro'gosh 那里。",oEN="McGavan wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 High Impact Mace with Enchant 2H Weapon - Lesser Impact and take the order to Commander Aggro'gosh at Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="欢迎，<class>，需要点什么吗？",pEN="Welcome <class>, need something?",c="我的钉锤！我还以为得自己去取呢，谢谢你。",cEN="My mace! I thought I was going to need to pick it up myself, thank you."}
Q[28416]={d="附近有位法师需要一根新魔杖。去沼泽里她的农场为 Tabetha 制作一根次级神秘魔杖。这请求有点出人意料，但我不会拒绝。也许是送给别人的礼物，她会用自己的方式加以强化。",dEN="A somewhat nearby mage is in need of a new wand. Craft a Lesser Mystic Wand for Tabetha at her farm out in the marsh. A surprising request but one I will not turn down. Perhaps its a gift for another and she'll enhance it in some way.",o="Balai Lok'Wein 要你用附魔技能制作 1 根次级神秘魔杖，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽 Quagmire 某处一间小屋里的 Tabetha 那里。",oEN="Balai Lok'Wein wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Mystic Wand and take the order to Tabetha at a house somewhere in the Quagmire in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="我一眼就看出你是附魔师，幸会。",pEN="I recognize an enchanter when I see one, well met.",c="谢谢你，这根魔杖是要送给别人的，我还会用自己的方法进一步强化它，只是我一直不擅长制作魔杖本体。这是你应得的报酬。",cEN="Thank you, this wand is for another and I will be enhancing it further with my own methods, but I have never been great at creating the base wand. Here is your commission due."}
Q[28417]={d="真粗心，我们收拾行装准备来这里时，我把魔杖忘在幽暗城了。也可能是落在哥布林商队上了。不管怎样，请给我做一根高级神秘魔杖吧——前提是你确实是附魔师……",dEN="How careless, I forgot my wand in Undercity when we were packing up to make our journey here. Or perhaps I left it on the Goblin Caravan. Either way, craft me a Greater Mystic Wand please, assuming you are an enchanter anyway..",o="Annie Grim 要你用附魔技能制作 1 根高级神秘魔杖，并把订单送到凄凉之地 Shadowprey Village 的 Annie Grim 那里。",oEN="Annie Grim wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Greater Mystic Wand and take the order to Annie Grim at Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="也许是我们被恶魔伏击时弄丢的。",pEN="Maybe I dropped it when we got ambushed by demons.",c="哦，太好了，这根魔杖比我上一根还好。请收下这个。",cEN="Oh how nice, this wand is better than my last. Please, take this."}
Q[28418]={d="哦，你好，附魔师，能耽误你一会儿吗。大家都没意识到我是炼金学徒，不是附魔师。Neeka Bloodscar 想让我为 Warlord Gortooth 附魔这把少校之刃，但我做不到。你能帮忙并把它送到附近塔楼里的他手上吗？",dEN="Oh hello enchanter, a moment if you will. People don't realize I'm an apprentice in Alchemy not Enchanting. Neeka Bloodscar wanted me to enchant this Major's Blade for Warlord Gortooth, but I can't. Can you help and deliver it to him in the nearby tower?",o="Jarkal Mossmeld 要你用附魔技能为提供的 1 把少校之刃附上附魔武器 - 打击，并把订单送到荒芜之地 Kargath 的 Warlord Goretooth 那里。",oEN="Jarkal Mossmeld wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Major's Blade with Enchant Weapon - Striking and take the order to Warlord Goretooth at Kargath in Badlands.",p="Thrall-hall，<class>。部落万岁。",pEN="Thrall-hall, <class>.",c="多谢，没有惯用的剑让我觉得像没穿衣服一样。这个附魔会派上用场的。你若好奇，是的，这是一把人类的剑。当你在战场上厮杀时，是有可能丢掉武器的。那种时候你必须抓起手边任何东西。所以我练习剑术，以防哪天不得不用剑。",cEN="My thanks, I felt naked without my usual sword. This enchantment will be put to good use. Lest you wonder, yes it is a Human sword. When you are out in the fields fighting a bloody fight, it is possible to lose your weapon. In those moments you must grab anything you can. So I practice swordsmanship in case I am ever forced to use one."}
Q[28419]={d="你好，附魔师。Gor'mul 最近相当消沉，所以我想提振一下他的精神。那就来点字面意思上的吧。每个好战士都带盾，所以我想请你用精神给这面我弄来的萨满之盾附魔，好提振他的精神。精神就是这个作用，对吧？",dEN="Greetings, enchanter. Gor'mul has been quite down lately, so I would like to raise his spirits. So let's do it literally. Every good warrior carries a shield, so I would like you to enchant this Shaman's Shield I got with Spirit to raise his spirits. That is what it does right?",o="Tor'gan 要你用附魔技能为提供的 1 面萨满之盾附上附魔盾牌 - 精神，并把订单送到阿拉希高地 Hammerfall 的 Gor'mul 那里。",oEN="Tor'gan wants you to use your enchanting skill to enchant the provided 1 Shaman's Shield with Enchant Shield - Spirit and take the order to Gor'mul at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",p="准备好了吗？",pEN="Is it ready?",c="呃，这是什么？萨满之盾？看起来倒是出奇地结实，也许我正需要一面新盾。谢谢你。",cEN="Um, what is this? A Shaman's Shield? Well it seems surprisingly sturdy, maybe a new shield is what I needed. Thank you."}
Q[28420]={d="如今补给商队少得可怜，既要防海盗、荒漠游荡者，又要防食人魔……还有虫子……好吧，这地方就是危险。我的大块发光碎片用完了，研究正需要一块，你能帮我弄一块来吗？我会为你的付出付钱。",dEN="Supply caravans are few and far between these days what with pirates and wastewanders and ogres... and bugs... and okay this place is dangerous. I am out of Large Radiant Shards and I could use one for my research, could you procure one for me? I will pay you for your efforts.",o="Melchor Bloodrunner 要你用附魔技能制作 1 块大块发光碎片，并把订单送到塔纳利斯 Anje'watha 的 Melchor Bloodrunner 那里。",oEN="Melchor Bloodrunner wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Large Radiant Shard and take the order to Melchor Bloodrunner at Anje'watha in Tanaris.",p="我们的灵魂之尘也快用完了……",pEN="We are also low on spirits...",c="多谢，附魔师。请收下这份报酬。",cEN="My thanks, enchanter. Please take this payment."}
Q[28421]={d="你是附魔师，对吧？能帮我个忙吗？作为制皮供应商，我寻找愿意为我供货的人。附魔师很难碰到，而我的附魔皮革用完了。你愿意帮我弄一张吗？",dEN="You are an enchanter right? Could you help me out? As a leatherworking supplier I look for people who are willing to provide me my stock. Enchanters are hard to come by, and I am out of Enchanted Leather. Would you be willing to get one?",o="Jangdor Swiftstrider 要你用附魔技能制作 1 张附魔皮革，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Mojache 营地的 Jangdor Swiftstrider 那里。",oEN="Jangdor Swiftstrider wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Enchanted Leather and take the order to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="你给皮革附魔了吗？",pEN="Have you enchanted some leather yet?",c="品质不错，这正合适。这是你应得的报酬。",cEN="Fine quality, this will do nicely. Here is your due payment."}
Q[28422]={d="等一下，附魔师。我们还需要大量补给才能让 Bloodvenom Post 运转起来。具体来说，我需要一些附魔瑟银锭来继续打造武器。能帮我做一个吗？当然，你会得到报酬。",dEN="Hold on a moment there, enchanter. We still need a lot of supplies to get Bloodvenom Post up and running. Specifically I could use some Enchanted Thorium Bars to keep crafting weapons. Could you craft me one? You will be compensated of course.",o="Altsoba Ragetotem 要你用附魔技能制作 1 块附魔瑟银锭，并把订单送到费伍德森林 Bloodvenom Post 的 Altsoba Ragetotem 那里。",oEN="Altsoba Ragetotem wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Enchanted Thorium Bar and take the order to Altsoba Ragetotem at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.",p="为什么就没有附魔瑟银箭的配方呢……",pEN="Why is there no recipe for Enchanted Thorium Arrows...",c="欢迎回来，我看到你带来锭了。这是你的报酬，谢谢。",cEN="Welcome back, I see you have the bar. Here is your pay, thank you."}
Q[28423]={d="等一下，小声点，你能帮我吗？大药剂师 Leander 收走了我的魔杖，他说我太依赖魔法，炼金术练得太少。可我需要我的魔杖！你能悄悄给我做一根替代品吗？我会付钱给你的！",dEN="Wait a moment, quietly, can you help me? Master Apothecary Leander took my wand because he said I was spending too much time relying on magic and not enough on my alchemy skill. But I need my wand! So can you make me a replacement on the down low? I will pay you!",o="学徒 Sarina 要你用附魔技能制作 1 根次级虚空魔杖，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Valormok 的学徒 Sarina 那里。",oEN="Apprentice Sarina wants you to use your enchanting skill to craft 1 Lesser Nether Wand and take the order to Apprentice Sarina at Valormok in Azshara.",p="别告诉大药剂师 Leander！",pEN="Don't tell Master Apothecary Leander!",c="谢谢，趁我们还没被发现，你快走吧。哦对，你的报酬，拿着！",cEN="Thank you, please go before we get caught. Oh right your payment, here!"}
Q[28424]={d="当心，<name>——你耳朵后面还沾着一点油污！这说明你是工程学的手艺人，我正好有件事需要你帮忙。\n\n让锯木厂持续运转是每小时都要操心的活。感觉你多看它一眼它就要散架。我需要几十把铜螺栓来让锯片继续转下去。你觉得你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Look out, <name> -- you missed a bit of grease behind your ear! That tells me you're an engineer by trade, and I have a task I could use your help with.\n\nKeeping the sawmill running is an hourly chore. It feels like it will break down if you so much as look at it wrong. I could use a couple dozen Handfuls of Copper Bolts to keep the blades spinning. Think you could help out?",o="Supervisor Raelen 要你用工程学技能制作 24 个铜螺栓，并把订单送到艾尔文森林 Eastvale 伐木场的 Supervisor Raelen 那里。",oEN="Supervisor Raelen wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 24 Handful of Copper Bolts and take the order to Supervisor Raelen at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="幸好今天一切都正常运转……到目前为止。",pEN="Fortunately, everything has been working today... so far.",c="谢谢，<name>！我很感激一位愿意伸手帮忙、造福社区的 $gtradesman:tradeswoman。",cEN="Thanks, <name>! I appreciate a $gtradesman:tradeswoman, willing to pitch in and help the community."}
Q[28425]={d="喂，既然你是工程师，这附近还有件事你能帮上忙。\n\n那边那位 Marshal Haggard 在暴风城卫队服役了几十年。有时他半夜醒来，满脑子都是第二次和第三次大战的记忆……他再也感觉不到安全了。我觉得他需要的是点火力。你知道，就是放在身边能让人安心的东西。我说的是炸药，<name>。一堆粗制铜炸弹会让他觉得自己拥有私人军火库。",dEN="Say, since you're an engineer, there's another task that you could help with around here.\n\nMarshal Haggard over yonder has been serving in the Stormwind Guard for decades. Sometimes he wakes in the night with memories of the Second and Third wars... he never feels safe anymore. I think what he could use is some firepower. You know, something to have around as a comfort. I'm talking explosives, <name>. A bunch of Rough Copper Bombs would make him feel like he had his own personal arsenal.",o="Supervisor Raelen 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个粗制铜炸弹，并把订单送到艾尔文森林 Eastvale 伐木场的 Marshal Haggard 那里。",oEN="Supervisor Raelen wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Rough Copper Bomb and take the order to Marshal Haggard at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="你好，年轻人。",pEN="Hail youngster.",c="Raelen 送的礼物？她怎么知道我一直梦想着和矮人迫击炮小队一起干活？\n\n我得好好报答你这份贴心的礼物，<name>。请连报酬一起收下这些补给吧。",cEN="A gift from Raelen? How did she know I always had a dream to work with the Dwarven mortar team?\n\nI must reward you for this thoughtful gift, <name>. Please take some supplies along with your fee."}
Q[28426]={d="诺莫瑞根的灾难让我们失去了那么多侏儒工程师，如今我们的手艺供不应求。就说 Pilot Hammerfoot 吧——他居然让我交出我自己的私人工具，好让他去修他的攻城车！\n\n哼，想要我的工具，除非从我尸体上拿。不过你要是想做件好事，可以制作几把奥术光扳手送到北门哨站给他。毕竟我们想要的是能用的攻城车。",dEN="With so many gnomish engineers lost during the catastrophe at Gnomeregan, our services are in high demand. Take Pilot Hammerfoot -- he actually asked me to give up MY personal tools so he could fix his siege engine!\n\nWell, he can have my tools over my dead body, but if you'd like to do a good deed, you can craft a few Arclight Spanners and deliver them to him over at North Gate Outpost. We do want working siege engines after all.",o="Razzle Sprysprocket 要你用工程学技能制作 2 把奥术光扳手，并把订单送到丹莫罗北门哨站的 Pilot Hammerfoot 那里。",oEN="Razzle Sprysprocket wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Arclight Spanner and take the order to Pilot Hammerfoot at North Gate Outpost in Dun Morogh.",p="你好，年轻人。有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Hail youngster. How can I help ye?",c="哼！他们还说矮人脾气坏。那个 Razzle 脸皮真厚……不过很感谢你把这些工具送来。让我给你一些我们的补给吧。",cEN="Hmph! And they call dwarves grumpy. That Razzle's got some nerve... but I appreciate your kindness in bringing me these tools. Let me give you a bit o' our supplies."}
Q[28427]={d="工程师和任何矮人一样懂得欣赏好酒，所以如果你有时间，我想请你去完成 Rejold Barleybrew 的这一订单。他需要一堆铜管来改造 Brewnall 村的蒸馏器。Rejold 现在酿的酒已经相当不错了，我很想看看等他把新蒸馏器开起来能酿出什么。",dEN="An engineer appreciates a good brew as much as any dwarf, so I'd like to ask you to fill this request from Rejold Barleybrew if you have the time. He needs a mess of copper pipes for improving the still in Brewnall Village. The ale Rejold already brews is quite good so I'm eager to see what he'll produce once he gets the new still running.",o="Razzle Sprysprocket 要你用工程学技能制作 5 根铜管，并把订单送到丹莫罗 Brewnall 村的 Rejold Barleybrew 那里。",oEN="Razzle Sprysprocket wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Copper Tube and take the order to Rejold Barleybrew at Brewnall Village in Dun Morogh.",p="想来杯麦酒吗，<class>？",pEN="Fancy an ale, <class>?",c="哦！你是来谈生意的！那就不一样了。我正急需这些管子。对了，让我把我剩下的补给分你一些——你比我更能用得上。",cEN="Oh! You're here on business! Well, that's different. I needed these tubes somethin' fierce. Say, let me give you some of my leftover supplies -- you'll make better use of 'em than I will."}
Q[28428]={d="Ishnu-dal-dieb，<class>。自从我从铁炉堡回来，找我做工程的人就多得忙不过来。订单多得我根本接不完。\n\n如果你也懂机械，也许能帮忙完成一个订单？Dolanaar 的猎人训练师 Dazalar 想试试火枪。你能想象吗？这想法可真前卫！\n\n总之，如果你能制作一把粗制爆破枪送给他，我会很感激你的帮助。",dEN="Ishnu-dal-dieb, <class>. I have found my engineering services much in demand since I returned from Ironforge. So much so, that I have more orders than I can handle.\n\nIf you have a mechanical bent yourself, perhaps you could help out with an order? Dazalar, the hunter trainer in Dolanaar, would like to try out a gun. Can you imagine? That's forward-thinking!\n\nAnyway, if you could craft and deliver a Rough Boomstick to him, I would appreciate your assistance.",o="Shanther 要你用工程学技能制作 1 把粗制爆破枪，并把订单送到泰达希尔 Dolanaar 的 Dazalar 那里。",oEN="Shanther wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Rough Boomstick and take the order to Dazalar at Dolanaar in Teldrassil.",p="我们暗夜精灵猎人用了几百年的弓……但谁能说矮人没发现更好的东西呢？",pEN="We night elf hunters have used a bow for centuries... but who is to say that the dwarves haven't discovered something better?",c="谢谢你，工程师。我很期待把这把……\"爆破枪\"的威力和我信赖的弓比较一番。",cEN="Thank you, engineer. I look forward to comparing the performance of this... \"boomstick\" to that of my trusty bow."}
Q[28429]={d="我手上有个订单让我有点摸不着头脑。也许你愿意看看？\n\nDenalan 一直在 Al'Ameth 湖边做植物实验。前几天他送来一张字条，要一些\"爆炸物\"来对付他所说的\"不听话的灌木丛\"。老实说我不知道该怎么理解，不过如果你有兴趣制作一些粗制炸药，可以送到 Dolanaar 后面湖边的 Denalan 那里。",dEN="I have an order I find a bit confounding. Perhaps you'd care to take a look at it?\n\nDenalan has been experimenting with plants down by Lake Al'Ameth. The other day he sent a note asking for something \"explosive\" to deal with what he called \"unruly shrubs\". Well, I don't know what to make of this, but if you're interested in crafting some Rough Dynamite, you can deliver it to Denalan down by the lake behind Dolanaar.",o="Shanther 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个粗制炸药，并把订单送到泰达希尔 Al'Ameth 湖的 Denalan 那里。",oEN="Shanther wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Rough Dynamite and take the order to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth in Teldrassil.",p="我从没想过园艺会用到炸药，但时代在变。",pEN="I never thought gardening would involve explosives, but times change.",c="谢谢你，工程师。我想问题已经在掌控之中了……不过知道手边有这东西，万一情况升级也安心些。",cEN="Thank you, engineer. I think I have the problem in hand... but it is a comfort to know I have this on hand if the situation escalates."}
Q[28430]={d="我被授权为人民军征调所需物资。你是工程师，对吧？我需要一个粗糙的瞄准镜，给塔顶的侦察兵 Riell。那能让她占尽优势，狙击任何袭击哨兵岭的东西。如果你能制作两个送给她，我们会给你报酬。",dEN="I have been given the authority to requisition items needed by the People's Militia. You're an engineer, right? I could use a Crude Scope for Scout Riell up on top of the tower. That would give her a good advantage to snipe anything that attacked Sentinel Hill. If you're able to craft and deliver a couple to her, we'd compensate you.",o="Protector Gariel 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个粗糙的瞄准镜，并把订单送到西部荒野哨兵岭的 Scout Riell 那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Crude Scope and take the order to Scout Riell at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="我以人民军的名义向你致意。",pEN="I greet you in the name of the People's Militia.",c="谢谢你，工程师。我希望永远用不上这些，但有备无患。这是 Gariel 提到的补给。",cEN="Thank you, engineer. I hope I never have to use these but it is better to be prepared. Here are the supplies Gariel mentioned."}
Q[28431]={d="作为人民军的物资采购员，我还想请你为保卫者 Dorana 制作一副敏捷虎纹护目镜。她独自一人走在从哨兵岭向北的那条路上，这副护目镜能保护她的眼睛不被沙暴扬起的尘土和毒辣的阳光所伤。如果你能好心送给她，我会很感激。",dEN="As the requisitioner for the People's Militia, I'd also like to request you craft Protector Dorana a pair of Agile Tiger Goggles. She walks the road that runs north from Sentinel Hill all by herself, and those goggles will protect her eyes from dirt kicked up by the dust storms and the harsh sun. If you'd be kind enough to deliver them to her, I'd appreciate it.",o="Protector Gariel 要你用工程学技能制作 1 副敏捷虎纹护目镜，并把订单送到西部荒野向北道路上的保卫者 Dorana 那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Agile Tiger Goggles and take the order to Protector Dorana at her route on the road north through Westfall.",p="我以人民军的名义向你致意。",pEN="I greet you in the name of the People's Militia.",c="我很感激 Gariel 和你的帮助。我会好好用这副护目镜的。这些是我收集来的一些补给，也许你用得上。",cEN="I appreciate Gariel's assistance and yours. I will put these goggles to good use. Here are some supplies I've scavenged that you might find useful."}
Q[28432]={d="这附近大多数精灵都不太信得过正经的工程学，不过我最近和 Archaeologist Everit 聊过，他是南边 Remtravel 挖掘场的一位矮人。他提到有些魔像的麻烦，还在找一些训练假人。我手上没货——我平时也不进这个——不过如果你有兴趣做几个，我敢说他不会亏待你。",dEN="Most of these elven folk 'round here don't really trust good engineerin', but I recently spoke to Archaeologist Everit, a dwarf who is part of Remtravel's Excavation down south. He mentioned some kinda issue with golems and that he was lookin' for some Target Dummies. I didn't have any in stock -- not somethin' I usually carry -- but if you're interested in crafting some, I'm sure he'd make it worth your while.",o="Gorbold Steelhand 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个训练假人，并把订单送到黑海岸 Remtravel 挖掘场的 Archaeologist Everit 那里。",oEN="Gorbold Steelhand wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Target Dummy and take the order to Archaeologist Everit at Remtravel's Excavation in Darkshore.",p="训练假人？是的，我前阵子是在找一些。",pEN="Target Dummies? Yes, I was lookin' for some awhile back.",c="说实话，我觉得这些东西达不到我想要的效果，但既然你费心跑一趟，我还是乐意付钱。谢谢你，<class>！",cEN="To tell you the truth, I don't think these are going to be effective to do what I want, but I'm happy to pay you for them anyway, since you went to the trouble. Thanks, <class>!"}
Q[28433]={d="另一件我手上没货的东西是银触媒，不过镇上有个暗夜精灵想买一些。他说那是给他妻子画像的「合适媒介」之类的话。我对艺术一窍不通……但我知道，如果你能给 Cerellean Whiteclaw 弄到一些银触媒，是能赚到钱的。",dEN="Another thing I don't keep in stock is Silver Contact, but a night elf here in town was interested in buying some. Said it was a 'proper medium' for sketchin' his wife or some such thing. I don't know anything about art... but I do know there's some coin to be made if you can rustle up some Silver Contact for Cerellean Whiteclaw.",o="Gorbold Steelhand 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个银触媒，并把订单送到黑海岸 Auberdine 的 Cerellean Whiteclaw 那里。",oEN="Gorbold Steelhand wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Silver Contact and take the order to Cerellean Whiteclaw at Auberdine in Darkshore.",p="让我独自哀悼吧，<race>。",pEN="Leave me to my grief, <race>.",c="哦……对……银片。我可以用它们给 Anaya 的脸做一幅蚀刻画。等我有时间缓过来，我会去做的。谢谢你。",cEN="Oh... yes... the silver sheets. I can use them to make an etching of Anaya's face. And I will, when I've had some time to recover. Thank you."}
Q[28434]={d="你好，<class>。我知道有点奇怪，一个矿工居然向工程师求助，但我有个新型自动挖掘工具的想法。要做出第一个原型，我需要五个铜质调节器。如果你能帮忙，我很乐意在你的报酬之外再给你一笔小费。",dEN="Hail, <class>. I know it's a bit strange, a Miner askin' for help from an Engineer, but I have an idea for a new automated digging tool. To craft my first prototype I need five Copper Modulators. I'm happy to give you a tip on top of your fee if you can help me out.",o="Brock Stoneseeker 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个铜质调节器，并把订单送到洛克莫丹 Thelsamar 的 Brock Stoneseeker 那里。",oEN="Brock Stoneseeker wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Copper Modulator and take the order to Brock Stoneseeker at Thelsamar in Loch Modan.",p="所以……调节器带动转轴，转轴带动轮子，轮子让转轴下沉，然后……哦抱歉，你打断我的沉思了。",pEN="So... the modulator turns the shaft, which turns the wheel, which makes the shaft go down and then... oh sorry, you caught me ruminatin'.",c="谢谢你，<name>。这是我凑来给你当小费的一些补给。",cEN="Thanks for this, <name>. And here's some supplies I've rustled up as a tip for you."}
Q[28435]={d="说到帮忙，不久前有个年轻人类路过这里，往远行者小屋去了。他好像对打猎有点厌倦了。他问镇上有没有人会做练习锁，但这里没人有那手艺。如果你想多赚点钱，他说他会在小屋里待一阵子。他叫 Darryl。",dEN="Speakin' of help, a young human passed by here not too long ago on his way up to the Farstrider Lodge. Seemed a bit bored of the hunt. Asked if anyone in town could make Practice Locks, but there's no one here with that skill. If you're looking to make a bit more coin, he said he'd be up at the lodge for some time. Name was Darryl.",o="Brock Stoneseeker 要你用工程学技能制作 5 把练习锁，并把订单送到洛克莫丹远行者小屋的 Daryl the Youngling 那里。",oEN="Brock Stoneseeker wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Practice Lock and take the order to Daryl the Youngling at Farstrider Lodge in Loch Modan.",p="<Darryl 叹了口气。> 这附近要是有点真正的竞争就好了。",pEN="<Darryl sighs.> If only there was some real competition around here.",c="练习锁？真的吗？那当然，我要一些。这在 Menethil 老家可时髦了。谢谢！",cEN="Practice locks? Really? Why yes, I'll take some. They're all the rage back home in Menethil. Thanks!"}
Q[28436]={d="隔壁有个人类，想造一种花哨的望远镜来看星星。我一直跟他说，我们侏儒早就有看星星的办法了——用华丽望远镜！\n\n我自己不是工程师，但你看上去是。我很希望你能做一个望远镜送给 Viktori，这样我就不用再听他念叨他那愚蠢的发明了！\n\n<Cog 低声嘟囔着人类如何侵占侏儒的产业。>",dEN="There's a human next door who is trying to build some kind of fancy spyglass to look at the stars. I keep telling him that we gnomes already have a way to look at the stars -- through an Ornate Spyglass!\n\nI'm not an engineer myself, but you seem to be. I'd love if you would craft a spyglass and deliver it to Viktori so that I don't have to hear any more about his silly invention!\n\n<Cog mutters something about humans encroaching on gnome industry under his breath.>",o="Cog Glitzspinner 要你用工程学技能制作 1 个华丽望远镜，并把订单送到暮色森林 Darkshire 的 Viktori Prism'Antras 那里。",oEN="Cog Glitzspinner wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Ornate Spyglass and take the order to Viktori Prism'Antras at Darkshire in Duskwood.",p="你好，<name>。你对天文学感兴趣吗？",pEN="Greetings, <name>. Are you interested in astronomy?",c="<Viktori 叹了口气。> 我跟 Cog 解释过，星星比你能透过望远镜看到的任何东西都要遥远得多，无论那望远镜做得多精致。但如果这样能让他别再烦我，我很乐意付钱请你做一个。",cEN="<Viktori sighs.> I have tried explaining to Cog that the stars seem much farther away than anything you could see through a spyglass, however finely crafted. But if it will get him to stop nagging me, I will happily compensate you for crafting it."}
Q[28437]={d="嘿，<class>。Everstill 湖的鱼情好得不能再好了。我在这个码头上钓到过许多又大又亮眼的翻车鱼——不过要是我有那些新奇的流体动力鱼饵，我想我能钓得更好。你认识会做那东西的人吗？",dEN="Hey, <class>. The fishing in Lake Everstill is as fine as it can be. I've caught many a big brilliant Sunfish from this dock -- but I think I could do better if I had some of those new-fangled Aquadynamic Fish Attractors. You don't know anyone who can make those, do you?",o="Zem Leeward 要你用工程学技能制作 10 个流体动力鱼饵，并把订单送到赤脊山 Lakeshire 的 Zem Leeward 那里。",oEN="Zem Leeward wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 10 Aquadynamic Fish Attractor and take the order to Zem Leeward at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="我听说只要有合适的鱼饵，这湖里甚至能钓到山鳟？",pEN="I've heard you can even fish Mountain Pike from this lake if you have the right bait?",c="哎呀，真没想到！我瞎念叨还真找对工程师了。多谢你，还有些我一直留着以备不时之需的补给，也给你吧。",cEN="Well, I'll be! I rambled on to the right engineer. You have my thanks, and some supplies I've been saving for a rainy day."}
Q[28438]={d="你好，<class>。我是来调查附近被遗忘者活动的。我的邻居 Orendil Broadleaf 向我问了很多关于工程学实践的问题。我觉得他不像其他许多暗夜精灵那样排斥技术。\n\n我想让 Orendil 看看工程学能驾驭怎样的力量。你愿意制作一些重型炸药带给他吗？",dEN="Greetings, <class>. I am here to investigate the activities of the Forsaken nearby. I have received many questions about the practice of engineering from my neighbor, Orendil Broadleaf. I believe he is not as opposed to technology as many other night elves seem.\n\nI would like Orendil to see the power that can be harnessed by engineering. Would you craft some Heavy Dynamite and bring it to him?",o="Delgren the Purifier 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个重型炸药，并把订单送到灰谷 Maestra 哨站的 Orendil Broadleaf 那里。",oEN="Delgren the Purifier wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Heavy Dynamite and take the order to Orendil Broadleaf at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",p="什么事？我能帮你什么吗？",pEN="Yes? How can I help you?",c="这根小木头竟有如此巨大的爆炸威力？我几乎不敢相信。我会找个安全的地方试它一试。\n\n感谢你愿意满足我的好奇心。我想这些我已经检验完的零件对你的手艺会派上用场。",cEN="This small log holds immense explosive power? I can hardly believe it. I will look for a safe place to test it.\n\nI appreciate your willingness to indulge my curiosity. I believe you'll find these parts that I have finished examining to be useful for your craft."}
Q[28439]={d="欢迎来到我简陋的工坊，<class>。我收到一份令人不安的报告，说上沼泽出了状况。龙喉兽人一直在那里集结兵力，恐怕 Burndural 正遭受攻击。\n\nCommander Strongborn 是那里防御的负责人，我这儿有他的一份订单，要为他的步枪兵订购两个标准瞄准镜。可惜我一直抽不出时间去办。你能帮我个忙，马上着手处理吗？",dEN="Welcome to my humble workshop, <class>. I've received a disturbing report that something is going on in the Upper Marshes. The Dragonmaw orcs have been building forces there, and I'm afraid Burndural may be under attack.\n\nCommander Strongborn is the head of the defenses up there, and I have an order here from him, requesting a couple of Standard Scopes for his riflemen. Alas, I haven't been able to get to it yet. Could you help me out and work on this right away?",o="Fradd Swiftgear 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个标准瞄准镜，并把订单送到湿地上沼泽 Burndural 的卫兵队长 Naimas 那里。",oEN="Fradd Swiftgear wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Standard Scope and take the order to Guard Captain Naimas at Burndural in the Upper Marshes of Wetlands.",p="趴下，<class>！你没看见我们正遭攻击吗！",pEN="Get down, <class>! Can't ye see we're under attack!",c="嗯，迟到总比不来好！我会把这些交给我最好的两名神射手。多谢你。",cEN="Well, better late than never! I'll hand these over to my two finest sharpshooters. Ye have my thanks."}
Q[28440]={d="Kurzen 上校的部队躲在荆棘谷远山的洞穴里。要是能用战术打击干掉他和他的手下就好了，但我们必须做好进攻失败的准备。\n\n这准备就包括一位像你这样有才华的工程师。\n\n我需要炸弹，<name>。大号的。具体来说，是一堆大号青铜炸弹。万一情况最糟，我们可以炸塌那个洞口，把 Kurzen 困在里面。",dEN="Colonel Kurzen's forces are holed up in a cave in the far hills of Stranglethorn. It would be better if we were able to take him and his men out with tactical strikes, but we must be prepared in the event that our offensive fails.\n\nThat preparation includes a talented engineer, like you.\n\nI need bombs, <name>. Big ones. A bunch of Big Bronze Bombs, to be specific. If the worst comes, we can blow the entrance to that cave and trap Kurzen inside.",o="Sergeant Yohwa 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个大号青铜炸弹，并把订单送到荆棘谷 Rebel Camp 的 Sergeant Yohwa 那里。",oEN="Sergeant Yohwa wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Big Bronze Bomb and take the order to Sergeant Yohwa at Rebel Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你的炸弹做好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Do you have those bombs done yet, <name>?",c="谢谢。这是你的报酬。\n\n我真心希望我们不必用上这些，那会是可怕的行径。但总好过让 Kurzen 煽动叛乱、毁掉这片丛林。",cEN="Thank you. Here is your payment.\n\nI sincerly hope we don't have to use these, it would be a terrible act. But, better than Kurzen fomenting rebellion and destroying the jungle."}
Q[28441]={d="喂——就是你！我想我在铁炉堡的工程学训练师那儿见过你，那时我还驻扎在东部王国。工程师，对吧？\n\n工头 Tionn 正设法让我们的锯木厂运转起来，但传动带的同步有点问题。他说需要几枚旋钮式同步器才能让它转起来。这事你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Say -- you there! I think I saw you at the engineering trainer in Ironforge, back when I was stationed in the Eastern Kingdoms. Engineer, right?\n\nForeman Tionn is trying to get our lumber mill operational but he's having some problems getting the belts to time correctly. Said he needs a handful of Gyrochronatoms to get it going. Is that something you can help with?",o="Guard Byron 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个旋钮式同步器，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽塞拉摩岛的工头 Tionn 那里。",oEN="Guard Byron wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Gyrochronatom and take the order to Foreman Tionn at Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="嘿……小心你在干什么，Sanchez！那可是我最好的锯子！\n\n哦抱歉，你刚才在说什么吗？",pEN="Hey... watch what you're doing Sanchez! That's my good saw!\n\nOh sorry, were you saying something?",c="哎呀！Byron 说他知道有个人能行，老实说我没想到他真能办到。等一下，让我多给你点当小费，$gguy:gal。",cEN="Well hot damn! Byron said he knew a $gguy:gal, but I honestly didn't think he'd deliver. Hold on, let me give you a little extra for a tip."}
Q[28442]={d="欢迎来到 Squigglecord。这地方是我一手建起来的，事情多得很。\n\n话说，你是工程师，对吧？看你手指上那些奥术光扳手磨出的茧子就知道了。愿意接一个还没人接的订单吗？\n\n有个住在科多兽坟场的哥布林想买一些坚固炸药。我对哥布林工程师向来抱有一份职业上的敬意，可这位是炼金师……我实在想不出他要炸药做什么，所以一直没接这个单。你要是想要，就全归你了！",dEN="Welcome to Squigglecord. I built this place from the ground up and there's plenty to do.\n\nSay, you're an engineer aren't you? I can tell by those arclight spanner calluses on your fingers. Care to fill an open order?\n\nThere's a goblin who lives down in the Kodo Graveyard who asked to buy some Solid Dynamite. Now I have a healthy professional respect for goblin engineers, but this one is an alchemist.... I don't know what he could possibly want dynamite for, so I haven't filled the order. If you want it, it's all yours!",o="Dibi Squigglecord 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个坚固炸药，并把订单送到凄凉之地科多兽坟场的 Hornizz Brimbuzzle 那里。",oEN="Dibi Squigglecord wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Solid Dynamite and take the order to Hornizz Brimbuzzle at Kodo Graveyard in Desolace.",p="骨头……那些干骨头……骨头……哦，你好！",pEN="Bones... them dry bones... bones... oh, hi!",c="很好，太好了。这个实验我已经等了很久。你能把幽灵炸飞吗？没人知道，但也许我们离答案又近了一步。\n\n总之，这是你的报酬。",cEN="Yes, good. I've been waiting for this for one of my experiments. Can you blow up a ghost? No one knows, but we may be one step closer to finding out.\n\nAnyway, here's your payment."}
Q[28443]={d="我很惊讶像 Lord Ravenholdt 这样的人类居然有造园的眼光，不过他这座花园的基础确实足以成就真正的杰作。要是有一副高聚焦护目镜，能让我真正看清枝叶的细节，那对我帮助太大了。你该不会正好知道哪里能弄到一副吧？",dEN="I was quite surprised that a human like Lord Ravenholdt would have an eye for landscaping, but his garden here has the foundation to be truly remarkable. What would really help me is if I had a pair of Hyper-Focused Goggles to really hone in on the details of the foliage. You don't happen to know where I could get a pair, do you?",o="Simone Cantrell 要你用工程学技能制作 1 副高聚焦护目镜，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Ravenholdt 庄园的 Simone Cantrell 那里。",oEN="Simone Cantrell wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Hyper Focused Goggles and take the order to Simone Cantrell at Ravenholdt Manor in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="asperia ficus 的布局必须分毫不差！",pEN="The arrangement of the asperia ficus must be JUST so!",c="这是你做的？真是有进取心！但作为 Ravenholdt 家的客人，我早已学会不按常理预期。来，请收下这些作为报酬。",cEN="You made these? How enterprising! But I have learned to expect the unexpected as a guest of the Ravenholdts. Here, please take these as compensation."}
Q[28444]={d="你钓鱼吗，<name>？我很爱钓鱼，但一群邪枝巨魔把我从最爱的钓点赶走时，我丢了我最喜欢的钓竿。\n\n镇上没有工程师，所以我不知道什么时候才能弄到新的。要是你碰巧遇到一些秘银管，也许会想到你的朋友 Howin，嗯？我可以用一些来做根新钓竿。",dEN="Do you ever fish, <name>? I love fishing but I lost my favorite pole when some Vilebranch trolls chased me out of my favorite fishing spot.\n\nThere's no engineer in town so I'm not sure when I'll get a new one. If you happen to come across some mithril tubes, perhaps you'll think of your friend Howin, hmm? I could use some to make a new pole.",o="Howin Kindfeather 要你用工程学技能制作 5 根秘银管，并把订单送到辛特兰 Aerie Peak 的 Howin Kindfeather 那里。",oEN="Howin Kindfeather wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Mithril Tube and take the order to Howin Kindfeather at Aerie Peak in Hinterlands.",p="那些巨魔确实够「邪」的。嘿嘿嘿。",pEN="Those trolls were VILE indeed. He he he.",c="一整套全新的秘银管给我？哎呀，真是太感谢你了！我这就动手做根新钓竿。我迫不及待想再回到水边了。",cEN="A brand new set of mithril tubes for me? Why, thank ye kindly indeed! I'll get to work crafting a new pole directly. I can't wait to head out to the water again."}
Q[28445]={d="我要训练的哨兵很多，<name>，盔甲却不够分。那些等着盔甲锻好的哨兵只能小心对练以免受伤。这就需要你了——你到来的消息早就传开了，说你有工程学的手艺。我需要一些高级训练假人给我的哨兵。你能帮忙吗？",dEN="I have many Sentinels to train, <name>, and not enough armor to go around. Those who are waiting for their armor to be smithed must spar carefully to avoid injury. That's where you come in -- word of your engineering skill preceeded your arrival. I require some Advanced Target Dummies for my Sentinels. Can you assist?",o="Shandris Feathermoon 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个高级训练假人，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Feathermoon 要塞的 Shandris Feathermoon 那里。",oEN="Shandris Feathermoon wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Advanced Target Dummy and take the order to Shandris Feathermoon at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="训练假人拿到了吗？",pEN="Do you have the training dummies?",c="感谢你及时处理此事，<name>。这是你的报酬。愿艾露恩与你同在。",cEN="I appreciate your prompt attention to this matter, <name>. Here is your payment. Go with Elune."}
Q[28446]={d="你是工程师吗？抱歉……你看起来就像。我哥哥是工程师。\n\n总之，我只是想告诉你，不久前有位叫 Dr. Atwood 的人在寒风营地寻找一些不稳定的扳机。银色黎明把他赶走了……不知为什么。不过他提到他在 Caer Darrow，如果有工程师路过的话。要是你敢冒着亡灵的危险赶到那里，也许是个赚钱的好机会！",dEN="Are you an engineer? Sorry... you just have the look of one. My brother's an engineer.\n\nAnyway, I just wanted to let you know that a man named Dr. Atwood was at Chillwind Camp a little while ago, looking for some Unstable Triggers. The Argent Dawn kind of ran him off... not sure why. But he mentioned that he was at Caer Darrow, if an engineer came by. Might be a good chance to make some coin if you can brave the undead to get there!",o="Mariel Dumont 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个不稳定的扳机，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地 Caer Darrow 的 Doctor Atwood 那里。",oEN="Mariel Dumont wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Unstable Trigger and take the order to Doctor Atwood at Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands.",p="我一直跟 Dean Blackwood 说，我们需要实用课程，不只是魔法课程。哦……嗯……你是谁？你不是我的学生！",pEN="I keep telling Dean Blackwood we need practical courses, not just magical ones. Oh... hmm... who are you? You're not one of my students!",c="有位好心人告诉了你我需要不稳定的扳机。真傻……我是说，太棒了！是的，我确实需要一些扳机。这些看起来还能用。\n\n你怎么还在这儿？哦，报酬。对。拿着这些零碎东西，继续走你的快活路吧。",cEN="A kind soul told you of my need for Unstable Triggers. How fooli... I mean, how marvelous! Yes, I am in need of some triggers. These appear to be in working order.\n\nWhy are you still here? Oh, payment. Right. Here, take these bits and bobs and move on your merry way."}
Q[28447]={d="哦！一位工程师同行！你指甲缝里的污垢我一眼就认得！\n\n话说，你接活吗？Wobble Hollow 这边有一大堆活要干，我抽不出时间去帮别人。北边恶魔那边住着一位哥布林，他想找人给他做两个致命瞄准镜。你要是想赚点钱，他大概会为你的手艺出个好价钱！",dEN="Oh! A fellow engineer! I'd recognize the grime beneath your fingernails anywhere!\n\nSay, are you for hire? There are a multitude of tasks around Wobble Hollow that need doing, so I can't spare the time to help anyone else. There's a goblin who lives over by the demons in the north who was looking for someone to craft him a couple of Deadly Scopes. If you're interested in making some coin, he'd probably pay well for your services!",o="Wilson Wobblesmith 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个致命瞄准镜，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Legash 营地的 Kim'jael 那里。",oEN="Wilson Wobblesmith wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Deadly Scope and take the order to Kim'jael at Legash Encampment in Azshara.",p="当财团派我来艾萨拉寻找贸易伙伴时，我可不知道还会碰上恶魔和熊。天哪！",pEN="When the Cartel sent me here to find trade contacts in Azshara, I didn't know there would be demons and bears involved. Oh my!",c="哦，太好了！那个脑子像浆糊的侏儒总算找到个有本事的人给我做瞄准镜了。现在我在三百码外就能对付那些难缠的客人了。\n\n和你做生意很愉快，<name>。我能叫你 <name> 吗？",cEN="Oh good! That mush for brain gnome found someone competent to craft me some scopes. Now I can handle unruly customers from three hundred yards away.\n\nPleasure doing business with you, <name>. Can I call you <name>?"}
Q[28448]={d="<Soros 看上去很虚弱，但神志清醒。>\n\n恶魔……干的。必须……复仇！需要……炸弹。高爆……炸弹。帮我……复仇！",dEN="<Soros seems weak but lucid.>\n\nDemons... did this. Must... get revenge! Need... bombs. Hi-Explosive... bombs. Help me... get revenge!",o="Soros Darkcrescent 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个高爆炸弹，并把订单送到费伍德森林 Talonbranch 林地的 Soros Darkcrescent 那里。",oEN="Soros Darkcrescent wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Hi-Explosive Bomb and take the order to Soros Darkcrescent at Talonbranch Glade in Felwood.",p="该死的……恶魔。",pEN="Foul... demons.",c="我会……恢复力量。我会……带上这些炸弹……摧毁那些恶魔。谢谢你……",cEN="I will... regain strength. I... will take these bombs... and destroy the demons. Thank you...."}
Q[28449]={d="当心，<name>——你耳朵后面还沾着一点油污！这说明你是工程学的手艺人，我正好有件事需要你帮忙。\n\n有一队哥布林正在奥格瑞玛城外修建新的飞艇塔，他们需要几十把铜螺栓。我一直忙着处理那些货车零件的订单，抽不出身。你觉得你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Look out, <name> -- you missed a bit of grease behind your ear! That tells me you're an engineer by trade, and I have a task I could use your help with.\n\nThere's a team of goblins working on building a new zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar and they could use a couple dozen Handfuls of Copper Bolts. I've been too busy with orders for parts for those carts to get to it. Think you could help out?",o="Mukdrak 要你用工程学技能制作 24 个铜螺栓，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的 Supervisor Hink 那里。",oEN="Mukdrak wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 24 Handful of Copper Bolts and take the order to Supervisor Hink at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar in Durotar.",p="你简直不敢相信我的工人弄丢了多少螺栓。有时候我觉得是蝎毒把他们的脑子弄糊涂了！",pEN="You would not believe the number of bolts my workers misplace. Sometimes I think the scorpid venom addles their minds!",c="谢谢，<name>！我很感激一位愿意伸手帮忙的 $gtradesman:tradeswoman。",cEN="Thanks, <name>! I appreciate a $gtradesman:tradeswoman, willing to pitch in and help."}
Q[28450]={d="喂，既然你是工程师，这附近还有件事你能帮上忙。\n\nSen'jin 村的 Lar Prowltusk 需要帮忙解决一帮讨厌的半人马。他问我能不能出点力，我说，嗯，我能让他们「轰」一声。嘿嘿。\n\n我说的就是炸药，<name>。\n\n一堆粗制铜炸弹会让他觉得自己拥有私人军火库。",dEN="Say, since you're an engineer, there's another task that you could help with around here.\n\nLar Prowltusk down in Sen'jin Village needs some help taking out a pesky band of centaur. He asked if there was anything I could contribute, and I said, well I can make 'em BOOM. Heh heh.\n\nI'm talking explosives, <name>.\n\nA bunch of Rough Copper Bombs would make him feel like he had his own personal arsenal.",o="Mukdrak 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个粗制铜炸弹，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔 Sen'jin 村的 Lar Prowltusk 那里。",oEN="Mukdrak wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Rough Copper Bomb and take the order to Lar Prowltusk at Sen'ji Village in Durotar.",p="小心半人马，<class>。",pEN="Watch out for the centaur, <class>.",c="炸弹？嗯，我可不想把整个峡谷都炸塌，但我看得出这些也许有用。请连报酬一起收下这些补给吧。",cEN="Bombs? Well, I don't want to collapse the whole canyon, but I can see these might be useful. Please take some supplies along with your fee."}
Q[28451]={d="卡利姆多的工程师少之又少，我们的手艺供不应求。就说 Melor Stonehoof 吧——他捎信说想找把新枪，可我一直忙得没空回他。我不愿放弃一单生意，不过你要是想做件好事，可以制作一把粗制爆破枪，送到雷霆崖的猎人高地给他。",dEN="With so few engineers in Kalimdor, our services are in high demand. Take Melor Stonehoof -- he sent a message he was looking for a new gun, but I've been too busy to respond. I hate to give up a commission but if you'd like to do a good deed, you can craft a Rough Boomstick and deliver it to him over on the Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.",o="Twizwick Sprocketgrind 要你用工程学技能制作 1 把粗制爆破枪，并把订单送到莫高雷雷霆崖的 Melor Stonehoof 那里。",oEN="Twizwick Sprocketgrind wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Rough Boomstick and take the order to Melor Stonehoof at Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="你好，年轻的 <class>。有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Hail, young <class>. How can I help you?",c="Twizwick 好心把这活让给你，好让我早点拿到新枪。请收下这些补给和我的谢意。",cEN="Twizwick was kind to offer you this work so that I could get a new gun sooner. Please, take these supplies and my thanks."}
Q[28452]={d="我知道 Baine Bloodhoof 是酋长之子，而且他讨厌技术。我也承认，如果牛头人对此不满，风险投资公司和探险者协会在莫高雷的所作所为就不算正当。你可不想得罪潜在客户！\n\n风险投资公司一直在往湖里倾倒废料，Baine 可以用一些铜管来帮忙抽走一部分石油和污泥。也许你可以让他看看，工程学（还有哥布林）除了炸东西，也能帮上忙？",dEN="I know Baine Bloodhoof is the chief's son and that he hates technology. And I admit, what the Venture Co. and the Explorer's League are doing in Mulgore ain't ok if the Tauren aren't happy about it. You never want to upset potential customers!\n\nThe Venture Company's been dumping waste in the lake and Baine could use some Copper Tubes to help siphon off some of the oil and muck. Maybe you can show him that engineering (and goblins) can help as well as blow stuff up?",o="Twizwick Sprocketgrind 要你用工程学技能制作 5 根铜管，并把订单送到莫高雷 Bloodhoof 村的 Baine Bloodhoof 那里。",oEN="Twizwick Sprocketgrind wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Copper Tube and take the order to Baine Bloodhoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="有什么我能帮你的吗，<class>？",pEN="How can I help you, <class>?",c="<Baine 听你解释 Twizwick 的想法。>\n\n我不信任这个哥布林，但我不会拒绝别人的援手，尤其如果你也认为装上这套……你刚才是怎么说的？管道？——是有道理的。\n\n谢谢你告诉我这件事，<name>。",cEN="<Baine listens as you explain Twizwick's idea.>\n\nI don't trust this goblin, but I will not refuse an offer of help, especially if you agree that there is wisdom in installing this... what did you call it? Plumbing?\n\nThank you for bring this to my attention, <name>."}
Q[28453]={d="自从死亡卫兵开始在丧钟镇唤醒沉睡者以来，找我做工程的人就多得忙不过来，订单多得我根本接不完。\n\n如果你也懂机械，也许能帮忙完成一个订单？Thomas Arlento 负责维护往返提瑞斯法和银松森林的货车，他要两把奥术光扳手来替换磨损的那几把。\n\n如果你能制作几把送给他，我会很感激你的帮助。",dEN="I have found my engineering services much in demand since the Death Guards began waking up the sleeping at Deathknell. So much so, that I have more orders than I can handle.\n\nIf you have a mechanical bent yourself, perhaps you could help out with an order? Thomas Arlento maintains the carts that travel through Tirisfal and Silverpine, and he requested a couple Arclight Spanners to replace ones that are worn out.\n\nIf you could craft and deliver some to him, I would appreciate your assistance.",o="Graham Van Talen 要你用工程学技能制作 2 把奥术光扳手，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地 Brill 的 Thomas Arlento 那里。",oEN="Graham Van Talen wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Arclight Spanner and take the order to Thomas Arlento at Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="最后说一次，不，我们不出租货车给私人聚会！",pEN="For the last time, no we don't rent carts for private parties!",c="哦，我的订单！谢谢你，工程师。来，这些是我从报废货车上留下的备用零件。",cEN="Oh, my order! Thank you, engineer. Here, take some leftover parts I kept from decommissioned carts."}
Q[28454]={d="我这儿有一份 Deathguard Linnea 的订单，她就驻扎在幽暗城外的路上。城东更远处的农场遭到了天灾的侵袭，她想要一些粗制炸药来……做点什么？我不知道，我只管做和送。这单你能接吗？",dEN="I have an order from Deathguard Linnea, who is camped on the road just outside the Undercity. They've had some Scourge incursions at the farms farther east of town and she'd like some Rough Dynamite to... do something? I don't know, I just craft and deliver. Could you handle this one?",o="Graham Van Talen 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个粗制炸药，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地幽暗城以东营地的 Deathguard Linnea 那里。",oEN="Graham Van Talen wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Rough Dynamite and take the order to Deathguard Linnea at her camp east of the Undercity in Tirisfal Glades.",p="我从没想过安保会用到炸药，但时代在变。",pEN="I never thought security would involve explosives, but times change.",c="谢谢你，工程师。我想问题已经在掌控之中了……不过知道有这东西留作后备，万一情况升级也安心些。",cEN="Thank you, engineer. I think I have the problem in hand... but it is a comfort to know I have this in reserve if the situation escalates."}
Q[28455]={d="我被授权为黑暗游侠征调所需物资。你是工程师，对吧？我需要一个粗糙的瞄准镜，给在 Olsen's Farthing 侦察的 Sam Yorick。那个位置能让他占尽优势，狙击任何从南面袭击瑟伯切尔的东西。如果你能制作两个送给他，我们会给你报酬。",dEN="I have been given the authority to requisition items needed by the Deathstalkers. You're an engineer, right? I could use a Crude Scope for Sam Yorick, who is scouting at Olsen's Farthing. That position will give him a good advantage to snipe anything that attacks the Sepulcher from the south. If you're able to craft and deliver a couple to him, we'd compensate you.",o="Guillaume Sorouy 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个粗糙的瞄准镜，并把订单送到银松森林 Olsen's Farthing 的 Sam Yorick 那里。",oEN="Guillaume Sorouy wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Crude Scope and take the order to Sam Yorick at Olsen's Farthing in Silverpine Forest.",p="我以黑暗女士的名义向你致意。",pEN="I greet you in the name of the Dark Lady.",c="谢谢你，工程师。我期望有了这套装备，我的爆头成功率能提高三倍。这是 Guillaume 提到的补给。",cEN="Thank you, engineer. I expect to increase my headshot success thricefold with this equipment. Here are the supplies Guillaume mentioned."}
Q[28456]={d="作为黑暗游侠的物资采购员，我还想请你为 Rane Yorick 制作一副敏捷虎纹护目镜。她独自一人走在从瑟伯切尔向北的那条路上，这副护目镜能保护她的眼睛不被污泥和毒辣的阳光所伤。如果你能好心送给她，我会很感激。",dEN="As the requisitioner for the Deathstalkers, I'd also like to request you craft Rane Yorick a pair of Agile Tiger Goggles. She walks the road that runs north from the Sepulcher all by herself, and those goggles will protect her eyes from muck and the harsh sun. If you'd be kind enough to deliver them to her, I'd appreciate it.",o="Guillaume Sorouy 要你用工程学技能制作 1 副敏捷虎纹护目镜，并把订单送到银松森林 Ivar Patch 的 Rane Yorick 那里。",oEN="Guillaume Sorouy wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Agile Tiger Goggles and take the order to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch through Silverpine Forest.",p="我以黑暗游侠的名义向你致意。",pEN="I greet you in the name of the Deathstalkers.",c="我很感激 Guillaume 和你的帮助。我会好好用这副护目镜的。这些是我收集来的一些补给，也许你用得上。",cEN="I appreciate Guillaume's assistance and yours. I will put these goggles to good use. Here are some supplies I've scavenged that you might find useful."}
Q[28457]={d="卡利姆多这儿大多数人并不真正了解工程学的力量，但他们知道自己想要我们做的东西。这意味着我们垄断了市场，活多得干不完。就说十字路口的队长 Sergra Darkthorn 吧。她在找训练假人。我手上一件都没有，不过如果你有兴趣做几个，我敢说她不会亏待你。",dEN="Most of these Kalimdor folks don't really know the power of engineering, but they know they want some of what we make. That means we've got a lock on the market and more work than we can handle. Take Sergra Darkthorn, the captain up in the Crossroads. She's looking for Target Dummies. I didn't have any on hand, but if you're interested in crafting some, I'm sure she'd make it worth your while.",o="Gazlowe 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个训练假人，并把订单送到贫瘠之地十字路口的 Sergra Darkthorn 那里。",oEN="Gazlowe wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Target Dummy and take the order to Sergra Darkthorn at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",p="训练假人？是的，我是在找一些。大多数新兵拿平原陆行鸟练手，可我们有那么几个\"特殊\"巨魔，需要不会还手的东西。",pEN="Target Dummies? Yes, I was looking for some. While most recruits cut their teeth on plainstriders, we have a few \"special\" trolls who need something that doesn't fight back.",c="要把这些新兵中的一部分磨练成部落的战斗力量会是个挑战，但我会试试。谢谢你，<class>！",cEN="It will be a challenge to mold some of these recruits into a fighting force for the Horde, but I will try. Thank you, <class>!"}
Q[28458]={d="另一件我手上没货的东西是银触媒，不过住在北面黄金之路上的一位哥布林想买一些。她说可以等送货。我不知道她在做什么，但我知道，如果你能给 Wenikee Boltbucket 弄到一些银触媒，是能赚到钱的。",dEN="Another thing I don't keep in stock is Silver Contact, but a goblin who lives on the north Gold Road was interested in buying some. Said she could wait for delivery. I don't know what she's working on, but I do know there's some coin to be made if you can rustle up some Silver Contact for Wenikee Boltbucket.",o="Gazlowe 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个银触媒，并把订单送到贫瘠之地北面黄金之路上 Wenikee Boltbucket 的家中。",oEN="Gazlowe wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Silver Contact and take the order to Wenikee Boltbucket at her home on the northern Gold Road in the Barrens.",p="今天真是鼓捣机械的好日子，<race>！",pEN="It's a fine day for tinkering, <race>!",c="哦……对……银触媒。我可以用它们做……东西。\n\n<Wenikee 偷偷把那叠银片塞进衬衫里，鼓鼓囊囊的。>\n\n谢谢你！",cEN="Oh... yes... the Silver Contact. I can use them to make... stuff.\n\n<Wenikee furtively conceals the stack of silver sheets in her shirt, which bulges out.>\n\nThank you!"}
Q[28459]={d="你好，<class>。我知道有点奇怪，一个铁匠居然向工程师求助，但我得让熔炉一直烧着。为此我需要五个铜质调节器。如果你能帮忙，我很乐意在你的报酬之外再给你一笔小费。",dEN="Hail, <class>. I know it's a bit strange, a Blacksmith asking for help from an Engineer, but I have to keep the forge running. To do so, I need five Copper Modulators. I'm happy to give you a tip on top of your fee if you can help me out.",o="Tatternack Steelforge 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个铜质调节器，并把订单送到贫瘠之地 Taurajo 营地的 Tatternack Steelforge 那里。",oEN="Tatternack Steelforge wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Copper Modulator and take the order to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",p="所以……调节器带动转轴，转轴带动轮子，轮子让风箱下沉，然后……哦，抱歉。我没看见你在那儿。",pEN="So... the modulator turns the shaft, which turns the wheel, which makes the bellows go down and then... oh, sorry. Didn't see you there.",c="谢谢你，<name>。这是我攒下给你当小费的一些补给。",cEN="Thanks for this, <name>. And here's some supplies I've saved up as a tip for you."}
Q[28460]={d="说到帮忙，我收到一张匿名字条，要一些练习锁。我不知道谁会想要那个，但这里没人有做这活的手艺。如果你想多赚点钱，字条让我把它们放在南面黄金之路旁一个地方，靠近一座被烧毁的部落瞭望塔。",dEN="Speaking of help, I received an anonymous note requesting some Practice Locks. I don't know who would be interested in that but there's no one here with the skill to make some. If you're looking to make a bit more coin, the note instructed me to drop them in a location off the Southern Gold Road, near a burned down Horde watchtower.",o="Tatternack Steelforge 要你用工程学技能制作 5 把练习锁，并把订单送到贫瘠之地南面黄金之路旁一座被烧毁的瞭望塔处的 Blusht 那里。",oEN="Tatternack Steelforge wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Practice Lock and take the order to Blusht at a burned down watchtower off the Southern Gold Road in the Barrens.",p="你看不见我，<class>。",pEN="You can't see me, <class>.",c="谢谢。还有，我从没来过这里。",cEN="Thanks. And, I was never here."}
Q[28461]={d="大酋长派我来整顿这个据点，我发现要做的事太多了。我们有骑兵斥候，但碎木岗哨本地的侦察装备却很少。\n\n你是工程师，对吧？我需要一个华丽望远镜来监视道路，也盯着点工人。我付钱。",dEN="The warchief sent me here to get this post in order, and I've found that there is much to be done. We have outriders but little scouting gear here at Splintertree itself.\n\nYou're an engineer aren't you? I could use an Ornate Spyglass to watch the road and to keep an eye on the workers. I'll pay.",o="Xirith 要你用工程学技能制作 1 个华丽望远镜，并把订单送到灰谷碎木岗哨的 Xirith 那里。",oEN="Xirith wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Ornate Spyglass and take the order to Xirith at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="那个望远镜拿到了吗？",pEN="Do you have that spyglass?",c="<Xirith 叹了口气。> 我跟战歌的人解释过，光靠\"干活\"、\"干活\"是赢不了灰谷的。这需要战术和筹划。不过作为工程师，你应该很懂计划这回事。\n\n谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="<Xirith sighs.> I have tried explaining to the Warsong that we can't just \"work\", \"work\" our way to victory in Ashenvale. It requires tactics and planning. But, as an engineer, you should know all about plans.\n\nThank you, <class>."}
Q[28462]={d="嘿，<class>。我们派了一名先遣斥候去东边的海上，他的任务是保障我们的食物补给。我听说有种叫流体动力鱼饵的诱饵能帮他们在海里钓鱼。我当然想尝尝刚捕上来的鲜鱼！你认识会做那东西的人吗？",dEN="Hey, <class>. We sent an advance scout out to the ocean to the east, and they are charged with securing our food supplies. I've heard that there's a lure called an Aquadynamic Fish Attractor that could help them catch fish in the ocean. I'd sure like some fresh-caught fish! You don't know anyone who can make those, do you?",o="Gharash 要你用工程学技能制作 10 个流体动力鱼饵，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽 Misty Reed 哨站的 Tok'Kar 那里。",oEN="Gharash wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 10 Aquadynamic Fish Attractor and take the order to Tok'Kar at Misty Reed Post in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="钓鱼？你凭什么觉得我们对钓鱼感兴趣？",pEN="Fishing? What makes you think we're interested in fishing?",c="<Gharash 咕哝着。>\n\n我不觉得站在那儿等吃的算什么光荣的事，不过要是我们走投无路，我或许会试试。这些是我们囤的一些补给，算作谢礼。",cEN="<Gharash grumbles.>\n\nI don't think standing around waiting for food is an honorable activity, but if we are desperate I might give it a try. Here are some supplies we've stockpiled as thanks."}
Q[28463]={d="嘿，你是工程师吗？太好了！我正准备让我的商队重新上路，但需要两个标准瞄准镜，这样这次我一看见那些半人马就能撂倒他们。你能帮我吗？",dEN="Hey, you an engineer? Hot damn! I'm getting ready to get my caravan back on the road but I'm in need of a couple Standard Scopes so this time I can pop those centaur as soon as I see them coming. Can you help me out?",o="Wizlo Bearingshiner 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个标准瞄准镜，并把订单送到千针石林 Whitereach 哨站的 Wizlo Bearingshiner 那里。",oEN="Wizlo Bearingshiner wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Standard Scope and take the order to Wizlo Bearingshiner at Whitereach Post in Thousand Needles.",p="这跟我的新爆破枪正好配！",pEN="This'll go nicely with my new boomstick!",c="感谢你愿意帮助一个可怜的落难哥布林。我想这些我从商队补给里拿到的零件对你会派上用场。",cEN="I appreciate your willingness to help a poor stranded goblin. I believe you'll find these parts that I have from my caravan supplies to be useful."}
Q[28464]={d="我自己就是工程师，但现在没空接活。我有自己的项目要做，可这挡不住别人来求我帮忙！\n\n我需要有人搭把手，更确切地说，是 Ziz Fizziks 需要你搭把手。\n\n如果你能制作一些重型炸药，可以送到 Windshear Crag 下面 Fizziks 的工坊。",dEN="I'm an engineer myself but I'm not available for hire right now. I've got my own project to work on, but that doesn't stop people from asking me for help!\n\nI could use a hand, or more specifically, Ziz Fizziks could use your hands.\n\nIf you're able to craft some Heavy Dynamite, you can drop it at Fizziks' workshop down in Windshear Crag.",o="Ditsy Springsocket 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个重型炸药，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Windshear Crag 的 Ziz Fizziks 那里。",oEN="Ditsy Springsocket wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Heavy Dynamite and take the order to Ziz Fizziks at Windshear Crag in Stonetalon Mountains..",p="你想干什么，<class>？我这儿忙着呢！",pEN="What do you want, <class>? I'm busy here!",c="嗯，迟到总比不来好！反正我要炸的东西也没长腿跑掉。谢了，<class>。",cEN="Well, better late than never! Not like the stuff I want to blow up has moved. Thanks, <class>."}
Q[28465]={d="你好，<name>！见到工程师同行总是件好事，哪怕你也是部落的一员。\n\n说到这个……Grom'gol 的 Commander Aggro'gosh 捎来字条，要一些大号青铜炸弹。虽然我在阵营冲突中表面上保持中立，但我更希望这单由部落工程师来完成。那就是你！",dEN="Greetings, <name>! It's always nice to see a fellow engineer, even if you are also part of the Horde.\n\nSpeaking of... Commander Aggro'gosh at Grom'gol sent a note requesting some Big Bronze Bombs. While I am, ostensibly, neutral in the faction conflict, I'd rather this order were filled by a Horde engineer. That means you!",o="Oglethorpe Obnoticus 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个大号青铜炸弹，并把订单送到荆棘谷 Grom'gol 的 Commander Aggro'gosh 那里。",oEN="Oglethorpe Obnoticus wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Big Bronze Bomb and take the order to Commander Aggro'gosh at Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="你的炸弹做好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Do you have those bombs done yet, <name>?",c="谢谢。这是你的报酬。\n\n我真心希望我们不必用上这些，但有备无患总好过临阵缺手。",cEN="Thank you. Here is your payment.\n\nI sincerly hope we don't have to use these but, better to have extra than to be wanting."}
Q[28466]={d="Tharg 不是最聪明的食人魔，但 Tharg 会注意东西。影子和光，亮和暗。Tharg 想知道时间。Tharg 不会看钟，但 Tharg 知道旋钮式同步器对时间有用。给 Tharg 带很多旋钮式同步器，Tharg 就有很多时间！",dEN="Tharg not smartest ogre, but Tharg notice stuff. Shadows and light, bright and dark. Tharg wonder about time. Tharg not know how to tell time but Tharg know Gyrochronatom is useful for time. Bring Tharg many Gyrochronatom so Tharg have lots of time!",o="Tharg 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个旋钮式同步器，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽 Brackenwall 村的 Tharg 那里。",oEN="Tharg wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Gyrochronatom and take the order to Tharg at Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="时间是敞开的圆圈？什么意思？",pEN="Time is open circle? Wut mean?",c="梦里听到的，Tharg 想。低语声说着时间。现在 Tharg 拥有世上所有的时间。Tharg 谢谢你。",cEN="Heard in dream, Tharg thinks. Whispers about time. Now Tharg have all the time in the world. Tharg thank you."}
Q[28467]={d="欢迎来到 Shadowprey。你是工程师，对吧？看你手指上那些奥术光扳手磨出的茧子就知道了。愿意接一个还没人接的订单吗？\n\n有个住在科多兽坟场的哥布林想买一些坚固炸药。我对哥布林工程师向来抱有一份职业上的敬意，可这位是炼金师……我实在想不出他要炸药做什么。你要是想要这个订单，就全归你了！",dEN="Welcome to Shadowprey. You're an engineer aren't you? I can tell by those arclight spanner calluses on your fingers. Care to fill an open order?\n\nThere's a goblin who lives down in the Kodo Graveyard who asked to buy some Solid Dynamite. Now I have a healthy professional respect for goblin engineers, but this one is an alchemist.... I don't know what he could possibly want dynamite for. If you want this order, it's all yours!",o="Tukk 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个坚固炸药，并把订单送到凄凉之地科多兽坟场的 Hornizz Brimbuzzle 那里。",oEN="Tukk wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Solid Dynamite and take the order to Hornizz Brimbuzzle at Kodo Graveyard in Desolace.",p="骨头……那些干骨头……骨头……哦，你好！",pEN="Bones... them dry bones... bones... oh, hi!",c="很好，太好了。这个实验我已经等了很久。你能把幽灵炸飞吗？没人知道，但也许我们离答案又近了一步。\n\n总之，这是你的报酬。",cEN="Yes, good. I've been waiting for this for one of my experiments. Can you blow up a ghost? No one knows, but we may be one step closer to finding out.\n\nAnyway, here's your payment."}
Q[28468]={d="我很惊讶 Galamav 竟然不用任何装备来辅助射击。我想他只是不知道工程学能怎么帮他——比如一副高聚焦护目镜！你该不会正好知道哪里能弄到一副吧？",dEN="I was quite surprised that Galamav uses no gear to help with his marksmanship. I think he is simply unaware of what engineering can do to help him -- such as a pair of Hyper-Focused Goggles! You don't happen to know where I could get a pair, do you?",o="Neeka Bloodscar 要你用工程学技能制作 1 副高聚焦护目镜，并把订单送到荒芜之地 Kargath 的神射手 Galamav 那里。",oEN="Neeka Bloodscar wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 1 Hyper Focused Goggles and take the order to Galamav the Marksman at Kargath in Badlands.",p="我向你致意，<class>。",pEN="I greet you, <class>.",c="这是你做的？真有意思。我看看它们能不能提高我的准头。来，请收下这些补给作为报酬。",cEN="You made these? How interesting. I shall see if they improve my aim. Here, please take these supplies as compensation."}
Q[28469]={d="你钓鱼吗，<name>？我很爱钓鱼，但一群邪枝巨魔把我从最爱的钓点赶走时，我丢了我最喜欢的钓竿。\n\n镇上没有工程师，所以我不知道什么时候才能弄到新的。要是你碰巧遇到一些秘银管，也许会想到你的朋友 Katoom，嗯？我可以用一些来做根新钓竿。",dEN="You fish, <name>? I love fishing but I be losin' my favorite pole when some Vilebranch trolls chased me out of my favorite fishing spot.\n\nThere's no engineer in town so I be unsure when I'll get a new one. If you happen to come across some mithril tubes, perhaps you'll think of your friend Katoom, hmm? I could use some to make a new pole.",o="Katoom the Angler 要你用工程学技能制作 5 根秘银管，并把订单送到辛特兰 Revantusk 村的 Katoom the Angler 那里。",oEN="Katoom the Angler wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Mithril Tube and take the order to Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in Hinterlands.",p="那些巨魔确实够「邪」的。嘿嘿嘿。",pEN="Those trolls were VILE indeed. He he he.",c="一整套全新的秘银管给我？太感谢你了！我迫不及待想试试。",cEN="A brand new set of mithril tubes for me? I be thankin' you! Can't wait to try it out."}
Q[28470]={d="我要训练的新兵很多，<name>，盔甲却不够分。那些等着盔甲锻好的新兵只能小心对练以免受伤。这就需要你了——你到来的消息早就传开了，说你有工程学的手艺。我需要一些高级训练假人给我的新兵。你能帮忙吗？",dEN="I have many Grunts to train, <name>, and not enough armor to go around. Those who are waiting for their armor to be smithed must spar carefully to avoid injury. That's where you come in -- word of your engineering skill preceeded your arrival. I require some Advanced Target Dummies for my recruits. Can you assist?",o="Remi Coldeye 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个高级训练假人，并把订单送到塔纳利斯 Anje'watha 的 Remi Coldeye 那里。",oEN="Remi Coldeye wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Advanced Target Dummy and take the order to Remi Coldeye at Anje'watha in Tanaris.",p="训练假人拿到了吗？",pEN="Do you have the training dummies?",c="感谢你及时处理此事，<name>。这是你的报酬。为了部落！",cEN="I appreciate your prompt attention to this matter, <name>. Here is your payment. For the Horde!"}
Q[28471]={d="你是工程师吗？抱歉……你看起来就像。\n\n不久前有位哥布林来找我，要一些不稳定的扳机。我这儿没有那类补给现货，不过他说如果有工程师路过，他会待在 Gluk 的营地。要是你敢穿过森林赶到那里，也许是个赚钱的好机会！",dEN="Are you an engineer? Sorry... you just have the look of one.\n\nA goblin came to me not long ago, looking for some Unstable Triggers. I don't carry those types of supplies in stock, but he mentioned that he would be staying at Gluk's Compound if an engineer came by. Might be a good chance to make some coin if you can brave the forest to get there!",o="Sheendra Tallgrass 要你用工程学技能制作 5 个不稳定的扳机，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Gulk 营地的 Viggo 那里。",oEN="Sheendra Tallgrass wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 5 Unstable Trigger and take the order to Viggo at Gulk's Compound in Feralas.",p="哦……嗯……你是谁？",pEN="Oh... hmm... who are you?",c="有位好心人告诉了你我需要不稳定的扳机。真傻……我是说，太棒了！是的，我确实需要一些扳机。这些看起来还能用。\n\n你怎么还在这儿？哦，报酬。对。拿着这些零碎东西，继续走你的快活路吧。",cEN="A kind soul told you of my need for Unstable Triggers. How fooli... I mean, how marvelous! Yes, I am in need of some triggers. These appear to be in working order.\n\nWhy are you still here? Oh, payment. Right. Here, take these bits and bobs and move on your merry way."}
Q[28472]={d="哦！一位工程师！你指甲缝里的污垢我一眼就认得！\n\n话说，你接活吗？我在翡翠圣地的时候，有位暗夜精灵想买一些致命瞄准镜。出于良心我不能卖给暗夜精灵，但她是塞纳里奥议会的人。你要是对这活感兴趣，沿着路往南就能找到她。",dEN="Oh! An engineer! I'd recognize the grime beneath your fingernails anywhere!\n\nSay, are you for hire? When I was down in Emerald Sanctuary, a night elf asked to buy some Deadly Scopes. I can't in good conscience sell to a night elf, but she is part of the Cenarion Circle. If you're interested in this job, you'll find her south down the road.",o="Altsoba Ragetotem 要你用工程学技能制作 2 个致命瞄准镜，并把订单送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的 Jessir Moonbow 那里。",oEN="Altsoba Ragetotem wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 2 Deadly Scope and take the order to Jessir Moonbow at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="我以塞纳里奥议会的名义向你致意。",pEN="I greet you in the name of the Cenarion Circle.",c="感谢你愿意帮助我，<race>。议会只想了结费伍德森林这里的腐化。这需要部落和联盟共同努力。",cEN="I appreciate your willingness to assist me, <race>. The Circle only wishes to end the corruption here in Felwood. That will take the efforts of both the Horde and Alliance."}
Q[28473]={d="每天开饭的时候，我听到的全是鱼人的威胁。这个 Mrrrggglll，那个 wharrrgbl。血卫士 Glush 对它们简直着魔了。\n\n我们镇上的熔炉还没法做工程学的东西，不过如果你愿意在别处做一些高爆炸弹送给 Glush，也许他就会觉得\"鱼人威胁\"已经解决，闭上嘴了！",dEN="Every day at chow time, all I hear about is the threat of murlocs. Mrrrggglll this and wharrrgbl that. Blood Guard Glush is obsessed with them.\n\nWe don't have our forge set up to do any engineering in town but if you're willing to make some Hi-Explosive Bombs elsewhere and deliver them to Glush, perhaps he'd feel safe from the \"murloc threat\" and shut up about it!",o="Gruul Darkblade 要你用工程学技能制作 20 个高爆炸弹，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Valormok 的血卫士 Glush 那里。",oEN="Gruul Darkblade wants you to use your engineering skill to craft 20 Hi-Explosive Bomb and take the order to Blood Guard Glush at Valormok in Azshara.",p="该死的……鱼人。",pEN="Foul... murlocs.",c="我会消灭艾萨拉的每一个鱼人。只要大酋长下令。谢谢你这些炸弹，<class>。\n\n<Glush 冲你露出一个狰狞的笑容。>",cEN="I will destroy every murloc in Azshara. If the Warchief commands it. Thank you for these bombs, <class>.\n\n<Glush gives you a menacing smile.>"}
Q[28474]={d="Kharanos 很快挤满了年轻的新兵，个个急着证明自己。而训练带来的是淤青、擦伤，还有多于理智的自尊。\n\n我们的绷带储备快见底了。你要是能给我带 20 个亚麻绷带，我们就能继续处理这些轻伤，免得它们变成更糟的麻烦。",dEN="Kharanos is fillin' fast with young and fresh recruits, all eager to prove themselves. And with trainin' comes bruises, scrapes, and more pride than sense.\n\nOur bandage stores are runnin' low. If ye can bring me 20 Linen Bandages, we can keep treatin' these minor injuries before they turn into somethin' worse.",o="Thamner Pol 要你用急救技能制作 20 个亚麻绷带，并把订单送到丹莫罗 Kharanos 的 Thamner Pol 那里。",oEN="Thamner Pol wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Linen Bandage and take the order to Thamner Pol at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="我们还有伤口要包扎，绷带却没了。你把补给带来了吗？",pEN="We still have wounds tae bind and no bandages to do it. Have ye brought the supplies?",c="正是时候。这些能帮我们在小家伙们的轻伤变成大问题之前照料好他们。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="Just in time. These will help us tend the young'uns before their small wounds become real problems. Ye have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[28475]={d="我收到 Remtravel 挖掘场考古学家 Everit 的消息，说他们挖出的魔像出了几起小事故。\n\n你懂得用急救包扎伤口的手艺吗？如果懂，能否准备一些重型亚麻绷带，送到挖掘场给 Everit？沿着路往南走相当远。",dEN="I received word from Archaeologist Everit at Remtravel's Excavation that there have been a few minor mishaps with the golems they unearthed.\n\nDo you know the art of binding wounds with first aid? If so, could you prepare a number of Heavy Linen Bandages and deliver them to Everit at the excavation site? It's rather far down the road to the south.",o="Archaeologist Hollee 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型亚麻绷带，并把订单送到黑海岸 Remtravel 挖掘场的 Archaeologist Everit 那里。",oEN="Archaeologist Hollee wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Linen Bandage and take the order to Archaeologist Everit at Remtravel's Excavation in Darkshore.",p="你是带着补给来的吗？Remtravel 的热情在往外漏——血也是。",pEN="Are ye here with supplies? Remtravel's leaking enthusiasm -- and blood.",c="太好了。这能让 Remtravel 保持完整，久到足以再去惹恼别的东西。你帮了我们所有人，<class>。",cEN="Excellent. This'll keep Remtravel in one piece long enough to aggravate somethin' else. You've done us all a service, <class>."}
Q[28476]={d="我懂我的毒药，<class>。我研究过、调配过、也解过。而在这片森林里？你最好做好应付一两次蜘蛛咬伤的准备。\n\n说到蜘蛛咬伤，守夜人正需要一些实用的物资。带 3 剂解毒剂给守望者 Dodds。不算讲究，但能让他的巡逻队站着，而不是死在沟里。",dEN="I know my poisons, <class>. I studied 'em, brewed 'em, cured 'em. And in this forest? You'd better be ready to handle a spider bite or two.\n\nThe Night Watch could use some practical resources when it comes to spider bites. Take 3 doses of Anti-Venom to Watcher Dodds. It's not fancy, but it'll keep his patrol on their feet instead of dead in a ditch.",o="Brink Spannercrank 要你用急救技能制作 3 剂解毒剂，并把订单送到暮色森林中部守夜人营地的 Watcher Dodds 那里。",oEN="Brink Spannercrank wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 3 Anti-Venom and take the order to Watcher Dodds at the Night Watch Camp in central Duskwood.",p="这片森林在黑暗里不安全，<class>。而如今这里永远是黑的。",pEN="These woods aren't safe in the dark, <class>. And it is always dark here, now.",c="哈！正是我们需要的。Brink 也许古怪，但他懂他的药方。谢谢你送来。",cEN="Hah! Just what we needed. Brink might be odd, but he knows his remedies. Thanks for the delivery."}
Q[28477]={d="喂，你背包里那些是绷带吗？我们正需要你帮忙。有几个卫兵在山脊附近过于冒进，一头撞上了兽人巡逻队。他们现在都回到 Lakeshire 了，不过嘛……有几位短期内是没法再出去站岗了。\n\n我们的医疗物资不够。你要是能给我带 20 个毛料绷带，我会确保送到卫兵手里。他们能活着已是万幸——让我们保住这份幸运。",dEN="Say, are those bandages in your pack? We could use your help. Some of the guards got too bold near the ridge and ran straight into an orc patrol. They're back in Lakeshire now, but well... some of them won't be going out on guard again for a while.\n\nWe're short on medical supplies. If you can bring me 20 Wool Bandages, I'll make sure they get to the guards. They're lucky to be alive -- let's keep them that way.",o="Amy Davenport 要你用急救技能制作 20 个毛料绷带，并把订单送到赤脊山 Lakeshire 的 Amy Davenport 那里。",oEN="Amy Davenport wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Wool Bandage and take the order to Amy Davenport at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="空着手是治不了伤的。那些绷带你有吗？",pEN="We can't treat wounds with empty hands. Do you have those bandages?",c="这些帮的忙比你想的多。只要有休息和妥善照料，我们的卫兵很快就能重新站起来——也许还会多几分谨慎。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="These'll help more than you know. With rest and proper care, our guards will be back on his their feet soon -- maybe with a bit more caution. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28478]={d="炼金术很了不起。有治烧伤的药水，有止痛的药剂，有增力的饮剂……但对某些伤口来说，有时我们真正需要的只是一条干净的布和一双稳的手。\n\n这个哨站没有常驻治疗者，<class>。所以我请你给我带 20 个重型毛料绷带。手头有物资，我们就能处理小伤，把炼金材料留给要紧的事。",dEN="Alchemy is marvelous. There are potions for burns, elixirs for pain, draughts for strength... but for some wounds, sometimes all we really need is a clean strip of cloth and steady hands.\n\nThere are no healers stationed at this outpost, <class>. Therefore, I ask you to bring me 20 Heavy Wool Bandages. With supplies on hand, we can mend the small wounds and save our alchemical supplies for serious matters.",o="Centrica Nightsong 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型毛料绷带，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Stonetalon 林地的 Centrica Nightsong 那里。",oEN="Centrica Nightsong wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Wool Bandage and take the order to Centrica Nightsong at Stonetalon Grove in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="再好的治疗者也需要东西来包扎伤口。绷带你带来了吗？",pEN="Even the best healer needs something to wrap around a wound. Do you have the bandages?",c="很好。简单、可靠，正是我们需要的。你帮的忙比你知道的更多，<class>。",cEN="Good. Simple, reliable, and exactly what we needed. You've helped more than you know, <class>."}
Q[28479]={d="双足飞龙盘踞在森林边缘的高空。它们的毒刺又快又狠，若不迅速处理就会致命。我们已经损失了两匹驮马，还差点失去一名斥候。\n\n看得出来，你擅长急救。我需要 3 剂强效解毒剂。下一个被蜇的生物也许撑不到毒发之前赶回来，我们必须做好准备。",dEN="Wyverns roam the high skies here on the edge of the forest. Their stings are fast, cruel, and fatal if you don't act quickly. We've already lost two pack horses and almost lost a scout.\n\nYou're skilled with First Aid, I can tell. I need 3 doses of Strong Anti-Venom. The next creature stung might not make it back before the venom does its work, and we must be prepared.",o="Rendow 要你用急救技能制作 3 剂强效解毒剂，并把订单送到千针石林 Thalanaar 的 Rendow 那里。",oEN="Rendow wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 3 Strong Anti-Venom and take the order to Rendow at Thalanaar in Thousand Needles.",p="毒不会等人，<name>。",pEN="The poison doesn't wait, <name>.",c="这正是我们需要的。这能让下一个倒霉的家伙继续喘气。你办到了，我很感激，<name>。",cEN="That's what we needed. This'll keep the next unlucky creature breathing. You came through, and I appreciate it, <name>."}
Q[28480]={d="避难所的这些流亡者已经承受了太多。疾病、伤痛，加上从破碎世界而来的漫长旅途，他们已经没剩什么可以用来疗伤了。\n\n如果你能匀出 20 个重型丝绸绷带，我会确保送到最需要的德莱尼手中。东西不多，但哪怕只是一块柔软的布，也能带来希望。",dEN="The exiles here at the Harborage have endured much. Between sickness, wounds, and the long journey from a shattered world, they've little left for healing.\n\nIf you can spare 20 Heavy Silk Bandages, I'll see they reach the neediest draenei. It's not much, but even a simple soft cloth can bring hope.",o="旅店老板 Finmir 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型丝绸绷带，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽避难所的旅店老板 Finmir 那里。",oEN="Innkeeper Finmir wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Silk Bandage and take the order to Innkeeper Finmir at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="拜托——如果你有绷带，请带来。",pEN="Please -- bring the bandages if you have them.",c="谢谢你。这些能减轻痛苦，也提醒我们没有被遗忘。在这片陌生的土地上，这比你想象的更重要。",cEN="Thank you. These will ease pain and remind us we're not forgotten. In this unfamiliar land, that matters more than you know."}
Q[28481]={d="是 Tyrande Whisperwind 亲自派我来研究那些在此安家的古代暗夜精灵的。但我发现菲拉斯的废墟既古老又危险。落石、尖根、苔藓下藏着的东西。要好好研究它们，我就得为小伤做好准备。\n\n出发前我还有很多要整理，正需要你帮忙。给我带 20 个魔纹绷带。我不会因为擦伤和扭伤就中止远征，但也不会让它们得不到处理。",dEN="I've been sent by Tyrande Whisperwind herself to study the ancient night elves who made a home here. But I've found that the ruins in Feralas are ancient and dangerous. Falling stone, sharp roots, hidden things beneath the moss. If I'm going to study them properly, I need to be ready for small injuries.\n\nI have much to review before setting out and I could use your assistance. Bring me 20 Mageweave Bandages. I won't halt the expedition over scrapes and sprains, but I won't let them go untreated, either.",o="Bethan Bluewater 要你用急救技能制作 20 个魔纹绷带，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Feathermoon 要塞的 Bethan Bluewater 那里。",oEN="Bethan Bluewater wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Mageweave Bandage and take the order to Bethan Bluewater at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="我有活要干，<name>。你愿意帮忙吗？",pEN="I have a job to do, <name>. Will you help?",c="多谢你，<class>。愿艾露恩保佑你。",cEN="You have my thanks, <class>. May Elune bless you."}
Q[28482]={d="我不像从前那么利索了，<name>，而大海可不在乎。在外面划破一道口子，很快就会恶化。船长处理完港口的生意就要我随时出海。我呢？我想在再爬桅杆之前歇一会儿。\n\n我知道了！给我带 20 个丝绸绷带，行吗？我还能挥得动弯刀，只是如今要维持完整，需要多些帮手。",dEN="I'm not as quick as I used to be, <name>, and the sea doesn't care. One scratch out there can turn sour fast. Captain wants me ready to sail as soon as he's taken care of his business in port. Me? I'd like some rest before I have to climb the rigging again.\n\nI know! Bring me 20 Silk Bandages, would you? I can still swing a cutlass, but I need a bit more help staying patched together these days.",o="Gavik Grimesail 要你用急救技能制作 20 个丝绸绷带，并把订单送到荆棘谷 Booty Bay 的 Gavik Grimesail 那里。",oEN="Gavik Grimesail wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Silk Bandage and take the order to Gavik Grimesail at Booty Bay in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="哎哟。我可不再是二十岁了。",pEN="Oof. I'm not twenty anymore.",c="真的很感谢。来，这点东西聊表谢意。",cEN="Appreciate it, truly. And here, a little something for your troubles."}
Q[28483]={d="恶魔以火焰和暗影来袭。我们在战斗，但伤口太多。\n\n我听说过你们的医药，还有不用草药和魔法就能疗伤的布。我想试试。给我带 20 个重型魔纹绷带，我要看看你们的方法能不能帮到我的人民。",dEN="Demons strike with fire and shadow. We fight, but wounds are many.\n\nI have heard of your medicine and cloth that heals without herbs or magic. I would try this. Bring me 20 Heavy Mageweave Bandages, and I will see if your ways help my people.",o="大酋长 Ungarl 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型魔纹绷带，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Blackmaw 村的大酋长 Ungarl 那里。",oEN="High Chief Ungarl wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Mageweave Bandage and take the order to High Chief Ungarl at Blackmaw Village in Azshara.",p="你谈的是治疗，但我需要证据。",pEN="You speak of healing, but I need proof.",c="这些带着暖意。疼痛在消退。也许你们这一族懂的确实不止钢铁与火焰。你帮了我们。",cEN="These hold warmth. The pain fades. Perhaps your kind does know more than steel and fire. You have helped us."}
Q[28484]={d="很高兴在这里见到有你这样手艺的人，<class>。Jaylssa 还没能站起来。在外面伤到她的不只是牙齿和爪子。那背后有股狂怒，她康复需要很长时间。\n\n为了稳住她的状况，我几乎用光了所有绷带储备。我们还需要更多。你要是能给我带 20 个符文布绷带，对她恢复大有帮助。",dEN="I'm glad to see someone of your skill here, <class>. Jaylssa's still not back on her feet. Whatever hit her out there wasn't just teeth and claws. It had fury behind it and her recovery will be long.\n\nI've gone through most of our stock of bandages keeping her stable. We could use more. If you can bring me 20 Runecloth Bandages, it'll go a long way towards helping her recover.",o="Leakey Cartspark 要你用急救技能制作 20 个符文布绷带，并把订单送到安戈洛环形山 Terror Run 的 Leakey Cartspark 那里。",oEN="Leakey Cartspark wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Runecloth Bandage and take the order to Leakey Cartspark at Terror Run in Un'Goro Crater.",p="我们的物资还是不够。她需要那些绷带——尽快。",pEN="We're still short on supplies. She needs those bandages -- soon.",c="感谢你的帮助，<name>。如果有什么我能回报你的，尽管告诉我。",cEN="I'm grateful for this assistance, <name>. Let me know if there is anything I can do to help you in return."}
Q[28485]={d="别可怜我，<class>。我的生命正走向尽头……伤口太多，光太少。但还有一线希望，虽然微弱。\n\n如果你能给我带 20 个重型符文布绷带，也许我还能撑得够久……久到再看一次林地上的日出。",dEN="Do not pity me, <class>. My life draws to its end... too many wounds, too little light. But there is a sliver of hope, faint though it is.\n\nIf you can bring me 20 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, perhaps I can hold on long enough... long enough to see one more sunrise over the glade.",o="Mulgris Deepriver 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型符文布绷带，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地 Writing Haunt 的 Mulgris Deepriver 那里。",oEN="Mulgris Deepriver wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Runecloth Bandage and take the order to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writing Haunt in Western Plaguelands.",p="我感到终点临近了。求你……如果你有绷带，现在就带来。",pEN="I feel the end nearing. Please... if you have the bandages, bring them now.",c="疼痛减轻了。若这真是我的终点，至少还能忍受。谢谢你。",cEN="The pain lessens. If it is to be my end, at least it will be bearable. Thank you."}
Q[28486]={d="营地里很快挤满了年轻的战士，新生的蹄子，个个急着证明自己。而训练带来的是淤青、擦伤，还有多于理智的自尊。\n\n我们的绷带储备快见底了。你要是能给我带 20 个亚麻绷带，我们就能继续处理这些轻伤，免得它们变成更糟的麻烦。",dEN="The camps are filling fast with young warriors, fresh hooves, all eager to prove themselves. And with training comes bruises, scrapes, and more pride than sense.\n\nOur bandage stores are running low. If you can bring me 20 Linen Bandages, we can keep treating these minor injuries before they turn into something worse.",o="Vira Younghoof 要你用急救技能制作 20 个亚麻绷带，并把订单送到莫高雷 Bloodhoof 村的 Vira Younghoof 那里。",oEN="Vira Younghoof wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Linen Bandage and take the order to Vira Younghoof at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="我们还有伤口要包扎，绷带却没了。你把补给带来了吗？",pEN="We still have wounds to bind and no bandages to do it. Have you brought the supplies?",c="正是时候。这些能帮我们在小家伙们的轻伤变成大问题之前照料好他们。多谢你，<name>。",cEN="Just in time. These will help us tend the young ones before their small wounds become real problems. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[28487]={d="你要是打算出去寻找那些失踪的黑暗游侠，就该考虑为他们可能的需要做准备。\n\n我说的是重型亚麻绷带，<class>。你该做上一叠带着，去找 Yorick 夫妇时用得上。",dEN="If you're going to go out seeking those missing Deathstalkers, you should consider preparing for their possible needs.\n\nI'm talking about Heavy Linen Bandages, <class>. You should whip up a stack and take them with you when you look for the Yoricks.",o="High Executor Hadrec 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型亚麻绷带，并把订单送到银松森林北部农场的 Rane Yorick 那里。",oEN="High Executor Hadrec wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Linen Bandage and take the order to Rane Yorick at the farms in northern Silverpine Forest.",p="你是带着补给来的吗？很好。Quinn 的热情在往外漏——血也是。",pEN="Are you here with supplies? Good. Quinn's leaking enthusiasm -- and blood.",c="太好了。这能帮我处理我们受的轻伤。要是它能把我们所有的问题都解决就好了。",cEN="Excellent. This'll help me with the minor wounds we sustained. If only it solved all our problems."}
Q[28488]={d="我懂我的毒药，<class>。它们是这片土地自卫的手段之一，而在这片群山里？你最好做好应付蜘蛛咬伤或双足飞龙毒刺的准备……说不定两样都来！\n\n驻扎在这里的新兵在毒药方面需要一些实用的物资。带 3 剂解毒剂给 Maggran Earthbinder。我们就用毒物本身的来源来治它。",dEN="I know my poisons, <class>. They are one of the land's defenses, and in these mountains? You'd better be ready to handle a spider bite or wyvern sting... if not both!\n\nThe Grunts stationed here could use some practical resources when it comes to poisons. Bring 3 doses of Anti-Venom to Maggran Earthbinder. We shall use the source of the poison to heal it.",o="Tammra Windfield 要你用急救技能制作 3 剂解毒剂，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Sun Rock 隐居地的 Maggran Earthbinder 那里。",oEN="Tammra Windfield wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 3 Anti-Venom and take the order to Maggran Earthbinder at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="离开隐居地时小心点，<class>。这些山坡上潜伏着许多危险。",pEN="Watch yourself when you leave the Retreat, <class>. Many dangers lurk in these slopes.",c="哈！正是我们需要的。Tammra 懂她的药方。谢谢你送来。",cEN="Hah! Just what we needed. Tammra knows her remedies. Thanks for the delivery."}
Q[28489]={d="喂，你背包里那些是绷带吗？我正需要你帮忙。我想去荒野闯一闯，但得先备些物资。一把武器、一些食物，还有一件你能帮上忙的事！\n\n我的医疗物资不够。你要是能给我带 20 个毛料绷带，我会确保好好使用。我能活着已是万幸——让我们保住这份幸运。",dEN="Say, are those bandages in your pack? I could use your help. I want to brave the wilds, but there some supplies I need first. A weapon, some food, and something you could help with!\n\nI'm short on medical supplies. If you can bring me 20 Wool Bandages, I'll make sure I put them to good use. I'm lucky to be here -- let's keep it that way.",o="Kaliyah Stormshew 要你用急救技能制作 20 个毛料绷带，并把订单送到贫瘠之地 Taurajo 营地的 Kaliyah Stormshew 那里。",oEN="Kaliyah Stormshew wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Wool Bandage and take the order to Kaliyah Stormshew at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",p="空着手是治不了伤的。那些绷带你有吗？",pEN="I can't treat wounds with empty hands. Do you have those bandages?",c="这些帮的忙比你想的多。我快准备好了。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="These'll help more than you know. I'm almost ready. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28490]={d="炼金术很了不起，<name>。有治烧伤的药水，有止痛的药剂，有增力的饮剂……但对某些伤口来说，有时我们真正需要的只是一条干净的布和一双稳的手。\n\n我的物资太宝贵，不能浪费在治疗药水上。所以我请你给我带 20 个重型毛料绷带。手头有物资，我们就能处理卫兵的小伤，把炼金材料留给要紧的事。",dEN="Alchemy is marvelous, <name>. There are potions for burning, elixirs for pain, draughts for strength... but for some wounds, sometimes all we really need is a clean strip of cloth and steady hands.\n\nMy supplies are too precious to be wasted on healing potions. Therefore, I ask you to bring me 20 Heavy Wool Bandages. With supplies on hand, we can mend the guards' small wounds and save our alchemical supplies for serious matters.",o="Apothecary Lydon 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型毛料绷带，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Tarren Mill 的 Apothecary Lydon 那里。",oEN="Apothecary Lydon wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Wool Bandage and take the order to Apothecary Lydon at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="再好的治疗者也需要东西来包扎伤口。绷带你带来了吗？",pEN="Even the best healer needs something to wrap around a wound. Do you have the bandages?",c="很好。简单、可靠，正是我们需要的。你帮的忙比你知道的更多，<class>。现在那些死亡卫兵来求我帮忙时，我就能叫他们滚远点了！",cEN="Good. Simple, reliable, and exactly what we needed. You've helped more than you know, <class>. Now I can tell those Deathguards to take a hike when they ask for my help!"}
Q[28491]={d="双足飞龙盘旋在千针石林的高空。虽然我很喜欢它们，但得承认它们的毒刺又快又狠，若不迅速处理就会致命。我们最近损失了两头驮运用的科多兽，还差点失去一名斥候。\n\n看得出来，你擅长急救。我需要 3 剂强效解毒剂。下一个被蜇的生物也许撑不到毒发之前赶回来，我们必须做好准备。",dEN="Wyverns roam the high skies here in the Needles. While I adore them, I must admit that their stings are fast, cruel, and fatal if you don't act quickly. We've recently lost two pack kodos and almost lost a scout.\n\nYou're skilled with First Aid, I can tell. I need 3 doses of Strong Anti-Venom. The next creature stung might not make it back before the venom does its work, and we must be prepared.",o="Elu 要你用急救技能制作 3 剂强效解毒剂，并把订单送到千针石林 Freewind Post 的 Elu 那里。",oEN="Elu wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 3 Strong Anti-Venom and take the order to Elu at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",p="毒不会等人，<name>。",pEN="The poison doesn't wait, <name>.",c="这正是我们需要的。这能让下一个倒霉的家伙继续喘气。你办到了，我很感激，<name>。",cEN="That's what we needed. This'll keep the next unlucky creature breathing. You came through, and I appreciate it, <name>."}
Q[28492]={d="我浑身都疼，<class>，但别想用治疗魔法碰我。我一点也不想要这所谓的\"圣光\"。\n\n普通医术就能治好我的伤，否则我宁可接受死亡。如果你能匀出 20 个重型丝绸绷带，我也许还能重新站起来。",dEN="My body aches, <class> but do not think to touch me with healing magic. I do not want any part of this \"Light\".\n\nConventional medicine will work for my wounds, or I'll accept death. If you can spare 20 Heavy Silk Bandages, I may be able to get back on my feet.",o="Bengor 要你用急救技能制作 20 个重型丝绸绷带，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽 Stonard 的 Bengor 那里。",oEN="Bengor wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Heavy Silk Bandage and take the order to Bengor at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="拜托——如果你有绷带，请带来。",pEN="Please -- bring the bandages if you have them.",c="谢谢你。这些能减轻我的痛苦。在这片荒凉的土地上，这比你想象的更重要。",cEN="Thank you. These will ease my pain. In this inhospitable land, that matters more than you know."}
Q[28493]={d="史学家派我来研究那些在此安家的古代暗夜精灵，但我发现菲拉斯的废墟既古老又危险。要好好研究它们，我就得为小伤做好准备。我一直在这里等着补给寄来，可不知为何一直没到。\n\n出发前我还有很多要整理，需要你帮忙加快进度。给我带 20 个魔纹绷带。我不会因为擦伤和扭伤就中止远征，但也不会让它们得不到处理。",dEN="I've been sent by the Lorespeakers to study the ancient night elves who made a home here, but I've found that the ruins in Feralas are ancient and dangerous. If I'm going to study them properly, I need to be ready for small injuries. I've been waiting here for the mail of additional supplies, but for some reason they haven't arrived.\n\nI have much to review before setting out and I could use your assistance to speed things up. Bring me 20 Mageweave Bandages. I won't halt the expedition over scrapes and sprains, but I won't let them go untreated, either.",o="Blaise Montgomery 要你用急救技能制作 20 个魔纹绷带，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Mojache 营地的 Blaise Montgomery 那里。",oEN="Blaise Montgomery wants you to use your firstaid skill to craft 20 Mageweave Bandage and take the order to Blaise Montgomery at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="我有活要干，<name>。你愿意帮忙吗？",pEN="I have a job to do, <name>. Will you help?",c="多谢你，<class>。愿黑暗女士看顾你。",cEN="You have my thanks, <class>. Dark Lady watch over you."}
Q[28494]={d="我的小杂鱼卖光了。今早最后几条卖给了一个看样子愿意为它们打一架的厨子。\n\n你要是有鱼竿和稳当的手，我需要一批新鲜的货。给我带 20 条新鲜的闪光小鳍鱼。这附近的人都指望我货源不断，我可不想开始把人拒之门外。",dEN="I'm clean out of smallfish. Sold the last of 'em this morning to a cook who looked ready to fight for it.\n\nIf you've got a rod and a steady hand, I could use a fresh haul. Bring me 20 Raw Brilliant Smallfish. Folks around here expect me to stay stocked, and I'd rather not start turning them away.",o="Jason Mathers 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的闪光小鳍鱼，并把订单送到艾尔文森林水晶湖的 Jason Mathers 那里。",oEN="Jason Mathers wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Brilliant Smallfish and take the order to Jason Mathers at Crystal Lake in Elwynn Forest.",p="除非你钓满了一整批小鳍鱼，否则我眼前还是个空货架。",pEN="Unless you've got a full catch of smallfish, I'm still staring at an empty inventory.",c="这才叫一批货。色泽好，收拾得干净……这些很快就能卖出去。你还真有一手！",cEN="Now that's a haul. Good color, clean catch... these'll sell fast. You've got a knack for this!"}
Q[28495]={d="我已经向暴风城请求为我们的人增拨食物，可换来的只有官样文章的推诿。人民军需要的是蛋白质，不是承诺。\n\n我们的物资又不够了，而现在新鲜的鱼比腌肉更容易弄到。你有鱼竿。能帮我填饱这么多张饥饿的嘴吗？可以的话，钓 20 条新鲜的滑皮鲭鱼送到哨兵岭给我。",dEN="I've requested more food for our people from Stormwind, but all I get in return is bureaucratic red tape. The People's Militia needs protein, not promises.\n\nWe're short on supplies again, and fresh fish is easier to come by than salted meat right now. You've got a pole. Can you help me fill all these hungry mouths? If you can, catch and deliver 20 Raw Slitherskin Mackerel to me here at Sentinel Hill.",o="Protector Gariel 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的滑皮鲭鱼，并把订单送到西部荒野哨兵岭的 Protector Gariel 那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Slitherskin Mackerel and take the order to Protector Gariel at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="那要不是满满一批鲭鱼，我们就还是空着肚子。",pEN="If that's not a full catch of mackerel, we're still running on empty.",c="这够一两支巡逻队吃了。干得好。今晚民兵们能吃饱，全靠你。",cEN="That'll feed a patrol or two. Good work. The Militia eats tonight thanks to you."}
Q[28496]={d="今早我把最后一点泥鳅鲷做成了菜。还没到中午就卖光了！加点香料、热锅一煎，大家怎么吃都吃不够。\n\n你要是有空钓鱼，给我带 20 条新鲜的长嘴泥鳅鲷。烹饪交给我——你只管保证供货不断。",dEN="Cooked up the last of my mud snapper this morning. Sold out before midday! Folks can't get enough of it with a bit of spice and a hot pan.\n\nIf you've got time to fish, bring me 20 Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper. I'll handle the cooking -- you just keep the supply coming.",o="Hal McAllister 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的长嘴泥鳅鲷，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Southshore 的 Hal McAllister 那里。",oEN="Hal McAllister wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper and take the order to Hal McAllister at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="没有鲷鱼就没有晚饭。钓到鱼再来吧。",pEN="No snapper, no supper. Come back when you've got the fish.",c="新鲜、紧实，大小刚刚好。这些直接上火了。你只要继续送这样的鱼来，我就继续卖到脱销。谢谢你，<name>！",cEN="Fresh, firm, and just the right size. These'll go straight on the fire. You keep bringing fish like this, and I'll keep selling out. Thanks, <name>!"}
Q[28497]={d="你是这地方新来的<fisherman/fisherwoman>？来比试一场怎么样？你还没学会挂饵的时候，我就在这片湖里钓湖心狂鱼了。你觉得你能赢过我的渔获？\n\n给我带 20 条湖心狂鱼，让我们看看你有几斤几两。只是等我还是钓上当天最大那条时，你可别不高兴。",dEN="Ye a new <fisherman/fisherwoman> in these parts? How about a bit o' sport? I've been reeling in Loch Frenzies since before ye could bait a hook. Think ye can beat my haul?\n\nBring me 20 Loch Frenzy and let's see what yer made of. Just don't be upset when I still catch the biggest one of the day.",o="Warg Deepwater 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的湖心狂鱼，并把订单送到洛克莫丹湖畔的 Warg Deepwater 那里。",oEN="Warg Deepwater wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Loch Frenzy and take the order to Warg Deepwater at the Loch in Loch Modan.",p="二十条狂鱼，少一条都不算数。你可没那么容易赖掉。",pEN="Twenty Frenzies or it doesn't count. You're not wriggling out of this that easy.",c="这才叫渔获。行吧，我承认——你确实有点本事。下一轮我请……除非你怕输。",cEN="Now that's a catch. Alright, I'll admit it -- ye got some skill. Next round's on me... unless you're scared to lose."}
Q[28498]={d="Maestra 哨站的哨兵一直物资短缺，尤其是任何新鲜的东西。日夜侦察的时候，肉干能顶的用处也就那么多。\n\n我们需要 20 条新鲜的鼠尾鱼。清淡、有营养，还容易用小火烧着吃。你要是能弄来，我保证一点都不浪费。",dEN="The Sentinels at Maestra's Post have been running low on supplies, especially anything fresh. Dried meat only goes so far when you're scouting day and night.\n\nWe could use 20 Raw Sagefish. Light, nourishing, and easy to cook over a small flame. If you can bring them in, I'll make sure none of it goes to waste.",o="Sentinel Onaeya 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的鼠尾鱼，并把订单送到灰谷 Maestra 哨站的 Sentinel Onaeya 那里。",oEN="Sentinel Onaeya wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Sagefish and take the order to Sentinel Onaeya at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.",p="我感激你的努力，但斥候们没法吃下好意。我还是需要那些鼠尾鱼。",pEN="I appreciate the effort, but the scouts can't eat good intentions. I still need that sagefish.",c="好极了。新鲜又干净。这些够驻扎在此的哨兵吃上一顿好饭了。愿艾露恩的光辉照亮你的道路，<class>。",cEN="Perfect. Fresh and clean. These will make a fine meal for the Sentinels stationed here. May Elune's radiance light your path, <class>."}
Q[28499]={d="我从藏宝海湾一直钓到黑暗深渊，可从没钓上过一条彩虹鳍金枪鱼。据说它们像日出一样闪光，味道还要好上一倍。\n\n给我带 20 条新鲜的彩虹鳍金枪鱼。我想亲眼看看一条，剩下的也许就下锅炸了。我很好奇你会用什么调味？",dEN="I've caught fish from Booty Bay to Blackfathom, but I've never reeled in a Rainbow Fin Albacore. Word is, they shimmer like a sunrise and taste twice as fine.\n\nBring me 20 Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore. I want to see one for myself, and maybe fry the rest. I wonder what you season them with?",o="Kilxx 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的彩虹鳍金枪鱼，并把订单送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的 Kilxx 那里。",oEN="Kilxx wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore and take the order to Kilxx at Ratchet in the Barrens.",p="你身上是有一股鱼腥味，没错，但你没有我要的那些鱼。",pEN="You smell like fish, sure, but you don't have the ones I asked for.",c="你看看这个……鱼鳍鲜亮，大小完美。这够做一两顿好饭了。你该得一点报酬。",cEN="Would you look at that... brilliant fins, perfect size. These'll make a fine meal or three. You've earned a bit of a reward."}
Q[28500]={d="你可曾只是坐在水边听一听？乐趣就在那儿。不是金币，也不是渔获。只是那份平静和那一甩。\n\n不过……要是你碰巧弄到一些新鲜的石鳞鳕鱼，我也不反对。它们让我想起自己当初为什么开始钓鱼。",dEN="You ever just sit by the water and listen? That's where the joy is. Not the gold, not the catch. Just the calm and the cast.\n\nStill... if you happen to rustle up some Raw Rockscale Cod, I wouldn't say no. They remind me why I started fishing in the first place.",o="老 Heming 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的石鳞鳕鱼，并把订单送到荆棘谷藏宝海湾的老 Heming 那里。",oEN="Old Man Heming wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Rockscale Cod and take the order to Old Man Heming at Booty Bay in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="鳕鱼还不够。耐心点，朋友……就像大海，它是一波一波来的。",pEN="Not enough cod yet. Patience, friend... like the sea, it comes in waves.",c="这样的石鳞鳕鱼是来自大海的馈赠。看得出来，你是用心在钓鱼。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Rockscale cod like this is a gift from the sea. You fish with heart, I can tell. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[28501]={d="别的哥布林都在外面挖矿、砍树，或者炸点什么来赚钱。外行。\n\n你不能无视陆地到头、海水开始这件事。利润也一样！只要你懂该钓什么，海里满是金子。比如油腻的黑嘴鱼。炼金师为它出高价。\n\n给我带 20 条油腻的黑嘴鱼，我就能让这些踩地的家伙看看，聪明的钱是从浪里来的。",dEN="Those other goblins are out here digging, chopping, or blowing something up for profit. Amateurs.\n\nYou can't ignore that the land ends and the water begins. And so does profit! The sea's full of gold if you know what to catch. Like Oily Blackmouth. Alchemists pay top coin for it.\n\nBring me 20 Oily Blackmouth and I'll show these land-stompers that smart money comes from the waves.",o="Smeed Scrabblescrew 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条油腻的黑嘴鱼，并把订单送到凄凉之地 Scrabblescrew 营地的 Smeed Scrabblescrew 那里。",oEN="Smeed Scrabblescrew wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Oily Blackmouth and take the order to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp in Desolace.",p="没有黑嘴鱼？那我还是身无分文，你还是浑身湿透。",pEN="No Blackmouth? Then I'm still broke and you're soggy.",c="这才叫一批货！油亮、光鲜，随时能转手赚钱。你负责弄鱼，我负责谈生意。",cEN="Now that's a haul! Slick, shiny, and ready to flip for profit. You bring the fish, I'll bring the deals."}
Q[28502]={d="在 Astranaar 的家里，我们看重鼠尾鱼那种简单、细腻、含蓄的味道。我从没想过会在奥特兰克这里找到它们，更没想到会更大！\n\n这些大鼠尾鱼是记忆与惊喜的馈赠。请给我带 20 条新鲜的大鼠尾鱼。我想看看那味道是不是还像我记忆中的一样。",dEN="Back home in Astranaar, we prized the sagefish for its simple, delicate, subtle flavor. I never expected to find them here in Alterac, and certainly not larger!\n\nThese Greater Sagefish are a gift of memory and surprise. Bring me 20 Raw Greater Sagefish, please. I want to see if the taste holds up to what I remember.",o="Simone Cantrell 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的大鼠尾鱼，并把订单送到奥特兰克山脉 Ravenholdt 庄园的 Simone Cantrell 那里。",oEN="Simone Cantrell wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Greater Sagefish and take the order to Simone Cantrell at Ravenholdt Manor in Alterac Mountains.",p="我需要完整的一批，才能知道这些鱼骨子里是不是真带着家的味道。",pEN="I need the full catch to know if these fish truly carry home in their bones.",c="和我认识的那些如此相像……却又更胜一筹。你今天带回来的不只是鱼。谢谢你。",cEN="So much like the ones I knew... and yet, more. You've brought back more than fish today. Thank you."}
Q[28503]={d="我住在沼泽里，所以大家都以为我喜欢水。让我把话说清楚。我不喜欢。又冷又湿，还钻得到处都是。\n\n但鱼呢？鱼我确实喜欢。尤其是鲶鱼。\n\n给我带 20 条新鲜的硬须鲶鱼，也许我就能忘掉我那双湿透的靴子。",dEN="I live in a swamp, so folks assume I like water. Let me clear that up. I don't. It's cold, it's wet, and it gets everywhere.\n\nBut fish? I do like fish. Especially catfish.\n\nBring me 20 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish and maybe I can forget my soggy boots.",o="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的硬须鲶鱼，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽 Swamplight 庄园的\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl 那里。",oEN="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish and take the order to \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at Swamplight Manor in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你喜欢猫吗？",pEN="Do you like cats?",c="这就是我要的。谢谢，<name>。",cEN="This is what I asked for. Thanks, <name>."}
Q[28504]={d="Elune'ara 湖里秘银头鳟鱼泛滥成灾。它们挤走了其他鱼群，弄脏了芦苇，扰乱了湖水的平衡。\n\n我们得减少它们的数量。你要是会钓鱼，给我带 20 条新鲜的秘银头鳟鱼。你既是在帮生态系统，也是在帮我们的餐桌。",dEN="Lake Elune'ara is overrun with Mithril Head Trout. They're crowding out the other schools, fouling the reeds, and upsetting the balance of the lake.\n\nWe need to thin their numbers. If you can fish, bring me 20 Raw Mithril Head Trout. You'll be helping the ecosystem and our dinner table.",o="Moren Riverbend 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的秘银头鳟鱼，并把订单送到月光林地 Nighthaven 的 Moren Riverbend 那里。",oEN="Moren Riverbend wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Mithril Head Trout and take the order to Moren Riverbend at Nighthaven in Moonglade.",p="湖里的鳟鱼还是太多。你不带来满满一批，我们就看不到平衡。",pEN="Still too many trout in the lake. We won't see balance until you bring a full haul.",c="这该能起点作用了。鱼鳍少一点，麻烦就少一点——顺带还有几顿好饭。干得好。",cEN="That should make a difference. Fewer fins, fewer problems -- and a few good meals, too. Well done."}
Q[28505]={d="Gluk 的执法者喜欢吃肉！也喜欢吃鱼！你有竿，你钓得好。你给 Gluk 的朋友们带很多新鲜的斑点黄尾鱼来。那我们就也当你是朋友。",dEN="Gluk's Enforcers like meat! Also like fish! You got pole, you fish good. You bring me many Raw Spotted Yellowtail for Gluk's friends. We think you a friend too then.",o="Mek'nell 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的斑点黄尾鱼，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Gluk 营地的 Mek'nell 那里。",oEN="Mek'nell wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Spotted Yellowtail and take the order to Mek'nell at Gluk's Compound in Feralas.",p="你有鱼吗？",pEN="You got fish?",c="鱼好！肚子不再咕咕叫。执法者不再问我鱼什么时候到。这让我高兴。",cEN="Fish good! Stomach no growl anymore. Enforcers stop asking me when fish get here. Makes me happy."}
Q[28506]={d="流放是苦涩的。冰冷的石头，古老的幽灵，锅里没有一点热气。\n\n但我记得阳鳞鲑鱼的味道。肥美、金黄，满是早已被遗忘的河流的暖意。给我带 20 条新鲜的阳鳞鲑鱼，我就能记起比阴影更好的东西……哪怕只是一顿饭的工夫。",dEN="Exile is bitter. Cold stone, old ghosts, and no warmth in the pot.\n\nBut I remember the taste of Sunscale Salmon. Rich, gold, full of warmth from rivers long forgotten. Bring me 20 Raw Sunscale Salmon, and I'll remember something better than shadows... if only for a meal.",o="阿塔莱流放者要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的阳鳞鲑鱼，并把订单送到辛特兰 Shadra'Alor 的阿塔莱流放者那里。",oEN="Atal'ai Exile wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Sunscale Salmon and take the order to Atal'ai Exile at Shadra'Alor in the Hinterlands.",p="没有鲑鱼？那流放的味道还跟往常一样——空空的。",pEN="No salmon? Then exile tastes the same as always -- empty.",c="细嫩的鱼肉，闪亮的鳞片……是的。有那么一刻，我不再孤单。你今天做的远不止喂饱我，<class>。",cEN="Soft flesh, shining scales... yes. For a moment, I am not alone. You've done more than feed me today, <class>."}
Q[28507]={d="喂，你背包上绑着的是鱼竿吗？我想问问，你能不能帮我们一个忙？\n\nJaylssa 的伤让我们在荒野里待得比计划久，新鲜食物已经吃完了。虽然我们不会饿死，可日复一日同样的口粮有点……嗯，无聊！\n\n我们需要点新鲜的东西。不用太讲究！只要你愿意帮我们钓一些新鲜的红鳃鱼就行。",dEN="Say, is that a fishing pole strapped to your pack? I wonder if you could do us a favor?\n\nJaylssa's injury has left us out in the wilderness longer than we planned and we are out of fresh food. While we won't starve, the same rations day in and day out are a bit... well, boring!\n\nWe could use something fresh. Nothing too fancy! Just some Raw Redgill, if you're willing to fish some up for us.",o="Leakey Cartspark 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的红鳃鱼，并把订单送到安戈洛环形山 Terror Run 的 Leakey Cartspark 那里。",oEN="Leakey Cartspark wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Redgill and take the order to Leakey Cartspark at Terror Run in Un'Goro Crater.",p="果然，饿着肚子是不容易痊愈的。",pEN="It turns out that hungry bellies don't heal easily.",c="哦，我真不知道该怎么谢你才好，<name>。我们这儿还有很多别的物资，让我分一些给你吧。",cEN="Oh, I can't thank you enough for these, <name>. We have plenty of other supplies here, so let me share some of them with you."}
Q[28508]={d="科赞的财团头目们说：「别光坐着等你的船进港。」\n\n可我那条船晚点了，而我现在确实就只是坐在这儿。所以我想——那不如吃点东西。\n\n给我带 20 条新鲜的光滑的强效鱼。它们个头大、味道好，也让我除了咬自己的神经之外有点别的东西可嚼。",dEN="The Cartel chiefs in Kezan say, “Don't just sit around waiting for your ship to come in.”\n\nWell, mine's late, and I'm definitely just sitting here. So, I figured -- might as well eat.\n\nBring me 20 Raw Glossy Mightfish. They're big, tasty, and give me somethin' to chew on besides my nerves.",o="Yorba Screwspigot 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的光滑的强效鱼，并把订单送到塔纳利斯 Steamwheedle 港口的 Yorba Screwspigot 那里。",oEN="Yorba Screwspigot wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Glossy Mightfish and take the order to Yorba Screwspigot at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="原来是我那个蠢弟弟搞的鬼。哦，你回来了？",pEN="Turns out my idiot brother probably had something to do with it. Oh, you're back?",c="这才像样！又大又亮，滋味十足。肚子填饱了，那条船晚到多久我大概都不会在意了。",cEN="Now that's more like it! Big, shiny, and full of flavor. With a full belly, I might not even notice how late that boat is."}
Q[28509]={d="我得承认，当初动身回卡拉赞时，我并没太考虑自己可能需要的「野外口粮」到底有多少。我带了不少腌制品，可……跟我在城里吃的比起来根本不算什么，更别提庄园里的了。\n\n我可不是钓鱼的料——太潮湿，虫子太多。但你要是能给我带 20 条新鲜的白鳞鲑鱼，我会很感激能吃到一顿不是从罐子里出来的饭。",dEN="I'll admit, when I set out to return to Karazhan, I didn't quite consider the full scope of “field provisions” I might need. I brought plenty of preserves, but... they're nothing compared to what I was eating in town, let alone the Manor.\n\nI’m not exactly the fishing type -- too damp, too buggy. But if you could bring me 20 Raw Whitescale Salmon, I'd be grateful for a meal that didn't come from a jar.",o="Ariden Ellis 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的白鳞鲑鱼，并把订单送到逆风小径 Ariden 营地的 Ariden Ellis 那里。",oEN="Ariden Ellis wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Whitescale Salmon and take the order to Ariden Ellis at Ariden's Camp in Deadwind Pass.",p="我还靠腌胡萝卜过活呢，朋友。拜托告诉我你找到鲑鱼了。",pEN="Still living off pickled carrots, friend. Please tell me you've found the salmon.",c="哦，谢天谢地。新鲜、松软，一点盐渍的硬壳都没有。你既救回了我的胃口，也救回了我的神志。",cEN="Oh, thank the stars. Fresh, flaky, and not a single brine crust. You've rescued both my appetite and my sanity."}
Q[28510]={d="我在躲避那些该死的血精灵时把一切都丢了——笔记、工具、零食。连我最喜欢的叉子都还没找到。\n\n我现在真正需要的是一顿像样的饭。你要是能给我带 20 只黑爪龙虾，至少在我琢磨下一步该怎么办的时候，肚子里能有点热乎的。",dEN="I lost everything -- notes, tools, snacks -- while fleeing those cursed blood elves. Still haven't even found my favorite fork.\n\nWhat I could really use right now is a proper meal. If you can bring me 20 Darkclaw Lobster, I'll at least have something warm in my belly while I figure out what I'm going to do next.",o="Kim'jael 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 只黑爪龙虾，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Legash 营地的 Kim'jael 那里。",oEN="Kim'jael wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Darkclaw Lobster and take the order to Kim'jael at Legash Encampment in Azshara.",p="我还是在这儿挨冻、挨饿，而且没有叉子。",pEN="I'm still out here cold, hungry, and forkless.",c="多汁、壳厚，而且没被法力之火烤焦！这些正合适。多谢你，<name>。我能叫你 <name> 吗？\n\n哦，对了，你要是找到一把叉齿弯了的银叉子，那也是我的。",cEN="Juicy, thick-shelled, and not charred by mana fire! These'll do nicely. You've got my thanks, <name>. Can I call you <name>?\n\nOh, and if you find a silver fork with a bent tine, that's mine too."}
Q[28511]={d="学生们变得……躁动不安。他们的胃口和野心一样贪得无厌——要是我再碰上仪式厅里有人晕倒一次，我可能就得牺牲掉他们中的一个了。而且他们还不够肥。\n\n给我带 20 条新鲜的夜鳞鲷鱼。它滋补、好做，还能让他们的头脑保持足够敏锐，省得我一次要片太多条。",dEN="The students grow... restless. Their appetites are as insatiable as their ambition -- and if I have to deal with another fainting spell in the ritual chamber, I may sacrifice one of them. And they're not nearly plump enough yet.\n\nBring me 20 Raw Nightfin Snapper. It's nourishing, easy to prepare, and keeps their minds sharp enough that I don't have to fillet too many at a time.",o="Isabelle Pickman 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的夜鳞鲷鱼，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地 Caer Darrow 的 Isabelle Pickman 那里。",oEN="Isabelle Pickman wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Nightfin Snapper and take the order to Isabelle Pickman at Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands.",p="我更愿意他们吃鱼，而不是互相吃。",pEN="I prefer them eating fish over each other.",c="啊，太好了。这该能喂饱这些小恶魔了——至少撑到下一次召唤。你为学院立了大功。",cEN="Ah, lovely. This should keep the little fiends fed -- at least until the next summoning. You've done the Academy a great service."}
Q[28512]={d="没有什么比得上水面的寂静、鱼线的轻扯、抛竿之间的宁静。这是与大地母亲和她所有造物的交流方式。\n\n如果你和我一样享受钓鱼，就给我带 20 条新鲜的闪光小鳍鱼。不为交易，不为钱财，只为分享收获的喜悦。",dEN="There's nothing quite like the stillness of the water, the tug on the line, the quiet between the casts. It is a way of communing with the Earthmother and all her creations.\n\nIf you enjoy fishing as much as I do, bring me 20 Raw Brilliant Smallfish. Not for trade. Not for coin. Just to share the joy of the catch.",o="Uthan Stillwater 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的闪光小鳍鱼，并把订单送到莫高雷 Bloodhoof 村的 Uthan Stillwater 那里。",oEN="Uthan Stillwater wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Brilliant Smallfish and take the order to Uthan Stillwater at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="你想待多久都行。",pEN="You're welcome to stay as long as you like.",c="漂亮的小鱼。谢谢你。很高兴知道还有人在湖水的节奏里找到安宁。",cEN="Beautiful little fish. Thank you. It's good to know others still find peace in the rhythm of the lake."}
Q[28513]={d="很多人说得好像自己会钓鱼，其实不过是吹牛。言语对海浪没什么意义。算数的是渔获。\n\n你觉得你有本事吗？给我带 20 条新鲜的滑皮鲭鱼，让我看看你是不是只有鱼饵和虚张声势。",dEN="Plenty of folk talk like they know how to fish but it's nothing more than tall tales. Words mean little to the waves. It's the catch that counts.\n\nThink you've got what it takes? Bring me 20 Raw Slitherskin Mackerel and show me you're more than just bait and bravado.",o="Killian Sanatha 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的滑皮鲭鱼，并把订单送到银松森林 North Tide's Run 的 Killian Sanatha 那里。",oEN="Killian Sanatha wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Slitherskin Mackerel and take the order to Killian Sanatha at North Tide's Run in Silverpine Forest.",p="等你拿到鲭鱼再来证明吧。",pEN="Come back when you've got the mackerel to prove it.",c="哎呀……这算得上是一批像样的渔获。也许你真懂得怎么用鱼钩。我算是服了。",cEN="Well now... that's a respectable haul. Maybe you do know your way around a hook. Color me impressed."}
Q[28514]={d="活人以为只有亡灵才渴望血肉。但我们的坐骑……它们也渴求肉的味道。\n\n它们再也啃不动干草捆了，但仍然渴望生食。给我带 20 条新鲜的长嘴泥鳅鲷——马儿喜欢看它们扭动。",dEN="The living think it's only the undead who hunger for flesh. But our steeds... they crave the taste of meat, too.\n\nThey can't gnaw bales of hay anymore, but they still crave something raw. Bring me 20 Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper -- the horses like them wriggling.",o="Tara Coldgaze 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的长嘴泥鳅鲷，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Tarren Mill 的 Tara Coldgaze 那里。",oEN="Tara Coldgaze wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper and take the order to Tara Coldgaze at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="它们越来越烦躁。鲷鱼也许能让它们安静下来……只要你带够。",pEN="They're growing restless. Snapper might soothe them... if you bring enough.",c="是的……这正合适。你又让马厩安静了一晚。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Yes... this will do nicely. You've quieted the stables for another night. Thank you, <name>."}
Q[28515]={d="肉我有的是——野猪、科多兽，随便你说。但我嚼腻了肥油、咬够了骨头。\n\n我想吃鱼。给我带 20 条火鳍鲷鱼。要辣的，要新鲜的。要是一批好货，我跟你好好做笔交易。",dEN="Got plenty of meat -- boar, kodo, ya name it. But I'm tired of chewing fat and crunching bone.\n\nI want fish. Bring me 20 Firefin Snapper. Somethin' spicy, somethin' fresh. I'll trade ya proper if it's a good catch.",o="Denni'ka 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条火鳍鲷鱼，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Malaka'jin 的 Denni'ka 那里。",oEN="Denni'ka wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Firefin Snapper and take the order to Denni'ka at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="没有鲷鱼？那我又得回去吃烤焦的科多兽肋排了。",pEN="No snapper? Then it's back to burnt kodo flank for me.",c="这正是我想吃的。你钓鱼是把好手——而我也有点值得跟你交换的东西。",cEN="Now that's what I was craving. You've got a good hand for fishin' -- and I've got something worth tradin' ya."}
Q[28516]={d="嘿，老兄，我听过这森林溪流里有一种叫鼠尾鱼的鱼的传说。据说它们滑溜、机灵，满是古老的魔法……至少是满是滋味。\n\n你能给我带 20 条新鲜的鼠尾鱼吗？我想看看这些传说是不是真的。也看看它们尝起来是不是和听起来一样好。",dEN="Yo mon, I heard stories of fish in de streams of dis forest called Sagefish. It's said they're slippery, clever, and full of old magic... or at least, flavor.\n\nCan ya bring me 20 Raw Sagefish? I want to see if dese tales be true. And if dey taste as good as dey sound.",o="Wik'Tar 要你用钓鱼技能收集 20 条新鲜的鼠尾鱼，并把订单送到灰谷 Zoram'gar 哨站的 Wik'Tar 那里。",oEN="Wik'Tar wants you to use your fishing skill to collect 20 Raw Sagefish and take the order to Wik'Tar at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",p="还没有鼠尾鱼？那它就还只是个故事。",pEN="No sagefish yet? Then it's still just a story.",c="哈！所以它们是真的！你的钩子很利，耳朵更利。多谢了。",cEN="Ha! So they're real! You've got sharp hooks and sharper ears. Much appreciated."}
Q[28517]={d="见习草药师，对吧？想证明你有本事出人头地吗？我们从基础开始。采 20 朵宁神花，送到阿祖拉之塔的 Sarah Templeworth 那里。她正为塔里的法师们张罗些什么，需要这些花，而且你要是偷工减料，她一眼就看得出来。",dEN="Apprentice herbalist, yes? Want to prove you have the skills to succeed? Let's start with the basics. Pick 20 Peacebloom and take them to Sarah Templeworth at the Tower of Azora. She needs them for something she's cooking up for the mages at the tower, and she'll know if you're cutting corners.",o="草药师 Pomeroy 要你用草药学技能采集 20 朵宁神花，并把订单送到艾尔文森林阿祖拉之塔的 Sarah Templeworth 那里。",oEN="Herbalist Pomeroy wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Peacebloom and take the order to Sarah Templeworth at the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest.",p="是有人派你带着我要的宁神花来的吗？",pEN="Did someone send you with my Peacebloom order?",c="十八……十九……二十。看来你的数数能力够得上联盟的标准了。采药愉快，<class>。",cEN="Eighteen... nineteen... twenty. Well, guess your powers of counting are up to the Alliance's standards. Happy herbing, <class>."}
Q[28518]={d="虽然我刚到 Kharanos 不久，但我草药手艺的名声已经传开了。我有好几个还没人接的订单，正需要个帮手。\n\n这儿有一份来自 Amberstill 牧场的。看来他们想要一蒲式耳银叶草给他们的公羊当零食。这单你能接吗？",dEN="Although I have only recently arrived in Kharanos, word of my skill with herbs has already spread. I have several unfilled orders I could use an assistant to help fill.\n\nHere is one from Amberstill Ranch. It seems they would like a bushel of Silverleaf as treats for their rams. Can you handle this?",o="Thedrieth Leafeye 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株银叶草，并把订单送到丹莫罗 Amberstill 牧场的 Veron Amberstill 那里。",oEN="Thedrieth Leafeye wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Silverleaf and take the order to Veron Amberstill at Amberstill Ranch in Dun Morogh.",p="哎，<class>。什么风把你吹到 Amberstill 牧场来了？",pEN="Aye, <class>. What brings you to Amberstill Ranch?",c="啊，我的订单！谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ah, my order! Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28519]={d="我向你致意，草药师同行。也许你想要个任务来磨练手艺？\n\nAlanna Raveneye 是位同行手艺人，在神谕林地练习附魔。她要了一包地根草。这单正适合你来接。",dEN="I bid you welcome, fellow herbalist. Perhaps you would like a task to hone your skills?\n\nAlanna Raveneye is a fellow crafter, practicing her skills with enchanting over at the Oracle Glade. She has requested a parcel of Earthroot. This would be an excellent order for you to fill.",o="Malorne Bladeleaf 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株地根草，并把订单送到泰达希尔神谕林地的 Alanna Raveneye 那里。",oEN="Malorne Bladeleaf wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Earthroot and take the order to Alanna Raveneye at the Oracle Glade in Teldrassil.",p="欢迎来到神谕林地，<class>。",pEN="Welcome to the Oracle Glade, <class>.",c="这太好了。我很喜欢地根草那股泥土的香味，你呢？路上小心。",cEN="This is excellent. I love the loamy smell of earthroot, don't you? Travel safely."}
Q[28520]={d="看你膝盖上的草渍就知道你是草药师。谢天谢地！我刚收到远行者小屋的消息。女猎手 Vyrin Swiftwind 急需魔皇草来清理一处动物咬伤引起的感染。好在你看起来有接这单的手艺。\n\n尽快把 20 株魔皇草送给 Vyrin。我可不想让一位高等精灵失望。他们已经受了太多苦。",dEN="I see by the grass stains on your knees that you're an herbalist. Thank goodness! I've just received a message from Farstrider Lodge. The huntress Vyrin Swiftwind is in desperate need of Mageroyal to cleanse an infection from an animal bite. Fortunately, you look like you have the skills for this request.\n\nTake 20 Mageroyal to Vyrin as soon as you can. I'd hate to fail a High Elf. They've suffered so much already.",o="Kali Healtouch 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株魔皇草，并把订单送到洛克莫丹远行者小屋的 Vyrin Swiftwind 那里。",oEN="Kali Healtouch wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Mageroyal and take the order to Vyrin Swiftwind at Farstrider Lodge in Loch Modan.",p="魔皇草？我就看你是那种乐于助人的。",pEN="Mageroyal? I thought you looked like the helpful sort.",c="啊，好的，谢谢你。我正需要这个。我的伤不重，但有合适的药材会好得更快。",cEN="Ah, yes, thank you. I needed this. My injury is minor, but will heal more quickly with the proper supplies."}
Q[28521]={d="你看得见我吗？你一定是草药师……感谢艾露恩。终于有个能跟我说话的人了！\n\n我在第三次大战中死去了，却被束缚在这个世界上。我有还不了的债，但我仍得尽力而为——或者说，得请你替我做。你能采一些荆棘草，送到通往灰谷的路西边他的小屋给 Lornan Goldleaf 吗？他会知道是谁送来的。",dEN="Can you see me? You must be an herbalist... thank Elune. Finally, someone I can speak with!\n\nI am bound to this world although I died during the Third War. I have debts I cannot repay, but I must still do what I can -- or, I should say, ask you to do it for me. Could you please gather some Briarthorn and deliver it to Lornan Goldleaf at his lodge west of the road to Ashenvale? He will know who it is from.",o="Yalda 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株荆棘草，并把订单送到黑海岸 Goldleaf 小屋的 Lornan Goldleaf 那里。",oEN="Yalda wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Briarthorn and take the order to Lornan Goldleaf at Goldleaf Lodge in Darkshore.",p="我何德何能，竟得你这不速之客登门？",pEN="To what do I owe this unexpected visit?",c="荆棘草……？\n\nYalda……我的爱人。这真是……出乎意料，但我感激得超出你的想象，<class>。谢谢你。",cEN="Briarthorn...?\n\nYalda... my love. This is... unexpected, but appreciated more than you know <class>. Thank you."}
Q[28522]={d="那头该死的野猪 Bellygrub 又跑到我的草药园里来了。这次它把我所有的迅捷蓟都吃了！\n\n要补种园子，我需要更多迅捷蓟插条，可兽人在附近游荡，离镇子太远太危险了。不过你看起来像是爱冒险的那种人。也许你能帮我一把？",dEN="That blasted boar, Bellygrub, has been in my herb garden again. This time he ate all my Swiftthistle!\n\nI need more Swiftthistle cuttings if I'm to restock the garden, but with the orcs about, it is too dangerous to venture far from town. You look like the adventuring sort, though. Perhaps you could help me out?",o="Martie Jainrose 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株迅捷蓟，并把订单送到赤脊山 Lakeshire 的 Martie Jainrose 那里。",oEN="Martie Jainrose wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Swiftthistle and take the order to Martie Jainrose at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="要是 Bellygrub 敢靠近我的野钢花，我就退休不干了。",pEN="If Bellygrub goes anywhere near my Wild Steelbloom, I'm retiring.",c="这些样品不错，<name>。我的园子有救了。谢谢你！",cEN="These are good samples, <name>. My garden is saved. Thank you!"}
Q[28523]={d="很高兴看到有位草药师愿意在部落攻打东边森林的时候出行。我一直在这儿帮忙照料银翼哨兵的伤员，但我听说 Astranaar 有个生病的孩子需要跌打草。也许你能帮我采 20 株跌打草，送到那儿的 Pelturas Whitemoon 手上？",dEN="I am glad to see an herbalist willing to travel with the Horde attacking the forest to the east. I have spent my time here helping the Silverwing Sentinels with their wounded, but I have heard there is a sick child in Astranaar in need of Bruiseweed. Perhaps you could help me by gathering 20 Bruiseweed and delivering it to Pelturas Whitemoon there?",o="Cylania Rootstalker 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株跌打草，并把订单送到灰谷 Astranaar 的 Pelturas Whitemoon 那里。",oEN="Cylania Rootstalker wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Bruiseweed and take the order to Pelturas Whitemoon at Astranaar in Ashenvale.",p="没有跌打草，我们就无从下手治疗。",pEN="Without the Bruiseweed, we cannot begin to heal.",c="愿祝福与你同在，<name>。我不知道这是不是解药，但它应该能减轻我女儿的痛苦。",cEN="Bless you, <name>. I do not know if this will be the cure but it should ease my daughter's suffering."}
Q[28524]={d="石爪山的蜘蛛咬得很深，它们的毒液会留下久久不散的残毒。\n\n只有用野钢花熬成的正经药汤才能把它拔出来，可我们的存货快没了。你能帮上忙！在更多人病倒之前，给我带 20 株野钢花来。",dEN="The spiders of Stonetalon bite deep, and their venom leaves behind a lingering residue.\n\nOnly a proper posset brewed with Wild Steelbloom can draw it out, but our supplies run low. You can help! Bring 20 Wild Steelbloom to me before more fall ill.",o="Gaxim Rustfizzle 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株野钢花，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Webwinder 小径上他营地的 Gaxim Rustfizzle 那里。",oEN="Gaxim Rustfizzle wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Wild Steelbloom and take the order to Gaxim Rustfizzle at his camp on Webwinder Path in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="没有野钢花，我就做不出解药。时间不多了。",pEN="Without the Wild Steelbloom, I can't make the cure. Time is running out.",c="好！这正是我需要的。药汤很快就熬好了。你救下的命也许比你知道的多。",cEN="Good! This is what I needed. The posset will be ready soon. You may have saved more lives than you know."}
Q[28525]={d="你好，<class>。我正准备参加中级炼金师的考核，但出了个问题。我想研究生命根，可最好的生命根产地要么满是饥饿的美洲狮，要么离部落太近，让人不放心。\n\n你愿意帮我采一些生命根吗？我很乐意送你一些补给和我调配的药水。",dEN="Good day, <class>. I am ready to begin my test for Journeyman alchemist, but there's a problem. I'd like to study Liferoot but the best sources of Liferoot are either full of hungry cougars or too close to the Horde for comfort.\n\nWould you be willing to gather some Liferoot for me? I'd be happy to give you some supplies and potions I've crafted.",o="学徒 Honeywell 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株生命根，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Southshore 的学徒 Honeywell 那里。",oEN="Apprentice Honeywell wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Liferoot and take the order to Apprentice Honeywell at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="我的考核快到了，<name>。我能指望你帮忙吗？",pEN="My test draws near, <name>. Can I count on your help?",c="哦！谢谢你！有朝一日我要是成了大师级炼金师，我一定会记得你的好意。",cEN="Oh! Thank you! Someday if I become a Master Alchemist, I will remember your kindness."}
Q[28526]={d="手上有草渍？你莫非是炼金师？\n\n这一带的元素躁动不安，我想做一个护符与它们沟通。为此，我需要大量的皇血草。你觉得你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Grass stains on your hands? Are you perhaps an alchemist?\n\nThe elements in this area are restless and I would like to fashion a talisman to commune with them. To do so, I need a large amount of Kingsblood. Do you think you could assist?",o="Lorna Stonebrand 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株皇血草，并把订单送到千针石林 Thalanaar 的 Lorna Stonebrand 那里。",oEN="Lorna Stonebrand wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Kingsblood and take the order to Lorna Stonebrand at Thalanaar in Thousand Needles.",p="你还没把皇血草带来？元素仍在躁动。",pEN="You haven't brought the Kingsblood? The elements are still restless.",c="很好。这正是我需要的。请收下这个，聊表谢意。",cEN="Good. This is exactly what I needed. Please, take this with my thanks."}
Q[28527]={d="沼泽里藏着许多危险，我们的斥候已经用惨痛的方式领教过了。我想调配出能让他们像本地美洲豹那样隐入雾中的药剂。\n\n看得出你精通草药。给我带 20 株枯叶草，我来办成这件事。",dEN="The swamps conceal many dangers, as our scouts have discovered the hard way. I wish to craft elixirs that let them vanish into the mists themselves, like the local jaguars do.\n\nI see you are skilled with herbs. Bring me 20 Fadeleaf, and I will see it done.",o="Magtoor 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株枯叶草，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽避难所的 Magtoor 那里。",oEN="Magtoor wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Fadeleaf and take the order to Magtoor at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="没有枯叶草，沼泽就无所不见——我们的敌人也一样。",pEN="Without the Fadeleaf, the swamp sees everything -- and so do our enemies.",c="好极了。有了这个，我们的斥候就能像幽灵一样行走。感谢你为我们这些流亡者效力。",cEN="Perfect. With this, our scouts will walk like ghosts. Thank you for your service to us exiles."}
Q[28528]={d="哦，我麻烦大了。住在沼泽里的那位法师——Tabetha——要卡德加的胡须，可我一点都没有。要是我再不给她送去，我不知道她会怎么做。她也许会把我变成蟾蜍！\n\n你能把 20 株卡德加的胡须送到 Tabetha 农场的她手上吗？",dEN="Oh, I'm in so much trouble. That mage who lives in the swamp -- Tabetha -- has requested Khadgar's Whisker, but I don't have any. If I don't bring her any soon, I don't know what she will do. She might turn me into a toad!\n\nCould you bring 20 Khadgar's Whisker to her at Tabetha's Farm?",o="Charity Mipsy 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株卡德加的胡须，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽 Tabetha 农场的 Tabetha 那里。",oEN="Charity Mipsy wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Khadgar's Whisker and take the order to Tabetha at Tabetha's Farm in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你迷路了吗？",pEN="Are you lost?",c="啊，是的。我的货。谢谢你送得及时。",cEN="Ah, yes. My delivery. I appreciate your timely delivery."}
Q[28529]={d="你要是在达拉然的废墟里探索，可得小心，<class>。\n\n我没法保证那些建筑的安全……哦！你是草药师。\n\n我正在做重建这座城市的工作，需要一些冬刺草。如果你想为联盟出力，请给我带一些来。",dEN="Be careful if you're exploring the ruins of Dalaran, <class>.\n\nI can't guarantee the safety of the buildings... oh! You're an herbalist.\n\nI am in need of Wintersbite for some of the work I am doing to restore the city. If you want to help the Alliance, please bring me some.",o="大法师 Ansirem Runeweaver 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株冬刺草，并把订单送到奥特兰克山脉达拉然的大法师 Ansirem Runeweaver 那里。",oEN="Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Wintersbite and take the order to Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver at Dalaran in Alterac Mountains.",p="还没有冬刺草？时间紧迫，<class>。",pEN="Still no Wintersbite? Time is of the essence, <class>.",c="干得好。感谢你在这件事上的勤勉，<class>。",cEN="Good work. I appreciate your diligence in this matter, <class>."}
Q[28530]={d="我从辛特兰下来采金棘草，可为了躲开那些似乎在这片土地每块田里巡逻的迅猛龙，我把脚踝扭了。你能不能替我把这活干完，好让我回家？",dEN="I came down from the Hinterlands to gather some Goldthorn, but I sprained my ankle running away from the raptors that seem to patrol through all the fields of this land. Could you possibly finish my task so I can return home?",o="Indon Cliffreach 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株金棘草，并把订单送到阿拉希高地 Refuge Point 的 Indon Cliffreach 那里。",oEN="Indon Cliffreach wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Goldthorn and take the order to Indon Cliffreach at Refuge Point in Arathi Highlands.",p="我需要那些金棘草。",pEN="I need that Goldthorn.",c="是的……这香气很浓。你做得不错。",cEN="Yes... the scent is strong. You have done well."}
Q[28531]={d="阿尔萨斯的眼泪……这么美的花却有这样悲伤的名字。你知道吗，它从前叫斯坦索姆百合。我听说在曾是洛丹伦的土地上，它们已经不再大量生长了。\n\n我想研究这种草药。给我带 20 株阿尔萨斯的眼泪，我会酬谢你。",dEN="Arthas' Tears... such a sorrowful name for such a beautiful flower. It used to be called Stratholme Lily, you know. I have heard they no longer grow abundantly in what was once the land of Lordaeron.\n\nI would like to study this herb. Bring me 20 Arthas' Tears and I shall reward you.",o="Logannas 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株阿尔萨斯的眼泪，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Feathermoon 要塞的 Logannas 那里。",oEN="Logannas wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Arthas' Tears and take the order to Logannas at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.",p="没有阿尔萨斯的眼泪，这个谜就依然无解。",pEN="Without Arthas' Tears, the mystery remains.",c="好漂亮的一束。我倒要看看，悲伤之中藏着怎样的真相。",cEN="A fine bunch. I shall see what truths lie hidden in grief."}
Q[28532]={d="我是第三次大战中随联盟军队前往卡利姆多的少数侏儒之一。我的部队回家时，我留下了。自从见过那些恶魔，那些纠缠我的念头就赶不走。\n\n我很庆幸在 Wobble Hollow 这里找到了落脚之处和一份差事，但我还是需要点东西来对付那些梦。我听说梦叶草是有效的药方。梦……叶……名字里就写着呢。",dEN="I was one of the few gnomes who traveled to Kalimdor with the Alliance army in the Third War. When my unit went home, I stayed. I can't shake the thoughts that plague me ever since I saw those demons.\n\nI was thankful to find a place and a purpose here in Wobble Hollow but I still need something for the dreams. I've heard that Dreamfoil can be an effective remedy. Dream... foil... it's right in the name.",o="Blimo Gadgetspring 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株梦叶草，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Wobble Hollow 的 Blimo Gadgetspring 那里。",oEN="Blimo Gadgetspring wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Dreamfoil and take the order to Blimo Gadgetspring at Wobble Hollow in Azshara.",p="还没有梦叶草？那我拥有的就只有噩梦了……",pEN="Still no Dreamfoil? Then all I have are nightmares....",c="是的……就跟我期望的一样芬芳。谢谢你。",cEN="Yes... just as fragrant as I hoped. Thank you."}
Q[28533]={d="嘿，<class>。你能想象，在一个满是海盗的港口城镇里，水上行走药水和水下呼吸药水卖得有多火。可惜我的荆棘藻全用完了，做不出更多！\n\n看你指甲缝里的泥，我就知道你是懂草药的。你要是能给我多带些来，我愿意分你一部分利润和我手头的药水。",dEN="Hey, <class>. As you can imagine, water walking and water breathing potions sell like hotcakes to a port town full of pirates. Unfortunately, I'm completely out of Stranglekelp to make more!\n\nI can tell from the dirt under your nails that you know your way around an herb, so I'm willing to cut you in on some of the profits and potions I do have, if you'll bring me more.",o="Glyx Brewright 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株荆棘藻，并把订单送到荆棘谷藏宝海湾的 Glyx Brewright 那里。",oEN="Glyx Brewright wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Stranglekelp and take the order to Glyx Brewright at Booty Bay in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="还是没有荆棘藻？看来我把这活随便许给一个进门的 <race>，是太蠢了。",pEN="Still no Stranglekelp? I suppose I was foolish to offer this job to any old <race> that wandered in the door.",c="我对你感觉不错，<name>。我能叫你 <name> 吗？总之，这是你的东西。",cEN="I had a good feeling about you, <name>. Can I call you <name>? Anyway, here's your stuff."}
Q[28534]={d="你喜欢解谜吗，<class>？我特别爱那种涉及幽灵和坟墓的谜题。\n\n我正在研究白骨之谷里的半人马幽灵，但我还想多了解墓地苔。为什么它只长在坟墓附近？我必须弄明白！\n\n你要是能给我带一蒲式耳墓地苔，我就能解开这个谜！",dEN="Do you like puzzles, <class>? I love puzzles when they involve ghosts and graves.\n\nI'm already researching the centaur ghosts that dwell in the Valley of Bones, but I also want to know more about Grave Moss. Why does it only grow near graves? I must know!\n\nIf you could bring me a bushel of Grave Moss, I could solve this mystery!",o="Hornizz Brimbuzzle 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株墓地苔，并把订单送到凄凉之地科多兽坟场的 Hornizz Brimbuzzle 那里。",oEN="Hornizz Brimbuzzle wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Grave Moss and take the order to Hornizz Brimbuzzle at the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace.",p="不知道幽灵菇是不是做幽灵披萨的好配料？",pEN="I wonder if Ghost Mushrooms make good toppings for Ghost Pizza?",c="啊，这个量不错。有了这些我应该能完成研究了。谢谢！",cEN="Ah, this is a good amount. I should be able to complete my research with this. Thanks!"}
Q[28535]={d="Springsocket 这边对紫莲花的兴趣突然涨了起来。我不知道为什么，但我想搭上这班车。\n\n你是个有空闲的草药师，不然你也不会在 Springsocket 这儿。那就出去采那些莲花吧，我们俩都能赚一笔。",dEN="There's a sudden uptick of interest in Purple Lotus here in Springsocket. I have no idea why, but I want in on that action.\n\nYou're an herbalist with time to spare, or you wouldn't be here in Springsocket. So get out there and collect that lotus and we can both profit.",o="Joakim Sparkroot 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株紫莲花，并把订单送到荒芜之地 Springsocket 的 Joakim Sparkroot 那里。",oEN="Joakim Sparkroot wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Purple Lotus and take the order to Joakim Sparkroot at Springsocket in Badlands.",p="没有货，我可没法赚出利润来分给你！",pEN="I can't make profit to share with you unless I have product!",c="好。这我能开工。来，先预付一部分我将来的收益。",cEN="OK. This I can work with. Here, an advance on what I'll make."}
Q[28536]={d="我在这里做的是精细又重要的工作，<class>。这些异种虫是祸害，必要的话我会把它们拆到分子级别。但要为我的工作调配出合适的补剂，我需要黄金参。这就要靠你了！",dEN="I'm doing some delicate and important work here, <class>. These Silithid are a menace and I will take them apart down to the molecule if necessary. But to craft the right kind of tonics for my work, I need Golden Sansam. That's where you come in!",o="Alchemist Pestlezugg 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株黄金参，并把订单送到塔纳利斯 Gadgetzan 的 Alchemist Pestlezugg 那里。",oEN="Alchemist Pestlezugg wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Golden Sansam and take the order to Alchemist Pestlezugg at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",p="时间紧迫，<class>！",pEN="Time is of the essence, <class>!",c="好。我担心这些生物和它们的扩散，<name>。保持警惕。",cEN="Good. I worry about these creatures and their spread, <name>. Be vigilant."}
Q[28537]={d="我验证费伍德森林腐化蔓延程度的另一种方法，是观察这里的一些植物。\n\n有一种叫格罗姆之血的草药，据说是在军团和部落经过这片森林之后才开始生长的。我想要一蒲式耳来研究。",dEN="Another way I can verify the extent of the corruption in Felwood is to look at some of the local plant life.\n\nThere is an herb called Gromsblood that supposedly only began growing after the Legion and the Horde passed through this forest. I should like a bushel of it to study.",o="Taronn Redfeather 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株格罗姆之血，并把订单送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的 Taronn Redfeather 那里。",oEN="Taronn Redfeather wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Gromsblood and take the order to Taronn Redfeather at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="腐化蔓延得越广，就越难对抗。",pEN="The farther the corruption has spread, the harder it will be to combat.",c="感谢你好心把格罗姆之血带给我，<class>。愿大地母亲保佑你。",cEN="I thank you for your kindness in bringing the Gromsblood to me, <class>. May the Earthmother bless you."}
Q[28538]={d="你听说过幽灵菇吗？我最近把草药也加进了我的原料清单，而这样的东西听起来正适合我们通灵学院的学生。\n\n我完全不知道它长在哪儿，但我愿意花钱买一批来试试。",dEN="Have you ever heard of Ghost Mushrooms? I've recently expanded my ingredients to include herbs, and something like this sounds perfect for our students at Scholomance Academy.\n\nI have no idea where it grows, but I'll pay for a load of them to try out.",o="Isabelle Pickman 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株幽灵菇，并把订单送到西瘟疫之地 Caer Darrow 的 Isabelle Pickman 那里。",oEN="Isabelle Pickman wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Ghost Mushroom and take the order to Isabelle Pickman at Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands.",p="你要是没有幽灵菇，我就得开始考虑……别的原料了。\n\n<Isabelle 上下打量着你。>",pEN="If you don't have the Ghost Mushrooms, I'll have to start considering... other ingredients.\n\n<Isabelle eyes you up and down.>",c="嗯，泥土味很重。像坟墓。但还有一种说不清的别的气味……也许是腐坏。我会很享受拿这些做实验。",cEN="Hmm, very earthy notes. Grave-like. But an intangible scent of something else... rot, perhaps. I will enjoy experimenting with these."}
Q[28539]={d="工作就是工作，<class>。不是消遣。而我有一件最适合你的枯燥差事。\n\n我需要火焰花。一大堆。出去给我弄些火焰花回来，而且不许你乐在其中！",dEN="Work is work, <class>. Not pleasure. And I have the perfect tedious job for you.\n\nI need Firebloom. A bunch of it. Get out there and get me some Firebloom, and don't you dare enjoy doing it!",o="Taskmaster Scrange 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株火焰花，并把订单送到灼热峡谷 Thorium Point 的 Taskmaster Scrange 那里。",oEN="Taskmaster Scrange wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Firebloom and take the order to Taskmaster Scrange at Thorium Point in Searing Gorge.",p="你要是没弄到火焰花，那就是你还没无聊够。",pEN="If you don't have the Firebloom, you haven't been bored enough.",c="行。继续干活吧，<class>。",cEN="Alright. Carry on, <class>."}
Q[28540]={d="Dadanga 真是头能干的科多兽，把我们的补给一路从 Gadgetzan 运来，甚至还吓退了几只饥饿的迅猛龙。我想好好犒劳它一番。\n\nDadanga 喜欢太阳草，可我不是草药师。也许你愿意帮我这个忙？",dEN="Dadanga here has been a real work-kodo, hauling our supplies all the way from Gadgetzan, and even scaring off some hungry raptors. I'd like to reward her for her efforts.\n\nDadanga likes Sungrass but I'm no herbalist. Perhaps you'd be willing to help me?",o="Petra Grossen 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株太阳草，并把订单送到安戈洛环形山 Marshal's Refuge 的 Petra Grossen 那里。",oEN="Petra Grossen wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Sungrass and take the order to Petra Grossen at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater.",p="我真不知道没有 Dadanga 我们该怎么办。",pEN="I don't know what we'd have done without Dadanga.",c="谢谢你，<name>。我相信它会喜欢这些的。",cEN="Thank you, <name>. I'm sure she will appreciate these."}
Q[28541]={d="我听说天灾浩劫之后，瘟疫之地这里长出一种新草药。它叫——倒也贴切——瘟疫花。\n\n我想研究这种被改变的草药。你能帮我采一些吗？我不敢远离圣光之愿礼拜堂，可你看起来足够强壮。",dEN="I've heard about a new herb growing here in the Plaguelands after the Scourge catastrophe. It's called, fittingly enough, Plaguebloom.\n\nI'd like to study this transformed herb. Could you gather some for me? I dare not venture far from Light's Hope Chapel, but you seem plenty strong.",o="Jase Farlane 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株瘟疫花，并把订单送到东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的 Jase Farlane 那里。",oEN="Jase Farlane wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Plaguebloom and take the order to Jase Farlane at Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",p="这些亡灵让我毛骨悚然……哦，呃。没什么。",pEN="All these undead give me the creeps... oh, uh. Nevermind.",c="我应该能弄清这种草药是不是危险。希望它是我能用来行善的东西。",cEN="I should be able to figure out if this herb is dangerous. Hopefully it's something we can use for good."}
Q[28542]={d="见习草药师，是吧，老兄？想证明你有本事出人头地吗？我们从基础开始。采 20 朵宁神花，送到剃刀岭的 Dura 那里。你要是偷工减料，她一眼就看得出来。",dEN="Apprentice herbalist, aye mon? Wanna prove ya got the skills to succeed? Let's start with the basics. Pick 20 Peacebloom and take 'em to Dura in Razor Hill. She'll know if you be cuttin' corners.",o="Mishiki 要你用草药学技能采集 20 朵宁神花，并把订单送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭的 Dura 那里。",oEN="Mishiki wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Peacebloom and take the order to Dura at Razor Hill in Durotar.",p="你确定采够了吗，<race>？",pEN="You sure you picked enough, <race>?",c="十八……十九……二十。看来你的数数能力够得上部落的标准了。采药愉快，<class>。",cEN="Eighteen... nineteen... twenty. Well, guess your powers of counting are up to the Horde standards. Happy herbing, <class>."}
Q[28543]={d="我侄子 Kray 是雷霆崖的炼金学徒。他给我妻子捎信说，他的银叶草又不够了。\n\n我担心他没把学业当回事，但我不想让他半途而废。你愿意采 20 株银叶草给他送去吗？你带着草药出现，他就会明白这样的好意很少是白来的。",dEN="My nephew Kray is an apprentice alchemist up in Thunder Bluff. He sent my wife a message that he's short on Silverleaf again.\n\nI worry that he isn't taking his studies seriously but I don't want him to fail. Would you gather 20 Silverleaf and take them to him? If you show up with the herbs, he will understand that such kindness is rarely free.",o="Ruul Eagletalon 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株银叶草，并把订单送到莫高雷雷霆崖的 Kray 那里。",oEN="Ruul Eagletalon wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Silverleaf and take the order to Kray at Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="我只是个学徒，<class>。你要是想要真正的药水，最好去问一位资深炼金师。",pEN="I'm just an apprentice, <class>. If you want real potions, best ask one of the senior alchemists.",c="哦！我叔叔到底还是帮上忙了。我知道，我知道。我得别再指望叔叔婶婶帮忙了。这是最后一次，我保证！",cEN="Oh! My uncle came through after all. I know, I know. I need to stop relying on my uncle and aunt for help. This is the last time, I promise!"}
Q[28544]={d="Cold Hearth 庄园那位讲究的\"裁缝\" Constance 说她正在搞什么\"自然时尚\"的名堂。谁知道那是什么意思。\n\n她要了 20 株地根草。趁她还没又开始把苔藓织进披肩里，赶紧给她送去，行吗？但愿那种说法永远别流行起来。",dEN="That fancy \"clothier\" Constance over at Cold Hearth Manor says she's working on some “natural fashion” nonsense. Whatever that means.\n\nShe asked for 20 Earthroot. Bring it to her before she starts weaving moss into shawls again, will you?\n\nI hope the term \"fashionably decayed\" never catches on.",o="Faruza 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株地根草，并把订单送到提瑞斯法林地 Cold Hearth 庄园的 Constance Brisboise 那里。",oEN="Faruza wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Earthroot and take the order to Constance Brisboise at Cold Hearth Manor in Tirisfal Glades.",p="时尚就是艺术，<race>！去吧，快去采。",pEN="Fashion is art, <race>! Go on, get picking.",c="等从幽暗城到暴风城人人都穿上我的设计时，Faruza 就会后悔她对我作品的狭隘看法。",cEN="Faruza will regret her close-mindedness regarding my designs when everyone is wearing them, from Undercity to Stormwind."}
Q[28545]={d="看你膝盖上的草渍就知道你是草药师。我不明白人们怎么会把炼金师和草药师搞混，更不明白他们凭什么觉得我有空去应付他们那些鸡毛蒜皮的草药小心思。好在你看起来有这单所需的手艺和时间。\n\n把 20 株魔皇草送给那位附魔师——我想他叫 Leo Sarn——他就在通往希尔斯布莱德的路南边扎了营。",dEN="I see by the grass stains on your knees that you're an herbalist. I don't know how people confuse alchemists with herbalists, or better still, why people think I have time to handle their minor herbal whims. Fortunately, you look like you have the skills and time for this request.\n\nTake 20 Mageroyal to that enchanter -- Leo Sarn, I think his name was -- he's made a camp just south of the road to Hillsbrad.",o="Apothecary Renferrel 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株魔皇草，并把订单送到银松森林通往希尔斯布莱德路南营地的 Leo Sarn 那里。",oEN="Apothecary Renferrel wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Mageroyal and take the order to Leo Sarn at his camp south of the road to Hillsbrad in Silverpine Forest.",p="没有魔皇草？哼，我还以为你看起来像是乐于助人的那种。",pEN="No Mageroyal? Hmph, I thought you looked like the helpful sort.",c="啊，总算来了。是 Renferrel 派你来的？不出所料。至少还有人办成了事。这正合适。",cEN="Ah, finally. Renferrel sent you? Figures. At least someone came through. This will do nicely."}
Q[28546]={d="哦，一位草药师！有个叫 Mebok Mizzyrix 的古怪哥布林给我发来一份荆棘草的订单。我这儿正好一点不剩，也不想再应付他那副\"十万火急\"的腔调。\n\n拜托了老兄，把 20 株荆棘草送到棘齿城给他，省得我头疼。",dEN="Oh, an herbalist! Some strange goblin by de name of Mebok Mizzyrix sent me a request for Briarthorn. I be fresh out and not keen on dealin' with his \"urgent\" tone again.\n\nPlease mon, bring 20 Briarthorn to him at Ratchet and save me de headache.",o="Hula'mahi 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株荆棘草，并把订单送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的 Mebok Mizzyrix 那里。",oEN="Hula'mahi wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Briarthorn and take the order to Mebok Mizzyrix at Ratchet in the Barrens.",p="你把我订的荆棘草带来了吗？要是没有，就赶紧回去把活干完！",pEN="You got my order of Briarthorn? If not, get back out and finish the job!",c="啊，总算来了。你简直不会相信，忙成这样搞发明的时候想找点像样的草药有多难。谢了！",cEN="Ah, finally. You wouldn't believe how hard it is to find decent herbs when you're this busy inventing. Thanks!"}
Q[28547]={d="你好，<race>。我来贫瘠之地是为了一项和平的研究任务，不过当地居民不愿把货物卖给我，也是可以理解的。我实验的下一阶段需要迅捷蓟。看样子你对植物有些本事，所以我请求你的协助。当然，我会为你的服务付钱。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. I am in the Barrens on a peaceful research mission, but the local townsfolk are understandably wary of selling their goods to me. I am in need of Swiftthistle for the next phase of my experiment. As it seems you have some skill with plants, I ask for your assistance. I will, of course, pay for your services.",o="Doan Karhan 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株迅捷蓟，并把订单送到贫瘠之地南面黄金之路以东他营地的 Doan Karhan 那里。",oEN="Doan Karhan wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Swiftthistle and take the order to Doan Karhan at his camp east of the Southern Gold Road in the Barrens.",p="像这样的小事会增进联盟与部落之间的情谊。",pEN="Small tasks like this will build fellowship between Alliance and Horde.",c="你成功回来了。这是答应给你的报酬。你得到了我的善意，<race>。",cEN="You return successful. And here is your promised payment. You have my good will, <race>."}
Q[28548]={d="暮光之锤在这里的活动打破了自然的平衡，奴役元素，腐蚀大地的灵魂。\n\n我必须向灵魂献上祭品。为此，我需要 20 株跌打草。Zoram'gar 哨站必须在元素与我们所有人反目之前弥补过失。",dEN="The Twilight Hammer's activities here have disturbed the natural balance, enslaving elementals and corrupting the spirits of the land.\n\nI must make an offering to the spirits. To do this, I will need 20 Bruiseweed. Zoram'gar Outpost needs to make amends before the elements turn on us all.",o="Je'neu Sancrea 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株跌打草，并把订单送到灰谷 Zoram'gar 哨站的 Je'neu Sancrea 那里。",oEN="Je'neu Sancrea wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Bruiseweed and take the order to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost in Ashenvale.",p="元素仍在躁动。没有跌打草，我们就无法开始仪式。",pEN="The elements remain restless. Without the Bruiseweed, we cannot begin the ritual.",c="这些应该够了。只要我们行动迅速，元素或许还会宽恕。你尽到了你的一份。谢谢你。",cEN="This will suffice. The elements may yet forgive, if we act swiftly. You have done your part. Thank you."}
Q[28549]={d="石爪山的蜘蛛咬得很深，它们的毒液会留下久久不散的残毒。\n\n只有用野钢花熬成的正经药汤才能把它拔出来，可我们的存货快没了。你能帮上忙！在更多人病倒之前，把 20 株野钢花送到 Malaka'jin。",dEN="The spiders of Stonetalon bite deep, and their venom leaves behind a lingering residue.\n\nOnly a proper posset brewed with Wild Steelbloom can draw it out, but our supplies run low. You can help! Bring 20 Wild Steelbloom to Malaka'jin before more fall ill.",o="Xen'Zilla 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株野钢花，并把订单送到石爪山脉 Malaka'jin 的 Xen'Zilla 那里。",oEN="Xen'Zilla wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Wild Steelbloom and take the order to Xen'Zilla at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="没有野钢花，我就做不出解药。时间不多了。",pEN="Without the Wild Steelbloom, I can't make the cure. Time is running out.",c="好！这正是我需要的。药汤很快就熬好了。你救下的命也许比你知道的多。",cEN="Good! This is what I needed. The posset will be ready soon. You may have saved more lives than you know."}
Q[28550]={d="当药剂师 Lydon 痴迷于死亡时，我却觉得生命……有趣得多。尤其是托这具形体的福，可能存在的其他生命形式。\n\n我需要 20 株生命根做一项精细的实验。一项关于重生的实验……变成蜘蛛！把它们送到 Tarren Mill 给我。",dEN="While Apothecary Lydon obsesses over death, I find life far more... intriguing. Especially other kinds of life which might be possible, thanks to this form.\n\nI require 20 Liferoot for a delicate experiment. One concerning rebirth... as a spider! Bring them to me at Tarren Mill.",o="Aranae Venomblood 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株生命根，并把订单送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵 Tarren Mill 的 Aranae Venomblood 那里。",oEN="Aranae Venomblood wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Liferoot and take the order to Aranae Venomblood at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="还没有生命根？那重生只能等等了。真令人失望。",pEN="No Liferoot yet? Then the rebirth must wait. How disappointing.",c="啊……鲜活，跳动着潜能。有了这个，我的工作就能重新开始。要是顺利的话，你甚至会被记住。",cEN="Ah... vibrant, pulsing with potential. With this, my work begins anew. You may even be remembered, if things go well."}
Q[28551]={d="你好，<name>。你看起来是位草药师。我想请你帮个忙。\n\n我在 Freewind Post 的朋友 Hagar 需要皇血草。别问我为什么，但听起来很急。\n\n采 20 株皇血草给他送去。他知道该怎么用。",dEN="Hail, <name>. You appear to be a herbalist. I would ask you a favor.\n\nMy friend Hagar down in Freewind Post is in need of Kingsblood. Don't ask me why, but it sounded urgent.\n\nGather 20 Kingsblood and take it to him. He'll know what to do with it.",o="Brave Moonhorn 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株皇血草，并把订单送到千针石林 Freewind Post 的 Hagar Lightninghoof 那里。",oEN="Brave Moonhorn wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Kingsblood and take the order to Hagar Lightninghoof at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",p="你没把皇血草带来？",pEN="You haven't brought the Kingsblood?",c="是 Brave Moonhorn 派你来的？好。这正是我需要的。请收下这个，多谢你。",cEN="Brave Moonhorn sent you? Good. This is exactly what I needed. Please, take this with my thanks."}
Q[28552]={d="沼泽里藏着许多危险，我们的斥候已经用惨痛的方式领教过了。我想调配出能让他们像本地美洲豹那样隐入雾中的药剂。\n\n看得出你精通草药。给我带 20 株枯叶草，我来办成这件事。",dEN="The swamps conceal many dangers, as our scouts have discovered the hard way. I wish to craft elixirs that let them vanish into the mists themselves, like the local jaguars do.\n\nI see you are skilled with herbs. Bring me 20 Fadeleaf, and I will see it done.",o="Rogvar 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株枯叶草，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽 Stonard 的 Rogvar 那里。",oEN="Rogvar wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Fadeleaf and take the order to Rogvar at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="没有枯叶草，沼泽就无所不见——我们的敌人也一样。",pEN="Without the Fadeleaf, the swamp sees everything -- and so do our enemies.",c="好极了。有了这个，我们的斥候就能像幽灵一样行走。感谢你为部落效力。",cEN="Perfect. With this, our scouts will walk like ghosts. Thank you for your service to the Horde."}
Q[28553]={d="喂，沼泽里那位女巫——Tabetha——她要卡德加的胡须来配她的一剂药。要是我再不给她送去，我不知道她会做什么。她也许会把我变成蟾蜍！\n\n你能不能把 20 株卡德加的胡须送到 Tabetha 农场给她……趁我还没开始呱呱叫？",dEN="Oi, de witch of de swamp -- Tabetha -- she wants Khadgar's Whisker for one o' her brews. If I don't bring her any soon, I don't know what she gonna do. She might turn me into a toad!\n\nCould ya bring 20 Khadgar's Whisker to her at Tabetha's Farm... before I end up croakin'?",o="Balai Lok'Wein 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株卡德加的胡须，并把订单送到尘泥沼泽 Tabetha 农场的 Tabetha 那里。",oEN="Balai Lok'Wein wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Khadgar's Whisker and take the order to Tabetha at Tabetha's Farm in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="你迷路了吗？",pEN="Are you lost?",c="啊，是的。我的订单。谢谢你送得及时，<class>。",cEN="Ah, yes. My order. I appreciate your timely delivery, <class>."}
Q[28554]={d="嘿，<name>。你有一分钟吗？\n\n没有冬刺草我就做不出我那道著名的冰霜之油，可最近本地的食人魔有点太活跃了。我需要一个有冒险精神的人给我带 20 株冬刺草来。那个冒险者是你吗？",dEN="Hey, <name>. You got a minute?\n\nI can't make my famous Frost Oil without Wintersbite, but the local ogres have been a bit more frisky lately. I need someone with an adventuring spirit to bring me 20 Wintersbite. Is that adventurer you?",o="Bro'kin 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株冬刺草，并把订单送到奥特兰克山脉奥特兰克废墟的 Bro'kin 那里。",oEN="Bro'kin wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Wintersbite and take the order to Bro'kin at the Ruins of Alterac in Alterac Mountains.",p="还没有冬刺草？没有它就没有冰霜之油，而没有冰霜之油……嗯，事情就麻烦了。",pEN="Still no Wintersbite? Without it, there's no Frost Oil, and without Frost Oil... well, things get messy.",c="啊，这才是正经货！这能让我的药剂又顺又冰。干得好。",cEN="Ahh, now that's the stuff! This'll keep my mixtures smooth and frosty. Good work."}
Q[28555]={d="要提振住在这座旧监狱里的人的士气，还有很多事要做。我的萨满仪式需要很多东西——有时是血和牙齿，有时是合适的草药来当香焚烧。\n\n我下一次仪式需要 20 株金棘草。有了它，我就能唤来栖息在这一带的、躁动不安的土地与火焰之灵的注意。",dEN="There is much to do to bolster the spirits of those who occupy this old prison. My shamanistic rituals require many things -- sometimes blood and tooth, sometimes the right herbs to burn as incense.\n\nI require 20 Goldthorn for my next ritual. With it, I can command the attention of the disturbed spirits of the earth and fire that dwell in this area.",o="Tor'gan 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株金棘草，并把订单送到阿拉希高地 Hammerfall 的 Tor'gan 那里。",oEN="Tor'gan wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Goldthorn and take the order to Tor'gan at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",p="火焰在呼唤金棘草。",pEN="The fire calls for Goldthorn.",c="是的……这香气很浓。今晚灵体就会回应。你做得不错。",cEN="Yes... the scent is strong. The spirits will answer tonight. You have done well."}
Q[28556]={d="阿尔萨斯的眼泪……这么美的花却有这样悲伤的名字。你知道吗，它从前叫斯坦索姆百合。我听说在曾是洛丹伦的土地上，它们已经不再大量生长了。\n\n我想研究这种草药。给我带 20 株阿尔萨斯的眼泪，我会酬谢你。",dEN="Arthas' Tears... such a sorrowful name for such a beautiful flower. It used to be called Stratholme Lily, you know. I have heard they no longer grow abundantly in what was once the land of Lordaeron.\n\nI would like to study this herb. Bring me 20 Arthas' Tears and I shall reward you.",o="Ruw 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株阿尔萨斯的眼泪，并把订单送到菲拉斯 Mojache 营地的 Ruw 那里。",oEN="Ruw wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Arthas' Tears and take the order to Ruw at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="没有阿尔萨斯的眼泪，这个谜就依然无解。",pEN="Without Arthas' Tears, the mystery remains.",c="好漂亮的一束。我倒要看看，悲伤之中藏着怎样的真相。",cEN="A fine bunch. I shall see what truths lie hidden in grief."}
Q[28557]={d="梦叶草……对某些人来说是无害的草药，但我看到了潜力——成就更大之物的潜力。\n\n它对心智的作用……很有前途。给我带 20 株梦叶草来，我们就可以开始配制一种新的瘟……我是说，药水。",dEN="Dreamfoil... a harmless herb to some, but I see potential -- potential for something much more.\n\nIt's effects on the mind are... promising. Bring 20 Dreamfoil to me, and we may begin formulating a new plag... I mean, potion.",o="学徒 Winter 要你用草药学技能采集 20 株梦叶草，并把订单送到艾萨拉 Valormok 的学徒 Winter 那里。",oEN="Apprentice Winter wants you to use your herbalism skill to collect 20 Dreamfoil and take the order to Apprentice Winter at Valormok in Azshara.",p="还是没有梦叶草？那我们就只有梦了……还有白白浪费的时间。",pEN="Still no Dreamfoil? Then all we have are dreams... and wasted time.",c="是的……就跟我期望的一样芬芳。这会非常好用。你也许帮着塑造了历……我是说，你帮到了我的研究。谢谢你。",cEN="Yes... just as fragrant as I hoped. This will serve beautifully. You may have helped shape hist... I mean, you have helped my studies. Thank you."}
Q[28558]={d="想当制皮匠？介意帮我处理几个订单吗？\n\nEastvale 的 Rallic Finn 订了一个新箭袋。他说旧的快散架了，箭从缝线里扎出来。那可是危险事。\n\n这活儿正适合新手接手。做一个轻型皮箭袋，送到伐木场给他。就当既是练手，也是帮忙。",dEN="An aspiring leatherworker? Mind helping out with a few orders?\n\nRallic Finn over at Eastvale put in an order for a new quiver. He says his old one's falling apart, arrows poking through the seams. Dangerous business, that.\n\nThis is a good task for a beginner to take on. Craft a Light Leather Quiver and deliver it to him at the Logging Camp. Consider it both practice and service.",o="Adele Fielder 要你用制皮技能制作 1 个轻型皮箭袋，并把订单送到艾尔文森林 Eastvale 伐木场的 Rallic Finn 那里。",oEN="Adele Fielder wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Light Leather Quiver and take the order to Rallic Finn at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest.",p="你看见我背上有个箭袋吗？那我猜我们这儿还没完事。",pEN="You see a quiver on my back? Then I guess we're not done here.",c="缝线结实，皮革干净……而且走路时不会扎我。上一个我可说不出这话。干得漂亮。",cEN="Sturdy stitching, clean leather... and it doesn't stab me when I walk. That's more than I can say for the last one. Nicely done."}
Q[28559]={d="你要是愿意，这儿还有一单：Tommy Joe 一直为某个神秘姑娘魂不守舍，现在他要些东西帮他看起来\"体面\"点。\n\n你要是正在提升制皮手艺，这正好是个由头，做两条手工缝制皮裤。送到 Stonefield 农场给他。也许穿得像样点能帮他迈出那一步。",dEN="If you're willing, here's another one: Tommy Joe's been mooning over some mysterious girl, and now he's asking for something to help him look \"presentable.\"\n\nIf you're advancing your leatherworking, this is a fine excuse to craft a couple pairs of Handstitched Leather Pants. Take them to him at the Stonefield Farm. Maybe looking the part will help him take action.",o="Adele Fielder 要你用制皮技能制作 2 条手工缝制皮裤，并把订单送到艾尔文森林 Stonefield 农场的 Tommy Joe Stonefield 那里。",oEN="Adele Fielder wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Handstitched Leather Pants and take the order to Tommy Joe Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm in Elwynn Forest.",p="我知道大家在说什么。你来这儿不只是为了看笑话的，对吧？",pEN="I know what people are saying. You're not just here to laugh, are you?",c="这些……真不错。你觉得她会注意到吗？也许我到底还是去跟她说话……回头吧。谢谢。",cEN="These are... real nice. Think she'll notice? Maybe I'll go talk to her after all... later. Thanks."}
Q[28560]={d="同行学徒？也许你不介意帮我处理几个积压的订单？\n\nOrgorn 一直光着膀子在南门哨站巡逻。他说他\"在跟风摔跤时把上衣弄丢了\"。是啊，当然。\n\n你要是正在练制皮，就给他做两件压花皮背心。就算他不肯承认，山里的空气也实在不算暖和。",dEN="A fellow apprentice? Maybe you wouldn't mind helping me with a few of these back orders?\n\nOrgorn's been patrolling South Gate Outpost without a shirt. Says he \"lost it in a wrestling match with the wind.\" Right.\n\nIf you're working on your leatherworking, make him a couple Embossed Leather Vests. Even if he won't admit it, the mountain air isn't exactly warm.",o="Gretta Finespindle 要你用制皮技能制作 2 件压花皮背心，并把订单送到丹莫罗南门哨站的 Orgorn Strongbrow 那里。",oEN="Gretta Finespindle wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Embossed Leather Vest and take the order to Orgorn Strongbrow at South Gate Outpost in Dun Morogh.",p="你背包里有背心吗？我可还光着膀子跟微风搏斗呢。",pEN="You got a vest in your pack? I'm still fightin' breezes bare-chested.",c="这才叫像样的装备。合身，看着更好。我说不定就一直穿着了。谢谢你，<name>",cEN="Now that's proper gear. Fits good, looks better. I might even keep this one on. Thanks, <name>"}
Q[28561]={d="我很希望这单由你来办。Grif Wildheart 对他的训练轮次越来越没耐心——地方也越来越不够。他说他的弹药袋磨得太破，铅弹撒得满地雪都是。\n\n你要是正在提升制皮手艺，就做两个小型皮弹药袋，送到 Kharanos 给他。他会好好用的。说不定也能让他别再冲着他那些学徒猎人吼了。",dEN="I'd love for you to handle this one. Grif Wildheart's been running low on patience -- and space -- for his training rounds. Says his ammo pouch is so worn it's leaking shot all over the snow.\n\nIf you're building your leatherworking skill, craft a couple Small Leather Ammo Pouches and take them to him in Kharanos. He'll put them to good use. And maybe stop growling at his apprentice hunters.",o="Gretta Finespindle 要你用制皮技能制作 2 个小型皮弹药袋，并把订单送到丹莫罗 Kharanos 的 Grif Wildheart 那里。",oEN="Gretta Finespindle wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Small Leather Ammo Pouch and take the order to Grif Wildheart at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="你带着袋子来了，还是只是来听我抱怨的？\n\n不管是哪样，见到你都很高兴！",pEN="Got a pouch with you, or are you just here to listen to me complain?\n\nEither way, glad to see ya!",c="我们来看看这个，<name>。\n\n完美。大小正合适，而且没破洞！你该得一份奖励。",cEN="Let's have a look at this, <name>.\n\nPerfect. Just the right size, and no holes! You've earned a reward."}
Q[28562]={d="啊，一位制皮学徒。欢迎来到我的工坊。你要是来练手艺的，我可以帮你。\n\n我有一些简单的活要办，正适合新手。Dolanaar 的 Jeena Featherbow 一直在泰达希尔的密林里训练。她的操劳把裤子磨出了好几个洞，需要换新的。你可以做两条硬皮裤送给她，算是帮手。",dEN="Ah, an apprentice leatherworker. Welcome to my studio. If you are here to practice your craft, I can assist you.\n\nI have some simple tasks that need doing and are just right for a beginner. Jeena Featherbow in Dolanaar has been training in the deep woods of Teldrassil. Her exertions have worn several holes in her pants, and she is in need of replacements. You may assist by crafting two pairs of Rugged Leather Pants and delivering them to her.",o="Nadyia Maneweaver 要你用制皮技能制作 2 条硬皮裤，并把订单送到泰达希尔 Dolanaar 的 Jeena Featherbow 那里。",oEN="Nadyia Maneweaver wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Rugged Leather Pants and take the order to Jeena Featherbow at Dolanaar in Teldrassil.",p="我的新裤子你带来了吗？别担心；我自己那条已经补过三次了。",pEN="Do you have my new pants? Don't worry; I've patched mine three times already.",c="谢谢你。下次地形就没那么容易绊倒我了。",cEN="Thank you. The terrain won't trip me up so easily next time."}
Q[28563]={d="我很少去达纳苏斯，但你要是愿意跑一趟城里，我还有一单正适合你去做。\n\n一位来访的矮人捎信说，他的腰带没能挺过从米奈希尔港出发的旅途。请给他做一条手工缝制皮带，送到首席考古学家 Greywhisker 手上。我想你会在月神殿找到他。",dEN="I rarely travel into Darnassus, but if you are willing to make your way to the city, I have another order that would be perfect for you to fulfill.\n\nA visiting dwarf sent a note that his belt did not survive the journey from Menethil Harbor. Please craft him a Handstitched Leather Belt and deliver it to Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker. I believe you'll find him at the Temple of the Moon.",o="Nadyia Maneweaver 要你用制皮技能制作 1 条手工缝制皮带，并把订单送到泰达希尔达纳苏斯月神殿的首席考古学家 Greywhisker 那里。",oEN="Nadyia Maneweaver wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Handstitched Leather Belt and take the order to Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker at the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus on Teldrassil.",p="这儿的精灵真有礼貌。都没人提起我腰围松了的事。",pEN="The elves here are right polite. No one's even mentioned the sag in my waistline.",c="哈！干得漂亮。这下我总算能完成一次发掘而不丢东西了……比如我的尊严。干杯。",cEN="Hah! Solid work. I might finally get through a dig without losin' something -- like my dignity. Cheers."}
Q[28564]={d="我是人民民兵的补给官，需要一位制皮师。你就是，对吧？\n\n斥候加利亚安日夜在哨兵岭一带巡逻，他的靴子已经开线散架了。我要申领一批替换品——要结实、安静、能经得起长时间的奔波。\n\n如果你的制皮手艺还过得去，就做几双暗皮靴给他送去。",dEN="I am the requisition officer for the People's Militia and I am in need of a leatherworker. That's you, right?\n\nScout Galiaan's been running patrols around Sentinel Hill day and night, and his boots are falling apart at the seams. I'm requisitioning a replacement -- something tough, quiet, and built for long hours on the move.\n\nIf your leatherworking's coming along, craft a couple pairs of Dark Leather Boots and deliver them to him.",o="保护者加里尔要你用制皮技能制作 2 双暗皮靴，并把货送到西部荒野哨兵岭的斥候加利亚安那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dark Leather Boots and take the order to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill in Westfall.",p="只要迪菲亚还在威胁我们的人民，我就不会放慢脚步。",pEN="As long as the Defias threaten our people, I'm not slowing down.",c="鞋底不错，针脚也干净……这些能撑一阵子。加里尔雇你没错。我不会浪费它们。现在，你也别浪费这些补给！",cEN="Good tread, clean stitching... these'll last. Gariel was right to hire you. I won't waste them. Now, don't waste these supplies!"}
Q[28565]={d="保护者伊万杰琳日夜在南方大道上巡逻，匕首岭吹来的风像迪菲亚兄弟会的刀刃一样割人。我要为她申领一件像样的斗篷。我要耐用的、能挡风遮雨的，而且要体面。\n\n如果你正在练制皮，就做一件优质皮斗篷送给她。她不会开口要舒适，但她同样配得上。",dEN="Protector Evangeline patrols the south road day and night, and the wind off the Dagger Hills cuts like a Defias blade. I'm requisitioning a proper cloak for her. I need something durable, weather-resistant, and dignified.\n\nIf you're working on your leatherworking, craft a Fine Leather Cloak and get it to her. She won't ask for comfort, but she deserves it all the same.",o="保护者加里尔要你用制皮技能制作 1 件优质皮斗篷，并把货送到西部荒野南方大道巡逻路线上的保护者伊万杰琳那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Cloak and take the order to Protector Evangeline at her patrol route on the southern road in Westfall.",p="你好，公民。小心些，这条路上既有豺狼人也有迪菲亚在巡逻。",pEN="Hail citizen. Be warned, both gnolls and Defias patrol this road.",c="这件斗篷不错。结实、轻便，而且真的很合身。加里尔什么都想到了——你也是。",cEN="This is a nice cloak. Strong, light, and it actually fits. Gariel thinks of everything -- and so do you."}
Q[28566]={d="制皮师？噢，感谢艾露恩！订单堆得我应付不过来，森林又这么危险。\n\n凯尔罗尼安·永影在清醒与沉睡之间游荡，可即便在恍惚之中，人们也指望他守护林地。他的皮甲已经磨得很薄了。他在梦境中或许不会察觉，但醒来后会在意。\n\n你能做五件中型护甲片给他送去吗？你到的时候他也许还没醒，但无声的帮助也是帮助。",dEN="A leatherworker? Oh thank Elune! I'm swamped with orders I'm having trouble fulfilling while the forest is so dangerous.\n\nKerlonian Evershade wanders between waking and sleep, but even in trance, he's expected to defend the Grove. His leathers are worn thin from use. He may not notice while he's in the Dream, but he will care when he wakes up.\n\nCould you please craft five Medium Armor Kits and deliver them to him? He may not even be awake when you get there, but quiet help is still help.",o="玛芙拉琳要你用制皮技能制作 5 件中型护甲片，并把货送到黑海岸古树林地（Bosque de los Ancestros）的凯尔罗尼安·永影那里。",oEN="Mavralyn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 5 Medium Armor Kit and take the order to Kerlonian Evershade at the Grove of the Ancients in Darkshore.",p="嗯……是吗？不是？你就是……带护甲片来的人吗？我好像梦到过你的到来。",pEN="Mm... yes? No? Are you the one... with the armor kits? I think I dreamed of your coming.",c="啊……是的。分量很轻，但强度……持久。谢谢你，朋友。即使在梦里，我也需要保护。",cEN="Ah... yes. The weight is light, but the strength... enduring. Thank you, friend. Even in dreams I need protection."}
Q[28567]={d="这也许不是最优先的订单，但却是最善意的一单。\n\n格温妮丝一直在奥伯丁帮忙整理补给记录和德鲁伊的货运，可她从上一季起就穿着同一件破旧的长袍。我想，是时候让她换件更结实、也更舒适的了。\n\n你能为她制作一件优质皮外套并送过去吗？你会在镇上的飞行平台上找到她。",dEN="This might not be the highest priority order, but it is one of the kindest.\n\nGwennyth's been helping coordinate supply records and druidic shipments in Auberdine, but she's been wearing the same battered tunic since last season. I thinks it's time she had something a little sturdier and a little more comfortable.\n\nWould you please craft her a Fine Leather Tunic and deliver it? You'll find her on the flight deck here in town.",o="玛芙拉琳要你用制皮技能制作 1 件优质皮外套，并把货送到黑海岸奥伯丁的格温妮丝·布莱勒冈德那里。",oEN="Mavralyn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Tunic and take the order to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde at Auberdine in Darkshore.",p="是玛芙拉琳派你来的？她真热心！",pEN="Did Mavralyn send you? How kind!",c="噢……这件真漂亮。要不是玛芙拉琳指出来，我都没发现自己的已经那么破了。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="Oh... this is beautiful. I didn't realize how worn mine had gotten until Mavralyn pointed it out. Thank you for this, <name>."}
Q[28568]={d="噢，一位受过训练的制皮师。既然来了镇上，愿意做点好事吗？巡山者奥兹莫克一直穿着一条连一阵强风都撑不住的裤子，在石头和积雪间攀爬。每次巡逻后都要给他疗伤，我实在受够了。\n\n如果你想提升制皮技能，就做几条轻皮短裤送到铁炉堡外的塞尔萨玛去。他也许会嘟囔几句，但不会拒绝。",dEN="Oh, a trained leatherworker. Care to do some good deeds while you're in town? Mountaineer Ozmok's been scrambling over stone and snow in pants that wouldn't hold together in a strong breeze. I've had enough of patching him up after every patrol.\n\nIf you're interested in building your leatherworking skill, craft a couple pairs of Light Leather Pants and deliver them to him in Thelsamar. He might grumble, but he won't say no.",o="卡特·桑普森要你用制皮技能制作 2 条轻皮短裤，并把货送到洛克莫丹塞尔萨玛的巡山者奥兹莫克那里。",oEN="Kat Sampson wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Light Leather Pants and take the order to Mountaineer Ozmok at Thelsamar in Loch Modan.",p="看来我得在镇上困上一阵子了。没有裤子，出去也没意义。",pEN="Guess I'm stuck in town for awhile. No pants, no point.",c="嗯，这些既结实又暖和，还没有破洞。够用了。不过告诉卡特，我还是不穿长衬裤。",cEN="Well now, these are sturdy, warm, and don't have any holes. They'll do. Tell Kat I'm still not wearing longjohns, though."}
Q[28569]={d="首席工程师欣德维尔一直在丢工具。这不是什么比喻。我是说，上周他的腰带断了，半个山谷都听见他的扳手砸在堤坝上的巨响。我当时真怕大坝会塌！\n\n他订做了一条优质皮腰带，要送到石坝水坝给他。如果你想施展制皮手艺，这活儿值得你花时间。也关乎我们所有人的安全。",dEN="Chief Engineer Hinderweir's been losing his tools. And that's not an idiom. What I mean is, his belt snapped last week, and half the valley heard the clang when his wrenches hit the dam. I was afraid it was going to burst!\n\nHe's asked for a Fine Leather Belt to be made and delivered to him at Stonewrought Dam. If you're interested in plying your leatherworking skills, this is a task worth your time. And all of our safety.",o="卡特·桑普森要你用制皮技能制作 1 条优质皮腰带，并把货送到洛克莫丹石坝水坝的首席工程师欣德维尔七世那里。",oEN="Kat Sampson wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Belt and take the order to Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII at Stonewrought Dam in Loch Modan.",p="没有腰带？那我最好用两只手抱紧我的锤子了。",pEN="No belt? Then I'd best hold onto my hammers with both hands.",c="终于好了。这下我不用一边干活一边躲坠落的零件了。多谢。",cEN="Finally. I'll be able to get back to work without dodging falling gear. Much obliged."}
Q[28570]={d="制皮师，我需要你的帮忙。是这样的，我最好的朋友凯拉·暗矛驻扎在蛛网小径一带，那里每天都有伏击、毒药，还有更糟的东西。她的装备补了无数次，撑不了多久了。\n\n你能做一批重型护甲片给她送去吗。我不想占用你太多时间，可她急需这些。",dEN="I could use your assistance, leatherworker. You see, my best friend Kaela Shadowspear's stationed along Webwinder Path, where every day brings ambushes, poison, and worse. She's patched her gear too many times to count, and it won't hold much longer.\n\nCan you craft a handful of Heavy Armor Kit and deliver them to her. I wouldn't impress on your time, she needs them badly.",o="猎人凯娜要你用制皮技能制作 5 件重型护甲片，并把货送到石爪山脉蛛网小径旁营地的凯拉·暗矛那里。",oEN="Hunter Kyana wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 5 Heavy Armor Kit and take the order to Kaela Shadowspear at her camp along Webwinder Path in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="我从没想过会有这么荒蛮的地方。那些山！那些地精！虽然危险，但真让人兴奋。",pEN="I never imagined such wild country as this. The mountains! The goblins! It is exciting even if it is also dangerous.",c="谢谢你，<class>。这能挡住刀锋，也许连蜘蛛的毒牙也能挡住。\n\n愿艾露恩保佑你。",cEN="I thank you, <class>. This will keep the blades out and maybe even the spider's fangs.\n\nMay Elune protect you."}
Q[28571]={d="我一直在静寂河岸追踪狼群，可我把箭袋丢在乌鸦岭附近了。现在肯定已经撕成碎片了，所以我需要一个新箭袋。\n\n你受过制皮训练？那你能替我做一个像样的重型箭袋吗。我要结实的，能装下足够撑过一整天的狩猎、再走回来的箭。",dEN="I've been tracking the wolves along the Hushed Bank, but I lost my quiver somewhere around Raven Hill. I'm sure it's torn to shreds now, so I need a new one.\n\nYou're trained in leatherworking? Well could you craft me a proper Heavy Quiver. I need something sturdy, with room for enough arrows to get through a long day's hunt and back again.",o="拉尔斯要你用制皮技能制作 1 个重型箭袋，并把货送到暮色森林静寂河岸营地的拉尔斯那里。",oEN="Lars wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Heavy Quiver and take the order to Lars at his camp on the Hushed Bank in Duskwood.",p="除非你给我一个背上的箭袋，否则我绝不靠近那些狼。",pEN="Unless you've got a quiver for my back, I'm not going anywhere near those wolves.",c="这才叫箭袋！扣得牢，活动也方便。多谢，<name>。今晚也许能睡得好一点。\n\n我在骗谁呢？在这片受诅咒的森林里，我永远睡不好。",cEN="Now that's a quiver! Holds tight, moves easy. Appreciate it, <name>. Might even sleep better tonight.\n\nWho am I kidding? I'll never sleep well in this accursed forest."}
Q[28572]={d="<class>，我最近听说了一段光荣事迹。在邪火岭，哨兵梅斯林在恶魔从南面涌来时坚守阵地，但也不是没有代价。她的护甲被烧焦，腰带整条断裂。她丢了武器，还有……呃……尊严，你明白我的意思。\n\n下一场战斗之前她得重新装备起来。如果你的制皮足够高深，就做几条暗皮腰带送到灰谷的林歌神殿给梅斯林。没时间可浪费了。我听说恶魔源源不断地涌来。",dEN="I heard a tale of glory recently, <class>. Out at Felfire Hill, Sentinel Maithryn stood her ground when the demons surged from the south, but not without cost. Her armor was scorched, and her belt torn clean through. She lost her weapon and her... uh... dignity, if you follow me.\n\nShe'll need to be equipped again before the next fight. If your leatherworking is advanced enough, craft a couple Dark Leather Belts and deliver it to Maithryn at Forest Song. There's no time to waste. I hear the demons just keep coming.",o="哈洛恩·暗织要你用制皮技能制作 2 条暗皮腰带，并把货送到灰谷林歌神殿的哨兵梅斯林那里。",oEN="Harlown Darkweave wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dark Leather Belt and take the order to Sentinel Maithryn at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="恶魔不会等，我的装备也不该等。我早知道母亲缝东西的时候就该认真看。\n\n当然了，那是三千年前的事了。",pEN="The demons don't wait, and neither should my gear. I knew I should have paid attention when my mother was sewing.\n\nOf course that was three thousand years ago.",c="皮子结实，合身。下次战斗时它能撑住。还有一条备用——太好了！多谢你，<name>。",cEN="Strong leather, good fit. This will hold the next time I'm in combat. And a spare -- nice! My thanks, <name>."}
Q[28573]={d="弗纳·奥斯古德在湖畔镇的马厩里干了很多年，在暴风城的王室似乎并不关心我们的时候，一直照顾着镇上的人。所以我们家才搬到这里来——以防兽人来袭……不过我用不着拿地方政治烦你。我需要你帮忙。\n\n我想委托你为弗纳制作一副非常特别的硬化皮手套。他新得了一匹小母马，特别爱拽缰绳，他那副旧手套磨得他满手水泡。就当是让弗纳保持工作状态，也算为赤脊山所有人尽一份力。",dEN="Verner Osgood's been working the stables in Lakeshire for years, looking after the people in town when the crown in Stormwind seems to care little about us. That's why my family came out here -- in case the orcs attacked... but I don't need to bore you with local politics. I could use your help.\n\nI'd like to commission you to craft Verner a very special pair of Toughened Leather Gloves. He's got a new filly that really likes to pull on the reins and his old gloves are leaving blisters behind. Consider keeping Verner in working order a service to all the people of Redridge.",o="克莱德·兰塔尔要你用制皮技能制作 1 副硬化皮手套，并把货送到赤脊山湖畔镇的弗纳·奥斯古德那里。",oEN="Clyde Ranthal wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Toughened Leather Gloves and take the order to Verner Osgood at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="别告诉我。你需要马蹄铁？",pEN="Don't tell me. You need horseshoes?",c="哎呀，真没想到。好久没人反过来照顾我了。你要是见到克莱德，替我跟他说声谢谢。这些补给也是给你的谢礼。",cEN="Well, I'll be. Been awhile since someone else looked out for me for a change. If you see Clyde, tell him thank you. And here's some supplies as thanks for you, too."}
Q[28574]={d="我看到你是怎么处理生皮的了。制皮师？我有份活儿给你。\n\n艾纳尔·石握是我最好的猎人——可他的手套快散架了，我也看腻了他用缠着布条的手指和固执的骄傲去搭箭。他不会主动要一副新的制箭师手套，那我来替他要。",dEN="I saw how you handled raw skins. Leatherworker? I've got a job for you.\n\nEinar Stonegrip's my best hunter -- but his gloves are falling apart, and I'm tired of watching him try to nock arrows with wrapped fingers and stubborn pride. He won't ask for some new Fletcher's Gloves, so I will.",o="詹姆斯·哈洛兰要你用制皮技能制作 1 副制箭师手套，并把货送到湿地绿带以南十字路口的艾纳尔·石握那里。",oEN="James Halloran wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fletcher's Gloves and take the order to Einar Stonegrip at the crossroads south of the Green Belt in Wetlands.",p="哈洛兰派你来的？那我猜你手里那副手套是给我的？",pEN="Halloran sent you? Then I'm guessing those gloves you're holding are meant for me?",c="<艾纳尔试了试手套，嘟囔了一声。>\n\n这手套没什么毛病，所以我没法退回去让他别再替我操心。我猜他也没付你钱吧？\n\n拿着，这是我上次狩猎剩下的一些补给。行了，走吧。",cEN="<Einar tries on the gloves and grumbles.>\n\nThere's nothin' wrong with them so I can't send them back and tell him to stop worryin' about me. And I suppose he didn't pay you either?\n\nHere, some supplies from my last hunt. Now, run along."}
Q[28575]={d="我们的看守者要抵御黑豹和鳄鱼、元素生物和发狂的鱼。他们制服这些家伙时，需要护腕来保护手腕。你看起来有摆弄皮子和针线的本事。你能帮帮他们吗？",dEN="Our Watchers defend from jaguars and crocolisks, elementals and frenzied fish. They could use bracers to protect their wrists while they wrangle these creatures. You seem like you have skill with hide and needle. Can you help them?",o="旅店老板芬米尔要你用制皮技能制作 6 副绿皮护腕，并把货送到悲伤沼泽避难营的看守者玛纳尔那里。",oEN="Innkeeper Finmir wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 6 Green Leather Bracers and take the order to Manaar the Watcher at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="你需要什么，外乡人？",pEN="What do you need, Outlander?",c="在这片陌生的土地上帮助我们，是一份善意。我们帮助帮助我们的人，所以收下这些补给，连同我的谢意。",cEN="It is a kindness to help us in this unfamiliar land. We help those who help us, so take these supplies with my thanks."}
Q[28576]={d="在尼耶尔前哨站这样的小据点，每个人都身兼数职。比如我，就负责收发消息。我这儿有一条你也许会感兴趣。\n\n科梅克小屋那边有个地精一直在打听制皮师。他说他\"出于生意上的原因\"需要一副新护肩。谁知道那是什么意思。\n\n也许能赚点金币？地精的口袋可深了……至少我这么听说。",dEN="In a tiny outpost like Nijel's Point we all handle more than one job. For example, I take and deliver messages. I've got one you might be interested in.\n\nSome goblin over at the hovel known as Kormek's Hut has been asking around for a leatherworker. Claims he needs new shoulders \"for business reasons.\" Whatever that means.\n\nCould be a good way to make some coin? Goblins have deep pockets... or so I've heard.",o="珍妮特·霍默斯要你用制皮技能制作 2 副野蛮护肩，并把货送到凄凉之地科梅克小屋的比布利·福兹巴克尔那里。",oEN="Janet Hommers wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Barbaric Shoulders and take the order to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut in Desolace.",p="我闻到新鲜皮革的味道了！护肩带来了吗？还是只是来看我这摊生意的？",pEN="I smell fresh leather! You got the shoulders? Or are you just here to admire my operation?",c="噢耶……这些正合适。空间够大，垫得也够厚。地精在谈判变得……激烈的时候就需要这个。你这双手不错，朋友！",cEN="Oh yeah... these'll do nicely. Plenty of room, plenty of padding. Just what a goblin needs when negotiations get... rough. You got good hands, friend!"}
Q[28577]={d="<class>，我看人很准，我猜……你是一位手艺不低的制皮师。\n\n费利西蒂的生日快到了，虽然她从不指望什么，我还是想送她点东西。我希望这份礼物既实用又雅致，还要有一点点出人意料。\n\n霜皮斗篷就再合适不过了。你对这活儿有兴趣吗？",dEN="I've got a good eye for evaluating people, <class>, and my guess is... you're a leatherworker of no small skill.\n\nFelicity's birthday is approaching, and while she'd never expect it, I'd like to get her something. I want the gift to be practical, elegant, and just a little unexpected.\n\nA Frost Leather Cloak would be just the thing. Are you interested in the work?",o="乔拉赫·雷文霍尔特领主。要你用制皮技能制作 1 件霜皮斗篷，并把货送到奥特兰克山脉雷文霍尔特庄园的乔拉赫·雷文霍尔特领主那里。",oEN="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Frost Leather Cloak and take the order to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt at Ravenholdt Manor in Alterac Mountains.",p="任务完成了吗？",pEN="Have you completed the task?",c="<name>，这活儿做得漂亮。我会向手下所有需要制作护甲的人推荐你。拿着，你的报酬。",cEN="This is a fine quality job, <name>. I shall recommend your services to any in my employ who need armor crafted. Here, your payment."}
Q[28578]={d="我口袋里装着工具，袖子里也装着工具，昨天还有一把扳手差点滚进下水道的格栅里。我侄女尼奥玛说我需要一条像样的腰带——具体来说，是几条暗色腰带。\n\n如果你受过制皮训练，就做几条送到这儿来。我不在乎它们长什么样，只要能挂住我的装备、又不会在压力下炸开就行。那是我自己的活儿。",dEN="I've got tools in my pockets, tools in my sleeves, and a spanner that nearly rolled into the sewer grate yesterday. My niece Nioma says I need a proper belt -- specifically, a couple of Dusky Belts.\n\nIf you're trained in leatherworking, craft a couple and bring them here. I don't care what they look like, so long as they hold my gear and don't explode under pressure. That's my job.",o="首席工程师乌鲁尔要你用制皮技能制作 2 条暗色腰带，并把货送到辛特兰鹰巢山的首席工程师乌鲁尔那里。",oEN="Chief Engineer Urul wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dusky Belt and take the order to Chief Engineer Urul at Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands.",p="你是带腰带来了，还是跟我侄女一样满嘴意见？",pEN="You bring the belt, or you just full of opinions like my niece?",c="嗯，这个不错。也结实。应该够我用。你可以告诉尼奥玛，她这次说对了。",cEN="Hmm, this is nice. And tough. Should do what I need. You can tell Nioma she was right -- this time."}
Q[28579]={d="你是制皮师？手上的茧子骗不了人。\n\n听着，让我抱怨一句——在这地方，普通的裤子根本不管用。海盗打得狠，太阳晒得更狠。我想要用龟壳做的裤子。那玩意儿硬得像食人魔的脑门。\n\n如果你的制皮手艺够好，就给我做几条龟鳞护腿。我要耐用的、灵活的、还能防海盗的。最好按这个顺序。",dEN="You a leatherworker? You've got the calluses.\n\nLook, let me complain for a minute -- regular pants just don't cut it out here. The pirates hit hard, and the sun hits harder. I want pants made out of turtle shells. Those things are tough as an ogre's forehead.\n\nIf you're skilled enough in leatherworking, craft me some Turtle Scale Leggings. I need something durable, flexible, and pirate-resistant. Ideally in that order.",o="保安官比尔吉威兹尔要你用制皮技能制作 2 条龟鳞护腿，并把货送到塔纳利斯热砂港的保安官比尔吉威兹尔那里。",oEN="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Turtle Scale Leggings and take the order to Security Chief Bilgewhizzle at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="你是给我送裤子来了，还是只来夸我穿着这条被海盗砸得坑坑洼洼的旧裤子还能活下来？",pEN="You bringin' me some pants, or just compliments about surviving the pirate dents in my old ones?",c="这才叫裤子！防护扎实，活动方便——那些海盗肯定恨死它了。干得好！",cEN="Now these are pants! Solid protection, good movement -- those pirates are gonna hate these. Nice work!"}
Q[28580]={d="那个矮人葛瑞根在菲拉斯的荒野里待的时间，比大多数路过这里的德鲁伊都长。他捎信来要一个新箭袋，要那种快捷箭袋。他需要不会被森林湿气弄散架的东西。\n\n我可绝不会迈出羽月要塞一步，<先生/女士>！不过你有手艺做那种东西，对吧？",dEN="The dwarf, Gregan, has been out in the wilds of Feralas longer than most druids who pass through here. He sent me a note requesting a new Quickdraw Quiver. Needs something that won't fall apart in the forest's humidity.\n\nYou won't catch me stepping foot out of Feathermoon, no <sir/ma'am>! But you've got the skill to craft one of those, don't you?",o="普拉特·麦克格鲁本要你用制皮技能制作 1 个快捷箭袋，并把货送到菲拉斯双塔山附近营地的葛瑞根·酿酒者那里。",oEN="Pratt McGrubben wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Quickdraw Quiver and take the order to Gregan Brewspewer at his camp near the Twin Colossals in Feralas.",p="<class>，我已经沦落到把箭塞进腰带环里了。",pEN="I've been reduced to shoving arrows in my belt loops, <class>.",c="啊，这正是我需要的，$g伙计:姑娘;！谢谢你冒着荒野的危险把它送来给我。",cEN="Ah, that's just what I need $glad:lassie,! You have my thanks for braving the wilds to bring this to me."}
Q[28581]={d="嘿——一位真正的制皮师！那股皮革和深岩盐的味道我到哪儿都认得。\n\n说到这个……我正犯难呢。我答应过一位叫克罗米的小侏儒，要为她盐渍一张熟化厚皮，可我的盐罐不见了，方圆几里又再没有别的制皮师。\n\n也许你可以代劳？还有个问题是，她在那边……安多哈尔的废墟里。而我不太擅长打架。可你看起来像。",dEN="Hey -- a real leatherworker! I'd recognize that smell of leather and deeprock salt anywhere.\n\nSpeaking of... I'm in a real pickle. See I promised this little gnome named Chromie that I'd salt up a Cured Rugged Hide for her, but my salt shaker is gone and there's not exactly another leatherworker around for miles.\n\nMaybe you could do it? You see, the other problem is that she's over there... in the ruins of Andorhol. And I'm not exactly the fighting sort. But you look like you are.",o="伦纳德·波特要你用制皮技能制作 1 张熟化厚皮，并把货送到西瘟疫之地安多哈尔的克罗米那里。",oEN="Leonard Porter wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Cured Rugged Hide and take the order to Chromie at Andorhol in Western Plaguelands.",p="早上好，<name>。如果对你来说不是早上，别在意。很快就到早上了。",pEN="Good morning to you, <name>. If it's not morning for you, don't worry about it. It will be, soon.",c="太好了！连我有时也需要些凡俗的补给，而你来得正是时候！让我送你一些补给作为答谢。我看得出，你以后会需要这些的。",cEN="Excellent! Even I need mundane supplies sometimes and you arrived right on time! Let me give you some supplies as thanks. I can see you'll need these in the future."}
Q[28582]={d="噢！我说，你不是制皮师……对吧？\n\n运气真好！是这样的，我们刚收到利基·卡特斯帕克的消息，那是一位在安戈洛研究古老精灵废墟的侏儒。她的同伴杰丽莎受了伤，靴子也毁了。好像跟焦油和毒药有关。总之，她们需要几双新的夜行靴。这事你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Oh! Say, you're not a leatherworker... are you?\n\nWhat luck! You see we just received a message from Leakey Cartspark, a gnome who is studying the old elven ruins in Un'goro. Her partner Jaylssa was injured and her boots were ruined. Something about tar and poison. Anyway, they could use a couple pairs of new Nightscape Boots. Is that something you could help with?",o="威利登·马歇尔要你用制皮技能制作 2 双夜行靴，并把货送到安戈洛环形山恐怖之途的利基·卡特斯帕克那里。",oEN="Williden Marshal wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Nightscape Boots and take the order to Leakey Cartspark at Terror Run in Un'Goro Crater.",p="能在荒野里遇到一位制皮师，运气真好！",pEN="What luck to encounter a leatherworker here in the wilds!",c="<name>，我真不知该怎么谢你。我可不乐意光着脚从这里跋涉出去。等杰丽莎好一些，我们就回羽月要塞去。",cEN="I can't thank you enough, <name>. I wasn't looking forward to trudging out of here in my bare feet. Once Jaylssa is feeling better, we'll make our way back to Feathermoon Stronghold."}
Q[28583]={d="一位有志气的制皮师？介意帮我处理几份订单吗？\n\n剃刀岭的索塔尔订了一个新箭袋。他说旧的那个快散架了，箭都从缝里戳出来了。那可不是闹着玩的。\n\n这对初学者来说是份不错的活计。做一个轻皮箭袋，送到马厩那边给他。就当是练习，也算为部落尽一份力。",dEN="An aspiring leatherworker? Mind helping out with a few orders?\n\nThotar over at Razor Hill put in an order for a new quiver. He says his old one's falling apart, arrows poking through the seams. Dangerous business, that.\n\nThis is a good task for a beginner to take on. Craft a Light Leather Quiver and deliver it to him at the stables. Consider it both practice and service to the Horde.",o="卡玛瑞要你用制皮技能制作 1 个轻皮箭袋，并把货送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭的索塔尔那里。",oEN="Kamari wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Light Leather Quiver and take the order to Thotar at Razor Hill in Durotar.",p="你看见我背上背着箭袋了吗？那我猜我们的事还没办完。",pEN="You see a quiver on my back? Then I guess we're not done here.",c="缝得结实，皮子也干净……走路时还不会戳我。上一个可做不到这一点。<class>，这活儿可以。",cEN="Sturdy stitching, clean leather... and it doesn't stab me when I walk. That's more than I can say for the last one. Acceptable work, <class>."}
Q[28584]={d="如果你愿意，这儿还有一单：罗卡尔说他一直在剃刀岭东北\"务农\"。据我听说，与其说是收割，不如说是乱挥乱打。据说他爬出枯竭峡谷时把裤子撕了。\n\n要是你想练练手，就做几条手缝皮裤给他送去。他的农场就在峡谷上方，剃刀岭城外。",dEN="If you're willing, here's another one: Rokar says he's been \"farming\" northeast of Razor Hill. From what I hear, it's more flailing than harvesting. Apparently, he ripped his pants climbing out of Drygulch Ravine.\n\nIf you're up for the practice, craft a couple pairs of Handstitched Leather Pants and bring them to him. His farm is up above the gulch, outside of Razor Hill.",o="卡玛瑞要你用制皮技能制作 2 条手缝皮裤，并把货送到杜隆塔尔剃刀岭东北、枯竭峡谷上方农场的罗卡尔·刃影那里。",oEN="Kamari wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Handstitched Leather Pants and take the order to Rokar Bladeshadow at his farm northeast of Razor Hill above Drygulch Ravine in Durotar.",p="新裤子？听着，我知道这听起来像什么，可我真的在务农。",pEN="New pants? Look, I know how this sounds, but I really was farming.",c="这些……真不错。比一个老农夫应得的还好。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="These are... real nice. More than an old farmer deserves. Thanks, <name>."}
Q[28585]={d="又一位制皮学徒？也许你不介意帮我处理几份积压的订单？\n\n赞根·石蹄在仪式之火上把上一件烧焦了，需要一件新的压花皮背心。这活儿不难，如果你愿意接的话。",dEN="Another leatherworking apprentice? Maybe you wouldn't mind helping me with a few of these back orders?\n\nZangen Stonehoof needs a new Embossed Leather Vest after scorching the last one at the ritual fire. This is an easy one, if you don't mind taking it on.",o="查乌·厚皮要你用制皮技能制作 2 件压花皮背心，并把货送到莫高雷雷霆崖高地的赞根·石蹄那里。",oEN="Chaw Stronghide wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Embossed Leather Vest and take the order to Zangen Stonehoof at the upper rise of Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="离火远一点，年轻人。",pEN="Stand back from the fire, young one.",c="<class>，我感谢你。我会自豪地穿上它。",cEN="You have my thanks, <class>. I shall wear this with pride."}
Q[28586]={d="赞根的兄弟梅洛尔是位出色的猎人。他也下了订单，我希望这一单由你来办。\n\n做几个小皮弹药包，送到雷霆崖猎人高地的梅洛尔那里。他刚从一位工程师那儿订了新枪，想试试新的弹药。",dEN="Zangen's brother, Melor, is a great hunter. He also put in an order and I'd like for you to handle this one.\n\nCraft a couple Small Leather Ammo Pouches and take them to Melor on the Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff. He's just ordered a new gun from an engineer, and wants to try out some new ammunition.",o="查乌·厚皮要你用制皮技能制作 2 个小皮弹药包，并把货送到莫高雷雷霆崖猎人高地的梅洛尔·石蹄那里。",oEN="Chaw Stronghide wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Small Leather Ammo Pouch and take the order to Melor Stonehoof at the Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="<class>，狩猎进行得如何？",pEN="How goes the hunt, <class>?",c="让我们看看，<name>。\n\n完美。大小正合适。谢谢你，愿大地母亲在你钻研手艺时指引你的双手。",cEN="Let's have a look at this, <name>.\n\nPerfect. Just the right size. Thank you, and may the Earthmother guide your hands as you explore your craft."}
Q[28587]={d="看到那边的雪琳了吗。这些天新崛起的被遗忘者订单多得把她压垮了。但我见过你跟她说话，我知道你能接手一些。所以我要交给你一项任务。\n\n谢尔顿·格里姆斯比出发去壁垒了，任务是寻找伟大的游侠纳萨诺斯·玛瑞斯，但我知道他不会成功。为什么？因为他穿着一条撑不过旅途的破裤子。所以给他做几条硬甲皮短裤，我们看看他能不能在白银之手面前保住脸面。",dEN="See Shelene over there. She's bogged down with orders from all the newly risen Forsaken these days. But I've seen you talking to her and I know you can take some of these on. So I'm charging you with a task.\n\nSheldon Grimsby headed out for the Bulwark on a mission to find the great ranger Nathanos Marris, but I know he won't succeed. Why? Because he's wearing torn pants that won't survive the trip. So craft him a couple pairs of Rugged Leather Pants and we'll see if he can avoid embarrassing himself in front of the Argent Dawn.",o="亡灵卫兵林尼亚要你用制皮技能制作 2 条硬甲皮短裤，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地壁垒的谢尔顿·格里姆斯比那里。",oEN="Deathguard Linnea wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Rugged Leather Pants and take the order to Sheldon Grimsby at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.",p="我的新裤子呢？别担心；我自己那条已经补了三次了。",pEN="Do you have my new pants? Don't worry; I've patched mine three times already.",c="谢谢。现在我只差鼓起勇气踏进瘟疫之地了。",cEN="Thank you. Now I just have to work up the courage to venture into the Plaguelands."}
Q[28588]={d="你见过奥利弗·德沃尔吗？他是布瑞尔的武器匠，恕我直言，手艺很不错。打造武器一流，做衣服一塌糊涂。简单说，他需要一条腰带。\n\n我们也许是不死之身，但火照样会烧，我可不想看着他的裤子因为系不住而从熔炉边烧起来。所以给他做一条手缝皮腰带，我们就都能免于意外了。",dEN="Have you met Oliver Dwor? He's the weaponsmith in Brill and he's a fine one if I do say so myself. Great with weapons, rubbish with clothing. In short, he needs a belt.\n\nWe might be undead, but fire still burns and I don't want to see his pants catch on fire from the forge because he couldn't keep them upright on his body. So craft him a Handstitched Leather Belt and we'll avoid any accidents.",o="亡灵卫兵林尼亚要你用制皮技能制作 1 条手缝皮腰带，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔的奥利弗·德沃尔那里。",oEN="Deathguard Linnea wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Handstitched Leather Belt and take the order to Oliver Dwor at Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="你想干什么？",pEN="What do you want?",c="我的裤子关林尼亚什么事！不过安全方面她说得也有道理。谢了，我会用上这条腰带的。",cEN="My pants are none of Linnea's business! But she does have a point about safety. Thanks. I'll make use of this belt."}
Q[28589]={d="你好，<race>。我和我的朋友穆拉都不是本地人。我猜这很明显。\n\n我们没料到银松森林会这么……冷。尤其是夜里。如果你有这门手艺，我希望你为我做几条暗皮靴。这样我在这儿等学徒的时候，蹄子就不会冻僵了。",dEN="Greetings, <race>. My friend Mura here, and I, are not from around here. I suppose that is obvious.\n\nWe were not prepared for how... cold Silverpine Forest is. Especially at night. If you have the skill, I'd like you to craft me a couple pairs of Dark Leather Boots. That will keep my hooves from freezing as I wait here for my apprentice.",o="智者格里恩霍恩要你用制皮技能制作 2 双暗皮靴，并把货送到银松森林瑟伯切尔的智者格里恩霍恩那里。",oEN="Sage Greenhorn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dark Leather Boots and take the order to Sage Greenhorn at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="我不知道我的蹄子还能这么疼。",pEN="I didn't know that my hooves could ache like this.",c="<name>，我由衷地感谢你。请收下这些补给，连同我的报酬。",cEN="You have my deepest appreciation, <name>. Please, take these supplies with my payment."}
Q[28590]={d="我站在这儿把蹄子冻得发僵，穆拉则被海上吹来的寒风冻得直抖，那风穿过起伏的山谷，像女妖的尖叫。\n\n你能不能为她做一件既能挡风又能挡雨的优质皮斗篷？",dEN="While I stand here freezing my hooves off, Mura shudders from the cold wind that comes off the sea and whips through the hilly valleys like a banshee's scream.\n\nCould you possibly craft her a Fine Leather Cloak that will keep out both the wind and the rain?",o="智者格里恩霍恩要你用制皮技能制作 1 件优质皮斗篷，并把货送到银松森林瑟伯切尔的穆拉·符文图腾那里。",oEN="Sage Greenhorn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Cloak and take the order to Mura Runetotem at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="必须……让牙齿……停下来……别打颤。",pEN="Must... stop... teeth from... chattering.",c="啊，真是舒服。几乎和大地母亲的温暖一样好。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ahh, blessed relief. Almost as good as the Earthmother's warmth. I thank you, <class>."}
Q[28591]={d="一位制皮师？是的，你就是我在幻象中看到的那个人。我做梦时看到你施展手艺去帮助法拉，她就住在这座山的山顶上。她需要几件中型护甲片。\n\n你会帮她的，对吧？",dEN="A leatherworker? Yes, you are the one I saw in my vision. I was dreaming and I saw you using your skill to help Falla, who lives on top of this very mountain. She is in need of several Medium Armor Kits.\n\nYou will help her, won't you?",o="纳尔帕克要你用制皮技能制作 5 件中型护甲片，并把货送到贫瘠之地哀嚎洞穴山顶住所的法拉·贤风那里。",oEN="Nalpak wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 5 Medium Armor Kit and take the order to Falla Sagewind at her home atop Wailing Caverns in the Barrens.",p="嗯……是吗？不是？你就是……带护甲片来的人吗？纳尔帕克梦到过你的到来。",pEN="Mm... yes? No? Are you the one... with the armor kits? Nalpak dreamed of your coming.",c="啊……是的。分量很轻，但强度……持久。谢谢你，朋友。即使在梦里，我们也需要保护。",cEN="Ah... yes. The weight is light, but the strength... enduring. Thank you, friend. Even in dreams, we need protection."}
Q[28592]={d="在梦中的幻象里，我还看到你手里拿着一件优质皮外套。我想那是给十字路口的加兹罗格的。他在跟几只迅猛龙搏斗时撕破了衬衫，一直瞒着同伴。你给他带一件新的去，他会松一口气的。",dEN="In my dream vision I also saw you with a Fine Leather Tunic in hand. I think it is meant for Gazrog at the Crossroads. He tore his shirt in a fight with several raptors and he has been hiding the damage from his comrades. He will be relieved when you bring him a new one.",o="纳尔帕克要你用制皮技能制作 1 件优质皮外套，并把货送到贫瘠之地十字路口的加兹罗格那里。",oEN="Nalpak wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Tunic and take the order to Gazrog at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",p="纳尔帕克派你来的？我根本不知道那是谁。",pEN="Nalpak sent you? I don't even know who that is.",c="好吧，不管那个纳尔帕克是谁，他说得没错。我确实需要一件新的胸甲，这件能用。有点奇怪……不过还是谢谢。",cEN="Well, whomever this Nalpak was, they were right. I do need some new chest armor and this will work. Kind of weird... but thanks."}
Q[28593]={d="噢，一位受过训练的制皮师。我们这儿正需要你帮忙。克鲁姆莫已经忙不过来了，可他不肯承认。他刚完成精通训练，心里紧张，却还硬撑着摆出一副勇敢的样子。\n\n如果你能帮帮他，我从他那儿借了几张订单。玛伦·天眼订了几条轻皮短裤。你可以做好后送到棘齿城外面海边的她家里去。",dEN="Oh, a trained leatherworker. We could use your help here. Krulmoo is overwhelmed but he won't admit it. He's trying to show a brave face, even though he's nervous -- he just completed his mastery training.\n\nIf you could help him out, I borrowed a few of his order slips. Mahren Skyseer requested a couple pairs of Light Leather Pants. You can craft them and deliver them to her at her home on the coast out past Ratchet.",o="鲁加·怒图腾要你用制皮技能制作 2 条轻皮短裤，并把货送到贫瘠之地提度斯阶梯的玛伦·天眼那里。",oEN="Ruga Ragetotem wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Light Leather Pants and take the order to Mahren Skyseer at the Tidus Stair in the Barrens.",p="你好，<name>。今天你那里的天空如何？",pEN="Greetings, <name>. How is the sky with you today?",c="感谢你如此用心地把这些送到我手上。请收下这些补给，连同大地母亲的祝福。",cEN="I thank you for your diligence in delivering these to me. Please, take these supplies with the Earthmother's blessing."}
Q[28594]={d="愿意再接一单吗？嗯……这张便条上没写名字。只有一行潦草的字：\"一条优质皮腰带\"。算了。你做好腰带送到克鲁姆莫那里就行。他会负责把它送到该去的地方。",dEN="Willing to take on another task? Hmm... this note has no name on it. Just a scribbled line saying \"One Fine Leather Belt\". Oh well. You can just craft the belt and take it to Krulmoo. He can handle the appropriate delivery.",o="鲁加·怒图腾要你用制皮技能制作 1 条优质皮腰带，并把货送到贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的克鲁姆莫·满月那里。",oEN="Ruga Ragetotem wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fine Leather Belt and take the order to Krulmoo Fullmoon at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",p="噢，抱歉。我很忙，不过有什么我能帮你的吗？",pEN="Oh, I'm sorry. I'm quite busy, but how can I help you?",c="谢谢你，也谢谢鲁加的帮忙。我自己需要这条腰带配裤子——我的好像不知道放哪儿去了。来，让我给你补些材料作为答谢。",cEN="I thank you and Ruga for assisting. I needed this belt for my own pants. I seem to have misplaced mine. Here, let me restock your materials as thanks."}
Q[28595]={d="制皮师，我需要你的帮忙。奉大酋长之命，我正设法让这里的部队保持状态，可补给短缺。我一边要照料碎木岗哨的需求，也不能忽视我们的斥候和游骑兵。\n\n做一批重型护甲片，送到驻扎在莫尔杉壁垒、贫瘠之地入口处的部队那里。我们不能让壁垒落入银翼的攻势之下，否则就会被切断与南方部队的联系。",dEN="I could use your assistance, leatherworker. At the behest of the Warchief, I am trying to get the troops into shape here and there is a shortage of supplies. While I am attending to the needs of Splintertree Post, I can't neglect our scouts and outriders.\n\nCraft a handful of Heavy Armor Kits and deliver them to our troops stationed at the Mor'shan Rampart, at the entrance to the Barrens. We cannot allow the Rampart to fall to the Silverwing advance or we will be cut off from our forces in the south.",o="希瑞斯要你用制皮技能制作 5 件重型护甲片，并把货送到灰谷莫尔杉壁垒的卡德拉克那里。",oEN="Xirith wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 5 Heavy Armor Kit and take the order to Kadrak at the Mor'shan Rampart in Ashenvale.",p="我从没想过会有这么荒蛮的地方。跟德拉诺完全不同。",pEN="I never imagined such wild country as this. So different from Draenor.",c="谢谢你，<class>。这能挡住精灵的刀锋，也许连蜘蛛的毒牙也能挡住。\n\n为了部落！",cEN="I thank you, <class>. This will keep the elvish blades out and maybe even the spider's fangs.\n\nFor the Horde!"}
Q[28596]={d="一位名叫塔洛的猎人一直在塔伦米尔边界追踪山狮，可他把箭袋丢在绞刑架角附近了。我敢说食人魔现在已经把它撕成碎片了，他得换个新的。\n\n你受过制皮训练？那你可以给他做一个像样的重型箭袋。他需要结实的，能装下足够撑过一整天狩猎、再走回来的箭。别担心他的宠物。他在镇上时会把那头凶家伙拴在马厩里。",dEN="A hunter named Tallow had been tracking the mountain lions along the edge of Tarren Mill, but he lost his quiver somewhere around Gallow's Corner. I'm sure the ogres have torn it to shreds by now, so he'll need a new one.\n\nYou're trained in leatherworking? Well you could craft him a proper Heavy Quiver. He'll need something sturdy, with room for enough arrows to get through a long day's hunt and back again. And don't worry about his pet. He keeps that vicious thing stabled when he's in town.",o="乔治·坎达特要你用制皮技能制作 1 个重型箭袋，并把货送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵塔伦米尔的塔洛那里。",oEN="George Candarte wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Heavy Quiver and take the order to Tallow at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="除非你带了箭袋给我背，否则我绝不靠近那些山狮。",pEN="Unless you've got a quiver for my back, I'm not going anywhere near those mountain lions.",c="这才叫箭袋！扣得牢，活动也方便。多谢，<name>。今晚也许能睡得好一点。\n\n我在骗谁呢？在这种该死的状态下，我永远睡不好。",cEN="Now that's a quiver! Holds tight, moves easy. Appreciate it, <name>. Might even sleep better tonight.\n\nWho am I kidding? I'll never sleep well in this accursed state."}
Q[28597]={d="你好，<name>。你对针线和皮革有几分手艺吗？我想弄几条暗皮腰带当礼物，让父母下次来乱风岗探望时带回家，可我们这里没有常驻的制皮师。\n\n如果你能接下这单，我很乐意付你报酬，再加上我上次狩猎剩下的一些皮子。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Do you have any skill with a needle and leather? I'd like to get a couple Dark Leather Belts as gifts for my parents to take home from their upcoming visit to Freewind Post but we have no leatherworker in residence.\n\nIf you can take this commission, I'll be happy to pay you and throw in some skins from my last hunt.",o="斯塔恩要你用制皮技能制作 2 条暗皮腰带，并把货送到千针石林乱风岗的斯塔恩那里。",oEN="Starn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dark Leather Belt and take the order to Starn at Freewind Post in Thousand Needles.",p="自从父母搬到雷霆崖，我就没见过他们了。",pEN="I haven't seen my parents since they moved to Thunder Bluff.",c="这些腰带又结实又时髦。谢谢你这么快就完成了订单。如约奉上你的报酬。",cEN="These belts are strong and stylish. Thank you for completing this order so quickly. As promised, here is your payment."}
Q[28598]={d="战争结束后，达恩·巨爪一直驻守在玛拉卡金。即使在困难处境中，他也是一位优秀的指挥官。我敬重他胜过大多数兽人。\n\n我想委托你为达恩制作一副非常特别的硬化皮手套。他最近遭遇了挫折，开始怀疑自己的领导力。我想提醒他，他受人尊敬、被人看重。就当是让达恩保持战斗状态，也算为部落尽一份力。",dEN="Darn Talongrip's been stationed at Malaka'jin since the war ended. He's a good commander, even in difficult situations. I respect him more than most orcs.\n\nI'd like to commission you to craft Darn a very special pair of Toughened Leather Gloves. He's recently had a setback that has made him question his leadership. I want to remind him that he is honored and valued. Consider keeping Darn in working order a service to the Horde.",o="玛格伦·缚地者要你用制皮技能制作 1 副硬化皮手套，并把货送到石爪山脉玛拉卡金的达恩·巨爪那里。",oEN="Maggran Earthbinder wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Toughened Leather Gloves and take the order to Darn Talongrip at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="你带了玛格伦的口信吗？",pEN="Do you carry a message from Maggran?",c="哎呀，真让我吃惊。我还以为那头老牛跟我过不去呢。他总是那么粗暴又刻薄。不过，也许士兵的生活就是这样吧。<class>，谢谢你这番提醒。",cEN="Well, color me shocked. I thought that old bull had it out for me. He's always so gruff and cynical. But that is a soldier's life, I suppose. Thank you for this reminder, <class>."}
Q[28599]={d="我看到你是怎么处理生皮的了。制皮师？我有份活儿给你。\n\n萨曼莎·疾蹄来荆棘谷是为了治好她的跛脚。但我看得出来，她已经开始接受猎人那种潜行与狙击的生活了。替她做一副制箭师手套，行吗？我本可以自己做，但我问她的问题太多了，不想让她以为我对她有意思。或者别的什么。\n\n<布劳恩咳了一声。>",dEN="I saw how you handled raw skins. Leatherworker? I've got a job for you.\n\nSamantha Swifthoof came to Stranglethorn seeking a cure for her lame foot. But I can see that she's beginning to embrace the hunter's life of stealth and sniping. Make her a pair of Fletcher's Gloves, will you? I'd do it, but I've asked her too many questions and I don't want her to think I'm sweet on her. Or anything like that.\n\n<Brawn coughs.>",o="布劳恩要你用制皮技能制作 1 副制箭师手套，并把货送到荆棘谷大路上巡逻的萨曼莎·疾蹄那里。",oEN="Brawn wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Fletcher's Gloves and take the order to Samantha Swifthoof at her patrol on the main road in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="布劳恩派你来的？那我猜你手里那副手套是给我的？",pEN="Brawn sent you? Then I'm guessing those gloves you're holding are meant for me?",c="他说狩猎似乎很适合我的生活，这话没错。但我还没放弃恢复速度的希望。<class>，谢谢你的这份礼物。",cEN="He's right that the hunt seems a good fit for my life. But I'm not giving up hope that I can recover my speed yet. I thank you for this gift, <class>."}
Q[28600]={d="我们的斥候要抵御黑豹和鳄鱼、元素生物和发狂的鱼。他们制服这些家伙时，需要护腕来保护手腕。你看起来有摆弄皮子和针线的本事。你能帮帮他们吗？",dEN="Our scouts defend from jaguars and crocolisks, elementals and frenzied fish. They could use bracers to protect their wrists while they wrangle these creatures. You seem like you have skill with hide and needle. Can you help them?",o="祖恩达尔莎要你用制皮技能制作 6 副绿皮护腕，并把货送到悲伤沼泽迷雾苇哨的托克卡那里。",oEN="Zun'dartha wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 6 Green Leather Bracers and take the order to Tok'Kar at Misty Reed Post in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="<class>，你需要什么？",pEN="What do you need, <class>?",c="在这片悲惨的土地上帮助我们，是一份善意。我们帮助帮助我们的人，所以收下这些补给，连同我的谢意。",cEN="It is a kindness to help us in this wretched land. We help those who help us, so take these supplies with my thanks."}
Q[28601]={d="在鬼行哨这样的小据点，我们大家都会出力帮助凄凉之地的其他人。这意味着我手上的订单多得处理不完，正需要你帮忙。\n\n科梅克小屋那边有个地精一直在打听制皮师。他说他\"出于生意上的原因\"需要一副新护肩。谁知道那是什么意思。\n\n也许能赚点钱？地精的口袋可深了……至少我这么听说。",dEN="In a tiny outpost like Ghost Walker we all pitch in to help others in Desolace. This means I have more orders than I can handle, and I could use your help.\n\nSome goblin over at the hovel known as Kormek's Hut has been asking around for a leatherworker. Claims he needs new shoulders \"for business reasons.\" Whatever that means.\n\nCould be a good way to make some coin? Goblins have deep pockets... or so I've heard.",o="纳尔夫·制皮者要你用制皮技能制作 2 副野蛮护肩，并把货送到凄凉之地科梅克小屋的比布利·福兹巴克尔那里。",oEN="Narv Hidecrafter wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Barbaric Shoulders and take the order to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut in Desolace.",p="我闻到新鲜皮革的味道了！护肩带来了吗？还是只是来看我这摊生意的？",pEN="I smell fresh leather! You got the shoulders? Or are you just here to admire my operation?",c="噢耶……这些正合适。空间够大，垫得也够厚。地精在谈判变得……激烈的时候就需要这个。你这双手不错，朋友！",cEN="Oh yeah... these'll do nicely. Plenty of room, plenty of padding. Just what a goblin needs when negotiations get... rough. You got good hands, friend!"}
Q[28602]={d="<class>，我看人很准，我猜……你是一位手艺不低的制皮师。\n\n费利西蒂的生日快到了，虽然她从不指望什么，我还是想送她点东西。我希望这份礼物既实用又雅致，还要有一点点出人意料。\n\n霜皮斗篷就再合适不过了。你对这活儿有兴趣吗？",dEN="I've got a good eye for evaluating people, <class>, and my guess is... you're a leatherworker of no small skill.\n\nFelicity's birthday is approaching, and while she'd never expect it, I'd like to get her something. I want the gift to be practical, elegant, and just a little unexpected.\n\nA Frost Leather Cloak would be just the thing. Are you interested in the work?",o="乔拉赫·雷文霍尔特领主。要你用制皮技能制作 1 件霜皮斗篷，并把货送到奥特兰克山脉雷文霍尔特庄园的乔拉赫·雷文霍尔特领主那里。",oEN="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Frost Leather Cloak and take the order to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt at Ravenholdt Manor in Alterac Mountains.",p="任务完成了吗？",pEN="Have you completed the task?",c="<name>，这活儿做得漂亮。我会向手下所有需要制作护甲的人推荐你。拿着，你的报酬。",cEN="This is a fine quality job, <name>. I shall recommend your services to any in my employ who need armor crafted. Here, your payment."}
Q[28603]={d="我有一大堆制皮材料，可自己半点手艺也没有。这就麻烦了，因为几次骰子运气不好，我欠了法迪尔海湾的洛洛几条新腰带。\n\n别问我为什么……他就是想用这种方式抵债。\n\n总之，没有腰带我就不敢在那儿露面，你能帮我一把吗？",dEN="I've got loads of leatherworking supplies, but no skill with the craft myself. That's a problem, because thanks to a couple unlucky rolls of the dice, I owe Lolo down at Faldir's Cove a couple new belts.\n\nDon't ask me why... that's just how he wanted the debt paid.\n\nAnyway, I can't show my face around there without them, so could you help me out?",o="图恩克要你用制皮技能制作 2 条暗色腰带，并把货送到阿拉希高地法迪尔海湾的望风者洛洛那里。",oEN="Tunkk wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Dusky Belt and take the order to Lolo the Lookout at Faldir's Cove in Arathi Highlands.",p="腰带带来了吗，小不点<race>？",pEN="You bring the belts, puny <race>?",c="行。兽人还债了。他可以再来做客。还能再输掉衣服！哈。哈！",cEN="OK. Orc pay his debt. He can come back and visit again. Lose more clothing too! Ha. Ha!"}
Q[28604]={d="你是制皮师？手上的茧子骗不了人。\n\n听着，让我抱怨一句——在这地方，普通的裤子根本不管用。海盗打得狠，太阳晒得更狠。我想要用龟壳做的裤子。那玩意儿硬得像食人魔的脑门。\n\n如果你的制皮手艺够好，就给我做几条龟鳞护腿。我要耐用的、灵活的、还能防海盗的。最好按这个顺序。",dEN="You a leatherworker? You've got the calluses.\n\nLook, let me complain for a minute -- regular pants just don't cut it out here. The pirates hit hard, and the sun hits harder. I want pants made out of turtle shells. Those things are tough as an ogre's forehead.\n\nIf you're skilled enough in leatherworking, craft me some Turtle Scale Leggings. I need something durable, flexible, and pirate-resistant. Ideally in that order.",o="保安官比尔吉威兹尔要你用制皮技能制作 2 条龟鳞护腿，并把货送到塔纳利斯热砂港的保安官比尔吉威兹尔那里。",oEN="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Turtle Scale Leggings and take the order to Security Chief Bilgewhizzle at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="你是给我送裤子来了，还是只来夸我穿着这条被海盗砸得坑坑洼洼的旧裤子还能活下来？",pEN="You bringin' me some pants, or just compliments about surviving the pirate dents in my old ones?",c="这才叫裤子！防护扎实，活动方便——那些海盗肯定恨死它了。干得好！",cEN="Now these are pants! Solid protection, good movement -- those pirates are gonna hate these. Nice work!"}
Q[28605]={d="那个矮人葛瑞根在菲拉斯的荒野里待的时间，比大多数路过这里的德鲁伊都长。他捎信来要一个新箭袋，要那种快捷箭袋。他需要不会被森林湿气弄散架的东西。\n\n你可别指望我迈出莫沙彻营地一步！不过你有手艺做那种东西，对吧？",dEN="The dwarf, Gregan, has been out in the wild of Feralas longer than most druids who pass through here. He sent me a note requesting a new Quickdraw Quiver. Needs something that won't fall apart in the forest's humidity.\n\nYou won't catch me stepping foot out of Camp Mojache! But you've got the skill to craft one of those, don't you?",o="扬格多尔·捷足要你用制皮技能制作 1 个快捷箭袋，并把货送到菲拉斯双塔山附近营地的葛瑞根·酿酒者那里。",oEN="Jangdor Swiftstrider wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Quickdraw Quiver and take the order to Gregan Brewspewer at his camp near the Twin Colossals in Feralas.",p="<class>，我已经沦落到把箭塞进腰带环里了。",pEN="I've been reduced to shoving arrows in my belt loops, <class>.",c="啊，这正是我需要的，$g伙计:姑娘;！谢谢你冒着荒野的危险把它送来给我。",cEN="Ah, that's just what I need $glad:lassie,! You have my thanks for braving the wilds to bring this to me."}
Q[28606]={d="一位有天赋的制皮师！那股皮革和深岩盐的味道我到哪儿都认得。\n\n说到这个……我需要你的手艺。这片森林里的邪能腐化已经开始在我帐篷的承重皮子上蚀出一个洞，我需要一张熟化厚皮来补，否则整顶帐篷都会塌到我们头上！\n\n如果你能给我弄到那张皮，我会非常感激。",dEN="A talented leatherworker! I'd recognize that smell of leather and deeprock salt anywhere.\n\nSpeaking of... I have need of your skills. The fel corruption in these woods has started to eat a hole in the structural leather of my tent and I need a Cured Rugged Hide to patch it or the whole thing will come tumbling down on top of our heads!\n\nIf you could supply me with that hide, I would be grateful.",o="塔罗恩·红羽要你用制皮技能制作 1 张熟化厚皮，并把货送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的塔罗恩·红羽那里。",oEN="Taronn Redfeather wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 1 Cured Rugged Hide and take the order to Taronn Redfeather at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="我们的治疗魔法能延缓邪能腐化，但无法永远挡住它。",pEN="Our healing magic will stave off the fel corruption, but not eternally.",c="太好了！这能加固并补上那个洞，为我们争取更多时间来研究终结这场腐化的办法。请收下这些补给，作为我的谢意。",cEN="Excellent! This will reinforce and patch the hole and give us many more months of time to research a way to end this corruption. Please take these supplies as my thanks."}
Q[28607]={d="噢！既然你是制皮师，我能再求你帮个忙吗？\n\n我欠卡玛瑞的，这辈子都还不清。她是我孩子的母亲，还一直忍受我大半时间不在家。差不多吧。\n\n总之，我手头现在没有皮子，但如果你能做几双夜行靴送到她奥格瑞玛暗巷区的店里，我会很感激的，兄弟。",dEN="Oh! Since ya be a leatherworker, can I ask one more favor of ya?\n\nI owe Kamari more than I can ever repay. She be da mother of my children and she put up with me being gone much o' da time. Mostly.\n\nAnyway, I don't got da skins on me now but if ya could craft a couple pairs of Nightscape Boots and deliver 'em to her at her shop in the Drag of Orgrimmar, I'd be grateful mon.",o="瑞尔科要你用制皮技能制作 2 双夜行靴，并把货送到杜隆塔尔奥格瑞玛的卡玛瑞那里。",oEN="Relko wants you to use your leatherworking skill to craft 2 Nightscape Boots and take the order to Kamari at Orgrimmar in Durotar.",p="又是瑞尔科寄来的包裹？今天是我的幸运日吗？",pEN="Another package from Relko? Isn't this my lucky day.",c="他给孩子们寄了靴子。不对，他是骗你给孩子们做靴子的，对吧？别担心，我会付你工钱的。\n\n我不懂他为什么觉得我们会需要靴子。我自己就是制皮师。那个巨魔真气人！",cEN="He sent me boots for the kids. No, he tricked YOU into making boots for the kids, didn't he? Don't worry, I'll pay you for your services.\n\nI don't know why he thought we'd need boots. I AM a leatherworker. That troll is infuriating!"}
Q[28608]={d="你想当剥皮师？那就让我看看你能不能找到点像样的东西，而不是一堆碎皮。\n\n给我拿轻皮来——不是皮革，是皮。有形状、有结构……值得动手加工的东西。证明你知道自己在做什么，我就替你担保，让你继续训练这项技能。",dEN="You want to be a skinner? Then show me you can find more than just scraps.\n\nBring me Light Hides -- not leather, hide. Something with shape, structure... something worth working with. Prove you know what you're doing, and I'll endorse you to keep training this skill.",o="格特·裂皮要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张轻皮，并把货送到丹莫罗卡拉诺斯的格特·裂皮那里。",oEN="Gert Leathersunder wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Light Hide and take the order to Gert Leathersunder at Kharanos in Dun Morogh.",p="让我看看你有没有干这行的手艺。",pEN="Show me you've got the hands for this trade.",c="哈。这才是我要看的。你有干这行的眼力。继续下去，你会有所成就的。",cEN="Hah. That's what I wanted to see. You've got the eye for this work. Keep going, and you'll make something of yourself."}
Q[28609]={d="谁都能挥刀剥下一张皮，可你能剥得干净吗？每次都一样干净吗？对那头野兽有应有的尊重吗？\n\n给我拿 20 块切割良好的轻皮来。如果你能在不糟蹋皮子的情况下凑齐，也许你就准备好正经学这门手艺了。",dEN="Anyone can swing a blade and peel a hide, but can you do it cleanly? Consistently? With appropriate respect for the beast?\n\nBring me 20 pieces of well-cut Light Leather. If you can gather that without butchering the hides, maybe you're ready to learn the craft properly.",o="拉德纳尔·驯鹿者要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块轻皮，并把货送到泰达希尔他家里的拉德纳尔·驯鹿者那里。",oEN="Radnaal Maneweaver wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Light Leather and take the order to Radnaal Maneweaver at his home in Teldrassil.",p="真正的剥皮师带回来的是成果，不是借口。",pEN="A real skinner brings back results, not excuses.",c="切口漂亮，拉伸干净。你的手很稳。看看你还能学点什么。",cEN="Good cut, clean stretch. You've got a steady hand. Let's see what else you can learn."}
Q[28610]={d="你好，<name>。你擅长使剥皮刀吗？我日夜赶工，以满足哨兵和路过阿斯特兰纳的冒险者的需求，现在急需原材料。\n\n如果你能给我带 20 块中皮来，我很乐意付你报酬。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Are you skilled with a skinner's blade? I have been working day and night to meet the demand of the Sentinels and adventurers passing through Astranaar and I am in need of raw materials.\n\nIf you can bring me 20 Medium Leather, I would be happy to pay you for your services.",o="拉尔丹要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块中皮，并把货送到灰谷阿斯特兰纳的拉尔丹那里。",oEN="Lardan wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Medium Leather and take the order to Lardan at Astranaar in Ashenvale.",p="没有材料就没有成品——帮我解决这个问题。",pEN="No supplies means no crafting -- help me fix that.",c="太好了！这能让生产继续下去。<name>，我很感激你。",cEN="Excellent! This will keep production moving. You have my gratitude, <name>."}
Q[28611]={d="你好，<name>。请原谅，我忍不住注意到你那把小心系在背包上的剥皮刀。我一直有兴趣收集原料，好打造护甲，保护那些深入此处荒野的人。你愿意为我收集 5 张中皮吗？",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Forgive me, but I could not help noticing your skinner's blade, carefully strapped to your pack. I am always interested in gathering raw stock from which I can fashion armor to protect those venturing into the wilds here. Would you be willing to gather 5 Medium Hides for me?",o="伦多要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张中皮，并把货送到千针石林萨兰纳尔的伦多那里。",oEN="Rendow wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Medium Hide and take the order to Rendow at Thalanaar in Thousand Needles.",p="你拿到那些皮子了吗？我还有订单在等。",pEN="Have you obtained the hides? I have orders waiting.",c="<name>，我很感激你。这些皮子能做出极好的护甲。",cEN="You have my gratitude, <name>. These hides will make excellent armor."}
Q[28612]={d="啊。一个此世的居民。一个带着剥皮工具的人。\n\n这个世界很奇怪——它的野兽、它的天空、它的气味。但皮革终究是皮革，我也仍然懂我的手艺。\n\n我对南边栖息的那些小龙很感兴趣。给我带 5 片绿龙宝宝鳞片来。有了它们，我就能打造适合此地的护甲。",dEN="Ah. An in-worlder. One who bears the tools for skinning.\n\nThis world is strange -- its beasts, its skies, its scents. But leather is still leather, and I still know my craft.\n\nI am intrigued by the tiny dragons that dwell to the south. Bring me 5 Green Whelp Scales. With them, I'll craft armor suited to this place.",o="莫鲁尔要你用剥皮技能收集 5 片绿龙宝宝鳞片，并把货送到悲伤沼泽避难营的莫鲁尔那里。",oEN="Moruul wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Green Whelp Scale and take the order to Moruul at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="把鳞片带来，我就开工。",pEN="Bring the scales, and I'll begin the work.",c="我已经能感觉到那副护甲的形状了。<name>，你为我们做了件好事。",cEN="I can feel the shape of the armor already. You've done well by us, <name>."}
Q[28613]={d="来看我们训练新兵？新兵就意味着淤青、流血和打坏的装备。如果他们的护甲撑不住，他们也撑不住。\n\n如果你想帮我们的部队，就给我带 20 块重皮来。我要用它加固训练装备。它得结实到能挨打，又得便宜到能随便消耗。",dEN="Here to watch our trainees? New recruits mean bruises, blood, and busted gear. If their armor can't hold, they won't either.\n\nIf you want to help our troops, bring me 20 pieces of Heavy Leather. I need it for reinforcing training gear. It must be tough enough to take hits, but cheap enough to burn through.",o="战斗大师希格蒂要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块重皮，并把货送到尘泥沼泽塞拉摩的战斗大师希格蒂那里。",oEN="Combat Master Szigeti wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Heavy Leather and take the order to Combat Master Szigeti at Theramore in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="没有皮革我就发不出装备。要么把材料给我拿来，要么别挡道。",pEN="I can't issue gear without leather. Get me the materials or get out of the way.",c="切口扎实。这能让那些新兵蛋子完整地撑到学会点东西。干得好。",cEN="Solid cuts. This'll keep the freshbloods in one piece long enough to learn something. Good work."}
Q[28614]={d="这片高地到处都是迅猛龙。它们有利爪、有鳞片，还很凶。我们跟它们打的交道够多了……不如也利用一下。\n\n给我带 5 张迅猛龙皮来。结实的好料，做装备正合适。让那些皮子在草丛里烂掉太可惜了。",dEN="The Highlands are crawling with raptors. They're clawed, scaled, and fierce. We fight 'em often enough... might as well use 'em.\n\nBring me 5 Raptor Hides. Sturdy stuff, good for gear. No point letting all that leather rot in the grass.",o="斯库尔托要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张迅猛龙皮，并把货送到阿拉希高地避难谷地的斯库尔托那里。",oEN="Skuerto wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Raptor Hide and take the order to Skuerto at Refuge Point in Arathi Highlands.",p="我还等着那些皮子呢。迅猛龙可不会自己剥皮。不过它们倒是可能来剥你的皮！",pEN="Still need those hides. The raptors won't skin themselves. Though they might try skinning you!",c="这些正合适。结实又有韧性的皮子，做护腕或马鞍都绝佳。现在你让这片高地为我们干活了。",cEN="That'll do nicely. Strong, flexible hide, perfect for bracers or saddles. You're making the Highlands work for us now."}
Q[28615]={d="住在东边很远的海岸上的那些海龟也许很慢，但它们的皮子很特别。耐用、柔韧，而且出奇地好加工。\n\n这些天巡逻的巨魔太多，我一直没能出去补充库存。如果你路过那边，给我带 10 片龟壳来。手法到位的话，我能把它们做成能用一辈子的上等护甲。",dEN="The turtles that live on the ocean shore far tae the east may be slow, but their hides are something special. They're durable, flexible, and surprisingly easy to work with.\n\nWith all the patrolling trolls these days, I haven't been able to head out to replenish my stock. If ye pass that way, bring me 10 Turtle Scales. With the right touch, I can turn them into fine armor pieces that last a lifetime.",o="尼奥玛要你用剥皮技能收集 10 片龟壳，并把货送到辛特兰鹰巢山的尼奥玛那里。",oEN="Nioma wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 10 Turtle Scale and take the order to Nioma at Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands.",p="你知道没有材料就没法制作，对吧？",pEN="Ye do know that crafting doesn't happen without the goods, right?",c="这些干净、厚实，塑形正合适。你对好材料有眼光。谢谢帮忙，<race>。",cEN="These are clean, thick, and perfect for shaping. You've got an eye for good material. Thanks for the help, <race>."}
Q[28616]={d="哦嚯，你是剥皮师？熟悉变异皮吗？怪东西。闪闪发亮、又韧又硬，卖得飞快。\n\n这样，我跟你做个交易。给我带 5 片变异鳞片和 1 片完美的变异鳞片，我就分你一份利润。\n\n不过你得进哀嚎洞穴去弄。你觉得你能行吗？",dEN="Oh, ho, you're a skinner? You familiar with Deviate hides? Strange stuff. Shimmery, tough, sells like crazy.\n\nLook I'll make you a deal. Bring me 5 Deviate Scales and one Perfect Deviate Scale and I'll cut you in for some of my profits.\n\nYou'll have to head into Wailing Caverns to get them though. Think you can handle that?",o="皮兹努克要你用剥皮技能收集 5 片变异鳞片和 1 片完美的变异鳞片，并把货送到贫瘠之地哀嚎洞穴西边他店里的皮兹努克那里。",oEN="Pizznukle wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Deviate Scale and 1 Perfect Deviate Scale and take the order to Pizznukle at his shop west of Wailing Caverns in the Barrens.",p="我要闪光，我要发亮！把真货给我拿来。",pEN="I need shimmer, I need shine! Bring me the real goods.",c="这才像话！这些能卖个好价钱，或者做成能卖好价钱的东西。你对值钱的东西很有嗅觉，笨蛋。冠军！我是说，冠军！",cEN="Now that's more like it! These'll fetch a fine price, or make something that will. You've got a nose for value, chump. Champ! I mean, champ!"}
Q[28617]={d="嘿，剥皮师。我有个活儿给你。别问是干什么用的。不，真的。别问。\n\n你只需要知道我需要厚皮。又大、又厚、很难弄到……对某个正在进行的项目来说再完美不过。\n\n完全无害，我向你保证。大概吧。",dEN="Heya, skinner. I've got a job for you. Don't ask what it's for. No, really. Don't.\n\nAll you need to know is I need Heavy Hide. Big, thick, hard to come by... perfect for a certain ongoing project.\n\nTotally harmless, I assure you. Probably.",o="比布利·福兹巴克尔要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张厚皮，并把货送到凄凉之地科梅克小屋的比布利·福兹巴克尔那里。",oEN="Bibbly F'utzbuckle wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Heavy Hide and take the order to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut in Desolace.",p="我离突破只差一步了！或者是离爆炸只差一步！都是好东西，完全正常的东西！",pEN="I'm this close to a breakthrough! Or an explosion! Of good, totally normal things!",c="厚实、耐用——正是我需要的。\n\n别担心。要是成了，你会听说的……",cEN="Thick, durable -- just what I needed.\n\nDon't worry. If this works, you'll hear about it...."}
Q[28618]={d="龙。又大、又凶、又危险。就在这儿东边住着一群，我跟你说——它们很值钱。只要你知道去哪儿卖，每片鳞都值一堆金币。而这消息我有，你可买不起。\n\n所以，我们做个交易。给我带 5 片磨损的龙鳞来。它们现在看着也许不怎么样，但稍加打磨和上胶，我们就能把野兽变成财源。",dEN="Dragons. Big, angry, dangerous. There's a bunch that live just east of here and let me tell you -- they're valuable. Every scale's worth a pile of coins if you know where to sell it. And that's information I have that you can't afford.\n\nSo, let's make a deal. Bring me 5 Worn Dragonscales. They might not look like much now, but with a bit of polish and pitch, we'll turn beast into bounty.",o="约阿基姆·火根要你用剥皮技能收集 5 片磨损的龙鳞，并把货送到荒芜之地泉源岗的约阿基姆·火根那里。",oEN="Joakim Sparkroot wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Worn Dragonscale and take the order to Joakim Sparkroot at Springsocket in Badlands.",p="没鳞片？那我们就赚不到利润，只有借口。",pEN="No scales? Then we're not making profit, just excuses.",c="啊哈，太好了！烧焦的、破破烂烂的，正是买家想要的。你对机会很有嗅觉。镇上还有不少别的活儿。",cEN="Ahhh, lovely! Burnt, battered, and exactly what the buyers want. You've got a nose for opportunity. Plenty of other work in town here."}
Q[28619]={d="沙漠不会轻易交出它的财富。你得流血、被烤、被晒，才能找到它们。\n\n可蝎皮呢？那宝贝根本藏都不藏。给我带 10 片蝎壳来，我就教你怎么把这些沙漠害虫变成利润。",dEN="The desert doesn't give up its riches easy. You've got to bleed, burn, and bake to find them.\n\nBut scorpid scales? That's one prize that's not hidden at all. Bring me 10 Scorpid Scales, and I'll show you how to turn those desert pests into profit.",o="奎恩要你用剥皮技能收集 10 片蝎壳，并把货送到塔纳利斯加基森的奎恩那里。",oEN="Quinn wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 10 Scorpid Scale and take the order to Quinn at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",p="还等着那些鳞片呢。沙子里多的是。去把它们猎来吧。",pEN="Still waiting on those scales. The sand's got plenty. Go hunt 'em down.",c="跟沙丘一样硬。这些肯定好卖。你挣到了你那一份。",cEN="Tough as the dunes. These'll sell just fine. You've earned your cut."}
Q[28620]={d="我说，你是剥皮师？我手上有些副业项目。安静的活儿，一点不官方。不过需要好材料。\n\n给我带 20 块厚皮来，我就跟你换些在这儿冒险用得上的补给。我要结实的东西，切口干净。别多问。",dEN="Say, you a skinner? I've got a few side projects going on. Quiet work, nothing official. Needs good material, though.\n\nBring me 20 pieces of Thick Leather and I'll trade you some useful supplies for adventuring out here. I need strong stuff, clean cuts. No questions asked.",o="维戈要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块厚皮，并把货送到菲拉斯格鲁克的营地的维戈那里。",oEN="Viggo wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Thick Leather and take the order to Viggo at Gluk's Compound in Feralas.",p="没有合适的材料就没法开工。",pEN="Can't start without the right materials.",c="谢了，伙计。一言为定。",cEN="Thanks, partner. A deal's a deal."}
Q[28621]={d="我还能通过研究这里的野兽来验证腐化已经渗透森林多深。它们被扭曲了，可它们的皮革呢？腐化很深，可到底有多深？\n\n我需要 5 张费伍德生物身上的厚皮。我要检测它们、研究这污渍。如果皮子还记得那毒，我们也许就能学会如何对抗它。",dEN="Another way I can verify how deep the corruption has permeated the forest is by studying the beasts here. They're twisted, but is their leather? The corruption runs deep, but how deep?\n\nI need 5 Thick Hides from the creatures of Felwood. I want to test them, study the taint. If the skin remembers the poison, we may yet learn how to fight it.",o="塔罗恩·红羽要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张厚皮，并把货送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的塔罗恩·红羽那里。",oEN="Taronn Redfeather wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Thick Hide and take the order to Taronn Redfeather at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="把皮子带来，我们就看看它们藏着什么秘密。",pEN="Bring the hides, and we'll see what secrets they carry.",c="这些皮子看起来和你在别处能得到的任何皮子都一样。这让人松了口气，<class>。谢谢你。",cEN="These hides appear to be the same as any other hides you might obtain elsewhere. That is a relief, <class>. Thank you."}
Q[28622]={d="冬天悄悄逼近，可不是人人都有遮风挡雨的地方。艾萨拉的风刮得很深，尤其是在夜里。\n\n我需要 5 张硬甲皮做暖和的毯子。保护我们的幼崽。活儿很简单，却意味着许多人的生存。",dEN="Winter creeps in, and not everyone has shelter. Winds in Azshara bite deep, especially at night.\n\nI need 5 Rugged Hides for warm blankets. Protect our cubs. Simple work, but means survival for many.",o="德雷吉要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张硬甲皮，并把货送到艾萨拉黑喉村的德雷吉那里。",oEN="Deleigi wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Rugged Hide and take the order to Deleigi at Blackmaw Village in Azshara.",p="没有皮子，就没有温暖。",pEN="No hides, no warmth.",c="这些皮子能用。也许幼崽长大后，有一天会来谢你。",cEN="These hides will do. Maybe cub grow up to thank you, one day."}
Q[28623]={d="我们从暗炉城撤出来的时候，把一半储备都丢下了：工具、装备，还有上好的皮革。事实证明，你没法靠回忆来制作东西。\n\n如果你想在这儿帮上忙，就给我带 20 块硬甲皮来。丢失的部分由我来补。抱怨没用。动手干活吧。",dEN="When we pulled outta Shadowforge City, we left half our stores behind: tools, gear, and good leather too. Turns out ye can't craft with memories.\n\nIf ye want to help out around here, bring me 20 pieces of Rugged Leather. I'll handle the replacements for what we lost. No use whining. Just get to work.",o="铸炉大师伯宁纳特要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块硬甲皮，并把货送到灼热峡谷瑟银哨塔的铸炉大师伯宁纳特那里。",oEN="Master Smith Burninate wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Rugged Leather and take the order to Master Smith Burninate at Thorium Point in Searing Gorge.",p="还等着那批皮革呢。你以为替换品会自己剥皮吗？",pEN="Still waitin' on that leather. You think replacements skin themselves?",c="<name>，我本来还不敢确定你能不能办成，但我很感激。再多几个肯帮忙的志愿者，我们很快就能恢复全部实力。",cEN="I wasn't sure you'd pull through, <name>, but I'm grateful. With a few more helpful volunteers, we'll be back to full strength in no time."}
Q[28624]={d="这儿太冷了，兄弟。扎卡加想念丛林。想念温暖。不过，扎卡加听说有个东西能帮上忙。\n\n这儿的熊皮很硬，过冬的格外厚。给扎卡加拿 5 张战熊皮来，这样只要雇主需要，扎卡加就能一直扛住寒冷。",dEN="It's too cold here, mon. Tzakaja miss de jungle. Miss de warmth. But, Tzakaja heard of somethin' that will help.\n\nDe bears here have tough hides, extra thick for de winter. Bring 5 of dem Warbear Leathers, so I can stand de cold as long as Tzakaja's employer needs.",o="扎卡加要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张战熊皮，并把货送到冬泉谷永望镇的扎卡加那里。",oEN="Tzakaja wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Warbear Leather and take the order to Tzakaja at Everlook in Winterspring.",p="扎卡加在这儿快冻僵了，兄弟！",pEN="Tzakaja be freezin' here, mon!",c="啊！就是这些，兄弟。扎卡加从冻僵的脚底板开始感谢你。",cEN="Ah! Dis be dem, mon. Tzakaja thank you from de bottom of my frozen feet."}
Q[28625]={d="你好，<name>。你想当剥皮师？那就让我看看你能不能找到点像样的东西，而不是一堆碎皮。\n\n给我拿一张轻皮来——不是皮革，是皮。有形状、有结构……值得动手加工的东西。证明你知道自己在做什么，我就替你担保，让你继续训练这项技能。",dEN="Hail, <name>. You want to be a skinner? Then show me you can find more than just scraps.\n\nBring me a Light Hide -- not leather, hide. Something with shape, structure... something worth working with. Prove you know what you're doing, and I'll endorse you to keep training this skill.",o="约恩·深割要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张轻皮，并把货送到莫高雷血蹄村的约恩·深割那里。",oEN="Yonn Deepcut wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Light Hide and take the order to Yonn Deepcut at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="让我看看你有没有干这行的手艺。",pEN="Show me you've got the hands for this trade.",c="哈。这才是我要看的。你有干这行的眼力。继续下去，你会有所成就的。",cEN="Hah. That's what I wanted to see. You've got the eye for this work. Keep going, and you'll make something of yourself."}
Q[28626]={d="你，就是你。我看见你跟剥皮训练师说话了！我需要你的本事。\n\n谁都能挥刀剥下一张皮，可你能剥得干净吗？每次都一样干净吗？对那头野兽有应有的尊重吗？\n\n给我拿 20 块切割良好的轻皮来。如果你能在不糟蹋皮子的情况下凑齐，也许你就准备好正经学这门手艺了。",dEN="You there. I saw you speaking to the skinning trainer! I need your skills.\n\nAnyone can swing a blade and peel a hide, but can you do it cleanly? Consistently? With appropriate respect for the beast?\n\nBring me 20 pieces of well-cut Light Leather. If you can gather that without butchering the hides, maybe you're ready to learn the craft properly.",o="亡灵卫兵林尼亚要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块轻皮，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔以南她营地的亡灵卫兵林尼亚那里。",oEN="Deathguard Linnea wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Light Leather and take the order to Deathguard Linnea at her camp south of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="真正的剥皮师带回来的是成果，不是借口。",pEN="A real skinner brings back results, not excuses.",c="切口漂亮，拉伸干净。你的手很稳。看看你还能学点什么。",cEN="Good cut, clean stretch. You've got a steady hand. Let's see what else you can learn."}
Q[28627]={d="你好，<name>。你擅长使剥皮刀吗？我日夜赶工，以满足战歌氏族和路过碎木岗哨的冒险者的需求，现在急需原材料。\n\n如果你能给我带 20 块中皮来，我很乐意付你报酬。",dEN="Hail, <name>. Are you skilled with a skinner's blade? I have been working day and night to meet the demand of the Warsong and adventurers passing through Splintertree and I am in need of raw materials.\n\nIf you can bring me 20 Medium Leather, I would be happy to pay you for your services.",o="费兰·强风要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块中皮，并把货送到灰谷碎木岗哨的费兰·强风那里。",oEN="Feran Strongwind wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Medium Leather and take the order to Feran Strongwind at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="没有材料就没有成品——帮我解决这个问题。",pEN="No supplies means no crafting -- help me fix that.",c="太好了！这能让生产继续下去。<name>，我很感激你。",cEN="Excellent! This will keep production moving. You have my gratitude, <name>."}
Q[28628]={d="你好，<name>。请原谅，我忍不住注意到你那把小心系在背包上的剥皮刀。我一直有兴趣收集原料，好打造护甲，保护那些深入此处荒野的人。你愿意为我收集 5 张中皮吗？",dEN="Hail, <name>. Forgive me, but I could not help noticing your skinner's blade, carefully strapped to your pack. I am always interested in gathering raw stock from which I can fashion armor to protect those venturing into the wilds here. Would you be willing to gather 5 Medium Hides for me?",o="莫特加·火鬃要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张中皮，并把货送到千针石林白崖哨站的莫特加·火鬃那里。",oEN="Motega Firemane wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Medium Hide and take the order to Motega Firemane at Whitereach Post in Thousand Needles.",p="你拿到那些皮子了吗？我在等着。",pEN="Have you obtained the hides? I am waiting.",c="<name>，我很感激你。这些皮子能做出极好的护甲。",cEN="You have my gratitude, <name>. These hides will make excellent armor."}
Q[28629]={d="你，拿剥皮刀的那个。我需要你帮忙！\n\n这个人硬说沼泽让他做噩梦。他声称需要一条用绿龙宝宝鳞片做的毯子才能睡好。\n\n上头命令我们保住他的命，而我只想别再听他抱怨。那么，你能弄到他想要的鳞片吗？",dEN="You there, with the skinning knife. I need your assistance!\n\nThis human insists that the swamp gives him nightmares. He claims he needs a blanket made from Green Whelp Scales to sleep better.\n\nWe've been ordered to keep him alive and I'd like to stop hearing him complain. So, can you get the scales he wants?",o="步兵祖尔要你用剥皮技能收集 5 片绿龙宝宝鳞片，并把货送到悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的步兵祖尔那里。",oEN="Grunt Zuul wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Green Whelp Scale and take the order to Grunt Zuul at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="把鳞片带来，我们就动手给他做这条毯子。",pEN="Bring the scales, and we'll begin the work to make him this blanket.",c="我都能预见到清静了。<name>，你为我们做了件好事。",cEN="I can anticipate the silence soon. You've done well by us, <name>."}
Q[28630]={d="来帮忙的？克拉库需要皮革做新东西。巨龙袭击时丢了很多。需要新护腕。新遮羞布。需要重皮来做这些东西。\n\n你去沼泽弄皮革？那样克拉库就高兴了！",dEN="Here to help? Krak need leather for new things. Lost much when dragons attacked. Need new bracers. New loincloths. Need Heavy Leather for make these things.\n\nYou go in swamp and get leather? Krak happy then!",o="克拉库要你用剥皮技能收集 20 块重皮，并把货送到尘泥沼泽蕨墙村的克拉库那里。",oEN="Krak wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 20 Heavy Leather and take the order to Krak at Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="克拉库需要更多皮革，小不点<race>。",pEN="Krak need more leather, puny <race>.",c="克拉库说，够好了。有这些东西，克拉库就不用把你捶成皮革了！",cEN="Krak say, good enough. Krak don't need to pound you into leather when have this stuff!"}
Q[28631]={d="这片高地到处都是迅猛龙。它们有利爪、有鳞片，还很凶。我们跟它们打的交道够多了……不如也利用一下。\n\n给我带 5 张迅猛龙皮来。结实的好料，做装备正合适。让那些皮子在草丛里烂掉太可惜了。",dEN="The Highlands are crawling with raptors. They're clawed, scaled, and fierce. We fight 'em often enough... might as well use 'em.\n\nBring me 5 Raptor Hides. Sturdy stuff, good for gear. No point letting all that leather rot in the grass.",o="图恩克要你用剥皮技能收集 5 张迅猛龙皮，并把货送到阿拉希高地落锤镇的图恩克那里。",oEN="Tunkk wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 5 Raptor Hide and take the order to Tunkk at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",p="我还等着那些皮子呢。迅猛龙可不会自己剥皮。不过它们倒是可能来剥你的皮！",pEN="Still need those hides. The raptors won't skin themselves. Though they might try skinning you!",c="这些正合适。结实又有韧性的皮子，做护腕或马鞍都绝佳。现在你让这片高地为我们干活了。",cEN="That'll do nicely. Strong, flexible hide, perfect for bracers or saddles. You're making the Highlands work for us now."}
Q[28632]={d="住在这片海岸的乌龟也许很慢，但它们的皮子很特别。耐用、柔韧，而且出奇地好加工。\n\n这些天巡逻的蛮锤和巨魔太多，我一直没能出去补充库存。如果你要出门，给我带 10 片龟壳来。手法到位的话，我能把它们做成能用一辈子的上等护甲。",dEN="The turtles that live on the ocean shore here may be slow, but their hides are something special. They're durable, flexible, and surprisingly easy to work with.\n\nWith all the patrolling Wildhammer and trolls these days, I haven't been able to head out to replenish my stock. If you're heading out, bring me 10 Turtle Scales. With the right touch, I can turn them into fine armor pieces that last a lifetime.",o="铁匠斯拉格特里要你用剥皮技能收集 10 片龟壳，并把货送到辛特兰恶齿村的铁匠斯拉格特里那里。",oEN="Smith Slagtree wants you to use your skinning skill to collect 10 Turtle Scale and take the order to Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",p="你知道没有材料就没法制作，对吧？",pEN="You do know that crafting doesn't happen without the goods, right?",c="这些干净、厚实，塑形正合适。你对好材料有眼光。谢谢帮忙，<race>。",cEN="These are clean, thick, and perfect for shaping. You've got an eye for good material. Thanks for the help, <race>."}
Q[28633]={d="你是矿工？我需要你帮忙。\n\n西泉要塞的军需官哈德森订了一批铜矿，可我现在一点都匀不出来。也许你可以施展手艺，代表闪金镇接下这份订单？",dEN="You a miner? I could use your help.\n\nQuartermaster Hudson over at Westbrook Garrison requested a load of Copper Ore, but I have none to spare at the moment. Perhaps you can put your skills to use and fill this order on Goldshire's behalf?",o="铁匠阿古斯要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铜矿，并把货送到艾尔文森林西泉要塞的军需官哈德森那里。",oEN="Smith Argus wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Copper Ore and take the order to Quartermaster Hudson at Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest.",p="你要是想找新护甲，就该知道我还等着闪金镇的一批货呢。",pEN="If you're looking for new armor, you should know I'm still waiting on a delivery from Goldshire.",c="终于有铜矿了。好，我可以回去干活了。",cEN="Copper at last. Good, I can get back to work."}
Q[28634]={d="我看见你包里那把矿工锄了！我这儿正犯难，你能帮我一把！\n\n石腭怪占了采石场，我们尤其缺人手来完成平民的石头订单。我们所有库存都得优先供给军队。\n\n你要是能采 20 块劣质石头送到钢架补给站的亚尔·锤石那里，我就少了一大桩心事。",dEN="I see that mining pick in your bag! I'm in a pickle here and ye could help me right on out!\n\nWith troggs in the quarry we're particularly short on fulfilling orders for stone from civilians. All our back stock has to go to the military.\n\nIf ye could mine 20 Rough Stone and take 'em to Yarr Hammerstone at Steelgrill's Depot, that would be a load of stone off my mind.",o="采石场主管瑟斯顿要你用采矿技能收集 20 块劣质石头，并把货送到丹莫罗钢架补给站的亚尔·锤石那里。",oEN="Quarrymaster Thesten wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Rough Stone and take the order to Yarr Hammerstone at Steelgrill's Depot in Dun Morogh.",p="我希望你不是采石场主管派来给我找借口的又一个跟班。\"采石场里有石腭怪\"……是啊，没错。我又不是昨天才出生的！",pEN="I hope you're not another one of the Quarrymaster's lackeys coming to give me another excuse. \"Troggs in the quarry\"... yeah right. Wasnae born yesterday!",c="这么说采石场里真有石腭怪？嗯……看来我欠钢架一瓶黑铁嘶嘶酒。多谢你送来这个。",cEN="So there really are troggs in the quarry? Hmmm... I guess I owe Steelgrill a Dark Iron Fizzler. Thank ye kindly for bringin' this."}
Q[28635]={d="达纳苏斯的熔炉如今也许已经燃起，但任何优雅都需要根基。既然我们能在泰达希尔采矿了，需求就大得惊人。\n\n给我带 20 块铜锭来。我这儿还有委托在等……精致的配件，无声的坚韧。而铜……铜会听从工匠之手的安排。",dEN="The forge in Darnassus may burn now, but every elegance needs a foundation. Now that we can mine in Teldrassil, the demand is overwhelming.\n\nBring me 20 Copper Bars. I have commissions waiting... delicate fittings, quiet strength. And copper... copper listens to the crafter's hand.",o="伍利安·橡熔者要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铜锭，并把货送到泰达希尔达纳苏斯的伍利安·橡熔者那里。",oEN="Wullian Oaksmelter wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Copper Bar and take the order to Wullian Oaksmelter at Darnassus in Teldrassil.",p="还没有锭？那活儿就得等，熔炉之歌也得等。",pEN="No bars yet? Then the work must wait, and so must the song of the forge.",c="这些堪称完美。柔软、坚韧，而且是用心塑造的。你为这门手艺增光了。",cEN="These will do beautifully. Soft, strong, and shaped by care. You've honored the craft."}
Q[28636]={d="啊，一位矿工。我有个活儿给你。\n\n时不时地，某门手艺会需要点不是普通矿石加口水就能应付的东西。要有点特别的亮泽，就像月亮和那些让精灵们激动不已的玩意儿。\n\n总之，给我带 5 块银锭来。我在奥伯丁有个委托，正需要恰到好处的光泽，而白银正合适。",dEN="Ah, a miner. I've a job for you.\n\nNow and then, a craft calls for something that ain't common ore and spit. Something with a special shine, like the moon an' all that the elves get excited for.\n\nAnyway, bring me 5 Silver Bars. I've got a commission here in Auberdine that needs just the right gleam, and silver fits the bill.",o="塞尔格鲁姆·石锤要你用采矿技能收集 5 块银锭，并把货送到黑海岸奥伯丁的塞尔格鲁姆·石锤那里。",oEN="Thelgrum Stonehammer wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Silver Bar and take the order to Thelgrum Stonehammer at Auberdine in Darkshore.",p="白银可不会自己走进来，<小伙子/姑娘>。你是把它带来，还是让我白浪费熔炉的时间？",pEN="Silver can't walk in on its own, <lad/lass>. You bringin' it, or am I wastin' forge time?",c="嗯，这才叫白银。光滑、纯净，而且正好够把这活儿办得妥帖。你挣到了你那一份。",cEN="Aye, now that's silver. Smooth, pure, and just enough to get the job done proper. You've earned your cut."}
Q[28637]={d="啊，一位矿工。我有个活儿给你。\n\n铁带又在唠叨着要银矿了。他说他在挖掘场那边有个刻着符文的装置要用。泰坦的事，我看更像是白银基质的胡言乱语！\n\n总之，自从银溪矿脉枯竭后，我这儿就一点银都没有了。你能不能去找一些送来？除非你有时间，否则别让他拉着你讲矮人历史讲个没完！",dEN="Ah, a miner. I've a job for you.\n\nIronband's been yammerin' for Silver Ore again. Says he needs it for some rune-stamped contraption out at the dig site. Titan business, silver matrix mumbo-jumbo's more like it!\n\nAnyway, I'm fresh out of silver since the Silver Stream Mine ran dry. Fancy you could look out for some and deliver it? And don't let him talk your ear off about dwarven history unless you've got the time!",o="布洛克·寻石者要你用采矿技能收集 10 块银矿，并把货送到洛克莫丹铁带挖掘场的勘察员铁带那里。",oEN="Brock Stoneseeker wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Silver Ore and take the order to Prospector Ironband at Ironband's Excavation in Loch Modan.",p="你是来办事的，还是来消遣的？",pEN="You here for business or pleasure?",c="啊，是令人愉快的公事，我明白了！只要把那些石腭怪清理掉，这座泰坦基质可真是个了不起的发现。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ah, pleasurable business, I see! This Titan matrix is really a remarkable find, once we get the troggs out of the way. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28638]={d="我的铜多得不知道该怎么用，可没有锡，我就没法熔炼青铜。问题是，外面树林里潜伏着那些东西，出镇太危险了。\n\n你能给我带 20 块锡矿来吗？这样我就能让熔炉继续烧着，又不必把自己喂给黑暗中的东西。",dEN="I've got more copper than I know what to do with, but without tin, I can't smelt bronze. Problem is, it's too dangerous to leave town with what's lurking in the woods.\n\nCan you bring me 20 Tin Ore so I can keep the forge going without feeding myself to what dwells in the dark?",o="加文·纳尔树要你用采矿技能收集 20 块锡矿，并把货送到暮色森林夜色镇的加文·纳尔树那里。",oEN="Gavin Gnarltree wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Tin Ore and take the order to Gavin Gnarltree at Darkshire in Duskwood.",p="我得赶紧炼点青铜了，不然指挥官会不高兴的。你不想站到埃伯洛克指挥官的对立面吧。据说战争期间，她一个人就镇住了整整一个排的天灾和恶魔！",pEN="I need to make some bronze soon, or the Commander is going to be upset. You don't want to be on the wrong side of Commander Ebonlocke. They say that during the war she single-handedly faced down an entire platoon of Scourge and Demons!",c="啊，谢谢，<class>。我还以为我得去面对那些狼——或者更糟的东西。",cEN="Ah, thanks, <class>. I thought I was going to have to face the wolves -- or worse."}
Q[28639]={d="嘿，你！拿矿工锄的那个。联盟需要你帮忙。\n\n命令刚下来：南海镇的赫尔姆斯沃西少校需要 20 块锡锭做配件和维修。问题是，我们这座矿已经不产锡了。\n\n去找到锡锭，送到南海镇给他。他可不爱等人。",dEN="Hey you! The one with the mining pick. The Alliance needs your help.\n\nOrders just came in: Major Helmsworthy over in Southshore needs 20 Tin Bars for fittings and repairs. Problem is, we aren't pulling tin out of this mine anymore.\n\nFind the bars and get them to him at Southshore. He doesn't like to wait.",o="卫兵帕克斯顿要你用采矿技能收集 20 块锡锭，并把货送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南海镇的赫尔姆斯沃西少校那里。",oEN="Guard Paxton wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Tin Bar and take the order to Major Helmsworthy at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="出什么问题了，公民？",pEN="What seems to be the problem, citizen?",c="谢谢你送来这个。我们都得尽自己的一份力，让联盟在可接受的参数内运转，尤其是在这些艰难时日。",cEN="My thanks to you for this. We all need to do our part to keep the Alliance operating within acceptable parameters, especially in these lean times."}
Q[28640]={d="哇，你好啊。你看见这条赛道了吗？引擎太多，时间太少！我有零件要焊、齿轮要磨，可青铜一块都没有。\n\n快给我带 20 块青铜锭来！我自己本可以去拿，可我一走开，就有东西要爆炸。大概吧……！",dEN="Whoa, hey there. You see this raceway? Too many engines, not enough time! I've got parts to weld, gears to grind, and zero bronze in stock.\n\nBring me 20 Bronze Bars, fast! I'd go get 'em myself, but if I step away, something's gonna explode. Probably...!",o="菲兹尔·铜栓要你用采矿技能收集 20 块青铜锭，并把货送到千针石林微光赛道的菲兹尔·铜栓那里。",oEN="Fizzle Brassbolts wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Bronze Bar and take the order to Fizzle Brassbolts at Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.",p="拿到青铜了吗？这些齿轮可不会自己修好！至少我觉得不会。",pEN="Got the bronze yet? These sprockets aren't going to fix themselves! At least, I think they won't.",c="滚烫的齿轮啊，你真带来了！青铜锭到手，还不用烧焦眉毛。今天真是个好日子！",cEN="Hot cogs, you actually brought them! Bronze bars and I didn't have to singe any eyebrows to get them. That's a good day!"}
Q[28641]={d="哎呀，一位矿工，在石爪山？我看这地方挺合适。如果你在找活儿干，这儿正好有份工作等着你？\n\n我需要石头！具体来说，是常和铁矿伴生的那种重型石头。石爪山本身的铁不多，但周边地区这种材料很丰富。如果你愿意帮忙，我一定会在你回来时给你报酬！",dEN="Why, a miner, here in Stonetalon? Good place for it, I reckon. And there's a job waiting here for you, if you're looking for work?\n\nI need stone! Specifically, the Heavy variety often associated with Iron ore. While there's only a little iron in Stonetalon itself, its neighboring areas are rich in this kind of material. If you're willing to help out, I will be sure to remunerate you upon your return!",o="巴珀·图克温克尔要你用采矿技能收集 20 块重型石头，并把货送到石爪山脉石爪林地的巴珀·图克温克尔那里。",oEN="Bapper Tookwinkle wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Heavy Stone and take the order to Bapper Tookwinkle at Stonetalon Grove in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="在弄到那块重型石头之前，我只能画图纸，做不了装置。",pEN="I'm stuck making diagrams instead of devices until I get that Heavy Stone.",c="噢，多么光荣的一天！万分感谢你，$g先生:女士;，<class>！",cEN="Oh, glorious day this is! Thank you kindly, $gmister:miss, <class>!"}
Q[28642]={d="在我的世界里，护甲是用纤维和芦苇、水晶与光编织而成的。可在这里，你们用金属塑形。\n\n我听说黄金很软。它渴望被弯折、被塑形。给我带 10 块金锭来，好让我学习你们的习俗，打造出美丽的东西。",dEN="In my world, armor is woven from fiber and reed, crystal and light. But here, you shape it from metal.\n\nI have heard gold is soft. Eager to bend and shape. Bring me 10 Gold Bars, so I might learn your ways and craft something beautiful.",o="莫鲁尔要你用采矿技能收集 5 块金锭，并把货送到悲伤沼泽避难营的莫鲁尔那里。",oEN="Moruul wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Gold Bar and take the order to Moruul at the Harborage in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我无法给没有的金属塑形。黄金真的像他们说的那样柔顺吗？",pEN="I cannot shape metal I do not have. Is gold truly as gentle as they say?",c="如此温暖，如此明亮……而且没错，如此柔顺。我明白了。只要你先采集大地的资源，就能用锤与心塑造这个世界。",cEN="So warm, so bright... and yes, so pliable. I see now. You can shape the world with hammer and heart, if you but gather its resources first."}
Q[28643]={d="在这儿为库尔提拉斯人干活真是件苦差事，我跟你说！时不时就有某个指挥官冒出来，把我的铁矿全部征走。他们刚刚又这么干了！\n\n我说，你背上背着矿工锄！也许你愿意帮我补充一下我自己的私人储备。我很乐意拿我自己的一些补给跟你换，都是冒险者用得上的东西！",dEN="It is a chore working for the Kul'Tirans here, I tell you! Every now and then some commander swoops in and requisitions all of my Iron Ore. They just did it, again!\n\nSay, you have a pickaxe on your back! Perhaps you'd be willing to refill my own personal reserve. I'd be happy to trade you some of my own supplies, stuff any adventurer would find useful!",o="卡兹·双链轮要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铁矿，并把货送到尘泥沼泽塞拉摩岛的卡兹·双链轮那里。",oEN="Caz Twosprocket wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Iron Ore and take the order to Caz Twosprocket at Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="锡根本做不了板甲。必须是铁，或者更好的材料。",pEN="Tin just doesn't work for plate. It must be iron or better.",c="啊！真正的铁，不是捡来的废料。这个我能用。谢谢你，<name>！",cEN="Ah! Real iron, not scavanged scraps. This, I can work with. Thank you, <name>!"}
Q[28644]={d="我的前哨站进展得挺顺利……只是……我们的铁锭储备已经低到危险的地步了。\n\n你能再给我带些来吗？不必很多，够让门把手留在门上、墙在有人靠着时不塌下来就行。",dEN="My outpost is coming along just fine... except... we are perilously low on our Iron Bar reserves.\n\nCould you bring me some more? Doesn't have to be a huge number, just enough to keep the doorknobs on the doors and the walls from toppling over if someone leans on them.",o="迪比·卷线要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铁锭，并把货送到凄凉之地卷线前哨站的迪比·卷线那里。",oEN="Dibi Squigglecord wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Iron Bar and take the order to Dibi Squigglecord at Squigglecord Outpost in Desolace.",p="光靠许愿和祈祷，我可撑不住这些东西。",pEN="I can't keep things together with a wish and a prayer.",c="干得好！有了这些，我们就能制作合页、锚、锤子……什么能维持运转就做什么。谢谢！",cEN="Good work! With this we can craft hinges, anchors, hammers... whatever we need to keep things running. Thanks!"}
Q[28645]={d="看看那副二头肌！你要么是矿工，要么是铁匠最可怕的噩梦。不管哪种，我都需要你的力气。\n\n看见这道路障了吗？为了把它撑住，我们已经用尽了所有办法，可兽人还在不断涌来。我需要 10 块钢锭来加固它，越快越好！",dEN="Look at those biceps! You're either a miner, or a blacksmiths worst nightmare. Either way, I need your strength.\n\nYou see this barricade? It's taken everything we've got to hold it together and the orcs keep coming. I need 10 Steel Bars to reinforce it, the sooner, the better!",o="卫兵队长奈玛斯要你用采矿技能收集 10 块钢锭。",oEN="Guard Captain Naimas wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Steel Bars.",p="除非我拿到那些钢锭，否则这道路障撑不了多久了。",pEN="The barricade can't hold for much longer unless I get those steel bars.",c="钢既坚固又可靠。是不是让你想起了什么人？\n\n多亏了你，伯恩杜尔的防线还能再撑一阵子。",cEN="Steel is strong and dependable. Remind you of anyone you know?\n\nThanks to you, Burndural's defenses can hold a little longer."}
Q[28646]={d="你有没有注意到，真银在亡灵附近会产生奇怪的共鸣？我有个理论，它可能会对死灵能量起反应，但我需要样本才能验证。\n\n我不是矿工……可你是！你能给我带 10 块真银矿来吗？如果我猜得没错，我们也许就找到了一件既优雅又有效的武器。",dEN="Have you ever noticed Truesilver resonates strangely near undead? I have a theory that it may react to necrotic energies, but I need samples to test it.\n\nI'm no miner... but you are! Would you bring me 10 Truesilver Ore? If I'm right, we may have found a weapon as elegant as it is effective.",o="阿莱克西娅·铁刃要你用采矿技能收集 10 块真银矿，并把货送到西瘟疫之地冰风营地的阿莱克西娅·铁刃那里。",oEN="Alexia Ironknife wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Truesilver Ore and take the order to Alexia Ironknife at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="要验证我的理论，我需要证据——那就意味着真银。",pEN="To test my theory, I need proof -- and that means truesilver.",c="太好了。有了这个，我就能开始制作新的子弹来验证我的理论了。<name>，你也许帮我们发现了一件真正强大的东西。",cEN="Wonderful. With this, I can begin crafting new bullets to test my theory. You may have helped us uncover something truly powerful, <name>."}
Q[28647]={d="据说恶魔不喜欢真银。这我可不能怪它们。那东西闪闪发亮、易于开刃，还受过不止一种祝福。\n\n想想在传送门遗迹附近游荡的那些恶魔，我们真该储备一批真银武器。给我带 5 块真银锭来，你就为联盟立了一功。",dEN="They say that demons don't like Truesilver. Can't say I blame 'em. Stuff's shiny, sharpens well, and blessed in more ways than one.\n\nWhat with those demons that stalk over near the remnants of the portal, we could use a store of Truesilver weapons. Bring me 5 Truesilver Bars, and you'll have done a service to the Alliance.",o="斯特鲁姆纳·燧石踵要你用采矿技能收集 5 块真银锭，并把货送到诅咒之地守望堡的斯特鲁姆纳·燧石踵那里。",oEN="Strumner Flintheel wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Truesilver Bar and take the order to Strumner Flintheel at Nethergarde Keep in Blasted Lands.",p="能不动用那些旧铁武器去砍恶魔，我还是尽量不用。",pEN="I'd rather not swing old iron weapons at those demons if I can help it.",c="我等不及要试试新武器了。要是它扎恶魔卫士比平时更疼，今晚我就为你举杯！",cEN="Can't wait to test some new weapons. If it stings a felguard more than usual, I'll raise a tankard to you tonight!"}
Q[28648]={d="真是一场灾难，<name>！我们起飞时带了四架飞机，结果只抢救回来一架，而它要重新飞起来简直需要奇迹。\n\n不过，你也许能帮我凑齐 20 块瑟银锭。我听说上面那片荒野里有不少矿石。要是我有时间亲自去看看就好了。",dEN="What a catastrophe, <name>! We only managed to salvage one plane from the four we took off with, and it'll take a miracle to get it working again.\n\nBut, you might be able to help me by scrounging up 20 Thorium Bars. I hear there's plenty of ore out in the wilderness up there. If only I had time to check it out myself.",o="威尔逊·摇锤要你用采矿技能收集 20 块瑟银锭，并把货送到艾萨拉摇锤谷的威尔逊·摇锤那里。",oEN="Wilson Wobblesmith wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Thorium Bar and take the order to Wilson Wobblesmith at Wobble Hollow in Azshara.",p="要开通飞往摇锤谷的航班还得等上一阵子，但这让我们又近了一步。",pEN="It will be awhile before we can offer flights to Wobble Hollow, but this will bring us one step closer.",c="呼哈！一个小奇迹达成了。现在，只要我有个正电子什么什么器……别担心，我不是要你去找一个来。",cEN="Huzzah! One small miracle achieved. Now, if I only had a positronic dowhipperdoodle... don't worry, I'm not asking you to find me one."}
Q[28649]={d="你是找活干的矿工？我有个门路给你。\n\n维尼基正在捣鼓一个又吵又不稳定、而且绝对不合规矩的东西。她说她需要 20 块劣质石头做\"结构缓冲\"之类的鬼话。能跑得更快，谁还在乎什么结构？\n\n你要是能采一些来，就给她送去——她在大路北边安了摊子。",dEN="You a miner lookin' for work? I've got a lead for you.\n\nWenikee's workin' on somethin' loud, unstable, and definitely not street legal. She says she needs 20 Coarse Stone for “structural buffering” or some nonsense. Who cares about the structure when you can go faster?\n\nIf you can mine some up, take it to her -- she's set up north along the Gold Road.",o="斯普特阀要你用采矿技能收集 20 块劣质石头，并把货送到北贫瘠之地黄金之路她家里的维尼基·螺栓桶那里。",oEN="Sputtervalve wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Coarse Stone and take the order to Wenikee Boltbucket at her home on the Gold Road in the Northern Barrens.",p="别让闲人偷看！送货走后面！啊啊啊！我还没准备好！",pEN="No prying eyes! Deliveries around back! Aahggghh! I wasn't ready!",c="噢！噢，好的！斯普特阀还记得我，真够意思。谢谢！现在，快走开……！",cEN="Oh! Oh, yes! Kind of Sputtervalve to remember. Thank you! Now, shoo...!"}
Q[28650]={d="金币会说话，<class>。在下面这个藏宝海湾，它是靠吼的。\n\n秘银会以品质闻名，我手里也排着一串买家，可没有货可展示。因为如今人人都想要花哨的镶边，而我的金矿早就用光了。\n\n想分一杯羹吗？给我带 10 块金矿来。稀罕东西，当然，但要是你知道谁付钱，就值你挥出的每一锄。",dEN="Gold talks, <class>. Down here in Booty Bay, it shouts.\n\nThe Mithril Order is known for quality and I've got buyers lined up, but no product to show. That's because everyone wants flashy trim these days, and I'm all out of Gold Ore.\n\nWant in on the action? Bring me 10 Gold Ore. Rare stuff, sure, but worth every swing of the pickaxe if you know who's paying.",o="麦加文要你用采矿技能收集 10 块金矿，并把货送到荆棘谷藏宝海湾的麦加文那里。",oEN="McGavan wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Gold Ore and take the order to McGavan at Booty Bay in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="还等着那批黄金呢。没有光泽，就没有交易。",pEN="Still waiting on that gold. No shine, no deal.",c="你在这门采矿手艺上有天赋——而我手上有的是腰包鼓鼓的客户。咱俩合起来，就是一个团队。干得好。",cEN="You've got a talent for this mining craft -- and I've got clients with deep pockets. Together, we make a team. Nice work."}
Q[28651]={d="在荒芜之地，人人都在抢矿石。因杜里尔？瑟银？算了吧，我要的是石头。坚实、未经雕琢的石头。\n\n听着，你有手艺，我有门路，那你有兴趣做个交易吗？给我带 20 块坚固的石头来，我就能保证你在这片荒瘠的废土上再多活一天。",dEN="Everyone's fighting over ore here in the Badlands. Indurium? Thorium? Forget it, I want the stone. Solid, unshaped stone.\n\nLook, you have the skill and I have the contacts, so are you interested in a deal? Bring me 20 Solid Stone and I can make sure you survive another day in this barren wasteland.",o="加普尔要你用采矿技能收集 20 块坚固的石头，并把货送到荒芜之地泉源岗的加普尔那里。",oEN="Gapple wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Solid Stone and take the order to Gapple at Springsocket in Badlands.",p="矿石是够花哨，没错。但聪明的地精知道，真正的利润在石头里。",pEN="Ore's flashy, sure. But the smart goblin knows, stone is where the real profit lies.",c="你在这门采矿手艺上有天赋——而我手上有的是腰包鼓鼓的客户。咱俩合起来，就能赚钱。就这么简单。",cEN="You've got a talent for this mining craft -- and I've got clients with deep pockets. Together, we make money. Simple as it gets."}
Q[28652]={d="很少见到精灵挥舞铁匠锤，更少见的是因此受人尊敬的精灵。但当我见到苏尔萨兹之后，我就知道，不弄清它的秘密我绝不罢休。\n\n为了继续我的研究，我需要秘银矿。沙漠里资源丰富，可那里绝不是唯一能找到它的地方。去吧，带着我期盼的东西回到我身边。",dEN="It is uncommon to see an elf wield a blacksmith's hammer, and rarer still, one who is respected for it. But once I beheld Sulthraze, I knew I would not rest until I learned its secrets.\n\nTo continue my research I need Mithril Ore. The desert abounds with resources but it is hardly the only place it can be found. Go, and return to me with my desire fulfilled.",o="特伦顿·光锤要你用采矿技能收集 20 块秘银矿，并把货送到塔纳利斯加基森的特伦顿·光锤那里。",oEN="Trenton Lighthammer wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Mithril Ore and take the order to Trenton Lighthammer at Gadgetzan in Tanaris.",p="我无法空着手证明自己。秘银……你带来了吗？",pEN="I cannot prove myself with empty hands. The mithril... do you have it?",c="是的……就是这个。我将继续揭开蕴藏在大地纯粹力量中的秘密。我会重新锻造我的声誉。Ishnu-dal-dieb，<name>。",cEN="Yes... this is it. I shall continue to unlock the secrets held in the pure power of the earth. I will forge my reputation anew. Ishnu-dal-dieb, <name>."}
Q[28653]={d="你看见那边那两个大块头了吗？迪姆和杜姆说他们随时都能把熔炉弄好，可我可不抱什么指望。\n\n要是有一些秘银锭，我们就能把进度加快一点。我想 20 块应该就够了。是的。当然是为了熔炉。不是为我自己，不是。不过还是把它们送到我这儿来。",dEN="You see those two brutes over there? Dim and Dum say they'll have the forge ready any day now, but I ain't holdin' my breath.\n\nWe could speed the process along a little if we had some Mithril Bars. About 20 should do the trick I think. Yes. For the forge, of course. Not for me personally, no. But bring them back to me.",o="维戈要你用采矿技能收集 20 块秘银锭，并把货送到菲拉斯格鲁克的营地的维戈那里。",oEN="Viggo wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Mithril Bar and take the order to Viggo at Gluk's Compound in Feralas.",p="看着这俩家伙想靠纯粹的意志力生出火来，还挺有意思的。",pEN="It's pretty entertaining watching these two try to make fire out of sheer will.",c="嘿，你还真有两下子！我本来还犯嘀咕，因为你是个<class>，而且还是<class><race>，不过凡事都有第一次！",cEN="Hey, you know what you're doing! I had my doubts, because you're a <class> and a <race> <class> at that, but first time for everything!"}
Q[28654]={d="就算我找回以前的园艺工具，我也不敢说它们还有多大用处。这里的腐化根深蒂固，照料土地也许需要更坚硬材料做成的铲子。\n\n如果你能给我带 20 块瑟银矿来，我就能打造一些新工具。我听说瑟银是硬到不能再硬的东西。要是有哪种材料能扛住费伍德的腐化，那一定就是它。",dEN="Even if I recover my old gardening tools, I'm not sure they'll be very useful. The corruption here runs deep, and tending the land may require trowels made of sterner stuff.\n\nIf you could bring me 20 Thorium Ore, I could fashion some new tools. I hear Thorium is as tough as it gets. If any material can handle Felwood's corruption, it must be that.",o="凯莱克·护天者要你用采矿技能收集 20 块瑟银矿，并把货送到费伍德森林翡翠圣地的凯莱克·护天者那里。",oEN="Kelek Skykeeper wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Thorium Ore and take the order to Kelek Skykeeper at Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood.",p="大地在等待，可没有矿石我就无法开工。",pEN="The land waits, but I cannot work without the ore.",c="这种矿物看起来确实坚固耐久——就像我们努力恢复的那片土地。<name>，我很感激你。",cEN="This mineral does seem strong and enduring -- just like the land we fight to restore. You have my gratitude, <name>."}
Q[28655]={d="我们放弃暗炉城的时候，不得不丢下熔炉、工具……以及所有补给。\n\n如今我们在这里重建，正需要一位熟练矿工的帮忙。给我带 10 块黑铁矿来。若我们要重拾力量，就得从火与金属开始。",dEN="When we abandoned Shadowforge City, we had to leave behind our forges, our tools... and all our supplies.\n\nNow that we're rebuilding here, I could use the assistance of a skilled miner. Bring me 10 Dark Iron Ore. If we're going to reclaim our strength, it starts with fire and metal.",o="铸炉大师伯宁纳特要你用采矿技能收集 10 块黑铁矿，并把货送到灼热峡谷瑟银哨塔的铸炉大师伯宁纳特那里。",oEN="Master Smith Burninate wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Dark Iron Ore and take the order to Master Smith Burninate at Thorium Point in Searing Gorge.",p="你以为我能用废料建起一座铸造厂吗？我需要那些黑铁。",pEN="Do you think I can build a foundry with scraps? I need that Dark Iron.",c="矿脉之母啊……黑铁是沉重、灼热、毫不留情的玩意。就像孕育它的那座山。有了这些东西，我们才能重新开始。",cEN="Mother of Mines... Dark Iron is heavy, hot, unforgiving stuff. Just like the mountain that birthed it. This stuff here is how we begin again."}
Q[28656]={d="我不常向人开口，凡人。我也不会解释。但我有自己的需求，你能帮上忙。\n\n给我带 20 块致密石头来。把疑问留在峡谷门口，答案或许随后就到。",dEN="I do not ask for things often, mortal. And I will not explain. But I have needs of my own that you can assist with.\n\nBring me 20 Dense Stone. Leave questions at the door of the Gorge, and answers may follow later.",o="维耶尔要你用采矿技能收集 20 块致密石头，并把货送到冬泉谷暗语峡谷的维耶尔那里。",oEN="Vi'el wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Dense Stone and take the order to Vi'el at Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring.",p="我的工作仍未完成。",pEN="My work remains unfinished.",c="可以接受。走的时候当心那些邪能兽。",cEN="Acceptable. Watch out for the felbeasts on your departure."}
Q[28657]={d="矿工学徒，我需要你帮忙。\n\n奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的监督者欣克订了一批铜矿，可我现在一点都匀不出来。也许你可以施展手艺，代表剃刀岭接下这份订单？",dEN="Apprentice miner, I could use your help.\n\nSupervisor Hink over at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar requested a load of Copper Ore, but I have none to spare at the moment. Perhaps you can put your skills to use and fill this order on Razor Hill's behalf?",o="克伦要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铜矿，并把货送到杜隆塔尔奥格瑞玛城外飞艇塔的监督者欣克那里。",oEN="Krunn wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Copper Ore and take the order to Supervisor Hink at the zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar in Durotar.",p="你要是想要进度报告，就该知道我还等着剃刀岭的一批货呢。",pEN="If you're looking for a progress report, you should know I'm still waiting on a delivery from Razor Hill.",c="终于有铜矿了。好，我们可以回去干活了。",cEN="Copper at last. Good, we can get back to work."}
Q[28658]={d="我看见你包里那把矿工锄了！你是个勤快人，对吧？也许你想要一份委托，一份真正属于你自己的订单？\n\n村里大帐篷里的哈兰特订了一批劣质石头。那你何不出去给他凑齐呢？帮助邻里是件好事……你也正好可以练练手。",dEN="I see that mining pick in your bag! Industrious one, aren't you? Perhaps you would like a commission, a real order you can call your own?\n\nHarant in the big tent in the village has asked for a load of Rough Stone. So why don't you get out there and fill it for him? It is a blessing to help our neighbors... and you could use the practice.",o="阿查克·余烬梦要你用采矿技能收集 20 块劣质石头，并把货送到莫高雷血蹄村的哈兰特·铁臂那里。",oEN="Achak Emberdream wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Rough Stone and take the order to Harant Ironbrace at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="你好，年轻的<race>。",pEN="Greetings, young <race>.",c="谢谢你替阿查克送来这些。我也会向他称赞你的手艺。",cEN="Thank you for delivering this on Achak's behalf. I shall compliment your skills to him as well."}
Q[28659]={d="亡灵卫兵林尼亚最近见什么征什么，现在她又要我把铜锭交出去，天知道那些亡灵卫兵在谋划什么。我要是交了，就一点材料都不剩了！\n\n所以我们这么办——你出去给她采 20 块铜锭，就说是我给的。然后那点微薄的报酬归你。我是说，丰厚的报酬。对你比对我有用。",dEN="Deathguard Linnea has been requisitioning everything in sight lately, and now she's asking me to give up my Copper Bars for whatever it is the Deathguards are planning. If I do that, I won't have any materials left!\n\nSo here's what we'll do -- you go out and mine up 20 Copper Bars for her and tell them they're from me. Then you can keep the pittance reward they're offering. I mean, plentiful reward. It'll do you more good than me.",o="弗格斯·基特萨佩尔要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铜锭，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔以南她营地的亡灵卫兵林尼亚那里。",oEN="Fergus Kitsapell wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Copper Bar and take the order to Deathguard Linnea at her camp south of Brill in Tirisfal Glades.",p="我希望你不是弗格斯的又一个跟班，跑来替他说为什么供不上我们需要的货？",pEN="I hope you're not another one of Fergus' lackeys, come with more excuses why he can't supply what we need?",c="这些能用。拿着，作为你服务的报酬。",cEN="These will do. Here, as payment for your services."}
Q[28660]={d="啊，一位矿工。我有个活儿给你。\n\n那边的塞巴斯蒂安和我，嗯，我们处不来。自从跳蚤和蜱虫那档子事之后，这座墓穴就容不下我们两个了，可要支撑死亡猎手，我们就得待在这儿。\n\n总之，给塞巴斯蒂安送 5 块银锭去。我在瑟伯切尔有个委托要他办，需要恰到好处的光泽，而白银正合适。这话由你去说，他更容易接受。",dEN="Ah, a miner. I've a job for you.\n\nSebastian over there, and I, well, we don't get along. This tomb isn't big enough for the both of us after the flea and tick incident, but it's where we have to be to support the Death Stalkers.\n\nAnyway, bring Sebastian 5 Silver Bars. I've got a commission I need him to handle here in the Sepulcher that needs just the right gleam, and silver fits the bill. The message will be received better coming from you.",o="约翰·福赫特要你用采矿技能收集 5 块银锭，并把货送到银松森林瑟伯切尔的塞巴斯蒂安·梅洛什那里。",oEN="Johan Focht wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Silver Bar and take the order to Sebastian Meloche at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="我刚才看见你跟约翰说话了。你是来浪费我时间的吗？",pEN="I saw you talking to Johan earlier. Are you just here to waste my time?",c="哼。好吧，我想我能接下这个委托。我清楚他说的是什么。而且那将会非常辉煌！\n\n<塞巴斯蒂安把最后这句冲着整个房间喊了出来。>",cEN="Hmph. Alright, I suppose I can handle the commission. I know just what he's talking about. And it will be glorious!\n\n<Sebastian shouts this last bit into the room in general.>"}
Q[28661]={d="啊，一位矿工。我有个活儿给你。\n\n我想在铁砧这儿向特劳格订做一些定制活儿，可我需要镶银的。他说他的银用完了，也不知道什么时候能再进到货。你觉得你能帮上忙吗？",dEN="Ah, a miner. I've a job for you.\n\nI'd like to order some custom work from Traugh here at the forge, but I need it to be silver-inlaid. He says he's out of silver and has no idea when he'll be getting more in. Think you could help with that?",o="贾汉·鹰翼要你用采矿技能收集 10 块银矿，并把货送到贫瘠之地十字路口的特劳格那里。",oEN="Jahan Hawkwing wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Silver Ore and take the order to Traugh at the Crossroads in the Barrens.",p="你是来办事的，还是来消遣的？",pEN="You here for business or pleasure?",c="啊，是令人愉快的公事，我明白了！既然有了合适的材料，贾汉这单活儿就好办了。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Ah, pleasurable business, I see! This commission from Jahan will be easy now that I have the proper materials. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28662]={d="啊看，来了一位专业矿工。你知道，我们的铜多得不知道该怎么用，可没有锡，我就没法熔炼青铜。问题是，外面树林里潜伏着那些东西，派苦工出镇太危险了。\n\n你能给我带 20 块锡矿来吗？这样我就能开始熔炼青铜了。",dEN="Ah look, a professional miner has arrived. Ya know, we've got more copper than I know what to do with, but without tin, I can't smelt bronze. Problem is, it's too dangerous to send the peons out of town with what's lurking in the woods.\n\nCan you bring me 20 Tin Ore so I can get moving on smelting some bronze?",o="工头泉源岗要你用采矿技能收集 20 块锡矿，并把货送到灰谷碎木岗哨的工头泉源岗那里。",oEN="Foreman Springsocket wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Tin Ore and take the order to Foreman Springsocket at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="我得赶紧炼点青铜了，不然那位希瑞斯会不高兴的。你不想站到希瑞斯的对立面吧。据说战争期间，她一个人就镇住了整整一个排的天灾和恶魔！",pEN="I need to make some bronze soon, or that Xirith is going to be upset. You don't want to be on the wrong side of Xirith. They say that during the war she single-handedly faced down an entire platoon of Scourge and Demons!",c="啊，谢谢，<class>。我还以为我得亲自去面对那个女巫——或者更糟的东西。",cEN="Ah, thanks, <class>. I thought I was going to have to face the warlock herself -- or worse."}
Q[28663]={d="嘿，你！拿矿工锄的那个。我需要你帮忙。\n\n命令刚下来：我得弄到 20 块锡锭做配件和维修。问题是，我们这儿可不会凭空冒出锡来。\n\n你觉得你能采出矿石、熔成锭，再送来给我吗？黑暗女士可不喜欢等人。",dEN="Hey you! The one with the mining pick. I need your help.\n\nOrders just came in: I need to get 20 Tin Bars for fittings and repairs. Problem is, we aren't pulling tin out of thin air here.\n\nThink you can mine and smelt the bars and get them to me? The Dark Lady doesn't like to be kept waiting.",o="克里斯托夫·杰夫科特要你用采矿技能收集 20 块锡锭，并把货送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵塔伦米尔的克里斯托夫·杰夫科特那里。",oEN="Christoph Jeffcoat wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Tin Bar and take the order to Christoph Jeffcoat at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="出什么问题了？",pEN="What seems to be the problem?",c="谢谢你送来这个。我们都得尽自己的一份力，让部落继续运转，尤其是在这些艰难时日。",cEN="My thanks to you for this. We all need to do our part to keep the Horde operating, especially in these lean times."}
Q[28664]={d="哇，你好啊。你看见这条赛道了吗？引擎太多，时间太少！我有零件要焊、齿轮要磨，可青铜一块都没有。\n\n快给我带 20 块青铜锭来！我自己本可以去拿，可我一走开，就有东西要爆炸。大概吧……！",dEN="Whoa, hey there. You see this raceway? Too many engines, not enough time! I've got parts to weld, gears to grind, and zero bronze in stock.\n\nBring me 20 Bronze Bars, fast! I'd go get 'em myself, but if I step away, something's gonna explode. Probably...!",o="波兹克要你用采矿技能收集 20 块青铜锭，并把货送到千针石林微光赛道的波兹克那里。",oEN="Pozzik wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Bronze Bar and take the order to Pozzik at Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.",p="拿到青铜了吗？这些齿轮可不会自己修好！至少我觉得不会。",pEN="Got the bronze yet? These sprockets aren't going to fix themselves! At least, I think they won't.",c="滚烫的齿轮啊，你真带来了！青铜锭到手，还不用烧焦眉毛。今天真是个好日子！",cEN="Hot cogs, you actually brought them! Bronze bars and I didn't have to singe any eyebrows to get them. That's a good day!"}
Q[28665]={d="哎呀，一位矿工，在石爪山？这地方挺合适。如果你在找活儿干，这儿正好有份工作等着你？\n\n我需要石头！具体来说，是常和铁矿伴生的那种重型石头。石爪山本身的铁不多，但邻近地区这种材料很丰富。手头有足够的石头，我们就能在联盟来犯时保持武器锋利。",dEN="Why, a miner, here in Stonetalon? Good place for it. And there's a job waiting here for you, if you're looking for work?\n\nI need stone! Specifically, the Heavy variety often associated with Iron ore. While there's only a little iron in Stonetalon itself, its neighboring areas are rich in this kind of material. With enough stone on hand, we can keep our weapons sharp in case of an Alliance attack.",o="玛格伦·缚地者要你用采矿技能收集 20 块重型石头，并把货送到石爪山脉日岩 retreat（Sun Rock Retreat）的玛格伦·缚地者那里。",oEN="Maggran Earthbinder wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Heavy Stone and take the order to Maggran Earthbinder at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon Mountains.",p="在我弄到那块重型石头之前，我们没什么东西可以用来磨利武器。",pEN="We have nothing to sharpen our weapons with until I get that Heavy Stone.",c="好。知道现在我们有了所需的补给，我就放心了。谢谢你，<class>。",cEN="Good. I feel reassured that we have the supplies we need now. Thank you, <class>."}
Q[28666]={d="黄金！战争期间，联盟的护甲闪耀着它的光泽。我永远忘不了那明亮的辉光。\n\n不过，自从我们回到斯通纳德，我就再没机会摆弄它了。也许你能弥补这一点，给我带些金锭来？",dEN="Gold! The Alliance armor flashed with it during the war. I will never forget that bright sheen.\n\nI've not had the chance to work with it since we returned to Stonard, though. Perhaps you could remedy that by bringing me some Gold Bars?",o="格里姆纳尔要你用采矿技能收集 5 块金锭，并把货送到悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的格里姆纳尔那里。",oEN="Grimnal wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Gold Bar and take the order to Grimnal at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我无法给没有的金属塑形。黄金真的像他们说的那样柔顺吗？",pEN="I cannot shape metal I do not have. Is gold truly as gentle as they say?",c="如此温暖，如此明亮……而且没错，如此柔顺。我明白了。只要你先采集大地的资源，就能用锤与心塑造这个世界。",cEN="So warm, so bright... and yes, so pliable. I see now. You can shape the world with hammer and heart, if you but gather its resources first."}
Q[28667]={d="你，就是你！我看见你背的矿工锄了。我以部落的名义征召你执行一项任务。\n\n看见那边的熔炉了吗？我们把它搭好了，可食人魔不买账，因为他们没有囤积材料。这就需要你了。给我带 20 块铁矿来，好让这些食人魔见识见识什么叫熔炼。",dEN="You there! I see the pickaxe you carry. I conscript you for a task on behalf of the Horde.\n\nYou see that forge over there? We set it up but the ogres haven't taken to it because they have no stockpiled materials. That's where you come in. Bring me 20 Iron Ore so we can show these ogres what smelting is all about.",o="纳泽尔·血矛要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铁矿，并把货送到尘泥沼泽蕨墙村的纳泽尔·血矛那里。",oEN="Nazeer Bloodpike wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Iron Ore and take the order to Nazeer Bloodpike at Brackenwall Village in Dustwallow Marsh.",p="锡根本做不了板甲。必须是铁，或者更好的材料。",pEN="Tin just doesn't work for plate. It must be iron or better.",c="啊！真正的铁，不是捡来的废料。这个我能用。我解除对你的征召，<name>。你可以去忙自己的事了。",cEN="Ah! Real iron, not scavanged scraps. This, I can work with. I release you, <name>. You may go about your business."}
Q[28668]={d="我一直靠给这里的巨魔供应斧头谋生，可随着部落的到来，我的铁锭储备已经低到危险的地步了。\n\n你能再给我带些来吗？不必很多，够让刀刃留在柄上、箭头保持锋利就行。",dEN="I have made a living out of supplying the trolls here with axes, but with the Horde showing up I am perilously low on my Iron Bar reserves.\n\nCould you bring me some more? Doesn't have to be a huge number, just enough to keep the blades on their handles and the arrowheads sharp.",o="哈伊·维拉尼要你用采矿技能收集 20 块铁锭，并把货送到凄凉之地暗影prey村（Shadowprey Village）的哈伊·维拉尼那里。",oEN="Hae'Wilani wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Iron Bar and take the order to Hae'Wilani at Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="光靠许愿和祈祷，我可撑不住这些东西。",pEN="I can't keep things together with a wish and a prayer.",c="谢谢你，兄弟。这够我用上一阵子了。",cEN="Thank you, mon. This will keep me in good stead for awhile."}
Q[28669]={d="看看那副二头肌！你要么是矿工，要么是铁匠最可怕的噩梦。不管哪种，我都需要你的力气。\n\n<class>，我看到了那场坠落。我对这个世界已经失去了希望。钢锭的秘密仍对我紧锁。可你，凭你高超的手艺，只要能给我带些样品来，也许就能帮上我。",dEN="Look at those biceps! You're either a miner, or a blacksmiths worst nightmare. Either way, I need your strength.\n\nI saw the fall, <class>. I have lost my hope in this world. The secrets of Steel Bars remain locked away from me. But you, with you superior skill, you may be able to help me if you could bring me some samples.",o="戈姆尔要你用采矿技能收集 10 块钢锭，并把货送到阿拉希高地落锤镇的戈姆尔那里。",oEN="Gor'mul wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Steel Bar and take the order to Gor'mul at Hammerfall in Arathi Highlands.",p="除非我拿到那些钢锭，否则我真想放弃这门手艺。",pEN="I feel like giving up the craft unless I get those steel bars.",c="嗯，这倒有意思。这不足以浇熄我的忧郁，但至少能让我的脑子忙上一阵子。",cEN="Hmm, this interesting. It is not enough to quench my melancholy but at least it will keep my mind occupied for awhile."}
Q[28670]={d="嗯，我忍不住注意到你是位矿工。正是我要找的人。\n\n暗影祭司范迪斯需要真银矿，好继续为瘟疫之地的坩埚制作她的中和剂。做个好人，替她弄几把来吧，好吗？",dEN="Hmm, I can't help but notice that you are a miner. Just who I was looking for.\n\nShadow Priestess Vandis is in need for Truesilver Ore to keep crafting her neutralizing agent for the Plaguelands cauldrons. Do be a dear and fetch a couple handfuls of it for her, will you?",o="高级执行官德灵顿要你用采矿技能收集 10 块真银矿，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地壁垒的暗影祭司范迪斯那里。",oEN="High Executor Derrington wants you to use your mining skill to collect 10 Truesilver Ore and take the order to Shadow Priestess Vandis at the Bulwark in Tirisfal Glades.",p="要检验我的中和剂，我需要证据——那就意味着真银。",pEN="To test my neutralizer, I need proof -- and that means truesilver.",c="太好了。有了这个，我就能开始制作更多中和剂来验证我的理论。<name>，你也许帮我们发现了一件真正强大的东西。",cEN="Wonderful. With this, I can begin crafting more neutralizer to test my theories. You may have helped us uncover something truly powerful, <name>."}
Q[28671]={d="我想让这些森林巨魔见识点不一样的东西，不是他们惯用的木头和石头。我说的是真银，<name>。\n\n我需要一批真银锭。你要是碰上一些，我很乐意从你手里买下。",dEN="I'd like to show these forest trolls something different than the wood and stone they typically use for their weapons. I'm talking about Truesilver, <name>.\n\nI am in need of a handful of Truesilver Bars. If you come across any, I'd gladly take them off your hands.",o="铁匠斯拉格特里要你用采矿技能收集 5 块真银锭，并把货送到辛特兰恶齿村的铁匠斯拉格特里那里。",oEN="Smith Slagtree wants you to use your mining skill to collect 5 Truesilver Bar and take the order to Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",p="能不动用那些旧铁武器去砍那些邪枝巨魔，我还是尽量不用。",pEN="I'd rather not swing old iron weapons at those Vilebranch trolls if I can help it.",c="我等不及要试试新武器了。要是它扎邪枝巨魔比平时更疼，今晚我就为你举杯！",cEN="Can't wait to test some new weapons. If it stings a Vilebranch more than usual, I'll raise a tankard to you tonight!"}
Q[28672]={d="真是一场灾难，<name>！我们刚把基础熔炉架起来，纳迦就发动袭击把它炸飞了！要让它重新运作简直需要奇迹。\n\n不过，你也许能帮我凑齐 20 块瑟银锭。我听说上面那片荒野里有不少矿石。要是我有时间亲自去看看就好了。",dEN="What a catastrophe, <name>! We only managed to set up the base forge when naga attacked and blew it up! It'll take a miracle to get it working again.\n\nBut, you might be able to help me by scrounging up 20 Thorium Bars. I hear there's plenty of ore out in the wilderness up there. If only I had time to check it out myself.",o="菲兹特要你用采矿技能收集 20 块瑟银锭，并把货送到艾萨拉瓦罗莫克的菲兹特那里。",oEN="Fizit wants you to use your mining skill to collect 20 Thorium Bar and take the order to Fizit at Valormok in Azshara.",p="要能在瓦罗莫克提供全套制作服务还得等上一阵子，但这让我们又近了一步。",pEN="It will be awhile before we can offer full crafting services in Valormok, but this will bring us one step closer.",c="呼哈！一个小奇迹达成了。现在，只要我有个自动校准的什么什么器……别担心，我不是要你去找一个来。",cEN="Huzzah! One small miracle achieved. Now, if I only had a auto-calibrating dinglewhinger... don't worry, I'm not asking you to find me one."}
Q[28673]={d="副官雷纳一直穿着件看上去更像破布的衣服在西泉要塞巡逻，这都是上周豺狼人伏击害的。他拒绝停下来修补——说那能磨炼品格。\n\n如果你有这门手艺，能做两件蓝色亚麻衬衫给他送去吗？他也许不会承认，但我知道他会感激这份心意。只是别让他说动你给他做一整套衣橱。",dEN="Deputy Rainer's been patrolling Westbrook Garrison in a shirt that looks more like a rag, thanks to a gnoll ambush last week. He refuses to stop for repairs -- claims it builds character.\n\nIf you have the skill, could you craft a couple Blue Linen Shirts and bring them to him? He may not admit it, but I know he'd appreciate the gesture. Just don't let him talk you into tailoring his whole wardrobe.",o="莎拉· Timberlain 要你用裁缝技能制作 2 件蓝色亚麻衬衫，并把货送到艾尔文森林西泉要塞的副官雷纳那里。",oEN="Sara Timberlain wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Blue Linen Shirt and take the order to Deputy Rainer at Westbrook Garrison in Elwynn Forest.",p="该死的豺狼人！我在这儿都快冻僵了。",pEN="Damn gnolls! I'm starting to freeze out here.",c="哎呀，看看这个！针脚结实，颜色也对……你做得比我想的还好。莎拉真是把什么都想到了——就是没想到我多讨厌欠人情。所以收下这些补给，咱俩就算两清了。",cEN="Well now, look at this! Stitching's solid, color's right... you've outdone yourself. Sara really thought of everything -- except how much I hate owing favors. So take these supplies and let's call it even."}
Q[28674]={d="梅贝尔·麦克卢尔整周都心神不宁地转来转去，问东问西，全关于缝纫和布料染色。她终于承认自己想要一条新裙子——要甜美又朴素的。\n\n如果你能给她缝一条简易长裙，能送到麦克卢尔葡萄园给她吗？她没说为什么，不过有传言说她终于找到心上人了！",dEN="Maybell Maclure's been fluttering about all week, asking questions about stitching and fabric dyes. She finally admitted she wants a new dress -- something sweet and simple.\n\nIf you can sew her a Simple Dress would you bring it to her at Maclure Vineyards? She didn't say why, but there's a rumor that she's finally got herself a sweetheart!",o="莎拉· Timberlain 要你用裁缝技能制作 1 条简易长裙，并把货送到艾尔文森林麦克卢尔葡萄园的梅贝尔·麦克卢尔那里。",oEN="Sara Timberlain wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Simple Dress and take the order to Maybell Maclure at Maclure Vineyards in Elwynn Forest.",p="噢，天哪！那条裙子是给我的吗？",pEN="Oh, my! Is that dress for me?",c="太完美了！噢，谢谢你。我迫不及待想试穿。你觉得这会引起他的注意吗？算了——别回答这个！",cEN="It's perfect! Oh, thank you. I can't wait to try it on. Do you think it'll catch his eye? Never mind -- don't answer that!"}
Q[28675]={d="琥珀still 牧场这一季把他们的公羊使唤得很凶，老维隆写信来说他两只鞍袋终于撑不住了——在一块尖石头上裂了个大口子。\n\n如果你有心做裁缝，就做几条结实的亚麻包给他送到琥珀still 牧场去。我本想自己寄一个，可我上次缝东西，出来活像给石腭怪做的袜子。",dEN="Amberstill Ranch has been running their rams hard this season, and old Veron wrote to say both of his saddle bags finally gave out -- split wide open on a sharp rock.\n\nIf you've a mind for tailoring, craft a pair of sturdy Linen Bags and take them to him at Amberstill Ranch. I'd send one myself, but the last time I sewed anything, it came out looking like a sock for a trogg.",o="乌斯拉尔·思雷克斯要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个亚麻包，并把货送到丹莫罗琥珀still 牧场的维隆·琥珀still那里。",oEN="Uthrar Threx wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Linen Bag and take the order to Veron Amberstill at Amberstill Ranch in Dun Morogh.",p="你是为鞍袋的事来的？",pEN="You here about the saddle bags?",c="这才叫好手艺。装燕麦和苹果正好够用，省得荆棘足又来啃我的靴子。多谢。",cEN="Now these are a fine piece of work. Should hold just enough oats and apples to keep Bramblefoot from chewing on my boots again. Much obliged."}
Q[28676]={d="酿酒村的玛蕾丝又在蒸馏器上烫到手指了。她说她那副旧手套在多年摆弄滚烫的壶之后，终于变得又硬又脆。\n\n如果你针线活儿在行，就给她做一副崭新的重型亚麻手套。她不会自己开口求助，但相信我，要是她每次搅拌都疼得龇牙咧嘴，她那些酒的味道可就要差一半了。",dEN="Marleth over in Brewnall's been burning her fingers on the still again. Says the old gloves she had finally went stiff and brittle after years of handling boiling kettles.\n\nIf you're handy with a needle, make her a fresh pair of Heavy Linen Gloves. She won't ask for help herself, but trust me, those brews of hers won't taste half as good when she's wincing every time she stirs.",o="乌斯拉尔·思雷克斯要你用裁缝技能制作 1 副重型亚麻手套，并把货送到丹莫罗酿酒村的玛蕾丝·大麦酒那里。",oEN="Uthrar Threx wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Heavy Linen Gloves and take the order to Marleth Barleybrew at Brewnall Village in Dun Morogh.",p="你是来喝点大麦酒暖暖肚子的？",pEN="You here to warm your belly with some Barleybrew?",c="噢，这些正合适！厚实，却还灵活。我的手指谢谢你——下一批大麦芽酒也会谢谢你！",cEN="Ooh, these'll do nicely! Thick, but still nimble. My fingers thank you -- and so will the next batch of Barleybrew Lager!"}
Q[28677]={d="科里瑟拉斯已经花了几个季节为旅人引路、照料月井，可如今他的道路正在转变——他选择步入艾露恩的祭司之列。这是一份高尚的使命，理应有像样的开端。\n\n你愿意制作三件白色亚麻长袍，送到多兰纳尔给他吗？这只是小小的心意，但一件新长袍可以标志更伟大事物的开始。",dEN="Corithras has spent seasons guiding travelers and tending the moonwells, but his path is shifting now -- he's chosen to walk among the priests of Elune. A noble calling, and one that deserves a proper beginning.\n\nWould you craft a trio of White Linen Robes and bring them to him in Dolanaar? It's a small gesture, but a new robe can mark the start of something greater.",o="特里安娜要你用裁缝技能制作 3 件白色亚麻长袍，并把货送到泰达希尔多兰纳尔的科里瑟拉斯·月怒那里。",oEN="Trianna wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 3 White Linen Robe and take the order to Corithras Moonrage at Dolanaar in Teldrassil.",p="为仪式准备的长袍吗？我感受到了召唤，可是……我不能毫无准备地开始。",pEN="A robe for the rites? I've felt the call, but... I cannot begin unprepared.",c="这……太完美了。布料、针脚——感觉就像一个全新的开始。谢谢你。我会在泰达希尔的枝桠下宣誓时穿上它。",cEN="This is... perfect. The fabric, the stitching -- it feels like a new beginning. Thank you. I'll wear it when I take my vows beneath the boughs of Teldrassil."}
Q[28678]={d="维斯普里斯图斯也许翱翔天际，可他的靴子从不久离地面。在照料角鹰兽和递送急件之间，他那双旧靴子的缝线早已磨薄。\n\n如果你能制作一双崭新的简易亚麻靴，送到鲁瑟兰村给他。他不会自己开口要求更换，可我觉得他配得上比脚底的木刺更好的东西。",dEN="Vesprystus might soar through the skies, but his boots never leave the ground for long. Between tending to hippogryphs and running dispatches, his old pair is worn thin at the seams.\n\nIf you can craft a fresh set of Simple Linen Boots, deliver them to him at Rut'theran Village. He won't ask for replacements himself but I think he's earned more than splinters in his soles.",o="特里安娜要你用裁缝技能制作 1 双简易亚麻靴，并把货送到泰达希尔鲁瑟兰村的维斯普里斯图斯那里。",oEN="Trianna wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Simple Linen Boots and take the order to Vesprystus at Rut'theran Village in Teldrassil.",p="<name>，你需要我载你一程吗？",pEN="Do you need a ride somewhere, <name>?",c="一双极好的靴子！落地时脚不疼，天空都显得更明亮了。",cEN="An excellent pair of boots! The sky's always brighter when your feet don't hurt on the landing."}
Q[28679]={d="作为人民民兵的补给官，照顾好仍留在西部荒野的平民，以及民兵成员，是我的职责。\n\n达芙妮·斯蒂尔维尔独自住在矿场再过去的地方，就在西南匕首岭的水边。那里很冷，我上次路过时，她穿的东西连根蜡烛都暖不热。如果你有裁缝手艺，一套像样的灰色毛纺衬衫会对她很有好处。",dEN="As requisitioner for the People's Militia, it's my responsibility to take care of the civilians still in Westfall, as well as the militia members.\n\nDaphne Stillwell keeps to herself out past the mine, right on the water's edge in the southwest Dagger Hills. It gets chilly out there, and last I passed by, she was wearing something that wouldn't keep a candle warm. If you've the tailoring skill, a proper set of Gray Woolen Shirts would do her good.",o="保护者加里尔要你用裁缝技能制作 4 件灰色毛纺衬衫，并把货送到西部荒野西南匕首岭她农场的达芙妮·斯蒂尔维尔那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 4 Gray Woolen Shirt and take the order to Daphne Stilwell at her farm in the southwest Dagger Hills in Westfall.",p="噢——是加里尔派你来的吗？",pEN="Oh -- were you sent by Gariel?",c="这件真好看……分量正好挡海风。替我谢谢加里尔……也让他别那么操心了。我挺好的。",cEN="This is lovely... just the right weight for the sea breeze. Tell Gariel thank you... and to stop worrying so much. I'm just fine."}
Q[28680]={d="西部荒野的人们已经匮乏太久了——但有办法能帮上忙。萨尔玛·萨丁从黎明干到黄昏，在自家农场忙活，还总为人民民兵备着热饭。这可怜的女人脚上几乎只穿着凉鞋！我已经拿到许可，代她申领两双毛纺靴。现在只差一位裁缝。是你吗？",dEN="The people of Westfall have gone without for too long -- but there are ways you can help. Salma Saldean's been working dawn to dusk at her farm and always has a hot meal ready for the Militia. The poor woman has barely more than sandals on her feet! I've secured permission to requisition two pairs of Woolen Boots on her behalf. All I need now is the tailor. Is that you?",o="保护者加里尔要你用裁缝技能制作 2 双毛纺靴，并把货送到西部荒野萨丁农场的萨尔玛·萨丁那里。",oEN="Protector Gariel wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Woolen Boots and take the order to Salma Saldean at Saldean's Farm in Westfall.",p="是加里尔派你来的？希望不只是几句好话——那种话我已经听得够多了。",pEN="Gariel sent you? I hope it's not just kind words -- I've got plenty of those already.",c="我找不到言语来形容这对我意味着什么。请替我谢谢保护者加里尔。也谢谢你。",cEN="I don't have the words to tell you what this means. Please, thank Protector Gariel for me. And thank you, too."}
Q[28681]={d="巴苏尔已经在阿尔萨拉克斯之塔驻守了好几周，暴露在海上吹来的寒风和塔内渗出的黑暗之中。他不肯离开岗位——连去取件斗篷都不肯。\n\n这就需要像你这样的裁缝了。我想请你为他制作一件珠饰斗篷，带来一点温暖和舒适。请送到黑海岸北部给他，让他知道，即便职责在召唤，他也没有被遗忘。",dEN="Balthule's been stationed at the Tower of Althalaxx for weeks, exposed to the chill winds off the sea and the darkness creeping from within. He won't leave his post -- not even to fetch a cloak.\n\nThat's where a tailor like you comes in. I'd like you to fashion him a Pearl-Clasped Cloak that offers a bit of warmth and comfort. Please deliver it to him in northern Darkshore, to remind him that even when duty calls, he is not forgotten.",o="沙尔丁要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件珠饰斗篷，并把货送到黑海岸阿尔萨拉克斯之塔的巴苏尔·影击那里。",oEN="Shaldyn wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Pearl-clasped Cloak and take the order to Balthule Shadowstrike at the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore.",p="阴影一天比一天大胆了。",pEN="The shadows grow bolder each day.",c="一件新斗篷？这比我应得的还要精致。不过，它会派上大用场。我会自豪地穿上它。请收下我从这些邪教徒身上搜来的一些补给，作为我的谢意。",cEN="A new cloak? It's finer than I deserve. Still, it will serve well. I'll wear it with pride. Please take some supplies I've scavenged from these cultists as my thanks."}
Q[28682]={d="有人向我要一双结实厚实的手套，可我手边没有那样的东西给来订货的矮人。如果你能帮忙，就做几副重型毛纺手套，送到雷姆travel 挖掘场的考古学家埃弗里特那里。",dEN="I had a request for some hardy and thick gloves, but I didn't have anything like that available to give to the dwarf who requested it. If you can help out, craft a couple pairs of Heavy Woolen Gloves and deliver them to Archaeologist Everit down at Remtravel's Excavation.",o="沙尔丁要你用裁缝技能制作 2 副重型毛纺手套，并把货送到黑海岸雷姆travel 挖掘场的考古学家埃弗里特那里。",oEN="Shaldyn wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Heavy Woolen Gloves and take the order to Archaeologist Everit at Remtravel's Excavation in Darkshore.",p="啊……是有人派你送补给来的吗？",pEN="Ah... were you sent with supplies?",c="终于有双像样的手套了！这些能挡住油污沾上石头，也能挡住寒气钻进我的指节。谢谢你，$g小伙子:姑娘;！",cEN="At last -- proper gloves! These'll keep the oils off the stone and the cold out of me knuckles. Thank ye $glad:lass,!"}
Q[28683]={d="我正需要一位有经验的裁缝帮忙处理几份洛克莫丹居民积压的订单。你有兴趣吗？\n\n巡山者鹅卵石眼力极好，一眼就能认出闪亮的石头，而顺手把每一块都揣进兜里的习惯更是厉害。问题是，他捡得太多，旧挎包都撑破了缝线。\n\n我这儿有个订单，要做两个新毛纺包送给他。据我所知，他上一次是驻守在国王谷。",dEN="I could use the assistance of an experienced tailor to fill a few back orders from folks in Loch Modan. Are ye interested?\n\nMountaineer Cobbleflint's got a sharp eye for shiny rocks and an even sharper tendency to pocket every last one. Problem is, he picked up so many his old satchels burst at the seams.\n\nI've got an order for two new Woolen Bags to deliver to him. Last I knew he was stationed down in the Valley of Kings.",o="奥尔德伦·科登要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个毛纺包，并把货送到洛克莫丹国王谷的巡山者鹅卵石那里。",oEN="Aldren Cordon wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Woolen Bag and take the order to Mountaineer Cobbleflint at the Valley of Kings in Loch Modan.",p="除非那些包是用毛线加耐心缝出来的，否则我没兴趣。",pEN="Unless those bags are stitched with wool and patience, I'm not interested.",c="以莫拉丁的胡子起誓，这些能装下双倍的石头、少一半的腰疼！你帮了我大忙。也许现在我能给那块奇怪的蓝石头找个地方了……？",cEN="By Moradin's beard, these will hold twice the stone for half the back pain. You've done me a kindness. Maybe now I can find space for that odd blue one...?"}
Q[28684]={d="水坝那边传话来，说巡山者哈吉尔摔了一跤，从支撑柱上爬下来时把裤子整个撕开了。从那以后，他一直用细绳和倔强补着穿。\n\n如果你不介意也接下这一单，就做一条手缝亚麻长裤，送到石坝水坝去。",dEN="Word from the dam is that Mountaineer Haggil had a bit of a tumble and ripped his britches clean through climbing down a support strut. He's been patching them with twine and stubbornness ever since.\n\nIf ye wouldn't mind picking up this order too, craft a pair of Handstitched Linen Britches and run them down to the Stonewrought Dam.",o="奥尔德伦·科登要你用裁缝技能制作 1 条手缝亚麻长裤，并把货送到洛克莫丹石坝水坝的巡山者哈吉尔那里。",oEN="Aldren Cordon wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Handstitched Linen Britches and take the order to Mountaineer Haggil at Stonewrought Dam in Loch Modan.",p="你感觉到那阵风了吗？",pEN="Do you feel that breeze?",c="谢天谢地！再吹两阵我可就要出丑了。你挣到了一些额外补给！",cEN="Blessed relief! I was two gusts away from scandal. You've earned some extra supplies!"}
Q[28685]={d="我姐姐以为光靠眨眼睛和烤面包就能赢得看守者卡兰的心。拜托。他需要的是个务实的人——就像我！\n\n我们需要一位中立的裁判来评判我们的礼物。如果你能制作几个小丝包，送到赤脊山大桥正南、暗色河岸旁的看守者卡兰那里，我就能证明我懂得一个勤恳的男人看重什么！",dEN="My sister thinks she can win Watcher Callahan over with just batting lashes and baking bread. Please. What he needs is someone practical -- like me!\n\nWe need a neutral judge for our gifts. If you can craft a couple Small Silk Packs and deliver them to Watcher Callahan by the Darkened Bank, just south of the Redridge Bridge, I'll prove I know what a hardworking man appreciates!",o="丹妮尔·拉链针要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个小丝包，并把货送到暮色森林暗色河岸的看守者卡兰那里。",oEN="Danielle Zipstitch wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Small Silk Pack and take the order to Watcher Callahan at the Darkened Bank in Duskwood.",p="你不是来闲聊的吧？",pEN="You're not here to gossip, are you?",c="这是丹妮尔寄给我的？哈……能装巡逻报告、野外装备……还是丝绸的，不简单。挺……周到的。没想到。等我回镇上会谢她。至于你的服务，我用这个谢你。",cEN="Danielle sent me this? Huh... room for patrol reports, field gear... and silk, no less. That's... thoughtful. Didn't expect that. I'll thank her when I'm back in town. As for your services, I'll thank you with this."}
Q[28686]={d="所以丹妮尔觉得我在讨好那个无聊的老看守者？想都别想！我的心上人有时尚品味。有抱负。有人脉。他……嗯，他是个地精。可不是随便哪个地精——是凯兹克斯，有品位的那位商人。\n\n既然丹妮尔想把它变成一场竞争，那我就奉陪。给凯兹克斯做一件碧蓝丝质外衣。他会印象深刻的，我打赌他会把湖畔镇那个骚货忘得一干二净！",dEN="So Danielle thinks I'm fawning over that boring old Watcher? Not a chance! My beau has style. Ambition. Connections. He's... well, he's a goblin. But not just any goblin -- Kzixx, the merchant with taste.\n\nSince Danielle wants to make it a competition, I'll play along. Craft an Azure Silk Vest for Kzixx. He'll be so impressed I bet he'll forget all about that trollop from Lakeshire!",o="雪莉·拉链针要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件碧蓝丝质外衣，并把货送到暮色森林暗色河岸的凯兹克斯那里。",oEN="Sheri Zipstitch wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Azure Silk Vest and take the order to Kzixx at the Darkened Bank in Duskwood.",p="来买东西的？",pEN="Here to buy?",c="嗯，这可是上等丝绸！雪莉·拉链针送的礼物？那又是谁？暮色镇的裁缝材料？嗯……我想她也许能成为一条有价值的生意门路。谢谢你的提点！",cEN="Well, this is some high quality silk! A gift from Sheri Zipstitch? Who even is that? Tailoring supplies in Darkshire? Hmmm... I suppose should could prove a worthwhile business connection. Thanks for the tip!"}
Q[28687]={d="我急需一位裁缝，从你手指上的茧子我就看得出你会拿针。日子近了——梅斯林和赛利姆·梦歌将在林歌神殿的枝桠下结为夫妻。庆典会很朴素，可她仍希望穿一件手工做的、充满意义的东西。\n\n如果你有这门手艺，就做一件白色毛纺长裙，送到灰谷另一边的她那里。",dEN="I am in desperate need of a tailor and I can tell by the calluses on your fingers that you know how to hold a needle. The day draws near -- Maithryn and Selim Dreamsong will be bound in marriage beneath the boughs of Forest Song. The celebration will be simple, but she still wishes to wear something handmade and full of meaning.\n\nIf you have the skill, craft a White Woolen Dress and deliver it to her on the other side of Ashenvale.",o="艾奥琳要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件白色毛纺长裙，并把货送到灰谷林歌神殿的哨兵梅斯林那里。",oEN="Aeolynn wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 White Woolen Dress and take the order to Sentinel Maithryn at Forest Song in Ashenvale.",p="重要的一天快到了，我还没拿到向阿斯特兰纳的艾奥琳订的那条裙子。",pEN="An important day dawns and I'm still missing the dress I requested from Aeolynn in Astranaar.",c="就是这个……这条裙子。端庄、优雅——正是艾奥琳描述的样子。谢谢你！这些补给本来是给艾奥琳的，不过我猜它们该归你。",cEN="This is it... the dress. Modest, graceful -- exactly what Aeolynn described. Thank you! These supplies were meant for Aeolynn but I suspect they belong to you instead."}
Q[28688]={d="我已经下定决心了！我不想再给那些不知感激的镇民倒酒了，我想研究卷轴。有人给了我一个机会，去阿佐拉之塔当学徒，我打算接受。\n\n可既然要去塔里，我就得看起来像那么回事。如果你能为我做几件次级法师长袍，那对我意义重大。我希望他们看到的不仅是个学生，而是一个准备好成为法师的人。",dEN="I've made up my mind! I'm done pouring drinks for unappreciative townsfolk when I want to be studying scrolls. I've been offered a spot as an apprentice at the Tower of Azora and I intend to take it.\n\nBut if I'm going to the Tower, I need to look the part. If you can craft me a couple Lesser Wizard's Robes, it would mean a lot to me. I want them to see me not just as a student, but as someone ready to become a mage.",o="格蕾琴·沃格尔要你用裁缝技能制作 2 件次级法师长袍，并把货送到赤脊山 Lakeshire（湖畔镇）的格蕾琴·沃格尔那里。",oEN="Gretchen Vogel wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Lesser Wizard's Robe and take the order to Gretchen Vogel at Lakeshire in Redridge Mountains.",p="你要是不交货，我是不是该试着给一袋土豆附个魔……？",pEN="I suppose I could attempt to enchant a potato sack if you don't deliver...?",c="噢——太完美了！这感觉就像迈出了第一步，你懂吗？一件给真正的准法师穿的长袍。谢谢你……下一站：阿佐拉之塔！",cEN="Oh -- it's perfect! This feels like a first step, you know? A robe for a real mage-to-be. Thank you... next stop: Tower of Azora!"}
Q[28689]={d="大海要求专注。一个走神的念头，你就会漂向礁石，或者更糟。当我掌着“少女之德”号的舵轮时，我需要清醒的头脑和稳健的双手。\n\n我听说过冥想手套：轻便、舒适，附了魔能安抚心灵。如果你能做，我想要两副。不用多讲究。只要能让这世上的喧嚣别在我脑子里打转，让我安稳地把大家带回家就行。",dEN="The sea demands focus. One loose thought, and you're drifting into rocks or worse. When I'm at the wheel of the Maiden's Virtue, I need a clear mind and steady hands.\n\nI've heard of Gloves of Meditation: light, comfortable, enchanted to soothe the spirit. If you can craft them, I'd like a couple pairs. Nothing fancy. Just something that keeps the noise of the world from rattling around in my head while I guide us home.",o="领航员克劳利要你用裁缝技能制作 2 副冥想手套，并把货送到湿地米奈希尔港的领航员克劳利那里。",oEN="Navigator Crowley wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Gloves of Meditation and take the order to Navigator Crowley at Menethil Harbor in Wetlands.",p="海浪很稳，我的心却不定。我正需要那副手套。",pEN="Waves are steady, but my mind isn't. I could use those gloves.",c="是的……正是我需要的。它们不只是合手——它们让我安定下来。有了这些，无论迷雾还是狂风我都能掌舵。谢谢你，朋友。",cEN="Yes... just what I needed. They don't just fit -- they center me. With these, I could steer through fog and fury alike. My thanks, friend."}
Q[28690]={d="<class>……你是裁缝，对吧？我是私下问你的，朋友。在修道院里，某些长袍是……不被鼓励的。他们称之为\"虚荣\"。\"太世俗\"。可在这里，在开阔的天空和幽暗的太阳之下，我以院长们从未教导过的方式感受着圣光。\n\n如果你的手足够灵巧，就为我做一件力量长袍。不是为了骄傲，而是为了证明敬畏与力量不必为敌。除了你我，谁都不必知道！",dEN="<class>... you are a tailor are you not? I ask this in confidence, friend. Within the cloister, certain robes are... discouraged. \"Vanity,\" they call it. \"Too worldly.\" But here, under open sky and shadowed sun, I feel the Light in ways the abbots never taught.\n\nIf your hands are skilled, craft me a Robe of Power. Not for pride but to prove that reverence and strength need not be enemies. None need know but you and I!",o="安东修士要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件力量长袍，并把货送到凄凉之地尼耶尔前哨站的安东修士那里。",oEN="Brother Anton wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Robe of Power and take the order to Brother Anton at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",p="我不能再大声询问了。你拿到那件东西了吗？",pEN="I must not ask aloud again. Do you have the item?",c="谢谢你。这将是我的秘密披风……直到圣光另有吩咐。",cEN="Thank you. This will be my secret mantle... until the Light commands otherwise."}
Q[28691]={d="巴托洛想卖给我一件雪人皮做的斗篷——你敢信吗？太离谱了。赫米特需要的是轻便透气的东西，不是重到能拿去摔跤的。\n\n如果你会缝纫，请做一件长丝质斗篷给我们送到这儿来。在赫米特有件暖和衣服穿之前，我们没法继续赶路。",dEN="Bartolo tried to sell me a cloak made from yeti fur—can you believe it? Outrageous. Hemmit needs something light and breathable, not heavy enough to wrestle.\n\nIf you can sew, please craft a Long Silken Cloak and bring it to us here. We can't keep traveling until Hemmit has something warm to wear.",o="塔玛拉·阿姆斯特朗要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件长丝质斗篷，并把货送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南海镇的赫米特·阿姆斯特朗那里。",oEN="Tamara Armstrong wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Long Silken Cloak and take the order to Hemmit Armstrong at Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="希望这不是又一张雪人皮……",pEN="I hope this isn't another yeti pelt....",c="谢谢你。轻如羽毛，而且真的很合身。我收集了一些补给，本来想自己做一件——来，你拿去吧。",cEN="Thank you. Light as a feather, and it actually fits. I gathered some supplies to try making my own -- here, you take them."}
Q[28692]={d="你是裁缝？谢天谢地！我需要你帮忙。\n\n本来我不该在背后说老板闲话，可……这事越来越要命了。穆尔杜格的裤子一天比一天往下掉，要是他再在食堂里弯一次腰，我们全都得走人。\n\n如果你有这本事，就给他做几条碧蓝丝质腰带，好把意思传达到。别告诉他是我派你来的——就说是\"一位眼光敏锐、忧心忡忡的下属\"送的礼物。",dEN="You a tailor? Thank the gods! I need your help.\n\nNow, I wouldn't normally go around talkin' behind the boss's back, but... this is gettin' dire. Murdug's pants've been slippin' lower by the day, and if he bends over again in the mess hall, we're all leavin'.\n\nIf you've got the chops, make him a couple Azure Silk Belts to get the point across. Don't tell him I sent you -- just say it's a gift from a \"concerned subordinate with eyes.\"",o="特鲁克·野须要你用裁缝技能制作 2 条碧蓝丝质腰带，并把货送到辛特兰鹰巢山的穆尔杜格·醉肚那里。",oEN="Truk Wildbeard wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Azure Silk Belt and take the order to Murdug Drunkbelly at Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands.",p="这是什么，来看望我？",pEN="What's this, a visit?",c="腰带！还是丝绸的，不简单。有点花哨……但结实。送这个的人有见识，至于传的话，我不介意。",cEN="Belts! And silk, no less. Bit fancy... but strong. Whoever sent this has good sense, and no offense at the message sent."}
Q[28693]={d="噢，一位裁缝！我知道你懂，在这种条件下我根本没法工作。丝绸过时了，毛料是场悲剧，魔纹布？别逗我笑。\n\n要我在这片被太阳晒白的废土上做出任何还算时髦的东西，我就需要像样的材料。给我带十卷符文布来。不是碎料，不是线头，而是整卷的、完好的。风格需要牺牲，而我需要符文布。",dEN="Oh, a tailor! I know you understand, I simply cannot work under these conditions. Silk is passé, wool is tragic, and mageweave? Don't make me laugh.\n\nIf I'm to produce anything remotely fashionable in this sun-bleached wasteland, I need proper material. Bring me ten Bolts of Runecloth. Not scraps, not threads but full bolts, pristine. Style demands sacrifice, and I demand Runecloth.",o="傲慢的裁缝师要你用裁缝技能制作 10 卷符文布，并把货送到塔纳利斯热砂港的傲慢的裁缝师那里。",oEN="Haughty Modiste wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 10 Bolt of Runecloth and take the order to Haughty Modiste at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="你管这叫交货？符文布呢？别浪费我的白天。",pEN="You call this a delivery? Where's the Runecloth? Do not waste my daylight.",c="终于！总算有点配得上我构想的东西了。有了这个，我们也许能挽救这一季。你可以沐浴在我的感激之中……隔着点距离。",cEN="Finally! At last, something worthy of my vision. With this, we might save the season. You may bask in my gratitude... at a distance."}
Q[28694]={d="这地方的土地在燃烧。邪能的污渍附着在石头上、沙子上，甚至钢铁上。伦格兹在不到一半的周数里就穿坏了三双靴子——什么都撑不住。据说煤纹布能抗热、抗火、抗腐化。所以守望堡愿意出钱为我们军需官买两双煤纹布靴。\n\n但愿这说法是真的，否则月底他就得光脚了。",dEN="The earth burns out here. The fel taint clings to stone, sand, even steel. Lungertz has gone through three pairs of boots in half as many weeks—nothing holds up. They say cindercloth resists heat, flame, and corruption. So Nethergarde will pay for a couple pairs of Cindercloth Boots for our Quartermaster.\n\nLet's hope that holds true, or he'll be barefoot by month's end.",o="看守者玛哈尔·巴要你用裁缝技能制作 2 双煤纹布靴，并把货送到诅咒之地守望堡的军需官伦格兹那里。",oEN="Watcher Mahar Ba wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Cindercloth Boots and take the order to Quartermaster Lungertz at Nethergarde Keep in Blasted Lands.",p="你是送靴子来的，还是只来讲故事的？因为地面还在冒烟呢。",pEN="You bringing boots, or just stories? Because the ground's still smoldering.",c="终于！玛哈尔·巴知道自己在做什么——你也一样。谢谢。让我从我们的储备里给你发一包补给。",cEN="Finally! Mahar Ba knows what he's doing—and you do too. Thanks. Let me issue you a bag of supplies from our stockpile."}
Q[28695]={d="自从被派驻冰风营地，我亲眼见过暗影如何移动、如何低语。它能毁灭，没错……但它也能保护。而且它会聆听，以圣光从不曾用过的方式。\n\n我必须更了解它。如果你能制作一副暗影布护肩，就送到冰风营地这儿给我。我相信它们不只是衣物——它们也许是通往长久以来被拒之门外的力量的钥匙。",dEN="Since I've been stationed at Chillwind Camp I've seen firsthand how the shadow moves, and how it whispers. It can destroy, yes... but it can protect too. And it listens, in ways the Light never does.\n\nI must understand it better. If you can craft a set of Shadoweave Shoulders, bring them to me here at Chillwind Camp. I believe they may serve as more than garb -- they may be keys to power long denied.",o="高阶女祭司玛克唐奈尔要你用裁缝技能制作 1 副暗影布护肩，并把货送到西瘟疫之地冰风营地的高阶女祭司玛克唐奈尔那里。",oEN="High Priestess MacDonnell wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Shadoweave Shoulders and take the order to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp in Western Plaguelands.",p="没有护肩？那我依然……未获启迪。",pEN="No shoulders? Then I remain... unenlightened.",c="是的……我能感觉到那些丝线在嗡鸣，充满潜力。光在上，影在下——但平衡才是两者之间的真理。你帮我朝它迈出了一步。谢谢你。",cEN="Yes... I can feel the threads hum with potential. Light above, shadow below -- but balance is the truth between. You've helped me take a step toward it. Thank you."}
Q[28696]={d="你是裁缝，对吧？很好。\n\n摇锤谷的那些侏儒坠毁在这里时失去了一切。我们设法给他们弄到了食物，他们也在搭建自己的住所，可除了身上穿的衣服，他们一无所有。\n\n如果你能做两条简易黑裙，就送到威尔海米娜·摇锤那里。这只是小小的善意，却是他们迫切需要的。",dEN="You're a tailor, aren't you? Good.\n\nThe gnomes down in Wobble Hollow lost everything they owned when they crashed here. We've managed to get them food and they're building their own shelter, but they've nothing to wear but the clothes on their backs.\n\nIf you can craft two Simple Black Dresses, take them to Wilhelmina Wobblesmith. It's a small kindness, but one they desperately need.",o="艾希拉队长要你用裁缝技能制作 2 条简易黑裙，并把货送到艾萨拉摇锤谷的威尔海米娜·摇锤那里。",oEN="Captain Ashyla wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Simple Black Dress and take the order to Wilhelmina Wobblesmith at Wobble Hollow in Azshara.",p="欢迎来到摇锤谷，<class>！",pEN="Welcome to Wobble Hollow, <class>!",c="是艾希拉队长送来的？哇……谢谢你给摇锤谷带回了一丝尊严！我们没什么东西，但我必须为你的善心给你点什么。",cEN="Captain Ashyla sent these to us? Wowee... thank you for bringing a shred of dignity back to Wobble Hollow! We don't have much but I have to give you something for your kindness."}
Q[28697]={d="雷兹拉克在剃风峡谷北边扎了个营地，想靠兜里的东西和一堆馊主意撑起一门生意。自然，他在要包。\n\n我忙着处理正经订单，没空帮忙，不过你要是想接这一单练练手，他答应过不会让你白干。",dEN="Rezlak's got a camp up north of Razorwind Canyon, trying to keep a business organized with nothing but his pockets and a heap of bad ideas. Naturally, he's asking for bags.\n\nI'm too busy with legitimate orders to help out, but if you're interested in taking this one for the practice, he promised to make it worth your while.",o="斯南格要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个亚麻包，并把货送到杜隆塔尔剃风峡谷的雷兹拉克那里。",oEN="Snang wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Linen Bag and take the order to Rezlak at at Razorwind Canyon in Durotar.",p="这是什么，来串门？因为除非你手里拿着包，否则我还在成堆的散装布卷里泡着。",pEN="What's this, a social visit? Because unless there's a bag in your hand, I'm still knee-deep in loose bolts.",c="哈！终于有个带背带、有侧边的了。我现在真能找着自己的东西了。来，拿些我收集的补给去。",cEN="Hah! Finally -- something with straps and sides. I can actually find my stuff now. Here, take some supplies I've collected."}
Q[28698]={d="别大惊小怪的，不过……我有个东西想让你替我制作。\n\n森金村的泰塔西总是在干活，帮所有人就是不帮她自己。我想，要是她有件漂亮衣服穿，也许会笑一笑。可我自己做给她又觉得有点怪。所以……你替我做好吗？",dEN="Don't go makin' a big fuss about it, but... I got something I want you to craft on my behalf.\n\nTai'tasi down in Sen'jin Village is always working, helping everyone but herself. Thought maybe she'd smile if she had something nice to wear. But it felt a little odd to craft it for her myself. So... you do it for me, hmm?",o="斯南格要你用裁缝技能制作 1 条简易长裙，并把货送到杜隆塔尔森金村的泰塔西那里。",oEN="Snang wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Simple Dress and take the order to Tai'tasi at Sen'jin Village in Durotar.",p="噢，兄弟！那条裙子是给我的吗？",pEN="Oh, mon! Is that dress for me?",c="一条裙子？给我的？哈……我用不着问是谁送来的。告诉斯南格……他下次路过时我会穿上它。噢，还有，他给我那包补给现在说得通了——那是付给你的。",cEN="A dress? For me? Hah... I don't need to ask who sent this. Tell Snang... I'll wear it next time he stops by. Oh, and now this bag of supplies he gave me makes sense -- it's to pay you."}
Q[28699]={d="血蹄村的马格林已经好几个季节都穿着那件旧丁香色背心了，到这会儿它更像是补丁而不是衬衫。他不会开口要新东西——说它\"还能穿\"。\n\n我真希望有时间做件好事帮帮他，可我订单和训练忙得不可开交。你要是有时间，能做两件蓝色亚麻衬衫送去吗？我想他会喜欢一份用心做的礼物。",dEN="Magrin down in Bloodhoof Village has been wearing the same old lilac vest for seasons now, and it's more patch than shirt at this point. He won't ask for anything new -- says it's “still got wear in it.”\n\nI wish I had time to do a good deed and help him out, but I'm swamped with orders and training. If you have time, could you craft two Blue Linen Shirts and deliver them? I think he'll appreciate a gift made with care.",o="瓦罕要你用裁缝技能制作 2 件蓝色亚麻衬衫，并把货送到莫高雷血蹄村的马格林·河鬃那里。",oEN="Vhan wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Blue Linen Shirt and take the order to Magrin Rivermane at Bloodhoof Village in Mulgore.",p="不用为那些断线操心，对吧？",pEN="No need to fuss over snapped threads, is there?",c="嗯。亚麻……针脚细致……这是瓦罕的手笔，对吧？哈。看来我得让那件旧背心歇歇了。谢谢你，朋友。",cEN="Hm. Linen... fine stitching... this is Vhan's doing, isn't it? Hah. I suppose I'll give the old vest a rest. Thank you, friend."}
Q[28700]={d="帕薇·雾行者一直在灵魂高地协助说书人处理古代遗物——精致的雕刻、羽毛护符，甚至裂开的符石。她订了一副手套，这样就不必赤着蹄子去碰它们了。\n\n我希望你接下这份订单，好让它及时送到。帕薇说我们应当以敬意对待过去，而这要从别把它弄脏开始。",dEN="Pawe Mistrunner's been assisting the Lorespeakers with ancient relics up on the Spirit Rise -- delicate carvings, feathered talismans, even cracked runestones. She requested a pair of gloves so that she could avoid handling them bare-hoofed.\n\nI'd like you to take this order so it can be delivered in a timely fashion. Pawe says we should treat the past with respect, and that starts with not smudging it.",o="瓦罕要你用裁缝技能制作 1 副重型亚麻手套，并把货送到莫高雷雷霆崖灵魂高地的帕薇·雾行者那里。",oEN="Vhan wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Heavy Linen Gloves and take the order to Pawe Mistrunner at the Spirit Rise in Thunder Bluff in Mulgore.",p="你是来研究历史的吗？",pEN="Have you come to study history?",c="啊……这副手套既保护双手，也保护历史。合手，缝得也仔细。瓦罕派你来是对的。祖先们感谢你，我也一样。",cEN="Ah... these gloves will protect both hand and history. Well-fitted, carefully stitched. Vhan was wise to send you. The ancestors thank you, and so do I."}
Q[28701]={d="梅丽尔·温迪尔替我们的圣骑士处理天灾石，那些石头的污秽把她的长袍染得都认不出来了？这词是这么用的吗？\n\n总之，她正需要几件新的白色亚麻长袍，可我一直没空去做。你正好可以练练手，那何不由你来做呢？",dEN="Merril Wendyl handles Scourgestones on behalf of our paladins, and the filth of those stones stains her robes to unrecognizability? Is that a word?\n\nAnyway, she could use some new White Linen Robes but I haven't had time to get to it. You could use the practice, so why don't you make them?",o="康斯坦丝·布里斯博伊斯要你用裁缝技能制作 3 件白色亚麻长袍，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地布瑞尔墓地的梅丽尔·温迪尔那里。",oEN="Constance Brisboise wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 3 White Linen Robe and take the order to Merril Wendyl at the Brill Cemetery in Tirisfal Glades.",p="我依旧衣不蔽体……也没人赏识。",pEN="I remain underdressed... and underappreciated.",c="终于好了。干净、挺括，而且恰到好处地肃穆。康斯坦丝懂得仪表的重要——即便在亡灵之中也一样。你做得很好。",cEN="At last. Crisp, clean, and properly somber. Constance understands the importance of presentation -- even in undeath. You've done well."}
Q[28702]={d="贾斯珀·格林是说书人的一名新学徒，他们派他去调查北岸矿洞。对此有个问题——他没有靴子。什么鞋都没有。\n\n贾斯珀也许会因为别的原因撑不过说书人的训练，可我不愿看到他仅仅因为穿得不像样而落选。我一直没空给他做点什么，不过你看起来不忙。何不由你来做呢？",dEN="Jasper Greene is an initiate in the Lorespeakers and they've asked him to investigate the North Shore Mine. One problem with that -- he has no boots. Or shoes of any kind.\n\nJasper may not make it through Lorespeaker training for other reasons, but I'd hate it to be simply because he was underdressed. I haven't had time to work on making anything for him, but you look like you're not busy. Why don't you do it?",o="康斯坦丝·布里斯博伊斯要你用裁缝技能制作 1 双简易亚麻靴，并把货送到提瑞斯法林地索利登农场的贾斯珀·格林那里。",oEN="Constance Brisboise wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Simple Linen Boots and take the order to Jasper Greene at Solliden Farmstead in Tirisfal Glades.",p="我就待在这儿，待在干土上。",pEN="I'm staying right here on dry dirt.",c="哎呀。谢谢。我……嗯……很高兴现在能做这项任务了。\n\n<贾斯珀叹了口气。>\n\n告诉康斯坦丝我又欠她一次。",cEN="Gee. Thanks. I... um... appreciate that I can do this task now.\n\n<Jasper sighs.>\n\nTell Constance I owe her -- again."}
Q[28703]={d="基利安已经在北潮汐run（North Tide's Run）钓了好几周的鱼，每次回来都湿透到骨头。他不肯承认，可他那件旧衬衫已经到处是洞，简直不像布了。\n\n如果你能缝几件灰色毛纺衬衫，就该给他送去。我本想自己去，但我不觉得他会乐意收我的东西。说来话长。",dEN="Killian's been fishing the North Tide's Run for weeks now, and he comes back soaked to the bone every time. He won't admit it, but that old shirt of his is more hole than cloth.\n\nIf you can sew up some Gray Woolen Shirts, you should bring them to him. I'd do it myself but I doubt he'd take it kindly from me. Long story.",o="安德莉亚·博因顿要你用裁缝技能制作 4 件灰色毛纺衬衫，并把货送到银松森林北潮汐run（North Tide's Run）的基利安·萨纳萨那里。",oEN="Andrea Boynton wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 4 Gray Woolen Shirt and take the order to Killian Sanatha at North Tide's Run in Silverpine Forest.",p="潮水退去时，你真能感觉到风的牙齿。",pEN="When the tide runs out you can really feel the teeth of the wind.",c="毛料的，嗯？不错……相当不错。暖和得能挡住海风，又朴素得不会惹海鸥盯着看。<class>，我感谢你，这些是我从海里捞来的补给。",cEN="Wool, eh? Not bad... not bad at all. Warm enough to keep the sea wind out, but plain enough to keep the gulls from staring. You have my thanks, <class>, and some supplies I've claimed from the sea."}
Q[28704]={d="莉莉就算按被遗忘者的标准也算个怪人。她涉猎附魔，却光着脚在森林里跑。\n\n我有很多本事，可做鞋不在其中。你要是有这方面的天赋，也许可以送她一双毛纺靴。我们被遗忘者得互相照应。",dEN="Lilly is an odd one, even for a Forsaken. She dabbles in enchanting but she runs through the forest without any shoes.\n\nI've got many talents but shaping footwear isn't one of them. If you have the talent for it, maybe offer her a pair of Woolen Boots. We Forsaken have to look out for one another.",o="安德莉亚·博因顿要你用裁缝技能制作 2 双毛纺靴，并把货送到银松森林瑟伯切尔以南她营地的莉莉那里。",oEN="Andrea Boynton wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Woolen Boots and take the order to Lilly at her camp south of the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest.",p="那是给我的吗……还是你只是路过？",pEN="Are those for me... or are you just passing by?",c="它们很暖和。我没想到。告诉安德莉亚我会好好爱惜。她总是比表面上操心得多。至于你的好意，拿着。",cEN="They're warm. I didn't expect that. Tell Andrea I'll wear them carefully. She always worries more than she lets on. And for your kindness, here."}
Q[28705]={d="自从部落在十字路口扎下根，我们的订单就多得一个月都做不完。你要是有裁缝手艺，我们正需要你帮忙清掉这些积压。\n\n萨洛塔斯·明阳船长已经在棘齿城靠港，要一件新的珠饰斗篷。拿这个练手应该挺容易，对吧，<name>？",dEN="Ever since the Horde established the Crossroads, we have had more orders than we can fill in a month. If you've got tailoring skill, we could use your help clearing this backlog.\n\nCaptain Thalo'thas Brightsun has put into port in Ratchet and asked for a new Pearl-clasped Cloak. Should be an easy one to cut your teeth on, eh <name>?",o="哈莉贾·白行者要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件珠饰斗篷，并把货送到贫瘠之地棘齿城的萨洛塔斯·明阳船长那里。",oEN="Halija Whitestrider wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Pearl-clasped Cloak and take the order to Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun at Ratchet in Barrens.",p="比困在这里更糟的，就只有困在这里还没有斗篷挡海风了。",pEN="The only thing worse than being stuck here is being stuck here without a cloak to cut the sea winds.",c="嗯，这在泰尔阿比姆算不上最时髦的样式，可乞丐没得挑。也许再过几千年，你们这些人就能学会像奎尔多雷那样缝东西了。不过别以为我会赖你的账。海盗总是还债的。",cEN="Well, it's not the height of fashion in Tel'Abim but beggars can't be choosers. Perhaps in a few thousand years you people will have learned to sew like the Quel'dorei. But don't think I'm going to stiff you. A pirate always pays his debts."}
Q[28706]={d="有人向我要一双结实厚实的手套，可我手边没有那样的东西给来订货的地精。如果你能帮忙，就做几副重型毛纺手套，送到黄金之路北边她家里的维尼基·螺栓桶那里。",dEN="I had a request for some hardy and thick gloves, but I didn't have anything like that available to give to the goblin who requested it. If you can help out, craft a couple pairs of Heavy Woolen Gloves and deliver them to Wenikee Boltbucket at her house north on the Gold Road.",o="哈莉贾·白行者要你用裁缝技能制作 2 副重型毛纺手套，并把货送到贫瘠之地黄金之路北边她家里的维尼基·螺栓桶那里。",oEN="Halija Whitestrider wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Heavy Woolen Gloves and take the order to Wenikee Boltbucket at her home on the northern Gold Road in the Barrens.",p="啊……是有人派你送补给来的吗？",pEN="Ah... were you sent with supplies?",c="终于有双像样的手套了！这些能挡住油污沾上我的手，也能保住我指节上的皮。谢谢！",cEN="At last -- proper gloves! These'll keep the oil off my hands and the skin on my knuckles. Thanks!"}
Q[28707]={d="我正需要一位有经验的裁缝帮忙处理几份贫瘠之地居民积压的订单。你有兴趣吗？\n\n塔特纳克·钢铸眼力极好，一眼就能认出奇怪的矿石，而顺手把找到的每一块都揣进兜里的习惯更是厉害。问题是，他捡得太多，旧挎包都撑破了缝线。\n\n我这儿有个订单，要做两个新毛纺包送给他。你可以在路对面、铁匠铺那儿找到他。",dEN="I could use the assistance of an experienced tailor to fill a few back orders from folks in the Barrens. Are you interested?\n\nTatternack Steelforge has got a sharp eye for strange ore and an even sharper tendency to pocket every last bit he finds. Problem is, he picked up so much his old satchels burst at the seams.\n\nI've got an order for two new Woolen Bags to deliver to him. You can find him just across the road, at the forge.",o="玛哈尼要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个毛纺包，并把货送到贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的塔特纳克·钢铸那里。",oEN="Mahani wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Woolen Bag and take the order to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.",p="除非你带了装矿石的东西来，否则我还得从地上刮。",pEN="Unless you brought something to carry ore, I'll keep scraping it off the ground.",c="嗯，这些能装下双倍的矿石、少一半的腰疼。<class>，我很感激。让我给你些材料作为答谢。",cEN="Hmm, these will hold twice the ore for half the back pain. I appreciate this, <class>. Let me give you some materials as thanks."}
Q[28708]={d="我的朋友布莱恩住在黑棘岭，她捎信来说，附近野猪人营地周围长满的巨大荆棘把她的裤子划破了。如果你不介意帮我，这一单正好可以让你练练手？",dEN="My friend Brine lives down on Blackthorn Ridge and she sent word that she ripped her pants on the giant thorns that grow all around the nearby quilboar encampment. This would be a good order for you to get some practice with, if you don't mind assisting me?",o="玛哈尼要你用裁缝技能制作 1 条手缝亚麻长裤，并把货送到贫瘠之地南部黑棘岭的布莱恩那里。",oEN="Mahani wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Handstitched Linen Britches and take the order to Brine at Blackthorn Ridge in the southern Barrens.",p="你感觉到那阵风了吗？",pEN="Do you feel that breeze?",c="感谢元素！再吹两阵我可就要出丑了。你赢得了我的感谢！",cEN="Thank the elements! I was two gusts away from scandal. You've earned my thanks!"}
Q[28709]={d="灰谷的猎人给我带来战利品，而在等着它们被装裱期间，我快没地方存放了。如果你能为我做几个小丝包，我就能用它小心地装这些贡品。猎人的骄傲不该被塞进粗麻袋里。",dEN="The hunters of Ashenvale bring me trophies and I'm running out of space to store them while we wait for them to be mounted. If you could craft me a couple Small Silk Packs, I could use them to carry these offerings with care. A hunter's pride should not be stuffed in a sack of burlap.",o="塞纳尼·雷心要你用裁缝技能制作 2 个小丝包，并把货送到灰谷碎木岗哨的塞纳尼·雷心那里。",oEN="Senani Thunderheart wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Small Silk Pack and take the order to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post in Ashenvale.",p="你不是来闲聊的吧？",pEN="You're not here to gossip, are you?",c="是的……缝线结实，织工精细。这会派上大用场。年轻的猎人们会看到他们的努力受到尊重、被人铭记。多谢。",cEN="Yes... strong seams, fine weave. This will serve well. The young hunters will see their efforts honored, and remembered. My thanks."}
Q[28710]={d="死亡猎手莱什干着份让人羡慕不起来的差事。她独自驻守在南点塔。我都记不起上次有人给她送补给是什么时候了。\n\n<name>，我老了，穿不过针眼了。也许你能帮这把老骨头一个忙，给莱什做一件碧蓝丝质外衣。告诉她，她让叔叔感到骄傲。",dEN="Deathstalker Lesh has an unenviable job. She's stationed at Southpoint Tower, all by herself. I can't remember the last time someone made a supply run out to her.\n\nI'm getting too old to pass the thread through the needle, <name>. Perhaps you can help these old bones out by crafting Lesh an Azure Silk Vest. Tell her she makes her uncle proud.",o="马伦·斯温要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件碧蓝丝质外衣，并把货送到希尔斯布莱德丘陵南点塔的死亡猎手莱什那里。",oEN="Mallen Swain wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Azure Silk Vest and take the order to Deathstalker Lesh at Southpoint Tower in Hillsbrad Foothills.",p="你想要什么？",pEN="What do you desire?",c="叔叔？我的叔叔们都死了。\n\n噢，马伦叔叔？好吧，他也死了，只是……死法不太一样。他倒是有心。谢了。",cEN="Uncle? All my uncles are dead.\n\nOh, Uncle Mallen? Well, he's dead too, just... in a different way. Kind of him I suppose. Thanks."}
Q[28711]={d="我急需一位裁缝，从你手指上的茧子我就看得出你会拿针。\n\n太阳落山后这里就冷了。沙子不像石头那样存得住热，而我平常这身打扮更适合赛道，不适合吹风。你能给我做一条漂亮暖和的毛纺长裙吗？我会付钱的！我保证！",dEN="I am in desperate need of a tailor and I can tell by the calluses on your fingers that you know how to hold a needle.\n\nIt gets cold out here when the sun drops. Sand doesn't hold heat like stone, and my usual outfit is more suited for racetrack than the wind. Would you make me a nice warm Woolen Dress? I'll pay! Promise!",o="泰拉斯·晨影要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件白色毛纺长裙，并把货送到千针石林微光赛道的泰拉斯·晨影那里。",oEN="Tyraeth Morningshade wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 White Woolen Dress and take the order to Tyraeth Morningshade at Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.",p="还在发抖呢！拿到那条裙子了吗？",pEN="Still shivering! Got that dress?",c="这又暖和又真的挺好看！谢谢你！这是我答应你的报酬。",cEN="This is warm and actually cute! Thank you! And here's the payment I promised."}
Q[28712]={d="我无意中听到你是位裁缝。我的行李本该被直接传送到微光赛道的。可现在看来，它正飘在某个现实之间——或者大海底。\n\n不管怎样，我需要两件次级法师长袍。希望你能加快这单，免得有人把我当成玩廉价把戏的骗子！",dEN="I couldn't help overhearing that you're a tailor. My luggage was supposed to be teleported straight to Mirage Raceway. Instead, I believe it is now somewhere between realities -- or possibly the bottom of the Great Sea.\n\nRegardless, I require a pair of Lesser Wizard's Robes. I hope you'll hurry the order along before someone mistakes me for a conjurer of cheap tricks!",o="法师提尔斯要你用裁缝技能制作 2 件次级法师长袍，并把货送到千针石林微光赛道的法师提尔斯那里。",oEN="Magus Tirth wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Lesser Wizard's Robe and take the order to Magus Tirth at Mirage Raceway in Thousand Needles.",p="你要是不交货，我是不是该试着给一袋土豆附个魔……？",pEN="I suppose I could attempt to enchant a potato sack if you don't deliver...?",c="啊，好多了。尊严恢复了，奥术焦点也重新对准了，衬里里连一只沙蚤都没有。你做得很好。",cEN="Ah, much better. Dignity restored, arcane focus realigned, and not a single sand flea in the lining. You've done well."}
Q[28713]={d="先知莫克萨丁会进入深度恍惚来指引我们。他能看穿丛林、大海，有时还能看穿灵魂世界的帷幕。可近来，这种消耗越来越大。他的幻象开始动摇。他的双手在颤抖。\n\n如果你能制作冥想手套，就送到格罗姆高营地这儿给他。它们也许能帮他锚定专注……并稳住他伸向不可见之物的手。",dEN="Far Seer Mok'thardin enters deep trances to guide us. He sees across jungle, sea, and sometimes through the veil of the spirit world. But lately, the strain has grown. His visions falter. His hands tremble.\n\nIf you can craft Gloves of Meditation, bring them to him here at Grom'gol Base Camp. They may help him anchor his focus... and steady his reach across the unseen.",o="赫拉格兰要你用裁缝技能制作 2 副冥想手套，并把货送到荆棘谷格罗姆高营地的先知莫克萨丁那里。",oEN="Hragran wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Gloves of Meditation and take the order to Far Seer Mok'thardin at Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale.",p="丛林在低语，可我没法让自己的心静下来。",pEN="The jungle whispers, but I cannot still my mind.",c="是的……这副手套带着一种沉静的力量。那些丝线平息了我眼后的风暴。你既尊敬了我，也尊敬了灵魂。带着这些为你手艺准备的补给，平安地去吧。",cEN="Yes... these gloves carry a quiet strength. The threads ease the storm behind my eyes. You honor both me and the spirits. Go in peace with these supplies for your craft."}
Q[28714]={d="<class>……你是裁缝，不是吗？我是私下问你的，朋友。我当时在外面，呃……方便……沼泽里突然窜出一只鳄鱼扑向我。在我……衣不蔽体的状态下，它只咬到了一口我的裤子。可现在我需要几条替换的。\n\n我愿意为你的服务付钱。别担心，长袍遮得住……暂时遮得住。",dEN="<class>... you are a tailor are you not? I ask this in confidence, friend. I was out, uh... relieving myself... when a crocolisk sprang up out of the swamp at me. In my... disrobed state, he got nothing more than a mouthful of my pants. But now I need a few replacements.\n\nI'm willing to pay for your services. Don't worry, the robe covers it... for now.",o="费尔泽鲁尔要你用裁缝技能制作 4 条深红丝质短裤，并把货送到悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的费尔泽鲁尔那里。",oEN="Fel'zerul wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 4 Crimson Silk Pantaloons and take the order to Fel'zerul at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="我不能再大声询问了。你拿到那些东西了吗？",pEN="I must not ask aloud again. Do you have the items?",c="谢谢你。这将是我们的秘密，<class>。集会上我的对手们可巴不得听到这个故事。",cEN="Thank you. This will be our secret, <class>. My rivals within the coven would love to get their ears on this story."}
Q[28715]={d="这边这个真是没用！\n\n<薇薇安用瘦骨嶙峋的拇指朝斯兰达一戳。>\n\n我说了我需要一件长斗篷。不是披肩。不是罩布。是一件。完整尺寸的。斗篷。\n\n你要是还不至于叫人彻底失望，就给我带一件长丝质斗篷来。要长到能挡住沙漠的风，还要有足够的样式，好让我忘掉眼下陪着我的是些什么货色。",dEN="THIS one here is USELESS!\n\n<Vivian jerks a bony thumb at Sranda.>\n\nI said I needed a long cloak. Not a shawl. Not a drape. A full. Size. Cloak.\n\nIf you're not a complete disappointment, bring me a Long Silken Cloak. Something long enough to keep out the desert wind, and with enough style to forget the company I'm keeping at the moment.",o="暗影法师薇薇安·拉格雷夫要你用裁缝技能制作 1 件长丝质斗篷，并把货送到荒芜之地卡加斯的暗影法师薇薇安·拉格雷夫那里。",oEN="Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Long Silken Cloak and take the order to Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave at Kargath in Badlands.",p="没有斗篷？那我们还有什么好说的？",pEN="No cloak? Then why are we speaking?",c="终于来了个有眼睛、有手、还带一丝能力的人。这个能用。我甚至可能不再抱怨了……短暂地。",cEN="At last, someone with eyes, hands, and a hint of competence. This will do. I might even stop complaining... briefly."}
Q[28716]={d="你是裁缝？感谢洛阿！我需要你帮忙。\n\n本来我不该把獠牙伸进别人的闲事里，可……这事越来越要命了。拉德的裤子一天比一天往下掉，要是他再弯一次腰，我这儿怕是要闹起来。\n\n你要是能给他做几条碧蓝丝质腰带，好把意思传达到……就别告诉他是我派你来的——就说是\"一位忧心忡忡的旅店客人\"送的礼物。",dEN="You a tailor? Thank the loa! I need your help.\n\nNow, I wouldn't normally stick my tusks into anyone else's business, but... this is gettin' dire. Lard's pants've been slippin' lower by the day, and if he bends over again I may have a riot on my hands.\n\nIf you could make him a couple Azure Silk Belts to get the point across.... Just don't tell him I sent you -- just say it's a gift from a \"concerned inn guest.\"",o="原始者断牙要你用裁缝技能制作 2 条碧蓝丝质腰带，并把货送到辛特兰恶齿村的拉德那里。",oEN="Primal Torntusk wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Azure Silk Belt and take the order to Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",p="这是啥，礼物？",pEN="Wut this, gift?",c="腰带！拉德再也不用拿邪枝巨魔的内脏当腰带了！拉德谢谢你。",cEN="Belts! Lard no have to use Vilebranch entrail for belt no more! Lard thanks you."}
Q[28717]={d="<class>……你是裁缝，不是吗？总算来了个能把我主人打扮得配得上她身份的人！没错，扎卡拉需要一件新长袍。不是随便什么长袍。是一件力量长袍！你觉得你能办到吗，<race>？动作快点！\n\n是啊，别担心，会付你钱的。",dEN="<class>... you are a tailor are you not? It's about time someone showed up who could outfit my master as she deserves to be outfitted! That's right, Zakara needs a new robe. Not just any robe. A Robe of Power! Do you think you can handle that, <race>? Snap to it!\n\nYeah don't worry, you'll get paid.",o="皮普乔特想让你用裁缝技能制作 1 件能量法袍，并把订单送到凄凉之地的暗影猎手村的扎卡拉手中。",oEN="Pipjot wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Robe of Power and take the order to Zakara at Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",p="<扎卡拉默默注视着你，她布满伤疤的脸僵硬得连微笑都做不到。>",pEN="<Zakara stares at you mutely, her scarred face too stiff to even smile.>",c="<扎卡拉点头致谢，并递给你一个装有布匹和裁缝材料的包裹。>",cEN="<Zakara nods her thanks and offers you a bag containing cloth and tailoring materials.>"}
Q[28718]={d="噢，一位裁缝！我知道你懂，在这种条件下我根本没法工作。丝绸过时了，毛料是场悲剧，魔纹布？别逗我笑。\n\n要我在这片被太阳晒白的废土上做出任何还算时髦的东西，我就需要像样的材料。给我带十卷符文布来。不是碎料，不是线头，而是整卷的、完好的。风格需要牺牲，而我需要符文布。",dEN="Oh, a tailor! I know you understand, I simply cannot work under these conditions. Silk is passé, wool is tragic, and mageweave? Don't make me laugh.\n\nIf I'm to produce anything remotely fashionable in this sun-bleached wasteland, I need proper material. Bring me ten Bolts of Runecloth. Not scraps, not threads but full bolts, pristine. Style demands sacrifice, and I demand Runecloth.",o="傲慢的裁缝师要你用裁缝技能制作 10 卷符文布，并把货送到塔纳利斯热砂港的傲慢的裁缝师那里。",oEN="Haughty Modiste wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 10 Bolt of Runecloth and take the order to Haughty Modiste at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.",p="你管这叫交货？符文布呢？别浪费我的白天。",pEN="You call this a delivery? Where's the Runecloth? Do not waste my daylight.",c="终于！总算有点配得上我构想的东西了。有了这个，我们也许能挽救这一季。你可以沐浴在我的感激之中……隔着点距离。",cEN="Finally! At last, something worthy of my vision. With this, we might save the season. You may bask in my gratitude... at a distance."}
Q[28719]={d="我不是森林巨魔，<class>。这里的土地太潮湿了。树木太近，也太高。我在考虑离开，但我必须为我的目的地做好准备：燃烧平原。\n\n如果你有这门手艺，我需要几双烬布靴。它们应该能扛住平原的酷热。",dEN="I am no forest troll, <class>. The earth is too moist here. The trees are too close, and too tall. I be thinkin' of leavin' but I must be prepared for my destination: Burnin' Steppes.\n\nIf you've the skill, I be needin' a couple pairs of Cindercloth Boots. They should handle the heat of the Steppes.",o="奥里克安多想让你用裁缝技能制作 2 双烬布靴，并把订单送到菲拉斯的莫沙彻营地的奥里克安多手中。",oEN="Orik'ando wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Cindercloth Boots and take the order to Orik'ando at Camp Mojache in Feralas.",p="你带靴子来了，还是只带了故事？",pEN="You bringin' boots, or just stories?",c="终于！你知道自己在做什么。谢谢。把这些我带不走的东西拿去吧。",cEN="Finally! Ya know what ya doin'. Thanks. Take these things I can not carry with me."}
Q[28720]={d="既然你把我的裤子做得那么好，我还有份活儿要交给你！这次我需要一副新护肩，暗影布套装里的那种。你觉得你能帮我办到吗？",dEN="Since you did such a good job on my pants, I have another job for you! This time I need a new pair of shoulders, something in the Shadoweave set. Think you could handle that for me?",o="菲尔泽鲁想让你用裁缝技能制作 1 副暗影布护肩，并把订单送到悲伤沼泽斯通纳德的菲尔泽鲁手中。",oEN="Fel'zerul wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 1 Shadoweave Shoulders and take the order to Fel'zerul at Stonard in Swamp of Sorrows.",p="没有护肩？那我还是……不够时髦。",pEN="No shoulders? Then I remain... unfashionable.",c="好……这下我能在女巫会的年度集会上一鸣惊人了。拿着这些补给。我得为出行做准备了。",cEN="Yes... I will steal the show at the coven's annual conference now. Here, take these supplies. I must prepare for my trip."}
Q[28721]={d="你是裁缝，对吧？很好。\n\n当贝尔格罗姆把我判到这里时，我没什么时间收拾行李。除非我想让自己的脑袋和肩膀分家。可一个姑娘天天穿同一套制服总会腻的。等我终于办完这里的事、能回奥格瑞玛喝上一杯麦酒时，我想要几条朴素的黑色长裙。你能帮我吗？",dEN="You're a tailor, aren't you? Good.\n\nWhen Belgrom sentenced me here there wasn't time to pack much. Not if I wanted to keep my head attached to my shoulders. But a girl gets tired of the same uniform every day. I'd like a couple Simple Black Dresses to wear when I finally conclude my business here and can grab an ale back in Orgrimmar. Can you help?",o="杰迪加想让你用裁缝技能制作 2 件朴素黑色长裙，并把订单送到艾萨拉瓦罗莫克的杰迪加手中。",oEN="Jediga wants you to use your tailoring skill to craft 2 Simple Black Dress and take the order to Jediga at Valormok in Azshara.",p="也许有一天我会告诉你贝尔格罗姆和我之间发生了什么。但不是今天。",pEN="Someday perhaps I will tell you what happened between me and Belgrom. Not today.",c="谢谢你让我的衣橱找回了一点尊严，<class>。",cEN="Thank you for bringing a shred of dignity back to my wardrobe, <class>."}
Q[33700]={d="这只圣杯似乎被人灌进了取自沼泽本身的水。我很好奇它是谁的。",dEN="The chalice seems to have been filled with water taken from the swamp itself. I wonder who it belongs to?",o="把圣杯还给它的主人。",oEN="Return the chalice to its owner.",p="我的圣杯？你找到它了？",pEN="My chalice? You found it?",c="你找到了我的圣杯！可它是空的。你喝过了？哦，天哪……我需要水。",cEN="You found my chalice! But it's empty. Did you drink from it? Ohhh goodness... I need water."}
Q[33701]={d="哦，原来是你来奖励我的！我渴坏了。求你了，能给我带点喝的吗？我把背包放哪儿了？我在里面变出过水。\n\n我没法思考。周围的沼泽野兽太多了，而我渴得要命。\n\n我看见部落往附近的哨塔运送补给。他们想要我的圣杯。我没法思考，我需要水……",dEN="Oh, it is YOU that has come to reward ME! I am so thirsty. Please, can you bring me a drink? Where did I put my backpack, I had conjured water in there.\n\nI can't think. There are too many swamp-beasts surrounding me and I'm so thirsty.\n\nI saw the Horde bringing supplies to the nearby Watch Tower. They want my chalice. I can't think, I need water...",o="用清水把圣杯装满。",oEN="Fill the chalice with fresh water.",p="这一定就是卡兹诺说的那种水！",pEN="This must be the water Khazno was talking about!",c="<用那桶清水把卡兹诺的圣杯灌满。>",cEN="<Use the bucket of fresh water to fill Khazno's chalice.>"}
Q[33702]={d="把水带回去给卡兹诺，并杀掉 5 只沼泽行者，帮他平复神经、理清思绪。",dEN="Bring the water back to Khazno and slay 5 Swampwalkers to help calm his nerves and clear his mind.",o="杀掉 5 只沼泽行者，并把水带回给卡兹诺。",oEN="Kill 5 Swampwalkers and bring the water back to Khazno.",p="我终于能清楚地思考了。",pEN="Finally, I can think clearly now.",c="我不知道自己出了什么事，但我确信和这些沼泽行者有关。",cEN="I don't know what happened to me, but I'm sure it has to do with these Swampwalkers."}
Q[33703]={d="你是说你在洞穴里找到了我的圣杯？！还是在其中一只野兽身上……\n\n还是说不是这样？\n\n……会不会和那把匕首有关……？\n\n唔，这可真是个难题。\n\n<name>，对吧？好吧，听我说，<name>，我觉得我被人暗算了，或者差不多是这么回事。\n\n我只知道他们想要我的匕首——低语。但他们拿不到。它是我的，只属于我。\n\n我必须把它藏起来。快，<name>，到他们永远找不到的地方与我会合……\n\n冬泉谷！确切地说，是凯尔瑟里尔湖！\n\n那正是我最初找到它的地方，嘿嘿！它在那里沉睡了许多年……\n\n到那里找我，我马上就动身。\n\n别担心，你不会比我先到的。",dEN="You said you found my chalice in the cave? On one of these beasts, no less...\n\nor was it?\n\n... could it have to do with the dagger...?\n\nHmm, this is certainly a predicament.\n\n<name>, was it? Well listen, <name>, I think I have been sabotaged, or something to that effect.\n\nAll I know is that they want my dagger, Whisper. But they cannot have it. It is mine and only mine.\n\nI must hide it. Quickly, <name>, meet me in the one place they could never find it...\n\nWinterspring. Lake Kel'Theril to be exact!\n\nThat is where I originally found it, hehe! Where it laid dormant for so many years...\n\nFind me there, I will leave momentarily.\n\nDon't worry, you won't get there before I do.",o="在冬泉谷找到卡兹诺。",oEN="Find Khazno in Winterspring.",p="你把我的圣杯灌满了吗？",pEN="Have you filled my chalice?",c="你到了。\n\n你花的时间可真够久的……\n\n现在轮到我的低语了。我亲爱的、亲爱的低语。\n\n你……你听到了吗？",cEN="You have arrived.\n\nTook you long enough...\n\nNow for my Whisper. My dear, dear Whisper.\n\nDo... do you hear it?"}
Q[33704]={d="我必须把它藏起来……我必须把低语藏起来……赶在他们再次找到我之前。\n\n它从不入睡。它从不放我走。总是低语……总是呼唤着他们。\n\n我曾试着把它埋起来。埋在冰冷的土地深处。我以为寂静会降临……我以为梦会停止。但它们从不停下。\n\n梦只是变得更响亮。而现在……现在他来了。\n\n你，<name>……你必须听。仔细听。\n\n阴影中有一个死神。我在清醒时见过他，睡着时又见了一次。始终注视。始终等待。\n\n他要的不是我。不，不。还不是时候。他要的是它。\n\n低语在呼唤他……它吸引着所有被死亡触碰过的人。而他听见了，就像我当初一样……就像你握它太久之后也会一样。\n\n找到他。\n\n猎杀他。\n\n在他从我手中夺走匕首、用鲜血与哀恸将它重新束缚之前，了结他。\n\n求你了，<name>……\n\n帮帮我。帮帮它。\n\n趁它还没把我们两个都吞噬。",dEN="I must hide it... I must hide Whisper... before they find me again.\n\nIt never sleeps. It never lets me go. Always whispering... always calling them.\n\nI tried to bury it once. Deep beneath the cold earth. Thought the silence would come... thought the dreams would stop. But they never do.\n\nThe dreams only grew louder. And now... now he has come.\n\nYou, <name>... you must listen. Listen carefully.\n\nThere is a Reaper in the shadows. I have seen him in my waking hours, and again in my sleep. Always watching. Always waiting.\n\nHe doesn’t want me. No, no. Not yet. He wants it.\n\nWhisper calls to him... it beckons to all those touched by death. And he has heard it, just as I did... just as you will if you hold it too long.\n\nFind him.\n\nHunt him down.\n\nEnd him before he tears the dagger from my hands and binds it anew in blood and sorrow.\n\nPlease, <name>...\n\nHelp me. Help it.\n\nBefore it consumes us both.",o="杀掉潜伏在凯尔瑟里尔湖的死神。",oEN="Kill the Reaper hiding in Lake Kel'Theril.",c="你杀掉那个窥视者了吗？\n\n低语没那么响了……我能分辨出它们在说什么了。",cEN="You have slain the watcher?\n\nThe whispers are less loud... I can make out what they are saying."}
Q[33705]={d="现在我明白了。那把匕首……本就不是为我而来的。它甚至已不属于这个世界。\n\n那些声音……不再是低语，而是尖叫。是哭号。\n\n过去本身紧抓着低语不放。它要求被听见、被和解……被释放。\n\n曾经有个人……不，是一位战士。一个随亡者之风吹到我耳边的名字：艾尔瑞克·晨裂。\n\n他在几个世纪前的上古之战中奋战。艾尔瑞克挥舞着低语对抗燃烧军团本身，直到他倒下——被那些夺走他缚魂之刃的恶魔背叛并屠戮。\n\n从那一刻起，艾尔瑞克的灵魂就再未离去。他的痛苦透过低语穿透艾泽拉斯，触及……寻找……\n\n我们必须结束这一切。\n\n去寻找昔日战火燃起之地。低语正对我尖叫，它们只说了两个字；\n\n「艾萨拉」。\n\n艾尔瑞克的鬼魂眷恋着他的故土。找到他，听听他的要求。他会指引你该做什么。\n\n我会回到沼泽里我那棵树旁……我对它已经颇有感情了。我挺享受在这地方和悲伤沼泽之间来回冒险的。",dEN="I understand now. The dagger... it was not meant for me. It is not even meant for this world anymore.\n\nThe voices... they're no longer whispers, they are screams. Cries.\n\nThe past itself clutches at Whisper. It demands to be heard, to be reconciled... to be freed.\n\nThere was a man once... no, a warrior. A name carried to me on the winds of the dead: Aelric Dawnrend.\n\nHe fought in the War of the Ancients, centuries ago. Aelric wielded Whisper against the Burning Legion itself, until he fell, betrayed and slaughtered by demons who stole his soul-bound blade.\n\nSince that moment, Aelric's spirit has never left. His agony breached into Azeroth through Whisper, reaching... searching...\n\nWe must end this.\n\nSeek the place where ancient wars were fought. The whispers are screaming at me and they tell me one word;\n\n'Azshara'.\n\nAelric's ghost clings to his old home. Find him, and listen to his demands. He will guide you to what must be done.\n\nI will return to my tree in the swamp... I have grown rather fond of it. I do enjoy the adventure between here and the Swamp of Sorrows.",o="前往艾萨拉，找到艾尔瑞克·晨裂。",oEN="Travel to Azshara and locate Aelric Dawnrend.",c="就这样开始了。\n\n剑刃在颤动。它知道你已经来了。\n\n无数个纪元以来，我一直在等待，被悲伤、被背叛、被低语所变成的那种残酷饥渴所束缚。\n\n你不是第一个回应哭号的人。但也许你会是第一个倾听的人。\n\n若你想看到这诅咒被解除，就必须在他人转身离去之处采取行动。\n\n收集古老仪式残留之物——悲伤、腐化与破碎誓言的遗物，然后回到我这里。\n\n只有借由它们，最后的束缚才能被击碎……我的灵魂才能终于得到安息。",cEN="And so it begins.\n\nThe blade stirs. It knows you are here.\n\nFor countless ages, I have waited, bound by grief, by betrayal, by the cruel hunger of what Whisper became.\n\nYou are not the first to answer the cries. But you may be the first to listen.\n\nIf you would see this curse undone, then you must act where others turned away.\n\nGather what remains of the old rites, relics of sorrow, of corruption, of broken oaths, and return to me.\n\nOnly through them can the final bond be shattered... and my soul at last find rest."}
Q[33706]={d="又一个被匕首吸引而来的灵魂……又一个我悲伤的棋子。\n\n低语……我的灵魂……\n\n我锻造她，是为了反抗军团……可她却被背叛与死亡从我身边夺走。\n\n自那以后，我的灵魂便一直游荡，穿过帷幕向外探求，紧抓着那把曾属于我一部分的利刃。\"\n\n上古之战粉碎的不只是石头与血肉。它粉碎了誓言。粉碎了信仰。\n\n低语之所以被诅咒，不是因为邪恶，而是因为渴望……我的渴望。\n\n你，凡人……你听到了那些哭号，不是吗？透过匕首传来的尖叫？\n\n它们是我的。也是其他人的……无数被卷入低语阴影的灵魂。\n\n我恳求你。斩断锁链。\n\n<Aelric baja la cabeza>\n\n收集举行净化所需的各种遗物，那将解除我与这件武器的束缚。我需要以下物品：\n\n月尘之泪，据说由冬泉谷的悲苦上层精灵掉落；被遗忘者印记，据说由厄运之槌的埃德雷斯巫师掉落；还有一块邪能废墟碎片，据说由诅咒之地的末日守卫指挥官掉落。\n\n我还需要悲伤烙印遗物——一件用于上层精灵古老仪式的远古神器……我想你那位在沼泽里的小朋友可能已经找到了它。",dEN="Another soul drawn to the blade... another pawn of my sorrow.\n\nWhisper... my soul...\n\nI forged her in defiance of the Legion... yet she was torn from me by betrayal and death.\n\nEver since, my spirit has wandered, reaching across the veil, clinging to the blade that was once part of me.\"\n\nThe War of the Ancients shattered more than stone and flesh. It shattered oaths. It shattered faith.\n\nWhisper is cursed not by evil, but by longing... my longing.\n\nYou, mortal... you have heard the cries, have you not? The screams through the blade?\n\nThey were mine. They were the others, too... countless souls drawn into Whisper's shadow.\n\n<Aelric lowers his head>\n\nI beg you. Sever the chains.\n\nCollect the relics necessary to perform the cleansing that will remove my bondage from this weapon. I require the following items:\n\nMoondust Tears, said to be dropped by Anguished Highborne in Winterspring, the Seal of the Forgotten, said to be dropped by Eldreth Sorcerers in Dire Maul, and a Shard of Fel Ruin, said to be dropped by Doomguard Commanders in the Blasted Lands.\n\nI'll also require the Sorrowbrand Relic - an ancient artifact used in old Highborne rituals... I believe your little friend back in the swamp may have found it.\n\nOnly then will Whisper be free... and so too shall I be.",o="收集艾尔瑞克打破束缚所需的物品。",oEN="Collect the items Aelric needs to break his bondage.",p="会是他吗？一个能够集齐所有必需物品的人……",pEN="Could it be? Someone who was capable of collecting all of the necessary items...",c="你做得很好。如今我已从低语的囚禁中解脱……那么作为回报？\n\n我把它交给你。愿它像当初侍奉我那样侍奉你，却不带它给这个世界带来的折磨。",cEN="You have done well. I am now unshackled from my bondage with Whisper... and in return?\n\nI give it to you. May it serve you as it once did me, without the torment that it has brought upon the world."}
Q[33707]={d="啊，你……请稍等片刻。\n\n你该不会碰巧认识一个叫卡兹诺的侏儒吧？\n\n古怪的家伙……不过曾经心地不错。在那些……事故之前，是个聪明的脑子。\n\n我最后一次听说，他正前往悲伤沼泽。他嘟囔着什么追踪线索，想终结那桩「女巫的烂摊子」……我得补充一句，那是他自己搞出来的烂摊子。\n\n那是很久以前了。坦白说，太久了。\n\n我开始担心沼泽把他整个吞了，或者更糟——他的过去追上了他。他总在惹麻烦，总在寻找新的冒险……新的饰物、小玩意、遗物，什么都好。\n\n你愿意去找找他吗？",dEN="Ah, you there... a moment, if you please.\n\nYou wouldn't happen to know a gnome named Khazno, would you?\n\nStrange fellow... but a good heart, once. Brilliant mind, before the... incidents.\n\nLast I heard, he was headed into the Swamp of Sorrows. Muttered something about following a trail, trying to put an end to the 'witch fiasco'... a fiasco of his own creation, I might add.\n\nThat was some time ago. Too long, frankly.\n\nI'm beginning to worry the swamp swallowed him whole, or worse, that his past has caught up with him. He's always getting into trouble, always seeking out new adventures... new baubles, trinkets, relics, you name it.\n\nWould you be willing to seek him out?",o="在悲伤沼泽找到卡兹诺。",oEN="Find Khazno in the Swamp of Sorrows.",c="你找到了我和我的树！这就是我！\n\n到处都是沼泽野兽……那个洞穴？为什么洞里那只那么大？\n\n我的杯子呢……我的圣杯。它没满。\n\n半空还是半满？呃……我渴死了。",cEN="You have found me and my tree! This is me!\n\nSwamp beasts everywhere... the cave? Why is the one in the cave so big?\n\nWhere is my cup... my chalice. It's not full.\n\nHalf empty or half full? Urgh... I'm so thirsty."}
Q[41715]={d="丹奥加兹的工程师需要一块来自黑铁爆破手的爆破技术零件。把它取回来，送到洛克莫丹的丹奥加兹交给他。",dEN="The Dun Algaz Engineer needs a piece of Demolish Tech from the Dark Iron Sappers. Recover it and return to him at Dun Algaz in Loch Modan.",o="在洛克莫丹从黑铁爆破手身上收集一块爆破技术，并把它带给丹奥加兹的丹奥加兹工程师。",oEN="Collect a Demolish Tech from Dark Iron Sappers in Loch Modan and bring it to the Dun Algaz Engineer at Dun Algaz.",p="就在那座大坝附近看看吧，好像是叫岩锻？差不多吧！",pEN="Just look around that dam, Rockwrought I think? Something like that!",c="占位奖励文本：丹奥加兹的工程师收下爆破技术，并向你道谢。",cEN="Placeholder reward text: The Dun Algaz Engineer takes the Demolish Tech and thanks you."}
Q[49976]={d="以圣光之名！我拿起这本书时差点被电到，<name>。它周围的空气噼啪作响，满是电能，我发誓能听见书页间传来遥远的雷声。只有那些有毅力引导风暴原始力量的人，才该考虑打开它。你准备好面对这样的元素之怒了吗？",dEN="By the Light! This tome nearly shocked me when I picked it up, <name>. The very air around it crackles with electrical energy, and I swear I can hear distant thunder rumbling from within its pages. Only those with the fortitude to channel the raw power of storms should even consider opening it. Are you prepared for such elemental fury?",o="阅读风暴法典，在北郡谷寻找尼基·塞斯拉。",oEN="Read the Storm Codex and seek out Niki Thesla in Northshire Valley.",p="我能感觉到风暴的能量在你周围噼啪作响，<name>。你把风暴法典带来了吗？风暴在召唤那些想要掌控它力量的人。",pEN="I can sense the storm's energy crackling around you, <name>. Have you brought the Storm Codex? The tempest calls to those who would master its power.",c="太出色了，<name>！你听从了风暴的召唤，证明了自己的价值。风与闪电的力量如今流经你身。作为风暴使者，你将号令自然本身的力量。\n\n欢迎踏上风暴之路。让你的敌人畏惧你的元素之怒吧！",cEN="Excellent, <name>! You have heeded the storm's call and proven yourself worthy. The power of wind and lightning flows through you now. As a Stormbringer, you will command the very forces of nature itself.\n\nWelcome to the path of the tempest. Let your enemies tremble before your elemental fury!"}
Q[49977]={d="一项高尚的使命在等着你，<name>。这份誓言刻在我见过的最精良的钢上，几乎散发着荣誉与责任的光辉。那些话语讲述着守护、牺牲，以及在最不可能的情况下坚守不退。很少有人有这份心去承担这样的重担。你有这样的勇气吗？",dEN="A noble calling awaits you, <name>. This oath was inscribed on the finest steel I have ever seen, and it practically radiates honor and duty. The words speak of protection, sacrifice, and standing firm against impossible odds. Few have the heart to take such a burden upon themselves. Do you possess such courage?",o="阅读守护者誓言，在北郡谷寻找格斯。",oEN="Read the Guardian's Oath and seek out Gus in Northshire Valley.",p="挺直腰杆，<name>。你带着守护者誓言吗？真正的保护者必须明白自己神圣职责的分量。",pEN="Stand tall, <name>. Do you carry the Guardian's Oath? A true protector must understand the weight of their sacred duty.",c="干得好，<name>！你明白这份使命所承载的神圣职责。守护者矗立在无辜与邪恶之间，永不屈服，永不折断。\n\n你的训练现在开始。记住：你的生命属于你所要保护的人。用你每一次呼吸去回报那份信任。",cEN="Well done, <name>! You understand the sacred duty that comes with this calling. A Guardian stands as the shield between innocence and evil, never yielding, never breaking.\n\nYour training begins now. Remember - your life belongs to those you protect. Honor that trust with every breath you take."}
Q[49978]={d="圣光本身似乎祝福了这份文件，<name>。当我握着它时，我感到一股暖意蔓延过胸膛，一种神圣使命的感觉充盈心间。这份誓言要求对圣光意志的绝对忠诚，以及在黑暗面前毫不动摇的信仰。这样的虔诚不会轻易给予。",dEN="The Light itself seems to have blessed this document, <name>. When I hold it, I feel a warmth spread through my chest and a sense of divine purpose fills my heart. This vow calls for absolute dedication to the Light's will and unwavering faith in the face of darkness. Such devotion is not given lightly.",o="阅读圣殿骑士誓言，在北郡谷寻找威廉修士。",oEN="Read the Templar's Vow and seek out Brother William in Northshire Valley.",p="圣光照耀着你，<name>。你把圣殿骑士誓言带来了吗？只有通过绝对的虔诚，才能侍奉神圣的意志。",pEN="The Light shines upon you, <name>. Have you brought the Templar's Vow? Only through absolute devotion can one serve the divine will.",c="圣光在你体内明亮地闪耀，<name>！你已拥抱圣殿骑士的道路，将灵魂奉献给神圣的侍奉。通过信仰与虔诚，你将成为神圣正义的工具。\n\n你神圣的职责从今日开始。愿你的信念永不动摇，愿你的信仰永恒燃烧。",cEN="The Light shines brightly within you, <name>! You have embraced the Templar's path and dedicated your soul to divine service. Through faith and devotion, you will become an instrument of holy justice.\n\nYour sacred duty begins this day. May your conviction never waver, and your faith burn eternal."}
Q[49979]={d="我必须承认，这本魔典让我极不舒服，<name>。那皮革封面似乎是……算了，我还是不要妄加猜测。它像心跳一样有节奏地搏动，我发誓书页上沾着深红的污渍。其中蕴含的魔法涉及生命力本身——一种既可怕又诱人的力量。务必极其小心地对待它。",dEN="I must confess, this grimoire makes me deeply uncomfortable, <name>. The leather binding appears to be... well, I'd rather not speculate. It pulses rhythmically, like a heartbeat, and I swear the pages are stained crimson. The magic within deals with life force itself - a power both terrible and alluring. Handle it with utmost care.",o="阅读鲜血魔典，在北郡谷寻找沉默的维斯普。",oEN="Read the Blood Grimoire and seek out Whisp the Silent in Northshire Valley.",p="我在你身上闻到了力量的铜腥味，<name>。你有鲜血魔典吗？走在猩红之路上的人必须明白它的代价。",pEN="I smell the copper scent of power upon you, <name>. Do you have the Blood Grimoire? Those who walk the crimson path must understand its price.",c="令人印象深刻，<name>。你对猩红之路毫无惧色，这很能说明你的潜力。血魔法不适合意志薄弱者——它要求牺牲、理解，以及对流经一切生灵之力的敬畏。\n\n你的训练现在开始。记住：自愿献出的血，比强夺而来的血拥有更强的力量。",cEN="Impressive, <name>. You show no fear of the crimson path, and that speaks well of your potential. Blood magic is not for the weak-willed - it demands sacrifice, understanding, and respect for the power that flows through all living things.\n\nYour training begins now. Remember - blood given freely holds more power than blood taken by force."}
Q[49980]={d="多么奇特的东西，<name>。这本指南上还粘着森林的碎屑——松针、苔藓，甚至一小截树枝。我短暂翻开它时，听到了像是鸟鸣和树叶沙沙的声音。它讲述着追踪、荒野求生，以及与自然本身融为一体。荒野正透过这些书页召唤你。",dEN="What a curious thing, <name>. This guide still has bits of forest debris clinging to it - pine needles, moss, even a small twig. When I opened it briefly, I heard what sounded like birdsong and rustling leaves. It speaks of tracking, wilderness survival, and becoming one with nature itself. The wild calls to you through these pages.",o="阅读游侠指南，在北郡谷寻找月溪镇的欧文。",oEN="Read the Ranger's Guide and seek out Owen of Moonbrook in Northshire Valley.",p="自然在诉说你，<name>。你把游侠指南带来了吗？自然认得自己的孩子，并召唤你走上古老的道路。",pEN="The wild speaks of you, <name>. Have you brought the Ranger's Guide? Nature recognizes its own, and calls you to the ancient ways.",c="自然选得很好，<name>。你体内带着荒野之魂，古老的传统在呼唤你的血脉。作为游侠，你将成为文明与未驯之地之间的桥梁。\n\n欢迎加入荒野的兄弟会。愿你的箭矢精准，愿你的道路通向自由。",cEN="Nature has chosen well, <name>. You carry the spirit of the wild within you, and the ancient ways call to your blood. As a Ranger, you will be the bridge between civilization and the untamed lands.\n\nWelcome to the brotherhood of the wild. May your aim be true and your path lead to freedom."}
Q[49981]={d="十分奇特，<name>。我本可以发誓这份手稿刚才还不在这里，可它就在这里。文字在我眼前闪烁变幻，仿佛同时存在于多个时刻。这样的时光魔法超出了我的理解，但也许你有那份心智去领会它的奥秘。",dEN="Most peculiar, <name>. I could have sworn this manuscript wasn't here a moment ago, yet here it is. The text seems to shimmer and shift before my eyes, as if existing in multiple moments simultaneously. Such temporal magic is beyond my understanding, but perhaps you have the mind to comprehend its mysteries.",o="阅读时光手稿，在北郡谷寻找索莉多米。",oEN="Read the Temporal Manuscript and seek out Soridormi in Northshire Valley.",p="时间在你周围以奇怪的方式流动，<name>。你持有时光手稿吗？时间之流把你带到了这一刻。",pEN="Time flows strangely around you, <name>. Do you possess the Temporal Manuscript? The streams of chronos have brought you to this moment.",c="引人入胜，<name>。你感知到时间本身的流动，这是极少凡人能获得的恩赐。作为时光术士，你将学会让因果屈从于你的意志，并在诸多时刻之间穿行。\n\n时间现在是你的盟友。明智地使用这份力量，因为操纵时间的后果会在所有现实中回响。",cEN="Fascinating, <name>. You perceive the flow of time itself, a gift granted to very few mortals. As a Chronomancer, you will learn to bend causality to your will and walk between the moments.\n\nTime is your ally now. Use this power wisely, for the consequences of temporal manipulation echo across all realities."}
Q[49982]={d="我实话对你说，<name>：这本日记让我发冷。字面意义上的冷。每次我靠近它，温度就会下降，我还老是听见分辨不清的微弱低语。它的装帧似乎是用……骨头做的。其中包含大多数人会视为禁忌的死亡魔法知识。你确定要走这样一条黑暗的路吗？",dEN="I'll be honest with you, <name> - this journal gives me the chills. Literally. The temperature drops whenever I get near it, and I keep hearing faint whispers that I can't quite make out. The binding appears to be made from... bone. This contains knowledge of death magic that most would consider forbidden. Are you certain you wish to pursue such a dark path?",o="阅读死灵法术日记，在北郡谷寻找恶棍哈尔伯特。",oEN="Read the Necromantic Journal and seek out Halbert the Scoundrel in Northshire Valley.",p="你一来温度就下降了，<name>。你把死灵法术日记带来了吗？死亡魔法会谨慎地挑选它的修行者。",pEN="The temperature drops in your presence, <name>. Have you brought the Necromantic Journal? Death magic chooses its practitioners carefully.",c="你有潜力，<name>。死亡不让你畏惧，这很……令人耳目一新。太多人逃避事物的自然秩序。作为死灵法师，你将学会与死亡合作，而不是与它对抗。\n\n你在黑暗技艺上的教育现在开始。记住：死亡并不邪恶，它只是不可避免。好好引导它。",cEN="You have potential, <name>. Death holds no fear for you, and that is... refreshing. Too many flee from the natural order of things. As a Necromancer, you will learn to work with death rather than against it.\n\nYour education in the dark arts begins now. Remember - death is not evil, merely inevitable. Guide it well."}
Q[49983]={d="小心点，<name>！这本典籍烫得几乎没法拿。火焰在它表面舞动却不烧毁书页，周围的空气因高温而扭曲。我几乎能感觉到其中蕴含的火焰魔法正乞求被释放。只有对毁灭怀有热情的人，才该考虑这样的力量。",dEN="Careful there, <name>! This codex is almost too hot to handle. Flames dance across its surface without burning the pages, and the air around it shimmers with heat. I can practically feel the fire magic contained within, begging to be unleashed. Only those with a passion for destruction should even consider such power.",o="阅读烈焰法典，在北郡谷寻找火焰领主科比。",oEN="Read the Flame Codex and seek out Firelord Kobe in Northshire Valley.",p="我感觉到你散发的热量，<name>。你带着烈焰法典吗？火焰会寻找那些有热情驾驭它毁灭之美的人。",pEN="I feel the heat radiating from you, <name>. Do you carry the Flame Codex? Fire seeks those with the passion to wield its destructive beauty.",c="太棒了，<name>！火焰热切地在你周围舞动，被你灵魂中的火焰吸引。作为炎术师，你会明白毁灭与创造不过是同一枚硬币的两面。\n\n让净化之焰在你体内燃烧！我们将在旧世界的灰烬中锻造出崭新而美丽的东西。",cEN="Magnificent, <name>! The flames dance eagerly around you, drawn to the fire in your soul. As a Pyromancer, you will learn that destruction and creation are merely two sides of the same coin.\n\nLet the cleansing fire burn within you! From the ashes of the old world, we will forge something new and beautiful."}
Q[49984]={d="欢迎回来，<name>！在你走之前，有个卫兵留下了这个，让我转交给你。我自己还没来得及瞄上一眼。\n\n以一切神圣之物起誓……我几乎没法直视这东西。那些符号似乎在扭动变幻，我还老是听见……低语。那些声音说着我听不懂、却让我充满恐惧的字眼。\n\n这么疯狂的东西只可能来自疯子帕塔尔，而只有真正疯狂的……或真正勇敢的……人才敢研究它。\n\n去拜访疯子帕塔尔吧，他会有更多答案。",dEN="Welcome back <name>! Before you go, one of the guards dropped this off and I was told to give this to you. I have not had a chance to peak at it myself yet.\n\nBy all that's holy... I can barely look at this thing directly. The symbols seem to writhe and shift, and I keep hearing... whispers. Voices speaking words I don't understand but that fill me with dread.\n\nSomething this insane could only come from Patal the Mad, and only the truly mad... or truly brave... would dare to study it.\n\nVisit Patal the Mad, he will have more answers.",o="阅读禁忌论著，在北郡谷寻找疯子帕塔尔。",oEN="Read the Forbidden Treatise and seek out Patal the Mad in Northshire Valley.",p="你一靠近，低语就变得更响，<name>。你把禁忌论著带来了吗？上古之神已标记你为它们的容器。",pEN="The whispers grow louder when you approach, <name>. Have you brought the Forbidden Treatise? The Old Gods have marked you as their vessel.",c="是——啊，<name>……低语告诉我你会来。你已被超越凡人理解的力量所标记，被选中去侍奉那些低等心智无法领悟的真相。上古之神正对你微笑。\n\n疯狂不过是无拘的清明，年轻的邪教徒。拥抱混沌，让它把你重塑成……更伟大的存在。",cEN="Yesss, <name>... the whispers told me you would come. You have been marked by powers beyond mortal comprehension, chosen to serve truths that lesser minds cannot grasp. The Old Gods smile upon you.\n\nMadness is merely clarity unbound, young cultist. Embrace the chaos, and let it reshape you into something... greater."}
Q[49985]={d="太迷人了！这本手册里满是我从未见过的图纸与图解，<name>。细小的齿轮、弹簧和发条装置仿佛要从书页间溢出来，我还能听见看不见的机械发出的微弱滴答声。这里魔法与工程的结合真是非凡。创新正等待着足够聪明、能够理解它的人。",dEN="Fascinating! This manual is filled with blueprints and schematics I've never seen before, <name>. Small gears, springs, and clockwork mechanisms seem to spill from its pages, and I can hear the faint ticking of unseen machinery. The combination of magic and engineering here is truly remarkable. Innovation awaits those clever enough to understand it.",o="阅读工程学手册，在北郡谷寻找诺曼·金镇。",oEN="Read the Engineering Manual and seek out Norman Goldshire in Northshire Valley.",p="我听见齿轮转动的声音，<name>。你把工程学手册带来了吗？创新在召唤那些能把魔法与机械连接起来的心智。",pEN="I hear the sound of gears turning, <name>. Have you brought the Engineering Manual? Innovation calls to minds capable of bridging magic and machinery.",c="聪明，<name>！我几乎能听见你那颗机灵的脑袋里齿轮转动的声音。作为工匠，你将学会把工程的精密与魔法的奇观融为一体——这种融合将塑造未来本身。\n\n你的创新学徒生涯从今天开始！我们将一同建造令世界惊叹与欢喜的奇观。",cEN="Brilliant, <name>! I can practically hear the gears turning in that clever mind of yours. As a Tinker, you will learn to blend the precision of engineering with the wonder of magic - a fusion that will shape the future itself.\n\nYour apprenticeship in innovation begins today! Together, we will build wonders that will amaze and delight the world."}
Q[49986]={d="多美的景象啊，<name>。这份经文散发着黎明的暖光，读它让我充满希望与新的活力。金色的文字讲述着通过太阳能量进行治疗，以及引导太阳赋予生命的力量。如此光辉的魔法只会给世界带来祝福与新生。",dEN="What a beautiful sight, <name>. This scripture glows with the warm light of dawn, and reading it fills me with hope and renewed vigor. The golden text speaks of healing through solar energy and channeling the sun's life-giving power. Such radiant magic brings only blessing and renewal to the world.",o="阅读太阳经文，在北郡谷寻找随军牧师奈索尼。",oEN="Read the Solar Scripture and seek out Chaplain Nysoni in Northshire Valley.",p="你的存在温暖了这处圣地，<name>。你有太阳经文吗？太阳的祝福流经那些被选中去治疗的人。",pEN="Your presence warms this sacred place, <name>. Do you have the Solar Scripture? The sun's blessing flows through those chosen for healing.",c="你是有福的，<name>！太阳的光辉流经你的存在本身，标记你为被选中进行治愈与新生之人。作为太阳祭司，你将给绝望者带来希望，给最黑暗之处带来光明。\n\n你的治疗之路现在开始。愿你的光芒永不黯淡，愿你永远为迷失在黑暗中的人带来黎明。",cEN="Blessed are you, <name>! The sun's radiance flows through your very being, marking you as one chosen for healing and renewal. As a Sun Cleric, you will bring hope to the hopeless and light to the darkest places.\n\nYour path of healing begins now. May your light never dim, and may you always bring dawn to those lost in darkness."}
Q[49987]={d="这本手册让我寒到骨子里，<name>。字面意义上的寒。它周围的空气会变冷，我还能闻到丧葬准备那种独特的气味。其中包含的知识关乎死亡本身——不是作为邪恶之物，而是作为一种应当被引导和疏导的自然力量。只有理解生死平衡的人才该研习这样的技艺。",dEN="This manual chills me to the bone, <name>. Literally. The air grows cold around it, and I can smell the distinct scent of funeral preparations. The knowledge within deals with death itself - not as evil, but as a natural force to be guided and channeled. Only those who understand the balance between life and death should study such arts.",o="阅读死亡手册，在北郡谷寻找除根者特罗埃斯。",oEN="Read the Death Manual and seek out Troes the Remover in Northshire Valley.",p="你周围的帷幕变薄了，<name>。你带着死亡手册吗？侍奉自然秩序的人明白死亡的必然。",pEN="The veil grows thin around you, <name>. Do you carry the Death Manual? Those who serve the natural order understand death's necessity.",c="你明白了，<name>。很好。太多人畏惧死亡，却没意识到它只是自然秩序的另一个侧面。作为死神，你将学会引导灵魂归于应有的安息，并维持生死之间的平衡。\n\n你对永恒轮回的侍奉现在开始。死亡会降临到所有人身上，但通过你的工作，它不必再被畏惧。",cEN="You understand, <name>. Good. Too many fear death, not realizing it is simply another aspect of the natural order. As a Reaper, you will learn to guide souls to their proper rest and maintain the balance between life and death.\n\nYour service to the eternal cycle begins now. Death comes for all, but through your work, it need not be feared."}
Q[49988]={d="古老的力量流经这块石板，<name>。刻在它表面的符文闪耀着自身的内部光芒，我能感受到每一个符号上承载的千年分量。这是我们族类所知最古老的魔法形式——将力量束缚为永久形态的技艺。这样的知识在世界尚且年轻时就已经很古老了。",dEN="Ancient power flows through this tablet, <name>. The runes carved into its surface glow with their own inner light, and I can feel the weight of centuries in every symbol. This is the oldest form of magic known to our kind - the art of binding power into permanent form. Such knowledge was old when the world was young.",o="阅读符文铭文，在北郡谷寻找旺达·贝雷辛。",oEN="Read the Runic Inscription and seek out Wanda Belezin in Northshire Valley.",p="古老的力量在你体内共鸣，<name>。你把符文铭文带来了吗？最初的魔法会认出配得上它秘密的人。",pEN="Ancient power resonates within you, <name>. Have you brought the Runic Inscription? The first magic recognizes one worthy of its secrets.",c="古老的力量认得古老的力量，<name>。你拥有解读魔法最初语言的稀有天赋——那些将力量束缚于物质本身的符文。这是来自世界黎明的知识。\n\n你的符文魔法研习从今天开始。古老的方式之所以长存，是因为它们永恒。愿你证明自己配得上这份信任。",cEN="Ancient power recognizes ancient power, <name>. You possess the rare gift to read the first language of magic - the runes that bind power to matter itself. This is knowledge from the dawn of the world.\n\nYour study of runic magic begins today. The old ways endure because they are eternal. May you prove worthy of such trust."}
Q[49990]={d="你一打败那些狗头人回来，就有人让我把这事告诉你，<name>。这似乎是一块刻着野蛮人战士粗糙标记的古老石板。石头本身散发着原始之怒，我能感觉到那股奔流在走上这条路之人体内的野性力量。在你处理修道院里的其他事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from defeating those kobolds, <name>. It appears to be an ancient tablet bearing the crude markings of the barbarian warriors. The stone itself radiates primal fury, and I can sense the wild strength that courses through those who follow this path. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.",o="在北郡谷寻找掠夺者阿曼达。",oEN="Seek out Amanda the Reaver in Northshire Valley.",p="啊，我感觉到原始之怒在你体内苏醒。你带着那块古老石板——你读过它的话，并接纳了栖居在你血中的野兽了吗？",pEN="Ah, I sense the primal fury awakening within you. You carry the ancient tablet - have you read its words and embraced the beast that dwells in your blood?",c="太出色了！我能看见你眼中的火焰，<name>。古老的道路在召唤那些心中有力量的人。\n\n野蛮人的道路不属于意志薄弱者。你将学会疏导自己的狂怒，让内心的野兽指引你的打击。你的敌人将在你的怒火前逃窜，你的盟友会因为你在身旁而战得更勇猛。\n\n这只是你旅程的开始。荒野有许多教训要传授，等你准备好时，我会在这里指引你。欢迎加入狂战士的兄弟会！",cEN="Excellent! I can see the fire in your eyes, <name>. The ancient ways call to those with strength in their hearts.\n\nThe path of the barbarian is not for the weak-willed. You will learn to channel your rage, to let the beast within guide your strikes. Your enemies will flee before your fury, and your allies will fight harder knowing you stand beside them.\n\nThis is only the beginning of your journey. The wild has many lessons to teach, and I will be here to guide you when you are ready. Welcome to the brotherhood of the berserker!"}
Q[49991]={d="你一打败那些狗头人回来，就有人让我把这事告诉你，<name>。这似乎是一卷部落卷轴，上面有巫医的神秘符号。奇异的草药绑在它的边缘，我几乎能听见古老灵魂的咒语低语。通过暗影与光明进行治疗的技艺不可轻视。在你处理修道院里的其他事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from defeating those kobolds, <name>. It appears to be a tribal scroll marked with the mystical symbols of witch doctors. Strange herbs are bound to its edges, and I can almost hear the whispered incantations of ancient spirits. The art of healing through shadow and light is not to be taken lightly. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.",o="在北郡修道院寻找雅拉医师。",oEN="Seek out Doctor Yara in Northshire Abbey.",p="灵魂们在低语你的到来，年轻人。你带着一卷神圣的卷轴，你聆听祖先的话、接受了他们的智慧吗？",pEN="The spirits whisper of your arrival, young one. You carry a sacred scroll, have you listened to the ancestors and accepted their wisdom?",c="灵魂们很满意，<name>。我能从环绕你的低语中听见它们的认可。\n\n你选择了暗影与治疗、死亡与重生的道路。作为巫医，你将在诸世界之间行走——与亡者交谈、号令灵魂，把腐化与复原都当作你的工具。\n\n洛阿已把你标记为它们的人。你将学会调制治疗药水与伤人妖术，呼唤祖先的智慧，束缚敌人的本质。这是一份神圣的责任，经由无数代传承下来。\n\n当你准备好学习更深的奥秘时来找我。灵魂们躁动不安，它们有许多东西要教你。",cEN="The spirits are pleased, <name>. I can hear their approval in the whispers that surround you.\n\nYou have chosen the path of shadow and healing, of death and rebirth. As a witch doctor, you will walk between worlds - speaking with the dead, commanding the spirits, wielding both corruption and restoration as your tools.\n\nThe loa have marked you as their own. You will learn to brew potions that heal and hexes that harm, to call upon ancestral wisdom and bind the very essence of your enemies. This is a sacred responsibility, one that has been passed down through countless generations.\n\nSeek me out when you are ready to learn the deeper mysteries. The spirits are restless, and they have much to teach you."}
Q[49992]={d="你一打败那些狗头人回来，就有人让我把这事告诉你，<name>。这似乎是一封盖有猎魔人银印的神圣信函。羊皮纸本身似乎在排斥黑暗，被那些以清除世间邪恶为毕生事业的人祝福过。这样的正义之怒需要恰当的引导。在你处理修道院里的其他事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from defeating those kobolds, <name>. It appears to be a sacred letter bearing the silver seal of the witch hunters. The parchment itself seems to repel darkness, blessed by those who dedicate their lives to purging evil from this world. Such righteous fury requires proper guidance. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.",o="在北郡修道院寻找埃林·特里亚斯。",oEN="Seek out Elling Trias in Northshire Abbey.",p="圣光在你周围炽烈燃烧，孩子。你带着我们教团的神圣信函——你读过它的话，并接受了狩猎的神圣重担吗？",pEN="The Light burns brightly around you, child. You bear the sacred letter of our order - have you read its words and accepted the holy burden of the hunt?",c="圣光照耀着你，<name>。我能从你的存在本身感觉到它的祝福。\n\n你已接受猎魔人的神圣誓约。如今你被神圣的使命所约束——搜寻一切形态的邪恶，以正义之火将其净化。这不只是一项使命，而是一道神圣的谕令。\n\n你的信仰将是你的武器，你的信念将是你的铠甲。你将学会把圣光引导成对不洁之物的毁灭打击，用受祝福的屏障保护无辜者，并看穿恶魔与亡灵的欺瞒。\n\n永远记住：邪恶或许藏于暗影，却无法抵挡正义的净化之焰。保持戒备，猎人。黑暗不会等待，我们也不能。",cEN="The Light shines upon you, <name>. I can feel its blessing in your very presence.\n\nYou have accepted the sacred covenant of the witch hunter. You are now bound by holy purpose - to seek out evil in all its forms and purge it with righteous fire. This is not merely a calling, it is a divine mandate.\n\nYour faith will be your weapon, your conviction your armor. You will learn to channel the Light into devastating attacks against the unholy, to protect the innocent with blessed barriers, and to see through the deceptions of demons and undead.\n\nRemember always: evil may hide in shadow, but it cannot withstand the purifying flame of justice. Stand ready, hunter. The darkness will not wait, and neither must we."}
Q[50024]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。碎骨骷髅的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往白骨荒野，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here.  The Broken Skeleton population is becoming a real threat. Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 of them.",o="前往白骨荒野，清除 30 只碎骨骷髅。",oEN="Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 Broken Skeletons."}
Q[50258]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。雷象碾碎者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往巴里废墟，清除 8 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Elekk Demolisher population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Ruins of Baa'ri and cull 8 of them.",o="前往巴里废墟，清除 8 只雷象碾碎者。",oEN="Travel to Ruins of Baa'ri and cull 8 Elekk Demolishers."}
Q[50259]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。斯克提斯卡利鸟的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往恐槌岩，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Skettis Kaliri population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Dreadmaul Rock and cull 30 of them.",o="前往恐槌岩，清除 30 只斯克提斯卡利鸟。",oEN="Travel to Dreadmaul Rock and cull 30 Skettis Kaliris."}
Q[50260]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。伊利达雷监工的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往巴里废墟，清除 6 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Illidari Overseer population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Ruins of Baa'ri and cull 6 of them.",o="前往巴里废墟，清除 6 只伊利达雷监工。",oEN="Travel to Ruins of Baa'ri and cull 6 Illidari Overseers."}
Q[50261]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。卡拉波祭司的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往影月谷，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Cleric of Karabor population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 of them.",o="前往影月谷，清除 30 只卡拉波祭司。",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 Cleric of Karabors."}
Q[50262]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。铁脊咀嚼者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往泰罗卡森林，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Ironspine Chomper population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Terokkar Forest and cull 30 of them.",o="前往泰罗卡森林，清除 30 只铁脊咀嚼者。",oEN="Travel to Terokkar Forest and cull 30 Ironspine Chompers."}
Q[50263]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。成年丝翼蛾的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往莫克纳萨村，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Mature Silkwing population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Mok'Nathal Village and cull 30 of them.",o="前往莫克纳萨村，清除 30 只成年丝翼蛾。",oEN="Travel to Mok'Nathal Village and cull 30 Mature Silkwings."}
Q[50264]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。铁脊石化者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往泰罗卡森林，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Ironspine Petrifier population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Terokkar Forest and cull 30 of them.",o="前往泰罗卡森林，清除 30 只铁脊石化者。",oEN="Travel to Terokkar Forest and cull 30 Ironspine Petrifiers."}
