Q[50270]={d="德拉诺碎裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。洞穴爬行者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往利刃之路，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Cavern Crawler population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Blades' Run and cull 30 of them.",o="前往利刃之路，清除 30 只洞穴爬行者。",oEN="Travel to Blades' Run and cull 30 Cavern Crawlers."}
