Q[50273]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。被感染的根行者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往白骨荒野，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Infested Root-Walker population is becoming a real threat. Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 of them.",o="前往白骨荒野，清除 30 只被感染的根行者。",oEN="Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 Infested Root-Walkers."}
