Q[50280]={d="德拉诺碎裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。恐惧魔的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Fear Fiend population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 30 of them.",o="前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 30 只恐惧魔。",oEN="Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 30 Fear Fiends."}
Q[50281]={d="德拉诺碎裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。无束虚灵的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往巴什伊尔码头，清除 13 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Unbound Ethereal population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Bash'ir Landing and cull 13 of them.",o="前往巴什伊尔码头，清除 13 只无束虚灵。",oEN="Travel to Bash'ir Landing and cull 13 Unbound Ethereals."}
Q[50282]={d="德拉诺碎裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。匕首尾蜥蜴的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往水晶脊，清除 6 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Daggertail Lizard population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Crystal Spine and cull 6 of them.",o="前往水晶脊，清除 6 只匕首尾蜥蜴。",oEN="Travel to Crystal Spine and cull 6 Daggertail Lizards."}
Q[50283]={d="德拉诺碎裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。影翼猫头鹰的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往影月谷，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Shadowwing Owl population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 of them.",o="前往影月谷，清除 30 只影翼猫头鹰。",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 Shadowwing Owls."}
Q[50284]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。熔炉守卫的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往铸魔营地：怒火，清除 11 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Furnace Guard population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Forge Camp: Wrath and cull 11 of them.",o="前往铸魔营地：怒火，清除 11 只熔炉守卫。",oEN="Travel to Forge Camp: Wrath and cull 11 Furnace Guards."}
Q[50285]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。邪恶火魂的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 8 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Vile Fire-Soul population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 8 of them.",o="前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 8 只邪恶火魂。",oEN="Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 8 Vile Fire-Souls."}
Q[50286]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。腐朽林怒者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往白骨荒野，清除 6 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Rotting Forest-Rager population is becoming a real threat. Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 6 of them.",o="前往白骨荒野，清除 6 只腐朽林怒者。",oEN="Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 6 Rotting Forest-Ragers."}
