Q[50294]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。迷失的托兰切的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往悲翼哨点，清除 10 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Lost Torranche population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Sorrow Wing Point and cull 10 of them.",o="前往悲翼哨点，清除 10 只迷失的托兰切。",oEN="Travel to Sorrow Wing Point and cull 10 Lost Torranches."}
Q[50295]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。影蹄召唤者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往影月谷，清除 6 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Shadowhoof Summoner population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 6 of them.",o="前往影月谷，清除 6 只影蹄召唤者。",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 6 Shadowhoof Summoners."}
Q[50296]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。以太鳐的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往刀锋山，清除 7 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Aether Ray population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Blade's Edge Mountains and cull 7 of them.",o="前往天空卫队哨站，清除 7 只以太鳐。",oEN="Travel to Skyguard Outpost and cull 7 Aether Rays."}
