Q[50301]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。晶熔矿工的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 8 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Crystalfused Miner population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 8 of them.",o="前往铸魔营地：恐惧，清除 8 只晶熔矿工。",oEN="Travel to Forge Camp: Terror and cull 8 Crystalfused Miners."}
Q[50302]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。黑风迁跃追猎者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往斯克提斯，清除 11 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Blackwind Warp Chaser population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Skettis and cull 11 of them.",o="前往斯克提斯，清除 11 只黑风迁跃追猎者。",oEN="Travel to Skettis and cull 11 Blackwind Warp Chasers."}
Q[50303]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。超矿剥皮者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往灵翼浮岛，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Overmine Flayer population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Netherwing Ledge and cull 30 of them.",o="前往灵翼浮岛，清除 30 只超矿剥皮者。",oEN="Travel to Netherwing Ledge and cull 30 Overmine Flayers."}
Q[50304]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。虚空矿脉破坏者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往灵翼矿洞，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Nethermine Ravager population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Netherwing Mines and cull 30 of them.",o="前往灵翼矿洞，清除 30 只虚空矿脉破坏者。",oEN="Travel to Netherwing Mines and cull 30 Nethermine Ravagers."}
Q[50305]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。甘尔葛分析者的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往旋涡尖塔，清除 30 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Gan'arg Analyzer population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Vortex Pinnacle and cull 30 of them.",o="前往旋涡尖塔，清除 30 只甘尔葛分析者。",oEN="Travel to Vortex Pinnacle and cull 30 Gan'arg Analyzers."}
Q[50306]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。灵翼鳐的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往灵翼浮岛，清除 15 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Netherwing Ray population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Netherwing Ledge and cull 15 of them.",o="前往灵翼浮岛，清除 15 只灵翼鳐。",oEN="Travel to Netherwing Ledge and cull 15 Netherwing Rays."}
Q[50307]={d="德拉诺撕裂之后，在德拉诺与扭曲虚空之间的屏障崩塌及随之而来的爆炸中，大部分生命都被抹去了。幸存下来的野生动物变得病弱或腐化，而耐奥祖的许多传送门被永久敞开，让各种危险生物进入外域，威胁我们在此地的存在。怒火先驱的数量正成为真正的威胁。前往基尔加丹王座，清除 15 只。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Wrath Herald population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Throne of Kil'jaeden and cull 15 of them.",o="前往基尔加丹王座，清除 15 只怒火先驱。",oEN="Travel to Throne of Kil'jaeden and cull 15 Wrath Heralds."}
Q[51000]={d="山间的空气在这本书周围噼啪作响，满是能量，<name>。即便刚对付过那些难缠的狼，我也能感觉到其中蕴含的电力。山中的风暴凶猛无情——也许你有那份毅力去驾驭它们的怒火？",dEN="The mountain air crackles with energy around this tome, <name>. Even after dealing with those tough wolves, I can feel the electrical power contained within. Mountain storms are fierce and unforgiving - perhaps you have the fortitude to master their fury?",o="阅读风暴法典，在寒脊谷寻找埃伦德·斯托姆贝尔奇。",oEN="Seek out Storm Codex and seek out Elund Stormbelch in Coldridge Valley.",p="我能感觉到风暴的能量在你周围噼啪作响，<name>。你把风暴法典带来了吗？山间的风暴在召唤那些想要掌控它力量的人。",pEN="I can sense the storm's energy crackling around you, <name>. Have you brought the Storm Codex? The mountain tempests call to those who would master their power.",c="太出色了，<name>！你听从了山中风暴的召唤，证明了自己的价值。风与闪电的力量如今流经你身，如同加冕于我们峰顶的永恒风暴。作为风暴使者，你将号令塑造群山本身的力量。\n\n欢迎踏上山中风暴之路。让你的敌人畏惧你的元素之怒吧！",cEN="Excellent, <name>! You have heeded the mountain storm's call and proven yourself worthy. The power of wind and lightning flows through you now like the eternal tempests that crown our peaks. As a Stormbringer, you will command the very forces that shape the mountains themselves.\n\nWelcome to the path of the mountain tempest. Let your enemies tremble before your elemental fury!"}
Q[51001]={d="这份誓言回荡着山石的强度，<name>。面对那些狼时你展现了勇气——如今这些话语讲述着像峰峦本身一样屹立不倒，在风暴面前岿然不动。你有成为不可撼动的守护者的毅力吗？",dEN="This oath rings with the strength of mountain stone, <name>. You showed courage facing those wolves - now the words speak of standing firm like the peaks themselves, unmovable in the face of any storm. Do you have the fortitude to be an immovable guardian?",o="阅读守护者誓言，在寒脊谷寻找铁锤卡佐恩。",oEN="Seek out Guardian's Oath and seek out Kharzon the Hammer in Coldridge Valley.",p="挺直腰杆，<name>。你带着守护者誓言吗？真正的群山守护者必须明白自己神圣职责的分量。",pEN="Stand tall, <name>. Do you carry the Guardian's Oath? A true mountain guardian must understand the weight of their sacred duty.",c="干得好，<name>！你明白这份使命所承载的神圣职责。群山守护者如峰峦本身般不可撼动，永不屈服，永不折断，就像我们脚下的岩石。\n\n你的训练现在开始。记住：你的生命属于你所要保护的人。以群山本身的力量去回报那份信任。",cEN="Well done, <name>! You understand the sacred duty that comes with this calling. A mountain Guardian stands as immovable as the peaks themselves, never yielding, never breaking, like the very stone beneath our feet.\n\nYour training begins now. Remember - your life belongs to those you protect. Honor that trust with the strength of the mountain itself."}
Q[51002]={d="以我的胡子起誓！圣光从这份文件中闪耀，亮如锻炉之火，<name>。你以荣誉应对了那些狼——山地矮人一向明白，真正的信仰燃烧起来就像我们锻炉中永恒的火焰：稳定、炽烈、永不熄灭。",dEN="By my beard! The Light shines as bright as forge-fire from this document, <name>. You handled those wolves with honor - the mountain dwarves have always known that true faith burns like the eternal flames of our forges - steady, strong, and unquenchable.",o="阅读圣殿骑士誓言，在寒脊谷寻找西迪斯·普莱德。",oEN="Seek out Templar's Vow and seek out Thiduis Pride in Coldridge Valley.",p="圣光照耀着你，<name>。你把圣殿骑士誓言带来了吗？只有通过绝对的虔诚，才能在这些神圣的峰峦间侍奉神圣的意志。",pEN="The Light shines upon you, <name>. Have you brought the Templar's Vow? Only through absolute devotion can one serve the divine will in these sacred peaks.",c="圣光在你体内明亮地闪耀，<name>！你已拥抱圣殿骑士的道路，在这些神圣的殿堂中将灵魂奉献给神圣的侍奉。通过信仰与虔诚，你将成为神圣正义的工具，燃烧如锻炉之火。\n\n你神圣的职责从今日开始。愿你的信念坚如山石，愿你的信仰永恒燃烧。",cEN="The Light shines brightly within you, <name>! You have embraced the Templar's path and dedicated your soul to divine service in these sacred halls. Through faith and devotion, you will become an instrument of holy justice, burning bright as forge-fire.\n\nYour sacred duty begins this day. May your conviction be as enduring as mountain stone, and your faith burn eternal."}
Q[51003]={d="真是奇妙！这本指南上还留着高山空气的气息，<name>。你追踪那些狼时展现了本领——我几乎能听见鹰啸，感受到山道间风的咬噬。群山的荒野在召唤那些足够勇敢、愿意回应的人。",dEN="Fascinating! This guide still carries the scent of high mountain air, <name>. You showed skill tracking those wolves - I can almost hear the cry of eagles and feel the bite of wind through stone passes. The mountain wilderness calls to those brave enough to answer.",o="阅读游侠指南，在寒脊谷寻找巴鲁尔·迈特曼。",oEN="Seek out Ranger's Guide and seek out Baruhr Mightmane in Coldridge Valley.",p="荒野的山风在诉说你，<name>。你把游侠指南带来了吗？自然认得自己的孩子，并召唤你走上高处的古老道路。",pEN="The wild mountain air speaks of you, <name>. Have you brought the Ranger's Guide? Nature recognizes its own, and calls you to the ancient ways of the high places.",c="群山的荒野选得很好，<name>。你体内带着高处的灵魂，古老的道路在呼唤你的血脉。作为群山游侠，你将成为石厅与未驯峰峦之间的桥梁。\n\n欢迎加入群山荒野的兄弟会。愿你的箭矢精准，愿你的道路通向高处的自由。",cEN="The mountain wilds have chosen well, <name>. You carry the spirit of the high places within you, and the ancient ways call to your blood. As a mountain Ranger, you will be the bridge between the stone halls and the untamed peaks.\n\nWelcome to the brotherhood of the mountain wild. May your aim be true and your path lead to the freedom of the heights."}
Q[51004]={d="奇怪……这份手稿似乎同时存在于多个海拔上，<name>。看过你对付那些狼之后，我想稀薄的山间空气一定让时光魔法更加显形了。只有心智最清明的人才该尝试这样的研习。",dEN="Strange... this manuscript seems to exist at multiple altitudes simultaneously, <name>. After watching you deal with those wolves, I see the thin mountain air must make temporal magic more visible. Only those with the clearest minds should attempt such studies.",o="阅读时光手稿，在寒脊谷寻找比耶科。",oEN="Seek out Temporal Manuscript and seek out Bieko in Coldridge Valley.",p="时间在你周围以奇怪的方式流动，<name>。你持有时光手稿吗？时间之流在这个海拔流动得不一样。",pEN="Time flows strangely around you, <name>. Do you possess the Temporal Manuscript? The streams of chronos move differently at this altitude.",c="引人入胜，<name>。你感知到时间本身的流动，这是在这个海拔上极少凡人能获得的恩赐。作为时光术士，你将学会让因果屈从于你的意志，并在这些古老峰峦间回响的诸多时刻之间穿行。\n\n时间现在是你的盟友。明智地使用这份力量，因为操纵时间的后果会在群山的所有时代中回响。",cEN="Fascinating, <name>. You perceive the flow of time itself, a gift granted to very few mortals at this altitude. As a Chronomancer, you will learn to bend causality to your will and walk between the moments that echo through these ancient peaks.\n\nTime is your ally now. Use this power wisely, for the consequences of temporal manipulation echo across all the mountain's ages."}
Q[51005]={d="这本日记周围的石头本身都变冷了，<name>。这些山藏着许多古老的秘密，而看过你如何对付那些狼之后，我发现其中一些涉及不安的亡者。对待这样危险的知识务必小心。",dEN="The very stone grows cold around this journal, <name>. These mountains hold many ancient secrets, and after seeing how you dealt with those wolves, some of them involve the restless dead. Tread carefully with such dangerous knowledge.",o="阅读死灵法术日记，在寒脊谷寻找萨维娜·格鲁姆。",oEN="Seek out Necromantic Journal and seek out Savina Gloom in Coldridge Valley.",p="山中的亡者在低语你，<name>。你把死灵法术日记带来了吗？在这些古老殿堂中，死亡魔法会谨慎地挑选它的修行者。",pEN="The mountain dead whisper of you, <name>. Have you brought the Necromantic Journal? Death magic chooses its practitioners carefully in these ancient halls.",c="你有潜力，<name>。在这些安息着众多先古的殿堂里，死亡不让你畏惧，这很……令人耳目一新。作为死灵法师，你将学会与群山的死亡合作，而不是与它对抗。\n\n你在古老技艺上的教育现在开始。记住：死亡并不邪恶，它只是不可避免。好好引导它走过这些神圣的石厅。",cEN="You have potential, <name>. Death holds no fear for you in these halls where so many ancients rest, and that is... refreshing. As a Necromancer, you will learn to work with the mountain's death rather than against it.\n\nYour education in the ancient arts begins now. Remember - death is not evil, merely inevitable. Guide it well through these sacred stone halls."}
Q[51006]={d="这本烫得像锻炉之火！这本典籍散发的热量足以温暖这些冰冷的山间殿堂，<name>。你对抗那些狼时展现了灵魂中的火焰——火焰魔法在这里备受尊重。我们矮人明白永不熄灭的火焰有多可贵。",dEN="Hot as forge-fire, this one! The codex radiates heat that could warm these cold mountain halls, <name>. You showed fire in your spirit fighting those wolves - fire magic is respected here. We dwarves know the value of a flame that never dies.",o="阅读烈焰法典，在寒脊谷寻找黛比·旋焰。",oEN="Seek out Flame Codex and seek out Debbie Whirlyflame in Coldridge Valley.",p="我感觉到锻炉之火从你身上散发出来，<name>。你带着烈焰法典吗？火焰会寻找那些有热情驾驭它毁灭之美的人，就像古时的矮人铁匠一样。",pEN="I feel the forge-fire radiating from you, <name>. Do you carry the Flame Codex? Fire seeks those with the passion to wield its destructive beauty like the dwarven smiths of old.",c="太棒了，<name>！火焰热切地在你周围舞动，被你矮人灵魂中的锻炉之火吸引。作为炎术师，你会明白毁灭与创造不过是同一把锤子的两面。\n\n让群山的火焰在你体内燃烧！我们将以矮人的方式，在旧世界的灰烬中锻造出崭新而美丽的东西。",cEN="Magnificent, <name>! The flames dance eagerly around you, drawn to the forge-fire in your dwarven soul. As a Pyromancer, you will learn that destruction and creation are merely two sides of the same hammer.\n\nLet the mountain fire burn within you! From the ashes of the old world, we will forge something new and beautiful in the dwarven way."}
Q[51007]={d="你好，<name>。克利波·厄运哨最近来过，让我把这个交给你。\n\n以群山之王起誓……这份论著上的符号在我没有直视它们时似乎会变幻扭动，<name>。看过你面对那些狼之后，我发现这东西靠近时，群山的回声会传来奇怪的低语。\n\n极其小心地对待它。",dEN="Greetings, <name>. Clippo Doomwhistle stopped by recently and told me to give this to you.\n\nBy the mountain kings... the symbols on this treatise seem to shift and writhe when I'm not looking directly at them, <name>. After watching you face those wolves, the mountain echoes carry strange whispers when this thing is near.\n\nHandle it with extreme caution.",o="阅读禁忌论著，在寒脊谷寻找克利波·厄运哨。",oEN="Seek out Forbidden Treatise and seek out Clippo Doomwhistle in Coldridge Valley.",p="你一靠近，群山的声音就变得更响，<name>。你把禁忌论著带来了吗？上古之神在这些石厅中回响。",pEN="The mountain voices grow louder when you approach, <name>. Have you brought the Forbidden Treatise? The Old Gods echo through these stone halls.",c="是——啊，<name>……群山的低语告诉我你会来。你已被超越凡人理解的力量所标记，被选中去侍奉那些在这些古老石厅中回响的真相。上古之神正从深处对你微笑。\n\n疯狂不过是无拘的清明，年轻的邪教徒。拥抱沉睡在群山之下的混沌，让它把你重塑成……更伟大的存在。",cEN="Yesss, <name>... the mountain whispers told me you would come. You have been marked by powers beyond mortal comprehension, chosen to serve truths that echo through these ancient stone halls. The Old Gods smile upon you from the deep places.\n\nMadness is merely clarity unbound, young cultist. Embrace the chaos that sleeps beneath the mountain, and let it reshape you into something... greater."}
Q[51008]={d="圣光保佑！这份经文闪耀如阳光映在新雪上，<name>。你面对那些狼时展现了正义的勇气——山峰更接近天穹，也许正因如此，圣光的祝福在这个海拔感受起来如此强烈。",dEN="Blessed Light! This scripture shines like the sun reflecting off fresh snow, <name>. You showed righteous courage against those wolves - the mountain peaks are closer to the heavens, and perhaps that's why the Light's blessing feels so strong at this altitude.",o="阅读太阳经文，在寒脊谷寻找石光牧师。",oEN="Seek out Solar Scripture and seek out Cleric Stonelight in Coldridge Valley.",p="你的存在给这处圣地带来温暖，<name>。你有太阳经文吗？太阳的祝福在这些纯净的高处流得最强。",pEN="Your presence brings warmth to this sacred place, <name>. Do you have the Solar Scripture? The sun's blessing flows strongest at these pure heights.",c="你是有福的，<name>！太阳的光辉流经你的存在本身，标记你为在这些纯净高处被选中进行治愈与新生之人。作为太阳祭司，你将给绝望者带来希望，给最深的群山洞窟带来光明。\n\n你的治疗之路现在开始。愿你的光芒永不黯淡，愿你永远为迷失在群山黑暗中的人带来黎明。",cEN="Blessed are you, <name>! The sun's radiance flows through your very being, marking you as one chosen for healing and renewal in these pure heights. As a Sun Cleric, you will bring hope to the hopeless and light to the deepest mountain halls.\n\nYour path of healing begins now. May your light never dim, and may you always bring dawn to those lost in the mountain's darkness."}
Q[51009]={d="这才叫真正的矮人活儿！光拿着这本手册我就能听见齿轮咔嗒作响、蒸汽嘶嘶喷涌，<name>。看过你对付那些狼的务实手法之后，看来宾克尔·冷栓认为你有机会向最棒的人学习。毕竟，我们的山地工程是全天下最精良的——只要你够聪明，学它的时候别把自己炸飞！",dEN="Now this is proper dwarven work! I can hear the gears clicking and steam hissing just by holding this manual, <name>. After seeing your practical approach to those wolves it looks like Binkle Coldbolt thinks you've got a shot at learning from the best. Afterall, our mountain engineering is the finest in all the land - if you're clever enough to learn it without blowing yourself up!",o="阅读工程学手册，在寒脊谷寻找宾克尔·冷栓。",oEN="Seek out Engineering Manual and seek out Binkle Coldbolt in Coldridge Valley.",p="我听见齿轮转动和蒸汽嘶嘶的声音，<name>。你把工程学手册带来了吗？创新在召唤那些能掌握真正矮人工程学的心智。",pEN="I hear the sound of gears turning and steam hissing, <name>. Have you brought the Engineering Manual? Innovation calls to minds capable of true dwarven engineering.",c="聪明，<name>！我几乎能听见你那颗机灵的矮人脑袋里齿轮转动的声音。作为工匠，你将学会把山地工程的精密与魔法的奇观融为一体——这种融合连铁炉堡都会嫉妒。\n\n你的创新学徒生涯从今天开始！我们将一同建造令世界惊叹、让我们山中的祖先引以为傲的奇观。",cEN="Brilliant, <name>! I can practically hear the gears turning in that clever dwarven mind of yours. As a Tinker, you will learn to blend the precision of mountain engineering with the wonder of magic - a fusion that will make even Ironforge jealous.\n\nYour apprenticeship in innovation begins today! Together, we will build wonders that will amaze the world and make our mountain ancestors proud."}
Q[51010]={d="古老的力量流经这块石板，<name>。这里刻下的符文比我们最古老的厅堂还要古老，是由塑造了群山本身的手刻下的。看过你面对那些狼之后，我明白这样的知识伴随着重大的责任。",dEN="Ancient power flows through this stone tablet, <name>. The runes carved here are older than our oldest halls, carved by hands that shaped the very mountains. After watching you face those wolves, such knowledge comes with great responsibility.",o="阅读符文铭文，在寒脊谷寻找穆尔蒙·熔炉。",oEN="Seek out Runic Inscription and seek out Murmon Fuseforge in Coldridge Valley.",p="古老的力量在你体内共鸣，<name>。你把符文铭文带来了吗？刻在这座山骨骼中的最初魔法会认出配得上它秘密的人。",pEN="Ancient power resonates within you, <name>. Have you brought the Runic Inscription? The first magic carved into these very mountain bones recognizes one worthy of its secrets.",c="古老的力量认得古老的力量，<name>。你拥有解读魔法最初语言的稀有天赋——那些由泰坦刻在这座山骨骼上的符文。这是来自世界黎明的知识。\n\n你的符文魔法研习从今天开始。古老的方式之所以长存，是因为它们像山石一样永恒。愿你证明自己配得上这份信任。",cEN="Ancient power recognizes ancient power, <name>. You possess the rare gift to read the first language of magic - the runes carved by the Titans into the very bones of this mountain. This is knowledge from the dawn of the world itself.\n\nYour study of runic magic begins today. The old ways endure because they are as eternal as the mountain stone. May you prove worthy of such trust."}
Q[51011]={d="这块石板脉动着原始而纯粹的能量，<name>。你像真正的战士一样与那些狼搏斗——野蛮人的方式粗粝却诚实。没有花哨的技巧，只有纯粹的力量与决心。群山孕育的是战士，不是舞者。",dEN="This tablet pulses with raw, primal energy, <name>. You fought those wolves like a true warrior - the barbarian's way is harsh but honest. No fancy techniques, just pure strength and determination. The mountain breeds warriors, not dancers.",o="阅读古老石板，在寒脊谷寻找格雷林·铁须。",oEN="Seek out Ancient Tablet and seek out Grelin Ironbeard in Coldridge Valley.",p="你身上带着战斗的气息，<name>。你把古老石板带来了吗？群山只孕育最强壮的战士。",pEN="You carry the scent of battle, <name>. Have you brought the Ancient Tablet? The mountain breeds only the strongest warriors.",c="对，就是这股劲，<name>！你有一颗真正群山战士的心，像峰峦本身一样凶猛而不屈。作为野蛮人，你将学会以群山的原始力量作战——没有花哨的技巧，只有纯粹的矮人力量。\n\n你的训练现在开始。记住：群山不谈判，不妥协，永不退让。你也不该退让！",cEN="Aye, that's the spirit, <name>! You have the heart of a true mountain warrior, as fierce and unbreakable as the peaks themselves. As a Barbarian, you will learn to fight with the raw power of the mountain - no fancy techniques, just pure dwarven strength.\n\nYour training begins now. Remember - the mountain doesn't negotiate, it doesn't compromise, and it never yields. Neither should you!"}
Q[51012]={d="这道谕令带有征服者的印记，<name>。群山藏着许多必须根除的邪恶，而伊罗在召唤那些有勇气在这些冰封峰峦间猎杀黑暗的人。你有成为猎杀邪恶者的本事吗？",dEN="This mandate bears the seal of the vanquishers, <name>. The mountains hide many evils that must be rooted out, and Yiro calls for those with the courage to hunt darkness in these frozen peaks. Do you have what it takes to become a hunter of evil?",o="在寒脊谷寻找征服者伊罗。",oEN="Seek out Yiro the Vanquisher in Coldridge Valley.",p="你身上带着猎人的灵魂，<name>。你把猎人谕令带来了吗？邪恶正等待着审判。",pEN="You carry the hunter's spirit, <name>. Have you brought the Hunter's Mandate? Evil awaits judgment.",c="圣光指引你来到我面前，<name>。\n\n这些冰封峰峦看似平静，但邪恶潜伏在每一道阴影、每一个洞穴、每一处被遗忘的废墟里。作为猎魔人，你将成为圣光对抗腐化的武器。你将追踪邪教徒，摧毁恶魔的影响，净化一切滋生的黑暗。\n\n你正义的怒火将烧穿最寒冷的山间空气。你受祝福的武器将击倒不洁之物。在这片严酷的土地上，你将成为一切腐化与毁灭之物的征服者。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的狩猎。让邪恶在你的到来前颤抖吧！",cEN="The Light has guided you to me, <name>.\n\nThese frozen peaks may seem peaceful, but evil lurks in every shadow, every cave, every forgotten ruin. As a Witch Hunter, you will be the Light's weapon against corruption. You will track down cultists, destroy demonic influences, and purge the darkness wherever it festers.\n\nYour righteous fury will burn through the coldest mountain air. Your blessed weapons will strike down the unholy. In these harsh lands, you will become the vanquisher of all that corrupts and destroys.\n\nWelcome to the eternal hunt. Let evil tremble at your approach!"}
Q[51013]={d="原始的元素力量在这本典籍周围盘旋，<name>！看过你如何对付那些狼之后，我可以告诉你其中蕴含的魔法像山间风暴一样狂野，而且危险两倍。只有有力量拥抱混沌的人才该尝试研习这样的原始之力。",dEN="Raw elemental power swirls around this codex, <name>! After seeing how you handled those wolves, the magic contained within is as untamed as a mountain storm and twice as dangerous. Only those with the strength to embrace chaos should dare to study such primal forces.",o="阅读原始法典，在寒脊谷寻找卡托·战锤。",oEN="Seek out Primal Codex and seek out Katho Hammerfist in Coldridge Valley.",p="原始的元素力量在你周围盘旋，<name>。你带着原始法典吗？群山未驯的元素在召唤它们的选民。",pEN="Raw elemental forces swirl around you, <name>. Do you carry the Primal Codex? The untamed elements of the mountain call to their chosen.",c="纯粹的力量流经你身，<name>！你明白，最纯粹形态的元素根本不在乎文明的规矩。作为仪祭师，你将像群山本身那样驾驭土、风、火、水——狂野、不驯、不可阻挡。\n\n你的原始魔法训练现在开始。记住：群山是你的导师，它对弱者毫不留情。",cEN="Raw power flows through you, <name>! You understand that the elements in their purest form care nothing for civilization's rules. As a Primalist, you will wield earth, air, fire, and water as the mountain itself does - wild, untamed, unstoppable.\n\nYour training in primal magic begins now. Remember - the mountain is your teacher, and it shows no mercy to the weak."}
Q[51014]={d="这本手册靠近时，空气本身都变冷了，<name>。在这些严酷的群山中，死亡是恒久的伴侣；看过你让那些狼解脱痛苦之后，也许正因如此，有些人学会了引导它，而不是畏惧它。带着应有的敬意对待这份知识。",dEN="The very air grows colder when this manual is near, <name>. Death is a constant companion in these harsh mountains, and after watching you put those wolves out of their misery, perhaps that is why some learn to guide it rather than fear it. Handle this knowledge with the respect it deserves.",o="阅读死亡手册，在寒脊谷寻找齐帕克·齿轮配重。",oEN="Seek out Death Manual and seek out Zipak Cogweight in Coldridge Valley.",p="你周围的帷幕变薄了，<name>。你带着死亡手册吗？侍奉自然秩序的人明白死亡在群山轮回中的位置。",pEN="The veil grows thin around you, <name>. Do you carry the Death Manual? Those who serve the natural order understand death's place in the mountain cycle.",c="你明白了真相，<name>。很好。死亡会降临到所有走上这些山道的人身上，但通过你的工作，它不必再被畏惧。作为死神，你将引导灵魂归于应有的安息，并在这些古老殿堂中维持平衡。\n\n你对永恒轮回的侍奉现在开始。山中的亡者是耐心的导师——好好向他们学习。",cEN="You understand the truth, <name>. Good. Death comes for all who walk these mountain paths, but through your work, it need not be feared. As a Reaper, you will guide souls to their proper rest and maintain the balance in these ancient halls.\n\nYour service to the eternal cycle begins now. The mountain dead are patient teachers - learn from them well."}
Q[51042]={d="焰冠在你靠近时专注地注视着你。尽管警惕，他似乎对你的存在感到好奇。也许他在期待什么。你注意到他的目光停留在此地以南，朝着那些鳄鱼出没的河流。也许给他带些鲜嫩的鳄鱼肉能让他对你亲近些？\n\n帮帮焰冠，给他带些鲜嫩鳄鱼肉，说不定你就能赢得一个火热的小朋友！",dEN="Flamecrest watches you intently as you approach. Though wary, he seems intrigued by your presence. Perhaps he’s expecting something. You notice his gaze lingering south of here, toward the river where crocolisks roam. Maybe bringing him some tender crocolisk meat will warm him up to you?\n\nHelp Flamecrest by bringing him some Tender Crocolisk Meat, and you might just earn a fiery little friend!",o="给焰冠带 5 块鲜嫩鳄鱼肉来赢得他的信任！",oEN="Bring Flamecrest 5 Tender Crocolisk Meat to earn his trust!",p="焰冠在你靠近时精神起来，眼睛睁得大大的，鼻孔翕动。他绕着你缓慢踱了一圈，目光紧盯着你的背包。\n\n他不说话，但眼中的疑问很清楚。你带肉来了吗？",pEN="Flamecrest perks up as you approach, eyes wide and nostrils flaring. He pads in a slow circle around you, gaze fixed on your pack.\n\nHe doesn’t speak, but the question is clear in his eyes. Did you bring the meat?",c="恭喜！焰冠现在是你的朋友了。这是你的奖励。",cEN="Congratulations! Flamecrest is now your friend. Here is your reward."}
Q[51043]={d="焰冠帮你把鳄鱼肉炙烤成巨龙似乎偏爱的那种样子。做完之后，他把目光转向东方。你说不清是什么吸引了他的注意，但他眼中的某种神色很明确。\n\n他想让你去帮助其他的幼龙。\n\n外面还有更多幼龙，警惕而孤单。如果你把这种炙烤鳄鱼肉带给它们，也许它们也会信任你。\n\n你有一种感觉，赢得它们的信任可能会带来更多东西。也许就连巨龙也有朋友。",dEN="Flamecrest helped you sear the crocolisk meat just the way dragons seem to prefer it. As he finishes, he turns his gaze to the east. You cannot say what draws his attention, but something about the look in his eyes is clear.\n\nHe wants you to help the others.\n\nThere are more whelps out there, wary and alone. If you bring them this seared crocolisk meat, perhaps they will trust you too.\n\nYou have a feeling that earning their trust could lead to something more. Maybe even dragons have friends.",o="用炙烤鳄鱼肉与 5 只幼龙交朋友。",oEN="Befriend 5 whelps by feeding them Seared Crocolisk Meat.",p="焰冠在你身边扑腾，尾巴因兴奋而抽动。他嗅了嗅空气，又朝东边瞥了一眼，然后带着期待的目光回头看你。\n\n他轻轻啾鸣，扇动翅膀，仿佛在催你继续前进。他目光中的某种东西在问：你找到它们了吗？",pEN="Flamecrest flutters to your side, tail twitching with excitement. He sniffs the air, then glances east again before looking back at you with expectant eyes.\n\nHe chirps softly, wings shifting as if urging you forward. Something in his gaze is asking. Did you find them?",c="你现在是巨龙真正的朋友了！",cEN="You are now a true friend of dragons!"}
Q[52000]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的野蛮人。这似乎是一块原始石板，上面刻着兽人战符文，脉动着几乎压不住的怒火。石头散发着野性力量，似乎来自穆卡卡——他在试炼谷传授野蛮人的道路。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young barbarian. It appears to be a primal tablet carved with orcish war-runes that pulse with barely contained fury. The stone radiates wild strength, and it seems to be from Mu'kaka, who teaches the barbarian's way in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找穆卡卡。",oEN="Seek out Mu'kaka in the Valley of Trials.",p="我感觉到原始之怒在你体内苏醒，战士。所以你想学习野蛮人狂怒与荒野战斗的道路？",pEN="I sense the primal fury awakening within you, warrior. So you wish to learn the barbarian's path of rage and wilderness combat?",c="Lok'tar，年轻的战士！战火在你眼中燃烧，我能感觉到奔流在你血中的原始怒火。你选择了野蛮人古老的道路。\n\n作为野蛮人，你将学会把内心最深处的狂怒引导成粉碎性的打击，连盔甲和骨头一起击碎。你的狂战士之怒会让你在战斗中几乎无人可挡，而荒野的灵魂将以致命的精准指引你的攻击。\n\n这条道路要求你接纳内心的野兽，同时保持足够的控制去分清敌友。你的怒火将是你最强大的武器，但绝不能吞噬你的荣誉。刻苦训练，更勇猛地战斗，让你的敌人尝到部落的怒火。\n\n欢迎加入狂战士的兄弟会，战士。愿你的怒火永恒燃烧！",cEN="Lok'tar, young warrior! The fire of battle burns in your eyes, and I can sense the primal rage that courses through your blood. You have chosen the ancient path of the barbarian.\n\nAs a Barbarian, you will learn to channel your innermost fury into crushing blows that shatter armor and bone alike. Your berserker rage will make you nearly unstoppable in combat, while the spirits of the wild guide your strikes with deadly precision.\n\nThis path requires you to embrace the beast within while maintaining enough control to distinguish friend from foe. Your rage will be your greatest weapon, but it must never consume your honor. Train hard, fight harder, and let your enemies taste the fury of the Horde.\n\nWelcome to the brotherhood of berserkers, warrior. May your rage burn eternal!"}
Q[52001]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的法师。这似乎是一卷沾血的卷轴，脉动着黑暗魔法，散发着铁与禁忌力量的腥臭。似乎来自织肉者凯拉——她在试炼谷修行这些猩红技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young blood mage. It appears to be a blood-stained scroll that pulses with dark magic, reeking of iron and forbidden power. It seems to be from Fleshweaver Chella, who practices these crimson arts in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找织肉者凯拉。",oEN="Seek out Fleshweaver Chella in the Valley of Trials.",p="我看得出猩红技艺已经召唤了你。所以你想掌握血魔法，把生命本身当作武器？",pEN="The crimson arts have called to you, I see. So you wish to master blood magic, to wield life itself as your weapon?",c="血呼唤血，而你的血以超越凡人理解的力量回应。你已选择走上猩红之路，去掌握血魔法这门禁忌技艺。\n\n作为血法师，你将学会牺牲生命力换取纯粹的魔法力量，把生命精华转化为能抽干敌人、或让盟友超越自身极限的毁灭法术。每一滴洒下的血都会成为你军械库中的武器。\n\n这种魔法要求不断的牺牲——你自己的血、敌人的血，以及在必要时愿意献身的盟友的血。但对于敢于付出这一代价的人，回报远超寻常的施法。\n\n永远记住：没有智慧的力量只会通向毁灭。用这些天赋为部落效力，愿你敌人的血为我们的胜利助燃。",cEN="Blood calls to blood, and yours answers with power beyond mortal understanding. You have chosen to walk the crimson path, to master the forbidden art of blood magic.\n\nAs a Blood Mage, you will learn to sacrifice vitality for raw magical force, turning life essence into devastating spells that can drain enemies dry or empower allies beyond their natural limits. Every drop spilled becomes a weapon in your arsenal.\n\nThis magic demands constant sacrifice - your own blood, your enemies' blood, the blood of willing allies when necessity demands it. But for those brave enough to pay this price, the rewards transcend ordinary spellcasting.\n\nRemember always that power without wisdom leads only to destruction. Use these gifts to serve the Horde, and may your enemies' blood fuel our victory."}
Q[52002]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的邪教徒。这似乎是一卷扭曲的卷轴，布满在不被直视时会移动变化的符号。奇怪的低声从其中回响，似乎来自鲁格拉·枯手——他在试炼谷与禁忌力量交流。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young cultist. It appears to be a writhing scroll covered in symbols that shift and change when not directly observed. Strange whispers echo from within, and it seems to be from Rug'ra Witherhand, who communes with forbidden powers in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找鲁格拉·枯手。",oEN="Seek out Rug'ra Witherhand in the Valley of Trials.",p="低语在你面前变得更响。所以你想侍奉古老存在，学习邪教徒的禁忌技艺？",pEN="The whispers grow stronger in your presence. So you wish to serve the Old Ones and learn the cultist's forbidden arts?",c="既然你加入了我们的行列，低语就变得更响了。古老存在欢迎又一位虔诚的仆人——一个心智足以领会低等生灵不敢承认之真相的人。\n\n作为邪教徒，你将学会与在第一次黎明之前便已存在的古老实体交流，通过危险的契约与诡秘的智慧获得力量。你的魔法将触及先于文明本身的力量。\n\n这份知识伴随着巨大的风险——低语能让脆弱的心智陷入疯狂，而你所接触的存在根本不在乎凡人的事务。但对于心智足够坚韧的人，宇宙本身的秘密就在触手可及之处。\n\n仔细听我教你的东西，因为古老存在始终在注视。好好侍奉它们，它们便会赐予你超乎想象的力量。",cEN="The whispers grow stronger now that you have joined our number. The Old Ones welcome another devoted servant, one whose mind can comprehend truths that lesser beings fear to acknowledge.\n\nAs a Cultist, you will learn to commune with ancient entities that existed before the first dawn, gaining power through dangerous pacts and eldritch wisdom. Your magic will tap into forces that predate civilization itself.\n\nThis knowledge comes with great risk - the whispers can drive weak minds to madness, and the beings you contact care nothing for mortal concerns. But for those with sufficient mental fortitude, the secrets of the universe itself lie within reach.\n\nListen carefully to what I teach you, for the Old Ones are always watching. Serve them well, and they will grant you power beyond imagination."}
Q[52003]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的邪能誓约者。这似乎是一份裹在绿色火焰中的恶魔契约，其地狱文字灼烧着阅读者的眼睛。似乎来自暴君格罗斯——他在试炼谷教别人束缚恶魔之力。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young felsworn. It appears to be a demonic pact wreathed in green flames, its infernal script burning the eyes of those who read it. It seems to be from Tyrant Gros, who teaches others to bind demonic power in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找暴君格罗斯。",oEN="Seek out Tyrant Gros in the Valley of Trials.",p="邪能能量从你的灵魂中散发出来，战士。所以你想成为恶魔猎手，去号令恶魔之力？",pEN="Fel energy radiates from your soul, warrior. So you wish to become Felsworn, to command demonic power?",c="邪能之焰如今在你体内燃烧，而且它们饥渴。你已选择成为恶魔猎手，去攫取军团的力量——不是反抗它，而是驾驭它。曾经想要奴役你的东西，如今屈从于你的意志。\n\n作为恶魔猎手的一员，你将通过支配与契约束缚恶魔精华，从扭曲虚空中撕下地狱盟友，把它们锁在你的号令之下。你驾驭的每一个恶魔都是你至高地位的证明，一件由腐化本身锻造的武器。\n\n这条道路并不在救赎与堕落之间寻求平衡。它彻底抛弃了那样的幻想。邪能的低语不是诱惑，而是真相，向那些足够无情、愿意接受它的人提供力量。弱者被腐化击倒；配得上的人塑造它。\n\n记住你为何拥抱这份力量：不是为了救赎，不是为了克制，而是为了至高无上。让邪能吞噬你的犹豫、仁慈与疑虑。愿你的火焰灼烧世界，直到只剩下那些足够强大、能够承受的人。",cEN="The fel flames burn within you now and they hunger. You have chosen to become Felsworn, to claim the Legion’s power not in defiance of it, but in mastery. What once sought to enslave you now bends to your will.\n\nAs one of the Felsworn, you will bind demonic essence through domination and pact, tearing infernal allies from the Twisting Nether and chaining them to your command. Every demon you wield is proof of your ascendancy, a weapon forged from corruption itself.\n\nThis path does not balance salvation and damnation. It abandons such illusions entirely. The fel whispers are not temptations, they are truths, offering strength to those ruthless enough to accept it. The weak fall to corruption; the worthy shape it.\n\nRemember why you embraced this power: not for redemption, not for restraint, but for supremacy. Let the fel consume hesitation, mercy, and doubt. May your flames scorch the world until only those strong enough to endure remain."}
Q[52004]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的守护者。这似乎是一块刻着守护誓言的抛光钢板，散发着一圈不可撼动的防御光环。似乎来自丹中士戈穆克——她在试炼谷致力于保护他人。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young guardian. It appears to be a polished steel tablet inscribed with protective vows, radiating an aura of unbreakable defense. It seems to be from Den Sergeant Gormuk, who has dedicated herself to protecting others in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找丹中士戈穆克。",oEN="Seek out Den Sergeant Gormuk in the Valley of Trials.",p="你的防护光环闪耀着明亮的光芒，年轻人。所以你想成为守护者，保护他人免受一切伤害？",pEN="Your protective aura shines brightly, young one. So you wish to become a Guardian, to shield others from all harm?",c="守护之灵认出你是它们选中的勇士。你已接受最高尚的使命——作为一名永恒的守护者，把别人的安危置于自己之上。\n\n作为守护者，你将学会成为一座活生生的堡垒，用防御技艺创造出任何敌人都无法突破的屏障。你的防护魔法将庇护整支队伍免受伤害，而你坚定不移的存在会激励盟友心中的勇气。\n\n这条道路要求无私的牺牲——为了让别人不必承受，你将忍受痛苦；为了让别人得以生存，你将直面死亡。荣耀往往与那些阻止灾难而非引发灾难的人擦肩而过，但没有什么荣誉比守护无辜者的生命更崇高。\n\n部落非常需要你的守护，守护者。随时准备好捍卫最重要的东西。",cEN="The spirits of protection recognize you as their chosen champion. You have accepted the most noble of callings - to serve as an eternal guardian, placing others' safety above your own.\n\nAs a Guardian, you will learn to become a living fortress, your defensive techniques creating barriers that no enemy can breach. Your protective magic will shield entire groups from harm while your stalwart presence inspires courage in allied hearts.\n\nThis path demands selfless sacrifice - you will endure pain so others need not, face death so others may live. Glory often passes by those who prevent disaster rather than cause it, but there is no higher honor than preserving innocent lives.\n\nThe Horde has great need of your protection, guardian. Stand ready to defend what matters most."}
Q[52005]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的克索诺斯骑士。这似乎是一份裹着阴影的文件，带有克索诺斯的印记，散发着冰冷的黑暗。似乎来自萨戈克——他在试炼谷行走于暗影与荣誉之间的这条危险道路。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young knight of xoroth. It appears to be a shadow-wreathed document bearing the seal of Xoroth, radiating cold darkness. It seems to be from Xagok, who walks this dangerous path between shadow and honor in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找斯皮罗。",oEN="Seek out Spi'ro in the Valley of Trials.",p="我感觉到暗影与荣誉都在召唤你。所以你想加入克索诺斯骑士，以黑暗侍奉光明？",pEN="Shadow and honor both call to you, I sense. So you wish to join the Knights of Xoroth, to wield darkness in service of light?",c="暗影拥抱你，荣誉指引你。你选择了最矛盾的一条道路——以黑暗侍奉光明，成为克索诺斯骑士。\n\n作为克索诺斯骑士，你将学会在坚守道德准则的同时引导虚空能量与暗影魔法。你的黑暗技艺会迷惑那些期待神圣魔法的敌人，而你正义的目的将让旁人视为禁忌的手段变得正当。\n\n这条道路要求绝对的道德清明：即便你从暗影本身汲取力量，也绝不能允许黑暗吞噬你的目标。你的誓约约束你以一切必要手段保护无辜者。\n\n欢迎加入教团，暗影骑士。愿你黑暗的光指引他人穿越最深的黑夜。",cEN="Shadow embraces you while honor guides you. You have chosen the most paradoxical of paths - to wield darkness in service of the light, to become a Knight of Xoroth.\n\nAs a Knight of Xoroth, you will learn to channel void energy and shadow magic while maintaining your moral principles. Your dark techniques will confound enemies expecting holy magic, while your righteous purpose justifies methods others would consider forbidden.\n\nThis path requires absolute moral clarity - you must never let the darkness consume your purpose, even as you draw power from shadow itself. Your oath binds you to protect the innocent through whatever means necessary.\n\nWelcome to the Order, shadow knight. May your dark light guide others through the deepest night."}
Q[52006]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的死灵法师。这似乎是一块由巨人骨雕刻而成的古老石板，上面铭刻着低语亡者之死的死灵符号。似乎来自复生者克拉加尔——他在试炼谷修行这些技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young necromancer. It appears to be an ancient tablet carved from giant bone, inscribed with necromantic symbols that whisper of undeath. It seems to be from Kragar the Reanimator, who practices these arts in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找复生者克拉加尔。",oEN="Seek out Kragar the Reanimator in the Valley of Trials.",p="亡者的灵魂在你周围低语。所以你想成为死灵法师，在诸世界之间引导灵魂？",pEN="The spirits of the dead whisper around you. So you wish to become a Necromancer, to shepherd souls between worlds?",c="死亡承认你是它忠实的仆人，一个明白终结不过是新的开始的人。你已选择成为诸世界之间的牧者。\n\n作为死灵法师，你将学会与亡者交谈、唤起骷髅仆从，并操纵生死本身的本源。但永远记住，这份力量的存在是为了维护自然秩序，而不是嘲弄它。\n\n无知者畏惧死灵法术，只看到腐化与邪恶。但真正的死灵法师是生死边界上的守护者，确保亡者安息，同时在需要时让他们的智慧帮助生者。\n\n祖先们低语着对你选择的认可。尊敬亡者，服务生者，并记住死亡不是该畏惧的敌人，而是该尊敬的导师。",cEN="Death recognizes you as its faithful servant, one who understands that endings are merely new beginnings. You have chosen to become a shepherd between worlds.\n\nAs a Necromancer, you will learn to speak with the dead, raise skeletal servants, and manipulate the very essence of life and death. But remember always that this power exists to preserve the natural order, not to mock it.\n\nThe ignorant fear necromancy, seeing only corruption and evil. But true necromancers serve as guardians of the boundary between life and death, ensuring that the dead rest peacefully while their wisdom aids the living when needed.\n\nThe ancestors whisper their approval of your choice. Honor the dead, serve the living, and remember that death is not an enemy to be feared, but a teacher to be respected."}
Q[52007]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的仪祭师。这似乎是一卷噼啪作响、满是原始元素能量的卷轴，微型的风暴与火焰在其中盘旋。似乎来自克鲁尔·碎岩——他在试炼谷与元素之灵交流。在你继续这里的事务之前，不妨先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young primalist. It appears to be a scroll that crackles with raw elemental energy, swirling with miniature tempests and flames. It seems to be from Krull Rocksmash, who communes with elemental spirits in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找克鲁尔·碎岩。",oEN="Seek out Krull Rocksmash in the Valley of Trials.",p="元素回应你的存在，战士。所以你想成为仪祭师，号令自然的原始力量？",pEN="The elements respond to your presence, warrior. So you wish to become a Primalist, to command the raw forces of nature?",c="原始的元素以创世之初的狂怒涌过你身！你已选择拥抱创世本身最根本的力量，成为土、风、火、水最纯粹形态的导体。\n\n作为仪祭师，你将学会以空前的力量号令元素魔法。你的法术将唤来火山喷发、毁灭性的地震、飓风级的大风与倾盆的洪水。现实本身的基石都会回应你的召唤。\n\n这份力量来自世界的根基本身，比任何凡人构想出的魔法都更古老、更危险。元素根本不在乎文明——它们只回应力量与敬意。显露软弱，它们就会吞噬你。\n\n原始之力已接受你为它们的勇士。愿你证明自己配得上驾驭那塑造了艾泽拉斯本身的根本力量。",cEN="The raw elements surge through you with primordial fury! You have chosen to embrace the most fundamental forces of creation itself, becoming a conduit for earth, air, fire, and water in their purest forms.\n\nAs a Primalist, you will learn to command elemental magic with unprecedented power. Your spells will call forth volcanic eruptions, devastating earthquakes, hurricane-force winds, and torrential floods. The very building blocks of reality will answer your call.\n\nThis power comes from the world's foundation itself, older and more dangerous than any magic devised by mortals. The elements care nothing for civilization - they respond only to strength and respect. Show weakness, and they will consume you.\n\nThe primal forces have accepted you as their champion. May you prove worthy of wielding the fundamental powers that shaped Azeroth itself."}
Q[52008]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的炎术师。这似乎是一份冒着烟的手稿，散发着炽热，火焰在它焦灼的表面上舞动。似乎来自格里什纳克·焦疤——他在试炼谷掌握火焰的技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young pyromancer. It appears to be a smoldering manuscript that radiates intense heat, with flames dancing across its scorched surface. It seems to be from Grishnakh Searscar, who masters the art of fire in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找格里什纳克·焦疤。",oEN="Seek out Grishnakh Searscar in the Valley of Trials.",p="火焰在你身上认出了同源的灵魂。所以你想成为炎术师，掌握毁灭与重生的技艺？",pEN="Fire recognizes a kindred spirit in you. So you wish to become a Pyromancer, to master the art of destruction and renewal?",c="火焰以舞动向它的新主人致意！你已拥抱纯粹毁灭与重生的道路，选择成为最具毁灭形态的元素之焰的执掌者。\n\n作为炎术师，你将学会召唤比巨龙吐息更炽烈的炼狱，让天降之火把战场化为玻璃，仅凭一个念头就把敌人化为灰烬。火焰将是你忠诚而可怖的仆从。\n\n永远记住，火焰既是毁灭者也是创造者——它清除枯死的生长，让新生命得以繁茂；它净化腐化，并为需要的人提供温暖与光明。尊重它的双重本性，它就会好好侍奉你。\n\n火焰欢迎它们的新主人。愿你的火烧得明亮，愿你的敌人烧得更旺！",cEN="Fire dances in recognition of its new master! You have embraced the path of pure destruction and renewal, choosing to become a wielder of elemental flame in its most devastating form.\n\nAs a Pyromancer, you will learn to conjure infernos that burn hotter than dragon's breath, to rain fire from the heavens that turns battlefields to glass, and to reduce your enemies to ash with but a thought. Flame will be your faithful and terrible servant.\n\nRemember always that fire is both destroyer and creator - it clears dead growth so new life can flourish, purifies corruption, and provides warmth and light to those who need it. Respect its dual nature, and it will serve you well.\n\nThe flames welcome their new master. May your fires burn bright and your enemies burn brighter!"}
Q[52009]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的游侠。这似乎是一本皮面装订的指南，散发着荒野的气味，沾着泥污，还留着野兽的足迹。似乎来自狼骑者雅拉——那位在试炼谷守护荒野的游侠。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young ranger. It appears to be a leather-bound guide that smells of the wild, stained with mud and marked by animal tracks. It seems to be from Wolfrider Yara, the ranger who protects the wilds in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找狼骑者雅拉。",oEN="Seek out Wolfrider Yara in the Valley of Trials.",p="荒野在召唤你的心，流浪者。所以你想成为游侠，守护艾泽拉斯的荒野之地？",pEN="The wilderness calls to your heart, wanderer. So you wish to become a Ranger, to protect the wild places of Azeroth?",c="荒野认出了自己的孩子！我能从你眼中看见荒野的召唤，那种标记着真正游侠的、与自然的深刻联结。你已选择成为未驯之地的守护者。\n\n作为游侠，你将学会在任何地形中潜行移动，像兄弟一样与野兽交流，并从阴影中以致命的精准发起攻击。森林会隐藏你，群山会庇护你，野兽会协助你。\n\n这条道路要求对自然世界及其所有生灵怀有深切的敬意。你将学会与自然和谐共处，同时保护它免遭那些为一己私利而剥削或毁灭它的人。\n\n荒野的灵魂欢迎它们新的守护者。愿你的箭矢精准，愿你的道路对那些心怀恶意之人始终隐蔽。",cEN="The wilderness recognizes one of its own! I can see the wild's calling in your eyes, the deep connection to nature that marks true Rangers. You have chosen to become a guardian of the untamed lands.\n\nAs a Ranger, you will learn to move unseen through any terrain, to communicate with wild beasts as brothers, and to strike from the shadows with deadly precision. The forests will hide you, the mountains will shelter you, and the animals will aid you.\n\nThis path requires deep respect for the natural world and all its creatures. You will learn to live in harmony with nature while protecting it from those who would exploit or destroy it for selfish gain.\n\nThe spirits of the wild welcome their new protector. May your arrows fly true and your path remain hidden from those who would do harm."}
Q[52010]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的符文大师。这似乎是一块沉重的石板，上面刻着闪耀的符文，脉动着古老的魔法力量。似乎来自吉娜·铭文阅读者——那位居住在试炼谷的符文大师。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young runemaster. It appears to be a heavy stone slab etched with glowing runes that pulse with ancient magical power. It seems to be from Zina Glyphreader, the runemaster who dwells in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找吉娜·铭文阅读者。",oEN="Seek out Zina Glyphreader in the Valley of Trials.",p="古老的力量在你面前骚动。所以你想成为符文大师，把魔法刻入石头与钢铁？",pEN="Ancient power stirs in your presence. So you wish to become a Runemaster, to carve magic into stone and steel?",c="古老的力量认出了你的价值！你已选择掌握有思想生灵所知最古老的魔法形式——将力量束缚于石头与钢铁之中的符文铭刻技艺。\n\n作为符文大师，你将学会雕刻比创造它们的文明更长久的魔法公式。你的附魔将被写入现实的肌理之中，创造出在其他魔法早已消散之后仍能持久生效的效果。\n\n这门技艺要求绝对的精准与耐心——一条画错位置的线就能把守护变成武器，而完美的执行则能创造出看似不可能的奇迹。你的工具很简单，但你的知识必须广博。\n\n孕育了符文魔法的原始之力承认你的价值。愿你的铭文完美无瑕，愿你的附魔永恒不朽。",cEN="Ancient power recognizes your worth! You have chosen to master the oldest form of magic known to thinking beings - the art of runic inscription that binds power into stone and steel.\n\nAs a Runemaster, you will learn to carve magical formulae that outlast the civilizations that created them. Your enchantments will be written into the very fabric of reality, creating effects that endure long after other magic has faded to nothing.\n\nThis art demands absolute precision and patience - a single misplaced line can turn a ward into a weapon, while perfect execution creates wonders that seem impossible. Your tools are simple, but your knowledge must be vast.\n\nThe primordial forces that gave birth to runic magic acknowledge you as worthy. May your inscriptions be flawless and your enchantments eternal."}
Q[52011]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的风暴使者。这似乎是一份噼啪作响、满是电能的文稿，雷声在书页间轻轻滚动。似乎来自吉姆切恩——那位在试炼谷号令风暴的风暴使者。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young stormbringer. It appears to be a manuscript that crackles with electrical energy, thunder rumbling softly from within its pages. It seems to be from Zim'chein, the stormbringer who commands tempests in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找吉姆切恩。",oEN="Seek out Zim'chein in the Valley of Trials.",p="雷声因你的到来而轰鸣，风暴召唤者。所以你想成为风暴使者，号令风与闪电？",pEN="Thunder rumbles at your approach, stormcaller. So you wish to become a Stormbringer, to command wind and lightning?",c="雷声轰鸣，向它的新冠军致意！风暴之灵选中了你，让你执掌它们的怒火，成为风与闪电本身的主宰。\n\n作为风暴使者，你将学会从晴空中召来风暴，唤下能击碎群山的闪电，并驾驭风本身冲入战场。大气本身将成为你的武器。\n\n风暴魔法纯粹而狂野，如同风暴本身。你必须学会驾驭它的怒火而不被它吞噬，引导它的力量而不迷失于它混沌的本性。尊重风暴，它就会忠诚地侍奉你。\n\n风暴之灵欢迎它们的新主人。愿你的闪电永不落空，愿你的风载你迅速走向胜利！",cEN="Thunder rolls in recognition of its new champion! The storm spirits have chosen you to wield their fury, to become a master of wind and lightning itself.\n\nAs a Stormbringer, you will learn to summon tempests from clear skies, to call down lightning that can shatter mountains, and to ride the wind itself into battle. The very atmosphere will become your weapon.\n\nStorm magic is raw and untamed, like the tempests themselves. You must learn to harness its fury without being consumed by it, to direct its power without losing yourself in its chaotic nature. Respect the storm, and it will serve you faithfully.\n\nThe tempest spirits welcome their new master. May your lightning never miss its target and your winds carry you swift to victory!"}
Q[52012]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的太阳祭司。这似乎是一份金色的经文，散发着温暖的阳光，辐射着神圣的治疗能量。似乎来自潘加乔·望日者——那位为试炼谷带来光明的太阳祭司。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young sun cleric. It appears to be a golden scripture that glows with warm sunlight, radiating divine healing energy. It seems to be from Pangajo Sunseer, the sun cleric who brings light to the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找潘加乔·望日者。",oEN="Seek out Pangajo Sunseer in the Valley of Trials.",p="圣光从你的存在中散发出来。所以你想成为太阳祭司，以黎明的力量进行治疗？",pEN="Holy light radiates from your being. So you wish to become a Sun Cleric, to heal with the power of dawn?",c="圣光以光辉的温暖拥抱你！你已选择成为神圣治疗的容器，在一个常被冲突与绝望笼罩的世界里成为希望的灯塔。\n\n作为太阳祭司，你将学会引导黎明本身的纯粹力量，治愈他人眼中的致命伤，净化已在凡人灵魂中扎根的腐化，并召下只灼烧邪恶的净化之焰。\n\n这份使命要求毫不动摇的怜悯，以及对守护生命的绝对忠诚。你会因治疗陌生人而筋疲力尽，会为保护无辜者而冒生命危险，会面对足以让最脆弱的灵魂惊恐逃窜的黑暗。\n\n永恒的太阳祝福你神圣的使命。愿你的光芒永不黯淡，愿你永远为迷失在最深黑夜中的人带来希望。",cEN="The Light embraces you with radiant warmth! You have chosen to become a vessel for divine healing, a beacon of hope in a world too often darkened by conflict and despair.\n\nAs a Sun Cleric, you will learn to channel the pure power of dawn itself, healing wounds that others consider fatal, purifying corruption that has taken root in mortal souls, and calling down cleansing fire that burns only evil.\n\nThis calling demands unwavering compassion and absolute dedication to preserving life. You will exhaust yourself healing strangers, risk your life protecting the innocent, and face darkness that would make lesser souls flee in terror.\n\nThe eternal sun blesses your sacred calling. May your light never dim, and may you always bring hope to those lost in the deepest night."}
Q[52013]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的圣殿骑士。这似乎是一份受祝福的文件，散发着神圣的光芒，铭刻着神圣侍奉的誓言。似乎来自真言者奥莫古尔格——他在试炼谷担任圣殿骑士。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young templar. It appears to be a blessed document that emanates holy light, inscribed with vows of divine service. It seems to be from Omogulg the Truthbearer, who serves as a templar in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找真言者奥莫古尔格。",oEN="Seek out Omogulg the Truthbearer in the Valley of Trials.",p="神圣的正义在你体内燃烧，勇士。所以你想成为圣殿骑士，作为神圣战士效力？",pEN="Divine justice burns within you, champion. So you wish to become a Templar, to serve as a holy warrior?",c="神圣的正义像熔钢一样流经你身！你已立下圣殿骑士的神圣誓言，选择成为侍奉正义本身的神圣战士。\n\n作为圣殿骑士，你将学会把神圣力量引导成对邪恶的粉碎打击，以受祝福的魔法治疗盟友，并在黑暗即将吞没世界时成为不可撼动的信仰之柱。\n\n这份使命要求绝对的道德清明，以及对正义毫不动摇的献身。你必须是审判者与行刑者、治疗者与保护者，一切都要由超越凡人理解的神圣智慧引导。\n\n圣光本身已选中你作为它在部落中的勇士。愿你的信仰成为你的力量，你的信念成为你的武器，你的正直成为你永恒的指引。",cEN="Divine justice flows through you like molten steel! You have sworn the sacred oaths of the Templar, choosing to become a holy warrior in service to righteousness itself.\n\nAs a Templar, you will learn to channel divine power into crushing blows against evil, to heal your allies with blessed magic, and to stand as an unshakeable pillar of faith when darkness threatens to overwhelm the world.\n\nThis calling demands absolute moral clarity and unwavering dedication to justice. You must be judge and executioner, healer and protector, all guided by divine wisdom that transcends mortal understanding.\n\nThe Light itself has chosen you as its champion among the Horde. May your faith be your strength, your conviction your weapon, and your righteousness your eternal guide."}
Q[52014]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的发明家。这似乎是一套满是机械设计的技术图纸，伴随着齿轮滴答作响的声音。似乎来自技工小子帕罗德——那位在试炼谷工作的发明家。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young tinker. It appears to be technical blueprints filled with mechanical designs, accompanied by the sound of ticking gears. It seems to be from Mekboy Parod, the tinker who works in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找技工小子帕罗德。",oEN="Seek out Mekboy Parod in the Valley of Trials.",p="创新在你的脑海中迸发火花，建造者。所以你想成为工匠，把魔法与机械融为一体？",pEN="Innovation sparks in your mind, builder. So you wish to become a Tinker, to blend magic and machinery?",c="闪亮的创新在你脑海中迸发！你已选择走上连接魔法与机械的道路，创造出单独一门技艺无法达成的奇迹。\n\n作为工匠，你将学会建造帮助盟友、迷惑敌人、并展现创造性思维应用于实际问题的力量的装置。你的发明将证明进步与传统可以携手同行。\n\n这条道路既要求技术知识，也要求创造性的灵感。你必须先理解事物如何运作，才能让它们运作得更好，但真正的创新来自看见别人忽略的可能性。\n\n发明的灵魂对你的选择微笑。愿你的装置在你最需要时永不失灵，愿你的创新好好服务于部落！",cEN="Brilliant innovation sparks in your mind! You have chosen to walk the path that bridges magic and machinery, creating wonders that neither art alone could achieve.\n\nAs a Tinker, you will learn to construct devices that aid allies, confound enemies, and demonstrate the power of creative thinking applied to practical problems. Your inventions will show that progress and tradition can work together.\n\nThis path requires both technical knowledge and creative inspiration. You must understand how things work before you can make them work better, but true innovation comes from seeing possibilities that others miss.\n\nThe spirits of invention smile upon your choice. May your devices never malfunction when you need them most, and may your innovations serve the Horde well."}
Q[52015]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的剧毒术士。这似乎是一本危险的典籍，散发着奇异毒素的恶臭，绿色蒸气从书页间渗出。似乎来自智者奎斯佩——他在试炼谷研究毒液与解药。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young venomancer. It appears to be a dangerous tome reeking of exotic toxins, with green vapors seeping from between its pages. It seems to be from Qwi'spe the Wise, who studies venoms and antidotes in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找智者奎斯佩。",oEN="Seek out Qwi'spe the Wise in the Valley of Trials.",p="毒素与解药之间的平衡在召唤你。所以你想成为剧毒术士，掌握毒药与治愈？",pEN="The balance of toxin and antidote calls to you. So you wish to become a Venomancer, to master poison and cure?",c="致命的平衡流经你的理解！你已选择掌握毒素的双重本性——它们伤害的力量，以及在正确使用时同等的治愈之力。\n\n作为剧毒术士，你将学会调制能击倒最强大敌人的毒药，也能创造拯救那些被他人认为无望之人的解药与疗法。只要理解其中原理，每种毒素都有它的解药。\n\n这份知识伴随着巨大的责任——杀死一头腐化野兽的化合物，也许能救下一个中毒的孩子。你的智慧必须指引何时释放死亡，何时守护生命。\n\n自然的平衡认可你的理解。愿你的毒液精准地击中我们的敌人，愿你的解药为我们的盟友带来治愈。",cEN="The deadly balance flows through your understanding! You have chosen to master the dual nature of toxins - their power to harm and their equal power to heal when properly applied.\n\nAs a Venomancer, you will learn to brew poisons that can fell the mightiest enemies, but also to create antidotes and cures that can save lives others consider beyond hope. Every toxin has its remedy if one understands the principles involved.\n\nThis knowledge carries tremendous responsibility - the same compound that kills a corrupted beast might save a poisoned child. Your wisdom must guide when to unleash death and when to preserve life.\n\nThe natural balance recognizes your understanding. May your venoms strike true against our enemies, and your cures bring healing to our allies."}
Q[52016]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻的巫医。这似乎是一卷装饰着部族图腾的古老卷轴，嗡鸣着祖先的力量与洛阿魔法。似乎来自罗尔乔库——他在试炼谷修行这些古老技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young witch doctor. It appears to be an ancient scroll decorated with tribal fetishes, humming with ancestral power and loa magic. It seems to be from Rol'joku, who practices these ancient arts in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在试炼谷寻找罗尔乔库。",oEN="Seek out Rol'joku in the Valley of Trials.",p="洛阿低语着你的名字，灵魂行者。所以你想成为巫医，作为诸世界之间的桥梁效力？",pEN="The loa whisper your name, spirit-walker. So you wish to become a Witch Doctor, to serve as bridge between worlds?",c="洛阿欢迎它们在凡世的新声音！你已选择成为祖先智慧的容器，把灵魂的国度与生者的土地连接起来。\n\n作为巫医，你将学会通过仪式与献祭引导洛阿的力量，以灵魂魔法治疗，并用超越死亡本身的妖术诅咒敌人。祖先将指引你的双手，无论是施以祝福还是施行审判。\n\n这份神圣的使命要求尊重古老的方式，同时适应现代的需要。你必须作为你族人的治疗者、顾问与灵魂向导，为那些听不见洛阿之声的人解读它们的意愿。\n\n你的魔法不只服务于个人的需要，也服务于整个社群的灵魂健康。\n\n祖先的智慧欢迎它新的守护者。愿洛阿指引你的脚步，愿你的魔法以同等的敬意侍奉生者与亡者。",cEN="The loa welcome their new voice in the mortal world! You have chosen to serve as vessel for ancestral wisdom, bridging the realm of spirits with the land of the living.\n\nAs a Witch Doctor, you will learn to channel the power of the loa through ritual and sacrifice, to heal with spirit magic and hex your enemies with curses that transcend death itself. The ancestors will guide your hands in both blessing and judgment.\n\nThis sacred calling demands respect for the old ways while adapting to modern needs. You must serve as healer, advisor, and spiritual guide to your people, interpreting the will of the loa for those who cannot hear their voices.\n\nYour magic serves not just individual needs, but the spiritual health of the entire community.\n\nThe ancestral wisdom welcomes its new guardian. May the loa guide your steps, and may your magic serve both the living and the dead with equal reverence."}
Q[53000]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一块骨制石板，上面刻着的符文脉动着原始之怒。那些古老的标记讲述着一种超越死亡本身的无穷怒火，似乎来自送葬者奇泰——他在丧钟镇传授死神的道路。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a bone tablet etched with runes that pulse with primal fury. The ancient markings speak of endless rage that transcends death itself, and it seems to be from Undertaker Chite, who teaches the reaper's way in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="我能感觉到怒火在你体内滋长，<name>。你把怒火石板带来了吗？无尽狂怒的道路正等待着那些足够强大、能够走上去的人。",pEN="I can sense the fury building within you, <name>. Have you brought the Fury Tablet? The path of endless rage awaits those strong enough to walk it.",c="看来你听从了无尽狂怒的召唤。很好。你很有前途，<name>。\n\n死神的道路不是盲目的狂怒，而是有目的、有形态的怒火。你将学会驾驭栖居在所有战士体内的原始暴怒，把它转化为更可怕的东西——一种永不黯淡、永不动摇、永不怜悯的怒火。在别人疲惫之时，你会变得更强。在别人后退之时，你会以更新的凶性向前推进。\n\n在我的教导下，你将掌握经由无数代拒绝接受凡人耐力极限的战士传承下来的狂战士技艺。你的怒火将成为活物，一个在战斗中低语着纯粹侵略所生之策略的伙伴。你将学会把这股暴怒引导成毁灭性的旋风攻击、撼动大地的冲锋，以及能把盔甲像羊皮纸一样劈开的打击。\n\n欢迎踏上永恒狂怒之路，<name>。让你的敌人明白，面对一个怒火毫无界限的人意味着什么！",cEN="So, you have heeded the call of endless fury. Good. You show promise, <name>.\n\nThe path of the Reaper is not one of mindless rage, but of fury given purpose and form. You will learn to harness the primal wrath that dwells within all warriors and transform it into something far more terrible - a rage that never dims, never falters, never shows mercy. Where others grow weary, you will grow stronger. Where others fall back, you will press forward with renewed ferocity.\n\nUnder my tutelage, you will master the berserker arts passed down through countless generations of warriors who refused to accept the limitations of mortal endurance. Your fury will become a living thing, a companion in battle that whispers strategies born of pure aggression. You will learn to channel this rage into devastating whirlwind attacks, earth-shattering charges, and strikes that can cleave through armor as if it were parchment.\n\nWelcome to the path of eternal rage, <name>. Let your enemies learn what it means to face one whose fury knows no bounds!"}
Q[53001]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一卷沾着古老血液的黑暗卷轴，散发着恶意的力量。猩红技艺召唤着那些明白死亡与不死都只是工具的人，似乎来自伊琳娜·瓦尔里德——她在丧钟镇修行这些禁忌技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a dark scroll stained with ancient blood, radiating malevolent power. The crimson arts call to those who understand that death and undeath are merely tools, and it seems to be from Irina Valreed, who practices these forbidden techniques in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找伊琳娜·瓦尔里德。",oEN="Seek out Irina Valreed in Deathknell.",p="血魔法的气息缠绕着你，<name>。你把猩红卷轴带来了吗？猩红技艺只向配得上的人显露。",pEN="The scent of blood magic clings to you, <name>. Have you brought the Crimson Scroll? The crimson arts reveal themselves only to the worthy.",c="猩红技艺选中了你，<name>。这可不是小事。\n\n血魔法是最古老、最强力的巫术形式之一。每一滴血都蕴含生命本身的精华——力量、记忆、潜能。作为血法师，你将学会以手术般的精准操纵这种生命之力。敌人的血将成为你的武器，他们的生命力将成为你的盾牌，他们的本质将成为你最毁灭性法术的燃料。\n\n你将研习血魔法的古老技艺：控制血液的艺术。你将学会让血脉中的血液沸腾，将它冻结以从内部炸碎骨骼，或将它抽出化为猩红的武器。倒下敌人的血将在你的号令下升起，形成盾牌、长矛或毁灭的旋涡。你将掌握以精心计算的代价换取可怕力量的血之契约，以及能抽干整片战场来供养一个末日法术的仪式。\n\n这条道路要求自律，因为血魔法会腐化粗心者，吞噬软弱者。但对于有意志掌握它的人，猩红技艺提供超乎想象的力量。\n\n欢迎踏上猩红之路，<name>。让血液本身屈从于你的意志！",cEN="The crimson arts have chosen you, <name>. This is no small thing.\n\nBlood magic is among the oldest and most potent forms of sorcery. Every drop of blood contains the essence of life itself - power, memories, potential. As a Bloodmage, you will learn to manipulate this vital force with surgical precision. The blood of your enemies will become your weapon, their life force your shield, their very essence fuel for your most devastating spells.\n\nYou will study the ancient techniques of hemomancy - the art of blood control. You'll learn to boil blood within veins, freeze it solid to shatter bones from within, or draw it forth as crimson weapons. The blood of fallen foes will rise at your command, forming shields, spears, or swirling vortexes of destruction. You will master blood pacts that grant terrible power at calculated costs, and rituals that can drain entire battlefields to fuel a single, apocalyptic spell.\n\nThis path demands discipline, for blood magic corrupts the careless and consumes the weak. But for those with the will to master it, the crimson arts offer power beyond imagination.\n\nWelcome to the crimson path, <name>. Let blood itself bend to your will!"}
Q[53002]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份破烂的手稿，布满了在被注视时似乎会扭动变幻的符号。古老实体的低语从其中回响，似乎来自萨迪厄斯·虚空探寻者——他在丧钟镇与超越死亡的力量交流。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a tattered manuscript covered in symbols that seem to writhe and shift when observed. The whispers of ancient entities echo from within, and it seems to be from Thaddeus Voidseeker, who communes with powers beyond death in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找萨迪厄斯·虚空探寻者。",oEN="Seek out Thaddeus Voidseeker in Deathknell.",p="虚空低语着你的名字，<name>。你把虚空手稿带来了吗？古老的力量因你的接近而骚动。",pEN="The void whispers your name, <name>. Have you brought the Void Manuscript? Ancient powers stir at your approach.",c="啊，又一个听见低语的人。虚空已标记了你，<name>。\n\n虚空并非空无一物——它充满了比创世更古老的意识，那是第一颗星辰点燃之前便已存在的力量。作为邪教徒，你将成为这些古老力量的导体，引导大多数心智无法理解、否则便会崩碎的能量。你听到的低语不是疯狂，而是对寻常感知而言过于可怖的真相。\n\n你将学会看穿现实的帷幕，感知那些扭动着、连接万物的力量触须。上古之神的影响从存在的裂缝中渗出，而你将变成这样一道裂缝——一道意志得以显现的活体传送门。暗影魔法将成为你的母语，你将说出让现实本身瓦解的言语。\n\n你的心智将扩张，以容纳足以击碎低等生灵的真相。你将召唤虚空实体为你效力，腐化敌人脚下的土地，并像瘟疫一样传播疯狂。虚空的赠礼有其代价——你的理智将不断受到考验，你的人性将受到质疑。但作为回报，你获得了超越凡人局限的力量。\n\n欢迎投入虚空的怀抱，<name>。让宇宙见识恐怖的新定义吧！",cEN="Ah, another hears the whispers. The void has marked you, <name>.\n\nThe void is not empty - it teems with consciousness older than creation, powers that existed before the first star ignited. As a Cultist, you will serve as conduit to these ancient forces, channeling energies that most minds cannot comprehend without shattering. The whispers you hear are not madness, but truth too terrible for ordinary perception.\n\nYou will learn to see beyond the veil of reality, to perceive the writhing tentacles of power that connect all things. The Old Gods' influence seeps through cracks in existence, and you will become one such crack - a living portal through which their will manifests. Shadow magic will become your native tongue, and you'll speak words that unmake reality itself.\n\nYour mind will expand to accommodate truths that would break lesser beings. You'll summon void entities to serve your will, corrupt the very ground your enemies stand upon, and spread madness like a plague. The void's gifts come with a price - your sanity will be constantly tested, your humanity questioned. But in return, you gain power that transcends mortal limitation.\n\nWelcome to the void's embrace, <name>. Let the universe learn new definitions of terror!"}
Q[53003]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份裹着绿色火焰的恶魔契约，其地狱文字燃烧着不洁的目的。邪能能量与那些已经尝过死亡的人共鸣，似乎来自达尔达尼斯——他在丧钟镇号令这些黑暗力量。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a demonic contract wreathed in green flames, its infernal script burning with unholy purpose. The fel energies resonate with those who have already tasted death, and it seems to be from Dar'danis, who commands these dark powers in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找达尔达尼斯。",oEN="Seek out Dar'danis in Deathknell.",p="军团能量在你周围噼啪作响，<name>。你把邪能契约带来了吗？恶魔们正躁动不安地等待新的契约。",pEN="Fel energy crackles around you, <name>. Have you brought the Fel Contract? The demons grow restless for a new pact.",c="邪能认出了自己的人。你已经迈出了走向诅咒的第一步，<name>——或者说是走向救赎，取决于你怎么看。\n\n邪能魔法是腐化的具现，是精炼为武器的混沌。燃烧军团或许已经倾覆，但它的力量仍留给那些足够大胆、敢于认领它的人。作为恶魔猎手，你将把恶魔束缚于你的意志，把军团自己的武器转而对付任何与你为敌的人。别人看到诅咒，你看到机会。\n\n你将知晓恶魔的真名，那些用邪能铁与强制之力把它们锁住的言语。低等小鬼将作为你的斥候，魅魔作为你的渗透者，邪能卫士作为你的战士。但不只是简单的召唤，你将引导邪能能量本身——像烧灼血肉一样轻易烧灼灵魂的绿色火焰，像疾病一样蔓延的腐化，以及把你重造成超越凡人之物的蜕变。\n\n邪能要求牺牲。你的灵魂将带着永不消退的印记，你的梦境将回响着恶魔的尖叫，你的存在本身就会让周围的人不安。但作为交换，你获得了曾击倒泰坦、焚毁整个世界的 power。你将在掌控与吞噬之间的刀刃上行走，永远只差一步就会迷失在邪能的饥渴里。\n\n欢迎踏上邪能之路，<name>。让恶魔们学会畏惧它们的新主人！",cEN="The fel recognizes its own. You've taken the first step into damnation, <name> - or perhaps salvation, depending on your perspective.\n\nFel magic is corruption given form, chaos refined into a weapon. The Burning Legion may have fallen, but their power remains for those bold enough to claim it. As a Felsworn, you will bind demons to your will, turning the Legion's own weapons against any who oppose you. Where others see damnation, you see opportunity.\n\nYou will learn the true names of demons, the words that bind them in chains of fel iron and compulsion. Lesser imps will serve as your scouts, succubi as your infiltrators, felguards as your warriors. But more than simple summoning, you will channel fel energy itself - green fire that burns soul as readily as flesh, corruption that spreads like a disease, and transformations that remake you into something more than mortal.\n\nThe fel demands sacrifice. Your soul will bear marks that never fade, your dreams will echo with demonic screams, and your very presence will unsettle those around you. But in exchange, you gain power that toppled titans and burned entire worlds. You will walk the razor's edge between control and consumption, always one misstep from losing yourself to the fel's hunger.\n\nWelcome to the fel path, <name>. Let the demons learn to fear their new master!"}
Q[53004]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一块刻着防护结界的钢板，散发着超越死亡仍能持存的防御魔法。守护者的誓言甚至约束着亡灵去保护他人，似乎来自死亡卫士布拉德福斯——他在丧钟镇履行这份神圣职责。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a steel tablet inscribed with protective wards, radiating defensive magic that persists beyond death. The guardian's oath binds even the undead to protect others, and it seems to be from Deathguard Bradforth, who maintains this sacred duty in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="你保护他人的决心早已传开，<name>。你把守护者誓言带来了吗？永恒守卫者的道路在等着你。",pEN="Your determination to protect others precedes you, <name>. Have you brought the Guardian Oath? The path of the eternal defender awaits.",c="你的誓言已被见证，<name>。从此刻起，你就是需要帮助之人的盾牌与庇护所。\n\n守护者坚守在他人无法坚守之处，忍受他人不愿忍受之事，保护那些无法保护自己的人。你的誓言不只是言语——它成为你本质的一部分，把你转化为一座抵挡一切伤害的活体堡垒。作为守护者，你将掌握防御技艺，把自己变成一件不可撼动的物体，让不可阻挡之力在其上撞碎。\n\n你将学会以纯粹的意志编织盾牌，那屏障能保护整支军队免受巨龙吐息或炮火轰击。光是你的存在就能激励盟友的勇气，并在敌人心中埋下疑虑。我将教你的古老技艺包括让你免疫击退的铁壁警戒姿态、把防御延伸到远处盟友的圣盾投射，以及让你在受到致命伤后仍能继续战斗的背水一战。\n\n但你要明白：守护者的道路意味着牺牲。你将一次又一次地把自己挡在危险与无辜者之间。你将承受痛苦，好让别人不必承受。别人撤退时，你将独自面对不可能的战局。这不是负担，而是特权——成为永不破碎的盾，永不倒塌的墙。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的守望，<name>。让邪恶在你的防御上撞得粉碎！",cEN="Your oath has been witnessed, <name>. From this moment forward, you are shield and shelter to those in need.\n\nThe guardian stands where others cannot, endures what others will not, and protects those who cannot protect themselves. Your oath is not merely words - it becomes part of your very essence, transforming you into a living bastion against all forms of harm. As a Guardian, you will master defensive arts that turn you into an immovable object against which the unstoppable force breaks.\n\nYou will learn to weave shields from pure will, barriers that can protect entire armies from dragon's breath or artillery bombardment. Your presence alone will inspire courage in allies and plant seeds of doubt in enemies. The ancient techniques I will teach you include the Iron Vigil stance that makes you immune to knockback, the Aegis Projection that extends your defenses to distant allies, and the Final Stand - a technique that allows you to continue fighting even after receiving mortal wounds.\n\nBut know this: the guardian's path is one of sacrifice. You will place yourself between danger and the innocent time and again. You will endure pain so others need not. You will stand alone against impossible odds while others retreat. This is not a burden, but a privilege - to be the shield that never breaks, the wall that never falls.\n\nWelcome to eternal vigilance, <name>. Let evil break itself upon your defenses!"}
Q[53005]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份裹着阴影的公告，带有克索诺斯的印记，散发着被高尚目的调和的冰冷黑暗。克索诺斯骑士明白荣誉超越生死，似乎来自布拉尔穆拉——他在丧钟镇坚守这些黑暗誓约。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a shadow-wreathed proclamation bearing the seal of Xoroth, radiating cold darkness tempered by noble purpose. The Knights of Xoroth understand that honor transcends life and death, and it seems to be from Brallmular, who upholds these dark oaths in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找布拉尔穆拉。",oEN="Seek out Brallmular in Deathknell.",p="暗影紧贴着你，如同第二层皮肤，<name>。你把暗影敕令带来了吗？克索诺斯骑士正等待着他们最新的成员。",pEN="Shadow clings to you like a second skin, <name>. Have you brought the Shadow Decree? The Knights of Xoroth await their newest member.",c="暗影接受了你，<name>。现在你必须证明自己配得上克索诺斯的传承。\n\n克索诺斯骑士是活生生的证明：黑暗未必意味着邪恶。我们取来暗影——刺客与恶魔的工具——把它锻造成正义的器具。当圣骑士公开挥舞光明时，我们以同等的正直从黑暗中出击。作为克索诺斯骑士，你将明白荣誉能在暗影中繁盛，正义有时需要一把隐藏的利刃。\n\n你将掌握让你与黑暗合一的影锻铠甲、直击灵魂的纯粹暗影武器，以及让你穿越阴影跨越遥远距离的移动技艺。但比单纯的技艺更重要的是，你将学会我们教团的哲学——善恶不由我们使用的力量决定，而由我们选择如何使用它们决定。\n\n我们的敌人永远看不见我们的到来。腐败的贵族会在自己的卧室里被暗影呛死。恶魔邪教徒会发现黑暗本身反噬其身。暴君将学会畏惧自己投下的影子。你将变成邪恶往床底下查看的东西，猎杀其他噩梦的噩梦。\n\n欢迎加入克索诺斯骑士，<name>。让暗影成为正义最锋利的刀刃！",cEN="Shadow accepts you, <name>. Now you must prove yourself worthy of Xoroth's legacy.\n\nThe Knights of Xoroth are living proof that darkness need not mean evil. We have taken shadow, the tool of assassins and demons, and forged it into an instrument of justice. Where paladins wield light openly, we strike from darkness with equal righteousness. As a Knight of Xoroth, you will learn that honor can thrive in shadow, that justice sometimes requires a hidden blade.\n\nYou will master the shadow-forged armor that makes you one with darkness, weapons of pure shadow that strike at the very soul, and movement techniques that allow you to step through shadows across vast distances. But more than mere techniques, you will learn the philosophy of our order - that good and evil are not determined by the forces we wield, but by how we choose to wield them.\n\nOur enemies will never see us coming. Corrupt nobles will choke on shadows in their own bedchambers. Demon cultists will find darkness itself turned against them. Tyrants will learn to fear the very shadows they cast. You will become the thing that evil checks for under its bed, the nightmare that hunts other nightmares.\n\nWelcome to the Knights of Xoroth, <name>. Let shadow become justice's keenest blade!"}
Q[53006]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一块古老的骨制石板，刻着脉动死亡力量的死灵符号。号令亡者的技艺会自然而然地出现在那些亲身经历过死亡的人身上，似乎来自多纳尔·瘟疫编织者——他在丧钟镇掌握这些技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be an ancient bone tablet carved with necromantic symbols that pulse with deathly power. The art of commanding the dead comes naturally to those who have experienced death themselves, and it seems to be from Dornall Plagueweaver, who masters these arts in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找多纳尔·瘟疫编织者。",oEN="Seek out Dornall Plagueweaver in Deathknell.",p="死亡的寒意尾随你身后，<name>。你把死亡法典带来了吗？死灵法术的秘密正等待着配得上的人。",pEN="Death's chill follows in your wake, <name>. Have you brought the Death Codex? The secrets of necromancy await the worthy.",c="死亡向你屈服，<name>。这只是你统治的开始。\n\n死灵法术是力量的终极表现——对死亡本身的统治。别人看到终结，我们看到资源。别人哀悼死者，我们看到等待起身的军队。作为死灵法师，你将号令连最勇敢的战士都畏惧的力量，因为有什么军队能对抗一支每损失一员就变得更强的军队？\n\n你将学会探过帷幕，把灵魂拖回服务之中，把它们束缚在成为你傀儡的尸体上。普通的骷髅只是开始——你将从陨落的英雄中唤起死亡骑士，用多具尸体拼造憎恶，并召唤遮蔽天空的骨龙。瘟疫将成为你的先驱，散播的死亡会化为你军队的新兵。\n\n但死灵法术提供的不只是亡灵仆从。你将学会抽取生命力来治疗自己，一触之间让敌人化为尘土，并让自己部分踏入死亡——从而免疫痛苦、恐惧与其他凡人的弱点。你将同时行走于两个世界，在生者与亡者之间同样自在。\n\n欢迎进入死亡的统治，<name>。让必死性本身在你的意志前低头！",cEN="Death yields to you, <name>. This is only the beginning of your dominion.\n\nNecromancy is the ultimate expression of power - dominion over death itself. Where others see endings, we see resources. Where others mourn the fallen, we see armies waiting to rise. As a Necromancer, you will command forces that terrify even the bravest warriors, for what army can stand against one that grows stronger with every casualty?\n\nYou will learn to reach across the veil and drag souls back into service, binding them to corpses that become your puppets. Simple skeletons will be just the beginning - you'll raise death knights from fallen heroes, craft abominations from multiple corpses, and summon bone dragons that darken the sky. The plague will be your herald, spreading death that becomes fresh troops for your armies.\n\nBut necromancy offers more than mere undead servants. You'll learn to drain life force to heal yourself, to age enemies to dust with a touch, and to step partially into death yourself - becoming immune to pain, fear, and other mortal weaknesses. You will walk in two worlds simultaneously, equally at home among the living and the dead.\n\nWelcome to death's dominion, <name>. Let mortality itself bow before your will!"}
Q[53007]={d="有人让我把这事告诉你，年轻人。这似乎是一卷噼啪作响、满是原始元素之怒的卷轴，自然的力量被不朽的意志所束缚。\n\n这卷卷轴让我害怕，<name>，它不召唤我。不过，你的召唤似乎来自夸尔多米——他在丧钟镇弯折时间与空间。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a scroll that crackles with raw elemental fury, the forces of nature bound by undying will.\n\nThis scroll terrifies me, <name>, it does not call to me. However, your calling seems to come from Quardormi, who bends time and space in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找夸尔多米。",oEN="Seek out Quardormi in Deathknell.",p="时间本身在你周围弯折，<name>。你把时光卷轴带来了吗？计时器感知到了你的潜能。",pEN="Time itself bends around you, <name>. Have you brought the Temporal Scroll? The chronometer senses your potential.",c="时间承认你，<name>。过去、现在与未来都注意到了你的潜能。\n\n时光术法或许是所有魔法技艺中最复杂的，因为它所处理的力量是大多数心智无法正确构想的。时间不是别人以为的那条河流——它是一片海洋，有洋流、旋涡与深度，只有理解其本质的人才能航行其间。作为时光术士，你将学会逆着时间之流游动，潜入它的深处，并改变它的流向。\n\n你将掌握时间加速，移动快到让别人看起来如同冻结。你将学会时间倒转，通过逆转个人的时间线来消除伤口。预言的艺术将属于你——窥见可能的未来，并选择让哪些成为现实。你将在几秒内让物体衰老数千年，或通过逆转它们的熵让它们恢复如初。\n\n但时光术法真正的力量在于悖论的操纵。你将学会同时存在于多条时间线中，创造稳定的时间循环以确保战斗尚未开始你就已经获胜，甚至从不同时间线召唤你自己的替代版本。这份责任极其重大——一次粗心的改动就可能瓦解因果本身。\n\n欢迎获得无时之力，<name>。让过去、现在与未来随你的设计起舞！",cEN="Time acknowledges you, <name>. Past, present, and future have taken notice of your potential.\n\nChronomancy is perhaps the most complex of all magical arts, for it deals with forces that most minds cannot properly conceptualize. Time is not the river others believe it to be - it is an ocean with currents, eddies, and depths that can be navigated by those who understand its nature. As a Chronomancer, you will learn to swim against time's current, to dive into its depths, and to alter its flow.\n\nYou will master temporal acceleration, moving so quickly that others appear frozen. You'll learn temporal reversal, undoing wounds by reversing personal timestreams. The art of prophecy will be yours - glimpsing possible futures and choosing which ones to make reality. You'll age objects millennia in seconds, or restore them to pristine condition by reversing their entropy.\n\nBut the true power of chronomancy lies in paradox manipulation. You'll learn to exist in multiple timestreams simultaneously, to create stable time loops that ensure your victory before battles begin, and even to summon alternate versions of yourself from different timelines. The responsibility is immense - one careless alteration could unravel causality itself.\n\nWelcome to timeless power, <name>. Let past, present, and future dance to your design!"}
Q[53008]={d="有人让我把这事告诉你，年轻人。这似乎是一份冒着烟的手稿，燃烧着冰冷的火焰，那不发热却吞噬一切。死亡无法熄灭炎术师的火焰，只会把它转变成更可怖的东西，似乎来自卡德摩斯·余烬烈焰——他在丧钟镇号令这些死亡之火。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a smoldering manuscript that burns with cold fire, flames that consume without warmth. Death cannot extinguish the pyromancer's flame - it only transforms it into something far more terrifying, and it seems to be from Cadmus Emberblaze, who commands these deathly fires in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找卡德摩斯·余烬烈焰。",oEN="Seek out Cadmus Emberblaze in Deathknell.",p="烟与灰的气味宣告你的到来，<name>。你把焦灼典籍带来了吗？永恒之焰正在寻找新的主人。",pEN="The smell of smoke and ash announces you, <name>. Have you brought the Seared Tome? The eternal flame seeks a new master.",c="永恒之焰认出了同源的灵魂。你燃烧着潜能，<name>。\n\n火是最初的魔法，是把凡人提升到野兽之上的赠礼。但你要号令的火焰超越了简单的燃烧。作为炎术师，你将掌握火的一切形态——从维系生命的温柔暖意，到锻造星辰的宇宙炼狱。你的火焰将带着目的、分辨力与可怕的美感燃烧。\n\n你将学会召唤在水下燃烧的火、冻结而非灼烧的焰，以及能熔穿城堡墙壁的炎爆。凤凰的重生将属于你——被击倒时从你自己的灰烬中升起。你将号令活生生的火元素，创造能焚毁投射物的火焰屏障，并从晴朗的天空降下流星。你的精通将延伸到火焰的本源——在分子层面操纵热量，用微小的火花制造爆炸，或把火焰聚焦成能切开一切的束流。\n\n但在毁灭之外，你还会理解火在创造中的角色。塑造金属的锻炉之焰、让森林更新的受控焚烧、驱动激情与创造力的内心之火——都将由你点燃或熄灭。\n\n欢迎来到炼狱之心，<name>。让你的火焰重塑世界！",cEN="The eternal flame recognizes a kindred spirit. You burn with potential, <name>.\n\nFire was the first magic, the gift that elevated mortals above beasts. But the flames you will command transcend simple burning. As a Pyromancer, you will master fire in all its forms - from the gentle warmth that sustains life to the cosmic infernos that forge stars. Your flames will burn with purpose, discrimination, and terrible beauty.\n\nYou will learn to conjure fire that burns underwater, flames that freeze instead of burn, and pyroblasts that can melt through castle walls. The phoenix's rebirth will be yours - rising from your own ashes when struck down. You'll command living fire elementals, create flame barriers that incinerate projectiles, and rain meteors from clear skies. Your mastery will extend to flame's very essence - manipulating heat at the molecular level, creating explosions from tiny sparks, or focusing fire into beams that cut through anything.\n\nBut beyond destruction, you'll understand fire's role in creation. The forge's flame that shapes metal, the controlled burns that renew forests, the inner fire that drives passion and creativity - all will be yours to kindle or extinguish.\n\nWelcome to the inferno's heart, <name>. Let your flames reshape the world!"}
Q[53009]={d="有人让我把这事告诉你，年轻人。这似乎是一本皮面装订的典籍，上面留着早已死去的野兽的足迹，散发着腐朽与古老荒野的臭气。死亡并未终结游侠与荒野的联结——而是把它加深成了更黑暗的东西，似乎来自古斯塔夫·枯萎飞行——他在丧钟镇的阴影中潜行。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a leather-bound tome marked with tracks from beasts long dead, reeking of decay and ancient wilderness. Death does not end the ranger's connection to the wild - it deepens it into something darker, and it seems to be from Gustaf Blightflight, who stalks through shadow in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找古斯塔夫·枯萎飞行。",oEN="Seek out Gustaf Blightflight in Deathknell.",p="荒野已把你标记为它的人，<name>。你把猎人指南带来了吗？野兽能感觉到同源的灵魂。",pEN="The wild has marked you as its own, <name>. Have you brought the Hunter's Guide? The beasts sense a kindred spirit.",c="荒野已认领你为它的一员，<name>。听着——即便此刻，野兽也承认你的存在。\n\n游侠的道路是原始联结的道路。你将成为掠食者与守护者、追踪者与生存者，在文明的边缘与自然的核心同样自在。游侠与荒野之间的纽带不只是情感——它是一份比城市更古老的魔法契约，是同类灵魂之间的相互理解。\n\n你将掌握能穿过浓雾追踪鬼魂的追踪技艺、能在三百步外射穿麻雀眼睛的箭术，以及让你在军队都会饿死的地方繁荣生存的方法。野兽会回应你的召唤——从与你并肩作战的忠诚狼群，到充当你在天空中眼睛的巨鹰。你将学会在荒野中移动而不惊动一片叶子，隐藏得如此完美，以至于你与周围环境融为一体。\n\n不只是技能，你将培养出本能。你能在天气变化到来的数天前嗅到它，在伏击发动前感觉到它，像读一本心爱的书一样读懂大地。荒野将用只有猎人懂的语言对你说话——鸟儿的警报鸣叫、鹿的不安、掠食者的领地标记。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的狩猎，<name>。别让任何猎物逃过你的追捕！",cEN="The wild has claimed you as one of its own, <name>. Listen - even now, the beasts acknowledge your presence.\n\nThe ranger's path is one of primal connection. You will become predator and protector, tracker and survivor, equally at home in civilization's edges and nature's heart. The bond between ranger and wild is not mere sentiment - it is a magical compact older than cities, a mutual understanding between kindred spirits.\n\nYou will master tracking techniques that can follow a ghost through fog, archery skills that allow you to put an arrow through a sparrow's eye at three hundred paces, and survival methods that let you thrive where armies would starve. Beasts will answer your call - from loyal wolves who fight beside you to great eagles who serve as your eyes in the sky. You'll learn to move through wilderness without disturbing a single leaf, to hide so perfectly that you become one with your surroundings.\n\nMore than skills, you'll develop instincts. You'll smell weather changes days before they arrive, sense ambushes before they're sprung, and read the land like a beloved book. The wild will speak to you in languages only hunters understand - the alarm calls of birds, the nervousness of deer, the territorial markings of predators.\n\nWelcome to the eternal hunt, <name>. Let no quarry escape your pursuit!"}
Q[53010]={d="有人让我把这事告诉你，年轻人。这似乎是一块刻着闪耀符文的石板，脉动着不死的力量。符文大师的技艺超越必死性——他们的铭文在血肉腐烂之后仍长久存续，似乎来自威廉·巴尔蒂尔——他在丧钟镇雕刻这些永恒的符号。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a stone slab etched with glowing runes that pulse with deathless power. The runemaster's art transcends mortality - their inscriptions endure long after flesh has rotted away, and it seems to be from Wilhelm Balthier, who carves these eternal symbols in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找威廉·巴尔蒂尔。",oEN="Seek out Wilhelm Balthier in Deathknell.",p="符文力量从你身上散发出来，<name>。你把符文石板带来了吗？古老的铭文正等待着你的手。",pEN="Runic power emanates from you, <name>. Have you brought the Runic Tablet? The ancient inscriptions await your hand.",c="符文回应你的触碰，<name>。它们认出了那个能通过铭刻塑造现实的人。\n\n符文魔法先于一切其他形式的法术。当宇宙尚且年轻时，最初的词语被刻入现实本身的根基，一切魔法都从这些原始符文流出。作为符文大师，你将学会铭刻承载创世语言本身之重的符号，那些在其他一切魔法失效时仍然持存的印记。\n\n你将掌握把普通武器变成传说神器的战斗符文、能庇护整座城市的防护结界，以及改变附近物理基本定律的现实符文。你的铭文将按你的判断强化、腐化、净化或毁灭。出自你手的一枚符文就能赐予超人的力量、诅咒血脉数代，或在遥远之地之间开启传送门。\n\n这门技艺要求精准——一笔画错位置就能颠倒符文的含义，把治疗变成伤害，把防护变成脆弱。你将学会在任何表面上铭刻符文——石头、钢铁、血肉，甚至空气本身。符文大师能书写成套运作的完整符文阵列，创造出寻常魔法无法达成的复杂效果。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的铭刻，<name>。让你的印记重塑存在！",cEN="The runes respond to your touch, <name>. They recognize one who can shape reality through inscription.\n\nRunic magic predates all other forms of spellcraft. When the universe was young, the first words were carved into the foundations of reality itself, and from these primal runes, all magic flows. As a Runemaster, you will learn to inscribe symbols that carry the weight of creation's own language, marks that persist when all other magic fails.\n\nYou will master combat runes that turn simple weapons into legendary artifacts, protective wards that can shield entire cities, and reality runes that alter the fundamental laws of physics in their vicinity. Your inscriptions will enhance, corrupt, purify, or destroy as you see fit. A single rune from your hand can grant superhuman strength, curse bloodlines for generations, or create portals between distant locations.\n\nThe art demands precision - a single misplaced stroke can invert a rune's meaning, turning healing into harm, protection into vulnerability. You'll learn to inscribe runes on any surface - stone, steel, flesh, even air itself. Master runecrafters can write entire runic arrays that work in concert, creating effects too complex for ordinary magic to achieve.\n\nWelcome to eternal inscription, <name>. Let your marks reshape existence!"}
Q[53011]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份噼啪作响、满是幽灵闪电的文稿，雷声从彼岸的国度回响。风暴使者的风暴携带着亡者的声音，那些狂风以失落灵魂的怒火呼啸，似乎来自达伯特·斯塔兹——他在丧钟镇号令这些幽魂风暴。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a manuscript that crackles with spectral lightning, thunder echoing from the realm beyond. The stormbringer's tempests carry the voices of the dead, winds that howl with the fury of lost souls, and it seems to be from Dabbert Staze, who commands these ghostly storms in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="风暴云因你的存在而聚集，<name>。你把风暴文稿带来了吗？风暴正在召唤它的新主人。",pEN="Storm clouds gather at your presence, <name>. Have you brought the Storm Manuscript? The tempest calls to its new master.",c="风暴云因你的到来而聚拢，<name>。风暴已选出了它新的声音。\n\n号令风暴就是驾驭自然本身的怒火。闪电、雷声、风与雨——它们不只是天气现象，而是早在第一个凡人呼吸之前便已存在的原始力量的表达。作为风暴使者，你将学会从晴空中召来这些力量，说出风暴的语言，并驾驭闪电本身。\n\n你将召唤能夷平要塞的龙卷风，以精准到毫厘的准头召下闪电，并用能偏转箭矢与法术的狂风环绕自身。风暴之眼将是你的圣所——一个完美宁静之地，而混沌在你周围咆哮。你将学会变身为活体闪电，瞬间穿越战场，并把风暴的怒火储存在体内，以毁灭性的爆发释放出来。\n\n巨大的风暴将预示你的到来——不是巧合，而是因为大气本身回应你的存在。你将像读预言一样解读天气模式，感知气压中的扰动，从而揭示隐藏的敌人或逼近的危险。假以时日，你甚至可能学会创造永久的暴风，在受诅咒的土地上咆哮数百年。\n\n欢迎来到风暴之心，<name>。让雷声宣告你的胜利！",cEN="Storm clouds gather at your approach, <name>. The tempest has chosen its new voice.\n\nTo command storms is to wield nature's own fury. Lightning, thunder, wind, and rain - these are not mere weather phenomena, but expressions of primal power that existed before the first mortal drew breath. As a Stormbringer, you will learn to call these forces from clear skies, to speak the language of tempests, and to ride the lightning itself.\n\nYou will summon tornadoes that can level fortresses, call down lightning strikes with pinpoint accuracy, and surround yourself with winds that deflect arrows and spells alike. The eye of the storm will be your sanctuary - a place of perfect calm while chaos rages around you. You'll learn to transform into living lightning, traveling instantly across battlefields, and to store storm's fury within yourself, releasing it in devastating bursts.\n\nGreat storms will herald your approach - not by coincidence, but because the atmosphere itself responds to your presence. You'll read weather patterns like prophecy, sensing disturbances in air pressure that reveal hidden enemies or approaching danger. In time, you may even learn to create permanent storms, tempests that rage for centuries over cursed lands.\n\nWelcome to the storm's heart, <name>. Let thunder announce your victories!"}
Q[53012]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份金色的经文，散发着苍白的光芒，是透过死亡帷幕滤过的神圣能量。即便是亡灵也能引导太阳的力量，把神圣之光变成既美丽又可怖的东西，似乎来自太阳言者塔莱西亚——她在丧钟镇维持着这种矛盾的信仰。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a golden scripture that glows with pale light, divine energy filtered through the veil of death. Even the undead can channel the sun's power, transforming sacred light into something both beautiful and terrible, and it seems to be from Sunspeaker Talethia, who maintains this paradoxical faith in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找太阳言者塔莱西亚。",oEN="Seek out Sunspeaker Talethia in Deathknell.",p="神圣的光辉照亮你的道路，<name>。你把太阳经文带来了吗？太阳的祝福正等待着虔信者。",pEN="Divine radiance illuminates your path, <name>. Have you brought the Solar Scripture? The sun's blessing awaits the faithful.",c="黎明的第一缕阳光已触碰了你，<name>。如今你永远在体内携带着那份光。\n\n太阳魔法是凡人可及的神圣力量最纯粹的表达。太阳慷慨地给予——光、温暖、生命本身——不求任何回报。作为太阳祭司，你将成为这份慷慨的导体，引导既能治疗、保护，又在必要时以千个太阳之怒毁灭的光辉。\n\n你将学会在体内储存阳光，在最黑暗之处成为灯塔。你的治疗之光将治愈伤口、驱除疾病，甚至让新近倒下者重获生命。太阳护盾将保护你的盟友，而太阳耀斑将致盲并灼烧你的敌人。天顶祝福将让你召下集中的阳光之柱，穿透一切黑暗、一切邪恶、一切阴影。\n\n但太阳魔法不止于单纯的光。你将理解太阳在一切生命中的角色——植物的光合作用、皮肤中维生素的生成、支配睡眠与清醒的昼夜节律。你将学会加速生长，为疲惫者注入活力，把白昼的清明带给困惑的心智。在你面前，亡灵会枯萎，阴影会逃散，最绝望的心中也会燃起希望。\n\n欢迎加入光辉的侍奉，<name>。让你的光驱散一切黑暗！",cEN="The sun's first ray at dawn has touched you, <name>. You carry that light within you now, forever.\n\nSolar magic is the purest expression of divine power accessible to mortals. The sun gives freely - light, warmth, life itself - asking nothing in return. As a Sun Cleric, you will become a conduit for this generosity, channeling radiance that heals, protects, and when necessary, destroys with the fury of a thousand suns.\n\nYou will learn to store sunlight within yourself, becoming a beacon in the darkest places. Your healing light will mend wounds, cure diseases, and even restore life to the recently fallen. Solar shields will protect your allies, while solar flares blind and burn your enemies. The zenith blessing will allow you to call down pillars of concentrated sunlight that can pierce through any darkness, any evil, any shadow.\n\nBut solar magic extends beyond simple light. You'll understand the sun's role in all life - photosynthesis in plants, vitamin creation in skin, the circadian rhythms that govern sleep and waking. You'll learn to accelerate growth, to energize the weary, and to bring the clarity of daylight to confused minds. In your presence, undead wither, shadows flee, and hope kindles in the most desperate hearts.\n\nWelcome to radiant service, <name>. Let your light banish all darkness!"}
Q[53013]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是一份受祝福的文件，散发着冰冷的光芒，是连坟墓之外都受约束的神圣誓言。圣殿骑士对正义的献身超越生死，创造出在不死之身中侍奉正直的勇士，似乎来自瓦埃里昂·大钟——他在丧钟镇坚守这些神圣职责。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a blessed document that emanates cold light, holy vows that bind even beyond the grave. The templar's dedication to justice transcends life and death, creating champions who serve righteousness in undeath, and it seems to be from Vaelion Grandbell, who upholds these sacred duties in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找瓦埃里昂·大钟。",oEN="Seek out Vaelion Grandbell in Deathknell.",p="你对正义的投入显而易见，<name>。你把神圣誓言带来了吗？圣光正在寻找新的勇士。",pEN="Your commitment to justice is palpable, <name>. Have you brought the Sacred Vow? The Light seeks a new champion.",c="你的信念有分量，<name>。圣光本身见证了你的誓言，并认定你配得上。\n\n圣殿骑士的道路把武艺与神圣目的结合在一起。你不只是一个恰好有信仰的战士——你是信仰的具现，是正义的血肉之身，是披甲执锐的正直。你剑刃的每一次打击都承载着神圣审判的分量。你举起的每一面盾牌都矗立成对抗邪恶本身的壁垒。\n\n你将掌握增强打击、削弱敌人意志的战斗祷言。神圣武器附魔将使你的手臂燃烧着圣火，灼烧腐化者而让无辜者毫发无伤。神圣铠甲技艺将以圣光本身环绕你，挡开物理与魔法的攻击。你将学会古老的驱邪仪式，那些放逐恶魔、净化人、地点与物品之腐化的言语。\n\n你的存在将成为战斗中的集结之处——盟友会因知道有一位圣殿骑士与他们同在而战得更勇猛，敌人则会在你正义的怒火前动摇。你将培养出感知一切形态之邪恶的能力，看穿伪装与幻象，找到其下道德层面的真相。假以时日，你甚至可能学会直接召下神圣审判——只灼烧有罪者的圣火。\n\n欢迎加入神圣的侍奉，<name>。让正义指引你的剑刃！",cEN="Your conviction has weight, <name>. The Light itself has witnessed your oath and found you worthy.\n\nThe templar's path combines martial prowess with divine purpose. You are not merely a warrior who happens to have faith - you are faith given form, justice made flesh, righteousness armed and armored. Every strike of your blade carries the weight of divine judgment. Every shield you raise stands as a bulwark against evil itself.\n\nYou will master combat prayers that strengthen your blows and weaken your enemies' resolve. Holy weapon enchantments will make your arms burn with sacred fire that sears the corrupt while leaving the innocent unharmed. The divine armor technique will surround you with light itself, turning aside both physical and magical attacks. You'll learn the ancient rites of exorcism, the words that banish demons and cleanse corruption from people, places, and objects.\n\nYour presence will become a rallying point in battle - allies will fight harder knowing a templar stands with them, while enemies will falter before your righteous fury. You'll develop the ability to sense evil in all its forms, to see through disguises and illusions to the moral truth beneath. In time, you may even learn to call down divine judgment directly - holy fire that burns only the guilty.\n\nWelcome to sacred service, <name>. Let justice guide your blade!"}
Q[53014]={d="有人让我把这个交给你，年轻人。这似乎是在防腐处理的皮肤上绘制的技术图纸，由死灵能量驱动的机械设计。死亡为发明带来了新的视角——以灵魂能量而非蒸汽运转的机械，似乎来自莱利·杰特——他在丧钟镇创造这些奇迹。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be technical blueprints drawn on preserved skin, mechanical designs powered by necromantic energy. Death brings new perspectives to invention - machinery that runs on soul energy rather than steam, and it seems to be from Riley Jett, who creates these marvels in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找莱利·杰特。",oEN="Seek out Riley Jett in Deathknell.",p="创新的火花在你体内燃烧，<name>。你把机械蓝图带来了吗？齿轮与魔法正等待着你的天才。",pEN="The spark of innovation burns within you, <name>. Have you brought the Mechanical Schematic? Gears and magic await your genius.",c="齿轮在你触碰下转动，魔法火花在你触碰下迸发，<name>。别人看到不可能，你看到可能性。\n\n工匠的技艺存在于魔法与科技的交汇处，证明创新与奥术力量不必彼此分离。你将建造本不该存在的装置、以嘲弄自然法则的原理运转的机械，以及能解决他人视为无解之难题的小器具。\n\n你将学会制作能独立思考与行动的机械仆从、能夷平城市街区的炸药，或能从墙上取下单块砖石的手术式装药。你的发明将包括能从小装置中瞬间展开的护盾、能在多种构型间变换的武器，以及能穿透墙壁、幻象甚至跨越维度感知的侦测设备。魔法与机械的融合将让你创造出永动机、产出能量多于消耗的装置，以及能随时间自我修复与改进的装备。\n\n你的工坊将成为奇迹与恐怖的所在——永不眨眼的机械眼、永不停止的蒸汽心脏，以及模糊了造物与活物界限的混种生物。你不仅会懂得如何建造，还会懂得如何创新，如何看见别人忽略的联系，如何以对普遍原理的创造性应用来解决问题。\n\n欢迎加入无尽的创新，<name>。让你的造物重新定义何为可能！",cEN="Gears turn and magic sparks at your touch, <name>. You see possibilities where others see impossibility.\n\nThe tinker's art exists at the intersection of magic and technology, proving that innovation and arcane power need not stand apart. You will build devices that shouldn't exist, machines that operate on principles that make mockings of natural law, and gadgets that solve problems others consider unsolvable.\n\nYou will learn to craft mechanical minions that think and act independently, explosives that can level city blocks or surgical charges that remove single bricks from walls. Your inventions will include shields that deploy instantly from small devices, weapons that transform between multiple configurations, and detection equipment that can sense through walls, illusions, and even between dimensions. The fusion of magic and machinery will allow you to create perpetual motion machines, devices that generate more energy than they consume, and equipment that repairs and improves itself over time.\n\nYour workshop will become a place of wonders and horrors - mechanical eyes that never blink, steam-powered hearts that never stop, and hybrid creatures that blur the line between construct and living being. You'll understand not just how to build, but how to innovate, to see connections others miss, to solve problems with creative applications of universal principles.\n\nWelcome to endless innovation, <name>. Let your creations redefine what's possible!"}
Q[53015]={d="有人让我提请你注意这件事，年轻人。这似乎是一本散发着异域毒药臭气的典籍，绿色蒸气从处理过的血肉书页间渗出。亡灵比任何活物都更懂毒素——死亡传授了关于毒药与腐朽的终极一课，似乎来自毒液收集者彭多——他在丧钟镇调制这些致命化合物。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a tome reeking of exotic poisons, green vapors seeping between pages of treated flesh. The undead understand toxins better than any living being - death teaches the ultimate lesson about poison and decay, and it seems to be from Venom Collector Pendo, who brews these deadly compounds in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找毒液收集者彭多。",oEN="Seek out Venom Collector Pendo in Deathknell.",p="异域毒液的气息先于你而至，<name>。你把毒药配方带来了吗？通过毒素的蜕变正等待着你。",pEN="The scent of exotic venoms precedes you, <name>. Have you brought the Venom Formula? Transformation through toxins awaits.",c="毒液在向你歌唱，<name>。每一种毒素都有自己的声音、自己的目的、自己可怕的美感。\n\n剧毒术法是借毒性达成蜕变的技艺。单纯致死的毒药只是儿戏——你将学会调制重塑身心、使其进化或退化、解锁隐藏潜能或封存力量的毒液。自然中的每一种物质都能成为你军械库中的工具，从最致命的蛇毒到不起眼的蜂刺。\n\n你将掌握制造即时生效或潜伏数年的毒素、只影响特定血脉或物种的毒药，以及像疾病一样在整个人群中传播的毒液。但毁灭只是你技艺的一半——你还会调制能治愈任何毒药的解药、赋予暂时超人能力的兴奋剂，以及造成永久良性突变的诱变剂。\n\n你自己的身体将成为活体实验室。你将发展出对一切已知毒素的免疫，同时学会通过皮肤、呼吸甚至目光分泌毒液。最高明的修行者能毒化抽象的概念——腐化记忆、污染情绪，或让魔法本身中毒。你将理解药物与毒药之间那条细细的界线，以及剂量如何决定一种物质是治愈还是伤害。\n\n欢迎踏上毒药之路，<name>。让化学在你手中变成炼金术！",cEN="The venoms sing to you, <name>. Each toxin has its own voice, its own purpose, its own terrible beauty.\n\nVenomancy is the art of transformation through toxicity. Simple poisons that merely kill are child's play - you will learn to brew venoms that reshape body and mind, that evolve or devolve, that unlock hidden potential or seal away power. Every substance in nature can become a tool in your arsenal, from the deadliest snake venom to the humble bee sting.\n\nYou will master the creation of toxins that work instantly or lie dormant for years, poisons that affect only specific bloodlines or species, and venoms that spread like diseases through entire populations. But destruction is only half your art - you'll also brew antidotes that can cure any poison, stimulants that grant temporary superhuman abilities, and mutagens that cause permanent beneficial transformations.\n\nYour own body will become a living laboratory. You'll develop immunity to all known toxins while learning to secrete venoms through your skin, breath, or even your gaze. The most advanced practitioners can poison abstract concepts - corrupting memories, tainting emotions, or toxifying magic itself. You'll understand the thin line between medicine and poison, how dosage determines whether a substance heals or harms.\n\nWelcome to the poison path, <name>. Let chemistry become alchemy in your hands!"}
Q[53016]={d="有人让我提请你注意这件事，年轻人。这似乎是一卷装饰着骨与黑暗图腾的古老卷轴，嗡鸣着不安灵魂的力量。巫医的技艺通过古老仪式连接生与死，似乎来自暗影行者沃斯——他在丧钟镇修行这些神秘技艺。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be an ancient scroll decorated with bones and dark fetishes, humming with the power of restless spirits. The witch doctor's art bridges life and death through ancient rituals, and it seems to be from Shadow-Walker Voss, who practices these mystical arts in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找暗影行者沃斯。",oEN="Seek out Shadow-Walker Voss in Deathknell.",p="灵魂在低语你的到来，<name>。你把灵魂图腾带来了吗？彼岸在召唤。",pEN="The spirits whisper of your arrival, <name>. Have you brought the Spirit Fetish? The other side beckons.",c="灵魂们低语着你的名字，<name>。它们一直在等你。\n\n巫医行走于诸世界之间，在生者与亡者之间同样自在。你将成为诸国度之间的桥梁、为无声灵魂发声的代言者、号令存在于凡人感知之外的力量的指挥官。这门古老的技艺先于文明本身，诞生于最初的凡人意识到死亡并非终结、而是一种转变之时。\n\n你将学会看见并对他人不可见的灵魂说话，通过自己的身体引导它们的知识与力量。祖先的灵魂将指引你的决断，幽魂战士将与你并肩作战，诸时代的智慧将像水一样流经你。你将掌握以灵魂之苦诅咒敌人的妖术、抵御附身的护符，以及能困住或放逐哪怕最强大灵魂的仪式。\n\n你的工具既原始又深邃——容纳灵魂盟友的图腾、召唤亡者起舞的鼓，以及让你承袭强大灵魂实体特质的假面。你将学会以肉身进入灵魂国度，航行于它奇异的地貌，并与从未知晓凡人形态的实体讨价还价。假以时日，你甚至可能学会让自己成为活着的灵魂，同时存在于多个国度之中。\n\n欢迎踏上灵魂之路，<name>。让诸世界之间的帷幕在你面前分开！",cEN="The spirits whisper your name, <name>. They have been waiting for you.\n\nThe witch doctor walks between worlds, equally at home among the living and the dead. You will become a bridge between realms, a speaker for spirits who have no voice, a commander of forces that exist just beyond mortal perception. This ancient art predates civilization itself, born when the first mortals realized that death was not an ending but a transformation.\n\nYou will learn to see and speak with spirits invisible to others, to channel their knowledge and power through your own body. Ancestral spirits will guide your decisions, ghostly warriors will fight at your side, and the wisdom of the ages will flow through you like water. You'll master hexes that curse enemies with spiritual afflictions, wards that protect against possession, and rituals that can trap or banish even the most powerful spirits.\n\nYour tools will be both primitive and profound - fetishes that house spirit allies, drums that call the dead to dance, and masks that let you assume the aspects of powerful spirit entities. You'll learn to enter the spirit realm physically, to navigate its strange geography, and to bargain with entities that have never known mortal form. In time, you may even learn to become a living spirit yourself, existing simultaneously in multiple realms.\n\nWelcome to the spirit path, <name>. Let the veil between worlds part before you!"}
Q[53017]={d="有人让我提请你注意这件事，年轻人。这似乎是一封盖着审判庭炽热蜡印的密封信函。既然你亲身经历过蜕变，你便能分辨自然的进化与真正的腐化，似乎来自贝利·憎恨之祸——他在丧钟镇以完美的正义进行狩猎。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be a sealed letter bearing the burning wax seal of the Inquisition. Having experienced transformation firsthand, you can distinguish between natural evolution and true corruption, and it seems to be from Bailey Horrorhate, who hunts with perfect justice in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="在丧钟镇寻找贝利·憎恨之祸。",oEN="Seek out Bailey Horrorhate in Deathknell.",p="正义的决心在你眼中燃烧，<name>。你把审判官的信函带来了吗？对腐化的狩猎永无止境。",pEN="Righteous determination burns in your eyes, <name>. Have you brought the Inquisitor's Letter? The hunt for corruption never ends.",c="狩猎现在开始，<name>。腐化有了新的掠食者要畏惧。\n\n猎魔人的担子沉重，却必不可少。你将成为切除感染的刀刃、净化腐化的火焰、看穿一切欺瞒的毫不动摇之眼。别人或许会对腐化者心怀怜悯，而你明白，有时候最仁慈的一刀就是致命一击。你的职责是通过清除他人太软弱或太盲目而无法识别的威胁，来保护无辜者。\n\n你将掌握专门为对抗黑暗力量而设计的技艺。灼烧腐化者的银制武器、揭示隐藏邪恶的圣水，以及阻止黑暗魔法扎根的护符。你将发展出近乎超自然的腐化侦测能力——女巫的诅咒、恶魔的影响，或虚空腐化那隐蔽的污痕。你的训练将包括抵抗精神操控、免疫诅咒，以及仅凭存在就破除附魔的能力。\n\n你将学会区分无害的乡野术士与真正的威胁，区分那些可以被救赎的人与必须被消灭的人。猎魔人最伟大的技能是判断——知道何时出击，何时按兵不动。你将汇集关于每一种腐化形态的知识，建立一座威胁及其弱点的脑中图书馆。假以时日，你的名字本身将成为抵御邪恶的护符，被父母念诵以保护孩子，被腐化者带着恐惧低声提起。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的狩猎，<name>。别让任何邪恶逃过你的视线！",cEN="The hunt begins now, <name>. Corruption has a new predator to fear.\n\nThe witch hunter's burden is heavy but necessary. You will become the blade that cuts out infection, the fire that purifies corruption, the unwavering eye that sees through all deception. Where others might show mercy to the corrupted, you understand that sometimes the kindest cut is the killing blow. Your duty is to protect the innocent by eliminating threats others are too weak or blind to recognize.\n\nYou will master techniques specifically designed to combat the forces of darkness. Silver weapons that burn the corrupted, holy water that reveals hidden evil, and wards that prevent dark magic from taking hold. You'll develop an almost supernatural sense for detecting corruption - a witch's curse, a demon's influence, or the subtle taint of void corruption. Your training will include resistance to mental manipulation, immunity to curses, and the ability to break enchantments with your mere presence.\n\nYou'll learn to distinguish between harmless hedge wizards and genuine threats, between those who can be redeemed and those who must be eliminated. The witch hunter's greatest skill is judgment - knowing when to strike and when to stay your hand. You'll compile knowledge of every form of corruption, creating a mental library of threats and their weaknesses. In time, your very name will become a ward against evil, spoken by parents to protect their children, whispered by the corrupt in fear.\n\nWelcome to the eternal hunt, <name>. Let no evil escape your sight!"}
Q[53201]={d="有人让我提请你注意这件事，年轻人。这似乎是一张空灵的星图，上面的星图闪烁着真正的星光，脉动着来自遥远星系的宇宙之力。唤星者的道路开启了天界的奥秘，它来自兰德拉拉尼斯——他在丧钟镇号令星辰之力。在你继续这里的事务之前，我不会犹豫先读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young one. It appears to be an ethereal chart containing star maps that twinkle with actual starlight, pulsing with cosmic power from distant galaxies. The way of the Starcaller opens celestial mysteries, and it comes from Landralanis, who commands stellar forces in Deathknell. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="阅读星图，在丧钟镇寻找兰德拉拉尼斯。",oEN="Read the Stellar Chart and seek out Landralanis in Deathknell.",p="你好，<name>。你有什么要给我吗？",pEN="Greetings, <name>. Have you something for me?",c="群星指引你来到我面前，<name>。我感觉到宇宙能量在你体内涌动。\n\n作为唤星者，你将号令先于凡人文明的力量。夜空将成为你的魔典，星座成为你的法术。你将把星光引导成毁灭性的光束，召下流星雨砸向敌人，并借由携带着遥远星系低语的星风航行。\n\n宇宙浩瀚而永恒，充满超越凡人理解的力量。古老的星辰之神曾驾驭这些同样的力量来塑造现实本身。如今它们的知识流经你身。\n\n欢迎掌握星辰之力。宇宙本身将屈从于你的意志！",cEN="The stars have guided you to me, <name>. I sense the cosmic energies stirring within you.\n\nAs a Starcaller, you will command forces that predate mortal civilization. The night sky becomes your grimoire, constellations your spells. You will channel starlight into devastating beams, call down meteor showers upon your enemies, and navigate by stellar winds that carry the whispers of distant galaxies.\n\nThe cosmos is vast and eternal, filled with powers beyond mortal comprehension. Ancient star-gods once wielded these same forces to shape reality itself. Now their knowledge flows through you.\n\nWelcome to stellar mastery. The universe itself bends to your will!"}
Q[55000]={d="啊……这块水晶……我见过类似的东西……虽然我对它只有零碎的记忆。曾经有一座祭坛，拥有在战斗中重塑我们装备的力量。它给了我们扭转战局所需的那份优势。战争结束后，我试图为联盟认领那座祭坛。我找了又找，可它不见了。被那些想要保护它力量的人藏了起来。真希望能告诉你更多。\n\n拿着这个，英雄。那场久被遗忘的战争的一件信物。\n\n保持坚强，保持忠诚。为了联盟！",dEN="Ah.. this crystal... I've seen its like before... Though, I have only fleeting memories of it. There was once an Altar with the power to reforge our gear in battle. It gave us the advantage we needed to turn the tide of the war. When the war ended, I sought to claim the Altar for the Alliance. I searched and searched, but it was gone. Hidden by those who wished to protect its power. I wish I could tell you more.\n\nTake this, Hero. A token of that long-forgotten war.\n\nStay strong, stay true. For the Alliance!",o="与元帅阿夫拉西亚比交谈，领取一枚重铸徽记。",oEN="Speak to Field Marshal Afrasiabi to receive a Reforge Token."}
Q[55001]={d="啊……这块水晶……我见过类似的东西……虽然我对它只有零碎的记忆。曾经有一座祭坛，拥有在战斗中重塑我们装备的力量。它给了我们扭转战局所需的那份优势。战争结束后，我试图为部落认领那座祭坛。我找了又找，可它不见了。被那些想要保护它力量的人藏了起来。真希望能告诉你更多。\n\n拿着这个，英雄。那场久被遗忘的战争的一件信物。\n\n保持坚强，保持忠诚。为了部落！",dEN="Ah.. this crystal... I've seen its like before... Though, I have only fleeting memories of it. There was once an Altar with the power to reforge our gear in battle. It gave us the advantage we needed to turn the tide of the war. When the war ended, I sought to claim the Altar for the Horde. I searched and searched, but it was gone. Hidden by those who wished to protect its power. I wish I could tell you more.\n\nTake this, Hero. A token of that long-forgotten war.\n\nStay strong, stay true. FOR THE HORDE!",o="与大领主伦萨克交谈，领取一枚重铸徽记。",oEN="Speak to Overlord Runthak to receive a Reforge Token."}
Q[55100]={d="<name>，你完成了第一次狩猎，证明了自己的价值。如今你面前的道路分岔了——你必须选择自己的命运。\n\n这本焦灼典籍是学徒亚克·洛雷格因留给你的。甚至在你出生之前，他就感知到你灵魂中燃烧的火焰。炎术师的道路召唤着那些想要掌握火焰本身的人。\n\n把这本典籍带到纳拉奇营地交给他。他将指引你走上永恒之焰的道路。",dEN="<name>, you have completed your first hunt and proven yourself worthy. The path before you now diverges - you must choose your destiny.\n\nThis Seared Tome was left for you by Apprentice Yahk Loregrain. He sensed the fire burning within your spirit even before your birth. The way of the Pyromancer calls to those who would master flame itself.\n\nTake this tome to him in Camp Narache. He will guide you down the path of eternal fire.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找学徒亚克·洛雷格因。",oEN="Seek out Apprentice Yahk Loregrain in Camp Narache.",p="火焰在你眼中舞动，<name>。你把焦灼典籍带来了吗？永恒之焰在召唤。",pEN="Fire dances in your eyes, <name>. Have you brought the Seared Tome? The eternal flame beckons.",c="永恒之焰在你身上认出了同源的灵魂，<name>。\n\n火对牛头人是神圣的——从我们的仪式火焰到安舍本身。作为炎术师，你将驾驭一切形态的火焰。你将召唤在水下燃烧的火，制造能夷平要塞的爆炸，并从晴朗的天空降下流星。\n\n你的火焰将带着目的与分辨力燃烧。你将理解火的双重本性——毁灭与创造、混沌与新生。掌握火球术，学会炎爆术，最终号令凤凰本身。\n\n欢迎来到炼狱之心。让你的火焰重塑世界！",cEN="The eternal flame recognizes a kindred spirit in you, <name>.\n\nFire is sacred to the Tauren - from our ceremonial flames to An'she himself. As a Pyromancer, you will wield flame in all its forms. You will conjure fire that burns underwater, create explosions that level fortresses, and rain meteors from clear skies.\n\nYour flames will burn with purpose and discrimination. You will understand fire's dual nature - destruction and creation, chaos and renewal. Master the Fireball, learn the Pyroblast, and eventually command the Phoenix itself.\n\nWelcome to the inferno's heart. Let your flames reshape the world!"}
Q[55101]={d="<name>，你的狩猎结束了，但一条更黑暗的道路在向你招手。很少有牛头人敢走我即将提供给你的这条路。\n\n这份虚空手稿是乌尔莎·梦锄留下的，她行走在大多数人不敢涉足的阴影中。她在你身上看到了某种东西——为了更大的善而拥抱禁忌知识的意愿。\n\n如果你有勇气聆听帷幕之外的低语，就把这份手稿带到纳拉奇营地交给她。但要知道，有些知识一旦学会便无法忘却。",dEN="<name>, your hunt is complete, but a darker path beckons. Few Tauren would dare what I am about to offer you.\n\nThis Void Manuscript was left by Ultha Dreamharrow, one who walks in shadows most fear to tread. She has seen something in you - a willingness to embrace forbidden knowledge for the greater good.\n\nIf you have the courage to hear whispers from beyond the veil, take this manuscript to her in Camp Narache. But know that some knowledge cannot be unlearned.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找乌尔莎·梦锄。",oEN="Seek out Ultha Dreamharrow in Camp Narache.",p="虚空低语着你的名字，<name>。你把虚空手稿带来了吗？古老的力量正在骚动。",pEN="The void whispers your name, <name>. Have you brought the Void Manuscript? Ancient powers stir.",c="你听见了来自彼岸的低语，<name>。并非所有牛头人都敢走上这条路。\n\n虚空提供的力量先于大地母亲，那是创世本身之前的知识。作为邪教徒，你将把疯狂引导成魔法，在混沌中看见真相，并与本不该存在的实体交流。上古之神的影响从现实的裂缝中渗出。\n\n你将掌握虚空箭，学会传播疯狂，并打开通往超乎一切理解之维度的裂隙。你的理智将不断受到考验，但作为回报，你获得了超越凡人局限的力量。\n\n欢迎投入虚空的怀抱。让现实屈从于你的意志！",cEN="You have heard the whispers from beyond, <name>. Not all Tauren would dare this path.\n\nThe void offers power that predates the Earthmother, knowledge from before creation itself. As a Cultist, you will channel madness into magic, see truth in chaos, and commune with entities that should not exist. The Old Gods' influence seeps through reality's cracks.\n\nYou will master Void Bolt, learn to spread Madness, and open rifts to dimensions beyond comprehension. Your sanity will be constantly tested, but in return, you gain power that transcends mortal limits.\n\nWelcome to the void's embrace. Let reality bend to your will!"}
Q[55102]={d="<name>，你已证明自己是一名猎人，但最伟大的奥秘不在平原上，而在头顶的天穹。\n\n奥科乌涅，洛修的天选者，专门为你留下了这张天界星图。她读过群星，看见你的命运写在尚未命名的星座之中。唤星者的道路很古老，甚至先于我们最古老的传统。\n\n当群星明亮时，把这张星图带到纳拉奇营地交给她。她将教你号令宇宙本身。",dEN="<name>, you have proven yourself as a hunter, but the greatest mysteries lie not on the plains, but in the heavens above.\n\nOko'une, Chosen of Lo'sho left this Celestial Chart specifically for you. She has read the stars and seen your destiny written in constellations yet to be named. The way of the Starcaller is ancient, predating even our oldest traditions.\n\nTake this chart to her in Camp Narache when the stars are bright. She will teach you to command the very cosmos.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找洛修的天选者奥科乌涅。",oEN="Seek out Oko'une, Chosen of Lo'sho in Camp Narache.",p="群星为你排列，<name>。你把天界星图带来了吗？宇宙之力正等待着你。",pEN="The stars align for you, <name>. Have you brought the Celestial Chart? Cosmic power awaits.",c="群星选中了你，<name>。姆沙与安舍只是开始。\n\n作为唤星者，你从天体汲取力量——星辰、月亮、彗星，以及凡人视线之外的宇宙现象。夜空将成为你的魔典，星座成为你的法术。你将把星光引导成毁灭性的光束，召下流星雨，并借由星风航行。\n\n牛头人一向观测天空以寻求预兆。而你走得更远——你号令群星本身。掌握星辰坠落，学会天界排列，最终召唤遥远星系的力量。\n\n欢迎掌握宇宙之力。让宇宙本身回应你的召唤！",cEN="The stars have chosen you, <name>. Mu'sha and An'she are but the beginning.\n\nAs a Starcaller, you draw power from celestial bodies - stars, moons, comets, and cosmic phenomena beyond mortal sight. The night sky becomes your grimoire, constellations your spells. You will channel starlight into devastating beams, call down meteor showers, and navigate by stellar winds.\n\nThe Tauren have always watched the sky for omens. You go further - you command the very stars themselves. Master Starfall, learn Celestial Alignment, and eventually summon the power of distant galaxies.\n\nWelcome to cosmic mastery. Let the universe itself answer your call!"}
Q[55103]={d="<name>，你成功的狩猎引起了太阳本身的注意。你在近旁时，安舍的光芒更加明亮。\n\n逐日者雷角为你留下了这份太阳祷文，由安舍本身的光辉祝福。他已预见你将成为黑暗中的希望灯塔——那黑暗正威胁着我们的世界。\n\n把这份祷文带到纳拉奇营地交给他。太阳祭司的道路在等着你——你将把光明本身既当作武器，也当作盾牌。",dEN="<name>, your successful hunt has caught the attention of the sun itself. An'she's light grows brighter when you are near.\n\nSunwalker Thunderhorn left this Sun Prayer for you, blessed by An'she's own radiance. He has foreseen that you will become a beacon of hope in the darkness that threatens our world.\n\nCarry this prayer to him in Camp Narache. The path of the Sun Cleric awaits - you will wield light itself as both weapon and shield.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找逐日者雷角。",oEN="Seek out Sunwalker Thunderhorn in Camp Narache.",p="安舍的光照耀着你，<name>。你把太阳祷文带来了吗？神圣的光辉正等待着你。",pEN="An'she's light shines upon you, <name>. Have you brought the Sun Prayer? Divine radiance awaits.",c="安舍的祝福照耀着你，<name>。\n\n逐日者们重新发现了古老的方式。作为太阳祭司，你引导神圣的太阳光辉去治愈伤口、驱除疾病、烧尽腐化。你成为黑暗中的希望灯塔，以安舍的力量守护与行义。\n\n你将学会以太阳光束灼烧敌人、以治疗之光修复盟友、以太阳祝福激发希望。亡灵会逃离你的存在，阴影会在你的光前退散。\n\n欢迎加入光辉的侍奉。让你的光刺穿一切黑暗！",cEN="An'she's blessing shines upon you, <name>.\n\nThe Sunwalkers have rediscovered ancient ways. As a Sun Cleric, you channel divine solar radiance to heal wounds, cure diseases, and burn away corruption. You become a beacon of hope in darkness, wielding An'she's power for protection and justice.\n\nYou will learn Solar Beam to sear enemies, Healing Light to mend allies, and Sun's Blessing to inspire hope. The undead flee your presence, shadows retreat from your light.\n\nWelcome to radiant service. Let your light pierce all darkness!"}
Q[55104]={d="<name>，在你狩猎时，古老的石头本身低语着你的名字。你经过时，古老的方式便骚动起来。\n\n戈罗，最古老传统的守护者，为你留下了这块符文石。它上面的每一道刻痕都刻于第一个萨满与元素交谈之前，刻于第一个德鲁伊对自然歌唱之前。符文大师的道路是我们族人所知最古老的力量之路。\n\n到纳拉奇营地去找他。他将教你铭刻现实本身。",dEN="<name>, the ancient stones themselves whispered your name during your hunt. The old ways stir when you pass.\n\nGo'hro, keeper of the eldest traditions, left this Rune Stone for you. Each mark upon it was carved before the first shaman spoke to the elements, before the first druid sang to nature. The way of the Runemaster is the oldest path of power our people know.\n\nSeek him out in Camp Narache. He will teach you to inscribe reality itself.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找戈罗。",oEN="Seek out Go'hro in Camp Narache.",p="符文力量从你身上散发出来，<name>。你把牛头人符文石带来了吗？古老的铭文正等待着你。",pEN="Runic power emanates from you, <name>. Have you brought the Tauren Rune Stone? Ancient inscriptions await.",c="古老的符文回应你的存在，<name>。\n\n早在萨满教或德鲁伊教之前，牛头人就在雕刻符文。这些符号先于语言——它们是获得了形态的纯粹概念。作为符文大师，你创造的每一道铭文都引导着特定的力量，在其他魔法消散之后仍长久存续。\n\n你将学会用于防御的防护符文、用于强化武器的力量符文，以及用于困住敌人的束缚符文。精准就是一切——一条画错位置的线就会改变一切。你的印记将存续数千年。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的铭刻。让你的符文重塑现实！",cEN="The ancient runes respond to your presence, <name>.\n\nLong before shamanism or druidism, the Tauren carved runes. These symbols predate language - they are pure concept given form. As a Runemaster, each inscription you create channels specific powers that persist long after other magics fade.\n\nYou will learn Protection Runes for defense, Power Runes to enhance weapons, and Binding Runes to trap enemies. Precision is everything - one misplaced line changes everything. Your marks will endure for millennia.\n\nWelcome to eternal inscription. Let your runes reshape reality!"}
Q[55105]={d="<name>，在你狩猎期间，我看见元素本身回应你的存在。大地在你脚下移动，火焰因你的接近而舞动。\n\n阿穆瓦特·鹰梦为你准备了这根元素图腾。她仅凭意志号令原始之力——不与灵魂讨价还价，也不温言请求。元素将服从你，或被迫服从。\n\n把这根图腾带到纳拉奇营地交给她。绝对元素统治的道路在等着你。",dEN="<name>, during your hunt, I watched the very elements respond to your presence. Earth shifted beneath your feet, fire danced at your approach.\n\nAmuwate Eagledream has prepared this Elemental Totem for you. She commands the primal forces through will alone - no bargaining with spirits, no gentle requests. The elements will obey you, or be compelled to obey.\n\nTake this totem to her in Camp Narache. The path of absolute elemental dominion awaits you.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找阿穆瓦特·赐生者。",oEN="Seek out Amuwate Lifegiver in Camp Narache.",p="元素在你周围涌起，<name>。你把元素图腾带来了吗？纯粹的力量正等待着你。",pEN="The elements surge around you, <name>. Have you brought the Elemental Totem? Raw power awaits.",c="元素在你身上认出了它们的主人，<name>。\n\n不同于与元素协商的萨满，仪祭师以纯粹的意志号令。土、火、水、风都毫无疑问地屈从于你的意愿。你不请求许可；你直接掌控。这份力量来自对塑造了我们世界的原始之力的理解。\n\n你将召唤元素本身的怒火，号令它们执行你的意旨，并最终与元素本身合而为一。大地因你的接近而颤抖，火焰跃起为你效劳，风暴因你的召唤而聚集。\n\n欢迎掌握元素统治。让原始之力服从！",cEN="The elements recognize their master in you, <name>.\n\nUnlike shamans who negotiate with elements, primalists command through raw will. Earth, fire, water, air all bend to your desires without question. You don't ask permission; you take control. This power comes from understanding the primal forces that shaped our world.\n\nYou will summon the very fury of the elements, command them to do your bidding, and eventually become one with the elements themselves. The earth trembles at your approach, flames leap to serve you, storms gather at your call.\n\nWelcome to elemental dominion. Let the primal forces obey!"}
Q[55106]={d="<name>，在你整个狩猎过程中，你本能地保护他人免受危险。大地母亲本身已把你标记为保护者。\n\n莫塔·碎石者，我们最坚定的防御者，亲自为你雕出了这块大地之盾石板。他在你身上看到了一位不可撼动的守护者的禀赋——一个无论代价如何都会挡在邪恶与无辜者之间的人。\n\n把这块石板带到纳拉奇营地交给他。守护者的道路要求牺牲，但提供最崇高的荣誉。",dEN="<name>, throughout your hunt, you instinctively shielded others from danger. The Earthmother herself has marked you as a protector.\n\nMotah Stonebreaker, our most stalwart defender, carved this Earth Shield Tablet for you personally. He sees in you the makings of an immovable guardian - one who will stand between evil and the innocent, no matter the cost.\n\nBring this tablet to him in Camp Narache. The way of the Guardian demands sacrifice, but offers the greatest honor.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找莫塔·碎石者。",oEN="Seek out Motah Stonebreaker in Camp Narache.",p="大地母亲指引你的脚步，<name>。你把大地之盾石板带来了吗？守护者的职责在召唤。",pEN="The Earthmother guides your steps, <name>. Have you brought the Earth Shield Tablet? The guardian's duty calls.",c="你已准备好成为那面盾，<name>。\n\n守护者体现了庇护我们家园的巨大台地。作为守护者，你引导大地母亲的护佑拥抱，站在危险与无辜者之间。你将学会以石肤化为花岗岩、以大地之盾保护盟友，以及以屹立如山变得不可撼动。\n\n这条道路要求牺牲。你承受本该由他人承受的痛苦。但没有什么荣誉比成为永不破碎的盾、永不倒塌的墙更崇高。牛头人一向是保护者。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的守望。让邪恶在你的防御上撞得粉碎！",cEN="You stand ready to become the shield, <name>.\n\nThe guardian embodies the great mesas that protect our homeland. As a Guardian, you channel the Earthmother's protective embrace, standing between danger and the innocent. You will learn Stone Skin to become granite, Earth Shield to protect allies, and Stand as Mountain to become immovable.\n\nThis path demands sacrifice. You endure pain meant for others. But there is no greater honor than being the shield that never breaks, the wall that never falls. The Tauren have always been protectors.\n\nWelcome to eternal vigilance. Let evil shatter upon your defenses!"}
Q[55107]={d="<name>，在你狩猎期间，空气本身都噼啪作响、满是能量。风暴云在你头顶聚集，却没有落雨。你已被风暴本身选中。\n\n图安图·云尾为你留下了这份雷霆呼唤，是在一场闪电风暴中写下的。他已掌握天空的怒火，并在你的灵魂中看见了同样的怒火沉睡。\n\n把这份文稿带到纳拉奇营地交给他。风暴使者的道路将教你成为风暴的化身。",dEN="<name>, the very air crackled with energy during your hunt. Storm clouds gathered above you without rain falling. You have been chosen by the tempest itself.\n\nTooantuh Cloudtail left this Thunder Call for you, inscribed during a lightning storm. He has mastered the rage of the skies and seen that same fury sleeping within your spirit.\n\nTake this manuscript to him in Camp Narache. The path of the Stormbringer will teach you to become the storm incarnate.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找图安图·云尾。",oEN="Seek out Tooantuh Cloudtail in Camp Narache.",p="雷声应和你的脚步，<name>。你把雷霆呼唤带来了吗？风暴正在酝酿。",pEN="Thunder echoes your steps, <name>. Have you brought the Thunder Call? The storm gathers.",c="雷霆像对待亲人一样问候你，<name>。\n\n牛头人一向敬畏风暴。作为风暴使者，你不只是敬畏它们——你成为它们。雷霆是你的声音，闪电是你的武器，风是你的仆从。你将掌握闪电箭、闪电链以及风暴形态本身。\n\n空气本身因你的存在而噼啪作响。云层因你的到来而聚集。你是风暴的化身，通过凡人的形态引导自然的怒火。这份力量要求控制——失控的风暴会毁灭一切。\n\n欢迎来到风暴之心。让雷声宣告你的到来！",cEN="Thunder greets you as kin, <name>.\n\nThe Tauren have always respected storms. As a Stormbringer, you don't merely respect them - you become them. Thunder is your voice, lightning your weapon, winds your servants. You will master Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, and Storm Form itself.\n\nThe very air crackles with your presence. Clouds gather at your approach. You are the tempest incarnate, channeling nature's fury through mortal form. This power demands control - an uncontrolled storm destroys all.\n\nWelcome to the tempest's heart. Let thunder herald your coming!"}
Q[55108]={d="<name>，我从未见过如此年轻的人身上有如此受控的怒火。你的狩猎有条不紊、精准、具有毁灭性。祖先的暴怒流淌在你的血中。\n\n加拉克·双棒在目睹你的潜能后准备了这块先祖战争石板。他承载着千场战斗的怒火，认出了同源的灵魂。野蛮人的道路不是盲目的狂怒，而是凝聚的暴怒。\n\n把这块石板带到纳拉奇营地交给他。他将教你驾驭战斗的风暴而不被它吞噬。",dEN="<name>, I have never seen such controlled fury in one so young. Your hunt was methodical, precise, devastating. The ancestors' rage flows in your blood.\n\nGalak Twoclubs prepared this Ancestral War Tablet after witnessing your potential. He carries the fury of a thousand battles and recognizes a kindred spirit. The way of the Barbarian is not mindless rage, but focused wrath.\n\nCarry this tablet to him in Camp Narache. He will teach you to ride the storm of battle without being consumed by it.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找加拉克·双棒。",oEN="Seek out Galak Twoclubs in Camp Narache.",p="祖先们在谈论你的到来，<name>。你把先祖战争石板带来了吗？狂怒的道路在等着你。",pEN="The ancestors speak of your approach, <name>. Have you brought the Ancestral War Tablet? The path of fury awaits.",c="大地母亲指引你走上了暴怒之路，<name>。\n\n狂战士的怒火像河流穿过平原一样流淌在牛头人的血中。我们的祖先引导这股暴怒，保护我们的族人免遭半人马、野猪人以及更糟的东西侵害。作为野蛮人，你驾驭这股怒火——受控、专注、具有毁灭性。\n\n你将掌握祖先的力量以获得强健，拥抱你的凶悍，并学会成为最野性的猎手。你的暴怒将成为一股活生生的力量，随每一场战斗成长。这条道路要求控制——驾驭风暴而不被吞噬。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的狂怒。让平原在你的战吼前颤抖！",cEN="The Earthmother has guided you to the path of rage, <name>.\n\nThe berserker's fury flows through Tauren blood like rivers through plains. Our ancestors channeled this rage to protect our people from centaurs, quilboar, and worse. As a Barbarian, you harness this fury - controlled, focused, devastating.\n\nYou will master the power of the ancestors for strength, embrace your brutality, and learn to become a hunter of the most savage degree. Your rage becomes a living force, growing with each battle. The path demands control - ride the storm without being consumed.\n\nWelcome to eternal fury. Let the plains tremble at your war cry!"}
Q[55109]={d="<name>，你的狩猎以正直为标志——你只取所需，没有无谓地伤害任何人。正义本身指引你的脚步。\n\n贾克斯·晨翔为你留下了这份神圣誓言，写在受大地母亲祝福的兽皮上。他既是战士也是审判者，并在你身上看到了一位真正正义勇士的禀赋。\n\n把这份誓言带到纳拉奇营地交给他。圣殿骑士的道路将把你锻造成正义的化身。",dEN="<name>, your hunt was marked by righteousness - you took only what was needed, harmed none unnecessarily. Justice itself guides your steps.\n\nJax Dawnsoar left this Sacred Oath for you, written on hide blessed by the Earthmother. He serves as both warrior and judge, and has seen in you the makings of a true champion of justice.\n\nBring this oath to him in Camp Narache. The path of the Templar will forge you into justice incarnate.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找贾克斯·晨翔。",oEN="Seek out Jax Dawnsoar in Camp Narache.",p="你的誓言有分量，<name>。你把神圣誓言带来了吗？正义在召唤。",pEN="Your oath has weight, <name>. Have you brought the Sacred Oath? Justice calls.",c="你对正义的投入把你带到了这里，<name>。\n\n圣殿骑士把战士的力量与精神的力量结合在一起。你成为正义的化身，每一个行动都受大地母亲祝福，每一次打击都承载神圣的审判。你将掌握神圣打击、神圣护盾以及奉献本身。\n\n牛头人一向为正确之事而战。作为圣殿骑士，你成为这些价值的终极表达。你的存在削弱邪恶、强化善良，把任何战斗的天平倾向正直一方。\n\n欢迎加入神圣的侍奉。让正义指引你的每一个行动！",cEN="Your commitment to justice has brought you here, <name>.\n\nThe templar combines warrior strength with spiritual power. You become justice incarnate, every action blessed by the Earthmother, every strike carrying divine judgment. You will master Holy Strike, Divine Shield, and Consecration itself.\n\nThe Tauren have always fought for what is right. As a Templar, you become the ultimate expression of these values. Your presence weakens evil and strengthens good, tipping any battle's scales toward righteousness.\n\nWelcome to sacred service. Let justice guide your every action!"}
Q[55110]={d="<name>，在你狩猎期间，我看见你读出他人看不见的踪迹，穿越他人无法通行的地形。荒野本身已认领你为它的人。\n\n纳瓦特·风角在观察了你的天赋之后制作了这本平原猎人指南。他行走在他人无法跟随的小径上，并已认定你将超越他的技艺。\n\n把这本指南带到纳拉奇营地交给他。永恒的狩猎在召唤你——你将成为我们在荒野中的眼睛。",dEN="<name>, during your hunt, I watched you read tracks others could not see, move through terrain others could not navigate. The wild itself has claimed you as its own.\n\nNawat Windhorn crafted this Plains Hunter Guide after observing your natural talents. He walks paths others cannot follow and has marked you as one who will surpass even his skills.\n\nTake this guide to him in Camp Narache. The eternal hunt calls to you - you will become our eyes in the wilderness.",o="在纳拉奇营地寻找纳瓦特·风角。",oEN="Seek out Nawat Windhorn in Camp Narache.",p="荒野在召唤你，<name>。你把平原猎人指南带来了吗？永恒的狩猎在等着你。",pEN="The wild calls to you, <name>. Have you brought the Plains Hunter Guide? The eternal hunt awaits.",c="狩猎已把你唤回家中，<name>。\n\n牛头人一向与自然和谐共处，但游侠走得更深。你与荒野合而为一，理解野兽的语言，追踪无形的踪迹，在他人丧命之处生存下来。你将驯服科多兽与平原陆行鸟，掌握弓术，并读懂大地本身。\n\n我们的族人比以往任何时候都更需要游侠。贫瘠之地变得危险，腐化蔓延，敌人骚动。你是我们在荒野中的眼睛，我们的第一道警报，我们的迅速回应。任何猎物都逃不过你的追捕。\n\n欢迎加入永恒的狩猎。别让任何敌人逃过你的视线！",cEN="The hunt has called you home, <name>.\n\nThe Tauren have always lived in harmony with nature, but Rangers go deeper. You become one with the wild, understanding beast language, tracking invisible trails, surviving where others perish. You will tame kodos and plainstriders, master the bow, and read the land itself.\n\nOur people need rangers more than ever. The Barrens grow dangerous, corruptions spread, enemies stir. You are our eyes in the wild, our first warning, our swift response. No quarry will escape your pursuit.\n\nWelcome to the eternal hunt. Let no enemy escape your sight!"}
Q[77493]={d="你做到了。黑石之主已倒在你脚下。取下他的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have done it. The Lord of Blackrock lies dead at your feet. Take his head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="把奈法利安的头颅带给你的相应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Nefarian to your respective leader.",p="办妥了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的一场伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在对黑翼龙族的战斗中，许多生命逝去了。黑石之主终于死去，我们有机会终结这一切。\n\n做得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. With the Lord of Blackrock finally dead, we have a chance to end it all.\n\nWell done."}
Q[77494]={d="你想要奖励？除掉黑石之主本身难道还不够作为奖励吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Lord of Blackrock not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="在藏宝海湾与雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这笨蛋。你本不该把我自己的信拿回来给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖励？行吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[77722]={d="我一直在研究一种爆炸性的新附魔，保证让你大吃一惊，但我需要一整包焚龙鳞片才能完成它！",dEN="I've been working on an explosive new enchantment guaranteed to blow you away, but I require a Flux-load of Incendosaur Scales to finish it!",o="获取一整包焚龙鳞片",oEN="Obtain a Flux-load of Incendosaur Scales"}
Q[77723]={d="嚯，你怕是要被 Flux 气疯了。我就差几片焚龙鳞片！我们就快成了！再弄到一点点，这个附魔就能把你炸飞。",dEN="Oh boy are you going to be Flux-ing mad. I'm a few Incendosaur Scales short! We are so close! Obtain just a little more and this enchant will blast you away.",o="获取更多焚龙鳞片。",oEN="Obtain more Incendosaur Scales."}
Q[77724]={d="别恨我。我们现在真的很接近了！我只差一片焚龙鳞片就能完成你的附魔！",dEN="Don't hate me. We are so close now! I only need one more Incendosaur Scale to complete your Enchantment!",o="再获取一片焚龙鳞片。",oEN="Obtain one more Incendosaur Scales."}
Q[77725]={d="追寻禁忌知识有许多回报。像你追寻知识那样，带着同样炽热的渴望去追击你的敌人吧！",dEN="The pursuit of Forbidden Knowledge has many rewards. Pursue your enemies with the same burning desire you pursue knowledge!",o="从塞尔杜林处获取禁忌知识。",oEN="Obtain Forbidden Knowledge from Theldurin."}
Q[77726]={d="你已证明自己绰绰有余，英雄。这不是我们轻易提出的提议。传授我们知识所涉及的魔法代价高昂，需要许多人的死亡。带来所需的材料，我们就举行仪式。",dEN="You have proven yourself more than capable Hero. This is not an offer we extend lightly. The magics involved in imparting our knowledge is costly and requires the deaths of many. Bring the required ingredients and we will perform the ritual.",o="获取举行血法师仪式所需的材料。",oEN="Obtain the ingredients required the perform the Bloodmage's Ritual."}
Q[77727]={d="仪式已经完成，英雄。接受你的新力量吧。",dEN="The ritual is complete Hero. Accept your new power.",o="完成仪式。",oEN="Complete the Ritual."}
Q[77728]={d="我们的部族曾拥有一种古老魔法，让我们的战士能操控凄凉之地的风来击倒敌人。我们一直在寻找这份古老知识，却一无所获。\n\n你帮我们击败了敌人，保住了凄凉之地。也许你也能找回那些失落的知识，让我们重新获得失去的魔法。",dEN="Our clan once had access to ancient magic that allowed our warrior to control the winds of Desolace to strike down our foes. We have sought out this ancient knowledge to no avail.\n\nYou have helped us overcome our foes and secure and Desolace. Perhaps you can can also secure the missing knowledge to gain access to the magics lost to us.",o="获取古老的吉尔吉斯石板。",oEN="Obtain the Ancient Gelkis Tablet."}
Q[77729]={d="我们的部族曾拥有一种古老魔法，让我们的战士能操控凄凉之地的风来击倒敌人。我们一直在寻找这份古老知识，却一无所获。\n\n你帮我们击败了敌人，保住了凄凉之地。也许你也能找回那些失落的知识，让我们重新获得失去的魔法。",dEN="Our clan once had access to ancient magic that allowed our warrior to control the winds of Desolace to strike down our foes. We have sought out this ancient knowledge to no avail.\n\nYou have helped us overcome our foes and secure and Desolace. Perhaps you can can also secure the missing knowledge to gain access to the magics lost to us.",o="获取古老的吉尔吉斯石板。",oEN="Obtain the Ancient Gelkis Tablet."}
Q[77730]={d="沼泽女巫把她的秘密魔法知识与另一些不洁之物一同埋了起来。",dEN="The Swamp Witch buried knowledge of her secret magic alongside other unsavory things.",o="挖出沼泽女巫的秘密魔法。",oEN="Dig up the Swamp Witches secret magic."}
Q[77731]={d="我们辛苦的工作终于有了回报！多么开创性的新法术啊！",dEN="Our hard work has finally paid off! What a groundbreaking new spell!",o="学习古老的大地魔法。",oEN="Learn the ancient earth magic."}
Q[77732]={d="大德鲁伊正在对安戈洛土壤的再生特性进行开创性研究。获取足够的晨光麦来完成研究。",dEN="The Arch Druid is undertaking groundbreaking research into Un'goro soil's regenerative properties. Obtain enough Morrowgrain to complete the research.",o="获取足够的晨光麦来完成研究。",oEN="Obtain enough Morrowgrain to complete the research."}
Q[77733]={d="大德鲁伊正在对安戈洛土壤的再生特性进行开创性研究。获取足够的晨光麦来完成研究。",dEN="The Arch Druid is undertaking groundbreaking research into Un'goro soil's regenerative properties. Obtain enough Morrowgrain to complete the research.",o="获取足够的晨光麦来完成研究。",oEN="Obtain enough Morrowgrain to complete the research."}
Q[77734]={d="我的主人桑德兰，空气之王，曾被赋予强大的魔法。其中一些我可以传给那些已被证明配得上驾驭他力量的人。\n\n先证明你是拉格纳罗斯势力的敌人。然后，把空气本身的力量带给我。带着空气精华、风之气息和空气元素回来。",dEN="My Lord Thunderaan, Prince of Air was blessed with powerful magics. Some of which I can pass on to those who have proven themselves worthy to wield his power.\n\nProve yourself to be an enemy of the forces of Ragnaros. Then bring me the power of the air itself. Return with Essence of Air, Breath of Wind and Elemental Air.",o="收集风的力量。",oEN="Collect the power of the wind."}
Q[77735]={d="没有人能在盾墙中并肩作战之前，真正称自己为士兵！\n\n只顾防御只能让你活过这场战斗。你必须杀死敌人才能赢得战斗。让我教你怎么两样都做到。",dEN="None may truly call themselves a Soldier before standing shoulder to shoulder in the Shield Wall!\n\nDefending yourself will only see you through the battle. You must kill your enemies to win the battle. Let me show you how to do both.",o="学习盾墙的秘密",oEN="Learn the Shieldwall Secrets"}
Q[77736]={d="没有人能在盾墙中并肩作战之前，真正称自己为士兵！\n\n只顾防御只能让你活过这场战斗。你必须杀死敌人才能赢得战斗。让我教你怎么两样都做到。",dEN="None may truly call themselves a Soldier before standing shoulder to shoulder in the Shield Wall!\n\nDefending yourself will only see you through the battle. You must kill your enemies to win the battle. Let me show you how to do both.",o="学习盾墙的秘密",oEN="Learn the Shieldwall Secrets"}
Q[77737]={d="圣光与自然都寻求治愈与守护。它们是共生的。\n\n正义宝珠蕴含巨大的神圣之光。把它们连同生命精华一起带给我，我就会与你分享把它们以完美共生结合起来的秘密。",dEN="The Light and Nature both seek to heal and protect. They are symbiotic.\n\nRighteous Orbs contain immense Holy Light. Bring them to me alongside Living Essence and I will share with you the secrets of combining them in perfect symbiosis.",o="收集正义宝珠与生命精华。",oEN="Collect Righteous Orbs and Living Essence."}
Q[77738]={d="你面前的尸体已被完全放干了血。你越靠近这具尸体，就越强烈地想要割开自己的血管，把你生命之血的赠礼献给这具尸体。你感觉到，一旦开始那个仪式，就再也无法回头，直到你像面前的尸体一样干枯。\n\n也许还有别的办法来喂养这具尸体？",dEN="The corpse before you is entirely drained of blood. The closer you get to the corpse the stronger the desire to open your veins and give the gift of your life's blood to corpse. You sense that once you begin that ritual there would be no turning back until you were as dry as the corpse before you.\n\nPerhaps there is another way to feed the corpse?",o="把英雄之血倒在尸体上。",oEN="Feed Blood of the Heroes to the corpse.",p="你把英雄之血喂给了面前的尸体。血液被磁力般的力量吸入尸体的獠牙之中。\n\n尸体似乎有了极短暂的一瞬生机，随后一滴血从接在它干枯心脏上的龙头中渗出。",pEN="You feed the Blood of Heroes to corpse before you. The blood is drawn into the corpse's fangs with magnetic force.\n\nThe body seems to gain life for the briefest moment before a single drop of blood pools from the spigot attached to its desiccated heart.",c="你把英雄之血喂给了面前的尸体。血液被磁力般的力量吸入尸体的獠牙之中。\n\n尸体似乎有了极短暂的一瞬生机，随后一滴血从接在它干枯心脏上的龙头中渗出。",cEN="You feed the Blood of Heroes to corpse before you. The blood is drawn into the corpse's fangs with magnetic force.\n\nThe body seems to gain life for the briefest moment before a single drop of blood pools from the spigot attached to its desiccated heart."}
