Q[77740]={d="你面前的尸体已被完全放干了血。你越靠近这具尸体，就越强烈地想要割开自己的血管，把你生命之血的赠礼献给这具尸体。你感觉到，一旦开始那个仪式，就再也无法回头，直到你像面前的尸体一样干枯。\n\n也许还有别的办法来喂养这具尸体？",dEN="The corpse before you is entirely drained of blood. The closer you get to the corpse the stronger the desire to open your veins and give the gift of your life's blood to corpse. You sense that once you begin that ritual there would be no turning back until you were as dry as the corpse before you.\n\nPerhaps there is another way to feed the corpse?",o="把英雄之血倒在尸体上。",oEN="Feed Blood of the Heroes to the corpse.",p="你把英雄之血喂给了面前的尸体。血液被磁力般的力量吸入尸体的獠牙之中。\n\n尸体似乎有了极短暂的一瞬生机，随后一滴血从接在它干枯心脏上的龙头中渗出。",pEN="You feed the Blood of Heroes to corpse before you. The blood is drawn into the corpse's fangs with magnetic force.\n\nThe body seems to gain life for the briefest moment before a single drop of blood pools from the spigot attached to its desiccated heart.",c="你把英雄之血喂给了面前的尸体。血液被磁力般的力量吸入尸体的獠牙之中。\n\n尸体似乎有了极短暂的一瞬生机，随后一滴血从接在它干枯心脏上的龙头中渗出。",cEN="You feed the Blood of Heroes to corpse before you. The blood is drawn into the corpse's fangs with magnetic force.\n\nThe body seems to gain life for the briefest moment before a single drop of blood pools from the spigot attached to its desiccated heart."}
Q[77741]={d="这只宝箱是从血帆海盗与南海自由佣兵之间的一场战斗中缴获的。传说一位南海自由佣兵船长把钥匙藏了起来，直到他能重新取回宝箱的那一天。",dEN="This treasure chest was recovered from a battle between Bloodsail Pirates and Southsea Freebooters. Legend has it that a Southsea Freebooter Captain hid the key until the day he could reclaim the chest.",o="找到宝箱的钥匙！",oEN="Find the key to the treasure!"}
Q[77742]={d="能结识一位黑暗技艺的同道大师是我的荣幸。我只有一个仪式还要教你。从腐痕之疤内的恶魔身上收集黑暗恶魔之血。这种强大的物质将让你变身为更强大的变形恶魔，拥有更强的力量与对黑暗技艺的掌握。\n\n前往腐痕之疤的旅途会很危险，但回报丰厚。只有最勇敢、最强大的术士才能完成这项任务。如果你准备好了，就收集黑暗恶魔之血并回到我这里。我会教你如何驾驭黑暗升格的力量。",dEN="It is an honor to meet a fellow master of the dark arts. I have only one more ritual to teach you. Collect Dark Demon Blood from the demons within the Tainted Scar. This powerful substance will allow you to transform into a more powerful Metamorphosis Demon, wielding greater strength and mastery of the dark arts.\n\nThe journey to the Tainted Scar will be perilous, but the reward is great. Only the bravest and most powerful of warlocks will be able to complete this task. If you are ready, collect the Dark Demon Blood and return to me. I will teach you how to harness the power of the Dark Apotheosis.",o="获取黑暗恶魔之血。",oEN="Obtain Dark Demon Blood.",p="你再次证明了自己是同类中最勇敢、最强大的人之一。你收集的黑暗恶魔之血会好好为你效力。\n\n现在，让我教你如何驾驭它的力量。升入黑暗升格不可轻慢对待。它要求极高的专注与控制。但有了黑暗恶魔之血，你将拥有前所未有地掌握黑暗技艺的力量。\n\n你准备好开始了吗？蜕变并非没有风险，但回报极其巨大。你将变成一股不可小觑的力量，一位真正的黑暗技艺大师。那么，你怎么说？你准备好拥抱黑暗恶魔之血的力量，变身为升格的变形恶魔了吗？",pEN="You have again proven yourself to be one of the bravest and most powerful of your kind. The Dark Demon Blood you have collected will serve you well.\n\nNow, let me teach you how to harness its power. The ascension into Dark Apotheosis is not to be taken lightly. It requires great focus and control. But with the Dark Demon Blood, you will have the power to master the dark arts like never before.\n\nAre you ready to begin? The transformation is not without its risks, but the reward is immense. You will become a force to be reckoned with, a true master of the dark arts. So, what say you? Are you ready to embrace the power of the Dark Demon Blood and transform into an ascended Metamorphosis Demon?",c="你再次证明了自己是同类中最勇敢、最强大的人之一。你收集的黑暗恶魔之血会好好为你效力。\n\n现在，让我教你如何驾驭它的力量。升入黑暗升格不可轻慢对待。它要求极高的专注与控制。但有了黑暗恶魔之血，你将拥有前所未有地掌握黑暗技艺的力量。\n\n你准备好开始了吗？蜕变并非没有风险，但回报极其巨大。你将变成一股不可小觑的力量，一位真正的黑暗技艺大师。那么，你怎么说？你准备好拥抱黑暗恶魔之血的力量，变身为升格的变形恶魔了吗？",cEN="You have again proven yourself to be one of the bravest and most powerful of your kind. The Dark Demon Blood you have collected will serve you well.\n\nNow, let me teach you how to harness its power. The ascension into Dark Apotheosis is not to be taken lightly. It requires great focus and control. But with the Dark Demon Blood, you will have the power to master the dark arts like never before.\n\nAre you ready to begin? The transformation is not without its risks, but the reward is immense. You will become a force to be reckoned with, a true master of the dark arts. So, what say you? Are you ready to embrace the power of the Dark Demon Blood and transform into an ascended Metamorphosis Demon?"}
Q[77743]={d="我一直在努力工作，我相信我已发现了一种制造时光水晶的方法。只要有足够的安多哈尔怀表，我就能制作出一块水晶，让我们瞥见过去与未来。这将让我们解锁时光魔法，并做出改变以阻止可能发生的灾难。\n\n前往安多哈尔，尽可能多地收集这些怀表。把它们带回来给我，好让我开始我的实验。我明白这项任务不会轻松，但我相信有你的帮助，我们就能制造出时光水晶并解开时光魔法的秘密。\n\n你准备好接下这项重要任务了吗？未来正指望我们！",dEN="I have been hard at work, and I believe I have discovered a way to create a Time Crystal. With enough Andorhal Watches, I will be able to craft a crystal that will give us a glimpse into the past and future. This will allow us to unlock time magic and make changes to prevent disasters that may occur.\n\nJourney to Andorhal and collect as many of these watches as you can. Bring them back to me so that I can begin my experiment. I understand that this task will not be easy, but I am confident that with your help, we will be able to create a Time Crystal and unlock the secrets of time magic.\n\nAre you ready to take on this important task? The future is counting on us!",o="找到 15 只安多哈尔怀表，它们散落在城市废墟中的锁箱里。把它们带回给西瘟疫之地安多哈尔旅店的克罗米。",oEN="Locate 15 Andorhal Watches, found in lockboxes amongst the rubble of the city. Return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",p="干得漂亮，冒险者！你带回了大量的安多哈尔怀表。有了这些怀表，我相信我的实验一定会成功。\n\n让我给你展示我打算如何把这些怀表合成为一块时光水晶。过程相当复杂，但我会尽力向你解释。\n\n首先，我会取来这些怀表，用一个特殊法术校准它们的时间能量。这将让我为水晶创造一个稳定的基底。然后，我会向水晶注入强大的时光魔法，让我们得以观察过去与未来。\n\n最后，我会仔细塑造并提纯水晶，直到它成为一颗没有瑕疵、熠熠生辉的宝石。我的朋友，我们就是这样制造出一块时光水晶的。\n\n你准备好见证我们劳动的成果了吗，冒险者？退后，让我施展我的魔法！",pEN="Wonderful work, adventurer! You have returned with a bountiful collection of Andorhal Watches. With these watches, I am confident that my experiment will be a success.\n\nLet me show you how I plan to synthesize these watches into a Time Crystal. The process is quite complex, but I will do my best to explain it to you.\n\nFirst, I will take the watches and align their temporal energies using a special spell. This will allow me to create a stable base for the crystal. Then, I will imbue the crystal with a powerful time magic that will allow us to observe the past and future.\n\nFinally, I will carefully shape and refine the crystal until it is a flawless, shimmering gem. And that, my friend, is how we will create a Time Crystal.\n\nAre you ready to witness the fruits of our labor, adventurer? Stand back, and let me work my magic!",c="干得漂亮，冒险者！你带回了大量的安多哈尔怀表。有了这些怀表，我相信我的实验一定会成功。\n\n让我给你展示我打算如何把这些怀表合成为一块时光水晶。过程相当复杂，但我会尽力向你解释。\n\n首先，我会取来这些怀表，用一个特殊法术校准它们的时间能量。这将让我为水晶创造一个稳定的基底。然后，我会向水晶注入强大的时光魔法，让我们得以观察过去与未来。\n\n最后，我会仔细塑造并提纯水晶，直到它成为一颗没有瑕疵、熠熠生辉的宝石。我的朋友，我们就是这样制造出一块时光水晶的。\n\n你准备好见证我们劳动的成果了吗，冒险者？退后，让我施展我的魔法！",cEN="Wonderful work, adventurer! You have returned with a bountiful collection of Andorhal Watches. With these watches, I am confident that my experiment will be a success.\n\nLet me show you how I plan to synthesize these watches into a Time Crystal. The process is quite complex, but I will do my best to explain it to you.\n\nFirst, I will take the watches and align their temporal energies using a special spell. This will allow me to create a stable base for the crystal. Then, I will imbue the crystal with a powerful time magic that will allow us to observe the past and future.\n\nFinally, I will carefully shape and refine the crystal until it is a flawless, shimmering gem. And that, my friend, is how we will create a Time Crystal.\n\nAre you ready to witness the fruits of our labor, adventurer? Stand back, and let me work my magic!"}
Q[77744]={d="你好，英雄！你已证明自己有能力给敌人致命一击，但我担心还有更强大的敌人在等着你。我将教你一种新的战斗技巧，让你能对最可怖的敌人施以致命一击。这技巧叫作猫鼬之怒，它使用一套结合了猫鼬撕咬与斩杀的有力连击。\n\n我会亲自教你猫鼬之怒，但小心，这可不是容易掌握的技巧。训练很艰苦，而且需要一瓶猫鼬药剂。\n\n你准备好学习这项强大的技巧了吗，英雄？带一瓶猫鼬药剂来！我们将一起磨练你的技能，把你变成猫鼬之怒的大师。",dEN="Greetings, hero! You have proven yourself capable of delivering the final blow to your enemies, yet I fear even more powerful enemies await. I will teach you a new combat technique that will allow you to deal the final blow to most fearsome enemies. The technique is called Mongoose Fury, and it involves using a powerful combo attack that combines Mongoose Bite and Execute.\n\nI will teach you the Mongoose Fury myself, but be warned, it is not an easy technique to master. The training is intense and requires an Elixir of the Mongoose.\n\nAre you ready to learn this powerful technique, hero? Bring a Elixir of the Mongoose! Together we will hone your skills and make you a master of the Mongoose Fury.",o="交付一瓶猫鼬药剂以掌握猫鼬之怒战斗技巧，对你的敌人施以致命一击。",oEN="Deliver a Elixir of the Mongoose to master Mongoose Fury combat technique to deal a final blow to your enemies.",p="给我带一瓶猫鼬药剂来，我就教你猫鼬之怒战斗技巧。",pEN="Bring me an Elixir of the Mongoose, and I will teach you the Mongoose Fury combat technique.",c="给我带来一瓶猫鼬药剂，你就能解锁猫鼬之怒战斗技巧。凭借这项强大的技巧，你将能前所未有地对敌人施以致命一击。",cEN="By bringing me an Elixir of the Mongoose, you will unlock the Mongoose Fury combat technique. With this powerful technique, you will be able to deal the final blow to your enemies like never before."}
Q[77745]={d="啊，很高兴又见到你，英雄！\n\n冰冷钢铁的触感唤回了我以为永远失去的、关于自己死亡的记忆。战斗怒火在关键时刻辜负了我。我的势头动摇了。代价是我的生命。\n\n也许你不必为这一课付出如此高昂的代价，英雄。如今我看清了自己的失败。去弄一瓶强力怒气药水。这瓶药水将解锁你怒火的力量，为你的身心做好准备，迎接你即将经受的艰苦训练。\n\n等你把药水带来，我就教你狂怒势头技巧。这项技巧将把你的怒火引导成势头，确保你不会像我那样在关键时刻动摇。\n\n你准备好接受这个挑战了吗，冒险者？狂怒势头的力量就在你触手可及之处，我知道你有本事掌握它。祝你好运！",dEN="Ah, it's good to see you again, Hero!\n\nThe touch of cold steel has restored memories of my demise I thought lost forever. The battle rage failed me in a crucial moment. My momemtum faltered. My life was the price.\n\nPerhaps you do not need to pay such a steep price for this lesson Hero. My failure is clear to me now. Acquire a Great Rage Potion. This potion will unlock the power of your rage and prepare your body and mind for the intense training you're about to undergo.\n\nOnce you have brought the potion, I will teach you the Raging Momentum technique. This technique will channel your rage into momentum and ensure you do not falter in your critical moment like I did.\n\nAre you ready to take on this challenge, adventurer? The power of Raging Momentum is within your reach, and I know you have what it takes to master it. Good luck!",o="把一瓶强力怒气药水交给陨落的英雄。",oEN="Deliver a Great Rage Potion to the Fallen Hero.",p="给我带一瓶强力怒气药水来，我就教你狂怒势头战斗技巧，把你的怒火引导成不可阻挡的势头。",pEN="Bring me a Great Rage Potion, and I will teach you the Raging Momentum combat technique to channel your rage into unstoppable momentum.",c="给我带来一瓶强力怒气药水，你就能解锁狂怒势头战斗技巧。这项技巧将让你把怒火引导成不可阻挡的势头，确保你不会像我那样在关键时刻动摇。",cEN="By bringing me a Great Rage Potion, you will unlock the Raging Momentum combat technique. This technique will allow you to channel your rage into unstoppable momentum, ensuring that you do not falter in your critical moment like I did."}
Q[77746]={d="欢迎回来，我的朋友！我相信你已从莫法兹那里取回碧蓝钥匙，并把它安然无恙地带回给我。你已证明自己是一位娴熟的冒险者、一位宝贵的盟友。\n\n我有个提议给你。你看，我一直在研发一种新的战斗技巧，能让你的毒药在使用毒伤时更加致命。这技巧叫作致命追击，需要娴熟的手法和迅捷的反应才能正确施展。\n\n我愿意把这技巧教给你，我的朋友。它将成为你战斗技能的宝贵补充，并可能在战斗最激烈时决定生死。\n\n你有兴趣学习致命追击吗，我的朋友？碧蓝钥匙已证明你有能力完成最具挑战性的任务，我相信你会轻松掌握这项技巧。\n\n慢慢考虑我的提议，但别等太久。时间至关重要，而敌人总在寻求占据优势。我期待很快听到你的回音，我的朋友。",dEN="Welcome back, my friend! I trust you have retrieved the Azure Key from Morphaz and brought it safely back to me. You have proven yourself to be a skilled adventurer and a valuable ally.\n\nI have a proposition for you. You see, I have been developing a new combat technique that will make your poisons even more deadly when using Shiv. The technique is called Deadly Follow-up, and it requires a skilled hand and quick reflexes to execute properly.\n\nI would be willing to teach you this technique, my friend. It would be a valuable addition to your combat skills and could be the difference between life and death in the heat of battle.\n\nAre you interested in learning Deadly Follow-up, my friend? The Azure Key has shown that you have what it takes to complete the most challenging tasks, and I believe you will master this technique with ease.\n\nTake your time to consider my offer, but do not wait too long. Time is of the essence, and the enemy is always seeking to gain an advantage. I look forward to hearing from you soon, my friend.",o="学习致命追击。",oEN="Learn Deadly Follow-up.",p="学习致命追击战斗技巧。这项技巧将让您在使用毒伤时毒药更加致命，并在战斗中给你宝贵的优势。祝你好运！",pEN="Learn the Deadly Follow-up combat technique. This technique will make your poisons even more deadly when using Shiv and give you a valuable advantage in combat. Good luck!",c="学习致命追击战斗技巧。这项技巧将让您在使用毒伤时毒药更加致命，并在战斗中给你宝贵的优势。祝你好运！",cEN="Learn the Deadly Follow-up combat technique. This technique will make your poisons even more deadly when using Shiv and give you a valuable advantage in combat. Good luck!"}
Q[77747]={d="啊，欢迎，冒险者！我是巴斯拉，风之守望者，我有一项任务，相信能让你的战斗技能更上一层楼。\n\n我需要一些次级血石矿石来举行一场强大的仪式，教你一项新的战斗技巧。这技巧叫作老血涌，它会让你的猛击比以往任何时候都更强力。\n\n你可以自己挖矿获得矿石，向矿工购买，或者到干须峡谷搜寻狗头人可能藏起来的次级血石矿石窖藏。\n\n等你拿到矿石，把它带回来给我，我就会举行仪式教你老血涌。这项技巧要求稳健的手与专注的心，但我相信你有本事掌握它。\n\n你准备好接受这个挑战了吗，冒险者？老血涌的力量就在你触手可及之处，我知道你有本事掌握它。祝你好运！",dEN="Ah, welcome, adventurer! I am Bath'rah the Windwatcher, and I have a task that I believe will take your fighting skills to the next level.\n\nI am in need of some Lesser Bloodstone Ore to perform a powerful ritual that will teach you a new combat technique. This technique is called Ol' Bloodsurge, and it will make your Slam more powerful than ever before.\n\nYou can acquire the ore by mining it yourself, purchasing it from miners, or searching Drywhisker Gorge for any caches of Lesser Bloodstone Ore that the Kobolds may have hidden away.\n\nOnce you have acquired the ore, bring it back to me, and I will perform the ritual to teach you Ol' Bloodsurge. This technique requires a strong hand and a focused mind, but I am confident that you have what it takes to master it.\n\nAre you ready to take on this challenge, adventurer? The power of Ol' Bloodsurge is within your reach, and I know you have what it takes to master it. Good luck!",o="为仪式获取 15 块次级血石矿石。",oEN="Acquire 15 Lesser Bloodstone Ore for the ritual.",p="给我带些次级血石矿石来，学习老血涌战斗技巧，让你的猛击更强大。",pEN="Bring me some Lesser Bloodstone Ore to learn the Ol' Bloodsurge combat technique and make your Slam more powerful.",c="给我带来一些次级血石矿石，我就会举行仪式教你老血涌战斗技巧。这项技巧将让你的猛击比以往任何时候都更强力，把你的战斗技能提升到新的层次。祝你好运！",cEN="By bringing me some Lesser Bloodstone Ore, I will perform a ritual to teach you the Ol' Bloodsurge combat technique. This technique will make your Slam more powerful than ever before and take your fighting skills to the next level. Good luck!"}
Q[77821]={d="做一个有本事的猎人，不只是杀死你的猎物……还在于别让自己变成猎物。在灰谷猎杀幽爪奔跑者与野生雄鹿。\n\n但要小心……你并不是这片森林里唯一的猎人。",dEN="Being a capable hunter isn't just about killing your prey... it's about not becoming prey yourself. Hunt down Ghostpaw Runners and Wild Bucks in Ashenvale.\n\nBe careful though... you are not the only hunter in these woods.",o="杀死 10 只幽爪奔跑者和 10 只野生雄鹿。",oEN="Kill 10 Ghostpaw Runners and 10 Wild Bucks."}
Q[77823]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n某人或某物一直在猎杀我们的猎人，但活儿还得干。你觉得你能削减雷喙野猪与雷首蜥的数量，又不让自己变成猎物吗？\n\n在南贫瘠之地杀死 10 只雷喙野猪和 10 只雷首蜥。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nSomeone or something keeps hunting our hunters, but the job still needs done. Think you can cull the population of Stormsnouts and Thunderheads without becoming prey yourself?\n\nKill 10 Stormsnouts and 10 thunderheads in the Southern Barrens.",o="杀死 10 只雷喙野猪和 10 只雷首蜥。",oEN="Kill 10 Stormsnouts and 10 Thunderheads."}
Q[77824]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n某人或某物一直在西部荒野猎杀我们的猎人！我不知道该怪罪亡命徒还是河爪豺狼人。无论如何，活儿还得干。河爪秘法师可能在指挥对我们猎人的袭击。杀掉他们的秘法师，你就能削减大型食腐者与大 Goretu 野猪的数量，又不让自己变成猎物。\n\n在西部荒野杀死 6 只大型食腐者、大血牙野猪和河爪秘法师。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nSomeone or something keeps hunting our hunters in Westfall! I don't know if I should blame Outlaws or the Riverpaw Gnolls. Either way the job still needs done. The Riverpaw Mystic might be directing the attacks on our hunters. Kill their Mystics and can cull the population of Greater Fleshrippers and Great Goretusks without becoming prey yourself.\n\nKill 6 Greater Fleshrippers, Great Goretusks, and Riverpaw Mystics in Westfall.",o="杀死 6 只大型食腐者、大血牙野猪和河爪秘法师。",oEN="Kill 6 Greater Fleshrippers, Great Goretusks, and Riverpaw Mystics."}
Q[77825]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n银松森林正遭到不受欢迎者的袭击！难民们已开始穿过格雷迈恩之墙。前往那道墙，劝阻更多人过来。\n\n达拉然或许已经不在了，但他们并没有带走所有居民。他们正试图在安伯米尔建立新家。让他们见识一下部落的待客之道。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nSilverpine Forest is under attack by undesirables! Refugees have begun passing through The Greymane Wall. Travel to the wall and dissuade anymore from coming through.\n\nDalaran may be gone now, but they didn't take all their residents. They are trying to build a new home in Ambermill. Show them some Horde hospitality.",o="杀死 8 名憔悴的难民、病弱的难民、达拉然守卫和达拉然法师。",oEN="Kill 8 Haggard Refugees, Sickly Refugees, Dalaran Watchers, and Dalaran Wizards."}
Q[77826]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n为什么洞穴总吸引最糟糕的邻居？你能把赤脊山的洞穴清理一下吗？\n\n前往雷斯班洞穴，杀死 8 名赤脊苦工。\n\n前往雷德斯山谷，杀死 8 名黑石苦工。\n\n前往加拉德尔山谷，杀死 8 名暗皮战士。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nWhy is it that caves attract the worst neighbors? Clean up the caves in Redridge would you?\n\nTravel to Rethban Caverns and kill 8 Redridge Drudgers.\n\nTravel to Renders Valley and kill 8 Blackrock Grunts.\n\nTravel to Galardell Valley and kill 8 Shadowhide Warriors."}
Q[77831]={d="雪人已经在希尔斯布莱德丘陵的一个洞穴里安了家。一条路进……一条路出……你能击败雪人并活着出来吗？\n\n杀死 16 只洞穴雪人和凶猛雪人。",dEN="The Yeti have taken up residence inside a cave in Hillsbrad Foothills. One way in... One way out... Can you defeat the Yeti and make it out alive?\n\nKill 16 Cave Yeti and Ferocious Yeti.",o="杀死 16 只洞穴雪人和 16 只凶猛雪人。",oEN="Kill 16 Cave Yeti and 16 Ferocious Yeti.",p="一条路进……一条路出……你能击败雪人并活着出来吗？\n\n杀死 10 只洞穴雪人和凶猛雪人。\n\n你必须在 15 分钟内完成此任务且不能死亡。",pEN="One way in... One way out... Can you defeat the Yeti and make it out alive?\n\nKill 10 Cave Yeti and Ferocious Yeti.\n\nYou must complete this quest within 15 minutes without dying."}
Q[77832]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你能完成狩猎而不变成猎物吗？\n\n在阿拉希高地杀死 10 只高地阔步者、杀死 10 只平原爬行者，并杀死 5 只幼年台地秃鹫。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nCan you complete your hunt without becoming prey?\n\nKill 10 Highland Striders, Kill 10 Plains Creepers, and Kill 5 Young Mesa Buzzards in Arathi Highlands.",o="杀死 12 只高地阔步者。\n杀死 12 只平原爬行者。\n杀死 5 只幼年台地秃鹫。",oEN="Kill 12 Highland Striders.\nKill 12 Plains Creepers.\nKill 5 Young Mesa Buzzards."}
Q[77834]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n一个名叫戈加农的恐惧魔王已在灰谷的恶魔坠落峡谷安了家。杀穿他的仆从，消灭他。\n\n杀死 8 只曼诺洛克鞭笞者、游荡的邪能卫士和灼热地狱火。\n\n杀死戈加农。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nA dreadlord named Gorgannon has taken up residence in Demon Fall Canyon in Ashenvale. Fight your way through his minions and destroy him.\n\nKill 8 Mannoroc Lashers, Roaming Felguards, and Searing Infernals.\n\nKill Gorgannon.",o="杀死 8 只曼诺洛克鞭笞者、游荡的邪能卫士和灼热地狱火。\n杀死戈加农。",oEN="Kill 8 Mannoroc Lashers, Roaming Felguards, and Searing Infernals.\nKill Gorgannon."}
Q[77835]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你觉得战斗之后那些尸体都去哪儿了？前往暮色森林、乌鸦岭墓地的暮色森林地下墓穴。让你的敌人最后一次安息。\n\n杀死 10 只骷髅守卫、骷髅袭击者和骷髅治疗者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nWhere do you think all those bodies end up after your battles? Travel to the Duskwood Catacombs in Raven Hill Cemetery. Put your enemies to rest one final time.\n\nKill 10 Skeletal Warders, Skeletal Raiders, and Skeletal Healers.",o="杀死 10 只骷髅守卫、骷髅袭击者和骷髅治疗者。",oEN="Kill 10 Skeletal Warders, Skeletal Raiders, and Skeletal Healers."}
Q[77836]={d="你正在成为一名出色的猎人。能潜行靠近时放倒猎物是一回事，在开阔地上狩猎则完全是另一回事……\n\n在闪光平原的鼬鼠陨石坑附近杀死 15 只盐石蜥蜴。",dEN="You are becoming quite the hunter. It's one thing bringing your prey down when you can sneak up on them. It's quite another to hunt while out in the open...\n\nKill 15 Saltstone Basilisk around Weazel's Crater in the Shimmering Flats.",o="杀死 15 只盐石蜥蜴。",oEN="Kill 15 Saltstone Basilisk."}
Q[77837]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你注意到湿地维尔加挖掘场里的挖掘工变少了吗？我做过研究，似乎挖掘场里的迅猛龙越多……挖掘工就越少！我想研究一下附近迅猛龙变少时会发生什么。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nHave you noticed the lack of excavators in Whelgar's Excavation Site in the Wetlands? I've done studies, and it appears that the more raptors in the dig site... the less excavators! I'd like to study what happens when there are less Raptors around.",o="杀死 14 只斑纹镰爪龙和斑纹剃颚龙。",oEN="Kill 14 Mottled Scytheclaws and Mottled Razormaws."}
Q[77841]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你能完成狩猎而不变成猎物吗？\n\n在奥特兰克山脉杀死 7 名碎岭执行者、好战者、法师和撕裂者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nCan you complete your hunt without becoming prey?\n\nKill 7 Crushridge Enforcers, Warmongers, Mages, and Maulers in Alterac Mountains.",o="杀死 7 名碎岭执行者、好战者、法师和撕裂者。",oEN="Kill 7 Crushridge Enforcers, Warmongers, Mages, and Maulers."}
Q[77845]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n曼诺洛克女巫会的燃烧之刃正在壮大实力与人数。他们召唤着自己无望控制的生物。前往凄凉之地的曼诺洛克女巫会，摧毁燃烧之刃以及他们召唤来的恶魔。\n\n在凄凉之地杀死 8 只次级地狱火、法师猎手、末日守卫队长和虚空姐妹。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Burning Blade in Mannoroc Coven are growing in strength and in number. They summon beings they cannot hope to control. Travel to the Mannoroc Coven in Desolace and destroy the Burning Blade and the demons they summon.\n\nKill 8 Lesser Infernals, Mage Hunters, Doomwarder Captains, and Nether Sisters in Desolace.",o="杀死 8 只次级地狱火、法师猎手和末日守卫队长及虚空姐妹。",oEN="Kill 8 Lesser Infernals, Mage Hunters, Doomwarder Captains, and Nether Sisters.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77846]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n刚才我看见有人穿着鳄鱼皮鞋、背着鳄鱼皮背包！那是我这辈子见过最丑的东西。我有可靠消息说，肇事的制皮师是从尘泥沼泽进货的。去那里……杀掉那些鳄鱼。我连皮都不要！我只想确保别人也拿不到！\n\n杀死 10 只斑纹尘泥鳄鱼、尘泥钳嘴鳄和尘泥利颚鳄。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nI saw someone wearing crocodile skin shoes with a crocodile skin backpack earlier! It was the ugliest thing I've ever seen. I have it on good authority the leatherworker responsible is getting their supply from Dustwallow Marsh. Travel there... and kill the Crocodiles. I don't even want the skins. I just want to make sure no one else can get them!\n\nKill 10 Mottled Drywallow Crocolisks, Drywallow Snappers, and Drywallow Daggermaws.",o="杀死 10 只斑纹尘泥鳄鱼、尘泥钳嘴鳄和尘泥利颚鳄。",oEN="Kill 10 Mottled Drywallow Crocolisks, Drywallow Snappers, and Drywallow Daggermaws.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77847]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n纳迦正在勘探藏宝海湾以北的奈克玛尼泉！我不确定他们在找什么，但我很确定我不想让他们找到。\n\n杀死 16 名纳迦探险者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Naga are exploring the Nek'mani Wellspring north of Booty Bay! I'm not sure what they are looking for there but I'm sure I don't want them to find it.\n\nKill 16 Naga Explorers.",o="杀死 16 名纳迦探险者。",oEN="Kill 16 Naga Explorers",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77848]={d="晶脉矿洞太宝贵了，不能一直关闭着。似乎每次我们清掉蜥蜴，它们就立刻搬回来。是时候来一次快速灭绝了！\n\n在 12 分钟内杀死 8 只鞭尾蜥蜴和 12 只铁颚蜥蜴。\n\n此任务必须在不死亡的情况下完成。",dEN="Crystalvein Mine is too valuable to remain closed. It seems like every time we clear out the Basilisk they move right back in. It's time for rapid extermination!\n\nKill 8 Thrashtail Basilisks and 12 Ironjaw Basilisks within 12 minutes.\n\nThis quest must be completed without dying.",o="在 12 分钟内杀死 8 只鞭尾蜥蜴和 12 只铁颚蜥蜴。",oEN="Kill 8 Thrashtail Basilisks and 12 Ironjaw Basilisks within 12 minutes.",p="晶脉矿洞太宝贵了，不能一直关闭着。似乎每次我们清掉蜥蜴，它们就立刻搬回来。是时候来一次快速灭绝了！\n\n在 12 分钟内杀死 8 只鞭尾蜥蜴和 12 只铁颚蜥蜴。\n\n此任务必须在不死亡的情况下完成。",pEN="Crystalvein Mine is too valuable to remain closed. It seems like every time we clear out the Basilisk they move right back in. It's time for rapid extermination!\n\nKill 8 Thrashtail Basilisks and 12 Ironjaw Basilisks within 12 minutes.\n\nThis quest must be completed without dying.",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77849]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n还有什么地方比墓地更适合狩猎？如果你死了，甚至没人需要搬动你的尸体。你就正好待在该待的地方。\n\n在凄凉之地杀死 8 只腐食恐魔、4 只远古科多兽、年长科多兽和垂死科多兽。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nWhat better place to hunt than a graveyard? If you die no one even has to move your body. You would be right where you belong.\n\nKill 8 Carrion Horrors, 4 Ancient Kodos, Aged Kodos, and Dying Kodos in Desolace.",o="杀死 8 只腐食恐魔、4 只远古科多兽、年长科多兽和垂死科多兽。",oEN="Kill 8 Carrion Horrors, 4 Ancient Kodos, Aged Kodos, and Dying Kodos.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77851]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你听过那只坐着的鸭子的故事吗？还是说你就是个活靶子？诅咒软泥就在费伍德森林康斯泰拉斯废墟旁的路边！它们数量不多，能躲藏的地方更少。\n\n你得是只会飞的鸭子，才能杀掉诅咒软泥并活着回来。这次你是在完全开阔的地方狩猎。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nYou've heard the story of the duck that sits right? Or is it a sitting duck? The Cursed Oozes are right off the road in Felwood by the Ruins of Constellas! There are few of them and even fewer places to hide.\n\nYou will have to be a duck of the flying variety to kill the Cursed Oozes and make it back alive. You are hunting right out in the open this time.",o="杀死 20 只诅咒软泥。",oEN="Kill 20 Cursed Oozes."}
Q[77852]={d="一旦进入大熔炉，只有两条路可以出来。你能杀掉目标并逃出来吗？\n\n杀死 7 名黑铁工头、7 名黑铁奴隶贩子和 10 名黑铁哨兵。\n\n此任务必须在不死亡的情况下完成。",dEN="There are only two ways out of The Cauldron once you are inside. Can you slay your targets and escape?\n\nKill 7 Dark Iron Taskmasters, 7 Dark Iron Slavers, and 10 Dark Iron Lookouts.\n\nThis quest must be completed without dying.",o="杀死 7 名黑铁工头、7 名黑铁奴隶贩子和 10 名黑铁哨兵。",oEN="Kill 7 Dark Iron Taskmasters, 7 Dark Iron Slavers, and 10 Dark Iron Lookouts.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行完契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[77853]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n这些说明烦到你了吗？我给你指示的时候你到底在听，还是只管四处乱跑杀东西？\n\n杀死 10 只哈扎利虫群、哈扎利黄蜂和哈扎利沙掠者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nDo these descriptions bug you? Do you even listen to me when I give you instructions or do you just run around killing things?\n\nKill 10 Hazzali Swarmers, Hazzali Wasps, and Hazzali Sandreavers.",o="杀死 10 只哈扎利虫群、哈扎利黄蜂和哈扎利沙掠者。",oEN="Kill 10 Hazzali Swarmers, Hazzali Wasps, and Hazzali Sandreavers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行完契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[77857]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n北泉鹰身女妖已占据渡鸦风废墟。她们在寻找卡多雷留下的古老秘密。前往菲拉斯，消灭北泉鹰身女妖。\n\n杀死 10 名北泉唤风者、北泉羽贼和北泉杀戮者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Northspring Harpies have overrun the Ruins of Ravenwind. They seek ancient secrets left by the Kaldorei. Travel to Feralas and destroy the Northspring Harpies\n\nKill 10 Northspring Windcallers, Northspring Roguefeathers, and Northspring Slayers.",o="杀死 10 名北泉唤风者、北泉羽贼和北泉杀戮者。",oEN="Kill 10 Northspring Windcallers, Northspring Roguefeathers, and Northspring Slayers.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77858]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n我从没见过一个地方有这么多软泥！更糟的是它们还在不停增殖！你觉得你能杀得够快，真正削减它们的数量吗？前往辛特兰的潜伏石，练习一下你的除法……对软泥做！",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nI've never seen so many Ooze in one place! What's worse is they just keep multiplying! Think you can kill them quick enough to actually make a dent in their numbers? Travel to Skulk Rock in The Hinterlands and practive your division... On the Ooze!",o="杀死 15 只翡翠软泥和绿色淤泥怪。",oEN="Kill 15 Jade Oozes and Green Sludges.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77859]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n只要你能避开巨魔，辛特兰是个狩猎的好地方。\n\n杀死 12 只银鬃潜伏者、银鬃嗥叫者、咸水钳嘴鳄和野蛮枭兽。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Hinterlands is a great place to hunt if you can avoid the trolls.\n\nKill 12 Silvermane Stalkers, Silvermane Howlers, Saltwater Snapjaws, and Savage Owlbeasts.",o="杀死 12 只银鬃潜伏者、银鬃嗥叫者、咸水钳嘴鳄和野蛮枭兽。",oEN="Kill 12 Silvermane Stalkers, Silvermane Howlers, Saltwater Snapjaws, and Savage Owlbeasts.",p="你好，<name>。任务进行得怎么样？",pEN="Greetings <name>. How goes the quest?",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[77861]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n安多哈尔不会真有什么危险的东西跑出来吧？让我们保持这样！\n\n进入安多哈尔废墟，消灭盘踞在那里的亡灵。\n\n杀死一只血肉魔像、3 名骷髅督军和 15 只灼热食尸鬼。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nNothing really dangerous comes out of Andorhal right? Let's keep it that way!\n\nEnter the ruins of Andorhal and destroy the undead residing there.\n\nKill a Flesh Golem, 3 Skeletal Warlords, and 15 Searing Ghouls.",o="杀死一只血肉魔像、3 名骷髅督军和 15 只灼热食尸鬼。",oEN="Kill a Flesh Golem, 3 Skeletal Warlords, and 15 Searing Ghouls."}
Q[77862]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你听见那尖叫声了吗？！是从东瘟疫之地的科林十字路口传来的……终结它！\n\n杀死 20 只恨意尖啸者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nDo you hear that shrieking?! It's coming Corin's Crossing in Eastern Plaguelands... Put an end to it!\n\nKill 20 Hate Shriekers.",o="杀死 20 只恨意尖啸者。",oEN="Kill 20 Hate Shriekers."}
Q[77863]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n鬼魂萦绕在冬泉谷的凯尔瑟里尔废墟。你会斩杀它们吗？还是会加入它们？\n\n杀死 5 名悲苦上层精灵和 12 名受难上层精灵。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nGhosts haunt the Ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring. Will you slay them? Or will you join them?\n\nKill 5 Anguished Highborne and 12 Suffering Highborne.",o="杀死 5 名悲苦上层精灵和 12 名受难上层精灵。",oEN="Kill 5 Anguished Highborne and 12 Suffering Highborne."}
Q[77864]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n希利苏斯有三座主要的虫巢。\n\n杀死 8 名雷加尔虫巢领主、佐拉虫巢掠夺者和阿希虫巢防御者。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThere are three major Hives in Silithus.\n\nKill 8 Hive'Regal Hive Lords, Hive'Zora Reavers, and Hive'Ashi Defenders.",o="杀死 8 名希利苏斯虫巢领主、哈佐兰掠夺者和哈霍兰防御者。",oEN="Kill 8 Hive'Regal Hive Lords, Hive'Zora Reavers, and Hive'Ashi Defenders."}
Q[77870]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n在安戈洛环形山的恐惧小道附近猎杀强大的剑龙。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nHunt the mightly Stegodon near Terror Run in Un'Goro Crater.",o="杀死 5 只剑龙和 5 只板甲剑龙。",oEN="Kill 5 Stegodon and 5 Plated Stegodon."}
Q[77871]={d="考验的时刻已经结束，英雄。你为此训练已久。\n\n拉格纳罗斯正在熔火之心的深处聚集力量。火焰之王想让整个艾泽拉斯在他面前燃烧。前往他的巢穴，直面他并消灭他。\n\n奥妮克希亚是个危险的敌人，但真正的危险是任由她的阴谋不受质疑。奥妮克希亚再次通过她的凡人伪装影响政治，企图引发一场让我们倒退数代的战争。我们绝不能让奥妮克希亚影响我们的世界。",dEN="The time for trials has come to end hero. This is what you have trained for.\n\nRagnaros is gathering his power deep within the Molten Core. The Fire Lord would see all of Azeroth burn before him. Confront him in his lair and destroy him.\n\nOnyxia is a dangerous foe, but the true danger is allowing her manipulations to go unchallenged. Onyxia again influences politics through her mortal disguises in an attempt to bring about a war that would set us back generations. We cannot allow Onyxia to influence our world.",o="杀死奥妮克希亚和拉格纳罗斯",oEN="Kill Onyxia and Ragnaros",p="挑战仍在等待着你。当你战胜这些传奇敌人后再回来。",pEN="The challenge still awaits you. Return when you have triumphed over these legendary foes.",c="传奇敌人已倒在你面前！火焰已被扑灭，巨龙已被杀死。艾泽拉斯为你的胜利而欢庆！",cEN="Legendary foes have fallen before you! The fire has been quenched and the dragon slain. Azeroth celebrates your triumph!"}
Q[77872]={d="任务描述",dEN="QuestDescription",o="杀死艾索雷葛斯和末日领主卡扎克",oEN="Kill Azuregos and Doomlord Kazzak",p="挑战仍在等待着你。当你战胜这些传奇敌人后再回来。",pEN="The challenge still awaits you. Return when you have triumphed over these legendary foes.",c="难以置信！你击败了艾泽拉斯最危险的两个生物。你的传说正在流传，勇士。",cEN="Incredible! You have bested two of the most dangerous creatures in all of Azeroth. Your legend grows, champion."}
Q[77873]={d="任务描述",dEN="QuestDescription",o="日志描述",oEN="LogDescription",p="挑战仍在等待着你。当你战胜这些传奇敌人后再回来。",pEN="The challenge still awaits you. Return when you have triumphed over these legendary foes.",c="巨龙的怒火已被平息。正因为你的英勇，艾泽拉斯更加安全。庆祝这场胜利吧，勇士！",cEN="The dragons' wrath has been quelled. Azeroth is safer thanks to your heroism. Celebrate this victory, champion!"}
Q[77874]={d="你终于来了，英雄！\n\n你感受到从传送门中涌出的黑暗能量了吗？我以前见过他们的同类。嗜血成性，充满邪能魔法。我们不能让他们通过，否则整个艾泽拉斯都将遭殃。\n\n准备好你的武器！",dEN="You're finally here, hero!\n\nDo you sense the dark energies surging through the portal? I've seen their kind before. Bloodthirsty and full of fel magic. We cannot let them get past, for all of Azzeroth will suffer.\n\nReady your weapon!",o="帮助奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤击败恶魔。",oEN="Help Orgrim Doomhammer defeat the demons.",p="恶魔仍在威胁我们。当你帮助了奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤后再回来。",pEN="The demons still threaten us. Return when you have aided Orgrim Doomhammer.",c="你与奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤并肩对抗恶魔并取得了胜利。你确实是一位配得上传说的英雄。",cEN="You stood with Orgrim Doomhammer against the demons and emerged victorious. Truly, you are a hero worthy of legend."}
Q[77875]={d="英雄！克罗米告诉了我另一起时间异常。据说奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤本人正身处诅咒之地，试图独自对抗恶魔。\n\n我们需要你的帮助！如果他现在死去，兽人将永远无法摆脱玛诺洛斯的诅咒，我们所熟知的世界也将陷入危险。前往黑暗之门，救出奥格瑞姆。\n\n快一点，英雄。你是我们唯一的希望！",dEN="Hero! Chromie has told me of yet another time anomaly. Apparently Orgrim Doomhammer himself is residing in Blasted Lands, trying to fight off demons all by himself.\n\nWe need your help! If he dies now, the orcs will never be free of Mannoroth's curse and the world as we know it will be in danger. Head over to the Dark Portal and save Orgrim.\n\nHurry, hero. You are our only hope!",o="在黑暗之门附近寻找奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤。",oEN="Find Orgrim Doomhammer near the Dark Portal.",p="你还没有找到奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤。去黑暗之门附近寻找他。",pEN="You have not yet located Orgrim Doomhammer. Seek him near the Dark Portal.",c="你在黑暗之门附近找到了奥格瑞姆·毁灭之锤。这是一次将被载入史册的重大会面。",cEN="You have found Orgrim Doomhammer near the Dark Portal. A momentous meeting that will be remembered in the annals of history."}
Q[77876]={d="守卫洛思里克\n相关",dEN="Defending Lothric\nRelated",o="Lothric 保卫战",oEN="Defending Lothric"}
Q[77877]={d="返回告示板。",dEN="Return to the Call Board.",o="阻止安其拉的入侵。",oEN="Stop the Ahn'Qiraji invasion."}
Q[77878]={d="历史记载，数千年前强大的古拉巴什帝国被一场大规模内战撕成碎片。一群颇具影响力的巨魔祭司召唤出一位古老而可怕的血神——夺灵者哈卡的化身。最终，祭司们被击败并遭到流放。\n\n如今，我们收到报告称，一群自称哈卡莱的新祭司正试图重现仪式，将哈卡召唤到我们的世界。\n\n前往祖尔格拉布，阻止那些仪式者将哈卡释放到艾泽拉斯！",dEN="History says that thousands of years ago the powerful Gurubashi Empire was torn apart by a massive civil war. An influential group of troll priests called forth the avatar of an ancient and terrible blood-god - Hakkar the Soulflayer. Ultimately, the priests were defeated and exiled.\n\nNow in the current day we have received reports that a new group of priests that call themselves the Hakkari are trying to recreate the rituals to summon Hakkar to our world.\n\nTravel to Zul'Gurub and stop the ritualists from unleashing Hakkar onto Azeroth!",o="让夺灵者永远沉默！",oEN="Silence the Soulflayer!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="夺灵者已被消灭！祖尔格拉布再也不会给我们带来麻烦。干得好，英雄。",cEN="The Soulflayer has been silenced! Zul'Gurub will trouble us no more. Well done, Hero."}
Q[77880]={d="在黑石山下的洞穴深处，有一个被黑铁矮人称为\"熔火之心\"的地方。那是一个布满熔岩魔像、火元素和其他炽热生物的深渊。它们全都效忠于被称为火焰之王拉格纳罗斯的存在，他是居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。\n\n我们的间谍报告称，他们正在准备最后的仪式，要将拉格纳罗斯召唤到我们的世界。召唤一位元素领主可能会给整个艾泽拉斯带来巨大的灾难与毁灭。\n\n必须不惜一切代价阻止这一切！集结一支军队，前往熔火之心，杀死任何挡路的人。",dEN="Deep down in the caverns below the Blackrock Mountain lies a place the Dark Iron Dwarves call the \"Molten Core\". A chasm filled with golems made of lava, fire elementals and other fiery creatures. They all serve the being known as Ragnaros the Firelord, one of the elemental lords residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth.\n\nOur spy reports tell us that they are preparing the final rituals to summon Ragnaros to our world. The summoning of an elemental Lord could cause great disasters and destruction all around Azeroth.\n\nThat must be prevented at any cost! Gather an army, travel to the Molten Core and slay anyone that stands in your way.",o="熄灭火焰之王！",oEN="Extinguish the Firelord!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="火焰之王已被熄灭！熔火之心不再燃烧。多么辉煌的胜利！",cEN="The Firelord has been extinguished! Molten Core burns no longer. What a glorious triumph!"}
Q[77881]={d="我们的斥候报告，死亡之翼的女儿奥妮克希亚目前正藏身在尘泥沼泽深处的巢穴中。在被人发现她就是卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托女士，并且是暴风城国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩失踪的罪魁祸首之后，她逃到了那里。\n\n我们必须趁她最虚弱的时候发动攻击！\n\n召集所有有能力的冒险者，前往奥妮克希亚的巢穴，干掉她！",dEN="Our scouts report that Onyxia, the daughter of Deathwing, is currently hiding inside her lair deep in the swamps of the Dustwallow Marsh. She fled there after she was discovered to be Lady Katrana Prestor and was responsible for the disappearance of Varian Wrynn, King of Stormwind.\n\nWe need to strike now when she's at her weakest!\n\nGather any able-bodied adventurers, travel to Onyxias lair and take her out!",o="杀死奥妮克希亚！",oEN="Slay Onyxia!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="奥妮克希亚已被杀死！失去族母后，她的子嗣将四散而去。这是对黑龙军团的决定性一击。",cEN="Onyxia has been slain! Her brood will scatter without their matriarch. A decisive blow against the black dragonflight."}
Q[77910]={d="嘿，你！想不想找个机会填满你的钱袋？尘泥沼泽里有一条叫埃博斯塔夫的龙。传言说他带着一件强大的护符。\n\n杀了他，把它带给我。你的报酬绝对值得。",dEN="You there! Up for a chance to fill your purse? There's a dragon in Dustwallow Marsh, goes by the name of Emberstrife. Word on the street is that he's carrying a powerful amulet.\n\nKill him n' bring it to me. Your reward will be worth your time.",o="杀死埃博斯塔夫。",oEN="Kill Emberstrife.",p="怎么样？你找到了吗？",pEN="Well? Did you find it?",c="梅尔文的脸开始涨红。",cEN="Melvin's face starts turning red."}
Q[77911]={d="一张纸条？他留下的全部东西就是……一张纸条？我们甚至看不懂，这是龙语。把它带给萨洛'塔斯·亮阳船长。他是我的老相识。我相信他会帮我们解决这个\"困境\"。\n\n我上次听说，他正在棘齿城借酒浇愁。\n\n还有，你休想对我耍任何花招。我会密切盯着你。",dEN="A NOTE? All he had was... a note? We can't even read this, it's draconic. Bring it to Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun. He's an old acquaintance of mine. I'm sure he will help us with this \"predicament\".\n\nLast I heard, he's been drowning himself in alcohol at Ratchet.\n\nAnd don't you dare try any tricks on me. I'll be watching closely.",o="与萨洛'塔斯·亮阳船长交谈。",oEN="Talk to Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun.",p="一张纸条？让我看看。",pEN="A note? Let me see.",c="有意思……",cEN="Interesting.."}
Q[77912]={d="别用那种怀疑的表情看着我。我当然能读懂这个。我一生中很大一部分时间都在研究这种语言，我愿意帮你，但首先我需要你帮个忙。\n\n你看，冬泉谷的群山里有一条蓝龙。她叫哈莱恩，她的精灵形态简直令人窒息。她的肌肤、她的秀发、她的面容和她的身姿……她的一切都……完美无瑕……\n\n这么说吧，我对她产生了一点好感。你可以在下方洞穴里使用传送法阵，到达一座山峰的顶端找到她。\n\n把这封信交给她，然后带回复信回来。",dEN="Stop looking at me with that questioning face. Of course I can read this. I've spent a good part of my life studying this language and I would be willing to help you but first i need a favour.\n\nSee, there's this blue dragon in the mountains of Winterspring. Her name is Haleh and her elven form is just breathtaking. Her skin, her hair, her face and her figure... everything about her is just... perfect...\n\nWell let's just say that I've developed a bit of a liking for her. You can find her ontop of a mountain that you can reach by using a teleportation circle in the caverns below.\n\nDeliver this letter to her and come back with an answer.",o="把情书交给哈莱恩。",oEN="Deliver the love letter to Haleh.",p="谁会给我寄情书？",pEN="Who would send ME a love letter?",c="好吧……蓝龙军团的一条龙可不是每天都能收到这种东西。",cEN="Well..It's not every day a dragon from the blue dragonflight gets something like this."}
Q[77913]={d="萨洛'塔斯·亮阳……是的，我听说过他。可惜，我心仪的是另一个人。一位强大得多的人。\n\n抱歉，<name>，但你得告诉他，我没有兴趣见他。",dEN="Thalo'thas Brightsun... Yes, I've heard of him. Unfortunately, there's another that I fancy. Someone far more powerful.\n\nI'm sorry, <name>, but you will have to tell him that I have no interest in meeting him.",o="把哈莱恩的反应告诉萨洛'塔斯。",oEN="Tell Thalo'thas about Haleh's reaction.",c="怎么样？她说了什么？",cEN="So? What did she say?"}
Q[77914]={d="更强大？萨洛丹海盗团的领袖对她来说还不够强大？无所谓，天上的龙多的是。\n\n说好的交易就是交易。这是你的纸条译文。",dEN="More powerful? The leader of the Thalo'dan Privateers is not POWERFUL enough for her? Whatever, there's plenty of dragons in the sky.\n\nA deal is a deal. Here's your translated note.",o="把纸条交给梅尔文。",oEN="Deliver the note to Melvin.",p="你把纸条翻译好了吗，<name>？",pEN="Did you get the note translated, <name>?",c="终于有线索了。",cEN="Clues, at last."}
Q[77915]={d="终于！你怎么去了这么久？再晚一天，我就要在契约板上悬赏你的人头了。\n\n这张纸条提到一个叫米兰达的女巫。看来目前护符就在她手上。找到她，把护符拿回来。不择手段。",dEN="Finally! What took you so long? Another day n' I would've put a notice for your head on the contract's board.\n\nThis note talks about a witch called Myranda. It seems like she's the one who is currently in possesion of the amulet. Track her down n' get it back. Use any means necessary.",o="找到女巫米兰达。",oEN="Find Myranda the Hag.",p="看到护符，梅尔文的眼睛睁大了。",pEN="Melvin's eyes widen at the sight of the amulet.",c="梅尔文从你手中夺过护符，塞进了自己的口袋。",cEN="Melvin grabs the amulet from your hands and stashes it in his pockets."}
Q[77916]={d="终于归我了！只剩最后一件事要做。护符必须浸入一条强大黑龙幼崽的血液中，而我恰好知道合适的人选。达基萨斯将军，目前盘踞在上黑石塔的龙崽军团首领。\n\n跟我来，<name>，我们来商量一下策略。",dEN="Mine, at last! There's only one thing left to do. The amulet must be dipped in the blood of a powerful black dragonspawn and i know just the right one. General Drakkisath, the leader of the dragonspawn armies which are currently residing in the Upper Blackrock Spire.\n\nFollow me, <name>, let's discuss our strategy.",o="跟随梅尔文。",oEN="Follow Melvin.",p="你以为我听不到动静吗？把那护符交出来。",pEN="Didn't think I'd hear the noise? Hand that amulet over.",c="这上面是……血？",cEN="Is this..blood on it?"}
Q[77917]={d="反正我从来就不喜欢那家伙。自从他来了以后，我的东西老是莫名其妙地消失。\n\n总之，别以为我不知道你的计划。我会帮你……但你欠我一个人情。\n\n去黑石塔。在那里你会找到达基萨斯将军。把他的血带给我，我会用它解锁这枚护符的全部潜能。",dEN="Well, I never liked the guy anyway. My things have been disappearing way too often since he's arrived.\n\nAnyway, don't think I don't know about your plan. I'll help you... but you'll owe me one.\n\nGo to the Blackrock Spire. There you'll find General Drakkisath. Bring me his blood and I'll use it to unlock the full potential of this amulet.",o="前往黑石塔并杀死达基萨斯将军。",oEN="Go to the Blackrock Spire and kill General Drakkisath.",p="完成了吗？退后，<name>。",pEN="Is it done? Stand back, <name>.",c="仪式已完成。这是你的护符。",cEN="The ritual is complete. Here's your amulet."}
Q[78801]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n它被称为虫群之柱可不是没有原因的！哈霍兰虫群的虫群ers正在希利苏斯要塞以南集结。我们承受不起失去希利苏斯据点的代价。在它们包围我们之前杀掉它们！",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThey don't call it the swarming pillar for no reason! Hive'Ashi Swarmers are amassing to the south of Silithus Hold. We cannot afford to lose our foothold in Silithus. Kill the swarmers before they can surround us!",o="杀死 18 只哈霍兰虫群和 5 只哈霍兰毒刺。",oEN="Kill 18 Hive'Ashi Swarmers and 5 Hive'Ashi Stingers."}
Q[78802]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n位于西瘟疫之地与东瘟疫之地交界附近的哀嚎洞穴，即便对那片被天灾感染的土地而言也极为邪恶。净化洞穴！\n\n杀死 8 只邪恶软泥怪、5 只腐烂巨兽、3 只吞噬软泥怪和 1 只腐烂恐魔。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Weeping Cave near the border between Western and Eastern Plaguelands is truly vile, even for that scourge infected land. Cleanse the cave!\n\nKill 8 Vile Slimes, 5 Rotting Behemoths, 3 Devouring Oozes and 1 Decaying Horror.",o="杀死 8 只邪恶软泥怪、5 只腐烂巨兽、3 只吞噬软泥怪和 1 只腐烂恐魔",oEN="Kill 8 Vile Slimes, 5 Rotting Behemoth, 3 Devouring Oozes and 1 Decaying Horror"}
Q[78803]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n西瘟疫之地的北岭伐木场一直是血色十字军为炉谷提供补给的关键。砍倒那些伐木工！",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Northridge Lumber Camp in the Western Plaguelands has been key to the Scarlet Crusade supplying Hearthglen. Cut down the lumberjacks!",o="杀死 20 名血色伐木工。",oEN="Kill 20 Scarlet Lumberjack."}
Q[78804]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n天灾正在制造一支缝合恐魔大军。我担心如果我们不立即终结这一切会发生什么。在东瘟疫之地，进入瘟疫之林的屠宰场，摧毁这些恐魔。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nThe Scourge are producing an army of Stiched Horrors. I fear what might happen if we don't put an end to this immediately.In the Eastern Plaguelands, Enter the Slaughterhouses in the Plaguewood and destroy these horrors.",o="杀死 8 只缝合恐魔和 2 名屠宰场守卫。",oEN="Kill 8 Stitched Horrors and 2 Slaughterhouse Protectors."}
Q[78805]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n前往逆风小径的邪恶之地，杀死居住在那里食人魔。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nTravel to The Vice in Deadwind pass and slay the Ogre that reside there.",o="杀死逆风食人魔法师、蛮兵和打击者。",oEN="Kill Deadwind Ogre Mages, Brutes and Maulers."}
Q[78806]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n你不会想把这样的小猫带回家的。说真的，别这么做。它们会吃了你。前往冬泉谷的霜刃石，控制一下它们的数量。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nYou don't want to take one of these kittens home. Seriously. Don't do it. They will eat you. Head to Frostsaber Rock in Winterspring and do some population control.",o="杀死 8 只霜刃豹幼崽和 8 只霜刃豹雌猎手",oEN="Kill 8 Frostsaber Cubs and 8 Frostsaber Huntress"}
Q[78807]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n前往艾萨拉，杀死占据拉文凯斯纪念碑的毒刺纳迦。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nTravel to Azshara and slay the Spitelash Naga that have occupied the Ravencrest Monument.",o="杀死 12 名毒刺战斗法师和附魔师。",oEN="Kill 12 Spitelash Battlemasters and Enchanters."}
Q[78808]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n前往艾萨拉，杀死在亚考兰神殿附近游荡的亚考兰响钳龙虾人。",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nTravel to Azshara and slay the the Arkkoran Clackers around the Temple of Arkkoran.",o="杀死 16 只亚考兰响钳龙虾人。",oEN="Kill 16 Arkkoran Clackers."}
Q[78809]={d="招募冒险者：\n\n前往费伍德森林的铁木林地，把铁木践踏者变成铁木碎片！",dEN="Adventurers Wanted:\n\nTravel to Irontree Woods in Felwood and turn the Irontree Stompers into Irontree Splinters!",o="杀死 20 只铁木践踏者。",oEN="Kill 20 Irontree Strompers."}
Q[80421]={d="危险：\n只有在非荣誉战斗区域才能获得击杀计数与经验。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n1000 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1000 枚飞升印记。\n250 枚神秘符文。\n100 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡或放弃前你都将受其约束。",dEN="Perilous:\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while in non-honorable combat zones.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n1000 Felforged Souls.\n1000 Marks of Ascension.\n250 Mystic Runes.\n100 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death or abandonment.",o="险恶：\n只有在非荣誉战斗区域才能获得击杀计数与经验。\n\n受到的伤害提高 21%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n2100 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n2100 点邪能之力。\n525 枚神秘符文。\n210 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",oEN="Perilous:\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while in non-honorable combat zones.\n\nDamage taken increased by 21%.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n2100 Felforged Souls.\n2100 Fel Power.\n525 Mystic Runes.\n210 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",p="险恶：\n只有在非荣誉战斗区域才能获得击杀计数与经验。\n\n受到的伤害提高 21%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n2100 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n2100 点邪能之力。\n525 枚神秘符文。\n210 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",pEN="Perilous:\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while in non-honorable combat zones.\n\nDamage taken increased by 21%.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n2100 Felforged Souls.\n2100 Fel Power.\n525 Mystic Runes.\n210 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",c="险恶：\n只有在非荣誉战斗区域才能获得击杀计数与经验。\n\n受到的伤害提高 21%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n2100 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n2100 点邪能之力。\n525 枚神秘符文。\n210 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",cEN="Perilous:\nYou can only get kill credit and experience while in non-honorable combat zones.\n\nDamage taken increased by 21%.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n2100 Felforged Souls.\n2100 Fel Power.\n525 Mystic Runes.\n210 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."}
