Q[80426]={d="转瞬即逝：\n你有 30 分钟时间达到满级。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n300 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1000 枚飞升印记。\n250 枚神秘符文。\n100 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡或放弃前你都将受其约束。",dEN="Fleeting:\nYou have 30 minutes to reach level max level.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n300 Felforged Souls.\n1000 Marks of Ascension.\n250 Mystic Runes.\n100 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death or abandonment.",o="转瞬即逝：\n你有 30 分钟时间达到满级。\n\n所有获得的经验降低 5%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n300 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",oEN="Fleeting:\nYou have 30 minutes to reach level max level.\n\nReduces all experience gained by -5%.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n300 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",p="转瞬即逝：\n你有 30 分钟时间达到满级。\n\n所有获得的经验降低 5%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n300 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",pEN="Fleeting:\nYou have 30 minutes to reach level max level.\n\nReduces all experience gained by -5%.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n300 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",c="转瞬即逝：\n你有 30 分钟时间达到满级。\n\n所有获得的经验降低 5%。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n300 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",cEN="Fleeting:\nYou have 30 minutes to reach