0 枚神秘符文。\n120 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",cEN="Accursed:\nIncreases your chance to miss by -50%.\n\nYou have a 50% chance to be afflicted by a random Warlock curse whenever you miss.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n275 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."}
