Q[80486]={d="双刃：\n你造成的伤害的 100% 会反弹给你。\n\n在战场中每次击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n500 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1000 枚飞升印记。\n250 枚神秘符文。\n100 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡或放弃前你都将受其约束。",dEN="Double-edged:\n100% of damage dealt is reflected back to you.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n500 Felforged Souls.\n1000 Marks of Ascension.\n250 Mystic Runes.\n100 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death or abandonment.",o="双刃：\n你造成的伤害的 100% 会反弹给你。\n\n此伤害有 5% 的几率造成爆击。\n\n在战场中击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n350 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",oEN="Double-edged:\n100% of damage dealt is reflected back to you.\n\nThis damage has a 5% chance to critically strike.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n350 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",p="双刃：\n你造成的伤害的 100% 会反弹给你。\n\n此伤害有 5% 的几率造成爆击。\n\n在战场中击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n350 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",pEN="Double-edged:\n100% of damage dealt is reflected back to you.\n\nThis damage has a 5% chance to critically strike.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n350 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death.",c="双刃：\n你造成的伤害的 100% 会反弹给你。\n\n此伤害有 5% 的几率造成爆击。\n\n在战场中击杀获得的邪能淬炼灵魂提高 30%。\n\n完成此挑战将奖励你：\n350 个邪能淬炼灵魂。\n1100 点邪能之力。\n275 枚神秘符文。\n110 个神秘宝珠。\n\n挑战只能在 20 级时接受。\n\n一旦你接受此挑战，在死亡前你都将受其约束。",cEN="Double-edged:\n100% of damage dealt is reflected back to you.\n\nThis damage has a 5% chance to critically strike.\n\n30% increased Felforged Soul gain from kills while in a Battlefield.\n\nCompleting this challenge will reward you with:\n350 Felforged Souls.\n1100 Fel Power.\n275 Mystic Runes.\n110 Mystic Orbs.\n\nChallenges can only be accepted at level 20.\n\nOnce you accept this challenge, you are bound to it until death."}
