Q[80651]={d="缺乏实战的战士总是最先倒下。与其他玩家决斗，磨练你的战斗技巧。享受这段经历，并将它带入未来的战斗之中。",dEN="The unpracticed warrior is the first to fall. Duel other players and practice your combat skills. Relish in this experience and carry it with you into future battles.",o="你已被挑战与另外五位英雄决斗。",oEN="You have been challenged to duel five other heroes.",p="你已被挑战与另外五位英雄决斗。",pEN="You have been challenged to duel five other heroes.",c="你已被挑战与另外五位英雄决斗。",cEN="You have been challenged to duel five other heroes."}
Q[80653]={d="在你领取宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情永远不够。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your chest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的支持者宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Supporter's Chest."}
Q[80654]={d="在你领取战争宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情永远不够。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your Warchest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的支持者战争宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Supporter's Warchest."}
Q[80655]={d="在你领取精英战争宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情永远不够。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your Elite Warchest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的支持者精英战争宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Supporter's Elite Warchest."}
Q[80656]={d="在你领取大师战争宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情无法估量。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your Master Warchest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的支持者大师战争宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Supporter's Master Warchest."}
Q[80666]={d="虽然血色十字军的主要目标是抗击天灾，但他们对所有生者种族同样极其危险。在盲目的狂热中，他们真的相信任何非人类种族要么是天灾的一员，要么与之结盟。",dEN="Although the Scarlet Crusades main focus is to fight the Scourge they are ever so dangerous to all the living races too. In their blind fanaticism they actually believe that any non-human race is either part of the scourge or allied with them.",o="在斯坦索姆阻止血色十字军。",oEN="Stop the Scarlet Crusade in Stratholme.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80667]={d="瑞文戴尔男爵曾是一位富有的地主，克尔苏加德的支持者，也是瘟疫谷物在北方人类王国蔓延的主要罪魁祸首之一。\n\n如今他指挥着目前盘踞在斯坦索姆东部的天灾部队，不断与血色十字军争夺斯坦索姆的完全控制权。\n\n潜入叛徒的巢穴，将他绳之以法！",dEN="Baron Rivendare, once a rich landowner, supporter of Kel'thuzad and one of the main delinquents responsible for the spread of the plagued grain across the northern human kingdoms.\n\nHe is now commanding the scourge forces that are currently infesting the eastern parts of Stratholme. Continously fighting against the Scarlet Crusade over full control of Stratholme.\n\nVenture into the traitors lair and bring him to justice!",o="杀死瑞文戴尔男爵。",oEN="Kill Baron Rivendare.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80668]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n黑暗院长加丁及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nDarkmaster Gandling and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死黑暗院长加丁。",oEN="Kill Darkmaster Gandling.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80669]={d="有传言说，黑铁氏族的矮人效忠于一个名为拉格纳罗斯的强大邪恶存在。他被称为\"火焰之王\"，是目前居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。如果他们将其\"神明\"召唤到我们位面的努力成功，可能会给艾泽拉斯带来绝对的灾难。\n\n这一情况必须被调查并处理！\n\n前往黑石深渊，终结他们的召唤企图！",dEN="Rumors have it that the dwarves of the Dark Iron clan are serving a great evil being known as Ragnaros. Also titled \"The Firelord\", he is one of the elemental lords currently residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth. If their efforts to summon their \"deity\" to our planes are succesful, it could spell absolute disaster for Azeroth.\n\nThis situation needs to be investigated and taken care of!\n\nGo to the Blackrock Depths and put an end to their summoning efforts!",o="摧毁黑铁氏族。",oEN="Destroy the Dark Iron Clan.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80670]={d="致所有寻求财富与荣耀的英雄！名为维克图斯的龙人、奈法利安的造物，目前居住在下黑石塔，因他对所有种族犯下的骇人罪行而被通缉。他的实验和他本身的存在都与生命为敌。",dEN="To all Heroes looking for riches and glory! The Wyrmkin and creation of Nefarian called Overlord Wyrmthalak currently residing in the Lower Blackrock Spire is wanted for his hideous crimes against all races. His experiments and his very existence go against life itself.",o="杀死维克图斯霸主。",oEN="Kill Overlord Wyrmthalak",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80671]={d="我们收到报告称，上黑石塔内的活动突然增加。看起来黑龙奈法利安正在调动他的兽人部队，准备对火焰之王的巢穴发动全面进攻，企图夺取黑石山的完全控制权。\n我们绝不能让他得逞！如果奈法利安成功招募黑铁矮人为其效力，对我们所有人都可能是灾难性的！\n\n目前达基萨斯将军负责军备工作。\n\n前往上黑石塔，杀死达基萨斯将军和他的爪牙！",dEN="We have received reports of a sudden rise of activity within the Upper Blackrock Spire. It seems that the black dragon Nefarian is mobilizing his orcish forces to prepare an all-out assault on the lair of the Firelord in an attempt to seize full control over the Blackrock Mountain.\nWe can't let this happen! If Nefarian manages to recruit the Dark Iron Dwarves for his efforts it could be disastrous for all of us!\n\nCurrently General Drakkisath is in charge of the arming effort.\n\nTravel to the Upper Blackrock Spire to kill General Drakkisath and his minons!",o="终结达基萨斯的暴政。",oEN="Put an end to Drakkisath's tyranny.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80672]={d="东厄运之槌废墟的居民崇拜一种非常强大的物品，名为\"神秘宝珠\"。许多旅行者曾试图与当地居民谈判获取这些宝珠。有时成功，有时……\n这一切必须结束。\n\n为了让神秘宝珠的丰富来源对所有人开放，我们必须杀死东厄运之槌废墟的现任居民。",dEN="The population of the eastern Dire Maul Ruins worship very powerful objects called \"Mystic Orbs\". Many travelers have tried to negotiate with its inhabitants to obtain the orbs from them. Sometimes with success and sometimes..\nThis has to end.\n\nTo make the plentiful source of Mystic orbs availablefor everyone we have to slay the current inhabitants of the eastern Dire Maul ruins.",o="杀死扭曲者奥兹恩。",oEN="Kill Alzzin the Wildshaper.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80673]={d="通缉！\n\n一位第三方委托人悬赏任何能击败现任戈多克食人魔之王的人。这位国王对外来者不太\"开放\"。这位匿名委托人希望扶植一位对与戈多克食人魔达成各种贸易协定稍微\"开放\"一些的国王。\n\n前往北厄运之槌，干掉现任戈多克之王。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nA third party contractor has set a reward out for anyone that can take down the current king of the Gordok Ogres. The king is not very \"open\" to outsiders. The anonymous contractor wants to instate a king that is a bit more \"open\" for various trade agreements with the Gordok Ogres.\n\nTravel to Diremaul North and take out the current king of the Gordoks.",o="杀死戈多克大王。",oEN="Slay King Gordok.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80674]={d="托塞德林王子曾是艾萨拉女王的忠实仆从，一位辛德拉，也是暗夜精灵古城埃雷萨拉斯——即今日的厄运之槌——的领袖。永恒之井毁灭后，托塞德林王子将一只恶魔囚禁在埃雷萨拉斯的废墟中，并让他的臣民汲取它的力量，从而维持对幸存辛德拉的统治。\n\n长期接触恶魔力量扭曲了托塞德林的心智，使他成为艾泽拉斯的巨大威胁。\n\n杀死王子的唯一方法是摧毁环绕能量柱的守卫，以降低力场。完成之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。王子的力量大幅削弱后，你便可以攻击并终结他。",dEN="Prince Tortheldrin was a loyal servant to Queen Azshara, a Shen'dralar and the leader of the ancient night elven city Eldre'Thalas known today as Dire Maul. After the Well of Eternity's destruction, Prince Tortheldrin maintained control over the surviving Shen'dralar by imprisoning a demon in the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and letting his subjects siphon its strength.\n\nThe exposure to demonic power twisted Tortheldrin's mind and made him a great danger to Azeroth.\n\nThe only way of killing the prince is to destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, you may attack and end him.",o="杀死托塞德林王子。",oEN="Kill Prince Tortheldrin.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[80762]={d="已发布一份为灵魂征集 5 份活化汤的 requisition 订单。只有拥有来自高风险材料的专家工匠才能制作这些贵重物品。",dEN="A requisition order has been placed for 5 Animated Soup for the Souls. Only an expert craftsman with materials obtained from High-Risk can create these valuable items.",o="收集 5 份融合活化汤。",oEN="Collect 5 Fused Living Soups."}
Q[80850]={d="已发布一份为灵魂征集 5 份活化汤的 requisition 订单。只有拥有来自高风险材料的专家工匠才能制作这些贵重物品。",dEN="A requisition order has been placed for 5 Animated Soup for the Souls. Only an expert craftsman with materials obtained from High-Risk can create these valuable items.",o="完成 requisition 订单。",oEN="Fulfil the requisition order."}
Q[80987]={d="在你领取宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情永远不够。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your chest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的赛季支持者宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Seasonal Supporter Chest."}
