Q[80998]={d="在你领取宝箱之前，Project-Ascension 的员工想向你致以最诚挚的感谢。\n\n你的支持对我们意义重大，让我们能够继续把飞升做得尽可能出色。\n\n你的贡献是服务器的命脉，我们的感激之情永远不够。\n\n希望你喜欢自己的购买，并享受一段美妙的游戏时光。\n\n此致，\nProject-Ascension 员工团队",dEN="Before you accept your chest, the Staff at Project-Ascension would like to extend our heartfelt gratitude.\n\nYour support means the world to us and empowers us to continue making Ascension as great as possible.\n\nYour contributions are the lifeblood of the server and our appreciation can never be overstated.\n\nWe hope you enjoy your purchase and have an amazing time playing.\n\nRegards\nThe Project-Ascension Staff",o="完成任务以领取你的赛季支持者宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Seasonal Supporter Chest."}
Q[80999]={p="选择你的道路，英雄。每一个决定都在塑造你的命运。",pEN="Choose your path, Hero. Every decision shapes your destiny.",c="你的道路已经选定。愿它引领你走向荣耀，英雄。",cEN="Your path has been chosen. May it lead you to glory, Hero."}
Q[81002]={d="啊，英雄。我想和你谈一件极其重要的事。\n\n你一定对守望者不陌生吧——那些游荡在艾泽拉斯荒野中的泰坦巨兽？也许你知道它们的另一个名字：世界首领。这些生物在我们时间的织理中扮演着关键角色，是让新英雄磨砺自身的磨刀石。这些生物出现得越频繁，艾泽拉斯的英雄就会越强大。我们必须加速它们的重生。\n\n拿着这枚时光遗物，去寻找守望者的古老神龛。在盟友的帮助下，将遗物引导入神龛。你需要三枚才能激活它。这样做将复活那位守望者。杀死它，成为艾泽拉斯勇士传奇的一部分。\n\n带着 10000 枚飞升印记回来。",dEN="Ah, Hero. I would speak to you on a matter of great importance.\n\nYou are no doubt familiar with the Watchers, the titanic beasts that roam the wilds of Azeroth? Perhaps you know them by another name: World Bosses. These creatures play a crucial role in the fabric of our time, serving as sharpening stone for new Heroes to test their mettle. The more often these creatures arise, the greater the Heroes of Azeroth become. It is essential we hasten their rebirth.\n\nTake this Relic of Time, and seek out out ancient shrines to the Watchers. With the aid your allies, channel the relic into the shrine. You will need three for it to activate. Doing so will revive the Watcher. Slay it, and play a part in the legacy of Azeroth’s champions.\n\nReturn with 10000 Marks of Ascension.",o="向诺兹多姆上交 10,000 枚飞升印记",oEN="Turn in 10,000 Marks of Ascension to Nozdormu",p="你需要 10,000 枚飞升印记来换取一枚时光遗物。",pEN="You need 10,000 Marks of Ascension for a Relic of Time."}
Q[81003]={d="虽然血色十字军的主要目标是抗击天灾，但他们对所有生者种族同样极其危险。在盲目的狂热中，他们真的相信任何非人类种族要么是天灾的一员，要么与之结盟。",dEN="Although the Scarlet Crusades main focus is to fight the Scourge they are ever so dangerous to all the living races too. In their blind fanaticism they actually believe that any non-human race is either part of the scourge or allied with them.",o="在斯坦索姆阻止血色十字军。",oEN="Stop the Scarlet Crusade in Stratholme.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
