Q[81005]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n黑暗院长加丁及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nDarkmaster Gandling and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死黑暗院长加丁。",oEN="Kill Darkmaster Gandling.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81006]={d="有传言说，黑铁氏族的矮人效忠于一个名为拉格纳罗斯的强大邪恶存在。他被称为\"火焰之王\"，是目前居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。如果他们将其\"神明\"召唤到我们位面的努力成功，可能会给艾泽拉斯带来绝对的灾难。\n\n这一情况必须被调查并处理！\n\n前往黑石深渊，终结他们的召唤企图！",dEN="Rumors have it that the dwarves of the Dark Iron clan are serving a great evil being known as Ragnaros. Also titled \"The Firelord\", he is one of the elemental lords currently residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth. If their efforts to summon their \"deity\" to our planes are succesful, it could spell absolute disaster for Azeroth.\n\nThis situation needs to be investigated and taken care of!\n\nGo to the Blackrock Depths and put an end to their summoning efforts!",o="摧毁黑铁氏族。",oEN="Destroy the Dark Iron Clan.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81007]={d="致所有寻求财富与荣耀的冒险者！名为维克图斯的龙人、奈法利安的造物，目前居住在下黑石塔，因他对所有种族犯下的骇人罪行而被通缉。他的实验和他本身的存在都与生命为敌。",dEN="To all adventurers looking for riches and glory! The Wyrmkin and creation of Nefarian called Overlord Wyrmthalak currently residing in the Lower Blackrock Spire is wanted for his hideous crimes against all races. His experiments and his very existence go against life itself.",o="杀死维克图斯霸主。",oEN="Kill Overlord Wyrmthalak",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81009]={d="东厄运之槌废墟的居民崇拜一种非常强大的物品，名为\"神秘宝珠\"。许多旅行者曾试图与当地居民谈判获取这些宝珠。有时成功，有时……\n这一切必须结束。\n\n为了让神秘宝珠的丰富来源对所有人开放，我们必须杀死东厄运之槌废墟的现任居民。",dEN="The population of the eastern Dire Maul Ruins worship very powerful objects called \"Mystic Orbs\". Many travelers have tried to negotiate with its inhabitants to obtain the orbs from them. Sometimes with success and sometimes..\nThis has to end.\n\nTo make the plentiful source of Mystic orbs availablefor everyone we have to slay the current inhabitants of the eastern Dire Maul ruins.",o="杀死扭曲者奥兹恩。",oEN="Kill Alzzin the Wildshaper.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81010]={d="通缉！\n\n一位第三方委托人悬赏任何能击败现任戈多克食人魔之王的人。这位国王对外来者不太\"开放\"。这位匿名委托人希望扶植一位对与戈多克食人魔达成各种贸易协定稍微\"开放\"一些的国王。\n\n前往北厄运之槌，干掉现任戈多克之王。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nA third party contractor has set a reward out for anyone that can take down the current king of the Gordok Ogres. The king is not very \"open\" to outsiders. The anonymous contractor wants to instate a king that is a bit more \"open\" for various trade agreements with the Gordok Ogres.\n\nTravel to Diremaul North and take out the current king of the Gordoks.",o="杀死戈多克大王。",oEN="Slay King Gordok.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81011]={d="托塞德林王子曾是艾萨拉女王的忠实仆从，一位辛德拉，也是暗夜精灵古城埃雷萨拉斯——即今日的厄运之槌——的领袖。永恒之井毁灭后，托塞德林王子将一只恶魔囚禁在埃雷萨拉斯的废墟中，并让他的臣民汲取它的力量，从而维持对幸存辛德拉的统治。\n\n长期接触恶魔力量扭曲了托塞德林的心智，使他成为艾泽拉斯的巨大威胁。\n\n杀死王子的唯一方法是摧毁环绕能量柱的守卫，以降低力场。完成之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。王子的力量大幅削弱后，你便可以攻击并终结他。",dEN="Prince Tortheldrin was a loyal servant to Queen Azshara, a Shen'dralar and the leader of the ancient night elven city Eldre'Thalas known today as Dire Maul. After the Well of Eternity's destruction, Prince Tortheldrin maintained control over the surviving Shen'dralar by imprisoning a demon in the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and letting his subjects siphon its strength.\n\nThe exposure to demonic power twisted Tortheldrin's mind and made him a great danger to Azeroth.\n\nThe only way of killing the prince is to destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, you may attack and end him.",o="杀死托塞德林王子。",oEN="Kill Prince Tortheldrin.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81025]={d="奥金尼地穴曾是许多令人作呕的实验之地，目的都是为掌握通灵术。玛拉达尔主教带着他的疯狂居住在陵墓深处。是时候让他和那些游荡在地穴中的灵魂安息了。不过在进入奥金尼之前，你最好记住这座城市最初的守卫者的警告……不尊重死者的人……或许会与他们一同被埋葬。",dEN="The Auchenai Crypts were home to many unsavory experiments in the pursuit of mastering the necromantic arts. Exarch Maladaar resides in the depths of the tombs with his madness. It is time to put him and the spirits that walk the crypt to rest. Though you would do well to remember the warning of the city’s original guardians before entering Auchenai… those who do not respect the dead...... may become entombed along with them.",o="征服地穴并击败主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Conquer the Crypts and slay Exarch Maladaar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81026]={d="星界财团悬赏节点亲王沙法尔。虚灵结界使他们无法进入法力陵墓处理这一威胁。虽然你可能只是阻止了一个虚灵把这里洗劫一空、好给另一个腾出地方，但他们中只有一位被证明是我们的盟友。如果你愿意挑战节点亲王，赏金就归你了。",dEN="The Consortium has offered a bounty on Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Ethereal Wards prevent them from entering the Mana Tombs and dealing with this threat. Although you may just be preventing one ethereal looting the place blind to make room for another, only one of them has proven our ally. The bounty is yours to collect should you wish to challenge the Nexus-Prince.",o="征服陵墓并击败节点亲王沙法尔。",oEN="Conquer the Tombs and slay Nexus-Prince Shaffar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81027]={d="奥金顿曾是德莱尼安葬逝者的圣地，直到暗影议会召唤出一只远古恶魔将其亵渎。被释放的魔法从未真正消散，如今疯狂的鸦人国王泰罗克已让他的狂信徒利用这股力量施展黑暗魔法。他们仍在寻找他们的主人摩摩尔，并以他的名义举行黑暗仪式。是时候清除外域的这处污点了。",dEN="Auchindoun was once a holy ground for Frainei burials until the Shadow Council defiled it by summoning an ancient demon. The magics released have never truly faded, and now the insane Talon King Ikiss has set his zealots to harnessing this power to work dark magic. They still seek their master, Murmur, and perform dark rituals in his name. It is time to clean this taint from Outlands.",o="征服大厅并击败鸦爪之王伊基斯。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Talon King Ikiss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81028]={d="暗影议会在无知与追逐力量中召唤出了摩摩尔。有些存在之所以居于宇宙的遥远角落是有原因的。暗影议会已经难以控制摩摩尔。这个存在给外域带来浩劫只是时间问题。前往暗影迷宫，在摩摩尔的力量增长到我们无法压制之前将其放逐。",dEN="The Shadow Council summoned Murmur in their ignorance and pursuit of power. There is a reason some beings reside in the far corners of the universe. The Shadow Council is having trouble keeping Murmur under control. It is only a matter of time before this being unleashed havoc on Outlands. Travel to the Shadow Labyrinth and banish Murmur before his power grows beyond what we can suppress.",o="征服迷宫并放逐摩摩尔。",oEN="Conquery the Labyrinth and banish Murmur.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81029]={d="我们最近抓获了向太阳之井走私法力容器的虚灵，凯尔萨斯计划用它们协助召唤基尔加丹。我们追踪这些法力容器到了能源舰。如果我们不中断他们的补给，他们可能会在我们准备好进攻太阳之井之前成功召唤出他们的指挥官。前往能源舰，摧毁他们的行动。",dEN="We recently captured ethereals smuggling manacells into the Sunwell where Kael’thas plans to use them to assist in summoning Kil’jaeden. We tracked those manacells back to the Mechanar. If we do not interrupt their supply they may succeed in summoning their commander before we are in place to assault the Sunwell. Travel to the Mechanar and destroy their operation.",o="关闭能源舰并击败计算者帕萨雷恩。",oEN="Shut down the Mechanar and slay Pathaleon the Calculator.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81030]={d="血精灵科学家对外域的植物群进行实验，利用纳鲁科技创造并操控生物，以赋予自己新的力量。看来这些实验并未如预期进行，已经失控。我们必须在这些被魔法改造的生物（简称 MMO）逃出实验室并引发连锁生态崩溃之前净化生态船！",dEN="Blood Elf scientists carry out experiments on the Flora in Outland, using naaru technology to create and manipulate living beings to grant themselves new powers. It seems that these experiments did not go as expected and have gotten out of control. We need to purify the Botanica before these Magically Modified Organisms, or MMOs for short, escape the lab and begin a cascading ecological collapse!",o="净化生态船并杀死迁跃扭木。",oEN="Purge the Botanica and slay Warp Splinter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81031]={d="纳鲁将他们在禁魔监狱遇到的最恐怖、最危险的生物关押了起来。凯尔萨斯派了一名典狱长和守卫前往禁魔监狱，但有哪个血精灵能在如此强大的力量环绕下不被腐化呢？周围是黑龙军团的爪牙、燃烧军团的恶魔，甚至还有上古之神的仆从……那以自由换取力量的耳语太过诱人，囚犯们已经开始挣脱束缚。赶快前往禁魔监狱，确保监狱的安全！",dEN="The Naaru jailed the most terrifying and dangerous creatures they encountered in the Arcatraz. Kael’thas sent a warden and guards to the arcatraz, but what blood elf wouldn’t become corrupted surrounded by so much power? Surrounded by agents of the black dragonflight, demons of the Burning Legion and even servants of the Old Gods… the whispers of an exchange of power for freedom were too enticing, and the prisoners have begun to break free. Make haste to the Arcatraz and secure the prison!",o="确保禁魔监狱的安全并杀死先驱斯克里思。",oEN="Secure the Arcatraz and slay Harbinger Skyriss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81032]={d="塞纳里奥远征队派出斥候调查正在抽干赞加沼泽的蒸汽树桩之谜。自然学家拜特再也没有回来。我们担心最坏的情况。前往奴隶围栏，清除你发现的一切威胁，以便塞纳里奥远征队完成他们的任务。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has sent scouts to investigate the mystery of the steam stumps draining Zangermarsh. Naturalist Bite never returned. We fear the worst. Travel to the Slave Pens dispatch any threats you find so the Cenarion Expedition can complete their mission.",o="解放奴隶围栏并杀死夸格米拉。",oEN="Liberate the Slave Pens and slay Quagmirran.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81033]={d="对我们的孢子人盟友来说，最大的危险一直是沼泽行者。我们对外域的入侵只会让他们的处境更糟。随着纳迦在盘牙水库加固阵地，沼泽行者已开始离开他们在幽暗沼泽的最后避难所。斯波雷加对我们在赞加沼泽的成功至关重要。绝不能让黑色潜行者威胁我们的盟友。",dEN="The greatest danger to our sporeling allies has always been the marsh walkers. Our incursion into Outlands has only made their situation worse. With the Naga fortifying their position in the Coilfang Reservoir, the marsh walkers have begun leaving their last refuge in the Underbog. Sporeggar is critical to our success in Zangarmarsh. The Black Stalker must not be allowed to threaten our allies.",o="征服幽暗沼泽并杀死黑色潜行者。",oEN="Conquer the Underbog and slay The Black Stalker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81034]={d="蒸汽地窟是纳迦在赞加沼泽抽水行动的机械心脏，也是我们对抗瓦丝琪女士的重要战术目标。仅仅破坏设施是不够的。我们必须消灭那些有能力重建它的人。杀死机械师斯蒂里格和水利术士瑟斯比亚，确保机械与魔法上的修复都不可能进行。然后通过击败督军卡利瑟里斯给予决定性一击。阻止蒸汽地窟。阻止抽水。",dEN="The Steamvault is the mechanical heart of the Naga’s draining operations in Zangarmarsh and is a significant tactical target in our efforts against Lady Vashj. Simply sabotaging the facility is not enough. We must destroy those capable of rebuilding it. Slay Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia to ensure repairs both mechanic and magical are impossible. Then deal the decisive blow by defeating Warlord Kalithresh. Stop the Steamvault. Stop the draining.",o="关闭蒸汽地窟并杀死督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Shut down the Steamvault and slay Warlord Kalithresh.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81035]={d="邪兽人已经加固了地狱火堡垒。他们满足于劫掠周边地区，但报告显示他们的人数正在……增长。我们需要对堡垒发动进攻。夺取城墙的控制权，好让我们的部队发动全面进攻！",dEN="The Fel Orcs have fortified Hellfire Citadel. They have been content simply raiding the surrounding area, but the reports show their numbers are… growing. We need to launch an assault on the Citadel. Take control of the Ramparts so our forces can launch a full fledged assault!",o="征服城墙并杀死先驱者瓦兹鲁登。",oEN="Conquer the Ramparts and slay Vazruden the Herald.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81036]={d="我们的部队已将邪兽人赶下城墙。趁此机会推进到塔中，设法揭开新邪兽人诞生背后的秘密！清除途中遇到的一切威胁。",dEN="Our forces have pushed the Fel Orcs off the Ramparts. Take this opportunity to push into the Tower and attempt to uncover the secret behind the creation of new Fel Orcs! Eliminate any threats you encounter on the way.",o="征服熔炉并杀死击碎者克里丹。",oEN="Conquer the Furnace and slay Keli'dan the Breaker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81037]={d="是时候在战斗中面对酋长卡加斯·刃拳了。只要邪兽人还能通过黑暗之门劫掠我们的补给线，我们就永远没有资源对黑暗神殿发动进攻。进入破碎大厅，终结这一威胁！",dEN="It is time to face Warchief Kargath Bladefist in battle. As long as the Fel Orcs can raid our supply lines through the Dark Portal we will never have the resources to mount an assault on the Dark Temple. Enter the Shattered Halls and put an end to this threat!",o="征服大厅并杀死酋长卡加斯·刃拳。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Warchief Kargath Bladefist.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81038]={d="时间的流动必须得到维护。即便我们的时间线只发生一点微小的改变，也可能带来灾难性的后果；可要是萨尔从未逃出敦霍尔德，那将发生怎样的崩解？我们所知晓的一切都将被抹去！时光守护者请求你立即援助。如果我们失去了过去，就必定会失去未来。",dEN="The Flow of Time must be preserved. Even one small change in our timeline could prove catastrophic, but to imagine the unraveling that would occur should Thrall never escape Durnhold? Everything we’ve ever known would be undone! The Keepers of Time request your immediate aid. If we lose the past, we surely lose the future.",o="守护时间并杀死纪元猎人。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay the Epoch Hunter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81039]={d="任由黑暗之门的开启被阻止是很诱人，但谁能说全新的未来会带来什么？我们的敌人之所以想要篡改时间线，唯一的原因就是我们在这一条时间线中对燃烧军团构成了严重威胁。我们必须维护时间的流动！",dEN="It is tempting to allow the opening of the Dark Portal to be prevented, but who is to say what a new future would hold? The only reason our enemies would seek to alter the timeline is because we pose a serious threat to the Burning Legion in this one. We must preserve the flow of time!",o="守护时间并杀死埃欧努斯。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay Aeonus.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81040]={d="虽然血色十字军的主要目标是抗击天灾，但他们对所有生者种族同样极其危险。在盲目的狂热中，他们真的相信任何非人类种族要么是天灾的一员，要么与之结盟。",dEN="Although the Scarlet Crusades main focus is to fight the Scourge they are ever so dangerous to all the living races too. In their blind fanaticism they actually believe that any non-human race is either part of the scourge or allied with them.",o="在斯坦索姆阻止血色十字军。",oEN="Stop the Scarlet Crusade in Stratholme.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81041]={d="瑞文戴尔男爵曾是一位富有的地主，克尔苏加德的支持者，也是瘟疫谷物在北方人类王国蔓延的主要罪魁祸首之一。\n\n如今他指挥着目前盘踞在斯坦索姆东部的天灾部队，不断与血色十字军争夺斯坦索姆的完全控制权。\n\n潜入叛徒的巢穴，将他绳之以法！",dEN="Baron Rivendare, once a rich landowner, supporter of Kel'thuzad and one of the main delinquents responsible for the spread of the plagued grain across the northern human kingdoms.\n\nHe is now commanding the scourge forces that are currently infesting the eastern parts of Stratholme. Continously fighting against the Scarlet Crusade over full control of Stratholme.\n\nVenture into the traitors lair and bring him to justice!",o="杀死瑞文戴尔男爵。",oEN="Kill Baron Rivendare.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81042]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n黑暗院长加丁及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nDarkmaster Gandling and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死黑暗院长加丁。",oEN="Kill Darkmaster Gandling.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81043]={d="有传言说，黑铁氏族的矮人效忠于一个名为拉格纳罗斯的强大邪恶存在。他被称为\"火焰之王\"，是目前居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。如果他们将其\"神明\"召唤到我们位面的努力成功，可能会给艾泽拉斯带来绝对的灾难。\n\n这一情况必须被调查并处理！\n\n前往黑石深渊，终结他们的召唤企图！",dEN="Rumors have it that the dwarves of the Dark Iron clan are serving a great evil being known as Ragnaros. Also titled \"The Firelord\", he is one of the elemental lords currently residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth. If their efforts to summon their \"deity\" to our planes are succesful, it could spell absolute disaster for Azeroth.\n\nThis situation needs to be investigated and taken care of!\n\nGo to the Blackrock Depths and put an end to their summoning efforts!",o="摧毁黑铁氏族。",oEN="Destroy the Dark Iron Clan.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81044]={d="致所有寻求财富与荣耀的冒险者！名为维克图斯的龙人、奈法利安的造物，目前居住在下黑石塔，因他对所有种族犯下的骇人罪行而被通缉。他的实验和他本身的存在都与生命为敌。",dEN="To all adventurers looking for riches and glory! The Wyrmkin and creation of Nefarian called Overlord Wyrmthalak currently residing in the Lower Blackrock Spire is wanted for his hideous crimes against all races. His experiments and his very existence go against life itself.",o="杀死维克图斯霸主。",oEN="Kill Overlord Wyrmthalak",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81046]={d="东厄运之槌废墟的居民崇拜一种非常强大的物品，名为\"神秘宝珠\"。许多旅行者曾试图与当地居民谈判获取这些宝珠。有时成功，有时……\n这一切必须结束。\n\n为了让神秘宝珠的丰富来源对所有人开放，我们必须杀死东厄运之槌废墟的现任居民。",dEN="The population of the eastern Dire Maul Ruins worship very powerful objects called \"Mystic Orbs\". Many travelers have tried to negotiate with its inhabitants to obtain the orbs from them. Sometimes with success and sometimes..\nThis has to end.\n\nTo make the plentiful source of Mystic orbs availablefor everyone we have to slay the current inhabitants of the eastern Dire Maul ruins.",o="杀死扭曲者奥兹恩。",oEN="Kill Alzzin the Wildshaper.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81047]={d="通缉！\n\n一位第三方委托人悬赏任何能击败现任戈多克食人魔之王的人。这位国王对外来者不太\"开放\"。这位匿名委托人希望扶植一位对与戈多克食人魔达成各种贸易协定稍微\"开放\"一些的国王。\n\n前往北厄运之槌，干掉现任戈多克之王。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nA third party contractor has set a reward out for anyone that can take down the current king of the Gordok Ogres. The king is not very \"open\" to outsiders. The anonymous contractor wants to instate a king that is a bit more \"open\" for various trade agreements with the Gordok Ogres.\n\nTravel to Diremaul North and take out the current king of the Gordoks.",o="杀死戈多克大王。",oEN="Slay King Gordok.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81048]={d="托塞德林王子曾是艾萨拉女王的忠实仆从，一位辛德拉，也是暗夜精灵古城埃雷萨拉斯——即今日的厄运之槌——的领袖。永恒之井毁灭后，托塞德林王子将一只恶魔囚禁在埃雷萨拉斯的废墟中，并让他的臣民汲取它的力量，从而维持对幸存辛德拉的统治。\n\n长期接触恶魔力量扭曲了托塞德林的心智，使他成为艾泽拉斯的巨大威胁。\n\n杀死王子的唯一方法是摧毁环绕能量柱的守卫，以降低力场。完成之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。王子的力量大幅削弱后，你便可以攻击并终结他。",dEN="Prince Tortheldrin was a loyal servant to Queen Azshara, a Shen'dralar and the leader of the ancient night elven city Eldre'Thalas known today as Dire Maul. After the Well of Eternity's destruction, Prince Tortheldrin maintained control over the surviving Shen'dralar by imprisoning a demon in the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and letting his subjects siphon its strength.\n\nThe exposure to demonic power twisted Tortheldrin's mind and made him a great danger to Azeroth.\n\nThe only way of killing the prince is to destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, you may attack and end him.",o="杀死托塞德林王子。",oEN="Kill Prince Tortheldrin.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81062]={d="奥金尼地穴曾是许多令人作呕的实验之地，目的都是为掌握通灵术。玛拉达尔主教带着他的疯狂居住在陵墓深处。是时候让他和那些游荡在地穴中的灵魂安息了。不过在进入奥金尼之前，你最好记住这座城市最初的守卫者的警告……不尊重死者的人……或许会与他们一同被埋葬。",dEN="The Auchenai Crypts were home to many unsavory experiments in the pursuit of mastering the necromantic arts. Exarch Maladaar resides in the depths of the tombs with his madness. It is time to put him and the spirits that walk the crypt to rest. Though you would do well to remember the warning of the city’s original guardians before entering Auchenai… those who do not respect the dead...... may become entombed along with them.",o="征服地穴并击败主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Conquer the Crypts and slay Exarch Maladaar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81063]={d="星界财团悬赏节点亲王沙法尔。虚灵结界使他们无法进入法力陵墓处理这一威胁。虽然你可能只是阻止了一个虚灵把这里洗劫一空、好给另一个腾出地方，但他们中只有一位被证明是我们的盟友。如果你愿意挑战节点亲王，赏金就归你了。",dEN="The Consortium has offered a bounty on Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Ethereal Wards prevent them from entering the Mana Tombs and dealing with this threat. Although you may just be preventing one ethereal looting the place blind to make room for another, only one of them has proven our ally. The bounty is yours to collect should you wish to challenge the Nexus-Prince.",o="征服陵墓并击败节点亲王沙法尔。",oEN="Conquer the Tombs and slay Nexus-Prince Shaffar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81064]={d="奥金顿曾是德莱尼安葬逝者的圣地，直到暗影议会召唤出一只远古恶魔将其亵渎。被释放的魔法从未真正消散，如今疯狂的鸦人国王泰罗克已让他的狂信徒利用这股力量施展黑暗魔法。他们仍在寻找他们的主人摩摩尔，并以他的名义举行黑暗仪式。是时候清除外域的这处污点了。",dEN="Auchindoun was once a holy ground for Frainei burials until the Shadow Council defiled it by summoning an ancient demon. The magics released have never truly faded, and now the insane Talon King Ikiss has set his zealots to harnessing this power to work dark magic. They still seek their master, Murmur, and perform dark rituals in his name. It is time to clean this taint from Outlands.",o="征服大厅并击败鸦爪之王伊基斯。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Talon King Ikiss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81065]={d="暗影议会在无知与追逐力量中召唤出了摩摩尔。有些存在之所以居于宇宙的遥远角落是有原因的。暗影议会已经难以控制摩摩尔。这个存在给外域带来浩劫只是时间问题。前往暗影迷宫，在摩摩尔的力量增长到我们无法压制之前将其放逐。",dEN="The Shadow Council summoned Murmur in their ignorance and pursuit of power. There is a reason some beings reside in the far corners of the universe. The Shadow Council is having trouble keeping Murmur under control. It is only a matter of time before this being unleashed havoc on Outlands. Travel to the Shadow Labyrinth and banish Murmur before his power grows beyond what we can suppress.",o="征服迷宫并放逐摩摩尔。",oEN="Conquery the Labyrinth and banish Murmur.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81066]={d="我们最近抓获了向太阳之井走私法力容器的虚灵，凯尔萨斯计划用它们协助召唤基尔加丹。我们追踪这些法力容器到了能源舰。如果我们不中断他们的补给，他们可能会在我们准备好进攻太阳之井之前成功召唤出他们的指挥官。前往能源舰，摧毁他们的行动。",dEN="We recently captured ethereals smuggling manacells into the Sunwell where Kael’thas plans to use them to assist in summoning Kil’jaeden. We tracked those manacells back to the Mechanar. If we do not interrupt their supply they may succeed in summoning their commander before we are in place to assault the Sunwell. Travel to the Mechanar and destroy their operation.",o="关闭能源舰并击败计算者帕萨雷恩。",oEN="Shut down the Mechanar and slay Pathaleon the Calculator.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81067]={d="血精灵科学家对外域的植物群进行实验，利用纳鲁科技创造并操控生物，以赋予自己新的力量。看来这些实验并未如预期进行，已经失控。我们必须在这些被魔法改造的生物（简称 MMO）逃出实验室并引发连锁生态崩溃之前净化生态船！",dEN="Blood Elf scientists carry out experiments on the Flora in Outland, using naaru technology to create and manipulate living beings to grant themselves new powers. It seems that these experiments did not go as expected and have gotten out of control. We need to purify the Botanica before these Magically Modified Organisms, or MMOs for short, escape the lab and begin a cascading ecological collapse!",o="净化生态船并杀死迁跃扭木。",oEN="Purge the Botanica and slay Warp Splinter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81068]={d="纳鲁将他们在禁魔监狱遇到的最恐怖、最危险的生物关押了起来。凯尔萨斯派了一名典狱长和守卫前往禁魔监狱，但有哪个血精灵能在如此强大的力量环绕下不被腐化呢？周围是黑龙军团的爪牙、燃烧军团的恶魔，甚至还有上古之神的仆从……那以自由换取力量的耳语太过诱人，囚犯们已经开始挣脱束缚。赶快前往禁魔监狱，确保监狱的安全！",dEN="The Naaru jailed the most terrifying and dangerous creatures they encountered in the Arcatraz. Kael’thas sent a warden and guards to the arcatraz, but what blood elf wouldn’t become corrupted surrounded by so much power? Surrounded by agents of the black dragonflight, demons of the Burning Legion and even servants of the Old Gods… the whispers of an exchange of power for freedom were too enticing, and the prisoners have begun to break free. Make haste to the Arcatraz and secure the prison!",o="确保禁魔监狱的安全并杀死先驱斯克里思。",oEN="Secure the Arcatraz and slay Harbinger Skyriss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81069]={d="塞纳里奥远征队派出斥候调查正在抽干赞加沼泽的蒸汽树桩之谜。自然学家拜特再也没有回来。我们担心最坏的情况。前往奴隶围栏，清除你发现的一切威胁，以便塞纳里奥远征队完成他们的任务。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has sent scouts to investigate the mystery of the steam stumps draining Zangermarsh. Naturalist Bite never returned. We fear the worst. Travel to the Slave Pens dispatch any threats you find so the Cenarion Expedition can complete their mission.",o="解放奴隶围栏并杀死夸格米拉。",oEN="Liberate the Slave Pens and slay Quagmirran.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81070]={d="对我们的孢子人盟友来说，最大的危险一直是沼泽行者。我们对外域的入侵只会让他们的处境更糟。随着纳迦在盘牙水库加固阵地，沼泽行者已开始离开他们在幽暗沼泽的最后避难所。斯波雷加对我们在赞加沼泽的成功至关重要。绝不能让黑色潜行者威胁我们的盟友。",dEN="The greatest danger to our sporeling allies has always been the marsh walkers. Our incursion into Outlands has only made their situation worse. With the Naga fortifying their position in the Coilfang Reservoir, the marsh walkers have begun leaving their last refuge in the Underbog. Sporeggar is critical to our success in Zangarmarsh. The Black Stalker must not be allowed to threaten our allies.",o="征服幽暗沼泽并杀死黑色潜行者。",oEN="Conquer the Underbog and slay The Black Stalker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81071]={d="蒸汽地窟是纳迦在赞加沼泽抽水行动的机械心脏，也是我们对抗瓦丝琪女士的重要战术目标。仅仅破坏设施是不够的。我们必须消灭那些有能力重建它的人。杀死机械师斯蒂里格和水利术士瑟斯比亚，确保机械与魔法上的修复都不可能进行。然后通过击败督军卡利瑟里斯给予决定性一击。阻止蒸汽地窟。阻止抽水。",dEN="The Steamvault is the mechanical heart of the Naga’s draining operations in Zangarmarsh and is a significant tactical target in our efforts against Lady Vashj. Simply sabotaging the facility is not enough. We must destroy those capable of rebuilding it. Slay Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia to ensure repairs both mechanic and magical are impossible. Then deal the decisive blow by defeating Warlord Kalithresh. Stop the Steamvault. Stop the draining.",o="关闭蒸汽地窟并杀死督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Shut down the Steamvault and slay Warlord Kalithresh.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81072]={d="邪兽人已经加固了地狱火堡垒。他们满足于劫掠周边地区，但报告显示他们的人数正在……增长。我们需要对堡垒发动进攻。夺取城墙的控制权，好让我们的部队发动全面进攻！",dEN="The Fel Orcs have fortified Hellfire Citadel. They have been content simply raiding the surrounding area, but the reports show their numbers are… growing. We need to launch an assault on the Citadel. Take control of the Ramparts so our forces can launch a full fledged assault!",o="征服城墙并杀死先驱者瓦兹鲁登。",oEN="Conquer the Ramparts and slay Vazruden the Herald.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81073]={d="我们的部队已将邪兽人赶下城墙。趁此机会推进到塔中，设法揭开新邪兽人诞生背后的秘密！清除途中遇到的一切威胁。",dEN="Our forces have pushed the Fel Orcs off the Ramparts. Take this opportunity to push into the Tower and attempt to uncover the secret behind the creation of new Fel Orcs! Eliminate any threats you encounter on the way.",o="征服熔炉并杀死击碎者克里丹。",oEN="Conquer the Furnace and slay Keli'dan the Breaker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81074]={d="是时候在战斗中面对酋长卡加斯·刃拳了。只要邪兽人还能通过黑暗之门劫掠我们的补给线，我们就永远没有资源对黑暗神殿发动进攻。进入破碎大厅，终结这一威胁！",dEN="It is time to face Warchief Kargath Bladefist in battle. As long as the Fel Orcs can raid our supply lines through the Dark Portal we will never have the resources to mount an assault on the Dark Temple. Enter the Shattered Halls and put an end to this threat!",o="征服大厅并杀死酋长卡加斯·刃拳。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Warchief Kargath Bladefist.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81075]={d="时间的流动必须得到维护。即便我们的时间线只发生一点微小的改变，也可能带来灾难性的后果；可要是萨尔从未逃出敦霍尔德，那将发生怎样的崩解？我们所知晓的一切都将被抹去！时光守护者请求你立即援助。如果我们失去了过去，就必定会失去未来。",dEN="The Flow of Time must be preserved. Even one small change in our timeline could prove catastrophic, but to imagine the unraveling that would occur should Thrall never escape Durnhold? Everything we’ve ever known would be undone! The Keepers of Time request your immediate aid. If we lose the past, we surely lose the future.",o="守护时间并杀死纪元猎人。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay the Epoch Hunter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81076]={d="任由黑暗之门的开启被阻止是很诱人，但谁能说全新的未来会带来什么？我们的敌人之所以想要篡改时间线，唯一的原因就是我们在这一条时间线中对燃烧军团构成了严重威胁。我们必须维护时间的流动！",dEN="It is tempting to allow the opening of the Dark Portal to be prevented, but who is to say what a new future would hold? The only reason our enemies would seek to alter the timeline is because we pose a serious threat to the Burning Legion in this one. We must preserve the flow of time!",o="守护时间并杀死埃欧努斯。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay Aeonus.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81077]={d="虽然血色十字军的主要目标是抗击天灾，但他们对所有生者种族同样极其危险。在盲目的狂热中，他们真的相信任何非人类种族要么是天灾的一员，要么与之结盟。",dEN="Although the Scarlet Crusades main focus is to fight the Scourge they are ever so dangerous to all the living races too. In their blind fanaticism they actually believe that any non-human race is either part of the scourge or allied with them.",o="在斯坦索姆阻止血色十字军。",oEN="Stop the Scarlet Crusade in Stratholme.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81078]={d="瑞文戴尔男爵曾是一位富有的地主，克尔苏加德的支持者，也是瘟疫谷物在北方人类王国蔓延的主要罪魁祸首之一。\n\n如今他指挥着目前盘踞在斯坦索姆东部的天灾部队，不断与血色十字军争夺斯坦索姆的完全控制权。\n\n潜入叛徒的巢穴，将他绳之以法！",dEN="Baron Rivendare, once a rich landowner, supporter of Kel'thuzad and one of the main delinquents responsible for the spread of the plagued grain across the northern human kingdoms.\n\nHe is now commanding the scourge forces that are currently infesting the eastern parts of Stratholme. Continously fighting against the Scarlet Crusade over full control of Stratholme.\n\nVenture into the traitors lair and bring him to justice!",o="杀死瑞文戴尔男爵。",oEN="Kill Baron Rivendare.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81079]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n黑暗院长加丁及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nDarkmaster Gandling and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死黑暗院长加丁。",oEN="Kill Darkmaster Gandling.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81080]={d="有传言说，黑铁氏族的矮人效忠于一个名为拉格纳罗斯的强大邪恶存在。他被称为\"火焰之王\"，是目前居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。如果他们将其\"神明\"召唤到我们位面的努力成功，可能会给艾泽拉斯带来绝对的灾难。\n\n这一情况必须被调查并处理！\n\n前往黑石深渊，终结他们的召唤企图！",dEN="Rumors have it that the dwarves of the Dark Iron clan are serving a great evil being known as Ragnaros. Also titled \"The Firelord\", he is one of the elemental lords currently residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth. If their efforts to summon their \"deity\" to our planes are succesful, it could spell absolute disaster for Azeroth.\n\nThis situation needs to be investigated and taken care of!\n\nGo to the Blackrock Depths and put an end to their summoning efforts!",o="摧毁黑铁氏族。",oEN="Destroy the Dark Iron Clan.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81081]={d="致所有寻求财富与荣耀的冒险者！名为维克图斯的龙人、奈法利安的造物，目前居住在下黑石塔，因他对所有种族犯下的骇人罪行而被通缉。他的实验和他本身的存在都与生命为敌。",dEN="To all adventurers looking for riches and glory! The Wyrmkin and creation of Nefarian called Overlord Wyrmthalak currently residing in the Lower Blackrock Spire is wanted for his hideous crimes against all races. His experiments and his very existence go against life itself.",o="杀死维克图斯霸主。",oEN="Kill Overlord Wyrmthalak",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81083]={d="东厄运之槌废墟的居民崇拜一种非常强大的物品，名为\"神秘宝珠\"。许多旅行者曾试图与当地居民谈判获取这些宝珠。有时成功，有时……\n这一切必须结束。\n\n为了让神秘宝珠的丰富来源对所有人开放，我们必须杀死东厄运之槌废墟的现任居民。",dEN="The population of the eastern Dire Maul Ruins worship very powerful objects called \"Mystic Orbs\". Many travelers have tried to negotiate with its inhabitants to obtain the orbs from them. Sometimes with success and sometimes..\nThis has to end.\n\nTo make the plentiful source of Mystic orbs availablefor everyone we have to slay the current inhabitants of the eastern Dire Maul ruins.",o="杀死扭曲者奥兹恩。",oEN="Kill Alzzin the Wildshaper.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81084]={d="通缉！\n\n一位第三方委托人悬赏任何能击败现任戈多克食人魔之王的人。这位国王对外来者不太\"开放\"。这位匿名委托人希望扶植一位对与戈多克食人魔达成各种贸易协定稍微\"开放\"一些的国王。\n\n前往北厄运之槌，干掉现任戈多克之王。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nA third party contractor has set a reward out for anyone that can take down the current king of the Gordok Ogres. The king is not very \"open\" to outsiders. The anonymous contractor wants to instate a king that is a bit more \"open\" for various trade agreements with the Gordok Ogres.\n\nTravel to Diremaul North and take out the current king of the Gordoks.",o="杀死戈多克大王。",oEN="Slay King Gordok.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81085]={d="托塞德林王子曾是艾萨拉女王的忠实仆从，一位辛德拉，也是暗夜精灵古城埃雷萨拉斯——即今日的厄运之槌——的领袖。永恒之井毁灭后，托塞德林王子将一只恶魔囚禁在埃雷萨拉斯的废墟中，并让他的臣民汲取它的力量，从而维持对幸存辛德拉的统治。\n\n长期接触恶魔力量扭曲了托塞德林的心智，使他成为艾泽拉斯的巨大威胁。\n\n杀死王子的唯一方法是摧毁环绕能量柱的守卫，以降低力场。完成之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。王子的力量大幅削弱后，你便可以攻击并终结他。",dEN="Prince Tortheldrin was a loyal servant to Queen Azshara, a Shen'dralar and the leader of the ancient night elven city Eldre'Thalas known today as Dire Maul. After the Well of Eternity's destruction, Prince Tortheldrin maintained control over the surviving Shen'dralar by imprisoning a demon in the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and letting his subjects siphon its strength.\n\nThe exposure to demonic power twisted Tortheldrin's mind and made him a great danger to Azeroth.\n\nThe only way of killing the prince is to destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, you may attack and end him.",o="杀死托塞德林王子。",oEN="Kill Prince Tortheldrin.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81099]={d="奥金尼地穴曾是许多令人作呕的实验之地，目的都是为掌握通灵术。玛拉达尔主教带着他的疯狂居住在陵墓深处。是时候让他和那些游荡在地穴中的灵魂安息了。不过在进入奥金尼之前，你最好记住这座城市最初的守卫者的警告……不尊重死者的人……或许会与他们一同被埋葬。",dEN="The Auchenai Crypts were home to many unsavory experiments in the pursuit of mastering the necromantic arts. Exarch Maladaar resides in the depths of the tombs with his madness. It is time to put him and the spirits that walk the crypt to rest. Though you would do well to remember the warning of the city’s original guardians before entering Auchenai… those who do not respect the dead...... may become entombed along with them.",o="征服地穴并击败主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Conquer the Crypts and slay Exarch Maladaar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81100]={d="星界财团悬赏节点亲王沙法尔。虚灵结界使他们无法进入法力陵墓处理这一威胁。虽然你可能只是阻止了一个虚灵把这里洗劫一空、好给另一个腾出地方，但他们中只有一位被证明是我们的盟友。如果你愿意挑战节点亲王，赏金就归你了。",dEN="The Consortium has offered a bounty on Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Ethereal Wards prevent them from entering the Mana Tombs and dealing with this threat. Although you may just be preventing one ethereal looting the place blind to make room for another, only one of them has proven our ally. The bounty is yours to collect should you wish to challenge the Nexus-Prince.",o="征服陵墓并击败节点亲王沙法尔。",oEN="Conquer the Tombs and slay Nexus-Prince Shaffar.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81101]={d="奥金顿曾是德莱尼安葬逝者的圣地，直到暗影议会召唤出一只远古恶魔将其亵渎。被释放的魔法从未真正消散，如今疯狂的鸦人国王泰罗克已让他的狂信徒利用这股力量施展黑暗魔法。他们仍在寻找他们的主人摩摩尔，并以他的名义举行黑暗仪式。是时候清除外域的这处污点了。",dEN="Auchindoun was once a holy ground for Frainei burials until the Shadow Council defiled it by summoning an ancient demon. The magics released have never truly faded, and now the insane Talon King Ikiss has set his zealots to harnessing this power to work dark magic. They still seek their master, Murmur, and perform dark rituals in his name. It is time to clean this taint from Outlands.",o="征服大厅并击败鸦爪之王伊基斯。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Talon King Ikiss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81102]={d="暗影议会在无知与追逐力量中召唤出了摩摩尔。有些存在之所以居于宇宙的遥远角落是有原因的。暗影议会已经难以控制摩摩尔。这个存在给外域带来浩劫只是时间问题。前往暗影迷宫，在摩摩尔的力量增长到我们无法压制之前将其放逐。",dEN="The Shadow Council summoned Murmur in their ignorance and pursuit of power. There is a reason some beings reside in the far corners of the universe. The Shadow Council is having trouble keeping Murmur under control. It is only a matter of time before this being unleashed havoc on Outlands. Travel to the Shadow Labyrinth and banish Murmur before his power grows beyond what we can suppress.",o="征服迷宫并放逐摩摩尔。",oEN="Conquery the Labyrinth and banish Murmur.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81103]={d="我们最近抓获了向太阳之井走私法力容器的虚灵，凯尔萨斯计划用它们协助召唤基尔加丹。我们追踪这些法力容器到了能源舰。如果我们不中断他们的补给，他们可能会在我们准备好进攻太阳之井之前成功召唤出他们的指挥官。前往能源舰，摧毁他们的行动。",dEN="We recently captured ethereals smuggling manacells into the Sunwell where Kael’thas plans to use them to assist in summoning Kil’jaeden. We tracked those manacells back to the Mechanar. If we do not interrupt their supply they may succeed in summoning their commander before we are in place to assault the Sunwell. Travel to the Mechanar and destroy their operation.",o="关闭能源舰并击败计算者帕萨雷恩。",oEN="Shut down the Mechanar and slay Pathaleon the Calculator.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81104]={d="血精灵科学家对外域的植物群进行实验，利用纳鲁科技创造并操控生物，以赋予自己新的力量。看来这些实验并未如预期进行，已经失控。我们必须在这些被魔法改造的生物（简称 MMO）逃出实验室并引发连锁生态崩溃之前净化生态船！",dEN="Blood Elf scientists carry out experiments on the Flora in Outland, using naaru technology to create and manipulate living beings to grant themselves new powers. It seems that these experiments did not go as expected and have gotten out of control. We need to purify the Botanica before these Magically Modified Organisms, or MMOs for short, escape the lab and begin a cascading ecological collapse!",o="净化生态船并杀死迁跃扭木。",oEN="Purge the Botanica and slay Warp Splinter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81105]={d="纳鲁将他们在禁魔监狱遇到的最恐怖、最危险的生物关押了起来。凯尔萨斯派了一名典狱长和守卫前往禁魔监狱，但有哪个血精灵能在如此强大的力量环绕下不被腐化呢？周围是黑龙军团的爪牙、燃烧军团的恶魔，甚至还有上古之神的仆从……那以自由换取力量的耳语太过诱人，囚犯们已经开始挣脱束缚。赶快前往禁魔监狱，确保监狱的安全！",dEN="The Naaru jailed the most terrifying and dangerous creatures they encountered in the Arcatraz. Kael’thas sent a warden and guards to the arcatraz, but what blood elf wouldn’t become corrupted surrounded by so much power? Surrounded by agents of the black dragonflight, demons of the Burning Legion and even servants of the Old Gods… the whispers of an exchange of power for freedom were too enticing, and the prisoners have begun to break free. Make haste to the Arcatraz and secure the prison!",o="确保禁魔监狱的安全并杀死先驱斯克里思。",oEN="Secure the Arcatraz and slay Harbinger Skyriss.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81106]={d="塞纳里奥远征队派出斥候调查正在抽干赞加沼泽的蒸汽树桩之谜。自然学家拜特再也没有回来。我们担心最坏的情况。前往奴隶围栏，清除你发现的一切威胁，以便塞纳里奥远征队完成他们的任务。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has sent scouts to investigate the mystery of the steam stumps draining Zangermarsh. Naturalist Bite never returned. We fear the worst. Travel to the Slave Pens dispatch any threats you find so the Cenarion Expedition can complete their mission.",o="解放奴隶围栏并杀死夸格米拉。",oEN="Liberate the Slave Pens and slay Quagmirran.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81107]={d="对我们的孢子人盟友来说，最大的危险一直是沼泽行者。我们对外域的入侵只会让他们的处境更糟。随着纳迦在盘牙水库加固阵地，沼泽行者已开始离开他们在幽暗沼泽的最后避难所。斯波雷加对我们在赞加沼泽的成功至关重要。绝不能让黑色潜行者威胁我们的盟友。",dEN="The greatest danger to our sporeling allies has always been the marsh walkers. Our incursion into Outlands has only made their situation worse. With the Naga fortifying their position in the Coilfang Reservoir, the marsh walkers have begun leaving their last refuge in the Underbog. Sporeggar is critical to our success in Zangarmarsh. The Black Stalker must not be allowed to threaten our allies.",o="征服幽暗沼泽并杀死黑色潜行者。",oEN="Conquer the Underbog and slay The Black Stalker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81108]={d="蒸汽地窟是纳迦在赞加沼泽抽水行动的机械心脏，也是我们对抗瓦丝琪女士的重要战术目标。仅仅破坏设施是不够的。我们必须消灭那些有能力重建它的人。杀死机械师斯蒂里格和水利术士瑟斯比亚，确保机械与魔法上的修复都不可能进行。然后通过击败督军卡利瑟里斯给予决定性一击。阻止蒸汽地窟。阻止抽水。",dEN="The Steamvault is the mechanical heart of the Naga’s draining operations in Zangarmarsh and is a significant tactical target in our efforts against Lady Vashj. Simply sabotaging the facility is not enough. We must destroy those capable of rebuilding it. Slay Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia to ensure repairs both mechanic and magical are impossible. Then deal the decisive blow by defeating Warlord Kalithresh. Stop the Steamvault. Stop the draining.",o="关闭蒸汽地窟并杀死督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Shut down the Steamvault and slay Warlord Kalithresh.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81109]={d="邪兽人已经加固了地狱火堡垒。他们满足于劫掠周边地区，但报告显示他们的人数正在……增长。我们需要对堡垒发动进攻。夺取城墙的控制权，好让我们的部队发动全面进攻！",dEN="The Fel Orcs have fortified Hellfire Citadel. They have been content simply raiding the surrounding area, but the reports show their numbers are… growing. We need to launch an assault on the Citadel. Take control of the Ramparts so our forces can launch a full fledged assault!",o="征服城墙并杀死先驱者瓦兹鲁登。",oEN="Conquer the Ramparts and slay Vazruden the Herald.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81110]={d="我们的部队已将邪兽人赶下城墙。趁此机会推进到塔中，设法揭开新邪兽人诞生背后的秘密！清除途中遇到的一切威胁。",dEN="Our forces have pushed the Fel Orcs off the Ramparts. Take this opportunity to push into the Tower and attempt to uncover the secret behind the creation of new Fel Orcs! Eliminate any threats you encounter on the way.",o="征服熔炉并杀死击碎者克里丹。",oEN="Conquer the Furnace and slay Keli'dan the Breaker.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81111]={d="是时候在战斗中面对酋长卡加斯·刃拳了。只要邪兽人还能通过黑暗之门劫掠我们的补给线，我们就永远没有资源对黑暗神殿发动进攻。进入破碎大厅，终结这一威胁！",dEN="It is time to face Warchief Kargath Bladefist in battle. As long as the Fel Orcs can raid our supply lines through the Dark Portal we will never have the resources to mount an assault on the Dark Temple. Enter the Shattered Halls and put an end to this threat!",o="征服大厅并杀死酋长卡加斯·刃拳。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Warchief Kargath Bladefist.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81112]={d="时间的流动必须得到维护。即便我们的时间线只发生一点微小的改变，也可能带来灾难性的后果；可要是萨尔从未逃出敦霍尔德，那将发生怎样的崩解？我们所知晓的一切都将被抹去！时光守护者请求你立即援助。如果我们失去了过去，就必定会失去未来。",dEN="The Flow of Time must be preserved. Even one small change in our timeline could prove catastrophic, but to imagine the unraveling that would occur should Thrall never escape Durnhold? Everything we’ve ever known would be undone! The Keepers of Time request your immediate aid. If we lose the past, we surely lose the future.",o="守护时间并杀死纪元猎人。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay the Epoch Hunter.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81113]={d="任由黑暗之门的开启被阻止是很诱人，但谁能说全新的未来会带来什么？我们的敌人之所以想要篡改时间线，唯一的原因就是我们在这一条时间线中对燃烧军团构成了严重威胁。我们必须维护时间的流动！",dEN="It is tempting to allow the opening of the Dark Portal to be prevented, but who is to say what a new future would hold? The only reason our enemies would seek to alter the timeline is because we pose a serious threat to the Burning Legion in this one. We must preserve the flow of time!",o="守护时间并杀死埃欧努斯。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay Aeonus.",c="英雄，你今天完成了伟大的壮举。当需要英雄时，是 <name> 响应了召唤，这不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Heroes were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[81226]={d="这个地方之所以被称为天启之地是有原因的，<race>。这里等待着的只有湮灭：而你就是它的先驱。杀死任何想要进入这片荒芜之地的人，不留一个活口去讲述此事。你就是天启的先兆。",dEN="There is a reason this place is known as the Apocalypse, <race>. Only oblivion awaits here: and you are its herald. Slay any who would enter this barren place, and leave none alive to tell of it. You are the harbinger of the Apocalypse.",o="参与天启之战并杀死英雄们！",oEN="Participate in the Apocalypse and slay Heroes!"}
Q[81244]={d="告示板向那些能够完成普通难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Normal dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成普通地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Normal dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服英雄地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Heroic dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81245]={d="告示板向那些能够完成英雄难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Heroic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成英雄地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Heroic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服史诗地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Mythic dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81246]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服普通地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Normal dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81247]={d="告示板向那些能够完成普通难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Normal dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成普通地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Normal dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服史诗地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Mythic dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81248]={d="告示板向那些能够完成英雄难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Heroic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成英雄地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Heroic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服英雄地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Heroic dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81249]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服普通地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Normal dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81250]={d="号召所有战士\n\n在艾尔文森林翠绿的山丘之间坐落着人类王国暴风城！突袭暴风城，杀死现任人类领袖伯瓦尔·弗塔根！",dEN="Calling all Warriors\n\nWithin the green hills of the Elwynn Forest lies the human nation of Stormwind! Raid Stormwind and slay the current leader of the humans Bolvar Fordragon!",o="在暴风城杀死伯瓦尔·弗塔根。",oEN="Slay Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81251]={d="在丹莫罗寒冷群山的深处住着矮人。他们地下的城市名为铁炉堡。围攻铁炉堡，杀死矮人领袖麦格尼·铜须！",dEN="Deep down in the frosty mountains of Dun Morogh is where the dwarves live. Their city below the surface is called Ironforge. Lay siege to Ironforge and slay the dwarven Leader Magni Bronzebeard!",o="在铁炉堡杀死麦格尼·铜须和大工匠梅卡托克。",oEN="Slay Magni Bronzebeard and High Tinker Mekkatorque in Ironforge.",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81252]={d="在卡利姆多西北部、迷雾之海之中矗立着世界之树泰达希尔。在它的树冠中隐藏着暗夜精灵的家园达纳苏斯。攀上泰达希尔，进入达纳苏斯，杀死暗夜精灵领袖泰兰德·语风！",dEN="In the north west of Kalimdor inside the Veiled Sea stands the world tree Teldrassil. Hidden within it's crown lies Darnassus the home of the night elves. Climb Teldrassil, enter Darnassus and slay the leader of the night elves Tyrande Whisperwind!",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81253]={d="在如今被称为杜隆塔尔的红色荒漠中，兽人建起了一座坚固的城市。围攻奥格瑞玛，击败兽人领袖萨尔。",dEN="In the red deserts now known as Durotar the orcs have built themselves a formidable city. Lay Siege to Orgrimmar and take down the orcish leader Thrall.",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81254]={d="在洛丹伦废墟的深处坐落着幽暗城。这里是摆脱了巫妖王影响的亡者的家园。攻击幽暗城，杀死亡者领袖希尔瓦娜斯·风行者！",dEN="Deep within the ruins of Loraderon lies the Undercity. Home to the undead that have freed themselves of the influence of the Lichking. Attack Undercity and kill the leader of the undead Sylvanas Windrunner!",o="杀死幽暗城的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Slay Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity.",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81255]={d="在莫高雷山谷最陡峭的石柱之上，牛头人建起了他们的家园。雷霆崖是一座独一无二的城市。烧毁它，并杀死牛头人领袖凯恩·血蹄。",dEN="On top of the steepest pillars in the valley of Mulgore is where the tauren have built their home. Thunder Bluff is a city like no other. Burn it down and slay the leader of the tauren Cairne Bloodhoof.",o="在雷霆崖杀死凯恩·血蹄。",oEN="Slay Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="敌方领袖仍在顽抗。攻陷他们的要塞，将他们击溃。",pEN="The enemy leaders still stand defiant. Storm their stronghold and lay them low.",c="敌方首领已被击毙！这是对我们事业的决定性一击。街道被我们敌人的鲜血染红。胜利！",cEN="The enemy's leadership has been struck down! A decisive blow for our cause. The streets run red with the blood of our foes. Victory!"}
Q[81256]={p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81257]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 2v2 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 2v2 Arena Matches",p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81258]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 3v3 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 3v3 Arena Matches",p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81259]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不参加一场战争游戏，决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into a Wargame and fight to the death.",o="参加一场战争游戏",oEN="Participate in a Wargame"}
Q[81260]={d="英雄！我们在战场上需要你的援助！敌军正在各条战线上争夺我们的主权！充实我们的队伍，带领我们走向胜利！在任意战略要地协助我们；带领我们的士兵穿过灰谷战场——木材对制造战争机器和建造家园至关重要！夺取风暴之眼中的塔楼控制权，我们可以夺回虚空风暴的潜在能量，将其从凯尔萨斯的掌控中解放出来，从而强化我们的部队！守住阿拉希的战略要地，那里采集的资源至关重要！在双子峰与对手交锋，该地对巩固我们在暮光高地的阵地至关重要！你在这些地点的任何帮助，都是我们赢得这场战争的关键！胜利必将属于我们",dEN="Hero! We require your aid upon the battlefields! The enemy forces are contesting our claim on all fronts! Bolster our ranks, and lead us to victory! Aid us on any of the strategic locations; Lead our soldiers across the battlefields of Ashenvale, the lumber is essential for creating our war machines and building our homes! Take control of towers in the Eye of the Storm, we can reclaim the latent energies of the Netherstorm and free it from Kael'thas control to empower our forces! Hold the strategic locations within Arathi, the resources gathered there are essential! Contest the opposition in Twin Peaks, the location is an essential in fortifying our positions within the Twilight Highlands! Your aid in any of these locations are essential to our victory in this war! Victory will be ours",o="赢得任意一场战场比赛，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",oEN="Win any battleground match and return to the Call Board for your reward.",p="战斗仍在继续。从战场凯旋后再来领取你的奖励。",pEN="The battle rages on. Return victorious from the battleground to claim your reward.",c="战场上的荣耀！你的胜利带来了荣誉与声望。领取你的奖励吧，勇士。",cEN="Glory on the battlefield! Your triumph brings honor and renown. Claim your reward, champion."}
Q[81261]={d="还没准备好进入评级竞技场？想在跻身大联盟之前打磨你的战斗技艺？练习赛竞技场可以让你检验自己的胆识！\n\n练习赛不会造成任何评级损失，还能让你在竞技场中测试自己的构筑！",dEN="Not quite ready to step into rated arenas? Want to prune your fighting toolkit before heading into the big-leagues? Skirmish Arenas will allow you to test your grit!\n\nSkrimishes do not incur any rating loss and allow you to test your build in Arenas!",o="参加 10 场 1v1 练习赛竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 1v1 Skirmish Arena Matches"}
Q[81262]={d="还没准备好进入评级竞技场？想在跻身大联盟之前打磨你的战斗技艺？练习赛竞技场可以让你检验自己的胆识！\n\n练习赛不会造成任何评级损失，还能让你在竞技场中测试自己的构筑！",dEN="Not quite ready to step into rated arenas? Want to prune your fighting toolkit before heading into the big-leagues? Skirmish Arenas will allow you to test your grit!\n\nSkrimishes do not incur any rating loss and allow you to test your build in Arenas!",o="参加 10 场 2v2 练习赛竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 2v2 Skirmish Arena Matches"}
Q[81263]={d="许多年来，安其拉的古老废墟一直荒废而沉寂。塞纳里奥议会始终密切关注着那片废墟，但除了偶尔出现的巨型虫子之外，那其实是相当安静的差事。\n\n直到最近，我们才收到塞纳里奥议会关于墙内活动频繁的消息。他们目前正在筹备一次远征进行调查。\n\n加入塞纳里奥部队，调查那片废墟。杀死你在那里发现的任何虫子和敌对生物。",dEN="For many years the old ruins of Ahn'Qiraj laid deserted and dormant. The Cenarion Circle always kept a close eye on those ruins but outside of a few oversized bugs here and there it was quite a silent duty.\n\nOnly very recently have we received messages from the Cenarion Circle about high activity within the Walls. They are currently preparing an expedition to investigate.\n\nJoin the Cenarion forces and investigate the ruins. Slay any bugs and other hostile creatures that you find there.",o="阻止安其拉的入侵。",oEN="Stop the Ahn'Qiraji invasion.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81264]={d="历史记载，数千年前强大的古拉巴什帝国被一场大规模内战撕成碎片。一群颇具影响力的巨魔祭司召唤出一位古老而可怕的血神——夺灵者哈卡的化身。最终，祭司们被击败并遭到流放。\n\n如今，我们收到报告称，一群自称哈卡莱的新祭司正试图重现仪式，将哈卡召唤到我们的世界。\n\n前往祖尔格拉布，阻止那些仪式者将哈卡释放到艾泽拉斯！",dEN="History says that thousands of years ago the powerful Gurubashi Empire was torn apart by a massive civil war. An influential group of troll priests called forth the avatar of an ancient and terrible blood-god - Hakkar the Soulflayer. Ultimately, the priests were defeated and exiled.\n\nNow in the current day we have received reports that a new group of priests that call themselves the Hakkari are trying to recreate the rituals to summon Hakkar to our world.\n\nTravel to Zul'Gurub and stop the ritualists from unleashing Hakkar onto Azeroth!",o="让夺灵者永远沉默！",oEN="Silence the Soulflayer!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81265]={d="黑龙奈法利安，死亡之翼之子，目前正在黑石山上层尖塔中调动他的军队，其中包括黑石氏族的兽人、尖石食人魔和燃棘巨魔。但这些甚至都不是这条黑龙藏在那块岩石中的最强力量。彩色巨龙、黑龙、黑色龙人、雏龙以及所有已知巨龙军团的蛋等等。他创造终极巨龙军团的实验已经严重失控，危险至极。\n\n我们必须终结他的疯狂，以及他那支由龙类憎恶组成的炽热大军。\n\n集结起来，前往黑翼之巢，杀死奈法利安。",dEN="The dragon Nefarian, son of Deathwing, is currently mobilizing his armies consisting of orcs from the Blackrock clan, Spirestone Ogres and Smolderthorne Trolls in the upper spires of the Blackrock Mountain. But those aren't even the most powerful forces the black dragon is hiding within that rock. Chromatic dragons, black dragons, black wyrmkin, whelps and eggs of all known dragon flights and many more. His experiments in creating the ultimate dragon flight have gotten far out of control and way too dangerous.\n\nWe need to put an end to his madness and his fiery army of dragonic abominations.\n\nGather up and travel to the Blackwing Lair and slay Nefarian.",o="杀死奈法利安！",oEN="Slay Nefarian!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81266]={d="在黑石山下的洞穴深处，有一个被黑铁矮人称为\"熔火之心\"的地方。那是一个布满熔岩魔像、火元素和其他炽热生物的深渊。它们全都效忠于被称为火焰之王拉格纳罗斯的存在，他是居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。\n\n我们的间谍报告称，他们正在准备最后的仪式，要将拉格纳罗斯召唤到我们的世界。召唤一位元素领主可能会给整个艾泽拉斯带来巨大的灾难与毁灭。\n\n必须不惜一切代价阻止这一切！集结一支军队，前往熔火之心，杀死任何挡路的人。",dEN="Deep down in the caverns below the Blackrock Mountain lies a place the Dark Iron Dwarves call the \"Molten Core\". A chasm filled with golems made of lava, fire elementals and other fiery creatures. They all serve the being known as Ragnaros the Firelord, one of the elemental lords residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth.\n\nOur spy reports tell us that they are preparing the final rituals to summon Ragnaros to our world. The summoning of an elemental Lord could cause great disasters and destruction all around Azeroth.\n\nThat must be prevented at any cost! Gather an army, travel to the Molten Core and slay anyone that stands in your way.",o="熄灭火焰之王！",oEN="Extinguish the Firelord!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81267]={d="我们的斥候报告，死亡之翼的女儿奥妮克希亚目前正藏身在尘泥沼泽深处的巢穴中。在被人发现她就是卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托女士，并且是暴风城国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩失踪的罪魁祸首之后，她逃到了那里。\n\n我们必须趁她最虚弱的时候发动攻击！\n\n召集所有有能力的冒险者，前往奥妮克希亚的巢穴，干掉她！",dEN="Our scouts report that Onyxia, the daughter of Deathwing, is currently hiding inside her lair deep in the swamps of the Dustwallow Marsh. She fled there after she was discovered to be Lady Katrana Prestor and was responsible for the disappearance of Varian Wrynn, King of Stormwind.\n\nWe need to strike now when she's at her weakest!\n\nGather any able-bodied adventurers, travel to Onyxias lair and take her out!",o="杀死奥妮克希亚！",oEN="Slay Onyxia!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81268]={d="虽然血色十字军的主要目标是抗击天灾，但他们对所有生者种族同样极其危险。在盲目的狂热中，他们真的相信任何非人类种族要么是天灾的一员，要么与之结盟。",dEN="Although the Scarlet Crusades main focus is to fight the Scourge they are ever so dangerous to all the living races too. In their blind fanaticism they actually believe that any non-human race is either part of the scourge or allied with them.",o="在斯坦索姆阻止血色十字军。",oEN="Stop the Scarlet Crusade in Stratholme.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81269]={d="瑞文戴尔男爵曾是一位富有的地主，克尔苏加德的支持者，也是瘟疫谷物在北方人类王国蔓延的主要罪魁祸首之一。\n\n如今他指挥着目前盘踞在斯坦索姆东部的天灾部队，不断与血色十字军争夺斯坦索姆的完全控制权。\n\n潜入叛徒的巢穴，将他绳之以法！",dEN="Baron Rivendare, once a rich landowner, supporter of Kel'thuzad and one of the main delinquents responsible for the spread of the plagued grain across the northern human kingdoms.\n\nHe is now commanding the scourge forces that are currently infesting the eastern parts of Stratholme. Continously fighting against the Scarlet Crusade over full control of Stratholme.\n\nVenture into the traitors lair and bring him to justice!",o="杀死瑞文戴尔男爵。",oEN="Kill Baron Rivendare.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81270]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n黑暗院长加丁及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nDarkmaster Gandling and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死黑暗院长加丁。",oEN="Kill Darkmaster Gandling.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81271]={d="有传言说，黑铁氏族的矮人效忠于一个名为拉格纳罗斯的强大邪恶存在。他被称为\"火焰之王\"，是目前居住在艾泽拉斯深处元素位面的元素领主之一。如果他们将其\"神明\"召唤到我们位面的努力成功，可能会给艾泽拉斯带来绝对的灾难。\n\n这一情况必须被调查并处理！\n\n前往黑石深渊，终结他们的召唤企图！",dEN="Rumors have it that the dwarves of the Dark Iron clan are serving a great evil being known as Ragnaros. Also titled \"The Firelord\", he is one of the elemental lords currently residing in the elemental planes deep inside Azeroth. If their efforts to summon their \"deity\" to our planes are succesful, it could spell absolute disaster for Azeroth.\n\nThis situation needs to be investigated and taken care of!\n\nGo to the Blackrock Depths and put an end to their summoning efforts!",o="摧毁黑铁氏族。",oEN="Destroy the Dark Iron Clan.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81272]={d="致所有寻求财富与荣耀的冒险者！名为维克图斯的龙人、奈法利安的造物，目前居住在下黑石塔，因他对所有种族犯下的骇人罪行而被通缉。他的实验和他本身的存在都与生命为敌。",dEN="To all adventurers looking for riches and glory! The Wyrmkin and creation of Nefarian called Overlord Wyrmthalak currently residing in the Lower Blackrock Spire is wanted for his hideous crimes against all races. His experiments and his very existence go against life itself.",o="杀死维克图斯霸主。",oEN="Kill Overlord Wyrmthalak",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81273]={d="我们收到报告称，上黑石塔内的活动突然增加。看起来黑龙奈法利安正在调动他的兽人部队，准备对火焰之王的巢穴发动全面进攻，企图夺取黑石山的完全控制权。\n我们绝不能让他得逞！如果奈法利安成功招募黑铁矮人为其效力，对我们所有人都可能是灾难性的！\n\n目前达基萨斯将军负责军备工作。\n\n前往上黑石塔，杀死达基萨斯将军和他的爪牙！",dEN="We have received reports of a sudden rise of activity within the Upper Blackrock Spire. It seems that the black dragon Nefarian is mobilizing his orcish forces to prepare an all-out assault on the lair of the Firelord in an attempt to seize full control over the Blackrock Mountain.\nWe can't let this happen! If Nefarian manages to recruit the Dark Iron Dwarves for his efforts it could be disastrous for all of us!\n\nCurrently General Drakkisath is in charge of the arming effort.\n\nTravel to the Upper Blackrock Spire to kill General Drakkisath and his minons!",o="终结达基萨斯的暴政。",oEN="Put an end to Drakkisath's tyranny.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81274]={d="东厄运之槌废墟的居民崇拜一种非常强大的物品，名为\"神秘宝珠\"。许多旅行者曾试图与当地居民谈判获取这些宝珠。有时成功，有时失败。\n这一切必须结束。\n\n为了让神秘宝珠的丰富来源对所有人开放，我们必须杀死东厄运之槌废墟的现任居民。",dEN="The population of the eastern Dire Maul Ruins worship very powerful objects called \"Mystic Orbs\". Many travelers have tried to negotiate with its inhabitants to obtain the orbs from them. Sometimes with success and sometimes.\nThis has to end.\n\nTo make the plentiful source of Mystic orbs availablefor everyone we have to slay the current inhabitants of the eastern Dire Maul ruins.",o="杀死扭曲者奥兹恩。",oEN="Kill Alzzin the Wildshaper.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81275]={d="通缉！\n\n一位第三方委托人悬赏任何能击败现任戈多克食人魔之王的人。这位国王对外来者不太\"开放\"。这位匿名委托人希望扶植一位对与戈多克食人魔达成各种贸易协定稍微\"开放\"一些的国王。\n\n前往北厄运之槌，干掉现任戈多克之王。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nA third party contractor has set a reward out for anyone that can take down the current king of the Gordok Ogres. The king is not very \"open\" to outsiders. The anonymous contractor wants to instate a king that is a bit more \"open\" for various trade agreements with the Gordok Ogres.\n\nTravel to Diremaul North and take out the current king of the Gordoks.",o="杀死戈多克大王。",oEN="Slay King Gordok.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81276]={d="托塞德林王子曾是艾萨拉女王的忠实仆从，一位辛德拉，也是暗夜精灵古城埃雷萨拉斯——即今日的厄运之槌——的领袖。永恒之井毁灭后，托塞德林王子将一只恶魔囚禁在埃雷萨拉斯的废墟中，并让他的臣民汲取它的力量，从而维持对幸存辛德拉的统治。\n\n长期接触恶魔力量扭曲了托塞德林的心智，使他成为艾泽拉斯的巨大威胁。\n\n杀死王子的唯一方法是摧毁环绕能量柱的守卫，以降低力场。完成之后，摧毁伊莫塔尔。王子的力量大幅削弱后，你便可以攻击并终结他。",dEN="Prince Tortheldrin was a loyal servant to Queen Azshara, a Shen'dralar and the leader of the ancient night elven city Eldre'Thalas known today as Dire Maul. After the Well of Eternity's destruction, Prince Tortheldrin maintained control over the surviving Shen'dralar by imprisoning a demon in the ruins of Eldre'Thalas and letting his subjects siphon its strength.\n\nThe exposure to demonic power twisted Tortheldrin's mind and made him a great danger to Azeroth.\n\nThe only way of killing the prince is to destroy the guardians surrounding the pylons to lower the force field. When this is done, destroy Immol'thar. With the Prince's power greatly reduced, you may attack and end him.",o="杀死托塞德林王子。",oEN="Kill Prince Tortheldrin.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81277]={d="我不愿在没有更多训练的情况下派你去执行如此危险的任务，但威胁已经出现。在应对这一威胁之前，先召集一支由熟练冒险者组成的小队。\n\n深入哀嚎洞穴，在穆坦努斯的噩梦进入我们的世界之前阻止他。",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nTravel deep into the Wailing Caverns and stop Mutanus before his nightmare enters our world.",o="进入哀嚎洞穴并杀死吞噬者穆坦努斯。",oEN="Enter The Wailing Caverns and slay Mutanus the Devourer.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81278]={d="我不愿在没有更多训练的情况下派你去执行如此危险的任务，但威胁已经出现。在应对这一威胁之前，先召集一支由熟练冒险者组成的小队。\n\n找到进入影牙城堡内院的方法。一路杀穿幽灵与狼人的军队，在阿鲁高法师的阴影蔓延到银松森林之外前杀死他。",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nFind a way to enter the inner courtyard of Shadowfang Keep. Fight your way through the army of ghosts and worgen and kill Archmage Argugal before his shadow extends past Silverpine Forest.",o="进入影牙城堡并杀死阿鲁高法师。",oEN="Enter Shadowfang Keep and slay Archmage Arugal.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81279]={d="许多年来，安其拉的古老废墟一直荒废而沉寂。塞纳里奥议会始终密切关注着那片废墟，但除了偶尔出现的巨型虫子之外，那其实是相当安静的差事。\n\n直到最近，我们才收到塞纳里奥议会关于墙内活动频繁的消息。他们目前正在筹备一次远征进行调查。\n\n加入塞纳里奥部队，调查那片废墟。杀死你在那里发现的任何虫子和敌对生物。",dEN="For many years the old ruins of Ahn'Qiraj laid deserted and dormant. The Cenarion Circle always kept a close eye on those ruins but outside of a few oversized bugs here and there it was quite a silent duty.\n\nOnly very recently have we received messages from the Cenarion Circle about high activity within the Walls. They are currently preparing an expedition to investigate.\n\nJoin the Cenarion forces and investigate the ruins. Slay any bugs and other hostile creatures that you find there.",o="阻止其拉虫人的入侵。",oEN="Stop the Qiraji invasion.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81280]={d="整个艾泽拉斯都在传，纳克萨玛斯的居民正变得越来越大、越来越强。我正在寻找一队强大的英雄进入纳克萨玛斯，终结他们首领的性命。拜托了……<name>，你准备好迎接这个挑战了吗？",dEN="Word around Azeroth has it that the denizens of Naxxramas are getting bigger and stronger. I'm looking for a band of strong Heroes to enter Naxxramas and end the lives of their leaders. Please.. <name>, are you up for the challenge?",o="杀死纳克萨玛斯的首领。",oEN="Slay the bosses of Naxxramas.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81281]={d="我不愿在没有更多训练的情况下派你去执行如此危险的任务，但威胁已经出现。在应对这一威胁之前，先召集一支由熟练冒险者组成的小队。\n\n肃清盘踞在死亡矿井中的强盗。终结首领艾德温·范克里夫，以确保威胁被真正清除。",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nRout the bandits that have taken up residence in the Deadmines. Put an end to leader Edwin Vancleef to ensure the threat is truly dealt with.",o="进入死亡矿井并杀死艾德温·范克里夫。",oEN="Enter The Deadmines and slay Edwin Vancleef.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81282]={d="英雄，我还有另一项危险的任务交给你。希望你身边有些值得信赖的同伴。\n\n侏儒们做得太过分了。他们在诺莫瑞根摆弄的科技太危险了……这要到什么时候才是个头？如果不加以阻止，冒险者们会整天玩弄科技而不是摧毁它……你明白我的意思。去摧毁机械师瑟玛普拉格。",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nThe gnomes have gone too far. The technology they play with in Gnomergan is too dangerous... where does it end? Adventurers will be playing on technology all day instead of destroying it if we don't... you get the idea. Go destroy Mekgineer Thermaplugg.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81283]={d="英雄，我还有另一项危险的任务交给你。希望你身边有些值得信赖的同伴。\n\n我们的间谍告诉我们，刺鬃酋长夏尔嘉一直在与天灾谈判。进入剃刀沼泽，在天灾与野猪人结成同盟之前干掉夏尔嘉！",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nOur spies tell us that Charlga Razorflank has been negotiating with the Scourge. Enter Razorfen Kraul and bring Charlga down before an alliance between the scourge and quilboars can be made!",o="进入剃刀沼泽并杀死刺鬃酋长夏尔嘉。",oEN="Enter Razorfen Kraul and slay Charlga Razorflank.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81284]={d="英雄，我还有另一项危险的任务交给你。希望你身边有些值得信赖的同伴。\n\n黑澗深渊中有一个本不该被打扰的生物正在苏醒。别让阿库麦尔浮出水面。",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nA creature is stirring that should have never been disturbed in Blackfathom Depths. Do not allow Aku'mai to reach the surface.",o="进入黑澗深渊并杀死阿库麦尔。",oEN="Enter Blackfathom Deeps and slay Aku'mai.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81285]={d="英雄，你的力量已经成长。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去执行自杀任务了……几乎。\n\n奥法师杜安至今还欠着图书馆的逾期罚款。这完全不可接受。前往血色修道院，给予他公正且完全正当的惩罚。死亡。",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nArcanist Doan still has unpaid library late fees. It's totally unacceptable. Visit the Scarlet Monastary and deliver his fair and totally justified punishment. Death.",o="进入血色修道院并杀死奥法师杜安。",oEN="Enter The Scarlet Monastery and slay Arcanist Doan.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81286]={d="英雄，你的力量已经成长。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去执行自杀任务了……几乎。\n\n我们本来乐意让血色十字军自生自灭……可你能相信吗，那些狂信徒中的一个竟然想竞选总统？！别误会……我反对他们阻止亡灵，但当你开始谈论人类是优等种族，并靠仇恨与恐惧展开竞选时，你就开始看起来像是该被一斧子劈在脸上的候选人了。去把他们全部杀光。",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nWe were content to leave the Scarlet Crusade to their own devices... but can you believe one of those fanatics wants to run for President?! Don't get me wrong... I'm opposed to them stopping the undead, but when you start talking about how humans are the master race and run on a campaign of hate and fear you start to look like a good candidate for an axe to the face. Go kill the lot of them.",o="进入血色修道院并杀死赫洛德和血色指挥官莫格莱尼。",oEN="Enter The Scarlet Monastery and slay Herod and Scarlet Commander Mograine.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81287]={d="英雄，你的力量已经成长。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去执行自杀任务了……几乎。\n\n看来我们没能及时阻止野猪人与天灾的谈判。一位强大的巫妖正在剃刀高地组建亡灵大军。这次彻底杀死寒冰使者阿门纳尔。",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nIt looks like we wern't quick enough to prevent the quilboar negotiations with the Scourge. A powerful lich is raising an undead army in Razorfen Downs. Kill Amnennar the Coldbringer for good this time.",o="进入剃刀高地并杀死寒冰使者阿门纳尔。",oEN="Enter Razorfen Downs and slay Amnennar the Coldbringer.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81288]={d="我开始觉得你可能真有潜力。想证明我看得没错吗？\n\n看来我是唯一一个在历史课上认真听讲的人？你听说过沙怒氏族吗？他们要对塔纳利斯历史上最血腥的篇章负责，这可不是小事！在乌克兹·沙顶酋长的氏族强大到足以挑战地精之前杀死他。",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nIt seems I'm the only one who paid attention in history class? Every heard of the Sandfury clan? They were responsible for the most bloody chapter in the history of Tanaris, and that's saying something! Kill Chief Ukorz Sandscalp before his clan is strong enough to challenge the goblins.",o="进入祖尔法拉克并杀死乌克兹·沙顶酋长。",oEN="Enter Zul'Farrak and slay Chief Ukorz Sandscalp.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81289]={d="我开始觉得你可能真有潜力。想证明我看得没错吗？\n\n这个不是上头派给我的，不过……你肯定不信！有个半人马说我妈胖！我知道一个完美的复仇办法。前往玛拉顿……然后杀了他的妈！胖的那个就是她。这就让他长记性了。",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nThis one didn't come from my superiors but... You won't believe this! Some centaur called my mom fat! I know the perfect way to get revenge. Travel to Mauradon... and kill his mom! She's the fat one. That'll teach him.",o="进入玛拉顿并杀死瑟莱德丝公主。",oEN="Enter Maraudon and slay Princess Theradras.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81290]={d="我开始觉得你可能真有潜力。想证明我看得没错吗？\n\n黑铁矮人在荒芜之地挖出了一座古老的泰坦城市。前往那座古城，摧毁矮人们想为他们的主人取回的一切。",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nThe Dark Iron Dwarves have unearthed an ancient Titan city in the Badlands. Travel to the ancient city and destroy whatever it is the dwarves hope to retrieve for their master.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81291]={d="我们几乎已经准备好对燃烧军团发动最后一击。若想在太阳之井高地成功发起攻势，我们必须弄清楚将要面对什么。突袭魔导师平台。我们必须夺取占卜宝珠的控制权才能继续推进。",dEN="We are nearly ready to strike the final blow to the Burning Legion. If we are to mount a successful offensive on Sunwell Plateau we have to know what we are walking into. Assault the Magisters’ Terrace. We must gain control of the Scrying Orb to push forward.",o="征服平台并杀死凯尔萨斯·逐日者。",oEN="Conquer the Terrace and slay Kael'thas Sunstrider.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81292]={d="奥金尼地穴曾是许多令人作呕的实验之地，目的都是为掌握通灵术。玛拉达尔主教带着他的疯狂居住在陵墓深处。是时候让他和那些游荡在地穴中的灵魂安息了。不过在进入奥金尼之前，你最好记住这座城市最初的守卫者的警告……不尊重死者的人……或许会与他们一同被埋葬。",dEN="The Auchenai Crypts were home to many unsavory experiments in the pursuit of mastering the necromantic arts. Exarch Maladaar resides in the depths of the tombs with his madness. It is time to put him and the spirits that walk the crypt to rest. Though you would do well to remember the warning of the city’s original guardians before entering Auchenai… those who do not respect the dead...... may become entombed along with them.",o="征服地穴并击败主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Conquer the Crypts and slay Exarch Maladaar.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81293]={d="星界财团悬赏节点亲王沙法尔。虚灵结界使他们无法进入法力陵墓处理这一威胁。虽然你可能只是阻止了一个虚灵把这里洗劫一空、好给另一个腾出地方，但他们中只有一位被证明是我们的盟友。如果你愿意挑战节点亲王，赏金就归你了。",dEN="The Consortium has offered a bounty on Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Ethereal Wards prevent them from entering the Mana Tombs and dealing with this threat. Although you may just be preventing one ethereal looting the place blind to make room for another, only one of them has proven our ally. The bounty is yours to collect should you wish to challenge the Nexus-Prince.",o="征服陵墓并击败节点亲王沙法尔。",oEN="Conquer the Tombs and slay Nexus-Prince Shaffar.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81294]={d="奥金顿曾是德莱尼安葬逝者的圣地，直到暗影议会召唤出一只远古恶魔将其亵渎。被释放的魔法从未真正消散，如今疯狂的鸦人国王泰罗克已让他的狂信徒利用这股力量施展黑暗魔法。他们仍在寻找他们的主人摩摩尔，并以他的名义举行黑暗仪式。是时候清除外域的这处污点了。",dEN="Auchindoun was once a holy ground for Frainei burials until the Shadow Council defiled it by summoning an ancient demon. The magics released have never truly faded, and now the insane Talon King Ikiss has set his zealots to harnessing this power to work dark magic. They still seek their master, Murmur, and perform dark rituals in his name. It is time to clean this taint from Outlands.",o="征服大厅并击败鸦爪之王伊基斯。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Talon King Ikiss.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81295]={d="暗影议会在无知与追逐力量中召唤出了摩摩尔。有些存在之所以居于宇宙的遥远角落是有原因的。暗影议会已经难以控制摩摩尔。这个存在给外域带来浩劫只是时间问题。前往暗影迷宫，在摩摩尔的力量增长到我们无法压制之前将其放逐。",dEN="The Shadow Council summoned Murmur in their ignorance and pursuit of power. There is a reason some beings reside in the far corners of the universe. The Shadow Council is having trouble keeping Murmur under control. It is only a matter of time before this being unleashed havoc on Outlands. Travel to the Shadow Labyrinth and banish Murmur before his power grows beyond what we can suppress.",o="征服迷宫并放逐摩摩尔。",oEN="Conquery the Labyrinth and banish Murmur.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81296]={d="我们最近抓获了向太阳之井走私法力容器的虚灵，凯尔萨斯计划用它们协助召唤基尔加丹。我们追踪这些法力容器到了能源舰。如果我们不中断他们的补给，他们可能会在我们准备好进攻太阳之井之前成功召唤出他们的指挥官。前往能源舰，摧毁他们的行动。",dEN="We recently captured ethereals smuggling manacells into the Sunwell where Kael’thas plans to use them to assist in summoning Kil’jaeden. We tracked those manacells back to the Mechanar. If we do not interrupt their supply they may succeed in summoning their commander before we are in place to assault the Sunwell. Travel to the Mechanar and destroy their operation.",o="关闭能源舰并击败计算者帕萨雷恩。",oEN="Shut down the Mechanar and slay Pathaleon the Calculator.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81297]={d="血精灵科学家对外域的植物群进行实验，利用纳鲁科技创造并操控生物，以赋予自己新的力量。看来这些实验并未如预期进行，已经失控。我们必须在这些被魔法改造的生物（简称 MMO）逃出实验室并引发连锁生态崩溃之前净化生态船！",dEN="Blood Elf scientists carry out experiments on the Flora in Outland, using naaru technology to create and manipulate living beings to grant themselves new powers. It seems that these experiments did not go as expected and have gotten out of control. We need to purify the Botanica before these Magically Modified Organisms, or MMOs for short, escape the lab and begin a cascading ecological collapse!",o="净化生态船并杀死迁跃扭木。",oEN="Purge the Botanica and slay Warp Splinter.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81298]={d="纳鲁将他们在禁魔监狱遇到的最恐怖、最危险的生物关押了起来。凯尔萨斯派了一名典狱长和守卫前往禁魔监狱，但有哪个血精灵能在如此强大的力量环绕下不被腐化呢？周围是黑龙军团的爪牙、燃烧军团的恶魔，甚至还有上古之神的仆从……那以自由换取力量的耳语太过诱人，囚犯们已经开始挣脱束缚。赶快前往禁魔监狱，确保监狱的安全！",dEN="The Naaru jailed the most terrifying and dangerous creatures they encountered in the Arcatraz. Kael’thas sent a warden and guards to the arcatraz, but what blood elf wouldn’t become corrupted surrounded by so much power? Surrounded by agents of the black dragonflight, demons of the Burning Legion and even servants of the Old Gods… the whispers of an exchange of power for freedom were too enticing, and the prisoners have begun to break free. Make haste to the Arcatraz and secure the prison!",o="确保禁魔监狱的安全并杀死先驱斯克里思。",oEN="Secure the Arcatraz and slay Harbinger Skyriss.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81299]={d="塞纳里奥远征队派出斥候调查正在抽干赞加沼泽的蒸汽树桩之谜。自然学家拜特再也没有回来。我们担心最坏的情况。前往奴隶围栏，清除你发现的一切威胁，以便塞纳里奥远征队完成他们的任务。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has sent scouts to investigate the mystery of the steam stumps draining Zangermarsh. Naturalist Bite never returned. We fear the worst. Travel to the Slave Pens dispatch any threats you find so the Cenarion Expedition can complete their mission.",o="解放奴隶围栏并杀死夸格米拉。",oEN="Liberate the Slave Pens and slay Quagmirran.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81300]={d="对我们的孢子人盟友来说，最大的危险一直是沼泽行者。我们对外域的入侵只会让他们的处境更糟。随着纳迦在盘牙水库加固阵地，沼泽行者已开始离开他们在幽暗沼泽的最后避难所。斯波雷加对我们在赞加沼泽的成功至关重要。绝不能让黑色潜行者威胁我们的盟友。",dEN="The greatest danger to our sporeling allies has always been the marsh walkers. Our incursion into Outlands has only made their situation worse. With the Naga fortifying their position in the Coilfang Reservoir, the marsh walkers have begun leaving their last refuge in the Underbog. Sporeggar is critical to our success in Zangarmarsh. The Black Stalker must not be allowed to threaten our allies.",o="征服幽暗沼泽并杀死黑色潜行者。",oEN="Conquer the Underbog and slay The Black Stalker.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81301]={d="蒸汽地窟是纳迦在赞加沼泽抽水行动的机械心脏，也是我们对抗瓦丝琪女士的重要战术目标。仅仅破坏设施是不够的。我们必须消灭那些有能力重建它的人。杀死机械师斯蒂里格和水利术士瑟斯比亚，确保机械与魔法上的修复都不可能进行。然后通过击败督军卡利瑟里斯给予决定性一击。阻止蒸汽地窟。阻止抽水。",dEN="The Steamvault is the mechanical heart of the Naga’s draining operations in Zangarmarsh and is a significant tactical target in our efforts against Lady Vashj. Simply sabotaging the facility is not enough. We must destroy those capable of rebuilding it. Slay Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia to ensure repairs both mechanic and magical are impossible. Then deal the decisive blow by defeating Warlord Kalithresh. Stop the Steamvault. Stop the draining.",o="关闭蒸汽地窟并杀死督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Shut down the Steamvault and slay Warlord Kalithresh.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81302]={d="邪兽人已经加固了地狱火堡垒。他们满足于劫掠周边地区，但报告显示他们的人数正在……增长。我们需要对堡垒发动进攻。夺取城墙的控制权，好让我们的部队发动全面进攻！",dEN="The Fel Orcs have fortified Hellfire Citadel. They have been content simply raiding the surrounding area, but the reports show their numbers are… growing. We need to launch an assault on the Citadel. Take control of the Ramparts so our forces can launch a full fledged assault!",o="征服城墙并杀死先驱者瓦兹鲁登。",oEN="Conquer the Ramparts and slay Vazruden the Herald.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81303]={d="我们的部队已将邪兽人赶下城墙。趁此机会推进到塔中，设法揭开新邪兽人诞生背后的秘密！清除途中遇到的一切威胁。",dEN="Our forces have pushed the Fel Orcs off the Ramparts. Take this opportunity to push into the Tower and attempt to uncover the secret behind the creation of new Fel Orcs! Eliminate any threats you encounter on the way.",o="征服熔炉并杀死击碎者克里丹。",oEN="Conquer the Furnace and slay Keli'dan the Breaker.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81304]={d="是时候在战斗中面对酋长卡加斯·刃拳了。只要邪兽人还能通过黑暗之门劫掠我们的补给线，我们就永远没有资源对黑暗神殿发动进攻。进入破碎大厅，终结这一威胁！",dEN="It is time to face Warchief Kargath Bladefist in battle. As long as the Fel Orcs can raid our supply lines through the Dark Portal we will never have the resources to mount an assault on the Dark Temple. Enter the Shattered Halls and put an end to this threat!",o="征服大厅并杀死酋长卡加斯·刃拳。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Warchief Kargath Bladefist.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81305]={d="时间的流动必须得到维护。即便我们的时间线只发生一点微小的改变，也可能带来灾难性的后果；可要是萨尔从未逃出敦霍尔德，那将发生怎样的崩解？我们所知晓的一切都将被抹去！时光守护者请求你立即援助。如果我们失去了过去，就必定会失去未来。",dEN="The Flow of Time must be preserved. Even one small change in our timeline could prove catastrophic, but to imagine the unraveling that would occur should Thrall never escape Durnhold? Everything we’ve ever known would be undone! The Keepers of Time request your immediate aid. If we lose the past, we surely lose the future.",o="守护时间并杀死纪元猎人。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay the Epoch Hunter.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81306]={d="任由黑暗之门的开启被阻止是很诱人，但谁能说全新的未来会带来什么？我们的敌人之所以想要篡改时间线，唯一的原因就是我们在这一条时间线中对燃烧军团构成了严重威胁。我们必须维护时间的流动！",dEN="It is tempting to allow the opening of the Dark Portal to be prevented, but who is to say what a new future would hold? The only reason our enemies would seek to alter the timeline is because we pose a serious threat to the Burning Legion in this one. We must preserve the flow of time!",o="守护时间并杀死埃欧努斯。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay Aeonus.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81307]={d="麦迪文的存在仍在卡拉赞的厅堂中游荡，即便他已死去数十年。他召唤来执行命令的恶魔实体仍在守护着卡拉赞中封存的魔法秘密与强大宝物。一路杀穿这座塔，为我们的学者扫清道路，好让他们开始发掘其中的秘密。",dEN="Medivh’s presence still haunts the halls of Karazhan, even decades after his death. The Demonic entities he summoned to perform his bidding still guard the magic secrets and powerful treasures locked away in Karazhan. Fight your way through the tower and clear the way for our scholars to begin unearthing the secrets that lie within.",o="将玛尔扎克王子从卡拉赞放逐！",oEN="Banish Prince Malchezaar from Karazhan!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81308]={d="阿曼尼森林巨魔以其大胆的突袭而臭名昭著。祖尔金是负责袭击奎尔萨拉斯的督军，尽管巨魔曾被高等精灵重创。他正在祖阿曼重整军队。别搞错了……如果祖尔金开始突袭，那将是毁灭性的。杀死祖尔金！没有了督军，巨魔军队将不再是威胁。",dEN="The Amani forest trolls are notorious for their daring raids. Zul’jin is the Warlord responsible for the raids on Quel’Thalas despite the trolls being devastated by the high elves. He builds his army again in Zul’Aman. Make no mistake... If Zul’jin begins to raid it will be devastating. Kill Zul’jin! The troll army will no longer be a threat without its Warlord.",o="击败祖尔金！",oEN="Defeat Zul'jin!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81309]={d="刀锋山高地的食人魔将格鲁尔当作神明来崇拜。到目前为止，格鲁尔满足于劫掠纳格兰平原，但我们对外域的入侵已引起食人魔的注意，格鲁尔决定追随他的崇拜者投入战斗只是时间问题。格鲁尔曾在战斗中证明过自己的力量——他将死亡之翼的后裔从天空中扯了下来。如果屠龙者决定攻击我们在外域的部队，他将构成严重威胁。我们必须在食人魔以我们或许无法匹敌的力量进军之前，在他的巢穴中杀死他。",dEN="The ogres of Blade’s Edge Mountain worship Gruul as a god. So far Gruul has been content raiding the plains of Nagrand, but our invasion into Outlands has drawn the attention of the ogres, and it is only a matter of time before Gruul decides to follow his worshippers into battle. Gruul has already proven his strength in battle when he tore Deathwing’s offspring of the sky. The Dragonkiller would pose a serious threat if he ever chose to attack our forces in Outland. We must slay him in his lair before the ogres march with a force we may be unable to match.",o="杀死屠龙者格鲁尔。",oEN="Kill Gruul the Dragonkiller.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81310]={d="除非我们切断邪兽人大军的力量源泉，否则他们永远不会被真正击败。那就是玛瑟里顿。伊利丹将这位深渊领主锁在地狱火堡垒的深处，他的爪牙在那里抽干他受污染的血液。玛瑟里顿被维持着微弱的气息，这正合我们的目的。阻止邪兽人大军扩充兵力。放干玛瑟里顿的所有血液。",dEN="The Fel Orc army will never be truly defeated until we cut them off from their source of power. Magtheridon. Illidin keeps the Pit Lord chained up in the depths of Hellfire Citadel where his minions drain his tainted blood. Magtheridon is kept barely alive, which suits our purpose well. Prevent the Fel Orc army from growing their number. Spill all of Magtheridon’s blood.",o="放干玛瑟里顿的所有血液。",oEN="Spill all of Magtheridon's Blood.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81311]={d="整个外域只有一座水库。如果我们不控制水源，就无法控制外域。瓦丝琪女士是伊利丹最信任的副官，负责确保伊利丹的军队持续掌控外域的水源供应。如果我们想有一线希望打开补给线并征服外域，就必须控制水源。击败瓦丝琪女士，夺取水库！",dEN="There is only one reservoir in all of Outlands. If we do not control the water, we do not control Outlands. Lady Vashj is Illidan’s most trusted lieutenant and responsible for ensuring Illidan’s army remains in control of Outland’s water supply. If we are to have any hope of opening our supply lines and conquering Outlands we must control the water supply. Defeat Lady Vashj and claim the reservoir!",o="让瓦丝琪女士彻底干涸。",oEN="Leave Lady Vashj out to dry.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81312]={d="即便在凯尔萨斯背叛之后，血精灵朝圣者仍在风暴要塞寻求庇护。我们绝不能让凯尔萨斯增强燃烧军团的兵力，也不能让他继续控制眼！这项纳鲁科技可能让他们无需依赖黑暗之门就能袭击艾泽拉斯。我们必须夺回风暴要塞，否则就要冒两线作战的风险。",dEN="Even after the betrayal of Kael’thas blood elf pilgrims still seek sanctuary in Tempest Keep. We cannot allow Kael’thas to bolster the forces of the Burning Legion or maintain control over The Eye! This naaru technology could allow them to assault Azeroth without relying on the Dark Portal. We must reclaim Tempest Keep or we risk fighting this war on two fronts.",o="击败凯尔萨斯。",oEN="Vanquish Kael'thas.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81313]={d="我们已经对燃烧军团造成了严重打击。我们几乎准备好突袭黑暗神殿了。我们的敌人如今试图在海加尔山之战中改写历史。如果他们得逞……我们就要冒着在外域这里对付阿克蒙德的风险。我们肯定会被赶回黑暗之门。我们必须派遣最有能力的英雄回到过去，确保在海加尔山战胜燃烧军团！",dEN="We have dealt serious blows to the Burning Legion. We are nearly ready to assault the Black Temple. Our enemies now seek to rewrite history in the Battle of Mount Hyjal. If they succeed… we risk having to deal with Archimonde here in Outlands. We would surely be pushed back through the Dark Portal. We must send our most capable heroes back in time to ensure victory in Hyjal over the Burning Legion!",o="把阿克蒙德留在过去。",oEN="Leave Archimonde in the past.",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81314]={d="伊利丹有许多强大的敌人，他留在黑暗神殿是因为害怕唤醒巫妖王，或被燃烧军团残余的领主发现。尽管如此，伊利丹仍在收紧对外域的掌控。只要他还固守在他那亵渎的圣所中，我们就永远无法真正挑战他的统治。杀死背叛者！",dEN="Illidan has many powerful enemies and remained in the Black Temple for fear of awaking The Lich King or being discovered by the remaining Lords of the burning Legion. Despite this, Illidan still tightens his grip on Outlands. We will never truly challenge his rule while he remains fortified in his profane sanctum. Kill the Betrayer!",o="杀死伊利丹！",oEN="Slay Illidan!",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81315]={d="数千年来，太阳之井一直为高等精灵的强大魔法提供能量。燃烧军团将一切都押在这座古老的力量之泉上，因为有了它，他们就有办法召唤他们的指挥官基尔加丹。如果基尔加丹亲临战场，我们必败无疑。但燃烧军团也给了我们在这场战争中给予决定性一击的机会。就是现在，英雄。击败燃烧军团。",dEN="For millennia the Sunwell fueled the high elve’s potent magic. The Burning Legion have committed everything to this ancient fountain of power, for with it, they will have the means to summon their commander Kil’jaeden. If Kil’jaeden takes the field we are surely doomed. But the Burning Legion have also given us the opportunity to deal a decisive blow in this war. This is it Hero. Defeat the Burning Legion.",o="放逐基尔加丹",oEN="Banish Kil'jaeden",p="地牢中的居民仍在喘息。当你穿越时光线完成使命后再回来。",pEN="The dungeon's denizens still draw breath. Return when you have completed your mission across the timeways.",c="往昔的回响再次归于沉寂。你穿越时光线的英勇已成为传说，英雄。领取你的奖励。",cEN="The echoes of the past grow silent once more. Your bravery across the timeways is legendary, Hero. Claim your reward."}
Q[81316]={d="告示板向那些能够完成普通难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Normal dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成普通地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Normal dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[81317]={d="告示板向那些能够完成英雄难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Heroic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成英雄地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Heroic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[81318]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗难度地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth then bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后返回告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[81319]={d="号召所有战士\n\n在艾尔文森林翠绿的山丘之间坐落着人类王国暴风城！突袭暴风城，杀死现任人类领袖伯瓦尔·弗塔根！",dEN="Calling all Warriors\n\nWithin the green hills of the Elwynn Forest lies the human nation of Stormwind! Raid Stormwind and slay the current leader of the humans Bolvar Fordragon!",o="在暴风城杀死伯瓦尔·弗塔根。",oEN="Slay Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",p="号召所有战士\n\n在艾尔文森林翠绿的山丘之间坐落着人类王国暴风城！突袭暴风城，杀死现任人类领袖伯瓦尔·弗塔根！",pEN="Calling all Warriors\n\nWithin the green hills of the Elwynn Forest lies the human nation of Stormwind! Raid Stormwind and slay the current leader of the humans Bolvar Fordragon!"}
Q[81320]={d="在丹莫罗寒冷群山的深处住着矮人。他们地下的城市名为铁炉堡。围攻铁炉堡，杀死矮人领袖麦格尼·铜须！",dEN="Deep down in the frosty mountains of Dun Morogh is where the dwarves live. Their city below the surface is called Ironforge. Lay siege to Ironforge and slay the dwarven Leader Magni Bronzebeard!",o="在铁炉堡杀死麦格尼·铜须和大工匠梅卡托克。",oEN="Slay Magni Bronzebeard and High Tinker Mekkatorque in Ironforge.",p="在丹莫罗寒冷群山的深处住着矮人。他们地下的城市名为铁炉堡。围攻铁炉堡，杀死矮人领袖麦格尼·铜须！",pEN="Deep down in the frosty mountains of Dun Morogh is where the dwarves live. Their city below the surface is called Ironforge. Lay siege to Ironforge and slay the dwarven Leader Magni Bronzebeard!"}
Q[81321]={d="在卡利姆多西北部、迷雾之海之中矗立着世界之树泰达希尔。在它的树冠中隐藏着暗夜精灵的家园达纳苏斯。攀上泰达希尔，进入达纳苏斯，杀死暗夜精灵领袖泰兰德·语风！",dEN="In the north west of Kalimdor inside the Veiled Sea stands the world tree Teldrassil. Hidden within it's crown lies Darnassus the home of the night elves. Climb Teldrassil, enter Darnassus and slay the leader of the night elves Tyrande Whisperwind!",p="在卡利姆多西北部、迷雾之海之中矗立着世界之树泰达希尔。在它的树冠中隐藏着暗夜精灵的家园达纳苏斯。攀上泰达希尔，进入达纳苏斯，杀死暗夜精灵领袖泰兰德·语风！",pEN="In the north west of Kalimdor inside the Veiled Sea stands the world tree Teldrassil. Hidden within it's crown lies Darnassus the home of the night elves. Climb Teldrassil, enter Darnassus and slay the leader of the night elves Tyrande Whisperwind!"}
Q[81322]={d="在如今被称为杜隆塔尔的红色荒漠中，兽人建起了一座坚固的城市。围攻奥格瑞玛，击败兽人领袖萨尔。",dEN="In the red deserts now known as Durotar the orcs have built themselves a formidable city. Lay Siege to Orgrimmar and take down the orcish leader Thrall.",p="在如今被称为杜隆塔尔的红色荒漠中，兽人建起了一座坚固的城市。围攻奥格瑞玛，击败兽人领袖萨尔。",pEN="In the red deserts now known as Durotar the orcs have built themselves a formidable city. Lay Siege to Orgrimmar and take down the orcish leader Thrall."}
Q[81323]={d="在洛丹伦废墟的深处坐落着幽暗城。这里是摆脱了巫妖王影响的亡者的家园。攻击幽暗城，杀死亡者领袖希尔瓦娜斯·风行者！",dEN="Deep within the ruins of Loraderon lies the Undercity. Home to the undead that have freed themselves of the influence of the Lichking. Attack Undercity and kill the leader of the undead Sylvanas Windrunner!",o="杀死幽暗城的希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Slay Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity.",p="在洛丹伦废墟的深处坐落着幽暗城。这里是摆脱了巫妖王影响的亡者的家园。攻击幽暗城，杀死亡者领袖希尔瓦娜斯·风行者！",pEN="Deep within the ruins of Loraderon lies the Undercity. Home to the undead that have freed themselves of the influence of the Lichking. Attack Undercity and kill the leader of the undead Sylvanas Windrunner!"}
Q[81324]={d="在莫高雷山谷最陡峭的石柱之上，牛头人建起了他们的家园。雷霆崖是一座独一无二的城市。烧毁它，并杀死牛头人领袖凯恩·血蹄。",dEN="On top of the steepest pillars in the valley of Mulgore is where the tauren have built their home. Thunder Bluff is a city like no other. Burn it down and slay the leader of the tauren Cairne Bloodhoof.",o="在雷霆崖杀死凯恩·血蹄。",oEN="Slay Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="在莫高雷山谷最陡峭的石柱之上，牛头人建起了他们的家园。雷霆崖是一座独一无二的城市。烧毁它，并杀死牛头人领袖凯恩·血蹄。",pEN="On top of the steepest pillars in the valley of Mulgore is where the tauren have built their home. Thunder Bluff is a city like no other. Burn it down and slay the leader of the tauren Cairne Bloodhoof."}
Q[81325]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 1v1 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 1v1 Arena Matches",p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81326]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 2v2 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 2v2 Arena Matches",p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81327]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 3v3 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 3v3 Arena Matches",p="我本以为你配得上我的奖励……看来未必？做完之后再回到这里。",pEN="I thought you were worthy of my reward.. Maybe not so much? Get back here when you're done.",c="哈哈哈！我就知道是你。拜托，把这些从我手上拿走吧。",cEN="Hahaha! I knew you were the one. Please, take these off my hands."}
Q[81328]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不参加一场战争游戏，决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into a Wargame and fight to the death.",o="参加一场战争游戏",oEN="Participate in a Wargame"}
Q[81330]={d="还没准备好进入评级竞技场？想在跻身大联盟之前打磨你的战斗技艺？练习赛竞技场可以让你检验自己的胆识！\n\n练习赛不会造成任何评级损失，还能让你在竞技场中测试自己的构筑！",dEN="Not quite ready to step into rated arenas? Want to prune your fighting toolkit before heading into the big-leagues? Skirmish Arenas will allow you to test your grit!\n\nSkrimishes do not incur any rating loss and allow you to test your build in Arenas!",o="参加 10 场 1v1 练习赛竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 1v1 Skirmish Arena Matches"}
Q[81331]={d="还没准备好进入评级竞技场？想在跻身大联盟之前打磨你的战斗技艺？练习赛竞技场可以让你检验自己的胆识！\n\n练习赛不会造成任何评级损失，还能让你在竞技场中测试自己的构筑！",dEN="Not quite ready to step into rated arenas? Want to prune your fighting toolkit before heading into the big-leagues? Skirmish Arenas will allow you to test your grit!\n\nSkrimishes do not incur any rating loss and allow you to test your build in Arenas!",o="参加 10 场 2v2 练习赛竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 2v2 Skirmish Arena Matches"}
Q[81332]={d="冒险者，风暴群峰中的阿查冯宝库已成为庞大元素力量的汇聚点。石之守望者阿查冯，一位令人生畏的大地元素，守护着这座宝库，阻止我们利用它的潜能。\n\n我们必须消除这一威胁，才能取得其中的宝物与秘密。召集你的盟友，击倒这位强大的守护者。",dEN="Adventurer, the Vault of Archavon in the Storm Peaks has become a focal point of immense elemental power. Archavon the Stone Watcher, a formidable earth elemental, guards this vault, preventing us from harnessing its potential.\n\nWe must eliminate this threat to access the treasures and secrets within. Rally your allies and bring down this mighty guardian.",o="击败石之守望者阿查冯！",oEN="Defeat Archavon the Stone Watcher!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81333]={d="勇敢的英雄，向天灾力量核心发动攻击的时刻到了。巫妖领主克尔苏加德，巫妖王的左右手，就居住在纳克萨玛斯，在我们的世界上策划着难以想象的恐怖。\n\n我们必须终结他邪恶的存在，为被瘟疫蹂躏的土地带来希望。召集你的盟友，突袭纳克萨玛斯，彻底杀死克尔苏加德。",dEN="Brave hero, the time has come to strike at the heart of the Scourge's power. Kel'Thuzad, the lich lord and right hand of the Lich King, resides in Naxxramas, orchestrating untold horrors upon our world.\n\nWe must end his vile existence and bring hope to the plagued lands. Gather your allies and storm Naxxramas to slay Kel'Thuzad once and for all.",o="终结克尔苏加德！",oEN="Put an end to Kel'Thuzad!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81334]={d="勇敢的勇士，一场可怕的威胁已从龙眠神殿下方浮现。昂首者萨塔里奥已经占据了黑曜石圣殿。这条强大的黑龙与他的幼龙副官们，正以黑暗的阴谋威胁我们世界的圣洁。\n\n你必须召集盟友，深入圣殿，终结他的恐怖统治。",dEN="Brave champion, a dire threat has emerged from beneath Wyrmrest Temple. Sartharion, the Onyx Guardian, has taken residence in the Obsidian Sanctum. This powerful black dragon, along with his drake lieutenants, threatens the sanctity of our world with his dark machinations.\n\nYou must gather your allies, descend into the sanctum, and put an end to his reign of terror.",o="终结萨塔里奥！",oEN="Terminate Sartharion!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81335]={d="勇士，面对织法者玛里苟斯的时刻到了。他那场企图掌控所有奥术魔法的错误圣战已经威胁到艾泽拉斯的平衡。\n\n必须在他的行为造成无法弥补的伤害之前阻止他。前往永恒之眼，终结玛里苟斯的统治。",dEN="Champion, the time has come to confront Malygos, the Spell-Weaver. His misguided crusade to control all arcane magic has threatened the balance of Azeroth.\n\nHe must be stopped before his actions cause irreparable harm. Venture into The Eye of Eternity and bring an end to Malygos's reign.",o="消灭玛里苟斯！",oEN="Eliminate Malygos!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81336]={d="冒险者，蕴藏在奥杜尔中的远古恐怖威胁着要吞噬我们所有人。尤格-萨隆，死亡古神，已从城市下方的牢笼中苏醒，散播着疯狂与腐化。\n\n必须在这股影响扩散出奥杜尔并吞没世界之前击败这可憎之物。召集你最强大的盟友，准备面对黑暗。",dEN="Adventurer, the ancient horrors that lie within Ulduar threaten to consume us all. Yogg-Saron, the Old God of Death, has awakened from his prison beneath the city, spreading madness and corruption.\n\nThis abomination must be vanquished before his influence spreads beyond Ulduar and engulfs the world. Assemble your strongest allies and prepare to face the darkness.",o="击倒尤格-萨隆！",oEN="Bring down Yogg-Saron!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81337]={d="冒险者，在十字军的试炼中面对强敌的时刻到了。阿努巴拉克，曾是一位骄傲的尼鲁布国王，如今作为死亡的先驱侍奉巫妖王。\n\n不能容许他的背叛与腐化继续存在。进入竞技场，直面阿努巴拉克，终结他黑暗的统治。",dEN="Adventurer, the time has come to face a formidable foe in the Trial of the Crusader. Anub'arak, once a proud Nerubian king, now serves the Lich King as a harbinger of death.\n\nHis betrayal and corruption cannot be allowed to persist. Enter the coliseum, confront Anub'arak, and put an end to his dark reign.",o="征服阿努巴拉克！",oEN="Conquer Anub'arak!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81338]={d="我们的斥候报告，死亡之翼的女儿奥妮克希亚目前正藏身在尘泥沼泽深处的巢穴中。在被人发现她就是卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托女士，并且是暴风城国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩失踪的罪魁祸首之后，她逃到了那里。\n\n我们必须趁她最虚弱的时候发动攻击！\n\n召集所有有能力的冒险者，前往奥妮克希亚的巢穴，干掉她！",dEN="Our scouts report that Onyxia, the daughter of Deathwing, is currently hiding inside her lair deep in the swamps of the Dustwallow Marsh. She fled there after she was discovered to be Lady Katrana Prestor and was responsible for the disappearance of Varian Wrynn, King of Stormwind.\n\nWe need to strike now when she's at her weakest!\n\nGather any able-bodied adventurers, travel to Onyxias lair and take her out!",o="杀死奥妮克希亚！",oEN="Slay Onyxia!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81339]={d="冒险者，面对艾泽拉斯有史以来最大威胁的时刻到了。巫妖王阿尔萨斯·米奈希尔端坐在冰冠堡垒深处的冰封王座之上。\n\n他的亡灵天灾威胁要以死亡与绝望的浪潮吞没世界。我们必须趁现在仍有力量挑战他时发动攻击。",dEN="Adventurer, the time has come to face the greatest threat Azeroth has ever known. The Lich King, Arthas Menethil, sits atop his Frozen Throne within the heart of Icecrown Citadel.\n\nHis undead scourge threatens to consume the world in a tide of death and despair. We must strike now, while we still have the strength to challenge him.",o="杀死巫妖王！",oEN="Slay the Lich King!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81340]={d="冒险者，红玉圣殿深处出现了新的威胁。暮光巨龙哈莱恩突破了我们的圣所，企图将艾泽拉斯拖入黑暗。\n\n必须在这股腐化进一步蔓延之前阻止这一威胁。召集你的盟友，在红玉圣殿内直面哈莱恩，恢复和平与稳定。",dEN="Adventurer, a new threat has arisen from the depths of the Ruby Sanctum. Halion, a powerful twilight dragon, has breached our sanctum and seeks to plunge Azeroth into darkness.\n\nThis menace must be stopped before his corruption spreads any further. Rally your allies and confront Halion within the Ruby Sanctum to restore peace and stability.",o="击败哈莱恩！",oEN="Vanquish Halion!",p="敌人依然屹立。做好准备，完成你的使命后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[81341]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗+地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic+ dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth. Then, bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗+地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic+ dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服史诗+地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Mythic+ dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81342]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗+地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic+ dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth. Then, bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗+地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic+ dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服史诗+地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Mythic+ dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81343]={d="告示板向那些能够完成史诗+地下城的精英冒险者提供丰厚的奖励。前往地下城查找器并加入一支队伍以证明你的价值，然后把成功的证明带到告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is offering valuable rewards to those elite adventurers who can complete a Mythic+ dungeon. Head to the dungeon finder and join a group to prove your worth. Then, bring proof of your success to the Callboard to claim your rewards.",o="将成功完成史诗+地下城的证明带到任意主城的告示板。",oEN="Bring proof of your successful completion of a Mythic+ dungeon to the Callboard in any major city.",c="干得好，<name>！你成功征服史诗+地下城，证明了你的冒险者本领。请收下这些奖励，作为我们的谢意，并继续寻找配得上你才华的挑战！",cEN="Well done, <name>! Your successful conquest of a Mythic+ dungeon has proven your skills as an adventurer. Take these rewards as a token of our appreciation, and continue to seek out challenges worthy of your talents!"}
Q[81344]={d="通缉！\n\n因犯下对抗生命本身的罪行，并制造了无穷无尽的天灾憎恶！\n\n拉丝·霜语及其同伙目前居住在西瘟疫之地的通灵学院。\n\n死活不论。",dEN="Wanted!\n\nFor crimes against life itself and the creation of endless scourge abominations!\n\nRas Frostwhisper and his Cohorts that are currently residing in Scholomance in the Western Plaguelands.\n\nDead.",o="杀死拉丝·霜语",oEN="Kill Ras Frostwhisper"}
