Q[81381]={d="已下达征调令，要求上缴 1 瓶不纯的显化之力药剂。只有使用高风险来源材料的资深工匠才能制作这些珍贵的物品。",dEN="A requisition order has been placed for 1 Impure Flask of Manifesting Power. Only an expert craftsman with materials obtained from High-Risk can create these valuable items.",o="收集 1 瓶不纯的显化之力药剂。",oEN="Collect 1 Impure Flask of Manifesting Power."}
Q[85001]={d="来烦扰我是不明智的。你是傲慢、无知……还是两者兼有？\n\n我是微光之光的侍僧，遗忘亡者的看护人。我们怀着悲痛与沉默，守护着家园仅存的遗迹。你并非瑟尔卓拉之子，我和众魂都不欢迎你的到来。\n\n可你仍旧闯入，对我们的怒火置若罔闻。若你执意踏上我们的圣地，就必须了解我们所背负的悲伤。我不会在你身上浪费时间，去遗迹深处寻找高阶女祭司吧。只有她能决定，这样一个不识时务的流浪者是否配得上帮助那些迷失者。",dEN="It is unwise to pester me. Are you arrogant, ignorant… or both?\n\nI am an acolyte of the Fading Light, caretakers of the forgotten dead. We guard what is left of our home in grief and silence. You are no child of Thel'dralor, and neither I nor the spirits welcome your presence.\n\nYet still you intrude, heedless of our ire. If you insist on walking among our sacred grounds, then you must learn the sorrow we bear. I will not waste my time with you, seek the High Priestess at the heart of the remnants. She alone will decide if such an unwieldy wanderer is worthy to aid the lost.",o="与高阶女祭司交谈",oEN="Speak with the High Priestess",c="哎呀，这可真出乎意料……\n\n很少有人怀着敞开的心来到遗迹，愿意帮助被遗忘者的人就更少了。\n\n如果你一路走到这里，却没有被迷失者的悲伤与愤怒吞没……那么也许你注定要站在我们中间。我们的教团从不拒绝一双仁慈之手。",cEN="Well, this is unexpected…\n\nFew come to the Remnants with open hearts, and fewer still offer aid to the forgotten.\n\nIf you have walked here without succumbing to the grief and anger of the lost… then perhaps you are meant to stand among us. Our order does not turn away a charitable hand."}
Q[85002]={d="你面前的尸体冰冷，浑身是血。\n\n在试图辨认她的身份时，你发现她脖子上挂着一枚吊坠，上面刻着「永恒挚友：安德里尔与艾尔丹娜」。\n\n也许你能找到上面提到的其中一人，告知她朋友惨死的消息。",dEN="The body before you is cold and covered in blood.\n\nIn trying to identify her, you find a pendant with the words ‘Best Friends for Eternity - Andriel and Eldanna’ around her neck.\n\nPerhaps you can find one of the names mentioned and inform them of their friend’s grisly end.",o="找到项链的主人，把她朋友身亡的消息告诉她。",oEN="Find the owner of the necklace and inform her of her friend’s demise.",p="<侍僧安德里尔瞪大了眼睛，张着嘴盯着你。>",pEN="<Acolyte Andriel stares at you with wide eyes, mouth agape.>",c="她……她走了……？\n\n请原谅我……你所说的事闻所未闻，更别说你本人出现在这里了。瑟尔卓拉的灵魂并不暴戾，他们平和安详，照料着我们——正如我们照料他们一样。说他们会袭击我们……一定是我们以某种方式激怒了他们……\n\n哦，艾尔丹娜……你做了什么……？",cEN="She…. she’s gone…?\n\nForgive me… what you say is unheard of, not to mention your very presence here. The spirits in Thel’dralor are not violent, they are peaceful, and they care for us - as we care for them. To propose that they would attack us… we must have angered them in some way…\n\nOh Eldanna… what have you done…?"}
Q[85003]={d="无论你的出现多么出人意料，我从不拒绝任何一个愿意照料我们同胞的灵魂；他们值得我们付出一切……而且远不止于此。\n\n我们的祭司人数稀少，不过这些年来，随着幸存者前来凭吊，人数也略有增加。其余的人散布在瑟尔卓拉各处，各自以自己的方式承受着悲伤。如果你愿意，去看看他们的情况，尽你所能提供帮助……也许，我们携手就能给这些可怜的灵魂带来一丝安宁。\n\n尽管我承认……这样的事从未有人做到过。",dEN="Unexpected as your presence may be, I have never turned away a soul who wished to tend to our brethren, they deserve all we can give… and still so much more.\n\nOur priesthood is few in number, though we have grown slightly over the years as survivors have come to pay their respects. The others are scattered throughout Thel'dralor, each struggling with their grief in their own way. If you would, check on them, offer what help you can… perhaps, together, we may bring some small measure of peace to these poor souls.\n\nThough I confess… such a thing has never been achieved before.",o="帮助瑟尔卓拉遗迹中各位微光之光的看护人。",oEN="Assist the various Caretakers of the Fading Light in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",p="求你了，帮我的同胞们渡过难关吧。无论是身体上的麻烦还是心底的痛苦，他们都无法独自承担。",pEN="Please, help my brethren with their struggles. Whether the problems be physical or from within the heart, they cannot shoulder their burdens alone.",c="我向你致谢。我必须承认……我没想到像你这样的人能在瑟尔卓拉行走自如。\n\n不管你是不是外来者，看来你比外表更有能耐。\n\n你做得很好……尽管我们悲伤的份量依旧沉重，但你的帮助让我们得以缅怀逝去的人。",cEN="You have my thanks. I must admit… I did not expect one such as you to navigate Thel'dralor.\n\nOutsider or no, it seems you are more capable than you appear.\n\nYou have done well… though the weight of our sorrow remains heavy, your aid has allowed us to honor those we have lost."}
Q[85004]={d="啊，就是你！对，你看起来有腿，太好了。\n别站在那儿冲我眨眼睛了，我昨天就需要一个能办事的信使。\n\n这是清晰药剂。女祭司菲拉莉亚一直在尝试一种与灵魂沟通的新仪式，要是她不能尽快拿到这个，她多半会晕倒，把她那漂亮的小脑袋磕在墓碑上。\n\n所以！把这个送过去，越快越好。不许观光，不许跟鬼魂搭讪，而且看在艾露恩的份上，别喝它。你扛不住那种头痛。",dEN="Ah, you there! Yes, you look like you have legs, perfect.\nNow, don’t just stand there blinking at me, I needed a tangible courier yesterday.\n\nThis is an Elixir of Clarity. Priestess Filaria has been attempting a new ritual to commune with the spirits, and if she doesn’t get this soon, she’ll probably fall over and crack her pretty little head on a gravestone.\n\nSo! Run this to her, fast as you can. No sightseeing, no chatting up ghosts, and for Elune’s sake, don’t drink it. You wouldn’t survive the headache.",o="在药剂变质之前，把清晰药剂交给瑟尔卓拉遗迹的女祭司菲拉莉亚。",oEN="Deliver the Elixir of Clarity to Priestess Filaria in the Remnants of Thel’dralor, before it spoils.",p="哦，天哪……你好……！真让人意外……！",pEN="Oh my- hello there...! What a surprise...!",c="这是女祭司伊尔琳派你送来的？她……呃……总是这么爱夸张。\n\n不过……谢谢你，我想我比自以为的更需要这个……",cEN="Priestess Ir’lynn sent this? She’s… um… always so dramatic.\n\nStill… thank you, I think I needed this more than I realized…"}
Q[85005]={d="啊，是高阶女祭司派你来的？说实话，新面孔总是让人欣慰。\n\n<瑟拉德林朝你微微一笑，但目光很快又飘回废墟那边。>\n\n客套话就不说了，我正需要多一双手。瓦砾间散落着圣物和纪念品——往昔的碎片，我们族人的碎片。艾瑞希尔希望把它们都找回来，而我会让她的意愿得以实现。\n\n挖掘时要小心。对她而言，每一件往昔之物都是神圣的。",dEN="Ah, the High Priestess sent you? A new face is a welcome sight, indeed.\n\n<Theladrin gives you a small smile, though his eyes soon wander back toward the ruins.>\n\nPleasantries aside, I could use an extra set of hands. Scattered throughout the rubble are relics and keepsakes — fragments of the past, fragments of our people. Aerithel would see them recovered, and I will see her will done.\n\nTake care with what you unearth. To her, every piece of the past is sacred.",o="回收散落在瑟尔卓拉遗迹各处的圣物。",oEN="Recover scattered relics across the Remnants of Thel'dralor.",p="你找到了什么……？",pEN="What have you found...?",c="<当你呈上圣物时，瑟拉德林睁大了眼睛。他用双手小心地接过，拂去尘土，仿佛它们是用玻璃做的。>\n\n你做得很好。这些不只是石头和小玩意儿，它们是记忆，是早已逝去的生命的碎片。对艾瑞希尔而言，它们是神圣的……而对我而言，嗯……\n\n<瑟拉德林轻轻呼出一口气，声音低了下去，渐渐沉默。>\n\n谢谢你，朋友。有了这些，也许我们的心能得到些许慰藉……哪怕只有一点点。",cEN="<Theladrin’s eyes widen as you present the relics. He takes them with careful hands, brushing the dust away as though they were made of glass.>\n\nYou’ve done well. These are more than stone and trinkets, they are memories, pieces of lives long extinguished. To Aerithel, they are sacred… and to me, well…\n\n<Theladrin lets out a quiet breath as he trails off, his voice soft.>\n\nThank you, friend. With these, perhaps our hearts will be eased… if only by a little."}
Q[85006]={d="……哦天哪，来了一位新面孔……！\n\n如你所见……我们还活着，而我们这些活人……不幸的是，也有自己的需求。这不是借口……但我一心扑在灵魂的事上……连最简单的事情都荒废了。\n\n我……我本不想麻烦你，真的……这些事本该由我自己料理，可是……我没法说服自己离开。现在不行。不是这样……",dEN="…Oh my, a newcomer…!\n\nAs you can see…we’re still alive, and us, the living… unfortunately have needs too. It’s no excuse… but I’ve been so distracted with the spirits… I’ve let even the simplest things fall to the wayside.\n\nI… I didn’t mean to trouble you, really… I should be taking care of these things myself, but… I cannot will myself to leave. Not now. Not like this…",o="从瑟尔卓拉遗迹周边的野生动物身上收集各种补给品。",oEN="Gather various supplies from the wildlife around the Remnants of Thel'dralor.",p="你已经回来了……？",pEN="You've returned already...?",c="我有时会忘记……即便置身于这一切悲伤之中……生命仍在继续。而我们……我们需要照料它……也需要照料自己。\n\n是你提醒了我……所以，谢谢你。",cEN="I keep forgetting sometimes… even in the middle of all this sorrow… life goes on. And we… we need to care for it… and for ourselves.\n\nYou’ve reminded me of that… so thank you."}
Q[85007]={d="<你发现一张被匆匆塞进日记里的皱纸条。>\n\n瑟拉德林，\n\n我……我知道你叫我别去，但我再也无法忽视它了。那些低语……那片树林……它们在尖叫，出事了。我能感觉到，在我的胸口，在我的骨头里……\n\n我必须亲眼去看。我……我会小心的，我保证。一有危险的苗头我就跑。只是……我无法袖手旁观。\n\n如果你迟迟没有我的消息……求你……别自责。我……我只是必须试一试……\n\n<这里也许发生过可怕的事。或许你该在一切都太迟之前去调查一下……>",dEN="<You find a crumpled note hastily tucked into a journal.>\n\nTheladrin,\n\nI… I know you told me not to go, but I can’t ignore it anymore. The whispers… the woods… they’re screaming, and something is wrong. I can feel it in my chest, in my bones…\n\nI have to see for myself. I… I’ll be careful, I promise. I’ll run at the first sign of danger. I just… I can’t do nothing.\n\nIf you don’t hear from me soon… please… don’t blame yourself. I… I just had to try…\n\n<Something terrible may have happened here. Perhaps you should investigate before it’s too late...>",o="在附近区域搜寻失踪的场地看护人。",oEN="Investigate the nearby area for the Missing Groundskeeper.",p="你是谁……？别伤害我……求你了……！",pEN="Who are you…? Don’t hurt me… Please…!",c="是高阶女祭司派你来的……？\n\n哦，感谢艾露恩……我……我以为不会有人来了……我……我以为……我以为我死定了！",cEN="The High Priestess sent you…?\n\nOh, thank Elune… I… I didn’t think anyone would… I… I thought… I thought I was done for!"}
Q[85008]={d="我的伤口像火烧一样，我……我几乎动弹不得。\n\n<他哀求地看着你，声音颤抖。>\n\n求你……我需要你帮我离开这里。我没法……我没法独自撑过去。我会跟着你走，我发誓不会拖累你太多……只是……我太虚弱了，既打不过他们，也跑不动。\n\n我……我从没想来这里。我本就不该……可是我……我无法忽视那些灵魂。求你……带我出去就好。",dEN="My wounds burn, and I… I can barely move.\n\n<He looks at you pleadingly, voice trembling.>\n\nPlease… I need your help to get out of here. I can’t… I can’t make it alone. I’ll follow your lead, I swear I won’t slow you too much… I just… I’m too weak to face them or even run.\n\nI… I never wanted to come here. I never should have… but I… I couldn’t ignore the spirits. Please… just get me out.",o="护送场地看护人达雷尼安到瑟尔卓拉遗迹的安全地点。",oEN="Escort Groundskeeper Dalenian to safety in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",p="嗯？",pEN="Hm?",c="哦，感谢群星，你把他平安带回来了。我无法表达我有多感激。你冒着极大的风险保全了他，哪怕阴影正要夺走我们一位虔诚的看护人。\n\n我已经开始处理他的伤口，可我心中的负担依然沉重。他竟遭受了这么多苦难，还差点在我的看护下丧命……看来我又一次失职了。\n\n但多亏了你，他安然无恙。你守住了我们教团的光，为此，我向你致以最深的谢意。",cEN="Oh, thank the stars you’ve returned him safely. I cannot express how grateful I am. You risked much to ensure his well-being, even when the shadows threatened to claim one of our devoted caretakers.\n\nI’ve already begun tending to his wounds, yet the weight in my heart is heavy. That he should have suffered so, and nearly died under my watch… I see I have failed once more.\n\nStill, thanks to you, he is safe. You have upheld the light of our order, and for that, you have my deepest gratitude."}
Q[85010]={d="灵魂们紧抓着自身的悲伤，任由情绪主宰自己。只要他们的死仍是不公的，他们就无法安息。至少，这是高阶女祭司教给我的。我不过是个侍僧……就像当年的艾尔丹娜一样。\n\n如果她试图安抚一个拒绝她仪式的灵魂，而对方因我们的存在而暴怒，那么它也许仍被狂怒束缚——既能扑向生者，也能把其他灵魂拖入混乱。\n\n抛开信仰不谈，必须做点什么。你看起来比我强得多。你愿意去寻找这个灵魂，让它安息吗？",dEN="The spirits clutch at their grief and let their emotions overtake them. They cannot rest while their deaths remain unjust. At least, that is what the High Priestess taught me. I am only an acolyte… as Eldanna once was.\n\nIf she attempted to soothe a spirit that refused her rites, and became angered by our presence, then it may still be bound in rage — able to lash out at the living or drag other spirits into chaos.\n\nCreed aside, something must be done. You look far more capable than I. Will you seek out this spirit and lay it to rest?",o="在瑟尔卓拉遗迹找到狂怒之魂，让它安息。",oEN="Find the Enraged Spirit in the Remnants of Thel’dralor and lay them to rest.",p="是你……是你做的吗……？",pEN="Did… did you do it…?",c="多么悲惨的事……我祈祷再也不要重演。\n\n我向你致谢。既然袭击者已被消灭，愿艾尔丹娜终于得到安宁，尽管她的死如此残忍而不公。她……我们……我们只是想帮你看见而已。\n\n我只希望我们做得足够。谢谢你。",cEN="What a tragedy… one I pray is never repeated.\n\nYou have my thanks. With her assailant gone, may Eldanna finally find peace, though her death was cruel and undeserved. She… we… we only ever wished to help you see.\n\nI can only hope we are enough. Thank you."}
Q[85011]={d="如果你想帮助我们，就必须明白瑟尔卓拉曾是什么样子——以及我们失去了什么。\n\n我们，微光之光的女祭司，曾是这座城市的智慧与指引。我们选择对抗艾萨拉女王和她的恶魔……也正因如此，我们的朋友、家人，以及我发誓要保护的无辜者，都遭遇了可怕的命运。那些在大分裂中对抗艾萨拉而死去的人，带着未竟的人生、失去的爱、破灭的梦想死去……而那是我的选择。\n\n我每天都向艾露恩祈祷，为他们的灵魂，为指引，为光明。也许你也该这样做。",dEN="If you wish to aid us, you must understand what Thel’dralor was - and what we have lost.\n\nWe, the Priestesses of the Fading Light, were once the wisdom and guidance of the city. We chose to oppose Queen Azshara and her demons… and for that, our friends, our families, the innocents I swore to protect, suffered a horrendous fate. Those who perished in the Sundering fighting Azshara, died with lives unfulfilled, loves lost, dreams vanished… and it was my choice.\n\nI pray to Elune every day for their souls, for guidance, for light. Perhaps you should do the same.",o="前往瑟尔卓拉各处月井，与每位守井人一同 /祈祷。",oEN="Venture to the various Thel’dralor moonwells and /pray with each of the Well-Watchers.",p="我尚未在你身上感受到守井人的祝福。等你拜访过他们之后再来找我；我们需要艾露恩能给予的一切指引。",pEN="I do not yet feel the blessing of the Well-Watchers upon you. Return to me once you have visited them, we shall need all the guidance Elune can offer.",c="啊……你回来了。\n\n你感受到艾露恩的爱了吗？她的指引？她光芒的温暖？祈祷它永不离开你……那是一种把心劈成两半的感觉……我再熟悉不过了。\n\n但即便如此，无论我们深爱之人命运如何，我们都绝不能在信仰上动摇。",cEN="Ah… you have returned.\n\nDo you feel Elune’s love? Her guidance? The warmth of her light? Pray that it never leaves you… it is a feeling that cleaves the heart in two… something I know all too well.\n\nYet still, we must never waver in our faith, no matter the fate of those we love."}
Q[85012]={d="大分裂之后……瑟尔卓拉沦为废墟。这……这就是我们挚爱家园仅存的一切。日复一日，我们辛劳着复原失去的东西，不仅为我们自己，也为那些被困在亡者之身中的灵魂。他们理应有一个可以回归的家……比我们任何人都更值得。\n\n我们挖出了一些雕像，那是我已经开始遗忘的老朋友的面容。我……我无法原谅自己让他们的记忆溜走，哪怕只是一瞬。\n\n我绝不会再让他们的面容消逝。拿着这块擦亮布……照看好他们，也许借着对他们的缅怀，你能体会到这些灵魂所背负的悲伤……以及我因遗忘而承受的重担。",dEN="After the Sundering… Thel’dralor lies in ruins. This… this is all that remains of our beloved home. Day after day we toil to restore what was lost, not only for ourselves, but for those trapped here in undeath. They deserve a home to return to… more than any of us.\n\nWe have unearthed statues, faces of old friends I had begun to forget. I… I cannot forgive myself for letting their memories slip, even for a moment.\n\nI shall never allow their visages to fade again. Take this polish… care for them, and perhaps, through their remembrance, you may learn the sorrow these souls carry… and the weight I bear for forgetting.",o="用擦亮布清洁瑟尔卓拉遗迹中的各处雕像。",oEN="Use the Polishing Cloth to clean the various statues in the Remnants of Thel'dralor.",p="你会永远记住他们的面容吗？",pEN="Will you remember their faces forever?",c="朋友、家人，以及我发誓要保护的无辜者——让他们的面容从记忆中淡去，是我永远无法原谅自己的背叛。我们修复的每一座雕像都是一道被重新揭开的伤口，但同时也是一个重新立下的誓言……他们再也不会被遗忘。\n\n你做得很好，孩子。照看他们的容貌，你便分担了我的重担，也许……我可以称你为朋友了。",cEN="The friends, family, the innocents I swore to protect - to let their visages slip from memory is a betrayal I can never forgive myself for. Each statue we restore is a wound reopened, yet also a vow renewed… that they will never be forgotten again.\n\nYou have done well, child. In caring for their likenesses, you share in my burden, and perhaps… I may call you friend."}
Q[85013]={d="作为朋友，你也许想知道，达雷尼安的伤已经痊愈了。被萨特——我们那些受诅咒的同胞——掳走，是我不愿加诸任何灵魂的折磨，更遑论一位亲爱的同伴。\n\n我忍受过萨特在瑟尔卓拉边缘徘徊……可现在他们钻进了我们神圣的家园，亵渎这些废墟，折磨早已饱受苦难的灵魂和幸存者。这，我绝不允许。\n\n去见见那位场地看护人吧。在康复期间，他掌握了将这些怪物从这片树林中清除出去的关键知识。",dEN="As a friend, it may interest you to know that Dalenian’s wounds have healed. To be taken by satyrs, our accursed brethren, is a torment I would not wish on any soul, least of all a dear companion.\n\nI have endured the satyrs prowling at the edges of Thel’dralor… but now they burrow within our sacred home, desecrating these ruins, tormenting spirits and survivors who have already suffered so greatly. This, I will NOT allow.\n\nMeet with the groundskeeper. In his recovery, he has gained knowledge vital to purging the woods of these monsters.",o="与瑟尔卓拉遗迹的场地看护人达雷尼安交谈。",oEN="Speak with Groundskeeper Dalenian in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",c="等——等等……是你！你是我的救命恩人！我不知该怎么谢你把我从那个洞里救出来。要是你没能及时赶到……我不敢想那些萨特会对我做什么。\n\n即便现在，我仍能感觉到他们的目光落在我身上。我早已放弃德鲁伊之道来照料族人，但我仍能听见森林的低语，诉说着他们的存在；一想到他们可能回来，我的手就抖个不停。\n\n可是，啊，我又扯远了。请原谅我。你已经对我如此仁厚，我欠你一份人情。如果你要再次面对那些怪物……我会尽我所能帮你。",cEN="W-wait... you! You are my savior! I cannot thank you enough for pulling me from that cave. Had you not come when you did… I dare not think of what the satyrs would have done.\n\nEven now, I can still feel their eyes on me. Long have I given up my druidic ways to tend to my kin, but I can still hear the woods, whispering of their presence, and my hands tremble at the thought of them returning.\n\nBut, ah, I ramble. Forgive me. You have shown me such kindness already, and I am in your debt. If you are to face those monsters again… I will help however I can."}
Q[85014]={d="我必须承认……尽管伤口已经痊愈，我仍能感觉到他们的爪子在皮肤上。那种触碰挥之不去，每次闭上眼睛，我都看见他们在等着我。他们把我吓坏了，彻底搅乱了我的安宁和心神……我没法不在惊恐中惊醒。\n\n而这还只是我受到的冲击。那些灵魂，那些被他们可怕巫术折磨得更惨的可怜灵魂……我无法忍受这种事再次发生。\n\n我……我没法亲自面对他们，可你……你比我强，强得多。如果你能把他们赶回去，哪怕只是一点点，也许我们都能喘口气。",dEN="I must confess… I can still feel their claws on my skin, even though my wounds have fully healed. Their touch lingers, and every time I close my eyes, I see them waiting for me again. They have terrified me so utterly, disturbing my peace, my mind… I cannot sleep without waking in terror.\n\nAnd that is only the impact on me. The spirits, the poor souls who were tormented further by their awful hexes… I cannot bear the thought of such a thing repeating.\n\nI… I cannot face them myself, but you… you are stronger, far stronger than I. If you would drive them back, even just a little, perhaps we could all breathe easier.",o="把萨特逐出雷加什营地。",oEN="Drive out the Satyrs from the Legash Encampments.",p="我还能听见他们……他们的笑声……他们的恨意……？",pEN="I can still hear them... their laughter... their hate…",c="他们走了……真的走了……？\n\n啊哈……啊哈哈哈……！愿上天保佑你，朋友！保佑你……！",cEN="They’re gone… truly…?\n\nAha…ahahaha…! Bless you friend! Bless you…!"}
Q[85015]={d="在被囚禁的日子里……我从索萨尔的手下那里学到了很多。\n\n他们会在深夜来到瑟尔卓拉，偷走祭品和圣物——那些我们长久以来用来安抚灵魂、平息他们怒火与悲伤的东西。\n\n他们以激怒我们逝去的亲人为乐，让我们的家人与我们为敌……等着有一天他们愤怒到失去自我，然后……然后他们可能会……不，我不能想这个。\n\n求你……把失去的东西找回来，别让那些本已被悲伤压垮的人再受伤害。",dEN="From my capture… I learned much from Xorthal’s minions.\n\nThey come to Thel’dralor in the dead of night, stealing offerings and relics - things we have long used to calm the spirits, to soothe their anger and sorrow.\n\nThey delight in enraging our fallen kin, in turning our family against us…waiting for the day when they grow so enraged they lose themselves and… and they might… No, I cannot think of this.\n\nPlease… recover what we have lost, before more harm comes to those already burdened by grief.",o="从雷加什营地找回被偷走的祭品。",oEN="Recover the stolen offerings from the Legash Encampments.",p="你都找到了吗……？",pEN="Have you found everything...?",c="你回来了……！\n\n我太欣慰了。我一直担心得……\n\n<达雷尼安温柔地笑了。>\n\n我很高兴你安然无恙，我亲爱的朋友。",cEN="You’ve returned…!\n\nI’m so relieved. I’ve been so worried I…\n\n<Dalenian smiles tenderly.>\n\nI’m glad you’re safe, my dear friend."}
Q[85016]={d="我大概耽搁你太久了……哦，可我怎么谢你都不够！\n\n请你快些回到高阶女祭司那里，把你的功绩、你的勇敢告诉她！我会大声歌颂你，连最淡薄的灵魂都能听见！\n\n哦……谢谢你，真的，谢谢你！",dEN="I’ve probably kept you longer than I should… oh, but I cannot thank you enough!\n\nPlease, hurry back to the High Priestess and tell her of your deeds- of your bravery! I’ll be singing your praises so loudly, even the most faded of spirits will hear me!\n\nOh… thank you, truly, thank you!",o="向瑟尔卓拉遗迹的高阶女祭司复命。",oEN="Report to the High Priestess in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",p="有事吗？",pEN="Yes?",c="啊……你回来了。看来萨特的威胁已被平息，多亏了你。\n\n<远处传来达雷尼安的歌声，高阶女祭司轻笑了一声。>\n\n你确实不只是保护了我们，你还减轻了此地灵魂的重担，无论生者还是亡者，为此我心怀感激。",cEN="Ah… you have returned. I see that the Satyr threat is quelled, thanks to you.\n\n<Dalenian’s singing is heard in the distance and the High Priestess chuckles.>\n\nTruly, you have done more than protect us, you have eased the burdens of the spirits here, both living and departed, and for that, I am grateful."}
Q[85017]={d="既然你已明白我们的处境，以及历史与缅怀的重要……那就该知道，并非所有城市都像瑟尔卓拉这般幸运，能有幸存者回来重建失去的一切。\n\n我的神殿至今仍未复原，而其他神殿则被各种生物占据。我本想亲自去清理，但我再也承受不起离开瑟尔卓拉。上一次我离开……回来时只见一片废墟。你尽可以说我懦弱，但我无法再面对那样的毁灭。\n\n对不起，我的朋友，我……我……需要独自待一会儿。请去和场地看护人瑟拉德林谈谈，他会告诉你更多。",dEN="Now that you understand our position, and the importance of history and remembrance… know that not all cities are as fortunate as Thel’dralor, where survivors have returned to restore what was lost.\n\nThough my Temple remains unrecovered, others have been claimed by all manner of creatures. I would purge them myself, but I cannot bear to leave Thel’dralor again. The last time I did… I returned to ruins. Call me a coward if you will, but I cannot face such devastation again.\n\nI apologize, my friend, I... I… need a moment to myself. Please, speak with Groundskeeper Theladrin, he shall tell you more.",o="与瑟尔卓拉遗迹的场地看护人瑟拉德林交谈。",oEN="Speak with Groundskeeper Theladrin in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",c="又见面了，是我们可爱的女祭司派你来查看修复工作的进展吗……？\n\n<场地看护人瑟拉德林眨了眨眼，专注地听着。>\n\n哦。哦，我明白了……\n\n艾露恩神殿落入阿科兰手中，这件事早已让艾瑞希尔心烦不已。我也为此不快，不过我还没无知到以为世界会围着我们停滞不前。就算我们净化了神殿，下一个世纪之内也会有新的居民搬进来。",cEN="Hello again, has our lovely High Priestess sent you to check on the restoration efforts…?\n\n<Groundskeeper Theladrin blinks as he listens intently.>\n\nOh. Oh I see…\n\nLong has it vexed Aerithel that the Temple of Elune has fallen into the hands of Arkkoran. It bothers me as well, though I am not so ignorant as to believe that the world will never move on around us. If we purge the temple, new denizens shall move in within the next century."}
Q[85018]={d="艾瑞希尔常常忘记，正因为有我们在，瑟尔卓拉才是特例，而非常态。\n\n尽管高阶女祭司会乐于亲手惩戒那位海神，但我承认……我很庆幸她派来的是你。当然，我对你并无恶意。\n\n话虽如此，如果你能清掉一些阿科兰的信徒——别去招惹那位海巨人本人——也许我们能减轻艾瑞希尔的一些愧疚。\n\n她救不了整个世界……也救不了她遇到的每一个灵魂或每一处废墟。我只希望能帮她明白这一点。",dEN="Aerithel often forgets that, because of our presence, Thel’dralor is the anomaly, not the standard.\n\nAs much as the High Priestess would enjoy smiting the sea god herself, I confess… I am glad she sent you instead. Not that I have any ill intent toward you, of course.\n\nThat being said, if you could clear out some of Arkkoran’s followers - without provoking the sea giant himself - perhaps we can ease some of Aerithel’s guilt.\n\nShe cannot save the world… nor every soul or ruin she encounters. I only wish I could help her understand that.",o="清除阿科兰神殿中的阿科兰信徒。",oEN="Clear out Arkkoran’s followers from the Temple of Arkkoran.",p="你清理完阿科兰的信徒了吗？",pEN="Have you finished culling Arkkoran's followers?",c="干得漂亮，朋友。\n\n虽然问题依然存在，但至少艾瑞希尔从悬崖上望出去时，不会再看到鱼人和贝壳类挤成一团了，这总归是件好事。",cEN="Well struck, friend.\n\nThough the problem persists, not seeing a gathering of murlocs and shellfish as Aerithel looks out from the cliffs can only help."}
Q[85019]={d="被弃置或被不友善的邻居占据，看到神殿落到这般境地，我作为工匠实在痛心。\n\n啊，我的朋友……真希望你能见到艾露恩神殿辉煌时的模样。流光溢彩，彩旗招展，还有世上最美的女子……\n\n尽管我们在过去几千年里发掘了瑟尔卓拉的许多东西，但离修复神殿还差得远。它半沉的状态让我忧心，我担心它的大理石墙壁正在受损。\n\n拿着这个刮藤壶器，右键点击它，就能刮掉神殿墙壁上硬化的藤壶。",dEN="Abandoned or occupied by unfriendly neighbors, it wounds the artisan in me to see the temple in such a state.\n\nAh, my friend… if only you could have seen the Temple of Elune in its glory days. Streaming lights, colorful banners, and the most beautiful women in the world…\n\nThough we have uncovered much of Thel'dralor over the past millennia, we are still far from restoring the temple. Its half-submerged state worries me and I fear for the damage being done to its marble walls.\n\nTake this Barnacle Scraper and right-click it to scrape the hardened barnacles from the temple walls.",o="清除附着在阿科兰神殿墙壁上的硬化藤壶。",oEN="Clear the Hardened Barnacles attached to the walls of the Temple of Arkkoran.",p="刮藤壶……这活儿我已经不知多少纪元没干过了，而且我 certainly 一点也不怀念。",pEN="Barnacle scraping... It's a task I haven't done in eons, and one I certainly do not miss.",c="啊……终于好了！看看那大理石……几乎就像艾瑞希尔本人走过那些厅堂的那天一样闪闪发亮。你干得非常出色，我的朋友。\n\n藤壶清除之后，神殿便免于更多损伤，也许……有一天它能再次向世界低语它的美丽。",cEN="Ah… at last! Look at that marble… almost as though it could gleam like the day Aerithel herself walked those halls. You’ve done a remarkable job, my friend.\n\nWith the barnacles cleared, the Temple is spared further harm, and perhaps… one day it can begin to whisper its beauty once more to the world."}
Q[85020]={d="如果可以的话，把我们的好消息带回给高阶女祭司。\n\n告诉她神殿已免于更多损伤，藤壶已经清理干净，我们已尽力保住了它残存的美。我相信你的消息会让艾瑞希尔露出笑容……至少，但愿如此。\n\n她肩上的担子已经太重了，片刻的欢欣是我们至少能给予她的。",dEN="If you could, bring our good tidings back to the High Priestess.\n\nTell her the Temple is spared further harm, the barnacles cleared, and that we’ve done our best to preserve what remains of its beauty. I’m sure your news will bring a smile to Aerithel’s face… or at least, let us hope it does.\n\nShe carries so much on her shoulders already, a moment of joy is the least we can offer her.",o="把好消息带给瑟尔卓拉遗迹的高阶女祭司。",oEN="Bring the good news to the High Priestess in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",c="<艾瑞希尔没有露出笑容，反而皱起眉头，眼中蒙上悲伤的阴影。>\n\n瑟拉德林……他不愿冒险与阿科兰发生冲突？我明白了。\n\n可是……我本不该要你去做这样的事。也许有一天，我会亲自面对那位海神。\n\n不过……你的努力，加上他的指引，确保了神殿免于更多损伤，大理石墙壁也已清理干净。即便是微小的保护之举，也承载着历史的重量，而今天，你们一同减轻了那份重担。为此，我心怀感激。",cEN="<Rather than a smile, Aerithel frowns, her eyes shadowed with sorrow.>\n\nTheladrin… he did not wish to risk an altercation with Arkkoran? I see.\n\nAnd yet… I should never have asked such a thing of you. Perhaps one day I will face the sea god myself.\n\nStill… your efforts, and his guidance, have ensured the temple is spared further harm, the marble walls cleared. Even small acts of preservation carry the weight of history, and today, together, you have lightened that burden. For that, I am grateful."}
Q[85021]={d="萨特已被赶走，场地也清理干净了……我本希望能看到些什么——任何东西都行。灵魂身上哪怕一丝变化的迹象……可依旧……什么都没有。永远什么都没有。\n\n我们做的一切似乎都无法让他们安息。我们只能无助地站在一旁，眼看着一颗颗心被绝望淹没。这算不上生活……也不是安宁的安息……只有悲伤，所有人依旧困在过去。\n\n女祭司菲拉莉亚一直是最能与灵魂共鸣的人……也许，我只能祈祷，如果真有变化，她能感应到。\n\n求你……去和她谈谈。我必须知道。",dEN="With the satyrs gone and the grounds cleared… I had hoped to see something- anything. Some sign of change in the spirits… but still… nothing. Always nothing.\n\nNot a thing we do seems to bring them peace. We can only stand by, helpless, as all hearts overflow with despair. This is no life… no peaceful rest… only sorrow, as all remain trapped in the past.\n\nPriestess Filaria has always been the most attuned to the spirits… Perhaps, and I can only pray that if any change has occurred, she can sense it.\n\nPlease… speak with her. I must know.",o="与瑟尔卓拉遗迹的女祭司菲拉莉亚谈谈灵魂性情可能发生的变化。",oEN="Speak with Priestess Filaria in the Remnants of Thel’dralor about a possible change in the temperament of the spirits.",c="她想要我做什么？！",cEN="She wants me to do WHAT?!"}
Q[85023]={d="这些不负责任、鲁莽的家伙里……哼！\n\n她最好祈祷这能成功，否则艾瑞希尔会惩戒某个人——多半是我！\n\n不……不，这太冒险了。菲拉莉亚才刚晋升为正式女祭司，我不是说不信任她……但这件事超出她能应付的范围。\n\n一定还有别的办法。与其把菲拉莉亚当作导管来放大，我们能不能用某种……不是活物的东西？这片区域曾是许多高等精灵大法师的家园。如果还有这样的圣物留存下来，那些该死的纳迦在废墟里抢走了一两件，我一点也不会意外。",dEN="Of all the irresponsible, foolhardy - BAH!\n\nShe better hope this works, or Aerithel’s going to smite someone—probably me!\n\nNo... no, this is too risky. Filaria only just ascended to become a full priestess, I don’t want to say I don’t trust her… but this is more than she can handle.\n\nThere must be something else we can do. Rather than amplify Filaria as a conduit, we could use something that wasn’t, perhaps, living? This area was home to many great highborne mages. If any relics like this remain, I wouldn't be surprised if one of those accursed naga snatched them in the ruins.",o="为瑟尔卓拉遗迹的女祭司伊尔琳从纳迦那里取回一件魔法聚焦器。",oEN="Retrieve a magical focus from the naga for Priestess Ir’lynn in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",p="我还是不敢相信我们真在做这种事。",pEN="I still can't believe we're doing this.",c="群星在上……你证明了自己比我想象中更能干。\n\n看来你已经从我的小跑腿助手毕业成了……嗯，稍微体面一点的跑腿助手。\n\n玩笑归玩笑，你的帮助我一直很感激。",cEN="By the stars… you’ve proven more capable than I expected.\n\nLooks like you’ve graduated from my little delivery helper to… well, my slightly more respectable delivery helper.\n\nHumor aside, your assistance is ever appreciated."}
Q[85024]={d="那么！但愿这次真能奏效……也但愿我不会成为瑟尔卓拉又一个悲惨故事的起因。\n\n<女祭司伊尔琳朝你笑了笑，但那笑容明显比平时虚弱。>",dEN="Now then! Let’s hope this actually works… and that I’m not the cause of yet another tragic tale in Thel’dralor.\n\n<Priestess Ir’lynn gives you a smile, though it’s noticeably weaker.>",o="使用艾尔达拉的魔法聚焦器，帮助女祭司菲拉莉亚在瑟尔卓拉遗迹与灵魂沟通。",oEN="Using Eldara’s Magical Focus, help Priestess Filaria commune with the spirits in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",p="她帮上忙了吗？",pEN="Was she able to help?",c="你们三个做了什么……什么？！\n\n<听你讲述时，高阶女祭司睁大了眼睛。>\n\n灵魂们是被……一道耀眼的光引出来的？那会不会是女神本人？\n\n不，她会怀着爱意引领他们走向最终的安息……而不是绝望。\n\n我不明白……",cEN="You three did… WHAT?\n\n<The High Priestess’ eyes widen as she listens to your tale.>\n\nThe spirits were drawn forth… by a shining light? Could it have been the goddess herself?\n\nNo, she would bring them to their final rest with love... not with despair.\n\nI do not understand..."}
Q[85025]={d="她不相信我。即便到了现在，见过这一切之后，她仍紧守着她的守夜……她的职责……她的悲伤。艾露恩救我，我无法因此责怪她。那正是我当初最爱她的那颗心——那部分从不会转身离去，无论代价多大。\n\n可那颗心正在把她撕碎……也在把亡者锁住。\n\n求你，我恳求你。去和她谈谈。你帮助过我们，为瑟尔卓拉带来了改变，还揭开了灵魂们的困境，而我只擦净了几件圣物。她信任你。告诉她，留下来就是定他们的罪，而放手……就是给他们安宁。如果她听不进丈夫的话，也许她会听她勇士的话。",dEN="She does not believe me. Even now, after all we’ve seen, she clings to her vigil… to duty… to grief. Elune help me, I cannot fault her for it. It is the heart I once loved most in her—the part that could never turn away, no matter the cost.\n\nBut that heart is breaking her… and it is chaining the dead.\n\nPlease, I beg you. Speak with her. You have aided us, made a difference in Thel’dralor and uncovered the plight of the spirits whereas I have only dusted off relics. She trusts you. Tell her to remain is to condemn them, and to let go… is to give them peace. If she cannot listen to her husband, then perhaps she will listen to her champion.",o="说服高阶女祭司放弃她的工作，永远离开瑟尔卓拉遗迹。",oEN="Convince the High Priestess to abandon her work and leave the Remnants of Thel’dralor forever.",c="这……真的是唯一的选择吗……？",cEN="Is this... truly the only option...?"}
Q[85026]={d="即便发生了这一切，灵魂们依旧无法安息。\n\n尽管我亲眼看着她死去……我以群星起誓，我仍能感觉到她的灵魂……\n\n如果她的灵魂被束缚在这里，我求你了……找到她……让她安息。让这一切结束吧……",dEN="The spirits still cannot rest…even with all that has happened.\n\nEven though I saw her die with my own eyes…I swear upon the stars, I can still feel her spirit…\n\nIf her soul is bound here, I beg of you…find her…and bring her peace. Let this be finished…",o="确保艾瑞希尔·悲歌的灵魂得到安息。",oEN="Ensure Aerithel Sorrowsong's soul finds rest.",p="你……见到她了吗……？",pEN="Did... you see her...?",c="我曾祈祷菲拉莉亚是错的……但看到你的表情……我知道那是真的。\n\n尽管他们在此世的锚点已经消失……可是……灵魂们依旧留在原地。真的……这简直是疯狂……\n\n除了继续照看留下来的人……继续艾瑞希尔的工作……并试着在这个过程中放下我们自己的悲伤，我不知道还能做什么。也许有一天，我也会离开……但现在不行，不能在我这么早就失去一位挚友的时候，不能在灵魂们也许还会有变化迹象的时候。\n\n愿艾露恩照亮你的道路，勇士。",cEN="I prayed Filaria was wrong… but seeing your face… I know it to be true.\n\nThough their anchor to this world is gone… still…STILL the spirits remain. Truly…this is madness…\n\nI do not know what to do but to continue caring for those who remain… to continue Aerithel’s work…and to try and let go of our own grief in the process. One day, perhaps, I too will leave… but for now, I cannot, not when I’ve lost a dear friend so soon, not when the spirits may yet show some sign of change.\n\nElune light your path, Champion."}
Q[85028]={d="我听说了你所做的事。她的灵魂仍受折磨，这让我深感痛心。如果她的灵魂和其他灵魂被困在无休止的不安轮回里，从坟墓中彼此呼唤……她还能得到安宁吗？\n\n我无法向你表达我的心有多哀恸；也许现在是我在从坟墓中呼唤她，无意间又一次把他们锁在亡者之身中。这个轮回……仍在继续。\n\n我不敢奢望，但我已经把她仅存的遗物收在山上的一个箱子里。等你离开瑟尔卓拉时带上它们吧。也许，借着这些遗物，艾瑞希尔的灵魂终于能被劝离这个受诅咒的地方……得到她本被剥夺的安息。",dEN="I heard what you did. It pains me deeply that her spirit remains tormented. If her soul and the others are trapped in an endless cycle of unrest, calling one another from the grave… will she ever find peace?\n\nI cannot express to you how my heart mourns, perhaps it is I who now calls her from the grave, inadvertently chaining them in undeath once more. The cycle… it continues.\n\nI do not dare hope, but I’ve gathered what little of her belongings remain in a chest up the hill. Take them with you when you leave Thel’dralor. Perhaps, through them, Aerithel’s spirit may finally be coaxed from this accursed place… and find the rest she was denied.",o="在瑟尔卓拉遗迹取回艾瑞希尔的遗物。",oEN="Claim Aerithel’s belongings in the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",c="<打开箱子时，你感觉到一股幽灵般的存在，你知道艾瑞希尔的灵魂又一次行走于世了。>",cEN="<As you open the chest you feel a ghostly presence, and know that Aerithel’s spirit walks once more.>"}
Q[85029]={d="我不知道灵魂们说的是谁，或是何物。\n\n如果这样的召唤是由魔法施行的，那么我回到瑟尔卓拉时，它的存在理应对我显而易见。\n\n也许灵魂们的话比我理解的更字面、更具体。\n\n去找场地看护人瑟拉德林。如果说还有谁对这些废墟有深入了解且仍然在世……那就是他。",dEN="I do not know whom, or what, the spirits speak of.\n\nIf such a conjuring were summoned by magic, surely its presence would have been apparent upon my return to Thel’dralor.\n\nPerhaps the spirits’ words are more literal, more tangible than I have interpreted.\n\nSeek out Groundskeeper Theladrin. If there is anyone with deep knowledge of these ruins still alive… it would be him.",o="与瑟尔卓拉遗迹的场地看护人瑟拉德林交谈，查明那道光亮的源头。",oEN="Speak with Groundskeeper Theladrin in the Remnants of Thel’dralor and discover the source of the Shining Light.",p="瑟拉德林能给我们一些指教吗？",pEN="Was Theladrin able to offer us any wisdom?",c="不……不，不可能。我不会相信的。想到仅我的悲伤就能把他们锁在这里，这样的负担……这样的诅咒，那就意味着每一次祈祷、每一次守夜、每一个无眠之夜都只是折磨之上再加折磨。\n\n可是……我心中有一部分……在怀疑。怀疑他的话是否属实。但我怎么可能——我怎么可能抛下他们？我的族人……我的亲人……转身离去就是再一次背叛他们所有人。\n\n让我静一静，朋友。求你……我必须想一想。我必须……我必须找到力量，去弄清这是真相——还是又一个错误。",cEN="No… no, it cannot be. I will not believe it. To think that my grief alone could chain them here, such a burden… such a curse, it would mean every prayer, every vigil, every sleepless night has been nothing but torment upon torment.\n\nAnd yet… a part of me… wonders. Wonders if his words bear truth. But how could I- how could I ever abandon them? My people… my kin… to walk away would be to betray them all over again.\n\nLeave me, friend. Please… I must think. I must… I must find the strength to know whether this is truth—or yet another mistake."}
Q[85031]={d="我会召集其他人，以及我们仅剩的几件家当。他们是否能找到力量抛下家园……亲人……记忆……我现在还说不准。\n\n但我们走着瞧。到瑟尔卓拉的边界来找我们。离开之前，我们需要在那里待一会儿，道别。",dEN="I will gather the others, and what few belongings remain to us. Whether they will find the strength to leave behind their home… their kin… their memories… I cannot yet say.\n\nBut we shall see. Meet us at the edge of Thel’dralor. We will need a moment there, to offer our farewells before we depart.",o="在瑟尔卓拉遗迹的边界与微光之光的看护人汇合。",oEN="Meet with the Caretakers of the Fading Light at the edge of the Remnants of Thel’dralor.",c="……我……我不敢相信。艾瑞希尔……她……走了。就在这里。就在我们眼前。\n\n她不该遭这种罪。这一切都不该……那么多灵魂，那么多痛苦……而现在她走了，就因为我们要救他们。就因为我们想试试……\n\n我从没想过会看到她倒下……她一直那么坚强，为我们所有人撑着。可现在……没有她的指引，我该怎么办？我们做的一切……都是错的。我们该往哪里去？",cEN="…I… I can’t believe it. Aerithel… she’s… gone. Right here. In front of us.\n\nShe didn’t deserve this. None of it… all those souls, all that pain… and now she’s gone because we tried to save them. Because we tried…\n\nI never imagined I would see her fall… she was always so strong, for all of us. And now… what am I supposed to do without her guidance? Everything we’ve done… is wrong. Where do we go from here?"}
Q[88803]={d="前往时光之穴吧，<Lord/Lady> <name>。阿纳克洛斯在等你回去。把克苏恩之眼交给他，他无疑会想把它添进他主人的收藏。",dEN="To the Caverns of Time you go, <Lord/Lady> <name>. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="把克苏恩之眼带到时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯那里。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",p="<name>大人！一切都结束了……",pEN="Lord <name>! It is over...",c="主人把这些留给了你，勇士。来自永恒宝库：一批跨越数千年的神器藏品——选择权在你。",cEN="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours."}
Q[88850]={d="我本该去查看法德里耶斯是否安好……幸好我真去看了。\n\n<哨兵痛得缩起身子。>\n\n这些废墟里到处爬满了纳迦；我怕说话太大声会引来他们查看，而我已经没有力气保护我们了……再也不能了。\n\n更别提，一旦他们把目光转向南方，联合起来突袭奥伯丁，我们将无力击退他们。削减他们的人数吧，请快一点……",dEN="I was supposed to check of Fadrieth... and it's damn good thing I did too.\n\n<The Sentinel cringes in pain.>\n\nThere are naga crawling all over these ruins, I fear if I speak too loudly they might investigate and I am in no shape to defend us... not anymore.\n\nNot to mention should their eyes turn southward, if they coordinate an attack on Auberdine, we'd be helpless to repel them. Thin their numbers, and hurry, please...",o="削减玛塞斯特拉废墟中纳迦的数量。",oEN="Thin the ranks of the naga in the Ruins of Mathystra.",p="他们还在附近吗……？",pEN="Are they still nearby...?",c="谢谢你。\n\n<哨兵满口鲜血地笑了。>\n\n我已经感觉好多了……",cEN="Thank you.\n\n<The Sentinel smiles through bloodied teeth.>\n\nI feel better already...."}
Q[88860]={d="纳迦没了武器就没那么危险了。把倒下者的装备收起来，别丢在原地——别的纳迦只会把它们捡走。\n\n剥去他们的武器，让他们再没有伤害他人的手段。\n\n<哨兵的目光飘向她的小妹妹。>\n\n我无法忍受那样的念头……",dEN="The naga aren't that dangerous without their weapons. Gather the equipment of those who fall, if they are left behind - other naga will simply take them up.\n\nStrip them of their weapons and deny them the means to hurt another.\n\n<The Sentinel's eyes trail to her little sister.>\n\nI could not bear the thought...",o="从黑海岸沿岸的风暴之鳞纳迦身上收集 5 把纳迦弯刀、5 把纳迦战刃和 5 支纳迦长矛。",oEN="Collect 5 Naga Scimitars, 5 Naga Glaives, and 5 Naga Pikes from the Stormscale Naga along the Darkshore coast.",p="<哨兵痛得呻吟起来。>",pEN="<The Sentinel groans in pain.>",c="唔……太好了。\n\n看到这些武器不再落入鳞片之手，真是令人宽慰。它们再也不能用来伤害卡多雷了。\n\n你做得很好，<name>。",cEN="Nng... excellent.\n\nIt's a relief to see these armaments safe from scaled hands. They can never be used to hurt a Kal'dorei again.\n\nYou've done well, <name>."}
Q[88870]={d="<西莱斯忍着痛对你笑了笑。>\n\n我不知该怎么谢你，英雄。\n\n我们必须把发现的情况告诉哨兵队长……也许该派一位女祭司上来。我的状况没法赶路。\n\n现在就去，动作要快！",dEN="<Cylaeth smiles up at you, tinged with pain.>\n\nI cannot thank you enough for your aid, hero.\n\nWe must tell the Sentinel Captain what we have discovered... and perhaps send a priestess up here. I'm in no condition to travel.\n\nGo now, and be swift!",o="与队长阿玛雅·暮纱交谈。",oEN="Speak with Captain Amaya Duskveil.",p="有话直说吧，冒险者。出什么事了？",pEN="Speak your mind, adventurer. What is it?",c="谢谢你，冒险者，接下来交给我来处理。\n\n我们会派出援军和一支规模大得多的部队扫荡这些废墟，迎击任何残留的纳迦，并营救我们失踪的斥候。纳迦的存在一刻也不能再被容忍。\n\n你为我们做了很多，我不会忘记你的相助。要是你没有及时赶到，我不敢想象我们的哨兵会遭遇什么。",cEN="Thank you, adventurer, I shall take things from here.\n\nWe shall send assistance and a much larger battalion to sweep through these ruins and confront whatever naga remain and rescue our missing scouts. The naga's presence will not be tolerated a moment longer.\n\nYou have done much for us, and I shall not forget your aid. I dare not imagine what might have happened to our sentinels should your arrival not be so timely."}
Q[90000]={d="你好，<name>。\n\n我们在灰谷的斥候发来报告，称该地区的绿龙军团活动异常频繁。他们显得躁动不安，仿佛收到了什么凶兆。\n\n我们需要人手前往树影林的前线，协助平息该区域的任何侵略行为。如果你决定加入我们，记得从他们的尸体上剥些鳞片下来。如果你在战场上表现得足够出色，我相信我们能为你的报酬达成某种安排。\n\n在外面小心点，<name>，我们已有报告称有人在对梦境的堕落中迷失了自我，如今追求着另一种回报。",dEN="Greetings, <name>.\n\nOur scouts from Ashenvale have sent in reports of an abnormal amount of activity from the Green Dragonflight in the area. They seem restless, as if they have recieved a bad omen.\n\nWe need men on the front lines at the Bough Shadow to help quell any aggression in the area. If you should choose to join us, be sure to pry some scales off of their dead bodies. If you do well enough on the battlefield I'm sure we could come to some kind of arrangement for your comhensation.\n\nBe careful out there <name>, we've had reports of men have losing themselves against the dreamers, and now seek a different reward.",o="从灰谷的树影林带回 60 片树影鳞片。",oEN="Return with 60 Bough Scales from the Bough Shadow in Ashenvale."}
Q[91001]={d="全体英雄注意：\n\n艾萨拉的蓝龙军团一直在挖掘门纳尔学院的遗迹，寻找沉睡在瓦砾与泥土之下的强大神器。\n\n绝不能让他们的侵犯得到默许。前往门纳尔湖，杀死你见到的任何蓝龙军团成员。\n\n带回 30 只蓝龙人的爪子，作为你功绩的证明。",dEN="ATTENTION ALL HEROES:\n\nThe Blue Dragonflight in Azshara have been digging up the remains of the Mennar Academy seeking powerful artifacts that lay dormant under the rubble and soil.\n\nTheir encroachment must not be met with passivity. Travel to Lake Mennar and kill any members of the Blue Dragonflight that you see.\n\nReturn with 30 Blue Dragonkin Claws as proof of your deeds.",o="从艾萨拉门纳尔湖带回 30 只蓝龙人的爪子。",oEN="Return with 30 Blue Dragonkin Claws from Lake Mennar in Azshara.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91002]={d="全体英雄注意：\n\n纳迦已经成为尘泥沼泽居民的大麻烦。他们一直在袭击往返塞拉摩和棘齿城的贸易与补给船只。是时候给他们一个难忘的教训了。\n\n去吧，冒险者。到阿尔卡兹岛上找到他们的巢穴，杀死那些水中的杂碎，带着他们的珍珠回来。\n\n不过要当心。我们的先头斥候报告说，那一带有个疯狂的侏儒科学家的怪异动静……",dEN="ATTENTION ALL HEROES:\n\nThe Naga have become quite an issue for the people of Dustwallow Marsh. They have been assaulting trading and supply ships going and coming from Theramore and Ratchet. The time has come to teach them a lesson that they won't soon forget.\n\nGo, adventurer. Seek out their home on Alcaz Island, slay the water-mongrels, and return with their pearls.\n\nBe wary, however. Our forward scouts have reported some strange rumblings of a mad Gnomish scientist in that area...",o="从尘泥沼泽外海的阿尔卡兹岛带回 12 颗纳迦珍珠。",oEN="Return with 12 Naga Pearls from Alcaz Island off the coast of the Dustwallow Marsh",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91004]={d="全体英雄注意：\n\n来自菲拉斯的令人不安的消息，冒险者！\n\n受翡翠梦魇腐化的绿龙军团一直在菲拉斯全境扩张势力。他们的数量似乎越来越多。\n\n他们已在翡翠湖一带被人目击。必须立即阻止他们的推进。\n\n搜寻你在那里发现的任何绿龙军团成员，带回他们的鳞片作为你功绩的证明。",dEN="ATTENTION ALL HEROES:\n\nTroubling news from Feralas, adventurer!\n\nThe Green Dragonflight, corrupted as a result of the Emerald Nightmare, have been expanding their forces throughout Feralas. They seem to be becoming more numerous.\n\nThey have been spotted around Jademir Lake. Their advance must be stopped forthwith.\n\nSeek out any Green Dragonflight members that you find there, and return with their scales as proof of your deeds.",o="从菲拉斯的翡翠湖带回 10 片灌注梦枝之力的鳞片。",oEN="Return with 10 Dream Bough-Infused Scales from Jademir Lake in Feralas.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91006]={d="招募帮手：\n\n菲拉斯的奇美拉种群正在快速增长。太快了。若按目前的速度继续下去，它们将超出恐怖之岛家园的承载能力，像瘟疫一样蔓延整个菲拉斯。\n\n必须维护艾泽拉斯的生态平衡，一旦这些奇美拉迁出岛屿，整个卡利姆多都将遭殃。\n\n削减它们的数量。带回每种奇美拉的四只翅膀。",dEN="HELP WANTED:\n\nThe Chimaerok population in Feralas is growing fast. Too fast. If it continues at the rate it is going currently, they will outgrow their home of the Isle of Dread and spread throughout Feralas like a plague.\n\nAzeroth's ecological balance must be preserved and if these Chimaeroks migrate out of the Isle, they would cause havoc throughout Kalimdor.\n\nReduce their population. Return with four wings from each type of Chimaerok.",o="从恐怖之岛带回奇美拉的角。",oEN="Return with the horns of the Chimaerok from the Isle of Dread.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91007]={d="招募雇佣兵：\n\n在冬泉谷海加尔山脚下的暗语峡谷，探测到大量恶魔能量涌出。看来有一股庞大的恶魔势力聚集在那里。\n\n这对我们只能是坏消息。我们需要你去找到驻扎在那里的赫达林副官，并将他们击杀。\n\n我们的先头斥候报告说他们身上带着奇怪的符文。从副官的尸体上取下符文带回来，以便进一步分析。",dEN="MERCENARIES NEEDED:\n\nA large amount of demonic energy has been felt emanating from Darkwhisper Gorge at the foot of Mount Hyjal in Winterspring. It appears that a large demonic force has amassed there.\n\nThis can only be bad news for us. We need you to seek out the Hederine Lieutenants residing there and slay them.\n\nOur forward scouts report that they carry strange runes. Take the runes from the bodies of the Lieutenants and return with them for further analysis.",o="处理冬泉谷暗语峡谷的恶魔威胁。",oEN="Deal with the demon threat in Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91008]={d="致所有感兴趣的人：\n\n冬泉谷霜语峡谷的霜槌巨人的元素构成一直具有引人入胜的特性。那些碎片和 E'ko 似乎是永不融化的结晶之冰。\n\n我们期望这些能在某种程度上为我们所用。前往霜语峡谷，以科学之名收集霜槌碎片和霜槌 E'ko！",dEN="TO ANY INTERESTED PARTIES:\n\nThe elements and composition of the Frostmaul Giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in Winterspring have always had intriguing properties. The shards and E'ko seem to be crystallic ice that never melts.\n\nWe expect these can be useful to us in some way. Travel to Frostwhisper Gorge and collect Frostmaul Shards and Frostmaul E'ko in the name of SCIENCE!",o="从冬泉谷的霜语峡谷带回 15 块霜槌碎片和 4 份霜槌 E'ko。",oEN="Return with 15 Frostmaul Shards and 4 Frostmaul E'ko from Frostwhisper Gorge in Winterspring",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91009]={d="招募雇佣兵：\n\n我们建议你为这项任务带上保暖装备。\n\n我们听闻有龙人从冬泉谷的麦索瑞尔涌出。与其他英雄联手，协助平息这一威胁。\n\n带回所需数量的龙鳞，你的努力将得到应有的回报。",dEN="MERCENARIES NEEDED:\n\nWe advise that you bring some warm gear for this task.\n\nWe've heard reports of Dragonkin emerging from Mazthoril in Winterspring. Join forces with fellow Heroes to help quell this threat.\n\nReturn with the required amount of their scales and you shall be duly rewarded for your efforts.",o="从冬泉谷的麦索瑞尔带回鳞片。",oEN="Return with scales from Mazthoril in Winterspring",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91010]={d="全体英雄注意：\n\n我们的侦察部队在荒芜之地的腐痕谷探测到异常的恶魔活动。\n\n燃烧军团军队的残部突然表现出有组织——因而危险——的行为。\n\n我们相信他们正在列阵集结残存兵力，可能是要做最后一次绝望的突击。\n\n也许他们在等待来自黑暗之门另一侧的增援？我们只能希望不是如此。\n\n我们绝不会被打个措手不及，也绝不姑息燃烧军团的任何威胁。\n\n重创他们的军队。带回他们的恶魔精华作为凭证。",dEN="ATTENTION ALL HEROES:\n\nOur reconnaissance forces have detected unusual demonic activity in the Tainted Scar, located within the Blasted Lands.\n\nRemnants of the Burning Legion's army are suddenly exhibiting organized and, therefore, dangerous behavior.\n\nWe believe they are forming ranks and consolidating what forces they have left for what could be a final desperate assault.\n\nPerhaps they expect reinforcements from beyond the Dark Portal? We can only hope not.\n\nWe will not be taken by surprise and we shall brook no threat from the Burning Legion.\n\nDecimate their forces. Return with their Demonic Essences as proof of the deed.",o="从腐痕谷带回 15 份恶魔精华。",oEN="Return with 15 Demonic Essence from the Tainted Scar",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91011]={d="招募雇佣兵：\n\n血色十字军又一次越界了。\n\n他们变得过于狂热，正试图在东瘟疫之地招募我们的部队。\n\n给他们一个明确的信息：对我们士兵的灌输绝不被容忍。\n\n潜入提尔之手——他们行动的腹地——从他们血淋淋的尸体上收集血色徽记。\n\n唯一好的狂热者，就是死掉的狂热者。",dEN="MERCENARIES NEEDED:\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade have once again overstepped their bounds.\n\nThey have become overzealous and are attempting to recruit from our forces in the Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nSend them a clear message that indoctrination of our soldiers will NOT be tolerated.\n\nInfiltrate Tyr's Hand, the heart of their operations, and collect Scarlet Emblems from their bloodied corpses.\n\nThe only good fanatic is a dead fanatic.",o="从提尔之手带回 25 枚血色徽记",oEN="Return with 25 Scarlet Emblems from Tyr's Hand",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91012]={d="招募猎鬼人：\n\n你相信有鬼吗？\n\n你相信可以为了钱杀掉他们吗？！\n\n那你可算找对告示板了，伙计。我们的客户有个特别的要求。\n\n希尔斯布莱德丘陵海岸以南的净化岛，到处都是那些灵质皮纳塔。\n\n狠狠敲打它们，直到它们再死一次、死得难看，让它们的幽灵精华飞出来。\n\n收集 15 份，谁知道呢，也许你还能拿到一笔介绍费！\n\n——署名，\n伊贡·菲兹克兰克",dEN="GHOSTHUNTERS NEEDED:\n\nDo you believe in ghosts?\n\nDo you believe in killing them for money?!\n\nThen you've come to the right callboard, pal. Our client has a special request.\n\nPurgation Isle, south of the shores of Hillsbrad Foothills, is just brimming with those ectoplasmic piñatas.\n\nWhack em' until they die a second horrible death and their Ghostly Essence comes flyin' out.\n\nCollect 15 of those and, who knows, you might even get a finder's fee!\n\n- SIGNED,\nEgon Fizzlecrank",o="从净化岛带回 15 份幽灵精华",oEN="Return with 15 Ghostly Essence from Purgation Isle",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[91014]={d="特别请求：\n\n我以制皮为业，有一件特别的委托想请有兴趣的冒险者帮忙。\n\n我受托为一位客户制作一套独一无二的红色龙鳞护甲。\n\n那位客户坚持鳞片必须是红色的。非常红。\n\n一种闪闪发亮、流光溢彩的红。他形容为 \"血一般的深红\"。\n\n他似乎相信，如果对手看不出他在流血，他就能获得某种战术优势。\n\n湿地的龙喉大门由大量鳞须皇家卫兵把守。他们的鳞片应该够用。\n\n我需要至少 30 片皇家红龙鳞，才能为客户完成整套护甲。",dEN="SPECIAL REQUEST:\n\nI am a professional leatherworker by trade and have a peculiar request for any interested adventurers.\n\nI have been commissioned to craft a unique set of red Dragonscale Armor for a client.\n\nThe client was insistent that the scales should be red. Very red.\n\nA glistening, shimmering red. He described it as a \"crimson, bloody red\".\n\nHe seems to believe that if his opponent cannot tell that he is bleeding, he will be at some kind of tactical advantage.\n\nThe Dragonmaw Gates in the Wetlands are guarded by plenty Scalebane Royal Guards. Their scales should suffice.\n\nI'll be needing at least 30 Royal Red Dragonscales to complete the full set for my client.",o="从龙喉大门带回 30 片皇家红龙鳞",oEN="Return with 30 Royal Red Dragonscales from the Dragonmaw Gates",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗退去了，哪怕只是暂时。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得赞扬。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[92000]={d="沙虫之牙与你见过的任何东西都不同。它比最精良的钢还要坚硬，重量却几乎为零。它绝对坚不可摧，却又似乎柔韧灵活。你从未见过这样的物件。\n\n看着这颗牙，一股压倒性的感觉涌遍全身。仿佛你周围的空气本身都在因力量而嗡鸣。把牙放进掌心，一阵难以忍受的剧痛传遍你的身体。你握不住它。\n\n一个无形的低语在你脑海中回响。你必须查明这把武器中灌注的古老力量究竟是什么来头。",dEN="The Sandworm Tooth is unlike anything you have seen. It is harder than the finest steel, yet it weighs almost nothing. It is absolutely unyielding, but somehow still seems flexible. You have never seen an object like this.\n\nAs you look at the tooth, and overwhelming sensation washes over you. It is as if the very air around you hums with power. Placing the tooth in your palm sends a wave of unbearable pain through your body. You cannot hold it.\n\nA formless whisper echoes in your mind. You must find out more about the nature of the ancient power imbued in this weapon.",o="找到了解沙虫之牙的人。",oEN="Find someone who knows about the Sandworm Tooth.",c="众神在上……我从没想到还能再见到一颗完好的沙虫之牙。这真是非同寻常。它所蕴含的力量……几乎触手可及。我以前确实见过一颗，但我不敢在这里谈论此事。我们必须小心行事，因为这颗牙里藏着某个古老而危险的秘密的钥匙。",cEN="By the gods... I never thought I'd lay eyes on another Pristine Sandworm Tooth. This is truly remarkable. The power it holds... it's almost palpable. I've seen one before, yes, but I dare not speak of it here. We must tread carefully, for this tooth holds the key to an ancient and dangerous secret."}
Q[100001]={d="你好啊，英雄！\n\n很高兴又见到你……哦，还是说我们这是初次见面……？我从来记不清，要流转的时间太多了……\n\n说到时间……\n\n看起来你现在的专精还有改进的余地……也许你想回到过去改一改？",dEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nIt’s good to see you again... Oh, or maybe we’re meeting for the first time..? I can never really remember, there’s so much time to go around..\n\nSpeaking of time...\n\nIt looks like that specialization you have could use some improvement.. Maybe you’d like to go back in time to change it..?",o="你好啊，英雄！\n\n很高兴又见到你……哦，还是说我们这是初次见面……？我从来记不清，要流转的时间太多了……\n\n说到时间……\n\n看起来你现在的专精还有改进的余地……也许你想回到过去改一改？",oEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nIt’s good to see you again... Oh, or maybe we’re meeting for the first time..? I can never really remember, there’s so much time to go around..\n\nSpeaking of time...\n\nIt looks like that specialization you have could use some improvement.. Maybe you’d like to go back in time to change it..?"}
Q[100003]={d="你好啊，英雄！\n\n所以你不想选新的东西？对现在的选择很满意？那样的话，我愿意用你的选择换一次好运的机会。\n\n这会移除你的选择卷轴！",dEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nSo you don't want to choose anything new? Happy with what you have? In that case I'd be willing to trade your choice for a chance at good fortune.\n\nTHIS WILL REMOVE YOUR SCROLL OF CHOOSING!",o="你好啊，英雄！\n\n所以你不想选新的东西？对现在的选择很满意？那样的话，我愿意用你的选择换一次好运的机会。\n\n这会移除你的选择卷轴！",oEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nSo you don't want to choose anything new? Happy with what you have? In that case I'd be willing to trade your choice for a chance at good fortune.\n\nTHIS WILL REMOVE YOUR SCROLL OF CHOOSING!"}
Q[100004]={d="你好啊，英雄！\n\n我们中的一些人靠坚持与准备创造自己的运气。\n\n愿你的运气助你一臂之力。",dEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nSome of us make our own luck through persistence and preparation.\n\nMay your luck server you well.",o="你好啊，英雄！\n\n我们中的一些人靠坚持与准备创造自己的运气。\n\n愿你的运气助你一臂之力。",oEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nSome of us make our own luck through persistence and preparation.\n\nMay your luck server you well."}
Q[100005]={d="你好啊，英雄！\n\n一只蓝色小鸟丢下了一整箱幸运卷轴。它不知从哪儿冒出来，叽叽喳喳地唱着即将到来的大事，还吩咐我把 3 张幸运卷轴送给配得上的英雄。",dEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nA little blue bird dropped off an entire crate of Scrolls of Fortunes. It came out of nowhere twitterings and twattering and tweeting about big things to come and instructed me to deliver 3 Scrolls of Fortune to worthy heroes.",o="你好啊，英雄！\n\n一只蓝色小鸟丢下了一整箱幸运卷轴。它不知从哪儿冒出来，叽叽喳喳地唱着即将到来的大事，还吩咐我把 3 张幸运卷轴送给配得上的英雄。",oEN="Hello there, Hero!\n\nA little blue bird dropped off an entire crate of Scrolls of Fortunes. It came out of nowhere twitterings and twattering and tweeting about big things to come and instructed me to deliver 3 Scrolls of Fortune to worthy heroes."}
Q[100008]={d="在冬泉谷这片严寒之地，有好几种强大的生物拥有我需要的 E'ko。\n\n我需要熊怪的寒冬坠落 E'ko、威严的碎齿熊的碎齿 E'ko、难以捉摸的枭兽的枭兽 E'ko、致命的冰风奇美拉的冰风 E'ko，以及狡黠的冰蓟雪人的冰蓟 E'ko。\n\n把这些带给我，我会把它们合成你所寻求的霜寒。这项技能将赋予持有者强大的力量。但小心点，伙计，冬泉谷的生物可不是好惹的。只有最强最勇敢的英雄才该接下这个任务。你有这个本事吗？\n\n记住，想猎取 E'ko，你的背包里必须有毛阿里之匣。",dEN="In the frigid land of Winterspring, there are several powerful creatures that possess the E'ko I need.\n\nI require Winterfall E'ko from the furbolgs, Shardtooth E'ko from the majestic Shardtooth bears, Wildkin E'ko from the elusive wildkin, Chillwind E'ko from the deadly Chillwind Chimeras, and Ice Thistle E'ko from the cunning Ice Thistle Yetis.\n\nBring these to me and I will combine them in to the Hoarfrost you seek. This skill will grant great power to whoever wields it. But be warned, mon, the creatures of Winterspring are not to be trifled with. Only the strongest and bravest heroes should undertake this quest. Do you have what it takes?\n\nRememba, you must have the Cache of Mau'ari in your inventory if you want ta hunt for E'ko.",o="收集所有 E'ko 组件，将它们合成霜寒。",oEN="Gather all the E'ko components to combine in to the Hoarfrost.",c="我由衷地祝贺你，伙计，你证明了自己是真正的英雄。作为奖励，我把霜寒的强大力量赐予你。\n\n这股力量会让最强的敌人也吓得发抖。愿它在战斗中对你大有用处。",cEN="Me hearty congratulations mon, you have proven yourself to be a true hero. As a reward, me present to you the mighty power of the Hoarfrost.\n\nThis power will make even the strongest of enemies tremble with fear. May it serve you well in battle."}
Q[100025]={d="我还有一份奖励，嘉奖你的英勇……",dEN="I have one last reward for your heroism...",o="接受陨落英雄的奖励。",oEN="Accept the Fallen Hero's reward."}
Q[100026]={d="谢谢你，英雄，谢谢你所做的一切。",dEN="Thank you hero, for all that you've done.",o="接受提里奥的谢意。",oEN="Receive Tirion's thanks."}
Q[100027]={d="嘿，你也是炎术师？该死，真倒霉。我本来还指望只有我一个人得受这份罪。\n\n好吧，如果你现在愿意发发善心，只要杀 2 只小猪，捡一下它们掉落的东西就行了。谢谢。\n\n科比率领一切\n相关",dEN="Hey, you're a Pyromancer too? Gyatt damn, that sucks. I was hoping I was the only one who had to suffer like this.\n\nWayll, if you wanna be cute rn u can simply kill 2 piggys and loot their braaps. Thanks.\n\nALL HAIL LORD KOBE\nRelated",o="杀 2 只小猪",oEN="kill 2 piggy"}
Q[100028]={o="你好，我是杜比，大便和小便的大人物，我非常喜欢数字 8。\n\n哈哈，为什么 7 害怕 4？因为 8% 哈哈\n相关",oEN="Helo I am dooby the big poopoo peepee man and I like the number 8 ALOT.\n\nHaha why is 7 afraid of 4? becaujse 8% lol\nRelated"}
Q[100029]={d="我该把装满的圣杯还给卡兹诺。",dEN="I should return the filled chalice back to Khazno.",o="带着装满的圣杯回去找卡兹诺。",oEN="Return to Khazno with the filled chalice.",p="你回来了？希望是好消息。",pEN="You've returned, with good news I hope?",c="哎呀，太感谢你了。这应该能派上用场！\n相关",cEN="Oh my, thank you so much. This should help!\nRelated"}
Q[100030]={d="你必须学会如何施加神秘附魔。",dEN="You must learn how to apply a mystic enchant.",o="施加一个神秘附魔。",oEN="Apply a mystic enchant."}
Q[100032]={d="所以你觉得你有成为强大战斗者的本事，是吧？\n\n让我把话说清楚。\n\n你没有。\n\n但如果你想试试？请便。这不像打一个普通强盗或一只游荡的野兽，<class>。这是真正的战斗，可不容易。\n\n想在这里闯出名堂？你得有耐心、意志坚定，也许还得有点乐观精神，并且愿意学习。\n\n这样吧。去战斗吧。证明你能与最强者一较高下，然后回来找我，我会用荣誉给你应得的回报。",dEN="So you think you have what it takes to be a powerful combatant, yeah?\n\nLet me make it very clear.\n\nYou don't.\n\nBut if you want to try? Be my guest. This isn't like fighting your average bandit or wayward creature, <class>. This is real fighting, and it's not easy.\n\nIf you want to make it here? You'll have to be patient, strong-willed, maybe even a tad optimistic, and willing to learn.\n\nI'll tell you what. Go off and fight. Prove you can fight it out with the best of them, then come back to me, and I'll make it worth your while in honor.",o="杀死 20 名玩家并完成 1 场战场。",oEN="Kill 20 players and complete 1 battleground.",c="我原本对你不抱信心。但你证明我错了。干得好。",cEN="I did not have faith in you. But you proved me wrong. Good job."}
Q[100033]={d="我是位老兵，<class>。你相信自己有在光荣的战斗中击败他人的本事？\n\n听我说。\n\n战场是最休闲的冒险者互相厮打的地方，那里的战斗往往血腥而混乱。\n\n而竞技场则能让你磨练技艺。看得出你看重有技巧的战斗，所以，这是我的提议。\n\n赢下 10 场竞技场练习赛，我会为你的付出给你回报。",dEN="I am a veteran of war, <class>. You believe you have what it takes to defeat others in glorious combat?\n\nListen to me.\n\nBattlegrounds are a place where the most casual adventurer go to duke it out, and the battles that occur there are often gruesome and hectic.\n\nArenas, on the other hand, allow you to hone your skill. I can see you value skillful combat, so, here is my proposition for you.\n\nWin 10 Arena Skirmishes and I will reward you for your efforts.",o="参加 1v1、2v2 和 3v3 三场竞技场练习赛。",oEN="Participate in three 1v1, 2v2, and 3v3 Arena Skirmishes.",c="你没让我失望。打得漂亮！",cEN="You did not disappoint. Brilliant fighting!"}
Q[100034]={d="今天是你的幸运日，英雄！如果你能给我带来 6 块幸运碎片，我就能把它们修补回一张可用的幸运卷轴。材料凑齐后，到你本地的告示板来找我就行。",dEN="Today is your lucky day, Hero! If you are able to bring me 6 Fragments of Fortune, I can mend them back into a functioning Scroll of Fortune. Just find me at your local Call Board when you've gathered the materials.",o="带着 6 块幸运碎片回去找诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to Nozdormu with 6 Fragments of Fortune.",p="你按要求把碎片带来了吗？",pEN="You have brought the Fragments as requested?",c="干得漂亮，英雄！愿幸运今日眷顾你。",cEN="Excellent work Hero! May fortune favor you this day."}
Q[100035]={d="今天是你的幸运日，英雄！如果你能给我带来 10 块幸运碎片，我就能把它们修补回一张可用的幸运卷轴。材料凑齐后，到你本地的告示板来找我就行。",dEN="Today is your lucky day, Hero! If you are able to bring me 10 Fragments of Fortune, I can mend them back into a functioning Scroll of Fortune. Just find me at your local Call Board when you've gathered the materials.",o="带着 10 块幸运碎片回去找诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to Nozdormu with 10 Fragments of Fortune.",p="你按要求把碎片带来了吗？",pEN="You have brought the Fragments as requested?",c="干得漂亮，英雄！愿幸运今日眷顾你。",cEN="Excellent work Hero! May fortune favor you this day."}
