Q[100058]={d="啊，朝圣者的盛宴时节到了，<class>！\n\n这是一个反思、感恩，而最重要的是……大快朵颐的季节！但一桌盛宴的好坏，取决于做菜的那双手，也取决于那些花时间栽种和培育食材的人。问题恰恰就出在这里……\n\n我们的农夫遇上了点小麻烦，收成因此减少，货运也不再可靠。有个……装置不知道跑到哪儿去了。如果你能处理掉它，我们都会非常感激你！\n\n愿你回来时，心和我们餐桌一样充实！",dEN="Ah, the time of Pilgrim's Bounty is upon us, <class>!\n\nIt's a season to reflect, to give thanks, and most importantly... to feast! But a feast is only as good as the hands that prepare it, and those who take the time to raise and nourish the wonderful ingredients that will be used. THAT is where a particular problem has come up...\n\nOur farmers have come into a bit of a pickle and its making their harvests less productive and their shipments less reliable. There is a... contraption that has gone astray. If you could deal with it we would all be very grateful to you!\n\nMay your heart be as full as our tables when you return!",o="在贫瘠之地或西部荒野击败菲尔·格里姆。",oEN="Defeat Phil Grim in the Barrens or Westfall.",c="击败菲尔·格里姆干得漂亮，<name>！你拯救了朝圣者的盛宴！\n\n这是你的奖励。",cEN="Wonderful work defeating Phil Grim, <name>! You've saved Pilgrim's Bounty!\n\nHere's your reward."}
Q[100071]={d="回到艾尔文森林闪金镇的梅莉卡·铁步那里。",dEN="Return to Melika Isenstrider at Goldshire in Elwynn Forest.",o="削减闪金镇以东强盗堡垒中迪菲亚盗贼的数量。",oEN="Thin the ranks of the Defias at the Bandit Bastion, east of Goldshire."}
Q[100072]={d="命运不会犯错，但英雄呢？\n\n给我带来飞升印记，我就会赐予你一张天赋王牌，让你可以重新选择已选的天赋技能。",dEN="Fate does not make mistakes, but can the same be said for Heroes?\n\nBring me Marks of Ascension, and I will grant you an Ace of Talents that will allow you to reselect your chosen talent abilities.",o="带着 100 枚飞升印记回去找希拉斯·暗月。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon with 100 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[100073]={d="听着，如果你还有精力接下任务，我这有个小小的后续。\n\n有消息说迪菲亚在东边建了个像样的据点。那是个大型营地，比寻常的乌合之众有组织得多。\n\n不久前，一些本地商人遭到洗劫，成箱的补给被抢走。都是些有用的东西，比如工具、布料，甚至一些稀有的烈酒。这一带的人就靠这些货物过日子。\n\n这事并非没有风险，但如果有人能进去把失物找回来，我认识几个会心存感激的人。我会确保你的付出得到回报。",dEN="Listen, I have a bit of a follow up for you, if you're still feeling up to the task.\n\nThere’s talk that the Defias have gathered in a proper hideout east of here. It’s a large encampment, far more organized than the usual rabble.\n\nSome local merchants were hit in a raid not long ago. Crates of supplies were taken. Useful things like tools, cloth, even some rare spirits. The sort of goods folks rely on around here.\n\nIt’s not without risk, but if someone were to head in and recover what was lost, I know a few people who would be grateful. I would see to it that you're rewarded for your effort.",o="从闪金镇以东的强盗堡垒取回 4 箱被偷的补给。",oEN="Recover 4 Stolen Supply Crates from the Bandit Bastion, east of Goldshire.",p="那边情况怎么样？你弄到那些箱子了吗？",pEN="How’s it look out there? You get your hands on any of those crates?",c="干得好。我会确保这些货物回到它们合法的主人手中。",cEN="Well done. I’ll see to it these goods get back to their rightful owners."}
Q[100074]={d="你发现了一份看起来货真价实的联盟文件，是从一名打扮成士兵、驻扎在迪菲亚前哨深处的人身上找到的。文件内容表明联盟部队与本地强盗之间存在勾结。\n\n这本不该发生。得让一位忠诚的人看看这个。\n\n把文件交给一位合适的联盟官员。运气好的话，他们会知道该怎么处理。",dEN="You've found what looks like a genuine Alliance document, carried by a man dressed as a soldier stationed deep in a Defias outpost. The contents point to collusion between Alliance forces and local bandits.\n\nThis should not be happening. Someone loyal needs to see this.\n\nDeliver the document to an appropriate Alliance official. With any luck, they will know what to do with it.",o="回去找杜汉元帅。",oEN="Return to Marshal Dughan.",p="你有事要汇报？让我看看。",pEN="You’ve got something to report? Let me see it.",c="所以……你是在我们自己人身上找到这个的，是吗？\n\n这枚印章是真的。我拿我的警徽担保。但这些命令是叛国。与强盗勾结？授权袭击我们自己的人民？\n\n这可不是什么伪造品。有人下达了这些命令，他们会为此付出代价。\n\n谢谢你把它交上来。悄悄地。剩下的交给我们。",cEN="So... you found this on one of our own, did you?\n\nThis seal’s legitimate. I’d stake my badge on it. But these orders are treason. Coordinating with bandits? Authorizing raids on our people?\n\nThis isn’t some forgery. Someone gave these commands, and they’ll answer for it.\n\nThank you for bringing this forward. Quietly. We’ll handle the rest."}
Q[100075]={d="收集到那块粗制皮革做得好，<name>。\n\n粗制皮革是游侠独有的。谁都能学会剥兽皮，但很少有人能理解兽皮中最粗糙边角的微妙之处。\n\n身为游侠，我们善于就地取材，因此能用极少的材料为自己做出极其有用的东西。\n\n试试看，<name>。制作一个水袋，然后回来找我。",dEN="Well done on collecting that Crude Leather, <name>.\n\nCrude Leather is unique to Rangers. Anyone can learn to skin a beast, but few would understand the nuance of the cruder scraps amongst their pelts.\n\nWe are resourceful as Rangers and, as such, can make incredibly useful things for ourselves with very little.\n\nGive it a go, <name>. Craft a Waterskin and then return to me.",o="为你的训练师制作一个水袋。",oEN="Craft a Waterskin for your trainer."}
Q[100076]={d="我想我现在明白了……但艾露恩在上，我真希望自己不明白！\n\n邪教徒想要唤醒恶魔索苟斯，他们的仪式已经开始了。最后一步必须由暮光之锤的三位首领完成，而他们将由女祭司安达莉尔召唤。我们绝不能让它们降临！\n\n现在就去，越快越好！你必须杀掉那位女祭司，阻止这场灾祸降临我们的海岸！",dEN="I think I understand now... but by Elune I wish I didn't!\n\nThe cultists wish to awaken the fiend, Soggoth, and their ritual is already underway. The last step is to be completed by the three leaders of the Twilight's Hammer who will be summoned by Priestess Andariel. We must not let them arrive!\n\nGo now, and swiftly! You must slay the Priestess and prevent this doom from befalling our shores!",o="在主宰之刃杀死暮光召唤者并击败女祭司安达莉尔，阻止那里的仪式。",oEN="Stop the ritual in the Master's Glaive by killing Twilight Summoners and slaying Priestess Andariel.",p="博学者查出什么了吗？",pEN="Has the Lorekeeper uncovered anything?",c="<听你讲述时，队长的眼睛睁大了。>\n\n赞美女神，你平安回来了。这样的任务连我最有经验的哨兵都会感到棘手。\n\n尽管你的作为十分英勇，但这样的事竟然需要发生，这让我深感不安。我得重新评估我们守卫和巡逻主宰之刃的方式，以免这样的灾难再次发生。",cEN="<The Captain's eyes grow wide at your tale.>\n\nPraise the Goddess, you've returned safely. Such a task would've troubled even my more experienced Sentinels.\n\nThough your deeds were valorous, the fact that they were required at all disturbs me greatly. I shall need to reevaluate how we protect and patrol the glaive to prevent such a catastrophe from happening once more."}
Q[100077]={d="告示板正在招募指挥官。保持小队队长身份，击败任意团队副本的最终首领，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is looking for commanders. Remain the group leader and defeat the final boss of any raid, then return to the Callboard to claim your reward.",o="带领任意团队副本小队战胜最终首领。",oEN="Lead any raid group to victory over a final raid boss.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行完契约再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[100078]={d="告示板正在招募指挥官。保持小队队长身份，击败任意非史诗+地下城的最终首领，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is looking for commanders. Remain the group leader and defeat the final boss of any non-Mythic+ dungeon, then return to the Callboard to claim your reward.",o="带领任意非史诗+地下城小队战胜最终首领。",oEN="Lead any non-Mythic+ dungeon group to victory over a final dungeon boss.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行完契约再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[100079]={d="告示板正在招募指挥官。保持小队队长身份，击败任意史诗+地下城的最终首领，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",dEN="The Callboard is looking for commanders. Remain the group leader and defeat the final boss of any Mythic+ dungeon, then return to the Callboard to claim your reward.",o="带领任意史诗+小队战胜最终首领。",oEN="Lead any Mythic+ group to victory over a final dungeon boss.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行完契约再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[100080]={d="你好，凡人……如果你哪天想从扭曲虚空的深处找回一个孤苦的灵魂，要知道，你该找的不是别人，正是我，伟大的贝尔皮克斯！\n\n我很仁慈，但我可不是慈善机构……给我带来燃烧军团阵亡部队的邪能之血，还有一块复活石。\n\n哦，再加上大约一千金币，我们就成交了！我需要那笔钱来，呃……做生意！对，做生意……",dEN="Hello mortal.. Should you ever find yourself seeking to retrieve a forlorn soul from the depths of the Twisting Nether, know that you should look no further than I, the great Belpix!\n\nI am benevolent, but I am not a charity case.. Bring me Fel Blood of fallen Legion forces, and one Resurrection Stone\n\nOh, and, throw in about a thousand gold and we should good! I need that for uhm.... For the trade! Yes, the trade..",o="带着 250 份邪能之血、一块复活石和 1000 金币回到贝尔皮克斯那里。",oEN="Return to Belpix with 250 Fel Blood, a Ressurection Stone, and 1000 gold."}
Q[100081]={d="告示板正在寻找身经百战的斗士。在搏击者公会竞技场击败 3 名对手，证明你的价值。任何段位，任何对手——只要赢就行。",dEN="The Callboard is seeking battle-hardened brawlers. Prove your worth by defeating 3 opponents in the Brawler's Guild arena. Any rank, any opponent — just win.",o="搏击者公会在召唤它的冠军。踏入竞技场击败任意 3 名对手，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",oEN="The Brawler's Guild is calling on its champions. Step into the arena and defeat any 3 opponents, then return to the Callboard to claim your reward.",p="<name>，我抽不出人手去围攻。去敦霍尔德找到克雷斯特法尔指挥官，把他活着救出来。",pEN="I cannot spare the men for a siege, <name>. Find Commander Crestfall in Durnholde and get him out alive.",c="你找到他时他还活着？感谢圣光……这比我敢指望的还要好。你让这个前哨站得以喘息，也让我的人有理由相信我们还能守住这些道路。",cEN="You found him alive? Thank the Light... That is better news than I had dared hope for. You've given this outpost breathing room, and you've given my men reason to believe we can still hold these roads."}
Q[100082]={d="那些该死的豺狼人霸占了我的农场！他们让我失去了一切，一切，我跟你说……\n\n我逃命之前设法干掉了几个，但那一群疯狗不会停下，除非你杀掉它们的首领，一个叫幽啸的讨厌家伙。\n\n如果我还想有回家的希望……幽啸必须死。",dEN="Those damned gnolls have overrun my farm! They've cost me everything, EVERYTHING I tell you...\n\nI managed to take down a few of them before I had to run, but that rabid pack will never stop until you kill their leader, a gnasty piece of work called Gloomsnarl.\n\nIf I ever have a hope to go home... Gloomsnarl must die.",o="在奈坦德农庄杀死妖术师幽啸。",oEN="Slay Gloomsnarl the Hexer at The Nethander Stead.",p="你解决幽啸了吗？只要那怪物还活着，豺狼人就会继续霸占我的农场！",pEN="Have you dealt with Gloomsnarl yet? So long as that monster lives, the gnolls will keep their hold on my farm!",c="真的……办成了吗？\n\n啊哈……哈哈哈！真是如释重负！\n\n也许有一天，也许很快……我终于能回家了。谢谢你，<name>。",cEN="It's done... truly?\n\nAha... ahaha! What a relief!\n\nMaybe one day, one day soon maybe... I can finally return to my home. You have my thanks, <name>."}
Q[100083]={d="圣光尚未抛弃我，不过我担心这次逃亡会把我们逼到极限。\n\n我们和安全之间隔着一排卫兵，但如果你能一路走到这里……也许我们还有机会。\n\n等你准备好承受这场考验时，跟我说一声。",dEN="The Light has not abandoned me yet, though I fear this escape shall push us to our very limits.\n\nThere are a swath of guards between us and safety, but if you were able to make it this far... perhaps we still have a chance.\n\nSpeak to me when you're prepared to endure this trial.",o="帮助埃德蒙·克雷斯特法尔逃离敦霍尔德要塞，然后回到南海镇的希斯·维博斯那里。",oEN="Help Edmund Crestfall escape Durnholde Keep, then return to Heath Verbose in Southshore.",p="<name>，我抽不出人手去围攻。去敦霍尔德找到克雷斯特法尔指挥官，把他活着救出来。",pEN="I cannot spare the men for a siege, <name>. Find Commander Crestfall in Durnholde and get him out alive.",c="埃德蒙比你早片刻平安归来。\n\n我不知该怎么谢你，冒险者，我无法忍受把我们的同伴——而且还是我的一位挚友——丢给那些强盗。\n\n埃德蒙值得更好的命运，而你给了他第二次机会。",cEN="Edmund returned mere moments before you did, safe and sound.\n\nI cannot thank you enough adventurer, I could not bear the thought of leaving one of our party, and a dear friend of mine at that, behind to those bandits.\n\nEdmund deserves a better fate and you've given him that second chance."}
Q[100107]={d="虚空风暴是一片充斥着动荡与危险的区域，我们需要一位技艺娴熟的冒险者，协助我们对抗混乱的势力。你的任务——如果你愿意接受——就是深入虚空风暴的核心，与你在那里遇到的恶魔交战。击败这些强大的敌人，你不仅能证明自己的本领，还能为恢复这片破碎之地的和平与安定作出贡献。做好准备吧，英雄，迎接等待你的挑战，让你的行动在虚空风暴中比言语更有说服力！",dEN="The Netherstorm is an area teeming with turmoil and danger, and we require a skilled adventurer to aid us in our battle against the forces of chaos. Your mission, should you choose to accept it, is to venture into the heart of the Netherstorm and engage in combat with the demons you find there. By defeating these formidable foes, you will not only prove your prowess but also contribute to the restoration of peace and stability in this shattered land. Prepare yourself, hero, for the challenges that await and let your actions speak louder than words in the Netherstorm!",o="深入虚空风暴的核心，击败恐怖守卫、怒焰使者与怒焰领主！",oEN="Venture into the heart of Netherstorm and defeat Terrorguards, Wrathbringers and Wrath Lords!",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行完契约再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[100108]={d="虚空风暴是一片充斥着动荡与危险的区域，我们需要一位技艺娴熟的冒险者，协助我们对抗混乱的势力。你的任务——如果你愿意接受——就是深入虚空风暴的核心，与 7 名恐怖守卫保护者、7 名怒焰使者和 3 名怒焰领主交战。击败这些强大的敌人，你不仅能证明自己的本领，还能为恢复这片破碎之地的和平与安定作出贡献。做好准备吧，英雄，迎接等待你的挑战，让你的行动在虚空风暴中比言语更有说服力！",dEN="The Netherstorm is a area teeming with turmoil and danger, and we require a skilled adventurer to aid us in our battle against the forces of chaos. Your mission, should you choose to accept it, is to venture into the heart of the Netherstorm and engage in combat with 7 Terrorguard Protectors, 7 Wrathbringers, and 3 Wrath Lords. By defeating these formidable foes, you will not only prove your prowess but also contribute to the restoration of peace and stability in this shattered land. Prepare yourself, hero, for the challenges that await and let your actions speak louder than words in the Netherstorm!",o="深入虚空风暴的核心，与恐怖守卫、怒焰使者和怒焰领主交战！",oEN="Venture into the heart of the Netherstorm and engage in combat with the Terrorguards, Wrathbringer's and Wrath Lord's!"}
Q[100466]={d="你好，英雄。\n\n欢迎来到暴风城，联盟的首都。我猜你是来休息和补给的。你会发现许多有助于你冒险的东西，从个人银行和拍卖行，到铁匠、附魔师，当然还有其他英雄。随你四处探索，但当你准备重返冒险时，去和飞行管理员杜加尔·朗德瑞克谈谈。西部省份正有麻烦酝酿，需要你的帮助。",dEN="Hail, Hero.\n\nWelcome to Stormwind, capital of the Alliance. I assume you've arrived to rest and restock. You'll find many things to aid you on your adventure, from personal banks and the Auction House to blacksmiths, enchanters, and of course other heroes. Explore as you like, but when you're ready to return to your adventure, speak to Flightmaster Dungar Longdrink. There is trouble brewing in the western province that requires your aid.",o="尽情探索暴风城，然后拜访飞行管理员杜加尔·朗德瑞克，飞往西部荒野继续你的冒险。",oEN="Explore Stormwind to your heart's content, then visit Flightmaster Dungar Longdrink to fly to Westfall to continue your adventure.",c="欢迎来到哨兵岭。你来得正是时候，危险正在逼近……",cEN="Welcome to Sentinel Hill. You're just in time, danger is afoot.."}
Q[100467]={d="我说话的时候给我立正！你正站在奥格瑞玛的大门前，部落的首都。里面备有各种助你前行的工具：银行、拍卖行、铁匠、附魔师，当然还有渴望流血的 other 英雄。随你四处探索，但别耽搁：我收到了来自西边十字路口的战报。你要去那里，杀死部落的敌人。准备好出发时，就去和飞行管理员多拉斯谈谈。",dEN="Stand at attention when I speak. You stand before the gates of Orgrimmar, capital of the Horde. Inside stand all manner of tools to aid you: banks, the Auction House, blacksmiths, enchanters, and of course other heroes eager to spill blood. Explore as you like, but do not linger: I have recieved reports of battle from the Crossroads to the west. You will travel there and slay the enemies of the Horde. Speak to Flightmaster Doras when you are ready to embark",o="尽情探索奥格瑞玛，然后去找飞行管理员多拉斯继续你的冒险。",oEN="Explore Orgrimmar to your heart's content, then seek out Flightmaster Doras to continue your adventure.",c="欢迎来到十字路口。我们需要你的帮助，<race>。",cEN="Welcome to the Crossroads. We could use your help <race>."}
Q[100500]={d="欢迎回来，我友善的学徒！现在听好了，因为我刚想出一道能让你起鸡皮疙瘩的配方。可惜，我需要一个意志坚定、胆识过人的人去帮我弄到制作它所需的材料，而我在附近没看到符合条件的人。\n\n这正是你登场的时机！如果你愿意冒点险，我可以保证这值得你花时间。当然，前提是你不会丢掉灵魂，从此在净化岛上游荡到永恒——不过这种事发生的几率大概只有百分之一。\n\n总之，我需要这些东西：",dEN="Welcome back my amicable apprentice! Now listen up, because I've just come up with a goose bump inducing recipe. Unfortunately, I require someone with unwavering resolve and mettle to get me the goods I need to make it, and I don't see anyone around who fits the bill.\n\nThat's where you come in! If you're willing to stick your neck out I can promise you it will be worth your while. Assuming, of course, you don't lose your soul and wind up wandering the Purgation Isle for the rest of eternity, but there's only, like, a one percent chance of that happening.\n\nAnyway, here's what I need:",o="迪尔格·快切想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 份熊腰肉。你可以从费伍德森林、菲拉斯和冬泉谷等地游荡的大熊身上取得。\n\n10 份清凉的泉水。大多数食物和饮水商人都卖这个。\n\n10 份地精香料。地精城市里任何体面的厨师都有！\n\n10 份幽灵之尘。这种阴森的东西可以从净化岛的幽灵居民身上找到。\n\n集齐所有物品后回到迪尔格那里。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Bear Flanks. You will get those from large bears wondering areas like Felwood, Feralas, and Winterspring.\n\n10 Refreshing Springwater. Most food and water vendors will carry this.\n\n10 Goblin Spices. Any respectable chef in Goblin cities will carry this!\n\n10 Ghost Dust. This spooky item can be find from the ghostly denizens of Purgation Isle.\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",p="呼，光是想想我就起鸡皮疙瘩了，<name>！",pEN="Phew, I'm getting goose bumps just thinking about it, <name>!",c="哦天哪，<name>，我浑身都发麻了！现在注意看。\n\n<迪尔格开始制作幽灵杂烩。>",cEN="Oh boy, <name>, my skin is already crawling! Pay attention, now.\n\n<Dirge begins to prepare ghostly goulash.>"}
Q[100501]={d="啊，正是我要找的明——我是说，超级明星！我知道你已经爱上了那些美味得要命的蛤蜊，但恐怕我得让你心碎了……因为这道新配方会让你惊喜万分，整个人都暖起来！\n\n是这样的，我一直在研究一种新汤，可汤太无聊了。我是说，你只是把东西丢进一锅水里，然后，嗯，你就得到了汤。所以我想：\"嘿，为什么不往水里扔点疯狂的东西，做一锅疯狂的汤呢！？\"这道带劲的新配方就是这么来的。\n\n所以，我需要这些东西：",dEN="Ah, just the suc--I mean super star I was looking for! Now I know you have fallen in love with those devilishly delightful clamlettes, but I'm afraid I'm going to have break your heart... because this new recipe is going to rock your socks and warm your boots!\n\nSee, there's this new soup I've been working on, but soup is boring. I mean you just throw stuff in a pot of water and, well, you get soup. So I thought, \"Hey, why not throw something crazy in the water to make some crazy soup!?\" That's how I came up with this new recipe which has a real bite to it.\n\nSo, here's what I'm going to need:",o="迪尔格·快切想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 条生刺鳍大比目鱼。弄到它们最好的去处是艾萨拉的海岸生物。\n\n10 份清凉的泉水。大多数食物和饮水商人都卖这个。\n\n10 份地精香料。地精城市里任何体面的厨师都有！\n\n10 片大型海德拉鳞片。你可以从阿尔卡兹岛的海德拉身上弄到这些家伙，但要小心，<name>，它们会咬人。\n\n集齐所有物品后回到迪尔格那里。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Raw Spinefin Halibut. Your best bet for these will be the coastal life of Azshara.\n\n10 Refreshing Springwater. Most food and water vendors will carry this.\n\n10 Goblin Spices. Any respectable chef in Goblin cities will carry this!\n\n10 Large Hydra Scale. You can snag these bad boys off the Hydras of Alcaz Isle, but be careful, <name>, they bite.\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",p="货到手了吗？我受够菲兹格里布尔不停发的那种垃圾了！",pEN="Have you got the goods? I'm getting tired of this junk that Fizzgrimble keeps handing out!",c="我已经能闻到香味了，<name>，你呢？这才叫手艺，<name>！\n\n<迪尔格开始制作海德拉鳞片汤。>",cEN="I can already smell it, <name>, don't you? This is how you do it, <name>!\n\n<Dirge begins to prepare hydra scale soup.>"}
Q[100502]={d="<name>，想找点可口的小点心吗？再想想，也许我可以给你做份沙拉。啊，那不关我的事！\n\n如果你想让身上多长点\"英雄份量\"，那我正好有你要的东西！没错，声名远扬的非凡大厨迪尔格设计出了完美的点心。它有香料，有派头，而且你一咬下去，滚烫的汁水就会在嘴里爆开！\n\n如果你在找卡利姆多的下一道爆款，就给我带这些东西来：",dEN="<name>, are you looking for a tasty little treat? On second thought, maybe I could whip you up a salad. Ah, it's none of my business!\n\nIf you're looking to put on a little \"heroic mass\" then I've got just the thing! That's right, Dirge, renowned chef extraordinaire, has designed the perfect snack. It's got spice, it's got panache, and it explodes into a burst of boiling hot juices as soon as you take a bite!\n\nIf you're looking for the next big hit in Kalimdor then bring me the following:",o="迪尔格·快切想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 份沙虫肉。你可以从希利苏斯附近的淤泥碾碎者和淤泥打击者身上获取。\n\n10 份地精香料。地精城市里任何体面的厨师都有！\n\n10 份异种蝎内脏。这些卑劣且可能有危险的货物，只能从希利苏斯最强最致命的异种蝎身上取得。\n\n集齐所有物品后回到迪尔格那里。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Sandworm Meat. You can acquire these from the Dredge Crushers and Dredge Strikers of nearby Silithus.\n\n10 Goblin Spices. Any respectable chef in Goblin cities will carry this!\n\n10 Silithid Innards. These vile, and potentially hazardous, goods can be got from only the strongest and most deadly Silithid from Silithus.\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",p="啊，我已经能感觉到体重在增加了。",pEN="Ah, I can already feel the pounds being added on.",c="光是想想，我的上颚就开始发烫了，<name>。现在仔细看着！\n\n<迪尔格开始制作异种蝎点心。>",cEN="The roof of my mouth is starting to burn just thinking of it, <name>. Now watch closely!\n\n<Dirge begins to prepare silithid snack.>"}
Q[100503]={d="<name>，我有好东西给你！不，说真的。怎么，你不信我？！\n\n听着，我也不是指提古勒和弗洛尔那种糊弄人的食物。不，我说的是正宗的老派地精美食。现在，我只需要你去帮我弄到一些霜语巨魔巨人那种著名的永不融化的冰。怎么，我可没说过这很容易。\n\n系好安全带，给我带这些东西来：",dEN="<name>, do I have a treat for you! No, really. What, you don't believe me?!\n\nLook, I'm not talking about that Tigule and Foror's excuse for food either. No, I'm talking about so good ol' fashioned Goblin goodies. Now, I just need you to get your hands on some of the famous nevermelting ice of the Frostwhisper Giants for me. What, I didn't say it would be easy.\n\nBuckle up and grab me these things:",o="迪尔格·快切想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 块永不融化的冰碎片。你只能从冬泉谷霜语峡谷的巨人身上采集。\n\n10 份冰镇牛奶。大多数食物和饮水商人都卖这个。\n\n10 份糖。地精城市里任何体面的厨师都有！\n\n集齐所有物品后回到迪尔格那里。",oEN="Dirge Quikcleave wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Shard of Nevermelting Ice. You can only harvest these from the giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in Winterspring.\n\n10 Ice Cold Milk. Most food and water vendors will carry this.\n\n10 Sugar. Any respectable chef in Goblin cities will carry this!\n\nGather all of the items and return to Dirge.",p="你有没有过馋甜食馋到愿意咬一口糖渍裂蹄牛脚趾的地步？好吧，别让我等到自己也那样！",pEN="Have you ever had a sweet tooth so bad you were willing to take a bite of candied clefthoof toes? Well, don't make me wait till I do!",c="接招吧，菲格尔和弗洛尔！呃嗯，现在仔细看着，<name>。\n\n<迪尔格开始制作迪尔格的永不融化冰淇淋。>",cEN="Take that Figle and Furor! Erhm, now watch closely <name>.\n\n<Dirge begins to prepare dirge's nevermelt ice cream.>"}
Q[100504]={d="所以，你是来跟真正的大厨学艺的？那就听好了，<name>，因为你得先学会成为大厨的第一条、也是最重要的一条守则，那就是 B.O.O.M。它代表：\n\nB. 只用最好的食材。\nO. 时刻服从我。\nO. 只做我说的事。\nM. 大厨金克丝永远知道什么最好。\n\n如果你对其中任何一条有意见，那这事就成不了；但只要你永远记住 B.O.O.M，你就会做得很好！\n\n现在，我们的第一课，我需要这些东西：",dEN="So, you've come to train from a real chef? Then listen up, <name>, because you'll need to learn the first and most important rule for being a master chef, and that's B.O.O.M. That stands for:\n\nBest ingredients only.\nObey me at all times.\nOnly do what I say.\nMaster chef Jinx always knows best.\n\nIf you've got a problem with any of those, then this isn't going to work out, but as long as you always remember B.O.O.M then you'll do great!\n\nNow, for our first lesson here's what I'm going to need:",o="金克丝·快斩想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 只玛克瑞尼爪。你可以从艾萨拉的任何玛克瑞尼身上取得，包括阿科兰人。\n\n10 份地精香料。你可以从金克丝那里，或地精城市里任何体面的厨师那里取得。\n\n集齐所有物品后回到金克丝那里。",oEN="Jinx Swiftchop wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Makrinni Claws. You can get these off any makrinni, even the arkkoran, in Azshara.\n\n10 Goblin Spices. You can get these from Jinx, or any respectable chef in a Goblin city.\n\nGather all of the items and return to Jinx.",p="你的功课进展如何？B.O.O.M 的每一条都记住了吗？",pEN="How goes your lesson? Are you learning all the points of B.O.O.M?",c="你也许会成为我的明星学徒！你掌握 B.O.O.M 的速度很快。现在看看大师是怎么干活的。\n\n<金克丝开始制作清蒸玛克瑞尼爪。>",cEN="You just might become my star pupil! You're pickup up on B.O.O.M quickly. Now watch a master do her work.\n\n<Jinx begins to prepare steamed makrinni claw.>"}
Q[100505]={d="我知道你忙着学 B.O.O.M 可能已经手忙脚乱了，但如果你真想成为大厨，就得能同时处理多项任务！所以我还要教你 P.O.P！它代表：\n\nP. 我们要力求完美的食材。\nO. 无论发生什么，都时刻服从我。\nP. 完全按我说的方式准备食物。\n\n这是除 B.O.O.M 之外你唯一需要知道的守则。两者一起学也相当容易。\n\n好，现在我们的第二课，我需要这些东西：",dEN="Now I know you've maybe got your hands full trying to learn B.O.O.M, but if you really want to be a master chef you need to be able to multi-task! That's why I'm going to teach you P.O.P as well! That's:\n\nPerfect ingredients is what we strive for.\nObey me at all times no matter what.\nPrepare the food exactly as I say.\n\nThis is the only rule other than B.O.O.M you need to know. They're also pretty easy to learn together.\n\nGood, now for our second lesson here's what I'm going to need:",o="金克丝·快斩想让你弄到以下物品：\n\n10 份角鹰兽肉。你可以从艾萨拉的任何角鹰兽身上取得。\n\n10 份地精香料。你可以从金克丝那里，或地精城市里任何体面的厨师那里取得。\n\n集齐所有物品后回到金克丝那里。",oEN="Jinx Swiftchop wants you to get the following items:\n\n10 Hippogryph Meat. You can get these off any hippogryph in Azshara.\n\n10 Goblin Spices. You can get these from Jinx, or any respectable chef in a Goblin city.\n\nGather all of the items and return to Jinx.",p="你发现 P.O.P 为什么是成为大厨的核心了吗？",pEN="Are you figuring out why P.O.P is at the core to becoming a master chef?",c="哇，你已经掌握了 P.O.P 的基础！我迫不及待要拿这事去羞辱迪尔格了！现在看看真正的大师是怎么完成的。\n\n<金克丝开始制作角鹰兽肉排。>",cEN="Wow, you've already mastered the basics of P.O.P! I can't wait to shove this in Dirge's face! Now see how a master really gets it done.\n\n<Jinx begins to prepare hippogryph steak.>"}
Q[100802]={d="我可能算错了一步，需要你帮忙纠正。\n\n\n\n我们的狩猎大师凯瑟里克·萨德森没法及时填饱要塞的肚子。而经过这样一场战斗，我的人需要的可不只是一碗清汤寡水的蔬菜汤。\n\n\n\n到林子里去找凯瑟里克，尽你所能帮助他。光是来到这座要塞站在我面前，你就已经比大多数人更有勇气了。我相信你是这项任务的合适人选。\n\n\n\n去吧。",dEN="It is possible I have made a miscalculation, and I need your help to set it right.\n\n\n\nOur Master of the Hunt, Ketheric Sadson, will not be able to fill the stronghold's bellies in time. And after a battle like this, my men will need more than a meager vegetable soup to keep them going.\n\n\n\nFind Ketheric in the woods and assist him however you can. You have already shown more courage than most just by coming to this fortress and standing before me. I believe you are the right person for this task.\n\n\n\nGo."}
Q[100803]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[100804]={d="兽人的军事策略通常可以概括为 \"冲上去杀\"，但他们的首领——勇士库尔干——扮演的角色远比发号施令重要得多：他是把其余人黏合在一起的胶水。\n\n\n\n而我们已经把他研究透了。这个时辰，他应该在指挥室里。基本是一个人。\n\n\n\n别放过这个杀他的机会。哦！还有，记住，我们是军情七处；收集你找到的任何详细记载他们营队计划的文件。\n\n\n\n把它们交给桥对面的萨玛拉。\n\n\n相关",dEN="hile orcish military strategy can usually be summed up as 'go and kill,' their leader, Champion Kurgan, serves a far more vital role than simply barking orders: he is the glue that holds the rest of them together.\n\n\n\nAnd we've studied him well. At this hour, he should be in the command room. Mostly alone.\n\n\n\nDo not let this chance to kill him slip away. Oh! And remember, we are SI:7; gather any documents you find detailing their battalion's plans.\n\n\n\nDeliver them to Samara, across the bridge.\n\n\nRelated",o="在科瑞博堡的堡垒中杀死黑石勇士库尔干。",oEN="Kill the Blackrock Champion Kurgan in the bastion of Fort Kerebor."}
Q[100805]={d="sdfsdf\n相关",dEN="sdfsdf\nRelated",o="sdfsdf",oEN="sdfsdf"}
Q[101600]={d="das\n相关",dEN="das\nRelated"}
