Q[101602]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[101603]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[101604]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[110462]={c="你确定这是你想走的道路吗，<name>？这不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n这枚戒指中灌注着一滴永恒之井的井水。随着你向流沙之鳞证明自己，它的力量也会增长。",cEN="Are you sure this is the path you seek to take, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThis ring is imbued with a droplet from the Well of Eternity. It will grow in power as you prove yourself to the Scale of the Sands."}
Q[110466]={d="你已立下誓言，<class>。现在就看你去兑现它了。\n\n尽心侍奉流沙之鳞，你将得到奖赏。若失败，我们所熟知的时间线将彻底崩解！",dEN="You've made your pledge, <class>. Now it is up to you to see it through.\n\nServe the Scale of the Sands well and you will be rewarded. Fail and the timeline as we know it will be unravelled!",o="在流沙之鳞达到尊敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士之后，把你的永恒之戒带给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Honored reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Lady Jaina Proudmore during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你仍在尽心为我们效力，<name>。",pEN="You continue to serve us well, <name>.",c="你证明了自己的价值，<race>。至少在一定程度上如此。\n\n诺兹多姆首席配偶的青睐可不是轻易能得到的。",cEN="You've proved your worth, <race>. Up to a certain point, at least.\n\nThe favor of Nozdormu's prime mate is not obtained easily."}
Q[110470]={d="你履行了对我们许下的承诺，<name>。为此你赢得了应得的认可。\n\n随着你继续与海加尔山周围的过往事件共鸣，我就能继续汲取你戒指中蕴含的力量。用不了多久，它就会达到全部潜能。",dEN="You've carried out the promise you made to us, <name>. And for that you've gained the recognition you deserve.\n\nAs you continue to become attuned with past events surrounding mount Hyjal, I can continue to tap into the power contained in your ring. It won't be long until it has reached its full potential.",o="在流沙之鳞达到崇敬声望，并在海加尔山之战中协助萨尔之后，把你的永恒之戒带给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Revered reputation with the Scale of the Sands and aiding Thrall during The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="你回来了。你想和我谈谈？",pEN="You've returned. You wish to speak to me?",c="你确实是位可敬的盟友。随着你力量增长，永恒之戒也会随之成长！",cEN="You are a worthy ally indeed. As you grow in power so does the band of eternity!"}
Q[110474]={d="你的成就超出了我最高的期望，<name>。\n\n你穿梭于时间之中，就像我认识过的任何一条青铜龙一样从容。你注定拥有强大的力量，而我非常乐意助你走上那条道路。\n\n继续为流沙之鳞效力，我就会释放你天赋的全部潜能。",dEN="Your accomplishments have gone beyond my greatest expectations, <name>.\n\nYou step in and out of time as comfortably as any bronze dragon I've known. You are destined for great power and I am more than pleased to help you on your way there.\n\nContinue to serve the Scale of the Sands and I will unleash your gift's full potential.",o="在流沙之鳞达到崇拜声望，并确保海加尔山之战的结局之后，把你的永恒之戒带给时光之穴的索莉多米。",oEN="Bring your Band of Eternity to Soridormi at the Caverns of Time after obtaining Exalted reputation with the Scale of the Sands and securing the outcome of The Battle of Mount Hyjal.",p="愿时间永远站在你这边，<name>。",pEN="May time always be on your side, <name>.",c="你与时间合一，<name>。你与我们合一。\n\n看哪！超越凡人理解的力量，正从那小小一片永恒之井的残迹中释放出来。\n\n接受这份礼物吧，让所有人都知道你和流沙之鳞的誓约……让所有人都知道你和时间本身的誓约！",cEN="You are one with time, <name>. You are one with us.\n\nBehold! Power beyond mortal understanding is unleashed from even that small remnant of the Well of Eternity.\n\nAccept this gift so that all may know of your covenant with the Scale of the Sands.... so that all may know of your covenant with time itself!"}
Q[110727]={d="你的服务已远超人们对你的期望，<name>。你距达拉然非公民所能获得的最高荣誉只差一步。\n\n继续向我们证明你的忠诚，我就会把你的玺戒强化到最高效能。",dEN="Your services have gone above and beyond what is expected of you, <name>. You are but a step away from achieving the highest honor available to non-citizens of Dalaran.\n\nContinue to prove your loyalty to us and I will empower your signet to its full capacity.",o="在紫罗兰之眼达到崇拜声望后，把你的紫罗兰玺戒带给逆风小径的大法师蕾莉达。",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Exalted reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="你现在持有的玺戒，力量已堪比议会中任何一位大法师的玺戒。无论走到哪里都戴着它，好让知情者认出你的忠诚。无论走到哪里都戴着它，好让它的力量像你侍奉我们一样侍奉你！",cEN="The signet you now hold is as powerful as that of any Archmage of the Council. Wear it wherever you go so that the initiated may recognize your allegiance. Wear it wherever you go so its power may serve you as you've served us!"}
Q[110731]={c="你确定你的选择吗，<name>？这不是一个可以轻率做出的决定。\n\n随着你继续向紫罗兰之眼证明自己，紫罗兰玺戒的力量也会增长。",cEN="Are you certain of your choice, <name>? This is not a decision you ought to take lightly.\n\nThe Violet Signet will grow in power as you continue to prove yourself to the Violet Eye."}
Q[110735]={d="你已选定自己的道路，<class>。现在就看你能沿着它走到何处了。\n\n你会发现，在达拉然的大法师中交些朋友自有好处。尽心为我们效力，你的功绩不会没有回报。",dEN="You've chosen your path, <class>. Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.\n\nYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages. Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded.",o="在紫罗兰之眼达到尊敬声望后，把你的紫罗兰玺戒带给逆风小径的大法师蕾莉达。",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Honored reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="你的效劳令我们倍感荣幸，<name>。看好了，我要释放你玺戒中蕴含的力量！",cEN="You honor us with your service, <name>. Behold as I unleash the power contained in your signet!"}
Q[110740]={d="你没有让我们失望，<name>。不过，我们仍对你寄予厚望。\n\n继续为紫罗兰之眼效力，你会得到相称的回报。",dEN="You have not disappointed us, <name>. We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.\n\nContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded.",o="在紫罗兰之眼达到崇敬声望后，把你的紫罗兰玺戒带给逆风小径的大法师蕾莉达。",oEN="Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye.",c="你的效劳并未被忽视，<name>。你的玺戒看似如初，但只要你继续证明忠诚，它的力量就会增长。",cEN="Your services have not gone unnoticed, <name>. Your signet may look the same, but its powers grow as you continue to prove your loyalty."}
Q[111033]={p="你改变主意，不想要先前的选择了？我想我可以帮你改回来。毕竟，对达拉然而言，你的忠诚比你想如何表现它更重要。\n\n这可不便宜。而且，当然，我需要你交回原来的戒指。",pEN="You've decided against your previous choice? I suppose I can help you reverse it. In the end Dalaran cares more about your loyalty than how you choose to show it.\n\nIt won't be cheap. And of course, I will need your old ring back.",c="慎重做出下一个决定吧。我们会尽力满足盟友的需求，但即便是达拉然的资源也有其极限。",cEN="Make this next decision carefully. We do our best to accommodate our allies, but even Dalaran's resources have their limits."}
Q[111105]={p="你戒指中的力量是可塑的，不过要逆转你的选择并不容易。你确定要替换它当前形态吗？",pEN="The power within your ring is malleable, though reversing your choice is not easy. Are you sure you want to replace its current form?",c="时间的沙粒向前流淌轻而易举。要让它们倒流也可以，但极为困难。",cEN="The sands of time flow forwards easily. They can be made to flow backward, but with great difficulty."}
Q[149065]={d="找到学徒梅莱多",dEN="Find Apprentice Meledor",o="你的持续相助对辛多雷来说价值非凡。沿着这条路往东走，在河桥以北，找到学徒拉伦。还有工作要做。",oEN="Your continued assistance would be of great value to the Sin'dorei. Find Apprentice Ralen to the east of here, along the road. north of the river bridge. There's work yet to be done.",c="为了部落的力量与狂怒！\n相关",cEN="For the strength and fury of the Horde!\nRelated"}
Q[149066]={d="天灾的威胁仍在银月城废墟之外溃烂。如果奎尔萨拉斯要真正痊愈，就必须在其源头清除腐化。集结你的力量，把战斗带到死亡之痕——那条穿过永歌森林、如同大地上一道伤疤的亵渎之路。净化这片枯萎绝非易事，但银月城的命运系于此举。",dEN="The Scourge threat still festers just beyond the Ruins of Silvermoon. If Quel’Thalas is to truly heal, the corruption must be purged at its source. Rally your strength and take the fight to The Dead Scar—the desecrated path that cuts through Eversong like a scar across the land. Cleansing this blight is no small task, but the fate of Silvermoon depends on it.",o="现在有比几个不服管教的学徒更要紧的事。沿着银月城废墟的城墙前往死亡之痕，给游侠贾艾拉她所需的一切帮助。",oEN="There are greater concerns now than a few misbehaving apprentices. Travel to the Scar, along the wall of the Ruins of Silvermoon, and give Ranger Jaela whatever aid she requires.",c="你来了就好，击退进攻需要每一份能出力的力量。\n相关",cEN="It's good that you've come, every able body is needed to repel the attack.\nRelated"}
Q[149067]={d="天灾已被击退到让我们能喘口气的地步；银月城的城墙安全了，但我们不能缩在这里等下一次进攻，必须做好准备。",dEN="The Scourge has been beaten back enough that we can breath, the walls of Silvermoon City are secure, but we cannot cower here and wait for the next assault, preparations must be made.",o="我们已经击退了进攻、守住了城墙，但没时间休息了。顺着路往西再往南走，到远行者营地，去和魔导师达斯维瑟谈谈。",oEN="We've repelled the attack and secured the walls, but there's no time to rest. Go West and South along the road, to Farstrider Retreat, and there speak with Magister Duskwither.",c="是游侠贾艾拉派你来的吗？你在这儿就好。\n相关",cEN="Did Ranger Jaela send you? It's good that you're here.\nRelated"}
Q[149068]={d="这些树林外围正传出令人不安的报告。我本打算前往晴风村评估报告中的情况，但我必须留在这里处理那些受苦的学徒。",dEN="Troubling reports are emerging from the outskirts of these woods. I was intending to travel to Fairbreeze Village to assess the circumstances of these reports, but I must remain behind and deal with the afflicted apprentices.",o="尖塔传来的消息确实令人不安。看来我还得在这里多待一阵。替我前往晴风村，查明那里的情况。",oEN="The news from the spire is indeed troubling. It seems I'll need to remain here a bit longer. Travel to Fairbreeze Village in my stead and determine the situation",c="你在这儿就好，黑暗正朝我们逼近。\n相关",cEN="It's good that you're here, darkness moves against us.\nRelated"}
Q[149176]={d="埃德里姆·天歌对你的史诗冒险极感兴趣，能在很多方面帮到你。他会向你提供装备，帮你升级现有装备，并回收你不要的史诗物品以换取更多史诗硬币。",dEN="Edrim Skysong is keenly interested in your Mythic Adventures, and can aid you in many ways. He'll offer you gear, help you upgrade existing equipment, and recycle unwanted mythic items for additional Mythic Coins,",o="在沙塔斯与埃德里姆·天歌交谈",oEN="Talk to Edrim Skysong in Shattrath",c="在你走过史诗成长体系的旅途中，埃德里姆·天歌会是你的得力助手。\n相关",cEN="Edrim Skysong will be a great asset to you on your journey through Mythic progression.\nRelated"}
Q[149177]={d="埃德里姆·天歌对你的史诗冒险极感兴趣，能在很多方面帮到你。他会向你提供装备，帮你升级现有装备，并回收你不要的史诗物品以换取更多史诗硬币。",dEN="Edrim Skysong is keenly interested in your Mythic Adventures, and can aid you in many ways. He'll offer you gear, help you upgrade existing equipment, and recycle unwanted mythic items for additional Mythic Coins,",o="在奥格瑞玛与埃德里姆·天歌交谈",oEN="Talk to Edrim Skysong in Orgrimmar",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149178]={d="埃德里姆·天歌对你的史诗冒险极感兴趣，能在很多方面帮到你。他会向你提供装备，帮你升级现有装备，并回收你不要的史诗物品以换取更多史诗硬币。",dEN="Edrim Skysong is keenly interested in your Mythic Adventures, and can aid you in many ways. He'll offer you gear, help you upgrade existing equipment, and recycle unwanted mythic items for additional Mythic Coins,",o="在暴风城与埃德里姆·天歌交谈。",oEN="Talk to Edrim Skysong in Stormwind.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149179]={d="你直面燃烧军团的时刻到了。走暴风城法师区法师塔顶端的传送门，前往荒芜之地。",dEN="Your time to confront the Burning Legion has come. Take the Portal to the Blasted Lands, located atop the Mage Tower in the Mage District of Stormwind.",o="前往荒芜之地。",oEN="Make your way to the Blasted Lands.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149180]={d="你直面燃烧军团的时刻到了。使用奥格瑞玛通往荒芜之地的传送门，它位于灵魂谷。",dEN="Your time to confront the Burning Legion has come. Take the Portal in Orgrimmar to the Blasted Lands, located in The Valley of spirits.",o="前往荒芜之地。",oEN="Make your way to the Blasted Lands.",c="你能来真是太好了，有很多事要做！\n相关",cEN="It's good that you've made it, there's much to do!\nRelated"}
Q[149181]={d="石拳塔克是矗立在伟大门槛前坚定不移的哨兵，是试炼守护者兼司仪。试炼是可自定义的游戏模式，会深刻改变你的体验难度，并提供各种外观与虚荣奖励。",dEN="Stony Tark stands as the unwavering sentinel at the threshold of greatness, the Keeper of Trials and Master of Ceremonies. Trials are customizable gamemodes that profoundly change the difficulty of your experience and offer a variety of vanity and cosmetic rewards.",o="拜访石拳塔克，试炼守护者。",oEN="Visit with Stony Tark, Keeper of Trials.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149182]={d="石拳塔克是矗立在伟大门槛前坚定不移的哨兵，是试炼守护者兼司仪。试炼是可自定义的游戏模式，会深刻改变你的体验难度，并提供各种外观与虚荣奖励。",dEN="Stony Tark stands as the unwavering sentinel at the threshold of greatness, the Keeper of Trials and Master of Ceremonies. Trials are customizable gamemodes that profoundly change the difficulty of your experience and offer a variety of vanity and cosmetic rewards.",o="拜访石拳塔克，试炼守护者。",oEN="Visit with Stony Tark, Keeper of Trials.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149183]={d="你已在地面上证明了自己的实力，但外域的天空在等着你。若你想翱翔于它破碎的大地之上，就需要适当的训练——以及一只飞行坐骑。去影月谷寻找那位资深飞行训练师。他会指引你踏上飞行的道路。",dEN="You've proven your strength on the ground, but the skies of Outland await. If you wish to soar above its shattered lands, you’ll need the proper training—and a flying mount. Seek out the expert flying trainer in Shadowmoon Valley. They'll guide you on the path to taking flight.",o="在影月谷与飞行训练师奥尔罗克交谈。",oEN="Speak with Olrokk, the Flight Instructor, in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149184]={d="你已在地面上证明了自己的实力，但外域的天空在等着你。若你想翱翔于它破碎的大地之上，就需要适当的训练——以及一只飞行坐骑。去影月谷寻找那位资深飞行训练师。他会指引你踏上飞行的道路。",dEN="You've proven your strength on the ground, but the skies of Outland await. If you wish to soar above its shattered lands, you’ll need the proper training—and a flying mount. Seek out the expert flying trainer in Shadowmoon Valley. They'll guide you on the path to taking flight.",o="在影月谷与飞行训练师艾莎·雷酒交谈。",oEN="Speak with IIsa Thunderbrew, the Flight Instructor, in Shadowmoon Valley.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149185]={d="神秘附魔按品质划分：稀有、史诗、传说和神器。这些附魔会强化法术、改变技能，或根据品质以不同方式提升属性。",dEN="Mystic Enchants are separated by quality; Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Artifact. These enchants will enhance spells, change abilities, or improve stats in different ways depending on their quality.",o="为你的收藏添加每种品质各 1 个附魔。",oEN="Add 1 enchant of each quality to your collection.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149186]={d="神秘附魔是最大化你角色潜能的关键。因此，你会希望确保把收藏中能用的附魔都应用到当前激活的附魔上。在单个专精中，你总共可以激活 11 个神秘附魔：6 个稀有、3 个史诗、1 个传说和 1 个神器。",dEN="Mystic Enchants are your key to maximizing the potential of your character. You will therefor want to make certain that you've applied all of the enchants that you can from your collection to your active enchants. You can activates a total of 11 Mystic Enchants in a single specialization; 6 Rare, 3 Epic, 1 Legendary, and 1 Artifact.",o="在激活附魔界面中填满每一个空置的神秘附魔槽位。",oEN="Fill every open Mystic Enchant slot in the Active Enchants UI.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149187]={d="神秘附魔卷轴可以通过击败敌人、在世界各处寻获，或与其他玩家交易获得。\n\n获得卷轴后，前往神秘附魔祭坛，使用神秘卷轴以获取其力量！神秘附魔祭坛常常被召唤在首都城中，你也可以到世界各地去探访一处。它们的位置已标在世界地图上。\n\n神秘附魔是解锁你英雄力量的关键。寻找能强化你法术、或解锁全新流派的神秘附魔，以提升你的实力。",dEN="Mystic Enchanting Scrolls can be obtained by defeating enemies, found hidden throughout the world, or by trading other players.\n\nOnce obtained, visit a Mystic Enchanting Altar to apply a Mystic Scroll to gain its powers! Mystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.\n\nMystic Enchants are key to unlocking your power as a Hero. Find Mystic Enchants that empower your spells or unlock whole new archetypes to increase your power.",o="- 通过击败敌人或与其他玩家交易获得一张神秘附魔卷轴。\n- 与首都或世界中的神秘附魔祭坛互动，选择附魔卷轴页签。\n- 激活一张神秘卷轴并把它应用到一个激活附魔槽位。",oEN="- Obtain a Mystic Enchanting Scroll by defeating enemies or trading other players.\n- Interact with a Mystic Enchanting Altar found in your Capital City or in the World and select Enchant Scrolls tab.\n- Activate a Mystic Scroll and apply it to an Active Enchant slot.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149188]={d="前往祭坛并选择附魔卷轴页签，然后获取一张无瑕神秘卷轴。\n\n点击神秘卷轴上的重铸，会在卷轴上随机生成一个新的神秘附魔，并覆盖卷轴上原有的附魔。重铸会消耗神秘符文；如果你没有神秘符文了，则消耗金币！\n\n每次重铸都会为你积累神秘附魔等级的经验。每提升一级都会给予你一份神秘萃取物，可用于把神秘附魔永久应用到你的附魔收藏中。该收藏在同一服务器的所有角色之间共享！\n\n神秘附魔祭坛常常被召唤在首都城中，你也可以到世界各地去探访一处。它们的位置已标在世界地图上。",dEN="Visit an Altar and select the Enchant Scrolls tab, then Obtain an Untarnished Mystic Scroll.\n\nClicking Reforge on a Mystic Scroll will roll a new Mystic Enchant on the scroll and overwrite any existing enchant on the scroll. Reforging consumes Mystic Runes, or gold if you are out of Mystic Runes!\n\nEach time you Reforge you earn experience towards your Mystic Enchanting level. Each level earned grants you a Mystic Extract which can be used to permanently apply Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection. This collection is shared across all characters on the realm!\n\nMystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.",o="- 在神秘祭坛的附魔卷轴页签中获取一张无瑕神秘卷轴。\n- 重铸你的神秘卷轴以获得新的神秘附魔。你可以一直重铸任意神秘卷轴，直到找到想保留的附魔。\n- 重铸神秘卷轴会为你积累通往神秘萃取物的进度。\n- 重铸 5 次。继续重铸，直到获得一份神秘萃取物。",oEN="- Obtain an Untarnished Mystic Scroll from the Enchant Scrolls tab of the Mystic Altar.\n- Reforge your Mystic Scroll to obtain new Mystic Enchants. You can continue reforging any Mystic Scroll until you find an Enchant you want to keep.\n- Reforging Mystic Scrolls grants you progress towards a Mystic Extract.\n- Reforge 5 times. Continue Reforging until you earn a Mystic Extract.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[149189]={d="把一个神秘附魔保存到收藏中，会为这一服务器的所有角色永久解锁它，让你随时都能在祭坛上直接施加该附魔，无需卷轴！\n\n将附魔加入收藏会摧毁卷轴，并消耗一份神秘萃取物。你能获得的神秘萃取物数量没有上限，所以务必保存你最喜欢的神秘附魔以及对你构筑至关重要的那些。\n\n在神秘祭坛的卷轴页签中选择一张神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。",dEN="Saving a Mystic Enchant to your collection permanently unlocks it for all characters on this realm, allowing you to apply that enchant from an Altar whenever you want without needing a scroll!\n\nAdding Enchants to your collection destroys the scrolls and consumes a Mystic Extract. There is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you can acquire, so be sure to save your favorite Mystic Enchants and ones critical to your build.\n\nSelect a Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab in the Mystic Altar, then hit Save to Collection.",o="在神秘祭坛的卷轴页签中选择一张神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。",oEN="Select a Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab in the Mystic Altar, then hit Save to Collection.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[150000]={d="兑换你的邪能击碎者。",dEN="Exchange your Felstriker.",o="兑换你的邪能击碎者 +1。\n\n这样做会移除该物品，并给予你相应数量的史诗硬币作为补偿。",oEN="Exchange your Felstriker +1.\n\nDoing so will remove the item, and award you with the appropriate amount of Mythic Coins as compensation."}
