Q[175326]={d="啊，这些日子在邓郡很少见到新面孔。\n\n我猜你算是个……雇佣兵？\n\n好，好。我钱多得是，活儿也不少。\n\n贸易中断，王国又疏于管理道路，狼群便猖狂起来。它们闯到邓郡来只是时间问题。\n\n去南边杀几头。让它们记住该怕钢铁与火焰。",dEN="Ah, it is rare to see new faces in Dunshire these days.\n\nI suppose you are something of a... mercenary?\n\nGood, good. I have money to spare, and work that needs doing.\n\nWith trade disrupted, the kingdom has neglected the roads, and the wolves have grown bold. It is only a matter of time before they reach Dunshire.\n\nKill a few south of here. Remind them to fear steel and flame.",o="杀死在邓郡崖下游荡的狼。",oEN="Slay the wolves prowling around Dunshire, at the foot of the cliff."}
