Q[208801]={d="安其拉的墙壁在颤抖。一股比世界本身更古老的邪恶力量已被摧毁。\n\n望着那巨大憎恶的残骸，你的心跳几乎停滞。即便在死亡之中，你仍能感到克苏恩邪恶的遗存环绕四周。\n\n你做到了被认为不可能的事。\n\n你抓住那怪物的一根眼柄，把它妥善收进背包。\n\n把克苏恩之眼带去下一个房间的巨龙那里。",dEN="The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.\n\nAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.\n\nYou have done what was thought to be impossible.\n\nYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.\n\nTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber.",o="把克苏恩之眼带到安其拉神殿的凯拉斯塔兹那里。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",p="<name>女士，你把我们从它的掌控中解放了出来。",pEN="Lady <name>, you have freed us of its grasp.",c="等我们确信此处的邪恶已被彻底摧毁，我们会自行离开这个地方，<name>女士。你的传奇之旅已接近尾声。",cEN="We will leave this place on our own, Lady <name> - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end."}
Q[208802]={d="那古神毫无生气的眼睛仍以其恶意的目光刺透你的脑海。时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯应该会处理此事。把克苏恩之眼交给他，他无疑会想把它放进主人的收藏。",dEN="The lifeless eye of the ancient god still penetrates your mind with its malicious stare. Anachronos at the Caverns of Time should take care of this. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="把克苏恩之眼带到时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯那里。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",p="<name>大人！一切都结束了……",pEN="Lord <name>! It is over...",c="主人把这些留给了你，勇士。来自那永恒宝库：一批跨越数千年的器物；选择权在你。",cEN="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours."}
Q[209103]={d="我不装腔作势，蛆虫。瘟疫之心物品所蕴含的黑暗，很可能把我们两个都毁掉。所以价钱才这么高。如果我要死，那也得像个有钱人那样死。\n\n我一点也不在乎你怎么死，只在乎你照我说的去做。把我需要的东西带来，我们双方都能得利——或者一起死；不过这个我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒施法者马塔乌斯，若你带给他以下物品，他将制作一件瘟疫之心长袍：1 件被亵渎的长袍、25 块战损的布片、4 块月布和 2 颗连接水晶。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",c="太好了，<name>！\n你把我要求的东西全都弄来了，现在我可以制作一件瘟疫之心长袍了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Robe."}
Q[209104]={d="我不装腔作势，蛆虫。瘟疫之心物品所蕴含的黑暗，很可能把我们两个都毁掉。所以价钱才这么高。如果我要死，那也得像个有钱人那样死。\n\n我一点也不在乎你怎么死，只在乎你照我说的去做。把我需要的东西带来，我们双方都能得利——或者一起死；不过这个我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒施法者马塔乌斯，若你带给他以下物品，他将制作一条瘟疫之心护腿：1 条被亵渎的护腿、20 块战损的布片、4 块月布和 2 颗连接水晶。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",c="太好了，<name>！\n你把我要求的东西全都弄来了，现在我可以制作一条瘟疫之心护腿了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Leggings."}
Q[209105]={d="我不装腔作势，蛆虫。瘟疫之心物品所蕴含的黑暗，很可能把我们两个都毁掉。所以价钱才这么高。如果我要死，那也得像个有钱人那样死。\n\n我一点也不在乎你怎么死，只在乎你照我说的去做。把我需要的东西带来，我们双方都能得利——或者一起死；不过这个我已经解释过了……",dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒施法者马塔乌斯，若你带给他以下物品，他将制作一顶瘟疫之心头冠：1 顶被亵渎的头冠、15 块战损的布片、3 块月布和 3 颗连接水晶。",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",c="太好了，<name>！\n你把我要求的东西全都弄来了，现在我可以制作一顶瘟疫之心头冠了。",cEN="Exellent <name> !\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Circlet."}
