Q[277493]={d="你做到了。黑石之主已倒在你脚下。取下他的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have done it. The Lord of Blackrock lies dead at your feet. Take his head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="把奈法利安的头颅带给你的相应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Nefarian to your respective leader.",p="办妥了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的一场伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在对黑翼龙族的战斗中，许多生命逝去了。黑石之主终于死去，我们有机会终结这一切。\n\n做得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. With the Lord of Blackrock finally dead, we have a chance to end it all.\n\nWell done."}
Q[277494]={d="你想要奖励？除掉黑石之主本身难道还不够作为奖励吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Lord of Blackrock not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="在藏宝海湾与雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这笨蛋。你本不该把我自己的信拿回来给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖励？行吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[300000]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[307491]={d="霸主伦萨克在力量谷等你。\n\n<萨尔向你致意。>\n\n别让你的观众久等，英雄。",dEN="Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength.\n\n<Thrall salutes you.>\n\nDo not keep your public waiting, hero.",o="去力量谷寻找霸主伦萨克。",oEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",p="让我看看这个。",pEN="Let me see this.",c="选择你的奖赏，让你辉煌胜利的庆典开始吧。",cEN="Choose your reward and let the celebration of your glorious victory begin."}
Q[307496]={d="去英雄谷找马廷利少校，<name>。他正等着你……",dEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, <name>. He will be expecting you...",o="去英雄谷寻找马廷利少校。",oEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes.",p="让我看看这个。",pEN="Let me see this.",c="<name>，能享有这般仪式的人寥寥无几。请选择你的奖赏，好让我们开始庆典。",cEN="Few are graced with such ceremony, <name>. Please, choose your reward so that we may begin the celebration."}
Q[307782]={d="前往英雄谷，与元帅阿弗拉西亚比交谈。",dEN="Go to the Valley of Heroes and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",o="前往暴风城的英雄谷，与元帅阿弗拉西亚比交谈。",oEN="Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",p="你那儿拿着什么？让我看看。",pEN="What do you have there? Let me see.",c="<元帅阿弗拉西亚比鞠了一躬。>\n\n选择你的奖赏，让庆典开始吧！",cEN="<Field Marshal Afrasiabi bows.>\n\nChoose your reward, let the celebration begin!"}
Q[307784]={d="去力量谷寻找霸主伦萨克。",dEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",o="在奥格瑞玛与霸主伦萨克交谈。他在力量谷等着你。",oEN="Speak with Overlord Runthak in Orgrimmar. He stands waiting for you in the Valley of Strength.",p="你那儿拿着什么？让我看看。",pEN="What do you have there? Let me see.",c="选择你的奖赏吧，好让我把这头野兽的脑袋挂起来，让所有人都看见。",cEN="Choose your reward so that I may mount the head of the beast for all to see."}
Q[307786]={d="你手捧容器时，能听到一声微弱的低语。\n\n\"把我……从这座……牢笼里……释放出来。\"\n\n\"两件将我们联结之物……\n\n以四者铸成的钢铁……\n精华……火焰之王。\"\n\n\"德米特里安……希利苏斯……\"",dEN="As you hold the vessel in your hand you can hear a faint whisper.\n\n\" Release me ... from this ... prison.\"\n\n\"Two that binds us ...\n\nsteel made of four ...\n\nessence ... firelord.\"\n\n\"Demitrian ... Silithus ...\"",o="要将逐风者桑德兰从他的牢笼中释放，你必须把重生容器、10 块元素之力和火焰之王精华交给希利苏斯的高级领主德米特里安。",oEN="To free Thunderaan the Windseeker from his prison, you must present the Vessel of Rebirth, 10 bars of Elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord to Highlord Demitrian in Silithus.",p="如有必要，就让整个世界屈服！",pEN="Bring the world to its knees if you must!",c="我连做梦都不敢预见这一天。\n\n看吧，凡人。\n\n看看那比存在本身更古老的存在！\n\n看看那曾与泰坦和神明都交过手的存在！\n\n站起来，我的主人！挣脱你的枷锁！",cEN="Even in dreams I did not dare foresee this day.\n\nBehold, mortal.\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO IS OLDER THAN EXISTENCE!\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO HAS FACED TITAN AND GOD ALIKE!\n\nRISE MY MASTER! BREAK FROM YOUR BONDS!"}
Q[307787]={d="你打败了逐风者。拿起那柄沉睡的剑刃，逼那卑鄙的骗子德米特里安用你为他的背叛所提供的材料，唤醒雷霆之怒。",dEN="You have defeated the Wind Seeker. Take the dormant blade and force the lying wretch, Demitrian, to use the materials you provided for his betrayal to wake Thunderfury.",o="把沉睡的御风之刃交给高级领主德米特里安。",oEN="Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",p="<德米特里安在你面前缩成一团。>",pEN="<Demitrian cowers in your presence.>",c="求你别伤害我！拿去吧！把剑刃拿去！让德米特里安重建他那可悲的人生吧！",cEN="Please do not harm me! Take it! Take the blade! Leave Demitrian to reshape his pathetic life!"}
Q[308183]={d="哈卡之心从内部燃烧着。虽然夺魂者已被击败，但他力量的核芯仍留在这颗被诅咒的器官里。",dEN="The Heart of Hakkar burns from within. Although the Soulflayer is defeated, the kernel of his power yet remains in this cursed organ.",o="把哈卡之心带到约亚姆巴岛的莫尔托那里。",oEN="Bring the Heart of Hakkar to Molthor on Yojamba Isle.",p="<name>，一股邪恶灵魂的臭气缠绕着你。你是被夺魂者诅咒了吗？",pEN="<name>, the reek of an evil soul surrounds you. Have you been cursed by the Soulflayer?",c="啊，哈卡之心。这么说夺魂者已经被杀死了！我们的世界得救了！\n\n<name>，你对我们的贡献怎么赞誉都不为过。你真是这个世界的英雄！",cEN="Ah, the Heart of Hakkar. So the Soulflayer has been slain! Our world is saved!\n\n<name>, your service to us cannot be overstated. You truly are a hero of this realm!"}
Q[308791]={d="一个可怕的威胁已被铲除。残暴的奥西里安已被击败。\n\n卡利姆多的居民若得知这场胜利，定会松一口气。带上奥西里安的头颅，把它呈交给塞纳里奥要塞的玛尔利斯指挥官。",dEN="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.\n\nThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.",o="把无疤者奥西里安的头颅交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的玛尔利斯指挥官。",oEN="Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",p="<name>，你回来了！而且还是完整无缺地回来的，我得多说一句。你从安其拉带来了什么消息？",pEN="Ah, <name>, you have returned! And in one piece, I might add. What news do you bring from Ahn'Qiraj?",c="我向你致以最高的嘉奖，并任你挑选一件强力物品，<name>。你为卡利姆多的人民立下了大功。",cEN="I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, <name>. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service."}
Q[308802]={d="那古神毫无生气的眼睛仍以其恶意的目光刺透你的脑海。时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯应该会处理此事。把克苏恩之眼交给他，他无疑会想把它放进主人的收藏。",dEN="The lifeless eye of the ancient god still penetrates your mind with its malicious stare. Anachronos at the Caverns of Time should take care of this. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="把克苏恩之眼带到时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯那里。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",p="<name>大人！一切都结束了……",pEN="Lord <name>! It is over...",c="主人把这些留给了你，勇士。来自那永恒宝库：一批跨越数千年的器物；选择权在你。",cEN="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours."}
Q[309120]={d="这枚护命匣是纳克萨玛斯之主仅存的东西。你的理智告诉你应当摧毁它，阻止这名巫妖再度重塑身躯。所幸，你很少听从内心那理性的声音。\n\n光明希望礼拜堂的某个人会为这件神器付给你一大笔钱。你会找谁呢……",dEN="The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.\n\nSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?",o="将克尔苏加德的护命匣带到东部瘟疫之地的光明希望礼拜堂。",oEN="Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.",c="我活了这么久，从没想过能见到这种东西……\n\n<蒙托伊神父似乎在流口水。>\n\n哦，是的，你会得到报酬的，亲爱的$g。你会得到极其丰厚的报酬。快给我。现在！",cEN="In all my days of living I would have never expected to see this...\n\n<Father Montoy appears to be salivating.>\n\nOh yes, you will be rewarded dear $g. You will be greatly rewarded. Give it here. Now!"}
Q[309250]={d="框架既已成形，埃提耶什便近乎完整。只差法杖的头部与杖柄。还有一个较小的麻烦：这根法杖是萨格拉斯邪恶力量的通道。\n\n去找个能帮你定位其余部件、并为法杖驱除邪恶的人吧。",dEN="With the frame formed, Atiesh is nearly whole. Only the head and base of the staff are now missing. There is also a minor issue regarding the staff being a conduit for Sargeras's evil.\n\nFind someone that can assist you in locating the remaining pieces and exorcising the evil from the staff.",o="找个人帮你取回法杖最后的两个部件，并驱除其中的邪恶。",oEN="Find someone that will help you in recovering the last two pieces of the staff and ridding it of evil.",p="你的时辰到了，凡人。",pEN="It was her time, mortal.",c="大法师们已经死了。\n\n不要为他们的离去哭泣，<name>。一切皆是命中注定，正如你手握守护者之法杖，也是命中注定……",cEN="The archmages have died.\n\nDo not mourn their passing, <name>. All such things are fated. Just as you holding the staff of the Guardian was fated..."}
Q[309251]={d="你怀疑自己为何还活着。毕竟，你持有一件极恶之物。答案并不明朗，<name>。我只是做我该做的事。\n\n克尔苏加德端坐于纳克萨玛斯的王座之上，正在谋划……他渴求你手中之物，也握有你寻觅之物。\n\n至于法杖的杖柄；矮人布莱恩·铜须在进入安其拉时持有它。他已离开安其拉，但埃提耶什的杖柄仍留在那里。\n\n如果你能找回那些部件，就把它们交还给我。",dEN="You question why you are still alive. After all, you have in your possession an item of great evil. The answer is not clear, <name>. I only do as I must.\n\nKel'Thuzad sits atop his throne in Naxxramas, plotting... He seeks that which you hold and holds that which you seek.\n\nAs for the base of the staff; the dwarf, Brann Bronzebeard, held it when he entered Ahn'Qiraj. He has left Ahn'Qiraj but the base of Atiesh remains.\n\nShould you succeed in recovering the pieces, return them to me.",o="时光之穴（塔纳利斯）的阿纳克洛斯想要埃提耶什的头部与埃提耶什的杖柄。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants the Staff Head of Atiesh and the Base of Atiesh.",p="以其目前的形态，这根法杖对凡人而言太过危险。",pEN="In its current form, the staff is far too dangerous to be in the hands of a mortal.",c="里面有一个存在……一个不属于这个世界的存在。",cEN="There is a being within... a being not of this world."}
Q[311002]={d="伊利丹·怒风的邪兽人大军之源已被击败。那座工厂停止了它那阴暗产物的生产，至少暂时如此。留下的只有几件破烂杂物和这颗被斩下的首级——一件配得上英雄的战利品。\n\n将玛瑟里顿的头颅带回地狱火半岛，交给你的阵营指挥官。",dEN="The source of Illidan Stormrage's fel orc army has been vanquished. The manufactory halts production of its grim product - at least for now. All that remains are a few trinkets and this severed head - a fitting trophy for a hero.\n\nReturn Magtheridon's head to your factions Commander in Hellfire Peninsula.",o="将玛瑟里顿的头颅带到地狱火半岛，交给你的阵营指挥官。",oEN="Return Magtheridon's Head to your faction's Commander in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="在我能记起的全部时光中——这是第一次——四下里一片寂静。",pEN="For the first time - in as long as I can remember - there is silence.",c="这次失败对伊利丹而言不只是打击。燃烧军团也在动摇……一位深渊领主指挥官被击败了。对燃烧军团来说，围攻地狱火堡垒已再无意义。他们所有的力量无疑都将转向黑暗神殿。\n\n救赎将……",cEN="This defeat is not only a blow to Illidan. The Legion too reels... A pit lord commander has been defeated. The siege of Hellfire Citadel now holds no purpose for the Burning Legion. All of their efforts will undoubtedly be turned upon the Black Temple.\n\nRedemption comes for Illidan... and soon."}
Q[311007]={d="你周围的空气嗡嗡作响，发出轻柔的鸣响。纳鲁知晓了你的胜利。或许正是他们让你不由自主地从凯尔萨斯·逐日者仍在抽搐的残骸中拾起这颗宝珠。它究竟藏着什么秘密？\n\n也许沙塔斯城的阿达尔能……",dEN="The air around you hums - a gentle hum. The naaru are aware of your victory. Perhaps they are the reason you were compelled to pick up this sphere from the still-twitching remains of Kael'thas Sunstrider. What secrets could it hold?\n\nPerhaps A'dal in Shattrath City could make sense of the item.",o="将翠绿宝珠带到沙塔斯城，交给阿达尔。",oEN="Take the Verdant Sphere to A'dal in Shattrath City.",p="你听到我的召唤了吗？是的……",pEN="You heard my call? Yes...",c="<阿达尔的思想与你的交融。>\n\n宝珠……奇怪。你可知道它曾经活着？是的。它就在这里，在宝珠之中。虽已残破，但确实如此。如今它在呼唤一股更强大的力量。不，不是伊利丹。\n\n更强大。\n\n欺诈者基尔加丹来了……\n\n但不是这里……\n\n<阿达尔将你的心神引向别处。>\n\n艾泽拉斯。未知之地。\n\n休息吧。你的兄弟姐妹们如今将夺回风暴要塞。\n\n<阿达尔哼唱起一首战歌。>",cEN="<A'dal's thoughts intermingle with your own.>\n\nThe sphere... Strange. Did you know that he lived? Yes. It is here - in the sphere itself. Maimed for certain. He calls to a higher power now. No, not Illidan.\n\nHigher.\n\nKil'jaeden the Deceiver comes...\n\nNot here...\n\n<A'dal points your mind elsewhere.>\n\nAzeroth. Unknown.\n\nRest. Your brothers and sisters will retake Tempest Keep now.\n\n<A'dal hums a song of battle.>"}
Q[311178]={d="端详着这瓶脉动的液体，你的思绪飘向祖阿曼外那个自命不凡的小个子。\n\n你迫不及待想看看巴德见到这东西时的表情！",dEN="As you examine the pulsating vial, your thoughts turn to the petulant little man outside Zul'Aman.\n\nYou can't wait to see Budd's expression when he sees this!",o="将祖尔金之血带到幽魂之地的祖阿曼外，交给巴德营地里的巴德。",oEN="Bring the Blood of Zul'jin to Budd at his camp in the Ghostlands, outside Zul'Aman.",p="<巴德努力掩饰着对你的厌恶。>\n\n又是你……\n\n我不知道还能怎么说：我实在太忙于自己的准备工作，没法继续牵着你的手走。\n\n相信我，<name>，这一切都是为你好。也许某个奇迹会让你闯出个名堂。\n\n如果……",pEN="<Budd tries to mask his displeasure at your presence.>\n\nYou again....\n\nI don't know how else to say it - I'm simply too busy with my preparations to hold your hand any longer.\n\nTrust me, <name>, it's all for the best. Perhaps, by some miracle, you might eventually build a name for yourself.\n\nIf so, you'll be able to say that you got your start from the incomparable Budd Nedreck!",c="你是说这是……祖尔金本人的血？\n\n<巴德定了定神，继续说道>\n\n好吧，我心领了，<class>，但我本来也能轻松解决他。他绝不可能像传说中那么可怕。这种事往往被夸大太多，你以后就会明白。那个可怜的老家伙多半是被关节炎拖垮了！\n\n不管怎么说，我想，作为我在此对你展现善意的回报，这也算是你最起码能做的了。\n\n现在，滚吧！我得处理掉这瓶可恶的药水！",cEN="Th-the Blood of Zul'jin himself you say?\n\n<Gathering himself, Budd continues>\n\nWell, I appreciate the gesture, <class>, but I could've taken him down with ease. There's no way he was as fearful as the legends say. These things have a way of being utterly overstated, as you'll learn in time. More likely, the pitiful old cretin was overcome with arthritis!\n\nAnyway, I suppose it was the least you could do as payment for the kindness I've shown you here.\n\nNow off with you - I must dispose of this vile vial!"}
Q[313372]={d="从那颗由萨菲隆爪中坠落的眼状宝石里，可以听到并感到一阵强烈的魔法嗡鸣。对凡人的耳朵来说，待在宝石近旁几乎是一种折磨。\n\n如此重要而强大的物品，想必只能呈交给……的女王。",dEN="A potent thrumming of magical nature can be heard and felt emanating from the eye-shaped jewel dropped from Sapphiron's clutches. To mortal ears it is nearly painful to be in the presence of the stone.\n\nSurely such a powerful item of import can only be taken to the queen of the dragons, Alexstrasza the Life-Binder. Seek her counsel atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",o="将聚焦之虹的钥匙交给龙骨荒野龙眠神殿顶层的生命缚誓者阿莱克丝塔萨。",oEN="Deliver the Key to the Focusing Iris to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",p="<name>，你竟然接触到了一把聚焦之虹的钥匙！你把它带在身上了吗？\n\n\n\n你怎么会拥有它？哦，萨菲隆还留着他那把？",pEN="<name>, you have come into contact with a key to the focusing iris! Do you have it upon your person?\n\n\n\nHow did you ever come into its possession? Oh, Sapphiron still had his?",c="这些钥匙掌握在蓝龙军团最古老的成员手中。只有他们奉主人玛里苟斯之命持有它们。\n\n这正是我们一直在等待的机会，向魔法守护巨龙发起进攻！\n\n<巨龙女王打量了你片刻。>\n\n你不能就这样用这把钥匙进入聚焦之虹，但我可以将我的一部分力量灌注给你；足以让你用它把虹膜打开一道缝隙。\n\n这就足以引来玛里苟斯的怒火了！",cEN="These keys are held by the most ancient members of the blue dragonflight. Only they are entrusted with them by their master, Malygos.\n\nThis is the break that we've been waiting for to strike at the Aspect of Magic!\n\n<The queen of dragons studies you for a brief moment.>\n\nYou are not able to use the key as-is to access the Focusing Iris, but I can imbue you with a portion of my power; enough to enable you to use it to open the iris a fraction.\n\nIt will be enough to draw Malygos's ire!"}
Q[313384]={d="既然你已能进入聚焦之虹，是时候让那把钥匙派上用场了。\n\n尽管我很希望看到玛里苟斯重新融入族群，但此刻那绝无可能。事关重大，其他守护巨龙的裁决是：织法者必须被击败。\n\n<克拉苏斯说这最后一句时显得极为不安>\n\n<name>，前往永恒之眼，面对玛里苟斯，并带着魔法之心回来。",dEN="Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.\n\nAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.\n\n<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>\n\n<name>, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic.",o="龙骨荒野龙眠神殿顶层的克拉苏斯想要你把魔法之心带回来。",oEN="Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.",p="只有玛里苟斯拥有魔法之心。那是他最珍视的宝物。",pEN="Only Malygos carries the Heart of Magic. It is his most prized possession.",c="这是极为悲痛的一天，不仅对龙族，也对艾泽拉斯所有活着的生灵。我们失去了一位最善于思考、最聪慧、最古老的友人。魔法失去了它的守护者。\n\n但愿在往后的岁月里，这被证明是明智之举，<name>……",cEN="This is a very sad day, not only for dragonkind, but for all of the living creatures of Azeroth. We have lost one of our most thoughtful, intelligent and ancient friends. Magic is now without its guardian.\n\nLet us hope that this was a wise decision in the coming years, <name>. A storm is still brewing on the horizon and now we are without one of our most powerful defenders."}
Q[316502]={d="你完成了不可能的事。黑龙军团的孵化母巢已倒在你脚下。取下她的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="将奥妮克希亚的头颅交给你的对应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to your respective leader.",p="这真的是吗？奥妮克希亚的头颅？",pEN="Is this really it? Onyxia's head?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在与黑龙军团的战斗中，无数生命逝去。如今我们终于给了他们关键一击。没有孵化母巢，就不会再有新的龙卵。\n\n干得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. Now we finally struck a crucial blow against them. No broodmother means no new eggs.\n\nWell done."}
Q[316503]={d="你想要奖赏？除掉孵化母巢难道还不算足够的奖赏吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Broodmother not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="与藏宝海湾的雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这蠢货。你本不该把我自己的信带回给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖赏。好吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[354000]={d="虚空风暴传来了令人不安的消息。军团派出了末日守卫阿拉格斯，前往遗忘熔炉基地监督邪能掠夺者和其他污秽机器的生产。要是让阿拉格斯得逞，军团在外域的军队将大为增强。找到潜伏在熔炉基地附近的督工阿拉格斯，在军团的战争机器变得更强之前终结他的险恶计划。虚空风暴的原野绝不能容留这些毁灭之器！",dEN="Troubling news has reached us from Netherstorm. The Doomguard Arragoth has been dispatched by the Legion to oversee production of fel reavers and other foul machines at Forge Base Oblivion. If Arragoth succeeds, the Legion's army in Outland will be bolstered considerably. Seek out Overseer Arragoth where he lurks near the Forge Base and put an end to his sinister plans before the Legion's war machine grows any stronger. The fields of Netherstorm must not host these engines of destruction!",o="杀死督工阿拉格斯",oEN="Slay Overseer Arragoth",c="干得好，英雄！你的努力沉重打击了军团在虚空风暴的行动。阿拉格斯一死，遗忘熔炉基地的邪能掠夺者和其他武器生产必定大受影响。尽管军团依然盘踞于此，但你今日已阻断了他们的进程。虚空风暴的军队欠你一份谢意——原野上游荡的邪能掠夺者少了，就意味着更多性命得以保全。",cEN="Well done, hero! Your efforts have dealt a major blow to the Legion's operations in Netherstorm. With Arragoth slain, production of fel reavers and other weapons at Forge Base Oblivion will surely suffer. Although the Legion's presence remains, you have hindered their progress this day. The forces of Netherstorm owe you a debt of gratitude, as fewer fel reavers roaming the fields means more lives saved."}
Q[354001]={d="我们收到了关于以太人在乌提斯法力熔炉附近活动的令人不安的消息。一个自称联结领主扎希尔的以太人获得了力量，正带头掀起该地区以太人行动的高潮。扎希尔是强大的奥术能量操控者，一直在用致命魔法灌注他的以太人同胞。若任由他继续下去，虚空风暴的以太人威胁可能暴增十倍。找到潜伏在乌提斯法力熔炉附近的联结领主扎希尔，在以太人变得过于猖狂之前终结他危险的实验。虚空风暴的稳定危在旦夕！",dEN="Disturbing news has reached us regarding the Ethereum's activities near Manaforge Ultris. An Ethereal calling himself Nexus-Lord Zahiir has been empowered to lead a surge in Ethereum operations in the region. Zahiir is a powerful wielder of arcane energies and has been imbuing fellow Ethereum with deadly magic. If his efforts are allowed to continue, the Ethereum threat in Netherstorm could increase tenfold. Seek out Nexus-Lord Zahiir where he lurks near Manaforge Ultris and put an end to his dangerous experiments before the Ethereum grow too bold. The stability of Netherstorm hangs in the balance!",o="杀死联结领主扎希尔",oEN="Slay Nexus-Lord Zahiir",c="干得好，英雄！你击败联结领主扎希尔，使乌提斯法力熔炉附近的以太人部队陷入混乱。多亏你的行动，他们邪恶的奥术活动被迫中止。扎希尔曾控制着许多扭曲的以太人——他一死，他们的士气便大为低落。",cEN="Well done, hero! Your defeat of Nexus-Lord Zahiir has scattered the Ethereum forces near Manaforge Ultris into disarray. Their nefarious arcane operations have been put on hold thanks to your actions. Zahiir held sway over many twisted ethereals - with him gone, their morale has weakened considerably."}
Q[354002]={d="杜罗法力熔炉周围流传着险恶的传言。据说那里的炎怒部队雇到一位名叫阿尔特蕾娅的高明星术师。这名狡猾的女巫一直在运用她对奥术的精通为炎怒部队增强力量，推进凯尔萨斯那套错误的图谋。如果阿尔特蕾娅继续把她的魔法教给更多血精灵，炎怒部队可能会在虚空风暴取得危险的先机。前往杜罗法力熔炉，找到阿尔特蕾娅，在为时已晚之前终结她毁灭性的影响。虚空风暴的未来危在旦夕！",dEN="Sinister rumors swirl around Manaforge Duro. Word is that the Sunfury forces there have acquired the services of a skilled Astromancer named Altrea. This cunning sorceress has been using her mastery over the arcane to empower the Sunfury and further Kael'thas' misguided agenda. If Altrea continues teaching her magic to more blood elves, the Sunfury could gain a dangerous advantage in Netherstorm. Venture to Manaforge Duro, locate Altrea and end her destructive influence before it is too late. The future of Netherstorm hangs in the balance!",o="杀死星术师阿尔特蕾娅",oEN="Slay Astromancer Altrea",c="谢谢你，英雄！你直面阿尔特蕾娅的勇气，沉重打击了驻扎在杜罗法力熔炉的炎怒部队。他们的星术师一死，魔法研究与训练必将受到严重影响。阿尔特蕾娅是个恶毒的影响源——她那些黑暗的教导本会让炎怒部队更有力量去施暴与流血。但多亏了你，凯尔萨斯的追随者已被削弱，虚空风暴也能松一口气，因为阿尔特蕾娅的邪恶已被终结。",cEN="Thank you, hero! Your courage in confronting Altrea has delivered a serious blow to the Sunfury forces stationed at Manaforge Duro. With their Astromancer slain, their magical research and training will be disrupted significantly. Altrea was a malicious influence - her dark teachings would have empowered the Sunfury for further violence and bloodshed. But thanks to you, Kael'thas' followers have been weakened and Netherstorm can breathe easier knowing Altrea's evil has been put to an end."}
Q[354003]={d="盘踞在炎怒要塞的炎怒部队日益壮大。统领他们的是一个名叫特雷亚兰指挥官的残暴魔剑士。特雷亚兰的剑击灌注着致命魔法，使他成为极其可怕的敌人。若放任不管，他可能召集并训练更多炎怒新兵，投入凯尔萨斯王子那场注定失败的远征。找到潜伏在炎怒要塞外的特雷亚兰指挥官，在炎怒部队于虚空风暴再获立足点之前终结他可鄙的行动。这片地区的未来取决于你的成败！",dEN="The Sunfury forces encroached at Sunfury Hold grow stronger by the day. Leading them is a ruthless spellblade named Commander Treyaran. Treyaran's sword strokes are imbued with deadly magic, making him a formidable foe. If left unchecked, he could rally and train more Sunfury recruits for Prince Kael'thas' ill-fated crusade. Seek out Commander Treyaran where he lurks outside Sunfury Hold and end his despicable campaign before the Sunfury gain another foothold in Netherstorm. The future of the region depends on your success!",o="杀死特雷亚兰指挥官",oEN="Slay Commander Treyaran",c="感谢你勇敢的付出，英雄。你战胜特雷亚兰指挥官，沉重打击了驻扎在炎怒要塞的炎怒部队。他们的魔剑士指挥官一死，士气大受打击，其咄咄逼人的扩张也将放缓。特雷亚兰本是严重的威胁，但多亏了你，他那场暴力的远征已被阻止。干得好！特雷亚兰已除，至少今天，虚空风暴更安全了。不过我们仍须警惕未来的危险。",cEN="Thank you for your brave efforts, hero. Your triumph over Commander Treyaran has dealt a punishing blow to the Sunfury forces stationed at Sunfury Hold. With their spellblade commander slain, their morale has taken a severe hit, and their aggressive expansion will be slowed. Treyaran was a serious threat, but thanks to you his violent crusade has been halted. Well done! With Treyaran gone, Netherstorm is safer, at least for today. Though we must remain vigilant against future dangers."}
Q[354004]={d="在古老的阿古斯时代，萨劳德斯曾是阿克蒙德的学生。时至今日，他仍是其主人最忠诚的门徒之一，无情地率领军团远征，希望借此赢得阿克蒙德的宠信。\n\n一名德莱尼斥候最近回到了沙塔斯，报告说她的其余队员都在虚空风暴阿克隆废墟附近被萨劳德斯杀害。如果你行动够快，也许能为这些斥候复仇，并给军团的部队一记毁灭性的打击。",dEN="Saraudaes was once a student of Archimonde during the ancient days of Argus. To this day, he remains one of his master's most loyal disciples, mercilessly leading the Legion's crusade in hope's of earning Archimonde's favor.\n\nA draenei scout recently returned to Shattrath, reporting that the rest of her party was slain by Saraudaes, in Netherstorm near Arklon Ruins. If you act quickly, you may be able to avenge the scouts, and deal a devastating blow to the Legion's forces.",o="杀死萨劳德斯",oEN="Slay Saraudaes",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜萨劳德斯，今日为虚空风暴清除了一个大害。他所掌握的那股黑暗力量再也无法威胁这片土地。虽然邪能余波或许仍在，但你今日战胜了燃烧军团。要不是你出手干预，萨劳德斯定会造成巨大的祸患。知道这样的邪恶已被铲除，虚空风暴的居民可以安心了。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over Saraudaes has purged a great evil from Netherstorm today. The dark power he held shall threaten the land no longer. Although fel energy may linger, you have won a victory over the Burning Legion this day. Saraudaes would have wrought great ruin had you not intervened. The residents of Netherstorm can breathe easier knowing such wickedness has been abolished."}
Q[354005]={d="影月谷传来坏消息。一个名叫托尔加卡的邪恶末日守卫被任命为军团要塞的指挥官，无疑是为了监督某种新的凶恶魔器或传送门的制造。托尔加卡残酷地驱使莫阿格劳工不停劳作——任何跟不上的人都会被杀死。他们正在制造的武器一旦完成，可能让军团在影月谷占得上风，甚至可能席卷整个外域。绝不能让这种事继续！潜入军团要塞，在这名无情监工的暴行害死更多无辜者之前杀掉督工托尔加卡。终结这个末日守卫的残暴统治！",dEN="Ill tidings from Shadowmoon Valley. A vile Doomguard named Tor'gakar has been placed in command of Legion Hold, no doubt to oversee the creation of some new fiendish weapon or portal. Tor'gakar cruelly drives the moarg laborers to work without rest - any who falter are slain. The weapons they are creating could give the Legion the upper hand in Shadowmoon, and perhaps all of Outland, if they were completed. This cannot continue! Infiltrate Legion Hold and slay Overseer Tor'gakar before more innocent lives are lost to his merciless taskmaster ways. End the Doomguard's brutal reign!",o="除掉督工托尔加卡",oEN="Slay Overseer Tor'gakar",c="谢谢你，英雄！托尔加卡一死，军团要塞的生产必定大受影响，为影月谷的部队争取到了急需的时间来筹划下一步行动。虽然燃烧军团的阴影依旧笼罩，但你今日赢得了一场胜利。好好享受吧，但要保持警惕。",cEN="Thank you, hero! With Tor'gakar vanquished, production at Legion Hold will surely suffer, buying much needed time for the forces of Shadowmoon Valley to plan their next move. While the Burning Legion's shadow still looms, you have won a victory this day. Enjoy it, but remain vigilant."}
Q[354006]={d="日蚀岗哨周围流传着令人不安的传言。据说一位天赋出众、名叫瑟拉伊娃的星术师躲在那里，把她黑暗的学问传播给误入歧途的日蚀血精灵。瑟拉伊娃对奥术的精通增强了日蚀部队及其不稳定的魔法实验。若放任不管，她可能造出一支奥术异变体的军队！到日蚀岗哨找出瑟拉伊娃，在为时已晚之前终结她扭曲的远征。影月的未来取决于你的英勇！",dEN="Troubling rumors swirl around Eclipse Point. Word is that a gifted Astromancer named Seraeva has taken shelter there, spreading her dark teachings amongst the wayward Eclipsion blood elves. Seraeva's mastery over the arcane has empowered the Eclipsion and their unstable magic experiments. If she remains unchecked, she could create an army of arcane abominations! Seek out Seraeva at Eclipse Point and end her twisted crusade before it is too late. The future of Shadowmoon depends on your heroism!",o="除掉星术师瑟拉伊娃",oEN="Slay Astromancer Seraeva",c="谢谢你，勇士！你直面瑟拉伊娃的勇气，沉重打击了日蚀部队及其在日蚀岗哨的阴暗图谋。他们的导师一倒，其魔法研究必定难以为继。瑟拉伊娃是个恶毒的影响源——她那些亵渎的教导只会滋生邪恶与纷争。但多亏了你，她卑劣的野心已被埋葬。知道这样的腐化已被清除，影月谷可以安心了。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your courage in confronting Seraeva has delivered a serious blow to the Eclipsion and their shadowy endeavors at Eclipse Point. With their mentor gone, their magical research will surely falter. Seraeva was a malicious influence - her profane teachings would have bred only wickedness and discord. But thanks to you, her vile ambitions have been laid to rest. Shadowmoon Valley can breathe easier knowing such corruption has been purged."}
Q[354007]={d="灵翼浮岛传来令人担忧的消息。残暴的邪兽人科伦降服了一头灵翼幼龙，如今自由地翱翔天际，所到之处人人惊恐。科伦率领着一伙龙喉兽人，他那头龙类坐骑赋予了他统治这片地区的巨大力量。若放任不管，他必定会镇压龙喉部族中残存的动乱，巩固自己的统治。我们绝不能再让这个邪恶暴君压迫灵翼族群！找到天空领主科伦，杀了他，解救他那头受尽虐待的幼龙，好让灵翼真正的精神得以重生！",dEN="Troubling news from Netherwing Ledge. The cruel fel orc Korun has subjugated a Netherwing drake and now freely rides the skies, terrorizing all in his path. Korun leads a band of Dragonmaw orcs and his draconic steed gives him immense power over the region. If left unchecked, he will surely crush the remaining unrest among the Dragonmaw and cement his rule. We cannot allow this evil tyrant to oppress the Netherwing brood any longer! Seek out Skylord Korun, slay him and free his mistreated drake so that the true spirit of the Netherwing might be rekindled!",o="除掉天空领主科伦",oEN="Slay Skylord Korun",c="谢谢你，英雄！你击败暴虐的天空领主科伦，把受奴役的灵翼族群从他的残暴中解救了出来。科伦一除，龙喉部族将失去对这些高贵巨龙的控制。你今日为正义打出了漂亮的一击！虽然龙喉的威胁仍在，但灵翼族群及其盟友如今有了希望——笼罩灵翼浮岛的阴影或许终能被驱散。",cEN="Thank you, hero! Your defeat of the tyrannical Skylord Korun has freed the enslaved Netherwing from his cruelty. With Korun removed, the Dragonmaw will lose their stranglehold over these noble dragons. You have struck a blow for justice this day! While the Dragonmaw threat remains, the Netherwing and their allies now have hope that the shadows over Netherwing Ledge may yet be lifted."}
Q[354008]={d="有传闻说，盘牙岗哨附近的水域里潜伏着某种庞然大物。目击者形容那是一头巨大的纳迦，又或者是一条巨蛇，力量与体型都异乎寻常。这头神秘的野兽似乎在聚集追随者，并腐化本地生物为其效劳。若放任不管，它可能聚起一支军队袭击影月谷。到盘牙岗哨附近找出这个\"赫鲁莱克\"，在它的力量进一步增长之前杀掉它！我们不知道是什么黑暗力量召唤出了这头怪物，但无论如何都必须阻止它。",dEN="There are whispers of something enormous lurking in the waters near Coilskar Point. Glimpses describe it as a massive naga, or perhaps serpent, of uncommon power and size. This mysterious beast seems to be gathering followers and corrupting local creatures to serve it. If left unchecked, it could amass an army and strike against Shadowmoon Valley. Seek out this \"Hrullek\" near Coilskar Point and slay it before its power grows further! We know not what dark force has conjured this monstrosity, but it must be stopped at all costs.",o="除掉赫鲁莱克",oEN="Slay Hrullek",c="干得好，英雄！你战胜赫鲁莱克，驱散了它刚成形的势力，为盘牙岗哨带来了和平——至少眼下如此。无论是何种邪恶魔法召唤出这样的庞然巨物，都已被果断挫败。虽然围绕这个叫\"赫鲁莱克\"的生物仍有诸多谜团，但有一点很清楚——它的存在本身就是违背常理的。你相信自己的直觉，在恰当的时机终结了它日益增长的威胁，做得对。影月谷今日欠你一份谢意。保持警惕，这片土地上仍潜伏着已知与未知的危险。",cEN="Well done, hero! Your triumph over Hrullek has scattered its nascent forces and delivered peace to Coilskar Point, at least for now. Whatever vile magic that conjured such a behemoth has been thwarted decisively. While mysteries yet swirl around this creature called \"Hrullek,\" one thing is clear - its existence was unnatural. You were right to trust your instincts and end its burgeoning threat when you did. Shadowmoon Valley owes you its thanks this day. Remain vigilant, as dangers both known and unknown still lurk in these lands."}
Q[354009]={d="黑暗的低语围绕着一名致命的恶魔猎手——泰拉尼尔，她潜伏在黑暗神殿附近的阴影中。泰拉尼尔是伊利丹·怒风的残暴追随者，率领着一支同样狂热的恶魔猎手队伍。她一直在用邪能能量灌注本地野生动物，制造一支恶魔野兽大军。若放任不管，泰拉尼尔和她那些邪恶爪牙可能对影月谷构成巨大威胁。找到这名危险的伊利达雷和她那群疯狂的恶魔野兽，在它们力量进一步增长之前将其尽数消灭！必须把这片土地从它们的污秽中净化。",dEN="Dark whispers surround a deadly demon hunter named Telaniel who lurks in the shadows near the Black Temple. Telaniel is a ruthless follower of Illidan Stormrage and leads a contingent of similarly fanatical demon hunters. She has been imbuing local wildlife with fel energy to create an army of demonic beasts. Left unchecked, Telaniel and her vile minions could pose a great threat to Shadowmoon Valley. Seek out this dangerous Illidari and her frenzied demon beasts and exterminate them before their power grows further! The land must be cleansed of their foul taint.",o="杀死泰拉尼尔",oEN="Slay Telaniel",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜泰拉尼尔和她那些腐化的造物，为这片土地除去了一大祸害。她邪恶的魔法再也无法蔓延——今日你战胜了伊利丹的部队。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over Telaniel and her corrupted creatures has lifted a great evil from these lands. Her sinister magic will spread no further - today you have won a victory over Illidan's forces."}
Q[354010]={d="刀锋山传来令人不安的消息。食人魔蛮兵鲁尔雷格一直在纠集血锤部族，对天卫哨站的人们发动新一轮攻击。鲁尔雷格以无情的狡诈从血锤哨站统领血锤部队，还捕捉无辜的狮鹫，用于他邪恶的狩猎取乐。绝不能任其如此！找到潜伏在血锤哨站的鲁尔雷格，终结他残暴的恐怖统治。天卫与刀锋山的安全取决于你的英勇！",dEN="Troubling news from Blade's Edge Mountains. The ogre brute Rur'legg has been rallying the Bloodmaul clan for renewed attacks against the people of Skyguard Outpost. Rur'legg leads the Bloodmaul forces from Bloodmaul Outpost with ruthless cunning, capturing innocent gryphons for use in his vile hunting sport. This must not stand! Seek out Rur'legg where he lurks at Bloodmaul Outpost, end his cruel reign of terror. The safety of the Skyguard and Blade's Edge depends on your heroism!",o="杀死鲁尔雷格",oEN="Slay Rur'legg",c="谢谢你，英雄！你战胜那个邪恶的蛮兵鲁尔雷格，使血锤部队四散溃乱。这一阵子，食人魔在发动大规模进攻前得好好掂量掂量了。你今日赢得了一场大胜！刀锋山的居民和天卫哨站那些勇敢的狮鹫骑士都欠你一份谢意。",cEN="Thank you, hero! Your triumph over that vile brute Rur'legg has scattered the Bloodmaul forces into disarray. The ogres will think twice now before mounting any major attacks for a while. You have won a great victory this day! The residents of Blade's Edge Mountains and the brave gryphon riders of Skyguard Outpost owe you a debt of gratitude."}
Q[354011]={d="刀锋山的死亡之门周围流传着险恶的传言。有人在该地区目击到一个名叫卡阿鲁扎尔的审判官恶魔，正用污秽魔法折磨、审讯被束缚于世的德莱尼灵魂。这生物以痛苦为食，还想扭曲德莱尼的记忆，把它们变成可以用来对付德莱尼的武器。绝不能让他的邪恶继续下去！找到在死亡之门举行亵渎仪式的审判官卡阿鲁扎尔。终结他折磨的统治，好让德莱尼的灵魂终于得到安息。",dEN="Sinister rumors swirl around Death's Door in Blade's Edge Mountains. An inquisitor demon named Khaa'ruzal has been spotted in the area, using foul magic to torture and interrogate draenei spirits bound to the world. This creature feeds on suffering and seeks to twist the draenei's memories into weapons he can use against them. His evil cannot be allowed to continue! Seek out Inquisitor Khaa'ruzal where he performs his profane rituals at Death's Door. End his reign of torment so that the draenei spirits may finally find peace.",o="杀死审判官卡阿鲁扎尔",oEN="Slay Inquisitor Khaa'ruzal",c="谢谢你，英雄。你今日的作为把饱受折磨的德莱尼灵魂从卡阿鲁扎尔的魔掌中解救了出来。他邪恶的审讯和无穷的残忍终于结束了。虽然他那股恶意的余音或许仍在回荡，但你为这地方带来了一份安宁。德莱尼欠你一份谢意——他们的记忆再也不会那么轻易被腐化、被用来对付他们自己。保持警惕，勇士。燃烧军团的仇恨在这片土地上根深蒂固。",cEN="Thank you, hero. Your deeds this day have freed the troubled draenei spirits from Khaa'ruzal's grasp. His vile inquisitions and endless cruelty have at last been ended. While echoes of his malice may still linger, you have brought a measure of peace to this place. The draenei owe you a debt of gratitude - their memories will no longer be so easily corrupted and turned against them. Stay vigilant, champion. The Burning Legion's hatred runs deep in these lands."}
Q[354012]={d="晶刺传来令人不安的消息。巴什伊尔人雇到了一位名叫联结领主卡里德的以太人法师，来统领他们在该地区的部队。卡里德掌控着强大的奥术魔法，一直在用在晶刺中采集的致命水晶强化巴什伊尔人。若放任不管，巴什伊尔人的威胁可能失控。找到在晶刺监督巴什伊尔人行动的联结领主卡里德。在他的魔法给刀锋山带来毁灭之前，终结他那场水晶远征！",dEN="Troubling news from The Crystal Spine. The Bash'ir have acquired the services of an Ethereal mage named Nexus-Lord Khariid to lead their forces in the region. Khariid wields powerful arcane magic and has been empowering the Bash'ir with deadly crystals harvested from the spines. If he is allowed to continue, the Bash'ir threat may grow out of control. Seek out Nexus-Lord Khariid where he oversees Bash'ir operations at The Crystal Spine. End his crystalline crusade before his magic brings ruin to Blade's Edge Mountains!",o="杀死联结领主卡里德",oEN="Slay Nexus-Lord Khariid",c="谢谢你，勇士！你击败联结领主卡里德，驱散了巴什伊尔人的部队，给予他们沉重的打击。多亏你的行动，他们在晶刺附近那些邪恶的采矿与秘术活动已被彻底打断。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your defeat of Nexus-Lord Khariid has scattered the Bash'ir forces and delivered a punishing blow. Their nefarious mining and mystical operations near The Crystal Spine have been disrupted completely thanks to your actions."}
Q[354013]={d="刀锋山的格里什纳周围笼罩着黑暗的低语。一个名叫夺魂者阿克里西斯的鸦人狂信徒正通过亵渎仪式聚敛力量，想借此讨好他那位神秘的女主人——所谓的风之女皇。阿克里西斯宰杀生物献祭，窃取它们的灵魂，用以滋养自己的魔法和风之女皇的野心。他的邪恶不能继续下去！到格里什纳找出夺魂者，在他害死更多无辜者之前终结他卑鄙的仪式。必须把这片土地从他的黑暗力量中净化！",dEN="Dark whispers surround Grishnath in Blade's Edge Mountains. An arakkoa fanatic known as the Soul-Harvester Akrysis gathers power through profane rituals, seeking to impress his mysterious mistress, the so-called Wind-Empress. Akrysis butchers creatures in sacrifice, stealing their souls to fuel his magic and the Wind-Empress' ambitions. His evil cannot continue! Seek out the Soul-Harvester at Grishnath and end his vile rites before more innocent lives are lost. The land must be cleansed of his dark power!",o="杀死夺魂者阿克里西斯",oEN="Slay Soul-Harvester Akrysis",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜夺魂者，今日为刀锋山清除了一个大害。他那亵渎的仪式和对无辜灵魂的献祭再也无法威胁这片土地。也许等到我们弄清这位\"风之女皇\"的真相时，你也有能力去面对她。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over the Soul-Harvester has purged a great evil from Blade's Edge Mountains today. His foul rituals and sacrifice of innocent souls will threaten the land no more. Perhaps when the time comes that we learn the truth of this \"Wind-Empress\", you may be capable of facing her as well."}
Q[354014]={d="一个名叫梅尔塔瓦的强大恶魔目前坐镇熔炉营地：愤怒，监督着该地区邪能掠夺者的建造。\n\n若要摧毁他，就必须趁现在，趁那些机器还没投入使用。",dEN="A powerful demon known as Maeltavar currently presides over Forge Camp: Wrath, overseeing the construction of Fel Reavers in the area.\n\nIf he is to be destroyed, it must be done now, before the machines are operational.",o="杀死梅尔塔瓦",oEN="Slay Maeltavar",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354015]={d="随着老巫婆吉塞尔达之死，有报告称她的女儿克里埃拉已经夺取了基尔索罗的控制权。事实证明，克里埃拉比她母亲还要狂热，她用召唤来的恶魔充实基尔索罗的队伍。\n\n必须在她的部族有力量以军团之名把玛格汉和库雷尼都献作祭品之前，击败克里埃拉。",dEN="With the death of Giselda the Crone, reports have come in that her daughter Kriella has seized control over the Kil'sorrow. Kriella has proven to be even more fanatical than her mother, bolstering the ranks Kil'sorrow with summoned demons.\n\nKriella must be defeated, before her clan has the strength to sacrifice both the Mag'har and Kurenei in the Legion's name.",o="杀死代言人克里埃拉",oEN="Slay Kriella the Speaker",c="基尔索罗多半还会找到另一个首领，但只能指望吉塞尔达和克里埃拉的死足以让这个部族陷入一段时间的混乱。",cEN="The Kil'sorrow will likely find yet another leader, but it can only be hoped the loss of both Giselda and Kriella is enough to send the clan into disarray for a time."}
Q[354016]={d="纳格兰传来令人不安的消息。加瓦西倒台之后，以太人联结领主法里斯控制了欧舒冈附近的维尔阿尼。法里斯掌控着强大的奥术魔法，一直在强化维尔阿尼，让他们在纳格兰各地发动袭击。若放任不管，法里斯和变得肆无忌惮的维尔阿尼可能对这片土地构成更大的威胁。找到欧舒冈外的联结领主法里斯，在更多无辜者遭受维尔阿尼之怒以前终结他的行动。纳格兰的安全危在旦夕！",dEN="Troubling news from Nagrand. After the fall of Gava'xi, the ethereal Nexus-Lord Faaris has taken control of the Vir'aani near Oshu'gun. Faaris wields powerful arcane magic and has been empowering the Vir'aani for attacks across Nagrand. If left unchecked, Faaris and the emboldened Vir'aani could become an even greater threat to the land. Seek out Nexus-Lord Faaris outside Oshu'gun and end his campaign before more innocents suffer the Vir'aani's wrath. The safety of Nagrand hangs in the balance!",o="杀死联结领主法里斯",oEN="Slay Nexus-Lord Faaris",c="你击败联结领主法里斯，遏止了维尔阿尼的复苏，为纳格兰带回了一些安宁。虽然那些阴暗的维尔阿尼可能仍潜伏在这片土地的角落，但你今日赢得了一场重大胜利。纳格兰的食人魔和其他居民都欠你一份谢意——感谢你勇敢地直面如此危险的敌人。你为正义打出了漂亮的一击，也让维尔阿尼明白：想在这里称霸没那么容易！",cEN="Your defeat of Nexus-Lord Faaris has broken the Vir'aani resurgence and brought some peace back to Nagrand. While the shadowy Vir'aani may still lurk in corners of the land, you have won a major victory this day. The ogres and other residents of Nagrand owe you a debt of gratitude for confronting such a dangerous foe with courage. You have struck a blow for justice and shown the Vir'aani that domination will not come easily here!"}
Q[354017]={d="纳格兰传来紧急消息。随着沼泽领主穆塞雷克和奥托尔的败亡，破碎的萨满扎图兰夺取了日泉岗哨附近残余暗血部队的控制权。扎图兰掌握着黑暗魔法，一直在纠集暗血部族准备大举进攻——报告显示他打算突袭加拉达尔，完成他兄弟未竟之事，把玛格汉兽人彻底灭绝！绝不能让这成为现实。找到藏在日泉岗哨附近暗血部族当中的扎图兰，在加拉达尔陷落之前终结他的恐怖行动。",dEN="Dire news from Nagrand. With the defeats of Swamplord Musel'ek and Ortor, the broken shaman Zatuuran has seized control of the remaining Murkblood forces near Sunspring Post. Zatuuran commands dark magics and has been rallying the Murkblood for a major attack - reports indicate he plans to strike against Garadar and finish what his brother started by wiping out the Mag'har orcs entirely! This cannot come to pass. Seek out Zatuuran where he hides among the Murkblood near Sunspring Post and end his campaign of terror before Garadar falls.",o="杀死扎图兰",oEN="Slay Zatuuran",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜扎图兰，粉碎了暗血部队的残余，为赞加沼泽带回了一些安宁。虽然他们邪恶的余音或许仍在沼泽中回荡，但你今日赢得了一场大胜。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over Zatuuran has shattered what remained of the Murkblood forces and brought some peace back to Zangarmarsh. While echoes of their evil may still linger in the swamps, you have won a major victory this day."}
Q[354018]={d="飞行员玛莎悬赏那个邪恶食人魔科拉瓦克的脑袋。这个野蛮的畜生率领着一伙战槌食人魔，前不久对纳格兰的奈辛瓦里远征营地发动了凶猛的袭击。虽然科拉瓦克被击退，但他在战斗中造成了相当大的破坏，重创了飞行员，还毁坏了装备。最严重的是，远征队的飞机受损，修好之前无法起飞。飞行员玛莎请求纳格兰任何有能力的冒险者，找到潜伏在战槌山的科拉瓦克，为她飞机额外遭受的损伤讨回公道。",dEN="Pilot Marsha is offering a bounty for the head of the vile ogre Kor'Avak. This savage brute leads a band of Warmaul ogres that recently launched a vicious attack on Nesingwary's expedition camp in Nagrand. While Kor'Avak was driven off, he caused considerable damage in the battle, severely injuring pilots and destroying equipment. Most critically, the expedition's plane suffered damage and is unable to fly until repaired. Pilot Marsha asks any able adventurers in Nagrand to seek out Kor'Avak where he lurks on Warmaul Hill and get revenge for the extra damage caused to her plane.",o="杀死科拉瓦克",oEN="Slay Kor'Avak",c="谢谢你，英雄！击败野蛮的科拉瓦克，你给战槌食人魔上了一堂关于克制与收敛的严厉一课。飞行员玛莎和奈辛瓦里远征队都欠你一份人情。",cEN="Thank you, hero! By defeating the barbaric Kor'Avak, you've taught the Warmaul ogres a harsh lesson about temperance and restraint. Pilot Marsha and the Nesingwary expedition are in your debt."}
Q[354019]={d="纳格兰暮光岭一带流传着令人不安的传言。一个名叫奥努拉尔的审判官恶魔已经掌控了该地区暗影议会的部队，并企图为某种黑暗目的重新开启那座沉寂的次元传送门。奥努拉尔已开始收集禁忌器物，并向传送门输送魔法。若让他得逞，谁知道他会把怎样的邪恶释放到我们的世界！绝不能让这成为现实。到暮光岭找出审判官奥努拉尔，在灾难降临纳格兰之前终结他亵渎的仪式。",dEN="Troubling rumors swirl around Twilight Ridge in Nagrand. An inquisitor demon named Onur'aal has taken command of the Shadow Council forces in the area and seeks to reopen the dormant dimensional gateway for some dark purpose. Onur'aal has begun gathering forbidden artifacts and channeling magic into the gateway. If he succeeds, who knows what evil he might unleash into our world! We cannot allow this to come to pass. Seek out Inquisitor Onur'aal at Twilight Ridge and put an end to his profane rituals before disaster strikes Nagrand.",o="杀死审判官奥努拉尔",oEN="Slay Inquisitor Onur'aal",c="你战胜审判官奥努拉尔，挫败了暗影议会的计划，使纳格兰免于一场灾祸。禁忌器物已被收回，次元传送门也再次被封住。虽然阴影仍盘踞在暮光岭，但你今日赢得了胜利。",cEN="Your triumph over Inquisitor Onur'aal has thwarted the Shadow Council's plans and protected Nagrand from calamity. The forbidden artifacts have been recovered and the dimensional gateway sealed once more. While shadows yet cling to Twilight Ridge, you have won a victory this day."}
Q[354020]={d="图雷姆传来令人不安的消息。破碎的萨满库诺多把雷克部族的残部统一在了泰罗卡森林。库诺多掌控着强大的元素魔法，一直在袭击附近的聚居地以掠夺资源。\n\n找到藏在图雷姆废墟中的雷克部族库诺多，在更多无辜者受害之前终结他的恐怖行动。",dEN="Troubling news from Tuurem. The broken shaman Kunodo has united the remnants of the Wrekt tribe in Terokkar Forest. Kunodo wields powerful elemental magic and has been raiding nearby settlements for resources.\n\nSeek out Kunodo of Wrekt where he hides among the ruins of Tuurem and end his campaign of terror before more innocents suffer.",o="杀死雷克部族的库诺多",oEN="Slay Kunodo of Wrekt",c="库诺多一死，雷克部族与血精灵之间的同盟似乎已彻底破裂。残余成员中有许多人已向沙塔斯投降，而且看他们的意图是真心想要弥补过错、重归德莱尼。你今日做得很好。",cEN="With Kunodo dead, the allegience between the Wrekt tribe and the blood elves seems to have broken down completely. Many of the remaining members have surrendered to Shattrath, and seem to be genuine in their intent to make amends and rejoin the Draenei. You have done well this day."}
Q[354021]={d="泰罗卡森林传来令人不安的消息。沙斯·沃杜恩死后，凯尔萨斯王子派了一位名叫阿莫里昂的新指挥官去监督火翼岗哨的行动。阿莫里昂兼具强大的奥术与邪能魔法，再加上致命的剑术。如果他成功再完成一枚法力炸弹，可能对这片土地构成严重威胁。",dEN="Troubling news from Terokkar Forest. After the demise of Sharth Voldoun, Prince Kael'thas has dispatched a new commander named Amorlion to oversee operations at Firewing Point. Amorlion wields powerful arcane and fel magic in combination with deadly swordsmanship. If he successfully completes another mana bomb, he could pose a grave threat to the land.",o="杀死阿莫里昂指挥官",oEN="Slay Commander Amorlion",c="你战胜阿莫里昂指挥官，打乱了火翼岗哨那些邪恶的行动。指挥官一死，他手下血精灵部队的士气大为低落。阿莫里昂是个可怕的敌人，但你的勇气与英勇赢得了这场战斗。只能指望火翼岗哨的法力炸弹计划就此永远搁置。",cEN="Your triumph over Commander Amorlion has disrupted the sinister operations at Firewing Point. With their commander slain, the morale of his blood elf forces has waned considerably. Amorlion was a formidable foe, but your courage and heroism have carried the day. It can only be hoped that the mana bomb project at Firewing Point has been laid to rest for good."}
Q[354022]={d="斯克提斯周围笼罩着黑暗的低语。一个名叫维克西斯的鸦人收割者——人称夺魂者——正通过亵渎仪式聚敛力量，想借此讨好他那位神秘的女主人——所谓的风之女皇。维克西斯残忍地收割生物的灵魂，用以滋养自己的魔法和风之女皇的野心。他的邪恶不能继续下去！到斯克提斯找出夺魂者，在他害死更多无辜者之前终结他邪恶的收割。",dEN="Dark whispers surround Skettis. An arakkoa reaper known as the Soul-Harvester Veksiss gathers power through profane rituals, seeking to impress his mysterious mistress, the so-called Wind-Empress. Veksiss cruelly reaps the souls of creatures to fuel his magic and the Wind-Empress' ambitions. His evil cannot continue! Seek out the Soul-Harvester at Skettis and end his vile harvesting before more innocent lives are lost.",o="杀死夺魂者维克西斯",oEN="Slay Soul-Harvester Veksiss",c="你今日的行动削弱了斯克提斯的势力。关于这位风之女皇以及她与鸦人之间的联系，疑问依旧存在，但至少她如今少了一个狂信徒。",cEN="Your actions have weakened the forces of Skettis this day. The question of this Wind-Empress, and her connection to the Arakkoa, still remains, but at least she now has one less fanatic."}
Q[354023]={d="奥金顿传来可怕的消息。暗影议会的术士蕾德蕾娅召唤了一个强大的末日守卫沃拉格，来监督闹鬼废墟内的邪能行动。沃拉格残忍地监督着奥金顿灵魂的腐化，把它们扭曲成破碎的暗影，为军团效命。这绝不能继续！潜入奥金顿，找到督工沃拉格，在更多灵魂坠入黑暗之前终结他亵渎的远征。",dEN="Dire news from Auchindoun. The warlock Reldreya of the Shadow Council has summoned a powerful Doomguard named Voralag to oversee fel operations within the haunted ruins. Voralag cruelly oversees the corruption of spirits within Auchindoun, twisting them into broken shades to do the Legion's bidding. This cannot continue! Infiltrate Auchindoun, seek out Overseer Voralag and end his profane crusade before more souls fall into darkness.",o="杀死督工沃拉格",oEN="Slay Overseer Voralag",c="谢谢你，英雄。你战胜恶魔般的沃拉格，把奥金顿的灵魂从腐化的威胁中解救了出来。他那些残忍的阴谋再也无法侵扰这片废墟。虽然暗影议会的余音或许仍在，但你今日赢得了胜利。",cEN="Thank you, hero. Your triumph over the fiendish Voralag has freed the spirits of Auchindoun from the threat of corruption. His cruel machinations will plague the ruins no more. While echoes of the Shadow Council may still linger, you have won a victory this day."}
Q[354024]={d="小心术士蕾德蕾娅，她是暗影议会的执法者。关于她的过去所知甚少，但她那亵渎的力量为黑暗效力得极为出色。蕾德蕾娅引导混乱与烈焰，召唤恶魔执行她邪恶的命令。她已在泰罗卡森林的土地上造成了巨大的苦难，而我们的斥候查明她正待在格兰戈瓦尔村。如果你行动够快，就能趁她还在那里时将她除掉。",dEN="Beware the warlock Reldreya, enforcer of the Shadow Council. Little is known of her past, but her profane power serves darkness well. Reldreya channels chaos and flame, summoning demons to do her vile bidding. She has brought great suffering to the lands of Terokkar Forest already, and our scouts have learned that she is staying at Grangol'var Village. If you act quickly, you can strike her down while she is still there.",o="杀死蕾德蕾娅",oEN="Slay Reldreya",c="谢谢你，勇士！在格兰戈瓦尔村击败阴险的蕾德蕾娅，你把她的阴影从这片土地上抹去了。虽然她那邪恶魔法残留的影响或许还会在这片区域留下伤痕，但你今日赢得了胜利。要不是你及时出手，蕾德蕾娅定会造成巨大的祸患。愿她的死证明：无论阴影多么深重，希望始终存在。",cEN="Thank you, champion! By defeating the sinister Reldreya at Grangol'var Village, you have lifted her shadow from the land. While the lingering influence of her vile magics may still scar the area, you have won a victory this day. Reldreya would have wrought great ruin had you not intervened when you did. Let her demise serve as proof that no matter how deep the shadows, there is always hope."}
Q[354025]={d="要小心那只名叫古克雷尔的异变体，它潜伏在赞加沼泽幽深的泥沼中。古克雷尔虽然原本是纳迦，却已变异成了远比纳迦更恐怖、更强大的东西。寥寥几个瞥见这头野兽又活下来的人说，那东西与其说是纳迦，不如说是怪物。任何能除掉这生物的人，都是为塞纳里奥议会立下大功。",dEN="Beware the aberration called Gurkrel that lurks in the marshy depths of Zangarmarsh. Though a naga in origin, Gurkrel has been mutated into something far more horrific and powerful. The fortunate few who have glimpsed this beast and survived tell of a creature more monster than naga. Any who can strike this creature down would be doing a great service to the Cenarion Circle.",o="杀死古克雷尔",oEN="Slay Gurkrel",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜古克雷尔，今日为赞加沼泽清除了大片腐化。无论是何种邪恶力量使这生物变异并强化，都遭到了沉重的打击。虽然它那违背常理的影响痕迹或许仍留在沼泽里，但你赢得了一场重大的胜利。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over Gurkrel has purged a great corruption from Zangarmarsh today. Whatever vile forces mutated and empowered this creature have been dealt a harsh blow. While signs of its unnatural influence may still linger in the marshes, you have won a significant victory."}
Q[354026]={d="有令人不安的传言提到一个阴险的恶魔猎手塞特西斯，他被派来监督赞加沼泽的纳迦活动。塞特西斯是伊利丹·怒风的狂热追随者，用邪能能量强化纳迦的黑暗魔法仪式与实验。传说在他监督之下，出现了诡异的变异与召唤，给沼泽带来了灾难性的后果。必须在这个伊利达雷特工任由纳迦用无节制的妄改彻底毁掉赞加沼泽脆弱的生态之前阻止他！",dEN="Troubling rumors speak of an insidious demon hunter called Saet'theas that has been sent to oversee naga activity in Zangarmarsh. A fanatical follower of Illidan Stormrage, Saet'theas uses fel energy to empower the naga's dark magic rituals and experiments. Tales tell of strange mutations and conjurings being performed under Saet'theas' supervision, with disastrous consequences for the marsh. This Illidari agent must be stopped before the naga utterly destroy Zangarmarsh's fragile ecosystem with their unchecked tampering!",o="杀死塞特西斯",oEN="Slay Saet’theas",c="你战胜塞特西斯，沉重打击了伊利丹在赞加沼泽的纳迦盟友。失去了这名恶魔监督者，他们那些邪恶的行动将大受限制。要不是你出手干预，塞特西斯本会酿成巨大的苦难。虽然纳迦的阴影仍盘踞此地，但你今日赢得了胜利。",cEN="Your triumph over Saet'theas has dealt a major blow to Illidan's naga allies in Zangarmarsh. With the loss of their demonic overseer, their sinister operations will be curtailed significantly. Saet'theas would have enabled great suffering had you not intervened. While the naga's shadow still lingers here, you have won a victory this day."}
Q[354027]={d="孢子人的传说中提到一种行走在赞加沼泽的生物，他们称之为\"长存之愿\"。据说那是一个从未有人真正见过的存在，因为它会摧毁任何发现它之人的心智，迫使他们代它进行狩猎。\n\n人们一直以为这传说不过是民间故事，但塞纳里奥远征队最近报告说，他们遭到本组织德鲁伊的袭击，而那些德鲁伊的心智似乎一片空白。这次袭击之后，他们请求有人去找出长存之愿——如果它真的存在——并将其摧毁。\n\n孢子人相信这生物常出没于蛇湖以北。",dEN="Sporeling legend calls of a creature that walks Zangarmarsh, which they call \"The Will Prevailing\". A being they claim has never been seen, because it has broken the minds of any who find it and force them to carry out its hunts in its stead.\n\nThe legend had been believed to be nothing more than folklore, but the Cenarion Expedition has recently reported an attack by druids of their own order, their minds seeming vacant. After this attack, they have requested that someone seeks out The Will Prevailing, if it exists, and destroys it.\n\nThe sporelings believe the creature often stalks to the north of Serpent Lake.",o="杀死长存之愿",oEN="Slay The Will Prevailing",c="看来这传说是真的。没有了这个沼泽行者随心所欲地粉碎他人的心智，赞加沼泽会安全得多。我们只能指望传说的后半段——说长存之愿死后能把心智转移到新宿主身上——确实只是无稽之谈。",cEN="So it seems the legend was true. Zangarmarsh will be a much safer place without this marsh walker shattering the minds of those it pleases. We can only hope that the second part of the legend, that the Will Prevailing is capable of transferring its mind to a new host when it dies, is truly a myth."}
Q[354028]={d="赞加沼泽蛮沼村周围流传着令人不安的传言。萨满米尔库什因宣扬极端主张而被流放，如今却回来了，正拉拢支持者企图推翻库鲁提长老。虽说蛮沼氏族算不上友善，至少大体上还安分自守。\n\n米尔库什声称鸟神要求以血献祭，为蛮沼氏族开辟一个新时代。他暴力的言论已经影响了一些族人。绝不能让这种纷争继续扩散！到蛮沼村外围找出米尔库什，不惜一切手段终结他误入歧途的远征，以免把内战与动乱带给这片沼泽。",dEN="Troubling rumors swirl around the Feralfen Village in Zangarmarsh. The shaman Mirkushi was exiled for promoting extremist views, but has returned to build support to overthrow Elder Kuruti. While the Feralfen have not proven friendly, they have mostly been keeping to themselves, at least.\n\nMirkushi claims the avian gods demand blood sacrifice to usher in a new age for the Feralfen. His violent rhetoric has already swayed some tribesmen. This discord cannot be allowed to spread further! Seek out Mirkushi on the outskirts of Feralfen Village and end his misguided crusade by any means necessary before it brings civil war and unrest to the marshes.",o="杀死米尔库什",oEN="Slay Mirkushi",c="我们向你致以最深的谢意，勇士。你战胜叛逆的米尔库什，清除了蛮沼村中狂热的毒害，也保住了库鲁提长老的领导地位。蛮沼氏族或许不是我们族人的朋友，但没有米尔库什煽动他们公开开战，我们就更安全。",cEN="You have our deepest thanks, champion. Your triumph over the traitorous Mirkushi has purged the poison of zealotry from Feralfen Village and protected Elder Kuruti's leadership. The Feralfen may not be friends to our people, but we are safer without Mirkushi driving them to outright warfare."}
Q[354029]={d="霸主高拳死后，一个名叫托拉克的邪恶食人魔蛮兵在安戈罗什部族中崛起掌权。托拉克肌肉发达、野蛮得毫不妥协，靠威吓与恐惧统治。他残暴的突袭已在双塔废墟和沼泽其他地区夺去了许多性命。托拉克无视脆弱的自然平衡，残忍地猎杀野生动物和沼泽居民，以满足自己的嗜血欲望。绝不能让这个暴君获得更大的权势！找到在迷雾湖以南游荡的托拉克，在更多无辜者受害之前终结他对安戈罗什部族的残暴统治。",dEN="A vile ogre barbarian named Torrak has risen to power amongst the Ango'rosh tribe in the wake of Overlord Gorefist's death. Muscle-bound and uncompromisingly savage, Torrak rules through intimidation and fear. His brutal raids have already claimed many lives at Twin Spire Ruins and other parts of the marsh. Ignoring the delicate natural balance, Torrak cruelly hunts wildlife and marsh inhabitants to appease his own bloodlust. This tyrant must not be allowed to gain further power! Seek out Torrak where he roams south of Marshlight Lake and end his cruel reign over the Ango'rosh before more innocents suffer.",o="除掉托拉克",oEN="Slay Torrak",c="谢谢你，勇士！你战胜凶残的托拉克，打断了安戈罗什部族对无谓暴力的渴求。虽然他那股野蛮的余音或许仍在废墟间回荡，但你今日为平衡与正义赢得了一场大胜。要不是你出手干预，托拉克只会带来更多流血与苦难。为你把这片沼泽从他的暴政中解放出来而自豪吧。",cEN="Thank you, champion! Your triumph over the vicious Torrak has broken the Ango'rosh tribe's lust for needless violence. While echoes of his savagery may still linger among the ruins, you have won a great victory for balance and justice this day. Torrak would have brought only further bloodshed and suffering had you not intervened. Take pride in liberating the marshes from his tyranny."}
Q[354030]={d="有可怕的传言提到叛徒阿拉格里沃斯，他原是先知维伦的顾问，几个世纪前背离了圣光。当纳鲁准备逃离阿古斯时，阿拉格里沃斯背叛了自己的人民，转而宣誓效忠燃烧军团。他的欺骗让军团造成了更大的破坏。如今，有人在地狱火半岛目击到阿拉格里沃斯，他正企图以新主人的名义犯下更为骇人的罪行。绝不能让这个叛徒再祸害另一个世界！在阿拉格里沃斯把更多军团部队召唤到外域之前找到他。除掉他将带来迟到已久的正义。",dEN="Dire rumors speak of the traitor Arragrivos, an erstwhile advisor of Prophet Velen who turned from the light ages ago. As the naaru prepared to flee Argus, Arragrivos betrayed his people and swore fealty to the Burning Legion instead. His deceit allowed the Legion to cause even greater destruction. Now, Arragrivos has been spotted in Hellfire Peninsula seeking to commit more heinous acts in his new masters' names. We cannot allow this traitor to harm another world! Seek out Arragrivos before he can summon further Legion forces into Outland. Ending him will deliver long overdue justice.",o="除掉阿拉格里沃斯",oEN="Slay Arragrivos",c="勇士，你战胜狡诈的阿拉格里沃斯，为我们族人昔日的背叛复了仇，也保护了今日的外域。虽然旧伤或许需要时间才能完全愈合，但你今日赢得了一场大胜。",cEN="Champion, your triumph over the devious Arragrivos has avenged our people's past betrayal while protecting Outland today. Though old wounds may take time to fully heal, you have won a great victory this day."}
Q[354031]={d="术士先知马格里尔曾是血环部族中的显赫成员，后来被一个名叫奈瑟库斯的兽人欺骗，遭到本族流放。\n\n他居住在泽斯戈尔外围附近，有报告称马格里尔似乎正打算召唤一支恶魔大军击退艾泽拉斯的军队，以此重获部族的青睐。\n\n虽说很难断定马格里尔能否得逞，但在他成功之前先将其击败，我们大家都会更安全。",dEN="The warlock Magril the Seer used to be a prominent member of the Bleeding Hollow, before he was deceived by an orc called Nethekurse and exiled from his tribe.\n\nResiding near the outskirts of Zeth'gor, reports have come in that Magril seems to be planning to earn back his tribe's favor by summoning an army of demons to drive back the forces of Azeroth.\n\nWhile it's hard to say if Magril can succeed in this plan, we are all safer if he is defeated before he can succeed.",o="除掉先知马格里尔",oEN="Slay Magril the Seer",c="马格里尔为重新赢得血环部族青睐而不顾一切，本可能成为我们所有人的威胁。他一死，在这片残破的土地上，我们至少少了一个危险源头。",cEN="Magril's desperation to earn back the favor of the Bleeding Hollow could have been a threat to us all. With him gone, we have at least one less source of danger in this shattered land."}
Q[354032]={d="瓦兹鲁登被击败后，一名新的龙骑士决心取代他的位置，夺回那些城墙。报告显示他已在路上。\n\n被夺回的城墙目前是一位炼金师的研究场所，他一心想要找到逆转邪能腐化的方法。萨卡里缺乏独自击败戈瓦尔所需的战斗能力。\n\n在地狱火堡垒拦截戈瓦尔，趁他还没抵达她那里就将他击落。",dEN="With the defeat of Vazruden, a new dragonrider has determined to take his place and reclaim the ramparts. Reports suggest he is on his way now.\n\nThe reclaimed ramparts currently serve as a research site for an alchemist intent on finding a way to reverse fel corruption. Sakari lacks the combat prowess to defeat Gorrval on her own.\n\nIntercept Gorrval at Hellfire Citadel and strike him down before he can reach her.",o="除掉天空领主戈瓦尔",oEN="Slay Skylord Gorrval",c="戈瓦尔一死，邪部落失去了一名危险的战士，萨卡里研究治愈邪能腐化的工作也能安全继续下去了。你们做得很好。",cEN="With Gorrval's death, the Fel Horde has been deprived of a dangerous warrior, and Sakari's research into curing fel corruption can continue safely. You have done well."}
Q[354033]={d="泰罗卡森林的哈尔艾什周围流传着令人不安的传言。一个名叫夺魂者阿克莱维尔的鸦人信徒一直在向他那些带翅膀的同胞低语一套新的狂热教义——崇拜所谓的风之女皇。阿克莱维尔的教导已经说服了许多人，他们如今以这位风之女皇的名义举行诡异的仪式和血祭。若放任不管，他的腐化可能吞噬该地区所有鸦人。到哈尔艾什找出阿克莱维尔，在他的阴暗影响进一步扩散之前终结他误入歧途的教派。必须把鸦人从他的黑暗控制中解救出来！",dEN="Troubling rumors surround Haal'esh in Terokkar Forest. An arakkoa cultist called Soul-Harvester Akrevyl has been whispering a fanatical new doctrine to his winged brethren - worship of the so-called Wind-Empress. Akrevyl's teachings have already swayed many, who now engage in strange rituals and blood offerings in this Wind-Empress's name. If left unchecked, his corruption could consume all arakkoa in the region. Seek out Akrevyl in Haal'esh and end his misguided cult before his shadowy influence spreads further. The arakkoa must be freed from his dark control!",o="杀死夺魂者阿克莱维尔",oEN="Slay Soul-Harvester Akrevyl",c="虽然我们离查明风之女皇的身份仍没有更近一步，但随着阿克莱维尔之死，她已在哈尔艾什失去了大部分影响力。谢谢你。",cEN="While we are still no closer to learning the identity of the Wind-Empress, she has lost much of her influence at Haal'esh with Akrevyl's death. Thank you."}
Q[354034]={d="有可怕的传言提到一个名叫努尔阿维斯的审判官恶魔，她是令人畏惧的毁灭领主卡扎克的亲信副官。努尔阿维斯在基尔加丹王座上监督对外域各地生物的审讯与腐化，以壮大燃烧军团的势力。作为一个狡猾的骗子，努尔阿维斯扭曲受害者的心智，把他们变成黑暗的不情愿仆从。绝不能让她继续这邪恶的勾当！潜入王座，在更多灵魂坠入暗影之前终结努尔阿维斯亵渎的远征。",dEN="Dire rumors speak of an inquisitor demon named Nur'Aviis who serves as a trusted lieutenant of the dreaded Doom Lord Kazzak. From the Throne of Kil'jaeden, Nur'Aviis oversees the interrogation and corruption of creatures from across Outland to strengthen the Burning Legion's forces. A cunning liar, Nur'Aviis twists the minds of her victims, turning them into unwilling servants of darkness. She cannot be allowed to continue her vile work! Infiltrate the Throne and end Nur'Aviis' profane crusade before more souls are lost to shadow.",o="杀死审判官努尔阿维斯",oEN="Slay Inquisitor Nur'Aviis",c="勇士，你战胜努尔阿维斯，把她的囚犯从军团狡诈的掌控中解救了出来。虽然有些心智可能留下她狡猾操纵的伤痕，但你今日赢得了一场大胜。努尔阿维斯再也无法折磨、灌输无辜者，让他们为黑暗效力。",cEN="Champion, your triumph over Nur'Aviis has freed her prisoners from the Legion's deceitful grip. While some minds may bear scars from her sly manipulations, you have won a great victory this day. Nur'Aviis shall never again torture and indoctrinate innocents into the service of darkness."}
Q[354035]={d="希恩诺的鸦人一天比一天猖狂。他们的术士编织着邪能魔法，而翼卫和泰隆尼特战士则频繁袭击途经希恩诺帷幕的旅人。必须在这些鸟人的侵略蔓延到泰罗卡森林更广之处前阻止他们。深入希恩诺，杀掉他们的术士、翼卫和狂热的泰隆尼特。让他们倒下者的尸首让鸦人有所收敛，管住他们暴力的挑衅。",dEN="The arakkoa of Shienor grow bolder by the day. Their sorcerers weave fel magics, while wing guards and talonite warriors stage frequent attacks on travelers passing through Veil Shienor. These bird-men must be stopped before their aggression spreads further through Terokkar Forest. Venture to Shienor, slay their sorcerers, their winged guards, and their fanatical talonites. Let the bodies of their slain give the arakkoa pause and curb their violent provocations.",o="杀死希恩诺的术士、翼卫和泰隆尼特",oEN="Slay sorcerers, wing guards and talonites in Shienor",c="你驱散并削弱了希恩诺的势力，至少眼下如此。鸦人已经领教了侵略的代价。虽然他们假以时日或许能重建，但你的行动赢得了一场胜利，也传递了一个明确的讯息——泰罗卡的居民绝不容忍无端袭击。干得好！",cEN="You have scattered and weakened the forces of Shienor, at least for now. The arakkoa have learned the cost of their aggression. While they may rebuild in time, your actions have won a victory and delivered a clear message - Terokkar's residents will not tolerate unprovoked assaults. Well done!"}
Q[354036]={d="最近几周，图雷姆的破碎者变得越来越有攻击性，是萨满库诺多给了他们胆气。\n\n德莱尼虽然希望与失散的兄弟姐妹重聚，可一旦沙塔斯陷落，他们和平的目标就无从谈起。眼下守卫图雷姆废墟的部队，正是库诺多最忠心的追随者之一。\n\n如果能削弱他们的战力，那里的部族或许会不再那么好斗；无论如何，平息他们的袭击都会让沙塔斯更安全。",dEN="The Broken at Tuurem have become increasingly aggressive in recent weeks, emboldened by the shaman Kunodo.\n\nWhile the Draenei hope to reunite with their lost brothers and sisters, their goals of peace will not happen if Shattrath falls. The forces that guard the remains of Tuurem now are among the most loyal to Kunodo.\n\nPerhaps the tribes there will become less aggressive if their combat force is weakened, and in any case, Shattrath will be safer with their assaults quelled.",o="前往图雷姆，削减那里破碎者和失落者的数量",oEN="Go to Tuurem and thin the ranks of the Broken and Lost Ones there",c="他们的队伍被削弱后，我们安全了太多太多。也许他们终有一日能重回圣光，但只要我们与他们的冲突持续下去，他们就不会这么做。",cEN="We are much much safer with their ranks weakened. Perhaps they can come back to the light in time, but they will not do so as long as our conflict with them continues."}
Q[354037]={d="泰罗卡的森林里充斥着富有攻击性的野生动物。凶恶的泰罗蛾、有毒的蜘蛛和野蛮的座狼都会无端袭击旅人。我们不能让这些野兽阻碍整个地区的往来与贸易。深入林中，削减这些动物的数量。杀死泰罗蛾、潜伏者和座狼。减少它们的数量会让泰罗卡的森林更安全。",dEN="he forests of Terokkar seethe with aggressive wildlife. Vicious teromoths, venomous spiders, and savage worgs attack travelers without provocation. We cannot allow these beasts to hamper movement and trade throughout the region. Venture into the woods and thin out the fauna. Slay teromoths, lurkers, and worgs. Reducing their numbers will make Terokkar's forests safer.",o="在泰罗卡森林杀死泰罗蛾、潜伏者、座狼和凶恶的泰罗蛾。",oEN="Slay teromoths, lurkers, worgs and vicious teromoths in Terokkar Forest.",c="泰罗卡的荒野依旧危险，但你的努力暂时降低了威胁。贸易与旅行可以继续，对领地性野兽袭击的恐惧也减轻了。不过，自然的平衡十分脆弱——必须有所克制，才不至于在安全所需之外夺走更多生命。你今日达成了这份平衡。干得好。",cEN="The wilds of Terokkar will remain dangerous, but your efforts have reduced the threat for now. Trade and travel can continue with lessened fear of attacks from territorial fauna. However, the Balance of nature is delicate - restraint must be shown so that we do not destroy more life than necessary for safety. You have achieved that balance this day. Well done."}
Q[354038]={d="图雷姆的破碎者和失落者与圣光隔绝已久。但若能以怜悯相待，他们或许仍有得到救赎的可能。代表我们，把这些德莱尼补给捆送到图雷姆的帐篷里，作为一个希望的姿态。补给中有食物、水、药品，还有一块灌注了圣光的水晶。若能受到善意接纳，这或许就是重建两族信任的第一步。不过要小心行事——未必人人都会欢迎这份礼物。",dEN="The Broken and Lost Ones of Tuurem have long been severed from the Light. But perhaps they may yet find redemption, if shown compassion. Deliver these bundles of Draenei Supplies to the tents in Tuurem as a gesture of hope on our behalf. The supplies contain food, water, medicines, and a Light-imbued crystal. If received warmly, this could be the first step toward restoring trust between our peoples. Tread cautiously though - not all may welcome this gift.",o="在图雷姆交付 5 份德莱尼补给。",oEN="Deliver 5 Draenei Supplies in Tuurem.",c="你的援助物资已经送到，图雷姆的一些人接受了这根橄榄枝。虽然还有大量工作要做，但你打开了一扇此前紧闭的门。如今有了希望：只要持续以理解与怜悯相待，两族之间的裂痕或许能慢慢弥合。耐心与仁慈往往才是通往和平的道路。你今日已在这条路上迈出了第一步。干得好，朋友。",cEN="Your deliveries of aid have been made, and some within Tuurem were receptive to this olive branch. Although much work remains, you have opened a door that was previously closed. There is now hope that the rift between our peoples may slowly be mended with continued understanding and compassion. Patience and mercy are often the path to peace. You have taken the first steps down that path this day. Well done, friend."}
Q[354039]={d="沙塔斯城妮可·巴特莱特保育员所办孤儿院的孩子们这几周过得很沉闷。为了让他们振作起来，妮可想把孤儿院装饰得色彩绚丽。她请你深入泰罗卡森林，从林中游荡的泰罗蛾身上，或是从当地把它用作试剂的鸦人和破碎者身上，收集闪光尘。",dEN="The children of Matron Nicole Barlett's orphanage in Shattrath City have had a dreary couple of weeks. To lift their spirits, Nicole wishes to decorate the orphanage in shimmering colors. She asks that you venture into Terokkar Forest and gather Glitterdust from the Teromoths that roam the forest, or from the Arakkoa and Broken in the area that use the Glitterdust as a regant.",o="在泰罗卡森林为沙塔斯孤儿院的保育员妮可·巴特莱特收集 16 份闪光尘，可取自泰罗蛾，或取自当地把它用作试剂的鸦人与破碎者。",oEN="Gather 16 Glitterdust from Teromoths or from Arakkoa and Broken that use it as a reagent in Terokkar Forest for Matron Nicole Barlett at the Shattrath Orphanage.",c="干得好，英雄！你从泰罗蛾身上收集的闪光尘会让孤儿院闪闪发亮。再次看到孩子们露出笑容，就是一位老保育员所需要的全部回报了。你的善意提醒我们：每一次失去之中，都藏着希望的火花。",cEN="Well done, hero! The Glitterdust you gathered from the Teromoths will make the orphanage shine. Seeing the children smile again is all the reward an old matron could need. Your kindness reminds us that every loss holds the spark of hope."}
Q[354040]={d="英雄，火翼岗哨的火翼血精灵始终是我们在泰罗卡森林盟友的心腹大患。他们的火焰法师向大地倾泻毁灭，血骑士则砍倒一切阻挡者。我恳求你，勇敢的英雄，在更多无辜者受害之前终结他们的暴行。找到火翼营地，杀掉他们的防御者、术士和血卫。只有削减他们的队伍，我们才有望阻止他们的恐怖行动。",dEN="Hero, the Firewing blood elves at Firewing Point are a constant threat to our allies in Terokkar Forest. Their fire mages rain destruction upon the land, while their blood knights cut down all who stand against them. I beseech you, brave hero, put an end to their rampage before more innocents are harmed. Seek out the Firewing encampment and slay their defenders, warlocks, and bloodwarders. Only by thinning their ranks can we hope to stop their campaign of terror.",o="在泰罗卡森林的火翼岗哨杀死火翼精灵。",oEN="Slay Firewing elves at Firewing Point in Terokkar Forest.",c="你今日立下了大功，英雄。火翼精灵因你的行动遭到重创，队伍被削弱，推进也被遏止。多亏了你，泰罗卡森林更安全了，为此我向你致以最深的谢意。",cEN="You have done a great service this day, hero. The Firewing elves have been dealt a grievous blow by your actions, their numbers thinned and their advance halted. Terokkar Forest is a safer place thanks to you, and for that you have my deepest gratitude."}
Q[354041]={d="英雄，碎手废墟的碎手兽人是泰罗卡森林的一场瘟疫。他们扭曲的苦工劫掠大地，碎脊者和毁灭者则碾碎一切挡路者。我请求你，勇敢的英雄，深入那片废墟，削减碎手部族的队伍。了结他们苦工、碎脊者和毁灭者的性命，好让他们的毁灭行动得以遏止。只有你有力量击垮碎手部族！",dEN="Hero, the Bonechewer orcs at the Bonechewer Ruins are a plague upon Terokkar Forest. Their warped peons despoil the land, while their backbreakers and devastators crush all who stand before them. I ask you, brave hero, to venture to the ruins and thinning the Bonechewer ranks. End the lives of their peons, backbreakers, and devastators so that their campaign of destruction might be halted. Only you have the strength to break the Bonechewers!",o="在泰罗卡森林的碎手废墟杀死碎手兽人。",oEN="Slay Bonechewer orcs at Bonechewer Ruins in Terokkar Forest.",c="你今日的表现极为出色，英雄。碎手部族不会很快从你给予的打击中恢复。他们的队伍已被粉碎，推进已被打断——多亏了你，泰罗卡森林将迎来和平。我向你致以最深的谢意。",cEN="You have done outstanding work this day, hero. The Bonechewer clan will not soon recover from the blow you have struck. Their numbers shattered, their advance broken - Terokkar Forest will know peace thanks to you. You have my deepest thanks."}
Q[354042]={d="英雄，泰罗卡森林的顶尖掠食者近来变得过于凶暴。迁跃潜伏者会传送而来伏击旅人，皇家泰罗蛾毫无预警地成群涌出，而头狼则率领狼群恐吓这片土地。我请你深入林中，削减这些凶暴野兽的数量——杀死潜伏者、泰罗蛾和头狼，让荒野恢复平衡。只有你具备战胜这些顶尖掠食者的本领。",dEN="Hero, the apex predators of Terokkar Forest have become overly aggressive as of late. The warp stalkers teleport in to ambush travelers, the royal teromoths swarm without warning, and the alpha worgs lead their packs to terrorize the land. I ask that you venture into the forest and cull these aggressive beasts - slay the stalkers, teromoths, and alpha worgs to restore balance to the wilderness. Only you possess the skill to overcome these apex predators.",o="杀死泰罗卡森林中的凶暴掠食者。",oEN="Slay aggressive predators in Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。杀掉那些凶暴的野兽——迁跃潜伏者、泰罗蛾和头狼——你让泰罗卡森林变得更安全了。多亏你今日的作为，自然的平衡得以恢复。请收下这份报酬，作为我谢意的表示。",cEN="Thank you, hero. By slaying those aggressive beasts - the warp stalkers, teromoths, and alpha worgs - you have made Terokkar Forest a safer place. The balance of nature has been restored thanks to your actions this day. Please take this reward as a token of my gratitude."}
Q[354043]={d="英雄，碎手部族在其废墟中的补给支撑着他们的战争机器。侏儒工程师艾弗莉·齿轮火花慷慨地为我们提供了她最新的炸药技术。我请你带上这些炸药，悄悄安放在碎手部族的补给当中。这样做将重创他们，也有助于我们的事业。你必须迅速而隐蔽，一旦被发现，我们的计划就会落空。等全部安放完毕、你安全离开那片区域后，艾弗莉就准备引爆它们。你准备好承担这项至关重要的任务了吗？",dEN="Hero, the Bonechewer clan's supplies at their ruins empower their war machine. The gnome engineer Efry Cogspark have generously supplied us with her latest in explosives technology. I ask you to take these explosives and plant them stealthily among the Bonechewer supplies. Doing so will critically weaken them and aid our cause. You must be swift and discreet, as discovery would foil our plans. When they're all planted and you are safely out of the area, Efry is prepared to detonate them. Are you up to this vital task?",o="在碎手废墟的碎手补给中安放炸药。",oEN="Plant explosives in Bonechewer supplies at the Bonechewer Ruins.",c="干得极为出色，英雄！爆炸报告显示我们的计划成功了——碎手部族的补给已被摧毁，连同许多使用补给的兽人，他们的行动受到严重妨碍。你今日的作为沉重打击了他们的战争机器。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：你的潜行与机智在我们的斗争中起了实实在在的作用。",cEN="Outstanding work, hero! The detonations report that our plan was a success - the Bonechewer supplies have been eliminated, many of the orcs who use them, critically hampering their operations. Your actions today strike a major blow against their war machine. Please take this reward, and know that your stealth and cunning have made a real difference in our struggle."}
Q[354044]={d="英雄，火翼血精灵用附魔护符来凝聚力量。如果我们能收集到若干这样的护符，我们的盟友相信他们能破译上面的符文，从而掌握火翼魔法的秘密。这些知识能让我们在与他们部队作战时占据优势。请前往火翼岗哨，从死者身上收集护符并带给我，好让我们的盟友解开其中的秘密。这可能让战局转向对我们有利。",dEN="Hero, the Firewing blood elves use enchanted amulets to focus their power. If we could collect a number of these amulets, our allies believe they could decipher the runes to learn Firewing magic secrets. This knowledge could give us an advantage in battling their forces. Please venture to Firewing Point, collect amulets from the fallen, and bring them to me so our allies may unlock their secrets. This could turn the tide in our favor.",o="在泰罗卡森林的火翼岗哨收集火翼护符。",oEN="Collect Firewing Amulets at Firewing Point in Terokkar Forest.",c="你做得极为出色，英雄！我们的盟友证实，他们已从你带回的印戒中破译出强大的魔法知识。这些关于火翼奥术的内幕情报让我们握有对付他们的优势。多亏你的努力，我们如今能更有效地反制并击败他们的魔法。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：你今日沉重打击了我们的敌人！",cEN="You have done excellently, hero! Our allies confirm they have deciphered powerful magical knowledge from the signets you recovered. This inside information into Firewing arcana arms us with an advantage against them. Thanks to your efforts, we can now counter and defeat their magic more effectively. Please take this reward, and know you have struck a great blow against our enemies this day!"}
Q[354045]={d="英雄，帷幕沙拉斯沙拉萨西部族的鸦人已证明自己是凶残的敌人。他们的先知用黑暗魔法对付我们，利爪卫士则砍倒我们最勇敢的士兵。我请你前往帷幕沙拉斯，对这些鸟类生物不必留情——杀掉他们的先知，让他们的诅咒再也无法侵扰我们；除掉他们的利爪卫士，让他们的刀刃再也伤不到别人。你愿意帮我们粉碎沙拉萨西的威胁吗？",dEN="Hero, the arakkoa of the Shalassi tribe at Veil Shalas have proven themselves a vicious foe. Their oracles wield dark magics against us, while their talonguards cut down our bravest soldiers. I ask you to venture to Veil Shalas and show no mercy to these avian creatures - slay their oracles so their curses trouble us no more, and eliminate their talonguards so their blades harm no others. Will you help us break the Shalassi threat?",o="在泰罗卡森林的帷幕沙拉斯杀死沙拉萨西鸦人。",oEN="Slay Shalassi arakkoa at Veil Shalas in Terokkar Forest.",c="你在帷幕沙拉斯行动起了作用，英雄。沙拉萨西的先知和利爪卫士已倒在你的手下，他们的黑暗魔法与刀刃都已失去威胁。我们对鸦人的行动因此更为有力。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：多亏你今日的成就，许多性命得以保全。",cEN="Your actions at Veil Shalas have made a difference, hero. The Shalassi oracles and talonguards lie dead by your hand, their dark magics and blades neutralized. Our campaign against the arakkoa is stronger for it. Please take this reward, and know many lives will be saved thanks to your accomplishment this day."}
Q[354046]={d="英雄，斯克提斯的鸦人一天比一天猖狂。他们的风行者用狂风伏击旅人，翼卫则在天上巡逻。阴暗的泰隆尼特从黑暗中现身袭击，而他们的时光扭曲者甚至把时间之流本身扭曲成武器。只要这些生物还在斯克提斯之外游荡，就没有人是安全的。我请你，勇敢的英雄，深入泰罗卡，削减这些入侵者的数量——杀掉他们，让他们的威胁不再扩散。你愿意帮我们保护森林免受他们的劫掠吗？",dEN="Hero, the arakkoa of Skettis grow bolder by the day. Their windwalkers ambush travelers with gusts of wind, while their wing guards patrol the skies. The shadowy talonites emerge from darkness to attack, and their time-shifters warp the flow of time itself as a weapon. None are safe while these creatures roam beyond Skettis. I ask you, brave hero, to venture into Terokkar and cull these interlopers - slay them so their menace spreads no further. Will you help protect the forest from their predations?",o="在泰罗卡森林杀死斯克提斯的鸦人入侵者。",oEN="Slay Skettis arakkoa interlopers in Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。多亏你的行动，鸦人的威胁已从泰罗卡退去。风行者、翼卫、泰隆尼特和时光扭曲者都已倒在你的手下，森林将重归安宁。感谢你除掉了这些危险的入侵者。请收下这份报酬，作为我谢意的表示。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The arakkoa threat has receded from Terokkar thanks to your actions. With the windwalkers, wing guards, talonites and time-shifters slain by your hand, the forest will know peace once again. You have my gratitude for eliminating these dangerous interlopers. Please take this reward as a token of that gratitude."}
Q[354047]={d="英雄，斯克提斯周边的荒野变得比以往任何时候都危险。凶恶的黑风刃豹潜行于阴影之中，而巨大的卡利鸟盘旋在天空。若放任不管，这些野兽只会愈发肆无忌惮。我请你，勇敢的英雄，深入斯克提斯周边的荒野，削减这些凶暴野兽的数量——杀掉刃豹和卡利鸟，让平衡得以恢复。只有你具备面对这类野兽的本领。",dEN="Hero, the wilds surrounding Skettis have become more dangerous than ever. Vicious blackwind saber cats stalk the shadows, while monstrous kaliri circle the skies above. Left unchecked, these beasts will only become more emboldened. I ask you, brave hero, to venture into the wilds around Skettis and cull these aggressive animals - slay the saber cats and kaliri so that balance is restored. Only you possess the skill to face such beasts.",o="在泰罗卡森林斯克提斯附近杀死黑风刃豹和黑风迁跃追猎者。",oEN="Slay Blackwind Saber Cats and Blackwind Warp Chasers around Skettis in Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。斯克提斯周边的野兽今日被你的手除掉之后，再也无法骚扰旅人了。黑风刃豹和巨大的卡利鸟一死，荒野的平衡便已恢复。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：你的作为让泰罗卡森林更安全了。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The beasts around Skettis will trouble travelers no more after being culled by your hand today. With the blackwind saber cats and monstrous kaliri slain, balance has been restored to the wilds. Please take this reward, and know that your actions have made Terokkar Forest safer."}
Q[354048]={d="英雄，斯克提斯和帷幕沙拉斯的鸦人仍然紧抓着他们失落阿匹西斯帝国的遗物。这些遗物中包括灌注了阿匹西斯能量的古老护符，由他们的祭司和先知佩戴。如果我们能收集到若干这样的护符，我们的盟友相信他们就能利用其中的魔法，以及这个失落已久帝国的秘密。深入鸦人的土地，与他们的爪牙交战，收集这些护符，好让我们解开其中的力量。但要注意——偷取他们的宝物可不会受人待见。",dEN="Hero, the arakkoa of Skettis and Veil Shalas still cling to relics of their lost Apexis empire. Ancient charms imbued with Apexis energies are among these relics, worn by their priests and prophets. If we could gather a number of these charms, our allies believe they could tap into their magic and secrets of this long-lost empire. Venture into araakoa lands, fight their minions, and collect these charms so we may unlock their power. But be warned - stealing their treasures will not be met kindly.",o="从斯克提斯和帷幕沙拉斯的鸦人身上收集古代阿匹西斯护符。",oEN="Collect Ancient Apexis Charms from arakkoa in Skettis and Veil Shalas.",c="你完成得极为出色，英雄！多亏你找回的护符，我们的盟友发掘出了阿匹西斯的古老魔法与知识。这将在未来的战斗中为我们带来宝贵的见识与资源。你勇闯鸦人的要塞、夺走他们的遗物，既打击了他们，也援助了我们的事业。请怀着我最深的谢意收下这份报酬。",cEN="You have succeeded marvelously, hero! Thanks to the charms you recovered, our allies have uncovered ancient Apexis magic and knowledge. This will grant us great insights and assets in the battles ahead. By braving the arakkoa strongholds and claiming their relics, you have struck a blow against them and aided our cause. Please take this reward with my deepest gratitude."}
Q[354049]={d="英雄，斯克提斯各处散布着古老的鸦人神龛，其中留存着他们历史与传说的回响。如果我们能与这些神龛沟通，或许就能得知他们阿匹西斯帝国失落已久的秘密。我们所能了解到的关于他们文化的一切，对研究德拉诺历史的学者们都极具价值。",dEN="Hero, scattered across Skettis are ancient arakkoa shrines that hold echoes of their history and lore. If we can commune with these shrines, we may be able to learn long-lost secrets of their Apexis empire. Anything we can learn of their culture would be of great interest to the scholars studying Draenor's history.",o="使用斯克提斯的鸦人神龛了解他们的历史",oEN="Use arakkoa shrines in Skettis to learn their history",c="你设法发掘出的信息，将为理解鸦人的历史提供宝贵的洞见。谢谢你！",cEN="The information you managed to uncover will give a valuable insight into the Arakkoa's history. Thank you!"}
Q[354050]={d="英雄，白骨荒野的野生动物被扭曲这片土地的能量变得畸形而凶暴。巨大的恐牙寡妇蛛在沙地上潜行，而衰老的裂蹄牛则漫无目的地游荡。若放任不管，它们只会变得更加野蛮。我请你直面这些生物——深入荒野，在它们的数量进一步增长之前杀掉寡妇蛛和裂蹄牛。削减这些野兽的数量，好让这片土地恢复平衡。你愿意接下这项至关重要的任务吗？",dEN="Hero, the wildlife of the Bone Wastes has become twisted and aggressive by the energies that warp this land. Massive dreadfang widows stalk the sands, while decrepit clefthoofs wander erratically. Left unchecked, they will only grow more savage. I ask you to face these creatures - venture into the wastes and slay the widows and clefthoofs before their numbers swell further. Cull these beasts so that balance might be restored to the land. Will you take on this vital task?",o="在泰罗卡森林的白骨荒野杀死恐牙寡妇蛛和衰老的裂蹄牛。",oEN="Slay dreadfang widows and decrepit clefthoofs in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。这些生物今日被你的手除掉之后，白骨荒野再也不会受它们恐吓了。恐牙寡妇蛛和衰老的裂蹄牛一死，这片土地便能开始从它们的野蛮中恢复。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：你的作为带来了改变。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The Bone Wastes will not be terrorized by those creatures any longer after being culled by your hand today. With the dreadfang widows and decrepit clefthoofs slain, the land may begin to heal from their savagery. Please take this reward, and know that your actions have made a difference."}
Q[354051]={d="英雄，有人发现秘社的成员正大批潜入白骨荒野。他们的散兵在试探我们的防线，而他们的禁咒师则在为黑暗仪式输送力量。与此同时，盗墓者正在劫掠墓穴与废墟，搜寻器物。若放任不管，他们的立足点只会不断扩大。我请你深入荒野，粉碎这次入侵——在他们的势力更稳固之前杀掉这些成员。你今日的行动或许能彻底遏止他们在泰罗卡的野心。",dEN="Hero, agents of the Cabal have been spotted infiltrating the Bone Wastes in force. Their skirmishers probe our defenses as their abjurists empower dark rituals. Meanwhile, tomb-raiders plunder crypts and ruins for artifacts. Left unchecked, their foothold will only grow. I ask you to venture into the wastes and crush this incursion - slay their agents before they can establish a stronger presence. Your actions today could halt their ambitions in Terokkar altogether.",o="在泰罗卡森林的白骨荒野杀死秘社成员。",oEN="Slay Cabal agents in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。多亏你的努力，秘社对白骨荒野的入侵已被粉碎。散兵、禁咒师和盗墓者都已伏诛，他们的侵略被挫败了。你把他们逼退，保护了我们的土地。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：这里有许许多多人的性命都要归功于你今日的作为。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The Cabal incursion into the Bone Wastes has been crushed due to your efforts. With their skirmishers, abjurists, and tomb-raiders slain, their invasion has been thwarted. You have turned them back and protected our lands. Please take this reward, and know many here owe their lives to your deeds this day."}
Q[354052]={d="英雄，盘踞白骨荒野的以太人用危险的魔法对付我们。他们的虚空法师把恶魔束缚于自己的意志之下，奥术师则引导混乱的能量。与此同时，劫掠者还在搜刮这片土地的废墟与遗物。我请你深入荒野，消除这些威胁——在虚空法师、奥术师和劫掠者的力量失控增长之前杀掉他们。你今日的行动或许能重创以太人的威胁。",dEN="Hero, the ethereals infesting the Bone Wastes wield dangerous magics against us. Their nethermancers bind demons to their will, while arcanists channel chaotic energies. Meanwhile, plunderers ransack the land's ruins and relics. I ask you to venture into the wastes and nullify these threats - slay the nethermancers, arcanists, and plunderers before their powers grow unchecked. Your actions today could deal a severe blow to the ethereal menace.",o="在泰罗卡森林的白骨荒野杀死以太人。",oEN="Slay ethereals in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。多亏你的努力，白骨荒野的以太人威胁已有所减弱。虚空法师、奥术师和劫掠者都已伏诛，他们邪恶的魔法再也无法侵扰我们。你今日对我们的敌人打出了有力的一击。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：多亏你的作为，许多人能睡得更安稳了。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The ethereal threat in the Bone Wastes has been diminished due to your efforts. With their nethermancers, arcanists, and plunderers slain, their sinister magics will no longer trouble us. You have struck a mighty blow against our foes this day. Please take this reward, and know many will rest easier thanks to your deeds."}
Q[354053]={d="英雄，有沙塔尔成员在虚空蛛脊失踪了。我们相信他们是被那里的蜘蛛抓走的，不过恐牙蜘蛛通常会让受害者在蛛网中活上几天才吃掉他们。如果我们行动够快，也许还能救出失踪的沙塔尔成员。\n\n小心，那些蜘蛛很可能也抓了该地区其他生物当食物，其中有些被放出来时未必会心怀感激。把你在那里找到的蛛网统统割开；这是唯一能确定里面裹着什么的方法。\n\n我们只能指望你找到的是失踪的沙塔尔成员，而不只是我们的敌人。",dEN="Hero, members of the Sha'tar have been lost in Netherweb Ridge. We believe they were taken by the spiders there, but Dreadfang spiders usually leave their victims alive for several days, bound in webs, before eating them. If we act quickly, we may yet be able to free the lost Sha'tar.\n\nBe warned, the spiders will have likely taken food from the other creatures of the area as well, and some may not be as grateful to be free. Cut open any webs you find there, it's the only way to be sure of what has been wrapped within.\n\nWe can only hope you manage to find the lost Sha'tar, and not merely our enemies.",o="在虚空蛛脊解救被困在蛛网中的受害者",oEN="Free Netherweb Victims in Netherweb Ridge",c="你今日立下了大功，英雄。多亏你的英勇，被俘的沙塔尔成员已从束缚中解脱，如今可以回家了。你不仅救了他们，还打击了正在蔓延的黑暗。愿这份报酬带给你慰藉——请记住，有许多性命因你的作为而改变。",cEN="You have performed a great service this day, hero. Thanks to your heroism, the captive Sha'tar have been freed from their bonds and can now return home. Not only did you save them, you struck a blow against the spreading darkness. May your reward bring you comfort, knowing many lives were touched by your deeds."}
Q[354054]={d="英雄，把白骨荒野扭曲成如此腐化之地的那些能量，也可以用于正途。以太人和秘社体内都携带着浓缩能量的碎片。抽取并收集这些以太火花和暗影精华，能让我们的盟友研究它们，或许还能想出办法用它们的魔法反过来对付其主人。深入荒野，与这些黑暗势力交战，收集它们的精华，好让我们把他们的力量变成对付他们的武器。",dEN="Hero, the energies that twist the Bone Wastes into such a corrupted land can be harnessed for good. Ethereals and Cabal alike carry shards of concentrated energy within them. Extracting and collecting these Ethereal Sparks and Shadowy Essences will allow our allies to study them, and perhaps devise ways to use their magic against its masters. Venture into the wastes, fight these dark forces, and gather their essence so that we may turn their powers against them.",o="在泰罗卡森林的白骨荒野收集以太火花和暗影精华。",oEN="Collect Ethereal Sparks and Shadowy Essence in the Bone Wastes of Terokkar Forest.",c="做得太精彩了，英雄！我们的盟友已经开始研究你收集的能量，探究它们能如何加以利用。假以时日，我们或许能找出办法，把它们的魔法引向它们的主人。你今日的作为巧妙地把敌人的长处变成了圣光的武器，打出了漂亮的一击。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：我们的斗争如今多了一份新的希望。",cEN="Marvelously done, hero! Our allies are already studying the energies you gathered, learning how they may be used. In time, we may decipher ways to channel their magic against its masters. Your actions today strike a cunning blow by turning our enemies' strengths into a weapon for the light. Please take this reward, and know our fight now carries new hope."}
Q[354055]={d="英雄，暗影议会在格兰戈瓦尔村的活动一天比一天猖狂。他们的暗影刽子手肆无忌惮地清除敌人，召唤师则把恶魔束缚于自己的意志之下。与此同时，猎手潜伏在黑暗中，除掉任何胆敢对抗议会的人。我请你前往格兰戈瓦尔，瓦解他们的行动——杀掉他们的成员，让那些邪恶的阴谋被打断。你今日的行动或许能重创暗影议会。",dEN="Hero, the Shadow Council's activities at Grangol'var Village grow bolder by the day. Their shadowy executioners eliminate enemies with impunity, while summoners bind demons to their will. Meanwhile, hunters stalk the darkness eliminating any who would oppose the Council. I ask you to venture to Grangol'var and dismantle their operations - slay their agents so their sinister machinations are disrupted. Your actions today could deal a severe blow to the Shadow Council.",o="在泰罗卡森林格兰戈瓦尔村杀死暗影议会成员。",oEN="Slay Shadow Council agents in Grangol'var Village in Terokkar Forest.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354056]={d="英雄，被称作斯基席安人的鸦人部族从斯基席斯帷幕发动的袭击已越来越凶猛。他们的恐鹰从上方伏击，撕风者则以远程攻击点杀目标。若放任不管，他们只会愈发猖狂。我请你压制这些鸦人——前往斯基席斯帷幕，在他们的攻势进一步升级之前杀掉他们的恐鹰和撕风者。你今日的行动或许能重创斯基席安人的势力。",dEN="Hero, the arakkoa tribe known as the Skithians have become increasingly aggressive in their attacks from Veil Skith. Their dreadhawks ambush from above while windrippers pick off targets with ranged attacks. If left unchecked, they will only grow bolder. I ask you to pin down these arakkoa - venture to Veil Skith and slay their dreadhawks and windrippers before their assaults escalate further. Your actions today could deal a severe blow to the Skithian forces.",o="在泰罗卡森林的斯基席斯帷幕杀死斯基席安鸦人。",oEN="Slay Skithian arakkoa at Veil Skith in Terokkar Forest.",c="谢谢你，英雄。多亏你今日的努力，斯基席斯帷幕的斯基席安威胁已大为减弱。恐鹰和撕风者被大量消灭，他们的攻势将会削弱。你对我们的敌人取得了一场重要的胜利，许多性命将因你的作为而得救。请收下这份报酬，作为我谢意的表示。",cEN="Thank you, hero. The Skithian threat at Veil Skith has diminished significantly thanks to your efforts today. With their dreadhawks and windrippers culled, their assaults will be weakened. You have secured an important victory against our foes, and many lives will be saved by your deeds. Please take this reward as a token of gratitude."}
Q[354057]={d="英雄，被称作戈杜尼的食人魔部族正从屏障岭出动，企图碾碎一路上的所有东西。高大的碎颅者用残忍的斧头散播死亡，碎脊者则似乎对痛苦完全免疫。致命的元素师用毁灭性的魔法轰击敌人。我恳求你，勇敢的英雄，深入群山，击倒这些庞然大物——杀掉他们的战士，在更多人受害之前遏止他们的毁灭行动。",dEN="Hero, the ogre clan known as the Gordunni are on the march from the Barrier Hills, seeking to crush all in their path. The towering head-splitters deal death with cruel axes, while the back-breakers seem impervious to pain. Deadly elementalists blast foes with destructive magic. I beseech you, brave hero, to venture to the hills and bring down these behemoths - slay their warriors so their campaign of destruction is halted before more suffer.",o="在泰罗卡森林的屏障岭杀死戈杜尼食人魔。",oEN="Slay Gordunni ogres in the Barrier Hills of Terokkar Forest.",c="你在屏障岭的行动起了作用，英雄。戈杜尼的威胁已经退去，他们的数量被你的手大幅削减。碎颅者、碎脊者和元素师都已伏诛，他们凶残的攻势将在一段时间内被削弱。你今日赢得了一场重要的胜利。请收下这份报酬，并请记住：许多无辜者都欠你一条命。",cEN="Your actions in the Barrier Hills have made a difference, hero. The Gordunni threat has receded, their numbers culled by your hand. With their head-splitters, back-breakers, and elementalists slain, their vicious attacks will be weakened for a time. You have won an important victory this day. Please take this reward, and know many innocents owe their lives to you."}
Q[354058]={d="英雄，关于一个名叫塞特的死神的黑暗低语仍在流传，斯基席斯帷幕的鸦人依然崇拜着他。虽然他处于沉眠状态，扭曲的崇拜者却以他的名义施行污秽魔法。如果我们能弄到他们的典籍，或许就能获得对付这个邪恶教派的情报。我需要你前往斯基席斯帷幕，收集你能找到的任何塞泰克典籍。把它们带给我，好让我们的盟友在它们落入错误之手以前解开其中的秘密。知识能抵御邪恶。只要理解塞特，我们就能阻止他复活。",dEN="Hero, dark whispers persist of a dead god named Sethe who is still worshipped by the Arakkoa of Veil Skith. Though dormant, twisted worshipers work foul magic in his name. If we could obtain their tomes, insight may be gained to combat this sinister cult. I need you to venture into Veil Skith and collect any Sethekk tomes you find. Bring them to me so our allies can unlock their secrets, before they fall into the wrong hands. Knowledge guards against evil. If we understand Sethe, we can prevent his resurrection.",o="深入斯基席斯帷幕，收集你能找到的所有塞特典籍。",oEN="Venture into Veil Skith and collect any Tomes of Sethe you can find.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354059]={d="英雄，屏障岭的食人魔仍然紧抓着他们悬槌祖先的遗物。刻有古代悬槌符文的石板常常装饰在他们简陋的营地与建筑上。如果我们能收集到若干这样的石板，我们的盟友相信他们就能翻译上面的铭文，发掘出悬槌失落已久的魔法知识。深入群山，与戈杜尼食人魔交战，夺回这些遗物，好让其中的秘密能为善而非为恶所用。",dEN="Hero, the ogres of the Barrier Hills still cling to relics of their Highmaul ancestors. Tablets engraved with ancient Highmaul runes often adorn their crude camps and structures. If we could gather a number of these tablets, our allies believe they could translate their inscriptions and uncover lost magical knowledge of the Highmaul. Venture into the hills, fight the Gordunni ogres, and reclaim these relics so their secrets may be unlocked for good, rather than evil.",o="从泰罗卡森林屏障岭的食人魔身上收集悬槌石板，并从斯基席斯帷幕的鸦人身上收集阿匹西斯石板。",oEN="Collect Highmaul Tablets from ogres in the Barrier Hills of Terokkar Forest and Apexis Tablets from Arakkoa in Veil Skith",c="做得太精彩了，英雄！多亏你找回的石板，我们的盟友已成功翻译出悬槌的古代知识。这将为我们带来关于食人魔魔法与历史的宝贵洞见。你勇闯戈杜尼部族、夺走他们的遗物，既推进了我们的事业，也打击了那些残暴的敌人。请怀着我的谢意收下这份报酬。",cEN="Marvelously done, hero! Thanks to the tablets you recovered, our allies have succeeded in translating ancient Highmaul knowledge. This will grant us valuable insights into ogre magic and history. By braving the Gordunni and claiming their relics, you have advanced our cause and struck a blow against our brutish foes. Please take this reward with my gratitude."}
Q[354060]={d="英雄，暗泽湖周边的野生动物变得越来越凶暴、越来越危险。巨大的沼泽潜伏者从泥沼中伏击旅人，而疏浚者则在破坏脆弱的生态系统。若放任不管，它们终将占据整个地区。我请你削减这些凶暴生物的数量——深入沼泽，在潜伏者和疏浚者的数量失控之前杀掉它们。在为时已晚之前，让赞加沼泽重归平衡。",dEN="Hero, the wildlife around Umbrafen Lake has become increasingly aggressive and dangerous. Massive marsh lurkers ambush travelers from the swamp, while dredgers destroy the fragile ecosystems. If left unchecked, they will overwhelm the region. I ask you to cull these aggressive creatures - venture into the marshlands and slay the lurkers and dredgers before their numbers grow out of control. Bring balance back to Zangarmarsh before it is too late.",o="杀死赞加沼泽暗泽湖周围的沼泽潜伏者和疏浚者。",oEN="Slay marsh lurkers and dredgers around Umbrafen Lake in Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354061]={d="英雄，暗泽村的邪恶纳迦又在图谋不轨了。有人目击到暗泽的先知、巫医和预言者正在举行黑暗仪式，向他们的蛇类主人献祭。这些仪式正在扰乱沼泽脆弱的平衡，也危及我们在赞加沼泽的盟友。我需要你前往暗泽，杀掉他们的仪式师，终结他们的黑暗魔法。",dEN="Hero, the vile naga of Umbrafen Village are up to no good once again. The Umbrafen oracles, witchdoctors, and seers have been spotted performing dark rituals and making offerings to their serpentine masters. These rituals are disrupting the delicate balance of the marshlands and putting our allies in Zangarmarsh at risk. I need you to venture to Umbrafen and put an end to their dark magic by slaying their ritualists.",o="杀掉暗泽纳迦的仪式师，打断他们的仪式。",oEN="Disrupt the rituals of the Umbrafen naga by slaying their ritualists.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354062]={d="英雄，暗冠海岸的纳迦变得愈发大胆，已在赞加沼泽扩大行动。暗冠的女巫、奴隶贩子和哨兵一直在袭击我们的前哨，并掳走俘虏，用于他们邪恶仪式的献祭。我们必须在其占据更多地盘之前遏止他们的侵略。我需要你前往暗冠海岸，除掉他们的仪式师——杀掉参与这些亵渎行径的女巫、奴隶贩子和哨兵。打断他们的黑暗魔法，让幸存的纳迦狼狈逃回深渊！",dEN="Hero, the naga of Darkcrest Shore have become emboldened and expanded their operations in Zangarmarsh. The Darkcrest sorceresses, slavers, and sentries have been raiding our outposts and taking captives to sacrifice in their vile rituals. We must put a stop to their aggression before they gain more ground. I need you to venture to Darkcrest Shore and eliminate their ritualists - slay the sorceresses, slavers, and sentries engaged in these profane acts. Disrupt their dark magics and send the surviving naga scrambling back to the depths!",o="杀掉暗冠纳迦的仪式师，打断他们的仪式。",oEN="Disrupt the Darkcrest naga rituals by slaying their ritualists.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354063]={d="英雄，我们在沙塔斯的盟友需要武器来武装士兵，以迎击军团即将发动的攻势。我有一项任务能帮他们解决补给。我们的斥候报告说，纳迦和暗泽的失落者都在赞加沼泽囤积武器。我需要你潜入他们的前哨，没收这些武器——收集你能找到的所有纳迦武器，以及暗泽部族的武器。把你收集到的所有武器带给我，好让我们把它们送到沙塔斯，为即将到来的战斗充实盟友的实力。",dEN="Hero, our allies in Shattrath need weapons to arm their soldiers against the coming Legion offensive. I have a task that will help supply them. Our scouts report that both the naga and the Lost Ones of Umbrafen have been amassing stockpiles of weapons in Zangarmarsh. I need you to infiltrate their outposts and confiscate these weapons - gather up any naga weapons you can find, as well as weapons from the Umbrafen tribe. Bring me all the weapons you collect so we can deliver them to Shattrath and bolster our allies for the battle ahead.",o="从纳迦和暗泽的前哨没收武器，用来武装沙塔斯的士兵。",oEN="Confiscate weapons from the naga and Umbrafen outposts to arm Shattrath's soldiers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354064]={d="一位名叫米尔辛斯的女士需要一种只能在赞加沼泽找到的特殊材料——生长在暗泽湖附近沼泽里的瞬息菇。这种蘑菇具有独特的魔法特性，能帮助为一道仪式提供力量，用以加固沙塔斯周围的防护。请深入沼泽，尽可能多地采集瞬息菇。我们族人的安全就取决于这道仪式能否成功完成。",dEN="A woman by the name of Mirsinth requires a special ingredient that can only be found in Zangarmarsh - ephemeral mushrooms that grow in the marshes near Umbrafen Lake. These mushrooms have unique magical properties that will help power a ritual to reinforce the protections around Shattrath. Please venture to the marshes and gather as many ephemeral mushrooms as you can find. The safety of our people depends on the successful completion of this ritual.",o="在赞加沼泽暗泽湖附近的沼泽中采集瞬息菇。",oEN="Gather Ephemeral Mushrooms from the marshes near Umbrafen Lake in Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354065]={d="勇士，赞加沼泽的死亡泥沼中正上演一场悲剧。昔日战斗残留的邪能魔法变异并腐化了当地的野生动物，把它们变成了可怕的枯萎异变体。巨人、多头蛇和泥沼之王在泥沼中游荡，被自己腐烂的形态逼得发狂。这些可怜的生灵如今已无可挽救，还对整个地区构成威胁。我需要你深入死亡泥沼，让那些变异生物解脱痛苦。在它们把腐化扩散得更远之前，杀掉枯萎巨人、泥沼之王和多头蛇。这是件残酷的差事，却是恢复平衡所必需的。我知道你会怀着怜悯去做。",dEN="Champion, a tragedy is unfolding in the Dead Mire of Zangarmarsh. The lingering fel magics from past battles have mutated and corrupted the local wildlife into horrible withered abominations. Giants, hydras, and bog lords wander the mire, driven mad by their decaying forms. These poor creatures are beyond saving now, and pose a threat to the entire region. I need you to venture into the Dead Mire and put the mutated creatures out of their misery. Slay the withered giants, bog lords, and hydras before they can spread their corruption further. This is a grim task, but necessary to restore balance. I know you will handle it with compassion.",o="杀死死亡泥沼中的枯萎生物，让它们解脱痛苦。",oEN="Slay the withered creatures in the Dead Mire and put them out of their misery.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354066]={d="英雄，暗冠营地的邪恶纳迦对赞加沼泽的袭击越来越凶猛。暗冠的海妖和监工一直在袭击我们的前哨，并掳走俘虏去从事沼泽的采掘劳作。我们必须迅速行动，在他们占据更多地盘之前终结这场猛攻。我需要我们最强大的勇士前往暗冠营地，终结这些肮脏的侵袭。杀掉领头发动攻击的暗冠海妖和监工，其余的就会灰溜溜地退回深渊。只有你具备终结他们侵略、恢复和平的力量。赞加沼泽就指望你了！",dEN="Hero, the vile naga of Darkcrest Enclave have become increasingly aggressive in their attacks against Zangarmarsh. Darkcrest sirens and taskmasters have been raiding our outposts and taking captives to work on harvesting the swamp. We must act quickly to end their onslaught before they gain more ground. I need our mightiest champion to venture to Darkcrest Enclave and put an end to these foul raids. Slay the Darkcrest sirens and taskmasters leading these attacks, and the rest will slither back into the depths in defeat. Only you possess the strength to end their aggression and restore peace. Zangarmarsh is depending on you!",o="杀掉赞加沼泽中暗冠纳迦的突袭队，终结他们的袭击。",oEN="End the Darkcrest naga attacks by slaying their raiding parties in Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354067]={d="勇士，赞加沼泽的水道已被危险的野生动物侵占，威胁着整个地区的贸易与往来。暗冠营地附近的潟湖里密密麻麻都是凶猛的鳗鱼、潟湖漫步者和多头蛇，任何胆敢经过的人都会遭到攻击。我需要我们最强大的英雄深入潟湖，在这些入侵物种彻底占据水道之前削减它们的数量。杀掉鳗鱼、漫步者和多头蛇，让安全的旅行与贸易得以恢复。赞加沼泽的人们就指望你来恢复潟湖的安全。",dEN="Champion, the waterways of Zangarmarsh have become overrun with dangerous wildlife that threatens trade and travel through the region. The lagoon near Darkcrest Enclave is swarming with aggressive eels, lagoon walkers, and hydras that attack anyone who dares pass through. I need our mightiest hero to venture into the lagoon and cull these invasive species before they completely take over the waterways. Slay the eels, walkers, and hydras so that safe travel and trade can resume once more. The people of Zangarmarsh are depending on you to restore safety to the lagoon.",o="消灭侵占潟湖的野生动物",oEN="Cull the wildlife overrunning the Lagoon",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354068]={d="一位名叫米尔辛斯的女士对赞加沼泽多种蘑菇的特性感到好奇，她悬赏给任何愿意触摸该地区那些奇怪蘑菇并回报其效果的人。她比较肯定其中没有一种碰到就会致命，并表示若有人证实并非如此，她愿意亲自把对方复活。",dEN="A woman named Mirsinth it curious about the properties of various mushrooms in Zangarmash, and is offering a reward to anyone willing to touch strange mushrooms in the area and report back on their effects. She is relatively certain none of them are lethal to touch, and is offering to personally resurrect anyone who learns otherwise.",o="触摸奇怪的蘑菇",oEN="Touch Strange Mushrooms",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354069]={d="英雄，我正在研究赞加沼泽的野生动物，以更好地理解沼泽生态系统中那份微妙的平衡。为了完成研究，我需要健康生物以及感染了在该地区蔓延的枯萎病的生物的样本。请从赞加沼泽的健康野生动物和枯萎生物身上采集组织样本。你收集的样本将提供宝贵的洞见，或许能帮助恢复沼泽的生机。你今日的努力将对保护这独特的环境产生长远影响。赞加沼泽将因你的贡献而繁荣！",dEN="Hero, I am studying the wildlife of Zangarmarsh to better understand the delicate balance of the marsh ecosystems. To complete my research, I require samples from healthy creatures and those affected by the withering disease spreading through the region. Please harvest tissue samples from healthy wildlife and withered creatures in Zangarmarsh. The samples you collect will provide invaluable insight that could help restore vitality to the marsh. Your efforts today will have lasting impacts on preserving this unique environment. Zangarmarsh will thrive thanks to your contribution!",o="在赞加沼泽从健康与枯萎的生物身上采集野生动物样本。",oEN="Harvest wildlife samples from healthy and withered creatures in Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354070]={d="勇士，血鳞部族的邪恶纳迦已在赞加沼泽建起一座要塞，威胁着该地区的稳定。监工和唤潮者从血鳞领地指挥对我们的盟友发动的袭击。我需要我们最强大的英雄潜入血鳞领地，从内部瓦解他们的势力。杀掉他们的监工和唤潮者，打断他们的指挥链。失去领导，残余的血鳞纳迦别无选择，只能撤退。打破他们对沼泽的控制，好让平衡得以恢复。赞加沼泽就指望你了，英雄！",dEN="Champion, the vile naga of the Bloodscale tribe have established a stronghold in Zangarmarsh, threatening the stability of the region. From the Bloodscale Grounds, overseers and wavecallers direct raids against our allies. I need our mightiest hero to infiltrate the Bloodscale Grounds and dismantle their forces from within. Slay their overseers and wavecallers to disrupt their chain of command. Without leadership, the remaining Bloodscales will have no choice but to retreat. Break their grip on the marsh so that balance can be restored. Zangarmarsh is depending on you, hero!",o="在血鳞领地杀掉血鳞纳迦的首领，瓦解他们的势力。",oEN="Dismantle the Bloodscale naga forces by slaying their leaders at Bloodscale Grounds.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354071]={d="英雄，安戈罗什部族的食人魔对赞加沼泽的袭击越来越凶猛。他们从劈石沼泽的前哨出动萨满和战士，袭击我们的聚居地，扰乱贸易路线。我需要你前往劈石沼泽，终结安戈罗什的威胁。杀掉他们的萨满以打断其魔法，除掉他们的战士以打垮其战力。部族一垮，残余的食人魔就会撤退。只有你具备把他们逼退、恢复赞加沼泽稳定的力量。",dEN="Hero, the ogres of the Ango'rosh clan have become increasingly aggressive in their attacks on Zangarmarsh. From their outpost at Hewn Bog, their shamans and warriors have been raiding our settlements and disrupting trade routes. I need you to venture to Hewn Bog and put an end to the Ango'rosh threat. Slay their shamans to disrupt their magics, and eliminate their warriors to break their fighting force. With their clan crushed, the remaining ogres will retreat. Only you possess the strength to drive them back and restore stability to Zangarmarsh.",o="在劈石沼泽杀掉安戈罗什食人魔的萨满和战士，削弱他们。",oEN="Cripple the Ango'rosh ogres by slaying their shamans and warriors at Hewn Bog.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354072]={d="勇士，蛇湖的野生动物已失衡到危险的地步。狂乱的泥鳍鱼和躁动的沼泽爪蟹毫无节制地繁衍，扰乱了生态系统。我需要一位擅长沼泽潜水的专家深入蛇湖湖底，在这些入侵物种压垮沼泽脆弱的栖息地之前削减它们的数量。杀掉狂乱的泥鳍鱼和躁动的沼泽爪蟹，好让自然的平衡得以恢复。",dEN="Champion, the wildlife in Serpent Lake has become dangerously out of balance. Mudfin frenzies and fenclaw thrashers proliferate unchecked, disrupting the ecosystem. I need an expert marsh diver to delve into the depths of Serpent Lake and cull these invasive species before they overwhelm the delicate marsh habitats. Slay the frenzied mudfins and thrashing fenclaws so that natural balance can be restored.",o="潜入蛇湖，消灭狂乱的泥鳍鱼和躁动的沼泽爪蟹。",oEN="Dive into Serpent Lake and cull the frenzied mudfins and thrashing fenclaws.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354073]={d="英雄，有人报告赞加沼泽蛇湖附近出现了奇怪的闪烁光芒。这些光的来源仍然不明，但它们似乎有意把我们引向某处，或者也许是引向某样东西。我需要你在事态进一步恶化之前调查这些目击事件。在蛇湖附近搜寻任何可能是这些闪烁光芒来源的东西，看看你能否查明它们的来源与目的。",dEN="Hero, strange flickering lights have been reported near Serpent Lake in Zangarmarsh. The origins of these lights remain unknown, but they seem intent on leading is somewhere, or perhaps, to something. I need you to investigate these sightings before the situation escalates further. Search the area near Serpent Lake for any sources of the flickering lights and see if you can discover their origin and purpose.",o="在赞加沼泽蛇湖附近调查那些神秘的闪烁光芒。",oEN="Investigate the mysterious flickering lights near Serpent Lake in Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354074]={d="下城的食物补给日益短缺。虽然外域有些地方食物匮乏，但赞加沼泽的泥鳍鱼却十分丰富——它们虽然危险，捕上来却是像样的一餐。\n\n如果你能收集泥鳍鱼，那可就帮了大忙。蛇湖里数量众多，不过该地区的纳迦和食人魔似乎也把它们当作食物来源，身上可能带着一些。",dEN="Food supplies in the Lower City are running low. While food is scarce in some parts of Outland, there is an abundance of Mudfins in Zangarmarsh which, while dangerous, serve as a decent meal if caught.\n\nYou would doing a great service if you were to gather the Mudfins. They are abundant in Serpent Lake, though the naga and ogres in the area seem to use them as a food source as well, and may be carrying some.",o="收集泥鳍鱼",oEN="Collect Mudfins",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354075]={d="英雄，我们在产卵谷的孢子人盟友正遭到沼泽巨人的攻击！疯狂的泥沼之王、真菌巨人和其他野兽凭借数量优势，眼看就要压垮孢子人的防线。我需要你前往产卵谷，保护孢子人免受这些入侵掠食者的侵害。杀掉侵入孢子人领地的饥饿泥沼之王和真菌巨人。你的力量是他们生存的唯一希望！请伸出援手，好让赞加沼泽恢复平衡。",dEN="Hero, our sporeling allies in The Spawning Glen are under attack by bog giants! Crazed bog lords, fungal giants, and other beasts threaten to overwhelm the sporelings' defenses through sheer numbers. I need you to travel to The Spawning Glen and defend the sporelings from these invasive predators. Slay the starving bog lords and fungal giants encroaching on sporeling territory. Your might is their only hope for survival! Please lend your strength so that balance can be restored to Zangarmarsh.",o="保护产卵谷的孢子人免受入侵掠食者的侵害。",oEN="Defend the sporelings of The Spawning Glen from invading predators.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354076]={d="勇士，血鳞部族的邪恶纳迦已在血鳞营地建起要塞，以此为基地劫掠并奴役赞加沼泽的各族。我们获悉，他们的劫掠队大多由血鳞女巫带领，监奴者则管束着他们的雷克奴隶。我需要你潜入血鳞营地，从内部摧毁他们的劫掠力量。杀掉他们的女巫以打断其魔法，除掉监奴者以解救俘虏。打破血鳞纳迦的掌控，好让赞加沼泽重获安宁。",dEN="Champion, the vile Bloodscale naga have established a stronghold at Bloodscale Enclave, using it as a base to raid and enslave the peoples of Zangarmarsh. We have learned that much of their raiding parties are led by Bloodscale enchantresses, with slavedrivers keeping their Wrekt slaves in line. I need you to infiltrate Bloodscale Enclave and decimate their raiding strength from within. Slay their enchantresses to disrupt their magic, and eliminate the slavedrivers to free their captives. Break the grip of the Bloodscales so Zangarmarsh may know peace once more.",o="潜入血鳞营地，摧毁血鳞纳迦的力量。",oEN="Infiltrate Bloodscale Enclave and break the strength of the Bloodscale naga.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354077]={d="英雄，蛮沼村的失落者已经失去平衡，如今威胁着赞加沼泽的稳定。他们的德鲁伊、猎手和秘法师已开始袭击我们在沼泽各处的盟友。我需要你前往蛮沼，在更多无辜者丧命之前消除这一威胁。杀掉他们被强化的德鲁伊、娴熟的猎手和神秘的萨满。打垮蛮沼人的力量，好让平衡得以恢复。虽然他们已无可救药，我还是请你在执行任务时怀有怜悯。为了赞加沼泽的利益，做必须做的事。我相信你能办到。",dEN="Hero, the Lost Ones of Feralfen Village have become unbalanced and now threaten the stability of Zangarmarsh. Their druids, hunters, and mystics have begun attacking our allies throughout the marsh. I need you to travel to Feralfen and eliminate the threat before more innocent lives are lost. Slay their empowered druids, skilled hunters, and mystical shaman. Break the strength of the Feralfen so balance can be restored. Though they are beyond redemption, I ask that you show mercy in your task. Do what must be done for the good of Zangarmarsh. I have faith you will succeed.",o="前往蛮沼村，消除其被强化的居民所带来的威胁。",oEN="Travel to Feralfen Village and eliminate the threat posed by its empowered residents.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354078]={d="英雄，我们在斯波加尔的盟友在为赞加沼泽平衡而进行的长期斗争中损失惨重。许多孢子人负伤倒地，村庄也遭到破坏。我需要一个像你这样富有同情心的人，去照料沼泽各处受伤的孢子人。治愈你能找到的伤者，尽可能地施以援手。这任务看似微不足道，但正是这样的仁慈之举，常常把局势推向希望。孢子人的文化就仰赖于你这样的英雄。请尽力保全斯波加尔的族人。",dEN="Hero, our allies in Sporeggar have suffered great losses in the ongoing struggle for balance in Zangarmarsh. Many sporelings lie wounded, their villages damaged. I need someone with your compassion to tend to the injured sporelings throughout the marsh. Heal those you can find and administer what aid you are able. Though the task may seem small, it is acts of mercy such as these that often turn the tide toward hope. The sporelings' culture depends on heroes like you. Please do what you can to preserve the sporeggar.",o="治疗受伤的孢子人。",oEN="Heal wounded sporelings.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354079]={d="德莱尼已经开始向破碎者学习萨满之道，但他们中许多人尚属新手，还没学会制作自己的图腾。我们没有能力为所有有志成为萨满的德莱尼制作图腾；不过，赞加沼泽的纳迦和失落者都通晓萨满之术。那些图腾虽是我们的敌人所造，却可以有更好的用途。",dEN="The draenei have begun to learn the arts of shamanism from the Broken, but many of them are still new to the practice, and have not yet learned to craft their own totems. We do not have the means to produce totems for all of the aspiring Draenei shamans, however the Naga and Lost Ones in Zangarmarsh both practice the art of shamanism. Though created by our enemies, their totems could be put to better use.",o="从失落者和纳迦身上收集附魔图腾",oEN="Collect Enchanted Totems from Lost Ones and Naga",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354080]={d="英雄，一片浓重的黑暗笼罩了匕首沼泽村，把村民逼至疯狂。匕首沼泽的泥沼居民和刺客变得残忍嗜血，袭击任何靠近他们那座被诅咒村庄的人。我请你前往匕首沼泽，在更多无辜者丧命之前消除这一威胁。杀掉泥沼居民和刺客，好让沼泽的平衡得以恢复。这是件残酷的差事，但匕首沼泽的居民已无可挽救。",dEN="Hero, a great darkness has settled over Daggerfen Village, driving its inhabitants to madness. The Daggerfen muckdwellers and assassins have become ruthless and bloodthirsty, attacking any who near their accursed village. I ask you to travel to Daggerfen and eliminate this threat before more innocents meet their end. Slay the muckdwellers and assassins so that balance may be restored to the marsh. It is a grim task, but the Daggerfen are beyond saving now.",o="杀死匕首沼泽村的失落者",oEN="Slay Lost Ones at Daggerfen Village",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354081]={d="勇士，安戈罗什部族的食人魔建起了一座要塞，威胁着赞加沼泽的稳定。他们从安戈罗什要塞发动残暴的袭击，攻击我们的盟友。我需要你潜入要塞，从内部瓦解安戈罗什的势力。杀掉他们的噬魂者以打断其黑暗仪式，再除掉他们的重击者以打垮部族的武力。队伍一乱，残余的食人魔别无选择，只能撤退。只有你这种级别的英雄才能终结安戈罗什的威胁。",dEN="Champion, the ogres of the Ango'rosh clan have established a stronghold that threatens the stability of Zangarmarsh. From Ango'rosh Stronghold, they launch brutal raids against our allies. I need you to infiltrate the stronghold and dismantle the Ango'rosh forces from within. Slay their soul eaters to disrupt their dark rituals, then eliminate their maulers to break the clan's martial strength. With their ranks in disarray, the remaining ogres will have no choice but to retreat. Only a hero of your caliber can end the Ango'rosh threat.",o="潜入安戈罗什要塞，瓦解其中的食人魔势力。",oEN="Infiltrate Ango'rosh Stronghold and dismantle the ogre forces within.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354082]={d="英雄，安戈罗什部族的食人魔愈发猖狂，从他们在安戈罗什领地的前哨对赞加沼泽的盟友发动攻击。他们的哨兵站岗放哨，残暴的战士和黑暗术士则实施无情的劫掠。我需要你前往安戈罗什领地，终结他们的侵略。杀掉他们的哨兵、战士和术士，打垮其劫掠队伍的实力。必须让安戈罗什部族明白，这种行为绝不被容忍。",dEN="Hero, the ogres of the Ango'rosh clan grow bolder, launching attacks on our allies in Zangarmarsh from their outpost at Ango'rosh Grounds. Their sentries stand guard while brutal warriors and dark warlocks carry out ruthless raids. I need you to travel to Ango'rosh Grounds and put an end to their aggression. Slay their sentries, warriors and warlocks to break the strength of their raiding parties. The Ango'rosh must be made to understand that such actions will not be tolerated.",o="前往安戈罗什领地，消灭他们凶悍的劫掠队。",oEN="Travel to Ango'rosh Grounds and eliminate their aggressive raiding parties.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354083]={d="泥沼之王被迫袭击孢子人以获取食物，我们已经查明了原因。安戈罗什的食人魔正在采走它们赖以为生的蘑菇，把它们赶出了家园。如果你能把这些蘑菇从食人魔手中夺回，我们就能留一部分给泥沼之王，或许能减少它们对孢子人的攻击。",dEN="The bog lords have been forced to attack the Sporelings for food, and we've learned why. The Ango'rosh ogres are harvesting the mushrooms they usually feed on and forced them out of their homes. If you take them from the ogres, we could leave some for the bog lords, possibly culling their aggression towards the sporelings.",o="从安戈罗什食人魔手中夺回被采走的蘑菇。",oEN="Retrieve Harvested Mushrooms from Ango'rosh ogres.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354084]={d="英雄，安戈罗什部族一个名叫玛尔德鲁克的邪恶术士把灵魂困在黑暗机器中，用以滋养他扭曲的魔法。这些可怜的灵魂正在痛苦中煎熬，必须得到解救！我需要你深入安戈罗什领地和要塞，找到并释放任何被困在他们灵魂装置中的灵魂。打碎那些装置，让灵魂终得安宁。这虽是微小的仁慈之举，却可能播下让安戈罗什部族走向救赎的种子。任何被困于黑暗中的灵魂都令我心中悲恸。请成为它们的解放者，勇士！",dEN="Hero, a vile sorcerer of the Ango'rosh clan known as Mal'druk traps souls within dark machines to fuel their twisted magic. These poor spirits are in agony and must be freed! I need you to venture into Ango'rosh Grounds and Stronghold to find and release any souls imprisoned in their soul devices. Break the devices to let the souls find peace at last. It is a small act of mercy, but may plant the seeds that blossom into the Ango'rosh's redemption. My heart weeps for any soul trapped in darkness. Please be their liberator, champion!",o="寻找并释放任何被囚禁在玛尔德鲁克灵魂装置中的灵魂。",oEN="Find and free any souls imprisoned in Mal'druk's soul devices.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354085]={d="勇士，军团已经围困了命运阶梯！邪能士兵、死亡低语者和一名邪恶的恐惧战术师正带头进攻。我们的斥候报告说，他们打算把阶梯当作传送门，引入源源不断的援军。我需要你奔赴前线，在为时已晚之前打破围困！消灭邪能士兵，让那些低语的亡者闭嘴，杀死恐惧指挥官。外域的命运悬于一线。只有你这种级别的英雄才能扭转对抗燃烧军团的战局。命运在召唤——你愿意回应吗？",dEN="Champion, the Legion has laid siege to the Stair of Destiny! Fel soldiers, death whisperers, and a vile dread tactician lead the assault. Our scouts report they plan to use the stair as a portal to bring in endless reinforcements. I need you to venture to the front lines and break the siege before it is too late! Eliminate the fel soldiers, silence the whispering dead, and slay the dread commander. The fate of Outland hangs in the balance. Only a hero of your caliber can turn the tide against the Burning Legion. Destiny calls - will you answer?",o="在地狱火半岛的命运阶梯打破军团的围困。",oEN="Break the Legion siege at the Stair of Destiny in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354086]={d="英雄，燃烧军团的部队正在地狱火半岛的军团前线集结。愤怒卫士、末日低语者和邪能驯兽者正在备战。我们必须趁他们壮大之前打乱他们的队伍！我需要你直击军团前线的核心。消灭愤怒卫士，让末日低语者闭嘴，清除邪能驯兽者。把他们的备战搅成一团乱麻，拖延他们的行动。外域的自由就取决于此刻此地能否阻止军团。你是我们最大的希望，勇士！打乱他们的队伍，好让我们重新集结。",dEN="Hero, the Burning Legion's forces amass at the Legion Front in Hellfire Peninsula. Wrathguards, doomwhisperers, and fel handlers prepare for war. We must disrupt their ranks before they gain strength! I need you to strike at the heart of the Legion Front. Eliminate the wrathguards, silence the doomwhisperers, and purge the fel handlers. Throw their preparations into chaos and delay their campaign. Outland's freedom depends on stopping the Legion here and now. You are our best hope, champion! Disrupt their ranks so we can regroup.",o="前往地狱火半岛的军团前线，打乱在那里集结的燃烧军团部队。",oEN="Venture to the Legion Front in Hellfire Peninsula and disrupt the Burning Legion forces gathering there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354087]={d="勇士，军团前线传来坏消息。一名邪恶的恐惧召唤者正监督着地狱火战争使者、焰醒小鬼和邪能精灵的仪式准备。无论他们在召唤什么邪恶，都必须阻止！前往军团前线，打断他们的仪式。杀死恐惧召唤者，放逐地狱火，让小鬼的聒噪闭嘴，消灭邪能精灵。在他们把魔法威力释放到我们头上之前摧毁它。只有你拥有对我们的敌人打出如此关键一击的力量。地狱火半岛就指望你了，英雄！",dEN="Champion, dark tidings from the Legion Front. A vile dreadcaller oversees infernal warbringers, flamewaker imps, and fel sprites in ritual preparations. Whatever evil they invoke must be stopped! Venture to the Legion Front and disrupt their rituals. Slay the dreadcaller, banish the infernals, silence the imps' heckling, and eliminate the sprites. Break the Legion's magical might before they unleash it upon us. Only you possess the power to strike such a critical blow against our foes. Hellfire depends on you, hero!",o="在地狱火半岛的军团前线打断燃烧军团的仪式。",oEN="Disrupt the Burning Legion's rituals at the Legion Front in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354088]={d="勇士，我们的斥候报告说，燃烧军团正通过邪能卷轴在地狱火半岛运送重要文件。这些文件里无疑载有他们入侵外域的计划。我们必须截获它们！深入地狱火半岛，秘密取得你能找到的所有邪能卷轴。把它们带给我，好让我们洞悉军团的阴谋与计划。知识是我们对抗他们入侵部队最好的武器。外域的未来就仰赖你这样的英雄，勇士。夺回那些卷轴，帮我们扭转战局！",dEN="Champion, our scouts report the Burning Legion transports important documents via fel parchments across Hellfire Peninsula. No doubt these contain plans for their invasion of Outland. We must intercept them! Venture into Hellfire and covertly obtain any fel parchments you can find. Bring them to me so that we may gain insight into the Legion's schemes and plans. Knowledge is our best weapon against their encroaching forces. The future of Outland depends on heroes like you, champion. Retrieve those parchments and help us turn the tide!",o="从地狱火半岛的燃烧军团部队手中获取邪能卷轴。",oEN="Obtain fel parchments from the Burning Legion forces in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354089]={d="勇士，燃烧军团利用结晶状的邪能能量水晶，为军团前线的黑暗机械提供能量。如果我们能安全地收容这些水晶，我们的盟友相信它们可以被净化，用于正途。我需要你前往军团前线，收集你在他们机械附近找到的任何邪能能量水晶。搬运时要小心！把水晶带给我，好让我们的盟友清除其中的腐化。为恶提供力量之物，也可以转而化为正义。",dEN="Champion, the Burning Legion utilizes crystalline fel power crystals to energize their dark machinery at the Legion Front. If we could safely contain these crystals, our allies believe they could be purified and used for good. I need you to venture to the Legion Front and collect any fel power crystals you find near their machines. Use caution when handling them! Bring the crystals to me so our allies can cleanse their corruption. What powers evil may instead be turned to righteousness",o="前往军团前线，在军团机械附近收集邪能能量水晶",oEN="Venture to the Legion Front and collect fel power crystals near Legion machinery",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354090]={d="英雄，泽斯戈尔的血环兽人是我们不能忽视的严重威胁。步兵、亡灵法师和黑暗萨满正在备战。我们必须现在行动，在他们壮大之前削弱其力量！我需要你潜入泽斯戈尔，从内部瓦解他们。消灭他们的步兵，制止亡灵法师的黑暗仪式，杀死他们腐化的萨满。让他们忙于重建而无暇他顾。",dEN="Hero, the Bleeding Hollow orcs at Zeth'gor are a grave threat we cannot ignore. Grunts, necrolytes, and dark shamans prepare for war. We must act now to undermine their forces before they gain strength! I need you to infiltrate Zeth'gor and dismantle them from within. Eliminate their grunts, stop the necrolytes' dark rituals, and slay their corrupted shamans. Leave them scrambling to rebuild.",o="深入泽斯戈尔，削弱在那里集结的部队。",oEN="Venture into Zeth'gor to undermine the forces preparing there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354091]={d="勇士，黑暗法术浸透了泽斯戈尔，把当地的野生动物变异成了凶猛的野兽。疯狂的魔化野猪、饥饿的秃鹫和其他生物如今威胁着这片地区。我实在不忍看它们受苦！杀掉那些被亵渎的魔化野猪、剥骨秃鹫，以及其他心智已被扭曲到无可挽救的动物。我知道这是件残酷的差事，但为了恢复平衡必须这么做。地狱火半岛需要你这样的仁厚英雄来做出艰难的选择。带着我的祝福去吧。",dEN="Champion, dark magics permeate Zeth'gor, mutating the local wildlife into vicious beasts. Deranged helboars, starving vultures and other creatures now threaten the region. I cannot bear to see them suffer! Slay the defiled helboars, bonestripper buzzards, and other animals whose minds have been twisted beyond salvation. I know it is a grim task, but one that must be done to restore balance. Hellfire depends on compassionate heroes like you to make the difficult choices. Go with my blessings.",o="在地狱火半岛消灭魔化野猪和秃鹫",oEN="Eliminate Hellboars and buzzards in Hellfire Peninsula",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354092]={d="英雄，远征军械库中被诅咒的灵魂再次以不屈营的名义崛起。很久以前，古尔丹的死亡骑士创造了这些亡灵士兵，把它们束缚于自己的意志之下。如今他们失去了首领，那些不屈的骑士、巫师和步兵在军械库中游荡，对所有人都是威胁。我们必须让他们安息！我需要你前往军械库，在更多无辜者受害之前瓦解这支营队。消灭他们的骑士，制止巫师的黑暗魔法，砍倒他们的步兵。把这些灵魂从亡灵的束缚中解放出来，好让他们终于得到安宁。这是件残酷的差事，但只有你能办到。地狱火半岛就指望你了，勇士！",dEN="Hero, the cursed spirits of the Expedition Armory rise again as the Unyielding Battalion. Long ago, Gul'dan's death knights created these undead soldiers, binding them to their will. Now leaderless, the unyielding knights, sorcerers, and footmen wander the Armory, a threat to all. We must put them to rest! I need you to travel to the Armory and dismantle the Battalion before more innocents suffer. Eliminate their knights, stop the sorcerers' dark magic, and cut down their footmen. Free these spirits from their undead bonds so they may finally know peace. This is a grim task, but only you can see it done. Hellfire depends on you, champion!",o="前往远征军械库，瓦解重新崛起的不屈营。",oEN="Travel to the Expedition Armory and dismantle the risen Unyielding Battalion.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354093]={d="英雄，炼金师萨卡里配制出了一种可能治愈肆虐地狱火半岛野生动物的邪能变异的药膏。只要及早涂抹，这种药膏也许能恢复它们的神智，治愈受影响的生物。不过，我们必须先做试验！深入地狱火半岛，把药膏涂在任何显出腐化迹象的野猪身上。仔细观察结果，然后回来报告你的发现。",dEN="Hero, the alchemist Sakari has formulated a potential cure for the fel mutations plaguing Hellfire's wildlife. This salve may restore clarity and heal those affected if applied early enough. However, we must test it first! Venture into Hellfire Peninsula and administer the salve to any helboars showing corruption. Observe the results carefully, then return and report your findings.",o="对魔化野猪使用萨卡里的药膏",oEN="Use Sakari’s Salve on Hellboars",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354094]={d="勇士，地狱火半岛的黑暗势力正在囤积武器，为即将到来的战役做准备。不屈营囤积的幽魂装备，以及血环部族收集的染血武器，都可能对我们自己的战争努力至关重要。我需要你前往远征军械库和泽斯戈尔，夺回这些黑暗装备。收集幽魂武器和染血武器并带给我，好让它们反过来增强我们自己的力量。敌人的装备，也可以成为让他们溃败的工具。你今日的作为将为我们即将投入战斗的士兵提供武装。",dEN="Champion, the dark forces of Hellfire stockpile weapons for their coming campaigns. Ghostly armaments hoarded by the Unyielding Battalion and bloodied weapons gathered by the Bleeding Hollow clan could be vital to our own war efforts. I need you to venture into the Expedition Armory and Zeth'gor to reclaim these dark armaments. Gather up ghostly and bloodied weapons and bring them to me so they may bolster our own forces instead. The armaments of our enemies may yet become instruments of their defeat. Your actions today will arm our soldiers for the battles ahead.",o="从远征军械库和泽斯戈尔夺回幽魂装备与染血装备。",oEN="Reclaim ghostly and bloodied armaments from the Expedition Armory and Zeth'gor.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354095]={d="英雄，荣耀之路上的碎手兽人日益壮大。他们的步兵构成了部队的骨干，而术士和新徒则在力量与技巧上不断增长。若放任不管，他们将成为一股不可阻挡的力量。我请你前往荣耀之路，把这群兽人搅乱——杀掉他们的战士、术士和新徒，破坏其组织。你今日的作为或许能对碎手部队打出致残的一击。",dEN="Hero, the Shattered Hand orcs at the Path of Glory grow in strength each day. Their grunts form the backbone of their forces, while warlocks and neophytes grow in power and skill. Left unchecked, they will become an unstoppable force. I ask you to venture to the Path of Glory and put these orcs into disarray - slay their warriors, warlocks and neophytes to disrupt their organization. Your actions today could deal a crippling blow to the Shattered Hand forces.",o="在地狱火半岛的荣耀之路杀死碎手兽人。",oEN="Slay Shattered Hand orcs at the Path of Glory in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354096]={d="英雄，碎手部族正在地狱火半岛各地肆无忌惮地开战。他们的卫兵率领劫掠队攻击各处要塞，而侍僧和狂战士则变得愈发嗜血。如果我们不尽快阻止他们，其力量将变得坚不可摧。我请你深入半岛，帮助削弱他们的战争能力——杀掉他们的卫兵、侍僧和狂战士，打乱他们的行动。你今日的作为或许能扭转对抗他们部队的战局。",dEN="Hero, the Shattered Hand clan wages war across Hellfire Peninsula unchecked. Their guards lead raiding parties against strongholds, while acolytes and berserkers grow ever more bloodthirsty. If we do not stop them soon, their strength will be unassailable. I ask you to venture into the peninsula and help cripple their war effort - slay their guards, acolytes and berserkers to disrupt their campaign. Your actions today could turn the tide against their forces.",o="在地狱火半岛杀死碎手兽人。",oEN="Slay Shattered Hand orcs in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354097]={d="英雄，碎手部族的残余仍在肆虐地狱火半岛各地。他们的食腐者把大地搜刮一空，劫掠者和唤魔者则攻击所有路过的人。若放任不管，他们会变得猖狂并恢复实力。我请你猎杀这些碎手兽人——杀掉他们的食腐者、唤魔者和劫掠者，让他们的部族再也无法扩张。你今日的作为或许能彻底铲除这一威胁。",dEN="Hero, remnants of the Bonechewer clan still lurk across Hellfire Peninsula. Their scavengers pick the land clean while raiders and evokers attack all who cross their path. Left unchecked, they will grow bold and regenerate their forces. I ask you to hunt down these Bonechewer orcs - slay their scavengers, evokers and raiders so their clan can gain no further foothold. Your actions today could exterminate this threat for good.",o="在地狱火半岛杀死碎手兽人。",oEN="Slay Bonechewer orcs in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354098]={d="英雄，邪部落的战争机器靠散布在地狱火半岛各处的补给储备来驱动。劫掠这些补给并据为己有，我们就能严重削弱他们的能力，同时充实自己。我请你深入邪部落的领地，与他们的部队交战，没收他们的补给。把它们带给我，好让我们的工匠判定如何最好地用来对付他们昔日的主人。",dEN="Hero, the Fel Horde's war machine is fueled by their stockpiles of supplies scattered across Hellfire Peninsula. By raiding these supplies and seizing them for ourselves, we can critically hinder their capabilities while bolstering our own. I ask you to venture into Fel Horde territory, fight their forces, and confiscate their supplies. Bring them to me so our artisans can determine how best to use them against their former masters.",o="在地狱火半岛夺取邪部落的补给。",oEN="Seize Fel Horde supplies in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354099]={d="一位名叫萨卡里的炼金师希望研究流淌在地狱火半岛邪兽人体内的腐化之血。通过从死者身上采集样本，她相信能找出抵御和反制这种恶魔污染的方法。我请你深入半岛，与这些邪能生物交战，收集它们的血液样本。把这些样本带给我，好让萨卡里推进她的研究，找出这个敌人的弱点。",dEN="An alchemist by the name of Sakari seeks to study the corrupted blood that runs through the Fel Orcs of Hellfire Peninsula. By gathering samples from the fallen, she believes she can devise ways to resist and counteract the demonic taint. I ask you to venture into the peninsula, battle these fel creatures, and collect vials of their blood. Bring these specimens to me so Sakari can further her research and find weaknesses in this enemy.",o="从地狱火半岛的邪兽人身上采集腐化之血样本。",oEN="Gather corrupted blood samples from Fel Orcs in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354100]={d="英雄，栖息在大裂隙中的野兽变得越来越凶暴。石镰幼崽成群袭击旅人，而首领则率领凶残的猎杀。巨大的隧道虫从深处钻出，恐吓这片土地。若放任不管，它们的数量将失控暴增。我请你深入裂隙，平定这些地底野兽——杀掉幼崽、首领和隧道虫，好让平衡得以恢复。",dEN="Hero, the beasts that dwell within the Great Fissure have become increasingly aggressive. Stonescythe whelps attack travelers in swarms while alphas lead brutal hunts. Massive tunnelers emerge from the depths and terrorize the land. If left unchecked, their numbers will surge out of control. I ask you to venture into the fissure and pacify these subterranean beasts - cull the whelps, alphas, and tunnelers so balance is restored.",o="在地狱火半岛的大裂隙杀死石镰和隧道虫。",oEN="Slay Stonescythe and Tunneler beasts in the Great Fissure of Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354101]={d="英雄，哈尔艾希部族的鸦人在哈尔艾希巢穴里愈发猖狂。他们的风行者伏击所有经过的人，利爪卫士则站岗放哨。致命的卡利鸟从高空俯冲袭击。若放任不管，他们只会愈发大胆。我请你率队突袭哈尔艾希——杀掉他们的风行者、利爪卫士和卡利鸟盟友，终结他们的侵略。你今日的作为或许能重创哈尔艾希的势力。",dEN="Hero, the arakkoa of the Haal’eshi tribe have become emboldened within their den at Haal’esh. Their windwalkers ambush all who pass by, while talonguards stand vigil. deadly kaliri swoop from above to attack. Left unchecked, they will only grow bolder. I ask you to lead an assault on Haal’esh - slay their windwalkers, talonguards, and kaliri allies to put an end to their aggression. Your actions today could deal a severe blow to the Haal’eshi forces.",o="在地狱火半岛的哈尔艾希巢穴杀死哈尔艾希鸦人和卡利鸟。",oEN="Slay Haal'eshi arakkoa and kaliri at the Den of Haal'esh in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354102]={d="英雄，泰尔哈马特神殿附近的野生动物变得野蛮而失控。凶恶的剥骨秃鹫不停地盘旋，庞大的魔化野猪肆无忌惮地冲锋。若任其发展，这些凶暴的掠食者只会变得更危险。我请你削减它们的数量——出发杀掉秃鹫和魔化野猪，让这片土地恢复平衡。用弓、用刀还是用法术，向这些地狱生物展示你的本领吧。",dEN="Hero, the wildlife near the Temple of Telhamat has become savage and unchecked. Vicious bonestripper vultures circle endlessly, while hulking helboars charge with abandon. Left to their own devices, these aggressive predators will only grow more dangerous. I ask you to cull their numbers - venture forth and slay the vultures and helboars so that balance is restored to the land. With bow, blade or spell, demonstrate your skill against these hellish creatures.",o="在地狱火半岛泰尔哈马特神殿附近杀死剥骨秃鹫和庞大的魔化野猪。",oEN="Slay bonestripper vultures and hulking helboars near the Temple of Telhamat in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354103]={d="英雄，沙纳尔废墟的恶魔伊利达雷掳走无辜者充当奴隶，无情地把他们锁上镣铐。他们的呼喊从废墟中传出，哀求着救赎。我恳求你，勇敢的英雄，前往沙纳尔砸断这些锁链——解放被奴役的人，好让他们回到亲人身边。你的怜悯与本领今日或许能救下许多性命。快些动身，别让更多人继续承受伊利达雷残酷的束缚。",dEN="Hero, the demonic Illidari at the Ruins of Sha'naar have taken innocents as slaves, chaining them mercilessly. Their cries ring out from the ruins, pleading for salvation. I beseech you, brave hero, to venture to Sha'naar and break these chains - free the enslaved so they may be returned to their loved ones. Your compassion and skill could save many lives this day. Go with haste, before more suffer the Illidari's cruel bonds.",o="在地狱火半岛的沙纳尔废墟解救被奴役的囚犯。",oEN="Free enslaved prisoners at the Ruins of Sha'naar in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354104]={d="英雄，我们的盟友正在研究栖息于地狱火半岛的鸟类与鸦人的奇异骨骼。通过从死者身上采集样本，他们相信能揭开有关其解剖结构与演化的秘密。我请你与这些有翼生物在整个半岛上交战，采集它们的骨骼。把样本带给我，好让我们的盟友继续研究。你今日的努力或许能为我们在这片陌生的土地上行动提供宝贵的知识。",dEN="Hero, our allies are studying the unusual bones of the birds and arakkoa that inhabit Hellfire Peninsula. By gathering samples from the fallen, they believe they can uncover secrets about their anatomy and evolution. I ask you to battle these winged creatures across the peninsula and harvest their bones. Bring the specimens to me so our allies can further their research. Your efforts today could provide valuable knowledge for navigating this alien land.",o="在地狱火半岛从鸟类和鸦人身上收集鸟类骨骼。",oEN="Gather avian bones from birds and arakkoa in Hellfire Peninsula.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354105]={d="勇士，基尔加丹王座传来不祥的消息。炽热的邪能火花和愤怒传令官正在聚集，无疑是在谋划把军团的影响扩散到整个外域。我们必须迅速行动，遏止他们的野心！我需要你前往王座，瓦解他们的势力。在邪能火花的火焰蔓延之前消灭它们，在传令官散布军团的谎言之前让它们闭嘴。打破他们对王座的掌控，好让地狱火半岛重见希望。",dEN="Champion, ominous tidings from the Throne of Kil'jaeden. Incandescent fel sparks and wrath heralds gather, no doubt planning to spread the Legion's influence across Outland. We must act quickly to stymy their ambitions! I need you to journey to the Throne and dismantle their forces. Eliminate the fel sparks before their fire spreads, and silence the heralds before they can proclaim the Legion's lies. Break their grip on the Throne so that Hellfire may know hope again.",o="前往基尔加丹王座，瓦解在那里集结的势力。",oEN="Venture to the Throne of Kil'jaeden and dismantle the forces gathered there.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354106]={d="英雄，我们的斥候报告基尔加丹王座出现令人不安的活动。军团正准备让新的邪血新兵参加烈焰仪式，以扩充队伍。我们必须迅速行动加以阻止！我需要你前往王座，打断这场仪式。在邪血新兵完成入门仪式之前杀掉他们。就算有几人逃脱也不必沮丧；拖延他们的入会同样削弱了军团。今日阻止一批新的烈焰士兵，或许能在日后的战斗中挽救无数性命。",dEN="Hero, our scouts report troubling activities at the Throne of Kil'jaeden. The Legion prepares to initiate new felblood recruits into the Rites of Flame, swelling their ranks. We must act quickly to prevent this! I need you to journey to the Throne and disrupt the ceremony. Slay the felblood initiates before they can complete their initiation. Despair not if some escape; delaying their induction weakens the Legion still. Preventing new soldiers of flame today may save countless lives in battles to come.",o="在基尔加丹王座打断军团对邪血者的入会仪式。",oEN="Disrupt the Legion's initiation of felbloods at the Throne of Kil'jaeden.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354107]={d="勇士，黑暗势力正在阿戈纳尔水池集结。恐魔和蛆虫现身，被邪能能量扭曲成骇人的异变体。若不加控制，它们的数量将激增，威胁整个地狱火半岛！我需要你前往水池，在为时已晚之前清除这些恶魔。消灭在腐化水域中滋生的恐魔和腐蛆。在毁灭蔓延到整片土地之前削减它们的数量。",dEN="Champion, dark forces amass at the Pools of Aggonar. Terrorfiends and maggots emerge, twisted by fel energies into horrific abominations. If left unchecked, their numbers will surge, threatening all of Hellfire! I need you to travel to the Pools and purge these fiends before it is too late. Eliminate the terrorfiends and rot maggots proliferating in the corrupted waters. Cull their ranks before ruin spreads across the land.",o="前往阿戈纳尔水池，清除从腐化水域中现身的恶魔。",oEN="Venture to the Pools of Aggonar and purge the fiends emerging from the corrupted waters.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354108]={d="勇士，我们在沙塔斯的盟友需要邪能余烬来锻造附魔装备，以备战即将到来的战斗。阿戈纳尔水池和基尔加丹王座遍布这类炽热碎片，但采集它们十分危险。只有你这种本领的英雄才能在尝试中生还。深入水池和王座，收集你能背得动的邪能余烬。凑够最后准备工作所需的量，好让我们的部队装备齐全地开赴战场。",dEN="Champion, our allies in Shattrath require fel embers to forge enchanted armaments for the coming battles. The Pools of Aggonar and Throne of Kil'jaeden teem with such fiery shards, but harvesting them is perilous. Only a hero of your skill can survive the attempt. Venture into the Pools and the Throne to gather as many fel embers as you can carry. Retrieve enough for the final preparations so our forces take to the field well-equipped.",o="深入水池和王座，为我们在沙塔斯的盟友采集邪能余烬。",oEN="Venture into the Pools and Throne to harvest fel embers for our allies in Shattrath.",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354109]={d="基尔加丹王座上的军团部队正在利用自己人——那些在战斗中失利的恐怖卫士——作为能量来源。他们用复杂的装置把恐怖卫士悬吊在该区域各处，还建造了更多装置，意图从这些恶魔身上抽取力量，供沉迷邪能的血精灵使用，或用于他们自己的武器。\n\n但既然精灵们能用他们的装置，我们相信我们也能把这份能量来源用于自己的目的。在基尔加丹王座周围收集恐怖虹吸器，用它们从被悬吊的恐怖卫士身上吸取能量。等你收集够了，就带回来。务必小心，恶魔的力量若不能妥善封存是十分危险的。",dEN="The Legion's forces at the throne of Kil'Jaeden are using their own members, Terrorguards who have failed in battle, as a power source. They have suspended the Terrorguards through complex devices around the area, and built yet more devices intended to drain power from these demons for fel-addicted Blood Elves, or their own weapons.\n\nBut if the elves are capable of using their devices, then we believe we too may be able to turn this power source to our own ends. Gather Terror Siphons around the Throne of Kil'Jaeden and use them to siphon energy from Suspended Terrorguards. When you have enough, return it here, and be careful, the power of demons is dangerous if not properly contained.",o="在基尔加丹王座周围收集恐怖虹吸器，用它们从被悬吊的恐怖卫士身上吸取力量",oEN="Gather Terror Siphons around the Throne of Kil'Jaeden and use them to siphon power from Suspended Terrorguards",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354110]={d="在督工托尔加卡的监督下，军团一直在影月谷的军团要塞制造一支新的地狱火大军。这支军队准备就绪后就会横扫影月谷，摧毁我们在那里的据点。\n\n在军队完全准备完毕之前它们处于休眠状态，而邪能魔法使其免受直接强攻——不过，我们也许找到了另一个办法。一位自称米尔辛斯的流浪萨满相信，只要把她图腾的力量与军团用于防护的能量核心之一结合，她的图腾就能扑灭地狱火的火焰，穿过它们的防护将其摧毁。\n\n虽然她不愿直接强攻军团要塞，但她已允许愿意摧毁这支军队的英雄借用她的图腾。拿上它，并从军团要塞收集能量核心，让图腾得以绕过地狱火的防御。然后把它放置在那里休眠的地狱火当中。剩下的就交给米尔辛斯的魔法了。",dEN="Under the oversight of Overseer Tor'gakar, the Legion has been creating a new army of infernals at Legion Hold in Shadowmoon Valley. The army is poised to march across Shadowmoon and destroy our footholds there.\n\nThey are dormant until the army is fully prepared, but fel magic protects from from direct assault, however, we may have found another solution. A traveling shaman calling herself Mirsinth believes her totem could extinguish the fires of the infernals and destroy them, even through their protections, if one of the Legion's power cores used in those protections was added to her totem's power.\n\nWhile she does not wish to assault Legion Hold directly, she has given permission for a hero willing to destroy this army to borrow her totem. Take it, and gather Power Cores from Legion hold to allow it to bypass the infernals' defenses. Then place it in the midst of the dormant infernals there. Mirsinth's magic will do the rest.",o="用米尔辛斯的水图腾摧毁地狱火",oEN="Destroy Infernals with Mirsinth's Water Totem",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354111]={d="勇士，斯克提隆传来可怕的消息。阴暗的黑暗议会正在集结，运用黑暗法术试图把他们的神明再次带入这个世界。先驱者散播毁灭，仪式师召唤黑暗，蔑鸦不祥地聒噪。绝不能容忍这种事！我需要你立刻前往斯克提隆，瓦解这个议会。除掉他们的先驱者，打断仪式，让乌鸦闭嘴，摧毁那些已献身于暗影的人。让他们的野心化为泡影。只有我们最强大的勇士才能对抗如此邪恶的魔法。圣光与你同在，英雄！",dEN="Champion, dire news from Sketh'lon. The shadowy Dark Conclave gathers, harnessing dark magics to try to bring their god to this world once more. Harbingers spread doom, ritualists invoke darkness, and scorncrows caw ominously. This cannot stand! I need you to travel to Sketh'lon immediately and dismantle the Conclave. Eliminate their harbingers, disrupt the rituals, silence the crows, and destroy those who have pledged themselves to shadow. Leave their ambitions in ruin. Only our greatest champion can succeed against such vile magic. The Light is with you, hero!",o="前往影月谷的斯克提隆，瓦解阴险的黑暗议会",oEN="Journey to Sketh'lon in Shadowmoon Valley and dismantle the sinister Dark Conclave",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354112]={d="英雄，凯尔萨斯的日蚀部队在日蚀岗哨日益壮大。士兵列队成阵，缚法者编织奥术魔法。科洛克那头怪物般的儿子统领着他们。如果我们不尽快迎战，他们的下一次进攻可能蹂躏影月谷。我请你前往日蚀岗哨，抹除日蚀部队的威胁——杀掉他们的士兵、缚法者以及他们邪恶的首领。终结他们的黑暗统治，好让影月谷重获安宁。",dEN="Hero, Kael'thas' Eclipsion forces grow stronger by the day at Eclipse Point. Soldiers form ranks while spellbinders weave arcane magics. Corok's monstrous son leads them all. If we do not confront them soon, their next assault could ravage Shadowmoon. I ask you to travel to Eclipse Point and erase the Eclipsion threat - slay their soldiers, spellbinders, and vile leader. End their dark reign so Shadowmoon may have peace.",o="在影月谷日蚀岗哨铲除凯尔萨斯的日蚀部队",oEN="Eradicate Kael'thas' Eclipsion forces at Eclipse Point in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354113]={d="英雄，黑暗议会的卵似乎灌注了他们那位神秘神明的一部分力量。如果我们能安全地封存这些卵，我们的盟友或许能从中发现他们那些亵渎繁育手段的弱点。我需要你深入斯克提隆，尽可能多地收集黑暗议会的卵。搬运时要小心！",dEN="Hero, the Dark Conclave's eggs seem to be infused with a portion of their mysterious god's power. If we could safely contain these eggs, our allies may be able to uncover weaknesses in their profane breeding practices. I need you to venture into Sketh'lon and gather as many Dark Conclave eggs as you can find. Use caution when handling them!",o="深入斯克提隆，收集黑暗议会的卵以供研究",oEN="Venture into Sketh'lon and gather Dark Conclave eggs for study",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354114]={d="英雄，日蚀的邪恶血精灵佩戴附魔坠饰来引导邪能能量。如果我们能弄到一批这样的坠饰，我们的盟友或许能找出打断他们魔法的方法。我需要你深入日蚀岗哨，从你击败的任何日蚀成员身上取下坠饰。小心别自己戴上！把坠饰带给我，好让我们找到办法用它们的力量反制它们的主人。",dEN="Hero, the vile Eclipsion blood elves adorn themselves with enchanted pendants to channel fel energies. If we could obtain a stockpile of these pendants, our allies may uncover ways to disrupt their magics. I need you to venture into Eclipse Point and strip the pendants from any Eclipsion you defeat. Take care not to wear them yourself! Bring me the pendants so we may find a way to turn their power against them.",o="深入日蚀岗哨，从日蚀血精灵身上收集附魔坠饰",oEN="Venture into Eclipse Point and collect enchanted pendants from the Eclipsion blood elves",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354115]={d="勇士，盘牙部族的邪恶纳迦已在盘牙岗哨站稳脚跟，用黑暗魔法威胁影月谷。海妖、水之守卫、眼镜蛇和防御者控制着这片区域，蓄势待发。我们必须行动！我需要你立刻前往盘牙岗哨，在他们构成更大威胁之前瓦解其势力。除掉他们的海妖，制止守卫者的仪式，杀死他们的眼镜蛇，击溃他们的防御者。把盘牙纳迦赶回海里去！",dEN="Champion, the vile naga of the Coilskar tribe have gained a foothold at Coilskar Point, threatening Shadowmoon with their dark magic. Sirens, waterkeepers, cobras, and defenders hold the area, poised to strike. We must act! I need you to travel to Coilskar Point immediately and dismantle their forces before they pose a greater threat. Eliminate their sirens, stop the keepers' rituals, slay their cobras, and break their defenders. Drive the Coilskar back into the sea!",o="前往盘牙岗哨，瓦解在那里集结的盘牙纳迦部队",oEN="Journey to Coilskar Point and dismantle the Coilskar naga forces gathered there",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354116]={d="英雄，盘牙部族的纳迦正变得猖狂。他们从蓄水池出动女巫、海神卫士和污泥看守者，对影月谷各处发动无情的袭击。绝不能容忍他们的侵略！我需要你前往蓄水池，瓦解盘牙的势力。除掉他们的女巫以打断其魔法。杀掉海神卫士以打垮其武力。摧毁污泥看守者，揭露他们那些邪恶的图谋。大幅削减他们的队伍，好让影月谷重归安宁。",dEN="Hero, the naga of the Coilskar tribe grow bold. From the Cistern, their sorceresses, myrmidons, and muckwatchers launch relentless attacks across Shadowmoon. Their aggression cannot stand! I need you to travel to the Cistern and dismantle the Coilskar forces. Eliminate their sorceresses to disrupt their magic. Slay the myrmidons to break their martial force. Destroy the muckwatchers to reveal their sinister efforts. Decimate their ranks so that Shadowmoon may know peace once more.",o="前往盘牙蓄水池，大量消灭在那里集结的盘牙纳迦部队",oEN="Journey to Coilskar Cistern and decimate the Coilskar naga forces gathered there",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354117]={d="勇士，影月谷在颤抖，暴怒的元素之灵正不受控制地涌现。大地之灵翻搅着土地，水之灵淹没了河流，邪火则狂怒地燃烧。它们的失衡威胁着我们所有人！我需要你走遍影月谷，制服这些疯狂的造物。平息大地之灵，安抚水流，扑灭火焰。在混乱吞噬这片土地之前恢复平衡。",dEN="Champion, Shadowmoon Valley trembles as enraged elemental spirits emerge unchecked. Earth spirits churn the land, water spirits flood the rivers, and felfire blazes with rage. Their imbalance threatens us all! I need you to travel across Shadowmoon and subdue these frenzied beings. Quell the earth spirits, calm the waters, and extinguish the flame. Restore equilibrium before havoc consumes the land.",o="走遍影月谷，制服暴怒的元素之灵",oEN="Journey across Shadowmoon Valley subduing enraged elemental spirits",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354118]={d="英雄，我们的斥候报告说，盘牙纳迦正在影月谷各地运送资源，以支撑他们那些黑暗的图谋。截下这些补给，就能打击我们的敌人。我需要你秘密夺取你在影月谷找到的任何盘牙补给。取得他们的装备、仪式材料，任何能扰乱他们行动的东西。把补给带给我，好让我们把他们的资源反过来对付他们。",dEN="Hero, our scouts report the Coilskar naga transport resources across Shadowmoon to support their dark efforts. Intercepting these supplies would deal a blow to our enemies. I need you to covertly seize any Coilskar supplies you find in Shadowmoon. Obtain their armaments, ritual components, anything that may disrupt their operations. Bring the supplies to me so we may turn their resources against them.",o="在盘牙岗哨和盘牙蓄水池收集盘牙补给",oEN="Collect Coilskar Supplies at Coilskar Point and Coilskar Cistern",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354119]={d="勇士，肆虐影月谷的元素能量，只要材料与技艺得当，是可以用于正途的。我们在沙塔斯的盟友想制作附魔器具，但需要来自那些疯狂之灵的精华。我恳请你，在影月谷各地游历时收集火、水和大地元素精华。从任何被击败的元素生物身上安全地抽取它们。只收集你能毫无损伤地携带的量。有了这些精华，我们的工匠就能锻造出对抗黑暗的器物。我们最急需的是水之器物，所幸该地区的纳迦身上多半也带着水之精华。",dEN="Champion, the elemental energies that rage across Shadowmoon Valley could be harnessed for good - with proper materials and skill. Our allies in Shattrath seek to craft enchanted implements, but require essences from the frenzied spirits. I humbly request you collect fire, water, and earth elemental essences during your travels in Shadowmoon. Extract them safely from any defeated elemental creatures. Gather only what you can transport without harm. With these essences, our craftsmen can forge artifacts to combat the darkness. We are most in need of implements of water, but fortunately the naga in the region are likely to carry water essence as well.",o="在影月谷各地从生物身上收集元素精华，用于制作器物",oEN="Collect elemental essences from creatures across Shadowmoon for crafting artifacts",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354120]={d="英雄，残暴的龙喉兽人从灵翼浮岛统治着影月谷，甚至连自己人也不放过。晋升者以铁腕统治，执行他们督军的意志。不听话的苦工渴望自由，脱离营地后变得孤立无援，而破天者则在各地发动无情的袭击。我们不能袖手旁观！我需要你前往灵翼浮岛，在龙喉的队伍中播下纷争。除掉那些晋升者，击落运输者以切断他们的补给，并杀死那些脱离队伍的怨愤苦工。有你的帮助，他们的掌控终将被打破！",dEN="Hero, the cruel Dragonmaw orcs subjugate Shadowmoon Valley from Netherwing Ledge, enslaving even their own. Ascendants rule with an iron fist, enforcing the will of their warlord. Disobedient peons yearn to be free, breaking from their camps and making themselves vulnerable, while skybreakers carry out ruthless raids across the land. We cannot idly stand by! I need you to travel to Netherwing Ledge and sow discord in the Dragonmaw ranks. Eliminate the ascendants, ground the transporters to cut off their supplies, and slay the disgruntled peons that have split themselves from the group. With your help, their grip may be broken at last!",o="深入灵翼浮岛，削弱龙喉部族维持其对影月谷掌控的力量",oEN="Venture to Netherwing Ledge and undermine the forces that maintain the Dragonmaw's grip on Shadowmoon",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354121]={d="勇士，龙喉兽人在灵翼矿洞毫无怜悯地压榨灵翼巨龙。黑色的血液从世界的心脏中渗出，爆裂者和蹂躏者恐吓巨龙，奴役破碎者使其屈服。我们绝不能容许这样的残暴！我需要你潜入矿洞，从内部瓦解龙喉的行动。清除黑血，消灭爆裂者和蹂躏者。摧毁矿洞，好让灵翼巨龙能再次自由飞翔！我相信你能办到。",dEN="Champion, the Dragonmaw orcs exploit the Netherwing dragons without mercy at the Netherwing Mines. The black blood oozes from the heart of the world itself as bursters and ravagers terrorize the dragons and Broken slaves into submission. We cannot allow such cruelty! I need you to infiltrate the mines and collapse the Dragonmaw operations from within. Purge the black blood eliminate the bursters and ravagers. Bring down the mines so the Netherwing may fly free once more! I have faith you will succeed.",o="深入灵翼浮岛，削弱龙喉部族维持其对影月谷掌控的力量",oEN="Venture to Netherwing Ledge and undermine the forces that maintain the Dragonmaw's grip on Shadowmoon",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354122]={d="英雄，灵翼浮岛正上演一场危机。暴怒的空气之灵陷入疯狂的狂暴，驱使成群的灵翼鳐鱼淹没这片区域。若不加控制，这些人侵生物将蹂躏整座浮岛！我需要你立刻前往灵翼浮岛，粉碎这波狂潮。在事态升级之前，平息疯狂的空气之灵，削减成群灵翼鳐鱼的数量。只有我们最强大的勇士才有力量完成这项至关重要的任务。浮岛的未来就指望你了，英雄！",dEN="Hero, a crisis unfolds at Netherwing Ledge. Enraged air spirits whip into violent frenzies, driving swarms of netherskates to overwhelm the region. If left unchecked, these invasive creatures will devastate the Ledge! I need you to travel to Netherwing Ledge immediately and crush this surge. Quell the frenzied air spirits and cull the swarming netherskates before the situation escalates. Only our mightiest champion possesses the power to succeed at this vital task. The future of the Ledge depends on you, hero!",o="前往灵翼浮岛，粉碎暴怒空气之灵与灵翼鳐鱼的狂潮",oEN="Journey to Netherwing Ledge and crush the surge of enraged air spirits and netherskates",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354123]={d="勇士，龙喉部族用灵翼水晶碎片，通过痛苦来控制他们奴役的巨龙。如果我们能安全地封存这些碎片，我们的盟友相信他们就能找出打断这种控制的方法。我需要你前往灵翼浮岛，夺取你能找到的任何灵翼碎片。搬运时要小心！把这些碎片交出去，我们的盟友就能解开其中的秘密，或许还能解放灵翼族群。",dEN="Champion, the Dragonmaw use crystalline netherwing shards to control their enslaved dragons through pain. If we could safely contain these shards, our allies believe they could determine how to disrupt their control. I need you to journey to Netherwing Ledge and seize any netherwing shards you find. Use caution when handling them! Delivering the shards will allow our allies to unlock their secrets and possibly free the Netherwing flight.",o="深入灵翼浮岛，收集灵翼碎片",oEN="Venture to Netherwing Ledge and collect netherwing shards",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354124]={d="勇士，灵翼巨龙即使身陷奴役，仍拥有强大的天赋魔法。我们在沙塔斯的盟友相信，研究它们的精华或许能带来关于新魔法学派的洞见。我恳请你在灵翼浮岛游历时收集灵翼精华样本。小心地从任何倒下的巨龙或生物身上抽取。只取你能安全携带的量。获得的知识或许能助我们战胜邪恶、解放灵翼族群。你今日的作为或许会重塑整个外域乃至更远之处的魔法技艺！",dEN="Champion, the Netherwing dragons possess great innate magic, even through enslavement. Our allies in Shattrath believe studying their essence could yield insights into new schools of magic. I humbly ask you to collect samples of Netherwing essence during your travels on Netherwing Ledge. Extract them carefully from any fallen dragons or creatures. Retrieve only what you can safely transport. The knowledge gained may aid us in vanquishing evil and freeing the Netherwing. Your actions today could reshape the magical arts across Outland and beyond!",o="从灵翼浮岛的生物身上收集灵翼精华样本以供研究",oEN="Collect Netherwing essence samples from creatures on Netherwing Ledge for study",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354125]={d="勇士，关于占据守望者牢笼的恶魔狱卒，黑暗的传言仍在流传。伊利达雷在他们阴森的监狱中折磨所有囚徒，把灵魂喂给他们邪恶的首领。我们绝不能容许这样的邪恶！我需要你潜入牢笼，瓦解狱卒的队伍。杀死监督这场折磨的恐怖守望者。除掉他的狱卒和苦痛者。打破伊利达雷的掌控，好让牢笼中的居民得以解脱。",dEN="Champion, dark rumors persist of the demonic jailors that hold the Warden's Cage. The Illidari torment all within their grim prison, feeding souls to their fiendish leader. We cannot allow such evil! I need you to infiltrate the Cage and dismantle the jailors' ranks. Slay the dreadwarden who oversees the torment. Eliminate his jailors and agonizers. Break the Illidari hold so the Cage's denizens may find release.",o="潜入守望者牢笼，瓦解其中恶魔般的伊利达雷狱卒",oEN="Infiltrate the Warden's Cage and dismantle the demonic Illidari jailors within",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354126]={d="勇士，灰舌部族已对巴里废墟发动入侵。灰舌的萨满、战士和苦工如今在瓦砾间爬行，威胁要亵渎这处德莱尼圣地。我们绝不能容许！我需要你立刻前往废墟，击退这支入侵的部族。除掉他们的萨满，砍倒他们的战士，瓦解他们的行动。把灰舌部族赶回阴影之中，好让平衡得以恢复。",dEN="Champion, the Ashtongue tribe has launched an invasion upon the Ruins of Baa'ri. Ashtongue shaman, warriors and workers now crawl among the debris, threatening to defile this sacred draenei site. We cannot allow this! I need you to travel to the Ruins immediately and route the invading tribe. Eliminate their shaman, cut down their warriors, and dismantle their efforts. Drive the Ashtongue back into the shadows so balance may be restored.",o="前往巴里废墟，击退入侵的灰舌部族",oEN="Journey to the Ruins of Baa'ri and route the invading Ashtongue tribe",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354127]={d="英雄，伊利丹的部队已经侵占了卡拉波废墟。炎怒根除者向圣地倾泻邪能火焰，恶魔猎手新兵和祈愿者则在亵渎神殿。我恳求你，勇敢的英雄，前往卡拉波，在这些神圣的废墟上作战——杀掉根除者、新兵和祈愿者，好让我们夺回控制权。你今日的作为或许能帮助我们收复卡拉波的神圣殿堂。",dEN="Hero, Illidan' forces have overrun the Ruins of Karabor. Sunfury eradicators rain fel fire upon the holy ground as demon hunter initiates and supplicants desecrate the temple. I beseech you, brave hero, travel to Karabor and do battle atop the sacred ruins - slay the eradicators, initiates, and supplicants so control can be wrested back. Your actions today could help reclaim Karabor's hallowed halls.",o="在影月谷的卡拉波废墟上与伊利丹的部队作战",oEN="Battle Illidan's forces atop the Ruins of Karabor in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354128]={d="英雄，卡拉波废墟的圣物匣中仍有古代遗物留存。这些器物在呼唤我们，渴望摆脱凯尔萨斯部下的亵渎。我请你前往废墟，从那些爪牙手中夺回这些神圣遗物，并把它们安全带出来。虽然卡拉波本身如今仍笼罩在黑暗之中，但保全它的珍宝，或许能为日后的复兴照亮道路。",dEN="Hero, ancient relics still linger within the reliquaries of the Ruins of Karabor. These artifacts call to us, yearning to be freed from desecration by Kael'thas' forces. I ask you to venture to the ruins, wrest these holy relics from his minions, and bear them away safely. Though Karabor itself may lie in darkness for now, preserving its treasures could light the way for its restoration in time.",o="在影月谷的卡拉波废墟中找回卡拉波遗物",oEN="Recover Karabor relics from the Ruins of Karabor in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354129]={d="英雄，那些污秽的伊利达雷携带着灌注了他们黑暗魔法与邪能能量的印记。如果我们能收集到若干这样的印记，我们的盟友相信他们就能利用其中的力量，构想出反制伊利达雷邪恶的办法。我请你猎杀影月谷各处的这些恶魔，夺取他们的印记并带给我。研究敌人的魔法，我们或许就能找出他们的弱点。",dEN="Hero, the foul Illidari carry sigils imbued with their dark magic and fel energy. If we could gather a number of these sigils, our allies believe they could tap into their power and devise ways to counteract the Illidari's evil. I ask you to hunt these demons across Shadowmoon Valley, seize their sigils, and bring them to me. By studying our enemies' magics, we may discover their weaknesses.",o="在影月谷收集伊利达雷印记",oEN="Collect Illidari sigils in Shadowmoon Valley",p="你的任务尚未完成。等你履行了契约，再回到告示板来。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[354130]={d="在夺取埃尔德拉废墟时似乎有个难题，纳迦也同样面对着它。某种意义上说，那正是我们想夺回的上层精灵圣物之一。\n\n我们获悉，上层精灵创造的一具守卫构造体历经这么久仍保持着运作。他们称它为欧拉沃斯，而过了这么长时间，它似乎依旧同样危险，也同样执着于履行自己的职责。\n\n即使我们能穿过纳迦的阻挠，只要欧拉沃斯还在活动，我们就无法安全地派遣研究人员进入废墟；尽管这样一具构造体若能完整保存下来必定极有研究价值，但把它留在那里是我们承担不起的风险。因此，我们请你深入埃尔德拉废墟，摧毁欧拉沃斯。",dEN="There seems to be a challenge in claiming the Ruins of Eldrath that the naga have faced in equal measure. One of the very Highborne relics that we wish to claim, at least in a sense.\n\nWe've learned that one of the guardian constructs created by the Highborne has remained activate even after all this time. They call it Ouravos, and despite all this time, it seems to be no less dangerous, and no less intent on carrying out its duty.\n\nEven if we get through the naga, we can't safely send any researchers into the ruins as long as Ouravos remains active, and as much as such a construct would prove fascinating to study when still intact, leaving it there is a risk we cannot afford. Therefore, we would ask you to journey deep into the Ruins of Eldrath and destroy Ouravos.",o="摧毁欧拉沃斯",oEN="Destroy Ouravos"}
Q[354131]={d="海神阿库罗克的追随者急于证明自己，攻击任何靠近他神殿的人，希望借此赢得神明的青睐。虽然我们与阿库罗克本人并无争斗，但他那些过分狂热的门徒在这一带实在是个大麻烦。\n\n我们请你前往神殿，亲自会一会阿库罗克的追随者。",dEN="The followers of the sea god Arkkoroc are eager to prove themselves, fighting any who come near his temple in the hopes of earning their god's favor. While we have no battle with Arkkoroc himself, his overzealous disciples have proven to be much of a nuisance in the area.\n\nWe would ask you to journey to the temple and face the followers of Arkkoroc for yourself.",o="在艾萨拉阿库兰神殿击败阿库罗克的门徒",oEN="Defeat the disciples of Arkkoroc at the Temple of Arkkoran in Azshara"}
Q[354132]={d="我们的研究者希望研究埃尔德拉之塔——艾萨拉上层精灵废墟中少数几处尚未被纳迦占据的地方之一，但该地区遍布鱼人、多头蛇和玛克里尼，我们抽不出足够的人手在这一带为研究人员提供充分保护。\n\n我们需要有人前去清空风暴海湾一带，好让那里的废墟可以安全地进行研究。",dEN="Our researchers would like to study the Tower of Eldara, one of the few parts of the Highborne ruins in Azshara which has not been claimed by the naga, but the area is crawling with murlocs, hydra, and makrini, and we have not been able to spare enough people to guard the researchers adequately in this area.\n\nWe need someone to go in and clear out the Storm Bay area so the ruins there are safe to study.",o="杀死埃尔德拉之塔附近的破浪者、玛克里尼抓挠者和风暴海湾战士",oEN="Slay Wavethrashers, Makrini Scrabblers, and Storm Bay Warriors near the Tower of Eldara"}
Q[354133]={d="英雄，苦涩旷野传来消息，暴怒的巨人正在威胁旅人。狂怒的崖行者踏过嶙峋的悬崖，轰鸣者则把狂风搅得疯狂。必须在更多无辜者受害之前平息它们原初的怒火！我需要你前往旷野，制服这些巨人。",dEN="Hero, word comes from the Bitter Reaches of raging giants threatening travelers. Enraged cliff walkers stomp along the jagged cliffs, while thunderers stir the very winds into frenzy. Their primal fury must be quelled before more innocents suffer harm! I need you to journey to the Reaches and subdue these giants.",o="在艾萨拉苦涩旷野杀死山地巨人",oEN="Slay Mountain Giants in the Bitter Reaches of Azshara"}
Q[354134]={d="关于居住在艾萨拉的半神阿库罗克，人们所知甚少，但在他神殿内及附近的不少生物似乎都崇拜他。我们想收集他的神像，以便进一步研究他的宗教。\n\n神殿中他的任何门徒都可能携带着阿库罗克神像，就连附近海域的其他生物似乎也与他有某种联系，所以我们相信其中一些也可能带着神像。",dEN="Little is known of the demigod Arkkoroc who resides in Azshara, but a number of creatures in and near his temple seem to worship him. We would like to gather idols to him in order to study his religion further.\n\nAny of his disciples in the temple may be carrying idols of Arkkoroc, but even the other creatures of the sea around the area seem to be connected to him in some way, so we believe some of them may have idols as well.",o="收集阿库罗克神像",oEN="Collect Idols of Arkkoroc"}
Q[354135]={d="在阿库兰神殿周围，可以看到一些奇怪的水泡漂浮着，恰好够不着。我们的记录表明，这些水泡与阿库兰的宗教有某种关联，但一直很难接触到它们以了解更多。\n\n如果你能想出办法捕获它们，我们会非常感激你抓来几个，并向我们报告你的发现。",dEN="Strange bubbles of water can be seen floating, just out of reach, around the Temple of Arkkoran. Our records suggest these are connected to the Arkkoran religion in some way, but it has been difficult to reach the bubbles to learn more.\n\nIf you can find a way to catch them, then we would greatly appreciate if you were to catch several and report your findings back to us.",o="收集阿库兰水泡",oEN="Collect Arkkoran Water Bubbles"}
Q[354136]={d="通缉：阿卡拉什",dEN="Wanted: Arkkalash",o="杀死阿尔卡拉什",oEN="Slay Arkkalash"}
Q[354137]={d="[稍后添加]",dEN="[Will Add Later]",o="杀死瓦尔克斯",oEN="Slay Val'xas"}
Q[377493]={d="你做到了。黑石之主已倒在你脚下。取下他的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have done it. The Lord of Blackrock lies dead at your feet. Take his head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="把奈法利安的头颅带给你的相应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Nefarian to your respective leader.",p="办妥了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的一场伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在对黑翼龙族的战斗中，许多生命逝去了。黑石之主终于死去，我们有机会终结这一切。\n\n做得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. With the Lord of Blackrock finally dead, we have a chance to end it all.\n\nWell done."}
Q[377494]={d="你想要奖励？除掉黑石之主本身难道还不够作为奖励吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Lord of Blackrock not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="在藏宝海湾与雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这笨蛋。你本不该把我自己的信拿回来给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖励？行吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[380600]={d="占位文本：这份揉皱的急件上盖着磨砺会管事人的红宝石印章。\n\n请用最终的任务文本替换此处内容。",dEN="Placeholder: The crumpled dispatch bears the ruby seal of an Attrition handler.\n\nReplace this with final quest text.",o="占位文本：研究这份揉皱的急件。",oEN="Placeholder: Study the crumpled dispatch.",p="占位文本：这份急件已可以上交。",pEN="Placeholder: The dispatch is ready to be turned in.",c="占位文本：你的发现增强了红玉磨砺会的实力。声望提高 500 点。",cEN="Placeholder: Your discovery strengthens the Ruby Attrition. Reputation increased by 500."}
Q[380601]={d="瓦拉斯塔兹给我们留下了很有价值的情报。我不打算让它白白浪费。\n\n你进过黑翼之巢，所以最适合完成我哥哥未竟的事业。他的密信提到了一些扭曲的实验，黑石氏族的兽人被注入龙血和元素精华，直到他们的心智彻底粉碎。\n\n他把它们锁了起来，但我确信，一旦被逼入绝境，他会毫不犹豫地把它们放出来对付我们，所以我建议你抢先一步，先解决掉那些东西。",dEN="Vaelastrasz left us with good intel. I don't plan on letting it go to waste.\n\nYou've been into the Blackwing Lair, so you're best suited to finishing what my brother started. His missive spoke of twisted experiments, orcs of the Blackrock Clan infused with dragon blood and elemental essences until their minds shattered utterly.\n\nHe keeps them locked away, but I'm sure he won't hestitate to unleash them on us all if pushed into a corner, so I'd advise you get a head start and get rid of those things.",o="在黑翼之巢杀死 10 个冰霜或剧毒实验体。",oEN="Slay 10 Frost or Poison Experiments in Blackwing Lair.",p="从瓦拉斯塔兹的描述来看，摧毁那些可悲的东西无论如何都算是一种仁慈。",pEN="From Vaelastrasz described, it sounds like it'll be a mercy to destroy those wretched things anyways.",c="你把那些东西解决掉了？\n\n作为红龙军团的一员，我本不该赞成任何生命的消逝，哪怕有时这是必要的。\n\n但那样的存在算不上生命，所以，谢谢你。",cEN="You got those things out of the way?\n\nAs a member of the Red Dragonflight, I should never condone a loss of life, even if sometimes it may be necessary.\n\nBut an existence like that is no life, so thank you."}
Q[380602]={d="关于那些实验体的描述，有些地方让我不安。我了解奈法利安的手法，那不太像他会做的东西。相似，是的，但我认为那不是他的造物。\n\n第二次大战后不久，一位聪慧的年轻炼金师在洛丹伦失踪了。我追查到了奈法利安的干预，但对此无能为力。他很可能是奈法利安实验的第一个对象，他肯定已经死了，或者更糟。\n\n但萨索斯尤以研究冰霜和剧毒闻名。听着耳熟吗？我不敢说我清楚他为何还活着，也许他和奈法利安做了交易，也许他还保留着自我的一部分。无论如何，你得继续深入，查明更多。\n\n如果更深处还有任何主要实验体，也一并了结他们的痛苦吧。为了他们，也为了我们。",dEN="Something is bothering me about the description of those experiments. I know Nefarian's handiwork, and those aren't quite the sort of thing he does. Similar, yes, but I don't think those are his creations.\n\nA bright young alchemist went missing from Lordaeron shortly after the Second War. I traced that back to Nefarian's meddling, but there wasn't anything to do about it. He was probably the first subject Nefarian experimented on, he was surely dead or worse.\n\nBut Xarthos was known for his work with frost and poison in particular. Sound familiar? I don't claim to know how he'd still be around, maybe he struck a deal with Nefarian, maybe he was left with something of himself. Either way, you need to push through and find out more.\n\nAnd if there's any primary subjects deeper in, put them out of their misery as well. For their sake, and for ours.",o="在黑翼之巢击败萨索斯和 4 个主要实验体。",oEN="Defeat Xarthos and 4 Prime Subjects in Blackwing Lair.",p="即便萨索斯还活着，我也怀疑他比其余的实验体更没救了。",pEN="Even if Xarthos is still alive, I doubt there's any more saving him than the rest of the experiments.",c="这么说他一直都在那下面，这么多年？\n\n幸好他只剩下一具空壳，如果心智破碎还能做到那种程度的话。",cEN="So he's been down there, all that time?\n\nWe're lucky he was nothing but a shell of his former self, if he was able to do that much even with a broken mind."}
Q[380603]={d="时候到了，<name>。奈法利安的防御正在消耗殆尽。我本想亲自去结束这一切，但……嗯，你也看到那让我哥哥落得了什么下场。你在那里取得的进展最大，所以我认为这件事最好由你来完成。\n\n克洛玛古斯还在里面，那是奈法利安改造过、当作某种宠物养着的熔火恶犬。解决它之后，通往山顶的路就该畅通了。\n\n了结这一切。击倒黑石之王，终结这场疯狂。死亡之翼的儿子统治那个地方已经太久了。",dEN="It's time, <name>. Nefarian is running out of defenses. I would love to go and finish this myself, but...well, you saw where that got my brother. You've had the most success in there, so I think it's best this falls on you.\n\nChromaggus is still in there, a modified core hound Nefarian keeps as some kind of pet. After that, you should have a clear path to the summit.\n\nFinish this. Strike down the Lord of Blackrock and put an end to all this madness. Deathwing's son has reigned over that place for far too long.",o="在黑翼之巢击败克洛玛古斯和奈法利安。",oEN="Defeat Chromaggus and Nefarian in Blackwing Lair.",p="你最好别站在这儿干等。那只会给他时间补充防御。",pEN="You'd best not stand here waiting. You'll only give him time to replenish his defenses.",c="<拉莱斯塔萨沉默了许久。>\n\n瓦拉斯塔兹，你已得报。奈法利安终于倒下了！\n\n我从未想过这一天会由凡人之手带来，但这一次，我很高兴自己被证明是错的。",cEN="<Ralestrasza is silent for a long moment.>\n\nVaelastrasz, you are avenged. Nefarian has finally fallen!\n\nI never thought this day would come from the actions of mortals, but this is a time I am glad to be proven wrong."}
Q[401059]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回到你首都的希拉斯·暗月那里，领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon in your capital city to claim your Hands of Fate."}
