Q[407491]={d="霸主伦萨克在力量谷等你。\n\n<萨尔向你致意。>\n\n别让你的观众久等，英雄。",dEN="Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength.\n\n<Thrall salutes you.>\n\nDo not keep your public waiting, hero.",o="去力量谷寻找霸主伦萨克。",oEN="Seek out Overlord Runthak in the Valley of Strength.",c="选择你的奖赏，让你辉煌胜利的庆典开始吧。",cEN="Choose your reward and let the celebration of your glorious victory begin."}
Q[407496]={d="去英雄谷找马廷利少校，<name>。他正等着你……",dEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes, <name>. He will be expecting you...",o="去英雄谷寻找马廷利少校。",oEN="Seek out Major Mattingly in the Valley of Heroes.",c="<name>，能享有这般仪式的人寥寥无几。请选择你的奖赏，好让我们开始庆典。",cEN="Few are graced with such ceremony, <name>. Please, choose your reward so that we may begin the celebration."}
