Q[416065]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回到你首都的希拉斯·暗月那里，领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon in your capital city to claim your Hands of Fate."}
