Q[416502]={d="你完成了不可能的事。黑龙军团的孵化母巢已倒在你脚下。取下她的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="将奥妮克希亚的头颅交给你的对应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Onyxia to your respective leader.",p="这真的是吗？奥妮克希亚的头颅？",pEN="Is this really it? Onyxia's head?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在与黑龙军团的战斗中，无数生命逝去。如今我们终于给了他们关键一击。没有孵化母巢，就不会再有新的龙卵。\n\n干得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. Now we finally struck a crucial blow against them. No broodmother means no new eggs.\n\nWell done."}
Q[416503]={d="你想要奖赏？除掉孵化母巢难道还不算足够的奖赏吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Broodmother not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="与藏宝海湾的雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",c="我猜你想要奖赏。好吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
