Q[420420]={d="全体英雄请注意！\n\n来自艾泽拉斯各地的植物学家正聚集在瘟疫之地，研究一种每年只开一次花的奇异草药。暴风城与奥格瑞玛的官员都拒绝就这些草药发表正式声明。一些保守团体称它为恶魔送来的「恶魔生菜」，但牛头人声称这是大地母亲本人的恩赐。\n\n汤姆·赫蒂将在光明希望教堂举办一场现场演出，并承诺会\"点亮全场\"。我们不清楚那是什么意思，但它闻起来确实棒极了。",dEN="Attention All Heroes!\n\nBotanists from all over Azeroth are converging on the Plaguelands to study a strange herb that only flowers once per year. Officials from both Stormwind and Orgrimmar have refused to release an official statement regarding these herbs. Some conservative groups are calling it the Devil’s Lettuce sent to Azeroth by the Legion, but the Tauren claim it is a gift from the Earth Mother herself.\n\nTom Hetty will be performing a live show with the promise of Lighting Up at Light’s Hope Chapel. We are unclear what that means, but it sure smells fantastic.",o="在光明希望教堂与斯托普·道格交谈。",oEN="Speak to Stoop Dogg at Light's Hope Chapel."}
Q[420421]={d="想找点真正能提升你体验的东西吗？\n\n我这儿正好有适合你的东西，只要你愿意为我干活。我现在太悠闲了，可不想四处奔波采集草药。如果你能在瘟疫之地各处找到 10 株奇异恶臭草药，并把它们的碎屑带给我，我就会送你一些最令人垂涎的技能卡。",dEN="Are you looking for something to really enhance your experience?\n\nI have just the thing that may work for you, provided you will work for me. I'm way too chill right now to be running around gathering herbs. If you find 10 Strange Stinky Herbs and throughout the Plaguelands and bring their trimmings back to me I will pass on some most desirable skill cards to you.",o="收集 10 份奇异恶臭碎屑。",oEN="Collect 10 Strange Stinky Trimmings."}
Q[420422]={d="想找点真正势大力沉的东西吗？\n\n我这儿正好有适合你的东西，只要你愿意为我干活。我现在太悠闲了，可不想四处奔波采集草药。如果你能在瘟疫之地各处找到 10 株奇异恶臭草药，并把它们的碎屑带给我，我就会送你一些最令人垂涎的技能卡。",dEN="Are you looking for something really hard hitting?\n\nI have just the thing that may work for you, provided you will work for me. I'm way too chill right now to be running around gathering herbs. If you find 10 Strange Stinky Herbs and throughout the Plaguelands and bring their trimmings back to me I will pass on some most desirable skill cards to you.",o="收集 10 份奇异恶臭碎屑。",oEN="Collect 10 Strange Stinky Trimmings."}
Q[420424]={d="你闻到了吗？奇异的草药已经长满了瘟疫之地。\n\n我需要采集这些草药，用于……研究目的。很多很多研究目的。带 15 份奇异恶臭碎屑回来见我！",dEN="Do you smell that? Strange Herbs have sprouted all over the Plaguelands.\n\nI need to gather these Herbs for... research purposes. Lots of research purposes. Return to me with 15 Strange Stinky Trimmings!",o="收集 15 份奇异恶臭碎屑。",oEN="Collect 15 Strange Stinky Trimmings."}
Q[420425]={d="你闻到了吗？奇异的草药已经长满了瘟疫之地。\n\n我需要采集这些草药，用于……研究目的。很多很多研究目的。带 20 份奇异辛辣碎屑回来见我！",dEN="Do you smell that? Strange Herbs have sprouted all over the Plaguelands.\n\nI need to gather these Herbs for... research purposes. Lots of research purposes. Return to me with 20 Strange Pungent Trimmings!",o="收集 20 份奇异辛辣碎屑。",oEN="Collect 20 Strange Pungent Trimmings."}
Q[420426]={d="你闻到了吗？我还以为是一窝臭鼬搬来了，但瘟疫之地长着一种效力强得多的奇异草药变种。\n\n采集这种草药可能风险更高。潮湿草药可以在高风险状态下的西瘟疫之地农场，以及东瘟疫之地考林路口一带找到。\n\n这些草药看起来是人工栽培的。我只能想象有人付出了多少心血才培育出如此优良的样本。\n\n潮湿草药只生长在「高风险」区域。",dEN="Do you smell that? I thought a family of skunks moved in, but there is a much more potent strain of these strange herbs growing in the Plaguelands.\n\nGathering this Herb may prove to be more risky. Dank Herbs can be found in the Farms of Western Plaguelands and Around Corrin's Crossing in Eastern Plaguelands in High-Risk.\n\nThese herbs appear cultivated. I can only imagine the effort someone went into to producing such fine specimen.\n\nDank Herbs are only found in HIGH RISK.",o="收集 5 份奇异潮湿碎屑。",oEN="Collect 5 Strange Dank Trimmings."}
Q[420427]={d="还没找到你想要的东西？\n\n嗯，你也许走运了。布尔斯又在咸水水手酒馆喝多了，开始拆开我所有密封的卡牌包！他把大部分都扔进了海湾，但我发现他昏倒在地，身上盖满了这些卡牌。只要你不介意食人魔的味道，可以随便挑。\n\n当然，我需要为布尔斯的\"停工时间\"索取补偿，也就是 30 枚飞升印记。",dEN="Haven't found what you are looking for yet?\n\nWell, you may be in luck. Burth had one too many at the Salty Sailor again and started opening all of my sealed card packs! He threw most of them into the bay, but I found him passed out covered in these. You can take your pick as long as you don't mind the smell of ogre.\n\nI will, of course, need compensation for Burths \"down time\" in the form of 30 Marks of Ascension.",o="收集 30 枚飞升印记",oEN="Collect 30 Marks of Ascension"}
Q[420428]={d="还没找到你想要的东西？\n\n嗯，你也许走运了。布尔斯又在咸水水手酒馆喝多了，开始拆开我所有密封的卡牌包！他把大部分都扔进了海湾，但我发现他昏倒在地，身上盖满了这些卡牌。只要你不介意食人魔的味道，可以随便挑。\n\n当然，我需要为布尔斯的\"停工时间\"索取补偿，也就是 30 枚飞升印记。",dEN="Haven't found what you are looking for yet?\n\nWell, you may be in luck. Burth had one too many at the Salty Sailor again and started opening all of my sealed card packs! He threw most of them into the bay, but I found him passed out covered in these. You can take your pick as long as you don't mind the smell of ogre.\n\nI will, of course, need compensation for Burths \"down time\" in the form of 30 Marks of Ascension.",o="收集 30 枚飞升印记",oEN="Collect 30 Marks of Ascension"}
Q[420430]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，你可以通过每日任务赚取飞升印记，并把它们带回这里兑换技能与天赋净化。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入配置来尝试新的构筑，然后在已上传的构筑中寻找符合你想象的那一个！\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n只有当你没有任何技能净化时才能接到此任务！",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, you can earn Mark of Ascension through Daily Quests, and return them here for Ability and Talent Purges.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE OBTAINED IF YOU DO NOT HAVE ANY ABILITY PURGES!",o="带着 200 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 200 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420431]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，这些技能与天赋净化可以让你彻底重置你的专精。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入专精来尝试新的专精，然后在已上传的专精中寻找符合你想象的那一个。\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n如果你没有任何技能或天赋净化，此任务可以在 60 级重复完成！",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, these Ability and Talent Purges will allow you to completely reset your build.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN BE REPEATED AT LEVEL 60 IF YOU DO NOT HAVE ANY ABILITY OR TALENT PURGES!",o="回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu."}
Q[420432]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，这些技能与天赋净化可以让你彻底重置你的专精。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入专精来尝试新的专精，然后在已上传的专精中寻找符合你想象的那一个。\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n如果你没有任何天赋净化，此任务可以在 60 级重复完成！",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, these Ability and Talent Purges will allow you to completely reset your build.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN BE REPEATED AT LEVEL 60 IF YOU DO NOT HAVE ANY TALENT PURGES!",o="带着 200 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 200 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420433]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，这些技能与天赋净化可以让你彻底重置你的专精。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入专精来尝试新的专精，然后在已上传的专精中寻找符合你想象的那一个。\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n如果你的遗忘卷轴不超过 10 个，此任务可以在 60 级重复完成！",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, these Ability and Talent Purges will allow you to completely reset your build.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN BE REPEATED AT LEVEL 60 IF YOU DO NOT HAVE MORE THAN 10 SCROLL OF UNLEARNING!",o="带着 200 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 200 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420434]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，这些技能与天赋净化可以让你彻底重置你的专精。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入专精来尝试新的专精，然后在已上传的专精中寻找符合你想象的那一个。\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n只有当你拥有少于 50 个神秘宝珠时才能接到此每日任务。",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, these Ability and Talent Purges will allow you to completely reset your build.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS DAILY QUEST IS ONLY AVAILABLE IF YOU HAVE LESS THAN 50 MYSTIC ORBS.",o="带着 200 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 200 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420435]={d="理论上，理论与实践是一回事。实践中，它们不是。\n\n如果你需要把理论付诸实践的工具……或者只是想练习一下理论，这些技能与天赋净化可以让你彻底重置你的构筑。\n\n你可以通过角色成长、载入构筑来尝试新的构筑，然后在已上传的构筑中寻找符合你想象的那一个！\n\n或者你也可以尝试打造自己独一无二的职业幻想，甚至与其他英雄分享。\n\n只有当你拥有少于 25 枚神秘符文时才能接到此每日任务。",dEN="In theory, theory and practice are the same. In practice, they are not.\n\nIf you require the tools to put your theory to the practice... or just want to practice some theory, these Ability and Talent Purges will allow you to completely reset your build.\n\nYou can try new builds through Character Advancement, Load Builds, then search the uploaded builds for one that catches your fantasy!\n\nOr you can try making your own unique class fantasy, and even share it with other Heroes.\n\nTHIS DAILY QUEST IS ONLY AVAILABLE IF YOU HAVE LESS THAN 25 MYSTIC RUNES!",o="带着 200 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 200 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420436]={d="你没注意到，军团恰好在我到来时停止了入侵。纯属巧合。巧合的是……我还囤积着大量魔血。\n\n给我带来 60 枚飞升印记，我就会用魔血奖励你——那是大师级工匠用来精炼奥金锭或月布之类强力材料的珍贵材料。",dEN="Did you notice the Legion stopped invading around the time I arrived. It was purely coincidence. Coincidently... I also have a huge stockpile of Fel Blood.rnrnBring me 60 Marks of Ascension, and I will reward you with Fel Blood, a valuable reagent master craftsmen use to refine powerful materials like Arcanite Bars or Mooncloth.",o="带着 600 枚飞升印记回去见诺兹多姆。",oEN="Return to the Nozdormu with 600 Marks of Ascension."}
Q[420445]={d="对你这样的人来说，死亡不过是通往力量的众多道路之一。你自愿将灵魂交给军团换取力量，而我们会信守这份契约。你或许已经倒下，但每一次死亡后你都会更强地回到艾泽拉斯……只要你侍奉得当。\n\n把这本《恶魔强化魔典》带给塞拉斯·暗月。他会赐予你 250 点魔能，让你可以购买一张幸运卷轴，用来强化你的构筑。\n\n你 20 级的灵魂与构筑绑定在扭曲虚空。在恶魔之泪中使用幸运卷轴重抽 20 级法术，可以永久强化你死后回归时所用的构筑。\n\n每次死亡后都去塞拉斯那里花掉你的魔能，直到你保存的 20 级构筑达到巅峰力量，这样你才能更好地侍奉你的主人。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged",dEN="Death is merely one of many paths to power for one such as you. You willingly traded your soul to the Legion for power, and we will honor this pact. You may have fallen, but you will return to Azeroth stronger with each death… provided you serve well.\n\nTake this Grimoire of Demonic Empowerment to Silas Darkmoon. He will grant you 250 Fel Power, allowing you to purchase a Scroll of Fortune that you may use to improve your build.\n\nYour level 20 soul and build is bound to the Twisting Nether. Using a Scroll of Fortune to reroll spells at level 20 while in Demon’s Tears will allow you to permanently improve the build you return to after death.\n\nSpend your Fel Power at Silas after each death until your saved level 20 build has achieved peak power so you might better serve your masters.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged",o="在恶魔之泪外的牢笼中与塞拉斯·暗月交谈。",oEN="Talk to Silas Darkmoon in the cages outside Demon's Tears.",p="你 20 级的灵魂与构筑绑定在扭曲虚空。在恶魔之泪中使用幸运卷轴重抽 20 级法术，可以永久强化你死后回归时所用的构筑。\n\n每次死亡后都去塞拉斯那里花掉飞升印记，直到你保存的 20 级构筑达到巅峰力量，这样你才能更好地侍奉你的主人。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged",pEN="Your level 20 soul and build is bound to the Twisting Nether. Using a Scroll of Fortune to reroll spells at level 20 while in Demon’s Tears will allow you to permanently improve the build you return to after death.\n\nSpend Marks of Ascension at Silas after each death until your saved level 20 build has achieved peak power so you might better serve your masters.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged",c="你 20 级的灵魂与构筑绑定在扭曲虚空。在恶魔之泪中使用幸运卷轴重抽 20 级法术，可以永久强化你死后回归时所用的构筑。\n\n每次死亡后都去塞拉斯那里花掉飞升印记，直到你保存的 20 级构筑达到巅峰力量，这样你才能更好地侍奉你的主人。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged",cEN="Your level 20 soul and build is bound to the Twisting Nether. Using a Scroll of Fortune to reroll spells at level 20 while in Demon’s Tears will allow you to permanently improve the build you return to after death.\n\nSpend Marks of Ascension at Silas after each death until your saved level 20 build has achieved peak power so you might better serve your masters.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/Felforged"}
Q[420446]={d="神秘宝珠是把你在附魔收藏中提取到的强大神秘附魔应用到装备上的关键。只要你有足够的宝珠，就可以反复应用同一神秘附魔。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想附魔的物品放上去。从附魔收藏中选择想要的神秘附魔，然后选择收藏重铸。\n\n神秘宝珠不会因死亡而丢失。\n\n此任务可以重复完成。\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",dEN="Mystic Orbs are the key to applying the powerful Mystic Enchants you have extracted into your Enchants collections and applying them to your gear. You can apply a Mystic Enchant as many times as you have Orbs to do so.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to enchant on it. Select the desired Mystic Enchant from your Enchants Collections and select Collections Reforge.\n\nMystic Orbs are not lost on death.\n\nTHIS QUEST IS REPEATABLE.\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",o="带着 500 点魔能回来。",oEN="Return with 500 Fel Power.",p="神秘宝珠是把你在附魔收藏中提取到的强大神秘附魔应用到装备上的关键。只要你有足够的宝珠，就可以反复应用同一神秘附魔。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想附魔的物品放上去。从附魔收藏中选择想要的神秘附魔，然后选择重铸收藏。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",pEN="Mystic Orbs are the key to applying the powerful Mystic Enchants you have extracted into your Enchants collections and applying them to your gear. You can apply a Mystic Enchant as many times as you have Orbs to do so.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to enchant on it. Select the desired Mystic Enchant from your Enchants Collections and select Collections Reforge.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",c="神秘宝珠是把你在附魔收藏中提取到的强大神秘附魔应用到装备上的关键。只要你有足够的宝珠，就可以反复应用同一神秘附魔。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想附魔的物品放上去。从附魔收藏中选择想要的神秘附魔，然后选择重铸收藏。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",cEN="Mystic Orbs are the key to applying the powerful Mystic Enchants you have extracted into your Enchants collections and applying them to your gear. You can apply a Mystic Enchant as many times as you have Orbs to do so.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to enchant on it. Select the desired Mystic Enchant from your Enchants Collections and select Collections Reforge.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting"}
Q[420447]={d="神秘符文是寻找全新强大神秘附魔的关键。神秘符文让你可以重铸任何精良或更高品质装备上的神秘附魔。\n\n重铸是提升你神秘附魔等级、解锁神秘提取物的关键。你可以把不需要的装备放进神秘附魔祭坛进行重铸，以寻找你想要的附魔并获得神秘提取物。\n\n当你找到想要永久保留的神秘附魔时，可以消耗一份神秘提取物摧毁该装备，把附魔提取到你的收藏中。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想重铸的物品放上去。选择重铸物品，抽取一个新的神秘附魔。\n\n神秘符文不会因死亡而丢失。\n\n此任务可以重复完成。\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",dEN="Mystic Runes are the key to finding new and powerful Mystic Enchants. Mystic Runes allow you to reforge the Mystic Enchant on any rare quality or above gear.\n\nReforging is key to upgrading your Mystic Enchanting level and unlocking Mystic Extracts. You can place unwanted gear into a Mystic Enchanting Altar and reforge it to seek out the Enchants you desire and to earn Mystic Extracts.\n\nWhen you find a Mystic Enchant you wish to keep permanently, you can spend a Mystic Extract to destroy the gear and extract the Enchant into your Collections.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to reforge on it. Select Reforge Item to roll a new Mystic Enchant.\n\nMystic Runes are not lost on death.\n\nTHIS QUEST IS REPEATABLE.\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",o="带着 500 点魔能回来。",oEN="Return with 500 Fel Power.",p="神秘符文是寻找全新强大神秘附魔的关键。神秘符文让你可以重塑任何精良或更高品质装备上的神秘附魔。\n\n提取附魔会摧毁装备。你可以把不需要的装备放进神秘附魔祭坛进行重塑，以寻找你想要的附魔并获得神秘提取物。\n\n当你找到想要永久保留的神秘附魔时，可以消耗一份神秘提取物摧毁该装备，把附魔提取到你的收藏中。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想重塑的物品放上去。选择重塑物品，获得一个新的神秘附魔。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",pEN="Mystic Runes are the key to finding new and powerful Mystic Enchants. Mystic Runes allow you to reforge the Mystic Enchant on any rare quality or above gear.\n\nExtracting an Enchant destroys the gear. You can place unwanted gear into a Mystic Enchanting Altar and reforge it to seek out the Enchants you desire and earn Mystic Extracts.\n\nWhen you find a Mystic Enchant you wish to keep permanently, you can spend a Mystic Extract to destroy the gear and extract the Enchant into your Collections.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to reforge on it. Select Reforge Item to roll a new Mystic Enchant.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",c="神秘符文是寻找全新强大神秘附魔的关键。神秘符文让你可以重塑任何精良或更高品质装备上的神秘附魔。\n\n提取附魔会摧毁装备。你可以把不需要的装备放进神秘附魔祭坛进行重塑，以寻找你想要的附魔并获得神秘提取物。\n\n当你找到想要永久保留的神秘附魔时，可以消耗一份神秘提取物摧毁该装备，把附魔提取到你的收藏中。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想重塑的物品放上去。选择重塑物品，获得一个新的神秘附魔。\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",cEN="Mystic Runes are the key to finding new and powerful Mystic Enchants. Mystic Runes allow you to reforge the Mystic Enchant on any rare quality or above gear.\n\nExtracting an Enchant destroys the gear. You can place unwanted gear into a Mystic Enchanting Altar and reforge it to seek out the Enchants you desire and earn Mystic Extracts.\n\nWhen you find a Mystic Enchant you wish to keep permanently, you can spend a Mystic Extract to destroy the gear and extract the Enchant into your Collections.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to reforge on it. Select Reforge Item to roll a new Mystic Enchant.\n\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting"}
Q[420472]={d="身为恶魔之躯的你，或许用了些非常规手段才走到这一步，但你一路走来所用的战术与天赋，未必能在接下来的战斗中派上用场。\n\n这次天赋净化可以让你彻底重置天赋，以更好地配合你的 60 级构筑。按 N 键，或点击小地图上的滚轮。然后选择重置菜单来净化你的天赋。",dEN="You may have resorted to less than conventional means to reach this point Felforged, but the tactics and talents you used to get here may not serve you in the battles to come.\n\nThis Talent Purge will allow you to completely reset your talents to better suite your level 60 build. Hit N, or the scroll wheel on your minimap. Then select Resets Menu to purge your talents.",o="领取塞拉斯的天赋净化。",oEN="Take the Talent Purge from Silas."}
Q[430001]={d="如果能让骰子只为你倾斜一次，那会怎样？\n\n密封卡牌确实能帮你\"敲定交易\"，可以这么说。密封卡牌中包含强大的技能卡，能保证新英雄获得一个技能等级。\n\n给我带来飞升印记，我就赐予你 5 张密封卡牌。祝你好运，英雄！",dEN="What if you could ensure the dice rolled in your favor just one time?\n\nSealed Cards can really help you \"seal the deal\" so to speak. Sealed Cards contain powerful Skill Cards that will guarantee new Heroes one skill level leveling.\n\nBring me Marks of Ascension, and I will grant you a 5 Sealed Cards. Good Luck Hero!",o="带着所需的飞升印记回去见塞拉斯·暗月。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon with the required Marks of Ascension."}
