Q[477493]={d="你做到了。黑石之主已倒在你脚下。取下他的头颅，呈交给伯瓦尔·弗塔根、萨尔或雷维尔加兹男爵。",dEN="You have done it. The Lord of Blackrock lies dead at your feet. Take his head and present it to Bolvar Fordragon, Thrall or Baron Revilgaz.",o="把奈法利安的头颅带给你的相应首领。",oEN="Take the Head of Nefarian to your respective leader.",p="办妥了吗？",pEN="Is it done?",c="这是整个艾泽拉斯的一场伟大胜利，<name>。\n\n在对黑翼龙族的战斗中，许多生命逝去了。黑石之主终于死去，我们有机会终结这一切。\n\n做得好。",cEN="This is a great victory for all of Azeroth, <name>.\n\nMany lives were lost in the fight against the black dragonflight. With the Lord of Blackrock finally dead, we have a chance to end it all.\n\nWell done."}
Q[477494]={d="你想要奖励？除掉黑石之主本身难道还不够作为奖励吗？\n\n好吧，我们确实弄到了一些配得上英雄的小玩意。",dEN="You want a reward? Is getting rid of the Lord of Blackrock not reward enough?\n\nWell, we have acquired some trinkets fit for a hero.",o="在藏宝海湾与雷维尔加兹男爵交谈。",oEN="Speak to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",p="你这笨蛋。你本不该把我自己的信拿回来给我。算了。",pEN="You dimwit. You weren't supposed to bring my own letter back to ME. Oh well.",c="我猜你想要奖励？行吧，随便挑。",cEN="I suppose you want a reward? Fine, take your pick."}
Q[480050]={d="伊多娜·怀瑟需要取回那些药水。迪菲亚兄弟会袭击了一支运往哨兵岭的补给队。在他们的营地中寻找被偷走的箱子并带回来，这样我们才能救治伤员。",dEN="Idona Wyther needs those potions back. The Defias raided a supply run bound for Sentinel Hill. Find the pilfered crates at their camps and bring them back so we can tend to the wounded.",o="从西部荒野的迪菲亚营地中夺回被偷走的药水。",oEN="Recover the stolen potions from the Defias camps in Westfall."}
Q[499995]={d="<race>！贵族花园再一次需要你的帮助。\n\n卡里奥克回来了，正在阿拉希高地大肆破坏。请帮我们再次击败他，让贵族花园能够继续安宁地举办！",dEN="<race>! The Noblegarden is in need of your help, once again.\n\nCariok has returned and is causing havoc in Arathi Highlands. Please help us defeat him once again, so the Noblegarden can continue in peace!",o="前往阿拉希高地，击败胡萝卜吞噬者卡里奥克。",oEN="Travel to Arathi Highlands and defeat Cariok, Devourer of Carrots.",c="谢谢你，<race>。贵族花园现在可以不受打扰地继续了，",cEN="Thank you <race>. Noblegarden can now continue on without interruption,"}
Q[499996]={d="离家出走，为了「重温这片土地闻名于世的堡垒与骑士的狂野战斗」，你在说什么……？\n\n我来这儿是为了救我的朋友巴格斯。他急需我的帮助，一个名叫卡里奥克的贪婪家伙绑架了他。\n\n卡里奥克说，只要我们带给他一大堆胡萝卜，他就放了我的朋友。但既然有你在这儿……我提议直接打上门去！\n\n你怎么说，<race>？准备好开打了吗？",dEN="Ran away from home to 're-live the wild combat of forts and knights the land is known for', what are you talking about..?\n\nI came over here to save a friend of mine, Bugs. He is in dire need of my help, a greedy being by the name of Cariok has kidnapped him.\n\nCariok told us he would let my friend go if we could bring him a big amount of carrots but with you here... I say we take the fight to him!\n\nWhat do you say <race>? Ready for a fight?",o="帮助毛绒屁股小少爷击败胡萝卜吞噬者卡里奥克，救出他的朋友。",oEN="Assist Mr. Fluffybottoms jr. in saving his friend by defeating Cariok, Devourer of Carrots",p="贵族花园占位文本 :) #17",pEN="Noblegarden placeholder :) #17",c="谢谢你救了我！我被困在这里好几天，根本出不去。我迫不及待想回到我的朋友毛绒屁股小少爷身边，和他一起分享胡萝卜。",cEN="Thank you for saving me! I've been stuck here for days without being able to leave. I can't wait to get back to my friend Mr. Fluffybottoms jr. and share some carrots with him."}
Q[499997]={d="听好了，<race>。兔子是了不起的生物。它们温顺、信任他人，还拥有东部王国最柔软的毛皮。用兔皮你几乎能做任何舒适的东西：靴子、手套、内衣。所以你才来这儿，对吧？想给自己做条兔皮内裤？\n\n[对话选项：不，乔治，兔子是朋友，不是配件。]\n\n哎呀，这回答真可爱。那告诉我，<race>，如果你这么爱兔子，你愿意为它们做任何事吗？比如说，给我带一根大胡萝卜来证明你对兔子的忠诚？",dEN="Listen here, <race>. Rabbits are magnificent creatures. They’re gentle and trusting, but they also have the softest pelts in the Eastern Kingdom. You can make just about anything comfortable with rabbit fur: boots, gloves, undergarments. That’s why you’re here, am I right? Looking to make yourself a pair of rabbit-skin underwear?\n\n[Dialogue Option: No, George, rabbits are friends not accessories.]\n\nWell now, that’s a cute reply. Tell me then, <race>, if you love rabbits so much, would you be willing to do anything for them? Even say, prove your loyalty to rabbits by bringing me a big carrot?",o="给乔治·坎达特带一根大胡萝卜，向他证明你是兔子的朋友。",oEN="Prove to George Candarte that you’re a friend to rabbit kind by bringing him a big carrot.",p="哎呀呀。这是我这辈子见过最大的胡萝卜。",pEN="Well, now. That’s the biggest carrot I’ve ever seen.",c="好吧，<race>。你已经向天下所有兔子证明了自己。我想我该把你介绍给我的小朋友……",cEN="Alright, <race>. You’ve proven yourself to rabbits everywhere. Guess I’ll introduce you to my little friend…"}
Q[499998]={d="尊贵的<race>。\n\n如果你能找到我失踪的孩子，我的感激将永无止境。遗憾的是，我只知道他逃去了东部王国。我听说海边有个地方，部落与联盟曾在那里激战。我只能想象他逃到了那片海岸。",dEN="Noble <race>.\n\nIf you would find my lost child, my gratitude would be unending. Regretfully, I know only that he fled to the Eastern Kingdoms. I hear of a place beside the sea where battles between the Horde and Alliance once raged. I can only imagine he fled to those shores.",o="寻找邦兹拉的孩子，他一定是逃到了希尔斯布莱德丘陵，去重温那片土地闻名于世的堡垒与骑士的狂野战斗。",oEN="Look for Bunzilla’s child that must have fled to Hillsbrad to re-live the wild combat of forts and knights the land is known for.",p="贵族花园占位文本 :) #15",pEN="Noblegarden placeholder :) #15",c="[乔治手握尖刀，警惕地盯着你。]\n\n像你这样的人会跑到这种鬼地方来，真是稀奇。你想干什么？\n\n……在找兔子？",cEN="[George stares at you warily, knife in hand.]\n\nStrange place to run into someone like you. What do you want?\n\n…searching for a rabbit?"}
Q[499999]={d="啊，你好，<race>。众灵祝你贵族花园快乐。唉，要是它们也能快乐就好了……\n\n英雄，高贵的灵魂们身上散发出一种奇异的哀伤。在遥远的莫高雷，有东西在痛苦地呼唤。我想问问，你愿意前往那里，找出这份哀伤的源头吗？贵族花园本该是所有人欢庆的时刻。",dEN="Ah, good day to you, <race>. The spirits wish you a happy Noblegarden. Alas, if only it were happy for them as well…\n\nA strange sadness emanates from the noble spirits, Hero. Far off in distant Mulgore, something calls out in distress. I wonder, would you be willing to travel there and find the source of this sadness? Noblegarden should be a joyous occasion for all.",o="前往莫高雷，查明哀伤的源头。",oEN="Travel to Mulgore and discover the source of the sadness.",p="贵族花园占位文本 :) #14",pEN="Noblegarden placeholder :) #14",c="站住！什么人？谁敢擅闯贵族花园女王邦兹拉的领地？哪头野兽敢来打扰我的悲伤？\n\n别烦我，<race>，我的悲伤没有尽头。我的孩子失踪了，因为我给他最爱玩的游戏《堡垒骑士世界》设了宵禁，他就从我们的洞穴里跑了出去。噢，他多么喜欢逼迫中世纪的战士进行血腥厮杀。我没能尽到父母的责任，不让他玩游戏，如今我失去了他。\n\n什么？你愿意帮我渡过难关？",cEN="Halt! Who goes there? Who dares trespass in the lands of Bunzilla, Queen of Noblegarden? What beast intrudes upon my sorrow?\n\nDo not disturb me, <race>, for my sadness knows no end. My child is missing, fled from our burrow when I imposed upon him a curfew for his favorite game, World of Fortknight. Oh, how he did so enjoy forcing medieval warriors into bloody combat. I have failed as a parent for not allowing him his game time, and now he is lost to me.\n\nWhat? You would aid me in my plight?"}
Q[500000]={d="祝你冬幕节快乐，<name>！\n\n当大多数人享受冬幕节的盛宴时，外面却有希望它被取消的人。显然，我们必须竭尽全力阻止他们毁掉冬幕节。\n\n格鲁普斯盘踞在奥特兰克山脉的雪原地区，等待最佳时机发动袭击。他对冬幕节的仇恨实在太深了，我们必须阻止他！",dEN="Have a wondrous Winter Veil, <name>!\n\nWhile most people enjoy the feast of Winter Veil, there are people out there who wish to see it canceled. Obviously, we must do everything we can to stop them from ruining Winter Veil.\n\nLocated in the Alterac Mountains, Grumpus resides in the snowy area waiting for the perfect time to strike. The amount of hatred he has for Winter Veil is too much and we must stop him!",o="前往奥特兰克山脉击败格鲁普斯，拯救冬幕节！",oEN="Travel to the Alterac Mountains and defeat Grumpus in order to save Winter Veil!",p="格鲁普斯还在外面试图毁掉冬幕节。我们必须尽快击败他！",pEN="Grumpus is still out there trying to ruin Winter Veil. We need to defeat him as soon as possible!",c="你做到了！非常感谢你拯救了冬幕节……当然，除非格鲁普斯明天又回来了……",cEN="You've done it! Thank you so much for saving Winter Veil.. Unless of course Grumpus returns again tomorrow..."}
Q[500002]={d="在冬泉谷的最南端，寒霜让位于阴影之处，坐落着暗语峡谷——燃烧军团玷污至深的地方。尽管第三次大战已经过去，峡谷中依然遍布着侍奉其残存意志的家伙。\n\n末日守卫新兵，无论是新近被召唤还是刚刚被腐化，都聚集在邪恶的仪式中。屠戮者，军团纪律的残暴执行者，以刀刃与烈焰让其他人俯首帖耳。更糟的是法力猎手，这些恶魔靠嗅探魔法精华来狩猎，以骇人的精准从生者身上汲取它。\n\n这些不是散兵游勇。他们正在准备。\n\n<name>，你的任务很明确：打乱他们的阵型，除掉他们的爪牙，并让军团记住——这个世界不会那么容易被夺走。",dEN="At the southernmost edge of Winterspring, where frost gives way to shadow, lies Darkwhisper Gorge—a place where the Burning Legion’s stain runs deep. Though the Third War has passed, the gorge still teems with those who serve its lingering will.\n\nDoomguard Initiates, newly summoned or freshly corrupted, gather in foul rituals. Slayers, brutal enforcers of Legion discipline, keep the others in line with blade and flame. Worse still are the Manastalkers, demons that hunt by scenting magical essence, draining it from the living with terrifying precision.\n\nThese are not scattered remnants. They are preparing.\n\n<name>, your task is clear: disrupt their ranks, silence their agents, and remind the Legion that this world will not be claimed so easily.",o="你的任务是削减聚集在暗语峡谷的恶魔势力。在他们组织起有规模的威胁之前，集中对付新兵、屠戮者和法力猎手。",oEN="You’ve been tasked with thinning the demonic forces gathering in Darkwhisper Gorge. Focus on Initiates, Slayers, and Manastalkers before they can mount an organized threat."}
Q[500003]={d="在暗语峡谷深处，某种邪恶之物已经扎根。在焦黑的岩石与烧焦的土地之间，邪能枯萎荆棘从地下钻出——饱含邪能能量的扭曲造物。\n\n这些荆棘被割开时会流出绿色的脓液，有人说风穿过它们时会听到低语。它们并非自然之物。它们正在蔓延。\n\n我们相信它们可能是深埋峡谷之下的古老恶魔仪式的残迹——或是先兆。如果军团想要唤醒冰层下的某种东西，这些荆棘或许就是第一个信号。\n\n给我带些样本回来，<name>。但要小心：这些荆棘生长之处，阴影紧随其后。",dEN="Deep within Darkwhisper Gorge, something foul has taken root. Among the blackened stones and scorched earth, Felblight Thorns claw their way out of the ground—twisted growths saturated with fel energy.\n\nThese thorns bleed a green ichor when cut, and some say they whisper as the wind moves through them. They are not natural. They are spreading.\n\nWe believe they may be the remnants—or the harbingers—of ancient demonic rites long buried beneath the Gorge. If the Legion seeks to awaken something beneath the ice, these thorns may be the first sign.\n\nBring me samples, <name>. But beware: where these thorns grow, shadows walk close behind.",o="从暗语峡谷收集 8 根邪能枯萎荆棘。这些被腐化的造物或许能揭示该地区恶魔活动的线索。",oEN="Collect 8 Felblight Thorns from Darkwhisper Gorge. These corrupted growths may provide insight into demonic activity in the region."}
Q[500004]={d="我的门徒正从雷霆崖赶来的路上，北面峭壁上的风怒鹰身女妖突然扑了下来。\n\n它们被任何雕刻或彩绘之物吸引，撕开了行囊，抢走了为下一次仪式准备的神圣图腾。门徒们保住了性命，但鹰身女妖如今把这些图腾当作装饰，挂在爪子和羽毛上。没有它们，仪式就无法开始。\n\n去北面找到风怒鹰身女妖，<name>，夺回被抢走的东西。把图腾还给我，好让风再次承载我们的声音。",dEN="My disciples were on the road from Thunder Bluff when the Windfury harpies swept down from the cliffs to the north.\n\nDrawn to anything carved or painted, they tore through the packs and snatched the sacred totems meant for our next rite. The disciples escaped with their lives, but the harpies now flaunt those totems as ornaments in their claws and feathers. Without them, the rite cannot begin.\n\nFind the Windfury to the north, <name>, and take back what they stole. Return the totems to me so the winds may carry our voices once more.",o="收集 8 根仪式图腾，并把它们带给石父环的毛尔·萨洛克·风蹄。",oEN="Collect 8 Ritual Totems and bring them to Maur Tharok Windhoof at Stonefather's Circle.",p="你从鹰身女妖那里夺回图腾了吗？没有它们，仪式无法推进。",pEN="Have you taken the totems back from the harpies? The rite cannot move forward without them.",c="就是这些。雪松上依然回响着我们刻下的歌谣。你让我们省去了重新制作它们的麻烦，为此我心怀感激。时机合适时，仪式会继续的。",cEN="These are the ones. The cedar still hums with the songs we carved into it. You’ve saved us the trouble of crafting them all over again, and for that, I’m grateful. The rite will go on when the time is right."}
Q[500005]={d="是他们派你来的？如果你又是那种卑劣的合同管理员，那就转身原路滚回去。我被糟糕的订单和更糟糕的文书工作压得喘不过气。\n\n刚从铁炉堡接到一笔额外订单。很大。很突然。他们不但没多派人手，反而把整个伐木队都换掉了。没时间训练，没时间规划，只管干。\n\n我落后了，而我讨厌落后。如果你使斧子顺手，又不介意寒冷，我需要你的帮忙。我们需要十二根霜松原木。你可以在附近的树林里找到。\n\n这不是白干的活。我会确保你不会白忙一场。",dEN="Did they send you? If you are another one of those scumbag contract managers, turn around and walk back the way you came. I am up to my neck in bad orders and worse paperwork.\n\nJust got an extra order from Ironforge. Big one. Sudden. And instead of giving us more hands, they swapped out the whole logging team. No time to train, no time to plan, just get it done.\n\nI am behind, and I hate being behind. If you are handy with an axe and do not mind the cold, I could use the help. We need Frostpine logs, twelve of them. You will find them in the woods nearby.\n\nIt is not charity work. I will make sure it is worth your while.",o="在冷凿营地附近的丹莫罗砍伐树木，带回 12 根霜松原木。",oEN="Chop down Dun Morogh trees near Coldhewn Camp and return with 12 Frostpine Logs.",p="木头拿到了吗？或者至少有点进展可以看看？我快没借口拖住工头了。",pEN="You have the logs? Or at least some progress to show? I am running out of ways to stall the foreman.",c="这能用。不完美，但聊胜于无。你刚帮我躲过一顿训话，还有在营房外冻僵的一夜。\n\n拿着，收下这个。你挣到的不只是一句谢谢。",cEN="This will do. Not perfect, but better than nothing. You just saved me from a lecture and a frozen sleep outside the barracks.\n\nHere, take this. You earned more than thanks."}
Q[500006]={d="看见营地上面那道山脊了吗？它就是在那里抓走上一个猎人的。我们找到了血迹。别的什么都没有。\n\n他们叫它冰皮。冰豹。体型巨大，悄无声息，而且聪明得让我们的陷阱毫无用处。它出手极快，只在雪地里留下一片鲜红，然后就再次消失。\n\n追猎它的人死得太多了。这已经不再是关乎荣耀或狩猎的事。只要它还在游荡，我们就没法在那片丘陵上干活。我也不会再派人去寒风中消失。\n\n如果你愿意冒险，那就去吧。但务必确保一击命中。冰皮不会给你第二次机会。",dEN="You see that rise above the camp? That is where it took the last hunter. We found the blood trail. Nothing else.\n\nThey call it Icehide. Ice leopard. Big, silent, and too smart for our traps. It strikes fast, leaves nothing but red in the snow, and then it is gone again.\n\nToo many have died chasing it. This is not about pride or sport anymore. We cannot work those hills while it still prowls. And I will not send another one of ours to vanish into the cold.\n\nIf you are willing to take the risk, do it. But be sure of your shot. Icehide will not give you a second.",o="有人请你追踪并杀死冰皮——那只出没于营地上方冷凿山脊的精英霜刃豹。",oEN="You’ve been asked to track and slay Icehide, the elite Frostsaber haunting Coldhewn Ridge above the camp.",p="你还活着？还是冰皮只是放你爬回来讲故事？",pEN="Still breathing? Or did Icehide just let you crawl back to tell the tale?",c="就是这个。这张皮绝不会认错。\n\n你做到了别人做不到的事。我们会祭奠逝者，这片丘陵也会因此更安全。\n\n这是你应得的。还有我们的敬意。",cEN="That is it. No mistaking that pelt.\n\nYou did what no one else could. We will honor the fallen, and the hills will be safer for it.\n\nYou earned this. And our respect."}
Q[500007]={d="科多兽在这片土地上行走的时间比我们任何人都久。它们的脚步把贫瘠之地塑造成了如今的模样。我从小就追随它们，学习兽群的习性，以及通过血脉流传下来的故事。\n\n但有些不对劲。幼崽很少，风中听不到它们的鸣叫。我看到兽群变得躁动不安、残缺不全。\n\n在南边的巨人旷野，大地被不属于这里的生物翻搅过。异种虫的隧道尖锐而扭曲，挖得离牧场太近了。我担心幼崽被掳走或驱散了。\n\n如果你发现活着的幼崽，引导它们回家。如果有已经倒下的，确保它们不会再被拖往深处。让兽群重归平衡。在你做到之前，贫瘠之地都会感受到它们的缺席。",dEN="The kodo have walked these lands longer than any of us. Their steps carved the Barrens into what it is. I have followed them since I was a child, learning the ways of the herd and the stories passed through their line.\n\nBut something is wrong. The calves are few, their cries missing from the wind. I have seen the herds shift, restless and incomplete.\n\nTo the south, in the Field of Giants, the earth has been stirred by creatures that do not belong. Silithid tunnels, sharp and wrong, burrow too close to the grazing grounds. I fear the young have been taken or scattered.\n\nIf you find any calves alive, guide them home. If any have fallen, ensure they are not taken deeper. Bring balance to the herds again. The Barrens will feel their absence until you do.",o="三头年轻的雷首科多兽与兽群走散了。把它们安全地引导回平原圣所。",oEN="Three young Thunderheads have become separated from the herd. Guide them safely back to the Sanctuary of the Plains.",p="你看到那些幼崽了吗？兽群看起来仍然不安。",pEN="Have you seen the calves? The herds still seem unsettled.",c="你找到它们了……谢谢你。它们归来会让兽群安定下来，大地也会因此喘口气。哪怕只是一头幼崽，也承载着未来季节的分量。",cEN="You found them... Thank you. Their return will steady the herds, and the land will breathe easier for it. Even one calf carries the weight of seasons to come."}
Q[500008]={d="大海最近很不安宁，<class>。鱼群消失，潮水翻涌，海带之间有什么黑暗之物在蠕动。\n\n我来这儿是想安静地钓鱼，而不是看着海岸被鳞片和獠牙撕碎。\n\n灰雾鱼人占据了这片海湾，毒害水域，拖着渔网扫过海床。它们的先知对着浪花吟唱邪恶的咒语，它们的撒网者则打捞一切会动的东西。更糟的是，海岸线上挤满了滨海狂乱者——被血腥与魔法气味吸引而来的、没有心智的利鳍野兽。\n\n消灭这些玷污此地的生物，帮助潮水恢复平静。",dEN="The sea has been restless lately, <class>. Fish vanish, the tides churn, and something dark stirs in the kelp.\n\nI came here to fish in peace, not to watch the coast get torn apart by scales and teeth.\n\nThe Greymist murlocs have overrun the cove, poisoning the waters and dragging nets across the seabed. Their Seers chant vile things to the surf, and their Netters have taken to hauling in anything that moves. As if that were not enough, the shoreline teems with Coastal Frenzies, mindless, razor finned beasts drawn by the scent of blood and magic.\n\nCut down the creatures defiling this place and help restore the stillness of the tide.",o="杀死当地的鱼人和让这片水域变得致命的狂乱海洋生物。",oEN="Slay the local murlocs and frenzied sea creatures that have turned the waters deadly.",p="潮水依然汹涌，<class>。你找到问题的源头了吗，还是灰雾鱼人仍在搅动海岸？我需要知道这片海岸线还有没有未来。",pEN="The tides are still rough, <class>. Did you find the source of the trouble, or are the Greymist still churning the coast? I need to know if this shoreline has a future.",c="你给了大海片刻安宁，<class>。鱼群可能会回来，潮水也可能暂时平静下来。你做的远不只是杀戮野兽……你帮助修复了陆地与海洋之间的联系。",cEN="You have given the sea a moment of peace, <class>. The fish may return, and the tide may settle, for now. You have done more than just slay beasts… you have helped mend the bond between land and sea."}
Q[500009]={d="我说，<name>……你看起来在海上还站得稳，这很走运，因为我有个朋友陷进了天大的麻烦里。\n\n我以前常和一个叫艾尔德林·唤潮的家伙在这片海岸钓鱼。他是个非常沉静的人。他给每条鱼都取了名字，对着海浪说话，就好像海浪会回应他一样。不久前他动身去月眠圣所寻找平静的水域，但我刚收到一条刻在浮木板上、漂到岸边的消息。上面只写了三件事：狂乱者。灰雾。救命。\n\n听着，我知道艾尔德林不是那种容易惊慌的人，所以如果他在用浮木传密信，事情就严重了。\n\n往南去月眠海岸找到他，行吗？如果他正被鱼人缠住，或是被当作引诱狂乱者的诱饵，他就需要一个刀刃锋利、反应更敏捷的人。",dEN="Say, <name>... you look like you have still got your sea legs, and that is lucky, because I got a friend in a real salt slick mess.\n\nUsed to fish these shores with a fella named Eldrin Tidecaller. Real calm sort. Knew the fish by name, talked to the waves like they talked back. He set off to Moonrest Sanctuary a while back to find some quiet waters, but I just got a message carved into a driftwood plank floatin' near shore. Said only three things: Frenzies. Greymist. Help.\n\nNow, I know Eldrin is not the panicky type, so if he is sendin' cryptic driftwood messages, things are serious.\n\nHead south to the Moonrest coast and find him, would ya? If he is tangled in murlocs or bait for a frenzy, he is gonna need someone with a sharp blade and sharper reflexes.",o="古伯·布兰普请你南下前往月眠圣所，看看他的老钓友艾尔德林·唤潮情况如何。",oEN="Gubber Blump has asked you to travel south to Moonrest Sanctuary and check on his old fishing companion, Eldrin Tidecaller.",c="所以是古伯派你来的？哼……他对潮水和麻烦一向很有直觉。幸好他这么做了。你来得正是时候。",cEN="So Gubber sent you? Hmph… always had a good sense for tides and trouble. Glad he did. You came just in time."}
Q[505000]={d="臭名昭著的科林·烈酒就盘踞在黑石深渊里。他正试图毁掉我们美妙的节日。\n\n<Bebe de un frasco>（从酒壶里喝了一口）\n\n噢天哪，就是这个味儿。科林·烈酒似乎惹了不少麻烦。我们需要宰了那个矮冬瓜，这样我们的补给才能继续流通！\n\n深入深渊，终结他毁掉我们乐趣的阴谋！",dEN="The infamous Coren Direbrew resides inside of the Blackrock Depths. He is seeking to ruin our wonderful festival.\n\n<Takes a drink from flask>\n\nOh boy that's the stuff, Coren Direbrew seems to be causing quite a bit of trouble. We need that loaf of a dwarf terminated so that our supplies can continue to flow!\n\nHead into the depths and end his plot to ruin our fun!",o="杀死科林·烈酒！\n\n你想起黑石深渊中关于科林·烈酒的那些传闻。也许你该去那里找找？",oEN="Slay Coren Direbrew!\n\nYou recall all the talk about Coren Direbrew in Blackrock Depths. Perhaps you should search there?"}
Q[520446]={d="神秘宝珠是把你在附魔收藏中提取到的强大神秘附魔应用到装备上的关键。只要你有足够的宝珠，就可以反复应用同一神秘附魔。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想附魔的物品放上去。从附魔收藏中选择想要的神秘附魔，然后选择收藏重铸。\n\n神秘宝珠不会因死亡而丢失。\n\n此任务可以重复完成。\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",dEN="Mystic Orbs are the key to applying the powerful Mystic Enchants you have extracted into your Enchants collections and applying them to your gear. You can apply a Mystic Enchant as many times as you have Orbs to do so.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to enchant on it. Select the desired Mystic Enchant from your Enchants Collections and select Collections Reforge.\n\nMystic Orbs are not lost on death.\n\nTHIS QUEST IS REPEATABLE.\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",o="带着 500 点魔能回来。",oEN="Return with 500 Fel Power."}
Q[520447]={d="神秘符文是寻找全新强大神秘附魔的关键。神秘符文让你可以重铸任何精良或更高品质装备上的神秘附魔。\n\n重铸是提升你神秘附魔等级、解锁神秘提取物的关键。你可以把不需要的装备放进神秘附魔祭坛进行重铸，以寻找你想要的附魔并获得神秘提取物。\n\n当你找到想要永久保留的神秘附魔时，可以消耗一份神秘提取物摧毁该装备，把附魔提取到你的收藏中。\n\n打开神秘附魔祭坛，把你想重铸的物品放上去。选择重铸物品，抽取一个新的神秘附魔。\n\n神秘符文不会因死亡而丢失。\n\n此任务可以重复完成。\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",dEN="Mystic Runes are the key to finding new and powerful Mystic Enchants. Mystic Runes allow you to reforge the Mystic Enchant on any rare quality or above gear.\n\nReforging is key to upgrading your Mystic Enchanting level and unlocking Mystic Extracts. You can place unwanted gear into a Mystic Enchanting Altar and reforge it to seek out the Enchants you desire and to earn Mystic Extracts.\n\nWhen you find a Mystic Enchant you wish to keep permanently, you can spend a Mystic Extract to destroy the gear and extract the Enchant into your Collections.\n\nOpen a Mystic Enchanting Altar and place the item you wish to reforge on it. Select Reforge Item to roll a new Mystic Enchant.\n\nMystic Runes are not lost on death.\n\nTHIS QUEST IS REPEATABLE.\nhttps://project-ascension.fandom.com/wiki/A_Guide_to_Mystic_Enchanting",o="带着 500 点魔能回来。",oEN="Return with 500 Fel Power."}
Q[521420]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="从塞拉斯那里领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Take your Hand of Fate from Silas."}
