Q[550000]={d="银色十字军令：\n\n被称为构造体外科医生的憎恶已在瘟疫林附近的瘟疫铸造通灵塔内被目击。该生物负责组装天灾军团憎恶，用死者的残骸缝合出恐怖之物。\n\n构造体外科医生必须被摧毁。不得回收任何残骸。\n\n任何带回其毁灭证据者，都将获得奖赏。",dEN="By order of the Argent Crusade:\n\nThe abomination known as the Construct Surgeon has been sighted within the plague-forged ziggurats near Plaguewood. This creature is responsible for assembling Scourge abominations, stitching horror from the remains of the fallen.\n\nThe construct surgeon must be destroyed. No remains are to be recovered.\n\nA reward will be granted to any who bring proof of its unmaking.",o="搜寻并消灭构造体外科医生。",oEN="Seek out and eliminate the Construct Surgeon.",p="外科医生已经倒下，他的实验室陷入沉寂。随着他的死亡，新憎恶的浪潮开始衰退。今夜死者将安息得更好。你做了别人不敢做的事——愿这枚徽记成为那份勇气的见证。",pEN="The Surgeon has fallen, his laboratory silenced. With his death, the tide of new abominations falters. The dead will rest easier this night. You have done what others dared not—may this token serve as a mark of that valor.",c="很好。天灾军团里又少了一个缝合匠。不管它在建造什么，现在都完不成了。",cEN="Good. One less stitcher in the Scourge’s ranks. Whatever it was building, it will not be finished now."}
Q[550001]={d="经验观察证实，死者并未安息。瘟疫林依然充斥着亡灵气息，由残余的死灵能量驱动。规律很一致：密度高、聚集不规则、腐烂速率极低。\n\n清除这些异常现象既能带来短期的场地稳定，也能为推算当地腐化阈值提供长期数据。在这次行动中，你将担任执行者。\n\n清除它们。一次一个也可以接受。效率更佳。",dEN="Empirical observation confirms that the dead are not resting. Plaguewood remains saturated with undeath, animated by residual necromantic energy. The pattern is consistent: high density, irregular clustering, minimal decay rate.\n\nElimination of these anomalies will provide both short-term field stability and long-term data for extrapolating local corruption thresholds. You will serve as the active agent in this operation.\n\nRemove them. One at a time is acceptable. Efficiency is preferred.",o="你被召唤去消灭瘟疫林中的亡灵恐怖，削减天灾军团的兵力。",oEN="You have been called to thin the Scourge’s ranks in Plaguewood by destroying its undead horrors.",p="你取得的击杀数在统计上足够显著吗？即便是部分削减，也能改变当地的平衡。",pEN="Have you acquired a statistically relevant number of eliminations? Even a partial reduction can shift the local equilibrium.",c="结果符合预期。环境腐化似乎略有减轻。更重要的是，你展现出了实际的可靠性。这会很有用。",cEN="Results are within expectations. The ambient corruption appears marginally reduced. More importantly, you have demonstrated practical reliability. That will be useful."}
Q[557001]={d="艾泽拉斯的勇敢冒险者们，请注意！我们正面临一场严峻的木材危机，它威胁着我们社会的根基。我们曾经繁荣的王国因木板短缺而瘫痪，建筑未能完工，修缮无人问津，我们进步的梦想支离破碎。我们迫切需要一位英雄的帮助，深入神秘的森林，穿越险恶的小径，从隐秘的林间采集珍贵的木材。你的英勇付出不会没有回报，一份绝妙的奖赏正等待着能帮助我们渡过这场灾难的人。加入我们的斗争，让艾泽拉斯重归富足与繁荣。现在就前往告示板报到，被赞颂为我们王国的救星吧！携手并肩，我们将战胜这场木材危机，为所有人建设更光明的未来。",dEN="Attention, brave adventurers of Azeroth! We are facing a dire timber crisis that threatens the very core of our society. Our once-thriving realm is paralyzed by a shortage of wood planks, leaving buildings unfinished, repairs neglected, and our dreams of progress shattered. We urgently require the assistance of a hero to delve into the mystical forests, navigate treacherous paths, and gather precious timber from hidden groves. Your valorous efforts will not go unrewarded, as a nifty prize awaits those who can help us overcome this catastrophe. Join us in our fight to restore abundance and prosperity to Azeroth. Report to the quest board now and be hailed as the savior of our realm! Together, we shall overcome this timber crisis and build a brighter future for all.",o="收集 20 根绿木原木",oEN="Collect 20 Green Wood Log",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约之后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[557002]={d="艾泽拉斯的勇敢冒险者们，请注意！我们正面临一场严峻的木材危机，它威胁着我们社会的根基。我们曾经繁荣的王国因木板短缺而瘫痪，建筑未能完工，修缮无人问津，我们进步的梦想支离破碎。我们迫切需要一位英雄的帮助，深入神秘的森林，穿越险恶的小径，从隐秘的林间采集珍贵的木材。你的英勇付出不会没有回报，一份绝妙的奖赏正等待着能帮助我们渡过这场灾难的人。加入我们的斗争，让艾泽拉斯重归富足与繁荣。现在就前往告示板报到，被赞颂为我们王国的救星吧！携手并肩，我们将战胜这场木材危机，为所有人建设更光明的未来。",dEN="Attention, brave adventurers of Azeroth! We are facing a dire timber crisis that threatens the very core of our society. Our once-thriving realm is paralyzed by a shortage of wood planks, leaving buildings unfinished, repairs neglected, and our dreams of progress shattered. We urgently require the assistance of a hero to delve into the mystical forests, navigate treacherous paths, and gather precious timber from hidden groves. Your valorous efforts will not go unrewarded, as a nifty prize awaits those who can help us overcome this catastrophe. Join us in our fight to restore abundance and prosperity to Azeroth. Report to the quest board now and be hailed as the savior of our realm! Together, we shall overcome this timber crisis and build a brighter future for all.",o="收集 20 根软木原木",oEN="Collect 20 Soft Wood Log",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约之后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
