Q[557011]={d="熟练的伐木工和工匠们，请注意！\n\n艾泽拉斯的工匠与建筑师们正在寻找稳定的优质木材供应，用于他们的手工艺和建造项目。前往附近的森林，挥动你信赖的斧头，砍倒适合取材的结实树木。把材料带到锯木厂，将原始木材加工成精炼木板。\n每一块木板都很重要，所以收拾好你的工具，作为一名真正的艾泽拉斯工匠开始你的旅程吧！",dEN="Attention, skilled woodcutters and craftsmen!\n\nThe artisans and builders of Azeroth are seeking a steady supply of quality timber for their crafts and construction projects. Journey to the nearby forests and wield your trusty axe to fell sturdy trees suitable for timber. Take the materials to a lumbermill and transform your raw lumber into refined planks.\nEvery plank counts, so gather your tools and begin your journey as a true craftsman of Azeroth!",o="收集 20 块绿木板",oEN="Collect 20 Green Wood Plank",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约之后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
