Q[580134]={d="前往祭坛并选择附魔卷轴页签，然后获取一张无瑕神秘卷轴。\n\n点击神秘卷轴上的重铸，会在卷轴上随机生成一个新的神秘附魔，并覆盖卷轴上原有的附魔。重铸会消耗神秘符文；如果你没有神秘符文了，则消耗金币！\n\n每次重铸都会为你积累神秘附魔等级的经验。每提升一级都会给予你一份神秘萃取物，可用于把神秘附魔永久应用到你的附魔收藏中。该收藏在同一服务器的所有角色之间共享！\n\n神秘附魔祭坛常常被召唤在首都城中，你也可以到世界各地去探访一处。它们的位置已标在世界地图上。",dEN="Visit an Altar and select the Enchant Scrolls tab, then Obtain an Untarnished Mystic Scroll.\n\nClicking Reforge on a Mystic Scroll will roll a new Mystic Enchant on the scroll and overwrite any existing enchant on the scroll. Reforging consumes Mystic Runes, or gold if you are out of Mystic Runes!\n\nEach time you Reforge you earn experience towards your Mystic Enchanting level. Each level earned grants you a Mystic Extract which can be used to permanently apply Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection. This collection is shared across all characters on the realm!\n\nMystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.",o="- 在神秘祭坛的附魔卷轴页签中获取一张无瑕神秘卷轴。\n- 重铸你的神秘卷轴以获得新的神秘附魔。你可以一直重铸任意神秘卷轴，直到找到想保留的附魔。\n- 重铸神秘卷轴会为你积累通往神秘萃取物的进度。\n- 重铸 5 次。继续重铸，直到获得一份神秘萃取物。",oEN="- Obtain an Untarnished Mystic Scroll from the Enchant Scrolls tab of the Mystic Altar.\n- Reforge your Mystic Scroll to obtain new Mystic Enchants. You can continue reforging any Mystic Scroll until you find an Enchant you want to keep.\n- Reforging Mystic Scrolls grants you progress towards a Mystic Extract.\n- Reforge 5 times. Continue Reforging until you earn a Mystic Extract.",p="当你成功提升神秘附魔等级时，就能获得神秘提取物。",pEN="Mystic Extracts are earned when you successfully raise your Mystic Enchanting level.",c="继续锻造神秘卷轴，获取更多神秘提取物！\n\n你能获得的神秘提取物数量没有上限。\n\n继续你的飞升之路，学习如何使用它们，并把附魔永久保存到你的附魔收藏中。\n相关",cEN="Continue Reforging Mystic Scrolls to earn more Mystic Extracts!\n\nThere is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you acquire.\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to learn how to use these and permanently save Enchants to your Enchant Collection.\nRelated"}
Q[580135]={d="把一个神秘附魔保存到收藏中，会为这一服务器的所有角色永久解锁它，让你随时都能在祭坛上直接施加该附魔，无需卷轴！\n\n将附魔加入收藏会摧毁卷轴，并消耗一份神秘萃取物。你能获得的神秘萃取物数量没有上限，所以务必保存你最喜欢的神秘附魔以及对你构筑至关重要的那些。\n\n在神秘祭坛的卷轴页签中选择一张神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。",dEN="Saving a Mystic Enchant to your collection permanently unlocks it for all characters on this realm, allowing you to apply that enchant from an Altar whenever you want without needing a scroll!\n\nAdding Enchants to your collection destroys the scrolls and consumes a Mystic Extract. There is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you can acquire, so be sure to save your favorite Mystic Enchants and ones critical to your build.\n\nSelect a Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab in the Mystic Altar, then hit Save to Collection.",o="在神秘祭坛的卷轴页签中选择一张神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。",oEN="Select a Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab in the Mystic Altar, then hit Save to Collection.",p="把带有你想提取的神秘附魔的物品放入神秘祭坛，然后点击界面底部的提取，摧毁该物品并把附魔加入你的收藏。\n\n如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上反复重铸直到获得一份。",pEN="Place an item with a Mystic Enchant you wish to extract into the Mystic Altar, then click Extract at the bottom of the UI to destroy the item and add the Enchant to your collections.\n\nIf you do not have a Mystic Extract, reforge at the altar until you acquire one.",c="把神秘附魔保存到收藏中，会为该服务器上的所有角色永久解锁它，让你随时都能从祭坛应用该附魔，而无需卷轴！\n\n把附魔加入收藏会摧毁卷轴并消耗一份神秘提取物。你能获得的神秘提取物数量没有上限，所以务必保存你最喜欢的神秘附魔，以及对你的专精至关重要的那些。\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Saving a Mystic Enchant to your collection permanently unlocks it for all characters on this realm, allowing you to apply that enchant from an Altar whenever you want without needing a scroll!\n\nAdding Enchants to your collection destroys the scrolls and consumes a Mystic Extract. There is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you can acquire, so be sure to save your favorite Mystic Enchants and ones critical to your build.\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[580137]={d="幻化师马拉兹可以让你改变装备的外观，你可以在首都的拍卖行找到他。\n\n幻化「外观」品质的物品是免费的！如果你想幻化一件非外观品质的物品，则需要从拍卖行购买一枚幻化符文。\n\n一旦你把某个外观应用到装备栏位，之后你装备的任何装备也会拥有该外观！这样你就能在升级装备或更换套装时保持外观不变！\n\n与马拉兹交谈以打开幻化菜单。选择你想幻化的任意装备栏位。选择你想应用到该栏位的物品，然后在弹出菜单中选择接受。\n\n你可以通过在马拉兹处选择一个栏位并点击移除幻化来关闭幻化，也可以选择底部选项\"切换幻化显示\"来关闭所有幻化。",dEN="Marazz the Transmogrifier will allow you to alter the appearance of your gear and can be found in your Capital City Auction House.\n\nThere is no cost to transmogrify a Vanity quality item! If you wish to transmogrify a non-vanity item you will need to acquire a Rune of Transmogrification from the Auction House.\n\nOnce you apply an appearance to a gear slot, any future gear you equip will also have that appearance! So you can upgrade your gear or change sets without changing your appearance!\n\nTalk to Marazz to bring up the Transmog menu. Select any gear slot you wish to transmogrify. Select the item you wish to apply to that slot, then select Accept from the pop-up menu.\n\nYou can disable Transmogs at Marazz by selecting a slot and clicking Remove transmogs, or you can toggle all transmogs off by selecting the bottom option to \"Toggle Transmog Display.\"",o="在首都拍卖行内的马拉兹处幻化任意物品。",oEN="Transmogrify any item at Marazz inside your Capital City Auction House.",p="在任意拍卖行与马拉兹交谈以打开幻化菜单。选择你想幻化的任意装备栏位。选择你想应用到该栏位的物品，然后在弹出菜单中选择接受。\n\n你可以通过在马拉兹处选择一个栏位并点击移除幻化来关闭幻化，也可以选择底部选项\"切换幻化显示\"来关闭所有幻化。",pEN="Talk to Marazz in any Auction House to bring up the Transmog menu. Select any gear slot you wish to transmogrify. Select the item you wish to apply to that slot, then select Accept from the pop-up menu.\n\nYou can disable Transmogs at Marazz by selecting a slot and clicking Remove transmogs, or you can toggle all transmogs off by selecting the bottom option to \"Toggle Transmog Display.\"",c="马拉兹随时都能为你应用或更换外观！你也可以从拍卖行获得便携幻化器，或在网页商店获得任意外观套装时获得它。\n\n你可以通过在马拉兹处选择一个栏位并点击移除幻化来关闭幻化，也可以选择底部选项\"切换幻化显示\"来关闭所有幻化。\n\n你可以在马拉兹处保存多套幻化套装，以便快速更换外观。\n相关",cEN="Marazz is always available to apply or swap out your appearances! You can also acquire a Portable Transmogrifier from the Auction House or when you acquire any Vanity Set from the Web Shop.\n\nYou can disable Transmogs at Marazz by selecting a slot and clicking Remove transmogs, or you can toggle all transmogs off by selecting the bottom option to \"Toggle Transmog Display.\"\n\nYou can save multiple Transmog Sets at Marazz to quickly swap your appearance.\nRelated"}
Q[580142]={d="把 3 个史诗附魔保存到你的收藏中。你可以重铸卷轴，直到获得一个想保存的史诗附魔，也可以在拍卖行搜索能强化你法术与天赋的附魔！\n\n前往祭坛，在卷轴标签页中选择一张史诗神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上重铸神秘卷轴来获取。\n\n史诗神秘附魔能为你的构筑解锁惊人的力量。它们可以赋予全新的技能，并大幅强化你现有的技能。",dEN="Save 3 Epic Enchants into your collection. You can Reforge Scrolls until you acquire an Epic Enchant you'd like to save, or search the Auction House for Enchants that empower your spells and talents!\n\nVisit an Altar and select an Epic Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab, then hit Save to Collection. If you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge Mystic Scrolls at the altar to acquire them.\n\nEpic Mystic Enchants unlock incredible power for your builds. They can grant entire new abilities and massively empower your existing abilities.",o="- 通过重铸、在世界中探索发现，或在拍卖行获取史诗神秘附魔卷轴。\n- 前往祭坛，把 3 个史诗神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏中。",oEN="- Acquire Epic Mystic Enchant Scrolls by Reforging, discovering them in the world, or the Auction House.\n- Visit an Altar and save 3 Epic Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.",p="把带有你想提取的史诗神秘附魔的物品放入神秘祭坛，然后点击界面底部的提取，摧毁该物品并把附魔加入你的收藏。\n\n如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上反复锻造直到获得更多。\n\n把 3 个史诗附魔提取到你的收藏中。",pEN="Place an item with an Epic Mystic Enchant you wish to extract into the Mystic Altar, then click Extract at the bottom of the UI to destroy the item and add the Enchant to your collections.\n\nIf you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge at the altar until you acquire more.\n\nExtract 3 Epic Enchants into your collection.",c="史诗卷轴可以通过锻造卷轴、在世界中探索发现，或从拍卖行购买获得。\n\n你能获得的神秘提取物数量没有上限。继续获取并保存能强化你法术与天赋的史诗附魔！\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Epic Scrolls can be obtained by Reforging Scrolls, discovering them in the world, or purchasing from the Auction House.\n\nThere is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you can earn. Continue to acquire and save Epic Enchants that empower your spells and talents!\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[580143]={d="把一个传说附魔保存到你的收藏中。你可以重铸卷轴，直到获得一个想保存的传说附魔，也可以在拍卖行搜索能强化你法术与天赋的附魔！\n\n前往祭坛，在卷轴标签页中选择一张传说神秘卷轴，然后点击保存到收藏。如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上重铸神秘卷轴来获取。\n\n传说神秘附魔能解锁改变游戏的力量。它们可以解锁全新的流派，彻底改变你的游玩方式，并为你的英雄带来巨大的力量提升。",dEN="Save a Legendary Enchant into your collection. You can Reforge Scrolls until you acquire a Legendary Enchant you'd like to save, or search the Auction House for Enchants that empower your spells and talents!\n\nVisit an Altar and select a Legendary Mystic Scroll from the Scrolls tab, then hit Save to Collection. If you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge Mystic Scrolls at the altar to acquire them.\n\nLegendary Mystic Enchants unlock game-changing power. They can unlock entirely new archetypes, change the way you play entirely, and grant a massive power boost to your Hero.",o="- 通过重铸、在世界中探索发现，或在拍卖行获取传说神秘附魔卷轴。\n- 前往祭坛，把一个传说神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏中。",oEN="- Acquire a Legendary Mystic Enchant Scroll by Reforging, discovering them in the world, or the Auction House.\n- Visit an Altar and save a Legendary Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.",p="把带有你想提取的传说神秘附魔的物品放入神秘祭坛，然后点击界面底部的提取，摧毁该物品并把附魔加入你的收藏。\n\n如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上反复锻造直到获得更多。\n\n把一个传说附魔提取到你的收藏中。",pEN="Place an item with a Legendary Mystic Enchant you wish to extract into the Mystic Altar, then click Extract at the bottom of the UI to destroy the item and add the Enchant to your collections.\n\nIf you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge at the altar until you acquire more.\n\nExtract a Legendary Enchant into your collection.",c="传说卷轴可以通过重铸卷轴、在世界中探索发现，或从拍卖行购买获得。\n\n你能获得的神秘提取物数量没有上限。继续获取并保存能强化你法术与天赋的传说附魔！\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Legendary Scrolls can be obtained by Reforging Scrolls, discovering them in the world, or purchasing from the Auction House.\n\nThere is no limit to how many Mystic Extracts you can earn. Continue to acquire and save Legendary Enchants that empower your spells and talents!\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[580144]={d="打开地下城查找器，排队进入随机普通地下城，或选择任意可用的指定地下城。\n\n你可以单人排队、带部分队伍排队，或找一支满员队伍。\n\n与你的队伍并肩作战，一路杀穿地下城，击败任意普通地下城的最终首领。\n\n此任务无法在史诗与英雄地下城中完成。",dEN="Open the Dungeon Finder and queue for a Random Normal Dungeon or pick any of the available Specific Dungeons.\n\nYou can queue for a dungeon solo, with a partial group or find a full group of players.\n\nWork with your party to fight your way through the dungeon and defeat the final boss of any NORMAL dungeon.\n\nThis quest is incompletable inside of Mythic & Heroic Dungeons.",o="在任意满级普通地下城中击败最终首领",oEN="Defeat the final boss in any end game Normal Dungeon",p="打开地下城查找器，排队进入普通难度的随机地下城，或选择任意可用的指定地下城。\n\n与你的队伍并肩作战，一路杀穿地下城，击败任意普通地下城的最终首领。",pEN="Open the Dungeon Finder and queue for a Random Normal Dungeon or pick any of the available Specific Dungeons.\n\nWork with your party to fight your way through the dungeon and defeat the final boss of any NORMAL dungeon.",c="地下城是为 PvE 内容武装自己、结识新朋友的绝佳途径！\n\n继续排队进入地下城，升级你的 PvE 装备。\n相关",cEN="Dungeons are a great way to gear up for PvE content and meet new friends!\n\nContinue to queue for dungeons and upgrade your PvE gear.\nRelated"}
Q[580165]={d="只要处于无风险状态，你可以在任何地方排队进入战场。\n\n按 H 键，点击战场标签页，然后点击加入战斗。\n\n你会在小地图上看到一个阵营徽记图标，表示你已经成功排队进入战场。一旦战场可用，你会收到一个弹窗，让你能够进入战斗！\n\n完成任意战场。即使失败，你依然能获得荣誉并完成任务！\n\n如果你在战场中感到吃力，请确保你穿齐了 PvP 装备，并用与你的构筑相辅相成的神秘附魔附满全身。战场中的许多玩家都使用专为 PvP 打造的构筑。你可以针对 PvP 优化天赋，如果你处于自由选择状态，也可以载入一套精选 PvP 构筑。",dEN="You can queue for a Battleground from anywhere while you are in No-Risk.\n\nHit H, Click the Battlegrounds Tab and then click Join Battle.\n\nYou will see a faction emblem icon on your minimap indicating you have successfully queue'd for the battleground. Once a Battleground is available, you will receive a pop up that will allow you to the Enter the Battle!\n\nComplete any Battleground. You will still earn Honor and quest completion even if you lose!\n\nIf you find yourself struggling in Battlegrounds ensure you are wearing full PvP Gear, you are fully enchanted with Mystic Enchants that compliment your build. Many players in Battlegrounds have builds specific to PvP. You can optimize your talents for PvP or load a featured PvP Build if you are on Free Pick.",o="排队并完成任意战场！",oEN="Queue for and complete any Battleground!",p="只要处于无风险状态，你可以在任何地方排队进入战场。\n\n按 H 键，点击战场标签页，然后点击加入战斗。\n\n完成任意战场。即使失败，你依然能获得荣誉并完成任务！",pEN="You can queue for a Battleground from anywhere while you are in No-Risk.\n\nHit H, Click the Battlegrounds Tab and then click Join Battle.\n\nComplete any Battleground. You will still earn Honor and quest completion even if you lose!",c="只要处于无风险状态，你可以在任何地方排队进入战场。\n\n如果你在战场中感到吃力，请确保你穿齐了 PvP 装备，并用与你的构筑相辅相成的神秘附魔附满全身。\n\n战场中的许多玩家都使用专为 PvP 打造的构筑，它们会比未针对 PvP 优化的构筑更有优势。你可以针对 PvP 优化天赋，如果你处于自由选择状态，也可以载入一套精选 PvP 构筑。\n相关",cEN="You can queue for a Battleground from anywhere while you are in No-Risk.\n\nIf you find yourself struggling in Battlegrounds ensure you are wearing full PvP Gear, you are fully enchanted with Mystic Enchants that compliment your build.\n\nMany players in Battlegrounds have builds specific to PvP that will have an advantage over builds not optimized for PvP. You can optimize your talents for PvP or load a featured PvP Build if you are on Free Pick.\nRelated"}
Q[580168]={d="死亡并非终点，在飞升中你有额外的工具来应对死亡。\n\n你会在法术书的通用标签页中找到 2 个只能在死亡状态下使用的法术。\n\n在首都复活会复活你，并将你传送到你阵营最近的首都。\n\n在最近的城镇复活会把你传送到你阵营最近的城镇。通常那就是你当前区域的任务中心。\n\n这些法术能让你避免在危险区域复活，摆脱 PvP 中的蹲尸者，或者在你更想前往新区域或新任务时，通过免除跑尸来加快游戏进度。\n\n下次死亡时，试试使用在最近的城镇复活或在首都复活。",dEN="Death isn't the end, and on Ascension you have additional tools to deal with death.\n\nYou will find 2 Spells in the General Tab of your Spellbook that can only be used while you are dead.\n\nResurrect in Capital City will resurrect and teleport you to your faction's closest capital city.\n\nResurrect in Closest Town will teleport you to your faction's closest town. This is usually your current Zone's Quest Hub.\n\nThese spells will allow you to avoid resurrecting in dangerous areas, escape campers in PvP, or just speed up your play session by avoiding a corpse run when you'd rather move on to a new area or quest.\n\nNext time you die, try Resurrecting in Closest Town or Capital City.",o="下次死亡时，施放在最近的城镇或首都复活。",oEN="Cast Resurrect in Closest Town or Capital City next time you die.",p="你会在法术书的通用标签页中找到 2 个只能在死亡状态下使用的法术。\n\n这些法术能让你避免在危险区域复活，摆脱 PvP 中的蹲尸者，或者在你更想前往新区域或新任务时，通过免除跑尸来加快游戏进度。\n\n下次死亡时，试试在最近的城镇或首都复活。",pEN="You will find 2 Spells in the General Tab of your Spell Book that can only be used while you are dead.\n\nThese spells will allow you to avoid ressurecting in dangerous areas, escape campers in PvP, or just speed up your play session by avoiding a corpse run when you'd rather move on to a new area or quest.\n\nNext time you die, try Ressurecting in Closest Town or Capital City.",c="在首都复活和在最近的城镇复活始终可以在法术书的通用标签页中找到。\n\n使用这些法术来避免在危险区域复活，摆脱 PvP 中的蹲尸者，或者在你更想前往新区域或新任务时，通过免除跑尸来加快游戏进度。\n\n下次死亡时，试试在最近的城镇或首都复活。",cEN="Resurrect in Capital City and Resurrect in Closest Town can always be found in the General Tab of your Spell Book.\n\nUse these spells to avoid ressurecting in dangerous areas, escape campers in PvP, or just speed up your play session by avoiding a corpse run when you'd rather move on to a new area or quest.\n\nNext time you die, try Ressurecting in Cloest Town or Capital City."}
Q[580169]={d="收集神秘附魔并扩充你的附魔收藏，会为你带来更多选择和更强力量。\n\n你可以保存到附魔收藏中的神秘附魔数量没有上限。重铸时会继续获得神秘提取物，它们通过完成各种内容获得，也可以在告示板旁的诺兹多姆处用金币或飞升印记购买。\n\n把 10 个神秘附魔保存到你的收藏中。",dEN="Collecting Mystic Enchants and expanding your Enchant Collection will give you more options and more power.\n\nThere is no limit to the number of Mystic Enchants you can save to your Enchant Collection. You will continue earning Mystic Extracts from reforging Reforging, earned by completing various content, and can be bought from Nozdormu next to the Call Board for Gold or Marks of Ascension.\n\nSave 10 Mystic Enchants to your collection.",o="把这 10 个神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏中。",oEN="Save 10 Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.",p="如果你没有神秘提取物，就在祭坛上反复重铸直到获得更多。\n\n找一个你想提取到收藏中的神秘附魔！你可以一直重铸直到找到，也可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔。只需输入名称或描述的一部分即可。\n\n把带有你想提取的神秘附魔的物品放入神秘祭坛，然后点击界面底部的提取，摧毁该物品并把附魔加入你的收藏。\n\n把 10 个神秘附魔加入你的收藏。",pEN="If you do not have Mystic Extracts, reforge at the altar until you acquire more.\n\nFind a Mystic Enchant you want to extract into your collection! You can reforge until you find one, or search the Auction House for a Mystic Enchant. Just type in the name or part of the description.\n\nPlace an item with a Mystic Enchant you wish to extract into the Mystic Altar, then click Extract at the bottom of the UI to destroy the item and add the Enchant to your collections.\n\nAdd 10 Mystic Enchants to your collection.",c="收集神秘附魔并扩充你的附魔收藏，会为你带来更多选择和更强力量。\n\n你可以保存到附魔收藏中的神秘附魔数量没有上限。重铸时会继续获得神秘提取物，它们通过完成各种内容获得，也可以在告示板旁的诺兹多姆处用金币或飞升印记购买。\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Collecting Mystic Enchants and expanding your Enchant Collection will give you more options and more power.\n\nThere is no limit to the number of Mystic Enchants you can save to your Enchant Collection. You will continue earning Mystic Extracts from reforging Reforging, earned by completing various content, and can be bought from Nozdormu next to the Call Board for Gold or Marks of Ascension.\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[580170]={d="你已经学会了骑术，但还只是个学徒。你的坐骑还有大得多的潜力，但你必须推进训练才能驾驭它们的最高速度。\n\n从拍卖行或其他玩家处购买一本《骑术宝典：熟练骑术》，或向骑术训练师学习熟练骑术，把你的坐骑速度从 60% 提升到 100%。\n\n务必比较拍卖行价格与训练师价格，以拿到最划算的交易！",dEN="You have learned the art of Riding, but you are still an apprentice. Your mounts have far more potential, but you must advance your training to be able to handle their full speed.\n\nAcquire a Riding Tome: Journeyman Riding from the Auction House or another player, or learn Journeyman Riding from a Riding Trainer to increase your mounted speed from 60% to 100%.\n\nBe sure to compare the Auction House prices with the Trainer Prices to get the best deal!",o="学习熟练骑术。",oEN="Learn Journeyman Riding.",p="学习熟练骑术以解锁 100% 的额外骑乘速度。大多数坐骑会根据你的骑术技能调整速度。\n\n你可以向骑术训练师学习熟练骑术。\n\n通常你可以从拍卖行或其他玩家处买到《骑术宝典：熟练骑术》，价格比在训练师处学习熟练骑术更低。",pEN="Learn Journeyman Riding to unlock 100% Increased Riding Speed. Most mounts adjust their speed to your riding skill.\n\nYou can learn Journeyman Riding from a Riding Trainer.\n\nYou can usually acquire a Riding Tome: Journeyman Riding from the Auction House or another player cheaper than the cost to train Journeyman Riding at the Trainer.",c="加入你外观收藏的任何坐骑都会自动根据你的骑术技能调整速度，所以你可以用 100% 的骑乘速度骑上你最爱的坐骑！\n相关",cEN="Any mount that is added to your Vanity Collection will automatically adjust their speed to your riding skill, so you can ride your favorite mounts at 100% riding speed!\nRelated"}
Q[580171]={d="《专精宝典 II》让你可以在同一角色上打造一套全新的构筑，同时还能在两者之间自由切换。\n\n你可以用金币从拍卖行购买专精宝典，或拜访任意荣誉嘉奖大师，用捐赠点数或荣誉点数购买。\n\n使用《专精宝典 II》后，你可以通过三种不同方式切换专精：\n\n- 点击法术书通用标签页中名为\"专精 II\"的法术\n- 进入角色成长（快捷键 N）\n- 输入：\"/cs #\"，即 change specialization 的缩写；因此要切换到专精 II，你会输入 \"/cs 2\"。",dEN="Tome of Specialization II will allow you to roll a completely new build on your same character, while still being able to simultaneously switch between the two.\n\nYou can purchase a Tome of Specialization for Gold off the Auction House, Donation Points or Honor Points by visiting any Honor Commendation Master.\n\nOnce you used the Tome of Specialization II, you can then switch from your specialization by three different ways:\n\n- Clicking the Spell in the General Tab of your spellbook called \"Specialization II\"\n- Going into the Character Advancement (N keybind)\n- Typing: \"/cs #\" short for change specialiation, so to switch to specialization II you would type \"/cs 2\".",o="学习第二专精。",oEN="Learn a Second Specialization.",p="《专精宝典 II》让你可以在同一角色上获得一套全新的专精，同时还能在两者之间自由切换。\n\n你可以用金币从拍卖行购买专精宝典，或拜访任意荣誉嘉奖大师，用捐赠点数或荣誉点数购买。\n\n使用《专精宝典 II》后，你可以这样切换专精：\n\n- 点击法术书通用标签页中名为\"专精 II\"的法术\n- 进入角色成长（快捷键 N）",pEN="Tome of Specialization II will allow you to roll a completely new build on your same character, while still being able to simultaneously switch between the two.\n\nYou can purchase a Tome of Specialization for Gold off the Auction House, Donation Points or Honor Points by visiting any Honor Commendation Master.\n\nOnce you used the Tome of Specialization II, you can then switch your specialization by:\n\n- Clicking the Spell in the General Tab of your spellbook called \"Specialization II\"\n- Going into the Character Advancement (N keybind)",c="然后你可以通过以下方式切换到专精 II：\n\n- 点击法术书通用标签页中名为\"专精 II\"的法术。\n- 进入角色成长（快捷键 N）并点击专精 II。\n\n你最多可以学习 8 个不同的专精！\n相关",cEN="You can then switch to Specialization II by:\n\n- Clicking the Spell in the General Tab of your spellbook called \"Specialization II\"\n- Going into the Character Advancement (N keybind) and click Specialization II.\n\nYou can learn up to 8 different Specializations!\nRelated"}
Q[580174]={d="头等舱实验传送器让你能在一瞬间从首都前往世界各地或其他首都。\n\n这种传送器位于首都的热闹区域，非常显眼，你不会错过。\n\n你会在数百码的高空被抛下，别担心，我们提供的降落伞刚好够你……安全落地。",dEN="The First Class Experimental Teleporter allows you to get from the Capital City into the World or into other capital cities in a jiffy.\n\nThis Teleporter is located in popular parts of the Capital Cities, it stands out and you won't miss it.\n\nYou will be dropped hundreds of yards into the air, don't worry, we provide a parachute that lasts just long enough to get you to the ground... safely.",o="使用头等舱实验传送器。",oEN="Use the First Class Experimental Teleporter.",p="头等舱实验传送器让你能在一瞬间从首都前往世界各地或其他首都。\n\n这种传送器位于首都的热闹区域，非常显眼，你不会错过。\n\n你会在数百码的高空被抛下，别担心，我们提供的降落伞刚好够你……安全落地。",pEN="The First Class Experimental Teleporter allows you to get from the Capital City into the World or into other capital cities in a jiffy.\n\nThis Teleporter is located in popular parts of the Capital Cities, it stands out and you won't miss it.\n\nYou will be dropped hundreds of yards into the air, don't worry, we provide a parachute that lasts just long enough to get you to the ground... safely.",c="头等舱实验传送器是快速穿越世界的绝佳方式，在高风险中尤其有用！\n相关",cEN="The First Class Experimental Teleporter is a great way to quickly traverse the world and is especially useful in High-Risk!\nRelated"}
Q[580175]={d="战争游戏是飞升的一项功能，让你无需等待排队计时就能排队进入任意战场或竞技场。\n\n战争游戏让你可以免费测试自己的构筑，在把它带进评级竞技场之前与朋友或敌人对战，也能让你的公会与敌对公会一决高下。\n\n要排队进入战争游戏，请在任意首都城市找到泰瑞·格罗兹克。\n\n找到你想对战的朋或敌，选择你的战场或竞技场（小规模战斗我们推荐竞技场），然后开打。",dEN="Wargames are a feature on Ascension that allows you to Queue up any Battleground or Arena with the cost of having no queue timer.\n\nWargames allow you to test out your build for free and play against your friends or foes before taking it into the Rated Arenas or allows your guild to duke it out with your rival guild.\n\nTo queue for a Wargame, locate Teri Glozilk in any Capital City.\n\nFind the friend or foe you wish to play against, select your battleground or arena (we recommend arena for small-scale fights) then begin the fight.",o="完成任意战争游戏。",oEN="Complete any Wargame.",p="要排队进入战争游戏，请在任意首都找到泰瑞·格罗兹克。\n\n找到你想对战的朋或敌，选择你的战场或竞技场（小规模战斗我们推荐竞技场），然后开打。",pEN="To queue for a Wargame, locate Teri Glozilk in any Capital City.\n\nFind the friend or foe you wish to play against, select your battleground or arena (we recommend arena for small-scale fights) then begin the fight.",c="战争游戏是飞升的一项功能，让你无需等待排队时间就能排队进入任意战场或竞技场。\n\n战争游戏让你可以免费测试自己的构筑，在把它带进评级竞技场之前与朋友或敌人对战，也能让你的公会与敌对公会一决高下。\n\n要排队进入战争游戏，请在任意首都城市找到泰瑞·格罗兹克。\n\n找到你想对战的朋或敌，选择你的战场或竞技场（小规模战斗我们推荐竞技场），然后开打。\n相关",cEN="Wargames are a feature on Ascension that allows you to Queue up any Battleground or Arena with the cost of having no queue timer.\n\nWargames allow you to test out your build for free and play against your friends or foes before taking it into the Rated Arenas or allows your guild to duke it out with your rival guild.\n\nTo queue for a Wargame, locate Teri Glozilk in any Capital City.\n\nFind the friend or foe you wish to play against, select your battleground or arena (we recommend arena for small-scale fights) then begin the fight.\nRelated"}
Q[580182]={d="在神秘祭坛上打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选取一个附魔，将其应用到生效附魔槽位，然后选择保存更改以激活你的神秘附魔。\n\n激活收藏中的附魔需要神秘宝珠，可通过告示板的日常任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或击败世界中的敌人获得！\n\n1 个传说附魔可应用于祭坛中央的大槽位。\n\n3 个史诗附魔可应用于内环的中型槽位。\n\n其余槽位中，你可以随意应用任意数量的稀有和优秀附魔。其中许多附魔可叠加至多 3 层。将鼠标悬停在收藏中的附魔上，即可查看其最大叠加层数。",dEN="Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select an Enchant from your Enchant Collections and apply it to an Active Enchant slot, then select Save Changes to activate your Mystic Enchant.\n\nActivating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\n1 Legendary Enchant can be applied to the large center slot in the Altar.\n\n3 Epic Enchants can be applied in the medium slots in the inner ring.\n\nYou can apply as many Rare and Uncommon Enchants in the remaining slots as you'd like. Many of these Enchants can stack up to 3 times. Mousing over the Enchant in the collection reveals its max stack size.",o="前往祭坛，从你的附魔收藏中选用一个神秘附魔，应用到生效附魔槽位。",oEN="Visit an Altar and apply a Mystic Enchant from your Enchant Collection to an Active Enchant slot.",p="给装备附魔是提升装备属性的关键一环。\n\n你可以在世界频道寻找附魔师，也可以在拍卖行搜索\"附魔卷轴\"。\n\n拿到附魔卷轴后，从邮箱中取出，然后对你当前装备的一件物品（左键点击）使用你购买的卷轴（右键点击）。",pEN="Enchanting your gear is a pivotal part of upgrading your Gear's Stats.\n\nYou can look for an enchanter in World Chat or you can search the Auction House for \"Scroll of Enchant\".\n\nOnce you have your Scroll of Enchant, retrieve it from the mailbox and then use the scroll you bought (right-click), on one of your currently equipped items (left-click).",c="从收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，它们可以通过告示板上的每日任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！\n\n祭坛中央的大栏位可以应用 1 个传说附魔。\n\n内圈的中型栏位可以应用 3 个史诗附魔。\n\n其余栏位可以应用任意数量的精良和优秀附魔。其中许多附魔最多可叠加 3 次。把鼠标悬停在收藏中的附魔上，即可看到其最大叠加层数。\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Activating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\n1 Legendary Enchant can be applied to the large center slot in the Altar.\n\n3 Epic Enchants can be applied in the medium slots in the inner ring.\n\nYou can apply as many Rare and Uncommon Enchants in the remaining slots as you'd like. Many of these Enchants can stack up to 3 times. Mousing over the Enchant in the collection reveals its max stack size.\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[580184]={d="与位于沙塔斯城中心的格拉斯交谈。\n\n你可以穿过黑暗之门进入外域，从而找到前往沙塔斯城的路。",dEN="Speak with G'eras located in the centre of Shattrath City.\n\nYou can find your way to Shattrath City by heading through the Dark Portal and into the Outlands.",o="在沙塔斯与格拉斯交谈",oEN="Speak with G'eras in Shattrath",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580186]={d="从神秘祭坛打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选择附魔，填满所有空的主动附魔栏位！如果你无法填满全部 17 个主动附魔栏位，就再收集一些相关的神秘附魔。\n\n从收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，它们可以通过告示板上的每日任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！\n\n祭坛中央的大栏位可以应用 3 个传说附魔。\n\n内圈的中型栏位可以应用 1 个史诗附魔。\n\n其余栏位可以应用任意数量的精良和优秀附魔。其中许多附魔最多可叠加 3 次。把鼠标悬停在收藏中的附魔上，即可看到其最大叠加层数。\n\n填满全部 17 个主动附魔栏位！",dEN="Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select Enchants from your Enchant Collections and fill all empty Active Enchant slots! Collect more relevant Mystic Enchants if you cannot fill all 17 Active Enchant slots.\n\nActivating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\n1 Legendary Enchant can be applied to the large center slot in the Altar.\n\n3 Epic Enchants can be applied in the medium slots in the inner ring.\n\nYou can apply as many Rare and Uncommon Enchants in the remaining slots as you'd like. Many of these Enchants can stack up to 3 times. Mousing over the Enchant in the collection reveals its max stack size.\n\nFill all 17 Active Enchant slots!",o="在全部 17 个主动附魔栏位中激活神秘附魔。",oEN="Activate a Mystic Enchant in all 17 Active Enchant Slots.",c="把你的神秘附魔发挥到极致，将决定你在终局内容中的成败。继续收集强大的神秘附魔，并确保你所有的主动附魔栏位都在强化你的构筑！\n相关",cEN="Maximizing your Mystic Enchants will determine your success in end-game content. Continue collecting powerful Mystic Enchants and ensure all of your Active Enchant slots are empowering your build!\nRelated"}
Q[580187]={d="从神秘祭坛打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选择一个传说附魔，把它应用到中央的主动附魔栏位！\n\n从收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，它们可以通过告示板上的每日任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！\n\n你同时只能拥有 1 个激活的传说附魔。",dEN="Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select a Legendary Enchant from your Enchant Collections and apply it to the center Active Enchant slot!\n\nActivating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\nYou can only have 1 Legendary Enchant active at a time.",o="激活一个传说神秘附魔。",oEN="Activate a Legendary Mystic Enchant.",c="你同时只能拥有 1 个激活的传说附魔。\n\n尝试不同的传说附魔，发现全新的玩法与全新的力量！\n相关",cEN="You can only have 1 Legendary Enchant active at a time.\n\nExperiment with different Legendary Enchants to discover new playstyles and new power!\nRelated"}
Q[580188]={d="从神秘祭坛打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选择一个史诗附魔，把它应用到 3 个史诗主动附魔栏位之一！\n\n从收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，它们可以通过告示板上的每日任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！\n\n你同时可以拥有 3 个不同的激活史诗附魔。",dEN="Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select an Epic Enchant from your Enchant Collections and apply it to one of the 3 Epic Active Enchant slots!\n\nActivating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\nYou can have 3 different Epic Enchants active at a time.",o="激活 3 个史诗神秘附魔。",oEN="Activate 3 Epic Mystic Enchants.",c="你同时可以拥有 3 个不同的激活史诗附魔。\n\n尝试不同的史诗附魔，发现全新的玩法与全新的力量！\n相关",cEN="You can have 3 unique Epic Enchants active at a time.\n\nExperiment with different Epic Enchants to discover new playstyles and new power!\nRelated"}
Q[580189]={d="你一开始拥有 2 个神秘附魔专精。你可以在战斗外的任何时候免费切换附魔专精！\n\n用专精宝典解锁一个新专精，也会解锁一个新的附魔专精。使用神秘附魔：专精宝典可以解锁更多附魔专精！\n\n神秘附魔专精让你可以为主动附魔创建不同的配置。这让你可以：\n- 更换附魔，随时尝试不同的构筑。\n- 如果你使用多专精玩不同的构筑，可以为它们保留不同的附魔配置。\n- 适应特定的场景与战斗。\n- 在 PvE 与 PvP 附魔配置之间快速切换。",dEN="You start with 2 Mystic Enchant Specializations. You can swap your Enchant Specialization anytime outside of combat for free!\n\nUnlocking a new Specialization with a Tome of Specialization will also unlock a new Enchant Specialization. Use Mystic Enchant: Specialization tomes to unlock even more Enchant specs!\n\nMystic Enchanting Specializations allow you to create different loadouts for your Active Enchants. This allows you to:\n- Swap your enchants to try out different builds on the fly.\n- Maintain different Enchant loadouts if you use multi-spec to play different builds.\n- Adapt to specific scenarios and encounters.\n- Quickly switch between PvE and PvP Enchant loadouts.",o="- 从角色成长菜单打开你的附魔收藏，或使用祭坛。\n- 点击左下角的\"更换\"按钮来切换你的附魔专精。\n- 选择一个不同的专精，然后激活。",oEN="- Open your Enchant Collection from the Character Advancement menu or use an Altar.\n- Click the 'Change' button at the bottom left to change your Enchant Specialization.\n- Select a different Specialization then Activate.",c="你一开始拥有 2 个神秘附魔专精。你可以在战斗外的任何时候免费切换附魔专精！\n\n用专精宝典解锁一个新专精，也会解锁一个新的附魔专精。使用神秘附魔专精宝典可以解锁更多附魔专精！\n\n神秘附魔专精让你可以为主动附魔创建不同的配置。这让你可以：\n- 更换附魔，随时尝试不同的构筑。\n- 如果你使用多专精玩不同的构筑，可以为它们保留不同的附魔配置。\n- 适应特定的场景与战斗。\n- 在 PvE 与 PvP 附魔配置之间快速切换。\n相关",cEN="You start with 2 Mystic Enchant Specializations. You can swap your Enchant Specialization anytime outside of combat for free!\n\nUnlocking a new Specialization with a Tome of Specialization will also unlock a new Enchant Specialization. Use Mystic Enchant: Specialization tomes to unlock even more Enchant specs!\n\nMystic Enchanting Specializations allow you to create different loadouts for your Active Enchants. This allows you to:\n- Swap your enchants to try out different builds on the fly.\n- Maintain different Enchant loadouts if you use multi-spec to play different builds.\n- Adapt to specific scenarios and encounters.\n- Quickly switch between PvE and PvP Enchant loadouts.\nRelated"}
Q[580190]={d="世界铸造的神秘附魔无法交易，也无法在祭坛重铸时找到。这些灵魂绑定的神秘附魔必须在世界中探索发现！\n\n获取一张世界铸造的神秘附魔卷轴，并把它保存到你的收藏中。",dEN="Worldforged Mystic Enchants cannot be traded or found when Reforging at the Altar. These soulbound Mystic Enchants must be discovered in the world!\n\nAcquire a Worldforged Mystic Enchant Scroll and save it to your collection.",o="把一个世界铸造的神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏中。",oEN="Save a Worldforged Mystic Enchant to your Enchant Collection.",c="世界铸造的神秘附魔无法交易，也无法在祭坛重铸时找到。这些灵魂绑定的神秘附魔必须在世界中探索发现！\n\n获取一张世界铸造的神秘附魔卷轴，并把它保存到你的收藏中。\n相关",cEN="Worldforged Mystic Enchants cannot be traded or found when Reforging at the Altar. These soulbound Mystic Enchants must be discovered in the world!\n\nAcquire a Worldforged Mystic Enchant Scroll and save it to your collection.\nRelated"}
Q[580193]={d="从神秘祭坛打开附魔收藏标签页，从你的附魔收藏中选择附魔，填满所有空的主动附魔栏位！如果你无法填满全部 17 个主动附魔栏位，就再收集一些相关的神秘附魔。\n\n从收藏中激活附魔需要神秘宝珠，它们可以通过告示板上的每日任务、地下城与团队副本、战场，或在世界中击败敌人获得！\n\n万能牌英雄只能使用精良和优秀附魔，而且大多数最多可叠加 3 次！把鼠标悬停在收藏中的附魔上，即可看到其最大叠加层数。\n\n用精良和优秀附魔填满全部 17 个主动附魔栏位！",dEN="Open the Enchant Collection tab from a Mystic Altar, select Enchants from your Enchant Collections and fill all empty Active Enchant slots! Collect more relevant Mystic Enchants if you cannot fill all 17 Active Enchant slots.\n\nActivating Enchants from your collection requires Mystic Orbs, which can be earned from Daily Quests on the Call Board, Dungeons and Raids, Battlegrounds or defeating enemies in the world!\n\nWildcard Heroes can only use Rare and Uncommon Enchants and most stack up to 3 times! Mousing over the Enchant in the collection reveals its max stack size.\n\nFill all 17 Active Enchant slots with Rare and Uncommon Enchants!",o="在全部 17 个主动附魔栏位中激活神秘附魔。",oEN="Activate a Mystic Enchant in all 17 Active Enchant Slots.",c="把你的神秘附魔发挥到极致，将决定你在终局内容中的成败。继续收集强大的神秘附魔，并确保你所有的主动附魔栏位都在强化你的构筑！\n相关",cEN="Maximizing your Mystic Enchants will determine your success in end-game content. Continue collecting powerful Mystic Enchants and ensure all of your Active Enchant slots are empowering your build!\nRelated"}
Q[580194]={d="收集神秘附魔并扩充你的附魔收藏，会为你带来更多选择和更强力量。\n\n你可以保存到附魔收藏中的神秘附魔数量没有上限。重铸时会继续获得神秘提取物，它们通过完成各种内容获得，也可以在告示板旁的诺兹多姆处用金币或飞升印记购买。\n\n把 10 个神秘附魔保存到你的收藏中。",dEN="Collecting Mystic Enchants and expanding your Enchant Collection will give you more options and more power.\n\nThere is no limit to the number of Mystic Enchants you can save to your Enchant Collection. You will continue earning Mystic Extracts from reforging Reforging, earned by completing various content, and can be bought from Nozdormu next to the Call Board for Gold or Marks of Ascension.\n\nSave 10 Mystic Enchants to your collection.",o="把这 10 个神秘附魔保存到你的附魔收藏中。",oEN="Save 10 Mystic Enchants to your Enchant Collection.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580195]={d="你在万能牌中学到的法术与技能可以用幸运卷轴重抽！\n\n塞拉斯·暗月会每 10 级赠送你免费的幸运卷轴，并在满级时用飞升印记出售幸运卷轴。\n\n试着重抽你最少使用、且没有提升构筑潜力的法术与技能。随着你不断重抽对你的帮助最小的法术，你会获得越来越多能显著强化你构筑的法术。",dEN="The spells and abilities you learn in Wildcard can be rerolled using Scrolls of Fortune!\n\nSilas Darkmoon will grant you free Scrolls of Fortune every 10 levels and offers Scrolls of Fortune at max level for Marks of Ascension.\n\nTry to Reroll your least used spells and abilities that are not increasing your build's potential. As you continue rerolling the spells that help you the least, you will acquire more and more spells that significantly empower your build.",o="- 在首都城市与塞拉斯·暗月交谈，获取幸运卷轴。\n- 按 N 或从菜单栏打开角色成长菜单。\n- 点击你想重抽的技能，然后选择遗忘。",oEN="- Speak to Silas Darkmoon in your Capital City to acquire Scrolls of Fortune.\n- Open your Character Advancement menu with N or from the menu bar.\n- Click an ability you would like to reroll and select Unlearn.",c="你在万能牌中学到的法术与技能可以用幸运卷轴重抽！\n\n塞拉斯·暗月会每 10 级赠送你免费的幸运卷轴，并在满级时用飞升印记出售幸运卷轴。\n\n试着重抽你最少使用、且没有提升构筑潜力的法术与技能。随着你不断重抽对你的帮助最小的法术，你会获得越来越多能显著强化你构筑的法术。\n相关",cEN="The spells and abilities you learn in Wildcard can be rerolled using Scrolls of Fortune!\n\nSilas Darkmoon will grant you free Scrolls of Fortune every 10 levels and offers Scrolls of Fortune at max level for Marks of Ascension.\n\nTry to Reroll your least used spells and abilities that are not increasing your build's potential. As you continue rerolling the spells that help you the least, you will acquire more and more spells that significantly empower your build.\nRelated"}
Q[580196]={d="你在万能牌中学到的天赋可以用幸运卷轴：天赋和幸运卷轴重抽！\n\n塞拉斯·暗月会每 10 级赠送你免费的幸运卷轴，并在满级时用飞升印记出售幸运卷轴。\n\n试着重抽那些不直接提升你力量、或不强化你优先使用技能的天赋！随着你重抽最弱或最不相关的天赋，你的构筑很快就会填满能带来巨大力量的天赋。",dEN="The Talents you learn in Wildcard can be rerolled using Scrolls of Fortune: Talents and Scrolls of Fortune!\n\nSilas Darkmoon will grant you free Scrolls of Fortune every 10 levels and offers Scrolls of Fortune at max level for Marks of Ascension.\n\nTry to Reroll talents that do not directly increase your power or empower abilities you use first! As you reroll your weakest or least relevant talents, your build will quickly fill up with talents that all add immense power.",o="- 在首都城市与塞拉斯·暗月交谈，获取幸运卷轴。\n- 按 N 或从菜单栏打开角色成长菜单。\n- 点击你想重抽的天赋，然后选择遗忘。",oEN="- Speak to Silas Darkmoon in your Capital City to acquire Scrolls of Fortune.\n- Open your Character Advancement menu with N or from the menu bar.\n- Click a Talent you would like to reroll and select Unlearn.",c="你在万能牌中学到的天赋可以用幸运卷轴：天赋和幸运卷轴重抽！\n\n塞拉斯·暗月会每 10 级赠送你免费的幸运卷轴，并在满级时用飞升印记出售幸运卷轴。\n\n试着重抽那些不直接提升你力量、或不强化你优先使用技能的天赋！随着你重抽最弱或最不相关的天赋，你的构筑很快就会填满能带来巨大力量的天赋。\n相关",cEN="The Talents you learn in Wildcard can be rerolled using Scrolls of Fortune: Talents and Scrolls of Fortune!\n\nSilas Darkmoon will grant you free Scrolls of Fortune every 10 levels and offers Scrolls of Fortune at max level for Marks of Ascension.\n\nTry to Reroll talents that do not directly increase your power or empower abilities you use first! As you reroll your weakest or least relevant talents, your build will quickly fill up with talents that all add immense power.\nRelated"}
Q[580197]={d="你可以锁定不想被意外遗忘或重抽的法术与天赋！它们随时可以解锁。\n\n被锁定的法术与天赋还会排在前面。这让你能快速找到要重抽的法术与天赋，并确保你不会重抽那些你还没准备好重抽的！\n\n锁定系统既能保护你的构筑，也让重抽更轻松。",dEN="You can lock Spells and Talents you don't want to accidentally unlearn or reroll! These can be unlocked at any time.\n\nLocked Spells and Talents also sort to the top. This allows you to quickly find spells and talents to reroll and ensures you don't reroll ones you are not ready to!\n\nThe locking system both protects your build and makes rerolling easier.",o="- 打开角色成长菜单\n- 在你想要锁定的技能或天赋上选择锁定图标",oEN="- Open the Character Advancement Menu\n- Select the Lock icon on an ability or talent you would like to lock",c="你可以锁定不想被意外遗忘或重抽的法术与天赋！它们随时可以解锁。\n\n被锁定的法术与天赋还会排在前面。这让你能快速找到要重抽的法术与天赋，并确保你不会重抽那些你还没准备好重抽的！\n\n锁定系统既能保护你的构筑，也让重抽更轻松。\n相关",cEN="You can lock Spells and Talents you don't want to accidentally unlearn or reroll! These can be unlocked at any time.\n\nLocked Spells and Talents also sort to the top. This allows you to quickly find spells and talents to reroll and ensures you don't reroll ones you are not ready to!\n\nThe locking system both protects your build and makes rerolling easier.\nRelated"}
Q[580198]={d="密封卡牌包中包含满级天赋技能卡。\n\n打开这些卡包，收集技能卡，用来更好地掌控未来的构筑，或保证当前构筑中的天赋。\n\n从卡包中翻出的卡牌会自动加入你的帐号通用技能卡收藏。",dEN="Sealed Card Packs contain max-level Talent Skill Cards.\n\nOpen these packs to collect Skill Cards you can use to gain more control of future builds or guarantee talents in your current one.\n\nCards revealed from packs are automatically added to your account-wide Skill Card Collection.",o="- 在首都城市拜访塞拉斯·暗月\n- 完成满级幸运卷轴任务，获取密封卡牌包。\n- 使用你的密封卡牌包将其打开。",oEN="- Visit Silas Darkmoon in a Capital City\n- Complete max level Scroll of Fortune quests to earn Sealed Card Packs.\n- Use your Sealed Card Pack to open it.",c="密封卡牌包中包含技能卡！\n\n打开这些卡包，收集技能卡，用来更好地掌控未来的构筑，或保证当前构筑中的法术与天赋。\n\n你能获得的技能卡数量没有上限，而且你会在大多数内容中获得卡包。随着你继续游玩，你会逐渐集齐自己的技能卡收藏。\n相关",cEN="Sealed Card Packs contain Skill Cards!\n\nOpen these packs to collect Skill Cards you can use to gain more control of future builds or guarantee spells and talents in your current one.\n\nThere is no limit to how many skill cards you can acquire, and you will earn packs through most content. As you continue playing you will fill out your skill card collections.\nRelated"}
Q[580199]={d="金色密封卡牌包中包含金色技能卡！\n\n金色技能卡包与金色卡牌的运作方式与普通技能卡相同，但它们可以填入金色技能卡栏位，随着你开始收集这些卡牌，让你能对自己的构筑拥有更强的掌控力。\n\n打开普通技能卡包时也会定期获得这些卡包，因为你的重复卡牌会转化为免费卡包进度的积累。",dEN="Golden Sealed Card Packs contain Golden Skill Cards!\n\nGolden Skill Cards Packs and Golden Cards function the same as normal Skill Cards, but they can fill the Golden Skill Card slots, allowing even more control of your build as you begin collecting these cards.\n\nThese packs are also acquired periodically when opening Normal Skill Card packs as your duplicate cards are transformed into progress towards free card packs.",o="- 在首都城市拜访塞拉斯·暗月\n- 选择金色技能卡菜单并购买一个金色卡包\n- 使用你的金色密封卡牌包将其打开。",oEN="- Visit Silas Darkmoon in a Capital City\n- Select Golden Skill Cards Menu and buy a Golden Pack\n- Use your Golden Sealed Card Pack to open it.",c="金色密封卡牌包中包含金色技能卡！\n\n金色技能卡包与金色卡牌的运作方式与普通技能卡相同，但它们可以填入金色技能卡栏位，随着你开始收集这些卡牌，让你能对自己的构筑拥有更强的掌控力。\n\n打开普通技能卡包时也会定期获得这些卡包，因为你的重复卡牌会转化为免费卡包进度的积累。\n相关",cEN="Golden Sealed Card Packs contain Golden Skill Cards!\n\nGolden Skill Cards Packs and Golden Cards function the same as normal Skill Cards, but they can fill the Golden Skill Card slots, allowing even more control of your build as you begin collecting these cards.\n\nThese packs are also acquired periodically when opening Normal Skill Card packs as your duplicate cards are transformed into progress towards free card packs.\nRelated"}
Q[580200]={d="打开密封卡牌包时，你会获得暗月奖券。\n\n这些奖券可以在塞拉斯·暗月处兑换普通、优秀、精良和史诗技能卡。攒下你的奖券，去获取对你构筑至关重要的技能卡。\n\n你也可以用暗月奖券购买外观奖励。暗月钱袋让你可以在帐号上的其他角色之间转移暗月奖券。",dEN="You earn Darkmoon tickets when you open Sealed Card Packs.\n\nThese tickets can be redeemed at Silas Darkmoon to buy Normal, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic Skill Cards. Save up your tickets to acquire key skill cards for your build.\n\nYou can also buy cosmetic prizesm for Darkmoon tickets. Darkmoon Pouches allow you to transfer Darkmoon tickets between other characters on your account.",o="- 在首都城市拜访塞拉斯·暗月\n- 选择暗月奖励菜单，即奖励\n- 购买一个暗月奖券钱袋（25）",oEN="- Visit Silas Darkmoon in a Capital City\n- Select Darkmoon Prizes Menu, the Prizes\n- Buy a Darkmoon Ticket Pouch(25)",c="打开密封卡牌包时你会获得暗月奖券。\n\n你可以在塞拉斯·暗月处兑换这些奖券，购买普通、优秀、精良和史诗技能卡。攒下你的奖券，去获取对你构筑至关重要的技能卡。\n\n你也可以用暗月奖券购买外观奖励。暗月钱袋让你可以在帐号上的其他角色之间转移暗月奖券。\n相关",cEN="You earn Darkmoon tickets when you open Sealed Card Packs.\n\nThese tickets can be redeemed at Silas Darkmoon to buy Normal, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic Skill Cards. Save up your tickets to acquire key skill cards for your build.\n\nYou can also buy cosmetic prizesm for Darkmoon tickets. Darkmoon Pouches allow you to transfer Darkmoon tickets between other characters on your account.\nRelated"}
Q[580201]={d="激活技能卡可以保证你抽到那个法术或天赋。\n\n技能卡只能在 1-9 级时激活。你可以随时把技能卡加入收藏，而且你的技能卡收藏在帐号上的所有角色之间共享。新角色和已获得威望的角色都可以使用你已经收集的卡牌。\n\n如果你使用多个专精，可以在某个专精中使用技能卡，直到该专精抽出它的第 5 个法术。",dEN="Activating Skill Cards guarantees that you will roll that Spell or Talent.\n\nSkill Cards can only be activated while you are levels 1-9. You can add Skill Cards to your collection at any time, and your Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account. New characters and Prestiged characters can use cards you have already collected.\n\nIf you use multiple specializations, you can use Skill Cards in a specialization until that specialization rolls its 5th spell.",o="- 打开角色成长\n- 点击技能卡标签页\n- 在 1-9 级时激活一张技能卡。",oEN="- Open Character Advancement\n- Click the Skill Cards tab\n- Activate a Skill Card while you are level 1-9.",c="激活技能卡可以保证你抽到那个法术或天赋！只要有空的技能卡栏位，你可以在任何等级使用技能卡。用技能卡来保证你的构筑获得关键法术和天赋。\n\n在升级过程中使用的技能卡会在最早可用的等级给予你该法术或天赋。在满级时使用，你会在下一次重抽时获得该技能卡。\n\n你最多可以激活 6 张法术与技能技能卡。3 张普通卡和 3 张金色卡。\n\n你最多可以激活 8 张天赋技能卡。4 张普通卡和 4 张金色卡。\n相关",cEN="Activating Skill Cards guarantees that you will roll that Spell or Talent! You can use Skill Cards at any level as long as you have open Skill Card slots. Use Skill Cards to guarantee key spells and talents to your build.\n\nSkill Cards used while leveling will grant you the Spell or Talent at the earliest available level. When used at max level, you will acquire the skill card on your next reroll.\n\nYou can activate up to 6 Spell and Ability Skill Cards. 3 Normal and 3 Golden Cards.\n\nYou can activate up to 8 Talent Skill Cards. 4 Normal and 4 Golden Cards.\nRelated"}
Q[580202]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会自动激活神秘附魔！达到满级会把这些神秘附魔永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中。\n\n这些附魔在不同流派中会在不同等级解锁。继续升级，直到你的全部 3 个史诗神秘附魔都被激活。",dEN="As you level up in your selected Archetype you will automatically activate Mystic Enchants! Reaching max level will permanently unlock these Mystic Enchants in your Enchant Collection.\n\nThese Enchants unlock at different levels for different Archetypes. Continue to gain levels until all 3 of your Epic Mystic Enchants have been activated.",o="通过升级解锁你流派的全部 3 个史诗神秘附魔。",oEN="Unlock all 3 Epic Mystic Enchants for your Archetype by leveling up.",c="你同时可以拥有 3 个不同的激活史诗附魔。",cEN="You can have 3 unique Epic Enchants active at a time."}
Q[580203]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会自动激活神秘附魔！达到满级会把这些神秘附魔永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中。\n\n这些附魔在不同流派中会在不同等级解锁。继续升级，直到你的传说神秘附魔被激活。",dEN="As you level up in your selected Archetype you will automatically activate Mystic Enchants! Reaching max level will permanently unlock these Mystic Enchants in your Enchant Collection.\n\nThese Enchants unlock at different levels for different Archetypes. Continue to gain levels until your LEgendary Mystic Enchant is activated.",o="通过升级解锁你流派的传说神秘附魔。",oEN="Unlock your Legendary Mystic Enchants for your Archetype by leveling up.",c="传说附魔是你流派的核心！同时只能有 1 个处于激活状态。",cEN="Legendary Enchants are core to your Archetype! Only one can be active at a time."}
Q[580204]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会自动激活神秘附魔！达到满级会把这些神秘附魔永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中。\n\n这些附魔在不同流派中会在不同等级解锁。继续升级，直到你全部 17 个神秘附魔栏位都被激活！",dEN="As you level up in your selected Archetype you will automatically activate Mystic Enchants! Reaching max level will permanently unlock these Mystic Enchants in your Enchant Collection.\n\nThese Enchants unlock at different levels for different Archetypes. Continue to gain levels until all 17 of your Mystic Enchant Slots are Active!",o="通过升级解锁你流派的全部 17 个神秘附魔。",oEN="Unlock all 17 Mystic Enchants for your Archetype by leveling up.",c="把你的神秘附魔发挥到极致，将决定你在终局内容中的成败。继续收集强大的神秘附魔，并确保你所有的主动附魔栏位都在强化你的构筑！",cEN="Maximizing your Mystic Enchants will determine your success in end-game content. Continue collecting powerful Mystic Enchants and ensure all of your Active Enchant slots are empowering your build!"}
Q[580205]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会继续自动学习法术、天赋和神秘附魔！\n\n达到满级后，这些神秘附魔会永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中！\n\n随着你不断升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找更接近你等级的任务和生物，以继续获取经验。\n\n按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会让视角拉远，显示完整的世界地图。把鼠标悬停在你当前区域周围的地区上。你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到符合你等级的区域，前往那里发现新任务，继续你的旅程直到 60 级。",dEN="You will continue to automatically learn spells, talents and Mystic Enchants as you level in your chosen Archetype!\n\nThese Mystic Enchants are permanently unlocked in your Enchant Collection upon reaching max level!\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 60.",o="获取足够的经验升到 60 级，把你流派的主动神秘附魔永久解锁到附魔收藏中！",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 60 to permanently unlock the Active Mystic Enchants for your Archetype into your Enchant Collection!",c="在流派中达到 60 级，会永久解锁重建你流派所需的神秘附魔，你可以开始尝试，找出属于自己的独特玩法！\n相关",cEN="Reaching level 60 in your Archetype permantly unlocks the Mystic Enchants required to recreate your Archetype and begin experimenting to find your own unique way to play it!\nRelated"}
Q[580206]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会继续自动学习法术、天赋和神秘附魔！\n\n达到满级后，这些神秘附魔会永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中！\n\n继续你在外域的旅程，获取足够的经验达到 70 级。\n\n随着你不断升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找更接近你等级的任务和生物，以继续获取经验。\n\n按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会让视角拉远，显示完整的世界地图。把鼠标悬停在你当前区域周围的地区上。你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到符合你等级的区域，前往那里发现新任务，继续你的旅程直到 70 级。",dEN="You will continue to automatically learn spells, talents and Mystic Enchants as you level in your chosen Archetype!\n\nThese Mystic Enchants are permanently unlocked in your Enchant Collection upon reaching max level!\n\nContinue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough experience to reach level 70.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.",o="获取足够的经验升到 70 级，把你流派的主动神秘附魔永久解锁到附魔收藏中！",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 70 to permanently unlock the Active Mystic Enchants for your Archetype into your Enchant Collection!",c="在流派中达到 70 级，会永久解锁重建你流派所需的神秘附魔，你可以开始尝试，找出属于自己的独特玩法！\n相关",cEN="Reaching level 70 in your Archetype permantly unlocks the Mystic Enchants required to recreate your Archetype and begin experimenting to find your own unique way to play it!\nRelated"}
Q[580207]={d="随着你在所选流派中升级，你会继续自动学习法术、天赋和神秘附魔！\n\n达到满级后，这些神秘附魔会永久解锁到你的附魔收藏中！\n\n继续你在外域的旅程，获取足够的经验达到 70 级。\n\n随着你不断升级，你需要前往新的区域，寻找更接近你等级的任务和生物，以继续获取经验。\n\n按 M，然后右键点击地图。这会让视角拉远，显示完整的世界地图。把鼠标悬停在你当前区域周围的地区上。你会在地图顶部中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到符合你等级的区域，前往那里发现新任务，继续你的旅程直到 70 级。",dEN="You will continue to automatically learn spells, talents and Mystic Enchants as you level in your chosen Archetype!\n\nThese Mystic Enchants are permanently unlocked in your Enchant Collection upon reaching max level!\n\nContinue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough experience to reach level 70.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.",o="获取足够的经验升到 70 级，把你流派的主动神秘附魔永久解锁到附魔收藏中！",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 70 to permanently unlock the Active Mystic Enchants for your Archetype into your Enchant Collection!",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成手头的任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续向前。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
