Q[580303]={d="史诗地下城考验的不只是你的技术，还有你装备的实力。\n\n要想在其中的试炼中活下来，你必须先把平均物品等级提升到 76。\n\n强化你的武器、护甲和饰品；只有那时，你才准备好深入其中！\n相关",dEN="The Mythic Dungeons test not only your skill but also the strength of your gear.\n\nTo survive the trials within, you must first increase your average item level to 76.\n\nUpgrade your weapons, armor, and trinkets, only then will you be ready to step into the depths!\nRelated",o="为即将到来的挑战做好准备。",oEN="Prepare yourself for the challenges ahead."}
Q[580304]={d="冒险者，卡拉赞的危险不可等闲视之。\n\n在踏入其中之前，你必须强化你的装备。\n\n把物品等级提升到至少 78，你就准备好迎接等待你的试炼了！\n相关",dEN="Adventurer, the dangers of Karazhan are not to be taken lightly.\n\nBefore you set foot inside, you must strengthen your equipment.\n\nRaise your item level to at least 78, and you will be ready to face the trials that await!\nRelated",o="在进入卡拉赞之前做好准备。",oEN="Prepare yourself before entering Karazhan."}
Q[580305]={d="飞升之路：放置一张技能卡",dEN="Path to Ascension: Slot a Skill Card",o="飞升之路：放置一张技能卡",oEN="Path to Ascension: Slot a Skill Card",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[580306]={d="随着等级提升，你会获得随机的法术和天赋。万能牌英雄每 2 级获得一个新法术，每级获得一个新天赋。",dEN="Roll random spells and talents as you level up. Wildcard Heroes roll a new spell every 2 levels and a new talent every level.",o="- 从 10 级开始获得法术和天赋。\n- 每 2 级获得新法术，每级获得新天赋。",oEN="- Begin rolling spells and talents starting at level 10.\n- Roll new spells every 2 levels and talents every level.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580307]={d="使用幸运卷轴，在多个等级重新抽取法术和天赋。随着等级提升，从塞拉斯那里获取更多幸运卷轴。",dEN="Use Scrolls of Fortune to reroll spells and talents at various levels. Get more Scrolls of Fortune from Silas as you level up.",o="- 每 10 级前往你的主城拜访塞拉斯·暗月，领取幸运卷轴。",oEN="- Visit Silas Darkmoon in your Capital City every 10 levels to receive Scrolls of Fortune.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580308]={d="购买你此前已获得但尚未使用的幸运卷轴。每次威望后都可使用此选项。",dEN="Purchase Scrolls of Fortune you have previously earned but not used. This option is available each time you prestige.",o="- 达到满级后，拜访塞拉斯·暗月即可取回任何未使用的幸运卷轴。",oEN="- After reaching max level, buy back any unspent Scrolls of Fortune by visiting Silas Darkmoon.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580309]={d="威望会重置你的角色等级，但保留进度。每次威望都会解锁强大的奖励，让你尝试新的构筑。",dEN="Prestiging resets your character’s level but retains progress. Unlock powerful rewards and try new builds each time you prestige.",o="- 与克罗米交谈，为你的角色威望并重置到 1 级。",oEN="- Talk to Chromie to prestige your character and reset to level 1.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580310]={d="使用快速重抽迅速过掉幸运卷轴，找到最适合你构筑的法术和天赋。",dEN="Use Rapid Rerolling to quickly cycle through Scrolls of Fortune and find the spells and talents that best suit your build.",o="- 在满级时打开角色成长体系，以启用快速重抽模式。",oEN="- Open Character Advancement at max level to enable Rapid Rerolling mode.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[580311]={d="使用英雄建筑师将精选配装导入快速重抽模式。精选配装针对快速成长进行了优化。",dEN="Use the Hero Architect to import Featured Builds into Rapid Rerolling mode. Featured Builds are optimized for rapid progression.",o="- 打开英雄建筑师，选择一套精选专精用于快速重抽。",oEN="- Open the Hero Architect and select a Featured Build to use in Rapid Rerolling.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[599016]={d="有人要我把这个交给你，年轻的<class>。它似乎是一张卷轴，上面绘有神秘的巫毒符号，还绑着异域羽毛，散发着灵魂能量。\n\n它来自罗尔乔库，一位在勇者谷修行的巫医。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它，然后去拜访他。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, young <class>. It appears to be a scroll marked with mystical voodoo symbols and bound with exotic feathers, radiating spiritual energy.\n\nIt is from Rol'joku, a practicing Witch Doctor here in the Valley of Trials. I wouldn't hesitate to read it and pay him a visit before you continue your duties here.",o="阅读灵魂卷轴，前往挑战谷寻找罗尔乔库。",oEN="Read the Spirit Scroll and seek out Rol'joku in the Valley of Trials.",p="灵魂在低语你的名字，年轻的探寻者。你把洛阿许诺的卷轴带来了吗？",pEN="Da spirits whisper your name, young seeker. You bring da scroll da loa promised?",c="我是罗尔乔库，古老传统的守护者。洛阿在我的梦中念出了你的名字，孩子。\n\n巫医之路不属于精神软弱之人。你将与死者交谈，统御暗影与光明，调制能救人也能杀人的药水。先祖会指引你的双手，灵魂会低语他们的秘密。\n\n让我们开始你通往奥秘的旅程吧。洛阿正在等待。",cEN="I am Rol'joku, keeper of da old ways. Da loa have spoken your name in my dreams, child.\n\nDa path of da witch doctor is not for da weak of spirit. You will speak with da dead, command shadow and light, brew potions dat heal or kill. Da ancestors will guide your hands, da spirits will whisper their secrets.\n\nLet us begin your journey into da mysteries. Da loa are waiting."}
Q[608059]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回到你首都的希拉斯·暗月那里，领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon in your capital city to claim your Hands of Fate."}
