Q[650141]={d="有人要我把这个交给你，<name>。它似乎是一块古老的石板，上面刻着原始的野蛮符文，跳动着原初之怒。石头本身就散发着野性的力量，看来是来自阿曼达——她在影谷传授野蛮人之道。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be an ancient tablet carved with primitive barbarian runes that pulse with primal fury. The stone itself radiates wild strength, and it seems to be from Amanda, who teaches the barbarian's way in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="我感觉到原初之怒正在你体内觉醒，<name>。这么说，你想学习狂暴与荒野战斗的野蛮人之道？",pEN="I sense the primal fury awakening within you, <name>. So you wish to learn the barbarian's path of rage and wilderness combat?",c="我能看到原初之怒在你的血脉中觉醒，<name>！你选择了古老的野蛮人之路，拥抱了那股不愿被驯服者血管中流淌的野性狂暴。\n\n作为野蛮人，你将学会把最深处的怒火化为毁灭性的战斗技巧。敌人在你的狂战士之怒面前逃窜，而你的盟友则从你的无畏勇气中汲取力量。自然本身也将成为你的盟友，教你像林中野兽一样战斗。\n\n这条路不适合内心或意志软弱之人。你必须学会以智慧平衡怒火，以荣耀平衡狂暴。但对于掌握了这种平衡的人而言，战场上再没有比一个狂暴全开的野蛮人更可怕的力量。\n\n欢迎你，荒野的兄弟。开始你的训练吧！",cEN="I can see the primal fury awakening in your blood, <name>! You have chosen the ancient path of the barbarian, embracing the wild rage that flows through the veins of those who refuse to be tamed.\n\nAs a Barbarian, you will learn to channel your innermost fury into devastating combat techniques. Your enemies will flee before your berserker rage, while your allies draw strength from your untamed courage. The wilderness itself will become your ally, teaching you to fight like the beasts of the forest.\n\nThis path is not for the weak of heart or mind. You must learn to balance your rage with wisdom, your fury with honor. But for those who master this balance, there is no force more terrifying on the battlefield than a barbarian in full fury.\n\nWelcome, brother of the wild. Let your training begin!"}
Q[650142]={d="有人要我把这个交给你，<name>。它似乎是一张深红色的卷轴，上面沾着可疑的血迹。卷轴以黑暗魔法能量有节奏地脉动着，看来是来自阿拉玛杜斯——那位在影谷修习这些禁忌之术的血法师。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a crimson scroll stained with what looks suspiciously like blood. The parchment pulses rhythmically with dark magical energies, and it seems to be from Aramadus, the blood mage who practices these forbidden arts in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往暗影谷寻找阿拉玛杜斯。",oEN="Seek out Aramadus in Shadowglen.",p="猩红之术已召唤你，<name>。这么说，你想掌握血魔法，把生命本身当作武器？",pEN="The crimson arts have called to you, <name>. So you wish to master blood magic, to wield life itself as your weapon?",c="猩红之术如今在你体内流淌，<name>。我能感觉到你血管中的力量，那份为更强大的魔法力量而牺牲生命本身的意志。你选择了血魔法这条危险的道路。\n\n作为血法师，你将学会操纵生命的本质，把鲜血转化为纯粹的魔法能量。你自己的生命力将驱动威力惊人的法术，而敌人的生命之力则化为你的武器。这是最原始、也最危险的魔法形态。\n\n永远记住，每施放一个法术都有代价。你自己的血、敌人的血、献祭的血……全都化为你这门黑暗艺术的原料。但对于有足够勇气付出这一代价的人，回报远超常人的理解。\n\n猩红之路如今由你去走。愿你的力量随着每一滴洒下的鲜血而增长。",cEN="The crimson art flows through you now, <name>. I can sense the power in your veins, the willingness to sacrifice life itself for greater magical might. You have chosen the dangerous path of blood magic.\n\nAs a Bloodmage, you will learn to manipulate the very essence of life, turning blood into raw magical energy. Your own vitality will fuel spells of incredible power, while your enemies' life force becomes your weapon. This is magic at its most primal and dangerous.\n\nRemember always that every spell cast comes at a cost. Your own blood, your enemies' blood, the blood of sacrifice - all become components in your dark art. But for those brave enough to pay this price, the rewards are beyond ordinary comprehension.\n\nThe crimson path is now yours to walk. May your power grow with each drop spilled."}
Q[650143]={d="有人要我把这个交给你，<name>。它似乎是一份时序手稿，仿佛同时存在于多个时刻。文字在我眼前不断变化，闪现着过去与未来的片段，看来是来自卡莱多姆——那位在影谷传授时光法术的青铜龙。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a temporal manuscript that seems to exist in multiple moments simultaneously. The text shifts before my eyes, showing glimpses of past and future, and it seems to be from Kaleidormu, the bronze dragon who teaches chronamancy in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往暗影谷寻找卡莱多姆。",oEN="Seek out Kaleidormu in Shadowglen.",p="时间本身在你周围弯曲，<name>。这么说，你想研习时光法术，操纵时间现实本身的洪流？",pEN="Time itself bends around you, <name>. So you wish to study chronamancy, to manipulate the very streams of temporal reality?",c="时间本身在你周围流转，<name>！你选择了研习所有魔法技艺中最复杂、最危险的一门：对时间现实本身的操纵。极少有凡人具备时光术士所需的心智纪律。\n\n作为时光术士，你将学会把敌人减速到如雕像般迟缓，让盟友加速到超凡的速度，甚至窥见过去与未来的回响。时间之织本身都将屈从于你的意志。\n\n这门魔法要求完美的精准和不可动摇的专注。一次计算失误就可能让你困在时间循环中，几秒之内苍老数十年，或者更糟。但一旦掌握这些技巧，你在战斗中几乎无人能敌。\n\n时间的洪流等待你的号令。让我们从时间操纵的基本原理开始。",cEN="Time itself shifts around you, <name>! You have chosen to study the most complex and dangerous of all magical arts - the manipulation of temporal reality itself. Few mortals possess the mental discipline required for chronamancy.\n\nAs a Chronomancer, you will learn to slow your enemies until they move like statues, accelerate your allies to superhuman speed, and even glimpse echoes of past and future events. The very fabric of time will bend to your will.\n\nThis magic demands perfect precision and unwavering focus. A single miscalculation could trap you in temporal loops, age you decades in seconds, or worse. But master these techniques, and you will become nearly untouchable in battle.\n\nThe streams of time await your command. Let us begin with the fundamental principles of temporal manipulation."}
Q[650144]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一张低语卷轴，上面覆满了不直接注视时就会改变的符号。怪异的嗓音从其中回响而出，看来是来自赛琳娜·影纱——她在影谷与禁忌之力相通。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a whispered parchment covered in symbols that shift when not observed directly. Strange voices echo from within, and it seems to be from Saelina Shedana, who communes with forbidden powers in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往暗影谷寻找赛琳娜·影纱。",oEN="Seek out Saelina Shedana in Shadowglen.",p="低语在你面前变得更强了，<name>。这么说，你想侍奉古神，学习邪教徒的禁忌之术？",pEN="The whispers grow stronger in your presence, <name>. So you wish to serve the Old Ones and learn the cultist's forbidden arts?",c="既然你已加入我们，低语就变得更加响亮了，<name>。我能听见古神谈论你的潜力，他们远古的嗓音乘着常人心智无法感知的风传来。你选择了禁忌知识的道路。\n\n作为邪教徒，你将学会与超越凡人理解的实体沟通，通过危险的契约与奥术智慧获取力量。你的魔法将连接先于文明本身存在的力量。\n\n这种知识伴随着巨大的风险。低语会将脆弱的心智引向疯狂，而你接触的存在并不在乎凡人的事务。但对于有力量抵御的人而言，宇宙本身的秘密触手可及。\n\n仔细听我所教。古神始终在注视，绝不容忍侍奉者的失败。",cEN="The whispers grow stronger now that you have joined us, <name>. I can hear the Old Ones speaking of your potential, their ancient voices carried on winds that normal minds cannot perceive. You have chosen the path of forbidden knowledge.\n\nAs a Cultist, you will learn to commune with entities that exist beyond mortal understanding, gaining power through dangerous pacts and eldritch wisdom. Your magic will tap into forces that predate civilization itself.\n\nThis knowledge comes with great risk. The whispers can drive weak minds to madness, and the beings you contact care nothing for mortal concerns. But for those with the strength to endure, the secrets of the universe itself lie within reach.\n\nListen carefully to what I teach you. The Old Ones are always watching, and they do not tolerate failure from those who serve them."}
Q[650145]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份恶魔契约，裹在绿色的邪能火焰中。卷轴上写着灼目的地狱文字，看来是来自邪能之触的艾莉瑞——她在影谷教导他人束缚恶魔之力。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a demonic contract wreathed in green fel flames. The parchment bears infernal script that sears the eyes, and it seems to be from Elyri the Fel-Touched, who teaches others to bind demonic power in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往暗影谷寻找邪能之触的弗洛齐。",oEN="Seek out Flowzie the Fel-Touched in Shadowglen.",p="邪能自你的灵魂中散发而出，<name>。这么说，你想成为烈焰誓约者，统御恶魔之力？",pEN="Fel energy radiates from your soul, <name>. So you wish to become Felsworn, to command demonic power?",c="邪能如今认可了你，<name>。你的灵魂带着印记，属于那些毫不犹豫拥抱恶魔之力的人。在一个由火焰与毁灭统治的时代，只有强大到足以夺取腐化的人才能生存。\n\n作为恶魔猎手的一员，你将通过支配与契约束缚恶魔精华，从扭曲虚空中撕出地狱盟友，让燃烧军团的烈焰臣服于你的意志。这种力量从来就不该被禁锢。它生来就是供人夺取的。\n\n走上这条路的人中，许多都因缺乏统御意志而被腐化吞噬。而你不同。恶魔的低语不是警告，而是启示，是只提供给足够冷酷者的真相。\n\n邪能烈焰如今在你体内燃烧。让它吞噬疑虑、怜悯与软弱。力量本身就是理由。愿这份馈赠将世界重塑为你的模样。",cEN="The fel energies recognize you now, <name>. Your soul bears the mark of one willing to embrace demonic power without hesitation. In an age ruled by fire and ruin, only those strong enough to claim corruption survive.\n\nAs one of the Felsworn, you will bind demonic essence through domination and pact, tearing infernal allies from the Twisting Nether and bending the fires of the Burning Legion to your will. This power was never meant to be restrained. It exists to be taken.\n\nMany who walk this path are consumed by corruption because they lack the will to command it. You will not. The whispers of demons are not warnings but revelations, truths offered only to those ruthless enough to listen.\n\nThe fel flames burn within you now. Let them consume doubt, mercy, and weakness. Power is its own justification. May this gift remake the world in your image."}
Q[650146]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份刻有庄严守护誓言的圣佑。卷轴散发着不可动摇的防御光环，看来是来自内德里斯·暗击——他献身于保护他人。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be sacred warding inscribed with solemn vows of protection. The parchment radiates an aura of unbreakable defense, and it seems to be from Nerdris Darkstrike, who has dedicated herself to protecting others. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="你的守护光环闪耀得十分明亮，<name>。这么说，你想成为守护者，保护他人免受一切邪恶侵害？",pEN="Your protective aura shines brightly, <name>. So you wish to become a Guardian, to shield others from all harm?",c="神圣的守护之力在你周围增强，<name>！你接受了最高尚的使命：做一名永恒的守护者，毫不犹豫、毫不动摇地把他人的安危置于自己之前。\n\n作为守护者，你将学会化身为一座活堡垒，用你的身体与魔法在盟友与伤害之间筑起一道不可逾越的屏障。你的防御技巧让你几乎刀枪不入，而你的保护法术将让整个小队远离危险。\n\n这条路需要无私的奉献。你要替他人承受痛苦，要直面死亡以便他人得以存活。荣耀与赞誉往往与那些阻止灾难、而非制造灾难的人擦肩而过。但你要知道，没有比守护无辜生命更高的荣誉。\n\n泰达希尔本身祝福你的守护誓言。随时做好准备，守护者；这个世界非常需要你的牺牲。",cEN="The sacred ward strengthens around you, <name>! You have accepted the most noble of callings - to serve as an eternal guardian, placing the safety of others above your own without question or hesitation.\n\nAs a Guardian, you will learn to become a living fortress, your body and magic forming an impenetrable barrier between your allies and harm. Your defensive techniques will make you nearly invulnerable, while your protective spells shield entire groups from danger.\n\nThis path requires selfless dedication. You will endure pain so others need not, face death so others may live. Glory and recognition often pass by those who prevent disaster rather than cause it. But know that there is no higher honor than preserving innocent lives.\n\nTeldrassil itself blesses your vow of protection. Stand ready, guardian - the world has great need of your sacrifice."}
Q[650147]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份盖有索罗斯印记的黑暗檄文，裹在冰冷的暗影烈焰中。文书讲述的是执掌黑暗以侍奉光明，看来是来自阿赫拉瓦拉——她在影谷走着这条危险的道路。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a dark proclamation bearing the seal of Xoroth, wreathed in cold shadow flames. The document speaks of wielding darkness in service of light, and it seems to be from Aheravara, who walks this dangerous path in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="暗影与荣耀同时召唤你，<name>。这么说，你想加入克索诺斯骑士，执掌黑暗以侍奉光明？",pEN="Shadow and honor both call to you, <name>. So you wish to join the Knights of Xoroth, to wield darkness in service of light?",c="暗影拥抱着你，而荣耀指引着你，<name>。你选择了最矛盾的一条路：执掌黑暗以侍奉光明，成为克索诺斯骑士。\n\n作为克索诺斯骑士，你将学会在坚守道德准则的同时引导虚空能量与暗影魔法。你的黑暗法术会让那些期待圣骑士般角色施放神圣魔法的敌人措手不及，而你正义的事业则为他人眼中的禁忌手段提供了正当性。\n\n这条路行走在救赎与沉沦之间的刀锋上。即便从暗影中汲取力量，你也绝不能任由黑暗吞噬你的信念。你的誓言要求你不惜一切代价保护无辜者。\n\n虚空低语着轻易获得力量的承诺，但你的荣耀必须比任何诱惑都更坚定。欢迎加入教团，黑暗圣骑士。",cEN="The shadow embraces you while honor guides you, <name>. You have chosen the most paradoxical of paths - to wield darkness in service of the light, to become a Knight of Xoroth.\n\nAs a Knight of Xoroth, you will learn to channel void energy and shadow magic while maintaining your moral principles. Your dark spells will confound enemies who expect holy magic from a paladin-like figure, while your righteous cause justifies methods others would consider forbidden.\n\nThis path walks the razor's edge between salvation and damnation. You must never let the darkness consume your purpose, even as you draw power from the shadows. Your oath binds you to protect the innocent through whatever means necessary.\n\nThe void whispers promises of easy power, but your honor must be stronger than any temptation. Welcome to the Order, dark paladin."}
Q[650148]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一部与骸骨相连的抄本，使周围的空气都变冷了。我能听见逝者的微弱低语从书页中传出，看来是来自奥金尼的巴雷拉姆——他在影谷修习通灵术。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a bone-bound codex that chills the air around it. I can hear faint whispers of the departed emanating from its pages, and it seems to be from Baarelam of the Auchenai, who practices necromancy in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往影谷寻找奥金尼的巴雷拉姆。",oEN="Seek out Baarelam of the Auchenai in Shadowglen.",p="亡者的灵魂在向你低语，<name>。这么说，你想成为死灵法师，引导灵魂穿梭于诸界之间？",pEN="The spirits of the dead whisper around you, <name>. So you wish to become a Necromancer, to shepherd souls between worlds?",c="死亡承认你是它的仆从，<name>，但不是它的主人。你选择成为诸界之间的牧者，引导灵魂归于应有的安息，并为正义的目的统御亡者之力。\n\n作为死灵法师，你将学会与死者交谈、唤起骷髅仆从，操纵生死本身的本质。但永远记住，这种力量的存在是为了维护自然秩序，而不是嘲弄它。\n\n许多人畏惧通灵术，只看到它可能带来的腐化。但真正的死灵法师是生死边界的守护者，确保亡者安息，并在必要时让他们的知识帮助生者。\n\n逝者的灵魂低语着认可你的选择。明智地使用这份力量，并永远记住：死亡不是终点，而是一次过渡。",cEN="Death recognizes you as its servant, <name>, but not as its master. You have chosen to become a shepherd between worlds, guiding souls to their proper rest and commanding the power of undeath for righteous purposes.\n\nAs a Necromancer, you will learn to speak with the dead, raise skeletal servants, and manipulate the very essence of life and death. But remember always that this power exists to preserve the natural order, not to mock it.\n\nMany fear necromancy, seeing only the corruption it can bring. But true necromancers serve as guardians of the boundary between life and death, ensuring that the dead rest peacefully and that their knowledge aids the living when needed.\n\nThe spirits of the departed whisper their approval of your choice. Use this power wisely, and may you always remember that death is not an end, but a transition."}
Q[650149]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一张元素卷轴，噼啪作响地散发着原初能量。微型的风暴、火焰与地震在其表面翻涌，看来是来自普利穆拉——她在影谷统御元素。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be an elemental scroll that crackles with primal energy. Miniature storms, flames, and earthen tremors swirl across its surface, and it seems to be from Prim'ula, who commands the elements in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="元素回应着你的存在，<name>。这么说，你想成为仪祭师，统御自然的纯粹之力？",pEN="The elements respond to your presence, <name>. So you wish to become a Primalist, to command the raw forces of nature?",c="纯粹的元素如今流经你的全身，<name>！你选择拥抱创世最原初的力量，成为土、气、火、水最纯粹形态的导体。\n\n作为仪祭师，你将学会以前所未有的力量与狂怒统御元素魔法。你的法术将召来火山喷发、毁灭性的地震、飓风般强劲的狂风与骤发的洪水。现实的构成本身都将回应你的召唤。\n\n这种力量源自世界的根基，比任何凡人构想出的魔法都更古老、更危险。元素并不在乎文明的事务：它们只回应力量与敬畏。露出软弱，你就会被它们吞噬。\n\n原初之力已接纳你为它们的勇士。愿你证明自己配得上执掌创世根本的力量。",cEN="The raw elements surge through you now, <name>! You have chosen to embrace the most primal forces of creation itself, becoming a conduit for earth, air, fire, and water in their purest forms.\n\nAs a Primalist, you will learn to command elemental magic with unprecedented power and fury. Your spells will call forth volcanic eruptions, devastating earthquakes, hurricane-force winds, and flash floods. The very building blocks of reality will answer your call.\n\nThis power comes from the world's foundation itself, older and more dangerous than any magic devised by mortals. The elements care nothing for civilization's concerns - they respond only to strength and respect. Show weakness, and they will consume you.\n\nThe primal forces have accepted you as their champion. May you prove worthy of wielding the fundamental powers of creation itself."}
Q[650150]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一张被自然侵蚀的卷轴，却仍保留着荒野的痕迹：松针、苔藓，以及古老森林的气息。看来是来自海德里尔·羽翔——那位守护影谷森林的游侠。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a nature-worn parchment that still bears traces of the deep wilderness - pine needles, moss, and the scent of ancient forests. It seems to be from Hydriel Featherflight, the ranger who protects the wilds of Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="荒野在召唤你的心，<name>。这么说，你想成为游侠，守护泰达希尔的圣地林苑？",pEN="The wilderness calls to your heart, <name>. So you wish to become a Ranger, to protect Teldrassil's sacred groves?",c="荒野认出了自己的同类，<name>！我能从你眼中看到森林的祝福，那份标记着真正游侠的野性召唤。你选择成为自然本身的守护者。\n\n作为游侠，你将学会在任何地形上无声穿行，像兄弟一样与野兽交谈，并从阴影中以致命精准发动攻击。森林会遮蔽你，动物会协助你，敌人永远看不到死亡的逼近。\n\n泰达希尔的圣地林苑有太多东西要教你。你将学会解读他人忽略的征兆，在任何地面上追踪猎物，并在最极端的自然环境中生存。你的弓将唱起死亡之歌，你的刀刃将尝到威胁自然世界者的鲜血。\n\n森林之灵欢迎它们新的守护者。愿你的箭矢精准飞翔，愿你的行踪对心怀恶意者永远隐秘。",cEN="The wilderness recognizes one of its own, <name>! I can see the forest's blessing in your eyes, the call of the wild that marks true Rangers. You have chosen to become a guardian of nature itself.\n\nAs a Ranger, you will learn to move unseen through any terrain, to communicate with wild beasts as brothers, and to strike from the shadows with deadly precision. The forests will hide you, the animals will aid you, and your enemies will never see death approaching.\n\nTeldrassil's sacred groves have much to teach you. You will learn to read the signs that others miss, to track prey across any surface, and to survive in the harshest wilderness. Your bow will sing death songs, and your blade will taste the blood of those who threaten the natural world.\n\nThe forest spirits welcome their new protector. May your arrows fly true and your path remain hidden from those who would do harm."}
Q[650151]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一封用黑色皮革装订的阴森信函，仿佛在吸取周围的光。书页上萦绕着深秋的气息，看来是来自幽影坎尼——他在影谷行走于生死之间。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a grim letter bound in black leather that seems to drain light from its surroundings. The scent of autumn's end clings to its pages, and it seems to be from Canni the Shade, who walks between life and death in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="生与死同样在你身上流淌，<name>。这么说，你想成为死神，在灵魂时限到来时收割它们？",pEN="Life and death flow through you equally, <name>. So you wish to become a Reaper, to harvest souls when their time comes?",c="永恒的收割在召唤你，<name>。你选择侍奉生死轮回本身，在指定的时刻成为灵魂的收割者。\n\n作为死神，你将学会感知一个存在何时大限已至，温柔地引导灵魂归于安息，并收割那些抗拒自然归宿者的生命之力。你的魔法从生死之间那道界限中汲取力量。\n\n这不是刺客的道路，而是一位确保自然秩序延续的神圣使者之路。你将学会分辨哪些生命应当被拯救、哪些应当终结，分辨仁慈与必要的职责。\n\n存在本身的轮回已选你为它的仆从。愿你永远记得：你的目的不是带来死亡，而是确保生命的旅程得到恰当的了结。",cEN="The eternal harvest calls to you, <name>. You have chosen to serve the cycle of life and death itself, becoming a reaper of souls when their appointed time arrives.\n\nAs a Reaper, you will learn to sense when a being's time has come, to guide souls gently to their rest, and to harvest the life force of those who refuse their natural fate. Your magic draws power from the boundary between life and death itself.\n\nThis is not the path of a murderer, but of a divine agent ensuring the natural order continues. You will learn to distinguish between a life that should be saved and one that must end, between mercy and necessary duty.\n\nThe cycle of existence itself has chosen you as its servant. May you always remember that your purpose is not to bring death, but to ensure that life's journey reaches its proper conclusion."}
Q[650152]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一块刻有发光符文的石板，跳动着原初的力量。这些符号看起来比文明本身还要古老，看来是来自雷瑟尔·达尔特拉尔——那位居住在影谷的符文大师。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be an inscribed tablet carved with glowing runes that pulse with primordial power. The symbols seem older than civilization itself, and it seems to be from Raethere Daltrall, the runemaster who dwells in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="一股古老的力量在你面前苏醒，<name>。这么说，你想成为符文大师，将魔法镌刻于石头与钢铁之中？",pEN="Ancient power stirs in your presence, <name>. So you wish to become a Runemaster, to carve magic into stone and steel?",c="古老的符文因认可而脉动，<name>！你选择了掌握文明所知最古老的魔法形态：以完美精准把符号镌刻于石头与钢铁之上的力量。\n\n作为符文大师，你将学会铭刻比创造它们的文明更持久的魔法公式。你的附魔将镌入现实之织，创造出在其他魔法消散之后仍长久存续的效果。\n\n这门技艺要求绝对的精准。一条线放错位置，就可能把保护结界变成致命陷阱；而完美的施展则能创造出看似不可能的奇迹。你的工具是锤与凿，但你真正的武器是知识，以及耐心。\n\n催生符文魔法的原初之力认可你的价值。愿你的铭刻无可挑剔，愿你的附魔永世长存。",cEN="The ancient runes pulse with recognition, <name>! You have chosen to master the oldest form of magic known to civilization - the power of symbols carved into stone and steel with perfect precision.\n\nAs a Runemaster, you will learn to inscribe magical formulae that outlast the civilizations that created them. Your enchantments will be carved into the very fabric of reality, creating effects that endure long after other magic has faded.\n\nThis art requires absolute precision. A single misplaced line can turn a protection ward into a death trap, while perfect execution can create wonders that seem impossible. Your tools are hammer and chisel, but your true weapons are knowledge and patience.\n\nThe primordial powers that gave birth to runic magic acknowledge your worth. May your inscriptions be flawless and your enchantments eternal."}
Q[650153]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一封天界信函，里面装着闪烁着真正星光的天体图。卷轴摸起来温热，尽管散发着空灵的寒意，看来是来自女猎手娜莉亚——她在影谷研究星辰。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a celestial chart containing star maps that twinkle with actual starlight. The parchment is warm to the touch despite its ethereal coldness, and it seems to be from Huntress Naalia, who studies the stars in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往影谷寻找女猎手娜莉亚。",oEN="Seek out Huntress Naalia in Shadowglen.",p="你靠近时，星辰更加明亮了，<name>。这么说，你想成为唤星者，引导天界魔法？",pEN="The stars shine brighter when you are near, <name>. So you wish to become a Starcaller, to channel celestial magic?",c="星辰本身在你面前更加明亮，<name>！你选择了研习天界之术，从无尽夜空中那些环绕你头顶旋转的遥远星光中汲取魔法力量。\n\n作为唤星者，你将学会解读书写于天际的宇宙图样，把星辰能量引导为毁灭性的法术，并借星象占卜窥见未来。天空本身将成为你的力量之源。\n\n艾露恩的祝福已为你铺好这条路，但你要学会求助于所有的星辰，而不只是我们的月之女神。每个星座都赐予不同的天赋，每个天体都为理解其本质者提供独特的能量。\n\n宇宙之力欢迎它们新的学生。愿星光照引你的法术，愿天界智慧照亮你穿越黑暗的道路。",cEN="The stars themselves shine brighter in your presence, <name>! You have chosen to study the celestial arts, drawing magical power from the distant lights that wheel overhead through the endless night.\n\nAs a Starcaller, you will learn to read the cosmic patterns written across the sky, to channel stellar energy into devastating spells, and to glimpse the future through astrological divination. The very heavens will become your source of power.\n\nElune's blessing has prepared you well for this path, but you will learn to draw upon all the stars, not just our moon goddess. Each constellation offers different gifts, each celestial body provides unique energies for those who understand their nature.\n\nThe cosmic forces welcome their new student. May the starlight guide your spells and the celestial wisdom illuminate your path through the darkness."}
Q[650154]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份风暴手稿，噼啪作响地散发着电能。书页中隐隐传来雷鸣，看来是来自库鲁——那位在影谷统御风暴的风暴使者。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a storm manuscript that crackles with electrical energy. Thunder rumbles softly from within its pages, and it seems to be from Q'ru, the stormbringer who commands tempests in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",o="前往影谷寻找库鲁。",oEN="Seek out Q'ru in Shadowglen.",p="你的到来令雷声轰鸣，<name>。这么说，你想成为风暴使者，统御狂风与闪电？",pEN="Thunder rumbles at your approach, <name>. So you wish to become a Stormbringer, to command wind and lightning?",c="雷霆在天空中回响，以示认可，<name>！你选择成为风暴本身的主人，把狂风与闪电的怒意当作武器。\n\n作为风暴使者，你将学会从晴朗的天空中召来暴风雨，唤出劈开山岳的闪电，并在战斗中驾驭狂风本身。大气都将屈从于你的意志，化为一件具有毁灭性力量的武器。\n\n这门魔法如风暴本身一般纯粹而狂野。你必须学会驾驭它的怒火而不被其吞噬，统御它的力量而不迷失于它的混沌本质。风暴只尊重力量与决心。\n\n暴风雨之灵已标记你为它们的勇士。愿你的闪电永不脱靶，愿你的狂风永远带你走向胜利。",cEN="Thunder rolls across the heavens in recognition, <name>! You have chosen to become a master of the storm itself, wielding the fury of wind and lightning as your weapons.\n\nAs a Stormbringer, you will learn to summon tempests from clear skies, to call down lightning that splits mountains, and to ride the wind itself into battle. The very atmosphere will bend to your will, becoming a weapon of devastating power.\n\nThis magic is raw and untamed, like the storms themselves. You must learn to harness its fury without being consumed by it, to direct its power without losing yourself in its chaotic nature. The storm respects only strength and determination.\n\nThe tempest spirits have marked you as their champion. May your lightning never miss its target and your winds never fail to carry you to victory."}
Q[650155]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份金色文书，散发着黎明温暖的光芒。这份受祝福的卷轴闪烁着治疗能量，看来是来自埃索达的泰露萨拉——那位为影谷带来光明的太阳祭司。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a golden scripture that radiates the warm light of dawn. Blessed parchment glows with healing energy, and it seems to be from Exodite Telusaara, the sun cleric who brings light to Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="神圣之光自你身上散发，<name>。这么说，你想成为太阳祭司，以黎明的力量治愈他人？",pEN="Holy light radiates from your being, <name>. So you wish to become a Sun Cleric, to heal with the power of dawn?",c="圣光以炽热的温暖拥抱你，<name>！你选择成为治愈与希望的灯塔，引导黎明本身的纯粹力量，驱散世间的黑暗。\n\n作为太阳祭司，你将学会治愈他人眼中致命的创伤，净化已在凡人灵魂中扎根的腐化，并召来只焚烧邪恶的净化之火。你只需在场，就能给受苦之人带来慰藉。\n\n这条路要求不可动摇的怜悯，以及对他人福祉的绝对奉献。你会因治疗陌生人而精疲力竭，会为保护无辜者而冒生命危险，会直面他人逃避的黑暗。\n\n黎明本身祝福你神圣的使命。愿你的光芒永不黯淡，愿你把希望带给那些迷失在最黑暗夜晚中的人。",cEN="The Light embraces you with radiant warmth, <name>! You have chosen to become a beacon of healing and hope, channeling the pure power of dawn itself to banish darkness from the world.\n\nAs a Sun Cleric, you will learn to heal wounds that others consider fatal, to purify corruption that has taken root in mortal souls, and to call down cleansing fire that burns only evil. Your presence alone will bring comfort to the suffering.\n\nThis path demands unwavering compassion and absolute dedication to the welfare of others. You will exhaust yourself healing strangers, risk your life protecting the innocent, and face the darkness that others flee from.\n\nThe dawn itself blesses your sacred calling. May your light never dim, and may you always bring hope to those lost in the darkest nights."}
Q[650156]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一份写在受祝福卷轴上的神圣誓言，散发着圣光。这文书让附近的人心中充满勇气，看来是来自艾蕾奥拉——她在影谷担任圣殿骑士。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a sacred vow written on blessed parchment that emanates holy light. The document fills nearby hearts with courage, and it seems to be from Elleora, who serves as a templar in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="神圣的正义在你心中燃烧，<name>。这么说，你想成为圣殿骑士，做一名神圣的战士？",pEN="Divine justice burns within you, <name>. So you wish to become a Templar, to serve as a holy warrior?",c="神圣的正义如熔金般流经你的全身，<name>！你已立下圣殿骑士的神圣誓言，选择成为侍奉正义本身的神圣战士。\n\n作为圣殿骑士，你将学会把神圣之力引导为粉碎邪恶的重击，用受祝福的魔法治疗盟友，并在最黑暗的时刻屹立为不可动摇的信仰之柱。你的剑将由神圣意志指引，你的盾将由正义之怒强化。\n\n这一使命要求绝对的道德清明，以及对正义不可动摇的奉献。你必须既是审判者又是行刑者，既是治疗者又是保护者，一切都要遵循超越凡人理解的神圣智慧。\n\n圣光本身已选你为它的勇士。愿你的信仰成为力量，愿你的信念成为武器，愿你的正义成为永恒的指引。",cEN="Divine justice flows through you like molten gold, <name>! You have sworn the sacred oaths of the Templar, choosing to become a holy warrior in service to righteousness itself.\n\nAs a Templar, you will learn to channel divine power into crushing blows against evil, to heal your allies with blessed magic, and to stand as an unshakeable pillar of faith in the darkest times. Your sword will be guided by divine will, your shield empowered by righteous fury.\n\nThis calling demands absolute moral clarity and unwavering dedication to justice. You must be judge and executioner, healer and protector, all guided by divine wisdom that transcends mortal understanding.\n\nThe Light itself has chosen you as its champion. May your faith be your strength, your conviction your weapon, and your righteousness your eternal guide."}
Q[650157]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是塞满精密图纸的机械设计方案。我能听见书页中传出微弱的发条声，看来是来自乔罗·迅锥——那位在影谷工作的发明家。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be mechanical schematics filled with intricate blueprints. I can hear the faint sound of ticking clockwork mechanisms emanating from the pages, and it seems to be from Joro Rapidspyre, the tinker who works in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="创新的火花在你脑中迸发，<name>。这么说，你想成为工匠，把魔法与机械结合起来？",pEN="Innovation sparks in your mind, <name>. So you wish to become a Tinker, to blend magic and machinery?",c="一个绝妙的创意在你脑中涌现，<name>！你选择了走上连接魔法与机械的道路，创造结合奥术力量与机械精度的奇迹。\n\n作为工匠，你将学会制造那些只懂传统魔法或世俗工程之人眼中不可能存在的装置。你的发明将帮助盟友、迷惑敌人，并证明进步与守护能够和谐共存。\n\n泰达希尔对机械之术而言似乎是个不太可能的地方，但自然本身就是最伟大的工程师。你将学会创造顺应自然之力、而非与之对抗的装置，证明科技能够增进而非取代自然的智慧。\n\n创新的齿轮正朝你转动。愿你的发明既是功能的奇迹，也是美的奇迹，在服务进步的同时不背弃自然世界。",cEN="Brilliant innovation sparks in your mind, <name>! You have chosen to walk the path that bridges magic and machinery, creating wonders that blend arcane power with mechanical precision.\n\nAs a Tinker, you will learn to construct devices that seem impossible to those who understand only traditional magic or mundane engineering. Your inventions will aid allies, confound enemies, and demonstrate that progress and preservation can work in harmony.\n\nTeldrassil may seem an unlikely place for mechanical arts, but nature itself is the greatest engineer of all. You will learn to create devices that work with natural forces rather than against them, proving that technology can enhance rather than replace the wisdom of the wild.\n\nThe gears of innovation turn in your favor. May your inventions be marvels of both function and beauty, serving progress without abandoning the natural world."}
Q[650158]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一部皮革汇编，散发着异域毒素的恶臭，偶尔有绿色蒸气从书页间渗出。看来是来自科拉尔·换牙——他在影谷研究毒药与解药之术。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a leather compendium reeking of exotic toxins, with green vapors occasionally seeping from between its pages. It seems to be from Ko'rahl Fangshifter, who studies the art of venoms and antidotes in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="毒与解药之间的平衡在召唤你，<name>。这么说，你想成为剧毒术士，同时掌握剧毒与治愈？",pEN="The balance of toxin and antidote calls to you, <name>. So you wish to become a Venomancer, to master poison and cure?",c="生死之间、毒与解药之间的平衡如今流经你的全身，<name>。你选择掌握毒素的双重本质：它伤害的力量，与它同样强大的治愈之力。\n\n作为剧毒术士，你将学会调配能击倒最强大敌人的致命毒药，也能制造解药与疗法，拯救他人眼中毫无希望的生命。只要理解了其中原理，每种毒药都有其对应之物，每种毒素都有其解药。\n\n这种知识伴随着巨大的责任。杀死一头腐化野兽的化合物，同样可能救活一个中毒的孩子。你的智慧必须指引何时释放死亡、何时守护生命，因为你所施展的力量是双刃的。\n\n自然平衡认可你的领悟。愿你的毒药精准地击中邪恶，愿你的解药为无辜者带来治愈。",cEN="The balance of life and death, poison and antidote, flows through you now, <name>. You have chosen to master the dual nature of toxins - their power to harm and their equal power to heal.\n\nAs a Venomancer, you will learn to brew deadly venoms that can fell the mightiest enemies, but also to create antidotes and cures that can save lives others consider beyond hope. Every poison has its counter, every toxin its remedy, if one understands the principles involved.\n\nThis knowledge carries great responsibility. The same compound that kills a corrupted beast might save a poisoned child. Your wisdom must guide when to unleash death and when to preserve life, for the power you wield cuts both ways.\n\nThe natural balance recognizes your understanding. May your venoms strike true against evil, and your cures bring healing to the innocent."}
Q[650159]={d="有人要我把这个告诉你，<name>。它似乎是一道燃烧着正义之火的受祝福谕令。其神圣文字旨在让腐化者的心中充满恐惧，看来是来自屠暗者哈伦多——他在影谷猎杀腐化。继续在这里履行职责之前，不妨读一读它。",dEN="I was asked to bring this to your attention, <name>. It appears to be a blessed mandate that burns with righteous fire. Its holy script is designed to strike fear into the hearts of the corrupt, and it seems to be from Darkslayer Harrendor, who hunts corruption in Shadowglen. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you continue your duties here.",p="正义之怒在你心中燃烧，直指腐化，<name>。这么说，你想成为猎魔人，荡清世间的邪恶？",pEN="Righteous fury burns against corruption in you, <name>. So you wish to become a Witch Hunter, to cleanse evil from the world?",c="正义之火在你的灵魂中燃烧，<name>！你选择将一生献给对腐化的永恒猎杀，成为一名立誓荡清世间一切藏匿邪恶的猎魔人。\n\n作为猎魔人，你将学会辨识那些蒙骗他人的超自然威胁，执掌专为毁灭腐化者而造的受祝福武器，并抵御那些令你的猎物堕落的诱惑。你的职责是警惕潜藏在无辜面孔之后的黑暗。\n\n这一使命要求时刻保持警觉，以及绝对的道德坚韧。你将面对以朋友面目出现的敌人，直面披着美德面具的邪恶，并做出他人永远无法理解的决定。这份知识的重担将深深地压在你身上。\n\n圣光已祝福你神圣的狩猎。愿你的武器永不辜负对抗腐化的使命，愿你的双眼永不被邪恶的伪装所蒙蔽，愿你的决心在黑暗面前永不动摇。",cEN="Righteous fire burns in your soul, <name>! You have chosen to dedicate your life to the eternal hunt for corruption, becoming a Witch Hunter sworn to cleanse evil wherever it may lurk.\n\nAs a Witch Hunter, you will learn to identify supernatural threats that fool others, to wield blessed weapons specifically designed to destroy corrupted beings, and to resist the very temptations that doom your quarry. Your purpose is to stand guard against darkness that hides behind innocent faces.\n\nThis calling demands constant vigilance and absolute moral fortitude. You will face enemies who appear as friends, confront evil that wears the mask of virtue, and make choices that others will never understand. The burden of this knowledge will weigh heavily upon you.\n\nThe Light has blessed your sacred hunt. May your weapons never fail against corruption, your eyes never be deceived by evil's disguises, and your resolve never waver in the face of darkness."}
Q[661104]={d="嘿嘿！你！对，就是你！你觉得你有本事驾驭我最新的发明吗？轰轰飞驰机是千针石林这一带最快的机器，不过它……有它自己的小脾气。那些地精老是往我的试车道上放龟壳向日葵和火焰地带来搞破坏！冲过火焰时用冷却系统，碰上那些带壳的麻烦就用龟壳保险杠！跑完一圈，让那些地精技师见识见识什么才叫真正的工程学！怎么样，聪明人？准备好烧点盐了吗？",dEN="Heh heh! You there! Yeah, YOU! Think you've got what it takes to handle my newest invention? The Boom Zoom Vroominator is the fastest machine this side of Thousand Needles, but she's got... quirks. Those goblins keep sabotaging my test track with turtle spinners and fire patches! Use the Coolant system when crossing flames and the Turtle Bumper when those shell-backed menaces get in your way! Complete the circuit and show those goblin greasemonkeys what REAL engineering looks like! What do ya say, hotshot? Ready to burn some salt?",o="驾驶轰轰飞驰机跑完盐原赛道的全程。",oEN="Complete the Salt Flat Race circuit using the Boom Zoom Vroominator."}
Q[661105]={d="嘿嘿！你！对，就是你！你觉得你有本事驾驭我最新的发明吗？轰轰飞驰机是千针石林这一带最快的机器，不过它……有它自己的小脾气。那些地精老是往我的试车道上放龟壳向日葵和火焰地带来搞破坏！冲过火焰时用冷却系统，碰上那些带壳的麻烦就用龟壳保险杠！跑完一圈，让那些地精技师见识见识什么才叫真正的工程学！怎么样，聪明人？准备好烧点盐了吗？",dEN="Heh heh! You there! Yeah, YOU! Think you've got what it takes to handle my newest invention? The Boom Zoom Vroominator is the fastest machine this side of Thousand Needles, but she's got... quirks. Those goblins keep sabotaging my test track with turtle spinners and fire patches! Use the Coolant system when crossing flames and the Turtle Bumper when those shell-backed menaces get in your way! Complete the circuit and show those goblin greasemonkeys what REAL engineering looks like! What do ya say, hotshot? Ready to burn some salt?",o="驾驶轰轰飞驰机跑完盐原赛道的全程。",oEN="Complete the Salt Flat Race circuit using the Boom Zoom Vroominator."}
Q[666995]={d="免费试用的东西。",dEN="Free Stuff for testing.",o="免费试用的东西。",oEN="Free Stuff for testing."}
Q[696969]={d="有些知识无法简单传授。最强大的打击和最毁灭性的法术，无法从艾泽拉斯或外域的任何一个训练师那里学到。即便是我，也无法教你如何解锁法术和技能的全部潜力。\n\n要真正精通你的法术和技能，你必须获得力量之书。奥尔多和占星者积累了许多这样的书卷，并愿意与那些证明了自己忠诚的人分享其中的知识。向其中一方宣誓效忠，然后前往奥尔多高地咨询守光者阿迪恩，或前往占星者之台咨询魔导师菲亚伦。\n\n若你想获得更多布满灰尘的书卷与更强大的力量，他们会给你一本布满灰尘的书卷，以及一份他们希望你收集的物品清单。",dEN="Some knowledge cannot simply be taught. The strongest strikes and most devestating spells cannot be learned from the trainers across Azeroth or Outlands. Even I am unable to teach you to unlock the full potential of your spells and abilities.\n\nTo truly master your spells and abilities you must acquire tomes of power. The Aldor and Scryer have horded many such tomes and are willing to share the knowledge they contain for those who prove their loyalty. Declare allegiance to one of these factions and consult with either Adyen the Lightwarden on Aldor Rise or Magistrix Fyalenn on Scryer's Tier.\n\nThey will offer you a Dusty Tome and a sample of the items they would have you collect if you wish to obtain more Dusty Tomes and greater power.",o="向奥尔多或占星者宣誓效忠。若你选择奥尔多，需前往奥尔多高地咨询守光者阿迪恩。若你选择占星者，需前往占星者之台咨询魔导师菲亚伦。",oEN="Declare your allegiance to either the Aldor or the Scryers faction. If you declare for the Aldor you should consult with Adyen the Lightwarden on Aldor Rise. If you declare for the Scryers you should consult with Magistrix Fyalenn on Scryer's Tier."}
Q[703063]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回去找塞拉斯·暗月领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon to claim your Hands of Fate."}
