Q[708063]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回去找塞拉斯·暗月领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon to claim your Hands of Fate."}
Q[734900]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓魔枢很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄！\n\n在英雄模式下消灭凯瑞史卓莎与法力守护者埃雷苟斯。\n\n如果你成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise the Nexus for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Keristrasza and Ley-Guardian Eregos on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!",o="在英雄模式下击杀凯瑞史卓莎与法力守护者埃雷苟斯。",oEN="Kill Keristrasza and Ley-Guardian Eregos on heroic mode."}
Q[734901]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓乌特加德城堡很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的勇敢英雄们！\n\n在英雄模式下击杀伊米隆国王与掠夺者因格瓦尔。\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Utgarde Keep for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill King Ymiron and Ingvar the Plunderer on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!",o="在英雄模式下击杀伊米隆国王与掠夺者因格瓦尔。",oEN="Kill King Ymiron and Ingvar the Plunderer on heroic mode."}
Q[734902]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓艾卓-尼鲁布很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的勇敢英雄们！\n\n在英雄模式下击杀阿努巴拉克国王与使者沃拉兹。\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Azjol-Nerub for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill King Anub'arak and Herald Volazj on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!",o="在英雄模式下击杀阿努巴拉克与使者沃拉兹。",oEN="Kill Anub'arak and Herald Volazj on heroic mode."}
Q[734903]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓祖达克很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的勇敢英雄们！\n\n在英雄模式下击杀先知萨隆亚与迦尔达拉。\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Zul'Drak for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Prophet Tharon'ja and Gal'darah on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!",o="在英雄模式下击杀先知萨隆亚与迦尔达拉。",oEN="Kill The Prophet Tharon'ja and Gal'darah on heroic mode."}
Q[734904]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓奥杜尔很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的勇敢英雄们！\n\n在英雄模式下击杀洛肯与铸铁者斯约尼尔。\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Ulduar for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Loken and Sjonnir The Ironshaper on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!"}
Q[734905]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓时光之域很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄们！\n\n在英雄模式下击杀各首领。\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise the Time Zones for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill the bosses on heroic mode.\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Emblems if you are successful!",o="在英雄模式下击杀各首领。",oEN="Kill the bosses on heroic mode."}
Q[734906]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓黑曜石圣殿很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄们！\n\n击杀萨塔里奥，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise the Obsidian Sanctum for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Sartharion and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在黑曜石圣殿击杀萨塔里奥。",oEN="Kill Sartharion in the Obsidian Sanctum."}
Q[734907]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓永恒之眼很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄们！\n\n击杀玛里苟斯，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise the Eye of Eternity for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Malygos and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在永恒之眼击杀玛里苟斯。",oEN="Kill Malygos in the Eye of Eternity."}
Q[734908]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓奥杜尔很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄们！\n\n击杀烈焰巨兽伊格尼斯，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Ulduar for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Flame Ignis and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="击杀奥杜尔中指定的首领。",oEN="Kill the listed bosses in Ulduar."}
Q[734909]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓十字军的试炼很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的强大英雄们！\n\n击杀阿努巴拉克，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Trial of the Crusader for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Anub'arak and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在十字军的试炼中击杀阿努巴拉克。",oEN="Kill Anub'arak in Trial of the Crusader."}
Q[734910]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这些强大的敌人已经恐吓冰冠堡垒很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的强大英雄们！\n\n击杀亡语者女士与鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foes has been terrorise Icecrown Citadel for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Deathwhisper and Blood-Queen Lana'thel and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在冰冠堡垒击杀亡语者女士与鲜血女王兰娜瑟尔。",oEN="Kill Lady Deathwhisper and Blood-Queen Lana'thel in Icecrown Citadel."}
Q[734911]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓奥妮克希亚的巢穴很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的强大英雄们！\n\n击杀奥妮克希亚，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foe has been terrorise Onyxia's Lair for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Onyxia and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在奥妮克希亚的巢穴击杀奥妮克希亚。",oEN="Kill Onyxia in Onyxia's Lair."}
Q[734912]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这些强大的敌人已经恐吓红玉圣殿很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的强大英雄们！\n\n击杀海里昂，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foes has been terrorise Ruby Sanctum for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Halion and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在红玉圣殿击杀海里昂。",oEN="Kill Halion in Ruby Sanctum."}
Q[734913]={d="勇敢的英雄们！\n\n诺森德需要你们的帮助！\n\n这个强大的敌人已经恐吓纳克萨玛斯很久了！\n\n消灭这个威胁！我相信你们，艾泽拉斯的伟大英雄们！\n\n击杀萨菲隆，向世界展示你们的强大力量！\n\n如果你们成功了，我会用大量冰霜徽章奖励你们！",dEN="Brave Heroes!\n\nNorthrend needs your help!\n\nThis mighty foes has been terrorise Naxxramas for a long time!\n\nEliminate the threat! I believe in you might hero of Azeroth!\n\nKill Saphiron and show the world your great power!\n\nI will reward you with a good amount of Frost Emblems if you are successful!",o="在纳克萨玛斯击杀萨菲隆。",oEN="Kill Saphiron in Naxxramas."}
Q[750000]={d="巴拉巴拉巴拉，任务描述，我也不知道。",dEN="blah blah blah quest description stuff, idk.",o="你必须在帮助农夫或帮助强盗之间做出选择。",oEN="You must choose to help the farmers or to help the bandits."}
Q[750003]={d="阅读卷轴时，你看到了关于一种名为邪能转换的流程的信息。就你所见，这是一种魔法附魔，能让你在死亡后保护自己的装备。\n\n不过，要成功为装备附魔似乎有一个主要条件。你需要金币，以便在意外死亡时代替你的装备。你必须进一步调查此事；据说暴风城的术士训练师旁边就有一座邪能转换祭坛！",dEN="As you read into the scroll, you see information on a process called Fel Commutation. From what you can see, it is a magical enchantment of sorts which allows you to protect your equipment through the grave.\n\nHowever, there seem to be one major requirement to successfully enchant your gear. You will need gold to take the place of your equipment in the event of your untimely demise. You must look into this more, there is said to be a Fel Commutation altar in Stormwind City by the warlock trainers!",o="你必须进一步了解这种\"邪能转换\"，才能拯救你的装备。",oEN="You must search for more information on this \"Fel Commutation\" to save your gear.",p="你好，有什么我能帮你的吗？\n\n哦……邪能转换，这可不是天天都能听到的词……没错，它确实存在，你可以用我身旁的祭坛进一步研究。不过，邪能转换可不是囊中羞涩的人玩得起的东西。现在，我们来说说你找到的那张卷轴吧……",pEN="Hello There, How can I help you?\n\nOh... Fel Commutation, I dont hear that every day... Yes, it does indeed exist, you can actually look into it more by using the altar beside me. However, Fel Commutation is not something for the light pocketed. Now, lets talk about that scroll you found...",c="像这样的卷轴可绝不常见。只要你出个价，我很乐意替你把它处理掉……",cEN="Scrolls like this are far from common. I would be happy to take it off of your hands for you for a price..."}
Q[750004]={d="阅读卷轴时，你看到了关于一种名为邪能转换的流程的信息。就你所见，这是一种魔法附魔，能让你在死亡后保护自己的装备。\n\n不过，要成功为装备附魔似乎有一个主要条件。你需要金币，以便在意外死亡时代替你的装备。你必须进一步调查此事；据说奥格瑞玛的术士训练师旁边就有一座邪能转换祭坛！",dEN="As you read into the scroll, you see information on a process called Fel Commutation. From what you can see, it is a magical enchantment of sorts which allows you to protect your equipment through the grave.\n\nHowever, there seem to be one major requirement to successfully enchant your gear. You will need gold to take the place of your equipment in the event of your untimely demise. You must look into this more, there is said to be a Fel Commutation altar in Orgrimmar by the warlock trainers!",o="你必须进一步了解这种\"邪能转换\"，才能拯救你的装备。",oEN="You must search for more information on this \"Fel Commutation\" to save your gear.",p="你好，有什么我能帮你的吗？\n\n哦……邪能转换，这可不是天天都能听到的词……没错，它确实存在，你可以用我身旁的祭坛进一步研究。不过，邪能转换可不是囊中羞涩的人玩得起的东西。现在，我们来说说你找到的那张卷轴吧……",pEN="Hello There, How can I help you?\n\nOh... Fel Commutation, I dont hear that every day... Yes, it does indeed exist, you can actually look into it more by using the altar beside me. However, Fel Commutation is not something for the light pocketed. Now, lets talk about that scroll you found...",c="像这样的卷轴可绝不常见。只要你出个价，我很乐意替你把它处理掉……",cEN="Scrolls like this are far from common. I would be happy to take it off of your hands for you for a price..."}
Q[760000]={d="想进竞技场打一场吗？首先，你得从布拉卡手下活下来。\n\n碎骨者布拉卡曾率领一支团队深入祖尔格拉布。仅凭双拳砸碎巨魔、野兽甚至一具石魔像后，他开始寻找更难打碎的东西。\n\n如今他为骸骨、鲜血和观众的欢呼而战。\n\n走进角斗场，证明你的骨头比他的拳头更硬。",dEN="You want to fight in the Arena? First, you’ll need to survive Brakka.\n\nBrakka the Bonecrusher once led a raiding party deep into Zul’Gurub. After smashing through trolls, beasts, and even a stone golem with nothing but his fists, he went looking for something harder to break.\n\nNow he fights for the crowd's bone, blood, and glory.\n\nStep into the pit, and prove your bones are tougher than his fists.",o="在角斗士竞技场击杀碎骨者布拉卡。",oEN="Slay Brakka the Bonecrusher in the Gladiator's Arena.",c="这么说布拉卡倒下了，嗯？说实话，我没指望你的骨头能撑住。\n\n那是你在角斗场里迈出的第一步。你尝到了鲜血，感受到了观众的咆哮。从这里开始，一切都不会更轻松。\n\n布拉卡只是热身。真正的怪物还在等着。",cEN="So Brakka’s down, huh? I’ll be honest, I didn’t expect your bones to hold up.\n\nThat was your first real step into the pit. You’ve tasted the blood, felt the roar of the crowd. Doesn’t get any easier from here.\n\nBrakka’s just the warm-up. The real monsters are still waiting."}
Q[760001]={d="你的下一个对手是铁皮·血拳，一名来自黑石氏族的残暴食人魔血战士。\n\n他靠一双拳头打穿了半个东部王国。他那标志性的锁链在每场战斗中如丧钟般回响，每一击都响得更重。当锁链开始咔嗒作响，观众就知道有人即将倒下。\n\n观众已经见识了你初尝鲜血的样子。现在他们想要一场盛宴。把铁皮交给他们。",dEN="Your next opponent is Ironhide Gorefist, a brutal ogre-blooded warbringer out of the Blackrock clan.\n\nHe’s brawled his way through half the Eastern Kingdoms. His signature chains echo through every fight like a death knell, ringing louder with every blow. When they start rattling, the crowd knows someone’s about to fall.\n\nThe crowd’s seen your first taste of blood. Now they want a feast. Give them Ironhide.",o="在角斗士竞技场击杀铁皮·血拳。",oEN="Slay Ironhide Gorefist in the Gladiator's Arena.",c="这么说……那个蛮子终于倒下了。我以为你在他手下撑不过一分钟，可你还在这儿，浑身是血，却还在呼吸。\n\n那不仅仅是一场打斗，你赢得了老兵的尊重，赢得了抛硬币者的尊重，也赢得了见惯一切的杀手的尊重。你离在竞技场传奇中赢得一席之地又近了一步。\n\n别松懈。下一个挑战会打得更狠。",cEN="So... the brute finally fell. I didn’t think you'd last more than a minute against him, but here you are, bloodied and still breathing.\n\nThat wasn’t just a fight, you won the respect of the old hands, the coin-tossers, and the killers who’ve seen it all. You’re one step closer to earning your place in the arena's legend.\n\nDon’t get comfortable. The next challenge will hit even harder."}
Q[760002]={d="挡在你与角斗场中属于你的位置之间的，只剩一个人。\n\n玛雅拉·赤牙不是一名斗士。她是一名猎手。冷静。精准。\n\n她在丛林中长大，被狩猎塑造。有人说古拉巴什的驯兽大师训练了她。也有人说，她把他们当作消遣猎杀了。\n\n她不咆哮。她等待。她观察。\n\n这不是一场打斗。这是一场考验。证明你不只是一头猎物。在竞技场中迎战玛雅拉，并从猎手的致命一击下活下来。",dEN="Only one stands between you and your place in the pit.\n\nMajara the Crimson Fang is not a brawler. She is a hunter. Cold. Precise.\n\nRaised in the jungle and shaped by the hunt. Some say the Gurubashi beastmasters trained her. Others say she hunted them for sport.\n\nShe does not roar. She waits. Watches.\n\nThis is not a fight. It is a test. Prove you are more than prey. Face Majara in the arena, and survive the hunter’s killstroke.",o="在角斗士竞技场击杀赤牙玛雅拉。",oEN="Slay Majara the Crimson Fang in the Gladiator's Arena.",c="你活下来了。你击败了玛雅拉。\n\n能做到的人不多。她那声咆哮？那是一名杀手终于找到对手时的声音。\n\n你与野兽、蛮子和嗜血之徒交手，并活着走了出来。\n\n观众已经知道了你的名字。欢迎来到竞技场……角斗士。",cEN="You lived through it. You beat Majara.\n\nNot many do. That roar of hers? That was the sound of a killer who knew she finally met her match.\n\nYou’ve fought beasts, brutes, and bloodletters and come out standing.\n\nThe crowd knows your name now. Welcome to the arena... gladiator."}
Q[765001]={d="瓦特鲁斯可以给你制作上古之弓的法杖，但只有我能为完成这把弓所需的弓弦附魔。\n\n这只是件小事，渺小的存在。杀死一头成年黑龙，从它的骨头中取出筋腱。把那条筋腱带回来给我，我会为材料附魔，把它变成一根几乎无法摧毁的弓弦。",dEN="Vartrus may offer you the stave to create a bow of Ancients but only I can enchant the string required to complete the bow.\n\nIt is a simple task, puny one. Slay a mature black dragon and remove the sinew from its bones. Return that sinew to me and I shall enchant the material into an almost indestructible bow string.",o="上古斯托玛要你给他带一条成年黑龙的筋腱。如果你找到了这条筋腱，把它带到费伍德交给斯托玛。",oEN="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",p="我相信找到并杀死一头黑龙对你来说不会太难，<name>。别拿无聊的闲话浪费我的时间。",pEN="I am certain that you will have little difficulty in finding and slaying a black dragon, <name>. Do not waste my time with idle chatter.",c="这可真是一头极其邪恶的龙。这筋腱散发着邪恶的臭味。\n\n给我一点时间清理这块肉上的污秽，并施加合适的附魔。",cEN="A most foul dragon this one was. The sinew reeks of evil.\n\nGive me a moment to cleanse the filth from this flesh and apply the proper enchantments."}
Q[765002]={d="瓦特鲁斯可以给你制作上古之弓的法杖，但只有我能为完成这把弓所需的弓弦附魔。\n\n这只是件小事，渺小的存在。杀死一头成年黑龙，从它的骨头中取出筋腱。把那条筋腱带回来给我，我会为材料附魔，把它变成一根几乎无法摧毁的弓弦。",dEN="Vartrus may offer you the stave to create a bow of Ancients but only I can enchant the string required to complete the bow.\n\nIt is a simple task, puny one. Slay a mature black dragon and remove the sinew from its bones. Return that sinew to me and I shall enchant the material into an almost indestructible bow string.",o="上古斯托玛要你给他带一条成年黑龙的筋腱。如果你找到了这条筋腱，把它带到费伍德交给斯托玛。",oEN="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",p="我相信找到并杀死一头黑龙对你来说不会太难，<name>。别拿无聊的闲话浪费我的时间。",pEN="I am certain that you will have little difficulty in finding and slaying a black dragon, <name>. Do not waste my time with idle chatter.",c="这可真是一头极其邪恶的龙。这筋腱散发着邪恶的臭味。\n\n给我一点时间清理这块肉上的污秽，并施加合适的附魔。",cEN="A most foul dragon this one was. The sinew reeks of evil.\n\nGive me a moment to cleanse the filth from this flesh and apply the proper enchantments."}
Q[765003]={d="瓦特鲁斯可以给你制作上古之弓的法杖，但只有我能为完成这把弓所需的弓弦附魔。\n\n这只是件小事，渺小的存在。杀死一头成年黑龙，从它的骨头中取出筋腱。把那条筋腱带回来给我，我会为材料附魔，把它变成一根几乎无法摧毁的弓弦。",dEN="Vartrus may offer you the stave to create a bow of Ancients but only I can enchant the string required to complete the bow.\n\nIt is a simple task, puny one. Slay a mature black dragon and remove the sinew from its bones. Return that sinew to me and I shall enchant the material into an almost indestructible bow string.",o="上古斯托玛要你给他带一条成年黑龙的筋腱。如果你找到了这条筋腱，把它带到费伍德交给斯托玛。",oEN="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",p="我相信找到并杀死一头黑龙对你来说不会太难，<name>。别拿无聊的闲话浪费我的时间。",pEN="I am certain that you will have little difficulty in finding and slaying a black dragon, <name>. Do not waste my time with idle chatter.",c="这可真是一头极其邪恶的龙。这筋腱散发着邪恶的臭味。\n\n给我一点时间清理这块肉上的污秽，并施加合适的附魔。",cEN="A most foul dragon this one was. The sinew reeks of evil.\n\nGive me a moment to cleanse the filth from this flesh and apply the proper enchantments."}
Q[765100]={d="林苑中气氛紧绷。风中传来的寂静比应有的更多。地底有什么东西在抽取植物的生命。缓慢地。坚定地。但并非所有植物都屈服了。\n\n有一朵花仍在抵抗。明亮而倔强。我们称它为阳炎花瓣。它只生长在林苑仍能深长呼吸的地方。在腐坏未曾占据的温暖地带。\n\n去寻找它们。只取你所需。它们的光芒不只属于我们，但它能帮我们弄清是什么让这地方染上了病。",dEN="The grove feels strained. The wind carries more silence than it should. Something beneath the soil draws the life out of the plants. Slowly. Purposefully. Yet not all yield.\n\nThere is one bloom that endures. Bright and stubborn. We call it the Sunfire Petal. It grows only where the grove still breathes deeply. In warm patches the rot has not claimed.\n\nFind them. Take only what you must. Their light is not for us alone, but it may help us understand what sickens this place.",o="在安戈洛环形山，从泰坦遗物附近的发光植物上采集 5 片阳炎花瓣。",oEN="Collect 5 Sunfire Petals from glowing plants near titan relics in Un'Goro Crater.",p="啊……我已经感觉到了。这些花瓣跳动着创世的回响。\n\n你做得很好，林苑感谢你——尽管它还不能开口说话。",pEN="Ah… I feel it already. These petals pulse with the echo of creation.\n\nYou’ve done well, and the grove thanks you, even if it cannot yet speak.",c="啊……我已经感觉到了。这些花瓣跳动着创世的回响。\n\n你做得很好，林苑感谢你——尽管它还不能开口说话。",cEN="Ah… I feel it already. These petals pulse with the echo of creation.\n\nYou’ve done well, and the grove thanks you, even if it cannot yet speak."}
Q[770010]={d="我不愿在你还没多受训练时就派你去做这么危险的事，但威胁已经出现了。在直面这一威胁之前，先召集一队有经验的冒险者。\n\n前往哀嚎洞穴深处，在穆坦努斯的梦魇进入我们的世界之前阻止他。\n\n此任务必须在 29 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nTravel deep into the Wailing Caverns and stop Mutanus before his nightmare enters our world.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 29!",o="进入哀嚎洞穴，杀死吞噬者穆坦努斯。",oEN="Enter The Wailing Caverns and slay Mutanus the Devourer.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770011]={d="我不愿在你还没多受训练时就派你去做这么危险的事，但威胁已经出现了。在直面这一威胁之前，先召集一队有经验的冒险者。\n\n想办法进入影牙城堡的内庭。一路杀穿幽灵与狼人的军队，在大法师阿鲁高的阴影蔓延出银松森林之前杀死他。\n\n此任务必须在 29 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nFind a way to enter the inner courtyard of Shadowfang Keep. Fight your way through the army of ghosts and worgen and kill Archmage Argugal before his shadow extends past Silverpine Forest.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 29!",o="进入影牙城堡，杀死大法师阿鲁高。",oEN="Enter Shadowfang Keep and slay Archmage Arugal.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770012]={d="我不愿在你还没多受训练时就派你去做这么危险的事，但威胁已经出现了。在直面这一威胁之前，先召集一队有经验的冒险者。\n\n解决盘踞在死亡矿井中的强盗。终结他们的首领埃德温·范克里夫，确保威胁被彻底清除。\n\n此任务必须在 29 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm loath to send you on such a dangerous task without more training, but the threat has presented itself now. Gather a party of skilled adventureres before you take on this threat.\n\nRout the bandits that have taken up residence in the Deadmines. Put an end to leader Edwin Vancleef to ensure the threat is truly dealt with.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 29!",o="进入死亡矿井，消灭埃德温·范克里夫。",oEN="Enter The Deadmines and slay Edwin Vancleef.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770013]={d="英雄，我又有一件危险的任务交给你。希望你有几个信得过的同伴在身边。\n\n侏儒们做得太过火了。他们在诺莫瑞根玩弄的技术太危险了……这会走到什么地步？如果我们不动手，冒险者们整天都会去玩弄那些技术而不是摧毁它……你明白我的意思。去摧毁机械师麦克尼尔·瑟玛普拉格。\n\n此任务必须在 39 级之前交付！",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nThe gnomes have gone too far. The technology they play with in Gnomergan is too dangerous... where does it end? Adventurers will be playing on technology all day instead of destroying it if we don't... you get the idea. Go destroy Mekgineer Thermaplugg.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 39!",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770014]={d="英雄，我又有一件危险的任务交给你。希望你有几个信得过的同伴在身边。\n\n我们的探子报告，查尔加·刺肋一直在与天灾军团谈判。进入剃刀沼泽，在天灾军团与野猪人结成同盟之前解决查尔加！\n\n此任务必须在 39 级之前交付！",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nOur spies tell us that Charlga Razorflank has been negotiating with the Scourge. Enter Razorfen Kraul and bring Charlga down before an alliance between the scourge and quilboars can be made!\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 39!",o="进入剃刀沼泽，消灭查尔加·刺肋。",oEN="Enter Razorfen Kraul and slay Charlga Razorflank.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770015]={d="英雄，我又有一件危险的任务交给你。希望你有几个信得过的同伴在身边。\n\n一只生物正在黑暗深渊中躁动，它本不该被打扰。别让阿库麦尔浮出水面。\n\n此任务必须在 39 级之前交付！",dEN="I have another dangerous task for you hero. I hope you have some trusted companions at your side.\n\nA creature is stirring that should have never been disturbed in Blackfathom Depths. Do not allow Aku'mai to reach the surface.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 39!",o="进入黑暗深渊，杀死阿库麦尔。",oEN="Enter Blackfathom Deeps and slay Aku'mai.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770016]={d="你变强了，英雄。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去送死了……几乎。\n\n奥法师杜安还欠着图书馆的罚款没交。这完全不可接受。前往血色修道院，给他送去公正且完全正当的惩罚。死刑。\n\n此任务必须在 49 级之前交付！",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nArcanist Doan still has unpaid library late fees. It's totally unacceptable. Visit the Scarlet Monastary and deliver his fair and totally justified punishment. Death.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 49!",o="进入血色修道院，杀死奥法师杜安。",oEN="Enter The Scarlet Monastery and slay Arcanist Doan.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770017]={d="你变强了，英雄。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去送死了……几乎。\n\n我们本来打算让血色十字军自生自灭……可你信吗，那群狂信徒里居然有人想竞选总统！别误会我……我反对他们扣押亡灵，但当他们开始鼓吹人类是优等种族、搞起仇恨与恐惧的宣传时，就越来越像是该被一斧子劈在脸上的料了。去把他们全杀了。\n\n此任务必须在 49 级之前交付！",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nWe were content to leave the Scarlet Crusade to their own devices... but can you believe one of those fanatics wants to run for President?! Don't get me wrong... I'm opposed to them stopping the undead, but when you start talking about how humans are the master race and run on a campaign of hate and fear you start to look like a good candidate for an axe to the face. Go kill the lot of them.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 49!",o="进入血色修道院，杀死血色指挥官莫格莱尼。",oEN="Enter The Scarlet Monastery and slay Scarlet Commander Mograine.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770018]={d="你变强了，英雄。我几乎觉得这次不是派你去送死了……几乎。\n\n看来我们还是慢了一步，没能阻止野猪人与天灾军团的谈判。一名强大的巫妖正在剃刀高地集结亡灵大军。彻底杀死寒冰使者阿姆嫩纳尔。\n\n此任务必须在 49 级之前交付！",dEN="You've grown in strength hero. I almost feel like I'm not sending you on a suicide mission this time... almost.\n\nIt looks like we wern't quick enough to prevent the quilboar negotiations with the Scourge. A powerful lich is raising an undead army in Razorfen Downs. Kill Amnennar the Coldbringer for good this time.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 49!",o="进入剃刀高地，杀死寒冰使者阿姆嫩纳尔。",oEN="Enter Razorfen Downs and slay Amnennar the Coldbringer.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770019]={d="我开始觉得你或许有潜力。想证明我没看错人吗？\n\n看来历史课上只有我一个人在听讲？你听说过沙怒氏族吗？塔纳利斯历史上最血腥的一章就是他们写下的，这话可不轻！在乌克兹·沙顶的氏族强大到足以挑战地精之前，杀掉他。\n\n此任务必须在 59 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nIt seems I'm the only one who paid attention in history class? Every heard of the Sandfury clan? They were responsible for the most bloody chapter in the history of Tanaris, and that's saying something! Kill Chief Ukorz Sandscalp before his clan is strong enough to challenge the goblins.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 59!",o="进入祖尔法拉克，杀死酋长乌克兹·沙顶。",oEN="Enter Zul'Farrak and slay Chief Ukorz Sandscalp.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770020]={d="我开始觉得你或许有潜力。想证明我没看错人吗？\n\n这任务不是上级派给我的，不过……你肯定不信！有个半人马说我妈胖！我知道完美的报复方式。去玛拉顿……然后杀掉他老妈！胖的是她。这就让他长记性了。\n\n此任务必须在 59 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nThis one didn't come from my superiors but... You won't believe this! Some centaur called my mom fat! I know the perfect way to get revenge. Travel to Mauradon... and kill his mom! She's the fat one. That'll teach him.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 59!",o="进入玛拉顿，杀死瑟莱德丝公主。",oEN="Enter Maraudon and slay Princess Theradras.",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[770021]={d="我开始觉得你或许有潜力。想证明我没看错人吗？\n\n黑铁矮人在荒芜之地挖出了一座古老的泰坦城市。前往那座古城，摧毁矮人们指望为其主人取回的一切。\n\n此任务必须在 59 级之前交付！",dEN="I'm beginning to think you might have potential. Care to prove me right?\n\nThe Dark Iron Dwarves have unearthed an ancient Titan city in the Badlands. Travel to the ancient city and destroy whatever it is the dwarves hope to retrieve for their master.\n\nThis quest must be turned in before level 59!",c="今天你立下了丰功伟绩，英雄。当人们需要冒险者时，是<name>响应了召唤，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[774286]={d="让查尔斯通固若金汤的不只是兹瓦斯特里亚。那头野兽统领着一群幼龙，每一头都残忍、狡猾，几乎和它们的主人一样致命。\n\n瑞瑟斯利亚、伊尔维希恩、利法里昂和艾诺西亚。它们合力把这座要塞变成了火焰与獠牙的堡垒。只要它们还活着，任何想攻击兹瓦斯特里亚的人都会先被撕成碎片。\n\n带上你的盟友，击败这四头龙。斩断这支巨龙军队的翅膀，也许等我们直面兹瓦斯特里亚时，就还有机会。",dEN="It isn’t just Zivarstria that makes Charstone untouchable. The beast commands a clutch of drakes, each one cruel, cunning, and near as deadly as their master.\n\nRethysria, Ilvission, Lifarion, and Enocia. Together, they’ve turned the keep into a fortress of fire and fang. As long as they draw breath, there’s no striking at Zivarstria without being torn apart first.\n\nTake your allies and bring the four down. Cut the wings from the wyrm’s army, and we may yet stand a chance when the time comes to face Zivarstria itself.",o="在查尔斯通要塞击败兹瓦斯特里亚的四名爪牙。",oEN="Defeat the four lieutenants of Zivarstria at Charstone Keep.",p="要塞中仍回荡着龙火的躁动。你解决了兹瓦斯特里亚的幼崽，还是它们仍盘踞在那些被诅咒的大厅里？",pEN="The keep still stirs with dragon fire. Have you dealt with Zivarstria’s brood, or do they yet roost in those cursed halls?",c="以先祖之名……你做到了。失去了那些幼龙，兹瓦斯特里亚变得虚弱，它对查尔斯通的统治也动摇了。\n\n这不会终结那头野兽，但这一击巨龙不会很快忘记。你斩断了它的翅膀，为此你既赢得了金币，也赢得了荣耀。",cEN="By the ancestors… you’ve done it. Without its drakes, Zivarstria stands weaker, its hold on Charstone shaken.\n\nThis won’t end the beast, but it’s a strike the dragon won’t soon forget. You’ve clipped its wings, , and for that, you’ve earned both gold and honor."}
Q[774287]={d="兹瓦斯特里亚……那头该死的龙像暴君一样盘踞在查尔斯通要塞之上，谁敢质疑它的统治它就向谁发难。我曾愚蠢到去尝试。那野兽的烈焰驱散了我的手下，它的爪牙把我的营地砸得粉碎。\n\n我们夺不回要塞，至少现在还不行。但我们可以给它一记重击，让这头龙流血，提醒它凡人不是任它戏耍的猎物。\n\n集结你的力量，寻找勇敢的盟友，直接迎战兹瓦斯特里亚。杀死那头野兽，我会为你的勇气奖赏你。",dEN="Zivarstria… that cursed dragon roosts above Charstone Keep like a tyrant king, daring any to challenge its reign. I was foolish enough to try. The beast’s flames scattered my men, and its minions tore my camp to shreds.\n\nWe won’t be taking back the keep, not yet. But we can strike a blow, make the dragon bleed, and remind it that mortals aren’t prey to be toyed with.\n\nGather your strength, find stout allies, and face Zivarstria head-on. Slay the beast, and I’ll see you rewarded for your bravery.",o="在查尔斯通要塞击败兹瓦斯特里亚。",oEN="Defeat Zivarstria in Charstone Keep.",p="别告诉我你空着手回来了……那头野兽的阴影仍笼罩着查尔斯通，我的骨头都能感觉到。你若想吹嘘自己的勇气，就带那巨龙陨落的证据来，否则不过是空话。",pEN="Don’t tell me you’ve come back empty-handed… The beast still casts its shadow over Charstone, I can feel it in my bones. If you mean to boast of courage, bring proof of the dragon’s fall, else it’s just words.",c="以我的胡子起誓……你们做到了。兹瓦斯特里亚死了？哈！那巨龙自以为无人能敌，如今却因你们而粉身碎骨。这不会一夜之间改变查尔斯通的局势，但以先祖之名，这是那野兽永远无法愈合的伤口。你们让那些自认高不可攀的怪物也感到了恐惧。",cEN="By my beard… ye did it. Zivarstria is dead? Ha! The dragon thought itself untouchable, and now it lies broken thanks to you. This won’t change Charstone overnight, but by the ancestors, it’s a wound the beast’ll never heal from. You’ve struck fear into monsters that thought themselves beyond reach."}
Q[774288]={d="该死的巨龙……我的营地几乎成了废墟，手下也四散而去。查尔斯通要塞里满是它的后代，我一个人撑不了多久。\n\n如果这封信能落到某个足够有胆量的人手里，就到要塞附近我营地的残骸处找我。我还有计划，也有足够的活计留给那些愿意拿命去拼的人。",dEN="Blasted wyrm… my camp’s near ruined, my men scattered. Charstone Keep swarms with its spawn, and I’ll not last long on my own.\n\nIf this reaches anyone with steel enough in their gut, find me at what’s left of my camp near the keep. I’ve plans yet, and work enough for those willin’ to risk their hides.",o="把字条交给格鲁姆利·壮臂，他就在查尔斯通要塞附近的营地里。",oEN="Deliver the note to Grumli Strongarm, found at his camp near Charstone Keep.",c="这么说你找到了我的字条，嗯？哈！我还以为风把它吹走了。看来命运派了你来代替它。没错，我有活计给你——如果你有胆量让那巨龙的子嗣流血的话。",cEN="So, ye found my note, eh? Hah! Thought the wind had carried it off. Guess the fates sent you instead. Aye, I’ve work for you, if you’ve the will to bleed a dragon’s brood."}
Q[775155]={d="这片森林充斥着毒与暗影……但我依然奔跑。\n\n我是疾风，曾属于雷霆崖，如今属于蜿蜒的小径。大地母亲通过运动教导，通过呼吸教导，通过蹄子敲击大地教导。即便在这该死的费伍德森林，我依然践行着她的教诲。\n\n若你的双腿仍有力量，灵魂仍燃烧着光芒，就来与我较量。不为征服。为清明。为火焰。\n\n你接受挑战吗，奔跑者？",dEN="The forest is thick with poison and shadows… but still, I run.\n\nI am Fleetwind, once of Thunder Bluff, now of the winding path. The Earthmother teaches through movement, through breath, through the pounding of hooves against the land. Even here, in cursed Felwood, I carry her lessons forward.\n\nIf your legs still hold strength, and your spirit burns bright, race me. Not for dominance. For clarity. For fire.\n\nDo you accept the challenge, runner?",o="与疾风·蹄奔赛跑，并比他先冲过终点线。",oEN="Race Fleetwind Hoofrunner and reach the finish line before he does."}
Q[777200]={d="我听说你想上阵杀敌，和那些最凶悍的角斗士血战一场，嗯？你来对地方了。无论你是想零风险地提升排名，还是内心对战斗的渴望强烈到愿意赌上装备，我们都有适合你的选择。两种排队方式都会为你的装备提供等级，但如果你加入高风险竞技场，就要承担失去装备的风险！",dEN="I hear you're looking to get down and bloody with the most brutal of Gladiators, eh? You've come to the right place. Whether you're looking to climb the ladder without a risk, or the passion for battle rages so strong inside you that you're willing to lose gear, we've got something for you. Both queues will give you rating towards your team, but if you queue High Risk Arena you risk the possiblity of losing gear!",o="把你的竞技场清单带到任意主城的诺兹多姆处。",oEN="Take your Arena Roster to Nozdormu in any capital city.",p="你好，<name>。你找到拉兹米特·格鲁姆洛克了吗？他在所有主城都有分部！",pEN="Greetings <name>. Have you found Razimit Glumlock? He's located in every capital!",c="太好了！这是你的竞技场点数和装备清单，拿去从头开始吧。",cEN="Great! Here are your Arena Points and Fresh Start Roster."}
Q[777777]={d="你的第一项任务是清剿，<name>。一个狗头人部族侵占了北面的森林。去那里与成群的狗头人作战。削减他们的数量，这样有朝一日我们才能把他们赶出北郡山谷。",dEN="Your first task is one of cleansing, <name>. A clan of kobolds have infested the woods to the north. Go there and fight the kobold vermin you find. Reduce their numbers so that we may one day drive them from Northshire.",o="杀死 8 只狗头人害虫，然后回去找治安官麦克布莱德。",oEN="Kill 8 Kobold Vermin, then return to Marshal McBride."}
Q[777778]={d="你越早开始学习，<name>，对我们所有人就越好。容错的空间很小，所以仔细听。\n\n灼热水晶（此地日怒尖塔以西那些漂浮的绿色物体）长期以来一直被用来为岛上的实验供能。法力浮龙曾是它们的守护者，但天灾军团入侵奎尔萨拉斯后，由于我们缺乏对它们的魔法控制，它们已经偏离了原本的位置。\n\n为了恢复秩序，除了削减它们的数量别无选择。做完这件事再回来找我。",dEN="The sooner you begin your education, <name>, the better for us all. There is little room for error, so listen closely.\n\nThe Burning Crystals - the green floating objects to the west of the Sunspire here - have long been used to power the isle's experimentations. The mana wyrms were their guardians, but the Scourge invasion of Quel'Thalas has driven them errant from our lack of magical control over them.\n\nThere is little choice but to thin their numbers for reclamation. Do this, then return to me.",o="杀死 8 只法力浮龙；它们出没于塔楼与凉亭旁的灼热水晶附近。",oEN="Kill 8 Mana Wyrms; they are located close to the Burning Crystals that are adjacent to the tower and gazebo."}
Q[777888]={d="阿拉希盆地即将失守！我们必须立刻派出援军，否则一切努力都将付诸东流。\n\n别再耽搁了，<class>，前往阿拉希盆地，碾碎敌人。",dEN="Arathi Basin is on the verge of being lost! We must send reinforcements at this very moment or all our efforts will have been in vain.\n\nDo not delay, <class>, go to Arathi Basin and crush the enemy.",o="在阿拉希盆地战场中赢得一场胜利，然后返回告示板。",oEN="Win an Arathi Basin battleground match and return to a Call Board."}
Q[777889]={d="阿拉希盆地即将失守！我们必须立刻派出援军，否则一切努力都将付诸东流。\n\n别再耽搁了，<class>，前往阿拉希盆地，碾碎敌人。",dEN="Arathi Basin is on the verge of being lost! We must send reinforcements at this very moment or all our efforts will have been in vain.\n\nDo not delay, <class>, go to Arathi Basin and crush the enemy.",o="在阿拉希盆地战场中赢得一场胜利，然后返回告示板。",oEN="Win an Arathi Basin battleground match and return to a Call Board."}
Q[777890]={d="阿拉希盆地即将失守！我们必须立刻派出援军，否则一切努力都将付诸东流。\n\n别再耽搁了，<class>，前往阿拉希盆地，碾碎敌人。",dEN="Arathi Basin is on the verge of being lost! We must send reinforcements at this very moment or all our efforts will have been in vain.\n\nDo not delay, <class>, go to Arathi Basin and crush the enemy.",o="在阿拉希盆地战场中赢得一场胜利，然后返回告示板。",oEN="Win an Arathi Basin battleground match and return to a Call Board."}
Q[777891]={d="阿拉希盆地即将失守！我们必须立刻派出援军，否则一切努力都将付诸东流。\n\n别再耽搁了，<class>，前往阿拉希盆地，碾碎敌人。",dEN="Arathi Basin is on the verge of being lost! We must send reinforcements at this very moment or all our efforts will have been in vain.\n\nDo not delay, <class>, go to Arathi Basin and crush the enemy.",o="在阿拉希盆地战场中赢得一场胜利，然后返回告示板。",oEN="Win an Arathi Basin battleground match and return to a Call Board."}
Q[777901]={d="吉里安国王，名号第一，湖泊的泳者，鱼人的主宰，小虫的吞食者，已然驾崩。他的尸身尚未干透，这些鱼人就已经开始争夺他的王冠！这些鱼人没有一个配得上吉里安。守护他的遗产。别让这些软弱的觊觎者夺取他的王座！",dEN="King Gillian, First of His Name, Swimmer of the Lake, Master of Murlocs, Eater of small bugs, has passed away. His body is barely dry and they already vie for his crown! None of these murlocs can hope to fill Gillian's shoes. Defend his legacy. Do not let these weak contenders claim his throne!",o="在国王的尸身干透期间，守卫角逐者之岛 5 分钟。",oEN="Defend the island from contenders for 5 minutes while the King's body dries out.",p="我的丈夫，吉里安国王，名号第一，湖泊的泳者，鱼人的主宰，小虫的吞食者，已然驾崩。他的尸身尚未干透，这些鱼人就已经开始争夺他的王冠！这些鱼人没有一个配得上吉里安。\n\n守护我丈夫的遗产。别让这些软弱的角逐者夺取他的王座！",pEN="My Husband, King Gillian, First of His Name, Swimmer of the Lake, Master of Murlocs, Eater of small bugs, has passed away. His body is barely dry and they already vie for his crown! None of these murlocs can hope to fill Gillian's shoes.\n\nDefend my husband's legacy. Do not let these weak contenders claim his throne!",c="干得好！这是你的奖励。",cEN="Good job! Here is your reward."}
Q[777902]={d="一张半湿的合约钉在告示板上。你勉强能辨认出灰谷法拉希姆湖的地图，上面写着\"Mmmrrglllm Mmgr Mmmurlok\"",dEN="A half soaked contract is pinned to the board. You can barely make out a map of Lake Falathim in Ashenvale with the words \"Mmmrrglllm Mmgr Mmmurlok\"",o="前往灰谷的法拉希姆湖，查明这份神秘合约的来历。",oEN="Seek out the source of the mysterious contract at Lake Falathim in Ashenvale",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[865000]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不进竞技场决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into the arena and fight to the death.",o="参加 10 场 1v1 竞技场比赛",oEN="Participate in 10 1v1 Arena Matches"}
Q[865003]={d="竞技场参与",dEN="Arena Participations",o="参加 10 场 2v2 竞技场练习赛",oEN="Participate in 10 2v2 Skirmish Arena Matches"}
Q[865006]={d="就是你！看来你有两把刷子。何不参加一场战争游戏，决一死战？",dEN="You there! You look like you've got what it takes. Why don't you step into a Wargame and fight to the death.",o="参加一场战争游戏",oEN="Participate in a Wargame"}
Q[865007]={d="英雄！我们在战场上需要你的援助！敌军正在各条战线上争夺我们的主权！充实我们的队伍，带领我们走向胜利！在任意战略要地协助我们；带领我们的士兵穿过灰谷战场——木材对制造战争机器和建造家园至关重要！夺取风暴之眼中的塔楼控制权，我们可以夺回虚空风暴的潜在能量，将其从凯尔萨斯的掌控中解放出来，从而强化我们的部队！守住阿拉希的战略要地，那里采集的资源至关重要！在双子峰与对手交锋，该地对巩固我们在暮光高地的阵地至关重要！你在这些地点的任何帮助，都是我们赢得这场战争的关键！胜利必将属于我们",dEN="Hero! We require your aid upon the battlefields! The enemy forces are contesting our claim on all fronts! Bolster our ranks, and lead us to victory! Aid us on any of the strategic locations; Lead our soldiers across the battlefields of Ashenvale, the lumber is essential for creating our war machines and building our homes! Take control of towers in the Eye of the Storm, we can reclaim the latent energies of the Netherstorm and free it from Kael'thas control to empower our forces! Hold the strategic locations within Arathi, the resources gathered there are essential! Contest the opposition in Twin Peaks, the location is an essential in fortifying our positions within the Twilight Highlands! Your aid in any of these locations are essential to our victory in this war! Victory will be ours",o="赢得任意一场战场比赛，然后返回告示板领取奖励。",oEN="Win any battleground match and return to the Call Board for your reward."}
Q[900450]={d="嘶嘶嘶……当狂风呼啸着掠过鳞片与天空，灵魂便躁动起来。\n\n谷地尖啸者沿着久已写就的航线飞行。\n\n它们的皮鳞因即将到来之事而震颤。\n\n骨语者需要那些鳞片。需要贴近倾听。\n\n把它们带来，我便会解读前方等待着什么。",dEN="Hhhrrk… spirits stir when wind screams through scales and sky.\n\nVale Screechers fly paths written long ago.\n\nTheir skins hum with what comes next.\n\nBonewhisper needs those scales. Needs to listen close.\n\nBring them, and I’ll read what waits ahead.",o="为骨语者从盗贼谷的谷地尖啸者身上收集 3 片风蛇鳞片。",oEN="Collect 3 Wind Serpent Scales from Rogue Vale Screechers for Bonewhisper.",p="嘶……你还在呼吸。灵魂要的风蛇鳞片，你带来了吗？",pEN="Hhh… you return breathing still. Do you carry the Wind Serpent Scales the spirits asked for.",c="嘶……没错。这些鳞片回响着真实。我触碰它们时，命运盘绕又松开。你做得很好。灵魂们已经注意到了。",cEN="Hhss… yes. These sing true. Fates coil and loosen when I touch them. You’ve done well. Spirits noticed that."}
Q[900451]={d="这里的呼吸变得微弱。\n\n嘶嘶嘶……灵魂说，更深的真相藏在痛饮阳光的石头之中。\n\n双子巨像附近的晶体闪烁着答案与力量。\n\n巨人们看守着它们。吵闹。笨拙。危险。\n\n骨语者无法走到那里。你可以。",dEN="Breath grows thin here.\n\nHhhrrk… spirits say deeper truths hide in stone that drinks the sun.\n\nCrystals near the Twin Colossals shine with answers and power.\n\nGiants guard them. Loud. Clumsy. Dangerous.\n\nBonewhisper can’t walk there. You can.",o="在双子巨像附近收集 5 块山体水晶碎片，然后回去找骨语者。",oEN="Collect 5 Mountain Crystal Shards near the Twin Colossals and return to Bonewhisper.",p="嘶……晶体的声音很尖锐。你拿到巨像那里的碎片了吗？",pEN="Hhh… crystal voices are sharp. Do you have the shards from the Colossals.",c="嘶……好。很好。这些既能熔入幻象，也能熔入药剂。命运如今更清晰了。骨语者不会忘记。",cEN="Hhss… good. Very good. These will melt into visions and mixtures both. Fates are clearer now. Bonewhisper won’t forget this."}
Q[900452]={d="嘶嘶嘶……那些幻象来得很糟。太吵闹。太尖锐。\n\n鳞片燃烧了。晶体尖叫了。邪恶在怒痕堡沸腾。\n\n那里有个巫师正在攫取属于我部族的灵魂。\n\n若任他喘息，他的魔法腐坏的将不只是骸骨。必须让他闭嘴。",dEN="Hhhrrk… visions came wrong. Too loud. Too sharp.\n\nScales burned. Crystals screamed. Evil boils in Rage Scar Hold.\n\nA sorcerer there claws at spirits that belong to my tribe.\n\nIf left breathing, his magic will rot more than bones. He must be silenced.",o="在怒痕堡杀死戴根，获取骸骨低语。",oEN="Slay Daegan in Rage Scar Hold for Bonewhisper.",p="嘶……一想到那个地方，空气就变得沉重。你去过怒痕堡，解决了那个毒害灵魂的人吗？",pEN="Hhh… the air tightens when I think of that place. Have you gone to Rage Scar Hold and ended the one who poisons the spirits.",c="嘶……如今更安静了。灵魂安息得更好。未来正远离鲜血与灰烬。你阻止了那本不该被纵容滋长之物。骨语者记着。",cEN="Hhss… it’s quieter now. Spirits rest easier. The future bends away from blood and ash. You stopped what should not have been allowed to grow. Bonewhisper remembers this."}
Q[900460]={d="此地以南是伊希尔迪恩的废墟。那里曾是一座颇具规模的精灵城市，如今不过剩些碎石与顽固的记忆。\n\n戈杜尼食人魔占据了残存的一切，像他们一贯喜欢的那样践踏历史。大分裂之后的岁月里，许多东西都已失落，但我猜某些被遗忘的角落里还留着小玩意儿。\n\n遗物总有在不该存在的地方留存下来的习性。去废墟里、古庙中，必要时连食人魔的巢穴也搜一搜。无论找到什么都带回来给我。",dEN="South of here lie the ruins of Isildien. Once an elven city of some importance, now little more than broken stone and stubborn memories.\n\nThe Gordunni ogres have claimed what remains, trampling history underfoot as they’re so fond of doing. Much was lost to time after the Sundering, but I suspect a few trinkets still linger in forgotten corners.\n\nRelics have a habit of surviving where they shouldn’t. Search the ruins, the old temple, and even the ogres’ den if you must. Bring me whatever you find.",o="在伊希尔迪恩的废墟、古庙与食人魔巢穴中寻找任何遗物，并交给卡尔德·维拉斯。",oEN="Search the ruins, the old temple, and the ogre den in Isildien for any relics and bring them to Calder Verass.",p="你在伊希尔迪恩发现了什么有趣的东西吗？哪怕是最小的碎片，也值得仔细查看。",pEN="Have you uncovered anything of interest in Isildien. Even the smallest fragment may be worth examining.",c="迷人。真是迷人。我没料到会是这个。一件乐器，偏偏是乐器，而且还附了魔。尽管年代久远、显然还受过粗暴对待，却保存得完美无缺。\n\n你是说，一个食人魔把它当棍棒挥舞。非凡的工艺，更非凡的魔法。\n\n光是这个，这趟旅程就值了。你干得非常出色，我的好奇心也得到了极大的满足。",cEN="Fascinating. Truly fascinating. I wasn’t expecting this. An instrument, of all things, and enchanted no less. Perfectly preserved despite its age and apparent abuse.\n\nYou’re telling me an ogre was swinging this about like a club. Remarkable craftsmanship, and even more remarkable magic.\n\nThis alone makes the trip worthwhile. You’ve done excellent work, and my curiosity is more than satisfied."}
Q[900461]={d="我一直听往来的旅人提起传闻。关于海岸边一座岛的低语——恐怖之岛，还有一处遍布纳迦的巨大洞窟。\n\n它们曾是高等精灵，你知道的，在大灾变把它们扭曲成如今的模样之前。这类生物往往珍藏着前世的碎片，那是它们无法彻底割舍的过去的遗物。\n\n据说沙尔扎鲁巢穴的某处藏有一批古老的窖藏。如果它真的存在，我想看看里面有什么。",dEN="I’ve been hearing rumors from travelers passing through. Whispers of an island offshore, the Isle of Dread, and a vast cave crawling with naga.\n\nThey were once Highborne, you know, before the Sundering twisted them into what they are now. Creatures like that tend to hoard pieces of their former lives, relics of a past they can’t quite let go of.\n\nSomewhere within Shalzaru’s Lair, there’s said to be an ancient cache. If it exists, I want to see what it holds.",o="在沙尔扎鲁巢穴中找到古老的窖藏，并将发现的任何遗物带回给卡尔德·维拉斯。",oEN="Find the ancient cache in Shalzaru's Lair and return any relics you discover to Calder Verass.",p="你回来了。那些传闻属实吗？巢穴里藏着什么值得一提的东西吗？",pEN="You’re back. Did the rumors prove true. Was there anything of note hidden within the lair.",c="难以置信。简直难以置信。这些物件比我敢于期望的要完好得多，附着其上的魔法也绝无认错的可能。想想看，它们挺过了大灾变，挺过了纳迦，一直完好无损地留存至今。你给我带来了真正特别的东西。\n\n我该怎么谢你都不为过。我的研究将大受裨益，你也是。",cEN="Incredible. Simply incredible. These pieces are far more intact than I dared hope, and the magic clinging to them is unmistakable. To think they survived the Sundering, the naga, and all this time untouched. You’ve brought me something truly special.\n\nI can’t thank you enough for this. My studies will benefit greatly, and so will you."}
Q[900470]={d="嘿，你看起来就是那种冒险者！就是那种靠拳打刀砍解决大部分麻烦的人？你是吗？哦，太好了！\n\n这附近没人卖墨水，所以我想也许可以试着自己做。唯一的问题是，路虽然挺安全，但森林深处对我来说太危险了。如果你愿意，能不能帮我把材料收集来？\n\n要做墨水，我需要三样东西。一种黏合剂、一种颜料，还有一种液体。\n\n先从黏合剂开始！我看见城外有很多树人游荡，也许它们身上有某种树液或树脂？找到什么臭烘烘的东西都给我带回来，我们从那儿接着来！",dEN="Say, you look like one of those adventurer types! You know, hacking and slashing your way through most of your problems? You are? Oh, what joy!\n\nSince no one around here sells ink, I thought I might try making my own. The only issue is that while the road is safe enough, the deeper forest is far too dangerous for me. If you’re willing, maybe you could gather the materials instead?\n\nTo make ink, I’ll need three things. A binder, a pigment, and a liquid.\n\nLet’s start with the binder! I saw plenty of treants wandering outside town, perhaps they have some kind of sap or tree resin? Bring me back whatever stinky substance you can find, and we'll go from there!",o="在城附近的森林中收集树人树液。把树液带给塔姆辛·勒弗雷。",oEN="Collect treant sap from the forest near town. Bring the sap to Tamsin Levray.",p="你已经回来了！你在外面找到什么树脂了吗？",pEN="You’re back already! Did you manage to find some sort of resin out there?",c="嗯，不算完美，但能用！谢谢你，<class>，材料少一样了！",cEN="Well it's not perfect, but it will do! Thank you <class>, that’s one material down!"}
Q[900471]={d="接下来，我们需要一种用来调配的液体……通常我会就近取些能喝的水，但我想到一个一直想试试的主意！\n\n前几天我朝山丘那边望，看到有元素生物在海岸边游荡！你能想象它们的水有多纯净吗？作为我们墨水的基底简直再完美不过！\n\n去海岸边帮我取一些来，好吗？不过，请务必小心。",dEN="Next, we'll need a liquid for mixing... Normally I’d just gather whatever drinking water is nearby, but I’ve had an idea I’ve always wanted to try!\n\nThe other day I peeked over the hills and spotted water elementals roaming along the coast! Can you imagine how pure their water must be? It would be absolutely perfect as a base for our ink!\n\nHead down to the coast and collect some for me, okay? Please do be careful, though.",o="沿海岸从海元素身上收集纯净之水。把它带给塔姆辛·勒弗雷。",oEN="Collect pure water from sea elementals along the coast. Bring it to Tamsin Levray.",p="你从元素身上取到水了吗？我迫不及待想看看！",pEN="Did you manage to collect some water from the elementals? I’m dying to see it!",c="哇！我从没见过这么清澈的水，这用起来一定棒极了！你知道你干得有多出色吗？",cEN="Wow! I’ve never seen water this clear before, this will do nicely! You’re doing an amazing job, you know."}
Q[900472]={d="只剩最后一种材料了，颜料！与其将就着用暗淡的黑色，我想我们也许可以试试更鲜艳的颜色……比如红色？或者绿色？\n\n然后我就想到了。豺狼人提到过这东南方住着些奇怪的虫子！\n\n那种生物用来做浓烈的红色再合适不过！哦，太令人兴奋了！你能帮我带一些它们的腺体回来吗？",dEN="Just one ingredient left now, the pigment! Rather than settling for a dull black, I thought we could try something more vibrant... Maybe a red? Or even a green?\n\nThen it hit me. The gnolls mentioned strange bugs living southeast of here!\n\nA creature like are perfect for a rich red! Oh, how exciting! Could you fetch me some of their glands please?",o="收集异种虫颜料腺体，并把它们带给塔姆辛·勒弗雷。",oEN="Collect silithid pigment glands and bring them to Tamsin Levray.",p="求你了，告诉我你找到颜料了。一想到这事我就坐立不安。",pEN="Please tell me you found the pigments. I can hardly sit still thinking about it.",c="这样一来，我的墨水就完成了！再次谢谢你，<class>！要是我在这儿逗留期间没法把一切都记下来，真不知道该怎么办，我确实欠你一次！\n\n拿着，这是给你的辛苦费。希望我们很快能再碰面！",cEN="And with that, my ink is complete! Thank you again <class>! I don't know what I would have done if I couldn't jam everything down during my visit here, I am truly in your debt!\n\nHere, take this for your troubles. And I do hope our paths cross again soon!"}
Q[900480]={d="伦克弄丢了大棒。最喜欢的大棒。落在了旧洞穴里。坏地方。吵闹又凶恶的食人魔。伦克不会再去了。伦克找到了新家。\n\n有时很吵，但大多还不错。可伦克想念旧大棒，想把它拿回来。你看起来很强，能帮伦克找回大棒吗？会让伦克非常高兴。\n\n大概是伦克的兄弟拿着的。兄弟让那里不再像家。",dEN="Lunk lose club. Favorite club. Left back at old cave. Bad place. Loud, mean ogres. Lunk not go back there. Lunk found new home.\n\nSometimes loud, but mostly okay. But Lunk miss old club and want back. You seem strong, can you get Lunk club back? Would make Lunk very happy.\n\nLunk’s brother probably has. Brother made it not feel like home.",o="前往戈杜尼前哨站，击败格伦克，取回伦克最爱的大棒。",oEN="Travel to Gordunni Outpost and defeat Gerlunk for Lunk's Favorite Club.",p="你去洞穴。找到伦克的大棒。带回来。简单。",pEN="You go cave. You find Lunk club. You bring it back. Simple.",c="啊。就是它。握在手里感觉还是那么好。\n\n你做了件好事，只要伦克在这儿，庇护所就是安全的。欢迎你留下。",cEN="Ahh. There it is. Still feels right in hand.\n\nYou did good thing, hub safe while Lunk here. You welcome to stay."}
Q[907002]={d="奥金尼地穴曾是许多令人作呕的实验之地，目的都是为掌握通灵术。玛拉达尔主教带着他的疯狂居住在陵墓深处。是时候让他和那些游荡在地穴中的灵魂安息了。不过在进入奥金尼之前，你最好记住这座城市最初的守卫者的警告……不尊重死者的人……或许会与他们一同被埋葬。",dEN="The Auchenai Crypts were home to many unsavory experiments in the pursuit of mastering the necromantic arts. Exarch Maladaar resides in the depths of the tombs with his madness. It is time to put him and the spirits that walk the crypt to rest. Though you would do well to remember the warning of the city’s original guardians before entering Auchenai… those who do not respect the dead...... may become entombed along with them.",o="征服地穴并击败主教玛拉达尔。",oEN="Conquer the Crypts and slay Exarch Maladaar."}
Q[907003]={d="星界财团悬赏节点亲王沙法尔。虚灵结界使他们无法进入法力陵墓处理这一威胁。虽然你可能只是阻止了一个虚灵把这里洗劫一空、好给另一个腾出地方，但他们中只有一位被证明是我们的盟友。如果你愿意挑战节点亲王，赏金就归你了。",dEN="The Consortium has offered a bounty on Nexus-Prince Shaffar. Ethereal Wards prevent them from entering the Mana Tombs and dealing with this threat. Although you may just be preventing one ethereal looting the place blind to make room for another, only one of them has proven our ally. The bounty is yours to collect should you wish to challenge the Nexus-Prince.",o="征服陵墓并击败节点亲王沙法尔。",oEN="Conquer the Tombs and slay Nexus-Prince Shaffar."}
Q[907004]={d="奥金顿曾是德莱尼安葬逝者的圣地，直到暗影议会召唤出一只远古恶魔将其亵渎。被释放的魔法从未真正消散，如今疯狂的鸦人国王泰罗克已让他的狂信徒利用这股力量施展黑暗魔法。他们仍在寻找他们的主人摩摩尔，并以他的名义举行黑暗仪式。是时候清除外域的这处污点了。",dEN="Auchindoun was once a holy ground for Frainei burials until the Shadow Council defiled it by summoning an ancient demon. The magics released have never truly faded, and now the insane Talon King Ikiss has set his zealots to harnessing this power to work dark magic. They still seek their master, Murmur, and perform dark rituals in his name. It is time to clean this taint from Outlands.",o="征服大厅并击败鸦爪之王伊基斯。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Talon King Ikiss."}
Q[907005]={d="暗影议会在无知与追逐力量中召唤出了摩摩尔。有些存在之所以居于宇宙的遥远角落是有原因的。暗影议会已经难以控制摩摩尔。这个存在给外域带来浩劫只是时间问题。前往暗影迷宫，在摩摩尔的力量增长到我们无法压制之前将其放逐。",dEN="The Shadow Council summoned Murmur in their ignorance and pursuit of power. There is a reason some beings reside in the far corners of the universe. The Shadow Council is having trouble keeping Murmur under control. It is only a matter of time before this being unleashed havoc on Outlands. Travel to the Shadow Labyrinth and banish Murmur before his power grows beyond what we can suppress.",o="征服迷宫并放逐摩摩尔。",oEN="Conquery the Labyrinth and banish Murmur."}
Q[907006]={d="我们最近抓获了向太阳之井走私法力容器的虚灵，凯尔萨斯计划用它们协助召唤基尔加丹。我们追踪这些法力容器到了能源舰。如果我们不中断他们的补给，他们可能会在我们准备好进攻太阳之井之前成功召唤出他们的指挥官。前往能源舰，摧毁他们的行动。",dEN="We recently captured ethereals smuggling manacells into the Sunwell where Kael’thas plans to use them to assist in summoning Kil’jaeden. We tracked those manacells back to the Mechanar. If we do not interrupt their supply they may succeed in summoning their commander before we are in place to assault the Sunwell. Travel to the Mechanar and destroy their operation.",o="关闭能源舰并击败计算者帕萨雷恩。",oEN="Shut down the Mechanar and slay Pathaleon the Calculator."}
Q[907007]={d="血精灵科学家对外域的植物群进行实验，利用纳鲁科技创造并操控生物，以赋予自己新的力量。看来这些实验并未如预期进行，已经失控。我们必须在这些被魔法改造的生物（简称 MMO）逃出实验室并引发连锁生态崩溃之前净化生态船！",dEN="Blood Elf scientists carry out experiments on the Flora in Outland, using naaru technology to create and manipulate living beings to grant themselves new powers. It seems that these experiments did not go as expected and have gotten out of control. We need to purify the Botanica before these Magically Modified Organisms, or MMOs for short, escape the lab and begin a cascading ecological collapse!",o="净化生态船并杀死迁跃扭木。",oEN="Purge the Botanica and slay Warp Splinter."}
Q[907008]={d="纳鲁将他们在禁魔监狱遇到的最恐怖、最危险的生物关押了起来。凯尔萨斯派了一名典狱长和守卫前往禁魔监狱，但有哪个血精灵能在如此强大的力量环绕下不被腐化呢？周围是黑龙军团的爪牙、燃烧军团的恶魔，甚至还有上古之神的仆从……那以自由换取力量的耳语太过诱人，囚犯们已经开始挣脱束缚。赶快前往禁魔监狱，确保监狱的安全！",dEN="The Naaru jailed the most terrifying and dangerous creatures they encountered in the Arcatraz. Kael’thas sent a warden and guards to the arcatraz, but what blood elf wouldn’t become corrupted surrounded by so much power? Surrounded by agents of the black dragonflight, demons of the Burning Legion and even servants of the Old Gods… the whispers of an exchange of power for freedom were too enticing, and the prisoners have begun to break free. Make haste to the Arcatraz and secure the prison!",o="确保禁魔监狱的安全并杀死先驱斯克里思。",oEN="Secure the Arcatraz and slay Harbinger Skyriss."}
Q[907009]={d="塞纳里奥远征队派出斥候调查正在抽干赞加沼泽的蒸汽树桩之谜。自然学家拜特再也没有回来。我们担心最坏的情况。前往奴隶围栏，清除你发现的一切威胁，以便塞纳里奥远征队完成他们的任务。",dEN="The Cenarion Expedition has sent scouts to investigate the mystery of the steam stumps draining Zangermarsh. Naturalist Bite never returned. We fear the worst. Travel to the Slave Pens dispatch any threats you find so the Cenarion Expedition can complete their mission.",o="解放奴隶围栏并杀死夸格米拉。",oEN="Liberate the Slave Pens and slay Quagmirran."}
Q[907010]={d="对我们的孢子人盟友来说，最大的危险一直是沼泽行者。我们对外域的入侵只会让他们的处境更糟。随着纳迦在盘牙水库加固阵地，沼泽行者已开始离开他们在幽暗沼泽的最后避难所。斯波雷加对我们在赞加沼泽的成功至关重要。绝不能让黑色潜行者威胁我们的盟友。",dEN="The greatest danger to our sporeling allies has always been the marsh walkers. Our incursion into Outlands has only made their situation worse. With the Naga fortifying their position in the Coilfang Reservoir, the marsh walkers have begun leaving their last refuge in the Underbog. Sporeggar is critical to our success in Zangarmarsh. The Black Stalker must not be allowed to threaten our allies.",o="征服幽暗沼泽并杀死黑色潜行者。",oEN="Conquer the Underbog and slay The Black Stalker."}
Q[907011]={d="蒸汽地窟是纳迦在赞加沼泽抽水行动的机械心脏，也是我们对抗瓦丝琪女士的重要战术目标。仅仅破坏设施是不够的。我们必须消灭那些有能力重建它的人。杀死机械师斯蒂里格和水利术士瑟斯比亚，确保机械与魔法上的修复都不可能进行。然后通过击败督军卡利瑟里斯给予决定性一击。阻止蒸汽地窟。阻止抽水。",dEN="The Steamvault is the mechanical heart of the Naga’s draining operations in Zangarmarsh and is a significant tactical target in our efforts against Lady Vashj. Simply sabotaging the facility is not enough. We must destroy those capable of rebuilding it. Slay Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia to ensure repairs both mechanic and magical are impossible. Then deal the decisive blow by defeating Warlord Kalithresh. Stop the Steamvault. Stop the draining.",o="关闭蒸汽地窟并杀死督军卡利瑟里斯。",oEN="Shut down the Steamvault and slay Warlord Kalithresh."}
Q[907012]={d="邪兽人已经加固了地狱火堡垒。他们满足于劫掠周边地区，但报告显示他们的人数正在……增长。我们需要对堡垒发动进攻。夺取城墙的控制权，好让我们的部队发动全面进攻！",dEN="The Fel Orcs have fortified Hellfire Citadel. They have been content simply raiding the surrounding area, but the reports show their numbers are… growing. We need to launch an assault on the Citadel. Take control of the Ramparts so our forces can launch a full fledged assault!",o="征服城墙并杀死先驱者瓦兹鲁登。",oEN="Conquer the Ramparts and slay Vazruden the Herald."}
Q[907013]={d="我们的部队已将邪兽人赶下城墙。趁此机会推进到塔中，设法揭开新邪兽人诞生背后的秘密！清除途中遇到的一切威胁。",dEN="Our forces have pushed the Fel Orcs off the Ramparts. Take this opportunity to push into the Tower and attempt to uncover the secret behind the creation of new Fel Orcs! Eliminate any threats you encounter on the way.",o="征服熔炉并杀死击碎者克里丹。",oEN="Conquer the Furnace and slay Keli'dan the Breaker."}
Q[907014]={d="是时候在战斗中面对酋长卡加斯·刃拳了。只要邪兽人还能通过黑暗之门劫掠我们的补给线，我们就永远没有资源对黑暗神殿发动进攻。进入破碎大厅，终结这一威胁！",dEN="It is time to face Warchief Kargath Bladefist in battle. As long as the Fel Orcs can raid our supply lines through the Dark Portal we will never have the resources to mount an assault on the Dark Temple. Enter the Shattered Halls and put an end to this threat!",o="征服大厅并杀死酋长卡加斯·刃拳。",oEN="Conquer the Halls and slay Warchief Kargath Bladefist."}
Q[907015]={d="时间的流动必须得到维护。即便我们的时间线只发生一点微小的改变，也可能带来灾难性的后果；可要是萨尔从未逃出敦霍尔德，那将发生怎样的崩解？我们所知晓的一切都将被抹去！时光守护者请求你立即援助。如果我们失去了过去，就必定会失去未来。",dEN="The Flow of Time must be preserved. Even one small change in our timeline could prove catastrophic, but to imagine the unraveling that would occur should Thrall never escape Durnhold? Everything we’ve ever known would be undone! The Keepers of Time request your immediate aid. If we lose the past, we surely lose the future.",o="守护时间并杀死纪元猎人。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay the Epoch Hunter."}
Q[907016]={d="任由黑暗之门的开启被阻止是很诱人，但谁能说全新的未来会带来什么？我们的敌人之所以想要篡改时间线，唯一的原因就是我们在这一条时间线中对燃烧军团构成了严重威胁。我们必须维护时间的流动！",dEN="It is tempting to allow the opening of the Dark Portal to be prevented, but who is to say what a new future would hold? The only reason our enemies would seek to alter the timeline is because we pose a serious threat to the Burning Legion in this one. We must preserve the flow of time!",o="守护时间并杀死埃欧努斯。",oEN="Preserve Time and slay Aeonus."}
Q[909040]={d="整个行动都靠水运转，而现在废土强盗那群渣滓弄得我们连一滴余水都快没有了。拆解我们的炸弹是一回事，但我们的储备已经低到危险的地步。要让加基森保持供水，我们需要更多水，而且要快。\n\n你去收拾那些强盗的同时，顺路到热砂港把这批订货替我送过去。当地的一个搬运工，泽贝尔·斯普利特，应该是我们快速补水的接头人。交给他，他知道该怎么做。",dEN="This whole operation runs on water, and right now the Wastewander scum have made sure there is barely a drop left to spare. Freeing up our pumps is one thing, but we are running dangerously low on reserve. If Gadgetzan is going to stay quenched, we need more water and fast.\n\nWhile you are putting those bandits in their place, head over to Steamwheedle and deliver this order for me. One of the local porters, Zebel Sphlit, should be our guy for a quick refill. Get it to him and he will know what to do.",o="把比尔吉维兹尔的订货单交给热砂港的泽贝尔·斯普利特。",oEN="Deliver Bilgewhizzle's Order to Zebel Shplit in Steamwheedle Port.",p="你带了比尔吉维兹尔的订货单吗？我可没时间守着空箱子干等。",pEN="Do you have Bilgewhizzle's order? I do not have time to wait on empty crates.",c="啊。加基森闹水荒。迟早的事。\n\n现在走吧。我还得管一个港口。",cEN="Ah. Water problems in Gadgetzan. Always sooner or later.\n\nNow move along. I have a port to run."}
Q[909041]={d="哦哦哦，这来得正是时候。我知道外面一定写着什么了不起的东西，货真价实的东西。不是酒馆里的传闻，也不是水手的闲话，而是一本真正的海盗日记。就是那种沾满海水和糟糕决定的。\n\n想想看。他们的想法。他们的日常。他们的风格。人人都把海盗说成拿刀的粗人，但故事不可能只有这一面。一定有机智。有戏剧性。有他们生活和抢劫方式中的格调。\n\n要是我能读到一本真正的日记，终于就能明白海盗究竟是怎么想的了。当然是为了研究。非常严肃的研究。\n\n你该替我找一本。要真的。别在意听起来有多危险。海盗一直在写东西。大概吧。",dEN="Oh oh oh, this is perfect timing. I just know there is something incredible written down out there, something authentic. Not tavern rumors or sailor gossip, but a real pirate diary. The kind stained with saltwater and bad decisions.\n\nThink about it. Their thoughts. Their routines. Their flair. Everyone talks about pirates like they are brutes with knives, but that cannot be the whole story. There has to be wit. Drama. A sense of style in how they live and steal.\n\nIf I could just read one genuine diary, I could finally understand how a pirate truly thinks. For research of course. Very serious research.\n\nYou should find one for me. A real one. Do not worry about how dangerous it sounds. Pirates write all the time. Probably.",o="在失落索具洞窟中取回一本海盗日记。",oEN="Retrieve a Pirate Diary from Lost Rigger Cove.",p="你找到真正的海盗日记了吗？不要赝品，也不要旅游手册；要带盐渍和墨水污迹的那种。",pEN="Did you find a real pirate diary? No fakes, no tourist brochures—something with salt and ink stains.",c="你真弄到了一本。看看这笔迹。这些墨渍。太不可思议了。\n\n哦，天哪。听听这一段。他们抱怨个不停。抱怨天气。抱怨靴子。抱怨被人捅刀子。最后这条有点出人意料。\n\n尽管如此，还是能感受到其中的浪漫。自由。自信。对美学的执着。说实话，我觉得自己本会是个了不起的海盗。\n谢谢。这本得读一整晚。也可能要好几晚。研究需要投入。",cEN="You actually got one. Look at the handwriting. The ink blots. This is incredible.\n\nOh wow. Listen to this part. They complain so much. About the weather. About their boots. About getting stabbed. That last one is a bit surprising.\n\nStill though, you can feel the romance in it. The freedom. The confidence. The commitment to the aesthetic. Honestly, I think I would have made a fantastic pirate.\nThank you. This is going to take all night to read. Possibly several nights. Research takes dedication."}
Q[909042]={d="你给我带来的沙子没有它应有的那么纯净。\n\n南边的沙丘下有什么东西在挖掘。许多条腿。无尽的饥饿。它们啃噬大地，在本该留存记忆的地方留下空洞。沙漠在它们面前退缩，却无处可逃。\n\n到南边去。摧毁那些在下方爬行啃食的东西。别听它们的声响。它们不属于这里。这不是屠杀。这是清理。",dEN="The sand you brought me was not as pure as it should have been.\n\nSomething is burrowing beneath the dunes to the south. Many legs. Endless hunger. They gnaw at the land and leave hollows where memory should be. The desert recoils from them, but it cannot move away.\n\nGo south. Destroy what crawls and feeds below. Do not listen to their noise. They are not part of this place. This is not slaughter. It is cleansing.",o="消灭裂口深渊中的昆虫类生物。",oEN="Destroy the insectoid creatures within the Gaping Chasm.",p="你把沙丘下爬行的东西解决了吗？裂口深渊应该安静下来了。",pEN="Have you silenced what crawls beneath the dunes? The Gaping Chasm should be still.",c="压力已经减轻了。\n\n大地会留下伤疤，但它会愈合。只要给它安静与时间，它总是会愈合。",cEN="The pressure has eased.\n\nThe land will scar, but it will heal. It always does, if given silence and time."}
Q[950000]={o="相关",oEN="Related"}
Q[967000]={o="在其中舞动的虚空染焰遵循着一种你在意识边缘才能感知到的节律……它源自沙层深处的下方。\n\n虚空熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化异种虫甲壳的火焰。",oEN="The Void tinged flames within dance to a rhythm you feel on the edge of your consciousness... emanating from deep beneath the sands.\n\nA Void Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Fused Silithid Carapace.",p="其中的虚空染焰吞噬了甲壳，只留下原本熔铸在其中的金属。",pEN="The void tinged flames within devour the carapace, leaving behind the metal that was fused within."}
