Q[967003]={o="一股惊恐之感压过了眼前熔炉的炽热，火焰仿佛在痛苦地尖叫……凑近细看便明白了原因。这些火焰以新近生者尚新鲜的骸骨为食。\n\n天灾熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化憎恶锁链的火焰。",oEN="A sense of a dread overpowers the intense heat within the forge before you, the fires seeming to scream in anguish... and upon closer examination it becomes clear why. The flames are being fed by the fresh bones of the recently living.\n\nA Scourge Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Abomination Chains.",p="熔炉内的骸骨围绕着憎恶锁链翻涌扭动；几只骷髅手指带着只有复仇者才有的怒火扯断了锁链。骸骨聚拢起来，把铸锭举给了你。",pEN="The bones within the forge undulate and writh around the Abomination Chains, skeletal fingers rip the chains apart in anger only reserved by those seeking revenge. The bones form together and lift the ingot out to you."}
Q[967004]={o="一股惊恐之感压过了眼前熔炉的炽热，火焰仿佛在痛苦地尖叫……凑近细看便明白了原因。这些火焰以新近生者尚新鲜的骸骨为食。\n\n天灾熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化憎恶锁链的火焰。",oEN="A sense of a dread overpowers the intense heat within the forge before you, the fires seeming to scream in anguish... and upon closer examination it becomes clear why. The flames are being fed by the fresh bones of the recently living.\n\nA Scourge Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Abomination Chains.",p="熔炉内的骸骨围绕着憎恶锁链翻涌扭动；几只骷髅手指带着只有复仇者才有的怒火扯断了锁链。骸骨聚拢起来，把铸锭举给了你。",pEN="The bones within the forge undulate and writh around the Abomination Chains, skeletal fingers rip the chains apart in anger only reserved by those seeking revenge. The bones form together and lift the ingot out to you."}
