Q[967006]={o="眼前的熔炉翻涌着源源不断的岩浆。如此炽烈的高温只可能来自黑石山的岩浆矿脉。\n\n火山熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化龙裔饰品的火焰。",oEN="The forge before you bubbles with a steady stream in lava. Such intense heat can only come from the lava veins within Blackrock Mountain.\n\nA Volcanic Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Wyrmkin Trinkets.",p="龙裔饰品似乎吸收了岩浆熔炉那惊人的热量。其中的宝石完全熔化，金属则开始发光，最终融为一体，形成一块坚实的龙钢铸锭。",pEN="The Wyrmkin Trinkets seem to absorb the incredible heat from the lava fed forge. The gems within completely melt away as the metal begins to glow and finally pool together, forming a solid ingot of Dragonsteel."}
Q[967007]={o="眼前的熔炉翻涌着源源不断的岩浆。如此炽烈的高温只可能来自黑石山的岩浆矿脉。\n\n火山熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化龙裔饰品的火焰。",oEN="The forge before you bubbles with a steady stream in lava. Such intense heat can only come from the lava veins within Blackrock Mountain.\n\nA Volcanic Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Wyrmkin Trinkets.",p="龙裔饰品似乎吸收了岩浆熔炉那惊人的热量。其中的宝石完全熔化，金属则开始发光，最终融为一体，形成一块坚实的龙钢铸锭。",pEN="The Wyrmkin Trinkets seem to absorb the incredible heat from the lava fed forge. The gems within completely melt away as the metal begins to glow and finally pool together, forming a solid ingot of Dragonsteel."}
Q[967008]={o="眼前的熔炉翻涌着源源不断的岩浆。如此炽烈的高温只可能来自黑石山的岩浆矿脉。\n\n火山熔炉蕴藏着已知唯一能够熔化龙裔饰品的火焰。",oEN="The forge before you bubbles with a steady stream in lava. Such intense heat can only come from the lava veins within Blackrock Mountain.\n\nA Volcanic Forge contains the only fires known capable of smelting Wyrmkin Trinkets.",p="龙裔饰品似乎吸收了岩浆熔炉那惊人的热量。其中的宝石完全熔化，金属则开始发光，最终融为一体，形成一块坚实的龙钢铸锭。",pEN="The Wyrmkin Trinkets seem to absorb the incredible heat from the lava fed forge. The gems within completely melt away as the metal begins to glow and finally pool together, forming a solid ingot of Dragonsteel."}
Q[967009]={o="眼前的熔炉中满是成千上万个微小的腐化火元素，它们察觉到你的存在后便停止了其中的火焰，它们的渴望十分清楚……被喂食。\n\n只有腐化熔炉中的腐化火元素，才能在吞噬活体铁树树皮时不把它彻底吃光。",oEN="The Forge before you is full of thousands of tiny corrupted fire elementals, and the flames within cease as they turn towards your presence, their desire clear... to be fed.\n\nOnly the Corrupted fire elementals within a Corrupt Forge are capable of consuming Living Iron Tree Bark without completely devouring it.",p="成千上万个微小的腐化火元素正在大快朵颐地啃食活体铁树的树皮，但熔炉几乎没有散出任何热量。任何普通的火焰都会夺走活体铁树的生命。进食完毕后，比先前略多一些的微小元素转过身来，满怀期待地看着你。",pEN="Thousands of tiny corrupted fire elementals feast upon the Living Irontree Bark, yet barely any heat escapes the forge. Any normal flames would have extinguished the life from the Living Iron. Their feast done, slightly more tiny elementals than before turn to look at you expectantly."}
Q[967010]={o="眼前的熔炉中满是成千上万个微小的腐化火元素，它们察觉到你的存在后便停止了其中的火焰，它们的渴望十分清楚……被喂食。\n\n只有腐化熔炉中的腐化火元素，才能熔化活体铁树树皮而不把它彻底吃光。",oEN="The Forge before you is full of thousands of tiny corrupted fire elementals, and the flames within cease as they turn towards your presence, their desire clear... to be fed.\n\nOnly the Corrupted fire elementals within a Corrupt Forge are capable of smelting Living Iron Tree Bark without completely devouring it.",p="成千上万个微小的腐化火元素正在大快朵颐地啃食活体铁树的树皮，但熔炉几乎没有散出任何热量。任何普通的火焰都会夺走活体铁树的生命。进食完毕后，比先前略多一些的微小元素转过身来，满怀期待地看着你。",pEN="Thousands of tiny corrupted fire elementals feast upon the Living Irontree Bark, yet barely any heat escapes the forge. Any normal flames would have extinguished the life from the Living Iron. Their feast done, slightly more tiny elementals than before turn to look at you expectantly."}
