Q[967012]={o="眼前的熔炉如此古老，其石料几乎像是天然形成的岩层。异界金属的矿脉贯穿石间，散发的炽热让人几乎无法靠近这座熔炉。\n\n只有侏罗纪熔炉才能熔化陨石碎片。",oEN="The Forge before you is so ancient the stones almost appear to be a natural rock formation. Veins of an otherworldly metal crawl throughout the stones emanating a heat so intense that approaching the forge is almost impossible.\n\nOnly the Jurassic Forge is capable of smelting Meteorite Shards.",p="你把陨石碎片放进熔炉，然后迅速退开。浸润着熔炉石壁的异界金属爆发出刺目的光芒，随后光芒消退，露出其中星界金属铸锭。",pEN="You place the Meteorite Shards in the forge and quickly back away. The otherworldly metal permeating the stone of the forge glows to a blinding light before fading to reveal the Star Metal ingot within."}
Q[967013]={o="你眼前的熔炉如此古老，其石料几乎像是天然形成的岩层。异界金属的矿脉贯穿石间，散发的炽热让人几乎无法靠近这座熔炉。\n\n只有侏罗纪熔炉才能熔化星界金属。",oEN="The Forge before you is so ancient the stones almost appear to be a natural rock formation. Veins of an otherworldly metal crawl throughout the stones emanating a heat so intense that approaching the forge is almost impossible.\n\nOnly the Jurassic Forge is capable of smelting Star Metal.",p="你把陨石碎片放进熔炉，然后迅速退开。浸润着熔炉石壁的异界金属爆发出刺目的光芒，随后光芒消退，露出其中星界金属铸锭。",pEN="You place the Meteorite Shards in the forge and quickly back away. The otherworldly metal permeating the stone of the forge glows to a blinding light before fading to reveal the Star Metal ingot within."}
Q[967014]={o="你眼前的熔炉如此古老，其石料几乎像是天然形成的岩层。异界金属的矿脉贯穿石间，散发的炽热让人几乎无法靠近这座熔炉。\n\n只有侏罗纪熔炉才能熔化星界金属。",oEN="The Forge before you is so ancient the stones almost appear to be a natural rock formation. Veins of an otherworldly metal crawl throughout the stones emanating a heat so intense that approaching the forge is almost impossible.\n\nOnly the Jurassic Forge is capable of smelting Star Metal.",p="你把陨石碎片放进熔炉，然后迅速退开。浸润着熔炉石壁的异界金属爆发出刺目的光芒，随后光芒消退，露出其中星界金属铸锭。",pEN="You place the Meteorite Shards in the forge and quickly back away. The otherworldly metal permeating the stone of the forge glows to a blinding light before fading to reveal the Star Metal ingot within."}
Q[967015]={o="你眼前的熔炉燃烧着淡蓝色的火焰，你一靠近，它们便吸走你身体的热量。\n\n只有极地熔炉才能熔化凛冬钢。",oEN="The Forge before you burns with pale blue flames that suck the heat from your body as you approach.\n\nOnly the Arctic Forge is capable of smelting Wintersteel.",p="淡蓝色的火焰在包裹霜铸锤心时变得冰冷刺骨。火焰似乎与跳动的霜铸锤心同频搏动，强度不断攀升，直到那搏动化为一声唯一的回响，随后心脏与火焰仿佛融为一体。搏动停止了，一块凛冬钢铸锭静卧在熔炉之中。",pEN="The pale blue flames grow frigid as they engulf the Frostmaul Hearts. The flames seem to beat in tandem with the Beating Frostmaul Heart, growing in intensitity until the beating becomes a single reverberation before heart and fire appear to melt together as one. The beating ceases, and a Wintersteel Ingot rests within the Forge."}
Q[967016]={o="你眼前的熔炉燃烧着淡蓝色的火焰，你一靠近，它们便吸走你身体的热量。\n\n只有极地熔炉才能熔化凛冬钢。",oEN="The Forge before you burns with pale blue flames that suck the heat from your body as you approach.\n\nOnly the Arctic Forge is capable of smelting Wintersteel.",p="淡蓝色的火焰在包裹霜铸锤心时变得冰冷刺骨。火焰似乎与跳动的霜铸锤心同频搏动，强度不断攀升，直到那搏动化为一声唯一的回响，随后心脏与火焰仿佛融为一体。搏动停止了，一块凛冬钢铸锭静卧在熔炉之中。",pEN="The pale blue flames grow frigid as they engulf the Frostmaul Hearts. The flames seem to beat in tandem with the Beating Frostmaul Heart, growing in intensitity until the beating becomes a single reverberation before heart and fire appear to melt together as one. The beating ceases, and a Wintersteel Ingot rests within the Forge."}
