Q[967018]={o="你眼前的古老石板受到强大的虚空魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导邪教遗物的能量，将那些防护分解为午夜之尘。",oEN="The ancient tablet before you is warded with powerful void magics.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Cultist Relics to shatter the wards into Midnight Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由邪教徒遗物引导向你面前的石板。被引导的能量先是变得混沌，最终却与石板散发的虚空能量对齐。如同一把钥匙严丝合缝地嵌入锁孔，那些防护自行崩塌，化为一堆午夜之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the cultist relics into the tablet before you. The channeled energy becomes chaotic, but eventually aligns with the void energy emenating from tablet. Like a key clicking into place, the wards collaspe upon themselves into a pile of Midnight Dust."}
Q[967019]={o="你眼前的古老石板受到强大的虚空魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导邪教遗物的能量，将那些防护分解为午夜之尘。",oEN="The ancient tablet before you is warded with powerful void magics.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Cultist Relics to shatter the wards into Midnight Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由邪教徒遗物引导向你面前的石板。被引导的能量先是变得混沌，最终却与石板散发的虚空能量对齐。如同一把钥匙严丝合缝地嵌入锁孔，那些防护自行崩塌，化为一堆午夜之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the cultist relics into the tablet before you. The channeled energy becomes chaotic, but eventually aligns with the void energy emenating from tablet. Like a key clicking into place, the wards collaspe upon themselves into a pile of Midnight Dust."}
Q[967020]={o="你眼前的古老石板受到强大的虚空魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导邪教遗物的能量，将那些防护分解为午夜之尘。",oEN="The ancient tablet before you is warded with powerful void magics.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Cultist Relics to shatter the wards into Midnight Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由邪教徒遗物引导向你面前的石板。被引导的能量先是变得混沌，最终却与石板散发的虚空能量对齐。如同一把钥匙严丝合缝地嵌入锁孔，那些防护自行崩塌，化为一堆午夜之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the cultist relics into the tablet before you. The channeled energy becomes chaotic, but eventually aligns with the void energy emenating from tablet. Like a key clicking into place, the wards collaspe upon themselves into a pile of Midnight Dust."}
Q[967021]={o="你眼前的天灾石板受到强大的通灵术与死亡魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导天灾之焦的能量，将那些防护分解为行尸之尘。",oEN="The scourge tablet before you is warded with powerful necromancy and death magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Scourge Foci to shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由天灾之焦引导向你面前的石板。环绕天灾石板的防护在熟悉的死灵能量面前屈服，你稍稍改变引导方式，便将那些防护击碎成行尸之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the scourge foci into the tablet before you. The wards surrounding the scourge tablet surrender to the familiar necrotic energy, and with a subtle shift of your channeling, you shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust."}
Q[967022]={o="你眼前的天灾石板受到强大的通灵术与死亡魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导天灾之焦的能量，将那些防护分解为行尸之尘。",oEN="The scourge tablet before you is warded with powerful necromancy and death magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Scourge Foci to shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由天灾之焦引导向你面前的石板。环绕天灾石板的防护在熟悉的死灵能量面前屈服，你稍稍改变引导方式，便将那些防护击碎成行尸之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the scourge foci into the tablet before you. The wards surrounding the scourge tablet surrender to the familiar necrotic energy, and with a subtle shift of your channeling, you shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust."}
Q[967023]={o="你眼前的天灾石板受到强大的通灵术与死亡魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导天灾之焦的能量，将那些防护分解为行尸之尘。",oEN="The scourge tablet before you is warded with powerful necromancy and death magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Scourge Foci to shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由天灾之焦引导向你面前的石板。环绕天灾石板的防护在熟悉的死灵能量面前屈服，你稍稍改变引导方式，便将那些防护击碎成行尸之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the scourge foci into the tablet before you. The wards surrounding the scourge tablet surrender to the familiar necrotic energy, and with a subtle shift of your channeling, you shatter the wards into Animated Corpse Dust."}
Q[967024]={o="你眼前的火山石板受到强大火焰魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导活体火山焦油的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为火山之尘。",oEN="The volcanic tablet before you is warded with powerful fire magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Living Volcanic Tar to shatter the wards into Volcanic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由活体火山焦油引导向你面前的石板。火山焦油吞噬了环绕石板的火焰魔法，直到那些防护再也没有力量维持附魔，崩塌成火山之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Living Volcanic Tar into the tablet before you. The Volcanic Tar devours the fire magic surrounding the tablet until the wards no longer have the strength to maintain their enchantment and collapse into Volcanic Dust."}
Q[967025]={o="你眼前的火山石板受到强大火焰魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导活体火山焦油的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为火山之尘。",oEN="The volcanic tablet before you is warded with powerful fire magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Living Volcanic Tar to shatter the wards into Volcanic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由活体火山焦油引导向你面前的石板。火山焦油吞噬了环绕石板的火焰魔法，直到那些防护再也没有力量维持附魔，崩塌成火山之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Living Volcanic Tar into the tablet before you. The Volcanic Tar devours the fire magic surrounding the tablet until the wards no longer have the strength to maintain their enchantment and collapse into Volcanic Dust."}
Q[967026]={o="你眼前的火山石板受到强大火焰魔法的保护。\n\n你可以引导活体火山焦油的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为火山之尘。",oEN="The volcanic tablet before you is warded with powerful fire magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Living Volcanic Tar to shatter the wards into Volcanic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由活体火山焦油引导向你面前的石板。火山焦油吞噬了环绕石板的火焰魔法，直到那些防护再也没有力量维持附魔，崩塌成火山之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Living Volcanic Tar into the tablet before you. The Volcanic Tar devours the fire magic surrounding the tablet until the wards no longer have the strength to maintain their enchantment and collapse into Volcanic Dust."}
Q[967027]={o="你眼前的风暴石板受到强大的自然魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导充能风暴岩的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为风暴之尘。",oEN="The storm tablet before you is warded with powerful nature magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Storm Charged Fulgerite to shatter the wards into Storm Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由充能风暴岩引导向你面前的石板。闪电从石板上迸出，与引导的能量相连，随后在震耳欲聋的轰鸣中释放。石板唯一留下的痕迹是一小堆风暴之尘，你迅速把它收了起来。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Stormed Charged Fulgerite into the tablet before you. Lightning arcs out from the tablet and connects with the channeled energy before discharging in a deafending thunderclap. The only trace of the tablet is a small pile of Storm Dust that you quickly gather."}
Q[967028]={o="你眼前的风暴石板受到强大的自然魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导充能风暴岩的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为风暴之尘。",oEN="The storm tablet before you is warded with powerful nature magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Storm Charged Fulgerite to shatter the wards into Storm Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由充能风暴岩引导向你面前的石板。闪电从石板上迸出，与引导的能量相连，随后在震耳欲聋的轰鸣中释放。石板唯一留下的痕迹是一小堆风暴之尘，你迅速把它收了起来。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Stormed Charged Fulgerite into the tablet before you. Lightning arcs out from the tablet and connects with the channeled energy before discharging in a deafending thunderclap. The only trace of the tablet is a small pile of Storm Dust that you quickly gather."}
Q[967029]={o="你眼前的风暴石板受到强大的自然魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导充能风暴岩的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为风暴之尘。",oEN="The storm tablet before you is warded with powerful nature magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Storm Charged Fulgerite to shatter the wards into Storm Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由充能风暴岩引导向你面前的石板。闪电从石板上迸出，与引导的能量相连，随后在震耳欲聋的轰鸣中释放。石板唯一留下的痕迹是一小堆风暴之尘，你迅速把它收了起来。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Stormed Charged Fulgerite into the tablet before you. Lightning arcs out from the tablet and connects with the channeled energy before discharging in a deafending thunderclap. The only trace of the tablet is a small pile of Storm Dust that you quickly gather."}
Q[967030]={o="你眼前的冰封石板受到强大的冰霜魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导注能枭兽仪祭羽毛的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为极地之尘。",oEN="The frozen tablet before you is warded with powerful frost magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers to shatter the wards into Arctic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由注能枭兽仪祭羽毛引导向你面前的石板。环绕石板的脉动冰霜能量似乎凝结成坚冰，随后碎裂为极地之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers into the tablet before you. The pulsating frost energy surrounding the tablet seems to solidify into solid ice before shattering into Arctic Dust."}
Q[967031]={o="你眼前的冰封石板受到强大的冰霜魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导注能枭兽仪祭羽毛的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为极地之尘。",oEN="The frozen tablet before you is warded with powerful frost magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers to shatter the wards into Arctic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由注能枭兽仪祭羽毛引导向你面前的石板。环绕石板的脉动冰霜能量似乎凝结成坚冰，随后碎裂为极地之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers into the tablet before you. The pulsating frost energy surrounding the tablet seems to solidify into solid ice before shattering into Arctic Dust."}
Q[967032]={o="你眼前的冰封石板受到强大的冰霜魔法保护。\n\n你可以引导注能枭兽仪祭羽毛的能量，击碎那些防护，将其化为极地之尘。",oEN="The frozen tablet before you is warded with powerful frost magic.\n\nYou could channel the energy from Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers to shatter the wards into Arctic Dust.",p="你运用分解魔法物品的能力，把那能量经由注能枭兽仪祭羽毛引导向你面前的石板。环绕石板的脉动冰霜能量似乎凝结成坚冰，随后碎裂为极地之尘。",pEN="You draw from your ability to disenchant magical items and channel that energy through the Infused Owlbeast Ritual Feathers into the tablet before you. The pulsating frost energy surrounding the tablet seems to solidify into solid ice before shattering into Arctic Dust."}
Q[967033]={o="你眼前这株植物的根部周围散落着细小的甲壳碎片。新鲜血肉与真菌的臭气在植物周围的空气中飘荡，对异种虫来说这是诱人的气味。\n\n用异种虫肉喂食这株植物，或许就能趁它忙于进食时采得一株深漠之根。",oEN="Small bits of carapace are scattered around the base of the plant before you. The stench of fresh meat and fungus hangs in the air around the plant, an enticing stench for a Silithid.\n\nFeeding this plant Silithid Flesh may allow you to harvest a Deep Desert Root while it's busy feasting.",p="块茎从地面伸出数尺，缠住了异种虫肉。原本深埋沙下的柔软根须如今露了出来。",pEN="The Tuber extends from the ground several feet and wraps around the Silithid Flesh. The soft roots previously deep beneath the sand are now exposed."}
Q[967034]={o="你眼前这株植物的根部周围散落着细小的甲壳碎片。新鲜血肉与真菌的臭气在植物周围的空气中飘荡，对异种虫来说这是诱人的气味。\n\n用异种虫肉喂食这株植物，或许就能趁它忙于进食时采得一株深漠之根。",oEN="Small bits of carapace are scattered around the base of the plant before you. The stench of fresh meat and fungus hangs in the air around the plant, an enticing stench for a Silithid.\n\nFeeding this plant Silithid Flesh may allow you to harvest a Deep Desert Root while it's busy feasting.",p="块茎从地面伸出数尺，缠住了异种虫肉。原本深埋沙下的柔软根须如今露了出来。",pEN="The Tuber extends from the ground several feet and wraps around the Silithid Flesh. The soft roots previously deep beneath the sand are now exposed."}
