Q[967036]={o="你靠近时，那株植物缓缓转过来面对你，茎干盘卷，蓄势待发。植物的下颚上挂着几片猩红的布料。\n\n若用血色之肉喂食这株植物，或许就能趁它忙于进食时采得一株死灵之莲。",oEN="As you approach the plant slowly turn to face you, its stalk coiled up and ready to lunge. Bits of scarlet cloth hang from the plant's jaws.\n\nFeeding this plant Scarlet Flesh may allow you to harvest a Necrotic Lotus while it's busy feasting.",p="植物舒展开来，从空中夺过肉块，以惊人的速度将其吞下。你刚采下一株死灵之莲，那咀嚼血肉的声响便停了下来。",pEN="The plant uncoils are snatches the chunks of flesh from air and devours them with shock speed. You barely finish harvesting a Necrotic Lotus before the sounds of teeth of flesh cease."}
Q[967037]={o="你靠近时，那株植物缓缓转过来面对你，茎干盘卷，蓄势待发。植物的下颚上挂着几片猩红的布料。\n\n若用血色之肉喂食这株植物，或许就能趁它忙于进食时采得一株死灵之莲。",oEN="As you approach the plant slowly turn to face you, its stalk coiled up and ready to lunge. Bits of scarlet cloth hang from the plant's jaws.\n\nFeeding this plant Scarlet Flesh may allow you to harvest a Necrotic Lotus while it's busy feasting.",p="植物舒展开来，从空中夺过肉块，以惊人的速度将其吞下。你刚采下一株死灵之莲，那咀嚼血肉的声响便停了下来。",pEN="The plant uncoils are snatches the chunks of flesh from air and devours them with shock speed. You barely finish harvesting a Necrotic Lotus before the sounds of teeth of flesh cease."}
Q[967038]={o="你靠近时，那株植物缓缓转过来面对你，茎干盘卷，蓄势待发。植物的下颚上挂着几片猩红的布料。\n\n若用血色之肉喂食这株植物，或许就能趁它忙于进食时采得一株死灵之莲。",oEN="As you approach the plant slowly turn to face you, its stalk coiled up and ready to lunge. Bits of scarlet cloth hang from the plant's jaws.\n\nFeeding this plant Scarlet Flesh may allow you to harvest a Necrotic Lotus while it's busy feasting.",p="植物舒展开来，从空中夺过肉块，以惊人的速度将其吞下。你刚采下一株死灵之莲，那咀嚼血肉的声响便停了下来。",pEN="The plant uncoils are snatches the chunks of flesh from air and devours them with shock speed. You barely finish harvesting a Necrotic Lotus before the sounds of teeth of flesh cease."}
Q[967039]={o="病态的绿色孢子漂浮在蘑菇周围的空气中。你注意到蘑菇底部有被孢子刺穿的生物，微小的菌柄从它们的尸体上长出。这株巨大的蘑菇似乎是从一整具萨特尸体上生长出来的。\n\n若用邪火肉块喂食这株植物，待那些致命孢子安全地转移进另一具血肉之中后，你或许就能采得一顶腐化之帽。",oEN="Sickly green spores hang in the air around the mushroom. You notice critters impaled with spores at the base of the mushroom, tiny fungal stalks rising from their corpses. The massive mushroom itself appears to have grown from an entire Satyr corpse.\n\nFeeding this plant Jadefire Meat Chunks may allow you to harvest a Corruption Cap once the deadly spores are safely in something else's flesh.",p="邪火肉块立刻被数百个孢子填满。蘑菇周围的空气似乎清净了，你迅速采下一顶腐化之帽。",pEN="The Jadefire Meat Chunks are immediately riddled with hundreds of spores. The air around the mushroom appears clear, and you quickly harvest a Corruption Cap."}
Q[967040]={o="病态的绿色孢子漂浮在蘑菇周围的空气中。你注意到蘑菇底部有被孢子刺穿的生物，微小的菌柄从它们的尸体上长出。这株巨大的蘑菇似乎是从一整具萨特尸体上生长出来的。\n\n若用邪火肉块喂食这株植物，待那些致命孢子安全地转移进另一具血肉之中后，你或许就能采得一顶腐化之帽。",oEN="Sickly green spores hang in the air around the mushroom. You notice critters impaled with spores at the base of the mushroom, tiny fungal stalks rising from their corpses. The massive mushroom itself appears to have grown from an entire Satyr corpse.\n\nFeeding this plant Jadefire Meat Chunks may allow you to harvest a Corruption Cap once the deadly spores are safely in something else's flesh.",p="邪火肉块立刻被数百个孢子填满。蘑菇周围的空气似乎清净了，你迅速采下一顶腐化之帽。",pEN="The Jadefire Meat Chunks are immediately riddled with hundreds of spores. The air around the mushroom appears clear, and you quickly harvest a Corruption Cap."}
Q[967041]={o="病态的绿色孢子漂浮在蘑菇周围的空气中。你注意到蘑菇底部有被孢子刺穿的生物，微小的菌柄从它们的尸体上长出。这株巨大的蘑菇似乎是从一整具萨特尸体上生长出来的。\n\n若用邪火肉块喂食这株植物，待那些致命孢子安全地转移进另一具血肉之中后，你或许就能采得一顶腐化之帽。",oEN="Sickly green spores hang in the air around the mushroom. You notice critters impaled with spores at the base of the mushroom, tiny fungal stalks rising from their corpses. The massive mushroom itself appears to have grown from an entire Satyr corpse.\n\nFeeding this plant Jadefire Meat Chunks may allow you to harvest a Corruption Cap once the deadly spores are safely in something else's flesh.",p="邪火肉块立刻被数百个孢子填满。蘑菇周围的空气似乎清净了，你迅速采下一顶腐化之帽。",pEN="The Jadefire Meat Chunks are immediately riddled with hundreds of spores. The air around the mushroom appears clear, and you quickly harvest a Corruption Cap."}
Q[967042]={o="一张藤蔓织成的网在你脚下扭动。这些藤蔓对你算不上威胁，却能轻易缠住一只鞭笞者。植物的巨口紧闭着。\n\n若用鞭笞者之茎喂食这株植物，待它张开巨口吞食茎干时，你或许就能采得一颗侏罗纪之球茎。",oEN="A spiderweb of vines wriggle beneath your feet. The vines pose no threat to you, but would snare a flayer with ease. The mouth of the plant is clamped firmly shut.\n\nFeeding this plant Flayer Stalks may allow you to harvest a Jurassic Bulb when the plant opens up to consume the stalks.",p="你把鞭笞者之茎抛过去时，植物周围的藤蔓翻涌扭动，将其推向缓缓张开的巨口。你伸手进去采下一颗侏罗纪之球茎，随后那巨口便猛地合上咬住食物。",pEN="The vines around the plant undulate and writhe when you throw the flayer stalks upon them, pushing them towards the mouth of the plant as it slowly opens. You reach inside and harvest a Jurassic Bulb before the mouth clamps shut around its meal."}
Q[967043]={o="一张藤蔓织成的网在你脚下扭动。这些藤蔓对你算不上威胁，却能轻易缠住一只鞭笞者。植物的巨口紧闭着。\n\n若用鞭笞者之茎喂食这株植物，待它张开巨口吞食茎干时，你或许就能采得一颗侏罗纪之球茎。",oEN="A spiderweb of vines wriggle beneath your feet. The vines pose no threat to you, but would snare a flayer with ease. The mouth of the plant is clamped firmly shut.\n\nFeeding this plant Flayer Stalks may allow you to harvest a Jurassic Bulb when the plant opens up to consume the stalks.",p="你把鞭笞者之茎抛过去时，植物周围的藤蔓翻涌扭动，将其推向缓缓张开的巨口。你伸手进去采下一颗侏罗纪之球茎，随后那巨口便猛地合上咬住食物。",pEN="The vines around the plant undulate and writhe when you throw the flayer stalks upon them, pushing them towards the mouth of the plant as it slowly opens. You reach inside and harvest a Jurassic Bulb before the mouth clamps shut around its meal."}
Q[967044]={o="一张藤蔓织成的网在你脚下扭动。这些藤蔓对你算不上威胁，却能轻易缠住一只鞭笞者。植物的巨口紧闭着。\n\n若用鞭笞者之茎喂食这株植物，待它张开巨口吞食茎干时，你或许就能采得一颗侏罗纪之球茎。",oEN="A spiderweb of vines wriggle beneath your feet. The vines pose no threat to you, but would snare a flayer with ease. The mouth of the plant is clamped firmly shut.\n\nFeeding this plant Flayer Stalks may allow you to harvest a Jurassic Bulb when the plant opens up to consume the stalks.",p="你把鞭笞者之茎抛过去时，植物周围的藤蔓翻涌扭动，将其推向缓缓张开的巨口。你伸手进去采下一颗侏罗纪之球茎，随后那巨口便猛地合上咬住食物。",pEN="The vines around the plant undulate and writhe when you throw the flayer stalks upon them, pushing them towards the mouth of the plant as it slowly opens. You reach inside and harvest a Jurassic Bulb before the mouth clamps shut around its meal."}
Q[967045]={o="植物周围的空气噼啪作响，能量涌动。靠得太近的螃蟹留下焦黑的残骸，在植物周围划出一道界线。\n\n若用纳迦之尾喂食这株植物，待它释放电荷时，你或许就能采得一片风暴之叶。",oEN="The air around the plant crackles with energy. The charred remains of crabs that wandered too close mark a boundary around the plant.\n\nFeeding this plant Naga Tails may allow you to harvest a Storm Front when the plant releases its charge.",p="植物立刻把能量释放到纳迦之尾上。纳迦的血肉吸收了惊人的电量，最终焦黑下去、崩解成灰，肥沃了周围的沙土。你得以在空气再次噼啪作响之前采下一片风暴之叶。",pEN="The plant immediately discharges its energy into Naga Tails. The Naga flesh absorbs a shocking amount of electricity before finally blackening and crumbling to ash, fertilizing the sand around it. You are able to harvest a Storm Frond before the air begins to crackle once again."}
Q[967046]={o="植物周围的空气噼啪作响，能量涌动。靠得太近的螃蟹留下焦黑的残骸，在植物周围划出一道界线。\n\n若用纳迦之尾喂食这株植物，待它释放电荷时，你或许就能采得一片风暴之叶。",oEN="The air around the plant crackles with energy. The charred remains of crabs that wandered too close mark a boundary around the plant.\n\nFeeding this plant Naga Tails may allow you to harvest a Storm Front when the plant releases its charge.",p="植物立刻把能量释放到纳迦之尾上。纳迦的血肉吸收了惊人的电量，最终焦黑下去、崩解成灰，肥沃了周围的沙土。你得以在空气再次噼啪作响之前采下一片风暴之叶。",pEN="The plant immediately discharges its energy into Naga Tails. The Naga flesh absorbs a shocking amount of electricity before finally blackening and crumbling to ash, fertilizing the sand around it. You are able to harvest a Storm Frond before the air begins to crackle once again."}
