Q[967048]={o="你靠近时，刺骨的寒意退去了。这株巨大的花朵散发着舒适的暖意，但你注意到就在新落的积雪之下，有几只被冻死的霜刃豹。\n\n用霜刃豹的尸体喂食这株植物，待它的热量消散后，你或许就能采得一株冬绽花。",oEN="The biting chill retreats as you approach. The massive flower generates a comfortable heat, but you notice Frostsabers frozen to death just beneath the fresh snow fall.\n\nFeeding this plant Frostsaber Carcasses may allow you to harvest a Winterbloom when the plant's heat dissipates.",p="你把尚有余温的霜刃豹尸体摆放在植物周围。植物的热量缓缓消散，让你得以采下一株冬绽花。",pEN="You nestle the still warm Frostsaber Carcasses around the plant. The plant's heat slowly dissipates, allowing you to harvest a Winterbloom."}
Q[967049]={o="你靠近时，刺骨的寒意退去了。这株巨大的花朵散发着舒适的暖意，但你注意到就在新落的积雪之下，有几只被冻死的霜刃豹。\n\n用霜刃豹的尸体喂食这株植物，待它的热量消散后，你或许就能采得一株冬绽花。",oEN="The biting chill retreats as you approach. The massive flower generates a comfortable heat, but you notice Frostsabers frozen to death just beneath the fresh snow fall.\n\nFeeding this plant Frostsaber Carcasses may allow you to harvest a Winterbloom when the plant's heat dissipates.",p="你把尚有余温的霜刃豹尸体摆放在植物周围。植物的热量缓缓消散，让你得以采下一株冬绽花。",pEN="You nestle the still warm Frostsaber Carcasses around the plant. The plant's heat slowly dissipates, allowing you to harvest a Winterbloom."}
Q[967050]={o="你靠近时，刺骨的寒意退去了。这株巨大的花朵散发着舒适的暖意，但你注意到就在新落的积雪之下，有几只被冻死的霜刃豹。\n\n用霜刃豹的尸体喂食这株植物，待它的热量消散后，你或许就能采得一株冬绽花。",oEN="The biting chill retreats as you approach. The massive flower generates a comfortable heat, but you notice Frostsabers frozen to death just beneath the fresh snow fall.\n\nFeeding this plant Frostsaber Carcasses may allow you to harvest a Winterbloom when the plant's heat dissipates.",p="你把尚有余温的霜刃豹尸体摆放在植物周围。植物的热量缓缓消散，让你得以采下一株冬绽花。",pEN="You nestle the still warm Frostsaber Carcasses around the plant. The plant's heat slowly dissipates, allowing you to harvest a Winterbloom."}
Q[967051]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。用坚固的秘银钥匙无法完全避开那些精密的防撬陷阱，但这把钥匙能让你在打开箱子时不至于把里面的东西全毁掉。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The intricate tamper proof traps cannot be completely bypassed with a Solid Homicite Key, but the key will allow you to open the chest without completely destroying the contents.",p="坚固的秘银钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你转动钥匙，听到一声沉重的砰响。打开窖藏的盖子，你发现许多东西已被你触发的防撬装置摧毁，但窖藏中央的宝物依然完好。",pEN="The Solid Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key and hear a heavy WHUMP. You open the lid to the cache to find many of the contents destroyed by the anti-tamper device you triggered, but the treasures in the center of the cache remain undamaged.",c="坚固的秘银钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你转动钥匙，听到一声沉重的砰响。打开窖藏的盖子，你发现许多东西已被你触发的防撬装置摧毁，但窖藏中央的宝物依然完好。",cEN="The Solid Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key and hear a heavy WHUMP. You open the lid to the cache to find many of the contents destroyed by the anti-tamper device you triggered, but the treasures in the center of the cache remain undamaged."}
Q[967052]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。精良的秘银钥匙能避开除最复杂者之外的所有防撬爆炸物。几乎所有内容物都将保持完好。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The exceptional Homicite Key will bypass all but the most intricate anti tamper explosives. Almost all of the contents will remain intact.",p="精良的秘银钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你转动钥匙，听到一声轻微的啪响。打开窖藏的盖子，你发现大多数防撬装置仍然完好，但部分内容物已被一个布置巧妙的小型防撬装置毁掉。",pEN="The Exceptional Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key and hear a tiny POP. You open the lid to the cache to find most of the anti-tamper devices still intact, but some of the contents were destroyed by a small well placed anti-tamper device.",c="精良的秘银钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你转动钥匙，听到一声轻微的啪响。打开窖藏的盖子，你发现大多数防撬装置仍然完好，但部分内容物已被一个布置巧妙的小型防撬装置毁掉。",cEN="The Exceptional Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key and hear a tiny POP. You open the lid to the cache to find most of the anti-tamper devices still intact, but some of the contents were destroyed by a small well placed anti-tamper device."}
Q[967053]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。秘银万能钥匙完美无缺，专为彻底拆除防撬爆炸物而设计，让你能取用箱中的全部内容物。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Master Homicite Key is a perfect fit designed to completely disable anti tamper explosives and grant you access to the entire chest's contents.",p="秘银万能钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你小心地转动钥匙，盖子在没有爆炸的情况下打开了。所有防撬装置都保持完好，但你听到一阵急促的滴答声。你取回了完好的宝物，可那些防撬装置在你来得及进一步查看之前便爆炸了。",pEN="The Master Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key carefully and the lid opens with no explosions. All of the anti-tamper devices remain intact, but you hear a rapid TICK TICK TICK. You recover the treasure intact, but the anti-tamper devices explode before you can examine them further.",c="秘银万能钥匙完美地插入锁孔。你小心地转动钥匙，盖子在没有爆炸的情况下打开了。所有防撬装置都保持完好，但你听到一阵急促的滴答声。你取回了完好的宝物，可那些防撬装置在你来得及进一步查看之前便爆炸了。",cEN="The Master Homicite Key fits perfectly into the lock. You twist the key carefully and the lid opens with no explosions. All of the anti-tamper devices remain intact, but you hear a rapid TICK TICK TICK. You recover the treasure intact, but the anti-tamper devices explode before you can examine them further."}
Q[967060]={o="你没有钥匙，但钥匙很少能拦住那些常年与巨龙搏斗并凯旋的英雄。\n\n所幸，这箱子装有多重爆炸物。藏起这些贵重物品的人确保了：既然他们得不到……别人也休想。\n\n大师级铁匠可以制作秘银钥匙，大师级工程师则可以制作侏儒万能钥匙，从而在不毁掉大部分内容物的情况下打开这些箱子。",oEN="You don't have a key, but keys rarely stop Heroes who regularly fight dragons and come out the other side.\n\nUnfortunately, the chest is rigged with multiple explosives. Whoever hid these valuables made sure that if they couldn't have them... neither could anyone else.\n\nA skilled blacksmith can create Homicite Keys or a skilled engineer can create Gnomish Masterkeys to gain access to these chests without destroying most of the contents.",c="你轻松砸开了锁，随即听到一声巨响。掀开盖子，只见内容物已被猛烈爆炸摧毁，但你在残骸中发现了一个没有被完全毁掉的小袋子。",cEN="You destroy the lock with ease and immediately hear a loud BANG. You lift the lid to find the contents shredded by a massive explosion, but you find a small pouch in a wreckage that hasn't been completely destroyed."}
Q[967061]={o="巢穴中散落着锋利的爪子和巨大的骸骨。无论栖息在这里的是什么生物，它似乎专门猎杀危险的掠食者。\n\n猎杀这样的野兽才是真正的奖赏，不过，也许你能搜刮巢穴找到些值钱的东西？\n\n大师级厨师可以制作诱饵，把这些顶级掠食者引回它们的巢穴。",oEN="Sharp claws and massive bones are scattered around the nest. Whatever creature lives here seems to exclusively hunt dangerous predators.\n\nHunting such a beast is the real prize, but perhaps you can find something of value pillaging the nest?\n\nAn expert Cook can craft bait used to lure these apex predators back to their nest.",c="你翻找巢穴，搜寻野兽可能留下的任何小玩意儿，结果发现一个沾满血迹的袋子，一侧还有巨大的爪痕。里面的东西多半已经洒落，但有时你就是走运……",cEN="You smash apart the nest looking for any trinkets the beast may have left and find a bloodstained pouch with a massive claw marks through one side. Most of the contents likely spilled out, but sometimes you get lucky..."}
Q[967105]={d="你可以通过在高风险等级 1、2、3 区域采集草药节点、在拍卖行购买或与其他玩家交易来获得健康的血藤。",dEN="You can obtain Healthy Sanguine Vine by gathering Herb Nodes in High Risk Tier 1, 2 and 3 Zones, searching the Auction House or trading with other players.",o="完成征用令。",oEN="Fulfill the requisition order.",p="征用令尚未完成。带上所需材料再回来。",pEN="The requisition order has not been fulfilled. Return with the required materials.",c="物资已收到并清点完毕。你对大业的贡献已被记录，英雄。",cEN="The goods have been received and accounted for. Your contribution to the cause is noted, Hero."}
