Q[967121]={d="你可以通过在高风险等级 1、2、3 区域的剥皮与肉类材料事件区，在拍卖行购买或与其他玩家交易来获得核心精华腌制肉。",dEN="You can obtain Cured Core Infused Meat from Skinning and Meat Material Event Areas in High Risk Tier 1, 2 and 3 Zones, searching the Auction House or trading with other players.",o="完成征用令。",oEN="Fulfill the requisition order.",p="征用令尚未完成。带上所需材料再回来。",pEN="The requisition order has not been fulfilled. Return with the required materials.",c="物资已收到并清点完毕。你对大业的贡献已被记录，英雄。",cEN="The goods have been received and accounted for. Your contribution to the cause is noted, Hero."}
Q[967122]={d="你可以通过在高风险等级 2、3 区域的剥皮与肉类材料事件区，在拍卖行购买或与其他玩家交易来获得精华腌制的恶魔之肉。",dEN="You can obtain Cured Demon Infused Meat from Skinning and Meat Material Event Areas in High Risk Tier 2 and 3 Zones, searching the Auction House or trading with other players.",o="完成征用令。",oEN="Fulfill the requisition order.",p="征用令尚未完成。带上所需材料再回来。",pEN="The requisition order has not been fulfilled. Return with the required materials.",c="物资已收到并清点完毕。你对大业的贡献已被记录，英雄。",cEN="The goods have been received and accounted for. Your contribution to the cause is noted, Hero."}
Q[967171]={d="最近流了太多的血，<name>。尸体引来了一种全新的掠食者，连我们最有经验的猎人也因此身陷险境。\n\n摧毁野兽巢穴，并带回你行动的证据。你也可以在巢穴中放置诱饵，杀死被引来的野兽，从而获得巢穴碎片。\n\n你可以在安戈洛、艾萨拉和灰烬荒地找到核心铸造的野兽巢穴。\n\n摧毁野兽巢穴，并带回你行动的证据。你也可以在巢穴中放置诱饵，杀死被引来的野兽，从而获得巢穴碎片。\n\n你必须拥有祖尔格拉布寻宝者或更高级别的增益，才能摧毁野兽巢穴。",dEN="Much blood has been spilled as of late <name>. The corpses have attracted a whole new class of predator putting even our most seasoned hunters in grave danger.\n\nDestroy Beast Nests and return with proof of your actions. You can also find Nest Fragments by placing bait at the nest and slaying the beasts it attracts.\n\nYou can find Core Forged Beast Nests in Un'goro, Azshara and Burning Steppes.\n\nDestroy Beast Nests and return with proof of your actions. You can also find Nest Fragments by placing bait at the nest and slaying the beasts it attracts.\n\nYou must have Zul'Gurub Treasure Hunter buff or above to Destroy Beast Nests.",o="在高风险区域摧毁或放置诱饵于 3 个野兽巢穴。",oEN="Smash or place bait in 3 Beast Nests in High-Risk.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967172]={d="这些新的掠食者比我们想象的更坚韧。摧毁它们的巢穴还不够。你必须把野兽引回它们的巢穴并加以屠戮。\n\n你可以通过烹饪或与其他英雄交易获得核心气息诱饵。\n\n你可以在安戈洛、艾萨拉和灰烬荒地找到核心铸造的野兽巢穴。\n\n用核心气息诱饵吸引野兽，并带着成功狩猎的证据回来。\n\n你必须拥有熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，才能在野兽巢穴中使用诱饵。",dEN="These new predators are more resilient than we ever imagined. Destroying their nests is not enough. You must lure the beasts back to their lairs and and slaughter them.\n\nYou can acquire Core Scented Bait from Cooking or by trading with another Hero.\n\nYou can find Core Forged Beast Nests in Un'goro, Azshara and Burning Steppes.\n\nLure Beasts with Core Scented Bait and return with proof of a successful hunt.\n\nYou must have Molten Core Treasure Hunter buff or above to use Bait at a Beast Nest.",o="在核心铸造的野兽巢穴中放置核心气息诱饵，并杀死掠食者。",oEN="Place Core Scented Bait in a Core Forged Beast Nest and slay the predator.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967173]={d="这些新的掠食者比我们想象的更坚韧。摧毁它们的巢穴还不够。你必须把野兽引回它们的巢穴并加以屠戮。\n\n你可以通过烹饪或与其他英雄交易获得天灾气息诱饵。\n\n你可以在高风险下的西瘟疫之地与东瘟疫之地找到天灾铸造的野兽巢穴。用天灾气息诱饵吸引野兽，并带着成功狩猎的证据回来。\n\n你必须拥有熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，才能在野兽巢穴中使用诱饵。",dEN="These new predators are more resilient than we ever imagined. Destroying their nests is not enough. You must lure the beasts back to their lairs and and slaughter them.\n\nYou can acquire Scourge Scented Bait from Cooking or by trading with another Hero.\n\nYou can find Scourge Forge Beast Nests scattered throughout Western and Eastern Plaguelands in High-Risk. Lure Beasts with Scourge Scented Bait and return with proof of a successful hunt.\n\nYou must have Molten Core Treasure Hunter buff or above to use Bait at a Beast Nest.",o="在天灾铸造的野兽巢穴中放置天灾气息诱饵，并杀死掠食者。",oEN="Place Scourge Scented Bait in a Scourge Forged Beast Nest and slay the predator.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967174]={d="这些新的掠食者比我们想象的更坚韧。摧毁它们的巢穴还不够。你必须把野兽引回它们的巢穴并加以屠戮。\n\n你可以通过烹饪或与其他英雄交易获得恶魔气息诱饵。\n\n你可以在高风险下的冬泉谷与希利苏斯找到恶魔铸造的野兽巢穴。用恶魔气息诱饵吸引野兽，并带着成功狩猎的证据回来。\n\n你必须拥有熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，才能在野兽巢穴中使用诱饵。",dEN="These new predators are more resilient than we ever imagined. Destroying their nests is not enough. You must lure the beasts back to their lairs and and slaughter them.\n\nYou can acquire Demon Scented Bait from Cooking or by trading with another Hero.\n\nYou can find Demon Forged Beast Nests scattered throughout Winterspring and Silithus in High-Risk. Lure Beasts with Demon Scented Bait and return with proof of a successful hunt.\n\nYou must have Molten Core Treasure Hunter buff or above to use Bait at a Beast Nest.",o="在恶魔铸造的野兽巢穴中放置恶魔气息诱饵，并杀死掠食者。",oEN="Place Demon Scented Bait in a Demon Forged Beast Nest and slay the predator.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967176]={d="获得熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，然后使用由大师级铁匠或大师级工程师制作的核心魔法钥匙，解锁高风险下的缚核藏匿点，并获取闭锁装置。\n\n你可以在安戈洛、艾萨拉和燃烧平原找到缚核藏匿点。\n\n搜刮藏匿点会赋予你无路可退，使你无法通过传送或炉石逃往安全之处。你必须活着回到城里才能领取你的宝物。",dEN="Reach Molten Core Treasure Hunter Buff or above, then unlock Core Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Core Magic Key crafted by an Expert Blacksmith or an expert Engineer and acquire Locking Mechanisms.\n\nYou can find Core Bound Hidden Caches in Un'goro, Azshara and Burning Steppes.\n\nLooting a Hidden Cache will grant you No-Retreat, preventing you from escaping to safety using teleports or hearthstones. You must make it back to town alive to claim your treasure.",o="使用核心魔法钥匙，打开高风险区域的缚核隐秘窖藏。",oEN="Open Core Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Core Magic Key.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967177]={d="获得熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，然后使用由大师级铁匠或大师级工程师制作的天灾魔法钥匙，解锁高风险下的缚灾藏匿点，并获取闭锁装置。\n\n你可以在西瘟疫之地和东瘟疫之地找到缚灾藏匿点。\n\n搜刮藏匿点会赋予你无路可退，使你无法通过传送或炉石逃往安全之处。你必须活着回到城里才能领取你的宝物。",dEN="Reach Molten Core Treasure Hunter Buff or above, then unlock Scourge Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Scourge Magic Key crafted by an Expert Blacksmith or an expert Engineer and acquire Locking Mechanisms.\n\nYou can find Scourge Bound Hidden Caches in Western Plaguelands and Eastern Plaguelands.\n\nLooting a Hidden Cache will grant you No-Retreat, preventing you from escaping to safety using teleports or hearthstones. You must make it back to town alive to claim your treasure.",o="使用天灾魔法钥匙，打开高风险区域的缚灾隐秘窖藏。",oEN="Open Scourge Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Scourge Magic Key.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967178]={d="获得熔火核心寻宝者或更高级别的增益，然后使用由大师级铁匠或大师级工程师制作的恶魔魔法钥匙，解锁高风险下的缚魔隐秘窖藏，并获取闭锁装置。\n\n你可以在希利苏斯和冬泉谷找到缚魔隐秘窖藏。\n\n搜刮隐秘窖藏会赋予你无路可退，使你无法通过传送或炉石逃往安全之处。你必须活着回到城里才能领取你的宝物。",dEN="Reach Molten Core Treasure Hunter Buff or above, then unlock Demon Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Demon Magic Key crafted by an Expert Blacksmith or an expert Engineer and acquire Locking Mechanisms.\n\nYou can find Demon Bound Hidden Caches in Winterspring and Silithus.\n\nLooting a Hidden Cache will grant you No-Retreat, preventing you from escaping to safety using teleports or hearthstones. You must make it back to town alive to claim your treasure.",o="使用恶魔魔法钥匙，打开高风险下的缚魔隐秘窖藏。",oEN="Open Demon Bound Hidden Caches in High-Risk using a Demon Magic Key.",p="你在飞升之路上仍有任务未完成。完成当前任务后再回来。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得好，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[967205]={d="大师级厨师的手艺需求量很大！\n\n危险的野兽已在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域筑巢！我们需要大师级厨师制作诱饵，把这些危险的掠食者引回巢穴并加以歼灭。\n\n不过别担心，厨师。如果你更喜欢烹调肉类而不是肢解它们，许多英雄会很乐意用东西换你制作的诱饵。",dEN="The skills of Expert Cooks are in High-Demand!\n\nDangerous Beasts have build nests all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled cooks are needed to craft Bait to lure these dangerous predators back to their nest to be exterminated.\n\nDon't worry though Cook. If you are more comfortable cooking meat than butchering it, many a Hero would gladly trade for the bait you craft.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967206]={d="大师级铁匠的手艺需求量很大！\n\n英雄们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现隐秘窖藏！我们需要大师级铁匠制作秘银钥匙，以便在不触发其中防撬装置的情况下打开这些窖藏。\n\n不过别担心，铁匠。如果你不想亲自去寻找这些窖藏，许多英雄会很乐意用东西换你的手艺。",dEN="The skills of Expert Blacksmiths are in High-Demand!\n\nHeroes have begun to discover Hidden Caches all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Blacksmiths are needed to craft Homicite Keys to open these Caches without triggering the anti-tamper devices within.\n\nDon't worry though Blacksmith. If you do no want to seek these caches out yourself, many a hero would trade for your craftsmanship.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967207]={d="大师级工程师的手艺需求量很大！\n\n英雄们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现隐秘窖藏！我们需要大师级工程师制作侏儒万能钥匙，以便在不触发其中防撬装置的情况下打开这些窖藏。\n\n不过别担心，工程师。如果你不想亲自去寻找这些窖藏，许多英雄会很乐意用东西换你的手艺。",dEN="The skills of Expert Engineers are in High-Demand!\n\nHeroes have begun to discover Hidden Caches all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Engineers are needed to craft Gnomish Masterkeys Keys to open these Caches without triggering the anti-tamper devices within.\n\nDon't worry though Engineer. If you do no want to seek these caches out yourself, many a hero would trade for your craftsmanship.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967208]={d="大师级炼金师的手艺需求量很大！\n\n草药师们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现新的肉食植物！我们需要大师级炼金师把这些新材料精炼成药瓶。\n\n如果你不想亲自去寻找这些材料，许多草药师愿意把他们采集到的材料卖给你。\n\n需要这些高风险材料的额外炼金配方可以在地下城与团队副本中找到。",dEN="The skills of Expert Alchemists are in High-Demand!\n\nHerbalists have begun to discover new Flesh Eating Plants all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Alchemists are needed to refine these new materials in Flasks.\n\nIf you do not want to seek these materials yourself, many an Herbalist will be willing to sell you the materials they gather.\n\nAdditional Alchemy Recipes requiring these High-Risk Materials can be found in dungeons and raids.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967209]={d="大师级裁缝的手艺需求量很大！\n\n英雄们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现新的布料！我们需要大师级裁缝把这些新材料精炼成强大的装备与披风附魔。\n\n如果你不想亲自去寻找这些材料，许多英雄愿意把他们采集到的材料卖给你。\n\n需要这些高风险材料的额外裁缝配方可以在地下城与团队副本中找到。",dEN="The skills of Expert Tailors are in High-Demand!\n\nHeroes have begun to discover new cloth all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Tailors are needed to refine these new materials into powerful gear and cloak enchantments.\n\nIf you do not want to seek these materials yourself, many a hero will be willing to sell you the materials they gather.\n\nAdditional Tailoring Recipes requiring these High-Risk Materials can be found in dungeons and raids.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967210]={d="大师级附魔师的手艺需求量很大！\n\n附魔师们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现新的附魔之尘与碎片！我们需要大师级附魔师把这些新材料精炼成强大的附魔。\n\n如果你不想亲自去寻找这些材料，许多英雄愿意把他们采集到的材料卖给你。\n\n需要这些高风险材料的额外附魔配方可以在地下城与团队副本中找到。",dEN="The skills of Expert Enchanters are in High-Demand!\n\nEnchanters have begun to discover new Enchanting Dust and Shards all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Enchanters are needed to refine these new materials into powerful enchants.\n\nIf you do not want to seek these materials yourself, many a hero will be willing to sell you the materials they gather.\n\nAdditional Enchanting Recipes requiring these High-Risk Materials can be found in dungeons and raids.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967211]={d="大师级制皮师的手艺需求量很大！\n\n剥皮师们已开始在艾泽拉斯各处的高风险区域发现新的皮革与毛皮！我们需要大师级制皮师把这些新材料精炼成强大的装备与胸甲附魔。\n\n如果你不想亲自去寻找这些材料，许多剥皮师愿意把他们采集到的材料卖给你。\n\n需要这些高风险材料的额外制皮配方可以在地下城与团队副本中找到。",dEN="The skills of Expert Leatherworkers are in High-Demand!\n\nSkinners have begun to discover new Leather and Hides all across Azeroth in High-Risk Zones! Skilled Leatherworkers are needed to refine these new powerful gear and chest enchants.\n\nIf you do not want to seek these materials yourself, many a skinner will be willing to sell you the materials they gather.\n\nAdditional Leatherworking Recipes requiring these High-Risk Materials can be found in dungeons and raids.",o="接受你的配方。",oEN="Accept your recipe.",c="成为专业大师是值得嘉奖的壮举。干得好，英雄。",cEN="Becoming an Expert in your craft is a feat worthy of reward. Well done Hero."}
Q[967212]={d="返回告示板。",dEN="Return to the call board.",o="收集 10 份血液精华。",oEN="Collect 10 Essence of Bloods."}
Q[967214]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。用坚固的秘银钥匙无法完全避开那些精密的防撬陷阱，但这把钥匙能让你在打开箱子时不至于把里面的东西全毁掉。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The intricate tamper proof traps cannot be completely bypassed with a Solid Homicite Key, but the key will allow you to open the chest without completely destroying the contents."}
Q[967215]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。精良的秘银钥匙能避开除最复杂者之外的所有防撬爆炸物。几乎所有内容物都将保持完好。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Exceptional Homicite Key will bypass all but the most intricate anti tamper explosives. Almost all of the contents will remain intact."}
Q[967216]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。秘银万能钥匙完美契合，专为彻底拆除防撬爆炸物而设计，让你能取用箱中的全部内容物。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Master Homicite Key is a perfect fit, designed to completely disable anti tamper explosives and grant you access to the entire chest's contents."}
Q[967223]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。用坚固的秘银钥匙无法完全避开那些精密的防撬陷阱，但这把钥匙能让你在打开箱子时不至于把里面的东西全毁掉。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The intricate tamper proof traps cannot be completely bypassed with a Solid Homicite Key, but the key will allow you to open the chest without completely destroying the contents."}
Q[967224]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。精良的秘银钥匙能避开除最复杂者之外的所有防撬爆炸物。几乎所有内容物都将保持完好。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Exceptional Homicite Key will bypass all but the most intricate anti tamper explosives. Almost all of the contents will remain intact."}
Q[967225]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。秘银万能钥匙完美契合，专为彻底拆除防撬爆炸物而设计，让你能取用箱中的全部内容物。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Master Homicite Key is a perfect fit, designed to completely disable anti tamper explosives and grant you access to the entire chest's contents."}
