Q[967277]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏装有复杂的机关与魔法防护，一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。你可以用一把扭曲魔法钥匙打开它。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged with complex mechanisms and magical wards to explode if tampered with. You can unlock it with a Twisted Magic Key."}
