Q[967362]={d="制作与转化已不再需要亵渎虚空。你可以将它们兑换为高风险卷轴。\n\n你可以把一张守护者卷轴：高风险事件带到一处未激活的高风险事件区域，为整个服务器开启该事件。\n\n当你在地图上放大该区域时，高风险热点会显示在世界地图上。",dEN="Profane Nether are no longer required from crafting and transmuting. You can exchange them for High-Risk Scrolls.\n\nYou can take a Keeper Scroll: High-Risk Event to an inactive High-Risk Event area to start the event for the entire server.\n\nHigh-Risk Hotspots are shown on the world map when you zoom in to the zone.",o="用你的亵渎虚空兑换高风险事件卷轴。",oEN="Exchange your Profane Nethers for High-Risk Event Scrolls."}
Q[967363]={d="只要你处于高风险状态，高风险热点就会显示在世界地图上。你可以在任意高风险热点使用守护者卷轴：高风险事件，为整个服务器开启额外的团队共享掉落。\n\n召集你的朋友，或者做好使用卷轴后战斗或逃跑的准备。所有高风险玩家都能看到事件已被激活，并可能朝你的位置赶来。\n\n但请振作，因为风险越大，回报越大！如果你成为被猎杀者，额外掉落不会因死亡而失去。不过，其余已获得的战利品仍处于风险之中。",dEN="High-Risk Hotspots are shown on the world map while you have High-Risk active. You can activate a Keeper Scroll: High-Risk Event at any High-Risk Hotspot to enable bonus shared party loot drops for the entire server.\n\nGather your friends or be prepared to fight or flee after using a scroll. All high-risk players can see that an event has been activated and may be drawn to your location.\n\nBut take heart knowing that with the increased risk comes increased rewards! Bonus loot drops will not be lost on death should you become the hunted. However, the other spoils acquired are still at risk.",o="接受你的高风险守护者卷轴。",oEN="Accept your High-Risk Keeper Scroll."}
Q[967364]={d="你已经精通你的手艺了吗，英雄？！\n\n如果你已精通自己的专业，就可以学会把精良品质的高风险材料转化为史诗品质的高风险材料。\n\n你可以用次级亵渎精华向我购买转化配方。\n\n把任何精良材料转化为史诗材料。",dEN="Have you mastered your craft Hero?\n\nIf you have mastered your profession you can learn to transmute Rare quality High-Risk Ingredients into Epic quality High-Risk Ingredients.\n\nYou can purchase Transmutation recipes from me for Lesser Profane Essence.\n\nTransmute any Rare Ingredient into Epic Ingredients.",o="把任何稀有品质的高风险材料转化为史诗品质材料。",oEN="Transmute any rare quality high-risk ingredient into an epic quality ingredient.",p="转化尚未完成。完成过程后再回来。",pEN="The transmutation is incomplete. Return when you have finished the process.",c="一次了不起的转化！这些材料会很好地为我们服务。你的炼金技艺令人印象深刻，英雄。",cEN="Remarkable transmutation! These ingredients will serve us well. Your alchemical skill is impressive, Hero."}
Q[967368]={d="一支远征队已被派往艾萨拉的雷文凯斯特纪念碑，去消灭尖刺鞭笞者。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara to destroy the Spitelash.",o="前往艾萨拉的雷文凯斯特纪念碑并消灭尖刺鞭笞者。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to the Ravencrest Monument in Azshara and destroy the Spitelash. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967369]={d="一支远征队已被派往艾萨拉的门纳尔湖，去消灭蓝色龙人。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to the Lake Mennar in Azshara to destroy the Blue Dragonspawn.",o="前往艾萨拉的门纳尔湖并消灭蓝色龙人。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to the Lake Mennar in Azshara and destroy the Blue Dragonspawn. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967370]={d="各位猎人注意！艾萨拉的巨人已被悬赏！",dEN="Attention all hunters! A bounty has been issued on giants of Azshara!",o="前往艾萨拉并完成狩猎。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to Azshara and complete the hunt. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
