Q[967435]={d="一支远征队已被派往冬泉谷的枭翼丛林或隐秘林地，去消灭枭兽。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to Owl Wing Thicket or the Hidden Grove in Winterspring to destroy the Owlbeasts.",o="前往冬泉谷的枭翼丛林或隐秘林地并消灭枭兽。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to Owl Wing Thicket or the Hidden Grove in Winterspring and destroy the Owlbeasts. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967436]={d="各位猎人注意！冬泉谷的恶魔已被悬赏！",dEN="Attention all hunters! A bounty has been issued on demons of Winterspring!",o="前往冬泉谷并完成狩猎。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to Winterspring and complete the hunt. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967437]={d="一支远征队已被派往冬泉谷的玛兹索瑞尔，去消灭钴蓝龙人。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to Mazthoril in Winterspring to destroy the Cobalt Wyrmkin.",o="前往冬泉谷的玛兹索瑞尔并消灭钴蓝龙人。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to Mazthoril in Winterspring and destroy the Cobalt Wyrmkin. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967438]={d="一支远征队已被派往希利苏斯的暮光营地，去消灭暮光邪教徒。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to the Twilight Camps in Silithus to destroy the Twilight Cultists.",o="前往希利苏斯的暮光营地并消灭暮光邪教徒。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to the Twilight Camps in Silithus and destroy the Twilight Cultists. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967439]={d="各位猎人注意！赫米特·奈辛瓦里已对希利苏斯的野兽发布悬赏！",dEN="Attention all hunters! Hemit Nesingwary has issued a bounty on the beasts of Silithus!",o="前往希利苏斯并完成狩猎。此任务只能在高风险下完成。",oEN="Travel to Silithus and complete the hunt. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967440]={d="已派遣一支远征队前往希利苏斯的亚什虫巢，消灭异种虫。",dEN="An expedition has been dispatched to Hive'Ashi in Silithus and destroy the Silithid.",o="前往希利苏斯的亚什虫巢，消灭异种虫。此任务只能在「高风险」下完成。",oEN="Travel to Hive'Ashi in Silithus and destroy the Silithid. This quest can only be completed in High-Risk.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[967492]={d="你已经获得了足够的力量来实现我的意志，邪能铸造者。屠杀我们敌人的时刻到了。如果你能完成我们的宏大计划，丰厚的奖赏正等着你。\n\n玛格汉兽人在德拉诺的存续时间比预想的更久。是时候在他们得到部落增援之前采取直接行动了。\n\n前往玛格汉哨站，收割他们的灵魂！",dEN="You have acquired enough power to fulfill my will Felforged. The time has come to slaughter our enemies. Great rewards are yours for the taking if you can bring our Master Plan to completion.\n\nThe Mag'har Orcs have survived in Outland longer than expected. It is time to take direct action before they are reinforced by the Horde.\n\nTravel to Mag'har Outpost and reap their souls!",o="屠杀玛格汉兽人。",oEN="Slaughter the Mag'har Orcs.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967493]={d="邪兽人是燃烧军团的叛徒。他们如今追随伊利丹，并将玛瑟里顿囚禁了起来。\n\n谁也不要弄错不忠的代价。将叛徒从地狱火壁垒中清除干净。",dEN="The Fel Orcs are traitors to the Burning Legion. They now follow Illidan and keep Magtheridon prisoner.\n\nLet none mistake the price of disloyalty. Purge Hellfire Ramparts of the traitors.",o="血洗地狱火城墙。",oEN="Reap Hellfire Ramparts.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967494]={d="我们不能允许部落与联盟在地狱火半岛建立永久据点。\n\n围攻萨尔玛与荣耀堡，削弱他们的防御。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow the Horde and Alliance to establish a permanent foothold in Hellfire Peninsula.\n\nLay siege to Thrallmar and Honor Hold to soften their defenses. Bring me their souls!",o="围攻地狱火半岛的部落与联盟哨站",oEN="Lay Siege to the Horde and Alliance outposts in Hellfire Peninsula",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967495]={d="幽暗沼泽是从纳迦手中夺回盘牙水库的绝佳集结地。\n\n消灭栖息在幽暗沼泽的生物，好让我的军队得以就位，进而摧毁纳迦。",dEN="The Underbog is the perfect staging location to reclaim Coilfang Reservoir from the Naga.\n\nWipe out the creatures that inhabit the Underbog so my armies can get in position to destroy the Naga.",o="收割幽暗沼泽。",oEN="Reap The Underbog.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967496]={d="安戈罗什是集结我们军团并开始进攻扎布拉金与泰雷多尔的完美要塞。\n\n从食人魔手中夺取这座要塞。把他们的灵魂带给我，以证明任务已经完成。",dEN="Ango'rosh is the perfect stronghold to amass our Legions to begin our assault on Zabra'jin and Telredor.\n\nClaim the stronghold from the ogre. Bring me their souls to prove the task complete.",o="为军团夺取安戈罗什要塞。",oEN="Claim Ango'rosh Stronghold for the Legion.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967497]={d="我们不能允许部落与联盟在赞加沼泽建立永久据点。 \n\n围攻扎布拉金与泰雷多尔，削弱他们的防御。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow the Horde and Alliance to establish a permanent foothold in Zangarmarsh.\n\nLay siege to Zabra'jin and Telredor to soften their defenses. Bring me their souls!",o="围攻赞加沼泽的部落与联盟哨站。",oEN="Lay Siege to the Horde and Alliance outposts in Zangarmarsh.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967498]={d="奥金尼的死灵法师既无法被我们招揽，也不容小觑。\n\n我们加诸部落与联盟的死亡与毁灭，正为死灵法师提供着强化其魔法所需的黑暗能量与尸体。\n\n摧毁死灵法师，并夺取地穴作为行动基地，好让军团得以进攻碎石堡与奥蕾莉亚要塞。",dEN="The necromancers within Auchenai cannot be turned to our side nor taken lightly.\n\nThe death destruction we are inflicting upon the Horde and Alliance is providing the necromancers with the dark energy and corpses they need to empower their magic.\n\nDestroy the necromancers and capture the Crypts as a staging ground for the Legions to move against Stonebreaker Hold and Allerian Stronghold.",o="劫掠奥金尼地穴。",oEN="Reap Auchenai Crypts.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967499]={d="斯克提斯是我们进攻奥蕾莉亚要塞与碎石堡之前的最后一块拼图。只要斯克提斯落入我们手中，我们的军团就能为这次进攻提供完美的监视。\n\n消灭居住在斯克提斯的鸦人。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="Skettis is final piece in our plans before we assault Allerian Stronghold and Stonebreaker Hold. With Skettis under our control our Legions will have a perfect overwatch for our assault.\n\nWipe out the Arakkoa residing in Skettis. Bring me their souls!",o="为军团夺取斯克提斯。",oEN="Claim Skettis for the Legion.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967500]={d="我们不能允许部落与联盟在泰罗卡森林建立永久据点。\n\n围攻碎石堡与奥蕾莉亚要塞，削弱他们的防御。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow the Horde and Alliance to establish a permanent foothold in Terokkar Forest.\n\nLay siege to Stonebreaker Hold and Allerian Stronghold to soften their defenses. Bring me their souls!",o="围攻泰罗卡森林的部落与联盟哨站。",oEN="Lay Siege to the Horde and Alliance outposts in Terokkar Forest.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967501]={d="植物园是我们长期计划的关键。凯尔萨斯已证明无法胜任这项任务。我们原本打算释放在艾泽拉斯身上的实验体已经失控。\n\n进入植物园，清除这些失败的实验体。我们必须重新控制这座设施，才能重新开始实验。",dEN="The Botanica is critical to our long term plans. Kael'thas has proven unsuited to this task. The experiments we had planned to unleash upon Azeroth have gotten out of control.\n\nEnter the Botanica and purge these failed experiments. We must regain control of the facility to begin our experiments anew.",o="劫掠植物园。",oEN="Reap the Botanica.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967502]={d="我们绝不能允许部落与联盟同库雷尼或玛格汉结成同盟！\n\n围攻塔拉与加拉达尔，削弱他们的防御。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow the Horde and Alliance to establish alliances with the Kurenai or Mag'har!\n\nLay siege to Telaar and Garadar to soften their defenses. Bring me their souls!",o="围攻纳格兰的部落与联盟哨站。",oEN="Lay Siege to the Horde and Alliance outposts in Nagrand.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967503]={d="元素高地仍被古尔丹的邪能魔法所腐蚀。是时候让那一举动服务于它最终的目的了。\n\n摧毁高地上的元素生物。我将引导这股被腐蚀能量的洪流，去打击我们的敌人！",dEN="The Elemental Plateau is still corrupted from Gul'dan's fel magic. It is time for that act to serve its final purpose.\n\nDestroy the Elementals on the Plateau. I will channel the massive release of corrupted energy strike our enemies!",o="摧毁元素高地。",oEN="Destroy Elemental Plateau.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967504]={d="永恒龙军团正在对我们邪能铸造者采取行动。他们企图扰乱时间线，阻止麦迪文开启黑暗之门。\n\n绝不能让他们的阴谋得逞！穿越时光之穴前往黑色沼泽，确保麦迪文完成他的使命。",dEN="The Infinite Dragonflight moves against us Felforged. They seek to disrupt the timeline and prevent Medivh from opening the Dark Portal.\n\nThey cannot be allowed to succeed! Travel through the Caverns of Time into The Black Morass and ensure Medivh fulfills his purpose.",o="消灭黑色沼泽中试图阻止黑暗之门开启的势力。",oEN="Destroy the forces in Black Morass seeking to prevent the Dark Portal from opening.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967505]={d="贝尔蒙在追逐力量的过程中变得傲慢自大。是时候让他的追随者去服务于更伟大的目标了。\n\n前往死亡之门，夺取其中的灵魂。它们的能量将有助于强化我的军团……以及你的报酬。",dEN="Baelmon has grown arrogant in his search for power. It is time for his followers to serve a greater purpose.\n\nTravel to Death's Door and claim the souls within. Their energy will help power my Legions... and your reward.",o="为死亡之门带来死亡。",oEN="Bring death to Death's Door.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967506]={d="我们不能允许部落与联盟在刀锋山建立哨站。\n\n围攻希尔瓦纳与雷神要塞，削弱他们的防御。把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow the Horde and Alliance to establish Outposts in Blade's Edge Mountain.\n\nLay siege to Sylvanaar and Thunderlord Stronghold to soften their defenses. Bring me their souls!",o="围攻刀锋山的部落与联盟哨站。",oEN="Lay Siege to the Horde and Alliance outposts in Blade's Edge.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967507]={d="凯尔萨斯在风暴要塞的失败真是没完没了！他派去维持禁魔监狱秩序的典狱官已被里面的囚犯腐化。\n\n你必须夺回禁魔监狱的控制权。我有珍贵的盟友被关押在那里。任何挡在你面前、又软弱到会被这种腐化侵蚀的军团成员，都格杀勿论。",dEN="Kael'thas's failure knows no ends in Tempest Keep! The Warden he sent to maintain control of the Arcatraz has been corrupted by the prisoner's within.\n\nYou must regain control of the Arcatraz. I have valuable allies locked within. Slay any members of the Legion weak enough to fall to this corruption and stand in your way.",o="夺取禁魔监狱的控制权。",oEN="Gain control of the Arcatraz.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967508]={d="我们不能允许有人在虚空风暴建立哨站。\n\n地精们草草搭起了一座简陋的哨站，叫做52区，正在为部落与联盟双方的英雄提供庇护。\n\n我们不能允许有人在虚空风暴建立据点，从而冒着法力熔炉或风暴要塞被用来对付我们的风险。\n\n围攻52区，把他们的灵魂带给我！",dEN="We cannot allow an outpost to be established in Netherstorm.\n\nThe goblins have scrapped together a meager outpost called Area 52 that is offering sanctuary to Heroes from both the Horde and Alliance.\n\nWe cannot allow a foothold to be established in Netherstorm and risk the Manaforges or Tempest Keep being used against us.\n\nLay siege to Area 52 and bring me their souls!",o="围攻刀锋山的52区。",oEN="Lay Siege to Area 52 in Blade's Edge.",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967509]={d="法力炸弹是一种邪恶的武器。我们将制造出有史以来最具毁灭性的一枚。\n\n从虚空风暴的法力熔炉中收集灌注法力的灵魂。是时候动用军团全部的力量来制造一枚法力炸弹了。而我心里已经有了理想的目标……",dEN="Mana bombs are a vile weapon. We will build the most destructive one ever unleashed.\n\nGather Mana Infused souls from the Manaforges in the Netherstorm. It is time to create a Mana bomb using all the might of the Legion. And I have just the target in mind...",o="获取法力熔铸之魂",oEN="Acquire Manaforged Souls",p="计划尚未完成。完成你的指令后再回来。",pEN="The master plan is not yet complete. Return when you have carried out your orders.",c="军团的意志已得到执行。你对事业的虔诚推动着我们黑暗的计划。干得好。",cEN="The Legion's will has been carried out. Your devotion to the cause furthers our dark agenda. Well done."}
Q[967515]={d="用恐惧材料兑换扭曲材料或虚空材料。恐惧材料已不再用于制作物品。",dEN="Exchange Dread Materials for Twisted or Void Materials. Dread Materials are no longer used to craft items.",o="用恐惧材料兑换扭曲材料或虚空材料",oEN="Exchange Dread Materials for Twisted or Void"}
