Q[970017]={d="就连死亡也无法把你的灵魂从军团的手中夺走。当你不可避免地任务失败、殒命于为军团效力之时，你的灵魂将被粉碎，你积累的力量将被那些把你的灵魂束缚在扭曲虚空的邪能吞噬，而你会回到这里。不过，只要你好好为军团效力，就会获得强化灵魂、迎接未来战斗的机会。\n\n完成恶魔契约以获得邪能之力。用获取邪能之力来证明你的价值。塞拉斯会把你的邪能之力转化为命运之手，让你得以永久强化自己的灵魂。\n\n在20级时重抽你的法术，这样当你死亡并复活时，就能更好地服务于你的主人。\n\n此任务只能在20级完成。你在20级更换的法术在死亡后依然保留。调整你重置后的专精，让每一次死亡都让你更强大——前提是你已获得所需的邪能之力。",dEN="Not even death can pull your soul from the grasp of the Legion. When you inevitably fail in your tasks and fall in service to the Legion your soul will be shattered, the power you have accumulated lost to the fel energies that bind your soul to the Twisting Nether and return you here. Serve the Legion well however, and you will be given the opportunity to empower your soul for the battles that lie ahead.\n\nComplete Demon Contracts to obtain Fel Power. Prove your worth by acquiring Fel Power. Silas will transmute your Fel Power into Hand of Fates that will enable you to improve your soul permanently.\n\nReroll your spells at level 20 so you might better serve your masters when you die and rise again.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE COMPLETED AT LEVEL 20. The spells you reroll at level 20 persist through death. Fine tune the build you reset to and grow in power with every death... provided you have earned the required Fel Power.",o="带着500点邪能之力回来。",oEN="Return with 500 Fel Power."}
