Q[971031]={d="就连死亡也无法把你的灵魂从军团的手中夺走。当你不可避免地任务失败、殒命于为军团效力之时，你的灵魂将被粉碎，你积累的力量将被那些把你的灵魂束缚在扭曲虚空的邪能吞噬，而你会回到这里。不过，只要你好好为军团效力，就会获得强化灵魂、迎接未来战斗的机会。\n\n完成恶魔契约以获得邪能之力。用获取邪能之力来证明你的价值。塞拉斯会把你的邪能之力转化为命运之手，让你得以永久强化自己的灵魂。\n\n在20级时重抽你的法术，这样当你死亡并复活时，就能更好地服务于你的主人。\n\n此任务只能在20级完成。你在20级更换的法术在死亡后依然保留。调整你重置后的专精，让每一次死亡都让你更强大——前提是你已获得所需的邪能之力。",dEN="Not even death can pull your soul from the grasp of the Legion. When you inevitably fail in your tasks and fall in service to the Legion your soul will be shattered, the power you have accumulated lost to the fel energies that bind your soul to the Twisting Nether and return you here. Serve the Legion well however, and you will be given the opportunity to empower your soul for the battles that lie ahead.\n\nComplete Demon Contracts to obtain Fel Power. Prove your worth by acquiring Fel Power. Silas will transmute your Fel Power into Hand of Fates that will enable you to improve your soul permanently.\n\nReroll your spells at level 20 so you might better serve your masters when you die and rise again.\n\nTHIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE COMPLETED AT LEVEL 20. The spells you reroll at level 20 persist through death. Fine tune the build you reset to and grow in power with every death... provided you have earned the required Fel Power.",o="带着1000点邪能之力回来。",oEN="Return with 1000 Fel Power."}
Q[975000]={d="在法律之外生活并不总是那么容易。梅尔文\"滑头\"麦克穆林和一些有影响力的法律法官保持着秘密渠道的联系。他可以在合适的耳朵边低语你的名字……只要你付得起价钱。\n\n你愿意为自己的罪孽忏悔吗，<name>？法律只提供一次救赎的机会。\n\n\n\n警告：此任务只能完成一次。这是唯一一个可以立即重置你与法律声望的任务。",dEN="It isn't always easy living life outside The Law. Melvin \"The Slip\" Mcmullin has back channel communication with some influencial Judges of The Law. He can whisper your name in the right ears... for a price.\n\nWill you repent your sins <name>? The Law will only offer redeption once.\n\n\n\nWARNING: THIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE COMPLETED ONCE. THIS IS THE ONLY QUEST THAT CAN IMMEDIATELY RESET YOUR REPUTATION WITH THE LAW.",o="贿赂梅尔文\"滑头\"麦克穆林，修复你与法律的声望。",oEN="Bribe Melvin \"The Slip\" Mcmullin to repair your reputation with The Law.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[975010]={d="黑暗之门开启了，随之而来的是让你那些黑暗行径就此终结的机会。\n\n我向所有愿意在外域对抗军团的英雄提供对过往罪行的赦免。在一片新土地上重新开始，是像你这样的亡命之徒极少能遇到的机会。当你穿过黑暗之门时，你会为艾泽拉斯一方而战吗？还是继续只为自己而战？\n\n你的忠诚属于哪一方，英雄？这个提议不会再有第二次。\n\n注意：此任务只能完成一次。如果你的等级超过60级，将无法接受或完成此任务。",dEN="The Dark Portal opens, and with it comes the opportunity for your Dark Deeds to come to a close.\n\nI am offering Pardons for past crimes to all Heroes willing to fight the Legion in Outland. A fresh start in a new land is an opportunity very few Outlaws such as you are presented with. Will you fight on the side of Azeroth when you step through the Dark Portal? Or will you continue fight for nothing but yourself?\n\nWhere does your Allegiance lie Hero? This offer will not be made twice.\n\nWARNING: THIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE COMPLETED ONCE. THIS QUEST CANNOT BE ACCEPTED OR COMPLETED IF YOU LEVEL BEYOND 60.",o="接受高级赦免者阿比里斯的赦免。",oEN="Accept your pardon from High Absolver Abilis."}
Q[975012]={d="我看到印着你面孔的通缉令，%n。你走到这里并非一路正直，但别以为你对抗军团的战斗无人注意。我向所有愿意在外域对抗军团的英雄提供最后一次赦免。\n\n注意：此任务只能完成一次，并会将你与法律的声望变为中立。",dEN="I see wanted posters with your face on it %n. Your journey here has not been a righteous one, but do not think your fight against the Legion has escaped notice. I am offering one final Pardon to all Heroes willing to fight the Legion in Outland.\n\nWARNING: THIS QUEST CAN ONLY BE COMPLETED ONCE AND WILL SET YOUR REPUTATION WITH THE LAW TO NEUTRAL.",o="接受高级赦免者阿比里斯的赦免。",oEN="Accept your pardon from High Absolver Abilis."}
Q[975728]={d="这个萨特……巴扎兰，还有尼尔鲁提到的另一个……他是什么来着，一个术士？……都必须死。找到炽刃会的这两名首领，杀了他们。",dEN="This satyr... Bazzalan, and the other Neeru mentioned--what was he, a warlock?--must be slain. Find these two leaders of the Searing Blade, and kill them.",o="杀死巴扎兰与召唤者耶尔格什，然后回到告示板。",oEN="Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to the Call Board."}
Q[978027]={d="你在62级之前将不再抽取新技能。你会保留53至60级间获得的技能精华，并且当你达到60级时，可以把积攒的8点技能精华花在两个50级和60级天赋上！在你不再抽取技能的等级上，此物品还会给予你一张幸运卷轴！",dEN="You will no longer roll new abilities until level 62. You will save your Ability Essence earned levels 53 to 60, and you can spend your saved 8 Ability Essence on two level 50 and 60 talents when you reach level 60! This item will also grant you a Scroll of Fortune at levels you are no longer rolling an ability!",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[978028]={d="你在62级之前将不再抽取新技能。你会保留53至60级间获得的技能精华，并且当你达到60级时，可以把积攒的8点技能精华花在两个50级和60级天赋上！在你不再抽取技能的等级上，此物品还会给予你一张幸运卷轴！",dEN="You will no longer roll new abilities until level 62. You will save your Ability Essence earned levels 53 to 60, and you can spend your saved 8 Ability Essence on two level 50 and 60 talents when you reach level 60! This item will also grant you a Scroll of Fortune at levels you are no longer rolling an ability!",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[978029]={d="你在62级之前将不再抽取新技能。你会保留53至60级间获得的技能精华，并且当你达到60级时，可以把积攒的8点技能精华花在两个50级和60级天赋上！在你不再抽取技能的等级上，此物品还会给予你一张幸运卷轴！",dEN="You will no longer roll new abilities until level 62. You will save your Ability Essence earned levels 53 to 60, and you can spend your saved 8 Ability Essence on two level 50 and 60 talents when you reach level 60! This item will also grant you a Scroll of Fortune at levels you are no longer rolling an ability!",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[978030]={d="当你达到60级时，可以把积攒的8点技能精华花在两个50级和60级天赋上！你只能选择1个60级天赋。这个宝箱里有一颗天赋骰子，让你可以洗掉已选的50级和60级天赋，重新选择新的天赋。",dEN="You can spend your saved 8 Ability Essence on two level 50 and 60 talents when you reach level 60! You can only pick 1 level 60 talent. This chest contains a Dice of Talents, which will allow you to unlearn your chosen 50 and 60 talents and pick new ones.",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[978031]={d="你将不再获得新技能。你会保留67至70级间获得的4点技能精华，让你在达到70级时可以额外选择一个50级或60级天赋！你总共会有12点技能精华，可以花在3个50级和60级天赋上。你只能选择1个60级天赋。在你不再获得技能的等级上，此物品还会给予你一张幸运卷轴！",dEN="You will no longer roll new abilities. You will save your 4 Ability Essence earned levels 67 to 70 to allow you to pick one additional level 50 or 60 talent when you reach level 70! You will have a total of 12 Ability Essence to spend on 3 level 50 and 60 talents. You can only pick 1 level 60 talent. This item will also grant you a Scroll of Fortune at levels you are no longer rolling an ability!",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[978032]={d="达到70级时，你可以把67至70级积攒的4点技能精华花掉，让你在达到70级时可以额外选择一个50级或60级天赋！你总共会有12点技能精华，可以花在3个50级和60级天赋上。你只能选择1个60级天赋。此物品还会给予你一颗命运骰子！",dEN="Upon reaching level 70, you can spend your 4 Ability Essence saved from levels 67 to 70 to allow you to pick one additional level 50 or 60 talent when you reach level 70! You will have a total of 12 Ability Essence to spend on 3 level 50 and 60 talents. You can only pick 1 level 60 talent. This item will also grant you a Dice of Destiny!",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[980000]={d="联盟控制着泰拉瑞盆地，并垄断了碎击者之核的市场。更糟的是，我们的狩猎队正遭到联盟和同样觊觎此地的石拳猎人的袭击。深入泰拉瑞盆地，收集被污染的碎击者之核，并屠杀在塔拉里东边扎营的石拳猎人，以此削减竞争者。",dEN="The Alliance control the Telaari Basin and have captured the market on Crusher Cores. What's worse is our hunting parties are under assault from the Alliance and the Boulderfist Hunters that also lay claim to the area. Venture into the Telarri Basin and collect Tainted Crusher Cores and thin the competition by slaughtering the Boulderfish Hunters who have made their camp east of Talaari.",o="收集1个被污染的攻击者之核与1把染血的食人魔长矛。",oEN="Collect Tainted Crusher Core and Bloody Ogre Spear."}
Q[980004]={d="伊多娜·怀瑟需要取回那些药水。迪菲亚兄弟会袭击了一支运往哨兵岭的补给队。在他们的营地中寻找被偷走的箱子并带回来，这样我们才能救治伤员。",dEN="Idona Wyther needs those potions back. The Defias raided a supply run bound for Sentinel Hill. Find the pilfered crates at their camps and bring them back so we can tend to the wounded.",o="从西部荒野的迪菲亚营地中夺回被偷走的药水。",oEN="Recover the stolen potions from the Defias camps in Westfall."}
Q[980104]={d="征服者瓦兹希尔已被悬赏。艾瑞斯飞船站的星界财团希望我们清除潜伏在奥舒冈的恶魔，以期改善他们与纳鲁的关系。潜入奥舒冈并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Subjugator Vaz'shir. The Consortium at Aeris Landing wants us to rid Oshu'gun of the demons lurking around down there, hoping to improve their relations with the Naaru. Descend into Oshu'gun and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀征服者瓦兹希尔，并杀死奥舒冈内的恐惧卫士。",oEN="Assassinate Subjugator Vaz'shir and kill Terrorguards inside Oshu'gun.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980105]={d="星界财团已对顾问佐尔博发出悬赏。他们找到了替代的收入来源，但顾问佐尔博和其他战槌食人魔无意出售他们的黑曜石战争念珠，所以财团希望我们执行备用计划。深入欢笑颅骨废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Zorbo the Advisor by the Consortium. They have found an alternative source of income, but the Zorbo the Advisor and the other Warmaul Orgres are not interested in trading away their Obsidian Warbeads, so the Consortium want us to execute the backup plan. Venture into the Laughing Skull Ruins and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀顾问佐尔博以及欢笑颅骨废墟中的战槌食人魔。",oEN="Assassinate Zorbo the Advisor and the Warmaul Ogres in Laughing Skull Ruins.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980106]={d="龙喉氏族已对暮光岭的暗影议会死影教徒发出悬赏。他们希望我们阻止暗影议会稳定暮光岭上的传送门。穿过恐惧熔炉营与仇恨熔炉营之间的恶魔传送门前往暮光岭，杀死死影教徒，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Deathshadow Cultists of the Shadow Council at Twilight Ridge by the Dragonmaw Clan. They want us to stop the Shadow Council from stabilizing the portal found on the Twilight Ridge. Venture to the Twilight Ridge through the Demonic Gateway between Forge Camp: Fear and Forge Camp: Hate and slay the Deathshadow Cultists, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死暮光岭的死影教徒。",oEN="Kill the Deathshadow Cultists at Twilight Ridge.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980107]={d="熔炉营的监工已被悬赏。受难者奥图里斯需要帮助，以阻止仇恨熔炉营与恐惧熔炉营的恶魔打造强大的武器并进一步深入纳格兰。突袭恐惧熔炉营与仇恨熔炉营并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Forge Camp Overseers. Altruis the Sufferer needs help to prevent the demons in Forge Camp: Hate and Forge Camp: Fear from building powerful weapons and advancing further into Nagrand. Assault Forge Camp: Fear and Forge Camp: Hate and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死仇恨熔炉营与恐惧熔炉营的熔炉营监工及其追随者。",oEN="Slay Forge Camp Overseers and their followers in Forge Camp: Hate and Forge Camp: Fear.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980112]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对格鲁尔巢穴外居住的刃喉食人魔发出悬赏。在巢穴中挑战格鲁尔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败屠龙者及其军队。前往刀锋山领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Bladespire Ogres that dwell outside Gruul's Lair by Baron Sablemane. Challenging Gruul in his lair is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the Dragonslayer and his forces. Travel to Blade's Edge Mountain and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀格鲁尔巢穴外的刃喉食人魔。",oEN="Assassinate the Bladespire Ogres outside Gruul's Lair.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980113]={d="常青林的塞纳里奥远征队已对驯犬大师贝尔蒙及其爪牙发出悬赏。是时候把死亡之门狠狠关上，挡住从中涌出的愤怒猎犬了！前往死亡之门领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Baelmon the Hound-Master and his minions by the Cenarion Expedition in Evergrove. It's time to slam Death's Door shut on the Wrath Hounds pouring through it! Travel to Death's Door and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="在死亡之门处决驯犬大师贝尔蒙及其爪牙。",oEN="Execute Baelmon the Hound-Master and his minions in Death's Door.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980114]={d="奥格瑞拉与沙塔尔天空卫队已对漩涡尖塔顶部的恶魔与野生动物发出悬赏。他们需要我们帮忙让营地更安全。前往漩涡尖塔领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the demons and wildlife atop the Vortex Pinnacle by the Ogri'la and Shattari Skyguard. They need our assistance to make their camps safer. Travel to the Vortex Pinnacle and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭漩涡尖塔顶部的深渊烈焰使者、碎皮野猪与愤怒猎犬。",oEN="Destroy the Abyssal Flamebringes, Shard-Hide Boars and Wrath Hounds atop the Vortex Pinnacle.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980115]={d="乌鸦林中出了极其糟糕的事。居住在格里什纳斯的鸦人及其黑暗魔法，最可能是肆虐森林的邪恶之源。洗劫村庄，杀死住在那里面的鸦人，并击败他们的女族长。前往刀锋山领取赏金。不过要小心，你并不是唯一追寻这份赏金的英雄，而战利品属于胜者。",dEN="Something is terribly wrong in Raven's Wood. The Arakkoa that reside in Grishnath and their dark magics are the most likely source of the evil plaguing the woods. Raid the village, slaughter the Arakkoa that live there and defeat their Matriarch! Travel to Blade's Edge Mountain and collect the bounty. Be cautious though, you are not the only Hero seeking this bounty, and to the victor go the spoils.",o="领取格里什纳蔑鸦、格里什纳先驱者与格里什纳女族长的赏金。",oEN="Collect the bounty on Grishna Scorncrows, Grishna Harbingers and the Grishna Matriarch.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980120]={d="星界财团已对生态圆顶内陆的野生动物发出悬赏。为防止种群数量过大以致生态圆顶无力承载，必须处理掉其中一些动物。前往生态圆顶内陆并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the wildlife inside Eco-Dome Midrealm by the Consortium. To prevent the population from becoming too big for the eco-dome to handle, some of the animals have to be dealt with. Travel to Eco-Dome Midrealm and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="猎杀生态圆顶内陆的野生动物。",oEN="Hunt down the wildlife inside Eco-Dome Midrealm.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980121]={d="星界财团已对法兰伦巨人发出悬赏。原始法兰石已在财团的客户中大受欢迎，他们希望我们替他们放倒这些巨人，好弄到更多。前往虚空石并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Farahlon Giants by the Consortium. Raw Farahlite has already proven popular with the Consortium's clients, and they want us to fell the giants for them so they can get their hands on more. Travel to Netherstone and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死虚空石的裂石者与法兰伦破石者。",oEN="Slay Cragskaar and the Farahlon Breakers in Netherstone.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980122]={d="星界财团已对特雷利姆矿坑与泽昂升降机井的居民发出悬赏。自从血精灵失去奥术法力熔炉下方的矿坑后，特雷利姆矿坑就成了他们维持熔炉运转的唯一材料来源。不用说，进一步瘫痪他们的采矿作业对财团来说是件好事，但他们已经开始盘算着进驻并据为己有。前往法力熔炉阿拉下方的特雷利姆矿坑与法力熔炉奥术下方的泽昂升降机井并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the inhabitants of Trellium Mine and Access Shaft Zeon by the Consortium. Ever since the bloodelfs lost the mine underneath Manaforge Ultris, Trellium Mine is where their sole supply of material for running the forges is coming from. Needless to say, it would be a boon for the Consortium to cripple their mining operation further, but they have started having ambitions of moving in and take them over for themselves. Travel to Trellium Mine below Manaforge Ara and Access Shaft Zeon below Manaforge Ultris and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="清剿法力熔炉阿拉下方的特雷利姆矿坑以及法力熔炉奥术下方的泽昂升降机井。",oEN="Clear out the Trellium Mine below Manaforge Ara and Access Shaft Zeon below Manaforge Ultris.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980123]={d="一位富有的赞助人已对法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队发出悬赏。上面没有写明动机，但对抗炎怒军团真的还需要理由吗？摧毁法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队。杀死他们的士兵，刺杀他们的首领！前往法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu by a wealthy benefactor. There is no motive listed, but do you really need one to fight the Sunfury? Lay waste to the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu. Kill their soldiers and assassinate their leadership! Travel to Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="歼灭法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队。",oEN="Lay waste to the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980128]={d="影月谷的居民已对盘牙蓄水池的纳迦发出悬赏。在影月谷，水非常宝贵，补给线的维持又十分昂贵，因此控制这里仅有的那点水源至关重要。前往盘牙蓄水池并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Naga in Coilskar Cistern by the inhabitants of Shadowmoon Valley. Water is valuable in Shadowmoon Valley and supply lines expensive to maintain, therefore it is important to control the little water that is already here. Travel to Coilskar Cistern and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭盘牙蓄水池的纳迦。",oEN="Exterminate the Naga in Coilskar Cistern.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980129]={d="死亡熔炉的暗影议会成员已被悬赏。暗影议会不断用他们的地狱火攻击我们。杀死守卫，屠杀死亡熔炉召唤者并收集他们的扭曲灵魂碎片，然后从召唤者斯卡塔克斯手中夺得死亡熔炉召唤法杖。前往死亡熔炉并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the The Shadow Council members at The Deathforge. The Shadowcouncil keeps attacking us with their infernals, Kill the Guardians, Slaughter the Deathforge Summoners and collect their Twisted Soul Shards, then obtain the Deathforge Summoning Staff from Summoner Skartax. Travel to The Deathforge and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="突袭死亡熔炉。杀死死亡熔炉守卫，并收集召唤者斯卡塔克斯的法杖及其召唤者身上的扭曲灵魂碎片。",oEN="Assault the Deathforge. Slay the Deathforge Guardians, and collect Summoner Skartax's staff and Twisted Soul Shards from his summoners.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980130]={d="卡拉波废墟的恶魔猎手大师已被悬赏。召集一队英雄，杀死那些负责训练恶魔猎手新兵的大师。伊利达雷从不缺新兵，但有能力训练他们的恶魔猎手却十分稀缺。前往卡拉波废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the master Demon Hunters in the Ruins of Karabor. Gather a group of Heroes and slay the masters responsible for training the Demon Hunter initiates. The Illidari have no shortage of recruits, but the Demon Hunters capable of training them are in short supply. Travel to the Ruins of Karabor and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="击败卡拉波废墟的恶魔猎手大师。",oEN="Defeat the master Demon Hunters in the Ruins of Karabor.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980131]={d="灵翼龙族已对灵翼浮岛的龙喉兽人发出悬赏。龙喉邪兽人占领了灵翼浮岛，并建起营地用作被奴役的虚空幼龙的繁殖场。这片土地曾属于灵翼龙族，他们想要夺回来。前往灵翼浮岛并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Dragonmaw Orcs at the Netherwing Ledge by the Netherwing. The Dragonmaw fel orcs have taken over Netherwing Ledge, and build a camp to use as a breeding area for the enslaved nether drakes.This land was once held by the Netherwing dragonflight and they want it back.Travel to the Netherwing Ledge and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="屠杀灵翼浮岛的龙喉苦工以及监督他们的龙喉晋升者。",oEN="Slaughter the Dragonmaw Peons and the Dragonmaw Ascendants overseeing them at the Netherwing Ledge",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980232]={d="灵魂平原上采集奥舒冈水晶的维尔安尼已被悬赏。艾瑞斯飞船站的星界财团不喜欢其他虚灵的竞争。杀死维尔安尼，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Vir'aani gathing Oshu'gun crystals in the Spirit Fields. The Consortium at Aeris Landing doesn't like competition from other Ethereals. Slay the Vir'aani, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭奥舒冈外的维尔安尼虚灵。",oEN="Eliminate the Vir'aani ethereals outside Oshu'gun.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980233]={d="星界财团已对灵魂平原的虚空孽生者发出悬赏。虚空孽生者对艾瑞斯飞船站的虚灵构成安全威胁，因为他们想尽可能靠近奥舒冈。前往灵魂平原并消灭虚空孽生者，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Voidspawns in the Spirit Fields by the Consortium. The Voidspawn poses a security risk for the Ethereals at Aeris Landing, as they wanted to be as close as possible to Oshu'gun. Travel to the Spirit Fields and exterminate the Voidspawn, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死奥舒冈外的虚空孽生者。",oEN="Slay Voidspawn outside Oshu'gun.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980234]={d="北风裂谷与南风裂谷的石拳氏族已被悬赏。前往他们的土丘杀死那些食人魔，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Boulderfist Clan at Northwind Cleft and Southwind Cleft. Go to to their mounds and slay the ogres, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死南风裂谷与北风裂谷的石拳食人魔。",oEN="Kill the Boulderfist Ogres at Northwind Cleft and Southwind Cleft.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980235]={d="哈兰下方的淤泥孽生者已被悬赏。大地之环需要我们摧毁淤泥孽生者，以免环境遭到污染。前往哈兰下方的水域并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Muck Spawn below Halaa. The Earthen Ring need us to destroy the Spawn of Muck to avoid contaminating the enviroment. Head to the waters below Halaa and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭哈兰下方的淤泥孽生者。",oEN="Exterminate the Muck Spawn below Halaa.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980236]={d="日泉岗哨的日泉居民已被悬赏。暗血部族正在给纳格兰的所有人制造麻烦，是时候终结他们了。前往日泉岗哨并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Sunspring Residents at Sunspring Post. The Murkblood tribe is causing trouble for everyone in Nagrand, it's time to put and end to them. Head to Sunspring Post and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭日泉岗哨的暗血部族。",oEN="Exterminate the Murkbloods at Sunspring Post.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980237]={d="常青林的德鲁伊们已对鲁安林地中的鸦人与黑翼龙教徒发出悬赏。他们凭借黑暗魔法与对野生动物的偷猎，对德鲁伊们的努力构成严重威胁。前往鲁安林地并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Arakkoa and Blackwing Wyrmcultists in Ruuan Weald by the Druids at Evergrove. They pose a grave threat to the efforts of the Druids, with their dark magic and the poaching the natural wildlife. Travel to Ruuan Weald and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在鲁安林地的鲁安诺克鸦人与黑翼龙教徒。",oEN="Kill the Ruuan'ok Arakkoa and the Blackwing Wyrmcultists living in Ruuan Weald.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980238]={d="血槌峡谷的血槌食人魔已被悬赏。虽然血槌食人魔并非群山中实力最强的氏族——他们没有获得名为屠龙者格鲁尔的格隆的青睐——但实力紧随其后。既然我们已经清理了刃喉，是时候把目光转向他们的对手了。前往血槌峡谷并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Bloodmaul Ogres in Bloodmaul Canyon. While the Bloodmaul ogres are not the strongest clan in the mountains, not having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, they run a close second. Now that we've dealt with winnowing the Bladespire, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals. Travel to Bloodmaul Canyon and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在血槌峡谷的血槌食人魔。",oEN="Slay the Bloodmaul Ogre residing in Bloodmaul Canyon.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980239]={d="歌唱山脊的次级虚空幼龙与水晶剥皮者已被悬赏。前往乌鸦林并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Lesser Nether Drake and Crystal Flayer residing in Singing Ridge. Travel to Ravens Wood and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭居住在歌唱山脊的次级虚空幼龙与水晶剥皮者。",oEN="Exterminate the Lesser Nether Drake and Crystal Flayer residing in Singing Ridge.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980240]={d="常青林的德鲁伊们已对维克面纱的鸦人发出悬赏。多年来他们一直安分无害，但有什么东西惊动了他们，如今他们随身携带水晶，并将其用于某种黑暗的目的。这些水晶的用途尚不为人知，但我们必须在吃到苦头之前阻止他们。前往维克面纱并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Arakkoa in Veil Vekh by the Druids at Evergrove. They have been benign for many years, but now something has stirred them and they carry crystals with them now, which they have turned to some dark purpose. It is not known what the purpose of these crystals is yet, but we need to stop them before we learn it the hard way. Travel to Veil Vekh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在维克面纱的鸦人。",oEN="Kill the Arakkoa residing in Veil Vekh.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980241]={d="巨石莫克食人魔与黑翼龙教徒已被悬赏。我们必须抓住任何机会打击这些山中的食人魔，否则他们终将压垮我们。至于黑翼龙教徒，他们正与巨石莫克食人魔交战，而我们不想用一个麻烦替换另一个，所以把他们也一并除掉。前往乌鸦林并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Boulder'mok Ogres and the Blackwing Wyrmcultists. We must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us. As for the Wyrmcultists, they are at war with the Boulder'mok Ogres, and we don't want to replace one problem with another, so get rid of them as well. Travel to Ravens Wood and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭居住在乌鸦林的巨石莫克食人魔与黑翼龙教徒。",oEN="Finish the Boulder'mok Ogre and Blackwing Wyrmcultists residing in Raven's Wood.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980242]={d="致所有有意者：诚聘承包商，提供稀有工程零件的安全获取服务。是否遵守适用的法律法规可自行决定。必须热情积极，具备10年客户服务经验，有处理脏活的经验者优先（非必需）。主动性是必备条件。\n\n死活不论：18名甘尔葛工程师，8名莫尔葛末日铁匠\n\n——此致敬礼\n星界财团",dEN="Attention all interested: Contractors sought for secure acquisition services of rare engineering parts. Compliance with applicable regulations and laws optional. Must be enthusiastic, 10 years customer service experience, wetwork experience optional. Initiative is a must.\n\nWanted Dead or Alive: 18 Gan'arg Engineers, 8 Mo'arg Doomsmiths\n\n-Regards\nThe Consortium",o="杀死甘尔葛工程师与莫尔葛末日铁匠",oEN="Slay the Gan'arg Engineers and Mo'arg Doomsmiths",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980243]={d="星界财团已对法兰伦废墟中的恶魔发出悬赏。财团想夺回恐惧魔王库鲁萨斯的晶核供自己使用，但首先需要有人替他们清出一条路。前往法兰伦废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the demons in the Ruins of Farahlon by the Consortium. The Consortium wishes to retrieve the crystal of the dreadlord Culuthas for their own use, but first they need someone to clear the path. Travel to Ruins of Farahlon and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="向居住在法兰伦废墟的库鲁萨斯之犬与库鲁萨斯之眼复仇。",oEN="Exact revenge on the Hound of Culuthas and Eye of Culuthas residing in the Ruins of Farahlon.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980244]={d="星界财团已对居住在废料堆的萨克希斯虚灵发出悬赏。萨克希斯虚灵从财团中分裂出去，正在分流财团的生意与贸易。故事就从这里开始。他们希望我们追捕并消灭这些叛徒。前往废料堆并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Zaxxis Ethereals residing in The Heap by the Consortium. The Zaxxis etherials split off from the Consortium and is siphoning off business and trade from the Consortium. This is where you enter the story. They want us to hunt down and exterminate the traitors. Travel to The Heap and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在废料堆的萨克希斯虚灵。",oEN="Slay the Zaxxis Ethereals residing in The Heap.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980245]={d="虚空风暴的血精灵与星界财团之间的生意……出了问题。更糟的是，炎怒军团一直在大量招募人手。他们在准备着什么可怕的东西，我能感觉到。你可以与星界财团一起帮助沙塔斯城的纳鲁，侦察那片区域并削减他们的人数。至少这能拖延他们正在筹备的阴谋，直到我们的特工查明真相。发现任何情况都回来向我汇报。\n\n哦，如果你在那边看到其他英雄，为保险起见，就假定他们与炎怒军团勾结，并确保他们的人数也同样被削减。",dEN="Business between the blood elves of netherstorm and the consortium have gone.....awry. To make matters worse, the Sunfury have been recruiting en masse. They are preparing something awful, I can feel it. You can help the Naaru of Shattrath along with The Consortium by scouting out there and thinning their numbers. In the very least this will delay whatever machinations they have been preparing for until our agents can get to the bottom of this. Report back here with whatever you've found.\n\nOh and if you see other heroes out there, to be on the safe side assume they are in league with the sunfury and see to it they are thinned as well.",o="杀死居住在法力熔炉布纳尔的炎怒血精灵。",oEN="Kill the Sunfury Blood Elves residing in Manaforge B'naar.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980246]={d="52区的地精已对居住在恩卡特废墟的无实体德莱尼与居住在阿克隆废墟的阿克隆恶魔发出悬赏。有这么多生物想要他们的命，他们很难为火箭收集材料。前往恩卡特废墟与阿克隆废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Disembodied Draenei residing in the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Demons residing in Arklon Ruins by the goblins at Area 52. It is hard for them to gather materials for their rocket with so many beings wanting them dead. Travel to the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Ruins and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭恩卡特废墟的无实体德莱尼与阿克隆废墟的阿克隆恶魔。",oEN="Slay the Disembodied Draenei in the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Demons in Arklon Ruins.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980247]={d="巴里废墟的灰舌破碎者与伊利达雷监工已被悬赏。伊利丹已命令灰舌部族在该地区挖掘古代德莱尼神器——据传它们藏着卡拉波神殿（如今被称为黑暗神殿）的秘密。前往巴里废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Ashtongue Broken and Illidari Overseers in the Ruins of Baa'ri. The Ashtongue has been ordered by Illidan to excavate the area for ancient Draenei artifacts that are rumored to hold the secrets of the Temple of Karabor, now known as the Black Temple. Travel to the Ruins of Baa'ri and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="巴里废墟的灰舌破碎者与伊利达雷监工。",oEN="Ashtongue Broken and Illidari Overseers in the Ruins of Baa'ri.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980248]={d="伊利丹统率的盘牙部队已侵占了影月谷的北部。\n在整个外域，伊利丹有许多部队需要我们应对，而没有哪支比盘牙更狡诈。\n海妖仍在蛊惑我们的部队，已造成大量伤亡，她们的赏金已经到手。\n他们占据了北方的古代德莱尼废墟，并将那片土地据为己有，即盘牙哨站。\n前往那里寻找海妖，终结她们的巫术。",dEN="The Coilskar forces Illidan commands have infested the northern part of Shadowmoon Valley.\nIllidan has many forces for us to deal with throughout Outland and none are more cunning than the Coilskar.\nThe Sirens continue to bewitch our forces and have caused many casualities, their bounty has been earnt.\nThey have claimed the ancient Draneii ruins to the north and have claimed that ground Coilskar Point.\nTravel there and seek the Sirens, put an end to their sorcery.",o="杀死居住在盘牙哨站的盘牙海妖。",oEN="Slay the Coilskar Sirens residing in Coilskar Point.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980249]={d="影月谷栖息着外域有史以来最腐化的邪能物种。\n尽管那里的敌人从不短缺，但邪能野猪与邪火双帆龙已被证明是棘手的野兽，是时候对付它们了。\n影月谷中部火山形成的熔岩池是邪火双帆龙的家园，而邪能野猪则在谷中四处游荡。\n去那里杀死这些野兽，帮忙再消除一个在那里威胁着我们的危险。",dEN="Shadowmoon Valley holds some of the most foul fel-tainted species ever seen in Outland.\nAlthough there is no shortage of enemies there the Felboar and Felfire Diemetradons have proven to be troublesome beasts, the time has come for them to be dealt with.\nThe lava pools that have been formed from volcano in the middle of Shadowmoon are home to the Felfire Diemetradons and the Felboars roam throughout the valley.\nGo there and slay theses beasts, help remove one more danger that threatens us there.",o="杀死居住在熔岩平原的邪火双帆龙与邪能野猪。",oEN="Slaughter the Felfire Diemetradons and Felboars residing in the Magma Fields.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980250]={d="伊利达雷哨站的伊利达雷恶魔已被悬赏。伊利达雷哨站是伊利丹忠诚恶魔的集结地，我们必须在他们变得更强大之前除掉他们。前往伊利达雷哨站并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Illidari Demons residing in Illidari Point. Illidari Point is a staging ground for Illidan's loyal demons, and we have to take them out before they become even stronger. Travel to Illidari Point and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="终结居住在伊利达雷哨站的伊利达雷恶魔。",oEN="Put an end to the Illidari Demons residing in Illidari Point.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980251]={d="龙喉要塞是影月谷龙喉兽人的集结地。\n他们在那里奴役幼龙为其效命，并在祖鲁希德的邪恶号令下，把它当作他们在此地大部分活动的基地。\n前往灵翼平原，你就会看到那座高耸于群山之间的雄伟要塞。\n杀死你在那里看到的任何龙喉兽人，确保我们要对付的敌人又少一个。",dEN="Dragonmaw Fortress acts as a staging ground for the Dragonmaw Orcs in Shadowmoon Valley.\nThey enslave the drakes to do their bidding there and use it as a base for most of their activies here under the vile bidding of Zuluhed.\nHead to the Netherwing Fields and you will see the towering fortress standing against the mountains.\nKill any Dragonmaw you see there and make sure there is one less enemy for us to deal with.",o="杀死居住在龙喉要塞的龙喉兽人。",oEN="Slay the Dragonmaw Orcs residing in Dragonmaw Fortress.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[980252]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对蛮沼村的居民发出悬赏。挑战失落者绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败失落者部族的成员。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Feralfen Village by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Lost Ones is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the members of the Lost One tribes. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的蛮沼居民。",oEN="Assassinate the Feralfen denziens within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980253]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对暗鳞海岸的居民发出悬赏。挑战暗鳞绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败暗鳞纳迦的成员。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Darkcrest Shore by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Darkcrest is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the members of the Darkcrest Nagas. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的暗鳞居民。",oEN="Assassinate the Darkcrest denziens within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980254]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对死亡泥潭的居民发出悬赏。挑战死亡泥潭的生物绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败死亡泥潭的居民。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of The Dead Mire by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the creatures of the Dead Mire is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of The Dead Mire. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的死亡泥潭居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of the Dead Mire within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980255]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对血鳞浅滩的居民发出悬赏。挑战血鳞绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败血鳞纳迦的成员。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Bloodscale Grounds by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Bloodscale is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the members of the Bloodscale Nagas. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的血鳞浅滩居民。",oEN="Assassinate the Bloodscale Grounds denziens within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980256]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对孢子谷的居民发出悬赏。挑战孢子谷的生物绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败孢子谷的居民。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of The Spawning Glen by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the creatures of the Spawning Glen is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of The Spawning Glen. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的孢子谷居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of the The Spawning Glen within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980257]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对安戈罗什营地的居民发出悬赏。挑战安戈罗什食人魔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败安戈罗什营地的居民。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Ango'rosh Grounds by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ogres of Ango'rosh is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Ango'rosh Grounds. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的安戈罗什居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Ango'rosh within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980258]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对安戈罗什要塞的居民发出悬赏。挑战安戈罗什食人魔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败安戈罗什要塞的居民。前往赞加沼泽并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Ango'rosh Stronghold by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ogres of Ango'rosh is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Ango'rosh Stronghold. Travel to Zangarmarsh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的安戈罗什居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Ango'rosh within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980259]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对壁垒山的居民发出悬赏。挑战壁垒山的食人魔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败壁垒山的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Barrier Hills by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ogres of Barrier Hills is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Barrier Hills. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的壁垒山居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Barrier Hills within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980260]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对图雷姆的居民发出悬赏。挑战图雷姆的失落者绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败图雷姆的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Barrier Hills by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Lost Ones of Tuurem is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Tuurem. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的图雷姆居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Tuurem within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980261]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对火翼岗哨的居民发出悬赏。挑战火翼岗哨的精灵绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败火翼岗哨的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Firewing Point by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Elves of Firewing Point is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Firewing Point. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的火翼岗哨居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Firewing Point within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980262]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对斯克提斯的居民发出悬赏。挑战斯克提斯的鸦人绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败斯克提斯的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Skettis by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Arakkoa of Skettis is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Skettis. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的斯克提斯居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Skettis within Terrokar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980263]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对沙拉斯面纱的居民发出悬赏。挑战沙拉斯面纱的鸦人绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败沙拉斯面纱的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Veil Shalas by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Arakkoa of Veil Shalas is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Veil Shalas. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的沙拉斯面纱居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Veil Shalas within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980264]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对光之墓的居民发出悬赏。挑战其中的虚灵绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败光之墓的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Tomb of Lights by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the Ethereals within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Tomb of Lights. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的光之墓居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Tomb of Lights within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980265]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对血环废墟的居民发出悬赏。挑战其中的食人魔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败血环废墟的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Bleeding Hollow Ruins by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ogres within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Bleeding Hollow Ruins. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的血环废墟居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Bleeding Hollow Ruins within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980266]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对碎骨废墟的居民发出悬赏。挑战其中的兽人绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败碎骨废墟的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Bonechewer Ruins by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the orcs within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Bonechewer Ruins. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的碎骨废墟居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Bonechewer Ruins within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980267]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对暗影之墓的居民发出悬赏。挑战其中的虚灵绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败暗影之墓的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of the Shadow Tomb by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ethereals within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of the Shadow Tomb. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀泰罗卡的暗影之墓居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of the Shadow Tomb within Terokkar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980268]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对暗泽村的居民发出悬赏。挑战那里的虚灵绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败暗泽村的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Umbrafen Village by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ethereals within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Umbrafen Village. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的暗泽村居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Umbrafen Village within Zangarmarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[980269]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对匕潭村的居民发出悬赏。挑战那里的虚灵绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败匕潭村的居民。前往泰罗卡并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the denziens of Daggerfen Village by Baron Sablemane. Challenging the ethereals within is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the denziens of Daggerfen Village. Travel to Terokkar and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀赞加沼泽的匕潭村居民。",oEN="Assassinate denziens of Daggerfen Village within Zangamarsh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[981251]={d="龙喉要塞是影月谷龙喉兽人的集结地。\n他们在那里奴役幼龙为其效命，并在祖鲁希德的邪恶号令下，把它当作他们在此地大部分活动的基地。\n前往灵翼平原，你就会看到那座高耸于群山之间的雄伟要塞。\n杀死你在那里看到的任何龙喉兽人，确保我们要对付的敌人又少一个。",dEN="Dragonmaw Fortress acts as a staging ground for the Dragonmaw Orcs in Shadowmoon Valley.\nThey enslave the drakes to do their bidding there and use it as a base for most of their activies here under the vile bidding of Zuluhed.\nHead to the Netherwing Fields and you will see the towering fortress standing against the mountains.\nKill any Dragonmaw you see there and make sure there is one less enemy for us to deal with.",o="杀死居住在龙喉要塞的龙喉兽人。",oEN="Slay the Dragonmaw Orcs residing in Dragonmaw Fortress.",p="你完成悬赏了吗？",pEN="Did you complete the bounty?",c="干得好，士兵！这是你完成悬赏的报酬，<name>。",cEN="Well done, Soldier! Here is your reward from the bounty, <name>."}
Q[982000]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n深入泰拉瑞盆地，收集被污染的碎击者之核，并屠杀在塔拉里东边扎营的石拳猎人。",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nVenture into the Telarri Basin and collect Tainted Crusher Cores and slaughter the Boulderfish Hunters who have made their camp east of Talaari.",o="收集1个被污染的攻击者之核与1把染血的食人魔长矛。",oEN="Collect Tainted Crusher Core and Bloody Ogre Spear."}
Q[982001]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n深入泰拉瑞盆地，收集扭曲的碎击者之核，并在部落眼皮底下于天歌湖偷取扭曲之水精华！",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nVenture into the Telarri Basin and collect Twisted Crusher Cores and poach Twisted Water Essence from under the Horde's noses in Skysong Lake!",o="收集扭曲的碎击者之核与旋风之水精华。",oEN="Collect Twisted Crusher Core and Twister Water Essence."}
Q[982002]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n从基尔索罗堡垒的基尔索罗教徒手中夺取基尔索罗仪式法杖，并从炽燃废墟的石拳秘法师那里夺取仪式念珠。",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nCapture Kil'sorrow Ritual Staves from Kil'sorry Cultists in Kil'sorrow Fortress and Ritual Beads from the Boulderfish Mystics in the Burning Blade Ruins.",o="收集基尔索罗仪式法杖与石拳仪式念珠。",oEN="Collect Kil'sorrow Ritual Staff and Boulderfist Ritual Beads."}
Q[982003]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n风芦悲惨者与石拳碎击者已经完成了搜刮和收集物资的苦活。军团要求你把那些物资据为己有。",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nThe Windyreed Wretches and Bouldfist Crushers have already done the hard work of scavenging and gathering supplies. The Legion requires you to appropriate those supplies.",o="收集悲惨者的拾荒物资与石拳补给品。",oEN="Collect Wretched Scavenged Goods and Boulderfish Provisions."}
Q[982008]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n穿过那座桥，猎杀希尔瓦纳外围的林间潜伏猞猁与妖精龙，把那些美味的肉带回来给我！",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nTravel across the bridge and hunt the Grovestalker Lynx and Fey Drake outside Sylvanaar and bring me back that delicious meat!",o="收集妖精肉排与猞猁肉排。",oEN="Collect Fey Steaks and Lync Steaks."}
Q[982009]={d="我的斥候报告部落与联盟之间发生了小规模冲突。你奉命阻止任何一方在冲突区域达成目标。\n\n部落天生拥有连我都不得不敬畏的狂怒，但现在他们正试图强化那股狂怒来对抗军团！他们正在用奇美拉之血与雷神肾上腺素做实验。从蛮锤要塞外围的生物身上弄到一批储备。",dEN="My scouts report skirmishes between the Horde and Alliance. You have been commanded to prevent either faction from accomplishing their goals in the conflict area.\n\nThe Horde has a natural fury even I must respect, but now they are trying to enhance that fury to fight the Legion! They are experiementing with Chimaera blood and Thunderlord Andrenaline. Obtain a stockpile from the creatures outside Wildhammer Stronghold.",o="收集纯净的奇美拉之血与雷神肾上腺。",oEN="Collect Untainted Chimera Blood and Thunderlord Adrenal Glands."}
Q[982104]={d="征服者瓦兹希尔已被悬赏。艾瑞斯飞船站的星界财团希望我们清除潜伏在奥舒冈的恶魔，以期改善他们与纳鲁的关系。潜入奥舒冈并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Subjugator Vaz'shir. The Consortium at Aeris Landing wants us to rid Oshu'gun of the demons lurking around down there, hoping to improve their relations with the Naaru. Descend into Oshu'gun and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀征服者瓦兹希尔，并杀死奥舒冈内的恐惧卫士。",oEN="Assassinate Subjugator Vaz'shir and kill Terrorguards inside Oshu'gun.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982105]={d="星界财团已对顾问佐尔博发出悬赏。他们找到了替代的收入来源，但顾问佐尔博和其他战槌食人魔无意出售他们的黑曜石战争念珠，所以财团希望我们执行备用计划。深入欢笑颅骨废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Zorbo the Advisor by the Consortium. They have found an alternative source of income, but the Zorbo the Advisor and the other Warmaul Orgres are not interested in trading away their Obsidian Warbeads, so the Consortium want us to execute the backup plan. Venture into the Laughing Skull Ruins and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀顾问佐尔博以及欢笑颅骨废墟中的战槌食人魔。",oEN="Assassinate Zorbo the Advisor and the Warmaul Ogres in Laughing Skull Ruins.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982106]={d="龙喉氏族已对暮光岭的暗影议会死影教徒发出悬赏。他们希望我们阻止暗影议会稳定暮光岭上的传送门。穿过恐惧熔炉营与仇恨熔炉营之间的恶魔传送门前往暮光岭，杀死死影教徒，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Deathshadow Cultists of the Shadow Council at Twilight Ridge by the Dragonmaw Clan. They want us to stop the Shadow Council from stabilizing the portal found on the Twilight Ridge. Venture to the Twilight Ridge through the Demonic Gateway between Forge Camp: Fear and Forge Camp: Hate and slay the Deathshadow Cultists, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死暮光岭的死影教徒。",oEN="Kill the Deathshadow Cultists at Twilight Ridge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982107]={d="熔炉营的监工已被悬赏。受难者奥图里斯需要帮助，以阻止仇恨熔炉营与恐惧熔炉营的恶魔打造强大的武器并进一步深入纳格兰。突袭恐惧熔炉营与仇恨熔炉营并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Forge Camp Overseers. Altruis the Sufferer needs help to prevent the demons in Forge Camp: Hate and Forge Camp: Fear from building powerful weapons and advancing further into Nagrand. Assault Forge Camp: Fear and Forge Camp: Hate and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死仇恨熔炉营与恐惧熔炉营的熔炉营监工及其追随者。",oEN="Slay Forge Camp Overseers and their followers in Forge Camp: Hate and Forge Camp: Fear.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982112]={d="萨布拉金男爵已对格鲁尔巢穴外居住的刃喉食人魔发出悬赏。在巢穴中挑战格鲁尔绝非可以轻率对待的战斗。萨布拉金希望我们帮助他击败屠龙者及其军队。前往刀锋山领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Bladespire Ogres that dwell outside Gruul's Lair by Baron Sablemane. Challenging Gruul in his lair is not a fight to be taken lightly. Sablemane wants us to help him in defeating the Dragonslayer and his forces. Travel to Blade's Edge Mountain and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="刺杀格鲁尔巢穴外的刃喉食人魔。",oEN="Assassinate the Bladespire Ogres outside Gruul's Lair.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982113]={d="常青林的塞纳里奥远征队已对驯犬大师贝尔蒙及其爪牙发出悬赏。是时候把死亡之门狠狠关上，挡住从中涌出的愤怒猎犬了！前往死亡之门领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Baelmon the Hound-Master and his minions by the Cenarion Expedition in Evergrove. It's time to slam Death's Door shut on the Wrath Hounds pouring through it! Travel to Death's Door and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="在死亡之门处决驯犬大师贝尔蒙及其爪牙。",oEN="Execute Baelmon the Hound-Master and his minions in Death's Door.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982114]={d="奥格瑞拉与沙塔尔天空卫队已对漩涡尖塔顶部的恶魔与野生动物发出悬赏。他们需要我们帮忙让营地更安全。前往漩涡尖塔领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the demons and wildlife atop the Vortex Pinnacle by the Ogri'la and Shattari Skyguard. They need our assistance to make their camps safer. Travel to the Vortex Pinnacle and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭漩涡尖塔顶部的深渊烈焰使者、碎皮野猪与愤怒猎犬。",oEN="Destroy the Abyssal Flamebringes, Shard-Hide Boars and Wrath Hounds atop the Vortex Pinnacle.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982115]={d="乌鸦林中出了极其糟糕的事。居住在格里什纳斯的鸦人及其黑暗魔法，最可能是肆虐森林的邪恶之源。洗劫村庄，杀死住在那里面的鸦人，并击败他们的女族长。前往刀锋山领取赏金。不过要小心，你并不是唯一追寻这份赏金的英雄，而战利品属于胜者。",dEN="Something is terribly wrong in Raven's Wood. The Arakkoa that reside in Grishnath and their dark magics are the most likely source of the evil plaguing the woods. Raid the village, slaughter the Arakkoa that live there and defeat their Matriarch! Travel to Blade's Edge Mountain and collect the bounty. Be cautious though, you are not the only Hero seeking this bounty, and to the victor go the spoils.",o="领取格里什纳蔑鸦、格里什纳先驱者与格里什纳女族长的赏金。",oEN="Collect the bounty on Grishna Scorncrows, Grishna Harbingers and the Grishna Matriarch.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982120]={d="星界财团已对生态圆顶内陆的野生动物发出悬赏。为防止种群数量过大以致生态圆顶无力承载，必须处理掉其中一些动物。前往生态圆顶内陆并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the wildlife inside Eco-Dome Midrealm by the Consortium. To prevent the population from becoming too big for the eco-dome to handle, some of the animals have to be dealt with. Travel to Eco-Dome Midrealm and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="猎杀生态圆顶内陆的野生动物。",oEN="Hunt down the wildlife inside Eco-Dome Midrealm.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982121]={d="星界财团已对法兰伦巨人发出悬赏。原始法兰石已在财团的客户中大受欢迎，他们希望我们替他们放倒这些巨人，好弄到更多。前往虚空石并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Farahlon Giants by the Consortium. Raw Farahlite has already proven popular with the Consortium's clients, and they want us to fell the giants for them so they can get their hands on more. Travel to Netherstone and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死虚空石的裂石者与法兰伦破石者。",oEN="Slay Cragskaar and the Farahlon Breakers in Netherstone.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982122]={d="星界财团已对特雷利姆矿坑与泽昂升降机井的居民发出悬赏。自从血精灵失去奥术法力熔炉下方的矿坑后，特雷利姆矿坑就成了他们维持熔炉运转的唯一材料来源。不用说，进一步瘫痪他们的采矿作业对财团来说是件好事，但他们已经开始盘算着进驻并据为己有。前往法力熔炉阿拉下方的特雷利姆矿坑与法力熔炉奥术下方的泽昂升降机井并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the inhabitants of Trellium Mine and Access Shaft Zeon by the Consortium. Ever since the bloodelfs lost the mine underneath Manaforge Ultris, Trellium Mine is where their sole supply of material for running the forges is coming from. Needless to say, it would be a boon for the Consortium to cripple their mining operation further, but they have started having ambitions of moving in and take them over for themselves. Travel to Trellium Mine below Manaforge Ara and Access Shaft Zeon below Manaforge Ultris and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="清剿法力熔炉阿拉下方的特雷利姆矿坑以及法力熔炉奥术下方的泽昂升降机井。",oEN="Clear out the Trellium Mine below Manaforge Ara and Access Shaft Zeon below Manaforge Ultris.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982123]={d="一位富有的赞助人已对法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队发出悬赏。上面没有写明动机，但对抗炎怒军团真的还需要理由吗？摧毁法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队。杀死他们的士兵，刺杀他们的首领！前往法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu by a wealthy benefactor. There is no motive listed, but do you really need one to fight the Sunfury? Lay waste to the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu. Kill their soldiers and assassinate their leadership! Travel to Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="歼灭法力熔炉杜罗与法力熔炉科鲁的军队。",oEN="Lay waste to the forces in Manaforge Duro and Manaforge Coruu.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982128]={d="影月谷的居民已对盘牙蓄水池的纳迦发出悬赏。在影月谷，水非常宝贵，补给线的维持又十分昂贵，因此控制这里仅有的那点水源至关重要。前往盘牙蓄水池并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Naga in Coilskar Cistern by the inhabitants of Shadowmoon Valley. Water is valuable in Shadowmoon Valley and supply lines expensive to maintain, therefore it is important to control the little water that is already here. Travel to Coilskar Cistern and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭盘牙蓄水池的纳迦。",oEN="Exterminate the Naga in Coilskar Cistern.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982129]={d="死亡熔炉的暗影议会成员已被悬赏。暗影议会不断用他们的地狱火攻击我们。杀死守卫，屠杀死亡熔炉召唤者并收集他们的扭曲灵魂碎片，然后从召唤者斯卡塔克斯手中夺得死亡熔炉召唤法杖。前往死亡熔炉并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the The Shadow Council members at The Deathforge. The Shadowcouncil keeps attacking us with their infernals, Kill the Guardians, Slaughter the Deathforge Summoners and collect their Twisted Soul Shards, then obtain the Deathforge Summoning Staff from Summoner Skartax. Travel to The Deathforge and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="突袭死亡熔炉。杀死死亡熔炉守卫，并收集召唤者斯卡塔克斯的法杖及其召唤者身上的扭曲灵魂碎片。",oEN="Assault the Deathforge. Slay the Deathforge Guardians, and collect Summoner Skartax's staff and Twisted Soul Shards from his summoners.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982130]={d="卡拉波废墟的恶魔猎手大师已被悬赏。召集一队英雄，杀死那些负责训练恶魔猎手新兵的大师。伊利达雷从不缺新兵，但有能力训练他们的恶魔猎手却十分稀缺。前往卡拉波废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the master Demon Hunters in the Ruins of Karabor. Gather a group of Heroes and slay the masters responsible for training the Demon Hunter initiates. The Illidari have no shortage of recruits, but the Demon Hunters capable of training them are in short supply. Travel to the Ruins of Karabor and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="击败卡拉波废墟的恶魔猎手大师。",oEN="Defeat the master Demon Hunters in the Ruins of Karabor.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982131]={d="灵翼龙族已对灵翼浮岛的龙喉兽人发出悬赏。龙喉邪兽人占领了灵翼浮岛，并建起营地用作被奴役的虚空幼龙的繁殖场。这片土地曾属于灵翼龙族，他们想要夺回来。前往灵翼浮岛并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Dragonmaw Orcs at the Netherwing Ledge by the Netherwing. The Dragonmaw fel orcs have taken over Netherwing Ledge, and build a camp to use as a breeding area for the enslaved nether drakes.This land was once held by the Netherwing dragonflight and they want it back.Travel to the Netherwing Ledge and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="屠杀灵翼浮岛的龙喉苦工以及监督他们的龙喉晋升者。",oEN="Slaughter the Dragonmaw Peons and the Dragonmaw Ascendants overseeing them at the Netherwing Ledge",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982232]={d="灵魂平原上采集奥舒冈水晶的维尔安尼已被悬赏。艾瑞斯飞船站的星界财团不喜欢其他虚灵的竞争。杀死维尔安尼，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Vir'aani gathing Oshu'gun crystals in the Spirit Fields. The Consortium at Aeris Landing doesn't like competition from other Ethereals. Slay the Vir'aani, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭奥舒冈外的维尔安尼虚灵。",oEN="Eliminate the Vir'aani ethereals outside Oshu'gun.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982233]={d="星界财团已对灵魂平原的虚空孽生者发出悬赏。虚空孽生者对艾瑞斯飞船站的虚灵构成安全威胁，因为他们想尽可能靠近奥舒冈。前往灵魂平原并消灭虚空孽生者，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Voidspawns in the Spirit Fields by the Consortium. The Voidspawn poses a security risk for the Ethereals at Aeris Landing, as they wanted to be as close as possible to Oshu'gun. Travel to the Spirit Fields and exterminate the Voidspawn, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死奥舒冈外的虚空孽生者。",oEN="Slay Voidspawn outside Oshu'gun.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982234]={d="北风裂谷与南风裂谷的石拳氏族已被悬赏。前往他们的土丘杀死那些食人魔，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Boulderfist Clan at Northwind Cleft and Southwind Cleft. Go to to their mounds and slay the ogres, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死南风裂谷与北风裂谷的石拳食人魔。",oEN="Kill the Boulderfist Ogres at Northwind Cleft and Southwind Cleft.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982235]={d="哈兰下方的淤泥孽生者已被悬赏。大地之环需要我们摧毁淤泥孽生者，以免环境遭到污染。前往哈兰下方的水域并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Muck Spawn below Halaa. The Earthen Ring need us to destroy the Spawn of Muck to avoid contaminating the enviroment. Head to the waters below Halaa and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭哈兰下方的淤泥孽生者。",oEN="Exterminate the Muck Spawn below Halaa.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982236]={d="日泉岗哨的日泉居民已被悬赏。暗血部族正在给纳格兰的所有人制造麻烦，是时候终结他们了。前往日泉岗哨并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on Sunspring Residents at Sunspring Post. The Murkblood tribe is causing trouble for everyone in Nagrand, it's time to put and end to them. Head to Sunspring Post and claim the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭日泉岗哨的暗血部族。",oEN="Exterminate the Murkbloods at Sunspring Post.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982237]={d="常青林的德鲁伊们已对鲁安林地中的鸦人与黑翼龙教徒发出悬赏。他们凭借黑暗魔法与对野生动物的偷猎，对德鲁伊们的努力构成严重威胁。前往鲁安林地并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Arakkoa and Blackwing Wyrmcultists in Ruuan Weald by the Druids at Evergrove. They pose a grave threat to the efforts of the Druids, with their dark magic and the poaching the natural wildlife. Travel to Ruuan Weald and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在鲁安林地的鲁安诺克鸦人与黑翼龙教徒。",oEN="Kill the Ruuan'ok Arakkoa and the Blackwing Wyrmcultists living in Ruuan Weald.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982238]={d="血槌峡谷的血槌食人魔已被悬赏。虽然血槌食人魔并非群山中实力最强的氏族——他们没有获得名为屠龙者格鲁尔的格隆的青睐——但实力紧随其后。既然我们已经清理了刃喉，是时候把目光转向他们的对手了。前往血槌峡谷并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Bloodmaul Ogres in Bloodmaul Canyon. While the Bloodmaul ogres are not the strongest clan in the mountains, not having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, they run a close second. Now that we've dealt with winnowing the Bladespire, it is time to turn our eye upon their rivals. Travel to Bloodmaul Canyon and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在血槌峡谷的血槌食人魔。",oEN="Slay the Bloodmaul Ogre residing in Bloodmaul Canyon.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982239]={d="歌唱山脊的次级虚空幼龙与水晶剥皮者已被悬赏。前往乌鸦林并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Lesser Nether Drake and Crystal Flayer residing in Singing Ridge. Travel to Ravens Wood and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭居住在歌唱山脊的次级虚空幼龙与水晶剥皮者。",oEN="Exterminate the Lesser Nether Drake and Crystal Flayer residing in Singing Ridge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982240]={d="常青林的德鲁伊们已对维克面纱的鸦人发出悬赏。多年来他们一直安分无害，但有什么东西惊动了他们，如今他们随身携带水晶，并将其用于某种黑暗的目的。这些水晶的用途尚不为人知，但我们必须在吃到苦头之前阻止他们。前往维克面纱并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Arakkoa in Veil Vekh by the Druids at Evergrove. They have been benign for many years, but now something has stirred them and they carry crystals with them now, which they have turned to some dark purpose. It is not known what the purpose of these crystals is yet, but we need to stop them before we learn it the hard way. Travel to Veil Vekh and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在维克面纱的鸦人。",oEN="Kill the Arakkoa residing in Veil Vekh.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982241]={d="巨石莫克食人魔与黑翼龙教徒已被悬赏。我们必须抓住任何机会打击这些山中的食人魔，否则他们终将压垮我们。至于黑翼龙教徒，他们正与巨石莫克食人魔交战，而我们不想用一个麻烦替换另一个，所以把他们也一并除掉。前往乌鸦林并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Boulder'mok Ogres and the Blackwing Wyrmcultists. We must take any chance we can get to strike down the ogres of these mountains, or they will overrun us. As for the Wyrmcultists, they are at war with the Boulder'mok Ogres, and we don't want to REPLACE one problem with another, so get rid of them as well. Travel to Ravens Wood and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭居住在乌鸦林的巨石莫克食人魔与黑翼龙教徒。",oEN="Finish the Boulder'mok Ogre and Blackwing Wyrmcultists residing in Raven's Wood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982242]={d="致所有有意者：诚聘承包商，提供稀有工程零件的安全获取服务。是否遵守适用的法律法规可自行决定。必须热情积极，具备10年客户服务经验，有处理脏活的经验者优先（非必需）。主动性是必备条件。\n\n死活不论：18名甘尔葛工程师，8名莫尔葛末日铁匠\n\n——此致敬礼\n星界财团",dEN="Attention all interested: Contractors sought for secure acquisition services of rare engineering parts. Compliance with applicable regulations and laws optional. Must be enthusiastic, 10 years customer service experience, wetwork experience optional. Initiative is a must.\n\nWanted Dead or Alive: 18 Gan'arg Engineers, 8 Mo'arg Doomsmiths\n\n-Regards\nThe Consortium",o="杀死甘尔葛工程师与莫尔葛末日铁匠",oEN="Slay the Gan'arg Engineers and Mo'arg Doomsmiths",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982243]={d="星界财团已对法兰伦废墟中的恶魔发出悬赏。财团想夺回恐惧魔王库鲁萨斯的晶核供自己使用，但首先需要有人替他们清出一条路。前往法兰伦废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the demons in the Ruins of Farahlon by the Consortium. The Consortium wishes to retrieve the crystal of the dreadlord Culuthas for their own use, but first they need someone to clear the path. Travel to Ruins of Farahlon and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="向居住在法兰伦废墟的库鲁萨斯之犬与库鲁萨斯之眼复仇。",oEN="Exact revenge on the Hound of Culuthas and Eye of Culuthas residing in the Ruins of Farahlon.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982244]={d="星界财团已对居住在废料堆的萨克希斯虚灵发出悬赏。萨克希斯虚灵从财团中分裂出去，正在分流财团的生意与贸易。故事就从这里开始。他们希望我们追捕并消灭这些叛徒。前往废料堆并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Zaxxis Ethereals residing in The Heap by the Consortium. The Zaxxis etherials split off from the Consortium and is siphoning off business and trade from the Consortium. This is where you enter the story. They want us to hunt down and exterminate the traitors. Travel to The Heap and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="杀死居住在废料堆的萨克希斯虚灵。",oEN="Slay the Zaxxis Ethereals residing in The Heap.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982245]={d="虚空风暴的血精灵与星界财团之间的生意……出了问题。更糟的是，炎怒军团一直在大量招募人手。他们在准备着什么可怕的东西，我能感觉到。你可以与星界财团一起帮助沙塔斯城的纳鲁，侦察那片区域并削减他们的人数。至少这能拖延他们正在筹备的阴谋，直到我们的特工查明真相。发现任何情况都回来向我汇报。\n\n哦，如果你在那边看到其他英雄，为保险起见，就假定他们与炎怒军团勾结，并确保他们的人数也同样被削减。",dEN="Business between the blood elves of netherstorm and the consortium have gone.....awry. To make matters worse, the Sunfury have been recruiting en masse. They are preparing something awful, I can feel it. You can help the Naaru of Shattrath along with The Consortium by scouting out there and thinning their numbers. In the very least this will delay whatever machinations they have been preparing for until our agents can get to the bottom of this. Report back here with whatever you've found.\n\nOh and if you see other heroes out there, to be on the safe side assume they are in league with the sunfury and see to it they are thinned as well.",o="杀死居住在法力熔炉布纳尔的炎怒血精灵。",oEN="Kill the Sunfury Blood Elves residing in Manaforge B'naar.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982246]={d="52区的地精已对居住在恩卡特废墟的无实体德莱尼与居住在阿克隆废墟的阿克隆恶魔发出悬赏。有这么多生物想要他们的命，他们很难为火箭收集材料。前往恩卡特废墟与阿克隆废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Disembodied Draenei residing in the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Demons residing in Arklon Ruins by the goblins at Area 52. It is hard for them to gather materials for their rocket with so many beings wanting them dead. Travel to the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Ruins and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="消灭恩卡特废墟的无实体德莱尼与阿克隆废墟的阿克隆恶魔。",oEN="Slay the Disembodied Draenei in the Ruins of Enkaat and the Arklon Demons in Arklon Ruins.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982247]={d="巴里废墟的灰舌破碎者与伊利达雷监工已被悬赏。伊利丹已命令灰舌部族在该地区挖掘古代德莱尼神器——据传它们藏着卡拉波神殿（如今被称为黑暗神殿）的秘密。前往巴里废墟并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Ashtongue Broken and Illidari Overseers in the Ruins of Baa'ri. The Ashtongue has been ordered by Illidan to excavate the area for ancient Draenei artifacts that are rumored to hold the secrets of the Temple of Karabor, now known as the Black Temple. Travel to the Ruins of Baa'ri and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="巴里废墟的灰舌破碎者与伊利达雷监工。",oEN="Ashtongue Broken and Illidari Overseers in the Ruins of Baa'ri.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982248]={d="伊利丹统率的盘牙部队已侵占了影月谷的北部。\n在整个外域，伊利丹有许多部队需要我们应对，而没有哪支比盘牙更狡诈。\n海妖仍在蛊惑我们的部队，已造成大量伤亡，她们的赏金已经到手。\n他们占据了北方的古代德莱尼废墟，并将那片土地据为己有，即盘牙哨站。\n前往那里寻找海妖，终结她们的巫术。",dEN="The Coilskar forces Illidan commands have infested the northern part of Shadowmoon Valley.\nIllidan has many forces for us to deal with throughout Outland and none are more cunning than the Coilskar.\nThe Sirens continue to bewitch our forces and have caused many casualities, their bounty has been earnt.\nThey have claimed the ancient Draneii ruins to the north and have claimed that ground Coilskar Point.\nTravel there and seek the Sirens, put an end to their sorcery.",o="杀死居住在盘牙哨站的盘牙海妖。",oEN="Slay the Coilskar Sirens residing in Coilskar Point.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982249]={d="影月谷栖息着外域有史以来最腐化的邪能物种。\n尽管那里的敌人从不短缺，但邪能野猪与邪火双帆龙已被证明是棘手的野兽，是时候对付它们了。\n影月谷中部火山形成的熔岩池是邪火双帆龙的家园，而邪能野猪则在谷中四处游荡。\n去那里杀死这些野兽，帮忙再消除一个在那里威胁着我们的危险。",dEN="Shadowmoon Valley holds some of the most foul fel-tainted species ever seen in Outland.\nAlthough there is no shortage of enemies there the Felboar and Felfire Diemetradons have proven to be troublesome beasts, the time has come for them to be dealt with.\nThe lava pools that have been formed from volcano in the middle of Shadowmoon are home to the Felfire Diemetradons and the Felboars roam throughout the valley.\nGo there and slay theses beasts, help remove one more danger that threatens us there.",o="杀死居住在熔岩平原的邪火双帆龙与邪能野猪。",oEN="Slaughter the Felfire Diemetradons and Felboars residing in the Magma Fields.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982250]={d="伊利达雷哨站的伊利达雷恶魔已被悬赏。伊利达雷哨站是伊利丹忠诚恶魔的集结地，我们必须在他们变得更强大之前除掉他们。前往伊利达雷哨站并领取赏金，但小心，<name>，你并不是唯一接受这份契约的冒险者。你必须做好准备，在狩猎中与竞争者一较高下！",dEN="A bounty has been placed on the Illidari Demons residing in Illidari Point. Illidari Point is a staging ground for Illidan's loyal demons, and we have to take them out before they become even stronger. Travel to Illidari Point and collect the bounty, but beware <name>, you are not the only adventurer to accept this contract. You should be prepared to fight the competition on your hunt!",o="终结居住在伊利达雷哨站的伊利达雷恶魔。",oEN="Put an end to the Illidari Demons residing in Illidari Point.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982251]={d="龙喉要塞是影月谷龙喉兽人的集结地。\n他们在那里奴役幼龙为其效命，并在祖鲁希德的邪恶号令下，把它当作他们在此地大部分活动的基地。\n前往灵翼平原，你就会看到那座高耸于群山之间的雄伟要塞。\n杀死你在那里看到的任何龙喉兽人，确保我们要对付的敌人又少一个。",dEN="Dragonmaw Fortress acts as a staging ground for the Dragonmaw Orcs in Shadowmoon Valley.\nThey enslave the drakes to do their bidding there and use it as a base for most of their activies here under the vile bidding of Zuluhed.\nHead to the Netherwing Fields and you will see the towering fortress standing against the mountains.\nKill any Dragonmaw you see there and make sure there is one less enemy for us to deal with.",o="杀死居住在龙喉要塞的龙喉兽人。",oEN="Slay the Dragonmaw Orcs residing in Dragonmaw Fortress.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[982255]={d="嘿，你！巫医。我需要你的帮助。\n\n巫毒大师肖金来到村里后教了我很多东西。我需要从回音群岛弄些材料，才能继续练习他传授给我的药剂。我在这里太忙了，脱不开身；也许你替我弄到这些东西，我就能把从他那里学到的一些东西分享给你？\n\n你可以在回音群岛的迅猛龙身上找到石质箭头，在老虎身上找到褪色獠牙，在碎浪爬行者身上找到干净的鱼骨。祝你好运，请务必快点！",dEN="Hey you! Witch Doctor! I need your help.\n\nVoodoomaster Sho'jin has taught me much since he came to the village. I need some supplies from Echo Isles to continue practicing the remedies he has shared with me. I'm far too busy here to go myself, maybe if you get them for me, I can share with you some of what he has taught me?\n\nYou can find Stone Arrowheads in the raptors of Echo Isles, Discolored Fangs from the tigers, and Clean Fishbones from the surf crawlers. Good luck, and please hurry!",o="从回音群岛的野兽身上收集8个石质箭头、3颗褪色獠牙和1根干净的鱼骨。",oEN="Collect 8 Stone Arrowheads, 3 Discolored Fangs and 1 Clean Fishbones from the beasts of Echo Isles."}
Q[982256]={d="年轻的巫医，你在我们的技艺上展现出了极大的天赋。为了你的旅程，我想为你配备在这个世界上生存所需的工具，好让你踏上更伟大的冒险。如果你能帮我终结那个名叫玛卡斯加的家伙——他曾跟随扎拉赞恩修习禁忌之术——我就把我私人收藏中的一件强大武器送给你。你可以在从这里到提拉加德要塞之间的岩石海岸找到玛卡斯加。动作要快！",dEN="Young Witch Doctor - you show great promise in our arts. For your journeys I want to equip you with the tools that you will need to survive in this world, before you embark on greater adventures. If you can help me with bringing an end to the one they call Makasgar, who trained under Zalazane in the forbidden ways, I will give you a powerful weapon from my own personal collection. You can find Makasgar on the rocky coast between here and Tiragarde Keep. Be swift!",o="在森金村正北方的海岸杀死扎拉赞恩的学徒玛卡斯加。",oEN="Kill Zalazane's apprentice, Makasgar, on the coast just North of Sen'jin Village."}
Q[982257]={d="斯纳兹偏偏在这个时候迟到，真是倒霉！我到底付钱给他干什么？\n\n等着瞧。等我抓住他，他就会知道为什么别人叫我“圣”……啊哈！你看起来正是我现在需要的<race>。有兴趣接份活吗？\n\n斯纳兹是我在南方的探子。他的工作是盯着失落匪徒，因为我的船马上就要离港了。他已经失联了，而今天的货物价值连城。\n\n在失落匪巢附近找到斯纳兹，告诉我情况如何。如果海岸是安全的，就让他保持下去并向我汇报。",dEN="Of all the times for Snazzy to be late! What the hell am I even paying him for?\n\nJust wait. When I get my claws on him, he's gonna know why they call me The San… Ah ha! You look like just the <race> I need right now. Care for a job?\n\nSnazzy is my southern operative. His job is to keep tabs on the Lost Riggers while my boats are about to leave port. He's gone radio silent and today's cargo is worth BOAT LOADS.\n\nFind Snazzy near Lost Rigger Cove and get me a status. If the coast is clear, tell him to keep it that way and report in.",o="在失落匪巢与斯纳兹·轰轴交谈。",oEN="Speak with Snazzy Boomsprocket at Lost Rigger Cove.",c="哦，天哪，你是在找我吗？还是泽贝尔派你来的？这可不太妙，不不不，这非常糟糕。\n\n我发誓我没有偷懒。是那些该死的海巨人，他们变得暴躁起来，还抢走了我的无线电！求你了，你得理解我！",cEN="Oh man, you were lookin' for me? And Zebel sent you? That's not good, no no no, that's really bad.\n\nI swear I wasn't slackin'. It's those damn sea giants—they turned aggressive and stole my radio! Please, you gotta understand!"}
Q[982258]={d="沙丘躁动不安。\n\n当沙粒升腾并凝聚成形，那不是愤怒，而是警告。当有什么东西打破了平衡，当足迹停留过久，或是鲜血无故流淌，沙漠便会聚拢起来。\n\n你在沙丘上看到的那些移动的生物，并不是你所理解的那种元素生物。那是沙丘对入侵的回应。\n\n去面对其中一个。当它倒下时，它留下的沙子仍会因运动而温热。那就是活性之沙。只取走留下的部分。不要让它散开。不要耽搁。",dEN="The dunes are restless.\n\nWhen the sand rises and takes form, it is not anger. It is warning. The desert gathers itself when something has disturbed its balance, when footsteps linger too long or blood is spilled without reason.\n\nThose creatures you have seen moving across the dunes are not elementals in the way you understand them. They are the dunes answering intrusion.\n\nFace one of them. When it falls, the sand it leaves behind will still be warm with motion. That is living sand. Take only what remains. Do not scatter it. Do not linger.",o="杀死一个阵风漩涡并收集它的活性之沙。",oEN="Slay a Gusting Vortex and collect its Living Sand.",p=" 你取到沙丘留下的活性之沙了吗？快把它带过来。",pEN="Have you taken the living sand the dunes left behind? Bring it here, quickly.",c="['你感觉到它在抗拒你，对吧？\n\n这很好。这说明沙丘仍有力量。你带来的沙子承载着重量与记忆。它记得自己被迫变成的形状。]",cEN="You felt it resist you, did you not.\n\nThat is good. It means the dunes still have strength. The sand you brought carries weight and memory. It remembers the shape it was forced to take."}
Q[982259]={d="这根被偷来的钓鱼竿质量好得令人惊讶；肯定有人想把它要回去。\n\n你可以看到手柄上刻着首字母 E. H.。",dEN="This pilfered fishing rod seems to be of surprising quality - someone will definitely want it back.\n\nYou can see the initials E. H. carved into the handle.",o="寻找失落的钓鱼竿的主人。",oEN="Find the owner of the Lost Fishing Rod.",p="你那儿拿的是什么？",pEN="What do you have there?",c="竟然会有这种事……\n\n<埃弗拉德暗自轻笑。>\n\n谢谢你，朋友。被那些流氓拿走之后它已经不复当初的状态了，但这是我从家乡带回来的少数几样东西之一。",cEN="Of all the things...\n\n<Everard chuckles to himself.>\n\nThank you, friend. It's not in the best condition anymore after those hooligans took it, but it's one of the few things I've regained from home."}
Q[999913]={d="你知道在缺了这么多报告的情况下整理文件有多难吗？\n\n我明白归档文书这种乏味的工作不受某些人待见，但这并不意味着它不重要。\n\n我缺了我们一名巡逻兵的实地报告；他负责从哨兵岭到艾尔文森林边境的路线。替我去找他，把他的报告带回来，因为他懒得自己交。",dEN="Do you know how difficult it is to sort papers when I'm missing so many reports?\n\nI understand the tedious task of filing paperwork is unappreciated by some, but that doesn't mean it isn't important.\n\nI'm missing the field report from one of our patrollers, he walks the route from Sentinel Hill to the border of Elwynn. Find him for me, and bring me back his report since he can't be bothered to do it himself.",o="寻找失踪巡逻兵的报告。",oEN="Find the report from the missing patroller.",p="你找到他了吗……？",pEN="Did you manage to find him...?",c="这名巡逻兵已经死了，无法再带着她的情报回去见档案管理员。",cEN="The patroller has been killed and cannot return with her information to the Archivist."}
Q[999914]={d="检查尸体时，你找到了那名巡逻兵只写了一半的报告。\n\n这个必须送回哨兵岭；档案管理员会想知道发生了什么。",dEN="Upon inspecting the body, you find the patroller's half-completed report.\n\nThis should be delivered back to Sentinel Hill - the Archivist will want to know what happened.",o="把半详细报告交还给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Return the Half-Detailed Report to Archivist Selnor.",p="你找到了吗？",pEN="Did you find it?",c="哦……哦，我明白了……\n\n我早有预感，尽管我一直试图否认。我只能希望他的文件是因为疏忽或懒惰而遗失的，但得知他的遭遇远比这更加阴暗……\n\n我希望他是唯一遭遇这种命运的人。但如果你找到其他人，请带着他们的报告回来，并告知我他们的下场。现在，请原谅，我需要一个人待一会儿……",cEN="Oh... oh I see....\n\nI had a feeling, even if I tried to deny such a thing. I could only hope that his papers were missing because of carelessness, or laziness, but to know his reasons are far more grim...\n\nI hope that he was the only one who befell such a fate. But if you do find any others, please return with their reports and inform me of their fates. Now if you'll excuse me, I need a moment to myself..."}
Q[999915]={d="你在倒下的保卫者身上找到了一份染血的报告。档案管理员塞尔诺应该看看这个。",dEN="You find a bloodstained report on the fallen protector. Archivist Selnor should see this.",o="把染血的报告交给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Deliver the Bloodstained Report to Archivist Selnor."}
Q[999931]={d="羊皮纸浸透了鲜血，而它的持有者身上布满了上百道伤口。\n\n报告这名巡逻兵下落的倒霉差事落在了你身上。档案管理员塞尔诺会想看看这些纸页，并得知这名女子的死讯。",dEN="The parchment is soaked in blood, its carrier littered in a hundred cuts.\n\nThe unfortunate duty of reporting this patroller's fate falls to you. Archivist Selnor will want to see these pages and hear of the woman's death.",o="把染血的报告交给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Deliver the Bloodstained Report to Archivist Selnor.",p="希望你手里的东西不是给我的……",pEN="I hope whatever you have there isn't for me...",c="档案管理员满怀恐惧地盯着那张羊皮纸，一言不发，只是向你点头致谢，随后便回到自己的工作中。",cEN="The Archivist stares at the parchment in abject horror, completely silent as she nods her thanks to you before returning to her duties."}
Q[999932]={d="一份破损的巡逻报告，末尾记到调查詹戈洛德矿洞为止。虽然缺了几页，但关键记录揭示了一个阴暗的下场。\n\n档案管理员塞尔诺会想看看这个。",dEN="A battered patrol report ending with investigating the Jangolode Mine. Pages are missing, but key notes remain revealing a grim fate.\n\nArchivist Selnor would want to see this.",o="把失落报告交给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Deliver the Lost Report to Archivist Selnor.",p="你需要什么吗？",pEN="Did you need something?",c="又一个……？\n\n真的吗……？\n\n愿圣光保佑我们。谢谢你把这个带回来，我会确保她的牺牲不被遗忘。",cEN="Another one...?\n\nTruly...?\n\nLight preserve us. Thank you for returning this to me, I'll ensure her sacrifice is not forgotten."}
Q[999933]={d="这张羊皮纸令人作呕：上面沾满了唾液和血污。这些纸页的作者就散落在你四周，碎成一块块，已无法辨认。\n\n档案管理员塞尔诺会想看看这份报告；她会知道这是谁。",dEN="The parchment is disgusting - covered in spit and gore. The author of these papers lay in pieces all around you, unrecognizable.\n\nArchivist Selnor will want to see this report, she will know who this is.",o="把浸透唾液的报告交给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Deliver the Spit-Soaked Report to Archivist Selnor.",p="<档案管理员被你口袋里飘出的气味熏得脸色发白。>",pEN="<The Archivist blanches at the smell wafting from your pockets.>",c="恶心，但至关重要……我会尽力把它清理干净并解读出来。\n\n哪怕这是件脏活，也是我欠那位保卫者的。谢谢你。",cEN="Disgusting, but vital... I will try to clean this and decipher it as best as I can.\n\nEven if it's dirty work, I owe it to that protector. Thank you."}
Q[999934]={d="这份报告被揉成一团又遭人踩踏，就像它的持有者一样残破不堪。\n\n不过字迹仍然可以辨认。档案管理员塞尔诺会想看看这个。",dEN="This report was balled up and stomped on, battered much like its carrier.\n\nThe writing however is still legible. Archivist Selnor would want to see this.",o="把皱巴巴的报告交给档案管理员塞尔诺。",oEN="Deliver the Crumpled Report to Archivist Selnor.",p="<档案管理员惊恐地看着你。>我本希望这是一次友好的拜访……但我想我知道并非如此。",pEN="<The Archivist looks at you with dread.> I would hope this is a friendly visit... but I believe I know better than that.",c="这是刘易斯的东西……\n\n我认识他。他是个善良的人，绝不该死于那些罪犯之手。\n\n<档案管理员眼中泛起泪光。>\n\n谢谢你……谢谢你找到了他。",cEN="This belonged to Lewis...\n\nI knew him. He was a kind man who deserved much better than to die to the hands of those criminals.\n\n<The Archivist's eyes well with tears.>\n\nThank you for this... for finding him."}
Q[999935]={d="伊多娜·怀瑟需要取回那些药水。迪菲亚兄弟会袭击了一支运往哨兵岭的补给队。在他们的营地中寻找被偷走的箱子并带回来，这样我们才能救治伤员。",dEN="Idona Wyther needs those potions back. The Defias raided a supply run bound for Sentinel Hill. Find the pilfered crates at their camps and bring them back so we can tend to the wounded.",o="从西部荒野的迪菲亚营地中夺回被偷走的药水。",oEN="Recover the stolen potions from the Defias camps in Westfall."}
Q[1002013]={o="以符文大师的身份学会骑乘坐骑。",oEN="Learn to ride a mount as a Runemaster.",c="学习骑术。",cEN="Learn to ride."}
Q[1002014]={o="以符文大师的身份学会骑乘专家级坐骑。",oEN="Learn to ride expert mounts as a Runemaster.",c="学习骑术。",cEN="Learn to ride."}
Q[1004002]={d="我一直在关注你，<name>。既然你真正的潜力已经显现，终于到了该正式认识的时候了。消灭如此强大的敌人，所带来的回报远不止它们身上那点战利品。你注意到在你取得胜利的时刻，货币标签页里被授予的那枚掠夺者嘉奖了吗？\n\n我收集了一些英雄所能获得的最强大的装备。不过，这些奖赏并非免费。战利品属于胜者。",dEN="I’ve had my eye on you <name>. Now that your true potential has manifested the time has finally come for introductions. Slaying such a mighty foe has greater rewards than just the spoils they carry. Did you notice the Raider’s Commendation awarded to your currency tab after your moment of triumph?\n\nI have collected some of the most powerful gear available to heroes. These rewards do not come free however. To the victor go the spoils.",o="是时候当面认识了，<name>。你注意到在你取得胜利的时刻，货币标签页里新增的那枚掠夺者嘉奖了吗？\n\n我收集了一些英雄所能获得的最强大的装备。不过，这些奖赏并非免费。战利品属于胜者。收集更多掠夺者嘉奖，通过击败终极对手来证明你的价值，我就会打开我的宝库供你挑选。杀死团队副本首领即可收集掠夺者嘉奖。",oEN="It is about time we met in person <name>. Did you notice the Raider’s Commendation awarded to your currency tab after your moment of triumph?\n\nI have collected some of the most powerful gear available to heroes. These rewards do not come free however. To the victor go the spoils. Collect more Raider’s Commendations and prove your worth by defeating the ultimate adversaries and I will open my collection of treasures for you to pick from. Slay Raid Bosses to collect Raider’s Commendations."}
Q[1005001]={d="看来我们手上有个食人魔级别的大麻烦，这话可不是双关。前往燃烧平原处理它。\n\n我不挑，杀死裂盾石的25个那种混蛋就行。",dEN="We seem to have a real ogre of a problem on our hands, no pun intended. Head to the Burning Steppes to deal with it.\n\nI am not picky, Kill any 25 of those bastards at Dreadmaul Rock.",o="杀死燃烧平原的裂盾石的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Dreadmaul Rock in The Burning Steppes.",p="看来我们手上有个食人魔级别的大麻烦，这话可不是双关。去燃烧平原处理它。\n\n我不挑，杀死碎盾石的30个那种混蛋就行。",pEN="We seem to have a real ogre of a problem on our hands, no pun intended. Head to the Burning Steppes to deal with it.\n\nI am not picky, kill any 30 of those bastards at Dreadmaul Rock."}
Q[1005002]={d="暗誓者最近一直在闹事。前往他们在诅咒之地的主要行动基地，把他们清除掉。\n\n杀死25名教徒，然后到告示板汇报。",dEN="The Shadowsworn have been stirring up a commotion as of late. Go to their main base of operations in the Blasted Lands and snuff them out.\n\nKill any 25 of the cultists and report back to the call board.",o="杀死诅咒之地的巨蛇之环的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of The Serpent's Coil in The Blasted Lands.",p="暗誓者最近一直在闹事。前往他们在诅咒之地的主要行动基地，把他们清除掉。\n\n杀死30名教徒，然后到告示板汇报。",pEN="The Shadowsworn have been stirring up a commotion as of late. Go to their main base of operations in the Blasted Lands and snuff them out.\n\nKill any 30 of the cultists and report back to the call board."}
Q[1005003]={d="碧火萨特已经闹腾得够久了。杀死他们中的25个，然后到告示板汇报。",dEN="The Jadefire Satyrs have been playing around for long enough, Kill any 25 of them and report back to the call board.",o="杀死费伍德森林的碧火小径的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Jadefire Run in Felwood.",p="碧火萨特已经闹腾得够久了，在费伍德森林杀死他们中的三十个。\n\n让那些萨特知道游戏时间结束了，杀死他们中的30个，然后到告示板汇报。",pEN="The Jadefire Satyrs have been playing around for long enough, kill thirty of them in Felwood.\n\nShow those satyrs that play time is over, kill any 30 of them and report back to the call board."}
Q[1005004]={d="黑石兽人一直在给我们找麻烦，让我们打他们最痛的地方，换个花样主动出击。\n\n消灭他们中的30个，然后到告示板汇报，还有，英雄……别被抓到。",dEN="The Blackrock orcs have been giving us trouble, lets hit them where it hurts and go on the offensive for a change.\n\nTake out 30 of them and report back to the call board, and, hero... Dont get caught?",o="杀死燃烧平原的黑石要塞的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of The Blackrock Stronghold in the Burning Steppes.",p="黑石兽人一直在给我们找麻烦，让我们打他们最痛的地方，换个花样主动出击。\n\n消灭他们中的30个，然后到告示板汇报，还有，英雄……别被抓到。",pEN="The Blackrock orcs have been giving us trouble, lets hit them where it hurts and go on the offensive for a change.\n\nTake out 30 of them and report back to the call board, and, hero... Dont get caught?"}
Q[1005005]={d="那些矮人和他们的机器已经烦了我们一阵子，而且他们只会越来越强。让我们杀杀他们的威风。\n\n杀死三十个矮人或他们的造物。还有，英雄，个头并不代表一切……别小看他们。",dEN="Those dwarves and their machines have been giving us trouble for a little while now and they are only getting stronger. Let's knock them down a notch.\n\nKill any thirty of the dwarves or their creations. And, hero, size isn't everything... Don't underestimate them.",o="杀死燃烧平原的索瑞森废墟的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of The Ruins of Thaurissan in The Burning Steppes.",p="那些矮人和他们的机器已经烦了我们一阵子，而且他们只会越来越强。让我们杀杀他们的威风。\n\n杀死三十个矮人或他们的造物。还有，英雄，个头并不代表一切……别小看他们。",pEN="Those dwarves and their machines have been giving us trouble for a little while now and they are only getting stronger. Let's knock them down a notch.\n\nKill any thirty of the dwarves or their creations. And, hero, size isn't everything... Don't underestimate them."}
Q[1005006]={d="瘟疫林的天灾军团正以惊人的速度繁殖，是时候控制一下种群了。\n\n如果你想帮忙，杀多少都随你。但我只为30次击杀付钱。杀够了就到告示板汇报。",dEN="The scourge at Plaguewood are multiplying at an alarming rate, it is time for some population control.\n\nIf you want to do the service, you can kill as many as you want. But, I am only paying you for 30 kills. Report back to the call board when you have had your fill.",o="杀死东瘟疫之地的瘟疫林的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Plaguewood in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="瘟疫林的天灾军团正以惊人的速度繁殖，是时候控制一下种群了。\n\n如果你想帮忙，杀多少都随你。但我只为30次击杀付钱。杀够了就到告示板汇报。",pEN="The scourge at Plaguewood are multiplying at an alarming rate, it is time for some population control.\n\nIf you want to do the service, you can kill as many as you want. But, I am only paying you for 30 killls. Report back to the call board when you have had your fill."}
Q[1005007]={d="祖玛沙尔那些巨魔一直在东瘟疫之地抓我们的人当食物。是时候报仇了。\n\n杀死祖玛沙尔的三十个巨魔。另外，如果之前没提过的话，他们可能会吃掉你，也可能不会，所以别被抓到。",dEN="Those trolls up at Zul'Mashar have been taking some of our men in The Eastern Plaguelands for food. It's time for pay back.\n\nKill any thirty of the trolls at Zul'Mashar. And, Incase it wasnt mentioned earlier, they may or may not eat you, so, don't get caught.",o="杀死东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Zul'Mashar in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="祖玛沙尔那些巨魔一直在东瘟疫之地抓我们的人当食物。是时候报仇了。\n\n杀死祖玛沙尔的三十个巨魔。另外，如果之前没提过的话，他们可能会吃掉你，也可能不会，所以别被抓到。",pEN="Those trolls up at Zul'mashar have been taking some of our men in The Eastern Plaguelands for food. It's time for pay back.\n\nKill any thirty of the trolls at Zul'mashar. And, Incase it wasnt mentioned earlier, they may or may not eat you, so, don't get caught."}
Q[1005008]={d="剧毒林地的天灾军团似乎变得异常强大；也许他们正在使用某种新的扭曲魔法。但是，你知道他们怎么说的：先动手，后思考。你介意帮我干掉他们中的一些吗？\n\n杀死剧毒林地的25个居民。我不会阻止你杀更多，但我只为30次击杀付钱。",dEN="The scourge in The Noxious Glade seem to be growing abnormally strong, perhaps they are utilizing some kind of new, twisted magic. But, you know what they say, act first, think later. Would you mind taking down a few of them for me?\n\nKill any 25 of the denizens of The Noxious Glade. I won't stop you from killing more, but I will only be paying you for 30.",o="杀死东瘟疫之地的剧毒林地的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of The Noxious Glade in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="剧毒林地的天灾军团似乎变得异常强大；也许他们正在使用某种新的扭曲魔法。但是，你知道他们怎么说的：先动手，后思考。你介意帮我干掉他们中的一些吗？\n\n杀死剧毒林地的30个居民。我不会阻止你杀更多，但我只为30次击杀付钱。",pEN="The scourge in The Noxious Glade seem to be growing abnormally strong, perhaps they are utilizing some kind of new, twisted magic. But, you know what they say, act first, think later. Would you mind taking down a few of them for me?\n\nKill any 30 of the denizens of The Noxious Glade. I won't stop you from killing more, but I will only be paying you for 30."}
Q[1005009]={d="安多哈尔废墟被天灾军团控制得太久了，是时候夺回属于我们的东西了。\n\n血色十字军显然不知道自己在那边干什么，是时候由我们来接管了。等你削减了天灾军团的队伍之后再回来。",dEN="The Ruins of Andorhal has been under scourge control for long enough, it is time to take back what is ours.\n\nThe Scarlet clearly don't know what they are doing there, it is time for us to take charge. Come back to be after you have put a dent in the scourge's ranks.",o="杀死西瘟疫之地的安多哈尔废墟的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of The Ruins of Andorhal in The Western Plaguelands.",p="安多哈尔废墟被天灾军团控制得太久了，是时候夺回属于我们的东西了。\n\n血色十字军显然不知道自己在那边干什么，是时候由我们来接管了。等你削减了天灾军团的队伍之后再回来。",pEN="The Ruins of Andorhal has been under scourge control for long enough, it is time to take back what is ours.\n\nThe Scarlet clearly don't know what they are doing there, it is time for us to take charge. Come back to be after you have put a dent in the scourge's ranks."}
Q[1005010]={d="亡灵正以他们邪恶的存在玷污乌瑟尔之墓及周边地区。他们必须被消灭。\n\n在这种情况下，逝者怎么可能安息？清除那里的亡灵，然后到告示板汇报。",dEN="Undead soil Uther's Tomb and the surrounding area with their unholy presence. They must be exterminated.\n\nHow can the dead be expected to rest in such a situation, clear out the living dead there and report back to the call board.",o="杀死西瘟疫之地的悔恨岭的25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Sorrow Hill in The Western Plaguelands.",p="亡灵正以他们邪恶的存在玷污乌瑟尔之墓及周边地区。他们必须被消灭。\n\n在这种情况下，逝者怎么可能安息？清除那里的亡灵，然后到告示板汇报。",pEN="Undead soil Uther's Tomb and the surrounding area with their unholy presence. They must be exterminated.\n\nHow can the dead be expected to rest in such a situation, clear out the living dead there and report back to the call board."}
Q[1005011]={d="英雄，作为冬天来说是不是有点太热了？我听说火羽山的火元素就是原因。但那很荒唐，对吧？毕竟只是个传言。不过杀掉一些也不会有坏处，对吧？\n\n总之，杀个三十来只，看看会不会有什么变化。倒不是说真会发生什么！我只是说，这不会有坏处，对吧？好吧，也许对你来说会有……",dEN="Isn't it a bit warm for winter hero? I hear that the fire elementals at Fire Plume Ridge are the cause. But thats silly, right? It's just a rumor after all. But it wouldnt hurt to kill a few of them right?\n\nAnyways, just kill about thirty of them and lets see if anything changes. Not that it would! I just mean, it couldn't hurt, right? Well maybe it would for you....",o="杀死安戈洛环形山的火羽山的任意25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'goro Crater.",p="英雄，作为冬天来说是不是有点太热了？我听说火羽山的火元素就是原因。但那很荒唐，对吧？毕竟只是个传言。不过杀掉一些也不会有坏处，对吧？\n\n总之，杀个三十来只，看看会不会有什么变化。倒不是说真会发生什么！我只是说，这不会有坏处，对吧？好吧，也许对你来说会有……",pEN="Isn't it a bit warm for winter hero? I hear that the fire elementals at Fire Plume Ridge are the cause. But thats silly, right? It's just a rumor after all. But it wouldnt hurt to kill a few of them right?\n\nAnyways, just kill about thirty of them and lets see if anything changes. Not that it would! I just mean, it couldn't hurt, right? Well maybe it would for you...."}
Q[1005012]={d="看来我们在加德纳尔有点恶魔方面的麻烦。你介意替我们解决一下吗？\n\n杀死那里三十个教徒或恶魔；在我眼里，他们都是一样的。",dEN="It seems we have a bit of a demonic problem in Jaedenar. Would you mind fixing it for us?\n\nKill any thirty of the cultists or demons there, they are all the same in my eyes.",o="杀死费伍德森林的加德纳尔的任意25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Jaedenar in Felwood.",p="看来我们在加德纳尔有点恶魔方面的麻烦。你介意替我们解决一下吗？\n\n杀死那里三十个教徒或恶魔；在我眼里，他们都是一样的。",pEN="It seems we have a bit of a demonic problem in Jaedenar. Would you mind fixing it for us?\n\nKill any thirty of the cultists or demons there, they are all the same in my eyes."}
Q[1005013]={d="魔爪部族一直在袭击往返冬泉谷路上的商人。是时候让他们安分点了。\n\n等你杀死了那里的三十个熊怪之后再回来找我。",dEN="The Felpaw have been attacking traders on the roads to and from Winterspring. It is time to put them in their place.\n\nJust come back to me after you have killed thirty of the Furbolgs there.",o="杀死费伍德森林的魔爪村的任意25个居民。",oEN="Kill any 25 of the denizens of Felpaw Village in Felwood.",p="魔爪部族一直在袭击往返冬泉谷路上的商人。是时候让他们安分点了。\n\n等你杀死了那里的三十个熊怪之后再回来找我。",pEN="The Felpaw have been attacking traders on the roads to and from Winterspring. It is time to put them in their place.\n\nJust come back to me after you have killed thirty of the Furbolgs there."}
Q[1005029]={d="注意，英雄们！\n\n天灾军团及其教徒自天而降！击败天灾入侵者，然后回来领取你的奖励。",dEN="Attention all Heroes!\n\nThe Scourge and their cultists descend from the skies! Defeat the Scourge invaders and come back for your reward.",o="保卫艾泽拉斯，抵御天灾军团。",oEN="Defend Azeroth against the Scourge.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1005030]={d="工人权益这，工人权益那。\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这或许是卑微的活计，但矿场里的农民已经组建了工会并宣布罢工。这是个非常棘手的局面，而我们的工期又催得很紧。\n\n收集 20 块铜矿。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Workers rights this, workers rights that.\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but the peasants in the mines formed a union and went on strike. This is a very delicate situation, and we have deadlines to meet.\n\nCollect 20 Copper Ores. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 20 块铜矿。",oEN="Collect 20 Copper Ores.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
