Q[1005040]={d="工人权益这，工人权益那。\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这或许是卑微的活计，但矿场里的农民已经组建了工会并宣布罢工。这是个非常棘手的局面，而我们的工期又催得很紧。\n\n收集 10 块小黑曜石碎块。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Workers rights this, workers rights that.\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but the peasants in the mines formed a union and went on strike. This is a very delicate situation, and we have deadlines to meet.\n\nCollect 10 Small Obsidian Shards. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 块小黑曜石碎块。",oEN="Collect 10 Small Obsidian Shards."}
Q[1005041]={d="工人权益这，工人权益那。\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这或许是卑微的活计，但矿场里的农民已经组建了工会并宣布罢工。这是个非常棘手的局面，而我们的工期又催得很紧。\n\n收集 5 块大黑曜石碎块。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Workers rights this, workers rights that.\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but the peasants in the mines formed a union and went on strike. This is a very delicate situation, and we have deadlines to meet.\n\nCollect 5 Large Obsidian Shards. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 5 块大黑曜石碎块。",oEN="Collect 5 Large Obsidian Shards."}
Q[1005050]={d="注意，全体英雄！\n\n我们急需你们的援助！我们的熔炼师最近组建了工会并宣布罢工！好像是关于一起我们忽视了的工伤事故，听着他们那一堆抱怨，说实话我已经记不清到底是怎么回事了。总之，这是个棘手的局面，而我们的工期又催得很紧……\n\n熔炼 10 块铜矿。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Attention all heroes!\n\nWe are in need of your immediate assistance! Our smelters recently formed a union and went on strike! Something about a workplace injury that we missed, with all their complaining, I honestly can't remember what this was all about. Anyways, this is a delicate situation, and we have deadlines to meet...\n\nSmelt 10 Copper Bars. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 15 块铜锭。",oEN="Collect 15 Copper Bars.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
