Q[1005074]={d="注意，英雄们！\n\n城里的研究公会已经开始研究我们此前一直随手丢弃或典当的各种石头、珠宝和宝石的潜在价值。他们最近提交了一份物资申请。目前我们人手不足，但即便如此，考虑到这项工作的重要性，我们指望你们来帮忙完成这份物资申请。\n\n我们的研究公会申请了 10 块孔雀石。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Attention Heroes!\n\nThe city's research guild has started looking into the hidden potential of various stones, jewels, and gems we have just been throwing away and pawning off. They recently put in an supplies request. We are currently short on manpower, but still, understanding the importance of this work, look to you to help fill out this supply request.\n\nOur research guild has put in a request for 10 Malachites. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 块孔雀石。",oEN="Collect 10 Malachites.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
