Q[1005131]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n最近，我们的炼金师一直在进行一些未经批准的化学武器研究……简单来说，我们当时想造一颗毒气弹。事后看来，也许我们不该把所有资源都投到这么荒唐的项目上，但事后诸葛亮总是最容易的，对吧？总之，我们所有的草药师现在都……身体抱恙……原因是一场神秘且完全无关的大规模中毒事件。\n\n我们还是得赶工期。我们的炼金师需要 2 株黑莲花。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Calling all Heroes!\n\nWe have recently had our alchemists doing some unsanctioned chemical weapons research.. To sum it up, we were trying to make a poison bomb. In hindsight, maybe we shouldn't have diverted all of our resources to such a ridiculous project, but hindsight is 20/20, right? Anyways, all of our herbalists are... indisposed at the moment.. Due to some mysterious and completely unrelated mass poisoning.\n\nWe still have deadlines to meet. Our alchemists require 2 Black Lotus. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 1 株黑莲花。",oEN="Collect 1 Black Lotus.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1005154]={d="注意，英雄们！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助来完成制皮公会最近提交的一份物资订单。我们的剥皮师在工作时遭到动物权益活动人士的阻拦和骚扰；看样子在这一切平息之前，我们一份订单都完不成。不过这正是你出场的地方，英雄……不管他们怎么抗议，我们都有订单要交付，而我相信他们不敢拦你。我们的制皮师需要 2 张轻皮。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Attention Heroes!\n\nWe need your help filling out a supply order the leatherworker's guild recently put in. Our skinners have been stopped and harassed while working by animal rights activists, it is looking like we aren't going to be able to meet any of our orders until this all blows over. That is where you come in though, Hero...Protest or not, we have orders to fill, and I am sure they wouldn't dare to stop you. Our leatherworkers need 2 Light Hides. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 5 张轻皮。",oEN="Collect 5 Light Hides.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
