Q[1005222]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n我们最近收到附魔师公会的一份物资申请，他们需要更多附魔材料。我们需要你帮忙完成这份订单，因为我们总不能一直把军械库里的装备都分解掉吧。我们的士兵还拿什么去打仗？！总之，如你所见，我们走投无路了……\n\n附魔师公会的申请需要 20 份灵魂之尘。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Calling all Heroes!\n\nWe recently got a supply request from the enchanters guild for more enchanting supplies. We need your help to fill this order out, because we can't keep disenchanting the equipment in the armoury. What will our soldiers fight with?! Anyways, as you can see, we are desperate..\n\nThe enchanters guild's request called for 20 Soul Dusts. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 20 份灵魂之尘。",oEN="Collect 20 Soul Dusts."}
Q[1005223]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n我们最近收到附魔师公会的一份物资申请，他们需要更多附魔材料。我们需要你帮忙完成这份订单，因为我们总不能一直把军械库里的装备都分解掉吧。我们的士兵还拿什么去打仗？！总之，如你所见，我们走投无路了……\n\n附魔师公会的申请需要 10 块大块闪光碎片。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Calling all Heroes!\n\nWe recently got a supply request from the enchanters guild for more enchanting supplies. We need your help to fill this order out, because we can't keep disenchanting the equipment in the armoury. What will our soldiers fight with?! Anyways, as you can see, we are desperate..\n\nThe enchanters guild's request called for 10 Large Glimmering Shards. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 块大块闪光碎片。",oEN="Collect 10 Large Glimmering Shards."}
