Q[1005239]={d="召唤所有英雄！\n\n我们最近收到附魔师公会的一份物资申请，他们需要更多附魔材料。我们需要你们的帮助来完成这份订单，因为我们总不能一直把军械库里的装备都分解掉吧。我们的士兵还拿什么去打仗？！无论如何，如你们所见，我们走投无路了……\n\n附魔师公会的申请需要 5 块节点水晶。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Calling all Heroes!\n\nWe recently got a supply request from the enchanters guild for more enchanting supplies. We need your help to fill this order out, because we can't keep disenchanting the equipment in the armoury. What will our soldiers fight with?! Anyways, as you can see, we are desperate..\n\nThe enchanters guild's request called for 5 Nexus Crystals. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 5 块节点水晶。",oEN="Collect 5 Nexus Crystals."}
Q[1005251]={d="注意，英雄们！\n\n我们最近收到裁缝公会的一份物资申请，他们需要更多附魔材料。我们需要你们的帮助来完成这份订单，因为这件事已经让我们觉得不对劲了。我明白这是为了崇高的事业，但我们总不能一直把孤儿的毯子和衣服拿去回收……总之……\n\n\n\n裁缝公会的申请需要 40 卷亚麻布。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Attention all Heroes!\n\nWe recently got a supply request from the tailors guild for more enchanting supplies. We need your help to fill this order out, because this doesn't feel right anymore. I get it is for a noble cause, but we can't keep taking blankets and clothes from the orphans to recycle... Anyways...\n\n\n\nThe tailors guild's request called for 40 Linen Cloths. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 40 卷亚麻布。",oEN="Collect 40 Linen Cloths.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
