Q[1005264]={d="艾泽拉斯的全体英雄，请注意：自我们记事起，其拉虫人便一直在侵扰艾泽拉斯。\n\n近来，他们开始在西利苏斯运用阿努比萨斯的力量。阿努比萨斯是由活石驱动的巨像，拥有诡异的力量。其中一具被称为塞蒂斯的阿努比萨斯化身，一直在西利苏斯为塞纳里奥议会的贵族成员制造灾难。\n\n集结你的力量，摧毁塞蒂斯。若你的物品等级低于 50，该物品不会掉落。",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: the Qiraji have been infesting Azeroth for as long as we can remember.\n\nRecently, we they have begun utilizing the powers of the Anubisath in Silithus. The Abunisath are animated giants of living stone that possess strange powers. One particular incarnation of the Abunisath known as Setis has been causing havoc for the noble members of the Cenarion Circle located in Silithus,\n\nGather your forces to destroy Setis. The item will not drop if you do not have item level 50 or higher.",o="摧毁塞蒂斯！",oEN="Destroy Setis!",p="对艾泽拉斯的威胁依然存在。等你杀死了那头威胁我们所有人的野兽，再回来。",pEN="The threat to Azeroth persists. Return when you have slain the beast that endangers us all.",c="一名强大的敌人已被击败！得知有你这样的勇士随时待命，艾泽拉斯终于能松一口气。去领取你应得的奖励吧。",cEN="A mighty foe has been vanquished! Azeroth breathes easier knowing champions like you stand ready. Claim your well-earned reward."}
Q[1005265]={d="艾泽拉斯的全体英雄，请注意：有报告称在诅咒之地目击到一名名为卡扎克的强大恶魔。卡扎克又被称为基尔加丹的右手与末日守卫恶魔领主，在第三次大战期间曾是阿克蒙德最信任的副官之一。他是燃烧军团中一名强大而可怕的恶魔。\n有人最后一次在诅咒之地的剧毒之痕看到卡扎克手持阿克蒙德的传说之刃。\n\n集结你的英雄同伴，将艾泽拉斯世界从燃烧军团手中拯救出来。若你的物品等级低于 50，该物品不会掉落。",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: There have been reports of a formidable demon known as Kazzak spotted in the Blasted Lands. Also known as Kil'jaeden's Right Hand and Lord of the Doomguard demons, Kazzak was known as one of Archimonde's most trusted lieutenants during the Third War. He is a formidable and powerful demon of the Burning Legion\nKazzak, wielding the fabled blade of Archimonde, was last seen in the Blasted Lands at the Tainted Scar.\n\nRally together your fellow heroes to save the world of Azeroth from the Burning Legion. The item will not drop if you do not have item level 50 or higher.",o="击败卡扎克领主！",oEN="Defeat Lord Kazzak!",p="对艾泽拉斯的威胁依然存在。等你杀死了那头威胁我们所有人的野兽，再回来。",pEN="The threat to Azeroth persists. Return when you have slain the beast that endangers us all.",c="一名强大的敌人已被击败！得知有你这样的勇士随时待命，艾泽拉斯终于能松一口气。去领取你应得的奖励吧。",cEN="A mighty foe has been vanquished! Azeroth breathes easier knowing champions like you stand ready. Claim your well-earned reward."}
Q[1005266]={d="艾泽拉斯的全体英雄，请注意：\n\n在大分裂之前，暗夜精灵城市埃达拉斯曾繁盛于如今被称为艾萨拉的土地上。一条名为艾索雷葛斯的蓝龙一直在该地区漫无目的地游荡。有人认为，在那座昔日强大要塞的废墟中，或许能找到许多上古高等精灵的强大神器。无数世代以来，蓝龙军团一直守护着强大的神器与魔法知识，确保它们不落入凡人之手。蓝龙艾索雷葛斯的出现，似乎暗示着艾萨拉的荒野中藏有极其重要的物品——也许正是传说中永恒之井的圣水。无论艾索雷葛斯在寻找什么，有一件事是确定的：艾索雷葛斯是艾泽拉斯的威胁，必须被击杀。若你的物品等级低于 50，该物品不会掉落。",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth:\n\nBefore the Great Sundering, the night elf city of Eldarath flourished in the land that is now known as Azshara. A blueflight dragon known as Azuregos has been aimlessly wandering the region. Some believebelieved that many ancient and powerful Highborne artifacts may be found among the ruins of the once-mighty stronghold. For countless generations, the Blue Dragon Flight has safeguarded powerful artifacts and magical lore, ensuring that they do not fall into mortal hands. The presence of Azuregos, the blue dragon, seems to suggest that items of extreme significance, perhaps the fabled Vials of Eternity themselves, may be found in the wilderness of Azshara. Whatever Azuregos seeks, one thing is certain: Azuregos is a threat to Azeroth and must be slain. The item will not drop if you do not have item level 50 or higher.",o="杀死艾索雷葛斯！",oEN="Slay Azuregos!",p="对艾泽拉斯的威胁依然存在。等你杀死了那头威胁我们所有人的野兽，再回来。",pEN="The threat to Azeroth persists. Return when you have slain the beast that endangers us all.",c="一名强大的敌人已被击败！得知有你这样的勇士随时待命，艾泽拉斯终于能松一口气。去领取你应得的奖励吧。",cEN="A mighty foe has been vanquished! Azeroth breathes easier knowing champions like you stand ready. Claim your well-earned reward."}
Q[1005300]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们，请注意：我们收到令人不安的消息，邪恶的巨魔术士、灵魂掠夺者阿塔祖尔已在东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔废墟现身。阿塔祖尔曾是一位受人尊敬的暗影猎手，却因黑暗的巫毒魔法而堕落，沦为巨魔神灵夺魂者哈卡的可怕仆从。\n\n如今阿塔祖尔举行着亵渎的仪式，折磨在祖玛沙尔阵亡的阿曼尼灵魂。他那邪恶的亡灵法术还将他们的尸骸复起为听命于他的僵尸。\n\n我们必须在阿塔祖尔集结起一支亡灵巨魔大军、将混乱散播到整个艾泽拉斯之前，团结起来阻止他！集结你的力量，前往祖玛沙尔！",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: Disturbing news has reached us of the vile troll warlock, Atal'zul the Soulreaver, being sighted in the ruins of Zul'Mashar in Eastern Plaguelands. Once a respected shadow hunter, Atal'zul became corrupted by dark voodoo magic, turning him into a feared servant of the troll god Hakkar the Soulflayer.\n\nAtal'zul now performs profane rituals, tormenting the souls of the Amani slain at Zul'Mashar. His vile necromancy also raises their corpses as zombies under his command.\n\nWe must unite to stop Atal'zul before he amasses an undead troll army to wreak havoc across Azeroth! Rally your forces and venture to Zul'Mashar!",o="摧毁灵魂收割者阿塔祖尔！",oEN="Destroy Atal'zul the Soulreaver!",p="对艾泽拉斯的威胁依然存在。等你杀死了那头威胁我们所有人的野兽，再回来。",pEN="The threat to Azeroth persists. Return when you have slain the beast that endangers us all.",c="一名强大的敌人已被击败！得知有你这样的勇士随时待命，艾泽拉斯终于能松一口气。去领取你应得的奖励吧。",cEN="A mighty foe has been vanquished! Azeroth breathes easier knowing champions like you stand ready. Claim your well-earned reward."}
Q[1005301]={d="你好，英雄！\n我们最近陷入了物资短缺的困境，希望一位像你这样水平的工匠能帮我们渡过难关。我们需要 8 瓶次级法力药水才能维持下去。",dEN="Greetings Hero!\nWe recently found ourselves in the middle of a supply shortage and were hoping an artisan of your caliber might be able to pull us out of this rut. We need 8 Minor Mana Potions in order to make ends meet.",o="收集 8 瓶次级法力药水。",oEN="Collect 8 Minor Mana Potions.",c="你好，英雄！\n我们最近陷入了物资短缺的困境，希望一位像你这样水平的工匠能帮我们渡过难关。我们需要 8 瓶次级法力药水才能维持下去。",cEN="Greetings Hero!\nWe recently found ourselves in the middle of a supply shortage and were hoping an artisan of your caliber might be able to pull us out of this rut. We need 8 Minor Mana Potions in order to make ends meet."}
