Q[1005674]={d="真正的工匠能够创造神话般的奇迹。\n\n我们需要你的帮助。只有像你这样真正的工匠，才能把我们从这个不利的处境中解救出来。\n\n收集2 套恶魔布护甲，然后把它交回告示板，换取一份相当不错的报酬，这足以解决你所有的麻烦。",dEN="A true artisan is one who can create mythical wonders.\n\nWe need your help. Only a true artisan like yourself could pull us out of this detrimental situation.\n\nCollect 2 felcloth armor sets and deliver them back to the callboard for a nifty reward, this will cover all of your troubles.",o="收集1 恶魔布袍。",oEN="Collect 1 Felcloth Robe.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
