Q[1005800]={d="全体英雄请注意！\n\n燃烧军团和他们的邪教徒正从天而降！击败军团入侵者，然后回来领取你的奖励。",dEN="Attention all Heroes!\n\nThe Legion and their cultists descend from the skies! Defeat the Legion invaders and come back for your reward.",o="保卫艾泽拉斯，抵御燃烧军团的入侵。",oEN="Defend Azeroth against the Legion Invasions.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1006000]={d="你读到一张贴在地精传送器侧面的便条……\n\n<class>，（等等，它怎么知道我的名字？）这是来自艾泽拉斯各地众多孤儿院的一封集体通知。近来我们陷入了困境：每年要添置衣物的孩子越来越多，我们的物资却日渐短缺。希望你能捐赠一些布料，帮我们缓解这个问题。我们除了一声感谢别无他物可以给你，但我们相信，每一次捐赠都会让因果之轮更偏向你这一边。\n相关",dEN="You read a note attached to the side of the Goblin Transpolyporter...\n\n<class>, (Wait, how does it know my name?) this is a collective notice from the many orphanages throughout azeroth. In recent times we have found ourselves in a bit of a bind, as we find ourselves with more bodies to clothe each year, we find ourselves running short on supplies. We hope that you can make a cloth donation to help contribute to the problem. While we can give you nothing but our thanks, we are sure that karma will shift closer to your side with each donation.\nRelated",o="把 20 亚麻布交给地精传送器。",oEN="Bring 20 linen cloth to the Goblin Transpolyporter."}
