Q[1006004]={d="你读到一张贴在地精传送器侧面的便条……\n\n<class>，（等等，它怎么知道我的名字？）这是来自艾泽拉斯各地众多孤儿院的一封集体通知。近来我们陷入了困境：每年要添置衣物的孩子越来越多，我们的物资却日渐短缺。希望你能捐赠一些布料，帮我们缓解这个问题。我们除了一声感谢别无他物可以给你，但我们相信，每一次捐赠都会让因果之轮更偏向你这一边。\n相关",dEN="You read a note attached to the side of the Goblin Transpolyporter...\n\n<class>, (Wait, how does it know my name?) this is a collective notice from the many orphanages throughout azeroth. In recent times we have found ourselves in a bit of a bind, as we find ourselves with more bodies to clothe each year, we find ourselves running short on supplies. We hope that you can make a cloth donation to help contribute to the problem. While we can give you nothing but our thanks, we are sure that karma will shift closer to your side with each donation.\nRelated",o="把 20 魔纹绷带交给地精传送器。",oEN="Bring 20 mageweave bandages to the Goblin Transpolyporter."}
Q[1006500]={d="致艾泽拉斯的所有英雄：我们收到了紧急消息，黑海岸的幽暗深处潜伏着一场可怕的威胁。名为索格斯的意志的邪恶实体已在远古废墟中被发现，它正像蔓延的黑暗一样扩散着阴险的影响。\n\n索格斯的意志如今统率着一支由邪教徒、扭曲生物和腐化野生动物组成的邪恶大军，一心要把疯狂与绝望散播到整个黑海岸。它们阴险的阴谋正威胁着将这片土地拖入永恒的暮色，并向我们的海岸释放难以名状的恐怖。\n\n艾泽拉斯的英雄们，请响应这战斗的号召！我们必须团结一致，对抗步步逼近的黑暗，将索格斯的意志那污秽的影响从我们的土地上彻底清除。集结你的盟友，坚定你的决心，前往黑海岸——我们世界的命运正悬于一线。",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: Urgent tidings have reached us concerning a dire threat lurking within the shadowed depths of Darkshore. The malevolent entity known as the Will of Soggoth has been sighted amidst the ancient ruins, spreading its sinister influence like a creeping darkness.\n\nThe Will of Soggoth now commands an unholy legion of cultists, twisted creatures, and corrupted wildlife, all bent on spreading madness and despair throughout Darkshore. Their insidious machinations threaten to plunge the land into eternal twilight and unleash unspeakable horrors upon our shores.\n\nHeroes of Azeroth, heed this call to arms! We must stand united against the encroaching darkness and purge the foul influence of the Will of Soggoth from our lands. Gather your allies, steel your resolve, and venture forth to Darkshore, where the fate of our world hangs in the balance.",o="摧毁索格斯的意志！",oEN="Destroy The Will of Soggoth!",p="艾泽拉斯面临的威胁依然存在。等你杀死了那威胁我们所有人的野兽再回来。",pEN="The threat to Azeroth persists. Return when you have slain the beast that endangers us all.",c="强敌已被击败！知道有你这样的勇士随时待命，艾泽拉斯也能稍稍松一口气了。领取你应得的奖励吧。",cEN="A mighty foe has been vanquished! Azeroth breathes easier knowing champions like you stand ready. Claim your well-earned reward."}
Q[1006555]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们，请注意：我们收到令人不安的消息，邪恶的巨魔术士、灵魂掠夺者阿塔祖尔已在东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔废墟现身。阿塔祖尔曾是一位受人尊敬的暗影猎手，却因黑暗的巫毒魔法而堕落，沦为巨魔神灵夺魂者哈卡的可怕仆从。\n\n如今阿塔祖尔举行着亵渎的仪式，折磨在祖玛沙尔阵亡的阿曼尼灵魂。他那邪恶的亡灵法术还将他们的尸骸复起为听命于他的僵尸。\n\n我们必须在阿塔祖尔集结起一支亡灵巨魔大军、将混乱散播到整个艾泽拉斯之前，团结起来阻止他！集结你的力量，前往祖玛沙尔！",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: Disturbing news has reached us of the vile troll warlock, Atal'zul the Soulreaver, being sighted in the ruins of Zul'Mashar in Eastern Plaguelands. Once a respected shadow hunter, Atal'zul became corrupted by dark voodoo magic, turning him into a feared servant of the troll god Hakkar the Soulflayer.\n\nAtal'zul now performs profane rituals, tormenting the souls of the Amani slain at Zul'Mashar. His vile necromancy also raises their corpses as zombies under his command.\n\nWe must unite to stop Atal'zul before he amasses an undead troll army to wreak havoc across Azeroth! Rally your forces and venture to Zul'Mashar!",o="摧毁灵魂收割者阿塔祖尔！",oEN="Destroy Atal'zul the Soulreaver!"}
Q[1007017]={d="麦迪文的存在仍在卡拉赞的厅堂中游荡，即便他已死去数十年。他召唤来执行命令的恶魔实体仍在守护着卡拉赞中封存的魔法秘密与强大宝物。一路杀穿这座塔，为我们的学者扫清道路，好让他们开始发掘其中的秘密。",dEN="Medivh’s presence still haunts the halls of Karazhan, even decades after his death. The Demonic entities he summoned to perform his bidding still guard the magic secrets and powerful treasures locked away in Karazhan. Fight your way through the tower and clear the way for our scholars to begin unearthing the secrets that lie within.",o="将玛尔扎克王子从卡拉赞放逐！",oEN="Banish Prince Malchezaar from Karazhan!",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007018]={d="阿曼尼森林巨魔以其大胆的突袭而臭名昭著。祖尔金是负责袭击奎尔萨拉斯的督军，尽管巨魔曾被高等精灵重创。他正在祖阿曼重整军队。别搞错了……如果祖尔金开始突袭，那将是毁灭性的。杀死祖尔金！没有了督军，巨魔军队将不再是威胁。",dEN="The Amani forest trolls are notorious for their daring raids. Zul’jin is the Warlord responsible for the raids on Quel’Thalas despite the trolls being devastated by the high elves. He builds his army again in Zul’Aman. Make no mistake... If Zul’jin begins to raid it will be devastating. Kill Zul’jin! The troll army will no longer be a threat without its Warlord.",o="击败祖尔金！",oEN="Defeat Zul'jin!",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007019]={d="刀锋山高地的食人魔将格鲁尔当作神明来崇拜。到目前为止，格鲁尔满足于劫掠纳格兰平原，但我们对外域的入侵已引起食人魔的注意，格鲁尔决定追随他的崇拜者投入战斗只是时间问题。格鲁尔曾在战斗中证明过自己的力量——他将死亡之翼的后裔从天空中扯了下来。如果屠龙者决定攻击我们在外域的部队，他将构成严重威胁。我们必须在食人魔以我们或许无法匹敌的力量进军之前，在他的巢穴中杀死他。",dEN="The ogres of Blade’s Edge Mountain worship Gruul as a god. So far Gruul has been content raiding the plains of Nagrand, but our invasion into Outlands has drawn the attention of the ogres, and it is only a matter of time before Gruul decides to follow his worshippers into battle. Gruul has already proven his strength in battle when he tore Deathwing’s offspring of the sky. The Dragonkiller would pose a serious threat if he ever chose to attack our forces in Outland. We must slay him in his lair before the ogres march with a force we may be unable to match.",o="杀死屠龙者格鲁尔！",oEN="Kill Gruul the Dragonkiller!",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007020]={d="除非我们切断邪兽人大军的力量源泉，否则他们永远不会被真正击败。那就是玛瑟里顿。伊利丹将这位深渊领主锁在地狱火堡垒的深处，他的爪牙在那里抽干他受污染的血液。玛瑟里顿被维持着微弱的气息，这正合我们的目的。阻止邪兽人大军扩充兵力。放干玛瑟里顿的所有血液。",dEN="The Fel Orc army will never be truly defeated until we cut them off from their source of power. Magtheridon. Illidin keeps the Pit Lord chained up in the depths of Hellfire Citadel where his minions drain his tainted blood. Magtheridon is kept barely alive, which suits our purpose well. Prevent the Fel Orc army from growing their number. Spill all of Magtheridon’s blood.",o="放干玛瑟里顿的所有血液。",oEN="Spill all of Magtheridon's Blood.",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007021]={d="整个外域只有一座水库。如果我们不控制水源，就无法控制外域。瓦丝琪女士是伊利丹最信任的副官，负责确保伊利丹的军队持续掌控外域的水源供应。如果我们想有一线希望打开补给线并征服外域，就必须控制水源。击败瓦丝琪女士，夺取水库！",dEN="There is only one reservoir in all of Outlands. If we do not control the water, we do not control Outlands. Lady Vashj is Illidan’s most trusted lieutenant and responsible for ensuring Illidan’s army remains in control of Outland’s water supply. If we are to have any hope of opening our supply lines and conquering Outlands we must control the water supply. Defeat Lady Vashj and claim the reservoir!",o="让瓦丝琪女士彻底干涸。",oEN="Leave Lady Vashj out to dry.",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007022]={d="即便在凯尔萨斯背叛之后，血精灵朝圣者仍在风暴要塞寻求庇护。我们绝不能让凯尔萨斯增强燃烧军团的兵力，也不能让他继续控制眼！这项纳鲁科技可能让他们无需依赖黑暗之门就能袭击艾泽拉斯。我们必须夺回风暴要塞，否则就要冒两线作战的风险。",dEN="Even after the betrayal of Kael’thas blood elf pilgrims still seek sanctuary in Tempest Keep. We cannot allow Kael’thas to bolster the forces of the Burning Legion or maintain control over The Eye! This naaru technology could allow them to assault Azeroth without relying on the Dark Portal. We must reclaim Tempest Keep or we risk fighting this war on two fronts.",o="击败凯尔萨斯。",oEN="Vanquish Kael'thas.",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007023]={d="我们已经对燃烧军团造成了严重打击。我们几乎准备好突袭黑暗神殿了。我们的敌人如今试图在海加尔山之战中改写历史。如果他们得逞……我们就要冒着在外域这里对付阿克蒙德的风险。我们肯定会被赶回黑暗之门。我们必须派遣最有能力的英雄回到过去，确保在海加尔山战胜燃烧军团！",dEN="We have dealt serious blows to the Burning Legion. We are nearly ready to assault the Black Temple. Our enemies now seek to rewrite history in the Battle of Mount Hyjal. If they succeed… we risk having to deal with Archimonde here in Outlands. We would surely be pushed back through the Dark Portal. We must send our most capable heroes back in time to ensure victory in Hyjal over the Burning Legion!",o="把阿克蒙德留在过去。",oEN="Leave Archimonde in the past.",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007024]={d="伊利丹有许多强大的敌人，他留在黑暗神殿是因为害怕唤醒巫妖王，或被燃烧军团残余的领主发现。尽管如此，伊利丹仍在收紧对外域的掌控。只要他还固守在他那亵渎的圣所中，我们就永远无法真正挑战他的统治。杀死背叛者！",dEN="Illidan has many powerful enemies and remained in the Black Temple for fear of awaking The Lich King or being discovered by the remaining Lords of the burning Legion. Despite this, Illidan still tightens his grip on Outlands. We will never truly challenge his rule while he remains fortified in his profane sanctum. Kill the Betrayer!",o="杀死伊利丹！",oEN="Slay Illidan!",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007025]={d="数千年来，太阳之井一直为高等精灵的强大魔法提供能量。燃烧军团将一切都押在这座古老的力量之泉上，因为有了它，他们就有办法召唤他们的指挥官基尔加丹。如果基尔加丹亲临战场，我们必败无疑。但燃烧军团也给了我们在这场战争中给予决定性一击的机会。就是现在，英雄。击败燃烧军团。",dEN="For millennia the Sunwell fueled the high elve’s potent magic. The Burning Legion have committed everything to this ancient fountain of power, for with it, they will have the means to summon their commander Kil’jaeden. If Kil’jaeden takes the field we are surely doomed. But the Burning Legion have also given us the opportunity to deal a decisive blow in this war. This is it Hero. Defeat the Burning Legion.",o="放逐基尔加丹！",oEN="Banish Kil'jaeden!",p="敌人依然屹立不倒。坚定你的意志，完成职责后再回来，英雄。",pEN="The enemy still stands. Steel yourself and return when you have fulfilled your duty, Hero.",c="胜利！黑暗势力遭受了毁灭性的打击。你的英雄事迹将被整个艾泽拉斯铭记。",cEN="Victory! The forces of darkness have suffered a devastating blow. Your heroism will be remembered across all of Azeroth."}
Q[1007027]={d="一支地狱火大军正准备对沙塔斯城发动大规模进攻！只要我们消灭守卫该区域的大灾变监工，天空卫队就能轻松轰炸他们的集结地。你必须为天空卫队夺取入侵点：大灾变，以确保沙塔斯城的安全。",dEN="A legion of infernals is preparing a massive assault on Shattrath City! The Skyguard will have no trouble bombing their staging ground once we eliminate the Cataclysm Overseers guarding the area. You must secure Invasion Point: Cataclysm for the Skyguard to ensure Shattrath Cities safety.",o="杀死 8 名大灾变监工和 6 名邪能掠夺者哨兵。",oEN="Slay 8 Catacylsm Overseers and 6 Fel Reaver Sentinels.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007028]={d="影月谷对我们在外域的行动构成的威胁从不缺乏。巨像很少离开它们的活动区域，而日蚀平原的巨人已经变得疯狂。一味避开它们已不再是选择。召集一队英雄，彻底清除这一威胁。",dEN="Shadowmoon Valley has no shortage of threats to our operations in Outlands. The Colossus rarely wander from their stomping grounds, the giants in the Eclipsion Fields have grown Crazed. Simply avoiding them is no longer an option. Assemble a group of heroes and exterminate the threat.",o="杀死 5 名疯狂巨像。",oEN="Slay 5 Crazed Colossus.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007029]={d="血精灵和巨人已开始在影月谷展开合作。这一联盟前所未有，后果难以预料。我们必须立刻调查此事。前往征服之路，消灭戈多克之子以及赤红岗哨周围的守卫，好让我们的调查员收集更多关于这一联盟的情报。",dEN="The Blood Elves and Giants have begun cooperating in Shadowmoon Valley. This alliance is unprecedented and the consequences impossible to predict. We must investigate the issue immediately. Travel to the Path of Conquest and eliminate the Sons of Gordok and any security around Crimson Watch so our investigators can gather more information surrounding this alliance.",o="杀死 8 名戈多克之子和 4 名伊利达雷监视者。",oEN="Slay 8 Sons of Gordok and 4 Illidari Watchers.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007030]={d="法拉隆巨人已开始在虚空风暴的阿尔克隆尼斯山脊集结。它们的数量增长得如此之多，以至于 52 区的地精报告地震活动大幅增加，甚至到了他们的火箭都有倾覆危险的地步！他们向我们保证一切都符合安全规范，但地精工程学就是地精工程学，最好还是在这些巨人无意间毁掉 52 区之前消灭它们。",dEN="Farahlon Giants have begun to assemble at Arklonis Ridge in the Netherstorm. Their numbers have grown so much that the goblins of Area 52 report a huge uptick in seismic activity. So much so that their rocket is in danger of tipping over! They assure us everything meets safety requirements, but Goblin Engineering being Goblin Engineering it is best to eliminate the giants before they unintentionally destroy Area 52.",o="杀死 6 名法拉隆巨人。",oEN="Slay 6 Farahlon Giants.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007031]={d="天空卫队研发出了一种新型实验炸弹，用于清剿地狱火的集结地。好消息是这些炸弹极为有效，坏消息是它们需要虚空石，而开采过程既漫长又危险。巨人们在四周踩踏、砸毁设备和伤害工人，开采几乎无法进行。清除虚空风暴中虚空石周围的法拉隆破坏者。",dEN="The Skyguard has developed a new experimental bomb for clearing out infernal staging grounds. The good news is that these bombs are highly effective, the bad news is that they require Netherstone and the extraction process is lengthy and dangerous. Extraction becomes nearly impossible with giants stomping around smashing up the gear and workers. Clear out the Farahlon Breakers around the Netherstone in the Netherstorm.",o="杀死 12 名法拉隆破坏者。",oEN="Slay 12 Farahlon Breakers.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007032]={d="我们从未见过如此多的巨像聚集在同一片区域。目前还不清楚这些巨人是聚集在天陨山脊周围，还是以某种方式在那里被制造出来。可以确定的是，我们必须趁现在还能动手时解决这一威胁。前往地狱火半岛，击溃狂怒的巨像。",dEN="We have never seen so many Colossus gathered in one area. It is unclear if the giants are gathering around Fallen Sky Ridge or somehow being created there. What is clear is that this threat must be dealt with while we still can. Travel to Hellfire Peninsula and break up the Raging Colossus.",o="杀死 20 名狂怒巨像。",oEN="Slay 20 Raging Colossus.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007033]={d="天空卫队在纳格兰铸魔营地上空的行动中损失了无数飞行员。燃烧军团已彻底筑垒固守，我们剩下的唯一选择就是地面进攻。突袭纳格兰的铸魔营地：恐惧与憎恨，杀死操作邪能火炮的恶魔卫士——正是这些火炮夺走了我们如此多飞行员的生命。摧毁莫尔葛工程师将打乱军团重建新火炮的企图，让我们的轰炸任务得以继续。",dEN="The Skyguard has lost countless flyers in missions over Nagrand's Forge Camps. The Legion is completely entrenched and our only remaining option is a ground assault. Assault Forge Camp: Fear and Hate in Nagrand and slay the Felguards operating the Fel Cannons that have claimed so many of our flyers. Destroying the Mo'arg Enginners will disrupt the Legions attempts at rebuilding new cannons and allow our bombing missions to continue.",o="消灭 8 名恶魔卫士军团士兵和 8 名莫尔葛工程师。",oEN="Destroy 8 Felguard Legionnaires and 8 Mo'arg Engineers.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007034]={d="刃拳食人魔将格鲁尔奉若神明，一旦他离开巢穴，他们必定会追随他投入战斗。食人魔的精锐士兵就驻扎在格鲁尔的巢穴外，以便更靠近他们的神，并守卫入口，阻挡任何胆敢挑战他的人。击败这些食人魔。阻止潜在的进攻，并在我们集结起足够强大的力量时，为挑战格鲁尔打开通路！",dEN="The Bladespire ogres worship Gruul like a god and will surely follow him into battle should he emerge from his lair. The ogres elite soldiers reside just outside of Gruul’s lair to be closer to their god and defend the entrance from any who would dare challenge him. Defeat the ogres. Prevent a potential attack and open the way to challenge Gruul when we assemble a force strong enough to defeat him!",o="杀死 22 名刃拳食人魔。",oEN="Slay 22 Bladespire Orgres.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007035]={d="我们的斥候在纳格兰的一次例行飞行中发现了巨大的建筑。他们无法靠近侦察，但所有报告都指出那建筑可能是一座传送门。我们尚不清楚其意图，但它们毫无疑问充满敌意。前往暮光山脊，终结这项黑暗的勾当。",dEN="Our scouts spotted an enormous structure during a routine fly over Nagrand. They were unable to scout closer but all reports indicate that structure may be a portal. We don’t yet know the intention, but they are without a doubt hostile. Travel to the Twilight Ridge and put an end to this dark work.",o="杀死 5 名死亡之影领主和 6 名死亡之影术士。",oEN="Slay 5 Deathshadow Overlords and 6 Deathshadow Warlocks.",p="邪恶仍在这片土地上滋生。等你解决了威胁再回来。",pEN="Evil still festers in these lands. Return when you have dealt with the threat.",c="黑暗暂时退去了。你在邪恶面前的勇气值得称赞。收下这份奖励吧，英雄。",cEN="The darkness recedes, if only for a time. Your courage in the face of evil is commendable. Take this reward, Hero."}
Q[1007046]={d="萨拉妮丝指挥官 —— 堕落的血精灵领袖凯尔萨斯夺取风暴要塞的控制权后，立刻命令萨拉妮丝指挥官布置防御，以抵御纳鲁可能派来夺回要塞的任何力量。\n\n高级植物学家弗雷温 —— 进入生态船仅仅几分钟后，弗雷温便开始进行鲁莽的实验，想要解开外域原生植物中隐藏的力量。\n\n看护者索恩格林 —— 实验需要资源。看护者索恩格林确保凯尔萨斯的植物学家们拥有揭示纳鲁秘密所需的力量与精华，哪怕这意味着必须牺牲数不清的生灵来获取它。\n\n拉伊 —— 纳鲁从外域各处收集了奇异野生动物的样本。生态船遭到入侵时，它们的防护措施被摧毁，一些最危险的样本因此得以自由游荡。\n\n迁跃扭木 —— 达纳苏斯的暗夜精灵请求帮助修复一株被困在风暴要塞中的奥术古树。由于受到凯尔萨斯·逐日者军队近期攻击的惊吓，迁跃扭木已无法分辨敌友，很可能会攻击任何打扰它的人。",dEN="Commander Sarannis – When the fallen blood elf leader, Kael'thas, seized control of the Tempest Keep, he immediately ordered Commander Sarannis to prepare defenses against whomever the naaru might send to reclaim the keep.\n\nHigh Botanist Freywinn – Mere minutes after entering the Botanica, Freywinn began conducting reckless experiments in order to unlock the power hidden among the native plant life of Outland.\n\nThorngrin the Tender – Experiments require resources. Thorngrin the Tender makes sure that Kael'thas's botanists have the power and essence they need to reveal the naaru's secrets, even if that means untold numbers of living creatures must be sacrificed to obtain it.\n\nLaj – The naaru gathered samples of unusual wildlife from across Outland. Their safeguards were destroyed when the Botanica was invaded, leaving some of the most dangerous specimens free to roam.\n\nWarp Splinter – The night elves of Darnassus have asked for help in restoring an Ancient of the Arcane, who found itself trapped in Tempest Keep. Frightened by the recent attack by Kael'thas Sunstrider's forces, the Warp Splinter is unable to differentiate friend from foe and is liable to attack any who disturb it.",o="深入并征服隐藏在生态船内的谜团与危险",oEN="Delve and Conquer the mysteries and dangers hidden inside The Botanica",c="英雄，你今天立下了丰功伟绩。当需要冒险者挺身而出时，是 <name> 响应了号召，这一点不会被忽视。",cEN="You have accomplished great deeds today hero. It shall not go unnoticed that when Adventurers were needed it was <name>ame who answered the call."}
Q[1007372]={d="燃烧军团的部队仍在不断袭扰黑暗之门两侧的补给线。要想击败军团，保障军队补给是我们必须赢下的第一场战斗！我们从艾泽拉斯运来的秘银和瑟银储备正在减少！我们必须找到本地的矿石来源。\n\n每一次与军团的交锋都会留下必须更换的断刃和枪尖，以及必须修补的护甲！外域的魔铁矿十分丰富，可以用来加固我们的步兵！\n\n收集魔铁矿石，并把它交给任意告示板。",dEN="Legion forces continue to harass our supply lines on both sides of the Dark Portal. Keeping the army well supplied is the first battle we must win if we are to defeat the Legion! Our supplies of Mithril and Thorium from Azeroth are dwindling! We must find a local source of ore.\n\nEvery skirmish with the Legion leaves behind broken blades and spear tips that must be replaced and armor that must be repaired! Fel Iron Ore is plentiful in Outland and can be used to reinforce our infantry!\n\nCollect Fel Iron Ore and deliver it to any call board.",o="收集20 魔铁矿石",oEN="Collect 20 Fel Iron Ore",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007373]={d="燃烧军团的部队仍在不断袭扰黑暗之门两侧的补给线。要想击败军团，保障军队补给是我们必须赢下的第一场战斗！我们从艾泽拉斯运来的秘银和瑟银储备正在减少！我们必须找到本地的矿石来源。\n\n精金护甲和装甲板格外坚固耐用。要想让前线维持对军团的长期攻势，我们必须为他们准备替换用的护甲和盾牌。\n\n收集精金矿石，并把它交给任意告示板。",dEN="Legion forces continue to harass our supply lines on both sides of the Dark Portal. Keeping the army well supplied is the first battle we must win if we are to defeat the Legion! Our supplies of Mithril and Thorium from Azeroth are dwindling! We must find a local source of ore.\n\nAdamantite armor and plating is exceptionally strong and durable. We must have replacement armor and shields for our front line if they are to maintain and extended assault on the Legion.\n\nCollect Adamantite Ore and deliver it to any call board.",o="收集20 精金矿石",oEN="Collect 20 Adamantite Ore",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007374]={d="燃烧军团的部队仍在不断袭扰黑暗之门两侧的补给线。要想击败军团，保障军队补给是我们必须赢下的第一场战斗！我们从艾泽拉斯运来的秘银和瑟银储备正在减少！我们必须找到本地的矿石来源。\n\n矿石中蕴藏的财富不止于金属。高品质的宝石能为军队提供高质量的瞄准镜、强大的饰品和护目镜。收集恒金矿石，交给我们的珠宝加工师筛选宝石。\n\n收集恒金矿石，并把它交给任意告示板。",dEN="Legion forces continue to harass our supply lines on both sides of the Dark Portal. Keeping the army well supplied is the first battle we must win if we are to defeat the Legion! Our supplies of Mithril and Thorium from Azeroth are dwindling! We must find a local source of ore.\n\nOre holds more treasure than just metal. High quality gems will keep the army supplied with high quality scopes, powerful trinkets and goggles. Collect Khorium Ore for our Jewelcrafters to sift through for gems.\n\nCollect Khorium Ore and deliver it to any call board.",o="收集8 恒金矿石",oEN="Collect 8 Khorium Ore",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007375]={d="燃烧军团的部队仍在不断袭扰黑暗之门两侧的补给线。要想击败军团，保障军队补给是我们必须赢下的第一场战斗！我们从艾泽拉斯运来的秘银和瑟银储备正在减少！我们必须找到本地的矿石来源。\n\n从子弹到枪管，再到炮弹。永恒矿石能让我们的部队在远处摧毁军团！为我们的军队收集一批永恒矿石！\n\n收集永恒矿石，并把它交给任意告示板。",dEN="Legion forces continue to harass our supply lines on both sides of the Dark Portal. Keeping the army well supplied is the first battle we must win if we are to defeat the Legion! Our supplies of Mithril and Thorium from Azeroth are dwindling! We must find a local source of ore.\n\nFrom bullets to gun barrels to artillary shells. Eternium Ore will allow our forces to destroy the Legion from range! Collect a supply of Eternium Ore for our army!\n\nCollect Eternium Ore and deliver it to any call board.",o="收集8 永恒矿石",oEN="Collect 8 Eternium Ore",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007378]={d="英雄，我们需要你的帮助！\n\n我们的士兵急需提振士气！于是我想到，也许可以用一顿丰盛的饭菜让他们振作起来！\n\n收集 12 魔草。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Hero, we need your help!\n\nOur soldiers are in desperate need of a morale boost! And then, I got to thinking, maybe we could raise their spirits with a hearty meal!\n\nCollect 12 Felweed. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集12 魔草",oEN="Collect 12 Felweed",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
