Q[1007390]={d="燃烧军团的部队仍在不断袭扰黑暗之门两侧的补给线。我担心如果不就地解决补给问题，我们的战役很快就会陷入停滞。\n\n要想击败军团，保障军队补给是我们必须赢下的第一场战斗！让治疗者和辅助施法者得到充足的物资与装备，从而让我们的战士能继续战斗，这一点至关重要。\n\n收集 4 卷灌魔灵纹布，并把它交给任意告示板。",dEN="Legion forces continue to harass our supply lines on both sides of the Dark Portal. I fear our campaign will soon grind to a halt if we do not secure supplies locally.\n\nKeeping the army well supplied is the first battle we must win if we are to defeat the Legion! It is vital we keep our healers and supportive casters well supplied and outfitted to keep our warriors in the fight.\n\nCollect 4 Bolt of Imbued Netherweave and deliver it to any call board.",o="收集4 灌魔灵纹布卷",oEN="Collect 4 Bolt of Imbued Netherweave",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
