Q[1007394]={d="看来我们的猎人还没完全适应新环境……\n\n英雄们，我们需要你们的帮助。这或许是些琐碎的活计，但我们的猎人至今仍未适应外域，我们的厨师也巧妇难为无米之炊！\n\n收集 12 闪电鳗。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Looks like our hunters haven't quite adapted to their new surroundings...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but our hunters still haven't adjusted to the Outlands and our cooks don't have anything to work with!\n\nCollect 12 Lightning Eel. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集12 闪电鳗",oEN="Collect 12 Lightning Eel",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
