Q[1007432]={d="动物权利这，动物权利那……\n\n英雄们，我们需要你们的帮助。这或许是些琐碎的活计，但我们猎人的工作正被第三方阻挠……\n\n收集 2 虚空龙鳞。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights this, animal rights that...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but our hunters' efforts are being blocked by third parties...\n\nCollect 2 Nether Dragonscales. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集2 虚空龙鳞",oEN="Collect 2 Nether Dragonscales",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007453]={d="动物权利组织对我们获取毛皮的方式表示\"关切\"……\n\n英雄们，我们需要你们的帮助。这或许是些琐碎的活计——动物权利组织一直就我们获取毛皮的方式纠缠不休，但那不是现在的重点。重点是，我需要你帮我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 1 制皮工具包。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 1 Leatherworker's Satchel. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集1 制皮工具包",oEN="Collect 1 Leatherworker's Satchel",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007454]={d="看来我们最新调配的草药不够用了……\n\n英雄们，我们需要你们的帮助。这或许是些琐碎的活计，但我们最新调配的草药已经用完了！我们制作的草药混合物纯天然，绝不添加任何香料！然而我们最新一批草药卖得太快，我们快没有原料继续生产了！你愿意帮我们一个忙吗？\n\n收集 5 疯狂炼金师药水。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\n\nCollect 5 Mad Alchemist's Potion. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集5 疯狂炼金师药水",oEN="Collect 5 Mad Alchemist's Potion",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007455]={d="动物权利组织对我们获取毛皮的方式表示\"关切\"……\n\n英雄们，我们需要你们的帮助。这或许是些琐碎的活计——动物权利组织一直就我们获取毛皮的方式纠缠不休，但那不是现在的重点。重点是，我需要你帮我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 2 重型结缔皮护甲片。当然，你会因你的帮助得到丰厚的报酬，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 2 Heavy Knothide Armor Kit. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集2 重型结缔皮护甲片",oEN="Collect 2 Heavy Knothide Armor Kit",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007457]={d="动物权益组织对我们获取毛皮的方式感到\"担忧\"...\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，动物权益组织一直拿我们获取毛皮的方式找我们麻烦，但现在那不重要。重要的是，我需要你替我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 2 个护手加固件。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 2 Glove Reinforcements. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 个护手加固件。",oEN="Collect 2 Glove Reinforcements",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007458]={d="想啊……想啊！头脑爆炸！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们想出了一个能洗脑的装置点子！想想看，这东西对犯罪分子和监禁体系会有多大影响！以我的经验，评估一件事的价值最好只看表面，不要深究可能的后果……\n\n收集 2 个战地修理机器人 110G。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Think.... Think...! Brain Blast!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we came up with an idea for a contraption that can brainwash people! Imagine the effects this could have on criminals and incarceration! In my experience, it's always best to evaluate the value of something on a surface level without looking too much into the potential consequences...\n\nCollect 2 Field Repair Bot 110G. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 个战地修理机器人 110G。",oEN="Collect 2 Field Repair Bot 110G",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007459]={d="动物权益组织对我们获取毛皮的方式感到\"担忧\"...\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，动物权益组织一直拿我们获取毛皮的方式找我们麻烦，但现在那不重要。重要的是，我需要你替我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 1 个结节皮弹药包。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 1 Knothide Ammo Pouch. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 1 个结节皮弹药包。",oEN="Collect 1 Knothide Ammo Pouch",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
