Q[1007461]={d="想啊……想啊！头脑爆炸！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们想出了一个能洗脑的装置点子！想想看，这东西对犯罪分子和监禁体系会有多大影响！以我的经验，评估一件事的价值最好只看表面，不要深究可能的后果……\n\n收集 1 个飞行机控制器。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Think.... Think...! Brain Blast!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we came up with an idea for a contraption that can brainwash people! Imagine the effects this could have on criminals and incarceration! In my experience, it's always best to evaluate the value of something on a surface level without looking too much into the potential consequences...\n\nCollect 1 Flying Machine Control. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 1 个飞行机控制器。",oEN="Collect 1 Flying Machine Control",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
