Q[1007472]={d="看来我们最新的配方没有草药了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们最新的配方没有草药了！我们制作的是纯天然草药配方，绝不添加任何香料！但我们最新的草药配方好像卖得很快，我们快没有原料做更多了！你能帮我们一个忙吗？\n\n收集 4 个德莱尼智慧合剂。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\n\nCollect 4 Elixir of Draenic Wisdom. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 4 个德莱尼智慧合剂。",oEN="Collect 4 Elixir of Draenic Wisdom",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
