Q[1007486]={d="动物权益组织对我们获取毛皮的方式感到\"担忧\"...\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，动物权益组织一直拿我们获取毛皮的方式找我们麻烦，但现在那不重要。重要的是，我需要你替我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 2 个战鼓。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 2 Drums of War. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 个战鼓。",oEN="Collect 2 Drums of War",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007487]={d="沙塔斯城防务部刚刚发布了一份新的武器合同，奖给第一个能完成订单的团队！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但沙塔斯城防务部为第一个完成这份荒唐订单的团队提供一份武器合同！这对太平洋武器公司来说可能意义重大，因为我们最近生意一直不太好……\n\n收集 1 个邪钢低语之刃。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="The Shattrath City Defense Department just released a new arms contract for the first group that can fill the order!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but The Shattrath City Defense Department is offering an arms contract for the first group to fill this rediculous order! This could be huge for The Pacificicous Arms Company, as we haven't been seeing a lot of business lately...\n\nCollect 1 Felsteel Whisper Knives. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 1 个邪钢低语之刃。",oEN="Collect 1 Felsteel Whisper Knives",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007492]={d="沙塔斯城防务部刚刚发布了一份新的武器合同，奖给第一个能完成订单的团队！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但沙塔斯城防务部为第一个完成这份荒唐订单的团队提供一份武器合同！这对太平洋武器公司来说可能意义重大，因为我们最近生意一直不太好……\n\n收集 10 个邪能磨刀石。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="The Shattrath City Defense Department just released a new arms contract for the first group that can fill the order!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but The Shattrath City Defense Department is offering an arms contract for the first group to fill this rediculous order! This could be huge for The Pacificicous Arms Company, as we haven't been seeing a lot of business lately...\n\nCollect 10 Fel Weightstone. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 个邪能磨刀石。",oEN="Collect 10 Fel Weightstone",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007493]={d="我们有订单要交付，而我的珠宝匠们还没掌握这个新专业……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我必须在昨天就把这些订单交掉。\n\n收集 10 个闪亮的血石榴子。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have orders to fulfill and my jewelcrafters still aren't getting the hang of this new profession...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but I need to fulfill these orders yesterday.\n\nCollect 10 Bright Blood Garnet. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 个闪亮的血石榴子。",oEN="Collect 10 Bright Blood Garnet",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007494]={d="我们有订单要交付，而我的珠宝匠们还没掌握这个新专业……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我必须在昨天就把这些订单交掉。\n\n收集 10 个光滑的金色德莱尼石。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have orders to fulfill and my jewelcrafters still aren't getting the hang of this new profession...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but I need to fulfill these orders yesterday.\n\nCollect 10 Smooth Golden Draenite. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 10 个光滑的金色德莱尼石。",oEN="Collect 10 Smooth Golden Draenite",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007495]={d="看来我们最新的配方没有草药了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们最新的配方没有草药了！我们制作的是纯天然草药配方，绝不添加任何香料！但我们最新的草药配方好像卖得很快，我们快没有原料做更多了！你能帮我们一个忙吗？\n\n收集 4 个精通合剂。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\n\nCollect 4 Elixir of Mastery. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 4 个精通合剂。",oEN="Collect 4 Elixir of Mastery",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
