Q[1007505]={d="沙塔斯城防务部刚刚发布了一份新的武器合同，奖给第一个能完成订单的团队！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但沙塔斯城防务部为第一个完成这份荒唐订单的团队提供一份武器合同！这对太平洋武器公司来说可能意义重大，因为我们最近没见到多少生意……\n\n收集 2 个邪铁棒。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="The Shattrath City Defense Department just released a new arms contract for the first group that can fill the order!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but The Shattrath City Defense Department is offering an arms contract for the first group to fill this rediculous order! This could be huge for The Pacificicous Arms Company, as we haven't been seeing a lot of business lately...\n\nCollect 2 Fel Iron Rod. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 个邪铁棒。",oEN="Collect 2 Fel Iron Rod",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007506]={d="动物权益组织对我们获取毛皮的方式感到\"担忧\"...\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，动物权益组织一直拿我们获取毛皮的方式找我们麻烦，但现在那不重要。重要的是，我需要你替我收集一些毛皮！\n\n收集 3 个外域野性长靴。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Animal rights groups are \"concerned\" with how we acquire our pelts...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\n\nCollect 3 Wild Draenish Boots. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 3 个外域野性长靴。",oEN="Collect 3 Wild Draenish Boots",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
