Q[1007528]={d="我们马上就有一笔大订单了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们的裁缝师就是做得不够快，而我们明天就要交一笔大订单！\n\n收集 6 个虚空织物捕网。",dEN="We have a big order coming up...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but our tailors just aren't working fast enough and we have a big order to fill tomorrow!\n\nCollect 6 Netherweave Net. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 6 个虚空织物捕网。",oEN="Collect 6 Netherweave Net",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007529]={d="我们有订单要交付，而我的珠宝匠们还没掌握这个新专业……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我必须在昨天就把这些订单交掉。\n\n收集 1 个重邪钢指环。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have orders to fulfill and my jewelcrafters still aren't getting the hang of this new profession...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but I need to fulfill these orders yesterday.\n\nCollect 1 Heavy Felsteel Ring. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 1 个重邪钢指环。",oEN="Collect 1 Heavy Felsteel Ring",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
