Q[1007556]={d="沙塔斯城防务部刚刚发布了一份新的武器合同，奖给第一个能完成订单的团队！\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但沙塔斯城防务部为第一个完成这份荒唐订单的团队提供一份武器合同！这对太平洋武器公司来说可能意义重大，因为我们最近没见到多少生意……\n\n收集 5 个强效护盾符。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="The Shattrath City Defense Department just released a new arms contract for the first group that can fill the order!\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but The Shattrath City Defense Department is offering an arms contract for the first group to fill this rediculous order! This could be huge for The Pacificicous Arms Company, as we haven't been seeing a lot of business lately...\n\nCollect 5 Greater Ward of Shielding. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 5 个强效护盾符。",oEN="Collect 5 Greater Ward of Shielding",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
