Q[1007577]={d="我们有订单要交付，而我的珠宝匠们还没掌握这个新专业……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我必须在昨天就把这些订单交掉。\n\n收集 8 个闪烁的蓝色月石。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have orders to fulfill and my jewelcrafters still aren't getting the hang of this new profession...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but I need to fulfill these orders yesterday.\n\nCollect 8 Sparkling Azure Moonstone. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 8 个闪烁的蓝色月石。",oEN="Collect 8 Sparkling Azure Moonstone",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
