Q[1007589]={d="我们有订单要交付，而我的珠宝匠们还没掌握这个新专业……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我必须在昨天就把这些订单交掉。\n\n收集 8 个泪珠血石榴子。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have orders to fulfill and my jewelcrafters still aren't getting the hang of this new profession...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but I need to fulfill these orders yesterday.\n\nCollect 8 Teardrop Blood Garnet. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 8 个泪珠血石榴子。",oEN="Collect 8 Teardrop Blood Garnet",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007590]={d="看来我们最新的配方没有草药了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们最新的配方没有草药了！我们制作的是纯天然草药配方，绝不添加任何香料！但我们最新的草药配方好像卖得很快，我们快没有原料做更多了！你能帮我们一个忙吗？\n\n收集 4 个强效神圣防护药水。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\n\nCollect 4 Major Holy Protection Potion. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 4 个强效神圣防护药水。",oEN="Collect 4 Major Holy Protection Potion",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007591]={d="看来我们最新的配方没有草药了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们最新的配方没有草药了！我们制作的是纯天然草药配方，绝不添加任何香料！但我们最新的草药配方好像卖得很快，我们快没有原料做更多了！你能帮我们一个忙吗？\n\n收集 4 个强效奥术防护药水。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\n\nCollect 4 Major Arcane Protection Potion. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 4 个强效奥术防护药水。",oEN="Collect 4 Major Arcane Protection Potion",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
