Q[1007614]={d="我们马上就有一笔大订单了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们的裁缝师就是做得不够快，而我们明天就要交一笔大订单！\n\n收集 2 个虚空织物长靴。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have a big order coming up...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but our tailors just aren't working fast enough and we have a big order to fill tomorrow!\n\nCollect 2 Netherweave Boots. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 2 个虚空织物长靴。",oEN="Collect 2 Netherweave Boots",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
