Q[1007622]={d="我们马上就有一笔大订单了……\n\n我们需要你们的帮助，英雄们。这可能是份不足挂齿的工作，但我们的裁缝师就是做得不够快，而我们明天就要交一笔大订单！\n\n收集 6 个虚空织物布卷。当然，你会因此获得丰厚的回报，英雄。",dEN="We have a big order coming up...\n\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but our tailors just aren't working fast enough and we have a big order to fill tomorrow!\n\nCollect 6 Bolt of Netherweave. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="收集 6 个虚空织物布卷。",oEN="Collect 6 Bolt of Netherweave",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008001]={d="现在你效忠于高级审问官。屠杀猎人与猎物吧。强者……弱者……都无所谓。把他们全部杀光，因为你现在已经是邪能之体了。",dEN="You serve the High Inquisitor now. Slaughter both hunter and prey. Strong... weak... it makes no difference. Kill them all, for you are Fel now.",o="杀死幽爪奔跑者与野鹿。",oEN="Kill Ghostpaw Runners and Wild Bucks.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008002]={d="臭林熊怪找到了一个食物充足、清水丰富、没有任何理由攻击部落或联盟的山谷。打破这份宁静。在他们队伍中撒下毁灭，让他们重新有理由去憎恨。",dEN="The Foulweald have found a valley with plenty of food, fresh water and no reason to attack the Horde or Alliance. Disturb the peace. Sow destruction in their ranks and give them reason to hate again.",o="杀死绿爪村的臭林熊怪",oEN="Kill Foulweald Furbolg at Greenpaw Village",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008003]={d="米斯特拉尔湖是宝贵的水源与魔法之源，对黑海岸的存亡至关重要。\n\n给它下毒。\n\n摧毁受腐化的水元素，让它们的污秽流入它们所守护的水域。",dEN="Mystral Lake is a valuable source of water and magics. It is critical to Ashenvale's survival.\n\nPoison it.\n\nDestroy the Befouled Water Elementals. Spread their filth to the water they protect.",o="杀死受污染的水元素。",oEN="Kill Befouled Water Elementals.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008004]={d="阴影心萨特妄图召唤地狱本身。回应他们。\n\n若你未归来，我便知他们值得一用，并且它们将取代你成为我永恒的僕从。",dEN="The Bleakheart Satyrs sought to call Hell itself. Answer them.\n\nIf you do not return I shall know they are worthy and they will take your place as my eternal servant.",o="杀死阴影心萨特",oEN="Kill Bleakheart Satyrs",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008005]={d="对我的忠诚是绝对的，但这份忠诚并非双向。你之所以能活着，只因为你有用。\n\n我的部分僕从变得软弱，延误了进攻。向邪焰丘的邪能之体展示，在我的军队里软弱会付出什么代价。",dEN="Loyalty to me is absolute, but that loyalty does not go both ways. You live only because you serve.\n\nSome of my servants have grown weak. They delay their attack. Show the Fel at Felfire Hill the cost of being weak in my army.",o="杀死灼热地狱火、邪能卫兵与曼纳罗克鞭笏者。",oEN="Kill Searing Infernals, Felguards and Mannoroc Lashers.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008006]={d="荒芜之地的灼热之刃在生前未能履行对我的义务。愿他们在死后服侍得更好。\n\n前往雷斧要塞，将他们的灵魂送到我这里。让你所杀的每一个都提醒你失败的代价。",dEN="The Burning Blade in Desolace have failed to meet their obligations to me in life. May they better serve in death.\n\nTravel to Thunder Axe Fortress and send their souls to me. Let each one you kill remind yourself of the price of failure.",o="杀死灼热之刃兽人。",oEN="Kill Burning Blade Orcs.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008007]={d="荒芜之地的半人马正在内战中寻找盟友。\n\n我们不需要盟友。把它们全部杀光。",dEN="The Centaur in Desolace are looking for allies in their war amongst each other.\n\nWe require no allies. Kill them all.",o="杀死科尔卡半人马。",oEN="Kill Kolkar Centaurs.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008008]={d="荒芜之地的马格拉姆半人马正在内战中寻找盟友。\n\n我们不需要盟友。把它们全部杀光。",dEN="The Magram Centaur in Desolace are looking for allies in their war amongst each other.\n\nWe require no allies. Kill them all.",o="杀死马格拉姆半人马",oEN="Kill Magram Centaurs",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008009]={d="生命在荒芜之地很难札下根，而我希望它永远如此。\n\n前去吧，成为我意志的工具，杀光居住在那里的生物。",dEN="Life is slow to take root in Desolace and I wish to keep it that way.\n\nGo forth and become the instrument of my desire. Slay the creatures living there.",o="杀死斯科帕希撞击者、磨牙蜥蜩与惊惧掠夺者。",oEN="Kill Scorpashi Snappers, Gritjaw Basilisks and Dread Swoops.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008010]={d="科多在年老时前往荒芜之地，在科多墓场祖先的骸骨间安详地死去。\n\n只要艾泽拉斯仍在我的影响之下，就没有任何生物能享得安宁。让它们在死前饱受折磨。",dEN="The Kodo travel to Desolace in their old age to die peacefully amonsgt the bones of their ancestors in the Kodo Graveyard.\n\nNone shall show peace while Azeroth is under my unfluence. Make them suffer before they die.",o="杀死垂死科多、老迈科多与古老科多。",oEN="Kill Dying Kodos, Aged Kodos and Ancient Kodo.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008011]={d="不要把风暴当作毁灭，因为它们经过之后，会让土地肥沃，为生命做好准备。\n\n在你清除荒芜之地的生命、确保它不会再次札根时，一并猎杀那些风暴行者。",dEN="Do not mistake a storm for being destructive, for after their passing they leave the land fertilized and ready for life.\n\nSeek out the Stormwalkers as you purge Desolace of life and ensure it does not take root again.",o="杀死旋风暴行者。",oEN="Kill Whirlwind Stormwalkers.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008012]={d="很遗憾，军团并非人人与我们目标一致。有些人只想征服艾泽拉斯，而不是摧毁它。\n\n提醒他们我们真正的目的。在他们扎下牢固根基之前摧毁他们，否则更糟的是，你会促使部落与联盟联手来阻止他们！\n\n摧毁曼纳罗克巫集会所。",dEN="It pains me to say that not all of the Legion share our goals. Some seek to merely conquer Azeroth instead of destroying it.\n\nRemind them of our true purpose. Destroy their followers before they can establish a proper foothold, or worse, encourage the Horde and Alliance to band together to stop them!\n\nDestroy the Mannoroc Coven.",o="杀死曼纳罗克巫集会所的竞争对手。",oEN="Kill the competition at Mannoroc Coven.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008013]={d="让我把“绝种”这个词说清楚。彻底杀光。连身带魂。\n\n屠杀长矛谷的半人马，然后杀掉它们的牧师，让它们的灵魂在死后也得不到安慰。\n\n它们的牧师就在通往马拉顿的洞穴里，与半人马灵魂在一起……其中许多现在都是你的责任了。它们可不会友好。",dEN="Let me be clear about my definition of extinction. Kill them totally. Body and Soul.\n\nSlaughter the Centaun in the Valley of Spears, then kill their priests so their spirits find no comfort in death.\n\nTheir priests are inside the caves leading to Mauradon with the Centaur Spirits... many of which you are responsible for now. They will not be friendly.",o="杀死马拉丁半人马与马拉丁牧师。",oEN="Kill Maraudine Centaurs and Mauradine Priests.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008014]={d="木爪豺狼人会驱逐所有入侵者，保卫自己的领土。\n\n豺狼人的滥杀本不是我会制止的事，但他们阻止了虫群向菲拉斯推进。祖卡什从希利苏斯挖隧道进入菲拉斯，但木爪豺狼人阻挡了它们的推进。\n\n杀光木爪豺狼人，好让祖卡什能为我的意志效力。",dEN="The Woodpaw defend their territory from all trespassers.\n\nGnolls killing indiscriminately isn't something I would normally put an end to, but they have halted the Hive from advancing into Feralas. The Zukk'ash have tunneled into Feralas from Silithus, but the Woodpaw have prevented them from advancing.\n\nKill the Woodpaw so that the Zukk'ash may serve my will.",o="杀死木爪豺狼人。",oEN="Kill Woodpaw Gnolls.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008015]={d="毁掉菲拉斯的本土掠食者。扰乱生态系统是我们在那里取胜的关键。\n\n你会在菲拉斯各处找到这些野兽，但最弱小的居住在低地丛林。",dEN="Decimate the predators native to Feralas. Destabilizing the ecosystem is key to our victory there.\n\nYou will find these beasts all through Feralas, but the weakest of them reside in the Lower Wilds.",o="杀死铁毛熊与长牙奔跑者。",oEN="Kill Ironfur Bears and Longtooth Runners.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008016]={d="是时候将我的计划付诸实施了。至今为止，它们的虫巢一直未被扰动。攻击祖卡什虫巢。\n\n削弱虫巢会从希利苏斯引来增援，并开始向菲拉斯推进。",dEN="It's time to put my plan into motion. So far their Hive has remained undisturbed. Attack the Zukk'ash Hive.\n\nWeakening the Hive will provoke reinforcements from Silithus and begin the push into Feralas.",o="杀死祖卡什异种虫。",oEN="Kill Zukk'ash Silithid.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008017]={d="严酷帕族既不是部落也不是联盟的朋友，但他们与菲拉斯的联系，就如树根与树木般紧密。\n\n他们的萨满与自然主义者会停止敌对行动，并试图重新平衡菲拉斯的生态系统。你要阻止他们破坏我的成果。",dEN="The Grimtotem are no friends to the Horde or Alliance, but they are connected to Feralas as strongly as the roots to the trees.\n\nTheir shaman and naturist will cease hostilities and seek to balance the ecosystem in Feralas. You will prevent them from undoing my work.",o="杀死严酷帕牛头人。",oEN="Kill Grimtotem Tauren.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008018]={d="在菲拉斯执行我的意志时，砍倒你们遇到的森林行者。当我的地狱火行军经过时，他们的尸体将是极好的引火料。",dEN="Chop down the Forest Walkers you encounter while carrying out my will in Feralas. Their corpses will make great kindling when my Infernals march through.",o="杀死漫游的森林行者。",oEN="Kill Wandering Forest Walkers.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008019]={d="古老的魔法在伊西尔迪恩废墟中回旋。我可以用那种魔法召唤地狱火，烧尽菲拉斯。\n\n消灭戈尔杜尼食人魔，好让我的邪教徒能开始必要的仪式。",dEN="Old magics swirl in the Ruins of Isiildien. I can use that magic to summon my Infernals to burn Feralas.\n\nClear out the Gordunni Ogre so my cultists can begin the required rituals.",o="杀死戈尔杜尼食人魔。",oEN="Kill Gordunni Ogres.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008020]={d="你必须毫无疑问地服从，否则将在毫无惜悯中死去。\n\n杀死怒痕要塞的雪怪。",dEN="You will obey without question. Or you will die without mercy.\n\nKill the Yeti in Rage Scar Hold.",o="杀死怒痕雪怪。",oEN="Kill Rage Scar Yetis.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008021]={d="我需要渡鸦风废墟。杀死废墟里的鹰身女妖，好让我的邪教徒能据此安营。",dEN="I require the Ruins of Ravenwind. Kill the Harpies in the ruins so my cultists can move in.",o="杀死渡鸦风女妖。",oEN="Kill Ravenwind Harpies.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008022]={d="当菲拉斯燃起军团的烈焰时，萨满会召唤水元素来拯救森林。你要确保没有任何元素可供召唤。\n\n摧毁遗忘海岸的元素。",dEN="When Feralas burns with the Legions Flames the Water Elementals will be called by the Shaman to save the forest. You will ensure no elementals are left to call.\n\nDestroy the elementals on The Forgotten Coast.",o="杀死海浪与海洋元素。",oEN="Kill Sea Spray and Sea Elementals.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008023]={d="杀死庞大的家伙真是令人愉悦。它们从来不会料到，而它们倒下时发出的声音如此悦耳。\n\n你至今表现不错。我允许你享受这项任务。\n\n杀死遗忘海岸的巨人，听听它们倒下的声音。",dEN="Killing something big is so satisfying. They never expect it, and the the sound they make when they fall is joyous.\n\nYou have served well so far. You have permission to enjoy this task.\n\nKill the Giants on The Forgotten Coast and listen to their falls.",o="杀死海岸步行者、浪涛步行者与深淵步行者。",oEN="Kill Shore Striders, Wave Striders and Deep Striders.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008024]={d="很少有战士能在战斗中与军团匹敌。戈多克食人魔大概会杀了你，但你的命属于我，由我来消耗。\n\n你生或死对我而言毫无区别。在我的军团到达前，削弱戈多克的军力。",dEN="Few warriors can match the Legion in combat. The Gordok Ogre will probably kill you, but your life is mine to spend.\n\nLive or die makes no difference to me. Soften the Gordok forces before my Legion arrives.",o="杀死戈多克食人魔。",oEN="Kill Gordok Ogres.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008025]={d="熊怪们已经安于在温泉与巨木哨所附近生活。屠杀它们。我要那些温泉溢满它们的鲜血。",dEN="The Furbolgs have grown content living near their Hot Springs and Timbermaw Post. Slaughter them. I want those Springs overflowing with their blood.",o="杀死冬泉熊怪。",oEN="Kill Winterfall Furbolgs.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008026]={d="杀死冰蓟流浪者。看着它们孤零零地死去，脱离部族、无人相助。我要你看清它们是怎么死的。\n\n你以为若你失职，你的死法会有什么不同吗？",dEN="Kill the Rogue Ice Thistles. Watch as they die alone, isolated from thier tribes with no one to help them. I want you to watch how they die.\n\nDo you imagine your death will be any different if you fail in your servitude?",o="杀死冰蓟流浪者。",oEN="Kill Rogue Icethistles.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008027]={d="只有当雪被鲜血染红，或在我的地狱火脚下融化时，它才是可以接受的。\n\n画布已经给你了；冬泉谷的原生生物会为你提供颜料。",dEN="The only time snow is acceptible is when it is painted in blood or melting under the feet of my Infernals.\n\nYou have the canvas, the creatures native to winterspring will provide the paint.",o="杀死冰风雏鸟与碎牙熊",oEN="Kill Fledgling Chillwind and Shardtooth Bear",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008028]={d="你以为杀完了？枭子才会那么想！那可真是个笑话！\n\n不许笑。我不开玩笑。若我想听你笑，只需命令即可。别再弄乱我的羽毛。",dEN="Owl be damned if you think you are done killing. That would be a hoot!\n\nDo not laugh. I don't makes jokes. If I desired your laughter I would simply command it. Stop ruffling my feathers.",o="杀死怒吼枭兽与冬泉猫头鹰。",oEN="Kill Raging Owlbeasts and Winterspring Owls.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008029]={d="在军团面前无处可避。摧毁冬泉村。",dEN="There is no shelter from the Legion. Destroy Winterfall Village.",o="杀死冬泉村的居民",oEN="Kill Residents of Winterfall Village",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008030]={d="毫无疑问、毫无惜悯地服从。杀死霜刃岩的霜刃幼虎。",dEN="Obey without question or mercy. Kill the Frostsaber cubs at Frostsaber Rock.",o="杀死霜刃幼虎",oEN="Kill Frostsaber Cubs",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008031]={d="你受命屠杀冬泉谷的奇美拉。",dEN="You are commanded to slaughter the Chimera in Winterspring.",o="杀死冰风蹂躏者",oEN="Kill Chillwind Ravagers",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008032]={d="我必须弄清楚这些枭兽为何发疯。杀死它们，看看里面。无论是什么让这些枭兽发疯，都可能用在冬泉谷其余的生物身上。",dEN="I must know why these Owlbeast are going crazy. Kill them and look inside. Whatever drove these Owlbeasts crazy could be used on the rest of Winterspring.",o="杀死月触枭兽、狂暴枭兽与疯狂枭兽。",oEN="Kill Moontouched Owlbeasts, Berserk Owlbeasts and Crazed Owlbeasts.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008033]={d="一张半湿的合约钉在告示板上。你勉强能辨认出灰谷法拉希姆湖的地图，上面写着\"Mmmrrglllm Mmgr Mmmurlok\"",dEN="A half soaked contract is pinned to the board. You can barely make out a map of Lake Falathim in Ashenvale with the words \"Mmmrrglllm Mmgr Mmmurlok\"",o="前往灰谷的法拉希姆湖，查明这份神秘合约的来历。",oEN="Seek out the source of the mysterious contract at Lake Falathim in Ashenvale",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你很好地服侍了军团，邪铸者。拿走你的奖赏吧。\n相关",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.\nRelated"}
Q[1008034]={d="是时候倾军团全力，对付那些可悲的人类了。\n\n把暴风城烧成废墟！",dEN="It is time to bring the full force of the legion to bear on the pathetic humans.\n\nBurn Stormwind to the ground!",o="在暴风城杀死伯瓦尔·弗塔根。",oEN="Slay Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008035]={d="是时候倾军团全力，对付那些可悲的矮人了。\n\n把铁炉堡烧成废墟！",dEN="It is time to bring the full force of the legion to bear on the pathetic dwarves.\n\nBurn Ironforge to the ground!",o="在铁炉堡杀死麦格尼·铜须与大匠师梅卡托克。",oEN="Slay Magni Bronzebeard and High Tinker Mekkatorque in Ironforge.",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008036]={d="是时候倾军团全力，对付那些可悲的暗夜精灵了。\n\n把达纳苏斯烧成废墟！",dEN="It is time to bring the full force of the legion to bear on the pathetic nightelves.\n\nBurn Darnassus to the ground!",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008037]={d="兽人们要么喝下邪能之血，要么被烧死！\n\n把暴风城烧成废墟！杀光所有拒绝邪能之血的人！",dEN="The orcs will drink the Fel Blood or they will burn!\n\nBurn Stormwind to the ground! Slay all who deny the blood!",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008038]={d="不死者拒绝臣服于军团。\n\n把幽暗城变成永久的墓窟！",dEN="The undead refuse to submit to the legion.\n\nTurn the Undercity into a permament grave!",o="在幽暗城杀死希尔瓦娜斯·风行者。",oEN="Slay Sylvanas Windrunner in Undercity.",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008039]={d="是时候倾军团全力，对付那些可悲的牛头人了。\n\n把雷霍崖烧成废墟！",dEN="It is time to bring the full force of the legion to bear on the pathetic Tauren.\n\nBurn Thunderbluff to the ground!",o="在雷霍崖杀死凯恩·血蹄",oEN="Slay Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.",p="你的任务还未完成。完成合同后回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1008047]={d="赞加沼泽正在死去。生物们在痛苦中缓缓干枯。它们的坚持树立了坏榜样。屠杀在死沼中挣扎求生的生物。",dEN="Zangarmarsh is dying. The creatures are suffering, slowly drying out. Their perserverance sets a bad example. Slaughter the creatures struggling for survival in The Dead Mire.",o="屠杀在死沼中挣扎求生的生物。",oEN="Slaughter the creatures struggling for survival in The Dead Mire.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008048]={d="幽沼巨魔很少离开自己的村子，只想安安静静地度日。好好享受，玩得开心。消灭幽沼村。",dEN="The Umbrafen rarely leave their village, wishing nothing more than to be left in peace. Enjoy yourself and have some fun. Exterminate Umbrafen Village.",o="消灭幽沼村。",oEN="Exterminate Umbrafen Village.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008049]={d="黑冠纳迦忘了瓦丝琪女士效忠于谁。它们惰怠度日，宁愿看着奴隶干活，却忘了自己也是军团的奴隶。惩罚潞湖与幽沼湖周围黑冠纳迦的惰怠。",dEN="The Darkcrest Naga forget who Lady Vashj serves. They idle about, preferring to watch their slaves work while forgetting they are themselves slaves to the Legion. Punish the Darkcrest around The Lagoon and Umbrafen Lake for their laziness.",o="惩罚潞湖与幽沼湖周围的黑冠纳迦。",oEN="Punish the Darkcrest around The Lagoon and Umbrafen Lake.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008050]={d="血鳞纳迦自视甚高，不甘于如今的地位。我派你去评判它们的价值。若你未归来……我会考虑它们的请求。测试盘牙水库与沼光湖周围的血鳞纳迦。",dEN="The Bloodscale Naga believe themselves worthy beyond their current station. I am sending you to judge their worth. Should you not return... I will consider their requests. Test the Bloodscale Naga around Coilfang Reservoir and Marshlight Lake.",o="测试盘牙水库与沼光湖周围的血鳞纳迦。",oEN="Test the Bloodscale Naga around Coilfang Reservoir and Marshlight Lake.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008051]={d="可悲的孢子人已证明是部落与联盟的盟友。我们的斥候发现大量孢子人正在凯戈尔洞穴采集食物。把它们干掉。",dEN="The pathetic Sporeggar creatures have proven allies to the Horde and Alliance. Our scouts have detected a large number of Sporeloks gathering food at Funggor Cavern. Put them to the sword.",o="伏击在凯戈尔洞穴采集食物的孢子人。",oEN="Gank the Sporeloks gathering food at Funggor Cavern.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008052]={d="孢子人软弱不堪，不配做军团的奴隶。难怪它们会与外域的部落与联盟战争机器结盟。若数量庞大，它们可能成为我们敌人的助力。前往产卵峡谷，在孢子人幼体成长为战士之前将它们屠杀。",dEN="The Sporeggar are weak and unfit to be slaves to the Legion. It is no surprise they have allied themselves with the Horde and Alliance war effort in Outland. In large numbers they could prove worth a boon to our enemies. Visit the Spawning Glen. Slaugher the Spreggar Spawn before they can grow into warriors.",o="屠杀产卵峡谷的孢子人幼体。",oEN="Slaugher the Spreggar Spawn in the Spawning Glen.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008053]={d="用你的力量去挑战安戈罗什要塞。击败驻防要塞的食人魔，证明你是一个军团可以信赖的僕从。",dEN="Pit your strength against the Ango'rosh Stronghold. Defeat the Ogre that garrison the stronghold and prove yourself a servent the Legion can rely on.",o="击败安戈罗什要塞的食人魔。",oEN="Defeat the Ogre in Ango'rosh Stronghold.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008054]={d="['控制图雷姆是军团收复泰罗卡林地计划的关键。驱逐现有居民，为军团占据这一战略要地。']",dEN="Controlling Tuurem is key to the Legion's plans to reclaim Terokkar Forest. Evict the current residents and claim this tactical location for the Legion.",o="屠杀图雷姆的居民。",oEN="Slaughter the residents in Tuurem.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008055]={d="火翼血精灵似乎不愿遵从我的命令。你受命前往火翼尖塔杀死它们。不要犯下它们同样的错误，妄图质疑这道命令。",dEN="The Firewing Blood Elves seem reluctant to follow my commands. You are commanded to Firewing Point to kill them. Do not repeat their mistake and think to question this command.",o="杀死火翼尖塔的血精灵。",oEN="Kill the Bloodelves at Firewing Point.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008056]={d="影子议会愚蠢地以为可以据我们的僕从为己有，还妄图奴役末日卫兵。前往影子阶梯，让这个密教团体记住与军团作对的后果。",dEN="The Shadow Council foolishly thinks to appropriate our servants and seek to enslave Doomguards to serve them. Visit The Shadow Stair and remind this cabal the consequences of crossing the Legion.",o="摧毁影子阶梯的影子议会成员。",oEN="Destroy the Shadow Council members at The Shadow Stair.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008057]={d="奥金顿正东的扭曲土丘引起了我的兴趣。如此多的骸骨。如此多的死亡。一个德莱尼教派在骸骨之间崇拜死亡。我想看看，若往这堆里再添些骸骨会怎样。屠杀那里的德莱尼。",dEN="The Writhing Mound just east of Auchindoun intrigues me. So many bones. So much death. A cult of Draenei worship death amongst their bones. I need to see what happens if we introduce even more bones to the pile. Slaughter the draenei there.",o="屠杀扭曲土丘的德莱尼。",oEN="Slaughter the Draenei at The Writhing Mound.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008058]={d="石拳食人魔想结盟。它们在流血之穴废墟驻有一支占领部队。去试试它们的成色。若你未回到我这里……我就开始与它们的领袖谈判。",dEN="The Boulderfist Ogre seek an alliance. They have an occupying force at the Bleeding Hollow Ruins. Test their worth. If you do not return to me... I shall begin negotiations with their leaders.",o="测试流血之穴废墟的食人魔。",oEN="Test the Ogres in Bleeding Hollow Ruins.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008059]={d="虚灵在光之陵墓里寻找着什么。它们怎敢在我们已宣告主权的土地上追求力量。消灭陵墓里的虚灵。",dEN="The Ethereal are seeking something in the Tomb of Lights. How dare they seek power in a land we have claimed. Extinguish the Ethereal in the tomb.",o="消灭光之陵墓的虚灵。",oEN="Extinguish the Ethereal in the Tomb of Light.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008060]={d="骨咬者废墟的邪能兽人一直听从火翼血精灵的命令。让这些兽人明白，除了绝对服从军团，任何其他做法都要付出代价。",dEN="The Fel Orcs in the Bonechewer Ruins have been taking orders from the Firewing Blood Elves. Show these Orcs the cost of anything less than absolute obedience to the Legion.",o="杀死骨咬者废墟的邪能兽人。",oEN="Slay the Fel Orcs in the Bonechewer Ruins.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008061]={d="影子议会仍在图谋影响军团。歼灭基尔索罗要塞里它们的跟随者。",dEN="The Shadow Council still seeks to gain influence over the Legion. Wipe out their followers at Kil'sorrow Fortress.",o="歼灭基尔索罗要塞的影子议会跟随者。",oEN="Wipe out the Shadow Council Followers at Kil'sorrow Fortress.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008062]={d="虚空幼体在纳格兰的灵魂之野四处游荡。猎杀这些生物，磨练你的技巧，以便更好地服侍你的主人。",dEN="Voidspawn roam the Spirit Fields in Nagrand. Hunt these creatures and hone your skills so you may better serve your masters.",o="猎杀游荡在纳格兰灵魂之野的虚空幼体",oEN="Hunt Voidspawn roaming the Spirit Fields in Nagrand",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008063]={d="嘲弄骷髅废墟的战锤食人魔自认有资格成为我们的盟友。它们若想加入军团，就必须把你的尸体带给我。让它们自己去争取；若它们证明不配，就回到我这里领取下一项任务。",dEN="The Warmaul Ogre in the Laughing Skull Ruins believe themselves worthy of being our allies. If they wish to join the Legion they must bring me your body. Make them work for it, and should they prove unworthy return to me for your next assignment.",o="测试嘲弄骷髅废墟的战锤食人魔。",oEN="Test the Warmaul Ogre in the Laughing Skull Ruins.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008064]={d="你表现得……还算合格，<race>。我允许你去战锤丘散散步。我相信你会在路上用你惯用的手法，征得战锤氏族的许可。",dEN="You have served... adequately <race>ace. I am granting you leave to take a hike through Warmaul Hill. I trust you will acquire permission from the Warmaul on the path using your usual methods.",o="屠杀战锤丘的食人魔。",oEN="Slaughter the Ogre at Warmaul Hill.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008065]={d="是时候将军团的影响扩展到纳格兰了。日泉哨所将成为我们新锻造营地的所在地。驱逐当地居民，开始动工建造憎怒锻造营地。",dEN="The time has come to extend the Legion's influence in Nagrand. Sunspring Post will be the location for our new Forge Camp. Evict the residents and break ground for Forge Camp Odium.",o="谋杀日泉哨所的居民。",oEN="Murder the residents in Sunspring Post.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008066]={d="玛格汉靠在加拉达尔郊外轻松猎物而变强。屠杀那些生物，把尸体留下腐烂，促使野兽逃离该地区。",dEN="The Mag'har grow strong with such easy hunting outside Garadar. Slaughter the creatures and leave their corpses to rot to encourage the beasts to flee the area.",o="屠杀玛格汉村周围的生物。",oEN="Slaughter the creatures around Mag'har Village.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008067]={d="你见过碎裂轰鸣者是怎么分崩离析的吗？它们拼命挣扎求生的样子多么可笑！前往灵魂之野南缘，把它们击碎！回来告诉我，你杀它们时它们如何痛苦。",dEN="Have you seen the way the Shattered Rumblers break apart? How strongly they try to hold on to life? Travel to the Southern Edge of the Spirit fields and shatter them! Return to me and tell me how they suffer as you kill them.",o="击碎灵魂之野南缘的碎裂轰鸣者。",oEN="Shatter the Shattered Rumblers in the southern edge of the Spirit Fields.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008068]={d="刃尖食人魔配不配服侍像格鲁尔这样的主人？去判定刃尖要塞的食人魔是否值得军团关注。",dEN="The Bladespire Ogre are worthy enough to serve a master such as Gruul. Determine if the Ogre in Bladespire Hold are worthy of the Legion attention.",o="挑战刃尖要塞的食人魔。",oEN="Challenge the Ogre in Bladespire Hold.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008069]={d="你受命消灭格里什纳斯的鸦人。不要让你的<race>失望。",dEN="You have been commanded to exterminate the Grishnath Arakkoa. Do not disappoint me <race>ace.",o="屠杀格里什纳斯的鸦人。",oEN="Slaughter the Arakkoa in Grishnath.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008070]={d="部落与联盟在斯卡尔德采集灼热元素的核心，用以制造轰炸我们铁炉堡营地的炸弹。猎杀这些元素直至它们绝迹，绝不让它们得到这种宝贵资源。",dEN="The Horde and Alliance harvest the cores from Searing Elementals in Skald to craft the bombs they use to bombard our Forge Camps. Hunt these elementals to extinction and deny them this valuable resource.",o="摧毁斯卡尔德的灼热元素。",oEN="Destroy the Searing Elementals in Skald.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008071]={d="你的效忠令你增光不少，<name>。前往死亡之门，用你的力量去挑战我在那里的僕从。在战斗中击败死亡之力，夺取你梦寐以求的力量。",dEN="Your servitude does you credit <name>ame. Travel to Death's Door and pit your might against my servants there. Defeat the Death's Might in combat and claim the power you so desire.",o="在死亡之门击败死亡之力。",oEN="Defeat Deaths Might at Death's Door.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008072]={d="面纱维克赫的鸦人已拒绝我们效忠军团的提议。把它们全部屠杀。让这场屠杀成为警示，以儆效尤，警告所有妄图拒绝军团的人。",dEN="The Arakkoa in Veil Vekh have declined our offer to serve the Legion. Slaughter them all. Let this massacre serve as an example to any who would seek to refuse the Legion.",o="将死亡带给面纱维克赫的鸦人。",oEN="Bring Death to the Arakkoa in Veil Vekh.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008073]={d="我的斥候发现两个从赞加沼泽通往刀锋山的洞穴。这是向该地区部落与联盟要塞发动进攻的完美集结地！为我们的部队清除这些洞穴。",dEN="My scouts have detected two caverns leading into Blade's Edge Mountains from Zangarmarsh. This is the perfect staging grounds to launch an assault on the Horde the Alliance fortresses in the area! Clear out the caverns for our troops.",o="清除连接赞加沼泽与刀锋山的洞穴。",oEN="Clear out the caverns connecting Zangarmash and Blade's Edge Mountains.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008074]={d="虚空之翼拒绝运送我们的部队去攻打部落与联盟。前往歌唱山脊，屠杀它们中最弱小、最无力抵抗的成员，促使它们重新考虑自己的拒绝。",dEN="The Netherwing refuse to fly our troops in an assault against the Horde and Alliance. Travel to Singing Ridge and slaughter the weakest, most helpless among them to motivate them to rethink their refusal.",o="在歌唱山脊屠杀较弱小的虚空幼龙。",oEN="Slaughter the Lesser Nether Drake at the Singing Ridge.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008075]={d="我的一个对手正在阿克隆废墟寻找一件神器。在审问官埃科拉什的猎犬发现更多神器之前把它们杀光！外域是我的战利品，只能由我掠夺。",dEN="One of my rivals is seeking an artifact in the Arklon Ruins. Kill Ekkorash the Inquisitor's hounds before they uncover more artifacts! Outlands is MINE to pillage.",o="在阿克隆废墟击败我对手的僕从。",oEN="Defeat my rival's minions at Arklon Ruins.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008076]={d="基尔纳瓦尔村法师行列的元素以弥漫全村的环境能量为食。击败它们。我想派我的邪能猎犬前往该地区，以这股能量为食。",dEN="The Elementals in Wizard Row at Kirin'var Village feed on the ambient power that permeates the village. Defeat them. I wish to send my Fel Hounds to the area to feed off this energy.",o="在基尔纳瓦尔村的法师行列击败元素。",oEN="Defeat the Elementals in Wizard Row at Kirin'var Village.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008077]={d="这件事也许是私仇，但它依然是命令。我在远野生态圆顶发现了最了不起的小家伙，我叫它小鲁思。我本想在我们烧毁这个世界之前捉住这只可爱的小家伙，但它已经成了住在那里的尖牙的零食。去替我复仇！",dEN="This may be personal, but it is still a command. I found the most amazing critter in Eco-Dome Farfield. I named it Little Looth. I had intended on capturing the cute critter before we burned this world but it has become a snack to the Sharp Tooth living there. Go extract my revenge!",o="杀死远野生态圆顶的生物。",oEN="Kill the creatures in Eco-Dome Farfield.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008078]={d="库卢斯派出了他的僕从前往法拉隆废墟，却拒绝告知我它们在废墟中的目的。我不能容许对手不缴纳贡奉就自由行事。屠杀他的僕从。",dEN="Culuthas has sent his minions to the Ruins of Farahlon. He refuses to inform me of their purpose in the ruins. I cannot allow a rival to operate freely without paying me tribute. Slaughter his minions.",o="屠杀法拉隆废墟中库卢斯的僕从。",oEN="Slaughter the minions of Culuthas in the Ruins of Farahlon.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008079]={d="埃泰雷姆集结地的虚灵正在浪费自己的潜力……因为它们不愿加入军团的事业。你受命摧毁它们！",dEN="The Ethereal at the Ethereum Staging Ground are wasting their potential... by not joining the Legion's cause. You are command to destroy them!",o="消耗埃泰雷姆集结地的埃泰雷姆。",oEN="Waste the Etherium at the Etherium Staging Grounds.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008080]={d="虚空巨龙再次挑衅我们要求它们加入军团的命令！若它们拒绝效忠，就必须被摧毁。屠杀天空山脊的虚空幼龙与巨龙！",dEN="Again the Nether Dragons defy our demands to join the Legion! If they refuse to serve they must be destroyed. Slaughter the Nether Drakes and Dragon in Celestial Ridge!",o="屠杀天空山脊的虚空幼龙与巨龙！",oEN="Slaughter the Nether Drakes and Dragon in Celestial Ridge!",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008081]={d="我派监工格林加尔去监督特雷姆矿的作业。他的产量令人不满。杀了他和他那些惰惰的工人。",dEN="I assigned Overmaster Grindgarr to oversee the operations at Trelleum Mine. His production has been unsatisfactory. Kill him and his lazy workers.",o="在特雷姆矿杀死监工格林加尔及其惰惰的工人。",oEN="Slay Overmaster Grindgarr and his lazy workers at the Trelleum Mine.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008082]={d="部落与联盟结成同盟，对军团而言……相当麻烦。但他们并不信任彼此，仍在不断修筑防御工事，指望着重新开战。屠杀野锤要塞与影月村之间岩浆场上的邪能野猪与邪火双脊飞龙。也许除掉他们两支军力之间的障碍，就能促成我们期望的冲突。",dEN="The Horde and Alliance standing united has proven... problematic for the Legion. Yet they do not trust each other and continue to build fortifications expecting to return to war with each other. Slaughter the Felboars and Felfire Diemetradon in the Magma fields between Wildhammer Fortress and Shadowmoon Village. Perhaps removing the obstacle between their two forces will encourage the conflict we desire.",o="屠杀野锤要塞与影月村之间岩浆场上的邪能野猪与邪火双脊飞龙。",oEN="Slaughter the Felboars and Felfire Diemetradon in the Magma fields between Wildhammer Fortress and Shadowmoon Village.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008083]={d="只有最强壮的兽人才能获准守卫死亡锻造厂。我很好奇他们的训练与我的相比如何。去向这些兽人展示你的技巧吧。若你未归，我会派更合适的人去收死，顺便看看要多少个死亡锻造厂才能打倒一个邪铸者。",dEN="Only the strongest orcs are trusted to guard the Deathforge. I am curious if how their training compares to my own. Go test your skills against these Orcs. If you do not return I will send someone better suited to collect your body and see how many Deathforge are required to bring down a Felforged.",o="在死亡锻造厂向兽人展示你的技巧。",oEN="Test your skills against the Orcs in the Deathforge.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008084]={d="你的主人命你屠杀盘牙岬的盘牙纳迦。",dEN="Your master commands you to slaughter the Coilskar Naga at Coilskar Point.",o="屠杀盘牙岬的盘牙纳迦。",oEN="Slaughter the Coilskar Naga at Coilskar Point.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008085]={d="伊利达雷正在巴尔里废墟进行未经授权的工作，并拒绝说明用途。屠杀他们的工人。提醒他们，他们是为军团做事，而不是与军团合作。",dEN="The Illidari are performing unsanctioned work in the Ruins of Baa'ri and refuse to explain their purpose. Slaughter their workers. Remind them that they work for the Legion, not with the Legion.",o="杀死巴尔里废墟的灰舌工人。",oEN="Fire the Ashtongue Workers in the Ruins of Baa'ri.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008086]={d="若虚空巨龙拒绝效忠军团，它们就会被奴役。龙喉兽人已制服了好几头幼龙。突袭龙喉要塞，屠杀他们的军队，以惩罚他们未将这些幼龙交给军团。",dEN="If the Nether Dragons refuse to serve the Legion they will be enslaved. The Dragonmaw Orcs have subjugated a number of the drakes. Assault Dragonmaw Fortress. Slaughter their forces for not delivering these Drakes to the Legion.",o="屠杀龙喉要塞的兽人军队。",oEN="Slaughter the Orc forces at Dragonmaw Fortress.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008087]={d="我的斥候报告显示，龙喉兽人正在虚空翼岩采集水晶。这可能就是他们奴役虚空巨龙的方法。不拘任何手段，阻止他们的工作。",dEN="My scout reports indicate the Dragonmaw are harvesting the crystals in Netherwing Ledge. This may be how they are enslaving the Nether Dragons. Prevent their work by any means necessary.",o="摧毁在虚空翼岩采集水晶的苦工。",oEN="Destroy the Peons harvesting crystals in Netherwing Ledge.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008088]={d="我怀疑伊利达雷正在训练新的恶魔猎手，以应对我的邪铸者所带来的威胁。这是不能容忍的。在这些恶魔猎手学徒成为威胁之前，把他们屠杀。",dEN="I suspect the Illidari are training new Demon Hunters to counter the threat my Felforged present. This will not be tolerated. Slaughter the Demon Hunter trainees before they can become a threat.",o="屠杀卡拉波尔废墟的恶魔猎手学徒。",oEN="Slaughter the Demon Hunter trainees in the Ruins of Karabor.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008090]={d="荒芜之地的盖尔基斯半人马正在内战中寻找盟友。\n\n我们不需要盟友。把它们全部杀光。",dEN="The Gelkis Centaur in Desolace are looking for allies in their war amongst each other.\n\nWe require no allies. Kill them all.",o="杀死盖尔基斯半人马",oEN="Kill Gelkis Centaurs",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008091]={d="若你连我的敌人都打不赢，就对我毫无价值。你当前的目标需要与军团的其他特工合作。你与其他邪铸者的结盟是否会超出这次猎杀，由你自己决定……深入马兹托里尔，杀死幼龙克里耶尔与法力之爪。",dEN="You are worthless to me if you cannot defeat my enemies. Your current target will require cooperating with other agents of the Legion. Rather your alliance with other Felforged extends beyond your hunt is up to you... Venture deep into Mazthoril and slay the drakes Scryer and Manaclaw.",o="击败克里耶尔与法力之爪",oEN="Defeat Scryer and Manaclaw",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008092]={d="必须尽快解决钴蓝龙裔。我们不能给它们时间整合军力。对马兹托里尔发动突袭，屠杀那些龙裔。",dEN="The Cobalt Dragonspawn must be dealt with swiftly. We cannot allow them time to consolidate their forces. Lead an assault on Mazthoril and slaughter the Dragonspawn.",o="屠杀钴蓝织法者、幼龙人与鳞骨者。",oEN="Slaughter Cobalt Mageweavers, Wyrmkins and Scalebanes.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008093]={d="霜锤巨人已在霜语峡谷集结，妄图将我的军力挡在该地区之外。摧毁这些巨人，好让我能派出军团猎犬，嗅出它们所守护的秘密。",dEN="The Frostmaul Giants have amassed at Frostwhisper Gorge and are intent on keeping my forces away from the area. Destroy the giants so I may send my Fel Hounds to sniff out the secrets they are protecting.",o="摧毁霜锤巨人与守护者",oEN="Destroy the Frostmaul Giants and Preservers",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008094]={d="艾泽拉斯属于我，任我灼烧。但赫德琳女士派出了一支精锐部队，占据了黑语峡谷。她想夺走我的荣耀！当艾泽拉斯燃烧时，写入军团典册的将只有我的名字，仅此一个。前往黑语峡谷，摧毁她的军队。",dEN="Azeroth is mine is burn. Yet the Lady Hederine has sent an elite force to occupy Darkwhisper Gorge. She seeks to steal my glory! When Azeroth burns it will be my name written in the Legion's Lexicon and my name alone. Travel to Darkwhisper Gorge and destroy her forces.",o="摧毁赫德琳杀手、入门者、法力追踪者与副官。",oEN="Destroy Hederine Slayers, Initiates, Manastalkers and Lieutenants.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008121]={d="在战场上证明你的价值！前往指定战场，杀死挡在你路上的部落、联盟或军团成员。\n\n在指定的战场区域内，你每持有一个活动中的挑战，就能额外获得灵魂。",dEN="Prove yourself on the battlefield! Travel to the designated battlefield and slay the Horde and Alliance, or Legion who get in your way!\n\nWhile in a designated Battlefield area you will earn bonus Souls for each challenge you have active.",o="在战场上取得 3 次击杀。",oEN="Earn 3 kills on the battlefield."}
Q[1008122]={d="在战场上证明你的价值！前往指定战场，杀死挡在你路上的部落、联盟或军团成员。\n\n在指定的战场区域内，你每持有一个活动中的挑战，就能额外获得灵魂。",dEN="Prove yourself on the battlefield! Travel to the designated battlefield and slay the Horde and Alliance, or Legion who get in your way!\n\nWhile in a designated Battlefield area you will earn bonus Souls for each challenge you have active.",o="在战场上取得 3 次击杀。",oEN="Earn 3 kills on the battlefield."}
Q[1008123]={d="在战场上证明你的价值！前往指定战场，杀死挡在你路上的部落、联盟或军团成员。\n\n在指定的战场区域内，你每持有一个活动中的挑战，就能额外获得灵魂。",dEN="Prove yourself on the battlefield! Travel to the designated battlefield and slay the Horde and Alliance, or Legion who get in your way!\n\nWhile in a designated Battlefield area you will earn bonus Souls for each challenge you have active.",o="在战场上取得 3 次击杀。",oEN="Earn 3 kills on the battlefield."}
Q[1008124]={d="希尔斯布拉德农场虽然常遭袭击，依然是联盟给养的主要供应来源。人类有个说法叫“盐化农场”。既然田里有那么多农夫，就不必麻烦用盐了。屠杀希尔斯布拉德农场的人类，用他们的鲜血浸透土地，绝不让任何作物再去喂养他们的军队。",dEN="Hillsbrad Fields, despite being the target of frequent raids, remains a primary supplies of the Alliance's provisions. The humans use the term salting the fields. I see no need to get salty when there are so many farmers in the fields. Slaughter the humans in Hillsbrad fields and soak the soil with their blood to prevent any further crops from feeding their armies.",o="屠杀希尔斯布拉德的农夫。",oEN="Slaughter Hillsbrad Workers.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008125]={d="当我们将战火引向幽暗城时，邓·加罗克要塞将是极佳的作战基地。该要塞目前由一群矮人驻守，他们比我们最初认为的更加顽强。集结一队军团邪铸者，为军团夺下这座要塞！",dEN="Dun Garok Fortress will be an excellent base of operations when we take the fight to the Undercity. The Legion is currently garrisoned by a group of dwarves that have proven more resilient than we first believed. Gather a group of Felforged and claim the Fortress for the Legion!",o="击败邓·加罗克的军队。",oEN="Defeat the Dun Garok Forces.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008126]={d="库尔森人是制药的行家。这些人类或许不属于联盟，但他们会把药材卖给出价最高的人。屠杀储藏库的库尔森人。用尸体填满洞穴，并毁掉存放在里面的药材，以防部落或联盟得到它们。",dEN="The Kurzen are expert medicine makers. These humans may not be aligned with the Alliance, but they will sell their supply to the highest bidder. Slaughter the Kurzen in The Stockpile. Fill the cave with corpses and spoil the medicines stored within to prevent the Horde or Alliance from acquiring them.",o="解决库尔森的问题。",oEN="Remedy the Kurzen Situation.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008127]={d="我到处寻找暗月马戏团 3000 系列的新卡牌。西拉斯造得不够快，而所有暗月马戏团的商贩都在几秒内就卖断货。你敢信吗，一个血鳞巨魔竟然想卖我一张？而且价格几乎翻了一倍！我听说巨魔们到处倒卖，但没想到倒卖竟然如此可恶。前往祖尔·昆达废墟，屠杀那些倒卖商。我们不能让一个比军团更可怕的邪恶，抢在我们前面毁掉艾泽拉斯。",dEN="I've been searching everywhere for the new Darkmoon Fair 3000 series cards. Silas can't make them fast enough, and all the Darkmoon vendors sell out within seconds. Can you believe a Bloodscalp troll tried to sell one to me? For nearly double the price! I heard the trolls were scalpers, but I had no idea how horrible scalping truly was. Travel to the Ruins of Zul'Kunda and slaughter the scalpers. We cannot allow an evil greater than the Legion to threaten destroying Azeroth before we do.",o="杀死血顶巨魔。",oEN="Kill Bloodscalp Trolls.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008128]={d="南海海盗拒绝喝下提供给他们的邪能之血，声称有朗姆酒就足够了！玖虐的海盗行径扰乱了艾泽拉斯的供应线，并打开了通道",dEN="The Southsea Pirates denied to drink the Fel Blood when offered, saying they were plenty satisfied with their Rum! Rampant piracy disrupts Azeroth's supply lines and and opens the lanes",o="劫掠南海海盗。",oEN="Plunder the Southsea Pirates.",p="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008129]={d="废土强盗团在塔纳利斯游荡。他们组织严密、手段狠辣，在艾泽拉斯最严酷的土地之一上繁衍壮大。别人都失败了，他们却活了下来。他们将是考验你实力的绝佳目标。前往水泉平原，把他们全部杀光。",dEN="The Wastewander Gang prowls Tanaris. They are organized, deadly and have managed to thrive in one of the most unforgiving lands on Azeroth. They have survived where all others have failed. They will make a worthy target to test your skills. Travel to the Waterspring Field and slaughter them all.",o="屠杀废土强盗团。",oEN="Slaughter the Wastewander Gang.",p="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008130]={d="沙怒巨魔是凶猛的战士。他们中许多人曾在单挑中击败过一名邪铸者。他们信仰与我们不同的神灵，认为他们的神会赐予他们击败军团的力量。前往沙落哨所，检验一下他们的说法。",dEN="The Sandfury trolls are fierce warriors. Many have defeated a Felforged in single combat. They believe in gods other than our own. They think their gods will give them the strength to defeat the Legion. Visit Sandsorrow Watch and test their theory.",o="击败沙怒战士。",oEN="Defeat the Sandfury Warriors.",p="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008131]={d="艾泽拉斯的军队如此惧怕龙人，以至于把他们的巢穴称为恐惧之翼小径。只有最勇敢的战士才敢穿越龙人的领地。前往恐惧之翼小径，留下一路尸骸，让艾泽拉斯的英雄们去发现。用军团所能之事的景象填满他们的噩梦。",dEN="The forces of Azeroth fear the Dragonspawn so much they refer to their lair as Terror Wing Path. Only the bravest of their warriors dare travel through Dragonspawn territory. Travel to Terror Wing Path and leave a trail of corpses for the Heroes of Azeroth to find. Fill their nightmares with visions of what the Legion is capable of.",o="杀死龙人与黑龙。",oEN="Kill the Dragonspawn and the Black Drake.",p="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效力得很好，邪铸者。领取你的奖赏吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1008132]={d="很少有战士能在战斗中与军团匹敌。戈多克食人魔大概会杀了你，但你的命属于我，由我来消耗。\n\n你生或死对我而言毫无区别。在我的军团到达前，削弱戈多克的军力。",dEN="Few warriors can match the Legion in combat. The Gordok Ogre will probably kill you, but your life is mine to spend.\n\nLive or die makes no difference to me. Soften the Gordok forces before my Legion arrives.",o="将黑石兽人化为灰烬。",oEN="Turn the Blackrock Orcs to ash.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1009027]={d="杀死冰蓟流浪者。看着它们孤零零地死去，脱离部族、无人相助。我要你看清它们是怎么死的。\n\n你以为若你失职，你的死法会有什么不同吗？",dEN="Kill the Rogue Ice Thistles. Watch as they die alone, isolated from thier tribes with no one to help them. I want you to watch how they die.\n\nDo you imagine your death will be any different if you fail in your servitude?",o="杀死寒风奇美拉、碎齿粉碎者和冬泉谷的猫头鹰。",oEN="Kill Chillwind Chimaera, Shardtooth Maulers and Winterspring Owls.",p="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",pEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward.",c="你为军团效忠有加，邪铸者。领取你的奖励吧。",cEN="You serve the Legion well Felforged. Take your reward."}
Q[1038679]={d="英雄你好！\n我们最近遇到了物资短缺，正指望着像你这样手艺出众的工匠能帮我们摆脱这个困境。",dEN="Greetings Hero!\nWe recently found ourselves in the middle of a supply shortage and were hoping an artisan of your caliber might be able to pull us out of this rut.",o="收集 9 张附魔卷轴 - 护腕 - 初级生命。",oEN="Collect 9 Scroll of Enchant Bracer - Minor Health.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成契约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
