Q[1100037]={d="你听说过神秘附魔吗？这些神秘力量能极大地强化你和你的技能。要解锁它们，你必须找到散布在世界各地的神秘卷轴。获得卷轴后，你就能在神秘附魔祭坛上汲取它的力量。\n\n我设法收集到了四张这样的卷轴。你可以选择其中一张，在旅途中助你一臂之力。",dEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\n\nI’ve managed to collect four of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey.",o="选择一张神秘卷轴。",oEN="Pick a Mystic Scroll.",p="你是哪一种 <class>？",pEN="What kind of a <class> are you?",c="你听说过神秘附魔吗？这些神秘力量能极大地强化你和你的技能。要解锁它们，你必须找到散布在世界各地的神秘卷轴。获得卷轴后，你就能在神秘附魔祭坛上汲取它的力量。\n\n我设法收集到了三张这样的卷轴。你可以选择其中一张，在旅途中助你一臂之力。",cEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\n\nI’ve managed to collect three of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey."}
