Q[1100048]={d="你听说过神秘附魔吗？这些神秘力量能极大地强化你和你的技能。要解锁它们，你必须找到散布在世界各地的神秘卷轴。获得卷轴后，你就能在神秘附魔祭坛上汲取它的力量。\n\n我设法收集到了三张这样的卷轴。你可以选择其中一张，在旅途中助你一臂之力。",dEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\n\nI’ve managed to collect three of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey.",o="选择一张神秘卷轴。",oEN="Pick a Mystic Scroll.",c="你听说过神秘附魔吗？这些神秘力量能极大地强化你和你的技能。要解锁它们，你必须找到散布在世界各地的神秘卷轴。获得卷轴后，你就能在神秘附魔祭坛上汲取它的力量。\n\n我设法收集到了三张这样的卷轴。你可以选择其中一张，在旅途中助你一臂之力。",cEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\n\nI’ve managed to collect three of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey."}
Q[1100049]={d="你好 <name>，在我训练 <class> 并探索艾泽拉斯的那些年里，我发现了记载着被遗忘技艺的古老卷轴——神秘附魔，它们能强化你的天赋能力。这些神秘卷轴散布在艾泽拉斯各处，等待配得上它们的冒险者前去寻找。一旦你获得卷轴，就能汲取它的力量。\n\n这些稀有神秘附魔将超越常规训练，让你的法术更加精湛。它们补强你现有的能力，带来细微却强大的优势。随着你力量增长，你会发现更强大的卷轴，解锁史诗与传说级附魔。而精通这些附魔，正是那段旅程的第一步。\n\n你最多可以将六种这样的附魔应用于你的军械库。你所选的每一种都将决定你作为 <class> 的发展方向。",dEN="Greetings <name>, during my years of training <class>s and exploring Azeroth, I've uncovered ancient scrolls detailing forgotten techniques - Mystic Enchantments that can enhance your natural abilities. These Mystic Scrolls are scattered across Azeroth, waiting to be found by worthy adventurers. Once you've acquired a scroll, you can harness its power.\n\nThese Rare Mystic Enchantments will refine your spells beyond standard training. They complement your existing abilities, providing subtle yet powerful advantages. As you grow in power, you'll discover more potent scrolls that unlock Epic and Legendary enchantments. But mastering these enchantments are the first step on that journey.\n\nYou may apply up to six of these enchantments to your arsenal. Each one you choose will shape how you develop as a <class>.",o="选择一张神秘卷轴。",oEN="Pick a Mystic Scroll.",c="你听说过神秘附魔吗？这些神秘力量能极大地强化你和你的技能。要解锁它们，你必须找到散布在世界各地的神秘卷轴。获得卷轴后，你就能在神秘附魔祭坛上汲取它的力量。\n\n我设法收集到了三张这样的卷轴。你可以选择其中一张，在旅途中助你一臂之力。",cEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\n\nI’ve managed to collect three of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey."}
