Q[1108033]={d="你以为身处军团行列之中就安全了吗？看看你四周。你的同类中只有最野心勃勃者才会自愿饮下邪能之血，为力量献出灵魂。你已证明了自己对力量的渴求……但你配得上吗？你愿意去夺取吗？即使必须从你自己的族人手中夺取？\n\n军团之中没有弱者的位置。我不会保护你不受我其他特工的伤害。清除队伍中不配之人是会得到奖赏的。\n\n完成此任务将解锁额外的击杀任务。",dEN="Do you imagine yourself safe amongst the ranks of the Legion? Look around you. Only the most ambitious among your kind would willingly drink the Fel Blood and offer their soul for power. You are proven your desire for power... but are you worthy? Are you willing to take it? Even if you must take it from your own kind?\n\nThere is no place for weakness amongst the Legion. I will not protect you from my other agents. Purging the unworthy from our ranks is rewarded.\n\nCompleting this quest will unlock additional kill quests.",o="杀死 2 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 2 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108034]={d="你从我的队伍中剔除弱者，干得很出色。去找到并屠杀那些不配之人。",dEN="You have done well culling the weak from my ranks. Seek out and slaughter the unworthy.",o="杀死 3 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 3 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108035]={d="你已证明自己是军团的战士。你会一路屠杀，以获取更多的力量与军衔吗？",dEN="You have proven yourself to be a warrior of the Legion. Will you slaughter your way to further power and rank?",o="杀死 5 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 5 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108036]={d="就连身经百战的战士也对你心生畏惧。为了力量，你会走到哪一步？",dEN="You inspire dread, even among seasoned warriors. How far will you go for power?",o="杀死 5 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 5 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108037]={d="即使在军团之中，我也很少遇到像你这样的人。这对你来说不只是力量或军衔，对吧？你热爱杀戮。这会得到奖赏的。",dEN="I have rarely met one such as you, even amongst the Legion. This is not merely about power or rank to you is it? You love to kill. This will be rewarded.",o="杀死 5 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 5 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108038]={d="若不是你饮血时我在场，我都要怀疑你一直以来就是个恶魔。",dEN="If I was not present when you drank the blood I would wonder if you were not a Demon all along.",o="杀死 5 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 5 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108039]={d="收割了这么多灵魂，却没有失去自己的……你令我印象深刻。",dEN="To reap so many souls without losing your own... You impress me.",o="杀死 5 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 5 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108040]={d="你是恶魔之中的神明。你会晋升至最终的阶位吗？",dEN="You are a god among demons. Will you ascend to the final ranks?",o="杀死 10 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 10 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108041]={d="证明你配得上邪能铸造之名，甚至赢得我的敬意。",dEN="Prove yourself worthy to be Felforged and earn even my respect.",o="杀死 10 名玩家。",oEN="Kill 10 players.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1108100]={d="在战场上证明你的价值！前往指定的战场，杀死入侵艾泽拉斯的军团邪铸者！\n\n当你在指定战场区域内时，击杀邪铸者将额外获得净化灵魂。",dEN="Prove yourself on the battlefield! Travel to the designated battlefield and slay the Felforged invading Azeroth!\n\nWhile in a designated Battlefield area you will earn bonus Purified Souls for slaying Felforged.",o="在战场上取得 5 次击杀。",oEN="Earn 5 kills on the battlefield."}
