Q[1205260]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n安多哈尔不会冒出什么真正危险的东西，对吧？那就让它保持这样！\n\n进入安多哈尔废墟，消灭盘踞其中的亡灵。\n\n杀死 1 个血肉傀儡、3 个骷髅军阀和 15 个灼热食尸鬼。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nNothing really dangerous comes out of Andorhal right? Let's keep it that way!\n\nEnter the ruins of Andorhal and destroy the undead residing there.\n\nKill a Flesh Golem, 3 Skeletal Warlords, and 15 Searing Ghouls.",o="杀死 1 个血肉傀儡、3 个骷髅军阀和 15 个灼热食尸鬼。",oEN="Kill a Flesh Golem, 3 Skeletal Warlords, and 15 Searing Ghouls.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205261]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n你听到那尖啸了吗？！它来自东瘟疫之地的科林十字路口……去终结它！\n\n杀死 20 个憎恨尖啸者。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nDo you hear that shrieking?! It's coming Corin's Crossing in Eastern Plaguelands... Put an end to it!\n\nKill 20 Hate Shriekers.",o="杀死 20 个憎恨尖啸者。",oEN="Kill 20 Hate Shriekers.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205262]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n幽灵出没于冬泉谷的凯尔瑟利尔废墟。你会杀死他们吗？还是加入他们？\n\n杀死 8 个痛苦的精灵贵族和 20 个受难的精灵贵族。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nGhosts haunt the Ruins of Kel'Theril in Winterspring. Will you slay them? Or will you join them?\n\nKill 8 Anguished Highborne and 20 Suffering Highborne.",o="杀死 8 个痛苦的精灵贵族和 20 个受难的精灵贵族。",oEN="Kill 8 Anguished Highborne and 20 Suffering Highborne.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205263]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n希利苏斯有三座主要的虫巢。\n\n杀死 8 个雷戈虫巢领主、佐拉虫巢劫掠者和亚什虫巢守卫。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nThere are three major Hives in Silithus.\n\nKill 8 Hive'Regal Hive Lords, Hive'Zora Reavers, and Hive'Ashi Defenders.",o="杀死 8 个雷戈虫巢领主、佐拉虫巢劫掠者和亚什虫巢守卫。",oEN="Kill 8 Hive'Regal Hive Lords, Hive'Zora Reavers, and Hive'Ashi Defenders.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205271]={d="看来我们手上有个食人魔级别的大麻烦，我可不是在玩文字游戏。前往燃烧平原处理它。\n\n我不挑，在碎惧石杀死 30 个那种混蛋就行。",dEN="We seem to have a real ogre of a problem on our hands, no pun intended. Head to the Burning Steppes to deal with it.\n\nI am not picky, kill any 30 of those bastards at Dreadmaul Rock.",o="在燃烧平原的碎惧石杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of Dreadmaul Rock in The Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205272]={d="暗影誓约者最近一直在制造骚乱。前往他们在诅咒之地的主要行动基地，将他们铲除。\n\n杀死 30 个邪教徒，然后向你的主人汇报。",dEN="The Shadowsworn have been stirring up a commotion as of late. Go to their main base of operations in the Blasted Lands and snuff them out.\n\nKill any 30 of the cultists and report back to your Masters.",o="在诅咒之地的巨蛇之环杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of The Serpent's Coil in The Blasted Lands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205273]={d="碧火萨特已经逍遥太久了，杀死其中 30 个，然后向你的主人汇报。",dEN="The Jadefire Satyrs have been playing around for long enough, kill any 30 of them and report back to your Masters.",o="在费伍德森林的碧火小径杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of Jadefire Run in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205274]={d="黑石兽人一直在给我们找麻烦，这次我们换个花样，直击他们的痛处，转守为攻。\n\n干掉其中 30 个，然后向你的主人汇报。",dEN="The Blackrock orcs have been giving us trouble, lets hit them where it hurts and go on the offensive for a change.\n\nTake out 30 of them and report back to your Masters.",o="在燃烧平原的黑石要塞杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of The Blackrock Stronghold in the Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205275]={d="那些矮人和他们的机器已经烦了我们一阵子，而且他们只会越来越强。让我们杀杀他们的威风。\n\n杀死三十个矮人或他们的造物。还有，英雄，个头并不代表一切……别小看他们。",dEN="Those dwarves and their machines have been giving us trouble for a little while now and they are only getting stronger. Let's knock them down a notch.\n\nKill any thirty of the dwarves or their creations. And, hero, size isn't everything... Don't underestimate them.",o="在燃烧平原的索瑞森废墟杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of The Ruins of Thaurissan in The Burning Steppes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205276]={d="瘟疫林的天灾军团正以惊人的速度繁殖，是时候控制一下种群了。\n\n如果你想帮忙，杀多少都随你。但我只为30次击杀付钱。杀够了就到告示板汇报。",dEN="The scourge at Plaguewood are multiplying at an alarming rate, it is time for some population control.\n\nIf you want to do the service, you can kill as many as you want. But, I am only paying you for 30 killls. Report back to the call board when you have had your fill.",o="在东瘟疫之地的瘟疫林杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Killl any 30 of the denizens of Plaguewood in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205277]={d="祖玛沙尔那些巨魔一直在东瘟疫之地抓我们的人当食物。是时候报仇了。\n\n杀死祖玛沙尔的三十个巨魔。另外，如果之前没提过的话，他们可能会吃掉你，也可能不会，所以别被抓到。",dEN="Those trolls up at Zul'Mashar have been taking some of our men in The Eastern Plaguelands for food. It's time for pay back.\n\nKill any thirty of the trolls at Zul'Mashar. And, Incase it wasnt mentioned earlier, they may or may not eat you, so, don't get caught.",o="在东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Killl any 30 of the denizens of Zul'Mashar in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205278]={d="腐毒之林的天灾似乎正变得异常强大；也许他们在使用某种新的扭曲魔法。不过，你知道人们怎么说：先行动，后思考。你介意替我干掉他们中的一些吗？\n\n杀死 30 个腐毒之林的居民。我不会阻止你多杀，但我只为 30 个付钱。",dEN="The scourge in The Noxious Glade seem to be growing abnormally strong, perhaps they are utilizing some kind of new, twisted magic. But, you know what they say, act first, think later. Would you mind taking down a few of them for me?\n\nKill any 30 of the denizens of The Noxious Glade. I won't stop you from killing more, but I will only be paying you for 30.",o="在东瘟疫之地的腐毒之林杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Killl any 30 of the denizens of The Noxious Glade in The Eastern Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205279]={d="安多哈尔废墟被天灾军团控制得太久了，是时候夺回属于我们的东西了。\n\n血色十字军显然不知道自己在那边干什么，是时候由我们来接管了。等你削减了天灾军团的队伍之后再回来。",dEN="The Ruins of Andorhal has been under scourge control for long enough, it is time to take back what is ours.\n\nThe Scarlet clearly don't know what they are doing there, it is time for us to take charge. Come back to be after you have put a dent in the scourge's ranks.",o="在西瘟疫之地的安多哈尔废墟杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of The Ruins of Andorhal in The Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205280]={d="亡者以其邪恶的存在亵渎着乌瑟尔之墓及周边地区。他们必须被消灭。\n\n在这种情况下，逝者怎么可能安息？清除那里的亡灵，然后向你的主人汇报。",dEN="Undead soil Uther's Tomb and the surrounding area with their unholy presence. They must be exterminated.\n\nHow can the dead be expected to rest in such a situation, clear out the living dead there and report back to your Masters.",o="在西瘟疫之地的悔恨岭杀死 30 个居民。",oEN="Killl any 30 of the denizens of Sorrow Hill in The Western Plaguelands.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205281]={d="英雄，作为冬天来说是不是有点太热了？我听说火羽山的火元素就是原因。但那很荒唐，对吧？毕竟只是个传言。不过杀掉一些也不会有坏处，对吧？\n\n总之，杀个三十来只，看看会不会有什么变化。倒不是说真会发生什么！我只是说，这不会有坏处，对吧？好吧，也许对你来说会有……",dEN="Isn't it a bit warm for winter hero? I hear that the fire elementals at Fire Plume Ridge are the cause. But thats silly, right? It's just a rumor after all. But it wouldnt hurt to kill a few of them right?\n\nAnyways, just kill about thirty of them and lets see if anything changes. Not that it would! I just mean, it couldn't hurt, right? Well maybe it would for you....",o="在安戈洛环形山的火羽山杀死任意 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'goro Crater.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205282]={d="看来我们在加德纳尔有点恶魔方面的麻烦。你介意替我们解决一下吗？\n\n杀死那里三十个教徒或恶魔；在我眼里，他们都是一样的。",dEN="It seems we have a bit of a demonic problem in Jaedenar. Would you mind fixing it for us?\n\nKill any thirty of the cultists or demons there, they are all the same in my eyes.",o="在费伍德森林的加德纳尔杀死任意 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of Jaedenar in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1205283]={d="魔爪部族一直在袭击往返冬泉谷路上的商人。是时候让他们安分点了。\n\n等你杀死了那里的三十个熊怪之后再回来找我。",dEN="The Felpaw have been attacking traders on the roads to and from Winterspring. It is time to put them in their place.\n\nJust come back to me after you have killed thirty of the Furbolgs there.",o="在费伍德森林的魔爪村杀死任意 30 个居民。",oEN="Kill any 30 of the denizens of Felpaw Village in Felwood.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1277870]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n在安戈洛环形山的恐惧小道附近猎杀强大的剑龙。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nHunt the mightly Stegodon near Terror Run in Un'Goro Crater.",o="获取 5 片剑龙鳞片。",oEN="Obtain 5 Stegodon Scales.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278801]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n它被称作虫群之柱可不是没理由的！亚什虫群正在希利苏斯要塞以南集结。我们绝不能失去在希利苏斯的立足点。趁它们还没能包围我们，杀光这些虫群！",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nThey don't call it the swarming pillar for no reason! Hive'Ashi Swarmers are amassing to the south of Silithus Hold. We cannot afford to lose our foothold in Silithus. Kill the swarmers before they can surround us!",o="获取 20 片发光的亚什虫鳞。",oEN="Obtain 20 Glowing Hive'Ashi Scales.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278802]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n位于西瘟疫之地与东瘟疫之地交界处的哀嚎洞穴极其邪恶，即便对那片被天灾侵染的土地而言也是如此。净化这座洞穴！",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nThe Weeping Cave near the border between Western and Eastern Plaguelands is truly vile, even for that scourge infected land. Cleanse the cave!",o="获取 16 瓶传染性软泥。",oEN="Obtain 16 Vials of Infectious Ooze.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278803]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n西瘟疫之地的北岭伐木场一直是血色十字军为壁炉谷补给的关键。干掉那些伐木工！",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nThe Northridge Lumber Camp in the Western Plaguelands has been key to the Scarlet Crusade supplying Hearthglen. Cut down the lumberjacks!",o="获取 15 把伐木斧。",oEN="Obtain 15 Lumberjack Axes.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278804]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n天灾正在制造一支缝合恐魔大军。我担心若不立即制止会酿成大祸。前往东瘟疫之地，进入瘟疫林的屠宰场，摧毁这些恐魔。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nThe Scourge are producing an army of Stiched Horrors. I fear what might happen if we don't put an end to this immediately.In the Eastern Plaguelands, Enter the Slaughterhouses in the Plaguewood and destroy these horrors.",o="获取 10 份憎恶缝线。",oEN="Obtain 10 Abomination Stitchings.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278805]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n前往逆风小径的恶行牢笼，杀死盘踞在那里的食人魔。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nTravel to The Vice in Deadwind pass and slay the Ogre that reside there.",o="获取 15 颗斩下的食人魔头颅。",oEN="Obtain 15 Severed Ogre Heads.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278806]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n你不会想把这种小猫带回家的。说真的，别这么做。它们会吃掉你。前往冬泉谷的霜刃石，做点种群控制。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nYou don't want to take one of these kittens home. Seriously. Don't do it. They will eat you. Head to Frostsaber Rock in Winterspring and do some population control.",o="获取 15 张霜刃豹皮。",oEN="Obtain 15 Frostsaber Pelts.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278807]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n前往艾萨拉，杀死占据了拉文凯斯纪念碑的毒刺纳迦。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nTravel to Azshara and slay the Spitelash Naga that have occupied the Ravencrest Monument.",o="获取 12 张毒刺纳迦皮。",oEN="Obtain 12 Spitelash Hides.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278808]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n前往艾萨拉，杀死游荡在亚考兰神殿周围的亚考兰响钳龙虾人。",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nTravel to Azshara and slay the the Arkkoran Clackers around the Temple of Arkkoran.",o="获取 15 只亚考兰之爪。",oEN="Obtain 15 Arkkoran Claws.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1278809]={d="通缉恶魔：\n\n前往费伍德森林的铁木森林，把铁木践踏者变成铁木碎木！",dEN="Demons Wanted:\n\nTravel to Irontree Woods in Felwood and turn the Irontree Stompers into Irontree Splinters!",o="获取 15 块铁木碎片。",oEN="Obtain 15 Irontree Splinters.",p="你的任务尚未完成。完成合约后再回到告示板。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1307786]={d="当你手持这只容器时，能听见微弱的低语。\n\n\"\"将我……从这……囚牢中……释放。\"\"\n\n\"\"束缚我们的二物……\n\n四者铸成的钢……\n\n精华……火焰之王。\"\"\n\n\"\"德米提恩……希利苏斯……\"\"",dEN="As you hold the vessel in your hand you can hear a faint whisper.\n\n\"\" Release me ... from this ... prison.\"\"\n\n\"\"Two that binds us ...\n\nsteel made of four ...\n\nessence ... firelord.\"\"\n\n\"\"Demitrian ... Silithus ...\"\"",o="要将逐风者桑德兰从他的囚牢中释放，你必须将重生容器、10 块源质锭和火焰之王精华交给希利苏斯的大领主德米提恩。",oEN="To free Thunderaan the Windseeker from his prison, you must present the Vessel of Rebirth, 10 bars of Elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord to Highlord Demitrian in Silithus.",p="若有需要，就让整个世界屈膝！",pEN="Bring the world to its knees if you must!",c="即便在梦中，我也不敢预见这一天。\n\n看吧，凡人。\n\n看那比存在本身更古老者！\n\n看那曾直面泰坦与神明者！\n\n崛起吧，我的主人！挣脱你的枷锁！",cEN="Even in dreams I did not dare foresee this day.\n\nBehold, mortal.\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO IS OLDER THAN EXISTENCE!\n\nBEHOLD HE WHO HAS FACED TITAN AND GOD ALIKE!\n\nRISE MY MASTER! BREAK FROM YOUR BONDS!"}
Q[1307787]={d="你打败了逐风者。拿起那柄沉睡的剑刃，逼那卑鄙的骗子德米特里安用你为他的背叛所提供的材料，唤醒雷霆之怒。",dEN="You have defeated the Wind Seeker. Take the dormant blade and force the lying wretch, Demitrian, to use the materials you provided for his betrayal to wake Thunderfury.",o="把沉睡的御风之刃交给高级领主德米特里安。",oEN="Present the Dormant Wind Kissed Blade to Highlord Demitrian.",p="<德米特里安在你面前缩成一团。>",pEN="<Demitrian cowers in your presence.>",c="求你别伤害我！拿去吧！把剑刃拿去！让德米特里安重建他那可悲的人生吧！",cEN="Please do not harm me! Take it! Take the blade! Leave Demitrian to reshape his pathetic life!"}
Q[1308791]={d="一个可怕的威胁已被铲除。残暴的奥西里安已被击败。\n\n卡利姆多的居民若得知这场胜利，定会松一口气。带上奥西里安的头颅，把它呈交给塞纳里奥要塞的玛尔利斯指挥官。",dEN="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.\n\nThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.",o="把无疤者奥西里安的头颅交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的玛尔利斯指挥官。",oEN="Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."}
Q[1308802]={d="那古神毫无生气的眼睛仍以其恶意的目光刺透你的脑海。时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯应该会处理此事。把克苏恩之眼交给他，他无疑会想把它放进主人的收藏。",dEN="The lifeless eye of the ancient god still penetrates your mind with its malicious stare. Anachronos at the Caverns of Time should take care of this. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="把克苏恩之眼带到时光之穴的阿纳克罗斯那里。",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."}
Q[1309120]={d="这枚护命匣是纳克萨玛斯之主仅存的东西。你的理智告诉你应当摧毁它，阻止这名巫妖再度重塑身躯。所幸，你很少听从内心那理性的声音。\n\n光明希望礼拜堂的某个人会为这件神器付给你一大笔钱。你会找谁呢……",dEN="The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.\n\nSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?",o="将克尔苏加德的护命匣带到东部瘟疫之地的光明希望礼拜堂。",oEN="Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands."}
Q[1309250]={d="框架既已成形，埃提耶什便近乎完整。只差法杖的头部与杖柄。还有一个较小的麻烦：这根法杖是萨格拉斯邪恶力量的通道。\n\n去找个能帮你定位其余部件、并为法杖驱除邪恶的人吧。",dEN="With the frame formed, Atiesh is nearly whole. Only the head and base of the staff are now missing. There is also a minor issue regarding the staff being a conduit for Sargeras's evil.\n\nFind someone that can assist you in locating the remaining pieces and exorcising the evil from the staff.",o="找个人帮你取回法杖最后的两个部件，并驱除其中的邪恶。",oEN="Find someone that will help you in recovering the last two pieces of the staff and ridding it of evil.",p="你的时辰到了，凡人。",pEN="It was her time, mortal.",c="大法师们已经死了。\n\n不要为他们的离去哭泣，<name>。一切皆是命中注定，正如你手握守护者之法杖，也是命中注定……",cEN="The archmages have died.\n\nDo not mourn their passing, <name>. All such things are fated. Just as you holding the staff of the Guardian was fated..."}
Q[1309251]={d="你怀疑自己为何还活着。毕竟，你持有一件极恶之物。答案并不明朗，<name>。我只是做我该做的事。\n\n克尔苏加德端坐于纳克萨玛斯的王座之上，正在谋划……他渴求你手中之物，也握有你寻觅之物。\n\n至于法杖的杖柄；矮人布莱恩·铜须在进入安其拉时持有它。他已离开安其拉，但埃提耶什的杖柄仍留在那里。\n\n如果你能找回那些部件，就把它们交还给我。",dEN="You question why you are still alive. After all, you have in your possession an item of great evil. The answer is not clear, <name>. I only do as I must.\n\nKel'Thuzad sits atop his throne in Naxxramas, plotting... He seeks that which you hold and holds that which you seek.\n\nAs for the base of the staff; the dwarf, Brann Bronzebeard, held it when he entered Ahn'Qiraj. He has left Ahn'Qiraj but the base of Atiesh remains.\n\nShould you succeed in recovering the pieces, return them to me.",o="时光之穴（塔纳利斯）的阿纳克洛斯想要埃提耶什的头部与埃提耶什的杖柄。",oEN="Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris wants the Staff Head of Atiesh and the Base of Atiesh.",p="以其目前的形态，这根法杖对凡人而言太过危险。",pEN="In its current form, the staff is far too dangerous to be in the hands of a mortal.",c="里面有一个存在……一个不属于这个世界的存在。",cEN="There is a being within... a being not of this world."}
Q[1313372]={d="从那颗由萨菲隆爪中坠落的眼状宝石里，可以听到并感到一阵强烈的魔法嗡鸣。对凡人的耳朵来说，待在宝石近旁几乎是一种折磨。\n\n如此重要而强大的物品，想必只能呈交给……的女王。",dEN="A potent thrumming of magical nature can be heard and felt emanating from the eye-shaped jewel dropped from Sapphiron's clutches. To mortal ears it is nearly painful to be in the presence of the stone.\n\nSurely such a powerful item of import can only be taken to the queen of the dragons, Alexstrasza the Life-Binder. Seek her counsel atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",o="将聚焦之虹的钥匙交给龙骨荒野龙眠神殿顶层的生命缚誓者阿莱克丝塔萨。",oEN="Deliver the Key to the Focusing Iris to Alexstrasza the Life-Binder atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",p="<name>，你竟然接触到了一把聚焦之虹的钥匙！你把它带在身上了吗？\n\n\n\n你怎么会拥有它？哦，萨菲隆还留着他那把？",pEN="<name>, you have come into contact with a key to the focusing iris! Do you have it upon your person?\n\n\n\nHow did you ever come into its possession? Oh, Sapphiron still had his?",c="这些钥匙掌握在蓝龙军团最古老的成员手中。只有他们奉主人玛里苟斯之命持有它们。\n\n这正是我们一直在等待的机会，向魔法守护巨龙发起进攻！\n\n<巨龙女王打量了你片刻。>\n\n你不能就这样用这把钥匙进入聚焦之虹，但我可以将我的一部分力量灌注给你；足以让你用它把虹膜打开一道缝隙。\n\n这就足以引来玛里苟斯的怒火了！",cEN="These keys are held by the most ancient members of the blue dragonflight. Only they are entrusted with them by their master, Malygos.\n\nThis is the break that we've been waiting for to strike at the Aspect of Magic!\n\n<The queen of dragons studies you for a brief moment.>\n\nYou are not able to use the key as-is to access the Focusing Iris, but I can imbue you with a portion of my power; enough to enable you to use it to open the iris a fraction.\n\nIt will be enough to draw Malygos's ire!"}
Q[1313384]={d="既然你已能进入聚焦之虹，是时候让那把钥匙派上用场了。\n\n尽管我很希望看到玛里苟斯重新融入族群，但此刻那绝无可能。事关重大，其他守护巨龙的裁决是：织法者必须被击败。\n\n<克拉苏斯说这最后一句时显得极为不安>\n\n<name>，前往永恒之眼，面对玛里苟斯，并带着魔法之心回来。",dEN="Now that you have access to the focusing iris it's time to put that key to use.\n\nAs much as I would like to see Malygos brought back into the fold, that's just not going to happen at this point. With everything that's at stake, it is the judgment of the other Dragon Aspects that the Spell-Weaver needs to be put down.\n\n<Krasus says this last with a great deal of trepidation.>\n\n<name>, travel to the Eye of Eternity, confront Malygos and return with the Heart of Magic.",o="龙骨荒野龙眠神殿顶层的克拉苏斯想要你把魔法之心带回来。",oEN="Krasus atop Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight wants you to return with the Heart of Magic.",p="只有玛里苟斯拥有魔法之心。那是他最珍视的宝物。",pEN="Only Malygos carries the Heart of Magic. It is his most prized possession.",c="这是极为悲痛的一天，不仅对龙族，也对艾泽拉斯所有活着的生灵。我们失去了一位最善于思考、最聪慧、最古老的友人。魔法失去了它的守护者。\n\n但愿在往后的岁月里，这被证明是明智之举，<name>……",cEN="This is a very sad day, not only for dragonkind, but for all of the living creatures of Azeroth. We have lost one of our most thoughtful, intelligent and ancient friends. Magic is now without its guardian.\n\nLet us hope that this was a wise decision in the coming years, <name>. A storm is still brewing on the horizon and now we are without one of our most powerful defenders."}
Q[1403059]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回到你首都的希拉斯·暗月那里，领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon in your capital city to claim your Hands of Fate."}
