Q[1420427]={d="你准备好成就一番事业了吗，英雄？\n\n选择一张技能卡，尽情享受你必将获得的力量。你只能选一张……所以要明智地选择！",dEN="Are you ready to make something of yourself Hero?\n\nPick a skill card and relish in power you are sure to achieve. You can only pick though... so choose wisely!",o="领取你想要的技能卡。你只能使用 1 张普通技能卡和 1 张金色技能卡。普通角色需要达到 1 级才能使用技能卡，而邪铸者玩家需要达到 20 级才能使用技能卡。",oEN="Collect your desired skill card. You can only use 1 Normal Skill Card and 1 Golden Skill Card. Level 1 is required to use a Skill Card for a normal character, and Level 20 is required to use a Skill Card as a Felforged player."}
Q[1420428]={d="你准备好成就一番事业了吗，英雄？\n\n选择一张技能卡，尽情享受你必将获得的力量。你只能选一张……所以要明智地选择！",dEN="Are you ready to make something of yourself Hero?\n\nPick a skill card and relish in power you are sure to achieve. You can only pick though... so choose wisely!",o="领取你想要的技能卡。你只能使用 1 张普通技能卡和 1 张金色技能卡。普通角色需要达到 1 级才能使用技能卡，而邪铸者玩家需要达到 20 级才能使用技能卡。",oEN="Collect your desired skill card. You can only use 1 Normal Skill Card and 1 Golden Skill Card. Level 1 is required to use a Skill Card for a normal character, and Level 20 is required to use a Skill Card as a Felforged player."}
Q[1420430]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以盾牌坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：Místico Legendario: Baluarte有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：Místico Legendario: Baluarte来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a stalwart defender to shield them from the dangerous foes in Azeroths Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to aid in their effort, accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Shield Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Bulwark. You can search for Bulwark at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：防御姿态。推荐的初始法术：雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spell: Defensive Stance. Recommended Starter Spells: Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以盾牌坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Baluarte有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Baluarte来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Shield Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Bulwark. You can search for Bulwark at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420431]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以盾牌坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Campeón carmesí有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Campeón carmesí来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a stalwart defender to shield them from the dangerous foes in Azeroths Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to aid in their effort, accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Shield Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Crimson Champion. You can search for Crimson Champion at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：防御姿态。推荐的初始法术：雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spell: Defensive Stance. Recommended Starter Spells: Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以盾牌坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、盾牌格挡、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Campeón carmesí有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Campeón carmesí来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Shield Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap, Shield Block or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Crimson Champion. You can search for Crimson Champion at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420432]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以熊形态坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n\n所需初始法术：熊形态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、横扫（熊）、闪避、反击、低吼。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Portador de la plaga有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Portador de la plaga来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a stalwart defender to shield them from the dangerous foes in Azeroths Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to aid in their effort, accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Bear Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Bear Form.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Swipe (Bear), Evasion, Maul or Growl.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Plague Bearer. You can search for Plague Bearer at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：熊形态。推荐的初始法术：正义之怒、横扫（熊）、闪避。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spell: Bear Form. Recommended Starter Spells: Righteous Fury, Swipe (Bear), or Evasion.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以熊形态坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n所需初始法术：熊形态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、横扫（熊）、闪避、Aplastar、低吼。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Portador de la peste有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Portador de la peste来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Bear Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Bear Form.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Swipe (Bear), Evasion, Maul or Growl.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Plague Bearer. You can search for Plague Bearer at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420433]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以双手武器坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de armas有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de armas来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a stalwart defender to shield them from the dangerous foes in Azeroths Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to aid in their effort, accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a 2handed Parry Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Blademaster. You can search for Blademaster at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：防御姿态。推荐的初始法术：雷霆一击、嘲讽。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spell: Defensive Stance. Recommended Starter Spells: Thunderclap or Taunt.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以双手武器坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n所需初始法术：防御姿态。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：正义之怒、雷霆一击、嘲讽。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de las hojas有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de las hojas来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a 2handed Parry Tank!\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Defensive Stance.\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Righteous Fury, Thunderclap or Taunt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Blademaster. You can search for Blademaster at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420434]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Golpe de vida、Rejuvenecimiento、Ola de sanación、Toque sanador。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Crecimiento floreciente、místico épico: Sinergia natural有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Crecimiento floreciente、místico épico: Sinergia natural来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a support to tend their wounds and cleanse them of deadly ailments in their fight against the dangerous foes in Azeroth's Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to heal and support your allies, I can set you on the path to becoming a beacon of hope capable of sustaining your party through the most brutal attacks imaginable.\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Rejuvenation, Healing Wave, Healing Touch.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Blooming Growth and the Epic Mystic Enchant: Natural Synergy. You can search for Blooming Growth and Natural Synergy at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。推荐的初始法术：Golpe de vida、Rejuvenecimiento、Ola de sanación、Toque sanador。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Recommended Starter Spells: Life Tap, Rejuvenation, Healing Wave, Healing Touch.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Absorción de vida、Rejuvenecimiento、Ola de sanación、Toque sanador。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Crecimiento floreciente、místico épico: Sinergia natural有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Crecimiento floreciente、místico épico: Sinergia natural来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Healer!\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Rejuvenation, Healing Wave, Healing Touch.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Blooming Growth and the Epic Mystic Enchant: Natural Synergy. You can search for Blooming Growth and Natural Synergy at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420435]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n\n所需初始法术：Luz sagrada。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Absorción de vida、Bendición de sabiduría、Renovar。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Luz creciente有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Luz creciente来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。\n",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a support to tend their wounds and cleanse them of deadly ailments in their fight against the dangerous foes in Azeroth's Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to heal and support your allies, I can set you on the path to becoming a beacon of hope capable of sustaining your party through the most brutal attacks imaginable.\n\nRequired Starter Spells: Holy Light.\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom or Renew.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Growing Light. You can search for Growing Light at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：Luz sagrada。推荐的初始法术：Golpe de vida、Bendición de sabiduría、Renovar。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spells: Holy Light. Recommended Starter Spells: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom, Renew.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n\n所需初始法术：Luz sagrada。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Absorción de vida、Bendición de sabiduría、Renovar。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Luz creciente有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Luz creciente来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Healer!\n\nRequired Starter Spells: Holy Light.\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom or Renew.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Growing Light. You can search for Growing Light at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it."}
Q[1420436]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n\n所需初始法术：Curación mayor。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Absorción de vida、Bendición de sabiduría、Renovar。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Resplandor sagrado有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Resplandor sagrado来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。\n",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a support to tend their wounds and cleanse them of deadly ailments in their fight against the dangerous foes in Azeroth's Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to heal and support your allies, I can set you on the path to becoming a beacon of hope capable of sustaining your party through the most brutal attacks imaginable.\n\nRequired Starter Spells: Greater Heal.\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom or Renew.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Holy Radiance. You can search for Holy Radiance at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：Sanación mayor。推荐的初始法术：Toque de maná、Bendición de sabiduría y Renovar。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spells: Greater Heal. Recommended Starter Spells: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom, Renew.",c="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位能治愈他们的伤口、驱除致命病痛的治疗者。\n\n如果你愿意治疗并支援你的盟友，我可以指引你成为一座希望之灯，在难以想象的猛烈攻势中支撑住你的队伍。\n\n所需初始法术：Sanación mayor。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Absorción de vida、Bendición de sabiduría、Renovar。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Resplandor sagrado有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Resplandor sagrado来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",cEN="Accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Healer!\n\nRequired Starter Spells: Greater Heal.\n\nRecommended Starter Spells or High Priority picks while leveling: Life Tap, Blessing of Wisdom or Renew.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Holy Radiance. You can search for Holy Radiance at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.\nRelated"}
Q[1420437]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们正在寻找一位坚定的守护者，在艾泽拉斯的副本与团队副本中为他们抵挡危险的敌人。\n\n如果你愿意助他们一臂之力，就接受这些技能卡，以法系坦克的身份开始你的旅程吧！\n\n所需初始法术：Barrera forjada en maná。\n升级过程中推荐的初始法术或高优先选择：Mano de rendición de cuentas、Aura de brillantez、y ya sea Bola de fuego、Proyectil de escarcha。\n\n这套法术组合与神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de armas有很好的协同效果。你可以在拍卖行搜索神秘附魔：místico legendario: Maestro de armas来获得它，或在神秘附魔祭坛重塑物品来获得它。",dEN="Heroes all across Azeroth are seeking a stalwart defender to shield them from the dangerous foes in Azeroths Dungeons and Raids.\n\nShould you wish to aid in their effort, accept these skill cards and begin your journey as a Caster-Tank.\n\nRequired Starter Spell: Manaforged Barrier.\nRecommended Starter Spells: Hand of Reckoning, Brilliance Aura, and either Fireball or Frostbolt.\n\nThis combination of spells synergizes well with the Legendary Mystic Enchant: Blademaster. You can search for Blademaster at the Auction House to obtain it, or reforge items at the the Mystic Enchanting Altar to obtain it.",o="收集你的技能卡，并在 1 级时激活它们。所需初始法术：Barrera forjada en maná。推荐的初始法术：Mano de rendición de cuentas、Aura de brillantez y ya sea Bola de fuego、Proyectil de escarcha。",oEN="Collect your skill cards and activate them while you are level 1. Required Starter Spell: Manaforged Barrier. Recommended Starter Spells: Hand of Reckoning, Brilliance Aura, and either Fireball or Frostbolt."}
Q[1599099]={d="「职业与专精清洗将让你能够重置天赋树，并重新分配你的点数！」",dEN="Class and Specialization Purges will allow you to start fresh in your talent tree, and reinvest your points!",o="与诺兹多姆交谈，领取 3 次职业与专精清洗。",oEN="Speak to Nozdormu to receive 3 Class and Specialization Purges."}
Q[1608059]={d="命运之手将赋予你重抽一个法术的能力。",dEN="The Hand of Fate will grant you the ability to reroll a single spell.",o="回到你首都的希拉斯·暗月那里，领取你的命运之手。",oEN="Return to Silas Darkmoon in your capital city to claim your Hands of Fate."}
