Q[1700100]={d="幸运宝箱会在你不再获得新技能的那些等级赐予你一张幸运卷轴。到 60 级时，你将有机会用这份保存下来的技能精华选择 50 级和 60 级天赋。",dEN="The Chest of Fortune will grant you Scroll of Fortune on levels you no longer roll new abilities. You will be given the opportunity to choose level 50 and 60 talents with this saved Ability Essence at level 60.",o="完成任务以领取你的幸运宝箱。",oEN="Complete the quest to accept your Chest of Fortune."}
Q[1700101]={d="艾泽拉斯的英雄们，请注意：其拉虫人已以浩大的声势出现在安其拉门外。\n\n近来，它们开始在希利苏斯动用阿努比萨斯的力量。阿努比萨斯是由活石驱动的巨人，拥有奇异的力量。其中一个特别的阿努比萨斯化身正变得过于强大，必须从艾泽拉斯的土地上彻底铲除。\n\n它们已渗入希利苏斯的安其拉之门，并开始蔓延至整个地区……击败这一邪恶，我将以丰厚的财宝回报你。",dEN="Attention all Heroes of Azeroth: the Qiraji have appeared in a magnificent force outside Ahn'Qiraj.\n\nRecently, they have begun utilizing the powers of the Anubisath in Silithus. The Anubisath are animated giants of living stone that possess strange powers. One particular incarnation of the Anubisath is becoming all to powerful and must be wiped off the face of Azeroth.\n\nThey have infiltrated the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj in Silithus and are beginning to spread throughout the zone... Defeat this evil and I will return you great treasures.",o="摧毁希利苏斯的其拉虫人部队！此任务提供巨额奖励，且你只能在今天从塞拉斯·暗月处接到它。",oEN="Destroy the Qiraji Forces in Silithus! This quest offers massive rewards & you can obtain it ONLY TODAY from Silas Darkmoon"}
Q[1848164]={d="<name>，沙塔斯有传闻说，你已为黑暗神殿与海加尔山之战做好了准备。把你的徽记交给我，我将授予你一个极具威望的头衔。",dEN="<name>, word around Shattrath is you've prepared yourself for Black Temple and the Battle for Mount Hyjal. Turn in your medallions to me, and I will grant you a title held by great prestige.",o="把你的黑暗神殿徽记与海加尔山之战徽记交给阿达尔。",oEN="Give your Black Temple and Battle for Mount Hyjal Medallions to A'dal.",p="传闻是真的还是假的？你为我拿到徽记了吗？",pEN="Are the rumors true or not? Have you got the Medallions for me?",c="很好……那我想我欠你这个。",cEN="Perfect.. I believe I owe this to you then."}
Q[1903511]={d="根据你的主要伤害技能和玩法，选择一项主属性：\n\n[力量] 适用于撕碎、十字军打击或英勇打击等技能。\n\n[敏捷] 适用于邪恶攻击、猎豹形态或奥术射击等技能。\n\n[智力] 适用于火球术、寒冰箭或腐蚀术等技能。\n\n[精神] 是治疗属性。当你想专注于治疗盟友时，就选择精神。\n\n你可以把鼠标悬停在菜单中的每项属性上查看详情。更改主属性没有花费，所以尽管尝试！",dEN="Pick a Primary Attribute based on your main damaging ability and playstyle:\n\n[Strength] for spells like Rend, Crusader Strike or Heroic Strike.\n\n[Agility] for spells like Sinister Strike, Cat Form or Arcane Shot.\n\n[Intelligence] for spells like Fireball, Frostbolt, or Corruption.\n\n[Spirit] is the healer stat. Pick Spirit when you want to focus on healing your allies.\n\nYou can mouse-over each stat in the menu to see more details. There is no cost to changing your Primary Attribute, so be sure to experiment!",o="- 打开角色成长（快捷键 N），或从菜单栏打开。\n- 在右上方区域选择一项主属性。\n- 你可以随时免费更改主属性！",oEN="- Open Character Advancement (Hotkey N) or from the menu bar.\n- Select a Primary Attribute from the top right section.\n- You can change Primary Attributes anytime for free!",p="按 'N'，然后点击力量、敏捷、智力或精神来选择你的主属性。你可以把鼠标悬停在这些属性上查看它们的效果！\n\n只要不在战斗中，你随时可以免费更改主属性。",pEN="Press 'N' and click either STR, AGI, INT or SPR to select your primary stat. You can mouse over these stats to see their effects!\n\nPrimary stat can be changed for free at anytime as long as you are not in combat.",c="只要不在战斗中，你随时可以免费更改主属性。把鼠标悬停在图标上阅读说明，即可了解各项主属性的更多信息。\n\n力量与敏捷是坦克、近战伤害输出者和远程伤害输出者的不错选择。\n\n智力是施法者的不错选择。\n\n精神是治疗者以及追求更强法力续航的施法者的不错选择。\n相关",cEN="You can change your Primary Stat for free at any time as long as you are not in combat. You can learn more about each primary stat by hovering over the icon and reading the tooltip.\n\nStrength and Agility are good choices for tanks, melee damage dealers and ranged damage dealers.\n\nIntellect is a good choice for spell casters.\n\nSpirit is a good choice for healers and spell casters looking for higher mana sustain.\nRelated"}
Q[1903512]={d="一张退离卷轴已加入你的外观收藏，它会把你直接传送回你的主城！你只需领取它！\n\n在角色成长（快捷键 N）中点击外观标签页。然后在顶部搜索栏中输入退离卷轴，或使用右上角的下拉菜单，按已知排序。\n\n找到你的退离卷轴后，选中该物品，然后点击交付物品把它送进你的背包。\n\n从外观收藏交付的物品可以无限次领取，并会自动加入你的背包或法术书的飞升标签页。\n\n外观收藏是你专属的个人宝库，用于存放与取回账号绑定的物品及强力的角色强化。",dEN="A Scroll of Retreat has been added to your Vanity Collection that will teleport you directly to your Capital City! You just have to claim it!\n\nClick the Vanity Tab from Character Advancement (Hotkey N). Then type Scroll of Retreat in the search bar at the top, or use dropdown menu in the top right and sort by Known.\n\nOnce you find your Scroll of Retreat, select the item, then click Deliver Item to send it to your Bags.\n\nItems delivered from your Vanity Collection can be claimed an unlimited number of times and are automatically added to your bags or the Ascension Tab of your Spell Book.\n\nThe Vanity collection is your own personal vault where account bound items and powerful character enhancements are stored and retrieved.",o="-打开角色成长（快捷键 N）。\n- 点击外观标签页。\n- 在顶部搜索栏中输入退离卷轴。\n- 点击该卷轴并交付。",oEN="-Open Character Advancement (Hotkey N).\n-Click the Vanity Tab.\n-Type Scroll of Retreat in the top search bar.\n-Click the Scroll and Deliver it.",p="一件强力物品已加入你的外观收藏！\n\n退离卷轴会把你直接传送回你的主城，就像炉石一样。它完全属于你。你只需领取它！\n\n要打开外观收藏，按 N 打开角色成长菜单，然后点击外观。",pEN="A powerful item has been added to your Vanity Collection!\n\nThe Scroll of Retreat will teleport you directly to your capital city just like a Hearthstone. And it’s all yours. You just have to claim it!\n\nTo open your Vanity collection, Hit N to bring up the Character Advancement Menu and then click Vanity.",c="收藏是你专属的个人宝库，用于存放与取回账号绑定的物品和强力的角色强化。要打开收藏，按 N 打开角色成长菜单，然后点击收藏。\n\n物品、坐骑、外观和玩具都位于外观标签页。你的退离卷轴就在这里。点击右上角的下拉菜单并按已知排序，或在搜索栏中输入退离卷轴。找到你的退离卷轴后，选中该物品，然后点击左侧面板中的交付。\n\n如果你把它弄丢或摧毁了，你随时可以从收藏中无限次地再次交付。\n\n该物品会自动加入你的背包或法术书的飞升标签页。\n相关",cEN="The Collections is your own personal vault where account bound items and powerful character enhancements are stored and retrieved. To open your Collections, Hit N to bring up the Character Advancement Menu and then click Collections.\n\nItems, mounts, cosmetics and toys are found under the Vanity Tab. This is where your Scroll of Retreat is. Click the dropdown menu in the top right and sort by Known, or type Scroll of Retreat into the search bar. Once you find your Scroll of Retreat, select the item, then click Deliver in the left pane.\n\nIf you lose it, or destroy it, you can always deliver it from the collections an unlimited amount of times.\n\nThe item will be automatically added to your bags or the Ascension Tab of your Spell Book.\nRelated"}
Q[1903513]={d="神秘附魔卷轴可以通过击败敌人、在世界各处寻获，或与其他玩家交易获得。\n\n获得卷轴后，前往神秘附魔祭坛，使用神秘卷轴以获取其力量！神秘附魔祭坛常常被召唤在首都城中，你也可以到世界各地去探访一处。它们的位置已标在世界地图上。\n\n神秘附魔是解锁你英雄力量的关键。寻找能强化你法术、或解锁全新流派的神秘附魔，以提升你的实力。",dEN="Mystic Enchanting Scrolls can be obtained by defeating enemies, found hidden throughout the world, or by trading other players.\n\nOnce obtained, visit a Mystic Enchanting Altar to apply a Mystic Scroll to gain its powers! Mystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.\n\nMystic Enchants are key to unlocking your power as a Hero. Find Mystic Enchants that empower your spells or unlock whole new archetypes to increase your power.",o="- 通过击败敌人或与其他玩家交易获得一张神秘附魔卷轴。\n- 与首都或世界中的神秘附魔祭坛互动，选择附魔卷轴页签。\n- 激活一张神秘卷轴并把它应用到一个激活附魔槽位。",oEN="- Obtain a Mystic Enchanting Scroll by defeating enemies or trading other players.\n- Interact with a Mystic Enchanting Altar found in your Capital City or in the World and select Enchant Scrolls tab.\n- Activate a Mystic Scroll and apply it to an Active Enchant slot.",p="神秘附魔是获取力量、战胜艾泽拉斯最强大敌人的关键。\n\n无论你的敌人是恶魔、联盟还是部落，胜利的关键都在于获取强大的神秘附魔，以补足你的战斗风格，并将它们应用到你的装备上。\n\n你会在邮箱里找到神秘附魔补给。召唤你的易变神秘祭坛，放置后使用它。把一件精良装备或提供的破旧神秘卷轴拖到附魔栏位，然后重铸该物品，直到你找到能赋予你所求力量的附魔。\n\n同一件物品可以无限次重铸，但提取附魔会摧毁该物品。你在重铸物品和提升神秘附魔等级时会获得提取次数。",pEN="Mystic Enchants are the key to acquiring power and succeeding against Azeroth's most power foes.\n\nRather your foe be Demon, Alliance or Horde the key to victory is acquiring powerful Mystic Enchants to compliment your fighting style and apply them to your gear.\n\nYou will find Mystic Enchanting supplies in your mailbox. Summon your Volatile Mystic Altar and use it once placed. Drag a rare piece of equipment or the Tattered Mystic Scroll provided into the enchanting slot and Reforge the item until you find an enchant that grants you the power you seek.\n\nReforging can be done an infinite number of times on the same item, but extracting the enchant will destroy the item. You earn extracts by reforging items and leveling up your mystic enchanting.",c="神秘附魔卷轴可以通过击败敌人或在世界各地找到隐藏的卷轴来获得。\n\n获得之后，去一趟神秘附魔祭坛，应用神秘卷轴以获取它的力量！主城中常常能见到被召唤出来的神秘附魔祭坛，你也可以到世界各地去探访一处。它们的位置标记在世界地图上。\n\n神秘附魔是解锁你英雄力量的关键。寻找能强化你的法术、或解锁全新原型的神秘附魔，以提升你的力量。\n\n继续你的飞升之路，不断解锁神秘附魔的全部力量！\n相关",cEN="Mystic Enchanting Scrolls can be obtained by defeating enemies or found hidden throughout the world.\n\nOnce obtained, visit a Mystic Enchanting Altar to apply a Mystic Scroll to gain its powers! Mystic Enchanting Altars can often be found summoned in Capital Cities, or you can venture into the world to visit one. Their locations are marked on the world map.\n\nMystic Enchants are key to unlocking your power as a Hero. Find Mystic Enchants that empower your spells or unlock whole new archetypes to increase your power.\n\nContinue your Path to Ascension to continue unlocking the full power of Mystic Enchants!\nRelated"}
Q[1903514]={d="与邪能互换传送门互动，打开邪能互换菜单。\n\n受邪能互换保护的装备栏位会以绿色高亮显示。你可以点击某个栏位来添加或取消邪能互换。如果你愿意，可以互换整套装备。\n\n只有在高风险中死亡时，你才会因邪能互换损失金币。在无风险 PvP、PvE 死亡、地下城、战场或竞技场中你都不会损失金币。只有当你在高风险 PvP 中被另一名玩家杀死时，才会损失邪能互换的金币。\n\n打开邪能互换传送门，点击那些未高亮的栏位来保护你的装备。",dEN="Interact with the Fel Commutation Portal to open up the Fel Commutation menu.\n\nGear slots that are protected by Fel Commutation are highlighted in green. You can click a slot to add or remove Fel Commutation. You can commute your entire set of gear if you desire.\n\nYou only lose gold for Fel Commutation when dying in High-Risk. You do not lose gold in No-Risk PvP, PvE deaths, Dungeons, Battlegrounds or Arena. You only lose Fel Commutation gold when dying to another player in High-Risk PvP.\n\nOpen the Fel Commutation Portal and protect your gear by clicking unhighlighted slots.",o="使用邪能互换在高风险区域保护你的物品",oEN="Protect your Items in High-Risk using Fel Commutation",p="与邪能互换传送门互动，打开邪能互换菜单。\n\n受邪能互换保护的装备栏位会以绿色高亮显示。你可以点击某个栏位来添加或取消邪能互换。如果你愿意，可以互换整套装备。\n\n只有在高风险中死亡时，你才会因邪能互换损失金币。在无风险 PvP、PvE 死亡、地下城、战场或竞技场中你都不会损失金币。只有当你在高风险 PvP 中被另一名玩家杀死时，才会损失邪能互换的金币。\n\n打开邪能互换传送门，点击那些未高亮的栏位来保护你的装备。",pEN="Interact with the Fel Commutation Portal to open up the Fel Commutation menu.\n\nGear slots that are protected by Fel Commutation are highlighted in green. You can click a slot to add or remove Fel Commutation. You can commute your entire set of gear if you desire.\n\nYou only lose gold for Fel Commutation when dying in High-Risk. You do not lose gold in No-Risk PvP, PvE deaths, Dungeons, Battlegrounds or Arena. You only lose Fel Commutation gold when dying to another player in High-Risk PvP.\n\nOpen the Fel Commutation Portal and protect your gear by clicking unhighlighted slots.",c="只有在高风险中死亡时，你才会因邪能互换损失金币。在无风险 PvP、PvE 死亡、地下城、战场或竞技场中你都不会损失金币。只有当你在高风险 PvP 中被另一名玩家杀死时，才会损失邪能互换的金币。\n\n装备越强，你的邪能互换费用越高。你可以在角色面板右下角查看当前一次高风险死亡会损失多少金币。如果你不想冒险失去物品，在踏入高风险之前，务必确保自己付得起那笔金币。",cEN="You only lose gold for Fel Commutation when dying in High-Risk. You do not lose gold in No-Risk PvP, PvE deaths, Dungeons, Battlegrounds or Arena. You only lose Fel Commutation gold when dying to another player in High-Risk PvP.\n\nEquipping stronger gear will increase your Fel Com costs. You can see how much gold you will currently drop on a High-Risk death in the bottom right of your character panel. Always be sure you can cover your gold cost when venturing out into High-Risk if you don't want to risk your items dropping."}
Q[1903520]={d="你可以随着等级提升来提升法术的等级。",dEN="You can rank up your spells as you gain levels.",o="与附近的《飞升入门之书》交谈以训练新的法术等级。你可以使用小地图上的地图透镜，然后选择职业训练师来定位《飞升入门之书》。",oEN="Talk to the nearby Beginner's Book of Ascension to train new spell ranks. You can use the Map Lens on your mini-map, then select Class Trainer to locate the Beginner's Book of Ascension."}
Q[1903521]={d="奥格瑞玛是兽人的首都，也是部落的中枢。\n\n英雄们从艾泽拉斯的各个角落远道而来，在环绕城市的坚固城墙之后寻求慰藉与同伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。前往奥格瑞玛这座伟大的战士之城，向大酋长萨鲁法尔报到。他会在城墙内恭候，向你致意。\n\n在奥格瑞玛，你会找到新的机遇与服务，助你踏上旅程。\n银行提供安全的存储。\n大型拍卖行让你可以出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备，为下一次冒险做好准备！\n首都中住着经验丰富的训练师，可以教你最高等级的法术。\n工匠们经营着店铺，乐于收下一个付得起学费的学徒。\n\n这座城市也许很大，但巡逻街头的卫兵总能为你指明该去的方向。",dEN="Orgrimmar is the capital city of the orcs and central hub for the Horde.\n\nHeroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same Hero. Travel to the great warrior city of Orgrimmar and announce yourself to High Warlord Saurfang. He will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.\n\nNew opportunities and services can be found in Orgrimmar that will help you on your journey.\nBanks offer secure storage.\nThe great auction house will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\nExpert trainers live within the capital that can teach you the highest ranks of your spells.\nArtisan craftsman maintain shops, and are happy to take on an apprentice with the coin to pay for their teaching.\n\nThe city may be large, but the guards that patrol the streets can always give you directions to where you need to go.",o="在奥格瑞玛与大酋长萨鲁法尔交谈。",oEN="Speak to High Overlord Saurfang in Orgrimmar.",p="奥格瑞玛是兽人的首都，也是部落的中枢。\n\n英雄们从艾泽拉斯的各个角落远道而来，在环绕城市的坚固城墙之后寻求慰藉与同伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。前往奥格瑞玛这座伟大的战士之城，向大酋长萨鲁法尔报到。他会在城墙内恭候，向你致意。\n\n在奥格瑞玛，你会找到新的机遇与服务，助你踏上旅程。\n银行提供安全的存储。\n大型拍卖行让你可以出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备，为下一次冒险做好准备！\n首都中住着经验丰富的训练师，可以教你最高等级的法术。\n工匠们经营着店铺，乐于收下一个付得起学费的学徒。\n\n这座城市也许很大，但巡逻街头的卫兵总能为你指明该去的方向。",pEN="Orgrimmar is the capital city of the orcs and central hub for the Horde.\n\nHeroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same Hero. Travel to the great warrior city of Orgrimmar and announce yourself to High Warlord Saurfang. He will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.\n\nNew opportunities and services can be found in Orgrimmar that will help you on your journey.\nBanks offer secure storage.\nThe great auction house will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\nExpert trainers live within the capital that can teach you the highest ranks of your spells.\nArtisan craftsman maintain shops, and are happy to take on an apprentice with the coin to pay for their teaching.\n\nThe city may be large, but the guards that patrol the streets can always give you directions to where you need to go.",c="欢迎来到奥格瑞玛这座大城市，<race>！我鼓励你尽情探索这座城市所能提供的一切。\n\n就在我正后方的银行能让你安全存放物品，为背包腾出空间。存在银行里的物品可以从任何其他银行取用。\n\n大型拍卖行就在银行正东边，它能让你出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备为下一次冒险做好准备！\n\n经验丰富的训练师能教你最高等级的法术，工匠们会帮你掌握最多两种专业技能。巡逻城市的卫兵可以为你指路，找到任何你想要的训练师。\n\n务必常回首都看看，<name>。随着你的力量增长，你会在城中发现许多机遇，它们也会发布在我身旁的英雄告示板上。\n\n在继续旅程之前，你也许想找旅店老板谈谈。你可以把炉石的位置设在这里的奥格瑞玛，或与世界各地遇到的任何旅店老板交谈来更改你的炉石位置。\n相关",cEN="Welcome to the great city of Orgrimmar <race>! I encourage you to explore all the city has to offer.\n\nThe Bank directly behind me will allow you to securely store your items and free space in your bags. Items stored in one bank can be accessed from any other bank.\n\nThe great auction house is directly east of the bank, and will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\n\nExpert trainers can teach you the highest ranks of your spells, and Artisan craftsman will help you master up to two professions. The guards that patrol the city can give you directions to any trainer you wish to seek out.\n\nMake sure you return to the capital city often <name>. As your strength grows, you will find many opportunities inside the city and posted to the Hero's Call Board next to me.\n\nBefore you continue your journey, you may want to speak with the Inn Keeper. You can set your Hearthstone location here in Orgrimmar, or speak with any Innkeep you find in the world to change your home location.\nRelated"}
Q[1903522]={d="暴风城是人类的首都，也是联盟的中枢。\n\n英雄们从艾泽拉斯的各个角落远道而来，在环绕城市的坚固城墙之后寻求慰藉与同伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。前往暴风城这座伟大的王城，向贾斯汀·德玛利尔报到。她会在城墙内恭候，向你致意。\n\n在暴风城，你会找到新的机遇与服务，助你踏上旅程。\n银行提供安全的存储。\n大型拍卖行让你可以出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备，为下一次冒险做好准备！\n首都中住着经验丰富的训练师，可以教你最高等级的法术。\n工匠们经营着店铺，乐于收下一个付得起学费的学徒。\n\n这座城市也许很大，但巡逻街头的卫兵总能为你指明该去的方向。",dEN="Stormwind is the capital city of the Humans and central hub for the Alliance.\n\nHeroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same Hero. Travel to the royal warrior city of Stormwind and announce yourself to Justine Demalier. She will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.\n\nNew opportunities and services can be found in Stormwind that will help you on your journey.\nBanks offer secure storage.\nThe great auction house will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\nExpert trainers live within the capital that can teach you the highest ranks of your spells.\nArtisan craftsman maintain shops, and are happy to take on an apprentice with the coin to pay for their teaching.\n\nThe city may be large, but the guards that patrol the streets can always give you directions to where you need to go.",o="在暴风城与斯蒂芬妮·特纳交谈。",oEN="Speak to Stephanie Turner in Stormwind.",p="暴风城是人类的首都，也是联盟的中枢。\n\n英雄们从艾泽拉斯的各个角落远道而来，在环绕城市的坚固城墙之后寻求慰藉与同伴。英雄，现在轮到你了。前往暴风城这座伟大的王城，向贾斯汀·德玛利尔报到。她会在城墙内恭候，向你致意。\n\n在暴风城，你会找到新的机遇与服务，助你踏上旅程。\n银行提供安全的存储。\n大型拍卖行让你可以出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备，为下一次冒险做好准备！\n首都中住着经验丰富的训练师，可以教你最高等级的法术。\n工匠们经营着店铺，乐于收下一个付得起学费的学徒。\n\n这座城市也许很大，但巡逻街头的卫兵总能为你指明该去的方向。",pEN="Stormwind is the capital city of the Humans and central hub for the Alliance.\n\nHeroes travel from the furthest reaches of Azeroth to seek comfort and companionship behind the mighty walls surrounding the city. The time has come for you to do the same Hero. Travel to the royal warrior city of Stormwind and announce yourself to Justine Demalier. She will be waiting to greet you inside the walls.\n\nNew opportunities and services can be found in Stormwind that will help you on your journey.\nBanks offer secure storage.\nThe great auction house will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\nExpert trainers live within the capital that can teach you the highest ranks of your spells.\nArtisan craftsman maintain shops, and are happy to take on an apprentice with the coin to pay for their teaching.\n\nThe city may be large, but the guards that patrol the streets can always give you directions to where you need to go.",c="欢迎来到暴风城这座大城市，<race>！我鼓励你尽情探索这座城市所能提供的一切。\n\n银行在喷泉南边，就在我正东面，它能让你安全存放物品，为背包腾出空间。存在银行里的物品可以从任何其他银行取用。\n\n大型拍卖行就在我正后方，它能让你出售寻得的宝物，或购买新装备为下一次冒险做好准备！\n\n经验丰富的训练师能教你最高等级的法术，工匠们会帮你掌握最多两种专业技能。巡逻城市的卫兵可以为你指路，找到任何你想要的训练师。\n\n务必常回首都看看，<name>。随着你的力量增长，你会在城中发现许多机遇，它们也会发布在我身旁的英雄告示板上。\n\n在继续旅程之前，你也许想找旅店老板谈谈。你可以把炉石的位置设在这里的暴风城，或与世界各地遇到的任何旅店老板交谈来更改你的炉石位置。\n相关",cEN="Welcome to the great city of Stormwind <race>! I encourage you to explore all the city has to offer.\n\nThe Bank is south of the fountain directly to the east of me, and will allow you to securely store your items and free space in your bags. Items stored in one bank can be accessed from any other bank.\n\nThe great auction house is directly behind me, and will allow you to sell the treasures you have found or buy new gear to prepare for your next adventure!\n\nExpert trainers can teach you the highest ranks of your spells, and Artisan craftsman will help you master up to two professions. The guards that patrol the city can give you directions to any trainer you wish to seek out.\n\nMake sure you return to the capital city often <name>. As your strength grows, you will find many opportunities inside the city and posted to the Hero's Call Board next to me.\n\nBefore you continue your journey, you may want to speak with the Inn Keeper. You can set your Hearthstone location here in Stormwind, or speak with any Innkeep you find in the world to change your home location.\nRelated"}
Q[1903523]={d="该启程前往首都了，<race>！奥格瑞玛在杜隆塔尔，远隔重洋，但我们的飞艇日夜不停地往返，在各大陆之间运送英雄。\n\n登上布瑞尔正南方的飞艇塔。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛飞艇停靠的码头外直接找到扎佩塔。与她交谈，然后等飞艇到来。",dEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is in Durotar, across the great ocean, but our zepplins operate day and night to ferry Heroes between continents.\n\nClimb the zepplin tower directly south of Brill.\n\nZapetta can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with her, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",o="登上布瑞尔南边的飞艇平台，与奥格瑞玛码头上的扎佩塔交谈。",oEN="Climb the zepplin platform south of Brill, and speak to Zapetta standing on the Orgrimmar dock.",p="该启程前往首都了，<race>！奥格瑞玛在杜隆塔尔，远隔重洋，但我们的飞艇日夜不停地往返，在各大陆之间运送英雄。\n\n登上布瑞尔正南方的飞艇塔。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛飞艇停靠的码头外直接找到扎佩塔。与她交谈，然后等飞艇到来。",pEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is in Durotar, across the great ocean, but our zepplins operate day and night to ferry Heroes between continents.\n\nClimb the zepplin tower directly south of Brill.\n\nZapetta can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with her, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",c="这就是载你前往奥格瑞玛的码头！飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，直接上去，找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息；飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别跳下去，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇、救援设备或任何类型的安全装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找弗雷扎，他会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",cEN="This is the dock that will take you to Orgrimmar! The zepplin should arrive soon <name>. When the zepplin approaches the platform, simply walk on and find a comfortable place to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety regulations, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats, rescue, or safety devices of any kind.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Frezza for directions to Orgrimmar."}
Q[1903524]={d="前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，你就可以上去。找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息，飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别往虚空里跳，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇或任何救援装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找弗雷扎，他会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",dEN="The zepplin to Orgrimmar should arrive soon <name>. When the Zepplin approaches the platform you can walk on. Find a comfortable palce to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety requires, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats or any rescue devices.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Frezza for directions to Orgrimmar.",o="在扎佩塔身旁等待飞艇到来。登上飞艇，横渡大洋。抵达后与弗雷扎交谈。",oEN="Wait by Zapetta for the zepplin to arrive. Board the zepplin and ride it across the ocean. Speak to Frezza when you arrive.",p="前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，你就可以上去。找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息，飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别往虚空里跳，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇或任何救援装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找弗雷扎，他会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",pEN="The zepplin to Orgrimmar should arrive soon <name>. When the Zepplin approaches the platform you can walk on. Find a comfortable palce to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety requires, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats or any rescue devices.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Frezza for directions to Orgrimmar.",c="欢迎来到卡利姆多，英雄！你前往奥格瑞玛的旅程快完成了。看到西边远处那座高大的瞭望塔了吗？\n\n往返于奥格瑞玛与幽暗城之间的飞艇日夜运行。你随时可以回到飞艇平台登艇，在各大陆之间旅行。\n\n按 'M' 打开世界地图，留意飞艇图标，这样你就能找到回到这座平台的路。\n\n你准备好去首都报到了吗，<race>？",cEN="Welcome to Kalimdor Hero! Your journey to Orgrimmar is nearly complete. Do you see the great watchtower in the distance to west?\n\nThe zepplin betwen Orgimmar and Undercity runs day and night. You can always travel between continents by returning to the zepplin platform and riding the zepplin.\n\nOpen your World Map by pressing 'M' and notice the zepplin icon so you can find your way back to this platform.\n\nAre you ready to present yourself in the capital <race>?"}
Q[1903525]={d="该启程前往首都了，<race>！奥格瑞玛曾经要徒步穿越荒原、跋涉前往杜隆塔尔，是一段漫长艰难的旅程，但我们的地精盟友在雷霆崖烈魂岗顶上运营着一艘前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇。\n\n前往雷霆崖，在烈魂岗找克伦德尔·大口袋。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛飞艇停靠的码头外直接找到克伦德尔。与他交谈，然后等飞艇到来。",dEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar was once a long and hard journy by foot through the Barrens and into Durotar, but our Goblin allies operate a zepplin to Orgrimmar located atop Spirit Rise in Thunderbluff.\n\nTravel to Thunder Bluff and seek out Krendle Bigpockets on Spirit Rise.\n\nKrendle can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with him, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",o="前往雷霆崖，在烈魂岗的奥格瑞玛飞艇平台与克伦德尔·大口袋交谈。",oEN="Travel to Thunder Bluff and speak to Krendle Bigpockets at the Orgrimmar Zepplin platform on Spirit Rise.",p="该启程前往首都了，<race>！奥格瑞玛曾经要徒步穿越荒原、跋涉前往杜隆塔尔，是一段漫长艰苦的旅程，但我们的地精盟友在雷霆崖烈魂岗顶上运营着一艘前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇。\n\n前往雷霆崖，在烈魂岗找克伦德尔·大口袋。\n\n你可以在奥格瑞玛飞艇停靠的码头外直接找到克伦德尔。与他交谈，然后等飞艇到来。",pEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar was once a long and hard journy by foot through the Barrens and into Durotar, but our Goblin allies operate a zepplin to Orgrimmar located atop Spirit Rise in Thunderbluff.\n\nTravel to Thunder bluff and seek out Krendle Bigpockets on Spirit Rise.\n\nKrendle can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with him, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",c="这就是载你前往奥格瑞玛的码头！飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，直接上去，找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息；飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别跳下去，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇、救援设备或任何类型的安全装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找泽莉·热喷嘴，她会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",cEN="This is the dock that will take you to Orgrimmar! The zepplin should arrive soon <name>. When the zepplin approaches the platform, simply walk on and find a comfortable place to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety regulations, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats, rescue, or safety devices of any kind.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Zelli Hotnozzle for directions to Orgrimmar."}
Q[1903526]={d="前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，你就可以上去。找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息，飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别往虚空里跳，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇或任何救援装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找泽莉·热喷嘴，她会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",dEN="The zepplin to Orgrimmar should arrive soon <name>. When the Zepplin approaches the platform you can walk on. Find a comfortable palce to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety requires, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats or any rescue devices.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Zelli Hotnozzle for directions to Orgrimmar.",o="在克伦德尔·大口袋身旁等待飞艇到来。登上飞艇，穿越贫瘠之地。抵达后与泽莉·热喷嘴交谈。",oEN="Wait by Krendle Bigpockets for the zepplin to arrive. Board the zepplin and ride it across the Barrens. Speak to Zelli Hotnozzle when you arrive.",p="前往奥格瑞玛的飞艇应该快到了，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，你就可以上去。找个舒服的地方在旅途中休息，飞艇会替你赶路。\n\n千万别往虚空里跳，英雄！根据地精安全条例，飞艇没有义务配备救生艇或任何救援装置。\n\n等飞艇靠上码头，就下船找泽莉·热喷嘴，她会告诉你怎么去奥格瑞玛。",pEN="The zepplin to Orgrimmar should arrive soon <name>. When the Zepplin approaches the platform you can walk on. Find a comfortable palce to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety requires, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats or any rescue devices.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Zelli Hotnozzle for directions to Orgrimmar.",c="欢迎来到杜隆塔尔，英雄！你前往奥格瑞玛的旅程快完成了。看到东边远处那座高大的瞭望塔了吗？\n\n往返于奥格瑞玛与雷霆崖之间的飞艇日夜运行。你随时可以回到飞艇平台登艇，在这些城市之间旅行。\n\n按 'M' 打开世界地图，留意飞艇图标，这样你就能找到回到这座平台的路。\n\n你准备好去首都报到了吗，<race>？",cEN="Welcome to Durotar Hero! Your journey to Orgrimmar is nearly complete. Do you see the great watchtower in the distance to east?\n\nThe zepplin betwen Orgimmar and Thunderbluff runs day and night. You can always travel between these cities by returning to the zepplin platform and riding the zepplin.\n\nOpen your World Map by pressing 'M' and notice the zepplin icon so you can find your way back to this platform.\n\nAre you ready to present yourself in the capital <race>?"}
Q[1903527]={d="该启程前往首都了，<race>！奥格瑞玛要穿越瘟疫之地、横渡大洋，是一段漫长艰辛的旅程，但魔法与工程学让我们得以加快行程。\n\n前往银月城，在逐日者王座与大法师罗曼斯交谈。\n\n大法师会向你说明如何使用我们强大的传送水晶，转瞬之间跨越遥远的距离。",dEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is a long and arduous journey through the plaguelands and across the ocean, but magic and engineering have allowed us to expedite the journey.\n\nTravel to Silvermoon City and speak to Grand Magister Rommath in Sunfury Spire.\n\nThe Grand Magister will explain how to use our powerful translocation crystals to travel great distances in the blink of an eye.",o="前往银月城，在逐日王庭与大法师罗曼斯交谈。",oEN="Travel to Silvermoon City and speak to Grand Magister Rommath within Sunfury Spire.",p="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！奥格瑞玛是一段穿越瘟疫之地、跨越海洋的漫长而艰难的旅程，但魔法与工程学让我们得以加快行程。\n\n前往银月城，到日怒之塔与大法师罗姆瑟对话。\n\n大法师会告诉你如何使用我们强大的传送水晶，在一眨眼间跨越遥远的距离。",pEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is a long and arduous journey through the plaguelands and across the ocean, but magic and engineering have allowed us to expedite the journey.\n\nTravel to Silvermoon City and speak to Grand Magister Rommath in Sunfury Spire.\n\nThe Grand Magister will explain how to use our powerful translocation crystals to travel great distances in the blink of an eye.",c="你好，<name>。首都已经请求你前往。进入我们身后不远处的内圣所，沿斜坡向上，使用传送宝珠前往银松林。",cEN="Greetings <name>. Your presence has been requested in the capital. Enter the Inner Sanctum directly beyond us. Travel up the ramp and use the Orb of Translocation to travel to Silverpine Forest."}
Q[1903528]={d="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！奥格瑞玛位于杜隆塔尔，在广袜大海的对岸，但我们的飞艇日夜不停地运送英雄们往返于各大陆之间。\n\n穿过这间屋子进入内圣所，使用传送宝珠前往银松林。\n\n到达后，穿过通往洛丹伦废墟的大门，从北侧出口离开。一直向北前行，抵达飞艇塔。\n\n在飞艇抵达奥格瑞玛的码头外就能找到扎佩塔。与她交谈，然后等待飞艇到达。",dEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is in Durotar, across the great ocean, but our zepplins operate day and night to ferry Heroes between continents.\n\nEnter the Inner Sanctum just through this room and use the Orb of Translocation to travel to Silverpine Forest.\n\nOnce you arrive, step through the door to the Ruins of Lordaeron and take the northern exit. Continue directly North to arrive at the Zepplin tower.\n\nZapetta can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with her, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",o="在隔壁房间的内圣所使用传送宝珠。然后登上外面的飞艇平台，与站在奥格瑞玛码头的扎佩塔交谈。",oEN="Use the Orb of Translocation in the Inner Sanctum in the next room. Then climb the zepplin platform outside and speak to Zapetta standing on the Orgrimmar dock.",p="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！奥格瑞玛位于杜隆塔尔，在广袜大海的对岸，但我们的飞艇日夜不停地运送英雄们往返于各大陆之间。\n\n穿过这间屋子进入内圣所，使用传送宝珠前往银松林。\n\n到达后，穿过通往洛丹伦废墟的大门，从北侧出口离开。一直向北前行，抵达飞艇塔。\n\n在飞艇抵达奥格瑞玛的码头外就能找到扎佩塔。与她交谈，然后等待飞艇到达。",pEN="The time has come to journey to the capital <race>! Orgrimmar is in Durotar, across the great ocean, but our zepplins operate day and night to ferry Heroes between continents.\n\nEnter the Inner Sanctum just through this room and use the Orb of Translocation to travel to Silverpine Forest.\n\nOnce you arrive, step through the door to the Ruins of Lordaeron and take the northern exit. Continue directly North to arrive at the Zepplin tower.\n\nZapetta can be found directly outside the dock where the zepplin to Orgrimmar arrives. Speak with her, and then wait for the zeppling to arrive.",c="这就是将你送往奥格瑞玛的码头！飞艇应该很快就会到达，<name>。当飞艇靠近平台时，直接走上去，找个舒服的地方休息，飞艇会替你完成剩下的旅程。\n\n只是千万别跳下去，英雄！按照地精安全条例，飞艇并不要求配备救生艇、救援设备或任何类型的安全装置。\n\n飞艇抵达码头后，下船并与弗雷扎交谈，让他告诉你前往奥格瑞玛的路线。",cEN="This is the dock that will take you to Orgrimmar! The zepplin should arrive soon <name>. When the zepplin approaches the platform, simply walk on and find a comfortable place to rest during your journey, the zepplin will do the work for you.\n\nJust don't jump off Hero! As per goblin safety regulations, the zepplin is NOT required to carry life boats, rescue, or safety devices of any kind.\n\nOnce the zepplin reaches the dock, depart and speak to Frezza for directions to Orgrimmar."}
Q[1903529]={d="到了开始前往首都之旅的时候了，<race>！前往铁炉堡，在侠匠区与洛马克·齿条交谈。",dEN="The time has come to begin your journy to the capital <race>! Travel to Ironforge and speak to Lomac Gearstrip in Tinkertown.\n\nLomac will explain how to ride the Deeprum Tram to Stormwind.",o="前往铁炉堡，在深水地铁入口外与洛马克·齿条交谈。",oEN="Travel to Ironforge and speak with Lomac Gearstrip outside of the entrance to the Deeprun Tram.",p="到了开始前往首都之旅的时候了，<race>！前往铁炉堡，在侠匠区与洛马克·齿条交谈。",pEN="The time has come to begin your journy to the capital <race>! Travel to Ironforge and speak to Lomac Gearstrip in Tinkertown.\n\nLomac will explain how to ride the Deeprum Tram to Stormwind.",c="进入深水地铁。在站台等待地铁到达，到达暴风城站后与尼普西交谈。",cEN="Enter the Deeprun Tram. Wait on the platform for the Tram to arrive, then speak to Nipsy when you arrive at the Stormwind station."}
Q[1903530]={d="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！暴风城远在山脉的另一侧。那些山口无法步行穿越，但侑儒工程学的奇迹造就了深水地铁。\n\n进入我身后的深水地铁。\n\n等待地铁到达，然后进入车厢。全程请将手、脚和剑刃保持在车厢内。你可不会想因为探头探得太出去而只能步行。\n\n抵达暴风城站后，下车并与布罗米·索克茨交谈，获取进一步指示。",dEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Stormwind lies far across the mountains. The passes are impossible to travel by foot, but the marvels of gnomish engineering have created the Deeprun Tram.\n\nEnter the Deeprun Tram directly behind me.\n\nWait for the tram to arrive and then enter the cart. Keep your hands, feet and swords inside at all times. You do NOT want to find yourself walking because you peered a little too far over the edge.\n\nWhen you arrive at the Stormwind station, depart the tram and speak to Bromey Sockets for further instruction.",o="进入深水地铁。在站台等待地铁到达，到达暴风城站后与布罗米·索克茨交谈。",oEN="Enter the Deeprun Tram. Wait on the platform for the Tram to arrive, then speak to Bromey Sockets when you arrive at the Stormwind station.",p="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！暴风城远在山脉的另一侧。那些山口无法步行穿越，但侑儒工程学的奇迹造就了深水地铁。\n\n进入我身后的深水地铁。\n\n等待地铁到达，然后进入车厢。全程请将手、脚和剑刃保持在车厢内。你可不会想因为探头探得太出去而只能步行。\n\n抵达暴风城站后，下车并与布罗米·索克茨交谈，获取进一步指示。",pEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Stormwind lies far across the mountains. The passes are impossible to travel by foot, but the marvels of gnomish engineering have created the Deeprun Tram.\n\nEnter the Deeprun Tram directly behind me.\n\nWait for the tram to arrive and then enter the cart. Keep your hands, feet and swords inside at all times. You do NOT want to find yourself walking because you peered a little too far over the edge.\n\nWhen you arrive at the Stormwind station, depart the tram and speak to Bromey Sockets for further instruction.",c="深水地铁日夜不停地运行。你随时可以回到这里，在暴风城与铁炉堡之间快速往返。从我所在位置的北侧离开深水地铁。前往贸易区，向贾斯汀·德马利尔报到。",cEN="The Deeprun Tram runs day and night. You can always return here to quickly travel between Stormwind and Ironforge. Exit the Deeprun Tram to the north of me. Travel to the Trade District and present yourself to Justine Demalier."}
Q[1903531]={d="到了开始前往首都之旅的时候了，<race>！前往达纳苏斯，在神殿花园西侧与莎琳·星光交谈。\n\n莎琳会告诉你如何前往鲁瑟兰村，开始前往暴风城的旅程。",dEN="The time has come to begin your journy to the capital <race>! Travel to Darnassus and speak to Sarin Starlight west of the Temple Gardens.\n\nSarin will explain how to travel to Rut'theran Village and begin your journey to Stormwind.",o="前往达纳苏斯，在神殿花园西侧与莎琳·星光交谈。",oEN="Travel to Darnassus and speak to Sarin Starlight west of the Temple Gardens.",p="到了开始前往首都之旅的时候了，<race>！前往达纳苏斯，在神殿花园西侧与莎琳·星光交谈。\n\n莎琳会告诉你如何前往鲁瑟兰村，开始前往暴风城的旅程。",pEN="The time has come to begin your journy to the capital <race>! Travel to Darnassus and speak to Sarin Starlight west of the Temple Gardens.\n\nSarin will explain how to travel to Rut'theran Village and begin your journey to Stormwind.",c="从我正前方的大树下方穿过，你就会被传送到鲁瑟兰村。到达鲁瑟兰村后，到奥伯丁码头对面的屋子里寻找埃拉拉斯·琥珀天。",cEN="Step beneath the tree directly in front of me to be transported to Rut'theran Village. Once you arrive in Rut'theran Village, meet Eralas Ambersky in the house in front of the docks to Auberdine."}
Q[1903532]={d="暴风城远在半个世界之外，<name>，但我们的船只已经准备好，为你的旅程加速。\n\n从我正北方的大树下方穿过，你就会被传送到鲁瑟兰村。到达后，与埃拉拉斯·琥珀天交谈。",dEN="Stormwind is half a world away <name>, but our ships are ready to speed you on your journey.\n\nStep below the tree directly north of me to be transported to Rut'theran Village. Once there, speak to Eralas Ambersky.",o="走到莎琳·星光正南方的大树下，你就会被传送到鲁瑟兰村，然后与埃拉拉斯·琥珀天交谈。",oEN="Walk beneath the tree directly south of Sarin Starlight to teleport to Rut'theran village, then speak with Eralas Ambersky.",p="暴风城远在半个世界之外，<name>，但我们的船只已经准备好，为你的旅程加速。\n\n从我正北方的大树下方穿过，你就会被传送到鲁瑟兰村。到达后，与埃拉拉斯·琥珀天交谈。",pEN="Stormwind is half a world away <name>, but our ships are ready to speed you on your journey.\n\nStep below the tree directly north of me to be transported to Rut'theran Village. Once there, speak to Eralas Ambersky.",c="你好，<name>。愿风助你前往暴风城的旅程顺利。\n\n不用担心，<race>。这些船只往返于两岸之间。你总是可以以前往时的方式返回达纳苏斯。\n\n在我正南方码头的尽头等待船只到达。你下船时，萨马里安会在那里等候，并给你进一步的指示。",cEN="Greetings <name>. May the wind favor your journey to Stormwind.\n\nAnd don't worry <race>. These ships travel back and forth. You can always return to Darnassus the same way you are leaving.\n\nWait at the end of the dock directly south of me until the ship arrives. Thamarian will be waiting when you disembark to give you further instructions."}
Q[1903533]={d="渡船会停靠鲁瑟兰村码头，将你运送到奥伯丁港口，在那里你可以乘船前往伟大的暴风城。\n\n在码头尽头等待船只到达。你下船后，在码头与萨马里安会合。",dEN="The ferry will arrive at the docks in Rut'theran village, and will transport you to the harbor at Auberdine where you can take passage to the great city of Stormwind.\n\nWait at the end of the dock for the ship to arrive. Meet Thamarian on the docks when you disembark.",o="在码头尽头等待船只到达，下船后与萨马里安会合。",oEN="Wait at the end of the dock for the ship to arrive, then meet with Thamarian when you disembark.",p="渡船会停靠鲁瑟兰村码头，将你运送到奥伯丁港口，在那里你可以乘船前往伟大的暴风城。\n\n在码头尽头等待船只到达。你下船后，在码头与萨马里安会合。",pEN="The ferry will arrive at the docks in Rut'theran village, and will transport you to the harbor at Auberdine where you can take passage to the great city of Stormwing.\n\nWait at the end of the dock for the ship to arrive. Meet Thamarian on the docks when you disembark.",c="我们的船只日夜不停地往返于奥伯丁与暴风城之间。你随时可以乘坐这些船只在城市间旅行。\n\n在最南侧、也就是我正南方的码头尽头等待船只到达。船只靠泊后，登船，让它载着你横渡大海。\n\n到达暴风城后，与纳尤拉交谈。她会在码头等候你。",cEN="Our ships travel between Auberdine and Stormwind day and night. You can use these ships to travel between cities whenever you wish.\n\nWait at the end of the southern most dock, directly south of me until the ship arrives. Once the ship has docked, board the vessel and let it carry you across the sea.\n\nOnce you arrive in Stormwind, speak with Nayura. She will await you at the docks."}
Q[1903534]={d="我们的船只日夜不停地往返于奥伯丁与暴风城之间。你随时可以乘坐这些船只在城市间旅行。\n\n在最南侧、也就是萨马里安正南方的码头尽头等待船只到达。船只靠泊后，登船，让它载着你横渡大海。\n\n到达暴风城后，与纳尤拉交谈。她会在码头等候你。",dEN="Our ships travel between Auberdine and Stormwind day and night. You can use these ships to travel between cities whenever you wish.\n\nWait at the end of the southern most dock, directly south of Thamarian until the ship arrives. Once the ship has docked, board the vessel and let it carry you across the sea.\n\nOnce you arrive in Stormwind, speak with Nayura. She will await you at the docks.",o="在南侧码头、也就是萨马里安正南方，等待前往暴风城的船只到达。你下船后与纳尤拉交谈。",oEN="Wait at the Southern dock directly south of Thamarian for the Ship to Stormwind to arrive. Speak to Nayura when you disembark.",p="我们的船只日夜不停地往返于鲁瑟兰与暴风城之间。你随时可以乘坐这些船只在城市间旅行。\n\n在最南侧、也就是萨马里安正南方的码头尽头等待船只到达。船只靠泊后，登船，让它载着你横渡大海。\n\n到达暴风城后，与纳尤拉交谈。她会在码头等候你。",pEN="Our ships travel between Rut'theran and Stormwind day and night. You can use these ships to travel between cities whenever you wish.\n\nWait at the end of the southern most dock, directly south of Thamarian until the ship arrives. Once the ship has docked, board the vessel and let it carry you across the sea.\n\nOnce you arrive in Stormwind, speak with Nayura. She will await you at the docks.",c="欢迎来到暴风城，<race>。\n\n贾斯汀·德马利尔正在贸易区焦急地等待你的到来。路上可别迷路太久。",cEN="Welcome to Stormwind <race>.\n\nJustine Demalier is anxiously awaiting your arrival in the Trade District. Do try not to get too lost on the way."}
Q[1903535]={d="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！暴风城远在大洋彼岸，但我们的船只和强劲的海风会很快将你送抵这座伟大的城市。\n\n沿埃索达尔西侧的道路前行，在瓦拉尔港口找到猎人凯拉·夜弓。她会引导你前往首都。",dEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Stormwind lies far across the ocean, but our ships and strong winds will take you to the great city in no time.\n\nFollow the road west of The Exodar and meet Huntress Kella Nightbow at Valaar's Berth. She will guide you on your journey to the capital city.",o="沿埃索达尔西侧的道路前行，前往瓦拉尔港口。到达后与猎人凯拉·夜弓交谈。",oEN="Take the road west from The Exodar and travel to Valaar's Berth. Speak with Huntress Kella Nightbow when you arrive.",p="到了前往首都的时候了，<race>！暴风城远在大洋彼岸，但我们的船只和强劲的海风会很快将你送抵这座伟大的城市。\n\n沿埃索达尔西侧的道路前行，在瓦拉尔港口找到猎人凯拉·夜弓。她会引导你前往首都。",pEN="The time has come to journy to the capital <race>! Stormwind lies far across the ocean, but our ships and strong winds will take you to the great city in no time.\n\nFollow the road west of The Exodar and meet Huntress Kella Nightbow at Valaar's Berth. She will guide you on your journey to the capital city.",c="你好，<name>。\n\n前往暴风城的旅程很远，但我们的船只坚固结实，艾泽拉斯再没有比他们更好的水手能将你送抵彼岸。\n\n沿我正西方的码头前行，等待船只到达。它会将你送往奥伯丁，萨马里安会在那里等候你。",cEN="Greetings <name>.\n\nThe journey to Stormwind is far, but our ships are strong and there are no better sailors on Azeroth to sail you there.\n\nFollow the docks directly west of me and wait for the ship to arrive. It will transport you to Auberdine, where Thamarian will be awaiting your arrival."}
Q[1903536]={d="前往暴风城的旅程很远，但我们的船只坚固结实，艾泽拉斯再没有比他们更好的水手能将你送抵彼岸。\n\n沿我正西方的码头前行，等待船只到达。它会将你送往奥伯丁，萨马里安会在那里等候你。\n\n不用担心，<race>。我们的船只双向往返。你随时可以搭乘来时的那艘船返回。",dEN="The journey to Stormwind is far, but our ships are strong and there are no better sailors on Azeroth to sail you there.\n\nFollow the docks directly west of me and wait for the ship to arrive. It will transport you to Auberdine, where Thamarian will be awaiting your arrival.\n\nDo not fret <race>. Our ships travel in both directions. You can return on the same boat you left on anytime you wish.",o="在猎人凯拉·夜弓正西方码头的尽头等待，船只到达后登船。你在奥伯丁下船后，与萨马里安交谈。",oEN="Wait at the end of the dock directly west of Huntress Kella Nightbow and board the ship when it arrives. Speak to Thamarian when you disembark at Auberdine.",p="前往暴风城的旅程很远，但我们的船只坚固结实，艾泽拉斯再没有比他们更好的水手能将你送抵彼岸。\n\n沿我正西方的码头前行，等待船只到达。它会将你送往奥伯丁，萨马里安会在那里等候你。\n\n不用担心，<race>。我们的船只双向往返。你随时可以搭乘来时的那艘船返回。",pEN="The journey to Stormwind is far, but our ships are strong and there are no better sailors on Azeroth to sail you there.\n\nFollow the docks directly west of me and wait for the ship to arrive. It will transport you to Auberdine, where Thamarian will be awaiting your arrival.\n\nDo not fret <race>. Our ships travel in both directions. You can return on the same boat you left on anytime you wish.",c="我们的船只日夜不停地往返于奥伯丁与暴风城之间。你随时可以乘坐这些船只在城市间旅行。\n\n在最南侧、也就是我正南方的码头尽头等待船只到达。船只靠泊后，登船，让它载着你横渡大海。\n\n到达暴风城后，与纳尤拉交谈。她会在码头等候你。",cEN="Our ships travel between Auberdine and Stormwind day and night. You can use these ships to travel between cities whenever you wish.\n\nWait at the end of the southern most dock, directly south of me until the ship arrives. Once the ship has docked, board the vessel and let it carry you across the sea.\n\nOnce you arrive in Stormwind, speak with Nayura. She will await you at the docks."}
Q[1903537]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
Q[1903538]={d="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 10 级。\n\n如果你还没有离开新手区，或者任务和生物对你而言已经太过简单，你可以沿着离开新手区的道路前行，前往一座拥有更具挑战性任务的村庄，那里的任务每完成一次都会奖励更多经验值。",dEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 10.\n\nIf you have not left the starting zone yet, or quests and creatures are becoming too easy for you, you can follow the path out of your starting zone to reach a village with more challenging quests that will grant more experience per completion.",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 10 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 10.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成当前任务后再回来吧。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得漂亮，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[1903540]={d="旅店主人提供各种各样的服务。你可以购买食物和饮水以帮助恢复生命值和法力值，在旅店及其周边接取任务，并设置你的炉石，以便在周游世界、完成任务时能够快速返回那家特定的旅店。\n\n如果你不小心丢失了炉石，只要与任何旅店主人对话并重新设置你的家，就能找回它。\n\n单击小地图上的放大镜，选择“旅店主人”，即可快速找到他们。",dEN="Innkeepers offer a variety of services. You can buy food and water to help replenish health and mana, find quests in and around the inn, and set your Hearthstone so you can return to that specific inn quickly while traveling the world and completing quests.\n\nIf you ever lose your Hearthstone you can recover it by talking to any innkeeper and setting your home again.\n\nYou can quickly find Innkeepers by clicking the magnifying lense on your mini-map and selecting Innkeeper.",o="前往一名旅店主人处，选择“将这家旅店设为你的家”。",oEN="Visit an Innkeeper and select Make this inn your home.",p="前往地图上标有黄色问号的旅店主人处。按 M 键即可打开地图。\n\n旅店主人提供各种各样的服务。你可以购买食物和饮水以帮助恢复生命值和法力值，在旅店及其周边接取任务，并设置你的炉石，以便在周游世界、完成任务时能够快速返回那家特定的旅店。\n\n按 M 键打开世界地图，即可找到旅店的位置。你会看到一个黄色的问号，标示着旅店主人的位置。",pEN="Visit the innkeeper marked by a yellow ? on your map. You can open your map by hitting M.\n\nInnkeepers offer a variety of services. You can buy food and water to help replenish health and mana, find quests in and around the inn, and set your Hearthstone so you can return to that specific inn quickly while traveling the world and completing quests.\n\nYou can find the location of the inn by hitting M and opening your world map. You will see a Yellow Question Mark indicating the location of the innkeeper.",c="你可以在大多数任务区和城市中找到旅店主人。向卫兵询问方向，或使用小地图上的放大镜找到最近的旅店主人，设置你的炉石，以便快速返回你当前的任务区。\n\n尽量在旅店中下线。离线期间，你的角色会获得休息奖励，提高获得的经验值。这项奖励最多可累积相当于 2 级的量，而在旅店或主城中下线可获得更多休息奖励。\n相关",cEN="You can find Innkeepers in most quest hubs and cities. Ask a guard for directions or use the magnifying lense on your minimap to locate the nearest Innkeeper to set your Hearthstone and quickly return to your current questing hub.\n\nAlways try to log off in an Inn. While offline, your characters will acquire a Rested Bonus that increases your experience gained. This bonus stacks up to 2 levels, and you earn more Rested Bonus while logged out in an inn or Capital City.\nRelated"}
Q[1903542]={d="专业是塑造角色身份、发展角色的重要组成部分。专业分为两大类：制造与采集。\n\n许多专业天然就能很好地搭配，比如草药学与炼金术，或矿工与锻造。\n\n你只能学习两项主专业，但副专业想学多少就能学多少。\n\n副专业包括急救、烹饪和钓鱼。\n\n与《初学者工匠之书》对话，选择一项专业！你随时可以遗忘自己的专业，日后再选一项新的。",dEN="Professions are an important part of developing your character crafting your identity. Professions fall into two categories, Crafting and Gathering.\n\nMany professions naturally pair well together, like Herbalism and Alchemy or Mining and Blacksmith.\n\nYou can only learn two primary professions, but can learn as many secondary professions as you would like.\n\nSecondary professions include First Aid, Cooking and Fishing.\n\nSpeak to the Beginner's Book of Artisans and pick a profession! You can always unlearn your profession and pick a new one later.",o="前往旅店外的《初学者工匠之书》，学习一项专业。",oEN="Visit the Beginner's Book of Artisans outside the inn and learn a profession.",p="与《工匠之书》对话，选择一项专业！你随时可以遗忘自己的专业，日后再选一项新的。",pEN="Speak to the Book of Artisans and pick a profession! You can always unlearn your profession and pick a new one later.",c="既然你已经选定了一项专业，就可以通过制造或采集来提升专业技能。\n\n随着技能提升，你将解锁新的配方，并获得采集更高品质材料的能力。\n\n前往任意主城的专业训练师，或使用携带式工匠之书，在技能提升的同时学习更高级的配方。\n\n在飞升服中，提升专业技能的同时也能获得经验值。拥有两项主专业总是值得的；如果你不确定该选什么，采集类专业非常适合升级。\n相关",cEN="Now that you have chosen a profession you can gain skills in your profession by crafting or gathering.\n\nAs you gain in skill, you will unlock new recipes and the ability to gather higher quality materials.\n\nVisit a Professional Trainer in any capital city or use a portable Book of Artisans to learn more advanced recipes as you grow in skill.\n\nYou gain experience while leveling your professions on Ascension. It's always worth having two primary professions, and if you are unsure of what to pick, gathering professions are great for leveling.\nRelated"}
Q[1903543]={d="告示板分布在所有主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝海湾和 20 级任务区！\n\n这些告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动。\n\n达到满级后，你应当经常查看告示板以接取日常任务。\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。",dEN="Call Boards are found in all major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and level 20 quest hubs!\n\nThese Boards contain Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically and timed events.\n\nYou should always check the Call Board at max level to pick up Daily Quests.\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.",o="与奥格瑞玛的告示板交互。",oEN="Interact with the Call Board in Orgrimmar.",p="告示板分布在所有主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝海湾和 20 级任务区！\n\n这些告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动。\n\n达到满级后，你应当经常查看告示板以接取日常任务。\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。",pEN="Call Boards are found in all major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and level 20 quest hubs!\n\nThese Boards contain Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically and timed events.\n\nYou should always check the Call Board at max level to pick up Daily Quests.\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.",c="告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你在升级途中可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动期间的特殊任务。\n\n告示板每天在服务器时间 03:00 更新日常任务。请经常查看告示板！\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。\n相关",cEN="The Call Board contains Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically while leveling and special quests during timed events.\n\nThe Call Board will offer new Daily Quests every day at 03:00 server time. Check the Ball Board often!\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.\nRelated"}
Q[1903544]={d="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 15 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击。这会拉远视角，显示整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到附近等级为 10 级或以上的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 15 级。",dEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 15.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind the nearby zone that is level 10+ and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 15.",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 15 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 15.",p="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 15 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击。这会拉远视角，显示整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到附近等级为 10 级或以上的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 15 级。",pEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 15.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind the nearby zone that is level 10+ and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 15.",c="随着等级提升，你的力量会不断增长，并获得更强大的法术以及额外的法术等级，使你的核心技能更加强大。\n\n随着你达到更高等级，NPC 会向你提供新的任务，将你送往未知区域和副本深处展开新的冒险，并在你力量增长时挑战更强大的生物。\n\n既然你已达到 15 级，就可以在《飞升初学者之书》中获得新的等级并强化你当前的法术与技能。随着等级继续提升，你还会解锁更多法术等级。\n\n完成更多任务、击杀生物，继续你的旅程，直至满级！\n相关",cEN="As you gain levels you will progress in power and gain access to more powerful spells and additional spell ranks making your core abilities stronger.\n\nNPCs will offer you new quests as you reach higher levels, sending you on new adventures to undiscovered zones, deep into dungeons and challenge you to face stronger creatures as your power grows.\n\nYou can acquire new ranks and empower your current spells and abilities at the Beginner's Book of Ascension now that you have reached level 15. You will unlock additional spell ranks as you gain additional levels.\n\nComplete additional quests and slay creatures to continue your journey towards max level!\nRelated"}
Q[1903545]={d="告示板分布在所有主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝海湾和 20 级任务区！\n\n这些告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动。\n\n达到满级后，你应当经常查看告示板以接取日常任务。\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。",dEN="Call Boards are found in all major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and level 20 quest hubs!\n\nThese Boards contain Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically and timed events.\n\nYou should always check the Call Board at max level to pick up Daily Quests.\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.",o="与暴风城的告示板交互。",oEN="Interact with the Call Board in Stormwind.",p="告示板分布在所有主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝海湾和 20 级任务区！\n\n这些告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动。\n\n达到满级后，你应当经常查看告示板以接取日常任务。\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。",pEN="Call Boards are found in all major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and level 20 quest hubs!\n\nThese Boards contain Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically and timed events.\n\nYou should always check the Call Board at max level to pick up Daily Quests.\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.",c="告示板上有日常任务、飞升之路任务、你在升级途中可能错过的自动弹出任务，以及限时活动期间的特殊任务。\n\n告示板每天在服务器时间 03:00 更新日常任务。请经常查看告示板！\n\n如果升级途中不确定该去哪个区域，你可以在告示板上找到指引你前行的任务。\n相关",cEN="The Call Board contains Daily Quests, Path of Ascension Quests, Quests you may have missed when they popped up automatically while leveling and special quests during timed events.\n\nThe Call Board will offer new Daily Quests every day at 03:00 server time. Check the Ball Board often!\n\nIf you ever find yourself unsure which zone to travel to while leveling, you can find quests that will guide your path on the Call Board.\nRelated"}
Q[1903546]={d="你可以在主要城市和任务区找到飞行管理员。大多数区域都有一名飞行管理员，让你能够快速往返该区域。\n\n单击小地图上的放大镜并选择“飞行管理员”，即可找到附近的飞行管理员。\n\n要解锁新的飞行路线，你必须与飞行管理员交谈。每次前往新区域时，都应当在你阵营的任务区寻找飞行管理员。",dEN="You can find Flightmasters in major cities and quest hubs. Most zones have a Flightmaster that will allow you to quickly travel to and from that zone.\n\nYou can find nearby Flightmasters by hitting the magnifying lense on your mini-map and select Flightmaster.\n\nTo unlock a new Flightpath, you must talk to the Flightmaster. Anytime you travel to a new zone you should look for the Flightmaster in your faction's quest hub.",o="与飞行管理员交谈，飞往十字路口。",oEN="Talk to the Flightmaster and fly to the Crossroads.",p="与奥格瑞玛银行旁塔楼顶部的飞行管理员多拉斯交谈，然后飞往十字路口。",pEN="Speak to Doras the Flightmaster at top of the tower next to the Ogrimmar Bank, then fly to the Crossroads.",c="飞行管理员是你旅程中至关重要的一环，让你能够快速往返于艾泽拉斯各地。\n\n旅程初始，你总是已经解锁了一些基础飞行路线，但随着等级提升、开始探索更危险的区域，你将需要与任务区里遇到的飞行管理员交谈，才能解锁往返该地点的飞行能力。\n\n尚未发现的飞行路线会以绿色感叹号标示。与飞行管理员交谈，新的飞行路线就会解锁。某些飞行路线需要其他路线作为连接，解锁更多飞行路线往往能开通更快捷的路线。\n\n发现新区域时，请务必寻找并解锁新的飞行路线。\n相关",cEN="Flightmasters are a critical part of your journey and allow you to quickly travel throughout Azeroth.\n\nYou always begin your journey with some basic flightpaths unlocked, but as you grow in levels and begin to explore more dangerous zones you will need to speak with the Flightmasters you find in Quest Hubs to unlock the ability to fly to and from that location.\n\nUndiscovered Flight Paths are displayed with a Green Exclamation Mark. Speak to the Flightmaster and your new Flight Path will be unlocked. Some Flightpaths require other connecting paths, and unlocking additional Flightpaths will often enable quicker routes.\n\nBe sure to seek out and unlock new Flightpaths when discovering new zones.\nRelated"}
Q[1903547]={d="你可以在主要城市和任务区找到飞行管理员。大多数区域都有一名飞行管理员，让你能够快速往返该区域。\n\n单击小地图上的放大镜并选择“飞行管理员”，即可找到附近的飞行管理员。\n\n要解锁新的飞行路线，你必须与飞行管理员交谈。每次前往新区域时，都应当在你阵营的任务区寻找飞行管理员。",dEN="You can find Flightmasters in major cities and quest hubs. Most zones have a Flightmaster that will allow you to quickly travel to and from that zone.\n\nYou can find nearby Flightmasters by hitting the magnifying lens on your mini-map and selecting Flightmaster.\n\nTo unlock a new Flightpath, you must talk to the Flightmaster. Anytime you travel to a new zone you should look for the Flightmaster in your faction's quest hub.",o="与飞行管理员交谈，飞往西部荒野。",oEN="Talk to the Flightmaster and fly to Westfall.",p="前往贸易区的东角，沿斜坡向上，与邓加尔·长饮交谈。然后飞往西部荒野。",pEN="Head to the East Corner of the Trade District, then follow the ramp up, speak to Dungar Longdrink. Then fly to Westfall.",c="飞行管理员是你旅程中至关重要的一环，让你能够快速往返于艾泽拉斯各地。\n\n旅程初始，你总是已经解锁了一些基础飞行路线，但随着等级提升、开始探索更危险的区域，你将需要与任务区里遇到的飞行管理员交谈，才能解锁往返该地点的飞行能力。\n\n尚未发现的飞行路线会以绿色感叹号标示。与飞行管理员交谈，新的飞行路线就会解锁。某些飞行路线需要其他路线作为连接，解锁更多飞行路线往往能开通更快捷的路线。\n\n发现新区域时，请务必寻找并解锁新的飞行路线。\n相关",cEN="Flightmasters are a critical part of your journey and allow you to quickly travel throughout Azeroth.\n\nYou always begin your journey with some basic flightpaths unlocked, but as you grow in levels and begin to explore more dangerous zones you will need to speak with the Flightmasters you find in Quest Hubs to unlock the ability to fly to and from that location.\n\nUndiscovered Flight Paths are displayed with a Green Exclamation Mark. Speak to the Flightmaster and your new Flight Path will be unlocked. Some Flightpaths require other connecting paths, and unlocking additional Flightpaths will often enable quicker routes.\n\nBe sure to seek out and unlock new Flightpaths when discovering new zones.\nRelated"}
Q[1903548]={d="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 20 级。\n\n随着等级提升，会有更艰难的任务向你开放。许多任务发布者会显示一个灰色感叹号，表示当你等级更高时他们会向你提供任务。\n\n继续接取并完成新任务，在累积经验的同时深入更艰难的区域，直到达到 20 级！",dEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 20.\n\nAs you gain levels more difficult quests will become available to you. Many quest givers will display a Grey Exclamation Mark indicating they will offer you a quest when you are higher level.\n\nContinue to accept and complete new quests, venturing into more difficult areas as you gain experience until you reach level 20!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 20 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 20.",p="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 20 级。\n\n随着等级提升，会有更艰难的任务向你开放。许多任务发布者会显示一个灰色感叹号，表示当你等级更高时他们会向你提供任务。\n\n继续接取并完成新任务，在累积经验的同时深入更艰难的区域，直到达到 20 级！",pEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 20.\n\nAs you gain levels more difficult quests will become available to you. Many quest givers will display a Grey Exclamation Mark indicating they will offer you a quest when you are higher level.\n\nContinue to accept and complete new quests, venturing into more difficult areas as you gain experience until you reach level 20!",c="20 级是你旅程中的一个重要里程碑。新的强大法术与天赋已经向你开放；如果你选择了英雄建筑师升级构筑，它们也已经添加到你的构筑中。\n\n如果你感到艰难或不知所措，随时可以前往英雄建筑师处，立即选择一套既有趣又强大的升级构筑！\n\n不确定接下来该去哪里？告示板总会提供指引你前往最适合你等级区域的任务！\n相关",cEN="Level 20 is a major milestone in your journey. New and powerful spells and talents are now available to you or have been added to your build if you selected a Hero Architect Leveling build.\n\nIf you find yourself struggling or overwhelmed, you can always visit the Hero Architect to choose a fun and powerful leveling build now!\n\nUnsure where to go next? The Call Board will always offer quests directing you to the zone that best matches your level!\nRelated"}
Q[1903549]={d="混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。\n\n无风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时不会掉落物品。\n\n无风险 PvE 模式完全关闭 PvP，你无法攻击其他玩家，也不会被他们攻击。\n\n要选择 PvE 模式，请先选择无风险，然后选择 PvE 模式。\n\n高风险模式是世界中独立的位面，这意味着你不会遇到无风险模式的玩家。在高风险模式下，如果你在 1 级区域被杀，会掉落背包中的物品；如果在 2 级或 3 级区域被杀，连身上装备的物品也会一并掉落！\n\n进入高风险模式时，你默认是所属阵营的忠诚成员。你可以施放“雇佣作战佣兵”变为中立，从而能够攻击任何人、也会被任何人攻击，同时还能与对立阵营的高风险玩家组队。你随时可以在主城中，通过施放法术书“常规”页签下的法术，在“佣兵”与“为部落而战”或“为联盟而战”之间切换。\n\n你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处切换风险模式。与混合风险 NPC 对话，选择“无风险 PvP”、“无风险 PvE”或“高风险 PvP”。",dEN="Hybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath.\n\nNo-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with no loot on death.\n\nNo-Risk PvE disables PvP entirely, so you cannot attack or be attacked by other players.\n\nTo opt-in to PvE Mode, choose No-Risk, then select PvE Mode.\n\nHigh-Risk is its own separate phase out in the world, meaning you will not encounter No-Risk players. While in High-Risk, you will drop items from your bag when killed while in Tier 1 zones. If you are killed in a Tier 2 or 3 zone you will also drop equipped loot!\n\nWhen entering High-Risk you will default to a Loyal Member of your faction. You can cast Mercenary for Hire to become neutral, allowing you to attack and be attacked by anyone, but also enable cross faction High-Risk grouping. You can switch between Mercenary and For the Horde or Alliance anytime in a main city by casting the spells in the General Tab of your spell book.\n\nYou can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime you wish. Talk to a Hybrid Risk NPC and select either No-Risk PvP, No-Risk PvE or High-Risk PvP.",o="与奥格瑞玛告示板旁的血守者罗佐克交谈。",oEN="Speak to Blood Keeper Rozok by the Orgrimmar Call Board.",p="混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。\n\n无风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时不会掉落物品。\n\n无风险 PvE 模式完全关闭 PvP，你无法攻击其他玩家，也不会被他们攻击。\n\n要选择 PvE 模式，请先选择无风险，然后选择 PvE 模式。\n\n高风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时会掉落物品，并且允许施放“犯罪意图”来谋杀自己阵营的人。谋杀自己阵营的人最终会使你成为“逆贼”，死亡时掉落额外物品，并且所有玩家都可以自由攻击你。\n\n你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处切换风险模式。与混合风险 NPC 对话，选择“无风险 PvP”、“无风险 PvE”或“高风险 PvP”。",pEN="Hybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath.\n\nNo-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with no loot on death.\n\nNo-Risk PvE disables PvP entirely, so you cannot attack or be attacked by other players.\n\nTo opt-in to PvE Mode, choose No-Risk, then select PvE Mode.\n\nHigh-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with loot on death, and allows casting Criminal Intent to murder your own faction. Murdering your own faction will eventually leading to your becoming an Outlaw, dropping additional loot on death and being freely attackable by all players.\n\nYou can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime you wish. Talk to a Hybrid Risk NPC and select either No-Risk PvP, No-Risk PvE or High-Risk PvP.",c="你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处免费切换风险模式。\n\n混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。",cEN="You can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime for free.\n\nHybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath."}
Q[1903550]={d="混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。\n\n无风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时不会掉落物品。\n\n无风险 PvE 模式完全关闭 PvP，你无法攻击其他玩家，也不会被他们攻击。\n\n要选择 PvE 模式，请先选择无风险，然后选择 PvE 模式。\n\n高风险模式是世界中独立的位面，这意味着你不会遇到无风险模式的玩家。在高风险模式下，如果你在 1 级区域被杀，会掉落背包中的物品；如果在 2 级或 3 级区域被杀，连身上装备的物品也会一并掉落！\n\n进入高风险模式时，你默认是所属阵营的忠诚成员。你可以施放“雇佣作战佣兵”变为中立，从而能够攻击任何人、也会被任何人攻击，同时还能与对立阵营的高风险玩家组队。你随时可以在主城中，通过施放法术书“常规”页签下的法术，在“佣兵”与“为部落而战”或“为联盟而战”之间切换。\n\n你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处切换风险模式。与混合风险 NPC 对话，选择“无风险 PvP”、“无风险 PvE”或“高风险 PvP”。",dEN="Hybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath.\n\nNo-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with no loot on death.\n\nNo-Risk PvE disables PvP entirely, so you cannot attack or be attacked by other players.\n\nTo opt-in to PvE Mode, choose No-Risk, then select PvE Mode.\n\nHigh-Risk is its own separate phase out in the world, meaning you will not encounter No-Risk players. While in High-Risk, you will drop items from your bag when killed while in Tier 1 zones. If you are killed in a Tier 2 or 3 zone you will also drop equipped loot!\n\nWhen entering High-Risk you will default to a Loyal Member of your faction. You can cast Mercenary for Hire to become neutral, allowing you to attack and be attacked by anyone, but also enable cross faction High-Risk grouping. You can switch between Mercenary and For the Horde or Alliance anytime in a main city by casting the spells in the General Tab of your spell book.\n\nYou can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime you wish. Talk to a Hybrid Risk NPC and select either No-Risk PvP, No-Risk PvE or High-Risk PvP.",o="与暴风城告示板旁的战场大师特雷莎交谈。",oEN="Speak to Battlemaster Tressa by the Stormwind Call Board.",p="混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。\n\n无风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时不会掉落物品。\n\n无风险 PvE 模式完全关闭 PvP，你无法攻击其他玩家，也不会被他们攻击。\n\n要选择 PvE 模式，请先选择无风险，然后选择 PvE 模式。\n\n高风险模式允许跨阵营 PvP，死亡时会掉落物品，并且允许施放“犯罪意图”来谋杀自己阵营的人。谋杀自己阵营的人最终会使你成为“逆贼”，死亡时掉落额外物品，并且所有玩家都可以自由攻击你。\n\n你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处切换风险模式。与混合风险 NPC 对话，选择“无风险 PvP”、“无风险 PvE”或“高风险 PvP”。",pEN="Hybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath.\n\nNo-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with no loot on death.\n\nNo-Risk PvE disables PvP entirely, so you cannot attack or be attacked by other players.\n\nTo opt-in to PvE Mode, choose No-Risk, then select PvE Mode.\n\nHigh-Risk allows for cross faction PvP with loot on death, and allows casting Criminal Intent to murder your own faction. Murdering your own faction will eventually leading to your becoming an Outlaw, dropping additional loot on death and being freely attackable by all players.\n\nYou can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime you wish. Talk to a Hybrid Risk NPC and select either No-Risk PvP, No-Risk PvE or High-Risk PvP.",c="你随时可以在混合风险 NPC 处免费切换风险模式。\n\n混合风险系统 NPC 分布在主要城市，以及许多中立城市，比如藏宝湾和沙塔斯。",cEN="You can change risk modes at a Hybrid Risk NPC anytime for free.\n\nHybrid Risk System NPCs can be found in major cities and many neutral cities like Booty Bay and Shattrath."}
Q[1903551]={d="魔能转换能让你在高风险 PvP 中保护自己的装备。\n\n前往奥格瑞玛幽暗裂隙中的魔能转换传送门。与传送门交互，即可在魔能转换中保护或移除装备栏位。如果你在高风险 PvP 中死亡，掉落的将是金币，而不是你的装备！\n\n按 C 键打开角色面板，在右下角可以看到你死亡时最多会损失的金币数量。\n\n贝尔皮克斯就在魔能转换传送门附近，与他交谈可了解更多。",dEN="Fel Commutation allows you to protect your gear in High-Risk PvP.\n\nFind the Fel Commutation Portal in the Cleft of Shadow within Ogrimmar. Interacting with the portal will allow you to protect or remove gear slots from Fel Commutation. If you die in High-Risk PvP, you will instead drop gold instead of your gear!\n\nYou can find your max gold lost on death in your character pane at the bottom right by hitting C.\n\nBelpix is standing near the Fel Commutation Portal, speak with him to learn more.",o="前往奥格瑞玛内部幽暗裂隙中的魔能转换传送门。",oEN="Visit the Fel Commutation Portal in the Cleft of Shadow inside Orgrimmar.",p="魔能转换能让你在高风险 PvP 中保护自己的装备。\n\n前往奥格瑞玛幽暗裂隙中的魔能转换传送门。与传送门交互，即可在魔能转换中保护或移除装备栏位。如果你在高风险 PvP 中死亡，掉落的将是金币，而不是你的装备！\n\n按 C 键打开角色面板，在右下角可以看到你死亡时最多会损失的金币数量。\n\n贝尔皮克斯就在魔能转换传送门附近，与他交谈可了解更多。",pEN="Fel Commutation allows you to protect your gear in High-Risk PvP.\n\nFind the Fel Commutation Portal in the Cleft of Shadow within Ogrimmar. Interacting with the portal will allow you to protect or remove gear slots from Fel Commutation. If you die in High-Risk PvP, you will instead drop gold instead of your gear!\n\nYou can find your max gold lost on death in your character pane at the bottom right by hitting C.\n\nBelpix is standing near the Fel Commutation Portal, speak with him to learn more.",c="与魔能转换传送门交互，打开魔能转换菜单。\n\n受魔能转换保护的装备栏位会以绿色高亮显示。你可以单击某个栏位以添加或移除魔能转换。如果你愿意，可以将整套装备全部转换。\n\n只有在高风险模式下死亡时，你才会因魔能转换而损失金币。在无风险 PvP、PvE 死亡、副本、战场或竞技场中都不会损失金币。只有在高风险 PvP 中被其他玩家杀死时，你才会损失魔能转换的金币。\n\n打开魔能转换传送门，单击未高亮的栏位即可保护你的装备。",cEN="Interact with the Fel Commutation Portal to open up the Fel Commutation menu.\n\nGear slots that are protected by Fel Commutation are highlighted in green. You can click a slot to add or remove Fel Commutation. You can commute your entire set of gear if you desire.\n\nYou only lose gold for Fel Commutation when dying in High-Risk. You do not lose gold in No-Risk PvP, PvE deaths, Dungeons, Battlegrounds or Arena. You only lose Fel Commutation gold when dying to another player in High-Risk PvP.\n\nOpen the Fel Commutation Portal and protect your gear by clicking unhighlighted slots."}
Q[1903552]={d="魔能转换能让你在高风险 PvP 中保护自己的装备。\n\n前往暴风城法师区“待宰羔羊”旅店地下室中的魔能转换传送门。与传送门交互，即可在魔能转换中保护或移除装备栏位。如果你在高风险 PvP 中死亡，掉落的将是金币，而不是你的装备！\n\n按 C 键打开角色面板，在右下角可以看到你死亡时最多会损失的金币数量。\n\n贝尔皮克斯就在魔能转换传送门附近，与他交谈可了解更多。",dEN="Fel Commutation allows you to protect your gear in High-Risk PvP.\n\nFind the Fel Commutation Portal in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb Inn in Stormwind's Mage District. Interacting with the portal will allow you to protect or remove gear slots from Fel Commutation. If you die in High-Risk PvP, you will instead drop gold instead of your gear!\n\nYou can find your max gold lost on death in your character pane at the bottom right by hitting C.\n\nBelpix is standing near the Fel Commutation Portal, speak with him to learn more.",o="前往暴风城法师区“待宰羔羊”旅店地下室中的魔能转换传送门。",oEN="Visit the Fel Commutation Portal in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb Inn in Stormwind's Mage District.",p="魔能转换能让你在高风险 PvP 中保护自己的装备。\n\n前往暴风城法师区“待宰羔羊”旅店地下室中的魔能转换传送门。与传送门交互，即可在魔能转换中保护或移除装备栏位。如果你在高风险 PvP 中死亡，掉落的将是金币，而不是你的装备！\n\n按 C 键打开角色面板，在右下角可以看到你死亡时最多会损失的金币数量。\n\n贝尔皮克斯就在魔能转换传送门附近，与他交谈可了解更多。",pEN="Fel Commutation allows you to protect your gear in High-Risk PvP.\n\nFind the Fel Commutation Portal in the basement of the Slaughtered Lamb Inn in Stormwind's Mage District. Interacting with the portal will allow you to protect or remove gear slots from Fel Commutation. If you die in High-Risk PvP, you will instead drop gold instead of your gear!\n\nYou can find your max gold lost on death in your character pane at the bottom right by hitting C.\n\nBelpix is standing near the Fel Commutation Portal, speak with him to learn more.",c="与魔能转换传送门交互，打开魔能转换菜单。\n\n受魔能转换保护的装备栏位会以绿色高亮显示。你可以单击某个栏位以添加或移除魔能转换。如果你愿意，可以将整套装备全部转换。\n\n只有在高风险模式下死亡时，你才会因魔能转换而损失金币。在无风险 PvP、PvE 死亡、副本、战场或竞技场中都不会损失金币。只有在高风险 PvP 中被其他玩家杀死时，你才会损失魔能转换的金币。\n\n打开魔能转换传送门，单击未高亮的栏位即可保护你的装备。",cEN="Interact with the Fel Commutation Portal to open up the Fel Commutation menu.\n\nGear slots that are protected by Fel Commutation are highlighted in green. You can click a slot to add or remove Fel Commutation. You can commute your entire set of gear if you desire.\n\nYou only lose gold for Fel Commutation when dying in High-Risk. You do not lose gold in No-Risk PvP, PvE deaths, Dungeons, Battlegrounds or Arena. You only lose Fel Commutation gold when dying to another player in High-Risk PvP.\n\nOpen the Fel Commutation Portal and protect your gear by clicking unhighlighted slots."}
Q[1903553]={d="副本是提升等级、获取强力装备的绝佳途径！\n\n随机副本器是一套排队系统，你可以单人使用，也可以与一群玩家一起使用。\n\n你可以以坦克、治疗或输出的身份排队进入副本。请务必确保你拥有与排队职责相匹配的专精。如果你拥有多个专精，可以考虑为每个职责分别创建配置，并为多个职责同时排队，以缩短等待时间！\n\n选择职责后，单击面板底部的\"寻找队伍\"。\n\n排队后，你会在小地图上看到一个绿色眼睛图标，将鼠标悬停在图标上即可查看排队状态。队伍凑齐后，你会收到弹出提示；当所有人都接受后，你将与其余队友一起被传送到副本中。",dEN="Dungeons are a great way to gain levels and powerful gear!\n\nThe Dungeon Finder is a queue system that you can use solo, or with a group of players.\n\nDungeons can be queue'd for as a Tank, Healer or Damage. You should always be sure you have a build that supports the role you are queueing for. If you have multiple specializations, you can consider creating builds for each role and queueing for more than one role to speed up your queue times!\n\nAfter you've selected your role, click \"Find a Group\" at the bottom of the panel.\n\nOnce queued, you will see a Green Eye Icon on your minimap, and you can mouseover the icon to see your queue status. When the group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the dungeon with the rest of your party when everyone accepts.",o="按 (I) 键打开随机副本器，或单击选项菜单中的绿色眼睛图标，选择一个副本并单击“寻找队伍”。",oEN="Open the Dungeon Finder by hitting (I) or click the Green Eye icon in your options menu, select a dungeon and click Find Group.",p="副本是提升等级、获取强力装备的绝佳途径！\n\n随着等级提高，会有新的副本向你开放排队。你可以单人使用随机副本器，也可以与一群玩家一起使用。\n\n你可以以坦克、治疗或输出的身份排队进入副本。请务必确保你拥有能支持排队职责的配置。如果你拥有多个专精，可以考虑为每个职责分别创建配置，并为多个职责同时排队，以缩短等待时间！\n\n单击副本旁边的复选框，即可选择可用的副本。绿色副本对你的等级而言轻松易举，黄色副本难度适中，红色副本则充满挑战。\n\n你可以为一个特定副本排队，也可以同时为多个副本排队！\n\n选择你想排队的副本，然后单击“寻找队伍”。排队后，你会在小地图上看到一个绿色眼睛图标，将鼠标悬停在图标上即可查看排队状态。队伍凑齐后，你会收到弹出提示；当所有人都接受后，你将与队伍一起被传送到副本中。",pEN="Dungeons are a great way to gain levels and powerful gear!\n\nNew dungeons become available to queue for as you reach higher levels. You can use the Dungeon Finder solo, or with a group of players.\n\nYou can queue for a dungeon as a Tank, Healer or Damage. You should always be sure you have a build that supports the role you are queueing for. If you have multiple specializations, you can consider creating builds for each role and queueing for more than one role to speed up your queue times!\n\nSelect from the available dungeons by clicking the check box next to the dungeon. Dungeons in Green will be easy for your level, Yellow will be a normal difficulty and Red will be challenging.\n\nYou can queue for one specific dungeon or multiple dungeons at the same time!\n\nSelect the dungeon(s) you wish to queue for and then click Find Group. You will see a Green Eye Icon on your minimap once queued, and you can mouseover the icon to see your queue status. When the group fills up, you will see a pop-up notification and be teleported to the dungeon with your group when everyone accepts.",c="副本是提升等级、获取强力装备的绝佳途径！\n\n随着等级提高，会有新的副本向你开放排队。你可以单人使用随机副本器，也可以与一群玩家一起使用。\n相关",cEN="Dungeons are a great way to gain levels and powerful gear!\n\nNew dungeons become available to queue for as you reach higher levels. You can use the Dungeon Finder solo, or with a group of players.\nRelated"}
Q[1903554]={d="学习初级骑术将使你的坐骑速度从 40% 提高到 60%！\n\n你可以向任何游方骑术训练师学习初级骑术，也可以前往奥格瑞玛荣誉谷，向骑术训练师基尔达学习。\n\n好多时候，竞拍行里的《骑术之书：初级骑术》比训练师卖得更便宜！想要享受骑术训练折扣，随时都值得去竞拍行看一看！",dEN="Learning Apprentice Riding will increase your mount speed from 40% to 60%!\n\nYou can learn Apprentice Riding from any Traveling Riding Trainer or in the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar from Kildar the Riding Trainer.\n\nThe Auction House often has Riding Tome: Apprentice Riding for sale cheaper than trainers! It's always worth checking the Auction House for a discount on riding training!",o="前往任何一名骑术训练师处，学习初级骑术训练。",oEN="Visit any Riding Trainer to learn Apprentice Riding Training.",p="前往奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷，与骑术训练师基尔达交谈。只需一笔小小的金币，基尔达就会教会你初级骑术，让你能够骑乘坐骑。\n\n与基尔达对话，选择\"我想学习骑乘坐骑\"。\n\n在训练菜单中学习初级骑术。\n\n如果你没看到初级骑术，单击下拉列表，确保勾选了\"可学习\"。",pEN="Travel to the Valley of Honor in Orgrimmar and speak with Kildar the Riding Trainer. Kildar will teach you Apprentive Riding for a small sum of gold, allowing you to ride mounts.\n\nSpeak to Kildar in then and select \"I seek to training to ride a steed.\"\n\nLearn Apprentice Riding in the training menu.\n\nIf you do not see Apprentice Riding, click the dropdown box and ensure \"Available\" is checked.",c="现在你可以使用和学习坐骑了！获取一只坐骑，学会召唤它，就能在户外大幅提升移动速度。\n相关",cEN="You can now use and learn mounts! Obtain a mount to learn how to summon it and massively increase your movement speed while outdoors.\nRelated"}
Q[1903555]={d="学习初级骑术将使你的坐骑速度提升从 40% 提高到 60%！\n\n你可以向任何游方骑术训练师学习初级骑术，也可以前往暴风城外艾尔文森林中的东谷伐木场，向骑术训练师兰达尔·亨特学习。\n\n好多时候，竞拍行里的《骑术之书：初级骑术》比训练师卖得更便宜！想要享受骑术训练折扣，随时都值得去竞拍行看一看！",dEN="Learning Apprentice Riding will increase your mount speed increase from 40% to 60%!\n\nYou can learn Apprentice Riding from any Traveling Riding Trainer or at the Eastvale Logging Camp outside Stormwind in Elwynn Forest from Randal Hunter the Riding Trainer.\n\nThe Auction House often has Riding Tome: Apprentice Riding for sale cheaper than trainers! It's always worth checking the Auction House for a discount on riding training!",o="前往任何一名骑术训练师处，学习初级骑术训练。",oEN="Visit any Riding Trainer to learn Apprentice Riding Training.",p="前往暴风城外艾尔文森林中的东谷伐木场，找兰达尔·亨特学习初级骑术训练。只需一笔小小的金币，兰达尔·亨特就会教会你初级骑术，让你能够骑乘坐骑。\n\n你可以走出暴风城，打开地图，前往任务标记处来找到兰达尔的位置。\n\n与兰达尔对话，选择\"我想学习骑乘坐骑\"。\n\n在训练菜单中学习初级骑术。\n\n如果你没看到初级骑术，单击下拉列表，确保勾选了\"可学习\"。",pEN="Travel to Visit Randal Hunter at the Eastvale Logging Camp outside Stormwind in Elwynn Forest to learn Apprentice Riding Training. Randal Hunter will teach you Apprentive Riding for a small sum of gold, allowing you to ride mounts.\n\nYou can find Randal's location by walking outside of Stormwind then opening your map and traveling to the quest marker.\n\nSpeak to Randal in then and select \"I seek to training to ride a steed.\"\n\nLearn Apprentice Riding in the training menu.\n\nIf you do not see Apprentice Riding, click the dropdown box and ensure \"Available\" is checked.",c="现在你可以使用和学习坐骑了！获取一只坐骑，学会召唤它，就能在户外大幅提升移动速度。\n相关",cEN="You can now use and learn mounts! Obtain a mount to learn how to summon it and massively increase your movement speed while outdoors.\nRelated"}
Q[1903556]={d="你已经获得了自己的第一只坐骑。现在该学会如何骑乘了！\n\n- 你的坐骑位于“坐骑”页签中。\n\n- 打开角色面板（快捷键 C），然后单击“宠物”页签（快捷键 Shift+P），再切换到“坐骑”页签。\n\n- 将坐骑法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速赶路时就能立即上马。\n\n- 在户外任何地方施放你的坐骑法术吧！",dEN="You have acquired your first mount. It's time to learn how to ride!\n\n- Your Mount is in your Mounts Tab.\n\n- Open your Character Pane (Hotkey C), then click the Pets Tab (Hotkey Shift+P), then Mounts Tab.\n\n- Drag the mount spell onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.\n\n- Cast your mount spell anywhere outdoors!",o="学会骑乘坐骑！",oEN="Learn how to mount up!",p="与加里安·亨特对话，购买一只坐骑！购买后，右键单击背包中的坐骑以学习它。按 C 键打开角色面板，然后单击“宠物”页签，再切换到“坐骑”，即可找到你已学会的坐骑。将新坐骑的法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速赶路时就能立即上马。",pEN="Speak with Garion Hunter and purchase a mount! Once purchased, right click the mount in your inventory to learn it. You can find your known mounts by hitting C to open your character pane, then click the Pets Tab, then Mounts. Drag the spell for your new mount onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.",c="按 C 键打开角色面板，然后单击“宠物”页签，再切换到“坐骑”，即可找到你的新坐骑。\n\n将新坐骑的法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速移动时就能立即上马。\n相关",cEN="You can find your new mount by hitting C to open your character pane, then click the Pets Tab, then Mounts.\n\nDrag the spell for your new mount onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.\nRelated"}
Q[1903557]={d="你已经获得了自己的第一只坐骑。现在该学会如何骑乘了！\n\n- 你的坐骑位于“坐骑”页签中。\n\n- 打开角色面板（快捷键 C），然后单击“宠物”页签（快捷键 Shift+P），再切换到“坐骑”页签。\n\n- 将坐骑法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速赶路时就能立即上马。\n\n- 在户外任何地方施放你的坐骑法术吧！",dEN="You have acquired your first mount. It's time to learn how to ride!\n\n- Your Mount is in your Mounts Tab.\n\n- Open your Character Pane (Hotkey C), then click the Pets Tab (Hotkey Shift+P), then Mounts Tab.\n\n- Drag the mount spell onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.\n\n- Cast your mount spell anywhere outdoors!",o="学会骑乘坐骑！",oEN="Learn how to mount up!",p="与奥格纳罗·奔狼者对话，购买一只坐骑！\n\n购买后，右键单击背包中的坐骑以学习它。\n\n按 C 键打开角色面板，然后单击“宠物”页签，再切换到“坐骑”，即可找到你已学会的坐骑。\n\n将新坐骑的法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速赶路时就能立即上马。",pEN="Speak with Ogunaro Wolfrunner and purchase a mount!\n\nOnce purchased, right click the mount in your inventory to learn it.\n\nYou can find your known mounts by hitting C to open your character pane, then click the Pets Tab, then Mounts.\n\nDrag the spell for your new mount onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.",c="按 C 键打开角色面板，然后单击“宠物”页签，再切换到“坐骑”，即可找到你的新坐骑。\n\n将新坐骑的法术拖到动作条上，这样当你需要快速移动时就能立即上马。\n相关",cEN="You can find your new mount by hitting C to open your character pane, then click the Pets Tab, then Mounts.\n\nDrag the spell for your new mount onto your hotbars so you can quickly mount when you need to travel fast.\nRelated"}
Q[1903558]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
Q[1903559]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
Q[1903560]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
Q[1903561]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
