Q[1903564]={d="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",dEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 7 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 7.",p="获取经验值以提升等级。提升等级能为你带来更强的力量、更多法术、进入副本的资格、各项功能以及新的区域。\n\n你可以在动作条正上方看到自己的经验条。将鼠标悬停在经验条上，即可看到你当前的经验值，以及还需要多少经验值才能升到下一级。\n\n获取足够的经验值以将你的经验条填满 6 次，并达到 7 级。你可以通过击杀世界上等级相近的怪物或完成任务来获得经验值。与头上带有黄色感叹号的 NPC 对话即可接取新任务。你可以在小地图上看到附近任务的位置！",pEN="Acquire experience to advance your level. Obtaining levels grants you more power, spells, access to dungeons, features and new areas.\n\nYou can view your experience bar directly above your hotkeys. Mousing over the bar will show you exactly how much experience you have and how much more you must obtain to reach a new level.\n\nGain enough experience to fill your experience bar 6 times and reach level 7. You can earn experience by killing monsters close to your level in the world, or by completing quests. Speak to an NPC with a Yellow Exclamation Mark above their head to accept new quests. You can see the location of nearby quests on your minimap!",c="随着等级提升，NPC 们会向你提供更多任务。完成任务、击杀生物，即可解锁新的法术与功能，并探索新的区域！\n\n继续踏上你的飞升之路！这条道路将带你走向无尽的力量与待探索的新区域，并帮助你发现令人兴奋的全新功能。",cEN="As you level up NPCs will offer more quests. Complete quests and kill creatures to unlock new spells, features and explore new areas!\n\nContinue on your Path to Ascension! This path leads you to immense power, new areas to explore and will help you discover new and exciting features."}
Q[1903565]={d="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 60 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击，视角会拉远至整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到与你等级相匹配的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 60 级。",dEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 60.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 60.",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 60 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 60.",p="继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 60 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击，视角会拉远至整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到与你等级相匹配的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 60 级。",pEN="Continue your journey and acquire enough experience to reach level 60.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 60.",c="达到 60 级是你旅程中的一个重要里程碑！达到 60 级将为你开放全新内容：\n\n- 60 级天赋技能已经向你开放。\n- 推进新的副本，获取装备，挑战英雄与史诗副本。\n- 参与团队副本！\n- 你可以在告示板上找到新的日常任务！\n- 满级战场会奖励荣誉，可用于购买强力的 PvP 装备。\n- 在竞技场 PvP 中挑战其他玩家。\n\n如果《燃烧的远征》已开放，你可以在告示板上找到【飞升之路：在外域升级！】来继续你的旅程！该任务会在黑暗之门开启后开放。\n相关",cEN="Reaching level 60 is a major milestone in your journey! Reaching Level 60 grants access to new content:\n\n- Level 60 Talent Abilities are now available to you.\n- Progress through new Dungeons and gain gear to challenge Heroic and Mythic Dungeons.\n- Participate in Raids!\n- New Daily Quests can be found on the Call Board!\n- Max level Battlegrounds award Honor that can be spent on powerful PvP Gear.\n- Challenge other Players in Arena PvP.\n\nIf The Burning Crusade is active, you can find [Path to Ascension: Level Up in Outlands!] on the Call Board to continue your journey! This quest will become available with the Opening of the Dark Portal.\nRelated"}
Q[1903566]={d="你必须穿过黑暗之门前往外域，才能继续迎向满级的旅程。\n\n在法师训练师处使用通往轰炸之地的传送门，然后与黑暗之门旁的 NPC 交谈。\n\n穿过黑暗之门后，在外域完成任务，提升到 61 级。",dEN="You must travel through the Dark Portal to Outlands to continue your journey towards max level.\n\nUse the Portal to Blasted Lands at the Mage Trainer, then speak with npc at the Dark Portal.\n\nOnce you travel through the Dark Portal, complete quests in Outlands to advance to level 61.",o="前往外域，获取足够的经验值以达到 61 级。",oEN="Travel to Outlands and acquire enough experience to advance to level 61.",p="在法师训练师处使用通往轰炸之地的传送门，然后与黑暗之门旁的 NPC 交谈。\n\n穿过黑暗之门后，在外域完成任务，提升到 61 级。",pEN="Use the Portal to Blasted Lands at the Mage Trainer, then speak with npc at the Dark Portal.\n\nOnce you travel through the Dark Portal, complete quests in Outlands to advance to level 61.",c="在外域不断前进，完成任务与副本，一路战斗直至 70 级！",cEN="Progress through Outlands, completing quests and Dungeons and fight your way to level 70!"}
Q[1903567]={d="你必须穿过黑暗之门前往外域，才能继续迎向满级的旅程。\n\n在法师训练师处使用通往轰炸之地的传送门，然后与黑暗之门旁的 NPC 交谈。\n\n穿过黑暗之门后，在外域完成任务，提升到 61 级。",dEN="You must travel through the Dark Portal to Outlands to continue your journey towards max level.\n\nUse the Portal to Blasted Lands at the Mage Trainer, then speak with npc at the Dark Portal.\n\nOnce you travel through the Dark Portal, complete quests in Outlands to advance to level 61.",o="前往外域，获取足够的经验值以达到 61 级。",oEN="Travel to Outlands and acquire enough experience to advance to level 61.",p="在法师训练师处使用通往轰炸之地的传送门，然后与黑暗之门旁的 NPC 交谈。\n\n穿过黑暗之门后，在外域完成任务，提升到 61 级。",pEN="Use the Portal to Blasted Lands at the Mage Trainer, then speak with npc at the Dark Portal.\n\nOnce you travel through the Dark Portal, complete quests in Outlands to advance to level 61.",c="在外域不断前进，完成任务与副本，一路战斗直至 70 级！",cEN="Progress through Outlands, completing quests and Dungeons and fight your way to level 70!"}
Q[1903568]={d="在外域继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 70 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击，视角会拉远至整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到与你等级相匹配的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 70 级。",dEN="Continue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough experience to reach level 70.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.",o="获取足够的经验值以提升到 70 级。",oEN="Acquire enough experience to advance to level 70.",p="在外域继续你的旅程，获取足够的经验值以达到 70 级。\n\n随着等级不断提升，你将必须前往新的区域，寻找与你等级更接近的任务和生物，以便继续获得经验值。\n\n按 M 键，然后在地图上右键单击，视角会拉远至整体的世界地图。将鼠标悬停在你当前区域周边的区域上，你就会在地图上方中央看到该区域的等级范围。\n\n找到与你等级相匹配的区域，前往那里发现新的任务，并继续你的旅程，直至 70 级。",pEN="Continue your journey in Outlands and acquire enough experience to reach level 70.\n\nAs you continue advancing in levels you will have to travel to new zones to find quests and creatures closer to your level to continue gaining experience.\n\nHit M, then right click the map. This will zoom you out to the overall World Map. Mouseover the areas around your current zone. You will see the zone's level range in the top center of the map.\n\nFind a zone that matches your level and travel there to discover new quests and continue your journey to level 70.",c="达到 70 级是你旅程中的一个重要里程碑！达到 70 级将为你开放全新内容：\n\n- 推进新的副本，获取装备，挑战英雄与史诗副本。\n- 参与团队副本！\n- 你可以在告示板上找到新的日常任务！\n- 满级战场会奖励荣誉，可用于购买强力的 PvP 装备。\n- 在竞技场 PvP 中挑战其他玩家。\n相关",cEN="Reaching level 70 is a major milestone in your journey! Reaching Level 70 grants access to new content:\n\n- Progress through new Dungeons and gain gear to challenge Heroic and Mythic Dungeons.\n- Participate in Raids!\n- New Daily Quests can be found on the Call Board!\n- Max level Battlegrounds award Honor that can be spent on powerful PvP Gear.\n- Challenge other Players in Arena PvP.\nRelated"}
Q[1903569]={d="你的宠物从 20 级开始获得宠物天赋点数。每提升 4 级，宠物就会获得更多宠物天赋点数。\n\n右键单击你的宠物头像。\n\n选择“宠物天赋”。\n\n然后单击任何天赋即可学习！",dEN="Your pet will begin acquiring Pet Talent Points starting at level 20. Your pet will earn more Pet Talent Point every 4 levels.\n\nRight click your Pet's Portrait.\n\nSelect Pet Talents.\n\nThen click any talent to learn it!",o="右键单击你的宠物头像，选择“宠物天赋”，然后分配一点天赋点数。",oEN="Right click your pet's portrait, select pet talents then assign a talent point.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成当前任务后再回来吧。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得漂亮，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。\n相关",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward.\nRelated"}
Q[1903570]={d="英雄，你打算专精于哪一项属性？力量、敏捷、智力还是精神？每项属性都有其独特的奖励，对于提升你的力量至关重要。",dEN="What Attribute will you specialize in Hero? Strength, Agility, Intellect or Spirit? Each Attribute comes with its own unique bonuses and is vital to growing in power.",o="按 'N' 键，选择“角色成长”，进入你的角色成长面板。\n\n在右上角选择你的主属性。你随时可以更改它。",oEN="Go to your Character Advancement by pressing 'N' and selecting Character Advancement.\n\nSelect your Primary Attribute on the top Right-hand side. You can change this at anytime.",p="你在飞升之路上还有工作要做。完成当前任务后再回来吧。",pEN="You still have work to do on the path of Ascension. Return when you have completed the task at hand.",c="干得漂亮，英雄！你在飞升之路上进展顺利。继续前进吧。",cEN="Well done, Hero! You are progressing nicely on the path of Ascension. Keep pushing forward."}
Q[1967215]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。精良的秘银钥匙能避开除最复杂者之外的所有防撬爆炸物。几乎所有内容物都将保持完好。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Exceptional Homicite Key will bypass all but the most intricate anti tamper explosives. Almost all of the contents will remain intact."}
Q[1967216]={o="你眼前的隐秘窖藏一旦被动手脚就会爆炸。秘银万能钥匙完美契合，专为彻底拆除防撬爆炸物而设计，让你能取用箱中的全部内容物。",oEN="The Hidden Cache before you is rigged to explode if tampered with. The Master Homicite Key is a perfect fit, designed to completely disable anti tamper explosives and grant you access to the entire chest's contents."}
