Q[2000014]={d="德拉诺尔的裂变与黑暗之门的开启之后，许多早已被遗忘的威胁重新浮现，向敢于抵抗它们的人发起挑战。在未知实体的驱使下，敌方势力不知疲倦地推进他们的计划，图谋将世界推向毁灭的边缘。英雄，你的任务很简单：深入敌人占据的领土，让他们永享安眠。",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor and the opening of the Dark Portal, many long forgotten threats have resurfaced to challenge those who may oppose them. Motivated by entities unknown, enemy forces have toiled endlessly to set their plans into motion, seeking to draw the world closer to the brink of oblivion. Your mission is simple, hero. Venture forth into the territory that is held by our enemies, and lay them to rest.",o="在本区域内击杀 20 名居民",oEN="Slay 20 denziens within this region",p="你的任务尚未完成。履行契约后再回到告示板前吧。",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
