Q[6011003]={d="伊利丹·怒风的邪兽人军团的源头已被击败。工厂停止了这种阴郁产物的生产——至少暂时如此。只剩下一些琐碎的小玩意儿，以及这颗被斩下的头颅——对于部落的英雄而言，这是一件合适的战利品。\n\n将麦迪文的头颅交还给远征军在泰罗卡的纳兹格雷尔。",dEN="The source of Illidan Stormrage's fel orc army has been vanquished. The manufactory halts production of its grim product - at least for now. All that remains are a few trinkets and this severed head - a fitting trophy for a hero of the Horde.\n\nReturn Magtheridon's head to Nazgrel at Thrallmar.",o="将麦迪文的头颅交还给地狱火半岛泰罗卡的纳兹格雷尔。",oEN="Return Magtheridon's Head to Nazgrel at Thrallmar in Hellfire Peninsula."}
Q[8200501]={d="返回告示板。",dEN="Return to the Call Board.",o="摧毁混沌之主卡扎克！",oEN="Destroy Doom Lord Kazzak!"}
Q[8200503]={d="返回告示板。",dEN="Return to the Call Board.",o="摧毁混沌之主卡扎克！",oEN="Destroy Doom Lord Kazzak!"}
Q[16777215]={d="注意了，技艺高超的伐木者与工匠们！\n\n艾泽拉斯的工匠与建造者们正在寻求稳定的优质木材供应，以满足他们的工艺与建造项目。如果你拥有伐木者的技艺，又擅长制作木板，那么我们正急需你的帮助！\n\n前往附近的森林，握紧你得力的斧头，伐倒适合取材的结实树木。等你积攒了足够多的原木后，将它们带到艾泽拉斯的各大首都，当地的工匠们正热切地等待着你的到来。在每座城市中寻找那位以精通木工而闻名的指定 NPC，将你的木板交给他以便进一步加工。\n\n工匠们会将你的原木加工成精制木板，用于打造华美的家具、结实的建筑以及无数其他作品。作为回报，他们会慷慨地赠予你金币，并可能分享他们的木工知识，让你提升自己的制造技能。\n\n你对这项工作的投入，不仅能支持当地的工匠，还能助力美化与建设我们亲爱的城市。每一块木板都很重要，所以整理好你的工具，开始你作为一名真正艾泽拉斯工匠的旅程吧！",dEN="Attention, skilled woodcutters and craftsmen!\n\nThe artisans and builders of Azeroth are seeking a steady supply of quality timber for their crafts and construction projects. If you possess the skills of a woodcutter and have a knack for crafting planks, your help is urgently needed!\n\nJourney to the nearby forests and wield your trusty axe to fell sturdy trees suitable for timber. Once you have gathered an ample supply of raw logs, bring them to the capital cities of Azeroth, where the local craftsmen eagerly await your arrival. Seek out the designated NPC in each city, known for their mastery of woodworking, and offer them your planks for further processing.\n\nThe craftsmen will transform your raw timber into refined planks, which will be used to create magnificent furniture, sturdy structures, and countless other creations. In return for your contribution, they will reward you handsomely with gold and potentially share their knowledge of woodworking, allowing you to enhance your own crafting abilities.\n\nYour commitment to this task will not only support the local craftsmen but also aid in the beautification and development of our beloved cities. Every plank counts, so gather your tools and begin your journey as a true craftsman of Azeroth!",o="收集 20 块绿木板",oEN="Collect 20 Green Wood Plank"}
end)(AscensionCN.QuestData)
